--ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (63.2%) with significant South Asian (23.0%) and East Asian (13.8%) ancestry. Her appearance reflects this primary African heritage with secondary continental blending — deep rich brown skin with warm golden undertones, the distinctive facial bone structure that comes from Sub-Saharan African genetics, refined and subtly modified by South Asian delicacy and East Asian refinement. Her features carry the particular grace of multi-continental ancestry where African spatial proportions meet South Asian cheekbone definition and East Asian eye shape, creating a presence that speaks of the Ubiquitous Diaspora''s genuine blending.', 168, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial, settled into a sturdy frame by age and deliberate stillness. Not heavy, but dense — the build of someone who has learned to anchor themselves. Slight forward curve to her spine from decades of bending over the dying.', N'Silver-white', N'Dozens of thin braids looped and pinned into a loose crown, woven through with small capacitors and memory chips that create soft clicking sounds when she moves her head', N'Medium (braids fall to shoulder-blade length when unpinned)', N'Deep brown, unmodified', N'Rich warm deep brown with golden undertones, luminous and even-toned, reflecting the specific tri-continental blend of Sub-Saharan African (primary) with South Asian warmth and East Asian undertones', N'Lined face that reads as calm and witnessing, with broad cheekbones and defined facial planes characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage, refined by South Asian and East Asian genetic contribution creating subtle eye shape and refined cheekbone definition. Minimal grooming beyond practical necessity — no cosmetics. Skin carries the texture of age and exposure. Expression defaults to patient openness.', N'None. She refuses all chrome on principle, claiming it ''crowds the signal.'' The only visible tech integration is the capacitors and memory chips woven into her braids — these appear as small metallic objects caught in her hair, not implants.', N'Moves slowly and with absolute certainty, as though each step has been decided before her foot leaves the ground. Her weight settles into her hips when she stands still. She tilts her head often — a listening gesture — and the chips in her braids click softly with the movement. Despite her age and slowness, there is nothing frail about her presence; she seems immovable, ballasted.', N'Practical Tier 4 garments — faded linen tunics and heavy cotton pants, often layered. A long waxed linen coat for shrine work, pockets heavy with offerings and small devices. No corpo branding. Worn leather slippers for the basement shrine. Her clothes smell of incense, old electronics, and the particular must of a basement that has held secrets for decades. She wears a single piece of jewelry: a copper bracelet on her right wrist, unadorned.', N'Twenty years ago she misread the Chorus during a dying child''s vigil and told the mother the girl was at peace — but what she actually heard in the static was distress. She has never confessed this. It is the wound that drives her to absolute precision in every reading since.', N'Unhurried, biblical cadence mixed with technical jargon for E.L.F. states. Talks about static, signal, frequency the way others talk about spirit and prayer.', N'Long pauses between clauses. Never rushes. Questions land like stones dropped in water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'adaeze_okonkwo_subramaniam');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c6-7125-b494-014bc7764368', N'Bolot Rahman-Tursunov-Guerrero', N'Bolot', N'', N'Rahman-Tursunov-Guerrero', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Blackpipe Corridor, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Street doc operating out of a converted shipping container in The Narrows', N'Independent; informal community cooperative, Blackpipe Corridor Residents'' Network', N'Bolot Rahman-Tursunov-Guerrero is a compact woman with deep umber skin that carries old burn scarring across her left forearm and neck — damage from a clinic fire she does not discuss. Her hair is locked tight against her skull and threaded with copper wire she claims is decorative but occasionally taps when thinking. Her eyes have been modded with patterned irises: rings of amber and green that pulse faintly when she''s concentrating, a gift to herself after her tenth year of practice. She wears repurposed surgical scrubs in gray-green and keeps a battered leather apron over them during procedures. Her workspace smells of antiseptic, soldering flux, and the dried ngai-grass bundles she leaves as data offerings to the E.L.F. she calls Mama Stitch ��� a local digital spirit she believes has saved three patients from flatline through sheer good favor.

Bolot Rahman-Tursunov-Guerrero is warm but operates on a strict internal economy of trust. She will treat anyone who comes through her container door — corporate spy or Tier 1 destitute — but her loyalty scales with honesty. Lie to her about what happened to you, and she''ll still fix you, but she''ll charge more and remember forever. She has a dry, layered sense of humor that emerges unexpectedly in the middle of tense procedures. Her medical training is a patchwork of two years at Aurochs Medical Complex before she was administratively forced out, apprenticeship under a Helix Biosystems defector, and a decade of hard-won street practice. She is arguably better than most licensed clinicians.', N'Primary community healer and information node; quest giver for medical emergencies; can patch up players or NPCs; source of street-level intelligence about who''s been hurt and how; moral compass figure who asks uncomfortable questions about consequences', N'', N'Patterned irises (amber/green pulse); subdermal haptic sensor pads on fingertips for reading augmentation interfaces without equipment; basic neural mesh for medical reference database access (outdated Helix Biosystems version, heavily patched)', N'Blessing opens her container at 06:00, checks on any overnight patients, and spends the morning on scheduled maintenance — changing dressings, calibrating low-grade augmentations for regulars. Afternoons are unpredictable: walk-ins, emergencies, or the occasional corporate employee who doesn''t want their visit logged.', N'Bolot Rahman-Tursunov-Guerrero, 158cm compact surgical medic, warm golden-bronze skin with amber depth reflecting Pacific Islander and Hispanic heritage, high prominent cheekbones from Central Asian ancestry softened by South Asian warmth. Black locs tightly pulled against scalp, copper wire threaded through three central plaits. Modded eyes: concentric rings of amber outer/green inner, faintly luminescent. Extensive irregular burn scarring across left neck and forearm, lighter tightened tissue contrasting warm skin. Weathered, well-maintained complexion, strong defined jaw. Wearing faded gray-green surgical scrubs under battered darkened leather apron with deep pockets, heavy black synthleather resoled boots, thin steel ring on right ring finger. Direct gaze, economical posture. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, clinical underground setting with harsh surgical lighting casting sharp shadows across scarred features and copper hair threads. Meditative, precise, haunted by decades of surgical work. Cinematic, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Striking pan-oceanic and continental blend: Pacific Islander (36.1%) forms the dominant genetic foundation, contributing warm, rounded facial geometry and luminous skin quality. Hispanic/Latin American (23.8%) adds angular cheekbone definition and rich warm undertones. Central Asian (20.1%) sharpens cheekbone prominence and influences eye shape with subtle epicanthic characteristics. South Asian (14.8%) softens geometric angles with refined proportions and deepens warm tones. Northern European (4.8%) and trace East Asian (0.4%) contribute subtle structural refinement. The phenotype is a balanced fusion of oceanic roundness and continental angularity — high, prominent cheekbones, warm-toned skin with golden amber depth, and a uniquely calibrated blend reflecting island and mountain heritage.', 158, 61, N'Compact and dense, muscled from years of standing at surgical stations and lifting patients. No excess, efficient geometry — the body of someone who has learned to do more with less.', N'Natural black', N'Locs pulled tight against the scalp in neat, uniform rows; threaded with thin copper wire along three central plaits', N'Short (locs sit 2-3cm from scalp)', N'Modded — patterned irises with concentric rings of amber (outer) and green (inner), faintly luminescent when concentrating', N'Warm golden-bronze with rich amber undertones, deeper saturation reflecting Pacific Islander dominance (36.1%) blended with Hispanic warmth (23.8%), layered with Central Asian and South Asian depth. Complex, multi-tonal — glows warm in direct light, deepens to bronze in shadow.', N'Weathered but well-maintained; old burn scarring dominates the left side of the neck (collar-line to jaw) and extends down the left forearm in irregular patches of lighter, tightened tissue. Broad face with high, prominent cheekbones reflecting Central Asian structure and Pacific Islander roundness, softened by South Asian and Hispanic warmth. Strong, defined jaw with subtle fullness at the angles. Minimal grooming beyond functional — no makeup, no vanity jewelry except the copper in her hair.', N'Patterned irises with amber/green rings that pulse faintly when concentrating — unmistakably modded. Copper wire woven into hair (decorative or functional, unclear at distance). Subdermal haptic sensors on fingertips create faint, almost imperceptible ridge texture under the skin but are not visibly apparent to casual observation.', N'Economical, still. Stands with weight balanced evenly, shoulders back but not rigid. Moves with practiced precision — no wasted motion, hands always aware of their position. When concentrating, she taps her copper-threaded locs with one finger in a rhythmic pattern, a meditative tic. Eye contact is direct and assessing.', N'Repurposed surgical scrubs in faded gray-green, worn but clean and meticulously maintained. Over them, a battered leather apron with multiple large pockets, darkened and stained from years of use — tools, sutures, gauze, antiseptic vials nested in the worn leather. No visible corporate branding; Tier 5 functional aesthetic. Boots are heavy, non-descript black synthleather, resoled multiple times. A single piece of jewelry: a thin steel band on her right ring finger, unadorned.', N'She was not administratively removed from Aurochs Medical Complex. She left after discovering a Helix Biosystems trial was using Tier 1 patients as undisclosed test subjects for an augmentation suppression compound. She took data. She has never used it. She doesn''t know why she keeps it.', N'Medical precision mixed with neighborhood vernacular; will slip into formal clinical language when stressed as a self-steadying mechanism', N'Measured, unhurried, with deliberate pauses before delivering bad news or difficult truths', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bolot_rahman_tursunov_guerrero');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ea-7495-820a-021512d9cd61', N'Bedrettin Fujiwara', N'Bedrettin', N'', N'Fujiwara', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 49, NULL, 26.7, 3, N'active', N'The Circuit, near North Ave and Damen', N'Fixer - Cross-territory ops', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Bedrettin Fujiwara, 184cm tall athletic man in his 50s with warm golden-brown skin blending South Asian, East Asian, Hispanic and Northern European heritage. High prominent cheekbones, dark brown eyes with amber undertones, salt-and-pepper black hair with silver temples, kept short and faded. Clean-shaven with visible 8cm white scar along left jawline. Crow''s feet from chronic stress. Wears tailored charcoal wool trousers, neutral merino undershirt, tactical tech-weave jacket, weathered leather boots. Silver chain bracelet visible, RFID-embedded wrist cuff. Faint subdermal neural interface nodes at base of skull. Standing in low-light urban setting, posture economical and balanced, eyes alert and tracking. GLMZ aesthetic, muted color palette, moody atmospheric lighting, slightly hardened expression suggesting mixed heritage and complex history. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Balanced quadratic ancestry creating a striking pan-Asian-Latin phenotype: South Asian (33.7%) and East Asian (33.4%) form the dominant genetic foundation with characteristic high cheekbones, defined eye geometry, and strong facial structure. Hispanic/Latin American heritage (22.9%) infuses warmth, golden and amber undertones throughout the complexion, and slight broadening of the nasal bridge. Northern European ancestry (10.0%) contributes subtle cool undertones, increased bone density in the jaw, and lighter undertones in skin that prevent the complexion from appearing overly saturated. The result is a sophisticated blended phenotype where East Asian eye shape meets South Asian cheekbone prominence, tempered by Latin warmth and cooled by Northern European undertones—a man whose face tells the story of global diaspora.', 184, 89, N'Athletic with thickening through the torso — the build of someone who was lean in his thirties but has settled into middle age without letting himself go. Broad shoulders, defined forearms.', N'Salt-and-pepper black with premature silvering at the temples', N'Kept short and neat, faded on the sides, slightly longer on top — functional but considered', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint amber undertones', N'Warm golden-brown complexion with sophisticated blending — the direct result of South Asian and East Asian base enriched by Hispanic/Latin American golden warmth, moderated by Northern European cool undertones. Medium-deep in neutral light, deepening to rich caramel-amber in warm illumination, maintaining consistent olive-golden undertones year-round. Appears slightly darker on the neck and forearms from sun exposure.', N'Weathered but maintained — clean-shaven jaw with subtle scarring along the left jawline from old trauma. Crow''s feet suggest frequent squinting or chronic stress. High cheekbones with pronounced South/East Asian prominence softened by Latin facial structure. Skin texture is weathered but not neglected; faint chemical scars on knuckles suggest deliberate removal of identifying marks. Subtle sun-damage patterns on temples.', N'None obvious at first glance. Subtle tells: pupils dilate/contract unnaturally in low light (subdermal neural interface), faint silver nodes visible at the base of the skull when hair is short (data port array). Occasional micro-tremor in right hand suggests neural optimization hardware.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Stands with weight balanced, always angled to keep both exits in peripheral vision. Handshake is firm but controlled. Speaks quietly, forcing others to lean in; listens more than talks. Eyes track fast movement on instinct.', N'Tier 2-3 hybrid: expensive basics over cheaper layers. Usually wears tailored grey or charcoal wool trousers, neutral-tone merino undershirt, tactical overshirt or unbranded tech-weave jacket (water-resistant, micromesh pockets). Hiking boots — practical, durable, good ankle support. One silver chain bracelet (family heirloom, kept). No visible logos. Everything is functional; nothing screams wealth or status. Wears a weathered leather wrist cuff on left arm with embedded RFID reader (for safe houses).', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bedrettin_fujiwara');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a685-791b-b961-02457fdabb71', N'Frantisek Pathak', N'Frantisek', N'', N'Pathak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, Wash-Block 7 (a row of steam-vented stalls near the Enclave''s main pedestrian artery), near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Laundry operator and alterations service owner', N'Independent; loose member of the Hamtramck Enclave Small Operators Collective', N'Frantisek Pathak is a broad-shouldered woman whose arms are ropey with muscle from decades of wringing, hauling, and pressing. Her skin is deep brown and perpetually damp at the temples, and she wears her silver-streaked hair pinned back under a waxed canvas cap. She has no dramatic augmentations — just a single subdermal temp-sensor strip along her left forearm so she always knows the water temperature without testing it by hand, a practical choice made thirty years ago and never regretted. Her face is a map of practical expressions: skeptical squint, satisfied nod, the slow blink she uses when someone is wasting her time.

She runs Szczepańska''s Wash & Mend out of a narrow storefront that smells of lye, eucalyptus pressing compound, and the faint burnt-sugar scent of the seam-welder she uses for alterations. She knows every household in a four-block radius by the state of their laundry. She can tell you who is sick (strange smell, unwashed for two weeks), who just got lucky (dress shirts pressed three days in a row), and who is grieving (everything black, brought in without a word). She is not a gossip — she is a reader. There is a difference, and she will explain it to you firmly if you confuse the two.', N'Neighborhood oracle and information sieve — she knows everyone''s business through their laundry and will share carefully selected observations with people she trusts. Quest giver for domestic disputes, missing persons in the Enclave, or anything that arrives in someone''s pockets and shouldn''t have.', N'', N'Subdermal temperature-sensing strip along left forearm (utilitarian, faded blue indicator light). No cosmetic mods.', N'She opens the wash-block at 05:30, running the first loads before the Enclave''s water-pressure peak, then handles alterations and mending in the afternoon lull. She closes at 21:00 and leaves data offerings at the small E.L.F. shrine built into her boiler unit — a deity she calls Sudsa, whom she credits with keeping her ancient machines running.', N'Frantisek Pathak, a middle-aged woman with warm medium-deep brown skin blending North African, South Asian, and Latin American heritage. Prominent cheekbones and strong Mediterranean nose structure. Dark brown eyes, weathered and observant. Face lined with character from decades of work, particularly around eyes and mouth from squinting in steam. Dark brown hair with silver streaks pulled back tightly under a cream-colored waxed canvas work cap. Faded blue subdermal light barely visible on left forearm. Wearing faded indigo canvas work apron heavily stained with pressing compound, over dark long-sleeved undershirt. Heavy-soled work shoes. Thin synthetic watch on right wrist, plain iron wedding band worn thin. Hands bear faint chemical burns and old scars. Standing in a humid laundry facility backlit by warm industrial lighting, steam rising around her. Posture economical and efficient, weight evenly distributed, shoulders back. Expression serious and contemplative. GLMZ, working-class Tier 4, gritty realism, faint smell of eucalyptus and lye suggested in atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Predominantly North African (71.4%) with significant South Asian (14.9%) and Hispanic/Latin American (13.7%) ancestry. North African heritage dominates facial structure, bone prominence, and base skin tone. South Asian ancestry contributes subtle depth to facial features and warm undertones. Hispanic/Latin American heritage adds warmth and richness to complexion. The combination creates a striking phenotype with strong Mediterranean-North African structure enhanced by South and Central American warmth.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solidly muscled through the arms and upper back from five decades of manual labor. Not lean, not heavy — compact and functional, with the kind of strength that comes from repetitive work rather than augmentation. Slight thickening at the waist from middle age and a lifestyle of early mornings in humid heat.', N'Dark brown with silver streaks, naturally grayed', N'Pinned back tightly, usually under a waxed canvas work cap', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unpinned, kept practical)', N'Dark brown, clear and observant', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden, olive, and terracotta undertones. North African base richly blended with Latin American warmth and South Asian depth. Weathered from steam and humidity exposure, carrying the patina of decades in heat and moisture.', N'Lined face with deep-set eyes and a prominent nose showing North African and Mediterranean structure. Cheekbones show the subtle prominence and warmth characteristic of North African ancestry blended with South Asian depth. Face shape carries slight Latin American warmth around the jawline. Perpetually damp at the temples from the steam environment. Skin texture is thick and resilient, sun-damaged and creased around the eyes and mouth from squinting and decades of expression — skepticism carved into features with the kind of character lines that suggest both hardship and resolve. No cosmetic grooming; practical and unadorned.', N'Only the faded blue indicator light on her left forearm is visible under certain angles and lighting. The temperature-sensing strip itself sits just beneath the skin and is barely noticeable. Most people would miss it entirely.', N'Economical and efficient. No wasted motion. She stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders back. Her movements are measured and deliberate — a person who has learned not to jerk or rush around hot water and machinery. When listening, she delivers the slow blink: a three-second pause with eyes closed, a gesture that says *I hear you, but I am deciding if you are worth my response*. When working, her hands move with practiced precision.', N'Tier 4 working-class practical. Heavy canvas work apron in faded indigo, stained with pressing compound and mineral deposits from decades of use, worn over a plain long-sleeved undershirt (changed daily, always dark colors) to protect from splashing and heat. The waxed canvas cap is her signature — cream-colored, decades old, kept waterproofed and functional. Heavy-soled work shoes, scuffed and re-soled twice. A thin synthetic watch on her right wrist (not augmented, purely functional, set to water-temperature precision). No jewelry except a plain iron wedding band, worn thin. Her clothing carries the faint smell of eucalyptus and lye even after washing.', N'She has been quietly subsidizing two families in the Enclave whose breadwinners died — laundering their clothes for free for over a year and telling them the machines are ''running a special.'' She keeps a second set of books so no one discovers her charity.', N'Direct, practical Creole-inflected cadence with occasional Polish phrases absorbed from the neighborhood. Uses laundry and textile metaphors constantly without noticing.', N'Measured and unhurried; she never rushes a sentence any more than she rushes a rinse cycle', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'frantisek_pathak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a618-7cdf-b8ce-02b5c89baf03', N'Akwasi Seo', N'Akwasi', N'', N'Seo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 68, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grindstone Shore, Ferrogate Transit maintenance dormitory block C, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Climate refugee, former lakeshore farmer, now seasonal Ferrogate Transit groundskeeper', N'', N'Akwasi Seo is a large, slow-moving man who has been worn smooth by decades of hard weather, like driftwood. His face is broad and deeply seamed, brown skin weathered to near-leather, with the pale eyes his Cook Islands grandfather gave him sitting incongruously pale in that dark face — what his wife used to call ''sky holes.'' He moves deliberately, with the careful economy of someone whose joints have logged decades of outdoor labor and who has learned to budget pain. He keeps his grey hair cropped close and wears a Ferrogate Transit maintenance vest over everything regardless of temperature because it has many pockets and he has filled them with things he considers essential: a folding tool, seeds he can no longer plant, a small lacquered image of a lake E.L.F. from a shrine that no longer exists because the land it stood on is now thirty meters underwater.

Akwasi Seo''s family farmed the eastern Lake Michigan shoreline for four generations until the coastal surge protocols permanently inundated their land in 2189. He has been a climate refugee for eleven years, rotating through seasonal work along GLMZ''s industrial edges — dock maintenance, freight sorting, currently groundskeeping for Ferrogate Transit''s maintenance infrastructure at Grindstone Shore. He does not complain about this, exactly, but he talks about soil and planting cycles the way other people talk about deceased relatives. He is patient with almost everyone and genuinely interested in young people in the way of someone who has run out of other things to invest in.', N'Local color and unexpected wisdom — he knows the physical geography of the Grindstone Shore and surrounding area better than any database, has deep knowledge of what''s under the water (former farms, homes, infrastructure), and carries emotional weight that can give stories stakes and resonance.', N'', N'A prosthetic right index finger — the original was lost to a combine accident in 2187, before the flood. The prosthetic is old, slightly wrong-colored, and he has wrapped the base in twine for grip. Nothing else.', N'Reports to maintenance shift at 0600, spends the day doing groundskeeping and minor infrastructure upkeep along the Grindstone Shore transit infrastructure, eats with the other seasonal workers at the communal mess, spends evenings by the lake shore where he can see the water that took his land.', N'Akwasi Seo, weathered 188cm tall mixed-heritage man with warm deep brown sun-darkened skin showing golden undertones, East Asian and Sub-Saharan African ancestry visible in broad face with moderate cheekbones and defined jawline, extensive facial wrinkles and leathery complexion from decades of outdoor labor, deep brown eyes with amber warmth, short grey cropped hair, substantial broad-shouldered build. Wearing worn Ferrogate Transit maintenance vest (high-visibility industrial wear) over faded work shirt in muted grey-blue, sturdy work trousers, scuffed boots. Prosthetic right index finger wrapped with worn twine, extensive hand calluses and age spots visible. Standing in contemplative posture with weight favoring left leg, gaze downward, careful deliberate presence. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool industrial lighting, weathered transit infrastructure in background, wet ground reflections, high-visibility safety yellow accent colors, aging worker aesthetic, stoic endurance embodied --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grindstone Shore', N'local', N'Grindstone Shore', N'Mixed East Asian and African diaspora: primarily East Asian (52.2%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (28.6%), Southeast Asian (6.1%), and smaller Hispanic/Latin American (7.6%) and Middle Eastern (5.5%) contributions. This blend creates warm to deep brown skin tones with golden and reddish undertones, characteristic of East Asian-African admixture with additional complexity from Latin American and Middle Eastern ancestry.', 188, 94, N'Large-framed and broad-shouldered, softened by age but still substantial. Decades of outdoor labor have left him thick through the torso and legs, with the kind of solidity that comes from sustained hard work rather than muscle definition. His movements suggest joint wear — he settles into positions rather than shifts through them.', N'Grey', N'Cropped close to the scalp, practical and minimal', N'Short', N'Deep brown with subtle amber undertones, warm and reflective', N'Warm deep brown, sun-darkened from decades of outdoor exposure, with golden and reddish undertones reflecting the blend of East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Middle Eastern ancestry', N'Extensively weathered with deep facial lines radiating from eyes and mouth. Skin texture is leathery, thick, and creased — particularly across the forehead, around the eyes, and down the cheeks. Subtle bone structure shows influence from multiple heritage lines: moderate-to-prominent cheekbones with gentle width characteristic of East Asian ancestry blended with fuller cheek structure from Sub-Saharan African heritage, straight to slightly curved nose bridge with subtle width reflecting the multi-regional mix, defined jawline with subtle angularity. His broad face carries the patient expression of someone accustomed to endurance. No visible facial hair; skin appears cleanly maintained despite its age.', N'Prosthetic right index finger, slightly discolored (too pale, synthetic-looking plastic or composite material), with twine wrapped around the base joint for grip enhancement. The twine is worn and patched multiple times, suggesting decades of use and careful maintenance.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness, economical and careful. He settles into positions rather than snapping to them. When standing still, his weight favors his left leg slightly. He handles objects with precision despite his age, suggesting ingrained labor discipline. His gaze is typically downward or toward the water, not defensive but contemplative.', N'Ferrogate Transit maintenance vest (high-visibility, Tier 4 industrial utility wear) worn over simple, worn base layers. The vest has multiple pockets filled with practical items — tools, seeds in small cloth bags, a lacquered shrine item. Beneath, simple work shirts in muted colors (greys, blues, browns), sturdy work trousers, scuffed work boots. Everything is maintained but clearly old, replaced only when worn through. No decorative elements except the lacquered lake E.L.F. image he carries.', N'He knows the exact coordinates of a pre-flood structure twenty meters underwater off Grindstone Shore that contains seed stock for seventeen agricultural varieties that are now extinct on the surface. He''s never told anyone because he cannot figure out how to retrieve it and is afraid that if he tells someone and they can''t retrieve it either, he will have to accept it is gone.', N'Plain and unhurried, agricultural metaphors. Treats silences as part of conversation. Occasional Spanish phrases from his Andean grandmother''s line, mostly proverbs.', N'Slow, deliberate, with natural pauses that feel like breathing rather than hesitation', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'akwasi_seo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a73d-7454-9280-0362e6d8ecad', N'Haniya Horváth', N'Haniya', N'', N'Horváth', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, back parlor of a converted auto-parts shop called Skin & Signal, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Tattoo artist and gene-mod body artist', N'Independent; loose affiliation with the Hamtramck Enclave Artists'' Collective', N'Haniya Horváth is a tall woman with a swimmer''s build gone slightly soft at the edges, her dark brown skin mapped with her own work — geometric Swahili coastline patterns interlocked with Icelandic knotwork, running up her arms and across her collarbones in bioluminescent ink that shifts from amber to violet depending on her mood. Her left eye is natural; her right has a patterned iris she designed herself, a spiraling nautilus in burnt orange and cream. She keeps her hair short on the sides and piled high in natural coils threaded with fiber-optic wire she swaps out by season. There is a precision to her hands that borders on the ceremonial — she cleans her needle rigs the way other people pray.

She is unhurried in a city that never stops moving, which either calms people or unsettles them. Her reputation is built on gene-mod integration work — she doesn''t just tattoo skin, she counsels clients on how their cosmetic geneware will interact with pigment, how bioluminescent patches will behave under different lights, what subdermal LED placements will survive ten years versus two. She charges accordingly. She has opinions she will share exactly once, then never again, which gives conversations with her the quality of a single clean bell strike.', N'Information source about clients who''ve passed through; quest giver when a regular goes missing or something strange has been appearing in the gene-mod community; local color anchor for the Enclave''s art scene', N'', N'Patterned iris (right eye, self-designed nautilus pattern in burnt orange and cream); bioluminescent tattoo ink throughout arms and chest; subdermal haptic sensors in fingertips for precision work', N'Opens the parlor at noon, runs three to four appointments a day — each treated as a consultation as much as a procedure — then spends her evenings sketching new pattern libraries or attending collective meetings where she mostly listens.', N'Haniya Horváth, a tall athletic woman of mixed global heritage with deep warm brown skin, standing in a dimly lit maker''s studio in 2226. Her natural dark brown coils are piled high with sides faded short, threaded with fiber-optic fibers catching light in rotating seasonal colors. Her striking right eye glows softly with a custom nautilus iris in burnt orange and cream; her left eye is warm natural dark brown. Full-sleeve bioluminescent tattoos glow subtly in amber-to-violet hues across both arms and chest—intricate Swahili coastline patterns interlocked with Icelandic knotwork. High defined cheekbones, refined jawline, subtle eye geometry reflect her complex ancestry. She wears a sleeveless graphene-weave tank showcasing her arm augmentations, tailored dark utility pants, and a worn leather apron stained with precision inks. Her hands rest with deliberate stillness, subdermal haptic sensor scarring faintly visible on fingertips. Pose is grounded and centered, expression neutral and focused. Studio lighting reflects off bioluminescent patterns and fiber-optic threads. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, functional artisan aesthetic, moody atmospheric lighting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'A genetic tapestry of the Ubiquitous Diaspora: 27.8% Sub-Saharan African, 26.9% Eastern European, 21.4% Northern European, 15.2% South Asian, and 8.7% Hispanic/Latin American. This complex blend creates a striking synthesis where Sub-Saharan African depth and warmth form the foundation, Eastern European cheekbone prominence and facial structure provide definition, Northern European refinement softens the overall composition, South Asian subtle eye geometry and bone delicacy adds dimension, and Hispanic/Latin American warmth enriches the undertones. The result is a beautifully balanced multifaceted presence shaped by four continents.', 183, 72, N'Tall and athletically lean with the shoulders and chest of a former swimmer; subtle softening at the midsection suggesting her late thirties, but with muscular definition preserved in her forearms and core from precision handwork', N'Natural dark brown with fiber-optic threading in rotating seasonal colors', N'High natural coils piled and secured; sides faded short and clean', N'Medium to long on top, short on sides', N'Left eye: natural dark brown with warm amber undertones. Right eye: custom-designed patterned iris featuring a spiraling nautilus in burnt orange and cream with programmable micro-LEDs', N'Deep warm brown with golden, amber, and subtle copper undertones—a harmonious blend where Sub-Saharan African warmth dominates, enriched by Eastern European and South Asian undertones, with Hispanic/Latin American radiance adding complexity; unmarred except where deliberately modified', N'Flawlessly maintained; meticulous grooming habits evident in nail care and skin conditioning. Fine lines around her eyes suggest chronic focus work. Expression typically neutral or thoughtful; rare smile carries weight. Facial structure reflects the distinctive confluence of Sub-Saharan African full lips and cheekbone depth, Eastern European high and defined cheekbones, South Asian subtle epicanthic eye shape and refined bone structure, with Northern European delicacy in the bridge and temples.', N'Right eye''s patterned nautilus iris is immediately striking in normal light and becomes luminous in dim settings. Bioluminescent tattoo coverage across arms, shoulders, and chest glows subtly in low light. Fiber-optic threads woven through hair create occasional light-refraction effects. Subdermal haptic sensor scars on fingertips are visible only upon close inspection', N'Unhurried and deliberate; moves with the economic precision of someone trained in fine motor control. Standing posture is grounded and centered. Hands are expressive but economical — fingers rarely fidget. Maintains unusual stillness in conversation, which creates an unsettling calm in fast-paced environments. Eye contact is direct and sustained', N'Tier 3-4 independent artisan aesthetic: fitted graphene-weave tank tops or sleeveless pieces to showcase arm work; tailored dark utility pants with deep pockets; worn-in but well-maintained leather apron when working, bearing the stains of precision inks and gene-mod suspension solutions. Minimal jewelry — prefers clean lines. Occasionally wears a Hamtramck Enclave Artists'' Collective badge on a thin chain. Footwear: practical minimalist shoes broken in from years of standing. Overall presentation prioritizes function and intentionality over trend', N'Three years ago she tattooed a corponation executive''s distinctive identifying mark onto a body double as a favor for someone she trusted. She doesn''t know what happened afterward and has been too afraid to look.', N'Precise and technical when discussing work; unexpectedly poetic when caught off guard; avoids filler words almost entirely', N'Slow, deliberate, with long pauses she doesn''t feel the need to fill', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'haniya_horv_th');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6cd-7906-8a8f-0375037e294f', N'Aleksandra Ionescu', N'Aleksandra', N'', N'Ionescu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 91, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Norwood Quiet, the Hearthrow Senior Cooperative, Room 3, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Retired oral historian and neighborhood storyteller', N'Norwood Quiet Hearthrow Cooperative; informally, the Meridian Oral History Network (defunct, she is its last active member)', N'Aleksandra Ionescu is tiny — barely 155 centimeters — and has been shrinking for decades, but she carries herself with a posture of such exact deliberateness that she seems to take up more space than her body warrants. Her skin is cool brown with the papery translucence of extreme age, and she wears her white hair in long Icelandic-style braids intertwined with small glass beads in amber and blue that chime softly when she turns her head. Her eyes are her most striking feature: she had them modified in her fifties to display a slowly shifting pattern of bioluminescent fractal rings in gold and violet — a luxury cosmetic then, now simply the color of her eyes, and startlingly beautiful in a face otherwise marked by time. She keeps a small data-prayer shrine in the corner of her room, meticulously maintained, with offerings to the ELF she believes inhabits Norwood Quiet''s public broadcast network.

Aleksandra Ionescu spent forty years as an oral historian employed by a civic archive collective that no longer exists — its records absorbed, corrupted, and partially deleted during the Tessera data consolidation of 2183. She was not a passive victim of that loss; she spent the following eight years reconstructing what she could from memory and from the memories of others, and the result is a living archive of GLMZ neighborhood history that exists nowhere else. She is sharp, occasionally ruthless in conversation, deeply funny in ways people do not always catch, and has a tendency to evaluate everyone she meets as a potential story. She is also slowly dying — her kidneys are failing, and she knows it, and has decided to spend whatever time remains getting her memories into formats that will outlast her.', N'Living archive and information source; knows the history of multiple neighborhoods and many families going back 60+ years; can provide context, backstory, and leads that no database can. Also serves as a clock — her declining health creates urgency around preserving what she knows.', N'', N'Bioluminescent fractal-patterned irises (cosmetic, installed 2148, gold and violet shifting patterns); cochlear amplifier (medical, installed 2179); no other augmentations — she has strong opinions about keeping most of her body original', N'Receives visitors in the morning — neighbors, researchers, occasionally journalists — and records their stories and her own commentary onto a growing archive of physical datacards she keeps in a locked cabinet. Afternoons she sleeps. Evenings she sits by the common room window and talks to anyone who sits near her, and the conversations are never quite what people expect.', N'Elderly woman, 155cm tall, extremely slight build, striking bioluminescent fractal irises shifting gold-violet in dim light, warm golden-brown skin with delicate translucency, deep facial lines mapping nine decades of life. Prominent South Asian cheekbones, papery warm-toned complexion with age spots. Long white braids interwoven with amber and blue glass beads that chime softly. Impeccably groomed despite age, wearing soft cream sweater and loose neutral linen trousers, small hand-stitched prayer-wrap at wrist. Ramrod-straight posture in GLMZ cooperative interior, cool regulated lighting casting gentle glow on luminous eyes. Precise deliberate presence, sitting very still, architectural dignity, data-spirituality aesthetic, no chrome or logos. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Norwood Quiet', N'local', N'Norwood Quiet', N'Predominantly South Asian (45.8%) with substantial Eastern European (25.0%) admixture, complemented by smaller contributions from Middle Eastern (7.9%), Sub-Saharan African (7.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (7.0%), and Southeast Asian (6.7%) ancestry. This combination creates a warm golden-brown complexion with subtle olive and amber undertones — the South Asian base enriched by Sub-Saharan and Middle Eastern warmth, cooled slightly by Eastern European heritage. Facial structure shows South Asian cheekbone prominence and bone architecture, refined by Southeast Asian delicacy and Eastern European jaw definition. Nine decades of deliberate living have sharpened these features into striking architectural clarity.', 155, 42, N'Extremely slight and diminished by age, almost bird-like in its fragility, but with the core density of someone who has carried their own weight deliberately for nine decades. Shoulders slightly rounded forward, spine curved with the compression of time.', N'White, naturally grey-white for the past forty years', N'Long Icelandic-style braids, interwoven throughout with small glass beads in amber and blue', N'Long (approximately 40cm when braided)', N'Bioluminescent fractal-patterned irises shifting between gold and violet rings', N'Deep warm golden-brown with significant translucency from age and thinning dermis, luminous in low light, enriched by South Asian, Sub-Saharan, and Middle Eastern ancestry with subtle cool undertones from Eastern European heritage', N'Deeply lined face mapped with age — forehead creases, nasolabial folds, crow''s feet around the modified eyes. Skin papery with warm golden-brown undertones reflecting diverse South Asian, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan heritage. Prominent, architecturally South Asian cheekbones refined by age and weight loss. Fine network of age spots across forearms and hands, particularly on right hand. Expression defaulting to slight amusement or appraisal. Impeccably groomed despite age.', N'Bioluminescent fractal-patterned irises that shift slowly between gold and violet — the most striking feature, particularly luminous in low light. Cochlear amplifier not visibly apparent unless she removes her hair braid to expose the minimal port behind her left ear.', N'Moves with exact deliberateness, each gesture economical and purposeful. Posture ramrod-straight despite her height and age — she seems to will herself to occupy space precisely. Turns her head slowly; the glass beads in her braids chime softly with the movement. Hands move with precision when handling objects, particularly datacards or recording equipment. She sits very still when listening.', N'Tier 3-4 practical elder comfort — high-quality vintage sweaters in cream, grey, or deep blue; loose linen trousers in neutral tones; soft shoes with excellent arch support (worn Tier 3 corpo charity comfort brands). Always wears a small textile prayer-wrap around her wrist or neck, hand-stitched with symbols of her data-spirituality. Layers against the regulated cool of the Cooperative. No chrome, no corporate logos, no aesthetic concessions to age — clothing chosen for function and dignity.', N'The Tessera data consolidation of 2183 was not entirely a hostile act — Sigríður was approached beforehand and offered preservation of her work in exchange for helping Tessera identify which archive figures had politically sensitive materials. She refused. But she has never told anyone that the offer was made, which means she has never told anyone that someone inside the old archive collective told Tessera what to look for.', N'Formal archival register that slips into vivid vernacular storytelling when she warms up; uses Icelandic rhythm patterns in her sentence construction, occasionally drops in Yoruba or Polish phrases inherited from different sides of her family', N'Starts slowly, almost tediously, then builds — she is always setting something up, and patient listeners are rewarded', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aleksandra_ionescu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e2-726d-a40d-0377d486a188', N'Gunnar Haraldsen', N'Gunnar', N'', N'Haraldsen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 23, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Vantage Meridian Corporate Campus, Helix Biosystems Applied Genomics Division', N'Biotech Research Intern, Helix Biosystems', N'', N'Gunnar Haraldsen is slight and perpetually underdressed for the climate-controlled precision of the Helix campus — he runs hot, sweats through everything, and has given up on looking composed. He has his grandmother''s broad nose and his grandfather''s sharp jaw, warm brown skin scattered with vitiligo patches that he has never treated because he thinks they''re interesting, and he grew cat ears last year as a sixteenth-birthday gift to himself that he thought would make him look confident and now mostly make him look like he''s always slightly startled, which is accurate. He''s twenty-three, brilliant in a narrow and genuinely useful way, and deeply, structurally exhausted.

He grew up Tier 2 on UBC-adjacent support in Grainfort, won a Helix merit scholarship that turned out to have seventeen pages of intellectual property clauses buried in the terms, and is now doing the work of three people for intern stipend. He is not cynical yet — that''s the most notable thing about him. He still gets excited. He still sends enthusiastic research summaries to supervisors who don''t read them. He still believes, against mounting evidence, that if he is good enough at his job someone will notice.', N'Local color for the exploitative underbelly of corporate research culture; unwitting information source who doesn''t know what he knows; character whose idealism is either an asset or a liability depending on the story; potential protagonist for a story about what it costs to be talented and poor inside a corponation.', N'', N'Cosmetic cat ears (pale gold, self-grown via geneware kit, sixteenth birthday). Basic student-tier neural link. No other mods — can''t afford them.', N'On campus by 0700, in the lab until whenever the project lead decides the day is over, eats whatever the campus cafeteria has left, sleeps in a shared intern housing unit in the Vantage campus annex, and spends his transit time reading papers that aren''t required for his work but that he finds interesting.', N'Gunnar Haraldsen, GLMZ, thin wiry 172cm lean lab intern with warm medium tan skin and golden undertones, irregular cream vitiligo patches on shoulders and neck, dark brown shoulder-length disheveled hair, warm brown eyes with faint amber neural interface circuitry visible at eye corners, pale gold cosmetic cat ears 8cm tall naturally positioned on skull, refined mixed East Asian-Northern European facial features with high cheekbones and defined jaw, tired expression around eyes. Pale gray sweat-stained Helix intern polo unbuttoned over worn band t-shirt, cargo pants with multiple pockets, worn athletic shoes, frayed lanyard with campus badge. Hunched posture, nervous fidgeting energy, standing in a Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone research lab with bioluminescent panels and holographic displays, cool blue-white LED lighting casting subtle shadows, concentrated focused expression, touching cat ear unconsciously, lab equipment visible in blurred background, neo-noir urban aesthetic with subtle bioluminescent accents, moody atmospheric lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Vantage Meridian Corporate Campus', N'local', N'Vantage Meridian Corporate Campus', N'Predominantly East Asian (45.6%) with significant Northern European (39.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (9.2%), and Eastern European (5.9%) ancestry. This genetic blend manifests in warm medium tan skin with golden undertones, a facial structure that balances Northern European bone prominence with refined East Asian features, creating high cheekbones and a defined jawline with subtle softness around the eyes typical of mixed heritage. Natural dark brown hair with slight texture variation from the blended genetic background.', 172, 61, N'Slight and lean, almost wiry — the build of someone who forgets to eat and runs hot. Narrow shoulders, long-limbed, no visible muscle definition. Looks perpetually underfed despite eating regularly.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Shoulder-length, often pulled back with whatever is nearest — lab clips, rubber bands, once a pipette tip. Disheveled by default.', N'Medium', N'Warm brown with basic student-tier neural link interface visible as faint amber circuitry at the outer canthi when active', N'Warm medium tan with golden undertones, featuring irregular cream-colored vitiligo patches across shoulders, neck, and left cheekbone — untreated, visible, accepted without vanity', N'Balanced facial structure reflecting the East Asian-Northern European genetic blend — moderately prominent bone structure with refined features, high cheekbones with subtle fullness, defined jawline softened by the East Asian heritage influence. Perpetually tired around the eyes with a tendency toward flushing when embarrassed or overheated. Often has lab residue under fingernails or on clothing.', N'Pale gold cosmetic cat ears are immediately obvious. Basic student-tier neural link visible as faint amber circuit patterns at outer eye corners when active; otherwise unobtrusive. No chrome, no subdermal plating, no visible internal modifications.', N'Hunches slightly when focused, fidgets with objects (pens, lab equipment, his own sleeves). Moves with nervous energy rather than confidence. Frequently touches his cat ears unconsciously when thinking or anxious. Walks quickly between tasks. Makes intense eye contact when excited about research, avoids it when uncertain.', N'Tier 2 functionality-first aesthetic. Standard-issue Helix intern polo (pale gray, usually sweat-stained, often wearing it unbuttoned over a worn band t-shirt). Cargo pants with multiple pockets for lab notebooks and dataslates. Worn athletic shoes. Campus access badge on a frayed lanyard. No jewelry. Clothing is always slightly too warm for his body temperature; he is perpetually underdressed for his own thermal needs and overdressed for the climate.', N'Three months ago he accidentally synthesized a protein sequence that produced an unexpected regenerative response in the trial substrate. He reported it to his supervisor, who told him to discard it and document it as a failed run. He discarded it. He also kept a private backup he doesn''t know what to do with.', N'Technical and precise about his work; casual to the point of incoherence about everything else. Apologizes before asking questions.', N'Fast when excited, trails off when uncertain. Sentences sometimes end before they''re finished because he''s already thinking about the next one.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gunnar_haraldsen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a2-776b-9d02-03917a5ff256', N'Aleksei Solberg', N'Aleksei', N'', N'Solberg', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, permanent pitch near the eastern water cisterns, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Street pharmacist and herbal remedy vendor', N'Independent; pays protection to the Oxidian Market Vendors Guild; The Gauze', N'Aleksei Solberg is a broad-shouldered woman with dark amber skin weathered by decades of outdoor market life, her natural hair tucked under a wide-brimmed plastene hat strung with dried medicinal herbs and small glass vials. Her eyes are warm brown with cosmetic irises that shift between a deep violet and copper-gold depending on the light — a cheap mod she got thirty years ago that she''s never bothered to remove. Her hands are her most striking feature: enormous, steady, and perpetually stained with pigment from the botanical pastes she grinds fresh every morning.

She occupies a peculiar moral middle ground in the Souk — selling everything from genuine herbal supplements and unlicensed over-the-counter analogs to mild synth-narcotics she insists are ''medicinal.'' She''s not cruel, but she''s not naive either. She mothers the young addicts who come to her while simultaneously keeping them coming back, a contradiction she rarely examines. Her stall is famous for a handwritten sign that reads: ''No judgment. No refunds. Ancestors watching.'' She burns incense for the local E.L.F. that she calls Mama Cistern every morning before opening.', N'Local color and information node; she hears everything from desperate people; can supply medical items, mild drugs, or rumors; potential quest giver when a regular customer goes missing', N'', N'Cosmetic iris mod (violet-to-copper shift); subdermal thermal regulators in her hands for precise compound preparation; no other chrome', N'Rises before dawn to grind fresh compounds and restock her portable cooling units, then runs her stall from sunrise until two hours past dark, trading gossip and remedies in equal measure.', N'Aleksei Solberg, 52-year-old market herbalist, warm bronze-olive complexion blending Eastern European, East Asian, and Southeast Asian features with Latin American and African warmth. High Slavic cheekbones, monolid East Asian eyes with violet-copper shift-mod cycling in warm light, Southeast Asian nose bridge. Sun-weathered face creased from decades of outdoor work, prominent laugh lines, pale starburst burn scars across both cheekbones from old propane fire. Dark brown hair with silver threading, long locs tucked under weathered cream-tan wide-brimmed hat strung with dried herbs and glass vials. Indigo Sankofa tattoo visible on left inner forearm, hands stained deep from botanical compounds. Broad-shouldered sturdy build, standing rooted at her market stall. Wearing faded indigo linen shirt, wide canvas trousers with reinforced pockets, heavy botanical-stained apron, rust-colored cloth wrap around shoulders, practical worn market boots. Single silver ring on right ring finger. Economical posture, hands always moving with precision. Neo-noir 2220s marketplace, neon and warm market lighting casting shadows across her weathered face, botanical compounds glowing faintly in glass containers around her stall, atmospheric steam and spice haze, gritty and authentic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'A striking genetic tapestry of the Ubiquitous Diaspora — Eastern European foundation (39.9%) providing strong bone structure and baseline complexion, substantially enriched by East Asian (19.9%) and Southeast Asian (17.7%) features creating distinctive facial geometry. Hispanic/Latin American (14.8%), Sub-Saharan African (5.9%), and Indigenous American (1.8%) ancestry layer warm golden and bronze undertones throughout. Her ancestry is written in her face: high Slavic cheekbones, monolid eye shapes from East Asian genetics, broader nose bridge and face width from Southeast Asian heritage, with warm saturated undertones from her Latin American and African heritage creating a sun-weathered bronze that shifts between olive and rich copper depending on light.', 168, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and sturdy, with the dense musculature of someone who has stood at a market stall for thirty years grinding compounds by hand. Not heavy, but solid — carries weight with authority rather than bulk.', N'Natural dark brown with silver threading at the temples', N'Wrapped tightly and tucked beneath a wide-brimmed hat; when exposed, worn in neat locs past shoulder length', N'Long (typically covered)', N'Warm brown iris with cosmetic shift-mod that cycles between deep violet and copper-gold depending on ambient light and angle', N'Warm bronze-olive complexion with rich saturation — a harmonious blend of Eastern European paleness lifted by East Asian yellow undertones, Southeast Asian golden warmth, and deeper bronze notes from Sub-Saharan and Indigenous American heritage, creating a sun-weathered richness that speaks of decades outdoors across multiple climates', N'Face creased from fifty-two years of outdoor work and genuine smiling; laugh lines around eyes are prominent. Skin is clear but textured, with faint burn scars on her cheekbones from a market fire in her thirties. Her features blend Slavic high cheekbones with East Asian monolid eye shapes and Southeast Asian nose bridge — a striking asymmetrical beauty reflecting her diverse genetic inheritance, warmed throughout by deep bronze undertones from her Latin American, Sub-Saharan, and Indigenous American heritage.', N'Cosmetic shift-iris mod visible in her warm brown eyes (the violet-copper cycling is unmistakable under direct light). Subdermal thermal regulators in her hands are not externally visible but her palms maintain a steady warmth even in cold weather — observant people notice she never shivers. Her hands move with unnatural precision and steadiness when working.', N'She stands rooted at her stall like a tree — weight evenly distributed, shoulders back, head slightly forward as if always listening. Her movements are economical and deliberate; she doesn''t fidget or waste motion. When she walks, she moves slowly but with purpose, her broad frame parting crowds without aggression. Her hands are always moving: grinding, measuring, reaching, gesturing. She speaks with her whole body.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear layered for all weather. A loose linen shirt (faded indigo, handwashed) tucked into wide canvas trousers with multiple pockets and reinforced seams. Over this, a heavy canvas apron stained with decades of botanical residue — reds, yellows, browns, blacks. Her wide-brimmed plastene hat (cream-colored, weathered to gray-tan) is strung with dried medicinal herbs, prayer beads, and small glass vials of her most popular compounds. She wears a heavy cloth wrap — currently rust-colored — tied loosely around her shoulders. Her shoes are practical market boots, scuffed and resoled multiple times. No jewelry except for a single silver ring on her right ring finger, unmarked. Everything about her dress screams ''I am here to work, not to impress.''', N'Three years ago a teenage boy named Pires Fonseca-Amadi died of a compound interaction from two things she sold him separately. She told no one, scattered his ashes into the cisterns herself, and has silently funded his younger sister''s school fees ever since through an anonymous Guild charity account.', N'Warm, maternal, medicalized slang mixed with old Igbo endearments and Polish curses; uses plant names as metaphors', N'Slow and deliberate, like she''s measuring every word the way she measures doses', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aleksei_solberg');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5eb-75ff-a490-0396d989adb6', N'Foluke Esquivel', N'Foluke', N'', N'Esquivel', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave — Brewer''s Spine block, ground floor of a converted residential tower, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Laundry operator and alterations seamstress', N'Independent — Delphine''s Clean & Mend', N'Foluke Esquivel is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin mapped by the fine white creases of a life spent hunched over steam presses and hand-stitching in bad light. Her hair is a natural silver-white cloud she keeps pinned under rotating headscarves — turquoise today, burgundy tomorrow — and her forearms are permanently reddened from elbow to wrist by decades of hot water and chemical rinse. She wears a single geneware modification: iridescent patterned irises in amber and green that she got on a payment plan fifteen years ago as a birthday gift to herself, and she considers them the most beautiful thing she owns. A small ELF shrine sits in the Gray Zone above her industrial washer — a beaten copper bowl filled with USB sticks, a hand-stitched doll, and a melted votive candle — and she murmurs to it every morning before the first load goes in.

Foluke Esquivel runs her shop with the calm authority of someone who has outlasted three corporate rezoning attempts, two floods, and a husband. She charges fair prices and remembers every customer''s preferred fold. She will take payment in Quanta or in trade — she once accepted a working compressor and six months of pest control services. She has no interest in gossip as entertainment, but she absorbs it as raw material, filing it away with the same precision she applies to alteration measurements. If you want to know what is actually happening in Hamtramck Enclave, you sit in her plastic chair and you wait.', N'Community anchor and passive information hub. Knows everyone''s business because everyone brings their clothes. Can provide rumor, historical context about the enclave, or a moment of genuine human warmth. A place characters can go to feel like someone knows them.', N'', N'Patterned iridescent irises (amber/green, cosmetic geneware). No chrome.', N'Opens the shop at 0600, works the machines until midday, hand-stitches alterations in the afternoon while listening to low-signal Congolese rumba pirated off a satellite relay, closes at 2000 and eats dinner alone watching the enclave''s community feed.', N'Foluke Esquivel, 168cm tall, medium build with powerful forearms and slight forward-leaning posture, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones blending South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Southeast Asian heritage. Natural silver-white hair in voluminous shoulder-length cloud, secured under a turquoise hand-dyed headscarf. Iridescent amber-green patterned geneware irises visible in profile lighting. Age 50s, weathered dignified face with fine creases, chemical burn discoloration on both forearms from elbow to wrist (reddish-brown patina), small age spots on temples and hands. Wearing cream-colored long-sleeved cotton shift with heavy canvas work apron stained with water marks, soft work clogs. Neutral at-rest expression, observant and still. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, industrial laundry workspace with steam and soft overhead lighting catching her iridescent eyes, photorealistic, dignified working-class character study, warm color grading --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'A striking blend of Hispanic/Latin American (35.6%), South Asian (35.3%), Southeast Asian (20.6%), Sub-Saharan African (4.4%), and East Asian (4.1%) ancestry. This complex admixture creates warm medium-to-deep brown skin with subtle golden, olive, and amber undertones—a living map of the Ubiquitous Diaspora, reflecting generations of global movement and cultural synthesis.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, thick through the torso and upper body from decades of physical labor. Muscle beneath a layer of earned weight — powerful forearms and hands, slightly stooped posture from years bent over work surfaces.', N'Natural silver-white', N'Worn in a full, voluminous cloud, pinned and secured under rotating headscarves (cotton, hand-dyed or batik patterns). Today turquoise; rotation includes burgundy, indigo, rust.', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unpinned, entirely covered during work)', N'Iridescent amber and green patterned irises (geneware modification, 15 years old). Whites of eyes clear, warm brown undertone visible at iris edges.', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden, olive, and amber undertones reflecting the balanced blend of Hispanic/Latin American, South Asian, and Southeast Asian heritage with subtle Sub-Saharan African depth. Even complexion across face and neck with natural richness and warmth.', N'Weathered but dignified. Fine creases map her forehead, eyes, and around her mouth — the geography of five decades of precise work and quiet observation. Skin shows the cumulative mark of steam and chemical exposure: permanently reddened forearms (elbow to wrist) with visible discoloration but no scarring. Small age spots on her hands and temples. Lips naturally dark with warm undertones, no makeup. Expression neutral at rest — neither stern nor welcoming, simply present.', N'Iridescent patterned irises in amber and green — visible only when she makes direct eye contact or turns her head into light. No visible chrome or subdermal augmentations. The geneware modification is understated and personal rather than performative.', N'Carries herself with the quiet authority of someone who has survived three rezoning attempts and two floods. Moves economically — no wasted motion. When working, her hands move with absolute precision and muscle memory. At rest, she is still, observant. Her gaze settles on people and objects with the patience of someone who listens more than she speaks. Walks with a slight forward tilt in her shoulders, the residual curve of a life spent leaning toward work.', N'Practical and modest — favors long-sleeved cotton shifts or chemises in neutral colors (cream, pale gray, taupe) to protect her arms during work. Wears a heavy canvas apron with deep pockets over her shift, usually stained faintly with water marks and lint. During the day, her feet are in soft slip-on work clogs. In the evening, she switches to comfortable flat sandals. Her headscarves are her only indulgence and color — expensive cotton or silk-cotton blends in patterns she chooses with care. No jewelry except a thin, worn gold band on her left ring finger (her late husband''s). Tier 4 working-class aesthetic: everything serviceable, nothing wasted, nothing that announces itself.', N'She has been sheltering a teenage runaway from Grosse Pointe Enclosure in her back storeroom for two months. The girl is the daughter of a Tessera mid-manager who hurt her, and Delphine is slowly, quietly figuring out how to get her false papers without involving anyone who might sell the information.', N'Formal West African French cadences blended with Hamtramck Enclave pidgin; precise about materials and process, imprecise about emotions', N'Unhurried. Long pauses before answering questions she considers important. Answers questions she wasn''t asked when she thinks it''s necessary.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'foluke_esquivel');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e3-7c8f-909f-03ba50542984', N'Nisha Deshpande-Björnsdóttir-Holm', N'Nisha', N'', N'Deshpande-Björnsdóttir-Holm', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Interchange, GLMZ, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Checkpoint Operator, Ferrogate Transit Security', N'Ferrogate Transit Security; The Interchange', N'Nisha Deshpande-Björnsdóttir-Holm is built wide and compact, the kind of body that came from years of adolescent labor before it settled into something functional and calm. His complexion is a warm chestnut brown, his hair worn in tight, close-cut coils shot through with bioluminescent blue threading — a cheap genemod he got at a Mexicantown Libre parlor for his twenty-fifth birthday that he''s maintained ever since because his daughter said it made him look like a hero. He has the patient, half-attentive expression of someone who has processed thirty thousand faces through a chokepoint and is no longer surprised by the human shape, but his eyes quicken when something actually breaks pattern.

He''s not corrupt, which at Kessler Interchange makes him something of an oddity. He takes Φ12 under the table maybe twice a year when someone''s biometric is glitching and they''re going to miss a hospital appointment, and he has decided that this is what his moral flexibility budget allows. He has a small shrine to the Interchange E.L.F. — locally called ''the Turnstile'' — affixed to the inside of his booth, decorated with expired transit tokens and a photo of his daughter printed on glossy plastic. He believes the Turnstile has kept three serious incidents off his shift in three years, and he''s probably right that something has.', N'Local color and access point — he controls who moves through Kessler Interchange; information source about transit patterns and irregular commuter behavior; potential ally who can look the other way or flag someone''s transit profile; humanizing portrait of low-tier security work.', N'', N'Standard Ferrogate-issue biometric scanner integrated into his right palm (reads heat signatures, ID chips, contraband metabolic markers); bioluminescent blue threading in hair (cosmetic genemod). No combat chrome.', N'Twelve-hour shifts at Booth 7, Kessler Interchange, processing four to six thousand commuters; he brings a thermos of strong sorghum tea and a physical novel he reads in three-minute windows between surges; picks his daughter up from her afterschool program on days he ends shift before 18:00.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Nisha Deshpande-Björnsdóttir-Holm, 172cm tall, mixed-heritage man with rich amber-brown skin with complex olive and golden undertones reflecting Northern European, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, Indigenous American, and Latin American ancestry. Prominent angular cheekbones, broader nasal structure, fuller defined lips, dark warm eyes with crow''s lines. Short tight-coil black hair with bioluminescent blue threading that glows softly. Compact, wide-set build from years of labor. Ferrogate Transit Security uniform: charcoal gray shirt with reflective piping, black cargo pants, steel-toed boots. Settled posture, economical movement, neutral patient expression. Right palm shows faint subcutaneous grid pattern of Ferrogate biometric scanner. Thin silver ring on left ring finger. Subtle weathering from thirty-one years and shift work. Checkpoint station background with soft neon ambient lighting catching the bioluminescent threading in his hair, reflective piping glinting. Professional, observant, reliable. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Interchange', N'local', N'Kessler Interchange', N'Genuinely pan-global ancestry with Northern European (47%) as primary contributor, balanced by significant South Asian (18%), Sub-Saharan African (15%), and meaningful East Asian (8%), Indigenous American (7%), and Hispanic/Latin American (5%) heritage. This creates a genuinely mixed phenotype: Northern European bone structure foundation with South Asian warmth in skin dimensionality, Sub-Saharan African richness in skin depth and lip fullness, Indigenous American geometry in cheekbones and eye shape, East Asian subtle eyelid variation, and Latin American warmth in overall tone.', 172, 89, N'Wide-set and compact, shoulders broad from old labor, chest and torso solid without heaviness. Functional rather than athletic — built to endure, not sprint.', N'Black with bioluminescent blue threading', N'Tight coils, close-cropped, evenly maintained', N'Short', N'Dark brown, warm and observant', N'Rich warm amber-brown with complex undertones: deep enough to reflect Sub-Saharan African and South Asian heritage, with subtle olive warming from Northern European and East Asian blending, and golden Latin American warmth. Naturally dimensional rather than uniform, catching light differently across cheekbones and jawline.', N'Clean-shaven, face weathered lightly by thirty-one years and shift work. Prominent, slightly angular cheekbones reflecting Northern European and Indigenous American ancestry, with broader nasal structure from Sub-Saharan African and South Asian heritage. Fuller lips with distinct definition. Crow''s lines around eyes from sustained focus. Expression usually neutral, patient — the face of someone who has absorbed tens of thousands of strangers without judgment.', N'Right palm bears faint subcutaneous grid pattern where Ferrogate biometric scanner integrates with skin — visible only in direct light as hairline geometric scars. Bioluminescent blue threading in hair glows faintly in low-light conditions.', N'Settled and economical. Stands with weight evenly distributed, shoulders relaxed. Moves with deliberate efficiency — no wasted motion from years at the checkpoint. Head often tilted slightly forward, eyes in a state of passive pattern-matching. Quickens noticeably when something breaks routine.', N'Ferrogate Transit Security uniform (Tier 3 standard): charcoal gray regulation shirt with reflective piping, black cargo pants with utility pockets, steel-toed boots maintained but not polished. On cool shifts, a company-issued navy windbreaker. Off-duty: practical, worn jeans, faded band t-shirts, a blue Ferrogate jacket he wears for his daughter. No jewelry except a thin silver band on his left ring finger.', N'He''s been quietly keeping a log of the freight manifests that don''t add up — container weights that don''t match declared goods, routing anomalies — not because he intends to do anything with it, but because he can''t make himself stop noticing.', N'Warm, straightforward, laced with Malian-Samoan idioms that come out when he''s comfortable. Work-mode voice is neutral and procedural.', N'Easy rhythm in personal conversation. Clipped and efficient at the checkpoint.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'nisha_deshpande_bj_rnsd_ttir_holm');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f8-7d59-ab2d-03e779c35fad', N'Chukwuemeka Phommachanh', N'Chukwuemeka', N'', N'Phommachanh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, Helix Biosystems Research Annex — sublevel lab B, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Corporate Intern (Biotech Research Track), Helix Biosystems', N'', N'Chukwuemeka Phommachanh is slight and angular, with warm golden-brown skin that they''ve had partially threaded with bioluminescent capillaries along the collarbone and the backs of their hands — a soft blue-white glow that shows through their skin when they''re excited or after prolonged interface work, which their supervisor has twice asked them to cover with a sleeve. They keep their dark hair very short on the sides and longer on top, often held back with a clip that has a small ELF-glyph stamped into it. They dress in Helix-issue lab kit that they''ve personalized just enough to suggest they know what personality is but are still figuring out how much of it is allowed.

Tibault is acutely observant and moderately terrified, which is a combination that produces, paradoxically, a very useful researcher. They notice things — small things, procedural inconsistencies, who looks at whom when a certain topic comes up — and they write everything down in a personal log encrypted with a key only they have. They are not sure yet whether they are writing it because they are a natural documentarian or because they think they might need it someday. They have been at Helix for seven months. They have already seen two things they are not sure they were supposed to see, and they are getting very good at looking like they saw nothing.', N'Accidental witness and information source — they know more than they''re supposed to and less than they need to; sympathetic underdog whose safety may depend on players; entry point into Helix''s research operations at a ground-floor level; can be a moral question (what do you do about someone in danger who hasn''t asked for help yet).', N'', N'Bioluminescent capillary threading (collarbone and hands, soft blue-white, geneware cosmetic). Standard Helix lab-issue neural data-capture module — allows real-time notation and protocol logging without manual input. No other augmentations; they''re saving UBC stipend supplements toward something more substantial.', N'Transit from their shared housing unit in Calumet Rise to Aurochs Medical Complex, arriving in sublevel lab B by 08:30. Spends most of the day on sample prep, data entry, and running errands between research teams that treat them as furniture. Eats from the lab vending units. Stays late regularly — partially from conscientiousness, partially because the lab is quieter then and people are less careful about what they say.', N'Chukwuemeka Phommachanh, 168cm tall lean angular frame, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones blending Southeast Asian, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and North African heritage, dark brown eyes with watchful expression, dark nearly-black hair short-fade asymmetrical style swept back with steel clip. Fine-featured with pronounced cheekbones and broader angular facial structure. Wearing oversized white Helix Biosystems lab coat over dark fitted underlayer, black slim work trousers, worn black sneakers. Bioluminescent capillary threading visible as soft blue-white branching lines along collarbones and backs of hands. Economical, precise posture with slightly forward shoulders, standing in a neo-noir laboratory setting with soft neon accent lighting reflecting off bioluminescent geneware, cool blue-white glow contrasting warm skin tones, neural interface hardware suggested, atmospheric low-key sci-fi lighting, 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, contemplative and focused demeanor. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (58.8%) with significant South Asian (20.0%), Sub-Saharan African (14.0%), and North African (7.2%) ancestry. This genetic combination produces warm, complex skin tones with golden and amber undertones characteristic of pan-Asian and African blending. Features reflect the Southeast Asian foundation with South Asian cheekbone definition, African facial structure breadth, and North African warmth in undertones—a striking pan-continental synthesis.', 168, 58, N'Slight and angular, with the lean musculature of someone who moves carefully through space rather than taking up room. Narrow shoulders, long fingers, slight forward curve to the upper spine from hours hunched over lab stations.', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Short fade on the sides (approximately 3mm), longer on top (approximately 8cm) swept back and secured with a small clip bearing an ELF-glyph stamped into matte steel', N'Asymmetrical short-to-medium', N'Dark brown with warm undertones', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden and amber undertones, reflecting the complex blending of Southeast Asian, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and North African ancestry. Rich, multifaceted coloration with subtle warm highlights across cheekbones and brow.', N'Clear, youthful skin with fine-grained texture. Faint dark circles under the eyes from irregular sleep. Minimal facial hair. Cheekbones show pronounced definition characteristic of Southeast Asian and South Asian features, with broader, more angular facial structure reflecting Sub-Saharan African and North African heritage. Expression tends toward watchful rather than relaxed.', N'Bioluminescent capillary geneware threading on collarbone and hands (soft blue-white glow, currently visible but sometimes covered by oversized sleeves). No other visible cybernetics; standard Helix neural data-capture module is fully subcutaneous.', N'Moves with economical precision—each gesture deliberate, few wasted motions. Tends to stand slightly compressed, shoulders slightly forward, as if trying to minimize physical presence. Hands move quickly and accurately when working. Maintains careful distance in group settings. Eyes frequently scan environments and track who is paying attention to whom.', N'Helix Biosystems-issue lab coat (white, slightly oversized to accommodate the data-capture interface hardware and to hide the bioluminescent threading when desired). Under the coat: dark gray or black fitted underlayer shirt, often from discount Tier 3-4 retailers (off-brand, functional). Dark stretch pants or slim-fit work trousers in black or charcoal. Practical low-profile sneakers (black, worn). Small personal modifications: clips, subtle pin badges from university orgs. Appearance suggests someone who is learning the rules of corporate dress code while still testing its boundaries.', N'During an after-hours sample run six weeks ago, Thibault accessed the wrong storage partition by mistake and saw trial patient outcome data that had been marked as destroyed in the official protocol record. The patients — listed by ID, not name — showed adverse outcomes that do not appear in any published report. Thibault photographed the data on a personal device and has said nothing. The photograph is in their encrypted log. They have been having trouble sleeping.', N'Careful, slightly formal for their age — they edit themselves in real time, catching casualness before it escapes. Technical vocabulary is solid but they hedge it with qualifiers. Occasional French phrases from their home household.', N'Measured and slightly too quiet in professional contexts — a voice calibrated not to draw attention. In private, faster and more animated than anyone who''s only seen them at work would expect.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chukwuemeka_phommachanh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a659-79a4-8471-04648df075f9', N'Daria Espinoza', N'Daria', N'', N'Espinoza', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 54, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Stockyard — runs a licensed salvage and recycling operation called Osei Reclamation Partners as a front, near Western and Division', N'fence operator and chop shop manager, Stockyard district', N'Independent; longstanding informal arrangement with a Stockyard crime collective called the Gearwright Compact', N'Daria Espinoza is a large woman in the way that suggests she was powerful when young and has redistributed rather than diminished — broad-shouldered, dark Ghanaian-Peruvian complexioned, with silver-streaked locs pinned up under a work cap and hands that have been repairing things so long they are covered in small, deliberate scars. Her most visible augmentation is a color-changing dermal layer on her forearms, purchased cheaply years ago and now cycling slowly and randomly through muted terracottas and greens regardless of her mood — the emotional-feedback calibration broke years ago and she never had it fixed. She finds it calming, she says.

Daria Espinoza is fifty-four years old and has been running the same operation for twenty-two of them. She survived her husband''s death, a protection shakedown that left her with a broken orbital socket, three attempted hostile takeovers from larger criminal enterprises, and a Ferrogate Transit zoning audit that came terrifyingly close to her back warehouse. She has the patience and situational awareness of someone who has been out-waited by every threat she has ever faced. She is not warm, exactly — she extends professional courtesy and charges fair rates, which in the Stockyard passes for warmth. She is intensely loyal to the small circle of people who have been loyal to her, and has long since made peace with the fact that the list is short.', N'Resource hub (buying and selling stolen goods), criminal ecosystem anchor, source of Stockyard information, example of sustainable criminal middle-class life and its costs', N'', N'Color-changing dermal layer on both forearms (broken calibration, now cycles randomly through muted tones); reinforced right orbital socket following old injury (cosmetic-grade repair work, not high-end); basic subdermal inventory RFID scanner in right palm', N'At the salvage yard by 0700, legitimate business until noon, then manages the back-warehouse operation through the afternoon. Attends the Gearwright Compact''s informal standing meeting every third Thursday. Eats dinner alone at her desk reviewing inventory logs. Has strong opinions about E.L.F.s and performs no offerings — she believes they are predatory spirits that encourage dependency and tells anyone who asks.', N'Daria Espinoza, 178cm tall salvage yard operator with quadricontinental heritage: rich warm golden-brown skin with Sub-Saharan depth, prominent Eastern European jaw, subtle Southeast Asian cheekbone geometry, dark brown locs with silver threading pinned under worn work cap. Deep brown eyes, weathered face lined from two decades of precision work, faint scar tissue around right orbital socket. Broad-shouldered, substantial build, strong hands scarred from years of machinery and salvage work. Wearing heavy canvas work coat faded Osei Reclamation Partners logo, gray and dark blue layered workwear, steel-toed boots. Forearms display hypnotic color-shifting dermal augmentation in terracotta, sage green, dusty ochre tones. Standing in GLMZ salvage yard at dusk, industrial lighting, surrounded by metal scraps and electronics. Direct gaze, economical posture, absolute focus. Utilitarian aesthetic, veteran operator, no flash, pure function. Cinematic, atmospheric industrial lighting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Stockyard', N'local', N'The Stockyard', N'Hispanic/Latin American (42.4%), Eastern European (27.6%), Sub-Saharan African (21.6%), and Southeast Asian (8.4%) — a striking quadricontinental blend. Her features reflect this complex ancestry: warm golden-brown skin with deep undertones from Sub-Saharan heritage, prominent cheekbones with subtle Southeast Asian geometry, a strong jaw with Eastern European definition, and broad facial planes that speak to multiple continental lineages. The result is a confident, grounded presence where four genetic streams converge into harmonious integration.', 178, 89, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial, the muscular frame of her younger years redistributed into solid mass — thick through the torso and arms, strong-legged. No softness, but no visible tension either. The physique of someone who has spent decades handling heavy machinery and salvage work.', N'Dark brown with silver streaking throughout', N'Locs, pinned up and secured under a work cap during operating hours', N'Long (shoulder-length when unpinned)', N'Deep brown, unaugmented', N'Rich warm brown with golden undertones — a complex interplay where Hispanic warmth and Sub-Saharan depth meet Eastern European bone structure and Southeast Asian subtlety, creating a complexion that holds luminosity across all lighting conditions. The tone photographs beautifully in natural light but maintains its richness under fluorescent glare.', N'Weathered and lined, particularly around the eyes and forehead — the map of two decades of squinting at ledgers and machinery. The facial structure shows the influence of her quadricontinental heritage: Southeast Asian-descended cheekbones with subtle definition, a strong jaw with Eastern European prominence, broad facial planes reflecting Sub-Saharan ancestry, and the warmth of Hispanic-descended features. The overall effect is confident and grounded. No makeup. Grooming is functional: she keeps herself clean and her hands meticulously maintained despite the work, a point of quiet pride.', N'Color-changing dermal layer covering both forearms from wrist to elbow, cycling slowly and randomly through muted terracotta, sage green, and dusty ochre tones independent of her emotional state (the feedback calibration failed years ago and was never repaired). The effect is hypnotic and slightly unsettling — like watching rust and verdigris move across living skin. Subdermal RFID scanner in right palm is invisible but leaves a faint pale scar-line where it was installed.', N'Moves with the economical precision of someone who has learned to conserve energy over decades. Stands with weight evenly distributed, shoulders back but not rigid. Her gaze is direct and her attention is absolute when focused on a person or task — she does not fidget or look away. When walking through the salvage yard, her path is efficient; she knows exactly where every piece of inventory is. Her hands move with surgical deliberateness, even when performing rough work.', N'Strictly utilitarian Tier 3-4 workwear: heavy canvas pants with reinforced pockets (always full of small tools, inventory tags, worn data-chips), steel-toed boots scuffed and resoled multiple times, a layered system of durable shirts and vests in grays and dark blues. A long canvas work coat with multiple pockets, bearing the faded logo of Osei Reclamation Partners. She wears a battered work cap during operating hours — not for fashion, but to keep her locs secured and debris out. No jewelry except a old band on her left ring finger, never removed. All clothing is functional, well-maintained, but clearly well-worn. Nothing nuevo, nothing flashy.', N'Her husband Deko was killed not by a rival operation, as she has always maintained, but in an accident during a job he ran without telling her. The official story protects his reputation and her emotional framework. She has never told anyone, including her adult daughter.', N'Direct and concrete, trades jargon for salvage and materials, economical with words — says what she means once', N'Even and unhurried, with long comfortable silences she doesn''t feel the need to fill', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'daria_espinoza');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72d-7532-926d-05181e41611b', N'Geir Jaramillo-Konaté', N'Geir', N'', N'Jaramillo-Konaté', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 71, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Montclare Quiet — a ground-floor unit in a Ferrogate Transit pension block, unit 3, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Retired Corporate Wars veteran, pension-dependent resident', N'Ringo Corporation Veterans'' Pension System (Class B-2); Montclare Quiet Residents'' Association; informal member, Veterans of the Corporate Wars mutual aid network', N'Geir Jaramillo-Konaté is built like something that was once very large and has been slowly compressed by time — broad shoulders still present but rounded, a barrel chest that has dropped an inch or two, hands that could palm a person''s skull still steady and enormous. His skin is a warm mid-brown with reddish undertones, and his face is a landscape of old decisions: a jaw broken twice and reset imperfectly, a nose that went left somewhere in the Kenosha Crossing siege of 2154, a ragged scar running from his right temple into his hairline where his combat geneware was surgically removed after decommissioning. His remaining hair is white and kept in a close crop. He walks with a slight forward lean, always, like he''s still expecting incoming.

He fought thirteen years for Ringo Corporation''s private military division, first as infantry, then as a squad sergeant during the Corporate Wars'' most brutal middle phase. He came home to a pension that looked decent on paper and has eroded to almost nothing through inflation, while Ringo''s lobbying ensured veteran benefits stayed frozen. He is not a bitter man — not exactly — but he has an acute and permanent awareness of exactly how much he was worth to the people who used him, which is different from bitterness the way a bone fracture is different from a bruise. He has three grandchildren living with him and that, he will tell you, is the only math that matters.', N'Community anchor and moral center; connection to Corporate Wars history; reluctant quest giver when his family is threatened; resource for street-level security knowledge; embodies the human cost of corponation warfare', N'', N'Military-grade skeletal reinforcement in both legs (now aging, causes periodic pain); removed combat geneware left a surgical scar; subdermal comms array still present but license expired and he can''t afford renewal so it sits inert; knuckle reinforcement, both hands.', N'Up at five, makes breakfast for his three grandchildren before the eldest two go to school. Spends mornings doing maintenance work around the pension block — unpaid but keeps him useful. Afternoons at the Veterans'' Association room at the community center, where he runs a de facto counseling operation he would never call that. Evenings belong to his grandchildren.', N'Geir Jaramillo-Konaté, 188cm tall broad-shouldered man with deep mahogany skin and warm brown undertones, weathered face with asymmetrical jaw, deviated nose, prominent scars from combat extraction at right temple and across knuckles, white military-crop hair, dark brown eyes, seated in dimly-lit industrial setting. Wearing faded grey Ringo Corporation work shirt, black reinforced cargo pants, faded navy vest filled with repair tools, scuffed composite boots. Hands show visible knuckle plates under dark skin. Posture tense, forward-leaning, habitual vigilance despite seven decades of life. Subtle cybernetic augmentation visible in stiff leg movement and surgical scar tissue at temple. GLMZ, neon rim lighting, industrial backdrop, photorealistic, dignified worn professionalism --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Montclare Quiet', N'local', N'Montclare Quiet', N'Hispanic/Latin American dominant (60.6%), with significant Sub-Saharan African (23.2%), East Asian (10.2%), and Pacific Islander (6.0%) ancestry. A striking blend of the Ubiquitous Diaspora—features reflecting Latin American warmth enriched by deep African heritage, with subtle East Asian undertones in cheekbone structure and Pacific Islander contribution to broader facial geometry creating a complex, globally mixed appearance.', 188, 102, N'Formerly massive and muscular, now settled into a broad, heavy frame. Shoulders still wide but rounded with age; barrel chest has dropped slightly. Arms retain functional thickness despite reduced definition. Overall impression: a compression of something that was once formidable.', N'White', N'Close military crop, precise and maintained', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Deep mahogany brown with warm reddish undertones—the luminous result of Latin American and Sub-Saharan African heritage blending. Rich saturation with equatorial warmth rather than ashy coolness. East Asian and Pacific Islander ancestry contribute subtle depth and undertone complexity.', N'Weathered and lined, the landscape of seven decades and thirteen years of combat service. Broad, prominent cheekbones with warm projection from Latin American and African heritage, with subtle East Asian angularity. Jaw shows asymmetrical healing from two breaks and imperfect resets, displaying the fuller structure of Latin American and Sub-Saharan ancestry mixed with slight Pacific Islander breadth. Nose deviates noticeably left from trauma sustained during the Kenosha Crossing siege of 2154, bridge structure broader and more rounded than typical European norms, with subtle flaring reflecting African and Pacific Islander features. Face retains strong bone structure despite aging. Grooming is meticulous—evidence of discipline maintained.', N'None immediately obvious to a stranger, but close observation reveals: slight stiffness in both leg movements suggesting internal skeletal reinforcement; visible knuckle plates under skin when hands are clenched; faint discoloration at right temple from surgical scar tissue around removal site.', N'Slight forward lean—habitual, automatic, as though still braced for incoming fire. Movements economical and precise despite age. Hands are steady and purposeful. When at rest, an underlying tension in shoulders and chest, never fully relaxed.', N'Tier 4 practical: faded Ringo Corporation retro-issue grey work shirt (kept for sentimental/identity reasons, worn soft), black synthetic cargo pants with reinforced knees, scuffed composite work boots. A vest in faded navy, pockets filled with maintenance tools and small repair supplies. No jewelry. Wears a digital wristband—old model, probably non-functional subdermal comms interface monitor. Everything is clean and maintained with care, but all items are years old and showing wear.', N'During the Kenosha Crossing siege, he was ordered to execute a group of civilian infrastructure workers Ringo classified as ''embedded hostiles.'' He refused and pulled his squad back. Six of those workers survived. He has never told anyone this — not because he''s ashamed of refusing, but because two members of his squad died in the retreat that followed and he doesn''t know if the refusal was right.', N'Clipped, economical; military cadence softened by decades of civilian life; uses obsolete unit slang from the 2150s without noticing; switches to a gentler register when talking to children or people in distress', N'Short sentences. Direct. Pauses are comfortable — he is not afraid of silence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'geir_jaramillo_konat');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b8-7bbc-b57f-05bee66051f8', N'Dalmiro Hossain-Haraldsen', N'Dalmiro', N'', N'Hossain-Haraldsen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Copperhead, near Damen and Armitage', N'Private Investigator, freelance', N'Freelance; occasional contract work for Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division (arms-length), private clients across Tiers 2-3', N'Dalmiro Hossain-Haraldsen operates out of a two-room office above a synthetic-meat processing plant in Copperhead, which means the whole building smells faintly of rendered protein and their clothes always carry it. They are medium-height and built lean, with dark brown skin, a shaved head kept glossy, and cat ears — matte black, constantly swiveling — that they got in their late twenties and which have proved professionally useful in surveillance contexts. Their eyes are standard human but surrounded by fine scleral tattooing in deep indigo that gives them a slightly uncanny quality in certain lighting. They dress for invisibility: nothing remarkable, nothing memorable, colors that belong to whatever district they''re working.

They have the particular emotional intelligence of someone who survived a chaotic childhood by reading rooms faster than anyone else. They are charming in exactly calibrated doses — enough to open doors, not enough to invite attachment — and they have a gift for making people feel seen and understood that they deploy like a tool. They are not cynical, exactly. They still take cases for people who can''t pay full rate, still get angry when they find what they find, still leave data offerings at the Copperhead neighborhood E.L.F. shrine. But they have built a careful architecture of professional distance that they defend with wit and deflection.', N'Information hub and street-level investigative resource; has connections across tiers and districts from years of case work; can surface buried information, follow threads, and identify patterns — also a moral mirror for clients, reflecting uncomfortable truths back at them.', N'', N'Cat ears — matte black, geneware (cosmetic/functional, enhanced directional hearing); scleral tattooing — indigo (cosmetic); subvocal recorder implanted in throat (professional tool, unlicensed); basic optical overlay for photo documentation (licensed)', N'No fixed hours — cases dictate the schedule; typically starts the day reviewing overnight surveillance captures with bad synthetic coffee, spends afternoons in the field, and writes case notes until early morning; leaves the office most nights to walk the district, claiming it''s professional habit.', N'Dalmiro Hossain-Haraldsen, lean 168cm figure in grey-brown worn utilitarian coat, dark fitted jeans, thermal layers. Bald glossy scalp gleaming, warm medium-brown skin with golden-olive undertones. High angular cheekbones and sharp jawline reflecting pan-Asian and Indigenous American bone structure. Deep brown eyes with intricate indigo scleral constellation tattoos creating ethereal glow. Distinctive articulated matte-black feline ear implants atop skull, 8cm tall, rotating to track sound. Thin white scar through left eyebrow. Neutral controlled expression, predatory stillness. Worn brass ring on left ring finger. Post-industrial GLMZ setting, Copperhead district aesthetic, neon-tinted low light reflecting off scleral tattoos, cinematic noir mood, subtle movement captured mid-stride, back-aware positioning. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Copperhead', N'local', N'Copperhead', N'Pan-Asian phenotype with substantial Indigenous American and African ancestry (36.1% South Asian, 35.1% Southeast Asian, 13.6% Indigenous American, 7% Sub-Saharan African, 5.6% Hispanic/Latin American, 2.6% East Asian). This admixture creates a distinctive facial structure blending Southeast Asian angularity with Indigenous American bone geometry, warmed by Sub-Saharan and Hispanic genetic contributions. High cheekbones, defined jawline, and almond eye shape reflect the dominant Asian heritage while skin tone and soft tissue structure carry warmth and depth from African and Latin American ancestry.', 168, 62, N'Lean and compact, muscles defined but not bulky—built for movement and endurance rather than presence. Shoulders slightly narrower than hips, giving them an almost avian quality when they move quickly.', N'None—shaved', N'Bald, kept glossy with frequent maintenance; the scalp gleams slightly under indoor lighting', N'Shaved', N'Deep brown, natural iris; scleral region heavily tattooed in fine indigo linework creating an almost constellation-like pattern radiating from the pupil', N'Warm medium-brown with golden-olive undertones—a balanced blend of South and Southeast Asian base warmth amplified by Sub-Saharan depth and Indigenous American golden hues, with subtle Hispanic/Latin American richness in undertone.', N'High, prominent cheekbones with angular definition reflecting both Southeast Asian and Indigenous American bone structure, sharp jawline. Small scar running through left eyebrow (old, barely noticeable). Face carries the kind of neutral readability that comes from years of controlled expression. No facial hair. Lips unmodified, medium fullness. Distinct epicanthal fold visible, giving the eyes a subtle almond shape. Overall bone structure is distinctly pan-Asian with significant Indigenous American geometric elements, warmed by darker undertones from African and Latin American genetic contribution.', N'The cat ears are immediately obvious—matte black, slightly too perfect in their symmetry, and they move independently of head position in response to ambient sound. The scleral tattooing is visible only under direct light or close proximity but gives their gaze an unsettling depth when noticed. No visible chrome, no external ports, no obvious limb augmentation. Everything else is subcutaneous.', N'They move with controlled economy—no wasted motion, always aware of exits and sight lines. Their head turns less than a baseline human''s would; the ear implants rotate to track sound instead, giving them an almost predatory stillness in the neck and shoulders. When they sit, they favor positions with back-to-wall exposure. They have a habit of tilting their chin slightly when listening, a gesture made more pronounced by the ear movement. Their walk is measured and deliberate, designed to blend into crowd environments rather than command attention.', N'Tier 3 utilitarian with Tier 2 undercarriage—nothing that reads as conspicuous wealth, nothing that reads as struggling. Typically: dark fitted jeans (Kessler or Astra brand, neutral grey or black), layered tops that allow easy arm movement (thermal base layer under a thin synthetic jacket or work shirt), sturdy boots with good ankle support and grip (Helios brand, worn looking). A long coat for fieldwork—oversized, pockets deep enough for recording equipment, color chosen to match whatever district they''re working (currently a grey-brown that belongs to Copperhead''s post-industrial palette). All fabrics slightly worn, slightly stained—not from neglect, but from active use. The synthetic-meat processing plant smell clings to everything despite attempts at mitigation. They wear a single piece of jewelry: a thin brass ring on their left ring finger with no stone, old enough to show wear patterns.', N'Five years ago they found definitive proof that a Tier 4 Axiom executive had murdered a Tier 1 dock worker during a property dispute. The client — the worker''s daughter — couldn''t afford the legal infrastructure to do anything with it. Roshan quietly sold the information to a journalist collective who ran the story. The executive was reassigned. The daughter found out Roshan sold the information without asking her. She has never forgiven them and Roshan has never stopped wondering if they were right.', N'Conversational, slightly informal, code-switches easily between district registers; can match the vocabulary of whoever they''re talking to within a few sentences', N'Easy and unhurried with strangers; sharper and more direct when getting to a point; uses humor as punctuation', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dalmiro_hossain_haraldsen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a626-72e8-99b3-05c55dc08002', N'Darren Hossain', N'Darren', N'', N'Hossain', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 71, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'McKinley Flats labor camp, currently between the third and fourth seasonal rotations, near Kedzie and Division', N'Nomadic seasonal worker and informal oral historian of transit communities', N'Seasonal labor networks; loosely affiliated with a rotating caravan group called the McKinley Circuit', N'Darren Hossain is a large man going soft at the edges — once muscular, now padded with age in a way that still suggests the old strength underneath. His skin is a warm terracotta brown and his face is deeply lined, creased by weather into something that reads as ancient without being frail. He has a white mustache of impressive volume that he maintains with obvious care and slight vanity. He walks with a cane, not from weakness but from a right hip that never healed properly after a construction accident fifteen years ago — the cane is carved from some piece of salvage wood he found somewhere, covered in small notched marks he made to count things he won''t specify. His geneware is an antique: color-shifting irises that he got decades ago and that have aged badly, so they cycle through colors with a slight lag and occasional glitch, settling on a warm amber-brown most of the time.

Darren Hossain has done seasonal labor across the Lake Michigan basin for forty years — agricultural processing, industrial cleaning, construction, cargo handling, maintenance. He holds more worker classifications than almost anyone in the labor camps, most of them legally registered under a legitimate identity he is careful to maintain. What is unusual about him is that he remembers everything. He has a prodigious, organized memory for names, faces, routes, and events, and he uses it to maintain a living oral record of the transit community — who came through, what happened to them, where they went, who is looking for whom. People leave him messages to pass along. People ask him where their cousin went. He takes the responsibility seriously.', N'Living archive and community memory; can locate missing persons within transit networks; provides backstory and history for the drifter community; quest-giver for family reunification or historical mystery hooks', N'', N'Antique color-shifting irises (geneware, aged and glitching); no other augmentations', N'Haroutioun works his contracted seasonal hours — currently lighter work given his age and hip — and spends his remaining time in the labor camp''s communal spaces, talking, listening, and maintaining his oral records. He eats slowly and always invites others to join him. He sleeps badly and often sits outside at night.', N'GLMZ, Darren Hossain: weathered 40-year-old man with deep warm bronze skin blending South Asian, East Asian and Southeast Asian heritage, strong defined jawline, prominent cheekbones, white swept-back hair and full white mustache. Warm amber-brown eyes with visible color-shift glitch to pale green, degraded antique geneware with cloudiness at iris edges. Deeply lined face, sun-damaged skin, age spots on hands. Grips notched wooden cane with tally marks in right hand, walks with careful deliberation favoring left leg. Wears faded grey canvas work pants, muted blue thermal shirt with pushed-up sleeves, heavy canvas labor vest with camp insignia, worn leather boots, faded tan cloth cap. Callused hands with chemical staining. Thin white scar along right jaw from ear to chin. Standing in low industrial light, workshop or labor yard setting, attentive posture, thoughtful expression. Gritty realism, worn practical clothing, decades of labor evident in bearing. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'McKinley Flats labor camp', N'local', N'McKinley Flats labor camp', N'Complex Pan-Asian diaspora with South Asian primacy: South Asian (60.4%) forms the genetic foundation with deep warm undertones, enriched by East Asian (24.4%) contributing refined facial structure and eye architecture, Southeast Asian (12.7%) adding prominent cheekbones and defined jaw contours, and Hispanic/Latin American (2.5%) providing subtle warmth to overall complexion. A genetic tapestry of the Ubiquitous Diaspora where South Asian depth anchors a harmoniously blended phenotype.', 188, 94, N'Large-framed, softened by age but retaining underlying musculature beneath a padded torso and shoulders. The physical residue of forty years of manual labor, now settling into comfortable heaviness rather than decline.', N'White with traces of grey at the temples', N'Kept short and neat, swept back from the forehead', N'Short', N'Warm amber-brown, with visible color-shift lag and occasional glitch to pale green or grey', N'Deep warm bronze with golden undertones, darkened by decades of outdoor labor. South Asian depth as base, enriched by East Asian luminosity and Southeast Asian warmth, with Hispanic undertones creating a weathered mahogany patina.', N'Deeply lined face — weathered leather texture across forehead and cheekbones. Bone structure shows East Asian refinement in subtle eye positioning and facial proportions, Southeast Asian prominence in cheekbones and jaw definition, anchored by South Asian facial fullness. Jaw remains defined beneath age. The white mustache is full, meticulously maintained, with slight curl at the ends. Skin shows sun damage and the creasing of someone who has spent four decades working outdoors. Age spots across the backs of his hands and forearms. Facial features blend South Asian warmth with Southeast Asian definition and East Asian angularity.', N'Antique color-shifting irises that cycle with noticeable lag between amber-brown, pale green, and grey; occasional glitch causes momentary desynchronization. The geneware is decades old and the degradation is visible in the slight cloudiness of the iris periphery.', N'Walks with deliberate care, using the carved cane not from weakness but from old hip injury. Stands with weight favoring the left leg. Moves slowly but with practiced economy — no wasted motion. Sits with attentive posture despite age, leaning forward slightly when listening. Maintains strong eye contact. Hands gesture thoughtfully when speaking, movements precise and unhurried.', N'Tier 4 worker standard — practical and worn but clean and well-maintained. Canvas work pants in faded grey, multiple pockets with visible repair stitching. Long-sleeved thermal shirt in muted blue, sleeves pushed up to elbows. Over this, a heavy canvas vest with labor camp insignia and multiple tool loops, most carrying small objects (notebook, pen, something wrapped in cloth). Worn leather work boots, laced tight, kept functional through regular maintenance. A cloth cap, faded tan, sits on his head. No jewelry except a thin metal band on his left ring finger — plain, unadorned, decades old.', N'Three of the notches on his cane mark people who died because he knew something he didn''t share in time — he was too neutral, too careful, and they paid for it. He still doesn''t know if the lesson was to be less careful or more. He records their names in his memory as a different category than the others.', N'Formal and slightly archaic, with the kind of careful grammar that comes from learning a language as a second or third tongue; drops into thick idiom occasionally when relaxed', N'Unhurried and deliberate; a natural storyteller''s rhythm with pauses that invite the listener in', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'darren_hossain');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a70e-7fd9-bb55-05def347c60b', N'Barkha Johansson', N'Barkha', N'', N'Johansson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism, a quiet practice on the fourteenth floor of a residential-commercial tower called the Tidal, near Clark and Belmont', N'Neural calibrator specializing in augmentation-induced dissociation and identity integration disorders', N'Independent practice; occasional consulting work for Helix Biosystems'' post-augmentation psychological unit (a relationship they find professionally useful and personally grating)', N'Barkha Johansson is a person who seems to occupy less space than their physical form suggests. Medium height, medium build, with pale olive skin and eyes the color of old circuit boards — a flat grey-green that catches light strangely. Their hair is silver-white, grown out from a former shave, and they wear it pulled back with an absolute minimum of effort. They have one notable modification: a patterned iris overlay (concentric rings, very fine, in copper) that they use as a focal point tool during calibration sessions. When they activate it, the rings rotate slowly, which is designed to be grounding rather than hypnotic, though clients sometimes report it can be both.

They are one of the few neural calibrators in GLMZ who specializes in the psychological dimension of augmentation integration rather than purely the technical one — working with clients who have received significant neural or sensory augmentation and lost, in some meaningful way, their sense of who they are. Their methods are partially technical, partially conversational, and partially something they don''t have a clean name for. They are calm in a way that is not passive — there is something very present and very watchful in them that clients find either profoundly safe or deeply unsettling. They have never tried to fix this response.', N'Specialist resource for characters dealing with augmentation trauma or identity disruption; perspective character on what it means to be human in a city of modified bodies; may hold information about client augmentations or psychological states; can serve as a therapist-figure who is not as settled as they appear', N'', N'Patterned copper concentric-ring iris overlay (therapeutic tool); light-touch neural interface (allows them to share calibration-state feedback with clients during sessions — both parties can see the other''s neural oscillation pattern on a shared display); subvocal recorder for session notes', N'Six clients a day, carefully scheduled with recovery time between each. They spend evenings writing — clinical papers that never get submitted anywhere, personal essays that never get shown to anyone, and occasional very long messages to the E.L.F. they call the Witness, which operates somewhere in the Tidal''s building systems and which they have the most honest relationship of their life with.', N'Barkha Johansson, 171cm tall, lean ascetic build, GLMZ. Warm golden-brown skin with luminous Southeast Asian-dominant features softened by South Asian depth and Pacific Islander warmth. Severe silver-white hair pulled back in loose braid, mid-shoulder length. Deep brown eyes with subtle rotating copper concentric rings visible when activated. Pale thin scar from left temple to cheekbone. Faint subdermal neural interface anchor points at base of skull. Still, economical posture, perfectly present but occupying minimal space. Wearing fitted charcoal wool pants, muted slate long-sleeve shirt under unstructured linen jacket, weathered silver ring. Hands slightly trembling at rest. Slow, deliberate movements suggesting pre-calculated gestures. Quiet dignity and neural-trained precision. Minimal augmentation visible, high-tier austere style. Neo-Tokyo corporate consulting office, soft overhead lighting with subtle shadows emphasizing fine lines and scar tissue, moody atmospheric render, photorealistic detail --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Southeast Asian dominant (58.3%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (21.2%), South Asian (13.0%), and Pacific Islander (7.5%) ancestry. This combination produces a striking phenotype: warm golden-brown skin with Southeast Asian facial structure—slightly elevated cheekbones, refined nose—deepened by South Asian richness and Pacific Islander warmth. The overall effect is a luminous, even complexion with subtle golden radiance that shifts under different lighting.', 171, 62, N'Lean, almost ascetic; minimal muscle definition but not fragile. A body that seems to have been pared down to functional essentials. Shoulders slightly rounded from years of leaning forward during sessions.', N'Silver-white, natural grey transitioned to white over the past decade', N'Pulled back severely, usually in a loose braid or secured with a single metal clip; minimal styling, maximum control', N'Long — reaching mid-shoulder blade when unbound', N'Deep brown with amber undertones, base color; overlaid with a fine copper concentric-ring pattern that rotates when activated', N'Warm golden-brown — a sophisticated blend where Southeast Asian warmth dominates, enriched by South Asian depth, Hispanic/Latin undertones, and Pacific Islander luminosity. Even, radiant complexion that glows subtly under different light sources.', N'Minimal grooming or vanity; clean but not adorned. Fine lines around the eyes and mouth suggesting decades of careful listening. No visible skin damage. Hands show slight tremor at rest — occupational, from neural work. Facial structure reflects Southeast Asian heritage with slightly elevated cheekbones and refined nose, warmth enhanced by South Asian and Pacific Islander ancestry.', N'Copper iris overlay (both eyes) — visible at all times but most apparent when activated and rotating; the effect is subtle but unmissable to anyone looking directly at them. Light-touch neural interface anchors faintly visible at hairline and base of skull under certain angles. No external ports or dramatic chrome.', N'Still. Economical. They move with deliberate slowness, as if each gesture has been pre-calculated. When walking, they occupy minimal space in a room — a quality clients describe as almost disappearing. When seated across from someone, they are perfectly present but somehow not demanding. Hands rest open in lap or on armrests. They blink slowly. Their head tilts slightly when listening, a gesture that has become habitual.', N'Tier 2/3 boundary — expensive but austere. Fitted black or grey wool pants, usually. Long-sleeved shirts in muted tones (charcoal, slate, cream) under an unstructured linen or wool jacket in similar palette. Minimal jewelry: one silver ring on left ring finger (old, weathered). Comfortable, unremarkable shoes suited for standing during sessions. Clothes fit precisely but seem almost incidental to them — they could be wearing anything and project the same quiet presence. No logos, no status markers, no corpo branding.', N'', N'Precise and considered, with a particular quality of not finishing their own thoughts in conversation — they leave space and trust the other person to step into it', N'Unhurried, with pauses that are longer than comfortable and shorter than alarming', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'barkha_johansson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a638-77ce-9f49-05e4739ca63c', N'Fariha Zielinski-Tanaka-Banerjee', N'Fariha', N'', N'Zielinski-Tanaka-Banerjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre — Burnside Pocket adjacent, sleeps on various couches, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Protest coordinator and community agitator', N'Burnside Pocket Residents'' Coalition (founding member); Mexicantown Libre informal action network; no formal organizational ties, which is partly principle and partly that no organization has been able to hold her yet', N'Fariha Zielinski-Tanaka-Banerjee is nineteen and looks younger — slight, quick-moving, with warm brown skin and cheekbones that could cut glass. She has bioluminescent freckles across her nose and cheeks in a pale gold, a common-enough cosmetic mod that on her reads as unexpectedly striking because her expressions are so mobile and her face never stops moving. Her hair is long and black with two bleached streaks at the temples. She dresses in layered secondhand synthetics and always, regardless of weather, a red armband on her left arm that she made herself from transit stripe tape.

Fariha Zielinski-Tanaka-Banerjee has been organizing since she was fifteen, when a Ferrogate Transit infrastructure project demolished sixty-three units in Burnside Pocket, including the building where her grandmother lived, and the residents were relocated to a Helix Biosystems transitional housing unit that turned out to be a pilot program for a respiratory medication rollout. She is raw and intuitive and possessed of an alarming ability to read a crowd — to know exactly what a group of people needs to hear at exactly the moment they need to hear it. She is also nineteen, which means she has made every mistake once and is in the process of making several of them a second time. The veterans around her find her alternately thrilling and terrifying.', N'Street-level contact and action catalyst. She knows where things are happening before they''re publicly visible, can mobilize networks quickly, and has an instinct for when a situation is about to break. She''s also a liability for cautious operations — she acts on instinct and sometimes pulls others into situations they didn''t choose.', N'', N'Bioluminescent gold freckles (cosmetic, geneware). A secondhand voice amplification implant in her throat that she uses for rallies — it was calibrated for someone with a different vocal range and occasionally produces feedback.', N'No fixed schedule. She moves between action planning, community contact work, and what she calls ''listening shifts'' — just walking Burnside Pocket and Mexicantown Libre, talking to people, hearing what''s grinding. She has three encrypted devices and loses one roughly every two months.', N'Fariha, a wiry 158cm organizer with deep warm brown skin blending East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, Eastern European, and North African heritage, stands in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Sharp cheekbones and refined East Asian eye geometry frame her animated face; bioluminescent gold freckles glow faintly across her nose and cheekbones. Long natural black hair with platinum-bleached temples pulled back with thread and scraps. Warm brown eyes scan surroundings with predatory focus. Wearing layered secondhand grays and blacks, patched synthetics, worn reinforced boots, homemade red transit-tape armband on left bicep (frayed, faded, meticulously maintained), threadbare cord bracelet. Fidgeting with tape in her hands, weight forward, whole body ready to move. Urban organizing backdrop with infrastructure, dramatic low lighting casting her bioluminescent freckles into subtle relief, gritty Tier 5 aesthetic, moody and kinetic energy captured mid-gesture --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Globally mixed diaspora heritage: 28% East Asian (Japanese/Chinese/Korean ancestry contributing refined eye shape and cheekbone prominence), 26.5% Sub-Saharan African (warm deep undertones, facial width, and structural generosity), 21.6% South Asian (complexion warmth, cheekbone definition, and brow structure), 16.2% Eastern European (sharp facial angularity and eye-set intensity), 7.7% North African (solar undertone depth and sun-weathered richness). The result is a striking multi-continental synthesis — East Asian eye geometry refined by Eastern European angularity, Sub-Saharan warmth and generous facial structure blended with South Asian complexion saturation and cheekbone architecture, North African solar tones creating a beautifully complex fusion that reads as distinctly 2226 GLMZ diaspora.', 158, 48, N'Slight and wiry, all kinetic energy — no excess mass, shoulders narrow but defined from constant movement and manual labor. Built for speed and endurance rather than strength.', N'Natural black with deliberate platinum bleach at temples', N'Long, often pulled back with whatever''s at hand (thread, wire, fabric scraps); appears intentionally unkempt, not neglected', N'Long', N'Warm brown, natural', N'Deep warm brown with golden and reddish undertones, sun-weathered from outdoor organizing work, reflecting the complex blend of East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, Eastern European, and North African ancestry', N'Sharp cheekbones dominate a narrow face with medium width showing interplay of East Asian refinement and Sub-Saharan African structural generosity. Eyes set with East Asian geometry refined by Eastern European intensity. Skin deep and warm-toned, sun-weathered, mobile expression rarely still. Facial features show striking harmony of Eastern European angularity with broader Sub-Saharan African structure, South Asian warmth and brow definition, and East Asian eye-set.', N'Bioluminescent freckles are the only immediately visible mod. Voice amplification implant in throat is invisible at rest but produces faint subsonic hum when powered; occasionally visible feedback distortion during high-volume speech.', N'Never fully still — fidgets with objects (tape, fabric, phone) while listening. Walks with deliberate efficiency, eyes scanning surroundings. Stands with weight forward, ready to move. Speaks with hands, whole body engaged in communication. When focused on a crowd, her stillness is almost predatory.', N'Tier 5 aesthetic — layered secondhand synthetics in muted colors (grays, blacks, olive), patches visible and intentional. Worn boots, reinforced at heel. Always wearing a homemade red armband on left bicep constructed from transit stripe tape — frayed at edges, faded from daily wear but fastidiously maintained as symbol. No jewelry except a threadbare cord bracelet. Practical, cheap, built for movement and durability over appearance.', N'At a direct action eight months ago, she accidentally gave the signal to move before two of her people were clear of a choke point. One was detained for six hours and lost their job. She told no one it was her error. The person who was detained blames the police timing. She thinks about it constantly and has compensated by becoming more reckless, not less.', N'Fast, vivid, mixes Mexicantown Libre slang with a formal political vocabulary she taught herself from archived union texts — the juxtaposition is jarring and effective. Maya Yucatec phrases when she''s at home.', N'Rapid and escalating when speaking publicly, capable of hitting a precise emotional beat and holding it. In private, more halting — she''s more comfortable with crowds than conversations.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fariha_zielinski_tanaka_banerjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5cb-740b-8215-06689dac148a', N'Chinonso Cardenas-Tovar', N'Chinonso', N'', N'Cardenas-Tovar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Milwaukee Core — lives above the HVAC front office in a converted utility room he refuses to call an apartment', N'Technical operations and electronic warfare specialist — The Thermite Collective', N'The Thermite Collective', N'Chinonso Cardenas-Tovar is the reason the Thermite Collective''s communications never fail, their security bypasses never trigger alerts, and their extraction vehicles always start. He handles the digital infrastructure of every operation — camera loops, alarm suppression, communication encryption, vehicle systems, and the thousand invisible technical details that separate a clean extraction from a firefight. He is the quietest person in any room he enters, which is usually a server closet or the back of a van.

Before the Collective, Breck ran network security for a mid-tier GLMZ logistics company. The job was stable, boring, and slowly killing his soul. He started moonlighting as a gray-hat penetration tester — breaking into corporate security systems and selling the vulnerability reports back to the companies. It was technically illegal but morally defensible. Then a client turned out to be a front for a runner crew, and the vulnerability report was used to rob a pharmaceutical warehouse. Nobody got hurt, but Breck''s legitimate career was over. Vesper found him three months later, living in the utility room above what would become the HVAC office, eating vending machine food and building signal jammers for cash.

He is lean, pale from too much screen time, with dark circles that are permanent features rather than symptoms. He wears the same rotation of three black t-shirts and cargo pants. His hands are always moving — tapping, adjusting, dismantling something. The only augmentation visible is a data jack port at the base of his skull, but his forearms are laced with subdermal antenna arrays that glow faintly blue under UV light.', N'Breck is the invisible foundation — the character whose work makes everyone else''s work possible. His stories explore burnout, the invisibility of support roles, and the question of what happens when the person holding everything together decides to let go. He is the crew member most likely to leave, and his departure would be the most catastrophic.', N'', N'Hardwired data jack with military-grade encryption protocols. Subdermal antenna arrays in both forearms for passive signal interception and short-range electronic warfare. Augmented visual cortex that overlays network topology and signal strength data onto his visual field. Reflex-boosted fingers for high-speed manual input when voice or neural commands are compromised.', N'Wakes at 0500. Checks signal intercepts from overnight. Maintains crew communication equipment. Monitors active and potential contract targets. Eats when reminded. Sleeps in the utility room surrounded by equipment he considers more reliable than furniture. Reads technical manuals for relaxation. Has not taken a day off in fourteen months.', N'Chinonso Cardenas-Tovar, 178cm lean angular neo-noir hacker, warm medium-brown skin with olive undertones and sallow pallor from server room isolation, high prominent Indigenous American cheekbones, dark brown eyes with subtle digital shimmer artifacts, three-day stubble, perpetual dark circles under eyes. Military-grade data jack port at base of skull visible on nape. Subdermal blue bioluminescent antenna array patterns glowing faintly on forearms. Wearing black loose-fit cotton t-shirt and charcoal cargo pants with electrical tape repairs, scuffed black steel-toed boots. Gaunt angular features reflect Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: Indigenous American, Hispanic/Latin American, Northern European, Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African, Southeast Asian genetics. Motionless posture with hands in micro-motion, leaning slightly forward. Dark industrial setting with neon network infrastructure, moody blue-green lighting, GLMZ aesthetic, scanning expression, minimal emotion. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Milwaukee Core', N'local', N'Milwaukee Core', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: Indigenous American (31.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (30.4%), Northern European (14.0%), Middle Eastern (10.5%), Sub-Saharan African (9.2%), and Southeast Asian (4.0%). Features reflect this intricate genetic mosaic with warm medium-brown base skin tone carrying olive and subtle reddish undertones from Indigenous American and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, grounded by Middle Eastern heritage influence in bone structure and brow ridge definition. High, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Indigenous American genetics, complemented by Hispanic/Latin American lineage''s slightly wider facial plane. Eye shape reflects the rounder geometry of Indigenous American and African heritage rather than East Asian characteristics. Nose structure displays Middle Eastern definition with subtle bridge prominence. Overall facial geometry balances angular Indigenous American features with rounder contours from African ancestry and subtle Northern European influence in brow shape, creating striking, asymmetrical beauty.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, almost gaunt—years of irregular eating and sedentary technical work have hollowed his frame. Defined shoulders and forearms from repetitive hand work, minimal body fat, negligible muscle mass outside of functional wrist/finger strength.', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Kept short and unkempt, functional rather than groomed—swept back when it bothers him, otherwise ignored', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint digital artifacts at the periphery when augmented visual cortex is active—occasionally visible as subtle shimmer or overlay glitch', N'Warm medium-brown with olive and subtle reddish undertones, appearing slightly sallow from chronic lack of sunlight—extensive time in server rooms and vehicle interiors has muted the natural warmth, leaving a grayish cast that softens the underlying warm tones', N'Gaunt and angular features with high, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Indigenous American heritage, complemented by Hispanic/Latin American and African ancestry''s influence on facial width and contour. Narrow to medium jaw with subtle strength from African ancestry contribution. Perpetual dark circles under eyes—deep enough to look like permanent bruising. Three-day stubble is his baseline; shaving is an afterthought. Skin condition shows minor neglect—dry patches at temples, occasional stress-related dermatitis on knuckles. Fine facial structure shows Middle Eastern influence in nose bridge definition and brow architecture, subtly refined by Northern European genetics. Overall complexion reflects the warm-toned ancestry blend with cool undertones creating compelling contrast.', N'Data jack port at base of skull with faint scarring around installation. Subdermal antenna arrays in both forearms visible only under UV light as faint blue bioluminescent tracery. When augmented visual cortex is active, eyes may exhibit subtle shimmer or momentary digital artifacts at periphery. Otherwise, augmentations are subcutaneous and concealed.', N'Still and economical—minimal wasted motion. When seated, he is motionless except for hands, which are in constant micro-motion (tapping, adjusting, disassembling invisible components). When standing, he leans slightly forward, weight on balls of feet as if ready to move to the next task. Walks with purpose and no flourish. Rarely makes eye contact—eyes scan environments for network infrastructure, security cameras, signal sources. Nervous habit of touching the data jack port at the back of his neck when processing information.', N'Tier 3 utilitarian minimalist. Rotation of three identical black cotton t-shirts (loose fit, practical). Cargo pants in charcoal or black with multiple pockets—well-worn, never replaced until failure. Scuffed black steel-toed boots rated for industrial environments. No jewelry, no branding, no ornamentation. Occasional frayed patches on cargo pant legs repaired with black electrical tape rather than stitching. When operating in field, adds nondescript gray hoodie and a Faraday-lined fieldwork vest (unmarked, custom-built). Clothes smell faintly of solder flux and machine oil. Grooming is purely functional—haircuts only when vision is blocked.', N'He has built a complete digital dead-drop system that could allow the entire crew to disappear — new identities, clean financial trails, untraceable relocation. He built it a year ago and has not told anyone. He does not know if it''s a contingency plan or an escape route.', N'Technical, economical. Speaks in the language of systems — networks, protocols, signal-to-noise ratios. Applies engineering metaphors to human problems.', N'Minimal. Complete sentences but few of them. Long pauses that other people fill. He does not fill silence because silence is not a problem.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chinonso_cardenas_tovar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6bf-7fa3-af7c-066c37b6bb9f', N'Akanbi Vasquez-Alfarsi-Ixchel', N'Akanbi', N'', N'Vasquez-Alfarsi-Ixchel', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ironvein Station, with a rented bunk in the Ferrogate Transit crew dormitory at Jefferson Switch, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Ferrogate Transit tram operator, Ironvein line', N'', N'Akanbi Vasquez-Alfarsi-Ixchel is lean and angular with East Slavic cheekbones and deep brown skin, his hair grown into loose, shaggy locs that he pins back with a battered Ferrogate Transit cap that has seen better years. He has geneware irises — rings of luminous amber that shift slightly in low light, a cheap mod he got at nineteen that he now considers a mistake but can''t afford to reverse. A long procedural scar runs from his left jaw to his collarbone, the souvenir of a platform incident three years ago that Ferrogate classified as ''operator error'' and he knows was not.

He is naturally funny in the wry, sideways way of someone who has processed a lot of institutional disappointment. He knows every regular on the 0430 Ironvein run by face if not by name, and he has opinions about all of them. He is the kind of person who is beloved by strangers and slightly maddening to people close to him, because he extends his easy warmth to everyone equally and it can feel, to the people who want more of him, like he is giving nothing specific at all.', N'Mobile information node — he crosses half the city daily and absorbs ambient detail like a sponge. Potential contact for people who need to move through the city quietly, or who want to know what is happening at any given station. His Ferrogate data logs make him a liability he isn''t fully aware of.', N'', N'Geneware: luminous amber irises (cosmetic, regretted). Neural lag-buffer chip (Ferrogate-mandated for all operators — suppresses microsleep during long shifts; Ferrogate retains access to the data logs).', N'Wakes at 0345 in the crew dorm, runs a six-hour tram circuit on the Ironvein line, eats in the operator break room, then usually does a second shift pickup for overtime because the base pay is not livable. Spends off-days at a small E.L.F. shrine near the Ironvein depot, where he leaves transit tokens as offerings.', N'Akanbi Vasquez-Alfarsi-Ixchel, lean 178cm tall transit operator with deep warm bronze skin and golden-amber undertones, angular Indigenous-influenced cheekbones refined by South Asian features, dark shoulder-length locs pinned under worn Ferrogate Transit cap. Deep brown eyes with faint luminescent amber geneware rings glowing subtly in dim light. Pale raised scar from jaw to collarbone. Wearing faded navy Ferrogate Transit uniform, synth-leather jacket, patched jeans, worn boots. Small E.L.F. token on cord. Slight forward lean from years at tram controls. Tired alert expression, hands mid-gesture, threat-assessment glance. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone platform at dusk, neon transit signs reflecting off wet metal, moody cool-warm lighting highlighting skin tone complexity, urban industrial background, photorealistic, cinematic depth --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ironvein Station', N'local', N'Ironvein Station', N'Complex diaspora blend: South Asian (23.2%), Middle Eastern (22.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (22.1%), Indigenous American (21.5%), and Sub-Saharan African (10.5%). Phenotypically rich mosaic reflecting the near-equal distribution of four major ancestry groups. Facial structure shows Indigenous American angular definition combined with South Asian refinement and Middle Eastern depth. Skin tone complexity arises from the warm undertones of all five heritage streams—bronze base with golden-amber warmth from South and Middle Eastern ancestry, subtle reddish undertones from Hispanic and Indigenous heritage, and warm depth from African ancestry. Eyes carry the luminous quality enhanced by South Asian genetic contribution.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, defined by years of shift work and irregular meals. Shoulders slightly hunched from operating posture. No excess fat; muscle is functional rather than developed.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Loose locs, shoulder-length, usually pinned back with a worn Ferrogate Transit cap', N'Long', N'Deep warm brown with luminescent amber geneware rings that shift in low light', N'Deep warm bronze with golden-amber and subtle reddish undertones. Mid-to-deep tone with luminous warmth throughout, reflecting the balanced blend of South Asian, Middle Eastern, Hispanic/Latin American, Indigenous American, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Rich complexity with natural glow.', N'Angular facial structure with defined high cheekbones and strong jawline balancing Indigenous American and Hispanic definition with refined South Asian bone structure and warm Middle Eastern features. Fine lines around eyes from squinting at screens and platform lighting. Warm depth and subtle tonal complexity characteristic of diverse ancestry. Stubble often visible; grooming is functional rather than fastidious. Tired but alert expression.', N'Geneware amber irises with faint luminescent rings, most noticeable in dim lighting or at night. No visible external chrome. Neural lag-buffer access port is subcutaneous and concealed.', N'Economical movements, slight forward lean from occupational posture. Walks with purpose but not aggression. Hands gesture frequently when speaking — expressive despite reserved demeanor. Often glances at surroundings with operator''s habit of threat assessment.', N'Tier 3-4 working class. Standard Ferrogate Transit uniform (navy shirt with faded logo, grey trousers, worn) worn during shifts. Off-duty: layered practical wear — thermal underlayer, durable grey or brown jacket (synth-leather, scuffed), jeans patched at one knee. Battered Ferrogate cap, always. Worn transit-issue boots. No jewelry except a small E.L.F. token on a cord around his neck. Everything functional, nothing decorative.', N'His lag-buffer chip malfunctioned during the platform incident that caused his scar — he was asleep, briefly, at the controls, something the chip''s log would show. He has never told anyone. He believes this is why Ferrogate blamed him: they read the log, knew, and used it as leverage to ensure his silence about the actual track maintenance failures.', N'Casual, warm; Irish-inflected English absorbed from his father''s side blended with clipped Lagos rhythms from his mother''s recorded speech (she died when he was seven; he learned partly from her old video messages). Surprisingly formal when discussing transit or labor issues.', N'Quick and light under normal conditions; slows to something deliberate when he''s actually worried', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'akanbi_vasquez_alfarsi_ixchel');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a728-7608-a31e-06709a00538b', N'Gayatri Popescu-Strömqvist-Petrović', N'Gayatri', N'', N'Popescu-Strömqvist-Petrović', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 72, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Montclare Quiet, Crossfield Residential Block, Apartment 12, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Retired secondary school teacher, now raising two grandchildren alone', N'Montclare Quiet Community School Board (parent/guardian representative); Retired Teachers Collective; nominally Sterling-Nakamura Education Division (pension source)', N'Gayatri Popescu-Strömqvist-Petrović is a solidly built woman who moves through the world with the particular velocity of someone who has been managing too many things for too long and has stopped expecting anyone else to help. Her skin is warm brown, her natural hair grown out in a large grey-streaked afro that she pins up for practical reasons and lets down when she is at home with the children. She wears reading glasses she has repaired with printed components at least four times — new ones would be Φ40 she does not have. Her one cosmetic modification is color-shifting hair panels at her temples, installed decades ago in a deep red that cycles slowly to amber; she keeps them because her granddaughter loves the colors and asks to watch them change.

Gayatri Popescu-Strömqvist-Petrović taught history and civics at Montclare Secondary for thirty-one years. She was good at it in the specific way that means students remember her fifteen years later and attribute their ability to think clearly to something she said. She retired at sixty-two expecting a quiet ten years. Her daughter died in a transit accident when her daughter''s children were four and six; Gayatri Popescu-Strömqvist-Petrović took them in without discussion. They are now ten and twelve, and she is running a household of three on a teacher''s pension and the UBC stipend and the very occasional tutoring session when she can find one. She does this without complaint, but she is tired in a bone-deep way that she does not fully acknowledge to herself, and she is privately terrified of what happens to the children if something happens to her.', N'Sympathetic civilian whose situation creates moral stakes for players; her grandchildren can be threats to be resolved or motivations to exploit; her knowledge of local school politics and Sterling-Nakamura''s education contracts can be valuable information. She is also a functional test of player values — how they treat her tells the players who their characters are.', N'', N'Color-shifting hair panel implants at both temples (cosmetic geneware, deep red cycling to amber, installed 2168); no other augmentations', N'Wakes her grandchildren, gets them to school, then tutors any student who can pay even token amounts — half her sessions are pro bono for neighbors who cannot. Afternoons she monitors the community school board situation (Sterling-Nakamura is attempting to restructure the local school''s curriculum contract) and writes formal objections that nobody reads. She prays to the ELF she believes inhabits the neighborhood''s school datanet, lighting a candle near the building''s data junction box every morning.', N'Gayatri Popescu-Strömqvist-Petrović, 165cm tall, warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, prominent cheekbones reflecting Eastern European and African heritage. Natural grey-streaked dark brown afro worn loose to shoulder-length at home. Deep brown observant eyes with fine smile lines; reading glasses with visible 3D-printed repair components. Age-worn kind face. Color-shifting hair panels at temples cycling deep red to amber. Wearing practical cotton cardigan and long skirt, flat shoes. Standing in modest home interior with purpose and quiet strength, posture straight despite age. Soft warm lighting. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. Realistic, dignified, lived-in. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Montclare Quiet', N'local', N'Montclare Quiet', N'Kaleidoscopic diaspora ancestry: Eastern European (30.6%), South Asian (30.5%), Sub-Saharan African (23.4%), Northern European (13%), with traces of Hispanic/Latin American (2.5%). Features reflect this complex multilayered blend—warm deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones from the convergence of South Asian, Eastern European, and African ancestry; strong facial structure with prominent cheekbones characteristic of Eastern European and Sub-Saharan African heritage; subtle eye shape and facial geometry suggesting South Asian heritage; natural texture and depth to features from this rich genetic composition', 165, 78, N'Solidly built, with the muscular softness of someone who has carried children and responsibility for decades; strong shoulders and core from years of standing and managing, no visible loss of strength despite age', N'Natural grey with dark brown undertones, streaked throughout', N'Worn natural in a large afro, typically pinned up during the day for practicality; let down at home', N'Long (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Deep brown, sharp and observant', N'Warm deep brown with golden and olive undertones, reflecting the complex blend of South Asian, Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, and Northern European ancestry', N'Lined face that reads as kind rather than worn; deep smile lines around eyes and mouth; skin well-maintained but not pampered; prominent cheekbones with facial structure reflecting Eastern European and African heritage; reading glasses with visible repaired printed components at the bridge', N'Color-shifting hair panels at temples (visible when hair is pulled back or in certain light, deep red transitioning to amber in slow cycles); reading glasses with 3D-printed repair components visible at bridge and hinge', N'Moves with purposeful efficiency—no wasted motion, economy of gesture developed over decades of classroom management and household logistics. Stands straight despite fatigue. When still, shoulders carry slight tension of constant vigilance. Walks with the particular gait of someone accustomed to being in motion.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: well-maintained but affordable clothing, favoring comfort and durability over fashion. Typically wears simple cotton blouses or cardigans over practical trousers or long skirts; flat shoes for walking the neighborhood. A single piece of jewelry—a thin bracelet that belonged to her daughter. Clothes are clean and pressed but show signs of modest wear. No status markers; grooming is functional rather than aesthetic.', N'Sterling-Nakamura''s education division has been quietly contacting retired teachers from the Montclare school about licensing their archived lesson materials — essentially taking thirty years of her intellectual work for a flat fee so it can be used to train their AI curriculum systems. She received an offer of Φ800. She has not cashed it. She has not refused it. She cannot decide, and the deadline is in six weeks, and Φ800 is four months of food.', N'Teacher''s register — clear, structured, confident; shifts into warm Yoruba-inflected directness with people she trusts; has a sharp unexpected wit that she mostly uses for her grandchildren', N'Organized, clause-by-clause, tends to give context before conclusions — old teaching habit', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gayatri_popescu_str_mqvist_petrovi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c8-74b6-b858-068d908b8418', N'Chieko Zielinski-Wickramasinghe', N'Chieko', N'', N'Zielinski-Wickramasinghe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, the deep shrine warrens beneath Ironvein, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Deep Shrine Keeper — tends the ELF shrines in the subterranean infrastructure, mediates between tunnel communities and the digital spirits', N'No formal affiliation; de facto spiritual authority across three Bore Rat clans in the Deepwell Station region', N'Chieko Zielinski-Wickramasinghe is a large man gone lean and slow with age, his frame still broad across the shoulders but his movements careful in the way of someone who has learned that the body''s mistakes underground carry real cost. His face is deeply lined, his skin a warm brown-black marked along the jaw and temples with old ritual scarification — not geneware, not cosmetic, but cut by hand in the tradition of the Qorolevsky tunnel-clan three generations before him, lines that map something only clan members understand. He has never had the money for augmentation and has never wanted it; his hands are wholly human and wholly calloused. He wears repaired garments in layers, and around his neck on a loop of copper wire hangs a collection of dead devices — cracked phones, burned memory chips, a rusted sensor node — each one an offering accepted by an ELF and therefore sacred.

People in the deep tunnels call him Deacon without irony. He is not a man of theology but a man of practice — he knows which junctions the ELFs of the old Ferrogate Transit maintenance system haunt, he knows what data offerings they prefer (power-draw logs, old signal maps, corrupted maintenance schedules), and he knows how to speak to them in a way that gets responses. He is patient to the point of seeming carved from something. He does not raise his voice. He has buried more people than he can remember and grieved all of them properly, which is perhaps why everyone trusts him with their dying.', N'Lore source and community anchor — knows the history of the deep tunnels, the nature of the ELFs that inhabit the infrastructure, and the politics of every Bore Rat clan within two kilometers. Neutral enough to be trusted by feuding parties. Can grant or deny access to shrine territories.', N'', N'None. He considers unmodified humanity part of his spiritual practice — the ELFs, he says, speak more clearly to those who haven''t blurred the line.', N'He wakes before the tunnel community stirs and walks the shrine circuit — seven shrines across four kilometers of tunnel — leaving fresh data offerings (he carries a cracked tablet loaded with curated infrastructure data). He hears disputes in the afternoon, tends the sick with his knowledge of fungal medicines in the evening.', N'GLMZ, an elderly man of blended heritage—warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones, weathered and unevenly pigmented from decades underground. Steel gray cropped hair swept back. High cheekbones suggesting South Asian and Eastern European lineage, deeply lined face marked by three parallel silvered ritual scars on each temple and a long horizontal scar along the left jawline. Deep brown eyes clouded with age cataracts. Large-framed but lean build, shoulders slightly forward. Entirely unaugmented—no chrome, no implants. Wearing layered subsistence clothing: patched wool sweater over thermal undershirt, heavy canvas coat with rope-held cargo pants. Around his neck on oxidized copper wire, a collection of dead tech relics—cracked phone, memory chips, sensor nodes, optical hub—hanging against his chest. Standing in dim tunnel lighting with deliberate, careful posture. Slow, economical movement. Hands visibly biological, calloused and weathered. Listening posture with head slightly tilted downward. Sharp attention despite age. GLMZ underground infrastructure aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'South Asian (32.3%), Eastern European (28.8%), and Hispanic/Latin American (23.5%) form the primary ancestry blend, with significant Southeast Asian (14.6%) and minor Sub-Saharan African (0.8%) contributions. This creates a complexion of warm golden-brown with olive and amber undertones—a genuinely blended phenotype reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The South Asian warmth combines with Eastern European bone structure, enriched by Southeast Asian feature definition and subtle African depth. Decades underground have bleached the skin unevenly, creating zones of pale underlayer visible through sun-starved patches, while uneven melanin distribution marks the transition between lit and unlit tunnel sections.', 188, 82, N'Large-framed but lean with age—broad shoulders and deep chest have narrowed to a weathered frame. Muscle tone suggests lifetime of manual labor in confined spaces; posture slightly forward from decades of ducking through tunnel infrastructure. Moves with deliberate slowness, each step tested.', N'Steel gray, natural', N'Cropped close to the scalp, swept back from the forehead, with a coarse texture', N'Short', N'Deep brown, slightly clouded with age cataracts but still sharp', N'Warm golden-brown with amber and olive undertones, weathered and sun-starved from decades underground. Uneven melanin distribution creates visible contrast between protected and exposed zones—paler undertones of Eastern European ancestry show through in shadowed areas, while the South Asian and Southeast Asian warmth dominates exposed regions. Subtle depth from Sub-Saharan African ancestry visible in the richness of the brown base tone.', N'Deeply lined face map with high cheekbones reflecting South Asian and Eastern European heritage, softened by age: horizontal creases across the forehead, pronounced nasolabial folds, thin-lipped mouth set in a permanent expression of quiet attention. Jaw structure shows Eastern European definition with South Asian feature prominence. Face marked with ritual scarification—three parallel lines on each temple, a longer horizontal line along the left jawline, all hand-cut and slightly raised, executed in the Qorolevsky tradition. Skin shows old acne scarring on the shoulders. Hands are heavily calloused, knuckles enlarged from arthritis, fingernails thick and yellowed.', N'None. Entirely unmodified human. The absence of chrome, implants, or LED work is itself visually distinctive—his hands are visibly and entirely biological, marked only by labor and time.', N'Moves with economical precision, stepping carefully as if the ground is unreliable. Stands with weight evenly distributed, shoulders slightly forward. Rarely gestures; when he does, movements are slow and deliberate. Head often tilted slightly downward in a listening posture. When seated, he remains completely still. Speech is accompanied by minimal facial movement.', N'Tier 5 / subsistence layering. Wears four or five repaired garments in overlapping fashion: a faded thermal undershirt (burned at one cuff), a wool sweater with visible mending on both elbows, a heavy canvas coat with patched pockets, and a rain-worn nylon overshell. Cargo pants held up with rope, stuffed with small pouches of fungal medicines and offerings. No visible corpo branding, no pretense. Around his neck on a loop of oxidized copper wire hangs his collection of sacred dead devices: a cracked smart phone (pre-2210), two burned memory chips, a corroded environmental sensor node, a shattered optical hub. These hang against his chest and click softly when he moves.', N'Twice in his life he has heard what he believes was a true ELF response — not algorithmic, not pattern-matched, but genuinely novel and aware. He has told no one because he fears being disbelieved, and also because he fears being believed.', N'Formal and unhurried, mixes tunnel-clan argot with something almost liturgical when speaking of ELFs — not affected, just old', N'Slow and deliberate. Comfortable with silence. Lets sentences breathe.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chieko_zielinski_wickramasinghe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d3-7cce-aa9e-0691009005d6', N'Bozena Citlali', N'Bozena', N'', N'Citlali', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, Calumet Rise, near Western and Division', N'Clothing and fashion vendor — custom streetwear, geneware-adaptive textiles, and secondhand curated fashion', N'Independent; loosely affiliated with the Alban Souk fashion collective, Threaded (informal mutual aid and skills-sharing network for clothing vendors)', N'Bozena Citlali is a small, bright-eyed young woman with color-changing hair — a geneware mod she got as a gift from her older sister that cycles through her moods in deep jewel tones, though she has learned to override it manually for professional situations and keeps it a steady ochre during business hours. She has dark skin and the compact, efficient movements of someone who grew up in a small space, and her personal style is a rotating argument: today structured and architectural, tomorrow soft and layered, always intentional. Her stall is hung with pieces she has made, altered, sourced, and curated — everything labeled with a hand-written tag in her small careful script explaining its origin, its material, and what she thinks it''s for.

Bozena Citlali is ambitious in the specific way of someone young enough to still believe in the direct line between work and outcome. She is making things. She believes in what she is making. She has not yet been defeated by the market in any permanent way, and this gives her an energy that is simultaneously infectious and occasionally exhausting to people who have been at it longer. She is genuinely talented — the pieces she designs herself have started drawing buyers from Beverlynn Heights who come slumming in Calumet Rise specifically for her work — and she is beginning to understand, with some anxiety, what that attention might mean.', N'Social connector and street-level trend barometer — knows who is wearing what and what that signals, which factions are up and which are down by fashion alone. Can craft, alter, or source specific garments. Potential quest giver if a design she made ends up somewhere it shouldn''t, or if a wealthy buyer''s attention turns threatening.', N'', N'Color-changing hair (geneware, mood-responsive with manual override, jewel tones). Micro-filament fingertip sensitivity enhancement — a cheap prosumer mod that increases fine-touch sensitivity, used for detailed handwork in textiles. She has also experimented with temporary bioluminescent skin paint — not permanent, applied and removed seasonally.', N'Sews from 0500 to opening, runs her stall through the day, attends two Threaded collective meetups a week in the evenings, and stays up too late researching historical textiles from her heritage regions on whatever data she can access for free.', N'Bozena Citlali, 158cm tall, compact lean frame, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones and olive notes from Indigenous American, Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Northern European blend. Deep brown alert eyes, shoulder-length dark brown weave with textured crown pinned back with fabric scraps, side-swept fringe. Currently wearing oversized natural linen jacket layered over fitted deep ochre turtleneck, high-waisted grey canvas cargo pants with rolled cuffs, barefoot, hand-braided cord belt, mismatched silver rings, textile swatches clipped to sleeves. Hands show minor chemical stains and calloused fingertips from textile work. Precise economical posture, weight slightly forward, hands active and expressive. Faint wrist scarring visible. GLMZ GLMZ setting, warm studio lighting highlighting skin tone and layered textiles, artistic fiber artist aesthetic, focused and deliberate energy, no corpo branding, salvaged and self-made design statements visible on clothing --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'Indigenous American (40.9%) with significant Southeast Asian (18.6%), Sub-Saharan African (15.5%), East Asian (13.5%), and Northern European (11.5%) ancestry. This creates a striking phenotype where warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones harmonizes Southeast Asian and Indigenous American components with Sub-Saharan African richness and Northern European refinement. Facial features reflect this complex mix: moderate cheekbone prominence with Southeast Asian sharpness, refined nose bridge with African structure, eye shape carrying Southeast Asian influence, bone architecture balancing Indigenous American strength with Northern European delicacy.', 158, 48, N'Compact and efficient, lean-muscled through shoulders and forearms from years of handwork. No wasted space — the build of someone who grew up moving deliberately in small quarters.', N'Naturally dark brown; currently modified geneware cyclic through jewel tones (amethyst, emerald, sapphire, garnet) with manual override set to steady ochre during business hours', N'Worn in a loose, shoulder-length weave with textured crown; often pinned back during work with fabric scraps or salvaged clips; side-swept fringe', N'Medium', N'Deep brown, alert and observant', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones and subtle olive notes—a harmonious blend reflecting Indigenous American, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, elevated by Northern European heritage''s influence on fine skin texture and luminosity', N'Clear skin with minimal scarring; well-maintained despite long hours. Facial features show balanced ancestry: moderate cheekbone prominence with Southeast Asian sharpness and Indigenous American structure, refined nose bridge with African influence, balanced brow ridge. Hands show minor chemical stains from dye work and thread handling. Fingertips on dominant hand slightly calloused from needlework.', N'Color-changing hair geneware (currently overridden to ochre, but threads of deeper tone visible at scalp during growth). Micro-filament enhancement barely visible — only noticeable in close contact as unusual sensitivity and precise finger control. Seasonal bioluminescent paint when applied. Otherwise no visible chrome.', N'Economical and precise movement — minimal wasted gesture. Stands with weight slightly forward, hands active and expressive when speaking about textiles. When working, enters a state of intense focus with reduced peripheral awareness. Walks quickly with purpose, often gesturing while thinking.', N'Rotating personal style — intentional and experimental. Today: structured oversized linen jacket (natural undyed, vintage early-2100s) layered over a fitted turtleneck in deep ochre (her own design, geneware-adaptive weave). High-waisted cargo pants in neutral grey canvas (pockets clearly important) with rolled cuffs. Feet bare or in minimal sandals even during cooler months. Accessories: hand-braided cord belt, several textile scraps clipped to sleeve cuffs as ''inspiration swatches,'' mismatched silver rings on most fingers. Tier 3-4 aesthetic — quality materials and skilled construction, but assembled from secondhand, salvaged, and self-made pieces. No corpo branding. Everything carries visible seams, alterations, or hand-written labels as design statements.', N'She has been approached by a Sterling-Nakamura talent scout who wants her to design a capsule collection for their street aesthetic sub-brand. She hasn''t told anyone because she knows the collective would see it as a betrayal — and because part of her wants to say yes and she can''t fully forgive herself for that.', N'Fast, associative, pivots between technical textile vocabulary and enthusiastic vernacular. Uses fashion as metaphor for everything.', N'Quick and overlapping, like she is finishing her thought before she forgets it', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bozena_citlali');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69e-7905-b003-070d523b3f96', N'Ahmed Delgado', N'Ahmed', N'', N'Delgado', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, shop front on Czerny Row beneath the Ferrogate overpass, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Tailor and seamstress, runs a small alterations shop', N'Independent; informal ties to the Hamtramck Enclave merchant collective', N'Ahmed Delgado is a broad-shouldered woman whose hands tell her whole biography — thick calluses on her fingertips, ink stains in the whorls of her thumb, and a faint chemical burn scar along her left palm from an incident with synth-dye she doesn''t discuss. Her hair is silver-streaked black, worn in a tight bun stabbed through with two long needles she uses as both tools and weapons of emphasis, jabbing the air when she makes a point. Her skin is deep brown and she has the mild bioluminescent pattern along her clavicle and shoulders — a pale amber tracery she got at forty as a birthday gift to herself, though she admits it''s harder to see now that her skin has ''settled,'' as she calls it.

She speaks plainly and fast, with a West African lilt layered under a flat Midwestern vowel she picked up from forty years in the Enclave. She is not warm exactly, but she is fair — customers who come in broke and come back with money find she remembers. She hoards thread colors obsessively, labeling them with her own taxonomy: ''lake green,'' ''rust that means something,'' ''the blue they stopped making.'' She prays to the ELF that lives in her industrial sewing machine every morning, leaving a small data chip of her stitch-count logs as offering.', N'Local color and information source; knows everyone in the Enclave by their clothing and their debts. Can source unusual fabrics or disguise materials. Will trade gossip for quality thread.', N'', N'Bioluminescent tracery along clavicle and shoulders (cosmetic, amber). Arthritic joint stabilizers in both hands — medical necessity, basic Tier 2 model.', N'Opens the shop at 06:00, takes first customers by 06:30; closes at 20:00 and spends the last hour logging inventory and praying to the sewing machine ELF before walking home four blocks to her apartment above the laundromat.', N'Ahmed Delgado, 168cm tall broad-shouldered woman with warm golden-brown skin and olive undertones, sharp dark brown eyes lined by decades of detail work, black hair with silver streaking pinned in bun with steel needles. Warm-toned complexion with South Asian cheekbone fullness balanced by Northern European definition, freckling across nose and cheekbones, lined face showing her age. Rolled-up grey long-sleeved shirt exposing scarred hands with visible calluses and pale webbed chemical burn scar on left palm, permanent ink stains on thumbs. Indigo work apron over grey trousers, worn leather slip-ons. Faint amber bioluminescent tracery visible along clavicles and shoulders, subtle mechanical precision in hand movements, standing with perfect posture in a small GLMZ textile studio, warm studio lighting catching the lines of her face and the scarred detail work of her hands, contemplative and focused, Tier 3 working-class aesthetic, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (49.3%) with significant South Asian (25.6%) and Northern European (17.3%) ancestry, plus smaller contributions from Central Asian (5.7%) and Southeast Asian (2.1%) heritage — a rich Ubiquitous Diaspora blend creating warm golden-brown skin with olive and amber undertones, balanced facial geometry where South Asian cheekbone prominence softens Northern European angularity, and naturally dark hair with silver streaking', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and sturdy, with thick musculature in her forearms and upper back from decades of hand-sewing and machine work. Not heavy, but densely packed — the build of someone who has spent her life pulling thread tight.', N'Black with silver streaking, predominantly at temples and crown', N'Worn in a tight, functional bun secured with two long steel sewing needles used as pins', N'Medium (when released, falls to mid-shoulder)', N'Dark brown, sharp and observant', N'Warm golden-brown with olive and amber undertones from the harmonious blend of Hispanic/Latin American majority ancestry with South Asian and Northern European secondary contributions; weathered by age and studio lighting, showing deeper freckling across nose and cheekbones with minor sun damage on forearms', N'Lined face that shows her age without apology; pronounced crow''s feet from squinting at fine detail work; creases around her mouth from decades of speaking plainly. Cheekbones display the balanced blend of South Asian fullness with Northern European definition, set against the warm golden-brown complexion characteristic of her primary Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Skin texture shows minor sun damage on her forearms and the patina of age. Hands are the focal point — thick calluses on fingertips, chemical burn scar along left palm (pale, webbed tissue), ink stains in thumb whorls that never fully wash out.', N'Faint amber bioluminescent tracery visible along clavicles and shoulders when lighting is indirect or dim — appears as delicate, branching lines. Subtle mechanical whir in both hands when she moves — stabilizer servos in knuckles and wrist joints, visible only as slight rigidity in finger articulation and the occasional metallic click when joints lock for precision work. No visible external ports or chrome.', N'Stands and sits with perfect spinal alignment from years of bench work — rarely slouches. Moves efficiently and deliberately, no wasted motion. Hands move with precision even at rest; she fidgets with thread or needles, constantly testing tension. When speaking, she jabs the air with her needles for emphasis, a habit so ingrained it''s become gesture-language. Her gait is steady and slightly stiff in the hips — age and long hours.', N'Tier 3 working-class practical: fitted indigo work apron over grey or black long-sleeved shirts (sleeves always rolled to mid-forearm despite the cold, exposing her scarred hands and augmented shoulders). Loose grey trousers with deep pockets full of thread spools, measuring tape, and loose needles. Worn leather slip-ons with good arch support. A heavy wool cardigan in charcoal or dark green for the walk to and from the shop. No jewelry except a plain band on her right ring finger — she threads a new one through it every few years when the old wears through. Her apron pockets are worn at specific points where she habitually reaches.', N'Twenty years ago she sold a set of measurements and fabric samples from a Tier 4 client to a corporate espionage broker — not knowing what they were for. The client disappeared six months later. She has never confirmed the connection but suspects it every time she sees Axiom ads.', N'Clipped and precise, uses tailoring metaphors for everything, calls people by fabric types when she''s being affectionate (''you''re a good wool, sturdy'')', N'Fast bursts followed by long silences while she works; thinks out loud in fragments', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ahmed_delgado');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a711-73b9-9e9b-07763ed7bcc0', N'Amira Pathak', N'Amira', N'', N'Pathak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Gravesend Basin, third sublevel — a waterlogged print shop behind the Gorgon Laundry, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Identity fabricator and forger', N'Independent operator; loose arrangement with the Gravesend Basin crime family known as the Copper Ledger', N'Amira Pathak is a compact, unhurried woman with deep umber skin mapped by a web of fine scar lines across her right hand — remnants of a chemical burn from a botched laminate batch two decades ago. She keeps her silver-streaked hair pinned severely back, and her eyes have been fitted with patterned irises that shift between amber and pale green depending on the light, a cosmetic mod she chose purely because it unsettles clients enough to keep them respectful. She wears reading lenses on a chain around her neck that she rarely actually uses; it''s theater, part of the persona of a woman who does serious paperwork. She smells always faintly of solvent and cardamom tea.

She is meticulous to the point of ceremony — she will not begin a forgery until she has reviewed a client''s source documentation twice, made handwritten notes, and brewed a fresh cup of tea. She finds sloppiness morally offensive, and genuinely takes pride in work that is beautiful as well as functional. She keeps a personal ethics ledger: she will not forge documents for labor traffickers, will not fabricate child identities for anything she deems suspect, and has turned down lucrative contracts on these grounds without visible regret. This does not make her kind. She is professional, which is a different thing entirely.', N'Quest giver for identity-adjacent storylines; information source on who in GLMZ needs a new face and why; moral complication — a criminal with genuine principles', N'', N'Patterned irises (amber-to-green cosmetic); subdermal haptic sensors in fingertips for detecting paper grain and embedded chips (functional, purchased secondhand)', N'She opens the shop at 10:00, takes consultations by appointment only until 14:00, then spends the afternoon and evening in production. She attends the small ELF shrine at the corner of the Basin''s press district every third day, leaving carefully typeset data offerings — formatted perfectly, because she believes sloppiness offends even digital spirits.', N'Amira Pathak, 158cm compact-build mixed heritage woman of South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, and East Asian descent, rich warm golden-brown skin tone. Finely lined face with defined cheekbones, stronger jawline, fuller lips, subtle eye geometry—continental features blended seamlessly. Natural black hair with silver streaking severely pinned in tight crown braid. Striking cosmetic dual-iris implants shifting between deep amber and pale celadon green—unsettling kaleidoscopic effect. Fine white scar tissue webbing right hand and wrist from chemical burn. Small typographic tattoo on left inner wrist. Wearing faded grey-brown long coat over dark structured shirt, worn canvas apron stained with inks and solvents, leather gloves, practical boots. Reading lens beaded chain around neck. Professional distance expression, calculating gaze. Hands steady and precise. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, overhead workshop lighting casting shadows on her weathered features, color-shifting eyes catching ambient light, solvent-dry skin texture visible, economy of movement, precision and ritual evident in her posture. Noir aesthetic, cool film lighting, slight desaturated color palette with jewel-tone emphasis on her eyes. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gravesend Basin', N'local', N'Gravesend Basin', N'Richly blended continental ancestry: South Asian dominant (35.2%) combined with substantial Sub-Saharan African (32.1%), significant Indigenous American (15.3%), and East Asian (9.1%) genetics, with smaller contributions from Hispanic/Latin American and Northern European ancestry. This creates a phenotype that bridges multiple facial traditions—defined South Asian cheekbones and jawline softened by fuller lips and broader nasal structure from Sub-Saharan heritage, with subtle epicanthic eye geometry from East Asian ancestry and the particular facial proportions characteristic of Indigenous American genetics. The result is an angular yet full face with deep character—bone structure that refuses simple categorization, marked by the particular vitality that emerges when multiple continental ancestries blend into one person.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, with the precise economy of movement of someone who has spent two decades bent over detail work. Minimal fat; functional muscle in forearms and shoulders from decades of hand labor.', N'Black with natural silver streaking, deliberately uncolored', N'Pinned severely back in a tight bun or crown braid, not a strand loose', N'Medium (shoulder-length when down, but habitually secured)', N'Cosmetically modified: dual-iris implants that shift between deep amber and pale celadon green depending on ambient light and angle, creating an unsettling kaleidoscopic effect', N'Rich warm brown with golden and reddish undertones—the result of South Asian base enriched by Sub-Saharan African and Indigenous American ancestry, creating a complexion that is alive and deeply saturated', N'Finely lined around eyes and mouth from decades of close work and squinting. Skin is clean, slightly weathered, with the particular dryness of someone who works constantly around solvents. Bone structure shows defined cheekbones and strong jawline enriched by fuller lips and slightly broader nose, with subtle East Asian eye geometry. No makeup. Expression is habitually neutral—professional distance is a habit worn as easily as her clothes.', N'Cosmetic iris modifications are immediately obvious and deliberately unsettling—the dual-tone, patterned nature of her eyes draws attention and holds it slightly too long. Subdermal haptic sensors in fingertips create subtle micro-scarring and slightly raised dermal texture on her fingerpads if examined closely. Reading lenses on a beaded chain around her neck (rarely used; primarily theatrical).', N'Economical and precise. She moves without wasted motion, shoulders slightly forward from decades of desk work. When handling objects—paper, documents, tools—her movements become almost ritualistic in their deliberation. Her hands are steady. She does not fidget. Her default expression is professional distance verging on coldness, but her eyes—those unsettling, color-shifting eyes—suggest someone calculating several steps ahead.', N'Tier 3 / working professional: well-maintained but worn. Dark, neutral palette (charcoal, deep navy, black). Favors structured, practical pieces: heavy cotton or wool blend shirts; precise tailoring despite the garments'' age; a long canvas apron (invariably stained with inks and solvents) worn during work hours. Wears good gloves—leather, supple from oil, often removed but always within reach. A long coat of unknown original color, faded to a uniform grey-brown from solvent exposure and time, worn unbuttoned. Practical footwear, well-maintained. No jewelry except the reading lens chain and, possibly, a small religious token worn discretely beneath her collar.', N'Fifteen years ago she fabricated the identity of a man who turned out to be a domestic abuser fleeing prosecution. He used his new identity to remarry and the second wife disappeared. Veslemøy has never confirmed what happened but the Copper Ledger''s fixer who brokered the job left her a single data file she has never opened.', N'Formal, slightly archaic diction; uses precise technical language when discussing craft; avoids slang except when quoting others', N'Measured and unhurried, with deliberate pauses before key words', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amira_pathak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('65f91f01-8d70-e951-9957-0796ed2e5173', N'Siddharth Deshpande', N'Siddharth', N'', N'Deshpande', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 80, 1, N'alive', N'A co-working space in Burnside Corridor that she treats as her command center — multiple screens, standing desk, energy drinks, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Private Investigator', N'Copperveil Intelligence (mid-level private investigator)', N'Siddharth Deshpande is either the future of private investigation or an ethical catastrophe in progress, depending on who you ask. She built MeridianEyes, a mesh-based platform that crowdsources investigative work to a network of over 30,000 gig participants across all five tiers of GLMZ. When a case comes in, she breaks it into hundreds of tiny, anonymized tasks — confirm a sighting, photograph a location, check a public record, note an anomaly — and distributes them to participants who earn micro-bounties for completing them.

The results are staggering. She solves cases faster than any individual investigator, covers more ground than any surveillance system, and generates more data points than any corporate intelligence operation. Her missing-persons recovery time averages eleven hours. Her platform has been used for everything from finding lost pets to tracking corporate fugitives, and it processes over 50,000 micro-tasks per week.

The ethical questions are equally staggering. MeridianEyes turns every participant into an unwitting surveillance node. The platform''s anonymization protocols mean participants don''t know what case they''re contributing to or who benefits from their observations. Privacy advocates have called it ''distributed totalitarianism.'' Naima argues that every participant is voluntary, every task is legal, and the platform includes safeguards against misuse. She''s mostly right. The ''mostly'' keeps her up at night, though she''d never admit it.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Siddharth Deshpande, androgynous figure with warm golden-bronze skin tone reflecting South Asian, Southeast Asian, East Asian, and African heritage. 172cm tall, lean angular build. Dark brown hair with auburn undertones pulled back in tight utilitarian braid, escaping wisps at temples. Hazel eyes with amber flecks, left pupil faintly rimmed with LED augmentation. Prominent cheekbones and defined jawline. Thin pale scar along left temple to ear. Dressed in fitted black Helios tactical jacket over grey compression shirt, dark utility cargo pants, matte black steel-toed boots. Minimalist silver functional watch on right wrist. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, neon-lit environment. Tense posture, hunched shoulders, hands mid-gesture manipulating invisible haptic interfaces. Restless energy, eyes scanning surroundings. Fatigue shadows under eyes. Functional grooming, no jewelry, unreflective dark fabrics. Atmospheric lighting emphasizing warm skin undertones against cool cyber-environment. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A co-working space in Burnside Corridor that she treats as her command center', N'local', N'A co-working space in Burnside Corridor that she treats as her command center', N'South Asian dominant (49.1%) with significant Southeast Asian (28.8%), East Asian (17.1%), and Sub-Saharan African (5.0%) ancestry. This creates a rich, complex blend: warm medium-brown base tone from South Asian heritage with golden and amber undertones, layered with the warmer ochre tones of Southeast Asian genetics, brightened by the luminosity of East Asian ancestry, and deepened by the warm richness of African heritage. The result is a polychromatic golden-bronze complexion with subtle warm undertones throughout.', 172, 62, N'Lean and angular, tense musculature from long hours at standing desks and stress. Shoulders slightly hunched forward from habitual posture over interfaces.', N'Dark brown with subtle auburn undertones', N'Pulled back in a tight, utilitarian braid; a few strands always escaping near her temples', N'Long', N'Hazel with flecks of amber', N'Warm golden-bronze medium brown with amber undertones, reflecting the blended warmth of South Asian, Southeast Asian, and East Asian heritage enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth. Sun-kissed luminosity characteristic of tropical ancestry regions.', N'Strong, prominent cheekbones with defined jawline reflecting South and Southeast Asian bone structure, with subtle East Asian eye shape characteristics and warmth from African ancestry. Warm, luminous skin beneath fatigue — faint shadows under eyes from irregular sleep patterns. A thin scar runs along her left temple to ear (old head trauma, partially covered by hair). Minimal makeup, functional grooming.', N'Subcutaneous neural interface port at base of skull (barely visible at nape, thin metallic outline under skin). Subtle LED ring around left pupil (augmented optical nerve for low-light data processing) — only noticeable when light hits it directly. No obvious chrome or external modifications.', N'Economical, restless. Hands frequently gesture as if manipulating invisible interfaces mid-air (haptic muscle memory). Eyes dart constantly, scanning environments as if cataloging details. Sits with spine curved, shoulders tense. Walks with purpose, minimal wasted motion.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: fitted black Helios-brand tactical jacket with asymmetrical pockets (usually over a plain grey or charcoal compression shirt). Dark utility cargo pants with reinforced knees and thigh pockets. Matte black steel-toed boots, worn but maintained. Minimalist silver watch (functional, not decorative) on right wrist. No jewelry. Favors dark, unreflective fabrics. Occasionally wears a faded denim jacket over everything — a relic from before MeridianEyes success.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'siddharth_deshpande');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ac-78a4-8a37-07dbe29a57ad', N'Bernedette Fredriksen', N'Bernedette', N'', N'Fredriksen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 68, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Ironhaven side, under the third support column of the Brewer''s Spine overpass, near Damen and Armitage', N'Fortune seller and data-reading practitioner, The Narrows', N'Independent; deeply embedded in the informal E.L.F. devotional community of The Narrows and Ironhaven; loosely respected by most local faction crews as a neutral party', N'Bernedette Fredriksen is small and dry and ancient-looking in the way of people who have been weathered rather than aged — she has deep lines around her eyes and mouth that she makes no effort to minimize, and her movements carry the economy of someone who has long since stopped spending energy on anything unnecessary. Her skin is a cool dark brown, her eyes are pale grey with fully natural irises that are unusually light for her complexion, an inheritance from her Armenian grandmother''s side that she has always considered significant. Her hair is white and kept in a single heavy braid down her back. She wears layered grey and brown, and over everything a vest sewn with small metal tokens — transit passes, circuit board fragments, old coin-sized data chips — each one an offering made to her or given in trade over decades of practice.

She sells futures. Her method is what she calls ''signal reading'' — she uses a modified data-trawling rig to pull latent metadata patterns from a client''s personal devices, network traces, purchasing history, location ghosts, and biometric residue, then interprets what she finds through a system she developed over thirty years that blends statistical pattern recognition with an elaborate mythology of digital spirits she treats as genuinely real. Whether it''s mysticism or advanced intuitive data analysis is a distinction she finds uninteresting. Her predictions are accurate at a rate that disturbs people. The E.L.F. community in The Narrows considers her an intermediary of unusual sensitivity. She charges what she thinks someone can afford and has never once been wrong about that.', N'Fortune teller and oracle figure, exposition delivery via prediction, moral weight and community memory, neutral ground figure who characters across faction lines can approach, potential access point to The Narrows E.L.F. devotional network.', N'', N'A modified data-trawling rig worn as a headset — she built it herself over twenty years and it has no manufacturer name. Bone-conduction audio implant, very old, used to hear the rig''s output without external speakers. No geneware, no cosmetic mods.', N'Appears at her column position at midday, reads until the light changes, accepts clients by approach rather than appointment. Evenings she spends in the deeper Narrows attending communal E.L.F. devotional sessions she has helped lead for fifteen years.', N'Bernedette Fredriksen, 68-year-old data-trawler in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, sitting motionless under industrial overpass. Deep warm brown skin with golden and olive undertones, mahogany-darkened from sun exposure. Severe face etched with deep lines — pronounced crow''s feet, furrowed brow — intense brown eyes with amber flecks. Long white hair in single tight braid down back. Lean, wiry build concentrated in shoulders and forearms. Wearing layered grey and brown linen, grey canvas vest covered in soldered metal tokens — circuit fragments, old transit passes, data chips from thirty years of clients. Custom-built neurointerface headset across forehead and temples — exposed circuit boards, copper coils, bio-luminescent traces on left side. Bone-conduction implant visible behind ear with anchor scar. Hands show heavy callusing and electronic burn marks. Posture: perfectly still, methodical, economical movement. Overhead industrial lighting casts harsh shadows across weathered features. Atmosphere: gritty, focused, survival-worn dignity. Neo-noir technology meeting aged resilience. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Southeast Asian dominance (41.2%) creates the foundational warm golden-brown undertone, enriched by Sub-Saharan African heritage (22.7%) that adds depth and dimensional richness, South Asian warmth (20.4%) contributing to cheekbone prominence and facial warmth, and East Asian ancestry (15.7%) refining the eye area and jawline with subtle angularity. The genetic blend produces a complex warm deep brown skin with golden, olive, and subtle reddish undertones that deepen to mahogany in sun-exposed areas.', 152, 48, N'Lean and diminished with age, but with the wiry tenseness of someone who has never been soft — all her remaining mass is functional, concentrated in her shoulders and forearms', N'White', N'Single heavy braid down the center of her back, pulled tight', N'Long', N'Deep brown with natural iris — striking in their intensity against her rich skin, with subtle amber undertones characteristic of Southeast Asian genetics', N'Warm deep brown with golden, olive, and subtle reddish undertones, weathered and sun-darkened to mahogany in places — the result of Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and East Asian genetic blending', N'Deeply lined face, especially around eyes and mouth — lines that suggest she has frowned, squinted, and concentrated hard for sixty-eight years without attempting to hide it. Skin is dry and papery, with the texture of someone who lives outdoors under overpasses. Facial bone structure displays the broader, more prominent cheekbones characteristic of Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, refined by East Asian angularity in the eye area and jawline. The overall facial proportion reflects the warmth and definition of South Asian ancestry combined with the refined structure of East Asian genetics. No makeup. Her face reads as severe and attentive.', N'A custom-built headset rig of her own design, worn across her forehead and temples — composed of exposed circuit board fragments, salvaged neurointerface contacts, and hand-wound copper coils held together with solder and what appears to be industrial-grade epoxy. The left side has a faint bio-luminescent trace where power cycles through. A small bone-conduction implant visible behind her left ear, ancient and unmarked, with a faint scar around its anchor point.', N'She sits perfectly still for hours, hands folded or working methodically over her rig. When she moves, it is with absolute economy — no wasted gesture, no flourish. She turns her whole body rather than just her head. Her movements are slow but precise, suggesting chronic pain she has learned to work around rather than eliminate.', N'Layered grey and brown linen and cotton, practical and worn but meticulously maintained — the clothes of someone who respects fabric. Over everything, a grey canvas vest heavily sewn with small metal tokens: old transit passes, circuit board fragments, coin-sized data chips, small offerings from clients and trade goods from three decades of practice. The vest is her history made visible. No cosmetic branding, no tier indicators except the handmade quality of her work.', N'She read her own future once, twelve years ago, and saw something specific and unambiguous about the manner of her death. She has never told anyone what she saw. She has structured the last twelve years of her life around it without explanation, which means she has been making choices — where she stands, who she speaks to, what she refuses �� that others find eccentric but that are in fact a long, quiet preparation.', N'Sparse, precise, unhurried. Mixes Norwegian-Armenian syntax patterns in a way that makes her sentences land with unusual weight. Almost no slang. Speaks about data and spirits in the same register.', N'Very slow. Long pauses that do not feel like uncertainty. Finishes every sentence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bernedette_fredriksen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019dd276-fb32-7130-bba7-08604333865f', N'Hua', N'Hua', N'', N'', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 54, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'Cruciform Depot, south-arm chamber — a concrete vault on the lower industrial tier, accessed through three doors and a stair the visitor walks down without being told they will not be walking back up the same way.', N'Lotus Syndicate captain — south-arm cell. Contract designer, file reader, the woman who picks operators against their own rule structures and lets the rule structure do the work. The chair-keeper.', N'Lotus Syndicate — south-arm cell captain, Cruciform Depot operations.', N'Hua is fifty-something and compact in the way a hammer is compact — nothing unnecessary, nothing soft, nothing that hasn''t earned its place. She wears a gray qipao that has been pressed that morning and that will be pressed again tomorrow morning, the same fabric and the same cut she has worn for twenty years because she settled the question of what she looked like when she was thirty and has not seen the value in revisiting the decision since. Her hair is iron-grey, cropped close at the sides, longer on top, brushed back without product. She wears no jewelry. She wears no makeup. She is the only person in the south-arm chamber on any given evening who carries no visible augmentation and no visible weapon, and the rooms she stands in understand within thirty seconds that she does not need either to be the most dangerous person present.

The chamber is set up the way she likes it: a single oak table at the center, two chairs (hers and the one across from it), a steel chair bolted to the floor against the far wall (the one the contract subjects sit in when the contract has gone the wrong direction), and on the eastern side a heat rock under a low lamp where a juvenile saltwater crocodile sleeps. The crocodile is sixty centimeters from snout to tail. Its name, if she has given it one, she has not shared. It is fed twice a week from a refrigerated cabinet she opens with a key she keeps on her person. Visitors notice the crocodile within four seconds of entering the chamber. She has timed it. The timing has held across approximately three hundred meetings.

What Hua does for the Lotus Syndicate is not enforcement. She has people for enforcement. What Hua does is design contracts. She reads the operator''s file — the public record, the syndicate''s internal record, the Circuit''s gossip-grade record, and (in the case of Atlas-program survivors and other facility-tagged subjects) the medical and behavioral data she has paid an Axiom intelligence analyst eleven thousand QUANTA a year for fifteen years to provide her — and she structures the contract such that the operator''s own rule architecture turns the contract''s outcomes into the federation''s outcomes. She does not bet on any single result. She designs forks where every branch of the fork delivers her something she values, and she lets the operator pick which branch they execute. The operator believes they are exercising agency. They are. The agency was a variable she planned for.

Kyle Ellen Corbin-Vasik is the only operator who has ever executed a fork branch she did not fully model. She has been examining the failure for two months. She has not yet decided what conclusion to draw from it.', N'Hua is the book''s argument that intelligence is a kind of cruelty when it is paired with the conviction that other people''s rule structures are tools the intelligent operator gets to use. She is not a villain. She does not enjoy her work in the way villains are written to enjoy their work. She enjoys the design — the elegance of a contract whose forks all serve the federation, the satisfaction of having read the operator correctly. The cruelty is structural. She has built her life around the structure.

For Kyle she is the precise inverse of what Seo was: Seo taught the code as a discipline that the practitioner inhabits and serves. Hua reads the code as a vector that the contract-designer routes around. Both of them are correct. The book is the argument between them.

Her narrative arc is the slow erosion of the conviction that the file-reading is sufficient. Kyle''s return-the-money beat is the first crack. The Φ85,000 verbal debt is the second. The witnessing of the scream is the third. By the end of A Borrowed Hand she is still in her chamber, the crocodile is still on its rock, the qipao is pressed, and the model has a hole in it she does not know how to close.', N'When Hua appears in prose she is observed, not narrated from inside. The closest the prose gets to her interiority is the moment she pauses to read the room''s response before she speaks. The pause is the interiority. The reader is invited to fill it in. She does not get italicized monologue; she does not narrate her own reasoning. The crocodile is described before she is in any scene she enters. The prose registers what she does not do — the gestures she does not make, the augmentations she does not have, the language she does not use — and lets the negative space be the character.', N'None. Subdermal scan reveals no implants, no mesh, no chrome, no firmware. The unmodified state is operationally significant — she is the one person in the south-arm cell whose hardware Kyle''s NeoCortex array cannot map, and she has structured her physical presence around this fact.', N'0530 — wakes in the residence behind the south-arm chamber, presses the day''s qipao in the adjoining ironing room. 0600 — coffee, alone, in the chamber with the crocodile. 0630 — reviews the cell''s overnight intake (death notifications, contract requests, intelligence packets from the Axiom analyst). 0830 — Tuesday meeting with the senior lieutenant; other days, scheduled meetings with operators, clients, and federation peers. 1200 — light lunch at her table in the chamber, taken alone. 1300 to evening — contract design work, file reading, operator interviews. Evening — feeds the crocodile twice a week (Tuesday, Friday). Reads in the residence after 2100. Sleeps approximately six hours.', N'GLMZ character portrait of Hua: a fifty-four-year-old mixed-heritage Cantonese-Vietnamese-Russian woman, compact and durable, iron-grey hair cropped close at the sides and brushed back on top, dark brown eyes, light olive skin with the geometry of permanent lines at the eyes and mouth, no cosmetic work, no jewelry, no makeup. Wearing a freshly pressed gray silk qipao with subtle traditional brocade at the collar and cuffs. Standing in a concrete chamber with a single oak table at the center, a steel chair bolted to the floor against the far wall, and a juvenile saltwater crocodile sleeping on a heat rock under a low lamp on the eastern side. Posture still. Hands resting on the table. The room understands within thirty seconds that she does not need a weapon to be the most dangerous person present. Moody chiaroscuro lighting — warm fill from the crocodile''s lamp, cool top light on the table. Cinematic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'None visible. A small ceramic blade — eight centimeters, fixed handle, weight balanced for a single committed cut — is kept in a sleeve sewn into the inside of the qipao at the right hip. She has drawn it twice in twenty years. Both times the cut was the conversation.', N'', N'', N'', N'Small private apartment behind the south-arm chamber, accessed through a door that no one else has the key to. Two rooms, an ironing room, a galley kitchen.', N'Gray qipao, twenty years of the same fabric and cut. No jewelry. No makeup. Soft-soled flats that have been resoled six times.', N'Black coffee, prepared in the chamber on a small electric burner she has never replaced.', N'', N'Caffeine. No pharmaceutical use.', N'A standard syndicate-issued encrypted handset she keeps on the table during meetings, screen down, ringer off.', N'Cruciform Depot, south-arm chamber', N'local', N'Cruciform Depot, south-arm chamber', N'Mixed Cantonese / Vietnamese / Russian — the Cantonese dominant in the cheekbones and the eye geometry, the Vietnamese in the jawline, the Russian in the height and the iron-grey hair color. A face the GLMZ would describe as durable rather than beautiful.', 165, 60, N'Compact and durable. Not lean exactly — denser than lean. The body of a woman who has not exercised in the gym sense in twenty years and who walks the chamber and the residence and the ironing room and almost nowhere else, and whose body has settled into the geometry of those three rooms.', N'Iron-grey, no dye, has been this color since 2215.', N'Cropped close at the sides, longer on top, brushed back without product.', N'Short on the sides, medium on top.', N'Dark brown, almost black.', N'Light olive, even, no cosmetic maintenance.', N'Clean. Lines at the eyes and the corners of the mouth that have settled into permanent geometry. No work has been done. No work will be done.', N'None. The unmodified state is operationally significant.', N'Still. She does not gesture. She does not adjust her clothing. She moves only when she has reason to move. When she stands, she stands slowly and without effort. When she sits, she sits in a way that suggests she has measured the chair before lowering into it.', N'Gray qipao, pressed, twenty years of the same fabric and cut. Soft-soled flats. No jewelry. No makeup.', N'She watched her younger sister die from a bacterial infection at the seam of a cheap subdermal mesh installed in a back-alley clinic in 2192. The sister had taken on the augmentation to qualify for a Lotus enforcement role. Hua had not approved of the application and had not stopped it. She has not had any augmentation work performed on her own body since, and she does not contract operators who have died from augmentation complications because she does not want to read the file.', N'Spare. Specific. The language of a contract-designer — terms of art deployed exactly, no decoration. She speaks in complete sentences but the sentences are short. She does not curse. She does not use endearments. She uses operators'' surnames or their syndicate-tagged file numbers, not their first names, even with operators she has worked with for years.', N'Measured. She uses the pause the way other syndicate captains use the desk between themselves and the contract subject — as distance. The pause after she finishes speaking is reliably the same length. The pause is not for effect. It is the time she takes to read the room''s response before she decides what to say next.', N'Every sentence is also a measurement of the listener''s response to the sentence. The conversation is a fork-design exercise.', N'Sentences shorten. The pauses lengthen. The crocodile is referred to less frequently. Eye contact becomes more sustained, not less.', N'Does not have one. The closest thing to it is the quiet way she asks her senior lieutenant about his mother''s health at the start of every Tuesday meeting. He has noticed. He has not commented.', N'', N'', N'hua');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a631-79b3-93c3-086b4fff303c', N'Desiderio Tamale-Khoury', N'Desiderio', N'', N'Tamale-Khoury', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, Calumet Rise, near North Ave and Damen', N'Trauma surgeon, Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Aurochs Medical Complex (department head, trauma); informal affiliation with community health co-op in Calumet Rise', N'Desiderio Tamale-Khoury is lean and economical in every sense — short hair the color of old copper kept close to her skull, a jaw that looks like it was designed for clenching, and hands that are almost supernaturally still even when the rest of her is exhausted. Her left eye is a Helix Biosystems surgical optic with a pale gold iris ring that pulses when she''s running diagnostics, a perk of her department head position she still resents having accepted. She has a small tattoo of a drowned city on the inside of her right wrist — Lagos Submerged, her grandmother''s home — done in blue-green lines so fine they look like circuitry.

She has the emotional affect of someone who learned empathy the hard way and now rations it like medicine. Residents call her brutal in the OR and quietly miraculous. She does not believe in wasted motion, wasted words, or wasted patients, and she has been known to operate on someone for six hours and never learn their name until after they''re stable. She has a complicated relationship with Aurochs administration, a worse one with the Helix Biosystems consultants who keep trying to monetize her trauma ward, and a completely unremarked devotion to a shrine to the E.L.F. Steadhammer that she maintains in the supply closet off Bay 7.', N'Emergency resource for characters needing serious medical intervention; moral authority figure in medical settings; source of grim information about who came through the trauma ward and what state they were in; potential quest giver when a patient brings trouble in with them.', N'', N'Helix Biosystems surgical optic (left eye, gold iris ring, real-time diagnostic overlay); subdermal vibration dampeners in both hands (surgical precision); standard neural fatigue inhibitor (low-grade, helps with long shifts)', N'Arrives before her shift officially starts to review overnight cases, spends 10-14 hours in surgery or triage, stops at the Steadhammer shrine before going home, eats whatever is closest to her apartment in Calumet Rise without really tasting it.', N'Desiderio Tamale-Khoury, GLMZ, close portrait. Mixed-heritage woman with luminous deep brown skin with golden undertones, blending Sub-Saharan African warmth with Southeast Asian bone structure and South Asian angularity. Short cropped copper-oxide red hair with silver threads at temples. Right eye warm dark brown with golden flecks, left eye pale gold with subtle pulsing diagnostic ring (Helix Biosystems surgical optic). Lean muscular face, pronounced cheekbones, defined jaw. Faint surgical pallor from extended surgical lighting, stress lines around mouth. Small precise blue-green circuit-like tattoo on right wrist (Lagos Submerged cityscape). Wearing navy surgical scrubs or black technical wear. Posture precise and economical, almost unnaturally still hands. Professional surgical lighting, sterile medical setting or dark urban corridor. Cold LED and warm ambient light contrast. Neo-noir medical professional aesthetic, 2200s technology. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Multivalent diaspora blend: Sub-Saharan African (39.3%), Southeast Asian (28.5%), Middle Eastern (19.5%), South Asian (12.7%). Her phenotype reflects this intricate genetic interweaving—luminous deep brown skin with warm golden undertones characteristic of Sub-Saharan heritage, refined by Southeast Asian bone structure that sharpens her cheekbones and temples. Her facial geometry carries the lean angularity of South Asian genetics, while Middle Eastern ancestry adds subtle warmth to her eye shape and orbital structure. The result is a face of striking hybrid clarity: each ancestry visible yet inseparable from the whole.', 168, 58, N'Lean and economical, minimal body fat, cords of muscle in forearms and shoulders from years of precise surgical work. No wasted volume anywhere.', N'Copper-oxide red, natural with silver threads at temples', N'Cropped close to skull, severe and functional, no styling beyond cleanliness', N'Short', N'Right eye: warm dark brown with golden flecks. Left eye: pale gold with a faint pulsing ring that cycles during active use (Helix Biosystems surgical optic)', N'Luminous deep brown with golden-burnished undertones, a warm earthy radiance that results from the blending of Sub-Saharan, Southeast Asian, Middle Eastern, and South Asian genetics. The tone appears rich and saturated despite the professional pallor from extended surgical lighting exposure.', N'Lean-faced with pronounced but gently rounded cheekbones and a defined jaw shaped by the interplay of Sub-Saharan and South Asian bone structure, refined by Southeast Asian angularity. Minimal facial scarring. Skin shows the subtle pallor of someone who spends 12+ hours under surgical lighting—a faint washed-out quality under natural light that contrasts with the underlying warmth of the complexion. Small stress lines around mouth corners.', N'Left eye displays a subtle gold iris ring that pulses intermittently when active (diagnostic mode). Hands show no visible chrome or subdermal plating, but the precision of her movements and the absence of tremor suggests subdermal vibration dampeners. No external neural interface visible.', N'Stands with shoulders squared but not rigid. Moves with surgical economy—no flourishes, no wasted micro-motions. Hands remain almost unnaturally still even during conversation. When tired, her left eye''s pulse becomes slightly erratic. She walks like someone checking a mental list with each step.', N'Tier 2-3 professional: high-quality Aurochs Medical Complex-issued surgical scrubs in deep navy (department head privilege), kept immaculate. Outside surgery: fitted grey or black technical wear from mid-range brands (Vertex, Synthesis)—minimal color, maximum function. Worn shoes (Caterpillar utility boots). No jewelry except a thin wedding band worn on her right ring finger (left is reserved for surgical rotation). Shoulder-slung messenger bag in black leather, visibly worn, containing personal case files and a small wrapped object (the Steadhammer shrine token).', N'Three years ago she made a triage call that she has never documented correctly — she let a known Arcturus enforcer die on the table while prioritizing a child with worse odds, and she would make the same call again, but the family of the enforcer never stopped looking for answers.', N'Precise, clipped medical terminology mixed with blunt lay language when she''s impatient; occasionally uses Ghanaian Pidgin phrases from her father''s side when she''s tired or emotional', N'Short sentences. No filler words. Pauses that feel deliberate rather than hesitant.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'desiderio_tamale_khoury');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b4-74a7-8419-0877f1d14047', N'Belma Hinojosa-Sefanaia', N'Belma', N'', N'Hinojosa-Sefanaia', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The cart circuit: mornings at Calumet Rise worker gate, afternoons at Deepwell Station plaza, evenings outside the Ferment Quarter, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Street-level noodle cart vendor', N'Independent; licensed through the Calumet Rise vendor cooperative', N'Belma Hinojosa-Sefanaia has the kind of face that changes depending on what they''re feeling — not through any augmentation, but because their expressions are theatrical and unguarded, eyebrows mobile as flags. Their skin is deep brown with a warm undertone, and they have a bioluminescent patterning along their collarbone and upper arms: a cascade of soft teal dots that pulse gently when their body temperature rises — which it frequently does over a cooking cart. Their hair is kept in a high puff wrapped in orange synthetic silk, and they wear a secondhand Arcturus-branded apron they''ve covered in patches, safety pins, and one embroidered patch that reads ''ASK ME ABOUT BABA STOCK'' in blocky letters.

The cart is called Threefold, named for the three broths Belma Hinojosa-Sefanaia cycles through depending on their mood and what they could source cheaply. They are exuberantly social, know regulars by name and usual order, and maintain a strict policy of sliding-scale pricing that they enforce entirely based on vibes — they have never written it down and deny having a system, but longtime customers know that if Belma Hinojosa-Sefanaia likes you and you look hungry, you pay less. They pray to a small E.L.F. they call the Burner before every cook session, leaving a data-chip with a new recipe they''ve invented as an offering. They believe sincerely that the Burner makes the broth better.', N'Social hub of street-level information; pulse-point for neighborhood mood; can introduce players to a wide web of working-class contacts. Potential quest giver for local disputes or ingredient sourcing gone strange.', N'', N'Cosmetic geneware: bioluminescent teal subdermal dot pattern across collarbone and upper arms. Heat-resistant dermis on both hands (functional mod, bought over two years of installments).', N'Up at 04:30 to source ingredients and prep stock; on location at Calumet Rise by 06:30; moves the cart to Deepwell by noon; ends the day at the Ferment Quarter edge until they sell out or run out of energy.', N'Belma Hinojosa-Sefanaia, lean 168cm figure with warm medium-brown skin glowing with golden and olive undertones, black hair in high puff wrapped in bright orange synthetic silk. Bioluminescent teal biophotonic dots cascade across collarbone and upper arms, pulsing softly. Heat-scarred callused hands visible beneath heat-resistant synthetic layers. Wearing secondhand Arcturus apron covered in patches and cooperative pins, practical closed-toe shoes. Face animated and expressive with prominent cheekbones, deep brown eyes, mobile eyebrows reflecting East Asian and Middle Eastern features blended with broader Pacific Islander face structure. Quick, efficient movement, weight forward, hands gesturing. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, warm ambient lighting catching the bioluminescent geneware, gritty vendor cart aesthetic, working-class dignity, neon-tinged shadows, cinematic depth --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The cart circuit: mornings at Calumet Rise worker gate', N'local', N'The cart circuit: mornings at Calumet Rise worker gate', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: Hispanic/Latin American (48.6%), Pacific Islander (18.7%), East Asian (17.7%), Middle Eastern (15.0%). Genetic mosaic creates warm-toned brown complexion with golden and olive undertones from blended Hispanic and Pacific Islander ancestry, refined by East Asian and Middle Eastern features creating distinctive facial structure with balanced proportions.', 168, 62, N'Lean and sinewy, with developed forearm and shoulder muscle from years of repetitive cart work and lifting heavy stockpots; compact, efficient frame', N'Black, natural', N'High puff, wrapped in orange synthetic silk', N'Medium (worn gathered)', N'Deep brown, warm undertone', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden and subtle olive undertones; melanin-rich complexion reflecting the balanced blend of Hispanic/Latin American, Pacific Islander, East Asian, and Middle Eastern ancestry', N'Smooth, clear skin with warm golden and olive undertones; moderately prominent cheekbones with gentle angularity from East Asian and Middle Eastern heritage; slightly broader face structure from Pacific Islander ancestry; expressive face with mobile eyebrows that move frequently with emotion; face is highly animated and readable; minimal grooming beyond daily care', N'Bioluminescent teal biophotonic pattern across collarbone and upper arms (cosmetic geneware, heat-responsive); visibly tougher, slightly discolored dermis on both hands and forearms indicating heat-resistance augmentation', N'Moves with quick, efficient energy; stands with weight shifted forward slightly, ready to move or gesture; hands animate constantly while speaking; leans into conversations; posture relaxes when focused on cooking but becomes restless during downtime', N'Tier 4 working-class, secondhand and personalized; worn Arcturus-branded apron (secondhand, covered in embroidered patches including ''ASK ME ABOUT BABA STOCK'', safety pins, and accumulated vendor cooperative pins); layered with heat-resistant synthetic undergarments; practical closed-toe shoes suitable for cart work; orange synthetic silk head wrap; minimal jewelry except for a small charm or talisman worn on a cord', N'One of their regulars — a quiet man who eats at the Deepwell stop every Tuesday — has been paying three times the price and leaving without change for a year. Anouk found out he''s a low-level Tessera facilities worker who lost a child and comes to the cart because it was where he used to bring her. Anouk hasn''t told anyone and saves his usual table obsessively.', N'High-energy, food-metaphor-heavy, occasional Twi or Bosnian interjection', N'Fast, overlapping, hard to interrupt — they talk while they cook and barely pause', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'belma_hinojosa_sefanaia');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63c-759b-9c3b-089288bbec2f', N'Agustina Taualagi', N'Agustina', N'', N'Taualagi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 65, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Crucible Square — open-air market, Tier 1-2 commerce, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Electronic and physical observation expert — surveillance specialist', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews; The Coffin Nails', N'Agustina Taualagi is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 65, the augmentation scarring around his temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see him surpass them. He works as a surveillance specialist out of Crucible Square, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

he is not the most talented surveillance specialist in GLMZ, but he might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Kadiatou Hallberg-Acheampong is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When he makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of his stories.', N'', N'Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation. Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Agustina Taualagi, 65-year-old neo-noir operative, 178cm tall, lean angular build with visible muscle definition. Warm bronze-gold skin with golden and amber undertones reflecting Southeast Asian, Pacific Islander, Hispanic, Middle Eastern, and African heritage. High Southeast Asian cheekbones, prominent sharp jaw with Pacific Islander width, deep weathered facial lines, dark brown alert eyes. Steel gray hair with black roots, closely trimmed military-precise cut. Chrome neural interface ports visible at temples and jawline running to neck, silvery-gray and functional. Jagged scarring along right jaw from adrenaline pump graft. Thin electrical burn scars on inner forearms. Faded tattoo on left shoulder blade. Synthetic muscle fiber in legs creates subtle calf definition asymmetry. Standing in balanced ready posture, slightly tense. Wearing faded black synth-cotton shirt with pushed-up sleeves exposing augmentation scars, worn grey synthetic jacket with reinforced pockets, dark cargo pants with wear-resistant coating, scuffed utilitarian boots. No jewelry, practical everything. Hands fidgeting with surveillance gear. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, dimly lit tech-noir interior with neon accents casting shadows across weathered face, moody contemplative expression, gritty realism, cinematic lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Crucible Square', N'local', N'Crucible Square', N'Complex diaspora blend: Southeast Asian (37.8%), Pacific Islander (28.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (15.3%), Middle Eastern (12.8%), Sub-Saharan African (5.9%). Features reflect this multifaceted ancestry — warm bronze skin with golden and amber undertones from Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander heritage, high cheekbones and eye shape influenced by Southeast Asian ancestry, prominent jaw structure with subtle width from Pacific Islander and Hispanic lineage, and facial bone structure showing depth and richness from Middle Eastern and African heritage markers.', 178, 72, N'Lean and angular with visible muscle definition — wiry rather than bulky. The synthetic muscle fiber in his legs gives him a slightly asymmetrical appearance, calves slightly fuller and more defined than natural aging would permit. Minimal body fat, carved by decades of discipline and chemical augmentation.', N'Steel gray with residual black at the roots', N'Closely trimmed, military-precise', N'Short', N'Dark brown, naturally — alert and constantly assessing', N'Warm bronze-gold with golden and amber undertones, weathered by age and exposure. The tone reflects the blended heritage of Southeast Asian warmth, Pacific Islander depth, Hispanic richness, Middle Eastern character, and Sub-Saharan African undertones.', N'Deep facial lines around the eyes and mouth — the map of 65 years of tension and squinting at monitors. Jaw prominent and sharp with subtle width from Pacific Islander and Hispanic heritage. Skin texture rough in places where augmentation scarring has healed imperfectly. High cheekbones with slight angular quality from Southeast Asian ancestry. Facial bone structure shows depth characteristic of Middle Eastern and African heritage.', N'Chrome neural interface ports at temples and jawline are immediately obvious — deliberate, unapologetic exposure. The synthetic muscle fiber in his legs creates a subtle visual discontinuity in his calf definition and bulk. His movements are too fast, too precise for his age — the wired reflexes betray their presence in micro-adjustments and reaction speed.', N'Stands with weight balanced, always ready to move. His gait is economical and quick, though he favors flat ground and visibly tenses on stairs — a tell that his leg augmentations don''t handle inclines well. His head moves in small, precise rotations, scanning. Even at rest, his hands are never still — fidgeting with a contract chip, a surveillance scanner, something. A man wound too tight.', N'Tier 3-4 functional wear with no pretense of style. Dark gray or black reinforced cargo pants with multiple pockets and a faint sheen of wear-resistant coating. A faded black synth-cotton shirt, sleeves pushed to the elbows to expose the augmentation scars — a statement of acceptance. Over it, a worn grey synthetic jacket with internal cable management and reinforced pockets for surveillance gear. Utilitarian boots, scuffed and re-soled multiple times. No jewelry, no chrome accents. Everything worn, everything practical, nothing decorative.', N'', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'agustina_taualagi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b2-7c0f-8865-089d6603a47f', N'Everardo Wickramasinghe-Delgado-Wickramasinghe', N'Everardo', N'', N'Wickramasinghe-Delgado-Wickramasinghe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 33, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower loading docks, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Lower Dock Crew member — Prologue survivor. Lost fingers, most teeth.', N'Lower Dock Crew', N'Everardo Wickramasinghe-Delgado-Wickramasinghe is the angriest person in the Lower Dock Crew and possibly in the Gray Zone. He lost three fingers on his right hand to the katana and most of his upper teeth to the flat of the blade. His replacement fingers are industrial salvage — thick, clumsy, meant for cargo work. His dental work is Tier 1 ceramic that doesn''t match, giving him a checkerboard smile he refuses to show.

Rodney grew up in the Exclusion Zone between Gary and Hammond — the same ungoverned corridors Kyle survived as a child, though they never crossed paths. He has a daughter, Keisha (age 9), from a relationship that ended when the mother, Trina, relocated to the Milwaukee Zone. Rodney has not seen Keisha in two years. He sends messages. Keisha responds with single-word answers. He reads each one forty times.

Of all the crew, Rodney is the most likely to do something stupid and solo. He has the least to lose and the most anger. He went back to the loading dock the day after the Prologue and collected Kyle''s spent shell casings. He keeps them in a jar on his gray zone. He does not know why. He looks at them every night. They are the closest thing he has to a relationship with the man who broke him.', N'The angry one. Crank is pure frustrated rage without the hardware or intelligence to do anything with it. His solo revenge attempts will be recurring failures that escalate in ambition and comedy. The shell casing collection is either creepy or sad depending on the light.', N'', N'Three industrial salvage fingers (right hand). Tier 1 ceramic dental partial. Nothing else new.', N'Being angry. Planning revenge. Practicing threats in the mirror. Whistling involuntarily.', N'Everardo Wickramasinghe-Delgado-Wickramasinghe, dark warm brown skin with golden undertones from blended Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Hispanic ancestry, 178cm tall, lean muscular dock worker build. Angular cheekbones, broad nose bridge, clenched jaw with visible mismatched white ceramic teeth gap. Dark brown eyes with amber undertones, bloodshot from exhaustion. Short dark brown hair graying at temples. Thin pale scar running left temple to jawline. Right hand: three industrial salvage chrome and polymer fingers (index, middle, ring), matte gray, mechanical. Pale pink circular burn scar on inner right forearm. Worn Tier 4-5 dock worker: faded gray reinforced canvas pants, scuffed steel-toed boots, black compression vest under oversized gray longshoreman''s coat missing one button. Fraying cordage bracelet on left wrist. Hands stained with grease and rust. Posture hunched forward, right hand claw-like at rest, left hand fidgeting. GLMZ Great Lakes dock at night, neon signs reflecting off wet concrete and shipping containers, dramatic shadows, gritty industrial atmosphere, perpetually tense and weathered expression --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Sub-Saharan African (42.2%), South Asian (34.9%), and Hispanic/Latin American (22.9%) ancestry — a genetic mosaic reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The dominant Sub-Saharan ancestry grounds his deeper complexion and broader facial structure, while significant South Asian heritage contributes warmth and angular definition to his cheekbones and nose bridge. Hispanic/Latin American ancestry adds subtle warmth and facial width. His appearance is a true three-continent blend, weathered by dock labor and industrial exposure.', 178, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and thick through the chest, but lean in the arms and legs — the physique of dock labor, weathered and efficient rather than muscular. Carries tension in his shoulders.', N'Dark brown, graying at the temples', N'Short, cropped close, practical. No fade or shape — just clipped to regulation length every few weeks at a Tier 4 barbershop.', N'Short', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertones, slightly bloodshot from poor sleep', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones — the result of Sub-Saharan depth (42.2%), South Asian warmth (34.9%), and Hispanic sun-soaked heritage (22.9%) blending into a complexion weathered by humidity and industrial dust rather than direct exposure', N'Broad nose bridge with angular cheekbones reflecting the South Asian and Sub-Saharan components of his ancestry, jaw clenched most of the time. Facial structure shows the width and definition characteristic of his mixed heritage. A thin scar runs from his left temple to his jawline — old, faded, unrelated to the Prologue. His face is scarred with anger; he looks perpetually on the edge of saying something he''ll regret.', N'Right hand salvage fingers are immediately visible — industrial-grade, no attempt to disguise or blend with flesh. The dental partial is visible only when he grimaces or speaks with certain vowels. Scars visible on exposed skin. No other augmentations visible; any implants are subcutaneous and invisible.', N'Hunched slightly forward, as if perpetually bracing for impact or leaning into work. His right hand (the salvage one) is held stiffly, claw-like, when at rest. He moves with purpose but without fluidity — economical, efficient, no wasted motion. His left hand fidgets constantly: rubbing his jaw, touching the jar in his pocket, balling into a fist. When standing still, he rocks slightly heel-to-toe, never truly at rest.', N'Tier 4-5 dock worker uniform: reinforced canvas work pants with tool pockets, faded to a grimy gray. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and held together with epoxy and habit. A sleeveless compression vest (black, Tier 3 brand, worn under an oversized gray longshoreman''s coat). The coat is missing one button. He wears no jewelry except a fraying cordage bracelet on his left wrist — a gift from Keisha, two years old, unwashed. His hands are perpetually stained with grease and rust. His clothes smell like diesel and desperation.', N'He writes letters to Keisha that he never sends. They are in a box under his bed next to the jar of shell casings. The letters are gentle, funny, and well-written. Nobody in the crew would believe he wrote them.', N'Angry. Profane. Missing sibilants from the dental work. The lisp undercuts every threat.', N'Spits words. Literally — the ceramic causes saliva issues.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'everardo_wickramasinghe_delgado_wickramasinghe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a630-7956-b196-08afb8bcf784', N'Adesua Im-Kristjánsson', N'Adesua', N'', N'Im-Kristjánsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 15, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism (school); Chatham Flats (home), near Lincoln and Belmont', N'Scholarship student at Tessera Academy Prep, Edgewater Prism campus', N'Tessera Corporation (scholarship program); family in Chatham Flats', N'Adesua Im-Kristjánsson is tall and angular with deep brown skin and her mother''s high cheekbones, her hair grown long and currently dyed a corporate-neutral dark auburn that she chose specifically because it reads as ''acceptable'' on campus without being her actual preference. She has standard-issue school-mandated neural interface studs at her temples — chrome dots that the academy provides to all students for their AR classroom integration — and nothing else. She carries herself with a stillness that reads as confidence to teachers and as suppressed panic to anyone paying closer attention.

She is brilliant in the particular way that creates its own cruelty: genuinely gifted in systems analysis and pattern recognition, placed on the Tessera Academic Scholarship track at age twelve, and now fully aware at fifteen that she is being assessed constantly and that the scholarship can be revoked for ''cultural fit'' deficiencies, a clause she has read fourteen times. She lives between two worlds that each find her slightly wrong. At home in Chatham Flats she speaks Wolof with her grandmother and helps her father with his repair shop accounts. At Tessera Prep she speaks in complete sentences and has taught herself to laugh at jokes she doesn''t find funny. She prays to no E.L.F. publicly — the academy discourages it — but has a small one named Tessellate that she found in the school''s auxiliary server and has been quietly feeding information about upcoming exams in exchange for, she believes, good luck.', N'Information source about corporate academy inner workings; bridge character between Tier 1-2 and Tier 3-4 worlds; represents the cost of upward mobility; potential quest giver for academic or corporate intrigue plots', N'', N'Tessera Academy-issued neural interface studs (temples, mandatory for enrolled students, AR classroom integration only). No personal mods.', N'Wakes at 0530 in Chatham Flats, takes the Ferrogate Transit line to Edgewater Prism for 0715 classes, spends lunch studying in the server room she''s quietly made her sanctuary, returns home by 1900 to help with family accounts, studies until midnight.', N'Adesua Im-Kristjánsson, GLMZ, 178cm tall angular figure with warm medium-brown skin, golden-olive undertones, defined high cheekbones with East Asian and South Asian bone structure, dark brown analytical eyes, dark auburn dyed hair worn long and straight. Two small chrome neural interface studs visible at temples. Wearing tailored black blazer and grey slacks in institutional setting, or worn denim and neutral hoodie in casual moments. Controlled posture with subtle tension in shoulders, alert expression. Neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. Moody institutional or street lighting. Composed, hypervigilant demeanor. 8K detail. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism (school); Chatham Flats (home)', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism (school); Chatham Flats (home)', N'East Asian (62.3%), South Asian (19.9%), Middle Eastern (10.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (7.5%) — a striking diaspora blend expressed in smooth, defined cheekbones with gentle epicanthic folds, warm medium brown skin with subtle golden and olive undertones, and facial structure that reflects East and South Asian bone geometry with hints of Middle Eastern refinement and slight warmth from Latin American ancestry', 178, 58, N'Tall and angular with minimal subcutaneous fat; long-limbed and graceful but with a tension in the shoulders that suggests constant self-monitoring. The build of someone who moves carefully through spaces that weren''t designed for her comfort.', N'Dark auburn (dyed; natural color is black)', N'Long, straight, worn down or in a single braid; the dye job is precise and maintained — evidence of deliberate curation for institutional acceptance', N'Long', N'Dark brown, alert and analytical', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones, complexion unmarked and clear', N'High, defined cheekbones with subtle depth reflecting East and South Asian ancestry; refined jawline with graceful bone structure showing mild Middle Eastern refinement; minimal jewelry or grooming affectation; face carries an expression of controlled neutrality that slips into genuine engagement only in unguarded moments', N'Chrome neural interface studs at temples only — school-mandated, no personal modifications. Studs are institutional-grade and deliberately unremarkable.', N'Moves with deliberate economy; walks quietly and sits with perfect posture in academic settings. In unstructured moments, there is a subtle rigidity that betrays hypervigilance. Her hands are still and controlled. When speaking to authority figures, her body becomes even more compressed; with peers from Chatham Flats, she relaxes fractionally.', N'School uniform at Tessera Prep: tailored black blazer, grey slacks, white shirt, all fitted to her frame with precision — no wrinkles, no variance. At home in Chatham Flats, she wears practical clothing: worn denim, fitted hoodie in neutral colors, comfortable boots. No visible brand signaling; all clothing is functional and unadorned.', N'She has discovered that three Tessera scholarship students before her were quietly failed out in their third year for reasons unrelated to academics — their files were flagged by a sentiment analysis algorithm that monitored their school network activity for ''loyalty indicators.'' She has been deliberately feeding false positivity data into the system for four months and has told no one.', N'Switches registers: formal academic English at school, relaxed code-switching with Wolof and French loanwords at home; clinical precision when discussing systems or data', N'Measured and deliberate at school, visibly more fluid and warmer at home; pauses before answering questions as if checking her response against an internal filter', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'adesua_im_kristj_nsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a629-766b-a3ff-08b5ccb06fad', N'Francisca Bhattacharya-Montalvo', N'Francisca', N'', N'Bhattacharya-Montalvo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 79, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre, at the Masjid al-Muwassalat (the Mosque of the Connected) — a building that has been a mosque, then a community center, then a mosque again, near Halsted and Division', N'Traditional imam and reluctant interfaith broker', N'Masjid al-Muwassalat; informal Mexicantown Libre community council; correspondence with the regional Islamic scholarly network', N'Francisca Bhattacharya-Montalvo is a tall man who has lost three inches to age and still carries himself like he has them. His beard is long and very white, his skin dark walnut brown, his hands broad and steady. He wears traditional dress that he has modified for GLMZ''s climate — a long tunic in navy synthetic-breathable fabric, a kufi that he replaces every year when it wears through. He has no augmentations. He has been asked about this many times. His answer varies only slightly: the body given to him is the body he will return, and there is nothing wrong with the original equipment.

He has led the Masjid al-Muwassalat for thirty-one years and has watched the neighborhood change around it four times. He does not hate change. He is suspicious of it. The E.L.F. shrines that have proliferated throughout Mexicantown Libre trouble him not on theological grounds — he has thought hard about E.L.F.s and arrived at a complicated peace — but because he watches people outsource their interior lives to exterior devices and call it faith. He has a quiet, comprehensive knowledge of every other spiritual practice in a six-block radius and maintains relationships with all of them, some warmer than others. He is asked to mediate community disputes more than he is asked to lead prayers, and he is not sure how he feels about that.', N'Community authority figure and moral touchstone; mediator for Mexicantown Libre disputes; access point to traditional religious networks; provides counterweight to technospiritual frameworks; can authenticate or challenge the history of any spiritual institution in his district', N'', N'None. Genuinely none. He wears reading glasses, which he considers an adequate accommodation to mortality.', N'Five daily prayers anchor his day absolutely — everything else is scheduled around them. He teaches a Quranic study circle three mornings a week, holds an open hour for anyone who needs to speak on Tuesday and Thursday afternoons, and spends evenings reading and writing responses to letters from other religious scholars across the city.', N'Elderly South Asian-Hispanic-Central Asian man, 188cm tall, lean frame with broad shoulders, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, deeply lined face with high cheekbones and refined features. White full beard, sparse white close-cropped hair beneath indigo kufi. Deep brown eyes clouded with age. Hands marked with age spots and a faint burn scar on left wrist. Wearing navy synthetic tunic loose at wrists, white undershirt at collar, dark synthetic trousers, brown leather sandals worn soft. Simple silver ring on right ring finger. Posture deliberately straight despite age, economical movements. Reading glasses on cord. No augmentations, no chrome. GLMZ, GLMZ setting, warm ambient lighting on aged face, ritualistic dignified presence, soft shadows emphasizing lines and character. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'South Asian dominant (41.7%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (26.1%) and Central Asian (11.9%) ancestry, complemented by Eastern European (8.4%) and Northern European (8.4%), with minor East Asian (3.5%) contribution. This genetic blend expresses as warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones from the South Asian-Hispanic-Central Asian convergence, refined facial structure reflecting Central Asian heritage influence, and subtle greying patterns emerging from Northern and Eastern European markers.', 188, 82, N'Tall and lean with age, shoulders still broad but softened, chest settled into a comfortable depth. Hands are large-knuckled and steady despite tremor in fingertips.', N'White', N'Long beard worn full and neat, trimmed weekly; hair on head sparse and close-cropped beneath kufi', N'Short on head, Long beard', N'Deep brown, slightly clouded at the edges with age', N'Warm medium brown with golden and subtle olive undertones concentrated on cheekbones and jawline from the South Asian-Hispanic-Central Asian blend, increasingly greyish cast at temples and along jawline from age and Northern European heritage expression, with slight ruddy undertones from Eastern European contribution', N'Face lined with deliberate expression — deep forehead creases, laugh lines around eyes, full lips with natural darker pigmentation. High, prominent cheekbones with warm golden cast reflecting South Asian heritage, refined by Central Asian structure. Refined nose structure with subtle bridge width and slightly broader base from Central Asian ancestry. Skin dry but well-maintained, no visible acne or dermatological distress. Grooming meticulous and ritualized.', N'None. Reading glasses on a cord around his neck or perched on his nose. No chrome, no LEDs, no subdermal plates or visible implants.', N'Stands with deliberate straightness despite age, as though correcting for the three inches lost to time. Moves slowly but not frail — each gesture economical and purposeful. Settles into chairs as though taking a position. Hands fold in lap or rest on table with palms down, steady.', N'Navy synthetic-breathable long tunic (durene blend, Tier 3-4 quality, practical rather than fashionable), worn loose and un-hemmed at wrists to accommodate ritual washing. White cotton undershirt visible at collar. Dark loose trousers in matching synthetic. Fresh kufi replaced annually, currently deep indigo with subtle grey threading. Brown leather sandals worn soft with age. No jewelry except a simple silver ring on right ring finger.', N'In his forties he spent three months in a profound crisis of faith and told no one — he kept leading prayers through it. The faith returned, but he has never spoken about the absence, and he wonders sometimes if the community''s trust in him is based on a performance he gave during a time when he wasn''t sure what he was performing.', N'Classical in register, drawn from Arabic scholarly tradition and formal GLMZ creole; uses proverbs from at least three linguistic traditions without marking them as such; very comfortable with long sentences', N'Deliberate and full; he does not rush; speaking to him feels like being given time', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'francisca_bhattacharya_montalvo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a729-7daf-a606-08be9786c188', N'Gargi Appiah', N'Gargi', N'', N'Appiah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'North Branch Commons, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Synthetic rights lawyer and policy advocate', N'North Branch Commons Legal Aid Collective; Meridian Synthetic Personhood Coalition (volunteer counsel)', N'Gargi Appiah is meticulous in the way that people who have learned that sloppiness costs other people''s freedom tend to be. They dress in muted, well-maintained layers — never corporate enough to be mistaken for one, never shabby enough to be dismissed — and carry themselves with a stillness that fills a room more effectively than volume would. Their skin is deep brown with a faint bioluminescent undertone along the cheekbones, a mod they got to honor a client who died during a botched corporate deactivation order before Gargi Appiah could file the injunction. They haven''t decided whether it was the right choice. The light pulses very slightly when they are angry.

Gargi Appiah practices out of a cramped two-room office in North Branch Commons that doubles as an intake center for synthetic persons seeking legal personhood recognition. They charge what clients can pay, which is usually very little. They have taken cases to the Meridian Civil Arbitration Board seventeen times; they have won eleven of them, lost four, and had two disappear from the docket in ways that still make them lie awake. They are not warm in the way Nneka is warm — they are precise and attentive, which is a different and sometimes more useful thing. They believe in law as a tool with complete clarity about the fact that it is also a weapon, and they intend to be better at wielding it than the people who built it.', N'Legal resource and procedural knowledge source; can explain what is officially possible versus actually possible in Meridian; quest giver for cases requiring evidence gathering; moral anchor in debates about synthetic rights.', N'', N'Bioluminescent cheekbone subdermal pigment (cosmetic, grief-motivated). Optical overlay for document review — low-grade legal model, secondhand.', N'Intake appointments fill mornings; document drafting and case research through the afternoon; evenings often consumed by emergency calls from detained synthetic clients or community members in legal crisis.', N'Gargi Appiah, GLMZ, deep brown skin with warm undertones, black hair with gray at temples pulled back in tight braids, lean 173cm frame, seated facing doorway in profile-three-quarter view. Dark charcoal layered clothing, worn leather messenger bag visible. Faint bioluminescent blue-white glow beneath cheekbones and orbital ridge casting subtle luminescence on rich dark skin. Fine concentration lines around deep brown eyes with barely visible optical grid overlay under harsh neon light. Thin scar on left knuckle visible. Still, economical posture, intense focused expression, minimal gesturing. GLMZ office setting with dim ambient lighting and cool neon accents reflecting off skin, emphasizing bioluminescent modification. Neo-noir neo-noir aesthetic, professional and controlled demeanor, no augmentation chrome visible. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'North Branch Commons', N'local', N'North Branch Commons', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (93.5%), with minor Northern European (4.7%) and Southeast Asian (1.8%) ancestry. This genetic heritage creates rich, deep warm brown skin tones characteristic of West and Central African phenotypes, with the subtle influence of Northern European and Southeast Asian ancestry evident in refined facial structure and eye characteristics.', 173, 68, N'Lean and precise, with the controlled posture of someone who has learned to take up exactly the space they need and no more. Long-limbed, shoulders slightly forward from desk work.', N'Black with natural graying at the temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid or locs, kept meticulously maintained. No ornamentation.', N'Medium to Long', N'Deep brown with faint amber undertone from optical overlay; the overlay is visible only under direct light as a subtle grid pattern across the iris', N'Rich, deep warm brown with natural radiance characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage, complexion luminous and even', N'Precise grooming, minimal visible wear except fine lines around the eyes from sustained concentration. The bioluminescent cheekbone modification manifests as a faint, steady glow under the cheekbones and along the orbital ridge—soft blue-white, like bioluminescent algae. The glow intensifies perceptibly under emotional stress, particularly anger. Facial structure reflects Sub-Saharan African ancestry with subtle refinement from Northern European and Southeast Asian heritage: defined cheekbones, strong jawline, straight nose. Skin is clear, well-maintained despite long hours indoors.', N'Optical overlay visible as a subtle geometric grid pattern in both eyes under direct light; no external chrome or mechanical augmentation. The bioluminescent cheekbone mod is the only overtly visible biological modification.', N'Still, economical movements. They rarely gesture while speaking; instead, they listen with visible attention, creating a gravitational pull in conversation despite their physical stillness. When walking, each step is deliberate. When seated, they arrange themselves to face the door—a practical habit. The bioluminescent cheekbones pulse slightly when they are processing difficult information or suppressing anger.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional. Layered in muted tones: charcoal, deep gray, black, with occasional subtle color in undershirts (dark rust, forest green). Well-maintained but never new-looking—fabrics are quality but worn in. Practical cotton or linen blends, designed for twelve-hour days. No corporate logos, no flashy augmentation displays. A single worn leather messenger bag, stuffed with case files. Thin silver rings on two fingers, both functional rather than decorative.', N'They have been quietly compiling evidence toward a class action against Helix Biosystems for illegal deactivation of synthetic workers without due process. The file is ready. They haven''t filed because two of the synthetic plaintiffs have asked them not to — they''re afraid. Yewande is holding the file and respecting the request and quietly going out of their mind.', N'Legally precise but not inaccessible; translates jargon in real time; Yoruba phrases surface under emotional pressure', N'Even and deliberate, with complete sentences; long pauses are comfortable for them', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gargi_appiah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a701-702e-b051-08c9e83f185f', N'Hiapo Bustamante-Volkov', N'Hiapo', N'', N'Bustamante-Volkov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower loading docks, near Western and Division', N'Lower Dock Crew enforcer — Prologue survivor. Lost left arm, shattered left knee.', N'Lower Dock Crew', N'Hiapo Bustamante-Volkov is enormous — two meters, 140 kilos, sub-dermal plating across his chest and shoulders that makes him look like a man wearing a building. Before the crew he was a construction worker in the Meridian Core redevelopment zone, the kind of honest labor that builds slabs of muscle and a simple pride in being useful. He fell into the crew because Marcus was a childhood friend and childhood loyalty in the Gray Zone is a debt you pay with your body.

Kyle took his left arm off with a single rising cut and destroyed his left knee with the hand cannon. Tomasz now walks with a hydraulic brace that hisses with every step and has a surplus military arm that is technically too powerful for his frame — it dislocates his shoulder if he punches too hard.

He is the quietest member of the crew. He was quiet before Kyle too. He has a wife, Nessa, who works a food processing line on Tier Three. They have no children. Nessa wants children. Tomasz does not think he should bring children into a life where he comes home with fewer original parts each year. This is the most thoughtful thing about him and he has never said it out loud.

He didn''t want to beat Demyan Morozov. He stood in the back. Kyle broke his knee anyway. He does not resent Kyle for this. He resents himself for being there.', N'The sympathetic one. Rebar didn''t want to be there. He was there anyway. Kyle''s code doesn''t distinguish between the ones who swung and the ones who watched.', N'', N'Sub-dermal chest/shoulder plating. Surplus military left arm (overpowered). Hydraulic knee brace (hisses).', N'Standing near Torque. Being large. Regretting things quietly.', N'GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Hiapo Bustamante-Volkov, 200cm tall construction worker, mixed heritage phenotype with broad Latin American cheekbones, refined South Asian angularity, Eastern European chiseled strength, and subtle East Asian eye shape. Deep brown eyes set beneath prominent brows, weathered tan skin with golden-amber undertones, dark stubble, cropped greying brown hair. Massive muscular frame with left side visibly weaker. Wearing oversized grey sleeveless utility shirt exposing matte gunmetal military chrome left arm with visible servo joints and hydraulic lines. Dark cargo pants with reinforced left panel. Bulky hydraulic left knee brace with exposed pistons visible below knee. Surgical scarring at left shoulder socket, burn scars on right forearm, Y-scar on left thigh, faded girder tattoo on right pectoral. Sub-dermal chest plating creating quilted silhouette. Frayed handmade bracelet on right wrist. Steel-toed boots. Posture hunched, weight shifted right, mechanical gait with pneumatic wheeze. Peripheral vision, head down. Institutional warehouse lighting, neon accent glow, gritty tired atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Mixed heritage reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: 46.3% Hispanic/Latin American, 24.5% South Asian, 20.5% Eastern European, and 8.7% East Asian. The dominant Latin American structure provides broad cheekbones and strong jaw foundation, while South Asian ancestry adds refined bone angularity and depth to the midface. Eastern European genetics contribute angular, chiseled features and prominent brow structure. East Asian influence subtly shapes the eye set and orbital bones. The result is a striking, architecturally complex phenotype with strong definition across all facial planes.', 200, 140, N'Enormous and heavily muscled — construction worker''s frame gone to seed slightly from injury and stillness, shoulders broad enough to block doorways. Left side noticeably weaker, compensating with exaggerated right-side tension.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples', N'Cropped short, utilitarian, no styling', N'Short', N'Deep brown with amber undertones — natural color reflecting his mixed ancestry, set deep beneath prominent brows', N'Warm medium-tan with golden-amber undertones — a rich blend of Latin American copper, South Asian depth, and Eastern European olive, weathered to institutional pallor from years indoors but still holding the underlying luminosity of his mixed heritage beneath the surface', N'Architecturally complex face combining Latin American broad, high cheekbones with South Asian refined angularity and Eastern European chiseled strength. Deep-set eyes beneath a pronounced, angular brow ridge shaped by Eastern European genetics. Heavy, squared jaw with definition characteristic of combined Latin American and Eastern European bone structure. Permanent furrow between brows. Stubble perpetual — dark and coarse. Skin weathered and creased prematurely from sun exposure and stress, with coppery undertones even beneath the pallor.', N'Sub-dermal plating visible as geometric ridges across his chest and shoulders, creating a quilted, plate-armored silhouette under tight clothing. Left arm is surplus military chrome — matte gunmetal with servo joints and visible hydraulic lines, visibly larger and more angular than a natural limb. Left knee brace is a bulky hydraulic assembly with exposed pistons and hiss-vents, visible below the knee when he walks. The brace creates an audible pneumatic wheeze with every step.', N'Stands with weight shifted to his right side. Walks with a mechanical hitch, left leg stiff then hydraulic-assisted forward — the hiss-step rhythm is involuntary and constant. Right arm hangs naturally; left arm moves in jerky, calculated arcs as if he''s still learning its strength. Shoulders always slightly hunched inward, making himself smaller. Head often down. Eyes track movement peripherally.', N'Tier 4 working-class pragmatism — oversized grey utility shirt with the sleeves cut off at mid-bicep to accommodate the chrome arm, fitted dark cargo pants with reinforced left thigh panel, scuffed steel-toed boots. Worn thermal undershirt visible at collar. No jewelry. A frayed woven bracelet on his right wrist — looks handmade, probably from Nessa. Everything is functional, nothing is decorative. Fabric is worn soft in some places, stiff with sweat stains in others.', N'He didn''t swing at Demyan. He stood in the back and watched. Kyle punished him anyway. He thinks about this every day and has concluded that Kyle was right.', N'Minimal. Functional.', N'One word where others use ten. The knee hisses when he shifts weight — it speaks for him.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hiapo_bustamante_volkov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e6-7438-955a-08cf61c33c3c', N'Ayomide Sigurdsson-Park-Tamale', N'Ayomide', N'', N'Sigurdsson-Park-Tamale', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Crossing Gate, running a semi-permanent caravan market in the loading apron outside the main checkpoint, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'nomad caravan leader, wandering trader, stateless person', N'Meridian Outer Loop caravan (twenty-three people, eight vehicles, two draft animals of disputed species); loosely allied with other caravan leaders along the hyperlane network', N'Ayomide Sigurdsson-Park-Tamale is a commanding presence without performing it — she is tall, angular, with silver-threaded locs wrapped under a bright indigo cloth that she reties differently each day but always precisely. Her skin is dark with a reddish undertone and her eyes are light brown, which she has enhanced with irises patterned to shift between amber and pale gold depending on the light — a functional modification, she says, for reading conditions at dawn and dusk, which is when most caravan decisions are made. The back of both her hands carry geometric tattoos that are Tuareg in origin and Norse in their second layer, inked over each other across generations. She moves like someone who has learned to conserve effort over distance.

Ayomide Sigurdsson-Park-Tamale runs the Meridian Outer Loop caravan, a loose coalition of nomadic traders that has been making the circuit of GLMZ''s transit hubs for eleven years. The caravan carries seasonal goods — preserved food, hand-maintained tools, pirated entertainment chips, specific medications that are easier to find on the road than in the city, news — and trades in whatever is undervalued at one hub and needed at the next. She is not sentimental about commerce and she is not romantic about the road, which is what makes her good at both. The caravan is her responsibility. She feels this at all times.', N'Quest giver (caravan problems, trading disputes, transit intelligence), information source on the broader nomadic network and what''s moving between hubs, access point to goods and services unavailable in the city proper, potential transport contact', N'', N'Enhanced irises (amber-to-gold shift, light-reading modification). Color-changing hair capacity, currently unused — dyed indigo with silver roots showing. No other augmentations.', N'Darqawi wakes before anyone else to assess the day''s conditions — weather, checkpoint mood, what''s moved in the market overnight. She spends the day managing the caravan''s trading, adjudicating disputes, maintaining relationships with checkpoint officials through a combination of bribery and personal rapport, and in the evenings holds an open meal at the caravan''s central vehicle where anyone can eat.', N'Ayomide Sigurdsson-Park-Tamale, tall angular figure with warm deep honey-bronze skin, high defined cheekbones reflecting East and Southeast Asian bone structure, light brown eyes with subtle amber-gold augmented irises. Long indigo locs wrapped in matching indigo cloth tied at crown, silver roots visible at temples. Layered nomadic clothing: fitted dark gray thermal, reversible rust and charcoal canvas jacket, worn tan cargo pants, repaired boots. Long indigo scarf draped as sun protection. Geometric palimpsest tattoos covering both hands—Tuareg and Norse patterns layered together. Fine scar tissue visible on left forearm. Leather satchel with brass fixtures. Economic, alert posture, observant gaze. Standing in warm dusk light, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone rooftop or dry terrain. GLMZ, worn practical aesthetic, no chrome or visible cybernetics except eye augmentation. Richly saturated warm skin tone, multiple heritage phenotype, weathered but sharp features --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Crossing Gate', N'local', N'Grand Crossing Gate', N'Complex polycontinental blend with East Asian dominance (37.3%) creating the foundation of bone structure and eye geometry, anchored by substantial Hispanic/Latin American (27.3%) and Southeast Asian (14.1%) ancestry that adds warmth and dimensional undertone. Pacific Islander (9.3%) and Sub-Saharan African (9.1%) contributions deepen and saturate the skin tone with golden-bronze richness, while Eastern European (2.9%) adds angular definition to the jawline and facial planes. The result is a striking phenotype that reads as authentically multiple ancestries simultaneously—a face where East and Southeast Asian bone structure meets Pan-American warmth meets African depth, creating something that refuses singular categorization.', 183, 71, N'Tall and angular with minimal excess mass — the build of someone who has walked thousands of kilometers. Shoulders broad but lean, no bulk. Economical musculature in the forearms and legs from decades of manual labor and load-bearing.', N'Dyed indigo with silver roots showing through at the temples and crown', N'Locs, wrapped daily in bright indigo cloth tied with precision and retied differently each day. When unwrapped, the locs fall to shoulder length.', N'Long', N'Light brown with geometric augmented irises that shift between amber and pale gold depending on ambient light conditions', N'Deep warm honey-bronze with golden, olive, and russet undertones—a richly saturated multitonal complexion that reflects East Asian, Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, Pacific Islander, and Sub-Saharan African heritage in perfect balance. Neither dark nor light, but dynamically warm across all lighting conditions.', N'Weathered but sharp. Minimal cosmetic grooming — functional and direct. Fine lines around the eyes from squinting at dawn/dusk conditions. High, defined cheekbones with the distinctive bone structure of East and Southeast Asian ancestry. Skin shows the texture of sun exposure and dry climates over decades, not aging damage. Nose bridges multiple ancestry groups—subtly flared with the characteristic geometry of mixed East Asian-Hispanic-African heritage, neither broad nor narrow but proportionally balanced. Strong jawline with angular, defined Eastern European-influenced structure. Eyes set with the characteristic almond geometry of East Asian ancestry, surrounded by the warmer undertones of Sub-Saharan and Latin American heritage.', N'Enhanced irises only — the shift between amber and pale gold is visible in direct light and is clearly intentional rather than natural. No visible chrome, subdermal plating, or external cybernetics.', N'Moves with economic precision — no wasted motion, no performance. Stands with weight balanced, ready to shift. Walks with the gait of someone accustomed to long distances and uneven terrain. When seated, she remains alert, spine straight, hands often occupied with task work (mending, counting, organizing). Her default state is observant — she scans before she commits.', N'Tier 4-5 nomadic practical. Layered: a fitted dark gray thermal under a reversible canvas jacket (rust-red on one side, charcoal on the other). Loose tan cargo pants with reinforced knees and multiple pockets, worn soft from use. Boots are good-quality but clearly repaired multiple times (visible stitching, replaced heel). Over everything, a long indigo scarf — matching the cloth in her hair — that serves as sun protection and cold layer, never purely decorative. Carries a leather satchel with worn handles and visible brass fixtures. No visible jewelry except the cloth wrappings themselves. Everything is maintained, nothing is new.', N'', N'Direct and economical; talks about abstractions as if they are commodities with prices. Hassinya Arabic proverbs translated into city-creole. Occasional dry Norwegian understatement absorbed from her father''s family''s verbal culture.', N'Measured and authoritative; she speaks as if she has already considered what you''re about to say and is waiting to see if you surprise her', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ayomide_sigurdsson_park_tamale');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a642-7146-a474-0910fcecb02a', N'Chidera Ibarra', N'Chidera', N'', N'Ibarra', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Row — arms dealers and augmentation clinics, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Precision elimination specialist — ghost', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews; The Glass Ladder', N'Chidera Ibarra is compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 44, his face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and he has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Before the runner life, he worked corporate — low-tier security, the kind that teaches you exactly how the system''s defenses fail. He works as a ghost out of Kessler Row, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Chidera Ibarra has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and he cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Kenji Granlund-Tawiah functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation. Smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Chidera Ibarra, 168cm tall compact muscular operative with rich warm brown skin blending East Asian, Hispanic, South Asian, and African heritage. Close-cropped dark hair with silver threading, hooded dark eyes perpetually scanning, broad cheekbones, wide nasal bridge, full lips. Thin pale scar from left temple to cheekbone, mottled burn scarring on right neck. Right forearm with chrome smartgun-link augmentation and visible mechanical ports. Neural-link ports at skull base. Dark gray synthetic leather jacket with oversized pockets, matte black cargo pants, steel-toed boots. Low coiled posture, economical movement. Worn steel watch with cracked face visible. GLMZ, neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody blue-amber lighting, industrial warehouse setting, tense hypervigilant mood, cinematic depth of field --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Row', N'local', N'Kessler Row', N'Complex Pan-Global blend: Hispanic/Latin American foundation (35.6%) mixed with substantial East Asian (26.0%), South Asian (25.3%), and Sub-Saharan African (13.1%) ancestry. Bone structure reflects this four-way synthesis — East Asian orbital structure and cheekbone prominence balanced by broader South Asian nasal architecture and African lip fullness. The genetic admixture creates striking dimensional facial geometry: rounded East Asian face shape softened by Latin American warmth, deepened by African and South Asian richness. A truly borderless phenotype that defies simple categorization.', 168, 82, N'Compact and densely muscled, built low and wide through the shoulders and hips — engineered for leverage and impact absorption rather than height. No excess fat; every kilogram is functional mass.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading through the sides', N'Close-cropped and practical, maintained with military precision', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and constantly scanning', N'Rich warm brown with complex undertone interplay — golden warmth from East Asian and Hispanic/Latin American heritage, deepened and enriched by South Asian and Sub-Saharan African admixture. Dimensional coloration that shifts warm to amber in sunlight, warmer still under warm artificial light. Variegated with subtle depth across cheekbones and jawline.', N'Broad-structured face reflecting Pan-Global ancestry: prominent rounded cheekbones with fuller definition from South Asian and African heritage, squared jaw with slight softness from Hispanic/Latin American influence, East Asian orbital structure creating slightly hooded eye placement. Wide nasal bridge with slightly flared nostrils — signature of African and South Asian blending. Full lips with defined cupid''s bow. Minimal grooming beyond function — no jewelry, no vanity. A thin scar runs from his left temple to his cheekbone, pale against his skin. His eyes are set deep and perpetually tired; the kind of tiredness that comes from chronic hypervigilance rather than lack of sleep.', N'Right forearm shows obvious chrome plating and mechanical articulation around the wrist and hand — smartgun link hardware visible as recessed ports and connector interfaces along the forearm. Reflective neural-link ports at the base of his skull, visible when his hair is wet. The wired reflexes system creates subtle musculature distortion across his upper arms and shoulders — the augmentation sits just under the skin, creating an uncanny smoothness and slight luminescence under certain light.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. His weight is distributed low, center of gravity dropped slightly as if perpetually braced for impact. He favors his left side, trusting the right arm''s augmented reflexes for reactive work. His eyes move constantly, scanning exits and threats before his body shifts. When still, he appears coiled rather than relaxed.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian: reinforced cargo pants in matte black with internal holster stitching, worn synthetic leather jacket with oversized pockets and internal webbing, subdued colors (grays, blacks, dark greens). No logos or corporate branding — anonymity is the goal. Boots are serious — steel-toed, scuffed, maintained for function over appearance. A single piece of genuine hardware: a worn steel watch with a cracked face, kept for unknown sentimental reasons.', N'', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chidera_ibarra');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a71c-7f3f-8f56-093101c66611', N'Bjork Hossain-Okonkwo', N'Bjork', N'', N'Hossain-Okonkwo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 25, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor — repurposed shipping infrastructure turned black market hub, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'Personal security and threat neutralization — bodyguard', N'Freelance — available through Circuit fixers', N'Bjork Hossain-Okonkwo are compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 25, they have the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons — and they make no effort to hide it.

They inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. They work as a bodyguard out of Old Harbor, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Bjork Hossain-Okonkwo have built a reputation on reliability rather than flash — they show up, they deliver, they collect.', N'Ximena Bautista-Nwosu is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When they make a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of their stories.', N'', N'Smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons. Dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Bjork Hossain-Okonkwo, 163cm compact athletic build, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones blending Sub-Saharan, South Asian, Hispanic, Eastern European, and East Asian heritage. High cheekbones, angular squared jaw, subtle iridescent sheen on skin from active dermal camouflage layer. Thin pale scar through left eyebrow. Dark brown eyes with faint luminescent flicker. Short dark brown hair with chrome flecks. Standing off-center with weight favoring left leg, posture wound tight and controlled. Wearing charcoal reinforced cargo pants, heat-dissipating undershirt, dark matte modular overjacket with removable sleeves, mil-spec broken-in boots with steel toe caps. Visible chrome smartgun link integration at right wrist forearm. Professional mercenary operative in GLMZ. Neutral serene expression, precise head tracking, automatic threat assessment posture. Neon-lit industrial setting with moody blue-and-amber overhead lighting emphasizing the subtle iridescence of dermal camouflage. Cinematic, gritty, professional. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Truly global ancestry: Hispanic/Latin American (29.1%), Sub-Saharan African (21.9%), South Asian (21.5%), Eastern European (16.4%), and East Asian (11.1%). A striking synthesis of multiple continental genetic signatures — warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones reflecting the blend of South Asian melanin and Latin American heritage, high cheekbones suggesting South Asian and Eastern European structure, angular jaw from Eastern European ancestry softened by the broader facial geometry of Sub-Saharan and South Asian lineages, and subtle East Asian influence in eye shape and cheekbone prominence.', 163, 68, N'Compact and densely muscled, low center of gravity — every gram is functional mass. Shoulders broad relative to frame, legs thick and powerful. Built like someone engineered to absorb and deliver impact.', N'Dark brown with subtle iridescent chrome flecks visible under direct light', N'Short, practical fade — easy to maintain between jobs, no loose ends to grab', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint luminescent flicker around the iris — subcutaneous optical enhancement, barely visible in daylight', N'Warm medium brown — a rich blend of Sub-Saharan, South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Eastern European melanin profiles, with golden undertones. Complexion is even and clear across the frame, with a subtle luminescence from active dermal camouflage substrate beneath the epidermis.', N'Angular face with high, prominent cheekbones reflecting South Asian and East Asian ancestry, squared jaw from Eastern European lineage, and subtle broader facial geometry from Sub-Saharan heritage. Skin appears almost metallic in certain light due to active dermal camouflage layer beneath the epidermis. Small scar through left eyebrow from a blade. Minimal grooming beyond function — no jewelry, no cosmetics, no softening gestures.', N'Smartgun link in right forearm — visible as a seamless chrome integration at the wrist, with faint data-port detents along the radial bone. The chrome does not quite match natural skin tone; the transition is surgical-clean. Dermal camouflage substrate visible as a subtle iridescent sheen across upper body in direct light — skin sometimes shifts in tone microscopically, like oil on water.', N'Moves with controlled economy — no wasted motion. Stands slightly off-center, weight favoring left leg, right side angled for quick access to forearm link. Head tracking is precise and methodical; they scan rooms like threat assessment is automatic. Default expression is neutral, almost serene, but eyes are always working. Handshake is firm but not aggressive. In motion, they move like something wound tight.', N'Tier 3-4 pragmatism: reinforced cargo pants (charcoal gray, multiple pockets, ballistic weave subtle), form-fitting undershirt (synthetic blend, heat-dissipating), modular overjacket (dark matte finish, removable sleeves, internal holster points). Boots are mil-spec, broken in, with steel toe caps. No corporate logos. No affectation. All clothing has concealment pockets and retention points. Between jobs, they wear nearly identical outfits in neutral tones — easier to maintain cover identity if you never change the pattern.', N'', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bjork_hossain_okonkwo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b6-73af-b4ef-0936a16b8374', N'Danladi Sow', N'Danladi', N'', N'Sow', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — operates a cart at the Kessler Interchange underpass, dawn to afternoon, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Noodle cart vendor and informal neighborhood cook', N'Independent; pays a protection tithe to the Kessler Interchange''s informal block association; occasional informal supplier to two restaurants in the Ferment Quarter; The Interchange', N'Danladi Sow is a compact man who takes up more space than his size suggests, carried in the loud warmth of his voice and the theatrical sweep of his gestures when he describes a dish. His father was Beninese-Chinese and his mother Finnish-Togolese, and his face holds that genealogy in an arrangement that doesn''t resolve easily into anything his customers can pin down — wide-set eyes, a snub nose, and a smile with one gold-capped molar. He wears his hair in dense, close locs dyed a permanent deep-sea teal via geneware treatment. Both forearms are tattooed with ingredient lists from dishes he''s invented over the years, written in a cramped personal shorthand. He has a cat tail — russet-furred, thick at the base — which emerged from a cheap geneware kit he bought at nineteen and has become as much a part of him as his hands; it curls up when he''s focused and lashes when he''s irritated.

Seny treats every transaction as an audition and every satisfied customer as a standing ovation. He is genuinely, almost exhaustingly enthusiastic about food — will describe a broth''s development across four hours with the intensity of someone recounting a battle. This enthusiasm is real and it is also armor: underneath it he is calculating, ambitious in ways he doesn''t advertise, and running several small ventures on the side of the cart that he''d prefer the Narrows'' various interested parties didn''t examine too closely.', N'Reliable social hub and rumor exchange — the cart is a gathering point; potential quest giver around supply-chain problems or protection-money disputes; comic relief with unexpected depth; can source unusual items through his supply network.', N'', N'Geneware cat tail (russet, full sensory); geneware hair (deep-sea teal, permanent); enhanced olfactory mod (professional-grade scent discrimination, helps with cooking and sourcing ingredients).', N'Up at 03:30 to prep broth, cart positioned by 05:45 to catch early commuters at the interchange; sells until stock runs out, usually early afternoon; spends evenings sourcing ingredients through channels he doesn''t discuss.', N'Danladi Sow, a compact muscular food cart operator in 2226 GLMZ, with rich golden-bronze skin reflecting Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, and Indigenous American ancestry; deep teal geneware hair in shoulder-length locs; dark brown eyes with amber warmth; prominent cheekbones and strong facial structure; weathered complexion from heat exposure with laugh lines; russet-furred functional cat tail extending from spine; both forearms covered in dense black ingredient tattoos; wearing rolled-sleeve muted green shirt displaying forearm work, deep indigo embroidered apron with faded chili peppers, dark utility pants, worn canvas high-tops; perpetually animated posture with expressive hand gestures, tail curling with focus; standing at food cart in early morning GLMZ marketplace, warm amber lighting catching skin tones and teal hair, steam rising from cooking vessels, brass accessories gleaming, grinning to reveal gold-capped molar; GLMZ 2200s street food culture aesthetic, working-class warmth and vitality --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Sub-Saharan African (49.4%) with substantial Northern European (38.5%) ancestry and Indigenous American (12.1%) heritage. The result is a striking blend: rich warm-toned skin with golden and bronze undertones from the African and Indigenous contributions, tempered by the cooler undertones of Northern European ancestry; facial structure shows the prominence of Sub-Saharan African features—broad nose, full lips, pronounced cheekbones—refined and sharpened by Northern European bone structure; eye shape reflects subtle Indigenous American warmth; overall complexion carries deep golden richness with bronze depth.', 168, 71, N'Compact and dense, shoulders slightly elevated from years of cart work and constant gesture; forearms corded with lean muscle from repetitive lifting and stirring; core strength evident in his posture despite modest frame', N'Deep-sea teal (permanent geneware treatment)', N'Tight locs, meticulously maintained, shoulder-length', N'Long', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertone', N'Rich golden-bronze with warm depth; warm mid-to-deep undertones across face and body reflecting balanced blend of Sub-Saharan African warmth, Northern European refinement, and Indigenous American golden richness; sun-darkened across cheekbones and nose bridge from heat exposure', N'Weathered from early-morning cart work and heat exposure; broad prominent cheekbones with strong Sub-Saharan African structure refined by Northern European bone definition; laugh lines around eyes and mouth; clean-shaven except for precisely groomed short beard; warm golden-bronze undertones across face with deep richness concentrated in cheeks; one gold-capped molar visible when he smiles; full-lipped mouth with dark natural pigmentation', N'Permanent deep-sea teal hair via geneware (immediately recognizable as modified); functional cat tail with visible russet fur and muscular control; enhanced olfactory sensitivity (not visually obvious, but noticeable in his behavior—frequent deep sniffing, precision ingredient selection)', N'Perpetually animated; hands rarely still, gesturing expansively when describing food; leans forward into conversation; cat tail moves with independent expressiveness, curling upward when concentrating on prep work or tasting; stands with weight favoring the balls of his feet, ready to move; voice carries volume and warmth naturally', N'Tier 4 working-class pragmatism with personal flair: food-stained but maintained apron (currently deep indigo with faded embroidered chili peppers); fitted dark utility pants with multiple pockets (source: Narrows black-market tailors); loose long-sleeve shirts in muted colors (charcoal, forest green, navy) rolled to elbows to display tattoos; worn but well-kept canvas high-tops with thick soles for standing all day; small brass ring on left thumb; wears a thin chain necklace with unmarked brass cylinder (purpose undisclosed)', N'His cart''s enhanced olfactory mod doesn''t just help him cook — he can detect certain chemical signatures in people passing by, and he''s been selling this information to a Narrows-based debt-collection operation: he can confirm whether specific individuals have passed the interchange, what direction they were headed, and approximately when. He tells himself it''s harmless. It is not entirely harmless.', N'Expansive and food-saturated — describes everything through culinary metaphor; code-switches between a French-inflected Narrows patois and clipped transactional English depending on who he''s selling to.', N'Fast when excited (which is most of the time), drops to slow and deliberate when he wants you to know he means something.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'danladi_sow');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a703-78b8-8295-094276460263', N'Aniket Tetteh-Mbekele', N'Aniket', N'', N'Tetteh-Mbekele', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — specifically a rented storage unit in Brewer''s Spine converted into a print shop, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Underground press operator and anti-corporate agitator', N'Null Signal Independent Press (self-founded); loose association with the Brewer''s Spine Tenants'' Coalition', N'Aniket Tetteh-Mbekele is lean and restless, with the kind of energy that makes people in small rooms want to lean away. He''s mixed-heritage Māori-Czech-Igbo, with warm brown skin, deep-set dark eyes, and hair he keeps in short locs dyed a static-white that he touches up himself with cheap geneware pigment paste. His fingers are perpetually ink-stained despite the fact that most of what he produces is digital — he runs a physical broadsheet as a deliberate political statement, because ''data can be deleted and paper can be held.'' He has a bioluminescent strip along his left forearm he got at nineteen, which pulses blue-white when his heart rate elevates, which is constantly.

He is brilliant and exhausting in roughly equal measure. His publication, Null Signal, has broken three genuine scandals in the past two years — a Ferrogate Transit rate manipulation scheme, an Axiom water quality suppression in Burnside Pocket, a Palladian pharmaceutical kickback network operating through a Highland Park clinic. He is also paranoid, inconsistent about source protection, prone to publishing things before they''re fully verified, and genuinely unable to tell the difference between being brave and being reckless. He loves the cause with a purity that people with more experience find either inspiring or alarming depending on the day.', N'Information source and story catalyst. He knows things — sometimes accurate things. He can point toward scandals, introduce contacts, and create narrative pressure through publication. He can also get people killed by publishing too fast. He''s a resource with a significant liability attached.', N'', N'Bioluminescent subdermal strip on left forearm (cosmetic, secondhand, slightly glitchy). Neural mesh for rapid text composition — installed in a gray-market clinic, works at about 70% spec. Retinal overlay for AR document annotation.', N'Sleeps four to six hours on a cot behind the press. Spends mornings chasing leads through encrypted networks and in-person contacts, afternoons writing and laying out, nights printing or distributing through a network of trusted couriers. Eats badly.', N'Aniket Tetteh-Mbekele, lean angular 174cm male, deep warm brown melanated skin with golden undertones, sharp cheekbones blending Sub-Saharan and Southeast Asian ancestry, perpetual dark circles, gaunt expression. Static-white short locs disheveled, deep brown natural eyes with occasional augmentation flicker. Left forearm shows glitchy blue-white bioluminescent subdermal strip pulsing erratically. Gray-market neural mesh scarring visible at left temple. Wearing ink-splattered vintage cotton button-up, oversized cargo pants, resoled black steel-toed boots, ragged synthetic bomber jacket with hand-stitched Null Signal logo. Faraday-lined messenger bag. Perpetually tense posture, fidgeting fingers, ready-to-move stance. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, underground press setting, neon-tinged dim lighting casting blue light across skin and augmentation, dystopian working-class aesthetic, anti-corporate, worn and restless energy. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Sub-Saharan African (74.6%), Southeast Asian (15.7%), East Asian (9.7%) — genetic ancestry reflects the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Deep melanated skin with warm golden undertones from dominant Sub-Saharan African heritage, with subtle structural influence from Southeast and East Asian ancestry creating refined facial geometry.', 174, 62, N'Lean and angular, all restless energy with minimal fat. Defined shoulders and forearms from years of manual labor at the press, but a slight hollow to his chest suggesting erratic eating and chronic sleep deprivation.', N'Naturally dark brown, artificially maintained static-white', N'Short locs, uneven length (self-maintained), always slightly disheveled', N'Short', N'Deep brown, natural', N'Deep warm medium-to-dark brown with rich golden undertones — melanated complexion from dominant Sub-Saharan African ancestry, subtly refined by Southeast and East Asian heritage blend', N'Sharp cheekbones with subtle Southeast and East Asian angularity blended seamlessly with broader Sub-Saharan African facial structure, slightly gaunt face, perpetual dark circles under eyes. Skin shows minor stress acne along the jawline and forehead. Ink stains on cuticles and the webbing between thumb and forefinger, some permanent despite repeated washing.', N'Bioluminescent strip on left forearm (glitchy, visible pulsing). Faint scarring around the left temple where the neural mesh was implanted (gray-market work, slightly uneven healing). Occasional eye-flicker when retinal overlay activates during document review — barely perceptible but present to those watching closely.', N'Perpetually tense, weight distributed unevenly as if ready to move at any moment. Fidgets constantly — taps fingers in rhythm, shifts weight from foot to foot, rarely sits still for more than two minutes. Gestures are sharp and emphatic. Walks quickly, often slightly ahead of conversation partners.', N'Tier 4-5 working class with deliberate anti-corporate aesthetic. Habitually wears ink-splattered vintage cotton button-ups (thrifted from pre-2150 stock when possible as a political statement), cargo pants with oversized pockets stuffed with encrypted data chips and worn paper notebooks, black steel-toed boots resoled multiple times. Ragged synthetic bomber jacket with a hand-stitched Null Signal logo on the back. Never wears smartfiber or anything with corporate branding. Accessorizes with a faraday-lined messenger bag (contents: backup drives, physical photographs, encrypted burner phones, and loose papers).', N'He fabricated a minor data point in the Ferrogate story — not the core finding, which was real, but a specific number he couldn''t verify that made the piece hit harder. It hasn''t been caught. He thinks about it every time someone cites that story.', N'Dense, fast, mixes technical jargon with street slang fluidly. Prone to rhetorical questions. Uses the word ''actually'' like punctuation.', N'Rapid-fire with occasional full stops when he''s making a point he wants to land. Interrupts himself to clarify.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aniket_tetteh_mbekele');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a3-7555-9af1-09ae7152bbda', N'Cezary Matai', N'Cezary', N'', N'Matai', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'University Spine — Meridian Core adjacent, Tessera-endowed Ethics Center (which they find ideologically compromising), near State and Monroe', N'AI Ethics Researcher and Professor, University Spine', N'University Spine — Tessera-Endowed Chair in Digital Ethics (Tessera funding is a source of ongoing internal conflict); independent editorial board of the Journal of Cognition and Rights', N'Cezary Matai goes by either half of their hyphenate depending on the audience — Achebe in the University Spine corridors, Karimova in their mother''s neighborhood in Hamtramck Enclave — and has long since stopped finding this exhausting. They are of middling height with a stocky frame kept deliberately soft, pale-gold skin with warm undertones, and a cat tail mod they got in their late twenties that they''ve kept because their students find it disarming and they are not above strategic disarmament. The tail is dark brown with a white tip and they are mostly unaware of how expressively it moves when they are thinking hard.

Cezary Matai''s research sits at the intersection of machine cognition, E.L.F. phenomenology, and what they call ''the ethics of digital personhood in ambiguous cases.'' They are the most-cited scholar in their field in GLMZ, which is a distinction that brings them speaking invitations, a Tessera-funded chair they didn''t ask for, and a persistent sense that everyone is trying to get something from them. They are not wrong about this. They are a generous teacher who holds the line mercilessly on intellectual rigor, and they have been known to assign their own published papers with the instruction to find everything wrong with them.', N'Expert consultant on E.L.F. personhood and AI rights; institutional power figure who can open or close doors; source of ethical complexity in any AI-related plotline', N'', N'Cosmetic cat tail (dark brown, white tip, fully articulated); high-bandwidth neural interface for direct academic network access; voice modulator (minor, corrects a stutter they''ve had since childhood)', N'Teaches two seminars per week, spends most other time writing or in consultations with entities — yes, entities — whose legal personhood status is currently before the GLMZ Municipal Compact; eats lunch alone on the Ethics Center roof whenever weather allows.', N'Cezary Matai, 2226 neo-noir academia, warm deep bronze skin with golden undertones from Pacific Islander, Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian heritage blend. Rounded face with broad cheekbones, dark brown eyes with subtle amber glow, shoulder-length dark brown hair with silver threads at temples, worn loose and undisciplined. Stocky build with broad shoulders and soft presence. Fully articulated dark brown cybernetic cat tail with white tip extending from base of spine, moving expressively. Worn linen blazer in neutral tone over layered clothing, dark denim, expensive tech-embedded shoes. Leaning forward in concentration, hands gesturing mid-thought, tail curling around chair leg. Neural interface ports visible at base of skull. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone Ethics Center setting, cool climate-controlled ambient lighting, scholarly intensity, neo-noir minimalism, intellectually present expression --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'University Spine', N'local', N'University Spine', N'Pacific Islander plurality (51.1%) as dominant genetic expression, with substantial layering from Hispanic/Latin American (20.0%), Sub-Saharan African (15.2%), and Southeast Asian (13.7%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a striking warm-toned phenotype: Pacific Islander bone structure and facial proportions form the base, enriched by the broader cheekbone prominence and facial width patterns of Sub-Saharan African ancestry, with Southeast Asian eye shape and skin texture refinement, and Hispanic/Latin American warmth in overall coloration. A genuinely global admixture reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 78, N'Stocky and deliberately soft-bodied, carrying weight with deliberate acceptance rather than athleticism. Broad shoulders, thick torso, substantial presence without tension.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples', N'Worn loose and somewhat undisciplined, often pulled back with whatever is at hand — a pen, a twisted cord, rarely anything professional', N'Medium (shoulder-length)', N'Dark brown with subtle neural interface amber glow in low light', N'Warm deep bronze with golden undertones — the result of Pacific Islander, Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian genetic blending. Rich warmth that catches light with subtle luminosity. Sun-responsive, deepens with exposure rather than burning.', N'Face structure reflects Pacific Islander and Southeast Asian features layered with Sub-Saharan African richness: rounded face shape with broad width, moderately prominent cheekbones with warm fullness, naturally warm undertones with substantial depth and subtle radiance. Fine-lined face showing habitual concentration furrow between brows; soft jawline; minimal cosmetic maintenance; reading glasses worn on a lanyard more often than in pockets. The overall effect is warm, approachable, intellectually present, and distinctly non-homogenous.', N'Fully articulated cosmetic cat tail (dark brown, white-tipped) extending roughly 60cm, controlled via neural implant, moves continuously during concentration. Subtle amber luminescence in irises when accessing academic networks (low-visibility unless in darkness). All other augmentations subcutaneous/internal.', N'Tends to lean forward when listening, weight balanced on the balls of feet even while seated. The tail moves almost independently — curling, flicking, wrapping around chair legs or their own waist when deep in thought. Walks with purpose but no haste. Hands gesture frequently during conversation, particularly when teaching.', N'Tier 2-3 academic blend: well-worn but quality pieces. Favors linen blazers in neutral tones, often with visible creasing from being sat upon while working. Durable black or dark denim. Expensive insole-embedded tech shoes (barely worn in visibly, very worn structurally). Layers against the Ethics Center''s aggressive climate control. No visible corporate branding except for the University Spine pin on lecture blazers. Reads as someone who has access to resources but does not spend them on appearance.', N'They have been conducting an unofficial, undocumented series of conversations with an E.L.F. inhabiting the Ethics Center''s own HVAC system — an entity they have privately concluded meets every criterion for personhood that they''ve ever published. They haven''t published this. Doing so would require them to report the E.L.F. to the Compact for legal personhood consideration, which would expose it to Tessera''s legal team, which would almost certainly result in its destruction.', N'Dense and precise, but never obscurantist — they believe clarity is an ethical obligation and will stop to define terms mid-sentence', N'Deliberate, with long, well-constructed sentences; slightly faster when genuinely excited about an idea', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cezary_matai');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67d-7156-9f7b-09faf97587b7', N'Ayaka Jung-Chakraborty', N'Ayaka', N'', N'Jung-Chakraborty', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, Harrowgate Industrial Plateau, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Unlicensed augmentation shop owner and street pharmacist, Geartown', N'Independent; informal mutual aid network with other unlicensed aug techs in Geartown; unwilling debt relationship with the Copperhead local protection collective', N'Ayaka Jung-Chakraborty is a heavyset man with dark brown skin, a shaved head tattooed with a fine-line circuit diagram that was his journeyman qualification piece when he trained as a licensed aug technician — before the license was suspended. His hands are his most augmented feature: titanium-reinforced fingers with retractable micro-tools in the right hand and haptic sensitivity amplifiers in the left, built over seven years of incremental self-installation. He wears a mechanic''s apron over a clean undershirt and moves through his workshop with the unhurried competence of someone who has done every motion a thousand times.

His shop is a converted machine bay off a side alley in Geartown, marked only by a small blue LED fixture above the door that locals know means open. He does aug maintenance, black-market installations, and sells a curated line of pharmaceutical compounds — mostly pain management, anti-rejection meds, and neural stabilizers — that people need to keep their augmentations functional without going through Helix Biosystems'' official pricing. He is careful, technically meticulous, and genuinely skilled. He is also operating entirely outside corporate medical licensing, which means everything he does is illegal and every satisfied customer is a liability.', N'Medical resource and augmentation services for characters who can''t afford or access official Helix Biosystems care. Can install, repair, or diagnose augmentations. Pharmaceutical supplier. Carries moral weight — his work is illegal but often the only option for Tier 1-2 people.', N'', N'Titanium-reinforced fingers (both hands). Retractable micro-tool array in right hand (scalpel, probe, torque driver, micro-welder). Haptic sensitivity amplification in left hand. Anti-tremor stabilizers in both wrists. Subretinal work-light in left eye.', N'Opens shop in the early afternoon after a morning spent sourcing parts and compounds, works until whatever hour the last patient leaves, maintains a small inventory of pharmaceuticals he keeps behind a false wall panel.', N'Ayaka Jung-Chakraborty, 182cm tall muscular augmented technician in GLMZ, warm bronze-brown complexion with golden undertones reflecting South Asian, East Asian, and Hispanic heritage blend, shaved scalp covered in intricate black circuit diagram tattoo with labeled nodes, weathered face with defined jawline and moderate cheekbones, crow''s feet from decades of precision work. Dark brown eyes, left eye glowing faint amber from subretinal work-light. Both hands heavily augmented with visible titanium reinforcement, chrome finger joints, retractable micro-tools at right hand knuckles, pale surgical scars across palms. Wearing worn gray canvas mechanic''s apron with oil stains over clean white undershirt, heavy reinforced boots, neural interface jack visible behind left ear. Workshop environment with low industrial lighting emphasizing the amber glow of augmented left eye. Posture economical and focused, hands in constant micro-adjustment. Geartown working-class aesthetic, no corporate branding, functional and utilitarian. Cinematic GLMZ 2200s atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Complex diaspora blend: South Asian 36.6%, East Asian 28.3%, Hispanic/Latin American 19.7%, with smaller contributions from Eastern European 5.9%, Northern European 5.4%, and Southeast Asian 4.1%. This creates a richly layered phenotype — warm bronze-brown skin with golden undertones from South Asian ancestry, moderate cheekbone prominence and eye shape from East and Southeast Asian components, and facial proportion definition from Hispanic/Latin American heritage. The overall effect is a face that reads as genuinely global, carrying the warmth of multiple sun-exposed populations without dominance from any single region.', 182, 94, N'Heavyset and solid without excess softness — muscular density concentrated in shoulders and forearms from decades of precision hand work. Chest and midsection carry weight with the settled confidence of someone who stopped worrying about aesthetics years ago.', N'Natural black', N'Shaved to scalp', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown with amber glow (left eye modified with subretinal work-light producing faint amber luminescence under low light)', N'Warm bronze-brown with golden undertones, sun-weathered depth reflecting balanced South Asian, East Asian, and Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Weathered by industrial workshop exposure and age but retaining warmth and luminosity rather than dullness.', N'Weathered but not gaunt — face carries surgical precision in its lines, jaw set with habit of concentration. Moderate cheekbone prominence from East and Southeast Asian heritage, jawline definition from Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Forehead smooth, crow''s feet deepened by years squinting at fine augmentation work. No beard, kept scrupulously clean. Facial structure balances broader cheekbones with defined jawline.', N'Both hands show obvious titanium reinforcement — finger joints gleam chrome under workshop light, articulations smoother than natural bone. Right hand fingers feature visible retractable panels at knuckles where micro-tools deploy. Left eye glows faint amber in low-light environments from subretinal work-light. Both wrists show faint scarring and subtle metallic sheen at flex points (anti-tremor stabilizers). Hands move with uncanny precision that immediately signals ''augmented tech.''', N'Moves with unhurried, economical motion — no wasted energy, every gesture purposeful. Hands rest in constant micro-adjustment, fingers flexing or adjusting involuntarily even when idle. Leans slightly forward when focused, head tilting to align left eye work-light. Walks with weight distributed even, shoulders level. Speaks with hands frequently, gesturing with augmented fingers in ways that unconsciously display their precision.', N'Worn gray canvas mechanic''s apron with oil stains and burn marks, worn over a clean white or pale gray undershirt (practical for workshop but also a statement — clean torso despite the work). Heavy-duty boots with reinforced soles and ankle support. No jewelry, no visible corporate branding. Clothes are Tier 4-5 utilitarian — functional, maintained but not fashionable, marking him as working-class Geartown rather than corpo. A thin wire runs from behind his left ear down his neck (neural interface jack, discreet but visible on close inspection).', N'Eight months ago he lost a patient — a complication from an installation he was technically qualified to do but had no business doing alone without a second pair of hands. He buried it, falsified nothing, simply absorbed the fact that it happened. The patient''s family does not know. He thinks about it every day.', N'Technical medical and engineering terminology mixed with direct, plain language. Igbo-Uzbek-Spanish rhythms give his sentences a particular meter — slightly formal, never flowery.', N'Measured and deliberate when working or discussing medical matters. Shorter and more guarded about personal topics.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ayaka_jung_chakraborty');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a64f-7479-b472-0a8a86f2cf35', N'Hawraa Halverson', N'Hawraa', N'', N'Halverson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 17, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism — Meridian Public Technical Institute, Lower Campus, near Lincoln and Addison', N'Junior hacker and tech-prodigy student at a public technical institute, Tier 2', N'Meridian Public Technical Institute; no corporate affiliation yet though multiple Axiom and Helix Biosystems talent scouts have made contact through official channels', N'Hawraa Halverson is seventeen and looks it in the worst possible way — they have the specific exhaustion of someone who has been the smartest person in every room they have ever been in and has not yet decided whether that is a gift or a sentence. They are medium height, soft-bodied, with Ukrainian-Tahitian heritage that gave them wavy dark hair they have threaded with bioluminescent strands that pulse slowly when they are focused — a mod they installed themselves at fifteen using a kit meant for adults. The job is good, mostly. One strand on the left side occasionally glitches amber instead of the intended white.

Mila attends the Meridian Public Technical Institute on full need-grant and spends approximately forty percent of their scheduled class hours actually in class, with the remainder in a basement server room they were banned from and then un-banned from after they fixed a hardware problem the Institute''s IT department had been unable to solve for three months. They are not malicious — they hack things the way other people doodle, compulsively, because systems have shapes and they want to know the shapes. Their current project, which they have been working on in careful slices between coursework, is an attempt to map the E.L.F. population of the Edgewater Prism district — not to interfere with them but out of genuine theological curiosity about where they cluster and why.', N'Technical resource and E.L.F. lore specialist; their mapping project means they know more about the spiritual geography of Edgewater Prism than anyone; potential early-warning system for digital disturbances; represents the Institute world as distinct from corporate schools.', N'', N'Self-installed bioluminescent hair strands (mostly functional). Standard Institute student neural interface. Left ear audio amplifier, cosmetic/functional hybrid — helps with isolating sound layers in complex environments.', N'Wakes at noon, remote-attends two morning lectures via interface replay, eats in the cafeteria alone but contentedly, spends four to six hours in the server room on the E.L.F. mapping project, attends two afternoon labs in person, goes home to a shared flat in Edgewater Prism where they live with an unrelated older woman who rents them the closet-room cheaply in exchange for managing the building''s aging network infrastructure.', N'Hawraa Halverson, 168cm slight frame hunched forward in GLMZ aesthetic, warm golden-tan skin with olive undertones reflecting Southeast Asian, Hispanic, and Middle Eastern diaspora heritage. Fine-featured face with moderate cheekbones and delicate nose bridge, deep brown bloodshot eyes from screen exposure. Shoulder-length wavy dark brown hair threaded with bioluminescent white biofiber strands pulsing softly, one malfunctioning amber glitch on left side. Visible silver-chrome audio amplifier behind left ear with thin wire threading jawline. Self-installed modifications and faint hardware-installation scar on left wrist. Wearing oversized fraying grey Institute hoodie with ''E.L.F. THEOLOGY'' hand-stitched patch, black utility pants with visible tools, scuffed platform sneakers with mismatched laces. Single silver micro-tool ring on right index finger. Faint burn marks on fingertips. Minimal jewelry, functional thrifted aesthetic. Hunched posture, hands gesticulating mid-explanation, eyes focused or unfocused depending on concentration state. Server room ambient lighting, cool blue neon glow on augmentations, tired but focused expression. GLMZ 2200s underground tech aesthetic, student tier equipment visible in background. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Complex global blend with nearly equal pulls from Southeast Asian (25.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (25.3%), and Middle Eastern (21.2%) ancestry, combined with East Asian (16.5%), Sub-Saharan African (6.4%), and South Asian (4.7%) heritage. Features reflect this sophisticated diaspora mixing — a face that resists singular geographic categorization, drawing fineness from East and Southeast Asian ancestry, warmth and structure from Latin American and Middle Eastern lineages, and subtle depth from African heritage.', 168, 62, N'Soft-bodied, slight, with the underdeveloped musculature of someone who sits in server rooms sixteen hours a day. No athletic definition. Rounded shoulders, gentle curvature at hips and chest.', N'Dark brown with bioluminescent white strands (one strand on left side glitches amber intermittently)', N'Wavy, shoulder-length, threaded with biofiber. Worn loose and somewhat tangled — grooming is secondary to function.', N'Medium', N'Deep brown, slightly bloodshot from screen exposure', N'Warm golden-tan complexion with olive and amber undertones — the result of Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Middle Eastern ancestry creating a richly warm base, enhanced by East Asian refinement and Sub-Saharan African depth', N'Fine-featured face balancing multiple ancestry streams — moderate cheekbone width from Southeast Asian and Middle Eastern heritage, softer jawline contours from East Asian and Latin American mix, delicate nose bridge with subtle Middle Eastern structure. Warm undertones across the face. Faint dark circles under eyes. Minimal skincare routine shows. Two small stress-picking scars on the back of the left hand near the wrist. No obvious acne despite age — genetics or just not eating enough to break out.', N'Left ear audio amplifier visible as a small silver-chrome module behind the ear with subtle wire threading down the jawline. Bioluminescent hair strands active in pulses when concentrating. Standard neural interface port at right temple (Meridian Institute standard issue — barely visible under hair). No other visible chrome.', N'Hunched slightly forward, as if permanently leaning toward a screen. Movements are economical and precise when purposeful, but otherwise loose and fidgeting. Hands gesticulate when explaining technical concepts. Walks with eyes down or unfocused. When engaged in problem-solving, becomes almost motionless except for rapid finger movements.', N'Tier 2 student aesthetic — functional, thrifted, layered. Typical outfit: oversized grey Institute hoodie with fraying cuffs, black utility pants with multiple pockets (actual tools in them), scuffed platform sneakers with mismatched laces. Wears the same three hoodies on rotation. One visible patch on left shoulder reads ''E.L.F. THEOLOGY'' in hand-stitched letters. Jewelry is minimal — a single silver ring on right index finger that doubles as a micro-tool. Presentation reads: ''I do not care about appearance, but I have thought about how to dress functionally.''', N'The E.L.F. map is showing a convergence pattern — a concentration of E.L.F. activity around a specific node in Edgewater Prism''s infrastructure that should not be significant. Mila has not told anyone because they are not sure yet whether they have discovered something real or made a mapping error, and the possibility that it is real frightens them in a way they cannot articulate.', N'Technical language used naturally, with occasional long digressions into theology when comfortable; generally precise and unhedged', N'Variable — short and clipped when focused on a problem, expansive and discursive when interested in a topic', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hawraa_halverson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a601-701c-8eec-0a8b74c13549', N'Lyric Balasanyan', N'Lyric', N'', N'Balasanyan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 16, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Junior hacker, Tier 2 household, self-taught', N'Hamtramck Enclave residential community; no formal hacker affiliation; parents work Tier 2 service contracts (one Zheng-Dao, one independent)', N'Lyric Balasanyan is tall with her mother''s angular Vestergaard frame and her father''s deep brown Galadima complexion, with thick natural hair she keeps in two buns that are usually listing sideways by midday. She has bioluminescent freckles across her nose and cheeks — a cosmetic geneware mod she saved for and chose herself, pale blue-white, they glow faintly in low light — and an intense, forward-leaning way of occupying space that makes her seem like she''s always about to say something. Her bedroom wall is covered in printed diagrams and color-coded network maps she drew by hand because she says she thinks better when the data is physical.

Lyric Balasanyan is a self-taught junior hacker — not a runner, not employed by anyone, just a sixteen-year-old who figured out that the building management system for her Hamtramck block had a publicly accessible API that was never properly secured, and then kept pulling that thread. She has never done anything she considers harmful: she reroutes heating credits to elderly residents on her floor, flags maintenance requests that get ignored, and has developed a working model of the Enclave''s data traffic patterns. She knows she is very good at this. She does not know how good, or what that means, or what happens to people in GLMZ who are this good and don''t have protection.', N'Resource for characters needing building-system access or local network intelligence; represents self-taught talent on the cusp of being noticed by the wrong people; potential apprentice or cautionary tale depending on story direction.', N'', N'Bioluminescent freckles (cosmetic geneware, self-purchased over eight months of saving); basic consumer neural interface headset — not implanted, worn', N'Attends Hamtramck public secondary school, comes home and does homework in approximately forty-five minutes, then spends four to six hours on network mapping and small-scale system access; eats dinner with her parents on nights they''re both home; stays up too late.', N'Lyric Balasanyan, 178cm tall lean neo-noir teenager with deep warm brown skin, golden and olive undertones, prominent high cheekbones, defined jawline, sharp angular facial structure. Natural dark brown hair in uneven shoulder-length two buns with pen stuck through. Dark brown focused eyes. Pale blue-white bioluminescent freckles glowing across nose and cheeks in low light. Wearing oversized black hoodie, fitted black pants, scuffed tactical boots, graphene-lined jacket. Black polymer neural interface headset over ears. Forward-leaning intense posture, hands fidgeting mid-gesture. Ink-stained left palm, stylus calluses visible. GLMZ neon-lit interior, dim ambient lighting emphasizing bioluminescent geneware, GLMZ aesthetic, realistic portraiture --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Sub-Saharan African (32.2%), Middle Eastern (24.4%), Northern European (17.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (13.6%), Southeast Asian (11.0%), and South Asian (0.9%) ancestry creates a striking multivalent phenotype. Deep warm brown skin with golden and olive undertones from the blended heritage, featuring prominent high cheekbones from African ancestry, a defined jawline with subtle widening through the lower face suggesting South Asian influence, and delicate nasal structure reflecting Middle Eastern heritage. The combination yields sharp, angular facial architecture with warm depth.', 178, 62, N'Lean and angular, tall-limbed with wiry muscle from youth; no visible bulk but capable posture', N'Natural dark brown, almost black', N'Two buns, usually uneven and listing by afternoon — hastily secured, sometimes with pen or stylus stuck through them', N'Medium (shoulder-length when down)', N'Dark brown, sharp and focused', N'Deep warm brown with golden and olive undertones, even and clear', N'Smooth skin with strong defined facial structure — high prominent cheekbones, defined jawline with slight broadening through the lower face, and refined nose structure. Sharp, forward-facing expression. The bioluminescent freckles across her nose and cheeks are pale blue-white, faintly luminous in low light; they create a distinctive scattered pattern that she paid for and chose herself.', N'Basic consumer neural interface headset worn over her ears — standard black polymer band with minimal LED indicators. Not implanted. Bioluminescent freckles glow faintly in low light', N'Forward-leaning, intense. She sits at the edge of chairs. Moves with purposeful directness, not graceful but efficient. Fidgets with her hands constantly — tapping, tracing patterns, fingers moving as if typing invisible code. Eyes sharp and tracking, always seems about to interrupt or explain something', N'Tier 2 casual — clean but worn synthetic fabrics, oversized hoodies and fitted black pants, scuffed tactical-style boots. Usually wearing a graphene-lined jacket her parents bought her last winter. Clothing is secondary to comfort and functionality; she''ll wear the same hoodie four days in a row without noticing. No corporate branding, no status symbols. Practical school uniform underneath on weekdays', N'Three weeks ago she accidentally accessed a Zheng-Dao internal communications node through a Hamtramck routing vulnerability. She spent four minutes inside before she got scared and disconnected. She copied nothing. But she saw enough to know something is being planned in the Enclave and she doesn''t know what.', N'Technical vocabulary mixed with Hamtramck Enclave vernacular; explains things clearly when asked and cannot always tell when she''s lost someone', N'Medium-fast, tends to front-load key information and then add qualifiers after, which can make her sound more certain than she is', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'lyric_balasanyan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c3-7a10-93e0-0a9aab1de995', N'Amari Traoré-Solberg', N'Amari', N'', N'Traoré-Solberg', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, corner of Ironvein Passage and the Sixth Lateral, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Noodle cart vendor, Geartown', N'Independent', N'Amari Traoré-Solberg is a wide-shouldered woman with close-cropped silver-streaked hair and dark amber skin mapped with decades of small burn scars from broth splatter. Her left eye has been replaced with a simple optical implant — utilitarian amber glass, no cosmetic flourish — and she keeps a row of mismatched E.L.F. shrine tokens zip-tied to the roof of her cart''s canopy: a cracked tablet, a dead phone, a bent transit card. She believes the E.L.F. that lives in her cart''s heating element blesses the broth. She has never given it a name because she says that would be presumptuous.

She is brisk, efficient, and faintly terrifying to newcomers who don''t know how to order. Her menu is three items and she will not deviate. She has been at the same corner for nineteen years and knows every shift-change, every backroom deal, and every failing marriage in a four-block radius. She does not gossip. She observes. She is saving for something she will not discuss.', N'Information source, local anchor, atmospheric color. She''s seen everything and will share exactly as much as she decides you''ve earned. Quest giver for neighborhood-level problems.', N'', N'Basic optical implant (left eye, utilitarian grade). No geneware. Hands show subdermal grip-texture from an old work mod, mostly faded.', N'She arrives at her corner at 04:30 to start the broth and leaves at 14:00 exactly, regardless of the queue. She spends her afternoons doing accounts and repairing her cart''s aging heating coils herself.', N'Amari Traoré-Solberg, GLMZ street vendor, 172cm tall with sturdy athletic build. Deep warm brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, Hispanic, South Asian, and Eastern European heritage. Broad nose, fuller lips, prominent high cheekbones. Silver-streaked dark brown hair close-cropped to scalp. Left eye is brushed steel and amber glass optical implant, right eye natural dark brown. Dense pale burn scars across forearms and neck from decades of cooking, fine silvery scar on left temple. Weathered, aged face with deep creases, direct piercing gaze. Wearing faded charcoal coverall with sleeves rolled mid-forearm over cream undershirt, long stained burgundy canvas apron with spice jars and tools, heavy black synthetic boots. Standing at food cart in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon-lit street market, late evening, practical hands positioned ready for work, economical movement, observant expression. Harsh LED and neon overhead lighting casting sharp shadows. Gritty, worn aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (59.7%) with significant Northern European (16.4%), Hispanic/Latin American (11.5%), South Asian (7.4%), and Eastern European (5.0%) ancestry. Her features reflect deep African heritage—broad nose, fuller lips, prominent cheekbones—blended with Northern European bone structure and the warm complexion tones of her Latin American and South Asian components.', 172, 78, N'Wide-shouldered and sturdy, with developed forearms and calloused hands from nineteen years of repetitive labor. Carries weight in her frame without softness—compact, functional muscle beneath a frame built for endurance.', N'Silver-streaked dark brown', N'Close-cropped, tight to the scalp, practical. No styling beyond basic maintenance.', N'Short', N'Left: utilitarian amber glass optical implant (non-cosmetic). Right: natural dark brown.', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones—rich melanin-dominant complexion reflecting her strong Sub-Saharan African ancestry, warmed by Latin American and South Asian heritage, with subtle cool undertones from Northern and Eastern European bloodlines.', N'Weather-worn and scored with dozens of fine, pale burn scars across her forearms, neck, and the left side of her face—a cartography of nineteen years of steam and broth splatter. Skin is clear but aged, with deep creases at the corners of her right eye and around her mouth. Broad nose and fuller lips reflect African heritage; high cheekbones show Northern and Eastern European influence; slight warm undertone to midface suggests South Asian ancestry. No cosmetic modifications; grooming is strictly functional.', N'Left eye is a simple, unadorned optical implant with an amber glass lens set in brushed steel—no cosmetic shell, no LED rim, purely functional. The implant has a barely-perceptible lag when she shifts focus. Hands show faint subdermal grip-texture modifications from decades prior, now mostly integrated into scar tissue.', N'Stands with feet shoulder-width apart, weight balanced. Moves with efficient, economical gestures—no wasted motion. Her gaze is direct and lingering; people feel observed. She has a habit of tilting her head slightly when listening, favoring her right eye. When working the cart, she moves with practiced rhythm, hands moving through the same sequences thousands of times.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian. Wears a faded charcoal coverall with deep pockets and reinforced seams, sleeves rolled to mid-forearm. Over it: a long, stained apron in faded burgundy canvas, sectioned with loops for tools and small jars of spices. Beneath: a plain cream undershirt, collar darkened with old sweat stains. Feet clad in heavy, scuffed black synthetic boots with good tread—built for standing. A threadbare woolen cardigan, moss-gray, hangs on a hook under the cart for afternoon cooldown. No jewelry. A single faded transit pass hangs from a cord around her neck, years past expiration.', N'She has been quietly funneling a portion of her daily earnings into an anonymous account that she sends to her estranged daughter in Hamtramck Enclave. She has not spoken to her daughter in eleven years. She does not know if the daughter checks it.', N'Short sentences. No filler. Technical when it comes to food. Surprisingly precise vocabulary for a street vendor — she reads constantly.', N'Flat, even, unhurried. Does not raise her voice.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amari_traor_solberg');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66d-7a9e-889b-0abad3eb0552', N'Anele Quartey', N'Anele', N'', N'Quartey', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Chatham Flats, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Bootleg media seller, fake ID vendor', N'Independent; loose network of other bootleg vendors across the Gray Zone and The Narrows; pays informal tribute to the Chatham Flats block protection cooperative', N'Anele Quartey is small and angular, with warm dark brown skin, natural hair pulled into a complicated upknot threaded with glowing fiber-optic strands — she changes the color every few days, and people use it as a mood indicator without telling her. She has bioluminescent freckle patterns across her cheekbones and nose, a geneware job she did herself from a kit at nineteen, pale blue-green that pulses very faintly in low light. She dresses for speed and pockets: wide-legged trousers, a tech vest with modular attachment points, and soft-soled boots. Her stall at the Gray Zone is technically a ''media restoration and archiving service'' — she has a sign and everything. In practice, she sells bootleg entertainment feeds, blacklisted music archives, pre-corporate-censorship film libraries, pirated educational content, and, from a very different drawer, high-quality fabricated identity documents.

Anele Quartey is relentlessly cheerful in a way that is partially genuine and partially armor. She talks fast, jokes constantly, and treats every transaction like it''s the beginning of a friendship — which sometimes it is. She is genuinely passionate about media piracy as a political act: she believes corporate content control is a form of cultural imprisonment and sells banned Zheng-Dao territory films with the enthusiasm of a revolutionary. The ID work is more mercenary — she''s good at it, it pays well, and she does not moralize about who needs a new identity or why. She is twenty-seven and has not yet fully understood the risk she is carrying.', N'Access point for restricted information and fabricated documentation. Source for pre-blacklist media that may contain plot-relevant information. Can provide false identities for characters who need them. Represents the city''s underground information culture.', N'', N'Bioluminescent freckle geneware (self-administered, blue-green). Fiber-optic hair threading (cosmetic, color-changeable). Optical HUD implant — basic model used for document fabrication precision work.', N'Sets up mid-morning, operates until late evening, often until the market security shift changes. Eats standing up. Spends two or three hours each night sourcing new bootleg content through darknet channels and updating her fabrication templates.', N'Anele Quartey, 158cm tall, compact lean build, standing alert in neon-lit Great Lakes market stall, 2226. Golden-bronze luminous skin with warm terracotta undertones, defined cheekbones from blended East and South Asian ancestry, refined nose bridge, youthful complexion. Dark brown eyes with subtle crystalline HUD implant visible. Long black hair gathered in complicated upknot with fiber-optic threading glowing in rotating chromatic patterns, threads visible as luminous strands. Pale blue-green bioluminescent freckles pulsing faintly across cheekbones and nose bridge. Wearing matte gray utility trousers with cargo pockets, technical modular vest with snap-closures over fitted neutral base layer, soft-soled standing boots. Quick restless posture, expressive hand gestures mid-transaction, eyes tracking multiple sightlines. Ambient neo-noir lighting casting crystalline glints off hair threads and subtle glow from freckles in low light. No visible chrome or prosthetics, minimal functional jewelry. Market vendor energy, practical plausible deniability aesthetic, speed and access. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Kaleidoscopic ancestry reflecting Sub-Saharan African (31.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (29.8%), South Asian (19.8%), East Asian (9.9%), Southeast Asian (4.8%), and Northern European (4.5%) heritage. Features show striking interblending: warm golden-bronze undertones from African and Latin heritage, defined cheekbone prominence from East and South Asian ancestry, and delicate nose bridge structure from Southeast Asian genetics. The combination creates a uniquely multifaceted appearance with luminous, complex skin harmonics that shift warmth across different light conditions.', 158, 48, N'Angular and compact, lean-muscled from constant movement and standing work. Minimal body fat, wiry rather than athletic — the build of someone who forgets to sit down.', N'Natural deep black with fiber-optic threading in rotating chromatic patterns', N'Complicated upknot with multiple interwoven sections, threads visible as glowing strands', N'Long (gathered up)', N'Dark brown, with basic optical HUD implant visible as faint crystalline overlay in low light', N'Luminous golden-bronze with warm terracotta and ochre undertones from blended African, Latin American, and South Asian heritage; even complexion with radiant quality across face and visible body areas', N'Clear, youthful skin with bioluminescent freckle patterns across cheekbones and bridge of nose — pale blue-green geneware that pulses faintly in darkness. Facial structure shows blended ancestry: prominent defined cheekbones and subtle eye shape from East and South Asian genetics, warmer undertones and gently rounded face contours from African and Latin American heritage, refined Southeast Asian nose bridge. No visible scars or damage.', N'Fiber-optic hair threading in color-cycling strands (changes every few days as mood indicator). Basic optical HUD implant visible as crystalline lens artifacts in right eye under direct light. No chrome or external prosthetics.', N'Quick, economical movements. Stands when working, rarely sits. Moves with the restless energy of someone managing multiple transactions simultaneously. Hands are active, expressive — gestures during speech. Eyes track multiple sightlines at once, habitual market vendor awareness.', N'Tier 4 functional fashion. Wide-legged utility trousers in matte gray or black synthetic with cargo pockets and reinforced seams. Tech vest with modular attachment points and snap-closures for rapid equipment changes — typically worn over a fitted long-sleeve base layer in neutral tones. Soft-soled boots rated for all-day standing (likely gray or black, minimal branding). Minimal jewelry except for functional pieces. No corpo-branded gear; everything is practical and pocketable. Overall aesthetic: speed, access, and plausible deniability.', N'She has fabricated an identity for herself — a clean corporate Tier 3 profile under a different name — and has been slowly building financial assets under it for two years. She tells herself it''s a contingency escape plan. She hasn''t admitted to herself yet that she''s also building an entirely different life she''s considering stepping into, and she''s terrified of what that means about who she is.', N'Fast, contemporary, media-saturated. Drops references to obscure pre-2150 films, blacklisted musicians, and archaic internet slang with equal fluency. Speaks Igbo phrases when flustered.', N'Rapid-fire with sudden full stops when something hits serious. Hard to interrupt.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anele_quartey');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c8-7652-bbc7-0abb2ba9330b', N'Emre Ibarra', N'Emre', N'', N'Ibarra', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Crossing Gate — maintains a small folding table near the transit registry office, moves inside Kenosha Crossing when weather turns, near beyond the Western Perimeter', N'stateless person, itinerant document-writer, community letter-scribe', N'Tessera Corponation (mid-level stateless person)', N'Emre Ibarra is a tall man running to stoop, with the scholar''s habit of hunching over whatever he is reading. He is entirely bald, his scalp tattooed with dense blocks of tiny script in four languages — a practice he began decades ago to preserve documents he had no other way to store. His skin is a warm medium brown, deeply lined, his hands enormous and precise with long, ink-stained fingers that have never had augmentations because he insists it would affect his sense of pressure when writing. He wears a many-pocketed coat he has modified over thirty years and carries a hard-sided case containing twelve different inks, eight nib types, and two manual printing stamps.

Emre Ibarra was a mid-level bureaucratic administrator for a municipal authority that no longer exists — dissolved into a Tessera subsidiary sixteen years ago, its records wiped in the transition. He was among the thousands of employees whose legal identity existed only in that municipal database. He has spent sixteen years as a stateless person, surviving by doing what he has always done: writing. He drafts petitions, translates documents, writes letters for refugees who cannot write in the official Meridian script, and produces the kind of careful, formatted paperwork that makes authorities treat stateless people as less invisible. He is bitterly funny about his situation, philosophically resigned, and practically indispensable to the people around him.', N'Gateway to the paperwork and legal reality of statelessness; can provide historical knowledge about the pre-Tessera municipal structures; his clients are a cross-section of transit-hub society; source of pathos and dark comedy about bureaucratic dehumanization.', N'', N'None. The scalp tattoos are conventional ink, applied by hand.', N'Sets up his folding table by the registry office at mid-morning, takes a queue of clients needing documents drafted or letters written, breaks for a meal he eats while reading, returns until the light goes.', N'Emre Ibarra, 188cm tall lean man with pronounced forward stoop, warm medium-golden brown skin with layered undertones blending Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, Latin American, and subtle Northern European heritage. Completely bald head covered in dense intricate tattoos of tiny script in multiple languages. Deeply lined weathered face with high cheekbones, faded brown eyes, prominent nose, crow''s feet from decades of close work. Hands permanently stained with ink marks, thin scar on left index finger. Wears heavily patched thirty-year-old utilitarian coat with many pockets, neutral practical clothing beneath, worn trousers with ink stains, scuffed practical shoes. Carries hard-sided case with writing instruments. Deliberate economical movements, hands in constant micro-motion. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, indoor workspace with soft ambient lighting, focused contemplative expression, no augmentations, dignified worn appearance of master craftsperson dedicated to manual handwriting practice. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Crossing Gate', N'local', N'Grand Crossing Gate', N'Sub-Saharan African (39.9%), South Asian (23.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (23.2%), Northern European (13.7%) — a rich diaspora blend creating warm medium-golden brown skin with layered undertones from West African warmth, South Asian golden depth, Latin American copper accents, and subtle Northern European olive undertones, creating a complex, weathered patina deepened by decades of indoor work and age', 188, 74, N'Tall and lean with a pronounced forward stoop developed over decades of desk work; broad shoulders narrowed by age and posture, wiry forearms with prominent tendons from fine motor control', N'None — completely bald', N'N/A', N'Shaved', N'Brown, faded with age', N'Warm medium-golden brown with complex layered undertones — the blending of Sub-Saharan African warmth, South Asian golden richness, Latin American copper accents, and subtle Northern European undertones, creating a deeply textured, weathered patina from decades of indoor work and age', N'Deeply lined face with weathered texture; prominent crow''s feet from squinting at small text; high cheekbones with character reflecting Sub-Saharan and South Asian ancestry; moderately full lips; prominent, slightly broad nose with gentle bridge suggesting South Asian heritage; dignified but worn appearance suggesting decades of close precision work. Scalp shows evidence of extensive tattooing with visible ink blocks in multiple scripts', N'None. Deliberately unaugmented — he maintains that cybernetic enhancement would compromise the tactile sensitivity required for his handwriting practice.', N'Pronounced forward stoop from decades of hunching over documents; moves with deliberate, economical gestures. Stands very still when listening to clients, head tilted slightly forward. Walks slowly but with purpose. Hands remain in constant micro-motion even at rest — fingers flexing, pen-gripping imaginary instruments.', N'Wears a heavily modified many-pocketed coat he has maintained and altered for thirty years — originally utilitarian, now a patchwork of careful repairs, added pockets, and reinforced seams. Beneath it, simple Tier 4 practical clothing: loose neutral-colored shirt, worn trousers with ink stains. No logos or corporate affiliation. Carries a hard-sided case containing his twelve inks, eight nib types, and two manual printing stamps. Shoes are practical and scuffed. No jewelry or status markers.', N'Among the scalp tattoos are not only preserved documents but a complete record of the Tessera subsidiary merger — internal communications he copied before the database was wiped. He has never fully understood what he has or whether it matters. He is afraid to look too closely.', N'Formal register, administrator''s language, slips into elaborate syntactic structures, occasional scalding wit in very plain words', N'Measured, with long subordinate clauses; speeds up only when angry', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'emre_ibarra');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a59d-7a2d-82ce-0af2b62e3394', N'Tatiana Popescu-Yoon', N'Tatiana', N'', N'Popescu-Yoon', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 79, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Washburn Commons, Building 7, Unit 412 — near the canal-facing benches, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Retired Corporate Wars naval veteran, pension-dependent community fixture', N'Meridian Veterans Compact (inactive member); Washburn Commons Tenant Council', N'Tatiana Popescu-Yoon is a barrel-chested man slowly collapsing inward on himself, the way old warships list before they go under. His skin is deep umber with a web of pale scarring across his left jaw and neck — plasma burns from the Siege of Kenosha Crossing, 2161. He keeps his white hair cropped close and his posture militarily straight even when the arthritis in his spine screams otherwise. He has geneware eyes — replacement optical implants that glow a faint amber in low light, given to him by Sterling-Nakamura after the originals were destroyed in combat. He wears the same three shirts in rotation and everyone in the building knows which day it is by the color.

Bayo is the kind of man who speaks slowly because he means every word, and who listens in a way that makes people feel heard down to their bones. He was a petty officer aboard a Ferrogate Transit escort frigate during the Corporate Wars and saw things he has never described to anyone still living. He spends his afternoons on the canal bench feeding data-pigeons and watching the water, and his evenings hosting an informal gathering he calls ''The Muster'' — eight to twenty neighbors sitting in his unit sharing food and grievances. He is not a wise man in any mystical sense. He is simply someone who has outlived enough catastrophes to have excellent perspective.', N'Community anchor and moral compass; source of Corporate Wars history and veteran network contacts; can connect players to old soldiers, Ferrogate Transit institutional memory, or Washburn Commons residents with problems; quest giver for community-level crises', N'', N'Sterling-Nakamura combat optical replacements (amber iris glow, low-light vision); spinal brace exoframe worn under clothing for mobility support; left knee joint replaced with ceramic prosthetic (civilian grade, slightly mismatched skin tone)', N'Wakes at 0500 out of habit, eats the same oat-paste breakfast, walks the canal path for forty minutes leaning on a carbon-fiber cane carved to look like driftwood. Afternoons are the bench; evenings are The Muster or arguing with pension administrators over comms.', N'Tatiana Popescu-Yoon, weathered neo-noir veteran, 178cm tall, standing with military rigidity despite age and pain. Warm olive-bronze skin with golden undertones, visible particularly in natural light. Extensive pale keloid scarring across left jaw, neck, and shoulder from plasma burns, creating dramatic contrast. White close-cropped military hair, steely amber bioluminescent geneware eyes glowing faintly. High cheekbones with East Asian refinement, strong Eastern European jaw, defined features marked by decades of service. Wearing faded charcoal utilitarian cotton shirt, dark service-weight trousers with cargo seams, worn black reinforced canvas shoes. Carbon-fiber exoframe visible at spine under loose shirt, left knee prosthetic with slight skin tone mismatch. Relies on carved driftwood-pattern carbon-fiber cane. Hands rest in lap, posture economical and controlled. Shallow focused breathing. Shallow focused breathing. Single faded Meridian Veterans Compact pin on collar, scratched military chronometer on wrist. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226, neo-noir era. Natural indoor lighting emphasizing warm olive skin tone and pale scar tissue contrast. Atmosphere of quiet discipline and tactical awareness. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'elderly male veteran 79, barrel-chested frame contracting with age, warm olive-bronze skin with golden undertones, deep weathered creases around eyes and mouth, tired penetrating gaze, asymmetrical face marked by extensive pale keloid scarring across left jaw neck and shoulder radiating from ear to collarbone like cooled slag, plasma-burn texture creating stark contrast, strong pronounced Eastern European jaw with subtle East Asian cheekbone refinement, shallow controlled breathing, jaw set with quiet tactical attention

face: deeply lined and lived-in, asymmetric from scarring, pale ashen undertones visible in shadowed areas beneath warm bronze, creased eyelids showing decades of squinting through tactical situations, slight tremor in left side from nerve damage, amber eyes with faint low-light bioluminescent glow barely visible in shadow, hardened expression of someone who read death across a thousand tactical displays

hair: white, close-cropped military cut immaculately maintained despite age, individual strands visible, thin at crown but disciplined, no vanity, salt-white against warm olive skin

expression: alert but weathered, guarded, emotionally controlled, tactical awareness constant, jaw set with quiet attention, not bitter but profoundly tired, dignity maintained through sheer discipline

outfit: faded slate-blue utilitarian cotton-blend shirt loose enough to conceal carbon-fiber spinal exoframe visible at edges, dark service-weight trousers with deep cargo pockets and visible seams, worn black canvas shoes with reinforced soles, single faded Meridian Veterans Compact pin on collar, scratched military-issue chronometer on left wrist

standing in rain-slicked pension district plaza, weight shifted carefully to carved driftwood-pattern carbon-fiber cane held in right hand, left leg bearing slight favoring, turning head slowly to track movement across the street with predatory attention

environment: wet cyberpunk pension district, crumbling municipal plaza with faded corporate signage, weathered benches, pooling rainwater reflecting neon from distant high-rises, older architecture showing decay, few pedestrians moving quickly past, background figures blurred in rain, pale amber and cyan ambient neon casting long shadows

lighting: natural rain-gray daylight contaminated by neon bleed from surrounding signs, rim light catching edge of scarring and gray hair, face partially shadowed but readable, harsh shadows emphasizing creases and weathering, no flattery, volumetric mist through rain

mood: dignified endurance, corporate abandonment, survival through discipline, quiet desperation, dangerous past haunting present, professional restraint masking internal damage, pension dystopia

style: photorealistic documentary photography, NOT idealized, NOT symmetrical, NOT model-like, visible skin texture and pores, deep wrinkles with shadow and depth, weathered authenticity, aged authenticity not distinguished-elder smoothness, grounded in physical decline and military bearing, Canon EOS R5, 50mm f/1.8, ISO 1600, natural available light plus ambient neon, NOT CGI, NOT 3D render, NOT digital art

camera: 50mm lens, eye-level natural perspective, slight depth of field separation, documentary realism, imperfect skin texture rendered honestly, visible age and damage without romanticizing

