style: shot on Canon EOS R5, documentary street photography, real skin texture with visible pores and imperfections, real hair with natural frizz and individual strands, NOT CGI, NOT 3D render, NOT digital art, NOT airbrushed, NOT smoothed, NOT idealized, NOT symmetrical, NOT model-like, avoid beauty standards

camera: 50mm f/1.8 lens, eye-level, natural perspective, ISO 1600, slight motion blur, shallow depth of field

--ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Washburn Commons', N'local', N'Washburn Commons', N'Eastern European / Hispanic-Latin American / East Asian blend. Genetic ancestry predominantly Eastern European (68.3%), with significant Hispanic-Latin American (22.2%) and East Asian (9.5%) contributions. This creates a distinctive phenotype combining the pale, cool undertones of Eastern European ancestry with warm golden tones from Hispanic heritage and subtle bone structure refinement from East Asian genetics. The result is a warm olive complexion with golden-bronze depth.', 178, 89, N'Barrel-chested but contracted with age; broad shoulders beginning to curve inward, musculature atrophied but still dense from decades of military bearing. Moves like a ship listing — compensating for internal structural fatigue.', N'White', N'Close-cropped military cut, immaculately maintained', N'Short', N'Amber (geneware replacement), faint bioluminescent glow in low light', N'Warm olive-bronze with golden undertones; the pale cool base of 68.3% Eastern European ancestry surfaces as slight ashen undertones in shadowed areas, while 22.2% Hispanic-Latin American heritage provides sustained warmth and bronzing capacity. The 9.5% East Asian contribution refines the overall tone into a harmonious warm olive that deepens noticeably in natural light.', N'Deep creases around eyes and mouth; heavy scarring on left jaw and neck (pale, keloid-raised plasma burns radiating from ear to collarbone, textured like cooled slag, creating stark contrast against warm olive-bronze skin). Facial structure shows blended ancestry — moderately high cheekbones with subtle East Asian influence, strong pronounced jaw with Eastern European prominence, defined nasal bridge reflecting mixed heritage. Skin weathered but clean, fingernails trimmed short. Jaw set with quiet attention.', N'Amber iris glow in both eyes (replacement optical implants, Sterling-Nakamura combat-grade); carbon-fiber exoframe visible at spine under loose-fitting shirts; left leg prosthetic knee joint with visible mismatched skin tone at contact point; relies on carved driftwood-pattern carbon-fiber cane for mobility support.', N'Stands and walks with deliberate military rigidity despite visible pain; spine held straight through exoframe support and pure discipline. Moves slowly, economically — each step deliberate. Sits with both feet flat. Hands at rest in lap, rarely gestural. Eyes track movement with the attention of someone who spent a lifetime reading tactical situations. Breathing is shallow and controlled.', N'Three rotating shirts in different solid colors (charcoal, slate, rust — all Tier 4 utilitarian cotton blends, well-maintained but faded from washing). Dark service-weight trousers with deep pockets and visible cargo seams. Worn black canvas shoes with reinforced soles for cane-walking. A single faded Meridian Veterans Compact pin on collar. No jewelry except a scratched chronometer on left wrist (military-issue, pre-Collapse model). Dresses for function and memory, not fashion.', N'During the Siege of Kenosha Crossing he gave an order that resulted in the deaths of eleven Zheng-Dao civilian dock workers who were in the wrong sector at the wrong time. The incident was classified by Sterling-Nakamura. He has never spoken of it. The pension he receives feels, to him, like payment for silence.', N'Old maritime slang mixed with formal military cadence; calls people ''sailor'' regardless of gender as a term of mild affection; uses nautical metaphors for everything', N'Measured, unhurried, with long pauses before important words — as if he is weighing them first', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'tatiana_popescu_yoon');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a705-73b3-a09a-0b039a52200c', N'Valentina Boateng', N'Valentina', N'', N'Boateng', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 47, NULL, 30, 2, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Kedzie and Division', N'Fixer - Extraction specialist', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Valentina Boateng, 168cm lean-muscled operative with warm medium-brown weathered skin, sharp cheekbones and strong jaw reflecting mixed Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, East Asian and North African heritage. Steel gray hair with black roots in tight functional braid. Dark brown eyes with subtle epicanthic influence and faint amber neon threading. Surgical scar on left temple, pockmark scars on shoulders. Matt black synthetic right hand with chrome finger joints. Faint ocular neural interface glow in left eye. Subcutaneous armor plating ridges visible on ribs. Wearing black reinforced Hegemony tactical cargo pants, charcoal matte jacket, worn Neo-Gen combat boots. Faded Cyrillic wrist tattoo. Coiled, alert posture, direct intense gaze. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, noir lighting with neon accent, gritty urban environment, moody cinematic atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex genetic blend of Hispanic/Latin American (49.9%), Sub-Saharan African (29.2%), East Asian (14.8%), and North African (6.1%) ancestry. This combination creates warm medium-brown skin with golden-reddish undertones, angular facial structure with pronounced cheekbones and strong jaw, and refined eye shape with subtle epicanthic fold influence. The multi-continental mix produces a striking, distinctly weathered appearance.', 168, 62, N'Lean and corded with functional muscle; the physique of someone who does her own wet work. No excess, all efficiency.', N'Steel gray with natural black roots, intentionally maintained for the contrast', N'Pulled into a tight, functional braid coiled at the base of her skull', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with faint amber neon threading in the iris—subcutaneous neural interface marker', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and reddish undertones from the Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African blend, deepened and weathered by decades of GLMZ exposure. North African ancestry contributes subtle warmth and depth to undertone complexity.', N'Weathered, angular face with sharp cheekbones and prominent jaw from African and Latin heritage. Dark brown eyes with subtle epicanthic fold from East Asian ancestry. Minimal grooming, no cosmetics. Two parallel scars mark her left temple, faded but visible. Skin has lived-in texture from decades in variable climate without excessive skincare. Scattered pockmark scars across shoulders and upper back.', N'Right hand replaced from wrist down—matt black synthetic composite with articulated chrome finger joints and visible haptic feedback nodes along the palm. Left eye has a faint luminescent quality when light catches it at certain angles (ocular neural interface). Subcutaneous armor plating visible as faint geometric ridges beneath the skin of her ribs on the right side.', N'Economical and alert. She moves as though always assessing exits and threats—shoulders slightly forward, weight distributed to the balls of her feet. Her right synthetic hand is never still, micro-adjusting, testing grip. Direct eye contact is constant, almost aggressive. When at rest, there''s a coiled quality to her; she doesn''t relax, only pauses.', N'Tier 3 utilitarian with older-model high-end components. Black reinforced cargo pants (Hegemony tactical cut, circa 2220) with structural webbing at the thighs. Charcoal matte jacket with internal holster rig visible when unbuttoned. Worn Neo-Gen combat boots, re-soled twice. A faded leather wristband on her left arm—older than her augmentations, possibly sentimental. No visible branding; she dresses for function, not status.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'valentina_boateng');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a664-73ff-bb17-0b2dd6e08dc1', N'Anamika Touré', N'Anamika', N'', N'Touré', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'Neighborhood council chair and mutual aid organizer', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone Council; informal ties to the Gray Zone Mutual Aid Collective', N'Anamika Touré is a broad-shouldered woman with deep brown skin mapped by two decades of outdoor organizing — laugh lines deep enough to hold water, a scar bisecting her left eyebrow from a Ferrogate Transit riot she never talks about publicly. Her hair is close-cropped and shot through with silver she refuses to dye, and she wears her council armband like other people wear jewelry: always present, never decorative. She moves through the Highland Park Autonomous Zone like she owns it, which in the most meaningful sense she does — she helped draft the mutual ownership charter fifteen years ago.

Anamika Touré projects a maternal authority that disarms people before they realize she''s already assessed them. She is genuinely warm, relentlessly practical, and quietly furious at almost everything. She believes the revolution will be won not in dramatic confrontations with corponation enforcers but in the accumulated weight of a thousand unglamorous decisions: who gets the medicine vouchers, which family gets the vacant unit, how to keep the food collective solvent when Axiom quietly buys up the distribution network. She is not naive enough to think goodness wins. She is stubborn enough to do it anyway.', N'Quest giver, community anchor, moral compass for the neighborhood. She can point players toward resources, local conflicts, and people who need help — or people who are causing harm. She knows where every body is buried in Highland Park, metaphorically and occasionally literally.', N'', N'Subdermal medical alert chip (welfare-tier, original issue from 2179). No cosmetic mods. She made a public point of declining geneware when it became fashionable — a choice she now half-regrets as politically legible in ways she didn''t anticipate.', N'Up before dawn to manage the morning food distribution queue, then council correspondence, then three to five in-person disputes to mediate before evening community forum. She eats whatever''s left over from distribution.', N'Anamika Touré, mid-50s woman with rich deep warm brown skin tone and complex ancestry visible in broad prominent cheekbones and strong facial structure. Close-cropped black hair with silver threading, left eyebrow bisected by thin pale scar extending to temple. Dark alert eyes with pronounced laugh lines, deep concentration creases on forehead. Broad-shouldered and solid build, 172cm tall, weathered forearms showing solar damage from decades of outdoor organizing work. Wearing loose earth-tone cotton-linen long-sleeve shirt with rolled sleeves, reinforced cargo pants with multiple pockets, worn synthetic leather belt, broken-in scuffed work boots. Faded olive drab council armband on left arm. Thin worn steel wedding band. Shoulder bag present. Standing in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone Tier 4 zone administrative space, circa 2226. Deliberate posture, hands at sides or gesturing with purpose. Ambient overhead lighting casting subtle shadows on weathered face. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, practical Tier 4 clothing, mood of quiet authority and responsibility. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (68.6%) with substantial Indigenous American (28.2%) ancestry and minor Southeast Asian (3.2%) influence. This genetic combination creates a striking phenotype: the deep warmth and broad facial structure of Sub-Saharan African heritage is enriched by the warm golden-bronze undertones and strong cheekbones of Indigenous American ancestry, with subtle refinement to eye shape and bone structure from Southeast Asian genetics. The result is a complexion of remarkable depth and richness — earthy, sun-warmed, and multidimensional.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, muscular from decades of physical labor and outdoor organizing rather than gym work. Carries weight with density, not softness. Chest and shoulders suggest someone accustomed to carrying things — literal and metaphorical.', N'Natural black with deep silver threading throughout', N'Close-cropped, low-maintenance fade with subtle texture; no styling beyond basic grooming', N'Short', N'Deep dark brown, alert and assessing', N'Deep warm brown with complex undertones — earthy richness from Sub-Saharan African heritage enhanced by golden-bronze warmth from Indigenous American ancestry. Sun-weathered with visible solar elastosis on forearms and shoulders from decades of outdoor exposure. Natural depth and luminosity even in artificial light.', N'Pronounced laugh lines radiating from eyes and mouth; deep forehead creases from decades of concentration and outdoor work. Broad cheekbones prominent — characteristic of both Sub-Saharan African and Indigenous American heritage. Full lips with naturally defined borders. Strong, squared jaw. Facial structure shows the genetic blend clearly in the width of the face and angularity of bone. Skin texture uneven in places — sun damage on shoulders and forearms consistent with prolonged outdoor exposure. Left eyebrow bisected by a thin pale scar running from brow ridge to temple, fully healed but visible against darker skin. No makeup. Minimal grooming beyond necessity.', N'None visible. Subdermal medical alert chip located beneath left collarbone is not visible without direct skin inspection or scanner.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical efficiency. Shoulders back, spine straight — a posture of responsibility rather than militarism. Makes sustained eye contact. Walks slowly through spaces she manages, as if inventory is taking place in her head. Gestures are purposeful, hands often occupied with holding something or gesturing for others to sit/listen. Hands often at her sides or holding council documents/armband.', N'Tier 4 practical. Favors loose-fitting, durable synthetic blends in earth tones and grays. Cotton-linen blend long-sleeve shirt (sleeves often rolled) paired with reinforced work pants or cargo trousers with multiple pockets. Worn synthetic leather belt holding council armband on left arm — the armband itself is faded olive drab with embroidered zone designation, treated as official regalia. Comfortable, broken-in work boots (non-chrome, scuffed leather). A lightweight windbreaker or canvas coat depending on season. No jewelry except a simple steel band on her left ring finger (wedding ring, worn thin). No visible brands; all clothing is functional and sourced through collective networks or secondhand. A shoulder bag, always present, containing council correspondence, medical supplies, and food distribution ledgers.', N'She negotiated a quiet back-channel arrangement with a mid-tier Axiom facilities manager eight years ago — he looks the other way on certain zoning violations in exchange for her steering labor disputes away from two specific Axiom properties. It has kept the zone solvent. It eats at her every single day.', N'Plain, direct, prefers concrete nouns. Slips into formal register when she wants to signal seriousness. Occasional Igbo phrases when emotional.', N'Measured and unhurried, like someone who has learned that rushing a sentence wastes time. Pauses before answering anything important.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anamika_tour');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c7-7403-b984-0b6260ee1fac', N'Drift Tran-Inoue-Im', N'Drift', N'', N'Tran-Inoue-Im', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 25, 2, N'active', N'The Circuit, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Fixer - Axiom proxy', N'Tessera Corponation (mid-level fixer)', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Drift Tran-Inoue-Im, 188cm tall Asian-diaspora fixer, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones and subtle depth, sharp angular East Asian features with Southeast Asian bone structure and Middle Eastern warmth. Dark brown hair with silver temples, closely cropped fade. Deep brown eyes with crow''s feet. Thin 8cm scar from left cheekbone to jaw. Clean-shaven, meticulous grooming. Faded Cyrillic tattoo on right inner forearm. Wearing tailored charcoal blazer, matte black expensive synthetic shirt, slim dark gray nano-fabric trousers, worn leather ankle boots. Platinum wedding band, vintage analog watch, silver chain at neck. Deliberate posture, hands slightly fidgeting. Mid-2200s near-future megacity setting, dimly lit corporate atrium or neon-lit café corner, processing information with guarded expression. Professional, understated, wealthy through reputation. GLMZ, moody atmospheric lighting, cinematic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'East Asian (51.4%), Southeast Asian (29.0%), Middle Eastern (15.4%), and Sub-Saharan African (4.2%) ancestry — a true product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. His genetic makeup creates a striking phenotype: warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden undertones and hints of deeper warmth from African heritage, refined angular features blending Southeast and East Asian bone structure with the warmth of Middle Eastern heritage, and the broad bone structure characteristic of East Asian ancestry.', 188, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and muscular with slight softening at the midsection — the physique of someone who trained hard in younger years and now maintains through sporadic gym sessions and metabolic boosters rather than discipline', N'Dark brown with silver threading at the temples', N'Closely cropped fade, neat and professional', N'Short', N'Deep brown, slightly tired-looking', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones and subtle deeper warmth beneath the surface — the complex blending of East Asian, Southeast Asian, Middle Eastern, and African ancestry creating rich, multitonal depth with a luminosity that shifts in different lighting, never appearing flat or uniform', N'Smooth and refined with defined cheekbones and a strong, slightly tapered jawline reflecting East and Southeast Asian heritage, with warmth and subtle depth from Middle Eastern and African ancestry. Faint scar running from his left cheekbone toward his ear. Grooming is meticulous — clean-shaven daily, skin maintained with subcutaneous hydration regulators. Crow''s feet suggest he smiles more than frowns, though his default expression is guarded. Subtle warmth to his complexion that shifts in different lighting.', N'None visible. His augmentations are subcutaneous neural arrays and likely internal reputation/credit management tech — the tools of a fixer who brokers information and favors. No chrome, no LED optics, no visible mods.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical grace — never rushing, always aware of the room. Shoulders naturally squared, head level. When seated, he sits back and to the side, never fully committed to comfort. Maintains eye contact during negotiations but looks away when listening, processing. Hands are rarely still; he fidgets with rings, cuffs, or a worn brass lighter.', N'Tier 2-3 business casual: tailored charcoal synth-wool blazer over a matte black synthetic shirt (no logo, expensive weave). Slim-fit dark gray trousers with subtle grid-pattern nano-fabric at the knees. Worn-in leather ankle boots, scuffed and comfortable. Accessorized with a platinum-finish wedding band (worn but maintained), a vintage mechanical watch on his left wrist (analog, pre-digital, a collector''s piece), and a thin silver chain at his neck disappearing beneath his shirt. Everything is understated, expensive, and deliberately non-flashy — the uniform of someone who builds wealth through reputation rather than display.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'drift_tran_inoue_im');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a621-70b2-8bcd-0b7f740ee62d', N'Dmitri Ingebrigtsen-Szabó', N'Dmitri', N'', N'Ingebrigtsen-Szabó', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 33, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Crucible Square — open-air market, Tier 1-2 commerce, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Network intrusion and digital warfare specialist — netrunner', N'Independent — Lattice territory specialist', N'Dmitri Ingebrigtsen-Szabó is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 33, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ice in the brain — and he makes no effort to hide it.

His entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. He works as a netrunner out of Crucible Square, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Dmitri Ingebrigtsen-Szabó is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who he burned last.', N'As a netrunner, Hadiya Forsberg-Ofosu embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ICE in the brain. Eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Dmitri Ingebrigtsen-Szabó: lean 178cm male with warm medium-brown Southeast Asian-dominant complexion and golden undertones, high cheekbones, structured jaw blending Asian and Eastern European features. Dark brown hair with bronze tones, short and swept back. Left eye warm organic brown, right eye cybernetic matte black with cyan circuit tracery. Chrome neural dampener port visible at base of skull with lead-gray wiring. Dark grey compression shirt under matte black synthweave jacket with reinforced seams, charcoal cargo pants, scuffed military-grade boots. Faint kanji dataflow tattoo on left forearm over old burn scars. Silver worn ring on left middle finger. Economical posture, visible tension in shoulders, slight forward angle favoring augmented eye side. Moody low-light setting, cool neon ambiance casting shadows across angular face, emphasizing cybernetic implants and intricate bone structure. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Crucible Square', N'local', N'Crucible Square', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (55.8%) with significant Eastern European (29.7%), East Asian (10.2%), and South Asian (4.3%) admixture. The genetic blend creates a distinctive pan-Asian appearance with strong Southeast Asian baseline: warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden undertones, refined by Eastern European bone structure complexity and East Asian refinement. High cheekbones and structured jaw reflect the convergence of multiple Asian and European lineages, with the Southeast Asian warmth dominating the overall visual impression.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with visible musculature — wiry rather than bulk, built for precision and endurance rather than power. Chest and shoulders show the kind of tension that comes from years of controlled stress.', N'Dark brown with natural bronze undertones', N'Worn short and functional, swept back from the face with minimal styling effort', N'Short', N'Left eye: warm brown, organic. Right eye: matte black with faint cyan circuit-line tracery, cybernetic.', N'Medium-warm brown with golden undertones — the Southeast Asian genetic dominance (55.8%) creates rich depth and warmth, refined by Eastern European pale undertones and East Asian refinement into a cohesive warm-medium complexion.', N'Sharp, high cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian heritage, structured jaw with defined bone structure influenced by Eastern European genetics. Skin shows warm medium-brown tone with subtle golden cast. Skin condition is clean but shows the wear of stress — faint lines around the eyes, the kind that come from squinting at screens in low light. No visible scarring on the face.', N'Neural dampener at base of skull with visible chrome backing and wiring. Right eye is cybernetic — matte black faceplate with faint circuit tracery, noticeably different from the warm brown of the left eye. No visible arm or leg augmentations.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Tends to keep his augmented eye side slightly forward in conversation, a habit born from always knowing where the threat is. When still, there is visible tension in his shoulders and jaw, like a coiled spring. Hands are steady, fingers occasionally twitching in small, unconscious patterns — muscle memory for keyboard work.', N'Tier 3 practical — dark grey long-sleeve compression shirt fitted to his lean frame, worn under a matte black synthweave jacket with reinforced seams and interior pockets designed for hardware. Cargo pants in charcoal with multiple sealed pockets. Boots are military-grade synthetic leather, scuffed from regular use. No visible corporate branding. A single piece of jewelry: a silver ring on his left middle finger, worn thin — the origin is not discussed.', N'Hadiya Forsberg-Ofosu betrayed their previous crew to survive a corporate raid. The crew didn''t survive. Nobody in GLMZ knows this.', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dmitri_ingebrigtsen_szab');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62f-7de1-947c-0bb54741ca91', N'Aytul Bautista', N'Aytul', N'', N'Bautista', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The fungus warrens beneath Hough Reclamation, accessed through the Undertow''s eastern branches, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Fungus Farmer — cultivates bioluminescent and edible fungi in the deep tunnels, primary food supplier for two Bore Rat settlements', N'Loosely affiliated with The Undertow''s eastern settlements; trade agreements with two Bore Rat clans', N'Aytul Bautista is compact and perpetually damp — there is no dry season in the fungus warrens, and after eight years of working them they carry that moisture like a second skin. Their hair is grown long and twisted back with strips of mycelium netting, threaded through with small glowing fungal clusters they''ve cultivated specifically for the caps: blue-white pinpricks of light that bob gently when they move. The effect is lovely and entirely practical — their hands are often full and they need the light somewhere that isn''t their hands. Their skin has taken on the faint phosphorescent undertone of someone who has been in bioluminescent spaces long enough for trace compounds to accumulate in the epidermis — doctors would call it benign; Aytul Bautista calls it home.

They are fiercely competent and aware of it, which comes across as confidence to people who like them and arrogance to people who don''t. They know more about fungal biology than most surface mycologists and have never been to school. Every strain of fungus in their warren was either cultivated from existing specimens or cross-developed through patient experimentation over years. They talk about their fungi with the affection and matter-of-fact practicality of a parent, and they are not warm with people the way they are warm with their work — humans are loud and destructive, and they need to be managed. Fungi, at least, respond predictably to care.', N'Resource node and local expert — the settlements they supply depend on them, giving Imara unexpected leverage. Information source on what''s moving through the eastern Undertow (traders always gossip). Potential quest giver when their supply lines are threatened.', N'', N'Cosmetic: fungal bioluminescent clusters in hair (cultivated, living, maintained like jewelry). Practical: pheromone-sensitivity enhancement mod (allows detection of fungal volatile compounds — invaluable for farming) purchased secondhand.', N'Their day begins and ends by the warren''s moisture cycles rather than any clock. They spend four to six hours tending growth, harvesting, managing substrate. The rest of their time goes to trade negotiations, seed-stock protection, and the ongoing project of developing a strain that grows faster on low-nutrient substrate.', N'Aytul Bautista, a 162cm compact figure with warm deep brown skin bearing golden and olive undertones, standing in a dim underground warren. Dark eyes with iridescent sheen reflect soft bioluminescent light. Long dark brown hair twisted into thick braids woven with glowing blue-white fungal fruiting bodies that cast eerie phosphorescent light across damp skin. Face shows South Asian-North African-Sub-Saharan blend: prominent cheekbones, defined bone structure, broader facial planes, with subtle East Asian eye complexity. Forearms corded with lean muscle, hands showing organic staining and mycelial scarring in branching patterns across palms. Wearing muted gray and deep blue synth-blend field clothes, heavily patched, with reinforced canvas cultivation apron. Waterproof sealed jacket, para-cord utility belt, bare feet or wrap-sandals. Skin glistens with perpetual moisture, faint phosphorescence visible on upper chest, neck, temples. Posture shows slight forward hunch from warren work, hands making small precise adjusting gestures. Standing in humid underground agricultural cavern with substrate beds and glowing fungal networks. GLMZ, Warren District, measured and focused presence, contained capability, bioluminescent aesthetic, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The fungus warrens beneath Hough Reclamation', N'local', N'The fungus warrens beneath Hough Reclamation', N'Complex genetic tapestry of South Asian (45%), Hispanic/Latin American (21.6%), North African (20.3%), Sub-Saharan African (10.5%), and East Asian (2.6%) ancestry—a living reflection of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The dominant South Asian genetics provide foundational structure, while the substantial North African and Sub-Saharan African components contribute to broader facial planes and stronger jaw definition. Hispanic/Latin American ancestry adds warmth and subtle angularity to cheekbones. The minor East Asian influence is visible in slight epicanthic fold complexity and refined eye shape nuance.', 162, 58, N'Compact and wiry with lean musculature developed from years of repetitive cultivation work — shoulders slightly rounded from hunching over substrate beds, forearms corded with fine strength', N'Dark brown with faint bioluminescent blue-white accents from fungal clusters woven into the braids', N'Long and twisted into multiple thick plaits secured with strips of mycelium netting, interspersed with small cultivated fungal fruiting bodies that glow softly', N'Long', N'Dark brown with faint iridescent sheen from trace bioluminescent compound accumulation', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones and subtle olive complexity from the South Asian-North African-Sub-Saharan blend, appearing slightly pale from minimal surface-world sun exposure. The tone reads as rich and dimensional rather than flat—warmth concentrated in the mid-face and chest, cooler undertones along the jawline reflecting the North African and East Asian components', N'Perpetually damp skin with a faint phosphorescent undertone visible in low light—the glow is most noticeable on the upper chest, neck, and temples where fungal compounds have accumulated. Facial structure shows South Asian-derived prominent cheekbones and defined bone structure, broadened and strengthened by North African and Sub-Saharan African features, with the subtle eye shape complexity from East Asian ancestry. Nails stained with organic matter and kept short and blunt for practicality. No facial hair; skin often shows minor cuts and abrasions from warren work, healing cleanly with minimal scarring', N'The fungal bioluminescent clusters woven throughout their hair are the primary visible augmentation — living organisms cultivated and maintained as both light source and adornment. The pheromone-sensitivity mod is subcutaneous and invisible except for the faint scar lines at installation points on the inner wrists. The cumulative phosphorescence of their skin from years of exposure reads as cosmetic rather than augmentation', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Slight forward hunch from warren work, but corrects posture when stationary. Hands are rarely still, often making small adjusting or checking gestures. Walks at a measured pace with careful foot placement. Head tilts slightly when listening, as though triangulating information. There is an air of contained capability and patient focus', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian: moisture-wicking synth-blend field clothes in muted grays and deep blues, heavily patched and stained with organic material. Reinforced canvas apron with multiple deep pockets for tools and specimen containers. Waterproof hooded jacket with sealed seams, well-worn. Simple para-cord wrapped around the waist for quick equipment attachment. No jewelry except the living fungal crown. Feet are either bare or in simple water-resistant wrap-sandals designed for warren conditions. Clothes show no corporate branding or tier-status indicator — everything is function-forward and durable', N'They''ve discovered a strain of fungus that produces a potent neurotoxin alongside its edible body — they''ve kept it quarantined in a private section of the warren, telling themselves it''s for research, but they know part of why they haven''t destroyed it is that it''s leverage they''ve never needed to use yet.', N'Dense with mycological terminology they don''t always translate — they forget not everyone knows what ''substrate'', ''inoculation'', ''mycelial network'' mean', N'Fast and associative when excited about their work, clipped and precise when conducting trade', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aytul_bautista');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63d-7936-bd59-0bc55b15bfa3', N'Hanka Cisneros', N'Hanka', N'', N'Cisneros', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Steamvent Alley — geothermal district, hot and chemical-smelling, near North Ave and Damen', N'Structural breach and explosive ordnance specialist — demolitions expert', N'Independent — works solo contracts', N'Hanka Cisneros are average height but with a presence that fills more space than the body accounts for. At 23, their face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and they have learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ice in the brain — and they make no effort to hide it.

They taught themself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know them best. They work as a demolitions expert out of Steamvent Alley, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Hanka Cisneros describe them as a precision instrument — point them at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Kamala Blomberg-Konadu is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When they make a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of their stories.', N'', N'Neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ICE in the brain. Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Hanka Cisneros, a 170cm lean muscular figure with deep warm brown skin glowing with golden undertones, standing in harsh neo-noir neon lighting. Sharp-featured face reflecting multicontinental ancestry — high cheekbones, angular jaw, subtle epicanthal folds, with old chemical burn scars visible on right temple and cheekbone. Dark brown eyes with faint silver neural threading. Asymmetrical dark brown hair with bleached platinum undercut on left side, longer slicked-back right side. Displaying visible cybernetic augmentations: dark chromed hydraulic elbow joints, neural dampener with silver-chrome threading at right temple creating subtle shimmer. Wearing dark gray reinforced tactical pants with tool loops, sleeveless shirt to expose augmentations, heavy-duty geothermal boots, weathered black synthetic jacket with heat-scorch and chemical stains. Duralloy bracelet on left wrist. Posture balanced and economical, weight forward, measuring gaze. Standing in moody industrial setting with hard shadows and neon glow from above, GLMZ geothermal district aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Steamvent Alley', N'local', N'Steamvent Alley', N'Complex diaspora blend: Sub-Saharan African (41.8%), South Asian (17.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (17.7%), Eastern European (10.2%), East Asian (7.9%), North African (4.6%). Features reflect this intricate ancestry — warm deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones creating luminous depth. Facial structure combines high cheekbones and angular jaw from South Asian and Eastern European heritage, broadened by Sub-Saharan African bone geometry. Eye shape carries subtle epicanthal folds from East Asian ancestry, rounded by the broader eye set of African heritage. Overall appearance is distinctly multicontinental: neither fully any single ancestry, but a harmonious synthesis of multiple genetic traditions.', 170, 68, N'Lean and muscular with functional density — no wasted mass. Shoulders and forearms show defined musculature from repetitive strain and deliberate conditioning. Core is tight. They move like someone who has trained their body as a tool.', N'Dark brown with bleached platinum undercut', N'Asymmetrical shave on left side; longer on right side, slicked back. Deliberate and maintained.', N'Medium (right side), very short (left side)', N'Dark brown with faint silver neural interface threading visible around the iris', N'Deep warm brown with golden and subtle olive undertones — luminous depth reflecting the blend of Sub-Saharan African base with South Asian warmth and slight Eastern European and North African cooling. Skin appears to shift between warm gold and subtle olive depending on light angle.', N'Sharp cheekbones and angular jaw reflect South Asian and Eastern European structure, enhanced by Sub-Saharan African bone geometry creating a distinctive facial architecture. Skin is clear but marked by old chemical burns on the right temple (faded to white scar tissue) and burn scarring on right cheekbone. Expression is typically neutral — learned impassivity. Skin condition is deliberately maintained despite occupational wear.', N'Neural dampener visible as a slight bulge and faint silver-chrome threading at the right temple, visible especially when light hits the scar tissue. The implant creates a subtle shimmer under skin. Hydraulic joints in both knees and elbows are partially visible — dark chromed plating at the elbow joints, visible through thin clothing or when moving. A faint hydraulic hiss is audible when they bend quickly.', N'Stands with weight balanced, shoulders back but not rigid. Moves economically — no wasted motion. When at rest, their gaze is always measuring: distance, angles, structural integrity of their surroundings. They walk with a slight forward lean, as if perpetually ready to move. Hand movements are controlled and deliberate.', N'Tier 3-4 functional wear — reinforced tactical pants in dark gray with visible tool loops and cargo pockets, usually carrying detonators or inspection equipment. Sleeveless or short-sleeved shirts to display augmented joints as a form of transparent credibility. Heavy-duty boots with reinforced ankle support, usually Titan-brand or equivalent geothermal district grade. Worn leather or synthetic jacket in black, covered in small heat-scorch marks and chemical stains from work. No corporate logos or branding — deliberately anonymous. Minimal jewelry except for a thin duralloy bracelet on left wrist (no visible function, possibly personal).', N'Kamala Blomberg-Konadu can''t read. Hides it behind voice interfaces and memorization. The shame is older than the chrome.', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hanka_cisneros');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a642-7210-8da9-0c29768d4bda', N'Anyelu Thorvaldsdóttir-Petrović', N'Anyelu', N'', N'Thorvaldsdóttir-Petrović', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 35, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Canopy — elevated walkway district above Geartown, near Lincoln and Addison', N'Counter-surveillance and mole detection — counterintelligence specialist', N'Independent — known in Old Harbor circles', N'Anyelu Thorvaldsdóttir-Petrović is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 35, there''s something unfinished about her face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — cranial bomb defuser — specialized implant that detects and neutralizes cortex b — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. She works as a counterintelligence specialist out of The Canopy, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Anyelu Thorvaldsdóttir-Petrović has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and she cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Kenji Guerrero-Osei-Mensah functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Cranial bomb defuser — specialized implant that detects and neutralizes cortex bombs in others. Synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Anyelu Thorvaldsdóttir-Petrović, GLMZ, East Asian-dominant features with sharp cheekbones and monolid geometry, angular Eastern European jaw, warm honey-amber skin tone from Middle Eastern ancestry, 168cm lean angular build with visible muscle definition. Deep brown eyes with metallic threading from cranial implant. Black hair with silver undertones pulled in functional braid, loose strands escaping. Jagged surgical scar right temple to ear with subtle chrome shimmer and dark LED markers. Stress-worn face with fine lines around eyes. Wearing dark synthetic jacket with holster points, reinforced cargo pants, matte-black boots, long-sleeved base layer. Worn data-ring on left index finger. Posture coiled and economical, weight forward, eyes scanning. Standing in Geartown shadows, neon ambient lighting catching the implant''s faint chrome, cool blue undertones in shadow, tired and dangerous. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Canopy', N'local', N'The Canopy', N'Predominantly East Asian (73.0%) with Eastern European (18.3%) and Middle Eastern (8.7%) ancestry — a striking blend that manifests in her sharp features and distinctive facial geometry. The East Asian heritage dominates her eye shape, cheekbone structure, and overall face proportions, while the Eastern European ancestry adds angular definition to her jaw and brow ridge. The Middle Eastern ancestry brings warmth and depth to her skin undertones, creating golden-honey and amber warmth rather than cool pink undertones.', 168, 58, N'Lean and angular with visible muscle definition — a runner''s physiology, all efficiency and no excess. Shoulders sharp, collarbone prominent, limbs suggest coiled potential rather than bulk.', N'Black with silver undertones from synthetic treatment', N'Pulled back in a functional braid, practical for work. A few loose strands always escape.', N'Medium', N'Deep brown with faint metallic threads visible in the iris — side effect of cranial implant integration', N'Warm medium tone with golden-honey and amber undertones — the result of predominantly East Asian genetics (73%) with Eastern European and Middle Eastern ancestry blending to create a warm, luminous complexion rather than cool or neutral undertones', N'Sharp, defined cheekbones with gentle monolid eye geometry characteristic of East Asian heritage, angular jaw and brow ridge from Eastern European ancestry, warm undertones from Middle Eastern ancestry. Minimal grooming beyond necessity. Skin shows the wear of irregular sleep and high stress — small lines around the eyes, a tightness at the mouth. Scar tissue along the right temple from surgical integration.', N'The cranial implant is obvious — a faint shimmer of chrome visible at the right temple beneath thinning skin, subtle LED indicators (currently dark) embedded in the surgical scar. When active, a thin line of soft blue light traces the implant''s perimeter. No visible limb augmentations, but her movements suggest subcutaneous reinforcement — she moves with deliberate, calculated precision.', N'Stands with weight slightly forward, never fully relaxed. Moves economically, every gesture purposeful. Eyes scan environments automatically — a habit so ingrained it''s unconscious. Hands rest near her body, always within rapid access distance. Speaks quietly, forcing others to pay attention rather than projecting. There''s a coiled quality to her stillness, like a spring compressed.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: dark synthetic jacket with interior holster points, reinforced cargo pants with thigh pockets and gear loops, matte-black boots with responsive sole-tech for rapid movement. Wears a long-sleeved base layer even in warm weather — functional as armor and habit. Minimal jewelry except for a worn data-ring on her left index finger. No corporate logos or tier signifiers; her gear is battered, maintained, and deliberately anonymous. Everything chosen for access, movement, and the ability to disappear into Geartown crowds.', N'', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anyelu_thorvaldsd_ttir_petrovi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5bc-7735-9705-0c455deede82', N'Dunni Abdykadyrov-Adu', N'Dunni', N'', N'Abdykadyrov-Adu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 32, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit — neon-lit entertainment and vice district, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Personal security and threat neutralization — bodyguard', N'Independent — operates through reputation only', N'Dunni Abdykadyrov-Adu is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 32, the augmentation scarring around her temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers a — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Born and raised in GLMZ, third generation — she has the city in her blood, its rhythms in her bones, its cruelty in her expectations. She works as a bodyguard out of The Circuit, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Dunni Abdykadyrov-Adu has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and she cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Aybek Sato-Poku functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers at 50 meters. Subdermal armor plating across torso and forearms — military surplus, scratched serial numbers', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Dunni Abdykadyrov-Adu, 172cm lean angular woman with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones, black hair in tight utilitarian braid, dark brown eyes with intense watchful expression. Broad midface width and prominent angular cheekbones reflecting Central Asian-East Asian-African blend. Visible brushed chrome cyberears flush against skull with microphone arrays. Fine white scarring at temples, thin scar along left jawline. Black syntileather jacket worn open over dark gray thermal undershirt, black tactical cargo pants, steel-toed boots. Silver antique bracelet on left wrist. Subdermal armor plating visible under skin creating geometric distortions, creates uncanny lines beneath fitted clothing. Standing alert with economical posture, weight distributed for rapid movement. Nocturnal near-future megacity setting, cool blue and amber neon lighting, gritty industrial background, moody atmospheric 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. Sharp focus on angular facial structure and functional augmentations. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Central Asian-dominant diaspora: 62.7% Central Asian ancestry (historically Turkic and Mongolic populations) forms the primary genetic base, combined with 25.4% East Asian contributing to facial structure, eye shape, and cheekbone prominence, and 11.9% Sub-Saharan African enriching skin depth and undertone warmth. The genetic blend produces a warm medium brown complexion with subtle golden undertones, characteristic of the historical Silk Road crossroads reflected in her ancestry.', 172, 58, N'Lean and angular with corded muscle definition from combat conditioning and maintenance work. No excess body fat — functional frame optimized for speed and precision rather than power.', N'Black with natural blue-black sheen', N'Pulled back in a tight, utilitarian braid that runs down the back of her skull. Occasionally worn loose, but function dictates containment.', N'Long', N'Dark brown — natural, unaugmented, with the flat intensity of someone who watches for threats automatically', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones, slightly deepened by the Sub-Saharan African component. Nocturnal pallor prevents sun-darkening, but the underlying warmth remains evident. Not sallow — luminous against darker lighting.', N'Broad midface width characteristic of Central Asian ancestry balanced by prominent, angular cheekbones influenced by East Asian heritage. Eye shape shows East Asian configuration with slight epicanthic fold. Minimal facial fat reveals sharp jawline and defined bone structure. Warm golden-brown skin tone consistent throughout. A few surgical scars visible at the temples from cyberear installation, white against the darker skin.', N'Cyberears are fully visible — brushed chrome or matte black synthetic mounted flush against the skull where human ears would be, with visible microphone arrays and minimal aesthetic concern for appearance. The installation is clean but unmistakably functional. Subdermal armor plating creates subtle angular distortions under skin on torso and forearms — visible when she moves or flexes, creating an uncanny geometric quality to her silhouette. The plating shows through thin or fitted clothing as hard lines beneath the surface.', N'Economical and alert. Stands with weight distributed for rapid movement in any direction. Her head tracks sounds independently of where her eyes are looking — a behavioral tic from the cyberears'' directional sensitivity. Moves with the controlled precision of someone trained to avoid wasted motion. When relaxed, there''s still tension in her shoulders and hands.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian — function over flash, built for the work. Black syntileather jacket with reinforced shoulders and sleeves, worn open most nights. Fitted dark gray thermal undershirt (helps regulate body temperature during nocturnal hours). Black tactical cargo pants with multiple sealed pockets for tools, ammunition, or data chips. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and well-maintained. A single silver bracelet on her left wrist — antique, possibly family — is the only personal jewelry. No visible corpo logos or affiliation markers. Minimal grooming products; her appearance is by necessity, not design.', N'', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dunni_abdykadyrov_adu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5fd-7d61-a16f-0c78246a9ee7', N'Bahram Baek', N'Bahram', N'', N'Baek', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 33, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'The Lattice — vertical slum built into scaffolding of an unfinished arcology, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Field trauma surgeon and combat support — combat medic', N'Freelance — multi-district operator', N'Bahram Baek are athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 33, scars map their face like a transit diagram of bad decisions and worse luck. The chrome is visible — bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release — and they make no effort to hide it.

They inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. They work as a combat medic out of The Lattice, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Bahram Baek operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Ebele Smirnov-Ankrah represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Their stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release. Eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Bahram Baek, 178cm field medic operative, warm medium-deep brown skin with complex global undertones, sharp defined jawline with moderate prominent cheekbones reflecting pan-Asian and African heritage, surgical scars across left cheekbone and right brow, dark hair in practical braid with silver threading at temples. Left eye warm organic brown, right eye unmistakable chrome cybernetic with iridescent iris glowing faintly. Chrome bioware neck interface visible along jawline. Black reinforced synthetic jacket with thermal regulation, kevlar underlayer at wrists and collar, military cargo pants with equipment pockets, steel-toed boots, modular medical belt. Lean athletic build, economical precise posture, neutral observation-focused expression. Nocturnal urban environment, neon-edged shadows, cool blue-green neo-noir lighting casting highlights on chrome eye and neck interface, industrial zone background with rain-slicked surfaces reflecting neon. Mood: alert, functional, predatory calm. Professional field operator aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Lattice', N'local', N'The Lattice', N'Intricate pan-global tapestry: Eastern European (33.3%), East Asian (27.5%), Southeast Asian (16.7%), South Asian (12.3%), and Sub-Saharan African (10.2%) ancestry creates a distinctly dimensional phenotype. Facial architecture reflects this synthesis — moderate epicanthic folds with defined supraorbital ridges, cheekbones that bridge East and Central Asian prominence with warmer undertones from South Asian and African heritage. Nose bridge carries Eastern European refinement with slightly broader base from Southeast Asian and African ancestry. Jawline sharp and defined, softened only slightly by the warm melanin distribution across the face. The overall effect is a harmonious blending where no single heritage dominates visually — instead creating a unique composite that reads as authentically contemporary diaspora.', 178, 72, N'Athletic and lean with defined musculature — dancer''s flexibility combined with fighter''s density. Low body fat, efficient movement economy. Built for sustained exertion and precision, not bulk.', N'Natural dark brown with premature silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid. No styling for aesthetics — pure function. Occasionally loose for night operations.', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unbraided)', N'Left eye: warm brown, organic. Right eye: cybernetic with iridescent chrome iris, capable of zoom and recording.', N'Warm medium-deep brown with complex undertones — melanin-rich African and South Asian base enhanced by East Asian and Southeast Asian warmth, tempered by cooler Eastern European undertones. Rich, luminous complexion with dimensional depth and subtle golden undertone.', N'Face mapped with surgical scars: one diagonal across left cheekbone (3cm, white and thin), another above right brow (2cm, slightly raised). Jaw defined and sharp with moderately prominent cheekbones reflecting the multicontinental ancestry blend. No facial hair. Skin shows minor pitting around the right eye socket where the prosthetic interfaces — barely noticeable without close inspection. Dark circles permanent from nocturnal schedule. Expression default is neutral, observation-focused.', N'Bioware adrenaline regulator visible as a subtle bulge beneath the left side of the neck, marked by a thin chrome interface line running from collarbone to jawline. Right eye is unmistakably cybernetic — chrome housing with slight luminescence during low-light operations. No attempt at concealment.', N'Moves with economical precision — dancer''s flow combined with predator''s readiness. Weight distributed for instant directional change. Eyes constantly cataloging environment and threat vectors. Stillness when stationary is absolute, no fidgeting. In conversation, maintains visual contact with the cybernetic eye slightly longer than natural (unconscious habit). Walks with slightly favored left side — old injury memory in the body.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian — high-function field medic aesthetic. Black synthetic reinforced jacket (thermal-regulated, pressure-sealed for contamination), kevlar-weave underlayer visible at wrists and collar. Cargo pants with reinforced thigh and calf pockets for medical supplies and tools. Modular belt system with quick-release medical kit attachments. Steel-toed boots rated for industrial hazard zones. Minimal jewelry except for a scratched medical alert chip embedded in left wrist. Everything is maintained, practical, and selected for rapid field deployment. No branding, no status symbols — survival aesthetic.', N'', N'Educated vocabulary wrapped in street delivery — the contrast is deliberate.', N'Halting — speaks in fragments, reassembles thoughts in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bahram_baek');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b6-78ed-8958-0c96839e1db5', N'Aleksander Huitzil-Salazar', N'Aleksander', N'', N'Huitzil-Salazar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 68, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Montclare Quiet, a corner flat above a laundromat she technically still owns half of, near Damen and Armitage', N'Retired union leader, Tier 3, community council chair, grandmother raising two grandchildren', N'Ferrogate Transit Workers Union (retired president, 30-year member); Montclare Quiet Community Council (current chair); Tessera pension recipient', N'Aleksander Huitzil-Salazar is the kind of woman whose presence in a room shifts the acoustics ��� people speak differently, sit straighter, choose their words more carefully. She is not tall but carries herself with the posture of someone who spent thirty years at the front of rooms demanding to be heard. Her heritage is Fijian-Polish, which expresses itself in wide cheekbones, a generous build, and warm brown skin that she has decorated with an elaborate bioluminescent tattoo pattern along both arms — traditional Fijian knotwork rendered in soft gold light, a gift she gave herself on her sixtieth birthday when Tessera''s transit workers finally won the pension reform she''d fought for through three contract cycles. Her hair is silver-black, worn in a thick braid, and she has cat ears — small, rounded, dark-furred — a geneware mod she got to match her grandchildren when they wanted one, which she now considers non-negotiable to her identity.

Aleksander Huitzil-Salazar is formidable and knows it, which means she has spent decades learning to calibrate her formidableness carefully. She can be devastatingly charming when she chooses, withering when she must, and quietly exhausted in the rare moments when no one is looking. She is raising her two grandchildren, Kofi (9) and Mira (6), after her daughter''s breakdown, and the exhaustion of simultaneous community leadership and primary caregiving is the thing she most carefully never shows.', N'Political and community power broker; can broker deals, gather community support, or apply legitimate pressure to local institutions; quest giver for stories about labor rights, housing disputes, or neighborhood protection; provides access to union networks and transit worker information channels.', N'', N'Bioluminescent tattoo array, both arms (gold knotwork, geneware-integrated). Cat ears, dark-furred (geneware, cosmetic). Cochlear enhancement implant, left ear — an old injury from a corporate security clash during the 2168 transit strike left her with significant hearing loss on that side.', N'Up at 0600 to get the grandchildren fed and to school; council business consumes most mornings via comm-calls and in-person mediations; afternoons she tries to reserve for the laundromat''s books and the council''s actual paperwork; picks up Kofi and Mira at 1600 and considers that hour the best part of every day; evenings she reads old union documents, ostensibly for history but really because they calm her.', N'Aleksander Huitzil-Salazar, a 162cm stocky woman with rich mahogany-bronze skin and strong Indigenous American bone structure, high prominent cheekbones, broad facial geometry reflecting 50% Indigenous American, 29.3% Central Asian, and 20.7% Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Silver-black hair in a thick long braid bound with cord and beads. Deep brown alert eyes. Small dark-furred geneware cat ears. Both forearms covered in bioluminescent gold knotwork tattoos that shimmer iridescent. Thin scar running from left temple to jaw. Wearing well-maintained dark jeans, deep emerald button-up shirt, navy cardigan blazer. Sensible leather boots resoled multiple times. Gold wedding band and silver pen on chain. Standing with deliberate posture, weight evenly distributed, commanding presence without aggression. Lived-in lined face with deep laugh lines. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, industrial backdrop, cool neon lighting casting shadows across her face highlighting bone structure and tattoo bioluminescence, serious contemplative mood, negotiator''s patience visible in her gaze. Professional portrait lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Montclare Quiet', N'local', N'Montclare Quiet', N'Indigenous American (50%), Central Asian (29.3%), and Hispanic/Latin American (20.7%) ancestry. This genetic combination creates a striking phenotype with strong Indigenous American bone structure enhanced by Central Asian and Latin American heritage contributions. Her ancestry reflects deep roots of Mesoamerican and Andean lineages mixed with Turkic and Mongolian steppe genetics, resulting in prominent high cheekbones, characteristically broad facial structure, and warm-to-deep skin tones that shift between bronze and rich mahogany with subtle golden undertones.', 162, 78, N'Stocky and substantial, with a wide frame that reads as grounded and immovable. Decades of union organizing and manual labor have built dense muscle beneath generous padding; she moves with the economy of someone who knows exactly how much space she occupies.', N'Silver-black', N'Thick braid, usually bound with a simple cord or elastic, occasionally adorned with small beads her grandchildren have gifted her', N'Long', N'Deep brown, alert and calculating', N'Rich mahogany-bronze with warm golden undertones—a nuanced blend reflecting strong Indigenous American and Latin American heritage with Central Asian depth, creating a complexion that shifts between burnished bronze and deep warm brown depending on light', N'Lined face that reads as lived-in rather than aged; high, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Indigenous American ancestry; broad facial structure with strong jaw carrying Indigenous and Central Asian bone geometry; laugh lines around eyes and mouth are deep and expressive; skin has the slight weathering of someone who spent decades outdoors during transit operations; minimal makeup, usually just a dark lipstick in deep berry or burgundy', N'Bioluminescent tattoo array (geneware-integrated, glowing gold knotwork on both arms). Small rounded dark-furred cat ears (geneware cosmetic modification, proportional to her head, always alert). Left ear shows a barely-visible surgical scar where cochlear enhancement implant was installed — the implant itself is internal and not visible, but the scar is noticeable if you''re close enough.', N'She stands with her weight evenly distributed, shoulders back but not rigid — the posture of someone trained to command rooms without appearing aggressive. Her movements are deliberate and economical; she doesn''t fidget or gesture excessively. When she walks, there''s a slight favoring of her right side, a legacy of old injuries. Her default expression is listening — she makes sustained eye contact and allows silence without filling it, which makes people nervous and makes her dangerous in negotiations.', N'Tier 3 working-class aesthetic with deliberate touches of dignity. She favors well-maintained practical clothing: dark jeans or work pants, usually paired with a button-up shirt in jewel tones (deep emerald, burgundy, navy) or understated patterns; cardigan or well-cut blazer worn over everything as armor and professionalism. Her shoes are sensible and broken in, usually leather boots that have been resoled multiple times. She wears a thick gold wedding band on her left hand (widowed fifteen years) and a silver pen on a chain around her neck — a gift from the union on her retirement. No flashy corporate wear, no Tier 1 affectation, but nothing threadbare either. Everything is clean, mended where necessary with visible care, and arranged to project quiet authority without ostentation.', N'During the 2168 transit strike, she accepted a private side-agreement with a Ferrogate mid-level executive that ended the strike three weeks early. The workers got most of what they needed, but not everything, and the executive was protected from an internal Ferrogate investigation that would have exposed serious safety violations. Four workers were injured in an ''accident'' on a line that the investigation would have flagged. She has rationalized this for fifteen years. She has not stopped.', N'Polished public speaker''s vocabulary with an undercurrent of Fijian-inflected English rhythms and occasional Polish idioms inherited from her grandmother. Knows how to make formal language feel warm and warm language feel formal.', N'Measured in public settings, faster and more direct in private. Pauses before key points with the precision of someone who learned pause as a rhetorical tool.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aleksander_huitzil_salazar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a1-7359-b399-0d0ac7e50434', N'Alhassan Zidane-Phommasack', N'Alhassan', N'', N'Zidane-Phommasack', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, Unit 7 of the Pressed & Clean cooperative on Bogdanow Street, near Ashland and Division', N'Laundry operator and alterations mender', N'Pressed & Clean Cooperative (independent), Hamtramck Enclave residents'' council', N'Alhassan Zidane-Phommasack is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin that has gone leathery at the knuckles from decades of hot water and chemical detergents. Her natural hair is gathered into a high wrap of faded indigo cloth, shot through with actual silver thread she stitched in herself for her fiftieth birthday. Her eyes are a watery hazel that turns almost gold under fluorescent light — a cosmetic iris mod she saved for six months to afford — and she wears no other augmentation. She moves with the unhurried authority of someone who has already decided she will not be rushed today or any other day.

She is known in the Enclave for two things: the sharpest crease in GLMZ and a bluntness that borders on prophecy. She will tell you exactly what is wrong with your relationship, your posture, and your collar stay in the same breath, and she will be correct on all three counts. She keeps a small shrine to the ELF she calls Grandma Rinse above her industrial press — offerings of fabric swatches and tiny bottles of softener — and she genuinely believes the old machine runs quieter when the shrine is tended.', N'Community anchor and information hub — she washes clothes for half the Enclave and hears everything. Can serve as a quest giver for neighborhood disputes, a source of local intelligence, or a moral voice that reframes a problem the players think they understand.', N'', N'Cosmetic iris mod (hazel-gold). No chrome. Compression sleeves on both forearms from an old wrist injury.', N'Opens the cooperative at 05:30, runs three loads before most customers arrive, spends midday doing hand-alterations and mending while her apprentice handles the front counter, closes at 20:00 and attends the residents'' council every second Thursday.', N'Alhassan Zidane-Phommasack, 168cm tall, dense muscular build, deep warm brown skin with golden-amber undertones from blended Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and North African heritage. Angular cheekbones softened by fullness through mid-face, weathered complexion creased around eyes and mouth. Natural black hair with silver-grey temples, wrapped high in faded indigo cloth with silver thread. Hazel-gold cosmetic iris mod. Wearing faded navy cotton apron over plain long-sleeved shirt with dark grey compression sleeves visible at forearms, dark work trousers, worn non-slip shoes. Silver handmade band on right ring finger. Deliberate posture, shoulders back, fingers subtly air-pressing invisible seams. Tier 4 enclave industrial setting, warm amber and cool fluorescent lighting mixing over work station, GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, worn fabric textures, documentary realism, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'weathered Tier 4 laundry operator, female 52, broad-shouldered and densely muscular, deep warm brown skin with golden-amber undertones, face built for work not beauty, angular cheekbones softened by fullness through mid-face, asymmetrical and lived-in, creased around eyes and mouth from decades of squinting at seams, leathery texture at knuckles and inner wrists, faded chemical burn scars on left wrist, pale scar line on right knuckle, watery hazel-gold eyes with subtle cosmetic iris mod

hair: natural black with silver-grey at temples, gathered into high wrap using faded indigo cloth hand-stitched with actual silver thread, fabric slightly frayed at edges, practical and dignified

