adjusting the wrap of her head cloth with one hand while walking through the laundry facility corridor, fingers unconsciously air-pressing invisible wrinkles as she moves, weight distributed evenly, shoulders back, moving with deliberate unhurried pace

environment: industrial laundry facility interior, fluorescent overhead lighting reflecting off tiled walls, stainless steel pressing tables and equipment visible in soft focus background, steam rising faintly, wet concrete floor with drainage channels, utilitarian and functional

lighting: harsh fluorescent overhead creating strong shadows under cheekbones and brow, hazel-gold eyes catching cool white light, skin luminosity emphasized by overhead glare, practical work lighting not flattering

