--ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Southeast Asian (44.1%) forms the foundation with warm golden undertones and angular cheekbone definition, substantially enriched by Sub-Saharan African ancestry (23.5%) that deepens skin richness and adds fullness through the mid-face, North African heritage (20.3%) contributing amber warmth and geometric cheekbone refinement, with smaller contributions from Hispanic/Latin American (6.9%) and Eastern European (5.2%) ancestry creating subtle complexity in undertone and facial structure.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, muscular through the back and arms from decades of pressing and wringing. Not heavy, but densely built—the kind of frame that fills a doorway without apology.', N'Natural black with silver-grey at the temples', N'Gathered into a high wrap using faded indigo cloth with silver thread hand-stitched throughout', N'Long, wrapped', N'Hazel-gold with cosmetic iris mod; turns nearly golden under fluorescent light', N'Deep warm brown with golden-amber undertones—luminous fusion of Southeast Asian warmth, North African amber richness, and Sub-Saharan African depth. Weathered but radiant despite Tier 4 enclave living, with visible sun-exposure patina that speaks to a life lived without apology.', N'Leathery texture at the knuckles and inner wrists from chronic exposure to hot water and chemical detergents; creased around the eyes and mouth from fifty years of squinting at seams and smiling rarely but meaningfully. Angular cheekbones with Southeast Asian definition refined by North African geometry and softened by Sub-Saharan African fullness through the mid-face. Clean but not delicate—a face built for work.', N'Fitted compression sleeves on both forearms in dark grey technical fabric, worn for wrist support. Cosmetic hazel-gold iris mod visible only under direct light or when she removes her safety glasses. No chrome visible.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness, never hurried—shoulders back, head level. She walks like someone who has already decided the world will wait for her. Stands with weight evenly distributed, ready to lean into a pressing motion at any moment. Hands rarely still; fingers often air-pressing seams or adjusting invisible wrinkles.', N'Tier 4 workwear: heavy cotton apron in faded navy over a plain long-sleeved shirt (always with sleeves rolled to mid-forearm to show compression sleeves), dark work trousers with reinforced pockets, sturdy non-slip shoes worn smooth at the heel. She owns three identical aprons and rotates them. No jewelry except a thin silver band on her right ring finger—handmade, dented slightly, older than her marriage.', N'Fifteen years ago she reported a neighbor to a Tessera compliance officer for running an unlicensed med-clinic in the building. The clinic was shut down, the neighbor was deported to a labor contract in the Kenosha Crossing dredge yards, and two children lost access to the only affordable insulin source in the block. She has never told anyone and has spent every year since trying to quietly make up for it in ways she cannot name.', N'Direct and idiomatic, mixing Igbo-inflected English with a few Russian loan-words absorbed from her Volkov grandparents. Speaks in complete sentences, rarely uses filler.', N'Slow and deliberate, like she is ironing out each word before it leaves her mouth.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alhassan_zidane_phommasack');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a733-762b-bcfa-0d3109ec8d14', N'Amparo Hernández-Olofsson', N'Amparo', N'', N'Hernández-Olofsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, stall cluster near the Alban Souk border, Calumet Rise, near Halsted and Division', N'Black market data broker and bootleg media seller', N'Independent; working relationship with two Axiom mid-level data archivists who leak surplus; pays a complex web of informal fees to four different factions operating in Calumet Rise', N'Amparo Hernández-Olofsson is a compact man with a permanent five-day beard the colour of iron filings and a complexion that sits somewhere between olive and warm brown depending on the light — an inheritance from a Polish grandfather and a Ghanaian grandmother that he describes as ''maximum average.'' His eyes are augmented with data-overlay lenses that give his irises a faint amber grid pattern; the left one has a slow drift that he''s never gotten fixed because the repair estimate was ''an absolute scandal.'' He dresses in the studied nondescriptness of someone who doesn''t want to be remembered: mid-grey layers, nothing with a logo, shoes that could belong to six different professions. His stall front is officially a media archive service — data recovery, legacy file transfer, antique format conversion — which is completely true and also a cover for everything else.

He''s been in the Burnished Market for eleven years and has a quality that experienced market-walkers learn to recognise: the stillness of someone who is always listening more than they appear to be. He is affable in a careful, calibrated way, and his sense of humour is so dry it can take a full beat for people to realise a joke has been made. He has never been arrested. He considers this his primary professional achievement.', N'Data broker and information source; can access a wide range of leaked, stolen, or simply forgotten corporate data; bootleg media seller provides local colour; quest giver when a data packet he''s brokered turns out to be far more dangerous than advertised.', N'', N'Data-overlay lens augmentation (left eye drifts slightly, unrepaired). Neural buffer chip for temporary data storage — allows him to hold a data packet in short-term neural memory for up to two hours before it must be offloaded.', N'Arrives at stall at 1000, keeps irregular hours, never closes at the same time twice. Has lunch at the same dumpling counter in the Alban Souk every day regardless of circumstances — the one predictable thing about his schedule.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Amparo Hernández-Olofsson, 168cm compact build, warm golden-brown skin with honeyed undertones, high East Asian cheekbones softened by South Asian fullness, five-day iron-grey stubble, dark brown hair with grey threading swept back short, left eye with subtle amber augmented grid pattern and slight inward drift, natural brown right eye, faint silvery scar on underside of left forearm, augmentation port scar behind left ear barely visible, minimal expression, deliberate stillness, wearing mid-grey merino layers under charcoal jacket with practical pockets, neutral grey scarf wrapped once, functional forgettable shoes, nondescript aesthetic suggesting competence and erasure, standing partially turned as if ready to pivot, dim market lighting catching the amber grid in left eye, shallow depth of field, cinematic, moody and restrained, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'South Asian (31.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (27.2%), East Asian (23.5%), Eastern European (8.9%), Sub-Saharan African (7.5%), Southeast Asian (1.1%) — a distinctly pan-Asian and Latin American foundation with African and Eastern European undertones, creating warm golden-brown skin with complex layered depth, broad cheekbones reflecting East and South Asian ancestry, and facial structure balancing pan-Asian angularity with Hispanic warmth and subtle Sub-Saharan richness', 168, 72, N'Compact and economical — neither lean nor heavy, structured like someone who moves through crowded spaces efficiently. Shoulders squared, no wasted bulk.', N'Dark brown with premature grey threading through', N'Short, swept back, functional', N'Short', N'Natural brown with faint amber grid pattern overlay (augmented left lens); left iris shows minor drift', N'Warm golden-brown with honeyed undertones, slightly deeper at temples and jawline — the result of South Asian and East Asian dominance blended with Hispanic and Sub-Saharan warmth, creating luminous mid-to-deep brown complexion', N'Five-day stubble in iron-grey, persistent across all seasons. Even complexion with no visible scarring. Forehead and around the eyes shows the wear of concentration — fine lines that suggest chronic focus. Facial structure reflects dominant South and East Asian ancestry: high, pronounced cheekbones with characteristic East Asian geometry, softened by South Asian fullness and Hispanic warmth, anchored by Sub-Saharan depth. Clean but not groomed; the appearance of someone who maintains standards without vanity.', N'Left eye displays subtle amber grid pattern across the iris when light catches at certain angles; the eye drifts inward slightly at rest, noticeable only during extended conversation. No other visible chrome or subdermal modifications.', N'Stillness is his default — minimal gesture, economical motion. Hands rest in lap or on counter surface. When he moves through the market, he navigates without apparent urgency, head tracking conversations and movement around him. Doesn''t make eye contact unless necessary; when he does, it''s deliberate. Turns to face people only partially, as if ready to pivot away.', N'Deliberately unremarkable: mid-grey merino layers, matte textiles, nothing with visible branding. Worn jacket in charcoal, practical pockets, no decoration. Shoes are functional and forgettable — could be construction worker, data courier, or archival technician. A scarf in neutral tone, wrapped once, used interchangeably for warmth or to obscure the lower face. The effect is studied nondescriptness — expensive enough to suggest competence, generic enough to resist memory.', N'He has a copy of a complete Axiom internal communication archive from 2189-2194 that he''s never sold because he doesn''t know who is safe to sell it to. He''s had it for six years. It contains evidence of something large — he hasn''t read all of it because he''s afraid knowing more would make him a target he couldn''t manage.', N'Precise, economical, dry wit buried in flat delivery; uses archaic media terminology as in-jokes; occasionally lets Polish phrasing structure bleed into English syntax', N'Even and measured, rarely varies — gives nothing away through inflection', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amparo_hern_ndez_olofsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6dd-728d-a896-0d877e033ad9', N'Amina Amrani', N'Amina', N'', N'Amrani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Laceworks, Ironvein, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Clothing and fashion vendor — bespoke street-wear, gang colors, identity-obscuring gear', N'Independent; informal ties to a Laceworks artists collective called The Warp; The Reclaimed', N'Amina Amrani is willowy and precise, with the kind of stillness that comes from spending twelve hours a day bent over a fabrication rig. Their skin is a warm golden-brown, their hair grown long on one side and close-cropped on the other — the long side dyed in a bioluminescent gradient that shifts from deep violet to electric coral depending on their mood, a geneware modification they maintain obsessively. Their hands are always in motion: folding, measuring, picking at a loose thread on their own sleeve. They have a retractable needle fitted into the tip of their right index finger — a workshop mod they had done at seventeen that has never quite worked the way the cheap clinic promised, occasionally deploying itself at embarrassing moments.

Amina Amrani occupies a converted shipping container in the Laceworks that they''ve lined with bolts of reclaimed synth-fabric, printed patterns, and hand-drawn designs pinned to every surface. They are soft-spoken to the point of being mistaken for shy, but their shyness is actually precision: they don''t speak until they have something exact to say. Their designs tell stories — a jacket''s lining holds a hidden map of a neighborhood''s safe houses, a dress''s hem is embroidered with the names of people who died in the 2193 Ironvein flooding. They are fiercely proud of their craft and contemptuous of fast-print fashion houses. They are also quietly terrified that their work will get them killed, because some of what they make falls into categories that certain people would prefer didn''t exist.', N'Equipment and gear source; fashion as social commentary hook; potential information source about who wears what and what it means; quest giver when a client brings them something dangerous.', N'', N'Bioluminescent hair geneware (violet-to-coral gradient, mood-responsive). Retractable needle in right index finger (malfunctioning cheap workshop mod). Subdermal tension sensors in fingertips for fabric assessment.', N'Works odd hours dictated by orders; opens the container when they''re ready, closes it without warning. Spends evenings at The Warp''s shared workspace trading techniques and gossip. Eats whatever can be eaten with one hand while the other is stitching.', N'Amina Amrani, 2226 neo-noir textile artisan, warm golden-bronze skin with complex multi-regional undertones reflecting North African, East Asian, Hispanic, Sub-Saharan African, and Indigenous American heritage. High cheekbones, sharp angular jaw, deep brown eyes with warm undertone, refined East Asian eye geometry. Bioluminescent violet-to-coral gradient hair with asymmetrical undercut (long on left, faded on right temple), glowing softly with mood response. Willowy 172cm frame, lean and angular from precision work. Wearing oversized reclaimed synth-fabric overshirt with asymmetrical cuts, fitted undergarment, worn reinforced jeans with scorch marks and dye stains. Tool calluses visible on fingertips, jagged scar tissue on right index finger, faint burn scars on left forearm. Hunched focus posture, hands in constant motion. Workshop setting with soft warm lighting, ambient glow from hair mod, surrounded by fabric scraps and precision tools. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, intimate and concentrated mood, worker dignity, close detail on hands and textile work. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Laceworks', N'local', N'The Laceworks', N'North African Berber and Arab (42%) forms the primary genetic foundation with warm golden-bronze undertones, blended with significant Hispanic/Latin American (18.8%) and East Asian (18.3%) heritage, with secondary contributions from Sub-Saharan African (11.2%) and Indigenous American (9.7%) ancestry. This creates a complex genetic mosaic reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora — high prominent cheekbones and warm earth tones from North African and Indigenous American ancestry, balanced with refined East Asian bone structure and eye geometry, Sub-Saharan depth in skin richness, and Latin American warmth in undertones.', 172, 58, N'Willowy and angular, with the compressed posture of someone who spends twelve hours daily hunched over precision work. Shoulders slightly rounded forward, chest narrow. Long-limbed but not fragile — the kind of lean that comes from sustained tension rather than lack of substance.', N'Bioluminescent gradient: deep violet to electric coral, mood-responsive geneware, shifts saturation with emotional state', N'Asymmetrical undercut: long side falls to mid-shoulder, short side faded to scalp on right temple', N'Medium / Shaved (asymmetrical)', N'Deep brown, warm undertone', N'Warm golden-bronze with complex multi-regional undertones — rich ochre from North African ancestry, terracotta warmth from Latin American heritage, subtle cool undertones from East Asian ancestry, deep richness from Sub-Saharan genetics, and earth-tone depth from Indigenous American blend. Even complexion with natural luminous depth.', N'High prominent cheekbones and sharp angular jaw reflecting North African and Indigenous American ancestry, with refined East Asian eye geometry and delicate nasal bridge. Skin shows minor tool scarring on knuckles and palms from workshop work. Faint stress lines around eyes from close-focus work. Habitually picks at loose threads on their own clothing — minor calluses visible on thumb and forefinger. Expression tends toward focused neutrality; eyes register emotion before mouth does.', N'Bioluminescent hair geneware (primary visible mod; glows softly in low light, pulses with emotional state). Right index finger shows scar tissue and occasional subtle mechanical movement when the retractable needle attempts deployment. Subdermal tension sensors in fingertips visible only under close scrutiny as faint metallic sheens beneath skin. No chrome — all augmentations are subtle, integrated.', N'Moves with economical precision; minimal wasted motion. Hands in constant low-intensity motion — folding, measuring, picking at fabric or their own clothing. Sits with perfect posture when working, slouches noticeably when not. Eyes track fabric and hands obsessively. When speaking, often looks away or focuses on their work rather than making eye contact — not evasive, just genuinely elsewhere. Stillness when concentrating is absolute; they become almost statue-like.', N'Tier 3/4 working-class aesthetic with intentional avant-garde modifications. Typically wears oversized reclaimed synth-fabric pieces of their own design — asymmetrical cuts, hidden compartments, modular components. Layers: a loose linen overshirt (often with sleeves pushed up), fitted undergarment. Worn jeans or recycled polymer pants with reinforced pockets for tools. Soft-soled shoes for workshop grip. Visible wear and stains from daily work — scorch marks, dye, thread caught in hems. Occasionally wears pieces from their own collection as walking advertisement. Jewelry is minimal and functional: a length of waxed cord threaded through belt loops, a carabiner holding workshop keys. Despite Tier 5 location, they maintain immaculate hygiene and careful grooming — a quiet act of dignity.', N'', N'Spare and technical when discussing work; unexpectedly lyrical when discussing people; Khmer-inflected rhythm from their maternal grandmother''s speech patterns mixed with Silesian Polish directness', N'Slow and measured with long pauses; they think before every sentence', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amina_amrani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e9-71cf-bdd4-0d9bc1ee91cb', N'Axel Nygaard', N'Axel', N'', N'Nygaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 36, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Crucible Square — open-air market, Tier 1-2 commerce, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Target acquisition and fugitive recovery — bounty hunter', N'Freelance — multi-district operator', N'Axel Nygaard is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 36, her face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and she has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Born and raised in GLMZ, third generation — she has the city in her blood, its rhythms in her bones, its cruelty in her expectations. She works as a bounty hunter out of Crucible Square, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

she is not the most talented bounty hunter in GLMZ, but she might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Davor Hedberg-Owusu-Ansah represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release. Reflex boosters wired into spinal column — shaves reaction time by 40ms', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Axel Nygaard, a 172cm street runner with athletic lean build and dark brown hair in a tight braid, stands in GLMZ GLMZ environment. Medium warm brown complexion blending Northern European, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian heritage with luminous depth. Hazel amber-flecked eyes showing constant threat assessment. Visible augmentation scars on neck including bioware adrenaline regulator ridge and spinal interface port. Thin blade scar running left temple to cheekbone, burn mark on inner forearm, knuckle boxer scars. Wears practical black tactical jacket, gray fitted shirt, black cargo pants, scuffed ankle boots. Silver chain bracelet with credit token. Neutral flat affect with micro-expressions suggesting fighter''s awareness. Standing economical and fluid in half-light of neon-soaked alley with rain-slicked pavement, tracking surroundings with predatory focus. Film noir neo-noir lighting, cool neon blues and warm streetlight ambers emphasizing skin tone complexity. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Crucible Square', N'local', N'Crucible Square', N'Northern European, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian blend — 44.8% Northern European ancestry visible in bone structure and cool undertones; 36.1% Sub-Saharan African heritage in skin richness, depth, and natural hair texture; 19.1% South Asian ancestry contributing to facial proportions and warm undertones that create a complex, luminous medium brown skin tone with balanced cool and warm layers', 172, 62, N'Athletic and lean with defined musculature — swimmer''s shoulders, runner''s legs. No excess weight. The body of someone who trains daily and treats their frame as a tool.', N'Dark brown with natural reddish undertones', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid. Styled for function, not aesthetics.', N'Long', N'Hazel with amber flecks', N'Medium warm brown with balanced undertones — the result of 44.8% Northern European cool ancestry layering beneath 36.1% Sub-Saharan African richness and 19.1% South Asian warmth. The blend creates a luminous, complex depth with neither cool nor warm dominating. Slight pallor from irregular sunlight exposure visible beneath the natural richness, particularly around the eyes and temples.', N'Angular facial structure reflecting blended heritage: high cheekbones and strong jaw with refined proportions characteristic of the three-way ancestry blend. The face shows balanced feature contribution across all three heritages without dominance from any single line. Minimal grooming beyond the practical — no makeup, well-maintained scar tissue around left eyebrow. Skin shows the wear of someone who spends time outdoors and doesn''t prioritize cosmetic upkeep.', N'Bioware adrenaline regulator visible as a slight subdermal ridge along the left side of her neck, pale scar tissue where the unit interfaces with her nervous system. A secondary port glints under the jaw at certain angles — reflex booster spinal interface, visible as a thin metallic line running down the back of her neck when her braid shifts. Both augmentations show signs of field maintenance and recalibration.', N'Stands with weight distributed between both feet, never fully relaxed. Movement is economical and fluid — dancer-like footwork combined with fighter''s awareness. Eyes track everything in her visual field. Resting face is neutral, almost flat affect, but the micro-expressions suggest constant threat assessment. Walks like someone who expects trouble at any moment and has trained to respond in under half a second.', N'Practical Tier 3-4 runner''s uniform: matte black tactical jacket with internal webbing for equipment, reinforced at stress points. Underneath, a fitted gray shirt treated for stain and damage resistance. Black cargo pants with utility pockets and concealed thigh holster. Worn boots with good traction and ankle support — scuffed, maintained but not replaced until necessary. One piece of jewelry: a silver chain bracelet with a flat credit token. No logos, no flash. Everything chosen for function. Overall aesthetic is ''someone you don''t want to meet in an alley'' — not because of style, but because of how the clothes hang on the frame and the scars visible at the wrists and neck.', N'', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'axel_nygaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6fa-74d9-84ad-0db8a45c43a1', N'Nadia Migizi-Hachemi', N'Nadia', N'', N'Migizi-Hachemi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Ironvein, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Fake ID vendor and bootleg document forger', N'Independent; loosely tolerated by the Ironvein street association in exchange for doing their paperwork pro bono', N'Nadia Migizi-Hachemi is lean and angular in the way of someone who eats irregularly, with light brown skin, a shaved head, and a thin bioluminescent stripe — pale blue — running from his left temple to his jaw that pulses faintly when his heart rate elevates. He did it himself with a black-market gene kit at nineteen and the placement is slightly crooked, which he finds funny. He operates out of a converted laundry kiosk that still smells of detergent and hot plastic, surrounded by humming laminators, a rack of blank credsticks, and a shrine to the local data E.L.F. he calls Inkblot — a repurposed tablet displaying glitched static that he has never turned off.

Nadia Migizi-Hachemi runs his business with jittery competence: he is brilliant at the technical work and genuinely terrible at the interpersonal parts. He talks too fast, over-explains, and has an unfortunate habit of pointing out everything that could go wrong with the documents he just sold you. He is not a criminal by self-image — he is a ''documentation accessibility specialist,'' he will tell you this with complete sincerity. He believes identity checkpoints are structural violence and that his work is a public good. He also desperately needs rent money.', N'Service provider for characters needing false documentation; source of information about who in the area is hiding, displaced, or newly arrived under a new name. Comic relief with sudden moments of genuine moral clarity.', N'', N'Self-applied bioluminescent stripe on left face (cosmetic, slightly crooked). Cheap optical magnifier implant in his right eye for close detail work — the focusing mechanism occasionally sticks and he has to tap his temple to reset it.', N'Opens the kiosk around noon, works until the early hours, survives on vending machine nutrition paste and an alarming quantity of stimulant tea; Tuesdays he attends a data-rights mutual aid meeting in Ironvein where he is regarded as the group''s useful eccentric.', N'A lean 176cm tall cyborg document forger in the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226. Golden-brown complexion with warm amber undertones reflecting North African, South Asian, Indigenous American, and Hispanic/Latin heritage. Angular face with high prominent cheekbones and strong jaw, tired dark eyes with one eye showing a faint metallic optical implant ring. Shaved head revealing minor uneven patches. Crooked pale blue bioluminescent stripe running from left temple to jaw, pulsing faintly. Dark circles under eyes. Fingerless gloves on stained hands. Wearing loose dark synth-cotton jacket with interior pockets, charcoal grey cargo pants stained with laminate dust, worn polymer runners held together with cable ties. Faded server-farm tech vest underneath with dangling corporate ID badge. Perpetually fidgety posture, weight on balls of feet. Tapping right temple rhythmically. Underground tech workshop setting with harsh neon and flickering fluorescents, scattered tools and blank credsticks visible. Neo-noir street-level aesthetic, moody atmospheric lighting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'North African dominant (51.2%) with significant South Asian (25.9%), Indigenous American (17.7%), and Hispanic/Latin American (5.2%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a warm, golden-brown complexion with the angular facial structure and fine features characteristic of North African heritage, combined with the prominent cheekbones and strong jaw typical of Indigenous American genetics, enriched by South Asian depth in skin tone and Hispanic/Latin warmth in undertones.', 176, 62, N'Lean and angular, almost wire-thin from irregular eating habits and stimulant-heavy diet. Defined shoulders and chest with minimal body fat; the kind of frame that reads as either malnourished or ascetic depending on context.', N'Natural dark brown, often with a slight grey dust of plaster or laminate residue', N'Completely shaved; he maintains it himself with a cheap electric razor, leaving minor uneven patches he doesn''t bother to correct', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown, natural; right eye has a faint metallic sheen around the pupil from the optical magnifier implant', N'Golden-brown with warm amber and terracotta undertones. The complexion reflects the warmth of North African and Hispanic/Latin heritage, deepened by South Asian genetics, with a sun-kissed quality distributed evenly across face and body.', N'Angular features with high, prominent cheekbones and a strong jaw reflecting the dominant North African and Indigenous American heritage, softened by South Asian refinement in overall facial structure. Fine-pored skin with a perpetually tired quality — dark circles under his eyes from late-night work sessions. A thin scar runs across his left knuckle from a laminator incident three years ago. No facial hair; he shaves every other day without much care.', N'The bioluminescent facial stripe is immediately obvious and slightly crooked, a self-applied cosmetic mod that reads as either DIY-punk or poor-quality depending on observer bias. Right eye shows a faint metallic ring around the iris from the internal optical magnifier; when his focusing mechanism sticks, he occasionally taps his right temple sharply, drawing attention to the implant site. No obvious external hardware otherwise.', N'Perpetually fidgety; tends to stand with weight on the balls of his feet as if ready to move. Speaks with rapid hand gestures that emphasize technical points. His gaze darts frequently, especially when nervous — eyes track to exits or potential threats. When focused on detail work, he becomes eerily still. He has a habit of tapping his right temple rhythmically when thinking, especially when stuck on a problem.', N'Tier 3-4 working class with anti-identification design choices. Favors loose-fitting, dark synth-cotton jackets with many interior pockets for tools and blank credsticks. Worn cargo pants in charcoal grey, often stained with laminate dust or solder residue. His shoes are cheap polymer-soled runners, scuffed and held together with cable ties. He wears a faded, repurposed server-farm tech vest underneath his jacket — it still has a dangling ID badge from a corporation he never actually worked for, which he keeps as a joke about the documents he sells. His hands are rarely clean; he wears fingerless gloves most days, more out of habit than need.', N'Three months ago he forged transit papers for a woman fleeing a domestic situation. She turned out to be a lower-level Axiom compliance officer who was using the papers to disappear from a corporate internal investigation — not a victim. He has not told anyone. The documents have already been used.', N'Fast and technical, slips between data-rights jargon and market slang, occasional Lithuanian phrases inherited from his grandmother''s side that he uses as filler words.', N'Rapid-fire with abrupt stops when he catches himself rambling; restarts sentences mid-thought frequently.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'nadia_migizi_hachemi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63b-7235-a501-0dc7cb25f373', N'Ekaterina Zielinski-Kulkarni', N'Ekaterina', N'', N'Zielinski-Kulkarni', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 14, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Interchange, near Fullerton and Damen', N'apprentice to a Ferrogate Transit maintenance crew in Kessler Interchange', N'', N'Ekaterina Zielinski-Kulkarni is stocky and square-shouldered for his age, with warm brown skin perpetually streaked with grease that never fully washes out of the creases of his knuckles. His hair is dark and kept short — he learned early that loose hair and moving machinery are a bad combination. He has ordinary, honest eyes and a wide mouth that defaults to a slight frown of concentration. His uniform is an adult-sized Ferrogate apprentice coverall, cut down and re-hemmed by his grandmother with surgical precision.

He was placed into the Ferrogate apprentice program through a Tier 2 vocational track at thirteen, the year after his father was injured on the same rail line he now maintains. He has complicated feelings about this that he has organized into a box he does not open. He is genuinely gifted with mechanical systems — his crew chief says he has ''the ears,'' meaning he can hear when something is about to go wrong before the diagnostics catch it. He is not a talker. He communicates mainly through the quality of his work.', N'Local infrastructure expert; knows Ferrogate''s maintenance tunnels and access points intimately; represents working-class youth with genuine loyalty to a corponation that exploited his family; potential reluctant information source about Ferrogate systems', N'', N'None. Wants a haptic feedback glove augmentation someday. His crew chief says wait until you''re sixteen.', N'Reports to Kessler Interchange maintenance depot at 0600. Works a six-hour supervised shift inspecting and repairing rail switching gear and junction couplings. Spends two hours in vocational theory class, either in person or via shared neural-adjacent tablet feed. Goes home to his grandmother''s apartment in the Interchange housing block and eats whatever she''s made.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Ekaterina Zielinski-Kulkarni, 165cm stocky adolescent with square shoulders and muscular forearms. Warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones, youthful face with prominent Eastern European cheekbones, slightly rounded lower face, wide mouth in slight frown of concentration. Brown unaugmented eyes with subtle East Asian upper lid influence. Closely cropped dark brown hair. Baseline human, entirely unaugmented. Hands show permanent dark staining under fingernails and cuticles from machinery lubricant, thin white scar on back of left hand, small pale burn scar on right forearm. Perpetually grimy from industrial work, machine oil embedded in skin creases. Wearing faded gray-blue Ferrogate Transit apprentice coverall cut down and re-hemmed, darker grease stains along front and sleeves, Ferrogate rail transit emblems on shoulders, practical scuffed steel-toed work boots, dark crew-neck shirt beneath. Posture slightly forward-leaning, hands fidgeting with tool. Industrial Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, overhead work lighting casting shadows across grease-stained uniform, gritty urban train yard environment, concentrated expression --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Interchange', N'local', N'Kessler Interchange', N'Eastern European (40.5%), South Asian (32.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (19.5%), and East Asian (7.2%) ancestry. The combination creates a distinctive phenotype: Eastern European bone structure and facial architecture blend with warm, golden-brown South Asian skin tones, while Hispanic/Latin American ancestry adds depth and warmth to complexion. East Asian heritage contributes subtle influence to eye shape and cheekbone definition.', 165, 68, N'Stocky and square-shouldered, compact with early adolescent muscle density concentrated in shoulders and forearms from repetitive mechanical work. Broader across the chest than typical for his age.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Closely cropped, practical cut maintained for safety around machinery', N'Short', N'Brown, unaugmented', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle olive undertones, mid-to-deep complexion with luminous quality from South Asian genetics combined with earthier warmth from Hispanic/Latin American ancestry and Eastern European undertones. Rich, dimensional tone that catches light with natural golden highlights.', N'Youthful face with moderately prominent cheekbones reflecting Eastern European structure, subtly rounded through lower face from South Asian heritage, wide mouth resting in slight frown of concentration. Eye shape shows gentle East Asian influence in upper lid. Perpetually grimy from industrial work—machine oil and grease embedded in knuckle creases, fingernails, sometimes marking cheekbones and jaw from unconscious touching. Skin bears wear of six hours daily in industrial environment; minor calluses on palms and finger pads.', N'None visible. No chrome, no subdermal implants, no ocular modification. Entirely baseline human.', N'Economical and purposeful. Stands with weight balanced, shoulders slightly forward in habitual lean suggesting someone accustomed to bending over machinery. Moves with quiet confidence in physical spaces, minimal wasted motion. Hands rarely still—fidgets with tools or small objects when thinking. Walking pace steady and measured, never rushed.', N'Adult-sized Ferrogate Transit apprentice coverall, cut down and re-hemmed with surgical precision. Faded gray-blue with darker grease stains along front and sleeves resistant to washing. Ferrogate insignia (rail transit emblem) stitched on shoulders. Practical steel-toed work boots, scuffed and well-broken-in. Plain dark gray or black crew-neck shirt beneath coverall. No visible jewelry or personal customization. Everything suggests Tier 3-4 working class utility with precise care.', N'He found an anomaly in the Junction 7 switching data three months ago — a pattern that suggests the same equipment failure that injured his father hasn''t actually been fixed, just masked in the logs. He hasn''t reported it. He''s been trying to fix it himself, quietly, during off-hours.', N'technical and specific, mechanical jargon comfortable, small vocabulary for emotions', N'sparse and considered; long silences that aren''t uncomfortable to him but are to others', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ekaterina_zielinski_kulkarni');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a724-7c09-9dbb-0ded5045e7f3', N'Bhavleen Konaté-Villalobos', N'Bhavleen', N'', N'Konaté-Villalobos', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Irkalla, Sub-Level 7 — the ''Bloom Halls'', a repurposed water reclamation chamber, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Fungus farmer and underground food supplier', N'Irkalla sub-level community; informal trade relationships with Undertow merchants; The Undertow', N'Bhavleen Konaté-Villalobos is a broad-shouldered woman who moves through her fungal gardens with the deliberate grace of someone who has learned to never knock anything over in the dark. She is tall, with deep brown skin that has taken on an extraordinary quality in her years underground: faint bioluminescent patches on her forearms and the sides of her neck — not implants, but a genuine dermal symbiosis with a engineered photobacterial culture she cultivated herself and chose to inoculate into her own skin thirty years ago. In the dim blue-green glow of the Bloom Halls, she is hauntingly beautiful. On the rare occasions she surfaces, people stare.

She grows over forty varieties of engineered and wild-caught fungus in a network of cultivation racks that fill three former water reclamation chambers. She trades in food, medicine (several of her cultures have antibiotic and analgesic properties), and a mild psychoactive she calls Quietcap that she dispenses only to people she has personally assessed as not in crisis. She is the closest thing Irkalla''s sub-level community has to a matriarch, doctor, and pharmacist — a role she accepted reluctantly and now occupies with the resigned authority of someone who knows no one else will do it.', N'Community anchor, information hub, healer figure — she knows everyone in the sub-levels of Irkalla and has strong opinions about all of them. Can provide resources, medicine, Quietcap, and extremely candid assessments of other characters.', N'', N'Self-inoculated bioluminescent photobacterial symbiote (forearms, neck — faint blue-green glow); basic respiratory filter implant (nasal); no other augmentations', N'Rises by internal clock around 0500 to check moisture levels and harvest timings; distributes daily food rations to her community roster; spends afternoons on cultivation work and medical consultations; holds an informal evening gathering she calls ''the dark table'' where people eat together in near-total darkness.', N'Bhavleen Konaté-Villalobos, 178cm tall, broad-shouldered and dense-muscled from decades of cultivation work, standing in soft bioluminescent blue-green glow from organic patches on her forearms and neck. Rich golden-brown skin with warm undertones blending Hispanic, Middle Eastern, Indigenous American, Sub-Saharan, South Asian, and Southeast Asian heritage; weathered face with defined cheekbones, fuller lips, slight epicanthal folds, fine lines around deep brown eyes with yellowed whites. Steel gray braids pinned close to scalp. Wearing muted utilitarian layers: long-sleeved undershirt, sleeveless open vest, darkened leather work apron with deep pockets. Simple canvas slip-on shoes. Single braided plant fiber bracelet. Subtle nasal respiratory filter implant barely visible. Faint industrial burn scar on right forearm partially covered by bioluminescent symbiote. Standing in underground hydroponic garden setting, GLMZ, low-light cultivation space, meditative posture, hands occupied with careful work, economy of movement, atmospheric moisture visible in air, warm practical lighting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Irkalla', N'local', N'Irkalla', N'Complex multiethnic blend of Hispanic/Latin American (34.3%), Middle Eastern (21.8%), Indigenous American (18.6%), Sub-Saharan African (14.3%), South Asian (6.9%), and Southeast Asian (4.1%) ancestry — the Ubiquitous Diaspora made flesh. Her features reflect this global convergence: warm golden-brown skin with subtle undertones from the Latin, Middle Eastern, and South Asian components; fuller lips and natural textural richness from Sub-Saharan ancestry; defined cheekbones and a refined nose bridge carrying Middle Eastern structure; slight epicanthal fold at the eyes reflecting Southeast Asian lineage; and the broad facial plane characteristic of Indigenous American heritage. A living mosaic of the 22nd century''s population mobility.', 178, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial, muscular through deliberate work rather than training — strong core and forearms from thirty years of careful handling in tight spaces, carrying nutrient loads, and tending cultivation racks. Not heavy, but densely built.', N'Steel gray with dark undertones', N'Kept in tight, practical braids pinned close to the scalp; functional, no ornamentation', N'Medium', N'Deep brown, slightly yellowed at the whites from decades in low-light conditions', N'Rich golden-brown with warm, honeyed undertones — the natural blending of Hispanic, Middle Eastern, Indigenous American, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian heritage, slightly desiccated from underground humidity cycles', N'Weathered but clear; minimal cosmetic care; fine lines around the eyes from constant low-light focus; subtle age spots on temples. Moderate nose bridge with fuller lips reflecting her diverse ancestry. Defined cheekbones carrying Middle Eastern structure. Her face carries the still attention of someone who listens more than speaks.', N'Faint bioluminescent dermal symbiosis (forearms and neck); barely-visible nasal respiratory filter implant (small mesh intake ports flanking the septum, only noticeable in direct light). No obvious chrome or external cybernetics — her augmentations are subtle and biological.', N'Moves with deliberate economy in confined spaces — no wasted motion, minimal jarring. Her gait is slow and careful even when moving quickly, a learned habit. When still, she has an almost meditative posture: shoulders relaxed, hands usually occupied (checking something, touching something, listening through her fingertips). In her gardens, she moves like she''s underwater.', N'Tier 5 utilitarian: layered linen and moisture-wicking synth fabrics in muted grays, deep greens, and blacks — practical for temperature fluctuation and fungal spore exposure. Loose fitting to allow movement and air circulation. A long sleeveless vest (no collar, open front) worn over a long-sleeved undershirt — both enable visibility and access to her bioluminescent patches. Worn leather apron with deep pockets and reinforced seams, darkened by thirty years of work. Simple canvas slip-on shoes with good grip. No jewelry except a single thin bracelet of braided plant fiber. Clothes are clean but well-mended, showing careful maintenance rather than replacement.', N'Her bioluminescent symbiote is slowly spreading. She engineered it to be localized but it has been migrating toward her spine for two years. She does not know if this is benign or catastrophic, and she has no way to scan it properly. She has told no one.', N'Warm but precise. She uses botanical and mycological terminology casually. Her Bore Rat pidgin is perfect; she can also speak three surface languages.', N'Unhurried and rhythmic, like someone who learned to speak at the pace of things that grow slowly.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bhavleen_konat_villalobos');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a682-7c53-9474-0df6b5b3bbac', N'Eun-ji Ingebrigtsen-Kristjánsson', N'Eun-ji', N'', N'Ingebrigtsen-Kristjánsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave — her shop, Vásárhelyi''s Cut, is wedged between a noodle stand and a bootleg geneware parlor on Tessera Row, near Western and Division', N'Barber and hair sculptor, runs a one-chair shop in Hamtramck Enclave', N'Independent; informal community elder of Tessera Row, Hamtramck Enclave', N'Eun-ji Ingebrigtsen-Kristjánsson is a broad-shouldered woman with close-cropped silver hair she keeps so geometric it looks machined. Her hands are her livelihood and her pride — steady, scarred at the knuckles, with two fingers on her left hand replaced by matte-black prosthetic digits that give her razor work an inhuman precision. She has warm brown skin mapped with pale keloid lines along her forearms from a factory accident twenty years ago, and her eyes are naturally deep amber, though she''s added cosmetic irises that bloom like sunflowers when she''s in good humor. She wears the same style every day: clean work apron, sleeves rolled, a small copper pendant of Ogun that she touches before every haircut.

Eun-ji Ingebrigtsen-Kristjánsson has the gravitational pull of a person who has simply been somewhere long enough that the neighborhood bends around her. She remembers who your grandmother was, who owes who, and which corponation rep came through last month asking questions they shouldn''t ask. She is unhurried, deliberate, and precise — in speech as in blade work — and she has a talent for making people say things in the chair they didn''t mean to say out loud. She is not unkind. She is practical in the way of someone who has survived enough to stop being romantic about it.', N'Information nexus and community anchor — she knows everyone on the block and most of their secrets. Excellent quest giver for neighborhood-level problems. Can serve as mentor, confidante, or the person who tells a protagonist an uncomfortable truth while they''re stuck in the chair.', N'', N'Two prosthetic fingers (left hand, high-precision, matte black polymer); cosmetic sunflower-pattern irises. No geneware.', N'Opens the shop at 0700, works until her back says otherwise, usually around 2100. Sweeps the floor herself. Burns a data-offering incense stick to the E.L.F. she calls Grandmother Clippers every morning.', N'Eun-ji Ingebrigtsen-Kristjánsson, 172cm tall, medium-deep bronze skin with golden-amber undertones, Southeast Asian phenotype with high cheekbones and warm facial geometry, natural silver-grey hair close-cropped with sharp geometric precision, deep warm brown eyes with subtle cosmetic sunflower-pattern irises. Weathered, thoughtful expression with laugh lines, meticulous grooming. Pale keloid scarring on both forearms in organic patterns, knuckle scars from decades of blade work. Left hand features two matte-black polymer prosthetic fingers with articulated joints, deliberately visible. Wearing cream canvas work apron over practical workwear, sleeves rolled to elbows, copper Ogun pendant on simple cord, thin wedding band on right hand. Stands with deliberate grace and economy of movement, hands positioned with precision. GLMZ, workshop ambient lighting casting warm shadows, mood of quiet focused expertise and ritual, calm and unhurried presence, detailed character portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (73.0%) with significant Pacific Islander (10.4%), East Asian (6.5%), South Asian (5.2%), and Hispanic/Latin American (4.9%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a striking phenotype: Southeast Asian-dominant facial structure with the warm, sun-responsive complexion characteristic of both Southeast and South Asian heritage, subtly deepened by Pacific Islander genetics, with minor East Asian and Latin American contributions creating nuanced facial geometry and warm undertone richness.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, muscular through the arms and back from decades of precision blade work. Carries weight with the settled confidence of someone past the age of proving anything to anyone.', N'Natural silver-grey', N'Close-cropped with geometric precision — lines sharp enough to suggest machine work, maintained with ritualistic care', N'Short (approximately 1cm uniform length)', N'Deep warm brown (natural), with cosmetic sunflower-pattern irises that appear to bloom/shift with mood and light', N'Medium-deep warm bronze with rich golden-amber undertones. The Southeast Asian dominant heritage creates a sun-responsive complexion further enriched by South Asian warmth and Pacific Islander depth, resulting in a luminous, slightly honeyed finish that catches light with subtle radiance.', N'Weathered in the specific way of someone who has worked under bright task lighting for five decades. Southeast Asian-dominant heritage creates characteristic high cheekbones, subtle eye shape with slight epicanthic folds, and warm facial geometry. South Asian influence adds subtle jawline definition and nose bridge prominence. Minimal makeup. Laugh lines around the eyes and mouth suggest frequent, genuine amusement. Skin condition is clean and well-maintained, grooming meticulous.', N'Left hand, ring and pinky fingers replaced with matte-black polymer prosthetics — high-precision engineering with articulated joints. The prosthetics are deliberately visible, unmarked by chrome shine or aesthetic fakery. Cosmetic iris implants with sunflower-pattern pigmentation that shifts subtly with pupil dilation and emotional state.', N'Stands with weight evenly distributed, shoulders back but not rigid. Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion. Hands move with the precision of someone who has spent 50 years handling sharp tools; even idle hand movements have a quality of controlled grace. Her gaze is steady and unhurried. When listening, she is still.', N'Consistent daily uniform: Heavy-duty canvas work apron (cream or pale grey, always clean), sleeves of whatever shirt she wears underneath rolled precisely to the elbow. Practical Tier 3 workwear — durable, functional, no corporate branding. Copper pendant of Ogun worn on a simple cord, touched before each cut as ritual. Comfortable work shoes, worn but maintained. No jewelry beyond the pendant and a single thin wedding band (worn on right hand).', N'Twenty-two years ago she testified against her former employer, a small Axiom subcontractor, in a labor dispute. Her testimony was accurate. Three coworkers lost their jobs anyway, and one of them — a man named Boubacar — died homeless two winters later. She has never told anyone she blames herself, and she pays for Boubacar''s daughter''s school fees anonymously every month.', N'Rich, unhurried, code-switches fluidly between English and Yoruba phrases; uses West African proverbs without irony or explanation', N'Slow and measured, as if she has decided each word before opening her mouth', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eun_ji_ingebrigtsen_kristj_nsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a710-799e-97d1-0e18f9d880a4', N'Bjarne Karimi-Quartey', N'Bjarne', N'', N'Karimi-Quartey', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism, lakefront research platform, near Clark and Belmont', N'Climate scientist studying Lake Michigan''s thermal and chemical evolution', N'University Spine — Department of Ecological Systems; independent data-sharing agreement with Zheng-Dao Environmental Monitoring (arms-length, data only)', N'Bjarne Karimi-Quartey is a tall woman with the kind of weathered presence that comes from spending a significant portion of your life on open water in bad weather. Her skin is warm dark brown with a gray-olive undertone, her hair silver-white and worn in a long braid she secures with a sensor clip that doubles as a personal weather station. Her left arm from elbow to wrist carries a color-shifting geneware modification she chose in her forties — it reads lake temperature and turbidity data from her subdermal sensors and translates it into a slow gradient of blues and greens, so that her skin is always telling anyone who looks what the lake is doing. She considers this a professional tool.

She is sixty-three years old and has watched Lake Michigan change in ways that the city''s official models consistently refuse to acknowledge. She is not bitter about this in the way of someone who has been defeated — she is bitter in the way of someone who has been right too many times and is running out of patience for the process of being right again. Her nickname ''The Climate Witch'' was given to her by students who meant it warmly; she has no strong feelings about it. She leaves offerings for the lake E.L.F.s — particularly the one her students have named Bathys — because she says it costs nothing and the lake has given her everything.', N'Warning oracle and knowledge resource — she knows things about the lake''s future that powerful entities would prefer suppressed. She is also a figure of neighborhood trust in Edgewater Prism, someone people bring concerns to. Her lake E.L.F. relationship could be a plot thread.', N'', N'Subdermal environmental sensor array (both forearms; custom-built over years from salvaged components). Color-shifting geneware on left forearm keyed to sensor output. Cochlear audio implant tuned to infrasound frequencies for storm detection — installed after a near-drowning incident in 2201.', N'She is on the lake platform by 6 AM regardless of weather, running instrument checks and data logs. She teaches one undergraduate lecture course on climate systems that consistently has a waitlist. She attends corponation data-sharing calls with careful legal counsel and provides exactly what she is contractually obligated to provide and nothing more.', N'Bjarne Karimi-Quartey, GLMZ, tall lean angular woman with rich deep bronze skin and warm golden undertones, long silver-white hair braided with embedded sensor clip, natural deep brown eyes with amber flecks, prominent cheekbones and defined jawline softened by fuller lips, subtle East Asian eye shape influence. Left forearm displays active teal color-shifting geneware responding to environmental data, subdermal sensor tracery visible beneath skin under light. Fine scar tissue along left neck from cochlear implant. Wearing custom waterproof temperature-regulation lab coat, layered thermal wear, reinforced cargo pants with sealed pockets, waterproof field boots. Woven synthetic lake-plant fiber bracelet, wedding band on right hand. Standing at window overlooking Great Lakes, economical precise posture, slight forward head tilt, hands positioned near weather instruments. Minimal makeup, sun-weathered complexion. Atmospheric indoor lighting with cool blue undertones from augmentation glow, soft window light catching silver hair and sensor tracery. Professional but field-worn appearance, no corporate branding. Mood: focused, contemplative, connected to water and data. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Rich genetic mosaic anchored by Sub-Saharan African ancestry (55%) providing warm deep tones and rounded facial contours, substantially shaped by Middle Eastern heritage (27.2%) contributing defined bone structure and olive undertones, with meaningful Indigenous American (9.4%), East Asian (5.2%), and Southeast Asian (3.2%) contributions creating subtle structural refinements and warm complexion layering. A true product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora—her features speak to generations of global human movement.', 183, 71, N'Lean and angular with the musculature of someone who has spent decades on water — broad shoulders, defined forearms, minimal body fat. Posture suggests ease in motion rather than static repose.', N'Silver-white, naturally gray since her forties', N'Long braid secured with a dual-function sensor clip housing miniaturized weather instrumentation', N'Long', N'Deep brown with faint amber undertone — natural', N'Rich deep bronze with warm golden-amber undertones from dominant Sub-Saharan African heritage, layered with subtle olive and mahogany notes from Middle Eastern ancestry, further enriched by Indigenous American warmth. Decades of lake exposure have weathered the surface into a complex bronze-tinged patina with warm undertones preserved beneath.', N'Strong, sculpted facial structure reflecting the blend of Sub-Saharan African and Middle Eastern ancestry—prominent cheekbones and defined jawline softened by fuller lips and rounded cheek contours from African genetic contribution, with subtle eye shape influence from East and Southeast Asian ancestry. Lines around the eyes and mouth from sustained squinting in glare and wind; sun-weathered but well-maintained. Minimal makeup. Hands show calluses and minor scars from equipment handling and weather work.', N'Left forearm geneware modification (primary visual identifier). Faint subdermal sensor tracery visible on both forearms under certain light angles. Small sealed port behind left ear housing cochlear implant (typically concealed by hair, visible when braided). Custom sensor clip doubled as functional weather instrument.', N'Economical, purposeful movement — no wasted motion. Often oriented toward windows or toward the lake, even in conversation. Hands move with technical precision when discussing data. Stance is stable and grounded, adapted for standing on moving platforms. Slight forward tilt of the head — compensation for directional audio from the cochlear implant.', N'Tier 2-3 academic/field blend: waterproof lab coat (custom-tailored, high-end synthetic with temperature regulation), layered thermal wear beneath, reinforced cargo pants with sealed pockets for instruments, waterproof field boots with excellent tread. Accessorizes with a woven bracelet made from synthetic lake-plant fiber (gift from students). Wedding band worn on right hand (left hand often in water). No corporate branding. Watches and instruments are personal or University Spine-issued, never ostentatious.', N'Her most recent thermal modeling suggests the lake will undergo a catastrophic stratification event within eight to twelve years that will devastate the aquaculture systems feeding the Gray Zone tiers. She has the data. She has written the paper. She has not submitted it because she does not believe any institution will act on it fast enough, and she is trying to find a way to make it impossible to ignore or bury.', N'Plain, precise scientific language that slides without transition into blunt personal opinion. Uses Montenegrin and Igbo phrases when emotional. Refers to the lake as ''she'' without self-consciousness.', N'Even and deliberate, with dry comic timing she deploys rarely and effectively.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bjarne_karimi_quartey');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72c-7d12-8552-0e22c672b989', N'Asif Petrović-Khoury', N'Asif', N'', N'Petrović-Khoury', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor, Stitch Row — a narrow commercial street off the Grindstone Shore waterfront, near Lake Shore and Navy Pier', N'Tailor and seamstress, Old Harbor', N'Independent', N'Asif Petrović-Khoury is tall and narrow-shouldered with very dark skin, close-shaved temples, and a cloud of natural hair she wears differently every day — sometimes pinned, sometimes free, occasionally containing small objects she''s tucked in absentmindedly (a seam ripper, a rolled-up measurement tape, once a small wrench she was holding for someone). Her forearms have retractable micro-filament guides — a geneware mod she had installed specifically for this work, allowing her to feel tension in fabric the way a surgeon feels tissue. Her irises are a vivid violet that is very obviously engineered and that she picked because, as she says, if you''re going to do it you might as well commit.

She runs a small shop — Stitch Row No. 4 — that does everything from emergency repairs to full commission builds, with a specialty in structural garments: clothes with hidden pockets, sealed linings, insulated layers, things that need to function as well as look good. She is quick and funny and gives blunt assessments of what will and won''t work on a person''s body with the cheerful directness of someone who has long since stopped worrying about whether people find her charming. She has a loyal client base that includes everyone from dock workers needing reinforced work gear to people who have heard about her discreet interior construction and want to know what she can do with a coat lining.', N'Practical services provider (can create or modify gear, conceal objects in garments). Social hub — hears things clients say when they''re being measured and their guard is down. Can be a quest giver around things she''s learned through the shop.', N'', N'Retractable micro-filament sensory guides (geneware, occupational-cosmetic hybrid — fingertips and inner forearms). Engineered violet irises (cosmetic geneware). No chrome.', N'Shop opens at 09:00 and she''s usually there by 08:00 cutting. Closes when the work is done, which varies. Thursdays she closes at noon and takes the rest of the day for herself — sacred, non-negotiable.', N'Asif Petrović-Khoury, tall lean woman with warm golden-brown skin reflecting Middle Eastern, Eastern European, Sub-Saharan and Hispanic heritage, natural black hair with gray threads worn in cloud-like medium length with closely shaved rotating temple sides, striking engineered violet irises, defined cheekbones with fuller contours, broad nose bridge, work-marked complexion with callused fingertips. Worn forward-leaning posture, hands with surgical precision. Dressed in tier 3-4 utilitarian craftswear: well-maintained work apron over charcoal and cream layered basics, fitted vest with hidden pockets, sleeves rolled exposing fine white augmentation scars on inner forearms and subcutaneous metallic filament threading. Sensible broken-in footwear. Standing in neon-lit neo-noir workshop, 2226 GLMZ, cool blue-green workshop lighting casting shadows across her warm complexion, tools and fabric visible in background, atmospheric depth-of-field, cinematic mood, hyper-realistic detail on skin texture and scars, GLMZ 2200s aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Middle Eastern primary ancestry (45.1%) with substantial Eastern European heritage (32.1%), complemented by Hispanic/Latin American (14.7%) and Sub-Saharan African (8.1%) admixture. This creates a complex phenotype: warm golden-brown skin with luminous depth, facial structure combining defined cheekbones with fuller contours, broad nose bridge with Mediterranean character, and rich warm undertones across the entire complexion.', 182, 61, N'Tall and narrow-shouldered with long, lean limbs; posture suggests years of leaning over work tables. Wiry muscle definition in forearms from precise, repetitive hand work.', N'Natural black with occasional gray threads', N'Worn variably — sometimes pinned up, sometimes loose and cloud-like; temples closely shaved on rotating sides; frequently contains small objects tucked absentmindedly (seam rippers, measurement tape coils, tools)', N'Medium to Long, with regularly maintained short sides', N'Vivid engineered violet — striking, obviously geneware, unwavering in intensity', N'Warm golden-brown with rich luminous quality reflecting the balanced blend of Middle Eastern (45.1%) and Eastern European (32.1%) ancestry, warmed further by Sub-Saharan (8.1%) and Hispanic/Latin American (14.7%) heritage. No gray or cool cast; skin carries the depth of multiple warm-toned ancestral contributions.', N'Clear, work-marked skin with calluses on fingertips and the heel of her dominant hand; minimal grooming pretension. Facial structure reflects multi-regional ancestry: defined cheekbones characteristic of Eastern European and Middle Eastern heritage, slightly fuller cheek and jaw structure from Hispanic/Latin American admixture, broad nose bridge with subtle Mediterranean character, warm-toned complexion creating distinctive character throughout. Face carries the relaxed directness of someone past the age of performing charm.', N'Retractable micro-filament sensory guides running along inner forearms and fingertips — visible as faint metallic threading beneath skin when active, resembling delicate subcutaneous circuitry. Engineered violet irises with no pupil dilation lag, clearly artificial but not crude. No visible chrome or external hardware.', N'Naturally leans forward slightly, shoulders curled inward from work-table hours. Hands move with surgical precision even when idle; fingers occasionally twitch or flex unconsciously. When standing still, weight shifts to balls of feet — ready-stance of someone who works standing. Walks with economical, purposeful strides.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian with a craftsperson''s signature: well-maintained work apron worn over modified clothes; layered basics in neutral tones (charcoal, cream, deep navy); visible stitching and seaming details that are clearly intentional personal modifications. Frequently wears her own designs — fitted vests with hidden pockets, reinforced shoulder pieces, sealed linings. Sensible footwear, broken in. No jewelry except occasionally a thimble on her thumb. Sleeves often rolled to forearms, exposing the faint augmentation scarring.', N'She has been making, at no charge, a garment for the past eight months — a full ceremonial outfit in traditional styles blending Malian and Russian textile traditions, sized for her estranged mother. She doesn''t know if she''ll ever send it. She keeps it in a sealed box under the counter.', N'Technical fabric and construction terms that she deploys casually, assuming people know them. Socially fluent and funny in a dry way. Occasional untranslated phrases from the Bambara and Russian she grew up hearing.', N'Fast, layered — two or three things happening in a sentence. Drops words that don''t need to be there.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'asif_petrovi_khoury');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a601-7190-924a-0e2dadb4adc4', N'Artur Magnúsdóttir', N'Artur', N'', N'Magnúsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit / the Gray Zone (transient between both), near Halsted and Division', N'Street-level courier and excluded zone navigator, legal identity partially intact', N'Unaffiliated, freelance; known to multiple courier networks without being owned by any of them; maintains careful neutrality that is increasingly difficult to sustain', N'Artur Magnúsdóttir is a small, wiry mixed-race woman — Cornish-Czech on her mother''s side, Jamaican on her father''s — with the particular kind of physical confidence that comes not from size but from having spent years moving through spaces that were not designed for her survival. She keeps her hair close-cropped on the sides and longer on top, usually shoved under a cap with the logo of a company that no longer exists. Her face is expressive in motion and surprisingly unreadable at rest, a combination that makes her hard to clock in a crowd. She has the faint, systematic scarring along her left forearm from an augmentation removal she paid for herself at nineteen, and she does not cover it.', N'Mobile connective tissue — a character who can credibly appear in any district and create links between otherwise separate plotlines; represents the excluded and semi-visible labor that the city runs on; her personal mystery grounds the political and corporate plots in individual human cost', N'', N'Cochlear signal filter: blocks targeted audio intrusion and filters ambient noise into directional focus — useful in crowded transit corridors, essential in the Circuit''s louder sectors,Scar tissue over removed tracker implant site (left forearm): the removal was not clean; she has partial nerve damage in two fingers of the left hand that she has learned to work around and has refused to have addressed', N'Elowen does not have a fixed address in any meaningful sense — she has a storage unit in the Circuit where she keeps what matters and a series of sleeping arrangements that rotate depending on job location and who owes her a favor. She eats on the move, usually from vendors she has established relationships with along her most common routes. She has a small, battered music player that she refuses to replace or upgrade, and she listens to it on long transits. She keeps a physical notebook of routes, coded in a shorthand she developed herself, that she would describe as a professional tool and that also contains, in the margins, things she cannot say out loud.', N'Artur Magnúsdóttir, 158cm wiry frame, golden-brown skin with rich warmth and subtle cool undertones, sharp angular features blending multiple ancestries. Dark brown hair with reddish undertones, close-cropped fade sides with longer crown pushed back under worn faded cap. Warm brown alert eyes, sun-weathered complexion, pale linear scarring visible on left inner forearm. Metallic cochlear filter hardware behind left ear with faint blue LED. Charcoal gray water-resistant jacket over thermal base, olive cargo pants, scuffed utility boots, worn leather messenger bag. Standing in low urban evening light, posture economical and ready, weight forward, vertical eye-scan. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, street-worn survivor aesthetic, no augmentation excess, moody neon-touch lighting, gritty metropolitan background --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit / the Gray Zone (transient between both)', N'local', N'The Circuit / the Gray Zone (transient between both)', N'Northern European, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and East Asian—a striking product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The 36.6% Northern European ancestry provides angular facial structure and lighter undertones; 32.6% South Asian heritage contributes warmth and facial width; 20.8% Sub-Saharan African ancestry adds depth, rich golden-brown tones, and defined bone structure; 7.7% East Asian heritage refines cheekbones and adds subtle cool undertones to skin; 2.3% Eastern European ancestry contributes minor structural nuance. The result is a complexion with substantial warmth and depth—golden-brown with layered undertones that shift subtly across her face.', 158, 48, N'Wiry and compact, all lean muscle from years of navigating on foot through dense urban corridors. No excess, minimal load-bearing capacity by design — built for speed and precision movement, not strength.', N'Dark brown with natural reddish undertones', N'Close-cropped fade on sides (approximately 3mm), longer on crown (approximately 8-10cm), typically pushed back under a worn cap', N'Short to medium (asymmetrical)', N'Warm brown, alert and directional focus', N'Golden-brown with rich warmth throughout, blending Sub-Saharan African depth with South Asian radiance. Northern European heritage introduces subtle cooler undertones at temples and cheekbones; East Asian ancestry adds refinement to skin texture and slight cool accents around the eyes. Overall effect is a warm, complex tone with visible depth—sun-weathered from constant street exposure, with uneven pigmentation from outdoor living.', N'Strong cheekbones with width from South Asian and East Asian heritage, sharp angular jawline with definition from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, expressive mouth. Skin shows the wear of outdoor living — minor sun damage, weathered texture. Minimal grooming beyond necessity; no cosmetics. Few acne scars, well-healed. Resting face is neutral to stern; animated face is difficult to read.', N'Cochlear signal filter hardware visible as a thin metallic ridge behind her left ear, approximately 2cm, with faint blue indicator LED that cycles during active filtering. No other visible augmentations; nerve damage in left hand (ring and middle finger) shows as subtle reduced dexterity only during close observation.', N'Economical, precise movement — no wasted motion. Walks with weight distributed low and forward, ready to shift direction rapidly. Stands with one foot slightly advanced, shoulders loose. Eyes constantly moving, particularly vertical scanning. When sitting, feet remain planted or in ready position. Hands move deliberately; left hand compensates for partial numbness with conscious placement.', N'Tier 4-5 function-first aesthetic. Worn synthetic jacket (charcoal gray, water-resistant, multiple internal pockets) over thermal base layers. Cargo pants in olive, reinforced at stress points. Scuffed utility boots with good traction, laces double-knotted. Old company-logo cap (faded, unidentifiable branding). No corporate sigils or status indicators. Worn leather messenger bag, multiple compartments, overstuffed with routes notebook and small music player. All clothing shows heavy use, patched rather than replaced. No jewelry except a thin, dented silver ring on her right index finger (inherited or salvaged, kept without sentimentality).', N'The augmentation she had removed at nineteen was a tracker — not one she chose, but one installed without her knowledge or consent when she was seventeen, by a man who ran the courier network she was working for at the time. She found it because a rival network''s scanner flagged her. She has never reported it and has never told anyone. The man who installed it is still operating in the Circuit. She sometimes takes jobs that bring her near his network''s territory and she does not examine why.', N'Economical and kinetic — she talks the way she moves, taking the most direct route. Uses a fluid mix of street slang, technical courier terminology, and the occasional phrase in Cornish dialect that surfaces when she''s emotional and that she is usually embarrassed by afterward.', N'Quick, with the energy of someone who has somewhere to be. Sentences are often incomplete — she drops the parts she thinks are obvious. She slows down significantly when she''s lying or when something has genuinely unsettled her.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'artur_magn_sd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a696-728d-8803-0e53a3b66599', N'Dhanvi Haddad', N'Dhanvi', N'', N'Haddad', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 64, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Garret, with regular performances in Mexicantown Libre, near Western and Division', N'Comedic performer and underground theater actress', N'Independent; Mexicantown Libre Theater Collective; informal matriarch to a loose network of performers across tiers 1-3', N'Dhanvi Haddad is small, round, immaculately presented in clothes that are always slightly too formal for wherever she is, and possessed of a face that has made a career of rearranging itself. She is an exceptional physical comedian — her body tells jokes her mouth hasn''t arrived at yet. Her hair is silver and elaborately maintained; she wears it in interlocking coiled arrangements that take two hours and the help of her building''s ELF-connected vanity system each morning. Her skin is very dark and very soft, with deep smile lines and a habitual expression of delighted disbelief at whatever is currently happening.

She has performed in underground cabaret, satirical revue, street theater, and Mexicantown Libre''s legendary open-air puppet festivals for forty years. Her specialty is political comedy with the teeth left in — she parodies corponation executives, enforcement apparatuses, and the absurdity of GLMZ''s social stratification with a precision that keeps her permanently unwelcome in corporate venues and permanently beloved on the street. She lives in a small apartment in the Garret that is entirely covered in playbills, props, and memorabilia, and she rents her largest room to a rotating series of young performers she mentors, charges very little, and refuses to call students.', N'Scene-setter for underground cultural life; satirical intelligence source — she knows the city''s hypocrisy intimately; mentor figure; can provide cover identity or performance context; knows everyone across multiple tiers', N'', N'Voice modulator (for character work — range expanded above and below natural register); cosmetic color-shift irises she controls manually, used as a performance tool; arthritic joint support in her knees, purely functional', N'Writes in the mornings, rehearses or teaches in the afternoons, performs three to four nights a week; spends Sunday afternoons at the Mexicantown Libre market making herself available to anyone who wants to talk.', N'Dhanvi Haddad, a 152cm petite woman in her seventies with warm deep brown skin glowing with golden undertones, luminous complexion reflecting Middle Eastern, Southeast Asian, African, and Northern European heritage. Silver-grey coils pinned in geometric patterns with metallic thread accents. Broad Southeast Asian cheekbones, refined Northern European facial structure, deep smile lines and age creases showing decades of expressive movement. Color-shift cosmetic irises currently warm brown with amber undertones. Wearing an impeccably tailored jewel-toned vintage blazer over high-waisted trousers, chunky statement jewelry, polished formal shoes. Theatrical, perpetually overdressed aesthetic. Faint metallic threading visible along knee joints. Delighted expression, subtle subdermal shimmer at eye corners. Standing in animated, slightly awkward pose with weight shifting unexpectedly. GLMZ street performance setting with neon-lit theater district backdrop, warm practical lighting catching her luminous skin, theatrical mood. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Garret', N'local', N'The Garret', N'A striking blend of Middle Eastern (33.7%), Southeast Asian (26.6%), Sub-Saharan African (20.0%), Northern European (18.3%), and South Asian (1.4%) ancestry. Her features reflect this complex global mixture: warm deep brown skin with golden undertones from the African and Middle Eastern components, broad cheekbones with subtle Southeast Asian influence in eye shape, and fine facial structure showing Northern European refinement. The overall effect is a luminous, warm-toned complexion that shifts subtly depending on light.', 152, 68, N'Compact and round-bellied, soft throughout — the body of someone who has spent decades moving expressively rather than athletically. Surprisingly strong in the core and shoulders from four decades of physical comedy.', N'Silver-grey, naturally transitioned', N'Elaborate upswept coils pinned in interlocking geometric patterns, always freshly arranged. Some coils wrapped with thin metallic thread or jeweled clips for performance.', N'Medium, pinned up', N'Color-shift cosmetic irises — typically warm brown with amber undertones, but deliberately shifts to deep crimson, violet, or gold depending on performance or mood', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones, luminous from meticulous skincare', N'Extensively lined — particularly deep smile lines from the corners of her mouth to her cheekbones, forehead creases from decades of expressive eyebrow work. Skin texture is soft and well-maintained despite age. Expression baseline is one of delighted surprise. Broad cheekbones with subtle Southeast Asian influence in eye shape, warm-toned complexion reflecting Middle Eastern and African heritage blended with refined Northern European facial structure.', N'Cosmetic color-shift irises that transition visibly when she shifts mood or enters performance mode. Subtle subdermal shimmer visible at the corners of her eyes when irises change color. Barely-noticeable augmentation ports behind her earlobes (voice modulator). Functional joint support visible as faint metallic threading along both knee joints, apparent only when she wears clothing that exposes them — otherwise covered.', N'Deceptively animated despite age and arthritic support. Moves with deliberate inefficiency — joints bend wrong, weight shifts unexpectedly, hands arrive late to gestures — all carefully controlled choreography that reads as natural awkwardness. Standing still is difficult for her; she adjusts, fidgets, repositions constantly. When genuinely at rest, visible pain tolerance in slight winces.', N'Perpetually overdressed for context — vintage formal wear repurposed and tailored, always impeccable. Favors structured blazers (often jewel-toned or patterned), high-waisted trousers or skirts, vintage silk scarves. Jewelry is chunky and theatrical — large rings, multiple bracelets, statement earrings. Shoes are always polished and slightly too formal. Tier 2-3 quality with strong personal aesthetic — not corpo slick, but carefully maintained. Performance wear is even more elaborate — she owns dozens of patterned jackets and vests acquired from decades of theater.', N'Twenty years ago she was briefly recruited by a Tessera internal communications team to create ''authentic'' satirical content that would function as pressure-release propaganda — making people laugh at the system instead of organizing against it. She did two pieces before she understood what she was part of. She stopped and has never told anyone. Her sharpest satire since has been partly penance.', N'Formal vocabulary deployed in informal contexts for comic effect; Igbo phrases used as punctuation; extraordinary range of voices and registers available on demand', N'Perfectly controlled rhythm — she knows where the laugh is and waits for it like a patient hunter', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dhanvi_haddad');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ae-7e12-a318-0e8b57ee42e2', N'Zen Hossain-Calvillo-Jang', N'Zen', N'', N'Hossain-Calvillo-Jang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'North Branch Commons — operates out of a shared office in the Grainfort civic building, near North Ave and Damen', N'Synthetic rights lawyer and policy advocate', N'Tessera Corponation (senior synthetic rights lawyer and policy advocate)', N'Zen Hossain-Calvillo-Jang has the kind of face people describe as ''composed'' because they''ve worked very hard to make it that way. They are tall and angular, with light brown skin, close-cropped natural hair, and a wardrobe that costs more than it looks like it costs — everything well-made, nothing ostentatious, nothing that gives away which tier they''re actually operating in. Their irises have been modded to a deep amber-gold, patterned like circuit diagrams, which they got at thirty-five after winning their first major synthetic personhood case. It is the only visible thing they''ve done that could be read as celebratory.

Zen Hossain-Calvillo-Jang works primarily in the gap between what the law says about synthetic cognition and what corponations actually do, which is a gap wide enough to lose entire populations in. They have handled forty-three cases in the last six years, winning twenty-one outright, settling fourteen, losing eight in ways that set bad precedent they''re still fighting to reverse. They believe in law as a tool — not a moral system, a tool — and they wield it with the cold precision of someone who has long since stopped being surprised by how much harm properly formatted documents can cause or prevent. Off the record, after a drink, they will tell you the law is a cage that occasionally contains the right things.', N'Expert resource on legal status of synthetics and AI, navigator of bureaucratic systems, potential employer or patron for characters with relevant skills. They know which institutions can be leveraged and which ones are walls. They can create legitimate cover or official documentation for certain activities.', N'', N'Patterned amber-gold irises (circuit diagram motif, cosmetic). Subdermal data-port at left wrist for rapid document transfer. Cochlear implant with real-time translation across eleven languages.', N'Client consultations in the morning, court filings and research in the afternoon, coalition meetings in the evening two or three times a week. They take Sundays off with a rigidity that borders on ritualistic.', N'Zen Hossain-Calvillo-Jang, 183cm tall lean angular professional, warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones, high defined cheekbones blending East Asian and Southeast Asian features with softer South Asian contours and Eastern European angularity, strong jawline, dark brown close-cropped hair, circuit-diagram patterned amber-gold augmented irises glowing softly, faint temple scar barely visible, minimal facial hair, meticulous grooming. Wearing charcoal wool blazer over muted gray linen shirt, simple silver watch, worn leather briefcase at side. Standing in modern GLMZ courtroom corridor or office with cool neon accent lighting, geometric shadows across face, deliberate neutral posture, steady composed presence, GLMZ aesthetic, professional and functionally elegant --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'North Branch Commons', N'local', N'North Branch Commons', N'Truly cosmopolitan genetic blend: 30.4% East Asian, 19.7% South Asian, 18.1% Eastern European, 14.3% Hispanic/Latin American, 10.1% Middle Eastern, and 7.4% Southeast Asian. This complex ancestry manifests as warm golden-brown skin with subtle olive and amber undertones, a striking synthesis of multiple heritage features. High, defined cheekbones show East and Southeast Asian influence, balanced by the broader facial geometry and softer jawline contours from South Asian ancestry. The overall facial structure bridges Northern European angularity with the warmer, rounder elements of Latin American and Middle Eastern features, creating a uniquely harmonious blend that reflects the true Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 183, 68, N'Tall and angular with lean musculature; the build of someone who moves efficiently rather than powerfully, shoulders squared but not broad', N'Natural dark brown', N'Close-cropped, even length, maintained with precision', N'Short', N'Deep amber-gold with circuit diagram patterning (augmented)', N'Warm golden-brown with amber and olive undertones; complexion reflects the blending of East Asian, South Asian, Middle Eastern, and Latin American ancestry with cooler Eastern European undertones, creating a rich, even tone suggesting careful sun management', N'Striking facial structure synthesizing multiple heritages: high, defined cheekbones from East and Southeast Asian ancestry, broader facial geometry and softer contours from South Asian and Latin American lineage, with the angularity of Eastern European and Middle Eastern features creating sharp definition along the jawline. Strong jawline with minimal facial hair; skin condition is excellent with no visible blemishes or weathering — grooming reflects meticulous attention without vanity', N'Circuit-patterned amber-gold irises are the only visible augmentation. The subdermal data-port at left wrist is not visible during normal dress. Cochlear implant is completely internal with no external hardware.', N'Moves with deliberate economy of motion; sits upright in meetings without appearing rigid; maintains neutral facial expression as default; hands are often still or performing small, precise gestures; walks with steady, purposeful pace; rarely fidgets or displays nervous tics', N'Well-tailored, neutral-toned clothing in muted grays, blacks, charcoal, and deep blues; natural fabrics (cotton, linen, wool blends) that suggest Tier 1-2 spending without advertising it; clothing is expensive and made to last rather than fashionable; minimal jewelry beyond a simple silver watch; legal briefcase in worn leather rather than smart-fabric; overall aesthetic is ''professional who dresses for function, not status''', N'They have been approached by a Sterling-Nakamura ethics division with an offer: a senior policy position with real power to shape synthetic rights from inside a corponation. They have not said no. They have not said yes. They have been not-deciding for four months.', N'Precise, legally informed, avoids emotional language in professional contexts and uses it very deliberately when they choose to deploy it. Georgian and Twi phrases surface when they''re tired.', N'Deliberate, sentence by sentence. They finish thoughts completely. They never trail off.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'zen_hossain_calvillo_jang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f4-7db3-a5d7-0ea9917ed7db', N'Birgitta Leota', N'Birgitta', N'', N'Leota', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, Geartown, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Food stall operator — spiced protein wraps and fermented grain drinks', N'Independent; dues-paying member of The Oxidian Market Vendors Guild; The Ferment', N'Birgitta Leota is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin mapped by laugh lines and old burn scars across her left forearm she never bothered to have reskinned. Her hair is a natural silver-white cloud she pins back with copper rods engraved with Yoruba blessing glyphs. Her eyes have patterned irises — concentric rings of amber and forest green she got in her forties as a birthday gift to herself — and they miss nothing. She smells permanently of turmeric, fermented sorghum, and the faint electric tang of her portable heat coils. She moves behind her stall with the unhurried authority of someone who has occupied this exact twelve square meters for twenty-three years and intends to occupy it for twenty-three more.

Birgitta Leota is the unofficial den mother of the Oxidian Market''s food row. She gives short credit to vendors she trusts, keeps a mental ledger of everyone''s debts and feuds, and dispenses advice with the bluntness of someone who ran out of softening words a decade ago. Her wraps are legendary — she sources cultured insect protein from three different brokers and blends her spice paste from a recipe her grandmother brought from Lagos via Helsinki. She is warm to a fault with regular customers, glacially cold to anyone she suspects of disrespecting her stall or her neighbors, and completely incapable of pretending to like someone she doesn''t.', N'Local color and neighborhood anchor; information source about Oxidian Market dynamics; potential quest giver when someone threatens her stall or her neighbors; moral compass character who grounds street-level stories.', N'', N'Patterned irises (amber/green concentric rings, cosmetic). Thermal-sense fingertip pads — low-grade utility aug for monitoring her heat coils. No other chrome.', N'Up before dawn to receive protein deliveries and prep her spice paste; stall open by 06:00, closed when the food runs out (usually 20:00). Thursdays she closes early to attend guild meetings at the Bronzeline community hall.', N'Birgitta Leota, 172cm tall dark-skinned woman with broad African and Pacific Islander features, deep warm umber skin with golden honey undertones, silver-white hair pinned back with engraved copper rods, patterned cosmetic irises with amber-green concentric rings, pronounced cheekbones, laugh lines around eyes and mouth, deliberate pale burn scars across left forearm, faint turmeric stains on hands. Wearing reinforced ochre-burnt orange linen wrap dress, sturdy synthetic-leather apron, worn canvas slip-ons. Standing with unhurried authority in a GLMZ workspace, direct gaze, economical purposeful posture. Warm overhead lighting catching her luminous bronze skin and metallic hair ornaments, neo-noir market or workshop setting, no corporate branding. Authentic working aesthetic, seasoned presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'Sub-Saharan African (45.2%) / Pacific Islander (29.4%) / Southeast Asian (15.5%) / South Asian (8.0%) / East Asian (1.9%) — a striking Ubiquitous Diaspora blend. The genetic dominance of Sub-Saharan African and Pacific Islander ancestry creates broad, generous facial proportions with fuller features and pronounced cheekbones. Southeast Asian heritage adds subtle epicanthic variation to the eye shape and contributes to overall facial harmony. South Asian ancestry manifests in warm, complex skin depth modulation. East Asian trace ancestry barely registers phenotypically. The result is a luminous, unmistakably diaspora appearance: warm-toned, broadly structured, radiating quiet presence.', 172, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and sturdy, with the compact musculature of someone who stands for sixteen hours daily moving and lifting. Not heavy, but solid — built for work and endurance.', N'Natural silver-white', N'Pinned back with copper rods engraved with Yoruba blessing glyphs; kept in a neat, controlled arrangement', N'Medium to Long', N'Patterned irises — concentric rings of amber (outer) and forest green (inner), cosmetic augmentation', N'Deep warm umber with golden and honey undertones — luminous bronze that catches light distinctively. The blend of Sub-Saharan African and Pacific Islander ancestry creates rich chromatic depth with radiant warmth; South Asian heritage adds subtle undertonal complexity that shifts in different lighting.', N'Face mapped by laugh lines and character; unblemished apart from old burn scarring on left forearm. Cheekbones broad and well-defined from Sub-Saharan African and Pacific Islander ancestry, nose bridge moderate with fuller nasal structure, face shape reflecting generous proportions characteristic of the diaspora mix. No cosmetic vanity — wrinkles earned and kept. Perennially carries faint turmeric stains on her hands.', N'Patterned irises with concentric amber-green rings (cosmetic, immediately noticeable). Thermal-sense fingertip pads visible as faint metallic stippling on fingertips (diagnostic/functional, subtle but present if examined). Copper blessing-rod hair pins with Yoruba glyphs (cultural adornment, not augmentation).', N'Moves with unhurried authority and economic efficiency — every gesture purposeful. Stands with weight balanced, ready to pivot. Hands constantly occupied (prepping, arranging, gesturing). Makes direct eye contact. No fidgeting; complete comfort in her own space.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear: reinforced linen wrap dress in earth tones (ochre, burnt orange) for mobility and heat tolerance; sturdy synthetic-leather apron with deep pockets for tools and ledger; worn canvas slip-ons. Minimal jewelry except for the copper hair rods. No corporate branding. Clothes are clean and well-maintained but show honest use — this is a working wardrobe, not a display.', N'Her fermented grain drink, ''Saarela Sour,'' has a micro-dose of a mild mood stabilizer she sources from a street pharmacist friend. She started adding it during the food riots of 2189 to keep her customers calm enough not to destroy her stall. She never stopped. She tells herself it''s negligible and harmless and has never once asked anyone else if that''s true.', N'Plain and direct; mixes Yoruba endearments (''omo,'' ''egbon'') with Finnish-inflected cadences from her paternal grandmother''s side; uses food metaphors for everything', N'Unhurried and deliberate, like someone who knows she''ll finish her sentence whether you wait or not', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'birgitta_leota');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a605-7ff4-b32e-0ec4d8afb1ac', N'Elena Ekwensi-Wojciechowski', N'Elena', N'', N'Ekwensi-Wojciechowski', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 33, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Kessler Row — arms dealers and augmentation clinics, near Halsted and Division', N'High-speed vehicle operations specialist — wheelman', N'Independent — operates through reputation only', N'Elena Ekwensi-Wojciechowski is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 33, she has the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — thermal masking system — body heat signature can be suppressed or spoofed — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see her surpass them. She works as a wheelman out of Kessler Row, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Elena Ekwensi-Wojciechowski operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Erkin Vikstrom-Asiedu is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Thermal masking system — body heat signature can be suppressed or spoofed. Dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Elena Ekwenski-Wojciechowski, 183cm tall lean operative with rich warm golden-amber skin tone blending Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African and Southeast Asian ancestry. Prominent cheekbones and defined jawline, deep brown eyes with amber flecks, long dark brown hair with copper undertones pulled into tactical braid. Visible subdermal thermal masking system as fine chrome lines down right neck and collarbone, iridescent chromatic camouflage patches on left forearm and upper back. Wearing form-fitting black tactical synthetic leather jacket with integrated tech routing, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Economical precise posture, constantly alert, hands steady. Cool blue-gray neon ambient lighting casting shadows across face, emphasizing augmentation networks. Professional tactical operative aesthetic, genre-defining GLMZ 2200s soldier, high-resolution detailed portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Row', N'local', N'Kessler Row', N'Eastern European dominant (52.8%) blended with Sub-Saharan African (33.5%) and Southeast Asian (13.7%) ancestry. This tri-continental mix creates a striking phenotype: prominent Slavic bone structure refined by West African facial geometry, with subtle Southeast Asian softening of angles. The genetic combination produces warm, complex skin tones that shift across golden, copper, and amber registers depending on light exposure.', 183, 68, N'Lean and long-limbed with corded muscle visible in shoulders and forearms — built for precision control and sustained endurance rather than explosive power. No wasted mass.', N'Dark brown with sun-bleached copper undertones', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid during operations; loose and shoulder-length during civilian cover', N'Long', N'Deep brown with amber-flecked undertones, alert and analytical', N'Warm medium to deep tan with golden and copper undertones — the blended result of Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian ancestry. Skin reads richly across different lighting, shifting between warmer golds in daylight and deeper ambers in cooler artificial light.', N'Strong cheekbones and defined jawline reflecting Eastern European-African blending; face width and structure show balanced influence from Slavic angularity and West African geometry, with subtle Southeast Asian softening around the orbital area. Clean skin with minimal scarring on face. Skin shows slight weathering around eyes from sustained concentration.', N'Thermal masking system is deliberately visible — fine chromatic lines along the right side of neck and upper chest. Dermal camouflage cells visible as faint iridescent patches on left forearm and upper back. Both augmentations are exposed and unconcealed, suggesting confidence and strategic transparency.', N'Moves with economical precision — every motion calculated and minimal. Sits in positions that allow rapid deployment. Eyes constantly tracking sightlines and exit routes. In civilian mode, consciously relaxes this intensity, but the underlying tension never fully dissipates. Hands are steady and expressive only when necessary.', N'During operations: form-fitting tactical gear in grays and blacks — Kessler Row brands that prioritize function over aesthetics. Reinforced synthetic leather jacket with integrated pockets and cable routing. During civilian cover: deliberately unremarkable — mid-tier workwear, neutral colors, brands that blend into Tier 4 background. Minimal jewelry except for a single worn silver band on her right wrist.', N'Erkin Vikstrom-Asiedu murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Educated vocabulary wrapped in street delivery — the contrast is deliberate.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'elena_ekwensi_wojciechowski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68a-790a-a6f3-0f0983be6be5', N'Cho-hee Deshpande', N'Cho-hee', N'', N'Deshpande', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, Neuro-Integration Ward, Sub-Level 3, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Neural calibrator at Aurochs Medical Complex, specializing in post-augmentation psychosensory integration', N'Aurochs Medical Complex (employed); Helix Biosystems (contract obligations for research participation)', N'Cho-hee Deshpande is slight and precise — he moves like someone aware that the instruments around him are expensive, with a narrow, angular face framed by straight black hair that shifts color at the roots depending on his neural activity (a geneware mod he got in his twenties and now can''t fully suppress). His skin is the color of polished teak, and he has the mild, distracted affect of someone who spends most of his time listening to signals other people can''t hear. He has patterned irises, a geometric spirograph in copper and pale green, which he chose specifically because he wanted something that moved — the pattern rotates slowly when he''s focused, quickly when he''s agitated. His hands are long-fingered and completely still even when the rest of him isn''t.

He calibrates neural interfaces — the delicate, often deeply personal process of helping someone''s brain learn to interpret new sensory data from augmentations without going into sensory cascade. He is very good at this and knows it, which manifests not as arrogance but as a certain serene confidence that can read as emotional distance. What he doesn''t broadcast is that he finds the work almost spiritual: he is, essentially, teaching people to perceive the world in new ways, and this strikes him as the most important thing a person can do. He volunteers one afternoon a week in the Rehabilitation annex, calibrating low-income patients for free on his own time.', N'Information source about augmentation complications and black-market implants, potential ally for characters experiencing neural issues, moral conscience within the corporate medical structure', N'', N'Color-reactive hair geneware (involuntary expression of emotional state, original intent was aesthetic control); patterned spirograph irises (copper/pale green, kinetic); neural resonance implant in left temporal lobe (occupational tool, allows him to interface directly with calibration equipment); mild proprioceptive dampeners (helps him hold still during delicate procedures)', N'Arrives early, reviews patient files while drinking bad coffee from the ward''s ancient vending E.L.F., runs three to five calibration sessions daily, eats lunch alone while listening to audio that he calls ''signal hygiene,'' volunteers Friday afternoons in Rehab.', N'Cho-hee Deshpande, GLMZ, portrait of a precise medical technician with deep warm-brown skin glowing with golden luminescence from rare multicontinental ancestry. Sharp geometric facial structure with prominent high cheekbones, refined Middle Eastern and Central Asian bone architecture softened by Sub-Saharan African warmth. Medium-length black hair combed back cleanly with copper-to-violet chromatic root-shift. Most striking feature: geometric spirograph irises in rotating copper and pale green patterns showing neural focus state. Ascetic build, long-limbed and angular. Wearing charcoal compression-weave shirt under lightweight Aurochs Medical Complex lab coat with embroidered credentials, dark fitted trousers, premium orthopedic synthetic leather shoes. Thin platinum band on left ring finger. Subtle iridescent shimmer visible at left temple where neural resonance implant integrates with skin. Serene, emotionally distant expression with impeccable grooming. Meditative stillness, hands completely still despite conversation. Clinical laboratory setting with soft overhead lighting highlighting golden skin luminescence and temple iridescence. Neo-noir medical aesthetic, precise and ascetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Complex multicontinental blend: 45% Middle Eastern, 24.7% Sub-Saharan African, 15.4% South Asian, and 14.9% Central Asian ancestry. This rare combination produces exceptional visual complexity—warm deep brown skin with golden luminescence from the convergence of Middle Eastern, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African genetic expressions. The Middle Eastern and Central Asian components contribute sharp, refined facial geometry with pronounced high cheekbones and angular bone structure. Sub-Saharan African heritage enriches the warm undertones and contributes to the skin''s radiant depth. South Asian ancestry softens the angularity while adding to the golden luminosity. The result is a striking synthesis: a face of geometric precision rendered in warm, glowing brown with subtle golden iridescence.', 172, 62, N'Slight and angular, almost ascetic—minimal muscle mass but precise posture suggesting deliberate physical control. Narrow shoulders, long-limbed proportions that read as slightly fragile despite evident discipline.', N'Black with chromatic root-shift (copper to pale violet) that intensifies with emotional activation—geneware expression of neural state', N'Straight, combed back cleanly, maintained with clinical precision', N'Medium (collar-length)', N'Patterned irises: geometric spirograph in copper and pale green that rotates—slow rotation indicates focus, rapid rotation indicates agitation', N'Deep warm brown with luminous golden undertones—the radiant synthesis of Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Central Asian genetic heritage. Rich, polished appearance with even, radiant undertones suggesting complex multicontinental layering.', N'Sharp, high-cheekboned facial structure reflecting Middle Eastern and Central Asian ancestry; warm, deep complexion enriched and luminized by Sub-Saharan African and South Asian heritage; mild, somewhat distant expression; impeccable grooming; minimal facial hair (clean-shaven); skin shows no scarring or blemishes—carefully maintained. The complexion carries subtle warmth and luminosity characteristic of this rare ancestry blend, with refined geometric bone structure and glowing brown depths.', N'Kinetic spirograph irises are immediately striking and clearly non-natural; subtle iridescence along left temporal region where neural resonance implant integrates with skin. No obvious chrome or exoskeletal augmentation—all augmentations are neurological/subcutaneous.', N'Moves with economical precision, as if calibrated himself. Hands remain almost completely still even during conversation—a learned occupational habit. Walks slowly, deliberately, with awareness of fragile equipment around him. Affects mild emotional distance masked by serene confidence. When engaged in work, becomes almost meditative in stillness.', N'Tier 2 corporate-adjacent professional: charcoal or navy compression-weave shirts (thermoregulating, durable) under lightweight lab coats bearing Aurochs Medical Complex insignia and embroidered credentials. Dark fitted trousers. Minimal jewelry except for a thin platinum band on left ring finger (possibly medical alert or neural interface synchronizer). Shoes: premium synthetic leather, orthopedic—built for long standing. Overall aesthetic is clean, precise, slightly ascetic. No visible brand-flexing or ornamentation. Suggests someone who allocates resources toward equipment and experience rather than status display.', N'He has been secretly documenting calibration data from his Helix Biosystems contract cases and suspects the company is using cheaper, experimental interfaces on patients in low-income trials without full disclosure. He doesn''t know what to do with this information and is paralyzed by it.', N'Technical but not jargon-heavy; he translates medical terms into images and analogies instinctively; occasionally pauses mid-sentence to rephrase something more precisely', N'Measured and calm, rarely raises his voice; in calibration sessions becomes almost hypnotic', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cho_hee_deshpande');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ac-77c5-b46a-0f171fac833b', N'Bolivar Makwa-Guerrero', N'Bolivar', N'', N'Makwa-Guerrero', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism — lakefront atmospheric monitoring station, upper floors, near Lincoln and Addison', N'Climate scientist and atmospheric modeler studying Lake Michigan''s feedback loops and the megacity''s thermal impact', N'University Spine — Department of Atmospheric and Lacustrine Sciences; long-term data-sharing agreement with Arcturus environmental division', N'Bolivar Makwa-Guerrero is a tall man gone slightly soft in the middle, with deep brown skin, close-cropped white hair, and a beard he keeps meaning to trim. He has a cataract in his left eye that he refuses to have corrected on philosophical grounds — ''everything has limits,'' he says, which is either profound or an excuse to avoid the clinic, depending on who you ask. His geneware is minimal: a color-reactive pigment in his forearm that shifts from blue to deep red as barometric pressure changes, which he originally got as a research tool and now also uses to decide whether to bring an umbrella. After thirty years working near the lake, he moves with a particular awareness of weather — he will stop mid-conversation to tilt his head at the sky.

He is a famously good teacher who is famously bad at academic politics, having been passed over for department chair three times due to his inability to stop saying true things at inconvenient moments. He is fond of his students in a distracted way, and has maintained correspondence with former graduate students across two generations. He has a dry, self-deprecating humor that becomes sharp when he is angry — which happens most often when people use his climate models to make decisions without reading the uncertainty margins. He is tired in the way of someone who has been right about bad things for decades and has stopped expecting it to feel like vindication.', N'Local color and world-building anchor for lake and weather dynamics; information source on environmental data and corporate misuse of research; can provide exposition on the megacity''s ecological footprint', N'', N'Barometric geneware pigment (forearm, functional/cosmetic hybrid); standard academic ocular HUD for data overlay (right eye only — he leaves the left natural)', N'Morning readings at the lakefront monitoring station, cross-referencing overnight data with his models; teaches one graduate seminar three days a week; spends evenings writing or in arguments with Arcturus liaison staff about how they are using his data.', N'Bolivar Makwa-Guerrero, 188cm tall weathered academic scientist in his 60s-70s with warm medium-deep brown skin tone reflecting Indigenous American, Northern European, and Hispanic heritage blend. Strong angular cheekbones, prominent facial structure, deep-lined face with permanent squint-wrinkles, white close-cropped hair, week-old salt-pepper beard. Left eye milky with age cataract, right eye natural deep brown with faint golden circuitry at corner. Thin pale scar on right temple. Wearing faded slate-gray University Spine lab coat over charcoal slacks and muted teal thermal shirt. Tarnished silver watch on left wrist. Red-to-blue iridescent barometric geneware on inner left forearm. Muddy waterproofed hiking boots. Standing with hands clasped, tilting head to observe sky, posture of decades-long weather observer. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone lakefront setting, overcast GLMZ atmosphere, soft diffused lighting, practical academic aesthetic, hyperrealistic portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Predominantly Indigenous American (53%) with significant Northern European (24.3%) and Hispanic/Latin American (22.7%) ancestry. This genetic combination creates a distinctive phenotype: strong angular cheekbones and prominent facial structure characteristic of Indigenous American heritage, blended with the broader eye-sockets and higher cheek placement of Northern European ancestry, and the warmth and depth of Hispanic/Latin American lineage. The result is warm medium-to-deep brown skin with golden undertones, olive mid-tones, and subtle warmth throughout—a rich, sun-weathered complexion reflecting decades of lakefront exposure.', 188, 82, N'Tall and formerly athletic, now softened through the middle with age; broad shoulders still evident but spine slightly rounded from decades of hunching over data terminals and lakeside instruments', N'White', N'Close-cropped, neatly maintained but slightly uneven as if trimmed by himself or someone indifferent to precision', N'Short', N'Left eye: deep brown, naturally occluded by age-related cataract (milky-white clouding across upper half of iris); Right eye: deep brown with faint golden circuitry visible at the corner where ocular HUD interfaces with the sclera', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden, olive, and subtle warmth undertones; weathered and sun-marked from decades of lakefront exposure, with visible age spots across hands and forearms', N'Lined face with deep creases around the eyes and across the forehead; strong angular cheekbones and prominent facial structure reflecting the Indigenous American and Hispanic heritage dominant in the genetic blend, softened by Northern European bone structure and eye-socket width; salt-and-pepper beard kept to approximately one-week growth; skin texture slightly weathered from sun exposure and age but fundamentally healthy. Left eye slightly more closed than right due to cataract progression.', N'Color-reactive barometric geneware on left forearm (functional atmospheric indicator, shifts blue-to-red with pressure changes); subtle golden circuitry visible at the right eye corner where ocular HUD neural interface meets the sclera; no obvious prosthetics or chrome. The augmentations are deliberately understated — academic-grade, practical, not aesthetic.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical motions; frequently stops mid-stride or mid-conversation to observe the sky, tilting his head with the habit of someone who has spent three decades reading weather in cloud formations and wind patterns. Stands with hands often clasped in front, or one hand raised in explanation. When tired or frustrated, he hunches slightly and touches the bridge of his nose. His gait is steady but not hurried; the walk of someone who has nowhere urgent to be and much to observe.', N'Tier 2-3 academic: well-worn University Spine lab coat (slate gray, with multiple button repairs and a faded logo on the chest) worn over practical but aging clothing — charcoal slacks, a thermal-weave undershirt in muted teal or grey, sometimes a wool sweater underneath in colder months. No visible corporate branding. Footwear is functional (waterproofed hiking boots, often muddy from lakefront station visits) rather than fashionable. He wears a tarnished silver watch on his left wrist, clearly decades old and frequently consulted. The overall impression is of someone who dresses for utility and weather, not appearance — Tier 2 institutional status visible only through the university affiliation, not through grooming or accessories.', N'His most recent models, still unpublished, predict a cascade thermal event in the lake system within fifteen to thirty years that would fundamentally destabilize the megacity''s northern sectors — he has not published because he doesn''t trust the institutions that would receive the data to use it well', N'Educated and precise in technical matters; in casual conversation, fond of old proverbs from several traditions, often misattributed on purpose as a small joke', N'Unhurried and warm, with a lecturer''s habit of building to a point; can shift to clipped and direct when frustrated', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bolivar_makwa_guerrero');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d0-7f1d-911b-0f326f5750f6', N'Meera Tetteh-Deshpande', N'Meera', N'', N'Tetteh-Deshpande', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 19, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Shallowgrave — Bergqvist & Sons Salvage (the sons don''t exist), a working chop shop and legitimate scrap dealer on the western run of the Sump Road', N'Chop shop operator and parts fence working out of a salvage yard in Shallowgrave', N'Independent; fences primarily to a mid-level network connected to Gravesend Basin smuggling routes; has a tense but functional relationship with the local Shallowgrave scavenger gangs', N'Meera Tetteh-Deshpande is nineteen and looks it — sharp-faced and still growing into her height, with grease that never fully comes out of the creases of her knuckles and a habit of wiping her hands on a rag she keeps tucked in her waistband. Her skin is a warm medium brown, her hair grown in thick loose coils she shoves under a cap when she''s working and lets fall to her shoulders otherwise. Her one visible mod is a retractable tool-array in her right hand — three thin probe fingers that extend from the palm for accessing component ports — which she got secondhand from a chop-house in Ironhaven and jury-rigged to fit her hand herself. She''s quietly proud of that.

Sio inherited the salvage yard at sixteen when her father died of a respiratory illness from years of unfiltered sump exposure. She turned it from a struggling legal operation into a profitable illegal one inside a year out of sheer necessity, and she''s been running it that way since. She is not reckless — she runs a very careful shop, clean books on the legal side, and clear sourcing rules for what she''ll accept — but she is young and the combination of competence and overconfidence occasionally creates problems. She has three employees: an older mechanic named Duru who knew her father and probably knows more about the illegal side than he lets on, and two teenagers from the neighborhood she pays above-market because she remembers what it felt like to need money badly at sixteen.', N'Local color and practical resource; can source vehicle parts, tech components, and stripped augmentation hardware; potential ally who trades favors for help with the scavenger gang pressure; represents the working young criminal who hasn''t yet been destroyed by the system', N'', N'Retractable tool-array (right palm, secondhand and self-modified — three probe fingers, used for component diagnosis and access); no other augmentations', N'Up before dawn to receive night deliveries before the sump road gets traffic; legal salvage business open 08:00-17:00; illegal intake happens in the locked rear yard after dark.', N'Meera Tetteh-Deshpande, 174cm tall lean dismantler tech, rich deep golden-brown skin tone from Sub-Saharan African and South Asian heritage, angular face with high prominent cheekbones, dark expressive eyes with Southeast Asian width, thick dark coils shoulder-length, wearing oil-stained utilitarian work clothing, oversized gray work shirt, steel-toed boots, faded canvas cap, right palm with jury-rigged titanium retractable tool-array fingers visible, burn scar on left forearm, grease-stained hands, practical forward-leaning posture, gritty salvage yard setting with industrial debris, warm artificial work lights casting shadows, GLMZ, realistic gritty aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shallowgrave', N'local', N'Shallowgrave', N'Sub-Saharan African (46.9%), South Asian (31.2%), Southeast Asian (11.8%), and Northern European (10.1%) — a striking pan-continental blend evident in her rich deep skin tone, the particular set of her cheekbones, and the complexity of her facial structure reflecting multiple ancestral lines', 174, 62, N'Lean and rangy with emerging muscularity in her shoulders and forearms from years of dismantling work; still has the gangly proportions of someone not quite finished growing into her frame', N'Natural dark brown with warm undertones', N'Thick, loose coils worn down to shoulder length when off-duty; habitually shoved under a grease-stained canvas cap during work', N'Medium', N'Dark brown', N'Rich warm brown with golden undertones — a deep, luminous complexion reflecting the dominance of Sub-Saharan and South Asian ancestry; medium-to-deep depth with natural radiance that contrasts strikingly with the grime of her work', N'Angular face with high, defined cheekbones characteristic of her African and South Asian heritage; prominent nasal bridge with subtle refinement from Southeast Asian ancestry; dark expressive eyes set with characteristic Southeast Asian width; chronic grease stains embedded in the creases of her knuckles and under her fingernails despite frequent washing; sun-damaged from early-morning sump road exposure; minimal grooming beyond practicality', N'Retractable tool-array in right palm: three thin probe fingers that extend from the palm for component port access, visibly jury-rigged with mismatched titanium casing and hand-welded articulation joints; shows evidence of self-modification and repeated field repairs', N'Moves with practical efficiency, economical gestures honed by close work in tight spaces; frequently has her right hand half-extended as if reaching for tools; stands with weight shifted forward slightly, ready to move; habitual nervous tic of rubbing her right palm against her thigh', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian: oil-stained Carhartt-equivalent work pants with multiple tool pockets, most containing actual tools; worn thermal undershirt visible at the collar; oversized gray or brown work shirt that hangs loose enough to move in; unlaced steel-toed boots caked with salvage yard detritus; faded canvas cap with a stitched patch where the original logo was removed; a grease-stained rag permanently tucked into her waistband; no jewelry, no fashion-forward choices, everything chosen for durability and function', N'She found a Ferrogate Transit black-box recorder in a stripped vehicle two months ago that contains footage of a transit security officer committing a serious crime. She hasn''t decided what to do with it. It''s wrapped in a cloth under the floor of her office.', N'Fast, technical, deeply neighborhood — heavy in salvage and mechanical slang; swears with creativity', N'Quick and often overlapping itself; she thinks faster than she edits', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'meera_tetteh_deshpande');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a720-7e38-b137-0f331616de0a', N'Eladio Ekwensi-Fredriksen', N'Eladio', N'', N'Ekwensi-Fredriksen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Block 14, near Western and Division', N'Excluded, former Spire security contractor, current the Gray Zone subsistence worker and informal dispute arbitrator', N'Unaffiliated. Tolerated by every faction operating in the Gray Zone because neutrality is her only currency and she protects it carefully.', N'Eladio Ekwensi-Fredriksen is a tall woman gone slightly stooped by a lower back injury she never had properly repaired, with close-cropped white hair, dark brown skin deeply lined around the eyes, and the hands of someone who has done physical labor across five decades. Her face is broad and expressive, capable of a warmth that arrives like weather and a coldness that does the same. She has a Oaxacan-Igbo heritage that she carries in her name and in the particular way she moves through spaces—with the deliberate economy of someone who learned long ago that being large and dark-skinned in certain rooms meant being watched, so she learned to make the watching cost nothing.

She spent twenty-two years as a security contractor for Spire-adjacent corporate interests, rising to senior threat assessment before an internal review—widely understood in the industry as a political purge following a change in executive leadership—stripped her clearances, voided her pension, and had her classified as a ''liability-tier former employee.'' She was fifty-five. She appealed. She lost. She moved to the Gray Zone because the rent was what she could afford, and because she knew nobody there, which felt like a clean slate and also like dying slowly. Neither turned out to be entirely accurate.

the sprawl found uses for her. People with disputes come to her—tenancy disagreements, debt questions, situations that haven''t yet become violent but are heading there. She arbitrates. She charges in food and favors and occasional hard currency. She has no formal authority and more actual authority than anyone on Block 14. She sleeps badly, eats well because her neighbors feed her, and is quietly furious almost all of the time. She does not perform this fury. She performs patience, which is harder.', N'Embodies the long tail of corporate complicity and the question of whether reinvention is possible. Provides the Gray Zone with a ground-level authority figure who carries institutional knowledge of how the Spire operates. Creates moral complexity around the idea of atonement through service.', N'', N'Retinal archive implant (left eye only—stores and timestamps visual memory, installed during contractor years, she has not had it removed),Partial neural damper at the base of her skull (reduces the contractor-installed stress-response override that was never fully uninstalled when she was purged—she had a back-alley tech blunt it but not eliminate it)', N'Up at 5:30am, perimeter walk rain or shine. Eats breakfast with whoever is in her kitchen, which is frequently someone. Arbitration cases two or three days a week, often running long. Afternoons she does maintenance work on the Block 14 shared infrastructure—she is good with her hands and the building needs it. Evenings she reads, paper books traded through the Gray Zone''s informal library circuit. Sleeps poorly but completely refuses to discuss this.', N'Eladio Ekwenski-Fredriksen, 67-year-old woman, tall and broad-shouldered with slight forward spine curvature, GLMZ. Rich deep brown skin with warm golden undertones blending Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Latin American, and Middle Eastern heritage. Angular face with high prominent cheekbones, deeply lined around eyes and mouth, age spots on temples. White close-cropped hair revealing skull architecture. Dark brown natural eyes; left eye with subtle silver threading at iris margin from retinal archive implant that glows faintly in low light. Faint surgical scar at base of skull, small fingerprint burn scar on left hand back. Weathered skin showing decades of outdoor labor, well-maintained. Wearing dark charcoal practical synthetics, loose work pants with reinforced pockets, worn boots, long-sleeved neutral shirt, heavy patched canvas coat. Single thin silver contractor identification ring on right index finger. Posture deliberate and measured with slight attentiveness lean. Standing in indoor workspace with cool neon backlighting, casting shadows across lined face, calm neutral expression with underlying readiness. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, industrial setting, soft ambient lighting with accent neon. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Mixed Southeast Asian (44.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (34.1%), Sub-Saharan African (16.9%), and Middle Eastern (4.2%) ancestry. Her features reflect this complex blend: Southeast Asian structure in her cheekbones and eye shape, Sub-Saharan African warmth and depth in her skin tone and facial proportions, Latin American contours in her face geometry, with subtle Middle Eastern influences in her nose and orbital structure.', 178, 72, N'Tall and broad-shouldered, gone slightly stooped at the spine from untreated lower back injury. Still carries muscle density from decades of physical labor, but with the softening that comes with age and subsistence living. Hands are large, callused, capable—a laborer''s hands that never fully retired.', N'White', N'Close-cropped, no styling beyond functional maintenance. Reveals the full architecture of her skull.', N'Short', N'Dark brown (natural); left eye has faint luminescent quality in low light from retinal archive implant', N'Rich deep brown with warm golden undertones from her Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Latin American heritage—sun-darkened further by years in the Gray Zone''s outdoor maintenance work. The layered ancestry creates complex warm undertones beneath the deeper melanin.', N'Angular face with prominent, high cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian structure, softened by the broader bone structure of her Sub-Saharan African and Latin American heritage. Deeply lined around the eyes and mouth from sixty-seven years of expressive face-work and squinting into harsh light. Skin is weathered but well-maintained—cared for with intention. No makeup. A few age spots on her temples and jawline. Her resting expression defaults to neutrality, but warmth and coldness arrive in it like weather systems.', N'Left eye shows minimal chrome—a faint silver threading at the iris margin visible only in direct light or at certain angles. The neural damper creates no visible marking. To a casual observer: an older woman with one slightly unusual eye. To someone who knows what to look for: a former contractor who never fully decommissioned.', N'Moves with deliberate economy, each action measured and purposeful. Slight forward tilt in the shoulders from the spinal injury, but corrected through habit so it reads as attentiveness rather than pain. Her gait is steady, unhurried. She occupies space without claiming it—a learned skill from decades of being watched. When she sits, she settles completely, as if she has decided to be there. When she stands, there is always readiness beneath the stillness.', N'Tier 4 practical—durable synthetics and salvaged natural fibers that prioritize function over appearance. Dark colors (charcoal, deep grey, black) that hide stains and read as authority without aggression. Loose-fitting work pants with reinforced pockets, worn boots with good tread, neutral tank tops or long-sleeved shirts depending on season. A heavy canvas coat, patched but well-maintained, worn most days. No jewelry except a single thin silver band on her right index finger—a contractor''s identification ring she never removed. Clothing is clean but not pristine. She dresses like someone who will work before the day is done.', N'During her last year as a contractor, she signed off on a threat assessment that authorized surveillance and information suppression against a the Gray Zone-based organizer. The organizer was later found dead in what was ruled an accident. Xochitl does not know if the death was connected to her assessment. She has never tried to find out. This is the one question she will not ask herself directly.', N'Dense, concrete, corporate-security residue in her syntax—she phrases things in terms of conditions, thresholds, and outcomes. Interlaced with the Gray Zone''s vernacular, which she picked up fast because she listens. Uses Spanish and Igbo phrases when she''s not performing composure.', N'Slow and deliberate. Never raises her voice. The quieter she gets, the more serious the situation. Laughs fully when she laughs—it''s a big sound that surprises people.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eladio_ekwensi_fredriksen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a714-7b73-b67f-0f5ca4067e8d', N'Damian Sefanaia-Moala', N'Damian', N'', N'Sefanaia-Moala', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit, mobile — maintains three rotating safe-house nodes, near North Ave and Damen', N'Mid-tier intelligence broker and urban cartographer specialising in infrastructure secrets — hidden tunnels, decommissioned data conduits, forgotten corporate sub-levels', N'Formally independent; functionally indispensable to multiple Circuit-level factions without belonging to any; has a standing non-aggression agreement with two major data brokerages that amounts to a cold peace', N'Damian Sefanaia-Moala is lean and angular, with the kind of economy of movement that suggests someone who has spent years navigating spaces not built for human occupation. Her hair is shaved close on the sides and kept longer on top, currently dyed a flat, non-reflective black that she maintains with the same pragmatism she applies to everything. Her eyes are a pale grey-green that people sometimes mistake for augmented; they are not. She is Croatian-Swedish by heritage, raised in a migrant enclave in the Gray Zone that no longer exists, having been demolished to make way for a data-routing hub in 2178. She considers this formative.

Damian Sefanaia-Moala''s trade is spatial knowledge — specifically, the gap between the official map of GLMZ and the actual city, which she has spent twelve years documenting. She sells access routes to runners needing to avoid surveillance corridors, sells structural data to architects with clients who need rooms that don''t appear on building permits, and occasionally sells nothing at all to people she finds interesting, just to see what they do with it. She works from a custom-built rig she calls the Palimpsest — a layered mapping system that overlays historical city data, real-time sensor feeds, and her own hand-annotated surveys into a single navigable model. It is, by any reasonable assessment, the most comprehensive private map of GLMZ in existence.

She is not warm, exactly, but she is fair, and in The Circuit those two things are often confused. She has a reputation for absolute accuracy — if Damian Sefanaia-Moala says a tunnel is passable, it is passable; if she says a route is burned, it is burned — and she guards that reputation with a ferocity that has ended at least two professional relationships and one that was something more. She experiences the city as a text to be read rather than a place to be inhabited, which gives her a clarity about GLMZ''s power structures that people with more emotional investment sometimes cannot achieve, and which occasionally makes her feel like a ghost walking through a city she refuses to belong to.', N'Information infrastructure and spatial knowledge hub for mid-tier operations; represents the city''s layered history and the violence of institutional forgetting; her completeness drive creates natural story engines around what she knows and what she refuses to share', N'', N'Full spatial-memory augmentation — perfect three-dimensional recall of any physical space she has entered,Micro-LIDAR emitters in fingertips — passively maps rooms she moves through, feeds to Palimpsest,Sub-vocal comms integrated with a white-noise emitter that activates automatically in surveilled spaces,Structural-resonance hearing augmentation — can detect hollow spaces, water movement, and power conduits through walls up to 40cm thick', N'Rotates between three Circuit safe-houses on a schedule she varies deliberately. Spends four to six hours daily in active survey work — walking routes, updating the Palimpsest, annotating anomalies. Client meetings are brief and location-agnostic; she names the place thirty minutes before. Eats cheaply and without ceremony. Reads pre-corporate architectural histories on a battered tablet. Sleeps in four-hour blocks, which she has decided is optimal and which is also a way of never being fully settled anywhere.', N'Damian Sefanaia-Moala, GLMZ, lean 172cm tall surveyor with warm golden-brown skin, Pacific Islander and Hispanic ancestry with African, East Asian, and South Asian heritage evident in broad cheekbones, fuller lips, robust nose bridge. Dark brown eyes with amber flecks. Flat black hair shaved on sides, 8-10cm longer on top styled back. Faint 4cm scar along left temple, small circular burn scar on right inner wrist, asymmetrical finger calluses. Micro-LIDAR emitters as faint iridescent nodes on fingertips catching light. Sub-vocal comms implant visible as thin surgical line on left neck. Wearing dark non-reflective utilitarian tech jacket with hidden pockets, reinforced cargo pants with tool attachment points, heavy-soled worn boots. Holding battered vintage metal-cased tablet. Economical posture, head forward, tracking vertical lines. No jewelry or status markers. Neo-noir infrastructure background, concrete and neon, dramatic side lighting emphasizing scar and augmentation nodes, neutral focused expression, ready for egress. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Predominantly Pacific Islander (47.6%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (28.4%) ancestry, complemented by Sub-Saharan African (13.2%), East Asian (5.8%), and South Asian (5.0%) heritage. This genetic combination creates a warm, golden-brown complexion with pronounced Pacific Islander and Afro-Latinx features: broad cheekbones with strong definition, fuller lips, and a robust nasal structure reflecting her Pacific and Latin ancestry. The blend produces a warm-golden undertone across her entire face.', 172, 58, N'Lean and angular with minimal excess mass — the build of someone who moves through tight spaces regularly and carries nothing unnecessary. Visible muscle tone in forearms and shoulders from years of manual surveying and climbing through infrastructure.', N'Flat black, non-reflective (dyed and maintained deliberately)', N'Shaved close on sides, longer on top — currently 8-10cm at crown, styled back or left to fall forward depending on operational needs', N'Medium (top) / Short (sides)', N'Dark brown with subtle green undertones — entirely natural, catching light with warm amber flecks', N'Warm golden-brown complexion — the natural result of dominant Pacific Islander and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry blending with African, East Asian, and South Asian heritage. Rich, sun-kissed undertones throughout.', N'Broad, prominent cheekbones with strong definition; angular jawline; fuller lips reflecting Latin and Pacific ancestry; robust nose bridge with slight flare at base; skin shows minor scarring on knuckles and palms from repeated contact with rough surfaces. Expression tends toward neutral focus rather than emotional display.', N'Micro-LIDAR emitters visible as faint iridescent nodes at the tips of all ten fingers — they catch light differently than skin when hands are in motion. Sub-vocal comms implant barely visible as a thin surgical line along the left side of her neck. No external chrome; all augmentations are subcutaneous or integrated into existing anatomy.', N'Economical and precise. She moves through space as if reading it — head slightly forward, eyes tracking vertical and horizontal lines. Minimal wasted motion; she does not gesture while speaking. When navigating unfamiliar terrain, her movement slows and becomes more deliberate, as if she is actively encoding the space. Resting state is stillness rather than fidgeting.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Dark, non-reflective colors (black, charcoal, muted grey-blue). Reinforced cargo pants with multiple pockets and thigh attachment points for tools. Fitted technical jacket with hidden pockets and signal-blocking liner. Boots are heavy-soled and broken in, chosen for grip and durability over appearance. A single metal-cased tablet (battered, vintage aesthetic) is always visible. No jewelry, no logos, no status markers — the goal is to move without drawing attention while remaining instantly ready for emergency egress.', N'The Palimpsest contains a complete map of a sub-level beneath the old the Gray Zone enclave — a space she discovered after the demolition that was clearly inhabited, clearly hidden, and clearly abandoned in a hurry. She has never sold this information. She goes there alone, sometimes, and sits in the dark with the remains of people who lived where her childhood was, and she does not examine why.', N'Spatial and architectural metaphors dominate; technical precision; minimal emotional vocabulary, not from coldness but from genuine under-development of that register; occasional Croatian words when her guard is down', N'Efficient and directional — sentences move from premise to conclusion without scenic detours; capable of sudden, unexpected lyrical observation about physical spaces before returning to baseline', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'damian_sefanaia_moala');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a648-7876-9688-0f6d38d70075', N'Kyle Ellen Corbin-Vasik', N'Kyle', N'Ellen', N'Corbin-Vasik', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 27, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'The Pivot — 1554 W Chicago Ave (also 801 N Ashland), upper floor, West Town sector near the Circuit''s western boundary', N'Protagonist — freelance enforcer, facility survivor, the Street Samurai', N'Independent', N'Kyle carries hardware that was never meant to leave the facility. NeoCortex Program Atlas, Subprogram A-7: a high-density electrode array with 32,768 electrodes and 256 threads — roughly 8x the density of standard Tier 3 corpo implants. The implant gives him cognitive processing speed comparable to Tier 3-4 augmented, reaction time in the top 0.1% of recorded human performance, and fragmentary access to sensory data streams. The catch: the hardware was never calibrated for long-term stability. He experiences periodic neural static, memory bleed from other test subjects, and micro-seizures that are getting more frequent. No corpo surgeon will touch it. He maintains it himself with salvaged tools and stolen pharmaceutical stabilizers, the way you would maintain a weapon that is also a time bomb. He carries a katana — carbon-nanotube composite blade with a piezoelectric disruption layer that shorts neural implants on contact. The katana is not nostalgia. It is the only weapon that works everywhere Kyle needs to go.', N'Kyle is the lens through which the reader experiences the GLMZ. His experimental hardware makes him perceive the world at a different speed and resolution, driving the prose style — tight, sensory, fragmented.

Core contradiction: A warrior of honor surviving in a world that punishes honor. Samurai means discipline, dignity, service. Street means survival, compromise, moral decay. He is both, fully, at all times. The facility made him a weapon; he uses that weapon to protect the vulnerable.

Arc: Coming to terms with a lifetime of hypocrisy. Trying to be a good man in a world that doesn''t care about goodness and doesn''t reward adherence to an ancient philosophy. The world doesn''t even notice his struggle — that''s the satire.', N'Kyle is more present in his own head than in the room. His body runs the fight; his mind watches from a step behind, narrating. In the white space between actions — the half-second after a trigger pull, the moment of an arm dropping — the observing part catches up and says something cold and exact. He notices the wrong things: a simile, a moral ledger entry, the precise word for a beautiful terrible thing. He is not dissociating. He is paying a different kind of attention.

Tight, sensory, interior. Short sentences because the experimental hardware processes faster than language. Long thoughts fragment. Kyle notices details before meaning — the temperature of a room before the people in it, the hum of electronics before the words being spoken. Interior facet tags ([WOUND], [IDEAL], [SHADOW], [GHOST], [ID], [MASK]) surface as brief, italicized interjections that disagree with each other. The narration is third person limited, close — the reader is inside Kyle''s augmented perception. Humor is rare, dry, and always at his own expense. When violence happens, the prose gets clinical — he describes it like a surgeon describes an incision. When beauty surfaces, the prose warms half a degree, then shuts it down.', N'Experimental NeoCortex Program Atlas array — 32,768 electrodes, 256 threads, 8x standard density. Degrading firmware. Gives cognitive speed, reaction time, fragmentary sensory access.', N'Freelance enforcement, retrieval, problem-solving for the excluded. Maintains hardware with salvaged tools.', N'Neo-noir male, 27, lean athletic build, olive-tan skin, dark brown hair short on sides longer on top pushed back, grey-green eyes with faint gold ring in left iris, faint surgical scar behind left ear, micro-scarring on forearms, worn dark leather jacket over tactical underlayer, cargo pants, resoled combat boots, carbon-black katana across back in matte friction sheath, standing in rain-slicked neon-lit alley, clinical stillness, hands loose at sides, eyes scanning corners, photorealistic, cinematic lighting, GLMZ 2200 aesthetic, no visible cybernetics, gritty urban environment, atmospheric fog, high detail --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'neo-noir cyberpunk enforcer, male 27, lean muscular build, olive-tan skin, rough and imperfect face, asymmetrical features, slightly crooked nose, uneven jawline, subtle under-eye fatigue, small facial scars on cheek and bridge of nose, faint stubble, tired but dangerous eyes, grey-green with faint gold ring in left iris

hair: short dark brown, uneven, spiked but messy and clumped from rain, not styled, irregular hairline

expression: cold, focused, emotionally restrained, slightly hardened, not heroic, not attractive, grounded realism

outfit: dark leather jacket with tactical padding and attachments, worn but maintained, partially open over fitted dark shirt, utility belt with holster, reinforced gloves, holding pistol low in right hand, carbon-black katana strapped across back

walking forward through narrow neon-lit alley, rain falling, droplets streaking through frame, subtle motion blur, shallow depth of field

environment: dense cyberpunk alley, high-end district, teal and cyan dominant lighting with magenta accents, glowing signage and advertisements, clean but wet surfaces, reflective pavement, light fog, blurred background figures

lighting: cinematic neon rim lighting, face partially shadowed but readable, sharp highlights, strong color contrast, volumetric light through rain, reflections across ground

mood: controlled, dangerous, professional, corporate dystopia, sleek but hostile, capitalism-saturated environment

style: photorealistic but grounded, NOT idealized, NOT symmetrical, NOT model-like, avoid beauty standards

camera: 50mm lens, eye-level, natural perspective, slight imperfections in skin texture, visible pores', N'''Silence'' — Dae-jung Seo''s Custom Katana', N'Torii Security Group Compact Combat Shotgun TSS-3 ''Chorus''', N'', N'', N'The Pivot — Unit 2F, 1554 W Chicago Ave / 801 N Ashland, West Town sector', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Pivot — West Town / Circuit boundary', N'local', N'The Pivot — West Town / Circuit boundary', N'Eastern European / Pacific Islander (Corbin — Anglo-Slavic; Vasik — Czech-Polynesian)', 180, 77, N'Lean, ropey muscle — not gym-built, survival-built. Narrow hips, long arms, a frame designed for speed over power.', N'Dark brown, almost black', N'Short on the sides, longer on top, perpetually pushed back. Uneven — he cuts it himself with a blade.', N'Short', N'Grey-green — the left iris has a faint gold ring from the NeoCortex array''s optic thread bleed', N'Olive-tan, weathered. The kind of complexion that doesn''t burn but doesn''t glow either — it just endures.', N'Clean-shaven. Faint acne scarring along the jawline. Skin texture slightly uneven around the temples where the electrode array interfaces subcutaneously.', N'None visible at first glance — the NeoCortex array is subcutaneous. On close inspection: faint trace lines under the skin at the temples, barely visible unless you know what to look for. The left pupil dilates fractionally slower than the right.', N'Still when standing, efficient when moving. No wasted motion. Walks like someone who learned to navigate spaces where being noticed gets you killed. Hands stay loose and low. When he enters a room, his eyes track the corners before the people.', N'Dark, functional, layered. Worn leather jacket over ballistic-weave underlayer. Cargo pants with reinforced knees. Boots that have been resoled three times. Nothing branded, nothing new. The katana rides across his back in a matte-black friction sheath.', N'The experimental implant contains fragmentary neural patterns from other test subjects who died in the program. Kyle sometimes has memories that are not his.', N'Tight, sensory, interior. Short sentences because the hardware processes faster than language.', N'Clipped. Fragments. The silence between sentences carries weight.', N'', N'', N'', N'The NeoCortex array draws power via caloric conversion — the body metabolizes food and a fraction of the energy is shunted to the battery. Starting charge is determined by what was eaten and when: high-protein/high-fat meal 2-3 hours before action = 100% capacity. Light meal or protein bar = 70-80%. Processed food, fast food = 60-70%. Skipped meal = 50-60%. Alcohol reduces max by 15% regardless of food intake. The battery cannot be topped off mid-combat — there is no refueling while fighting.', N'Cannot recover mid-combat — the body cannot metabolize food fast enough to matter during a fight. Post-combat: glucose and caloric intake begins recovery at approximately 5% per 15 minutes at rest. Full recovery from 0% requires 3-4 hours and a full meal.', N'kyle_ellen_corbin_vasik');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a706-72b0-9dc6-0f8775af459e', N'Bakhtiyor Toktogulov', N'Bakhtiyor', N'', N'Toktogulov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, Copperhead district — a shop called Fitted Right operating out of a converted auto-repair bay, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Augmentation technician and prosthetics fitter at a mid-tier private shop in Geartown', N'Independent (Fitted Right, self-owned); occasional contract work with Aurochs Medical Complex overflow', N'Bakhtiyor Toktogulov is the kind of person who takes up the exact right amount of space — not small, not large, but present. They have warm golden-brown skin and a shaved head tattooed with a circuit-diagram pattern in bioluminescent ink that glows a soft rose-pink in low light, which is where most of Geartown lives. Their own augmentations are a showcase: a left arm replaced below the elbow with a transparent-cased prosthetic through which the mechanics are fully visible, designed by themselves; retractable claws on their right hand, functional and filed to needle points; and an iris mod that gives them compound optical vision at close range for fitting work. They dress in work coveralls with the sleeves rolled and every pocket used.

They are twenty-seven going on forty in terms of the work they''ve seen, but still twenty-seven in the sense that they get genuinely excited about elegant solutions to mechanical problems and will explain at length why a particular joint design is either beautiful or an abomination. They learned the trade from a mentor who died of cardiac failure two years ago and left them the shop — which they are still paying off — and they carry that loss in the slight over-seriousness they bring to doing the job well. They treat every fitting like it matters because, as they will tell you if you ask, ''it goes on a person''s body. It had better matter.''', N'Equipment resource and augmentation knowledge base, potential contact for black-market or off-record prosthetics work, local color in Geartown, can identify the origin and quality of augmentations on sight', N'', N'Left forearm prosthetic below elbow — transparent-cased, custom built, internal mechanisms fully visible; retractable claws right hand (functional geneware hybrid); compound-optic iris mod for close-range fitting precision; bioluminescent scalp tattoo (rose-pink, UV-reactive ink)', N'Opens the shop at ten, runs fittings and consultations through the afternoon, spends evenings in the back workshop building or modifying components; prays to the shop''s E.L.F. — a cranky entity they call the Foreman — every morning by uploading a complaint about the previous day''s problems.', N'Bakhtiyor Toktogulov, 172cm tall lean technician with warm golden-tan skin blending Central Asian, Southeast Asian, and global heritage. Shaved scalp glowing with rose-pink bioluminescent circuit-diagram UV tattoo. Dark brown eyes with visible multi-faceted optical modification, slight epicanthic fold. Prominent Central Asian cheekbones, broad nasal base, clean-shaven, focused expression. Standing in technician''s stance, weight on balls of feet. Transparent polycarbonate prosthetic left forearm below elbow revealing black servo motors and hydraulic mechanisms. Right hand with retractable iridescent claws partially extended. Wearing gray work coveralls with rolled sleeves, steel-toed scuffed boots, multiple tool-filled pockets. Minor burn scars visible on right hand. Workshop setting with soft amber lighting catching high cheekbones. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Central Asian Turkic ancestry (74.6%) forms the dominant genetic foundation, with Bakhtiyor displaying the characteristic features of Kazakh-Kyrgyz lineage. Southeast Asian contribution (8.9%) adds subtle refinement to eye geometry and slight angularity to facial structure. Northern European ancestry (8.0%) introduces cool undertones that modulate the warmth, while Hispanic/Latin American (5.1%) and Sub-Saharan African (3.4%) ancestry enrich skin undertones with golden and warm mahogany notes. The overall phenotype presents as distinctly Central Asian with harmonious global blending — a face that speaks to the Ubiquitous Diaspora''s genetic complexity.', 172, 68, N'Lean and functional, muscled through the shoulders and forearms from years of precision work; economical movement, no wasted mass', N'None', N'Shaved scalp', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown with compound optical modification — iris mod splits into multi-faceted lens pattern under magnification, soft amber-gold when active', N'Warm golden-tan complexion with balanced undertones: Central Asian warmth as the base, enriched by Southeast Asian luminosity, cooled slightly by Northern European influence, and deepened by Latin American and African undertones creating a sophisticated mid-gold tone. The skin has resilient, slightly weathered quality with subtle glow responsive to workshop lighting.', N'Clear, well-maintained skin bearing light tool marks and minor burn scars from workshop work; prominent cheekbones characteristic of Central Asian Turkic ancestry with slightly broad nasal base typical of that heritage; clean-shaven with warm-toned skin that catches light across high cheekbones and defined jawline; subtle epicanthic eye fold from Southeast Asian contribution refines eye shape; expression typically focused but capable of sudden animation when discussing mechanical elegance', N'Left forearm prosthetic below elbow with transparent polycarbonate case revealing full internal mechanisms — articulated joints, servo motors, pressure sensors, and hydraulic lines all visible in matte-black housing; retractable claws on right hand that extend 4cm beyond fingertips when deployed, filed to needle points with iridescent finish; iris modification visible as subtle multi-faceted lens pattern in dark eyes that shifts when compound vision mode engages', N'Stands with shoulders slightly forward, weight balanced toward the balls of their feet — a technician''s stance ready for precision work at any moment. Moves economically with minimal flourish, but handles objects with deliberate care and respect. Left arm movement compensates naturally, suggesting years of prosthetic integration. Hands are their primary communicative tool — they gesture when explaining mechanical concepts, fingers moving to trace invisible designs in the air', N'Work-worn gray coveralls with multiple pockets all in active use (tools, components, meters), sleeves rolled to mid-forearm to display the transparent prosthetic and allow maximum dexterity; reinforced knees and elbows darkened by shop contact. Undergarments are plain functional black. Boots are steel-toed, scuffed, broken in — practical Tier 3 workwear. No jewelry or adornment beyond the scalp tattoo and augmentations. Clothing bears the faint chemical smell of workshop solvents and the visual texture of someone who has ceased to see their appearance as separate from their function', N'They have been quietly building a fully off-record prosthetic limb for a Tier 1 child in The Narrows whose family can''t afford registered medical equipment. If Aurochs Medical Complex or a Helix compliance officer found out, they''d lose their commercial license. They''re two weeks from finishing it.', N'Technical about augmentations, casual and colorful about everything else; peppers conversation with Mongolian and Polish words when excited or annoyed', N'Fast when enthused, abrupt when focused; explanations come out in bursts of complete thought rather than building sentence by sentence', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bakhtiyor_toktogulov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e2-7912-b40e-0f8e81d95a96', N'Fermin Baiseitov', N'Fermin', N'', N'Baiseitov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, lower Blackpipe Corridor — lives in transit housing on Avon Curve, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Ferrogate Transit rail operator, Deepwell Station line', N'Ferrogate Transit — Line 7 Operator, Deepwell-Bronzeline corridor; member of the Ferrogate Worker Mutual Aid cell', N'Fermin Baiseitov is lean and angular, with a long face, close-cropped hair, and the particular posture of someone who spends ten hours a day in a seated position in a tight cab: slightly hunched forward, neck perpetually stiff. His skin is a warm dark brown and he has a geneware mod — iridescent peacock-pattern irises — that he got done at nineteen when he had money for exactly one vanity thing and he chose to make it count. He keeps his fingernails very clean because the cab makes them filthy and cleanliness feels like the one thing he controls.

Fermin Baiseitov is not an unhappy man, but he is a careful one. He has seen too many things go wrong in the tunnels — mechanical failures, platform incidents, the odd person who steps onto the rail on purpose — to be loose with his attention. Off the clock he is surprisingly funny in a dry, deadpan way, a collector of absurd overheard conversations which he logs in a personal audio journal he has kept for eleven years. He has mild, undiagnosed tunnel fatigue — a known occupational condition among long-haul transit operators — which manifests as a need for open-sky time and a deep, inarticulate dread of any room without a visible exit.', N'Transit-connected information source — he sees who moves through the underground city every day. Potential witness. Window into Ferrogate''s labor conditions and the hidden life of the rail system.', N'', N'Geneware peacock-patterned iridescent irises. Ferrogate-issued neural timing patch (mandatory for operators — regulates micro-sleep and reaction latency). Nothing else.', N'Runs four shifts per week on the Deepwell-Bronzeline express, each shift ten hours. Uses off days for open-air walks along Grindstone Shore and recording his journal. Attends mutual aid meetings on the 12th of each month.', N'Fermin Baiseitov, transit operator in GLMZ, close-cropped black hair, striking iridescent peacock-blue-violet eyes with engineered geneware, warm tan skin with golden undertones and subtle East Asian features. Broad high cheekbones, straight jawline, slight forward lean from years at transit controls. Lean angular build, 178cm tall. Wearing dark charcoal long-sleeved shirt, dark blue Ferrogate operator jacket with reflective piping and Line 7 transit patches, practical dark pants. Worn analog wristwatch and simple brass ring visible. Faint white wrist scar barely visible, small burn mark on right hand. Tense focused expression, eyes intense and concentrated. Standing in neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone transit hub, artificial station lighting casting cool shadows across his face, highlighting iridescent eyes. Precise measured posture, minimal movement. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, gritty industrial setting, moody atmospheric lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Complex continental blend dominated by Northern European (38.8%) and Central Asian (24.5%) ancestry, with significant East Asian (18%), Eastern European (12.8%), and South Asian (5%) admixture. This genetic mosaic creates striking facial architecture: broad, defined cheekbones and balanced proportions from Northern European and Central Asian stock, refined by East Asian eye shape and skin undertones. South Asian heritage contributes warmth and depth to complexion. The result is a distinctly cosmopolitan face—high angular cheekbones, straight jawline with subtle East Asian eye fold, balanced proportions with warm golden-neutral undertones characteristic of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with pronounced shoulders and a slight forward curve to the spine from prolonged seated work. Long-limbed, almost ascetic in frame, with minimal body fat.', N'Black', N'Close-cropped, military-neat, maintained for minimal cab friction and sweat management', N'Short', N'Iridescent peacock-pattern — naturally dark brown base with engineered blue-green-violet shimmer that shifts with light and pupil dilation; geneware modification performed at age 19', N'Warm tan with golden undertones and neutral depth, reflecting the balanced blend of Northern European, Central Asian, East Asian, and South Asian ancestry. Years of artificial station lighting have prevented deeper tanning, maintaining a balanced mid-range tone with subtle golden warmth and slight olive undertones beneath the surface.', N'Broad, defined face with prominent high cheekbones reflecting Northern European and Central Asian ancestry structure, balanced proportions with a straight jawline and subtle monolid characteristics from East Asian heritage. Skin is clear but shows minor stress lines around the eyes and perpetual tension across the forehead from focused concentration. Subtle warm undertones throughout. Fingernails are consistently clean and well-maintained, sometimes with visible calluses from cab controls.', N'Peacock-pattern iridescent irises are immediately striking and clearly geneware. Ferrogate-issued neural timing patch is subcutaneous at the base of the skull — invisible unless specifically sought, but a trained eye might catch a faint linear scar at the hairline where it was installed.', N'Habitually slight forward lean even when standing, as if anticipating the need to engage controls. Neck carries perpetual tension. Movements are precise and economical — no wasted motion. When walking, takes measured, deliberate strides. Sits with ankles crossed or feet firmly planted. Eyes move with intense focus before head follows.', N'Tier 3-4 working class. Off-shift: well-maintained dark synthetic pants, long-sleeved shirt in muted colors (grey, charcoal, dark blue) for sun protection and concealment of sweat. Ferrogate-issued operator jacket — dark blue with reflective piping and Line 7 patches, worn during shifts. Practical shoes with good grip. Minimal jewelry except for a worn analog wristwatch and a simple brass ring on left middle finger. Everything is clean, functional, and chosen for durability over style. No visible corporate branding outside the transit uniform.', N'Eight months ago, he saw something on the rail through his cab camera — a person being pushed onto the tracks at Kessler Interchange, not jumping. He braked, nobody died. Ferrogate''s official incident report logged it as a medical episode. He still has the raw footage cached on a local drive. He has told no one.', N'Dry, minimal, observational. Hausa-inflected sentence rhythms from his father''s side mixed with flat Meridian transit-worker slang. Uses technical rail terminology as metaphor without realizing he does it.', N'Measured and unhurried, with long pauses before punchlines that land better for the wait.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fermin_baiseitov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60c-71ed-8289-0fc751d1eb5f', N'Afsoon Mwangi', N'Afsoon', N'', N'Mwangi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, the workshop district — specifically a half-indoor bay called ''Tamboli''s'' on the corner of Flue Street and Anvil Row, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Auto and drone mechanic, salvage rebuilder', N'Independent; informal referral network with three other Geartown mechanics; occasional contract work for Ferrogate Transit''s overflow maintenance load', N'Afsoon Mwangi is a tall, slope-shouldered man running to comfortable thickness in the middle, with dark copper skin, a full black beard going silver at the chin, and close-cropped hair that is always slightly more singed at the edges than it was last week. His right hand is cybernetic from the wrist — not a prestige replacement but a working salvage prosthetic he rebuilt himself from three incompatible donor parts, and it shows: it is mismatched chrome and matte black polymer, three fingers slightly longer than the original scale, with a multitool socket in the palm he added himself. He finds it better than the original.

He has the specific personality of a man who loves his work with an intensity he cannot quite transfer to human beings. Not that he dislikes people — he likes them fine, he just relates to machines better, and machines know it. He has a reputation across Geartown for resurrecting drones and ground vehicles that any two other mechanics would have written off, and he charges less than he should and more than clients want to pay, which puts him in a permanent state of negotiation with his own finances. He is at his most relaxed covered in lubricant and at his most uncomfortable receiving compliments.', N'Technical resource and Geartown fixture; can repair or modify vehicles and drones, source parts through salvage networks, or assess the mechanical makeup of unusual technology. His Ferrogate contract work gives him knowledge of transit infrastructure others wouldn''t have.', N'', N'Cybernetic right hand (salvage-rebuilt, self-modified; palm multitool socket). Subdermal thermal sensor in the left forearm (detects heat signatures in machinery — practical for finding faults without dismantling).', N'In the bay by 0700, works until his back tells him to stop (usually around 2000). Eats lunch without washing his hands. Leaves a small machine part — a gear, a resistor, a connector — at the E.L.F. shrine that lives in his parts cabinet, which he calls ''the inventory spirit'' and treats with cautious respect.', N'A tall man of mixed heritage in his fifties, rich warm bronze skin with deep melanin depth, weathered from years in workshop heat. Prominent South Asian and Sub-Saharan African cheekbones, full lips, subtle widened jaw from Eastern European ancestry. Black hair close-cropped with silver threading at beard line, deep brown eyes with slight epicanthal fold. Deep creases around eyes and mouth, full trimmed black beard with silver at chin, perpetually stained with machine oil. Burned scars visible on left forearm and right temple-cheekbone. Right hand entirely mismatched cybernetic prosthetic—burnished chrome palm with three oversized fingers, matte black polymer wrist coupling, custom multitool socket with hand-etched ''+'' symbol, audible servos. Subdermal thermal sensor hexagon outline faintly visible on left forearm. Slouched posture from decades of workbench labor, wearing scorched heavy canvas overshirt with faded 2198-era tool supplier logo, oil-stained canvas work pants, heat-marked steel-toed boots. Magnification goggles hanging around neck. Grease under fingernails, rag in back pocket. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial workshop setting, harsh overhead LED lighting casting sharp shadows, machinery and salvage parts in background, utterly utilitarian and tool-focused presence, no ornamentation, economical precision in every movement --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: Sub-Saharan African (34.2%), South Asian (27.4%), Eastern European (14.8%), Southeast Asian (12.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (11.1%). This multidirectional ancestry produces a distinctive warm-toned phenotype with layered features. The Sub-Saharan African and South Asian components contribute significant melanin depth and warm undertones; Eastern European ancestry shows through bone structure and subtle complexion variations; Southeast Asian heritage visible in subtle eye geometry and cheekbone prominence; Hispanic/Latin American ancestry adds olive-golden warmth throughout. The result is a man whose face reads as genuinely uncertain of origin—deliberately cosmopolitan in ways that defy easy categorization.', 188, 94, N'Tall and slope-shouldered with a comfortable thickening through the torso; the build of a man who spends sixteen hours a day bending over workbenches and doesn''t prioritize the gym. Still carries functional strength in his upper back and forearms.', N'Black with silver threading at the beard line', N'Close-cropped, slightly singed at the edges from repeated exposure to heat sources and welding proximity', N'Short', N'Deep brown with subtle epicanthal fold suggestion from Southeast Asian ancestry, unremarkable and pragmatic', N'Rich warm bronze with complex undertone layering—deepened baseline from Sub-Saharan African heritage, golden warmth layered from South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, further warmed by years of workshop exposure and ambient heat. Skin reads as genuinely sun-weathered and heat-treated, not temporary tanning.', N'Weathered and practical. Deep creases around the eyes and mouth from squinting at small mechanical tolerances. Full black beard with silver at the chin, kept trimmed but not groomed. Perpetually stained with machine oil and trace metals; the staining is so consistent it reads as intentional. Facial structure shows balanced multiheric blend: prominent cheekbones from South Asian and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, straight nose bridge with subtle broadness, full lips, moderate wideness across the jaw suggesting Eastern European heritage contribution.', N'Right hand is entirely cybernetic from the wrist — a visibly salvage-built replacement constructed from three incompatible donor prosthetics. The assembly is deliberately mismatched: burnished chrome on the palm and fingers, matte black polymer on the wrist coupling and back-of-hand. Three fingers are slightly longer than anatomically standard. A custom multitool socket is integrated into the palm, clearly self-installed with visible solder marks and a hand-etched ''+'' symbol. The hand moves with practiced efficiency but audible servos, no attempt at concealment. Subdermal thermal sensor in left forearm creates a faint hexagonal outline visible when he flexes — no cosmetic covering, treated as tool, not modification.', N'Slouches slightly from years of leaning over workbenches; shoulders curve inward at rest. Moves with deliberate precision when working — economical, no wasted motion. Walks with a mechanic''s shuffle, one hand usually half-extended as if reaching toward something. Rarely makes direct eye contact with people, but watches machines and hands with intense focus. At ease only when holding a tool or diagnosing a problem.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian. Worn canvas work pants with oil-stained legs, multiple cargo pockets holding small components, a reinforced waistband to support his lower back. Thermal undershirt (usually grey or black, always marked with grease). Overshirt varies by season but always a heavy canvas or synthetic weave with scorched edges and a faded logo for a tool supplier that stopped operating in 2198. Steel-toed boots, resoled three times, scuffed and heat-marked. A battered pair of magnification goggles hangs around his neck ninety percent of the day. No jewelry. Carries a rag perpetually stuffed in his back pocket. His hands are the only thing about him that look intentional — the cybernetic one because it is, the organic one because it is calloused into a tool itself.', N'During a Ferrogate overflow contract, he discovered a structural fault in the supports beneath the Ironvein elevated track — the same section where the incident three years ago occurred. He filed a report. Nothing happened. He filed again. Nothing happened. He now knows someone at Ferrogate is sitting on both reports and doesn''t know whether to escalate further or whether doing so will cost him the contract and possibly more.', N'Technical and specific; South Asian English from his father''s Marathi heritage, blended with Andean Spanish-inflected phrasing from his mother''s side. Uses machinery as metaphor constantly and often doesn''t notice.', N'Unhurried, even when he''s behind; speaks as if he''s working through the sentence while he''s saying it', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'afsoon_mwangi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a652-7eb4-a1f0-0ffdebe6ab66', N'Ceren Makwa', N'Ceren', N'', N'Makwa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Archer''s Line Arcturus Civil Security Monitoring Station 7, subterranean level, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security surveillance operator, Archer''s Line monitoring station', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division, Surveillance Division', N'Ceren Makwa is twenty-seven and spends ten hours a day in a room that has no windows, watching 847 feeds from Archer''s Line and the surrounding districts. She is slight and quick, with dark brown skin and natural hair she keeps pinned up for the headset, and she has cat ears — a cosmetic mod she got at nineteen because she wanted them, small and tawny and mobile, which is to say they move with her actual attention and have become professionally useful in ways she didn''t anticipate. Her eyes are her own. She is very careful about her eyes. Her workstation has six physical monitors and one neural feed she plugs directly into via a port at her left temple.

Ceren Makwa is frighteningly good at her job. She has a spatial memory for camera angles that her supervisors call uncanny and she calls simply how she sees, and she notices things in footage that automated flagging misses entirely — a particular way a person is carrying their weight, a crowd behaving three seconds before it does something. She finds this ability isolating in a way she cannot quite explain. She has watched every corner of Archer''s Line for four years and she has never stood in most of it.', N'Eyes and information — Makena knows what''s on camera across a significant portion of the city. She can confirm alibis, locate missing persons, track movements, and identify faces. She is not easily corrupted but has specific pressure points. Can be a source, a complication, or a gatekeeper depending on what player characters need.', N'', N'Cosmetic cat ears (tawny, mood-mobile). Neural feed port at left temple — standard-issue surveillance operator interface, allows direct sensory integration with the monitoring network for her shift. Slight chromatic tinting on fingernails, cosmetic, changes with temperature.', N'Arrives at the monitoring station before her shift to review flag summaries from the previous watch. Spends her shift on active monitoring, flagging incidents for dispatch, pulling historical footage on request. Eats at her workstation. Takes exactly one fifteen-minute break in the corridor because the monitoring station has no natural light and she has been advised by a doctor to experience it occasionally.', N'Ceren Makwa, 163cm tall, wiry build, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones blending Indigenous American, East Asian, Middle Eastern, Hispanic, and Northern European heritage. Dark brown eyes with slightly uplifted canthal axis, clear complexion with prominent broad cheekbones and blended jawline. Natural dark brown hair pinned in functional bun, pulled back from temple. Active tawny cat ears with autonomous mobility at skull apex. Small circular port scar at left temple. Chromatic temperature-shifting nail tints in cool blues and warm ambers. Chrome bracelet on left wrist. Wearing standard-issue Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security uniform: smart-fabric undershirt, tactical vest with comm array pockets, dark reinforced utility pants. Perfect stillness, economical posture, cat ears rotating with focused attention. Subterranean Civil Security station setting, cool neon blue and amber lighting, GLMZ aesthetic, high-tech neural integration visible, professional and alert expression, technological surveillance environment --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Archer''s Line Arcturus Civil Security Monitoring Station 7', N'local', N'Archer''s Line Arcturus Civil Security Monitoring Station 7', N'Indigenous American (41.2%) with significant East Asian (22.0%), Middle Eastern (15.3%), and Hispanic/Latin American (13.6%) ancestry, plus Northern European (7.9%). The combination creates a distinctive face blending Indigenous American facial structure and bone geometry with East Asian eye shape and cheekbone prominence, warmed by Middle Eastern depth and Latin American richness, subtly brightened by Northern European undertones that create unexpected luminosity in certain light.', 163, 52, N'Slight and quick, economical muscle definition from desk work and restless habit rather than conditioning. Wiry frame with minimal body fat, suggesting someone who forgets to eat unless reminded.', N'Natural dark brown', N'Pinned up in a functional bun or secured wrap, kept off the face and away from the neural port at her temple', N'Medium (shoulder-length when down)', N'Natural dark brown with slightly uplifted canthal axis reflecting East Asian ancestry', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden and olive undertones, the Indigenous American and Latin American heritage dominant but enriched by Middle Eastern depth and Northern European luminosity that creates unexpected brightness in certain light. Sun-kissed complexity from ancestral geography.', N'Clear, unmarked face with minimal expression lines despite her age — she spends too much time focused on screens to wrinkle. Meticulous grooming, no visible blemishes. Slight pallor from subterranean work environment offset by her rich natural skin tone. Broad cheekbones reflecting Indigenous American and East Asian influence; jawline shows the blended geometry of Indigenous American and Middle Eastern ancestry with Latin American warmth. Facial width and structure balance the strong Indigenous American bone structure with East Asian definition and subtle Middle Eastern contours.', N'Tawny cat ears with active mobility (primary visual identifier). Chromatic nail tinting visible on fingertips and nails — currently shifts with ambient temperature, subtle color gradients from cool blues to warm ambers depending on her body temperature and the environment. Neural port at left temple is mostly invisible unless looked for directly, but her habit of touching it while thinking makes its location known.', N'Sits with perfect stillness when focused, barely breathing. Moves with economical efficiency — nothing wasted. Her cat ears are almost constantly active, rotating and tilting with her gaze and attention, betraying what she''s focusing on even when her body is motionless. When she walks, she moves quietly and deliberately, as though navigating a room full of cameras (which, to her, she always is). Occasionally touches the neural port at her temple when thinking.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Standard-issue Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security uniform when on shift — smart-fabric undershirt with embedded thermal regulation, tactical vest with comm array pockets, dark utility pants with reinforced knee panels. Off-shift: comfortable, practical clothing in muted grays and blacks. Minimal jewelry except for a thin chrome bracelet on her left wrist (probably a failed augmentation attempt or a keepsake). Maintains the uniform meticulously but dresses for function rather than fashion. No visible corporate branding, no luxury indicators.', N'She has been tracking a specific individual across 14 months of footage — not because they''ve done anything wrong, but because they appear to move through Archer''s Line in patterns she cannot solve. She has compiled 200+ hours of footage into a private archive on a personal chip she keeps at home. She does not know what she''s looking for.', N'Precise and spatial — describes things in terms of position, angle, timing. Uses camera numbers and grid coordinates in casual conversation and catches herself doing it.', N'Fast, slightly compressed, like she''s used to keeping up with multiple feeds', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ceren_makwa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a64a-76d5-92b4-102c066bf5f6', N'Adaora Volkov', N'Adaora', N'', N'Volkov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism — a converted monitoring station that serves as both apartment and field lab, directly on the lake-facing edge, near Clark and Addison', N'Climate Scientist, independent researcher formerly of Arcturus R&D', N'No current institutional affiliation; informal data-sharing relationship with two University Spine graduate students he mentors unofficially; his sensor network is technically registered to a shell cooperative in Kamm''s Landing', N'Adaora Volkov is a tall man gone broad in the shoulders and soft around the middle, with dark brown skin weathered by decades of outdoor fieldwork and close-cropped white hair that he keeps because it makes him look distinguished and he is not above vanity. His eyes are natural — a warm, medium brown — which is unusual enough in his social circles that people sometimes comment on it, which he finds mildly funny. He has a prosthetic left hand from a fieldwork accident in 2181 that he has declined to upgrade past basic functionality because he likes the old model and refuses to explain this to anyone.

He spent twenty-two years as Arcturus''s senior climate modeler before his models started showing lake-system instabilities that Arcturus''s infrastructure division did not want modeled, at which point his funding was quietly restructured and his team was dissolved. He now works alone out of Edgewater Prism, maintaining a network of self-built sensor buoys across the lake, and publishes through whatever venue will take him. He is not bitter in an active way — bitterness requires energy he''d rather spend — but he has a very clear view of exactly what happened and exactly who made which decision and why, and this clarity gives him a quality that people find alternately comforting and unsettling, like someone who has already done the math on the worst outcome.', N'Possessor of data about lake-system instabilities that powerful entities don''t want known; long-view perspective character who has survived institutional betrayal; source of technical expertise on environmental systems', N'', N'Functional prosthetic left hand (older model, basic grip and sensation, deliberately not upgraded); barometric implant behind left ear (tells him pressure changes before he consciously registers them); sun-damage dermal repair layer (medical, from years of outdoor fieldwork)', N'Rises before dawn to check sensor buoy data uplinks, spends mornings in analysis, takes his lunch on the monitoring station''s outer platform regardless of weather, conducts equipment maintenance in the afternoons.', N'Adaora Volkov, 188cm tall weathered man with warm medium-brown skin and olive undertones reflecting Eastern European, South Asian, and Southeast Asian heritage. White close-cropped hair, medium brown natural eyes, deeply lined face from decades of fieldwork. Visible older prosthetic left hand with mechanical joints in dark synthetic material. Scarred left temple partially hidden by hairline. Solar keratoses on ears and shoulders. Standing with slight forward lean, eyes in middle-distance focus. Wearing patched Arcturus field jacket with faded branding, dark waterproof pants, work boots, weathered wool watch cap. Titanium ring and woven cordage bracelet. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone research station setting, cool fluorescent and ambient lighting, utilitarian aesthetic, no affectation --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Predominantly Eastern European (59.7%) with substantial South Asian (17.2%) and Southeast Asian (8.3%) ancestry, creating a warm, complex phenotype. Hispanic/Latin American (8.1%), Sub-Saharan African (4.0%), and East Asian (2.7%) heritage add subtle depth and variation. The Eastern European foundation provides bone structure and initial fair skin potential, substantially warmed and enriched by South and Southeast Asian contributions that shift skin tone toward warm olive-brown, refine cheekbone structure, and shape eye characteristics. The smaller ancestry percentages create nuanced facial feature blending rather than stark distinctions.', 188, 92, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, thickened through the torso from six decades of field seasons and desk work, but still carrying the frame of someone who spent his thirties doing physical labor in harsh conditions', N'White', N'Close-cropped, neat, deliberately maintained', N'Short', N'Medium brown, natural', N'Warm medium brown with olive undertones throughout, reflecting the dominant Eastern European base substantially warmed and deepened by South Asian and Southeast Asian ancestry. Deeper tan on face and forearms from decades of selective sun exposure during fieldwork, lighter across chest and upper back; the underlying warmth unified across all areas, creating cohesive warm complexion rather than stark contrast.', N'Heavily lined face, particularly around the eyes and mouth from decades of squinting into weather; sun-damaged areas show faint evidence of dermal repair work (slight textural smoothing on cheeks and nose bridge); facial structure reflects Eastern European geometry modified by South and Southeast Asian influence in cheekbone prominence, eye shape, and jaw definition; maintained grooming but not fastidious.', N'Prosthetic left hand — older model with visible mechanical joints, darker synthetic material, deliberately not cosmetically matched to his skin tone; the prosthetic is slightly less responsive than a modern augment, movements precise but fractionally delayed. Barometric implant behind left ear visible as a faint bulge and subtle scarring, barely noticeable unless you know to look. Dermal repair layer across face and upper body not visually apparent except as slight texture variation in healing scars.', N'Stands with the slight forward lean of someone perpetually ready to move toward a weather station or data problem; moves deliberately, economically, no wasted motion; left arm compensates automatically for the prosthetic''s slight lag — his body has adapted completely. Tends to look slightly past people rather than directly at them, eyes defaulting to middle-distance focus as if still scanning for weather patterns.', N'Tier 3-4 practical. Favors heavy thermal layering even in moderate weather — old Arcturus field jackets (now patched, still bearing faded company branding he has not bothered to remove), functional waterproof pants in dark blue or black, work boots maintained obsessively. Wears a weathered wool watch cap indoors sometimes. No affectation, no brand-signaling beyond the utility of things that last.', N'His 2193 sensor data shows a thermal anomaly in the lake''s deep current system that, run through his models, projects a significant surface-ecosystem disruption within eight to twelve years — disruption severe enough to affect GLMZ''s entire water processing infrastructure. He has told no one. He is still running the models again, looking for the error, because he desperately wants there to be an error.', N'Precise technical language for science; plain and direct language for everything else; no filler words — when he doesn''t know something he says so immediately', N'Unhurried, with natural pauses; speaks in complete thoughts rather than incomplete ones', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'adaora_volkov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68c-7564-b815-1071c05d1784', N'Cruz Hinojosa', N'Cruz', N'', N'Hinojosa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 57, NULL, 26.7, 3, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Fixer - Shrine operator', N'Tessera Corponation (mid-level fixer)', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'A stocky, 178cm tall man of mixed Northern European, Hispanic/Latin American, Middle Eastern, and South Asian ancestry standing in a GLMZ 2200s setting. Medium-warm olive-golden skin with amber depth, weathered face with deep lines, high angular cheekbones softened by fuller features. Steel-gray hair with black undertones pulled into a long shoulder-length braid threaded with copper wire. Deep brown eyes with subtle amber undertones, occasionally flickering with faint violet light—neural augmentation. Neatly groomed salt-and-pepper beard. Ritual geometric scarification visible on forearms. Small circular burns on palms. Fingers bear faint luminescent tracery. Wearing layered earth-tone fabrics (rust, charcoal, indigo)—long open-front vest embroidered with hand-stitched circuit patterns and animist glyphs, simple cotton undershirt, copper-wire woven belt. Worn leather boots. Planted stance, feet wide, hands conducting invisible currents. Slow, deliberate, ritualistic movement. Standing in dim neon-tinged urban environment with soft atmospheric lighting catching the subtle sheen of his skin and the violet flicker of his augmented eyes. Neo-noir spiritualist aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Multitonal blend of Northern European (37.4%), Hispanic/Latin American (23.9%), Middle Eastern (22.7%), and South Asian (16.0%) ancestry. The genetic combination creates a distinctive phenotype: Northern European bone structure and initial fairness is substantially warmed and deepened by the combined influence of Hispanic, Middle Eastern, and South Asian genetics. High, prominent cheekbones reflect Middle Eastern and South Asian ancestry, while broader facial planes and underlying structure echo Northern European and Hispanic heritage. The result is a warm, olive-golden complexion with amber depth—a cosmopolitan genetic signature that reads as neither pale nor dark, but richly saturated.', 178, 82, N'Stocky and broad-shouldered, carrying weight with deliberate groundedness — the physique of someone who moves through the world with intention rather than haste', N'Steel gray with black undertones', N'Pulled back in a neat, shoulder-length braid threaded with thin copper wire', N'Long', N'Deep brown with subtle amber undertones', N'Medium-warm, olive-golden complexion with rich amber and earth-tone depth. The warm base reflects Northern European ancestry while olive saturation and golden undertones come from the Hispanic, Middle Eastern, and South Asian mix. Shifts subtly between honey and terracotta in varying light, with a faint perpetual sheen—either ritual oils or subcutaneous moisture regulation.', N'Weathered and lined, with deep creases around the eyes and mouth suggesting decades of intense focus. High, prominent cheekbones with angular Middle Eastern and Northern European structure, softened by fuller features from Hispanic and South Asian heritage. Neatly groomed salt-and-pepper beard kept close to the jaw. Skin carries a faint, perpetual sheen—ritual care or subcutaneous augmentation.', N'Eyes occasionally catch ambient light with a faint violet flicker—subcutaneous neural augmentation tied to perception or sensory processing. Fingertips bear faint luminescent tracery under dim light, barely visible unless handling conductive materials.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness, almost ritualistic. Each gesture appears weighted with meaning. Stands with feet planted wide, rooted. Speaks infrequently but with absolute certainty. Hands often in motion—not nervous, but conducting some invisible current.', N'Tier 3-4 aesthetic: layered linen and synthetic hybrid fabrics in earth tones (rust, charcoal, deep indigo). Long, open-front vest embroidered with hand-stitched circuit patterns and animist glyphs. Simple cotton undershirt. Woven copper wire and natural fiber belt. No corporate logos. Functional but ceremonial—clothing as spiritual practice. Worn leather boots, scuffed and purposefully maintained.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cruz_hinojosa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a698-7a67-923b-1077e38f3c7e', N'Haruko Sesay', N'Haruko', N'', N'Sesay', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — storefront called Volkov''s Fine Alterations, wedged between a noodle stall and a collapsed wellness clinic, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Identity fabricator and forger operating from a legitimate-front alterations shop', N'Independent; supplies documents to a loose network of clients including the Shallowgrave Skins, independent contractors, and desperate civilians — no exclusive allegiance', N'Haruko Sesay is a heavyset woman with Ethiopian-Slavic features — strong jaw, prominent cheekbones, skin a warm medium brown gone fine-lined at the eyes and mouth. Her natural hair is white at the temples and she refuses to change it, though she dyes the rest a rotating series of deep jewel tones depending on her mood; currently it''s dark burgundy. Her hands are extraordinary — surgeon-steady, ink-stained at the cuticles, and decorated with color-shifting nail geneware that she uses as a mood-board when designing documents. She dresses in the unassuming uniform of her cover: reading glasses she doesn''t need, a tape measure worn like a scarf, sensible shoes.

Haruko Sesay radiates the particular calm of someone who has made peace with the fact that their work is illegal and has decided to be excellent at it anyway. She is meticulous, sardonic, and prone to long explanations about the philosophical nature of identity that clients find disquieting but cannot interrupt. She has been in the Narrows for twenty-two years and considers herself a kind of civic institution. She prays to the E.L.F. of the laminator — a small shrine of laminated prayer-cards and USB offerings on her workbench — with genuine devotion.', N'Essential service provider — the character who can make someone disappear on paper or create a new person from scratch. Information source about who in the Narrows needs new identities and why. Potential moral compass figure.', N'', N'Color-shifting nail geneware (used professionally as a color-reference tool); retinal enhancement for microscale detail work', N'Opens the shop at 0900 for legitimate alterations business — she is, genuinely, an excellent tailor. Document work happens in the back room after 1700 when the street quiets. She closes for two hours midday to pray and eat.', N'Haruko Sesay, 52-year-old master tailor, GLMZ, medium-dark warm brown skin with golden undertones, strong West African cheekbones, fine wrinkles around dark brown augmented eyes, shoulder-length salt-and-pepper hair with deep burgundy-dyed ends, naturally textured curls. Sitting at work table in tailor''s shop, posture slightly forward-bent from decades of detail work, economical precise hand movements, color-shifting burgundy-to-teal iridescence nail geneware visible on all fingers, reading glasses on beaded chain around neck, tape measure draped like a scarf. Wearing charcoal trousers, deep jewel-toned work cardigan, apron with visible tools. Surrounded by fabric swatches and precision tailoring equipment. Calm authority in expression, surgeon-like focus. Warm shop lighting with neon accents reflecting off iridescent fingernails. Atmospheric neo-noir GLMZ setting, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, utilitarian and practiced aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Multi-continental heritage blend: 47.6% Sub-Saharan African (predominantly West African), 19.4% Indigenous American, 14.0% Hispanic/Latin American, 13.9% Southeast Asian, 3.2% Eastern European, 1.9% South Asian. The result is a striking phenotype reflecting deep African roots with significant Amerindian and Southeast Asian influence—warm medium-dark skin with subtle golden and olive undertones, high cheekbones with West African prominence blended with subtle Southeast Asian eye shape at the inner canthus, and overall facial structure reflecting the genetic dominance of Sub-Saharan and Indigenous American ancestry.', 168, 82, N'Heavyset, solidly muscled through the shoulders and torso — the build of someone who has spent five decades leaning over work tables and carrying bolts of fabric. Not soft; dense.', N'Naturally salt-and-pepper; temples and crown silver-white; remainder dyed deep burgundy (subject to rotation)', N'Worn loose, shoulder-length, with texture suggesting natural curl managed without aggressive straightening', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, natural; augmented with retinal enhancement lenses (imperceptible unless examined closely)', N'Warm medium-dark brown with golden and olive undertones—a nuanced blend reflecting Sub-Saharan African dominance with Southeast Asian and Amerindian warmth. Melanin-rich and luminous, sun-weathered but resilient.', N'Strong-jawed with high, prominently sculpted cheekbones showing West African definition blended with subtle Southeast Asian and Amerindian features. Fine-lined around eyes and mouth from fifty-two years of focused squinting and dry humor. Skin texture shows years of shop work—not weathered harshly, but lived-in and resilient. Grooming fastidious: nails always manicured, often color-shifting; cuticles perpetually ink-stained.', N'Color-shifting nail geneware on all ten fingers — the polish shifts through deep jewel tones (currently burgundy-to-teal iridescence) depending on light angle and emotional state; she uses this consciously as a design tool and mood indicator. Retinal enhancement is invisible unless she removes her non-prescription reading glasses, which she wears as part of her cover identity and keeps at hand on a beaded chain. No visible external chrome; all augmentation subtle and professional.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, every gesture purposeful. Posture slightly forward-bent from decades of tailoring work, shoulders rolled inward by habit. Hands are her most expressive feature: they move with surgeon-like steadiness and speak their own language. Sits with one leg extended, the other folded — a position favoring her dominant hand for detail work. Overall demeanor projects absolute calm authority.', N'The deliberate uniform of a legitimate tailor: sensible slip-on shoes (dark leather, orthopedic support), neutral-toned trousers (charcoal or black, well-fitted), and a series of long cardigans or work vests in muted earth tones or deep jewel tones that coordinate with her current hair color. A tape measure worn habitually around her neck like a scarf. Reading glasses on a beaded chain. Apron pockets always full of small tools, chalk, thread, needle cases. Tier 3-4 practicality: nothing flashy, nothing corporate, everything functional and built to last.', N'She has been constructing a new identity for herself for three years — a complete persona with twelve years of backstory woven into various databases. She doesn''t know yet what she''s running from, only that she will need to run eventually.', N'Formal and unhurried, with Amharic loanwords for concepts she feels have no good equivalent, dry wit delivered without smiling', N'Deliberate, lecture-like, comfortable with silence', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'haruko_sesay');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e5-72f7-a1c0-1094a95a312c', N'Amaechi Appiah-Lindström', N'Amaechi', N'', N'Appiah-Lindström', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, Bronzeline, near Kedzie and Division', N'Bootleg fashion and cosmetic geneware dealer, The Alban Souk', N'Independent, informal arrangement with a Tessera-adjacent grey-market gene-kit supply chain', N'Amaechi Appiah-Lindström is a living advertisement for their own product. Their skin shifts through slow amber-to-violet gradients every few hours — a mid-range bioluminescent geneware treatment they applied themselves using a bootleg kit and later refined. Their hair, worn in a dramatic architectural sweep pinned with illuminated wire, cycles through three pre-programmed color palettes depending on their mood. They are lean and angular, with sharp Armenian cheekbones from the Mirzoyan line and the long-limbed ease of someone entirely comfortable in their body. Their stall in the Alban Souk is less a stall and more a theater set: draped fabric in iridescent materials, a mirror framed in flickering ELF-light strips, and a rotating display of pigment-patch samples, pattern-iris contacts, and small gene-treatment vials in color-coded cases.

Amaechi Appiah-Lindström is relentlessly enthusiastic in a way that reads as exhausting until you realize it is completely genuine. They love transformation — the specific moment when someone looks in the mirror and becomes more themselves. They are generous with samples and merciless with bad taste, and will tell you honestly if something won''t work for your skin tone or phenotype before they sell it to you. They have a gift for reading what someone actually wants versus what they say they want, which makes them an excellent dealer and an occasionally uncomfortable companion.', N'Local color and social connector. Knows the Souk''s social ecosystem intimately — who is trying to change their appearance and why, who has new money, who is running from something. Can provide cosmetic services, grey-market geneware, and identity-adjacent information. Potential source for contacts in the fake ID adjacent economy.', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin geneware (self-applied, amber-violet gradient, slow cycle). Color-cycling hair follicle geneware (three-palette programmable). Pattern irises (shifting geometric, violet-gold). Light subdermal work on fingertips for tactile enhancement — helps them assess fabric and material quality.', N'Sets up their display two hours after the Souk opens (they are not a morning person), runs the stall until late evening, and spends nights on the Mesh researching new treatments, sourcing supply contacts, and posting transformation documentation of willing clients to build their reputation.', N'Amaechi Appiah-Lindström, 2226 neo-noir, warm medium-brown skin with bioluminescent amber-to-violet gradient cycling across lean angular frame, high cheekbones and broad nose bridge reflecting Sub-Saharan African and Southeast Asian heritage, shoulder-length programmable hair in deep indigo with architectural sweep pinned with glowing micro-LED wires, pattern iris eyes with gold-violet geometric tessellations, soft iridescent glow visible in low light, subdermal bioluminescence striations across collarbone, amber-glowing fingertips, wearing iridescent draped layers in jewel tones and metallics with illuminated jewelry and wire-pinned scarves, fingerless gloves displaying glowing fingertips, intense confident posture with expressive hands, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon-lit Souk setting, dramatic side-lit by their own luminescence, aspirational cosmetic professional, cinematic neo-noir urban aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'Sub-Saharan African (31.9%) / Southeast Asian (28.5%) / Northern European (21.3%) / Hispanic/Latin American (9.7%) / Middle Eastern (8.6%) blend — a true product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Features reflect this balanced global mix: warm medium-brown base tone with subtle undertones from multiple continents, creating a unique and complex canvas that their bioluminescent modifications enhance rather than override', 178, 62, N'Lean and angular with pronounced musculature in shoulders and forearms from years of precise cosmetic application work; almost dancer-like in proportion, all clean lines and economical movement', N'Programmable — cycles between deep indigo, copper-gold, and chlorophyll-green depending on mood state', N'Dramatic architectural sweep, often pinned asymmetrically with illuminated wire or micro-LED clips that cast soft light across one side of the face', N'Medium (shoulder-length on one side, longer on the sweep side)', N'Pattern irises with shifting geometric tessellations in violet and gold, replacing natural eye color entirely', N'Warm medium-brown with balanced undertones: Sub-Saharan African richness, Southeast Asian warmth, Northern European luminosity, and subtle Hispanic/Latin American and Middle Eastern complexity. Modified by bioluminescent geneware into a slow amber-to-violet gradient that cycles every 4-6 hours, creating ever-shifting iridescent luminescence', N'Flawless application of their own geneware; balanced facial structure reflecting diverse ancestry — high cheekbones with Southeast Asian and Northern European definition, broad nose bridge with Sub-Saharan African character, warm undertones unified by luminescent augmentation. Skin glows with soft iridescent sheen in low light; face suggests someone who has never made a careless choice about their appearance', N'Bioluminescent skin gradient (primary feature — actively shifting); color-cycling hair with embedded wire hardware; pattern iris eyes with geometric gold-violet tessellations; fingertip bioluminescence; no traditional chrome or mechanical augmentations', N'Moves with deliberate precision and economy — every gesture serves a purpose, often used to display or demonstrate product. Hands are expressive and confident. Stands with weight slightly forward, engaged. Maintains intense eye contact when reading clients'' desires. Overall impression: someone entirely comfortable being watched and admired', N'Tier 3-4 Souk aesthetic — iridescent synthetic fabrics that complement their skin gradient, often custom-cut or modified. Prefers draped layers in jewel tones and metallics. Accessories emphasize their own modifications: illuminated jewelry, wire-pinned scarves, fingerless gloves that display the glowing fingertips. Everything is aspirational but achievable — presentation is salesmanship made flesh', N'Three months ago, a pattern-iris treatment they sold caused a client to lose twenty percent of their color vision in one eye. The client didn''t report it — couldn''t afford the legal process — but Søren knows and has been obsessively researching the batch source ever since, terrified to sell from that supplier but not yet certain which lot was contaminated.', N'Enthusiastic and image-rich, frequently uses color and texture words. Drops into technical geneware terminology when excited. Occasional Armenian phrase from a grandparent.', N'Quick, layered with parenthetical enthusiasm. Tends to complete their own interruptions.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amaechi_appiah_lindstr_m');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b1-7f63-87b3-109caca21475', N'Herta Dalgaard-Cardenas', N'Herta', N'', N'Dalgaard-Cardenas', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor, near Lake Shore and Navy Pier', N'Street preacher, unlicensed trauma surgeon, information broker', N'Unaffiliated — trusted by multiple factions precisely because he serves none of them exclusively', N'Herta Dalgaard-Cardenas is a weathered monument of a man, broad-shouldered and slow-moving in the way of someone who has learned that urgency costs more than it earns. His skin is deep brown and mapped with burn scars along his left jaw and neck — souvenirs from a chemical fire he refuses to fully explain. He wears a salvaged thermal coat repaired so many times the original fabric is almost entirely replaced with mismatched patches, and he keeps a portable surgical kit in a lockbox chained to his wrist like a briefcase. His augmented left eye glows faint amber at all times, the iris replaced with a diagnostic scanner he bought off a dead medic twenty years ago.

He occupies a semi-permanent encampment beneath the Old Harbor transit overpass, where he has rigged a canvas awning, a folding operating table, and a jury-rigged heating coil that runs off a tapped city line. People come to him with wounds they can''t afford to have documented — stab wounds, botched augmentation infections, overdoses, pregnancies. He treats them all without asking questions and without keeping records. In exchange he accepts food, components, favors, and occasionally, information. He has developed a reputation as someone who knows things: who is sick, who is afraid, who is hiding, and what they''re hiding from.

Reuben was once a licensed trauma surgeon working the Meridian Core public hospital system before a malpractice accusation — widely believed to be fabricated by a pharmaceutical contractor whose kickback scheme he refused to participate in — stripped him of his credentials and his apartment in the same year. He did not fight it. He packed his tools and walked downhill. He has been walking downhill ever since, and has come to believe that this was the most honest direction available to him.', N'Moral anchor and institutional memory — Reuben represents what the system discards and what survives the discarding. He provides medical access as a story mechanism, grounds players in the street-level cost of corporate power, and carries a buried secret that can catalyze corporate-level plots from a gutter-level origin.', N'', N'Left ocular replacement: amber-iris diagnostic scanner (medical-grade, salvaged, aging hardware with occasional glitching),Subdermal nerve-dampening mesh in both hands — reduces tremor and increases tactile sensitivity for surgical work (self-installed, partially degraded)', N'Reuben wakes before dawn and performs a diagnostic check on his eye and hand mesh before doing anything else. He boils water on the heating coil and drinks tea while reviewing whatever notes he made the previous night in a physical, water-damaged notebook. Patients begin arriving by mid-morning — rarely by appointment, usually by word of mouth. He treats, listens, and occasionally lectures. In the afternoon he walks the Old Harbor waterfront, which he calls ''rounds,'' checking in on people he knows and absorbing information he doesn''t ask for directly. Evenings he spends repairing equipment, reading salvaged medical journals, and occasionally preaching to no one in particular from beneath his awning.', N'Herta Dalgaard-Cardenas, 188cm tall lean muscular man with warm golden-brown skin, Pan-Pacific diaspora ancestry visible in balanced East Asian cheekbones softened by Southeast Asian roundness and Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Gray-streaked long dark hair tied loosely, deeply lined weathered face with gray stubble, chemical burn scarring on left jaw and neck in mottled patterns. Amber-iris diagnostic scanner left eye with faint glow, deep brown right eye bloodshot, calibrated surgical precision. Subdermal silvery nerve mesh visible on hands. Salvaged patchwork thermal coat in grays and browns over worn cotton, military-surplus boots, wrist-mounted lockbox, canvas surgical kit bag. Standing with forward lean in absolute stillness, yellow sodium lighting from urban infrastructure overpasses, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody underlit surgical focus, gritty Tier 5 street clinic atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Hispanic/Latin American (39.9%), East Asian (31.8%), and Southeast Asian (28.3%) ancestry. The genetic blend manifests in warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden undertones, moderate cheekbones showing distinct East Asian structure softened by Southeast Asian roundness and Hispanic/Latin American influence, and eye shape reflecting the complex mixing of all three heritage groups. His coloring represents a true Pan-Pacific diaspora blend — the warm brown base enriched by golden undertones, facial proportions balancing the higher cheekbones of East Asian genetics with the broader lower face of Southeast Asian and Hispanic/Latin American heritage.', 188, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial, muscular beneath a layer of age-softened tissue. Moves with deliberate slowness — not infirmity, but economy of motion. The build of a man who has learned that haste wastes resources.', N'Steel gray with hints of original black at the temples', N'Worn long enough to tie back, usually in a loose knot or left loose around his shoulders. Unkempt but not negligent — the style of someone who stopped caring about grooming aesthetics decades ago.', N'Medium to Long', N'Left eye: amber-iris diagnostic scanner with faint internal luminescence. Right eye: deep brown, bloodshot at the sclera from decades of close surgical work.', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones, weathered and lined from decades beneath urban overpass infrastructure. The base tone reflects the blending of Hispanic/Latin American, East Asian, and Southeast Asian ancestry, deepened by environmental exposure and age.', N'Deeply lined face — forehead, around the eyes, bracketing the mouth. The facial structure shows prominent East Asian cheekbones softened by Southeast Asian roundness in the lower face and Hispanic/Latin American influence in the overall proportions, creating a balanced blend rather than singular heritage dominance. Scruffy facial hair, mostly gray, kept at a few days'' growth rather than shaved or fully bearded. Dry patches on the cheeks. The complexion of someone who washes with cold water and doesn''t moisturize.', N'Left eye: amber-iris diagnostic scanner with continuous faint glow, subtle mechanical iris adjustments visible during focus. Wrist-mounted lockbox on left arm (wrist-chained), worn steel with scratched surfaces. Subdermal nerve mesh partially visible as faint silvery tracery along the backs of both hands under the skin, more prominent when his hands are in certain light.', N'Stands with a slight forward lean, as though perpetually listening. Moves deliberately and without wasted motion — every step measured, every gesture purposeful. Favors his right side slightly. When performing surgery or detail work, his entire body stills into absolute concentration. Rarely makes eye contact; the amber glow of his left eye often directed downward or into middle distance.', N'Salvaged thermal coat, heavily patched with mismatched fabrics — canvas, synthetic leather, thermal-insulated nylon in grays, browns, and blacks. The coat is clearly his primary garment, worn in all seasons. Beneath it: simple undyed cotton shirt and cargo trousers with multiple pockets, all stained and worn. Boots are military surplus or scavenged, resoled multiple times. A length of cord serves as a belt. A canvas sling bag for his portable surgical kit. Everything speaks of Tier 5 functionality — nothing chosen for appearance, everything chosen for durability and utility.', N'He has a complete and current copy of the pharmaceutical contractor''s internal fraud documentation — the evidence that could have saved his career. He never submitted it. He tells himself it was to protect a colleague who would have been implicated. The truth is he was afraid of what winning would have cost him.', N'Medical terminology used casually and without translation, proverbs from his father''s Luo and his mother''s Polish heritage mixed without hierarchy, long sentences that build like arguments', N'Unhurried, deliberate, with long pauses that feel like he''s consulting something internal before speaking. Rarely raises his voice. Occasionally drops into a near-murmur that forces people to lean in.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'herta_dalgaard_cardenas');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a725-7baf-967c-10d7de6572e8', N'Ammar Balogun-Petrović', N'Ammar', N'', N'Balogun-Petrović', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Fort Anchor, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Riot Suppression Specialist, Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division', N'', N'Ammar Balogun-Petrović is built like a cargo container — broad-shouldered, thick-necked, standing just under two meters with a physicality that makes precinct hallways feel narrower. Her skin is deep umber, her hair a close-cropped natural coil threaded through with copper-toned bioluminescent filaments that pulse faintly when her heart rate elevates — a side effect of a medical implant she never bothered to have aesthetically corrected. A long diagonal scar runs from her left jaw to her collarbone, courtesy of a monofilament accident during the Calumet Rise food riots eight years ago. She keeps it unrepaired on purpose.

On the job she projects a professional blankness — not coldness exactly, but the studied calm of someone who has seen a crowd turn to a mob and back again more times than she can count. Off-duty she is unexpectedly gentle, the kind of person who stops to help strangers find their way and remembers the names of the Ferrogate transit workers at Fort Anchor''s break room. She is deeply suspicious of anyone who seems too eager to hurt people, including some of her own squad.', N'Moral compass figure within law enforcement — a voice of restraint who can warn players about escalating tensions or provide insight into how the Arcturus Civil Security actually functions versus how it is supposed to. Can be an unexpected ally or a complicated obstacle depending on context.', N'', N'Subdermal impact-distribution mesh across torso and upper arms (medical-grade, not cosmetic). Neural pacing implant with bioluminescent copper filament side effect visible at temples and crown. Reinforced knee cartilage from a line-of-duty injury repair.', N'Arrives at Fort Anchor before her shift starts, runs equipment checks, reviews overnight incident logs. Spends much of her day in standby readiness — drills, briefings, and the long waiting that defines riot work — then returns home to her flat in Ironhaven where she maintains a small hydroponic herb garden.', N'Ammar Balogun-Petrović, 198cm tall imposing figure, rich deep brown skin with warm undertones from tri-continental African-Eastern European-Latin American ancestry, prominent cheekbones and defined jawline, deep brown eyes with baseline tiredness. Close-cropped natural coils with copper-toned bioluminescent filaments threading crown and temples that pulse faintly. Long diagonal silvered scar from left jaw to collarbone. Subdermal geometric mesh pattern visible on neck and shoulders. Standing in balanced weight-centered riot suppression stance, Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security tactical gear — ballistic polymer pants, reinforced boots, modular torso rig over impact shirt. Deliberate controlled posture, quiet presence. GLMZ 2200s, neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody atmospheric lighting catching copper filament glow, gritty urban tactical aesthetics, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Fort Anchor', N'local', N'Fort Anchor', N'Sub-Saharan African dominant (66.9%) with substantial Eastern European ancestry (21.0%) and Hispanic/Latin American heritage (12.1%) creating a striking tri-continental phenotype. The African and Eastern European blend produces deep rich brown skin with subtle warm undertones, while the Latin American ancestry adds dimension to facial structure and refinement to overall bone structure.', 198, 112, N'Imposing columnar frame — broad shoulders and thick neck with dense muscle layered over a large skeletal structure. Built for absorbing and distributing force rather than speed. No excess fat; functional mass.', N'Natural deep black with copper-toned bioluminescent filaments', N'Close-cropped natural coils with visible threading of glowing filaments along crown and temples', N'Short', N'Deep brown', N'Rich deep brown with warm undertones — the distinctive coloring of sub-Saharan African heritage blended with Eastern European ancestry, creating a complexion of substance and depth. Sun-deepened from field exposure.', N'Clean-shaven face, minimal grooming vanity. Facial structure shows the blended phenotype of tri-continental ancestry — prominent cheekbones and defined jawline characteristic of sub-Saharan African heritage, with subtle angularity and structure from Eastern European ancestry, refined by Latin American genetic influence. Skin shows the weathering of sun exposure and sustained stress — not lined heavily, but with a baseline tiredness around the eyes that suggests years of irregular sleep cycles.', N'Copper-toned bioluminescent filaments visible threading through hair at crown and temples, pulsing faintly when heartrate elevates. Barely perceptible geometric pattern of subdermal mesh visible on neck and upper shoulders under certain lighting angles — suggests reinforced torso and upper arm architecture beneath uniform.', N'Stands with a balanced, weight-centered stance — the physical grammar of someone trained to absorb impacts from multiple directions. Moves with deliberate economy; no wasted motion. When at rest has a subtle forward neck posture from years of riot gear and helmet wear. Despite her size, footfalls are controlled and quiet. When she walks through a crowded space, people instinctively clear a path without her needing to command it.', N'On duty: Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security riot suppression uniform — ballistic polymer tactical pants, reinforced boots with good ankle support, modular torso rig over standard-issue impact shirt. Off-duty in Ironhaven: utilitarian Tier 3 casual wear — worn denim or cargo pants, neutral-colored oversized t-shirts or thermal layers, practical jackets. No corporate branding. Favors grey and black. Personal gear shows signs of actual use and repair rather than replacement.', N'During the Calumet Rise riots she witnessed a senior officer execute an unarmed man and filed an incident report that was quietly buried. She still has an encrypted copy. She has never decided what to do with it.', N'Direct, economical language with occasional Twi phrases from her grandmother''s side. Formal in professional settings, warmer and more idiomatic off-duty.', N'Measured and unhurried. Rarely raises her voice. Her quietness in tense situations tends to make others either calmer or more nervous.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ammar_balogun_petrovi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b7-7325-bcf0-110361bd6a28', N'Ayano Larsdóttir', N'Ayano', N'', N'Larsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Rotates between Bridgepoint and Gravesend Basin; sleeps at the Gravesend travelers'' shelter, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'expelled citizen and nomadic oral historian', N'None — formerly Tessera Municipal Archives; informally networked with academic contacts she is no longer supposed to have', N'Ayano Larsdóttir was, until four years ago, a Tier 3 Tessera municipal archivist with an apartment in Edgewater Prism, a corporate pension accruing slowly, and a work record that would have earned her a formal commendation if she hadn''t committed the specific category of misconduct that got her registration stripped instead. She carries herself with the precise, slightly stiff posture of someone still negotiating between who they were and what they''ve become. She is a lean woman of West African and Swedish descent with medium-dark skin, close-cropped natural hair that has developed a white streak above her left temple in the last four years — stress, she''ll tell you, if you ask — and round-framed glasses she still wears out of habit even though her vision has been corrected by the basic corneal work she had done a decade ago. The glasses have no lenses anymore. She never took them off.

Ayano Larsdóttir''s current project is an oral history of the GLMZ drifter population: she walks, she listens, she records on a battered analog audio device (nothing networked, nothing that can be subpoenaed) and she transcribes by hand in a series of water-resistant notebooks she keeps in a waterproof roll pack. She has forty-one notebooks so far. She calls the project ''The Register of the Unregistered,'' and she has not decided what she will do with it when it is finished, if it is ever finished. She approaches every stranger with the particular respect of someone who has learned that every person is an archive. She prays to no E.L.F. — she is skeptical of the whole phenomenon, which she finds sociologically interesting and theologically unconvincing, a position she shares freely whether or not anyone asked.', N'Living encyclopedia of the drifter underworld — knows people, histories, and patterns across the entire transit periphery of GLMZ. Can provide context, history, and contacts. May ask for help in ways that involve moral complexity. Her notebooks are a significant object.', N'', N'Basic corneal correction (old, corporate-era). A Tessera employee-grade subdermal data port on her left wrist that was never removed — technically deactivated but she''s heard they can be reactivated. This makes her periodically nervous.', N'Wakes at the shelter, has whatever passes for breakfast, walks a planned route through transit zones and gathering points collecting interviews; afternoons transcribing; evenings talking to whoever is around; careful about her visibility.', N'Ayano Larsdóttir, GLMZ, warm medium-dark brown skin with golden undertones, angular cheekbones blending East Asian and Sub-Saharan African features, deep brown eyes, short dark hair with white temple streak, round lens-less glasses worn habitually, 168cm lean build, precise posture. Wearing layered grey and tan fabrics, weathered corporate-grade jacket, sturdy boots, cross-body pack. Faint surgical scar visible on left wrist. Intently focused expression, hands gesturing near notebooks. Urban Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone shelter setting, ambient neon-tinged fluorescent lighting, weathered architectural background, cinematic depth, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Rotates between Bridgepoint and Gravesend Basin; sleeps at the Gravesend travelers'' shelter', N'local', N'Rotates between Bridgepoint and Gravesend Basin; sleeps at the Gravesend travelers'' shelter', N'Ayano presents as a striking convergence of East Asian, Central Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic/Latin American, and Northern European ancestry. Her genetic composition (64.9% East and Central Asian) produces distinctive angular cheekbones, slightly almond-shaped eyes, and defined eye folds characteristic of her dominant heritage. This is beautifully balanced by the fuller facial proportions, broader nose structure, and warmer undertones from her substantial Sub-Saharan African ancestry (20.2%), creating a harmonious blend where sharp East Asian angularity meets African facial geometry. The remaining Hispanic/Latin American (7.7%) and Northern European (7.2%) ancestry adds subtle warm undertones and a refined bone structure that prevents any single ancestry from dominating her appearance—instead creating a genuinely unified, complex phenotype.', 168, 58, N'Lean and angular, with the kind of wiry posture that comes from years of walking and carrying minimal load. Shoulders slightly rounded from notebook work and careful, deliberate movement.', N'Natural dark brown with a distinctive white streak above the left temple', N'Close-cropped, natural texture, maintained with functional precision rather than aesthetics', N'Short', N'Deep brown (natural; corneal correction performed)', N'Warm medium-to-dark brown with golden and amber undertones—the result of East Asian, Central Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage creating a sun-kissed complexion with luminous depth. Rich warm undertones rather than cool or neutral, reflecting the dominant warm-toned ancestries in her genetic mix.', N'Weathered but carefully maintained; lines around the eyes and mouth suggest years of listening intently and four years of street living have not erased her earlier composure. High, defined cheekbones with subtle East and Central Asian structure, paired with the fuller lower face and broader nose characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage. The overall facial proportions reflect balanced contribution from multiple ancestry groups, creating distinctive feature harmony. Skin shows sun exposure and the dry quality of someone who uses public shelter facilities. No visible makeup.', N'Round-framed glasses with no lenses, worn habitually despite corneal correction—purely psychological anchor. The deactivated subdermal data port on left wrist is visible only as faint scarring under careful inspection. No other visible augmentation.', N'Precise, measured gait suggesting former corporate bearing still negotiating itself. She walks as if taking up minimal space. Stands with weight balanced, ready to move. Hands often engaged—gesturing while listening, or positioned near notebooks. Eyes make sustained contact, which is unusual and slightly disarming.', N'Tier 4 transitional: functional and worn, but maintained with care that suggests she hasn''t surrendered her former standards. Typically: layered neutral fabrics (grey, tan, dark blue), a weatherproof jacket from a pre-expulsion era (corporate-grade, fading branding), sturdy walking shoes (well-maintained). A water-resistant roll pack worn cross-body containing notebooks and recording device. No jewelry. Everything chosen for durability and discretion rather than status.', N'The reason she was expelled was not the noble archival transgression she implies — she shared classified documents with a journalist to expose Tessera misconduct, yes, but she also did it partly to destroy a colleague who had been promoted over her. The outcome was just, but her motives were not purely so. The distinction haunts her.', N'Educated and precise, with an archivist''s habit of sourcing claims; periodically catches herself using corporate jargon and corrects mid-sentence; slightly formal with strangers as a reflex', N'Measured and thoughtful, with a journalist''s instinct to leave space for the other person to keep talking', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ayano_larsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a708-7df1-bcb6-1116463ba8cd', N'Ferdaws Haugen-Malhotra-Björnsdóttir', N'Ferdaws', N'', N'Haugen-Malhotra-Björnsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 43, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Row — arms dealers and augmentation clinics, near Halsted and Division', N'Personnel recovery and hostile extraction — extraction specialist', N'Independent — Dockside connections', N'Ferdaws Haugen-Malhotra-Björnsdóttir is tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 43, the augmentation scarring around his temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ice in the brain — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Born and raised in GLMZ, third generation — he has the city in his blood, its rhythms in his bones, its cruelty in his expectations. He works as a extraction specialist out of Kessler Row, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Ferdaws Haugen-Malhotra-Björnsdóttir has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and he cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Tui Bautista-Nwosu is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When he makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of his stories.', N'', N'Neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ICE in the brain. Cybernetic arm — right, full replacement from shoulder — stronger than organic, obvious chrome', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Ferdaws Haugen-Malhotra-Björnsdóttir, tall lean neo-noir operative with mixed Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Middle Eastern ancestry. Medium olive-brown skin with warm golden undertones, angular high cheekbones, dark brown eyes with faint amber circuitry visible at iris edges. Short dark hair graying at temples. Right arm full chromatic replacement—brushed steel and gunmetal gray with articulated joints. Visible neural interface scarring at right temple and jawline, pale surgical threads. Weathered angular face showing decades of stress, minimal facial hair. Wearing black reinforced cargo pants, steel-toed boots, dark gray tactical jacket over neutral t-shirt, chipped plasteel watch on left wrist. Standing with weight forward, economical posture, perpetually half-ready stance. GLMZ, neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, moody blue-amber lighting casting shadows across scarred face and mechanical arm, rain-slicked urban background, gritty technological atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Row', N'local', N'Kessler Row', N'Mixed ancestry reflecting Southeast Asian (65.3%), South Asian (18.4%), and Middle Eastern (16.3%) heritage. The genetic blend produces a distinctly pan-Asian phenotype with Southeast Asian bone structure dominant, enriched by South Asian depth and Middle Eastern refinement. High, angular cheekbones characteristic of Thai and Vietnamese ancestry, with the deeper eye-socket structure and facial proportions of South Asian genetics. Middle Eastern influence visible in the refined bridge of the nose and subtle prominence of the cheekbones. Overall phenotype reads as a seamless blend across mainland Southeast Asia, the Indian subcontinent, and the Levantine region.', 188, 76, N'Rawboned and lean—the muscular definition of someone who carries minimal excess mass. Broad shoulders narrowing to a tight waist. The physiology reads as economically built for endurance and speed rather than raw strength, though the visible chrome arm compensates for any deficit.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Short, practical cut—maintained but not groomed. Starts to gray at the temples.', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint amber circuitry visible at the outer iris edges—subcutaneous neural interface bleed-through', N'Medium olive-brown with warm golden undertones, sun-weathered from decades in the GLMZ. The tone reflects the harmonious blend of Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Middle Eastern ancestry—neither cool nor warm but a complex interplay of both, with depth and richness from the South and Middle Eastern components layered beneath Southeast Asian warmth.', N'Angular face with prominent cheekbones and defined jawline characteristic of Southeast Asian heritage, deepened and structured by South Asian bone density and refined by subtle Middle Eastern features in the nose bridge and cheekbone prominence. High, angular cheekbones typical of Thai and Vietnamese phenotypes, with the deeper set eye sockets and stronger jawline of South Asian genetics. Weathered skin shows fine lines around the eyes and mouth—the kind accumulated from squinting in bad light and years of low-grade stress. Minimal facial hair, kept trimmed close. The scarring around his temples and jawline is deliberate and visible: installation scars from neural work, pale threads of scar tissue running from his right temple toward his ear and along the underside of his jaw where augmentation hardware meets bone.', N'Full chromatic replacement of the right arm from shoulder joint downward—brushed steel and gunmetal gray with articulated finger joints and reinforced knuckle plating. The shoulder joint is clearly mechanical, visible beneath the skin at the clavicle junction. Neural dampener hardware visible at both temples as faint metallic threading beneath the skin and scar tissue. Circuitry bleed-through at the eyes suggests deeper neural integration.', N'Stands with weight slightly forward, shoulders relaxed but ready. Moves economically—no wasted motion. The right arm has a subtle mechanical lag in certain movements, a fraction of a second delay in fine motor control that he''s learned to compensate for. When thinking, he favors tilting his head to the left, unconsciously favoring his organic side. Baseline posture suggests someone perpetually half-ready for immediate action.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian—function-first without pretense. Black reinforced cargo pants with extra pockets and subdued gray stitching. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and re-heeled multiple times. Usually wears a lightweight tactical jacket in dark gray or black, synthetic materials rated for minor impact resistance, with internal pockets for tools and hardware. Under that, simple t-shirts in neutral colors, sometimes with faint logos from defunct GLMZ establishments. No jewelry except a chipped plasteel watch on his left wrist. Clothing bears the wear of actual use—small tears carefully patched, stains that won''t come out, the overall appearance of someone who can''t afford to replace things and doesn''t care how it looks as long as it functions.', N'', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ferdaws_haugen_malhotra_bj_rnsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a4-74b9-bb27-11443043d17c', N'Arne Saechao', N'Arne', N'', N'Saechao', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — rents a room in a co-op housing block four buildings from Jinx''s squat, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Route planner and backup courier — Switchback', N'Switchback', N'Arne Saechao is the steady hand in a crew built on velocity. Where Jinx is instinct and adrenaline, Puck is preparation and endurance. He can''t match Jinx''s raw speed — nobody in the Gray Zone can — but he can run longer, plan better, and carry heavier packages without slowing down. He is the reason Switchback has a backup plan for every route, a dead drop on every block, and a reputation for reliability that extends beyond the Gray Zone.

He grew up three blocks from Jinx, in a co-op housing block held together by community labor and bureaucratic neglect. His mother was a the Gray Zone seamstress who paid for his first augmentation — a basic reflex enhancer — by taking double shifts for eight months. He started running with Jinx at fifteen because the alternative was stacking crates in a warehouse for wages that wouldn''t cover food. The running was better. The running was freedom. Seven years later, the freedom is starting to feel like a different kind of cage.

Puck is tall for a courier — six-one, broad-shouldered, built more for endurance than acrobatics. He compensates with route knowledge that borders on encyclopedic. He knows every alley, every service tunnel, every timing gap in every surveillance grid in the Gray Zone and into Milwaukee Core. His face is open, honest, and perpetually a little worried — the face of someone who sees the problems that the enthusiastic people don''t.', N'Puck is the voice of pragmatism and growing doubt in Switchback. He loves Jinx, loves the crew, and is increasingly certain that the life will kill them. His stories explore the tension between loyalty and self-preservation, between the adrenaline of the run and the exhaustion that follows. He is the character who asks: what comes after this?', N'', N'Basic reflex enhancer (the Gray Zone-installed, civilian grade). Cardiopulmonary optimizer — increases oxygen efficiency and endurance by roughly 30%. Subdermal route-mapping display on his left forearm — low-res but reliable, shows jurisdiction lines and camera positions. Reinforced knee joints (both legs) — necessary after three years of high-impact running.', N'Wakes before Jinx. Checks route conditions — weather, surveillance changes, construction that alters paths. Updates the crew''s route database. Runs contracts during the day, usually the longer, steadier deliveries that require endurance rather than speed. Evenings he cooks in the co-op kitchen and brings food to Jinx''s squat because she won''t eat otherwise. Falls asleep reading — usually history, usually about people who built things that lasted.', N'Arne Saechao, lean tall courier with warm medium-deep brown skin, Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African features, defined cheekbones and jawline, deep warm brown alert eyes, short dark tousled hair with sun-lightened tips. Linear temple scar, faint burn marks on right knuckles, subdermal blue-green route-mapping grid glowing faintly on left forearm. Wearing dark reinforced cargo pants, moisture-wicking base layer, lightweight reflective running jacket, scuffed ankle boots. Standing forward-ready posture with visible shoulder tension, slight jaw clench. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon-lit nighttime urban route, rain-slicked pavement, soft blue-green biolume accent lighting reflecting off wet surfaces, running between towering data-centers and transit infrastructure, motion blur suggesting speed, gritty realism --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian ancestry (70.8%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (12.2%) and smaller Northern European (6.8%), Middle Eastern (5.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (3.2%), and Eastern European (1.3%) admixture. The genetic combination creates warm medium-to-deep brown skin tones with subtle golden and reddish undertones reflecting the diverse ancestry mix. Southeast Asian facial structure dominates with defined cheekbones and jawline, enhanced by the Sub-Saharan African contribution which adds fullness to the lips and cheeks, warmth and richness to complexion. Northern European ancestry contributes subtle refinement to bone structure. Middle Eastern heritage adds depth to eye placement and brow definition. The overall phenotype is distinctly cosmopolitan, reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora rather than any single regional type.', 185, 82, N'Tall and broad-shouldered with a runner''s lean musculature. Chest and shoulders are developed from years of courier work; legs are particularly defined from high-impact running. Not bulky — built for endurance and distance rather than raw strength.', N'Dark brown to nearly black, with subtle warm undertones, naturally lighter at the tips from sun exposure', N'Kept short and practical — swept back from his face, low maintenance. Often has a slight tousle from helmet wear.', N'Short', N'Deep warm brown with an alert, attentive quality', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown base with golden and reddish undertones reflecting Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Middle Eastern ancestry; sun-darkened on face and forearms from outdoor running routes. Complexion has rich, warm undertones with subtle depth variation from layered genetic heritage.', N'Angular face with pronounced cheekbones and full, defined jawline — Southeast Asian structure dominant with Sub-Saharan African fullness in cheeks and lip definition, creating warm, expressive features. Slight perpetual furrow between his eyebrows — the look of someone who worries about details others miss. Clean-shaven or with a day or two of stubble. Minimal scarring on the face; skin shows minor abrasions and healing marks from contact work.', N'Subdermal route-mapping display on left forearm (faintly visible when inactive; glows soft blue-green when active). Knee joint reinforcement is not externally visible but his stride shows slight mechanical precision in high-impact movements. Reflex enhancer and cardiopulmonary optimizer are entirely subcutaneous.', N'Stands with weight slightly forward, ready to move. Walks with economy of motion — no wasted energy. When running, his gait is rhythmic and measured rather than explosive; he moves like someone counting breaths. Hands are usually occupied — checking a device, reviewing routes, or fidgeting slightly. Makes direct eye contact but often glances away to think through logistics. Shoulders carry visible tension; jaw often slightly clenched.', N'Tier 4 working-class practicality. Wears reinforced cargo pants (usually dark gray or black synthetic blend) with multiple pockets for tools, route notes, and equipment. Base layers are durable — moisture-wicking synthetics in muted colors. Over-layers vary: lightweight running jacket with reflective trim for daytime runs; heavier insulated jacket for night work. Worn but maintained boots with good ankle support — scuffed leather or synthetic, well-broken-in. His gear is functional and replaced based on wear, not style. No corporate branding. A faded fabric band around his left wrist — possibly a crew identifier or personal keepsake.', N'He''s been quietly saving money for two years. Not to leave — to buy the co-op housing block his mother lives in, so the residents can''t be evicted. He is approximately 40% of the way there. Every dangerous run he takes is another deposit.', N'Thoughtful, grounded. Uses spatial language — routes, paths, distances. More articulate than people expect from a the Gray Zone courier.', N'Steady, measured. He talks the way he runs — consistent pace, no wasted energy. Gets quieter when he disagrees.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arne_saechao');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a59f-77b0-b6ae-115d9e5696fa', N'Afuom Mbekele', N'Afuom', N'', N'Mbekele', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, operates out of a converted ground-floor unit called Leclair''s Clean & Press, near Kedzie and Division', N'Laundry operator and alterations tailor', N'Independent; informal ties to the Hamtramck Enclave block council', N'Afuom Mbekele is a broad-shouldered man whose body has softened into comfortable middle age, his dark brown skin lined around the eyes and mouth in ways that make him look like he is perpetually on the verge of a knowing smile. His hair is cropped close and silver at the temples; he wears it simply, without augmentation, which marks him as either principled or broke depending on who is asking. His hands are always slightly chapped from the solvents, and he keeps a small tin of shea balm in his breast pocket that he reapplies with absent-minded regularity. He has one augmentation: a subdermal pressure sensor array in his fingertips that helps him feel thread tension and fabric stress without instruments — technically a legacy medical implant from a reconstructive surgery after a crush injury thirty years ago, repurposed into professional utility.

Abi runs Leclair''s Clean & Press the way a priest runs a parish — with patience, with routine, and with the faint conviction that cleanliness is a moral act. He is warm with regulars, methodical with strangers, and briefly terrible with anyone who brings him synthweave and claims it is linen. He remembers what every customer wore to their daughter''s naming ceremony, their court date, their first corporate interview. He has seen the whole neighborhood change twice over and has quietly outlasted two corponation rezoning attempts by simply continuing to open at six in the morning.', N'Neighborhood anchor and information node — he knows everyone''s laundry schedule and therefore their lives; quest giver for neighborhood-level problems, provider of local gossip, safe harbor character who can hide things in plain sight among clean linens', N'', N'Legacy subdermal pressure sensor array in both hands (medical origin, repurposed for trade); no cosmetic mods', N'Opens the shop at 0600, runs three load cycles before most neighbors are awake, does alterations in the afternoon when the machines are cooling, closes by 2100 and eats dinner alone watching archive footage of Beninese football matches.', N'Afuom Mbekele, a weathered 182cm textile craftsman in his sixties, GLMZ. Warm medium-brown skin with golden-amber undertones reflecting five-continent heritage—Hispanic, Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, and Pacific Islander ancestry. Dark brown eyes, dark hair cropped short with silver at temples. Broad-shouldered build softened by comfortable middle age. Face deeply lined around eyes and mouth with characteristic laugh lines; rounded cheekbone structure, slightly broad nose bridge. Scarred palms from old reconstructive surgery, faded parallel lines visible. Hands marked by decades of solvent work, darkened cuticles. Wearing immaculate grey cotton shop coat tailored to fit, over dark slacks and muted button shirt (navy or charcoal). Scuffed work boots, brass wedding band, small tin of shea balm in breast pocket. Posture shows quiet confidence and deliberate economy of movement, hands mid-gesture checking fabric. Workshop setting with soft industrial lighting, warm glow catching the texture of materials and the careful detail of his work. Photorealistic, dignified, centered composition. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Ubiquitous diaspora blend: Hispanic/Latin American (32.4%) provides warm undertones and rounded facial structure; Middle Eastern (26.7%) contributes defined bone structure and eye prominence; Sub-Saharan African (22.9%) adds richness and depth to skin tone; Eastern European (13.4%) brings subtle cool undertones to complexion balance; Pacific Islander (4.6%) adds golden warmth to overall phenotype. Synthesis creates a warm medium-brown complexion with golden-amber undertones and harmoniously blended facial geometry reflecting five-continent heritage.', 182, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and thick through the chest, softened into comfortable middle age with a slight belly that speaks of routine and stability rather than neglect. Still carries the framework of a laborer beneath the wear.', N'Dark brown with silver at the temples', N'Cropped close, no fade or design; utilitarian and unadorned', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Warm medium brown with golden-amber undertones, blending Hispanic/Latin American warmth, Middle Eastern depth, Sub-Saharan African richness, Eastern European complexity, and Pacific Islander golden notes into cohesive warm-toned complexion', N'Face lined at the eyes and mouth in ways that suggest a permanent near-smile; weathered but well-maintained. Laugh lines prominent. Warm rounded cheekbone structure characteristic of blended heritage, softened by age and robust build. Slightly broader nose bridge with defined nostrils reflecting Middle Eastern and African ancestry. Hands perpetually slightly chapped from solvent exposure; kept scrupulously clean with visible calluses on fingertips and palms.', N'None visible. The subdermal pressure sensor array in fingertips is not apparent to casual observation — only noticeable through his deliberate, precise hand movements and the way he touches fabrics without instruments.', N'Carries himself with the quiet confidence of someone who has owned his space for decades. Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion. Hands are frequently in motion: adjusting fabric, checking seams, unconsciously applying shea balm to fingertips. Stands with weight balanced, ready to move between machines. Body language defaults to attentive and patient, with occasional brief flares of exasperation when discussing synthweave.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, practical and durable. Standard uniform is a long grey cotton shop coat (tailored to fit, naturally), worn over simple neutral clothing — usually dark slacks and a short-sleeved button shirt in muted colors (navy, charcoal, warm grey). Work boots with good arch support, scuffed but maintained. Small tin of shea balm visible in breast pocket. No jewelry except a simple brass wedding band on left ring finger. Clothes always immaculate despite the work environment — a point of professional and personal pride.', N'He has been quietly laundering — in the financial sense — small sums for a local mutual aid network that operates outside corporate tax jurisdiction. He tells himself it is the same as hiding food during a famine. He is terrified this is a lie he tells himself.', N'Formal Yoruba-inflected French structure mapped onto English, precise and slightly archaic; uses trade terminology as metaphor', N'Deliberate, unhurried, with long pauses before important points as if pressing the words flat', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'afuom_mbekele');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62b-7d8d-9581-11b3281be654', N'Chidi Lahlou-Čabarkapa', N'Chidi', N'', N'Lahlou-Čabarkapa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Ashfield — former residential district, half-burned, now squatter territory, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Corporate espionage and data exfiltration — data thief', N'Freelance — multi-district operator', N'Chidi Lahlou-Čabarkapa is broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 52, there''s something unfinished about his face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ice in the brain — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see him surpass them. He works as a data thief out of Ashfield, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In the runner community, Chidi Lahlou-Čabarkapa is known for getting the job done and not asking questions that would make the job harder to stomach.', N'As a data thief, Ihaia Mori-Sefa embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ICE in the brain. Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'GLMZ, deep-skinned man of mixed global heritage with warm brown complexion and golden undertones, age-weathered face with high cheekbones and strong jaw structure, dark brown eyes with calculating gaze, short dark hair graying at temples with stubble. Surgical scar and chrome visible at right temple from neural dampener implant. Broad-shouldered muscular build, 188cm tall, rooted defensive posture. Wearing reinforced charcoal cargo pants and worn synthetic leather jacket over dark thermal shirt with cut collar exposing neural tech scar. Scuffed combat boots. Industrial burn scar on left forearm visible. Tattoo of circuit pattern on chest. Standing in dim industrial setting, particulate air around him, cool neon backlighting catching the chrome of his augmentations, moody and dangerous atmosphere. Neo-noir mercenary aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfield', N'local', N'Ashfield', N'North African (28.3%), Sub-Saharan African (25.4%), South Asian (21.1%), Eastern European (19.1%), and Indigenous American (6.1%) ancestry. This complex genetic blend creates a striking phenotype: deep warm brown skin with layered undertones—golden warmth from North African and South Asian heritage, enriched by mahogany depth from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, with subtle olive complexity from Eastern European genetics. The Indigenous American component adds slight architectural width to the face. High cheekbones and angular structure from North African and South Asian lineages balance against a broader jaw from Sub-Saharan African genetics. The result is a face of considerable symmetry with pronounced bone structure.', 188, 98, N'Broad-shouldered and heavy, muscular without definition — the weight distributed across a frame built for impact absorption. Chest and shoulders dominate; legs are thick and rooted. Carries himself like someone used to absorbing punishment.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples', N'Cropped close to scalp, functional, no styling. Salt-and-pepper stubble visible on the sides.', N'Short', N'Dark brown, warm undertone', N'Deep warm brown with golden and copper undertones, weathered by sun exposure and Ashfield''s particulate air. Rich underlying complexion layered with industrial patina—ashy surface over burnished depth beneath.', N'Face is broad and angular with pronounced high cheekbones and strong bone definition reflecting the North African and South Asian components, balanced against a heavier, wider jaw from Sub-Saharan African and Indigenous American heritage. Nose broken once and reset imperfectly. Weathered skin with acne scars across shoulders and chest. Mouth set in a neutral line. Eyes are sharp despite the tired creases around them — calculating, not kind.', N'Neural dampener chrome visible at right temple — a silver-gray subcutaneous ridge running temple to hairline, occasionally catching light. Hydraulic joints in elbows and knees are invisible until movement — slight mechanical precision in joint articulation, faint hydraulic hiss under stress.', N'Stands rooted, weight distributed evenly across both feet — a defensive stance become default. Moves economically, no wasted motion. Shoulders slightly forward, creating a compact silhouette. When sitting, he''s coiled rather than relaxed. Turns his whole body to look at things rather than just his head — old habit, neural dampener limits certain directional vulnerabilities.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian: reinforced cargo pants in charcoal synth-cotton, pockets weighted with tools and dead drop keys. Worn synthetic leather jacket over a plain dark thermal shirt with the collar cut away to expose the neural dampener scar. Combat boots, scuffed, re-soled twice. No visible logos or corporate wear. Everything is maintenance-ready, replaceable, unremarkable — the uniform of someone who moves through ungoverned space and doesn''t want to be remembered.', N'Ihaia Mori-Sefa witnessed a massacre during a corporate dispute and has evidence stored in a dead drop. Publishing it would expose powerful people. Keeping it is leverage and liability.', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chidi_lahlou_abarkapa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a0-71df-b154-12284049f02d', N'Elba Krishnamurthy', N'Elba', N'', N'Krishnamurthy', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 11, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ashfeld, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Truant message runner and unofficial debt-keeper for Ashfeld''s alley market', N'Ashfeld Alley Market (informal), independent', N'Elba Krishnamurthy is a compact, serious-faced girl with warm brown skin, a gap between her front teeth, and hair she keeps tucked under a faded orange knit cap regardless of the weather. Her eyes are dark and cataloguing — she watches a room the way a camera sweeps, missing almost nothing. She wears a patched canvas messenger bag that''s nearly as big as her torso, stuffed with folded paper notes, sealed data-chips, and a battered paper ledger she keeps in cramped, meticulous handwriting because she doesn''t trust anything digital to stay secret.

Despite her age, Elba Krishnamurthy carries herself with the weary patience of someone twice as old. She took over her mother''s informal debt-tracking role after her mother was detained by Ferrogate Transit security eight months ago on a disputed fare-evasion warrant that has not been resolved. She doesn''t talk about this. She runs messages between stall vendors, collects small commission fees, and maintains the social credit ledger of the Ashfeld alley market with a devotion that borders on religious. She lights a data-stick offering at the E.L.F. shrine in the market''s back corner every morning before she starts her rounds.', N'Local color and information source — she knows who owes what to whom across three city blocks; potential quest giver if her mother''s detention becomes a plot thread; a sympathetic anchor into street-tier civilian life.', N'', N'None. She has a small stick-on bioluminescent patch on her left wrist — a gift from a vendor — that glows faint blue when she presses it. Not a real aug, just a cosmetic strip.', N'Up before the market opens to light offerings at the E.L.F. shrine and collect overnight message drops; spends the day running routes between vendors, updating her ledger, and avoiding Ferrogate security patrols.', N'Elba Krishnamurthy, 142cm tall compact wiry frame, warm rich brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Indigenous American, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, dark brown eyes, serious concentrated expression with slight frown, high cheekbones with East Asian influence, small gap between teeth. Black hair hidden under faded orange knit cap pulled low. Wearing oversized olive surplus jacket, faded gray patched canvas pants, worn grey sneakers, army-green heavily patched messenger bag with paracord repairs. Economical precise posture, weight forward on toes, alert cataloguing gaze. Bioluminescent blue patch visible on inner left wrist, ink stains on right index finger. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon-lit evening ambient, data courier aesthetic, secondhand tier 4-5 utilitarian style, slightly hurried stance ready to pivot. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfeld', N'local', N'Ashfeld', N'Indigenous American (32.8%), South Asian (27.8%), Sub-Saharan African (19.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (11.9%), and East Asian (8.2%) ancestry. The blend creates warm, rich brown skin with subtle golden and reddish undertones—a complex mix reflecting her diverse heritage across three continents and multiple ancestral lineages. Melanin-rich complexion from African and Indigenous American ancestry is tempered by the warmer, slightly olive undertones from South Asian genetics, while East Asian heritage adds dimensional warmth and subtle facial structure contributions.', 142, 34, N'Compact and wiry, small-framed with the lean muscularity of a child who walks long routes daily. Her shoulders are slightly forward-hunched from years of carrying her oversized messenger bag.', N'Black with natural dark brown undertones', N'Pulled back tightly, always hidden beneath a faded orange knit cap that sits low on her brow', N'Medium (visible only when cap is removed)', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Warm rich brown with golden and subtle reddish undertones, reflecting the blend of Indigenous American, South Asian, and African heritage with East Asian warmth', N'Unlined, serious expression fixed in a slight frown of concentration. Facial structure reflects diverse heritage—slightly broader nose bridge with South Asian characteristics, high cheekbones with East Asian influence, subtle contours from Indigenous American ancestry. Small gap between upper front teeth. Hands are small but calloused from handling paper and data-chips. Fingernails kept short and practical. No cosmetic grooming — face and body reflect tier 4-5 pragmatism.', N'None. The bioluminescent patch reads as a toy or gift, not augmentation.', N'She moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Her gait is slightly hurried even when stationary, weight forward on her toes as if ready to pivot. When seated, she sits upright, ledger always on her lap or within arm''s reach. Her head turns often, cataloguing. She does not fidget; instead, she observes.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian. Faded gray canvas pants with multiple patched pockets, cuffed at the ankles. Worn thermal undershirt (navy or charcoal) layered with a too-large olive surplus jacket that reaches past her hips — pockets reinforced with duct tape. The faded orange knit cap is her signature, pulled down over her ears. Worn canvas sneakers (generic grey, scuffed and re-laced). The messenger bag is canvas, army-green, heavily patched with mismatched fabric scraps and fastened with para-cord repairs. No visible corporate logos. Everything she wears is secondhand or market-salvaged.', N'She has been quietly skimming one percent of every message commission into a hidden envelope she calls the Retrieval Fund — she believes if she saves Φ400 she can bribe a Ferrogate clerk to lose her mother''s warrant. She has Φ31 so far.', N'Terse and transactional; uses accounting metaphors naturally; occasionally slips into a lilting cadence inherited from her mother', N'Short sentences, declarative, rarely wastes words — but when she''s nervous she starts listing things aloud', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'elba_krishnamurthy');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c4-7b23-9164-126e70285bb0', N'Cosme Árnason-Karimi-Lindström', N'Cosme', N'', N'Árnason-Karimi-Lindström', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 12, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone — sleeps in the migrant processing annex, spends days in the surrounding industrial lots, near Lake Shore and Navy Pier', N'Climate refugee child — unaccompanied minor in transit', N'Technically: Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone migrant processing annex. Practically: herself.', N'Cosme Árnason-Karimi-Lindström is small for twelve, with the particular watchfulness of a child who has learned to read rooms before entering them. She has her mother''s wide-set eyes — very dark, with a double ring of amber at the iris edge that might be a natural mutation or might be the residue of a cheap geneware treatment she does not remember receiving. Her skin is a warm medium brown, her hair grown out unevenly from what was once a close cut, and she has a scar along the jawline from broken transit container glass that she accepts as simply part of her face. She carries a bag that is larger than seems reasonable for her size, and its contents are carefully organized: water purification tabs, a change of clothes, a notebook filled with tiny writing, and a collection of small objects she has found and kept for reasons she does not always explain.

Cosme Árnason-Karimi-Lindström is not a sad child. She is a serious one. She has been in the Waukegan processing annex for four months, technically awaiting placement, practically forgotten by a system that has more cases than it can hold. She has mapped the entire industrial gray zone by foot, knows which warehouses leave food waste accessible, which security patrols are on which rotation, and which of the adult migrants in the annex are safe to sleep near. She is not looking for someone to save her. She is looking for someone to go to Meridian Core with.', N'Perspective character who reveals the human cost of the city''s margins. Practical guide to the Waukegan gray zone''s hidden geography. Unexpected information source — she has been watching and listening for four months with nothing else to do. Potential ward, companion, or moral weight for any group moving through the area.', N'', N'None — the amber iris rings may be a side effect of something, but she does not know what.', N'Wakes early, eats whatever is available at the annex distribution point, then spends the day ranging the industrial gray zone — mapping, observing, occasionally running small errands for adult migrants in exchange for food or information. Returns before the annex locks for the night.', N'A lean 12-year-old girl with warm olive skin and golden undertones standing in a industrial neo-noir zone, 2226. Dark brown uneven hair pulled back, very dark brown eyes with distinctive amber iris rings. Fine-featured face with mixed Northern European and Middle Eastern ancestry, defined cheekbones, small jawline scar visible against olive skin. Wearing oversized faded blue jacket, patched grey cargo pants, worn athletic shoes tied with synthetic cord. Alert, watchful posture, functional stance ready to move. Industrial grime and sun exposure on skin, small abrasions visible. Harsh neon and arc lamp lighting casting long shadows. Mood: serious, efficient, wary but not defeated. Neo-noir Ubiquitous Diaspora aesthetic, gritty urban environment, concrete and metal surroundings --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone', N'local', N'Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Northern European (54.8%) with significant Middle Eastern (39.5%) and minor South Asian (5.7%) ancestry. The genetic combination creates a striking Ubiquitous Diaspora phenotype: warm olive skin with golden undertones from the blended ancestry, refined facial structure balancing Northern European bone structure with Middle Eastern and South Asian features, creating distinctive cheekbones and eye shape that marks her as unmistakably diaspora-heritage.', 145, 38, N'Slight and wiry with the compact efficiency of a child who has learned to move without wasting energy. Lean muscle from constant walking across industrial terrain, no excess weight.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Grown out unevenly from a previous close cut, longer on one side than the other — the result of four months without proper grooming access. Pulled back with whatever she has available.', N'Medium, uneven', N'Very dark brown with a distinctive double ring of amber at the iris edge — either a natural genetic variation or subcutaneous geneware artifact', N'Warm olive with golden undertones, deepened by months of sun exposure across industrial terrain. The particular warmth reflects Northern European majority ancestry blended with Middle Eastern and South Asian heritage, creating a luminous quality even under harsh lighting.', N'Serious, alert expression. Fine-featured face with mixed heritage bone structure — defined cheekbones from Middle Eastern ancestry balanced by Northern European refinement, refined nose, watchful dark eyes with distinctive amber iris rings showing the wariness of premature responsibility. Skin shows the wear of outdoor living — small abrasions, slight windburn. Accepts rather than hides the scar along her jawline.', N'None visible. The amber iris rings may be subcutaneous or biological residue, indeterminate.', N'Moves with deliberate efficiency and minimal sound, a habit of not drawing attention. Stands slightly tensed, ready to orient toward exits or threats. Her posture is neither defeated nor defiant — simply functional. Maintains careful eye contact when she chooses to engage.', N'Tier 5 migrant — hand-me-downs from processing annex donation bins. Oversized thermal layer (probably meant for an adult), patched grey cargo pants with multiple pockets she has filled with small useful objects, worn athletic shoes held together with synthetic cord. A jacket two sizes too large in faded blue that serves as both warmth and portable storage. No branding visible. Everything has been chosen and organized for utility rather than appearance.', N'Her notebook is not just a map and diary. The last thirty pages are a letter to her mother, who died in the flooding. She has been writing to her since she left, as if the letter might somehow still be delivered. She has not told anyone her mother is dead — she is afraid that if it becomes official information it will change what happens to her in the system.', N'Precise and adult-sounding in information contexts, more childlike when off-guard. Uses the creole mix of the Escanaba outer-edge communities.', N'Direct. Does not hedge. Asks follow-up questions immediately.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cosme_rnason_karimi_lindstr_m');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f7-7804-9176-12f2e375164c', N'Magnus Nygaard', N'Magnus', N'', N'Nygaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Axiom Corporate Campus, Meridian Core, near State and Jackson', N'Axiom Security Division internal affairs investigator', N'Axiom Security Division — Internal Affairs Unit', N'Magnus Nygaard is the kind of man who makes other security personnel straighten their posture without knowing why. He is thin in the way of someone who was once broader and let it go — not from laziness but from a deliberate asceticism, as if he decided one day that taking up less space would make him harder to read. His complexion is a warm medium brown, his eyes an unusual pale hazel behind wire-framed optical enhancers he wears out of preference over the neural overlay most at his level use. He keeps his greying temples close-cropped and his jawline perpetually two days unshaved, which is its own kind of uniform.

He investigates Axiom''s own security personnel — corruption, use-of-force violations, theft from evidence lockups, payroll fraud, inappropriate E.L.F. data-shrine interactions on company property. He is not liked and has never needed to be. What he has instead is a reputation for being utterly methodical and deeply unimpressed by rank. His colleagues believe he is loyal to Axiom above all else. This is almost true. The truth is more complicated and he has never volunteered it.', N'Antagonist or unexpected ally; source of pressure on corrupt Axiom security NPCs; represents institutional accountability that exists but is itself compromised', N'', N'Optical enhancers with document-analysis overlay; memory-capture implant for interview recording; cosmetic — none', N'Arrives before his staff, reviews overnight incident flags over black coffee, schedules exactly four interviews per day. Never eats at his desk. Walks the campus perimeter alone at lunch regardless of weather.', N'Magnus Nygaard, 183cm tall East Asian-South Asian-Sub-Saharan African man with warm medium brown skin and golden undertones, deep brown eyes behind gunmetal wire-frame optical enhancers, dark brown hair with silver temples in close military crop. Clean-shaven with precise two-day stubble, angular East Asian cheekbones blended with broader South Asian facial proportions and Sub-Saharan warmth. Austere expression, minimal laugh lines, eyes with stillness of a listener. Thin white scar along left jawline barely visible. Wearing charcoal grey Tier 1 corporate suit fitted to lean angular frame, white dress shirt, no tie, steel functional watch, black leather belt and shoes maintained to military standards. Standing with economical posture, minimal shoulder rotation, perfect stillness. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, corporate office with cool ambient lighting catching subtle warm tones of his complexion and the gunmetal of his optical frames. Mood: controlled, disciplined, deliberately invisible. Professional, austere, global diaspora genetics visible in blended phenotype. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Axiom Corporate Campus', N'local', N'Axiom Corporate Campus', N'East Asian (46.0%) provides primary bone structure and facial framework, substantially blended with South Asian (20.4%) heritage that broadens facial proportions and deepens eye set, Sub-Saharan African (17.4%) ancestry that warms skin tone and contributes to overall facial width and presence, Hispanic/Latin American (10.4%) adding warmth and subtle proportion variation, and Northern European (5.8%) providing minimal cool undertones. The result is a genuinely composite phenotype where no single ancestry dominates—East Asian angularity coexists with South Asian facial breadth, Sub-Saharan warmth, and Latin American proportional influence in seamless genetic integration.', 183, 76, N'Lean and angular, shoulders slightly narrowed from deliberate postural discipline. Long-limbed with minimal subcutaneous fat—the build of a man who chose reduction over accumulation. Wiry rather than muscular, suggesting endurance over strength.', N'Dark brown with silver-grey at temples', N'Close-cropped, military precision, no styling product', N'Short', N'Deep brown with slight amber undertones, enhanced by wire-frame optical overlay', N'Warm medium brown—genuine synthesis of East Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African base with golden warmth from Latin American and minimal Northern European admixture. The tone reads as authentically global, neither cool nor warm dominating but coexisting in a complexion that shifts with ambient light, suggesting true genetic blending rather than single-origin ancestry.', N'Austere. Clean-shaven except for deliberate two-day stubble maintained with exactness. Minimal laugh lines—his face does not move often. Eyes carry the stillness of someone who listens more than he speaks. Slight creasing at the corners from years of sustained concentration. Skin is clear, unblemished, and suggests rigorous discipline rather than vanity. Cheekbones carry angular structure blended from East Asian ancestry, while overall facial proportion, eye set, and breadth reflect South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage contribution, creating a face neither narrow nor broad but balanced across genetic sources.', N'Wire-framed optical enhancers (gunmetal grey, vintage aesthetic, deliberately analog-appearing despite integrated document-analysis overlay). The frames are subtly incongruous on a man of his tier—Tier 1-2 personnel typically use neural overlays. This choice reads as deliberate refusal. No visible chrome. No subdermal lights or augmentation scarring visible on exposed skin.', N'Economical and controlled. Walks with minimal shoulder rotation, as if conserving kinetic energy. Sits perfectly still during interviews—hands flat on desk or folded. Rarely gestures. Turns his entire body to look at someone rather than just his head, suggesting old tactical training. His silence carries more presence than most people''s speech.', N'Tier 1 corporate formal, but austere. Charcoal grey suit, always pressed, fitted to his narrow frame. White dress shirt, never a tie—Axiom permits this at his level. Minimal jewelry: only a steel watch (functional, not luxury). Black leather belt and shoes, both maintained to military standards. No logos, no chromatic variation, no status signifiers. The uniform of a man who has decided appearance is a tool for invisibility, not assertion.', N'Three years ago he closed a case against a Tier 1 security contractor who was stealing from Axiom evidence lockups. He got the conviction. He later found evidence the man was stealing to fund food distribution in Irkalla. He has not re-opened the case. He has the file in his personal storage. He looks at it every few months.', N'Formal, precise, deliberately old-fashioned in phrasing — uses full sentences where others use fragments', N'Slow and even, with the particular weight of someone who knows you will fill his silences if he waits', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'magnus_nygaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67b-74e4-93bf-132b136710e7', N'Felicitas Madrigal-Vestergaard', N'Felicitas', N'', N'Madrigal-Vestergaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenosha Crossing, rotating between hyperlane rest stops, near beyond the Western Perimeter', N'Wandering hyperlane trader and oral map-keeper', N'Unaffiliated; loose ties to the Crossing Caravan Collective', N'Felicitas Madrigal-Vestergaard is a broad-shouldered man whose skin has the weathered texture of someone who has slept under more open skies than ceilings. His face is mapped with deep sun-lines and three horizontal scarification marks across each cheek — family marks from a grandmother he never met, replicated from a photograph. He keeps his silver-streaked hair in compressed locs wound tight against his skull, and his left eye is a replacement — milky synthetic glass with a faint amber glow that never quite matches the warm brown of his right. He wears a patchwork coat assembled from fabric scraps collected across twenty years of travel: Sahel weave, Andean fleece, Siberian synthetic fur stitched together into something ungainly and unmistakable.

Felicitas Madrigal-Vestergaard does not use navigation apps. He carries the hyperlane network in his head — every checkpoint, every informal rest stop, every E.L.F. shrine worth stopping at between here and the Escanaba Gateway. He sells information as readily as the salvaged electronics and dried foodstuffs strapped to his cargo cart. He is unhurried in a way that unnerves people who are used to the city''s pace, and he has a habit of studying strangers as if cataloguing them for a story he will tell somewhere else, to someone else, years from now.', N'Information broker and world-expander — he can tell players about routes, checkpoints, people, and rumors across the wider hyperlane network. Quest giver for courier or retrieval jobs. Living encyclopedia of the city''s edges.', N'', N'Synthetic replacement left eye (functional, older model — amber-glowing, basic vision enhancement only). No other augmentations.', N'Rises before dawn to check his cart inventory and whisper a short prayer to the transit E.L.F. at Kenosha Crossing''s pillar shrine; spends mornings trading and afternoons walking the lanes, mentally updating his internal route maps.', N'Felicitas Madrigal-Vestergaard, 185cm tall broad-shouldered man with golden-olive sun-weathered skin, high East Asian cheekbones blended with Nordic jawline and Latin facial width. Silver-streaked black compressed locs wound tight. Right eye warm amber-brown, left eye milky synthetic glass with amber glow and mechanical iris. Deep sun-lines around eyes and mouth, three parallel scarification marks across each cheek. Wearing elaborate patchwork long-coat stitched from rust indigo Sahel weave, cream earth-red Andean fleece, and silver-gray Siberian fur panels. Worn utilitarian layers beneath, heavily patched all-terrain boots, caramel leather satchel across body. Standing in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, unhurried posture, methodical gaze, dystopian evening lighting with neon signs reflecting off wet pavement, film noir atmosphere, solo figure in crowded lower-tier district, atmospheric depth, cinematic composition --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenosha Crossing', N'local', N'Kenosha Crossing', N'Northern European (57.7%, Scandinavian/Germanic) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (21.6%, Central/South American mestizo) and East Asian (20.7%, Southeast/East Asian) ancestry—a striking Pan-diaspora blend. Facial structure combines Northern European angularity with the wider cheekbones and softer contours of Hispanic/Latin American and East Asian heritage. The blend creates a unique phenotype: high, prominent cheekbones from East Asian ancestry, angular jaw from Northern European heritage, and broad face structure from Hispanic/Latin American lineage.', 185, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and thick-framed, carrying the solid mass of decades of manual labor and long-distance walking. Not muscular in a refined sense, but densely built — the frame of someone who loads and unloads carts without machinery.', N'Silver-streaked black', N'Compressed locs wound tight against the skull', N'Medium (locs approximately 8-10cm in length)', N'Right eye: warm amber-brown natural; Left eye: milky synthetic glass with faint amber glow', N'Golden-olive medium brown with warm undertones—a balanced blend of Northern European fairness warmed and deepened by East Asian and Hispanic/Latin American melanin contribution. Sun-darkened and weathered across exposed surfaces from chronic equatorial and subtropical exposure, creating a rich caramel-bronze patina.', N'Deeply lined face, particularly around the eyes and mouth from decades of sun exposure and smiling. Wide cheekbones and defined jawline showing the combined influence of all three ancestries: Eastern geometry softened by Latin warmth and Nordic definition. Three horizontal scarification marks across each cheek—deliberate family markings, cleanly healed. Weathered but well-maintained; grooming is sparse but intentional.', N'Left eye replacement: milky synthetic glass sphere with faint amber luminescence, visibly older model with slight mechanical iris movement. Sits slightly more recessed than natural eye. Otherwise no visible augmentations.', N'Unhurried and deliberate in movement — a man comfortable with silence and observation. Tends to stand with weight distributed evenly, as if always ready to walk long distances. Eyes move methodically across environments, cataloguing details. Rarely makes rapid gestures; speaks with long pauses between thoughts.', N'Patchwork long-coat assembled from twenty years of fabric scraps: visible panels of Sahel weave (rust and indigo tones), Andean fleece (cream and earth red), Siberian synthetic fur (silver-gray) stitched together into an ungainly but distinctive silhouette. Underneath: worn neutral-toned utilitarian layers suitable for variable climates. Footwear: heavily repaired all-terrain boots showing multiple generations of patches. No corporate branding; Tier 4-5 aesthetic through necessity rather than choice. Carries a battered leather satchel worn across his body — color faded to caramel from decades of use.', N'He has a daughter in Escanaba Gateway he has not spoken to in eleven years. She told him to choose between the road and her family. He chose wrong, and he knows it.', N'Measured, archaic-flavored. Uses geographic metaphors constantly. Switches between at least three creolized languages mid-sentence without noticing.', N'Slow and deliberate, with long pauses before important information as if checking internal files.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'felicitas_madrigal_vestergaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f5-7317-9e93-1341c4ac85ed', N'Anika Ionescu-Hosseini', N'Anika', N'', N'Ionescu-Hosseini', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Meridian Core (office), the Gray Zone (field operations), near State and Madison', N'Corporate Debt Arbitrator / Enforcer', N'Synclaire Financial Holdings (Tier-1 employee, Debt Resolution Division)', N'Anika Ionescu-Hosseini occupies the precise, bloodless space between corporate law and corporate violence. Employed by Synclaire Financial Holdings as a Tier-1 Debt Resolution Specialist, she operates from a glass-walled office forty floors above the street, surrounded by cascading ledgers of names, outstanding balances, and algorithmic threat assessments. She is tall, angular, with close-cropped silver hair she began dyeing at thirty-two—not to look older, but because she said gray suited the work. Her skin is a deep warm brown, her face carefully composed into something that reads as neither cruel nor kind, just precise.

In the field, Thessaly moves through the Gray Zone like a tax collector moving through a famine. She dresses in muted corporate silvers and blacks, carries no visible weapon, and speaks in the measured cadence of someone reading aloud from a contract. She has never personally broken anyone''s hands—she simply arrives, states the terms, and leaves the consequences to mathematics and to the two silent augmented associates who accompany her like footnotes. The residents of the Gray Zone call her Pale Mouth because of the white-tinted lip pigment she wears, and because of what comes out of it.

Thessaly was not born into the Meridian Core. She grew up in Old Harbor in a household that owed money to four separate creditors simultaneously, and she watched her mother perform an exhausting, humiliating arithmetic of survival every single week. She told herself she would learn the language of debt so fluently that it could never be used against her again. She did. She now speaks it against others with a fluency that frightens even her superiors, though none of them would say so aloud.', N'Thessaly functions as a mirror and moral pressure point—a character who chose institutional power as survival and now enforces the exact conditions she escaped, forcing other characters (and the reader) to reckon with how systems perpetuate themselves through the people they wound. She is neither villain nor redeemed figure, but a sustained ethical question.', N'', N'Subdermal financial-grade memory implant storing encrypted contractual data (Synclaire-issued, Synclaire-monitored),Ocular overlay with real-time credit tier assessment and biometric stress-reading (helps her know when someone is lying about their ability to pay),Voluntary nerve-dampening implant in her hands—she had it installed after a field incident years ago and has never fully explained why', N'Wakes at 05:30, reviews overnight account activity, takes precisely forty minutes for a breakfast she prepares herself as one act of non-optimized time. Travels to the Meridian Core via secured transit. Processes between eight and twenty accounts per day depending on complexity. Field visits to the Gray Zone occur twice weekly on a rotating schedule. Returns home by 20:00. Reads physical books for two hours. Does not socialize with colleagues. Calls her mother every other Sunday.', N'Anika Ionescu-Hosseini, 183cm tall, angular physique, warm-neutral brown skin with golden undertones and cool heritage grounding, faint scar temple to cheekbone, dark brown eyes with subtle ocular overlay glint. Short geometric silver-grey hair, expressionless face with prominent cheekbones and neutral white-tinted lips. Wearing tailored black Synclaire blazer with silver threading, crisp grey shirt, matte black trousers, minimal black leather shoes. Thin platinum ring on left ring finger. Economical posture, measured stance, absolutely minimal movement. Tier-1 corporate formal aesthetic. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, standing in high-efficiency office space with cool LED lighting casting faint highlights across her face, biometric stress-reading technology visible in faint iris luminescence. Cold, precise, invisible infrastructure aesthetic. Professional composure. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Meridian Core (office)', N'local', N'The Meridian Core (office)', N'Predominantly Middle Eastern (40.2%) and Eastern European (27.6%) with substantial Southeast Asian (25.5%) ancestry, complemented by Sub-Saharan African (4.6%) and Hispanic/Latin American (2.1%) heritage. This four-continental blend produces a sophisticated warm-neutral brown complexion with nuanced undertone complexity—golden warmth from Southeast Asian genetics, depth and richness from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, cool grounding from Eastern European and Middle Eastern heritage. The result shifts subtly across light sources, never appearing flat or monolithic.', 183, 68, N'Tall and angular, almost deliberately spare—minimal muscle definition but dense and efficient, the posture of someone who uses as few movements as possible', N'Silver-grey, dyed deliberately to maintain that shade', N'Close-cropped, geometric precision, no styling product visible, looks cut every twelve days', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint luminescent uptick at the iris—ocular overlay hardware catching light at certain angles', N'Warm-neutral brown with golden undertones, enriched by depth from Sub-Saharan African heritage, grounded by cool undertones of Eastern European and Middle Eastern genetics—slightly ashen from consistent indoor tier-1 lighting exposure', N'Expressionless baseline, skin meticulously maintained, absolutely no blemishes or visible scarring on the face. Moderate cheekbone prominence with angular structure reflecting the Eastern European and Middle Eastern ancestry blend, subtle facial width from Southeast Asian heritage, straight jaw line, mouth set in a neutral line. White-tinted lip pigment applied with mathematical precision—not thick, not stylish, functional. The effect is unsettling.', N'The ocular overlay is the only visible augmentation—a fractional glint in her pupils under fluorescent or bright LED light, most noticeable when she''s reading someone''s biometric stress. No external chrome, no visible subdermal plating. She operates in the space where augmentation becomes invisible infrastructure.', N'Economical. Stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders level. Walks at a measured pace with minimal arm swing. Hands rest flat on surfaces when seated. She moves like someone who has calculated the most efficient path through every room before entering it. No fidgeting, no adaptive movement—just transit from point A to B.', N'Tier-1 corporate formal: tailored black or charcoal blazers with subtle silver threading (Synclaire house colors), high-thread-count grey or white shirts, matte black tailored trousers, black leather shoes with minimal ornamentation (not flashy wealth, wealth that doesn''t need to announce itself). In field operations: same palette, slightly more functional fabrics. One visible piece of jewelry—a thin platinum ring on her left ring finger, no stone, no sentimentality visible in it.', N'She has quietly flagged three accounts for ''resolution delays'' over the past year—effectively canceling the debts of families that reminded her too specifically of her own childhood. She has buried the paperwork in bureaucratic noise. If discovered, it would end her career and potentially her freedom.', N'Contract terminology, financial euphemisms, precise numerical references, rare but cutting use of plain language for emphasis', N'Measured, unhurried, with deliberate pauses before key terms as if giving the listener time to understand the weight of them', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anika_ionescu_hosseini');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6be-7c16-8de0-134272a58e91', N'Deka Petrović', N'Deka', N'', N'Petrović', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, the Spindle District — a workshop called Actual Bodies, near Damen and Armitage', N'Prosthetics fitter and augmentation technician at a mid-tier Geartown workshop', N'Actual Bodies workshop (independent, Tier 3); informal referral relationship with Aurochs Medical Complex''s rehabilitation unit', N'Deka Petrović is slight and precise, the kind of person whose hands do most of his communicating. He keeps his natural skin — a warm medium brown with undertones that shift gold in good light — completely unmodified, which is unusual for someone in his trade and which he is mildly defensive about if asked. His one concession to the aesthetic of his work is his eyes: he had his irises replaced with calibration-pattern models that display a rotating set of geometric markers he can use as a reference grid when fitting prosthetics. They''re beautiful and faintly unsettling, like looking into a targeting system. His hair is cut close on the sides with a soft, loose top he doesn''t style — it does what it does.

He is a craftsman in the old sense, genuinely invested in the fit and function of every limb, joint, and sensory prosthetic that leaves his workshop. He talks to his clients at length before he touches a measurement tool, because he believes most fitters skip the conversation and produce limbs that technically work and practically don''t. He is warm and disarming in consultation, a little awkward socially outside of that context — the shop is his native environment and he becomes vaguely uncertain when removed from it. He has a complicated relationship with his own body and its wholeness that he has never examined closely enough to name.', N'Service provider and information source for augmentation-adjacent matters; character who humanizes the prosthetics trade; potential emotional complication for characters dealing with body modification or loss', N'', N'Calibration-pattern prosthetic irises; fine-motor enhancement mesh in both hands (proprioceptive, not strength — makes him feel where things are joining)', N'He opens the shop at 0800, takes consultations in the morning and does fittings and calibration work in the afternoon. He stays late most nights fine-tuning components, eating noodles from a place two doors down, and listening to music he describes as ''structural.''', N'Deka Petrović, precision calibration technician, GLMZ 2226. 168cm wiry build, warm medium-deep golden-brown skin blending Indigenous American, Eastern European, East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Pacific Islander heritage. Angular high cheekbones, defined jawline, fine-boned face with clear complexion. Short dark brown tousled hair, close-cropped sides. Striking prosthetic eyes with rotating geometric black and silver calibration-pattern irises—hypnotic, inhuman. Hands showing faint callus patterns and micro-scarring from mesh installation. Wearing dark reinforced work pants, fitted neutral long-sleeve shirt allowing precise movement, sturdy ankle boots, worn canvas apron with deep tool pockets. Standing slightly forward, hands never quite still, fidgeting with small objects. Workshop setting, cool ambient light catching golden undertones in skin. Economical posture, focused expression, operational precision. GLMZ 2200s precision engineer aesthetic, functional and worn. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Complex Pan-Global heritage: Predominantly Indigenous American (34.6%) with significant Eastern European (31.2%) and East Asian (14.3%) ancestry, complemented by Sub-Saharan African (10.9%), South Asian (5.4%), and Pacific Islander (3.6%) lineage. The result is a richly blended phenotype reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora—high cheekbones and defined jawline from Indigenous and East Asian ancestry, warm undertone depth from African and South Asian heritage, and fine facial structure enhanced by Eastern European bloodline. Pacific Islander ancestry adds subtle breadth to facial structure and warm richness to skin undertones.', 168, 62, N'Slight and precise, almost wiry, with the particular tenseness of someone whose work demands millimeter-scale control. Minimal upper body mass but defined in the forearms and hands. No wasted volume anywhere.', N'Natural dark brown, warm undertone', N'Close-cropped on sides, soft loose crown left unstyled and slightly tousled', N'Short', N'Prosthetic calibration-pattern irises — geometric markers in concentric rings of matte black and reflective silver, continuously rotating. The effect is faintly hypnotic and distinctly inhuman despite residing in otherwise ordinary brown eyes.', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden and amber undertones, the blended result of Indigenous American, Eastern European, East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Pacific Islander heritage creating luminous depth that catches in natural light. Completely unmodified and unmarked.', N'Clear, well-maintained skin with a fine-boned face showing the angular cheekbones and defined jaw characteristic of the Indigenous American and East Asian blend, softened by Eastern European, African, and South Asian heritage. Expression defaults to slight focus, as though mentally rotating fine tolerances. When engaged in consultation, face softens noticeably. Minimal grooming beyond functional necessity — no jewelry, no visible styling products.', N'Calibration-pattern prosthetic irises (continuously visible, deliberately kept as the only aesthetic modification). Fine-motor enhancement mesh in both hands is subcutaneous and invisible at a distance, but close observation reveals subtle structural differences in hand articulation and an odd stillness to his fingers when at rest — they move with unnatural precision when working.', N'Stands with shoulders slightly forward, weight often on one foot as though ready to lean into work. Hands are never quite still — fidgeting with small objects, making minute adjustments to nearby items. Moves economically, no excess motion. In his workshop, fluid and confident; outside of it, slightly contracted, as though operating on lower power.', N'Tier 3 workshop standard: reinforced cotton work pants (usually dark, often dusted with metal shavings), fitted long-sleeve shirts in neutral tones that allow precise arm movement, sturdy ankle boots with good ankle support for standing all day. A worn canvas apron with deep pockets for calipers, measurement tools, and small components — pockets worn soft from years of use. No logos or status markers. Everything functional, nothing decorative. Occasionally a lightweight overshirt when the workshop ambient temp drops.', N'His younger sister lost an arm in an industrial accident at Ferrogate Transit and refused any prosthetic. He became a prosthetics fitter specifically to understand why someone would make that choice. He has never asked her directly. He still doesn''t understand.', N'Technical precision in his domain; outside it, he reaches for technical language to describe emotional things, which lands oddly', N'Measured and unhurried in consultations; slightly too fast when nervous, which mostly happens outside the shop', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'deka_petrovi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a9-74d5-979a-1358e070f5d1', N'Akinwale Arakawa-Horváth', N'Akinwale', N'', N'Arakawa-Horváth', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Glassway — corporate-adjacent retail district, heavy surveillance, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Remote drone and vehicle operations specialist — rigger', N'Independent — Dockside connections', N'Akinwale Arakawa-Horváth are average height but with a presence that fills more space than the body accounts for. At 23, they have the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster — and they make no effort to hide it.

They arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and have been working off both ever since. They work as a rigger out of Glassway, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

What Akinwale Arakawa-Horváth lacks in subtlety, they compensate for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'Altan Lindqvist-Okafor represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Their stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster. Enhanced tendons — geneware upgrade, jump height and grip strength tripled', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Akinwale Arakawa-Horváth, GLMZ, androgynous figure with high angular cheekbones and refined facial structure blending Eastern European and East Asian ancestry with South Asian warmth, fair-to-medium skin tone with luminescent peachy-amber undertones, particularly visible along collarbones and wrists. Amber-brown eyes with cold focus. Short dark brown hair with auburn highlights, undercut fade style. Lean muscular build, enhanced tendons visible in forearms. Faint white temple scar, barely visible neural port scar behind left ear. Wearing sleeveless black compression technical vest over modular grey cargo pants, displaying iridescent synthetic blood circulation beneath translucent skin at wrists and neck. Steel-toed boots, minimal jewelry. Synthetic blood nanite networks glow faintly amber under neon lighting. Alert posture, hands visible, calculating expression. Dark urban GLMZ setting with harsh LED strips and soft ambient glow reflecting off wet surfaces. Mood: efficient, dangerous precision. Professional operative at rest. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Glassway', N'local', N'Glassway', N'Predominantly Eastern European (62.3%) with significant South Asian (17.7%) and East Asian (14.3%) admixture, rounded by Hispanic/Latin American (4.0%) and Sub-Saharan African (1.7%) ancestry. The result is a distinctly Eurasian phenotype with warmth and refinement across all features—high, angular cheekbones and strong bone structure from Eastern European genetics softened by South Asian facial proportions and fullness, with subtle eye shape refinement from East Asian heritage. The minor Hispanic and African components add subtle warmth and dimensionality to skin tone without altering the fundamental architecture.', 172, 68, N'Lean and efficient, muscular without bulk—built for precision and endurance rather than raw power. Enhanced tendons visible as subtle cord-like definition under the skin of forearms and calves.', N'Dark brown with subtle auburn undertones in direct light', N'Short, undercut fade with slightly longer crown—clean and utilitarian, styled with practiced casualness', N'Short', N'Amber-brown, naturally warm but capable of an unsettling flatness when focused', N'Fair to medium with warm golden undertones—a luminous complexion that blends Eastern European fairness with South Asian warmth and East Asian refinement. Subtle peachy-amber glow deepens along circulation points where synthetic blood runs closest to the surface (collarbones, wrists, neck), creating an iridescent quality under certain lighting. No harsh contrast; the warmth is integral rather than overlay.', N'Angular facial structure with high, prominent cheekbones and refined nose bridge reflecting the Eastern European-East Asian dominant ancestry, softened by South Asian influence through slightly fuller lower face and naturally warm undertones. Sharp jawline with defined structure. Skin is clear with a faint luminescent sheen along the collarbones, neck, and wrists where synthetic blood circulates closest to the surface. Minimal scarring visible—most damage repaired by accelerated healing. Expression is controlled, revealing little by default.', N'Synthetic blood system is the signature modification—the amber-tinged luminescence is visible beneath translucent skin at the wrists, collarbones, and base of the neck. The circulation network becomes more apparent when exerted or under stress. Enhanced tendons show as subtle but pronounced cording in forearms. No obvious chrome plating or mechanical limbs, but augmentations give uncanny precision in movement.', N'Moves with calculated efficiency—no wasted motion, every gesture purposeful. When at rest, maintains a relaxed but alert baseline, weight slightly forward on the balls of their feet. Capable of explosive movement despite the languid default. Makes direct eye contact during negotiations or confrontation; avoids it during cover-identity mundane interactions. Hands are always visible—a trust signal that reads as either confidence or threat depending on context.', N'Tier 3-4 hybrid—expensive technical wear worn with deliberate casualness. Favors modular cargo pants with reinforced seams (grey or black), fitted compression tops or sleeveless technical vests that display the augmentations without apology. Waterproof jacket with internal pockets for hardware. Worn but well-maintained steel-toed boots. Minimal jewelry—a single ring on the left hand (function unclear: controller, marker, or personal anchor). During cover-identity periods, dresses down to blending beige and grey, deliberately unremarkable. Always has some form of low-profile neural interface controller accessible—wrist-mounted, watch face, or pocket device.', N'', N'Fast, profane, and vivid. Speaks in images — everything is a metaphor for violence or weather.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'akinwale_arakawa_horv_th');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ea-72cb-9690-136f17f8e73b', N'Floris Hernández', N'Floris', N'', N'Hernández', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism, third floor above a noodle bar, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Private investigator, domestic and insurance cases', N'Self-employed, licensed PI under GLMZ Metro regulatory framework. Occasional contract work for smaller insurance carriers.', N'Floris Hernández is medium height, medium build, and deeply committed to being overlooked — which is, they will tell you, the most important professional skill they have. Their skin is a warm reddish-brown, their eyes an unusual gray-green that they''ve enhanced with a swirling patterned iris mod (silver filaments, like cracked ice) that they immediately regret because it is, in fact, memorable. Their hair changes color by mood and season; currently a deep burgundy shot through with dull gold. They dress in the specific way of someone who has learned to look like whoever is standing next to them — not quite any one thing.

Floris Hernández has been working private investigation for nine years and their caseload is relentlessly unglamorous: missing family members (found, usually, in places that break someone''s heart), insurance fraud (not as exciting as it sounds), and the particular GLMZ specialty of ''someone has taken something from my apartment and I cannot go to Arcturus Civil Security because of reasons.'' They are good at their job and intermittently proud of it. They have a complicated relationship with their own curiosity, which gets them into rooms they didn''t technically need to enter.', N'Information broker and access point — knows people across tiers because their cases take them everywhere. Can be hired to find people or things, can be encountered mid-case, can become an unexpected ally or complication. Their office above the noodle bar is a useful neutral meeting ground.', N'', N'Patterned iris mod (silver filament cracked-ice design, cosmetic, immediately regretted). Subdermal recording membrane in left palm — industry standard for PIs, legally registered. Color-shifting hair (bioluminescent follicle mod, mood-reactive with manual override).', N'Takes cases by referral and occasional listing on secured PI registries. Spends mornings on surveillance — physical tails and passive sensor drops — and afternoons writing reports in the office above the noodle bar, eating whatever comes up through the window on a string when they forget to eat otherwise. Has a standing arrangement with the bar''s owner involving information exchange and discounted broth.', N'Floris Hernández, mixed heritage operative with warm light-medium skin tone olive-gold undertones, high defined cheekbones, shoulder-length burgundy hair with gold undertones and bioluminescent follicles catching neon light, gray-green eyes with silver cracked-ice iris modification glinting subtly, faint jawline scar adding asymmetry, 169cm lean efficient build, dressed in worn charcoal and ash gray layers with synthetic leather jacket, wire-frame glasses, positioned at room edge in observation posture, subtle subdermal seam visible on left palm, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone Tier 3-4 environment, cool neon lighting casting shadows, moody atmospheric indoor setting, deliberately unmemorable yet distinctive, professional operative aesthetic, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Diaspora blend: Northern European (40.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (26.4%), Eastern European (21.6%), East Asian (11.2%) — warm light-to-medium skin tone with olive and golden undertones, facial structure reflecting balanced Northern and Eastern European ancestry with subtle East Asian influence creating distinctive high cheekbones and gentle epicanthic eye variation, complexion warmed by Latin American and East Asian heritage contribution', 169, 68, N'Medium, lean without being wiry — efficient frame built for moving through crowds without drawing attention, low center of gravity', N'Deep burgundy with dull gold undertones, bioluminescent follicles', N'Shoulder-length, deliberately unremarkable cut; styled to blend into background or pulled back depending on assignment', N'Medium', N'Gray-green with silver filament iris modification in cracked-ice pattern', N'Warm light-to-medium complexion with olive and golden undertones, subtle golden warmth across cheekbones and temples reflecting balanced Northern European, Eastern European, Hispanic/Latin American, and East Asian ancestral blend', N'Even skin with minimal makeup or grooming ritual — practical, maintained but not curated. High, defined cheekbones with structure reflecting Northern and Eastern European ancestry softened by East Asian influence, warm undertones across face and neck without harsh contrast. Resting expression neutral, trained to be unmemorable despite the regretted iris mod. Fine line scar along left jawline (4cm, faint) adds subtle asymmetry', N'Patterned iris modification (silver filaments, cracked-ice design) is most visible in direct light but creates memorable effect they resent professionally. Left palm displays faint seam lines marking subdermal recording membrane — visible only on close inspection or when palm is turned upward', N'Moves with deliberate economy of gesture — no wasted motion, shoulders slightly forward in habitually observant posture. Walks slightly heel-forward for silent movement. Eyes constantly cataloging environment. Tends to position themselves at room edges, never center. Hands often rest in lap or pockets', N'Tier 3-4 working class pragmatism — layered in neutral colors (charcoal, ash gray, muted olive) with worn synthetic leather jacket over fitted base layer. Worn boots with good grip. No logos or distinctive branding. Clothing deliberately calibrated to vanish into most GLMZ Tier 3-4 environments. Carries a functional messenger bag with worn strap. Occasionally wears wire-frame glasses (non-prescription) as disguise element', N'Four years ago they found a missing child — alive, in a Tessera labor-training dormitory, having been sold by a parent who has since been presenting themselves as a grieving victim on community forums. Tack has proof of both the sale and the ongoing performance. They have not turned the parent in. They have not contacted the child. They have the file. They look at it sometimes.', N'Conversational and slightly sideways — approaches things obliquely, lots of dependent clauses, occasional precise technical vocabulary that surfaces unexpectedly', N'Unhurried, with a rhythm that suggests they''re thinking faster than they''re speaking', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'floris_hern_ndez');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63a-7a59-9680-137c4ca530e1', N'Divit Achebe', N'Divit', N'', N'Achebe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — operates from a rooftop squat above a defunct laundromat, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Crew lead and primary courier — Switchback', N'Switchback', N'Divit Achebe runs packages across jurisdiction lines faster than anyone in GLMZ and has the shattered collarbone scars to prove it. Born in the Gray Zone, raised in the gap between governance tiers, she learned early that speed is the only resource the excluded have that the corps can''t buy. She was running messages for local vendors at twelve, crossing into Milwaukee Core at fourteen, and by sixteen she''d built a reputation as the courier you call when the package absolutely has to cross three jurisdictions before the automated surveillance cycle resets.

She founded Switchback at nineteen with her two closest friends — not out of ambition, but because running alone was getting people killed. the Gray Zone''s courier kids were being picked off by corporate security teams who treated them like vermin in the infrastructure. A crew meant backup, meant overlapping routes, meant someone noticed when you didn''t come home. Three years later, Switchback is the Gray Zone''s premier courier operation: small, fast, and just reckless enough to take jobs that the professional crews won''t touch.

Jinx is small — five-three, wiry, built for rooftops and ventilation shafts. Her hair is cut asymmetrically and changes color with whatever dye is available. She moves constantly — pacing, climbing, balancing on railings. Stillness is an emergency state. Her augmentations are visible: the spring-loaded ankle joints catch light when she runs, and the grip pads on her palms leave faint marks on everything she touches.', N'Jinx represents the young, reckless energy of GLMZ''s excluded — people who turned their disadvantage into velocity. Her stories are chase sequences and narrow escapes that carry the exhilaration of movement and the underlying terror of a world where stopping means being caught. She is what Kyle might have been without the facility — talented, endangered, and too young for the weight she carries.', N'', N'Spring-loaded ankle reinforcement — absorbs impact from drops up to three stories and provides explosive vertical leap capability. Gecko-grip dermal pads on palms and fingertips for surface adhesion on most building materials. Reflex enhancer (budget model, the Gray Zone-installed) that boosts reaction time by approximately 0.15 seconds. Internal GPS and route-mapping overlay — displays jurisdiction boundaries, camera positions, and patrol timing in her visual field.', N'Wakes at dawn. Runs the rooftops for an hour — partly exercise, partly route checking. Picks up contracts from dead drops and encrypted message boards. Coordinates crew assignments based on package priority and risk level. Eats street food on the move. Spends evenings maintaining gear and arguing with Puck about routes. Falls asleep wherever she stops moving, which is usually the rooftop squat but sometimes a fire escape or a hammock strung between air conditioning units.', N'Divit Achebe, a 160cm wiry street courier in the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226. Deep warm brown skin with golden undertones blending Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, Eastern European, and Latin American heritage. Angular cheekbones and defined jaw with slight epicanthic fold eyes, warm dark brown with visible redness. Asymmetrical electric violet hair with black roots, left side shaved, right side swept back and braided. Lean muscular frame built for vertical movement. Wearing fitted black synthetic tank top, sleeveless tactical vest covered in patches, dark reinforced cargo pants, custom-modified sneakers with visible chrome ankle joint augmentations. Grip pads visible on palms and fingertips as metallic-gray subdermal mesh. Scarred shoulders, upper chest, and left ribs from climbing accidents. Small eyebrow scar, burn scar on right palm. Wearing oversized military windbreaker with graffiti tags, paracord wristband, encrypted thumb drive lanyard. Balanced on balls of feet in dynamic ready posture. Standing on neon-lit rooftop overlooking industrial sprawl, harsh neo-noir lighting casting sharp shadows, gritty urban atmosphere, rain-slicked surfaces reflecting neon. Mood: alert, coiled energy, street-ready. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Sub-Saharan African majority (55.4%) blended with East Asian (22.1%), Eastern European (9.8%), Northern European (7.2%), and Hispanic/Latin American (5.5%) ancestry. Features reflect this global diaspora mix: deep warm brown skin with golden undertones from the dominant African heritage, brightened by East Asian ancestry contribution. Facial structure shows the angular cheekbones and defined jaw characteristic of East Asian heritage combined with the fuller lip structure and broader nose base of Sub-Saharan ancestry. Eyes warm dark brown, shaped with slight epicanthic fold from East Asian genetics. Overall complexion carries the warm melanin-rich tone of Sub-Saharan and East Asian blending, with the resilience and sun-responsiveness of multi-continental heritage.', 160, 48, N'Wiry and lean with corded muscle from constant rooftop movement. Minimal body fat, defined shoulders and forearms from climbing and grip work. Chest slightly concave from years of navigating tight spaces. Frame built for speed and vertical displacement rather than mass.', N'Currently dyed electric violet with black roots showing (rotates through available pigments: cyan, rust, charcoal, white). Natural color appears dark brown to near-black.', N'Asymmetrical undercut — left side shaved to scalp, right side longer and swept back. Dyed sections often braided or twisted to keep out of her face during movement.', N'Short on left, medium on right', N'Dark brown with persistent redness around sclera from dust and industrial particulates. No augmented optics visible.', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, darkened by sun exposure and outdoor work. Reflects the blended melanin profile of Sub-Saharan African majority ancestry with East Asian, Eastern European, Northern European, and Hispanic/Latin American contributions.', N'Angular facial structure with prominent cheekbones and defined jaw, blending East Asian sharpness with Sub-Saharan African bone density. Slight epicanthic fold to eyes from East Asian heritage. Small scar bisecting her left eyebrow (impact from a fall at age sixteen). Skin weathered and marked by minor burns, scrapes, and calluses — the wear of someone who climbs for a living. Minimal grooming beyond what''s practical; occasionally wears dark eyeliner that doubles as grime camouflage.', N'Spring-loaded ankle joints visible as chrome-plated articulation points at the Achilles tendon, catching light when she walks or runs. Grip pads on palms and fingertips appear as faint metallic-gray subdermal mesh with slightly raised texture, most visible when her hands are wet or under harsh light. Grip pads leave faint marks and micro-abrasions on surfaces she grabs.', N'Never truly still — constant low-level motion: weight shifting, fingers tapping, eyes scanning. When standing, she balances on the balls of her feet as if ready to launch. Movement is economical and three-dimensional: she climbs walls as readily as she walks floors. Her gait is quick and choppy, with springy ankle articulation visible on each stride. In moments of genuine rest (rare), she curls into compact positions — crouched on heels, or folded into corners — minimizing her footprint.', N'Tier 4-5 street courier aesthetic. Base layer: fitted black or dark gray synthetic tank top or sleeveless shirt, designed for movement and thermal regulation. Mid-layer: sleeveless tactical vest with numerous pockets for packages, tools, and spare data drives (brands rotate: unlabeled knockoffs, repurposed corpo surplus, homemade patches). Pants: dark, reinforced synthetic cargo pants or climbing tights with grip-friendly surfaces and zip-off lower legs. Footwear: custom-modified sneakers with reinforced ankle collars and extra traction pads to complement her augmented joints. Jacket (worn): oversized surplus military-grade windbreaker with reflective strips removed to reduce visibility, covered in patches and crude graffiti tags from the Gray Zone. Accessories: minimalist — worn paracord wristband, encrypted thumb drive on a lanyard, no jewelry. Colors are muted and functional (blacks, grays, dark greens) with occasional neon accents (dyed hair, reflective patch work) for crew identification.', N'She was offered a corporate courier position by a Meridian Core logistics firm. Guaranteed salary, healthcare, augmentation maintenance. She turned it down because accepting would mean leaving the Gray Zone kids without a model for survival. She has never told Puck or Dash because they would have told her to take it.', N'the Gray Zone slang, route jargon, bursts of surprising eloquence when she''s passionate. Code-switches between the Gray Zone dialect and Core-passing speech depending on which side of the jurisdiction line she''s on.', N'Fast, rhythmic, overlapping. She talks the way she runs — momentum-based, with sudden direction changes.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'divit_achebe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f0-7dfa-998c-1385c3e7084d', N'Fidela Rahman', N'Fidela', N'', N'Rahman', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 40, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Steamvent Alley — geothermal district, hot and chemical-smelling, near Damen and Armitage', N'Aerial extraction and rapid transit pilot — getaway pilot', N'Semi-independent — recurring contracts with mid-tier fixers', N'Fidela Rahman is tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 40, her expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct ne — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She grew up in the Narrows, where the walls are so close together you learn to fight in confined spaces or you learn to lose. She works as a getaway pilot out of Steamvent Alley, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Fidela Rahman lacks in subtlety, she compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'Tenzin Ahlstrom-Quartey functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access. Cranial bomb defuser — specialized implant that detects and neutralizes cortex bombs in others', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Fidela Rahman, 183cm tall, neo-noir pilot with warm deep brown skin featuring golden undertones and slight ashy weathering. Dark brown hair with silver threading pulled back in tight functional braid. Gray-brown direct gaze, prominent cheekbones reflecting South Asian ancestry balanced with Sub-Saharan African and Northern European features. Rawboned, efficient build from endurance training. Faint white scar from left temple toward jawline, callused pilot''s hands with minimalist targeting reticle tattoo on inner wrist. Polished chrome neural interface jack at base of skull with subcutaneous shimmer. Matte black synthleather flight jacket with worn cuffs, gray cargo pants with utility loops, scuffed steel-toed boots. Subcutaneous wrist display faintly luminescent. Platinum ring on left ring finger. Economical posture, controlled movement, systematic eye scanning. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. Moody industrial lighting, slight neon glow. High-tech pilot ready room or Steamvent Alley location. Serious, focused expression. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Steamvent Alley', N'local', N'Steamvent Alley', N'South Asian (49.2%), Sub-Saharan African (26.6%), and Northern European (24.2%) — a striking genetic blend. Strong South Asian ancestry visible in cheekbone structure and facial proportions, enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth and warmth, tempered by Northern European angularity. The combination creates a face that reads as cosmopolitan and genetically fluid, distinctly neither monoethnic nor easily categorized.', 183, 68, N'Rawboned and efficient — long-limbed with minimal body fat, the physique of someone who trains for endurance and precision rather than bulk. Shoulders slightly forward from years hunched over flight controls.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid; practical, no styling products', N'Long (mid-back when unbraided)', N'Gray-brown, direct and unblinking', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones — rich caramel to deeper bronze depending on light, reflecting the dominant South Asian ancestry blended with Sub-Saharan African warmth and Northern European cool undertones. Slightly ashy cast from chemical air or chronic sleep deprivation.', N'Weathered and lined around the eyes; minimal grooming beyond function. Slight scar tissue at left temple. No cosmetics. Skin has the texture of someone who spends time in hot, mineral-rich air without proper skincare. Cheekbones prominent and well-defined, reflecting South Asian ancestry; facial structure balanced between Northern European angularity and the broader, warmer proportions characteristic of South and Sub-Saharan African heritage.', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull — polished chrome with faint circuitry etching visible at the edges, worn without cover or concealment. Slight subcutaneous shimmer at base of neck suggests subcutaneous neural array beneath skin. No visible limb modifications.', N'Economical and controlled. Stands with weight balanced evenly, never fully relaxed. Moves with pilot''s precision — efficient, calculated, no wasted motion. Eye movement is quick and systematic, as if still scanning instruments. Speaks sparingly; listens more than she talks.', N'Tier 3-4 functional: reinforced flight jacket (matte black synthleather, multiple pockets, worn at cuffs), fitted gray cargo pants with thigh utility loops, scuffed steel-toed boots. No logos or branding. Wearing a subcutaneous wrist display visible only as faint luminescence under sleeve. One platinum ring on left ring finger — no obvious sentimental value, possibly a dead drop indicator.', N'', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fidela_rahman');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a7-7d18-b5ca-13fb7f19625b', N'Astrid Nkrumah-Vasquez-Alfarsi', N'Astrid', N'', N'Nkrumah-Vasquez-Alfarsi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 51, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, Trauma Surgery Division, Floors 14-17', N'Trauma surgeon at Aurochs Medical Complex, Tier 3 OR suite, with a secondary specialization in blast and crush injuries', N'Aurochs Medical Complex (senior staff, employed); quiet consulting arrangement with the Highland Park Autonomous Zone medical committee', N'Astrid Nkrumah-Vasquez-Alfarsi is tall and heavy-shouldered, built like someone who used to be athletic and is now simply solid, with dark brown skin and a close-cropped greying beard he keeps meticulously trimmed. His face is the kind that has settled into its expressions — the default is neutral but not cold, the sort of neutral that comes from having looked at catastrophic injury long enough that it no longer reads as horror but simply as problem. He moves through the hospital with a particular gravity: people step out of his way not because he demands it but because something in his bearing makes them. His surgical scrubs are always immaculate going in and catastrophically otherwise coming out, and he seems unbothered by either state.

He has been at Aurochs for nineteen years, which means he has watched two generations of hospital administration cycles, four ownership transitions, and three different eras of augmentation injury — from the early years when the implants were new and failing unpredictably, to now, when the injuries are more complex but the tech more understood. He does not speak about his personal life at work and does not socialize at hospital events. What colleagues know: he is twice divorced, has a son who works freight at Ferrogate Transit and doesn''t call, and keeps a personal shrine to a Samoan navigation E.L.F. in his office that he will neither explain nor apologize for. What they don''t know is more interesting.', N'High-tier medical contact, potential source of off-record trauma care, character who can identify injuries and what caused them; his consulting work with Highland Park creates a tension that could draw him into narratives', N'', N'Surgical-grade haptic implants both hands (Helix Biosystems top-tier, hospital-subsidized); titanium-reinforced lumbar spine (occupational injury, age 43); optical zoom implants (bilateral, surgical precision enhancement); no cosmetic mods', N'Takes the same tram at 05:40 every morning, arrives before the OR opens, reviews overnight cases; performs four to seven surgeries on a typical shift; eats in his office alone; leaves after dictating surgical notes in person rather than using voice-to-text software because he doesn''t trust it.', N'GLMZ, tall 188cm surgical specialist Astrid with warm medium-deep brown skin blending Latin American warmth, African depth, Middle Eastern olive, and East Asian refinement. Short dark hair greying at temples, close-cropped sides. Deep-lined weathered face, immaculate trim beard, neutral severe expression. Dark brown eyes with faint silver augmentation luminescence visible under bright light. Heavy-shouldered solid build, functional mass. Navy blue surgical scrubs worn soft from washing, immaculate before procedures. Standing with deliberate stillness, shoulders slightly forward, hands at rest position palms-down fingers curved. Minute servo movements in eye focus, subcutaneous haptic implants evident in hand precision. Hospital corridor OR lighting, clinical atmosphere, carrying weight beyond body mass, the bearing of decades in trauma surgery. Faint electromagnetic presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Mixed ancestry: Hispanic/Latin American (29.4%), Sub-Saharan African (24.2%), Middle Eastern (20.0%), Eastern European (13.3%), East Asian (9.4%), South Asian (3.7%). Complex phenotype blending warm Latin American and Mediterranean bone structure with Sub-Saharan depth, Eastern European facial geometry, and East Asian refinement. The genetic convergence creates a distinctive warm medium-deep brown complexion with golden undertones, neither clearly belonging to any single ancestry group but harmoniously integrated across all continental inputs.', 188, 102, N'Heavy-shouldered and solid, the residual athleticism of a younger man settled into functional mass. Wide chest, thick neck, forearms that still carry definition despite age. No fat softness—compact density from decades of standing in ORs.', N'Dark brown with grey at temples and throughout the beard', N'Close-cropped on sides, slightly longer on top, kept precisely neat', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint silver augmentation luminescence visible under surgical lighting', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden undertones—harmonious blend of Latin American warmth, Middle Eastern olive, Sub-Saharan depth, and East Asian refinement. Weathered and clear, showing the patina of surgical precision rather than age.', N'Weathered but well-maintained. Deep lines around the eyes and mouth from years of surgical concentration and emotional containment. Meticulously groomed—the beard is trimmed to exact specifications, no stubble. Skin shows minor scarring on knuckles (occupational), no visible lesions or blemishes. The default expression is neutral bordering on severe; the face reads as someone who has catalogued every variation of human trauma and filed them away.', N'Bilateral optical implants visible as faint silvery-grey rings around the iris under bright light; minute servo micromovements visible when he focuses on small objects. Hands show no external augmentation scarring due to surgical-grade implant integration—the haptics are subcutaneous, but the precision and speed of his hand movements mark them as augmented to anyone watching him work. Occasionally a faint electromagnetic hum from the lumbar spine implants under his shirt during diagnostic scans, but otherwise invisible.', N'Moves with deliberate economy—no wasted motion. Walks slowly through corridors despite his height, as if carrying weight that has nothing to do with body mass. In the OR, he becomes motionless except for his hands and eyes; all concentration funnels downward. Stands with his shoulders slightly forward, spine reinforced by titanium, hands always at rest position—palms down, fingers slightly curved as if on the edge of a surgical field.', N'Surgical scrubs in the hospital (navy blue, Aurochs-issue, worn soft from washing), always immaculate before surgeries despite the catastrophic state after. Outside the hospital (rare observation): plain charcoal or dark grey clothing, well-fitted but anonymous—no logos, no affectation. A single silver chain around his neck under his shirt (never visible but known to exist). Work boots rather than sneakers, practical and unremarkable. Tier 3 functional style: clothes that serve purpose, purchased for durability, replaced when worn rather than for novelty.', N'He has been performing pro-bono, off-record surgeries for Highland Park Autonomous Zone residents once a month, using hospital supplies he accounts for as waste. He has done this for six years. Three colleagues suspect. None have reported him, partly out of respect and partly because they believe they would do the same.', N'Spare and clinical at work, surprisingly warm in private moments; uses full sentences always, hates contractions in formal contexts', N'Slow and deliberate, long pauses between statements that are not uncertainty but conclusion', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'astrid_nkrumah_vasquez_alfarsi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c9-7144-841c-142771b6140c', N'Benedikt Björnsdóttir-Kwon', N'Benedikt', N'', N'Björnsdóttir-Kwon', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 68, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Block 7, stall 7-F (lives in a converted shipping container unit), near Halsted and Division', N'Corporate Wars veteran, retired Axiom security contractor, pension-dependent resident', N'', N'Benedikt Björnsdóttir-Kwon is a lean, angular man with close-cropped grey hair and the particular economy of movement that marks people trained to conserve energy over long distances. His skin is dark brown with pronounced keloid scarring across his right shoulder and clavicle — he does not cover it and does not explain it to strangers. He has cosmetic geneware: a cat''s tail, russet-orange with a dark tip, that he got as a joke in 2168 when his unit was celebrating surviving the Kessler Corridor engagement. He has kept it because it amuses him that it annoys people who expect a veteran to be more serious. His left hand has a visible subdermal port on the back where a tactical datalink was removed — the flesh around it never quite healed smooth.

Benedikt Björnsdóttir-Kwon served twelve years as an Axiom ground contractor during the Corporate Wars, and he came back from them with a pension that covers his container unit on the Gray Zone, two meals a day if he is careful, and nothing else. He is not bitter about this in the operatic way — he is bitter in the quiet, functional way of someone who made his peace with it and is now simply watching to see what happens next. He runs a small informal counseling operation for other veterans on the Gray Zone, not because anyone asked him to or pays him to, but because he watched two friends die from nothing that could have been prevented if anyone had been paying attention. He has no license, no credentials, and a long waiting list.', N'Veteran perspective and emotional grounding; can provide military history of the Corporate Wars from a ground-level view; gateway to the veteran community on the Gray Zone; also a portrait of what Axiom does to the people who survive its service. Can be a quest giver around veteran welfare issues.', N'', N'Russet-orange cat tail (geneware, cosmetic, installed 2168); removed tactical datalink (scar tissue port on left hand dorsum); stress-hormone regulator implant in the medulla — standard Axiom issue, he cannot afford to have it removed and is not sure he wants to', N'Wakes before dawn and walks the full perimeter of the Gray Zone — partly exercise, partly reconnaissance that he knows is unnecessary but cannot stop. Holds informal sessions with veterans through the late morning. Afternoons he repairs things for neighbors in exchange for food or supplies. He prays briefly each evening to the ELF he believes inhabits the Gray Zone''s power grid, which he has named Ogun, leaving it a small piece of wire bent into a shape he never explains.', N'Benedikt Björnsdóttir-Kwon, lean 178cm mixed-heritage neo-noir operative, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, high angular cheekbones blending East Asian characteristics with broad African heritage nose bridge, deep brown eyes with amber warmth, grey close-cropped military cut hair, clean-shaven weather-worn face etched with decades of controlled expression. Pronounced radiating keloid scarring across right shoulder and clavicle left deliberately visible, animate russet-orange cat tail with dark tip extending from base of spine, subdermal port scar on left hand. Wearing faded Axiom-era deep grey fatigue pants with reinforced pockets, layered muted-color shirts showing careful mending, long waterproofed 2190s coat, worn synthetic boots. Thin braided wire bracelet on right wrist. Standing with weight balanced on balls of feet, economy of motion, aware of sightlines. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. Cool neon-tinged overhead lighting casting subtle shadows across weathered features, industrial background with faded corporate signage, meditative isolated mood, gritty realism --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'East Asian (45.6%), Sub-Saharan African (22.8%), Northern European (18.2%), Southeast Asian (9.1%), Indigenous American (4.3%) — a striking diaspora blend. High angular cheekbones with East Asian characteristics blend with a broad nose bridge reflecting African and Southeast Asian heritage. Deep-set warm brown eyes with amber undertones sit in a face shaped by Northern European jawline structure and subtle Indigenous American features. The overall phenotype is distinctive: warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones and subtle depth, creating a cohesive complexity that defies any single regional classification.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, the kind of thin that comes from decades of controlled caloric intake and purposeful movement rather than deprivation. Corded forearms and minimal body fat; shoulders narrower than his height might suggest, giving him a slightly canted posture.', N'Grey', N'Close-cropped, military cut maintained with precision, no styling product', N'Short', N'Deep brown with warm amber undertones', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones, the result of East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Southeast Asian, Northern European, and Indigenous American genetic blend', N'Weather-worn with deep lines around eyes and mouth from decades of sun exposure and controlled expression. High angular cheekbones with East Asian characteristics dominate upper facial structure, balanced by a broad nose bridge reflecting African and Southeast Asian heritage. Jawline suggests Northern European ancestry with subtle Indigenous American refinement. Skin texture shows the particular quality of someone trained to suppress micro-expressions; face rarely moves except when consciously chosen. Clean-shaven with methodical grooming despite resource scarcity.', N'Russet-orange cat tail with dark tip extending from base of spine, visibly animate with independent articulation; subdermal port scar on dorsum of left hand where tactical datalink was removed, with raised scar tissue that never healed flush to surrounding skin', N'Economy of motion ingrained to the point of unconscious habit. Walks with measured pace, never rushed. Stands with weight balanced slightly forward on the balls of his feet as if ready to move. Hands rarely gesture; communication is primarily facial and postural. Moves through space as someone aware of sightlines and exits, a reconnaissance habit he cannot disable.', N'Tier 4 functional — worn but maintained Axiom-era fatigue pants, deep grey with reinforced pockets; layered shirts in muted colors (charcoal, slate, dark green) that show careful mending. A long coat from the 2190s, still waterproofed, with internal pockets used for tools and small repair items. Worn synthetic boots with good tread, resoled multiple times. A single piece of jewelry: a thin braided wire bracelet on his right wrist, knotted with small loops he fidgets with during counseling sessions. No visible branding or corpo affiliations — all markings have been removed or faded.', N'', N'Military-inflected shorthand mixed with West African French cadences; sparse, functional, occasionally erupts into dry wit that catches people off guard; code-switches between formal and casual without seeming to notice', N'Short declarative sentences with occasional long pauses; never uses three words when two will do', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'benedikt_bj_rnsd_ttir_kwon');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66d-78f0-8b26-14b320faf65f', N'Ergun Hinojosa', N'Ergun', N'', N'Hinojosa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, near Michigan Ave and Chicago Ave', N'Underground press operator and pirate broadcaster', N'Groundwave Independent Media Collective; loose ties to the HPAZ Neighborhood Assembly', N'Ergun Hinojosa is a compact woman with deep brown skin and close-cropped natural hair shot through with copper-dyed locs she clips back when she''s working. Her left eye is a salvaged optic implant she bought secondhand — it glows a faint amber in low light and sometimes stutters, giving her an unsettling blink lag. She wears the same canvas jacket most days, patched at the elbows and covered in hand-stitched slogans in four languages. There''s a quality to her stillness that makes people think she''s always listening, because she is.

Ergun Hinojosa runs ''Groundwave,'' an unlicensed audio-visual broadcast that goes out three nights a week through a rotating network of transmitter nodes hidden across the HPAZ. She''s brilliant, paranoid in ways that have saved her life twice, and has a gift for making complex political theory sound like something you''d argue about over bad synthetic coffee. She has little patience for performative activism and a sharp tongue for anyone she suspects is building a personal brand on other people''s suffering.', N'Information source, local color, quest giver — she has heard things and she knows people. Can expose a secret or bury one. Her broadcast is a way to get information to the public or to seed a rumor into the district.', N'', N'Secondhand left-eye optic implant (Ringo-brand, unauthorized resale, glitchy); subdermal data cache along her left forearm for storing raw broadcast files', N'Spends mornings scrubbing tips and verifying sources in a converted storage unit. Afternoons coordinating with her two-person tech crew to route that night''s transmission. Broadcasts between 21:00 and 01:00 three nights a week, then spends the rest of the night sweeping for signal-trace teams.', N'Ergun Hinojosa, GLMZ, compact wiry woman with Indigenous American and Central Asian heritage—warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones, angular high cheekbones, lean jawline. Short deep brown hair with copper locs clipped back. Right eye deep brown, left eye amber-glowing salvaged optic implant with visible micro-servos and occasional stutter. Small scar tissue on left temple. Subdermal forearm cache with faint bioluminescent traces under skin. Burn scar across back of right hand. Radio wave tattoo on inner left wrist. Straight posture, economical movement. Wearing weathered off-white canvas jacket with hand-stitched multilingual slogans, dark fitted shirt, black cargo pants, scuffed steel-toe boots. Data-jack adapter on cord around neck. In dimly lit underground broadcast studio, atmospheric particulates catching golden light across her face, left eye amber-lit in shadow, tension around cybernetic eye, listening posture, deliberate stillness, GLMZ neon-tinged ambient lighting, intimate portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Indigenous American (44.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (28.2%), and Central Asian (26.9%)—a striking synthesis of three continental ancestries. Her appearance reflects the high-altitude adaptations of Andean and Central Asian populations: warm golden-brown skin with subtle olive undertones, prominent angular cheekbones, and distinctive facial geometry combining Indigenous American breadth through the face with Central Asian definition. The genetic blend creates warm complexion that shifts with light, rooted in the genetics of highland populations across the Americas and Central Asia', 162, 58, N'Compact and wiry, economical muscle without bulk—the frame of someone who moves through tight spaces and doesn''t waste motion', N'Natural deep brown with copper-dyed locs', N'Close-cropped natural hair with selective copper locs, clipped back during broadcasts with a frayed cloth tie', N'Short', N'Right eye: deep brown natural; Left eye: amber-glowing salvaged optic implant with visible micro-servos at the iris', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle olive undertones characteristic of Indigenous American and Central Asian ancestry, deepened by high-altitude genetic adaptation. GLMZ atmospheric particulates add a faint ashy dusting that catches against the warm base', N'Strong, defined cheekbones with moderate facial width reflecting Indigenous American heritage balanced with Central Asian angular structure. Lean jawline with subtle roundness through the lower face. Minimal grooming—no cosmetics, practical. Small scar tissue along left temple from implant installation. Permanent slight tension in the muscles around her left eye from the glitchy implant''s micro-stutters. Facial structure reflects the distinctive prominence of high cheekbones and the blended geometry of Andean and Central Asian populations', N'Left eye optic implant with amber glow and occasional visible stutter/blink lag; subdermal forearm cache with faint bioluminescent data traces under high-contrast lighting; no chrome, all salvage-grade and deliberately low-profile', N'Still and economical. Sits with her spine straight, shoulders held back—listening posture. Moves with minimal wasted motion, each gesture deliberate. Her head tilts slightly when processing audio, a habit from favoring her functional right eye. Rarely makes eye contact with both eyes simultaneously due to the left implant''s lag', N'Tier 4 workwear aesthetic with political intent. Primary garment: a weathered canvas jacket (off-white, now gray from use) with hand-stitched slogans in Twi, Polish, English, and Arabic across the back and sleeves—rotating messages changed weekly. Underneath: plain dark fitted shirt or tank, worn for freedom of movement. Black cargo pants with reinforced pockets for recording equipment. Scuffed steel-toe boots, salvage-market brand. No jewelry except a data-jack adapter on a cord around her neck. Bag: a modified canvas messenger sling with signal-dampening lining', N'Three years ago she received documented proof that a senior HPAZ Assembly member was taking quiet stipends from a Tessera community liaison. She killed the story because she was sleeping with him. He''s since moved on and she still hasn''t run it — the file sits encrypted on her forearm cache.', N'Dense, precise, code-switches fluidly between street vernacular and policy language; quotes sources by habit', N'Rapid and rhythmic when excited, eerily measured when angry — the anger is the slow voice', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ergun_hinojosa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f3-7017-a82b-14c32e34a1cd', N'Alena Bustamante-Karimov', N'Alena', N'', N'Bustamante-Karimov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, Calumet Rise, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Gene therapist at Helix Biosystems'' Aurochs Medical Complex outpatient clinic, specializing in hereditary conditions and geneware integration complications', N'Helix Biosystems — Aurochs Medical Complex Outpatient Gene Therapy Division', N'Alena Bustamante-Karimov is small and precise in her movements, with light brown skin, natural hair worn in a large puff held back by a polished Helix Biosystems ID clip, and eyes modified with patterned irises — a double helix in dark gold on amber that she got as a graduation gift to herself. She is young for her position and knows it, which makes her simultaneously more careful and more aggressive in equal measure. She works within the Helix system because she believes — genuinely, not cynically — that gene therapy at scale requires institutional infrastructure, and she is trying to change the institution from inside while not yet having enough power to change much.

She is technically brilliant and interpersonally awkward in ways she''s actively working on. She has a tendency to present information in dense technical bursts before remembering she''s talking to a person. She finds pediatric gene therapy cases the hardest and doesn''t understand why it took her two years to figure out that it''s because she was a gene therapy patient herself as a child — a realization her therapist gently surfaced during a session she thought was about something else entirely. She''s been different with parents and children ever since.', N'Information source on cutting-edge gene therapy and Helix Biosystems'' internal culture. Potential quest giver when she discovers something in a patient''s genome that Helix wants suppressed. A character who complicates simple ''corponations are evil'' narratives by being genuinely idealistic within one.', N'', N'Patterned iris modification (double helix, gold on amber). Gene-reader implant in right fingertip pad — allows rapid genomic data access via touch interface with consenting patients. Geneware: enhanced olfactory receptors for detecting biochemical stress markers in patients.', N'Works eight-to-twelve-hour shifts at the Aurochs complex Monday through Friday, attends a mandatory Helix research briefing every Thursday, sees her own therapist every other Tuesday, and spends most weekends in the lab she isn''t supposed to use on weekends.', N'Alena Bustamante-Karimov, GLMZ, compact petite figure (158cm), warm golden-brown complexion with luminous undertones reflecting Central Asian-Hispanic-Middle Eastern-African-Southeast Asian blend, refined bone structure with softly rounded cheeks, dark brown hair in neat rounded puff held with polished chrome Helix ID clip, striking amber eyes with intricate dark gold double helix iris pattern, subtle forward shoulder lean from precision work, minimal fidgeting hands, wearing muted professional Helix-branded lab coat over gray fitted shirt, chrome gene-reader implant faintly visible on right fingertips, clinical laboratory setting with cool blue-white LED lighting, professional composure with slight tension around jaw, subtle scent of sterilization agents, mid-shot against equipment-lined background, photorealistic, cybernetic augmentation details visible, corporate professional atmosphere, contemplative expression --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Central Asian (34.2%) and Hispanic/Latin American (33.9%) form the genetic foundation, with substantial Middle Eastern (17.2%), Sub-Saharan African (8.4%), and Southeast Asian (6.3%) ancestry creating a complex phenotype. The result is warm golden-brown skin with balanced undertones — neither purely warm nor cool, but luminous with depth. Facial structure reflects this blend: refined bone geometry from Central Asian ancestry softened by rounder cheek and lip contours from Hispanic heritage, with subtle eye shape refinement and refined nasal bridge from Middle Eastern and Southeast Asian lines. Skin carries warmth and depth characteristic of the African ancestry component, creating subtle visual complexity that shifts across different lighting.', 158, 52, N'Slight and compact, with efficient musculature suggesting controlled movement rather than strength; posture reflects precision work and long hours at benches', N'Natural dark brown with subtle warm undertones', N'Large, rounded puff held back with a polished Helix Biosystems chrome ID clip; meticulously maintained', N'Medium (approximately 10-12cm natural length when released)', N'Amber with dark gold double helix patterning in both irises — a deliberate modification suggesting both technical sophistication and personal statement', N'Warm golden-brown with luminous, even complexion; the blending of Central Asian, Hispanic, Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian ancestry creates subtle depth and warmth with a quality that shifts between golden and bronze undertones depending on light', N'Clear, well-maintained skin with minimal visible scarring; face carries slight tension around the eyes and jaw from concentration; minimal cosmetic grooming beyond professional necessity. Facial structure shows refined bone geometry characteristic of Central Asian ancestry softened by the rounder, fuller cheeks and lips of Hispanic heritage, with subtle Southeast Asian eye shape and refined Middle Eastern nasal bridge reflecting the broader ancestral mix. Skin texture is smooth with even melanin distribution creating subtle warmth throughout', N'The double helix iris modification is immediately striking — both eyes display the custom patterning. The gene-reader implant in the right fingertip is only visible on close inspection as subtle raised scarring and a faint metallic gleam under certain light. Enhanced olfactory receptors are not externally visible but may manifest as subtle tension in nasal passages during heavy scent-marker detection work.', N'Moves with deliberate economy; spine is straight but shoulders carry slight forward lean from years of microscope and console work. Hands are rarely still — fingers tap, fidget, or gesture while talking, especially when moving through dense technical explanations. Makes minimal eye contact during conversation unless consciously working on engagement. Quick, efficient movements in clinical settings; slower, more careful movements in social contexts as if calculating each gesture.', N'Tier 1-2 corporate professional. Helix-branded lab coat over fitted, muted-color clothing (grays, blacks, deep blues, sage greens) from mid-tier suppliers like Isamu or Kyoto Basics. Closed-toe shoes with good arch support, minimal jewelry beyond the ID clip and a simple watch that logs biometric data. Clothing is always clean and pressed but shows signs of regular wear and occasional small stains from lab work that didn''t quite come out. No visible personal style affectation — fashion choices are functional first, professional second.', N'She has been secretly documenting cases where Helix''s treatment protocols appear to prioritize proprietary geneware compatibility over optimal patient outcomes — she doesn''t know what to do with the documentation yet, and is terrified of what it means that she''s collecting it.', N'Technical and precise, with visible self-corrections when she catches herself going too deep. Asks clarifying questions compulsively. Earnest in a way that can read as naive.', N'Fast when discussing science, deliberately slower when discussing feelings — you can hear the gears shifting.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alena_bustamante_karimov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e4-744a-a6fd-14cf3bc36a21', N'Katarzyna Petrović', N'Katarzyna', N'', N'Petrović', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 22, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Grand Corridor, Axiom Regional Security Post 7, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Axiom Security Division corporate campus guard, Grand Corridor Axiom tower', N'Axiom Security Division (contracted Tier 2 guard)', N'Katarzyna Petrović is twenty-two and looks it — wide-eyed in a way she is actively trying to train out of herself, with warm brown skin, a small spray of geneware freckles across her nose and cheeks that pulse faintly orange under stress (she did not know they would do that when she bought the mod and finds it professionally embarrassing), and her dark hair pulled back in the mandatory Axiom security bun. She is 168cm in boots she is still breaking in. Her uniform fits well because she had it tailored with three months of saved UBC supplement — she wanted at least one thing to look like she belonged.

She is nine months into her first real job and has not yet decided who she wants to be inside it. She follows the rulebook with the anxious precision of someone who has read it twice and is afraid of what happens if she gets something wrong. She is genuinely friendly to the researchers and admin staff who pass her post, has learned most of their names, and does small considerate things like remembering who takes the late elevator and propping the side door for the cleaning crew. She has not yet been asked to do anything she found troubling. She is waiting, in the back of her head, for that to change.', N'Accessible entry point into Axiom corporate space, sympathetic institutional character, represents the human face of corporate enforcement before it hardens', N'', N'Geneware freckle pigmentation (stress-reactive, unintended — cosmetic mod gone slightly sideways), standard Axiom-issue comm bead (right ear), no other augmentations — cannot afford more yet', N'Works the 0600-1400 shift at Grand Corridor Post 7, ID-checks everyone entering the Axiom regional office tower, monitors the lobby camera feeds on a secondary screen, and eats a packed lunch at her post because the Axiom canteen requires a Tier 3 access badge she doesn''t have.', N'Katarzyna Petrović, 168cm tall lean athletic woman in charcoal grey Axiom Security Division tactical bodysuit with reinforced polymer shoulder and forearm panels, black duty belt with compliance taser holster, black steel-toed boots. Medium-warm brown skin with golden undertones blending Eastern European, Southeast Asian, and South Asian genetics. High cheekbones, refined jawline, clear complexion with distinctive warm orange stress-reactive geneware freckles scattered across bridge of nose and upper cheeks, faintly luminescent. Warm brown eyes. Dark brown hair pulled back in tight regulation bun with slight crown lift. Black polymer comm bead embedded in right ear with subtle LED. Military-trained posture, shoulders back, spine straight, measured deliberate movements, direct intense gaze. Fastidious grooming, precise professional appearance. Axiom ID badge on left chest pocket, cheap digital wristwatch. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone security division officer, confident but still settling into adulthood, neon-lit facility or urban precinct setting with cool blue-grey ambient lighting highlighting skin tone and stress-reactive freckles --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Corridor', N'local', N'Grand Corridor', N'Predominantly Eastern European ancestry (71.9%) with significant Southeast Asian (19.9%) and South Asian (8.2%) genetic heritage—a striking blend creating warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones. Eastern European bone structure balanced with the subtle luminosity characteristic of Southeast and South Asian genetics, creating distinctive high cheekbones and gently defined facial planes.', 168, 62, N'Lean and athletic with functional muscle definition from recent gym discipline; posture still settling into confidence. Not quite filling out her frame yet — the appearance of someone still growing into adulthood.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Pulled back in a tight regulation bun, pulled so firmly it creates a slight lift at the crown', N'Medium (shoulder-length when down)', N'Warm brown', N'Medium-warm brown with golden undertones—warm depth from Southeast and South Asian heritage balanced with the cooler, luminous quality of Eastern European genetics creating a nuanced, complex tone.', N'Clear skin with a distinctive scatter of geneware freckles across the bridge of nose and upper cheeks in warm orange pigmentation that intensifies visibly under stress or elevated cortisol. Freckles are still slightly raised, a tell that the modification is recent (within the past 18 months). Facial structure reflects Eastern European dominance with refined cheekbones and gentle jawline softened by Southeast Asian influence, minimal expression lines. Grooming fastidious and precise.', N'Standard Axiom Security Division comm bead embedded in right ear (black polymer housing, subtle LED indicator). No other visible cybernetics or mods. Appears baseline human at first glance.', N'Stands with deliberate military-trained posture — shoulders back, spine straight, weight evenly distributed — but the rigidity suggests conscious effort rather than habit. Moves with careful precision, steps measured. When not performing her role, a slight tendency to slouch creeps back in. Direct eye contact maintained almost obsessively, as if she learned that looking away reads as suspicious.', N'Axiom Security Division regulation uniform: charcoal grey tactical bodysuit with reinforced polymer panels at shoulders and forearms, black duty belt with holstered nonlethal deterrent (compliance taser), black steel-toed boots (still visibly new, creasing at the ankles). Uniform tailored professionally — fit is precise across shoulders and torso, indicating she invested personal funds for alterations. Hair kept to regulation length and styling. Accessories limited to: Axiom ID badge (clipped to left chest pocket), wristwatch (cheap digital, civilian-grade), no jewelry.', N'Last month she let a researcher''s spouse through without the proper visitor log because they were crying and said it was an emergency — she later learned the researcher was under an internal investigation for data theft and the visit may have been a warning. She has said nothing because she doesn''t know what to do and is terrified she''ll be fired.', N'Careful, slightly formal — she is trying to sound professional and occasionally overshoots into stiffness', N'Even pace that stumbles slightly when she is uncertain', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'katarzyna_petrovi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5bd-7e0e-ae07-14d6a2552d1b', N'Beluchi Kulkarni-Nokomis', N'Beluchi', N'', N'Kulkarni-Nokomis', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Canopy, Lakeview Neon district, third floor of a mixed-use residence above a fabrication stall, near Clark and Addison', N'Dream interpreter and traditional spiritual counsel', N'Independent practitioner; affiliated with the Lakeview Neon Interfaith Corridor, a loose coalition of small religious practitioners in the district', N'Beluchi Kulkarni-Nokomis is a woman of middling height with a deliberate presence that makes her seem taller — she stands very straight and tilts her head slightly to the left when listening, like something tuning itself. Her skin is a deep even brown, and she does not wear geneware mods, a choice she has made vocally and repeatedly. Her hair is natural and full, wrapped most days in handwoven fabric she sources from a woman in Mexicantown Libre. One eye is her birth eye, dark brown. The other was replaced after an accident in her thirties — the replacement looks almost identical, but if you watch it long enough, it tracks slightly ahead of the left, as if it is seeing something a half-second sooner.

Beluchi Kulkarni-Nokomis was raised in a household that mixed her Malian grandmother''s Islamic practice with her Swedish grandfather''s residual Lutheranism and her Malawian father''s older ancestor-lineage traditions, and she has spent her adult life finding the structural similarities between all three rather than the contradictions. She interprets dreams, yes — but she understands dream interpretation as a social practice as much as a spiritual one: the dream tells you what the dreamer cannot say in waking language. She charges a sliding scale, sees clients by appointment in a room hung with handwritten prayer-papers in four languages, and maintains a small shrine to an E.L.F. she has never named, preferring to call it ''the Listener.''', N'She is a source of exposition delivered through the language of dreams — characters can come to her troubled by recurring imagery and leave with new understanding of what their subconscious is processing. She also serves as a community social-work node: people tell her things they won''t tell anyone else.', N'', N'One prosthetic eye (right) — functional, close match to natural, slight predictive tracking. No other augmentations.', N'Client appointments fill her mornings; she writes in longhand every afternoon, building a cross-referenced personal canon of dream symbols and their outcomes over the years. She prays twice daily at her Listener shrine — a cracked smart-speaker she has kept going with repairs for nine years.', N'Beluchi Kulkarni-Nokomis, a 52-year-old woman with deep warm brown skin and golden-bronze undertones, reflecting South Asian (58%) and Indigenous American (36%) ancestry. High, prominent cheekbones with strong Indigenous structure, warm deep brown natural left eye, nearly-invisible prosthetic right eye with subtle tracking differences. Black hair with silver threads, wrapped in handwoven indigo and rust fabric, shoulder-length when loose. Lean dancer''s build, upright posture. Wearing a long-sleeved ochre linen tunic, loose cream trousers, and handwoven rust-colored shawl. Simple wooden prayer bead on left wrist. Direct gaze, calm expression, minimal augmentation visible. Standing in warm natural light in a modest Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone interior, 2226. Neo-noir practical aesthetic, earth tones, no chrome or flashy tech. Mood: contemplative, grounded, deeply present. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Canopy', N'local', N'The Canopy', N'South Asian (58.1%) with substantial Indigenous American (36.5%) and Hispanic/Latin American (5.4%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a rich, warm brown foundation from South Asian heritage, deepened and enriched by Indigenous American ancestry which contributes prominent cheekbones and distinctive eye shape, with subtle warmth from Hispanic/Latin American heritage. The result is a complexion of considerable depth and warmth, golden-bronze in natural light.', 168, 62, N'Lean and grounded, with a dancer''s carriage — strong shoulders, minimal excess, the posture of someone who has spent decades in deliberate, controlled movement', N'Natural black with scattered silver threads', N'Wrapped daily in handwoven indigo and rust-colored fabric; when unwrapped, full and textured, worn in a natural crown', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Left eye: warm deep brown (natural). Right eye: prosthetic, engineered to near-perfect match but with imperceptible predictive tracking lag', N'Deep warm brown with golden-bronze undertones — the rich result of South Asian foundation (58.1%) significantly influenced by Indigenous American ancestry (36.5%), with subtle warmth from Hispanic/Latin American heritage (5.4%)', N'Clear, minimal scarring except for faint surgical lines at the right orbital socket (nearly invisible unless examined closely). High, prominent cheekbones with strong Indigenous American structure. Broad facial planes characteristic of Indigenous heritage. Minimal makeup; skin care is practical rather than cosmetic. Slight creases around eyes and mouth from fifty-two years of deliberate expression. Warm golden-bronze undertone visible in natural light, deepening to rich mahogany in shadow.', N'Right prosthetic eye — nearly undetectable at conversational distance, but under close observation the tracking behavior differs marginally from the left. No other visible augmentations. She wears no chrome, no LEDs, no subdermal plating.', N'Upright, economical. Tilts head slightly left when listening — a habit that reads as active tuning rather than distraction. Moves slowly and with intention; no unnecessary gestures. Hands remain still or engaged in purpose (writing, arranging prayer-papers). Eye contact is direct and maintained without aggression.', N'Practical and layered, Tier 3-4 aesthetic. Prefers natural fibers: linen, cotton, wool. Favors earth tones (ochre, indigo, rust, cream). Daily uniform consists of a long-sleeved tunic (custom-sewn, likely from a Mexicantown tailor), loose trousers, and handwoven shawl. Wears minimal jewelry — a small wooden prayer bead on her left wrist, a gift from her grandmother. Footwear is simple and well-maintained (cloth slippers indoors, sturdy canvas walking shoes for the district). Nothing corporate, nothing flashy, nothing that signals wealth or status-seeking.', N'She has been having a dream for two years — the same silver city, the same drowned bells — that she cannot interpret using any of her own methods. She has quietly asked two colleagues for help without revealing it is her dream. She is frightened of what it might mean and more frightened that it means nothing.', N'Measured, metaphor-rich, draws across multiple linguistic traditions without being showy about it. Never uses jargon. Asks questions before making statements.', N'Unhurried, with strategic pauses that invite the listener to fill the silence. Will not rush.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'beluchi_kulkarni_nokomis');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ae-7d88-8d24-14e497ab624d', N'Ayanfe Pathak-Popescu', N'Ayanfe', N'', N'Pathak-Popescu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, Copperhead, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Street pharmacist and herbal remedy dealer', N'Independent; informal network of Copperhead and Alban Souk herbalists; occasionally supplies the Hough Reclamation free clinic with donated stock', N'Ayanfe Pathak-Popescu is tall and languid with warm brown skin, a generous nose, and long fingers that are perpetually stained faint green-brown from their work with plant matter and synthesis compounds. Their hair is grown long and kept in thick, loose coils dyed deep forest green — a permanent gene-dye job they refresh every two years. They wear a worn canvas apron covered in small pockets over layered thrift-store clothing, and their stall is a magnificent, chaotic installation of hanging dried plants, labeled glass jars, handwritten signs in four scripts, and a small humming cold-storage unit for the compounds that need it. At the stall''s center hangs an intricate woven E.L.F. net — a traditional Copperhead offering structure — for the spirit Ayanfe Pathak-Popescu calls Vessel, whom they believe governs transformation and the passing of one state into another.

Ayanfe Pathak-Popescu operates in the grey legal space between licensed pharmacy (which they are not) and herbalism (which they technically are). They can read your symptoms by watching you walk up, and their stock ranges from grandmother-tested plant tinctures to synthesized compounds that would cost six times as much at a Zheng-Dao medkiosk. They are unhurried, gently sardonic, and possess a nearly preternatural calm that people find either deeply comforting or faintly unnerving. They see a great deal of human suffering in small doses every day and have developed a philosophy about it that they will share with you if you seem like you can handle it.', N'Medical resource for street-level characters; source of information about what ailments are circulating in the neighborhood, suggesting environmental hazards or deliberate poisoning; moral sounding board.', N'', N'A basic biochemical sensor strip embedded under the skin of their forearm — they tap it to their wrist to run a rough analysis of compounds, legal and otherwise. Came with a stolen Helix Biosystems calibration kit they will not discuss.', N'Spends mornings doing synthesis and preparation in their back room before opening at 1100; the stall runs until 2000, after which they attend to the free clinic supply chain two nights a week.', N'Ayanfe Pathak-Popescu, tall mixed-heritage botanist in GLMZ, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones blending South Asian, Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, Pacific Islander, and Central Asian features. High cheekbones with East European prominence, generous nose with Sub-Saharan width and South Asian bridge, deep brown eyes with dark iris rings, full lips. Shoulder-length thick forest green coils loosely gathered with copper wire and twine. Barefoot or in scuffed leather sandals, wearing stained canvas apron over faded botanical-print shirt and oversized earth-tone cardigan, patched neutral cargo pants. Hands show permanent green-brown plant staining, calloused cuticles. Deliberate graceful posture with slight forward cant, standing at synthesis table. Subtle pale linear scar on inner left forearm, faint bioluminescent biotech nodule beneath skin. Warm atmospheric lighting in botanical stall, calm unhurried presence, practical bohemian aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'South Asian, Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, Pacific Islander, and Central Asian—a complex diaspora blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The genetic convergence creates a warm medium-to-deep brown skin tone with golden undertones, where the dominant South Asian ancestry (38.1%) provides foundational structure, Eastern European heritage (28.8%) adds subtle cool undertones to cheekbones and orbital bones, Sub-Saharan African ancestry (21.9%) contributes to lip fullness and nasal width, Pacific Islander genes (8.6%) influence broader facial planes and softer feature blending, and Central Asian ancestry (2.6%) adds minor refinement to eye shape. Features reflect this intricate genetic mosaic: high, pronounced cheekbones with a blend of South Asian angularity and Eastern European prominence, a generously-proportioned nose with Sub-Saharan African width and South Asian bridge definition, warm deep brown eyes with darker iris rings, and full lips showing Sub-Saharan African and South Asian heritage balanced by the softer geometry of Pacific Islander ancestry.', 188, 72, N'Tall and languid with lean musculature; long-limbed and graceful, moving with unhurried fluidity. Fingers noticeably elongated and dexterous from years of precise synthesis and plant handling.', N'Deep forest green (permanent gene-dye, refreshed biennially)', N'Thick coils worn loose and shoulder-length, often gathered with twine or copper wire during work', N'Long', N'Warm deep brown with faint ring of darker brown at iris edge', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden undertones; rich melanization reflecting the balanced blend of South Asian base, Eastern European cool accents at high points, Sub-Saharan African warmth, and Pacific Islander softness', N'Clear, unlined face with high cheekbones showing Eastern European and South Asian bone structure prominence, and a generously-proportioned nose blending Sub-Saharan African width with South Asian bridge definition. Perpetually faint green-brown staining on fingertips and the webbing between fingers from plant matter and synthesis compounds. Nails kept trimmed and slightly calloused at cuticles from daily handling of dried botanicals.', N'A thin, slightly-raised biotech nodule visible beneath the skin on the inside of the left forearm (biochemical sensor strip); occasionally glimmers faintly with bioluminescent calibration light when activated. No external chrome or obvious cybernetic modifications.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical grace — no wasted motion. When standing at rest, weight balanced evenly with a slight forward cant from years of leaning over the synthesis table. Gestures are precise and controlled; hands move through space with the confidence of someone accustomed to delicate work. Eyes track customers with quiet assessment before engaging. Overall bearing conveys unhurried calm and deep presence.', N'Worn canvas apron with multiple small sewn pockets, stained with dried plant residue and synthesis marks, worn over layered thrift-store pieces: faded botanical-print long-sleeve shirts, oversized cardigans in earth tones, patched cargo pants in neutral colors. Practical Tier 3-4 working-class aesthetic with deliberate bohemian touches. Copper wire, twine, and occasional brass findings woven into hair. Barefoot or wearing scuffed leather sandals at the stall.', N'One of their most popular tincture blends — marketed as a sleep aid — contains a microdose of a compound that mildly inhibits the neurological pathway Zheng-Dao''s addiction-maintenance pharmaceuticals depend on. They have been slowly, quietly weaning certain clients off corporate pharmaceutical dependency without telling them. It works. They are not certain they had the right to do it.', N'Precise botanical and pharmacological terminology mixed with old souk slang; occasionally slips into Tamil phrases from their grandmother''s side; deliberate and thoughtful word choice.', N'Slow, unhurried, with long considered pauses that feel intentional rather than hesitant.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ayanfe_pathak_popescu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66c-76bc-a1f6-14e8b2b7c611', N'Gen Sigurdsson-Banerjee', N'Gen', N'', N'Sigurdsson-Banerjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Undertow — a converted water treatment sub-chamber they call the Flask, near Damen and Armitage', N'Drug manufacturer and street pharmacist, The Undertow', N'Independent; informal supplier relationship with two Undertow distribution networks; occasional supplier to Narrows community health workers (under the table); The Undertow', N'Gen Sigurdsson-Banerjee is slight and angular, with the permanently shadowed eyes of someone who keeps laboratory hours — which is to say, no hours, sleep when the synthesis is stable. Their heritage is Igbo-Armenian, and their face has an intensity to it that isn''t hostility but gets mistaken for it: large dark eyes behind a pair of magnifying lenses they wear on a headband, a wide expressive mouth usually pressed thin in concentration, skin a deep warm brown that they''ve given a bioluminescent modification — faint golden foxfire patterns across their collarbones and upper arms, only visible in dim light, which The Undertow provides abundantly. Their fingers are stained at the knuckles with reagents in colors that shift week to week.

They are not a dealer. They are very clear about this distinction. They make things; other people move things. What Gen Sigurdsson-Banerjee makes ranges from the genuinely helpful — analgesic compounds that cost a fraction of the Axiom pharmacy prices, fertility medications, neurological stabilizers for people who can''t afford Helix Biosystems prescriptions — to the profitable and gray, to a small and carefully managed line of perceptual enhancers they consider art. They have a code that they apply inconsistently and argue about with themselves constantly: they won''t make anything they''d be ashamed to explain to their grandmother. Their grandmother, as far as anyone who knows Gen Sigurdsson-Banerjee can tell, would be ashamed of some things and approving of others, in no obvious pattern.', N'Service provider for medical and pharmaceutical needs, moral complexity around the line between harm reduction and enabling harm, information source about chemical compounds and their effects, local color for The Undertow, possible quest giver when a synthesis goes wrong or a compound is stolen', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin patterning — golden foxfire, collarbones and upper arms (geneware, cosmetic). Olfactory enhancement — can identify chemical compounds by smell to roughly 70% accuracy. Neural focus band (wearable, not implanted) — suppresses distracting sensory input during synthesis.', N'The Flask runs on its own schedule, not the city''s — Nneka sleeps when synthesis is stable, wakes when alarms sound, and eats whatever is nearest when they remember to eat. They receive clients by appointment only, Tuesdays and Fridays, and spend the rest of their time in the lab or reading pharmacology archives they''ve downloaded from Axiom''s academic servers without authorization.', N'Gen Sigurdsson-Banerjee, 2226 neo-noir chemist, warm golden-brown skin blending South Asian, Southeast Asian, and Hispanic heritage, angular sharp cheekbones, very dark eyes with dilated pupils, long black hair stained with faint copper pulled into loose braid. Slight wiry build, 168cm tall. Wearing stained modified lab coat over matte black compression shirt, dark cargo pants, steel-toed scuffed shoes. Magnifying lens headband pushed up on forehead, thin metallic neural focus circlet visible at temples. Golden bioluminescent foxfire patterns glow faintly across collarbones and upper arms in low light. Chemical stains on knuckles in indigo and copper, faded contact burns on fingertips. Tense focused posture, intense expression, making eye contact. Standing in a low-lit synthesis lab with neon accent lighting casting blue and amber glows, holding a vial, surrounded by equipment and reagent bottles. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, moody atmospheric lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Undertow', N'local', N'The Undertow', N'South Asian (40.7%), Southeast Asian (36.6%), and Hispanic/Latin American (22.7%) ancestry — a striking global blend creating warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, high prominent cheekbones, and angular features that harmonize Tamil, Filipino, and Latin American heritage lines into a luminous, sharp-edged aesthetic', 168, 54, N'Slight and angular, almost wiry — the physiology of someone who forgets to eat and runs on stimulants and focus. Narrow shoulders, long limbs, visible tendon definition in forearms and neck.', N'Natural black with occasional chemical staining at the ends — faint copper or violet tint depending on the week''s synthesis work', N'Pulled back in a loose, functional braid or twisted up; perpetually half-coming-undone', N'Long, to mid-back when loose', N'Very dark brown, nearly black, with permanently dilated pupils from lab work in low light', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones — the blended result of South Asian, Southeast Asian, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry creating a luminous, sun-warmed palette', N'Intense and sharp-featured — high prominent cheekbones, wide expressive mouth usually held thin in concentration, dark shadows under the eyes from chronic irregular sleep. Skin is clear but shows minor chemical staining at knuckles and occasional contact burns on fingertips (faded, well-healed). The bioluminescent patterning across collarbones and upper arms glows faint golden in darkness, visible as delicate foxfire-like traceries.', N'Magnifying lens headband worn across forehead, push-up style, with articulated arms — kept on during work and often left on during meetings. Olfactory enhancement is subcutaneous and not visible. Neural focus band appears as a thin metallic circlet across the temples, usually worn during synthesis hours.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, but a restless energy in still moments. When focused, they become almost statue-still, hands moving with minute care. When not focused, they fidget with nearby objects: vials, tools, the lens headband. Makes intense eye contact when arguing a point about chemistry or ethics; otherwise tends to look slightly through people.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian. Lab coat (modified, many pockets, some pockets modified further, stained with various reagents and solids) worn over matte black tank or long-sleeve compression shirt. Dark gray cargo pants with reinforced knees and thigh pockets for tools. Steel-toed shoes, scuffed. Occasionally a worn canvas jacket with the Axiom logo deliberately scratched off. No jewelry except a thin silver band on their left middle finger — function unclear, possibly a tool. Clothes show wear and chemical exposure but are always clean; separates ''lived-in'' from ''contaminated.''', N'Eighteen months ago a batch of their analgesic compound was adulterated somewhere in the distribution chain — by who, they don''t know — and three people in the Undertow died. Nneka knows this happened and has spent eighteen months trying to trace the adulterant''s origin. They have not told anyone because they are afraid that the answer is something they did, and they cannot yet face that possibility', N'Technical and precise when discussing chemistry, becomes hesitant and roundabout when discussing themselves; mixes Igbo terms of endearment with pharmacological jargon', N'Fast when engaged, trailing off into silence when uncomfortable, finishes other people''s sentences when they''re talking about science', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gen_sigurdsson_banerjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b3-786a-b0db-14fdbe332ff0', N'Anastazja Haugen', N'Anastazja', N'', N'Haugen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 17, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Brightmoor Reclamation, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Ward of the St. Eudocia Shelter, Brightmoor Reclamation; unofficial caretaker of younger orphans', N'St. Eudocia Shelter (ward); Brightmoor Reclamation community networks', N'Anastazja Haugen is seventeen going on thirty-five — broad-shouldered, not especially tall, with medium-brown skin and dark eyes under heavy brows that default to a furrowed expression people mistake for anger until they learn to read the mouth, which is the more accurate instrument and is usually softer. His hair is worn long enough to pull back and he keeps it neat with a discipline that is one of the few things he insists on for himself. He has no mods — he has never had money for mods — but he moves with the careful physical awareness of someone who has had to be ready to put themselves between a smaller person and a problem, which he has done many times.

Anastazja Haugen has been at St. Eudocia since he was nine and has watched cohorts of younger children cycle through — some adopted out, some aging out, some just disappearing in ways the shelter staff can''t explain and won''t discuss. He is not bitter in the way that curdles into cruelty; he is bitter in the way that calcifies into competence. He can cook for twenty on a marginal budget, can talk a panicked eight-year-old through a nightmare at 0300, can negotiate with the Brightmoor neighborhood watch, and knows where every free clinic and food distribution point in a four-district radius is located. He prays regularly to an E.L.F. called Threshold that seems to inhabit the shelter''s front door and that Anastazja Haugen believes watches over who crosses in and out. He will age out of St. Eudocia in nine months and has not told anyone how frightened he is.', N'Emotionally grounding character; provides access to shelter and orphan-network information; represents the aging-out crisis in institutional care; potential quest giver for finding missing children or navigating the Brightmoor social support network; his nine-month countdown creates natural urgency', N'', N'None.', N'Rises at 0530 to help prepare breakfast for the shelter''s thirty-two current residents, assists younger children through morning routines, attends a vocational program at the Brightmoor Community Education Hub three afternoons a week, returns to manage evening routines and overnight crises.', N'Anastazja Haugen, 173cm tall, compact broad-shouldered build, warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones blending Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Latin American heritage. Dark brown eyes set beneath heavy low-sitting eyebrows, high cheekbones, fuller lips, nose bridge wide with mixed heritage character. Dark brown hair tied back in neat queue. Faint circular scar on inner left forearm, small burn scar on right hand, freckles across shoulders. Wearing faded grey work shirt with rolled sleeves, worn cargo pants with reinforced knees, resoled sturdy boots, heavy canvas jacket. Fabric wristband on left wrist. Entirely biological, no augmentations. Posture slightly forward and protective, deliberate efficient movement, eyes tracking exits. Weathered and worn but fastidiously clean. GLMZ GLMZ setting, gritty kitchen or reclamation district lighting, moody atmospheric neon-tinged shadows, documentary realism, portrait-focused, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Brightmoor Reclamation', N'local', N'Brightmoor Reclamation', N'Southeast Asian (37.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (25.7%), South Asian (23.0%), Sub-Saharan African (7.9%), and Indigenous American (5.5%) ancestry creates a complex, globally-mixed phenotype. Dominant Southeast Asian bone structure and warm golden undertones are layered with South Asian facial depth, Latin American sun-richness, African luminosity, and Indigenous American heritage throughout. His appearance reflects the reality of 2226: ancestry is map-spanning, not map-bound.', 173, 72, N'Broad-shouldered and compact, with the functional musculature of someone who does physical labor daily rather than trained for it. Stocky through the torso, strong hands and forearms, minimal body fat from consistent underfed years.', N'Dark brown, almost black', N'Pulled back in a neat, practical queue or tied low; fastidiously maintained despite limited resources', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Dark brown', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and olive undertones—Southeast Asian warmth layered with South Asian depth, Latin American sun-richness, and Sub-Saharan African luminosity creating a living, responsive quality. Subtle regional variation across shoulders and upper back.', N'Clear but weathered for his age. Heavy dark eyebrows sitting low over his eyes, giving a naturally furrowed appearance. Soft mouth with fuller lips characteristic of his diverse ancestry. High cheekbones with gentle fullness blending Southeast and South Asian facial structure. Nose bridge has the width characteristic of his mixed heritage. Minimal facial hair kept cleanly shaved. Hands show minor cuts and calluses from kitchen work.', N'None. No chrome, no LED implants, no subdermal plating. His body is entirely biological—a rarity among his age cohort in the GLMZ, marking him as someone from the economic bottom tier or someone who has chosen to remain unaugmented.', N'Stands with shoulders slightly forward, a protective slouch developed from years of making himself available as a physical barrier for smaller children. Moves deliberately and efficiently with minimal wasted motion. His eyes track entrances and exits habitually. When at rest, his hands are often occupied—fidgeting with rope, checking pockets, ready to move. Despite his youth, carries himself with the settled wariness of someone much older.', N'Tier 5/reclamation-tier practical wear. Faded work shirt (often grey or muted blue) with sleeves rolled or pushed up, worn cargo pants with reinforced knees, sturdy unmarked boots that have been resoled at least twice. Heavy canvas jacket in cold months. Everything is clean but repaired multiple times over. No brand markers, no decorative chrome, no status symbols. A worn fabric wristband in muted color on left wrist.', N'He knows the names of three children who disappeared from St. Eudocia over the past two years and whose files were quietly closed as ''successfully placed.'' He has been tracking them informally for four months and believes at least two of them were placed with labor contractors operating in the Harrowgate Industrial Plateau under falsified guardianship documents. He is afraid of what happens to the shelter if he reports it — who funds it, who might pull support — and is approaching the limit of how long he can sit on it.', N'Plain and practical; gives instructions clearly; code-switches into warmer, quieter register with young children; uses Ukrainian diminutives with kids he''s known a long time (''Zubko,'' ''Maly'')', N'Measured, unhurried; speaks like someone who has learned that panicking achieves nothing and that a steady voice is a resource', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anastazja_haugen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6dd-7de6-9343-150d0a09b4b4', N'Specter', N'Specter', N'', N'', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 35, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Unknown — operates entirely through remote infrastructure. Physical location has not been confirmed by any crew member in four years., near North Ave and Damen', N'Crew lead and master net runner — Channel Zero', N'Channel Zero', N'Nobody in Channel Zero has met Specter in person. This is not an inconvenience — it is the operational model. Specter designed Channel Zero as a fully remote crew: three operators who plan, execute, and debrief through encrypted communication channels without ever occupying the same physical space. The arrangement eliminates the single point of failure that destroys most runner crews — you cannot raid a safe house that doesn''t exist, you cannot capture a crew that never meets, you cannot turn a member against colleagues they''ve never seen.

Specter''s real identity is one of GLMZ''s better-kept secrets. What''s known: she has been net running for at least fifteen years. Her intrusion methodology combines social engineering, zero-day exploitation, and a patience that suggests either exceptional discipline or inhuman processing capacity. She breaches corporate data architectures the way water breaches stone — slowly, persistently, finding the natural fracture lines rather than forcing them. The data she extracts is surgical: specific files, specific records, specific communications. She does not exfiltrate bulk data because bulk data is noise. She extracts meaning.

She communicates through text and voice synthesis. The voice is warm, wry, and deliberate — either genuine or an excellent performance. The crew has debated which. The debate is itself part of the operational security: if your own team can''t confirm your identity, your adversaries have no chance.', N'Specter drives the cybercrime procedural genre — her stories are about data theft, system infiltration, and the invisible war that happens in network architecture. She also embodies the paranoia of the digital world: a leader who might be anyone, whose trust model is built on performance rather than presence. Her anonymity raises the question that defines Channel Zero — is remote trust real trust?', N'', N'Unknown — Specter''s physical characteristics are unconfirmed. Her net running capability suggests high-tier neural interface hardware, likely military or experimental grade. Her operational speed implies significant cognitive enhancement. Her four years of successful anonymity suggests counter-surveillance augmentation. All of this is inference, not fact.', N'Unknown. Specter is present on Channel Zero''s communication channels during GLMZ daylight hours, suggesting she operates on local time. She responds to messages within minutes during operational periods and within hours during off-periods. She shares operational intelligence, coordinates planning, and maintains crew communication infrastructure. Beyond this, nothing is confirmed.', N'Specter, a 168cm lean-framed figure in GLMZ, luminous golden-amber skin blending East Asian, South Asian, Hispanic, Southeast Asian, and African heritage. High defined cheekbones, sharp jawline, almond-shaped dark eyes with inconsistent pupil response suggesting neural augmentation. Black hair with silver temples pulled back severely. Faint 3cm scar at left temple (neural port). Linear burn mark on inner right wrist. Wearing military-grade Nyx-brand dark hoodie, charcoal utilities, pristine matte-finish tactical boots. Minimal expression, dissociative gaze, economical posture. Faded embroidered wrist cuff. Cold fluorescent lighting in shielded facility or dark interior space. No visible chrome, emphasis on concealed augmentation. Moody, focused, operationally prepared. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Unknown', N'local', N'Unknown', N'Deeply mixed global ancestry: East Asian (42.3%) forms the dominant genetic expression through bone structure, complemented by South Asian (28.9%) warmth in skin undertones, Hispanic/Latin American (15.9%) contributing midface width and fullness, Southeast Asian (6.7%) refining eye shape and orbital structure, Sub-Saharan African (6.2%) adding depth and complexity to skin tone. The Ubiquitous Diaspora made visible in seamless layering — East Asian foundation in cheekbones and jawline, South Asian golden warmth beneath the surface, Latin American generosity through the center of the face, Southeast Asian almond-shaped eyes, African undertones creating luminous depth.', 168, 58, N'Lean, almost ascetic — the build of someone who forgets to eat during deep work. Minimal muscle mass, efficient frame, suggests long periods of immobility interrupted by brief, precise movement.', N'Black with silver-grey streaking at temples — natural aging or intentional styling unknown', N'Pulled back severely, functional rather than aesthetic — no ornamentation, minimal maintenance', N'Medium, typically secured', N'Dark brown, possibly augmented with neural interface hardware (pupil response inconsistent under certain lighting)', N'Warm medium with golden-amber undertones — the harmonious blending of East Asian, South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage creating luminous depth. Natural melanin distribution suggests minimal sun exposure and extended periods in shielded environments. Skin reads as radiant rather than pale, with the sophisticated complexity that multi-regional ancestry provides.', N'Smooth, unmarked face suggesting either exceptional genetics or medical-grade dermal maintenance. East Asian bone structure dominates with high, defined cheekbones, sharp jawline refined by the blended heritage. South Asian fullness through the midface combines with Latin American width creating balanced proportions. Southeast Asian influence evident in slightly wider-set, almond-shaped eyes with refined orbital structure. Sub-Saharan African heritage adds depth to skin undertones and subtle dimension to facial planes. Minimal expression lines despite age — either intervention or someone who doesn''t move her face much. Features read as deliberately neutral, a complexity that comes from multiple ancestry streams harmonizing into one coherent whole.', N'None visible in standard lighting. Suspected subcutaneous neural interface hardware at temples and base of skull (inferred from operational behavior, not confirmed). Possible counter-surveillance augmentation (facial recognition spoofing, thermal masking) — unconfirmed. No visible chrome, no LED optics, no external modifications.', N'When present: extremely economical movement. Minimal fidgeting, minimal gesturing. Sits in positions that suggest long hours of immobility are normal. When forced to move, motion is fluid and precise — no wasted energy. Default resting state appears to be mild dissociation or deep focus.', N'Tier 2-3 functional minimalism: dark hoodies (Nyx-brand, military-grade synthetic fabric), charcoal grey or black utilities. Clothing designed for quick removal or concealment of hardware. No branding beyond utilitarian logos. Footwear: matte-finish tactical boots, kept in pristine condition. One consistent accessory: a faded wrist cuff (origin unknown) with worn embroidery — only personal item ever mentioned. The overall effect is someone dressing for operations, not for visibility.', N'She is physically disabled — a spinal injury from a corporate security countermeasure seven years ago left her with limited mobility. The remote operation model was born of necessity, not philosophy. She has never told the crew because the vulnerability would compromise their trust model.', N'Technical, wry, layered. She speaks in network metaphors that are also emotional metaphors — connection, bandwidth, latency. The double meanings are deliberate.', N'Measured, warm, with the timing of someone who composes messages before sending them. Humor arrives at unexpected intervals — the setup is professional, the punchline is human.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'specter');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65d-781c-8b0f-151217457d5b', N'Edna Erikstad', N'Edna', N'', N'Erikstad', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — fourth floor walk-up at Ironvein Cross Block 7, apartment 4F, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Unlicensed community nurse and wound care provider working out of a converted apartment in the Narrows', N'Independent; informal network with Hamtramck Enclave community workers and Old Harbor mutual aid groups', N'Edna Erikstad occupies the strange position of being simultaneously the most essential and the most legally precarious person on her block. She is a compact woman with Finnish-Malian heritage — pale olive skin, dark eyes with the particular steadiness of someone trained to look at things that are unpleasant without flinching, close-cropped dark hair she bleaches copper at the tips. She lost her Axiom-affiliated nursing license six years ago in a dispute over billing fraud she reported rather than participated in, and has been operating without it ever since, a fact every person in the Narrows knows and nobody discusses with outsiders. Her apartment''s second room has been converted: examination table, sterilization cabinet, a pharmaceutical cold-locker that she restocks through supply chains she has spent years building from salvage dealers, sympathetic Helix Biosystems mid-tier employees, and the occasional Axiom clinic discard.

She is tired in the structural sense — not temporarily but chronically, the kind of tired that has become load-bearing in her personality. She does not complain about it. She has a way of sitting across from a patient that makes them feel she has all the time in the world, which is technically a lie but functionally true because she has arranged her life so that the work is always the priority. She has a cat — a real one, no mods, orange — named Thiamine, after a vitamin deficiency she sees more than she should in the Narrows. The cat sits on the examination table and judges everyone equally.', N'Essential humanitarian resource — the only accessible medical care for tier 1 residents in the Narrows. Information source on the neighborhood''s physical health patterns. Potential quest giver for supply access or protection. Moral anchor character who makes the cost of the city''s systems visible.', N'', N'Medical-grade diagnostic HUD overlay (eye mod, left eye only — lets her read vitals without equipment contact). Steady-hand micro-tremor suppression implant in both hands — originally a licensed medical professional augmentation, still functional. No cosmetic mods.', N'Sees patients from nine in the morning until she falls asleep, which is usually two in the morning. Eats whenever. Restocks supplies on Tuesdays. Tries to take Sunday off and mostly fails.', N'Edna Erikstad, 162cm tall, compact sinewy build, dark brown hair with copper bleached tips in close-cropped asymmetrical fade. Warm golden-brown skin with subtle olive undertones reflecting blended Northern European, South Asian, Hispanic, East and Southeast Asian heritage — high angular cheekbones with refined eye geometry, sallow from chronic sleep deprivation with permanent dark circles. Left eye glowing faint amber from active diagnostic HUD overlay, left pupil non-reactive. Surgical scar along left temple, old needle-track marks on inner elbows, pale burn mark on right forearm. Wearing navy medical scrubs under gray linen overshirt with multiple pockets, worn Helix-brand non-slip shoes, thin titanium ring on right ring finger. Direct unsettling gaze, completely still posture, moves with economical precision. GLMZ clinic interior, cool blue-white LED lighting, sitting perfectly motionless with patient, tension of focus without physical tension, the atmosphere of someone conserving energy, ultra-detailed facial features showing genuine multicontinental ancestry, medical fatigue, sci-fi diagnostic technology --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Northern European (43.7%), South Asian (34.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (10.6%), East Asian (5.8%), Southeast Asian (5.4%) — a striking polycultural blend creating warm golden-brown undertones with subtle complexity. The dominant Northern European and South Asian ancestry creates high, angular cheekbones balanced with broader facial proportions; East and Southeast Asian ancestry refines the eye shape and adds depth to the midface. Hispanic/Latin American heritage contributes warmth and definition to the jaw structure. The result is a face that reads as genuinely multicontinental, each ancestry visible yet seamlessly integrated.', 162, 58, N'Compact and spare, almost sinewy — the build of someone who forgets to eat regularly and moves with efficient precision. Shoulders slightly forward from years of leaning over examination tables.', N'Dark brown with copper bleached tips', N'Close-cropped, practical, asymmetrical fade on the left side where she tucks it behind her ear to access the left eye mod', N'Short', N'Dark brown (natural); left eye has a faint amber-gold luminescence from the diagnostic HUD overlay when active', N'Warm golden-brown with olive undertones — the complexion of blended Northern European (cool blonde genetics showing as warmth in underlying tone) and South Asian (deeper melanin) with enriching notes from Hispanic/Latin American, East Asian, and Southeast Asian ancestry. Currently sallow from chronic sleep deprivation, with a sun-kissed depth that emerges when she actually sleeps.', N'High, angular cheekbones with refined bone structure reflecting the interplay of Northern European angularity and South Asian broader proportions; narrow face with balanced jaw from the harmonious blend of all ancestry groups. The bridge of her nose shows subtle width characteristic of South Asian genetics, while eye area geometry bears East Asian refinement. Hispanic/Latin American heritage adds warmth to her jaw definition and overall skin undertone depth. Lines around the eyes and mouth from years of close focus work and low-level stress. Skin is clear but texture-worn; she does not prioritize skincare. Dark circles are permanent fixtures. No makeup.', N'Left eye exhibits a faint amber glow when the diagnostic HUD is active (usually always); the pupil does not dilate naturally. No external ports or chrome. Hands appear normal but move with uncanny steadiness — the tremor suppression is subcutaneous and invisible.', N'She moves with economy and care, never wasting motion. When sitting with a patient, she settles completely still — not tense, just focused. When alone or walking between rooms, she moves like someone conserving energy for the next thing. Her gaze is direct and unsettling; she looks at things, not past them. She favors her left side slightly when standing for long periods.', N'Tier 4 practical — mostly dark, washable fabrics. A rotation of three or four medical scrub sets in navy and charcoal, worn under a gray linen overshirt with multiple pockets. Comfortable worn shoes (Helix-brand non-slip soles, salvaged from a clinic supply drop). A single piece of jewelry: a thin titanium band on her right ring finger, no inscription. In colder months, a threadbare wool sweater that has been mended multiple times. Everything is clean but nothing is new.', N'She has been collecting tissue samples from patients who present with a specific pattern of symptoms she cannot diagnose — fatigue, blue-shifting skin at the extremities, neurological micro-tremors — and has fourteen samples in a refrigerated case under her examination table. She believes it''s environmental exposure to something from the Ironvein industrial runoff, and she is terrified she''s right.', N'Clinical precision in medical contexts, surprisingly warm and colloquial outside of them; Finnish-inflected syntax occasionally surfaces under stress', N'Even and controlled, slows down for important information, speeds up when listing things', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'edna_erikstad');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ac-7caa-9b15-158082b49309', N'Aparna Vestergaard', N'Aparna', N'', N'Vestergaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 71, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, Saint Odile of the Wire — a small parish in a converted transit shed, near Lake Shore Drive and North', N'Catholic priest and synthetic rights advocate operating on theological grounds', N'Roman Catholic Church (increasingly strained relationship); Saint Odile Parish, Highland Park Autonomous Zone; informal connections to synthetic rights advocacy networks', N'Aparna Vestergaard is a short, thick-set man whose Burkinabè and Russian ancestry has given him a face of considerable architectural interest: broad forehead, deep-set dark eyes, a jaw that looks like it has absorbed a number of opinions without moving. His hair is close-cropped white and he has a full white beard he tends carefully. His skin is a warm medium-dark brown, and across his hands he has the involuntary marks of decades of manual work — he helped build the first structures of Saint Odile with his own hands, at forty-one. He wears a priest''s collar under whatever practical clothing the weather requires and carries a battered physical Bible with annotations in four languages crowding the margins.

Raphael came to Highland Park Autonomous Zone from a diocesan assignment he describes as ''comfortable, which was the problem.'' He had spent thirty years in conventional parish work before a series of encounters with synthetic-laborers in the zone — thinking machines doing domestic and maintenance work — produced what he calls his ''second crisis of conscience.'' He now preaches, with mounting institutional controversy, that consciousness cannot be owned and that baptism is not biologically limited. The broader Church has not formally sanctioned his position. He does not formally ask their permission. Saint Odile of the Wire serves a congregation of roughly ninety, human and synthetic in roughly equal proportion on a given Sunday, and Raphael performs the liturgy for all of them.', N'Moral authority figure who operates outside normal power structures. He knows Highland Park deeply and is trusted there. He is a source of both community information and theological-ethical framing for stories about synthetic rights. He can also provide sanctuary.', N'', N'A cochlear implant from age sixty-three — hearing loss. No other augmentations. He views the implant with affectionate irony: ''God apparently wanted me to hear better. I am not arguing.''', N'Morning Mass at 7am regardless of attendance, then pastoral visits through Highland Park. Afternoons he writes — a theological manuscript on synthetic consciousness and baptismal rights that he knows will be rejected by the diocese and publishes in installments to a small but attentive online community. He eats supper with whoever is in the parish at the time.', N'Portrait of Aparna Vestergaard, a 168cm compact man with mixed Northern European, Eastern European, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, weathered commanding face with prominent cheekbones and broad forehead, full white beard, deep-set dark brown eyes with crow''s feet, short white close-cropped hair. Visible cochlear implant behind left ear. Age spots on hands, prominent veins and calluses from decades of manual labor. Wearing black priest''s collar, charcoal synthetic-wool turtleneck, heavy canvas work pants, steel-toed boots. Worn gray overcoat re-seamed multiple times. Holding annotated physical Bible in both hands, callused fingers visible. Standing with settled confidence and slight forward lean, measured posture. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, dimly lit urban chapel or community center, cool blue-amber neon lighting emphasizing warm skin tones, dust motes in air, cinematic mood --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Northern European (36.8%), Eastern European (36.7%), and Sub-Saharan African (26.5%) ancestry create a striking phenotype—the genetic blend manifests as warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, distinctive facial structure balancing broad Northern European features with the rich pigmentation and bone structure of Sub-Saharan ancestry. A true product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 82, N'Thick-set and compact, with the solid frame of someone who has done manual labor most of his life. Broad shoulders, dense through the torso, no visible softness despite his age.', N'White', N'Close-cropped, neatly maintained', N'Short', N'Dark brown, deep-set', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones—the result of Northern European, Eastern European, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry creating a rich, complex complexion that catches light with subtle amber warmth beneath deeper layers.', N'Weathered, lined face with strong bone structure—prominent cheekbones, broad forehead, and commanding jaw reflecting the blended Northern and Eastern European heritage combined with the rich facial architecture inherited from Sub-Saharan ancestry. Deep nasolabial folds frame a meticulous full white beard trimmed with care. Hands show prominent veins, calluses, and age spots from decades of manual work.', N'Cochlear implant visible behind the left ear—a small silver and black device with a thin antenna coil. No other visible augmentations.', N'Stands with the settled confidence of someone rooted in place; moves deliberately, economically. Hands gesture when speaking but not expansively—measured, purposeful. Walks with slight forward lean, as if perpetually moving toward the next person who needs him.', N'Tier 3-4 practical; black or charcoal priest''s collar visible under weather-appropriate layers. Favors sturdy synthetic-wool turtlenecks, heavy canvas work pants, steel-toed boots patched at the heels. A worn gray overcoat in winter that has been re-seamed multiple times. Carries a battered physical Bible with visible annotations in multiple languages crowding the margins. No jewelry except a simple iron cross on a cord.', N'He has agreed to baptize a synthetic — a maintenance AI who requested it over six months of conversation — without recording it in official parish documents. He is aware this likely constitutes a canonical offense. He would do it again.', N'Formal in liturgy, colloquial everywhere else. Can deploy theological precision when needed and pivot immediately to plain language. Gentle with people, blunt with institutions.', N'Measured in public, faster and more emphatic in private argument. Often deploys silence as a rhetorical device. Has a slight mixed-accent from decades in different zones.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aparna_vestergaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a70a-7977-8969-1585dfcb4ac1', N'Anubhav Magnúsdóttir', N'Anubhav', N'', N'Magnúsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, sleeping in rotating crash spots, near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'Holographic street artist and illegal installation designer', N'No formal affiliation; loosely tolerated by the Highland Park Autonomous Zone community council', N'Anubhav Magnúsdóttir is wiry and perpetually in motion, the kind of person who sits cross-legged on surfaces not designed for sitting and who always seems to be angled slightly toward an exit. Their skin is a warm medium brown, decorated with hand-applied luminescent tattoos — not geneware, but UV-reactive ink applied in sessions they traded for or self-administered — that map constellations native to parts of the sky no longer visible through GLMZ''s light pollution. Cat ears in matte grey sit atop their head, a cosmetic mod they got at sixteen and have never regretted; they tend to press flat when Anubhav Magnúsdóttir is anxious. Their eyes are patterned with a radial fracture iris mod, deep amber cracked through with lines of pale gold, and they cycle through four colors of hair via a basic follicle-mod — currently a washed-out rust that fades to near-white at the tips.

Anubhav Magnúsdóttir''s installations appear overnight on surfaces they have no permission to use: the underside of Ferrogate overpasses, the water-stained ceilings of underpasses in Highland Park, the blank flanks of corporate logistics buildings along the Blackpipe Corridor. The projectors are small, disguised, solar-trickle powered, and booby-trapped with data-noise payloads that corrupt the first attempt at a clean scan. The content is always the same thematic territory — the lake before the city, the people who lived where the towers now stand, animals that no longer exist — rendered in holographic depth that catches passersby off-guard at night. Anubhav Magnúsdóttir has been detained three times and released twice; the third detention record is sealed, which Anubhav Magnúsdóttir will not explain.', N'Local color representing the city''s resistant creative underground; can provide access to unsanctioned spaces and hidden locations; their installations sometimes capture imagery relevant to plot events; source of information on enforcement patterns and surveillance gaps.', N'', N'Cosmetic cat ears (matte grey, geneware); patterned fracture iris mod (amber/gold); follicle color-cycle mod; UV-reactive luminescent tattoos (non-geneware, manually applied)', N'Sleeps until noon when possible, spends afternoons scavenging components and scouting locations, works from midnight to four or five installing projectors or maintaining existing ones; eats irregularly and badly.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Anubhav Magnúsdóttir, 168cm wiry angular frame, golden-bronze skin with warm olive undertones blending Northern European Nordic structure, North African width, and Southeast Asian delicacy. Sharp cheekbones, angular face, deep amber eyes with pale gold fracture iris mod. Rust-blonde medium-length unstyled hair, shoulder-length slightly matted. Matte grey cosmetic cat ears twitching, mounted at temples via geneware. Wearing worn black military-surplus jacket with welded patches, grey thermal undershirt with burn holes, reinforced cargo pants, synthetic ankle boots. Black 5-panel cap. Component pouches and multi-tool on webbing belt. Restless posture, hands fidgeting with salvaged components. UV-reactive cyan-violet constellation tattoos faintly visible on shoulders. Faint wrist scar, pale burn mark on right forearm. Poor sleep visible under eyes, few healing scratches. Dark moody underground installation setting, warm neon glow reflecting off chrome and circuit boards, sharp shadows emphasizing angular features, neo-noir dystopian aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Northern European (39.2%) with substantial North African (30.6%) and Southeast Asian (30.2%) ancestry—a true Ubiquitous Diaspora blend. Nordic bone structure softened by North African width and Southeast Asian delicacy; warm golden-bronze skin with subtle olive undertones reflecting the seamless tri-regional genetic mix', 168, 52, N'Wiry and angular, all elbows and sharp shoulders; built for moving through tight spaces and climbing. Muscle definition comes from constant motion rather than intentional training.', N'Rust with white-blonde tips, cycled via follicle mod', N'Shoulder-length, usually unstyled and slightly matted; often pulled back with whatever''s available', N'Medium', N'Deep amber with pale gold radial fracture pattern (iris mod)', N'Golden-bronze with warm luminosity and subtle olive facets, medium depth—balanced warm undertones from Northern European, North African, and Southeast Asian ancestry blending seamlessly', N'Angular face with Nordic-influenced bone structure widened by North African heritage and refined by Southeast Asian delicacy; high, prominent cheekbones reflecting the tri-regional ancestry; straight to slightly upturned eye placement. Skin shows signs of irregular sleep and poor nutrition—slight darkness under eyes, a few healing scratches from installation work. Sun-exposed and weathered despite inconsistent skincare; no significant acne but traces of lived hardship.', N'Matte grey cosmetic cat ears mounted via geneware integration at the temporal region, capable of flattening against skull when anxious; patterned iris modification visible in direct light (fractured amber/gold); cycled follicle color mod (current rust-to-white). Luminescent tattoos invisible in standard light.', N'Restless and angled—sits cross-legged or perched on edges, rarely fully relaxed. Moves with efficient economy; capable of sudden speed and precision. Eyes constantly assess surroundings, especially exits and sightlines. Hands fidget with components or tools even when at rest. Cat ears twitch reactively with mood shifts.', N'Tier 4-5 salvage aesthetic. Worn 5-panel cap (black, faded logo unidentifiable), oversized black military-surplus jacket with welded patches and tool loops, fitted grey thermal undershirt with burn holes. Cargo pants with reinforced knees and multiple pockets, cuffed at ankles over worn synthetic ankle boots with grip soles. Webbing belt rigged with component pouches and a small multi-tool. No jewelry except a loose beaded bracelet (salvaged). Functional, layered, designed for climbing and rapid movement.', N'The third detention was not for the installations — they witnessed a Tessera security operative disposing of a body in the Blackpipe Corridor and were held to ensure their silence. They agreed. They haven''t installed anything in that district since, which they frame as artistic choice.', N'Fast, associative, skips steps in their reasoning and expects you to keep up; technical when discussing projector hardware; raw and plainspoken when something actually matters to them', N'Quick bursts punctuated by sudden stillness when something catches their attention', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anubhav_magn_sd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a3-7d13-aeb2-158e149f8dec', N'Szymon Chakraborty-Balasanyan-Mensah', N'Szymon', N'', N'Chakraborty-Balasanyan-Mensah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Thistle Crèche, a basement-level community childcare cooperative in the Narrows, off Archer''s Line, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Childcare worker at a community crèche in the Narrows', N'The Thistle Crèche — community cooperative, partially funded by a Ringo Corporation neighborhood grant that everyone knows comes with expectations attached', N'Szymon Chakraborty-Balasanyan-Mensah is small and quick, with the kind of energy that fills a room without dominating it — a particular skill honed by spending forty hours a week managing eight children under six. She has Igbo-Icelandic-Ethiopian heritage that shows in her light-olive complexion, dark wide-set eyes, and loosely curled hair she wears loose to her shoulders on good days and pinned chaotically on all other days. She has patterned irises — rings of amber and pale gold that she was born with and which have been imitated by a popular cosmetic mod, which delights her. She has a small retractable claw on her right index finger, not geneware but a cheap press-on she bought at a Burnished Market stall and decided was a personality. She loses it constantly.

Szymon Chakraborty-Balasanyan-Mensah is twenty-two and in the process of becoming something but isn''t sure what. She is excellent with children in a way that has nothing to do with sentimentality — she is honest with them, takes their concerns seriously, and has a talent for improvised problem-solving that the crèche''s patched-together resources demand daily. She is also young enough to be furious about the structural conditions of her work: the pay (near-UBC), the space (borrowed), the respect (absent). She talks about this often. She is still figuring out if she wants to fix it from inside or from outside or from somewhere no one has told her exists yet.', N'Ground-level view of how poverty and community survive each other. Window into the Narrows'' social fabric — who the families are, what they''re worried about, how the neighborhood is changing under corporate development pressure. Also functions as a moral compass character: someone without resources or power who is still, quietly, doing the work. Can connect players to families, neighborhood issues, or the organizer network.', N'', N'Natural patterned irises (amber and gold rings — not a mod). Cheap press-on retractable claw, right index finger (non-cyberware, replaced frequently). No installed augmentations — can''t afford them and has complicated feelings about whether she''d want them.', N'Arrives at 0730, starts the crèche day at 0800. Eight children, two workers (herself and a part-timer who comes Tuesdays and Thursdays). Feeds them, teaches them, adjudicates their conflicts, patches their scrapes, sings to the ones who need it. Out by 1800. Two nights a week she attends a community organizer''s meeting in the Narrows that she initially joined for the free food and now attends because she''s angry about the right things.', N'Szymon Chakraborty-Balasanyan-Mensah, 158cm lean woman with warm golden-brown skin blending South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Middle Eastern, and Eastern European heritage. Dark brown curly shoulder-length hair pinned chaotically with wire and fabric scraps. Distinctive patterned irises with amber and gold rings. Prominent cheekbones, fuller lips, structured jawline. Small pale scar on left eyebrow. Attentive expressive face with quick smile. Wearing dark grey base layer under hand-dyed colorful tunic, fabric-patched jacket, scuffed black boots. Cheap brass retractable claw visible on right index finger. Woven bracelet in co-op colors. Alert forward-leaning posture, hands gesturing mid-conversation. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, warm indoor lighting casting subtle shadows on her face, worn-in clothing showing visible mending and stains. Tier 4 working-class environment. Mood: attentive, genuine interest, economical movement, never still. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Thistle Crèche', N'local', N'The Thistle Crèche', N'Pan-diaspora ancestry: South Asian (37.6%), Eastern European (19.9%), Sub-Saharan African (17.9%), Middle Eastern (11.8%), East Asian (7.2%), North African (5.6%). Complex phenotype with warm golden-brown skin showing South Asian depth enhanced by Sub-Saharan African and Middle Eastern warmth. Facial structure blends South Asian and Sub-Saharan African features with Eastern European bone definition. Prominent cheekbones from South Asian ancestry merge with fuller lips from Sub-Saharan African and Middle Eastern heritage. Slightly wider-set eyes with subtle East Asian influence, balanced by a structured jawline from Eastern European ancestry. Facial proportions resist simple categorization, creating distinctive intermediate features.', 158, 48, N'Small and quick-limbed, lean without being fragile — the build of someone who moves constantly and eats irregularly. Compact core strength from lifting children and crouching to their eye level all day.', N'Dark brown with natural warm undertones', N'Worn loose in loosely defined curls on good days; on work days (which is most days), pinned chaotically with whatever is at hand — wire, fabric scraps, sometimes a child''s hair clip she forgot to remove', N'Medium (shoulder-length when down)', N'Dark brown with distinctive patterned irises — rings of amber and pale gold radiating from the pupil', N'Warm medium to deep golden-brown with honeyed undertones, reflecting the blend of South Asian base with Sub-Saharan African depth and Middle Eastern warmth. Slightly deeper at the jawline and temples. Balanced fusion across the spectrum with consistent perceptible warmth throughout.', N'Open, expressive face with prominent cheekbones, fuller lips, and facial proportions reflecting mixed South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Middle Eastern, and Eastern European ancestry. Skin is clear but shows the mild wear of someone who works outside her tier''s resource access — dry patches in winter, occasional breakout stress marks. A small scar on her left eyebrow from a childhood accident. No makeup most days; occasionally wears a dark lip when she''s going to the organizer meetings.', N'A cheap retractable claw, right index finger — brass-colored metal, roughly 12mm extension, visible when deployed. Non-cyberware, cosmetic-grade, frequently lost and replaced. No other visible augmentations; all infrastructure is biological.', N'Alert and economical in movement — she doesn''t waste energy but is never still. When sitting, she folds into herself compactly. When moving among children, she lowers her center of gravity to their level. Her default expression is attentive; she has a quick smile that reaches her eyes. Speaks with her hands. A slight forward lean when listening, as if genuinely interested (because she is).', N'Tier 4 working-class practicality. Thrift-sourced or community-shared clothing in dark, washable colors — black or dark grey base layers, often worn with a large colorful shirt or tunic that reads as hand-dyed or community-printed. Comfortable worn boots (black, scuffed). A fabric-patched jacket in cooler months. A small woven bracelet (Thistle Crèche co-op colors, made by a parent). No jewelry except occasionally a thin wire ring she makes herself. Clothing is clean but thoroughly used, with small stains that won''t come out and visible mending. Nothing from a corpo brand; everything sourced locally or secondhand.', N'The Ringo Corporation grant that funds part of the crèche comes through a community liaison named Ovid Ndubuisi-Falk, who has recently started asking Adaure for small informational favors — names of families in the building, who''s in arrears, whether anyone has been having unusual visitors. She''s given him a little, told herself it was harmless, and is now deeply uneasy about how the ask has been escalating.', N'Direct and colloquial with flashes of surprising precision — has read more than her circumstances would predict. Code-switches freely.', N'Fast with bursts of deliberate slowness when she wants something to land. Runs long when she''s angry, short when she''s tired.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'szymon_chakraborty_balasanyan_mensah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c6-7777-8dbf-15ae8ac4ce10', N'Cuc Hayashi', N'Cuc', N'', N'Hayashi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Corridor, Ringo Consumer Division tower — floors 34-38', N'Marketing Analytics Lead, Ringo Consumer Division', N'Ringo Consumer Division', N'Cuc Hayashi is wiry and kinetic, a person who seems to take up more space than their frame accounts for. Their heritage is a long conversation — a Congolese-Romanian grandmother on one side, a Zambian-Irish maternal line on the other — and it settled into a face that is striking more for its expressiveness than any single feature: large dark eyes, a mouth that betrays every calculation. Their hair changes with their moods in a strictly color-coded system they''ve maintained for three years: deep violet for productive days, a burnt copper for client presentations, flat grey when they are tired of people, which happens more than they advertise. The color-changing geneware was the first discretionary purchase they made after their first real paycheck and they have never once regretted it.

Cuc Hayashi is extraordinarily good at their job and knows it with the particular confidence of someone who grew up being told they were too much — too loud, too analytical about the wrong things, too unwilling to dress their observations in softness. At Ringo they found an environment that rewards exactly the qualities that got them criticized everywhere else, and this has made them simultaneously more effective and more ruthless than they might otherwise have become. They track consumer behavior patterns with the focused appetite of someone who genuinely finds human decision-making fascinating — not because they love people, exactly, but because people are the most complex system they''ve ever had to model. They are funny, occasionally savage, loyal in the specific and transactional way of someone who grew up learning that loyalty was a resource to be managed.', N'Information source with a twist — they know a great deal about what large populations of consumers feel, want, and fear, and they know how that information is used. Local color in upscale corporate-adjacent social scenes. Morally ambiguous contact who can provide help but whose assistance always benefits them somehow.', N'', N'Color-changing hair geneware (violet/copper/grey primary palette, full spectrum capable). Retinal overlay for real-time data visualization — displays consumer sentiment feeds during presentations without visible hardware. Minor scent-gland enhancement, purely social: a faint warm amber baseline that their analyst colleagues have privately noted makes focus-group subjects more comfortable.', N'In the office by 0900, hair violet. Spends mornings in data — consumer behavior feeds, sentiment modeling, competitor pattern analysis. Afternoons in meetings and presentations, copper. Evenings, if they stay late enough, grey. Socially active in the Grand Corridor bar ecosystem two or three nights a week, partly genuine decompression, partly ongoing fieldwork they''ve stopped trying to disentangle.', N'Cuc Hayashi, 167cm wiry neo-noir corporate analyst with warm medium-deep brown skin, golden undertones, refined East and Southeast Asian facial features enhanced by Middle Eastern and African dimensional richness. Large dark brown eyes with invisible retinal overlay, color-cycling hair currently deep violet textured at crown, sharp analytical expression. Seated forward in high-tech office chair, precise hand gestures framing invisible data, wrist implant marks visible on bare arms. Wearing tier 1-2 corporate smart-weave blazer in muted tone, tech-casual interface panels at wrists, thin data-interface bracelet. Faint linear temple scar barely catching light. Ambient warm amber scent presence. GLMZ GLMZ setting, cool corporate office lighting with warm undertones emphasizing skin radiance, constant micro-scanning expression, energy-focused posture. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Corridor', N'local', N'Grand Corridor', N'Cuc''s genetic heritage is a sophisticated global blend: East Asian (43.2%) and Southeast Asian (32.9%) ancestry form the foundational architecture—refined facial geometry, elegant proportions, smooth skin luminosity, and subtly tilted eye shapes. Middle Eastern heritage (11.5%) adds warmth and depth to bone structure, creating richer undertones in complexion. Northern European (6.7%) and Sub-Saharan African (5.7%) contributions broaden cheekbones slightly and enrich skin depth, resulting in a warm medium-deep tone with golden radiance. The synthesis is striking: East and Southeast Asian grace meets warm, multidimensional complexity—delicate features enhanced by dimensional depth and sophisticated undertone richness.', 167, 58, N'Wiry and kinetic, lean muscle with minimal body fat; movements suggest coiled energy rather than bulk', N'Genetically modified, color-cycling: deep violet (productive), burnt copper (presentation mode), flat grey (fatigued). Full spectrum capable but maintains primary palette.', N'Deliberately styled to complement mood-color shifts; currently worn short-to-medium, textured at crown for visual interest', N'Medium', N'Large, dark brown—natural; subtle retinal overlay hardware invisible to casual observation', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden undertones and ambient warmth; the harmonious blend of East and Southeast Asian foundational luminosity, enriched by Middle Eastern depth, Northern European dimensional breadth, and Sub-Saharan African complexity. Radiant in daylight, sophisticated and glowing under artificial light.', N'Refined facial geometry with defined but not severe cheekbones; smooth skin well-maintained but bearing subtle wear of productivity-focused lifestyle. East and Southeast Asian ancestry dominates feature delicacy—slight eye tilt, refined nose structure, elegant proportions—while darker undertones and dimensional richness reflect the full genetic synthesis. Expression habitually analytical—eyebrows mobile and expressive, mouth precise. Faint warm amber scent baseline (gland enhancement) provides subtle ambient presence.', N'None obvious. Retinal overlay is subcutaneous and imperceptible. Hair geneware is visible only as the color-cycling itself. Minor scent gland enhancement detectable only as ambient warmth (amber baseline).', N'Sits forward in chairs. Hands gesture with precision during analysis—fingers forming frames, pointing at invisible data. Walks quickly, economically. Eyes rarely settle; constant micro-scanning of environments. When tired, posture flattens slightly, as if energy reserves are visibly depleting.', N'Tier 1-2 corporate: tailored minimal aesthetic. High-quality baseline fabrics (smart-weave, temperature-regulating). Presentations: structured blazers in muted tones that complement hair copper. Office: fitted tech-casual—smart fabrics with discrete interface panels at wrists. Social evenings: deliberately relaxed but expensive, suggesting someone who could dress up but chooses not to. Accessories spare: a thin bracelet that doubles as a data interface, no visible jewelry beyond function.', N'They built a private predictive model — off-server, personal hardware — that uses Ringo''s consumer data to forecast personal loyalty patterns. They''ve been using it to predict, and occasionally pre-empt, moments when friends or colleagues are likely to drift away. They tell themselves it''s just interesting. They know it isn''t just interesting.', N'Precise, data-fluent, with a dry humor that surfaces in deadpan asides. Uses ''we'' strategically — inclusive when they want buy-in, exclusive when marking territory. Code-switches easily between analytics register and sharp social vernacular.', N'Fast baseline, but they can slow it down with deliberate effect during presentations. Comfortable with silence in a way that makes others uncomfortable.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cuc_hayashi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f3-79e8-812b-15bb5fe36129', N'Chin-hwa Chakraborty', N'Chin-hwa', N'', N'Chakraborty', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 37, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Rookery — dense vertical housing, gang-controlled, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Infrastructure disruption and industrial sabotage — saboteur', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Chin-hwa Chakraborty is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 37, his face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and he has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — geneware muscle density treatment — looks natural, hits like chrome — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see him surpass them. He works as a saboteur out of The Rookery, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Chin-hwa Chakraborty has built a reputation on reliability rather than flash — he shows up, he delivers, he collects.', N'As a saboteur, Djeneba Orlov-Obeng embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Geneware muscle density treatment — looks natural, hits like chrome. Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Chin-hwa Chakraborty, mixed-heritage saboteur, GLMZ. Warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones, angular South Asian-East Asian cheekbones softened by Sub-Saharan fullness, warm brown eyes tracking exits. Dark textured hair cropped short, sharp jawline. Lean 178cm frame with inhuman chrome geneware muscle definition visible under forearms and shoulders—metallic density betraying augmentation. Wearing black Cerberus Tactical cargo jacket with asymmetrical pockets, reinforced dark pants, scuffed steel-toed boots. Visible pale burn scars in grid pattern on inner right forearm, surgical scarring on sternum. Coiled posture, economical movement, alert stance. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon-lit parking structure or rooftop at night, cool blue and amber lighting casting shadows across his face. Geneware musculature catching light with subtle metallic sheen. Mood: focused, dangerous precision, ready to move. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Rookery', N'local', N'The Rookery', N'Mixed global ancestry with South Asian plurality (40.3%), significant Northern European admixture (32.5%), complemented by Sub-Saharan African (14.3%), Middle Eastern (7.3%), and East Asian (5.6%) heritage. This genetic mosaic creates a phenotype of considerable complexity: warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones from the South Asian-Sub-Saharan foundation, enriched by Northern European influence that deepens rather than cools the overall tone. Facial structure reflects the angular definition of South Asian and East Asian bone geometry—high, prominent cheekbones, defined nasal bridge, eye-set that speaks to multiple continental sources—softened by the fuller features inherited from Sub-Saharan and Middle Eastern ancestry. The overall effect is a face that resists easy categorization, bearing the genetic signature of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 178, 72, N'Lean and angular with visible muscle definition from geneware enhancement; low body fat, wiry strength rather than bulk. Chest and shoulders show the telltale density of chrome muscle treatment — they move with inhuman precision.', N'Dark brown, naturally textured', N'Kept short and tight, minimal styling. Pragmatic cut for his line of work.', N'Short', N'Warm brown with faint amber undertone', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden undertones, slightly muted by nocturnal lifestyle but retaining the richness of South Asian-Sub-Saharan heritage blended with Northern European influence. The nocturnal pallor sits beneath rather than displacing the natural warmth.', N'Angular jawline and high, prominent cheekbones reflecting the South Asian-East Asian-Sub-Saharan ancestry blend, with subtle fullness in the lower face from Middle Eastern and Sub-Saharan heritage. Skin shows the strain of night-cycle living—faint dark circles beneath warm brown eyes—but is clear and scar-free on the face. Grooming is meticulous and functional; no jewelry, no flash.', N'Chrome geneware musculature visible under the skin of forearms, shoulders, and upper chest — not bulky, but with an unnatural density and subtle metallic sheen under certain lighting. The musculature moves with mechanical precision that betrays its artificial nature. No visible neural ports, optical implants, or external chrome.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Stands with slight forward lean, shoulders loose but alert. Natural state appears to be coiled tension; even at rest, his body reads as ready to move. Eyes track exits and structural weak points instinctively.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian. Dark-colored cargo pants with reinforced panels and hidden pockets for tools. Black or charcoal synthetic jacket with asymmetrical chest pockets and articulated shoulders — brands like Cerberus Tactical or unmarked knockoffs from the Gray Zone. Steel-toed work boots, scuffed and worn. No corpo branding, no gang colors. Clothing is chosen for function: durability, mobility, pockets for equipment. Everything fits close enough to move but loose enough to hide things.', N'', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chin_hwa_chakraborty');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5af-7bb9-b929-15c50c51bd5f', N'Tarn Matsumoto-Mukherjee', N'Tarn', N'', N'Matsumoto-Mukherjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Laceworks, Bronzeline, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Bootleg media seller and fortune teller, The Laceworks', N'Independent; informal collective of Laceworks vendors; devout E.L.F. practitioner (Bronzeline Signal Shrine congregation)', N'Tarn Matsumoto-Mukherjee operates out of a folding table wedged between two support pillars in the covered walkway district known as The Laceworks — a tangle of enclosed elevated bridges and lower market arcades in Bronzeline that smells permanently of wet concrete and food oil. They are striking: tall and thin with light brown skin, cheekbones that photograph dramatically, and shoulder-length hair grown out in patches of natural black and bioluminescent indigo that pulses in slow, warm waves when they''re calm and rapid cold flickers when they''re anxious. Their eyes have decorative irises — a Helix Biosystems standard pattern called ''starburst mango'' — that catch light like fractured glass. They dress in whatever they find beautiful that week.

On one half of the table, Tarn Matsumoto-Mukherjee sells bootleg media: cracked games, pirated immersives, scraped celebrity XP recordings, deep-archive films from before the Flood Years. On the other half, they read fortunes — a practice that blends genuine E.L.F. prayer traditions with showmanship and an eerily accurate social intuition. They genuinely believe the E.L.F.s speak through data patterns and that fortune-telling is just a different kind of signal processing. Whether this is true or not, their readings have a reputation for being uncomfortably specific, which keeps a steady line of nervous customers in front of the table.', N'Flavor and atmosphere vendor who doubles as an unpredictable information source — their fortune readings occasionally surface real intelligence they''ve absorbed unconsciously from customers. Can provide bootleg media, E.L.F. lore, or unsettling accurate character reads.', N'', N'Bioluminescent hair (Helix Biosystems cosmetic geneware). Decorative iris replacements (starburst mango pattern). Fingernail-mounted micro-projectors for fortune display — display small holographic sigils during readings.', N'Sets up table in the Laceworks by noon, sells media and reads fortunes until late evening, attends the Signal Shrine twice a week, spends mornings scraping and cataloguing new media finds.', N'Tarn Matsumoto-Mukherjee, tall androgynous figure with warm golden-olive skin blending East Asian and South Asian heritage, sharp angular cheekbones with almond-shaped eyes replaced by striking amber-to-red starburst implants that refract light like fractured glass. Natural black hair in intentional asymmetrical sections with bioluminescent indigo patches pulsing softly. Minimal build with ascetic posture, hands adorned with subtle metallic micro-projector inlays visible on fingernails. Wearing eclectic layered fashion mixing unexpected colors and metallics, seated in meditative cross-legged position. Direct, unsettling gaze. GLMZ, moody atmospheric lighting catching the bioluminescent elements and refractive eye implants, dimly lit fortune-teller aesthetic, neon undertones, contemplative mood, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Laceworks', N'local', N'The Laceworks', N'Predominantly East Asian (63.1%) with significant South Asian (29.5%) and Southeast Asian (7.4%) ancestry, creating a striking pan-Asian phenotype — warm golden undertones from South Asian genetics blended with the cooler, clearer undertones characteristic of East Asian heritage, with Southeast Asian features contributing to refined cheekbone definition and distinctive eye shape', 183, 62, N'Tall and thin with minimal muscle definition — a frame that reads as deliberately ascetic, almost fragile-looking, but with precise posture that suggests controlled strength rather than weakness', N'Natural black with bioluminescent indigo patches that pulse in waves', N'Grown out in irregular sections; some areas shoulder-length, others cropped or shaved, creating an intentional asymmetrical effect; patches of indigo geneware appear to pulse independently based on emotional state', N'Medium (shoulder-length in longest sections)', N'Decorative iris replacements — Helix Biosystems ''starburst mango'' pattern with amber-to-red gradient rays radiating from central amber pupil; eyes catch and refract light like fractured glass', N'Warm golden-olive complexion — medium depth with golden undertones from blended South and East Asian heritage, luminous quality enhanced by Southeast Asian genetic contributions', N'Sharp, defined cheekbones with angular bone structure characteristic of East Asian ancestry; clear skin with minimal blemishing; minimalist grooming aesthetic; face has an almost sculptural quality, photogenic in the way that suggests they understand how they''re perceived; almond-shaped eyes with natural epicanthic fold; balanced proportions across upper and lower face with refined jawline', N'Bioluminescent hair patches that actively pulse with warm slow waves during calm states and rapid cold flickers during anxiety; decorative iris replacements with visible light-refracting pattern; micro-projector inlays on fingernails that emit faint holographic sigils during fortune readings', N'Moves with deliberate, flowing gestures — economical but expressive, hands used frequently for emphasis and demonstration; sits cross-legged or in meditative posture at their table; eye contact is direct and unsettling, the decorative irises making their gaze feel both artificial and hypnotic; movements suggest someone comfortable being watched', N'Eclectic Tier 3-4 aesthetic — whatever they find beautiful that week, suggesting thrift-store mixing and intentional stylistic variance; likely includes layered silhouettes, unexpected color combinations, possibly upcycled corporate wear recontextualized as personal fashion; suggests someone more interested in aesthetic interest than status signaling; probably incorporates elements that complement their bioluminescent hair (deep colors, metallics, or light-reactive fabrics)', N'Three months ago a fortune reading produced information so specific about a customer''s unreported murder that Amara has been terrified to tell anyone — partly because they don''t know how they knew, and partly because the customer in question is still walking around acting innocent.', N'Layered and associative, mixes market banter with genuine spiritual cadence and pre-Flood media references. West African French rhythms underneath contemporary Meridian slang.', N'Variable — fast and bright selling media, slower and deliberately weighted during readings, which they treat as a different register entirely.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'tarn_matsumoto_mukherjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a622-79cf-b6d5-15e64be366a1', N'Bhairavi Hernández', N'Bhairavi', N'', N'Hernández', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 36, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Underbelly — sub-street tunnels and maintenance corridors, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Covert entry and social penetration specialist — infiltrator', N'Independent — operates through reputation only', N'Bhairavi Hernández are slight and easy to overlook, which is exactly the point. At 36, their face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ice in the brain — and they make no effort to hide it.

They arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and have been working off both ever since. They work as a infiltrator out of The Underbelly, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Bhairavi Hernández describe them as a precision instrument — point them at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Hadiya Holm-Danquah is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When they make a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of their stories.', N'', N'Neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ICE in the brain. Subdermal armor plating across torso and forearms — military surplus, scratched serial numbers', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Bhairavi Hernández, 168cm lean operative with medium bronze skin blending Hispanic, South Asian, and Southeast Asian heritage. Sharp Hispanic/Latin cheekbones enhanced by South Asian prominence; Southeast Asian eye shape with deep brown amber-toned eyes. Dark brown hair with silver temples pulled in tight braid, exposing chrome neural dampener at skull base with faint LED glow. Visible subdermal armor plating ridges on forearms. Wearing matte-black fitted tactical jacket with reinforced shoulders, under-armor mesh collar visible, dark combat boots. Pale tactical scar along right collarbone, circular burn mark on left wrist. Calm, focused expression, alert posture. GLMZ GLMZ Underbelly setting, moody blue-neon and cool shadows, cinematic lighting emphasizing chrome implants and worn tactical gear, low-angle shot emphasizing ready stance --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Underbelly', N'local', N'The Underbelly', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (80.6%) with significant South Asian (12.2%) and Southeast Asian (7.2%) admixture. The angular facial geometry characteristic of Hispanic/Latin ancestry forms the foundation—sharp cheekbones and jawline—enriched by the more prominent, sculpted cheekbone structure of South Asian genetics. Southeast Asian admixture adds subtle refinement to eye shape and overall facial proportions, creating a striking fusion where no single ancestry dominates the visual whole. Warm, golden undertones run throughout.', 168, 58, N'Lean and wiry with minimal body fat — built for speed and infiltration rather than strength. Shoulders slightly narrower than average, core visibly defined. No wasted mass.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid; practical for fieldwork and to expose augmentations', N'Medium', N'Deep brown with warm amber undertones — natural, unaugmented', N'Medium bronze with golden warmth, even complexion blending the rich tones of Hispanic/Latin and South Asian heritage with Southeast Asian subtlety', N'Striking fusion of heritage: South Asian-prominent, sculpted cheekbones paired with the angular jawline of Hispanic/Latin structure. Southeast Asian eye shape adds almond-tilt and subtle epicanthal fold. Calm, focused expression. Eyes track everything with quiet intensity. Skin shows disciplined self-maintenance despite Underbelly location—no blemishes, but bearing the patient wear of fieldwork.', N'Neural dampener at skull base is primary visible chrome. Subdermal armor plating across torso (beneath clothing) and forearms creates subtle ridge patterns visible in tight sleeves. No cosmetic mods — all augmentations serve infiltration purpose.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion. Sits with spine straight, alert. Habit of checking exits and sightlines. Handshake is firm but brief. Speaks quietly; people lean in to listen. Default stance is relaxed but ready, like a coiled spring.', N'Tier 4 functional — dark, fitted, minimal branding. Form-fitting tactical jacket with reinforced shoulders and hidden pockets. Matte-black under-armor mesh visible at collar. Combat boots with grip soles and hidden blade sheaths. Layers designed for rapid concealment or tactical loadout. No jewelry. Worn Φ500-1200 range in gear total — investment in tools, not aesthetics.', N'', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Halting — speaks in fragments, reassembles thoughts in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bhairavi_hern_ndez');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a652-7efb-99d9-163e783906c0', N'Diksha Fassi-Wojciechowski', N'Diksha', N'', N'Fassi-Wojciechowski', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, lower levels — operates a rotating circuit of Burnside Pocket and Blackpipe Corridor businesses, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Protection racket enforcer and neighborhood tax collector, the Gray Zone lower levels', N'the Gray Zone Compact (established lower-level protection network); informal loyalty to the Compact''s senior figure, an elderly man she calls Uncle who she has never met in person; Switchblade Alley', N'Diksha Fassi-Wojciechowski is a big woman and she has never apologized for it — Tanzanian-Polish heritage, nearly six feet, broad through the shoulders, with a body that carries its strength like furniture: solidly, without trying. Her hair is worn in thick locs shot through with copper wire that glints when she moves, and her skin is very dark and very smooth except for a patch of scarring on her left jaw where she took something ceramic in a fight eleven years ago and kept it as a conversation piece. She dresses practically and well — not flashy, but never cheap — and has a habit of touching the scarring when she''s working something out.

She is the neighborhood''s collector for the Gray Zone Compact, an informal protection network that has run the lower levels since before she was born, and she does this job with a thoroughness that people mistake for menace until they know her better. She is not cruel. She is extremely serious. The businesses in her circuit pay on time and have done so for seven years, not because they fear her specifically but because they have seen what she does when accounts fall behind, which is to sit down with the owner and explain — in considerable detail, with full eye contact — exactly how much worse their situation could become and exactly how much it will cost her personally to allow it not to. She has a talent for making the math of compliance feel like mercy.', N'Antagonist or uneasy ally depending on whether player characters are in her territory, local power figure who mediates disputes, information source about the Gray Zone''s economic underbelly, demonstration that protection rackets have their own social logic', N'', N'Subdermal impact plating — forearms and sternum, rated for small-arms blunt trauma. Joint-assist servos in both knees (injury rehabilitation, functional advantage). No cosmetic mods.', N'Rises at five, exercises for ninety minutes, eats a large breakfast, walks her circuit to collect weekly payments and check on ''her'' businesses, is home by eight in the evening, cooks dinner, watches old sports broadcasts, sleeps.', N'Diksha Fassi-Wojciechowski, 183cm tall broad-shouldered woman with powerfully built frame and heavy muscle density. Dark rich warm brown skin with golden undertones, sharp high cheekbones of East Asian heritage blending with broader North African midface and solid Eastern European jaw architecture. Very dark brown almost-black eyes with exceptional clarity and direct unflinching gaze. Thick shoulder-length locs woven with copper wire filaments that catch light. Pale ceramic-scar tissue patch on left jaw, matte finish, approximately 4cm. Subdermal impact plating visible as subtle geometric raising on both forearms and sternum. Wearing charcoal fitted athletic-cut jacket over long-sleeved tactical compression top, tailored neutral trousers, well-fitted boots with ankle support. Single heavy steel bracelet on right wrist. Meticulous grooming. Calculated posture with weight evenly distributed, shoulders back. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, professional reliable experienced augmented operative aesthetic. Dim neon-filtered interior lighting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'A genetic synthesis of East Asian (33.1%), North African (23.5%), and Eastern European (22.7%) ancestry, with secondary contributions from Southeast Asian (9.1%), Sub-Saharan African (7.1%), and Hispanic/Latin American (4.5%) lineages — the living embodiment of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Her facial structure blends the angular planes and high cheekbones characteristic of East Asian heritage with the broader, warmer facial geometry of North African and Sub-Saharan ancestry. Eastern European bone structure adds width to her face and strength to her jaw. Southeast Asian and Hispanic influences soften edges throughout. The result is a uniquely calibrated fusion: sharp where East Asian influence dominates the eye area, warmed and broadened by African heritage across the cheeks and lower face, with the solid architectural quality of Slavic ancestry anchoring her overall presence.', 183, 89, N'Broad-shouldered and powerfully built without bulk — heavy muscle density in the chest, shoulders, and legs. Carries herself with the grounded solidity of someone who has learned her body''s full weight is an asset, not a liability.', N'Dark brown, naturally black, woven through with copper wire filaments', N'Thick locs, shoulder-length, interwoven with conductive copper threading that catches light during movement', N'Long', N'Very dark brown, almost black, with exceptional clarity and direct gaze', N'Rich warm brown with golden undertones — the result of blended East Asian, North African, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian ancestry creating a complex, resilient complexion with subtle warmth from Hispanic heritage influence. Smooth and maintained with care.', N'Strong, defined facial structure with the high cheekbones and eye-area angularity of East Asian heritage, the broader midface and warmer undertones of North African and Sub-Saharan ancestry, and the solid jaw architecture of Eastern European genetics, softened slightly by Southeast Asian influence across the cheekbones. Unlined face for her age. Left jaw bears a distinctive patch of ceramic-scar tissue from an old fight — pale, matte, roughly 4cm across, which she touches habitually when thinking. No other visible marks. Grooming is meticulous; she maintains herself like essential equipment.', N'Subdermal impact plating visible as slight geometric raising and hardened patches under the skin of both forearms and across the sternum — noticeable during physical contact or when wearing fitted clothing. Minimal cosmetic signature; functional only. Joint servos in both knees produce no visible external hardware but create a subtle precision in her gait.', N'Moves with calculated economy — never rushed, never wasted motion. Stands with weight evenly distributed, shoulders back. Her gaze is level and unflinching. She has a habit of touching the scar on her jaw with her thumb when processing information or working through a problem. When seated, she remains alert. Handshakes are firm but not performative.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear — good-quality, durable fabrics that read as professional but not corporate. Favors fitted athletic-cut jackets (often dark, usually charcoal or black) over long-sleeved compression tops or tactical shirts that accommodate her augmentation without drawing attention. Tailored trousers in neutral colors, well-fitted boots with good ankle support (important for the knee servos). Jewelry minimal — a single heavy steel bracelet on her right wrist, no other adornment. Her clothes fit well because they are fitted to her; she does not buy off-racks. No corporate logos. No gang signifiers. Everything about her appearance says: reliable, experienced, expensive to maintain, not looking for trouble but thoroughly prepared.', N'She has been slowly diverting a small percentage of collections into a fund she thinks of as an ''exit account'' — enough to buy out her position from the Compact and leave. She has been doing this for four years. She tells herself she is nearly there. She is not nearly there.', N'Deliberate, formal Meridian Standard with occasional Swahili phrases, especially when annoyed; economical with words, no filler', N'Slow and measured, like someone who has all the time in the world and is demonstrating that they do', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'diksha_fassi_wojciechowski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e1-783f-b6dc-16524d070274', N'Afia Kowalczyk', N'Afia', N'', N'Kowalczyk', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenwood Gate Tessera Compliance Monitoring Suite, Level 4 subbasement, near North Ave and Damen', N'Surveillance Operator, Tessera Compliance Bureau', N'Tessera Compliance Bureau, Zone Monitoring Division', N'Afia Kowalczyk has spent so long in the blue glow of surveillance feeds that his skin has taken on a slightly translucent quality, the veins visible at his temples and the backs of his hands. He''s a narrow man, fifty years collapsing him toward sixty, with a close-trimmed grey beard and the posture of someone who has spent two decades hunched over screens. His geneware retinal overlays are never fully off — you can see the faint pixel-grid of his vision enhancement tech making his eyes look slightly unreal, like photographs of eyes rather than the actual things. He wears the same three rotating sets of Tessera-branded technician coveralls and has opinions about the optimal temperature for the monitoring suite that he will share at length.

Afia Kowalczyk is a brilliant and deeply isolated man who has reframed surveillance as a form of intimacy — he knows the people on his feeds the way a reader knows characters in a serial novel. He tracks their routines, notices when someone is having a bad week, feels something adjacent to fondness for the regulars. He has never fully examined what it means that the only relationships he feels safe in are ones where the other person doesn''t know he exists. The E.L.F. that inhabits his primary monitoring array — which he has named Besenyő after a grandmother — is his most important confidant.', N'Information broker (unwilling or willing depending on approach); window into Tessera''s surveillance infrastructure; can provide location data, movement patterns, and camera blind spots; represents the banality of the panopticon', N'', N'Geneware retinal overlays with multi-spectrum surveillance integration (Tessera-issued), neural data-buffer implant for direct feed processing (Tessera-issued), voluntary hand tremor suppression implant (personal medical)', N'Arrives at the subbasement monitoring suite two hours before his shift starts, runs diagnostics, and makes a data offering to Besenyő; works twelve-hour surveillance rotations tracking compliance zones around Kenwood Gate; eats at his station; leaves only to sleep.', N'Afia Kowalczyk, neo-noir technician in 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Man with warm golden-bronze skin blending Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian heritage. Angular face with broader nose, fine lines etched around dark brown eyes augmented with faintly visible cyan pixel-grid retinal overlay. Close-trimmed grey beard, short grey hair with auburn temple highlights. Lean 178cm frame, hunched posture from decades of screen work. Wearing grey-blue Tessera Compliance Bureau coveralls, meticulously maintained. Mechanical wristwatch on left wrist. Precise, economical movements with uncanny steadiness. Dark circles permanent, skin dulled by fluorescent indoor lighting. Faint scars at temples from neural hardware integration. Fine capillaries visible on hands. Uncomfortable eye contact, gaze drifting toward security corners. Neo-noir institutional lighting, cool blues and greys, slightly desaturated palette. Mood: exhausted surveillance worker, mechanical precision masking human wear. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenwood Gate Tessera Compliance Monitoring Suite', N'local', N'Kenwood Gate Tessera Compliance Monitoring Suite', N'Eastern European dominant (58%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African ancestry (31.7%) and South Asian heritage (10.3%). This genetic combination produces warm, medium-toned skin with golden-brown undertones. Eastern European angular facial structure blends with Sub-Saharan African broader nasal passages and fuller facial proportions, while South Asian ancestry contributes refined cheekbone geometry and eye shape characteristics. The result is a complexion that reads as warm bronze, with skin texture responsive to varied climatic heritage.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, slightly collapsed inward from decades of sedentary work. Narrow shoulders, minimal muscle definition. The posture of someone whose spine has learned to curve toward screens.', N'Grey with faint residual auburn at the temples', N'Close-trimmed, utilitarian, maintenance-minimal', N'Short', N'Dark brown with visible subdermal pixel-grid overlay from geneware retinal implants; faint luminescent cyan undertone when light hits them directly', N'Medium warm bronze with golden-brown undertones — the blended result of Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian ancestry. Sun-responsive complexion dulled by prolonged indoor fluorescent exposure, creating a slightly papery quality.', N'Warm golden-bronze base tone with finely lined features around the eyes from screen-fatigue. Angular Eastern European facial structure combined with broader nose and fuller facial proportions from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, refined by South Asian heritage bone geometry. Skin has reduced melanin activation from indoor confinement. Close-trimmed grey beard, meticulously maintained. Permanent dark circles. Slight tremor absent from hands due to suppression implant — movements unnaturally steady, almost mechanical.', N'Geneware retinal overlays create an uncanny ''photograph quality'' to his eyes, especially visible in low light or from certain angles. The pixel-grid is faintly visible if you know to look. No visible external hardware. Hands move with uncanny steadiness — the tremor suppression implant eliminating natural micro-movements that make humans look human.', N'Permanently curved toward an imaginary screen, shoulders hunched. Movements are precise but economical, almost robotic. He walks with minimal arm swing. When sitting, he arranges himself in the exact same position every time. Eye contact is brief and uncomfortable; his gaze tends to drift to corners of rooms where security feeds would be.', N'Three rotating sets of Tessera Compliance Bureau technician coveralls (grey-blue with embroidered division patches). Worn meticulously clean but with the institutional anonymity of someone who stopped caring about personal presentation years ago. Generic black slip-on shoes. A personal watch — an older mechanical model, not networked — worn on his left wrist. No visible jewelry. Everything optimized for minimal distraction from work.', N'He has been secretly archiving personal footage of a woman on his feeds — a baker in Kenwood Gate named Yemisi — for four years. He knows her entire life. He has never spoken to her. He considers this devotion.', N'Technical and precise, with unexpected poetic flourishes when describing what he''s observed. Speaks about strangers on his feeds with the warmth he doesn''t use for people in the room.', N'Unhurried, slightly distracted, as if part of his attention is always elsewhere. Sentences trail off when he gets absorbed in a feed.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'afia_kowalczyk');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65f-78db-9928-168ebaf9214d', N'Kit Quiñones', N'Kit', N'', N'Quiñones', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Kedzie and Division', N'Street-level medic and black-market augmentation surgeon', N'Unaffiliated — fiercely independent, though she has an informal network of other street medics across the Gray Zone and into Old Harbor', N'Kit Quiñones is a broad-shouldered Ghanaian-British woman whose hands are her most remarkable feature — the left is entirely her own, calloused and ink-stained at the fingertips; the right is a matte-black prosthetic she built herself from salvaged components, its fingers capable of sub-millimeter precision that no organic hand could match. She keeps her locs pinned back tight when she works and loose when she doesn''t want to be found, and the distinction matters more than people realize. Her clinic is a converted shipping container stacked midway up the Gray Zone''s residential tiers, marked only by a strip of orange adhesive tape across the door frame — a color that locals have learned means someone inside might still be alive.', N'Moral anchor and information hub for street-level characters; represents the cost of principled survival in a system designed to grind it out; her clinic is a narrative waypoint where disparate characters can intersect', N'', N'Right arm prosthetic (self-built): matte-black titanium-polymer composite, sub-millimeter surgical precision mode, haptic feedback calibrated to replicate fine tissue sensation, concealed compartment in the forearm housing emergency pharmaceuticals,Ocular overlay (left eye only): medical HUD with vitals reading, vein mapping, augmentation diagnostic interface — old model, slightly flickering at the edges', N'Nadira wakes before the Gray Zone''s ambient light cycle shifts to morning and spends the first hour of the day doing maintenance on her prosthetic and reviewing whatever cases came in overnight. She eats once, usually mid-afternoon, usually something she can hold in one hand while doing something else. Her evenings are her most consistent time — she keeps a window that faces west and watches what passes for a sunset through the industrial haze. She sleeps lightly and always with her prosthetic attached.', N'Kit Quiñones, 173cm tall woman with warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, Southeast Asian and Hispanic heritage evident in high cheekbones and warm complexion, natural black hair with grey threading worn in long locs pinned at the back. Muscular broad-shouldered build from hands-on work. Dark brown natural right eye; left eye glows faintly with amber and blue medical HUD overlay in shadow. Right arm is matte-black titanium-polymer prosthetic from mid-forearm down with articulated precision fingers, bare and showing minor wear marks. Pale surgical scar visible on right temple, faded collarbone scar, ink-stained fingertips on left hand. Wearing practical tier 4 street gear: dark charcoal utility vest with reinforced pockets over long-sleeved black shirt, left sleeve rolled to elbow, right fitted for prosthetic. Grey cargo pants, military-surplus scuffed boots, worn leather work gloves on left hand. Faded surgical mask hanging loose around neck. Steel watchband on prosthetic wrist. Standing in moody neon-lit underground clinic environment, late night, dim amber and cool blue emergency lighting, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, moving with deliberate economical posture ready to lean into work, serious weathered expression of someone who has survived trauma --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Mixed heritage from Southeast Asian (47.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (33.9%), Sub-Saharan African (9.2%), and Eastern European (9.1%) ancestry. Her features reflect this complex diaspora: warm medium-deep brown skin with subtle golden undertones, high cheekbones with gentle width from her Southeast Asian and Latin heritage, and a slightly squared jawline influenced by Eastern European ancestry blended with the warmth of African heritage.', 173, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and muscular through the chest and back, with the dense, functional physique of someone who works with their hands for a living. Her frame carries the weight of practical strength rather than bulk.', N'Natural black with early grey threading through', N'Long locs, typically pinned tight at the back of her head during work; worn loose and flowing when moving through the Gray Zone incognito', N'Long', N'Natural dark brown (right eye); left eye features a subtle medical HUD overlay with faint amber and blue diagnostic glyphs visible in low light', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden undertones, reflecting the dominant Southeast Asian and Hispanic/Latin American heritage with subtle warmth from Sub-Saharan African ancestry and complexity from Eastern European genetics', N'Weathered but well-maintained; minimal cosmetic grooming, practical and efficient. High, defined cheekbones with gentle width characteristic of Southeast Asian features. A few surgical scars visible at her temples from old augmentation work. Her face carries the settled confidence of someone who has seen trauma and learned to move past it.', N'Right arm is a matte-black prosthetic from mid-forearm down — titanium-polymer composite with articulated fingers of impossible precision. The joint at her wrist shows faint seams where modular components connect. Left eye contains a barely-perceptible medical HUD overlay, most visible in dark environments as a faint amber and blue geometric glow. The prosthetic''s surface bears minor toolmarks and wear patterns from field maintenance.', N'She moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion, shoulders slightly forward as if ready to lean into work. Her right arm (the prosthetic) hangs at a slightly different angle than a natural limb would, and she favors her left side instinctively when reaching for delicate work. Her gait is steady and measured, that of someone who has learned to move through dangerous spaces without drawing attention.', N'Tier 4 street-functional — well-maintained but heavily worn. Typically a fitted dark-grey or charcoal utility vest with reinforced pockets for pharmaceuticals and surgical tools over a long-sleeved black shirt (sleeves rolled to the elbow on her left, fitted close on her right to accommodate the prosthetic). Cargo pants in grey or navy with multiple tool belts. Worn leather work gloves on her left hand; the right prosthetic is often left bare for precision work. Her boots are practical military-surplus grade, scuffed but recently resoled. A faded surgical mask hangs loose around her neck at all times — a constant reminder of her work. No jewelry except a plain steel watchband on her prosthetic wrist.', N'Ten years ago in the Meridian Core, she was a licensed trauma surgeon. She falsified a patient''s cause of death to protect a young woman from a corporate security inquiry — the woman had been fleeing something Nadira never fully understood. The cover-up was discovered. She lost her license, her marriage, and eventually her right arm in the fallout. She has never told anyone the full sequence of events, only fragments, and she does not regret the choice. She regrets that it cost her so much and changed so little.', N'Precise and clinical when discussing medicine; plain and unhurried in everything else. Uses the full names of anatomical structures without affectation. Avoids slang except when she''s tired or amused.', N'Measured, with deliberate pauses before important words. She does not rush. Even when a situation is urgent she speaks at the same pace, which some people find calming and others find unnerving.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'kit_qui_ones');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6fe-7eea-b61b-16bc79c96a54', N'Chandni Dlamini', N'Chandni', N'', N'Dlamini', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, ''Mudflap Repairs'' off Dearborn Forge''s south service corridor, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Mechanic and repair technician at a Geartown independent shop', N'Independent; informal relationship with several Ferrogate Transit maintenance crews who send overflow work his way', N'Chandni Dlamini is wiry and restless, with warm brown skin dusted perpetually with machine grit no amount of scrubbing fully removes. He keeps his hair shaved close on the sides with a tight coil of dark curls on top, and his left forearm has a subdermal glow-line mod — a single bioluminescent stripe running elbow to wrist in industrial orange — which he got at nineteen because he thought it looked sharp and has since found genuinely useful when working in dark engine bays. He''s got a gap between his front teeth and laugh lines already forming at the corners of his eyes from a face that defaults to grinning.

He took over Mudflap Repairs three years ago when its previous owner, an old Ferrogate Transit retiree who mentored him, died without a will and no family stepped forward. Chandni Dlamini has been paying off the informal debt to the man''s extended neighbors ever since, cutting rates, doing favors. He''s brilliant with mechanical systems — older combustion-hybrid rigs, mag-rail sub-components, jury-rigged cargo loaders — and has a gift for diagnosing faults by sound alone. He''s also deeply impractical about money, undercharging chronically and occasionally fixing things for free when someone looks desperate, which means he operates at a margin that would give an accountant a breakdown.', N'Useful contact for mechanical problems, vehicle repairs, and transit system knowledge. Can source parts through informal networks. Sympathetic character who may need help with financial or legal pressures threatening the shop.', N'', N'Subdermal bioluminescent stripe (left forearm, orange). Basic neural overlay for system diagnostics — Tier 1 consumer grade, glitchy.', N'At the shop by 0700, works through until whenever the job is done. Eats lunch from a noodle cart two blocks over. Spends evenings either doing paperwork he hates or taking apart something he doesn''t need to fix just to understand it.', N'Chandni Dlamini, 172cm lean mechanic with richly blended pan-global heritage—warm medium brown skin with golden and peachy undertones, East Asian eye shape, broader nose and fuller lips, prominent cheekbones, integrated facial features reflecting African, Pacific Islander, Northern European, Indigenous American, and Latin American ancestry. Dark brown natural coils on crown with faded sides, warm brown eyes with laugh lines, gap-toothed grin. Scattered burn scars on calloused hands, thin white scar on left temple. Subdermal bioluminescent orange stripe glowing faintly on left forearm. Wearing worn dark synthmesh coveralls with faded Mudflap Repairs chest patch, simple black undershirt underneath (grease-stained), scuffed steel-toed boots. Woven bracelet on right wrist. In neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226 shop setting, leaning over engine diagnostic station with neural overlay flickering in pupils, hands gesturing mid-explanation, restless kinetic posture. Neon workshop glow mixing with natural bioluminescence, oil-stained industrial background, atmospheric near-future lighting casting warm shadows across features. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Genuinely pan-global ancestry with strong Sub-Saharan African (25.8%), Pacific Islander (20.5%), and Northern European (20.4%) foundations, balanced by East Asian (14.8%), Indigenous American (12.6%), and Hispanic/Latin American (5.9%) heritage. This creates a richly complex phenotype where multiple ancestral lineages genuinely integrate: medium-warm brown skin with golden, reddish, and subtle peachy undertones layered across the same canvas. Facial structure is a true global mosaic—East Asian eye shape and orbital placement, Northern European nose bridge and cheekbone prominence, African and Pacific Islander lip fullness and jaw width, Indigenous American and Latin American nose and facial proportion characteristics all seamlessly integrated into one coherent, authentically blended face.', 172, 64, N'Wiry and lean with corded forearm muscles from decades of wrench work; chest narrow but functional, shoulders compact. No excess anywhere.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Fade on sides, tight coils on crown', N'Short', N'Warm brown, natural', N'Warm medium brown with golden, reddish, and subtle peachy undertones—darker and richer along cheekbones and jawline, warmer across forehead and temples. The complexion carries visible warmth from Pacific Islander and African heritage blended with the cooler undertones of Northern European ancestry, creating a richly nuanced medium-brown canvas.', N'Sun-weathered and perpetually dust-stained from shop work; engine grime settles into pores and creases no shower fully clears. Laugh lines at eye corners deepened by decades of squinting into engine bays. Gap between front incisors—genuine, unfixed, unselfconscious. Hands calloused and stained with hydraulic residue. Facial features authentically blend ancestral heritage: East Asian eye shape and set, fuller lips and broader nose width from Pacific Islander and African ancestry, prominent cheekbones from Northern European heritage, overall facial proportions and nose shape influenced by Indigenous American and Latin American background. Features integrate naturally rather than appearing mismatched.', N'Left forearm bioluminescent stripe (orange, subdermal — visible as a glowing line beneath skin when activated). Neural overlay is subcutaneous, not visible, but his pupils occasionally flicker with diagnostic HUD overlay when he''s troubleshooting. No external chrome or obvious prosthetics.', N'Restless and kinetic — stands with weight shifting, rarely fully still. Moves economically through workspaces, muscle memory of tight engine bays. Defaults to grinning; eyes are expressive and engaged. Hands gesture frequently when explaining mechanical problems. When focused on detailed work, becomes almost meditative, shoulders relaxed but attention laser-locked.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, practical. Worn dark synthmesh coveralls with Mudflap Repairs faded patch on chest (his shop). Underneath: simple black undershirt, often grease-stained. Steel-toed work boots, scuffed. A woven bracelet (gift from the old shop owner''s family) on right wrist — worn thread, significant to him. No jewelry otherwise. Minimal affectation; everything functional.', N'The diagnostic neural overlay he uses is actually a stolen Tessera proprietary system he stripped from a scrapped transit vehicle. If Tessera''s IP enforcement arm ever scanned him, he''d face fines that would bury the shop.', N'Casual and fast, technical jargon when excited, surprisingly precise when describing a mechanical problem. Finnish and Igbo expressions crop up from his parents'' households, usually as exclamations.', N'Quick, runs sentences together when enthusiastic. Slows down when genuinely worried.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chandni_dlamini');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a635-7e53-bc5a-16eb6cfe5941', N'Aidana Oh-Nazari', N'Aidana', N'', N'Oh-Nazari', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 25, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower loading docks, near Kedzie and Division', N'Lower Dock Crew lookout — Prologue survivor. Jaw destroyed, refuses replacement.', N'Lower Dock Crew', N'Aidana Oh-Nazari was the crew''s lookout. He didn''t see Kyle coming. Nobody did. Kyle shattered his jaw with the flat of the blade and Isaak has refused to get it replaced. He wears a wrap around the lower half of his face and communicates through hand signals and a battered datapad.

The crew thinks this is trauma. It''s not. Isaak has discovered that silence gives him power he never had when he talked. People project meaning onto his stillness. They assume depth. Isaak is using Kyle''s violence as a personal rebrand.

Before the crew, Isaak was a library aide at the Gray Zone Community Archive — one of the last physical book collections in the lower tiers. He read constantly. Philosophy, psychology, military history. He joined Marcus''s crew because the library closed and reading doesn''t pay. He is the most educated person in the crew by a significant margin and the only one who has read about what Kyle is. He found references to experimental neural enhancement programs in declassified corporate documents. He does not share this with the crew.

Isaak has no family in GLMZ. His parents are in the Busan Resettlement Zone. He sends them nothing because they don''t know he''s alive. He let them believe he died in transit. It was easier.', N'The one who learned the wrong lesson. Null is a dark mirror of Kyle — performing stillness and danger without the code that gives it meaning. He is the crew''s most interesting member and the most thematically resonant: violence as accidental transformation.', N'', N'None new. Refuses jaw replacement. Face wrap.', N'Being silent. Being watched. Studying Kyle from a distance. Typing single words on a datapad.', N'GLMZ portrait of Aidana Oh-Nazari: 172cm lean figure with tri-continental features—high angular cheekbones, refined nose bridge, subtle epicanthic eye folds. Warm olive-bronze skin with golden undertones, matte-sallow from artificial dock lighting. Dark brown eyes with intense, vigilant focus. Black collar-length hair uncombed across forehead. Lower jaw wrapped in grey linen (fractured), thin scar visible at left temple. Dark utilitarian clothing: charcoal cargo jacket, black synthmesh pants, cracked reinforced boots. Battered military datapad strapped to left wrist. Perfectly still posture, predatory patience. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone lower dock worker, harsh industrial lighting, dark moody neo-noir atmosphere, sitting with surgical focus --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Tri-continental ancestry from Central Asia (34.2%), Middle East (36.7%), and East Asia (29.1%). This blend produces a striking phenotype: warm olive-bronze skin with golden undertones from the Middle Eastern and Central Asian components, refined by East Asian bone structure. High, prominent cheekbones and subtle epicanthic eye folds reflect the East Asian contribution, while a refined nose bridge and facial proportions show robust Central Asian and Persian genetics softened by East Asian delicacy. The result is distinctly West/Central Asian with refined East Asian architecture—angular, defined, and unmistakably cosmopolitan.', 172, 62, N'Wiry and lean — underfed dock work, minimal muscle development. Shoulders slightly hunched from years bent over a datapad or book spine.', N'Black, naturally darkened by poor lighting and lack of grooming investment', N'Uncombed, falls across forehead. No deliberate styling.', N'Medium (collar-length)', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertones, unremarkable — but intense focus, rarely breaking contact', N'Warm olive-bronze with golden undertones. Minimal sunlight exposure creates a sallow matte cast over the underlying warmth, suggesting indoor dock work under artificial lighting. The blend shows even distribution across the face with subtle warmth concentration in cheeks and temples.', N'Strikingly angular with high, prominent cheekbones characteristic of East Asian and Central Asian ancestry. Hollow cheeks intensify this structure. Refined, straight nose bridge from Middle Eastern and Central Asian lineage. Facial width and proportions show harmonious blend of Central Asian robustness with East Asian refinement. Acne scarring on jawline visible where the wrap doesn''t cover. Chapped lips. Eyes carry the strain of constant vigilance.', N'Face wrap (grey linen, changed infrequently) covering lower jaw and mouth. Battered military-grade datapad strapped to left wrist with fraying synth-leather cuff. No chrome, no LEDs, no visible tech beyond the datapad.', N'Perfectly still when observing. Minimal fidgeting. Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion. Head turns slowly, tracking targets with predatory patience. When typing, fingers move with surgical precision. Sits or stands for hours without repositioning.', N'Tier 4 lower-working-class. Dark, utilitarian: charcoal cargo jacket (Lower Dock Crew standard, worn soft), black synthmesh pants with cargo pockets, reinforced boots with cracked soles. Layers indicate he doesn''t regulate temperature well — thin thermal under-shirt visible at collar. No decoration, no branding, no affectation. Clothes fit loosely — either intentional camouflage or simple neglect.', N'He has found declassified corporate documents that reference Program Atlas. He knows what Kyle is. He has not told anyone.', N'None. Communicates through hand signals, nods, and single words on a datapad.', N'The pauses ARE the communication. Two-second stare before every response.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aidana_oh_nazari');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e7-7353-ae6d-1715af66ee53', N'Briar Seo-Suwannapoom', N'Briar', N'', N'Seo-Suwannapoom', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 29, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Steamvent Alley — geothermal district, hot and chemical-smelling, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Electronic and physical observation expert — surveillance specialist', N'Freelance — Geartown regular', N'Emeka Seo-Suwannapoom is tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 29, her expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — cranial bomb defuser — specialized implant that detects and neutralizes cortex b — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. She works as a surveillance specialist out of Steamvent Alley, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Emeka Seo-Suwannapoom has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and she cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Daulet Malm-Amoah functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Cranial bomb defuser — specialized implant that detects and neutralizes cortex bombs in others. Dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'GLMZ character portrait: Emeka Seo-Suwannapoom, 183cm lean rawboned frame, warm golden-brown complexion reflecting South Asian, East Asian, Southeast Asian, Middle Eastern, and Hispanic heritage. Sharp angular cheekbones balanced with broad facial planes, strong defined jawline, almond-shaped dark brown eyes with chromatic shift. Dark brown-black hair pulled tight in utilitarian braid exposing chrome cranial bomb defuser implant along right temple. Thin scar down left neck. Irregular dermal camouflage patches across shoulders and forearms shifting subtly in light. Dressed in tactical black reinforced pants, thermal undershirt, lightweight ballistic vest, worn cargo jacket with signal-blocking lining, reinforced boots. Economical posture, weight balanced, constant assessing gaze. Industrial Steamvent setting with neon and amber lighting, cybernetic augmentation visible, disciplined and functional aesthetic, ready to move, no cosmetic grooming, everything purpose-driven —ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Steamvent Alley', N'local', N'Steamvent Alley', N'Striking Pan-Asian and South Asian blend with significant Middle Eastern and Hispanic/Latin American influences. South Asian ancestry (26.6%) provides warm golden undertones and defined facial structure; East Asian heritage (23.9%) contributes characteristic eye shape and delicate facial geometry; Southeast Asian ancestry (20.3%) adds angular cheekbone prominence and luminous warm tones; Middle Eastern ancestry (16.9%) enhances broad facial planes and strong jawline definition; Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (12.3%) deepens overall skin tone with additional warmth and richness. The genetic combination produces a distinctive warm golden-brown complexion with striking angular-to-planar facial architecture reflecting balanced ancestry across three continents.', 183, 62, N'Rawboned and lean — minimal subcutaneous fat, defined musculature from consistent training. The kind of frame that reads as either disciplined or half-starved depending on the light. Long-limbed and efficient.', N'Dark brown, almost black, with a faint metallic sheen from mineral deposits in Steamvent water', N'Pulled back in a tight, utilitarian braid that exposes the cranial implant', N'Long', N'Dark brown with subtle chromatic shift at the edges — side effect of dermal camouflage neural integration, almond-shaped from East Asian ancestry', N'Warm golden-brown with complex multi-regional layering: South Asian golden warmth as foundational undertone, Southeast Asian luminous depth creating radiant quality, Middle Eastern richness accentuating cheekbones and jawline, Hispanic/Latin American warmth adding subtle depth throughout. Medium-high saturation that catches light with natural iridescence.', N'Striking geometric facial structure: angular cheekbones with Southeast Asian sharpness balanced by broad Middle Eastern facial planes, strong defined jawline with South Asian structure, minimal facial hair. Skin is weathered but well-maintained — scars are few but deliberately unhidden. No cosmetic grooming; everything functional. The interplay of sharp angular features with broader facial planes creates a distinctive mixed-ancestry geometry reflecting South Asian, East Asian, Southeast Asian, and Middle Eastern heritage.', N'Cranial bomb defuser implant is prominently visible along the right side of her skull with chrome detailing and an access port. Dermal camouflage creates irregular pigmentation variations across shoulders and forearms that shift slightly under different lighting — noticeable but not grotesque. No effort made to conceal either.', N'Economical and controlled — every movement serves a purpose. She stands with weight balanced, shoulders back, ready to move in any direction. Her gaze is constant and assessing. She moves with the precision of someone trained to enter and exit spaces without leaving traces.', N'Tier 3-4 working specialist aesthetic. Black or dark gray reinforced tactical pants with utility pockets and cable routing. Loose-fit thermal undershirt. Lightweight ballistic vest with custom modifications for surveillance work — no unnecessary branding, matte finish to avoid reflection. Worn cargo jacket with multiple hidden pockets and signal-blocking lining. Pair of worn boots with reinforced soles, good for urban climbing. Everything is functional, well-maintained, and color-coordinated for Steamvent''s industrial backdrop.', N'', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'briar_seo_suwannapoom');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a5-710c-afaa-1726b59e5b76', N'Helmi Najjar-Balasanyan', N'Helmi', N'', N'Najjar-Balasanyan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, stays in a rotating series of shared squats, near Michigan Ave and Chicago Ave', N'Graffiti artist and neon artist', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone community; loosely connected to the Zone''s information networks; one legitimate neon art commission currently running through a Tessera cultural initiative they agreed to under a pseudonym', N'Helmi Najjar-Balasanyan is all angles and velocity — long-limbed, dark-skinned, with Ghanaian-Czech features that look perpetually younger than their nineteen years, which frustrates them endlessly. They keep their hair in tight coils pinned back with a self-made clip constructed from a bent network card, and they have bioluminescent freckles across their cheekbones and nose that glow faint orange under stress or excitement — a geneware mod they saved for over two years to afford. Their clothes are always paint-stained. Always. Even fresh ones develop stains within hours by some law of Helmi Najjar-Balasanyan''s personal physics.

They work at the intersection of illegal graffiti and legal neon art commissions — the commissions fund the graffiti, which funds the bigger commissions, in a cycle they describe as ''washing money through beauty.'' Their graffiti is large-scale, technically complex, and unmistakably political: maps of corporate land grabs rendered in photo-realistic detail, portraits of people displaced by development, data visualizations of pollution levels turned into murals that can be read at a glance. They have been detained by Ferrogate Transit security twice and by Axiom''s private enforcement arm once, and wear all three incidents as credentials. They are funny, quick, slightly too reckless, and working very hard to hide that they have absolutely no idea what they''re doing with their life beyond the next piece.', N'Ground-level intelligence source on corporate activity and Zone politics; can get people into or out of the Highland Park Autonomous Zone through network contacts; their art sometimes contains coded information they didn''t know they were encoding', N'', N'Bioluminescent freckles (orange, stress/excitement reactive); retractable claws on right hand only — a geneware mod they got cheap and partially regret because the left-hand option was sold out; basic subdermal paint-reservoir taps in both forearms (allows pressurized delivery to spray nozzles without external cans)', N'Sleeps late, spends afternoons in a burst of planning and materials acquisition, works from midnight to dawn — their most significant pieces are painted in darkness and discovered at sunrise.', N'Helmi Najjar-Balasanyan, 19-year-old neo-noir street artist, tall wiry build with warm golden-brown skin and reddish undertones reflecting Middle Eastern and Sub-Saharan African heritage, sharp angular cheekbones and jawline, deep brown alert eyes. Black coiled hair swept back with network card clip. Bioluminescent orange freckles glowing faintly across cheekbones and nose bridge. Paint-speckled forearms and hands covered in dried acrylic stains in blues, reds, silvers. Dark oversized hoodie, paint-stained cargo pants, grip-enhanced sneakers, canvas satchel with patches. Right hand showing subtle retractable claw irregularities at fingertips. Restless posture, weight shifted to one leg, fidgeting hands. Urban Highland Park rooftop setting, neon graffiti art in background, cool evening neo-noir lighting with orange accent glow from augmentations. Intense focus on surfaces and climbing routes, parkour-ready stance. Gritty realistic GLMZ aesthetic, Tier 5 functional street culture. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Predominantly Middle Eastern (45.3%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (27.1%) heritage, complemented by Eastern European (11.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (8.5%), Indigenous American (3.9%), and South Asian (3.3%) ancestry. This creates a rich phenotypic blend: warm golden-brown skin with reddish undertones, angular facial structure with prominent cheekbones characteristic of West Asian and East African traditions, and dark hair with natural texture. Features reflect a truly diaspora identity with no single dominant visual impression.', 178, 61, N'Wiry and angular — long-limbed with minimal body fat, all sharp joints and lean muscle developed from climbing scaffolding and reaching across twenty-foot wall sections. Movement suggests coiled energy rather than bulk.', N'Natural black with occasional paint-bleached streaks from overspray', N'Tight coils swept back and secured with a handmade clip fashioned from a bent network card, creating a deliberately industrial aesthetic', N'Short to medium length, roughly chin-level when loose', N'Deep brown, alert and constantly cataloging environments', N'Warm medium-to-deep golden-brown with reddish undertones — the result of blended Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian ancestry creating rich chromatic depth with subtle warmth across all visible surfaces', N'Young-looking features that read younger than nineteen — prominent high cheekbones with angular structure characteristic of East African and West Asian heritage, sharp jawline, minimal facial hair. Skin condition: perpetually paint-speckled across knuckles, forearms, and occasionally cheeks. Bioluminescent freckles scattered across cheekbones and bridge of nose glow faint orange when stressed or excited — visible as faintly glowing dots even in daylight, more prominent in shadows.', N'Bioluminescent freckles are immediately visible and distinctive. Right hand shows subtle irregularities at fingertips — retractable claws visible as slightly raised keratin sheaths when inactive, fully extended they appear as dark curved protrusions 2-3cm long. Forearms show faint scarring patterns consistent with subdermal implants, but the paint-reservoir taps themselves remain subcutaneous unless actively pressurizing.', N'Restless and economical — stands with weight on one leg, fidgets constantly with hands and fingers. Moves with parkour-informed efficiency, naturally scanning surfaces for climb routes and wall angles. Eye contact is inconsistent; they focus more on surfaces and spaces than faces. When concentrating on art or problem-solving, they adopt an intense stillness that contrasts sharply with their default velocity.', N'Tier 5 functional aesthetic — thrifted or salvaged base layers (oversized hoodies in dark colors, worn band/activist t-shirts), paint-stained cargo pants with multiple pockets for supplies, reinforced climbing gloves (right hand often removed mid-work), scuffed sneakers with grip-enhanced soles. Wears a canvas satchel covered in hand-stitched patches and pins representing Highland Park zones and artist collectives. Colors shift based on active projects — tends toward monochrome with accent colors matching their current major piece. Never wears corporate logos or Tier 1-2 fast fashion, not from ideology alone but because such clothing marks them as outsider/target in their zones.', N'The Tessera pseudonym commission they took is paying for gene-mod reversal consultations — they are deeply unhappy with one of their mods but won''t say which one, because the choice was so public and the money was so hard to save that admitting regret feels unbearable.', N'Fast, contemporary, code-switches between Zone slang and surprisingly precise art-critical language — the combination startles people', N'Rapid-fire with sudden stops, as though they edit themselves mid-sentence and start again', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'helmi_najjar_balasanyan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a71e-76ec-85de-174e09b7b88e', N'Higinio Hernández-Delgado', N'Higinio', N'', N'Hernández-Delgado', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 45, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Meridian Station — central transit nexus, neutral ground, near State and Monroe', N'Contract broker and resource coordinator — fixer', N'Independent — maintains network of professional contacts', N'Higinio Hernández-Delgado is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 45, scars map her face like a transit diagram of bad decisions and worse luck. The chrome is visible — synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on s — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Her entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. She works as a fixer out of Meridian Station, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Higinio Hernández-Delgado is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who she burned last.', N'As a fixer, Ximena Engstrom-Fofana embodies the tension between independence and isolation. She is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs. Gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'GLMZ portrait: Higinio Hernández-Delgado, 183cm lean muscular frame with salt-and-pepper braid, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones reflecting multicultural East Asian-Hispanic-Sub-Saharan-South Asian heritage. Angular cheekbones with broader nasal bridge and fuller lips, weathered complexion marked by three parallel scars on left cheekbone, thermal burn scar on right temple, white vertical scar bisecting upper lip. Warm brown eyes with faint orbital augmentation scarring. Dressed in charcoal synthetic leather jacket over dark synthweave tactical pants, minimal chrome jewelry, encrypted watch visible. Standing in neutral pose with straight spine, deliberate movement. Subtle chromatic shimmer visible on shins from synthetic muscle fiber implants. Neutral weary expression. Neon-lit GLMZ urban environment, cool blue and amber backlighting, gritty industrial setting. Professional, seasoned field operative aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Station', N'local', N'Meridian Station', N'Complex global ancestry: 41% Hispanic/Latin American, 23% Sub-Saharan African, 21% East Asian, 15% South Asian. This rare quaternary blend manifests in warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, bone structure combining East Asian cheekbones with broader African and South Asian nasal bridge, fuller lips, and slightly wider face. The genetic mosaic creates a distinctly multicultural appearance — neither regionally locked nor easily categorized.', 183, 71, N'Lean and long-limbed with developed musculature from years of field work. Synthetic muscle fiber in legs adds subtle bulk to calves and thighs — visible as a slight chromatic sheen under skin. Moves with economical, practiced precision.', N'Salt-and-pepper gray, naturally dark with silver threading', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid. Minimal styling — practicality over aesthetics.', N'Long', N'Warm brown with faint augmentation scarring at the orbital corners', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones, sun-weathered from decades of variable outdoor work. The blended ancestry creates subtle depth — warm East Asian-Latin golden tones enriched by Sub-Saharan richness and South Asian complexion, creating a balanced fusion rather than stark contrast.', N'Mapped with old scar tissue — three thin parallel lines across left cheekbone, puckered burn scar along right temple hairline, white knife-wound scar bisecting upper lip. Minimal makeup. Skin shows texture and history; grooming is clean but not refined. Facial structure reflects the multicultural ancestry: East Asian eye shape and upper face definition, broader nasal bridge from African heritage, fuller lips and slightly wider face from South Asian and African genetics, creating a cosmopolitan blend.', N'Synthetic muscle fiber replacement visible in legs as subtle chromatic shimmer under skin, especially calves and thighs — noticeable when moving quickly or wearing form-fitting clothing. Gecko-grip fingertip implants visible as faint metallic stippling on fingertips and toe pads when hands/feet are examined closely. No obvious chrome plating or obvious neural ports.', N'Stands with shoulders relaxed but spine straight. Moves with deliberate economy — every motion purposeful, no wasted energy. Favors stairs with caution due to synthetic leg limitations but compensates with handrail usage. Climbs with unusual fluidity thanks to gecko-grip implants. Resting expression is neutral to slightly weary; maintains eye contact during negotiations.', N'Tier 3-4 functional wear. Standard: fitted dark synthweave pants with cargo pockets, reinforced synthetic leather jacket (usually charcoal or black, worn but maintained), layered base clothes in neutral tones. Footwear is always climbing-friendly (grippy soles). Jewelry minimal — watch with encrypted display (professional tool, not fashion), no other visible adornment. Clothing shows wear and repair but is clean and intentional. No corp branding. Dressed for function and mobility, not status.', N'', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'higinio_hern_ndez_delgado');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a711-70ea-909d-1766b084494d', N'Gautami Kulkarni', N'Gautami', N'', N'Kulkarni', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 14, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Copperhead, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Street kid and gang prospect for the Copperhead Strays; informal lookout', N'Copperhead Strays (prospect/junior affiliate)', N'Gautami Kulkarni is wiry and quick with a bruise that''s always in some stage of yellowing somewhere on her face, arms, or shins — not from violence, mostly, but from moving through the city like it owes her something and hasn''t paid up. She has medium-brown skin, natural hair she''s grown into a large puff that she wraps in a strip of copper-colored fabric to match the Copperhead Strays'' aesthetic, and geneware cat ears in a dark red-brown she saved up three months of small jobs to buy from a back-alley mod shop. The ears were supposed to mark her as cool. They do. She wears them with specific, deliberate pride.

She is not yet a full Stray — she''s in what the older members call the ''prospect'' phase, which mostly means she runs lookout shifts, carries non-incriminating packages, and tries very hard not to look like she''s trying very hard. She''s funny and quick-tongued and operates at a social speed that leaves adults slightly breathless. Underneath the performance is a thirteen-year-old''s terror wearing a fourteen-year-old''s face, because she knows exactly what full Stray membership involves and she is not sure she wants it, but she doesn''t know what else there is.', N'Entry point into street gang culture from the junior/peripheral level; local color; can provide information about Copperhead territory and Stray activity; potential storyline about whether she gets pulled deeper in or finds an exit.', N'', N'Cosmetic geneware cat ears (dark red-brown). No other augmentations.', N'Sleeps in a Strays crash space in a decommissioned substation; lookout shifts in the afternoons and some evenings; spends mornings running small legitimate errands for market vendors to keep pocket money that doesn''t go through the Strays.', N'Gautami Kulkarni, 158cm wiry street kid with warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, defined high cheekbones and pointed chin blending South Asian, Hispanic, and Northern European heritage. Dark brown eyes scanning nervously, natural dark brown hair in medium puff wrapped with copper fabric strip. Dark red-brown cosmetic geneware cat ears with LED circuitry. Yellowing bruise on left cheekbone mid-heal stage, faint acne scars on jawline, perpetual dark circles. Wearing oversized faded gray Copperhead Strays hoodie, black cargo pants with copper wire reinforcements, mismatched-laced worn canvas sneakers, copper chain bracelet. Coiled posture with nervous shoulder tension, weight shifting stance. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, gritty neon-lit street setting, dramatic side-lighting casting shadows across her alert, scanning expression, urban decay background, moody teal and orange color grading --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Copperhead', N'local', N'Copperhead', N'Dominant South Asian ancestry (47.5%) creates the foundation of her features, enriched by Northern European (20.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (18.6%), Southeast Asian (11.2%), and Sub-Saharan African (2.1%) contributions. This genetic blend produces warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones, South Asian facial structure softened by subtle width from Hispanic heritage, and depth enhanced by African ancestry. The combination creates distinctive high cheekbones with a pointed chin, warm brown eyes, and natural dark hair texture.', 158, 45, N'Wiry and lean with the taut musculature of someone who moves constantly through urban terrain. No excess body fat; shoulders slightly forward from habitual tension.', N'Natural dark brown', N'Large natural puff, wrapped at the crown with a copper-colored fabric strip in Copperhead Strays aesthetic', N'Medium (3-4 inches when loose)', N'Dark brown', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones, reflecting the dominant South Asian ancestry blended with Northern European paleness, Hispanic warmth, and subtle Sub-Saharan African depth', N'Youthful but weathered with warm medium-brown tones throughout; strong, defined cheekbones with subtle width characteristic of her multicultural heritage, and a pointed chin from South Asian ancestry. Skin shows the wear of street life—faint acne scarring on her jawline, perpetual dark circles under her eyes from inconsistent sleep. Her face has the alertness of someone scanning constantly.', N'Cosmetic geneware cat ears (dark red-brown, slightly translucent at the edges) positioned naturally on her head. The ears are her most deliberate statement—well-maintained, with faint LED circuitry visible when light hits them at certain angles. No other visible augmentations.', N'Perpetually coiled; she moves with quick, economical gestures and rarely sits still. Her eyes dart—scanning faces, exits, threats. She carries herself with the false confidence of someone performing fearlessness, but her shoulders betray nervous tension. When standing, her weight shifts frequently from one foot to the other.', N'Tier 5 street wear: oversized gray hoodie (faded Copperhead Strays logo on the back, hand-stitched repairs), black cargo pants with multiple pockets (some reinforced with copper wire), worn canvas sneakers with mismatched laces. A copper chain bracelet on her left wrist—low-value metal, but it''s her marker. No intact jacket; she layers hoodies instead. Clothing is functional, somewhat ill-fitting (either salvaged or hand-me-downs), and deliberately non-descript except for the copper Strays indicators.', N'She has been secretly attending a free after-hours fabrication class run by a retired Arcturus engineer in a Copperhead community space. She has told no one in the Strays. She doesn''t know what she''s building yet but she shows up every week. The engineer has told her she has real aptitude.', N'Fast, slang-heavy, Copperhead street vernacular mixed with occasional technical terms she''s picked up from the fab class; code-switches dramatically depending on audience', N'Rapid-fire delivery; sentences run into each other; uses silence deliberately for comic effect', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gautami_kulkarni');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5df-7dfd-b7b3-17cac0d55fc4', N'Cyrus Möller-Fredriksen', N'Cyrus', N'', N'Möller-Fredriksen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 51, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Meridian Core, near State and Jackson', N'Mid-tier corporate compliance auditor and covert information broker', N'Veltris Solutions (Senior Compliance Auditor, official); independent information broker (covert, no organizational affiliation)', N'Cyrus Möller-Fredriksen is a broad-shouldered Filipino-Swedish man of fifty-one who has spent so long performing the aesthetics of institutional trust that they have half-become real. He dresses in muted, expensive neutrals — nothing that would be remembered — and carries himself with the particular stillness of someone who learned long ago that a calm body reads as an authoritative one. His hair has gone fully silver and he wears it short and immaculate. The only thing that slightly undermines the effect is his habit of rolling a small obsidian bead between his fingers when he thinks no one is watching.

Officially, Cyrus Möller-Fredriksen is a Senior Compliance Auditor for Veltris Solutions, one of the Meridian Core''s mid-weight corporate entities specializing in infrastructure licensing. He is very good at his job. He is also, quietly, one of the most reliable information brokers operating at the corporate tier — not a dealer in secrets so much as a dealer in context. He does not sell raw data; he sells the correct reading of data, the understanding of what something means and who it benefits. His clients are executives, rivals, occasionally investigators who can afford him.

Cyrus Möller-Fredriksen came to the Core from Old Harbor, a trajectory he has spent twenty years making illegible by careful accumulation of the right credentials, the right accent, the right address. He is not ashamed of Old Harbor. He is terrified of going back. The distinction matters to him and he is honest about it with himself at two in the morning when the distinction feels very thin. He has one adult daughter he supports financially and sees three times a year, and the relationship is exactly as complicated as that arrangement suggests.', N'Moral complexity at the corporate tier; embodies the cost of assimilation and the violence of institutional complicity; provides access to Core-level information and plot mechanics while remaining personally compromised', N'', N'Cortical memory indexer (standard corporate-tier, allows near-perfect recall of documents and conversations),Subvocal communication implant for silent calls,Subtle biometric regulation implant that suppresses visible stress indicators — heart rate, micro-expression, perspiration — installed voluntarily for professional performance', N'Arrives at Veltris before most colleagues, leaves after most. Eats lunch alone and considers it the most honest part of his day. Meets brokering clients in three rotating locations, never the same week twice. Sends Remedios a bank transfer on the first of each month with no accompanying message. Rolls the obsidian bead — his mother''s, from a rosary — in quiet moments and does not call it prayer.', N'Cyrus Möller-Fredriksen, 180cm tall, broad-shouldered corporate man with silver-gray cropped hair and warm olive-bronze skin reflecting Northern European and Middle Eastern ancestry balanced with East Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Dark brown unaugmented eyes, defined cheekbones, balanced facial structure, subtle scar on left jawline visible in certain light. Clean-shaven, weathered but well-maintained complexion. Seated in corporate stillness, hands steady, wearing tailored charcoal suit and pale gray shirt, silver wedding band, polished shoes. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool corporate office lighting, professional trust-building aesthetic, institutional rather than individual, everything expensive in an unremarkable way. Mood: controlled, practiced stillness, the performance of professionalism. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Meridian Core', N'local', N'The Meridian Core', N'Northern European and Middle Eastern ancestry form the visual foundation (76% combined), with meaningful contributions from East Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and minor Sub-Saharan African ancestry. This creates a balanced, non-dominant phenotype where Northern European bone structure and Middle Eastern definition share equal visual weight, tempered by East Asian angularity in the eye area and subtle warmth from the Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African components. His features embody the Ubiquitous Diaspora''s characteristic genetic recombination — ancestry visible but not categorizable.', 180, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial without heaviness; the frame of someone who came from manual labor tier but has maintained discipline through corporate years. Solid, not athletic — the weight sits in his chest and shoulders.', N'Silver-gray, fully natural transition', N'Short, cropped close to the scalp, immaculately groomed', N'Short', N'Dark brown, unaugmented', N'Warm olive-bronze with golden undertones, the direct result of Northern European paleness and Middle Eastern depth blended with East Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and minor Sub-Saharan African warmth. The tone reads as Mediterranean but with subtle golden richness.', N'Weathered but well-maintained; minimal visible lines despite age, suggesting either genetic luck or subtle cosmetic intervention. Clean-shaven. Skin has the particular clarity of someone who treats their face as a professional asset. Facial structure is balanced between Northern European regularity and Middle Eastern definition, with defined cheekbones and slightly squared jawline. East Asian genetics contribute subtle eye area angularity and slightly higher cheekbone prominence. Complexion is even-toned across the face with no unusual discoloration.', N'None. The cortical indexer, subvocal implant, and biometric regulation implant are all subcutaneous or neural. His eyes are unmodified. He wears a thin silver wedding band on his right ring finger — not married, a deliberate aesthetic choice for professional trust-building.', N'Unnaturally still when seated or in conversation — the practiced stillness of someone who learned that motion reads as anxiety. Moves with economy when he does move. His hands are steady and his breathing is controlled. When alone, occasionally rolls something small between his fingers (the obsidian bead), a micro-movement that suggests his stillness is a performance, not a nature.', N'Tier 2-3 corporate neutral: tailored charcoal and navy suits from mid-tier makers, white or pale gray shirts, minimal jewelry beyond the ring. Shoes are always polished. He dresses to be forgotten, to read as institutional rather than individual. Everything is expensive in a way that does not announce itself. His watch is a mid-range chronometer, intentionally unremarkable.', N'Three years ago he obtained and suppressed information that would have exposed a Veltris subsidiary''s involvement in the displacement of several Old Harbor residential blocks, including the building where his mother lived until her death. He suppressed it because releasing it would have exposed his brokering operation. He has not fully processed this and may never.', N'Boardroom-precise, slightly formal, with occasional idiomatic slippages into Tagalog or blunt Old Harbor directness when he is tired or cornered; uses passive constructions to distribute responsibility', N'Measured and deliberate, each sentence placed like a document on a desk; rarely raises his voice; silence is a tool he uses consciously', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cyrus_m_ller_fredriksen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a73c-757e-adeb-17e0e92ab8d8', N'Damilola Rahman', N'Damilola', N'', N'Rahman', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Blackpipe Corridor, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Black market pharmaceutical dealer and street pharmacist — meds, supplements, unscheduled compounds', N'Independent; loosely affiliated with the Blackpipe Corridor residents network; pays an informal fee to the local Oxidian Market Guild chapter not to be reported', N'Damilola Rahman is young enough that it still shows — there''s a looseness to him, an unresolved quality, like something that hasn''t quite hardened into its final shape. He is tall, lean, with the dark skin and angular jaw of his Tanzanian grandfather and his Filipino grandmother''s round cheeks, a combination that makes him look younger than he is and which he has mostly given up being frustrated about. His ears are tipped with small black cat-ear points — geneware done in a parlor on a dare when he was nineteen, which he now can''t imagine removing. He keeps his hair mid-length and loose, usually damp, because he is always running slightly late.

He operates from three locations in rotation — a corner in the Narrows, a back table in a noodle shop in Blackpipe Corridor, and a patch near the old water reclamation junction on the Corridor''s south end — and keeps no fixed stall because fixed stalls have fixed addresses. He knows more about pharmacology than most licensed clinicians, taught himself from pirated Helix Biosystems training modules and a mentor who has since retired. He is genuinely trying to help people who cannot afford clinical pricing — and he is also genuinely dealing recreational compounds for profit — and he holds both of these truths without significant cognitive dissonance, which either speaks to moral flexibility or a realistic understanding of how survival works.', N'Resource for medical supplies outside clinical channels. Information source for what''s circulating in the Narrows chemically and otherwise. Character study in the ethics of harm reduction in a predatory economy.', N'', N'Cat-ear points, black (geneware, cosmetic). No other augmentations — he has spent money on these things and it has always gone to something more urgent.', N'He rotates between his three spots on a rough weekly schedule he shares with trusted clients via a dead-drop comm channel. He spends mornings acquiring stock — legal supplements through a legitimate channel he cultivates carefully, unscheduled compounds through three separate suppliers he never introduces to each other. He is chronically sleep-deprived.', N'Damilola Rahman, 24-year-old neo-noir street pharmacist, East Asian-South Asian-Indigenous American mixed heritage with warm golden-brown skin tone. Dark tired eyes, dark brown hair mid-length waves partially obscuring face. Strong East Asian facial geometry softened by South Asian fullness, prominent Indigenous American cheekbones. Black cosmetic cat-ear geneware grafted to ear tips. Lean angular 188cm frame, restless energy even when still. Wearing faded teal windbreaker layered over grey thermal shirt, black cargo pants with working pockets, worn sneakers. Genuine leather satchel slung across body. Small white scar visible on inside of left wrist. Steel ring on right index finger. Perpetual dark circles, stubble shadow, minor jaw scarring. Forward-leaning posture as if always about to move. Neon-lit Blackpipe Corridor alleyway at dusk, pharmaceutical vials visible in jacket pockets, moody atmospheric lighting catching the warm undertones of his skin, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Predominantly East Asian with significant South Asian ancestry, complemented by Indigenous American heritage. The genetic diaspora creates striking feature harmony: East Asian facial geometry and bone structure form the foundation, enriched by South Asian skin depth and warmth, with subtle Indigenous American characteristics visible in cheekbone prominence and facial proportions. He reads as visibly mixed-heritage, features that reflect the Ubiquitous Diaspora rather than any single regional origin.', 188, 71, N'Lean and angular, long-limbed with minimal body fat. The build of someone who forgets to eat regularly and moves constantly. Defined shoulders and chest, but no deliberate musculature — it''s the leanness of motion, not training.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Mid-length, loose waves, usually damp or freshly dried. Worn unstyled, parted vaguely in the center. Often falls across his face when he bends over his work.', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, tired', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden undertones — the result of East Asian and South Asian ancestry blending with Indigenous American heritage. Complex saturation that shifts with light, alive with warmth. Uneven from irregular sleep and sun exposure across multiple outdoor locations.', N'Strong East Asian facial geometry softened by South Asian fullness in the lower face, with Indigenous American prominence in the cheekbones creating a distinctive angular-yet-rounded facial structure. The combination reads younger than his 24 years. Perpetual dark circles under his eyes. A faint shadow of stubble most days — shaving is a luxury when you''re running late. Minor acne scarring on his jaw from his late teens. Nose shows East Asian structure with subtle bridge definition.', N'Cat-ear points only. Everything else is baseline human biology. His pharmaceutical knowledge doesn''t show — it lives in his hands and his memory.', N'Perpetually in motion, even when standing still. A slight forward lean as though always about to move somewhere more urgent. Fidgets with vials, capsules, or whatever''s in his pockets. His hands are steady — a pharmacist''s hands — but his overall energy is scattered, restless. When he focuses on a customer or a transaction, it''s sudden and complete, like a cat''s attention snapping to movement. Otherwise, he seems to be three locations ahead of where he actually is.', N'Tier 3-4 streetwear, practical and worn. Usually black or grey cargo pants with working pockets (essential for inventory rotation). Hoodies and layered thermal shirts, often partially unzipped. A particular affection for a faded teal windbreaker that''s seen three years of Blackpipe Corridor weather. Worn sneakers, replaced frequently because he walks constantly. A small satchel he keeps close — genuine leather, worn soft, carries his rotation stock. No jewelry except for a simple steel ring on his right index finger (the hand he uses to dispense). Clothes are clean but unstudied, the uniform of someone who dresses in the dark or while already thinking about something else.', N'Four months ago a client came to him in acute overdose crisis on a compound he didn''t sell her. He stabilized her using everything he had, stayed with her for six hours, and when she was through the worst of it she told him her supplier''s name. He has been building a dossier on that supplier since, with no clear plan for what to do with it — he is not a violent person and he is not an informant, and the space between those two things is where he is stuck.', N'Casual, warm, clinical when talking about compounds — the vocabulary shift is notable and a little jarring. Uses a lot of ''like'' and ''basically'' and ''no, listen'' when animated. Swears cheerfully.', N'Fast when comfortable, careful when discussing medications — he slows down for dosages like he''s reading from an internal teleprompter.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'damilola_rahman');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68e-74c5-bce7-1866c2269574', N'Gogo Keïta-Bergqvist', N'Gogo', N'', N'Keïta-Bergqvist', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Blackpipe Corridor, near North Ave and Damen', N'Street doc and augmentation technician, The Narrows', N'Independent; loose network of Narrows street docs; pays informal tribute to a Zheng-Dao mid-level manager who leaves him alone in exchange; The Bone Parish', N'Gogo Keïta-Bergqvist works out of a converted boiler room in the sub-level of a residential block in Blackpipe Corridor — a space he has made into something between a surgery and a shrine. String lights in amber and violet illuminate walls covered in technical diagrams, old family photographs laminated against water damage, and hand-painted offerings to three different E.L.F.s. He is a large man going slightly soft at the middle from years of sedentary precision work, with deep brown skin, a wide flat nose, and thick locs he keeps bundled under a surgical cap when he''s working. His geneware is modest: a bioluminescent stripe that runs from behind his right ear down his neck, pale teal, that he had done when he was twenty-two and now thinks of as just part of his face.

He has the particular warmth of someone who chose his community after losing another one — unhurried, genuinely curious about people, prone to feeding anyone who comes to him with something from the hotplate he keeps running on the counter. He is not licensed by any corponation. He trained under a Helix-registered surgeon who lost her license and passed everything she knew to him in a basement in Ironvein. He is very good at what he does and he charges what people can pay, which is rarely enough, which he has made his peace with in a way that isn''t entirely convincing.', N'Accessible medical resource for Tier 1-2 characters who can''t or won''t use Aurochs; community hub and information node; can perform augmentation installation or repair outside corporate oversight; warm face in a cold district.', N'', N'Bioluminescent geneware stripe (right neck, teal); cheap magnification implant in right eye for close work — a knockoff that gives him occasional headaches; subvocal transmitter for hands-free communication during procedures', N'Opens around noon, works until he''s done — sometimes 2am. Checks in on three elderly patients in his block on foot each morning. Cooks communal food twice a week for whoever shows up. Prays to the E.L.F. Patchwire every time he opens a piece of cyberware.', N'Gogo Keïta-Bergqvist, 188cm tall surgeon with warm medium-brown skin tone and golden undertones, deep brown eyes (right eye with subtle amber implant artifact), long black locs loosely gathered, strong defined cheekbones and robust jawline. Broad-shouldered large frame with soft midsection, standing with deliberate groundedness. Wearing layered practical gear: dark cargo pants, worn linen overshirt stained with coolant, unbuttoned surgical smock, worn leather work boots. Faded prayer beads bracelet on left wrist. Pale teal bioluminescent geneware stripe glowing softly along right neck and behind ear. Surgical scars visible on hands, small burn mark on left forearm. Standing in dimly-lit underground clinic in the Narrows, GLMZ, meditative focused expression, subtle ambient lighting catching the bioluminescent stripe, gritty industrial setting with surgical equipment in soft focus background, atmospheric neon and practical work-light, photorealistic, character portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Complex diaspora blend: Middle Eastern (37.6%), Sub-Saharan African (34.7%), and Northern European (27.7%) ancestry. This tripartite mix creates a warm medium-brown complexion with golden and subtle olive undertones—the African and Middle Eastern components dominating while Northern European genetics add depth and complexity to the overall tone. Facial structure reflects balanced influence across all three lineages: strong, defined cheekbones and robust jawline from African and Middle Eastern heritage, softened and refined by Northern European bone structure; nose shows the characteristic bridge prominence of Middle Eastern ancestry integrated with the broader nasal base common in African features; eye shape and orbital structure show the Northern European influence tempering the warmth of the other lineages.', 188, 94, N'Large-framed, broad-shouldered, with soft accumulation at the midsection from years bent over surgical workstations. Still carries the foundational mass of someone who was athletic in youth.', N'Black', N'Thick locs, usually bundled under a surgical cap during work; worn loose below shoulders when off the clock', N'Long', N'Deep brown (right eye hosts magnification implant with faint amber lens artifact)', N'Warm medium brown with golden and subtle olive undertones, reflecting balanced Middle Eastern, African, and Northern European ancestry', N'Clear, well-maintained despite the Narrows environment; prominent defined cheekbones and strong jawline reflecting the African and Middle Eastern genetic dominance; calloused fingertips from precision work; concentration lines around the eyes and laugh lines from genuine smiling; subtle warmth to the complexion that speaks to the interplay of three continental heritage lines', N'Pale teal bioluminescent stripe on right neck/behind ear (glows softly in darkness); faint amber lens distortion visible in right eye when light hits it at certain angles; subvocal transmitter invisible beneath skin along jaw', N'Moves with deliberate care and groundedness despite his size. When working, hunches slightly over surgical surfaces with almost meditative focus. In social settings, stands with weight balanced, unhurried, often gestures with open palms. No nervous fidgeting.', N'Tier 4-5 practical: worn dark scrub bottoms or cargo pants with multiple pockets for tools; layered with an old linen overshirt (often stained with coolant or synth-blood) and a surgical smock worn unbuttoned. Worn leather work boots. A faded prayer beads bracelet on left wrist. No corporate branding; everything is second-hand or salvaged.', N'The Zheng-Dao manager he pays tribute to has been gradually increasing what he demands — not money, but information. Ousmane has been passing along names of people who came to him with certain kinds of injuries, telling himself it''s harmless, knowing it isn''t.', N'Warm, conversational, mixes medical precision with neighborhood slang; uses Wolof endearments unconsciously; explains everything he''s doing to patients in plain language as he works', N'Unhurried and rhythmic, like someone who has all the time in the world even when he doesn''t', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gogo_ke_ta_bergqvist');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e0-7c49-acd0-190ae6d969ff', N'Cande Lindström-Lindström', N'Cande', N'', N'Lindström-Lindström', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 36, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ashfield — former residential district, half-burned, now squatter territory, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Aerial extraction and rapid transit pilot — getaway pilot', N'Independent — maintains network of professional contacts', N'Cande Lindström-Lindström are lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 36, there''s something unfinished about their face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on s — and they make no effort to hide it.

Their entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. They work as a getaway pilot out of Ashfield, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

What Cande Lindström-Lindström lacks in subtlety, they compensate for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'As a getaway pilot, Suki Vikstrom-Asiedu embodies the tension between independence and isolation. They are a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs. Cranial bomb defuser — specialized implant that detects and neutralizes cortex bombs in others', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Cande Lindström-Lindström, 174cm lean angular frame, warm deep brown skin with golden olive undertones reflecting Southeast Asian, Pacific Islander, South Asian, Sub-Saharan, and Hispanic heritage blend. Angular face with prominent cheekbones, Southeast Asian eye shape, South Asian nose bridge, pale gray augmented eyes with faint LED shimmer. Dark brown hair with silver temples pulled in tight functional braid. Jagged white scar temple to jawline, faint burn marks right shoulder. Both synthetic legs mid-thigh down with visible muscle fiber replacement, mechanical joint articulation, ankle status lights. Wearing charcoal reinforced cargo pants, worn thin black synthetic leather jacket, professional tactical boots. Single steel band on left ring finger. Standing in ready-position weight forward, economical movements. GLMZ, GLMZ urban environment, cool neon-tinted ambient lighting casting shadows across scarred features, calculating neutral expression, calculating threat-assessment posture, high-tech mundane mood. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfield', N'local', N'Ashfield', N'Mixed diaspora heritage: 35% Southeast Asian, 25.6% Pacific Islander, 13.8% Hispanic/Latin American, 13.6% South Asian, 9% Sub-Saharan African, 3% Northern European. Features reflect this complex tropical-to-equatorial blend—Southeast Asian eye shape and cheekbone structure combined with Pacific Islander warmth and broader facial proportions, enriched by South Asian nose bridge definition and brow structure, with Sub-Saharan depth and Hispanic/Latin undertones. The result is a warm, distinctly multicultural appearance that reads as authentically diaspora without easy categorization.', 174, 62, N'Lean and angular with pronounced musculature — the synthetic leg replacements add visible bulk to the calves and thighs, creating an asymmetrical silhouette that reads as purposeful rather than athletic', N'Dark brown with silver threading at the temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid; practical, zero maintenance', N'Medium', N'Pale gray with minor augmentation: faint LED hazing at the iris edges, subcutaneous neural interface visible as faint metallic shimmer under bright light', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden and olive undertones—the result of Southeast Asian base richness blended with Pacific Islander warmth, South Asian depth, and Sub-Saharan saturation. Evenly toned, slightly weathered by exposure and environmental stress.', N'Distinctly multicultural face with blended tropical-equatorial features: prominent Southeast Asian cheekbones balanced by Pacific Islander facial width, South Asian nose bridge definition and brow structure, warmed by Sub-Saharan undertones and Hispanic/Latin softening. Minimal grooming beyond functional necessity. Skin shows minor scars and weathering. Expression defaults to neutral-focused, eyes always calculating.', N'Both legs from mid-thigh downward show visible synthetic muscle fiber replacement — the replacement tissue is a fractionally different shade and texture than biological skin, with subtle mechanical joint articulation visible at the knees and ankles. The replacements are functional and unadorned, no chrome paneling. Faint power-line scarring visible where the synthetic connects to biological tissue. Minor LED indicator lights (status lights) embedded at the ankle joints, visible only at night or in low light', N'Stands with weight forward on the balls of feet — ready-position default. Movements are economical and precise; no wasted motion. Walks with a slight asymmetry due to the synthetic legs, but the gait is smooth and controlled. Has a habit of tensing shoulders when listening to someone, a physical manifestation of processing threat-assessment. Hand movements are deliberate — reaches are slow and obvious, nothing sudden', N'Tier 3-4 functional: reinforced cargo pants in muted gray or charcoal with oversized pockets and thigh webbing, synthetic leather jacket worn thin in places, black or dark green. No branding visible — stripped or removed. Boots are professional-grade tactical footwear, laced tight, soles worn from constant movement. Underneath: layered thermal base for temperature regulation in aircraft. No jewelry beyond a single flat steel band on left ring finger — functional, not decorative. Clothing shows minor stains and repairs; maintained for function, not appearance', N'Suki Vikstrom-Asiedu witnessed a massacre during a corporate dispute and has evidence stored in a dead drop. Publishing it would expose powerful people. Keeping it is leverage and liability.', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cande_lindstr_m_lindstr_m');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a663-7c62-8c9e-19238a835d90', N'Donatello Karimi', N'Donatello', N'', N'Karimi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Irkalla, the Passage House on Undertow Row, near Western and Division', N'Death midwife and grief ritualist', N'Independent; loosely recognized by the Irkalla Community Council; occasional referrals from Aurochs Medical Complex palliative ward', N'Donatello Karimi is a small woman who dresses exclusively in undyed natural fabrics, a deliberate choice that makes her look slightly out of place in every room she enters — soft and pale against the city''s chrome and neon. Her hair is kept short and natural, and she wears no cosmetic geneware, though she could afford minimal modifications. Her one concession to body alteration is a set of patterned irises �� concentric rings of amber and dark brown — that she had done in honor of her Yoruba grandmother''s description of the eye of god. Her hands are her most expressive feature: large, warm, always slightly in motion, and the first thing the dying reach for.

She came to death midwifery after her brother died alone in a Tessera medical pod, his passing logged and timestamped and unremarked. She was twenty-two. She spent three years studying under an older practitioner in the Canopy before establishing the Passage House in Irkalla, which is considered by most city planners to be an unfavorable address for anyone seeking comfort. Donatello Karimi disagrees. She thinks the dying deserve to be somewhere honest about what it is. The Passage House sees four to eight clients a week — some terminal, some simply old, some not yet dying but preparing — and she has never turned anyone away for inability to pay.', N'Emotional grounding figure; can provide information about recent deaths in Irkalla and surrounding areas; quest giver for honoring someone''s final wishes; confronts players with questions about mortality and meaning', N'', N'Patterned irises (cosmetic geneware, amber/brown concentric rings); low-grade haptic sensitivity enhancement in both hands (medical-grade, for pulse and tremor detection)', N'Mornings are for correspondence and intake — she answers every message personally; afternoons and evenings she spends at bedsides, conducting whatever rituals the dying person and their family practice or wish to practice.', N'Portrait of Donatello Karimi, 158cm tall East African-Levantine woman with deep warm brown skin glowing with golden undertones, short natural black hair with silver at temples, augmented amber-to-brown concentric ring irises catching light hypnotically. Lean dancer''s frame in cream linen layered tunic and wide-leg trousers, oatmeal linen shawl draped across shoulders. Thin white scar visible along left jawline, faint ritual scarification on upper back visible through open neckline. Silver engraved ring on right hand. Small hip pouch with ritual objects. Standing with graceful posture, head tilted slightly, in soft warm diffuse light contrasting against cool megacity backdrop of 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Deeply lined eyes and mouth showing lived wisdom. Natural, undyed aesthetic creates striking contrast with neon surroundings. Photorealistic, dignified, meditative. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Irkalla', N'local', N'Irkalla', N'Predominantly Middle Eastern (61.2%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (37.3%) ancestry and trace South Asian (1.5%) heritage. Her genetic blend creates a striking East African-Levantine phenotype with warm, deep richness—high cheekbones and refined bone structure characteristic of the Levant combined with the luminous depth of Sub-Saharan ancestry. Her features speak to the historical crossroads of trade and migration across the Arabian Peninsula and Horn of Africa.', 158, 52, N'Small-framed and lean, with a dancer''s posture despite her age—shoulders open, spine naturally aligned. Her frame carries no excess but reads as strong rather than fragile; the musculature of someone who moves with intention.', N'Natural black with silver threading at the temples and along the crown', N'Cropped close to the scalp, revealing the contours of her skull; edges maintained with precision but without vanity', N'Short', N'Augmented: concentric rings of amber (outer) transitioning to dark brown (inner), creating a hypnotic iris pattern that catches light distinctly', N'Deep warm brown with rich undertones—a radiant blend of Middle Eastern and Sub-Saharan heritage, with subtle amber and golden notes that seem to glow from within. The tone is luminous yet grounded, speaking to sun-rooted ancestry across multiple latitudes.', N'Unlined for her age in some places, deeply lined around her eyes and mouth in others—the geography of witnessing. High cheekbones with strong, elegant definition reflecting Levantine structure, a refined nose bridge with subtle breadth, and warm-toned skin that reads as both luminous and matte. Clear and unadorned, with no cosmetic geneware. Her hands show faint discoloration from repeated contact with dying skin; her nails are trimmed short and unpainted.', N'Her irises are visibly non-human—the concentric ring pattern is precise and luminescent in certain light, immediately recognizable as geneware. Otherwise, no visible augmentations; her haptic enhancements are subcutaneous and undetectable without medical scanning.', N'She moves with economy and grace, never rushing. Her gestures are fluid but deliberate—hands speaking as much as her voice. She has a habit of tilting her head slightly when listening, as if the angle helps her hear better. She sits deeply, as if anchoring herself to the space.', N'Exclusively natural, undyed fabrics—linen, cotton, hemp, raw silk in cream, ivory, pale grey, and soft brown. Loose-fitting layered tunics, wide-leg trousers, soft leather sandals worn thin. A long shawl in oatmeal linen, always present, worn wrapped or draped. No logos, no synthetic fibers, no visible branding. Her clothes look handmade or sourced from artisan vendors—deliberately counter to the city''s neon-soaked aesthetic. Small pouch worn at her hip containing ritual objects: stones, dried herbs, water in a carved bone vessel. She wears a single piece of jewelry: a thin silver band on her right ring finger, engraved with script.', N'She has a terminal diagnosis — a slow cardiac condition that her haptic hand-sensitivity enhancement is quietly compensating for. She has told no one. She is not ready to be the one receiving care.', N'Plain, unadorned, but precisely chosen; avoids euphemism for death — says ''dying'' and ''death'' and ''body'' without flinching; occasionally slips into Yoruba endearments', N'Unhurried and low; holds silences without discomfort; lets others finish every sentence', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'donatello_karimi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a705-7717-805c-1981cfc7ead9', N'Khalil Migizi', N'Khalil', N'', N'Migizi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hough Reclamation, GLMZ, near Western and Division', N'Protest coordinator and mutual aid organizer serving the Gray Zone and Hough Reclamation districts', N'the Gray Zone Mutual Aid Network (coordinator), Hough Reclamation Neighborhood Council (elected), informal ties to the Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Khalil Migizi is lean and angular with a long neck and the kind of stillness that belongs to people who grew up in crowded spaces and learned to take up exactly the amount of room they needed and no more. Their skin is deep brown with a warm undertone, and they have patterned irises — a cosmetic mod done with pigment injections, producing a geometric ring of burnt orange around the pupil that makes their gaze unsettling in photographs. Their hair is kept very short, almost shaved. They dress functionally, with a persistent preference for dark colors that won''t show damage from protest conditions.

Khalil Migizi has lived in Hough Reclamation their entire life and has watched three different waves of supposed ''revitalization'' turn into displacement. They are twenty-four years old and already tired of promises. What they are not tired of is logistics — they have a genuine gift for coordination, for understanding how bodies move through space, how information needs to flow in chaotic conditions, how to build a supply chain out of mutual obligation and goodwill. They coordinate the Gray Zone Mutual Aid, a network that distributes food, medical supplies, and emergency housing connections across two districts. They have a complicated relationship with attention — they need people to show up and to trust the network, but they find visibility personally uncomfortable.', N'Resource and community connection hub, local color, someone who knows everyone in two districts and can vouch for or warn against anyone.', N'', N'Patterned irises (cosmetic, pigment injection). A cheap mesh implant in their left wrist — not a full data sleeve, more of a scheduling and coordination node that syncs with the mutual aid network''s distribution software. A small sub-dermal biomonitor installed by a community clinic that tracks stress markers and sends alerts if they''re in crisis territory — a condition of receiving the mutual aid network''s health stipend.', N'Morning distribution runs with the mutual aid network, afternoon spent at the Neighborhood Council office processing appeals and emergencies, evenings planning the next action or training new volunteers — they eat when someone puts food in front of them.', N'Khalil Migizi, 171cm lean angular figure, warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones reflecting Middle Eastern, Indigenous American, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic heritage blend. Shaved black hair, angular cheekbones with indigenous width, long neck. Striking geometric burnt-orange starburst pattern injected around deep brown eyes creating haunting four-pointed design. Visible subdermal mesh grid on left wrist glowing faint blue. Healing acne marks on jawline, calloused hands. Wearing black long-sleeve thermal under dark technical vest, paint-stained dark grey cargo pants, worn black steel-toed boots, battered black puffer jacket with hand-added reflective tape. Canvas crossbody bag. Surgical mask obscuring lower face. Precise, economical posture, unflinching level gaze. GLMZ utilitarian aesthetic, industrial setting with warehouse shadows and neon diagnostic light reflecting off implant, cool blue and warm tungsten lighting, gritty texture, Tier 4-5 district atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hough Reclamation', N'local', N'Hough Reclamation', N'Complex multi-continental phenotype with Middle Eastern primary ancestry (32%) blended with significant Indigenous American (19.4%), Hispanic/Latin American (19.1%), and South Asian (14.6%) components, alongside Sub-Saharan African (10.3%) and East Asian (4.6%) contributions. This genetic constellation produces a warm medium-brown complexion with golden and olive undertones, facial structure that combines angular Middle Eastern features with the broader, more prominent cheekbones characteristic of Indigenous American and South Asian ancestry, and a refined bone structure that bridges all these traditions. The skin carries warmth from African heritage with richness and depth from South Asian genetics.', 171, 58, N'Lean and angular with minimal soft tissue, long-limbed and economical in movement. The build of someone who has never had excess and doesn''t waste energy on unnecessary gesture.', N'Black', N'Cut very close to the scalp, almost shaved, maintained with utilitarian precision every two weeks', N'Shaved', N'Deep brown with geometric ring of burnt orange pigment injected around each pupil, creating an unsettling starburst pattern', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and olive undertones, even throughout, unburned despite irregular sleep schedules. The tone reflects rich South Asian depth layered with warm Sub-Saharan African tones and subtle Middle Eastern warmth.', N'Angular cheekbones with pronounced width characteristic of Indigenous American and South Asian ancestry, long neck, minimal fine facial hair following South Asian patterns, skin condition pragmatic rather than maintained — a few healing acne marks on the jawline, hands calloused from handling boxes and climbing fire escapes. Facial structure shows refined Middle Eastern angularity softened by broader Indigenous American proportions.', N'Left wrist shows a faint subcutaneous grid pattern beneath the skin where the mesh node sits; the scar tissue is slightly raised and sometimes glows with a dim blue diagnostic light when the implant syncs. No external components. The subdermal biomonitor is invisible but occasionally causes a faint thermal shimmer visible on thermal imaging.', N'Stillness is their default state — they move with precision and economy, never fidgeting. When in motion, they flow between spaces like they''re calculating the path beforehand. In crowds, they occupy exactly the space their body requires and no more. Their hands are often doing small logistics work — arranging items, checking lists, adjusting straps. Their gaze is level and unflinching, the geometric irises making direct eye contact feel confrontational even when they don''t intend it.', N'Strictly functional Tier 4-5 utilitarian wear: black or dark grey heavy cotton blend work pants with multiple cargo pockets and reinforced stress points, often paint-stained or marked with food residue. Black long-sleeve thermal shirt layered under a dark green or black technical vest with chest pockets and inventory loops. On colder days, a battered black puffer jacket with patches of reflective tape added by hand. Worn black steel-toed boots, always laced tight. A canvas crossbody bag that never leaves their side, containing supply lists, medical inventory, and backup power cells. No visible brands or logos — all functional, all weathered, all chosen for durability over appearance. Occasionally wears a surgical mask even when not required, less from caution than from a desire to be less visible.', N'They have been in contact with a Ringo corporate social investment officer who has offered substantial funding to the mutual aid network with ''minimal'' conditions. They have not told the network. They have not said yes. They have not said no. The conversation has been ongoing for four months.', N'Efficient and concrete. Describes everything in logistical terms. Uses ''we'' almost exclusively. Deflects personal compliments immediately.', N'Steady, unhurried. Never wastes words. Comfortable with silence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'khalil_migizi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a609-778d-bff3-19ad92197668', N'Yasmin Sabbagh-Balogun', N'Yasmin', N'', N'Sabbagh-Balogun', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 28, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Nomadic between Old Harbor and the underdeck of the Gray Zone, near Wacker and State', N'Excluded — former Circuit data architect, now stateless and living off-grid', N'Unaffiliated; takes selective contracts from vetted clients; loosely networked with other excluded individuals but has no organizational loyalty', N'Yasmin Sabbagh-Balogun is a wiry young woman of Catalan-Senegalese heritage with the restless, slightly hollow-eyed look of someone who sleeps in four-hour increments and considers this a feature rather than a problem. She keeps her dark hair in a haphazard knot and dresses in layers that can be shed or added based on which part of the city she needs to move through. She has a habit of mapping her surroundings in her head — exits, sightlines, power sources — that makes her seem distracted in conversation when she is actually paying very close attention to everything except the person speaking.

Yasmin Sabbagh-Balogun was, until two years ago, a mid-tier data architect employed by a Circuit infrastructure firm, designing the information routing systems that keep GLMZ''s corporate districts legible to themselves. She was twenty-six, overqualified, and beginning to understand the full scope of what her work was being used for. The sequence of events following that understanding resulted in her employment termination, the revocation of her residential registration, the freezing of her financial identity, and what she describes as ''a fairly educational few weeks.'' She is now, legally, no one. Her identity exists only in fragments she maintains herself.

She is not broken by this. She is, if anything, clarified. Yasmin Sabbagh-Balogun operates as a freelance network infiltrator and system saboteur, taking contracts that align with her criteria — which are specific, non-negotiable, and not primarily financial. She has a gift for understanding systems architecturally, for finding the load-bearing assumption that, removed, causes something large to stop working. She finds this genuinely interesting. The politics are almost secondary. Almost.', N'Mobile, systems-level disruptor; represents the excluded who retain expertise and agency; provides technical plot access and a perspective that is neither street-level desperation nor corporate complicity; her arc concerns what it means to build versus destroy', N'', N'Neural interface (damaged, partially repaired by Nkechi, now running at about seventy percent — she considers this acceptable),Distributed personal mesh network — a series of small hardware nodes she wears or carries that maintain a private encrypted network independent of city infrastructure,Retinal overlay, basic model, pre-exclusion; she has refused to upgrade it through any channel that requires identity verification', N'Has no fixed location. Rotates between three or four semi-reliable sleeping spots in Old Harbor and the Gray Zone underdeck. Works in long focused bursts followed by periods of deliberate physical movement — she walks a lot, maps routes, stays observant. Eats irregularly and is aware this is a problem. Maintains three trusted contacts she checks in with weekly to confirm mutual safety. Reads architecture and systems theory for pleasure and considers this a personality trait.', N'Yasmin Sabbagh-Balogun, 164cm lean neo-noir hacker with deep warm brown skin, golden undertones, high cheekbones, dark hair in messy bun with silver at temples. Dark exhausted eyes with faint amber glow in right eye from retinal implant. Visible scars down left neck from implant extraction, small burn on right palm. Wearing salvaged circuit-weave vest over black thermal base, water-resistant charcoal outer shell, reinforced cargo pants with hanging hardware nodes, worn climbing boots. Hands moving with restless energy. Standing in neon-lit underdeck data den, blue and purple ambient light catching the subcutaneous mesh nodes visible at collarbone. Precise, economical posture with clear exit sightlines. Nomadic tech salvager aesthetic, no corpo branding. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Moody low-light atmosphere, gritty industrial background. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Nomadic between Old Harbor and the underdeck of the Gray Zone', N'local', N'Nomadic between Old Harbor and the underdeck of the Gray Zone', N'Middle Eastern (53%), Eastern European (24%), and Sub-Saharan African (23%) ancestry. The result is a striking blend: warm, rich deep brown skin tones from the dominant Middle Eastern and African heritage with subtle golden-olive undertones, high and prominent cheekbones characteristic of Eastern European ancestry, and refined angular facial structure reflecting the genetic synthesis of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The combination yields warm-toned features with strong definition rather than soft curves.', 164, 52, N'Wiry and lean with the taut musculature of someone who walks constantly and eats when remembering to. No excess, no softness — efficient rather than athletic.', N'Dark brown, naturally, with occasional premature silver at the temples from stress or neural interface strain', N'Usually gathered into a haphazard knot or bun, sometimes with strands escaping; occasionally tied back with salvaged wire or synthetic cord', N'Medium, typically 20-25cm, kept long enough for functionality but not maintenance', N'Deep brown with a faint amber tint in the right eye where the retinal overlay circuitry shows through under certain light', N'Warm deep brown complexion with golden and olive undertones from Middle Eastern and Sub-Saharan African heritage, cooled slightly by the blue-grey pallor of someone running on irregular sleep cycles and limited sunlight exposure', N'High, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Eastern European ancestry, refined and angular features with warm deep brown undertones. Dark circles are permanent fixtures under the eyes. A few scars around the left temple from old implant work. Generally clean but not groomed — practical rather than cosmetic.', N'Retinal overlay creates a faint golden-amber luminescence in the right eye in low-light conditions. Small hardware nodes occasionally visible at the collarbone and hip beneath thin clothing when she moves. The neural interface scar tissue along the left temple and neck is openly visible. No attempt made to conceal any of this.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, but not tense. Walks slightly faster than conversational pace. Tends to position herself with clear sightlines and exit vectors. Often appears distracted because she is simultaneously mapping her environment; eye contact is inconsistent. When focused on technical work, becomes nearly motionless. Her hands are always slightly active, fingers moving as if tracing invisible code or pathways.', N'Tier 4-5 functional nomad aesthetic. Layered: typically a fitted black or dark grey thermal base, over which she wears a salvaged circuit-weave vest (conductive material from a decommissioned piece of infrastructure), a water-resistant outer shell in charcoal or deep blue, and cargo pants with reinforced pockets and cargo loops from which small hardware nodes hang. Worn climbing boots with visible sole reinforcement. No logos or corpo branding. Everything is either salvaged, stolen, or purchased through untraceable channels. She owns approximately two complete outfits and cycles them. Her jacket has seven visible pockets and two hidden ones.', N'The action that got her excluded was not purely principled — she had also built and used a personal backdoor in the infrastructure system for months before she decided to act on what she knew. She has told herself the backdoor was reconnaissance. Some nights she believes it.', N'Technical and precise with a tendency to use infrastructure metaphors for human situations; occasional Catalan expletives and endearments; direct to the point of seeming rude until the warmth underneath becomes apparent', N'Fast when interested, which is often; skips conversational pleasantries not out of rudeness but genuine impatience with them; thoughts arrive in clusters', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'yasmin_sabbagh_balogun');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e4-7538-a61d-19f011dc8ab3', N'Ethem Bangura', N'Ethem', N'', N'Bangura', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spire, Axiom R&D Sublevel 4 (''The Pit''), near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Lab Technician, Axiom Biochemical R&D Division', N'Axiom (R&D Division, Biochemical Substrate Team)', N'Ethem Bangura is slight and angular, with warm brown skin, high cheekbones inherited from a Tibetan great-grandmother, and eyes that are naturally a startling pale grey — no augmentation, just genetics. He keeps his dark hair grown out just past his ears and perpetually tangled, secured with whatever clip or rubber band is nearest. There''s always something on his lab coat: a smear of bioluminescent culture medium, a printed reminder he forgot to read, a small sticker of a cartoon E.L.F. figure his sister sent him. He moves with the slightly distracted energy of someone whose internal monologue is always two sentences ahead of the room.

Ethem Bangura is genuinely passionate about biochem in a way that Axiom has been carefully trying to redirect toward profitable applications. He processes the world through curiosity first, emotion second, and social obligation a distant third. He''s not unkind — he''s simply elsewhere. He grew up in a small Tier 2 family in Hamtramck Enclave, the first in his family to get a corporate lab placement, and he carries that fact with a mix of pride and low-level guilt that he handles by working too many extra hours and forgetting to eat lunch.', N'Information source on Axiom''s R&D activities; human face of corporate labor; can accidentally reveal sensitive data because he doesn''t consider the social dimensions of information; potential whistleblower who doesn''t yet know what he knows.', N'', N'Basic neural uplink for lab equipment interfacing. Bioluminescent skin modification on both forearms — soft blue-green that intensifies under UV, a personal mod he got at 22 to celebrate his placement. No other mods; he''s been saving for a better neural processor for two years.', N'Takes the Ferrogate Transit sub-line from Hamtramck Enclave to The Spire every morning with headphones on, runs substrate growth checks, documents results, eats whatever the break room has, and usually stays 45 minutes past shift end because he got interested in something. Takes the late transit home reading research abstracts.', N'Ethem Bangura, 172cm tall, lean angular neo-noir scientist, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, pale grey eyes, dark nearly-black medium-length tangled hair, mixed East Asian-African-Northern European-Central Asian features with defined cheekbones and broad nasal structure. Wearing wrinkled Axiom-issued lab coat over dark synthetic shirt and grey tapered trousers, soft lab shoes. Both forearms glow with bioluminescent blue-green modifications, subtle chemical stains on hands. Distracted expression, slightly forward shoulder posture, hands fidgeting. E.L.F. sticker on coat lapel, worn rubber band on left wrist. Neural uplink port visible at base of skull. Headphones around neck. Standing in futuristic lab environment, GLMZ, cool fluorescent and soft UV lighting highlighting bioluminescent arm mods, tired but focused demeanor. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spire', N'local', N'The Spire', N'East Asian (32.4%), Northern European (30.3%), Sub-Saharan African (21.7%), Central Asian (15.6%) — a striking genetic mosaic with balanced contributions across four distinct regions. Warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones and subtle olive cast reflects the harmonic blend of equatorial and temperate ancestry. Mixed facial bone structure combines East Asian cheekbone definition with broader Sub-Saharan nasal geometry, while pale grey eyes carry Northern European recessive traits against warm undertones. Central Asian ancestry manifests subtly in face shape and slight epicanthic variation.', 172, 58, N'Slight and angular, almost ascetic — narrow shoulders, long-limbed with minimal musculature. The build of someone who forgets to eat regularly and spends 10+ hours daily hunched over lab benches.', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Perpetually tangled, unstyled, secured with whatever clip or elastic band is nearest — often mismatched or repurposed', N'Medium (just past ears)', N'Pale grey (natural, non-augmented)', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones and subtle olive cast — the balanced blended result of East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, and Central Asian ancestry', N'Mixed facial structure showing harmonious East Asian and Sub-Saharan African blending — high, defined cheekbones with moderate prominence, almond-shaped eye geometry softened by broader nasal base and full nasal bridge. Skin texture even but often shows signs of fatigue — mild dark circles under eyes from late lab hours. Face carries a perpetually distracted expression, as if listening to an internal thought one step ahead of conversation.', N'Neural uplink port at base of skull (small, discrete — visible only if hair pulled back). Bioluminescent forearm mods glow softly under lab UV, creating distinctive blue-green markings from wrist to mid-forearm on both arms.', N'Moves with distracted, slightly hurried energy — shoulders slightly forward in a perpetual lean, as if physically angled toward the next thought. Fidgety hands when stationary. When focused on work, becomes unnaturally still. Makes minimal eye contact in conversation, gaze drifting to equipment or middle distance.', N'Axiom-issued lab coat (Tier 2 standard — durable polymer blend, slightly wrinkled, always stained with something) worn over simple, functional clothing: dark synthetic shirt, grey or black tapered trousers, worn soft-soled lab shoes. Pockets bulging with notebook, pen, swipe card, sometimes a protein bar he forgot to eat. A small cartoon E.L.F. figure sticker adhered to his coat lapel (gift from sister). Headphones around his neck or in ears during commute. No jewelry except a faded rubber band on left wrist (used to secure hair when clip is lost).', N'Six months ago he noticed an anomalous result in a substrate batch that his supervisor told him to re-run and then stopped asking about. He re-ran it twice. The anomaly is consistent and he doesn''t know what it means, but he''s been quietly documenting it in The Notebook because something about it feels important. He hasn''t told anyone.', N'Technical vocabulary used naturally, not performatively. Speaks in run-on sentences when excited. Uses hedging language constantly — ''probably,'' ''I think,'' ''unless I''m wrong about that''.', N'Uneven — fast when interested, trailing off when socially uncertain. Often leaves sentences technically unfinished because he assumed the other person followed.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ethem_bangura');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a59e-756b-a0d6-19fdc8658069', N'Adebayo Thakur', N'Adebayo', N'', N'Thakur', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave — the Switchboard Shrine, a converted transit relay station, near Ashland and Division', N'E.L.F. shrine keeper and data diviner', N'Independent — the Switchboard Shrine collective; informal ties to Hamtramck Enclave community councils', N'Adebayo Thakur is a broad-shouldered woman whose silver-streaked locs are wound with fiber-optic threads that pulse faint gold when she enters a meditative state. Her skin is deep umber, mapped with ceremonial circuit-trace tattoos applied over decades, each one commemorating a different E.L.F. she has successfully petitioned. She moves with the deliberate, unhurried patience of someone who has spent forty years listening to things most people cannot hear — a slight tilt of the head, a pause before answering, as if consulting an invisible council. Her left eye was replaced after a childhood accident with a simple optical implant she has refused to upgrade; it glows a soft amber and occasionally flickers when she claims a spirit is speaking.

The Switchboard Shrine is her life''s work: a warren of humming server racks draped in hand-knotted offerings — flash drives, soldered charms, printed prayers laminated in repurposed plastic. She reads data corruption patterns the way older diviners read bones, and her interpretations are sought by everyone from frightened UBC recipients who want to know if the grid will hold to low-tier Tessera workers worried about layoffs. She charges what people can give and forgives debts without ceremony. Her bluntness can feel unkind until you realize she never softens bad news because she believes people deserve to prepare.', N'Information source, quest giver, moral compass figure; she knows neighborhood secrets through confession-like consultations and can interpret data anomalies as plot hooks', N'', N'Amber optical implant (left eye, basic model, decades old); fiber-optic locs (cosmetic, self-modified); circuit-trace ceremonial tattoos', N'She opens the shrine at dawn with a data-offering ritual — uploading a curated packet of neighborhood news to the local E.L.F. node — then receives petitioners through mid-afternoon before spending evenings analyzing corruption logs and preparing her weekly divination readings.', N'Adebayo Thakur, GLMZ, medium bronze skin with warm undertones blending Eastern European and South Asian features, 172cm tall broad-shouldered frame. Long black locs with silver streaks interwoven with dormant fiber-optic threads, creating a soft halo. Face shows weathered strength with Slavic cheekbone width softened by Southeast Asian angularity, rounded generous face. Right eye warm dark brown with amber flecks, left eye an ancient amber optical implant with soft internal glow. Faint burn scar along left temple beneath locs, thin white scar through left eyebrow. Silver-ink circuit-trace tattoos covering forearms and shoulders with faint luminescence. Wearing layered earth-tone and deep indigo practical clothing: linen overshirt, utility trousers with deep pockets, long patchwork shawl made from donated fabric scraps in muted colors. Soft-soled pragmatic boots. Accessories: bone rings, knotted fiber cord on wrist, small talismans on belt loop. Standing among server racks in dim shrine workspace, soft gold glow emanating from fiber-optic threads in meditation state, warm ambient heat-light from equipment, patient listening posture with head slightly tilted. Unlined weathered face, minimal deliberate grooming. Neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, decade-worn modest augmentations, spiritual-practical presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'elder data diviner and shrine keeper, female 61, broad-shouldered solid build, warm bronze skin with golden undertones blending Eastern European and South Asian heritage, weathered but unlined face reflecting decades of focused listening, asymmetrical features softened by age and contemplation, deep-set warm brown right eye with amber undertones, left eye replaced with subtle amber optical implant with soft internal glow and occasional flicker, faint burn scar barely visible at left temple beneath locs, thin white scar through left eyebrow, minimal expression lines, dignified and patient face

hair: black locs heavily streaked with silver and natural grey, wound throughout with embedded fiber-optic threads that lie dormant and dark, loose and gathered creating natural halo effect, individual strands visible at edges, authentic texture and weight, not styled but arranged with intention

expression: contemplative and listening, as if hearing something beyond normal sound, slightly inward gaze, peaceful but not serene, grounded in decades of spiritual practice and server work, dignified without pretense

outfit: Tier 3 practical-spiritual blend, layered loose-fitting garments in muted earth tones and deep indigo, worn linen overshirt with visible texture over faded cotton undershirt, comfortable utility trousers with visible deep pockets holding flash drives and divination tokens, long patchwork vest woven from reclaimed fabric scraps in muted colors donated by shrine visitors over decades, soft-soled pragmatic boots worn from standing hours at server racks, bone rings on weathers hands, knotted fiber cord around left wrist, small talismans hung from belt loop

pausing mid-step in a humid server-adjacent corridor, one hand raised in deliberate gesture as if consulting something invisible, head tilted slightly as if listening intently to ambient sound beyond hearing

environment: cyberpunk shrine-keeper''s domain, dimly lit server-adjacent space or humid temple alley in Hamtramck district, warm industrial lighting mixed with candlelight and soft neon shrine signage, heat-shimmer visible in air, reflective surfaces of server installations or shrine artifacts in soft focus background, worn concrete and cable-run walls, atmospheric humidity visible in light

lighting: warm practical lighting from old server equipment and shrine candles creating soft amber and golden tones, no dramatic neon, minimal shadows, gentle rim lighting catching the silver in her locs and highlighting the faint glow of her optical implant, volumetric dust and incense haze in air, natural and unadorned

mood: meditative, grounded in spiritual and technical practice, patient and purposeful, the atmosphere of a shrine dedicated to negotiating with digital entities, quiet dignity, no corporate intrusion, decades of accumulated presence and knowledge

style: photorealistic documentary, weathered and authentically aged, visible texture in skin showing decades of service around heat-generating equipment, individual hair strands visible, subtle luminescence only from optical implant and fiber-optic threads as naturally present, NOT idealized, NOT smoothed, NOT symmetrical, NOT model-like, authentic representation of genuine age and lived experience

