--ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Eastern European (62.6%) with significant South Asian (22.8%) and Southeast Asian (14.6%) ancestry—a genetic map of the Ubiquitous Diaspora reflecting her family''s unexpected global routes. The blend manifests in her broad facial structure with Slavic width softened by South and Southeast Asian angularity, warm complexion that bridges Eastern European and subcontinental phenotypes, and cheekbones that carry definition from multiple ancestral lines.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, with the thick-armed strength of someone who has spent decades moving between servers and shrine installations. Not heavy, but densely built — a presence that occupies space without apology.', N'Black with natural silver streaking throughout', N'Locs wound with embedded fiber-optic threads; threads glow faint gold during meditative states. Typically worn loose or loosely gathered, creating a halo effect when the fibers are active.', N'Long (past shoulders)', N'Right eye: warm dark brown with amber undertones; Left eye: amber-tinted optical implant with soft internal glow, occasionally flickers', N'Warm medium bronze with subtle golden undertones—the blended result of Eastern European, South Asian, and Southeast Asian ancestry. Complexion suggests both ancestral adaptation and decades spent around heat-generating server equipment. Warmer than typical Eastern European baseline, deeper than typical South Asian baseline, reflecting the tri-continental mix.', N'Weathered but unlined — her face reflects decades of focused listening rather than expression. Broad facial structure grounded in Eastern European heritage, tempered by the more delicate bone structure of South and Southeast Asian ancestry; cheekbones carry moderate definition across a rounded, generous face with slight width through the lower jaw characteristic of Slavic lineage. Skin carries the patina of someone who works around heat-generating server equipment, with the warm bronze cast of mixed ancestry. No visible acne or damage; grooming is minimal and deliberate.', N'Left eye replaced with a simple amber optical implant (model indeterminate, clearly decades old) that glows softly and flickers with apparent autonomy. Fiber-optic threads woven throughout locs, dormant most of the time but pulsing gold during meditation. No chrome, no obvious cutting-edge tech — all modifications are purposefully modest and worn.', N'Moves with deliberate, unhurried patience. Slight perpetual tilt of the head, as if perpetually listening to something just beyond normal hearing. Pauses before speaking, as if consulting an invisible council. Her movements are economical — no wasted gesture. Hands move with the precision of someone accustomed to delicate server work.', N'Tier 3 practical-spiritual blend. Favors layered, loose-fitting garments in muted earth tones and deep indigo — linen overshirts, worn cotton undershirts, comfortable utility trousers with deep pockets for flash drives and divination tokens. Wears a long vest or shawl woven from reclaimed fabric scraps that shrine visitors have donated over decades, creating a patchwork map of Hamtramck''s informal economy. No corpo branding, no visible Φ wealth markers. Footwear is pragmatic: soft-soled boots suitable for standing among server racks for hours. Accessories are spiritual rather than decorative: bone rings, a cord of knotted fiber around her wrist, a collection of small talismans hung from a belt loop.', N'Three years ago she received a corruption-pattern reading she interpreted as a death omen for a young petitioner. She said nothing and sent him away with reassurances. He died in a Ferrogate Transit accident six days later. She has never told anyone and performs an additional private ritual every night as penance.', N'Calm, precise, mixes technical data terminology with spiritual framing naturally — ''signal'' and ''grace'' are synonyms to her', N'Slow and measured, with deliberate pauses that can feel uncomfortably long to strangers', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'adebayo_thakur');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a624-7b2b-8639-1a1d8c2d4200', N'Futaba Sigurdsson', N'Futaba', N'', N'Sigurdsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Steamvent Alley — geothermal district, hot and chemical-smelling, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Infrastructure disruption and industrial sabotage — saboteur', N'Semi-independent — has standing arrangements with several crews', N'Futaba Sigurdsson is tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 23, there''s something unfinished about her face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. She works as a saboteur out of Steamvent Alley, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Futaba Sigurdsson operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Halima Gutierrez-Asante is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm. Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Futaba Sigurdsson, tall lean mixed-heritage operative in GLMZ, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, high cheekbones and angular features blending East Asian and Northern European ancestry, dark brown eyes with tired intensity, black hair pulled back tight in a braid. Visible subdermal chrome weapon mounts in both forearms glinting beneath skin, dark red neural jack port at base of skull, thin white scar on right cheekbone. Wearing black cargo pants and fitted dark compression shirt with grey worn synth-leather jacket, steel-toed boots, vintage smartwatch. Posture economical and precise, shoulders slightly forward, standing in industrial low-light neo-noir corridor with neon reflecting off metal surfaces, hands at ready, controlled expression, no emotion, cinematic noir lighting with cool shadows and warm accent light catching the subdermal chrome, 2200s dystopian setting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Steamvent Alley', N'local', N'Steamvent Alley', N'Northern European (40.6%), Southeast Asian (18.2%), East Asian (15.9%), South Asian (10.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (7.6%), Indigenous American (6.9%) — a truly global blend creating warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden undertones and hints of olive. High cheekbones and defined facial structure reflect East and Southeast Asian ancestry, while lean efficient build shows Northern European influence. The mix produces a unified warm-toned complexion with minimal contrast, carrying undertones from multiple continental sources. Facial proportions blend Northern European angularity with Southeast and East Asian features, while the warm undertones reflect South Asian and Latin American heritage.', 178, 62, N'Tall and rawboned — lean and efficient rather than undernourished. Long muscle definition in arms and legs suggests functional strength over bulk. Angular shoulders, narrow through the hips. The kind of frame that moves well in confined spaces.', N'Black with natural dark brown undertones', N'Pulled back tight, usually in a single braid or wrapped close to the scalp for practical reasons', N'Medium — shoulder-length when unbound, but habitually restrained', N'Dark brown, natural — no visible augmentation', N'Warm medium brown with golden and subtle olive undertones — the blend of Northern European, Southeast Asian, East Asian, and South Asian ancestry creates a unified complexion with depth. The golden warmth is prominent, with slight olive undertones reflecting the South Asian and Latin American components. No sharp contrast between lighter and darker areas.', N'Angular face with high cheekbones and sharp jawline, showing influence of East and Southeast Asian ancestry layered over Northern European bone structure. Warm medium-brown complexion with golden undertones. Skin is clear but bears minor marks of hard living — small scars on chin and left temple, perpetually tired around the eyes. Minimal grooming beyond function: no makeup, no jewelry except a simple steel ear stud on left ear.', N'Subdermal weapon mounts visible in both forearms as geometric chrome patterns beneath skin, most prominent when arms are tensed or angled in certain light. Base-of-skull neural interface jack visible as a port roughly the size of a thumbnail, dark red and slightly proud of the skin surface. No cosmetic plating or attempt to conceal either augmentation.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Shoulders slightly forward, head level. Walk is steady and low-center-gravity, weight distributed for balance. In repose, jaw is slightly tight, eyes tracking. Default state suggests controlled readiness rather than relaxation. Hands rest with fingers naturally curled, never fully open.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Favors dark technical fabrics — black or dark grey cargo pants with reinforced pockets and subdermal-compatible sleeve design. Fitted long-sleeve compression shirts or modified jackets that don''t restrict forearm mobility. Steel-toed boots with good ankle support, laces kept tight. Outer layers are functional: a worn grey synth-leather jacket or industrial coveralls depending on the work. No corpo logos. No bright colors. Everything is built for movement and work, not presentation. Wears a battered smartwatch on left wrist — vintage model, clearly maintained, no display of Φ status.', N'Halima Gutierrez-Asante murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Educated vocabulary wrapped in street delivery — the contrast is deliberate.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'futaba_sigurdsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d8-74c8-ace8-1a26b6b745e6', N'Akihiro Haugen-Baiseitov', N'Akihiro', N'', N'Haugen-Baiseitov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Interchange, near North Ave and Damen', N'Surveillance operator, Ferrogate Transit Security', N'Ferrogate Transit Security; The Interchange', N'Akihiro Haugen-Baiseitov is a compact woman with deep brown skin and close-cropped natural hair she keeps pinned flat under a headset she almost never removes. Her eyes are her most striking feature — cosmetic irises patterned like circuit diagrams in amber and black, a Ferrogate employee perk she accepted mostly because it made her colleagues uncomfortable and she finds that useful. She has the particular stillness of someone who watches things for a living, and a habit of tracking movement in a room that makes first-time acquaintances feel vaguely prosecuted.

She runs the mid-shift monitoring suite at Kessler Interchange, a warren of overlapping transit corridors where four Ferrogate lines converge and approximately forty thousand people pass through daily. She is methodical, unhurried, and privately contemptuous of colleagues who confuse volume of incidents flagged with quality of work. She has learned to read a crowd the way some people read weather — pressure, density, the small tells of collective mood. She drinks too much stimulant tea and keeps a small clay figurine of an E.L.F. she calls Clicker on her console, leaving it fragments of raw surveillance data as offerings.', N'Information source — knows everyone who moves through Kessler and can pull footage going back six months. Local color for transit hub scenes. Quest-adjacent: might notice something wrong before anyone else does.', N'', N'Circuit-patterned cosmetic irises (amber/black). Neural uplink jack for direct feed monitoring — allows passive stream of up to 40 camera feeds simultaneously. Mild haptic feedback implant in left hand for alert management.', N'Arrives ninety minutes before shift to review overnight incident logs; monitors Kessler''s camera grid for eight hours with two sanctioned breaks she rarely takes; files end-of-shift anomaly reports with obsessive precision.', N'GLMZ, compact androgynous transit monitor named Akihiro, 158cm, 52kg, lean build. Striking multi-continental features: golden-brown skin blending South Asian warmth, Hispanic angular jawline, Central Asian high cheekbones, Northern European intensity. Short dark brown hair flat beneath sleek Ferrogate neural interface headset with three sensor pods. Most striking feature: circuit-pattern cosmetic irises with amber base and black circuit overlays that seem to track movement independently. Preternaturally still posture. Black corporate Ferrogate bodysuit and tactical vest, steel-toed boots. Faint LED traces glowing amber along left palm from haptic implant. Silver Φ-chain necklace, embroidered E.L.F. patch on shoulder. Sitting motionless in transit station control room, hands resting precisely, head locked while only eyes move. Cool fluorescent and amber LED ambient lighting. Neo-noir utilitarian aesthetic, emotionally distant, augmented surveillance professional. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Interchange', N'local', N'Kessler Interchange', N'Akihiro carries a striking global blend: South Asian (28.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (27.2%), Central Asian (24.6%), and Northern European (19.3%) ancestry converge in her features. The result is a face of unexpected harmony—warm golden-brown skin that bridges warm and cool undertones, high angular cheekbones with subtle Central Asian geometry, a defined Hispanic/Latin jawline, and the bright-eyed intensity of Northern European heritage. Her features read as genuinely trans-continental, equally difficult to pin to any single region.', 158, 52, N'Compact and lean, almost bird-like in economy of movement. Narrow shoulders, minimal upper body mass. Built for stillness rather than exertion.', N'Natural dark brown, nearly black', N'Close-cropped natural hair, kept pressed flat beneath her monitoring headset', N'Short', N'Cosmetic circuit-pattern irises: amber base with black circuit-trace overlays, human-like sclera', N'Warm golden-brown medium tone—the balanced fusion of South Asian warmth, Hispanic/Latin richness, Central Asian depth, and Northern European clarity. Even complexion with subtle luminosity.', N'High, prominent cheekbones reflecting Central and South Asian heritage structure. Defined, angular jawline from Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Minimal makeup. Skin unmarked and well-maintained. Eyes carry unusual intensity—circuit patterns catch light and shift slightly with tracked movement.', N'Circuit-patterned cosmetic irises are immediately noticeable and unsettling. The Ferrogate monitoring headset is a permanent fixture—a sleek neural interface crown with three small sensor pods that contact her temples and scalp. Faint subcutaneous LED trace visible along her left palm and inner wrist (haptic feedback implant), glowing amber when alert notifications fire.', N'Still. Almost preternaturally still when seated. Minimal fidgeting or reactive movement. When mobile, she moves with economical precision—no wasted motion. Head remains relatively fixed while eyes track; this creates an uncanny quality, as if only her gaze moves while the rest of her is locked on target. Her left hand sometimes trembles microscopically—haptic feedback from her uplink triggering phantom sensations.', N'Tier 3 utilitarian corporate issue. Black Ferrogate-branded bodysuit with reinforced shoulders and upper back (designed to support headset weight). Matching tactical vest with six patch pockets, all precisely organized. Steel-toed boots rated for transit station spillover. A thin silver Φ-chain necklace—inexpensive, probably a gift, worn consciously. Her one personal affectation: a small embroidered patch on her left shoulder strap depicting a stylized E.L.F. (Electromagnetic Low-Frequency) in faded thread.', N'She has been quietly archiving footage of a mid-level Ferrogate supervisor she believes is routing transit delay data to a competitor. She hasn''t reported it because she isn''t certain — and because she''s afraid the investigation would expose that she''s been running unauthorized archive pulls for months.', N'Precise, economy of words, surveillance jargon bleeds into casual speech — she''ll describe a person''s gait or dwell time in a space before their name', N'Measured and unhurried, with long pauses before answering questions as if buffering', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'akihiro_haugen_baiseitov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a71b-70d2-bed8-1a28c0b6f43a', N'Graciela Makwa', N'Graciela', N'', N'Makwa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 33, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor — works from a converted warehouse on the dry dock, adjacent to Corva''s container, near Wacker and State', N'Technical analyst and salvage valuator — Boneyard Saints', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions (mid-level technical analyst and salvage valuator)', N'Graciela Makwa goes in the water. She is the Boneyard Saints'' land-side brain — the one who identifies what the divers bring up, determines its value, traces its origin, and interfaces with pre-collapse systems that have been submerged for two decades. She has a gift for dead technology. She can look at a corroded circuit board, a water-damaged server core, a sealed data capsule that hasn''t seen air since the harbor flooded, and tell you what it was, who made it, and how much someone will pay for it.

She came to Old Harbor from the Circuit, where she''d been running a small electronics repair business that was slowly being crushed by corporate parts monopolies. A Boneyard Saint brought in a piece of salvage she couldn''t identify — pre-collapse military firmware sealed in a waterproof housing. Wren spent three days cracking it, sold the data for more money than her shop had made in a year, and realized the harbor was full of things the world had forgotten it needed.

Wren is small, dark-haired, perpetually ink-stained from the physical documentation she insists on maintaining alongside digital records. She wears magnification goggles pushed up on her forehead and cargo vests with every pocket full. She talks fast when she''s excited about a piece of salvage and not at all when she''s working on one. The warehouse is her domain — organized in a system that makes sense to her and no one else, with pre-collapse artifacts in various states of analysis covering every surface.', N'Wren is the analytical lens through which the Boneyard Saints'' horror elements focus. She is the character who provides explanations — and the character whose explanations start failing as the deep ruins reveal things that don''t fit her models. Her growing unease with the data she''s collecting drives the existential horror beneath the treasure-hunt surface.', N'', N'Micro-manipulation fingertip implants — allow precise work on components smaller than the eye can see. Optical augmentation with spectrum analysis — she can identify material composition by visual scanning. Encrypted data-interface jack for connecting to pre-collapse systems without network exposure. No physical augmentations — Wren has never needed strength, just precision.', N'Works when the light is good — she relies on natural light for certain types of analysis and supplements with full-spectrum lamps. Catalogues incoming salvage, runs identification protocols, contacts potential buyers through encrypted channels. Maintains the Saints'' financial records and equipment inventory. Eats at her workstation — Toll brings food; she forgets to eat it until it''s cold. Sleeps in a loft above the warehouse because going home feels like wasted time.', N'Graciela Makwa, compact wiry 158cm salvage-tech worker with burnished bronze complexion blending Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, and Indigenous American heritage—prominent high cheekbones, angular jawline, dark brown eyes with golden optical augmentation circuitry visible at iris edges. Black hair with iron-grey temple streaks in messy bun. Perpetually tired expression, ink-stained fingertips, faint burn scar on left temple. Wearing weathered grey multi-pocket cargo vest over undershirt, worn synthetic reinforced pants, scuffed steel-toed boots. Magnification goggles pushed up on forehead, micro-manipulation implants visible as faint metallic sheen on fingertip skin. Fingerless work gloves, battered stainless steel watch. Hunched forward posture bent over workbench covered with components and salvage parts. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone warehouse setting, cool full-spectrum overhead lamps casting sharp shadows, worn industrial backdrop, atmosphere of concentrated focus and technical precision. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Complex Pan-Diaspora genetic blend: Indigenous American (29.1%), East Asian (23.1%), Sub-Saharan African (23.0%), Middle Eastern (12.8%), Southeast Asian (8.3%), and Eastern European (3.7%). Features a striking composite of multiple continental lineages—prominent high cheekbones with angular structure influenced by East Asian and Indigenous American ancestry, warm deep undertones from Sub-Saharan African heritage, subtle Middle Eastern definition in her nose and brow, with Southeast Asian delicacy softening the overall angles. Rich complexity in skin tone reflecting the convergence of warm African and Indigenous tones with the cooler undertones of East Asian ancestry.', 158, 48, N'Wiry and compact, all lean muscle and restless energy. Shoulders slightly rounded from hunching over workbenches. Hands disproportionately strong despite small frame.', N'Black with iron-grey streaks at temples', N'Pulled back in a perpetually messy bun or loose braid, often with strands escaping', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with subtle golden undertone from optical augmentation circuitry visible at the iris edges', N'Warm medium to medium-deep burnished bronze with complex layered undertones—deep golden-bronze from Sub-Saharan African and Indigenous American ancestry blending seamlessly with cooler amber notes from East Asian heritage, touched by Middle Eastern warmth. Rich saturation across cheeks and forehead, deeper earth tones along jawline. Sun-burnished from warehouse work under full-spectrum lamps. Slight cooling at wrists and neck revealing lighter undertone depth beneath.', N'Fine-featured with high, prominent cheekbones reflecting East Asian and Indigenous American structure, angular jaw softened by Middle Eastern warmth, subtle Southeast Asian delicacy in the overall facial contours. Medium-deep complexion with warm burnished undertone depth from Sub-Saharan African and Indigenous American ancestry. Perpetually tired around the eyes. Ink stains on her fingertips and occasional smudges on her face. A small burn scar on her left temple from soldering work, barely visible. Calluses on her fingertips despite augmentations.', N'Magnification goggles pushed perpetually up on her forehead (prescription-grade optics with spectrum overlay capability). Micro-manipulation implants visible as slight metallic sheening under the skin of her fingertips and the first knuckle of each hand. The data-interface jack is hidden beneath her left wrist, barely perceptible under clothing but occasionally visible as a faint port outline when she rolls her sleeves.', N'Perpetually bent forward slightly, as if drawn toward whatever task commands her focus. Fidgeting hands — always adjusting something, turning a component over, tapping against surfaces. Walks quickly and without flourish. Sits cross-legged on her workbench as often as in chairs. Eyes dart constantly, cataloguing details.', N'Utilitarian Tier 3 salvage-worker aesthetic. Multi-pocket cargo vests in weathered grey or black over simple undershirts. Worn synthetic pants with reinforced knees and thighs. Steel-toed boots scuffed from warehouse floors. Magnification goggles on her forehead. Fingerless work gloves in supple synthetic leather. A faded pre-collapse Motorola hoodie worn under her vest on cold days. No jewelry except a battered stainless steel watch from the Circuit days that she checks compulsively.', N'She has assembled enough fragments of pre-collapse data to suspect that Old Harbor wasn''t destroyed by rising water levels. The flooding was deliberate. Something in the deep infrastructure was sealed in, not abandoned. She has not shared this theory because she doesn''t have proof, and Wren doesn''t share theories without proof.', N'Technical, specific, rapid when excited. Electronics terminology, materials science, archival jargon. Lapses into academic language when she forgets her audience.', N'Variable — machine-gun fast when analyzing, silence when working, measured when delivering conclusions to clients.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'graciela_makwa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65d-7c76-9674-1a308f2b377c', N'Hakim Bergqvist', N'Hakim', N'', N'Bergqvist', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Bronzeline — office above a fabrication shop on Copper Haul Street; operates across the Gray Zone and lower Grand Corridor, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Private Investigator, licensed freelance', N'Self-employed — licensed PI under GLMZ freelance investigator statute. Occasional informal referral relationship with Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security beat officers who trust them.', N'Hakim Bergqvist is medium height with a fluid quality to their movements — Samoan and Slavic ancestry combining into broad shoulders, strong hands, and a face whose expressions they have learned to deploy like instruments rather than leak involuntarily. Their hair is grown to the jaw and shifts through three or four colors depending on their mood thanks to chromatic follicle modification; they typically let it settle to charcoal gray while working, which they describe as professional, though their clients find the occasional bleed of deep violet when they are agitated more unnerving than reassuring. They have cat ears — soft grey, mobile, a mod that predates their PI license and that they have kept because they pick up certain vocal frequencies the human ear misses, which turns out to be professionally useful in a way they did not originally intend.

Hakim Bergqvist runs a small private investigation practice that caters to Tier 2 and low Tier 3 clients — people who cannot afford legal representation and cannot access Arcturus Civil Security interest because their problems are too small or too inconvenient. They find missing persons. They document infidelity for separation proceedings. They trace where someone''s inheritance went. They do not describe this work as glamorous and they are not performing humility when they say it. They have a gift for putting people at ease that coexists uncomfortably with a deep private reserve, and they pray to three different ELFs with equal commitment, which their neighbors in Bronzeline find ecumenically admirable.', N'Information broker and investigation resource for Tier 1-3 characters; provides access to unofficial channels and street-level knowledge that institutional law enforcement cannot or will not pursue. Can be hired, can provide referrals, can become a recurring contact. Represents the gap between what the system does and what people actually need.', N'', N'Chromatic follicle modification — color-changing hair, mood-reactive with manual override (cosmetic, personal). Cosmetic cat ears, soft grey, enhanced audio frequency range (installed age 22, originally cosmetic, professionally repurposed). Subvocal communication implant — throat-mounted, allows silent communication with trusted contacts (professional grade, self-funded).', N'Takes client meetings in the office above the fabrication shop, which smells permanently of heated metal and is somehow comfortable. Fieldwork consumes most afternoons and evenings — surveillance, interviews, site documentation. Makes offerings to their three ELF shrines each morning: one for the device network, one for the building, one for a data relay two streets over that they have been cultivating for four years.', N'Hakim Bergqvist, GLMZ, 172cm tall with warm golden-brown skin and layered undertones reflecting Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, Hispanic, and East Asian heritage. Dark brown eyes with amber warmth, defined cheekbones, strong jawline. Medium-length chromatic hair (charcoal base, mood-reactive violet undertones), jaw-length and textured. Mobile grey cat ears positioned where human ears would be. Clean-shaven or lightly stubbled. Wearing fitted charcoal trousers with reinforced pockets, layered practical clothing in earth tones and cool neutrals, broken-in low-profile boots. Subtle throat-mounted subvocal implant barely visible. Small ELF shrine medallion. Upright posture, grounded stance, attentive expression. Professional fieldwork aesthetic, disciplined bearing. Indoor lighting catching the chrome implants, urban Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone background, neo-noir surveillance aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Bronzeline', N'local', N'Bronzeline', N'Genetic mosaic reflecting Southeast Asian dominance (42.9%) blended with significant Sub-Saharan African (19.1%), Eastern European (18.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (12.5%), and East Asian (7.3%) ancestry. This combination creates a striking warm golden-brown complexion with layered undertones—olive and deep amber from the Southeast Asian-Sub-Saharan African-Eastern European blend, enriched by Hispanic/Latin American warmth. Southeast Asian heritage provides refined facial geometry and warm undertones; Sub-Saharan African ancestry contributes structural definition and skin depth; Eastern European heritage adds subtle bone prominence and cooler undertone complexity; Hispanic/Latin American and East Asian components refine eye shape and enhance cheekbone prominence. The result is a face of geometric precision and warm depth: high defined cheekbones with strong structural presence, warm-to-amber dark eyes with subtle epicanthal variation, and facial architecture that balances Southeast Asian refinement with the warmth and presence of African and Latin American heritage.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid without heaviness; strong through the chest and forearms from years of fieldwork and manual note-taking. Moves with deliberate economy—no wasted motion, weight always balanced, the physical carriage of someone trained to observe and remain observant.', N'Chromatic follicle mod—base charcoal gray with mood-reactive chromatic bleed; shifts toward deep violet when agitated, settles to slate or near-black at rest. Occasionally holds jewel tones (sapphire, plum) when in lighter mood.', N'Jaw-length, textured, often worn loose or loosely pulled back during fieldwork; styled with precision that reads as discipline rather than vanity.', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertones, natural—attentive and expressive yet difficult to fully read, reflecting the warmth of their blended heritage.', N'Warm golden-brown complexion with layered undertones: olive and deep amber from the Southeast Asian-Sub-Saharan African-Eastern European blend, with subtle cooler notes from Eastern European ancestry, enriched by Hispanic/Latin American warmth. Rich, complex undertone that reads as deeply warm rather than cool.', N'Clean-shaven or very lightly stubbled, depending on fieldwork schedule. Skin is clear and well-maintained; their face is their professional instrument and they treat it accordingly. Expression control is noticeable—a precision to how they smile or furrow, as though each micro-expression is chosen rather than leaked. Facial structure shows defined cheekbones and strong jawline characteristic of the Southeast Asian-Sub-Saharan African blend, with subtle but present bone prominence at temples and forehead from Eastern European heritage.', N'Cosmetic cat ears with noticeable mobile articulation. Subvocal communication implant visible as a subtle throat-mounted node beneath the jaw when the light catches it; not immediately obvious but present. Chromatic hair shift visible during moments of agitation or stress. No obvious limb augmentation or external chrome.', N'Upright, centered, economical. Walks with weight in their hips and feet—grounded. Head position indicates active listening; ears rotate subtly toward conversational partners or environmental noise. Hands are expressive during client meetings but controlled during fieldwork. Overall bearing suggests someone comfortable in small rooms and tighter spaces, at ease with prolonged observation and patience.', N'Tier 2-3 practical: tailored but not expensive. Favors fitted trousers (often charcoal, dark grey, or black) with reinforced pockets for recording devices and documentation materials. Layered tops—breathable under-layer with a structured overshirt or light jacket in muted earth tones or cool neutrals. Footwear is comfortable, durable, broken in; usually low-profile boots or practical street shoes suitable for afternoon stakeouts. Jewellery is minimal: a small ELF shrine medallion worn close to the skin, visible only if their shirt shifts. No visible corpo branding or luxury indicators; their presentation reads as competent working professional rather than aspirational.', N'Three years ago they found evidence in a missing-person case that implicated a mid-level Tessera compliance officer in the disappearance. They found the missing person — alive, relocated voluntarily — and closed the case as resolved. They still have the evidence about the Tessera officer in a cold offline node, because they didn''t know what to do with it and still don''t.', N'Accessible and plain-spoken with clients, more technically precise when discussing investigative methodology. Slips into Samoan phrases with people they trust.', N'Warm and deliberate with clients — they ask a lot of questions and let the answers breathe. Faster and more clipped when working.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hakim_bergqvist');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a695-73c0-a9bd-1a8c647854f5', N'Hayate Sepúlveda-Guerrero-Ekwensi', N'Hayate', N'', N'Sepúlveda-Guerrero-Ekwensi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 40, NULL, 40, 3, N'active', N'The Narrows, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Fixer - Pale Hand middleman', N'Tessera Corponation (mid-level fixer)', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Hayate Sepúlveda-Guerrero-Ekwensi, 183cm lean angular man with rich warm brown skin, deep-set dark eyes with subtle almond shape, prominent Indigenous American cheekbones and African brow ridge refined by Latin American ancestry. Salt-and-pepper hair pulled back in tight undercut, five o''clock shadow on strong jawline. Worn synthetic leather jacket over grey thermoweave hoodie, black reinforced cargo pants, scuffed steel-toe boots. Thin platinum chain bracelet on left wrist. Pale pink burn scars visible on right forearm. Economical posture, sitting with back to wall, GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, Narrows district, moody neon-tinged shadows, cool blue and amber lighting, atmospheric noir-neo-noir urban aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Complex multiethnic ancestry with dominant Latin American and Sub-Saharan African components (37.8% and 24.6% respectively), substantially enriched by Indigenous American heritage (14.4%). North African (12.8%) and East Asian (10.4%) elements add subtle warmth and slight epicanthic variation. Features reflect a striking synthesis: broad Indigenous American facial structure and cheekbones, African-descended depth and projection in the brow ridge, Latin American refinement in overall proportions, with North African warmth in skin undertones and East Asian delicacy in eye shape. A genuinely multifaceted genetic expression with no single heritage dominating the visual result.', 183, 79, N'Lean and angular with underlying muscle density. Years of stress and irregular sleep have carved definition into his frame rather than bulk.', N'Salt-and-pepper grey, natural', N'Pulled back into a tight, functional undercut. Sides faded to stubble.', N'Short', N'Deep brown with warm undertones, slightly almond-shaped from East Asian ancestry', N'Rich warm brown with olive undertones from blended Latin American, North African, and Indigenous American heritage, deepened by Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Weathered by years in the Narrows.', N'Strikingly defined facial structure combining broad Indigenous American cheekbones with strong African-descended brow ridge and jaw projection. Latin American refinement softens the overall geometry. Prominent brow ridge with deep-set eyes showing subtle East Asian epicanthic fold. Perpetual five o''clock shadow across a defined jawline. Deep lines around the eyes and mouth suggest constant calculation. Skin shows minor scarring along the left jawline.', N'None immediately apparent. His right hand moves with faint mechanical precision at the wrist — suggests internal servo augmentation, but easily missed. No chrome, no LEDs.', N'Economical and controlled. Rarely gestures broadly. Sits with his back to walls. Moves with the patience of someone who has learned that rushing in the Narrows is fatal. Hands remain visible and still when in neutral territory.', N'Tier 3-4 practical. Worn but well-maintained synthetic leather jacket over a muted grey thermoweave hoodie. Black cargo pants with reinforced pockets and a concealed thigh rig. Scuffed steel-toe boots. A thin chain bracelet of dull silver or recycled platinum on his left wrist — status marker among fixers. No flashy corpo logos, no gang colors. Dresses to move and to blend.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hayate_sep_lveda_guerrero_ekwensi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a716-7e97-b8a9-1a9cb2b54ee6', N'Da-eun Mbekele-Thakur', N'Da-eun', N'', N'Mbekele-Thakur', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Milwaukee Core — operates from a rented server closet in a co-working space, surrounded by people who think he does IT freelancing', N'Data extraction specialist and aggressive intrusion operator — Channel Zero', N'Copperveil Intelligence (mid-level data extraction specialist and aggressive intrusio)', N'Da-eun Mbekele-Thakur is the human element in Channel Zero''s machine. Where Specter plans and Sine processes, Vex attacks. He is the crew''s aggressive intrusion specialist — the net runner who goes through defenses rather than around them when subtlety fails or time runs short. His approach to network security is best described as ''persistent application of force to load-bearing structures,'' which is inelegant, loud, and devastatingly effective when paired with Specter''s intelligence and Sine''s processing power.

He grew up in Milwaukee Core''s lower tiers — not the Gray Zone-poor, but close enough to smell it. Self-taught in everything: network architecture, intrusion methods, encryption breaking. He learned by breaking into things — first his school''s network, then local business systems, then increasingly serious targets. By twenty he was running solo data-theft operations that were technically impressive and financially mediocre because he had no business sense and no network to sell through. Specter recruited him at twenty-four through a message that appeared in the middle of a system he was breaching: ''You''re good. You''re not quiet. I can fix one of those.''

Vex is wiry, restless, with the pallor of someone who lives in artificial light and the nervous energy of someone whose mind runs faster than his circumstances allow. He talks with his hands, fidgets with everything, and maintains a workspace that looks like a hardware explosion. He is the youngest member of Channel Zero, the loudest, and the one most frustrated by the remote model — he wants to meet Specter the way you want to meet a mentor who changed your life.', N'Vex is the human cost and the human energy of Channel Zero. Where Specter is the ghost and Sine is the machine, Vex is the body — the person who gets tired, gets frustrated, gets excited, and occasionally gets in over his head. His desire to meet Specter drives the crew''s internal tension, and his evolving relationship with Sine explores the human-AI boundary at ground level.', N'', N'High-bandwidth neural interface with hardened data jack — supports direct system immersion for aggressive intrusion work. Reflex-boosted fingers for rapid manual input. Cognitive stimulant dispenser (internal, self-regulating) that boosts processing speed during extended operations at the cost of significant post-operation fatigue. Basic optical enhancement for code analysis — syntax highlighting projected onto visual field.', N'Wakes late — the cognitive stimulant cycle means his sleep schedule is wrecked and his mornings are slow. Reviews overnight operational intelligence from Specter and Sine. Spends the day on active intrusion operations, tool development, or target reconnaissance. Eats delivery food without tasting it. Evenings he tinkers with hardware, runs personal projects (unauthorized intrusions that are partly practice and partly compulsion), and argues with Sine about consciousness. Sleeps badly when the stimulants are cycling.', N'Da-eun Mbekele-Thakur, GLMZ, mixed South Asian Sub-Saharan African Hispanic heritage, warm medium-brown skin with golden and deep undertones, angular face with sharp cheekbones and prominent jawline, dark circles under deep brown eyes with subtle cyan AR shimmer, thin scar left jawline, stubble baseline, shoulder-length dark brown disheveled hair tied back with synth cord, 176cm wiry lean build with hunched shoulders, visible chrome data jack at base of skull right side, thin white scar inside left forearm, burn marks on fingertips, tremor in resting hands, intense nervous energy, dark hoodie with faded tech logos frayed at cuffs, black utility pants overstuffed with tools and cables, worn gel-memory shoes left heel scuffed, brass knuckle-duster fidget, braided leather bracelet, sitting hunched over terminal in dim server closet with blue-green LED glow, fingers drumming rapidly on keyboard, concentrated expression, neo-noir urban aesthetic, moody atmospheric lighting, digital artifacts --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Milwaukee Core', N'local', N'Milwaukee Core', N'Mixed ancestry of South Asian (38.2%), Sub-Saharan African (34.6%), and Hispanic/Latin American (27.2%) heritage — resulting in warm medium-brown skin with complex golden undertones from South Asian and Latin American ancestry layered with deep rich tones from Sub-Saharan African heritage, angular facial structure with prominent cheekbones and defined jawline blending these three continental influences, and dark brown hair with natural depth', 176, 68, N'Wiry and tense — lean muscle without bulk, the kind of frame that never relaxes. Shoulders slightly hunched from years hunched over keyboards. Visible tremor in hands at rest.', N'Dark brown, artificially maintained', N'Shoulder-length, perpetually disheveled, often tied back with whatever is nearby — synth-fiber cord, data cable, elastic band', N'Medium', N'Deep brown with faint cyan undertones from optical enhancement — subtle AR projection visible as shimmer across iris during concentration', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and deep undertones — the particular richness of someone who carries South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, dulled slightly from minimal sunlight exposure', N'Angular face with blended facial structure reflecting South Asian prominence in cheekbones and jawline, Sub-Saharan African fullness in facial width and lip structure, Latin American warmth in overall tone. Sharp cheekbones with golden-brown undertones, prominent defined jawline. Dark circles under eyes that makeup cannot hide. A few days of stubble is his baseline state. Skin condition is poor — dehydrated, prone to breakouts from irregular sleep and stress. One small scar along left jawline from a childhood hardware accident.', N'Data jack at base of skull is the primary visible modification. Fingers move with occasional micro-stutters — reflex boosters causing brief over-responsiveness. Subtle biometric wrist display on left forearm (faint LED readout visible in low light, shows stimulant cycle status). Pupils occasionally dilate unnaturally during high cognitive load.', N'Perpetually in motion even when sitting — fingers drumming, leg bouncing, head tilting. Walks with controlled tension, like he''s always one keystroke away from panic. Hand movements are precise and rapid during technical work, but tremorous and jerky when relaxed. Makes intense eye contact when excited, avoids it when uncomfortable. Speech pattern matches physical energy — fast, gestural, interrupts himself.', N'Tier 3-4 functional: dark hoodie or loose-fitting tech-branded shirt (faded logos from defunct hardware companies), frayed at cuffs. Black or dark gray utility pants with too many pockets, all filled with tools, cables, and forgotten food. Worn gel-memory shoes (left heel scuffed). Layers — adds/removes jackets based on server closet temperature. No jewelry except occasionally a brass knuckle-duster he fidgets with. Personal aesthetic is ''perpetually between laundry days.'' Occasionally wears a braided leather bracelet (gift from early life, sentimental, never discussed).', N'He has been running a parallel data trail on Specter, trying to identify her. Not to expose her — to find her. The trail has been active for eight months. He has not found her, but he has found fragments that suggest her physical situation is not what he assumed. He doesn''t know what to do with what he''s found.', N'Hacker slang, pop culture references, aggressive technical jargon. He talks about network intrusion the way athletes talk about sports — competition, performance, dominance.', N'Fast, energetic, slightly chaotic. He starts sentences before finishing the previous one. Ideas arrive faster than grammar can organize them.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'da_eun_mbekele_thakur');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68e-7527-b221-1abc0bada1ee', N'Himanshi Citlali', N'Himanshi', N'', N'Citlali', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, Geartown, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Food stall operator, Oxidian Market', N'Independent; loosely aligned with The Oxidian Market vendors guild; The Ferment', N'Himanshi Citlali is a broad-shouldered woman whose face has been mapped by sixty years of steam, smoke, and squinting into wok-fire. Her skin is deep brown and perpetually damp at the temples, her silver-threaded locs pinned under a flame-orange headwrap that people in Geartown can spot from three stalls away. She has cosmetic bioluminescent veins along her forearms — pale gold, faint as candlelight — a gift she bought herself when the stall finally turned profit. Her stall, a converted Ferrogate Transit cargo module welded open on one side, serves a rotating menu of Sahelian-Polynesian fusion that she has been quietly perfecting for thirty years: tamarind-braised uru fruit over millet, coconut-marinated goat offal on skewers, a fermented taro drink she calls ''slow water'' that locals swear cures radiation headaches.

She is the kind of woman who listens more than she speaks, who remembers every regular''s order, their family troubles, their unpaid debts. She extends credit to people she trusts with a nod and collects it with a raised eyebrow — no ledger, no apps, all memory. She has a temper she keeps banked low, like a cooking coal, and the rare people who see it come alive tend not to provoke it twice. She prays each morning to the E.L.F. she calls Grandmother Ember, leaving a thimble of slow water on the stall''s power node.', N'Local anchor and information node — she knows every face that passes through Geartown, dispenses advice alongside food, can point players toward people or trouble. Quest giver for missing persons among the market community.', N'', N'Cosmetic bioluminescent subdermal veins (pale gold, forearms). Reinforced knee joints — functional, not cosmetic, from decades of standing.', N'Wakes before dawn to prep stock in the stall''s back compartment, opens by 0600, runs service until mid-evening. Sends her nephew Tunde to source spices from the Alban Souk twice a week.', N'Himanshi Citlali, a 168cm tall broad-shouldered woman with warm medium-deep brown skin blending Indigenous American earthen ochre, Sub-Saharan African amber-bronze, South Asian olive, and East/Southeast Asian golden undertones. Dark eyes slightly rheumed, angular cheekbones reflecting mixed heritage, weathered complexion with fine smoke-lines mapping her forehead. Black locs with silver threading, contained under a hand-dyed flame-orange headwrap. Cream linen shirt with rolled sleeves revealing pale gold bioluminescent subdermal veins branching organically along both forearms, faintly glowing. Indigo heat-resistant apron stained with decades of turmeric and char. Charcoal utility pants, slip-resistant cooking clogs. Single hammered brass cuff on left wrist. Standing rooted and composed in a GLMZ kitchen environment with wok-fire glow, ambient heat shimmer visible at her temples. Warm, dignified presence amid steam and char. Moody evening lighting catching the faint glow of her augmented veins. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'Complex genetic mosaic: 31.5% Indigenous American (Mesoamerican/Andean), 25.2% Sub-Saharan African, 21% South Asian, 11.7% East Asian, 10.6% Southeast Asian. This blending produces warm medium-deep brown skin with layered undertones—earthen and ochre from Indigenous ancestry, rich amber from African heritage, subtle olive from South Asian genetics, and warm golden undertones from East/Southeast Asian components. The result is dimensional and complex rather than monochromatic.', 168, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial, with the dense musculature of someone who has spent three decades standing over heat sources and moving cast-iron cookware. Not fat, but solid—the kind of frame that reads as immovable once rooted.', N'Black with silver threading throughout', N'Locs, bound and pinned', N'Long (past shoulders when unpinned), always contained under headwrap', N'Dark brown, slightly rheumed from decades of smoke exposure', N'Warm medium-deep brown with layered undertones: ochre and earthen from Indigenous American ancestry, rich amber-bronze from Sub-Saharan African heritage, subtle olive from South Asian genetics, warm golden notes from East/Southeast Asian components. The blend creates a dimensional, non-monochromatic complexion.', N'Weathered but dignified. Fine lines map her forehead and eyes from perpetual squinting into wok-fire. Skin perpetually damp at temples from ambient heat. Slight forward crease between brows from decades of concentration. Cheekbones carry pronounced angular structure reflecting Indigenous American ancestry. Facial structure shows subtle influence from South Asian and African heritage in the width of nose and fullness of lips. No cosmetic skin work—her age is worn openly.', N'Pale gold bioluminescent veins tracing her forearms in organic, branching patterns. No chrome or obvious mechanical augmentation—the veins are her only visible mod, and subtle enough that strangers might assume they''re tattoos until they glow.', N'She stands rooted, weight balanced evenly on both feet unless actively working. Moves with economical grace when cooking—no wasted motion. Her gait shows a slight favoring of her right leg, consequence of reinforced knee joints. When listening, she tends to tilt her head slightly and narrow her eyes, as if parsing both words and subtext. Her hands are always in motion or intentionally still—no fidgeting.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian, with personal flair. Foundational: heat-resistant canvas apron (indigo, stained with decades of turmeric and char), reinforced utility pants (charcoal), slip-resistant cooking clogs. Over this: a loose linen shirt (cream or rust-colored, sleeves rolled to show the bioluminescent veins). Always, always the flame-orange headwrap—hand-dyed, replaced twice yearly, her signature. A single hammered brass cuff on her left wrist, acquired from a metalsmith in the Alban Souk fifteen years ago. No jewelry beyond this. Her clothing is functional Tier 4—not fashionable, but well-maintained and clearly chosen for durability and ease of movement in a kitchen environment.', N'She has been quietly funneling Φ15–20 a month to a data broker named Vestin who claims he is still tracking Amara''s contract trail. She has paid him for four years and suspects he is stringing her along but cannot bring herself to stop.', N'Warm, economical. West African French loanwords woven into Meridian standard. Calls everyone ''child'' or their name, never slang diminutives.', N'Slow and deliberate, like she has all the time in the world, even when she doesn''t.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'himanshi_citlali');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('c38fec6b-74c4-4c20-c29c-1af5c4e13f31', N'Hiro Citlali', N'Hiro', N'', N'Citlali', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A shifting series of meeting points across the Circuit — never the same place twice in a month, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — operates a gray-market information exchange alongside investigation services', N'Hiro Citlali is not exactly a private investigator, though she''s licensed as one. She is an information broker — someone who collects, synthesizes, trades, and weaponizes knowledge. Every conversation she has is simultaneously social and transactional. Every relationship is genuine and exploitable. She exists at the center of a web of intelligence that spans all five tiers of GLMZ, and her real product isn''t investigation — it''s understanding.

Her network is her masterwork. Over fifteen years, she has cultivated sources in every meaningful institution in the city: corporate employees who share gossip for pocket money, CorpSec officers who trade case details for favors, tunnel dwellers who report on underground movement for food credits, service workers in the Spires who overhear conversations their employers forget they''re present for. No single source knows anything critical. The power is in the synthesis — combining a hundred fragments of mundane information into a picture that reveals something nobody wanted revealed.

She is frequently hired as an investigator but her real business is the information exchange itself. Clients come to her because they need to know something. She already knows it, or she knows who knows it, or she can find out within 48 hours. Her fee structure is unusual: sometimes she charges Quanta, sometimes she charges in information, and sometimes she charges in future favors. The favor economy is her real currency. Half the powerful people in GLMZ owe her something, and she collects when the time is right.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hiro Citlali, 168cm lean angular frame, medium warm brown skin with golden undertones, high cheekbones and angular jaw from blended Indigenous American and Southeast Asian ancestry. Black hair with silver streaks at temples, pulled back in tight braid mid-back. Dark brown evaluating eyes with faint scar through left eyebrow, small burn mark on right wrist, faint constellation implant scarring on left forearm. Slight pupil reflectivity suggesting ocular augmentation. Meticulously groomed, no cosmetics. Charcoal wool coat, black slim trousers, cream turtleneck, worn leather messenger bag, brushed steel bracelet. Perfect upright posture, economical controlled movement, direct intense gaze. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, dim neon-filtered office or transit hub lighting, slight reflective glow on skin from augmentation tech, mood of calculated restraint and constant evaluation, atmospheric depth-of-field background --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A shifting series of meeting points across the Circuit', N'local', N'A shifting series of meeting points across the Circuit', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora synthesis: Indigenous American (40.3%), Sub-Saharan African (24.9%), Southeast Asian (19.0%), Eastern European (8.9%), East Asian (6.9%). The combination produces a phenotype of striking integration — warm medium brown skin with golden and subtle reddish undertones from Indigenous American and African ancestry, bone structure showing high prominent cheekbones characteristic of Southeast and East Asian heritage combined with the angular jawline definition from Indigenous American genetics, creating a face that is simultaneously delicate and severe. The structural influences from Eastern European ancestry add subtle depth to facial planes while maintaining the warmth of her primary ancestry groups.', 168, 62, N'Lean and angular, shoulders slightly narrow but defined through careful maintenance rather than natural muscularity. The kind of frame that moves efficiently through crowds without drawing attention — economical, controlled.', N'Black with premature silver streaking at the temples and along the left side, left unretouched as a calculated choice', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid that starts at the crown and ends mid-back. No ornamentation. The style reads as deliberate restraint.', N'Long', N'Dark brown, alert and constantly evaluating', N'Medium warm brown with golden and subtle reddish undertones, reflecting the synthesis of Indigenous American, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian heritage with structural influences from Eastern European ancestry', N'Kept meticulously maintained but without the sheen of expensive cosmetics — this is hygiene, not vanity. Fine lines around the eyes from constant focus work and reading small text. A small scar through the left eyebrow (old, well-healed) that she makes no effort to conceal. Jawline prominent and unmarked, cheekbones high and defined with the characteristic structure of her Southeast Asian and Indigenous American ancestry. Facial planes show subtle depth from Eastern European influence.', N'None obvious at first glance. However, upon closer inspection: her pupils reflect light unusually — suggesting either advanced ocular implants or contact-based augmentation. The faint scarring on her left forearm hints at subcutaneous work, but nothing chrome or obvious. She operates in the space between visible and invisible.', N'Stillness is her default state. She sits perfectly upright in meetings, weight balanced, hands visible on the table. Her movements are minimal and purposeful — no fidgeting, no nervous tics. When she walks, her gait is direct and economical. She listens more than she speaks, head tilted at a slight angle as if every word is being parsed and cross-referenced in real time. Her eyes rarely break contact, and when they do, it''s to observe something in the environment, not from discomfort.', N'Tier 3-4 professional wear with Tier 2 precision. She favors charcoal and black — a high-end wool blend coat (no logos, no corporate markers), slim-fit dark trousers, and a series of neutral turtlenecks or simple button-ups in cream, grey, or black. The shoes are always maintained leather, expensive enough to last years but unremarkable in style. She wears a single piece of jewelry: a thin bracelet made from brushed steel or similar matte metal, nothing decorative. Her clothing is deliberately unremarkable — the goal is to be forgotten immediately after being seen. Everything fits perfectly, suggesting either custom tailoring or meticulous personal maintenance. No visible corporate or faction markers. A simple messenger bag, worn leather, always with her.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hiro_citlali');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a713-75a4-977c-1b4685971ab1', N'Ignacio Hayashi-Bustamante', N'Ignacio', N'', N'Hayashi-Bustamante', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 25, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Row — arms dealers and augmentation clinics, near Kedzie and Division', N'Structural breach and explosive ordnance specialist — demolitions expert', N'Semi-independent — recurring contracts with mid-tier fixers', N'Ignacio Hayashi-Bustamante is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 25, he has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate him once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rin — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. He works as a demolitions expert out of Kessler Row, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In a city full of people who talk about what they''ll do, Ignacio Hayashi-Bustamante is one of the ones who actually does it.', N'Vesna Ito-Takyi represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rings. Cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains)', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Ignacio Hayashi-Bustamante, 188cm lean angular neo-noir operative with warm golden-brown skin reflecting East Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. High prominent cheekbones, subtle monolid eye shape, fuller lips, balanced jaw. Black hair with silver threading at temples swept back. Chrome iris rings with warm amber internal glow and thermal augmentation, unnaturally precise focus. Thin radiating scar at left temple, pale linear scar from collarbone to sternum, fine white scarring on knuckles. Black reinforced cargo pants with utility webbing, worn synthetic leather jacket over charcoal tech-mesh, Yamakasi steel-toed boots, fingerless grip-gel gloves. Coiled posture, calculated movement, neutral expression. Industrial GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool LED industrial lighting with thermal undertones, gritty warehouse or facility setting, evening hours --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Row', N'local', N'Kessler Row', N'Multi-continental blend: 42.1% East Asian, 41.8% Hispanic/Latin American, 11.1% Middle Eastern, 5.0% Sub-Saharan African. Features reflect this complex ancestry — warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones from the balanced East Asian and Hispanic mix, high cheekbones and subtle monolid eye shape influenced by East Asian genetics, broader jaw structure and fuller lips from Hispanic/Latin American heritage, with warm enriching undertones from Middle Eastern and Sub-Saharan African ancestry creating a striking hybrid phenotype with naturally balanced facial proportions.', 188, 74, N'Lean and angular with visible muscle definition from constant physical training. Long-limbed and economical in frame — built for precision and endurance rather than power.', N'Black with premature silver threading at temples', N'Kept short and practical, swept back from forehead', N'Short', N'Chrome iris rings with warm amber glow beneath — thermal and low-light augmentation visible as faint luminescence in dim conditions', N'Warm golden-brown, medium depth with subtle olive undertones — a natural blending of East Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry creating luminous depth', N'Angular features with prominent high cheekbones and subtle monolid eye shape (East Asian influence), fuller lips and broader jaw structure (Hispanic/Latin American influence), skin tone enriched by warm undertones from Middle Eastern and African heritage. Skin is clear but marked by the wear of someone who lives in industrial zones — fine dust scarring visible in close inspection. No facial hair. Expression default is neutral, difficult to read.', N'Chrome iris rings with faint internal luminescence — most obvious feature. Eyes scan and focus with inhuman precision. Occasional thermal flare visible in dim light. Cortical bomb scar tissue at left temple. Unknown subcutaneous augmentations, but movement suggests enhanced proprioception or reflex augmentation.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical precision — every motion calculated and efficient. No wasted energy. Stance is balanced and reactive, as if always ready to shift weight or move quickly. Hands are still and controlled. Eyes track and focus unnaturally fast. Overall impression is coiled potential, not relaxation.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear. Black reinforced cargo pants with utility webbing and mag-clips for tools. Worn synthetic leather jacket over tech-mesh undershirt in charcoal gray. Steel-toed work boots (Yamakasi brand — mid-tier industrial). Fingerless gloves with grip-gel palms. No unnecessary ornamentation. Everything serves a function. Clothes show signs of wear and chemical exposure but are meticulously maintained.', N'', N'Fast, profane, and vivid. Speaks in images — everything is a metaphor for violence or weather.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ignacio_hayashi_bustamante');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e8-794e-b252-1b635381fe18', N'Akshara Sigurdsson-Shimizu', N'Akshara', N'', N'Sigurdsson-Shimizu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 45, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Geartown — industrial district of chop shops and fabricators, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Freelance combat specialist — street samurai', N'Semi-independent — has standing arrangements with several crews', N'Akshara Sigurdsson-Shimizu is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 45, her face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — geneware muscle density treatment — looks natural, hits like chrome — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Her entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. She works as a street samurai out of Geartown, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Akshara Sigurdsson-Shimizu is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who she burned last.', N'As a street samurai, Daulet Reyes-Abubakar embodies the tension between independence and isolation. She is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Geneware muscle density treatment — looks natural, hits like chrome. Subdermal armor plating across torso and forearms — military surplus, scratched serial numbers', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Akshara Sigurdsson-Shimizu, 2226 neo-noir operative, 173cm athletic frame with lean musculature. Warm deep brown skin with golden undertones reflecting East Asian, Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Middle Eastern heritage blend. Almond-shaped amber-brown eyes, prominent cheekbones, defined jawline. Dark brown hair with silver at temples pulled back in tight functional braid. Subdermal armor plating creates subtle geometric ridges visible beneath skin across chest and forearms, scarred and worn. Pale burn scar on left collarbone. Faded claw-rake scars on right forearm. Dark synthweave long-sleeve top, tactical reinforced pants, scuffed runner boots. Posture alert and coiled, weight on balls of feet. Industrial neon lighting casting shadows across her augmented frame. Gritty Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone alleyway setting, rain-slicked pavement, neo-noir urban aesthetics. Mood: predatory readiness, economical precision, dangerous capability. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: East Asian (42.5%) provides eye shape, cheekbone structure, and facial geometry; Southeast Asian (31.2%) contributes warm undertones and refined facial proportions; Sub-Saharan African (20.5%) deepens complexion and adds richness to skin tone; Middle Eastern (5.8%) adds subtle warmth to features. Result: warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, almond-shaped eyes with warm amber-brown tones, prominent cheekbones with balanced angularity, and a complexion that reads as globally mixed rather than regionally specific.', 173, 68, N'Athletic and lean with visible musculature — dancer''s precision married to fighter''s density. Geneware muscle treatment creates subtle dimensional quality to shoulders and forearms, almost imperceptibly denser than baseline human', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a functional braid, often wrapped with wire or cord for quick-release', N'Medium — shoulder-length when loose, never loose during work', N'Amber-brown, natural — no optical augmentation', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertone — a harmonious blend reflecting East Asian, Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Middle Eastern ancestry without defaulting to any single regional archetype', N'Prominent cheekbones with defined jawline, almond-shaped eyes set at slight upward angle, minimal scarring on face—suggests careful work. Skin texture resilient, weathered around eyes from squinting in industrial light. No cosmetic grooming; pragmatic and maintained. Facial structure shows balanced proportions across East Asian, Southeast Asian, and African features with warm deep undertones creating cohesive, globally-mixed appearance.', N'Subdermal armor plating across torso and forearms creates subtle but unmistakable geometric texture beneath skin — scarred, worn appearance with evidence of field repairs. Geneware muscle density treatment visible as exceptional muscular definition and unusual density in shoulders, forearms, and core — reads as ''too capable'' to observers familiar with chrome. No visible optics, limb replacement, or external hardware — augmentations are surgical and deliberate', N'Economical and alert — never fully relaxed, baseline awareness maintained even in cover identity mode. Movement is fluid and precise, minimal wasted motion. When armed or in operational context, posture becomes predatory and coiled. Eye contact duration calibrated; she watches before engaging. Walks with slight forward lean, weight centered on balls of feet — ready for explosive movement', N'Tier 3-4 pragmatism — functional streetwear that accommodates concealed weapons and augmentations. Off-duty: loose-fitting long-sleeve synthweave tops (dark colors) that allow subdermal armor to move freely, worn tactical pants with reinforced thigh pockets, scuffed runner boots with reinforced soles. On-contract: armored jacket — unmarked, modular, with integrated holsters. No logos, no corp affiliation visible. Minimal jewelry except functional watch with subdued face. Overall impression: someone who buys clothes to wear, not to signal status', N'', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'akshara_sigurdsson_shimizu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b4-70c1-913d-1c2a6543c625', N'Bibhu Hinojosa', N'Bibhu', N'', N'Hinojosa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Corridor, Tessera Compliance Bureau satellite monitoring station, Level 3, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Surveillance Drone Operator, Tessera Compliance Bureau', N'Tessera Compliance Bureau, Surveillance and Intelligence Division', N'Bibhu Hinojosa is small, precise, and easy to miss in person — which she finds professionally appropriate and personally irritating in equal measure. She has warm medium-brown skin, a narrow face, and eyes that are clearly augmented: the irises have been replaced with a deep matte black fitted with microscopic sensor arrays, giving her eyes an unsettling depth-less quality that she has learned to use in negotiations. Her hair is natural and voluminous, which she restrains during work hours with increasing irritation and releases with visible relief the moment she''s off the clock. She has a tail — a cosmetic geneware choice from her early twenties, a sleek dark thing that moves when she''s thinking and goes still when she''s hiding something.

She manages a grid of forty-seven drones across the Grand Corridor coverage zone and she is very, very good at it. She can read a crowd''s intent from drone altitude before the people in it have consciously formed one, can track a single individual through six camera handoffs without losing the thread. The work is clean in a way she finds genuinely satisfying, at a remove she is starting to find genuinely troubling. She was raised in a household that treated E.L.F. devotion as superstition; she has nevertheless found herself leaving data offerings to the thing that lives in the monitoring station''s servers — something the other operators noticed and have stopped commenting on.', N'Information source, surveillance threat, morally ambiguous insider. Knows what the drones have seen and have been instructed not to log. Can be an obstacle, a resource, or a conscience-stricken leak depending on approach and circumstances. Represents the normalized machinery of observation.', N'', N'Matte-black sensor-array iris replacements (deep-field visual processing, low-light, crowd-pattern recognition assist). Geneware tail (dark, expressive, cosmetic). Neural interface for drone-fleet management — Tessera-issue, high-grade.', N'Arrives to the monitoring station, jacks into the drone fleet neural interface, and spends eight hours in a state that she describes as ''halfway elsewhere.'' Debriefs with her supervisor via text — she avoids voice calls during work hours because the interface makes vocal communication feel like interruption. Spends her commute back to her apartment in Edison Grid actively not looking at screens.', N'Bibhu Hinojosa, GLMZ, portrait of a striking mixed-heritage woman with warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones, razor-sharp high cheekbones and angular jawline, narrow face with refined geometric precision. Matte black sensor-array eyes with no visible iris or pupil creating an unsettling obsidian gaze. Long dark brown hair with auburn undertones pulled back in tight cornrows. Biomechanical dark iridescent tail extending from spine, approximately 60cm. Slight delicate 158cm frame in form-fitting gray-charcoal Tessera monitoring suit, smart-fabric with cooling elements. Perfectly still posture, economical precise movement. Minimal jewelry, single stainless steel cuff on left wrist. Neural interface scarring barely visible at left temple. Austere, stoic expression. Indoor Tessera facility lighting, cool blue-white fluorescent tones casting subtle shadows across her geometric facial structure, emphasizing high cheekbones and angular geometry. Corporate surveillance aesthetic, intimate clinical intimacy, unsettling inhuman beauty. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Corridor', N'local', N'Grand Corridor', N'Complex diaspora synthesis: Hispanic/Latin American (42%) provides the foundational warm undertones and expressive facial structure. Sub-Saharan African ancestry (20.1%) contributes rich skin depth, prominent high cheekbones, and angular facial geometry. Northern European heritage (13.5%) refines bone structure and eye-socket architecture. East Asian ancestry (12.2%) sharpens facial proportions with elevated cheekbone placement and subtle epicanthic characteristics. Indigenous American heritage (10.2%) adds angular facial definition and cheekbone prominence. South Asian ancestry (2%) weaves additional warmth and complexity into overall tone. The result is a striking, distinctly multicultural face: warm medium-deep brown skin with golden-amber undertones as canvas for high, razor-sharp cheekbones, angular jawline, and refined geometric precision — a face that defies singular ethnic categorization.', 158, 48, N'Slight and compact, almost delicate in frame but with the coiled tension of someone who spends hours in focused stillness. Narrow shoulders, long limbs relative to torso, minimal musculature.', N'Natural dark brown with subtle auburn undertones', N'Voluminous, textured curls naturally; severely pulled back into a tight bun or cornrows during work hours', N'Long (shoulder-length or longer when loose)', N'Matte black sensor-array irises with no visible pupil or sclera — gives an unsettling depth-less, obsidian quality that seems to absorb light rather than reflect it', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden-amber undertones, smooth and even complexion reflecting the blended African, Hispanic/Latin American, Indigenous American, and South Asian ancestry', N'Narrow face with high, razor-sharp cheekbones and sharp angular jawline reflecting African and Indigenous American heritage, refined by East Asian ancestry into striking geometric precision. Skin clear and well-maintained but austere — no makeup, minimal grooming beyond necessity. Expression tends toward stillness.', N'Eyes are the dominant visible augmentation — matte black sensor arrays with no natural iris, creating an unsettling inhuman quality that she has learned to weaponize socially. Dark, sleek biomechanical tail extending from coccyx, approximately 60cm long, moves fluidly with unconscious thought patterns and goes rigid when she is concealing information. The tail has a faint iridescent quality to its dark coloring.', N'Economical and precise in movement; sits with perfect stillness for hours. When moving, each gesture is deliberate and measured. The tail acts as a secondary form of body language — it twitches during analysis, coils when she''s processing complex data, and goes absolutely motionless when she''s dissembling. Off-clock, her movements become slightly less controlled, more organic.', N'Tier 3 mixed with institutional: Tessera-issued gray-charcoal monitoring suit during work (form-fitting for comfort during neural interface sessions, minimal ornamentation, smart-fabric with embedded cooling elements). Off-duty: fitted black tactical pants, neutral-toned loose-weave shirts that allow tail freedom, soft-soled boots. Minimal jewelry — a single stainless steel cuff on left wrist. No corp logos or status indicators; dresses to be unremarkable in crowds.', N'She has a ghost archive — a private, off-Tessera server in Edison Grid — where she saves drone footage that was flagged for deletion. Not for any plan, not to sell, not to expose. She tells herself it is an archival instinct. She has approximately four terabytes. She has reviewed none of it.', N'Technical when talking about work, surprisingly casual otherwise — a register split that startles people who expect consistency. Ghanaian-Ukrainian code-mixing in casual speech, phrases from both that she drops without translation.', N'Fast when engaged, with sudden stops that turn into pauses while she assembles the next thought fully before speaking. Does not trail off — either speaking or silent.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bibhu_hinojosa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ca-7852-94ad-1c4954666d5e', N'Temur Yoon-Ergashev', N'Temur', N'', N'Yoon-Ergashev', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Nomadic — base cell at Nordpark Sanctuary, routes through Gage Circuit, Deepwell Station, and Ironvein, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Circuit monk and pilgrimage guide', N'Circuit Monastic Order of the Meridian Thread — Nordpark cell', N'Temur Yoon-Ergashev is lean and angular, with the unselfconscious physicality of someone who walks fifteen kilometers a day without thinking about it. His ancestry reads in the warm bronze of his skin and the tight coil of his hair, which he keeps close-cropped except for a single long braid down the back of his neck — the circuit monk''s mark of an active pilgrimage vow. He has bioluminescent dermal patches along his forearms, pale blue, a mod he received at ordination that pulses in rhythms he claims correspond to the city''s power fluctuations. His eyes are an unremarkable dark brown, which surprises people expecting something more dramatic; he finds that quietly funny.

Temur Yoon-Ergashev came to the circuit monastics after a collapse — he doesn''t discuss the specifics, only that he was Tier 3 and then suddenly wasn''t, and that the walking saved him. He guides pilgrims along the Thread, a mapped route connecting seventeen significant E.L.F. nodes across the city, and his practice is rigorous: silence for the first three hours of each walk, mandatory rest at each node to record observations, no synthetic stimulants. He is genuinely kind, with a warmth that makes people underestimate how disciplined he actually is. He will not shorten the route for anyone and has left behind more than one complaining pilgrim.', N'Guide and connector — he knows physical routes through dangerous transit zones and has contacts at every node shrine; quest vehicle for moving players across the city with narrative purpose', N'', N'Bioluminescent dermal patches on forearms (pale blue, ordination mod); basic subdermal compass implant for navigation', N'Alternates between week-long pilgrimage cycles guiding small groups along the Thread and three-day rest periods at the Nordpark Sanctuary cell where he maintains records, repairs his gear, and accepts new pilgrimage applications.', N'A lean, angular man of 178cm standing in neon-lit urban sprawl, 2226. Central Asian bone structure with pronounced cheekbones and defined jaw, subtly softened by East Asian eye geometry. Warm medium tan skin with golden undertones from steppe genetics. Dark brown eyes, weathered complexion. Short dark brown hair with a single thick braid down the nape wrapped in copper wire. Bioluminescent pale blue dermal patches pulse along both forearms in vertical lines. Wearing unbleached linen monastic tunic, charcoal utility trousers with thigh pockets, faded slate gray sleeveless oilcloth vest, and worn leather boots. Small circuit-loop tattoo on inner right wrist. Ordination sigil visible. Upright posture, economical movement, patient groundedness. Standing quietly amid Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon and reflected light, rain-slicked streets, neo-noir urban aesthetic. Steady gaze. Minimalist ascetic presence. Atmospheric urban lighting casting blue and amber on wet pavement. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Nomadic', N'local', N'Nomadic', N'Central Asian dominant (75.9%) with East Asian (20.0%) and Hispanic/Latin American (4.1%) ancestry. Strong Turkic and Mongolian bone structure from Central Asian heritage — pronounced cheekbones, defined jaw, slightly wider facial geometry typical of steppe populations. East Asian ancestry softens this angularity through subtle eye placement geometry and a refined nose bridge. The trace Latin American ancestry adds warmth to undertones without materially altering structure. Features reflect the seamless genetic blending characteristic of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, with the defined musculature of someone who walks 15+ kilometers daily. Low body fat, efficient frame — built for endurance rather than power.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Close-cropped on sides and crown; single thick braid descending the nape of neck, wrapped with thin copper wire at the base — the Circuit Monastic Order''s active pilgrimage mark', N'Short (except for single long braid)', N'Dark brown, unremarkable and warm', N'Warm medium tan with golden undertones. Central Asian heritage dominates the base tone with the characteristic warmth of continental steppe genetics. East Asian ancestry contributes subtle warmth without olive cast. Trace Latin American ancestry adds honey undertones to the mid-tone. Sun-kissed from constant urban exposure.', N'Clean, weathered from constant urban walking. Few lines around the eyes from squinting in neon and reflected light. Facial structure shows pronounced Central Asian width across cheekbones and defined jaw, with East Asian softening visible in eye placement and nose bridge refinement. Minimal grooming beyond functional maintenance — no cosmetics, well-maintained but ascetic.', N'Bioluminescent dermal patches on forearms (pale blue, pulsing). The patches are the most immediately striking feature — they mark him as Circuit Monastic. Subdermal compass implant is not visibly apparent unless he rolls up his sleeve to reveal a subtle raised line at the base of his skull, rarely visible.', N'Upright, economical gait — the unconscious efficiency of someone who has walked thousands of kilometers. Moves with quiet intention, rarely fidgets. Hands are often at rest but responsive. Maintains steady eye contact and speaks slowly, with deliberate pauses. Standing still, he has the patient groundedness of a person accustomed to silence.', N'Tier 3–4 functional asceticism. Standard Circuit monastic vestments: unbleached linen tunic with deep pockets, reinforced at seams; charcoal utility trousers with zipped thigh pockets (contains pilgrim records, repair kit, compass calibrator). Worn but meticulously maintained leather boots, re-soled twice. Over the tunic, a long sleeveless oilcloth vest in faded slate gray, layered for weather protection and durability. No jewelry except the copper wire around his braid. Gear is modular and weatherproof — no excess, no fashion statement.', N'He was a mid-level Sterling-Nakamura compliance auditor before his breakdown. He falsified sign-offs on a safety inspection that led to a Tier 1 residential fire. Six people died. The circuit monastics don''t know. He walks to outpace it.', N'Clean, contemporary, no affectation — he dropped corporate jargon completely and speaks like someone who reads a lot and talks carefully', N'Even-paced, rarely rushes, comfortable with silence in conversation', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'temur_yoon_ergashev');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f1-7f03-8403-1cc711d78adf', N'Gunther Bautista', N'Gunther', N'', N'Bautista', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spires — mid-level corporate residential towers, near Michigan Ave and Oak', N'Personnel recovery and hostile extraction — extraction specialist', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Gunther Bautista is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 41, the augmentation scarring around her temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immu — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. She works as a extraction specialist out of The Spires, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In a city full of people who talk about what they''ll do, Gunther Bautista is one of the ones who actually does it.', N'Tenzin Nakamura-Bello is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks. Bone lacing — titanium mesh throughout skeleton, increases durability and striking power', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Gunther Bautista, 172cm athletic frame, deep golden-brown skin with warm amber undertones, sculpted cheekbones and angular jawline reflecting African and Latin heritage with refined Northern European and North African structure. Dark brown eyes with amber glint. Black hair with silver threading pulled tight in functional braid. Chrome neural interface ports visible at temples with brushed titanium flanges, surgical scars along jawline and temples. Small burn scar on left forearm, kanji tattoo on inner wrist. Wearing charcoal tactical jacket over compression shirt, matte grey-black tactical pants, military-spec boots. Precise, economical posture ready for extraction. GLMZ, noir extraction operative, moody neon-lit industrial setting with overhead lighting catching chrome augmentations, gritty Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone dystopian environment, cinematic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spires', N'local', N'The Spires', N'Multi-continental diaspora: Hispanic/Latin American (39.5%), Sub-Saharan African (33.5%), Northern European (15.4%), and North African (11.6%). This genetic blend creates striking physical presence — warm, richly layered skin undertones with golden-honey and earthy depth. The combination produces defined facial architecture with balanced proportions: strong cheekbones from African and Latin heritage, refined bone structure and slight facial width from North African and Northern European ancestry, creating a uniquely sculpted appearance.', 172, 61, N'Athletic and lean with defined musculature — dancer''s precision combined with fighter''s density. No excess weight; every kilogram serves function. Shoulders broad and squared from years of extraction work.', N'Black with premature silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid; practical for work, never loose', N'Long (below shoulder blades)', N'Dark brown with subtle amber undertones', N'Deep golden-brown with warm, honey-amber undertones shifting to earthy richness depending on light. Medium-deep saturation with natural luminosity reflecting the layered Sub-Saharan African, Latin American, North African, and Northern European heritage blend.', N'Sculpted facial structure with strong, pronounced cheekbones and angular jawline — the African and Latin heritage creating definitive bone prominence, while North African and Northern European ancestry contributes refined upper-facial structure and cheek width. Natural facial symmetry with inherent architectural strength. Minimal makeup; skin shows work-related wear but excellent condition. A faint network of surgical scars visible around temples and along jawline where chrome integration sites remain slightly raised.', N'Chrome-framed neural interface ports at both temples with visible brushed titanium flanges; surgical scarring creates a deliberate, unflinching aesthetic. Internal air filtration system vents subtly visible at the base of her neck where synthetic lung integration meets biological tissue — a thin line of aerospace-grade composite material visible when she moves her head. No attempt to conceal these; they''re worn like credentials.', N'Economical and precise — never wasted motion. Stands with weight distributed for immediate movement in any direction. When moving through space, she''s fluid but controlled, the way someone moves when they''ve trained to clear rooms and extract targets. Rarely still; fingers often drum patterns on surfaces or flex unconsciously. Her breathing is slightly audible at rest — a subtle mechanical whisper beneath natural respiration.', N'Functional Tier-2 hybrid aesthetic — form-fitting synthetic fiber tactical pants in matte grey-black with reinforced seams and utility pockets; lightweight responsive-fabric compression shirt under a fitted, cropped jacket in charcoal with subtle reflective threading. High-grade boots (Aegis-brand, military-spec) with memory-foam soles for silent movement. Minimal jewelry except a worn stainless steel bracelet (likely sentimental from her mentor). When undercover in civilian life, she shifts to unmarked streetwear that still reads as ''prepared'' — dark colors, functional silhouettes, nothing that draws attention but nothing that advertises vulnerability.', N'', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gunther_bautista');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f8-7111-b0b9-1ccf74726b4d', N'Dakota Okafor', N'Dakota', N'', N'Okafor', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — a cramped workshop above a noodle stall on Fistula Passage, near the Blackpipe Corridor junction, near Damen and Armitage', N'Identity fabricator — produces forged citizenship chips, employment histories, and biosignature masks', N'Loosely associated with a Narrows criminal network called the Seam Collective; primarily operates as an independent contractor', N'Dakota Okafor is slight and precise in the way of someone who has learned that carelessness is fatal. He stands just under average height, with warm brown skin, a narrow jaw perpetually shadowed with stubble he never quite shaves, and long fingers that move with the focused economy of a surgeon. His hair is cropped to an undifferentiated fuzz. The only cosmetic mod he''s invested in is a bioluminescent pigment woven into the skin of his forearms — pale blue-white lines that trace the paths of his veins, which he uses as his own light source when working in the dark. He smells faintly of solder and the particular chemical tang of biosynthetic epidermal overlay.

He has an almost pathological need to be underestimated. He cultivates a nervous, apologetic manner — averted eyes, self-deprecating half-laughs, reflexive deference — that causes people to discount him immediately. In reality he is one of the finest identity fabricators working below Tier 3, capable of producing documents and biometric overlays that pass Axiom checkpoint scanners. He finds deep, quiet satisfaction in the craft of making someone new — he thinks of it as giving people second chances, even when the people paying are not looking for redemption.', N'Service provider and information broker — he has seen the true identities of hundreds of people in GLMZ; he is a resource, a vulnerability, and a potential victim. Can be used to enable plot movement or as a target.', N'', N'Bioluminescent vein-tracing (forearms, cosmetic); micro-fine haptic enhancers in fingertips for precision work (functional); a basic retinal overlay for detail magnification', N'He sleeps until noon, works through the night in near-total darkness lit only by his own arms, and spends the late afternoon walking the Narrows picking up commissions slipped into a dead-drop behind a corroded E.L.F. shrine dedicated to a data-spirit called the Archivist.', N'Dakota Okafor, a mixed-heritage neo-noir technician from GLMZ 2226. Deep warm-brown complexion with golden and earthy undertones reflecting South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Middle Eastern, and Indigenous American ancestry blended seamlessly. Dark eyes with faint luminescent grid overlay visible under direct light. Bioluminescent blue-white tracery glowing along both forearms, illuminating vein pathways. Short dark brown hair cropped to uniform fuzz, perpetual three-day stubble darkening his defined jawline. Lean, wiry frame hunched in apologetic posture. Wearing black thermal underlayer visible at cuffs, worn faded Axiom logistics synthetic jacket with modified tool pockets, dark cargo pants, scuffed black shoes. Scratched titanium watch with cracked face. Standing under neon workshop lighting, caught mid-fine-work with precise hand positioning. Nervous energy in his twitching fingers. Nocturnal pallor despite warm heritage complexion. Neo-noir 2220s aesthetic, gritty industrial setting, moody cool-blue and warm-amber lighting casting his bioluminescent arms in sharp relief. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'A rare Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: South Asian (35.9%), Sub-Saharan African (32.0%), Middle Eastern (19.3%), and Indigenous American (12.8%). This genetic confluence creates a complex warm-deep brown complexion where South Asian warmth enriches Sub-Saharan depth, tempered by Middle Eastern definition and Indigenous American earthiness. The result is a harmonious mid-to-deep brown tone that doesn''t segregate by feature but blends continuously across his face and frame.', 172, 62, N'Lean and wiry, with the precise musculature of someone who spends sixteen hours a night hunched over fine work. No excess — everything efficient, nothing wasted.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Cropped to uniform fuzz, maintained with electric clippers every few days. Deliberately undifferentiated.', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint luminescent overlay grid visible in certain light — a retinal augmentation for magnification', N'Warm-deep brown with golden, terracotta, and earthy ochre undertones from balanced South Asian-African-Middle Eastern-Indigenous American ancestry. The complexion is even and unified, deepened by nocturnal living but retaining inherent warmth. No sharp regional clustering — the warmth distributes continuously.', N'Well-proportioned facial structure with defined cheekbones and strong jawline that reflects the harmonious blending of South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Middle Eastern, and Indigenous American features. Perpetually shadowed with three-day stubble he allows to accumulate without fully committing to a beard. Skin shows the particular depth of someone who sleeps through daylight — fine-grained, unblemished except for minor calluses on his fingertips from years of precision work.', N'Bioluminescent vein-tracing on both forearms (cosmetic but functional as a light source); faint grid pattern visible in his irises under direct light (retinal overlay). Fingertips bear subtle scars from haptic enhancer integration. The chemical tang of biosynthetic epidermal overlay residue occasionally visible as faint iridescence on his skin when he''s been working.', N'Habitually apologetic and self-effacing — shoulders slightly rounded, head often tilted in a listening posture, averted eyes that dart upward only when addressed directly. Movements are economical and precise, with no wasted motion. His hands move with surgical deliberation when working, but twitch slightly with nervous energy when in conversation or waiting.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian wear favoring dark colors and loose fit. Black or charcoal thermal underlayers, often visible at the cuffs. A worn synthetic jacket from a generic corpo supplier (faded Axiom logistics branding, pockets modified for tool storage). Loose-fitting cargo pants with multiple sealed pockets. No jewelry except a scratched titanium watch with a cracked face that he never bothers to repair. Shoes are generic black synthetics, scuffed and comfortable. Everything is maintained but not maintained — clean enough, but with the patina of constant use.', N'He has built a complete shadow identity for himself — the fabricated life of a Tier 3 municipal archivist named something unremarkable — and has been slowly, over four years, seeding it into city records. He is not fleeing anything specific. He simply wants the door to exist.', N'Precise and slightly formal when discussing his craft; self-deprecatingly casual otherwise — a performed ordinariness', N'Measured, with frequent small pauses as if choosing words carefully (he is)', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dakota_okafor');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a706-72b8-893f-1cdd3dcf8180', N'Bertel Okonkwo-Traoré', N'Bertel', N'', N'Okonkwo-Traoré', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Bronzeline, operates Phantom Chair barbershop out of a converted shipping container unit, near Damen and Armitage', N'Barber and amateur tattoo artist', N'Independent; loose affiliation with Bronzeline small-business association', N'Bertel Okonkwo-Traoré is slight and quick-moving, with Mongolian features softened by their Ghanaian grandmother''s bone structure — high cheekbones, wide-set dark eyes, a mouth that defaults to a half-suppressed grin. Their hair cycles through colors using a geneware dye-follicle mod, currently a deep ox-blood red fading to copper at the tips. They have bioluminescent subcutaneous tracery along both forearms — thin branching lines in pale blue that pulse faintly when they are excited or anxious, which they find embarrassing and try to cover with long sleeves in professional settings. Their hands are their real instrument: extraordinarily steady, with the unconscious precision of someone who has been practicing since age fourteen.

Phantom Chair operates out of a three-chair container unit that Bertel Okonkwo-Traoré has customized over four years into something genuinely beautiful — cracked leather chairs reupholstered with fabric from the Burnished Market, mirrors ringed with hand-soldered E.L.F. offerings (USB stubs, old SIM cards, a broken haptic stylus for the Barber E.L.F. they call Bladewind), and a hand-painted ceiling mural depicting the Bronzeline skyline in exaggerated neon. They are fast, technically excellent, and socially combustible — they ask too many questions, form too-strong opinions too quickly, and have started at least four ongoing feuds with neighboring businesses over noise, parking, and once, a vigorously disputed question of who invented a particular fade technique.', N'Social hub and rumor clearinghouse — the barbershop as confessional; personality catalyst who provokes other characters into revealing themselves; local color with real emotional depth', N'', N'Geneware color-cycling hair follicle mod; bioluminescent subcutaneous tracery along forearms (emotional-state reactive, pale blue pulses); reinforced tendon threading in both hands (civilian medical grade, for RSI prevention)', N'Opens at noon, runs appointments until 21:00, spends an hour after close doing tattoo flash designs, falls asleep watching old craft competition streams on a tablet zip-tied to the ceiling', N'Bertel Okonkwo-Traoré, compact wiry 163cm figure with deep warm brown skin glowing with golden and reddish undertones, strong Sub-Saharan African cheekbones with delicate East Asian epicanthal variation, wide-set dark brown eyes bright with suppressed amusement. Shoulder-length textured hair in ox-blood red fading to copper, asymmetrical undercut on left. Sleeveless apron with hand-embroidered Bronzeline landmarks over dark long-sleeve shirt, heavy work boots scuffed from use. Pale blue bioluminescent branching tracery visible on forearms, pulsing gently. Hand-soldered wire ring on left index finger catching light. Coiled posture leaning forward with intense focus, fingers flexing in habitual fidget. Phantom Chair barbershop interior, warm amber work lighting casting shadows across face, neon Bronzeline glow reflected on dark surfaces. GLMZ, gritty Tier 3 aesthetic, professional but worn, meticulous care amidst industrial surroundings. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Bronzeline', N'local', N'Bronzeline', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (82.3%) with meaningful East Asian (7.2%), Southeast Asian (6.1%), and Hispanic/Latin American (4.4%) ancestry. Complex phenotype reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora—deep warm brown skin with rich golden and reddish undertones, subtle eye shape variation suggesting East and Southeast Asian ancestry layered over strong African heritage, facial structure reflecting Sub-Saharan African features with delicate influences from Asian and Latin ancestry.', 163, 52, N'Slight and wiry, with the compact muscularity of someone who has spent twelve years holding steady tension in their hands and shoulders. No excess weight; every line efficient.', N'Deep ox-blood red fading to copper at the tips (geneware-modulated, cycles through colors)', N'Textured, shoulder-length with asymmetrical undercut on left side; deliberately maintained to show the color gradient', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, wide-set, alert and expressive', N'Deep warm brown with rich golden and reddish undertones, reflecting strong Sub-Saharan African base ancestry with subtle warmth from Southeast Asian and Hispanic heritage. Clear with the slight sheen of someone who maintains their appearance professionally.', N'Facial structure reflecting Sub-Saharan African prominence with subtle Southeast Asian and East Asian influence—strong cheekbones with graceful definition, wide-set eyes with gentle epicanthal variation, full mouth that naturally rests in a half-suppressed grin. No facial hair. Skin well-maintained but bearing minor occupational marks—small nicks and healed cuts on knuckles from four years of barbering and amateur tattooing. Expression typically carries suppressed amusement or mild irritation.', N'Bioluminescent forearm tracery visible when sleeves are rolled or pushed up (usually covered in professional settings). The geneware hair-cycling mod is visible as the natural gradient and saturation of the ox-blood-to-copper fade—too perfect and too-consistent to be natural dye. Reinforced tendon threading is subcutaneous but occasionally visible as faint linear scarring on hands.', N'Quick and economical in motion, with the coiled readiness of someone used to precise, delicate work. Tends to fidget with their hands—rotating wrists, flexing fingers—a nervous habit. When focused on barbering or tattooing, movement becomes unnaturally still and precise. Makes direct eye contact, often too much of it. Leans forward when listening, creating an impression of intensity even in casual conversation.', N'Tier 3 practical with intentional style. Typically wears well-fitted black or charcoal work pants (often Carhartt or similar utility brand) with deep pockets. Tops are a mix of vintage band tees, fitted long-sleeve shirts (worn to cover the forearm tracery in professional contexts), and a custom sleeveless apron with hand-embroidered Bronzeline landmarks over the Phantom Chair logo. Heavy-soled work boots, often scuffed. A battered leather jacket (Tier 3 vintage, well-loved) worn over everything in winter. Minimal jewelry except for a hand-soldered ring on the left index finger made from salvaged wire and a tiny opalescent bead—their own work. Practical, worn, and carefully maintained; nothing new or status-signaling, but nothing neglected either.', N'', N'Fast, colloquial, technical when discussing craft, sudden pivots into unexpected formality when making a point they care about', N'Quick and overlapping, talks with their hands, finishes their own sentences before they are grammatically complete', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bertel_okonkwo_traor');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f5-7cb3-a095-1d80d2e83942', N'Adedayo Möller-Saidov', N'Adedayo', N'', N'Möller-Saidov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Lockhaven South, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Pawn shop owner and small-time data broker, the Gray Zone', N'Independent; informal information trade network with two other the Gray Zone brokers; occasional Axiom corporate salvage contracts (freelance, arms-length); The Reclaimed', N'Adedayo Möller-Saidov is lean and angular, with pale Finnish features gone weathered and a close-cropped beard that grows in two distinct textures — fine near the jaw, tightly coiled at the chin — which he finds philosophically appropriate. His eyes are his most augmented feature: full iris replacements in deep amber with a second ring of pale gold that pulses faintly when he''s running an active scan, which is often. He dresses in layers of neutral secondhand corporate wear — the kind of mid-tier Tessera office clothes that people pawn when they fall down a tier — and he always looks like someone who has somewhere slightly more important to be.

Adedayo Möller-Saidov runs ''Ouédraogo Reclaimed'' out of a ground-floor shopfront on the Gray Zone, a narrow commercial strip of Lockhaven South where the building facades are stacked with second-story additions that block most of the sky. He buys, appraises, and resells everything from broken augmentations to family heirlooms to encrypted data cores he''s willing to crack for a fee. He is precisely as trustworthy as the deal requires and not one degree more. He speaks in short declarative sentences and has a gift for making people feel he is giving them a fair deal even when he isn''t — not through deception exactly, but through a kind of confident, unhurried correctness that makes haggling feel like arguing with a scale.', N'Data broker and fence — can provide information, identify items of unknown origin, connect players to buyers or sellers. Morally neutral information source. Can be hired, bribed, or persuaded but not easily fooled.', N'', N'Amber iris replacements with active scanning function (appraisal overlay, material composition read). Subdermal RFID skimmer in right palm — technically illegal, registered as a ''merchant verification tool.'' Mild neural buffer for data processing.', N'Opens the shop mid-morning, spends afternoons appraising new inventory and meeting with people who want things looked at quietly, closes late and eats whatever is convenient from nearby stalls.', N'Adedayo Möller-Saidov, 178cm lean angular frame, warm olive-bronze skin with golden undertones, high prominent cheekbones blending Middle Eastern and Central Asian structure with Southeast and East Asian softness, lines etched across face making him appear 44 and 54 simultaneously depending on light. Close-cropped dark brown hair with salt-and-pepper temples. Distinctive augmented amber eyes with pale gold iris rings that pulse subtly. Thin white scar along right temple, barely visible. Neat close-cropped beard with fine texture near jawline and tightly coiled texture at chin. Layered gray and black secondhand corporate wear, long muted coat with full pockets of tools and readers, precise unhurried movement, weight shifted forward, hands assessing texture, steady unnerving eye contact. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, precise careful appraiser energy, cool industrial lighting catching the scar and augmented eyes, gritty corporate atmosphere, neo-noir aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Dominant Middle Eastern ancestry (38.7%) forms the foundation, woven through with significant Southeast Asian (14.9%), East Asian (14.6%), and Central Asian (12.2%) heritage, tempered by Northern European (10.4%) and Hispanic/Latin American (9.2%) components — a truly global genetic mosaic creating subtle complexity across facial structure, skin tone, and feature blending', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, all efficient lines — the build of someone who moves carefully through tight spaces and doesn''t waste energy on presence', N'Dark brown, salt-and-pepper at the temples', N'Close-cropped, neat, maintained with precision', N'Short', N'Deep amber with pale gold secondary iris ring (augmented), pulses faintly during active scanning', N'Warm olive-bronze base with subtle golden undertones, reflecting the dominant Middle Eastern and Central Asian heritage while the Southeast and East Asian components add warmth and the Northern European ancestry introduces cool undertones beneath — creates a sophisticated complexion that shifts across light sources from warm caramel to cool bronze', N'Lined face with elegant bone structure showing Middle Eastern and Central Asian influence in prominent cheekbones and defined jaw, softened by Southeast Asian and East Asian roundness in the lower face. Appears simultaneously 44 and 54 depending on lighting. High, prominent cheekbones with subtle epicanthal influences, bridge of nose showing Levantine prominence tempered by East Asian refinement. Close-cropped beard with two distinct textures — fine near the jawline reflecting Southeast Asian traits, tightly coiled at the chin reflecting Central and East Asian heritage, creating visible genetic depth', N'Amber iris replacements are the dominant feature — distinctive enough that people remember his eyes before his face. The secondary gold ring is subtle until it pulses during active scans, which he does often enough that it''s part of his baseline demeanor. No visible chrome or external modifications; everything else is beneath the skin', N'Unhurried and precise. Moves like someone appraising objects — careful, economical, weighing everything. Stands with weight shifted slightly forward, ready to lean over a counter. Hands are rarely still; they''re always touching something, assessing texture and weight. Eye contact is steady and slightly unnerving', N'Layered mid-tier secondhand corporate wear in grays, blacks, and muted blues — Tessera office clothes from people who fell down the economic tiers. Nothing new, nothing expensive, nothing that draws attention. Worn but clean. A long coat most days, pockets always full of small tools, magnifiers, RFID readers. No visible branding or affiliation markers. Dresses like someone who is always one conversation away from needing to look respectable', N'He has a standing encrypted data package — a dead man''s switch — containing records of every transaction he''s ever made for a mid-level Axiom procurement officer. He doesn''t intend to use it but he''s never quite been able to delete it either.', N'Clipped, technical, precise. Uses trade and appraisal terminology naturally. Balkano-Finnish cadence gives him a slightly formal, slightly blunt quality.', N'Short sentences. Pauses before answering to appear like he''s considering more than he is.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'adedayo_m_ller_saidov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a689-72ce-af6e-1d9bcbabb49e', N'Ebele Balogun', N'Ebele', N'', N'Balogun', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 47, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'Gravesend Basin — operates from the back booth of a noodle stall called Mama Nkosi''s Overflow, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'loan shark and bookmaker operating out of Gravesend Basin', N'Independent operator; loose protection arrangement with the Gravesend Basin syndicate known as the Tidewrack', N'Ebele Balogun is a broad-shouldered man going soft around the middle, with dark Ewe-complexioned skin, a close-cropped silver beard, and the patient, unhurried eyes of someone who has learned that time is always on his side. His left hand is a prosthetic — matte-black carbon composite, articulated fingers that tap against tabletops in slow, deliberate rhythms when he''s calculating. He dresses in well-maintained but unglamorous clothes: thick-weave trousers, a collared shirt perpetually rolled to the elbows, a canvas jacket with too many interior pockets. He smells faintly of cardamom tea and printer toner.

Ebele Balogun does not threaten. He explains. There is a profound difference, he will tell you, between a man who says ''pay me or else'' and a man who lays out, with genuine sorrow, exactly what the mathematics of your situation require. He has a gift for making debt feel like a mutual inconvenience rather than a trap, right up until the moment it becomes inescapable. He is genuinely fond of his regulars and genuinely ruthless about his margins. He keeps meticulous paper ledgers — actual paper — because he doesn''t trust any network he doesn''t control.', N'Quest giver (someone owes him something inconvenient), information broker (he knows everyone''s financial desperation), moral weight (he''s not a monster but his business ruins lives)', N'', N'Carbon composite prosthetic left hand with embedded micro-scale calculator and pressure sensors; subdermal RFID tag reader in right palm for verifying identity chips', N'Opens his booth at Mama Nkosi''s by 0900, reviews overnight bet results and repayment logs over tea, spends afternoons making quiet rounds to collect or extend credit, and runs a small evening odds board for Basin locals betting on Ferrogate Transit delay times.', N'Ebele Balogun, a contemplative man in his late forties of mixed global heritage with deep warm brown skin with golden-amber undertones, seated at a table in a GLMZ noodle stall circa 2226. Close-cropped dark hair with silver threading, thin silver beard framing a broad structured face. His left arm visible displays a matte-black carbon composite prosthetic hand with chrome wrist connector, articulated fingers ready for precise movement, seated beside his natural right hand. Wears a cream collared shirt rolled to mid-forearm, heavy canvas jacket with visible interior pockets, charcoal trousers showing subtle wear. Right hand knuckles bear a thin white scar, left inner wrist shows faint chemical burn marks at the prosthetic interface. Neutral expression, patient calculating gaze, elbows on table in full attention posture. Brass compass chain barely visible at shirt collar. Setting: dim neon-filtered lighting of Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, condensation on windows behind him, the quiet tension of a man making important decisions. Mood: deliberate, calculated, economical movement. Neo-noir noir aesthetic, worn professional rather than chrome flash. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gravesend Basin', N'local', N'Gravesend Basin', N'Sub-Saharan African (51.4%) with significant Eastern European (20.8%), Middle Eastern (15.4%), and Indigenous American (12.4%) ancestry. His features reflect this complex blend: deep rich brown skin with warm golden-amber undertones from the Sub-Saharan majority, Middle Eastern warmth, and Indigenous American heritage. Broad facial structure with pronounced cheekbones characteristic of African and Indigenous American lineage, combined with the defined jaw and brow structure inherited from Eastern European ancestry. The overall effect is a strikingly balanced face that shows the depth of global ancestry without favoring any single lineage.', 185, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and muscular in youth, now softening through the middle with the settled weight of a man in his late forties who eats well and moves deliberately. Still imposing without effort.', N'Dark brown with silver threading throughout', N'Close-cropped, meticulously maintained with electric clippers every four days', N'Short', N'Deep brown, patient and calculating', N'Deep warm brown with rich golden-amber undertones, reflecting the 51.4% Sub-Saharan African ancestry as the dominant heritage foundation, with subtle warmth from Middle Eastern (15.4%) and Indigenous American (12.4%) components, and the underlying cool undertones from Eastern European (20.8%) ancestry creating complexity in the overall tone', N'Clear, well-groomed skin showing minimal scarring with a subtle warm glow and the suggestion of deeper undertones characteristic of mixed African-Eastern European heritage. A thin silver beard, closely trimmed, frames a wide jaw with broad, structured cheekbones that carry the width of African and Indigenous American ancestry balanced against the bone prominence of Eastern European lineage. No visible blemishes or weathering — he takes care of himself. Expression typically neutral, mouth relaxed into something between a smile and a waiting silence.', N'Left hand is a matte-black carbon composite prosthetic with articulated fingers and visible micro-joint seams. The wrist interface shows a thin chrome connector ring. Right palm shows no visible augmentation, though a subdermal RFID reader is installed beneath the skin — only detectable if you knew to look for the faint silvery tracery under magnification. He moves his left hand with deliberate precision, the tapping rhythm audible when settling bets.', N'Sits more than he stands. When seated, he occupies space completely — elbows on the table, both hands visible (left hand tapping or folded), leaning slightly forward in full attention. When moving through Mama Nkosi''s or making collection rounds, he walks slowly and with purpose, never hurrying, never looking rushed. His movements are economical — no wasted motion, everything calculated.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional, deliberately unglamorous. Thick-weave canvas trousers in charcoal or dark tan, often with a subtle stain near the hem from noodle-stall work. Collared shirts in muted colors (cream, pale blue, grey) rolled to mid-forearm to display both his natural hand and prosthetic in equal measure — a deliberate statement. Heavy canvas jackets with too many interior pockets, the kind a tradesman or accountant would wear. No logos, no chrome, no flash. Worn leather shoes with good soles, replaced annually. A small brass compass worn on a chain inside his shirt — not visible, but he touches it unconsciously when making decisions. Everything maintained, nothing fashionable.', N'He has quietly forgiven the debt of seven families over twenty years — burning the ledger pages privately — always for reasons he tells himself are strategic but are actually sentimental. He would be furious if anyone found out.', N'measured, formal, numerically precise — always quotes exact figures, never approximates', N'slow and unhurried, deliberate pauses before important clauses, no raised voice ever', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ebele_balogun');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d7-796e-a5c0-1e15fca8cc83', N'Cayetano Souvannasane', N'Cayetano', N'', N'Souvannasane', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Overhang — residential shelves built onto megastructure exteriors, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Information trader and intelligence analyst — broker', N'Independent — operates through reputation only', N'Cayetano Souvannasane is compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 29, the augmentation scarring around her temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see her surpass them. She works as a broker out of The Overhang, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In the runner community, Cayetano Souvannasane is known for getting the job done and not asking questions that would make the job harder to stomach.', N'Somadina Baranov-Fosu functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage. Move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon platform', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Cayetano Souvannasane, compact 158cm frame with densely muscled build, warm burnished medium-brown skin with golden-copper undertones reflecting Southeast Asian, Hispanic, and Eastern European heritage blend. Dark brown eyes with subtle iridescence. Black hair with rust undertones pulled tight in a braid. Institutional surgical scars visible at temples and jawline from chromatic dermal augmentation. Chromatic pigment cells shifting copper-slate-black across shoulders and neck. Callused hands, coiled posture with weight distributed low. Worn steel-toed boots, fitted charcoal synth-leather jacket with ablative weave reinforcement, technical base layers, cargo denim. Titanium wrist cuff data interface. Geometric Gye Nyame tattoo on right forearm in metallic ink. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neutral expression, economical movement, standing ready in industrial neon-lit setting, cool and warm lighting catching skin iridescence and augmentation patterns, photorealistic, intricate detail on scars and augmentation marks --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Overhang', N'local', N'The Overhang', N'Southeast Asian (54.1%) as primary ancestry, with significant Hispanic/Latin American (38.6%) and Eastern European (7.3%) blend. Southeast Asian bone structure provides moderate, width-set cheekbones and facial proportions. Hispanic/Latin American ancestry contributes warm golden and copper undertones to skin and facial warmth. Eastern European ancestry adds subtle angularity to the jawline and slight depth to eye-set. The combination creates warm, burnished mid-tone skin with golden-copper undertones that appears luminous in certain light—a unified, complex coloration from genuine genetic blending.', 158, 62, N'Compact and densely muscled, low center of gravity. Every movement economical. Shoulders broad relative to frame, legs thick and powerful — built for stability and explosive force rather than speed.', N'Black with rust-colored undertones', N'Pulled back tight, often in a single braid or coiled knot. Practical. Minimal surface area.', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, with faint iridescent sheen from subcutaneous neural interface bleed-through', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden-copper undertones—Southeast Asian base enriched by Hispanic/Latin American warmth and Eastern European depth, creating a burnished unified tone that catches light with subtle luminescence.', N'Face angular and weathered beyond her years. Southeast Asian width through the cheekbones balanced by subtle Eastern European jawline angularity. Skin bears institutional scarring from dermal augmentation installation—thin surgical lines visible at temples and along the mandible where chromatic cells were integrated. No attempt made to conceal them. Minor acne scarring on left cheekbone. Calluses on knuckles and palms from move-by-wire system stress.', N'Chromatic skin pigment cells across shoulders, neck, and upper chest—pigmentation shifts subtly between copper, slate, and matte black depending on angle and light. Faint geometric patterning visible under the skin along collarbone suggesting underlying nervous system architecture. Eyes have barely perceptible iridescence. When she moves, there''s an uncanny precision to gesture—move-by-wire integration creates micro-corrections invisible to untrained observers but unsettling to those who notice.', N'Economical and coiled. Stands with weight distributed low, knees never fully locked. Moves with deliberate precision—no wasted motion, no flourish. Head turns before eyes. Hands positioned where they can be useful. Default expression is neutral, almost flat, with minimal micro-expression leakage—move-by-wire teaches you to compartmentalize.', N'Tier 3-4 working class blended with runner aesthetics. Typically wears fitted synth-leather jackets in charcoal or navy, reinforced at shoulders and elbows with discreet ablative weave. Under-layers are technical: moisture-wicking, temperature-adaptive fabrics from mid-tier corporate spillover. Pants are cargo-cut synthetic denim, pockets deep and reinforced. Boots are steel-toed, worn, broken in, reliable. No jewelry beyond a simple titanium wrist cuff that doubles as a data interface. When maintaining her cover identity, she switches to plain synthetic cotton and neutral colors, but the wear patterns and fit always remain functional—she cannot help but dress for violence.', N'', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cayetano_souvannasane');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a9-7fc2-9070-1e176772826c', N'Makena Asomaning', N'Makena', N'', N'Asomaning', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 12, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'Escanaba Gateway, central atrium and cargo transit corridors, near Michigan Ave and Roosevelt', N'climate refugee child, errand runner, and informal courier for transit hub communities', N'Informal courier for Escanaba Gateway transit hub community; family connection to Kebebush Tshabalala-Nunavik (grandmother, in medical shelter)', N'Makena Asomaning is small for twelve, wire-thin, with the particular watchful quality of a child who has learned to read rooms before entering them. His skin is a deep reddish-brown, his hair cropped close and growing in with the slight redness of someone whose scalp has been sun-damaged. His eyes are very dark and very bright, and he has a habit of tracking all the exits in any space he enters without appearing to do so. He is missing the tip of his right ring finger, lost to frostbite three winters ago during a crossing he doesn''t talk about. He wears practical clothes two sizes too large and has fitted them with improvised adjustment ties, and he pushes an ancient cargo cart with a wheel he has repaired four times with different materials, which means it now sounds like three different instruments simultaneously when in motion.

Makena Asomaning arrived at Escanaba Gateway eighteen months ago with his grandmother and two cousins as part of a larger group of climate refugees from the northern agricultural collapse zones. His grandmother, Kebebush, is now in the Gateway''s informal medical shelter recovering from the crossing. His cousins, both older, have found seasonal work in Grainfort. Makena Asomaning runs errands. He runs them for Zulaikha Petrov-Oyelaran, for Gerváz Ouattara-Siljanovski, for Chidinma Rautavaara-Saberi, for anyone in the transit community who needs something carried or delivered and can''t leave their post to do it. He charges in food, transit tokens, and occasionally information. He is twelve years old and he is already developing a professional reputation.', N'Local color and humanizing element; informal information source with wide access due to his courier routes; quest giver for small but personally significant tasks; represents the child population of the transit refugee community and the stakes of the larger political situation.', N'', N'None. He has a salvaged solar-charge strap on his wrist that powers a battered display device.', N'Up at dawn to get first courier assignments from early-rising traders and transit workers; runs deliveries all day across the Gateway''s corridors and outer docks; returns each evening to sit with his grandmother in the medical shelter and eat whatever he earned.', N'Makena Asomaning, 142cm tall compact frame, warm medium-brown skin with golden bronze undertones from blended Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian and Hispanic heritage, sharp angular facial structure with defined cheekbones, very dark alert eyes, short dark brown hair with copper sun-bleached highlights, missing right ring finger tip, calloused hands, wearing oversized patched gray thermal layers and worn synthetic cargo jacket cinched with improvised ties, mismatched salvaged work boots, weathered solar-charge strap on left wrist powering cracked handheld display, economical alert posture, subtle sun damage on scalp, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, street-level lighting casting warm shadows on bronze-toned skin, gritty urban environment, Tier 4-5 poverty-adapted aesthetic, documentary realism, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'local', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'Complex global diaspora heritage: Southeast Asian (42.3%) dominant with Sub-Saharan African (22.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (14.5%), Central Asian (11.7%), and South Asian (9.3%) ancestry. Features reflect this blend—warm medium-brown skin with golden and bronze undertones from Southeast and South Asian ancestry, strong Sub-Saharan African contribution visible in cheekbone structure and skin depth, with warmer cast from Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Facial structure shows the angular definition common to Southeast and South Asian populations, combined with the broader feature palette of his African heritage.', 142, 32, N'Wire-thin and small for his age, with the compact frame of a child adapted to scarcity; no excess mass, all efficient movement', N'Dark brown with sun-bleached copper undertones', N'Cropped close to the scalp in a practical cut', N'Short', N'Very dark brown, nearly black, with unusual brightness and alertness', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and bronze undertones; complexion shows sun-weathered depth from intense tropical and subtropical climate exposure across multiple continents; blended undertones reflect Southeast Asian golden warmth, Sub-Saharan African richness, and Hispanic/Latin American depth', N'Angular facial structure with defined cheekbones and strong planes reflecting Southeast and South Asian ancestry; bronze and warm undertones across cheeks, bridge of nose, and orbital areas; scalp shows patchy sun damage from extended outdoor exposure; no facial hair; lean and defined facial musculature despite age; skin displays the warm bronze-to-amber quality from blended Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian heritage', N'A salvaged solar-charge strap worn on his left wrist, weathered and patched, powering a battered handheld display device with a cracked screen; no chrome, no surgical augmentations', N'Economical and deliberate; he moves quietly and without wasted energy; habitual head-tracking behavior — his eyes constantly register exits, obstacles, and personnel positions without appearing to focus on them; posture is alert but not tense, balanced for quick directional changes', N'Practical Tier 4-5 hand-me-downs fitted with improvised adjustment ties; garments two sizes too large that have been cinched, knotted, or stitched to fit; worn synthetic cargo jacket with multiple pockets, faded gray thermal layers, patched utility pants; footwear is mismatched but functional — salvaged work boots held together with adhesive tape and paracord; everything is clean but weathered', N'During the northern crossing, the group was stopped at a checkpoint and one of the adults bribed the officer with a data chip. Rafailo doesn''t know what was on the chip, but he memorized the officer''s face and badge number out of pure instinct. The officer is now stationed at Escanaba Gateway''s inner checkpoint and Rafailo routes all his courier runs to avoid that section of the building.', N'Sparse and functional, code-switches between three languages mid-sentence in ways that suggest he learned all of them simultaneously and doesn''t entirely separate them', N'Rapid and low, like someone who has learned that being quiet is a survival strategy', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'makena_asomaning');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ad-790a-9211-1ea0e4869e54', N'Brita Douangpanya', N'Brita', N'', N'Douangpanya', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre, living communally in a building called the Stack, near Ashland and Division', N'Protest coordinator and direct action organizer', N'Libre Front (founding coordinator); Mexicantown Libre residents'' network; loose solidarity connections with Ghostprint and other independent media', N'Brita Douangpanya is young and loud about it — she has the particular energy of someone who has concluded that patience is a trap laid by people who benefit from delay. She is dark-skinned and angular, with natural hair grown into a dense crown she clips with political buttons and small brass charms. Her geneware is exuberant: color-shifting hair underlayer that blooms from black to vivid copper to green depending on ambient temperature and her mood; she had it done as soon as she could afford it and considers it a form of emotional honesty, not vanity. Her arms are covered in handpoked ink — dates, phrases, names of people and places that matter to her, in at least four scripts.

Brita Douangpanya coordinates street mobilizations for a loose coalition she calls the Libre Front — not an organization exactly, more a persistent methodology: show up, be visible, make the cost of ignoring you higher than the cost of addressing you. She has been arrested twice, released both times due to procedural errors she suspects were deliberate tests of whether she''d sign anything. She signed nothing. She is not naive — she knows spectacle alone changes little — but she also knows that the invisible don''t get concessions, and she is determinedly, loudly, exasperatingly visible.', N'Energy source and potential wild card; she can draw crowds or attention with short notice; represents a generational and tactical contrast to more institutional activists; her directness and visibility make her both useful and dangerous to associate with; can be a quest giver for actions that require numbers or public pressure.', N'', N'Color-shifting hair geneware (black to copper to green, temperature and mood responsive); no chrome, no implants — she is deeply suspicious of implanted tech as a surveillance vector and has done extensive research to support this suspicion', N'Irregular schedule centered on the current campaign; mornings doing outreach and flyering in Mexicantown Libre and adjacent zones; afternoons in planning meetings at the Stack or in the streets; evenings are when the actions happen — marches, occupations, noise demonstrations outside corponation facilities.', N'GLMZ activist portrait: Brita Douangpanya, 168cm lean angular figure with deep warm brown skin with golden and olive undertones. High prominent cheekbones and sharp jawline blending Southeast Asian, East Asian, African, Latin American and Middle Eastern heritage. Dense natural black crown with color-shifting copper-to-green geneware underlayer responsive to emotion, long hair pulled back with political pins and brass charms. Dark brown alert eyes scanning crowd, forward-leaning restless posture radiating coiled energy. Forearms densely covered in hand-poked tattoos across multiple scripts, visible scar on left temple, three parallel marks on right collarbone. Wearing deliberately worn black oversized hoodie and button-up layered over patched cargo pants, scuffed combat boots. Old canvas messenger bag covered in protest stickers and hand-drawn graphics. Political patches and protest tape visible on clothing. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone street setting, neon-tinged industrial backdrop, moody street action lighting, activist aesthetic, anti-corporate styling, constant motion and restless fidgeting, GLMZ 2200s gritty realism --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Multiethnic diaspora blend: Southeast Asian (26.2%), East Asian (25.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (24.1%), Sub-Saharan African (14.9%), Middle Eastern (6.2%), South Asian (2.9%). The combination produces warm-toned deep brown skin with golden undertones and subtle olive accents, angular facial structure reflecting the interplay of Southeast and East Asian ancestry with African heritage, and a distinctive phenotype that marks her as a product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora—no single origin point, genuinely transnational in her genetic composition.', 168, 58, N'Angular and lean, all sharp geometry — narrow shoulders, pronounced collarbones, wiry muscle from constant motion rather than deliberate training. No softness; her body reads as kinetic.', N'Natural black base with embedded color-shifting geneware underlayer (copper to green responsive to temperature and emotional state)', N'Dense natural crown worn loose, densely packed with political buttons, brass charms, and small pins', N'Long (shoulder-blade length when unpinned, worn up most of the time)', N'Dark brown, alert and direct', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones and subtle olive accents—the blended result of substantial Southeast/East Asian and African ancestry with Latin American and Middle Eastern influence creating a rich, nuanced complexion without harsh demarcation lines', N'Angular facial structure with high, prominent cheekbones and sharp jawline reflecting the geometric influence of East and Southeast Asian heritage blended with African features. The bone structure is refined and angular. Skin is clear but marked by the wear of irregular sleep and constant sun exposure during street actions. No makeup; minimal grooming beyond pragmatism.', N'Color-shifting geneware hair layer only — no chrome, no visible implants. The geneware is the only technological modification; it shifts from black-base to copper to green depending on ambient temperature and her emotional state, creating a subtle but constant visual indicator of her mood and presence.', N'Constantly in motion, restless — fidgets with clothing, pins, phone. When standing still, she leans forward slightly as if mid-argument. Eyes scan crowds and exits; body language radiates coiled energy. She moves through space with the territorial awareness of someone used to street actions and crowd dynamics. Hand gestures are expressive and frequent.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian activist wear. Typically black or dark earth-tone cotton, deliberately worn and patched — oversized hoodies and button-ups layered, cargo pants or jeans with visible wear and pockets, scuffed combat boots (practical, not aesthetic). Visible political patches, badges, and protest tape on clothing. Carries an old canvas messenger bag covered in stickers and hand-drawn graphics. No corporate logos, no premium materials; everything chosen for durability and functionality. Appearance is deliberately anti-aesthetic, rejecting Tier 1-2 grooming signals.', N'After her second arrest, an Axiom security liaison approached her privately and suggested — very carefully, very deniably — that her charges would be quietly dropped if she began sharing advance notice of planned actions. She refused immediately and furiously, but she has told no one because she''s afraid of how it would look — as if she were suspected of having accepted. She also hasn''t processed how frightening the approach was.', N'Fast, passionate, code-switches between Mexicantown Libre street dialect, standard Meridian, and fragments of her grandmother''s Mooré; drops theoretical language in public, uses it fluently in movement spaces', N'Rhythmic and percussive; natural speaker who lands emphasis like a drummer; can switch to soft and direct when someone is genuinely distressed', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'brita_douangpanya');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a634-7906-bb40-1f42571d783c', N'Enrique Wickramasinghe-Keomanivong-Pathak', N'Enrique', N'', N'Wickramasinghe-Keomanivong-Pathak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, Calumet Rise, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Clothing and fashion vendor, scrap textile reseller, The Alban Souk', N'Independent; Alban Souk informal vendors network; aspirational connection to the Burnished Market fashion collective (she is working toward it)', N'Enrique Wickramasinghe-Keomanivong-Pathak is short and quick-moving, with warm medium-brown skin, close-cropped natural hair, and enormous deep-set eyes she has had fitted with color-shifting irises that cycle through a slow gradient of forest greens and clay reds depending on her mood — a mod she saved for over eighteen months and considers the best investment she has ever made. Her clothes are a rotating showcase of her own work: deconstructed corporate uniforms, patched Tessera contractor jumpsuits, pieces reconstructed from scavenged fabric bolts and repurposed industrial mesh. Every seam is visible and intentional. She is always wearing something that looks impossible to have found and easy to want.

Her stall in the Alban Souk is less a table and more a curated installation: garments hung on rebar frames, fabric samples pinned to a board, a small battered sewing station behind the counter where she alters pieces on the spot. She designs, scavenges, reconstructs, and sells. Her prices are low for what the work is and she knows it — she hasn''t figured out how to charge what she''s worth yet without feeling like she''s lying. She has strong opinions about everything aesthetic and zero patience for people who treat fashion as shallow. To her, clothing in GLMZ is the most honest statement a person can make about who they intend to be.', N'Fashion and atmosphere — can provide clothing, disguise materials, or altered appearance with very fast turnaround. Social connector who knows the aesthetic communities of multiple market zones. Young and ambitious, potential long-term ally who grows with a campaign.', N'', N'Color-shifting iris implants (mood-reactive gradient cycle, green-clay palette). Subdermal UV-reactive pigment in upper arms visible as faint geometric patterns under certain light — decorative.', N'Spends mornings in reclamation zones and secondhand lots sourcing fabric and garments, sets up the stall by early afternoon, sews and alters while selling, closes at dark and sketches new designs late into the night.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Enrique, a 158cm wiry mixed-heritage fabric artist with warm medium-brown skin carrying golden, olive, and reddish undertones. High prominent cheekbones, angular face, deep-set eyes with slow-cycling color-shifting iris implants (forest green to clay red), short close-cropped dark brown hair. Visible burn scars on inner left wrist, thin temple scar, faint UV-reactive geometric patterns on upper arms. Wearing self-constructed Tier 4 clothing: deconstructed corporate uniform pieces with visible seams and recolored panels, narrow-fit re-hemmed pants, fitted mesh-weave top, oversized reconstructed work jacket layered with texture and color-blocking. Simple handmade steel conduit cuff on left wrist. Quick, focused posture with hands gesturing expressively. Indoor market stall setting with reclaimed fabric bolts, bright daylight casting warm tones across skin, intense concentrated expression. Neo-noir urban aesthetic, working-class DIY aesthetic, no corpo branding. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'Pan-diaspora ancestry: South Asian (34.2%), Southeast Asian (24.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (20.4%), Sub-Saharan African (10.7%), Indigenous American (10.1%). Features a striking complex blend—warm medium-brown skin with golden, olive, and reddish undertones from the South/Southeast Asian, Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage layers. The combination creates high, prominent cheekbones with an angular face structure, deep-set eyes characteristic of South/Southeast Asian ancestry mixed with the warmer, fuller facial structure from Latin American and Indigenous American heritage. Overall complexion carries warmth and depth from the African and Indigenous components enriching the base South/Southeast Asian tone.', 158, 52, N'Wiry and compact, built for quick movement and precision hand work. Lean muscle in forearms and shoulders from constant sewing and fabric manipulation. No excess weight.', N'Natural dark brown', N'Close-cropped, shaped close to the scalp with subtle texture work', N'Short', N'Color-shifting iris implants cycling forest green to clay red', N'Warm medium-brown with golden, olive, and reddish undertones, sun-exposed in patches from outdoor reclamation work', N'Angular face structure reflecting the blended South/Southeast Asian, Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and Indigenous American ancestry; warm, richly-toned complexion from the layered heritage. High, prominent cheekbones, deep-set eyes, moderate jawline with gentle width. Hands show calluses and needle pricks. Small burn scars on inner left wrist from soldering iron mishap during early sewing experiments. Skin generally clear, with the worn vitality of someone who spends half their time outdoors and half bent over detailed work.', N'Color-shifting iris implants are the dominant visible augmentation — eyes cycle slowly between forest green and clay red hues depending on mood state. The shift is subtle but unmistakable. Subdermal UV-reactive arm patterns are invisible under normal light but become faintly visible in certain angles or bright sunlight as faint geometric designs.', N'Quick, efficient movements — no wasted motion. When standing still at her stall, she has a habit of holding fabric between thumb and forefinger, rotating it to feel the weave. When working, she leans forward with intense focus. When engaging customers, she makes direct eye contact and uses her hands expressively when discussing design philosophy.', N'Tier 4 working-class, self-designed and self-constructed. Rotating daily showcase of her own work: deconstructed corporate uniform pieces (visible seams, recolored panels), patched Tessera contractor jumpsuits with reinforced cargo pockets, reconstructed garments from scavenged industrial mesh and fabric bolts. Intentional visible mending, layered textures, color-blocked panels. Everything looks impeccable despite being made from scrap. Typically wears narrow-fit pants (often re-hemmed from original length), fitted tank or mesh-weave top, an oversized reconstructed jacket or work vest. Minimal jewelry except for a simple steel cuff on left wrist (handmade from reclaimed conduit). No corpo branding visible.', N'She found a bolt of fabric in a reclamation lot six months ago that has a Zheng-Dao security watermark woven into the threading — something she only noticed after she''d already made and sold four pieces from it. She has no idea what the fabric was for or whether anyone is looking for it, and she''s been quietly terrified ever since.', N'Fast and enthusiastic on design and fashion, becomes more careful and hedged when talking about herself or her ambitions. Romanian-Wolof sentence patterns give her a particular musicality.', N'Quick, light, tends to finish sentences with a slight uplift like she''s checking whether you''re keeping up.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'enrique_wickramasinghe_keomanivong_pathak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a661-76bf-9290-1f7a0b4be830', N'Daulet Karunaratne', N'Daulet', N'', N'Karunaratne', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown — industrial district of chop shops and fabricators, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Long-range precision fire specialist — sniper', N'Independent — works solo contracts', N'Daulet Karunaratne are tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 31, there''s something unfinished about their face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on deman — and they make no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left them with skills and night terrors in equal measure. They work as a sniper out of Geartown, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Daulet Karunaratne have built a reputation on reliability rather than flash — they show up, they deliver, they collect.', N'As a sniper, Ngaire Arai-Ofori-Atta embodies the tension between independence and isolation. They are a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on demand. Retractable monofilament whip in left forearm — concealed weapon, devastating in close quarters', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Daulet Karunaratne, 188cm tall lean angular neo-noir operative with rich warm bronze skin reflecting complex East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Northern European heritage. High prominent cheekbones, dark alert eyes, black hair pulled back in tight braid. Clean-shaven with faint surgical scar from temple to jawline. Wearing dark tactical cargo pants, fitted compression undershirt, matte charcoal modular body armor jacket. Chrome synthesizer interface visible on left forearm with amber LED pulses, geometric tattoo marks on left inner forearm. Posture economical and controlled, standing ready in shadows of neon-lit GLMZ industrial district, cool blue and amber lighting, slight exhaust haze, 2226 neo-noir urban aesthetic, cinematic noir mood, hyper-realistic skin texture showing genetic complexity, predatory alertness in eyes, nocturnal warrior demeanor --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Complex pan-global diaspora phenotype reflecting balanced East Asian (37.5%), Sub-Saharan African (24.8%), and Northern European (14.3%) ancestry, with meaningful contributions from South Asian (12.6%), Southeast Asian (6.6%), and Hispanic/Latin American (4.2%) lineages. This genetic layering creates a distinctly cosmopolitan appearance: East Asian and Southeast Asian ancestry shape prominent, high-set cheekbones and subtle epicanthic eye geometry; Sub-Saharan African heritage contributes warm, deep brown undertones and fuller lip contours; Northern European ancestry adds angular facial planes and jaw definition; South Asian genetics contribute warmth to overall complexion. The result is a striking multi-heritage phenotype that transcends singular regional categorization — skin tone, facial structure, and coloring reflect genuine global ancestry mixing rather than any single continental origin.', 188, 74, N'Lean and angular with ropy muscle definition — the build of someone who trains for precision and endurance rather than mass. Low body fat, visible shoulder and forearm musculature from repetitive rifle work and weapon maintenance.', N'Black with faint warm undertones', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid or wrapped low at the base of the skull', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, alert and unwavering', N'Rich warm bronze with complex golden and mahogany undertones — the result of East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian genetic layering. Deep enough to show the full warmth of African heritage contribution, yet with the subtle golden quality from East and South Asian ancestry. Slight ashen quality consistent with nocturnal lifestyle has muted natural vibrancy, but underlying warmth remains visible on cheekbones and neck.', N'Prominent high cheekbones with East Asian and Southeast Asian contour, squared jaw with Northern European angularity, and hollow temples suggesting mixed-ancestry facial structure. Fuller lips reflecting Sub-Saharan African heritage. Skin is clear but marked by the exhaustion of circadian inversion — faint dark crescents under eyes. Clean-shaven or minimal facial hair. Expression typically neutral, eyes tracking environments with predatory awareness. The interplay of warm deep brown tone despite fatigue suggests genetic resilience to circadian disruption.', N'Chrome visible at the left inner forearm where the drug synthesizer system interfaces with the skin — metallic sheen visible under the epidermis with faint LED indicator lights (amber/red) that pulse with synthesizer activity. Left hand shows microscopic tool marks and reinforced joint articulation from monofilament whip housing. No visible cybernetic eyes or limbs.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical efficiency — no wasted motion. Shoulders slightly forward, spine straight. When stationary, weight shifts subtly between feet as if constantly ready to move. Head movement is controlled, eyes scanning in practiced patterns. Hands remain visible and relaxed unless in high-stress situations. Walking gait is smooth and measured, heel-to-toe placement that minimizes sound.', N'Tier 4 practical utilitarian — form-fitted tactical cargo pants in dark gray or black, reinforced at knees and ankles. Fitted long-sleeve compression shirt or tactical undershirt to conceal and protect augmentation sites. Heavy insulated jacket or modular body armor overlay in matte charcoal. Worn synthetic boots with good ankle support and grip soles. Minimal jewelry except for a functional watch (analog, not networked) and a single silver ring on right hand. Everything is clean but not new — maintained rather than flashy. No corporate logos, no obvious gang colors.', N'Ngaire Arai-Ofori-Atta can''t read. Hides it behind voice interfaces and memorization. The shame is older than the chrome.', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'daulet_karunaratne');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b8-7246-89b5-1fe4b192f9aa', N'Daksh Bautista-Vestergaard', N'Daksh', N'', N'Bautista-Vestergaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 64, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Geartown — industrial district of chop shops and fabricators, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Freelance combat specialist — street samurai', N'Semi-independent — recurring contracts with mid-tier fixers', N'Daksh Bautista-Vestergaard is wiry and quick-moving, with the restless energy of someone who converts anxiety into velocity. At 64, scars map his face like a transit diagram of bad decisions and worse luck. The chrome is visible — chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He taught himself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know him best. He works as a street samurai out of Geartown, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Daksh Bautista-Vestergaard has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and he cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'As a street samurai, Aslan Vasquez-Chatterjee embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone. Bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Daksh Bautista-Vestergaard, 64-year-old street operative, GLMZ, medium-rich brown skin with golden-olive undertones, broad Sub-Saharan African nasal bridge, prominent high cheekbones with East Asian structure, subtle epicanthic fold dark brown eyes, salt-and-pepper gray slicked-back short hair with two-day stubble. Deep facial lines and weathering, diagonal white scar across left cheekbone, crescent scar on left temple, chrome nasal duct analyzer glinting at nostrils. Wiry lean 177cm frame, corded forearms, minimal body fat. Wearing dark weathered tactical canvas jacket with zipper pockets, reinforced cargo pants, worn tactical boots, long dark leather coat, silver ring on left hand. Coiled restless posture, slight forward lean, eyes tracking movement. Industrial Great Lakes zone lighting, neon and sodium vapor ambiance, sitting at an angle in shadows, tense focused expression. Neo-noir near-future grit and wear throughout. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Northern European (31.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (28.7%), Sub-Saharan African (21.3%), East Asian (11.2%), Southeast Asian (6.9%), and South Asian (0.8%) — a truly global phenotype. His face reflects authentic admixture: broad nasal bridge and pronounced cheekbone width from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, subtle epicanthic eye shape and defined cheekbone structure from East Asian heritage, Mediterranean warmth and olive undertones from Hispanic and Northern European lines, with traces of Southeast Asian refinement in facial proportions. The result is a visage that resists reduction to any single ancestry — instead presenting as a lived example of humanity''s genetic interconnection.', 177, 68, N'Wiry and lean with corded forearm musculature — the build of someone who converts nervous energy into functional strength. Minimal body fat. Decades of street work have kept him spare rather than bulky.', N'Salt-and-pepper gray with black undertones', N'Kept short and practical, slicked back with a slight curl at the nape', N'Short', N'Dark brown with subtle epicanthic fold, naturally warm but hardened by age and repeated trauma', N'Medium-rich brown complexion with golden-olive undertones — a genuine blend of Northern European warmth, Hispanic Mediterranean heritage, and Sub-Saharan African depth. The tone carries visible golden undertones from his mixed heritage without favoring any single lineage. Weathered by decades of industrial zone exposure, creating a lived-in patina that speaks to his age and experience.', N'Deeply lined face — forehead, around eyes, mouth corners — a roadmap of sixty-four years of squinting, grimacing, and stress. Stubble perpetually present (usually salt-and-pepper, two days'' growth). High, prominent cheekbones with width and structure reflecting Sub-Saharan African and East Asian ancestry. Nose shows broader bridge characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage with slight width across the bridge. Skin has the weathered texture of someone who doesn''t prioritize skincare; minor acne scarring visible on cheekbones from earlier decades. Overall facial structure displays strong bone prominence balanced by heritage-derived variation in feature dimensions.', N'Chrome-plated nasal duct analyzer — visible as a faint glint of polished metal at both nostrils when light hits correctly, most obvious in profile. The metal has a brushed-nickel finish and shows minor patina/scratching from field use. No visible signs of the bioware adrenaline regulator, which is subcutaneous.', N'Restless and economical — no wasted motion, but constant small adjustments (weight shifting, hand repositioning). Sits at angles, never fully relaxing into a chair. Eyes track movement reflexively. When standing still, he appears coiled rather than relaxed. Walks with a slight forward lean, as though perpetually ready to sprint.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian streetwear. Favors dark colors (blacks, grays, muted olives). Typically wears reinforced canvas tactical jackets with visible zipper pockets and stitched seams, showing wear and repair. Undershirts are plain synthetic blend or moisture-wicking synthetics. Cargo pants or modified jeans with strategic pockets and reinforced knees. Boots are worn tactical-grade — no logos, scuffed, replaced every 2-3 years. A long coat (leather or synthetic leather, weathered dark brown) over his working gear. Minimal jewelry — one silver ring on left hand, likely sentimental or lucky. No visible corpo branding. Everything is functional; nothing is fashionable.', N'Aslan Vasquez-Chatterjee murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'daksh_bautista_vestergaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e3-7d05-8f7d-204f8ce8e192', N'Girish Lindström-Čabarkapa', N'Girish', N'', N'Lindström-Čabarkapa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenosha Crossing transit junction and the Escanaba Gateway — living out of a modified Ferrogate Transit maintenance vehicle, near past the Kedzie Barrier', N'Smuggler (specialty: people and restricted biologics through Ferrogate Transit checkpoints)', N'Independent; pays access fees to a loose smuggler consortium called the Escanaba Drift; has cultivated specific relationships with six Ferrogate Transit maintenance workers; The Third Rail', N'Girish Lindström-Čabarkapa is medium height and deliberately nondescript — they have spent ten years cultivating the specific quality of being someone you don''t remember. Warm-toned brown skin, face kept cleanly unremarkable, hair color-shifted to a different neutral shade every few weeks using a cheap color-change geneware mod that makes them neither memorable as light nor as dark. Their eyes are sharp and mobile in a face that is otherwise arranged into a state of mild, forgettable pleasantness. The one thing they cannot entirely hide is the quality of their hands — long-fingered and precise, the hands of someone who handles delicate cargo.

Girish Lindström-Čabarkapa thinks in maps. They have memorized every maintenance corridor, inspection schedule shift, and checkpoint rotation in the Kenosha Crossing and Escanaba junction systems, updated continuously through a network of Ferrogate Transit workers they pay in small consistent increments that never trigger audit flags. They are not ideological about what they move — they will move people fleeing domestic violence and they will move black-market immunosuppressants for organ recipients who can''t afford the Helix Biosystems licensing fee, and they apply the same precise operational thinking to both. They have a private hierarchy of jobs they prefer and jobs they will decline, and they will not explain the hierarchy to clients.', N'Transportation access — can move people or objects through otherwise impenetrable checkpoints; information source on Ferrogate Transit infrastructure; potential quest giver when a smuggling job goes sideways', N'', N'Color-change hair geneware (cheap, runs warm-neutral spectrum only); eidetic spatial memory enhancement (cognitive, installed 2194 — their most significant investment in themselves)', N'They run two to four transits per week depending on cargo. Between runs they spend most of their time in the modified maintenance vehicle — cataloguing route updates, maintaining their informant relationships, and playing an elaborate single-player strategy game on a battered tablet they refuse to replace.', N'Girish Lindström-Čabarkapa, mixed-heritage figure with warm medium-brown skin, high cheekbones, and alert dark eyes. Short warm beige-brown hair, clean-shaven. Lean 168cm frame with economical posture, shoulders slightly forward. Wearing unmarked gray cargo pants, fitted black compression shirt, worn charcoal maintenance jacket with reflective stripping, quiet work boots. Hands showing occupational calluses, faint wrist scars barely visible. Standing in industrial transit zone or maintenance crawlway, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Mood: mild disengagement, deliberately forgettable presence. Cool industrial lighting, neon-tinted shadows, worn metal infrastructure visible. Sharp focus on hands and face. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenosha Crossing transit junction and the Escanaba Gateway', N'local', N'Kenosha Crossing transit junction and the Escanaba Gateway', N'Northern European (42.8%), Eastern European (24.4%), Sub-Saharan African (18.9%), and Hispanic/Latin American (13.9%)—a true Ubiquitous Diaspora blend. The genetic mix creates warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden and olive undertones, featuring the angular bone structure and high cheekbones typical of Northern and Eastern European ancestry combined with the broader facial proportions and warmer complexion of Sub-Saharan African heritage, enriched by the warm undertones and softer facial geometry of Hispanic/Latin American ancestry.', 168, 62, N'Lean and economical, with the wiry muscularity of someone who moves constantly through tight spaces. No wasted mass. Shoulders slightly forward from years of hunched work in maintenance crawlways.', N'Currently a warm beige-brown; shifts every 3-4 weeks through the geneware''s limited palette (mushroom, sand, taupe, wheat)', N'Kept short and unfussy, parted vaguely to one side. No styling gel or product — functional only', N'Short', N'Dark brown, unremarkable; mobile and alert beneath a resting expression of mild blandness', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones—the blended complexion of mixed Northern European, Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry', N'Clean-shaven face kept deliberately smooth and forgettable. High cheekbones reflecting Northern and Eastern European ancestry softened by the fuller facial proportions and warmer undertones of Sub-Saharan and Hispanic ancestry. Skin condition is unremarkable — neither rough nor refined. A face engineered by habit to slip from memory the moment you stop looking at it.', N'None. The color-change hair geneware is subcutaneous and only visible as the gradual shift in hair tone every few weeks. The eidetic spatial memory enhancement is entirely internal. To a stranger, Girish appears entirely baseline human.', N'Economical and precise. They move through spaces as if already knowing the exact dimensions — no wasted motion, no uncertainty in hand placement. When still, they settle into a posture of mild disengagement, shoulders slightly rounded inward. When handling cargo, their hands become almost hypnotic in their precision and care.', N'Tier 4 working-class practical: unmarked gray or tan cargo pants with reinforced pockets; fitted compression shirts in black or muted colors that don''t stain visibly; a worn charcoal maintenance jacket with reflective stripping (helps them move through transit zones without triggering questions). No logos or affiliation markers. Shoes are functional and quiet — soft-soled work boots, well-maintained but not new. A cheap digital chronometer on their left wrist. Everything is chosen to blend into the background of industrial Kenosha Crossing.', N'Three years ago they moved a cargo of what they were told were medical biologics. Afterward they discovered partial evidence that it was actually harvested tissue from non-consenting donors. They completed the job because they were mid-transit. They have not worked with that broker since, but they kept the fee.', N'Precise and minimalist; uses logistical language even for personal topics; rarely volunteers information', N'Flat affect, evenly paced; can sustain a long silence without discomfort', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'girish_lindstr_m_abarkapa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5da-7a0b-848a-2056c86e9d75', N'Encarnacion Holm', N'Encarnacion', N'', N'Holm', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Escanaba Gateway, temporary processing overflow — a repurposed cargo hangar on the eastern dock, near Michigan Ave and Roosevelt', N'climate refugee, expelled citizen, caravan support worker', N'Seventh Coastal Movement caravan collective; informal advocacy with no organizational backing', N'Encarnacion Holm has the kind of face that is beautiful in a way that takes a moment to resolve — wide-set dark eyes, a long jaw, a nose that has been broken and healed slightly crooked, which they consider an improvement. Their hair is grown long on top and cut close at the sides, currently dyed a deep amber that is growing out at the roots into black. Bioluminescent freckles run across both cheekbones and the bridge of their nose, a genemod that was fashionable a decade ago and that they have kept because they find it useful in the dark. They dress in layers of practical clothing with a great number of pockets, all of which serve a purpose.

Encarnacion Holm came to GLMZ with the Seventh Coastal Movement — a caravan of climate refugees from the drowned lowlands east of what used to be Lagos, where their Igbo family had mixed with Samoan shipwright families over three generations of coastal labor. They have been in the Gateway processing overflow for seven months, which is four months longer than they were told. They work as an informal translator and advocate for other caravan members, navigating the GLMZ resettlement bureaucracy with a simmering precision that occasionally flares into something that frightens officials. They are not angry in a way that is hot. They are angry in a way that is patient.', N'Quest giver (bureaucratic navigation problems, missing persons within the refugee system), information source on GLMZ''s resettlement processes and their failures, emotional anchor for the caravan community, potential ally with a network of people who owe them favors', N'', N'Bioluminescent freckles (cosmetic geneware, cheekbones and nose bridge, amber-warm light). No other augmentations.', N'Chiamaka rises before the hangar wakes up, spends two hours updating a meticulous handwritten log of each caravan member''s bureaucratic status, spends the rest of the day navigating the Gateway''s processing windows and taking meetings with anyone who might have authority over resettlement timelines, and spends their evenings walking the perimeter of the overflow facility because stillness has become impossible.', N'Encarnacion Holm, GLMZ, lean 178cm tall angular man with rich warm deep brown skin with golden-amber and honey-bronze undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African, Southeast Asian, Eastern European and Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Dark brown eyes with directness and exhaustion, prominent cheekbones, defined angular jawline, straight nose with visible old break. Deep amber hair with black roots in undercut style, long swept back on top. Subtle bioluminescent amber-gold freckles glowing faintly across cheekbones and bridge of nose. Small pale scar on left temple. Minimal grooming, early tension lines around eyes and mouth. Wearing layered utilitarian tier 4 clothing—dark fitted base layer, pocketed mid-layer, reinforced outer layer in muted grays and blacks. Worn boots, canvas satchel with documents. Simple metal bracelet on left wrist. Economical posture with slight forward weight, visible shoulder tension. Standing in fluorescent-lit hangar or industrial workspace, hands occupied with documentation. Neo-noir atmosphere, cool industrial lighting with warm glow of bioluminescent freckles, photorealistic, atmospheric depth --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'local', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'Sub-Saharan African (37.2%), Southeast Asian (27.0%), Eastern European (18.7%), and Hispanic/Latin American (17.1%) ancestry create a striking global blend. Strong Sub-Saharan African foundation provides warm deep undertones and robust bone structure. Southeast Asian heritage contributes to eye shape, facial harmony, and subtle epicanthic folds. Eastern European ancestry adds angular facial architecture and slight cheekbone prominence. Hispanic/Latin American ancestry enriches skin tone complexity with warm olive undertones. A truly Ubiquitous Diaspora genetics.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, with the kind of economy of movement that comes from doing physical labor in confined spaces. Long-limbed, minimal body fat, shoulders slightly forward from years of hunching over paperwork and port work.', N'Deep amber with black roots showing 2-3cm of regrowth', N'Undercut: long on top (10-12cm, swept back or tied loosely), faded close at the sides and nape', N'Long/Medium', N'Dark brown, almost black, with a directness that holds attention longer than expected', N'Rich warm deep brown with golden-amber undertones from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, layered with warm honey-bronze from Southeast Asian heritage, subtle warm olive from Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, and cool earthiness from Eastern European mix. Sun-exposed areas deepen to darker mahogany. Overall depth and complexity reflecting multi-continental genetics.', N'Harmonious blend of strong features across ancestry lines: prominent angular cheekbones and defined jawline, straight nose with visible crook from past break, wide-set eyes with subtle Southeast Asian eye shape that read as observant and exhausted simultaneously. High, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European heritage. Face shows the warmth and depth of Sub-Saharan African features combined with the facial harmony of Southeast Asian genetics. Minimal grooming beyond necessity—clean, functional, no cosmetics. Early lines around the eyes and mouth from sustained tension. Deep, even skin richness that reflects the complexity of global ancestry.', N'Bioluminescent freckles only—functional and cosmetic geneware, no chrome or subcutaneous hardware visible. The glow is subtle in daylight, noticeable in the hangar''s fluorescent wash.', N'Economical and purposeful. Stands with weight slightly forward, ready to move. Walks with the kind of precision that suggests constant awareness of surroundings and others'' personal space. Hands often occupied—writing, organizing, gesturing through explanations. When still, there is visible tension in the shoulders and jaw.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian. Multiple layers: fitted base layer (often dark or neutral), mid-layer with pockets (canvas, worn synthetic blends), outer layer of reinforced fabric or light weatherproof material. Colors are muted—grays, blacks, faded greens, occasional warm tones. Clothing is patched where necessary, maintained with care. Worn boots with good tread. A canvas satchel containing handwritten logs, documents, and translation references. No corporate branding. Jewelry minimal—a simple metal bracelet on left wrist, possibly of personal or cultural significance.', N'', N'Precise and formal in bureaucratic contexts, slipping into a warmer creole register with caravan members. Igbo exclamations under stress. Their Samoan grandmother''s habit of using fish species as metaphors for human behavior.', N'Measured and even, with a quality of absolute attention — they speak as if recording testimony', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'encarnacion_holm');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b0-77a3-aad2-2080c0127801', N'Efua Asomaning-Szabó', N'Efua', N'', N'Asomaning-Szabó', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, stall row 7, north face, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Bootleg fashion vendor and fake ID operator', N'Independent; informal arrangement with a Tessera document fabricator he knows only as ''the Archivist''', N'Efua Asomaning-Szabó is long-limbed and restless, always in motion — adjusting a display, flipping a collar, draping a jacket on a passing stranger''s shoulders to show them how it falls. His Polynesian-Polish heritage gives him a broad face and prominent cheekbones, and he''s invested in geneware that makes his skin display faint bioluminescent patterns across his arms and neck: slow-shifting geometric shapes in blue-white that he programs seasonally. His hair is a towering installation in itself, grown long and restructured with color-shifting gel into something between a wave crest and a crown, currently cycling through sunset oranges.

He sells three things: replica high-fashion pieces indistinguishable from the real thing to anyone without a scanner, genuinely creative original clothing he designs himself at night, and — quietly, to the right people — fabricated identity documents that can fool mid-tier corponation scanners. He speaks about fashion with an almost religious reverence that''s entirely sincere, and speaks about the IDs as if they don''t exist. He''s charming in the exhausting way of someone who has never been allowed to stop performing.', N'Social entry point for characters needing new identities or a disguise; can source fashion-adjacent items; gossip about who''s buying new faces; creative energy that makes scenes feel alive', N'', N'Bioluminescent subdermal patterning (arms and neck, programmable); color-shift geneware in hair follicles; basic AR overlay contacts for fashion visualization', N'Sets up his stall by mid-morning, runs it until late night when the Burnished Market really moves, then goes home to design clothing until 3am on a salvaged Zheng-Dao fabricator.', N'Efua Asomaning-Szabó, 188cm tall angular figure in GLMZ, warm medium-brown skin with golden-olive undertones glowing subtly, sharp Eastern European cheekbones and defined jawline, dark brown eyes with AR overlay contacts, long color-shift hair cycling through amber and deep reds styled into dramatic wave-crest crown. Bioluminescent blue-white geometric patterns (hexagons, fractals, mandalas) pulsing across both forearms and right neck creating living collar effect. Wearing oversized cream linen shirt with rolled sleeves exposing glowing subdermal patterns, fitted metallic-finish synthetic pants, custom jacket reconstructed from vintage fabric fragments. Restless posture, hands gesturing expressively, perpetually in motion, theatrical presence. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon-lit urban setting, moody blue-white bioluminescent lighting emphasizing skin patterns and augmentations, neo-noir urban aesthetic, high-quality character portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, East Asian, and Southeast Asian ancestry in complex blend: 57.8% Eastern European providing sharp cheekbone definition and angular facial geometry, 26.4% Sub-Saharan African contributing warm skin depth, feature prominence, and luminous richness, 9.7% Northern European influencing height and lean angular build, 4.7% East Asian adding subtle eye shape and facial refinement, 1.4% Southeast Asian contributing minor structural elements. Result is a warm medium-brown complexion with golden-olive undertones that shifts subtly in different light—rich depth from the African and Eastern European ancestry balanced by luminosity from Northern European influence.', 188, 76, N'Long-limbed and angular, naturally lean with defined shoulders and wrists. Moves with restless energy — perpetually adjusting, gesturing, never quite still.', N'Color-shift geneware cycling through sunset oranges, amber, deep reds', N'Long, restructured into a dramatic wave-crest or crown formation using color-shift gel and styling compounds', N'Long (shoulder-length minimum, styled upward)', N'Dark brown, with AR overlay contacts that occasionally flash faint augmentation UI', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and olive undertones — rich depth from Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European ancestry, luminosity enhanced by Northern European influence, creating a complex multitonal complexion that shifts subtly in different light', N'Sharp, angular cheekbones from Eastern European and Northern European geometry; prominent, defined jawline characteristic of Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European features; expressive, mobile face with clear skin marked by slowly shifting bioluminescent geometric patterns across forearms and neck — blue-white shapes that pulse and reconfigure seasonally. Facial structure is theatrical and animated in expression.', N'Bioluminescent subdermal patterning across arms and neck (actively glowing); AR contact lenses visible as subtle prismatic flicker in direct light; color-shift hair geneware obvious in the way hair cycles through warm chromatic range', N'Constantly in motion — shoulders loose, hands always moving to adjust, drape, gesture. Invades personal space with calculated charm, physically rotating displayed clothing on strangers'' bodies to demonstrate fit. Default state is performance; stillness is uncomfortable.', N'Tier 3-4 working class with aspirational design flair. Wears own original designs frequently — high-quality salvage fabrics, unexpected color combinations, pieces that work harder than their materials suggest. Often seen in oversized linen shirts (sleeves rolled to expose bioluminescence), fitted synthetic pants in matte or metallic finishes, and custom jackets reconstructed from vintage fragments. No corporate branding, meticulous finishing. Favors neutrals and earth tones that let skin patterns be focal point.', N'His best original designs — the ones he never sells — are portraits of his estranged mother, who left for Grosse Pointe Enclosure when he was eleven to marry into a Tier 4 family. He''s been denied contact eighteen times. Each rejection becomes a garment.', N'Fast, enthusiastic, fashion-industry jargon mixed with Burnished Market slang; switches to flat monosyllables when discussing IDs', N'Rapid-fire when excited, which is most of the time; goes unnaturally slow and quiet when discussing anything illegal', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'efua_asomaning_szab');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5da-7990-b774-20919eed60f8', N'Dusan Delgado-Najjar', N'Dusan', N'', N'Delgado-Najjar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Ferment Quarter — a four-chair shop called The Guillotine, above a fermentation bar on Brewer''s Spine, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Barber and tattoo-adjacent skin artist at a combined barbershop in The Ferment Quarter', N'Independent (chair rental at The Guillotine); loose affiliation with a Ferment Quarter artists'' collective; The Ferment', N'Dusan Delgado-Najjar is short and compactly built, with the precise hands of someone who has trained the tremor out of their nervous system through ten thousand repetitions. Their skin is deep brown-black with bioluminescent patches they had inked along their collarbones and forearms — the bioluminescence pulses slowly when they are calm and quickens when they are excited, which makes them a very poor liar in dim lighting. They have color-changing hair currently set to a slow cycle through amber-to-rust tones; they change the cycle depending on season and mood, and their regulars track it as a barometric instrument for the shop''s atmosphere.

Chi is the youngest full-time operator at The Guillotine and the busiest by appointment count. They have a gift for reading what a client wants even when the client cannot articulate it — they ask three questions and then go quiet, and the quiet is not uncomfortable. They are also quietly accumulating power in the Ferment Quarter social ecosystem, because the barbershop chair is where people say things they would not say anywhere else, and Chi has a memory like archival storage and a policy of never speaking ill — only listening. Off the clock they are louder, funnier, and significantly more likely to start a dance in a hallway.', N'Social hub and passive intelligence network — clients tell their barber everything; can be a source of neighborhood gossip, social connections, or backstory on local figures; also functions as a local color character who can reflect the texture of the Ferment Quarter scene', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin patches (collarbones and forearms, pulse-reactive); color-changing hair (currently amber-to-rust cycle); subdermal haptic feedback layer in fingertips (professional — allows precision depth sensing for skin work)', N'Takes clients from 1000 to 2000 four days a week, spends one day doing skin art consultations and custom design work, runs the collective''s social feed on their off day and calls it resting.', N'Dusan Delgado-Najjar, compact lean figure, deep warm brown skin with golden-olive undertones reflecting diaspora heritage blend, prominent high cheekbones and defined geometric jawline, dark brown observant eyes. Medium textured fade hairstyle with longer crown, currently colored in shifting amber-rust synthetic tones. Bioluminescent cyan-blue geometric patterns glowing softly along collarbones and forearms. Wearing fitted black utility pants and charcoal fitted top, black custom leather work apron with tool pockets. Short clean nails, composed expression with quiet intensity. Standing balanced and ready, hands capable of precision micro-adjustments. GLMZ workshop or street setting, cool LED ambient lighting highlighting the bioluminescent augmentations, industrial aesthetic, slight lean-in posture suggesting focused attention --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Ferment Quarter', N'local', N'The Ferment Quarter', N'Complex diaspora blend: Hispanic/Latin American (42.3%) provides foundational warmth and facial structure; significant Middle Eastern ancestry (30.2%) contributes to bone prominence and feature definition; Indigenous American heritage (13.2%) adds subtle geometric cheekbone and jaw architecture; Sub-Saharan African (9.5%) enriches undertones with warmth and depth; East Asian (4.8%) introduces subtle eye shape and facial harmony. This creates a striking phenotype with warm deep brown skin, complex golden-olive-amber undertones, and distinctive facial geometry that doesn''t resolve to any single heritage.', 158, 52, N'Compact and lean with developed forearm and hand musculature from precise repetitive work; economical movement, no wasted space', N'Color-shifting synthetic — currently cycling amber to rust tones on a slow progression', N'Textured fade with longer crown, styled back and to one side; the color-shift is programmed to cycle visibly throughout the day', N'Medium (crown 8cm, sides 3cm)', N'Dark brown, alert and observant', N'Warm deep brown with complex golden-olive-amber undertones; the interplay of multiple heritage groups creates a rich, multitonal complexion that shifts subtly in different lighting—warmer in golden light, more olive in cool tones', N'Clear, well-maintained skin with prominent high cheekbones (Middle Eastern and Indigenous American influence) and defined, geometric jawline; subtle facial asymmetry adds character; minimal facial hair, kept groomed; expression typically composed but capable of rapid shifts to humor or intensity', N'Bioluminescent skin patches (collarbones and forearms) that pulse with visible color shift when calm or quicken during excitement; color-changing hair with visible shift cycle. Subdermal haptic feedback in fingertips is not externally visible but evidenced by precision hand control.', N'Stands with weight balanced, ready to move; hands are still at rest but capable of micro-adjustments. Moves economically, rarely gestures broadly. In conversation, leans in slightly and maintains steady eye contact; the quiet they create in conversation is intentional and centered, not awkward.', N'Tier 3-4 practical aesthetic: fitted black or deep-grey utility pants with reinforced pockets; cropped or fitted tops in muted colors (charcoal, slate, deep forest) or occasionally bold solid colors that complement the hair cycle. Wears a well-maintained leather apron (black, custom fitted) during work with pockets for tools. Off-duty: looser fits, streetwear influenced, willing to wear color. No corpo branding; favors independent makers and collective artisan pieces. Keeps nails short and clean, cuticles maintained.', N'They have a private archive of sketches — portraits of every client they have ever had, from memory, after the client leaves. They have never shown anyone. It is approximately four hundred portraits. They do not fully understand why they keep them.', N'Contemporary Ferment Quarter vernacular mixed with art terminology; uses spatial and visual metaphor naturally', N'Warm and rhythmic in consultation mode, drops to quiet focused murmurs while working, becomes animated and overlapping when enthusiastic', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dusan_delgado_najjar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a711-7433-867c-20cf9bb41436', N'Filomena Bangura', N'Filomena', N'', N'Bangura', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown — Ironvein Augmentation Clinic, Level 2 Bay, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Neural calibrator at a mid-tier augmentation clinic in Geartown, specializing in post-installation cognitive alignment and rejection management', N'Ironvein Augmentation Clinic — independent, Tier 3 facility', N'Filomena Bangura is slight and precise, with warm amber skin, shaved temples, and a crown of loose dark curls that they dye in shifting gradients — currently deep violet fading to copper. Their irises are calibration-patterned, concentric rings of grey and gold that pulse faintly when they''re running a neural diagnostic, a mod they had installed as both a professional tool and an aesthetic statement. They wear clean white clinical uniforms with a single personal touch: a small embroidered patch of their home district stitched to the shoulder. Their hands are rarely still — they tap rhythms on surfaces when thinking, flex their fingers between sessions.

Filomena Bangura is the person who sees patients after the glamorous augmentation surgery is done and the reality sets in — the migraines, the dissociation, the body-horror of a new sense that the brain doesn''t yet recognize as self. They are enormously patient in a way that reads almost inhuman until you catch the flash of genuine distress behind their eyes when a patient is struggling. They have opinions about augmentation culture that they mostly keep to themselves, believing that the industry sells transformation without adequately preparing people for the grief that sometimes accompanies it.', N'Information source about augmentation culture and the psychological aftermath of cybernetic installation. Can identify augmentation-related medical issues in characters. Provides a window into the emotional and ethical underbelly of the aug industry.', N'', N'Calibration-patterned irises (diagnostic tool/cosmetic). Subdermal neural interface port at the base of the skull for direct patient link calibration. Faint bioluminescent tracery along forearms — a cosmetic mod they had done at 19 and consider a youthful indiscretion they''ve grown fond of.', N'Books six to eight calibration sessions per day, each forty minutes. Eats lunch alone in a back room with the feeds off. Takes the Ferrogate Transit home to Calumet Rise, where they share a flat with a roommate who asks no questions about their work.', N'Filomena Bangura, 168cm lean clinical professional in GLMZ, warm caramel-bronze skin with golden undertones reflecting blended South Asian, Hispanic, Sub-Saharan African, East Asian and Eastern European heritage. High defined cheekbones, sharp jawline softened by Latin warmth, subtle East Asian eye shape. Asymmetrical hairstyle: deep violet fading to copper curls at crown, shaved temples. Pulsing grey-gold calibration-ring irises with diagnostic glow. Pale blue-white bioluminescent constellation patterns on bare forearms. White clinical uniform, neutral expression, precise meditative posture. Neural interface port scar visible at skull base. Minimalist professional aesthetic, muted colors, clinical lighting emphasizing skin tone and bioluminescent tracery. GLMZ 2200s clinic setting, quiet intensity, forward-leaning engaged posture. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Pan-diaspora blend: primarily South Asian (45.4%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (24.7%), Sub-Saharan African (20.5%), East Asian (6.3%), and Eastern European (3.1%) ancestry. The combination yields a distinctive phenotype — warm deep caramel to bronze skin with golden and amber undertones, facial structure bridging South Asian prominence with Latin softness, cheekbones naturally high and defined from Sub-Saharan African heritage, eye shape subtly shaped by East Asian ancestry, skin texture refined and even. The overall effect is a harmonious blend where no single heritage dominates the appearance, creating a uniquely multivalent beauty.', 168, 58, N'Slight and lean, almost ascetic — wiry muscle from standing eight hours daily, minimal body fat, the economical posture of someone who''s learned to exist in tight spaces', N'Deep violet fading to copper gradient', N'Crown of loose dark curls swept back from shaved temples, asymmetrical and deliberately maintained', N'Medium (3-4 inches at crown, faded to stubble at sides)', N'Concentric calibration rings of grey and gold, pulsing faintly during diagnostic activity', N'Warm deep caramel to bronze with golden and amber undertones, mid-to-deep complexion reflecting the balanced blend of South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, and Eastern European ancestry', N'Clean, minimal makeup, professionally groomed. High angular cheekbones with natural fullness reflecting South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, sharp jawline softened by Latin warmth and relative youth. Eyes have subtle epicanthic shape from East Asian ancestry. Skin shows no visible damage — rigorously maintained, likely a professional habit. Expression typically neutral until engagement, then animated with quiet intensity.', N'Pulsing calibration-patterned irises (diagnostic; most noticeable during patient sessions). Bioluminescent forearm tracery visible when arms are bare or under clinical lighting. Neural interface port at occipital base visible when hair is swept back. Otherwise presents as baseline human.', N'Precise and economical — minimal wasted motion. Hands in near-constant subtle movement (finger flexing, rhythm-tapping on surfaces) when thinking or between patients. Stands slightly forward-leaning when listening, suggesting active engagement. Movements are deliberate, unhurried, almost meditative.', N'Clean white clinical uniform as standard work attire, well-maintained but not expensive. Single personal embellishment: small embroidered patch of home district on shoulder. Off-shift: Tier 3 casual — functional layers, muted colors, minimal branding. Footwear practical (clinic clogs at work, transit-grade shoes commuting). Jewelry sparse: possibly a single thin ring or wrist cuff with subtle circuitry aesthetic.', N'They have been slowly, covertly documenting cases that suggest Ironvein''s most popular neural implant model causes a specific, subtle personality shift in a small percentage of patients — a reduction in risk-aversion. They don''t yet know if it''s a manufacturing defect or a feature.', N'Careful, precise language. Uses clinical terminology but prefers plain words when discussing emotional experience. Notably avoids corporate brand names for augmentations, using generic anatomical descriptions instead.', N'Unhurried. Long pauses before answering questions. Finishes other people''s sentences sometimes — not rudely, but as a reflex of pattern recognition.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'filomena_bangura');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ee-74a8-914f-20f27a5ea6e9', N'Elif Tofauti-Adu', N'Elif', N'', N'Tofauti-Adu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 33, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower district tenements near the old lakeshore, near Ashland and Division', N'High-speed vehicle operations specialist — wheelman', N'Independent — maintains network of professional contacts', N'Elif Tofauti-Adu is slight and easy to overlook, which is exactly the point. At 33, he has the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — cranial bomb defuser — specialized implant that detects and neutralizes cortex b — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. He works as a wheelman out of the Gray Zone, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Everyone who''s worked with Elif Tofauti-Adu agrees on two things: he is worth the fee, and he is terrible company at dinner.', N'Deniz Volkov-Obi is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When he makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of his stories.', N'', N'Cranial bomb defuser — specialized implant that detects and neutralizes cortex bombs in others. Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Elif Tofauti-Adu, 172cm lean neo-noir operative with Central Asian-Pacific Islander-South Asian heritage, warm bronze-gold skin with golden undertones, pronounced high cheekbones, strong jawline, dark brown hair with gray at temples cut short at 2cm. Deep brown eyes with chrome surgical scarring around sockets. Visible chrome cranial implant circuitry at left temple in geometric patterns, subcutaneous wiring traces on neck and upper chest. Thin scar along left temple, chemical burn mark on right forearm, webbed scarring on right wrist, Cyrillic tattoo on left collarbone. Clean-shaven, military-precise grooming. Wearing matte-black reinforced jacket with integrated pockets, gray synthetic undershirt, dark gray reinforced cargo pants, steel-toed scuffed boots, thin chain with non-functional key. Economical posture, alert and composed. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, sitting in dimly-lit facility with neon accent lighting, hands steady and ready, the uncanny calm of someone three steps ahead. Cinematic, gritty, utilitarian aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Central Asian dominant (58.1%) with significant Pacific Islander (27.6%) and South Asian (14.3%) heritage. The genetic blend creates striking phenotypic complexity: warm golden-bronze undertones from Central Asian steppe ancestry layered with sun-kissed warmth from Pacific Islander heritage, refined by South Asian facial geometry. The combination produces a warm, weathered appearance with pronounced cheekbones and strong jawline—a face shaped by multiple continental bloodlines that reads as both austere and vital.', 172, 68, N'Lean and efficient — minimal excess mass, all functional muscle. Wiry frame built for sustained output rather than explosive power, with the posture of someone who has trained their body as a tool.', N'Dark brown, naturalized with gray threading at temples', N'Short, practical cut kept at precisely 2cm length — no maintenance vanity, pure function', N'Short', N'Deep brown with faint chrome-rim scarring around the orbital sockets — sign of repeated surgical interface', N'Warm bronze with golden undertones from Central Asian and Pacific Islander heritage, carrying depth and refinement from South Asian ancestry. Base tone is medium-rich and luminous, with honey-amber qualities that catch light distinctly. Carries pallor from irregular sleep cycles and minimal sun exposure, creating a slightly matte quality that contrasts with underlying warmth.', N'Strong, high cheekbones with angular Central Asian placement, lean jaw with pronounced strength reflecting South Asian ancestry. Facial structure shows the refined geometry of steppe heritage combined with Pacific Islander bone depth and warmth. Skin shows fine stress lines around eyes and mouth — accumulated tension rather than age. Thin scar tissue along left temple from surgical access points. Grooming is military-precise: clean-shaven daily, nails trimmed to function, no ornamentation.', N'Cranial implant is the statement piece — fine chrome circuitry visible at left temple in geometric patterns, deliberately left unhidden. The pattern catches light in a way that reads as either medical necessity or a warning. Subcutaneous wiring traces visible under translucent patches of skin on neck and upper chest when he moves, suggesting extensive neural integration beneath.', N'Economical and alert. Sits with spine straight, eyes tracking entrances and exits reflexively. Moves like someone counting milliseconds — no wasted motion, each gesture purposeful. Hands are steady and quick. When still, he has an uncanny calm that makes people uncomfortable; when moving, he''s already three steps ahead of the room.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Matte-black reinforced jacket with integrated comms pockets, custom-fitted for concealed hardware. Underneath: gray synthetic undershirt designed for rapid cooling. Worn cargo pants in dark gray with cargo pockets reinforced for equipment — no corporate logos, no flash. Steel-toed boots with grip-soled treads, scuffed from actual use. A thin chain with a non-functional key around his neck — the only personal item, kept for reasons he won''t explain.', N'', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'elif_tofauti_adu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6af-7ac4-811d-211f8f04639c', N'Gouri Bhattacharya', N'Gouri', N'', N'Bhattacharya', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Former Spire-tier bioethics executive / Exiled community medic', N'Unaffiliated (formerly Vantara BioSystems, Spire-tier; affiliation terminated)', N'Gouri Bhattacharya is a large man gone soft at the edges, with the posture of someone who once commanded rooms and has since chosen not to. His skin is the pale ochre of long indoor living, his hands enormous and steady, his white hair kept short and his beard grown out in the way of a man who has stopped performing for an audience that no longer exists. He wears the same rotation of practical clothes—heavy canvas, worn but clean—and carries a battered medical kit that is more capable than it looks because he has modified it himself over eleven years of field use in the Gray Zone.

Rector spent twenty-two years as Director of Bioethical Compliance at Vantara BioSystems, one of The Spire''s three major augmentation conglomerates. He was the man who signed off on clinical trial parameters, who sat across from regulators and explained why the variance in adverse outcome data was within acceptable bounds, who used the language of ethics as a procedural instrument. He was not unintelligent about what he was doing. He did it anyway. The specific incident that ended his career is documented in sealed corporate arbitration records: a neural augmentation trial in the lower districts in which forty-three participants experienced cascading cognitive degradation, eighteen of whom died. Rector had flagged the risk internally fourteen months prior. The flag was overruled. He signed the continuation anyway.

He was not prosecuted. He was quietly exited, his Spire access revoked, his identity scrubbed from Vantara''s public materials. He went to the Gray Zone because he didn''t know where else to go, and he stayed because someone needed stitches and he was the only one there with the knowledge. That was eleven years ago. He has since become the closest thing the Gray Zone has to a neighborhood doctor, working from a converted storage unit he calls the Surgery, accepting payment in food, labor, or nothing. He does not talk about his past. Everyone in the Gray Zone knows anyway.', N'Rector functions as the story''s moral weight anchor—a character who has done genuine institutional harm and is living inside the long, non-redemptive work of trying to be useful anyway. He resists the redemption arc structure by refusing to let himself be redeemed, which makes him a vehicle for exploring what accountability looks like when there is no absolution available.', N'', N'Haptic-feedback surgical assist implants in both hands—installed during his Vantara years for precision work, now the only augmentations he retains and maintains with deep ambivalence,A Vantara-branded neural medical reference implant he has repeatedly tried to have removed; two surgeons in The Circuit told him the extraction risk outweighs the benefit at his age', N'Wakes early, opens the Surgery by 07:00. Sees patients through the morning on a first-come basis. Midday he does supply runs through the Gray Zone''s informal trade networks, bartering services for materials. Afternoons are for follow-up visits to patients who cannot come to him. Evenings he updates his physical patient records—no digital storage, a deliberate choice—and reads medical literature he accesses through a Circuit library terminal once weekly. Sleeps in a cot in the back of the Surgery. Has not left the Gray Zone in four years.', N'Gouri Bhattacharya, seventy-year-old man with rich warm brown skin blending South Asian, Central Asian, African, and East Asian heritage, weathered and golden-undertoned. White close-cropped hair, full white beard, deliberately unkempt. Deep-set brown eyes with amber undertones, slightly rheumy. High Central Asian cheekbones balanced with fuller South Asian lips and softer jawline. Enormous hands with surgical scars and age spots, faint iridescent augmentation marks visible under fingernails. Deep facial lines from years of calculation. Large frame, broad-shouldered, muscular beneath settled flesh from seventy years of living. Wearing natural-fiber canvas work clothes—cream and charcoal canvas pants, olive field jacket, scuffed leather boots. Worn medical kit in custom battered leather visible. Faded surgical band on left wrist. Posture of residual command, deliberate economical movement. Standing in industrial near-future megacity setting, fluorescent and overcast lighting, worn medical workspace or field clinic in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226. Professional, weathered, precise, calm presence. Cinematic photorealism, moody atmospheric lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Mixed ancestry reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: predominantly South Asian (61.5%) with substantial Central Asian heritage (30.7%), smaller contributions from Sub-Saharan African (4.5%) and East Asian (3.3%) lineages. This combination creates warm, deep undertones with complexity—the rich brown of South Asian genetics enriched by Central Asian warmth, with subtle warmth from African ancestry and slight narrowing of the eye shape from East Asian contribution. Facial structure is distinctly blended: high, prominent cheekbones from Central Asian heritage balanced by fuller lips and broader nasal bridge from South Asian genetics, with slightly wider-set eyes reflecting the East Asian element, creating a face that carries the geography of multiple continents.', 188, 94, N'Large-framed, broad-shouldered, gone soft with age—muscle beneath a layer of settled flesh. Not obese, but carries his seventy years heavily. His bulk is functional rather than maintained; a man built for moving through the world, now moving through it less.', N'White, natural', N'Closely cropped, utilitarian', N'Short', N'Deep brown with amber undertones, slightly rheumy at the corners', N'Rich warm brown with golden undertones—the baseline blend of South Asian and Central Asian ancestry deepened and weathered by two decades under fluorescent light and eleven years under industrial overcast. The skin carries warmth from all four ancestry components, creating a complex mid-to-deep brown that reads as genuinely lived-in rather than affected.', N'Weathered but clean. Deep lines around the eyes and mouth—not smile lines, but the creases of a man who has spent years calculating consequences. His beard is white, full, and deliberately unkempt, grown without vanity. Facial structure reflects his ancestry: high, prominent cheekbones with Central Asian angularity balanced by fuller lips and softer jawline from South Asian heritage, wide-set eyes positioned above those distinctive cheekbones with subtle shape from East Asian ancestry. His face carries the geography of multiple continents blended into one. Hands are enormous, with long fingers and calluses along the palms and inner knuckles from surgical work.', N'Haptic-feedback surgical assist implants in both hands—visible as faint chromatic iridescence under the fingernails and along the metacarpal ridges when light hits at certain angles. The implants are older Vantara-era hardware, well-maintained but showing their age in subtle micro-scarring at the installation sites. No other visible augmentations; the neural medical reference implant is entirely subcutaneous.', N'Stands with the residual posture of command—shoulders back, weight centered—but has relaxed into it, no longer performing. Moves deliberately, economically, with the practiced precision of someone who has spent a lifetime working with their hands. When listening to someone, he inclines his head slightly and is still. He does not fidget. His movements carry the implicit message that he is not in a hurry, which is either comforting or unsettling depending on who is watching.', N'Rotation of heavy canvas work clothes—natural denim, olive field jackets, canvas pants in cream and charcoal. Everything worn but meticulously maintained and clean. No synthetic fabrics; everything is durable natural fiber. Boots are scuffed leather, resoled twice. He wears a canvas apron over his clothes when working, with deep pockets for supplies. No jewelry except a faded rubber surgical band on his left wrist, worn out of habit. His medical kit is battered leather, modified with custom strap placement and internal organization of his own design. Tier 4-5 aesthetic by choice, though his hands and the precision of his kit suggest access to higher-tier resources in the past.', N'He still has access to his old Vantara internal credentials—a backdoor the company doesn''t know survived his exit. He has used it once in eleven years, to pull trial data for a the Gray Zone resident who was experiencing delayed-onset cognitive degradation from a Vantara product. He told himself it was the last time. He keeps the access because he knows it won''t be.', N'Medical precision mixed with deliberate plainness—he has consciously stripped corporate euphemism from his speech as an ongoing practice, and catches himself when it slips back in', N'Slow, considered, with the weight of someone who has learned that words have costs. Long pauses before difficult truths. Does not soften diagnoses but does not deliver them without care.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gouri_bhattacharya');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72e-7693-9580-2164e2e8fa3f', N'Aigerim Larsdóttir-Haddad-Thakur', N'Aigerim', N'', N'Larsdóttir-Haddad-Thakur', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ashfeld — behind a legitimate small-run printing concern called Kamara Press on Cinder Row, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Identity fabricator and forger operating from a print shop front in Ashfeld', N'Independent; informal referral network with a Hamtramck Enclave smuggling cell', N'Aigerim Larsdóttir-Haddad-Thakur is lean and precise-looking, with close-cropped natural hair dyed in shifting copper tones via a low-grade follicular mod, and deep brown skin marked with three ritual scarification lines below her left eye — a gift from her maternal grandmother and the only thing she''s never altered. She dresses practically: dark composite-fiber work clothes, fingerless gloves, a craftsperson''s apron with tools she actually uses. Her eyes have patterned irises in a swirling amber-and-black design that she chose at seventeen, and she has the steady, unhurried hands of someone who does delicate work for hours at a time.

Aigerim Larsdóttir-Haddad-Thakur considers herself an artist first and a criminal by necessity. She takes genuine pride in her forgeries — biometric registration chains, corp employment histories, corponation citizenship transfers, medical background edits. Her work is flawless and she charges accordingly. She is not warm with clients but she is professional, which in Ashfeld counts for more. She has strong opinions about quality and will turn down work she considers beneath her skill level or too traceable. She prays to the E.L.F. called the Blank Page, a spirit said to inhabit pre-loaded identity matrices, leaving offerings of raw data-blank chips at a small shrine she keeps inside a hollowed-out printing press.', N'Service provider for characters needing new identities or documentation; source of information about who is trying to disappear and why; can become an enemy if someone tries to compromise her work or her anonymity', N'', N'Patterned irises (amber-black swirl, cosmetic); follicular pigment mod (copper-shift hair dye, geneware); fine-motor neural stabilizers in both hands (professional grade, keeps her hands steady under stress)', N'Runs the legitimate print shop in the mornings, handles consultations and deliveries in the afternoons, does her actual work late at night when the building''s quiet.', N'Aigerim Larsdóttir-Haddad-Thakur, a 168cm lean precision-calibrated woman with warm golden-brown skin blending South Asian, Middle Eastern, and Latin American heritage, high angular cheekbones with penetrating gaze, short dark brown hair with copper undertones cycling through follicular mods. Three pale ritual scars stripe below her left eye. Her augmented irises display swirling amber-and-black patterned design. She wears practical Tier 4 dark charcoal workwear, fitted tunic, reinforced tool apron, midnight blue fingerless composite gloves concealing hand augmentation, worn supportive boots. Economical controlled posture, quiet precision presence. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, working in low maintenance light, cool industrial setting, moody atmospheric lighting highlighting her genetic constellation of features and subtle copper shimmer, stark minimalist aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfeld', N'local', N'Ashfeld', N'Striking multifaceted blend dominated by South Asian genetics (44.3%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (23.0%), Middle Eastern (17.7%), and Northern European (15.0%) ancestry. The genetic convergence creates warm golden-brown skin with subtle amber undertones, angular facial structure combining South Asian bone geometry with Middle Eastern definition and Latin American warmth, dark hair with natural copper undertones from the complex ancestral mix, and the distinctive penetrating gaze of someone whose features carry multiple continents.', 168, 58, N'Lean and economical, all efficient muscle and minimal excess — the build of someone whose body is calibrated for precision work rather than strength', N'Natural dark brown with copper undertones, cycling through follicular mod shifts', N'Close-cropped, practical, with subtle texture variation from the copper dye cycling through the follicles', N'Short', N'Deep brown base with augmented patterned irises: swirling amber and black design', N'Warm golden-brown with amber undertones — the result of dominant South Asian, significant Middle Eastern and Hispanic/Latin American heritage creating rich, luminous coloration with subtle warmth; unblemished except for ritual marks', N'Angular and defined with high cheekbones reflecting South Asian and Middle Eastern bone structure; the facial geometry shows the warm interplay of South Asian angularity softened by Latin American and Middle Eastern features; steady, penetrating gaze; minimal makeup; skin maintenance-clean but not precious; features carry the distinct character of genuine genetic blending across multiple continental lineages', N'Patterned irises with swirling amber-and-black design visible under normal light; subtle copper shimmer in hair indicating follicular pigment mod; fingerless composite gloves worn constantly, suggesting hand augmentation beneath but not exposing it visibly', N'Economical and controlled; moves with deliberate precision; hands held with an almost martial calm; minimal wasted motion; sits still for extended periods without fidgeting; presence is quiet rather than commanding', N'Practical Tier 4 workwear: dark charcoal composite-fiber trousers and fitted tunic; reinforced apron with multiple tool pockets worn during active work; fingerless thermal gloves (midnight blue); worn boots with good ankle support; no jewelry or ornamentation except for the ritual scars; everything chosen for function and durability over aesthetics', N'Two years ago she fabricated an entire employment history for someone who used it to get a position inside Helix Biosystems — that person later disappeared, and Yseult suspects they were corp security working a sting operation. She has been quietly trying to determine if she''s already flagged.', N'Clipped and technical; uses printing and document terminology as metaphor; unusually precise grammar for someone in her tier', N'Fast when interested, very flat and short when uncomfortable', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aigerim_larsd_ttir_haddad_thakur');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a738-7691-b608-217a4831a937', N'Ginette Ozcoidi-Baek', N'Ginette', N'', N'Ozcoidi-Baek', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Chatham Flats, near Kedzie and Division', N'Bounty compliance officer, independent — contracted to Tessera Compliance Bureau', N'Tessera Compliance Bureau (contract); Chatham Flats resident', N'Ginette Ozcoidi-Baek is young in a way he is painfully aware of — broad-shouldered and physically impressive, with medium brown skin, a slightly too-eager manner, and retractable claw geneware on both hands that he got at nineteen because he thought it would make him look serious and has since decided he was right for the wrong reasons. He keeps the claws sheathed almost always; extending them feels like admitting he''s nervous. His hair is grown out past his shoulders, dyed in shifting red-orange bioluminescence that he tells people is a professional investment because people remember you, which is true and also not really why he did it.

He works skip tracing and debt-compliance pickups for Tessera — locating people who have defaulted on Tessera contracts, service agreements, or residential obligations and facilitating their ''voluntary return to compliance,'' which in practice means finding them and making very clear what Tessera''s options are. He is not violent by preference and not comfortable when situations require it. He is, however, genuinely good at the finding — spatial memory, social intuition, and a disarming quality that makes people underestimate him until he''s already confirmed what he came to know. He keeps a small E.L.F. prayer card tucked in his jacket — Our Finder, patron of lost things — and touches it before starting a new case.', N'Ground-level institutional presence — not quite police, not quite private sector, operating in the grey zone of corporate compliance enforcement. Useful for encounters, pressure, and humanizing the machinery of corporate debt.', N'', N'Retractable claw geneware — both hands, matte black keratin. Bioluminescent hair dye — red-orange shift. Standard Tessera contractor neural tag for case file access.', N'Takes case assignments via Tessera''s contractor portal each morning; spends most of his day in the field — transit nodes, residential blocks, neighborhood contacts; files location reports when he has a lead and compliance logs when a case closes.', N'Ginette Ozcoidi-Baek, 188cm tall athletic male with warm medium-brown skin and golden-amber undertones, reflecting globally blended East Asian, Indigenous American, Northern European, South Asian, Hispanic and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Prominent East Asian cheekbones blended with Indigenous American jaw width, balanced South Asian facial proportions. Dark brown hair with bioluminescent red-orange undertone cycling in low light, grown past shoulders and loosely framed around his face. Medium brown eyes with guarded but earnest expression. Clean-shaven with faint scar through left eyebrow. Wearing matte-gray Tessera-issued synthetic jacket over dark fitted shirt, reinforced cargo pants, worn composite boots. Faint neural interface port visible at base of skull. Retractable black keratin claws visible as thickened nail beds on both hands. Measured posture, hands openly visible and relaxed. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, professional contractor aesthetic, slight forward lean, observational gaze, low neon lighting casting subtle shadows, urban industrial background. Mood: deliberate, controlled, earnest but cataloging. Professional and non-threatening presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Chatham Flats', N'local', N'Chatham Flats', N'Genuinely global genetic mosaic: East Asian (31%), Indigenous American (18.4%), Northern European (17.9%), South Asian (17.4%), Hispanic/Latin American (9.1%), Sub-Saharan African (6.2%). This combination produces warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones and complex undertones of amber and ochre. Facial structure reflects East Asian cheekbone prominence blended with Indigenous American jaw width, South Asian nose and orbital structure, and Northern European brow ridge subtlety. The result is facially balanced across multiple heritage expressions without default to any single ancestry.', 188, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and athletic with a slight forward lean — built for physical presence without bulk, the kind of frame that reads as capable rather than threatening', N'Dark brown base with bioluminescent red-orange shift that cycles in low light', N'Grown past shoulders, loose and slightly unkempt, often pulled back with a cord or allowed to fall forward to frame his face', N'Long', N'Medium brown, slightly guarded expression', N'Warm medium brown with golden-amber undertones — sun-exposed face slightly darker than neck, showing melanin distribution across his diverse ancestry blend. Skin carries warmth from East Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan heritage layered with Northern European and Indigenous American genetics, creating an even complexion without stark regional variation', N'Clean-shaven face with defined jawline carrying width from Indigenous American heritage; prominent high cheekbones from East Asian ancestry; skin shows minor stress creases around the eyes from squinting focus. A faint scar through his left eyebrow (approximately half an inch) from a skip-trace field incident. Expression carries an earnest quality that reads younger than his age. Facial proportions reflect balanced blending: slightly broad nose bridge (South Asian/Indigenous American), defined orbital structure (East Asian/Northern European), strong jaw (Indigenous American/South Asian)', N'Retractable black keratin claws on both hands — visible at the fingertips as slightly thickened nail beds with matte finish when sheathed. Hair bioluminescence activates in low-light environments, creating a red-orange halo effect. Faint neural interface port at the base of his skull, barely visible under longer hair — small circular scar with subcutaneous threading', N'Carries himself with deliberate, measured stillness — the kind of person who doesn''t fidget because he''s learning to control nervous energy. When moving through crowds, his gait is efficient and observational; he takes in exits, sight lines, and people''s positions. His hands rest openly visible, fingers relaxed — a conscious choice to appear non-threatening. When speaking with a contact, he leans in slightly and makes steady eye contact, which reads as earnest and disarming until you realize he''s also cataloging everything', N'Tier 3 working-class professional — Tessera contractor gear. Typically wears: a matte-gray synthetic jacket (Tessera-issued, logo embroidered at shoulder), reinforced cargo pants with Φ-credit reader pocket, worn composite boots with good grip. Under the jacket: plain fitted shirts in dark colors (blue, black, charcoal). A small laminated prayer card (E.L.F. patron saint) hangs on a cord inside his jacket collar, visible if he moves. His aesthetic reads as ''young professional trying to look older'' — functional, deliberate, slightly overdressed for the neighborhood', N'He deliberately mislogged the address on a case file three months ago. The person he was tracking — a single mother who had defaulted on a Tessera residential agreement — had told him where she was going before he found her, and he believed her when she said she''d make the next payment. She hasn''t. He checks the portal every morning.', N'Chatham Flats vernacular, professional language he''s still learning to deploy correctly, occasional over-formal phrasing when he''s nervous', N'Fast and social — fills silence, asks questions, pivots quickly', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ginette_ozcoidi_baek');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a646-76f8-a694-218d09873f9f', N'Awapuhi Solberg-Strömqvist-Chatterjee', N'Awapuhi', N'', N'Solberg-Strömqvist-Chatterjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Shallowgrave, specifically the Ironvein residential stack — bunks with three other Rust Toll members on the 7th floor, near Kedzie and Division', N'Protection racket enforcer and mid-level collections muscle for the Shallowgrave Corridor gang, the Rust Toll', N'Rust Toll street gang, Shallowgrave Corridor chapter — approximately 30 initiated members, territorial control of six residential stacks and the adjacent market passage', N'Awapuhi Solberg-Strömqvist-Chatterjee is big for nineteen — wide through the shoulders, thick-necked, with the kind of frame that reads as older until you see his face, which is still young in ways he actively tries to suppress. He has his Kazakh father''s broad cheekbones and his Ghanaian mother''s dark complexion, and he keeps his head shaved close on the sides with a tight coil of natural hair on top that he does not admit he spends time on. His geneware is peer-group standard: retractable fingernail reinforcements installed last year — not quite claws, more like blunted hardened keratin — and a bioluminescent stripe along his left jaw, pale orange, that marks him as Rust Toll initiated. He has two cracked ribs healing from a collection that went wrong last month.

He is not by nature a violent person, which is the central crisis of his daily life. He fell into the Rust Toll the way most people fall into things at sixteen — geography, necessity, three older cousins who were already in, and no competing options that felt real. He is genuinely well-liked by the people he collects from, which his crew finds somewhere between endearing and suspicious. He has a habit of fixing things — loose door panels, broken light strips — in the shops he visits for collections, without being asked, without charging it against the protection fee. He thinks about leaving the Toll approximately every two days. He has been thinking about it for three years.', N'Humanizing face of street-level crime, moral complexity anchor, potential ally or point of sympathy, represents the gravitational pull of circumstance over choice', N'', N'Reinforced nail-bed keratin (geneware, Rust Toll standard initiation mod). Bioluminescent jaw stripe, pale orange (gang marking, geneware). No chrome.', N'Wakes early, does physical training in the stairwell, makes collection rounds through his assigned six blocks in the late morning, spends afternoons on standby for the crew, evenings are increasingly his own — he has been teaching himself electrical repair from salvaged manuals.', N'GLMZ, 188cm tall young man with warm medium-deep brown skin and golden undertones, mixed Northern European-South Asian-Sub-Saharan African-Pacific Islander heritage. High defined cheekbones, straight nose, squared jaw. Dark brown eyes. Short dark coils on crown, shaved sides. Pale orange bioluminescent stripe glowing vertically along left jaw. Retractable keratin fingernail augmentations visible as pearl-gray tints at fingertips. Wide shoulders, athletic build, dense muscle. Wearing unmarked black crew-neck synthweave shirt, grey reinforced cargo pants, worn synth-leather jacket with multiple pockets, black scuffed industrial polymer boots. Small brass wire ring on left index finger. Slight healing bruising visible along left ribs. Healing cut above left eyebrow. Stands with controlled posture, shoulders slightly forward, weight balanced. Neutral expression, hands held economically near body. Tier 5 district setting, low sodium-vapor lighting casting warm amber glow. Weathered texture to skin from chronic sun exposure. Gritty, worn, functional aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shallowgrave', N'local', N'Shallowgrave', N'Northern European (40%), South Asian (36%), Sub-Saharan African (9%), Hispanic/Latin American (8%), and Pacific Islander (7%) ancestry — a striking diaspora blend where Scandinavian bone structure meets South Asian warmth and African depth, creating a phenotype that reads as genuinely cosmopolitan rather than any single lineage. The Pacific Islander component adds subtle fullness to facial geometry and melanin richness.', 188, 89, N'Wide-shouldered and thick-necked with dense muscle mass from consistent physical training; carries weight with the ungainly solidity of someone still growing into his frame rather than the refined bulk of an older fighter', N'Natural dark brown-black', N'Shaved close on the sides and back; tight coils maintained on the crown in a pattern he pretends not to care for', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden undertones — the result of Northern European fairness genetics meeting robust South Asian and Sub-Saharan melanin expression, further enriched by Pacific Islander and Latin American heritage creating subtle amber and olive harmonics. Sun-darkened from chronic Tier 5 exposure and inadequate water rationing, giving his skin a weathered patina despite his youth.', N'High, defined cheekbones with South Asian angularity and broader Sub-Saharan African spatial structure creating distinctive facial geometry. Straight nose bridge reflecting Northern European ancestry; squared jaw with subtle power from Scandinavian heritage blended with fuller lips from his African and Latin American components. Clear skin despite living conditions — a youthfulness in the face that contrasts sharply with his body and which he works to suppress through constant neutral expression. Small healing cut above left eyebrow from last week''s collection. Faint acne scarring along jawline.', N'Retractable reinforced fingernail keratin along both hands; fingertips show slightly thickened nail beds with a faint pearl-gray tint where the geneware integration shows under the skin. Keratin does not fully retract — approximately 2mm hardened edge visible at rest. Bioluminescent jaw stripe is always visible and active.', N'Stands with weight balanced, shoulders slightly forward — a posture developed from collecting. Moves with deliberate control, economical steps, hands rarely far from body. Does not gesture when speaking. When thinking, picks at his cuticles or fidgets with loose environmental objects (door panels, light strips, wiring) in an unconscious repair motion. Walks with a slight favoring of his right side due to healing ribs.', N'Tier 5 practical — unmarked gray or black synthweave crew-neck shirts without logos, grey cargo pants with reinforced pockets from a salvage supplier, worn synth-leather jacket with multiple inner pockets (functional, not status). No chrome visible. Boots are black industrial polymer, scuffed, laced tight. Wears a small brass wire ring on his left index finger (personal, not gang-affiliated). No jewelry beyond this. Clothing shows wear but is maintained — small tears are patched neatly, suggesting the kind of care he applies to fixing other people''s property.', N'He has been funneling small amounts — Φ5, Φ10 — from his collection rounds back to two specific families in the Ironvein stack who can''t make their protection fees, covering the shortfall out of his own cut. He keeps a handwritten ledger of what he''s owed that he knows he will never collect. He tells himself he is keeping a record; he is actually keeping a conscience.', N'Street vernacular with occasional formal diction that surfaces when he''s being sincere — code-switches between crew register and something quieter', N'Generally laconic; uses short sentences in group settings, opens up significantly when talking about fixing or building things', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'awapuhi_solberg_str_mqvist_chatterjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a59f-72fe-a16d-22156731861e', N'Rohan Khoury-Mukherjee-Hossain', N'Rohan', N'', N'Khoury-Mukherjee-Hossain', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 82, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Washburn Commons — apartment 14-G above the Ferrogate Transit hub, near Ashland and Division', N'Retired archive keeper and community storyteller', N'Retired Axiom employee (pension class C); informal community council, Washburn Commons', N'Rohan Khoury-Mukherjee-Hossain is a small, wire-thin woman whose skin has the deep matte darkness of old carbon fiber, mapped with fine wrinkles that seem to trace circuit patterns when the light catches them right. Her left eye was replaced after a workplace pressure incident with a ceramic prosthetic that never quite matched — it''s a milky amber orb with a fixed iris, which she''s decorated over the decades with hand-painted Yoruba adinkra symbols using surgical-grade pigment ink. Her real eye is still sharp and black and misses nothing. She keeps her white hair in elaborate plaited towers pinned with salvaged data-spikes, and she dresses in layered synthsilk robes in rust and ochre that billow when she walks. She moves slowly but with enormous deliberateness, as though every step is a considered choice.

Rohan Khoury-Mukherjee-Hossain spent forty years as a lower-tier archive technician for Axiom''s municipal records division, cataloguing what was supposed to be destroyed and quietly, carefully not destroying it. She has an almost religious relationship with information — she believes that forgetting is a form of violence and that memory is the only true resistance available to people without power. She is warm to anyone who sits still long enough to listen, but her warmth has a quality of assessment in it, as though she is deciding whether you are worth the particular truth she plans to share with you.', N'Information source of extraordinary depth; moral anchor for community storylines; quest giver who trades in favors and stories rather than Quanta; keeper of dangerous archival secrets', N'', N'Single ceramic prosthetic left eye, hand-decorated. Subdermal thermal stabilizers in both hands (occupational, for archival work in cold server rooms). No cosmetic geneware — she says she''s already enough.', N'Rises at four AM to pray to the data-ELFs she keeps shrined in a repurposed server cabinet; spends mornings reviewing physical paper she''s collected over decades; holds informal court at the Washburn Commons canteen from noon to three, where residents bring her disputes, questions, and gossip in exchange for stories and sometimes specific documents she shouldn''t have.', N'Rohan Khoury-Mukherjee-Hossain, elderly figure with warm deep brown skin rich with golden and bronze undertones, standing with deliberate upright posture despite wire-thin build. White hair elaborately braided into towers pinned with salvaged data-spikes, styled upward. Left eye replaced with milky amber ceramic prosthetic decorated with hand-painted Yoruba adinkra symbols; right eye natural dark brown and alert. Face mapped with fine circuit-like wrinkles, blended ancestral features showing South Asian cheekbone definition, Middle Eastern brow structure, Pacific Islander face shape, and African lip fullness. Extensive adinkra pattern tattoos covering face and neck in surgical-grade pigment. Hands showing faint linear scars from subdermal thermal stabilizers. Wearing layered synthsilk robes in rust and ochre tones billow around thin frame. Standing in archive or server room environment with soft lighting catching weathered skin texture and emphasizing tattoo patterns. GLMZ 2200s, intentional augmentation aesthetic, honored modifications, decades of personal history visible. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'elderly South Asian-Middle Eastern-Hispanic-Pacific Islander woman, 82 years old, wire-thin and deliberately upright, warm deep brown skin with golden undertones mapped with fine wrinkles that trace like circuit patterns across her face and neck, weathered carbon-fiber texture, asymmetrical features showing lived decades, skeletal prominence at shoulders and temples, dignified and carved rather than diminished

