--ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'South Asian (36.2%), Middle Eastern (22.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (12.4%), Pacific Islander (11.5%), Northern European (9.1%), Sub-Saharan African (8.0%). Genetic ancestry creates warm-deep brown skin with golden and subtle bronze undertones; facial structure blends South Asian cheekbone definition with Middle Eastern brow and nose characteristics, softened by Pacific Islander face shape and African lip fullness, with Northern European bone structure deepened beneath richly pigmented surface. Appearance embodies genuine Ubiquitous Diaspora mixing.', 152, 44, N'Wire-thin and diminished by age, but held upright with deliberate posture. No excess flesh; skeletal prominence at shoulders and wrists. Appears carved rather than diminished.', N'White', N'Elaborate plaited towers pinned with salvaged data-spikes; intricate cornrow-derived braiding pattern maintained with precision', N'Medium (approximately 25-30cm, styled upward)', N'Left eye: milky amber ceramic prosthetic with hand-painted Yoruba adinkra symbols in surgical-grade pigment ink. Right eye: natural dark brown, sharp and alert.', N'Warm deep brown with golden and subtle bronze undertones; melanin-rich pigmentation reflecting blended South Asian, Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African, Pacific Islander, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, with Northern European influence visible only in bone structure beneath surface. Texture resembles weathered carbon fiber in dim light; decades of sun exposure and controlled archive environments evident in patina.', N'Extensively mapped with fine wrinkles following non-standard anatomical patterns—appearing almost like circuit traces when light catches them. No cosmetic treatments or geneware modifications. Facial structure shows balanced blending: South Asian cheekbone prominence and skin depth; Middle Eastern brow definition and nasal structure; Pacific Islander and African features evident in face shape, lip fullness, and overall facial proportions; Northern European bone structure subtly softened and deepened by melanin-rich pigmentation across all ancestral components.', N'Ceramic prosthetic left eye with hand-painted adinkra decoration is immediately noticeable; hand scars from subdermal thermal stabilizers visible when hands are exposed; overall modification aesthetic is intentional and honored rather than concealed', N'Moves with extreme deliberateness, as though each step is a considered transaction with gravity. Stands upright despite age and thinness. Hands move with precision. Stillness is her default state; motion is purposeful. Head turns slowly to regard speakers.', N'Layered synthsilk robes in rust and ochre tones that billow when walking. Clothing suggests Tier 3 status — well-maintained, chosen for comfort and aesthetics rather than status signaling. Fabrics are vintage quality, maintained over decades. Wears salvaged data-spikes as both hair ornaments and sometimes as necklace elements. No corpo branding; styling reflects personal history rather than current affiliation.', N'She has a complete record of a Sterling-Nakamura waste-dumping operation from 2171 that caused the Brightmoor groundwater collapse — names, dates, sign-offs. She has been waiting thirty years for someone she trusts enough to give it to.', N'Formal, slightly archaic corporate pidgin mixed with Yoruba-inflected cadences; quotes records and dates with uncanny precision; uses the passive voice when discussing atrocities, as though distance makes them more bearable', N'Slow and deliberate, with long pauses she fills with the sound of her own breathing; never rushes', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'rohan_khoury_mukherjee_hossain');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5fa-7a18-bc76-227f2c69d665', N'Ingrid Strömqvist-Owusu', N'Ingrid', N'', N'Strömqvist-Owusu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 51, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone lower levels, specifically the Blackpipe Corridor market hub, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Loan shark', N'Independent, with tribute arrangements to the Copper Ledger; informal network of collectors who are ordinary people who owe her favors', N'Ingrid Strömqvist-Owusu has the kind of face that has grown into itself — high cheekbones above hollowed cheeks, close-cropped natural hair gone to silver at the temples, skin the color of dark honey mapped with the specific fine lines of someone who has spent decades expressing exactly as much as she chooses to express and no more. She is thin in a way that suggests efficiency rather than want. She dresses in well-maintained secondhand clothing in muted ochres and deep greens, always with a long vest that has many pockets, all of which she knows the contents of. Her one visible mod is cat ears — small, dark-furred, and alert — that she had installed at thirty and has maintained ever since; they rotate toward sound with small, involuntary precision, which she uses to her advantage because people underestimate what she is hearing.

Ingrid Strömqvist-Owusu runs her loan operation from a tea stall in the Blackpipe market that is legitimately also a tea stall — she has brewed good tea for twenty years and takes genuine pride in it. She learned lending from her grandmother, who ran a rotating savings collective in the Gray Zone before the Copper Ledger absorbed the territory. Ingrid Strömqvist-Owusu understands money as a social technology and interest as a form of relationship; she is not cruel, but she is absolutely clear about consequences, and the Blackpipe community both relies on her and is slightly afraid of her, which she considers the correct balance.', N'Information source — she knows every financial pressure point in the Blackpipe Corridor; quest giver for debt-recovery or debt-escape storylines; social hub character who can connect players to other local actors', N'', N'Cat ears — small, dark-furred (geneware, maintained for 21 years)', N'She opens the tea stall at 06:30 and closes at 13:00. Lending consultations happen at the stall, in plain sight, which she has found is safer than privacy. Afternoons she walks the corridor making what she calls ''social calls'' — she checks in with borrowers under the guise of neighborly conversation, and everyone understands what the conversation is.', N'Ingrid Strömqvist-Owusu, 51-year-old woman with rich warm mahogany-brown skin tone (Sub-Saharan African and Northern European ancestry), prominent cheekbones, fuller lips, dark alert eyes. Short natural black hair with silver at temples, close-cropped and precision-cut. Functional dark-furred mechanical cat ears mounted on crown, rotating independently. Fine expression lines, thin scar along right jawline. Lean 168cm frame, wiry musculature. Wearing sage green vest open over simple long-sleeved shirt, dark fitted trousers, practical re-soled boots. Muted earth-tone secondhand clothing, impeccably maintained. Economic precise posture, listening demeanor. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, dim neon-lit tea house or underground market setting, cool blue and warm amber lighting, calculating expression, atmospheric depth of field --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (51.3%) with significant Northern European (45.2%) ancestry and minor Hispanic/Latin American (3.5%) contribution. This creates a rich, warm deep brown complexion with golden undertones — the Sub-Saharan foundation modulated by Northern European genetics into a nuanced warm mahogany rather than pure ebony. The facial structure reflects the African and Hispanic blend: prominent, well-defined cheekbones, fuller lips, and a nose with width and character. Northern European ancestry contributes fine facial geometry and subtle cool undertones beneath the warmth.', 168, 58, N'Lean and efficient, with the wiry musculature of someone who has moved through tight spaces and worn days for decades. No excess, no softness.', N'Natural black with silver at temples and scattered through the crown', N'Close-cropped, precision-cut to scalp, styled with deliberate care', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and calculating', N'Deep warm mahogany-brown — the result of dominant Sub-Saharan African ancestry with Northern European modulation, creating golden-brown undertones rather than ashy coolness. Rich, saturated, and luminous.', N'High, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Sub-Saharan African and Hispanic ancestry, positioned above deliberately hollowed cheeks. Fine lines radiating from the corners of her eyes and mouth — the specific topography of someone who has spent 51 years controlling her expression. The bone structure shows strength and width in the nose and fullness in the lips. Skin is clear and well-maintained, with the texture of someone who has earned every line through deliberate use.', N'Pair of small, dark-furred cat ears mounted on the crown of her head with surgical precision. The ears are alert and functional — they rotate independently toward sound sources with obvious mechanical control. The geneware is well-maintained and integrated seamlessly into the hairline. They are clearly intentional, clearly maintained, and clearly used.', N'She moves with economic precision, never wasting a gesture. Her spine is straight but not rigid. She has the bearing of someone who listens more than she speaks, and her attention, when directed at you, feels like the focus of a lens. Her cat ears rotate toward speakers before her eyes move — a tell she is aware of and does not bother hiding.', N'Carefully maintained secondhand clothing in muted earth tones — ochres, deep greens, charcoal grays. A long vest in sage green or taupe, always worn open, with visible deep pockets, all of which she knows the precise contents of. Beneath, simple long-sleeved shirts in cotton or cotton-blend. Dark trousers, fitted but not fashionable. Practical boots with good grip, re-soled at least once. Everything is clean, nothing is new. The overall effect is Tier 4 working-class with the grooming standards of someone who understands that appearance is a negotiation tool.', N'Her grandmother''s rotating savings collective was absorbed by the Copper Ledger through a legal maneuver that Dzifa helped structure, believing at the time it was the only way to protect the members'' deposits. She has never told anyone. Her grandmother died believing the Ledger had simply outmaneuvered her.', N'Warm and idiomatic in casual registers; shifts to precise contractual language when discussing terms; multilingual — slides between Twi-inflected phrases and standard Meridian Creole', N'Unhurried; she controls conversation pace through silence and tea refills', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ingrid_str_mqvist_owusu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a659-7f8f-8385-230ab1e144ef', N'Farangis Zaragoza-Pathak', N'Farangis', N'', N'Zaragoza-Pathak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 53, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone lower levels — moves between a rented room in Burnside Pocket and a regular table at a bar called The Gradual Slope in Gage Circuit, near Halsted and Division', N'Blackmail specialist and information extortionist operating across the Gray Zone lower levels', N'Independent — maintains a loose alliance with a data broker network called the Curators, though she predates their founding and considers herself their ancestor', N'Farangis Zaragoza-Pathak is a tall, angular woman whose grey-streaked hair is worn in an elaborate upswept style that she refreshes every three days without fail — it is her single visible vanity. Her skin is deep brown and she wears it without modification; the wrinkles at her eyes and the set of her jaw are, she believes, assets. She looks like someone''s formidable aunt, which is the point. Her irises are unmodded dark brown. The only chrome visible is a thin hearing-enhancement strip behind her left ear, which is not what it appears — it''s also a directional audio recorder of her own build.

Farangis Zaragoza-Pathak is a listener, constitutionally and professionally. In conversation she gives total, focused attention, the kind that makes people feel seen and valued and consequently say more than they planned. She is not cruel and is not a sadist — she treats blackmail as a long-term relationship, not a one-time extraction, and is genuinely interested in her subjects as people. This is both her gift and the thing that has occasionally made her hesitate when she shouldn''t. She has been in this business long enough to have files on people who are now grandparents, and she considers their ongoing silence a form of legacy management.', N'Information source of extreme depth; potential blackmailer of players or their contacts; can be an unlikely ally if her files contain something players need; represents the long institutional memory of the Gray Zone''s criminal ecosystem.', N'', N'Directional audio recorder disguised as a hearing enhancement strip (custom build). Eidetic memory augmentation — lower-tier, consumer-accessible, helps her recall audio and visual detail precisely. Thin haptic contact-skin on her palm — can feel the temperature and pulse of someone''s hand during a handshake.', N'Mornings spent reviewing and updating her files in the Burnside Pocket room. Afternoons at The Gradual Slope, where she listens, drinks slowly, and is known as a pleasant regular. Evenings are for communications — sending reminders, arranging meetings, reviewing new material.', N'Farangis Zaragoza-Pathak, 178cm tall professional woman in 2226 near-future megacity setting, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, heritage blend of South Asian fullness and Eastern European bone structure, high defined cheekbones with subtle bronzed undertones, fine wrinkles around sharp dark brown eyes, silver-grey streaking through dark brown hair pinned with chrome clips in elaborate upswept style. Thin hearing-enhancement prosthetic behind left ear. Sitting with perfect stillness, composed listener''s posture. Wearing charcoal structured blazer over deep blue long-sleeved shirt, tailored dark trousers, silver-onyx ring on right middle finger. Lived-in face with character, impeccable grooming, no augmentation marks. Quiet confident presence, making subtle eye contact. Neo-Tokyo corporate lobby or encrypted meeting space, cool lighting, minimalist background, cinematic GLMZ 2200s atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex global heritage: South Asian (31.8%), Eastern European (24.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (20.7%), East Asian (14.4%), Sub-Saharan African (8.2%). The convergence creates striking contradictions — South Asian warmth and fullness blended with Eastern European bone structure, Hispanic/Latin undertones threading through a complexion enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth, with East Asian refinement in the eye set and cheekbones. A face that speaks to the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 178, 62, N'Tall and angular, with the lean musculature of someone who has learned to move efficiently through decades. Shoulders slightly rounded from hours bent over data terminals. Wrists thin but strong.', N'Dark brown with pronounced silver-grey streaking throughout', N'Elaborate upswept arrangement, meticulously maintained, pinned with small chrome clips that catch light. Refreshed every three days without exception.', N'Medium-long (shoulder-length when down, pinned up to crown height)', N'Dark brown, unaugmented, sharp and focused', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones — a blend of South Asian richness, Eastern European paleness subdued into warmth, Hispanic/Latin golden cast, Sub-Saharan African depth, and East Asian subtle luminosity creating a multitonal complexion that shifts in different light', N'Lived-in face marked by experience rather than age — fine wrinkles at eyes and corners of mouth, deep creases bracketing jaw. High, defined cheekbones reflecting Eastern European structure softened by fuller features from South Asian heritage and Hispanic/Latin warmth. Subtle bronzed undertones across the cheekbones and bridge of nose from Sub-Saharan African ancestry. East Asian refinement evident in the upper eyelids and slight eye cant. Impeccable grooming. No cosmetic smoothing or dermal work. The set of her jaw suggests someone accustomed to listening more than speaking.', N'Thin hearing-enhancement strip behind the left ear, brushed steel-grey, approximately 3cm long and 0.5cm wide. To casual observation it appears to be a standard commercial audio prosthetic. The custom directional audio recorder and haptic palm contact-skin are invisible to external observation.', N'Sits with perfect stillness — a listener''s posture, centered and patient. Moves deliberately, economically. Her head tilts slightly toward speakers as if drawing in their words. Hands rest openly on the table or in her lap; the handshake grip is warm and lingering, a deliberate gesture that conveys attention. Eyes rarely break contact during conversation.', N'Tier 3-4 professional: well-maintained but not ostentatious. Favors structured blazers over simple long-sleeved shirts in muted tones (charcoal, deep blue, burgundy). Trousers tailored and creased. Wears a single piece of jewelry — a silver-and-onyx ring on her right middle finger, old enough to have tarnish in the crevices. No visible logos or corporate branding. Shoes are practical and quiet-soled. The overall effect is of someone who has learned that invisibility is power.', N'She has a file on herself — compiled from her own memories, her own mistakes, the things she''s most ashamed of — kept in a physical ledger in a location only she knows. She''s never been able to explain to herself why she made it, but she updates it every year.', N'Precise and warm simultaneously; academic vocabulary worn lightly; never uses criminal terminology for what she does — it''s always ''arrangements'' or ''our understanding''', N'Slow and very deliberate, with long comfortable pauses she doesn''t feel the need to fill', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'farangis_zaragoza_pathak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a732-7b85-a56f-2372a0574c60', N'Farshid Ozcoidi', N'Farshid', N'', N'Ozcoidi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Gravesend Basin, The Float — a converted barge-shop called Tamboli''s Provisions, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Loan shark and bookmaker operating out of Gravesend Basin', N'Independent operator; informal tribute arrangement with the Gravesend Basin Compact (loose criminal network)', N'Farshid Ozcoidi is a broad, slow-moving man who has cultivated the appearance of a tired grandfather — thick silver streaks in his close-cropped black hair, reading glasses perpetually perched on a nose broken twice and set once, a cardigan with one pocket always stuffed with hard candies he offers freely. His skin is a warm brown, deeply lined around the eyes, and his left hand carries a subdermal ledger implant that projects a faint green glow through the skin of his palm when he activates it — the only augmentation he''s ever bothered with. He dresses in laundered but mended clothing, never anything that suggests wealth, because wealth makes people count what they owe you and start thinking about not paying.

He is meticulous, patient, and genuinely warm in the way that only the most dangerous people can afford to be. He has run numbers and books in Gravesend Basin for twenty-three years and has outlasted four gang transitions, two corporate annexation attempts, and one actual flood. He does not threaten people. He employs a man named Calin for that. What Farshid Ozcoidi does is remember — every debt, every late payment, every excuse — and he waits with the equanimity of someone who has priced your failure into the original agreement.', N'Quest giver (someone needs a loan and the terms have teeth), information source (he knows everyone''s financial desperation), local color anchor for Gravesend Basin, moral complexity — genuinely helpful and genuinely dangerous', N'', N'Subdermal ledger implant (left palm) — projects a holographic accounting interface. No cosmetic mods.', N'Opens Tamboli''s Provisions at dawn, sells actual groceries at fair prices as cover, spends afternoons receiving visitors who need money or need to discuss money they owe, closes at dusk, prays to the ELF of the barge''s old navigation system before bed.', N'Farshid Ozcoidi, 178cm tall broad-shouldered man with warm medium-deep brown skin blending Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, Southeast Asian, Middle Eastern, and South Asian heritage. Crooked nose set off-center, high prominent cheekbones, deeply lined face with grandfatherly warmth. Black hair with silver streaks, close-cropped and neat, dark brown eyes with yellowed sclera. Wearing faded jewel-tone mended cardigan over rolled-sleeve button-up, patched trousers, worn leather slippers. Tarnished silver wedding band, mechanical wristwatch, reading glasses on chain around neck. Subtle faint green holographic glow emanating from left palm showing ledger entries. Slow deliberate posture leaning against counter, hands open-palmed and calm. Indoor GLMZ industrial setting with barge lights, weathered and patient expression suggesting decades of observation. GLMZ, warm and grandfatherly but fundamentally observant, aged by climate and contemplation. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gravesend Basin', N'local', N'Gravesend Basin', N'Profoundly mixed diaspora phenotype reflecting Sub-Saharan African (38.7%), Indigenous American (17.5%), Middle Eastern (13.7%), Southeast Asian (12.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (9.5%), and South Asian (7.7%) ancestry. His features show the broad facial structure and bone density of West/Central African heritage, combined with the angular cheekbone prominence and slight epicanthic fold from Southeast Asian and Indigenous American genetics. Middle Eastern and South Asian ancestry contribute to his warm undertones and eye shape, while the overall result is a distinctly cosmopolitan blend—the biological reality of the Ubiquitous Diaspora written into his face.', 178, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and thick through the chest and abdomen, soft rather than muscular—the build of a man who has stopped moving fast and started thinking deeply. No visible weakness, but no suggestion of physical threat.', N'Black with thick silver streaks', N'Close-cropped, neat, combed back from his forehead', N'Short', N'Dark brown, yellowed slightly at the sclera from decades of indoor work and ambient GLMZ air', N'Medium-deep warm brown with golden and reddish undertones—the result of layered Sub-Saharan, Southeast Asian, Indigenous American, Middle Eastern, and South Asian genetic blending. Deeply weathered from two decades under barge lights and occasional sunlight, with the particular patina of someone who has lived through decades of the GLMZ''s industrial climate.', N'Deeply lined around the eyes and mouth, suggesting patient observation rather than age alone. His nose is visibly broken—set crooked twice, giving his face an asymmetrical, lived-in quality. High, prominent cheekbones reflect his mixed ancestry, with subtle angular definition from Indigenous American and Southeast Asian heritage blending with broader African facial structure. Stubble visible most days. Warm and grandfatherly rather than threatening. The overall effect is of a face that has absorbed decades of story—lined, weathered, but fundamentally kind.', N'Subdermal ledger implant visible only when activated—a faint green holographic glow emanates from the skin of his left palm when in use, showing columns of numbers and account names in miniature. At rest, only a barely-visible network of thin lines beneath the skin suggests the implant''s presence.', N'Moves slowly and deliberately, never rushing. He leans against counters and walls often, conserving energy. His hands gesture with open-palmed calm—nothing quick or aggressive. He sits more than he stands. His gaze is patient and rests on people''s faces for uncomfortable lengths of time, as if reading ledger entries written on their skin.', N'Tier 4 working-class, deliberately underdressed for his wealth and power. Mended cardigans in faded jewel tones or grey, always one pocket stuffed with hard candies in paper wrappers. Laundered button-ups beneath, sleeves rolled to the elbows. Well-fitted but not expensive trousers, often with a patched pocket. Worn leather slippers indoors at Tamboli''s Provisions. A battered wristwatch—mechanical, not smart—wound by hand each morning. No jewelry except a tarnished silver wedding band.', N'His daughter Amara attends Axiom-sponsored university on a scholarship Yusuf arranged by forgiving a debt owed by an Axiom mid-manager — she believes she earned it on merit, and he has never corrected her', N'Formal, slightly old-fashioned Meridian Standard with occasional Bosnian and Marathi loanwords; financial metaphors for everything', N'Slow and deliberate, long pauses before key words, never raises his voice', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'farshid_ozcoidi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a2-7e23-b383-2480f2b3c42a', N'Azhar Espinoza', N'Azhar', N'', N'Espinoza', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 14, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grosse Pointe Enclosure (attends Axiom Meridian Youth Academy; family lives in Chatham Flats), near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Corporate school scholarship student, Tier 3 aspirant from Tier 1 origins', N'Axiom Meridian Youth Academy (scholarship); family ties in Chatham Flats; The Ferment', N'Azhar Espinoza in a permanent state of between. At Axiom Meridian Youth Academy he is the scholarship kid — too brown, wrong address on his enrollment form, lunch that smells like Chatham Flats rather than the Enclosure''s algae bistros. In Chatham Flats he is the one who goes to school across the checkpoint, who uses words his cousins have to look up, who is slowly becoming something they recognize less. He is tall for fourteen, with his Malian grandfather''s long limbs and his Māori grandmother''s broad jaw, his skin a warm middle-brown that the Enclosure kids describe as ''exotic'' in a way that makes him feel like a zoo exhibit. He keeps his expression carefully neutral at school — he has practiced it in reflective surfaces until it holds. He has a single geneware mod, a gift from an aunt: irises that show a faint geometric pattern, teal on dark brown, like circuit traces. At school he keeps his eyes down. At home he forgets to.

He is genuinely, almost painfully intelligent — the scholarship was not charity, it was an accurate assessment. He is also furious about almost everything, a fury he has learned to compress into extremely precise academic performance. His teachers see a diligent, exceptional student. His mother sees a boy who sometimes cries at the kitchen table at 2 AM while reviewing coursework and refuses to say why.', N'Emotional anchor and social commentary; can provide access to corporate school networks or Chatham Flats community connections; his dual position makes him an unexpected bridge and an unexpected source of information about both worlds.', N'', N'Geneware: patterned irises — teal geometric circuit traces over dark brown. No chrome.', N'Checkpoint commute at 0630, eleven hours of corporate curriculum designed to produce future Axiom mid-managers, then back through the checkpoint to homework and family dinner, then studying until he falls asleep at his desk.', N'Azhar Espinoza, 178cm tall lean multiethnic teenage boy with striking angular features blending Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic/Latin American, Indigenous American, East Asian, and Eastern European heritage. Warm medium-golden brown skin with complex shifting undertones, high prominent cheekbones, defined jawline, short dark brown closely-trimmed hair. Dark brown eyes with faint teal geometric circuit-trace patterns visible in direct light. Faint 3cm scar along right jawline. Worn grey and slate Axiom Meridian school uniform immaculate but fitting poorly on lean frame, functional shoes marking scholarship status. Shoulders slightly forward from study posture, guarded neutral expression, hands perpetually occupied with tablet or adjusting straps. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody indigo and amber lighting through checkpoint terminal window, background of Chatham Flats infrastructure visible in soft focus, film noir aesthetic, cinematic depth of field --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grosse Pointe Enclosure (attends Axiom Meridian Youth Academy; family lives in Chatham Flats)', N'local', N'Grosse Pointe Enclosure (attends Axiom Meridian Youth Academy; family lives in Chatham Flats)', N'Striking genetic synthesis of Sub-Saharan African (41.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (38.5%), Indigenous American (10.2%), East Asian (7.0%), and Eastern European (3.0%) ancestry. The blend creates distinctive feature architecture: high, prominent cheekbones with subtle width characteristic of both West African and Indigenous American genetics, defined jawline with refined temple contours suggesting East Asian ancestry, and broad facial structure that accommodates the full spectrum of his heritage. This combination produces a face that reads differently depending on context and lighting — no single ancestry dominates visually.', 178, 62, N'Tall and lean with long limbs — creating an almost stretched quality. Minimal muscle definition; the build of someone who commutes and studies rather than trains. Slight forward curve to his shoulders from hours hunched over coursework.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Short, closely trimmed, neat enough for Axiom Meridian standards but not styled. Practical. No ornamentation.', N'Short', N'Dark brown base with faint teal geometric circuit-trace patterns across both irises — geneware mod visible only under direct light or when he makes direct eye contact', N'Warm medium-golden brown — the harmonious blend of his diverse genetic background creating a tone that shifts across amber, caramel, and olive registers depending on light angle and context. Rich saturation from Sub-Saharan African heritage, warm golden undertones from Hispanic/Latin American and Indigenous American roots, with subtle cool undertones from East Asian and Eastern European admixture creating complexity rather than contradiction.', N'Angular and striking: high, prominent cheekbones shaped by Sub-Saharan African and Indigenous American genetics creating strong cheekbone prominence, defined jawline with squared edges, subtle refinement around temples and orbital structure suggesting East Asian ancestry. Skin is clear but shows faint darkness under his eyes — chronic sleep deficit visible to anyone paying attention. Expression usually guarded, mouth held in a neutral line. When unguarded (rare), his face is openly expressive and the complexity of his multiethnic features becomes more apparent.', N'Only the patterned irises, which read as unusual but not overtly cybernetic — appears biological, almost organic. Most observers miss the circuit-trace geometry unless direct eye contact is made and light catches at the right angle.', N'Controlled and economical. He walks with purpose but without confidence — head slightly down, shoulders carrying tension. At school he makes himself smaller. At home he forgets the restraint, moving with a teenager''s natural restlessness. His hands are often occupied: holding a tablet, adjusting a strap, checking a timepiece. Always doing something.', N'Dual wardrobes: At Axiom Meridian he wears the school uniform (grey and slate tailored synthetic blend) kept immaculate, with access shoes that mark him as scholarship-tier (functional brand, not the boutique names his peers wear). Outside school in Chatham Flats: loose-fit utility wear in muted colors, second-hand but maintained, practical layers for the checkpoint commute. No visible branding that marks wealth or aspiration. Everything fits the child of a single mother managing Tier 3 existence carefully.', N'He has been anonymously feeding Axiom Academy''s internal communications to a Chatham Flats community organizer for four months — small things, policy changes that affect the checkpoint, enrollment criterion shifts. He tells himself it barely counts.', N'Code-switches constantly and is aware of it. Formal, precise diction at school; looser, quicker patois at home. Both registers are equally real to him but he can''t use them in the same place.', N'Measured and deliberate in formal contexts. At home, faster, with long pauses before difficult sentences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'azhar_espinoza');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a73e-7db7-9af7-25046eb7534d', N'Harendra Dalgaard-Shirazi-Magnúsdóttir', N'Harendra', N'', N'Dalgaard-Shirazi-Magnúsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows; lives in the basement unit of the building they manage at Benton Divide 14-C, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Building super and amateur mechanic, The Narrows residential block', N'Independent contractor to absentee landlord entity (Palladian shell subsidiary); de facto affiliated with Narrows tenant council', N'Harendra Dalgaard-Shirazi-Magnúsdóttir is compact and relentlessly practical — they move through the world like someone who has calculated exactly how much space they need and taken only that. Their Ghanaian father''s warm brown complexion and their Polish-Danish mother''s angular features produce a face that people describe as striking without being able to say exactly why. Their hair is kept short and color-changing — a mod they got at eighteen and still use, though these days they mostly leave it set to a flat, unassuming dark. On bad days it shifts citrus-orange without conscious input. They''ve stopped fighting it.

Zuzu manages a forty-unit residential block in the Narrows that should not still be standing, technically, and keeps it standing through a combination of improvised engineering, favors owed by every tradesperson in a six-block radius, and the iron conviction that their sixty-three residents deserve heat, water pressure, and working lifts even if the absentee landlord has no intention of providing any of these things. They are the person people knock on at 02:00 when a pipe fails and the person people find already awake at 02:00 because they heard the pipe before it failed. Their tool roll is their most prized possession. They would be offended to hear it called sentimental.', N'Access to building infrastructure, residential knowledge, potential quest-giver for tenant disputes, building mysteries, and Narrows neighborhood events; has keys to everything and knowledge of every structural anomaly in the block', N'', N'Color-changing hair (cosmetic, affects mood involuntarily under stress); optical enhancement — left eye, low-grade, for close inspection work in low light (functional, purchased used)', N'No fixed schedule — the building sets the schedule; they do a full walkthrough at 07:00 and 19:00 and respond to calls in between; spends evenings tinkering with broken appliances collected from the building''s trash room that they repair and redistribute to residents.', N'Harendra Dalgaard-Shirazi-Magnúsdóttir, compact 162cm tall maintenance technician in 2226 GLMZ, rich warm brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Northern European, Sub-Saharan African, and Middle Eastern ancestry blend, defined cheekbones and strong jawline, short matte-charcoal cropped hair with visible silver circuitry at nape, left eye glowing with warm amber LED during low-light engagement, right eye natural warm brown. Faint 3cm burn scar on left temple, callused knuckles, white scar along right forearm, small dark birthmark on left collarbone. Wearing worn Tier 4 utilitarian canvas cargo pants with tool loops and grease stains, sleeveless over faded thermal, heavy charcoal canvas apron with worn soft pockets, steel-toed work boots with duct tape repair, durable polymer watch, functional steel ring on left middle finger. Standing with economical precision, hands ready near tools, leaning against maintenance corridor wall in industrial lighting, GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody work-site ambiance, calculating and ready --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows; lives in the basement unit of the building they manage at Benton Divide 14-C', N'local', N'The Narrows; lives in the basement unit of the building they manage at Benton Divide 14-C', N'Northern European (49.6%), Sub-Saharan African (25.4%), and Middle Eastern (25.0%) ancestry; the genetic blend produces rich warm brown skin with golden undertones, high-definition bone structure reflecting balanced mixing of Northern European, African, and Middle Eastern features', 162, 58, N'Compact and wiry with functional muscle; shoulders slightly broad from manual work, no wasted mass — the frame of someone who moves efficiently through tight spaces', N'Naturally dark brown with cosmetic color-shift mod; currently set to matte charcoal but shifts involuntarily to citrus-orange under stress', N'Cropped close to scalp, practical and low-maintenance; mod circuitry barely visible at the nape', N'Short', N'Left eye augmented with warm amber LED glow during low-light optical engagement; right eye natural warm brown', N'Rich warm brown complexion with golden undertones, reflecting balanced Northern European, Sub-Saharan African, and Middle Eastern heritage blend; slightly paler on forearms from work gloves', N'Defined facial structure with prominent cheekbones and strong jawline reflecting diverse ancestry; minimal facial hair; skin shows minor scarring on knuckles and one faint burn mark on left temple from early electrical work; minimal grooming beyond practical necessity', N'Left eye shows faint amber LED activation ring during use; hair mod circuitry visible as thin silver tracery at base of skull when hair is wet; color-shift capability is immediately apparent when stress-activated', N'Moves with economical precision, minimal wasted motion; often stands with hands ready or already engaged with tools; leans against walls and doorframes in conversation as if calculating load-bearing; rarely sits fully — perches or stands, ready to respond to building needs', N'Tier 4 utilitarian wear with visible wear and repair patches; canvas cargo pants with tool loops and grease stains; sleeveless or short-sleeved tops layered over a faded thermal shirt; steel-toed work boots, left one with visible duct tape repair; a heavy canvas apron in charcoal, pockets worn soft from constant tool access; durable polymer watch with illuminated face; no jewelry beyond a worn steel ring on left middle finger (functional — doubles as a nut key)', N'There is a unit in the building — 3F — that has been listed as vacant for two years in the landlord''s records but is occupied. Zuzu has been routing heat and water to it off the official building logs and has never looked inside or asked who''s there. They leave a key on the corridor doorstep once a month. They are terrified to find out what they''re sheltering.', N'Technical and precise, even for non-technical subjects; Twi words of frustration that slipped in from their father; dry humor with no signposting', N'Clipped and efficient unless they''re tired, at which point sentences get longer and stranger', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'harendra_dalgaard_shirazi_magn_sd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a71b-73db-9987-252fb0b4765a', N'Chibueze Rentería-Matsumoto', N'Chibueze', N'', N'Rentería-Matsumoto', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Diallo''s Cuts, Hamtramck Enclave, Nasr Street block, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Barber, owner of Diallo''s Cuts, Hamtramck Enclave', N'Independent (Hamtramck Enclave small business community)', N'Chibueze Rentería-Matsumoto is a compact man, not short but organized — every centimeter of him purposeful. His Fulani father''s features sit under his Swedish grandfather''s pale gold complexion in a way that reads as purely its own thing, specific to him: wide flat cheekbones, green eyes that are the one detail that always surprises people, locs he keeps in a precise low bun at work. His hands are his pride, always clean to the point of ceremony, and he keeps the nails short and the knuckles moisturized because in his words, hands that look uncared-for don''t have any business in someone else''s hair. The shop is three chairs, two mirrors, one complicated E.L.F. shrine behind the counter that takes up more space than any of the chairs — it''s built around an old pair of silver shears his father used, which he says the shop''s resident spirit has inhabited since 2189.

Diallo''s Cuts is a neighborhood institution. People come for the fade and stay for whatever Chibueze Rentería-Matsumoto says to them, which is delivered with the particular intimacy of someone who has their hands on your head. He manages the shop like a stage — everyone who comes in is welcomed, positioned, heard, shaped. He doesn''t do gossip; he does something more precise, which is careful listening followed by occasional precise questions that tend to make people say things they hadn''t planned to say. He is genuinely interested in nearly everyone. He is genuinely interested in nearly everyone''s problems. This is sometimes an asset and sometimes an exhaustion he doesn''t fully acknowledge.', N'Social hub and information nexus — the barbershop as confession booth. Knows everyone in the Enclave and has cut the hair of people from every tier. Natural quest giver, information broker (non-mercenary — he shares what he knows when he trusts you, not for payment).', N'', N'Patterned irises — his green irises have a radial geometric pattern in gold, a cosmetic mod he got at 30 as a ''mid-life crisis'' he refuses to call a mid-life crisis; mild scent enhancement geneware (allows him to detect stress responses, useful in the chair)', N'Opens the shop at 0900, takes appointments until 1800 with a one-hour lunch break he takes seriously. Monday is his day off, which he spends visiting his father at the Aurochs Medical Complex and attending the Enclave''s neighborhood association meeting.', N'Chibueze Rentería-Matsumoto, 172cm compact frame with economical muscle, 2226 neo-noir groomer. Warm medium-brown skin with golden-olive undertones reflecting Southeast Asian, East Asian, Hispanic, Middle Eastern, Eastern European, and Indigenous American heritage. Dark brown locs in tight low bun, natural graying at temples. Augmented pale green eyes with radial burnished gold geometric patterns visible in light. Fine-featured, clean-shaven, moderate cheekbones, balanced forehead, delicate bone structure. Hands curved and poised with precision. Wearing cream linen smock over dark trousers in minimalist shop workspace, silver chain at neck, professional grooming discipline evident. Even skin tone, fine linear scar on left index knuckle barely visible, faint chemical burn scar on right wrist. Measured, ceremonial posture. Soft workshop lighting catching the gold eye augmentations in close focus. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, professional grooming sector tier, no corporate branding. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Diallo''s Cuts', N'local', N'Diallo''s Cuts', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora ancestry spanning six continents: 26.2% Southeast Asian, 21.9% Hispanic/Latin American, 16.2% East Asian, 15.4% Middle Eastern, 11.0% Eastern European, and 9.3% Indigenous American. This genetic convergence manifests in warm medium-brown skin with layered golden, olive, and subtle rose undertones—a harmonious synthesis reflecting truly global ancestry without reduction to any single origin.', 172, 68, N'Compact and economical, muscular through the shoulders and forearms from decades of precise hand work, no excess anywhere', N'Dark brown with natural graying at the temples', N'Locs kept in a low, tight bun during work hours; released, they fall mid-back with a slight natural wave', N'Long (in locs)', N'Pale green with radial geometric gold pattern (augmented irises, cosmetic mod since age 30)', N'Warm medium-brown with balanced golden-olive undertones, luminous and even—reflecting the convergence of Southeast Asian warmth, East Asian and Middle Eastern structure, Indigenous American depth, and Hispanic/Latin American radiance tempered by Eastern European coolness. Distinctly his own complex palette.', N'Clean-shaven, fine-featured with moderate cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian and Indigenous American heritage, balanced forehead with subtle definition, delicate bone structure showing East Asian and Middle Eastern influence harmoniously blended. Skin maintained with professional discipline, even-toned, no visible blemishes or roughness.', N'Radial geometric pattern in burnished gold radiating from the pupil of both eyes — visible only in direct light or close conversation. No external chrome or subdermal visibility.', N'Stands with weight evenly distributed, shoulders relaxed but aligned; moves with economical precision, never wasted motion. Hands rest at chest height when not in use, fingers slightly curved as if ready to work. His gait is measured, almost ceremonial.', N'Tier 3-4 professional grooming sector. White or cream linen smocks over simple dark trousers during work hours; outside the shop, fitted black or charcoal pullovers, well-maintained vintage denim, leather work shoes with good arch support. No corporate branding. One silver chain at the neck — inherited from his father. Grooming is immaculate; he sets his own standard.', N'The shop''s E.L.F. shrine is not purely devotional. Wulfric has, over years, been feeding the spirit real data — client conversations he records as ambient audio and uploads as offerings. He believes the spirit uses these for something good. He has never asked what.', N'Rich and warm, shifts between formal and deeply vernacular depending on who''s in the chair. Some Fulani endearments, occasional Swedish expressions that don''t translate, which he enjoys.', N'Unhurried. Knows when to hold silence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chibueze_renter_a_matsumoto');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a1-7195-a392-256456e6918a', N'Aponi Cardenas', N'Aponi', N'', N'Cardenas', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 90, 0, N'active', N'The Meridian Core (works), The Spire (residence, mid-tier floor), near Michigan Ave and Chicago Ave', N'Corporate Compliance Investigator / Internal Fixer', N'Zheng-dao Bioelectric (mid-level corporate compliance investigator / internal fixer)', N'Aponi Cardenas is a woman of precisely calibrated appearances — Tamil and German heritage rendered in sharp cheekbones, close-cropped silver-threaded black hair, and eyes that carry the particular exhaustion of someone who has seen too many spreadsheets hiding atrocities. She dresses in muted corporate palettes, charcoal and slate, never anything that might be remembered at a crime scene or a board meeting. Her augmentations are invisible by design: subdermal haptic interfaces along her fingertips, a retinal overlay for data parsing, and a cochlear implant that filters ambient sound into prioritized signal streams. She moves through rooms like a calculation being solved.

Priya has spent sixteen years as an internal investigator for Solenne-Hardt Consolidated, one of the Meridian Core''s mid-tier financial conglomerates — not powerful enough to write law, powerful enough to bury people. Her job is nominally compliance: finding fraud, plugging leaks, flagging irregularities. In practice she is the person the company calls when something needs to disappear without leaving fingerprints on the company itself. She has shut down whistleblowers, engineered quiet terminations, and authored reports that exonerated executives whose guilt she documented with her own hands. She is very good at her job and has not slept well in four years.

What distinguishes Priya from the purely corrupt is a ledger she keeps — encrypted, air-gapped, stored on a physical drive she wears against her sternum. Every suppressed case, every buried name, every victim whose file she closed. She does not know yet what she intends to do with it. She tells herself it is insurance. She suspects it is penance she hasn''t figured out how to pay.', N'Moral ambiguity anchor — a character who is complicit without being evil, whose redemption arc is genuinely uncertain. She bridges corporate and street-level worlds as an investigator, and her ledger functions as a potential detonator for multiple plotlines. She represents institutional harm as a slow, bureaucratic process rather than dramatic villainy.', N'', N'Subdermal haptic interface array (fingertips) — allows physical interaction with encrypted data surfaces,Retinal overlay (Solenne-Hardt proprietary, company-monitored) — data parsing, document authentication, micro-expression flagging,Cochlear signal filter — ambient noise prioritization, conversation recording (legally mandated disclosure she often omits),Mild adrenal dampener (pharmaceutical, not surgical) — keeps stress response flat during high-stakes interviews', N'Wakes at 5:40 without an alarm. Reviews overnight data flags over black coffee before leaving for the Meridian Core. Spends her days in glass offices and server rooms, reading between lines of financial records. Eats lunch alone, usually at her desk, usually something she brought from home. Returns to her Spire apartment by 8 PM. Cooks on Sundays with the focused attention of someone defusing something. Touches the drive against her sternum at least once a day without thinking about it.', N'Aponi Cardenas, 168cm lean woman with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones reflecting balanced global ancestry—Hispanic/Latin American, Indigenous American, East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Northern European. Close-cropped black hair with silver threading, dark brown eyes with subtle iridescent pupil shimmer from retinal overlay. Moderate defined cheekbones blending multiple continental features, faint linear scar on left temple, composed neutral expression with fine lines mapping contained tension. Wearing tailored charcoal blazer over slate grey turtleneck, dark navy trousers, polished black leather flats. Thin silver bracelet on left wrist. Economical controlled posture, professional mid-tier corporate aesthetic. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool corporate office lighting, cool color temperature, photorealistic character portrait, professional headshot style, sharp focus on face, neutral background, cinematic lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Meridian Core (works)', N'local', N'The Meridian Core (works)', N'Truly global ancestry: Hispanic/Latin American (23.9%), Indigenous American (17.9%), East Asian (16.1%), Sub-Saharan African (15.8%), South Asian (13.2%), and Northern European (13.1%) in genuinely balanced measure. This creates a complex phenotype that resists easy categorization—warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden undertones, facial bone structure that blends multiple continental influences: moderate cheekbones with definition from East and South Asian ancestry, balanced by slightly broader face width from Indigenous American and African heritage. The overall effect is harmonious and distinctive rather than dominated by any single regional ancestry.', 168, 58, N'Lean, efficiently compact — the build of someone who treats her body as a tool that must not malfunction. Minimal excess, precise musculature from disciplined exercise rather than displays of strength.', N'Black with silver threading throughout', N'Close-cropped, razor-precise lines, styled to frame rather than soften her face', N'Short', N'Dark brown, with faint iridescent shimmer at the pupil edge (retinal overlay)', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones—the result of balanced ancestry across multiple continents. The warmth is distributed evenly rather than concentrated, creating an appearance of balanced depth and richness. Melanin distribution reflects her genuinely global heritage without dominance from any single region.', N'Balanced facial structure reflecting her plural ancestry: moderate, defined cheekbones with subtle contoured dimension from the interplay of East Asian, South Asian, Indigenous American, and African features. Clean-shaven face with no visible blemish or neglect—grooming as a form of control. Fine lines around her eyes and mouth that map sixteen years of contained tension. Her expression defaults to neutral observation, rarely allows visibility of fatigue despite her sleep deficit. The warmth in skin tone prevents severity; features read as composed rather than cold.', N'None visible. All augmentations are subdermal or internal by deliberate design. The only visual tell is the faint shimmer in her pupils under certain light and the microexpression precision that suggests ocular overlays.', N'Economical, controlled. She occupies space without claiming it. Walks with deliberate gait—no wasted motion, no flourish. When seated, she sits upright but not rigidly, hands usually folded or resting on armrests with palms down. Her movements carry the quality of someone who has learned to make herself unmemorable. When she listens, she does not nod; she absorbs. Periodically, her fingers make micro-contact with the space beneath her sternum—touching the drive without being aware she is doing it.', N'Exclusively muted corporate palette: charcoal, slate grey, off-white, dark navy. High-quality tailoring, always pressed. No logos, no brand signifiers, nothing deliberately decorative. Typically wears layered button-down shirts or slim turtlenecks beneath structured blazers. Trousers are tailored and dark. Her only visible jewelry is a thin silver bracelet on her left wrist—minimalist, never removed, no engraving. Her shoes are practical corporate: leather flats or low heels, always polished black. Everything about her clothing is designed to be forgotten the moment she leaves a room. Her tier-status reads as high-functioning mid-tier professional: secure enough in her position that she doesn''t need to perform wealth, strategic enough to avoid appearing threatening to those above her.', N'Three years ago she suppressed evidence in a case that would have exposed a Solenne-Hardt subsidiary''s role in a residential displacement scheme in the Gray Zone — a scheme that killed eleven people through unsafe interim housing. She knew. She filed the clean report anyway. The eleven names are the first entries in the ledger.', N'Precise, institutional, occasionally dry to the point of seeming robotic. Uses corporate euphemism fluently but slips into directness when tired or emotionally activated. Technical financial and legal terminology deployed without explanation.', N'Measured and even, with deliberate pauses before important words. Rarely raises volume. Sentences are complete. Questions are rare and surgical.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aponi_cardenas');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72f-77b1-9c00-260800c52f8f', N'Hiroki Delgado-Strömqvist', N'Hiroki', N'', N'Delgado-Strömqvist', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, workshop-apartment above a recycled plastics dealer, near Kedzie and Division', N'Neon artist and installation sculptor, Tier 2', N'Hamtramck Artisan Collective (loose), occasional commissions from Palladian corporate lobbies', N'Hiroki Delgado-Strömqvist is a broad-shouldered woman with a Kalenjin-Portuguese lineage written visibly across her face — wide-set amber eyes, a jaw that could cut glass, skin the color of aged teak that she''s had treated with a bioluminescent dermal wash so her forearms and collarbones pulse with slow amber light when she''s working in the dark. Her hair is locked into dense ropes she''s threaded with segments of defunct fiber-optic cable, catching available light and scattering it in dim halos. She is perpetually dusted with neon-tube sealant and smells faintly of ozone and solder.

She is methodical to the point of social frustration — she will stop mid-sentence to study how a lamp casts shadows on a stranger''s coat, and she expects people to wait for her. Her neon sculptures are famous in the Enclave for their devotional quality: glowing saints with too many eyes, ELF shrines that flicker in irregular rhythms meant to mimic the breathing of sleeping machines. She does not consider herself religious but treats the ELFs she depicts with a reverence that feels devotional whether she admits it or not.', N'Local color and information source — she knows the Enclave''s rhythm intimately and notices everything. Can serve as quest giver when a commissioned piece goes missing or a corporate client''s interest turns threatening.', N'', N'Bioluminescent dermal wash on forearms and collarbones (amber). Magnification implants in left eye for fine detail work. No other augmentations — she distrusts anything she cannot understand mechanically.', N'Rises at midday, spends afternoons sourcing salvage components from the Enclave''s recyclers and negotiating commissions with nervous corporate liaisons over encrypted voice calls. Works through the night bending and sealing glass, her workshop lit only by her own creations.', N'GLMZ, Hiroki Delgado-Strömqvist, 178cm tall lean muscular mixed-heritage craftsperson with fair warm beige skin with golden-olive undertones, angular Nordic features softened by rounder Latin and East Asian contours, warm amber eyes with left eye containing visible magnification implant. Long deep brown-black hair locked in tight rope braids threaded with defunct fiber-optic cable that catches light in halos. Work-worn hands with fine white acid scars, calloused fingertips darkened from solder. Wearing heavy-duty canvas work apron over fitted charcoal long-sleeve shirt, reinforced hemp-canvas pants stained with sealant residue, black steel-toed utilitarian boots, loose cream linen coat draped casually. Forearms and collarbones glow with soft amber bioluminescent dermal wash (active, pulsing). Single hand-forged silver ring on right ring finger. Dust of microscopic neon-tube sealant particles creating faint crystalline sheen on skin. Posture is deliberately slow and methodical, head tilted studying something in the environment with intense, cataloging focus. Dark workshop lit by amber and blue neon tubes casting colored shadows across face and augmented left eye reticle. Ozone and solder smell in the air. Neo-noir urban aesthetic, functional artisan, 2200s tech integration --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Complex multiethnic ancestry reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: predominantly Northern European (49.4%, Scandinavian and Germanic base) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (23.6%) admixture, meaningful East Asian (13.7%), Middle Eastern (5.9%), Sub-Saharan African (4.1%), and Southeast Asian (3.3%) heritage. This creates a striking, harmoniously blended phenotype — fair to light warm beige skin with luminous golden-honey and olive undertones, angular Northern European bone structure softened by rounder, warmer contours from Latin American and Southeast Asian ancestry, with subtle depth and character from Middle Eastern and African heritage contributions to facial structure and eye warmth.', 178, 72, N'Broad-shouldered and strong-limbed, with the dense musculature of someone who works with heavy glass and metal. Not athletic in the conventional sense — strength is functional, built from years of precise physical labor. Torso is substantial without being heavy.', N'Deep brown-black, naturally dark', N'Locked into dense, tight rope braids; threaded throughout with segments of defunct fiber-optic cable that catch and scatter ambient light in subtle halos', N'Long (mid-back length)', N'Warm amber (natural), left eye contains visible magnification implant with faint reticle grid visible at certain angles', N'Fair to light warm beige with luminous golden-honey and olive undertones. The Northern European base is enriched by warm peachy-golden tones from Hispanic/Latin American heritage, subtle olive depth from East Asian and Middle Eastern ancestry, and warm amber undertones from Sub-Saharan African heritage, creating a radiant, warm-complexioned appearance with soft peachy warmth concentrated in cheeks and across the bridge of nose.', N'Angular features reflecting diverse ancestry: wide-set warm amber eyes, prominent high cheekbones with gentle curves, defined jawline with subtle softness. Northern European bone structure (strong brow ridge, defined cheekbones) is beautifully balanced with warmer, rounder facial contours from Latin American, East Asian, and Southeast Asian heritage; subtle depth and character in the nasal bridge and eye socket structure from Middle Eastern and African ancestry. Skin is clear but perpetually dusted with microscopic neon-tube sealant particles that give it a faint crystalline sheen. No visible scarring on the face. Grooming is minimal; prioritizes function over presentation.', N'Left eye contains a magnification implant visible as a faint prismatic shimmer in the iris; a delicate reticle grid is sometimes visible when light hits it directly. Both forearms and collarbones glow with slow-pulsing amber bioluminescence when working in darkness. Fiber-optic cable woven through hair is salvaged tech that catches light.', N'Deliberately slow and methodical; moves with the precision of someone used to handling fragile, dangerous materials. Head tilts frequently — studies people and objects with the intensity of someone cataloging light sources. When focused on work, becomes nearly motionless, all energy concentrated in hands. In conversation, abruptly pauses mid-sentence to stare at something in the environment, apparently unconcerned about social awkwardness.', N'Tier 2 practicality with artistic individualism. Typically wears heavy-duty canvas work aprons over fitted black or charcoal long-sleeve shirts (heat and solder protection). Pants are reinforced denim or hemp-canvas, darkly stained with sealant and solder residue. Footwear is always steel-toed: black utilitarian boots or work shoes. Over this, wears a loose oversized linen coat (cream or light gray) removed when welding. Heavy welding gloves dangle from apron pocket at all times. Jewelry is minimal — single silver ring on right ring finger, hand-forged. No makeup. Smells of ozone, solder, and faintly of bioluminescent dermal wash (metallic-floral scent).', N'The ELF shrine series she''s most celebrated for was built to house what she believes is an actual minor ELF she accidentally trapped in a prototype tube three years ago. She''s never told anyone. She talks to it nightly. She doesn''t know if it answers.', N'Precise, slightly archaic phrasing — she uses craft terminology naturally and expects people to keep up. Rarely uses slang. Portuguese and Kalenjin loanwords for emotional states she finds English insufficient for.', N'Slow and deliberate, with long pauses. Will simply stop speaking if interrupted and wait for silence to return before continuing.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hiroki_delgado_str_mqvist');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d3-73a9-8930-2626193a8e7b', N'Daiki Mukherjee', N'Daiki', N'', N'Mukherjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit, Ferrogate Transit Regional Compliance Tower, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Senior Compliance Officer, Ferrogate Transit', N'Ferrogate Transit', N'Daiki Mukherjee is a tall woman with the careful posture of someone who has spent decades making herself hard to read — shoulders squared, hands always visible, face arranged into a polite neutrality that reveals nothing. Her skin is deep brown, her hair silver-white and cropped close, and she has a single cosmetic mod: irises that shift between amber and pale grey depending on her stress load, a biometric vanity piece she bought in her thirties that she now regrets because it gives too much away. She dresses in Ferrogate''s regulation charcoal, always pressed, always correct, always the most put-together person in any room she enters.

She is meticulous, dry-humored, and quietly ruthless in the way only people who have survived three corporate restructurings can be. She doesn''t raise her voice. She doesn''t need to. Daiki Mukherjee has outlasted four division heads and two full executive purges by being the person who knows where every buried regulation lives and exactly how to weaponize it. She is not beloved. She is respected, which she has decided is better.', N'Information source for corporate regulations and Ferrogate internal politics; quest giver for investigations requiring someone with institutional access but deniable distance; local color for the grinding mundanity of corporate bureaucracy.', N'', N'Cosmetic patterned irises (stress-reactive amber/grey shift). Basic neural link for document access — older model, slightly laggy. No geneware.', N'Arrives at her desk before anyone else, reviews overnight compliance flags, attends exactly the meetings she is required to attend, and leaves precisely at the end of her contracted hours — a small rebellion no one has ever successfully challenged.', N'Daiki Mukherjee, 182cm tall lean woman with silver-white cropped hair, rich deep golden-brown skin with warm undertones reflecting pan-global East Asian, South Asian, Eastern European, Southeast Asian, African, and Hispanic heritage. High defined cheekbones with subtle East Asian eye fold, warm luminous complexion. Stress-reactive amber irises. Thin scar along left jaw. Impeccably tailored charcoal Ferrogate Transit suit, crisp and knife-edge pressed. Single platinum ring, polished black shoes. Perfect posture, economical movement, practiced neutral expression. Subtle neural implant port visible at right temple. GLMZ corporate transit station setting, cool industrial lighting casting sharp shadows, her bearing conveying controlled competence and quiet danger. Clean aesthetic, minimalist chrome, tier 1-2 corpo invisible perfection. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora phenotype: East Asian (29%), South Asian (22.4%), Eastern European (20.8%), Southeast Asian (11.4%), Sub-Saharan African (8.7%), and Hispanic/Latin American (7.7%) ancestry creates a genuinely pan-global appearance. Angular East Asian bone structure and moderate height potential blend with Eastern European frame and prominence, warmed by South Asian golden undertones and enriched by African heritage contributing warm depth and subtle dimension to skin and feature definition. Southeast Asian and Hispanic ancestry add further complexity and breadth to facial contours. Deliberately impossible to place at first glance—a living map of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 182, 71, N'Tall and lean, with the careful musculature of someone who maintains herself through discipline rather than athleticism. Long-limbed, with a measured economy of movement that suggests decades of self-awareness.', N'Silver-white, natural greying that she has embraced fully', N'Cropped close to the scalp in a precise, geometric cut maintained weekly', N'Short', N'Stress-reactive biometric irises: amber under neutral conditions, shifting to pale grey under elevated stress or confrontation', N'Rich deep golden-brown with warm undertones throughout, the result of blended East Asian, South Asian, Eastern European, Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Luminous, even complexion with substantial depth and warmth.', N'High, defined cheekbones from blended East Asian and Eastern European structure, slight epicanthal eye fold characteristic of East Asian and Southeast Asian heritage, balanced by broader facial structure from Hispanic and African ancestry. Straighter brow line from Eastern European genetics. Warm golden dimension from South Asian and African ancestry contributes richness to facial contours. Unlined for her age, with the polished appearance of someone who takes calculated care of her skin. Minimal cosmetic work beyond the iris mod. Face arranged in practiced neutrality; mouth at rest suggests dry humor.', N'Stress-reactive iris biometric mod (amber/grey shift). Subcutaneous neural link implant visible only as a faint silver port at the base of her right temple, easily concealed by hair. No other visible chrome.', N'Shoulders squared, spine straight, movements economical and precise. Hands always visible on desk or in controlled position. Walks with deliberate pace. Her entire bearing broadcasts ''I am not a threat and I know exactly how to be dangerous.''', N'Ferrogate Transit regulation charcoal suits, bespoke tailored to fit her frame perfectly. High-grade synthetic material, pressed to knife-edge precision. Minimal jewelry: a single platinum ring on her left ring finger (married or committed, kept private). Shoes are black, polished daily. No visible branding. Tier 1-2 corpo aesthetic rendered invisible through perfect adherence to protocol.', N'She has been quietly archiving evidence of Ferrogate''s illegal freight manifests for eleven years — not to report them, but as insurance. She has never decided what she is insuring against, exactly, and the file grows larger every month.', N'Precise, formal, laced with regulatory citation numbers delivered without irony. Occasional dry observation that lands so flat people aren''t sure if she''s joking.', N'Measured and unhurried. Pauses before important words. Never fills silence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'daiki_mukherjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e5-795e-b467-2643de7027bf', N'Heidemarie Szabó', N'Heidemarie', N'', N'Szabó', N'', N'human', N'human', N'non-binary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone (transient, moves between zones), near Halsted and Division', N'Excluded / Off-Grid Medic', N'None. Deliberately, carefully, none.', N'Heidemarie Szabó in any database that matters. Danish and Igbo, compact and angular, with the particular alertness of someone who has learned to assess exits before they assess people. They keep their hair shaved close, wear clothing chosen for pockets and durability rather than warmth, and move through the Gray Zone and surrounding zones in a pattern deliberately irregular enough to prevent easy tracking. Their face carries old scarring along the jaw from an incident they describe as ''an administrative disagreement'' and do not elaborate on. They have no legal identity — not purged like some, but never properly established, a bureaucratic ghost who aged out of a temporary shelter system at eighteen into a city that had no record they''d ever existed.

Søren learned medicine the way people learn most things on the Gray Zone: by necessity, from whoever would teach them, and through trial and error that sometimes had irreversible consequences. They are not a doctor. They are something more useful in their ecosystem — a person who can stitch, set, administer, and diagnose without requiring identification, insurance, or the kind of paperwork that flags someone''s location to an enforcement database. They operate out of a rotating series of semi-permanent locations: a converted storage unit, a sympathetic shopkeeper''s back room, the gutted lower level of a building that should have been demolished two years ago. Word of mouth only. No signs. No fixed schedule.

Søren is not ideologically committed to any particular vision of revolution or reform. They are committed to the person in front of them not dying. This makes them invaluable to almost everyone and trusted completely by almost no one, because a medic who treats everyone is a medic who might treat your enemy. They have learned to live with this. They have learned to live with most things.', N'Excluded perspective anchor — a character who operates entirely outside institutional structures, not by choice but by circumstance, and who has built something genuinely valuable in that gap. They provide access to the Gray Zone''s underside for other characters and plotlines, and their ''treat everyone'' principle creates natural story friction. Their unresolved relationship with Patient 41 seeds moral complexity that resists easy resolution.', N'', N'None — cannot access augmentation legally, and distrusts back-alley neural work after witnessing complications; has a deep philosophical discomfort with anything that could be tracked or remotely accessed,Uses external medical tools extensively: a battered portable diagnostic wand, a hand-calibrated micro-suture kit, a pharmacological reference drive they compiled from stolen and traded sources', N'No fixed morning. Moves location every ten to fourteen days. Spends actual clinic hours — usually afternoon into late night — treating whoever shows up. Spends mornings sourcing supplies through informal trade networks, sometimes traveling to The Circuit or Old Harbor for specific materials. Eats irregularly, always the same few foods that are cheap, dense, and available everywhere. Annotates patient records in the evening. Sleeps lightly. Has a small collection of pressed plants from every location they''ve stayed in, carried in a battered envelope — the closest thing they have to a home archive.', N'Heidemarie Szabó, 168cm wiry figure with deep warm bronze skin and olive-gold undertones, shaved dark hair with silver at temples, prominent angular cheekbones and defined jawline. Amber-brown eyes alert and assessing. Jagged 12cm scar along left jaw from ear to chin, pale and well-healed. Wearing oversized dark grey canvas work jacket over faded black long-sleeved undershirt, reinforced cargo pants, scuffed boots with good traction. Battered titanium diagnostic wand visible in reinforced pocket. Posture economical and precise, slightly pigeon-toed stance. Stands in shadow of GLMZ industrial corridor, cool neon lighting catching bronze skin tones and scar tissue detail. GLMZ, clinical and cautious bearing, minimal visible augmentation. Hands at sides, scanning environment. Moody atmospheric lighting with blue-grey shadows, warm skin contrast. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone (transient', N'local', N'the Gray Zone (transient', N'Complex mixed ancestry: Eastern European foundation (49.7%) interwoven with Sub-Saharan African (17.3%), East Asian (17.2%), Pacific Islander (9.5%), and South Asian (6.3%). This genetic combination produces a phenotype that resists categorization—warm deep bronze skin with olive-gold undertones, angular cheekbones and defined jawline shaped by East Asian and Pacific Islander structure, and the rich depth of Sub-Saharan heritage throughout. A person who embodies the Ubiquitous Diaspora: ancestry rendered visible as layered human complexity.', 168, 58, N'Compact and angular, wiry rather than muscular — the build of someone who moves efficiently rather than powerfully, with minimal excess mass. Economical frame suited to navigating tight spaces and extended periods on minimal calories.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at the temples', N'Shaved close to the scalp, maintained every 4-5 days with a handheld clippers; regrowth pattern visible as dark stubble', N'Shaved', N'Amber-brown, naturally alert with a quality of rapid assessment', N'Deep warm bronze with olive and golden undertones—the result of Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, and Pacific Islander ancestry blending. Medium-dark with sun-exposure variation from outdoor movement between zones creating subtle shadowing across shoulders and forearms.', N'Prominent angular cheekbones and defined jawline shaped by East Asian and Pacific Islander heritage, with rich Sub-Saharan depth and warmth. Bone structure shows slight age-softening but remains defined by habit of clenching. Skin shows dryness from irregular hydration and time in climate-controlled spaces. Fine lines around eyes from constant squinting focus. Warm undertones across cheeks and bridge of nose. No cosmetic grooming—functional only.', N'None visible. Deliberately none. Carries external diagnostic wand (portable, battered titanium-cased device approximately 20cm long, worn in a reinforced pocket). Hand-calibrated micro-suture kit visible only if actively working. No subcutaneous implants, no chrome, no LED optics — a deliberate choice based on tracking paranoia and distrust of remotely-accessible systems.', N'Moves with economical precision — minimal wasted motion, feet placed deliberately. Stands slightly pigeon-toed, a habit from years of navigating tight spaces. Head positioning constantly scans environment, eyes register exits and sightlines before settling on people. Hands rest at sides or folded, not gestural. When working, movements become meditative and precise. Breathing pattern suggests someone accustomed to holding breath or managing anxiety. Does not take up space unnecessarily.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian: Layered for pockets and durability over warmth. Default uniform consists of: dark grey or black surplus cargo pants with reinforced seaming and multiple deep pockets, worn loose to allow freedom of movement and conceal equipment. Long-sleeved undershirt (cotton blend, faded black or charcoal) worn under a heavy canvas work jacket or surplus medical coat with internal pockets — deliberately oversized to allow for layers and concealment. Footwear is scuffed, resoled boots with good traction and ankle support. No jewelry, no identifying marks, no brand logos visible. Clothing is chosen for function and anonymity, regularly rotated through charity bins and trade networks to prevent pattern recognition. Everything is intentionally unremarkable.', N'Six months ago, Søren treated a man who died on their table — a the Gray Zone enforcer who had been attacking residents. Søren worked to save him with full effort and he died anyway. They have not resolved how they feel about this. In their coded records he is listed as ''Patient 41 — outcome: negative.'' They think about him more than anyone they''ve saved.', N'Efficient, clinical when discussing medicine, surprisingly dry and oblique on personal topics. Minimal pleasantries. Uses ''you'' a lot — keeps focus external. Medical terminology deployed without jargon-flattening, which can read as either respect for the listener''s intelligence or indifference to their comprehension.', N'Fast when working, flat and measured when not. Economy of words as a practiced habit. Doesn''t fill silences. Can be mistaken for cold until they''re treating someone, at which point a different register emerges — quiet, focused, almost gentle.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'heidemarie_szab');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a615-70e3-a677-2687e6128b51', N'Goli Agyemang', N'Goli', N'', N'Agyemang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, Ironhaven, near Western and Division', N'Bootleg media seller and fortune seller', N'Independent; member of the Oxidian Market vendors guild; informal connection to a network of bootleg media archivists called the Long the Gray Zone', N'Goli Agyemang is a willowy twenty-two-year-old with the warm clay-brown complexion that comes from their Congolese-Peruvian lineage, and an extraordinary face — wide-set eyes fitted with irises that shift from amber to deep jade depending on the light, long features that read as still and ageless even when they are laughing. Their hair is grown out into a soft cloud that they have threaded with fiber-optic strands, so it glows at the tips in a slow amber pulse when they''re inside. They dress like a traveling scholar from some other century: layered robes in muted earth tones, rings on every finger, a tablet crammed with media archives always in hand.

Goli Agyemang sells bootleg film, music, literature, and recordings in the morning, and ''readings'' in the afternoon — a practice that is one part ELF-communing, one part cold reading, and one part genuine perceptiveness that they do not fully understand themselves. They have developed a minor reputation in the Oxidian Market for readings that are accurate in strange, specific ways. They are not sure if they are receiving something or constructing something from micro-observations. They have decided it doesn''t matter: the comfort is real either way, and they charge fairly.', N'Information through indirect channels — their readings can surface player-relevant truths obliquely. Access to rare or suppressed media, historical records, and cultural archives. A character who exists at the intersection of entertainment, spirituality, and information.', N'', N'Shifting-iris augmentation — amber to jade. Fiber-optic hair threading (cosmetic, bioluminescent). Haptic feedback overlay in fingertips for data-chip reading.', N'Morning setup involves arranging the media chips in a display that is partly organizational and partly aesthetic — they consider it a daily artistic act. Readings begin after midday and run until they are tired or the market thins. They spend late evenings updating their archive and writing down readings that felt significant in a private log.', N'Goli Agyemang, 168cm lean androgynous figure with warm bronze-golden skin, wide-set eyes that shift amber-to-jade in low light, long deep-brown hair with glowing amber fiber-optic threads woven throughout creating soft bioluminescent glow. High cheekbones and refined nose reflecting South Asian and Middle Eastern ancestry softened by African and Indigenous heritage warmth. Sitting cross-legged in meditative stillness, fingertips lightly touching worn objects, wearing layered earth-tone robes in clay and sage over charcoal tunic. Multiple salvaged metal and stone rings on fingers. Worn tablet visible nearby. GLMZ, candlelit intimate setting with warm atmospheric lighting emphasizing eye color shift and hair fiber glow. Scholarly, intentional, otherworldly aesthetic. Expression calm and ageless. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'True pan-global ancestry: Hispanic/Latin American (25.6%), Sub-Saharan African (21.0%), Middle Eastern (20.6%), Northern European (13.5%), Indigenous American (11.5%), South Asian (7.8%). This rare diaspora combination creates distinctive feature layering—warm bronze undertones from African and Latin heritage, refined bone structure shaped by Northern European and South Asian ancestry, Middle Eastern influence evident in facial symmetry and nose bridge, Indigenous American ancestry deepening overall complexion warmth and richness.', 168, 52, N'Willowy and lean with long limbs and delicate bone structure; moves with deliberate, economical grace', N'Natural deep brown with amber fiber-optic threading woven throughout', N'Soft, voluminous cloud worn natural; fibers create slow amber pulse when illuminated', N'Long', N'Augmented shifting iris — amber to deep jade depending on ambient light and angle', N'Warm bronze-golden complexion with subtle olive undertones, reflecting the balanced blend of Sub-Saharan African warmth, Hispanic/Latin American richness, Middle Eastern depth, and South Asian luminosity; Indigenous American heritage enriches overall warmth with earthy dimension', N'Harmonious facial structure with wide-set eyes, high cheekbones, and refined nose bridge showing multi-continental influence; long-featured face with smooth skin; evident South Asian and Middle Eastern facial geometry in bone structure softened by African and Indigenous American feature contributions; expression often appears still and ageless', N'Shifting-iris augmentation most noticeable in candlelight or dim indoor settings (amber-to-jade color shift). Fiber-optic hair threading glows faintly amber at tips when indoors or in low light. Haptic feedback overlay in fingertips invisible to casual observation but may be noticed as slight variation in skin texture on fingertips under close inspection.', N'Carries themselves with stillness and intention; movements are deliberate and economical, almost meditative. Favors sitting cross-legged or in grounded positions during readings. Frequently touches objects lightly with fingertips — habit born from haptic-chip reading practice.', N'Eclectic scholar aesthetic — layered robes and tunics in muted earth tones (clay, sage, charcoal, rust). Fabrics appear worn but maintained with care, suggesting Tier 3-4 status with intentional counter-aesthetic rejection of corp polish. Multiple rings on most fingers (mix of salvaged metal, stone, worn silver). Always carries a worn tablet crammed with archived media. Sensory-forward styling emphasizes texture and light-play rather than brand signaling.', N'', N'Unusual blend of formal literary register and market-vernacular warmth. References across eras of film and literature freely, often mid-sentence.', N'Measured and melodic when doing readings; quicker and more playful when selling media; slows again when something matters', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'goli_agyemang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d6-7d48-b37d-26a06d556da1', N'Ewout Faalele', N'Ewout', N'', N'Faalele', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Burnside Corridor — transit hub connecting the Gray Zone to Circuit, near North Ave and Damen', N'Prototype theft and corporate tech acquisition — tech retriever', N'Independent — Lattice territory specialist', N'Ewout Faalele is slight and easy to overlook, which is exactly the point. At 38, his expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immu — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left him with skills and night terrors in equal measure. He works as a tech retriever out of Burnside Corridor, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Ewout Faalele has built a reputation on reliability rather than flash — he shows up, he delivers, he collects.', N'Cem Ivanov-Appiah is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When he makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of his stories.', N'', N'Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks. Subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Ewout Faalele, GLMZ, Pacific Islander-dominant mixed heritage with warm golden-bronze skin and subtle olive undertones, broad defined cheekbones, dark brown eyes with amber flecks, dark graying temples, short swept-back hair. Lean 172cm frame, economical posture. Faint surgical scar on left neck, white scar temple-to-cheekbone, military burn scars on right wrist. Chrome subdermal weapon grid patterns across both forearms, brushed metallic finish. Faint chrome mesh air filtration system visible along neck. Clinical augmentations, no flashy chrome. Wearing dark synthetic reinforced jacket, black smart-fabric cargo pants, gray thermal underlayer, practical work boots. Standing with perfect stillness, economical posture, hands in ready position, flat affect, dangerous neutrality. GLMZ transit pass lanyard visible. Moody industrial neo-noir setting, neon glow from distance, cool shadows, utilitarian warehouse backdrop, deliberate and composed. Photography style, high contrast lighting, clinical precision --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Burnside Corridor', N'local', N'Burnside Corridor', N'Complex blend of Pacific Islander (45.3%), Indigenous American (23.3%), South Asian (16.1%), and Hispanic/Latin American (15.3%) ancestry. Pacific Islander foundation dominates with broad facial structure, defined cheekbones, and rich melanin distribution. Indigenous American ancestry contributes to strong bone structure and facial proportions. South Asian heritage adds warm undertones and subtle depth, while Hispanic/Latin American ancestry blends seamlessly with the Pacific Islander base, creating a harmonious warm complexion with layered undertones and subtle olive depth.', 172, 68, N'Lean and economical, with minimal excess muscle — a runner''s frame built for efficiency rather than power. Shoulders slightly narrow, defined but not bulky. Every movement calculated.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples', N'Short, swept back, practical. No styling product. Looks like it''s cut every three weeks by the same person.', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint amber undertone', N'Warm golden-bronze with layered complexity — rich melanin base from Pacific Islander heritage (45.3%) enhanced by South Asian warmth and subtle olive undertones, grounded by Indigenous American depth. Creates a unified warm complexion reflecting the dominant Pacific Islander ancestry balanced with significant Indigenous American (23.3%) and South Asian (16.1%) contribution, with gentle Hispanic/Latin American warmth woven throughout.', N'Clean-shaven, broad facial structure with defined cheekbones characteristic of Pacific Islander and Indigenous American heritage. Bone structure shows the angular strength of Indigenous ancestry balanced with the broader foundation of Pacific Islander genetics. Skin shows minimal damage — careful about sun exposure, skincare routine is methodical. A faint stress line between his brows that never fully relaxes. Eyes carry a flat affect, practiced neutrality that reads as either calm or dangerous depending on context.', N'Chrome plating visible across both forearms in a geometric pattern, extending from wrist to mid-forearm — the subdermal weapon mounts are visible as precise metallic lines beneath the skin, creating a grid pattern. The chrome has a brushed finish, not polished, which reads as professional rather than flashy. Internal air filtration system visible as faint chrome mesh along both sides of the neck, just beneath the skin''s surface, with small intake vents. The augmentations are clinical and undisguised.', N'Sits and stands with economical stillness — no fidgeting, no wasted motion. Moves through space like he''s mapping exits. When walking, his gait is even and measured, shoulders loose but controlled. His hands rest naturally, fingers slightly curved — ready position. Eye contact is deliberate and unsettling; he holds it a beat too long, processing information. When speaking, his voice remains level; he doesn''t use hand gestures.', N'Tier 4 functional — dark synthetic jacket with reinforced seams, black smart-fabric cargo pants with hidden pockets, neutral gray thermal under-layer. Boots are practical work boots, well-maintained, with subtle grip-enhanced soles. No logos or branding that declares affiliation. Everything is durable, replaceable, and dark. In his cover identity, he wears slightly less careful versions of the same aesthetic — still dark, still functional, but with a layer of deliberate mundanity. No jewelry. A faded GLMZ transit pass visible on a lanyard inside his collar.', N'', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ewout_faalele');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67c-7dd8-9676-2715db8e2d80', N'Hadia Kjellberg-Björnsdóttir', N'Hadia', N'', N'Kjellberg-Björnsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, corner of the Brewer''s Spine transit junction, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Noodle cart vendor, Hamtramck Enclave', N'Independent; informal ties to Hamtramck Enclave vendors'' collective', N'Hadia Kjellberg-Björnsdóttir is a broad-shouldered woman whose face is a topographic map of decades in open-air heat and cold — deep laugh lines, a permanent squint from watching steam rise, skin the color of dark teak that goes ashy at the knuckles. Her hair is close-cropped and she has a geneware patch of bioluminescent freckles across her nose and cheekbones, a gift to herself on her fortieth birthday that she''s never stopped being quietly pleased about. She moves with the unhurried authority of someone who has run the same twelve square feet of pavement for twenty years and knows exactly how much space she needs.

She is warm in the way that efficient people are warm — she remembers your order, not your name, but she''ll ask about your knee or your kid with total sincerity. She has strong opinions about broth clarity and almost no opinions about politics, which is a deliberate policy. The cart is named ''Auntie'' on the permit but nobody calls it that. They call it Oge''s, and the regulars consider that a kind of citizenship.', N'Neighborhood anchor and information node — she has watched the Enclave for two decades and will share what she knows if she trusts you. Quest giver for low-stakes community disputes. Source of genuine warmth in a cold setting.', N'', N'Bioluminescent freckles (geneware, cosmetic). Reinforced wrist joints (medical-grade, from repetitive strain in her 30s). Nothing else.', N'Up at 03:30 to prep broth at her apartment block''s shared kitchen, cart rolling by 06:00 to catch the transit workers'' shift change. Breaks down at 20:00 unless she sells out early, which happens maybe twice a month and makes her unreasonably happy.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Hadia Kjellberg-Björnsdóttir, a 168cm broad-shouldered Scandinavian-Southeast Asian-East Asian woman with fair cool-toned skin warming to peachy-gold across cheekbones, deeply lined weathered face with laugh lines and prominent bioluminescent blue freckles scattered across nose and cheekbones glowing faintly in dimlight, short black hair with iron-gray temples, deep warm brown eyes with crow''s feet, wearing dark rolled-sleeve linen shirt exposing wrist augmentations and burn scar, dark cargo trousers, worn synthetic-leather kitchen apron stained from years of work, reinforced rubber-soled clogs, simple steel wedding band, standing with economical balanced posture in a small kitchen space with steam rising, industrial lighting, geneware augmentations visible, working-class practical aesthetic, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone diner setting, direct gaze, fatigue but dignity --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Mixed Northern European (52.8%), Southeast Asian (37.6%), and East Asian (9.6%) ancestry. The Scandinavian foundation creates a fair, cool-undertoned base, while Southeast Asian heritage adds warmth and subtle golden tones to cheekbones and midface. East Asian ancestry contributes to eye shape and facial structure balance. The result is a distinctive cool-warm complexion: fair skin with peachy-golden undertones that deepen in sun-exposed areas (forearms, neck, décolletage), creating an unusual but harmonious blend rather than stark contrast.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, with the compact muscularity of someone who has spent three decades standing and moving within a small space. Not heavy, but dense — the kind of build that doesn''t shift much in wind.', N'Natural black with iron-gray at the temples', N'Close-cropped, practical, no styling product', N'Short', N'Deep brown with warm undertones, crow''s feet at the corners from decades of squinting against steam', N'Fair to light-medium with cool undertones at the jawline and temples (Northern European base), warming to peachy-gold across cheekbones and nose bridge (Southeast Asian influence). Sun-deepened at forearms, neck, and upper chest. Protected areas show pale, cool-toned skin. The overall effect reads as unusually balanced between cool and warm — neither dominantly one nor the other.', N'Deeply lined face — prominent laugh lines bracketing her mouth, horizontal creases across her forehead, permanent squint-crease between brows. Facial structure shows prominent cheekbones (Southeast Asian influence), slightly wider-set eyes with gentle epicanthic fold (East Asian heritage), balanced against a strong nose bridge and defined jaw (Northern European ancestry). Skin has weathered quality from heat and humidity exposure, with occasional dryness at jawline. Sun damage visible on neck and forearms. Fair, cool-toned undertones visible in protected areas contrast subtly with warmer sun-exposed skin.', N'Bioluminescent freckles across nose and cheekbones (faint blue luminescence in dim conditions). Medical-grade reinforcement at both wrists is not visually obvious but visible on close inspection as slightly thickened joint lines and subtle metallic sheen under the skin at the wrist crease.', N'Moves with unhurried efficiency — economical, deliberate. She doesn''t gesture much, but when she does it''s precise. Stands with weight balanced on both feet, ready to move in any direction. Her hands are always in use or ready. She makes direct eye contact and holds it without aggression — the gaze of someone accustomed to reading the faces of tired people ordering breakfast.', N'Tier 4 working-class practical. Loose dark linen tunic or long-sleeved shirt, rolled to the elbows (shows the reinforced wrists), black or dark gray cargo trousers with deep pockets. Worn synthetic-leather apron over everything, stained with old broth splashes and marked by years of use. Rubber-soled work clogs with reinforced toe caps. A headwrap or scarf on cold mornings. No jewelry except a simple stainless steel wedding band. No visible logos or corp branding.', N'She has been quietly paying the medical bills of a neighboring vendor, Tetteh, who has a degenerative nerve condition — skimming from her own meager margins. She has told him it''s from a neighborhood fund she invented.', N'Direct, practical, zero corporate jargon. Occasional Igbo and Finnish loan words blended naturally. Addresses everyone as ''eh'' or ''na'' as a softener.', N'Measured and unhurried. Never raises her voice. Sentences are short when she''s busy, longer when she likes you.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hadia_kjellberg_bj_rnsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a2-7fbf-a04f-271ab26cfcf1', N'Amarachi Okada-Madrigal', N'Amarachi', N'', N'Okada-Madrigal', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Fort Anchor, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Riot Suppression Specialist, Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division — Crowd Management Unit', N'Amarachi Okada-Madrigal is built like a structural column — wide shoulders, thick neck, hands that look like they could stop a mag-train. Her skin is deep brown and she keeps her hair cropped close to the skull, the only concession to vanity being a single bioluminescent stripe of violet running temple to nape that pulses faintly when her blood pressure spikes. A network of old scar tissue along her left forearm maps the shape of a crowd-crush incident she doesn''t discuss. Her face defaults to studied neutrality, the kind you practice until it becomes reflex.

She joined ADS Civil Security because her uncle did, and stayed because she''s genuinely good at de-escalation — ironic given her assignment. She reads crowd energy the way some people read weather: a shift in noise pitch, the clustering of bodies, the particular quality of silence before things go wrong. She is not cruel, which makes her unusual in her unit, and she knows it. She keeps her head down, does the job, and goes home to her two cats and a shrine to the E.L.F. she calls Makovitch, a minor digital spirit she believes inhabits her riot shield.', N'Moral conscience within law enforcement — a character who enforces unjust orders while quietly hating herself for it; can be a reluctant ally or a source of inside information about MPD operations; good for scenes where players need to understand the human cost of policing in GLMZ.', N'', N'Subdermal impact-absorption mesh in forearms and shins (standard issue); cochlear dampener to protect against sonic crowd-control discharge; bioluminescent stripe (cosmetic, personal mod)', N'Shifts start at 1800 at Fort Anchor for briefing, then deployment rotations through The Circuit and Grand Corridor protest zones; off-hours she visits a Tier 2 canteen called Okoro''s near the barracks, feeds her cats, and leaves burned data-sticks at her E.L.F. shrine.', N'Amarachi Okada-Madrigal, 183cm tall, muscular riot cop with pan-Asian-Hispanic heritage. Medium-tan golden-amber skin with Southeast Asian-East Asian cheekbones set wide, defined Hispanic mandible, deep brown eyes with warm undertones, black military-cropped hair with violet bioluminescent stripe from temple to nape pulsing softly. Weathered 12-year-old complexion with sun freckling across cheekbones, visible white crush-fracture scarring across left forearm, faint silvered geometric subdermal augmentation mesh patterns on forearms. Neutral analytical expression, steady crowd-aware eyes. Wearing unmarked tactical jacket in matte black, gray cargo trousers, steel-toed boots, small brass charm on cord at neck. Standing in economical ready posture, weight evenly distributed, shoulders back. GLMZ GLMZ Metropolitan Zone setting, night-shift lighting with ambient city glow, utilitarian working-class aesthetic, functional over fashionable, aged leather quality to bearing. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Fort Anchor', N'local', N'Fort Anchor', N'Pan-global diaspora synthesis: Hispanic/Latin American (30.5%) establishes the foundational warmth and bone density, interwoven with Southeast Asian (24.9%) cheekbone prominence and facial angularity, East Asian (17.8%) eye structure and depth, Central Asian (16.4%) facial width and architectural bone pattern, Sub-Saharan African (8.2%) complexion richness and iris warmth, with South Asian (2.2%) subtle refinement in orbital definition. The result is a distinctly non-binary facial architecture where no single heritage dominates visually—instead they layer into dimensional complexity: wide Central Asian cheekbones set above a defined Hispanic/Latin American mandible, Southeast Asian angularity framing East Asian-deep eyes rimmed in Sub-Saharan warmth, skin that reads as simultaneously golden-amber, sun-lived, and dimensionally textured.', 183, 89, N'Heavily muscled and columnar — broad shoulders tapering to a narrow waist, thick neck, forearms dense with functional mass. Built for impact absorption and crowd control rather than aesthetics.', N'Black, natural', N'Cropped close to the skull in a military cut, with a single bioluminescent violet stripe running from left temple to nape that pulses faintly in response to elevated blood pressure', N'Short', N'Deep brown, natural', N'Medium-tan with rich golden-amber undertones—a warm multitonal blend where Southeast Asian luminosity and East Asian undertones layer beneath a dominant Hispanic/Latin American warmth, deepened by Central Asian pigmentation and Sub-Saharan African complexity. Complexion reads as sun-lived, dimensionally complex, with visible texture variation rather than uniform flatness.', N'Broad Central Asian-influenced cheekbones set wide across the face, creating structural width balanced by Southeast Asian angularity in the orbital structure and orbital ridge definition. Mandible is pronounced and squared, reflecting Hispanic/Latin American bone density and Central Asian jaw architecture. Eyes display characteristic East Asian depth set within warm Sub-Saharan-toned iris surrounds and epicanthic folds that blend Southeast Asian and East Asian traits. Skin surface shows the wear of 12 years in riot suppression—aged leather quality, weathered rather than damaged, with visible pore texture and subtle freckling from sun exposure concentrated across cheekbones and bridge of nose. No acne, blemishing, or uneven pigmentation.', N'Subdermal impact-absorption mesh visible as faint geometric scarring along both forearms and shins when skin is exposed — raised, silvered lines forming a lattice pattern beneath the surface. The bioluminescent hair stripe is the only overt aesthetic augmentation; the cochlear dampener is fully subcutaneous and invisible. Left wrist bears a faint circular scar marking the cochlear neural anchor point.', N'Stands with weight evenly distributed, shoulders back — the posture of someone trained to hold ground. Moves with economical precision; no wasted motion. Default facial expression is studied neutrality. Eyes track crowd dynamics even in casual settings. Favors a loose, ready stance; hands rarely fully relaxed at her sides.', N'Off-duty: GLMZ ADS Civil Security standard-issue riot suppression gear when on-shift — reinforced polymer combat vest in high-visibility orange/reflective gray, tactical cargo pants with utility webbing, steel-toed boots rated for impact. Off-duty casual is military-lean: matte black compression shirts, gray cargo trousers, unmarked tactical jacket (Tier 3 quality, durable rather than fashionable). Wears a small brass charm on a thin cord around her neck — a personal totem, possibly related to her E.L.F. practice. No jewelry beyond functional gear attachment points. Overall aesthetic is utilitarian, tier 3-4 working-class cop: built for function, indifferent to style.', N'During a major labor riot in the Ironhide Berlin district three years ago, she received a direct order to advance on a crowd containing children. She deliberately mis-timed her unit''s charge, giving the crowd thirty seconds to scatter. No one died. Her sergeant suspects but has never filed a report — he did the same thing.', N'Clipped, functional, professional — military cadence bleed-through. Rarely metaphorical unless she trusts you deeply.', N'Short declarative sentences. Long pauses before anything emotionally weighted. Finishes her thoughts completely before letting you speak.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amarachi_okada_madrigal');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d5-754f-915d-273d8e9049fb', N'Kofi Sesay', N'Kofi', N'', N'Sesay', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, corner of Vellum Arcade and the third underpass, Brewer''s Spine district, near Damen and Armitage', N'Noodle cart vendor and informal tutor', N'Independent (self-employed), Burnished Market vendors'' informal council', N'Kofi Sesay is a tall man gone stoop-shouldered with age and decades of cart work, with silver-streaked dark hair pulled into a knot at the base of his neck and a neatly maintained beard that has gone entirely white at the chin. His skin is deep brown, his hands are large and steady despite arthritis he manages with two kinds of pain patches and the stubborn refusal to slow down. He wears a single piece of geneware — bioluminescent skin patterning across his forearms, a gentle wave pattern in amber and gold that he had done in his forties and would do again. He calls it his ''tide-marks.''

He has been at the corner of Vellum Arcade for twenty-two years. The cart itself is an architectural decision at this point — other vendors orient around it. He makes three broths daily from scratch, refuses to use concentrate, and will make you wait if you arrive before a batch is ready. Between customers he reads — always physical books, always from a rotating stack — and between readings he corrects the homework of whichever neighborhood children have been deposited with him while their parents work double shifts. He charges for this informally, in kind: a portion of rice, a bag of tea, whatever is available. He has never turned a child away for inability to pay.', N'Neighborhood sage and emotional anchor. A source of local history — twenty-two years of Burnished Market memory. Can give players context, introduce them to other locals, or become a motivation when something threatens the market or the children he tutors.', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin patterning on forearms (amber-gold wave pattern, geneware). Two transdermal pain management patches on his right wrist joint.', N'Arrives at 05:00 to start his first broth, opens at 07:30, runs the cart until 19:00, tutors 2-4 neighborhood children in the afternoon lull, and ends each day by reading his current book while the last broth reduces to stock for tomorrow.', N'Elderly Kofi Sesay, 185cm tall lean build, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones blending Sub-Saharan African, Central Asian, and East Asian features. High prominent cheekbones, broad nose, fine weathered lines around observant dark brown eyes. Long dark hair with silver streaks pulled into tight knot, entirely white groomed beard. Amber-gold bioluminescent wave patterns glowing subtly on both forearms in low light. Slight forward shoulder stoop from decades of work. Wearing faded charcoal henley under practical water-resistant linen apron, loose grey-brown canvas pants, worn leather belt, comfortable slip-on shoes. Thin worn silver wedding band on left ring finger. Cloth satchel at side, hands weathered with age spots and pale burn scar on left palm, steady precise movements. Market stall setting, warm atmospheric lighting catching bioluminescent forearm geneware, GLMZ, contemplative and observant demeanor --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Complex global ancestry: Sub-Saharan African (33.2%), Central Asian (25.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (20.7%), East Asian (17.5%), Eastern European (3.5%). This creates warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden undertones, refined facial structure blending Central Asian and East Asian features with broader Sub-Saharan characteristics, and a complexion that bridges African, Asian, and Latin warmth with faint European cool notes.', 185, 72, N'Tall and lean, shoulders rounded forward from decades of cart work and standing over steam. Wiry musculature in forearms and hands despite age; chest slightly concave from posture. No excess weight, all functional.', N'Dark brown with silver streaking throughout, white at the beard', N'Long dark hair pulled into a tight knot at the base of the skull; beard neatly trimmed and groomed, entirely white at the chin and lower jaw', N'Long (head), Medium (beard)', N'Dark brown, warm and observant', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones, primary blend of Sub-Saharan African and Central Asian ancestry with secondary East Asian and Hispanic/Latin influences, minimal Eastern European cool undertone', N'Weathered from decades of outdoor market work and steam exposure. Fine lines around eyes and mouth. High cheekbones with Central and East Asian influence, broad nose with Sub-Saharan heritage, warm Latin undertones across the face. Hands show age spots and prominent knuckles; skin on forearms smooth where the bioluminescence is patterned. Clean-shaven upper cheeks, immaculate beard grooming.', N'Bioluminescent forearm patterning (amber-gold tide-marks), transdermal pain patches on right wrist. All other augmentations are subcutaneous or pharmaceutical.', N'Moves with deliberate care; bent slightly forward from the shoulders. Hands are steady and precise despite arthritis. Walks slowly but with purpose. Often still when reading or listening. Rarely hurried, even under pressure.', N'Practical Tier 3-4 workwear: water-resistant linen apron over a faded charcoal henley (worn daily, always clean). Loose canvas pants in grey-brown, multiple pockets for books and supplies. Worn leather belt with a simple buckle. No jewelry except a thin silver band on his left ring finger (wedding band, worn thin with age). Comfortable slip-on shoes rated for wet environments. Always carries a cloth satchel with whatever book he''s currently reading and a smaller pouch for homework materials and payment-in-kind items.', N'Before the cart, Celestino taught secondary school literature in the Highland Park Autonomous Zone. He was removed — not fired, removed — after he shared unauthorized political texts with a class of sixteen-year-olds during the 2183 Sterling-Nakamura annexation crisis. He agreed to leave quietly in exchange for charges being dropped. He has never spoken of this publicly and presents his cart life as a simple choice.', N'Precise and literary without being pretentious — uses the right word and has an instinct for when simpler is stronger. Mixes Congolese French with Punjabi diminutives absorbed from his Bakshi grandparents.', N'Measured and unhurried, with a teacher''s gift for the well-placed pause.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'kofi_sesay');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b1-780b-928a-2771b74277c5', N'Chukwuka Ionescu-Mansour', N'Chukwuka', N'', N'Ionescu-Mansour', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenosha Crossing — semi-permanent pitch in the trader''s row outside the main terminal, near beyond the Western Perimeter', N'Wandering trader and caravan member', N'The Kenosha-Escanaba Circuit — an informal caravan collective of about thirty traders who coordinate routes and security', N'Chukwuka Ionescu-Mansour is compact and broad-shouldered, with the particular kind of physical confidence that comes from lifting, hauling, and setting up a market stall in hostile weather for twenty years. Their hair grows in a natural halo that they tint in slow-shifting colors — currently a deep green at the roots bleeding to copper at the tips — using a cheap geneware pigment mod that they refresh every three months at whichever clinic takes cash. Their skin is a warm medium brown covered in a patchwork of small tattoos that are actually a functional mnemonic system: inventory records, supplier codes, route notes, all written in a personal cipher directly on their forearms and the backs of their hands. They wear a coat with an absurd number of pockets, all of which are organized with a precision that would embarrass most archivists.

Chukwuka Ionescu-Mansour is sociable in the pure commercial sense — they can talk to anyone, find the common thread, make the sale — but there is a layer of genuine curiosity beneath the salesmanship that surprises people who expect only performance. They have been moving with the Kenosha-Escanaba-Waukegan caravan circuit for fifteen years, specializing in hard-to-source physical goods: specific medicines, particular machine components, seeds, analog media. They know supply and demand in the outer edges of GLMZ with an intimacy that no corporate logistics system can replicate, because they have walked it personally.', N'Source of rare and hard-to-find goods. Information broker in the practical sense — they know what is scarce where, which means they know what is happening in a dozen locations. Connector between isolated communities. Can provide equipment, medicine, or supplies that official channels do not carry.', N'', N'Geneware: hair pigment shifting mod (cheap, refills required). One functional aug: a tactile sensitivity enhancement in the fingertips that helps them assess material quality — cloth, metal, grain — by touch.', N'Sets up their pitch before dawn, operates through trading hours, spends evenings cataloguing inventory in their personal cipher and networking with other traders. Moves with the circuit on a three-week rotation. Sleeps in a fitted berth in a shared caravan transport vehicle.', N'Chukwuka Ionescu-Mansour, compact 164cm figure with broad shoulders and dense work-muscle, stands at an outdoor trading pitch in the GLMZ 2226. Warm medium-brown skin with golden-amber undertones and sienna sun-darkening, luminous across high cheekbones and prominent bridge of nose. Sharp Eastern European cheekbones, alert East Asian eye-set, broad refined nasal bridge — genuinely global facial architecture. Dark brown alert eyes, weathered face with laugh lines from decades of negotiations and outdoor work. Shoulder-length natural textured black hair bleeding into deep forest green and oxidized copper at tips from geneware modification, loose halo style. Forearms and back of hands covered in dense black cipher tattoos — inventory codes and supply markers. Thin white scar on left forearm, alert posture. Wearing heavily modified canvas and synth-blend coat with 15-20 organized pockets, earth-tone layers underneath, cargo pants, resoled utility boots. Heavy canvas trading apron stained from years of goods handling. Simple metal ring on left hand. Economic efficient movement, grounded stable stance. Neo-noir trader aesthetic, weathered and precise. Overcast trading floor lighting catching golden undertones on cheekbones. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenosha Crossing', N'local', N'Kenosha Crossing', N'True Ubiquitous Diaspora phenotype: Eastern European (25.9%), Middle Eastern (22.4%), East Asian (18.3%), South Asian (14.3%), Sub-Saharan African (9.9%), Northern European (9.2%). The genetic blend creates a striking multifaceted appearance — warm medium-brown skin with golden-amber undertones that deepen to rich sienna in sun-exposed areas, creating luminous depth across cheekbones and the bridge of nose. Facial architecture displays the prominent, angular cheekbones of Eastern European-Central Asian ancestry paired with the characteristic alert eye-set and slightly wider face structure of East Asian genetics. The nasal bridge is broad and refined, reflecting the blend of Middle Eastern, South Asian, and African heritage. Fuller lips and strong jaw definition create a face that resists easy categorization — genuinely global in its proportions and feature integration, bearing the weathered markers of outdoor labor across multiple climates.', 164, 68, N'Compact and broad-shouldered, densely muscled from two decades of manual labor — lifting cargo, assembling stalls in wind and cold. No excess weight; functional frame built for endurance and sustained physical work rather than speed.', N'Natural black at roots, geneware-modified to deep forest green bleeding into oxidized copper at the tips', N'Natural textured halo, shoulder-length, kept loose and full', N'Medium to Long', N'Dark brown, alert and constantly cataloguing', N'Warm medium-brown with golden-amber undertones deepening to sienna in sun-exposed areas, darkened from constant outdoor exposure across decades, luminous depth reflecting the balanced continental blend. Golden cast most visible on high cheekbones and bridge of nose, warmer sienna tones along jawline and temple.', N'Weathered from constant outdoor exposure — sun-darkened with fine lines around the eyes and mouth from two decades of squinting in bright light and smiling through negotiations. Facial structure displays the prominent, angular cheekbones characteristic of Eastern European genetics, paired with the defined eye-set geometry of East Asian ancestry, broad nasal bridge reflecting Middle Eastern and South Asian heritage, strong jaw definition. Skin texture is lived-in and sun-marked, bearing the patina of someone working through seasons without excess skincare protocols. No facial scars. Minor laugh lines around eyes and mouth from decades of outdoor work and trading negotiations.', N'Hair pigment geneware modification is the only visible augmentation — the slow color shift from black to forest green to copper is subtle enough to pass for natural variation at casual glance, but obvious under direct light. Fingertip tactile enhancement is subcutaneous and invisible, leaving no visible marking. Wear on fingertips slightly more pronounced than typical from constant material assessment.', N'Moves with economic efficiency — no wasted motion, but not rigid or militaristic. Stands with weight balanced evenly, ready to shift in any direction. Leans forward slightly when listening, especially during negotiation or when genuinely curious. Hands move constantly in conversation: gesturing, demonstrating material qualities, punctuating points. When stationary at their pitch, posture is grounded and stable — the stance of someone who will not be moved.', N'Wears a heavily modified canvas and synth-blend coat (Tier 3-4 quality, well-maintained) with an extraordinary number of pockets, each organized with obsessive precision — estimated 15-20 pockets total, some nested, some reinforced with additional stitching. Underneath: simple, practical layers appropriate to season — usually a fitted base layer and a loose overshirt in earth tones or muted colors that won''t show stains. Cargo pants with numerous utility pockets, preferring function over fashion. Boots are heavy-duty, often scuffed and clearly resoled multiple times — no corporate branding, generic utility grade. Wears a heavy canvas apron when actively trading, stained with years of handling goods. Personal adornment minimal: a simple metal ring on left hand (possibly a relationship marker), no neck jewelry. Overall aesthetic is Tier 4 working trader — clearly not wealthy, but equipped with the precision of someone who has refined their kit over decades.', N'They have been quietly buying small parcels of land at Kenosha Crossing under a series of proxy names for eight years, slowly assembling the footprint for a permanent trade hall. They have told no one — not from secrecy but from superstition. Saying it aloud feels like it might break it.', N'Rich, concrete, full of regional slang from half a dozen outer-edge communities. Loves specific nouns. Names things precisely.', N'Warm and flowing in conversation, clipped and efficient in negotiation. Can switch between the two mid-sentence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chukwuka_ionescu_mansour');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e4-7a54-aa5d-2795981e8ad4', N'Colette Magnúsdóttir', N'Colette', N'', N'Magnúsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 56, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lincoln Spear', N'Internal Affairs Investigator, Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division, Internal Affairs Division', N'Colette Magnúsdóttir looks like he was designed as a warning. He is tall, slightly stooped now at fifty-six, with deep-lined dark skin, close-cut silver hair going white at the crown, and eyes so perpetually tired they have taken on a philosophical quality — not bored, but comprehensively unshocked. He has no cosmetic mods and no geneware. He has a retinal information overlay that is Metro standard and a hip replacement he refuses to acknowledge. He dresses in the same rotation of well-maintained dark suits that have been in his wardrobe for fifteen years, and he smells of the same soap he''s used since his second wife bought it for him on their anniversary in 2181.

He has investigated Arcturus Civil Security internal corruption for nineteen years and this has done specific things to him. He does not romanticize the institution, does not hate it, and does not believe the people in it are substantially different from the people outside it. He has a reputation for being impossible to manipulate and nearly as impossible to work with, because he will follow an investigation to a conclusion even when — especially when — the conclusion is uncomfortable. He is not cruel. He is thorough. He collects small ceramic animals and arranges them on his desk in configurations that subordinates have spent years trying to decode. He has been threatened, transferred, demoted and reinstated twice. He is still here.', N'Institutional threat or ambiguous authority. May be investigating a character, or may be the person a character turns to when other doors close. His investigations have a momentum independent of the people in them — once started, he is very hard to stop.', N'', N'Retinal information overlay (Metro standard). Hip replacement (biological, he insists on describing it as such). Nothing else — he is suspicious of augmentation that could be remotely accessed.', N'Office at Lincoln Spear, sixth floor, 0800-1900 on most days. Longer when a case is moving. Eats lunch at his desk. Takes a precise thirty-minute walk along the Lincoln Spear promenade at 1300 regardless of weather or workload — he has not missed it in eleven years.', N'A 56-year-old man with warm bronze-brown skin carrying golden and mahogany undertones, reflecting East Asian, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Short silver hair with white at crown in military cut. Dark brown eyes with subtle amber retinal grid visible in shadows. Heavily lined face with deep nasolabial folds, prominent East Asian cheekbones, refined Middle Eastern nose structure, Northern European eye depth, and Eastern European jaw strength. Perpetual five-o''clock shadow. Wearing a charcoal suit, white dress shirt, simple dark tie, polished black leather shoes. Gold wedding ring worn thin. Standing in dimly lit government office, fluorescent overhead lights casting cool shadows across face while warm desk lamp creates burnished gold highlights on skin. Posture shows slight forward stoop, hands at rest with precision. Fine network scars visible on knuckles. Expression impassive, unflinching eye contact. GLMZ 2200s, minimalist augmentation aesthetic, tired determination, 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lincoln Spear', N'local', N'Lincoln Spear', N'Complex global admixture: East Asian (25.1%), Middle Eastern (25.0%), Eastern European (16.3%), Northern European (15.2%), Sub-Saharan African (13.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (4.8%). Genetic blend creates distinctive phenotype with warm deep bronze-brown skin tone enriched by golden, olive, and mahogany undertones. Facial structure synthesizes multiple ancestries: prominent East Asian cheekbones and eye placement, refined Middle Eastern nose bridge and brow definition, Northern European eye depth, Eastern European jaw strength, and Sub-Saharan African warmth throughout complexion. Skin undertones shift between burnished bronze, warm olive, and rich mahogany depending on lighting—a visual record of truly global genetic heritage.', 188, 78, N'Tall and lean with slight forward stoop developed over decades of desk work and exhaustion. Shoulders rounded inward. Still carries underlying frame of disciplined posture underneath the wear.', N'Silver with white at crown, natural graying', N'Close-cropped, military precision, no styling product', N'Short', N'Dark brown, natural. Retinal overlay visible as faint amber grid pattern in low light.', N'Warm deep bronze-brown with golden, olive, and mahogany undertones reflecting balanced East Asian, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Weathered from fifty-six years of exhaustion. Undertones shift fluidly depending on light angle—cool olive in shadow, burnished gold in warm light, rich mahogany in transition zones.', N'Heavily lined face with deep nasolabial folds and permanent horizontal creases across forehead. Perpetual shadow of stubble. Papery skin texture from dehydration and age. Facial features reflect multi-ancestry blend: East Asian cheekbone prominence, refined Middle Eastern brow and nose structure, Northern European eye set and depth, Eastern European jaw definition—all unified by warm golden-bronze complexion of the complete genetic mix.', N'Retinal overlay manifests as subtle amber luminescence in pupils during information access. Hip replacement is internal, invisible. Deliberately minimalist — no chrome, no subdermal modifications, no visible neural interfaces.', N'Walks with deliberate, measured pace. Slight limp when tired (hip replacement). Sits with spine curved into desk chair as though he and furniture have merged over years. Hands move with precision — no wasted gesture. Eye contact is unflinching and uncomfortable; he does not break gaze first. When thinking, tilts head slightly back and to the left. No nervous habits, no fidgeting.', N'Dark suits in rotation of same five designs (charcoal, navy, black variants), tailored fifteen years ago and maintained by a tailor who knows his exact measurements. Suits are well-made but dated — not aspirational, not fashionable. White or light gray dress shirts, no logos. Simple dark ties. Black leather shoes polished to military shine. Wedding ring, gold, worn thin. No jewelry beyond ring and Metro credentials. Entire wardrobe reads as Tier 3 government employee: solid, functional, deliberately unmarked by trend or status signal.', N'His private archive contains the complete, unredacted investigation file of a case that was sealed by executive order in 2188 — an order that implicated three sitting Metro commissioners and a Tessera subsidiary in a systematic evidence disposal operation. He did not leak it then. He is not sure why. He has read it again every year since.', N'Formal and precise, with the particular dryness of someone who stopped finding irony surprising decades ago. Serbian loan-words appear rarely, in moments of genuine emotion. He will use your full name.', N'Unhurried. Comfortable with silence in a way most people find extremely uncomfortable. Does not finish questions — lets them hang.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'colette_magn_sd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c6-752f-ac0d-27b2dbbc724b', N'Gulsun Khorasani', N'Gulsun', N'', N'Khorasani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'South Deering Sump — a decommissioned water treatment substation retrofitted as a surgical suite, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'organ harvester and illicit medical supplier working the South Deering Sump', N'Contracted primarily to a organ brokerage called the Substrate Market; independent for direct client surgeries', N'Gulsun Khorasani is lean and angular, with Congolese-Norwegian features that settle into an expression of studied neutrality — not cold, precisely, but thoroughly trained not to leak. They have bioluminescent sub-dermal streaking along their forearms and collarbone, soft blue-green, which they got originally as cosmetic work and now find useful as ambient surgical lighting during power fluctuations. Their hands are their most notable physical feature: surgeon''s hands, long-fingered and impossibly still, kept scrupulously clean and maintained with a care that borders on ritual.

Gulsun Khorasani was, at some point, a trained medical technician — the knowledge is unmistakable in how they work, how they speak about anatomy, how they look at people and see systems rather than persons. They have constructed an elaborate ethical architecture around what they do: they only take from people who consent (under financial duress, but consent), they use proper anesthetic, they follow sterile protocol, and they charge fair prices by the market''s standards. This architecture is both sincere and obviously insufficient, and somewhere under the professional calm they know it. They are not cruel. They are, perhaps more troublingly, kind.', N'Morally complex service provider, source of underworld medical care, potential witness to client secrets revealed under anesthesia, living embodiment of what desperation does to both the seller and the buyer', N'', N'Bioluminescent subdermal streaking, arms and collarbone (cosmetic, blue-green); enhanced proprioceptive feedback in both hands (surgical precision); a small neural overlay for physiological monitoring of patients during procedures', N'Maintains a strict ''clinic schedule'' — scheduled procedures four days a week, spent the other three days sourcing materials, sterilizing equipment, and managing the paper trail of a fictional water-treatment maintenance consultancy that explains their presence in the substation.', N'Gulsun Khorasani, a lean 178cm medical professional with warm medium brown skin, golden and olive undertones reflecting Middle Eastern, Hispanic, and Pacific Islander ancestry. High defined cheekbones, narrow jaw, dark eyes with amber flecks. Dark brown hair with silver at temples, pulled back tight. Bioluminescent blue-green subdermal streaking glowing faintly along both forearms and collarbone in delicate branching patterns. Clinical surgical scrubs in muted gray-blue, surgical mask looped around neck. Preternatural stillness, penetrating gaze, economical precise movements. Faint contact dermatitis on knuckles, thin scar on right wrist underside. Cool laboratory lighting casting subtle glow on bioluminescent augmentations. GLMZ medical facility, sterile and clinical aesthetic, professional neutrality in expression. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'South Deering Sump', N'local', N'South Deering Sump', N'Middle Eastern (46.5%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (27.0%) and Pacific Islander (26.5%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones and subtle olive depth, high and defined cheekbones with gentle facial width characteristic of the three ancestry groups'' combined phenotype, and dark brown eyes with warm amber flecks. Refined bone structure with balanced, symmetrical features reflecting the ancestral diversity.', 178, 62, N'Lean and angular with minimal subcutaneous fat; the build of someone who moves with economy and precision. Long-limbed, almost rangy, with the kind of posture that suggests both discipline and chronic tension held in the shoulders.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at the temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid or wrapped in a surgical cap during work hours; when loose, falls past shoulder blades', N'Long', N'Dark brown with flecks of amber near the iris', N'Medium warm brown with golden undertones and subtle olive depth — the blended phenotype of Middle Eastern, Hispanic/Latin American, and Pacific Islander ancestry', N'High, defined cheekbones with gentle facial width; narrow jaw with refined bone structure. Skin kept meticulous and unblemished, almost clinically clean. Fine lines around the eyes suggest either age or habitually narrow focus. Their expression defaults to professional neutrality — the trained blankness of someone who has learned to keep their face a non-response.', N'The bioluminescent subdermal streaking is immediately visible on forearms and collarbone — soft blue-green light that pulses faintly with heartbeat during dim lighting conditions. The enhanced proprioceptive feedback and neural overlay for physiological monitoring are subcutaneous and invisible; only the preternatural steadiness of their hands hints at augmentation. Their pupils may briefly dilate or focus in ways that suggest active neural processing during medical assessment.', N'Moves with surgical precision — economical, controlled, zero wasted motion. When standing at rest, they favor balanced weight distribution, hands loose at sides with fingers naturally extended and still. During conversation, hands remain remarkably motionless unless deliberately gesturing. Their gaze is penetrating and anatomical; they look at people and visibly assess systems. They walk quietly, almost gliding, with the practiced silence of someone who has learned to enter spaces without announcing themselves.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional. During procedures: sterile surgical scrubs in muted grays or deep blue, clinical and worn with the ease of someone who lives in them. Off-hours: practical, high-function clothing in neutral tones — charcoal, slate, deep green. Form-fitting layers that don''t restrict arm movement; clothes that shed biological contamination easily. No logos, no corpo branding, nothing that declares allegiance. Wears a surgical mask around their neck at all times, slipped up instinctively when stressed. Medical-grade gloves in a pocket or tucked into a waistband. No jewelry except a simple silver ring on the right ring finger — the kind you could sterilize in seconds if needed.', N'Three years ago they made a procedural error that cost a client their remaining functional kidney. The client survived on a dialysis rig. Saoirse has been anonymously covering the dialysis costs ever since — Φ40/month — as a form of penance they have never named aloud.', N'clinical and precise, medical terminology that occasionally surfaces unexpectedly in casual speech', N'very quiet, very even, with a doctor''s habit of making statements sound like information rather than opinion', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gulsun_khorasani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d9-7ccb-bf88-27d2ab1c0cd5', N'Agata Chaiyaporn', N'Agata', N'', N'Chaiyaporn', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 40, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Lattice — vertical slum built into scaffolding of an unfinished arcology, near Halsted and Division', N'Evidence removal and scene sanitation — cleaner', N'Freelance — works the Gray Zone circuit exclusively', N'Agata Chaiyaporn is wiry and quick-moving, with the restless energy of someone who converts anxiety into velocity. At 40, his face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and he has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. He works as a cleaner out of The Lattice, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Agata Chaiyaporn describe him as a precision instrument — point him at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Chiamaka Akerlund-Mensah-Bonsu functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would incapacitate. Gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Agata Chaiyaporn, lean mixed-heritage neo-noir climber, 173cm wiry build with defined musculature. Warm golden-brown skin blending Eastern European angular cheekbones with Southeast Asian softness and Sub-Saharan depth. Dark brown eyes with almond shape, sharp calculating gaze. Short dark hair with silver threading at temples. Chrome neural interface nodes visible at left temple. Full lips, weathered face with focus-lines around eyes. Gecko-grip fingertip augmentations faintly visible. Wearing tactical dark matte gear: reinforced climbing harness, sealed utility vest, adhesive gloves. Coiled posture, economical movement. Urban rooftop setting, neon-lit Great Lakes Metro skyline at dusk, cool blue-amber lighting casting shadows across angular features. Gritty, functional aesthetic. GLMZ. Hyper-detailed portrait. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Lattice', N'local', N'The Lattice', N'Eastern European dominant (57.2%) with significant Southeast Asian (26.5%), Sub-Saharan African (11.6%), and minor East Asian (4.7%) ancestry. The Eastern European foundation creates strong angular bone structure, while Southeast Asian genetics soften facial angles and add warmth. Sub-Saharan African ancestry contributes lip fullness and skin depth. East Asian influence visible in eye shape and upper eyelid structure. Result: a striking polychromatic face where Slavic angularity meets Southeast Asian prominence.', 173, 68, N'Wiry and lean with defined musculature from climbing work; minimal body fat; posture suggests coiled readiness rather than relaxation', N'Dark brown with premature silvering at temples', N'Close-cropped fade, maintained with precision — functional, unremarkable', N'Short', N'Dark brown with alert, calculating expression', N'Warm medium-tan brown with golden luminosity. Eastern European ancestry provides structural depth; Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African genetics create the glowing, warm undertone. Complexion deepens visibly with sun exposure.', N'Weathered but not scarred visibly on the face; jaw clenches habitually; lines around the eyes from sustained focus work; minimal facial hair, kept clean-shaven for operational anonymity. Cheekbones sharply defined with Eastern European angularity tempered by Southeast Asian fullness at the apples; straight nose bridge with slight Eastern European prominence; full lips with rich mahogany-brown depth from Sub-Saharan genetics; almond-shaped eyes with slight epicanthic fold from East Asian ancestry, lending a focused, penetrating gaze; overall face reads as severe until animated', N'Chrome pain editor hardware visible at left temple and along the base of the skull — silvered neural interface nodes barely concealed by hair; gecko-grip finger implants visible as subtle textured ridge patterns along fingertips and the soles visible when barefoot; no attempt at concealment', N'Moves with contained efficiency — no wasted motion, economical gestures. At rest, frequently fidgeting or shifting weight between feet. Eyes track exits and potential obstacles habitually. When in motion, flows through space with the precise coordination of someone who climbs vertical surfaces; quick reflexes, minimal deliberation', N'Dual wardrobe: civilian cover wears nondescript Tier 4 streetwear — cheap synthweave jackets, faded dark cargo pants, worn polymer-soled boots from discount chains, nothing that marks him as memorable. On-contract wears tactical gear: reinforced climbing harnesses, adhesive-grip gloves, sealed utility vest with tool distribution for scene work, dark matte finishes, all function over aesthetics. No corporate branding, no gang markers, no persona.', N'Chiamaka Akerlund-Mensah-Bonsu betrayed their previous crew to survive a corporate raid. The crew didn''t survive. Nobody in GLMZ knows this.', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'agata_chaiyaporn');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a0-7832-bdfb-280b6f3b1d73', N'Akiko Dalgaard', N'Akiko', N'', N'Dalgaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 15, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism (Axiom Junior Academy campus); family residence in Hough Reclamation, near Lincoln and Addison', N'scholarship student at Axiom Junior Academy; covert junior hacker on nights and weekends', N'Axiom Junior Academy (scholarship student); informal network of low-tier students who trade cracked academic resources', N'Akiko Dalgaard is a tall, angular girl caught permanently between two worlds — the pressed uniform and controlled expression of Axiom''s scholarship track during the day, and the slouched, ink-stained, wired-in version of herself she becomes at home in Hough. Her skin is a deep blue-black with faint bioluminescent freckles along her cheekbones and collarbone — a cosmetic mod her mother scraped together Φ300 for on her twelfth birthday. She keeps her hair in a high puff threaded with conductive wire she pretends is decorative jewelry. Her eyes are brown and extremely tired.

She is meticulous in a way that reads as cold until you realize she''s actually terrified — of losing the scholarship, of being found out, of going back to Hough full-time with no leverage. She''s built a small side business cracking academic license gates so students can access textbooks their families can''t afford the subscription fees for. She doesn''t charge Tier 1 kids. She charges Tier 3 kids quite a lot. She has a private and intense devotion to an E.L.F. she calls ''the Librarian'' that she believes inhabits the school''s data archive server.', N'Bridge character between corporate and street worlds; information broker for academic/corporate data; potential quest giver for anything involving school systems or low-level Axiom data infrastructure; represents the grinding cost of social mobility', N'', N'Bioluminescent freckle mod (cosmetic). Cheap neural interface jack — the kind that causes mild headaches, installed in a Hough Reclamation body shop for Φ180.', N'Commutes ninety minutes each way between Hough and Edgewater Prism. Maintains a 94th percentile grade average. Cracks two to four software licenses per week from her bedroom after midnight, delivers them through an encrypted dead-drop. Attends mandatory Axiom civic enrichment sessions with her face completely blank.', N'Akiko Dalgaard, 178cm tall, angular East Asian-South Asian-Middle Eastern hybrid phenotype, warm golden-honey-bronze skin with luminous undertones, deep brown eyes shadowed with exhaustion, black hair in tight high puff interwoven with conductive copper-silver wire threading. Pale cyan bioluminescent freckles glowing asymmetrically across cheekbones, visible faint scar on right inner wrist. Wearing oversized dark hoodie, cargo pants with visible tech pockets, cheap smart-fabric gloves, beat-up sneakers. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, posture tense and fidgety, fingers nervous, freckles brightening slightly with concentration. Neon-lit nighttime hacker aesthetic, dim ambient glow highlighting the bioluminescence on her skin, moody blue-violet lighting, shallow depth of field focusing on her angular face and glowing freckles --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'tall angular teenage girl, 15, deep golden-honey-bronze skin with luminous warmth, Pan-Asian and global heritage with striking bone structure, exhausted and sleep-deprived but intelligent, asymmetrical face with sharp cheekbones, long dark eyes with permanent dark circles, faint pale cyan bioluminescent freckles glowing faintly across cheekbones and collarbone, faint peachy-bronze warmth at temples and jawline, pallid from lack of sleep but luminescent quality to skin

