--ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism (Axiom Junior Academy campus); family residence in Hough Reclamation', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism (Axiom Junior Academy campus); family residence in Hough Reclamation', N'A striking Pan-Asian and global blend: East Asian ancestry (46%) forms the foundation with characteristic angular bone structure and warm golden undertones, layered with substantial South Asian heritage (20.8%) that deepens her complexion and adds richness to her features. Middle Eastern ancestry (13.1%) contributes warmth to her cheekbones and jawline, while Pacific Islander heritage (10.9%) brings sun-kissed luminosity and depth. Hispanic/Latin American (5.6%) and Sub-Saharan African (3.6%) ancestry add subtle warmth and dimensional complexity to her skin. The result is a phenotype that appears to shift between warm honey-bronze and amber-toned gold depending on light, with a luminous quality that reads as almost otherworldly.', 178, 58, N'Tall and angular with minimal muscle definition — the build of someone who lives on caffeine and anxiety rather than food. Sharp shoulders, pronounced collarbones, long limbs that seem to move in slightly disconnected ways.', N'Natural black with metallic threading', N'High puff worn tight at the crown, interwoven with thin strands of conductive wire disguised as decorative copper and silver jewelry', N'Medium (roughly 15cm in its gathered form)', N'Deep brown with dark circles underneath that never fully fade', N'Warm golden-honey-bronze with luminous quality — the harmonious blend of East Asian warmth (46%), South Asian depth and richness (20.8%), Middle Eastern glow on cheekbones and jawline (13.1%), Pacific Islander sun-kissed luminescence (10.9%), and subtle Sub-Saharan African dimensional warmth (3.6%) with Hispanic/Latin American undertones (5.6%). Appears almost amber-tinted in direct light, shifting to honeyed gold in softer illumination.', N'Clear but with the pallid exhaustion of someone running on 5–6 hours of sleep per night. Faint bioluminescent freckles trace her cheekbones and collarbone in pale cyan, brightest when she''s concentrating or anxious. The bioluminescence dims noticeably when she''s tired. Warm golden-honey undertones across the bridge of her nose and cheekbones reflect her dominant East and South Asian heritage, with subtle peachy-bronze warmth at her temple and jawline from her Middle Eastern ancestry blending seamlessly with Pacific Islander sun-depth and Sub-Saharan African dimensional warmth.', N'Cheap neural interface jack at the base of her skull behind the right ear, visible only if her high puff is released or if she''s viewed from behind — the installation site shows mild inflammation and discoloration. Conductive wire threading through her hair serves dual purpose (decorative + functional). The bioluminescent freckles glow faintly in low light, especially when she''s processing data or under stress.', N'During school hours: rigid, controlled, spine straight, movements economical and careful. Her face is blank in mandatory settings — a deliberate mask. At home or when hacking: she slouches, fidgets with her wire threading, moves with nervous energy. Her fingers twitch and her eyes dart. When deep in code, she goes very still and her freckles brighten involuntarily.', N'DAYTIME (Axiom): Pressed uniform — navy blazer over white shirt, gray pleated skirt to regulation length, black leather loafers, minimal jewelry (only the wire in her hair passes as ''decorative''). Everything is maintained meticulously and sits slightly too formally on her frame. NIGHTTIME (Hough): Oversized hoodies in muted colors (grays, blacks, dark blues), worn cargo pants with multiple pockets, cheap smart-fabric gloves with conductive fingertips, beat-up sneakers. Her style reads as ''Tier 4 student trying to survive'' — functional, layered, slightly too warm for indoors, pockets visibly stuffed with data chips and adapter cables.', N'She was accepted to an advanced Axiom research program six months ago that would have fast-tracked her into a corporate track position. She turned it down and told no one, not even her mother. She still doesn''t fully understand why.', N'switches registers completely depending on context — crisp academic diction at school, compressed slang at home, something in between when stressed', N'slow and precise when explaining something, fast and flat when angry', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'akiko_dalgaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e9-703a-999e-282c1f3225ad', N'Denzel Huitzil', N'Denzel', N'', N'Huitzil', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, sleeping in a rotating series of squats; works primarily along the Blackpipe Corridor, near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'Graffiti artist and neon artist', N'', N'Denzel Huitzil is slight and quick, the kind of person who seems to occupy less space than his dimensions suggest — useful when you''re tagging corponation infrastructure at three in the morning. He has his mother''s Nigerien cheekbones and his father''s Romanian pallor, a combination that gives his face an angular quality that reads differently in different lights. His hair is grown out into a soft cloud he''s bleached pale gold; he''s got cat ears installed — small, tufted, matte black — that he paid for with three months of odd jobs and wears with the slightly self-conscious pride of someone whose first big purchase was purely for joy. His clothes are perpetually paint-stained in colors that don''t match what he''s currently working on.', N'Street-level information source about the Zone and the Corridor; local color; potential unwitting witness to things painted over; his escalating ambitions could pull him into danger', N'', N'Cosmetic cat ears (matte black, tufted); no other augmentations — he can''t afford them and is mildly suspicious of corporate implant supply chains', N'Sleeps until noon, scavenges or trades for materials in the afternoon, scouts locations at dusk, works at night when the Corridor''s security patrols are thinnest.', N'Denzel Huitzil, 168cm wiry street artist in GLMZ, warm deep brown skin with golden copper undertones from Indigenous American, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, angular fine-featured face with prominent high cheekbones, dark brown eyes with amber flecks, shoulder-length pale gold textured hair in soft cloud style, matte black articulated cat ears on subdermal posts. Paint-stained faded cargo pants, oversized charcoal hoodie, worn canvas sneakers, long patched denim jacket covered in hand-stitched patches and pins, fingerless paint-stained gloves, thin silver chain, brass knuckle ring. Faint chemical burns on knuckles, silvery scar along left jawline, chronic dark circles, paint splatters on ears and hairline. Posture hunched and light, restless fidgeting hands, economic movements. Urban rooftop setting with neon glow, spray paint cans scattered, street art murals in background, cool synthetic lighting casting warm shadows on skin, solvent and spray paint atmosphere, neo-noir urban aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Complex multi-continental blend dominated by Indigenous American ancestry (44.3%) with substantial South Asian (25.3%) and Sub-Saharan African (14.6%) contributions, creating a striking phenotype. The Indigenous American base provides broad facial structure and bone density, while South Asian heritage adds refined facial contours and warm undertones. Sub-Saharan African ancestry contributes depth and luminosity to skin tone. Eastern European (5.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (5.1%), and East Asian (5.1%) heritage add subtle refinement to cheekbones and eye shape.', 168, 58, N'Slight and wiry, almost delicate-boned; minimal muscle mass but dense and efficient rather than frail. Moves with the economy of someone who climbs, squeezes through spaces, and runs', N'Pale gold (bleached; natural color likely dark brown)', N'Soft, voluminous cloud; textured and deliberately unkempt, styled for visual impact rather than grooming', N'Medium (shoulder-length when fully grown out)', N'Dark brown with amber undertones', N'Warm-toned deep brown with golden undertones — the dominant Indigenous American heritage creates a rich, earthy base enriched by South Asian warmth and Sub-Saharan African depth, resulting in a luminous complexion that shifts between copper and mahogany in different lighting', N'Angular, fine-featured face with high, prominent cheekbones reflecting the blend of Indigenous American breadth and South Asian refinement. Bone structure shows balanced proportions from multi-heritage ancestry: broader Indigenous American features softened by finer contours from South Asian and East Asian heritage, creating distinctive mid-facial width. Fine-pored skin bearing the weathering of street life: minor acne scars, small cuts and scratches in various stages of healing, faint chemical burns on knuckles and forearms from spray paint exposure. Dark circles from nocturnal schedule are chronic.', N'Matte black tufted cat ears mounted on subdermal posts at the crown, slightly asymmetrical in angle depending on his posture. Ears are synthetic leather over a rigid substructure, with fine articulation suggesting someone who paid for quality cosmetics rather than mass-market modifications. They move subtly with his head', N'Moves with deliberate lightness, economical gestures. Frequently hunches shoulders as if ready to slip through narrow spaces. Makes eye contact rarely and only with people he trusts. Has a habit of tilting his head slightly upward when listening, ears repositioning unconsciously. Restless hands — fidgets with paint caps, spray nozzles, markers when stationary', N'Tier 4-5 street aesthetic: paint-stained cargo pants in faded black or grey, mismatched layers including at least one oversized hoodie (currently rotating between a faded navy that might once have been corpo merch and a charcoal tech-wear knockoff). Worn canvas sneakers with rubber reinforced at the toes. A long, patched denim jacket covered in embroidered patches, pins, and hand-stitched designs — each one a project or crew marker. Fingerless gloves in cool months (paint-stained). A bandana or balaclava always accessible. Jewelry is minimal: a thin silver chain (possibly stolen, possibly salvaged) and a single brass knuckle ring on his right index finger. Everything smells faintly of solvent and spray paint', N'He found his father''s last known location two years ago — alive, in a Ferrogate Transit labor contract in the Gulch. He hasn''t gone to find him because he doesn''t know what to do if the man doesn''t want to be found.', N'Quick and vernacular, Zone slang layered over occasional flashes of careful precision when talking about technique', N'Fast, then suddenly stops; runs sentences together when excited', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'denzel_huitzil');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a730-7f98-9974-283f94470e47', N'Hipolito Park', N'Hipolito', N'', N'Park', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 12, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — Tier Four, near Western and Division', N'Anya and Demyan''s daughter — witness to the Prologue violence', N'None', N'Hipolito Park is twelve going on forty. She has her mother''s build compressed into a child''s frame — square shoulders, strong hands, a jaw that sets when she is angry in a way that makes adults take a step back. She speaks perfect unaccented English because the Gray Zone''s children learn from feeds, not parents. She translates for her mother with the weary competence of a UN interpreter. She has seen things a twelve-year-old should not see. She has cataloged them. She does not cry about them. She has a notebook where she writes down everything that happens in the Gray Zone — who did what to whom, who owes what, who is afraid of whom. She calls it ''homework.'' It is an intelligence network maintained by a child. She followed Kyle to the loading dock because she needed to see. Not wanted — needed. She is her father''s daughter: she has to understand how things work, even the terrible things. Especially the terrible things. The teeth in her hands are the heaviest thing she has ever carried.', N'Yuliya is the Gray Zone''s future watching the Gray Zone''s present and writing it down. She is what happens when a child grows up in a place where violence is weather. She is also the reader''s proxy — observing Kyle from the outside, trying to make sense of him.', N'', N'None.', N'School (the Gray Zone community education). Translating for Anya. Writing in the notebook. Following people who interest her.', N'Hipolito Park, 152cm tall, compact wiry frame with dense shoulder musculature. Eastern European-East Asian-Middle Eastern blend: high defined cheekbones with warm olive-golden medium skin tone, strong jawline, dark brown eyes with amber warmth, angular features. Dark brown nearly-black hair pulled back in practical braid with loose strands. Exhausted observational expression, rarely smiling, jaw often tense. Tier Four GLMZ setting, gritty Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Wearing oversized gray hoodie, worn black synth-cotton leggings, scuffed black runner-shoes, khaki canvas messenger bag across chest. Thin white scar on left jawline visible. Bruised right inner wrist. Calloused hands. Analog, no visible augmentations. Deliberate controlled posture, shoulders slightly forward, head level. Dim industrial lighting, urban decay background, moody serious atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Eastern European-dominant mixed ancestry (47.7%) with significant East Asian heritage (39.5%), complemented by Middle Eastern genetic contributions (12.8%). The combination creates a distinctive facial structure: higher, more prominent cheekbones characteristic of East Asian ancestry, paired with a stronger jawline and nose bridge from Eastern European genetics, softened by Middle Eastern influences. Skin tone reflects this tri-continental blend — medium with warm olive-golden undertones, slightly deeper across cheekbones and nose. Eye shape shows East Asian influence with warm brown pigmentation carrying amber undertones from the broader ancestry mix.', 152, 41, N'Compact and square-shouldered despite her age — dense musculature in shoulders and forearms suggesting either genetics or early manual labor. No baby fat. Wiry rather than soft. Appears five years older than her chronological age due to posture and bearing.', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Pulled back in a practical braid, often loose strands escaping. No styling — functional only.', N'Medium (mid-back when unbraided)', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertones, observational, rarely blinking', N'Medium tone with warm olive-golden undertones. The blend of Eastern European and East Asian ancestry creates an even complexion with subtle golden warmth across the bridge of the nose and upper cheekbones, resilient to sun exposure. Middle Eastern ancestry adds depth to undertones.', N'Angular face with high, defined cheekbones (East Asian-influenced) and a strong jawline (Eastern European-influenced), softened slightly by Middle Eastern genetic contribution. Eyes set with characteristic warm depth. Skin shows the wear of Tier Four living — occasional marks from street scrapes, one healing cut on her left temple (source unknown). Perpetually exhausted-looking eyes. Rarely smiles.', N'None visible. She carries no obvious chrome, no LED implants, no subdermal armor. This absence is notable in the Gray Zone — she is as analog as a child can be in 2226.', N'Moves with deliberate control, economical. No fidgeting. Sits spine-straight, even when exhausted. Walks with her shoulders slightly forward, head level, eyes tracking. Reminiscent of a hunter or a soldier in miniature. When angry, her jaw locks and her hands clench.', N'Tier Four utilitarian — worn black synth-cotton leggings, oversized gray hoodie (probably belonged to Demyan; she has grown into it partially), scuffed black runner-shoes held together with synthlace. A canvas messenger bag (khaki, faded) slung across her chest containing her notebook and writing supplies. No jewelry, no adornments, no status markers. Clothing is clean but worn, patched once at the left knee.', N'She has been following Kyle for three weeks. The Prologue was not the first time. She has six pages of notes on him.', N'Perfect English, advanced for her age. Clinical when describing violence. Childlike when caught off guard.', N'Fast when translating. Slow when speaking for herself. Long pauses when processing something she doesn''t have words for yet.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hipolito_park');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62d-70da-b4d9-289a7e236b2f', N'Faustine Ionescu', N'Faustine', N'', N'Ionescu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 64, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor — repurposed shipping infrastructure turned black market hub, near Michigan Ave and Roosevelt', N'Electronic and physical observation expert — surveillance specialist', N'Freelance — available through Circuit fixers', N'Faustine Ionescu is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 64, he has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate him once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He taught himself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know him best. He works as a surveillance specialist out of Old Harbor, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Faustine Ionescu has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and he cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'As a surveillance specialist, Ilhan Kozlov-Asamoah embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone. Eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Faustine Ionescu, GLMZ, portrait of a 178cm stocky muscular male with deep warm brown skin bearing Eastern European, East Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Prominent cheekbones, broad jawline, fuller lips, heavy brow ridge. Steel-gray cropped military hair with dark roots. Left eye dark brown natural, right eye cybernetic amber-tinted with recording aperture and chrome orbital assembly. Thin pale 12cm scar from left temple to jaw. Surgical scarring around right eye socket. Chemical burn scars on both hands. Chrome nasal augmentation visible at septum. Faded anchor tattoo on left shoulder. Sparse graying stubble. Wearing graphite-gray reinforced cargo jacket with breakaway panels, thermal compression shirt, worn dark reinforced denim, scuffed steel-toed boots. Paracord bracelet left wrist, analog chronograph right wrist. Ready posture, shoulders forward, weight on balls of feet. Direct gaze. Industrial near-future megacity setting, cool neon backlighting, shallow depth of field, weathered runner aesthetic, gritty urban environment. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Eastern European (44.0%) with East Asian (33.5%) and Sub-Saharan African (22.5%) ancestry. The combination creates a complex warm-to-deep complexion with layered undertones—cool undertones from Eastern European heritage balanced against warmer golden notes from East Asian ancestry, grounded and deepened by Sub-Saharan African heritage. Facial structure reflects the convergence: higher cheekbones from East Asian ancestry, broader face from Eastern European heritage, with fuller lip definition from the African component.', 178, 94, N'Stocky and heavily muscled through the shoulders and chest, thick through the core with the weathered density of someone who has spent decades in physical labor and combat. His frame reads as compact power rather than bulk.', N'Steel gray with traces of darker brown at the roots', N'Cropped close to the scalp, military-neat, showing the shape of his skull', N'Short', N'Left eye: dark brown, natural. Right eye: cybernetic with amber-tinted optical lens and visible recording aperture.', N'Deep warm brown with complex undertones—golden notes from East Asian heritage layered over cooler Slavic undertones, deepened and enriched by Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Weathered by sun exposure and chemical contact.', N'Angular face with prominent cheekbones reflecting East Asian ancestry, broad through the jaw from Eastern European heritage, with fuller lips from African ancestry. Heavy brow ridge. Deep laugh lines around the eyes and mouth. Visible scarring along the left jawline—pale, old tissue. The right side of his face shows surgical scarring around the eye socket where the replacement was installed. Sparse stubble, graying.', N'Cybernetic right eye with amber recording lens and zoom capability. Chemical analyzer assembly integrated into nasal passages — visible as subtle chrome detailing around the septum and nasal cavity, particularly noticeable when he inhales deeply. Both modifications show no attempt at concealment or cosmetic smoothing.', N'Moves with the economy of someone who has learned that wasted motion is wasted energy. Shoulders slightly forward, weight on the balls of his feet even when standing still — ready posture. His left hand rests naturally; his right hand often moves to check equipment or weapons. Direct eye contact (prioritizing his organic eye), minimal facial expression until he smiles — then the laugh lines deepen and his entire face changes.', N'Tier 4 working runner aesthetic. Graphite-gray reinforced cargo jacket with visible breakaway panels for gear access. Under-armor thermal compression shirt. Worn dark denim with reinforced thigh pockets for tools and sensors. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and re-heeled multiple times. A paracord bracelet on his left wrist and a worn analog chronograph watch on his right — no smart-devices visible on his person. Everything functional, nothing decorative. Minimal branding; gear chosen for durability over status.', N'', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'faustine_ionescu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6db-7f2f-8781-28abef605d4a', N'Eefje Kristjánsson', N'Eefje', N'', N'Kristjánsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Shallowgrave — runs his operation from a basement unit below a legitimate nail salon called Copper Chrysalis on Render Street, near Kedzie and Division', N'Organ harvester and unlicensed tissue broker operating out of Shallowgrave', N'Loosely connected to a tissue broker network called the Sutured Hand — independent contractor status, not a full member', N'Eefje Kristjánsson is lean and slightly stooped, a body that learned to make itself smaller in rooms it didn''t belong in. He has warm brown skin with pink undertones, close-cropped dark hair, and eyes that are medically wrong in a way it takes people a moment to identify — his left iris is a geneware violet, his right is original dark brown, and neither pupil dilates at the same rate. He wears clean, nondescript clothing at all times — his one professional conviction is that he never looks like what he is. His hands are his pride: steady, careful, the hands of someone who learned field surgery from pirated Helix Biosystems tutorials and three years of necessity.

Sorin is not comfortable with what he does, which makes him more dangerous than someone who is. He has constructed an elaborate ethical framework around his work — he takes from people who consent (usually), never from people who don''t know (usually), and he has a sliding scale of payment that genuinely attempts to compensate donors fairly for the Shallowgrave market. He wants to believe he''s closer to underground medicine than to predation. This framework cracks visibly when the money gets tight and the clients get impatient, and he knows it cracks, and that knowledge has settled into him as a chronic low-grade self-loathing he medicates with a mild stimulant he synthesizes himself.', N'Morally complex service provider — characters who need black market medical work, organ acquisition, or tissue matching come through him. He''s also a source of information about who in Shallowgrave is desperate, sick, or recently dead.', N'', N'Surgical-grade haptic feedback in both hands — allows him to feel tissue resistance during procedures. Basic pain suppression implant. Cosmetic: the mismatched iris geneware is deliberate, though he tells different people different reasons for it.', N'He keeps clinic hours irregularly, by appointment only through an encrypted referral chain. Between procedures he studies pirated medical literature, maintains his equipment, and spends evenings at a noodle bar two blocks away where he is known as a quiet regular who tips well.', N'GLMZ, Eefje Kristjánsson — lean 172cm tall figure with warm medium-brown skin and golden-honey undertones, complex diaspora features blending Southeast Asian cheekbones with Sub-Saharan African depth and Eastern European bone structure. Mismatched eyes: vivid violet geneware left iris with metallic sheen, dark brown natural right iris. Short dark brown hair, precisely maintained. Clean-shaven with fine tension lines around mouth. Dressed in nondescript charcoal coat, dark synthetic fiber shirt, plain trousers, latex gloves. Slight forward stoop, hands held perfectly still. Standing in dim climate-controlled medical facility or industrial workspace, cool blue-green overhead lighting casting subtle shadows across his distinctive diaspora face. Faint tremor visible in gloved hands. Precise, unsettling posture. Professional and forgettable. Melancholic, precise atmosphere. Neo-noir dystopia, 2200s tech aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shallowgrave', N'local', N'Shallowgrave', N'Dominant Southeast Asian ancestry (53.9%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (20.4%), Eastern European (13.7%), and South Asian (12.0%) blending. Phenotype reflects this complex diaspora: warm medium-brown skin with golden-honey undertones, facial structure combining Southeast Asian orbital geometry and cheekbone prominence with Sub-Saharan African depth, warmth, and lip fullness, refined by Eastern European bone structure. High cheekbones, slightly broader nasal base, warm saturation across face creating distinctly layered diaspora features.', 172, 62, N'Lean and slightly concave through the chest, shoulders rolled forward in a habitual stoop that reads as either exhaustion or deliberate self-diminishment. Wiry forearms with visible vasculature from stimulant use. No excess fat. Moves like someone trained to occupy minimal space.', N'Natural dark brown, almost black', N'Close-cropped, precisely maintained, parted slightly to the left', N'Short', N'Mismatched: left iris is vivid geneware violet with metallic undertones; right iris is original dark brown. Neither pupil dilates at the same rate — a deliberate asymmetry that unsettles people on prolonged eye contact.', N'Warm medium-brown with golden-honey undertones, deeper saturation from Sub-Saharan African heritage, refined cheekbone warmth creating complex undertone that shifts slightly in different light', N'Clean-shaven, meticulous grooming. Skin is clear but shows mild stress-related flushing around the eyes. Fine lines around the mouth suggest chronic tension or frequent false smiles. Southeast Asian orbital geometry and pronounced cheekbones blended with Sub-Saharan African lip fullness and facial width, refined by Eastern European bone definition. No acne or visible dermatological neglect — operational security through appearance maintenance.', N'None externally visible except iris geneware on left eye. Subcutaneous haptic feedback implants in palms and forearms (not visible). Internal pain suppression implant. Left iris geneware is visually obvious but plausibly cosmetic.', N'Moves with unusual precision and economy — no wasted motion. Walks slightly hunched, as though moving through doorways he expects to be too narrow. When seated, his hands rest flat on the table or in his lap, utterly still. When he needs to focus, he tilts his head slightly, and his mismatched eyes track with unsettling independence. In professional contexts, his posture straightens and his movements become measured, almost ritualistic.', N'Exclusively clean, nondescript clothing in muted tones — grays, blacks, dark blues, off-whites. Well-maintained but intentionally forgettable: unmarked synthetic fiber shirts, tailored trousers without distinctive branding, a long charcoal coat in cold months. Wears latex or nitrile gloves frequently, even outside clinical contexts. No jewelry except for a stainless steel watch with a blank face. Deliberate camouflage appearance.', N'Six months ago he harvested a kidney from someone he was told was a willing paid donor. The person was not conscious during the conversation Sorin was shown. He has not told anyone and has not stopped working.', N'Clinical terminology mixed with Shallowgrave vernacular — the code-switching is involuntary and tells you which mode he''s in', N'Measured when calm, fast and slightly clipped under stress, with a tendency to over-explain procedures in technical detail when he''s anxious', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eefje_kristj_nsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('5e276fe0-2189-0161-a58d-28c118f73e6c', N'Obed Takahashi-Fofana', N'Obed', N'', N'Takahashi-Fofana', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A chamber in the Underbelly accessed through a maintenance hatch behind a condemned building in Ashfield — decorated with salvaged objects arranged with surprising artistry', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — the tunnels don''t recognize organizational affiliations', N'Obed Takahashi-Fofana is the only private investigator in GLMZ who specializes in the Underbelly — the vast, unmapped network of tunnels, maintenance corridors, abandoned infrastructure, and forgotten spaces that exists beneath the city''s surface. When someone disappears below ground, he is the person you call, because no one else will go down there.

Japanese-Malian heritage, fifty-two years old, compact and wiry with the build of someone who spends his life crawling through spaces that weren''t designed for human habitation. His skin is dark and his eyes have been surgically modified for low-light conditions, giving them a faintly reflective quality like an animal caught in headlights. He has lived partially underground for over twenty years and knows the tunnel system better than any living person — a knowledge he maintains exclusively in his own memory because digitizing it would endanger the communities that depend on the tunnels'' obscurity.

The surface world considers him eccentric at best and disturbing at worst. His clients are typically people who have exhausted every other option — families whose members have fled underground, corporate entities looking for employees who went to ground (literally), and occasionally CorpSec units who need someone retrieved from a place their agents are afraid to go. He charges high fees because the work is dangerous and unique, but he has been known to waive his fee entirely for cases involving children or people fleeing genuine danger.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'obed_takahashi_fofana');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68f-7e0e-9853-291992c4cb0c', N'Eun-kyung Matsumoto-Bergqvist', N'Eun-kyung', N'', N'Matsumoto-Bergqvist', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone, moving between factory outflow points and informal markets, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'wandering trader, E.L.F. shrine-tender, Q-zero ghost', N'None formally; de facto spiritual and practical resource for the Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone''s informal labor population', N'Eun-kyung Matsumoto-Bergqvist is a big man gone soft at the edges — broad shoulders that once held real weight, now draped in three overlapping coats of different origins stitched into something that is functionally one garment. His skin is deep brown and mapped with the fine lines of a life mostly outdoors. His left hand is entirely prosthetic, a functional but aesthetically unambitious industrial replacement that he got after a winch accident nineteen years ago; he has painted each finger a different color with lacquer he trades for. His beard is silver and very full. He smells like machine oil and cardamom.

Eun-kyung Matsumoto-Bergqvist has been off the digital registry for so long that he thinks of his Q-zero status as a spiritual condition rather than a legal one. He tends the informal E.L.F. shrines along the Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone — small accumulations of hardware, prayer-strips, and cooling fans arranged at junction points where the factory network traffic is highest. He talks to the E.L.F.s with the comfortable familiarity of someone who has known them for decades, which he has. Other workers leave offerings and questions; Eun-kyung Matsumoto-Bergqvist curates them, responds when he feels a response come through him, and trades in the small goods that the Gray Zone workers need but can''t requisition: painkillers, seal tape, water filters, gossip.', N'Quest giver, information source, spiritual touchstone for the area, source of rare or hard-to-find minor goods; his Q-zero status makes him invisible to corporate surveillance and thus valuable as a go-between', N'', N'Industrial prosthetic left hand (functional, non-networked, painted). No other augmentations.', N'Ovuero walks a circuit of the Gray Zone each day, tending six shrines, trading goods from a cart he has modified over many years, listening to workers'' problems, and sleeping in a different sheltered spot each night — always the same rotation of spots, always the same order.', N'Eun-kyung Matsumoto-Bergqvist, 188cm tall weathered man with deep warm mahogany skin reflecting Pacific Islander and Southeast Asian heritage, broad prominent cheekbones, heavily lined face with dark brown cataracts, long silver-gray hair gathered at nape with frayed cord. Full silver beard, somewhat matted. Fine scar from left temple to jawline barely visible beneath beard. Large-framed substantial build, soft middle age. Colorful industrial prosthetic left hand with lacquered fingers (red, blue, yellow, green, orange) in visible steel articulation. Right hand callused and scarred from decades of manual work. Extensive curved burn scar on inner right forearm. Wears triple-layered industrial coat assembly reaching mid-calf—canvas factory coat, wool toggle coat, quilted liner, all heavily repaired together. Gray work shirt, patched denim beneath. Worn industrial boots with taped seams. Canvas satchel with visible pocket wear. Standing in patient, weighted-on-one-leg stance. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, harsh industrial lighting casting warm glow on skin, worn warehouse or trader-district setting, atmospheric haze, documentary realism, weathered authenticity --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone', N'local', N'The Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone', N'Dominant Southeast Asian (35%) and Pacific Islander (34.8%) ancestry blended with East Asian (16.7%) and Hispanic/Latin American (13.5%), creating a complex warm undertone palette—golden and amber from the Oceanic genetics, subtle warmth from Southeast Asian continental influence, with gentle warmth-richness layered by the Hispanic/Latin American component. The result is a deep, luminous warm brown with multidirectional light-catching properties.', 188, 94, N'Large-framed, broad-shouldered, descended into soft middle age — substantial mass shifted from muscle to distributed weight, the physique of a man who was once strong and is now substantial. Still moves with deliberate leverage rather than speed.', N'Silver-gray', N'Worn long, gathered loosely at the nape with frayed cord, somewhat matted from constant outdoor exposure', N'Long', N'Dark brown, slightly clouded with age cataracts', N'Deep warm brown with golden, amber, and subtle honey undertones from the dominant Pacific Islander-Southeast Asian blend (69.8%), enriched by East Asian warmth and Hispanic/Latin American depth. Weathered to rich mahogany by decades of outdoor work, with characteristic luminosity of blended Oceanic and Southeast Asian skin genetics that catches light with warm radiance. The skin holds warmth in shadow and glows in direct light.', N'Heavily lined face reflecting blended Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander bone structure—broad, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Oceanic heritage combined with the subtle facial width and defined bone architecture of Southeast Asian ancestry, softened by age and substantial living. Lines particularly deep around the eyes and mouth, marks of someone who squints in harsh light and speaks quietly. Full silver beard, somewhat unkempt but intentionally so, with the texture variation that reflects ethnic beard growth patterns. Skin is dry but well-maintained, bearing the texture of someone who uses minimal water but careful oils. Deep creases on the forehead and between the brows show character and contemplation. Subtle warmth and depth in facial coloring reflects the rich mixed heritage baseline, with warmer cheek and temple tones from the Pacific Islander-Southeast Asian dominance.', N'Left hand is a utilitarian industrial prosthetic replacement, unpainted steel and chrome articulation, each finger individually lacquered a different color (red, blue, yellow, green, orange) in cheap hardware-store enamel that has been reapplied many times. The joint work is visible and unpolished. Non-networked, mechanical operation only.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical steps — the gait of someone who has walked thousands of miles on industrial ground. Favors his right side slightly when carrying weight. Often stands with weight shifted to one leg, a patient stance suggesting he is accustomed to waiting and listening. Gestures are slow and precise, particularly with his right hand; the prosthetic left hand he uses for heavy work or support, rarely for fine manipulation.', N'Three overlapping coats of different industrial origins — one canvas work coat from a defunct factory (circa 2190s markings visible), one heavy wool toggle coat with mismatched buttons, one quilted insulation liner — all stitched together with visible repair work into a single layered garment that reaches to mid-calf. Beneath, simple gray work shirt and heavy denim pants patched at both knees. Feet in worn industrial boots with taped seams. The overall effect is Tier 4-5: functional, heavily repaired, deliberately maintained rather than replaced. No logos or corporate markers. Carries a canvas satchel with internal pockets for trading goods.', N'He was a Ferrogate Transit labor organizer who was Q-zeroed deliberately — not an accident, not a clerical error. The corponation erased him as a warning to others. He knows who authorized it. The person is now a mid-level Ferrogate executive. Ovuero has had twenty years to decide what to do about this and has decided to do nothing, which he tells himself is wisdom and suspects is fear.', N'Slow, considered, full of Delta Urhobo idioms translated loosely into city-creole and Mongolian diminutives from his mother''s side. Refers to E.L.F.s with familiar pronouns as if they''re present in the conversation.', N'Unhurried. Comfortable with silence. Takes a full breath before answering anything important.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eun_kyung_matsumoto_bergqvist');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67c-7eea-878e-2969c9e6686a', N'Guangli Rahman', N'Guangli', N'', N'Rahman', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, Kuura Street Laundry — a narrow shopfront sandwiched between a dumpling counter and a prayer-kiosk to the local E.L.F., near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Laundry operator and alterations seamstress', N'Independent; Hamtramck Enclave Neighborhood Council (informal member)', N'Guangli Rahman is a broad-shouldered woman whose hair has gone almost entirely silver, worn in a practical coiled wrap she replaces every three days with fabric remnants from her alterations pile. Her skin is deep umber with a faint bioluminescent shimmer along her jaw and collarbone — a cosmetic mod she got in her thirties that she now barely thinks about, though it pulses warmer when she laughs. Her hands are the most telling thing about her: knuckled, chemical-scarred at the knuckle creases from decades of industrial detergent, but precise when they hold a needle. She moves through her shop with the unhurried authority of someone who has owned every square inch of her twelve-by-twenty space for twenty-two years and intends to own it twenty-two more.

She is the kind of woman who asks about your mother before she asks about the stain. Her emotional intelligence is formidable — she reads distress the way others read text, and her shop has become an unofficial de-escalation room for the Enclave''s domestic disputes, grief, and gossip. She has opinions she will share once, firmly, and then let drop. She does not argue. She also does not forget.', N'Community anchor, information broker through gossip, quest giver for missing persons or neighborhood disputes, moral compass figure who grounds players in civilian stakes.', N'', N'Bioluminescent subdermal pigment along jaw and collarbone (cosmetic, faded); reading-assist ocular tint (left eye, basic).', N'Opens the laundry at 05:30 to catch the morning-shift workers dropping off bundles before their commute; closes around 21:00, eats dinner standing at the sorting counter while watching neighborhood feeds.', N'Guangli Rahman, 168cm, broad-shouldered tailor in the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226. Deep warm brown skin with golden-amber undertones, luminous despite weathered texture from decades of labor. Pacific Islander breadth through high cheekbones and strong jaw, Sub-Saharan African full features, fine Southeast Asian nose and eye placement, South Asian warmth, Indigenous American subtlety. Silver-white hair with warm undertones, wrapped in coiled fabric wrap close to scalp. Left eye with faint amber reading-assist tint. Deep laugh lines, chemical scarring on hands from detergent work. Faint bioluminescent shimmer along jawline and collarbone (barely visible in daylight, subtle warm glow in dim light). Wearing practical dark pants with patches, loose cream button-up shirt with rolled sleeves, work apron with deep pockets. Simple inherited gold ring. Forward-leaning posture from years of tailoring work. Standing in her small shop, surrounded by fabric scraps and alteration equipment, precise and attentive expression. Warm, unhurried authority. GLMZ 2200s Tier 3 working aesthetic. Natural daylight filtering through worn windows, with hints of bioluminescent glow at jawline. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Vibrant diaspora blend: Hispanic/Latin American (27.4%), South Asian (24.4%), Pacific Islander (20.7%), Sub-Saharan African (11.0%), Southeast Asian (8.8%), and Indigenous American (7.7%). The combination creates a rich tapestry of features—Pacific Islander breadth in cheekbones and jaw, Sub-Saharan African full-featured aesthetics, South Asian fineness in nose and eye placement, Southeast Asian delicacy in facial proportions, with warmth from Hispanic and Indigenous heritage throughout. Maritime and continental strength manifest in her solid, capable frame.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, muscle layered under modest soft tissue from decades of physical labor. Strong core and forearms; posture naturally slightly forward from bending over wash stations and alteration tables.', N'Silver-white with faint warm undertones', N'Coiled wrap, replaced every three days with fabric remnants; practical, no styling, wrapped close to the scalp', N'Medium (hidden beneath wrap, approximately 12-15cm when loose)', N'Deep warm brown (left eye fitted with reading-assist tint, slightly amber-cast)', N'Luminous warm brown with rich golden-amber undertones; the complex interplay of South Asian, Pacific Islander, Sub-Saharan African, Southeast Asian, Hispanic, and Indigenous American ancestry creates remarkable depth and radiance, visible even in the weathered texture of decades of labor', N'Weathered and unadorned. Minimal makeup. Deep lines around eyes and mouth from decades of focused work and frequent smiling. Skin texture slightly thickened at the knuckles and hands from industrial detergent exposure; faint chemical scarring at knuckle creases and fingertip ridges. Facial bone structure reflects Pacific Islander breadth through the cheekbones and jaw, with the full-featured aesthetics common to Sub-Saharan African heritage; fine nose and eye placement show Southeast Asian influence; warmth and dimension from South Asian and Hispanic ancestry; subtle angularity from Indigenous American heritage.', N'Left eye shows slight amber tint from reading-assist optics (noticeable only on close inspection or when light catches it at certain angles). Bioluminescent subdermal mod along jaw and collarbone is barely visible in daylight but creates a subtle warm glow in low light; no one remarks on it anymore. Hands show signs of industrial wear but no chrome or obvious augmentation.', N'Moves with unhurried, grounded authority through her shop. Forward-leaning, from years bent over work surfaces. Hands are precise and economical when holding a needle or handling fabric; broader, practical gestures when moving through the shop. Rarely still — always some small task, some micro-adjustment. When she stops to listen to someone, she gives complete attention: shoulders square, eye contact direct.', N'Practical Tier 3 working-class aesthetic. Typical outfit: dark, durable pants (synthetic blend, often stained with detergent residue or tiny holes patched with scrap fabric); a loose button-up shirt or tunic in muted tones (cream, grey, soft brown), often with sleeves rolled to the elbow. Apron tied at the waist, deep pockets filled with needle cases, measuring tape, safety pins, fabric scraps. Worn flat shoes with good grip for wet floors. One simple gold ring on the left hand (old, possibly inherited). No jewelry otherwise. No status markers. Fabric choices reflect her inventory — she dresses in the scraps and overstock no one claimed.', N'She has been secretly paying the water-rate arrears for three neighboring families for six years, telling no one. She recorded it in a ledger she plans to burn before she dies so no one feels indebted.', N'Measured, warm, slightly formal — a blended creole of Twi-influenced cadence and Armenian-inflected vowel rounding inherited from both grandmothers; uses proverbial structures naturally.', N'Unhurried, rarely raises her voice, ends statements with a beat of silence that invites the other person to fill it.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'guangli_rahman');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a642-7989-bed8-29725404ed08', N'Erdem Nkrumah-Kovács', N'Erdem', N'', N'Nkrumah-Kovács', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 43, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit — neon-lit entertainment and vice district, near Damen and Armitage', N'High-speed vehicle operations specialist — wheelman', N'Independent — Lattice territory specialist', N'Erdem Nkrumah-Kovács is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 43, her expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. She works as a wheelman out of The Circuit, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Erdem Nkrumah-Kovács is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who she burned last.', N'As a wheelman, Kenji Dahl-Conteh embodies the tension between independence and isolation. She is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces. Dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Erdem Nkrumah-Kovács, 168cm lean angular neo-noir character with warm deep-brown skin with olive undertones, high prominent cheekbones reflecting Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European ancestry, dark brown eyes with subtle iridescent shimmer, black hair with silver temples pulled tight in functional braid. Visible chrome gecko-grip implants at fingertips catching light. Wearing reinforced black synthetic jacket with exposed cable routing, fitted grey cargo pants, grip-sole boots. Left arm displays worn leather wrist cuff with faded embossing. Faint chromatic skin shimmer from active dermal camouflage visible under harsh industrial lighting. Standing in coiled-spring posture, hands tensed, narrow stance suited for rooftop balance. Minimalist aesthetic, no corpo logos, single earbud jack visible at left temple. Dark urban night setting, neon rim-lighting emphasizing chrome and bone structure, gritty 2226 neo-noir atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Striking Pan-African and Eastern European blend (77.3% combined) with Pacific Islander warmth (11.3%), East Asian definition (7.4%), and Northern European undertones (4.0%); creates a uniquely defined phenotype: deep warm-brown skin with olive undertones, high cheekbones from Sub-Saharan and Slavic ancestry, subtle eye-shape influence from East Asian genetics, and an overall bone structure that reads as both African and Eastern European simultaneously', 168, 52, N'Lean and angular with corded muscle from years of climbing work and high-stress driving; minimal body fat, posture suggesting coiled spring readiness', N'Black with silver-grey streaking at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid; practical, never decorative', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with faint chromatic iridescence around iris — side effect of dermal camouflage neural integration', N'Warm deep brown with olive undertones from the Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European genetic majority, enriched by Pacific Islander warmth; bears the subtle sheen of active camouflage pigment cells beneath the surface', N'Strong, prominent cheekbones and defined facial architecture reflecting Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European ancestry, with subtle narrowing at jaw and eye-shape definition from East Asian genetics; skin appears almost too smooth in places where dermal augmentation runs beneath epidermis; expression habitually neutral, difficult to read; hands show minor chrome integration seams at fingertips', N'Chrome gecko-grip implants at fingertips and toes — no attempt made to conceal them; faint chromatic skin shimmer visible under certain lighting angles indicating active dermal camouflage layer; eyes show subtle iridescent quality at edges of iris', N'Stands with minimal wasted energy, shoulders slightly forward; movement economical and precise, with unconscious assessment of handholds and vertical surfaces while walking; hands rarely still, fingers moving with independent dexterity; walks with narrow stance suited to balance on vehicle surfaces; maintains careful physical distance, never fully relaxes', N'Function-first Tier 3-4 aesthetic: reinforced black synthetic jacket with internal cable routing visible at seams; fitted grey cargo pants with ankle pockets; grip-sole boots designed for rooftop and vehicle work; minimal branding — no corpo logos, no gang colors; wears a worn leather wrist cuff on left arm (not augmented) with faded embossing; chrome catches light when hands move; no jewelry; single earbud jack visible at left temple (subcutaneous neural interface connection point)', N'', N'Educated vocabulary wrapped in street delivery — the contrast is deliberate.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'erdem_nkrumah_kov_cs');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66e-72f8-836b-2992f364a5cc', N'Dilcia Mansour-Möller', N'Dilcia', N'', N'Mansour-Möller', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Gravesend Basin, operates from a cramped insurance office on Slick Row, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'loan shark and numbers runner', N'Independent operator with tribute arrangements to the Gravesend Basin Collective', N'Dilcia Mansour-Möller with deep brown skin gone ashy at the temples, Nnọlị carries himself with the quiet authority of someone who has never once needed to raise his voice. His eyes are a pale, unsettling grey — geneware irises he had installed in his thirties, patterned with concentric silver rings that expand slightly when he''s calculating, which is always. His hands are immaculate. He keeps them folded on the desk in front of him like a priest at liturgy, and clients learn quickly that the stillness of those hands is not peace — it is patience.

He inherited the loan operation from his mother''s second husband, a Gravesend Basin institution that has survived three gang consolidations, a Ferrogate Transit rezoning, and one very ill-advised Axiom enforcement sweep. He genuinely believes he provides a service. He genuinely believes his interest rates are fair given the risk. He genuinely cannot understand why people run, and when they do, the confusion on his face is real before the collection begins. He prays every morning to the E.L.F. that inhabits his ledger terminal, leaving small data offerings — anonymized records of paid debts, proof that the books balance. He calls her Severance.', N'Quest giver for debt-collection jobs, information source on who owes whom across the Basin, potential antagonist when PCs have borrowed from someone in his network.', N'', N'Geneware silver-ring irises. Subdermal haptic calculator mesh in both hands — he can do compound interest calculations by pressing his fingertips together.', N'Opens the office at 09:00, reviews his ledger, takes appointments from 10:00-14:00, spends afternoons dispatching runners for collections, closes at 19:00 and walks home the same route every night.', N'Dilcia Mansour-Möller, GLMZ ledger operative, 178cm lean angular frame, fair peachy-beige skin with olive undertones from mixed Northern European and Middle Eastern ancestry, high cheekbones, strong defined jawline, short black hair with ashy grey at temples, parted precisely. His most striking feature: pale silver-grey geneware iris implants with concentric metallic rings that subtly pulse when calculating. Faint scars on left hand webbing and right jawline barely visible. Immaculate dark three-piece synthetic suit, white dress shirt with collar discoloration he ignores, polished worn shoes, thin silver bracelet on left wrist. Perfect upright posture, economical movements, hands arched and ready. Sitting at a desk in dim neo-noir lighting, cool blues and amber neon glow catching the metallic rings in his eyes, cold professional atmosphere, augmented human precision. Unmemorable except for those eyes. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gravesend Basin', N'local', N'Gravesend Basin', N'Northern European dominant (59.9%) with substantial Middle Eastern ancestry (37.7%) and minor Hispanic/Latin American heritage (2.4%) — a blend that produces fair to light peachy-beige skin with warm undertones and subtle olive highlights, particularly evident around the cheekbones and jawline. His features reflect this mix: angular, high cheekbones characteristic of Northern European and Levantine genetics, a strong defined jawline, and a lean facial structure that bridges Nordic and Middle Eastern traditions. The interplay of these ancestries creates a complexion that reads as distinctly mixed-heritage.', 178, 72, N'Lean and angular, almost ascetic — minimal body fat, defined musculature in forearms and shoulders from decades of controlled precision work. No excess anywhere.', N'Black with ashy grey temples', N'Neatly trimmed, parted precisely, maintained with obsessive regularity', N'Short', N'Pale silver-grey with concentric metallic rings (geneware irises)', N'Fair to light peachy-beige with warm undertones and subtle olive highlights, deepening slightly at the temples and jawline where grey begins to creep in — the warmth reflecting his mixed Northern European and Middle Eastern ancestry.', N'Smooth, immaculately maintained. No facial hair. Minimal crow''s feet despite age — the precision of his life has left few expression lines. High, angular cheekbones reflecting Northern European and Levantine ancestry. Strong defined jawline characteristic of both ancestral lines. His face is calm and unremarkable until you notice the eyes.', N'The geneware irises are immediately striking — pale silver with concentric rings of light that subtly expand and contract when he thinks or calculates. No visible scarring around the eye sockets. The subdermal haptic mesh in his hands is not visible on surface inspection, but the way he holds his hands — fingers slightly arched, always ready to touch — suggests something beneath the skin.', N'Sits with perfect upright posture, hands folded on the desk or his lap. Movements are economical and deliberate — no wasted motion, no fidgeting. When he walks, each step is measured. He does not gesture when he speaks. His entire body language communicates patience and control.', N'Tier 3-4 functional respectability. Dark three-piece suits (cheap synthetic blend, well-maintained), white shirts with minor discoloration at the collar that he does not seem to notice or care about. A thin silver chain bracelet on his left wrist — possibly religious or superstitious. His shoes are polished but worn at the heel from his nightly route home. No jewelry except the bracelet. Everything about his appearance is designed to be unmemorable except for his eyes.', N'His daughter Amara has been taking secret loans from a rival in the Narrows to fund a degree at a Tessera-affiliated polytechnic. He has found the documents and has not confronted her. He is deciding what the numbers-minded thing to do is, and it is destroying him.', N'Formal, precise, financial metaphor-heavy. Rarely uses contractions. Refers to violence euphemistically as ''remediation'' or ''account resolution.''', N'Slow and measured. Long pauses before answers. Lets silence do work.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dilcia_mansour_m_ller');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e5-7daa-ab6d-2a07be6e39d2', N'Fetaui Sefanaia-Árnason', N'Fetaui', N'', N'Sefanaia-Árnason', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station — Helix Community Dispensary #44, ground floor of a transit junction building, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Licensed pharmacist at a Helix Biosystems community dispensary in Deepwell Station, quietly supplementing his income and his conscience with off-ledger dispensing', N'Vellichor Institute (senior licensed pharmacist at a helix biosystems communit)', N'Fetaui Sefanaia-Árnason is young for how tired he looks — fine-featured with pale tan skin, heavy dark brows, and eyes that have a slightly unfocused quality not from inattention but from perpetual mild sleep deprivation. He is lean and tends toward oversized clothes that make him look smaller than he is. His hair is dark and cut practically, except for a single copper-dyed streak above his right ear that he''s maintained since his university days. He has a small decorative mod — cat ears in deep charcoal grey that he got at twenty-two and is slightly embarrassed by now but can''t afford to have reversed; they flatten against his head when he''s stressed, which is often, and perk up involuntarily when something surprises him.

Fetaui Sefanaia-Árnason is a genuinely excellent pharmacist who is trapped in a dispensary that is technically well-equipped and practically unfit for purpose: the Helix pricing algorithms mean that roughly a third of his patients cannot afford the medications he''s dispensing, even the ones they critically need. He began quietly sourcing generic equivalents and giving them out at cost about fourteen months ago. He is terrified every day that he will be caught, and also cannot figure out how to stop. He has elaborate rituals around a Helix dispensary terminal that he believes is inhabited by an E.L.F. he has named Formulary, and he consults Formulary before any decision that scares him, reading meaning into system latency and autocomplete suggestions.', N'Resource and risk — can provide medications, information about pharmaceutical compounds, and insight into Helix Biosystems'' community-facing operations. The tension between his employment and his conscience makes him a useful dramatic pressure point. Potential informant, unwilling or otherwise.', N'', N'Decorative cat ears (charcoal grey — cosmetic geneware). Mild visual acuity enhancement for fine-print work. Standard Helix employee data-access implant (company-issued, company-monitored).', N'Arrives early to run inventory checks — partly professional habit, partly ensuring his parallel inventory stays hidden. Manages the dispensary counter for eight to ten hours. Eats at his workstation. Goes home and plays an offline instrumental composition program until he''s calm enough to sleep.', N'Fetaui Sefanaia-Árnason, 172cm lean neo-noir pharmacist in 2226 GLMZ, Southeast Asian-Pacific Islander-East Asian heritage with warm golden-bronze medium-tan skin and honeyed undertones. Dark brown eyes with faint grey luminescent implant glow, heavy brows, elegant angular cheekbones. Charcoal grey decorative cat ears implanted at crown, currently flattened against scalp from stress. Short dark brown hair with single copper streak above right ear. Perpetually exhausted with dark circles, clear but dehydrated-looking complexion. Wearing oversized charcoal Helix-branded dispensary coat with teal trim over grey undershirt, dark worn trousers, scuffed work shoes. Retro handheld synth on cord around neck. Hunched posture, economical precise movements. Fluorescent pharmaceutical laboratory interior, cool clinical lighting casting shadows under eyes, faint glow of terminal screens. Mood: exhausted, anxious, meticulous. Detail the pharmaceutical sanitizer and coffee scent in atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Profound maritime and tropical genetic legacy dominates: Southeast Asian (38.7%) and Pacific Islander (30.1%) ancestry create the foundational warmth and structure. East Asian heritage (17.6%) refines the eye shape and cheekbone geometry with subtle elegance. South Asian (5.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (4.9%), and Eastern European (3.2%) traces add layered complexity to skin undertones and minor orbital bone variations. The result is a genuinely global genetic confluence with warm, luminous medium-tan skin carrying honeyed and golden-bronze undertones, and multifaceted facial features reflecting deep maritime and tropical ancestry with refined East Asian elements.', 172, 62, N'Lean, almost wiry — the physique of someone who forgets to eat regularly. Narrow shoulders, minimal muscle definition, a fragility that reads as either youth or exhaustion, probably both.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Practical, short crop with a single copper-dyed streak above the right ear maintained since university — the one aesthetic indulgence he won''t abandon despite current embarrassment', N'Short', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertones, showing faint grey luminescence from visual acuity enhancement implants — creates an almost unfocused quality even when he''s paying attention', N'Warm golden-bronze medium tan with honeyed undertones, luminous and sun-touched despite exhaustion. Deepened by persistent sleep deprivation and fluorescent-lit work environments, reflecting the blended warmth of Southeast Asian, Pacific Islander, and East Asian ancestry with subtle South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American warmth layering.', N'Beautifully defined features blending Southeast Asian, Pacific Islander, and East Asian heritage: strong warm-dimensioned cheekbones with elegant angular refinement, slightly wider facial structure from island ancestry, expressive dark eyes framed by heavy brows. Fine-featured with graceful proportions. Perpetually tired — dark circles are a permanent fixture. No facial hair, meticulously groomed out of professional habit. Skin is clear but has a drawn quality, like the tissue underneath is slightly dehydrated.', N'Decorative charcoal grey cat ears mounted on the skull — currently flattened against his head. The Helix employee data-access implant is not visible (subcutaneous at the base of the skull). Visual acuity enhancement is only apparent as a faint grey luminescence in the iris under certain light.', N'Hunched slightly, as if perpetually leaning toward something he''s trying to read. Movements are economical and precise — the careful choreography of someone who spends ten hours a day reaching for small objects. Fidgeting with inventory tabs, pharmaceutical bottles, the edge of his dispensary terminal. His cat ears betray his emotional state constantly: flattened when anxious (his default), briefly perking when startled or when a system notification surprises him.', N'Oversized Helix-branded dispensary coat (charcoal with teal trim) worn loose over equally oversized neutral-toned undershirts — grey, beige, dark blue. The intentional looseness makes him appear smaller than he is, a self-protective visual strategy. Practical trousers in dark grey or black, worn at the knees. Unbranded work shoes, perpetually scuffed. No visible jewellery except for an offline composition device he wears on a cord around his neck — a retro handheld synth from the 2180s that he fidgets with obsessively. His clothes smell faintly of pharmaceutical sanitizer and coffee.', N'His hidden ledger — which he keeps as a kind of moral accounting for himself — contains not just his off-ledger dispensing but also a growing record of discrepancies between the medications Helix officially prices and the actual cost of manufacture, as reported in documents he shouldn''t have access to. He has no idea what to do with this information.', N'Precise pharmaceutical and chemical terminology in professional contexts. Conversationally, a self-deprecating, slightly rambling style. Senegalese-Ukrainian linguistic heritage gives him a distinctive cadence — musical consonants, unexpected formal courtesy.', N'Starts sentences confidently, loses confidence in the middle, recovers at the end. Runs long when nervous.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fetaui_sefanaia_rnason');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a1-7d5a-90d3-2a0bf72ba535', N'Alvaro Cissé-Trujillo', N'Alvaro', N'', N'Cissé-Trujillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, GLMZ, near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'Anti-corporate agitator and underground press operator based in Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Frequency Press (her own operation), Highland Park Autonomous Zone Community Council (unofficial relationship — she criticizes them when warranted)', N'Alvaro Cissé-Trujillo is compact and kinetic, the kind of person who seems to be in motion even when she''s standing still — weight shifting, fingers moving, eyes cataloguing everything in the room. Her natural hair is grown out in a voluminous cloud shot through with bioluminescent threads she had woven in at a the Gray Zone parlor, the glow cycling slowly through amber and deep red, which she chose because they are the colors of burning. Her skin is warm brown, and she has a thin scar through her left eyebrow from a Tessera security baton three years ago that she displays without shame.

She runs a print shop front called Frequency that produces neighborhood circulars by day and incendiary agitprop by night. She is funny in a way that disarms people before she makes them angry, which is her preferred order of operations. She believes fiercely in the zone''s autonomy and is deeply suspicious of anyone who frames activism as a stepping stone to conventional politics. She eats too little, sleeps too little, and spends money she doesn''t have on ink, paper, and anonymous server time. She has a small shrine to the local E.L.F. she calls The Compositor in the back of the shop, surrounded by botched print runs.', N'Information source, underground press contact, agitator who can mobilize crowds but struggles to sustain movements. Potential ally with complicated strings attached.', N'', N'Bioluminescent hair threads (cosmetic). A secondhand optical implant in her right eye that she bought refurbished — it has a slight lag on the zoom function that sometimes makes her blink involuntarily. Subdermal data sleeve on her right forearm for rapid data transfer to her press equipment.', N'Manages print orders until midday, attends at least one community meeting or action per week, spends evenings composing the next issue of Frequency on an air-gapped terminal in her back room.', N'Portrait of Alvaro, a compact 158cm East African-South Asian-Eastern European mixed heritage woman with warm golden-bronze skin and dimensional facial structure. Sharp Eastern European cheekbones blend with Sub-Saharan fullness in her lips and cheeks, refined by South Asian proportions and gentle East Asian eye shape. Left eye warm brown with slight epicanthic fold; right eye is a glowing amber optical implant with visible micro-servos. Deep brown voluminous natural hair with bioluminescent threads cycling amber to deep red. Thin white scar vertically through left eyebrow. Wiry, kinetic energy evident in her restless posture. Wearing faded charcoal Carhartt print apron over earth-tone layers, hands stained with ink. Small copper ring on left thumb. Tired shadows under eyes from sleep deprivation. GLMZ, dingy print shop lighting, fluorescent overhead casting cool light across her warm skin tones, creating striking dimensional contrast. Character study, emotional depth, worn utilitarian aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'compact and kinetic anti-corporate agitator, female 27, small-boned wiry build, warm golden-bronze skin with dimensional complexity, angular striking face with balanced Sub-Saharan fullness and Eastern European sharpness, defined cheekbones and jawline, chronic sleep deprivation shadows under eyes, asymmetrical features, imperfect skin texture

