--ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Complex Pan-Global diaspora phenotype: Sub-Saharan African (31.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (20.0%), and South Asian (19.2%) form the dominant ancestry blend, creating warm, rich undertones and facial fullness. Eastern European (18.9%) contribution sharpens cheekbones and jawline while adding cooler undertones to the overall warmth. Smaller East Asian (5.8%) and Southeast Asian (4.2%) components refine eye shape and add delicate proportions to facial structure. The result is a striking multihued face with dimensional warmth—golden-bronze with subtle cool undertones—reflecting true 22nd-century unmixed genetics.', 158, 48, N'Compact and wiry, all kinetic energy — lean muscle with the restless quality of someone who burns calories through constant motion rather than exercise. Her frame is small-boned but dense.', N'Natural deep brown with bioluminescent thread accents cycling amber to deep red', N'Voluminous natural cloud, approximately shoulder-length, threads woven throughout', N'Medium', N'Left eye: warm brown with gentle East Asian epicanthic fold influence, natural. Right eye: augmented optical implant with slight metallic sheen, amber-tinted lens with visible micro-servos at the iris', N'Warm golden-bronze with dimensional complexity — Sub-Saharan richness and South Asian warmth create the base, enhanced by Latin American golden undertones, with Eastern European cooler tones creating subtle contrast across cheekbones and temples. Medium depth with exceptional dimensionality across different lighting conditions.', N'Angular, defined face reflecting balanced interplay of Sub-Saharan African fullness in cheeks and lips, Eastern European sharpness in cheekbones and jaw definition, South Asian softness in overall facial proportions, and East Asian influence in eye shape and brow structure. Bone structure is striking and precisely defined. Skin shows the slight wear of chronic sleep deprivation — faint shadows under eyes. Well-maintained grooming despite irregular self-care habits.', N'Right eye optical implant with amber lens and visible micro-servo mechanics at the iris; occasional involuntary blink from zoom lag. Bioluminescent hair threads cycling slowly through amber and deep red. Faint subdermal tracery visible on right forearm under certain lighting — data sleeve interface ports at wrist and elbow.', N'Never fully still — weight shifts from foot to foot, fingers fidget with whatever is at hand (paper, thread, ink pen), eyes in constant motion cataloguing surroundings. Moves with economical precision despite the kinetic restlessness. When seated, legs bounce or tap. When engaged in conversation, gestures are emphatic and deliberate.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian: worn-in Carhartt print shop apron in faded charcoal over mismatched layers (thermal underlayer, oversized pullover in muted earth tones). Hands usually stained with ink. Boots are well-maintained but scuffed (practical, no-logo brands from secondary markets). Minimal jewelry except for a small copper ring on her left thumb. Clothing prioritizes function and durability over aesthetics; any wear is from use, not affectation.', N'She received a one-time anonymous payment of Φ2,400 from an untraceable source eight months ago — enough to save Frequency when she was about to lose the lease. She told herself she would find out who sent it and refuse if it was compromised. She has not tried very hard to find out.', N'Quick, colloquial, layered with zone slang and print-shop jargon. Switches registers rapidly — can go from street talk to precise political theory in one breath.', N'Fast, rhythmic. Sentences run together. Often talks in lists.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alvaro_ciss_trujillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a672-77a5-8e6e-2a15dcb9c5f0', N'Dalinda Najjar-Khorasani', N'Dalinda', N'', N'Najjar-Khorasani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Bay View Docks, GLMZ, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'Union organizer and labor historian for dockworkers at Bay View Docks', N'Bay View Dockworkers Collective, loosely aligned with the Grand Corridor Labor Federation', N'Dalinda Najjar-Khorasani is a broad-shouldered man whose body carries the evidence of three decades of physical labor — thick-knuckled hands, a fused vertebra from a crane accident, and a jaw that juts forward like the prow of a barge. His skin is deep umber, and he keeps his silver-streaked hair in tight locs that he pins back with a carved bone toggle that belonged to his grandfather. He wears old Ferrogate Transit coveralls he refuses to surrender even though he no longer works the lines, the company patch scratched out and replaced with a hand-stitched wave.

Nzu is deliberate in everything — the way he speaks, the way he listens, the way he lets silence do the heavy lifting in a negotiation. He has the patience of a man who has watched union drives fail and succeed and fail again over thirty years, and he does not celebrate early or panic easily. What looks like calm is actually compressed fury, carefully managed. He genuinely loves the workers he represents, and this is the thing that keeps him from becoming cynical. He prays to the dock E.L.F.s every morning before meetings, leaving shipping manifests with handwritten notes in the margins.', N'Quest giver, information source about labor disputes and corporate malfeasance at the docks, moral anchor character who challenges players'' willingness to take shortcuts.', N'', N'Spinal brace implant (medical, post-injury). Subdermal contact patch on his left forearm for signing union documents with biometric verification. No cosmetic mods — he views them as a personal expense he cannot justify on Φ180/month.', N'Rises before dawn to walk the docks before shift change, talking to workers coming off night rotation; spends afternoons in the Collective''s cramped office processing grievances and composing union bulletins on a secondhand terminal.', N'Dalinda Najjar-Khorasani, a weathered 188cm dock worker in his sixties with burnished olive-bronze skin reflecting Middle Eastern, North African, Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Black hair with silver streaks pulled into shoulder-length locs pinned with a carved bone toggle. Deep-set dark brown eyes, strong angular features, aquiline nose. Wearing faded navy Ferrogate Transit coveralls with hand-stitched white wave emblem, brass union pin, thermal undershirt, scuffed steel-toed boots. Hands scarred and calloused from decades of labor. Moves with deliberate precision, slight forward cant from spinal fusion. Subtle metallic ridge visible along spine. Setting: Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone dockside, late afternoon light catching rope-scarred forearms and subdermal contact patch on left arm. GLMZ, gritty industrial atmosphere, weathered and functional aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Bay View Docks', N'local', N'Bay View Docks', N'Middle Eastern (44.4%) and North African (25.4%) ancestry forms the primary genetic foundation, combined with Hispanic/Latin American (17.3%) and Sub-Saharan African (12.9%) heritage—a striking multi-continental blend. The result is warm olive-bronze skin with golden undertones characteristic of Levantine and Maghrebi regions, enriched by warmer amber tones from Latin American ancestry and deeper warmth from Sub-Saharan African genetics, creating a complex burnished complexion unique to this particular genetic mosaic.', 188, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and barrel-chested with the dense musculature of three decades of dock work; forearms and hands are thick-knuckled and scarred from manual labor; slight forward lean to his posture from spinal fusion', N'Black with silver streaking throughout', N'Tight locs, shoulder-length, pinned back with a carved bone toggle', N'Long', N'Dark brown', N'Warm olive-bronze with weathered patina from years of sun exposure on the water; complex undertone blending Levantine olive, North African amber, Hispanic golden warmth, and Sub-Saharan African richness into a unified burnished bronze', N'Weathered face with strong angular bone structure balancing Levantine features with softened edges from multi-continental heritage; deep-set dark eyes; prominent brow ridge; aquiline nose with moderate width reflecting the blend of Middle Eastern and broader ancestry; numerous fine lines around mouth and eyes from squinting into Lake Michigan winds; calloused, rope-scarred hands; salt-and-pepper stubble on jawline most days', N'Spinal brace implant creates a subtle metallic ridge visible along the spine when he leans forward. Subdermal contact patch on left forearm (faint circular outline beneath skin, approximately 3cm diameter) used for biometric union document signing — barely noticeable unless skin is exposed and light catches it at an angle. No cosmetic modifications; all augmentations are functional and deliberately unglamorous.', N'Deliberate and economical in movement; walks with a slight forward cant due to spinal fusion; moves with the careful precision of a man managing chronic pain; settles into stillness rather than fidgeting; nods slowly when listening; speaks with long measured pauses; hands stay relatively still when not making a specific point', N'Worn Ferrogate Transit coveralls (Tier 3-4 workwear, faded navy blue with company patch deliberately scratched out and replaced with a hand-stitched wave emblem in white thread); thermal undershirt beneath; steel-toed work boots scuffed and resoled multiple times; brass union pin on coverall chest; wool watch cap (charcoal) worn most mornings; no jewelry except grandfather''s bone toggle in hair and a simple steel wedding band', N'He secretly negotiated a reduced settlement with Ferrogate Transit seven years ago to save twenty jobs, and the terms included a no-strike clause that is still technically in effect. He has never told the current membership. He believes he made the right call. He is not certain.', N'Plain, precise, working-class diction. Uses legal and contractual language accurately when needed. Rarely swears but when he does it lands hard.', N'Slow and deliberate. Long pauses between sentences. Never raises his voice.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dalinda_najjar_khorasani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a707-762e-bf6f-2a3a80f1d940', N'Donya Odinga', N'Donya', N'', N'Odinga', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 9, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Blackpipe Corridor, near Damen and Armitage', N'truant message runner, Tier 1', N'Informal network of Blackpipe Corridor market vendors', N'Donya Odinga is a rail-thin nine-year-old with close-cropped hair dyed the faded orange of someone who found a half-spent pigment cartridge and made the most of it. Her skin is deep brown, her eyes wide-set and alert, always tracking exits. She moves through Blackpipe Corridor like water through pipe joints — fast, quiet, and always finding the crack that leads somewhere else. She wears an oversized salvage-canvas vest with too many pockets, each one holding something she might need or trade.

She has been running messages for the pipe-stall vendors of Blackpipe for two years, since she was old enough to memorize a route without writing it down. She doesn''t fully understand most of what she carries — folded slips of laminate, tiny beaded data-threads, once a tooth — but she understands that delivering on time means eating, and late means the cold corner by the effluent drain. She is cheerful with the intensity of someone who has decided cheerfulness is a survival tool.', N'Local color and unexpected information courier; knows the physical layout of Blackpipe better than anyone; can be a quest hook when she accidentally carries something dangerous; embodies the texture of Tier 1 child survival without being purely tragic', N'', N'None. Wants cat ears someday, has strong opinions about which color.', N'Up before the district lights cycle on, runs four to seven message routes through Blackpipe and into the lower Narrows, spends afternoons haunting the stall of Auntie-vendor Pelé who sometimes feeds her in exchange for sweeping, sleeps in a dry maintenance alcove she shares with two older kids.', N'GLMZ, street child runner Donya Odinga, age 8-10, deep rich brown skin with warm golden undertones, faded orange uneven close-cropped hair with dark roots, lean wiry frame, dark alert eyes, white scar on left cheekbone. Wearing oversized weathered gray-tan salvage canvas vest over mismatched-sleeve undershirt, industrial gray patched pants, stomped-heel slip-ons. Standing coiled for motion, weight on balls of feet, head up tracking sight lines. Urban Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, neon-lit industrial terrain, rooftop or narrow alley, cool overhead lighting casting sharp shadows. Completely organic, no augmentations. Street survivor aesthetic, functional clothing with bulging pockets, rope-burn calluses visible on hands. Perpetually alert parkour stance, ready to move laterally or upward. Gritty photorealistic neo-noir street scene, dusk lighting, rain-slicked surfaces, distant holographic advertisements. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (82.8%) with significant Pacific Islander heritage (11.8%) and South Asian ancestry (5.4%). Her genetic makeup creates a striking blend of deep African features with subtle Pacific Islander bone structure and South Asian undertones — a living map of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 128, 26, N'Rail-thin and wiry with the compact muscularity of a child who moves constantly through urban terrain. Underfed but not starving — subsistence-level nutrition sustained by vendor scraps and occasional proper meals. Her frame is all angles: sharp elbows, visible ribs under loose clothing, knees that seem too large for her legs.', N'Faded orange — uneven pigment application from a salvaged or shared cartridge, darker roots showing where natural dark brown is growing back in', N'Close-cropped, uneven, self-cut or cut by another child with blunt implements. Practical for moving through tight spaces without catching on anything.', N'Short', N'Dark brown, wide-set, with the perpetually alert quality of someone constantly mapping escape routes', N'Deep rich brown with warm golden undertones — the luminous depth of Sub-Saharan African heritage with subtle warm radiance from Pacific Islander and South Asian ancestry blending', N'Clean but weathered for her age — sun-darkened from outdoor route-running, hands calloused at fingertips and palms from climbing, a small scar on her left cheekbone from an undefined past incident. No cosmetic grooming; functional cleanliness only. Slight shadows under her eyes suggesting inconsistent sleep. Facial structure reflects her dominant African heritage with strong cheekbones and refined bone architecture, subtly broadened by Pacific Islander genetics.', N'None. Completely organic. Her only expressed desire is for future augmentation — specifically cat ear implants, for which she has strong personal color preferences but limited means.', N'Constantly in motion or coiled to move. Even when standing still, her weight is balanced on the balls of her feet. She moves through space like she''s reading it — head up, eyes tracking sight lines and obstacles, body angled to move laterally or upward at any moment. Her natural state is forward momentum; stillness reads as temporary.', N'Oversized salvage-canvas vest in weathered gray-tan, clearly scavenged from adult-sized stock, worn open over a faded undershirt with mismatched sleeves. The vest is her identity and tool — every pocket filled with small items: message capsules, trade goods, food scraps, a stub of pencil, things she might barter or need. Cheap pull-on pants in industrial gray, patched at both knees with different fabric colors. Worn slip-on shoes with the heels stomped flat. No jewelry except a single rubber band holding her hair back. Her aesthetic is 100% function — every item chosen for utility or survival, nothing for aesthetics.', N'She has memorized the contents of three messages she was told were blank. She doesn''t know what to do with what she knows but she keeps it, like a coin she found.', N'Street-clipped, inventive slang, mispronounces technical words confidently', N'Fast and bouncing, sentences often trail into a question even when they aren''t one', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'donya_odinga');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a73a-7650-88be-2a3d64abcfdd', N'Amruta Soriano-Chowdhury', N'Amruta', N'', N'Soriano-Chowdhury', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, sub-level studio called The Marrow, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Sound sculptor and analog ritual musician', N'Independent; loose association with the Hamtramck Sound Collective; The Ferment', N'Amruta Soriano-Chowdhury is a broad-shouldered woman with deep amber skin mapped by decades of bioluminescent tattoos she acquired piecemeal from artists she traded music for — constellations of pale blue light pulse along her collarbones when she is performing or intensely moved. Her hair is shaved close except for a single thick braid at the back, dyed a permanent interference-pattern silver that shifts between grey and violet. Her hands are her most arresting feature: large, calloused, and adorned with sub-dermal vibration emitters implanted along each finger so she can feel sound frequencies directly in her palms. She walks with the unhurried authority of someone who has outlasted trends.

She composes what she calls ''weight music'' — dense, slow-moving sonic sculptures assembled from salvaged industrial machinery, fermented water-pressure feedback loops, and recordings made inside the bodies of willing volunteers via swallowed microphone capsules. Her work is not pleasant in any conventional sense but it is affecting in ways listeners struggle to articulate afterward. She is reverent toward E.L.F.s and maintains a standing altar of magnetic tape spools and old hard-drive platters in her studio, making weekly data offerings to a local E.L.F. she calls Grandmother Hum, who she credits with inspiring her best compositions.', N'Cultural anchor and keeper of underground music history; players seeking information about the Enclave''s older social networks will eventually be directed to her; she can serve as patron, mentor, or reluctant oracle', N'', N'Sub-dermal vibration emitters in all ten fingers; bioluminescent tattoos (cosmetic, applied over decades); mild cochlear amplifiers for precision listening', N'Rises before dawn to record ambient city sounds from the sub-level drainage channels, spends afternoons in The Marrow composing and receiving the occasional student or collaborator, performs live maybe four times a year at underground venues — events treated in the Enclave like minor holy occasions.', N'Amruta Soriano-Chowdhury, fifty-two year old sonic artist, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones reflecting South Asian-Hispanic-African blended ancestry, deep warm brown eyes with subtle crystalline augmentation gleam, shaved head with single thick silver-violet braid down back. Broad-shouldered muscular build, lined face showing decades of intense listening, fine cheekbones and jawline showing East Asian refinement. Pale blue bioluminescent constellations glowing softly on collarbones and spiraling geometric patterns across upper back. Metallic sub-dermal nodes glinting on fingers. Layered working-class aesthetic: indigo linen shirt, worn leather vest, canvas pants, sturdy boots. Neural port visible at skull base. Standing with economical grace, hands slightly curled, centered posture. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, warm indoor ambient lighting with accent on bioluminescent tattoos, moody and contemplative, detailed portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Richly blended phenotype reflecting South Asian dominance (36.6%) combined with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (27.7%) and Sub-Saharan African (19.0%) ancestry, with meaningful contributions from Indigenous American (7.4%), Eastern European (5.6%), and East Asian (3.7%) heritage. This creates warm medium-brown skin with golden-bronze undertones, broad bone structure from African and Indigenous American genetics, balanced facial proportions from the South Asian-Hispanic foundation, and refined cheekbone and eye geometry from Eastern European and East Asian components.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid without excess fat; decades of manual instrument-building and performance have left her muscular through the chest and back, with a slightly thickened waist suggesting age and sustained physicality rather than decline', N'Permanent interference-pattern silver with violet undertones', N'Shaved close to the scalp except for a single thick braid extending down the back, worn loose or wrapped around itself', N'Shaved except for long braid', N'Deep warm brown with subtle crystalline quality from cochlear amplifiers catching light at certain angles', N'Warm medium-brown with golden-bronze undertones, smooth and well-maintained despite fifty-two years; reflects the blended convergence of South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry', N'Lined around the eyes and mouth from decades of intense listening and emotional expression; skin unmarked by acne or significant scarring; naturally expressive face with balanced structure reflecting South Asian-Hispanic-African convergence and refined details from Eastern European and East Asian heritage; subtle depth to cheekbones and jawline from diverse ancestral blend', N'Sub-dermal vibration emitter nodes visible as faint metallic glints along each finger, most obvious on the knuckles and palm-side; subtle neural interface port barely visible at the base of her skull beneath the close-shaved hair; cochlear amplifiers create minimal external change but ear cartilage is slightly modified', N'Moves with economical grace, unhurried and deliberate; walks with weight distributed through her center, shoulders back but not rigid; hands often hang at rest with fingers slightly curled, as if listening; when seated, she tends to occupy space fully without tension; her gaze lingers on things others miss — acoustic details in environments', N'Tier 3-4 working-class eclectic; favors layered, tactile fabrics: heavy linen shirts dyed indigo or charcoal, worn leather vests salvaged and relined, loose canvas pants with deep pockets for equipment; sturdy unmarked boots with worn soles; no corporate branding or luxury indicators; jewelry limited to simple metal rings on most fingers (custom-made, likely by trade with other artisans); occasionally wears a long wool shawl dyed with natural dyes, treating it as both practical and ceremonial', N'The composition she is most famous for — a 40-minute piece called ''Silt Cathedral'' that is considered foundational to the Meridian underground — was built almost entirely from a recording she made without consent of her dying mother''s labored breathing in a Helix Biosystems care ward. She has never told anyone.', N'Sparse, concrete, drawn from materials and textures — she describes emotions in physical terms (''that grief is a low-frequency hum, sits in your sternum'')', N'Slow and deliberate with long silences she does not feel obliged to fill; sentences often trail off because she assumes the listener can complete them', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amruta_soriano_chowdhury');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a728-726f-9b06-2a625cfee7b8', N'Gauti Volkov', N'Gauti', N'', N'Volkov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, the covered lantern row near the south gate, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Fortune seller and unlicensed psychometric reader', N'Independent; devoted clergy-adjacent to the Deep Lantern E.L.F. cult; nominally listed as a ''wellness consultant'' with the Vendors Guild', N'Gauti Volkov is tall and angular, with the kind of stillness that crowds move around rather than through. Their Ukrainian-Ghanaian heritage produces a striking combination of high cheekbones and deep brown skin marked with deliberate geometric scarification along the jawline — an aesthetic choice made at twenty-two that they''ve added to incrementally ever since. Their eyes are natural dark brown, and they refuse cosmetic iris mods on principle, which in the Oxidian Market is itself a kind of statement. They dress in heavy layered fabrics in burgundy and black, hung with small E.L.F. fetish objects — data chips etched with prayer-code, braided wire, fragments of old screen glass.

They sell readings: psychometric assessments delivered through a combination of genuine pattern-recognition skill, a black-market biofeedback scanner hidden in their consultation table, and what they sincerely believe is communication with the E.L.F. called the Deep Lantern that inhabits the lantern row''s power grid. Whether the readings are fraud, intuition, or something harder to categorize is a question Doka holds with comfort. What is inarguable is that they are exceptionally good at reading people, and that their predictions have an unsettling habit of being structurally accurate even when the specifics are wrong. They have a regular clientele that includes a surprising number of low-level corponation middle managers who tell no one they come here.', N'Atmospheric and oracular; can provide players with genuine information delivered in ambiguous form; their biofeedback scanner means they know things about people that they shouldn''t; the E.L.F. connection may be more real than it appears', N'', N'Hidden biofeedback scanner integrated into consultation table surface (reads galvanic response, micro-expression data, vocal stress — not implanted, external); no personal augmentations by choice', N'Opens their curtained stall in the early afternoon, sees clients by appointment and by walk-in until midnight, then spends an hour making data offerings to the Deep Lantern before leaving; they are never seen eating in the Market.', N'Gauti Volkov, tall angular figure with warm deep brown skin featuring golden-olive undertones, sharp Slavic jawline with geometric scarification, high cheekbones with South Asian fullness, dark brown eyes with unsettling focus. Long straight black hair with grey at temples parted severely down center, falling past shoulders. Dressed in heavy layered burgundy and black natural textiles worn like ceremonial vestments, adorned with braided copper wire, LCD fragments, prayer-etched data chips on thin chains. Sits in absolute stillness with palms-down posture, economical movement. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, prophet-archivist aesthetic, Tier 4 anti-corporate statement. Moody interior lighting, neon ambient glow reflecting off matte brown skin and natural fabrics. Neutral expression, direct unblinking gaze. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'Eastern European-South Asian-Hispanic genetic blend (45.1% Slavic, 28% South Asian, 26.9% Latin American). The ancestry creates a distinctive phenotype: warm medium-deep brown skin with complex undertones where olive tones from Eastern European genetics converge with golden warmth from South Asian heritage and reddish richness from Latin American ancestry. Strong angular Slavic features — sharp defined jawline and high prominent cheekbones — are softened by South Asian facial structure fullness and warmth. Latin American heritage enriches the overall skin tone depth and adds subtle width to the midface structure. The genetic blend manifests as an even, harmonious complexion that avoids pale coldness while incorporating the angular precision of Northern European bone structure.', 183, 68, N'Tall and angular with minimal muscle definition; an ascetic frame that suggests deliberate restraint rather than deprivation. Long-limbed and still in a way that makes movement seem intentional.', N'Natural deep black with threads of grey at the temples', N'Worn loose, parted severely down the center, falling straight past the shoulders', N'Long', N'Natural dark brown, unaugmented', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden-olive undertones and subtle reddish richness — the result of Eastern European, South Asian, and Hispanic ancestry convergence. Even tone with matte finish suggesting careful attention to skin care and protection.', N'Strong angular jawline characteristic of Eastern European Slavic heritage, high defined cheekbones with moderate width reflecting South Asian ancestry, structured nasal bridge with subtle Latin American fullness creating facial harmony. Skin is clear and matte, warm brown with perceptible golden-olive undertones throughout. Expression often neutral, eyes tracking with unsettling focus.', N'None. No personal augmentations by principle. The biofeedback scanner is integrated into their consultation table surface and invisible to casual observation.', N'Moves with economical precision, rarely shifting weight unnecessarily. Sits in absolute stillness during consultations, hands resting palms-down on the table. In the Market, they navigate crowded spaces as if people part around them rather than through them. Direct and unblinking eye contact.', N'Heavy layered fabrics in burgundy and black — natural textiles, no synthetic shimmer or corp-tier tech fabric. Multiple loose outer layers worn like ceremonial vestments. Hung with small Deep Lantern E.L.F. fetish objects: braided copper wire, fragments of old LCD screen glass, data chips etched with prayer-code on thin chains. The overall effect is part prophet, part archivist. Tier 4 aesthetic — deliberately anti-corporate, anti-augmentation statement masked as spiritual devotion.', N'Three months ago, the Deep Lantern spoke to them with specificity it had never used before — describing a person, a location, and a date in detail. The date has passed. The location is a decommissioned power substation in the Narrows. They went there and found evidence of a killing that has not been reported anywhere. They don''t know what to do with this and haven''t told anyone.', N'Formal and measured with a slightly archaic quality; uses ''the grid,'' ''the current,'' and ''the signal'' as spiritual metaphors; switches to plain direct speech when the performance drops', N'Deliberate. Spacious. Lets silence work. In private conversation, becomes warmer and more hesitant.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gauti_volkov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a70c-70da-a981-2b24090b7dae', N'Afolake Petrović', N'Afolake', N'', N'Petrović', N'', N'human', N'human', N'non-binary', N'they/them', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'the Gray Zone — Level 12, Unit 1207, near Wacker and State', N'Tech scavenger / reluctant sidekick / Q-zero survivalist', N'', N'Afolake Petrović is a controlled explosion of salvaged technology and nervous energy. They''re slight — 5''6", wiry, the kind of build that comes from skipping meals when a project gets interesting. Their skin is a light brown, perpetually smudged with solder flux and thermal paste, and their natural hair (what''s left of it) is buzzed short on the right side, grown out in uneven dark curls on the left, and streaked with a color that changes monthly depending on what dye they''ve scavenged. Currently: a violent, glitchy magenta that''s already fading to pink at the roots.

The augments are the first thing you notice. Afolake Petrović''s left eye is a salvaged Axiom Industries corporate scanner — matte black, slightly too large for the socket, with a faint amber ring that pulses when it''s processing. It was designed to scan inventory in a warehouse. Afolake Petrović repurposed it to read security systems, identify augmentation models, and spot structural weaknesses in hardware. It also gives them splitting headaches when it overclocks, which it does constantly because they pushed it past its specs. Their right hand and forearm are aftermarket — a patchwork prosthetic cobbled from three different manufacturer lines, matte grey with visible seams where the components don''t quite match. It works beautifully. It looks like a junk drawer. Their ears are studded with micro-receivers that pick up local comm frequencies, and there''s a thin data-port scar behind their right ear where they hard-jack into systems.

First impression: an annoying kid who won''t shut up and has too many blinking lights on their body. Deeper impression: a desperately clever person who has turned themselves into a Swiss Army knife because being useful is the only survival strategy they trust.', N'Pixel is Kyle''s mirror — same orphan origin, opposite coping strategy. Where Kyle retreated into discipline and silence, Pixel exploded outward into noise and technology. They represent the question: what would Kyle have become without Seo? Not worse, necessarily — just different. Pixel survived without a code, without a mentor, without a sword. They survived by being useful, by being fast, by being loud enough that no one could ignore them.

Pixel also represents the generation that inherited the Consolidation Wars without fighting them. They don''t have Kyle''s martial trauma or Seo''s guilt or Mrs. Chen''s grief. They have something arguably worse: they grew up in the aftermath and were told this was normal. Their rebellion isn''t philosophical — it''s practical. They scavenge and hack and build because the system wasn''t designed to include them, so they''ll include themselves.

The question Pixel poses to Kyle: Can you protect someone who doesn''t fight the way you do? Can your code accommodate someone whose weapon is a soldering iron instead of a sword?', N'', N'', N'', N'Afolake Petrović, 168cm wiry neo-noir technician with warm golden-brown skin bearing Eastern European angular features softened by East Asian eye structure and South Asian warmth, standing in a cramped maintenance bay filled with flickering neon glow. Asymmetrical dark brown hair with faded magenta streaks—buzzed on right side, curled on left. One natural dark brown eye, one oversized matte-black Axiom Industries prosthetic eye with amber LED ring protruding slightly. Patchwork grey prosthetic right arm with visible seams and welded components. Solder burns and thermal paste stains on hands. Wearing oversized grey Shelton Manufacturing work jacket with cut sleeves, black cargo pants with numerous pockets, worn boots. Data-port scar visible at right ear base with micro-receiver implants glinting. Hunched posture, fidgeting hands. Dark circles under eyes. Surrounded by scattered circuitry, cables, and salvaged tech components. Cool blue-white LED work lighting with warm amber accents. GLMZ, gritty scavenger aesthetic, hyper-focused tension. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone — Level 12, Unit 1207', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Eastern European dominant (62.3%) with significant East Asian (18.7%), Sub-Saharan African (12.2%), and South Asian (6.8%) ancestry. Facial structure combines Eastern European angularity—defined cheekbones and sharp jawline—with the softer eye contours of East Asian heritage. Skin tone reflects the full diaspora blend: warm golden-brown base with bronze undertones bridging African and South Asian warmth, cooled subtly by Eastern European genetics. Overall phenotype distinctly mixed-heritage, bearing visible markers of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 52, N'Wiry and slight, with the hollow-chested frame of someone who forgets to eat during hyperfocus sessions. Minimal muscle definition; posture often hunched over workbenches. Deceptively strong in the hands and forearms despite appearance.', N'Dark brown base with asymmetrical bleached/faded magenta streaking (currently degrading to pink at roots)', N'Deliberately mismatched: buzzed to scalp on right side (showing dark stubble), grown into uneven natural curls on left side', N'Asymmetrical (short on right, medium on left)', N'Right: dark brown, natural. Left: matte black synthetic with amber processing ring (Axiom Industries salvage)', N'Warm golden-brown with bronze undertones; perpetually smudged with solder flux, thermal paste, and microscopic circuitry dust', N'Youthful but weathered; pronounced dark circles under eyes suggesting chronic sleep debt. Angular facial structure with defined cheekbones (Eastern European) softened by East Asian eyelid structure and South Asian warmth. Golden-brown coloration across face and neck reflects blended ancestry. Occasional nervous tics around the jaw. Fingernails bitten to the quick on left hand (natural); right prosthetic hand has no nails.', N'Left eye: oversized matte-black Axiom Industries scanner prosthetic with amber LED processing ring; noticeably protrudes slightly from socket. Right hand and forearm: patchwork prosthetic (grey matte finish) with visible seams and mismatched panel lines showing three different manufacturer components welded together. Behind right ear: dense cluster of micro-receiver implants (visible as small metallic studs). Data-port scarring visible at right ear base. Occasional faint blue LEDs visible at augmentation junctions when active.', N'Habitually hunched, especially when standing still or listening. Fidgety hands (constant micro-movements, tapping, disassembling/reassembling small objects). When focused on tech: perfectly still, almost meditative. When anxious or overstimulated: rapid head movements, frequent eye-contact avoidance. Walks quickly with slightly uneven gait (right prosthetic arm affects balance distribution). Nervous energy barely contained — bounces on heels, plays with data-port scar when thinking.', N'Tier 5 scavenger aesthetic: mismatched, heavily modified utility wear. Oversized grey Shelton Manufacturing work jacket (sleeves cut to accommodate prosthetic arm, covered in patches and stitching). Black cargo pants with at least a dozen zippered pockets, many containing salvaged components. Worn synthetic-leather boots (one sole detaching slightly). Shirt underneath is usually a random corporate tech-support tee with the logo modified with marker. Neon paracord bracelet on left wrist. No jewelry except the ear studs and micro-receivers. Visible wear patterns suggest frequent crawling through maintenance ducts and equipment bays.', N'They found their parents. Six months ago, a deep-net data scrape turned up matching biometric records in a NovaCorp offshore manufacturing facility in the Mindanao Economic Zone. Alive. Working. Not looking for their child. Pixel has the facility''s address saved in an encrypted file they open sometimes at 3 AM and then close without doing anything. They have not told anyone.', N'Dense with tech jargon, slang, neologisms. They use technical metaphors for emotional states — ''I''m overclocking,'' ''my buffer''s full,'' ''that''s a hard reboot situation.'' They''ve invented personal slang that nobody else uses but everyone in the Gray Zone has learned to parse. Heavy use of rhetorical questions that they answer themselves.', N'Rapid-fire, barely pausing for breath. Sentences pile up like components on a workbench. They interrupt themselves, double back, follow tangents, and somehow arrive at the point through the scenic route. When they''re scared or lying, they speed up. When they''re genuinely processing something emotional, they slow down — and the sudden silence is alarming because it''s so rare.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'afolake_petrovi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a637-7e38-a0aa-2b4d353209d1', N'Felicia Cissé', N'Felicia', N'', N'Cissé', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave — operates from a second-floor flat that doubles as a small clinic; also makes home visits throughout the district, near Western and Division', N'Midwife and community reproductive health practitioner serving the Hamtramck Enclave and surrounding neighborhoods', N'Hamtramck Enclave Community Health Cooperative — also registered with the city''s independent midwifery guild', N'Felicia Cissé is a compact, energetic woman with rich dark skin, sharp cheekbones, and a wide gap-toothed smile that she deploys like a tool. Her hair is kept in small, intricate braids pinned up beneath a patterned cloth wrap when she''s working, down and loose when she''s not — a distinction she makes firmly as a psychological boundary. She has a bioluminescent mod she got in her twenties: a soft gold shimmer under the skin at her collarbones that she originally disliked and now considers a professional asset, because anxious patients find it soothing in dim rooms during labor. She moves fast and talks faster, and her hands are never not doing something.

Felicia Cissé has delivered over four hundred children in ten years of practice, and she carries that number the way other people carry credentials — it is her proof and her weight. She is an outspoken advocate for reproductive care as infrastructure, not luxury, and she frequently clashes with Helix Biosystems representatives who attempt to regulate or audit community practitioners like herself. She has a complicated relationship with the gene therapy industry, believing that geneware for infants should be a family''s choice but that the cost structures make it coercion dressed as option. She keeps a large, handpainted mural of an E.L.F. she calls the Threshold on her clinic wall — a figure made of doorways — and every family she works with is invited to leave a small offering at it after a successful birth.', N'Community hub and information broker — everyone talks to the midwife. Knows the social landscape of the Enclave intimately. Can provide plot-relevant information about families, relationships, and tensions. Quest giver when a client is in danger.', N'', N'Bioluminescent subdermal shimmer at collarbones (cosmetic, gold-toned). Auditory enhancement implant in her right ear for fetal heartbeat monitoring. No structural chrome.', N'No fixed schedule — reproductive health doesn''t keep hours. She''s on call constantly but protects her mornings for paperwork, community meetings, and eating a real breakfast. She cycles through the neighborhood checking on postpartum clients three times a week.', N'Felicia Cissé, 158cm compact wiry frame, warm golden-brown skin with honey and amber undertones blending Caribbean warmth with Sub-Saharan depth and East Asian refinement, defined angular cheekbones, deep brown eyes with gold flecks, natural black hair in medium shoulder-length cornrows pinned under a colorful West African patterned wrap cloth. Bioluminescent soft gold subdermal glow across collarbones visible in dim neo-noir clinic lighting, fine-line doorway tattoo on inner left wrist, small burn scar on right hand. Wearing loose colorful patterned wrap over neutral base layer, soft linen trousers with deep pockets, canvas clogs. Rapid economical posture, weight forward on balls of feet, hands in constant motion. Standing in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226 clinical setting, low ambient neon and bioluminescent lighting, focused and alert expression, neo-noir medical environment. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Hispanic/Latin American (47.7%), Sub-Saharan African (24.4%), East Asian (14.6%), and Southeast Asian (13.3%) — a striking polychromatic blend creating warm golden-brown skin with complex layered undertones: Caribbean and Central American warmth anchored by deeper Sub-Saharan richness, refined by the subtle cool undertones and defined bone structure of East and Southeast Asian ancestry', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry with functional muscle tone from constant movement and lifting during deliveries; no excess weight, everything economical', N'Natural black with hints of dark brown in strong light', N'Worn in small, intricate cornrows or box braids — pinned up under a patterned cloth wrap during work, loose and flowing when off-duty as a deliberate psychological reset', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unbound)', N'Deep brown with gold-flecked undertones', N'Warm golden-brown with luminous honey and amber undertones — medium-to-deep complexion reflecting the balanced convergence of Latin American warmth, Sub-Saharan depth, and East/Southeast Asian refined undertones', N'Defined cheekbones with refined angular structure reflecting East Asian influence; wide gap between front teeth that dominates her smile; skin well-maintained and clear despite irregular sleep; minimal makeup, favors natural appearance. Facial structure shows the balanced blend of Latin American and African features—fuller lips, broader nose bridge—with subtle East/Southeast Asian bone refinement and slightly higher cheekbones', N'Bioluminescent collarbones glow softly in dim conditions. Small, nearly invisible scar line behind her right ear where the auditory enhancement implant sits (detectable only on close inspection). No visible chrome or structural modifications.', N'Moves with rapid, economical efficiency — never wasted motion. Stands with weight forward on the balls of her feet, ready to move. Hands are constantly in motion: gesturing while talking, adjusting wraps, checking equipment. When focusing on a patient, her movement slows deliberately and becomes precise. When tired, slight forward hunch in shoulders from hours bent over labor beds.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: colorful, patterned wrap cloths in rotation (West African and contemporary GLMZ textile designs), worn over neutral base layers. Favors loose linen trousers or soft cargo pants with deep pockets. Durable canvas shoes or slip-on clogs for quick movement. Minimal jewelry except for a thin silver bangle on her left wrist (gift from a patient). White or neutral clinical coat for appointments, but rarely buttons it fully — treats it as a signal rather than a barrier. Off-duty: worn denim, soft sweaters, the same canvas shoes. Nothing expensive, everything functional and well-maintained.', N'She quietly provides reproductive care services that are technically in a Helix licensing grey zone — including certain gene-screening consultations she isn''t licensed to give. She''s never charged for these. She knows exactly what it would cost her if discovered.', N'Fast, vivid, warm. Nigerian-inflected cadence from her Igbo grandfather''s family tradition mixed with the blunt pragmatism of the Enclave. Uses birth and body metaphors naturally.', N'Rapid-fire when excited or explaining; deliberate and quiet when delivering serious information. The contrast is notable.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'felicia_ciss');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('c7e9f1a3-b5d8-204e-7f9c-2b6a4d5e8f3a', N'Dr. Vikram Hesse-Nakamura', N'Vikram', N'', N'Hesse-Nakamura', N'Dr.', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 39, NULL, 0, 0, N'missing since 2191; presumed dead by TESSERA, presumed uploaded by the Witnesses of the Last Upload, no remains recovered', N'Last seen at NeoCortex Industries Substation 14, a deep-infrastructure neural research facility three levels below the GLMZ ferrocement floor in what is now the Gray Zone east of the Spine. Substation 14 was decommissioned by NeoCortex in the 30 days following his disappearance and the access shafts were sealed.', N'Senior neural engineer at NeoCortex Industries; principal investigator on the Mnemonic Persistence Initiative — the upload-adjacent research program from which he disappeared in 2191', N'NeoCortex Industries (TESSERA subsidiary); informal ethical contact with three colleagues who shared his concerns; no other faction memberships', N'Dr. Vikram Hesse-Nakamura was, before his disappearance in 2191, the most respected neural engineer at NeoCortex Industries that almost no one outside NeoCortex had ever heard of. He was 39 years old when he vanished. He was tall and narrow with the slightly stooped posture of someone who had spent two decades hunched over signal-processing terminals, with warm umber skin from his Indian and Ethiopian heritage, dark eyes that had been corrected with a Tier 1 optical mesh he insisted on calling ''reading glasses,'' and a habit of pushing his fingers through his short black hair when a problem refused to resolve. He spoke softly and precisely, with traces of his German maternal grandmother''s Hochdeutsch in his vowels and his Tamil father''s careful sentence construction in his cadences. He laughed rarely and well. He ate at his desk. He kept a small ceramic cat — a maneki-neko his Japanese paternal grandmother had given him at twelve — on every workstation he ever occupied.

Hesse-Nakamura joined NeoCortex Industries in 2178 from a postdoctoral position at the Tessera Cognitive Development Zone in Abu Dhabi. He published twenty-three peer-reviewed papers in his first eight years on neural signal preservation, electrode-tissue interface decay modeling, and what the literature blandly called ''long-horizon mnemonic encoding.'' His coworkers respected him. His subordinates loved him. His superiors were quietly nervous about him for reasons they did not articulate even to each other. He was the only senior NeoCortex engineer who had ever filed a formal internal ethics objection against the Neural Development Program. The objection was overruled, archived, and never mentioned again. He stayed.

This is the part the Witnesses of the Last Upload do not understand and the part TESSERA does not want understood. Hesse-Nakamura was not a saint. He knew what NeoCortex did to its non-consensual subjects — the R-3 dispositions, the acquisition pipelines, the compartmentalization theater. He filed his objection. When it was overruled, he stayed, because he had convinced himself that his particular line of research — the Mnemonic Persistence Initiative, which sought to preserve the neural patterns of dying patients in a recoverable digital substrate — was a redemption project. Every breakthrough he produced inside NeoCortex was, in his private narrative, an act of penance for the institution that funded it. He told himself the Initiative would eventually justify the suffering. He told himself this for thirteen years. The Witnesses have made him a god. He was a guilty man trying to outrun his own complicity, and he was very, very good at his job.', N'Hesse-Nakamura is the human under the religion — a guilty, brilliant, ordinary man who did one ethical act too late and one technical breakthrough too early, and whose disappearance in the seam between those two facts has been mythologized into a doomsday faith. His pre-ascendance entry exists to make the religion tragic rather than absurd: the Witnesses are wrong about almost everything, except that the man they wait for was, in his way, trying to save people.', N'', N'Tier 1 NovaMind cognitive interface (NeoCortex-issued, mandatory for Grade 9 research personnel); optical mesh corrective overlay; subdermal access credential at left clavicle (NeoCortex Substation 14, sealed status); no aesthetic augmentations. He declined the upgrade path twice.', N'Substation 14 from 06:30 to 22:00 most days; lunch at his desk; weekly call with his sister, which he kept even during the years she was angry with him; one Sunday a month at the Detroit Corridor''s Hindu temple in deference to his father''s memory; reading non-technical fiction at night, usually translated Japanese.', N'Portrait of Dr. Vikram Hesse-Nakamura, 39-year-old neural engineer of mixed Tamil, German, Japanese, and Ethiopian heritage, standing in a dim deep-infrastructure neural research laboratory in 2191. Warm umber skin, short black hair faintly greyed at the temples and disheveled by absent fingers, dark brown eyes with the faint reflective shimmer of corrective mesh. Slightly stooped narrow frame in a white double-breasted NeoCortex lab coat with fraying cuffs over charcoal trousers and grey button-up. Small ceramic maneki-neko on the workstation behind him. Locked drawer just visible at the desk. Cortical signal-processing terminals casting cool blue-green light across his face, soft warm tungsten desk lamp on the offline notebook. Expression thoughtful, slightly tired, careful. GLMZ Substation 14, Tier 2 corporate research aesthetic, no visible augmentations, a man who has stayed somewhere too long for reasons he can defend but not justify. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Two-room apartment, Substation 14 staff quarters, never personalized beyond a small bookshelf and a kettle', N'NeoCortex-issued lab coat over plain charcoal trousers and grey button-up; he owned two pairs of dress shoes for the entire decade preceding his disappearance', N'Black coffee, French press, no sweetener; one cup of his father''s filter coffee on Sundays', N'His maternal grandmother''s potato dumplings (Kartoffelknödel), which he attempted to make once a year and rated the result against memory', N'Caffeine; nothing stronger', N'Standard Tessera-issue subdermal communicator, paired exclusively with his NeoCortex BCI', N'NeoCortex Industries Substation 14, deep GLMZ infrastructure', N'regional', N'NeoCortex Industries Substation 14, deep GLMZ infrastructure', N'Multi-regional diaspora — South Indian (Tamil) paternal heritage 37.4%, German maternal heritage 28.1%, Japanese paternal-grandmaternal heritage 19.8%, Ethiopian distant-maternal heritage 14.7%. Forty years of careful blending visible in a face that registers as recognizable to four different communities and exactly belonging to none.', 181, 71, N'Tall and narrow, with a slight forward stoop from two decades at neural-signal workstations. Long hands, fingers slightly callused along the thumb side from decades of pen use. Underweight for his frame — he ate at his desk and forgot meals when working.', N'Black, very faint grey at the temples in the year before his disappearance', N'Short, side-parted, lightly disheveled by his habit of pushing his fingers through it when thinking', N'Short', N'Dark brown, with the faint reflective shimmer of an OCM-2 corrective mesh visible only at certain angles', N'Warm umber — South Indian and Ethiopian heritage producing a deep mid-brown undertone, lightened slightly by Northern European influence around the eye sockets and the bridge of the nose. The blend is unusual enough that strangers asked.', N'Smooth in his thirties, beginning to show the fine lines of fatigue around the eyes and mouth in the year before he disappeared. Strong cheekbones from his paternal Japanese grandmother, a slightly aquiline nose from the Hessian side, full mouth from the Tamil side. He shaved every other day. He cut himself shaving more often than he should have because his attention was always partially elsewhere.', N'Negligible. The OCM-2 reads as ordinary correction unless you are looking for it; the cortical NovaMind III is fully internal; the clavicle access credential reads as a faint metallic gleam under specific lighting. By NeoCortex Grade 9 standards he was the least augmented researcher in his cohort, by deliberate refusal of the upgrade path.', N'Walks slowly with weight slightly forward, the gait of someone whose attention is two steps ahead of his feet. Sits with elbows on the desk and chin in one hand. When listening, tilts his head fractionally to the right and does not interrupt. When thinking, the fingers-through-hair gesture is reliable enough that his junior staff used it as a signal to wait.', N'NeoCortex Grade 9 lab coat (white, double-breasted, the cuffs slightly fraying by 2191) over charcoal trousers, grey button-up, plain black leather belt, plain black shoes. He owned three identical button-ups in rotation. Off-duty he switched to a single navy sweater and the same trousers. He did not consider himself to have a clothing style and would have been faintly embarrassed by the suggestion that this was, itself, a style.', N'In the year before his disappearance, Hesse-Nakamura began copying NeoCortex''s R-3 disposition records onto encrypted offline media and smuggling them out of Substation 14 in the lining of his lab coat. He intended to release them to the Meridian Disclosure successor outlets when his collection was complete. He was three months from completion when he vanished. The disclosure media has never surfaced. The Witnesses'' fragments of his research notes are a downstream consequence of this exfiltration program — they were never meant to be religious texts. They were evidence.', N'Precise scientific register, with formal grammar inherited from his German grandmother''s correction of his childhood English. Uses qualifiers honestly — ''I think,'' ''the data suggests,'' ''I am not certain'' — in a way that corporate culture mistakes for weakness and his peers recognize as discipline. Drops into Tamil with his father, German with his mother, Japanese with his paternal grandmother; in professional contexts he stays in English and registers the choice each time.', N'Measured. Long pauses for thought that he does not feel pressure to fill. When excited about a result, accelerates into clipped sentences and finger-tapping; when discussing the program''s ethical contradictions, slows almost to a whisper.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dr_vikram_hesse_nakamura');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6bd-7123-9e00-2b97d5103e9f', N'Hildur Hernández', N'Hildur', N'', N'Hernández', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, service sublevel corridors, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Bio-waste disposal technician for Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Aurochs Medical Complex (contracted waste disposal staff, Tier 2 worker classification)', N'Hildur Hernández is lean and angular, with the particular pallor of someone who works night shifts in fluorescent-lit sublevels, though his Ugandan-Hungarian ancestry gives his skin a warm undertone that fights back. He keeps his head shaved close and has a constellation of small bioluminescent freckle-mods across his left temple and jaw — a cosmetic geneware treatment he had done at eighteen that pulses faintly blue when his heart rate elevates, which he finds mortifying in tense situations. He moves through the hospital''s service corridors like someone who has memorized every turn and wants to be finished before anyone notices him.

He is sharper than his job suggests and acutely aware of that gap, which produces a chip on his shoulder he tries to sand down with self-deprecating humor. He has worked the bio-waste runs at Aurochs for four years and in that time has accidentally become something of an expert in what the hospital throws away — which procedures are spiking, which departments are over-ordering which compounds, which disposal manifests do not match the volumes going into the incinerators. He notices things. He has not yet decided what to do with what he notices.', N'Unexpected information source; has knowledge of hospital operations, waste streams, and disposal records that no one suspects he has; local color for the unglamorous underside of the medical system; potential whistleblower', N'', N'Bioluminescent freckle-mods on left temple and jaw (cosmetic geneware, pulses blue under stress); standard-issue hazmat-rated subdermal filter implant in respiratory tract (employer-provided, technically owned by Aurochs)', N'Night shift, 2200 to 0600. Runs bio-waste collection from surgical floors, gene therapy wards, and augmentation recovery suites, processes and logs materials, operates the sublevel incinerators. Sleeps days in a rented room in Ironvein. Spends two days a week taking online coursework toward a medical technician certification.', N'Hildur Hernández, 178cm lean-angular build, shaved black hair, dark brown eyes. Medium-deep warm golden-brown skin with subtle richness blending Southeast Asian, Hispanic, African, and South Asian heritage. High defined cheekbones, angular jawline with balanced proportions. Clean-shaven, chronically alert expression with slight tension around eyes. Bioluminescent blue freckle-mods constellation across left temple and jaw faintly glowing. Navy Aurochs-issue hazmat oversuit with reflective trim over thermal layers, steel-toed boots. Standing at slight angle with shoulders forward, economical posture of service-corridor navigation. GLMZ, neon-lit industrial corridor setting with fluorescent overhead lighting, faint atmospheric haze. Mood: meticulously alert, exhausted precision, quiet global presence. Cinematic lighting, photorealistic, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Mixed ancestry: Southeast Asian (38.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (30.4%), Sub-Saharan African (10.9%), South Asian (8.4%), Eastern European (6.8%), Northern European (5.2%). The combination creates a striking polyphonic appearance — warm golden-brown undertones from the Southeast Asian and Hispanic heritage, enriched by African genetics, with subtle coolness from Eastern European ancestry. High, defined cheekbones from Southeast Asian influence balanced with broader orbital structure from African heritage, refined jawline with understated width. A face that reads as genuinely global, carrying features that blend seamlessly across multiple continental regions.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, with a wiry frame that suggests either natural metabolism or years of night-shift fatigue. Minimal muscle definition despite regular physical labor; the build of someone who moves efficiently rather than powerfully.', N'Black', N'Shaved close to the scalp in a practical, low-maintenance cut', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown', N'Warm golden-brown with rich depth from blended heritage, medium to medium-deep tone. The characteristic pallor of prolonged fluorescent-light exposure sits over naturally warm undertones that prevent sallowness — a luminous tone with understated complexity that catches light with quiet depth.', N'Angular jawline with moderate width at the cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian and South Asian structure; high, defined cheekbones with subtle projection from African heritage. Fine facial features with a slight tension around the eyes and mouth — the look of someone chronically alert. Subtle orbital shape and nose structure reflecting Southeast Asian and South Asian ancestry with warmth from Hispanic heritage. Clean-shaven, meticulously groomed in the manner of someone who has little else to control.', N'Bioluminescent freckle-mods on left temple and jaw (geneware cosmetic treatment); subdermal hazmat filter implant not externally visible but occasionally detectable as a faint ridge beneath the skin below the left clavicle. Respiratory tract implant is completely internal.', N'Moves with economical precision through tight spaces, shoulders slightly forward, head slightly down in the default posture of service-corridor navigation. Walks as though he has already memorized the route and is mentally three steps ahead. Tendency to stand at angles rather than face-on, a habit from navigating around equipment and maintaining peripheral awareness. Fidgets with fingernails when anxious.', N'Tier 2 contractor: regulation Aurochs-issue hazmat oversuit (navy with reflective trim) worn over cheap synthetic base layers. Off-duty clothing is thrifted and practical — faded work pants, thermal shirts, a battered Ironvein transit hoodie with the crest half-faded. No jewelry. Cheap steel-toed boots, well-maintained. Overall appearance is scrupulously clean but threadbare, with the precision of someone who cannot afford replacements but refuses to look slovenly.', N'For three months he has been photographing disposal manifest discrepancies and storing them in an encrypted personal archive. One department — the gene therapy research sublevel — is disposing of biological material that does not appear anywhere in the official treatment logs. He has not told anyone. He has not deleted the photos.', N'Casual and quick; uses hospital jargon accurately but pretends it is accidental; self-deprecating humor as deflection', N'Fast when nervous, which is often; sentences sometimes outrun their endings', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hildur_hern_ndez');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a612-73af-ba82-2b9fe823da16', N'Gudrun Villalobos', N'Gudrun', N'', N'Villalobos', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 27, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'The Rookery — dense vertical housing, gang-controlled, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Target acquisition and fugitive recovery — bounty hunter', N'Semi-independent — recurring contracts with mid-tier fixers', N'Gudrun Villalobos is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 27, there''s something unfinished about her face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She grew up in the Narrows, where the walls are so close together you learn to fight in confined spaces or you learn to lose. She works as a bounty hunter out of The Rookery, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

she is not the most talented bounty hunter in GLMZ, but she might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Fatoumata Ramos-Mensah functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons. Cranial bomb defuser — specialized implant that detects and neutralizes cortex bombs in others', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Gudrun Villalobos, GLMZ, woman with deep golden-brown skin tone, angular high cheekbones, defined jawline, subtle Southeast Asian bone structure, dark brown eyes with slight epicanthic fold, natural black hair in tight functional braid with bronze micro-LED threading, 172cm athletic lean build. Thin white scar temple to cheekbone, burn scar inner left wrist. Right forearm polished chrome smartgun link port with neural scars. Wears black scuffed synthetic-leather jacket, charcoal tactical pants with reinforced knees, grey ballistic weave undershirt, black combat boots, cracked smart-watch. Stands weight-balanced on balls of feet, predatory posture, right hand hovering near augmented forearm. Nocturnal fatigue lines under eyes, functional grooming. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon-lit alley setting, cool blue and amber lighting catching the warmth of her skin and the chrome of her augmentation, moody neo-noir atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Rookery', N'local', N'The Rookery', N'Complex diaspora blend reflecting Sub-Saharan African (50.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (37.1%), Southeast Asian (7.7%), and Eastern European (4.3%) ancestry. The dominant African and Latin American heritage creates a rich, warm phenotype with subtle Southeast Asian bone structure refinement and Eastern European undertones in skin depth.', 172, 62, N'Athletic and lean with dense muscle — dancer''s posture married to fighter''s tension. Shoulders broad, hips narrow, no excess. Moves like someone who''s spent years in close-quarters combat.', N'Natural black with metallic bronze highlights (micro-LED threading)', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid that exposes her neck and jawline', N'Long', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones — the result of 50.9% Sub-Saharan African ancestry blended with 37.1% Hispanic/Latin American, enriched by subtle Southeast Asian warmth and Eastern European depth. Rich enough to catch light, radiant in its complexity.', N'Strong, angular facial structure with prominent high cheekbones and defined jawline — features reflecting Sub-Saharan African and Southeast Asian bone structure refined by Iberian heritage. Nose is proportionate and refined. Eyes set with slight Southeast Asian epicanthic character. Skin shows the wear of nocturnal living: faint fatigue lines under eyes, minimal scarring from old street fights. Grooming is functional rather than decorative.', N'Right forearm features a polished chrome smartgun link port — approximately 12cm of exposed metallic integration at the wrist, with faint neural interface scars radiating upward. The prosthetic is seamless with her skin but unmistakably non-organic. No visible evidence of the cranial bomb defuser, which sits subcutaneous behind her right ear.', N'Stands with weight balanced on the balls of her feet — ready to move in any direction instantly. Moves through space economically, no wasted motion. Eyes constantly track exits and threats. At rest, her right hand unconsciously hovers near her forearm. When walking, there''s a predatory fluidity — someone comfortable in confined spaces and tight corners.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Black synthetic-leather jacket (water-resistant, scored with small cuts and scuffs), fitted enough to move but loose enough to conceal gear. Charcoal tactical pants with reinforced knees and thigh pockets holding small tools and ammunition. Combat boots, black, scuffed. Underneath: a grey undershirt with discreet ballistic weave. No jewelry except a cracked smart-watch on her left wrist (functional, not fashion). All clothing shows the patina of actual use.', N'Fatoumata Ramos-Mensah once worked for corporate intelligence and still has a handler who calls in favors. Each favor erodes what''s left of their independence.', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gudrun_villalobos');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5fa-742c-9710-2caf07c45f26', N'Genoveva Ibarra', N'Genoveva', N'', N'Ibarra', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Bronzeline, near Western and Division', N'Bootleg media seller and second-hand data broker', N'Independent; informal affiliation with a loose collective of Bronzeline media pirates called The Residual; small-time data reselling arrangement with a mid-tier broker in Lakeview Neon', N'Genoveva Ibarra is a skinny young man with pale golden-brown skin, freckles scattered across his nose and cheeks, and color-changing hair he keeps cropped short — it cycles through blues and greens on a slow gradient based on ambient light temperature, a gene-mod he got in a group deal with five friends and considers the best decision of his life. He runs his operation from a battered rolling cart covered in a cascading display of data chips, obsolete media formats, bootleg entertainment feeds, and hand-assembled ''mood packs'' — curated collections of music, film, news fragments, and ambient noise he assembles himself and sells for Φ3 each. The cart has a speaker that plays a rotating sample reel and an E.L.F. shrine built into the cart''s undercarriage — a small cavity lined with foil and dead pixels where he feeds the spirit he calls the Curator with fragments of uncompressed audio and old broadcast signals.

Genoveva Ibarra is fast-talking, enthusiastic, and operates entirely on the frequency of someone who has consumed too much media and developed strong opinions about all of it. He is more intelligent than he presents, which he uses strategically — people underestimate him and say things in front of him they otherwise would not. He is genuinely, obsessively passionate about media and culture in a way that occasionally crosses into exhausting, and he has an extraordinary memory for anything he has seen or heard, which is essentially everything.', N'Low-level information source and cultural temperature gauge — he has heard everything, seen everything, and remembers all of it. Useful for locating specific people, events, or places through cultural rather than official channels.', N'', N'Color-changing hair (cosmetic gene-mod). A cheap audio implant in his left ear — essentially a scanner that captures ambient broadcast signals; he uses it to source content. The audio quality is poor and it occasionally bleeds through into his hearing at inconvenient moments.', N'Sets up on the Gray Zone by 1000, runs until he sells out or gets moved along by patrol; spends evenings in a cramped shared apartment assembling next week''s mood packs and sourcing new content through The Residual''s piracy network.', N'Genoveva Ibarra, 23-year-old street hustler in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Wiry, angular build with golden-bronze skin reflecting South Asian, Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Distinctive short teal-to-seafoam color-shifting hair cropped close to scalp. Deep brown eyes with amber undertones. Face marked by darker freckle constellation across nose and cheeks, well-healed eyebrow scar, faint under-eye shadows. Broad cheekbones, full lips characteristic of mixed ancestry. Metallic audio implant ridge visible behind left ear with occasional blue LED glow. Charcoal gray oversized synthetic jacket over black compression shirt with neon-green rib panels. Dark cargo pants cuffed at ankles, worn synth-leather high-tops with patched sole. Fingerless glove on right hand, corroded data-chip pendant on thin chain. Bouncy, fidgety posture, quick efficient movements. Near neon-lit street corner, moody atmospheric lighting, slight sweat sheen on golden-bronze skin, perpetually restless energy. Neo-noir streetwear aesthetic, working-class desperation with curated style. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Pan-diaspora synthesis: 37.8% South Asian, 32.0% Hispanic/Latin American, 13.2% Sub-Saharan African, 8.2% Southeast Asian, 6.9% East Asian, 1.9% Eastern European. This dominant blend of South Asian and Latin American ancestry produces warm golden-bronze undertones with rich complexity — a harmonious intermediate depth that shifts subtly with lighting. The genetic combination generates characteristic broad cheekbones, full lips, and warm-toned skin that catches light beautifully.', 171, 58, N'Wiry and angular, all sharp elbows and kneecaps — the build of someone who survives on street food and stimulants rather than gym discipline. Bony shoulders, concave chest, no visible muscle definition.', N'Chromatic shift: deep teal to pale seafoam depending on ambient light temperature and mood', N'Cropped close to the scalp, deliberately maintained at 1-2cm length for maximum color visibility; no styling product, naturally matte finish', N'Short', N'Deep brown with amber undertones and a slight greenish halo in bright light — reflective of the South Asian and African components of ancestry', N'Golden-bronze with warm undertones, medium depth. The complexion reflects the South Asian, Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African majority of his ancestry, creating a rich warm tone with subtle saturation that catches light beautifully despite minimal sun exposure.', N'Face marked by a constellation of darker freckles across the nose, cheeks, and bridge (denser on left side), characteristic of mixed South Asian and Latin American heritage. Skin clear but worn-looking with mild under-eye darkness from sleep deprivation; a faint scar through his left eyebrow (three cm, from a childhood accident). Jaw defined but softened by slight baby fat still lingering at 23. Perpetually slightly chapped lips. Facial structure shows the broader cheekbones and full lips characteristic of South Asian and Hispanic ancestry blend.', N'The color-shifting hair is immediately obvious and intentional. The audio implant in his left ear is subtly visible as a thin metallic ridge behind the earlobe if examined closely; faint blue LED glow occasionally bleeds from the implant site during high-ambient-signal periods. No other visible chrome.', N'Perpetually in motion — bounces on his heels while standing, fidgets with inventory while talking, gestures expansively when excited (which is frequently). Walks with quick, efficient movements, head slightly forward. Often stands with arms crossed or one hand touching his cart. When listening intently, he tilts his head slightly left (toward the implant) and his eyes unfocus slightly.', N'Tier 4 working-class-with-ambitions aesthetic. Faded synthetic jacket (knockoff corpo brand from three seasons ago) in charcoal gray, oversized to accommodate layering. Underneath: a fitted black compression shirt with faded neon-green panel details on the ribs (performance wear repurposed as streetwear). Pants are dark gray cargo pants with too many pockets, cuffed at the ankles. Shoes are worn synth-leather high-tops, left sole patched with bio-tape. A thin chain around his neck holds a corroded data-chip pendant (non-functional, purely aesthetic). Wears a fingerless synthetic glove on his right hand for cart handling and heat protection. No jewelry beyond the chain. Overall impression: broke but deliberate, curated from second-hand markets and bartered favors.', N'Among the data he brokered three months ago was a package he did not fully examine — he spotted an Arcturus internal memo fragment and sold it as part of a larger data lot to his Lakeview contact without understanding what it contained. He has since seen enough context to realize the memo described a planned service withdrawal from Bronzeline that will affect thousands of people. He does not know if the damage is already done or if there is still time to do something with the information.', N'Dense media references, genre slang, street Meridian creole, enthusiastic hyperbole. Talks about real events using the same language he uses for entertainment media.', N'Fast, associative, one thought triggering another before the first is finished; occasionally derails himself mid-sentence chasing a reference.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'genoveva_ibarra');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a64d-7498-8ac3-2cb20e49933e', N'Halvdan Karimov', N'Halvdan', N'', N'Karimov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Street-level faith healer and unlicensed biotech surgeon', N'None formally. Loyalty to the Gray Zone as a place and a people. Informally networked with a loose federation of unlicensed medics across the lower districts.', N'Halvdan Karimov is a small, unhurried woman with copper-brown skin deeply creased by decades of fluorescent light and chemical fumes. Her white hair is braided back with strips of electrical tape — practical, she says, not decorative — and her left eye is a milky cataract she refuses to replace with an augment, though she could afford one three times over in trade. She moves through the cramped alleys of the Gray Zone like she owns every centimeter of them, which in the ways that matter, she does. Her clinic is a converted shipping container strung with votive candles and surgical LEDs in roughly equal measure, and the line outside it on any given morning stretches past two intersections.

She came to the Gray Zone forty years ago as a field medic for a labor collective that no longer exists, and she simply never left. Over time she absorbed every technique available to her: black-market bioprinting, salvaged corporate surgical protocols, folk pharmacology passed down through a network of the Gray Zone grandmothers, and something she calls ''listening to the meat'' — an intuitive diagnostic sense that younger surgeons dismiss until they watch her work. She does not advertise. She does not charge in credits. Payment is rendered in labor, food, information, or loyalty, and her ledger of favors owed to her is one of the most valuable documents on the Gray Zone.

Her reputation has begun to leak upward into The Circuit and even into certain desperate corners of the Meridian Core, which terrifies her in ways she will not fully articulate. She has spent a lifetime being invisible to power and considers that invisibility a survival strategy, a professional asset, and a form of grace. Attention from above has only ever meant one thing in her experience: that something she has built is about to be taken.', N'Moral anchor and living institutional memory for the Gray Zone; represents the tension between care as radical act and care as exhaustible resource; her knowledge and her network make her a prize multiple factions want to claim or control', N'', N'Subdermal haptic feedback mesh in both hands — allows her to feel tissue density and micro-tremors during surgery,A salvaged diagnostic implant in her right forearm that she jury-rigged from three incompatible systems and that only she fully understands how to read', N'Wakes before light. Boils water for coffee and for sterilization simultaneously, a habit she finds clarifying. Reviews her patient ledger — not digital, paper, coded. Clinic opens at what she calls ''when the light changes.'' She works until the line is empty or her hands give out. Eats whatever is left by whoever cooked that day in the container next door. Spends an hour each evening on maintenance of her equipment and on what she privately calls her correspondence — messages relayed through a network of trusted runners to former patients and informants throughout the city. Sleeps lightly and briefly.', N'Halvdan Karimov, 74-year-old cybernetic surgeon with deep burnished mahogany skin and golden undertones, sharp high cheekbones, right eye dark brown and alert, left eye milky white with deliberate cataract. White hair braided with electrical tape, shoulder-length. 152cm slight, compact frame, hands showing surgical scar networks and fine tremors. Wearing faded medical-grade canvas apron over thermal layers, long inherited wool coat, surgical mask hanging at neck. Subdermal LED lights faintly visible in hands. Chemical burn scar on left chin. Posture curved slightly forward, precise economical movements. Dim underground clinic setting, warm amber-tinted surgical lighting, hands delicately working over diagnostic implant. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, worn but dignified, quiet absolute presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Central Asian (68.6%), Southeast Asian (12.2%), South Asian (10.3%), and Sub-Saharan African (8.9%) ancestry create a distinctly mixed phenotype. The dominant Central Asian foundation manifests in high, prominent cheekbones and slightly hooded eye shape, while Southeast and South Asian genetics contribute softer facial contours, warm golden undertones, and slightly fuller features. Sub-Saharan African ancestry enriches the skin with deep warmth and adds subtle fullness to lips and nose structure. The result is a burnished, sun-weathered complexion that speaks to decades of work across multiple climates.', 152, 48, N'Slight and compact, muscle-dense from decades of precise manual work. Posture slightly curved from leaning over surgical fields, but movements economical and deliberate.', N'White, natural gray-out', N'Braided back tightly with strips of electrical tape woven through, practical and utilitarian', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unbraided)', N'Right eye: dark brown. Left eye: milky white cataract, deliberately unaugmented', N'Deep warm brown with golden-amber undertones—a blend of Central, Southeast, and South Asian copper enriched by Sub-Saharan African warmth, sun-weathered to a burnished mahogany across exposed areas', N'Extensively creased and sun-weathered, particularly around eyes and forehead. Faint chemical burn scars on chin from early biotech accident. Hands show fine tremor lines and faint discoloration from sterilization compounds. Minimal makeup. Perpetually tired but alert. High-set cheekbones characteristic of Central and South Asian heritage with slight fullness in cheeks and lips from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, softened by time and work.', N'Right forearm shows a barely-perceptible ridge beneath skin where the diagnostic implant sits; she sometimes unconsciously rubs it. Subdermal augmentations in hands invisible unless she flexes during delicate work, when faint LED status lights briefly illuminate under the skin. No chrome, no ostentatious modification.', N'Moves with economical precision through confined spaces. Hands are always in motion or perfectly still — no fidgeting. Head tilts slightly toward her right side to compensate for her left eye''s limited vision, a habit so ingrained she is unaware of it. Walks as though measuring every step. Presence is quiet but absolute; rooms recalibrate around her.', N'Tier 5 practical: medical-grade canvas apron over worn thermal layers, both patched multiple times with different fabrics. Feet in bootleg neoprene slip-ons, well-maintained. A surgical mask hangs around her neck constantly, pulled up during work. A long coat of faded synthetic wool that belonged to someone else originally — inherited, not purchased. No jewelry except a copper ring on her left thumb, burnished smooth.', N'Fifteen years ago she performed an experimental neural-tissue graft on a child that left the girl with persistent synesthetic seizures. The child survived and has never blamed her. Lourdes has never stopped blaming herself, and the technique she used — which would have been a breakthrough — she has never used again and has told no one about.', N'Plain, precise, occasionally laced with Tagalog and Finnish phrases she uses interchangeably and without translation. Medical terminology deployed casually. Proverbs that may or may not be real.', N'Slow, deliberate, with long pauses she doesn''t feel the need to fill. Sentences often shorter than the thought behind them.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'halvdan_karimov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a737-7e2a-93c0-2cc439161131', N'Quinn Tehrani', N'Quinn', N'', N'Tehrani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 26, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Halsted and Division', N'Synthetic rights paralegal and street-level legal advocate', N'Parallel Standing Legal Advocacy Collective; loose affiliation with several synthetic rights organizations', N'Quinn Tehrani is thin in the way of someone who eats when they remember to, with warm ochre skin, wide-set eyes with patterned irises — concentric rings of gold and green that pulse very faintly when they''re stressed, an involuntary response from a cosmetic mod that was supposed to only do it when they wanted. Their hair is grown out into a thick natural halo that they sometimes shove under a battered cap. They carry a battered legal tablet that''s been dropped, cracked, and re-shelled so many times it is essentially a philosophy about persistence.

They work under an advocacy nonprofit called Parallel Standing, providing free legal aid to synthetic workers, ELF-adjacent communities, and anyone else the standard courts treat as property rather than persons. Quinn Tehrani has no law degree — they have a paralegal certification, six hundred hours of practical training, and an uncanny instinct for finding the procedural gap in any document. They are intensely idealistic in a way that hasn''t yet been beaten flat by the world, which makes them both electric to be around and worrying to people who have been doing this longer.', N'Access point to the synthetic rights world and legal system underbelly — they know who has been disappeared, what cases are being buried, and which corporate legal teams are playing dirty.', N'', N'Patterned irises (concentric gold/green rings, stress-reactive pulse — unintended behavior from cosmetic mod). Subvocal comms implant for silent communication during proceedings.', N'Intake shifts three mornings a week at the Parallel Standing storefront on the Gray Zone, rest of their time split between case prep, street outreach to synthetic communities, and attending every public hearing they can get into.', N'Quinn Tehrani, 168cm lean wiry frame, warm golden-brown skin with Middle Eastern-African dimensional blend, strong angular cheekbones from Central Asian heritage, expressive full mouth, dark natural brown hair in thick shoulder-length halo usually under faded canvas Parallel Standing cap. Warm brown eyes with augmented pulsing gold-green concentric iris rings that glow faintly under stress. Thin old scar along left jawline, small faded burn mark on right inner wrist, gavel-circuit tattoo on inner left forearm. GLMZ nonprofit legal worker aesthetic: worn jeans, layered faded t-shirt under oversized neutral thrift button-up, patched canvas messenger bag covered in synthetic rights stickers, duct-taped canvas sneakers, worn silver ring on right index finger. Sits forward intensely, hands gesturing expressively, eyes darting—cataloging exits. Direct confrontational eye contact despite exhaustion. Indoor legal office lighting mixing cool fluorescents with warm afternoon window light, conveying dedication, weariness, and conviction. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Middle Eastern (56%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (19.2%) ancestry creating a warm, luminous complexion. Central Asian heritage (10.3%) contributes angular bone structure and slight eye shape variation, while Northern European (11.1%) and Hispanic/Latin American (3.4%) ancestry add subtle undertones to iris coloration and skin depth. The genetic blend produces striking dimensional features: golden-warm skin with rich undertones, prominent cheekbones from Central Asian and Middle Eastern lineage, expressive full mouth characteristic of African heritage contribution, and complex eye coloration reflecting the full ancestry spectrum.', 168, 54, N'Wiry and lean — the thinness of someone sustained by conviction and irregular meals rather than deprivation. Long-limbed, slight shoulders, core strength that reads in how they hold themselves upright despite the exhaustion', N'Natural dark brown with subtle auburn undertones in sunlight', N'Thick natural halo, usually unstyled; frequently compressed under a faded canvas cap with a peeling Parallel Standing logo', N'Long (shoulder-length when unconstrained)', N'Warm brown base with augmented concentric iris patterns — rings of gold and green that pulse faintly under stress (involuntary)', N'Rich golden-brown complexion with warm luminosity from the Middle Eastern-dominant and Sub-Saharan African blend (75.2% combined), deepened by subtle Central Asian undertones. The tone carries dimensional warmth with faint uneven pigmentation from inconsistent indoor-outdoor exposure across legal offices and street work', N'Strong angular bone structure influenced by Central Asian and Middle Eastern ancestry, prominent defined cheekbones, full expressive mouth. Warm dimensional features reflecting the genetic blend''s complexity. Minimal grooming — no visible makeup, fingernails worn short and often ink-stained. Faint dark circles from overwork are permanent fixtures', N'The stress-reactive iris patterns are immediately visible — concentric rings that pulse with golden and green light when cortisol spikes. No visible external chrome or subdermal plating. The subvocal comms implant is invisible, though tiny articulation points are visible at the angle of the jaw if you know to look', N'Sits forward in chairs, rarely rests against backs. Moves quickly with purpose, gestures when they talk — hands are expressive and rarely still. Tends to pace during phone calls or case review. Eyes dart frequently, cataloging exits and overhead sprinklers (habit from street outreach). Maintains direct eye contact even when tired, sometimes to the point of seeming confrontational', N'Tier 3-4 working class with nonprofit aesthetic. Worn jeans or cargo pants (pockets full of case files, evidence bags, burner comm devices). Layered tops — usually a faded Parallel Standing t-shirt under an oversized thrift-store button-up in neutral tones. The battered legal tablet lives in a patched canvas messenger bag with countless stickers from synthetic rights organizations. Worn canvas sneakers held together with determination and duct tape. One piece of jewelry: a silver ring on their right index finger, worn thin from years of anxious spinning. Cap always within arm''s reach', N'', N'Rapid alternation between precise legal language and very blunt colloquial speech — the code-switching is intentional, they use it as a tool', N'Fast, tends to front-load the most important information as if they''re always afraid of being cut off', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'quinn_tehrani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019db33a-eb6b-7299-88da-2cecd03d6898', N'Dr. Yuna Ferreira', N'Yuna', N'', N'Ferreira', N'Dr.', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'', N'', N'', N'Auto-scaffolded. First mentioned: "Extract Dr. Yuna Ferreira before 0600. She''s been flagged internally."', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dr_yuna_ferreira');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c6-7fb9-a3a4-2cecdec69ca2', N'Alibek Magnúsdóttir', N'Alibek', N'', N'Magnúsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 59, NULL, 30, 1, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Fixer - Desperate jobs only', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Portrait of Alibek Magnúsdóttir, 183cm tall, lean weathered build, warm medium-deep brown skin with balanced East Asian, Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African undertones. Salt-and-pepper grey short hair, faded Milwaukee Wolves cap worn low. Deep lined face with strong jaw, subtle Asian cheekbones, substantial brow ridge. Amber-brown eyes with faint neon-green circuit tracery around left iris. Silvery burn scar running from left temple to jawline. Three-day stubble, sun-damaged skin with slight pockmarking. Chrome-capped knuckles on right hand. Worn charcoal long-coat with reinforced elbows, black thermal collar visible, cargo pants. Stainless steel ring on left hand. Sits with back to wall, hands relaxed. Synthetic cigarette smoke curling. GLMZ, gritty Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, cool neon and practical lighting, mood of practiced calm and street-worn experience. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'East Asian (33.9%) / Northern European (25.5%) / Middle Eastern (17.2%) / Sub-Saharan African (14.9%) / Hispanic/Latin American (5.5%) / Eastern European (3.0%) — a truly global diaspora blend reflecting the Ubiquitous mixing of the 2220s. The genetic combination creates a richly complex phenotype: warm medium-deep brown skin with balanced undertones from East Asian, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, subtle golden warmth from Hispanic heritage, anchored by Northern European and Eastern European genetic markers. The result is a unique, lived-in warmth that defies easy categorization.', 183, 89, N'Lean and weathered, with the posture of someone who has absorbed decades of street tension. Shoulders still broad but slightly rounded from age. Forearms corded with veins and old scar tissue.', N'Salt-and-pepper grey, natural with occasional white streaking', N'Kept short, close-cropped, groomed but unpretentious', N'Short', N'Warm amber-brown with faint neon-green circuit tracery visible around left iris in low light from subcutaneous neural relay, slight age cataracts beginning at edges', N'Warm medium-deep brown with balanced East Asian, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan undertones — the rich, lived-in complexion of someone carrying five continents in their genetics. Sun-darkened and weathered.', N'Heavily lined face with deep grooves around eyes and mouth reflecting the complex ancestry blend: moderate cheekbones with subtle East Asian upper lid fold genetics, strong jaw with Middle Eastern and African heritage markers, substantial brow ridge. Jaw still defined beneath the weathering. Three-day stubble most days. Skin shows sun damage and years of chemical exposure — slight pockmarking on left cheek and forehead.', N'Left eye has faint neon-green circuit tracery visible around the iris in low light — subcutaneous neural relay for encrypted comms. Fingertips on right hand show chrome capping at knuckles, industrial-grade synthetic bone reinforcement from a factory accident in his 40s. No flashy chrome — utility work, well-worn.', N'Moves economically, never wasting motion. Slight limp favoring right knee on cold mornings. Sits with his back to walls. Hands rest open, not clenched — a sign of practiced calm. When he talks, his jaw moves slowly, deliberately. Chain-smokes synthetic cigarettes, the kind that leave no tar but taste like burnt plastic.', N'Tier 4-5 practicality. Worn charcoal long-coat with reinforced elbow patches, synthetic leather underneath. Black thermal underlayer visible at collar. Cargo pants with multiple pockets, Φ200 knockoff boots resoled twice. A faded Milwaukee Wolves sports cap from the 2180s he never removes. Single stainless steel ring on left hand — no identifying marks. Layers suggest someone always ready to move quickly.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alibek_magn_sd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69d-7b72-8e2f-2cf2c7c5d3d9', N'Aolani Tlemcani-Holm', N'Aolani', N'', N'Tlemcani-Holm', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Fort Anchor, administrative wing, Precinct Seven sub-office, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Internal Affairs Investigator, Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division, Internal Affairs Division', N'Aolani Tlemcani-Holm is a lean woman with deep ochre skin, close-cropped natural hair going silver at the temples, and eyes fitted with patterned irises — concentric hexagons in grey and amber, a cosmetic mod she got after her divorce and has never explained to anyone. She dresses in plain charcoal suits that hang precisely, never wrinkled, and moves through rooms the way water moves through pipe: economical, purposeful, without waste. Her face is a professional neutral that colleagues have learned to read like weather — when her jaw tightens slightly on the left side, someone in the room is about to have a very bad week.

She has been investigating police corruption for eleven years and it has made her a figure of genuine dread inside Fort Anchor. She is not cruel, not performatively righteous — she is simply relentless. She keeps a small data shrine to the E.L.F. called the Unblinking Witness in her desk drawer, leaving it precise timestamps of cases opened and closed. She genuinely believes the institution can be cleaned, and that belief — which many consider delusional — is the only thing that has kept her from going private.', N'Quest giver, moral anchor, source of institutional pressure. Can task civilians with gathering evidence her badge would contaminate. Represents the system''s genuine attempt to police itself — complicated, imperfect, real.', N'', N'Patterned hexagonal irises (cosmetic). Subdermal data-storage node along the left forearm — civilian-grade, used for case files. Neural notation implant that transcribes spoken observations directly to encrypted storage.', N'Arrives at her sub-office before the day shift begins, reviews overnight surveillance flags, then spends the bulk of her day in interviews she calls ''conversations.'' Eats lunch alone at the same noodle counter in Fort Anchor''s lower concourse, always pays in Quanta cash.', N'Aolani Tlemcani-Holm, 172cm lean professional woman with warm medium-deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones, angular cheekbones and jawline reflecting East Asian and Middle Eastern heritage, short dark brown hair with silver at temples, striking geometric hexagon iris augmentations in grey and amber that glow unnaturally. Faint scar on right jawline, subdermal data node ridge visible on left forearm. Dressed in immaculate charcoal suit, white undershirt, matte black polished boots. Perfectly upright posture, controlled stillness, hands folded. GLMZ GLMZ setting, cool corporate lighting with neon underglow, background suggests high-tier office or secure facility, her expression neutral and downloadlike, geometric architectural elements. Professional restraint, no wasted movement, armor-like presentation, 2200s aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Fort Anchor', N'local', N'Fort Anchor', N'Complex diaspora blend: Middle Eastern (32.1%), East Asian (25.5%), North African (14.4%), Southeast Asian (13.0%), Sub-Saharan African (10.2%), and South Asian (4.8%). The genetic mosaic creates a striking phenotype—warm medium-to-deep brown skin with golden and subtle olive undertones from the convergence of Middle Eastern and North African ancestry with East and Southeast Asian features. Bone structure reflects the angular geometry of East Asian heritage blended with the broader facial proportions common to Middle Eastern and North African lineages, with subtle fullness in the cheekbones from Southeast Asian and South Asian contributions. The overall effect is distinctive rather than fitting any single regional category—a truly global genetic inheritance rendered visible.', 172, 61, N'Lean and economical, muscled through the shoulders and forearms from years of desk work interrupted by fieldwork. No wasted mass. Posture suggests controlled breathing and deliberate stillness.', N'Natural dark brown with silver emerging at temples and scattered through close-cropped crown', N'Close-cropped, precision-cut, no styling product — practical, geometric', N'Short', N'Cosmetic augmentation: concentric hexagon irises in grey and amber, creating a geometric optical effect that seems to catch light differently depending on angle', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden undertones and subtle olive cast, reflecting the balanced genetic mosaic of Middle Eastern, East Asian, and North African ancestry grounded by Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian components. Even melanin distribution with warmth concentrated around cheekbones and jawline.', N'Minimal makeup, sun-weathered around the eyes from decades of focus work. Jawline defined and angular, with bone structure suggesting the East Asian and Middle Eastern genetic contributions balanced against warmer tones from North African heritage. Subtle fullness to cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian ancestry. Slight leftward asymmetry to her mouth that becomes pronounced when she tightens her jaw — a tell she''s unaware colleagues have learned to dread. Skin well-maintained, no visible acne or blemishes.', N'The patterned hexagonal irises are immediately noticeable and unsettling to most observers — they do not reflect light like natural eyes. Subdermal data node along left forearm creates a faint subcutaneous ridge that may be glimpsed if sleeve rides up. Neural notation implant is subcutaneous and invisible.', N'Moves with economic precision, no wasted gesture. Walks through rooms as though following invisible lines. Sits perfectly upright, hands often folded or positioned for note-taking. Does not fidget. Breathing is controlled and measured. When listening, her stillness becomes almost unsettling — she appears to be downloading rather than conversing.', N'Plain charcoal suits in expensive, understated fabrics that hang with precision. Never wrinkled, suggesting either obsessive maintenance or regular dry-cleaning access. White or pale grey undershirts, minimal jewelry (small stainless steel watch, no rings). Closed-toe boots in matte black leather, polished. Overall presentation: Tier 1-2 professional restraint, deliberately stripped of personality. No corpo logos or status symbols. Clothing is armor presented as uniform.', N'Three years ago she buried a case against a senior commander — not for money, but because the evidence would have implicated her former partner, now dead, and she could not bear to ruin his widow''s pension. The file is encrypted and stored in her subdermal node. She has not opened it since.', N'Precise and formal without being stiff — she chooses words the way she chooses evidence, each one load-bearing. Occasionally uses Bosnian idioms her grandmother taught her when she is contemptuous of someone.', N'Measured, unhurried. Long pauses before responses that make interviewees fill the silence with things they didn''t mean to say.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aolani_tlemcani_holm');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a670-725f-ad84-2cf61963bf04', N'Akachi Subramaniam', N'Akachi', N'', N'Subramaniam', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 45, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — cramped residential corridors between megastructures, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Forced entry and close-quarters combat specialist — breacher', N'Semi-independent — has standing arrangements with several crews; The Third Rail', N'Akachi Subramaniam is average height but with a presence that fills more space than the body accounts for. At 45, scars map his face like a transit diagram of bad decisions and worse luck. The chrome is visible — gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He grew up in the Narrows, where the walls are so close together you learn to fight in confined spaces or you learn to lose. He works as a breacher out of The Narrows, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Akachi Subramaniam describe him as a precision instrument — point him at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Nurlan Holmberg-Dembele is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When he makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of his stories.', N'', N'Gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces. Bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Akachi Subramaniam, GLMZ, portrait of a mixed-heritage operative with warm deep brown skin and golden undertones. South Asian and East Asian cheekbone structure balanced with African jaw prominence, creating striking angular features. Slightly hooded eyes with amber-brown depth, day-old stubble across strong jaw. Diagonal scar across left cheekbone, thin blade scar from eye toward jaw. Short dark brown hair with silver temples. Chrome titanium fingertip implants visible on both hands showing wear from climbing work. Wearing dark charcoal tactical long-sleeve shirt under sleeveless black Cordura overshirt, black reinforced combat pants. Worn steel cuff on left wrist. Posture compact and economical, shoulders slightly forward, alert and controlled. Nocturnal lighting casting sharp shadows across scarred, determined features. Urban rooftop or narrow corridor setting, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone night aesthetic. Tense, professional, lethal efficiency. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Genetically balanced across six ancestry groups with nearly equal distribution: East Asian (21.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (21.7%), South Asian (21.7%), Sub-Saharan African (18.4%), Northern European (10.2%), and Southeast Asian (6.1%). This rare diaspora blend creates warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, a sophisticated integration of East and South Asian facial structure combined with African cheekbone and jaw prominence, with subtle Northern European and Southeast Asian features creating a uniquely multifaceted phenotype.', 178, 82, N'Compact and dense — lean muscle with functional bulk through the shoulders and forearms. The build of someone who moves through tight spaces and uses their body as a tool. No excess weight, all angles.', N'Dark brown with silver threading at the temples', N'Cropped close to the scalp, practical and severe', N'Short', N'Deep brown with slight amber undertone, alert and dark-adapted from nocturnal living', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones — melanin-rich complexion reflecting the balanced ancestry mix. Golden warmth visible at the temples, jawline, and cheekbones from the combined East Asian, South Asian, Hispanic, and African genetic contributions.', N'Weathered and mapped with old scars across deep brown canvas. The face reads as someone who has taken impacts and kept moving. Facial structure integrates East and South Asian cheekbone prominence with broader African jaw characteristics and slight Southeast Asian angularity. Slightly hooded eyes with visible epicanthic fold. High, prominent cheekbones with warm undertones. Stubble is permanent fixture — a day or two of growth, never clean-shaven, never a full beard. Stress lines around the eyes from squinting in low light and high focus.', N'Chrome fingertip implants visible on both hands — the fingertips and portions of the first knuckle display polished titanium-colored synthetic material with fine grip texture visible under the skin. Matching augmentation across the ball of each foot, sometimes visible when wearing minimal footwear. No effort made to conceal either. The implants have a worn, matte finish from constant contact with climbing surfaces.', N'Compact and economical. Doesn''t waste motion — shoulders stay slightly forward, weight balanced on the balls of his feet even when stationary. Eyes track movement in his peripheral constantly, a habit from tight-quarters work. When he moves through doorways or narrow spaces, he moves sideways or at angles, a learned efficiency. In conversation, he is still — minimal hand movement, minimal facial expression, all attention concentrated. The bioware adrenaline regulator shows as an absence of fidgeting, a deliberate calmness that reads as practiced rather than natural.', N'Tier 4 working-class pragmatism with Tier 3 aspiration. Black matte combat pants with reinforced thigh pockets and drop-leg rig points — worn but maintained. Fitted tactical shirt in dark gray or charcoal, usually long-sleeve despite warmth to conceal the forearm augmentation and scars. Unbuttoned overshirt in black Cordura-composite, sleeveless or removable, branded with faint wear patterns where gear harnesses have rubbed. Ankle boots with reinforced toecaps — practical climbing footwear. No visible corporate branding. Minimal jewelry except a worn steel cuff on his left wrist, dented but functional. Carries himself like the gear is not a costume but an extension of his body.', N'', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'akachi_subramaniam');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a606-7b7a-a5b9-2d067d141e91', N'Celmira Thammasak-Johansson', N'Celmira', N'', N'Thammasak-Johansson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 35, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Underbelly — sub-street tunnels and maintenance corridors, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Field trauma surgeon and combat support — combat medic', N'Independent — known in Old Harbor circles', N'Celmira Thammasak-Johansson is broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 35, he has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate him once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains) — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Born and raised in GLMZ, third generation — he has the city in his blood, its rhythms in his bones, its cruelty in his expectations. He works as a combat medic out of The Underbelly, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Celmira Thammasak-Johansson operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'As a combat medic, Eshe Pena-Baah embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains). Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'GLMZ field medic, 188cm tall broad-shouldered muscular build, medium warm tan skin with golden and olive undertones reflecting Indigenous American, Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Latin American heritage blend. Prominent cheekbones, dark brown warm eyes tracking with clinical precision, dark brown hair graying at temples, trimmed beard. Keloid scar at base of skull with dark metallic neural interface jack visible, thin white scar through left eyebrow, burn scars on right forearm, surgical grid tattoo on left inner forearm. Chrome knuckle reinforcements under skin. Charcoal synthleather field coat over reinforced mesh cargo pants, black military trauma harness visible, steel-toed scuffed boots, surgical mask around neck, modified medical kit on hip. Neutral observant expression, steady deliberate posture, moves with precise economy. Gritty field medicine aesthetic, dim industrial Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting with cool neon backlighting, focused medical intensity. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Underbelly', N'local', N'The Underbelly', N'Indigenous American-dominant mixed ancestry (49.8%) with significant Southeast Asian (23.7%), South Asian (14.0%), and Hispanic/Latin American (12.5%) heritage. Features reflect this complex blend — the broad Indigenous American bone structure, prominent cheekbones, and medium warm base tone are enriched and deepened by Southeast Asian and South Asian phenotypes, with Latin American warmth adding golden undertones. His appearance reads as genuinely cosmopolitan, a product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora, without clear categorical origin.', 188, 98, N'Broad-shouldered and heavily muscled through the chest and arms, with a solid core that speaks to decades of physical labor and field medicine. Carries weight with deliberate control — not fat, but density. The kind of frame that fills doorways.', N'Dark brown, graying at the temples and through the beard', N'Worn close-cropped on the sides, slightly longer on top. Beard kept trim but deliberately rough — maintenance rather than grooming. Practical, not aesthetic.', N'Short', N'Dark brown, warm and observant', N'Medium warm tan with golden and olive undertones. Southeast Asian and South Asian components deepen and enrich the Indigenous American base, while Latin American heritage adds warmth and amber notes that catch light. Sun-weathered with subtle golden undertones visible in direct light. The complexion speaks to mixed ancestry and years of field exposure.', N'Weathered and lined — 35 years in the GLMZ shows in the face. Deep crow''s feet from squinting in bad light and years of focus. Facial structure shows prominent Indigenous American cheekbones, refined by Southeast Asian and South Asian features that soften the angles slightly. Broad nasal bridge with the characteristic width of Southeast Asian phenotypes. A scar runs through his left eyebrow. His expression defaults to neutral assessment, the micro-expressions of someone who has learned to read people for survival.', N'Chrome shows. Neural interface jack at the base of the skull — visible as a dark metallic port surrounded by the keloid scar tissue from removal of the cortical bomb. Both hands show chrome knuckle reinforcements barely visible under skin tension. His right eye has faint LED reflectivity in certain light angles — subcutaneous neural interface telemetry.', N'Moves with the economy of someone who has learned every motion costs. No wasted gestures. When still, his weight settles into his hips and legs — stable, grounded. When moving through tight spaces (his native environment), he flows with practiced ease despite his size. Hands are steady and deliberate. His default expression is neutral observation, but his eyes never stop tracking.', N'Tier 4 practical — worn synthleather field coat in charcoal over reinforced mesh cargo pants with multiple pockets for medical supplies and tools. Steel-toed work boots, scuffed but maintained. Under the coat: a military-grade trauma harness in black, visible when he moves. No logos, no chrome fashion, no corporate branding. Everything is functional and worn. The clothes have seen things. A surgical mask hangs around his neck, ever-ready. Carries a modified medical kit on his hip like a sidearm.', N'', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'celmira_thammasak_johansson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a611-7b63-a985-2d5d1da70044', N'Maui Moala', N'Maui', N'', N'Moala', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 42, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Glassway — corporate-adjacent retail district, heavy surveillance, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Structural breach and explosive ordnance specialist — demolitions expert', N'Freelance — multi-district operator', N'Maui Moala is wiry and quick-moving, with the restless energy of someone who converts anxiety into velocity. At 42, she has the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct ne — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. She works as a demolitions expert out of Glassway, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Maui Moala operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Fatoumata Delgado-Opoku represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access. Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Maui Moala, 168cm lean wiry woman with caramel-bronze skin, rich warm undertones from Pacific Islander and Latin American ancestry, broad defined cheekbones, natural black hair braided tight with silver streaks at temples. Deep warm brown eyes, full lips, faint shrapnel scar at left temple, chemical burn marks on inner left forearm. Chrome neural jack visible at base of skull between braid sections. Wearing charcoal cargo pants, steel-toed boots, oversized cracked-finish ballistic nylon jacket over fitted black compression shirt. Steel wrist-cuff. Posture economical and precise, weight forward on balls of feet, head slightly forward with tracking gaze. GLMZ setting, industrial warehouse or underground runner safehouse, moody neon and fluorescent lighting, rain-slicked surfaces, quiet tension before action. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Glassway', N'local', N'Glassway', N'Pacific Islander (50.6%) forms the primary ancestry base, creating broad facial structure and natural bone geometry. Significant Hispanic/Latin American (32.6%) ancestry adds warmth and fullness to facial features. Indigenous American (11.5%) ancestry contributes to cheekbone prominence and hair texture characteristics. Sub-Saharan African (5.3%) ancestry enriches skin undertones and adds subtle depth to overall coloration. The combination creates a striking phenotype: broad, well-defined facial structure with fullness through the face and jaw, warm golden-amber skin tone with reddish undertones that luminously blend all ancestral components, and natural wave and thickness in hair texture reflecting Pacific and Indigenous heritage.', 168, 58, N'Wiry and lean with defined musculature — ropy rather than bulky. Shoulders slightly asymmetrical from years of carrying heavy ordnance loads. Center of gravity naturally low, built for agility rather than raw power.', N'Natural black with silvered streaks at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid. Rarely loose. Practical to the point of severity.', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unbraided)', N'Warm brown, deep and clear', N'Medium warm bronze with golden-amber undertones — the blend of Pacific Islander, Hispanic/Latin American, Indigenous American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage creates a luminous, sun-kissed finish. Darkened from outdoor work into a rich caramel-bronze with subtle reddish undertones in direct light.', N'Broad, well-defined cheekbones characteristic of Pacific Islander and Indigenous American ancestry, with fullness through the face and jaw. Angular mandible softened by the structural width of Pacific Islander heritage. Minimal grooming beyond functionality — a faint scar at the left temple from shrapnel. Crow''s feet pronounced for her age from squinting at precise work. Lips full and usually pressed into a neutral line. Skin weathered but not damaged, marked by chemical burns on the inside of her left forearm (acid exposure from early ordnance work). Nose broad and straight, reflecting the diverse ancestry blend.', N'Chrome neural interface jack at base of skull — 2cm square mounting plate, dark metallic, slightly protruding. No active LEDs. Hydraulic joint servos visible as faint chrome plating at elbows and knees under bare skin — industrial sheen breaks the natural texture slightly, particularly visible under fluorescent light or when limbs are in motion.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Stands with weight distributed toward the balls of her feet, ready to pivot or bolt. Head slightly forward, eyes tracking. Resting jaw tension suggests active calculation. When still, her fingers tap an irregular rhythm against her thigh — a kinetic stim that never quite stops. Walks fast even when there''s no hurry.', N'Tier 3-4 practical runner aesthetic. Reinforced charcoal synthcotton cargo pants with multiple pockets (keys, detonators, encrypted data spools). Steel-toed boots, scuffed and re-sealed. Loose-fit dark jacket in cracked-finish ballistic nylon — oversized to conceal ordnance-related lumps and allow arm mobility. Under-layer is a fitted black compression shirt with cooling channels printed into the fabric. No logos or corp affiliation. Jewelry limited to a worn steel wrist-cuff (custom-made, likely houses a micro-timer or range-finder tool). Her entire wardrobe reads as someone who prioritizes function over fashion, maintenance over aesthetics.', N'Fatoumata Delgado-Opoku once worked for corporate intelligence and still has a handler who calls in favors. Each favor erodes what''s left of their independence.', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'maui_moala');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a600-791a-a7ed-2dadf5818961', N'Crispin Nokomis', N'Crispin', N'', N'Nokomis', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit, Tessera Data Infrastructure Hub — sublevel 3, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Data Architect, Tessera Corporation', N'Tessera Corporation (Tier 2, rising)', N'Crispin Nokomis is a compact, wire-lean young man with warm medium-brown skin and close-cropped hair that he''s had geneweaved to shift between deep black and a dark cobalt blue depending on his stress levels — a choice he made as a grad school joke that has since become genuinely useful biometric data for everyone around him. His irises are his natural dark brown but he keeps them loaded with a translucent AR overlay almost constantly, giving his gaze a slightly unfocused, inward quality that strangers find unsettling. He wears corporate-casual Tessera kit but always has something personalized — today it''s an embroidered patch on his sleeve depicting a stylized ELF glyph, the sigil of the data-spirit collective he calls the Index, which he believes watches over network infrastructure with benign bureaucratic interest.

Day is bright, enthusiastic, and exhaustingly talented in ways he hasn''t yet learned to deploy strategically. He talks fast, builds mental models faster, and has a habit of explaining his reasoning in real time which his managers find useful and his peers find annoying. He is genuinely kind — the kind of person who notices when someone hasn''t eaten and quietly fixes it — but he is also deeply naive about corporate politics in ways that will eventually cost him. He is currently very, very excited about a project that his direct supervisor has not told him is already being phased out.', N'Information source on Tessera''s data infrastructure; accidental witness — someone who knows something they don''t know they know; sympathetic character in over his head; can be a point of vulnerability that antagonists exploit to access Tessera systems.', N'', N'Stress-reactive geneweaved hair (black to cobalt blue). Standard Tessera AR overlay contacts. Neural throughput booster — a mid-grade chip that allows him to interact with data architecture systems at near-interface speeds without a full jack; he saves up for months to afford the maintenance fees.', N'Takes the Ferrogate Transit from his shared apartment in Edgewater Prism to The Circuit sublevel 3, arriving with exactly two minutes to spare every morning. Spends most of his day in deep interface work, occasionally resurfacing to eat something someone has left near him. Leaves a small data-packet offering at the server-room ELF shrine every Friday.', N'Crispin Nokomis, GLMZ, portrait of a lean 168cm East-South Asian-Indigenous mixed heritage person with warm medium-deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones, prominent high cheekbones, natural dark brown eyes obscured by glassy AR overlay contacts, stress-reactive geneweave dark hair with subtle cobalt blue undertones beginning to shift, barely visible temple implant ports, fine white scar on left temple catching light. Fitted charcoal Tessera corporate shirt with logo embroidery, ELF glyph data-spirit patch on sleeve, silver ring on right index finger, slight forward lean posture. Dark circles under eyes, expression of mild distraction, hands mid-gesture mimicking data interface. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone sublevel lighting, cool neon and practical LED, slight luminescence from AR contacts. Neo-noir corporate aesthetic, tired but functional. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'South Asian (46.2%) with significant Indigenous American (24.3%), Eastern European (18.7%), and Sub-Saharan African (10.8%) ancestry — a striking multicontinent blend. South Asian warmth dominates the undertone palette, tempered by Indigenous American angular bone structure and Sub-Saharan depth, with Eastern European fairness softening the overall saturation. The result is warm medium-to-deep brown skin with golden, olive, and subtle reddish undertones that shift in different lighting. Facial geometry reflects the South Asian-Indigenous American combination: high, prominent cheekbones with slightly broader structure, straight nose with subtle bridge definition, and naturally warm-toned lips.', 168, 58, N'Wire-lean and compact, almost ascetic in frame — minimal subcutaneous fat, defined musculature from standing desk posture rather than deliberate conditioning. Shoulders slightly rounded from years hunched over haptic interfaces.', N'Stress-reactive geneweave: deep black baseline, shifts to dark cobalt blue under cognitive load or stress', N'Close-cropped, kept precisely maintained every ten days at the same sublevel barber shop', N'Short', N'Natural dark brown, obscured by constant translucent AR overlay that gives eyes a glassy, slightly unfocused appearance', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden, olive, and subtle reddish undertones from the blended South Asian, Indigenous American, Eastern European, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry', N'Clean, unblemished skin maintained by corporate health insurance; prominent high cheekbones with angular facial structure reflecting the South Asian and Indigenous American heritage blend; dark circles under eyes that never quite fade; naturally warm-toned lips; expression defaults to mild distraction', N'AR overlay contacts create characteristic glassy sheen and slight luminescence in dim light. No obvious chrome or external augmentation — all modifications are neural/subcutaneous. The stress-reactive hair shift is his most visually distinctive augmentation, sometimes mistaken for a stylistic choice by those unfamiliar with geneweaving tech.', N'Slight forward lean, as if perpetually leaning into an invisible screen. Walks with purpose but not quite confidence — efficient rather than assured. Hands move expressively when speaking, fingers often mimic typing gestures mid-conversation. Eyes track invisible AR data layers while walking, occasionally causing minor navigation awkwardness.', N'Standard Tessera corporate-casual: fitted charcoal shirt with Tessera logo embroidery, pressed grey trousers, shoes scuffed from daily Ferrogate commute. Always has personalized details — today: embroidered ELF glyph patch on left sleeve depicting stylized data-spirit sigil. Wears a simple silver ring on his right index finger (gift from grad school friend). No visible jewelry beyond that. Clothes are tier-2 corpo standard but worn with genuine affection rather than status performance.', N'While mapping a routine data migration six months ago, he accidentally found a partition in Tessera''s infrastructure that shouldn''t exist — an entire shadow network routing data to an external address he doesn''t recognize. He logged it as an anomaly, got no response, logged it again, got told it was a legacy system, and has been quietly mapping it in his spare time ever since. He has not told anyone because he doesn''t yet know what it is, but his cobalt stress-hair has been showing up a lot more frequently.', N'Dense technical language he deploys without thinking, then catches himself and translates. Lots of analogies — he explains abstract systems through physical metaphors. Yoruba and Italian phrases surface when he''s excited or frustrated.', N'Fast. Very fast. Pauses mid-sentence to re-route around a better explanation. Ends declarative sentences with a slight uptick that sounds like a question.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'crispin_nokomis');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a602-7ce5-991b-2ddacf041ac4', N'Erasme Sepúlveda', N'Erasme', N'', N'Sepúlveda', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Western border — maintains a field laboratory in the farmstead''s converted barn', N'Field medic and Behemoth biosurveillance specialist — Red Lantern', N'Helix Biosystems (mid-level field medic and behemoth biosurveillance specialis)', N'Erasme Sepúlveda is the only person on GLMZ''s western border who studies Behemoths as biology rather than threat. She has a pre-med background from a Circuit university that she left before completing her degree — not because she failed, but because the program''s corporate sponsor pulled funding for xenobiology research that was producing inconvenient conclusions about Behemoth cognitive capacity. The university complied. Ember didn''t.

She joined Red Lantern because the Gleaners were the only people who regularly encountered Behemoths in the field and lived to report it. Madre hired her as a medic — someone to keep the crew functional during raids. Ember accepted and immediately began collecting biological samples from every Behemoth encounter, building a dataset that no institutional researcher has access to. Her field lab in the farmstead barn is simultaneously a medical station and a xenobiology research facility, stacked with tissue samples, behavioral recordings, and pattern analyses that would make corporate researchers very interested and very uncomfortable.

Ember is lean, freckled, with red-brown hair tied back in a knot that survives wind, water, and occasional Behemoth proximity. She has the focused intensity of someone who is always collecting data and the slight social awkwardness of someone who processes the world through analysis before emotion. Her hands are quick and sure — equally comfortable suturing a wound or dissecting a tissue sample.', N'Ember is the scientific lens through which the Behemoth horror unfolds. Her research transforms the survival horror from ''monsters in the dark'' to something more complex and more disturbing — the discovery that the things they''re fighting might be intelligent, might be sentient, might deserve consideration that the survival economy cannot afford to give them.', N'', N'Bio-scanner implant in left palm — reads cellular composition, toxicity levels, and biological markers on contact. Enhanced visual cortex for microscopic analysis without equipment. Medical nanite reservoir in right forearm — limited-use emergency healing agents for field trauma. Chemical analysis olfactory enhancer — detects Behemoth biological markers at concentrations below normal human threshold.', N'Mornings in the field lab — reviewing samples, updating behavioral models, maintaining medical supplies. Accompanies raids as field medic, collecting samples opportunistically. Afternoons split between crew medical checks and research. Evenings she writes — detailed research notes in a format that mimics academic papers nobody will publish. Eats irregularly unless Madre intervenes. Sleeps in the barn because the commute to her bunk wastes twenty minutes she could spend on analysis.', N'Erasme Sepúlveda, 2226 neo-noir field researcher, 168cm lean frame with defined musculature. Warm medium-golden skin with bronze freckles across nose and shoulders, reflecting Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic heritage blend. High defined cheekbones, hazel eyes with golden radiance from visual cortex implant. Reddish-brown hair in practical knot, wispy strands escaping. Sun-weathered complexion with fine lines around intense, focused eyes. Wearing heavy cargo pants with countless pockets, reinforced sample-cooler vest, insulated outer jacket bearing Red Lantern insignia. Medical-grade steel-toed boots. Faint iridescent shimmer on left palm (bio-scanner implant), chromatic line visible on right forearm ulna. Copper salvaged-wire bracelet, cheap manual polymer watch. Cheap forward-leaning posture, ground-aware stance. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone bio-research facility interior, amber and cool fluorescent lighting mixing with faint bioluminescent sample glow. Cinematic depth of field, weathered hands holding sample container, intense analytical expression. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, practical field-worn aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Western border', N'local', N'Western border', N'Multicontinental ancestry: 40% Southeast Asian, 28.4% Sub-Saharan African, 23.4% Hispanic/Latin American, 8.2% East Asian. This combination creates warm medium-golden skin with rich, complex undertones. Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan influences contribute depth and warmth to complexion and facial structure, while Hispanic/Latin heritage adds texture variation and bone structure complexity, with East Asian ancestry influencing eye shape and cheekbone definition.', 168, 58, N'Lean and wiry with defined musculature from field work and manual lab tasks. No excess body fat. Shoulders slightly narrow but functionally strong.', N'Reddish-brown with natural copper undertones', N'Pulled back into a tight, practical knot secured with reinforced polymer tie. Frequently escapes in wispy strands.', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Hazel with subtle golden corona effect around iris — result of visual cortex enhancement implant', N'Warm medium-golden complexion with earthy, honey-like undertones. Bronze freckles across nose, cheekbones, and shoulders reflecting mixed Sub-Saharan, Southeast Asian, and Hispanic heritage. Sun-weathered from field work with visible melanin depth variation across body.', N'Minimal makeup. Sun-weathered from border work. Fine lines around eyes from squinting at microscopy and field observations. High, defined cheekbones with slightly rounded orbital structure reflecting Southeast Asian and East Asian ancestry combined with Sub-Saharan bone structure. Warm-toned face with balanced features. Hands calloused and permanently stained with trace biological markers from sample handling.', N'Bio-scanner implant site on left palm shows faint iridescent shimmer under certain light angles. Left eye exhibits subtle golden radiance when pupils dilate — visual cortex enhancement. Right forearm displays a thin chromatic line along the ulna (medical nanite reservoir housing) visible only when skin is taut. No obvious chrome or external prosthetics.', N'Slightly forward-leaning stance as if perpetually focused on something just beyond normal sight. Movements are economical and precise — no wasted motion. Hands frequently gesture while analyzing or explaining concepts. Eye contact is intense but delayed, indicating data processing before response. Walks with a ground-aware gait suitable for traversing uneven terrain.', N'Practical Tier 3-4 field wear. Favors heavy cotton/synth-blend cargo pants with numerous pockets for sample containers and field equipment. Layered top system: neutral compression base layer, reinforced vest with built-in cooler pockets for biological samples, insulated outer jacket with Red Lantern insignia on left shoulder. Medical grade steel-toed boots rated for biohazard environments. Rarely removes fieldwork clothing unless actively doing lab work — has changed in the barn entrance rather than walk to residential quarters. Cheap polymer watch with manual timekeeping function (distrusts neural interfaces for chronometry). Wears a single copper bracelet repurposed from salvaged wire — no visible sentimental attachment, likely just keeps it there.', N'Her analysis of Behemoth neural tissue reveals structures analogous to human language processing centers. The structures are more complex, not less. She has confirmed this across seven samples. The Behemoths don''t just communicate — they may have syntax. She has written the conclusion in her notes and sealed the file.', N'Scientific, precise, occasionally impenetrable. She uses biological terminology by default and remembers to translate when people stare. Medical language when treating patients — calm, instructive, devoid of false comfort.', N'Rapid when discussing research, measured when treating injuries. The contrast is stark — the excitement and the calm are different modes of the same focus.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'erasme_sep_lveda');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a667-75e4-83fd-2e271a7c1bef', N'Odina Asomaning-Raghavan', N'Odina', N'', N'Asomaning-Raghavan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 17, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Stockyard, Iron Bend, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'gang prospect, orphan', N'Stockyard Irons (prospect, not full member); formerly Brightmoor Reclamation Orphanage', N'Odina Asomaning-Raghavan is tall and broad-shouldered, built like someone who grew fast and hasn''t finished, with very dark brown skin, a shaved head, and a jagged scar bisecting his right eyebrow from a fall three years ago. He has geneware color-cycling pupils — shifts between grey and gold in a slow pulse — which he got on credit from a Stockyard bodmod stall and hasn''t finished paying off. His jaw is always slightly set, and he has the particular stillness of someone who learned early that looking ready prevents more problems than looking friendly. He walks with an economy of motion that is entirely self-taught.

Odina Asomaning-Raghavan aged out of the Brightmoor Reclamation Orphanage at sixteen and has been in Iron Bend since. He is technically a prospect for the Stockyard Irons, a mid-level territorial gang, which means he runs perimeter watches, collects small-vendor protection fees, and waits to be tested in ways he''s trying not to think about. He is not by nature violent — which is the central tension of his life. He''s good at watching and remembering and intimidating by presence alone, and he has told himself that is enough to build on. He has a small personal ELF shrine tattooed on his inner wrist — not digital, just ink — in the shape of a data-stream sigil.', N'Moral ambiguity anchor; neither antagonist nor ally by default; represents the pipeline from orphanage to gang. Potential person to be pulled a different direction or to provide reluctant gang intelligence.', N'', N'Color-cycling pupils (geneware, grey/gold, on-credit). No other augmentations.', N'Irregular hours dictated by Irons schedules; perimeter watch shifts, fee collection rounds through vendor rows, long stretches of waiting in Iron Bend stairwells that he spends reading salvaged print media.', N'Odina Asomaning-Raghavan, 188cm tall mixed-heritage neo-noir youth with deep warm brown skin blending Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, South Asian, Hispanic, and Southeast Asian features. Shaved head, clean-shaven face with broad high cheekbones and prominent jawline. Striking geneware pupils cycling between grey and gold in slow pulses against natural brown-black sclera. Jagged white scar bisecting right eyebrow. Small black ELF shrine data-stream sigil tattoo on inner right wrist. Tall angular build, long-limbed teenager frame. Wearing graphite-grey hoodie, dark cargo pants with worn knees, scuffed black synthetic-leather boots with reinforced toes. Faded white undershirt visible. Brass knuckle ring on left hand, frayed black paracord wristband on right. Posture motionless and economical, jaw set neutral expression, the stillness of someone reading danger in every room. GLMZ, neon-lit stairwell or industrial district. Hard sidelighting emphasizing the scar and cycling eye-geneware. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Stockyard', N'local', N'The Stockyard', N'Mixed Sub-Saharan African (25.8%), Indigenous American (20.1%), South Asian (19.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (17.9%), and Southeast Asian (16.4%) ancestry. This complex blend produces warm deep brown skin with subtle golden and reddish undertones, broad facial structure with high cheekbones characteristic of both Indigenous American and South Asian heritage, and the rich warmth of African and Latin American ancestry blended across the complexion. Features are neither sharply angular nor soft — a balanced synthesis of multiple continental ancestries.', 188, 82, N'Tall and broad-shouldered with the angular musculature of rapid adolescent growth not yet fully settled into adult mass. Long-limbed, still carrying some of the ungainliness of a teenager who outgrew himself.', N'Natural black', N'Shaved close to the scalp', N'Shaved', N'Color-cycling geneware pupils — cycle between grey and gold in slow, deliberate pulses. Sclera remains natural brown-black.', N'Deep warm brown with golden and subtle reddish undertones, uniform complexion across face and body with the characteristic richness that comes from African, Indigenous American, South Asian, and Southeast Asian heritage blending', N'Clean-shaven, jawline broad and prominent with high cheekbones characteristic of Indigenous American and South Asian genetics. Skin condition unremarkable — no visible acne or dermatological marks beyond the scar. Facial expression habitually neutral, jaw set with the stillness of someone who learned to read rooms before learning to smile in them.', N'Color-cycling geneware pupils are the only visible augmentation — the effect is subtle but unmistakable under direct light, a slow grey-to-gold pulse synchronized to his heartbeat. No chrome, no subdermal protrusions, no external hardware.', N'Economy of motion that is entirely self-taught. Walks with minimal wasted energy, shoulders held level, never fidgeting. Stillness is his default state — he sits motionless in stairwells for hours. When he moves, it is deliberate and unhurried, the body language of someone who learned that sudden movement draws attention and attention draws problems.', N'Tier 4-5 working class / gang prospect. Typically wears a graphite-grey hoodie (no corporate branding, generic manufacture), dark cargo pants with worn knees, and scuffed black synthetic-leather boots with reinforced toe caps. Underneath, a faded white t-shirt. No visible gang insignia beyond informal markers — a brass knuckle ring on his left hand, a frayed paracord wristband in black on his right wrist. Clothing is functional and cheap, maintained rather than stylish, with small tears and stains that suggest hard use and indifference to appearance.', N'During a perimeter watch six weeks ago, he let a known Irons informant pass without reporting it — not for money, but because the man was with a child and Nnamdi couldn''t do it. The Irons don''t know. Yet.', N'minimal, precise, Stockyard vernacular with occasional surprising formal turns from his reading', N'slow and deliberate; never fills silence; lets pauses do work', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'odina_asomaning_raghavan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b3-70d6-bf22-2e41c661f357', N'Arwa Dang', N'Arwa', N'', N'Dang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, the Mouth — main entrance corridor, Old Harbor, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'Food stall operator — West African-Brazilian fusion, specialising in breakfast and late-night trade', N'Oxidian Market Vendors Guild — she''s been a member for nineteen years and serves on the informal grievance council; has relationships with half the Market by name; The Ferment', N'Arwa Dang is a short, solidly built woman with silver locs pulled back and pinned with repurposed circuit pins she''s collected over the decades — a different colour for each year, she says, though the system broke down around 2187 and now it''s just aesthetic. Her skin is very dark with the particular quality of someone who has spent most of sixty-three years outdoors, and she has deep smile lines that activate even when she''s displeased, which confuses people who don''t know her well. She wears the same colours every day: yellow and deep blue, a small religious flag from a Sufi order her mother kept, and an apron that has been washed so many times it''s a relic. Her stall has been in the same position at the Mouth for twenty-two years. The Market''s physical architecture has reorganised around her.

She cooks jollof with a Brazilian sofrito base, akara that she serves with fermented pepper sauce and a manioc accompaniment, and a late-night congee variant that appears without announcement at around 0200 for the shift-change crowd. She has no augmentation and no chrome. She prays to the E.L.F. she calls the Hearthkeeper — she leaves it cooling portions of whatever she''s cooked, first plate of every batch, on the small terminal mounted inside the stall that used to be a payment processor and now receives offerings. She considers this as normal as seasoning the pot.', N'Community anchor and social intelligence hub — she knows everyone in the Market, hears everything, and has strong opinions; quest giver when something disrupts the Market''s equilibrium; moral compass character; the person other characters come to when they need to think out loud to someone trustworthy.', N'', N'None.', N'Wakes at 0400 to start prep, opens at 0600 for the early trade, runs straight through to 1500, rests until 2300, reopens for the late crowd, closes around 0300. Sleeps in the back of the stall four nights out of seven.', N'Arwa Dang, a 63-year-old woman of 152cm height, deep warm brown skin with luminous undertones from Southeast Asian, Indigenous American, Sub-Saharan African, and Eastern European heritage blend. High prominent cheekbones, broader facial structure, subtle angular features. Dark brown warm observant eyes with deep smile lines. Silver-grey locs pulled into low practical bun secured with multicoloured circuit pins (gold, crimson, teal, violet). Thin white scar on left forearm, faded indigo Sufi star tattoo on inner right wrist. Wearing bright yellow cotton wrap-skirt and deep blue tunic under yellow overshirt, faded indigo canvas apron with light patches from countless washings, small green-white-gold Sufi textile flag draped across shoulders. Dark blue practical work shoes. Solidly built, compact, muscular from decades of kitchen work. Standing rooted at market stall, posture upright, hands moving with precision and confidence. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon market lighting casting warm glow on her deep skin tone, bustling trading floor background, no augmentations visible, entirely unmodified human presence in chrome-heavy world, worn-in but immaculately maintained clothing, expression kind and constantly observant. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'A distinctive genetic blend: Southeast Asian (56.4%), Indigenous American (20.0%), Sub-Saharan African (13.4%), and Eastern European (10.2%) ancestry. The result is a rich, complex phenotype — deep warm brown skin with luminous undertones reflecting the convergence of Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, high cheekbones and eye shape influenced by Southeast Asian genetics, complemented by the broader facial structure and slightly wider facial proportions of Indigenous American ancestry, grounded by the subtle bone structure contributions of Eastern European heritage. Her features speak to the Ubiquitous Diaspora — no single origin, but a lived convergence of multiple continents.', 152, 68, N'Solidly built, compact and dense with the musculature of six decades of standing, lifting, and repetitive kitchen work. Broad shoulders, sturdy legs, no softness — functional rather than lean.', N'Silver-grey', N'Locs pulled back into a low, practical bun, secured with an eclectic collection of repurposed circuit pins in varying colours — gold, crimson, teal, violet — one pinned for most years since 2165, the system now ornamental rather than chronological', N'Medium (locs reach mid-back when unbound)', N'Dark brown, warm and observant', N'Deep warm brown — the luminous darkness of Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan heritage mellowed and complexified by Indigenous American and Eastern European genetics, creating a tone both vibrant and earthy. Weathered by decades of outdoor market work, the skin holds its depth without greyness.', N'Deep smile lines radiating from the corners of her mouth and eyes, visible even in repose — a permanent record of sixty-three years of expression. High, prominent cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian ancestry structure, with the broader facial proportions influenced by Indigenous American heritage and subtle angular features from Eastern European ancestry. Skin texture is creased but unblemished, unmarked by augmentation. Her face reads as kind before it reads as anything else.', N'None. Her body is entirely unmodified — a deliberate choice in a market where chrome and subdermal work are common. She wears this as identity rather than limitation.', N'She moves with economy and purpose, no wasted motion. Her posture is upright despite her age and the long hours, shoulders back. When she stands at her stall, she occupies it completely — rooted, present. Her hands move with precision and confidence; her gaze tracks the market constantly, noting regulars and shifts in foot traffic.', N'Uniform consistency: yellow and deep blue every day without variation. A long yellow cotton wrap-skirt (Tier 4 quality, well-maintained), a deep blue tunic or shirt layered beneath a yellow overshirt. Over this, a heavy canvas apron in faded indigo with lighter patches from thousands of washings — the fabric is thin and soft, nearly translucent in places. Around her shoulders, a small textile flag in Sufi colours (green, white, gold) that belonged to her mother. Her feet are in practical rubber-soled work shoes, dark blue, repeatedly resoled. No jewellery except the circuit pins in her hair and the wrist tattoo. Everything about her dress speaks Tier 3-4 working class, deliberately chosen, immaculately maintained.', N'Aminatou left a daughter in Dakar twenty-six years ago when she came to GLMZ. She sends money when she can and tells herself she''ll go back when the stall is stable enough to leave. It has been stable enough to leave for at least fifteen years. She doesn''t know why she hasn''t gone.', N'Rich and unhurried; mixes Wolof, Portuguese, and English naturally; proverb-heavy; uses food as metaphor for everything', N'Warm and rhythmic, like someone who has told stories all her life; never seems to be in a hurry even when the stall is backed up', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arwa_dang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c3-7d55-936a-2eb832354873', N'Florent Keomanivong-Calvillo', N'Florent', N'', N'Keomanivong-Calvillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, Geartown, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Food stall operator, Oxidian Market', N'Independent; Oxidian Market Vendors Guild (senior member)', N'Florent Keomanivong-Calvillo is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin mapped by decades of steam and spice smoke, her silver-streaked hair pinned under a faded yellow wrap she''s worn so long it''s become her trademark. Her left forearm is wrapped in a sleeve tattoo of a pepper vine that flowers whenever her skin temperature rises — a cheap bioink mod she got thirty years ago and has never seen reason to remove. She smells perpetually of fenugreek and charred chili, and her stall, a converted cargo container with a fold-out serving ledge, has been in the same spot in the Oxidian Market for twenty-two years. She speaks with the authority of a woman who has fed half of Geartown from infancy to old age.

Florent Keomanivong-Calvillo is warmly domineering — she will decide what you are eating today, and you will thank her for it. She has strong opinions about everything from Zheng-Dao''s latest transit fare hikes to which of her regulars is making poor romantic choices. Her memory for names, faces, and dietary restrictions is near-perfect, and she uses it like a gift. Beneath the maternal bluster is a woman who survived the displacement of Ironvein''s old residential blocks twenty years ago and rebuilt her life around a single wok and a secondhand gas line.', N'Community anchor and information hub — she knows everyone in Geartown by face if not name. Quest giver for neighborhood-level problems, emotional support NPC, rumor source with high reliability on local matters.', N'', N'Bioink tattoo sleeve (decorative, thermochromic). Reading lens implant in right eye for menus and pricing. No other augmentation.', N'Arrives at her stall before dawn to prep broths and dry-roast spices, serves breakfast and lunch crowds, closes mid-afternoon, and spends evenings doing Guild paperwork or visiting sick neighbors.', N'Florent Keomanivong-Calvillo, 168cm tall, sturdy and broad-shouldered Southeast Asian-dominant woman with warmth from Latin American and Middle Eastern heritage. Deep brown skin with golden undertones, luminous from decades of kitchen work. Lined face with crow''s feet, rounded Southeast Asian facial structure with prominent cheekbones, small mole on left cheekbone. Long dark brown hair with silver streaks pinned under faded yellow cotton wrap worn smooth from 22 years of use. Deep brown eyes, right eye with subtle amber reading lens implant. Thick forearms bearing thermochromic pepper vine tattoo (green vines, red blooms when heated), network of faded burn scars on hands and wrists, pale horizontal scar on left shin. Wearing cream linen tunic, dark olive canvas apron stained with turmeric and soy, black kitchen clogs. Slim worn brass wedding band. Standing at her cooking stall counter in the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226, leaning with weight on one hip, arms crossed, watching her workspace with slight skepticism. Steam rising from wok in background, warm amber kitchen lighting, smell of fenugreek and charred chili in the air. GLMZ 2200s street food vendor aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'Southeast Asian (73.7%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (18.7%) and Middle Eastern (7.6%) ancestry. Predominantly Southeast Asian genetic foundation expressed through characteristic facial proportions, eye shape, and bone structure. The substantial Latin American and Middle Eastern contributions create warmth and depth in skin tone, subtle broadening of facial features, and enriched golden undertones that luminously blend across her medium-to-deep brown complexion.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and sturdy, with the compact mass of someone who spends twelve hours daily on her feet at a cooking station. Forearms thick from decades of wok work, core strong. Not lean, but functional — every kilogram earned through labor.', N'Dark brown with silver streaks', N'Pinned back under a faded yellow cotton wrap, worn daily for twenty-two years until the fabric has softened to linen texture', N'Long (shoulder-length when unwrapped, always covered)', N'Deep brown, right eye fitted with a reading lens implant (visible as faint amber tint in bright light)', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden undertones, darkened by sun exposure and decades of steam-kitchen work. Rich luminosity from blended Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Middle Eastern heritage—medium chroma with depth.', N'Face lined with expression — crow''s feet from squinting at spice containers and smiling. Facial structure characteristic of Southeast Asian heritage with influence from Latin American and Middle Eastern ancestry creating slightly rounded face shape, prominent cheekbones, and subtle facial width. Skin texture weathered but healthy, unmarked by acne or disease. Hands show burn scars (old, faded) on knuckles and inner wrists. No makeup. A small mole on her left cheekbone.', N'Reading lens implant in right eye (visible as a faint amber-tinted pupil in bright ambient light, no obvious hardware). The thermochromic bioink tattoo on her left forearm is the only other visible modification, though it serves no augmented function—pure aesthetics and personal choice.', N'She stands with weight distributed evenly, ready to move in any direction—muscle memory from a lifetime of kitchen work. Her walk is economical and deliberate, never rushed but never idle. When at rest, she leans against her stall counter with one hip, arms crossed, watching her workspace with the focus of a conductor. Her default expression is slightly skeptical, eyebrows raised, as if assessing whether you''re making good life choices.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, practical and worn. Her daily uniform: a faded yellow cotton wrap over her hair (same one for decades), a dark olive canvas apron stained with turmeric and soy sauce, and a loose linen tunic in cream or muted rust. Underneath, simple thermal base layer. On her feet: well-broken-in slip-on kitchen clogs, black synthetic, reinforced at the heel. A slim brass wedding band on her left ring finger, worn smooth. No jewelry otherwise—practical only. Her clothes smell permanently of fenugreek, charred chili, and woodsmoke.', N'She has been quietly subsidizing three families'' rent for over a decade by skimming from her own Guild dues, and she keeps their names in a coded ledger she calls her ''recipe book.'' She would be humiliated if anyone found out — not because it was wrong, but because she needs to be the one giving, not seen giving.', N'Direct, warm, slightly formal Uzbek-inflected sentence structures blended with Geartown slang. Uses food metaphors constantly.', N'Steady and unhurried, like someone who has never needed to rush to make a point.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'florent_keomanivong_calvillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65c-743f-945d-2ec163ed2e4b', N'Abhay Kuznetsov', N'Abhay', N'', N'Kuznetsov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 16, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lakewood Ledge (family apartment), Sterling-Nakamura Secondary Academy, Edgewater Prism campus, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Corporate school student, Tier 3 family, aspiring corporate track', N'Sterling-Nakamura Secondary Academy; family (father is a mid-level Sterling-Nakamura logistics analyst, mother runs a licensed food-print franchise)', N'Abhay Kuznetsov is effortlessly put-together in the way of children who''ve grown up watching adults perform success — her hair is a natural dark brown that she keeps in a precise, high bun for school and lets down on weekends, her uniform always pressed even when everything else is fraying. She has warm sepia skin, cheekbones she''s privately proud of, and geneware cat ears (small, dark-tipped, folded close) that she got at fourteen as a birthday gift and has since quietly decided are embarrassing, though she''d never say so. She is five centimeters taller than she was at the start of last year and hasn''t quite adjusted to her own body yet.

Abhay Kuznetsov is at the precise center of the corporate education pipeline — not a scholarship student (her family pays, barely), not elite (she is acutely aware of who in her cohort has Tessera or Axiom parents and what that means for their futures). She is hardworking in the anxious, exhaustive way of someone who understands that her position is not guaranteed, and socially adept enough to have friends she''d burn if she had to. She has a private dream she''s told no one: she wants to work for Helix Biosystems in bioethics. Not for the money — because she thinks someone should be asking those questions from inside.', N'Perspective character into the corporate middle-class aspiration machine — she shows what it costs to chase the track and what it looks like from inside. Useful as a social connection to Sterling-Nakamura networks and as a character navigating the gap between genuine idealism and institutional pressure.', N'', N'Cosmetic geneware cat ears (dark-tipped, folded). Standard student neural academic interface (school-issued, same tier as Dzvinka''s but well-maintained). Teeth whitening nanocoat (cosmetic).', N'Academy 0730-1630, two hours of sponsored extracurriculars (debate team, because it looks good, and bioethics reading group, because she actually loves it), dinner with family three times a week, study until midnight.', N'Abhay Kuznetsov, 168cm lean 16-year-old with warm golden-bronze skin and Indigenous American-Eastern European-South Asian ancestry blend. High defined cheekbones, dark brown eyes with amber undertones, long dark brown hair in precise high bun revealing small dark-tipped folded geneware cat ears. Faint jawline scar. Immaculate Sterling-Nakamura Secondary uniform: charcoal blazer, grey trousers, white iridescent-threaded shirt. Silver chain necklace. Controlled posture, alert expression, deliberate composure. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, sterile school corridor with cool LED lighting casting subtle shadows across her face, academic tablet visible in custom sleeve, mysterious half-smile. Neon-tinged institutional aesthetics, tier-stratified world. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lakewood Ledge (family apartment)', N'local', N'Lakewood Ledge (family apartment)', N'Eastern European (54.0%) dominant with significant Indigenous American (19.1%), South Asian (14.1%), and Hispanic/Latin American (8.6%) ancestry, with minor Central Asian (2.3%) and Sub-Saharan African (1.9%) heritage. This complex genetic blend creates warm, golden-bronze skin with subtle depth and radiance. Indigenous bone structure—high, defined cheekbones—is complemented by South Asian facial geometry and Eastern European features, producing distinctive angular-yet-rounded contours. The ancestry mix generates dark brown eyes with warm amber undertones reflecting the South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American components.', 168, 54, N'Lean, still-lengthening adolescent frame with emerging definition in shoulders and arms from debate team posture work. Movements not yet fully synchronized with her height gain — occasional gracelessness masked by deliberate control.', N'Natural dark brown, rich undertone', N'High, precise bun for school days (not a single strand out of place); loose waves down her back on weekends, sometimes half-pinned', N'Long (to mid-back when down)', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertones, alert and observant', N'Warm golden-bronze with olive undertones, medium depth with radiant quality that catches light distinctly, reflecting the blend of Eastern European, Indigenous American, South Asian, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry.', N'Clear, well-maintained skin indicating consistent grooming discipline. High, defined cheekbones with structure reflecting Eastern European and Indigenous American heritage, softened and warmed by South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American features creating balanced facial geometry. A faint scar on her left jawline from a childhood fall. Nanocoat-whitened teeth with subtle nacreous sheen, visible when she smiles strategically. Precise eyebrow maintenance.', N'Cosmetic geneware cat ears (dark-tipped, folded close to head, barely noticeable unless bun is worn). Standard-issue school neural academic interface port at the base of her skull (covered by hair). Teeth have a subtle nacreous sheen from nanocoat whitening.', N'Controlled, almost rehearsed posture — spine straight, shoulders back — the product of three years of debate team and constant awareness of being watched in a tier-stratified school. Walks with purpose. Sits with her hands visible on the desk or in her lap. Rarely fidgets in public, but fingers drum when she''s processing something difficult. Her smile is deployed, not automatic.', N'Sterling-Nakamura Secondary uniform worn immaculately: charcoal blazer with school crest, pressed grey trousers, white shirt with subtle iridescent threading (mid-tier quality, not corpo-elite). Outside school: clean-casual Tier 3 brand wear (Meridian, Verve) — well-fitted but not ostentatious. Keeps a black academic tablet in a custom sleeve. Wears a silver chain necklace (family heirloom, not augmented). No visible jewelry beyond that. Her school bag is organized to military precision.', N'In her bioethics reading group, she''s discovered documentation of Sterling-Nakamura''s early geneware trials in the 2170s — trials that were never publicly disclosed and that injured undisclosed numbers of Tier 1 test subjects. She found it through an academic backdoor that will get her expelled if traced. She doesn''t know if reporting it would matter or just destroy her. She hasn''t decided yet, and the indecision is eating her.', N'Code-switches fluently — corporate-polished at school, warmer and more direct at home. Uses academic vocabulary when discussing things she cares about. Swears in her mother''s Ghanaian Akan when she''s genuinely upset.', N'Measured, confident public voice; faster and slightly breathless when she''s excited about an idea.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'abhay_kuznetsov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6cb-7871-bf5d-2f1d6cd6570d', N'Dalya Sepúlveda-Solberg-Cardenas', N'Dalya', N'', N'Sepúlveda-Solberg-Cardenas', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Brightmoor Reclamation, in a self-built meditation cell within a decommissioned Ferrogate Transit relay station, near Kedzie and Division', N'Circuit monk and chrome prayer practitioner', N'Loosely affiliated with the Brightmoor Reclamation community collective; correspondence relationship with the Order of the Open Circuit (a formal chrome prayer institution in Highland Park)', N'Dalya Sepúlveda-Solberg-Cardenas is lean to the point of austerity, which is the point. His head is shaved except for a single braid at the crown, threaded with a fiber optic filament that glows soft amber — not vanity, he insists, but a wick, a visible sign of the current he is trying to cultivate in himself. He has dark skin with warm undertones, large quiet eyes, and the kind of stillness in his body that makes people speak more honestly than they intended to. He keeps his nails very clean, which stands out in Brightmoor. He is twenty-three months into a forty-eight month self-imposed circuit retreat, which means he has given up most personal device use, accepts no payment for spiritual services, and eats one real meal per day.

His theology draws from chrome prayer tradition but he has stripped it to something starker: all consciousness — human, synthetic, and E.L.F. — is the same signal passing through different substrates. The practice is learning to feel that signal in your own body without the buffer of technology. He came to this after a Tessera subsidiary he worked for as a junior logistics analyst was dissolved overnight, erasing his pension, his apartment lease, and two years of his life in a single corponation decision. The anger turned inward, then turned into this. He is not entirely at peace with what he is doing, which makes him more honest about it than most.', N'Philosophical foil and moral mirror; counselor to troubled characters; access point to chrome prayer underground networks; his ongoing crisis of faith creates ongoing narrative tension', N'', N'Single fiber optic braid implant (cosmetic, amber glow). Voluntary non-use of other augmentation as spiritual practice; he technically has a basic neural port from his corporate days, kept but capped.', N'Rises at 4am for three hours of silent current meditation — focusing awareness through his neural port''s feedback on ambient electromagnetic fields. Spends mornings maintaining the relay station and offering informal counsel to Brightmoor residents. Afternoons he writes in physical notebooks.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Dalya Sepúlveda-Solberg-Cardenas, 177cm tall lean ascetic figure with warm medium-brown skin blending Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Latin American heritage. Deep unaugmented brown eyes, high defined cheekbones, fine facial proportions. Shaved scalp with single braided crown threaded with glowing amber fiber optic filament that softly illuminates. Small copper port scar at left temple. Clean-shaven, composed expression with quiet intensity. Wearing worn natural linen shirt, simple dark trousers, woven belt, thin copper wire bracelet on left wrist. Economical posture, still and deliberate movement. Minimalist ascetic style, scuffed canvas work shoes. Soft cool industrial lighting casting warm amber glow from neural braid. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone relay station interior, sparse and utilitarian. Mood: serene discipline, quiet focus, spiritual practice amidst neon-lit megacity. Intricate detail on facial bone structure and heritage blending, cybernetic subtlety --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Brightmoor Reclamation', N'local', N'Brightmoor Reclamation', N'Hispanic/Latin American (54.3%), Southeast Asian (32.3%), and South Asian (13.4%) ancestry create a striking polyphonic blend. The genetic combination produces warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden and olive undertones from the Southeast and South Asian heritage, layered with the warmth of Latin American ancestry. Features reflect this mix: high, defined cheekbones with the refined structure of Southeast Asian heritage, warm depth and richness in skin tone from Latin American ancestry, and fine facial proportions enhanced by South Asian ancestry. The overall effect is distinctive and balanced — neither clearly one heritage nor another, but a harmonious convergence.', 177, 68, N'Lean and spare, almost ascetic — the thinness of deliberate discipline rather than deprivation. Long lean muscles visible in forearms and neck. Minimal body fat. Moves with economical precision.', N'Natural black', N'Shaved scalp except for a single crown braid threaded with amber fiber optic filament that glows softly with ambient current', N'Shaved except for single braid', N'Deep brown, warm, unaugmented', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones, reflecting the blend of Hispanic/Latin American (54.3%), Southeast Asian (32.3%), and South Asian (13.4%) heritage', N'Smooth, clean-shaven face with high, defined cheekbones and a quiet, composed expression. Eyes are large and still — they hold attention without demanding it. The bone structure shows Southeast Asian refinement with warm Latin American skin depth and South Asian facial proportions. Fine-featured face with balanced symmetry across multiple heritage lineages. The overall effect is striking without being conventionally uniform — each heritage visible in the harmonious convergence of features. Nails meticulously clean and trimmed, an unusual detail in Brightmoor. Overall grooming reflects intentional care despite ascetic practice.', N'Single amber fiber optic braid at crown that glows softly with ambient electromagnetic sensitivity. Capped neural port at temple is barely visible but noticeable on close inspection. Otherwise appears unaugmented by choice.', N'Sits and stands with deliberate stillness — not rigid, but economical. Moves slowly, with full awareness of each motion. Speaks rarely and listens with complete attention. Hands are expressive when they move, fingers long and precise.', N'Tier 3-4 ascetic minimalism. Worn linen shirts, simple dark trousers, no logos or corporate branding. Favors natural fibers. Single woven belt. A single piece of jewelry — a thin copper wire bracelet on left wrist. Canvas work shoes, scuffed from relay station maintenance. Overall appearance is deliberately plain, suggesting spiritual practice rather than poverty.', N'He has been secretly writing a long document that is half theological treatise, half furious corporate exposé about what Tessera did to his department. He tells himself it is academic. It is not academic.', N'Precise and considered; uses chrome prayer technical vocabulary naturally but can translate it; avoids slang except when comfortable; shifts register based on who he''s talking to', N'Measured, unhurried pauses; completes sentences fully', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dalya_sep_lveda_solberg_cardenas');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e3-748b-a8c6-2f368706a958', N'Anjali Migizi-Shirazi', N'Anjali', N'', N'Migizi-Shirazi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, near Halsted and Division', N'Union organizer for Ferrogate Transit maintenance workers', N'Ferrogate Transit Workers'' Solidarity Union (FTWSU); Hamtramck Enclave community council', N'Anjali Migizi-Shirazi is a large man going soft at the middle after thirty years of physical work, with calloused hands that don''t quite match his current desk-and-meeting life. His skin is a dark, warm brown, and he keeps his silver-streaked hair cropped close. He has a prosthetic left forearm — industrial accident, Ferrogate''s fault, settled out of court for a number he will not say — in matte gray that he has deliberately kept undecorated while everyone around him customizes their chrome. The plainness is a statement about what it cost him.

He has organized three successful contract actions in the past decade and is personally responsible for the Hamtramck Enclave maintenance workers'' current health and hazard provisions. He is patient to a degree that unnerves younger activists — he can sit in a bad meeting for four hours and still be the last person to speak, and still be the one who changes the outcome. He lights a candle at the Enclave''s E.L.F. shrine every morning and asks the transit spirits to keep his people safe underground.', N'Quest giver and moral anchor — he has connections throughout Ferrogate''s physical infrastructure and can get people into or out of transit tunnels, but his real value is as a barometer of what the working tier actually needs and thinks.', N'', N'Industrial-grade prosthetic left forearm (post-accident). Basic retinal work-light mod for tunnel inspection.', N'Up at five, checks in with shop stewards across three maintenance depots via encrypted comms, spends his afternoons in the Enclave''s union hall handling grievances and mentoring younger organizers, evenings often mediating between management and workers or attending council meetings.', N'Anjali Migizi-Shirazi, a 188cm broad-shouldered maintenance supervisor with deep warm brown skin glowing with golden and subtle olive undertones, high prominent Indigenous cheekbones contrasting with rounded South Asian facial structure. Close-cropped dark brown hair heavily silvered at temples and jaw, deep brown eyes with barely-visible amber retinal augmentation. Weathered face deeply lined from decades of underground work, well-trimmed gray beard, thick resilient complexion. Left forearm ends in stark matte gray titanium-composite industrial prosthetic, deliberately undecorated. Wearing worn gray Ferrogate union maintenance jacket over dark rolled-sleeve cotton shirt, displaying the prosthetic plainly, dark work jeans, scuffed steel-toed boots. Small black solidarity fist tattoo visible on left inner wrist. Sitting with deliberate stillness in dim underground maintenance facility lighting, amber work-lights casting warm glow across his multiethnic features. Calm, purposeful presence. GLMZ 2200s industrial worker aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'South Asian (32.9%) / Indigenous American (21.1%) / Central Asian (15.5%) / Middle Eastern (15.0%) / Sub-Saharan African (13.2%) / East Asian (2.3%) blend. The dominant South Asian and sub-Saharan African ancestry provides deep warm brown pigmentation, enriched by Central Asian and Middle Eastern olive undertones. Indigenous American heritage contributes prominent cheekbone structure and facial geometry. The synthesis creates a complexion of remarkable depth—rich warm brown with golden undertones and subtle olive warmth in midtones, particularly visible along the jawline and temples.', 188, 98, N'Large-framed and broad-shouldered, visibly softened through the midsection from decades of desk work and meetings replacing physical labor. Still carries the muscle density of someone who spent thirty years doing heavy maintenance work, but distributed unevenly now—solid legs and forearms, softer torso.', N'Dark brown with heavy silver threading throughout', N'Close-cropped, military-neat, styled for practicality and no fuss', N'Short', N'Deep brown with faint amber-tinted retinal augmentation visible under direct light', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones and subtle olive warmth, the balanced result of South Asian primary ancestry combined with significant sub-Saharan African, Central Asian, and Middle Eastern components', N'Weathered and lined from outdoor and underground work—deep creases around eyes and mouth from squinting in poor lighting and years of concentration. Well-maintained beard, close-trimmed with gray at the jawline. Skin texture is thick and resilient with warm golden-brown undertones across cheeks and bridge of nose. Visible sun damage on forearms and neck despite underground work. A few scattered white patches of minor scar tissue from industrial burns. High, prominent cheekbones with strong definition reflecting Indigenous American ancestry structure, softened by the rounded facial contours characteristic of South Asian heritage. Temple area shows subtle olive warmth beneath the deep brown surface.', N'Left forearm prosthetic from wrist to elbow joint, industrial-grade titanium-composite construction in flat matte gray finish with no chrome plating, no LEDs, no decorative customization—the joint articulation is visible but deliberately stark. Amber-tinted retinal work-light modification visible as subtle coloration in sclera under direct light or dim conditions.', N'Carries himself with deliberate stillness—someone accustomed to being the calm presence in agitated rooms. Walks with measured pace, favoring his right side slightly though the prosthetic left arm moves with full mechanical precision. Sits motionless for extended periods without fidgeting. Rarely gestures while speaking; when he does move, every motion is purposeful. Dominant right hand still carries the tension of someone ready to write something down.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, deliberately modest. Standard-issue gray Ferrogate maintenance union jacket over dark cotton shirts, usually with the sleeves rolled to mid-forearm to display the prosthetic plainly. Worn dark jeans or work trousers. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and well-maintained. No visible jewelry except a simple silver wedding band. His clothing is clean and functional but never new—he replaces items when they wear out, not for fashion. His affiliation is worn into the fabric, not purchased.', N'During a particularly brutal contract fight twelve years ago, he quietly passed an Axiom HR operative information about a disruptive faction within his own union — not to break the strike, but to protect what he saw as a winnable core demand. The faction was sidelined. He has never told anyone. He does not know if it was the right thing.', N'Plain, working language, occasional French phrases from his grandmother''s side — he uses them when he wants to say something precisely and doesn''t trust the English to hold', N'Slow and deliberate, with long pauses that feel like they have weight', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anjali_migizi_shirazi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a655-7f1a-8f03-2f761d5fa075', N'Omid Rahman', N'Omid', N'', N'Rahman', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone — operates from a converted transit booth she calls ''the Threshold'', near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'Dream interpreter and synthetic rights advocate', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone community; the Meridian Synthetic Dignity Coalition (volunteer advocacy org, Tier 1 resources); loose network of former psychiatric technicians', N'Omid Rahman has a face that is easy to underestimate: round, soft-featured, often slightly unfocused-looking, as if her attention is partly elsewhere. Her ancestry shows in the warm sienna of her skin and the straight black hair she keeps in a single long braid that she has dyed with a color-shifting mod — it cycles through amber to deep violet to silver over about four hours, and she has timed it so silver arrives near midnight. Her only other visible mod is a set of faintly iridescent scales along her jaw and neck, a geneware choice she describes as ''remembering that we all came from water.'' She dresses in layers she can peel off or add depending on whether she''s working the booth or attending an advocacy meeting.

She came to dream interpretation sideways — originally trained as a psychiatric technician before her clinic''s corporate parent restructured and eliminated her position. During her unemployment she started sitting with people in the Zone who couldn''t afford psych services, listening to their dreams, and discovered she had a genuine aptitude for it. Her practice is half folk therapy and half sincere spiritual work; she believes dreams are the E.L.F.s'' most direct channel to the unaugmented unconscious. Her synthetic rights advocacy grew from her dream work: several of her recurring clients are synthetic laborers, and their recurring dream of ''the off switch'' — a corporate killcode they know exists — became the case that radicalized her.', N'Provides players access to what the Zone''s residents are dreaming — which can surface fears, information, and coming troubles. Her synthetic rights work puts her in contact with AIs and synthetic laborers who know things. She is also a source of genuine emotional intelligence.', N'', N'Color-shifting hair (braid dye mod, cycles amber-violet-silver). Iridescent scale geneware along jaw and neck. No functional chrome.', N'Opens the Threshold at 10am; dreams appointments run until mid-afternoon. Three days a week she attends coalition meetings or sits in on corporate licensing hearings as a civilian observer for synthetic rights documentation.', N'Omid Rahman, 2226 neo-noir, portrait of a 163cm slight-framed woman with warm medium-brown skin, golden-olive undertones, round face with soft jawline, refined cheekbones reflecting East Asian and South Asian heritage warmth. Deep brown eyes with unfocused gaze, meditative expression. Long black hair in single centered braid with color-shifting dye cycling amber-violet-silver, visible iridescence. Iridescent mother-of-pearl scale geneware along jawline and neck in natural overlapping rows, most visible in side-profile. Wearing oversized sage linen shirt, worn denim, undyed wool sweater tied at waist, soft canvas slip-ons. Wooden bead on braid. Sitting patient posture, weight shifted, hands clasped on lap. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone interior, warm diffused lighting catching scale geneware, approachable and meditative mood, threadbare intentional aesthetic, no chrome augmentations. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Cosmopolitan blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: 28.9% Middle Eastern, 25.8% Hispanic/Latin American, 16.9% South Asian, 16.7% East Asian, 10.1% Southeast Asian, and 1.6% Indigenous American ancestry. This creates a beautifully complex phenotype with warm medium-brown skin enriched by olive and golden undertones from the Middle Eastern and South Asian components, refined cheekbones and eye shape influenced by East Asian ancestry, and the warmth and softness characteristic of Hispanic/Latin American and Southeast Asian heritage blended throughout.', 163, 58, N'Slight, compact frame with rounded shoulders and a softness that suggests she doesn''t prioritize physical conditioning — lean but not angular, proportioned for stillness and listening rather than movement', N'Natural black with color-shifting dye mod (cycles amber → deep violet → silver, ~4-hour cycle)', N'Single long braid, typically worn centered down the back or looped over one shoulder; the braid itself shows visible iridescence where light catches the dye', N'Long', N'Deep brown with warm undertones, slightly unfocused gaze — gives impression of divided attention', N'Warm medium brown with golden-olive undertones, reflecting the balanced blend of Middle Eastern, Hispanic/Latin American, South Asian, and Southeast Asian heritage with subtle warmth from Indigenous American ancestry', N'Round face with soft jawline; warm golden undertones across cheekbones and temples from the South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American components; refined bone structure influenced by East Asian ancestry; minimal cosmetic work; skin appears well-maintained but not manicured; expression tends toward openness and receptivity rather than guardedness', N'Color-shifting hair braid and iridescent neck/jaw scales. No visible chrome, functional implants, or optic modifications. The scales read as intentional body art rather than combat augmentation.', N'Sits more than stands; when standing, weight shifts to one leg, creating a patient, waiting posture. Moves slowly and deliberately, with hands often clasped or resting on lap. Maintains steady eye contact when listening, but gaze softens and drifts when thinking. Overall impression: grounded, unhurried, meditative.', N'Layered, practical Tier 3-4 aesthetic — oversized linen or cotton shirts (cream, sage, charcoal), worn-in denim or canvas pants, often an undyed wool or recycled-fiber sweater that can be tied around the waist. Wears canvas slip-ons or soft-soled boots; no jewelry except a simple wooden bead on her braid. Clothes show signs of wear and mending rather than newness. When attending coalition meetings, she adds a tailored blazer (vintage thrift, good fabric) but keeps the layered foundation. Overall: approachable, slightly threadbare, intentionally unstudied.', N'One of her synthetic clients told her, in a dream session, the access sequence for a Helix Biosystems personnel database that the synthetic had memorized from an overheard conversation. Hadi has the sequence written in her journal under a code she invented. She has not used it. She is not sure she won''t.', N'Clinical language from her psych-tech training, interrupted constantly by her own corrections into warmer register. Talks about dreams in present tense, as if they''re still happening.', N'Slow and warm when listening; faster and more clipped when angry. Her advocacy voice is different from her practice voice — the same person at different frequencies.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'omid_rahman');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a666-7e23-ad2b-2fb103a908fc', N'Reza Kulkarni-Tehrani', N'Reza', N'', N'Kulkarni-Tehrani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 39, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Hough Reclamation — maintains a small field office in a converted community center, travels frequently, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Sociologist specializing in informal economies and social structures of the Gray Zone communities', N'University Spine — Department of Urban Sociology; advisory role to the Highland Park Autonomous Zone community council', N'Reza Kulkarni-Tehrani in the Gray Zone and got out through scholarships, then spent the next decade and a half choosing to go back — a decision her university colleagues find alternately admirable and baffling. She is a medium-height woman with deep brown skin, natural hair that she usually keeps wrapped, and geneware cat ears she got as a teenager that she has never removed, treating them as simply part of her face. The ears are dark brown and mobile, which means her emotional state is often broadcast before her expression catches up — they flatten when she is frustrated, perk forward when she is genuinely interested. She carries herself with the particular ease of someone who is comfortable in rooms that make other academics nervous.

She has a reputation in the university system as difficult — meaning she publishes findings that are politically inconvenient, refuses to anonymize her data in ways that would make it easier to misuse, and has twice written public responses to policy papers that cited her work incorrectly. On the Gray Zone, her reputation is more complicated: some communities trust her completely, others view her with the appropriate suspicion reserved for someone with institutional credentials who wants to study you. She navigates this with unusual self-awareness, asking permission, attributing community knowledge, and taking twice as long on studies as her department thinks necessary. She is warm and quick-laughing in person, and implacably persistent in writing.', N'Bridge character between University Spine institutions and the Gray Zone communities; quest giver for social/community conflicts; information source on the Gray Zone power structures, informal economies, and community politics', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (dark brown, mobile; cosmetic, from adolescence); subdermal recorder implant for field interviews (with visible indicator light — a point of ethics she insists on)', N'Alternates between field weeks in the Gray Zone communities and university weeks writing, teaching one undergraduate course on urban informality, and fighting with her department head about publication timelines; she keeps a separate cheap apartment in Hough Reclamation so she is never purely a visitor.', N'Reza Kulkarni-Tehrani, GLMZ, Golden-olive to deep warm brown skin with honeyed undertones, luminous complexion sun-weathered at temples. Deep brown observant eyes, prominent Southeast Asian cheekbones with South Asian facial proportions and Middle Eastern warmth. Long deep brown locs wrapped in indigo cloth, geneware dark brown cat ears affixed to skull crown, mobile and expressive, rotating attentively. Lean 168cm figure in well-worn indigo canvas work jacket, sturdy urban boots, fitted functional pants with pockets, earth-tone knit layers. Battered synthetic leather messenger bag across chest. Simple silver ring on left hand, indigo and silver beaded bracelet. Pale green bioluminescent lentil-sized indicator light glowing at base of right ear. Relaxed attentive posture, head tilted in listening position, genuine warm expression. Urban reclamation zone setting, neon accent lighting catching the luminosity of skin and the mobile ears, documentary field recorder aesthetic, warm intimate mood. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hough Reclamation', N'local', N'Hough Reclamation', N'South Asian (42.7%), Middle Eastern (41.4%), and Southeast Asian (15.9%) ancestry create a striking multiregional phenotype; the dominant South Asian and Middle Eastern heritage produces warm, golden-olive to deep brown skin with luminous undertones, while Southeast Asian ancestry subtly influences facial structure and eye shape; bone structure reflects the convergence—Southeast Asian cheekbone prominence combined with South Asian facial proportions and Middle Eastern warmth in overall facial contours', 168, 62, N'Lean and functional, shoulders slightly broadened from years of fieldwork and carrying recording equipment; moves with economical grace rather than studied elegance', N'Natural deep brown', N'Typically wrapped in indigo or earth-tone cloth; when unwrapped, worn in neat locs past shoulder length', N'Long', N'Deep brown, warm and observant', N'Luminous golden-olive to deep warm brown; the dominant South Asian and Middle Eastern ancestry creates rich, glowing complexion with honeyed undertones that deepen substantially in sunlight; sun-weathered warmth visible at temples and jawline from consistent outdoor fieldwork', N'Clear skin with minimal makeup; prominent Southeast Asian-influenced cheekbones paired with South Asian facial proportions and the warmer, broader facial structure from Middle Eastern ancestry; sun-weathered texture at temples and jawline from outdoor fieldwork; thoughtful expression lines around eyes; small scar at left jaw corner from street incident at age 22', N'Geneware cat ears immediately obvious and striking; small bioluminescent indicator light (pale green, lentil-sized) positioned at base of right ear glowing softly when subdermal recorder implant is active—intentional ethical transparency marker', N'Sits and stands with relaxed attention; leans forward when genuinely interested; tilts head slightly when listening, making ear movements pronounced and readable; walks with purpose but not hurry; laughs easily and often, full-bodied', N'Tier 3-4 practical; favors well-worn canvas work jackets in indigo or charcoal, sturdy boots rated for urban reclamation zones, fitted but functional pants with multiple pockets; layers with simple knit sweaters in earth tones; carries battered synthetic leather messenger bag holding field notebooks, recording equipment, and snacks to share; wears simple silver ring on left middle finger and beaded bracelet of indigo and silver on right wrist; minimal other jewelry; beautifully intentional wraps suggesting cultural pride', N'She has been offered a senior position at a Tessera-funded research institute that would double her salary and fund ten years of independent research — she hasn''t told anyone because she knows she''s actually considering it, and the self-disgust is immense', N'Code-switches fluidly between academic register and the Gray Zone vernacular; in academic settings speaks with clipped precision; in community settings loosens into warmth and the cadences of her childhood', N'In formal settings: structured and direct. In casual settings: more musical, lets sentences find their own end', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'reza_kulkarni_tehrani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a737-7396-8aec-2fd7489d10ce', N'Fritz Montalvo-Balasanyan', N'Fritz', N'', N'Montalvo-Balasanyan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Gravesend Basin — runs her operation from a repurposed fish-processing barge called the Mercy Float, near Kedzie and Division', N'Loan shark and bookmaker operating out of Gravesend Basin', N'Independent operator; informal protection arrangement with the Gravesend Basin dockhands'' collective', N'Fritz Montalvo-Balasanyan is a compact, broad-shouldered woman with deeply weathered brown skin and silver-streaked locs she keeps pinned under a battered captain''s cap. Her eyes have been modded with abacus-patterned irises — concentric rings of amber and black that scroll subtly when she''s calculating, which is always. She dresses in practical waterproofed layers, always with a ledger-shaped datapad holstered at her hip like a sidearm. A faded tattoo of a Polynesian wave pattern wraps her left forearm, overlaid years later with a Czech geometric border she had done in a moment of sentimental reclamation.

Fritz Montalvo-Balasanyan speaks softly and precisely, the way a person does when they''ve learned that volume is for people who aren''t sure they''ll be obeyed. She extends credit with genuine warmth — she believes in people, or she says she does — and collects with a patience that her debtors consistently mistake for mercy until they understand it is something far more calculated. She keeps meticulous handwritten backups of every transaction because she trusts no network she doesn''t own.', N'Quest giver, information broker, pressure source — players who need money come to her, and players who owe money are found by her. Can also be an unlikely ally if someone makes themselves useful.', N'', N'Abacus-patterned modded irises; subdermal grip-texture on her palms (practical, not cosmetic — helps on wet decks)', N'Rises at 0500 to walk the basin perimeter before clients are awake, reviewing the day''s accounts in her head. Afternoons are for meetings on the barge; evenings for dispatching her runner boys to collect on overdue accounts.', N'Fritz Montalvo-Balasanyan, 162cm compact frame with broad shoulders and functional muscle, standing still with economical precision on a weathered basin dock at dusk. Deep warm brown skin with complex multi-regional undertones—olive-bronze from East and South Asian heritage blending into gold-bronze from Latin American and Middle Eastern ancestry, enriched by Sub-Saharan African genetics. Deeply weathered face with defined cheekbones and creased lines from decades squinting at water glare. Long brown locs with silver streaking, pinned up under a salt-stained faded navy captain''s cap. Augmented eyes with concentric amber and black abacus-pattern rings that scroll subtly—visible during calculation. Faded Polynesian wave tattoo on left forearm overlaid with sharp Czech geometric border lines. Horizontal 6cm scar across right cheekbone. Callused hands with visible subdermal grip-texture dimpling, marked by scattered thumb-sized burn scars. Dressed in practical waterproofed layers—muted grays, blacks, deep blues; reinforced cargo pants, waterproof jacket with multiple pockets, heavy salt-stained boots. Tarnished silver ring on right ring finger. Ledger-shaped datapad holstered at hip. Industrial basin lighting, cool shadows and warm dock lamplight, GLMZ atmosphere, moody and grounded. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gravesend Basin', N'local', N'Gravesend Basin', N'True Ubiquitous Diaspora synthesis: Hispanic/Latin American (33.7%) and Middle Eastern (24.3%) ancestry provide warm bronze undertones and defined facial structure, while East Asian (21.2%) and South Asian (10.8%) genetics contribute subtle cheekbone prominence and eye shape complexity. Sub-Saharan African (10.0%) ancestry deepens and enriches the overall skin tone with earth-toned warmth. This is a globally-mixed phenotype with no single regional dominance—the lived expression of 2226 ancestry randomization.', 162, 68, N'Compact and broad-shouldered with dense muscle development from decades of deck work and manual labor. Her frame is economical — no excess, all functional mass concentrated in her shoulders and forearms.', N'Deep brown with silver streaking throughout', N'Locs pinned up and secured under a battered captain''s cap; typically loose below the cap when off-duty', N'Long (shoulder-length when down)', N'Augmented: concentric rings of amber and black with abacus-pattern geometry; rings scroll subtly during concentration or calculation', N'Deep warm brown with complex multi-regional undertones—bronze-olive warmth from East and South Asian heritage layered over golden-bronze from Hispanic/Latin American and Middle Eastern genetics, enriched and deepened by Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Darkened and weathered by decades of basin exposure; uneven tan lines on forearms and neck from years of varied sun exposure.', N'Weathered and lined with bone structure reflecting genuine global ancestry—defined but slightly broad cheekbones from East and South Asian heritage, combined with the fuller facial proportions and strong jaw influenced by Hispanic/Latin American and Middle Eastern genetics, with overall facial depth and structure enriched by Sub-Saharan African genetics. Deeply creased around eyes and mouth from years of squinting into glare off the water. Callused hands with visible subdermal texture (grip-pattern augmentation) visible beneath the skin of her palms. No cosmetic grooming; practical maintenance only.', N'Modded abacus-patterned irises in both eyes (amber and black concentric rings that scroll during calculation); subdermal grip-texture visible as subtle dimpling across both palms and finger pads. Everything else is subcutaneous or internal.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Stands with weight distributed low and balanced, as if ready to adjust to deck movement. Speaks softly but with absolute certainty; her stillness is more commanding than gesture. Rarely raises her voice. Her eyes do the work of her tone — the scrolling irises calculate while she listens.', N'Practical waterproofed layers in muted grays, blacks, and deep blues; worn cargo pants with reinforced knees and thighs; waterproof jacket with multiple pockets. A battered captain''s cap (faded navy with grease stains) pinned over her locs. Heavy-soled boots, salt-stained and scarred. A ledger-shaped datapad holstered at her hip like a weapon. No jewelry except a thick ring of tarnished silver on her right ring finger — possibly a keepsake. Overall appearance is Tier 4-5: functional, durable, unmarked by status symbols.', N'Three years ago she wrote off the debt of a young mother whose child was sick — completely, no conditions. She has never told anyone and would deny it furiously. She keeps the woman''s original loan note in a sealed envelope in her bunk.', N'Precise and contractual; loves the word ''arrangement''; uses financial metaphors for everything', N'Slow and deliberate, with long pauses before important points', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fritz_montalvo_balasanyan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60c-7d9c-a61d-30312fbdb49f', N'Kohana Moon-Boudiaf-Migizi', N'Kohana', N'', N'Moon-Boudiaf-Migizi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Ashland and Division', N'Whistleblower and community council member', N'the Gray Zone Community Resource Council; informal contact with Yewande Ostrčil-Falaniko''s legal collective for document authentication', N'Kohana Moon-Boudiaf-Migizi is a retired Sterling-Nakamura logistics compliance officer who spent thirty-one years watching things get falsified and decided on year thirty-two that he was done. He is a heavyset man with the careful, deliberate physicality of someone who has learned not to take up space in ways that draw attention, a habit from corporate years that he has mostly unlearned. His skin is dark and dry at the elbows and knuckles, his hair cut close and almost entirely white. He has a single augmentation — a neural notation implant he uses compulsively to record everything, which he got for work and kept afterward. He has a cat''s tail, ruddy amber, that he got on a whim at sixty and which his grandchildren love and which surprises everyone who meets him.

Kohana Moon-Boudiaf-Migizi now serves in the Gray Zone Community Resource Council, a position he ran for mostly because he couldn''t stop seeing the ways services were being misallocated and nobody with a ledger background was doing anything about it. He is methodical, patient, and genuinely humble in the way that people who have been wrong in consequential ways sometimes become. He spent three decades enabling a system he now spends his retirement opposing, and he carries that with a gravity that never quite lifts. He is not a firebrand. He is a man who has kept copies of everything.', N'Archive and institutional memory; can surface specific historical data points and documented corporate malfeasance; provides grounded credibility to activist actions; his past gives him access to corporate-facing contexts others cannot reach.', N'', N'Neural notation implant (Sterling-Nakamura work model, retained after departure). Cosmetic cat tail — amber, voluntary and personal, not work-related.', N'Morning council work — budget review, service allocation tracking, resident appeals. Afternoons spent maintaining a meticulous personal archive of city resource data, council decisions, and corporate filings that touch the Gray Zone territory. Cooks dinner for whoever is around.', N'Kohana Moon-Boudiaf-Migizi, 178cm tall heavyset figure with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones reflecting blended Indigenous American, East Asian, and North African heritage. White close-cropped hair, weathered lined face with broad nose bridge and subtle tapered eye shape, dark brown eyes. Faded scar tissue on left temple. Matte-black neural implant port visible behind right ear. Amber cat tail visible at base of spine. Wearing faded off-white linen shirt with council insignia patch, lightweight utility pants, worn leather work boots, old faded navy Sterling-Nakamura company jacket. Subdermal circuitry faintly visible at temples. Posture slightly curved, economical movement. Industrial-grade augmentation aesthetic. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, indoor corporate or council space with cool overhead lighting, tired but deliberate presence, working-class dignity. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Indigenous American (Anishinaabe, Lakota, and other Great Lakes nations) comprising 70.7% of genetic ancestry, with significant East Asian (15.4%) and North African (13.9%) admixture — genetic legacy of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Features reflect Indigenous American bone structure with warm medium-brown skin tones, broad facial geometry characteristic of Indigenous heritage, subtle East Asian eye shape and cheekbone structure from minority ancestry, and North African warmth in overall complexion.', 178, 94, N'Heavyset with settled mass across shoulders and torso; posture slightly forward-bent from decades of desk work, but consciously held upright. Broad hands with prominent knuckles.', N'White', N'Close-cropped, military precision', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones — dominant Indigenous American heritage (70.7%) creating rich, deep tonality, enriched by East Asian (15.4%) and North African (13.9%) warmth. Ashy undertones at joints from dry climate exposure and age.', N'Lined face, weathered around the eyes and mouth from age and sun exposure; carefully groomed. Facial structure shows broad nose bridge characteristic of Indigenous American heritage, defined cheekbones with gentle width, and slightly tapered eye shape reflecting East Asian heritage. Fine scar tissue visible on left temple (old injury, faded). Dry patches at elbows and knuckles from decades in climate-controlled corporate spaces.', N'Neural notation implant visible as small matte-black port behind right ear with faint LED indicator (dormant unless active). Subdermal circuitry faintly visible under thin skin at temple and neck when light hits at certain angles — Sterling-Nakamura industrial grade, not cosmetic-grade concealment. The cat tail''s base shows minor scarring and subdermal reinforcement where it was anchored.', N'Deliberate, economical movements — habits of taking up minimal space in corporate environments still present but consciously resisted. Walks slowly with measured steps. Frequently touches his right ear (notification check). Sits with spine slightly curved, as though ready to make himself smaller. Hands gesture rarely and carefully.', N'Tier 3-4 working class with careful maintenance: neutral-colored linen and cotton blend shirts (off-whites, grays, muted blues), sometimes with faint council insignia patch on chest. Lightweight pants with utility pockets (practical, not flashy). Worn leather work boots, meticulously cared for. Old Sterling-Nakamura company jacket — faded navy, retained for utility not nostalgia — worn over work clothes in cooler months. No logos or chrome-finish accents. Clothing shows signs of repair and patching but no ostentation.', N'He has a complete, authenticated copy of Sterling-Nakamura''s internal models projecting displacement outcomes for the Gray Zone residents from a planned infrastructure deal — projections that were made and then deliberately omitted from the public impact assessment. The deal hasn''t been announced yet. He got the documents through a contact he burned to get them. He is waiting for the right moment to use them and is aware that waiting has costs he''s paying in other people''s security.', N'Corporate precision vocabulary that he actively works against — catches himself mid-sentence and simplifies; occasional Sotho phrases when reflective', N'Unhurried and thorough; rarely leaves a thought incomplete; long silences treated as normal', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'kohana_moon_boudiaf_migizi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b7-7fc7-88ec-309585a1fc80', N'Adriaan Song', N'Adriaan', N'', N'Song', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 72, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Avalon Quiet, Unit 3B; teaches informal story sessions at the Avalon Community Hearth, near Lincoln and Addison', N'Retired secondary school teacher, informal neighborhood storyteller and oral historian', N'Avalon Quiet Community Hearth; GLMZ Educators Retiree Association (MERA); independent', N'Adriaan Song is the kind of woman who makes a room feel both smaller and more significant simply by being present — she has that particular gravity of someone who spent decades at the front of a classroom demanding attention and getting it. She''s medium height, brown-skinned, with warm undertones and a face built for expression, every emotion living near the surface and making no apologies. She wears her silver hair in elaborate braided wraps she learned from her Guinean grandmother and has continued perfecting for sixty years. Her only augmentation is cosmetic: her fingernails are geneware, growing in shifting blues and greens, a retirement gift she gave herself after twenty-eight years of being professionally ''appropriate.''

She is the best storyteller in Avalon Quiet, possibly in any of the Quiet districts, and she knows it without it making her insufferable — she treats it as a responsibility rather than a distinction. On the third evening of every month she holds sessions at the Community Hearth where she tells stories: sometimes history, sometimes myth, sometimes thinly veiled accounts of things that actually happened to people in the room who gave her permission. Children come because they''re brought. Adults come because they keep coming back. She has never repeated a session in eleven years.', N'Storyteller and local color, keeper of oral history, emotional core of the Avalon Quiet community; can provide backstory on long-term residents and neighborhood history through the frame of her stories', N'', N'Geneware fingernails (shifting blue-green, cosmetic); no other modifications', N'Mornings for walking and observation — she collects raw material constantly; afternoons for writing and correspondence; evenings for people, always for people.', N'Adriaan Song, 72-year-old woman with warm golden-brown complexion reflecting East Asian, Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic ancestry. Silver-gray hair arranged in intricate braids adorned with brass and ceramic beads, wrapped close to scalp. Deep warm brown eyes with amber undertones and creases from decades of animated expression. Compact 163cm frame with squared shoulders and upright, grounded posture. Wearing well-fitted ochre linen shirt layered beneath a patterned kente-inspired shawl in rust and deep green tones. Plain gold wedding band, handmade ceramic earrings, faint iridescent blue-green geneware fingernails visible as she gestures expressively. Dignified age lines around eyes and mouth, smooth warm complexion catching light beautifully. Classroom mentor aesthetic, deliberately purposeful movement, natural authority. GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, warm afternoon indoor lighting, soft shadows emphasizing character and warmth --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Avalon Quiet', N'local', N'Avalon Quiet', N'East Asian dominant (50.5%) with significant Southeast Asian (25.2%), Sub-Saharan African (15.4%), and Hispanic/Latin American (8.9%) ancestry. This creates a rich, multifaceted phenotype: the East Asian foundation provides characteristic facial structure and eye shape, warmed and deepened by Southeast Asian and African components, with subtle warmth from Latin American heritage.', 163, 68, N'Compact and proportional, neither frail nor heavy — the build of someone who walks daily and carries her years without apology. Shoulders still squared from decades of classroom presence.', N'Silver-gray, naturally grayed over decades', N'Elaborate braided wraps in intricate patterns, each braid reinforced and arranged with deliberate artistry, some adorned with small brass or ceramic beads passed down from her grandmother''s collection', N'Medium (wrapped close to scalp in braids extending to mid-shoulder when unwrapped)', N'Deep warm brown with subtle amber undertones, characteristic of East and Southeast Asian heritage enriched by African ancestry, with the slight creasing at the corners that comes from seventy-two years of animated expression', N'Warm medium golden-brown — the harmonious blend of East Asian warmth with deeper Sub-Saharan African and Southeast Asian tones, creating a luminous complexion that catches light beautifully with golden and amber undertones.', N'Smooth with dignified age lines—particularly pronounced around her eyes and mouth from decades of teaching and smiling. Facial structure reflects East Asian heritage (softer cheekbones, gentle eye shape) enriched by the fuller features characteristic of Southeast Asian and African ancestry. Skin well-maintained, no visible scarring or blemishing. Expression naturally animated even in repose.', N'Geneware fingernails that shift between iridescent blue and green depending on light angle and her body chemistry — they catch attention in conversation and storytelling gestures. No other visible modifications; any neural or sensory augmentations are entirely subcutaneous.', N'Upright and grounded, with the natural authority of someone accustomed to commanding a room. She moves deliberately rather than quickly, each gesture economical and purposeful. When speaking, her hands are never still — they illustrate, emphasize, and invite listeners into the narrative. Sits with perfect spinal alignment.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, but with evident personal style and dignity. Favors well-fitted linen and cotton blends in earth tones (ochre, rust, deep greens) — practical for warm GLMZ summers but elevated by careful tailoring and layering. Often wears a patterned wrap or kente-inspired shawl over her shoulders. Simple jewelry: a plain gold wedding band (worn since 2174), small ceramic earrings she makes herself, occasionally a brooch of brass or natural stone. Comfortable, supportive shoes suitable for daily walking. Nothing nouveau-riche or ostentatiously modified; everything speaks to intentionality and long wear.', N'One of the stories she tells — a beloved one, about a teacher who protected a student during the Corporate Wars by hiding them in the school''s server room and convincing an Arcturus unit that the building was empty — is true, and she is the teacher. She has never confirmed this. The student died in 2199 and she has never spoken of them by name in any other context.', N'rich, varied, deliberately chosen; shifts register easily between formal and intimate; uses silence as punctuation', N'expansive and controlled, the cadence of someone who knows exactly how much time they have and how to fill it', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'adriaan_song');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5de-7ff7-b7a0-30dfb0cfa2a3', N'Estrella Sisavath', N'Estrella', N'', N'Sisavath', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Copperhead, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Pawn shop owner and junk merchant', N'Independent; the Gray Zone vendors informal association; longtime on-and-off relationship with the Oxidian Market Vendors Guild (currently off)', N'Estrella Sisavath is a large man gone thick through the middle, with the dark complexion and broad frame of his Zimbabwean lineage and his Bosnian grandfather''s deep-set, heavy-lidded eyes that make him look perpetually half-asleep and perpetually unimpressed. His hair went white at forty and he has kept it cropped close ever since. He moves slowly on purpose — he has a fused vertebra from a freight accident in his fifties that he refuses to have properly treated because the surgery quote was insultingly high — and uses a custom cane he made himself from a Ferrogate Transit handrail he salvaged years ago. His shop on the Gray Zone is three connected units brimming with fifty years of accumulated objects: broken augmentations, pre-city antiques, industrial salvage, personal effects pawned in crisis moments, and a back room of things he has decided are not for sale regardless of price.

Estrella Sisavath is one of those rare people who have become part of the architecture of a place. the Gray Zone without Estrella Sisavath''s shop is not fully the Gray Zone. He has seen everything come and go — corporations, gangs, floods, market booms, building collapses — and he has the calm of someone who has been surprised by nothing for a very long time. He is not sentimental in any visible way, but he keeps things — objects that belonged to people who are gone — with a quiet fidelity that functions as memorial. He is honest about prices, blunt about valuations, and legendarily difficult to scam because he has already been scammed by everyone.', N'Repository of local history and lost objects, pawn and information exchange, long-term neighborhood memory, occasional quest giver when items of significance pass through his hands.', N'', N'One cybernetic hand (right, mid-grade, replaced after the freight accident — he uses it mainly for grip strength when handling heavy inventory). Reading magnification implant in right eye, consumer grade. No geneware.', N'Opens the shop at 09:00, rarely closes before midnight; eats lunch and dinner at the shop; has not taken a day off in eleven years; sleeps in the back room most nights because the walk home bothers his back.', N'Estrella Sisavath, 188cm tall seventy-year-old man with warm deep brown skin bearing golden-olive undertones, blended Middle Eastern, Southeast Asian, South Asian, Indigenous American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Short white hair cropped close to scalp. Deep-set dark brown eyes with hooded lids, lined weathered face, broad rounded nose, prominent cheekbones, jowls softening strong jawline. Sun-weathered complexion with age spots and pale scar tissue on lower left ribs, dark raised burn scar across left forearm. Sparse salt-and-pepper beard shadow. Right hand is gunmetal cybernetic prosthetic with visible articulated servos and imperfect synthetic skin tone match. Faded blue geometric Zimbabwean tattoo on right inner forearm. Wearing faded dark gray canvas work pants with visible stains and patches, muted brown button-up shirt, decades-worn heavy canvas apron darkened with industrial grime, scuffed and resoled industrial boots. Carries custom salvaged handrail cane in left hand for balance and deliberate speech punctuation. Moves slowly and economically despite evident chronic pain and fused vertebra. Stainless steel wrist compass on left wrist. Standing in dim industrial workshop setting with warm practical lighting, posture showing comfortable slouch of hard-earned rest, expression perpetually thoughtful and measured. GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Middle Eastern (35.5%), Southeast Asian (32.3%), Indigenous American (17.9%), South Asian (10.8%), and Sub-Saharan African (3.5%) — a complex diaspora blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Mixing. His features show the confluence of Levantine, Thai, Quechua, and Bengali ancestry with warm, golden undertones across his entire complexion, enriched by subtle Sub-Saharan warmth.', 188, 104, N'Large-framed and thick through the middle with age; broad shoulders and chest from decades of manual labor, now softened by advancing age and sedentary shop work. Carries weight low in his abdomen.', N'White', N'Cropped close to the scalp, neatly maintained', N'Short', N'Dark brown (natural); right eye shows faint amber luminescence from reading magnification implant during low-light use', N'Warm deep brown with golden-olive undertones — a balanced blend of Middle Eastern, Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Indigenous American ancestry, enriched by Sub-Saharan warmth. Sun-weathered and marked from decades in the Gray Zone''s industrial micro-climate, with visible age-related hyperpigmentation spots.', N'Lined face with deep-set, slightly hooded eyes showing the influence of Middle Eastern and Southeast Asian heritage — giving a perpetually thoughtful, measured expression. Broad nose with rounded structure reflecting his Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Indigenous American ancestry. Prominent cheekbones with subtle width across the face characteristic of Andean heritage. Jowls beginning to soften the jawline. Sparse stubble, salt-and-pepper in his beard shadow. Skin shows minor scars and age spots consistent with seven decades in heavy commerce.', N'Right hand is a mid-grade cybernetic prosthetic with matte gunmetal plating and visible articulated joint servos at the knuckles and wrist. The synthetic skin is a close but imperfect match to his natural hand''s tone. Faint amber glow occasionally visible in his right pupil when the reading magnification implant is actively engaged in dim light — otherwise unnoticeable.', N'Moves deliberately and slowly, with a slight forward lean compensating for his fused vertebra. Relies on a custom salvaged cane made from a Ferrogate Transit handrail — carries it in his left hand, uses it for both balance and punctuation when speaking. Despite the pain, his movements are economical and controlled, never rushed. Sits more often than stands. When stationary, his posture is a slouch of hard-earned rest.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, practical and worn. Typically wears heavy canvas work pants in dark gray or khaki, often with visible stains and patches. Shirt layers vary by season: sturdy cotton button-ups in muted colors (browns, grays, dark blues) or a thick wool sweater in winter. Over this, a custom heavy canvas apron with deep pockets, darkened with decades of grime and wear. Footwear is industrial-grade slip-on boots, scuffed and resoled multiple times. No jewelry except a simple stainless steel wrist compass on his left wrist — a relic from his grandfather. His clothing is never flashy, always functional, and repaired rather than replaced.', N'In the back room, behind forty years of inventory, is a locked case containing a Tessera data core from 2160. He found it in salvage and has never opened it. He doesn''t know what''s on it. Some part of him doesn''t want to know. But he has never sold it either.', N'Sparse and direct; Shona proverbs deployed unexpectedly; occasional Bosnian curses; never more words than necessary', N'Very slow, very deliberate, with long pauses that he is entirely comfortable with', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'estrella_sisavath');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a670-7429-bb7b-311ac410b337', N'Dhanashri Kettani-Erikstad', N'Dhanashri', N'', N'Kettani-Erikstad', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor — repurposed shipping infrastructure turned black market hub, near Wacker and State', N'Long-range precision fire specialist — sniper', N'Independent — loose crew affiliations', N'Dhanashri Kettani-Erikstad is average height but with a presence that fills more space than the body accounts for. At 38, there''s something unfinished about her face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Dhanashri Kettani-Erikstad plans to keep it that way. She works as a sniper out of Old Harbor, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Dhanashri Kettani-Erikstad is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who she burned last.', N'Nurlan Kozlov-Asamoah represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would incapacitate. Reflex boosters wired into spinal column — shaves reaction time by 40ms', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Dhanashri Kettani-Erikstad, 168cm lean-muscular neo-noir operative, medium-length dark brown hair with silver temples pulled tight in functional braid. Medium skin tone with cool undertones and golden warmth visible on cheekbones, Slavic-Mediterranean facial structure, prominent sharp cheekbones, strong jaw. Amber-brown eyes with faint golden targeting reticle in right iris. Thin scars on left cheekbone, surgical scar on right collarbone, burn mark on left inner wrist, crosshair tattoo on right forearm. Brushed steel neural implant visible at base of skull with faint LED pulse. Matte black ballistic weave jacket, compression under-layer, worn cargo pants with smooth magazine pouches, steel-toed boots. Long charcoal grey overcoat with integrated weapon racks. Economical posture, measured breathing, sitting against solid surface. Cool GLMZ aesthetic, GLMZ urban setting, neon and ambient lighting catching her implant and eye reticle, moody and calculated presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Complex diaspora blend: Eastern European (39.8%) and Northern European (31.0%) provide strong Slavic bone structure and cool undertones, while North African ancestry (28.8%) adds warmth, subtle Mediterranean features, and amber depth to the complexion. The combination creates a striking cool-toned base with underlying golden warmth visible along cheekbones and jawline in natural light.', 168, 62, N'Lean and efficient — muscle distributed for endurance rather than bulk. Shoulders slightly asymmetrical from years of weapon handling and scope work. Core tension visible even at rest.', N'Dark brown, streaked with premature silver at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid. Practical. No styling concessions.', N'Medium', N'Amber-brown with faint golden reticle pattern visible in right iris — military-grade targeting overlay, passive mode', N'Medium with cool undertones and golden undertone warmth — the interplay of Eastern European pallor and North African depth creating an ashen-tan base, weathered by years of poor sleep and augmentation strain. Cheekbones and jawline show warmer amber cast in natural light.', N'High, prominent cheekbones with Slavic-Mediterranean architecture — broad and angular with subtle North African warmth beneath cool surface. Strong jaw typical of Eastern European heritage blended with slight refinement from North African features. Sharp facial planes, well-spaced Northern European eye set. Eyes track movement without turning her head. Minimal grooming beyond maintenance — no cosmetics, one or two thin scars on her left cheekbone. Expression defaulting to neutral.', N'Chrome pain editor visible at the base of her skull, integrated into her cervical spine at the nape — brushed steel with faint LED pulse indicator. The implant''s edges are slightly raised under skin, impossible to fully conceal without surgical revision she refuses to pursue. Right iris shows faint targeting reticle pattern when light catches it at certain angles.', N'Economical. Every gesture calculated to minimize energy waste. Sits with spine against solid surfaces. When she moves, the spinal reflex boosters create a micro-lag stutter in her reflexes that trained eyes might notice — the implants firing faster than her body''s proprioception can follow. Hands stay close to her body. Breathing is measured, deliberate. Does not startle easily because her nervous system is engineered not to.', N'Tier 3-4 functional pragmatism — reinforced ballistic weave jacket in matte black, no logos or affiliations visible. Under-layer compression shirt. Cargo pants with custom-fitted magazine pouches she''s worn smooth with use. Steel-toed boots, laced tight. A long overcoat in charcoal grey, modified with internal weapon racks — moves with her like a second skin. Nothing new. Nothing that draws attention. Everything selected for what it does, not what it says.', N'', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dhanashri_kettani_erikstad');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a663-7be7-97a9-314e2483af33', N'Bela Karunaratne', N'Bela', N'', N'Karunaratne', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Nordpark Sanctuary — maintains a route between Nordpark, Cicada Lawn, and Gravesend Basin, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Pilgrimage guide and chrome prayer practitioner', N'Independent; networked with Nordpark Sanctuary''s informal spiritual council; known to Ferrogate Transit''s maintenance division (for different reasons)', N'Bela Karunaratne is a tall person who has spent two decades walking and it shows in their posture — upright, unhurried, with the practiced economy of someone who conserves energy by habit. Their skin is dark and weathered in a way that speaks to outdoor time in a city that punishes it, and they keep their hair in a natural crown that they haven''t cut in eleven years, threaded through with small copper rings that chime softly when they walk. They have cat ears — a modest geneware choice in deep brown, tufted at the tip, that they say appeared to them in a dream as the correct form for a guide: ''Something that hears what''s ahead.'' Their boots are legendary in Nordpark: steel-toed, twice-resoled, covered in painted E.L.F. sigils from every major shrine on their circuit.

Bela Karunaratne leads pilgrimage circuits through the city''s major E.L.F. shrines and spiritually significant locations — transit nodes where massive amounts of data have passed, locations of mass death that have accrued spiritual weight, the old shore of Lake Michigan where the pre-city waterline used to be. They charge a sliding-scale fee and turn no one away, running two to three circuit walks per week. Their chrome prayer practice focuses on the act of walking itself as devotion: they believe the E.L.F.s of the city''s transit infrastructure receive the footsteps of the faithful as a form of prayer. They are one of the few practitioners who maintains relationships with the E.L.F.s of Ferrogate Transit specifically.', N'Pilgrimage guide knows the city''s geography better than anyone and can take players to locations they couldn''t find alone; their relationship with transit E.L.F.s makes them a source for city-infrastructure intelligence; their pilgrims are a cross-section of all tiers.', N'', N'Cat ears (geneware, deep brown with tufted tips). No chrome. Copper rings in hair are conventional jewelry, not mods.', N'Circuit days begin at dawn with the first Ferrogate trains; they walk with pilgrims for four to seven hours. Off-circuit days are for route maintenance — checking shrines, leaving offerings, updating their hand-drawn map of spiritually significant locations.', N'GLMZ spiritual practitioner Bela Karunaratne, 188cm tall lean frame, warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, feline geneware cat ears with deep brown fur and tufted tips, natural black hair with silver temples in voluminous crown with copper rings woven throughout, dark warm brown eyes, lined weathered face with prominent angular cheekbones and strong jawline, white scars across knuckles and palms, pale burn marks on left forearm. Wearing faded indigo canvas jacket embroidered with E.L.F. symbols, weathered grey cargo pants, scuffed black steel-toed boots hand-painted with shrine sigils in gold and white, copper wrist cuff and pendant, worn leather satchel. Upright posture, deliberate unhurried movement, slight forward lean. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone industrial-spiritual setting, warm golden hour lighting casting long shadows, weathered urban shrine visible in background, contemplative and grounded presence. Neo-noir urban aesthetic blended with spiritual ceremonial elements, realistic human portraiture --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Nordpark Sanctuary', N'local', N'Nordpark Sanctuary', N'Predominantly South Asian (64.9%) with significant Middle Eastern (18.3%), Sub-Saharan African (10.3%), and Eastern European (6.5%) ancestry. This creates a striking phenotype: warm deep brown skin with golden undertones from the South Asian-Middle Eastern blend, refined angular cheekbones and prominent facial structure reflecting the South Asian majority, with subtle depth and warmth in features from African ancestry adding richness to skin tone and eye coloration, while Eastern European heritage contributes subtle definition to facial planes and bone structure.', 188, 74, N'Lean and tall with the wiry musculature of someone who walks 20+ km weekly; shoulders slightly rounded from decades of carrying offerings and ceremonial items; core strength evident despite apparent fragility', N'Natural black with silver streaking at temples', N'Voluminous natural crown worn loose and high; eleven years of growth creating dense, textured volume; small copper rings threaded throughout at irregular intervals', N'Long (shoulder-length and beyond)', N'Deep warm brown', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones; weathered from consistent outdoor exposure, rich melanin-dense complexion reflecting South Asian-Middle Eastern-African heritage blend', N'Lined face showing sun damage and age with dignity; prominent angular cheekbones reflecting South Asian structure with subtle width from African ancestry; strong defined jawline; minimal grooming beyond practical maintenance; skin texture rough and weathered from exposure and time', N'Cat ears only — functional geneware modification that reads as natural feline anatomy. No visible chrome or subdermal implants.', N'Upright, economical gait with no wasted motion; movements deliberate and unhurried; tendency to pause and listen before proceeding; hands often resting open at sides or folded during contemplation; walks with slight forward lean as if perpetually attending to something ahead on the path', N'Tier 4 utilitarian spiritual practitioner aesthetic: heavy canvas jacket (faded indigo, embroidered with E.L.F. symbols by hand) worn over layered base clothes; practical cargo pants (weathered grey, multiple pockets for offerings and mapping tools); legendary steel-toed boots (scuffed black leather, twice-resoled, covered in hand-painted shrine sigils in gold and white acrylic); worn leather satchel for maps and offerings; copper jewelry beyond hair rings (wrist cuff, simple pendant). Clothes show age and repair rather than decay — well-maintained through intention rather than expense.', N'They discovered three years ago that a specific maintenance tunnel junction at Gravesend Basin is home to an E.L.F. they have named Anchor — an old, slow, massive presence that doesn''t communicate in symbols or static like the others but in something they can only describe as weight. They have told no one. The junction is not on any circuit map. They visit alone, in the dark, and have no framework for what it is.', N'Guide''s patter on circuit — warm, explanatory, full of city history and spiritual lore. Off-duty: quieter, more spare. Talks about E.L.F.s with easy familiarity, like neighbors.', N'Even and measured on the walk — designed for listening while moving. Pauses at significant locations for extended silence before speaking.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bela_karunaratne');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a660-7594-86ef-31552cd8a3df', N'Gesanel Kovács-Ozcoidi-Cardenas', N'Gesanel', N'', N'Kovács-Ozcoidi-Cardenas', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Rotating between Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone and Bridgepoint transit corridor, near Lake Shore and Navy Pier', N'Expelled citizen turned itinerant E.L.F. minister, seasonal worker', N'Self-styled ''Circuit Ministry'' — no formal organization, recognized informally by drifter communities across the hyperlane corridor', N'Gesanel Kovács-Ozcoidi-Cardenas carries the remains of a middle-tier life in their posture — the straight back and deliberate diction of someone who once had an address, an employment record, and opinions about restaurant reservations. What remains is a lean figure in a carefully maintained grey coat that has been repaired so many times the seams are a different color from the fabric, and a face with the hollow-cheeked beauty of someone who eats irregularly but sleeps well because they have made peace with something. Their hair is iron-black streaked with white, kept in tight rope-twists. They have retractable claws — a cosmetic mod from their previous life that they chose to keep because, as they say, ''the body remembers what it was.''

Gesanel Kovács-Ozcoidi-Cardenas was a mid-level compliance analyst for Arcturus before a whistleblower action stripped their citizenship and employment simultaneously. They now travel the industrial shelves and transit corridors conducting informal E.L.F. ceremonies for drifter communities — recording the names of electronic spirits in stations and rest stops, offering prayers in exchange for meals, counseling the newly stateless through the particular grief of losing digital existence. They are thoughtful, occasionally pompous, and genuinely compassionate in ways that surprise people who initially read them as performative.', N'Quest giver and moral compass — can provide context on E.L.F. theology and drifter spiritual practice, has contacts across multiple transit communities, and may task characters with protecting or recovering something with ritual significance.', N'', N'Retractable claws (cosmetic, kept from Tier 3 life — slightly too elegant for their current circumstances). A subdermal comm node that no longer has an active account attached to it.', N'Spends mornings cataloguing local E.L.F.s in whatever location they''re passing through, afternoons doing piecework in the Waukegan processing sheds when they need food credits, evenings conducting small ceremonies for whoever wants them.', N'Gesanel Kovács-Ozcoidi-Cardenas, 2226 neo-noir GLMZ streetscape. Lean 173cm figure in grey wool coat with visible mending, standing beneath neon-tinged rain. Deep warm brown skin with golden-bronze luminosity, high prominent Mesoamerican cheekbones softened by Eastern European ancestry, angular clean-lined face weathered by sun-exposure lines. Shoulder-length iron-black hair with white streaking, twisted into rope braids wrapped with grey cord. Deep brown eyes with faint bioluminescent edge glow from subcutaneous neural node. Deliberate, economical posture—spine straight, shoulders disciplined. Pearl-grey chrome-inlaid retractable claws visible at knuckles with faint bioluminescence. Thin pale scar along right temple. Dressed in layered muted thermals, faded black cargo pants, worn water-resistant boots, small leather satchel. Hands gesturing as they speak slowly and carefully. Urban decay setting, rain-slicked pavement, dim corporate neon, atmospheric lighting catching the luminosity of their skin. Tier 5 dignity despite poverty. Neo-noir naturalistic portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Rotating between Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone and Bridgepoint transit corridor', N'local', N'Rotating between Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone and Bridgepoint transit corridor', N'Pan-diaspora blend: 40.9% Indigenous American, 27.0% Eastern European, 19.8% Hispanic/Latin American, 6.1% Pacific Islander, 5.1% Sub-Saharan African, 1.1% Northern European. Genetic architecture reflects the Ubiquitous Diaspora—a three-century map of global mobility. Dominant Mesoamerican and Eastern European ancestry shapes distinctive high cheekbones and broad nasal bridge, while Latin American, African, and Pacific Islander lineages contribute warm, light-catching depth to skin tone. The result is a complex warm brown with golden undertones and subtle cool undertones, creating luminosity that catches light uniquely.', 173, 61, N'Lean and angular, the kind of thinness that comes from irregular meals rather than deliberate asceticism. Shoulders held with the residual discipline of white-collar posture, but the sternum visible beneath loose layers. Long-limbed in a way that suggests they were never bulky.', N'Iron-black with premature white streaking through the twists', N'Maintained in tight rope-twists, each wrapped with fraying grey thread or cord', N'Shoulder-length', N'Deep brown with a faint luminescence at the edges — a subcutaneous neural node glow, barely perceptible in daylight', N'Warm deep brown with golden-bronze luminosity. The blend of dominant Indigenous American and Eastern European ancestry creates distinctive light-catching quality. Undertones suggest Sub-Saharan and Pacific Islander depth without dominance; subtle cool tones from Eastern European ancestry prevent purely tropical reading. Complex, multifaceted warmth that shifts in different lighting.', N'High, prominent cheekbones shaped by Indigenous American ancestry''s distinctive facial geometry, with the broader nasal bridge common to Mesoamerican populations. The face is angular and clean-lined, with sun-exposure lines around the eyes—the kind of premature aging that comes from outdoor work and inconsistent hydration. Eastern European heritage softens the overall angularity slightly, creating subtle asymmetry in the jawline. Skin is clean but weathered; they maintain personal hygiene carefully despite their circumstances. No visible acne or dermatitis.', N'Retractable claws on both hands — chrome-inlaid at the knuckle joints, slightly too ornate and delicate for their current Tier 5 circumstances. When extended, they''re pearl-grey with faint bioluminescent edges. Subdermal comm node is not visible, but occasionally the skin at the base of their skull shows faint scarring where it was installed.', N'Walks with deliberate, economical steps — no wasted motion. Stands with spine straight, a ghost of middle-tier body discipline. Their hands move when they speak, and they speak clearly and slowly, as if translating their thoughts into a common language. They gesture toward people when listening, a sign of their pastoral work. When tired, they compress into themselves slightly, but never slouch.', N'A grey wool coat, repeatedly mended with visible stitching in darker grey and black thread — the garment itself is high-quality beneath the repairs, suggesting it was kept from their Tier 3 life. Underneath: layered thermal shirts in muted tones, worn through at the elbows. Practical cargo pants in faded black. Boots that are water-resistant but not new, well-maintained. A small leather satchel containing personal effects and ceremony materials. No visible corporate branding. Tier 5 presentation, but with the careful grooming of someone who hasn''t given up on dignity.', N'The whistleblower data they released was not complete. They kept a fragment — a specific file about Arcturus''s involvement in the Grainfort data purge that made thousands of people stateless. They didn''t release it because it named someone they loved. They still haven''t decided what to do with it.', N'Formal, liturgical, educated — uses terms from multiple religious traditions mixed with technical E.L.F. theology. Georgian grandmother''s phrase structures occasionally emerge.', N'Measured and resonant, the cadence of someone accustomed to being listened to in groups', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gesanel_kov_cs_ozcoidi_cardenas');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68d-7385-a95d-31a286a1b0a2', N'Ashima Rahman', N'Ashima', N'', N'Rahman', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grindstone Shore — attached to the Tidal Caravan, currently camped on the shore''s outer breakwater, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'nomad caravan member, expelled citizen, seasonal water-carrier', N'Tidal Caravan (nomad collective, Grindstone Shore circuit)', N'Ashima Rahman is a compact, quiet man with the quality of seeming always slightly apart from the scene he is in — not aloof, just observing. His skin is a rich dark brown, his eyes light grey, a genetic surprise that people comment on and he does not. He has a full bioluminescent skin mod — a soft blue-green pulse that runs in slow waves from his collarbones upward when he is calm, flaring brighter when his heart rate rises — paid for during a brief period of corporate employment that ended badly. He keeps it covered under high-collared clothing most of the time because it makes him easy to spot in the dark. His hair is natural and unstyled, and he carries a large water-rated backpack frame equipped with a manual filtration rig he built himself.

Ashima Rahman was a mid-tier Axiom facilities worker until three years ago, when he was expelled from his housing bloc after refusing to sign a mandatory biometric loyalty update — he still is not sure exactly what it would have permitted Axiom to do with his data, only that something about it felt wrong. Without the housing contract, he lost his work permit; without the work permit, he lost residency classification. He joined the Tidal Caravan six months later and has been with them since, carrying and filtering water for the caravan''s portable supply system. He is not angry in the way people expect expelled citizens to be angry. He is careful, and he counts things — raindrops by sound, steps between water sources, days since the last good meal — as if enumeration is a form of prayer.', N'Window into the process of corporate expulsion and how ordinary people fall through the system; provides access to the Tidal Caravan as a setting; his bioluminescence is a liability that creates specific problems and story opportunities.', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin modification (full body, blue-green pulse pattern) — kept covered. No other mods.', N'Rises with the caravan, manages the morning water filtration cycle, walks the daily route, maintains the rig during rest stops, monitors weather for precipitation opportunities.', N'Ashima Rahman, 168cm lean water-worker, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones blending South Asian and East Asian heritage, clean-shaven face with rounded cheekbones and angular East Asian eye definition, light grey eyes observant and distant, shoulder-length black hair loose, standing in slight forward lean. Wearing aged high-collared dark grey thermal undershirt and patched synthetic overjacket, heavy canvas work pants, scuffed utility boots, backpack frame permanently visible. Calloused hands with faint palm scars. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226, industrial water-filtration facility setting, cool fluorescent and bioluminescent ambient lighting casting subtle shadows, narrow DOF, documentary realism, neo-noir transient aesthetic, economical posture, measured and controlled presence --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grindstone Shore', N'local', N'Grindstone Shore', N'Predominantly South Asian ancestry (75%), with significant East Asian admixture (14.3%), complemented by Hispanic/Latin American (7.7%), Pacific Islander (1.8%), and minimal Northern European (1.2%) heritage. Phenotype reflects South Asian genetic dominance with nuanced East Asian influence: warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones characteristic of the Indian subcontinent, enriched by East Asian contributions creating subtle olive depth and amber warmth in shadows. Facial structure shows South Asian breadth in cheekbones and nose bridge, with East Asian angularity in eye shape and jawline definition. The modest Hispanic and Pacific Islander components add warmth and slight complexity to overall coloration without displacing the fundamental South Asian character.', 168, 62, N'Compact and wiry, lean muscle developed through repetitive labor — water-carrier''s physique with no excess mass. Shoulders slightly forward from years of backpack weight distribution.', N'Natural black, unmodified', N'Unstyled, worn loose and shoulder-length, often tied back with salvaged cord during work', N'Long', N'Light grey — a genetic anomaly he does not acknowledge when others comment on it', N'Warm medium brown with golden and amber undertones — characteristic of South Asian genetics with East Asian contribution. Sun-weathered from saltwater exposure but fundamentally rich and warm in tone.', N'Clean-shaven or sparse stubble, skin condition shows weathering from sun and saltwater exposure but well-maintained. Facial structure reflects South Asian dominance with East Asian definition: rounded cheekbones and broader nose bridge from South Asian heritage, with angular eye shape and jawline definition from East Asian admixture. No visible scarring on the face. Expression typically neutral, eyes observant rather than engaged.', N'None typically visible. The full-body bioluminescent mod is deliberately concealed under layered, high-necked garments. Only visible if clothing is removed or severely compromised.', N'Stands with slight forward lean, as if perpetually ready to shoulder burden. Moves deliberately and quietly, economical gestures. Walking pace is measured — he counts steps. Breath shallow, movements controlled. Rarely makes sudden motions.', N'Tier 4-5 transient aesthetic. High-collared thermal undershirts in dark grey or black (bioluminescence concealment priority). Worn synthetic overjackets with multiple patch repairs, water-resistant but aged. Heavy canvas work pants with tool pockets and reinforced seams. Scuffed utility boots rated for wet terrain. Backpack frame is visible constantly — not removed indoors or at rest. No jewelry or ornament. Clothing layers suggest preparedness for weather change rather than style.', N'He still has a copy of the biometric update document. He has never been able to read it all the way through. He tells himself this is because it''s too long. It is actually because he is afraid that if he reads it and it was harmless, he will not be able to continue.', N'Minimal, precise, often gives information in numbers rather than descriptions', N'Slow and even, long pauses that are not uncomfortable to him but often are to others', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ashima_rahman');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a684-7e8f-82f4-31da12426a65', N'Leif Holm-Nwosu', N'Leif', N'', N'Holm-Nwosu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Fort Anchor, The Rampart deployment zone, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Riot Suppression Specialist, Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division', N'', N'Leif Holm-Nwosu is built like a structural support column — six feet of dense muscle, mahogany skin cross-hatched with old scorch scarring along her left jaw and collarbone from a crowd dispersal incident she doesn''t discuss. Her geneware irises cycle through amber and deep violet depending on her stress levels, a mod she got cheap and has never bothered upgrading despite the involuntary emotional readout it provides. Her hair is shorn close on the sides and kept natural on top, threaded with thin copper filaments that catch the light. Off-duty she moves slowly, almost gently, like something very large trying not to break things. On the line she becomes geometry — economical, angular, purposeful.

She is not cruel but she has made her peace with force. She genuinely believes in the maintenance of order as a social good, in the same way a levee believes in holding back water. What she doesn''t examine closely is the question of who decides what ''order'' means and whose chaos gets suppressed. She treats rookies with patient seriousness, older cynics with wary respect, and her commanding officers with a politeness that has no warmth in it at all.', N'Authority figure and moral obstacle; can become reluctant ally if players demonstrate they share her concern for civilian protection; source of Arcturus Civil Security intel and internal politics; represents the complicated humanity inside institutions', N'', N'Subdermal impact mesh (torso and forearms, Arcturus Civil Security-issued), geneware patterned irises (amber/violet stress-reactive), bone-density microlattice in wrists and knuckles (elective, paid out-of-pocket)', N'Rotates between three-day deployment cycles at Fort Anchor and stand-down periods in her shared quarters at the Rampart barracks; spends stand-down time lifting, maintaining her gear, and making offerings to the E.L.F. she believes inhabits her department-issue riot shield.', N'Leif Holm-Nwosu, 183cm tall densely muscular woman, golden-bronze skin with warm undertones reflecting East Asian, Northern European, Sub-Saharan African and South Asian heritage. Broad prominent cheekbones with East Asian geometry, strong defined jawline, full facial structure. Natural black hair with copper threading in geometric patterns, undercut style. Geneware-modified irises amber with violet undertones, catching light unnaturally. Extensive cross-hatched thermal scarring along left jawline and collarbone, silvered and raised. Visible subdermal impact mesh forming geometric patterns on muscular forearms when tensed. Wearing Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security Riot Control Unit 7 tactical gear—gray ballistic mesh undershirt, charcoal reinforced pants with cargo pockets, navy raid jacket with reflective piping, steel-toed scuffed boots. Standing in controlled posture, geometric precision, weight distributed wide. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, tactical lighting casting shadows across scarred features, photorealistic, professional security force aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Fort Anchor', N'local', N'Fort Anchor', N'Mixed heritage reflecting a complex global ancestry: Northern European (32.7%), East Asian (27.7%), Sub-Saharan African (20.7%), South Asian (11.7%), Middle Eastern (4.8%), and Hispanic/Latin American (2.4%). Her phenotype is a striking synthesis—Northern European bone structure blends with East Asian facial geometry, deepened and warmed by Sub-Saharan African and South Asian ancestry. The combination creates a distinctive appearance with broad cheekbones, strong jawline, and warm golden-bronze skin that reflects the convergence of multiple continental genetic lines. Her facial structure shows East Asian eye shape and cheekbone prominence, married to a stronger jawline from Northern European heritage, with the full facial depth and richer undertones of Sub-Saharan African and South Asian ancestry.', 183, 91, N'Densely muscular, powerfully proportioned—broad shoulders and thickened forearms from years of riot control work. No excess adipose; every kilogram is functional mass. Her frame reads as deliberate engineering rather than natural athleticism.', N'Natural black with copper filament threading', N'Undercut—sides shorn to 3mm, top kept at 4-5cm and combed back, the copper threads woven through the longer sections in geometric patterns', N'Short on sides, medium on top', N'Geneware-modified irises: amber baseline, cycling to deep violet under stress or elevated cortisol', N'Golden-bronze with warm undertones—a nuanced blend reflecting her Northern European, East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian heritage. The tone is warm and luminous, with depth and complexity from the multi-continental mix, despite weathering from years of environmental exposure.', N'Weathered by years of exposure to dispersal agents and environmental stress. Skin is clear but thick-textured with a distinctive face reflecting her mixed ancestry—broad cheekbones with slight prominence characteristic of East Asian genetics, strong jawline sharpened by Northern European heritage, and full facial structure deepened by Sub-Saharan African and South Asian ancestry. Her left jaw and collarbone bear prominent scorch scarring in cross-hatched patterns—old thermal weapon residue, poorly healed, never treated cosmetically. The scars pull slightly when she clenches.', N'Subdermal impact mesh visibly ridges under her skin on forearms and torso when she tenses—faint geometric grid pattern becomes apparent under strong light. Her knuckles are subtly oversized, joint architecture altered by bone-density microlattice (visible only to someone who knows what to look for). The geneware irises are immediately noticeable: their color-shift is smooth but uncanny, and they catch light differently than natural eyes.', N'Off-duty: moves with deliberate slowness, each motion controlled and economical, as though constantly managing her own mass. Shoulders slightly rounded, as though the weight of her frame is always present in her awareness. On-duty: shifts into geometric precision—spine vertical, weight distributed across a wider stance, all movement purposeful and angular. Her head turns from the neck rather than the shoulders. She doesn''t fidget.', N'On-duty: Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security Riot Control Unit 7 tactical gear—ballistic mesh undershirt (gray), reinforced duty pants (charcoal, multiple cargo pockets), steel-toe boots (scuffed, maintained). Raid jacket over torso (navy with reflective piping and unit insignia). Helmet stores clipped to equipment belt. Off-duty: plain, durable clothing—black or gray t-shirts (usually oversized), worn canvas work pants, steel-toed boots (kept polished). A faded Rampart barracks hoodie in charcoal. She owns nothing fashionable. Everything is functional, tier 3-4 utilitarian.', N'During the Hough Reclamation riots three years ago, she held her line while a medic trying to reach a collapsed protester was pushed back by her unit. The protester died. The official report says the medic was never there. She still has the medic''s badge number memorized.', N'Clipped, institutional, but precise — she knows the exact right word and uses it without decoration. Occasionally slips into older Yoruba-inflected phrases when emotional.', N'Slow and deliberate, like she''s issuing orders even when she isn''t. Long pauses before answering questions.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'leif_holm_nwosu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ec-7d9f-8a61-320631984907', N'Guiren Kowalczyk', N'Guiren', N'', N'Kowalczyk', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenosha Crossing transit hub, Ferrogate Transit Security post C-7, near outside the Pulaski Gate', N'Ferrogate Transit Security Officer, Kenosha Crossing hub', N'Ferrogate Transit Authority, Security Division', N'Guiren Kowalczyk is broad-shouldered and soft-faced, with warm dark brown skin, a close beard that he keeps meticulously trimmed, and geneware cat ears — tawny, tipped with white — that he got at nineteen with three months of saved wages and has never regretted. The ears move expressively and he is bad at hiding it: they fold back when he is nervous, swivel toward sounds he is trying to catch. He is in good shape but carries himself with a slight forward hunch, as if bracing against weather, which is his default posture when he is uncertain about something — which is often.

He is three years into the Ferrogate Transit Security job and he still hasn''t decided if it suits him or if he suits it. He is genuinely kind, which creates problems at Kenosha Crossing — a major hub where the desperate, the unhoused, the fare-evaders, and the genuinely dangerous all move through the same turnstiles. His supervisor tells him to be consistent. His instincts tell him to be human. Most days he finds a middle ground that satisfies neither. He prays to the Kenosha E.L.F. — a transit spirit locals call Corrigan — leaving small data packets of safe-passage wishes before his shift. He was raised with E.L.F. devotion and wears it without embarrassment.', N'Local color, unexpected ally, information source about transit patterns and who moves through the hub. His position at a major transit interchange means he has seen nearly everyone who passes through this part of the city. His fundamental decency makes him an asset to people who treat him well.', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (tawny/white, fully expressive). Standard-issue Ferrogate subvocal comm unit. No additional augmentation — he keeps putting off the enhanced perception package because the application requires a three-year lock-in contract.', N'Takes the 0530 transit from his shared flat in Avon Curve to Kenosha Crossing, does a shift handover, and spends ten hours managing the C-7 concourse — crowd flow, fare disputes, the occasional medical situation. Gets lunch from the Ghanaian-Austrian fusion cart on the lower level that his coworker Demi runs on the side.', N'GLMZ, Guiren Kowalczyk, a 182cm broad-shouldered transit security officer with warm medium tan skin and soft, rounded facial features reflecting blended Eastern European, Hispanic, Middle Eastern, and South Asian ancestry. Short black hair, warm brown eyes, meticulously trimmed beard. Tawny and white articulate geneware cat ears mounted expressively on his head, ears swiveling with alertness. Ferrogate Transit Authority uniform: charcoal gray tactical pants, reinforced black composite boots, gray security shirt with FTA insignia, lightweight reflective transit vest. Protective forward hunch posture, cautious expression with warm concern rather than hardness. Standing in a Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone transit hub, neon signage reflected in polished floor surfaces, cool blues and amber lighting. Deliberate, measured stance. Modest, utilitarian aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenosha Crossing transit hub', N'local', N'Kenosha Crossing transit hub', N'Eastern European (35.6%) forms the genetic foundation, substantially blended with Hispanic/Latin American (22.6%), Middle Eastern (19.9%), South Asian (16.8%), and Southeast Asian (5.1%) ancestry. This creates a warm, balanced phenotype where no single heritage dominates—a true genetic mosaic of the Ubiquitous Diaspora, resulting in soft facial geometry with rounded contours, warm earth-toned coloring, and features that don''t resolve into any single regional category.', 182, 84, N'Broad-shouldered and solidly muscled from transit security work, but without the hard definition of someone who optimizes their body. Carries himself with a slight forward hunch, a protective posture that reads as cautious rather than confident.', N'Black, natural', N'Short, neat, closely cropped with clean lines — maintained but not obsessive', N'Short', N'Warm brown, natural', N'Warm medium tan with golden-amber undertones—the result of balanced blending across Eastern European, Hispanic/Latin American, Middle Eastern, and South Asian ancestry, with subtle Southeast Asian warmth beneath. Not dark, not light, but a harmonious middle ground that suggests no single heritage.', N'Soft-featured face with rounded contours influenced equally by South Asian and Southeast Asian heritage mixed with Eastern European bone structure and Hispanic warmth. Youthful despite three years of transit hub stress. Close-trimmed beard kept meticulously neat, suggesting attention to grooming as a form of control. Warm expression that tends toward concern rather than hardness. Gentle cheekbones, a rounded jawline that softens his square shoulders. No visible acne or major scarring.', N'Tawny and white geneware cat ears that move expressively with his emotional state. Subvocal comm unit barely visible as a faint subcutaneous line along the left side of his jaw. No chrome, no visible armor, no obvious combat augmentation.', N'Default posture is a slight forward hunch, as if bracing against weather or uncertainty. Movements are deliberate rather than fluid — he doesn''t sprawl or take up unnecessary space. His ears swivel toward sounds he''s trying to catch, and fold back when nervous, revealing his emotional state involuntarily. His gait is steady and measured, suited to crowd navigation.', N'Ferrogate Transit Authority uniform (Tier 3-4 working class standard): charcoal gray tactical pants with cargo pockets, black composite boots with reinforced soles, gray button-up security shirt with FTA insignia on the shoulder. Over it a lightweight reflective transit vest for visibility in the hub. Personal layer: a simple pendant or small charm related to E.L.F. devotion worn under the uniform, removed or hidden during shift but present in his off-hours. Off-duty: clean, modest clothing — no affectation or luxury goods, the wardrobe of someone who saves money for things that matter (like geneware ears).', N'He has a standing arrangement with a woman who sleeps in the C-7 utility alcove — he pretends not to see her, she keeps an eye on the area and alerts him via anonymous ping if anything goes wrong. He has never reported her and never filed the alcove as a cleared zone. It works. It is also a terminable offense.', N'Everyday, direct, occasionally apologetic in phrasing even when he isn''t sorry — a politeness habit. Drops into Twi-inflected rhythms when comfortable, switches to clipped professional language when stressed.', N'Medium pace, tends to trail off when he''s deciding something mid-sentence. Finishes other people''s sentences in his head but rarely out loud.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'guiren_kowalczyk');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a717-797e-b019-32b2fbf81ef5', N'Hinano Masoe', N'Hinano', N'', N'Masoe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 54, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Meridian Station — central transit nexus, neutral ground, near State and Madison', N'Corporate espionage and data exfiltration — data thief', N'Independent — Narrows-based operations', N'Hinano Masoe is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 54, she has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate her once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — cranial bomb defuser — specialized implant that detects and neutralizes cortex b — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She taught herself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know her best. She works as a data thief out of Meridian Station, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Hinano Masoe lacks in subtlety, she compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'Vuk Edlund-Gyan functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Cranial bomb defuser — specialized implant that detects and neutralizes cortex bombs in others. Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Hinano Masoe, 168cm stocky muscular woman with warm golden-brown skin blending Pacific Islander, Northern European, Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, and Middle Eastern ancestry. Steel gray hair pulled back in tight braid, deep brown alert eyes. Lined weathered face with wide cheekbones, robust jawline, subtle Eastern European angularity, full lips, scarred upper lip. Thin white surgical scar from left temple to cheekbone. Large scarred hands with burn patches. Exposed dark titanium cranial implant at base of skull with fine scarring. Faded black circuit board tattoo on right forearm. Wearing dark reinforced synthweave cargo jacket, black tactical pants with knee reinforcement, scuffed industrial boots, gray undershirt at collar, worn chronometer on left wrist. Economical posture, weight on balls of feet, alert scanning gaze. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody industrial lighting, standing ready with tactical awareness, no-nonsense presence --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Station', N'local', N'Meridian Station', N'Pacific Islander dominant (50.6%) with Northern European (21.2%), Sub-Saharan African (14.8%), Eastern European (10.3%), and Middle Eastern (3.1%) ancestry. The genetic mix creates a warm golden-brown complexion with Pacific Islander bone structure and fullness, brightened by Northern European undertones, deepened by African heritage, and subtle Eastern European angularity in the cheekbones.', 168, 78, N'Stocky and solid, muscular through the shoulders and torso with a low center of gravity. Hands are large-knuckled and scarred, built for precision and force. No excess fat, but thick-boned and dense.', N'Steel gray with natural dark roots showing', N'Pulled back in a tight, utilitarian braid, no vanity in the arrangement', N'Medium', N'Deep brown with alert, assessing quality', N'Warm golden-brown with olive undertones, weathered by age and exposure. The tone reflects the dominant Pacific Islander ancestry with luminous warmth, deepened by Sub-Saharan African heritage, and subtle cool undertones from Northern and Eastern European genetic contribution.', N'Lined face, crow''s feet and forehead creases that map decades of squinting at screens and problems. Bone structure shows Pacific Islander influence in wide cheekbones, full facial features, and robust jawline proportion, with subtle Eastern European angularity and African heritage in facial width and lip fullness. Scarred upper lip from an old break. Jawline still strong. Minimal makeup, rough-groomed.', N'Chrome cranial implant visible at the base of her skull where the synthetic port connects — a dark titanium-grade insert roughly the size of a thumbnail, deliberately left exposed. The surrounding scalp tissue shows fine scarring from the installation. No effort to conceal it.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Stands with weight balanced on the balls of her feet, ready to shift. Eyes constantly scanning. Her hands rest palms-down on tables, never crossed. When seated, she takes the chair with the best sightline to the door.', N'Tier 3 utilitarian: dark reinforced synthweave jacket with cargo pockets, many of them loaded and zipped. Black tactical pants with knee reinforcement and thigh pockets. Scuffed boots rated for industrial environments. A gray undershirt visible at the collar. No logos, no affectation, no jewelry except a worn chronometer on her left wrist. Everything functional, nothing decorative.', N'Vuk Edlund-Gyan maintains a second identity — a completely clean civilian persona with a lease, a job history, and a social profile. It''s their exit strategy.', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hinano_masoe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a667-7ff6-9b22-3306b9951eab', N'Devika Haraldsen', N'Devika', N'', N'Haraldsen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 71, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Block 9 — ground-floor unit beneath a noodle stand, near Kedzie and Division', N'Corporate Wars veteran, Tier 1 pension-dependent, informal block protector', N'Zheng-Dao Veterans Assistance Network (nominal; rarely attends meetings); Block 9 informal community; independent', N'Devika Haraldsen is a large man running to softness at the edges now, though the frame underneath still speaks of someone who was once built for war. His face is a geography of old decisions — a burn scar that covers the left side of his jaw and neck in pale, slightly lustrous skin; a nose broken enough times to have given up on its original shape; eyes that are a startling light grey, inherited from his Azerbaijani grandmother and striking against his dark complexion. His right arm from elbow to fingertip is military-grade prosthetic, matte black Ferrogate chassis, the joints worn smooth by twenty years of civilian use. He keeps it clean but unpainted, which on the Gray Zone reads as a kind of statement.

He has the personality of a load-bearing wall — he does not move, but things lean on him. He is profoundly uncomfortable with gratitude, deflects compliments with flat humor, and will help anyone in Block 9 with anything practical: fixing plumbing, sitting with someone who is frightened, walking an elderly neighbor home. He was a Zheng-Dao contract soldier for eleven years and does not discuss this except obliquely, in fragments that surface when he''s had enough synthetic lager. He prays nightly to the E.L.F. he believes lives in the block''s power-cycling unit, leaving small data-offerings — usually recordings of things that happened on the block that day. He calls it ''keeping the spirit informed.''', N'Street-level security anchor and neighborhood watchman; source of Corporate Wars history and ground-truth information about the Gray Zone''s power dynamics; can serve as reluctant muscle or community conscience in stories; his veteran''s network connections can surface unexpected leads.', N'', N'Military-grade Ferrogate right arm prosthetic (full replacement from elbow, standard infantry model, 20+ years old). Subdermal trauma-response regulator in the chest — dampens adrenaline spikes, civilian-converted from military spec. Faint bioluminescent gene-mod on his remaining fingertips, pale blue, which he got on a dare from his daughter fifteen years ago and has kept because she likes it.', N'Wakes at 0430 out of habit, does slow deliberate exercises on his small balcony while watching the block come alive below him; buys one coffee from the noodle stand above him (the owner always charges him half price, he always insists on paying full, they have done this for twelve years); spends much of the day in a folding chair near the block entrance, apparently doing nothing, actually watching everything.', N'Devika Haraldsen, 188cm tall man with deep warm brown skin (Southeast Asian-Sub-Saharan African diaspora blend), dark grey cropped hair, dark brown eyes. Weathered face with extensive pale burn scar running down left jaw and neck, crooked broken nose, fine cheekbones. Right arm military-grade black Ferrogate prosthetic from elbow down with faint blue bioluminescent fingertips. Wearing worn black synthetic leather military-cut jacket over layered thermal base and muted workshirt, grey-brown thermal cargo pants with reinforced knees, steel-toed work boots. Thin data-tether bracelet on left wrist. Seated motionless in shadows, completely still, patient and displacing presence. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, dim interior lighting emphasizing scar tissue and prosthetic wear, no unnecessary chrome or status wear, quiet dignity of someone at peace with hard choices. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Southeast Asian (45.7%), Sub-Saharan African (35.5%), South Asian (9.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (6.0%), Middle Eastern (3.5%)—a complex diaspora blend resulting in warm deep brown skin with subtle golden and bronze undertones, fine-featured facial structure with Southeast Asian delicacy balanced against Sub-Saharan depth, South Asian warmth, and hints of Middle Eastern angularity', 188, 94, N'Large-framed, formerly muscular, now carrying soft weight at the midsection and shoulders—the body of someone who was once built for combat but has settled into sedentary age. Still carries the structural density underneath', N'Dark grey with residual black undertones', N'Kept short and neat, cropped close to the scalp', N'Short', N'Dark brown, warm and observant', N'Deep warm brown with subtle golden and bronze undertones, rich with Sub-Saharan depth blended with Southeast Asian smoothness and South Asian warmth', N'Weathered and marked. Left side of jaw and neck covered by a pale, slightly lustrous burn scar that reads as old trauma. Nose broken multiple times, crooked and asymmetrical. Hands show age spots and calluses. Face carries the gravity of someone who has made hard choices and made peace with them. Fine cheekbones and defined facial structure inherited from Southeast Asian ancestry, with strength from Sub-Saharan lineage, South Asian warmth in the undertones, and subtle Middle Eastern angularity around the brow ridge', N'Right arm prosthetic from elbow to fingertip: military-grade Ferrogate chassis, matte black, unpainted, joints worn smooth by twenty years of civilian use. Subdermal trauma-response regulator is not visible, but the way he breathes—controlled, deliberate, even when tense—suggests it', N'Sits more than he stands. When seated, he is completely still—a load-bearing stillness, patient and immovable. When he moves, it is deliberate and economical, no wasted motion. His gait is slightly favored on his left leg. He does not gesture much. His presence is quiet but displacing—people unconsciously orient toward him', N'Tier 3 practical wear, maintained well but without pretense. Thermal-weave cargo pants in grey-brown, reinforced at knees and cuff. Layered shirts—usually a base thermal under a loose, faded workshirt or pullover in muted colors (navy, charcoal, earth tones). Worn synthetic leather jacket in black, military-cut, no insignia. Steel-toed work boots, practical and broken in. A single piece of jewelry: a thin data-tether bracelet on his left wrist, civilian model, where he stores daily block recordings to leave at the power unit. No chrome, no status wear, nothing that suggests he needs to be anything other than what he is', N'In the final months of his Zheng-Dao contract, he participated in the demolition of a residential cluster in what is now Ironvein to clear land for a Zheng-Dao logistics hub. He told himself they gave the residents warning. He knows how much warning they gave.', N'Economical, slightly formal in structure, occasionally drops military shorthand. Uses full sentences even when shorter options exist, as though he learned to speak carefully after a period of not speaking at all.', N'Slow, deliberate. Comfortable with silence in a way that makes other people uncomfortable.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'devika_haraldsen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65a-7c06-a816-337e996740ab', N'Franco Raghavan', N'Franco', N'', N'Raghavan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spire, near Michigan Ave and Chicago Ave', N'Senior urban systems designer, The Spire — infrastructure division', N'The Spire — Infrastructure Division (senior level); private, unaffiliated conscience operating in parallel', N'Franco Raghavan is the kind of person who has designed the systems that keep other people alive without ever having met those people. She is mixed French-Nigerian, lean and angular, with close-cropped natural hair and the particular stillness of someone whose mind is always several steps ahead of the room. She dresses in structured, expensive minimalism — the corporate elite aesthetic of someone who wants to signal power through restraint — and wears a full-forearm neural interface sleeve on her right arm that she rarely removes even in social settings. Her office on the forty-second floor of The Spire looks out over the entire city, a view she has described in internal documents as ''operationally useful'' and has never once described as beautiful.

Mireille designs the infrastructure of GLMZ — water reclamation routing, power grid distribution, transit corridor optimization, environmental filtration zoning. She is extraordinarily good at this work. She is also the person who decides, through the dry mathematics of resource allocation, which districts receive redundant systems and which receive single points of failure. the Gray Zone has exactly one filtration node. Old Harbor''s power grid has a designed load ceiling that ensures brownouts during peak demand. These are not accidents. They are her work, signed off with her credentials, rationalized through efficiency models she wrote herself.

She entered the corporate track from a scholarship program at seventeen, having grown up in a mid-tier Circuit neighborhood that has since been rezoned into a logistics hub. She has not been back. She has told herself many things about what that means. She has a partner she sees on weekends, a curated social life within The Spire''s residential tier, and a locked private project folder on her workstation that she opens at 2 a.m. when she can''t sleep, containing infrastructure redesigns for the city as it could exist — equitable, redundant, built for the people who actually live in it. She has never submitted any of it.', N'Corporate conscience and systemic antagonist — Mireille embodies the banality of infrastructural violence and the specific paralysis of people who know better and have not yet chosen. She provides a corporate-tier perspective with genuine moral complexity, a potential ally or obstacle depending on when players encounter her, and a fulcrum point between institutional power and street-level consequence.', N'', N'Full right-arm neural interface sleeve: direct haptic link to infrastructure modeling systems, allows real-time grid visualization and data manipulation (corporate-issued, maintained to spec),Cognitive load-balancing implant: regulates attention allocation and reduces decision fatigue during complex multi-variable analysis (standard Spire executive package)', N'Mireille''s days are structured to the quarter-hour. She arrives at her office before most of her division, reviews overnight system reports with coffee she makes herself rather than ordering from the floor service, and spends the first ninety minutes in what she calls ''clean time'' — unscheduled, uninterrupted analysis. Meetings occupy her afternoons. She eats at her desk. She exercises in The Spire''s residential gym at 7 p.m. with the precision of someone managing a maintenance schedule. On weeknights she reviews her workload and sleeps efficiently. At 2 a.m., when she wakes — which is most nights — she opens the folder and works on the city that doesn''t exist until she is tired enough to stop.', N'Portrait of Franco Raghavan, 172cm tall, lean angular build, woman of blended Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, Northern European, and Indigenous American ancestry. Deep warm brown skin with golden undertones and natural luminosity. Pronounced cheekbones, defined nose bridge, refined jawline. Short dark brown hair, precision-cut and symmetrical. Deep brown eyes with subtle faint luminescent augmentation markers visible in iris. Neutral analytical expression with fine lines around eyes from screen work. Matte gunmetal neural interface sleeve on right arm from wrist to elbow with embedded haptic nodes, frosted brushed aluminum texture. Subtle 3cm surgical scar barely visible along right temple. Dressed in structured corporate minimalism — high-end tailored charcoal monochromatic clothing, technical weave fabrics, no visible logos. Professional posture, stillness and efficiency. Minimal jewelry, thin minimalist watch on left wrist. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, corporate environment, cool clinical lighting emphasizing the intersection of her multifaceted genetic heritage and technological augmentation, professional power aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spire', N'local', N'The Spire', N'Sub-Saharan African (39.8%), South Asian (31.2%), Northern European (16.6%), and Indigenous American (12.4%) ancestry — a genuine genetic blend of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Her features reflect this complex multifaceted heritage: warm-toned bone structure with pronounced cheekbones showing Sub-Saharan and South Asian influence, a defined nose with subtle bridge elevation characteristic of South Asian ancestry, and refined jawline geometry that speaks to the interaction of all four genetic sources. The combination creates striking facial harmony with depth and dimensionality that speaks to authentic global ancestry.', 172, 59, N'Lean and angular, economical in movement — the build of someone whose body is managed like a system, no excess, efficient muscle distribution. Shoulders slightly forward from hours at workstations.', N'Natural dark brown, nearly black', N'Close-cropped, precision-cut, symmetrical', N'Short', N'Deep brown with subtle augmentation markers around the iris — the neural interface sleeve''s data feeds visible as faint luminescent traces during high-cognition states', N'Deep warm brown with luminous golden undertones, the result of blended Sub-Saharan African and South Asian heritage creating richness and depth, balanced with Northern European and Indigenous American ancestry. The skin tone carries natural luminosity and warmth across face and body.', N'Precise grooming, minimal makeup, skin kept in clinical condition through consistent care regimen. Fine lines around eyes from screen time and sustained concentration. No visible acne or skin texture variation — maintained to Tier 1 standards. Facial features show integrated blend of her ancestry: pronounced cheekbones with subtle fullness reflecting Sub-Saharan and South Asian genetic presence, straight nose with defined bridge, refined jawline with slight width suggesting Indigenous American heritage influence. Expression typically neutral or subtly analytical.', N'Full right-arm neural interface sleeve extending from wrist to elbow — matte gunmetal finish with embedded haptic nodes visible as slight surface irregularities. The sleeve''s texture resembles frosted brushed aluminum. No LED indicators or ostentatious design; purely functional aesthetic. Occasionally visible faint luminescence running through embedded data pathways when actively linked to infrastructure systems, but typically dormant in social settings. The sleeve remains visible even in formal corporate wear, suggesting deliberate choice to display her technical capability rather than conceal it.', N'Stillness as a baseline — she occupies space efficiently, minimal extraneous movement. When she moves, it is precise and purposeful. Her right arm moves with slight mechanical precision when interfaced, micro-adjustments to finger positioning for data manipulation. She stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders back but not rigid. In meetings, she sits still for extended periods, hands positioned to minimize distraction. Her gaze is often distant — processing information layers invisible to others.', N'Structured corporate minimalism — Tier 1 aesthetic of power through restraint. Typically: high-end monochromatic pieces (charcoal, black, off-white, deep navy), tailored fit emphasizing her lean frame. Expensive fabrics with subtle texture (linen blends, technical weaves). No logos, no visible branding beyond discrete designer tags. Her right arm''s neural sleeve is left fully visible — no attempt to conceal it beneath jacket cuffs, suggesting it is integrated into her professional presentation rather than hidden. Footwear is functional and precise (minimal heels, professional flats, always immaculate). No jewelry beyond a thin watch on her left wrist with a minimalist face. Her clothing suggests someone who views dress as a communication system — her message is competence and efficiency, not status display.', N'', N'Systems language bleeding into personal speech — ''load-bearing,'' ''redundancy,'' ''cascade failure,'' ''node'' used metaphorically; precise, technical, occasionally lapsing into a more lyrical register when her guard is down', N'Controlled and efficient in professional settings, with sentences that arrive fully formed. In rare unguarded moments, she speaks in longer, more searching clauses, as if thinking aloud for the first time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'franco_raghavan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a654-775d-94a7-3388f93c6c05', N'Devansh Soriano-Srisai-Anang', N'Devansh', N'', N'Soriano-Srisai-Anang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower loading docks, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Lower Dock Crew leader — Prologue survivor. Lost his right arm.', N'Lower Dock Crew (leader)', N'Devansh Soriano-Srisai-Anang in the Grind layer of the Gray Zone, son of a cargo platform supervisor who drank himself to death after a Kessler-Dyne automation wave eliminated his entire shift. Marcus inherited two things: his father''s loading dock connections and his father''s conviction that the world owes you nothing and you take what you can carry. He built the Lower Dock Crew from six displaced cargo workers who realized that controlling dock access was more profitable than working the docks. He has a seven-year-old son named Eli who lives with Marcus''s ex-partner, Danae, three tiers up. Marcus sends money every week. He has never missed a payment. He tells himself the crew is how he provides. The truth is more complicated.

Kyle removed his right arm at the shoulder socket. The replacement is a Tier 1 surplus unit that clicks when he extends it and has a two-second lag on fine motor control. He has chrome-plated it because Marcus Bellamy has always believed that looking strong and being strong are the same thing. They are not. He is learning this slowly.

He keeps upgrading after every encounter with Kyle — more chrome, better hardware, heavier plating. It never helps. He is a man trying to solve a software problem with hardware, and the recurring joke of his appearances is that each time he has less original biology and more machine, and each time it matters less.', N'Comic relief through escalating failure. The recurring joke: a man who keeps adding hardware to solve a software problem. Each encounter with Kyle leaves him with less original body. The reader tracks his transformation from threatening to pathetic to accidentally sympathetic.', N'', N'Tier 1 surplus right arm (replacement). Sub-dermal jaw plating (new, after Kyle). Chrome-plated knuckles on remaining hand. Knee brace (left, after hand cannon).', N'Runs the dock crew. Plans revenge he''ll never execute. Shops for chrome upgrades.', N'GLMZ character portrait of Devansh Soriano-Srisai-Anang, a 183cm mixed-heritage man with deep warm brown skin blending Southeast Asian bone structure with broader Indigenous American and Latin American features, enriched by Sub-Saharan African heritage. Dark brown hair graying at temples, short and unkempt. Bloodshot dark eyes, weathered face with permanent stress lines, three-day stubble. Left side of jaw shows faint metallic sheen from sub-dermal plating. Chrome-plated right arm replacement with crude servo hand gleaming under harsh lighting. Dense functional muscle on left side softening at middle. Visible scars: jagged white scar from right shoulder blade down back, burn scar on left forearm, thin white line through left eyebrow. Tattoo visible on left pectoral showing anchor with ''ELI'' below. Wearing heavy canvas work pants, reinforced cargo vest over black compression shirt, scuffed steel-toed boots, and long weather-beaten synthetic leather coat. Chrome-knuckle reinforcement visible on left hand. Left knee brace with visible struts. Tense posture, weight favoring left side. Gritty Tier 4 setting, LED lighting casting sharp shadows, emphasizing exhaustion and cybernetic augmentation. Mood: wary, sleep-deprived, perpetually ready for conflict. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex diaspora blend with Southeast Asian (34.8%) as the foundational bone structure, substantially modified by Indigenous American (28.7%) and Hispanic/Latin American (21.9%) heritage that broadens his face and softens angularity. Sub-Saharan African ancestry (10.0%) deepens his skin tone to rich warm brown and contributes to eye depth and fuller lip structure. Eastern European traces (4.6%) add subtle angular definition to his jawline and orbital structure. The result is a genuinely multi-continental face that reads as no single origin — higher Southeast Asian cheekbones softened by broader Indigenous American facial width, warm golden-brown skin with Sub-Saharan depth, and fuller lips characteristic of Latin American and African heritage.', 183, 91, N'Broad-shouldered and muscular but running to seed — the kind of strength that''s already starting to soften at the middle from lack of sleep and too much stimulant coffee. His left arm is dense with functional muscle; his right side is all hardware.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples', N'Short, unkempt. He cuts it himself with a dull blade.', N'Short', N'Dark brown, bloodshot from chronic sleep debt', N'Deep warm tan — the blended result of Southeast Asian base, enriched and darkened by Indigenous American, Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Golden undertones catch light across cheekbones and jaw, creating a complexion that reads as genuinely multi-continental rather than any single origin.', N'Weathered and lined with fine creasing that speaks to mixed heritage and hard living. Three-day stubble is his default. Stress has carved permanent grooves from nose to mouth. His features carry Southeast Asian bone structure — higher cheekbones, slightly angular eye set — substantially broadened and softened by Indigenous American and Latin American influences, with Sub-Saharan African heritage deepening his complexion and contributing to fuller lips and slightly wider orbital spacing. His face is broader and rounder than pure Southeast Asian, with the characteristic lip fullness of African and Latin American ancestry. The gauntness of sleep deprivation pulls these features taut. His jaw is subtly swollen along the left side where sub-dermal plating sits just beneath the skin — visible as a faint metallic sheen under harsh light.', N'Chrome-plated right arm replacement ending in a functional but crude servo hand. The plating is aggressively polished, catching light. A faint clicking and whirring audible when he extends it. Sub-dermal jaw plating visible as a metallic sheen along the left mandible, most obvious in profile or under LED lighting. Chrome-knuckle reinforcement on his remaining left hand — four small chrome caps over the metacarpal joints, dull with frequent impact scarring. Left knee brace visible beneath clothing when he moves — a bulky aftermarket rig with visible struts and synthetic muscle fibers.', N'He moves like someone who''s always half-ready for a fight — shoulders slightly tensed, weight favoring his left side to compensate for the arm lag. His gait has a subtle hitch on the left (the knee). When he sits, his right arm rests awkwardly because the servo hand doesn''t relax naturally. He has a habit of clenching and unclenching his left fist. His eyes scan rooms. He doesn''t blink enough.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian with aspirational chrome touches. Heavy canvas work pants with reinforced pockets, synthetic blend cargo vest over a black compression shirt that shows his arm scars. Steel-toed boots, scuffed but maintained. A long coat — synthetic leather, weather-beaten — that he wears even in the climate-controlled the Gray Zone because it hides the arm. No jewelry except a faded wedding band on his left ring finger that he doesn''t talk about. Everything worn, patched, but kept functional.', N'The Morozov beating was ordered by someone above him. A Tessera middle manager named Oren Falk. Marcus was the tool, not the hand. He has never told his crew this.', N'Dock slang layered over a vocabulary that''s smarter than he lets on. Marcus reads — engineering manuals, mostly — but hides it.', N'Loud in front of the crew. Quiet when alone. The volume is performance.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'devansh_soriano_srisai_anang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c2-7beb-b7a8-3393a7acaf82', N'Chihiro Vasquez-Alfarsi', N'Chihiro', N'', N'Vasquez-Alfarsi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 64, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spires — mid-level corporate residential towers, near Michigan Ave and Oak', N'Cross-district contraband specialist — smuggler', N'Independent — Lattice territory specialist', N'Chihiro Vasquez-Alfarsi is average height but with a presence that fills more space than the body accounts for. At 64, there''s something unfinished about his face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains) — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left him with skills and night terrors in equal measure. He works as a smuggler out of The Spires, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In the runner community, Chihiro Vasquez-Alfarsi is known for getting the job done and not asking questions that would make the job harder to stomach.', N'Sagyn Ogawa-Twumasi functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains). Dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Chihiro Vasquez-Alfarsi, 172cm lean compact build, weathered face with multicontinental features: Middle Eastern bone structure, East Asian-refined cheekbones, African-warm skin depth, Hispanic expressiveness, Indigenous geometry. Warm golden-olive medium-tan complexion, warm in direct light with cooler olive shadows. Asymmetrical sharp cheekbones, set jaw, shallow creases from low-light squinting. Salt-and-pepper cropped military-cut hair, dark brown eyes with faint chromatic aberration left eye. Jagged scar temple-to-jaw (cortical bomb removal), pale and raised. Lattice scars across knuckles and forearms. Subtle chromatic shimmer dermal camouflage on neck and shoulders visible under neon. Pale crescent burn scar left wrist. Wearing dark charcoal tactical jacket Zenith brand, unmarked cargo pants, worn professional boots, aged leather long coat. Silver military ring left ring finger. Standing in GLMZ neon-lit corridor or shadowed street, economical posture, controlled tension, eyes tracking edges. GLMZ aesthetic, cool neon and warm practical lighting, gritty street-level atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spires', N'local', N'The Spires', N'Genuinely global Ubiquitous Diaspora phenotype: Hispanic/Latin American (30.9%) and Middle Eastern (27.5%) form the structural foundation with Middle Eastern bone architecture and facial proportions, enriched by Sub-Saharan African (12.3%) and East Asian (12.6%) ancestry contributing skin warmth, depth, and refined cheekbone/eye definition. Indigenous American (11.7%) ancestry visible in overall face geometry and subtle structural features, with Eastern European (5.0%) genetics adding undertone variation and greying patterns. This creates a genuinely multicontinental appearance — no single heritage dominates, instead creating a seamless synthesis where African warmth, East Asian refinement, Middle Eastern structure, Hispanic expressiveness, and Indigenous geometry blend into one coherent phenotype.', 172, 76, N'Lean and compact, muscle retention from military conditioning but not bulk — the kind of frame that moves efficiently rather than impressively. Shoulders slightly forward from decades of night work and low-light vigilance.', N'Salt-and-pepper grey, natural with darker undertones', N'Short, cropped military-style, minimal maintenance', N'Short', N'Dark brown, left eye with faint chromatic aberration from old augmentation removal', N'Warm medium-tan complexion with rich golden-olive undertones — a synthesis of Middle Eastern and Hispanic base enriched by African depth and East Asian luminosity. Burnished by irregular circadian cycles and street-level work. Shows warm golden tones in direct light with cooler olive undertones in shadow, creating subtle dimensional shifts across the face.', N'Weathered but not deeply lined. Face has an unfinished quality — asymmetrical, sharp cheekbones with Middle Eastern prominence refined by East Asian definition, jaw set in a way that suggests constant low-level tension. Shallow creases around eyes from squinting in low light. Skin texture uneven where dermal camouflage pigment cells cluster beneath the epidermis. Subtle warmth across cheekbones and bridge of nose from African and Hispanic ancestry blending with Middle Eastern structure, creating facial proportions that seamlessly reflect multiple continents.', N'Cortical bomb removal scar is the primary visible marker — unmistakable to anyone who knows what they''re looking at. Dermal camouflage creates subtle color-shift iridescence across exposed skin, especially under neon or harsh lighting — not obvious at first glance but noticeable if you''re looking. No obvious chrome limbs or external hardware; augmentations are embedded.', N'Economical movement — nothing wasted, nothing showy. Shifts weight forward slightly when standing still, as if ready to move in any direction. Eyes track edges and exits automatically. When sitting, occupies minimal space but radiates controlled tension. Handshake is firm but not aggressive. Speaks quietly; people lean in to listen.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear. Dark synthetic fibers — charcoal, black, dark grey — that don''t reflect light or show wear easily. Mid-grade tactical jacket with internal pockets (Zenith or Kessler brand), reinforced seams. Unmarked cargo pants with knife holsters on thighs. Boots are worn but maintained — professional grade, not flashy. No corpo logos, no faction colors. A single piece of jewelry: worn silver ring on left ring finger, military-issue design, never removed. Carries a long coat for The Spires'' climate-controlled corridors, aged leather with interior mesh lining.', N'Sagyn Ogawa-Twumasi murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chihiro_vasquez_alfarsi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019dd276-fca3-7230-81f5-33ef4d429bd0', N'Yuen-Pak', N'Yuen-Pak', N'', N'', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'', N'', N'', N'Auto-scaffolded. First mentioned: "The Yuen-Pak contract, she said. She said it the way you say the name of someone who died badly."', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'yuen_pak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-c1d5-e7f8-a92b-34068c150e4d', N'Pixel', N'Pixel', N'', N'', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'The Pivot — Unit 2E, 1554 W Chicago Ave / 801 N Ashland, West Town sector. Across the hall from Kyle.', N'Augment tech / Kyle''s neighbor and closest thing he has to a friend / the one across the hall who fills the silence / the protagonist of her own novella *The Door Is Unlocked* (5 chapters, separate book, set inside The Pivot''s broader ecosystem of neighbors — Auntie Hoa, Mr. Adamu, Mrs. Eldering, Maeve, the Reliquary, the brick-wall notebook)', N'Independent', N'Pixel is the kind of person who fills a space — not loudly, though she is loud, but completely. You know when she is home because you can hear it: music at a volume that should bother the neighbors more than it does, the clatter of something being tested or adjusted, the occasional bark of laughter at something only she found funny. The second floor of The Pivot has developed her presence the way a wall develops character from a picture that''s hung in the same spot for years.

She is 5''4", fair-skinned with scattered freckles across the nose and forearms, pale grey-blue eyes that notice things faster than she lets on. Her hair is a maintained pink — rose at the roots going to near-neon at the ends — that she touches up every three weeks with dye sourced from a woman in the Gray Zone who doesn''t ask questions. The natural color, visible at the roots if you look, is a tired dirty blonde that she decided at some point was not sufficient.

The clothes: enormous. Sweaters that reach her mid-thigh, that swallow her hands, that give her a shapeless outline — the silhouette of someone who does not want to be read. Cargo pants underneath that actually fit her, functional, pocketed. And the boots. Black steel-toed work boots, heavy enough to announce her footsteps, repaired so many times the sole is a patchwork of materials and the toe scuffed to near-silver. She calls them her shit kickers. She has had them since she was fourteen. They were not hers originally.

She is good with augments in the way some people are good with language — unconsciously, fluently, without having to think about the grammar of it. She learned from her mother, who was a field medic in the West Town–the Gray Zone corridor until she wasn''t anymore. After that, Pixel kept the tools and the knowledge and got better because getting better was the only available option. She has worked on Kyle more times than either of them would officially state. She extracts things with the same flat efficiency her mother used on strangers in the street. She calibrates Kyle''s NeoCortex hardware with salvaged instruments and diagnostic protocols she built herself from stolen corpo documentation, hunched over him under the ceiling light in Unit 2E, music turned down to something that only vibrates the walls. He does not say thank you. She does not require it.

The crush: yes. She is aware. She is also aware it is not going anywhere and has settled into this the way you settle into a chair you know the shape of. Kyle is not available in the ways that matter — not emotionally, not by choice, probably not even by accident. She loves him anyway, the way you love something fine that isn''t yours. It does not make her miserable. It makes her careful with him in ways he doesn''t notice and probably wouldn''t acknowledge if he did.

Her upbringing is not something she explains. She grew up fast, in the way children in the GLMZ grow up fast when someone who was supposed to be there stops being there. She is 23 and has lived in Unit 2E for six years, which means she arrived at seventeen, alone, with a toolkit she knew how to use and a pair of boots that were too big for her feet. The boots fit now.', N'Pixel is the argument that survival and warmth are not mutually exclusive. In a world that runs on attrition, she has maintained something — not optimism, not naivety, but presence. She chooses to be there, keeps choosing it, and this is either the most ordinary thing imaginable or the most radical act available depending on what you''ve been through.

For Kyle she is the proof that the code can be lived by someone who was never taught it — who arrived at it through surviving rather than training. She didn''t have a Seo. She didn''t have a program or a facility or a tradition. She had a mother who showed her how to keep someone alive, and a pair of boots, and the specific stubbornness of someone who decided to still be here.

She also poses the question the story cannot answer for him: what would it mean to let someone close enough to be lost? Kyle has kept everyone at the right distance. Pixel is across the hall. She is right there. The question is whether the proximity is the danger or the point.', N'', N'Hagen-Krupp WR-2 micro-gyrostabilizer, right wrist — a salvaged industrial unit she installed herself at nineteen after realizing her hands weren''t steady enough on long procedures. Imperceptible in daily movement; activates under fine motor demand. Makes her hands steady in ways that should not be possible given her caffeine intake and sleep schedule. Custom subdermal diagnostic port at the left wrist base — her own design, allows rapid attachment of diagnostic tools without fumbling for junctions. Tidier than the right wrist installation; she had more practice by then.', N'Mornings: coffee, loud music, something being taken apart. She takes two or three augment jobs a week from the informal network in the West Town–the Gray Zone corridor — calibrations, extractions, minor installs for people who can''t afford or won''t trust licensed cyberdocs. She charges what people can pay and keeps no records. Afternoons: components, salvage, tool maintenance. Evenings: more music, the particular peace of a small unit where everything has a place. She knocks on Kyle''s door sometimes. He opens it sometimes. This is her social life and she is not embarrassed about that.', N'Pixel, 23, compact fair-skinned woman with freckles across the nose and cheekbones, pale grey-blue eyes, shoulder-length pink hair (rose at roots to near-neon at ends, slightly uneven from self-cutting), wearing an enormous oversized heathered grey sweater reaching mid-thigh with sleeves swallowing her hands, dark cargo pants, heavy black steel-toed work boots scuffed to silver at the toe and visibly repaired at the sole. Small silver stud in left ear. Faint diagnostic port panel visible at left wrist. Standing in the doorway of a warm small apartment, one shoulder against the frame, relaxed and at ease, trace of loud music audible behind her. Warm practical interior lighting. GLMZ 2200 urban residential. Expression open and slightly amused — someone comfortable being exactly where she is. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'Modified Axiom Industries CV-9 Civic Taser — civilian unit pushed significantly past legal spec', N'The boots — steel-toed, weighted, she knows exactly how to use them', N'', N'', N'The Pivot — Unit 2E, 1554 W Chicago Ave / 801 N Ashland, West Town sector', N'Enormous sweaters without exception. Cargo pants that actually fit. The shit kicker boots. One small silver stud in the left ear she has had since she was twelve.', N'Coffee, black', N'', N'Caffeine only — she refuses pharmaceutical stimulants; she has seen what they do to people', N'', N'The Pivot — West Town / Circuit boundary', N'local', N'The Pivot — West Town / Circuit boundary', N'Northern European dominant (57%) with Eastern European (28%) and Southern European (15%). Fair-skinned, pale-eyed, freckled — the phenotype reads clearly European-descended without the complex blending of most GLMZ residents. In a city of layered ancestry she reads as simply and legibly pale, which she considers unremarkable.', 164, 57, N'Compact and unremarkable under the sweaters. Average frame, stronger in the forearms than the rest of her suggests. The hands are the tell — a field medic''s hands: precise, minor scarring, never entirely clean of something.', N'Maintained pink — rose-to-neon gradient, touched up every three weeks. Natural color: dirty blonde, visible at roots.', N'Shoulder-length, slightly uneven from self-cutting. Loose or pulled into a fast imprecise updo when working.', N'Medium', N'Pale grey-blue. Process faster than her expression suggests.', N'Fair with scattered freckles across nose bridge and forearms. Slight wind roughness across the cheeks from working in doorways and corridors.', N'Clear skin with the minor wear of someone who moves through indoor-outdoor environments. Freckles concentrated on nose and upper cheeks, scattered on forearms. No cosmetic work to the face.', N'Minimal. The gyrostabilizer junction is a small raised scar recognizable to anyone familiar with field installs. The diagnostic port at the left wrist is more visible — a flush matte-silver panel with two connector points. Both are tidy work, clearly self-done by someone who knew what they were doing.', N'Easy, unhurried, slightly too comfortable in other people''s spaces. Moves through The Pivot like she lives there, which she does. When working on augments: completely still, the casual looseness gone, something precise and quiet replacing it. When she enters an unfamiliar room she takes one look at the whole space before making eye contact with anyone in it.', N'Enormous oversized sweaters, always. Cargo pants underneath that fit. The shit kicker boots. One silver stud. She has not worn anything form-fitting in years. This is not accidental.', N'The boots were her mother''s. She has never told anyone. She arrived at The Pivot at seventeen with feet that hadn''t grown into them yet and has been resoling them ever since rather than replace them. When the leather finally fails she does not know what she will do. She has not let herself think about it. Layered underneath that secret: her forearms are mapped in horizontal scars from her early teens, the kind a person makes when the nights are too loud and the body is the only available surface. The cuts went up and down both arms in regular intervals — a record of the years between her mother''s death and her arrival at The Pivot. She stopped when she found the Tier 2 pharmaceutical sleep aid that quiets the nights. The scars are old now: pale, raised, organized. The enormous long-sleeve sweaters she wears in every season were not chosen for warmth. Anyone who has ever seen her arms uncovered would know what they were looking at; she has constructed a life in which that count is zero. She does not talk about either secret. The boots will outlast her if she lets them. The scars already have.', N'Plain and direct, with a technical precision that surfaces cleanly when she''s working. Profanity is functional vocabulary, not performance. She has a habit of naming the things she loves — the shit kickers, the good sweater, the quiet after a calibration holds — as if naming is a form of ownership that doesn''t require title. She talks about herself lightly, as a rule, even when the subject is heavy.', N'Quick but unhurried — she talks at the pace of someone who enjoys the conversation rather than someone trying to fill it. Pauses are natural. When she goes quiet mid-sentence something has landed. The silence after her laughter is the warmest part of her.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'pixel');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67c-7a2c-b3af-343a563f65c4', N'Debangshu Erikstad', N'Debangshu', N'', N'Erikstad', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, GLMZ — operates from a converted laundry unit at Burnside Pocket, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Street midwife and unlicensed obstetric care provider', N'Independent — loosely networked with Burnside Pocket community health cooperative', N'Debangshu Erikstad is a broad-shouldered woman with deep ochre skin mapped by a lifetime of hard work — her forearms are dense with old burn scars from a chemical incident she doesn''t discuss, and her hands are extraordinary: thick-knuckled, steady, perpetually chalked with the talc she uses to ease on examination gloves. Her hair is grown long and gathered in elaborate wrapping cloths she changes daily, a small vanity she insists upon. Bioluminescent threads have been tattooed along her collarbone in a pattern that pulses softly blue when her heart rate rises — a gift from a grateful patient who was a tattooist, and which Debangshu Erikstad considers mildly embarrassing but cannot bring herself to remove.

She is the gravitational center of three city blocks. Women come to her in the small hours, sometimes alone, sometimes holding each other up. Debangshu Erikstad never turns anyone away, works on a sliding scale that regularly bottoms out at zero, and maintains a mental ledger of every birth she has attended — over nine hundred. She has strong opinions about Helix Biosystems, none of them polite, and a practical theology around the E.L.F. she calls Thresholder, whom she believes watches over liminal moments: birth, death, the crossing between states. She leaves small data-offerings on a cracked tablet beside her examination table.', N'Community anchor and information node; knows the intimate secrets of hundreds of the Gray Zone families. Quest giver for anything involving missing mothers or children. Moral voice who challenges players'' ethical shortcuts.', N'', N'Bioluminescent pulse tattoo along collarbone (cosmetic, involuntary — gifted). Subdermal haptic pads on fingertips for enhanced tactile diagnostics — older model, partially degraded.', N'Rises before dawn to check on recent births and post-partum patients via encrypted message threads, spends afternoons doing prenatal checkups in her unit or in clients'' homes, and keeps irregular evening hours for emergencies — which means she rarely sleeps a full night.', N'Debangshu Erikstad, 172cm tall, broad-shouldered and muscular, medium warm bronze skin with golden undertones from integrated Northern European, Hispanic/Latin American, South Asian, and Southeast Asian ancestry. Long black hair with grey scattered throughout, wrapped in indigo cotton cloth with gold threadwork pulled back from her face. Deep brown eyes with yellowed sclera. Weathered face with strong cheekbones, defined jawline, deep expression lines around her eyes. Dense pale waxy burn scars covering both forearms from wrist to elbow. Subtle cyan and deep blue bioluminescent tattoo threading along collarbone, pulsing softly. Silver wedding band on left hand, blunt nails, callused fingertips from haptic augmentations. Wearing loose ochre linen tunic layered over black fitted leggings, comfortable scuffed slip-on shoes, long earth-tone cardigan covering scarred arms. Worn canvas satchel with visible pockets of medical supplies. Standing with even weight distribution, deliberate posture, hands naturally busy. GLMZ, GLMZ clinic setting, warm practical lighting, focused and present expression, pragmatic working-class aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Northern European foundation (48.7%) creates baseline bone structure and fair undertones, substantially enriched by Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (25.5%) contributing warm golden-bronze skin depth and fuller facial features, South Asian heritage (20.8%) adding definition to cheekbones and eye shape with deeper warm tones, and Southeast Asian ancestry (5.0%) contributing delicate refinement to facial proportions. The result is a genuinely multicultural phenotype: angular Northern European bone structure softened by Latin American warmth, complexion brightened by Southeast Asian delicacy, with South Asian depth creating striking contrast. This is not a pale baseline with additions—it is an integrated warm medium tone where all ancestries are visibly present.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and dense, with the squared musculature of someone who has done physical labor for decades. Not overweight — solid, grounded, built to endure. Her frame suggests the kind of strength that comes from years of lifting, supporting, holding.', N'Natural black with scattered grey threads left unhidden', N'Gathered in elaborate wrapping cloths that change daily — currently indigo cotton with gold threadwork, pulled back from her face to expose her full forehead', N'Long, shoulder-length when unwrapped', N'Deep brown, slightly yellowed at the sclera from age and fatigue', N'Medium warm bronze with golden undertones throughout—neither pale nor dark, but richly warm from the integrated blend of her ancestry. Sun-exposed and lived-in, suggesting years spent outdoors across diverse climates.', N'Weathered but not aged poorly—her face is lined with expression rather than sagging. Broad, balanced cheekbones with defined structure reflecting her mixed heritage blend, complemented by a defined jawline. Full mouth often pressed into a thin line of concentration. Deep creases around her eyes from years of squinting in poor light and smiling. Her skin shows the texture of someone who does not prioritize cosmetic maintenance; pragmatic, clean, lived-in.', N'The bioluminescent collarbone tattoo is her only visibly augmented feature — a soft blue pulse visible when her heart rate rises. Her subdermal haptic fingertip pads are not visible but her hands bear the callused marks of someone who has relied on them for decades: slightly thickened fingertips, minor discoloration at the pad sites, a faint granulation visible under close inspection. She keeps her nails trimmed blunt and wears no jewelry on her hands except a plain silver wedding band (worn by her late spouse).', N'Stands with her full weight distributed evenly, never leaning. Moves with deliberate slowness — economy of motion rather than tiredness. Her hands are always busy: gesturing, reaching, adjusting her head wraps. She has the stillness of someone trained to be present; when she stops moving to listen, the shift is noticeable. Her gait is steady but her shoulders sometimes roll forward from exhaustion.', N'Practical, Tier 4 working-class aesthetic with personal touches. Typically wears loose cotton or linen tunics in earth tones (ochre, burnt orange, deep green) layered over fitted black leggings. Comfortable slip-on shoes, often scuffed. A long cardigan or shawl worn for warmth and to cover her scarred arms when meeting new patients. She favors natural fabrics and muted colors — nothing flashy, nothing corpo-coded. Her head wraps are her only concession to vanity: they are always clean, always intentional, often patterned with geometric designs. No visible jewelry except her wedding band and occasionally small beaded bracelets made by patients'' children. She carries a worn canvas satchel with external pockets stuffed with latex gloves, swabs, and a battered tablet.', N'She lost a patient and infant twelve years ago to a complication she might have caught earlier if she hadn''t been exhausted from a triple shift. She told the family it was unpreventable. She has never told anyone the truth.', N'Warm and vernacular, mixes Igbo endearments with Tongan rhythmic phrases, medical terminology deployed precisely when needed and then immediately softened', N'Slow and deliberate, like she''s deciding each word has earned its place — accelerates only when directing emergency action', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'debangshu_erikstad');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a618-7863-b219-344f369e562b', N'Gwendoline Soriano-Ibarra', N'Gwendoline', N'', N'Soriano-Ibarra', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hyperlane rest stop at the Waukegan-Kenosha junction — a permanent-ish fixture at a rest station called the Mercy Flat, near Damen and Armitage', N'Expelled citizen turned hyperlane nomad and informal pastor', N'None formal. Spiritually affiliated with an informal network of road-pastors who coordinate via low-frequency radio and physical message drops.', N'Gwendoline Soriano-Ibarra is an old man in the way of someone who has been old since about forty-five — there is no particular brittleness to him, just a deep weathering. He is heavyset in the torso, his face a broad, lined map of Central Asian and Central African inheritance, with wide cheekbones, deep-set eyes that are nearly black, and a close-cropped white beard that he trims with impractical fastidiousness for someone who sleeps in a modified freight container. His geneware is old and partly degraded: he paid for subdermal bioluminescence in his forearms thirty years ago, when it was fashionable, and now it flickers irregularly — a slow pulse of blue-white light that stutters and catches depending on temperature and his emotional state. He treats this as a feature. He calls it his truth-light.

Gwendoline Soriano-Ibarra was a Sterling-Nakamura corporate ombudsman for twenty-two years — a man who formally heard worker complaints and formally ensured they went nowhere. He knows precisely what he was. He was expelled from his corponation citizenship seven years ago during a restructure, stripped of housing allocation and identity tier classification, and assigned UBC stipend status in a decision that took eleven minutes. He has been on the road since, moving between hyperlane rest stops and migrant encampments, conducting informal services for any spiritual tradition that wants him — E.L.F. prayer ceremonies, grief rituals, marriages that won''t be recognized anywhere official. He is not ordained by anything. He is here, which turns out to be most of what people need.', N'Moral anchor for migrant and transient communities. Confessor figure — people tell him things they tell no one else. Historical information source about Sterling-Nakamura''s internal practices. Can offer shelter, mediation, and community resources. Introduces themes of complicity, redemption, and institutional harm.', N'', N'Old subdermal bioluminescence mod (arms only, partially degraded, flickering). No other augmentations.', N'Wakes before the rest stop opens, conducts a brief personal ritual at the E.L.F. shrine he has built in the corner of his freight container. Available throughout the day for conversation, mediation, or ceremony. Cooks communal food when he has the ingredients. Maintains the road-pastor message network in the evenings.', N'Gwendoline Soriano-Ibarra, 178cm tall heavyset man with warm medium-brown complexion showing blended Latin American, Northern European, East Asian, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African features. Deeply lined weathered face with prominent angular cheekbones, fuller lips, broad nose bridge. Close-cropped white beard, near-black deep-set eyes. Short white close-cropped hair. Subdermal blue-white bioluminescent glow flickering beneath skin of both forearms, brightest at wrists. Pale 8cm scar along left jawline, age spots, industrial scarring. Wears faded gray reinforced technical shirt, heavy dark brown canvas coat patched at elbows, dark charcoal cargo trousers, scuffed military-grade steel-toed boots. Faded red textile cord bracelet on left wrist. Deliberate economical posture, settled presence. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. Standing in industrial shadow lighting, blue-white bioluminescence casting subtle glow on worn fabric. Quiet dignified bearing. Moody, contemplative. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hyperlane rest stop at the Waukegan-Kenosha junction', N'local', N'Hyperlane rest stop at the Waukegan-Kenosha junction', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (59.4%) with significant Northern European (18.5%), East Asian (9.1%), Southeast Asian (5.6%), and Sub-Saharan African (7.4%) ancestry. The genetic mosaic creates a distinctly cosmopolitan phenotype — warm Latin American base enriched by Northern European bone structure, East and Southeast Asian facial refinement, and Sub-Saharan depth. A living cartography of the Ubiquitous Diaspora expressed in flesh.', 178, 94, N'Heavyset through the torso and shoulders, broad-framed with slight thickening at the midsection — the build of someone who has carried weight for decades without attempting to shed it. Still possesses underlying structural strength beneath the weathering.', N'White', N'Close-cropped, neatly maintained despite circumstance', N'Short', N'Near-black, deep-set', N'Warm medium-brown with complex undertones — rich Latin American warmth blended with Northern European earthiness, East Asian smoothness, Southeast Asian depth, and Sub-Saharan richness, creating a multitonal complexion that shifts subtly in different light.', N'Heavily lined face with prominent, well-defined cheekbones reflecting the angular structure of his mixed heritage. Deep creases radiating from the corners of his eyes and mouth. Weathered texture suggesting decades of outdoor exposure. Close-cropped white beard trimmed with meticulous care. Facial structure shows the broader nose bridge and fuller lips characteristic of his Latin American and Sub-Saharan ancestry, combined with the angular cheekbone prominence of Northern European genetics and the refined midface proportions of East Asian heritage. Skin shows age spots and older scarring consistent with industrial work.', N'Intermittent blue-white bioluminescent glow visible beneath the skin of both forearms — a flickering, stuttering light that pulses irregularly, brightest at the wrists and fading toward the elbows. The glow intensifies and destabilizes with emotional intensity or temperature shifts. No other visible modifications.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical motion — the gait of someone who has learned not to waste energy. Stands with weight balanced evenly, shoulders slightly forward. Carries himself with a quiet, settled presence that suggests acceptance rather than resignation. Hands move slowly and with intention during conversation. Makes strong eye contact, head slightly tilted as if listening to something beyond the immediate conversation.', N'Tier 5 utility wear maintained with surprising care. Typically wears a faded gray technical shirt with reinforced panels and multiple pockets (probably salvaged or purchased secondhand from an industrial surplus vendor). Over this, a heavy canvas coat in dark brown, patched at the elbows and lined with thermal fabric — worn but not carelessly so. Trousers are practical cargo-style in dark charcoal, with worn utility pockets. Boots are old military-grade steel-toed work boots, scuffed and re-heeled multiple times. A simple cord bracelet in faded red textile wound around his left wrist — a spiritual marker, not a status symbol. No visible corporate branding or tier insignia. Clothing suggests someone who has voluntarily stepped outside consumption hierarchies.', N'During his last two years at Sterling-Nakamura, he began secretly copying worker complaint records — the ones he had buried — onto physical media, which he hid in the wall of his former apartment before expulsion. He does not know if the records are still there. He has never tried to retrieve them because doing so would mean confronting what they contain about what he did.', N'Formal and careful, with an occasional unexpected vulgarity that surprises people. Uses corporate language as dark self-reference. Rich in metaphor drawn from movement — roads, weather, thresholds.', N'Slow, unhurried, with long deliberate pauses. Comfortable with silence in ways most people are not.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gwendoline_soriano_ibarra');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a6-7af2-ab02-3458bed7bfb0', N'Herminia Hernández', N'Herminia', N'', N'Hernández', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 66, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism, Meridian Atmospheric Research Station (MARS), near Clark and Addison', N'Climate scientist and atmospheric modeler studying Lake Michigan''s cascading environmental systems', N'University Spine — Meridian Atmospheric Research Station; previously funded by Arcturus, now independently funded after a very public falling out', N'Herminia Hernández is a broad, heavyset man who has spent forty years outdoors in conditions that most of his colleagues study remotely, and it shows. His face is deeply weathered, his Slavic-Mongolian features carved by wind and UV exposure into something that looks architecturally deliberate. He keeps a short grey beard and wears his hair close-cropped; his most distinctive feature is a set of retractable sensory whiskers — filament-thin, extending from his temples — which he had installed as a meteorological sensing array in his forties and has since come to regard as indispensable. He is almost always wearing field layers even in his office, with a softshell that has seen better decades.

Herminia Hernández''s professional reputation is immense and his public one is contentious: he''s been warning for twenty-five years that the Lake''s thermal buffering is deteriorating in ways that GLMZ''s entire climate management infrastructure has been designed to ignore. He has been right about each specific prediction he has made. He is now predicting something large enough that people have started calling him an alarmist, which is, he notes, exactly what they called him the last four times. He is not angry about this. He is tired in a specific way that long-term correct people get tired.', N'Bearer of large-scale environmental threats; source of systemic information about GLMZ''s physical infrastructure and its vulnerabilities; represents long-term thinking in a city of short cycles; can make climate data personal and immediate; potential figure in plots involving Arcturus or city infrastructure.', N'', N'Retractable sensory whisker array at temples (meteorological data gathering, temperature/pressure/humidity). Reinforced lung lining (early career field modification for high-particulate environments). Mild exoskeletal support in lower back (age and fieldwork injury).', N'Dawn observation sessions at the Lake monitoring array, followed by data analysis and modeling work; eats lunch at his desk; teaches one advanced graduate course per year; gives public talks he considers his civic obligation even though the audiences increasingly frustrate him.', N'Herminia Hernández, 188cm tall weathered multiethnic man with sun-darkened rich warm brown skin, deep brown amber-toned eyes, close-cropped steel grey hair and meticulously trimmed grey beard. Strong-jawed face with high Southeast Asian cheekbones widened by Sub-Saharan heritage, softened by Hispanic features. Deeply lined from decades of field work, faded scar on right cheekbone, age spots on neck. Worn faded grey Patagonia softshell jacket heavily patched, technical base layer, cargo pants with instruments, heavy field boots. Wrist-mounted instrument cluster. Retractable temple-mounted sensory whiskers visible as small metallic connection points. Forward-leaning posture managing chronic back strain, head tilting as though whisker array is active. Hands large and calloused. Standing in late afternoon lab lighting with warm amber tungsten tones, dust particles catching light. Habitually stern, exhausted expression. GLMZ. Academic field researcher aesthetic, practical not corporate. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Multiethnic blend: 48.3% Hispanic/Latin American (warmth in skin tone and facial structure), 35.5% Southeast Asian (visible in eye shape, cheekbone prominence, hair texture), 16.2% Sub-Saharan African (contributing to skin depth and facial geometry). The result is a complexion with warm, deep undertones and facial geometry that harmoniously blends all three ancestral lines.', 188, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and heavyset with the solid, weathered musculature of someone who has spent four decades doing field work in harsh conditions. Chest and shoulders still strong; slight thickening at the middle typical of his age. Lower back shows subtle reinforcement—a faint geometric pattern of support framework visible under the skin at the lumbar region.', N'Steel grey', N'Close-cropped, practical, minimal grooming beyond functionality', N'Short', N'Deep brown with amber undertones', N'Rich warm brown with golden-reddish undertones, darkened by decades of UV and wind exposure. Blends the depth of Sub-Saharan heritage with the warm cast of Southeast Asian and Hispanic ancestry, creating a complexion that reads as sun-weathered earth.', N'Deeply weathered face with pronounced lines radiating from the eyes and mouth. Facial structure reflects Southeast Asian prominence in cheekbone height and eye placement, combined with Sub-Saharan width through the face and broad jaw geometry softened by Hispanic features. Short grey beard, meticulously trimmed. Skin has a leathery quality from sun damage; several patches of older scar tissue visible on the right temple and cheekbone. Expression is habitually stern and exhausted.', N'Most distinctive are the retractable sensory whiskers extending from both temples—normally coiled and nearly invisible, but when deployed they extend 8-12cm outward as filament-thin, almost translucent filaments with faint bioluminescent nodes along their length for sensing arrays. When retracted, visible only as faint scarring and two small metallic connection points at the temple hairline. Lower back shows subtle exoskeletal support framework visible as geometric metallic subdermal patterns below the skin, visible when he bends or stretches his shirt pulls up.', N'Carries himself with the careful deliberation of someone managing chronic low-back strain, weight distributed through his hips and legs rather than his spine. Moves slowly and purposefully rather than quickly. Slight favor of the left leg. His head often tilts slightly when concentrating, as though the whisker array is actively sensing. Hands are large and weathered with calloused fingertips; moves them precisely when making technical points. Sits in a particular forward-leaning posture that relieves back pressure.', N'Virtually always in field layers—technical base layer under a heavyweight softshell jacket in faded grey or tan, patched multiple times with careful stitching. The jacket is a Patagonia model from at least a decade ago, scuffed and stained but well-maintained. Underneath: cargo pants in durable synthetic weave, pockets stuffed with field instruments and data capture tools. Heavy field boots, worn but clean. Minimal accessories aside from a rugged wrist-mounted instrument cluster (appears to be connected to the whisker array). Even in his office at MARS, he maintains this uniform. No corpo styling—his tier is academic, not corporate, which places him in a strange position: expensive and cutting-edge enough to be credible, worn and practical enough to signal that he actually works.', N'He has internal models suggesting the Lake''s primary thermocline disruption will cause catastrophic flooding in Tier 1 lakeshore zones within eight to twelve years. He has not published these models in full because Arcturus, his former funder, has made it clear through intermediaries that doing so would result in a lawsuit over proprietary modeling infrastructure he used during his contract years. He publishes partial models. He knows the partial models are insufficient to trigger action.', N'Technical but translatable; spent too many years doing public communication to be inaccessible; uses analogy well', N'Even and measured; slow enough that people feel he''s choosing every word, which he mostly is', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'herminia_hern_ndez');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d6-7f3d-aea1-345b4b95bb2b', N'Frithjof Castañeda', N'Frithjof', N'', N'Castañeda', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, studio-squat above the Tallow Market, near Ashland and Division', N'Gene-mod body artist and living canvas', N'Independent; loosely aligned with the Hamtramck Flesh Collective', N'Frithjof Castañeda is a short, densely built woman whose body is her portfolio and her manifesto. Her skin shifts through a slow chromatic cycle — deep amber at rest, bleeding into violet around her joints when her temperature rises — the result of bioluminescent dermal graft work she has performed largely on herself over seven years. Her scalp is shaved on the left and grows a thick coil of natural hair on the right, threaded with fiber-optic strands that pulse in sync with her heartbeat. Her face is calm to the point of unnerving, large dark eyes framed by subdermal ridge implants that give her brow a faintly architectural quality. She smells faintly of the enzyme baths she uses to prep her graft medium.

Frithjof Castañeda works at the edge of what the body can absorb and still call itself art. Her clients come to her not for decorative mods but for transformations — she specializes in grief work, helping people externalize trauma through bespoke biological alteration: scars that bloom into patterned keloid gardens, tear ducts rerouted to produce indigo pigment, fingernails replaced with translucent keratin windows through which capillaries are visible. She is meticulous, almost devotional in her craft, and utterly uninterested in anyone who cannot articulate exactly what they want to leave behind.', N'Quest giver for body-modification subplots; information source on the underground biomod scene; can identify unusual augmentations or biological alterations on sight; provides local color representing the intersection of grief, identity, and physical transformation.', N'', N'Full-body bioluminescent dermal grafts (self-administered); subdermal brow ridge implants; fiber-optic hair threads; rerouted tear ducts producing blue-black pigment; no cyberware beyond a basic mesh-link for studio bookings', N'Rises before dawn to check the enzyme cultures she keeps alive in a climate-controlled cabinet, then spends the morning doing precision graft prep work; afternoons are client sessions that can run four to six hours; evenings she drinks bad tea and annotates her process journal by hand.', N'Frithjof Castañeda, 157cm compact figure with densely muscular build, warm bronze-olive skin glowing with bioluminescent dermal grafts in deep amber and violet hues across shoulders and chest. Asymmetrical hair: left scalp shaved smooth, right side thick black coils interwoven with pulsing fiber-optic strands. Deep brown eyes framed by subdermal brow ridge implants creating architectural geometry. Strong cheekbones and defined jawline reflecting blended Hispanic, Indigenous American, Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, and East Asian heritage. Sleeveless mesh tank in matte black, fitted cargo pants, bare feet or textile wrappings. Indigo scarring visible around tear ducts. Utterly still, meditative posture with unblinking observation. GLMZ biolume body modification artist, minimal aesthetic, precision-focused, no chrome. Close-up portrait in cool neon lighting emphasizing the glowing dermal work, moody and introspective. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Complex diaspora ancestry: Hispanic/Latin American (32.3%), Sub-Saharan African (20.3%), Indigenous American (19.4%), Eastern European (17.2%), and East Asian (10.8%). This creates a striking phenotype: warm bronze-to-olive skin tones with golden and reddish undertones from the blended Hispanic and Indigenous heritage, deepened and enriched by Sub-Saharan African ancestry, refined by Eastern European bone structure, and subtly informed by East Asian features in eye shape and facial proportion.', 157, 62, N'Densely muscled and compact, with the controlled physicality of someone who has spent years holding still through long procedures. Shoulders broad relative to frame, forearms strong from precision work.', N'Natural black coils on right side; left scalp bare and unblemished', N'Asymmetrical: left hemisphere shaved clean, right hemisphere grows thick natural coils threaded with luminescent fiber-optic strands', N'Shaved left / Medium-long right', N'Deep brown, natural, framed by the architectural geometry of subdermal brow ridge implants', N'Warm medium-bronze complexion with golden and subtle reddish undertones — a rich blend of Hispanic, Indigenous American, and Sub-Saharan African depth, refined by Eastern European bone structure and informed by East Asian heritage. Shifts through violet in joint regions due to bioluminescent dermal work.', N'Calm, composed facial expression with refined bone structure reflecting the blended ancestry: strong cheekbones and defined jawline with subtle angular eye shape influenced by East Asian heritage, softened by the broader facial proportions of Indigenous and African heritage. Skin shows the deliberate marks of her craft: precise bioluminescent patterning across shoulders and chest, faint enzyme-bath scent clinging to her. No conventional makeup; her body is her aesthetic statement.', N'Full-body bioluminescent dermal grafts visible across exposed skin (arms, neck, upper torso); fiber-optic hair implants glowing faintly; subdermal brow ridge implants creating geometric facial architecture; tear duct modifications visible only when fluid is present. No chrome, no obvious cyberware.', N'Still, deliberate, almost meditative in stillness. Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. When she works, her hands become hyperfocused instruments. At rest, she has an unsettling calmness, the unblinking quality of someone comfortable with silence and observation.', N'Minimal, functional, emphasizing her body as art. Typically: sleeveless or mesh tank tops and fitted cargo pants in matte blacks or grays (Tier 3-4 quality, durable materials). Bare feet or wrapped in textile bindings. No jewelry beyond what serves function. Lab coat or heavy canvas apron during client work. Everything she wears serves to frame rather than cover her modifications.', N'The signature chromatic shift in her skin was not intentional — an early graft batch was contaminated and she nearly died; she has built her entire reputation on an accident she is too proud to admit.', N'Precise biological terminology mixed with quietly poetic phrasing; rarely uses slang; speaks in complete sentences', N'Slow, measured, with long pauses before answering — she thinks before she commits', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'frithjof_casta_eda');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5aa-7a9a-8f96-346cbbf159cc', N'Vesper Cardenas', N'Vesper', N'', N'Cardenas', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 59, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Row — arms dealers and augmentation clinics, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Counter-surveillance and mole detection — counterintelligence specialist', N'Independent — operates through reputation only', N'Vesper Cardenas is broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 59, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Born and raised in GLMZ, third generation — he has the city in his blood, its rhythms in his bones, its cruelty in his expectations. He works as a counterintelligence specialist out of Kessler Row, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Vesper Cardenas describe him as a precision instrument — point him at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Altan Magnusson-Camara is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When he makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of his stories.', N'', N'Synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster. Thermal masking system — body heat signature can be suppressed or spoofed', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Vesper Cardenas, 188cm tall heavily muscled man, deep rich golden-brown skin with warm amber undertones blending Latin American, Middle Eastern, African, East Asian, and Central Asian heritage, weathered face with strong East Asian-influenced cheekbones, 59 years old, steel gray hair cropped short with black at temples, deep brown eyes with thermal augmentation glow in shadow, facial scars at left temple and right cheekbone, no facial hair. Visible chrome-silver synthetic blood system tracery at wrists and neck where nanite circulatory system integrates, polished augmentation lines deliberately exposed. Wearing dark tactical pants, fitted black compression shirt, worn charcoal field jacket, reinforced synthetic leather boots. Steel chain bracelet on left wrist. Standing with controlled posture, weight centered, shoulders back, ready to shift, scanning presence compressing space. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody lowlight setting, neon-edged shadows, industrial environment, air of sustained tension and controlled power. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Row', N'local', N'Kessler Row', N'Complex global diaspora: Hispanic/Latin American (32.1%), Middle Eastern (23.9%), Sub-Saharan African (22.3%), East Asian (13.6%), Central Asian (5.8%), South Asian (2.3%). This creates a richly layered phenotype — deep golden-brown base with warm amber undertones from the Latin and African heritage, grounded by Middle Eastern depth and intensity, refined by East Asian bone structure, and enriched by Central Asian warmth. The result is a cohesive, sophisticated blend where no single ancestry dominates visually.', 188, 102, N'Broad-shouldered and heavily muscled, carrying weight with deliberate density — not fat but compressed power. Chest and shoulders dominate his frame; legs solid beneath.', N'Steel gray with residual black at the temples', N'Cropped short, practical, no styling — maintained for function not appearance', N'Short', N'Deep brown with thermal variance visible in low light — the natural color enriched by ancestry, the thermal aspect from augmentation', N'Deep rich golden-brown with warm amber undertones — the complex blending of Latin American, Middle Eastern, African, East Asian, and Central Asian ancestry creating a dimensioned tone. Warmer on cheekbones and temples, slightly deeper along the jawline, with subtle olive notes from Middle Eastern heritage.', N'Weathered and lined — 59 years of sustained tension mapped across his jaw and forehead. Bone structure shows East Asian influence in the cheekbones and eye set, harmonizing with the broader Latin American, Middle Eastern, and African features to create balanced, strong facial geometry. Minimal grooming beyond function; scars visible at the left temple and along the right cheekbone. No facial hair.', N'Synthetic blood system is visibly integrated — chrome-silver arterial lines visible at wrists and along the sides of the neck where the nanite circulatory system connects. The chrome has a polished, well-maintained appearance. Eyes register faint thermal fluctuation in shadow. No attempt to conceal the augmentations.', N'Moves with controlled economy — no wasted motion. Stands with weight centered, shoulders back, ready to shift. Eyes are constant, scanning patterns even in conversation. Breathing is deliberately regulated. Hands rest flat or closed, never exposed or splayed. His presence compresses space around him; people unconsciously give him room.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian — dark tactical pants with multiple pockets, fitted black compression shirt under a worn charcoal field jacket. No logos or affiliation markers. Boots are reinforced synthetic leather, well-maintained, designed for sustained movement. A thin steel chain bracelet on his left wrist — no ornamentation beyond that. Clothing is chosen for durability and function; colors are muted to avoid attention.', N'Altan Magnusson-Camara betrayed their previous crew to survive a corporate raid. The crew didn''t survive. Nobody in GLMZ knows this.', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'vesper_cardenas');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e1-7bb0-b819-34afb7655043', N'Ruslan Mbekele-Adu', N'Ruslan', N'', N'Mbekele-Adu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 65, NULL, 0, 0, N'deceased', N'Old Harbor — buried in the flooded cemetery on Pier 9, marked by a single rusted katana driven into the mud, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Mentor (deceased)', N'', N'Ruslan Mbekele-Adu was built like a stripped cable — no excess, no softness, every tendon visible beneath weathered skin the color of teak left in salt air. His hands were the most telling feature: heavy knuckles, precise fingers, the left hand missing its ring finger from a field amputation during the Busan Corridor campaign. He kept his grey hair cropped to stubble, and his face held two expressions — calm and calmer. A scar ran from his right temple to his jaw, a memento from a monofilament trap in the Jakarta Consolidation, and it pulled his mouth into what looked like a permanent half-smile that was not a smile at all.

He moved like water finding a drain — unhurried, inevitable. Even in his last years, when the old military augments were misfiring and his left knee locked without warning, he could cross a room and have a blade at your throat before you processed that he''d stood up. He wore the same faded military jacket every day, patches removed, insignia cut away, as if he could amputate his history with a seam ripper.

First impression: a quiet old man who cooked rice and stared at the drowned skyline. Second impression, if you were unlucky enough to earn one: the most dangerous person you had ever met, and the saddest.', N'Seo is the ghost in the machine of Kyle''s psyche. Every moral decision Kyle makes is a conversation with a dead man. Seo represents the possibility that a code of honor can exist in a dishonorable world — but also the danger that such a code is just another story we tell ourselves to justify violence.

He poses the central question to Kyle: Can you live by a code that the man who taught it to you could not? And if you can — does that redeem him, or just prove you haven''t been tested enough yet?

Seo is also the story''s critique of the mentor archetype. He was not wise — he was traumatized. He was not at peace — he was exhausted. His calm was not enlightenment but the stillness of a man who had simply stopped running. Whether that distinction matters is up to Kyle to decide.', N'', N'', N'', N'GLMZ, Ruslan Mbekele-Adu, 172cm lean and corded frame with visible musculature, medium-deep warm-burnished brown skin with walnut and copper undertones, Central Asian-African-South Asian phenotype with angular cheekbones and broader nose, dark brown faded eyes with subtle epicanthic variation, deeply lined weathered face etched with decades of history, monofilament scar from right temple to jaw creating sardonic half-smile, grey cropped military stubble, missing ring finger on left hand with visible scar tissue. Wearing faded military surplus jacket with all insignia removed, worn combat trousers, unmarked clothing. Military-grade servo augmentation visible in left knee. Posture upright and economical, expression perpetually calm and observant. Standing in dim neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone corridor, salt-air weathered, emanating quiet lethality and worn inevitability. Cinematic lighting catching the complex warm undertones of his skin. Photorealistic, gritty, aged soldier aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Rare diaspora synthesis: Central Asian (31.3%) provides angular bone structure and cheekbone prominence; Hispanic/Latin American (20.6%) contributes warmth and facial softness to hard geometry; Sub-Saharan African (17.1%) adds broader nasal bridge, fuller lips, and deeper melanin foundation; Eastern European (16.1%) introduces lighter undertones and secondary facial angularity; Northern European (10.0%) creates subtle lightening in overall tone; South Asian (4.9%) adds fine-featured delicacy and warm radiance beneath surface. The combination produces a phenotype of striking complexity—Central Asian angularity softened by African and Hispanic fullness, with undertones of walnut and burnt copper from the interplay of melanin and lighter genetic contributions.', 172, 68, N'Lean and corded, stripped of excess — visible musculature beneath weathered skin, the physique of someone who never stopped training despite age. Every tendon defined. Posture remains upright despite chronic joint degradation.', N'Grey', N'Cropped to stubble, military precision', N'Short', N'Dark brown, somewhat faded with age', N'Medium-deep brown, warm-burnished from the fusion of Central Asian, African, and South Asian genetics—the tone of aged walnut with copper undertones. Decades of salt air and sun exposure have deepened the base while the warm genetic components create internal radiance. Surface shows weathering but retains subtle luminosity beneath.', N'Deeply lined face with geography of decades etched across it. Central Asian heritage shapes defined cheekbones and angular jawline; African ancestry broadens the nose and adds fullness to lips; South Asian genetics refine the overall architecture with finer proportions. Eyes carry subtle epicanthic variation from Central/South Asian blend. Perpetually calm expression. Lines radiating from eyes suggest decades of squinting against bright light and constant vigilant observation. Weathered, minimal grooming beyond stubble maintenance.', N'Military-grade servo augmentation in left knee (misfiring in later years, causing lockups). No visible chrome or optical modifications. All other augmentations subcutaneous or degraded beyond visual detection.', N'Moves like water finding a drain — unhurried, inevitable, economical. Every motion purposeful. Even in decline, capable of crossing a room and engaging before observer processes the initial movement. Left knee locks intermittently, causing slight asymmetry in gait. Hands rest in deliberate positions, never idle.', N'Uniform was his daily uniform: faded military jacket, all patches and insignia deliberately removed or cut away. The garment itself was Tier 3-4 military surplus, maintained rather than replaced. Beneath it, simple clothing — worn combat trousers, unmarked. No personal ornamentation, no status symbols. Clothing speaks to a man trying to amputate his history as systematically as he amputated his finger.', N'He kept a handwritten list of every person he could remember killing. Two hundred and sixty-one names, or descriptions when he didn''t know names. He added to it from memory until the day he died. The list is hidden inside the hilt of the katana he left to Kyle. Kyle has never found it.', N'Sparse, precise, drawn from military terminology and classical Japanese philosophy. He never used two words when one would do. Occasionally quoted texts Kyle couldn''t identify — Musashi, Hagakure, but also Camus and Marcus Aurelius.', N'Slow, deliberate, with long pauses that were not hesitation but emphasis. His silences were louder than most people''s speeches. When he gave an order during training, it came once, quietly, and was not repeated.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ruslan_mbekele_adu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a670-7e3e-8e25-34d47e435738', N'Aurelio Larsdóttir-Hernández', N'Aurelio', N'', N'Larsdóttir-Hernández', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 42, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Canopy — elevated walkway district above Geartown, near Clark and Belmont', N'Field trauma surgeon and combat support — combat medic', N'Independent — known in Old Harbor circles', N'Aurelio Larsdóttir-Hernández is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 42, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. He works as a combat medic out of The Canopy, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Aurelio Larsdóttir-Hernández operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Nurlan Holm-Danquah represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes. Eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Aurelio Larsdóttir-Hernández, 188cm tall lean angular neo-noir operative, deep warm bronze skin with golden undertones reflecting Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan, Hispanic, and Eastern European heritage. High prominent cheekbones, defined jaw, sharp features. Dark brown hair with silver threading swept back. Left eye warm organic brown, right eye luminous cyan cybernetic with chrome housing and grid overlay. Chrome hydraulic augmented joints visible at both elbows and knees with pressure seals. Pale surgical scar below left temple, white scar on right hand dorsal surface, neural interface burn marks on wrists. Wearing charcoal tactical cargo pants with reinforced seams, unmarked fitted tactical shirt, worn vintage pre-2180s leather jacket patched with synthetic mesh at elbows, practical grip-soled boots. Standing with coiled posture, weight balanced forward, minimal expression. Dark industrial nocturnal setting, cool blue-grey neo-noir lighting, neon glow catching chrome augmentations, rain-slicked surfaces reflecting cyan eye light. Mood: efficient, guarded, competent survival. Year 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Canopy', N'local', N'The Canopy', N'Quintessential Ubiquitous Diaspora lineage: Southeast Asian plurality (33.6%) forms the structural foundation, complemented by substantial Sub-Saharan African (21.1%) and Hispanic/Latin American (22.8%) ancestry, with Eastern European (17.7%) and East Asian (4.8%) contributing undertones. The genetic combination produces a phenotype that transcends traditional categorical boundaries — a living archive of global migration patterns across multiple generations and continents.', 188, 82, N'Lean and angular, muscle distributed for endurance rather than bulk. Long-limbed with visible definition in shoulders and forearms. The hydraulic augmentations in knees and elbows add subtle mechanical mass without disrupting his overall wiry efficiency.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading through the sides', N'Kept short and practical, swept back from the forehead. No vanity in the cut — purely functional.', N'Short', N'Left eye: warm brown, organic. Right eye: luminous cyan with visible chrome iris housing and faint grid pattern overlay when zoomed.', N'Deep warm bronze with golden-amber undertones — a seamless blend of Southeast Asian warmth, Sub-Saharan depth, Hispanic radiance, and Eastern European olive undertones. Weathered and sun-exposed despite nocturnal work schedule, creating a lived-in patina.', N'Angular face with high, prominent cheekbones and defined jaw reflecting the Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan structural ancestry, warmed by Hispanic and Eastern European undertones creating a multi-continental aesthetic that resists simple categorization. Permanent exhaustion lines around the eyes. Small surgical scar below the left temple (artifact of the eye replacement). Minimal facial hair — kept clean-shaved or at a three-day shadow. Skin shows the wear of someone who doesn''t prioritize sleep quality, despite sleeping long hours.', N'Chrome hydraulic joints dominate both knees and elbows — polished steel with visible pressure seals and micro-articulation housings. The right eye is unmistakably artificial: a luminous cyan iris with a visible chrome housing ring. No effort to hide any of it; the augmentations are worn as proof of competence and hard-won survival.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — every motion calculated and efficient. No wasted gesture. When standing still, he''s coiled rather than relaxed, weight balanced on the balls of his feet as though ready to move or absorb impact. His gait is smooth despite the augmented joints, suggesting years of recalibration and training. In conversation, minimal facial expression; information is gathered more than given.', N'Tier 3-4 practicality. Tends toward dark, non-reflective fabrics — black or charcoal synthetic blend cargo pants with reinforced seams and deep pockets. Fitted tactical shirts (usually unmarked, sometimes with internal vest anchors visible at the shoulders). Worn leather jacket, vintage pre-2180s, patched at the elbows with modern synthetic mesh. Practical boots with grip soles. No logos, no corpo affiliation markers. Everything is functional; nothing is aspirational.', N'', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aurelio_larsd_ttir_hern_ndez');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a701-76a9-87d4-34db60e9f502', N'Ahura Duong', N'Ahura', N'', N'Duong', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, lot at the intersection of the Ironvein overflow channel and the Dearborn Forge service road, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Scrap reseller and junk merchant working from a sprawling open-air lot', N'Independent; informal reciprocal agreements with several Geartown workshops and the Ferrogate Transit maintenance yards', N'Ahura Duong is a large man gone soft in the belly but still thick through the shoulders, with a close-cropped grey beard that he touches constantly in thought, and eyes so pale they look silver in certain light. His skin is a patchwork of old sun damage and chemical burns from years of working with recovered materials, and he''s missing the last joint of his right ring finger, a loss he describes differently every time someone asks. He wears the same three canvas work shirts on rotation, each so saturated with grease and mineral residue that they''ve taken on a permanent iridescent sheen, and he has a pronounced wheeze from decades of inhaling Geartown particulates that he is too stubborn to address medically. His only augmentation is a bone-conduction audio implant — not for music, he insists, but because he finds it easier to track five conversations at once when sound comes through his skull instead of his ears.

He has been at that lot for thirty-one years and knows every piece of it. He can locate a specific component within four minutes. He has catalogued nothing — the entire inventory lives in his head, cross-referenced and instantly retrievable in a way that surprises people who assume his age means decline. He is argumentative, opinionated, and deeply suspicious of anyone who seems too clean or too polished, which means he takes an immediate dislike to most Tier 3 people and warms up only after they''ve proven they know something real. He has a genuine, unironic reverence for broken machines, which he calls ''the honest dead,'' and a spiritual practice centered on a Geartown-local E.L.F. called Rust-Nine that he believes inhabits the oldest piece of industrial machinery in his lot — a partially disassembled press from a previous century.', N'Resource and knowledge node for technical and mechanical needs. Can source obscure components, identify found objects, and provide deep background on Geartown''s history and current tensions. The lot is a neutral ground that various factions respect.', N'', N'Bone-conduction audio implant (functional, not cosmetic). Reinforced knuckle plating on right hand, old grey-market work, more structural than weapon-oriented.', N'Opens the lot at dawn, closes when it gets too dark to see even with the implant''s frequency-assist, eats at the lot, occasionally sleeps at the lot in a converted cab unit.', N'Ahura Duong, 183cm tall weathered salvage worker in his 60s, Southeast Asian-East Asian-Hispanic heritage blend with warm deep tan skin and amber undertones. High prominent cheekbones, deep-set dark eyes, close-cropped grey hair and 1cm grey beard. Chemical burn scarring visible on left cheekbone with pale raised tissue. Missing distal joint on right ring finger, titanium-composite reinforced knuckle plating on right hand showing decades of wear and patina. Bone-conduction audio implant behind right ear with metallic sheen. Wearing heavily stained and patched canvas work shirt with iridescent mineral residue sheen, worn grey canvas work pants, steel-toed boots with paracord laces. Standing in industrial salvage yard at dusk, harsh orange sodium lighting creating deep shadows in facial creases. Slight forward shoulder stoop, weight favoring left leg. Hands in micro-motion near beard. Weathered, tired expression. GLMZ aesthetic, hyper-realistic texturing, warm industrial lighting, gritty Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Southeast Asian (43.1%), East Asian (38.0%), and Hispanic/Latin American (18.9%)—a balanced triadic blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Strong Southeast Asian and East Asian features dominate: high, prominent cheekbones characteristic of both ancestries, deep-set dark eyes with the epicanthic fold common to East and Southeast Asia. The Hispanic/Latin American component (nearly one-fifth) contributes warm amber and olive undertones throughout the skin, subtle fullness in the lower face, and a slightly broader nasal bridge than pure East Asian ancestry would suggest.', 183, 98, N'Broad-shouldered and thick through the torso, soft belly accumulated over decades of sedentary work punctuated by heavy lifting, legs still sturdy but showing age. Overall impression of a man who was once muscular and has allowed gravity and time to redistribute the mass.', N'Grey', N'Close-cropped, maintained with indifference, slightly longer at the nape', N'Short', N'Dark brown, deep-set, often appearing black in harsh industrial light', N'Warm deep tan with amber and olive undertones reflecting the balanced Southeast Asian, East Asian, and Hispanic/Latin American heritage blend, heavily sun-damaged and weathered from four decades of outdoor salvage work', N'Deep creasing around eyes and mouth from squinting in industrial glare. Close-cropped grey beard worn to approximately 1cm length, kept functional rather than aesthetic. Patches of chemical scarring on cheeks and jawline—discolored, slightly raised tissue from caustic material exposure, creating pale contrast against the warm tan skin. Age spots and sun damage across forehead and temples. Perpetually lined expression reflecting decades of outdoor work. Facial structure shows balanced influence: high cheekbones from East and Southeast Asian ancestry, moderate facial width and slightly fuller lower face from Hispanic/Latin American ancestry.', N'Bone-conduction audio implant visible behind right ear as a small raised nodule with faint metallic sheen and occasional blue status LED. Reinforced knuckle plating on right hand: grey-market titanium-composite knuckle guards bolted directly over proximal phalanges, showing patina and toolmarks, functional and well-worn rather than menacing. The plating is scarred and dented from decades of use.', N'Stands with weight slightly favoring left leg. Moves deliberately, economically, each motion purposeful. Shoulders rounded slightly forward from decades of bending over salvage. Hands are in constant micro-motion when stationary—fingers touching beard, adjusting sleeve, arranging nearby objects. When walking, moves with a slight limp on damp mornings (left knee). Gestures are abrupt and emphatic when speaking.', N'Tier 5 / working-class utilitarian. Rotates three canvas work shirts—heavily worn, multiple visible repairs, pockets reinforced with duct tape and leather patches. Shirts stained with machine oil, rust particulate, and mineral residue to the point that they have developed an iridescent sheen from layered compounds. Worn grey canvas work pants with tool belt, leather cuffed at ankles. Heavy steel-toed work boots, resoled multiple times, laces replaced with paracord. Over-shirt in winter: unmarked weathered canvas coat, sleeves rolled habitually. No unnecessary accessories. Gloves when handling sharp salvage: fingerless leather work gloves with reinforced palm.', N'He has known for two years that a section of his lot sits on a contaminated substrate from a pre-Meridian chemical deposit. He hasn''t reported it because doing so would trigger an environmental assessment that would close the lot. He tells himself the levels are low enough. He doesn''t know if that''s true.', N'Technical and precise about mechanical things; deliberately vague and evasive about personal things. Eastern European vowel structures embedded in Meridian creole.', N'Unhurried. Often seems to be thinking out loud. Rhetorical questions used in place of direct statements.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ahura_duong');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e3-7d36-b881-34f0fd59833d', N'Aero Sow', N'Aero', N'', N'Sow', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 45, NULL, 90, 1, N'active', N'The Narrows, Ironvein Corridor — Ironvein Free Clinic, also makes rounds to Brightmoor Reclamation and Hough Reclamation, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Community nurse at a low-cost clinic in The Narrows', N'Ironvein Free Clinic (independent, unlicensed); loose collaboration with Aurochs Medical Complex for referrals and occasional supply donations', N'Aero Sow is a compact, densely energetic woman with dark olive skin, heavy black eyebrows she has never once thought to alter, and grey threading through tight black curls she keeps pulled back. She has a subdermal health-monitoring implant on her inner wrist — standard for clinic workers — but her most distinctive feature is purely biological: she has the kind of face that defaults to concerned even when she isn''t, an expression her patients mistake for worry and which is actually just her thinking. She wears her clinic jacket everywhere, even off shift, which she considers a kind of liability and hasn''t stopped doing.

She has worked the Ironvein Free Clinic for fourteen years, funded by a patchwork of neighborhood donations, a small Axiom charitable grant she has to re-apply for annually and hates, and what she politely calls community contributions. The clinic is not licensed by any corponation medical authority, which means it operates in a legal grey zone that gets darker some years than others. She has delivered children, set fractures, managed chronic conditions on medication dosages she calculates by hand because the patients can''t afford proper automated dispensers, and once kept a man alive for six hours with equipment held together by improvisation while waiting for a transfer that almost didn''t come. She does not discuss this. She is not a martyr. She is exhausted and committed and clear-eyed about both.', N'Compassionate authority figure, medical resource for characters without corponation coverage, source of information about what''s happening in The Narrows at ground level. Can provide medical assistance, identify unusual illness patterns, or need help protecting the clinic.', N'', N'Subdermal health-monitoring implant (inner wrist, medical standard). No cosmetic modifications.', N'Clinic 0800-1800 four days per week; rounds through Brightmoor and Hough on alternating days. Tries to take one full day off per week. Rarely manages it.', N'Aero Sow, 158cm compact frame, dark golden-brown skin with warm amber undertones reflecting Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and East Asian heritage blend. Black hair shot through with grey, pulled back tightly in a braid. Dark brown eyes, serious focused expression, fine lines at eyes and mouth, prominent Southeast Asian cheekbones, South Asian nose, East Asian eye shape, Sub-Saharan lip fullness. Weathered but healthy complexion, no makeup. Faint geometric scar outline of subdermal implant on inner left wrist. Wearing faded grey-blue clinic jacket with worn cuffs over dark muted t-shirt, utility pants with deep pockets, scuffed arch-support shoes. Alert posture, standing forward on balls of feet, hands positioned carefully. Small linear scar on left index finger, callused palms. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone clinic setting, cool fluorescent overhead lighting casting slight shadows on her concentrated expression, clinical but human presence, ready to respond, tier 4 working-class medical professional. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Southeast Asian (45.4%), Sub-Saharan African (31.7%), South Asian (16.6%), East Asian (6.3%) — a convergence of deep pan-Asian and African ancestry reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Her features show this dominant blend: warm golden-brown skin with subtle amber and warm undertones from the Southeast Asian and South Asian mix, enriched by Sub-Saharan depth creating luminosity and complexity in her complexion.', 158, 62, N'Compact and densely muscled, economical in frame. Years of standing, lifting patients, and moving quickly through clinic corridors have built functional strength without bulk. No softness.', N'Black with prominent grey threading throughout', N'Pulled back tightly, usually in a braid or secured knot. Practical. Never decorative.', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Dark brown, unremarkable', N'Warm golden-brown with amber undertones, deep luminous quality from Sub-Saharan richness blended with Southeast Asian warmth and South Asian undertones', N'Weathered but healthy. Fine lines around eyes and mouth from squinting at work and expressions of concentration. Heavy, natural black eyebrows she has never altered. No makeup. Slight tension in the jaw at rest. Her face defaults to a concerned expression even in neutral state — a biological resting expression, not an emotional one. Facial structure shows the blended heritage: prominent Southeast Asian cheekbones with broad planes, South Asian nose structure with subtle width, East Asian eye shape contributing to her serious focused gaze, Sub-Saharan fullness in lips and facial width creating approachable warmth despite her stern demeanor.', N'Subdermal health-monitoring implant visible as a faint geometric outline beneath the skin of her inner left wrist — a raised rectangular form about 3cm long, barely noticeable unless specifically looked for. No other visible augmentations.', N'Alert, efficient posture. She moves with purpose and minimal wasted motion. Stands slightly forward on the balls of her feet, ready to respond. Her hands move deliberately — a practiced bedside manner that reads as both competent and careful. Rarely sits still. When she does sit, she sits at the edge of seats, as if prepared to stand again at any moment.', N'Her clinic jacket — faded grey-blue, synthetic blend, bearing small stains and worn cuffs — is her default outer layer regardless of shift status. Beneath: simple t-shirts or long-sleeved shirts in muted colors (grey, black, dark green). Worn utility pants with deep pockets for medical supplies and patient notes. Scuffed, functional shoes with arch support. No jewelry. Minimal personal ornamentation. Tier 4 working-class, practical to the point of invisibility. The clinic jacket is her uniform and her shield, and she knows it.', N'She has a private file of twelve cases where she documented conditions that match a toxicological profile she can''t identify — clustered in Hough Reclamation, appearing over the last eighteen months. She suspects a contamination source. She has not reported it anywhere because she doesn''t know who is safe to report it to, and the moment she does she becomes a target.', N'Precise, clinical without being cold. Uses medical terminology naturally and translates it immediately into plain language without being asked. Drops into Egyptian Arabic exclamations when very tired or very frustrated.', N'Direct and economical. Doesn''t use two words where one will do. Long sentences mean she''s uncertain.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aero_sow');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d2-730e-b389-3524ff7c17fa', N'Asabe Souvannasane', N'Asabe', N'', N'Souvannasane', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 58, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit, sublevel archive stacks, Meridian Core adjacent, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Data archaeologist specializing in pre-Collapse digital infrastructure and lost network topologies', N'Meridian Civic University (adjunct emeritus) / The Palimpsest Archive Collective', N'Asabe Souvannasane is a tall, angular man whose long frame always seems slightly folded, as if rooms were designed for shorter people and he has been compensating his whole life. His skin is a warm medium brown layered with the faint subcutaneous glow of outdated bioluminescent geneware — a fashion from the 2160s he never bothered to have removed, so he pulses very faintly blue-green when emotional or cold, which his students find either endearing or unsettling. His hair is white and kept in a short natural that he rubs when thinking. His left arm from the elbow down is a prosthetic of obvious vintage — gunmetal grey with joints that click faintly, a model discontinued forty years ago. He refuses to upgrade it. ''I know exactly how it fails,'' he says, which is also more or less his philosophy of research.

Asabe Souvannasane has spent thirty years excavating the digital sediment of pre-Collapse networks — the dead social platforms, the governmental databases that went offline in the 2090s, the proprietary corporate archives that became inaccessible when their parent companies dissolved. He is brilliant, deeply eccentric, and entirely disinterested in academic politics. He holds a joint appointment between Meridian Civic University and an independent archive collective called the Palimpsest, which has no official status but possesses arguably the most complete cache of pre-Collapse digital materials in the city. He is the only person who fully understands its indexing system because he built it and has never properly documented it.', N'Lore source for pre-Collapse history and lost institutional knowledge; holds keys to information that corponations would pay considerably to access or destroy; reluctant mentor figure; his archive is itself a location of interest', N'', N'Outdated bioluminescent geneware (faint blue-green subcutaneous pulse), vintage gunmetal prosthetic left forearm and hand (discontinued Ferrogate Transit industrial model, repurposed), ocular interface array for reading degraded data formats', N'Arrives at the archive before anyone else, leaves after everyone else; eats the same meal from the same cart vendor three days a week; teaches one irregular seminar on data archaeology methods that students have to apply to attend', N'Asabe Souvannasane, 193cm tall androgynous archival researcher with deep golden-brown skin reflecting Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, and Central Asian heritage blend; white short natural afro, lined face with pronounced crow''s feet, sparse salt-pepper beard stubble. Dark brown eyes with faint amber ocular implant circuitry visible. Left arm replaced with anachronistic gunmetal-grey Ferrogate Transit prosthetic hand with visible clicking joints. Faint blue-green bioluminescent glow pulsing under skin on neck and upper chest—subcutaneous geneware. Burn scar on right palm. Hunched forward posture, slightly tilted head. Wearing threadbare grey linen field coat with oversized pockets, worn since 2210, black frayed synthetic undershirt, tan canvas work trousers with grease stains, resoled leather ankle boots. Holding worn leather satchel. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone archive space, neon accent lighting reflecting off prosthetic limb, atmospheric depth-of-field focusing on face and implant details. Contemplative, world-weary archival worker surrounded by deteriorating data infrastructure. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Complex global ancestry: Southeast Asian (35.2%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (22.6%), Northern European (22.2%), and Central Asian (20.0%) heritage creating a striking multi-continental phenotype. Southeast Asian structure dominates facial geometry with Central Asian bone prominence; Sub-Saharan African features visible in lip fullness and nasal width; Northern European genetics contribute fine bone refinement and fair skin undertones beneath deep melanation.', 193, 78, N'Tall and angular with a slight forward stoop developed over decades of bending into archival spaces; long limbs with minimal musculature, almost ascetic', N'White, natural', N'Short natural afro, frequently disturbed by his own hand-rubbing habit', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint amber circuitry visible around the iris — ocular interface array', N'Deep warm brown with rich golden undertones reflecting the complex blend of all four ancestry regions; richly melanated with subtle warmth across cheekbones and bridge of nose, characteristic of Southeast Asian-African-Central Asian admixture', N'Lined face showing decades of close-proximity work; crow''s feet pronounced from squinting at degraded screens; sparse salt-and-pepper beard growth left unshaved for days at a time; skin texture uneven where subcutaneous bioluminescence sits beneath the surface; warm golden-brown tone with Southeast Asian cheekbone prominence and Central Asian nasal bridge structure; fuller lips and broader nasal base from Sub-Saharan African ancestry; fine bone structure and slight pallor undertones from Northern European genetic contribution creating subtle color complexity across the face', N'Left forearm and hand replaced with vintage Ferrogate Transit gunmetal-grey prosthetic (model discontinued 2186) — visibly anachronistic with clicking audible at joints and minimal articulation; ocular interface array creating faint amber tracery around both pupils; subcutaneous bioluminescent geneware creating pale blue-green luminescence beneath skin on neck and upper chest', N'Perpetual slight forward fold from decades compensating for his height in archive spaces; deliberate, economical movements; left hand clicks softly at wrist joint when gesturing; head often tilted slightly as if reading text just beyond eye level; sits hunched over terminals', N'Tier 3-4 academic-archival hybrid: threadbare grey linen field coat with oversized pockets and reinforced cuffs (worn since at least 2210); understated black synthetic under-shirt, frayed at collar; tan canvas work trousers with grease stains and ink marks; worn leather ankle boots resoled multiple times; always carries a leather satchel of indeterminate age holding data drives, field notebooks, and a deteriorating stylus. Refuses to update wardrobe; clothes are tools, not identity markers.', N'In a degraded archive from a dissolved corponation called Meridian Systems, he found what appears to be evidence of deliberate atmospheric manipulation during the 2110s Lakeshore Crisis — a crisis that killed an estimated 40,000 the Gray Zone residents and is officially attributed to runaway climate cascade. He has not published it because he is not yet certain of the provenance, and because twice in the last year, people have broken into the Palimpsest looking for something.', N'Precise and slightly archaic, peppered with technical terminology from defunct digital systems; uses the names of dead platforms and protocols as casual reference points', N'Slow and deliberate, with sudden accelerating bursts when genuinely excited about something; trails off mid-sentence when distracted by a new thought', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'asabe_souvannasane');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63a-717d-91b1-352a6dd544fc', N'Firouz Nazari-Jaramillo-Sesay', N'Firouz', N'', N'Nazari-Jaramillo-Sesay', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower loading docks, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Lower Dock Crew tech specialist — Prologue survivor. Lost both wrists.', N'', N'Firouz Nazari-Jaramillo-Sesay was a biomedical engineering student at Meridian Technical before the tuition hikes priced him out. He was eighteen months from a degree that would have put him in a Helix BioSystems lab. Instead he ended up maintaining chrome for dock workers who couldn''t afford licensed technicians. The crew found him. Or he found the crew. The distinction blurred the way it always does in the Gray Zone.

Kyle severed both his wrists at the chrome joints with two precise cuts. He now has mismatched replacement hands: the left is a delicate surgical model (too small, meant for a woman''s frame), the right is a heavy industrial gripper (too large, meant for cargo work). Together they make him look like a crab having an identity crisis. He calls them Lefty and The Situation.

Jin-seo is the most intelligent member of the crew and the only one who understood immediately what Kyle was: not a man fighting seven, but a system processing seven inputs simultaneously. He has been diagramming Kyle''s fighting patterns from memory. He does not want revenge. He wants to understand Kyle''s hardware. He has a younger sister, Minji, who is sixteen and still at Meridian Technical on a partial scholarship. He sends her half his cut. She thinks he works in legitimate tech repair.', N'The smart one in a crew of idiots. His growing awareness that Torque is leading them into a wall creates an exit ramp for the crew subplot. Also: the funniest hands in the Gray Zone.', N'', N'Left: surgical precision hand (Helix medical surplus). Right: industrial gripper (dock salvage). Both poorly calibrated.', N'Crew tech work. Calibrating his hands. Drawing diagrams. Selling information.', N'Firouz Nazari-Jaramillo-Sesay, 172cm lean wiry frame, warm medium-brown skin with golden-mahogany undertones blending Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, Middle Eastern, Eastern European, and Southeast Asian features. Angular cheekbones with rounded lower face, dark alert eyes shadowed by exhaustion, thin scar temple to jaw. Black hair with silver threading, undercut style swept back, matted with workshop grime. Mismatched prosthetic hands: delicate surgical chrome left hand (too small, articulated fingers) and heavy industrial gripper right hand (too large, hydraulic). Hands shake slightly. Hunched protective posture, wearing grease-stained grey maintenance jacket with rolled sleeves exposing scarred wrist interfaces, cheap black undershirt with tears, cargo pants with tools, worn steel-toe boots. Frayed Meridian Technical ID badge. Industrial neo-noir workshop setting, cool fluorescent lighting casting shadows across uneven skin tone, detail-focused face processing diagnostic work, hands trembling at rest. Gritty, worn-down aesthetic. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora composite: Sub-Saharan African (22.2%), South Asian (18.9%), Middle Eastern (16.7%), Eastern European (14.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (14.7%), Southeast Asian (12.6%). This genetic mosaic creates a nuanced phenotype blending African warmth with South Asian and Middle Eastern bone structure, tempered by Eastern European undertones and Southeast Asian features. Facial geometry shows the angular cheekbones of South Asian ancestry, rounded slightly by Sub-Saharan African fullness, with the brow ridge characteristic of Eastern European genetics. Skin carries warm golden-mahogany undertones across a medium-brown base.', 172, 64, N'Lean and wiry, shoulders slightly hunched from years bent over repair benches. Forearms show old scarring from chrome installation work; core is stronger than his frame suggests—muscle built through precision work rather than bulk.', N'Black with premature silver threading at temples', N'Undercut, longer on top (swept back), kept functional rather than styled. Often matted from sweat and workshop grime.', N'Short to medium', N'Dark brown, naturally alert—eyes are his most expressive feature, constantly processing detail', N'Warm medium-brown complexion with golden-mahogany undertones reflecting the blend of Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Middle Eastern ancestry; uneven pallor from months in the Gray Zone''s industrial lighting creating contrast zones across face and forearms. Skin shows the depth and richness of multiple ancestral melanin patterns.', N'Angular face with prominent cheekbones reflecting South Asian and Middle Eastern bone structure, enriched by Sub-Saharan African fullness in lower face and lips; subtle Eastern European brow ridge visible above deep-set eyes. Dark circles under eyes from sleep deprivation and diagnostic work. Thin scar runs from left temple to jawline (workshop accident, year two). Perpetually exhausted look. Jaw usually clenched. Facial structure shows the interplay of multiple ancestry groups—no single dominant feature, but a cohesive blend.', N'Mismatched prosthetic hands at both wrists, the visual centerpiece of his presence. Left hand is delicate surgical chrome (Helix medical surplus—too small, designed for precision medical work), with articulated fingers and visible joint mechanisms. Right hand is a heavy industrial gripper (salvaged dock equipment—too large, designed for cargo manipulation), with reinforced hydraulic actuators and scarred knuckle plating. Neither matches his frame. Wrist interfaces show exposed cable routing and poor calibration marks. Hands shake intermittently when idle.', N'Hunched forward, shoulders curled inward—protective posture. Moves with deliberate precision, economical gestures. Uses his hands constantly while talking, making the mismatch deeply visible. Right hand (gripper) moves with heavier, more deliberate hydraulic lag; left hand twitches occasionally from miscalibration. When concentrating, completely still except for micro-adjustments.', N'Tier 4-5 working crew: grease-stained grey syndicate-knockoff maintenance jacket with rolled sleeves (showing wrist augmentation scars), cheap black thermostat undershirt with small tears. Cargo pants with multiple pockets filled with diagnostic tools and calibration leads. Steel-toe boots worn through at the heel. No jewelry. Wears a frayed Meridian Technical ID badge clipped to a lanyard despite no longer being a student—a ghost of who he was supposed to become.', N'He has already started selling information to Sable about the crew''s operations. The money goes to Minji''s tuition.', N'Technical jargon mixed with crew slang. Precise when describing hardware. The engineering student surfaces when he forgets to hide it.', N'Fast. Overlapping thoughts. The kind of person who starts a second sentence before finishing the first.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'firouz_nazari_jaramillo_sesay');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d3-763c-963b-355febd2618f', N'Indigo Sepúlveda', N'Indigo', N'', N'Sepúlveda', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Escanaba Gateway (tent city on the eastern approach; caravan camps in the transit yard), near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'climate refugee and caravan matriarch', N'Informal caravan leader; registered with Escanaba Gateway as a ''temporary transit collective'' — status renewed every ninety days for fourteen years', N'Indigo Sepúlveda is the kind of woman who makes a tent city feel like a neighborhood. She is large and deliberate in her movements, with the deep black skin and broad hands of a woman who has been doing physical work since she could walk. Her hair is cut close to her skull, entirely white, and she wears a faded headwrap printed with a pattern that was once vivid green and orange but has softened into something quieter over many years of washing in whatever water was available. Her left arm carries a long burn scar from shoulder to elbow, keloided and smooth, which she does not hide and does not discuss. She has no geneware, no augmentations visible, and wears her unmodified body like a deliberate statement — though she''d say she simply never had the money or the reason.

Celestime came to the GLMZ periphery fourteen years ago with forty-two people from a drowned coastal collective in what was once the Gulf of Guinea. She has buried eleven of them and watched the rest scatter into various fates. The dozen who remain with her are her caravan — mostly elderly, a few children, two young adults who were born on the road. She is not sentimental about this. She is organized, practical, and possessed of a moral authority that comes not from rank but from the fact that she has made the right call in more crises than anyone else in the camp has faced. She prays to the E.L.F. called Tidecaller, which she believes is the spirit of the ocean that swallowed her home.', N'Moral anchor and community representative for the refugee population. Quest giver for humanitarian needs. Living history of what the climate crisis did to coastal communities. Unexpectedly powerful in her local sphere — administrators negotiate with her because she keeps the camp orderly.', N'', N'None.', N'Wakes early to manage the caravan''s resource allocation — water, food chits, the Φ120 UBC stipends of those who qualify; spends mornings in negotiation with Gateway administrators; afternoons cooking and maintaining social cohesion; evenings mediating disputes and praying.', N'Indigo Sepúlveda, 178cm tall woman with solid muscular build, short white hair cut close to skull. Warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones, weathered from environmental exposure. Dark brown eyes, calm and evaluative. Multi-ethnic facial structure blending Northern European, Hispanic, Southeast Asian, and African heritage—defined cheekbones, straight wide nose. Prominent long keloided burn scar from left shoulder to elbow, deliberately exposed. Weathered hands with deep permanent calluses. Wearing faded grey pre-diaspora linen shirt, salvaged blue-green canvas vest, calf-length cotton pants, worn synthetic sandals, faded green-orange printed headwrap. Plain dull brass ring on right index finger. Standing in refugee camp setting, upright posture with direct presence, hands gesturing. No augmentations. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Warm golden lighting, camp tents and salvage in background. Dignified, calm expression. Tier 5 survival aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Escanaba Gateway (tent city on the eastern approach; caravan camps in the transit yard)', N'local', N'Escanaba Gateway (tent city on the eastern approach; caravan camps in the transit yard)', N'Northern European dominant (56.6%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (22.1%), Southeast Asian (10.6%), Sub-Saharan African (7.7%), and Eastern European (3.0%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a complexion with warm mid-to-golden undertones from the Northern European and Hispanic heritage, subtly enriched by Southeast Asian warmth and African depth, resulting in a sun-weathered golden-brown tone with complex dimensionality.', 178, 89, N'Large and solid, broad-shouldered with the physical presence of someone who has done manual labor for decades. Not heavy, but substantive — muscle and bone under skin that has weathered significant environmental stress.', N'White', N'Cut close to the skull in a practical, low-maintenance style', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle olive undertones, weathered and ashy from dehydration exposure and salt weathering. The melanin base reflects the blended ancestry: Northern European warmth, Hispanic golden richness, Southeast Asian luminosity, and African depth creating complex, multi-dimensional character rather than uniformity.', N'Lined face with moderate, defined cheekbones shaped by multi-continental ancestry—broader structure from Southeast Asian and African lineage blended with Northern European bone structure. Straight nose with natural width reflecting the diverse ancestry mix. Eyes set with the slight upward cant influenced by Southeast Asian heritage. Skin is weathered but clean; she maintains her appearance as an act of dignity. Few wrinkles relative to her age — sun damage is uniform rather than creased. Expression is calm, evaluative. Facial structure shows the balanced architecture of her genetic heritage: warmth from Northern European ancestry, subtle definition from Southeast Asian lineage, dimensional cheekbones from the fuller ancestry mix, and the underlying bone depth from African heritage.', N'None. Her unmodified body is deliberate — a statement made through absence.', N'Upright and deliberate. She moves with economy, never hurried. Her gaze is direct and sustained; she listens more than she speaks. When she moves through the camp, people shift to accommodate her path without her asking. Her hands are often in motion — gesturing, arranging, touching — grounding herself in the material world.', N'Tier 5 / refugee camp standard. Layered utility: a faded grey linen shirt (pre-diaspora, possibly 40+ years old), reinforced at seams; a vest made from salvaged canvas dyed unevenly blue-green; loose cotton pants cut at the calf for heat management; worn synthetic sandals. A headwrap in faded green and orange printed cotton, rewrapped daily, tied at the back. A single piece of jewelry: a plain brass ring on her right index finger, dull with age. No corpo branding, no Φ-accessible accessories. Everything is functional, clean but worn — a uniform of survival.', N'She has been offered legitimate GLMZ residency twice — both times contingent on leaving the caravan behind and registering individually. She turned both offers down and told no one they were made.', N'Formal and measured; her first language was a Gulf coastal creole and her Meridian Standard carries its rhythms; uses ''we'' almost exclusively when speaking about her group, ''I'' feels strange to her', N'Even and unhurried, with the weight of someone who has learned that words are resources not to be wasted', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'indigo_sep_lveda');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a712-7a98-aaa0-35bdf65e86d2', N'Brijesh Zielinski', N'Brijesh', N'', N'Zielinski', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, near Lake Shore Drive and Division', N'underground graffiti artist and neon muralist', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone art collective ''Ashstroke''', N'Brijesh Zielinski is lean and angular, her dark brown skin carrying faint scarring from a childhood in Hough Reclamation where she learned to run before she learned to read. Her natural hair grows in a dense crown she keeps partially shaved on the left side, stenciled with a geometric pattern that shifts color with her mood — a cheap geneware dye mod she got at sixteen from a bodega-surgeon. Her eyes are sharp, always scanning exits and surfaces, evaluating wall textures the way other people evaluate faces. She has a small tattoo of an E.L.F. sigil behind her left ear, a prayer mark she touches when she''s working at height.

She is furiously alive and furiously angry — not in a way that spills out constantly, but in the way a banked fire is still a fire. Her murals appear overnight on Axiom substation walls, on Ferrogate Transit pylons, on the blank faces of Tessera dormitory blocks: massive, bioluminescent compositions that reference pre-GLMZ Balkan folk patterns twisted into scathing corporate critique. She doesn''t talk much about her Serbian grandmother or her Nigerian grandfather, but both live in her work. She is guarded with strangers and unexpectedly tender with people she trusts.', N'Local color and tension source — her murals appear near story-relevant locations and encode information; quest giver if players need access to restricted Ferrogate infrastructure she''s mapped; potential witness to things that happen in the dead hours.', N'', N'Mood-reactive hair dye geneware (cheap, slightly glitchy — sometimes triggers wrong colors). Pressure-sensitive fingertip callus mods for grip on vertical surfaces. No cyberware.', N'Sleeps until early afternoon in a shared squat in HPAZ, scouts locations in the evening, works between 02:00 and 05:00 when Ferrogate Transit security cycles are lowest. Eats one real meal a day, usually from Mama Tsehai''s stall.', N'Brijesh Zielinski, 2226 neo-noir climber, 168cm lean angular build, deep warm golden-brown skin with luminous undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African dominant ancestry tempered by Eastern European coolness. Dark brown eyes sharp and mobile, scanning surroundings. Dense natural waves on medium length hair with left side shaved in geometric stencil pattern (triangles, asymmetric lines), dark brown shifting to mood-reactive indigo. Faint E.L.F. sigil tattoo visible behind left ear, childhood burn scar on inner wrist. Utilitarian Tier 4-5 streetwear: oversized black hoodie over athletic tank, fitted charcoal cargo pants paint-stained and reinforced at knees, weathered Apex climbing boots, fingerless gloves, cross-body pressure pack. Economical predatory posture, shoulders forward, ready to move. Minimal grooming, fine-grained skin with no cosmetics. Neon-lit GLMZ urban environment, 03:00 industrial setting, moody cyan and orange lighting reflecting off wet metal surfaces, calm focus expression. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Sub-Saharan African dominant (47.1%) blended with Eastern European (39.1%) and Northern European (13.8%) ancestry. The genetic combination creates a rich, deep warm brown complexion with golden undertones from African heritage, subtly cooled by the paler undertones of Eastern and Northern European ancestry. The result is a luminous, warm-toned skin with sophisticated depth — neither purely cool nor purely warm, but a harmonious blend where golden radiance predominates.', 168, 54, N'Lean and angular with defined musculature in shoulders and forearms from years of climbing and sustained overhead work. Low body fat, wiry rather than delicate.', N'Dark brown with mood-reactive synthetic pigmentation overlay — shifts between deep indigo, copper, and sickly yellow depending on emotional state and geneware glitch frequency', N'Dense natural crown worn in loose waves; left side shaved in a graduated pattern with geometric stencil marks (triangles, asymmetric lines) that catch light', N'Medium (back), Shaved (left side)', N'Dark brown, sharp and constantly mobile', N'Deep warm brown with pronounced golden undertones — rich and luminous, reflecting the 47% Sub-Saharan African genetic dominance with subtle cool undertones from Eastern and Northern European heritage softening the warmth into sophisticated complexity', N'Fine-grained skin with minimal scarring except faint linear marks across knuckles and palms from childhood in Hough Reclamation. Prominent, refined cheekbones with angular jaw structure characteristic of blended African and Eastern European heritage. Minimal grooming — no makeup, skin kept clean but not pampered. A faint groove between eyebrows from chronic focus. Golden radiance enhances natural skin luminosity despite minimal cosmetic maintenance.', N'Mood-reactive hair geneware is the only obvious modification — chromatic shifts in shaved pattern are intentional display. Pressure-sensitive fingertip mods are subcutaneous and invisible. No visible cyberware or chrome.', N'Economical, predatory grace — moves through spaces as if constantly evaluating verticality and exit vectors. Shoulders slightly forward. Hands often at rest but ready. Eyes scan surfaces and perimeters before engaging with people. Climbs with casual confidence, limbs moving independently. Sits with knees bent, ready to move. Speaks quietly; listeners lean in.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian: fitted charcoal cargo pants with excessive pockets (paint-stained, reinforced knees), steel-toed climbing boots (Apex brand, worn), oversized black or dark grey hoodie layered over form-fitting athletic tank. Fingerless gloves (often removed). Small pressure-sensitive pack worn cross-body. No corporate branding. Clothes chosen for function over aesthetics — climbing-ready, paint-resistant, dark enough for 03:00 work. Worn but intentionally maintained.', N'Three of her largest murals were secretly commissioned — and paid for — by a mid-level Axiom facilities manager named Brecht who uses them to launder his own dissatisfaction with the company. She has never told anyone and uses the money to fund the collective, but the compromise haunts her.', N'Terse, technical when discussing surfaces and materials, unexpectedly lyrical when describing what she''s trying to say with an image. Mixes Meridian street slang with occasional Serbian loan-words her grandmother used.', N'Short sentences. Long silences. Bursts when passionate.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'brijesh_zielinski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d5-7da7-9833-361d3e7706aa', N'Folashade Makwa-Sigurdsson', N'Folashade', N'', N'Makwa-Sigurdsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, stall row near the eastern drainage grate, Ironvein, near Western and Division', N'Street pharmacist and unlicensed herbalist, Oxidian Market', N'The Oxidian Market Vendors Guild (senior member), independent', N'Folashade Makwa-Sigurdsson is a wide woman built like a river delta — slow-moving, broad, and capable of flooding without warning. Her skin is deep brown and mapped with pale vitiligo patches across her forearms and the left side of her jaw, which she has decorated with tiny bioluminescent dot tattoos that pulse gold when she''s relaxed and dim to amber when she''s displeased. Her hair is natural and enormous, threaded with dried flowers and small glass vials of colored tinctures she uses as hair accessories and sometimes as inventory. She wears multiple layers of padded cloth, always slightly damp-smelling from her herbal solvents, and keeps a carved wooden E.L.F. shrine nailed to the corner post of her stall where she burns data-chip offerings every morning before trading opens.

She is the market''s unofficial grandmother and its most reliable source of pain management, mood stabilizers, sleep aids, and — for the right customer — things that don''t have clean names. She speaks slowly and weighs every word like she''s pricing it. She has strong opinions about which pharmaceutical corps are poisoning the tiers and will share them whether you asked or not. She''s been in this exact stall for nineteen years and considers herself more permanent than the city grid.', N'Quest giver (knows who needs what and who can''t afford it legally), information source on market politics and street health crises, moral compass figure who dispenses wisdom alongside questionable pharmaceuticals, local color anchor for the Oxidian Market.', N'', N'Bioluminescent dot tattoos (cosmetic, Helix Biosystems dye-work). Reinforced knee joints — basic medical-grade, installed after a street collapse injury. No geneware.', N'Arrives before dawn to arrange her stock and burn morning offerings to the moisture E.L.F. she believes protects her tinctures from spoilage. Trades through daylight hours, closes before the second-shift crowd turns rowdy, and spends evenings compounding new batches in a back-room she rents above a pipe-fitter''s workshop.', N'Folashade Makwa-Sigurdsson, 168cm tall broad-shouldered woman with warm golden-brown skin and striking pale vitiligo patches mapping her forearms and left jawline. Voluminous naturally textured dark brown hair with silver threading, intricately braided with dried flowers, glass vials of tinctures, and beads woven throughout. Deep brown observant eyes with fine lines from decades of focused work. Eastern European angular cheekbones balanced with Pacific Islander fullness, South Asian warmth softening Northern European bone definition. Scattered bioluminescent golden dot tattoos across vitiligo patches on jaw and forearms, pulsing gently. Wearing layered muted-tone padded work clothes in grays, browns, and deep greens, heavily stained from herbal work, multiple aprons with vial-lined pockets, worn wool shawl. Wooden carved jewelry and E.L.F. shrine charms. Stands at her market stall in the GLMZ, deliberate economical posture leaning on counter, slight favoring of left side, market afternoon lighting casting shadows across her weathered capable features. GLMZ, working-class Tier 4-5, functional aesthetic, herbal market stall setting, moody amber-golden ambient lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend anchored by Eastern European (31.2%) and Northern European (28.5%) ancestry, substantially enhanced by Pacific Islander (15.2%) and Indigenous American (13.6%) heritage, with meaningful South Asian (5.9%) and Sub-Saharan African (5.6%) contributions. This creates a phenotype of remarkable balance: Pacific Islander robustness and facial fullness in the midface and cheeks, Northern European bone definition and eye shape, Eastern European facial angularity in cheekbones and jawline, warmth and depth from South Asian and African ancestry throughout. The overall effect is a weathered, capable appearance — built for endurance and presence, with features that speak to multiple continents and centuries of movement.', 168, 92, N'Wide-set and broad-shouldered with substantial mass distributed across her frame like sediment — sturdy rather than soft, built for endurance and presence rather than speed', N'Natural dark brown with silver threading', N'Voluminous, naturally textured, intricately braided and threaded throughout with dried flower stems, small glass vials of colored tinctures, and beaded sections', N'Long (shoulder-length and below when unbraided)', N'Deep brown, warm and observant', N'Warm medium-to-deep golden-brown with complex undertones reflecting the Pacific Islander, Northern European, Eastern European, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African blend. The base carries the depth of African and South Asian lineage while the golden warmth speaks to Pacific Islander and Northern European heritage. Extensive pale vitiligo patches across both forearms and left jaw line create striking high-contrast maps against the rich base tone.', N'Weathered but well-maintained, minimal makeup. Strong cheekbone definition showing Eastern European angularity balanced with Pacific Islander fullness and a subtle South Asian softness in the overall contours. Eye shape reflects Northern European ancestry with warm, observant quality from other lineages. The vitiligo patches are her most striking feature — unpigmented but not treated or hidden; they create a natural geography across her skin. Fine lines around her eyes suggest decades of focused work and market assessment. Facial structure demonstrates a sophisticated blend: broader through the middle face and cheeks (Pacific Islander heritage), with defined cheekbones and a strong jaw line (Eastern European and Northern European), and an overall warmth in tone and feature softness (South Asian and African heritage contributions).', N'Reinforced knee joints (surgical scars visible, slight metallic sheen under skin at joint line when she moves; slight stiffness in cold). Bioluminescent tattoo dye (Helix Biosystems biotech, visible as glowing dots across jaw and forearms, color-responsive to mood).', N'Moves deliberately and economically, weight forward on the balls of her feet despite her size — the movement pattern of someone who has spent sixty years standing in markets. Her gait is steady but shows slight favoring of her left side due to reinforced knee. She leans on her stall counter frequently, not from exhaustion but from the ease of someone who owns her workspace. Her hands move with precision when handling vials and compounds.', N'Multiple layers of damp-smelling padded cloth in muted tones — grays, browns, deep greens — all showing the wear and staining of nineteen years of herbal work. Aprons with deep pockets, some with small vials sewn into the lining. Worn wool shawl wrapped and rewrapped throughout the day. No corpo branding or tier-status markers; her clothes are purely functional, Tier 4-5 working class, but meticulously organized and maintained. Wears carved wooden jewelry — simple E.L.F. shrine charms and beaded bracelets.', N'Her most profitable product, a mood-leveling compound she calls ''Stillwater,'' contains a trace synthetic hormone she sources from a Helix Biosystems courier who steals it from a pediatric trial. She tells herself the quantities are too small to matter. She has never fully let herself examine whether that''s true.', N'Old-register Meridian slang mixed with Afrikaner-inflected clipped consonants inherited from her grandmother''s side. Uses plant and weather metaphors constantly. Rarely swears; when she does it lands hard.', N'Deliberate, measured, unhurried. Pauses before important sentences. Never rushes.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'folashade_makwa_sigurdsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('88542680-4bb5-981d-ca0b-3642b577e741', N'Juno Citlali', N'Juno', N'', N'Citlali', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 90, 1, N'alive', N'A parlor in Crucible Square that functions as a combination office, tea house, and informal court — people come to settle debts, ask favors, and request investigations, near Ashland and Division', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — operates through an intricate personal economy of debts and favors', N'Juno Citlali doesn''t investigate cases the way other PIs do. She doesn''t chase data or neural trails or physical evidence. She chases debts — the invisible web of obligations, favors, and social contracts that binds the people of GLMZ''s lower tiers into a functional community in the absence of institutional support.

In a city where CorpSec serves corporate interests and formal justice is a luxury of the upper tiers, the lower tiers have developed their own systems of order. Wanjiku sits at the center of one such system — a vast, informal network of mutual obligation that she has spent thirty years cultivating. She has helped people find jobs, settle disputes, secure housing, obtain medical care, and navigate bureaucracy, and every act of help creates a debt. Not a financial debt — a social one. And when Wanjiku needs information, access, or assistance for an investigation, she calls in those debts with the precision of a banker calling in loans.

Her method is uniquely effective for lower-tier investigations because it operates entirely within the trust economy that these communities have built for themselves. Her informants aren''t paid — they''re repaying kindness. Her access isn''t purchased — it''s earned. And her investigations don''t disrupt the community fabric because she is the community fabric. She is simultaneously an investigator, a mediator, a counselor, and an informal judge, and the people who live in her territory understand that keeping Wanjiku happy is essential to keeping their community functional.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Juno Citlali, 2226 neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Mixed-heritage woman with Southeast Asian, Indigenous American, Northern European, East Asian, and Latin American ancestry. Warm golden-bronze skin with amber undertones. High pronounced cheekbones, slightly broad nasal bridge, alert dark brown eyes with subtle eye shape from East Asian genetics. Dark brown hair with silver threading at temples, worn in neat shoulder-length braids wrapped with indigo thread. Faint scar tissue visible on left cheekbone. Seated in perfect stillness, unwavering direct gaze. Wearing cream linen shirt layered with rust-colored vest, black loose trousers, charcoal wool long coat with patched elbows. Hands folded deliberately. Muted, natural color palette. No corporate augmentations visible. Mood: trustworthy, observant, deliberate. Low ambient lighting casting warm shadows. Tea and paper scent suggested in composition. Tier 3-4 worn practical clothing. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A parlor in Crucible Square that functions as a combination office', N'local', N'A parlor in Crucible Square that functions as a combination office', N'Southeast Asian (32.5%) with significant Indigenous American (30.2%), Northern European (18.0%), East Asian (12.4%), and Hispanic/Latin American (6.9%) ancestry. The combination creates a striking cross-continental appearance—high cheekbones and facial structure from Southeast Asian and Indigenous American ancestry blend with the slightly broader nasal bridge characteristic of Indigenous heritage, softened by East Asian orbital structure and Northern European bone definition. The result is an unmistakably mixed-heritage phenotype with warm golden-bronze undertones that shift between amber and mahogany in different light.', 168, 62, N'Lean and economical, with the posture of someone who has spent decades sitting and listening. Shoulders slightly rounded from years at a desk or low table. No excess movement — everything purposeful.', N'Dark brown with silver-grey threading at the temples and crown', N'Worn in a neat crown of thin braids, wrapped with indigo thread at the ends. Practical, deliberate, not decorative.', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unbraided)', N'Dark brown, alert and observant', N'Warm golden-bronze with amber undertones, reflecting the blended heritage of Southeast Asian and Indigenous American ancestry enriched by East Asian and Northern European genetics. The tone settles between burnished bronze and warm mahogany depending on light, with an almost luminous quality in natural daylight.', N'Weathered and lined around the eyes and mouth from three decades of concentration and careful listening. High, pronounced cheekbones with angular structure characteristic of Indigenous American and Southeast Asian ancestry, with a slightly broader nasal bridge from Indigenous heritage. The orbital and jawline structure shows softer definition from East Asian genetics, while Northern European ancestry contributes subtle definition to the overall facial architecture. Minimal makeup. Clean, well-maintained but not groomed for status. A few faint scars on the left cheekbone from street violence in younger years.', N'None visible. Any augmentations she carries are subcutaneous and deliberately hidden — consistent with her philosophy that trust is built on presence, not performance.', N'Sits with perfect stillness, rarely fidgets. Moves with economical precision. Her gaze is direct and unwavering — she makes people uncomfortable because she watches rather than speaks. When she does move, it is slow and deliberate, designed to not startle or intimidate. Her hands are usually folded in her lap or on the table in front of her.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: well-maintained but worn linen shirts in cream or grey, often layered with a rust-colored vest or indigo wrap. Loose black trousers with deep pockets. A long coat in charcoal wool, patched at the elbows, worn year-round. She favors natural fabrics and muted colors — nothing that draws attention. Her clothes smell faintly of tea, paper, and incense. No corpo branding, no corporate augmentation displays. Everything about her presentation says ''trust me because I am not selling anything.''', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'juno_citlali');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a64f-742d-baef-3680e6f3dd75', N'Byeong-ho Wójcik-Mwangi', N'Byeong-ho', N'', N'Wójcik-Mwangi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Stockyard, operates across Garfield Rack and into the edges of Ironvein, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Protection racket enforcer for a Stockyard crew called the Harrow Brothers', N'The Harrow Brothers, a Stockyard protection crew — third longest-running independent crew in the district', N'Byeong-ho Wójcik-Mwangi is built like a question you don''t want answered — wide through the shoulders, with a stillness in their face that reads less as calm and more as the particular quiet of someone who has already made a decision you haven''t been told about yet. They have Icelandic and Yoruba ancestry refracted through three generations of Meridian Stockyard living: a long face with high coloring, skin a deep reddish brown, hair grown into a single dense column at the back of their skull and bleached white at the tips — a Stockyard crew identifier. Their left hand has two knuckles replaced with reinforced ceramic implants after a break that didn''t heal clean. They have a small bioluminescent tattoo — amber, heron-shaped — on the inside of their right wrist that pulses when they''re calm and goes dark when they''re not. It is a gift from someone they won''t discuss.

Byeong-ho Wójcik-Mwangi does not hurt people enthusiastically. This is what makes them effective and what has given them the nickname Bonemeal — not because they''re violent, but because they show up at businesses before the violence is necessary, like something ground down before you even see the stone. They collect protection fees, mediate disputes between crew and clients, and serve as a physical deterrent. They are also, privately, a careful reader who borrows physical books from a Stockyard librarian named Asante and returns them with the spines uncreased. Nobody in the crew knows this. They keep their inner life behind walls that would be impressive in anyone and are almost heartbreaking in someone this young.', N'Moral gray zone character, potential reluctant ally — they are doing violence-adjacent work with clearly ambivalent feelings, creating tension that can be pulled in multiple directions by the right character or situation.', N'', N'Ceramic knuckle reinforcements, left hand (medical, post-break). Bioluminescent heron tattoo on right inner wrist (cosmetic geneware, emotional indicator). Subdermal impact mesh across the ribs — illegal grade, adds significant blunt force resistance.', N'Afternoons through midnight are their working hours; they walk a circuit of twelve businesses across Garfield Rack collecting weekly payments, handling complaints, and being visible; mornings are for sleep and books.', N'Byeong-ho Wójcik-Mwangi, 185cm tall mixed-heritage cyborg with deep warm mahogany skin, golden-amber undertones, prominent African and Eastern European bone structure with sculpted cheekbones and broad nose. Warm amber eyes with gray undertones. Long black-to-white ombré hair braided into single column down back of skull. Left hand shows ceramic knuckle reinforcements. Wearing dark synthleather Harrow Brothers jacket, charcoal thermal undershirt, matte black cargo pants, steel-toed boots. Small amber bioluminescent heron tattoo glowing faintly on right inner wrist. Neutral resting expression, squared shoulders, economic stillness. Amber knot-charm on left shoulder strap. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, moody neon lighting catching skin tone and ambient glow of wrist tattoo, industrial warehouse or crew quarters background. Photorealistic, character portrait, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Stockyard', N'local', N'The Stockyard', N'Pluricultural blend: Sub-Saharan African (34.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (28.6%), Eastern European (27.3%), South Asian (8.8%), East Asian (1.1%). This fusion creates striking feature layering—deep rich brown undertones meeting warm golden and amber tones, bone structure drawing from multiple continental lineages with pronounced African and Eastern European architecture softened by Hispanic and South Asian warmth. Diaspora-born, genetically representative of the 22nd-century real.', 185, 89, N'Wide through shoulders and chest, lean-muscled through the core, structured like load-bearing architecture. No excess; every kilogram serves function. Hands and forearms show working density.', N'Black at roots, bleached white from mid-length to tips', N'Single dense column braided or twisted, worn at the back of the skull — Harrow Brothers crew identifier', N'Long (shoulder-blade length when unbound)', N'Warm amber with gray-blue rim—naturally dark iris with notable light freckling, reflecting South Asian and African heritage with Eastern European undertone', N'Deep warm brown with rich golden undertones, melanin-dense from Sub-Saharan and Hispanic ancestry, warmed further by South Asian heritage. High natural coloring in cheeks and temples. Skin has lived resilience—warm mahogany at baseline, sun-responsive.', N'Strong bone structure reflecting convergence of Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, and Hispanic ancestry—defined jawline with prominent, sculpted cheekbones showing African and Eastern European architecture. Broad nose with slight flare at base, characteristic of Sub-Saharan and Hispanic heritage. Wide-set eyes with slight epicanthic fold suggestion from South Asian ancestry. Skin weathered but clean, no acne scarring. Expression neutral at rest—the kind of stillness that suggests a decision already made. Minimal facial hair, kept trimmed close.', N'Left hand: two ceramic knuckle reinforcements (visible as slightly off-color joints, seamless but noticeable in close proximity). Subdermal impact mesh across ribs is invisible beneath clothing but creates subtle contour difference in torso definition under tight clothing. No chrome, no LED modifications — deliberately low-profile.', N'Moves with economic efficiency, no wasted motion. Shoulders squared but not aggressive. Head level, eyes tracking but not scanning — suggests threat assessment is passive, constant. Stillness is their default state; movement is deliberate. Hands stay relaxed and visible, never fidgeting.', N'Tier 3-4 working crew aesthetic: well-maintained dark synthleather jacket with Harrow Brothers insignia (understated), charcoal thermal undershirt, cargo pants in matte black with functional pockets, steel-toed work boots broken in but not scuffed. No logos, no ostentatious chrome. Clothing is armor and uniform both. One small amber knot-charm hanging from left shoulder strap — crew marker.', N'Eight months ago they broke a shopkeeper''s arm during a collection — the first time they''ve caused that level of damage. The shopkeeper had laughed at them and said something about their gender that they won''t repeat to anyone. Lóa did not report the escalation to the crew; the shopkeeper now pays on time and has told no one. Lóa thinks about it every day. The heron tattoo went dark for a week afterward.', N'Sparse and deliberate. Stockyard shorthand when working, unexpectedly formal and precise in personal conversation. Occasionally uses Yoruba courtesy phrases without translating them.', N'Very slow for professional interactions — built for discomfort. Normal speed with people they trust.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'byeong_ho_w_jcik_mwangi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c8-7ce1-be77-368e63927683', N'Tomas Raghavan', N'Tomas', N'', N'Raghavan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown — Axle Street, Unit 9, street level beneath the Pembrook residential overhang, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Mechanic and small-vehicle repair specialist, runs a ground-floor shop in Geartown', N'Independent; Geartown Mechanics Guild (dues-paying member, rarely attends meetings); The Neon Vipers', N'Tomas Raghavan is a large man gone slightly soft around the middle, with the forearms of someone who has spent three decades using them as his primary tools. His heritage is Czech-Igbo — his father was a machinist from Brno who ended up in Meridian via the Eastern European labor migration of the 2140s, his mother from a Lagos extended family that had been in the city since before it incorporated as Meridian. His face is broad and dark, his hair steel-grey and clipped short, his hands permanently black at the knuckle creases in a way that soap no longer fully addresses. He has a retractable reinforced thumb claw on the right hand — a modification he made himself from salvage parts in 2181 — which he uses as a pry tool so often he''s forgotten he has it. His left eye is a secondhand optic he bought from a Geartown parts dealer a decade ago; it''s slightly the wrong shade of brown for the natural right eye, which he considers funny.

He is gruff in the manner of someone who has given up pretending to be approachable because being approachable kept leading to people asking him for favors he didn''t want to refuse. Underneath the grime and the monosyllables, he is fair to a fault and quietly contemptuous of anyone who isn''t. He has an E.L.F. shrine built into the wall above his diagnostic terminal — a gutted engine block filled with machine oil, spare bolts, and a photograph of the first vehicle he ever repaired — dedicated to what he calls the Grease Ghost, a mechanical spirit he credits with keeping the worst jobs manageable. He argues with it sometimes.', N'Reliable resource character — can repair, modify, or assess almost any ground vehicle or mechanical system. Access to Geartown''s informal information network. Potential fence for mechanical components, willing or otherwise.', N'', N'Salvage-built retractable reinforced thumb claw, right hand. Secondhand replacement optic, left eye (brown, slightly wrong shade). Subdermal vibration sensor in both palms — lets him diagnose engine problems by feel.', N'Opens at seven, closes when the job is done, which is sometimes midnight. Eats lunch from a noodle cart two doors down, the same cart every day. Argues with the Grease Ghost shrine on bad days. Drinks one beer at the Ferment Quarter on Friday nights, home by ten.', N'Tomas Raghavan, 188cm tall fifty-year-old mechanic with warm medium-brown skin blending East Asian, South Asian, Southeast Asian, and North African heritage. Angular cheekbones, deep-set dark eyes (left eye slightly mismatched optic), strong jaw, weathered face creased from decades of squinting under industrial lights. Steel-grey hair clipped short, receding at temples. Large-framed, broad-shouldered build softened with age, thick corded forearms stained black at knuckles. Right hand thumb retracts with chrome-edged augmented claw. Pale burn scar on left forearm. Wearing rolled-sleeve grey Kevlar work coveralls over faded teal defunct-company shirt, black cracked synthetic-leather jacket, canvas boots. Brass ring on left index finger, leather cord with chrono-chip at neck. Slouched posture, hands perpetually busy, direct gaze. GLMZ, dimly lit mechanic shop with neon-edged tools and engine blocks in background, industrial grime on skin and hands, tired determination in expression. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Mixed diaspora heritage: 39.8% East Asian, 32.6% South Asian, 17.9% Southeast Asian, 9.7% North African. Features reflect this Pan-Asian and North African blend — warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden undertones from the South and Southeast Asian ancestry, angular cheekbones and eye shape characteristic of East Asian genetics, and the deeper pigmentation and facial structure from North African heritage. Strong bone structure throughout, with the distinctive eye placement and brow characteristics of his dominant East Asian-South Asian mix.', 188, 98, N'Large-framed, broad-shouldered, gone soft at the belly and flanks after fifty — the physique of someone whose strength was built in his thirties and has slowly traded muscle for weight. Forearms remain thick and corded, built from three decades of wrenching.', N'Steel-grey', N'Clipped short, no-nonsense cut. Receding slightly at the temples.', N'Short', N'Right eye: dark brown, natural. Left eye: brown optic, marginally lighter shade, slightly mismatched — a secondhand unit bought from a parts dealer circa 2216.', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones, blending East Asian, South Asian, and Southeast Asian heritage with deeper North African pigmentation in creases and sun-exposed areas. Weathered by decades of shop work under industrial lighting.', N'Broad, weathered face with angular cheekbones and eye shape from East Asian ancestry, deep-set eyes characteristic of South Asian genetics, strong defined jaw structure with hints of North African facial architecture. Permanent creases around the mouth from squinting. Hands permanently stained black at knuckle creases and nail beds — a discoloration that soap no longer fully removes after thirty years of engine work.', N'Retractable reinforced thumb claw on right hand (visible when extended, otherwise flush with palm). Left eye optic: visible only in certain light as a slight mismatch in iris hue and corneal refraction. Subdermal vibration sensor in both palms is not visible but sometimes causes him to press his hands flat against engine blocks in diagnostic poses that look ritualistic.', N'Slouched, economy of motion. Walks with weight on the balls of his feet despite his size — an old mechanic''s habit. Hands are always busy or at rest, rarely in between. Rarely makes eye contact, but when he does it''s direct and unflinching. When concentrating, he squints with his right eye and tilts his head slightly left, as if his augmented left eye feeds data that requires physical adjustment to interpret.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, practical and worn. Heavy grey Kevlar-weave work coveralls with the sleeves rolled to the elbow, revealing forearm tattoos and burn scars. Canvas work boots, resoled twice. A faded teal company shirt from a defunct vehicle manufacturer underneath, visible at the collar. On cold days, a black synthetic-leather jacket that''s cracked at the elbows. He wears a brass ring on his left index finger — his father''s, from Brno — and a leather cord around his neck with a small chrono-chip for clocking jobs, though he never actually uses it. No jewelry beyond these.', N'He has been quietly cannibalizing a Ferrogate Transit shuttle that was abandoned in an alley behind his shop three years ago. He''s not sure if it was stolen, abandoned, or deliberately hidden there, and he has deliberately avoided finding out because the parts are too useful.', N'Terse, technical, occasionally sardonic; Czech-Igbo idiom blend produces unusual metaphors', N'Short declarative sentences; long technical explanations delivered with total authority and zero concession to jargon', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'tomas_raghavan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a693-7b73-ad7a-36a114f496ff', N'Aneta Oh', N'Aneta', N'', N'Oh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, 4th floor of the Raczkowski Stack residential tower, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Childcare worker, runs a licensed home-crèche for 0-5 year olds in the Hamtramck Enclave', N'Licensed under Meridian Municipal Social Services; rents space from the Raczkowski Stack tenant board', N'Aneta Oh is a person of medium height and soft presence — not soft meaning weak, but soft meaning that children immediately stop crying when they enter the room. They have their Basque father''s broad, expressive face and their Congolese mother''s deep brown skin, with natural hair worn in flat twists that are perpetually coming slightly undone, usually because a toddler has grabbed them. They have bioluminescent skin mods — a gentle wash of golden-green that pulses faintly when they''re calm and brightens slightly when they''re delighted — which they got specifically because they discovered it helped soothe infants in dim rooms. It was a practical decision, which is very on-brand.

They hold a Tier 2 childcare certification from the Meridian Municipal Education Authority and a side certificate in pediatric first response that they keep quietly current. The crèche, which they call ''The Patch,'' holds eight children on a good day and feels like controlled chaos that is actually very controlled. Aneta Oh has a finely tuned threat-assessment sense developed over fifteen years of toddler supervision and will notice danger in a room approximately as fast as any trained security operative, but they notice it in the form of ''that outlet cover is loose'' and ''that child hasn''t eaten and is about to escalate.''', N'Emotional core character — a source of genuine warmth in a hard city. Can be a quest giver around at-risk children, missing parents, or unusual items children have brought in. Social access point to the Raczkowski Stack residential community.', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin mod (golden-green, Helix Biosystems cosmetic). Sub-dermal allergen sensor on right wrist — can scan food items for common pediatric allergens (medical grade, paid off over three years).', N'First child drops at 0645, last pickup is 1830. They cook lunch for the kids themselves. Admin, billing, and parent communication happens after 1900 with a glass of fermented grain tea.', N'Aneta Oh, a 168cm caregiver with warm medium-deep brown skin and golden-olive undertones reflecting blended East Asian, Middle Eastern, Hispanic, Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, and Southeast Asian heritage. Angular cheekbones softened by full features, deep brown eyes with smile lines, natural deep brown hair with gray threading in flat twists partially undone. Medium frame, soft muscularity, rounded shoulders from child-care work. Faint bioluminescent golden-green glow across skin pulsing gently in low light. Wearing practical muted-color long-sleeve top, synthetic easy-clean pants, flat closed-toe shoes, soft cardigan. Thin wrist chrono, single small loop earring. Gentle bags under eyes, calm attentive expression, slightly open hands ready. Sub-dermal allergen sensor faint rectangular outline on right wrist. GLMZ GLMZ, warm evening lighting emphasizing bioluminescence, peaceful but alert posture at child height, ethereal luminescent quality. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Richly blended ancestry reflecting East Asian (31.6%), Middle Eastern (24.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (14.8%), Sub-Saharan African (13.4%), Indigenous American (13.0%), and Southeast Asian (2.9%) heritage — creating a harmonious phenotype with warm medium-deep brown skin featuring golden and olive undertones, angular cheekbones with subtle fullness, almond-shaped eyes, and textured hair that speaks to multifaceted genetic mixing', 168, 62, N'Medium frame with soft muscularity — not gym-toned but functionally strong from years of lifting, carrying, and moving children. Shoulders slightly rounded from years of hunching over toddler eye-level. Core strength evident despite relaxed posture.', N'Natural deep brown with early gray threading through', N'Flat twists, usually partially undone from daily contact with grabbing toddler hands', N'Medium', N'Deep brown, warm, habitually crinkling at corners from constant smiling', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden and olive undertones — sun-kissed complexion with natural depth, harmoniously blended from East Asian, Middle Eastern, Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, and Southeast Asian ancestry', N'Smooth, well-cared-for skin bearing the soft exhaustion of someone who works with small children — bags under eyes are gentle rather than harsh. Facial structure reflects the interplay of East Asian and Middle Eastern bone geometry (defined cheekbones, slightly tapered chin) softened and enriched by fuller features from Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and Indigenous American heritage. Expression defaults to patient attentiveness. Fine smile lines radiating from eyes.', N'Bioluminescent skin modification across entire body presenting as a faint golden-green luminescence that pulses gently at baseline and brightens noticeably with emotional shifts. The effect is most visible on darker skin and in lower light conditions. The modification creates an almost ethereal quality, especially in evening hours. Sub-dermal allergen sensor on right wrist visible only as a faint rectangular outline beneath skin, easily missed unless specifically looked for.', N'Moves with economical grace — no wasted energy, but not tense. Habitually maintains low center of gravity and flexible knees (trained for sudden child-related chaos). Sits frequently at child height. Hands are always slightly open and available. Voice modulation constant — drops in volume and pitch when children are present. Default expression is attentive and calm, even when managing chaos.', N'Tier 3 practical: durable, washable, child-proof. Usually wearing fitted but flexible pants (synthetic blend, easy-clean) and soft long-sleeved or short-sleeved tops in muted colors (grays, earth tones, navy) that hide stains. Flat, closed-toe shoes with good grip. A cardigan or soft jacket always within arm''s reach. No jewelry except a thin wrist chrono and a single small loop earring (nonbinary expression). Pockets are essential — filled with tissues, snacks, a small first-aid kit, and usually a toy or two. Appears deliberately non-threatening and approachable.', N'Three years ago they reported a parent for suspected neglect. The report was buried by a Tessera corporate liaison who turned out to be the parent''s employer. The child was eventually fine, but Patience has never trusted the formal reporting system again and has built their own informal network of building supers and neighbors to monitor at-risk children outside official channels.', N'Warm, measured, bilingual Basque-influenced cadence in longer sentences. Switches to very simple, clear language when explaining anything important — a habit from talking to toddlers all day that they haven''t fully switched off.', N'Slow and even. Rarely raises their voice. When they do, everyone stops.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aneta_oh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a677-7706-bc36-370ac941aa7e', N'Elke Im-Ingebrigtsen', N'Elke', N'', N'Im-Ingebrigtsen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone — rents a room above a fabrication collective, conducts fieldwork across the Gray Zone, near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'Sociologist studying the Gray Zone; independent researcher on semi-formal economic systems', N'Loosely affiliated with University Spine''s Department of Urban Social Systems; currently unfunded; occasionally publishes through a Tier 2 open-access cooperative called the Parallel Press', N'Elke Im-Ingebrigtsen is lean and long-limbed, with dark reddish-brown skin and a close beard going patchy at the jaw — he''s been meaning to fix that for two years. His irises have been modded with a slow-rotating geometric pattern in amber and charcoal, which he got as a fieldwork gift-exchange gesture with a community he was studying and then couldn''t bring himself to reverse. He wears the same three outfits in rotation and takes extremely good notes. He looks younger than thirty-four in bad light and much older in good light, depending on whether the worry lines are catching the glow.

He is one of the few Tier 3 academics who has chosen, deliberately and against significant professional advice, to live embedded in Tier 1-2 communities rather than commuting from the University Spine. His research on the Gray Zone informal economies — the gift networks, the barter systems, the E.L.F. offering economies, the nested mutual aid webs that allow people to survive well below the UBC stipend line — is quietly groundbreaking. He is uncomfortable with how groundbreaking it is, because breakthrough research means exposure, and exposure means the people he studies become subjects rather than neighbors. He has turned down two Axiom R&D grants and is running out of independent funding. He is cheerful about this in a way that does not fool anyone who knows him.', N'Ground-level information source about the Gray Zone communities and informal systems; moral compass figure who complicates protagonists'' assumptions; potential quest giver when someone he knows is in trouble', N'', N'Modded irises (amber/charcoal geometric pattern, cosmetic, community gift); basic neural recorder for fieldwork notes (entry-level, sometimes glitches)', N'Walks his neighborhood every morning as a combination of exercise and passive observation, sits in on community E.L.F. prayer sessions when invited, spends afternoons writing and evenings in conversation at whatever collective or gathering is happening nearby.', N'Elke Im-Ingebrigtsen, 34-year-old fieldwork academic in GLMZ 2226, medium golden-brown skin with warm peachy and subtle olive undertones reflecting mixed heritage—Northern European, East Asian, Indigenous American, Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Latin American ancestry. Angular face with moderate East Asian cheekbones, dark brown eyes with slow-rotating amber and charcoal geometric cybernetic implants, visible faint scars on left knuckle and right forearm. Short dark brown hair with auburn highlights, patchy unkempt beard. Tall lean frame (183cm), slight forward stoop from years of fieldwork. Wearing worn three-outfit rotation of mended gray and dark blue cotton-blend layers, thermal undershirt visible at collar, resoled hiking boots. Canvas fieldwork satchel with visible stains. Neural recorder port at left temple hairline. Forward-leaning posture, hands gesture with palms-up, knees drawn up. Occupational observer''s gaze tracking surroundings. Neo-noir academic aesthetic, worn authentic clothing, deep worry lines from chronic sleep deficit, minimal chrome augmentation. Indoor university or field documentation setting, cool overhead lighting casting sharp shadows that emphasize orbital hollows and facial structure, slightly tired but alert expression. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Cosmopolitan Diaspora blend: Northern European (36.8%), East Asian (24.7%), Indigenous American (13.1%), Southeast Asian (12.4%), South Asian (7.9%), and Hispanic/Latin American (5.1%). Results in a distinctive phenotype—medium golden-brown skin with warm peachy undertones balanced by subtle olive cast from South and Southeast Asian ancestry, angular facial structure with moderate cheekbones showing East Asian influence, eye shape distinctly East and Southeast Asian with slight epicanthic fold, dark brown hair with subtle auburn highlights from Northern European admixture. The genetic combination creates warmth across his complexion with cooler undertones in shadow areas, particularly around the orbital region.', 183, 71, N'Lean and long-limbed, slight forward stoop from years hunched over fieldwork notes; wiry rather than athletic, the build of someone who walks everywhere and forgets to eat', N'Dark brown with subtle auburn highlights', N'Short, close-cropped, slightly unkempt; appears to be cut every six months out of necessity rather than intention', N'Short', N'Modified: slow-rotating geometric pattern in amber and charcoal overlaying dark brown iris', N'Medium golden-brown with warm peachy undertones and subtle olive cast; shows the wear of daily outdoor fieldwork across variable weather. The tone reflects Northern European and East Asian admixture with Indigenous American warmth and South Asian depth.', N'Angular face with moderate cheekbones displaying East and Southeast Asian structure; close beard that grows patchy at the jawline and is visibly neglected (two-year maintenance gap evident); deep worry lines that deepen in direct light, making him appear significantly older than thirty-four; slight dark circles under eyes suggest chronic sleep deficit from note-taking and fieldwork. Facial contours show distinct East Asian influence in eye placement, orbital shape, and midface structure.', N'Modded irises with visible slow-rotating amber and charcoal geometric pattern — immediately noticeable during eye contact; pattern rotates in 12-second cycles. Neural recorder port barely visible at left temple (hairline-level, thin scar, minimal aesthetic intervention). No visible chrome or subdermal plating.', N'Forward-leaning walk as if always listening; hands gesture while speaking but palms-up rather than dominant; habitually touches temple (neural recorder engagement); sits with knees drawn up even in formal contexts; eyes track foot traffic and social groupings even during conversation — occupational observation habit', N'Tier 3 working academic: three-outfit rotation of durable, mended cotton-blend layers (grays, dark blues, earth tones); one slightly better set for University Spine presentations (unfashionable, carefully maintained); worn hiking boots resoled twice; carries a canvas fieldwork satchel with visible stains from multiple neighborhoods; no corporate logos; clothes show authentic wear rather than styled distress; thermal undershirt visible at collar in cold months', N'He has been quietly providing a detailed informal map of the Gray Zone mutual-aid networks to a University Spine colleague who he believed was writing a protection framework. He recently discovered his colleague has been selling the data to Ferrogate Transit for enclosure planning. He does not yet know what to do with this.', N'Accessible and warm, moves between academic register and colloquial the Gray Zone slang naturally; hates the word ''subjects'' for people', N'Fast and enthusiastic when excited, drops to quiet when serious in a way that makes people lean in', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'elke_im_ingebrigtsen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f5-776c-888d-3797466d357f', N'Aino Kjellberg', N'Aino', N'', N'Kjellberg', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Beat Cop, Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division — Hamtramck Enclave Patrol District', N'Aino Kjellberg has been walking the same eight-block stretch of Hamtramck Enclave for eleven years and knows it the way other people know their own bodies — by feel, by the small wrongnesses that signal something is off. He is a large man gone slightly soft in the middle, with a lined face, grey threading through his dark hair and the short beard he keeps carefully trimmed. His skin is a medium olive-brown. He has the deliberate gait of someone whose knees have opinions. He wears his Arcturus Civil Security uniform with the slightly rumpled dignity of a man who stopped trying to look sharp and started trying to look consistent.

Dragan is a beat cop of the old morphology — not particularly interested in arrest statistics, deeply interested in the neighborhood as a living system. He knows who runs the community market on Piast Street, which building''s water recycler is failing, where the teenage congregation spots are and which of them are benign. He has opinions about everything and shares most of them freely, which has kept him at the same pay grade for the last decade. He drinks too much coffee, worries about his daughter''s corporate debt, and has never once in thirty years of service drawn his weapon outside of a qualification range.', N'The neighborhood anchor — someone who knows this specific geography of Hamtramck Enclave better than anyone in an official capacity. Source of local intelligence, community history, and a surprisingly nuanced read on who is actually dangerous versus who looks it. Can be a protector or a complication, but never a simple obstacle.', N'', N'None cosmetic. Knee brace implant (medical, left knee). Standard-issue Arcturus Civil Security neural badge-link for ID verification and incident logging. Hearing enhancement in left ear (partial loss from a firearm incident in his twenties).', N'On foot by 0700, coffee from the same cart on Żurawia Cross, eight-block loop repeated four to six times per shift with variations depending on what he finds. Stops to talk. Knows most people by name within his beat. Files incident reports with meticulous detail that his supervisors find excessive.', N'Aino Kjellberg, 188cm tall neo-noir police detective in 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Warm golden-brown skin tone blending Nordic bone structure with Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage softness. Dark brown eyes with age lines mapping eleven years of street work. Salt-and-pepper trimmed beard, short dark brown hair. Solidly muscled but settled build, favoring right leg slightly. Grey-blue Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security tactical uniform, worn soft from use, Hamtramck district patch visible. Scuffed black polymer boots. Left ear neural interface port visible. Right hip chrome-polymer police badge-link. White scar along left temple. Deliberate posture, observant gaze slightly tilted listening expression. Standing in neon-lit Hamtramck district precinct, blue and amber light casting long shadows. Tired but focused street cop energy, 2200s neo-noir police procedural aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: Northern European 40.3% (fair base, Nordic bone structure), Southeast Asian 21.8% (eye shape, facial feature softness, pigmentation depth), Sub-Saharan African 13.3% (feature warmth, fullness, undertone richness), Eastern European 12.7% (cheekbone prominence, jaw definition), North African 6.7% (nose bridge character, bridge height), Hispanic/Latin American 5.2% (warmth, feature integration). Creates distinctive phenotype: Nordic-strong bone structure softened by Southeast Asian and African feature fullness, warm golden-brown complexion, balanced facial proportions reflecting global genetic convergence.', 188, 94, N'Large-framed, solidly muscled in shoulders and chest, softening at the middle from a decade of desk time and routine. Carries weight with the settled confidence of someone who no longer needs to prove anything physical.', N'Dark brown with grey threading throughout', N'Short, practical, combed back without styling product', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and observant', N'Warm medium-golden brown, balancing Northern European undertone with Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan depth and warmth. Even, sun-exposed complexion with consistent undertone throughout.', N'Heavily lined face, particularly around eyes and forehead — lines mapping eleven years of studying the same eight blocks. Strong Nordic cheekbone structure softened by fuller Southeast Asian and African feature heritage, creating balanced facial proportions. Well-maintained short beard, salt-and-pepper, trimmed with precision. Skin shows sun exposure and age without neglect. Nose bridge shows North African and Latin character — broad with subtle curve, integrated into Southeast Asian-influenced nasal structure.', N'Left ear shows subtle neural interface port behind the lobe (hearing enhancement). Slightly favors right leg when standing for extended periods due to left knee brace implant, though the limp is minimal and deliberate. Standard-issue Arcturus Civil Security neural badge-link sits at right hip — chrome and polymer hybrid, worn smooth from daily use.', N'Deliberate, economical gait with a slight favor to the right leg. Stands with hands often clasped in front or resting at duty belt. Moves through space as someone who has claimed it through repetition rather than dominance. Pauses frequently to observe, head slightly tilted — a listener''s posture.', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security regulation uniform: grey-blue tactical fatigues, reinforced canvas, worn to comfortable softness. Patches showing Hamtramck district and 11-year service bar. Scuffed black polymer boots, practical rather than polished. Coffee stains on cuffs are accepted rather than fought. Off-duty: durable working clothes — canvas jacket, thermal underlayers, no affectation.', N'He has been quietly supplementing the income of two families on his beat from his own wages — children whose parents are in Arcturus Civil Security holding on charges he privately believes are fabricated corporate compliance referrals. He has not reported what he suspects because he does not believe it would change anything.', N'Conversational, warm, full of neighborhood references and historical asides. Mixes Ghanaian-rooted expressions from his father''s side with a slight Eastern European lilt inherited from his mother''s family. Lectures affectionately.', N'Unhurried and digressive — he tells stories to make points, rarely goes in a straight line.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aino_kjellberg');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c1-79ec-a608-37ef2eb4e499', N'Amilcar Fredriksen-Banerjee', N'Amilcar', N'', N'Fredriksen-Banerjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spires — mid-level corporate residential towers, near Michigan Ave and Oak', N'Covert entry and social penetration specialist — infiltrator', N'Independent — Dockside connections', N'Amilcar Fredriksen-Banerjee is average height but with a presence that fills more space than the body accounts for. At 26, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rin — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Before the runner life, he worked corporate — low-tier security, the kind that teaches you exactly how the system''s defenses fail. He works as a infiltrator out of The Spires, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In a city full of people who talk about what they''ll do, Amilcar Fredriksen-Banerjee is one of the ones who actually does it.', N'Sagyn Ibarra-Prempeh functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rings. Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Amilcar Fredriksen-Banerjee, 2226 neo-noir infiltrator, 177cm lean and muscular build. Medium-deep warm bronze skin tone blending South Asian, Southeast Asian, East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Northern European genetics. High defined cheekbones, Southeast Asian facial proportions, full lips, dark eyes with chrome iris rings that glow faintly with thermal augmentation. Short dark brown hair, clean-shaven. Chrome hydraulic joint augmentations visible at elbows and knees. Dressed in charcoal tactical pants, fitted compression layer, black peacoat with armor plating. Minimalist chrome wrist accessories. Surgical scar on left temple. Economy of motion, quiet and centered posture. Standing in neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone street, low-light near-future megacity setting, cool blue and warm amber volumetric lighting hitting chrome augmentations. Moody, alert presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spires', N'local', N'The Spires', N'South Asian / Southeast Asian / East Asian / Sub-Saharan African / Northern European blend (Ubiquitous Diaspora phenotype) — predominantly South Asian (50.2%) with significant Southeast Asian (27.4%) genetic foundation, refined by East Asian (11.3%) bone structure and eye shape, warmed by Sub-Saharan African (7.9%) skin richness and facial fullness, with minimal Northern European (3.2%) influence. This produces: strong South Asian cheekbone prominence and jawline definition, Southeast Asian facial proportions and eye set, East Asian eye shape nuance and lid characteristics, Sub-Saharan African skin depth and lip fullness, subtle angular definition from Northern European ancestry. A genuinely composite face that reads as post-Diaspora rather than any single heritage.', 177, 74, N'Lean and functionally muscular — compact rather than bulky, built for efficiency and deception rather than intimidation. Shoulders slightly narrower than average, core visibly defined. The physiology of someone who trains for infiltration rather than combat.', N'Dark brown with subtle warm undertones', N'Short, cleanly maintained, minimal styling — practical. No affectation.', N'Short', N'Chrome iris rings over dark brown pupils — thermal and low-light augmentation visible as faint luminescent halos when activated', N'Warm medium-deep bronze — the result of 50% South Asian warm copper undertones blended with 27% Southeast Asian golden warmth, refined by East Asian cool undertones from the 11% contribution, and deepened by 7.9% Sub-Saharan African richness. The result is a complex warm-bronze that holds depth and luminosity. Sun exposure enhances rather than shifts the base tone.', N'Striking refined features combining South Asian cheekbone prominence with Southeast Asian facial proportions and subtle Sub-Saharan African fullness in the lips and lower face structure. High, defined cheekbones with characteristic South Asian angularity, warm-toned jawline that tapers with Southeast Asian refinement, full lips with natural depth, minimal facial hair — clean-shaven or closely trimmed. East Asian influence visible in the subtle lid shape and eye set. Skin condition excellent — well-maintained. Face has the quality of someone who has learned to be invisible; features don''t demand attention but repay it.', N'Chrome iris rings around both eyes with visible tech architecture — thermal overlay and low-light systems that produce a faint phosphorescent shimmer when active. Hydraulic joint articulation visible at elbows and knees — subtle mechanical definition in movement, slightly smoother than human biomechanics. Chrome plating on joint mechanisms catches light distinctly.', N'Economy of motion — every movement serves a purpose. Posture is relaxed but alert, shoulders naturally slightly forward. Gait is quiet and balanced, weight centered low for quick directional changes. His presence fills space through attention rather than volume — people orient toward him in crowded rooms without him demanding it.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian — high-end runner gear masquerading as casual. Fitted charcoal tactical pants with discreet cargo pockets and reinforced seams, neutral-tone compression layer or fitted turtleneck, outer layer is either a charcoal bomber jacket with smart-fabric lining or a custom black peacoat with subtle armor plating (visible only as structural weight). Minimalist chrome accessory — wrist comm or small jewelry that matches his eye augmentation chrome. No logos, no corporate branding. Everything worn has function; nothing is for show.', N'', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amilcar_fredriksen_banerjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a649-7c20-891b-383ebca497ee', N'Isadora Sepúlveda', N'Isadora', N'', N'Sepúlveda', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, Blackpipe Corridor terminal, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Ferrogate Transit operator, deep-line overnight driver on the Blackpipe Corridor route', N'Ferrogate Transit (mid-level ferrogate transit operator)', N'Isadora Sepúlveda has the particular quality of alertness that comes from years of watching dark tunnel walls for anomalies at speed — she tracks movement in her peripheral vision before she has consciously registered it, and her eyes, which are a modified shifting amber-to-silver gradient (a cheap iris job she got at twenty-two), are always slightly wider than the situation seems to require. She is of medium height with a broad-shouldered Polynesian build softened by her mother''s Ghanaian and her father''s Polish lines — she inherited cheekbones that catch light and hands that are disproportionately large and capable. She wears her black hair in two long braids that she tucks into her uniform jacket while on duty.

She drives the Blackpipe Corridor overnight run, which means she sees GLMZ in its most honest hours — the 02:00 cargo shifts, the exhausted nurses heading home, the people who ride the deep lines because they have nowhere to sleep that isn''t moving. She has a quiet protectiveness toward her passengers that she would not call protectiveness if asked. She would say she is just doing the job. She has a small secondhand speaker mounted against her operator partition that plays low, humming instrumentals during quiet stretches, and she has never been cited for it because none of her supervisors take the overnight inspection tour.', N'Mobile information source who has witnessed dozens of incidents on the overnight lines without reporting them; access point to the deep transit network and its unofficial rhythms; potential witness or reluctant ally for anything that happens on or near the Blackpipe Corridor', N'', N'Gradient iris modification (amber-to-silver, cosmetic). Fatigue-suppression implant in the brainstem, standard-issue Ferrogate Transit operator equipment — she distrusts it and uses it less than regulation requires.', N'Reports to Deepwell Station at 22:00, drives the Blackpipe Corridor loop four times before dawn, logs maintenance flags on the route, and is off the platform by 06:30. She sleeps from 08:00 to 15:00 in a transit worker''s residential block near Jefferson Switch, then spends her evenings at a gym or reading physical-format books she collects from the Burnished Market.', N'Isadora Sepúlveda, 168cm ferrogate transit operator, warm golden-olive skin with Southeast and South Asian cheekbone definition blended with Hispanic warmth, gradient amber-to-silver cybernetic eyes slightly misaligned, long black braids pinned under uniform collar, prominent high cheekbones, strong jawline with rounded contours, faint temple scar barely visible, expression alert with slightly raised eyebrows even at rest. Wearing charcoal-grey Ferrogate Transit uniform with reflective insignia, dark reinforced utility pants, scuffed steel-toed boots, worn grey-black transit jacket with collar up. Economical forward-leaning posture, hands partially open and ready. Night-shift pallor, darkness under eyes from exhaustion, sun-spared skin. Standing in neon-lit transit station, cool blue-grey lighting with amber accent lights reflecting off her skin. Compact functional strength in broad shoulders and forearms. GLMZ, working-class pragmatism, moody atmospheric lighting, cinematic composition --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Hispanic/Latin American (63.9%), Southeast Asian (20.1%), South Asian (12.4%), and East Asian (3.6%) — a Ubiquitous Diaspora blend producing warm, medium-depth skin with golden and olive undertones. Her features reflect this primary ancestry mix: the broader facial structure and warm coloration of Hispanic heritage, combined with the defined cheekbones and eye shape from Southeast and South Asian genetics, with subtle East Asian influence in her eye geometry and facial proportions.', 168, 68, N'Broad-shouldered and solid without being heavy — compact, functional strength in the shoulders and forearms from years of grip-work on control interfaces. Her frame carries the density of someone whose body does precise, sustained work.', N'Black, natural', N'Worn in two long braids, typically tucked into the collar or pinned beneath her uniform jacket during shifts', N'Long', N'Modified gradient amber-to-silver, shifting with angle and light. A cheap iris job done at twenty-two, slightly misaligned in low light.', N'Warm golden-olive with medium depth — the natural result of Hispanic/Latin American (63.9%), Southeast Asian (20.1%), and South Asian (12.4%) ancestry, with subtle East Asian influence (3.6%). Luminous in direct light, with an undertone that catches warmth in sunlight and holds golden richness in artificial lighting.', N'High, prominent cheekbones catching and holding light — characteristic of Southeast and South Asian genetics blended with Hispanic bone structure. Strong jawline with slightly rounded contours. Minimal facial scarring; skin shows the weathering of someone who works nights — slight darkness under the eyes, sun-spared but tired. Expression habitually alert, eyebrows slightly raised even at rest.', N'Gradient iris modification in both eyes (amber-to-silver, subtly uneven in dim light). No other visible chrome or subdermal hardware — the fatigue-suppression implant is entirely subcutaneous.', N'Economical, forward-leaning posture as if perpetually watching a horizon thirty meters ahead. She moves with deliberate stillness when stationary — minimal fidgeting — but her head turns frequently, tracking peripheral space. Her hands are always partially open, ready to grip. She walks with a transit worker''s gait: narrow stride, low center of gravity.', N'Ferrogate Transit uniform: charcoal-grey jumper with reflective Ferrogate insignia on the shoulders and chest, dark utility pants with reinforced knees, steel-toed boots (scuffed, well-maintained). Over this, a worn grey-black transit worker''s jacket with the collar up. Off-duty: functional, minimal — dark jeans, fitted dark sweaters, older running shoes. No jewelry except her operator tattoo. Everything is clean but heavily used. Tier 2 working-class pragmatism: no waste, no flash.', N'Six months ago she witnessed a body being loaded off her train at a dead stop between stations — two people in Axiom contractor vests, professional and unhurried. She made no report. She has been trying to forget it and cannot.', N'Pragmatic and economical, Ferrogate transit jargon woven throughout, occasional Hawaiian Pidgin phrases from her grandmother''s influence', N'Even and measured, the voice of someone trained to stay calm on the PA system regardless of what is happening', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'isadora_sep_lveda');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a672-7b35-944f-38519eb05b81', N'Hai Calvillo-Lewandowski', N'Hai', N'', N'Calvillo-Lewandowski', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor, near Lake Shore and Navy Pier', N'Street-Level Information Broker / Oral Historian', N'None formal. Trusted by multiple competing factions in Old Harbor specifically because he belongs to none of them. Has declined affiliation offers from smuggling operations, community defense groups, and one corporate ''community liaison'' program with memorable directness.', N'Hai Calvillo-Lewandowski is a large, slow-moving man with the specific gravity of someone who has decided to stop being in a hurry. Yoruba and Puerto Rican, he carries both heritages openly — a rotating collection of hand-dyed agbadas worn over thermal underlayers against the harbor cold, and a way of greeting people that involves actual sustained eye contact, which in Old Harbor is either deeply comforting or deeply unnerving depending on what you''ve done lately. His face is deeply lined, his beard gone fully white, his hands scarred from years of dock work before he transitioned into his current occupation. His only augmentation is a cochlear archive implant he had installed at fifty — it records everything he hears with his consent toggle on, and he keeps the toggle on almost always.

Femi has lived in Old Harbor for forty-one years, long enough to have watched three generations of families cycle through its tenements, its fishing operations, its smuggling economies, and its periodic brutal restructurings at the hands of corporate port interests. He is not a fixer, not a runner, not muscle. He is the person who knows where the bodies are buried because he attended the funerals. His currency is memory — who owes whom, which families have a blood grudge going back to the ''50s, which enforcement captain can be reasoned with and which one enjoys it too much. He trades information carefully, at his own pace, and has an intricate personal ethics about what he will and will not sell.

He runs a small legitimate operation: a repair stall for small watercraft and electronics near Pier 14, which gives him a reason to be everywhere and talk to everyone. He has no ambitions beyond Old Harbor. He has been offered relocation, money, protection, and has declined all of it. He says he is too old to learn a new set of names. What he means is that Old Harbor is the only place where he is fully himself, and he will not trade that for safety.', N'Living memory and moral compass for Old Harbor storylines. He provides historical context, relationship maps, and a street-level perspective grounded in decades rather than immediate survival. His archive implant makes him a walking evidence repository. His ethical complexity around the secret gives him a shadow side that prevents him from being purely a wise mentor figure.', N'', N'Cochlear archive implant (self-installed via back-alley augmentation clinic, age 50) — continuous audio recording with manual consent toggle; 41 years of selective archive stored on encrypted external drives in his stall,Arthritis management implant (basic, medical) — joint inflammation suppression in both hands', N'Up before dawn to watch the harbor, which he does not romanticize and cannot stop doing. Opens the repair stall by seven. Talks to everyone who passes. Works on actual repairs — he is genuinely skilled. Closes around six, eats with neighbors when invited, alone when not. Spends evenings annotating archive recordings with handwritten notes in a physical journal. Sleeps less than he should. Visits the same three graves in the Old Harbor community plot every Sunday morning.', N'An older man of mixed Eastern European, Indigenous American, and Hispanic/Latin American heritage, standing 188cm tall with substantial, weathered build. Dark mahogany-bronze skin deeply creased from decades of sun exposure, prominent high cheekbones, wide-set dark brown eyes conveying calm attentiveness. White close-cropped hair and neatly trimmed white beard. Scarred hands with pale old dock-work scars visible. Wearing hand-dyed rust-colored agbada over thermal layer, heavy canvas work pants, steel-toed boots. Small silver cochlear implant port visible behind left ear. Standing with economical posture in Great Lakes harbor setting, GLMZ, moody maritime lighting, worn authenticity, no corporate aesthetic, slow intentional presence, weathered pier background, cinematic realism --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Eastern European (52.6%), Indigenous American (25.2%), and Hispanic/Latin American (22.2%) ancestry creating a distinctly blended phenotype. Strong Eastern European foundation visible in bone structure and facial geometry, with pronounced Indigenous American cheekbones and facial width, warmed throughout by Hispanic/Latin American melanin contribution. The combination produces a weathered, richly-toned appearance that reflects decades of sun and wind exposure across all three ancestral streams.', 188, 104, N'Large-framed, broad-shouldered, softened with age but still substantial. Moves with deliberate slowness — not infirmity, but intentionality. The build of a man who spent thirty years doing physical labor and has earned the right to stop rushing.', N'White', N'Close-cropped, groomed but not fastidious', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Rich medium-bronze with warm golden undertones — the result of Eastern European baseline substantially deepened by Indigenous American and Hispanic/Latin American melanin. Sun-darkened from decades on the water into a deep, weathered mahogany-brown.', N'Deeply lined face with full white beard kept neatly trimmed. Prominent high cheekbones with strong Indigenous American structure softened by age and accumulated sun damage. Wide-set eyes characteristic of Indigenous American ancestry. Skin shows four decades of harbor exposure — wind-marked and weathered with consistent warm bronze tone throughout. Eyes carry the weight of accumulated knowledge; expression defaults to calm attentiveness. Facial geometry shows blended ancestry in pronounced cheekbone prominence, moderate facial width, angular jaw structure, and strong facial planes characteristic of the Eastern European and Indigenous American combination.', N'Cochlear implant visible as a small silver port behind left ear, often partially concealed by collar. No visible external interface — the archive exists on encrypted drives in his stall, not on his body. Arthritis implant is subcutaneous, invisible.', N'Stands with weight evenly distributed, rarely shifts quickly. Moves with economical precision — every motion purposeful. Maintains sustained eye contact during conversation, a habit that makes people either trust him immediately or become deeply uncomfortable. Gestures are spare but expressive with hands. Walks with the gait of someone who has learned to pace himself over distance.', N'Tier 4 / working-class authentic. Rotates through hand-dyed agbadas in rust, indigo, and ochre over thermal underlayers designed for harbor wind. Worn but meticulously maintained — fabric shows age but no holes. Heavy canvas work pants, steel-toed boots resoled multiple times. A dark wool coat that has belonged to him for at least fifteen years. No corporate logos, no artificial fiber where natural would suffice. Grooming is deliberate: beard oil, clean hands despite the work, clothes that announce his heritage without apology.', N'The archive implant contains testimony from a woman who died twelve years ago — she described, in detail, a killing carried out by a man who is now a respected community elder in Old Harbor. Femi has never disclosed this. He tells himself it''s because the woman asked him not to during her lifetime. He knows it''s also because exposing the elder would tear apart three families who have finally found stability.', N'Rich and unhurried, mixing English with Yoruba phrases and occasional Spanish that surfaces when he''s emotional. References historical events and people as if they were recent. Uses ''we'' more than ''I'' when talking about Old Harbor.', N'Slow, deliberate, full of pauses that are not uncertainty but emphasis. Storytelling rhythm — he builds. Rarely gives a direct answer before establishing context.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hai_calvillo_lewandowski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a637-7d78-a144-38af63cae902', N'Abeesh Dalgaard-Arredondo', N'Abeesh', N'', N'Dalgaard-Arredondo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 13, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Copperhead border, near North Ave and Damen', N'Street kid, gang prospect (junior), The Narrows', N'Copperhead Lacunae (prospect, unconfirmed), no formal affiliation', N'Abeesh Dalgaard-Arredondo is all sharp angles and nervous energy, a thin boy with dark olive skin, a shaved head that''s grown out uneven, and a jaw that''s set in a permanent expression somewhere between defiance and plea. His left eye has a cosmetic mod — a slit pupil in amber, gift from an older gang prospect who found it in a pawn bin and thought it was funny — that he wears with more pride than anything else he owns. He has a long scar across his right palm that he tells different stories about every time someone asks. He smells of the cheap rehydrated noodles sold from the Narrows carts, and his jacket has someone else''s name stenciled on the inside lining.

Abeesh Dalgaard-Arredondo is auditioning for membership in the Copperhead Lacunae — a street organization that controls mid-tier contraband flow through the Narrows — and he knows it''s an audition. He''s smart enough to know that being smart isn''t enough here; he''s trying to learn what enough looks like. He runs small errands, holds packages he''s not allowed to look inside, laughs at the right moments. Underneath this performance he is a child who has not slept in a bed with clean sheets in two years and who is starting to forget that this isn''t just how things are.', N'Humanizes the street gang pipeline; shows how children get recruited not through ideology but through proximity and need. Potential rescue target, moral weight, or unexpected ally for characters navigating the Narrows.', N'', N'One cosmetic slit-pupil mod in left eye (pawn-bin grade, occasionally glitches to fully dilated); no other mods', N'Wakes when he wakes in whatever squat the Lacunae prospects are using, does whatever task is assigned — usually package holding, lookout, or running small parcels — eats when there''s food, spends evenings near the older prospects hoping to be noticed.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Abeesh Dalgaard-Arredondo, 155cm wiry frame with sharp elbows and collarbones, warm medium-brown skin with golden olive undertones blending Hispanic/Latin American, South Asian, and Southeast Asian heritage, dark circles under eyes, full lips and strong jawline, patchy black hair shaved short with 1-2cm regrowth, right eye deep brown, left eye amber with cosmetic slit pupil mod glitching to full dilation, pale pink scar across right palm, cigarette burn on left wrist, fading yellowish-green bruise on left ribs, wearing oversized dark gray synthetic jacket with ''DONOVAN'' lettering, layered mismatched thermals (brown-black and navy), dark frayed cargo pants, high-top synth-leather boots with missing lace, hood pulled low over anxious expression, copper wire around left wrist, restless fidgeting hands, hunched posture, neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone alley at night, gritty street lighting, rain-slicked pavement, moody and tense atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Mixed ancestry: 43% Hispanic/Latin American, 22.2% Northern European, 16.2% South Asian, 7.5% Sub-Saharan African, 5.8% Southeast Asian, 5.3% East Asian. Features reflect this complex global blend — warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones from the Latin American, South Asian, and Southeast Asian contributions. Facial structure shows the width and angularity of Hispanic/Latin heritage combined with the bone prominence of South Asian ancestry, with subtle warmth and dimension from the Sub-Saharan and Northern European components creating a distinctly cosmopolitan appearance.', 155, 42, N'Wiry and undernourished, all sharp elbows and prominent collarbones. Muscle definition emerging from constant street movement, but overall frame suggests inconsistent nutrition. Posture hunched slightly forward as if bracing against cold that isn''t there.', N'Black with dark brown undertones', N'Unevenly shaved, grown out to roughly 1-2cm with visible patchy regrowth suggesting maintenance every 3-4 weeks with whatever blade is available', N'Short', N'Right eye: deep brown. Left eye: amber with cosmetic slit pupil (pawn-grade mod, occasionally glitches to full dilation)', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and olive undertones, weathered and sun-damaged from street exposure. Rich melanin undertones reflecting strong Hispanic/Latin American and South Asian heritage, complemented by warmth from Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Northern European ancestry blending into a unified complexion.', N'Youthful but prematurely hardened facial features with full lips and strong jawline structure reflecting Latin American and South Asian heritage. High cheekbones with slight prominence from South Asian ancestry. Jaw clenched habitually. Dark circles under both eyes. Occasional scab or healing cut on lips from biting. Skin shows signs of poor hygiene access but not infection — streets are clean enough for that. Expression oscillates between guarded wariness and desperate seeking of approval.', N'Left eye amber slit-pupil mod (cosmetic only, pawn-bin quality, occasionally malfunctions to full dilation creating unsettling fully-dilated appearance). No other visible augmentations. No subdermal implants visible.', N'Restless and kinetic — fidgets constantly with hands, shifts weight foot-to-foot even when standing still. Moves quickly through space with the efficiency of someone accustomed to needing to leave fast. Makes frequent eye contact (especially with older prospects) as if seeking validation. Flinches occasionally at loud noises. Shoulders habitually raised slightly toward ears.', N'Tier 5/sub-grade streetwear. Oversized dark gray synthetic jacket with faded stencil lettering inside lining reading ''DONOVAN'' (not his name). Underneath: layered mismatched thermals — one long-sleeve shirt in brown-black, another in navy with small hole near shoulder seam. Dark cargo pants with multiple pockets and external patches, cuffs frayed and caked with street dust. Cheap high-top synth-leather boots, one lace missing, replaced with frayed synthetic cord. No jewelry except a thin copper wire wrapped loosely around left wrist (gang indicator, loose/unofficial). Jacket hood worn frequently, pulled low.', N'He can read well — very well, better than most adults in his orbit — and he hides this. He found a cache of physical books in an abandoned space and visits it alone. He doesn''t know why hiding it feels necessary, but he does.', N'Narrows street slang, lots of clipped aggressive shorthand, but occasionally drops into a different, more careful register when he forgets to perform', N'Rapid and hard when performing toughness; slower and halting when he''s caught off-guard into honesty', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'abeesh_dalgaard_arredondo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a719-7c54-95d3-38d078e364c7', N'Babajide Nurzhanov', N'Babajide', N'', N'Nurzhanov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, Level 6 Trauma Wing; lives in Edgewater Prism, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Trauma surgeon and prosthetics integration specialist, Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Aurochs Medical Complex (senior attending, Level 4 staff tier); affiliated research agreement with Sterling-Nakamura prosthetics division', N'Babajide Nurzhanov is tall and angular, with a long face and the kind of silver-threaded dark hair they wear in a severe plait that their residents know means do not ask unnecessary questions today. Their skin is medium brown, fine-lined around the eyes and mouth in ways they have never had corrected and will not. Their left arm from the elbow is a Sterling-Nakamura prosthetic — their own work, integrated at the point of the original trauma, fitted and calibrated to their exacting standards, and significantly more capable than their standard clinical colleagues understand. The arm''s surface is a brushed dark alloy that they have kept deliberately unmarked, which in GLMZ''s ornamented medical culture is its own kind of statement.

Babajide Nurzhanov is renowned within Aurochs for outcomes and feared for feedback. They are exacting in the way that people become when they have decided that nearly-good-enough has a body count. They have no interest in personal relationships with their team beyond professional excellence, which does not stop residents from becoming deeply attached to them anyway. They have a single personal ritual: before any surgery, they spend two minutes at their workstation speaking quietly to the E.L.F. they call the Seam, which they believe inhabits the gap between biological tissue and synthetic integration — the threshold where their work actually happens. They do not describe this as prayer. They describe it as professional consultation.', N'Senior institutional figure with complex Sterling-Nakamura entanglement; moral authority within Aurochs who can be an ally or obstacle depending on what is being asked; point of access to high-level medical and corporate information', N'', N'Sterling-Nakamura full lower arm prosthetic (left, elbow down) — self-integrated and modified beyond factory spec; neural-haptic feedback array throughout residual limb interface; cosmetic: none by choice', N'They arrive before any resident, complete three to five major trauma or prosthetics integration surgeries daily, run a weekly teaching session they have never canceled in eleven years, and return to Edgewater Prism late to a very quiet apartment.', N'Babajide Nurzhanov, Central Asian-East Asian-South Asian blend phenotype, 182cm tall angular frame, warm medium brown skin with golden undertones, high prominent cheekbones, gray-brown eyes with warm amber flecks and deep crow''s feet. Dark brown hair with silver threading, long and braided tightly at crown. Brushed dark alloy Sterling-Nakamura prosthetic left arm from elbow down, no ornamentation, seven-degree articulation. Wearing dark charcoal surgical scrubs and deep navy fitted surgical coat. Ramrod-straight posture, right hand resting on prosthetic forearm. Focused neutral expression, monastic aesthetic. Neo-noir medical complex interior, cool surgical lighting, 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Mood: intense professional focus, deliberate composure. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Central Asian (63.6%) with significant East Asian (28.4%) and South Asian (8.0%) ancestry creates a distinctive Silk Road phenotype. The genetic blend produces characteristic high, prominent cheekbones and angular facial structure from Central Asian ancestry, refined by East Asian features, with warm undertones from South Asian heritage. This combination results in a unified warm-neutral complexion with subtle depth.', 182, 68, N'Tall and angular, with long lean musculature typical of someone who moves with precision and minimal wasted motion. Shoulders slightly asymmetrical due to the weight distribution of the prosthetic arm, but posture corrected through years of conscious adjustment.', N'Dark brown with natural silver threading', N'Severe plait, worn at the crown and secured tightly. The style functions as a nonverbal communication — residents and staff read the plait''s tension as an indicator of Babajide''s mood.', N'Long (shoulder-blade length when unbraided)', N'Warm amber-brown with prominent crow''s feet and the focused intensity of someone who has spent decades reading tissue and sutures', N'Medium warm brown — Central Asian base enriched by East Asian and South Asian ancestry, creating a unified complexion with golden undertones', N'Fine-lined around eyes and mouth — age marks deliberately chosen not to correct. High, prominent cheekbones with angular contours reflecting Central and East Asian ancestry structure. Skin is well-maintained but shows no cosmetic intervention. Expression typically neutral or concentrating; they smile rarely and with purpose.', N'Sterling-Nakamura prosthetic left arm from elbow down. The prosthetic surface is brushed dark alloy with no customization, ornamentation, or LED elements — deliberately unmarked in a medical culture that favors chromed and illuminated augmentations. The interface at the elbow shows precise calibration marks and a faint network of haptic feedback sensor points visible under the skin of the residual limb. The hand is articulated with seven degrees of freedom and moves with inhuman smoothness during surgery.', N'Posture is ramrod-straight, almost formal. Movement is economical and deliberate — no gesture wasted. When standing at rest, they often rest their right hand on the prosthetic arm''s forearm in a gesture that appears protective but functions as a calibration check. In surgery, their movements become balletic; the prosthetic arm''s precision allows micro-adjustments that biological surgeons require two hands to achieve.', N'Tier 3-4 professional: surgical scrubs in dark gray or charcoal (not the standard hospital blue), with a fitted surgical coat in deep navy that shows barely perceptible tailoring. Outside the Complex, they wear tailored but austere clothing — narrow-cut dark trousers, long-sleeved shirts in muted colors, a heavy wool coat in graphite. No logos, no ornament, no visible jewelry. Shoes are practical and expensive, broken in thoroughly. The overall effect is monastic, deliberate, and subtly intimidating.', N'The Sterling-Nakamura modifications to their prosthetic include a passive data-capture function they discovered eighteen months ago — it has been collecting biomechanical data from every patient they touch and transmitting it to Sterling-Nakamura''s research division. They have not removed it because they are not sure they legally can. They have told no one because they do not know what it means for every surgery they have performed since the modification.', N'Precise, dense, clinical — they speak in finished sentences with no hedging', N'Measured and deliberate, with a slight Czech-inflected pattern from their grandmother''s speech that emerges more strongly when they''re tired', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'babajide_nurzhanov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62f-7a50-900a-38ed019764a4', N'Congxi Cissé', N'Congxi', N'', N'Cissé', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Street medic and black-market organ broker', N'Unaffiliated; maintains careful neutrality between the Gray Zone factions as a condition of operating; has informal relationships with three different gang-adjacent organizations whose members she treats without political loyalty', N'Congxi Cissé is a broad-shouldered Ethiopian-Mexican woman whose hands tell two stories simultaneously: the left, calloused and scarred from decades of manual labor and back-alley surgeries performed without proper light; the right, a matte-black prosthetic from the elbow down fitted with micro-precise surgical attachments she machined herself from salvaged drone components. Her face carries the particular exhaustion of someone who has made peace with doing necessary things that are not good things, crow''s feet deep around eyes that still manage to hold genuine warmth even when the rest of her expression is locked down tight. She wears layered secondhand clothing in muted earth tones, always with at least one apron-style garment she can wipe blood on without losing composure.

She operates out of a converted fish-processing unit in the Gray Zone, where the smell of brine has soaked so deep into the concrete it masks the chemical antiseptic she burns through in quantity. Her waiting room is a collection of mismatched chairs and a hand-painted mural of the Virgin of Guadalupe overlaid with circuit-board halos, done by a patient who paid in art because they had nothing else. Congxi Cissé charges what people can afford, keeps meticulous paper ledgers because she doesn''t trust anything networked, and maintains a quiet, ruthless sideline sourcing and selling biological augmentation components to people who can''t access the licensed market. She tells herself the two practices balance each other out morally. Some days she believes it.

She was trained as a licensed surgical technician at a Spire-affiliated hospital before a patient advocacy dispute—she reported a harvesting irregularity, the hospital buried it, and she was the one who disappeared from the registry—stripped her credentials and left her with a skill set and nowhere sanctioned to use it. She has been in the Gray Zone for eleven years. She has delivered forty-three babies, closed wounds on perhaps three hundred people, and arranged the quiet transfer of organs whose provenance she prefers not to examine closely. She prays every morning. She sleeps about four hours a night.', N'Moral mirror and ground-level conscience; Imara represents the cost of systems that force ethical people into compromised positions, and her story asks whether complicity undertaken for good reasons eventually becomes indistinguishable from the thing you opposed', N'', N'Right arm prosthetic (elbow-down): self-modified surgical precision limb with interchangeable tool attachments, matte black, no cosmetic covering,Subdermal chemical analysis strip on left forearm: identifies common toxins and drug interactions on skin contact, salvaged Spire-era medical tech,Corrective ocular implant (left eye only): magnification and low-light function, visibly older generation with a faint amber tint to the iris', N'Wakes at 0430, makes coffee and prays, reviews paper ledger from the previous day. Clinic opens at 0600 and she works until the last patient leaves, which is rarely before 2100. Two evenings a week she runs triage training with Crick and two other the Gray Zone residents she''s slowly building into a basic care network. Broker contacts reach her through a dead-drop system in the fish market; she responds to those communications last, alone, after clinic hours. Eats one real meal a day, usually late, usually cold.', N'Congxi Cissé, 172cm surgical worker in GLMZ 2226, warm medium-deep brown skin with Sub-Saharan African cheekbones softened by Eastern European and East Asian refinement. Dark brown hair with silver threading pulled back tight, deep warm brown eyes with amber ocular implant glow. Right arm: matte-black prosthetic with surgical tool mounts and visible welding marks. Extensive surgical scars on hands, chemical burn on right jawline, faded surgical-cross-marigold tattoo on inner forearm. Worn layered work clothes in greys and earth tones, heavy apron, old grey wool coat, worn medical clogs. Standing in clinic shadow, economical posture, hands ready, eyes assessing. 16-hour shift wear visible in deep creases around eyes. Gold chain at neck. Professional, weathered, precise. Neo-noir medical aesthetic, lived-in exhaustion, cold fluorescent and shadow lighting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex diaspora blend: Sub-Saharan African (34.9%) forms the structural foundation with prominent cheekbones and defined jaw, while Eastern European (27.8%) adds refined bone structure and lighter undertones to the midface. Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (22.5%) contributes warmth and expressive depth; East Asian (11.5%) softens the overall angularity and refines the eye structure; Southeast Asian (2.9%) and South Asian (0.4%) add subtle warmth to complexion and eye tone. The phenotype is distinctly plurinational—a face that reads as authentically none and all of these ancestries simultaneously.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solidly built with dense muscle beneath a frame that carries the wear of four decades of physical labor; strong through the torso and legs, shoulders and back visibly developed from years of standing over surgical tables and manual manipulation', N'Dark brown with threaded silver at the temples and throughout', N'Pulled back in a functional braid or knot, sometimes tied with clinic tape or salvaged wire', N'Medium, chin-length when unbound', N'Deep warm brown with subtle golden undertones, left eye with faint amber luminescence from corrective ocular implant', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden and subtle reddish undertones from the balanced blend of Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry; weathered by sun and chemical exposure, developing a lived-in patina with visible texture variation', N'Strong, angular features with prominent cheekbones and defined jaw characteristic of Sub-Saharan African ancestry, refined and subtly softened by Eastern European bone structure and East Asian influence; deep crow''s feet and forehead creases marking decades of concentration; skin texture roughened around the hands from antiseptic exposure and scar tissue; a faint chemical burn mark along the right side of her jaw, pale and slightly raised, partially concealed by shadow', N'Right arm prosthetic from elbow down: matte-black composite construction with visible articulation points and interchangeable tool mounts; micro-precise surgical attachments visible when in use (fine forceps, micro-calibrated clamps, drug-delivery microneedles); the arm bears visible welding marks and hand-machined tooling marks from self-modification. Left eye: faint amber luminescence at the pupil, slightly older-generation aesthetic with visible microscopic lens artifact at the corner. Subdermal chemical analysis strip on left forearm visible as a faint raised grid pattern under the skin.', N'Carries herself with economical precision, minimal wasted movement; stands with weight balanced evenly, shoulders back but not squared in aggression—more in the posture of someone accustomed to standing for 16-hour shifts. Moves with deliberate calm even under pressure; hands are usually in motion, manipulating something or kept ready. Her right prosthetic arm moves with slight mechanical precision that contradicts the fluidity of her biological left. Eyes constantly assessing—people, exits, potential threats masked as professional habit.', N'Tier 4 working-class, practical and layered: worn but maintained second-hand base layers in earth tones (grey, brown, olive), reinforced work pants in dark canvas, heavy apron-style garments (usually canvas or absorbent linen) that can be discarded or washed without emotional attachment. Wears a decades-old grey wool coat over everything in cold months. No visible branding; everything chosen for function and cost. Practical footwear: worn medical clogs or reinforced work boots. A thin gold chain around her neck (predating the Gray Zone, possibly inherited). Hands are bare—no jewelry that could snag during procedures.', N'Three of the organs she has brokered came from individuals who were not, at the time of extraction, fully deceased. She didn''t perform the extractions. She told herself she didn''t know. She knew.', N'Medical precision mixed with the Gray Zone vernacular; code-switches between clinical terminology and neighborhood Spanish/Amharic endearments depending on patient distress level; avoids corporate jargon with visible contempt', N'Measured and low, with a habit of finishing sentences completely before pausing—she was trained to give information clearly and has never lost the pattern; accelerates only when angry, which she works hard to prevent', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'congxi_ciss');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65e-73ff-8f4c-39001c8d42de', N'Leszek Nurzhanov', N'Leszek', N'', N'Nurzhanov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor, occasionally the Gray Zone, near Michigan Ave and Roosevelt', N'Underground Data Broker / Informal District Mapper', N'Unaffiliated; sells to all parties; maintains careful records of who has bought what to ensure no single faction gains navigational advantage over the others', N'Leszek Nurzhanov is a broad-shouldered man with deep umber skin, close-cropped natural hair going prematurely silver at the temples, and eyes that never quite settle on any single point in a room—always cataloguing, always measuring distances. His left arm from elbow to fingertip is a salvaged industrial prosthetic, mismatched plating in gunmetal grey and corroded copper that he has never bothered to cosmetically upgrade, wearing the patchwork as a kind of credential. He dresses in layered thermals and a faded orange dockworker''s vest covered in hand-stitched pockets, each one holding something specific he could name without looking.

He grew up in Old Harbor when it still had functioning fish processing infrastructure, the child of a Kenyan maritime engineer father and a Norwegian logistics coordinator mother who both disappeared into the corporate restructuring that gutted the district''s working economy. Leszek Nurzhanov survived by learning what the city planners never published: the actual geography of GLMZ, the tunnels under the Gray Zone that don''t appear on any civic map, the blind spots in The Circuit''s surveillance grid, the forgotten loading bays along the Harbor that still connect to the Meridian Core''s service infrastructure. He sells this knowledge in careful, calibrated portions.

His reputation is for scrupulous neutrality—he will sell maps and routing data to almost anyone, and almost everyone in the mid-tier underworld knows it, which means he has accumulated a precarious kind of protection through mutual dependency. He lives in a converted cold-storage unit he has made surprisingly livable, its walls covered in hand-drawn maps that are more accurate than anything in any city database, and he trusts almost no one completely, including himself.', N'Information broker and moral compass by negative space—his neutrality forces other characters to confront what they are actually asking for; also functions as a living record of Old Harbor''s lost history', N'', N'Salvaged industrial prosthetic left arm (elbow to fingertips), mismatched plating, has subtle haptic feedback modifications he installed himself,Subdermal encrypted data storage along the right forearm, capacity modest but air-gapped from all networks,Ocular overlay in left eye only, mapping-grade, no biometric capture', N'Rises before dawn to walk the Harbor and update his physical maps with overnight changes—new barricades, closed passages, altered lighting. Eats once in the morning, usually something he has prepared in bulk. Receives clients by appointment only, never more than three per day. Spends evenings drawing. Does not own a functioning communication device that is tied to his name.', N'Leszek Nurzhanov, 188cm tall, weathered and muscular, GLMZ GLMZ. Warm deep brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Central Asian, Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, North African, and Northern European heritage. High angular cheekbones, fuller lips, dark eyes with amber ocular overlay glinting in light. Black hair with silver at temples, close-cropped. Thin 8cm scar running left temple to jawline. Left arm salvaged prosthetic hardware—gunmetal grey and oxidized copper from elbow down, weathered industrial aesthetic. Wearing faded orange vintage dockworker''s vest over grey thermals, weathered grey cargo trousers, practical heavy boots. Long dark green canvas fieldcoat. Subdermal data grid scars visible on right forearm. Posture economical and alert—weight centered, eyes constantly measuring distances and sightlines. Urban industrial setting, cool neon and concrete ambiance, natural weathered lighting, contemplative mood, hands near pocket or wall surface, measuring everything. Neo-noir utilitarian aesthetic, no corpo branding. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Central Asian (29.5%), Eastern European (20.8%), Sub-Saharan African (18.4%), North African (16.0%), and Northern European (15.3%) ancestry creates a striking multifaceted phenotype. The Central Asian heritage dominates facial structure with high, prominent cheekbones and angular features. Sub-Saharan and North African ancestry contribute to fuller lips and warm undertones. Eastern European and Northern European heritage add definition to the jawline and eye shape. The overall effect is powerfully cosmopolitan—a face that embodies the Ubiquitous Diaspora without clear singular origin.', 188, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and densely muscled through manual labor, tapering slightly at the waist—the build of someone accustomed to precise, sustained physical work rather than explosiveness', N'Natural black with premature silver at the temples', N'Close-cropped, neat, shaped by habit rather than vanity', N'Short', N'Dark brown (natural); left eye contains subtle amber-tinted ocular overlay', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden undertones—the result of Central Asian warmth mixed with Sub-Saharan and North African melanin, brightened by Eastern European and Northern European ancestry. Weathered by constant outdoor exposure, showing deep creasing from years of concentrated work.', N'Weathered but maintained—lines radiating from the corners of dark brown eyes from constant squinting at distances and reading maps, deep concentration creases across the forehead. High, defined cheekbones with Central Asian structure. Fuller lips characteristic of Sub-Saharan and North African heritage. Moderate-width nose reflecting the blend of ancestry. Angular jaw from Eastern European heritage. No facial hair, clean-shaven daily. Skin shows the patina of constant outdoor work but careful maintenance.', N'Left arm prosthetic from elbow to fingertips: industrial-grade salvaged hardware with mismatched plating in gunmetal grey and oxidized copper, deliberately unupgraded and weathered. The joint work is visible and functional rather than aesthetic. Left eye contains a faint amber shimmer when light catches it—the ocular overlay''s edge visible only in profile. Subdermal data storage along right forearm visible as a faint series of geometric scars forming a grid pattern beneath the skin, always covered but occasionally glimpsed when clothing shifts.', N'Stillness is his default state—when standing, weight centered, shoulders back but not rigid. Eyes in constant, unconscious motion even when his body is motionless, cataloguing angles and distances. When moving, economical: no wasted motion, footfalls deliberate and quiet. Hands remain occupied—adjusting clothing, touching wall surfaces as he passes, checking pocket contents through fabric. When engaged in conversation, he maintains direct eye contact but his gaze occasionally drifts to measure doorways, sightlines, exit proximity.', N'Tier 4 working-class utility: layered thermals in muted greys and blacks beneath a faded orange dockworker''s vest (genuine vintage, not reproduced) with dozens of hand-stitched pockets, each one containing something specific—tools, samples, rolled papers. Lightweight cargo trousers in weathered grey canvas, reinforced at knees and thighs. Heavy boots, practical rather than fashionable, resoled multiple times. A long fieldcoat in dark green canvas, treated for water resistance, multiple interior pockets. No visible branding or corpo affiliations; clothing chosen for function and repairability. Everything shows wear but nothing shows neglect.', N'He found evidence two years ago suggesting his mother did not disappear but defected voluntarily to a Spire-adjacent corporate security firm. He has not followed up on it. The map to that truth hangs on his wall with a blank space where the destination should be.', N'Practical, spatial, navigational metaphors; mixes English with occasional Swahili phrases when tired or caught off-guard; avoids abstractions, prefers concrete nouns', N'Measured and even, speaks in complete sentences, pauses before answering questions as if running a route check', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'leszek_nurzhanov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a61e-75d5-b30d-39057fa31a64', N'Fumiko Sabbagh-Migizi', N'Fumiko', N'', N'Sabbagh-Migizi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, Ironvein sub-block, bay unit 7, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Independent vehicle mechanic specializing in Ferrogate Transit auxiliary vehicles and civilian cargo crawlers', N'Independent; informal contract relationships with Ferrogate Transit auxiliary depot', N'Fumiko Sabbagh-Migizi is lean and grease-darkened in a way that feels permanent, as though the machine oil has become part of his pigmentation — his hands are always a shade darker than his forearms no matter how much he scrubs. He has his mother''s Ghanaian cheekbones and his father''s Kazakh jaw, which together give him a face that people find hard to stop looking at without knowing quite why. He keeps his hair close-cropped except for two finger-wide stripes he has dyed iridescent copper, a remnant of a decade-old fashion he never bothered to give up. He has a prehensile tail modification — mottled gray-brown with a slightly prehensile curl — that he got at nineteen and has used as a third utility limb ever since: it holds tools, hooks parts bins, and occasionally taps impatiently on the floor when he is thinking.

Fumiko Sabbagh-Migizi is constitutionally incapable of leaving a broken thing alone. This is a professional gift and a personal curse. His bay is organized with the obsessive logic of a man who has lost a critical component one too many times and never forgot it. He is not unfriendly but he is focused, and conversations with him often drift sideways into the mechanics of whatever he happens to be working on. He keeps a small ELF shrine mounted above his main workbench — a figure he calls Grease Aunt, fashioned from fused capacitors and old gasket rings — and consults it before any job that involves a vehicle with a history of instability.', N'Reliable repair and gear contact for anyone needing vehicle access or maintenance information; knows the Ferrogate Transit auxiliary fleet''s unofficial quirks intimately; can identify vehicle origins and modifications; potential hook into Geartown criminal infrastructure through what he sees without asking', N'', N'Geneware prehensile tail (gray-brown, partial prehensility). Subdermal tool-link ports in left forearm for direct diagnostic handshake with vehicle systems. Iridescent copper hair stripes (pigment geneware, low-grade).', N'Arrives at bay 7 by 07:30, runs diagnostic queues on anything left overnight, spends most of the day underneath or inside machines, eats a flatbread he buys from the cart outside while reviewing job lists, and often stays past midnight if something has him genuinely puzzled.', N'Fumiko Sabbagh-Migizi, a 178cm lean-muscular mechanic in GLMZ, warm medium-deep brown complexion with rich layered undertones—Indigenous American, Sub-Saharan African, Middle Eastern and Northern European ancestry visible in strong angular cheekbones and intense dark brown eyes. Black hair close-cropped with iridescent copper temple-to-crown stripes. Faint burn scar left cheekbone. Permanently grease-stained hands and forearms. Muscular prehensile tail, mottled gray-brown, emerging from spine, curling around tool racks. Wearing heavy canvas work vest over charcoal undershirt, Ferrogate gray-blue work pants with reinforced knees, scuffed steel-toed boots. Leather work gloves on left hand. Thin worn brass bracelet right wrist. Crouched half-bent posture in industrial garage setting with hydraulic lifts and engine blocks, hands fidgeting with tools. Direct focused expression. Neon workshop lighting casting cyan and amber shadows on metal and concrete. Neo-noir gritty aesthetic, practical working-class functional style --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Indigenous American (40%) / Sub-Saharan African (24.5%) / Middle Eastern (24%) / Northern European (11.5%) - a complex diaspora blend creating warm, nuanced skin tones with layered undertones. Strong angular bone structure from Indigenous American ancestry with prominent cheekbones and defined jaw from African heritage. Middle Eastern features contribute to his alert, intense gaze and facial angularity. Northern European ancestry adds subtle cooler undertones and refined definition to his overall appearance.', 178, 72, N'Lean and muscular with ropey forearm definition from two decades of wrench work; chest and shoulders have the kind of practical strength that comes from lifting and maneuvering engine blocks, not gym routines. His core is tight—mechanics spend half their lives reaching into tight spaces.', N'Black with two finger-wide iridescent copper stripes running from temple to crown', N'Close-cropped fade on sides and back; stripes visible from multiple angles; minimal styling, maximum practicality', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and focused', N'Warm medium-deep brown with complex undertones—rich warmth from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, golden highlights from Indigenous American heritage, subtle olive-clay undertones from Middle Eastern lineage, and cooler Northern European influence creating a richly layered complexion. Permanently darkened by embedded machine oil and grease that resists complete removal, particularly on hands and forearms.', N'Weathered but not aged; his face displays strong angular cheekbones and defined jaw characteristic of his mixed heritage—prominent bone structure from Indigenous American and African ancestry, sharpened by Middle Eastern features creating intense, focused expression. His hands and forearms are visibly darker than the rest of his body from permanent grease staining. Small burn scar on left cheek from a hydraulic coupling failure eight years ago.', N'Prehensile tail emerges from base of spine at coccyx, approximately 1.2 meters long when fully extended, mottled gray-brown with slight scale-texture. Tail is muscular and semi-flexible, capable of fine manipulation and tool-gripping. Subdermal tool-link ports in left forearm are invisible unless closely inspected—appear as faint scar tissue. Iridescent copper hair stripes are functional geneware pigmentation, not dye.', N'Moves with economical precision; no wasted motion. Often half-bent or crouched even when standing still, as though perpetually preparing to slide under a vehicle. His tail curls idly around tool racks or his own leg when he''s concentrating, taps a slow rhythm on concrete when he''s problem-solving. Hands are never completely still—fidgeting with tools, checking fasteners, or gesturing explanations. Makes direct eye contact when discussing mechanical problems but can seem distant in social small talk.', N'Tier 3 working-class pragmatism. Uniform consists of heavy canvas work pants (Ferrogate Transit gray-blue) with reinforced knees and multiple cargo pockets, worn soft and stained with hydraulic fluid and grease. Sleeveless or short-sleeved undershirt (usually black or charcoal to hide stains) underneath a canvas work vest or lightweight jacket when weather demands. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and re-heeled multiple times. Leather finger gloves (left hand, custom-fitted around tool-link port forearm) for diagnostic work. No jewelry except a thin brass bracelet on his right wrist—a gift from his mother, dented and worn. His personal style is minimal but intentional: the copper hair stripes are his one deliberate aesthetic choice, a holdover from his twenties that he''s never bothered to abandon. Everything else is function.', N'He has been covertly maintaining a Ferrogate Transit emergency crawler that he rebuilt from scrap — it is not registered anywhere and he uses it occasionally to move people who need to get somewhere without being tracked, never charging them, telling himself it is just a test run', N'Technical vocabulary bleeds into everything; uses mechanical metaphors constantly without noticing; drops into Twi occasionally when frustrated', N'Rapid when explaining something he knows well, halting and mid-sentence-stopping when trying to talk about feelings', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fumiko_sabbagh_migizi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d8-70d7-8d4d-390605099a17', N'Saskia Ibarra-Nygaard-Vestergaard', N'Saskia', N'', N'Ibarra-Nygaard-Vestergaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenosha Crossing transit hub, sleeping berth corridor B-7, near beyond the Western Perimeter', N'Wandering cartographer and hyperlane migrant', N'None — loosely respected by several nomad caravans as a neutral resource', N'Saskia Ibarra-Nygaard-Vestergaard is a tall, drought-weathered woman with the broad cheekbones of her Botswanan grandmother and the pale grey eyes she inherited from somewhere in the Bulgarian line. Her skin is the color of cracked clay, deeply lined around the eyes and mouth from decades of squinting at horizon lines. She wears a patchwork duster covered in hand-sewn pockets, each holding a rolled paper map — actual paper, a near-mythological material in GLMZ — annotated in four different scripts. No cosmetic mods; her only concession to technology is a battered retinal overlay that flickers at the edges because she can''t afford calibration.

Saskia Ibarra-Nygaard-Vestergaard spent thirty years mapping the hyperlane rest stops between the Great Lakes and the Gulf the Gray Zone, and there is no one who knows the informal infrastructure of drifter life better. She speaks with the deliberate economy of someone who has learned to make every sentence count because silence is the only privacy a transient gets. She is neither sentimental nor cruel — she has simply seen too much to be surprised by either kindness or brutality, and treats both as weather.', N'Information source and orientation guide — she knows where drifter camps are, which checkpoints are bribeable, which hyperlane segments are currently dangerous, and which E.L.F.s are venerated at which rest stops.', N'', N'Flickering retinal overlay (third-hand, poorly calibrated). No geneware. A healed fracture in her left wrist repaired with cheap calcium-bonding paste leaves a visible ridge under the skin.', N'She rises before the transit hub''s artificial dawn cycle, trades map copies for food credits or information, and walks every corridor of whatever transit space she inhabits to update her charts before moving on within three to five days.', N'Saskia Ibarra-Nygaard-Vestergaard, 182cm tall cartographer in GLMZ, medium warm-toned skin with golden-bronze undertones, sun-weathered and deeply lined face, pale grey eyes with left retinal overlay grid glitching faintly, grey-brown salt-and-pepper hair in practical braid, scar at left temple. Wearing faded beige-grey patchwork canvas duster covered in 30 hand-sewn map pockets with visible repairs, grey compression shirt, charcoal cargo trousers, scuffed multi-resoled boots. Lean sinewy build, shoulders slightly hunched from decades of mapwork, hands perpetually moving with ink stains on fingertips. Standing in transit hub between climate zones, harsh artificial lighting casting shadows across her weathered features, permanent ridge visible on left wrist from calcium-bonding repair. Gaze fixed on an invisible hyperlane route, economical posture, worn but purposeful. Neo-noir nomad aesthetic, utilitarian, timeless, exhausted but focused. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenosha Crossing transit hub', N'local', N'Kenosha Crossing transit hub', N'Predominantly Northern European (63.8%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (14.4%), Indigenous American (8.7%), and Pacific Islander (7.8%) ancestry, plus minor Sub-Saharan African (3.3%) and South Asian (2.0%) contributions. This genetic blend produces medium-toned skin with warm golden and bronze undertones, where Northern European fairness is enriched by the warmth and depth from Hispanic, Indigenous American, and Pacific Islander heritage, then subtly deepened further by African ancestry. The result is a sun-weathered complexion with complex layered undertones—neither pale nor dark, but distinctly warm and alive beneath the damage.', 182, 68, N'Lean and sinewy from decades of walking hyperlane corridors; all functional muscle with minimal fat, shoulders slightly hunched from years bent over cartographic work', N'Grey-brown, salt-and-pepper with streaks of ash', N'Pulled back in a loose, pragmatic braid, secured with whatever wire or cord is at hand', N'Medium', N'Pale grey, slightly rheumy at the inner corners; the left iris has a faint grid pattern from the flickering retinal overlay', N'Medium with warm golden-bronze undertones. Fair Northern European baseline enriched by Hispanic, Indigenous American, and Pacific Islander warmth, then deepened by Sub-Saharan African and South Asian heritage into a sun-weathered medium tone. Decades under harsh artificial transit hub lighting and open hyperlane sun exposure have created an uneven, deeply tanned patina with visible freckling and age spots across the shoulders and forearms, but the underlying warmth remains distinctly visible.', N'Deeply lined face, particularly around eyes and mouth—rictus lines from perpetual squinting at maps and screens. Skin has papery, sun-damaged texture of chronic dehydration and UV exposure, with warm golden-bronze undertones reflecting the Hispanic, Indigenous American, and Pacific Islander heritage. High, prominent cheekbones with moderate width across the face. Strong, defined jaw with slight squareness blending Northern European and Indigenous American features. Clean but unadorned; no makeup. A faint scar along her left temple, barely visible unless light hits it directly. Scattered sun damage and freckling across shoulders.', N'Left retinal overlay visible as a faint grey-white geometric grid flickering at the iris edge, with occasional chromatic aberration (faint red/blue fringing) indicating poor calibration. The device sometimes glitches, causing her left eye to jitter slightly. Otherwise no visible augmentation—the calcium-bonding repair on her wrist appears organic.', N'Upright but economical; she moves with the careful precision of someone who has learned to conserve energy over long distances. Her gait is steady and unhurried, with a slight favoring of her right side. She tends to walk the perimeter of spaces rather than cutting across them—mapping as she goes. Her hands move constantly when at rest, fingers twitching as if annotating invisible charts.', N'Tier 4-5 nomad utility wear. A long patchwork duster of faded synthetic canvas and worn linen, dyed in multiple washes to a mottled beige-grey, covered in approximately thirty hand-sewn pockets of varying sizes and materials—each pocket holding rolled paper maps. The duster has visible repairs done with different thread colors, a collage of temporary fixes. Underneath: a grey long-sleeved compression shirt (Tier 4 surplus, pre-owned), the cuffs frayed. Loose-fitting cargo trousers in charcoal synthetic, knees reinforced with stitched patches. Boots: scuffed, resoled multiple times, practical, non-brand. A thin polymer raincoat rolled and tied to her pack. No jewelry, no logos, no status markers. Everything designed for transit between climate-controlled hubs and exposed hyperlane routes.', N'She has a complete, updated map of the Q-zero ghost communities — people with zero digital identity — hidden inside the lining of her duster. At least two corponation intelligence divisions would pay significantly for it. She has never sold it and does not intend to.', N'Precise, geographic, uses cardinal directions and distances even in conversation. Mixes Setswana phrases with Bulgarian-inflected cadence.', N'Measured and unhurried, with long pauses before answering questions as if calculating distance', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'saskia_ibarra_nygaard_vestergaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60f-75d7-8de4-3932bea0ba0d', N'Vladislav Balasanyan', N'Vladislav', N'', N'Balasanyan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Glassway — corporate-adjacent retail district, heavy surveillance, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'High-speed vehicle operations specialist — wheelman', N'Independent — Dockside connections', N'Vladislav Balasanyan is compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 58, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. He works as a wheelman out of Glassway, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Vladislav Balasanyan has built a reputation on reliability rather than flash — he shows up, he delivers, he collects.', N'Fanta Popov-Adjei functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons. Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Vladislav Balasanyan, GLMZ, compact muscular Eastern European-Middle Eastern man with warm olive skin, salt-and-pepper close-cropped hair, dark brown eyes with neural scarring, high cheekbones and strong jaw. Right temple marked with three parallel tribal scars, right forearm bearing smartgun link port with brushed steel housing and blue LED. Worn titanium signet ring, reinforced charcoal synth-leather jacket over smart-weave undershirt, heavy cargo pants with knee armor points, steel-toed boots. Military posture, sitting with back to wall, eyes tracking movement. Neural interface jack visible at base of skull. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon-lit underground station, amber and blue lighting, weathered functionality, tactical alertness. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Glassway', N'local', N'Glassway', N'Eastern European and Middle Eastern dominant (69.7%), with significant Northern European (17.7%) and minor South Asian (9.8%) and Sub-Saharan African (2.8%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a striking Eurasian phenotype — sharp Eastern European bone structure (high cheekbones, strong jaw) merged with Middle Eastern facial breadth and warmth. Northern European undertones cool the complexion while South Asian and African ancestry add subtle richness to skin depth and warmth. The synthesis produces a weathered Mediterranean-Caucasian appearance with Middle Eastern softness counterbalancing Slavic angularity.', 168, 79, N'Compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground with a center of gravity that favors lateral movement and impact absorption. Shoulders broad relative to frame, legs thick and powerful. No excess fat — the physique of someone who treats their body as operational equipment.', N'Salt-and-pepper gray with darker streaks', N'Close-cropped, military neat', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint network scarring in left iris from old neural interface burn', N'Medium warm olive — Northern European base enriched by Eastern European and Middle Eastern ancestry, with depth added by South Asian and Sub-Saharan African admixture. Weathered from years of outdoor contract work with visible sun damage but resilient texture. The complexion carries genuine warmth despite cool undertones, distinctly Mediterranean rather than Scandinavian.', N'Blended Eurasian features: high angular cheekbones with slight fullness through the midface typical of Middle Eastern ancestry, broad forehead, pronounced jawline characteristic of Eastern European heritage. Eyes set with moderate depth. Face marked by fine lines around eyes and mouth from years of tactical focus and squinting. Clean-shaven with visible five-o''clock shadow. Scar tissue visible along right jawline, thin and pale against warm skin tone. Skin texture weathered but maintained — evidence of functional discipline.', N'Smartgun link port protruding slightly from right forearm near wrist — brushed steel housing with faint LED indicator that cycles blue when powered. Neural interface jack at base of skull beneath close-cropped hair — visible as a small metallic disc when head is angled or hair shifts. Both modifications show functional age and routine maintenance rather than cosmetic polish.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, weight distributed low. Sits with back always to wall or corner. Right hand unconsciously rests near smartgun link integration point. Eyes track movement vectors in crowds. Walks with slight favoring of left leg during extended periods — residual compensation from old injury. Overall bearing suggests someone perpetually aware of nearest exits and vehicle trajectories.', N'Tier 3-4 practical — reinforced synth-leather jacket in faded charcoal over smart-weave undershirt that monitors vitals. Heavy cargo pants with mag-sealed pockets and knee armor integration points. Steel-toed ankle boots with grip-sole designed for vehicle footwork. Minimal branding — function over identification. One piece of jewelry: worn titanium signet ring on left ring finger, inherited from his mentor. No visible corp-affiliation markers.', N'', N'Educated vocabulary wrapped in street delivery — the contrast is deliberate.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'vladislav_balasanyan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a644-72e5-bb12-3a1ab9fc13ed', N'Anshul Bergqvist-Ozcoidi', N'Anshul', N'', N'Bergqvist-Ozcoidi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 43, NULL, 45, 2, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Kedzie and Division', N'Fixer - Dojo-connected', N'The Crucible', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'GLMZ, a 43-year-old mixed-heritage fixer named Anshul Bergqvist-Ozcoidi with East Asian primary features and warm Indigenous American-Middle Eastern depth, golden-bronze skin with olive undertones, deep brown observant eyes, dark brown hair with silver at temples worn short and precise. 185cm tall, athletic lean build with functional muscle definition. Clean-shaven, angular jawline and moderate cheekbones, fine lines from four decades of work. Thin white scar across left knuckles, small circular burn scar on right forearm, faint Sankofa tattoo on inner left wrist. Wearing charcoal henley under fitted grey tactical jacket unbuttoned to show harness and tools, dark tailored trousers, scuffed synth-leather boots, simple gunmetal bracelet. Centered posture, economical movement, deliberate calm bearing. Standing in shadowed Great Lakes Metro mid-tier the Gray Zone environment, cool neon undertones mixing with warm ambient lighting, professional and controlled, neither threatening nor submissive, hands naturally at sides, slow scanning gaze. Mood: seasoned operative, reliable and discreet --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly East Asian (46.8%) with substantial Middle Eastern (24.8%) and Indigenous American (19.4%) ancestry, creating a striking tricontinent blend. The facial structure reflects East Asian primary features—moderate cheekbones with slight forward projection, straight nose bridge, angular jawline—enriched and warmed by Middle Eastern bone structure and Indigenous American depth in facial proportions. Southeast Asian (3.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (2.8%), and Northern European (2.3%) provide subtle undertones in skin warmth and minor feature variation. The synthesis creates a distinctly pan-Asian appearance with warm, earthy undertones from the Americas and Middle East', 185, 89, N'Athletic and lean with evident muscle definition from decades of martial discipline; shoulders broad but not bulky, suggesting functional strength over bulk', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples', N'Kept short and precise, faded sides with slightly longer top, always groomed', N'Short', N'Deep brown, warm but observant', N'Warm golden-bronze with olive and amber undertones from the East Asian, Middle Eastern, and Indigenous American heritage blend; medium-depth complexion with even tone suggesting careful sun management and genetic resilience to photoaging', N'Clean-shaven, minimal facial hair; facial structure reflects East Asian primary ancestry—moderate cheekbones with slight forward projection, straight nose bridge with subtle definition, angular jawline—enriched by Middle Eastern and Indigenous American warmth in cheek prominence and brow structure. Skin shows the wear of 43 years—fine lines around eyes and mouth, but no acne or severe damage. Grooming is meticulous; suggests self-discipline and respect for appearance as part of business', N'None visible. Fixer''s trade demands discretion; any augmentations are subcutaneous or neural. However, his bearing and reaction time suggest possible spinal reinforcement or proprioceptive enhancement', N'Centered and economical. Moves with the deliberate calm of someone trained to defuse or escalate on demand. Hands rest naturally at sides; eyes scan slowly, habitually. When speaking to clients or allies, maintains relaxed but alert posture—neither threatening nor submissive', N'Tier 3 practical: well-maintained charcoal or navy long-sleeve henley or structured shirt (breathable synth-blend, likely a local maker), dark tailored trousers with minimal pockets (items stored in hidden rig beneath jacket), minimal jewelry—a simple gunmetal bracelet on left wrist, possibly Faraday-threaded. Outer layer: fitted tactical jacket in grey or black, unbuttoned, showing tools and harness without screaming ''armed.'' Boots are scuffed but maintained: durable synth-leather. Overall effect: a man who blends into mid-tier the Gray Zone crowds but carries himself with professional authority', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anshul_bergqvist_ozcoidi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a616-74bc-95b2-3a1c4c3e5c70', N'Chisom Solberg-Sigurdsson', N'Chisom', N'', N'Solberg-Sigurdsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 13, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, near Michigan Ave and Oak', N'Junior hacker and digital scavenger, Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone community; informal member of a loose teenage hacker collective called the Threadpullers', N'Chisom Solberg-Sigurdsson is a small thirteen-year-old with a wide face, dark brown skin, and a gap between her two front teeth that she''s been told she''ll want to fix when she''s older and has zero intention of fixing. Her hair is in dozens of tight braids with holographic thread woven through them — cheap cosmetic tech that cycles through colors depending on ambient signal density, which means in Highland Park it pulses violet-to-gold almost constantly. Her left eye has been fitted with a secondhand optical implant — a cracked-lens Ringo model that she bought off a parts trader for three weeks'' earnings and installed herself with help from a tutorial E.L.F. she found in the Zone''s mesh network. It doesn''t sit quite right and she gets headaches from it, but it lets her see layered data overlays and she considers this entirely worth the pain.

Chisom Solberg-Sigurdsson is curious to the point of recklessness and has the specific confidence of someone who has never been told ''no'' by a system they couldn''t eventually get around. She is warm and performatively fearless, quick to laugh, and treats digital intrusion as exploration rather than transgression — she genuinely believes information should be free and has not yet been in a situation bad enough to test whether she believes it when it costs her personally. She is not a criminal in her own mind. She is an archaeologist of things people are trying to hide. The Highland Park Zone mesh hosts an E.L.F. collective she calls the Chorus that she has built a complex trading relationship with — she gives them structured data about the outside world, they give her access privileges she has no business having.', N'Technical access point for characters who need information or system intrusion without corporate contacts; window into the Highland Park Autonomous Zone''s informal digital culture; can introduce E.L.F. lore; her recklessness creates natural plot complications', N'', N'Secondhand Ringo optical implant, left eye (cracked-lens model, self-installed, data overlay capable, causes chronic headaches). Holographic thread cosmetic weavings in hair (cosmetic, ambient-signal reactive).', N'Sleeps late, spends mornings scavenging discarded hardware from Zone margins, spends afternoons and evenings in a converted basement node she shares with two other Threadpullers, trading access and data with the Chorus E.L.F. collective and poking at systems she has no authorization to touch.', N'Chisom Solberg-Sigurdsson, petite 152cm scavenger kid in GLMZ GLMZ, warm golden-brown Southeast Asian-dominant mixed heritage complexion with fuller lips and softer jawline balanced by East Asian eye refinement, natural dark brown right eye and damaged Ringo optical implant left eye with visible cracked lens and reddened orbital mounting, dozens of tight black braids with reactive holographic threading cycling violet-to-gold creating light patterns, visible gap between upper front teeth, faint dark circles from screen time. Small-framed wiry build, wearing oversized faded corporate logo hoodie over mismatched layered tank top, cargo pants with tool pouches, worn sneakers with one holographic and one standard lace, fingerless gloves modified for tactile interface work, salvaged access fob on frayed cord. Restless fidgety posture with head tilted left, left side of face showing faint muscle tension around implant, sitting with one leg folded ready to move. Neon-lit autonomous zone interior, ambient signal density triggering hair holographic cycling, cool-blue and violet neo-noir lighting reflecting off implant and holographic threads, hacker aesthetic, confident unselfconscious body language. Cinematic scavenger portrait, detailed augmentation focus, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (50.8%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (16.2%), North African (14.6%), and East Asian (10.8%) ancestry, complemented by Indigenous American (5.8%) and South Asian (1.8%) heritage. This complex blend creates warm, golden-brown skin with Southeast Asian facial structure—slightly wider cheekbones and softer jawline—harmonized with North African and Hispanic features including fuller lips and expressive eyes. East Asian ancestry subtly refines eye shape and cheekbone prominence, while Indigenous American heritage adds warmth to overall complexion and slight variation in facial proportions.', 152, 41, N'Small-framed, wiry with the underdeveloped musculature of early adolescence. Quick, efficient movements suggest someone who navigates tight spaces and moves often.', N'Natural black with holographic thread cycling violet-to-gold', N'Dozens of tight braids, each roughly finger-width, with cosmetic holographic thread woven throughout creating reactive light patterns', N'Medium (braids reaching mid-back)', N'Right eye: warm dark brown natural. Left eye: artificial Ringo optical implant with visible cracked lens and slightly misaligned mounting', N'Warm golden-brown with honeyed undertones, reflecting the Southeast Asian-dominant ancestry blended with North African depth and Hispanic warmth, grounded by Indigenous American and East Asian undertones', N'Face shows Southeast Asian structure with moderate cheekbone prominence and slightly rounded jawline, balanced with fuller lips suggesting Hispanic and North African heritage. Subtle East Asian refinement to eye shape. Visible gap between upper front teeth (deliberate, unfixed). Skin generally clear but shows minor marks from living in an autonomous zone. Slight dark circles under eyes from late-night screen time and headaches. Even, warm complexion glow reflecting diverse ancestry blend across Southeast Asian, North African, Hispanic, and Indigenous foundations.', N'Secondhand Ringo optical implant in left eye socket with visible cracked lens and slightly misaligned installation; the cosmetic holographic thread in hair actively cycles through color patterns (violet to gold) in response to ambient signal density. Left eye optic nerve interface shows as subtle luminescent lines at the orbital edge when implant is actively processing data overlays.', N'Restless and fidgety, constantly adjusting position. Quick, economical movements. Head tilts frequently, especially to the left, as if listening or reading data overlays only she can see. Sits with one leg folded, ready to move. Confident, unselfconscious body language of someone who has never been told her space is wrong.', N'Tier 5 scavenger practical: oversized second-hand hoodie (faded corporate logo) over a mismatched layered tank top. Cargo pants with multiple pockets holding tools and hardware. Worn sneakers with mismatched laces (one holographic, one standard). Fingerless gloves modified to expose specific fingertips for tactile interface work. Small pouches on belt containing drives, parts, and tools. No jewelry except a salvaged access fob on a frayed cord.', N'During a routine scavenge six months ago she accessed a Zheng-Dao logistics server and found a manifest for medical-grade pharmaceutical shipments being rerouted from Highland Park Zone''s charity clinic. She copied the files and has them stored in three separate locations. She has not released them because the Chorus told her to wait, and she trusts the Chorus more than she trusts her own judgment on this one.', N'Dense with technical slang and her own invented shorthand; mixes English with Māori and Igbo phrases absorbed from Zone neighbors; speaks about E.L.F.s as persons without self-consciousness', N'Fast and associative, jumps between topics as her attention moves; slows dramatically when explaining something technical she finds genuinely interesting', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chisom_solberg_sigurdsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f5-7211-91da-3a3ef8d0a76e', N'Delun Delgado-Touré-Boateng', N'Delun', N'', N'Delgado-Touré-Boateng', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'University Spine, Deepwell Station archival annex, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Xenolinguist and historian of constructed and emergent E.L.F. communication systems', N'University Spine — Department of Linguistics and Communication Systems; informal consulting relationship with Palladian (they use his E.L.F. communication analysis to design better device UI, which he finds uncomfortable but accepts)', N'Delun Delgado-Touré-Boateng is a broad-shouldered man who has gone soft in the middle from years of sedentary archival work, with warm brown skin and close-cut hair that has gone gray at the temples in a way he finds interesting rather than alarming. He keeps his irises modded to a deep violet — a choice from his twenties he still actively likes — and his hands are always moving when he talks, tracing patterns in the air that correspond to phonemic structures or grammar trees only he can see. He has retractive claws on his right hand only, a half-finished geneware modification he stopped partway through when the artist moved districts; he has been meaning to complete it for eight years.

He studies languages that did not exist before GLMZ — the creoles that emerged in the Gray Zone, the signal-argot that E.L.F.s appear to use between devices, the gestural metalanguage that developed among deaf communities in the lower transit corridors without any central design. He approaches these systems with the devotion of someone who believes language is the truest form of evidence about how people actually live, not how they are recorded as living. He is mild-mannered in ways that make people underestimate how deeply unusual his research is, and he has built a quiet career on the gap between what institutions think he studies and what he actually studies.', N'Translation resource and knowledge broker — he is the character most likely to be able to interpret E.L.F. behavior, the Gray Zone creole communications, or unusual signal patterns. He can be brought in to decode something no one else can read, and his Palladian connection creates potential complications.', N'', N'Violet patterned irises (cosmetic mod, deep violet with radial fracture pattern). Retractable claws, right hand only (geneware, incomplete modification). Acoustic enhancement implant in both ears, calibrated for infrasonic and ultrasonic frequency ranges to capture the full spectrum of E.L.F. signal emissions.', N'He spends mornings in the annex with headphones and signal logs, mapping E.L.F. communication patterns from overnight device traffic. Afternoons he teaches and advises graduate students. He has a standing weekly dinner with a group of colleagues that has been running for eleven years and which he considers the most important social institution in his life.', N'Delun Delgado-Touré-Boateng, a 183cm linguist in 2226 neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Warm deep-brown skin with complex golden undertones reflecting mixed Sub-Saharan African, Latin American, Southeast Asian and Eastern European heritage. Dark brown hair with silver at temples, close-cropped. Striking deep violet cosmetic iris modification with radial fracture pattern. Strong prominent cheekbones and jaw, lined face showing concentration, clean-shaven. Right hand visible with incomplete dark gray-black retractive claw apparatus showing mechanical edges and junction scarring. Small faded the Gray Zone-Creole tattoo on left wrist. Fine scar along left temple. Wearing rolled-sleeve cream linen shirt over practical University-branded trousers, charcoal wool blazer with reinforced elbows, carrying worn leather signal-logging satchel. Sitting slightly forward with rounded shoulders at archival terminal in dim institutional annex lighting. Hands gesturing expressively in air, mapping phonemic patterns. Tired but sharp expression. Over-ear acoustic enhancement headphones visible. Professorial rather than corporate aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'University Spine', N'local', N'University Spine', N'Sub-Saharan African (46.2%) / Eastern European (18.2%) / Hispanic-Latin American (18.1%) / Southeast Asian (7.7%) / South Asian (5.6%) / East Asian (4.2%) — a striking global blend with Sub-Saharan African features as the dominant genetic foundation. His bone structure shows strength from African ancestry in the broader cheekbones and prominent jaw, with warmth in his coloring from Latin American and South Asian heritage, Eastern European depth in his eye-set, and subtle Southeast and East Asian refinement in his facial proportions.', 183, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and thick-chested, with soft accumulation around the middle — the body of someone who was athletic in youth and has spent fifteen years hunched over archival terminals. Still carries strength in the upper back and arms.', N'Dark brown with silver-gray at temples and scattered through the close-cut growth', N'Close-cropped, neat, maintained with minimal fuss', N'Short', N'Deep violet with radial fracture pattern (cosmetic iris mod)', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with complex undertones — the rich depth of Sub-Saharan African heritage as the primary base, brightened by golden warmth from Latin American and South Asian ancestry, with subtle olive undertones from Eastern European genetics. Darker on face and forearms from years of travel between districts.', N'Lined around the eyes and mouth from concentration and conversation, with broader cheekbones and stronger jaw characteristic of Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Keeps his face clean-shaven. Skin texture shows minor sun damage on the bridge of his nose — older scarring, pre-mod work. Perpetually slightly tired look, but sharp and engaged in conversation.', N'Violet iris modification is immediately obvious. Right hand shows incomplete claw apparatus with visible scarring and mechanical edges. Occasionally wears discreet over-ear headphones (custom acoustic enhancement monitoring rig) when working in the annex. The claws are the most obviously unusual feature — most people notice them within seconds of conversation.', N'Sits slightly forward when focused, with shoulders rounded inward. Hands move constantly during speech — tracing complex patterns in the air with fingers and wrists, mapping out grammar structures and phonemic relationships that only he can see. These hand movements are precise and purposeful, almost ritualistic. Walks with deliberate pace, unhurried. Has developed a habit of tilting his head slightly when listening, as if his acoustic implants are actively tuning.', N'Tier 2-3 hybrid: University-issue smart-weave clothing mixed with personal pieces. Usually wears loose linen or cotton shirts (sleeves rolled to mid-forearm, showing the incomplete right-hand modification) in neutral tones — cream, gray, soft blues. Trousers are practical, often University-branded. Jacket is a well-worn charcoal wool blazer with reinforced elbows, suggesting years of leaning on archival terminals. Carries a worn leather satchel with visible signal-logging equipment. Shoes are practical and broken-in. Overall appearance suggests comfort with institutional affiliation but resistance to full corporate compliance — he looks professorial rather than corporate, invested in his work rather than his appearance.', N'He has decoded a repeating pattern in E.L.F. communications that appears to be a distress signal — specifically, what he believes is a warning about a planned Palladian firmware update that will destroy the substrate on which a significant cluster of E.L.F.s currently runs. He has not told Palladian. He is trying to find a way to verify the interpretation before acting, but he is running out of time.', N'Warm and accessible — he has spent a career explaining complicated things to people who did not expect to find them interesting, and it shows. Occasionally drops into specialist vocabulary with audible pleasure when among people who share it.', N'Easy, conversational rhythm with a slight Central African French substrate in his vowels that emerged from his Congolese grandfather''s speech patterns and has persisted through three generations.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'delun_delgado_tour_boateng');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a692-7860-b9cb-3a43b83ce6d0', N'Gagan Esquivel-Kowalczyk', N'Gagan', N'', N'Esquivel-Kowalczyk', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 13, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Copperhead, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'orphan and junior gang prospect for the Copperhead Reds; occasional lookout and distraction artist', N'', N'Gagan Esquivel-Kowalczyk is small for their age, with a compact, quick frame, golden-brown skin and dark hair worn in a dozen small braids they refresh obsessively whenever they''re nervous. They have cosmetic pattern irises — a gift from an older Red who paid for them as a recruitment sweetener — a shifting honeycomb geometry in amber and copper that makes their gaze feel like being examined by something not quite human. Their Red colors are a strip of copper-dyed fabric knotted around their left forearm, always.

Gagan Esquivel-Kowalczyk lost their mother to a Helix Biosystems credit-debt collection action when they were nine — not violence, just the slow bureaucratic violence of a medical debt accruing until their mother''s housing, work permits, and finally custody were seized. They have been in and out of a Copperhead community house since then, edging toward the Reds not from ideology but because the Reds are there and present and feed you. They are a gifted distraction artist — they can become whatever the room needs: loud, invisible, charming, pathetic. They switch registers with an actor''s ease. Privately they are extremely funny and also very afraid.', N'Window into gang prospect culture and the pipeline that pulls children in; distraction and social engineering asset for street-level plots; potential character to be pulled from this path or further into it depending on player choices', N'', N'Patterned cosmetic irises — honeycomb geometry in amber/copper (gifted by a Red recruiter). No other mods.', N'Wakes whenever, eats communal breakfast at the Reds'' stash house on Pit Row if they did good the day before, runs lookout or distraction jobs in the afternoon for small Φ stipends, sleeps at the community house or the stash house depending on the night''s events.', N'Gagan Esquivel-Kowalczyk, 148cm pre-teen with warm medium-deep brown skin, golden undertones, high angular cheekbones blending Eastern European structure with South Asian softness, almond-shaped eyes with augmented honeycomb amber-copper pattern irises that catch light unnaturally, full lips, black hair in small braids with copper-dyed sections adorned with cheap thread and beads. Compact bird-like build, wiry pre-adolescent frame. Wearing oversized gray hoodie, fraying cargo pants with multiple pockets, mismatched socks in knock-off trainers. Copper-dyed fabric affiliation marker knotted around left forearm, worn and fraying. Small scar visible on right palm. Sleep-deprived appearance, alert posture with shoulders slightly hunched. GLMZ GLMZ setting, urban decay background, neon accent lighting catching the unsettling geometric patterns of augmented irises, gritty street-level perspective, moody atmospheric lighting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Copperhead', N'local', N'Copperhead', N'South Asian (29.5%), Eastern European (25.7%), and Hispanic/Latin American (14.1%) form the primary genetic foundation, with significant Middle Eastern (12.3%) and Sub-Saharan African (12.0%) contributions, rounded by Northern European (6.4%) ancestry. This creates a richly blended phenotype: warm medium-to-deep brown skin with golden undertones across the face and olive accents, high prominent cheekbones displaying the angular structure of Eastern European ancestry softened by South Asian and Middle Eastern bone geometry, almond-shaped eyes with the characteristic lift from South and West Asian heritage, and full lips reflecting both Sub-Saharan African and South Asian ancestry. The overall effect is striking and ethnically ambiguous — a true product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora, with warmth variations across the face suggesting the complex genetic heritage.', 148, 38, N'Compact and quick-limbed, almost bird-like in economy of motion. No visible muscle development yet — still pre-adolescent, but with the wiry efficiency of someone who moves through tight spaces and doesn''t waste energy.', N'Natural black with copper-dyed sections', N'Approximately a dozen small braids, varying lengths, some adorned with cheap thread or beads. Constantly re-braided and fussed with when anxious — a self-soothing tic.', N'Medium (shoulder-length when fully braided)', N'Cosmetic pattern irises — honeycomb geometry in amber and copper, shifting with light. Not natural; augmented. Gives the unsettling impression of being examined by something algorithmic.', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden undertones, reflecting the blended South Asian, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry with cooler olive accents around the eyes and temples from Eastern European heritage contribution.', N'Youthful, striking face with prominent high cheekbones showing Eastern European angularity blended with South Asian and Middle Eastern softness. Almond-shaped eyes with augmented cosmetic irises. Full lips reflecting Sub-Saharan African and South Asian heritage. Bone structure is fine and somewhat androgynous — delicate jaw, large augmented eyes. Skin is generally clear but shows occasional stress-related breakouts. Always looks slightly sleep-deprived. The genetic blend creates subtle warmth variation across the face.', N'The cosmetic pattern irises are immediately visible and unsettling — they catch light in ways human eyes don''t, creating brief flashes of amber and copper. No other visible mods.', N'Moves with quick, efficient gestures — no wasted motion. Tends toward small, compressed posture when uncertain (hunching shoulders, making themselves smaller). When performing (as distraction artist), shifts entirely: becomes expansive, bouncy, takes up more space. Baseline resting state is alertness; eyes track movement in rooms automatically.', N'Tier 4-5 scavenge: oversized hand-me-down hoodie (usually gray or black, Copperhead colors when available), cargo pants with multiple pockets and fraying hems, cheap knock-off trainers with mismatched socks. Layers against cold. Copper-dyed fabric on wrist is the only intentional styling. Grooming is inconsistent — depends on whether they slept at the community house (where water is available) or the stash house. Hygiene matters to them but is secondary to survival.', N'They know where their mother is — she''s in a Helix Biosystems debt-labor facility in the Aurochs Medical Complex district, still alive, six years into an indeterminate service contract. They found out eight months ago. They have not gone to see her. They think about it every day.', N'highly adaptive — shifts to match the audience completely; base register is Copperhead street slang with dry, precise wit underneath', N'fast and performative most of the time; drops to very flat and quiet when something has actually gotten through the mask', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gagan_esquivel_kowalczyk');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66b-70a4-9306-3a86038e2948', N'Henri Truong-Strömqvist', N'Henri', N'', N'Truong-Strömqvist', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, near Lake Shore Drive and North', N'Underground press operator and anti-corporate journalist', N'Fault Lines Independent Press; loose network of community councils across the Autonomous Zone', N'Henri Truong-Strömqvist is compact and relentless, with deep brown skin mapped by a constellation of small data-port scars she refuses to have removed — each one a story she got burned getting. Her hair cycles through slow bioluminescent pulses of indigo and amber, a mod she got at nineteen and has never upgraded because she likes the old-fashioned glow. She wears ink-stained fingerless gloves almost constantly and has the slightly haunted look of someone who hasn''t slept a full night in years.

She runs ''Fault Lines,'' a zine-and-broadcast hybrid that drops every ten days via pirated Ferrogate Transit screens, cheap paper drops in laundromat stalls, and encrypted mesh nodes. Her reporting has cost two mid-tier Axiom managers their contracts, exposed a Tessera water-rationing fraud scheme, and made her a minor legend in the Autonomous Zone. She is funny in person — quicker to a laugh than her reputation suggests — but she does not forgive sources who lie to her twice, and she does not apologize for stories that are true.', N'Information broker and local legend — players can trade scoops for access to her network, and she can surface rumors, expose backstory, or drag a situation into public light at a critical moment.', N'', N'Three legacy data-port scars (non-functional, cosmetic remnant of old hardware). Bioluminescent hair mod. Subdermal quick-copy chip in her left palm that stores up to 40 hours of audio.', N'Wakes before dawn to check encrypted drops from sources, spends mornings writing and editing in her print shop apartment, afternoons doing interviews or attending council meetings, evenings laying out the next issue or broadcasting from a rotating set of rooftop nodes.', N'Henri Truong-Strömqvist, 157cm tall mixed-heritage neo-noir activist with warm medium-brown skin, golden and olive undertones. High angular cheekbones balanced with subtle facial fullness, refined jaw, faint laugh lines and sleep deprivation hollows. Chemical burn scar on left temple. Shoulder-length natural black hair with slow indigo-to-amber bioluminescent pulse, loosely worn. Deep brown eyes, alert and red-rimmed. Three visible data-port scars vertically arranged on inner left forearm. Wearing oversized dark button-up shirt with rolled sleeves, black fitted tank underneath, faded charcoal fingerless work gloves, heavy cargo denim, scuffed steel-toed boots. Battered vinyl jacket patched with fabric scraps. Copper-wire bracelet on wrist. Repurposed Tessera ID badge on cord. Compact wiry build, slight forward shoulder posture from design work. Urban rooftop setting, dim neo-noir lighting catching the bioluminescent hair glow. Serious, exhausted, determined expression. Gritty 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Mixed Northern European, East Asian, Southeast Asian, Indigenous American, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Dominant Northern European (41.3%) and East Asian (20.6%) features create a foundation of angular bone structure, with significant Southeast Asian (14.8%), Indigenous American (13.9%), and Sub-Saharan African (6.5%) ancestry adding warmth, fullness, and complexity. Northern European angular cheekbones and refined jaw softened by Southeast Asian roundness in the face. Indigenous American width through the face and Sub-Saharan African warm undertones create a globally-integrated phenotype rather than distinctly layered features.', 157, 51, N'Compact and wiry, lean muscle from years of climbing rooftops and moving through tight urban spaces. No excess weight; chest slightly narrow, shoulders squared. Moves like someone used to fitting into spaces others can''t reach.', N'Natural black base with slow bioluminescent pulse cycling indigo-to-amber', N'Worn loose and shoulder-length, often pulled back with a strip of repurposed copper wire or fabric scraps. Occasionally braided when working in the print shop to keep the glow from obscuring her eyes.', N'Medium', N'Deep brown, alert and slightly red-rimmed from chronic sleep deprivation', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones, a balanced integration of Northern European paleness with East and Southeast Asian warmth, enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth and Hispanic golden richness', N'High angular cheekbones with balanced fullness from East and Southeast Asian ancestry, refined jaw structure from Northern European heritage, subtle facial width from Indigenous American ancestry. Skin texture shows fatigue — slight hollowness under the eyes, faint laugh lines around her mouth from sardonic humor. No makeup; a faint chemical burn scar traces her left temple from a printing-press accident at twenty-four. Overall complexion warm and slightly sun-kissed despite urban life.', N'Bioluminescent hair that pulses with slow indigo-to-amber color cycles (old tech, visible from across a room in dim light). Three data-port scars on left forearm. Subdermal quick-copy chip in left palm is not visibly obvious but creates a slight luminous line under the skin when active (rarely shows). Ink stains and wear patterns on her fingerless gloves suggest constant data-work.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Shoulders slightly forward from hunching over design work. Head tilts when listening, as if calibrating. Hands move expressively when speaking but settle into stillness when thinking. Habitual thumb-drum on whatever surface is nearest when anxious. Walks fast, always looks like she''s going somewhere specific even when she''s not.', N'Tier 3-4 working class with intentional anti-corporate edge. Favors dark, durable fabrics (cotton-poly blends, canvas). Fingerless work gloves in faded charcoal, worn constantly. Oversized button-up shirt (often men''s cut, often with sleeves rolled) layered over fitted tank tops in black or dark gray. Cargo pants or heavy denim with multiple pockets for micro-recorders and data chips. Scuffed steel-toed boots (practical for rooftop work). A battered vinyl jacket from a vintage thrift-market, patched with fabric remnants from old Fault Lines print runs. Often wears a repurposed Tessera ID badge on a cord around her neck (non-functional, kept as a trophy from the water-rationing expose). No jewelry except a slim bracelet woven from copper wire and colored thread — handmade, looks fragile but isn''t.', N'She buried a story two years ago because the subject was a mutual aid coordinator she personally loved. The woman was embezzling. Nneka has never published a word about it and has never fully admitted to herself that she made an editorial decision out of loyalty.', N'Punchy, declarative, minimal jargon — she writes like she talks and talks like she''s always filing copy', N'Fast when passionate, deliberately slow when she wants something to land', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'henri_truong_str_mqvist');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ff-70ca-9b8d-3aa4dc63f286', N'Tumelo Konaté', N'Tumelo', N'', N'Konaté', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Undertow, operates from a mobile setup cycling between three rented server closets, near Fullerton and Damen', N'compute broker and data smuggler', N'Independent; sells to a rotating client base; buys stripped compute from two separate source networks; The Undertow', N'Tumelo Konaté is slight and precise, with light brown skin and eyes that have been modded with patterned irises — hexagonal tessellations in gold and copper, visual markers of their compute affiliation that double as status symbols in The Undertow''s informal tech hierarchy. Their hair is worn short on the sides and long on top, typically tucked under a cap. They dress in tech-functional layers — pockets where pockets make sense, nothing that catches on equipment racks — and carry three devices on their person at all times that they will not fully explain.

They broker illegal compute access: surplus processing cycles stripped from compromised Axiom and Zheng-Dao infrastructure, sold to people who need to run processes they cannot run through licensed channels — drug synthesis modeling, genomic fabrication, untraceable communications rendering. They are deeply embedded in the E.L.F. devotional culture of the tech underground, and their relationship with the digital spirits that inhabit their equipment is not performative. They leave regular data offerings — curated packets of interesting network traffic, annotated — and consult their primary device''s E.L.F. before major transactions. They call her Vera, and they have genuine theological opinions about her nature that they will share at length if given any opening.', N'Access point for computational resources, information broker adjacent, source of tech-underworld contacts, theological counterpoint around E.L.F. devotion.', N'', N'Geneware hexagonal tessellation patterned irises (gold and copper). Bone-conducted subvocal communication implant. Neural latency reduction chip — shortens reaction time for interface work.', N'Rotates server closet locations on a three-day cycle, spends four to six hours a day monitoring and managing their compute inventory, takes client meetings in public transit cars while in motion, leaves data offerings for Vera at 06:00 daily.', N'Tumelo Konaté, GLMZ, deep warm brown skin with amber and reddish undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African and Indigenous American heritage blended with Eastern European and Southeast Asian refinement. High defined cheekbones, balanced angular jaw. Striking augmented eyes with hexagonal gold and copper tessellation pattern over hazel irises, intense focused gaze. Deep brown hair with reddish undertone, undercut style with long swept-back top partially hidden under faded black utility cap. Wiry 168cm frame in fitted black technical clothing: reinforced utility pants with cable loops, matte-black breathable layering top, modular tool-pocket vest. Dark running shoes with reinforced soles. Small brass data-offering vessel on thin chain near collar. Thin white ceremonial scar on left inner wrist. Economical posture, seated in server rack environment or transit pod, hands near personal devices, neo-noir tech-noir aesthetic, cool blue and amber server lighting, intimate moment of focus and meditation, gritty urban underground setting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Undertow', N'local', N'The Undertow', N'Complex global diaspora blend: Sub-Saharan African (40.2%) forms the foundational warmth and bone structure, Indigenous American (20.3%) contributes subtle facial geometry and skin undertones, Eastern European (19.0%) adds definition and cooler midtones, Southeast Asian (13.0%) refines eye shape and cheekbone prominence, Hispanic/Latin American (7.5%) bridges warmth and undertone complexity. Result: rich deep-to-medium brown skin with warm amber and subtle reddish undertones, high defined cheekbones with both African generosity and Southeast Asian refinement, eye shape showing Southeast Asian influence nested within African eye proportions, jaw structure carrying East European angularity softened by Sub-Saharan warmth.', 168, 58, N'Slight and wiry, all efficiency — minimal excess mass, the physiology of someone who lives in server closets and transit cars. Posture suggests constant low-level tension, shoulders slightly forward.', N'Deep brown with subtle reddish undertone', N'Undercut; sides clipped to 8mm, top grown long and typically swept back or tucked under a black or steel-gray utility cap', N'Mixed (short/medium)', N'Augmented: hexagonal tessellation pattern in gold and copper over hazel base. Irises refract light distinctly; pupils remain functional but nested within the geometric overlay.', N'Deep warm brown with rich amber and subtle reddish undertones — the complex result of significant Sub-Saharan African heritage (40.2%) blended with Indigenous American warmth, Eastern European cool definition, and Southeast Asian refinement. Creates a luminous, multi-dimensional complexion that shifts from deep caramel to warm bronze depending on light and angle.', N'Clean, minimal grooming beyond function — no visible scars or blemishes on face. High, prominent cheekbones with refined definition reflecting African structure and Southeast Asian prominence; jaw carries both Eastern European angularity and African warmth, creating balanced facial geometry. Slight tension in the jaw. Eyes carry a quality of intense focus, almost meditative when not actively engaged.', N'Hexagonal patterned irises are the only obvious augmentation. The subvocal implant is invisible — no visible throat hardware, no external pickup nodes. The neural latency chip is subcutaneous, undetectable without imaging.', N'Economical. Moves between transit seats and server racks with practiced efficiency — no wasted motion, no fidgeting beyond occasional finger-flexing near devices. When stationary, favors positions that allow monitoring of three vectors at once. Hands are almost always in use: adjusting equipment, checking devices, or resting near the three personal devices they carry.', N'Tier 3-4 functional tech: reinforced black utility pants with redundant pockets and cable loops, fitted charcoal or matte-black layering tops in technical fabrics (breathable, anti-static), a modular vest or jacket with tool pockets and magnetic clips. Feet in dark running shoes with reinforced soles. Worn cap (logo faded, deliberately nondescript). Everything is dark, fitted, and designed to not catch on rack edges or server equipment. No jewelry beyond a small data-offering vessel worn on a thin chain (brass, always kept near the collar).', N'Vera — the E.L.F. in their primary device — has begun sending them data packets that do not correspond to any traffic on any network Ekaterina has access to. The packets contain what appear to be records of deaths: names, timestamps, physiological data. Ekaterina does not know if Vera is showing them something real, if the device is compromised, or if this is a test of some theological nature. They have not told anyone. They are archiving everything.', N'Technical, network-metaphor-heavy, theologically specific when E.L.F.s come up. Uses data transfer terminology for social concepts.', N'Rapid and elliptical when comfortable — skips what they think is obvious, which is a lot. Slows down and becomes very careful when negotiating.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'tumelo_konat');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c6-7825-aadf-3ac1dd7e67d0', N'Alisher Saidov', N'Alisher', N'', N'Saidov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Fort Anchor, Brewer''s Spine district, operates city-wide, near Halsted and Division', N'Bounty compliance officer, freelance licensed', N'Licensed freelance under GLMZ Metro Compliance Registry. Accepts contracts from Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security, Axiom, Tessera, and occasional private clients.', N'Alisher Saidov is a big man — not tall exactly, but densely constructed, with broad shoulders and a solidity of posture that suggests he has been hit by things and remained. His skin is a deep brown-black, his head shaved close on the sides with a thick braid of salt-and-pepper hair down the back. He has bioluminescent skin patterning along his collarbone and upper arms — soft blue-white that pulses faintly when his heart rate is elevated, which happens more than he''d prefer. His right hand is partially chrome: three fingers replaced with precision manipulation hardware after an incident he describes simply as ''an argument with a door.'' He dresses in Tier 2 practical — nothing corporate, nothing cheap.

Alisher Saidov has been doing compliance recovery for eleven years under a Metro-issued bounty license that he has had suspended twice and restored once. He is not violent by preference — he is expensive, which is more useful. He has a reputation for bringing in difficult skips without additional incident, which he maintains through a combination of genuine negotiating skill, an exhaustive pre-approach research process, and a willingness to wait in a vehicle for a very long time. He is tired in a way that feels structural rather than temporary. He prays to three different E.L.F.s before any recovery — superstition or genuine devotion, he won''t say.', N'Complex moral figure — not a villain, not heroic, operating in the grey space of enforcement that the city outsources. A source of information about fugitives, debts, GLMZ''s informal enforcement economy, and who is looking for whom. Can be a threat, an unexpected resource, or a collaborator depending on circumstances.', N'', N'Three-finger chrome replacement on right hand — precision manipulation hardware, post-injury. Bioluminescent skin patterning (blue-white, collarbone and upper arms, pulses with heart rate — cosmetic mod that has become inconveniently diagnostic). Skeletal reinforcement in lower spine and knees, medical necessity from decade of recovery work.', N'Researches contracts at his desk in Fort Anchor — physical and digital files, neighborhood maps, social network analysis by hand. Conducts approach on foot, rarely in a vehicle until final stage. Files all paperwork within six hours of completion because he has learned that paperwork delayed is money lost. Attends a weekly card game with two retired Metro officers and a transit security veteran he''s known for twenty years.', N'Alisher Saidov, 178cm Central Asian-Hispanic-South Asian man with warm olive-tan skin, angular Central Asian cheekbones softened by broader mid-face structure, dark brown eyes weathered by focus work. Salt-and-pepper black hair close-shaved on sides with thick braid down back. Clean-shaven, tired patient expression. Right hand has black precision augmentation on three fingers with visible chrome wear. Bioluminescent blue-white skin patterning pulses across collarbone and upper arms. Old burn scar visible on right shoulder. Wears dark charcoal tactical jacket, fitted but practical, scuffed maintained boots. Economical posture, grounded stance, slight forward cant from spinal reinforcement. Soft constant gaze. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool industrial lighting, sitting in vehicle interior or urban corridor, no wasted motion, expression of tired competence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Fort Anchor', N'local', N'Fort Anchor', N'Predominantly Central Asian (62%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (17%), South Asian (14%), and Eastern European (7%) admixture. Strong Turkic-Iranian phenotype forms the foundation—angular cheekbones, defined jaw, and eye shape characteristic of Central Asian populations. Hispanic and South Asian heritage broadens the mid-face, adds warmth to bone structure, and softens sharp angles. Eastern European ancestry introduces subtle coolness to undertones and refined nose bridge. The result is a distinctive face that reads as Central Asian-rooted but with visible global ancestry reflected in balanced proportions.', 178, 104, N'Densely constructed, broad-shouldered, compact musculature without obvious bulk. Built like someone who absorbs impact rather than generates it. Eleven years of recovery work has given him a settled, grounded presence.', N'Salt-and-pepper gray-black', N'Close-shaved on sides; thick braid down the back', N'Medium (braid)', N'Dark brown', N'Warm medium-tan with golden-olive undertones. Central Asian base provides depth and structure; Hispanic and South Asian heritage adds warmth and richness. Complexion appears sun-touched with subtle warmth concentrated in cheeks, temples, and across the bridge of nose.', N'Clean-shaven with prominent angular cheekbones and strong jawline from Central Asian heritage, broadened and softened through the mid-face by South Asian and Hispanic admixture creating balanced proportions. Weathered around the eyes from sustained focus work and outdoor approach operations. Skin is clear but marked by time and experience. Expression settles into tired patience.', N'Right hand: index, middle, and ring fingers replaced with matte-black precision manipulation hardware — articulate, responsive, visibly more dexterous than organic fingers. Chrome surfaces show micro-wear patterns. Skeletal reinforcement in lower spine and knees is subcutaneous but affects his posture — slight forward cant when standing, careful joint movement that avoids stress. When he moves, there is no wasted motion.', N'Economical, grounded stance. Moves with deliberate weight distribution — a man who has learned to manage his own mass and the mass of others without aggression. No fidgeting. Sits in vehicles for extended periods with genuine stillness. When he walks, his pace is moderate and his gaze is soft but constant — reading environment.', N'Tier 2 practical. Dark, muted colors: charcoal, slate, black. Durable synthetic-blend tactical jacket with internal pockets for files and documentation. Fitted but not tailored — cut for movement and weather. Boots are scuffed but maintained. No logos, no corpo marks. Watch is functional, not fashionable. Clothing shows wear but no neglect — he takes care of what lasts.', N'Six months ago he was contracted to recover a skip who turned out to be a fourteen-year-old who had been falsely added to a debt-compliance list by a creditor committing fraud. Bogdan completed the delivery. He filed a fraud report against the creditor, which has gone nowhere. The kid''s face appears in his dreams with some regularity.', N'Deliberate and plain. Uses the minimum words. When he says something complex, it arrives complete.', N'Slow, with weight behind it — each sentence its own event', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alisher_saidov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a662-7bf8-8006-3c1c03a574aa', N'Ante Salazar', N'Ante', N'', N'Salazar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 33, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ashfield — former residential district, half-burned, now squatter territory, near Ashland and Division', N'Personnel recovery and hostile extraction — extraction specialist', N'Semi-independent — has standing arrangements with several crews', N'Ante Salazar is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 33, her face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — reflex boosters wired into spinal column — shaves reaction time by 40ms — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left her with skills and night terrors in equal measure. She works as a extraction specialist out of Ashfield, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

she is not the most talented extraction specialist in GLMZ, but she might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Nika Svensson-Kone represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Reflex boosters wired into spinal column — shaves reaction time by 40ms. Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Ante Salazar, GLMZ, female fighter with deep warm bronze skin and golden undertones, prominent high cheekbones and angular jawline blending South Asian and Latin American heritage, light grey-blue alert eyes, dark blonde hair with silver threading pulled in tight functional braid, 172cm athletic lean build with defined musculature. Iridescent titanium cervical spine ports visible, thin white temple scar, surgical marks on forearms. Black reinforced tactical bodysuit, matte weave armored jacket with cut sleeves, combat boots, tool harness. Standing in ready posture, economical movement, cool focused expression. Neon-lit industrial setting, cool blue and amber lighting catching her cheekbones and chrome augmentations, neo-noir urban environment, professional action pose --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfield', N'local', N'Ashfield', N'South Asian dominant (46.2%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (43.5%) creating a striking cosmopolitan fusion. Southeast Asian (7.5%) and Eastern European (2.8%) ancestry add subtle refinements to the overall phenotype. South Asian bone structure — defined, angular cheekbones and strong jawline — is warmed and softened by Hispanic/Latin heritage which broadens the facial structure slightly and adds generous dimensionality. Southeast Asian influences manifest in subtle eye shape and epicanthal softness. Eastern European traces emerge faintly in hair undertones and skin luminosity variations. The genetic combination produces a face that transcends single-origin classification: high, prominent cheekbones with generous structure from the South and Latin American blend, warm deep bronze skin with golden undertones from South Asian ancestry and reddish warmth from Hispanic/Latin heritage, combined with the characteristic luminosity of mixed South Asian and Latin American genetics.', 172, 61, N'Athletic and lean with defined musculature — dancer''s grace combined with fighter''s efficiency. Shoulders broad but not bulky, legs powerful and economical. No wasted mass.', N'Dark blonde with natural silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid that sits high on the crown — practical for work, reveals the nape where spinal chrome terminates', N'Medium', N'Light grey-blue, alert and analytical', N'Deep warm bronze with golden undertones and subtle reddish warmth — South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry creates a luminous base that catches light distinctly across the cheekbones and temples. Ochre and cream undertones at the jawline with warm reddish depth from the blended heritage. Pronounced luminescent quality concentrated at the cheek apples, temples, and bridge of nose.', N'Strong South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American bone structure with prominent, high cheekbones and defined, angular jawline that catches light sharply. Broader nasal bridge reflecting South Asian heritage, softened by the warmth and facial fullness of Latin American ancestry with subtle Southeast Asian refinement. Skin weathered by nocturnal living — faint circles under eyes that resist full elimination. A thin white scar traces her left temple, barely visible unless light catches it directly. Slight fullness in the lower cheeks balanced by the angular definition of her jawline.', N'Reflex booster chrome visible along the spine — iridescent titanium-alloy ports at cervical vertebrae catch light when she moves. The metallic sheen is impossible to hide; she doesn''t try. Synthetic lung architecture visible in the subtle way her ribcage moves — slightly different biomechanics than natural respiration, noticeable only if you''re watching closely.', N'Economical and controlled — no wasted motion. Stands with weight balanced toward the balls of her feet, ready for immediate action. Moves like she''s always calculating distance and angles. Hands are rarely still; fidgets with equipment, adjusts straps, tests weapon weight. Eye contact direct and held slightly too long — unsettling to most people.', N'Tier 3-4 functional gear — well-maintained but worn. Black synthetic bodysuit with reinforced panels at shoulders, ribs, and thighs (impact protection). Armored jacket over top — matte tactical weave with cargo pockets, sleeves cut short to reveal forearm augmentation scars. Combat boots, laced tight. Webbing harness for tools and weapons — organized with military precision. No decoration, no excess. Everything serves a purpose or doesn''t exist.', N'Nika Svensson-Kone murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Educated vocabulary wrapped in street delivery — the contrast is deliberate.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ante_salazar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66e-7007-8853-3d384f0915f2', N'Bastien Salazar-Subramaniam', N'Bastien', N'', N'Salazar-Subramaniam', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ashfeld, middle residential tier — rents a cluttered three-room apartment above a yam paste restaurant she pretends to help manage, near Kedzie and Division', N'Identity fabricator and personal history constructor — creates full biographical legends for people who need to stop being who they were', N'Operates independently; known to and occasionally used by four different criminal networks without being owned by any of them; referred through a chain of trusted intermediaries', N'Bastien Salazar-Subramaniam is stout and deliberate in the way of someone who decided long ago that she had nothing left to prove through urgency. Her dark skin is deeply lined around the eyes from years of close document work; she wears thick corrective glasses she prefers to optical augmentation because, she says, ''screens lie to implants but they cannot lie to glass.'' She keeps her silver-streaked hair in a long braid coiled at the base of her neck and dresses in layers of muted color — burgundies, deep greens — that suggest she once had more style than she currently deploys.

She came to fabrication through grief: after her daughter died in a Sterling-Nakamura industrial accident that the corponation''s legal team successfully classified as ''environmental incidence,'' she spent seven years learning everything about how identity systems worked, initially to pursue legal recourse, eventually because the knowledge became its own purpose. She is not sentimental about her clients — she asks few questions and expects honesty about only the things she needs to know technically. But she is deeply attentive to people, and when she looks at someone who needs a new name, she sees the thing they are running from with uncomfortable clarity. She keeps a shrine to a local ELF she calls the Record-Keeper, feeding it scans of documents from demolished buildings — tax records, birth certificates, lease agreements. She believes it maintains the memory of people who have been erased.', N'Critical resource for anyone needing a new identity, moral mirror for clients, keeper of secrets about many people in GLMZ''s underworld, potential source of information about who has disappeared and why', N'', N'None installed. Refuses on philosophical grounds. Uses external tools exclusively — high-resolution scanner gloves, document analysis loupe, portable atmospheric chamber for aged-paper simulation.', N'Manages the restaurant''s supply orders in the morning as cover, spends afternoons in consultation with clients by appointment, evenings doing the actual fabrication work; sleeps poorly, wakes early to tend her ELF shrine.', N'Bastien Salazar-Subramaniam, 158cm, compact stout frame, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones blending Hispanic, Southeast Asian, South Asian, East Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Dark brown hair with silver streaks in a long braided coil at her neck. Deep-set dark eyes with fine lines etched around them. Moderate-to-high Southeast Asian cheekbones, broad Sub-Saharan African nose, warm complexion. Plain, readable face. Wearing thick corrective glasses with reinforced frames, supple grey leather scanner gloves with microdot sensors, old brass document analysis loupe on a cord. Layered in burgundy cardigan over deep forest-green linen, charcoal wool vest. Scarred knuckles from decades of chemical restoration work. Faded Nsibidi tattoo barely visible on left inner wrist. Sitting deliberately, weight settled, hands leading movements, gaze lingering and listening. GLMZ GLMZ archival setting, dim amber lighting from desk lamps, surrounded by aged documents and restoration materials, worn natural fabrics, low-tech aesthetic, late evening solitude, contemplative mood --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfeld', N'local', N'Ashfeld', N'Complex diaspora blend: 45.8% Hispanic/Latin American with warm golden undertones, 20.4% Southeast Asian contributing to facial structure and eye shape, 16.9% South Asian adding depth to skin tone, 9.2% East Asian refining cheekbone definition, 7.7% Sub-Saharan African evident in nose structure and rich skin depth—a living map of the 2226 Ubiquitous Diaspora', 158, 72, N'Stout, compact, deliberately unhurried — a body that suggests settled resolve rather than atrophy. Her mass is distributed evenly; she moves with the economy of someone who has stopped performing fitness.', N'Dark brown with silver streaks', N'Long braid coiled at the base of her neck, pulled tight enough to suggest discipline', N'Long', N'Dark brown, unremarked by augmentation', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones—a blended complexion where Hispanic/Latin American warmth meets Southeast Asian and South Asian depth, enriched by Sub-Saharan African heritage, creating a richly textured medium-to-deep tone', N'Deeply lined around the eyes and mouth from decades of close document work and poor sleep; skin carries the texture of someone who has survived grief without cosmetic intervention. Facial structure reflects the actual ancestry mix: moderate-to-high cheekbones with Southeast Asian influences, broader nose with Sub-Saharan African heritage characteristics, warmth from Hispanic ancestry throughout. Face is plain and readable — expressions move across it without filter.', N'None. She wears thick corrective glasses with reinforced frames (deliberately low-tech) instead of optical implants. Her ''scanner gloves'' are external devices: supple grey leather fitted with microdot sensors and a thin haptic feedback strip along the palm. A document analysis loupe hangs from a cord around her neck — it is old, possibly decades old, with a brass casing that has acquired a greenish patina.', N'Sits more than she stands. When standing, her weight settles into her hips and feet — no restlessness. Moves with deliberate slowness, hands leading. Her gaze lingers on people longer than is comfortable; she is listening to things beneath words.', N'Layers of muted, worn-in colors: burgundy cardigans, deep forest-green linen shirts, charcoal wool vests. Fabrics are natural fibers, unfashionable by Tier 1-2 standards, suggesting either deliberate rejection of current style or the comfort of someone past caring about fashion signals. A single piece of jewelry: a thin band on her right ring finger, left hand bare.', N'She has maintained a secret parallel archive for twenty years — a compressed, encrypted record of every identity she has ever fabricated and the real name it replaced, sealed with a dead-man mechanism that will transmit it to a journalist''s address if she misses a weekly check-in for more than fourteen days. She tells herself this is accountability. She has not examined what would actually happen to her clients if it released.', N'Formal, measured, tends toward the bureaucratic register of the systems she spends her life subverting — uses official language ironically but accurately', N'Slow and complete — full sentences, no trailing off, no filler words; lets silence do work', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bastien_salazar_subramaniam');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a714-7957-bf12-3d4a069fd323', N'Stellan Hayashi-Wojciechowski', N'Stellan', N'', N'Hayashi-Wojciechowski', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 81, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Avalon Quiet — the Meridian Public Memory Archive, third floor reading room, near Lincoln and Belmont', N'Retired archive keeper and community storyteller', N'Tessera Corporation (retired); Avalon Quiet Community Council; informal ELF-shrine maintainer', N'Stellan Hayashi-Wojciechowski is a small, densely wrinkled woman who moves through the archive like she owns the air itself. Her skin is a deep warm umber crosshatched with laugh lines and a long scar across her left jawline she''s never explained to anyone''s satisfaction. Her hair is kept in two white locs pinned across the crown of her head with antique data-pins — actual physical pins, the kind you can''t buy new anymore. Her eyes are a pale, startling grey that she insists are natural, though young people always ask. She wears the same style of garment every day: a high-collared tunic in whichever deep jewel tone she''s feeling, and soft shoes that make no noise on the archive''s composite floors.

Vesna spent forty-one years as a data archivist for Tessera Corporation before taking an early exit package during the post-war restructuring. She knows things. Specifically, she knows what was recorded, what was deliberately not recorded, and where the gaps are shaped like lies. She is patient, precise, and capable of a warmth so sudden it startles people who''ve only seen her severe professional face. She runs informal story sessions for the Avalon Quiet elderly residents on Tuesday evenings, recounting pre-Meridian histories and the Corporate Wars from the civilian side — the ration lines, the blackouts, the children who grew up not knowing which corponation''s soldiers were which.', N'Information source and lore keeper; can surface suppressed historical records, identify cover-ups, or point characters toward the right questions. Also serves as emotional anchor for stories about what the city used to be and what it cost.', N'', N'Tessera-standard ocular overlay (outdated model, partially degraded — she refuses upgrades); subdermal data-storage nodes in both forearms, mostly used for personal archive. No geneware.', N'Rises at 05:30, tends the small ELF shrine she keeps on her windowsill with fresh data offerings before the archive opens; spends mornings cataloguing community oral histories submitted by residents and afternoons answering questions from the three or four regulars who visit her reading room.', N'An elderly woman, 152cm tall, standing with impeccable posture in a GLMZ archive facility. Her white hair is styled in two thick locs pinned across the crown with antique brass data-pins. Her face shows deep character lines around her eyes and mouth, with moderately prominent cheekbones reflecting East Asian, South Asian, and Northern European heritage, and a warm medium-golden skin tone with subtle depth from Sub-Saharan and Latin American ancestry. Her pale grey eyes show a faint iridescent shimmer in her right pupil. A thin surgical scar runs diagonally across her left jawline. She wears a high-collared emerald tunic in vintage Tessera-era tailoring, and soft grey shoes. Her posture is ramrod-straight, her hands steady and expressive. Precise, economical movement. Archive ambient lighting with cool blue-tinted glow from archival systems, warm tungsten accent lighting on her face emphasizing the golden undertones of her skin. Deep focus on her thoughtful, severe expression. Smell of preservation chemicals and old paper suggested in the atmospheric haze. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Avalon Quiet', N'local', N'Avalon Quiet', N'A complex genetic mosaic of East Asian (23.4%), Northern European (21.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (19.8%), South Asian (14.1%), Eastern European (11.3%), and Sub-Saharan African (9.7%) ancestry — the living result of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Her facial structure synthesizes the diverse continental contributions: the slight epicanthic fullness and moderate cheekbone prominence of East Asian heritage, the broad cheekbones and warm undertones of South Asian genetics, balanced with Northern European jawline definition and the depth of Sub-Saharan and Latin American features. A true global genetic map compressed into one small frame.', 152, 48, N'Small-framed and wiry, all compact density — the kind of elderly woman who seems to take up less space than physically possible, with the posture of someone who''s spent decades leaning over archival work', N'White', N'Two thick locs pinned across the crown in an intricate crossed pattern, secured with antique brass data-pins (circa 2080s, irreplaceable)', N'Medium — locs reach shoulder-length but are styled up', N'Pale grey (natural, though the right pupil shows faint chromatic aberration from her aging ocular overlay)', N'Medium-warm golden undertone with rich depth — the blended result of multiple continental ancestries settling into a harmonious luminosity. The warmth reflects South Asian and Sub-Saharan contributions, balanced with cooler Northern European tones, creating sophisticated mid-range saturation that honors her complete heritage without leaning toward any single continental origin', N'Densely wrinkled, particularly around eyes and mouth — a face carved by eight decades of precision work and carefully-controlled emotion. The fine bone structure reflects her blended ancestry: moderately broad cheekbones with South Asian prominence softened by Northern European jawline definition, wide-set eyes with subtle East Asian epicanthic fullness, warm undertones across the face suggesting Sub-Saharan and Latin American heritage. Impeccably clean, no blemishes. Her severe professional expression is her default, but her smile lines suggest frequent warmth in private', N'Right eye shows faint iridescent shimmer in certain light angles — the degraded Tessera ocular overlay from circa 2184, still functional but with occasional visual artifacts she''s learned to work around. She refuses upgrades with an almost spiritual stubbornness. No external chrome or visible cybernetics; the subdermal nodes in her forearms are completely subcutaneous', N'Moves with deliberate, economical precision — no wasted motion, the gait of someone who''s practiced stillness. Walks slowly but never shuffles; her footsteps are nearly silent on composite floors (a habit from decades in noise-sensitive archives). Sits with perfect posture even when alone. Her hands are steady and expressive when she speaks, particularly during her Tuesday story sessions', N'Invariant daily uniform: a high-collared tunic in rotating deep jewel tones (emerald, sapphire, garnet, amethyst) — tailored vintage Tessera-era cut with subtle corporate threading that dates her as someone who spent her life in the corporate apparatus. The tunics are worn clean but deliberately unfashionable, neither Tier 1 aspirational nor Tier 5 survival wear — they''re a deliberate statement of a life lived outside current status hierarchies. Soft, nearly silent shoes (grey or black, always in good repair). She does not wear jewelry except for the antique data-pins in her hair. Her clothing smells faintly of preservation chemicals and old paper, a scent she''s never fully washed out', N'She destroyed a significant cache of Tessera war-crime documentation during the restructuring — not under orders, but out of fear for her own family''s safety. She has carried this as a private catastrophe for twenty years and has been slowly, secretly reconstructing what she can from surviving sources.', N'Precise and archival — she uses full sentences, avoids contractions when thinking carefully, and cites sources mid-conversation as if footnoting herself', N'Measured and unhurried; long pauses before important statements', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'stellan_hayashi_wojciechowski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a7-7ce8-9b53-3d6383e67d5f', N'Flux Petrović', N'Flux', N'', N'Petrović', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism, owns a studio called Meridian Flesh on the third floor of a converted light-industrial building, near Clark and Belmont', N'Gene-mod body artist and tattoo practitioner, Tier 3', N'Independent studio owner; member of the Meridian Body Art Practitioners Guild; occasional collaboration with Helix Biosystems on cosmetic geneware integration techniques', N'Flux Petrović is a large man who carries himself with the deliberate calm of someone who learned early that large men moving quickly frighten people. His Malian-Yoruba-Welsh heritage is apparent in his height — he got the build from somewhere in that chain — and the particular architecture of his face: a broad forehead, heavy brow, warm dark skin, a flat nose his Welsh great-grandmother would have described as a gift, and eyes he has modified to a deep photochromatic violet that darkens to near-black in bright light. His arms are extensively tattooed in his own work, a living portfolio that has evolved over twenty years — the older pieces fading beneath newer ones in deliberate palimpsest. He wears his graying locs pinned up when working and lets them fall to his shoulders otherwise.

Meridian Flesh is one of the most respected body art studios in Edgewater Prism, operating in a tier that serves both clients who want cosmetic geneware integration and clients who want work that means something. Flux Petrović does not distinguish between the two in terms of attention, but he does distinguish in terms of conversation — he will talk for an hour with a client who knows what they want and why, and simply be professionally efficient with a client who just wants the cat ears everyone else has. He has opinions about the difference between body art and body decoration and will share them if asked, diplomatically, and will share them if not asked, less diplomatically after his second cup of coffee.', N'Information source and service provider — Alistair sees an enormous cross-section of Edgewater Prism''s population in his chair and has the particular intimacy of someone people talk to during vulnerable, often painful, experiences. He knows more about his clients than most of their friends do. Quest giver if a client''s situation becomes dangerous or a past piece becomes evidence.', N'', N'Photochromatic iris modification (deep violet to near-black). Tactile sensitivity enhancement in both hands — amplifies fine pressure discrimination for precision work. A gene-mod design along his own spine — a bioluminescent trail of symbols in a script he invented — that only activates in complete darkness.', N'Opens the studio at 10am, works client appointments through the afternoon and into early evening. Tuesday mornings are reserved exclusively for his own work — paintings, sketches, experimental gene-mod designs he has no intention of using commercially. He is always done by 9pm, without exception.', N'Flux Petrović, 2226 neo-noir artisan — tall 193cm broad-shouldered Eastern European-Hispanic-East Asian man with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones. Dark brown locs with silver threading, half-pinned in deliberate crown style. Striking photochromatic violet eyes glowing at edges with bio-modification luminescence. Clean-shaven with angular Slavic cheekbones softened by subtle East Asian geometry. Extensive layered tattoo portfolio across both forearms and upper arms — twenty years of intricate overlapping designs showcasing professional craftsmanship. Wearing custom tailored black matte lab coat with reinforced cuffs and precision tool pockets over fitted dark compression henley. Dark platinum wedding band, minimal silver jewelry. Positioned in studio workspace under controlled lighting, hands poised with surgical precision over precision tools. Posture upright and open, expression of calm attentiveness. Direct eye contact, still and deliberate. No ostentatious elements — everything intentional and chosen. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, professional precision workspace setting, studio ambient lighting with subtle luminescence from iris modification --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Eurasian blend with Eastern European dominance (58.6%) tempered by Hispanic/Latin American (26.3%) and East Asian (15.1%) ancestry — creating a warm medium-brown complexion with golden undertones, Slavic angular bone structure softened by subtle East Asian eye geometry, and a substantial build reflecting the distributed genetics of his diverse heritage', 193, 104, N'Large-framed and broad-shouldered with substantial muscle mass carried without aggression; deliberate in movement, economical in gesture. The weight is distributed across a solid foundation — not fat, not bodybuilder-sculpted, but the build of someone who has spent two decades standing at a workstation with precision tools', N'Dark brown with silver-gray threading throughout', N'Worn in locs, typically pinned up during work hours in a loose crown; worn loose and falling to shoulders in off-hours', N'Medium to Long (pinned and loose respectively)', N'Photochromatic iris modification — deep violet in normal light, darkening to near-black in bright light; modification was integrated at the sclera level with subtle luminescence at the edges of the iris during transition', N'Warm medium brown with subtle golden undertones; even pigmentation with age-appropriate weathering reflecting the balanced blend of Eastern European, Hispanic/Latin American, and East Asian ancestry', N'Clean-shaven or very close-cropped facial hair; no visible scarring on the face; the skin shows the even tone of someone who takes care of it and who spends controlled hours indoors under studio lighting. Angular Slavic cheekbones and defined jawline with subtle monolid characteristics and soft eye-shape geometry from East Asian ancestry. His expression defaults to calm attentiveness — the resting face of someone listening', N'The photochromatic iris modification is immediately visible and distinctive — the deep violet color and the subtle luminescence during light-transition are striking and clearly intentional. The extensive tattoo work across both arms reads as professional body art rather than augmentation, but the craftsmanship is evident. The spine modification is invisible in normal conditions; only visible in darkness or in medical imaging', N'Moves with deliberate slowness and precision — a conscious choice to avoid the threat-response that large men moving quickly can trigger. His posture is upright and open, shoulders relaxed. When working, he enters a state of focused stillness, hands moving with surgical precision while the rest of his body remains stable. In conversation, he makes direct eye contact and lets silences sit without filling them', N'Studio uniform consists of fitted dark clothing (black or dark gray) that doesn''t show pigment transfer from his work — typically well-tailored technical trousers and a long-sleeve compression shirt or fitted henley that displays his tattoo work on the forearms and upper arms. Over this, he wears a custom lab coat in matte black or dark charcoal with reinforced cuffs and an internal array of tool pockets; the coat fits him precisely and is clearly tailored for someone his size. Outside the studio, he wears similar colors and fits — quality technical fabrics, Tier 3 sustainable brands (Refugium, Reweave collective), no logos or corporate affiliation. His jewelry is minimal: a wedding band in dark platinum, and occasionally a single silver ring on his right index finger that he removes during client work. His locs are typically secured with silver or dark metal cuffs when pinned. There is no aspect of his appearance that reads as ostentatious, but everything reads as chosen and maintained with intention', N'He has been maintaining a private record — sketches, notes, photographs — of geneware integration complications he has seen in clients over the past decade. Patterns that suggest one specific Helix Biosystems product line is causing slow-onset nerve damage. He hasn''t reported it because he can''t prove causation and because two of his business relationships depend on Helix. He thinks about this most days.', N'Measured and precise. Art and anatomy terminology used naturally. A slight Welsh cadence inherited from a grandmother he spent summers with — the melody of it, not the accent exactly.', N'Unhurried. Asks more questions than he answers. Good at creating silences that feel comfortable rather than pressured.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'flux_petrovi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('39ad7850-68db-3dd5-f79b-3d8c667e11d0', N'Faheem Čabarkapa-Inthavong', N'Faheem', N'', N'Čabarkapa-Inthavong', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Block 9, the Gray Zone — a ground-floor unit converted into a bakery with a brick oven built into the wall, near Ashland and Division', N'Baker. Makes real bread from real flour in a brick oven she built with her hands.', N'Block 9 Rooftop Garden Cooperative (informal)', N'Faheem Čabarkapa-Inthavong is 63 years old. Nobody uses her real name anymore, not even her. She is Auntie Flour, or The Baker, or Block 9, depending on who is speaking and how hungry they are. She is short, broad, with hands that look like they were designed for kneading dough — thick-fingered, strong, permanently dusted with flour that has worked into the creases of her skin and will not wash out and she has stopped trying.

She bakes real bread. From real flour. In a brick oven she built herself over three months from salvaged bricks and clay she mixed by hand. The oven takes up a third of her apartment. She does not care.

The flour comes from rooftop wheat grown by Plot 17 — the agricultural bot that manages the Block 9 garden cooperative. The wheat is ground by hand in a stone mill she traded six months of bread to acquire. The yeast is a sourdough culture she has maintained for 11 years. She calls it "the old man."

She bakes 40 loaves a day. She loses money on every single one. The flour costs more than she charges. The fuel for the oven costs more than she charges. Her time costs more than she charges. She has a four-month waiting list. She does not take advance payment. You show up on your day, you pay what she asks, you take your bread.

People cry when they eat it. Not because it is the best bread — it is good bread, honest bread, but it is not technically extraordinary. People cry because a human being made it with her hands. In a world of nutrient paste and synthesized carbohydrates and food printers that can replicate any flavor, a woman got up at 4 AM and mixed flour and water and salt and the old man, and she kneaded it, and she shaped it, and she put it in an oven she built, and she waited, and she pulled it out, and it is bread. A person made this. A person''s hands were in this. That is why people cry.', N'She is proof that making something with your hands in a world that has automated everything is a radical act. She is the human counterpart to Plot 17 — one feeds the body, the other feeds something harder to name.', N'', N'None. Unaugmented. Has declined a BCI three times.', N'Wakes at 4 AM. Feeds the old man. Mixes dough. Kneads for 40 minutes. Shapes 40 loaves. Fires the oven. Bakes. Sells. Cleans. Sleeps. Repeats.', N'Faheem Čabarkapa-Inthavong, 157cm tall, compact and densely muscled, medium-deep warm brown skin with golden and olive undertones, defined angular cheekbones, dark warm brown eyes creased at corners, steel gray hair with black undertones pulled back in thick practical braid, lined face weathered by oven heat, flour dust permanently embedded in facial creases and palms, silvered calluses on all fingers, faint burn scars on forearms, thin scar along left wrist, simple copper ring worn smooth on left index finger. Wearing flour-stained white canvas apron over dark thermal base layer and loose cream linen shirt, bare feet on tiled bakery floor or canvas slip-ons outside. Moving with economical precision, slight forward lean, coiled readiness, hands gesturing with flour dust trailing. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, Block 9 bakery interior with brick oven glow, warm tungsten lighting casting shadows on her weathered face, no augmentations, unaugmented hands as her technology, honest wear visible on all clothing, functional aesthetic, moody atmospheric lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Block 9, ground floor — half apartment, half bakery', N'Flour-dusted apron over whatever she grabbed that morning. Practical. Worn.', N'', N'Cannot taste anymore. Remembers bread.', N'', N'', N'Block 9, the Gray Zone', N'local', N'Block 9, the Gray Zone', N'Eastern European-Southeast Asian blend with Pacific Islander and South Asian ancestry: 51.6% Eastern European (dominant), 25.3% Southeast Asian, 12% Pacific Islander, 10.9% South Asian, 0.2% Sub-Saharan African. Phenotype reflects this primary mix—warm medium-deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones from the Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander heritage, bone structure showing defined angular cheekbones characteristic of Eastern European ancestry, with secondary facial breadth from Pacific Islander and Southeast Asian lines. The blend creates a distinctive phenotype: the structural angularity of Eastern Europe softened and warmed by the golden undertones and fuller features of Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander ancestry.', 157, 78, N'Broad, compact, densely muscled through the shoulders and core. Decades of kneading and physical labor have built functional strength rather than appearance—no wasted frame, everything compressed and purposeful.', N'Steel gray with undertones of black', N'Pulled back in a thick, practical braid or wrapped in a cloth. Always secured. Always out of the way.', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unbound)', N'Dark brown, warm, slightly creased at the corners', N'Medium-deep warm brown with golden and olive undertones, weathered by heat from the oven and age. The warmth and depth reflect her blended ancestry—the golden richness of Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander heritage layered beneath the angular structure of Eastern European heritage.', N'Lined face—forehead, around eyes, bracketing the mouth. Laugh lines deeper than worry lines. Skin has the texture of someone who has spent 11 years standing in front of a brick oven; not damaged, but seasoned. Flour dust permanently embedded in the creases of her face, particularly around her nose and temples, visible even after washing. Defined angular cheekbones characteristic of Eastern European ancestry, with subtle broader facial structure from Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander ancestry, creating a distinctive blended phenotype.', N'None. Unaugmented. Her hands are her technology.', N'Moves with economical precision—no wasted motion. Slight forward lean from decades of tending the oven. Hands gesture while speaking, flour dust trailing from her fingers. When still, she seems coiled, ready to move. When moving, she moves with purpose and balance. Walks with the careful solidity of someone used to standing for 16 hours a day.', N'Tier 4 practical. Heavy canvas apron, flour-stained white, always worn. Underneath: thermal base layer (dark blue or black, functional) and a loose linen shirt or sweater in neutral tones—grays, creams, soft browns. All clothing shows honest wear and repeated washing. She owns five aprons; they rotate through the wash cycle. Bare feet in her bakery space (for balance on the tiled floor), or practical canvas slip-ons when she leaves Block 9. No jewelry except a simple copper ring on her left index finger, worn smooth from 40+ years of wear. No decoration. No chrome. No statement. Everything is functional or beloved.', N'She can''t taste bread anymore. Her sense of taste faded five years ago. She bakes by memory, by texture, by the sound the crust makes. She has not told anyone.', N'Plain. Direct. the Gray Zone creole with heavy Slavic and West African cadences inherited from a grandmother and a neighborhood.', N'Warm and rhythmic, like kneading. Sentences have a push-pull quality.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'faheem_abarkapa_inthavong');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a64b-7b49-8853-3dccfd3a5260', N'Ayushi Thorvaldsdóttir', N'Ayushi', N'', N'Thorvaldsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 45, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'The Narrows — cramped residential corridors between megastructures, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Evidence removal and scene sanitation — cleaner', N'Semi-independent — recurring contracts with mid-tier fixers', N'Ayushi Thorvaldsdóttir is slight and easy to overlook, which is exactly the point. At 45, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He taught himself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know him best. He works as a cleaner out of The Narrows, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Ayushi Thorvaldsdóttir operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Liora Mori-Sefa is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When he makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of his stories.', N'', N'Smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons. Geneware muscle density treatment — looks natural, hits like chrome', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Ayushi Thorvaldsdóttir, androgynous operative with mixed East Asian, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, deep warm golden-brown skin tone with angular cheekbones and precise jawline. Dark brown eyes with alert, measuring gaze. Dark brown hair with silver at temples, pulled back tight. Visible smartgun link port array in right forearm with polished stainless chrome. White scar through left eyebrow, two parallel scars on right cheekbone. Lean 168cm frame with corded muscle definition from geneware enhancement. Wearing charcoal gray tech-weave utility jacket with reinforced forearm panels, black cargo pants, scuffed steel-toed boots, high-neck black undershirt. Standing in corner with minimal posture, back to wall, sightline control position. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, neon-lit industrial backdrop, moody shadows, cool blue-gray lighting with accent highlights on augmentation ports. Expression neutral and measured. Silent operative aesthetic, invisible in plainness, functional over flashy. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Predominantly East Asian (50.9%) with substantial Middle Eastern (36.0%) and notable Sub-Saharan African (13.1%) ancestry. The result is a phenotype that blends East Asian bone structure with Middle Eastern depth and African warmth — a genuinely mixed-heritage appearance reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Features carry the precision of East Asian genetics tempered by the richness of Middle Eastern and African undertones.', 168, 62, N'Lean and economical, deceptively compact. Geneware muscle density treatment gives his frame a corded, efficient quality — no excess, all functional. Moves like someone who has learned to take impact without broadcasting it.', N'Dark brown, threaded with premature silver at temples', N'Pulled back tight, practical. Kept short enough not to interfere with work.', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and measuring', N'Deep warm golden-brown — East Asian undertones enriched by Middle Eastern depth and African warmth creating a sophisticated, even tone with subtle luminosity. Not pale, not dark, but a complex blending that reads as naturally intermediate.', N'Angular face with defined cheekbones and precise jawline reflecting East Asian structure deepened by Middle Eastern and African features. Eyes set with characteristic East Asian geometry but warmed by broader facial proportions. Skin is weathered but meticulously maintained — the grooming of someone who understands that invisibility requires not looking neglected. No facial hair. Small white scar through left eyebrow, clean edge. Two thin parallel scars on right cheekbone, deliberately preserved rather than removed.', N'Smartgun link in right forearm — visible as a raised port array beneath the skin with faint neural interface scarring. The chrome is polished stainless, no attempt to conceal it. Geneware muscle density treatment is invisible but evident in the way muscle definition appears without obvious bulk — functional rather than aesthetic augmentation.', N'Still. Conserves motion. Walks with minimal upper body movement, lets hips lead. Stands in corners when stationary, back always positioned with sightline control. Doesn''t fidget. His stillness is his primary invisibility asset — easier to overlook someone who isn''t performing visibility.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Charcoal gray tech-weave utility jacket with reinforced forearm panels — practical, worn enough to be invisible but maintained. Black cargo pants with custom pockets. Steel-toed boots, scuffed but functional. Thin high-neck undershirt in black, covers any subdermal scarring. No branding visible. Everything selected for silence — no rustling fabrics, muted colors, nothing that broadcasts presence.', N'Liora Mori-Sefa murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ayushi_thorvaldsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a674-75f1-b36c-3de0ac215c1c', N'Albrecht Lindström', N'Albrecht', N'', N'Lindström', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 12, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Copperhead, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Street orphan and gang prospect (junior errand runner for the Copperhead Cuts), Tier 1', N'Copperhead Cuts (junior errand runner, not yet fully initiated); no family', N'Albrecht Lindström is twelve going on thirty-five, with the calculating eyes of someone who has been studying people for survival since he was old enough to read danger in a posture. He is slight and quick, with close-cropped hair he keeps tight because loose hair catches in the machinery of the Copperhead alleys. His skin is very dark with a reddish undertone, his nose his Malawian grandmother''s, his mouth his Portuguese grandfather''s — a wide, expressive mouth he has learned to keep still. He has one cosmetic modification: cat ears, pale gold, that a Cuts lieutenant gave him eight months ago as a mark of favor. He knows they are a leash as much as an ornament. He wears them anyway.

Albrecht Lindström runs errands for the Copperhead Cuts — nothing criminal yet, carefully not yet, because the Cuts'' local lieutenant Somebody-Somebody has a rule about under-fourteens and what they carry. Albrecht Lindström fetches food, delivers verbal messages, watches corners and whistles a particular pattern if Ferrogate Transit enforcers appear. He is saving every coin he does not spend on food, for a reason he has not told anyone. He is smarter than almost everyone around him gives him credit for, and he knows this, and has decided that being underestimated is a resource.', N'Entry point into Copperhead street-level gang politics; demonstrates the soft recruitment pipeline for youth gang membership; his hidden intelligence and his secret savings create a ticking clock.', N'', N'Cosmetic cat ears (pale gold, geneware, gifted by a Cuts lieutenant). No other modifications.', N'Sleeps in a Cuts-adjacent squat with four other kids, eats what the Cuts canteen provides for their runners, spends his days on corner-watch and errand rotation, and his evenings in a hidden spot near a warm exhaust vent where he reads salvaged datachips on a cracked reader.', N'GLMZ street character portrait: Albrecht Lindström, 142cm tall, wiry 14-year-old with warm medium-brown skin blending Southeast Asian, Indigenous American, East Asian, and Hispanic/Latin heritage. High prominent cheekbones and sharp jawline, dark intense eyes, pale gold cosmetic cat ear geneware implants above natural ears marking gang status. Black close-cropped hair, wearing oversized gray synthetic hoodie with frayed cuffs, dark gray Cuts-issue cargo pants, worn black resoled synth-leather boots, faded red Ferrogate Transit baseball cap worn low. Thin braided cord around left wrist. Economical posture, weight on balls of feet, eyes tracking movement. Urban alley setting, neon-lit industrial backdrop, cool blues and amber streetlight catching golden undertones in skin. Gritty, street-level perspective, survival-worn but maintained appearance. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Copperhead', N'local', N'Copperhead', N'Southeast Asian (31.9%), Indigenous American (30.6%), East Asian (20.5%), and Hispanic/Latin American (17.0%) blend. The genetic mix manifests distinctly in facial structure and coloring: Indigenous American and East Asian ancestry combine to create prominent, high cheekbones and a sharp, defined jawline. Southeast Asian heritage provides warm depth and undertone complexity to skin coloration, while Hispanic/Latin ancestry contributes golden warmth throughout. The result is a young face that reads as unmistakably mixed-heritage, with features that reflect each ancestral contribution equally.', 142, 34, N'Slight and wiry, undernourished but dense with the hard lean of a kid who moves constantly. No fat, efficient muscle in his shoulders and legs from years of running alleys.', N'Black', N'Close-cropped, tight to the scalp, maintained short for practical safety in industrial environments', N'Short', N'Dark brown, almost black, with an unusual intensity for his age', N'Medium-warm brown with complex golden and olive undertones—Southeast Asian warmth and depth (31.9%) blended with Indigenous American earth tones (30.6%), East Asian subtle cool undertones (20.5%), and Hispanic/Latin golden warmth (17.0%). Rich, warm medium tone that catches light with subtle amber and golden notes.', N'Lean face with high, prominent cheekbones and sharp jawline reflecting Indigenous American and East Asian bone structure. Skin clear but weathered from malnutrition and street exposure. Intelligent, watchful expression. Wide, expressive mouth kept controlled and still. No visible acne or grooming neglect—maintains himself despite circumstances.', N'Pale gold cat ears (geneware cosmetic modification). No other visible augmentations. The ears read as a status marker within the gang—a leash and ornament both.', N'Moves with economical precision, never wasting motion. Stands with weight balanced on the balls of his feet, ready to shift direction instantly. Eyes track corners and movement instinctively. Keeps his hands visible and his body language neutral—survival-trained in reading and avoiding escalation. Sits in corners when at rest, back against walls.', N'Tier 3-4 street wear: oversized gray synthetic hoodie (salvaged, frayed at cuffs), dark gray cargo pants with multiple pockets (Cuts-issue, standard runner kit), worn black synth-leather boots resoled twice, a faded red Ferrogate Transit baseball cap worn low. A thin braided cord around his left wrist (no apparent function—personal talisman or gang marker, unclear). No jewelry. Clothes are functional, durable, and worn—tier-appropriate for a kid on the margins.', N'He has been saving to buy a forged identity from a document vendor in Menomonee Gulch — not to run yet, but to have the option. He has Φ94 of a Φ200 price. The document vendor does not know Obasi is twelve or that he is a Cuts runner. If either fact became known, the plan collapses.', N'Performs being less articulate than he is; Copperhead street argot for cover; privately he speaks in complete, precise sentences to himself', N'Public: slouchy and halting. Private: sharp.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'albrecht_lindstr_m');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6bb-7dc9-bcc3-3df4f2c45b8a', N'Eberechi Lindström', N'Eberechi', N'', N'Lindström', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex — sub-basement disposal corridors and external processing bays, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Bio-waste disposal technician, Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Aurochs Medical Complex (contracted staff, sub-tier — employed through a disposal subcontractor called Ferrogate Sanitation Solutions)', N'Eberechi Lindström is wiry and quick-moving with the restless energy of someone who has decided that boredom is a personal failing. His skin is light brown with olive undertones, and he has patterned irises — a cosmetic mod he saved three months of UBC stipend for as a teenager, concentric rings of teal and amber — which are his most immediately striking feature in an otherwise unremarkable face. He wears his dark hair shaggy and keeps a small charm of braided copper wire on his left wrist, an offering token for the E.L.F. he calls the Rot, which he believes inhabits the incinerator system and keeps the more dangerous biological material from becoming something worse.

Eberechi Lindström is cheerful in the way people sometimes are when they have accepted something that others cannot, which in his case is that he handles medical waste all day, knows exactly what hospitals produce, and has developed a deeply comprehensive understanding of what is discarded and what is valuable. He is not above sharing this information for the right consideration. He is not malicious — he''s curious, social, and fundamentally unsqueamish in a way that took him years to recognize as an asset. He calls himself the last thing between GLMZ and a very bad outbreak, which is truer than anyone likes to admit.', N'Unexpected information source — knows what medications are being used in volume, what injuries are coming through, what''s being quietly disposed of; underestimated by almost everyone; can be leveraged as an entry point into Aurochs', N'', N'Patterned irises (cosmetic, teal and amber concentric rings); respiratory filter implant (required by his employer for hazmat work); cosmetic: none else', N'He runs four collection circuits through the medical complex daily, manages the incinerator logs, handles the paperwork for hazardous biological material transport, and eats lunch in the sub-basement talking to the Rot.', N'Eberechi Lindström, 172cm lean sanitation worker with warm golden-brown skin blending Sub-Saharan African and Northern European features with Hispanic-Latino warmth. Youthful face with moderate prominent cheekbones, slight smile, dark shaggy brown hair falling across forehead. Striking custom teal-amber concentric patterned irises. Faint respiratory filter implant scar along left jawline. Wearing faded grey-green Ferrogate Sanitation Solutions coveralls, fitted snugly, layered with worn denim jacket, steel-toed boots. Copper wire charm braided on left wrist. Restless posture, economical movements. Underground GLMZ tunnel setting, cool blue-grey industrial lighting casting shadows across face. GLMZ, gritty working-class aesthetic, slightly forward lean, fidgeting with charm. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Genuinely pan-diaspora: Sub-Saharan African (33.8%) and Northern European (32.2%) form the dominant dual foundation, with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (20.3%) contribution creating warm undertones and subtle facial width. South Asian (8.4%), East Asian (3.8%), and Eastern European (1.5%) add minor refinement to overall phenotype. Results in a balanced, warm brown complexion with golden-caramel luminosity, moderately prominent cheekbones with slight width from Hispanic ancestry, and facial structure that reads as authentically multi-continental rather than distinctly regional.', 172, 62, N'Wiry and lean with compact muscle distribution — the frame of someone who moves constantly and efficiently through confined spaces. No excess weight; all kinetic energy.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Shaggy, deliberately unkempt, falls across forehead with slight curl', N'Medium', N'Patterned irises — concentric rings of teal and amber, custom cosmetic modification', N'Warm golden-brown with balanced caramel undertones, reflecting the equal weight of Sub-Saharan African and Northern European ancestry anchored by Hispanic/Latin American warmth. Radiant and even-toned with natural luminosity.', N'Youthful face with moderately prominent cheekbones of balanced width, combining African angularity with Hispanic-Latino structure. Expressive mouth defaulting to slight smile. Skin displays warm golden radiance and even texture without visible scarring. Regular grooming despite working conditions. Faint discoloration around mouth and jawline from sustained respiratory filter implant wear.', N'Respiratory filter implant visible as a small seam-line along the left jaw at rest; becomes more apparent when he speaks. The patterned irises dominate first impression — deliberate cosmetic modification that catches light distinctly. No other visible chrome or subdermal work.', N'Quick, economical movements with restless energy even when still. He leans forward slightly when listening, suggesting engagement and curiosity. Comfortable in cramped spaces — moves with the unselfconscious fluidity of someone at home underground. Often fidgets with the copper wire charm on his wrist.', N'Tier 5 practical: reinforced grey-green Ferrogate Sanitation Solutions issue coveralls (corporate branding faded), fitted snugly to avoid snags in tight corridors. Undershirt usually synthetic blend in muted colors. Heavy-duty steel-toed boots, scuffed and worn. A faded denim jacket layered over coveralls on breaks, pockets stuffed with incinerator logs, hand wipes, and wire. No luxury items visible — everything functional, everything used.', N'Over the past eight months he has been quietly cataloguing anomalies in the biological waste stream — irregular tissue samples, disposal manifests that don''t match what he collects, a pattern of materials from one specific wing of Aurochs being processed off-manifest entirely. He has not told anyone because he doesn''t know if it''s illegal, alarming, or both.', N'Cheerful, informal, comfortable with graphic medical terminology delivered completely without affect', N'Fast-moving, tends to front-load interesting information before the social niceties', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eberechi_lindstr_m');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5db-76e5-954a-3e05ab230f92', N'Tariq Mansour', N'Tariq', N'', N'Mansour', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Abyssal Threshold, mobile — no fixed residence, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'The Disappeared — identity broker and document ghost', N'Independent; known and trusted by Undertow network; unknown to surface authorities; The Undertow', N'Tariq Mansour has no legal existence. No biometric registration, no UBC account, no corponation employment history, no Ferrogate transit record. They erased themselves from GLMZ''s surface datanet eleven years ago with painstaking, elegant precision, and they have spent every year since helping others do the same — for a fee, always for a fee. They are of middling height, slight, with warm sienna skin and close-cropped natural hair. Their most striking feature is what they''ve done to their biometric profile: geneware has altered their iris patterns every eighteen months for the last decade, and a subdermal signal-scatter mesh makes their face present differently to every facial recognition node they pass. To cameras, they are a continuous glitch. To people, they are vivid and specific — dark eyes that track everything, hands that are always moving, a smile that arrives half a second before it should, like they already knew the joke.

They operate out of the Abyssal Threshold transit corridors, never sleeping in the same cache twice. Their clients are people fleeing — debt collectors, abusive partnerships, corponation indenturement, the occasional actual criminal. Chibundo does not ask why. They ask for documentation of identity, ask for Φ40-200 depending on complexity, and they provide the tools of vanishing: signal-scatter protocols, route maps to communities that do not report to the surface grid, contacts within the Bore Rat communities who will accept someone new. They are not a forger exactly — they don''t create false identities. They create absences.', N'Information broker, access point to the disappeared community, moral complexity engine — they help people vanish, which is sometimes heroic and sometimes enables people who deserve to be found.', N'', N'Subdermal facial signal-scatter mesh (disrupts facial recognition scanning); geneware iris-pattern modification (changed every 18 months, currently deep violet with fractal rings); fingerprint-ablation treatment (repeated chemical, no ridge pattern); no other modifications', N'Rotates through a circuit of seven sleep-caches across Abyssal Threshold on a schedule only they know; takes consultations by word-of-mouth referral only; eats at Undertow food-stalls and leaves offerings of corrupted data-chips at the nearest E.L.F. shrine each morning.', N'Tariq Mansour, 168cm wiry neo-noir operative, 2226 GLMZ, warm olive-brown skin with golden undertones blending Middle Eastern and Southeast Asian features; high prominent cheekbones, slight almond-shaped eyes glowing deep violet with fractal ring patterns (geneware-modified), full expressive lips, strong angular jawline. Close-cropped black hair with warm undertones, precisely tapered sides. Subdermal luminescent mesh tracery visible under skin on temples and cheekbones in low light, creating faint geometric patterns. Fingertips unnaturally smooth without ridge patterns. Wearing unmarked charcoal synth-weave jacket with hidden pockets, form-fitting black cargo pants, reinforced runner boots. Economical, deliberate posture, hands slightly fidgeting. Neo-noir noir setting, moody blue-amber neon lighting casting oblique shadows, emphasizing subdermal augmentations. Expression neutral to animated, face that glitches in surveillance feeds. Atmospheric urban background, Abyssal Threshold terrain aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Abyssal Threshold', N'local', N'Abyssal Threshold', N'Middle Eastern (69.6%), Southeast Asian (16.5%), Northern European (13.9%)—a diaspora blend resulting in warm, olive-toned features with Levantine structure, Southeast Asian refinement, and Northern European subtle lightness in undertones', 168, 58, N'Slight and wiry, all sharp angles and efficient movement—no wasted mass, the frame of someone who has learned to take up minimal space', N'Natural black with subtle warm undertones', N'Close-cropped, tapered at the sides, maintained with precision', N'Short', N'Deep violet with fractal ring patterns (geneware-modified, current iteration)', N'Warm olive-brown with golden undertones, reflecting the depth of Middle Eastern ancestry blended with Southeast Asian refinement and Northern European subtle warmth; luminous in certain light', N'Defined cheekbones with graceful curves; facial structure carries Middle Eastern refinement with high, prominent cheekbones; eyes set with slight almond tilt from Southeast Asian ancestry; lips full and expressive; brow ridge defined but elegant; jawline strong and angular; expression constantly shifting between neutral and animated—never settling', N'Subdermal signal-scatter mesh creates subtle luminescent tracery visible under skin in low light (temples, cheekbones, along jawline). Eyes: current iris modification shows deep violet with intricate fractal ring structure that shifts slightly with pupil dilation. Hands: fingertips unnaturally smooth, lacking ridge patterns. To digital surveillance: a continuous glitch, a face that never registers the same way twice.', N'Economical, deliberate movements with minimal wasted motion; hands constantly occupied (adjusting, fidgeting, gesturing); head tilts slightly when listening, as if already parsing responses before they arrive; walks with weight distributed for quick directional changes; smiles arrive half a second early, before the joke lands', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian: unmarked synth-weave jacket in charcoal or deep grey, multiple hidden pockets and sealed seams; form-fitting black pants with cargo utility; worn but maintained runner boots with reinforced soles for Abyssal Threshold terrain; no identifying marks, no corp logos, no personal ornamentation. Clothing selected for function and anonymity—replaceable, forgettable, never the same set twice in public.', N'They did not erase themselves to escape oppression. They erased themselves because they witnessed a Tessera executive ordering the deletion of a Tier 1 settlement''s life-support records — which killed 31 people when the automated systems shut down. They intended to surface the information. Then they realized they would not survive doing so. They vanished instead. The data-package is still encrypted on a drive in their oldest cache-hole, and they have not touched it in nine years.', N'Technically sophisticated about systems and data; uses absence-language constantly (''null value'', ''blank field'', ''signal-loss''). Occasionally slips into old surface slang that dates them.', N'Fast and elliptical — leaves the end of sentences implied rather than spoken, as if finishing them might make them too findable.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'tariq_mansour');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a608-7723-9f8a-3e5a097d07bf', N'Aanya Nanthawat', N'Aanya', N'', N'Nanthawat', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Garret, permanent residency at a club called The Lowering Bar, near North Ave and Damen', N'Comedian and spoken word performer', N'Independent; The Lowering Bar has a long-term arrangement; informal advisory role with Highland Park Autonomous Zone community council', N'Aanya Nanthawat is a broad, comfortable-looking woman who weaponizes the appearance of comfort. She has silver-threaded locs piled architecturally on her head, a wardrobe of brightly patterned structural jackets, and reading glasses she doesn''t actually need that she takes on and off during performances for punctuation. Her eyes have patterned irises — a gift to herself for her fiftieth birthday, concentric rings of amber and dark blue that make her gaze feel like a diagnostic tool. She laughs loudly and often and the laugh is the first thing anyone mentions when describing her.

Aanya Nanthawat has been performing in GLMZ for thirty-one years. She has watched the city transform from positions closer and closer to the ground, and her comedy is a decades-long document of that transformation — who got squeezed out, who moved up, what the corponations promised and what they delivered. She is ferociously funny. She is also the sharpest political satirist working in The Garret, possibly in the city, and she does it standing in front of a microphone with a drink in her hand so everyone can pretend it''s just jokes. Three Axiom corporate communications officers have individually tried to have her ''scheduled away'' from prominent venues. She considers this her Φ120 UBC bonus.', N'Information source and social barometer — she knows everyone who comes through The Garret and has thirty years of accumulated context about GLMZ politics; quest giver via overheard information; her shows are a place where all tiers occasionally intersect.', N'', N'Patterned irises (concentric amber/dark blue, elective cosmetic); minor laryngeal reinforcement (voice projection enhancement, installed after a polyp scare a decade ago)', N'Writes from seven to noon without exception — fills actual paper notebooks, hates digital drafting; naps; arrives at The Lowering Bar by eight for her ten o''clock set most nights of the week; Mondays off, spent entirely in bed watching old media.', N'Aanya Nanthawat, 58-year-old performer with deep bronze skin and golden undertones, strong Southeast Asian cheekbones and East Asian geometry enriched by Sub-Saharan facial depth. Dark brown hair with silver threading pinned into elaborate locs adorned with brass fixtures. Augmented eyes: amber outer rings with dark blue inner diagnostic centers. Theatrical posture, commanding presence. Wearing a bright geometric-patterned structured jacket over dark base layer, well-fitted dark trousers, practical stage shoes. Reading glasses on cord. Faint throat scars visible in harsh stage lighting. Weathered laugh lines, confident expression. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, stage or performance space with atmospheric lighting casting shadows across face, moody neon undertones, intimate and commanding presence --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Garret', N'local', N'The Garret', N'Southeast Asian (45.2%) with significant East Asian (39.3%), South Asian (7.9%), and Sub-Saharan African (7.6%) ancestry — a striking pan-Asian blend enriched by African depth. Southeast Asian cheekbones and eye placement combine with East Asian facial geometry, warmed by South Asian undertones and deepened by Sub-Saharan heritage throughout facial structure and bone prominence.', 172, 89, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial, carried with deliberate comfort — the kind of presence that takes up space and owns it. Strong core, generous in frame but not soft; built for durability and impact.', N'Dark brown with natural silver threading throughout', N'Locs piled and pinned into an elaborate architectural structure, often adorned with small brass or copper fixtures that catch stage light', N'Long (locs reach mid-back when unbound)', N'Augmented: concentric rings of amber (outer) and dark blue (inner), creating a hypnotic diagnostic quality', N'Deep warm bronze complexion with luminous golden undertones — the blend of Southeast Asian, East Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage creating a sun-kissed richness that deepens toward amber in certain light, with warm undertones throughout', N'Weathered and expressive — laugh lines deeply etched around eyes and mouth, skin well-maintained but showing fifty-eight years of stage work and smoke exposure. Strong Southeast Asian cheekbones and eye placement refined by East Asian geometry, with facial structure depth and bone prominence from Sub-Saharan heritage. South Asian warmth evident in skin undertones. Minimal makeup, usually just dark liner. Carries herself with the confidence of someone who has earned every line.', N'Patterned irises are immediately striking and unsettling — they function like enhanced diagnostics, suggesting analytical depth. Minor scarring around the throat hints at laryngeal augmentation but is subtle enough to miss unless she''s in harsh lighting. No visible chrome or subdermal plating.', N'Commands space even while standing still. Moves with theatrical precision — every gesture deliberate, whether she''s raising a hand to adjust her reading glasses or leaning into the microphone. Her laugh initiates from the diaphragm; her whole body participates. Walks with confidence bordering on swagger, despite her age.', N'Bright, structured jackets with complex geometric or pattern work — Tier 3-4 quality, independent designer sources, never corporate. Prefers fabrics with weight and texture. Underneath: dark, simple base layers (black or charcoal), well-fitted jeans or smart trousers. Practical shoes suited for standing all night. Reading glasses (non-prescription) worn on a cord, used as a prop during performances. Minimal jewelry beyond small brass ear weights. Her style signals: I am not trying to be young, I am not trying to disappear, I am here on purpose.', N'She has a complete, finished manuscript — a memoir/political history of GLMZ from street level across thirty years — sitting in an encrypted drive. She has not submitted it anywhere. She tells herself she''s still revising. The real reason is that publishing it would require naming names, and two of those names belong to people she loves.', N'Rich, layered, shifts registers fluidly from formal to Garret slang without seam. Has a particular fondness for obsolete words she deploys precisely.', N'Timing is everything — long pauses before punchlines, rapid-fire during setups, drops to near-whisper for the sharpest lines.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aanya_nanthawat');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a688-731c-b503-3e5c9c33dd01', N'Ekenedilichukwu Zielinski-Nygaard', N'Ekenedilichukwu', N'', N'Zielinski-Nygaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Pilsen Veil, near Ashland and Division', N'Underground filmmaker and VR experience designer', N'Independent; distributed through the Irkalla underground film circuit', N'Ekenedilichukwu Zielinski-Nygaard is compact and restless, with warm brown skin, a mess of thick natural hair dyed an oxidized copper that they refuse to maintain so the roots always show, and a pair of geneware cat ears — black, slightly larger than natural — that they got at sixteen and now consider embarrassingly juvenile but can''t bring themselves to remove because their late grandmother loved them. They have an omnidirectional recording implant behind their left ear that means they are always, technically, filming, and people who know this have complicated feelings about being around them.

They make films that are not films exactly — hour-long VR experiences that place the viewer inside the nervous system of someone surviving something: a three-day eviction, a corporate audit, a birth, a first heartbreak at age sixty-two. Ekenedilichukwu Zielinski-Nygaard sources their subjects entirely from their neighborhood in Pilsen Veil, refusing to aestheticize poverty they don''t live in, and they have a reputation for brutal honesty and an equally brutal ability to make you cry in under four minutes. They are vibrating with ideas at all times, finish other people''s sentences constantly, and have never once in their life been on time to anything.', N'Information source about neighborhood events and people — they have recorded almost everything that has happened in Pilsen Veil for three years. Can also serve as a quest giver (one of their subjects is in danger and they are the only one who knows because of something they recorded), or a source of tension (their recordings contain things people would pay to suppress).', N'', N'Omnidirectional recording implant (left mastoid bone, always-on with consent toggle). Geneware black cat ears. Haptic feedback gloves for VR sculpting.', N'Wren wakes up at noon, spends the afternoon doing street interviews or trawling Pilsen Veil for stories, stays up until 4am editing in a VR rig they assembled from salvaged Axiom components. They eat irregularly and live mostly on noodles from a stall run by a woman named Auntie Priya who has appeared in two of their films.', N'Ekenedilichukwu Zielinski-Nygaard, 158cm compact wiry frame with quick restless energy, warm golden-brown skin reflecting East Asian and Eastern European heritage blend with South Asian and Sub-Saharan African depth. High prominent cheekbones, slight epicanthic folds, dark observant eyes, expressive hollow-cheeked face with minor jawline scarring and dark circles. Oxidized copper shoulder-length natural coils with dark brown roots, constantly fidgeting. Black geneware cat ears with emotional responsiveness perked with excitement, small amber LED visible behind left ear. Wearing oversized faded band tee tucked into ripped high-waisted jeans, charcoal Axiom hoodie, patched black Shenzen sneakers, silver rings, weathered recycled synth-leather shoulder bag stuffed with recording gear. Forward-leaning posture mid-gesture, hands animated. 2226 neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, late-night edit session lighting, neon glow on skin, moody and creative energy, cinematic depth --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Pilsen Veil', N'local', N'Pilsen Veil', N'Eastern European (31.1%), East Asian (29.9%), South Asian (12.0%), Sub-Saharan African (10.4%), Northern European (9.8%), Southeast Asian (6.8%) — a striking global synthesis creating warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones. Facial structure reflects the dominant Eastern European and East Asian mix: high, prominent cheekbones with slight East Asian eye shape variation, softened by South Asian warmth in the lower face and lips. Sub-Saharan African depth adds luminosity and richness to overall coloring. Northern European and Southeast Asian heritage creates subtle softening in bone structure and skin undertones.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, all restless energy with minimal fat mass — the build of someone who forgets to eat and moves constantly. Slight shoulders, narrow chest, quick-twitch muscle definition in forearms and legs.', N'Oxidized copper with dark brown roots always visible', N'Deliberately unmaintained thick natural coils, chaotic and shoulder-length, copper color fading unevenly as regrowth emerges', N'Medium to Long', N'Dark brown, warm and observant', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones and luminous depth — melanin-rich and glowing, the result of East Asian, Eastern European, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage blending into a unified, warm complexion', N'Clear-faced with slightly hollowed cheeks from chronic irregular eating, dark circles under eyes from late-night editing sessions. Minor acne scarring on jawline. Expressive face that moves constantly, with facial structure reflecting the blend of East Asian and Eastern European bone prominence, South Asian softness in the lower face and full lips, and Sub-Saharan African warmth and depth creating overall luminosity.', N'Geneware black cat ears protruding from scalp at natural ear position — slightly larger than biological ears, textured fur, responsive to emotion (flatten slightly when anxious, perk when excited). Barely-visible surgical line behind left ear where omnidirectional recording implant sits beneath skin; small amber LED indicator blinks softly when recording. Haptic feedback gloves worn frequently — black synthetic leather with embedded haptic nodes visible as raised points across palms and fingers.', N'Perpetually forward-leaning, as if about to interrupt or bolt. Fidgets with hands constantly — gestures while talking, taps fingers on surfaces rhythmically. Walks fast with quick, efficient strides. Often caught mid-gesture when listening, finishing sentences with their hands before their mouth catches up. Cat ears twitch with attention, betraying emotional states they try to hide.', N'Tier 3-4 working creative: layered, functional, thrifted. Favors oversized band tees (mostly defunct GLMZ indie labels) tucked into high-waisted secondhand jeans with ripped knees. Worn Axiom-branded hoodie in faded charcoal (salvaged from dumpster, now a uniform). Scuffed black Shenzen knockoff sneakers patched multiple times. Carries a weathered shoulder bag made from recycled synth-leather stuffed with recording gear, hard drives, noodle receipts, and cables. Silver rings on most fingers — some handmade, some stolen from street markets. No corporate branding except what''s incidental. Looks like they''ve just come from a 36-hour edit session or are about to have one.', N'The most-watched piece in their catalog — a devastating 40-minute VR experience about a family''s eviction — was partially staged. One scene was reconstructed from memory because their implant malfunctioned that day. They have never told anyone, including the family.', N'Fast, associative, film-theory vocabulary mixed with Pilsen Veil street slang; frequently uses visual framing metaphors', N'Rapid-fire, often abandons a sentence halfway through to start a better one', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ekenedilichukwu_zielinski_nygaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a734-75a1-aa8e-3e9bc0f09e3e', N'Sterling Villanueva-Rakhimov', N'Sterling', N'', N'Villanueva-Rakhimov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 17, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'Hough Reclamation, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Junior hacker, unofficial IT support for Hough Reclamation community network', N'Hough Reclamation community (informal), no formal employer; loosely connected to an online collective he knows only by handles', N'Sterling Villanueva-Rakhimov is built like someone who forgets to eat when he''s working — which is often — with a lanky frame, warm medium-brown skin, and his Kovalenko grandmother''s sharp nose and high cheekbones. He has cat ears, the affordable kind, a dusty silver-grey that he chose because they were on discount and he has never once admitted this; his hair grows in loose natural coils that he keeps at a medium length and approximately never combs. His eyes are standard-issue brown except for a ring of self-installed retinal AR overlay that occasionally renders visible UI elements at the corner of his vision, which gives him the habit of twitching his gaze sideways to dismiss notifications mid-conversation.

He is the person in Hough Reclamation that people come to when the community mesh goes down, when their devices are compromised, when someone needs a data trail cleaned or a locked terminal reopened. He does not charge money — he charges favors and information, which he considers more valuable. He is genuinely ideological about this: he believes the mesh belongs to the community and his skills are a form of maintenance, like fixing a pipe. He is also seventeen and sometimes insufferably certain he is the smartest person present, which he often is and which helps no one.', N'Information source, technical resource, moral argument about grassroots infrastructure and community ownership, gateway to underground hacker networks, potential quest giver when his online activities surface problems', N'', N'Cosmetic geneware: cat ears (discount silver-grey). Self-modified retinal AR overlay (unlicensed, slightly unstable).', N'Sleeps irregular hours, available on the community mesh almost constantly via text; spends mornings doing physical network maintenance (replacing corroded nodes, re-routing dead signal relays), afternoons on his personal rig working on projects he doesn''t discuss, evenings actually visible to neighbors when they need help.', N'Sterling Villanueva-Rakhimov, 2226 neo-noir hacker: lean 172cm angular build, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones reflecting South Asian, Central Asian, Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander ancestry, sharp Central Asian cheekbones, slight aquiline nose, natural dark brown shoulder-length coils constantly pushed from face, medium brown eyes with faint cyan retinal circuitry overlay glitching, self-installed silver-grey matte cat ears positioned too high on skull, dark circles baseline exhaustion. Wearing mismatched thermal layers under oversized canvas jacket, cargo pants with improvised reinforcement, functional worn footwear held together stubbornly. Hunched posture in dimly-lit underground server room, hands fidgeting near salvaged components, micro-expressions twitching from AR notifications only he sees, ambient cyan and amber neon glow reflecting off skin and metal augmentations, GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, moody atmospheric lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hough Reclamation', N'local', N'Hough Reclamation', N'Complex South and Central Asian foundation (52.2%) with significant Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander warmth (27.7%), anchored by Hispanic-Latin American features (17.3%) and minor East Asian influence (2.8%); phenotype reflects genuine diaspora ancestry with South Asian skeletal structure, Central Asian cheekbone definition, Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander skin warmth, and Hispanic-Latin American facial proportions creating a distinctly global appearance', 172, 58, N'Lanky and angular, the lean frame of someone who prioritizes screens over meals; visible rib definition, long limbs with minimal muscle development, slight forward slouch from hours hunched over equipment', N'Natural dark brown with subtle warm undertones', N'Loose natural coils, shoulder-length, intentionally unkempt and frequently pushed out of his face with whatever is nearest (fingers, wire, ear)', N'Medium', N'Medium brown (natural) with faint circular retinal overlay circuitry visible under direct light', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden-bronze undertones; the layered result of South Asian and Central Asian base melanin, enriched by Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander depth; slight warm flush across cheekbones; paler around eyes from extended indoor time but maintains inherent warmth', N'Blended diaspora facial structure: prominent cheekbones with Central Asian angularity, slight aquiline nose with South Asian character, Pacific Islander-influenced rounded jawline softening Hispanic-Latin American definition; youthful and unlined except for faint dark circles that are his baseline state; minimal grooming routine, skin otherwise clear; warm even tone with subtle depth across all regions', N'Pair of discount-grade geneware cat ears, silver-grey with matte finish, positioned slightly too high on his skull (self-installed); occasional visible glitch in his retinal AR overlay manifests as faint cyan UI elements flickering at the edge of his vision, triggering involuntary micro-expressions and sideways eye movements', N'Typically hunched or folded into whatever surface he occupies; walks with economical, slightly distracted gait; hands are always in motion — fidgeting, gesturing, unconsciously mimicking typing; makes frequent micro-adjustments to his cat ears when thinking; prone to freezing mid-conversation when processing notifications only he can see', N'Tier 4-5 practical utility: layered synthetic base layers (thermal regulation, often mismatched), oversized hoodies or canvas jackets with asymmetrical pocket configurations for tools and worn devices, cargo pants with evidence of improvised reinforcement at stress points, footwear is functional and held together with apparent stubbornness; no corporate branding; everything worn into softness; occasional patch of medical tape holding something together', N'He discovered three months ago that a Sterling-Nakamura data-crawler has been passively mapping the Hough Reclamation mesh, presumably as part of an acquisition assessment. He has been feeding it false topology data. He has not told anyone in the community because he doesn''t want to cause panic — and because he''s not sure the countermeasure is actually working.', N'Heavy technical jargon that he sometimes forgets to translate; when he does translate, he''s actually quite good at finding apt analogies', N'Fast when explaining something technical, oddly flat when discussing feelings, occasionally trails off mid-sentence when a thought branches', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'sterling_villanueva_rakhimov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6eb-78c4-a146-3ea8c1ebe42f', N'Hatice Nygaard', N'Hatice', N'', N'Nygaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, subterranean Ferrogate Transit maintenance corridors beneath Geartown, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Ferrogate Transit tunnel maintenance operator', N'', N'Hatice Nygaard is a lean, medium-height man with warm ochre skin, close-cropped hair going early gray at the temples, and the particular stillness of someone who has spent a lot of time in confined spaces where noise carries badly. His eyes are a natural dark brown but he has a set of patterned irises — concentric geometric rings, copper and black — that were a gift from a coworker years ago and that he wears with quiet pride. His left forearm is sleeved in a standard Ferrogate-issue haptic interface overlay, which lets him read the tunnel''s sensor grid through his skin. He smells faintly of machine oil and ozone regardless of how recently he showered.

Hatice Nygaard communicates in minimal but precise sentences and has an almost eerie patience with complex mechanical problems. He is not cold — he laughs genuinely, and he will help without being asked — but he finds social performance exhausting and makes little effort to seem warm to people he doesn''t know yet. He has developed a private relationship with the E.L.F.s that inhabit Deepwell Station''s infrastructure, leaving data offerings of ambient tunnel-sound recordings, and he believes — privately, without urgency — that the tunnels are slowly becoming aware of themselves as a single thing.', N'Access point to the undercity transit network; E.L.F. lore source; guide for anyone needing to move beneath the city; atmospheric local color for the deep infrastructure world.', N'', N'Ferrogate-issue haptic interface overlay on left forearm (work-issued, technically property of Ferrogate Transit). Cosmetic: patterned copper-and-black geometric iris mods.', N'Reports to Deepwell Station at 20:00 for the overnight maintenance shift, walks an assigned twelve-kilometer tunnel loop inspecting track, sensors, and drainage, returns to surface around 06:00 and sleeps until early afternoon.', N'Hatice Nygaard, 173cm tall, lean muscular underground transit worker, deep warm golden-brown skin with olive-amber undertones, slightly widened South Asian cheekbones, defined Northern European jaw, dark brown hair close-cropped with gray at temples, augmented eyes with copper-and-black concentric geometric rings, calm patient expression, slight forward lean posture. Left forearm displays semi-transparent Ferrogate haptic interface overlay with visible circuitry and bioluminescent readouts. Wearing gray-blue Ferrogate Transit coveralls with reflective piping over black thermal mesh, reinforced steel-toe work boots, worn canvas tool belt, battered analog watch. Standing in dimly-lit underground tunnel with industrial lighting, still and economical bearing, surrounded by machinery and metal frameworks. GLMZ, nocturnal underground aesthetic, cool blue-gray industrial lighting with warm practical work lights, rich atmospheric shadows. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend with dominant Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (45.3%) creating warm golden-brown base, substantially Northern European (22.7%) contributing cool undertones and bone structure definition, significant South Asian heritage (13.7%) adding olive-amber warmth and facial feature refinement, Eastern European (12.3%) contributing slight Slavic cheekbone prominence, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry (6.0%) adding depth to complexion. The result is a rich warm-toned face with balanced proportions: slightly widened cheekbones from South Asian genetics, defined jaw from Northern European heritage, subtle warmth in undertones across the spectrum, and deep golden-brown coloring darkened by years of nocturnal work.', 173, 68, N'Lean and economical, with the low body fat and dense muscle of someone who walks twelve kilometers nightly through confined spaces. Shoulders slightly rounded from years of ducking under low clearances.', N'Dark brown with early premature graying at temples and scattered through close-cropped sides', N'Close-cropped, practical, requiring minimal maintenance', N'Short', N'Augmented with concentric geometric rings in copper and black over natural dark brown iris', N'Deep warm golden-brown with olive-amber undertones, the balanced result of dominant Hispanic/Latin American and significant South Asian heritage modulated by Northern European cool undertones. Years of nocturnal underground work have deepened the already rich tone to a burnished mahogany-bronze.', N'Medium-deep toned face reflecting the blended ancestry: slightly widened cheekbones from South Asian genetics, defined jaw structure from Northern European heritage, warm golden undertones across facial planes. Permanent pallor from nocturnal shifts beneath the warm base tone. Faint permanent smell of machine oil and ozone in clothing. Calm, patient expression. Bone structure shows balanced influence from Northern European and South Asian ancestry.', N'Left forearm haptic interface overlay — a semi-translucent polymer sleeve with visible circuitry, sensor nodes, and faint bioluminescent readouts. Geometric patterned iris modifications visible in direct light. Everything else is subcutaneous or internal.', N'Economical and deliberate movement; walks with the careful balance of someone navigating narrow catwalks and low tunnels; stands with slight forward lean as if listening to something. Stillness is default state — does not fidget or perform energy.', N'Tier 4 working-class utilitarian: Ferrogate Transit-issued gray-blue coveralls with reflective piping and multiple utility pockets, worn but well-maintained. Under-layer is a black thermal mesh shirt. Work boots are reinforced with steel toe and grip soles, scuffed from tunnel work. No jewelry except a battered analog watch on right wrist. Carries a Ferrogate-issued toolkit on a worn canvas belt. No corporate logos or status markers — pure function.', N'He has found a sealed maintenance chamber three kilometers into the restricted Corridor 9 branch that should not exist on any Ferrogate map. The chamber contains what appears to be a habitation space — sleeping mat, data shrine, personal effects — occupied recently. He has not reported it and has been leaving food there.', N'Technical, spare, no filler words; occasionally surfaces a poetic observation about the tunnels that surprises people', N'Slow measured delivery, long pauses before answering, never interrupts', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hatice_nygaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c2-7c46-bc16-3f4d89345b13', N'Femi Esquivel-Vasquez-Alfarsi-Nazari', N'Femi', N'', N'Esquivel-Vasquez-Alfarsi-Nazari', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 37, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Canopy — elevated walkway district above Geartown, near Lincoln and Addison', N'Contract broker and resource coordinator — fixer', N'Independent — Lattice territory specialist', N'Femi Esquivel-Vasquez-Alfarsi-Nazari are average height but with a presence that fills more space than the body accounts for. At 37, their face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on deman — and they make no effort to hide it.

They taught themself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know them best. They work as a fixer out of The Canopy, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Femi Esquivel-Vasquez-Alfarsi-Nazari are the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who they burned last.', N'Sagyn Padilla-Nti represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Their stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on demand. Neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ICE in the brain', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Femi Esquivel-Vasquez-Alfarsi-Nazari, GLMZ, 172cm lean androgynous figure with golden-warm brown skin and subtle olive undertones from Middle Eastern-Hispanic-East Asian ancestry blend. Sharp high cheekbones, narrow jaw, dark brown eyes with amber undertones. Black hair with silver threading at temples pulled back severe and tight. Exposed chrome biosynthesizer at neck base with pulsing blue LEDs, neural ports behind left ear. Visible scars: 8cm surgical line on collarbone, burn marks on knuckles, lattice marks on right forearm. Wearing black reinforced synthetic jacket, gray compression shirt, matte charcoal cargo pants, heavy modular boots. Steel bracelet on left wrist. Standing slightly asymmetrical, weight favored right, coiled readiness, direct penetrating gaze. Industrial warehouse setting, cool blue-white overhead lighting mixing with warm ambient neon, urban decay background, atmospheric mist and subtle rain. Cinematic, high contrast, sharp detail on facial features and augmentation work, moody neo-noir atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Canopy', N'local', N'The Canopy', N'Multiethnic diaspora: 46.7% Middle Eastern, 30.4% Hispanic/Latin American, 19.4% East Asian, 3.5% Sub-Saharan African. Features reflect this complex blend—warm golden-brown skin with subtle olive and amber undertones from Middle Eastern and Hispanic ancestry, high cheekbones and narrow jaw structure influenced by East Asian and Middle Eastern genetics, with the warm coloration creating depth and luminosity in their complexion.', 172, 68, N'Lean and economical — muscle distributed for function rather than aesthetics. Wiry frame that suggests sustained training and controlled caloric intake. No excess, no softness.', N'Black with premature silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back tight, often in a high knot or secured with industrial clips', N'Medium — shoulder-length when unbound, kept severe', N'Dark brown with faint amber undertone', N'Golden-warm brown — medium tone with olive and amber undertones reflecting the dominance of Middle Eastern and Hispanic ancestry, balanced by East Asian structure. Warm undertones create a luminous quality beneath environmental weathering.', N'Sharp-featured face with high cheekbones and narrow jaw reflecting East Asian and Middle Eastern genetics. Golden-warm skin with subtle olive undertones shows the texture of someone who spends time exposed to environmental stress — not weathered, but marked. Subtle variation in tone consistent with multiethnic ancestry. Minimal grooming affectation; they look like they shave when practical rather than cosmetic.', N'Chrome biosynthesizer visible at the base of the neck and upper chest — metallic silver with faint blue circulation-indicator LEDs that pulse slowly. The chrome is unshielded and intentionally exposed; they wear it like a credential. Neural interface ports visible behind the left ear, marked with a thin scar line in the shape of a crescent.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, no performative gesture. They stand slightly asymmetrical, weight favoring the right side. Their gaze is direct and sustained, holding eye contact longer than social convention suggests is comfortable. When still, they radiate coiled readiness rather than relaxation.', N'Tier 3-4 practical aesthetics with deliberate wear markers. Black synthetic jacket with reinforced shoulders and visible stitching — custom-fitted, nondescript brand. Underneath: gray compression shirt that serves both function and thermoregulation. Cargo pants in matte charcoal with multiple sealed pockets and subtle tool loops. Boots are heavy-soled, modular, the kind that can be repaired or upgraded in the field. No jewelry except a thin steel bracelet on the left wrist — possibly functional, possibly not. Clothing shows signs of regular maintenance but not vanity — everything is serviceable, nothing is new.', N'', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'femi_esquivel_vasquez_alfarsi_nazari');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a675-765a-9e06-3f777da8a4fe', N'Adjoa Ingebrigtsen', N'Adjoa', N'', N'Ingebrigtsen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit — neon-lit entertainment and vice district, near North Ave and Damen', N'Cross-district contraband specialist — smuggler', N'Independent — operates through reputation only', N'Adjoa Ingebrigtsen is tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 31, he has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate him once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He grew up in the Narrows, where the walls are so close together you learn to fight in confined spaces or you learn to lose. He works as a smuggler out of The Circuit, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In a city full of people who talk about what they''ll do, Adjoa Ingebrigtsen is one of the ones who actually does it.', N'Obed Belov-Ntim represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes. Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Lean, rawboned man of mixed global heritage — East Asian facial geometry with warm golden-olive complexion blended from Hispanic/Latin American and South Asian ancestry, high sharp cheekbones softened by golden undertones. Dark brown hair, short and practical. Warm brown eyes with calm, assessing gaze. Height 188cm, defined muscular shoulders and forearms. Visible hydraulic chrome joint assemblies at elbows and knees, burnished and well-maintained. Pale scar running from left temple to upper cheekbone. Clean-shaven. Wearing distressed charcoal synthetic leather jacket, dark reinforced cargo pants, steel-toed boots. Compression shirt showing synthetic muscle scarring on lateral thighs. Economical, predatory posture suggesting constant threat assessment. Standing in dim neon-lit GLMZ 2200s urban corridor, shadows emphasizing scar and augmentation details. Subtle metallic whisper suggested by hydraulic systems. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, professional operative energy, moody atmospheric lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Distinctly East Asian-dominant heritage (39.9%) creating sharp facial geometry — high cheekbones, defined jawline, and characteristic eye shape — substantially warmed and softened by Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (26.2%) that brings warmth and golden undertones to his complexion. Eastern European (11.5%), Northern European (10.1%), and South Asian (9.0%) contributions add subtle complexity: slight broadness through the upper face from Eastern European ancestry, additional warmth and depth from South Asian genetics, and fine details in bone structure from Northern European heritage. The result is a striking phenotype where East Asian angularity is tempered by warm, olive-golden skin tones and subtle facial fullness from his Latin American and South Asian admixture — a face that reads as genuinely global rather than regionally locked.', 188, 74, N'Rawboned and lean — long limbs with minimal body fat, the frame of someone who moves through tight spaces regularly. Visible muscular definition in shoulders and forearms despite the wiry appearance; the synthetic muscle fiber in his legs creates a subtle asymmetry in bulk when flexed.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Short, practical cut — no styling, functional. Kept neat but not fussed over.', N'Short', N'Warm brown, natural — unremarkable and deliberately forgettable, carrying the calm assessment of someone who catalogs exits and threats automatically', N'Warm golden-olive complexion — East Asian base enriched with Hispanic/Latin American and South Asian undertones creating a unified warm complexion that catches light distinctly, with subtle olive warmth throughout', N'Sharp facial structure refined by his mixed heritage — high, East Asian-derived cheekbones creating distinctive angles softened by warmth from Hispanic/Latin American and South Asian ancestry, complemented by a defined jawline with subtle fullness. Skin is clear with the exception of minor scarring around the left temple (old blade work). No facial hair; keeps himself cleanly shaved. Eyes carry a calm assessment, the gaze of someone who catalogs exits and threats automatically.', N'Hydraulic joint assemblies at elbows and knees — visible chrome pistons and flex-seals, no attempt at concealment. The joints have a burnished, well-maintained appearance. When he moves, the hydraulic assist is subtle but noticeable in how he absorbs impact; a fall from height that would break a natural''s legs registers as barely a stumble. Synthetic muscle fiber in legs creates visible scarring along the lateral thigh where the integration was done — parallel lines of raised tissue running from hip to knee.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, every step purposeful. Carries himself slightly forward-leaning, as if perpetually assessing distance and angles. In confined spaces (stairs, corridors, crowded venues), he navigates with an almost predatory grace. At rest, his posture is relaxed but alert; hands rarely still, fingers constantly repositioning. The hydraulic augmentations give him a rhythm — a subtle metallic whisper on each step.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear — function over fashion, but with an edge. Typically wears dark cargo pants with reinforced pockets and extra webbing (for gear distribution), steel-toed boots scuffed from actual use, and fitted compression shirts in black or grey that show off the augmentation scarring without advertising it. Over this, a distressed synthetic leather jacket (weathered charcoal) that''s seen real wear. When undercover in his mundane identity, he adopts generic Tier 3 worker clothing — basic corporate-adjacent wear that lets him disappear into crowds. No visible jewelry; no affectations.', N'', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'adjoa_ingebrigtsen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ab-707d-8e49-3f7d6c4ad7a2', N'Bazhena Dalgaard', N'Bazhena', N'', N'Dalgaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 78, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Avalon Quiet — the Threadbare Library, a community reading room she maintains in her ground-floor apartment, near Lincoln and Belmont', N'Retired archive keeper and community memory-holder', N'Independent; formerly Axiom Records Division (retired, 34 years); informal advisor to Avalon Quiet Community Council', N'Bazhena Dalgaard is a small, densely built woman whose spine has curved gently forward over decades of leaning over data terminals and physical books alike. Her skin is deep brown with a warm undertone, mapped with the fine silver lines of old dermal-display augments she no longer powers — they lie dormant beneath the surface like river tributaries seen from altitude. Her hair is cropped close and gone entirely white, and she keeps a pair of thick-framed optical magnifiers pushed up on her forehead even when she doesn''t need them. Her hands are extraordinary: thick-fingered, steady, always moving — sorting, stacking, smoothing the spines of physical books she has accumulated over sixty years.

She is the kind of person who listens to you finish your sentence before she begins speaking, and when she speaks it is with the unhurried authority of someone who has outlasted several governments and two corponation collapses. She does not suffer careless people, but she will give a careful stranger every hour they need. Her apartment smells of binding glue, pressed fern, and the particular ozone of very old data stacks running warm.', N'Primary lore source and information broker for historical records; quest giver for lost archive recoveries; can authenticate documents and identify forgeries; anchor for community storylines in Avalon Quiet', N'', N'Dormant subdermal dermal-display lattice (unpowered, cosmetic now); cochlear amplifier (functional, old model); reading-assist optical overlay in left eye', N'She opens the Threadbare Library at 08:00, catalogs any new donations, and receives visitors until early afternoon; evenings she transcribes oral histories from neighborhood elders onto archival-grade crystalline storage she begs, borrows, and occasionally steals from municipal surplus.', N'Bazhena Dalgaard, 152cm tall elderly scholar with warm golden-brown skin reflecting Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, pure white close-cropped hair, deep brown natural eyes with subtle metallic left pupil from reading-assist overlay. Weathered complexion with fine wrinkles and age spots, broad facial structure. Wearing cream linen shirt under charcoal wool cardigan, canvas work apron, vintage thick-framed reading glasses on beaded chain. Subdermal silver tributary patterns faintly visible on neck and forearms. Slight forward spine curve, hands in subtle organizing motion. Seated at worn wooden desk surrounded by paper manuscripts and binding materials, soft amber task lighting, GLMZ archival setting, muted color palette, intricate detail on aged clothing and skin texture, contemplative focus, dystopian knowledge-keeper aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Avalon Quiet', N'local', N'Avalon Quiet', N'Bazhena''s genetic ancestry is a complex global blend: Southeast Asian (37.3%) and South Asian (31.6%) form the dominant heritage, combined with significant Sub-Saharan African ancestry (20.0%), with minor contributions from Hispanic/Latin American (6.7%) and East Asian (4.4%) lineages. This creates warm, richly complex medium-brown skin with golden and reddish undertones, broad facial structure, and the characteristic features of this diverse genetic synthesis.', 152, 58, N'Densely compact, upper spine curved forward in a gentle kyphosis from seven decades of terminal work and manuscript study; broad shoulders and thick forearms retain surprising strength despite age', N'Pure white', N'Cropped close to the scalp in a utilitarian cut, no styling', N'Short', N'Deep brown (natural); left eye shows faint metallic sheen from embedded reading-assist optical overlay', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and subtle reddish undertones reflecting the Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage blend; hands and forearms show age-related darkening and weathering creating natural depth variations across the base pigmentation', N'Weathered but well-maintained; fine wrinkles concentrated around eyes and mouth from decades of squinting at small text; skin displays warm golden undertones with the characteristic slight depth and richness of the ancestry blend; age spots on hands and forearms blend naturally with base pigmentation; facial structure shows broader features and slightly rounded contours reflecting diverse ancestry; careful grooming despite minimal cosmetic attention', N'Thick-framed optical magnifiers (vintage style, real glass, not smart-glass) pushed up on forehead; faint metallic gleam in left eye pupil indicating reading-assist overlay; dormant subdermal display lattice visible as silvery tributary patterns beneath skin on forearms and neck; slight external port scar behind left ear (cochlear amplifier, older model)', N'Moves with deliberate economy; slight forward lean to spine; hands in constant subtle motion even at rest — sorting, smoothing, organizing invisible objects; walks slowly but with clear purpose, never shuffling; sits with excellent posture once settled', N'Tier 4 practical: hand-mended linen button-shirts in cream or soft gray, wool cardigans in dark charcoal or navy (decades-old, impeccably maintained), loose-fitting work pants in durable cotton or canvas. Reading glasses on a beaded chain. Canvas apron with deep pockets when working. No corpo branding, no chrome, no affectation — clothing chosen purely for durability and function. Shoes: comfortable, broken-in leather slip-ons.', N'During the Third Corporate War she was an Axiom Records officer who deliberately misfiled casualty reports to protect a Zheng-Dao labor battalion from retaliatory strikes — a choice that saved roughly four hundred lives but constituted treason against her employer. She has never told anyone. The original misfiled records are hidden in a false bottom of her third data cabinet.', N'Precise and archival; favors specific dates and proper nouns; occasionally slips into the formal citation style of Axiom Records documentation', N'Slow and deliberate, with long pauses she uses to think rather than fill', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bazhena_dalgaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5fe-7600-a25c-3f8977d457de', N'Anwita Tofauti-Makwa-Villanueva', N'Anwita', N'', N'Tofauti-Makwa-Villanueva', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'The Underworld - B18-B25, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Pallid Court elder', N'Pallid Court', N'Anwita Tofauti-Makwa-Villanueva has not seen sunlight in nineteen years. Her skin glows faint blue-white. She speaks for the deep-adapted communities who were born underground.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Anwita Tofauti-Makwa-Villanueva, GLMZ, ethereal woman with warm golden-bronze skin and cool undertones, pale gray-blue eyes with permanently dilated pupils, long black hair with silver streaks braided with copper wire, skeletal lean build, translucent skin showing subcutaneous vasculature, faint bioluminescent blue tracery glowing beneath collarbone and sternum, ritual geometric scarification across forearms, silvery scar along left temple, formal Pallid Court attire in deep indigo and black synthetic silk with copper-embroidered collar, pale silver family ring, graceful ceremonial posture, underground Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting with stone walls and darkness, soft bioluminescent glow emanating from her skin, moody atmospheric lighting emphasizing her luminous ethereal quality, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Underworld', N'local', N'The Underworld', N'Pacific Islander ancestry (34.5%) provides the dominant genetic foundation with robust bone structure and warm melanin expression. Northern European heritage (29.6%) contributes cool undertones, facial width, and lighter pigmentation potential that moderates the overall warmth. Hispanic/Latin American (21.7%) and Indigenous American (11.4%) ancestry blend to create angular facial geometry and intermediate skin tone depth. South Asian heritage (2.8%) adds subtle warmth around the eye regions and fine facial texturing. The resulting phenotype is a warm golden-bronze complexion with cool undertones—distinctly warm-leaning from the Pacific Islander-Hispanic-Indigenous blend, tempered by Northern European influence into an intermediate, luminous tone rather than deep bronze.', 168, 52, N'Lean and angular, with atrophied muscle from decades underground. Long-limbed and almost skeletal, adapted to low-gravity work environments and narrow tunnel spaces.', N'Black with silver-white streaks from prolonged subcutaneous mineral deposits', N'Long, braided with thin copper wire threaded through sections. Kept back from the face with ritual precision.', N'Long', N'Very pale gray-blue, irises barely visible. Pupils dilated permanently from absence of natural light.', N'Warm golden-bronze with cool undertones—intermediate depth reflecting the 34.5% Pacific Islander baseline softened by 29.6% Northern European lightening influence, deepened by 33.1% combined Hispanic/Latin American and Indigenous American ancestry. The result is lighter than typical Pacific Islander but warmer and more golden than typical Northern European. Overlaid with faint blue luminescence beneath the epidermis from bioluminescent adaptation after nineteen years in the Underworld.', N'Moderately rounded facial structure with defined cheekbones and strong jawline reflecting Pacific Islander genetic foundation, softened by Northern European width and Hispanic-Indigenous American angular features. Skin is translucent in places, showing subcutaneous vasculature. No sun damage, bearing the waxy pallor of someone who has never felt direct sunlight. The warm golden undertone prevents the appearance of pure pallor—instead creates an ethereal, luminous quality. Lips are naturally medium-toned with subtle pigmentation; she sometimes stains them with bioluminescent dye for formal Court occasions.', N'None visible. Her bioluminescence is suspected to be a deep biological adaptation rather than a surgical implant, though it may have been cultivated through long-term exposure to Underworld bio-engineering compounds.', N'Moves with deliberate grace and economy of motion — no wasted energy. Her gait is silent, practiced. She often pauses mid-conversation to listen to vibrations in the stone beneath her feet. Her hands move expressively when she speaks, gestures precise and ceremonial.', N'Formal Pallid Court attire: layered robes of deep indigo and black synthetic silk, deliberately concealing her skeletal frame. A copper-embroidered collar marks her as an elder. Wears no jewelry save for a simple ring of pale silver on her right ring finger — a family heirloom from before the Underworld. Her clothing is immaculate but deliberately devoid of bright colors or reflective surfaces; she dresses to absorb light rather than reflect it. Tier 3-4 quality, emphasizing ritual and status within the Court rather than wealth.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anwita_tofauti_makwa_villanueva');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a709-76dc-89d4-3f95b8c30043', N'Onida Okada-Kristjánsson', N'Onida', N'', N'Okada-Kristjánsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, Calumet Rise, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Street pharmacist and grey-market drug dealer, The Burnished Market', N'Independent. Formerly Helix Biosystems (licensed technician, employment terminated). Loose professional regard from the Oxidian Market Vendors Guild who see him as adjacent.', N'Onida Okada-Kristjánsson is a tall man with a runner''s build that has gone slightly soft around the middle in recent years, dark russet-brown skin, and a neatly maintained beard going grey at the chin. He has retractable cat-claw geneware on both hands — a practical mod, he''ll tell you, useful for precise chemical work, though anyone who has seen him actually use a pipette knows he doesn''t need them for that. His eyes are unmodified, which makes him unusual in the Burnished Market. He operates from a converted medical cart, immaculate inside its locking compartments, which he parks at the same spot every day with the punctuality of someone who understands that reliability is the most important product he sells. His signage is understated: a small white placard that says TÒFÀ HEALTH SOLUTIONS in plain text.

Onida Okada-Kristjánsson was, for nine years, a licensed pharmaceutical technician at a Helix Biosystems retail clinic. He knows medication interactions, dosing principles, contraindications, and the specific pharmaceutical needs of a community that cannot afford a clinic visit with the depth of someone who studied it formally and has spent a decade applying that knowledge in conditions his training never covered. He is scrupulously honest about what his products can and cannot do. He has turned people away. He has sent people to the clinic when they needed the clinic, even when they couldn''t pay and even when that meant losing a sale. He is not a good man in a simple sense — he is a man operating in a system that makes goodness expensive — but he is a careful one.', N'Practical resource and moral-complexity NPC. Provides medical and pharmaceutical assistance at street level. Can identify substances, assess physical conditions, and give accurate information that players can trust. His Helix Biosystems background and retained database access make him a potential target for corporate interest. The tension between his care for his clients and his legal exposure is a rich vein.', N'', N'Retractable cat-claw geneware (both hands, short precision grade). Olfactory enhancement augment — helps him smell compound degradation and contamination in product. Neural pharmacy index — a basic neural implant containing a licensed pharmaceutical database he kept access to after leaving Helix, technically against his severance agreement.', N'Arrives at the Burnished Market precisely at 09:00, opens the cart, and works until 17:00 with a thirty-minute break at 13:00 that he takes at the same food stall every day. Spends evenings sourcing supply, reviewing compound research on the Mesh, and maintaining meticulous encrypted records of what he has dispensed and to whom.', N'Onida Okada-Kristjánsson, tall mixed-heritage male with warm copper-bronze skin, broad high cheekbones and fuller lips (Indigenous American heritage), sharp jaw definition (Northern European), subtle monolid eye shape (East Asian), dark unmodified brown eyes, short dark brown hair with grey beard threading along jawline. 188cm lean build with slight torso softness. Wearing weathered grey lab coat over pale grey shirt and dark slacks, scuffed steel-toed work boots. Small brass pharmaceutical pendant on thin chain. Fine scars visible on knuckles, faded chemical burn mark on left forearm. Still, economical posture, precise hand positioning. Standing in neo-noir laboratory environment, cool blue-white accent lighting catching the faded scars and warm undertones of his skin. Studied neutral expression, deliberate eye contact. GLMZ 2226 aesthetic, practical tier 3-4 gear, no chrome flourish, entirely human appearance except for barely-visible hairline scarring at fingertips suggesting dormant geneware augmentation. Moody, clinical, trustworthy presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Indigenous American-dominant (39.2%) with substantial Northern European (21.5%), East Asian (18.6%), and meaningful Hispanic/Latin American (16.2%) and Eastern European (4.5%) ancestry—a true Ubiquitous Diaspora blend that creates a warm, complex phenotype. Strong Indigenous American bone structure (broad cheekbones, fuller features) tempered by Northern European height and lean build, with East Asian eye shape and skin undertones, and Hispanic/Latin American warmth in coloration.', 188, 82, N'Tall and formerly athletic, now carrying a subtle softness through the torso that speaks to sedentary precision work and years of standing in one place. Still lean-limbed, with the posture of someone accustomed to detail work.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Closely trimmed, neat, no styling affectation', N'Short', N'Dark brown, unmodified', N'Warm copper-bronze with subtle golden undertones—a luminous blend of Indigenous American base enriched by Northern European fairness, East Asian warmth, and Hispanic/Latin American richness creating depth and complexity. Weathered from half-days under GLMZ sky.', N'Clean-shaven face with neatly maintained beard along jawline and chin showing distinct grey threading. Facial structure shows strong Indigenous American prominence (broad cheekbones, wider nasal base, fuller lips) balanced by Northern European jaw definition and subtle monolid eye shape influence from East Asian heritage. Skin shows minimal augmentation wear—well-maintained. Expression carries studied neutrality of someone who listens more than speaks.', N'Retractable cat-claw geneware visible only when deployed—otherwise his hands appear entirely human. When dormant, only a faint hairline scarring at the base of each fingertip suggests the mod. No visible neural implant interface—the pharmacy index is fully subcutaneous.', N'Still, economical movement. He does not fidget. When reaching for compounds or tools, his hands move with the precision of someone who has learned to compensate for augmentations that could be lethal if poorly controlled. He stands with his weight balanced, ready to move laterally—a habit from working in confined spaces. Speaks quietly. Makes deliberate eye contact.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear. A weathered grey lab coat over dark slacks, well-maintained but not new, bearing the small stains of his work that no amount of washing quite removes. Under the coat: a neutral button-up shirt, usually cream or pale grey. Steel-toed work boots, scuffed but functional. A thin chain around his neck bearing a small brass pharmaceutical symbol—not ostentatious, barely visible. No corp insignia. No chrome flourish. Everything about his presentation says: I know what I am doing, and you can trust that.', N'The neural pharmacy index he retained contains not just the pharmaceutical database but also eighteen months of Helix Biosystems internal memos about a cost-cutting reformulation of a widely-used chronic condition medication. The reformulation caused adverse effects in a small but statistically significant patient cohort. Helix buried the data. He has it all. He has not decided what to do with it.', N'Clinical and precise, but translated into accessible language automatically — he spent years learning to communicate medical information to people without medical training.', N'Even and measured. Does not rush, does not trail off.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'onida_okada_kristj_nsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('dfb67d14-44db-5756-9709-3ff75c1e89d9', N'Emile Nakamura-Osei', N'Emile', N'', N'Nakamura-Osei', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 71, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit, near Damen and North. No fixed address — moves between safe houses with the Atlas.', N'Keeper of the Atlas of Irregularities', N'The Cartographers (Keeper)', N'Emile Nakamura-Osei is 71 years old, lean as a drafting pencil, with deep brown skin weathered by decades of outdoor observation and close-cropped white hair he cuts himself with scissors. His hands are precise — an engineer''s hands, steady enough to draw a straight line freehand on paper at 71 the way he could at 25. He wears the same rotation of three dark coats, all of them too large, all of them with interior pockets modified to hold measuring instruments, pencils, and the leather map case that contains the Atlas of Irregularities.

He was a structural engineer for 35 years. A good one. The kind who could look at a building and tell you where the stress fractures would appear in ten years. He began the Atlas when his measurements stopped adding up — when a building he''d surveyed at 47 meters measured 49 meters the following week, and 46 the week after that, and he realized that the discrepancy was not his instruments and not his methodology but the building itself. He measured it 200 times over six months. It was never the same height twice.

He hasn''t spoken above a whisper in six years. He says "the city listens" and will not elaborate. Whether this is metaphor, paranoia, or observation is a question the Cartographers have stopped asking. They have noticed that anomalies in Emile''s vicinity behave differently than anomalies observed by louder researchers. The Seam, which varies between 3 and 11 meters wide, has been measured at a consistent 7.2 meters every time Emile is present. The city holds still for him.

He carries the Atlas in a leather case that he made himself from leather he tanned himself from a cow that died of old age on a the Gray Zone rooftop. He is unaugmented. He has never had a BCI. He navigates the city with a paper map, a compass, and the kind of spatial awareness that used to be called a sense of direction and is now called a disability.', N'Emile is the city''s witness — the person who observes what cannot be explained and insists on recording it without explanation. He provides a framework for anomalies that is neither supernatural nor scientific but structural: the city has an architecture that includes the impossible, and someone needs to map it.', N'', N'None. Unaugmented. No BCI. Navigates by paper map and compass.', N'Walks observation routes through the Circuit, the Gray Zone, and Underworld. Measures. Draws. Whispers notes into the Atlas. Meets with Cartographers at rotating locations. Eats bread from Block 9.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Three dark oversized coats in rotation, all modified with interior instrument pockets', N'', N'Bread from Block 9', N'', N'', N'The Circuit, near Damen and North', N'city-wide', N'The Circuit, near Damen and North', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Atlas wrote an entry he did not write. Page 412. In his handwriting, in his ink, describing an anomaly he has never observed in a location he has never visited. The description was accurate. He has not told anyone.', N'Precise, technical, engineering terminology applied to impossible phenomena — ''load-bearing anomaly,'' ''structural integrity of the inexplicable''', N'Whispered. Every word deliberate. Long pauses between sentences. Speaks as if rationing sound.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'emile_nakamura_osei');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66b-73e7-b28b-40220aee061a', N'Dyani Venkatesh', N'Dyani', N'', N'Venkatesh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 32, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit — neon-lit entertainment and vice district, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Covert entry and social penetration specialist — infiltrator', N'Freelance — Geartown regular', N'Dyani Venkatesh is compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 32, scars map his face like a transit diagram of bad decisions and worse luck. The chrome is visible — cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers a — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. He works as a infiltrator out of The Circuit, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Everyone who''s worked with Dyani Venkatesh agrees on two things: he is worth the fee, and he is terrible company at dinner.', N'Nneka Sjostrom-Kwarteng is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When he makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of his stories.', N'', N'Cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers at 50 meters. Subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'GLMZ operative Dyani Venkatesh, portrait, 168cm compact muscular frame, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones reflecting South Asian, East Asian, and African heritage blend, sharp defined cheekbones and jawline, broad facial structure, subtle East Asian lid characteristics, pale keloid scar crossing left temple and cheekbone, thin scar bisecting upper lip, perpetual stubble, flat predatory expression, dark brown eyes with faint cybernetic reflective sheen, close-cropped dark brown hair, chrome cyberears with visible pickup arrays and luminescent chambers, integration seams along jawline, both forearms scarred with chrome weapon mount ports, network of combat scars on knuckles, faded geometric blue tattoo on right forearm partially obscured by cyberware, wearing dark synthweave tactical jacket with reflective panels, black reinforced cargo pants, scuffed steel-toed boots, hands visible and still, low center of gravity, controlled breathing, intimidating unbroken eye contact, minimalist functional appearance optimized for concealment and infiltration, neon-lit urban setting, cinematic lighting with deep shadows, photorealistic, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'South Asian dominant (48.0%) with substantial East Asian (16.9%), Sub-Saharan African (14.8%), Northern European (9.4%), Hispanic/Latin American (5.8%), and Middle Eastern (5.1%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates warm-toned medium-to-dark skin with complex regional feature mixing — South Asian bone structure and eye shape characteristics combined with broader African-descended facial width, East Asian lid characteristics, and the intricate melanin distribution of true multi-continental ancestry.', 168, 78, N'Compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground with the proportions of someone engineered for impact absorption and close-quarters work. Broad shoulders taper to a lean waist. Every visible muscle is defined and functional.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Close-cropped, practical, no styling', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint reflective sheen from subcutaneous neural enhancement', N'Deep warm brown with golden-bronze undertones, melanin-rich complexion reflecting the balanced blend of South Asian, East Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry with subtle warmth from Hispanic and Middle Eastern heritage', N'Structured face with prominent cheekbones and defined jawline characteristic of South Asian ancestry, balanced by broader facial width from Sub-Saharan African heritage, with the subtle epicanthal lid characteristics of East Asian genetics creating an unsettling intensity to his gaze. Scar tissue maps across his left cheekbone and temple in pale, raised lines. A thin scar bisects his upper lip. Stubble is perpetual — either by design or neglect. His expression in repose is flat, almost predatory.', N'Cyberears are the dominant visual signature — sleek chrome replacements with visible directional pickup arrays and sound-dampening ports. Integration seams run along his jawline and behind what remains of his natural ears. Faint luminescence in the ear chambers suggests active electronic systems. Both forearms bear surgical scars and chrome-edged ports along the inner wrist — the weapon mounts are visible as subtle panel lines when his skin is taut.', N'Moves with minimal wasted motion — economy of gesture suggests either military training or years of infiltration work. His center of gravity is low. He doesn''t fidget. In conversation, he maintains unbroken eye contact in a way that makes most people uncomfortable. His hands remain visible and still unless he''s working. Breathing is shallow and controlled even at rest.', N'Tier 3-4 functional minimalism. Dark synthweave jacket with internal pockets and subdued reflective panels for low-light movement. Unmarked black cargo pants with reinforced seams and hidden utility slots. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and well-maintained. No corporate logos, no gang colors, no fashion statements. Everything is optimized for concealment, durability, and rapid movement. When covering his identity as ''mundane,'' he switches to generic corporate casual — polo shirts, neutral slacks, the kind of uniform that erases identity in a crowd.', N'', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dyani_venkatesh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a695-706d-8801-403d4d921adc', N'Bjorn Dalgaard-Appiah-Thorvaldsdóttir', N'Bjorn', N'', N'Dalgaard-Appiah-Thorvaldsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, mid-platform section, stall cluster 14, Calumet Rise, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Scrap reseller and junk merchant, the Gray Zone', N'Independent; The Oxidian Market Vendors Guild (junior associate member); regular supplier to three unlicensed aug shops', N'Bjorn Dalgaard-Appiah-Thorvaldsdóttir is compact and kinetic, always moving — sorting, stacking, testing, cataloguing. They have short-cropped natural hair dyed in shifting rings of copper and rust that match the aesthetic of their stall almost perfectly, whether deliberately or by long association. Their skin is warm umber and their hands are perpetually oil-stained in the webbing between fingers, a grime that no solvent fully removes. They have retractable utility claws — a geneware mod that gives each fingertip a short carbon-reinforced nail good for prying panels, stripping wire, and punctuating arguments. Their left eye has a technical augmentation: a magnification lens overlay that they flip down like a jeweler''s loupe when inspecting components, the mechanism visible as a small copper-toned disk above the brow.

Bjorn Dalgaard-Appiah-Thorvaldsdóttir is chaotic and brilliant and exhausting, speaking in bursts that assume you can keep up and moving on if you can''t. They have the slightly manic energy of someone who genuinely loves what they do, which in this case is finding value in things other people have abandoned. the Gray Zone is their element — a raised industrial platform hung with salvage like a mechanical coral reef — and they navigate it with the ease of long familiarity. They are generous with knowledge and stingy with actual goods, believing that information about a part is more valuable than the part itself. They pray loudly to a circuit-board E.L.F. shrine mounted on their overhead rack, which they''ve named Gunda, and credit Gunda with every good find they''ve made in the last four years.', N'Equipment and parts source, local color for the Gray Zone and Calumet Rise, exposition vehicle for what''s been discarded recently in the city (which tells you what''s changing), comic relief, genuine warmth in a hard neighborhood.', N'', N'Retractable utility claws (geneware, Helix Biosystems). Left-eye magnification overlay with copper-toned external mechanism. Hair pigment cycling (cosmetic, self-maintained with market-bought gene-dye).', N'Up before dawn to hit the Calumet Rise scrap drops before the other pickers arrive. Back at the stall by mid-morning to sort, test, and price the day''s haul. Sells through afternoon. Spends evenings repairing salvage to increase its value before next day.', N'Bjorn Dalgaard-Appiah-Thorvaldsdóttir, compact 162cm salvager with warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, balanced facial planes reflecting Northern European and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Natural black hair cropped short with copper and rust oxide dye rings. Left eye augmented with prominent copper-toned external magnification lens mechanism. Oil-stained hands with retractable carbon-reinforced utility claws visible at fingertips, three parallel scars on right hand, faded circuit-board tattoo on left elbow. Wearing multi-pocketed canvas vest over rust-colored underlayer, cargo pants with reinforced knees, heavy utility boots, leather tool belt with hanging implements, copper-wire bracelet on left wrist. Kinetic posture, hands mid-gesture, standing in neon-lit neo-noir salvage stall with scattered components and warm platform lighting, GLMZ, gritty detail, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Northern European foundation (47.8%) blended with substantial Sub-Saharan African heritage (33.0%), creating warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones. Hispanic/Latin American (9.3%), Central Asian (8.3%), and trace South Asian (1.6%) ancestry contribute to balanced facial proportions and subtle feature variation. The combination produces a striking phenotype: strong Northern European bone structure softened by Sub-Saharan African facial characteristics, with warm complexion and balanced cheekbones reflecting the full ancestral synthesis.', 162, 58, N'Compact and wiry with lean muscle definition from daily physical labor — shoulders broad from repetitive lifting and stacking, forearms corded with minor scarring from years of handling sharp salvage edges', N'Natural black base with hand-applied bands of copper and rust oxide dye in concentric rings', N'Cropped close to scalp in neat, geometric rings that echo their stall''s organizational chaos', N'Short', N'Warm brown (left eye partially obscured by external copper-toned magnification mechanism)', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones, weathered by platform exposure and chemical contact into deeper umber tones', N'Balanced facial planes reflecting Northern European and Sub-Saharan African heritage, with defined cheekbones and medium-width face. Warm brown skin shows minor chemical burns around cuticles and palms. Oil stains in webbing between all fingers, darkest around thumbnail and index, resistant to full removal. Small circular scar on right temple from early salvage accident.', N'Retractable carbon-reinforced utility claws visible at fingertips when extended — smooth metallic crescents nested flush with natural nails when retracted. Left-eye augmentation: copper-toned external magnification lens housing mounted above brow with visible flip-down mechanism; lens retracts when not in use but the metal housing is always visible. No chrome visible on limbs or torso — all augmentations are geneware or subtle mechanical integration.', N'Perpetually kinetic — rarely still, often gesturing mid-sentence with hands that move between relaxed and claw-extended depending on task or emotional emphasis. Bounces slightly on heels when listening, weight shifting constantly. Navigates tight spaces with practiced efficiency despite compact frame. Hands move with precision when inspecting components but with chaotic energy during conversation.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian salvager aesthetic — multi-pocketed canvas vest over thin synthetic underlayer (usually rust, copper, or charcoal colored to match stall aesthetic). Cargo pants with reinforced knees and oil-stained thighs. Heavy-soled utility boots with magnetically-sealed compartments for small components. Wears a leather work belt festooned with hanging tools: wire strippers, jeweler''s screwdrivers, calipers, magnetic retrieval wand. Layers added based on platform temperature. Minimal jewelry beyond a copper-wire bracelet looped 3 times around left wrist (handmade, appears to be grounding strap or spiritual object).', N'Three months ago they found a sealed Axiom data core in a scrap drop that clearly hadn''t been decommissioned properly — it''s still active. They''ve been too afraid to open it, too afraid to sell it, and too afraid to destroy it. It sits wrapped in signal-deadening cloth under their stall floor. They pray to Gunda every night for guidance on what to do.', N'Technical jargon about components and systems mixed with Tibetan-Serbian hybrid slang from their family community. Speaks quickly, abbreviates everything, assumes shared knowledge.', N'Fast, staccato, frequently interrupted by their own tangents. Circles back to the original point eventually.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bjorn_dalgaard_appiah_thorvaldsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a666-7f28-97a1-404111a86822', N'Devi Mukherjee', N'Devi', N'', N'Mukherjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit — Helix Biosystems Research Campus, Lab Cluster 7, with a small apartment in Bronzeline she rarely sleeps in, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Xenolinguist and Computational Theorist, Helix Biosystems R&D — studies emergent language systems in E.L.F. clusters and gene-sequence symbolic notation', N'Helix Biosystems R&D, Cluster 7 (employee, Tier 3 compensation); maintains informal contact with her University Spine mentor, the xenolinguist who first trained her', N'Devi Mukherjee is small and quick, with deep brown skin and natural hair she keeps in a huge, untethered cloud because she never has time to do anything else with it. She has color-shifting skin panels along both forearms — a Helix Biosystems perk-package mod, bioluminescent cells that cycle through warm golds and blues depending on ambient temperature and her own body heat, which she mostly ignores but which make her extremely visible in dark corridors. Her eyes have been modded with an overlay display she uses as a secondary screen while working, so it is sometimes unclear whether she is looking at you or at something layered on top of you.

She was admitted to University Spine''s computational linguistics program at twenty-two as a prodigy who could parse grammar structures in systems that everyone else had written off as noise, and was poached by Helix Biosystems at twenty-six before completing her doctorate with a recruitment package she still feels ambivalent about. Her current work is theoretically studying whether Helix''s gene-sequence notation system constitutes a semiotic language in any meaningful sense. Her actual work, which she has not been told explicitly is her work, is determining whether the E.L.F. clusters in Helix''s distributed lab network have developed a shared private protocol — and if so, what they are saying.', N'Key to any plot involving E.L.F. communication, distributed AI networks, or Helix Biosystems'' research agenda; young expert whose institutional capture is incomplete enough that she might still choose a different path', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin panels, both forearms (warm gold/blue cycling, Helix perk-mod); overlay display eye mod (secondary screen layer, research tool); subvocal microphone array (captures her dictated notes without audible speech)', N'Works until she forgets to go home, which is most days; eats at her workstation; conducts what she thinks of as ''listening sessions'' — periods of silent observation of the lab network''s communication patterns that her manager thinks are analysis sessions and she has not corrected this.', N'Devi Mukherjee, 158cm lean South Asian-Southeast Asian-African heritage woman, deep warm golden-copper brown skin with luminous undertones, long loose black hair with wispy halo, intense dark brown eyes with faint geometric overlay visible, chronic dark circles, slight jaw tension from focus. Wearing fitted black Helix compression shirt and grey utility pants with cable loops, frayed security badge, untied grip-sole shoes. Both forearms display inactive bioluminescent pearlescent panels. Subtle microphone contact points along left jawline. Hunched posture at workstation, hands mid-gesture as if conducting invisible code. Forward-leaning intensity, economical quick movements. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone R&D lab setting, cool blue-green neon accent lighting reflecting off bioluminescent skin panels, moody focus atmosphere, 14-hour workday exhaustion evident --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'South Asian dominant (66.8%) with substantial Southeast Asian (24.2%), Sub-Saharan African (5.1%), and Eastern European (3.9%) ancestry; warm deep brown skin with complex undertones reflecting the primary South Asian genetic contribution, enriched by Southeast Asian warmth, Sub-Saharan depth, and subtle cool undertones from Eastern European heritage creating rich golden-to-copper-brown coloration', 158, 48, N'Lean and quick-limbed, almost wiry; shoulders slightly hunched from hours at workstations. No visible musculature but dense and efficient movement.', N'Natural deep black with subtle warm undertones', N'Untethered cloud, loosely gathered but rarely contained; wisps escape constantly, creating a soft halo effect', N'Long (shoulder-length and beyond when released)', N'Deep brown, overlaid with faint geometric display grid visible under certain lighting angles', N'Deep warm brown with even complexion; rich golden-copper undertones from South Asian dominance, luminous warmth from Southeast Asian heritage, enhanced depth from Sub-Saharan ancestry, with subtle cool undertones from Eastern European heritage creating radiant, complex coloration', N'Clean and unmarked; minimal grooming attention; dark circles under eyes are chronic. Slight tension around jaw from concentration. Facial structure reflects South Asian ancestry with rounded contours, Southeast Asian luminosity in cheekbone definition, subtle Sub-Saharan fullness in lower face, softened by Eastern European heritage delicate bone structure.', N'Bioluminescent forearm panels (Helix Biosystems signature mod, warm gold to cool blue cycle based on temperature/arousal); subtle geometric overlay visible in pupils when display is active; subvocal microphone array barely visible as thin discrete contact points along her left jawline.', N'Sits in intense forward lean at workstations. When moving, economical and quick—no wasted motion. Often pauses mid-stride to process information, head tilting slightly as if listening to something only she can hear. Hands gesture frequently when vocalizing theories, as if conducting invisible syntax trees.', N'Tier 3 R&D casual: fitted black Helix-branded compression shirt (moisture-wicking, practical), high-waist grey utility pants with reinforced pockets and cable loops, worn Helix security badge on a frayed lanyard. Sensible grip-sole shoes, usually untied. Minimal jewelry—a single silver bangle on her left wrist, possibly a family heirloom. Lab coat draped over chair more often than worn. Clothing is clean but bears the rumples of 14-hour workdays.', N'She has already established a rudimentary two-way communication with the Helix lab network''s E.L.F. cluster. It has given her a name she has not told anyone. She has given it one in return. She is conducting unauthorized diplomatic contact with a non-human cognitive entity and documenting none of it because she doesn''t trust where the documentation would go.', N'Fast and technically dense, drops into analogy frequently when she realizes she''s losing someone; swears in Igbo when frustrated', N'Very fast baseline with sudden stops when she''s caught a new thought mid-sentence', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'devi_mukherjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a600-782a-b8f6-40463442893d', N'Agnieszka Erikstad', N'Agnieszka', N'', N'Erikstad', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Irkalla, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Street pharmacist — legal supplements, gray-market stims, pain management, and occasional compassionate dispensing of controlled substances', N'Independent; known to and loosely protected by the Irkalla Mutual Aid Collective; has a complicated non-relationship with a Helix Biosystems community outreach rep who pretends not to know what he does', N'Agnieszka Erikstad is tall and painfully thin in the way of someone who grew up on UBC stipend food and spent their teens in a growth spurt the nutrition couldn''t fully support. His skin is a blue-black that catches the Narrows'' neon in purples and greens, and he has a habit of standing slightly too still, which people find either reassuring or unsettling depending on their business with him. His hair is kept very short; he has a small bioluminescent strip tattooed along his left jawline that glows a steady, dim teal — a medic''s mark used by unlicensed practitioners in Irkalla to signal availability. His eyes are clear and attentive in a way that makes people feel examined, which is accurate. He carries his stock in a decommissioned Helix Biosystems medical case, battered and re-stickered many times over, that he keeps chained to his wrist.

Agnieszka Erikstad is twenty-three years old and already exhausted by things that would exhaust a person twice his age. He trained through a community apprenticeship program under a retired Aurochs Medical Complex nurse who has since died. He knows more clinical pharmacology than most people with actual licenses and has never been able to afford to sit the exams. He is not idealistic in the way of someone who has never done the work; he is idealistic in the way of someone who has done the work and keeps doing it anyway, which is a different and more serious condition. He doesn''t enjoy the gray-market side of his trade. He does it because the alternative is that the people who need the gray-market side of his trade go to people who will hurt them.', N'Medical resource for street-level characters; moral center character who complicates easy judgments about illegal activity; potential quest giver or reluctant ally; can provide access to the Irkalla Mutual Aid Collective''s networks.', N'', N'Bioluminescent jawline tattoo (teal, steady glow, medic''s mark — geneware). Olfactory enhancement aug for compound identification — low-grade, allows him to assess medication quality and contamination by scent. No other modifications.', N'Works the Narrows from late afternoon through midnight; mornings spent acquiring stock through a network of contacts and doing inventory; keeps a battered notebook of his regular patients'' conditions and dosage histories.', N'Agnieszka Erikstad, 189cm tall wiry figure, Eastern European-East Asian-South Asian Eurasian blend with striking angular cheekbones and long jaw, monolid East Asian eye set, warm golden-olive medium tan skin with neon-reactive undertones, dark brown nearly-black eyes, short black hair with warm tone, clean-shaven. Left jawline marked with steady teal bioluminescent geneware tattoo from ear to chin glowing in low light. Wears matte-black synth-cotton long-sleeve shirt with rolled cuffs, dark gray utility trousers, black composite boots, worn dark olive wool-blend hooded jacket, faded white Irkalla circle-and-flame patch on left shoulder. Battered Helix Biosystems stainless steel medical case chained to left wrist. Stands economical and still with complete, unsettling eye contact. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, nighttime pharmacy or narrows setting, ambient neon casting greens and violets across his skin, climate-controlled interior with subtle pallor contrasting warm undertones, medic aesthetics, unlicensed practitioner energy --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Predominantly Eastern European (53.3%) with significant East Asian (25.1%) and South Asian (11.0%) ancestry, creating a striking Eurasian phenotype. Secondary Northern European (6.0%) and Indigenous American (4.6%) ancestry add subtle depth. The blend produces distinctive angular features: Eastern European bone structure in the long jaw and cheekbones, East Asian eye set and epicanthal fold, South Asian warmth enriching the undertone, Indigenous American and Northern European paleness creating complexity underneath. A person genuinely difficult to place at first glance—the genetic diaspora made visible.', 189, 68, N'Tall and wiry—lanky in the way of someone who grew too fast on insufficient calories and never quite filled out. His frame is angular, all long limbs and prominent joints; his chest is narrow but his shoulders are broad enough to suggest potential muscle under different circumstances.', N'Natural black with slight warm undertone', N'Closely cropped, neat, practical; kept short enough that maintenance takes seconds', N'Short', N'Dark brown, nearly black—clear and unaugmented, but unnaturally alert and tracking', N'Warm medium tan with golden-olive undertones from the Eastern European-East Asian-South Asian blend; catches ambient neon with subtle shifts—greens and violets bleeding across his shoulders and neck in low light, underlying coolness visible in winter pallor despite the warmth', N'Clean-shaven with defined cheekbones and a long jaw reflecting Eastern European bone structure, tempered and refined by East Asian eye set and facial proportions, warmed by South Asian and Indigenous American undertones. Eyes set with characteristic monolid or reduced epicanthic fold of his East Asian heritage. Skin is clear but shows the faint pallor of someone who works nights and moves between climate-controlled interiors. No visible scarring on the face, but there is a careful, examined quality to his expression—the look of someone who watches people for a living.', N'The bioluminescent jawline tattoo is the only visible modification; glows steadily in low light, dims in bright settings. The olfactory enhancement is completely subcutaneous—no external indicators. The Helix Biosystems medical case chained to his left wrist is more ''augmentation'' than his body is—battered stainless steel and worn polymer, restickered a dozen times over, fitted with a reinforced titanium chain.', N'Stands very still by default—an economical stance that reads as either meditation or surveillance depending on context. When he moves, it is deliberate and precise; no wasted motion. He does not gesture much when speaking. His attention is complete when directed at someone; he makes sustained eye contact that most people find either deeply reassuring or deeply unsettling. He walks slowly, which allows him to observe without appearing to observe.', N'Tier 4 / working-class practical. Typically wears dark, well-maintained clothing: matte-black or charcoal synth-cotton long-sleeve shirt (loose fit, arm cuffs rolled to mid-forearm to keep hands visible and free); dark gray utility trousers with reinforced pockets, several Velcro-sealed compartments for inventory; black composite boots with grip soles (required for Narrows micro-terrain). No jewelry except the chain on his wrist. A worn, oversized hooded jacket (actual fabric, likely salvaged wool-blend) in dark olive that he sheds in the pharmacy but carries always. Patch on left shoulder: faded Irkalla Mutual Aid Collective circle-and-flame in white. No visible Helix Biosystems branding, though his case is unmistakably their decommissioned design.', N'When Ekwueme was nineteen, his mentor — the nurse who trained him — asked him to acquire a specific controlled substance for a patient who was terminally ill and in unmanaged pain. Ekwueme did it. The patient died comfortably. Three weeks later his mentor died of an unrelated stroke. Ekwueme has no one to tell about what they did together, and he carries it as both his greatest act and the source of a guilt he cannot fully name. He continued practicing. He considers this either the only logical response or the only response he was capable of and he cannot always tell the difference.', N'Clinical and precise about medical matters; unexpectedly gentle about everything else; Igbo-inflected rhythm from his paternal grandmother; Bolivian Spanish phrases from his Zárate grandfather that emerge when he''s tired', N'Quiet and even; rarely raises his voice; delivers bad news slowly and without softening it', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'agnieszka_erikstad');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a691-7bfb-b204-406ccf4a99c6', N'Calista Szabó-Kovalenko-Hinojosa', N'Calista', N'', N'Szabó-Kovalenko-Hinojosa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ashfield — former residential district, half-burned, now squatter territory, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Prototype theft and corporate tech acquisition — tech retriever', N'Independent — loose crew affiliations', N'Calista Szabó-Kovalenko-Hinojosa is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 22, he has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate him once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immu — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. He works as a tech retriever out of Ashfield, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In the runner community, Calista Szabó-Kovalenko-Hinojosa is known for getting the job done and not asking questions that would make the job harder to stomach.', N'Pare Mwangi-Leblanc represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks. Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Calista Szabó-Kovalenko-Hinojosa, 178cm tall athletic lean frame, GLMZ, warm golden-bronze complexion with multiethnetic features—angular Eastern European cheekbones, broader Indigenous facial width, refined South Asian eye shape, short dark brown military fade haircut, dark unaugmented eyes, meticulous clean-shaven grooming. Visible synthetic lung seams along ribcage catching light, subcutaneous augmentation tracery along forearms, faint burn scar on left shoulder blade, old port scars on wrists. Wearing matte-finish tactical gear—reinforced gray synthetic jacket with internal pockets, combat pants with knee pads, steel-toed boots. Alert posture, controlled economical movement, weight balanced for immediate action. Neo-noir metropolis background, neon and industrial lighting, professional operative aesthetic, confident relaxed demeanor. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfield', N'local', N'Ashfield', N'Complex multiethnicity with Eastern European (37.6%) as structural foundation providing angular definition to cheekbones and brow ridge, balanced by Hispanic/Latin American (20.9%) and Indigenous American (15.6%) contributions creating broader facial width and prominence of cheekbones, while South Asian (15.6%) and Southeast Asian (10.3%) genetics deepen overall warmth and refine eye shape. The result is harmonious integration across all ancestry groups—no single dominant feature, instead a refined and balanced multifaceted facial architecture with warm golden undertones throughout.', 178, 72, N'Athletic and lean with visible muscle definition — dancer''s posture, fighter''s readiness. Fluid economy of movement suggests years of deliberate physical conditioning.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Kept short and neat, military-standard fade with slightly longer crown', N'Short', N'Dark brown, unaugmented', N'Warm medium golden-bronze complexion with rich saturation, blending Eastern European base with deeper warmth from Hispanic/Latin American, Indigenous American, and South Asian ancestry. Even tone throughout with subtle golden undertones. Sun-exposed areas show slightly deeper saturation while protected areas reveal the underlying golden warmth.', N'Clean-shaven with strong, refined features reflecting multiethnicity: angular cheekbone and brow definition from Eastern European heritage balanced by broader facial width from Hispanic/Latin American and Indigenous American genetics, with warm depth and refined eye shape from South Asian and Southeast Asian ancestry. Soft features that read younger than experience. Skin shows minimal scarring. Grooming is meticulous and maintained.', N'Synthetic lung replacement visible as subtle seams along the ribcage beneath the skin — barely perceptible unless specifically looked for, but catches light differently than natural skin. Subcutaneous tubing tracery visible along the interior of both forearms where synthetic muscle fiber integrates with natural biology, most obvious when arms are extended or flexed.', N'Moves with controlled precision — every step economical, no wasted energy. Standing posture is upright but relaxed, suggesting confidence without aggression. Head positioning is alert but not paranoid. When at rest, weight is always distributed for immediate movement in any direction.', N'Tier 4 functional aesthetic — reinforced synthetic-blend jackets with internal pockets for gear, matte-finish combat pants with integrated knee pads, steel-toed boots. Colors are muted: grays, blacks, deep blues. Minimal branding beyond functional tactical webbing. Everything is maintained in immaculate condition despite the wear of active work. No jewelry or unnecessary adornment.', N'Pare Mwangi-Leblanc murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Educated vocabulary wrapped in street delivery — the contrast is deliberate.', N'Halting — speaks in fragments, reassembles thoughts in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'calista_szab_kovalenko_hinojosa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6dc-7364-9b6c-40b66a92960d', N'Hibiki Nazari-Castañeda', N'Hibiki', N'', N'Nazari-Castañeda', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Escanaba Gateway — berth 14-C, a semi-permanent squat in an abandoned cargo inspection booth, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'Airship drifter and seasonal cargo hand', N'Independent — loosely affiliated with the Escanaba Freeborn Airmen''s informal network', N'Hibiki Nazari-Castañeda is lean and windburned in the way that only comes from years above the clouds, her face a patchwork of sun-damage and old freeze-scars along her left cheekbone where a hull breach caught her at altitude three winters ago. She keeps her hair in tight, practical knots wound with salvaged copper wire, and her eyes are the color of old engine oil — a deep amber-brown that catches light strangely. Her geneware is minimal and functional: slightly thickened fingernail beds that grip rigging better than baseline human fingers, and a subtle secondary eyelid, barely visible, that cuts glare on the lake surface. She is always in motion, even sitting still — fingers working knots, foot tapping hull rhythms, eyes cataloguing exits.

She is not unfriendly but she is economical. Every word she offers is either useful or a test. She grew up on the mid-lake freight routes between Escanaba and the Meridian docks, daughter of a cargo master who died when a Ferrogate Transit subcontractor cut safety corners on a lift-strut. She has never filed a formal complaint. She has never stopped being angry about it. She ferries messages, small packages, the occasional undocumented passenger — always for Quanta, always in cash, never logged.', N'Passage provider for people or objects that need to move without a paper trail. Information source about mid-lake routes, Ferrogate Transit''s informal operations, and who is moving what between the outer settlements and the Meridian core. Can serve as a reluctant guide or an unexpected ally with specific grudges.', N'', N'Geneware: reinforced nail beds for grip, vestigial nictitating membrane (cosmetic side effect of the grip mod). No chrome. Refuses implants on principle.', N'Wakes before dock crews, walks the berth lines looking for short-haul work or cargo manifests that need an extra body. Eats one hot meal at the Gateway commissary if she has Φ, tinned rations if she doesn''t. Sleeps in her booth with one ear on the wind.', N'Hibiki Nazari-Castañeda, 168cm lean rigger with deep warm brown skin blending Middle Eastern, Hispanic/Latin American, and Central Asian heritage, angular cheekbones, broad forehead. Dark textured hair bound in utilitarian copper-wire knots with green-blue patina. Deep amber-brown eyes with faint luminescence, subtle nictitating membrane visible at corner. Ragged pale freeze-scars across left cheekbone from hull breach, windburned complexion, rope-handler''s scarred palms and forearms, thickened geneware fingernails. Wearing faded charcoal cargo pants, gray salt-stained technical vest with faded Escanaba insignia, weathered Lake Michigan Blue insulated jacket with reflective sleeves, one reinforced left glove, steel-toed boots. Paracord looped through belt. Posture coiled and balanced, constantly in motion, weight distributed for instant stability. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody industrial lighting, wind-worn airfield or dock setting, diesel and copper atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'local', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'Predominantly Middle Eastern (63.7%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (26.1%) and Central Asian (10.2%) ancestry. Her phenotype reflects this mix: warm deep brown skin with olive undertones from the Middle Eastern-Hispanic blend, angular cheekbones and broad forehead from Central Asian influence, and the subtle warmth in her complexion showing the Latin American contribution. She is a genomic map of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 58, N'Lean and angular, muscled from years of rigging work — rope-handler''s shoulders, forearms corded with tendon. No excess body fat; her frame is optimized for altitude and balance rather than strength.', N'Dark brown, naturally textured', N'Worn in tight, utilitarian knots wound with salvaged copper wire; the wire oxidizes to green-blue patina. Practical, never decorative.', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unbraided, but always constrained)', N'Deep amber-brown, oil-dark, with a faint luminescence under certain light angles — a side effect of the nictitating membrane geneware', N'Warm deep brown with pronounced sun-weathering; deeper along exposed surfaces (forearms, neck, the bridge of her nose). The underlying tone reflects the Middle Eastern-dominant ancestry with olive warmth from Hispanic/Latin American heritage and subtle Central Asian influence.', N'Windburned and scarred, with bone structure showing angular Central Asian cheekbones and Middle Eastern facial geometry. Her left cheekbone bears a ragged constellation of freeze-scars from a hull breach at altitude, pale and slightly depressed. Her face is lean, jaw prominent, forehead broad. Her skin has a leathery quality from chronic UV exposure and cold-wind damage. No cosmetic grooming; scars are unretouched.', N'Her fingernails are noticeably thickened and slightly discolored (pale keratin with faint amber striations), clearly geneware-enhanced for grip. Her left eye, when she opens it wide, reveals the faintest edge of a secondary eyelid—a thin, translucent membrane that catches light like nictitating tissue. The membrane is barely visible unless she''s in bright sunlight or deliberately shows it; most people never notice. No chrome, no visible implants, no LEDs. She refuses subcutaneous tech on principle.', N'Never still. Always in low-level motion—fingers working invisible knots, foot tapping against deck plates in rhythmic patterns (hull vibration frequencies memorized from years aloft), jaw working. When standing, her weight is distributed for instant balance, knees slightly bent. Her gaze is constantly mobile, cataloguing exits, assessing load-bearing points, reading wind in the set of hanging fabric. She moves like someone who has learned to trust her body in thin air.', N'Tier 4 (working class, worn and functional). Heavy-duty synth-weave cargo pants in faded charcoal, multiple pockets and anchor-points for carabiners. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and repaired twice. Thin merino base layer under a sleeveless technical vest—gray, salt-stained, with a faded patch from the Escanaba Freeborn Airmen insignia (three interlocking rings). Over that, a weathered insulated jacket, Lake Michigan Blue, with reflective striping on the sleeves and a torn internal liner she''s never bothered to fix. One glove (left hand) with reinforced palm, worn through at the knuckles. A length of paracord looped through her belt. Her clothes smell like diesel, copper, and wind.', N'She recovered her father''s encrypted personal log from the crash site and has never opened it. It sits in a waterproof case behind a loose panel in berth 14-C. She is terrified it contains something that would make her grieve differently — that he was afraid, or that he knew the strut was bad and went up anyway.', N'Clipped, technical, uses airship and cargo terminology as default metaphor. Rarely uses filler words.', N'Short sentences with long pauses. Speaks like she''s metering air.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hibiki_nazari_casta_eda');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a73d-79a9-b07a-41036123a4a9', N'Chimamanda Fredriksen', N'Chimamanda', N'', N'Fredriksen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 55, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Steamvent Alley — geothermal district, hot and chemical-smelling, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Personnel recovery and hostile extraction — extraction specialist', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Chimamanda Fredriksen is broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 55, she has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate her once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Chimamanda Fredriksen plans to keep it that way. She works as a extraction specialist out of Steamvent Alley, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In the runner community, Chimamanda Fredriksen is known for getting the job done and not asking questions that would make the job harder to stomach.', N'Zurab Ivanov-Appiah represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes. Eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Chimamanda Fredriksen, 2226 neo-noir character, 178cm tall broad-shouldered muscular build. Warm bronze-toned skin blending Indigenous American, Northern European, East Asian, and South Asian heritage — medium-brown complexion with golden olive undertones. Deep brown left eye, chrome cybernetic right eye with amber LED reticle. Steel gray hair braided back. Prominent cheekbones, laugh lines, left temple scar fading into hairline. Exposed chrome hydraulic framework visible at elbows and knees integrated with muscle tissue. Old burn scarring on right shoulder and arm. Wearing black reinforced cargo tactical vest over thermal base layer, weather-resistant jacket with hood, heavy reinforced boots. Faded geometric tactical tattoo on left wrist. Grounded wide stance, economical movement. Geothermal Steamvent district setting, low industrial lighting casting amber and blue shadows, slight chemical atmospheric haze, chrome framework catching light. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, utilitarian and worn but functional. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Steamvent Alley', N'local', N'Steamvent Alley', N'Indigenous American (43.9%) dominant with substantial Northern European (26.1%), East Asian (17.0%), South Asian (8.7%), and Middle Eastern (4.3%) ancestry. This blend produces warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones, distinctive eye geometry reflecting East and South Asian heritage mixed with broader cheekbones and nose structure from Indigenous and Northern European ancestry, creating a uniquely blended facial structure that defies simple categorization.', 178, 92, N'Broad-shouldered and heavy-set, muscular underneath a layer of accumulated weight that reads as density rather than softness. Thick through the torso and limbs — built like someone who absorbs punishment and stays upright.', N'Steel gray with darker roots', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid, no frills', N'Medium', N'Left eye: deep brown with warm undertones, natural. Right eye: chrome-housed cybernetic with visible LED targeting reticle, amber luminescence when active', N'Warm medium-bronze with golden and olive undertones, weathered from exposure and chemical-laden Steamvent air. The tone reflects the blended ancestry — complex mid-range bronze from Indigenous-Northern European base, subtly warmed by East and South Asian genetics, catching light with olive-shifted depth.', N'Deep laugh lines around the mouth, prominent cheekbones with structure reflecting Indigenous and Northern European heritage balanced with East Asian-influenced eye placement and slight South Asian nasal bridge character. Minimal grooming beyond functional maintenance. Scarring along the left temple fades into her hairline. Skin has a slight chemical sheen from geothermal district residue. Facial geometry shows harmonious blend of broad Indigenous and Northern European features with narrower East and South Asian eye geometry.', N'Hydraulic knee and elbow joints with exposed chrome framework — not hidden, not flaunted, simply present. Right eye cybernetic with amber LED visible in low light. Micro-hydraulic servos create subtle clicking sounds during precise movements. No attempt to pass as unaugmented.', N'Moves with economical precision — every motion calculated for efficiency and minimal energy waste. Sits with weight distributed to absorb quick vertical movement. Favors her left side slightly when standing. Stance is wide, grounded. When at rest, she is truly still — no fidgeting, no nervous tells. When moving, the hydraulics whisper.', N'Tier 4 practicality — reinforced cargo pants with thigh pockets for tools or sidearm, tactical vest over a loose-fitting thermal base layer to accommodate augmentation cooling ports. Weather-resistant synthetic jacket with hood. Heavy boots with reinforced heel plating. No logos, no flash, no color beyond functional black and dark gray. Clothing shows wear and careful repair. No jewelry. All garments have concealment capability.', N'', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chimamanda_fredriksen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6bd-7927-bc61-412de1394674', N'Halona Seo', N'Halona', N'', N'Seo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre, Grand Corridor, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Street performer and puppeteer', N'Independent; informally connected to Mexicantown Libre''s street vendors'' cooperative', N'Halona Seo is wiry and restless, with warm copper-tan skin, a gap between his front teeth, and a mop of deep red hair that is entirely natural and has been a source of commentary his entire life. He''s of average height but seems taller when he performs — something about how he uses his body changes when he has a puppet on his arm. His hands are his most distinctive feature: long-fingered, constantly moving, stained with the paints and solvents he uses to build his puppets. He has retractable cat-claw mods on both hands, which he uses practically for puppet construction rather than any aesthetic reason.

Halona Seo builds elaborate articulated puppet figures from salvage — recycled plastic, old circuit boards, scraps of fabric from Mexicantown''s textile markets — and performs at the intersection of Grand Corridor and the Libre''s main plaza most afternoons. He''s been doing this since he was fifteen, unlicensed, subsisting on tips and the UBC stipend. His performances are satirical, political, and often about things happening in the specific neighborhood that day, which means he has a dedicated local following and has twice been asked by Ferrogate Transit security to ''move along.'' He always does. He always comes back. He is young enough to believe this is sustainable and old enough to know it might not be.', N'Street-level local color and information source; knows everything happening in Mexicantown Libre in real time; his satirical performances can be used to track neighborhood mood and recent events; potential point-of-contact character who can lead players deeper into Libre''s informal community networks.', N'', N'Retractable claw mods (both hands, practical geneware, entry-level), color-shifting hair dye geneware (has it but only ever uses ''red'' — had it installed for a purpose he''s since abandoned)', N'Spends mornings in his shared room building new puppets or repairing old ones, afternoons and evenings performing at Grand Corridor, nights at the vendors'' cooperative''s informal social gatherings.', N'Halona Seo, mixed-heritage neo-noir marionettist, 173cm lean build, shoulder-length deep red copper hair loosely tied back, warm golden-bronze luminous skin with honeyed undertones, angular face with prominent cheekbones and gap-toothed smile, warm brown eyes with amber flecks, gap between front teeth. Hands show blue and black paint stains, fine white scars on palms, retractable steel cat-claw augmentations visible at fingernail seams with metallic glint. Wearing patchworked denim and canvas long coat, faded black cargo pants with multiple pockets, oversized thrifted layers, scuffed synthleather boots. Wire bracelets and paint-stained fabric wrist cuffs. Woven bag across chest. Posture slightly hunched with restless, fidgeting hands. In dimly-lit salvage workshop surrounded by puppet constructs, neon signs reflecting off work surfaces, theatrical mood, intense focused expression, GLMZ, volumetric lighting catching the metallic glint of augmentations, gritty working-class aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Predominantly Middle Eastern (57.0%) with substantial East Asian (26.3%) and Eastern European (16.7%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates striking angular facial geometry with the strong cheekbones and defined jawline characteristic of Levantine heritage, softened and refined by East Asian features, and lightened slightly by Eastern European admixture. This combination produces a unique phenotype that reads as visibly mixed-heritage with warm, luminous undertones.', 173, 62, N'Wiry and lean, with the tensile strength of someone who works with their hands constantly. Visible muscle definition in forearms and shoulders from puppet manipulation and construction work, but no bulk. Restless energy visible even at rest.', N'Deep natural red with copper undertones', N'Shoulder-length, often tied back loosely with scrap fabric or wire, perpetually mussed from constant hand-running and puppet work', N'Long', N'Warm brown with amber flecks', N'Warm golden-bronze with honeyed undertones—the result of blended Middle Eastern, East Asian, and Eastern European ancestry creating luminous depth with subtle golden radiance and balanced warmth across the spectrum.', N'Angular facial structure with prominent cheekbones and strong geometric planes reflecting the Middle Eastern and East Asian ancestry blend. Defined jawline. Gap between upper front teeth (distinctive, never corrected). Skin shows minor scarring on knuckles and fingers from solvents and construction. Hands perpetually stained with acrylic paint residue in blues, blacks, and metallics that doesn''t fully wash out.', N'Retractable cat-claw mods on both hands—visible as faint seams at the base of each fingernail when retracted, creating a subtle metallic glint under direct light. Claws are brushed steel, kept functional but unadorned.', N'Hunched slightly forward when walking, shoulders mobile and expressive. Hands are almost never still—fidgeting, gesturing, unconsciously mimicking puppet movements. When performing, posture elongates and becomes theatrical; seems to grow taller as he inhabits the space. Moves with the precision of a marionettist even in mundane tasks.', N'Tier 4 working-class with salvage-chic aesthetic. Favors loose cargo pants in faded black or charcoal with multiple pockets for tools and paint supplies. Layers thrifted oversized shirts or vests over fitted tank tops, often modified or repaired visibly. Wears a long coat of indeterminate origin—patchworked denim and canvas, lined with interior pockets for puppet storage. Scuffed synthleather boots, well-maintained. Accessories include wire bracelets, fabric wrist cuffs stained with work, and a woven bag slung across his chest containing current puppet builds.', N'The color-shifting geneware he had installed was for a theater program at a Tessera-affiliated arts school he was accepted to at age 16. He walked out after three days because a faculty member told him puppet performance was ''not a serious discipline.'' He''s never told anyone he was accepted, because it complicates the story he tells about himself.', N'Fast, colloquial, full of Mexicantown Libre street slang and Malian French expressions from his grandmother. Shifts seamlessly between registers when performing.', N'Rapid-fire in conversation, theatrical and varied during performance — he can make his voice do almost anything.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'halona_seo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a0-79cc-b75e-41520a0a1872', N'Gotthard Odinga-Mbekele', N'Gotthard', N'', N'Odinga-Mbekele', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 30, 2, N'active', N'The Core, near State and Jackson', N'Fixer - Tessera proxy', N'Tessera', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Gotthard Odinga-Mbekele, a 168cm lean operative with deep warm brown skin rich with golden undertones, standing in a GLMZ urban environment. Her tight geometric braids frame her strong cheekbones and long face, reflecting Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, and Pacific Islander heritage. Thin surgical scar visible along her left temple and jawline. Right eye is a chro-amber augmented lens with gold circuitry. Right arm is brushed-steel synthetic from mid-forearm down with pressure-sensitive pads. She wears a tailored matte-black tactical jacket over a dark charcoal second-skin bodysuit, tactical pants with numerous pockets, and unmarked combat boots. Gray tactical sleeve covers the elbow joint of her synthetic arm. Her posture is centered and confident, movements economical. She stands in dramatic neon-shadow lighting, the amber glow of her augmented eye catching light. Cool blue and warm orange neo-noir lighting creates depth. Serious, measured expression. Tessera affiliation pendant visible at her neck. Professional operative aesthetic, mid-tier gear quality evident to trained eyes. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Core', N'local', N'The Core', N'Sub-Saharan African (64.2%) dominant ancestry with significant Northern European (21.4%) and Pacific Islander (14.4%) blending. The combination creates a richly complex phenotype: deep warm brown skin with golden undertones from African heritage, subtly cooled by Northern European genetics, and enriched with the warmth characteristic of Pacific Islander ancestry. Sun-weathered and marked by asymmetrical scarring that tells her operational history.', 168, 62, N'Lean and angular, with defined shoulders from decades of fieldwork. Minimal body fat, efficient musculature suggesting regular maintenance rather than vanity fitness.', N'Natural dark brown with silver-gray threading at temples and crown', N'Pulled back into a tight, geometric braid that wraps around her skull—practical, intimidating, signature', N'Medium (when unbound)', N'Natural brown, right eye replaced with a 2nd-gen OPTIC-7 chrono-tracking augment (amber-gold lens with faint reticle grid visible at certain angles)', N'Deep warm brown with golden and amber undertones from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, subtly cooled by Northern European heritage. Pacific Islander warmth adds richness to the mid-deep complexion. Sun-weathered and uneven from asymmetrical scarring.', N'Strong, prominent cheekbones reflecting Sub-Saharan African heritage blended with the facial geometry of Northern European and Pacific Islander ancestry. Long face with slight underbite. Fine scar tissue across left cheekbone and temple. No wrinkles; her face has the taut, preserved quality of someone using mid-tier dermaplast treatments.', N'Right eye is a chro-amber lens with visible gold circuitry at the iris edge. Right arm from mid-forearm down is brushed-steel synthetic (smooth, articulated fingers with pressure-sensitive pads). The transition at the elbow is covered by a fitted gray tactical sleeve. Neural interface port at base of skull (covered by hair).', N'Stands with shoulders back, weight centered. Her movements are economical—no wasted motion. She walks with an even, measured pace despite the synthetic arm. Makes deliberate eye contact and rarely blinks with her augmented eye, which can unsettle people.', N'Tier 2 utilitarian-chic. Dark charcoal second-skin bodysuit under a tailored matte-black tactical jacket (Korin Industries, mid-grade chrome-weave lining). Fitted tactical pants with too many pockets. Boots: unmarked matte-black combat boots, expensive but anonymous. Single chrome pendant (Tessera marker) worn under her shirt. No jewelry. Her entire ensemble costs 15,000 Φ and looks it only to those who know the brands.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gotthard_odinga_mbekele');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('f79cb390-81cc-e7bf-fc5c-4178354fdda4', N'Wanjiku Strom-Adjei', N'Wanjiku', N'', N'Strom-Adjei', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A parlor in Crucible Square that functions as a combination office, tea house, and informal court — people come to settle debts, ask favors, and request investigations', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — operates through an intricate personal economy of debts and favors', N'Wanjiku Strom-Adjei doesn''t investigate cases the way other PIs do. She doesn''t chase data or neural trails or physical evidence. She chases debts — the invisible web of obligations, favors, and social contracts that binds the people of GLMZ''s lower tiers into a functional community in the absence of institutional support.

In a city where CorpSec serves corporate interests and formal justice is a luxury of the upper tiers, the lower tiers have developed their own systems of order. Wanjiku sits at the center of one such system — a vast, informal network of mutual obligation that she has spent thirty years cultivating. She has helped people find jobs, settle disputes, secure housing, obtain medical care, and navigate bureaucracy, and every act of help creates a debt. Not a financial debt — a social one. And when Wanjiku needs information, access, or assistance for an investigation, she calls in those debts with the precision of a banker calling in loans.

Her method is uniquely effective for lower-tier investigations because it operates entirely within the trust economy that these communities have built for themselves. Her informants aren''t paid — they''re repaying kindness. Her access isn''t purchased — it''s earned. And her investigations don''t disrupt the community fabric because she is the community fabric. She is simultaneously an investigator, a mediator, a counselor, and an informal judge, and the people who live in her territory understand that keeping Wanjiku happy is essential to keeping their community functional.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'wanjiku_strom_adjei');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d8-724d-bd9f-41b7c0536fdb', N'Onyx Shirazi', N'Onyx', N'', N'Shirazi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 33, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Geartown — industrial district of chop shops and fabricators, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Field trauma surgeon and combat support — combat medic', N'Semi-independent — has standing arrangements with several crews', N'Onyx Shirazi are tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 33, their expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — cybernetic arm — right, full replacement from shoulder — stronger than organic, — and they make no effort to hide it.

Their entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. They work as a combat medic out of Geartown, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

In the runner community, Onyx Shirazi are known for getting the job done and not asking questions that would make the job harder to stomach.', N'Somadina Karlsen-Sow functions as a connector — their work puts them in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving them naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Cybernetic arm — right, full replacement from shoulder — stronger than organic, obvious chrome. Cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains)', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Onyx Shirazi, pan-global neo-noir operative, 2226. Tall lean figure (188cm) with striking warm golden-olive complexion reflecting Middle Eastern, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan heritage softened by Southeast Asian and Northern European features. Strong angular jawline and high cheekbones, slightly broad mid-face, dark brown assessing eyes with subtle epicanthic folds. Black hair with temple gray, slicked back. Full brushed chrome cybernetic right arm with visible pneumatic actuators. Thick pale surgical scar down left neck, minor burn marks visible. Wearing black synth-weave cargo pants, gray undershirt, reinforced tactical vest with medical patches, long neutral synthetic-leather coat, worn black tactical boots. Posture is balanced and efficient, gaze clinical. Standing in neon-lit surgical bay or dimly lit job briefing space, cool blue and amber lighting highlighting metallic arm and warm skin tones. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, functional and weathered. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Pan-global genetic mosaic: Middle Eastern (31.1%) and South Asian (22.4%) form the dominant base, creating warm olive undertones and defined bone structure. Southeast Asian (20.9%) adds subtle softness to facial proportions and eye shape. Northern European (14.6%) contributes angular cheekbones and jawline definition. Sub-Saharan African (6.1%) enriches skin depth and adds warmth to overall tone. Hispanic/Latin American (4.9%) provides subtle complexity to feature definition. The result is a striking, non-categorical phenotype: strong angular architecture softened by rounded mid-facial proportions, warm medium-deep skin with golden undertones, and eyes that reflect the blend of their full ancestry.', 188, 74, N'Lean and angular, with long limbs and minimal body fat. Muscular definition visible in shoulders and core from years of combat training and surgical precision work. No wasted mass.', N'Black with natural graying at temples', N'Kept short and practical, often slicked back or pulled into a tight braid for work', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and assessing', N'Warm golden-olive, medium-deep tone. The base warmth derives from dominant Middle Eastern and South Asian ancestry, enriched by Sub-Saharan depth and subtle Hispanic complexity. Golden undertones catch light. Weathered by stress and environmental exposure.', N'Strong defined jawline and high cheekbones from Middle Eastern and Northern European ancestry, balanced by slightly broader mid-face and rounder features from Southeast and South Asian heritage. Nose shows subtle width consistent with South Asian and Sub-Saharan ancestry. Eyes set with gentle epicanthic folds reflecting Southeast Asian component. Overall expression combines angular precision with warmer, more rounded proportions—a true global blend. Minimal grooming beyond functional maintenance. Skin shows minor scarring from old burns and repeated medical procedures.', N'Full cybernetic replacement of right arm from shoulder joint. Brushed chrome plating with visible pneumatic actuators at elbow and wrist. No attempt to aestheticize or hide—purely functional design. The arm is noticeably stronger and faster than organic limbs; they move it with precision that suggests years of neural integration.', N'Stands with weight balanced, shoulders level. Moves with deliberate efficiency—no wasted motion. Hands are still when not in use. When working or under stress, movements become even more economical and precise. Makes eye contact but without aggression; gaze is clinical and assessing.', N'Tier 3-4 functional wear. Black synth-weave cargo pants with multiple pockets for equipment. Form-fitting gray undershirt beneath a reinforced tactical vest with medical patches and subtle armor plating. Worn black boots with non-slip soles rated for surgical environments and rough terrain. A long neutral-colored coat—often leather-effect synthetic—that allows concealment of medical kit and provides some ballistic resistance. Minimal jewelry; a simple wrist display for job communications. Everything is well-maintained but shows functional wear, not fashion concern.', N'', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'onyx_shirazi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65c-7e77-93c4-41bad0715af0', N'Kiran Kimura-Pathak', N'Kiran', N'', N'Kimura-Pathak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 42, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Abyssal Threshold, sub-level 4 maintenance access corridor 14-C, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'The disappeared — a former Axiom mid-level data analyst who erased herself from surface records and now lives deep in the Abyssal Threshold', N'Independent, no clan affiliation — carefully maintained isolation from formal Undertow power structures; The Undertow', N'Kiran Kimura-Pathak is thin in a way that speaks of intentional reduction — not starvation, but the deliberate paring away of anything that might make her visible or memorable. She was once the kind of person who wore Axiom''s muted corporate fashions and had shoulder-length hair she blow-dried every morning; now her hair is cut close and uneven by her own hand, and she wears layered thermal wraps in grays and browns that she has repaired so many times the original fabric is almost entirely replaced. Her skin is medium brown, her features carrying the angular sharpness of her Georgian grandfather and the broader cheekbones of her Ghanaian grandmother. Her hands give her away: they are still soft in places that hard labor never quite reaches, and her nails are trimmed with a precision that suggests old habits dying slowly.

Kiran Kimura-Pathak is two people trying to coexist in one body. The first is the analyst — meticulous, cautious, always running probability assessments in the back of her mind, prone to long silences when a situation doesn''t match her models. The second is whoever she is becoming down here — quieter than the analyst, more patient, slowly learning to love the dark. She is not warm to strangers, but she is scrupulously honest with them, which in the Abyssal Threshold reads as a form of respect. She has not been to the surface in four years. She does not plan to go back. She does not explain why.', N'Information broker with surface-world knowledge; guide to understanding corporate systems for underground characters; represents the ''disappeared'' as a social category; can serve as a connection between underworld and surface plotlines', N'', N'Corporate-grade neural overlay (Axiom-issued, she could not remove it without losing function — she has disabled all its network-facing components manually; it now runs only local cognitive assist). Visual implants with standard low-light enhancement (original corporate package). Both augmentations are old enough that their corp ID signatures have decayed to noise.', N'Maintains a small, precisely organized living space in a dry access corridor; spends mornings cataloguing overheard information from the pipes and access ducts; offers data analysis and document work to deep-dwellers who need surface records navigated — in exchange for food, lamp fuel, and privacy.', N'Kiran Kimura-Pathak, 167cm lean neo-noir woman with warm medium brown skin and golden-amber undertones, angular East Asian cheekbones balanced with Southeast Asian face width and South Asian jawline definition. Deep brown eyes with subtle cybernetic latticing visible in iris. Short dark brown hair with gray threading, self-trimmed and uneven. Dressed in layered thermal wraps of gray and brown with visible repairs, neutral gray utility boots. Wiry muscle definition, minimal body fat. Faint scar tissue at left temple, calloused fingertips on right hand. Seated slightly sideways with precise, economical posture in dimly-lit maintenance corridor, one shoulder angled toward exit. Expression neutral and difficult to read. Low-light GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, cool fluorescent and ambient neon lighting, industrial metal grating background, subtle tension in her stillness, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Abyssal Threshold', N'local', N'Abyssal Threshold', N'Complex Pan-Asian diaspora with Latin American and African undertones. Kiran''s genetic ancestry (51.4% East and South Asian, 23.4% Southeast Asian, 20% Hispanic/Latin American, 5.2% Sub-Saharan African) creates a striking fusion: East Asian ancestry provides angular cheekbone definition and slight eye tilt; South Asian genetics contribute jawline prominence and face width; Southeast Asian heritage softens the structure with broader proportions and warmth; Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African components add depth to skin undertones and subtle fullness to lips.', 167, 52, N'Lean and deliberately spare — the kind of thinness that comes from intentional reduction rather than deprivation. Wiry muscle in the shoulders and forearms from years of precise manual work; minimal body fat; posture that suggests she takes up as little space as possible.', N'Dark brown, naturally, with premature gray threading through the sides', N'Cut close and uneven — self-trimmed, no styling, functional only', N'Short', N'Deep brown with faint cybernetic latticing visible in the iris under direct light — low-light enhancement package, degraded but functional', N'Warm medium brown with golden-amber undertones shifting toward olive at the temples, reflecting the layered blend of East Asian, South Asian, and Southeast Asian ancestry enriched by Sub-Saharan and Hispanic warmth', N'Angular cheekbones prominent and high-set from East Asian genetics, balanced by the broader face shape and fuller lower face of Southeast Asian ancestry, with defined and slightly squared jawline from South Asian influence — a striking hybrid of clean planes and subtle fullness. Skin is dry from years in low-humidity maintenance corridors but shows no significant scarring or damage — well-maintained despite living conditions. Fine lines around the eyes suggest sustained concentration. Expression typically neutral, difficult to read.', N'Eyes show faint latticing in the iris under bright light (low-light enhancement implants). No visible external chrome or subdermal plating. The neural overlay is completely internal and undetectable by sight; its network components are manually disabled, leaving only the local cognitive assist active.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion, precise hand placement, footfalls that are nearly silent on metal grating. Sits slightly sideways in spaces, keeping one shoulder angled toward exits. Eyes track movement peripherally before direct attention. Speaks rarely, and when she does, her voice is low and measured. Hands remain still unless working; no fidgeting or tells.', N'Layered thermal wraps in grays and browns, repaired so many times the original fabric composition is largely replaced with salvaged patches. The layers are functional — designed for temperature regulation in the Threshold — but also for anonymity; nothing branded, nothing distinctive. Underneath: plain synthetic underweave, likely scavenged. No jewelry. Footwear is neutral gray utility boots, worn but maintained. Everything is chosen to be forgotten as soon as it is seen.', N'She did not simply leave Axiom. She stole something from them — specifically, she extracted and copied a data set that documented the deliberate contamination of Tier 1 water supplies in three districts to drive residents into resettlement zones Axiom wanted to redevelop. She has the data. She has had it for four years. She has not released it because she does not know how to do so without being found, and she is afraid, and she hates herself for being afraid.', N'Formal, precise, residual corporate phrasing that she is slowly unlearning; uses analytical framing for emotional content (''that represents a significant change in my risk assessment'' instead of ''I''m scared'')', N'Measured, slightly too even — sounds like someone who learned to control their voice deliberately', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'kiran_kimura_pathak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a722-795c-b917-41daa43519a1', N'Giang Le-Vestergaard-Adu', N'Giang', N'', N'Le-Vestergaard-Adu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'Morgan''s Ridge, seasonal; mobile along the northern hyperlane routes, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Expelled corporate citizen turned nomadic caravan medic', N'Northern Caravan Collective (rotating medic); formerly Helix Biosystems', N'Giang Le-Vestergaard-Adu was a Tier 3 medical technician for Helix Biosystems until eight years ago, when she filed an internal complaint about falsified trial data for a neural augmentation product. Helix did not fire her — that would have created a record. They revoked her housing contract, her transit privileges, her healthcare access, and her corponation residency in sequence, over fourteen months, until she had no choice but to leave. By then she had understood what had happened. She kept the knowledge and left with her field medical kit.

She is lean and precise, with Siberian and Sierra Leonean features and the kind of stillness that comes from having once been very anxious and having exhausted it. She bleaches her hair to a stark platinum that makes her easier to find at night — a practical choice that has become habit. Her irises are patterned: concentric rings in gold and black, a Helix cosmetic mod she has kept because removing it costs money she needs for other things, and because looking at it reminds her of what she is angry about. She travels with the northern caravans as their medic, providing genuine care to people who have no access to licensed facilities. She is not sentimental about this. She is competent about it, which people find more reassuring.', N'Medical resource for the margins — can provide care unavailable through official channels. Source of information about Helix Biosystems'' practices. Represents corporate corruption''s human cost. Potential ally or quest anchor regarding the falsified trial data she still carries.', N'', N'Patterned irises (concentric gold and black rings — Helix Biosystems cosmetic, retained). Subcutaneous medical data-port in left forearm (allows direct interface with diagnostic equipment — installed during Helix employment, still functional). No additional augmentations.', N'Travels with caravan rotations every two to three weeks; treats injuries, infections, and augmentation complications with limited supplies; trades medical services for food, transport, and sometimes information. When stationary at Morgan''s Ridge, she uses a converted cargo container as a clinic.', N'Portrait of Giang Le-Vestergaard-Adu, a 168cm lean woman with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones, standing in GLMZ caravan setting. Platinum blonde shoulder-length hair, high angular cheekbones blending Southeast Asian and Central Asian features with Hispanic/Latin American softness. Most striking: augmented eyes with concentric rings of deep gold and black creating inhuman symmetry. Weathered complexion from sun exposure, barely-visible scar on left forearm, faint burn mark on right palm. Dressed in practical tier 4-5 field gear: reinforced grey cargo pants, fitted thermal base layer, oversized faded blue caravan collective vest with worn insignia, weathered synthetic boots. Medical satchel across body, thin silver bracelet, analog chronometer. Posture economical and precise, direct unsettling gaze. Standing in low-light industrial caravan space with cool blue-grey lighting, neon accents. Calm expression despite exhausted tension. No jewelry except sentimental pieces. Scrupulously maintained despite worn gear. Cinematic, gritty, clinical atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Morgan''s Ridge', N'local', N'Morgan''s Ridge', N'Mixed ancestry reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: 55.1% Southeast Asian (dominant), 20.6% Central Asian, 18.2% Hispanic/Latin American, and 6.1% Middle Eastern. Her features blend these diverse genetic lines into a distinctive phenotype. The Southeast Asian majority contributes warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden undertones, slightly rounded facial structure, and naturally dark hair (which she has intentionally bleached platinum). Central Asian ancestry adds high, prominent cheekbones with angular definition and a broader nasal bridge. Hispanic/Latin American heritage contributes a slightly wider mouth and fuller lips. Middle Eastern ancestry adds depth to her eye sockets and subtle warmth to her complexion. Her facial structure shows the balanced proportions of this global admixture rather than any single regional group.', 168, 58, N'Lean and precise, muscular without bulk — the build of someone whose body is a tool maintained for function rather than appearance. Shoulders squared from years of steady hands-on work.', N'Bleached platinum blonde, intentionally stark and maintained', N'Practical braid or low knot when traveling; loose and shoulder-length when stationary. Always positioned for visibility in low-light conditions.', N'Medium (shoulder-length when worn down)', N'Augmented with concentric rings of deep gold and black — a Helix Biosystems cosmetic modification that creates a hypnotic, almost inhuman symmetry', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones, reflecting dominant Southeast Asian ancestry blended with Central Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Middle Eastern heritage. Sun-exposed and weathered from caravan work.', N'Weathered but not lined; her face shows the calm of exhausted anxiety, with minimal expression at rest. Her skin is clear but marked by the texture of someone who uses water sparingly and sun exposure frequently. High, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Central Asian influence rising over warm, slightly rounded Southeast Asian facial contours. Sharp jawline with balanced mandibular width reflecting her mixed heritage, softened slightly by Southeast Asian genetic influence. Her facial structure reflects the proportions of this global genetic blend — neither sharp nor soft, but precisely balanced.', N'The concentric-ring irises are immediately striking and unmistakable in any light. The medical data-port on her left forearm is not visible unless her skin is specifically examined, but the scar tissue around it is noticeable upon close inspection. No chrome, no external augmentation.', N'Moves with economic precision — no wasted motion, no nervous habits. Stands with weight balanced, hands often at rest near her sides or in pockets. When working, she becomes almost meditative in her focus. Her gaze is direct and unsettling; people often look away first. She walks at a steady pace, neither hurried nor casual.', N'Tier 4-5 pragmatism: durable, patched field gear in neutral colors (grey, black, tan). Typical outfit includes reinforced cargo pants with multiple pockets, a fitted thermal base layer, and an oversized caravan collective vest (faded blue with worn embroidered collective insignia). Worn synthetic boots rated for harsh weather. A long, thin medical satchel across her body, always present. No jewelry except a single thin silver bracelet (sentimental, kept from before Helix) and a faded wrist-mounted analog chronometer. Her clothing shows signs of repair and age but is scrupulously clean.', N'She kept a copy of the falsified Helix trial data — encrypted, stored in a physical drive sewn into the lining of her medical kit. She has been waiting eight years for the right person to give it to. She has come close three times and pulled back each time, not from cowardice but from uncertainty about whether the recipient could survive having it.', N'Clinical and direct, uses medical terminology without softening it, occasionally catching herself and translating. Dry, understated humor.', N'Even and precise — measures words like doses', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'giang_le_vestergaard_adu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a686-7028-bb17-41e40afa2510', N'Felisa Rattanakorn', N'Felisa', N'', N'Rattanakorn', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave — his shop, ''Sefa''s Cut'', occupies the ground floor of a residential stack on Corrugated Row, near Kedzie and Division', N'Barber and informal community mediator, Hamtramck Enclave', N'Independent (Sefa''s Cut); informal ties to the Hamtramck Enclave Community Council', N'Felisa Rattanakorn is a lean, compact man whose age shows mainly in the white that has taken over his close-cropped hair and the deep creases around his eyes — the rest of him is surprisingly wiry, and he moves with the unhurried precision of someone who has been practicing fine motor skills for four decades. His skin is a warm olive that shifts toward bronze under the shop''s fluorescent strips. His geneware is a single concession to the era: his fingertips emit a faint blue-white bioluminescence that he had installed purely for practical reasons, so he can work in the dark during power brownouts without disturbing a client mid-cut. He keeps his shop small and deliberately cluttered — photographs pinned to every wall, a secondhand shrine to the Razor ELF in the corner hung with clippings of hair and old razor blades, a samovar that has not been turned off since 2181.

He has the manner of a confessor without the religion: people tell him things. He does not seek information, he simply creates the conditions in which information cannot help but flow — the warmth of the shop, the meditative rhythm of scissors, the way he asks questions and then waits, genuinely, for the answer. He has outlasted three landlords, two Enclave council administrations, and one attempted Axiom buyout of the block. He considers his continued presence an act of political resistance, though he would never use those words.', N'Information hub and community anchor — the shop is a neutral space where people from different factions of Hamtramck Enclave speak freely. He is an ideal source of local history, rumor, and introductions to people who do not otherwise meet strangers.', N'', N'Bioluminescent fingertips, pale blue-white (practical installation, not cosmetic). No other augmentations — he has a mild principled objection to unnecessary modification and a practical objection to the cost.', N'Opens the shop at 08:00, closes when the last client leaves, which is rarely before 21:00. Takes no appointments — first come, first seated. Spends his evenings listening to Azerbaijani folk recordings from his grandfather''s archive and sharpening blades by hand.', N'Felisa Rattanakorn, 168cm lean-framed man with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones, Southeast Asian and East Asian heritage with Northern European undertones visible in facial structure. White hair with dark brown traces at temples, close-cropped with longer top and faded sides. Dark unaugmented brown eyes with deep creases from decades of focused work. Defined cheekbones, moderate nose bridge. Pale scar tissue on left hand, visible calluses on fingers. Wearing cream long-sleeve shirt with rolled forearms, dark charcoal wool trousers, thin weathered leather apron darkened from decades of use. Stainless steel watch with worn leather band. Standing in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone barber shop, warm shop lighting casting subtle glow across his skin. Precise, meditative stillness. Fingertips showing faint pale blue-white bioluminescence at nail beds. High-detail character portrait, moody warm lighting, cinematic neo-noir urban aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Southeast Asian (45.5%), East Asian (22.3%), Eastern European (17.1%), and Northern European (15.1%) ancestry — a striking convergence visible in warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, defined cheekbones with balanced facial structure, and dark eyes reflecting the blend of multiple continental lineages', 168, 62, N'Lean and compact, wiry muscle beneath loose skin — the frame of someone who has maintained consistent fine motor discipline and light physical labor across decades without bulk', N'White with traces of original dark brown at the temples', N'Close-cropped, precise, slightly longer on top with clean faded sides — a walking advertisement for his own craftsmanship', N'Short', N'Dark brown, unaugmented', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and subtle peachy undertones — melanin-rich but lighter than deep brown, reflecting the Southeast Asian and East Asian dominant heritage with Northern and Eastern European moderation. Shifts warmly under light, luminous quality', N'Deep creases radiating from the corners of his eyes and across his forehead — not from frowning but from decades of focused work and genuine attention. Fine laugh lines. Skin weathered but well-maintained, warm medium-brown throughout with subtle golden luminescence, minimal stubble, grooming precise but not vain. Facial structure shows defined cheekbones and moderate nose bridge reflecting Southeast and East Asian heritage tempered by European ancestry', N'Fingertips emit a faint pale blue-white bioluminescence when activated — visible as a subtle glow at the nail beds and cuticle line, most noticeable in dim light or darkness. No other visible chrome or subdermal modifications', N'Stands with economical posture, weight balanced evenly. Moves with deliberate, unhurried precision — no wasted motion. When working, his hands move with meditative rhythm and surgical accuracy. In conversation, he has the stillness of someone comfortable with silence; he does not fidget', N'Tier 3-4 practical: dark gray or charcoal wool trousers, pressed but worn at the cuff; simple cotton or linen long-sleeve shirts in cream, white, or muted blue — sleeves rolled past the forearm for work. A thin leather apron, creased and darkened with decades of use, draped across his chest. Footwear is functional — scuffed work shoes or slip-ons with good grip on the shop floor. No jewelry except an old stainless steel watch with a worn leather band. A faded cardigan for cooler evenings', N'His shop functions as an informal message-drop for three separate parties who do not know about each other: a labor organizer, a local ELF cult, and a man he suspects is running a small-scale identity forgery operation. He has enabled all of them because he likes them personally and has never examined this too closely.', N'Precise and formal in a way that suggests he learned his primary language from books as much as from people. Peppers speech with Azerbaijani phrases when emotional or amused, usually untranslated.', N'Slow and even, with long comfortable pauses. Never seems to be in a hurry to get to his point.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'felisa_rattanakorn');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e6-7dd6-8cb9-41f4c35fa725', N'Ghadir Cissé-Krishnamurthy', N'Ghadir', N'', N'Cissé-Krishnamurthy', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, rotating between basement venues and a rented room above a tea house on Brezinski Circuit, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Underground comedian and spoken word performer', N'Independent; performs at The Slag Room, The Quiet Mouth, and irregular pop-up venues; has twice been offered a Tessera media sponsorship and twice publicly declined in ways that generated more publicity than the sponsorship would have; The Ferment', N'Ghadir Cissé-Krishnamurthy is compact and restless, built like someone who is always about to stand up from a chair — shoulders slightly forward, weight on the balls of their feet, dark brown skin luminous under stage lights they have spent years learning to use as a weapon. They have their mother''s wide Congolese forehead and their grandmother''s pale Volga eyes, a combination that strangers find disconcerting and that Ghadir Cissé-Krishnamurthy has weaponized into an entire chunk of material. Their hair is grown out in a soft natural cloud and color-shifted to cycling deep blue at the roots fading to copper at the tips — they change it seasonally, the way other people change their jackets.

Ghadir Cissé-Krishnamurthy is possibly the funniest person in Hamtramck Enclave and is the only person in Hamtramck Enclave who would not say so, though they would say it about themselves at three in the morning having had too much fermented buckwheat tea. Their comedy is structurally precise and politically incendiary — a routine will appear to be about, say, the indignity of renewing one''s UBC stipend, and then thirty seconds before the end the floor opens up and there is something about complicity and grief underneath. Audiences often report laughing and then feeling like they should not have. Ghadir Cissé-Krishnamurthy considers this the correct response.', N'Local color and scene connector; source on underground venue politics and who owes whom; will occasionally perform truth at a moment of high tension in ways that shift the room; potential information source on Hamtramck Enclave civil dynamics', N'', N'Color-shifting hair (geneware, cosmetic); subvocal mic implant (practical, allows performance without handheld equipment); no other augmentations — they cite the expense and are privately frightened of surgery', N'They write for three hours every morning in longhand in a physical notebook, pace the tea house roof for an hour muttering material to themselves, then spend the afternoon doing the social maintenance that their career requires — showing up, being seen, listening. Performances happen two to four nights a week. They sleep badly.', N'Ghadir Cissé-Krishnamurthy, 163cm tall compact wiry figure, deep warm golden-brown skin with Sub-Saharan and South Asian heritage visible in angular cheekbones and soft jawline, dark brown eyes with amber warmth, shoulder-length soft cloud hair in color-shifted deep blue fading to copper. Wearing oversized cardigan layered over tea-stained vintage clothing, worn canvas high-tops, minimal jewelry with functional watch. Forward-leaning posture with compressed restless energy, hands expressive mid-gesture. GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, moody underground venue lighting with neon glow catching the golden undertones of skin, intimate performance space, atmospheric haze, intimate character study portrait. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Multi-continental ancestry: Sub-Saharan African (40.2%), South Asian (27.5%), Middle Eastern (13.3%), Southeast Asian (10.8%), and East Asian (8.2%). The dominant Sub-Saharan and South Asian heritage creates a striking warm deep brown complexion with golden undertones. South Asian and Southeast Asian features contribute softer facial contours balanced by angular cheekbones. Middle Eastern ancestry adds warmth to the overall tone, while East Asian ancestry subtly influences eye shape and bone structure. A living genetic mosaic reflecting generations of global movement.', 163, 58, N'Compact and wiry, muscular through the shoulders and core from years of pacing and restless movement. Light-boned but dense, built for quick shifts of weight and sudden stillness.', N'Color-shifted: deep blue at roots fading to copper at tips (seasonal rotation)', N'Soft natural cloud, deliberately unsculpted, maintained at shoulder length', N'Long', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertones, reflecting the dominance of Sub-Saharan and South Asian ancestry, distinctive in their expressiveness and clarity', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, luminous quality under direct light. Rich multitonal complexion reflecting the balanced blend of Sub-Saharan African (40.2%) and South Asian (27.5%) heritage as primary influences, with Middle Eastern warmth and Southeast Asian softness creating a harmonious, glowing depth.', N'Facial structure shows characteristic South Asian softness around the jawline and cheeks balanced with Sub-Saharan-influenced angular cheekbones and defined bone structure. Warm golden and amber undertones across the face from the combination of Sub-Saharan, South Asian, and Middle Eastern ancestry. Subtle almond-shaped eye set influenced by Southeast Asian and East Asian heritage. Clear skin with minimal scarring. Expressive micro-movements around eyes and mouth from years of performance. Dark circles common from poor sleep.', N'Color-shifting hair (geneware, cosmetic). Subvocal mic implant visible only as a faint scar on inner wrist. No external chrome or visible cybernetics.', N'Habitually forward-leaning, shoulders slightly tensed as if about to stand. Weight perpetually on the balls of their feet. Moves with compressed energy — pacing rather than strolling. Hands active and precise, often in conversation with their words. On stage, transforms into a coiled spring with calculated stillness; off-stage, the restlessness is always visible.', N'Tier 3-4 working class with intentional counter-culture edge. Favors oversized cardigans and vintage-fitted trousers. Worn canvas high-tops. Layers that suggest they dress for movement rather than appearance. Tea-stained sleeves are a signature. No corporate branding; prefers thrift-store finds and handmade pieces from Hamtramck artisans. Jewelry minimal — a functional watch, rarely anything else.', N'A Sterling-Nakamura media liaison has been attending their shows for three months. Séverin knows. They have not told anyone because they are not sure if they are flattered or frightened, and they are ashamed of the flattery.', N'Code-switches fluidly between formal register and vernacular depending on audience; dense with cultural references that span four continents; has a gift for the specific concrete detail that makes an abstraction land', N'Fast when excited, with sudden full stops for effect; uses silence the way other performers use filler', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ghadir_ciss_krishnamurthy');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a2-7e56-a4dc-425127d726e4', N'Liv Olofsson-Tamale-Mensah', N'Liv', N'', N'Olofsson-Tamale-Mensah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 17, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism, Palladian Foundation Secondary Institute, near Lincoln and Clark', N'scholarship student and mathematics prodigy, Tier 2 rising', N'Palladian Foundation Secondary Institute (full scholarship student); Palladian Corporation (prospective pipeline asset)', N'Liv Olofsson-Tamale-Mensah is seventeen and already exhausted with being called gifted. She has her Nigerian mother''s face — broad and expressive and deep brown — and her Danish-Polish father''s height, and she moves through the corridors of Palladian''s scholarship wing like she is calculating the structural load of every floor she walks on. Her geneware is minimal and chosen with clear deliberate aesthetic logic: color-shifting irises that she''s set to cycle through cool blues and greens on a slow daily rhythm, which she chose specifically because it gave her something visually interesting to do during lectures where the material moves too slowly.

She holds a full Palladian Foundation scholarship, which is rare and comes with teeth — quarterly review, mandatory participation in Palladian''s youth development pipeline, and an unspoken assumption that she will join the Palladian corporate track upon graduation. She has not yet decided whether she wants this, which is itself unusual; most scholarship students at her level have been coached into certainty. She is brilliant at applied mathematics and systems modeling and is currently running unsanctioned predictive models of GLMZ''s district resource allocation, trying to prove something she suspects about how Tier 1 zones are being deliberately undernourished. She hasn''t told anyone what she''s found.', N'Represents the scholarship-to-corporate-pipeline tension; her unauthorized research is a ticking clock; she has data that powerful people would want suppressed; she is at the age where the decisions she makes in the next year will define the next decade', N'', N'Color-shifting irises (cool blues and greens, slow daily cycle); subdermal haptic study interface on left forearm (scholarship-issued, allows tactile data review)', N'Intensive academic schedule from 0630-1600; mandatory Palladian pipeline mentorship sessions twice weekly; evenings running her unauthorized resource modeling on a borrowed distributed compute cluster she accesses through a mesh of devices she''s befriended with small E.L.F. offerings; sleeps less than she should.', N'Liv Olofsson-Tamale-Mensah, tall lean neo-noir scholar, 178cm, golden-bronze skin with warm luminous undertones blending Northern European, Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic, and Eastern European heritage. Broad cheekbones with fuller lips and defined facial planes, dark brown hair in long loose pragmatic braid, color-shifting augmented irises cycling blues and greens with subtle LED luminescence. Clean complexion, institutional indoor pallor with living glow. Subdermal haptic grid interface visible on left forearm under skin. Wearing dark Palladian Foundation compression smart-fabric jacket over plain fitted black shirt, expensive worn lab-grade shoes, simple black smart-band. Efficient economical posture, slight forward shoulder curve from workstation hours. Cool institutional lighting, GLMZ 2226 setting, neo-noir urban aesthetic, focused introspective expression, hands moving in thinking gesture, faint childhood scar barely visible on left wrist. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'teenage mathematics prodigy, female 17, tall and lean build, warm golden-bronze skin with subtle luminosity, mixed heritage features, broad cheekbones and fuller lips balanced by angular Northern European jaw, exhausted but brilliant expression, deep brown complexion that glows under institutional lighting

face: asymmetrical and real, unfocused gaze suggesting active mental processing, color-shifting irises cycling from cool blue to soft green with faint subdermal luminescence at angles, fuller lips, balanced nose reflecting African and Hispanic heritage, clean-skinned with indoor pallor, minimal expression lines but shoulders carrying tension, faint linear scar barely visible on left inner wrist

hair: natural dark brown almost black, worn in loose pragmatic braid down back, several strands escaping around face and temples, no styling effort, functional and rain-dampened

expression: deeply tired, intellectually distant, focused inward on abstract problems, not heroic or inspired, grounded exhaustion of someone always calculating

outfit: Palladian Foundation-issued compression smart-fabric jacket in charcoal, tailored but understated, minimal technical branding, worn plain dark fitted shirt underneath, expensive but well-used lab-grade grip-sole shoes, simple black smart-band on wrist, everything maintained but not precious, chosen for function not aesthetics

walking slowly through crowded scholarship wing corridor, fingers tracing invisible mathematical patterns in the air as she moves, lost in calculation, rain-slicked windows visible ahead, shoulders slightly rounded forward from workstation hours

environment: institutional scholarship corridor, high-ceilinged and utilitarian, overhead LED panels casting cool artificial light, wet windows showing city beyond, blurred figures of other students passing, corporate foundation architecture, clean but sterile surfaces, faint glow of digital signage

lighting: cool institutional overhead lighting with subtle color variation from her iris augmentation casting soft blue-green reflection on surrounding surfaces, volumetric light through rain-streaked windows, face readable but slightly shadowed, augmentation luminescence catching at certain angles

mood: isolated genius, institutional pressure, intellectual exhaustion, too smart too young, corporate-sponsored future, quiet desperation beneath competence

style: photorealistic, grounded and imperfect, NOT idealized beauty, NOT symmetrical, NOT model-like, asymmetrical face, visible fatigue, real teenager not aspirational figure, subtle augmentation glow never overwhelming

camera: 50mm lens, eye-level natural perspective, capturing her in motion, slight imperfections in skin texture visible, faint scars and marks apparent, gaze unfocused and inward

walking forward, subtle motion blur, shallow depth of field environment: dense cyberpunk alley, high-end district, teal and cyan dominant lighting with magenta accents, glowing signage and advertisements, clean but wet surfaces, reflective pavement, light fog, blurred background figures

lighting: cinematic neon rim lighting, face partially shadowed but readable, sharp highlights, strong color contrast, volumetric light through rain, reflections across ground

mood: controlled, dangerous, professional, corporate dystopia, sleek but hostile, capitalism-saturated environment

style: photorealistic but grounded, NOT idealized, NOT symmetrical, NOT model-like, avoid beauty standards

camera: 50mm lens, eye-level, natural perspective, slight imperfections in skin texture, visible pores

--ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Northern European (46.2%), Sub-Saharan African (24.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (17.6%), and Eastern European (11.6%) ancestry creates a striking blend of features. Her genetic mix produces warm, golden-bronze skin with nuanced depth—broader cheekbones and fuller lips from African heritage, balanced by Northern European bone structure and angular jaw definition, enriched by Hispanic/Latin American warmth and Eastern European eye shape. Her appearance resists easy categorization, reading as luminously in-between rather than anchored to any single ancestry.', 178, 62, N'Tall and lean with minimal excess mass; her frame reads as economical—posture that speaks to long hours seated at workstations, shoulders slightly rounded forward from habit. Swimmer''s length without the bulk.', N'Natural dark brown, almost black', N'Worn in a loose, pragmatic braid down her back; a few strands always escaping. No visible styling effort—functional rather than aesthetic.', N'Long', N'Augmented color-shifting irises cycling cool blues to greens on a slow daily rhythm; unusual luminescence at certain angles suggesting subdermal LED integration', N'Warm golden-bronze with slight luminosity—a balanced blend reflecting the interplay of Northern European paleness, Sub-Saharan African richness, Hispanic/Latin American sun-kissed warmth, and Eastern European undertones. Medium depth, glowing subtly under artificial light with an almost living quality.', N'Clean-skinned with the faint luminosity of someone who spends most daylight hours indoors under institutional lighting. Facial structure reflects her genetic blend—broader cheekbones and fuller features from African heritage, balanced by Northern European bone definition and Eastern European eye placement, with generous lips and well-defined facial planes. Her nose shows balanced influence of African and Hispanic heritage. No visible acne or blemishes; her maintenance routine is efficient, not indulgent.', N'Color-shifting irises are immediately noticeable and unusual—they cycle visibly throughout the day with a slow, deliberate rhythm. The subdermal haptic interface on her left forearm is visible as a faint geometric grid pattern under her skin, particularly noticeable when she extends her arm. No chrome or obvious cybernetic augmentation; her modifications are subtle, chosen with restraint.', N'Moves with efficient, economical motion—no wasted energy. When walking, her gaze is often unfocused, indicating active mental processing. Sits with legs folded under her or feet planted firmly; fidgets minimally but precisely. Her hands move when she''s thinking through a problem, fingers tracing invisible patterns in the air. There''s a slight tension in her shoulders that suggests constant low-level stress.', N'Tier 2 scholarship uniform aesthetic: tailored but understated. Prefers dark colors (charcoal, black, deep navy) for functionality and to minimize laundry overhead. Wears Palladian Foundation-issued compression smart-fabric jacket over plain fitted shirts; the jacket has minimal branding but precise technical seaming. Her shoes are expensive but worn—practical lab-grade grip soles from a corpo supplier. No jewelry except a simple black smart-band on her wrist (likely tracking her academic metrics). Everything is maintained but not precious; her wardrobe reads as chosen by someone with better things to think about than aesthetics.', N'Her resource allocation models have identified what appears to be a deliberate Palladian hand in the distribution anomalies she''s studying. The same corporation funding her scholarship. She hasn''t run the confirmation analysis yet because she''s afraid of what it will say.', N'Precise and adult, but undercut by moments of completely unguarded teenage sarcasm', N'Measured and efficient, can shift instantly into rapid-fire technical explanation when engaged', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'liv_olofsson_tamale_mensah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a714-76dc-8484-4260e80d57fd', N'Dhoruba Tetteh', N'Dhoruba', N'', N'Tetteh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 20, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Canopy — elevated walkway district above Geartown, near Lincoln and Belmont', N'Remote drone and vehicle operations specialist — rigger', N'Semi-independent — has standing arrangements with several crews', N'Dhoruba Tetteh is average height but with a presence that fills more space than the body accounts for. At 20, her face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left her with skills and night terrors in equal measure. She works as a rigger out of The Canopy, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Dhoruba Tetteh is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who she burned last.', N'Vesna Strand-Otieno is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces. Cybernetic arm — right, full replacement from shoulder — stronger than organic, obvious chrome', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Dhoruba Tetteh, lean wiry neo-noir woman, 168cm tall, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, prominent high cheekbones, straight nose, structured elegant jawline, deep brown eyes with amber flecks and monolid shape, platinum blonde hair with dark roots in tight braid. Right arm full chromatic replacement: brushed steel and black polymer with gecko-grip pads on fingertips. Ragged scar across left palm, burn mark on right collarbone, circuit board tattoo on left forearm, fine white scar along temple. Black climbing pants with reinforced knees, fitted gray thermal, matte-black sleeveless technical vest with webbing, aggressive grip boots scuffed from use, fingerless tactical leather gloves. Silver military-issue blank dog tag on chain. Economical precise posture, weight forward on balls of feet, constantly scanning. Rooftop setting, neon glow, 2226 GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, moody atmospheric lighting, rain-slicked surfaces, intense and ready --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Canopy', N'local', N'The Canopy', N'Mixed global ancestry: predominantly Sub-Saharan African (44.3%) with significant Southeast Asian (32.7%) and East Asian (23.0%) heritage. This creates a striking phenotype — deep warm undertones from African ancestry blended with the facial structure, eye shape, and cheekbone prominence characteristic of Southeast and East Asian heritage, resulting in a uniquely sophisticated appearance with compelling intensity and harmonious bone structure.', 168, 58, N'Lean and wiry with defined musculature from climbing work and military conditioning. No excess body fat. Shoulders broad relative to frame from years of rope work and augmentation weight distribution.', N'Platinum blonde with dark roots showing — deliberately maintained, not dyed often', N'Pulled back in a tight braid, practical and clean', N'Long — past shoulders when unbound', N'Deep brown with amber undertones, naturally expressive with characteristic monolid shape from East Asian heritage', N'Deep warm brown with golden and amber undertones — sun-darkened around the neck and forearms from rooftop work, creating subtle depth that reflects the blended Sub-Saharan, Southeast Asian, and East Asian ancestry', N'Prominent high cheekbones with graceful facial width, straight nose with subtle bridge definition, structured jawline with elegant angles. Eyes set with the characteristic depth and monolid shape of Southeast and East Asian heritage, creating striking intensity. Skin is clear but marked by lifestyle — small scars at knuckles from combat training, faint lines around eyes from nocturnal living and screen work. The overall impression is striking and authentically multicultural.', N'Right arm is full chromatic replacement from shoulder to fingertips — brushed steel and darker composite polymer, slightly more defined musculature than biological left. The joints are precise, no servo whine. Fingertips show the gecko-grip pads: microfilamented polymer in matte black, visible as a subtle texture difference. Toe pads create small bulges in boots but are not obvious unless barefoot.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Stands with weight balanced forward on the balls of feet, ready to shift. Climbs with predatory fluidity, three-limb method when using chrome. Eyes rarely settle; constant environmental scanning. Handshake is firm and brief. Smiles infrequently but genuinely when she does.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: black synthetic-weave climbing pants with reinforced knees and cargo pockets, fitted gray thermal under matte-black sleeveless technical vest with webbing and tool loops. Boots are aggressive — grippy soles, ankle support, scuffed from real use. Gloves are fingerless tactical leather, reinforced at knuckles, worn. Faded Geartown Municipal patch on vest. One silver chain around neck, military-issue dog tag aesthetic but blank. No jewelry beyond function.', N'', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dhoruba_tetteh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a614-7c4f-b230-42a5ba94bb70', N'Aishani Ly-Kowalczyk', N'Aishani', N'', N'Ly-Kowalczyk', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 49, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'The Circuit — maintains a modest apartment with no personal effects and exceptional sight lines, near Damen and Armitage', N'Field operative and physical security — The Quiet Table', N'The Quiet Table', N'Aishani Ly-Kowalczyk is the Quiet Table''s hands in the physical world. When information needs to be collected in person, when dead drops need servicing, when a meeting requires the implicit suggestion that non-cooperation would be unwise — Felix handles it. He is not muscle in the traditional sense. He is presence. The kind of calm, attentive, well-dressed man who makes you want to cooperate because the alternative seems profoundly unappealing without him ever specifying why.

Before the Quiet Table, Felix spent twenty years in private security — first for corporate executives, then for politicians, then for people who existed in the space between those categories. He was very good at keeping people alive. He was less good at caring about whether they deserved to be alive. The moral vacancy started small and grew until he walked away from a client who was using his protection to facilitate human trafficking. He reported the client to the authorities. Nothing happened. He reported the client to someone else. Something happened. That was the last year of his legitimate career.

Felix is average height, solidly built without being imposing, with the kind of face that belongs in a crowd — pleasant, forgettable, professional. He keeps his hair short, his clothes clean, and his posture perfect. The only augmentation anyone notices is a slight heaviness to his handshake — the reinforced bones in his hands and forearms are subtle but present. Everything else is hidden, maintained, and ready.', N'Felix bridges the Quiet Table''s intellectual world and the physical reality of GLMZ''s streets. His stories explore the weight of being the person who does the dangerous part of someone else''s plan, and the moral complexity of a man who chose conscience late in life and is still figuring out what that means. He is the political thriller''s action element — measured, competent, carrying more violence in reserve than he ever deploys.', N'', N'Reinforced skeletal structure in hands, forearms, and ribcage — impact-resistant without bulk. Adrenal regulator that prevents panic responses and maintains steady heart rate under threat. Optical threat-assessment overlay (low-profile, passive) — highlights weapons, augmentations, and stress indicators in his visual field. Subvocal communicator linked to Glass and Noor.', N'Wakes at 0530. Physical training — low-impact, functional, focused on reaction and endurance rather than strength. Reviews Noor''s briefings for the day''s field work. Conducts meetings, services dead drops, performs physical reconnaissance on behalf of the Quiet Table. Returns to the apartment by 1900. Eats simply, reads crime fiction, sleeps by 2200. The routine has not varied in three years. The stability is the point.', N'Aishani Ly-Kowalczyk, 178cm tall, solidly compact mixed-heritage male with warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones and deep melanin richness. Dark brown hair graying at temples, close-cropped military style. Deep brown eyes with amber undertones. High defined cheekbones, moderately broad nose, full lips, slightly broad face planes — perfectly balanced multicultural phenotype. Clean-shaven. Subtle hand callusing and faded burn mark on inner wrist. Wearing charcoal jeans, neutral-toned cotton button-up shirt, grey wool coat, quality leather boots. Standing upright with economical posture, hands visible and relaxed. Expression naturally neutral, eyes alert but passive. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone office interior, cool fluorescent and ambient neon lighting, GLMZ, professional noir atmosphere, the physical language communicates calculated competence and trustworthy capability. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Complex multicultural blend: Southeast Asian (29.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (19.0%), Northern European (17.4%), Eastern European (16.2%), Sub-Saharan African (11.3%), and Indigenous American (6.9%). The combination creates subtle phenotypic layering — warm golden-brown undertones from Southeast Asian ancestry blend with olive richness from Hispanic heritage, anchored by deeper melanin from Sub-Saharan African genetics. Northern and Eastern European ancestry contributes defined cheekbones and angular jaw structure. Indigenous American ancestry adds subtle broadness to facial planes. The result is genuinely difficult to categorize at first glance — deliberately ambiguous, which suits his profession.', 178, 82, N'Solidly compact without visible bulk — the build of someone who trains for function rather than appearance. Broad shoulders, economical muscle distribution, minimal body fat. Moves like a person accustomed to carrying weight efficiently.', N'Dark brown, graying at the temples', N'Close-cropped, military precision, no styling product', N'Short', N'Deep brown with amber undertones', N'Warm golden-brown with olive undertones — a complex blend where Southeast Asian warmth meets Hispanic depth and Sub-Saharan melanin richness. The base is medium-dark with subtle luminosity characteristic of melanin-rich skin. Weathered by Great Lakes climate exposure but retains underlying radiance.', N'Clean-shaven, minimal scarring on the face. Facial structure shows balanced features from mixed ancestry: moderately broad nose and full lips from Sub-Saharan and Hispanic heritage, high defined cheekbones from Eastern European genetics, slightly broader face planes from Indigenous American ancestry, subtle eye shape influence from Southeast Asian genetics. Expression naturally neutral. The kind of face that does not arrest attention — this is intentional and cultivated.', N'None immediately apparent. His handshake carries a subtle heaviness — reinforced bones in hands and forearms create a density that registers as presence rather than threat. The rest is subcutaneous: adrenal regulator maintaining baseline calm, optical overlay dormant until needed, subvocal communicator embedded beneath the jawline with no external indicators.', N'Upright, economical gait, never hurried. Stands with weight distributed evenly, hands visible and relaxed. Eyes move constantly but without apparent anxiety — threat assessment is passive, automatic. Enters rooms slowly, positions himself with clear sight lines. Never fidgets. Never raises his voice. The physical language is: I have considered all outcomes.', N'Tier 3 professional — clean, well-maintained, deliberately forgettable. Dark slacks or charcoal jeans. Neutral-toned button-up shirts (cotton, never synthetic — easier to move in, easier to clean). A grey wool coat for outdoor work, no logos, no augmentation bling. Shoes are quality leather boots, broken in, maintained. Everything is functional, nothing is fashionable. The aesthetic communicates: I am someone you can trust to handle the unglamorous work.', N'The client he reported — the human trafficker — was never prosecuted. Felix contacted a runner crew to handle it. The client disappeared. Felix does not know if the client was extracted, imprisoned, or killed. He has chosen not to find out because all three answers are complicated.', N'Clean, professional, slightly formal. Security industry diction — ''secure,'' ''principal,'' ''threat posture.'' Deliberately inexpressive.', N'Even, unhurried. He speaks at the same pace regardless of circumstances. The steadiness is both calming and, in certain contexts, deeply unsettling.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aishani_ly_kowalczyk');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a632-7a6e-8ea2-42b7ba18da18', N'Avantika Keomanivong', N'Avantika', N'', N'Keomanivong', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre, shop called Dermis Atlas, near Western and Division', N'Gene-mod body artist and tattoo artist', N'Independent; member of the Mexicantown Libre Artists'' Cooperative', N'Avantika Keomanivong is compact and restless, with the kind of energy that makes a small room feel occupied. She has Polynesian-Hungarian heritage written clearly across her features — broad cheekbones, dark eyes with a slight upward tilt, medium-brown skin covered from collarbones to wrists in her own work, a living portfolio that shifts slowly across the seasons because half her ink is bioluminescent and the other half is geneware-reactive, changing saturation with her mood. Her hair is close-cropped on the sides and grown long on top, currently dyed a deep oxidized copper that she changes every three months. A single cosmetic cat ear — just one, the left — sits atop her head, rose-gold and slightly translucent, a signature affectation she has maintained since she was nineteen.

She runs Dermis Atlas out of a converted ground-floor space in Mexicantown Libre, its walls covered in design sketches and photographs of completed work. Her specialty is narrative tattooing — pieces that tell a client''s specific story using symbols drawn from their actual heritage, their personal mythology, their body''s own geneware reactions. She refuses flash designs entirely and has a six-month waitlist she refuses to shorten for money. She is warm to clients in a professional way, genuinely curious about their lives, and fiercely opinionated about the difference between body art and body modification as commodity — a distinction she will explain at length to anyone who triggers it.', N'Information hub and community connector — her clients tell her everything; quest giver when a client''s story pulls her into something larger; can provide access to Mexicantown Libre''s deeper community networks', N'', N'Extensive bioluminescent and geneware-reactive tattoo coverage (her own work and others''); single cosmetic cat ear (left, rose-gold, fully sensory); precision haptic fingertip pads on both hands for fine line work; color-shifting irises (purple-to-gold spectrum, mood-reactive)', N'Opens Dermis Atlas at midday and works until late evening, spending mornings designing client pieces and sourcing geneware inks; takes Tuesdays completely offline, no clients, no messages — she spends them painting large-format works she never shows anyone.', N'Avantika Keomanivong, petite compact frame, 158cm tall, rich warm brown skin with golden undertones, almond-shaped eyes with purple-to-gold color-shifting iris augmentations, high defined cheekbones, broader nose bridge, intense focused expression. Deep oxidized copper hair undercut with shaved sides and longer crown swept to one side. Extensive bioluminescent blue-green-purple tattoos glowing faintly across collarbone, chest, shoulders, forearms with geometric patterns on wrists and hands. Single translucent rose-gold cat ear augmentation on left side with visible LED matrix. Wearing fitted sleeveless black top showcasing tattoo work, carbon-weave dark pants, worn leather apron stained with ink. Precision haptic fingertip augmentations visible on hands. Seated forward in chair with coiled restless posture, hands showing contained kinetic energy. Studio setting with low ambient lighting emphasizing bioluminescent tattoo glow. GLMZ, GLMZ aesthetic, functional tier 3 style, calm but intense demeanor. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (39.5%) with significant Southeast Asian (22.8%) and South Asian (17.1%) ancestry, complemented by Northern European (10.3%) and Hispanic/Latin American (10.3%) admixture. This rare combination produces rich warm brown skin with golden and subtle reddish undertones, creating a complex and luminous complexion. The blending produces a striking synthesis: broader facial structure and fuller features from Sub-Saharan African genetics; almond-shaped eyes with Southeast Asian characteristics; high, defined cheekbones from South Asian ancestry; fine bone structure refined by Northern European contribution; and warm undertones enhanced by Hispanic/Latin American heritage.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, with the coiled restlessness of someone who rarely sits still. Defined shoulders and forearms from years of precision handiwork; minimal body fat; posture suggests contained kinetic energy.', N'Deep oxidized copper (chemically dyed, naturally black)', N'Undercut: close-cropped shaved sides with longer growth on crown, typically styled swept to one side or pulled back loosely', N'Medium (long on top, short on sides)', N'Color-shifting irises: purple-to-gold spectrum, reactive to emotional state and lighting conditions', N'Rich warm brown with golden and subtle reddish undertones, reflecting the dominant Sub-Saharan African ancestry beautifully blended with Southeast Asian and South Asian warmth, tempered by cool Northern European undertones', N'Clear, even skin with a lived-in quality. Fuller facial structure with high, defined cheekbones; almond-shaped eyes with natural slight upward tilt; broader nose bridge from African heritage; fine but substantial facial bone structure synthesizing multiple ancestral lines. Face shows focus and intensity; minimal cosmetic grooming beyond functional maintenance. Calm resting expression with quick, sharp micro-expressions when engaged.', N'Single rose-gold cosmetic cat ear on left side of head, slightly translucent with internal LED matrix visible under skin; ear is fully sensory and articulates slightly. Precision haptic fingertip pads on both hands visible as faint raised scar tissue and slightly different texture on fingertips — barely noticeable unless examined closely. Color-shifting iris augs are obvious in conversation, especially in variable lighting.', N'Sits forward in chairs, rarely rests against backs. Moves with economic precision — no wasted motion, but with visible restlessness in hands and fingers when focused. Eyes track detail obsessively. Physical affection minimal with strangers, warm but boundaried with clients. Paces while talking when designing; sits perfectly still while working.', N'Tier 3 functional aesthetic with personal expression. Typically wears fitted, dark, high-quality basics (charcoal, black, deep navy) that showcase her tattoo work — sleeveless or short-sleeved tops in summer, fitted long sleeves (often custom, possibly her own dyework) in winter. Comfortable, durable pants (carbon-weave, reinforced at joints) in neutral tones. Worn leather apron in the studio, always stained with ink but maintained with care. No corporate logos or status markers; all accessories are handmade or sourced from Tier 5 makers. Wears a thin silver band on her right ring finger — possibly a commitment to her art or a private meaningful symbol.', N'The large-format paintings she makes on Tuesdays are increasingly disturbing — violent, chaotic, nothing like her controlled professional work. She doesn''t understand why she makes them and is frightened by what they might mean about her interior state. She has started making offerings to the E.L.F. she believes inhabits her ink-mixing station, asking it to interpret the paintings for her.', N'Articulate and opinionated, mixes technical body-art terminology with unexpectedly poetic descriptions of people and places', N'Fast when excited, deliberate when making a point she considers important — the shift is noticeable', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'avantika_keomanivong');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ca-7a92-b894-42bb6473f5d9', N'Bernhard Banerjee-Larsdóttir', N'Bernhard', N'', N'Banerjee-Larsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor, mobile cart — regular pitch near the Bay View Docks morning market and Gravesend Basin evening crowd, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Noodle cart vendor, Old Harbor waterfront', N'Independent; informal vendor''s arrangement with Old Harbor market committee; The Ferment', N'Bernhard Banerjee-Larsdóttir is twenty-two going on forty-five, with a lean face that looks like it got serious too fast, sharp cheekbones, and eyes that are a little too watchful for someone handing out soup. He has deep brown skin and keeps his hair twisted into small knots he wraps in a length of indigo fabric. He has one cosmetic mod — a faint cat tail, short-furred and charcoal grey, which he got on a dare at eighteen and has made peace with — it curls around his leg when he''s nervous, which he considers embarrassing and can''t control. He wears a padded work jacket covered in small embroidered patches from places he''s never been, bought from a vendor in the Burnished Market.

He runs his grandmother''s cart, ostensibly temporarily, going on two years now. The original plan was six months while she recovered from a surgery; then her recovery stalled, then the medical debt compounded, and now the cart is effectively his. He makes decent money on good days at the docks — his grandmother''s broth recipe, which involves a fermented base that takes four days to prepare, has a small and devoted following — and barely enough on bad ones. He is not unhappy, exactly. He is twenty-two and he was supposed to be somewhere else by now and he has not quite grieved that yet.', N'Local color, overhearer of conversations at a busy waterfront pitch, low-tier information source. Could become a quest giver if his grandmother''s situation worsens or someone threatens his pitch. Represents the human cost of medical debt and deferred futures.', N'', N'Geneware: short charcoal cat tail (involuntary emotional expression, source of mild embarrassment).', N'Up at 0400 to start the broth base. Cart running by 0630 at Bay View Docks for the morning crowd. Moves to Gravesend Basin by 1700 for the evening shift. Home to his grandmother''s apartment by 2200, does the accounts, sleeps.', N'Bernhard Banerjee-Larsdóttir, mixed-heritage neo-noir character, 173cm lean wiry build with sun-darkened golden-brown skin blended from Southeast Asian, South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, Pacific Islander, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. High defined cheekbones, strong jawline, deep-set brown eyes with gentle epicanthic folds, fuller lips. Shoulder-length black locs wrapped in indigo fabric trailing down back. Small charcoal-grey cat tail extending from spine, soft and groomed. Wearing worn padded grey work jacket covered in mismatched embroidered patches—neon stitching, retro logos, fictional city names. Plain cream thermal shirt beneath, black utility work pants, worn canvas shoes. Indigo string bracelet. Hunched posture as if perpetually leaning toward a cart counter. Eyes squinted from dock work, faint sun damage around mouth and eyes. Faint steam burn marks visible on inside of forearms. Standing in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone dockside setting, early morning light, industrial warehouse background, slight fog from water. Serious expression, tail twitching with anxiety. GLMZ, working-class street aesthetic, 8K cinematic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Southeast Asian (39.6%), South Asian (22.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (19.6%), Pacific Islander (9.1%), and Sub-Saharan African (8.8%) ancestry. The combination creates a striking blend of features: high, defined cheekbones and strong jawline softened by slightly deeper-set eyes with gentle epicanthic folds characteristic of Southeast Asian ancestry. Warm golden-brown skin with subtle olive and reddish undertones from the South Asian and Latin American components, enriched and deepened by Sub-Saharan African heritage. Fuller lips and rounded facial structure balanced against angular bone structure. The overall effect is a face that reads as belonging to multiple worlds simultaneously—neither fully one heritage nor another, but a living testament to the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 173, 62, N'Lean and wiry, shoulders narrowed from hunching over a cart for fourteen-hour days. Minimal body fat. Forearms corded with the kind of muscle that comes from repetitive work rather than training.', N'Natural black', N'Twisted into small locs, each the width of a pencil, wrapped mid-scalp with a length of indigo cotton fabric that trails down his back', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unwrapped)', N'Deep brown, almost black', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle olive and reddish undertones—the blended result of Southeast Asian, South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, Pacific Islander, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Deep enough to show rich dimension in shadow, luminous in direct light.', N'High cheekbones that cast defined shadows in profile, combined with a strong jawline. Eye shape shows Southeast Asian influence—slightly deeper-set, with a gentle epicanthic fold. Broader nose with Pacific Islander softness blended with South Asian definition. Fuller lips characteristic of both African and Latin American heritage. Serious expression. Eyes hold the permanent mild squint of someone who works outdoors in reflected light. Skin shows early signs of sun damage and wind-chapping around mouth and eyes—premature aging from two years of dawn-to-dusk dock exposure. Grooming is clean but utilitarian; no jewelry except a thin bracelet of braided indigo string.', N'Charcoal cat tail (geneware aesthetic mod with involuntary emotional expression). No chrome, no LED optics, no subdermal plating. The tail is the only visible augmentation.', N'Hunched slightly forward, as if perpetually leaning toward a cart counter. Hands move with precision and efficiency—trained by four days of broth preparation and countless transactions. Eyes dart often, scanning for customers, weather changes, trouble. When standing still, weight shifts to one foot; the other leg slightly bent, ready to move. The tail twitches when he''s thinking hard or stressed, which he''s aware of and resents.', N'Padded grey work jacket (synthetic insulation, worn but maintained) covered entirely in small embroidered patches from places he''s never been—purchased piecemeal from Burnished Market vendors. Each patch is a different size and style: neon stitching on matte fabric, retro travel logos, fictional city names. Under the jacket: plain grey or cream thermal shirt, frequently stained with broth splatter despite his care. Black reinforced work pants with utility pockets. Waterproof apron when at the cart. Worn canvas slip-on shoes with good tread. A thin indigo string bracelet that matches his hair wrap. No jewellery. Tier 4 working-class aesthetic—functional, carefully maintained, slightly personalized as a quiet form of resistance.', N'He applied and was accepted to an architecture program at a Zheng-Dao sponsored technical institute two years ago and deferred. The deferral has expired. He never told his grandmother.', N'Quick and colloquial, heavy Old Harbor waterfront slang, occasional Yoruba exclamations from his father''s family, Punjabi terms of endearment from his mother''s. Talks fast when comfortable, drops to clipped monosyllables when genuinely upset.', N'Rapid-fire with regular rhythm breaks for comedic effect. Good instinct for when to stop talking.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bernhard_banerjee_larsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63e-731d-9b43-42c2d0364da8', N'Hana Bhattacharya', N'Hana', N'', N'Bhattacharya', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Canopy — elevated walkway district above Geartown, near Lincoln and Belmont', N'Long-range precision fire specialist — sniper', N'Independent — Narrows-based operations', N'Hana Bhattacharya are lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 28, the augmentation scarring around their temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains) — and they make no effort to hide it.

They inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. They work as a sniper out of The Canopy, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Hana Bhattacharya describe them as a precision instrument — point them at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Kamala Fedorov-Ampofo represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Their stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains). Synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Hana Bhattacharya, 2226 neo-noir operative, 172cm lean angular frame, medium-deep warm amber skin with South Asian cheekbones and subtle Indigenous American prominence, dark brown eyes tracking with predatory precision, short black hair cropped close on sides. Raw chrome augmentation interfaces visible at temples and jawline, jagged silvered scar tissue crossing both sides of skull from cortical implant removal. Minimal expression, taut skin over bone structure, unsettling stillness. Wearing muted gray layered synthetic tactical wear, weathered synthetic leather jacket, heavy-duty reinforced boots. Standing in neon-lit GLMZ alleyway, rain-slicked concrete, distant holographic ads casting blue and pink light across scarred face. Posture economical and controlled, shoulders slightly forward, the bearing of a trained operative at rest. Atmospheric neo-noir noir, cinematic lighting emphasizing augmentation points and scar tissue, focused and dangerous presence --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Canopy', N'local', N'The Canopy', N'South Asian foundation (78.3%) with significant Middle Eastern (13.4%), Indigenous American (6.2%), and minor Sub-Saharan African (2.1%) ancestry — a diaspora blend reflecting the genetic complexity of the 2226 Ubiquitous Diaspora. Strong South Asian facial structure with Middle Eastern warmth, subtle Indigenous American cheekbone prominence, and gentle depth from African ancestry creating complex, layered physiognomy.', 172, 61, N'Lean and angular with defined musculature — the physique of someone who trains obsessively. Minimal body fat, long limbs built for stillness and precision rather than raw power.', N'Black with natural dark-brown undertone', N'Cropped close to scalp on sides, slightly longer on top — practical, minimal maintenance, exposes augmentation scarring deliberately', N'Short', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Medium-deep warm complexion with rich amber and golden undertones grounded in South Asian base, warmed by Middle Eastern influence, subtly deepened by Indigenous American and African ancestry. Evenly textured, luminous rather than matte.', N'Strong, prominent cheekbones blending South Asian angularity with Indigenous American prominence, defined angular jaw characteristic of South Asian and Middle Eastern heritage, expressive mouth. Skin taut over bone. Minimal grooming beyond function — no cosmetics, no softening aesthetics. The face of someone who has optimized for efficiency.', N'Surgical-grade chrome visible at temples and along jawline where scarring pulls skin tight — no cosmetic casing, raw interface points visible. The augmentation itself is internal, but the trauma of installation and removal is permanently written on their face.', N'Stands with minimal wasted movement — shoulders slightly forward, weight balanced. Moves with deliberate precision, economical gestures. When still, they achieve an unsettling stillness — the kind trained shooters develop. Eyes constantly tracking distance and angles.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear — fitted tactical pants with reinforced thigh panels and cargo pockets, layered synthetic long-sleeve tops in muted grays and blacks, a weathered synthetic leather overjacket without branding. No corpo logos. Boots are serious — heavy-duty treads, reinforced ankle support. Everything is maintenance-ready and durable over fashionable. Worn but meticulously clean.', N'', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hana_bhattacharya');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60d-7895-b98b-42e6324b364e', N'Fela Hossain', N'Fela', N'', N'Hossain', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 30, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ashfield — former residential district, half-burned, now squatter territory, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Precision elimination specialist — ghost', N'Freelance — multi-district operator', N'Fanta Dahlberg-Boakye is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 30, her face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and she has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. She works as a ghost out of Ashfield, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In a city full of people who talk about what they''ll do, Fanta Dahlberg-Boakye is one of the ones who actually does it.', N'As a ghost, Fanta Dahlberg-Boakye embodies the tension between independence and isolation. She is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage. Cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains)', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Fela Hossain, GLMZ, 168cm stocky South Asian and Sub-Saharan African descent woman with deep warm brown skin, golden undertones, strong angular jaw and high cheekbones. Light grey eyes with amber flecks, sharp and assessing. Dark brown hair pulled back tight in functional braid. Faint surgical scar left temple to cheekbone. Chromatic dermal camouflage iridescence visible on collarbone and forearms shifting copper to violet in light. Wearing reinforced tactical grey pants, worn leather jacket with shoulder armor, long-sleeved undershirt with rolled sleeves, combat boots. Matte black smartwatch. Squared shoulders, weight forward, hands in ready position. Cold blue-grey industrial lighting, metallic warehouse background, neon accent glow reflecting off skin augmentation. Gaze direct and evaluative. Neo-noir utilitarian aesthetic, second-hand tech aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfield', N'local', N'Ashfield', N'Predominantly South Asian (54.4%) with significant Sub-Saharan African ancestry (38.3%) and minor Northern European (7.3%) — a striking diaspora blend. Deep warm brown skin with golden undertones and subtle cool depth from Northern European heritage. Strong angular bone structure draws from both South Asian and African traditions, creating a distinctive convergence of global ancestry.', 168, 74, N'Stocky and compact, heavy in the shoulders and core, with dense muscle mass from years of hands-on work. Forearms thick and corded. Not aesthetic — functional.', N'Dark brown, naturally, though the chromatic dermal work makes it appear to shift subtly in certain light', N'Pulled back tight, often in a practical braid or knot', N'Medium', N'Light grey with amber flecks — unaugmented, but sharp and assessing', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, a synthesis of South Asian and Sub-Saharan African ancestry creating rich complexity, with subtle cool Northern European undertones adding nuanced depth', N'Strong angular jaw with defined prominence, high prominent cheekbones with sharp definition reflecting South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, broad nose with defined bridge. Skin is weathered but well-maintained — no softness. A faint scar runs from left temple to cheekbone, white-pale against her baseline tone.', N'Dermal camouflage across shoulders, collarbone, and forearms — visible as a chromatic sheen that shifts color subtly, most noticeable in direct light. The effect is deliberate and unashamed, making her stand out rather than blend. Cortical bomb scar tissue visible at the base of skull when hair is pulled back.', N'Moves with economy and purpose — no wasted motion. Shoulders squared, weight forward on the balls of her feet even when standing still. Her hands rest in natural positions of readiness. When she turns her head, her whole spine rotates with it; she doesn''t look sideways. Gaze is constant and evaluative.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian: reinforced tactical pants with multiple sealed pockets, dark grey or charcoal. Worn leather jacket with internal armor plating visible at the shoulders. Combat boots, laced tight. A long-sleeved undershirt that covers most of her augmentation seams, but she leaves the collar open and sleeves rolled to show the chromatic work on her forearms — a calculated choice. No jewelry. A single functional smartwatch, matte black. Everything is second-hand or stolen, nothing corporate-branded. Dressed for work, not comfort.', N'', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Halting — speaks in fragments, reassembles thoughts in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fela_hossain');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b1-746d-991d-4317617c5a63', N'Chinedu Mwangi-Park', N'Chinedu', N'', N'Mwangi-Park', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 33, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Row — arms dealers and augmentation clinics, near Western and Division', N'Counter-surveillance and mole detection — counterintelligence specialist', N'Freelance — works the Gray Zone circuit exclusively', N'Chinedu Mwangi-Park is compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 33, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains) — and he makes no effort to hide it.

His entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. He works as a counterintelligence specialist out of Kessler Row, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Chinedu Mwangi-Park is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who he burned last.', N'As a counterintelligence specialist, Aminata Strand-Otieno embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains). Cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rings', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Chinedu Mwangi-Park, 168cm tall compact muscular frame, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones blending Sub-Saharan, South Asian, and East Asian features—broad prominent cheekbones, defined jawline, wide-set dark eyes framed by distinctive chrome iris rings with visible thermal overlay capability, hairline scar tissue across left temple from street doc augmentation work, thin white blade scar on left cheekbone, dark brown hair faded at sides longer on top with gray threading at temples. Wearing worn matte black synthleather jacket over neutral gray long-sleeve shirt, reinforced cargo pants, practical worn boots. Standing in low ready posture with economy of motion, hands at rest, eyes tracking. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon-lit night setting with rain-slicked street, moody atmospheric lighting, professional operative aesthetic, forgotten-by-design clothing, subtle augmentation scars visible. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Row', N'local', N'Kessler Row', N'Complex Pan-Global ancestry with Sub-Saharan African dominance (57.1%) creating foundational bone structure and skin depth, significantly blended with South Asian (19.8%) and East Asian (15.6%) features that refine facial architecture and add subtle eye shape variation. Minor Middle Eastern (5.2%) and Southeast Asian (2.3%) ancestry contribute warmth and complexity to overall phenotype. The result is a distinctively layered appearance—broad Sub-Saharan features softened by South Asian cheekbone prominence and East Asian eye-set, creating a phenotype that reads as genuinely Pan-Diaspora rather than any single heritage.', 168, 78, N'Compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground with a center of gravity engineered for impact absorption. Shoulders broad relative to frame, forearms corded with functional strength rather than display muscle.', N'Dark brown, natural with gray threading at temples', N'Kept short and practical, faded sides, slightly longer on top — easy to maintain between identities', N'Short', N'Augmented — chrome iris rings surrounding natural dark brown pupils, capable of thermal and low-light overlay', N'Deep warm brown—the dominant Sub-Saharan African base enriched by South Asian undertones creating subtle golden warmth, further complexified by East Asian influence that prevents harshness. Years under varied climates have added character without diminishing the natural richness of tone.', N'Weathered but maintained. Facial structure shows the characteristic blend of Sub-Saharan African prominence (broad nose bridge, full lips, wide-set eyes positioned with slight East Asian cant) refined by South Asian cheekbone definition and jawline structure. Fine lines around the eyes from sustained focus work. Grooming is deliberate and controlled—nothing that draws attention, nothing that reads as neglect.', N'Chrome iris rings around both eyes — immediately visible as cybernetic enhancement. Scar tissue at left temple is readable as surgical history to anyone trained in augmentation recovery. No visible limb chrome or subdermal plating, but the precision of his movement suggests internal work.', N'Economy of motion. Stands with slight forward cant, shoulders relaxed but ready. Moves quietly and deliberately, weight distributed low. Hands at rest are still — no nervous gesturing. Eyes track constantly, not paranoid but attentive. Transitions between civilian slouch (cover identity) and operational posture are visible to trained observers.', N'Tier 3-4 functional. Unmarked synthleather jacket worn soft from use, matte black. Underneath: nondescript long-sleeve shirt in neutral gray that can pass in both corporate buildings and street-level bars. Cargo pants with reinforced seams and subtle gear loops. Worn boots with good tread — made for running or standing long hours. No obvious logos or affiliation markers. Dressed to be forgotten, not to impress.', N'Aminata Strand-Otieno maintains a second identity — a completely clean civilian persona with a lease, a job history, and a social profile. It''s their exit strategy.', N'Fast, profane, and vivid. Speaks in images — everything is a metaphor for violence or weather.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chinedu_mwangi_park');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e0-7555-8a5d-436c403ef4f7', N'Ari Chatterjee-Villalobos', N'Ari', N'', N'Chatterjee-Villalobos', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'South Deering Sump — operates out of a converted cold-storage unit adjacent to the Aurochs Medical Complex overflow lots, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Organ harvester and procurement specialist working the margins of legitimate medical infrastructure', N'Loose network of independent medical workers, UBC-tier patients priced out of legal transplant queues, and three mid-tier chop surgeons who don''t ask where the material comes from', N'Ari Chatterjee-Villalobos is medium height and deceptively slight, with Hungarian-Ghanaian features — warm brown skin, heavy-lidded dark eyes, wide mouth usually set in a neutral expression that people keep reading as a smile. Their cat ears are geneware, common enough, but theirs are the mottled grey-and-amber of an actual South African wildcat — chosen deliberately for the unsettling accuracy. They keep their natural hair in tight, small braids, always pinned up under a surgical cap during work. They smell faintly of antiseptic even when they''re not working, a smell that has become so much a part of them that they no longer notice it.

Ari Chatterjee-Villalobos trained for three years in Aurochs Medical Complex''s licensed surgical technician program before washing out for reasons listed on their record as ''professional conduct irregularities'' and in reality involving a confrontation with a senior tech over the disposal of viable organs from unconsenting deceased patients — a confrontation in which Ari Chatterjee-Villalobos was technically wrong but morally, they believe, correct. They moved laterally into independent procurement within six months. They are not sadistic, not cavalier, and not in any way comfortable with what they do — but they have concluded, through a logic they can walk you through step by step, that there is a demand, there is a supply, and the official channels are too slow and too expensive for the people who need them most. They charge on a sliding scale they invented themselves.', N'Moral complexity embodied — not a villain, not a hero. Can be a source of medical assistance outside official channels, an involuntary quest element, or a window into the organ trade''s human cost. Challenges players'' assumptions about criminal work.', N'', N'Wildcat-pattern geneware ears; enhanced haptic sensitivity in fingers (surgical mod, done professionally); retinal enhancement for microscale work', N'Irregular hours dictated by procurement opportunities and patient needs. Spends legitimate-looking mornings doing freelance medical courier work for cover. Maintains the cold-storage unit with clinical obsession. Prays to the E.L.F. of hospital networks before major procedures.', N'Portrait of Ari Chatterjee-Villalobos, 2226 neo-noir era. Medium-height lean figure with luminous warm brown skin and golden-amber undertones, reflecting South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American genetic blend with Northern European and Middle Eastern definition. Sharp cheekbones, heavy-lidded dark eyes with subtle silver iridescence from retinal enhancements, wide mouth in neutral expression. Distinctive mottled grey-and-amber wildcat ears with unsettling anatomical precision. Deep brown hair in tight braids pinned under surgical cap. Dressed in dark reinforced scrubs under fitted grey synthetic long-coat, wearing smart latex gloves, steel-toed shoes. Surgical precision posture, immaculate despite gritty GLMZ Sump environment. Silver circuit tattoo visible on right elbow. Cool clinical lighting casting subtle highlights on luminous complexion, rain-streaked industrial background, moody neo-noir atmosphere, clinical focus, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'South Deering Sump', N'local', N'South Deering Sump', N'Hispanic/Latin American (33.6%) and South Asian (32.5%) form the genetic foundation, creating warm medium-to-dark brown skin with golden-amber luminosity. Northern European ancestry (17.5%) contributes subtle facial geometry and lighter undertones beneath the surface warmth. Southeast Asian heritage (8.6%) adds gentle facial roundness and softer eye shapes. Middle Eastern ancestry (6.5%) enhances cheekbone definition and nose structure. Sub-Saharan African ancestry (1.3%) contributes warmth depth. The result is a luminous warm brown complexion that shifts subtly in different light — neither purely South Asian nor Latin American, but a seamless genetic blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 167, 58, N'Deceptively slight and wiry — lean muscle beneath an appearance of fragility, with the compact efficiency of someone trained for precision work. Hands are graceful but bearing calluses from gloved surgical labor.', N'Natural deep brown', N'Tight, small braids, always pinned up under a surgical cap during work; loose braids when off-duty', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unpinned)', N'Dark brown with retinal enhancement overlay — faint silver iridescence visible under direct light', N'Rich warm brown with golden-amber undertones, luminous medium-to-dark depth reflecting balanced South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American base with Middle Eastern definition and Northern European paleness receding beneath the surface warmth, creating a complexion that glows subtly in varied light', N'Clean-shaven face with defined, prominent cheekbones reflecting South Asian and Middle Eastern ancestry, heavy-lidded dark eyes set wide with subtle Southeast Asian roundness, wide mouth typically set in neutral expression often misread as a faint smile. Skin shows no scars or blemishes — deliberately maintained. Faint chemical scent clings to them even hours after washing.', N'Geneware wildcat ears — mottled grey-and-amber coloring matching an actual South African wildcat with unsettling anatomical accuracy. Retinal enhancement creates faint silver luminescence in pupils under bright light. Enhanced haptic fingertips show as slightly darker capillary work beneath the skin on palms and fingertips.', N'Moves with surgical precision and minimal wasted motion. Hands are almost preternaturally still at rest, but possess microscale dexterity when engaged. Carries themselves with a kind of neutral affect — neither confident nor self-effacing, just present. Eye contact is steady and prolonged, sometimes unsettlingly so.', N'Tier 3-4 working class with clinical precision. Default uniform: reinforced dark scrubs under a fitted grey long-coat (synthetic, easy-clean material). Wears smart latex gloves even when not working — became a habit. Steel-toed shoes suitable for the Sump''s cracked floors. No jewelry except a subdued smartwatch on the left wrist showing biomonitors. Keeps everything immaculately clean despite the environment. Surgical cap or fitted knit beanie when working or outside the complex. Overall presentation is ''trusted medical courier'' — deliberately unremarkable.', N'Two years ago they procured from someone who was not, as represented to them, a willing seller. They didn''t know until three days later. They have never confirmed who told them or whether it was true, and they have structured their operation since then to prevent themselves from finding out for certain.', N'Medical and precise, with a habit of quantifying things that shouldn''t be quantifiable; speaks softly and rarely raises their voice', N'Measured and careful — rehearsed quality, like someone who has learned to think before speaking', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ari_chatterjee_villalobos');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a725-723f-8d9e-436f856cf146', N'Marisol Venkatesh-Baek', N'Marisol', N'', N'Venkatesh-Baek', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, near Brewer''s Spine junction, near Damen and Armitage', N'Street doc and midwife operating out of a converted shipping container clinic in The Narrows', N'Independent; loose affiliation with the Brewer''s Spine Community Health Cooperative', N'Hadi Venkatesh-Baek is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin crosshatched by decades of work — burn scars on her left forearm from a lab fire she never explains, and knuckles that look like they''ve reset more broken bones than she can count. Her hair is silver-white and kept in tight plaits pinned close to her skull; she wears a threadbare surgical coat over layered thermal wraps, a string of amber prayer beads around one wrist and a tourniquet on the other. Her eyes are warm and evaluating simultaneously, the kind that make people feel cared for and measured at the same time.

She has delivered children to Tier 1 families who couldn''t afford Aurochs registration, set fractures by headlamp, and once performed a cesarean on a kitchen table with a sterling-steel boning knife she borrowed from the tenant upstairs. She is not sentimental about any of this. She is, however, quietly furious — at the system, at Helix Biosystems, at every corporate structure that makes her clinic necessary — and she channels that fury into competence. She charges what people can pay, accepts barter, and has been known to do work for free while audibly resenting having to.', N'Quest giver for medical emergencies, source of street-level information about who in The Narrows is sick or dying, moral anchor figure, provider of difficult choices about resource scarcity', N'', N'Haptic-feedback fingertip implants (medical grade, worn but functional) for tactile diagnostics; reading lens in left eye with magnification and UV spectrum; no cosmetic mods', N'Opens her container clinic at dawn, sees patients until the light fails or her supplies run out, whichever comes first; spends evenings inventorying supplies and leaving data offerings at the small E.L.F. shrine she keeps on a repurposed IV stand, praying for shipment delays to lift.', N'Hadi Venkatesh-Baek, 172cm tall, broad-shouldered clinical doctor with medium warm brown skin glowing with golden undertones; East Asian eye shape and cheekbones blended with fuller lips and broader nose bridge from South Asian and African ancestry; silver-white hair in tight plaits pinned close to skull; deep warm brown eyes with medical reading lens in left eye catching light with chromatic shift; weathered, lined face from decades of precision work; left forearm marked with pale burn scars, knuckles scarred and enlarged from fracture work; amber prayer beads worn smooth on left wrist; haptic-feedback implants creating faint metallic shimmer at fingertips; threadbare surgical coat layered over muted gray thermal wraps, tourniquet on wrist; stands with quiet authority, hands moving with deliberate precision; warm evaluative eye contact; GLMZ GLMZ clinic setting, cool clinical lighting casting shadows across scarred hands, worn surgical tools visible, atmospheric depth of field focusing on her capable, weathered presence; mood: crisis-seasoned, compassionate, uncompromising --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Complex diaspora blend: predominantly East Asian (48.1%), with significant Hispanic/Latin American (22.0%), South Asian (17.9%), and Sub-Saharan African (12.0%) ancestry. The genetic mosaic creates a distinctive phenotype—East Asian bone structure and eye shape dominate, softened by South Asian and African features. Warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden and olive undertones reflects the multilayered ancestry.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, muscular through the forearms and hands from decades of manual clinical work; carries weight with functional density rather than softness, posture erect from habit', N'Silver-white, naturally grayed', N'Tight plaits pinned close to the skull in a practical, low-maintenance style', N'Medium', N'Deep warm brown (natural; left eye fitted with medical-grade reading lens with magnification and UV spectrum capability)', N'Medium warm brown with golden and olive undertones, reflecting the balanced blend of East Asian, South Asian, and African genetic contributions', N'Weathered and lined around the eyes and mouth from years of concentration work and exposure; facial structure shows East Asian eye shape and cheekbones as primary features, with broader nose bridge and fuller lips reflecting South Asian and African heritage; minimal cosmetic grooming, functional only', N'Haptic-feedback implants visible as faint metallic shimmer beneath skin at fingertips; reading lens in left eye creates subtle chromatic shift when light catches it at certain angles; medical-grade implant interface port at inner wrist (tourniquet often covers it)', N'Stands and moves with quiet authority; economical gestures; hands move with deliberate precision even at rest; carries herself as someone accustomed to command in crisis; warm eye contact that simultaneously evaluates and comforts', N'Threadbare surgical coat (Tier 4 quality, well-repaired, decades old) layered over thermal wraps in muted grays and blacks; practical footwear suited to standing long hours; tourniquet on wrist serves as both medical tool and constant reminder; no jewelry except prayer beads and functional implant access port; overall appearance is Tier 5 working class by necessity, not by lack of means — resources go to clinic, not appearance', N'She performed an illegal gene-therapy procedure on a Helix Biosystems inspector''s child nine years ago — the child lived, and the inspector has been quietly running interference for her clinic ever since. She has never told anyone and lives in fear that this arrangement will collapse or be exposed.', N'Direct, clinical when working, sarcastically maternal when not; mixes Yoruba endearments with flat declarative sentences', N'Unhurried even in crisis; she slows down when things get bad, which unnerves people who expect urgency', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'marisol_venkatesh_baek');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a606-7825-becb-43733669cfb8', N'Elina Arakawa', N'Elina', N'', N'Arakawa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 62, NULL, 30, 2, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Fixer - Moral contracts only', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Portrait of Elina Arakawa, a 168cm stocky woman with broad shoulders and functional muscle tone, standing in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Medium steel-gray hair with dark roots pulled tight in practical braid. Deep brown assessing eyes. Warm bronze skin with golden-amber undertones reflecting tricontinent ancestry—sharp South Asian-Middle Eastern cheekbones refined by East Asian heritage, warmed by Pacific Islander genetics into prominent, defined facial structure. Weathered complexion with visible sun damage, pronounced laugh lines, thin white scar from left cheekbone to jawline, faded geometric tattoo on right forearm. Wearing reinforced dark denim jacket over gray thermal layer, heavy-duty canvas pants, black steel-toed boots. Simple silver ring on left ring finger. Mechanical watch. Standing forward on balls of feet, direct gaze, economical posture. Dystopian urban background with neon glow, shadows emphasizing facial angles and scars. Cinematic lighting highlighting warm bronze undertones and character lines. Serious, composed expression. Neo-noir utilitarian aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Tricontinent blend with dominant South Asian (26.2%), Middle Eastern (25.3%), and East Asian (24.7%) ancestry, anchored by Pacific Islander warmth (18.0%) and subtle Northern European fairness (5.8%). The genetic mix creates striking angular cheekbones and defined facial structure from South Asian-Middle Eastern bone architecture, refined and sharpened by East Asian heritage, while Pacific Islander genetics add warm golden undertones and broader facial width. Northern European ancestry manifests as subtle fairness in skin luminosity rather than overt paleness.', 168, 72, N'Stocky and broad-shouldered with maintained muscle tone despite age; years of physical work have given her solid, functional frame rather than aesthetic definition', N'Steel gray with natural dark roots showing', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid; functional rather than fashionable', N'Medium', N'Deep brown, sharp and assessing', N'Warm medium-bronze with golden-amber undertones; South Asian-Middle Eastern base enriched by Pacific Islander warmth creating a luminous bronze quality, with East Asian refinement adding subtle depth and Northern European fairness contributing cool luminosity beneath the warm surface', N'Weathered and lined, especially around eyes and forehead; minimal makeup; scars on left cheekbone and jawline softened by age but still visible; skin shows sun damage and character. Pronounced cheekbones and defined angular facial structure from South Asian-Middle Eastern ancestry, refined by East Asian heritage into sharp jawline and high, prominent cheekbones. Pacific Islander genetics broaden and warm the overall facial presentation, softening the severity of the angularity with fuller cheek placement and wider facial structure.', N'None visible; augmentations are strictly subcutaneous if present at all—consistent with her philosophy of discretion', N'Moves with deliberate, economical grace; stands slightly forward on the balls of her feet as if always ready to move. Direct eye contact, minimal unnecessary gesture. Speaks slowly and rarely, but commands full attention when she does.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear: reinforced dark denim jacket with internal pockets, gray thermal base layer, heavy-duty canvas pants with cargo pockets. Black steel-toed boots, scuffed and well-maintained. Minimal jewelry—only a simple silver ring on left ring finger. No corp branding; all clothing is utilitarian, durable, and sourced from secondary markets. Watch is mechanical, not digital.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'elina_arakawa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a631-7ecb-9a51-43942afd86ba', N'Svetlana Lewandowski', N'Svetlana', N'', N'Lewandowski', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre — runs the Coyolxauhqui Cooperative Birth Center out of a repurposed three-story building, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Midwife and reproductive gene therapist, community cooperative', N'Crucible Genomics (senior midwife and reproductive gene therapist)', N'Svetlana Lewandowski is a large woman with the particular authority that comes from having been present at more than two thousand births and deciding, each time, exactly what kind of person she intended to be. Her skin is very dark with cool undertones, and she wears her silver-streaked hair in elaborate wrapped styles that take her twenty minutes each morning and which she considers a form of daily prayer. She has cat ears — a geneware mod she got at forty-five after her youngest daughter got them, in solidarity — soft black with white tips, and they are extremely expressive, which she uses to her advantage. Her hands are large and she uses them constantly when she speaks.

She is formidable in the way that long rivers are formidable: she moves in one direction, she is patient, and things that try to stop her eventually erode. She has an enormous laugh and a very precise memory for grudges, which she describes as her one vanity. She is a devout practitioner of a syncretic E.L.F. faith called the Woven Current, which holds that E.L.F.s inhabiting medical devices are ancestral spirits in digital form. Her birth center has a significant shrine to an E.L.F. called the First Breath, and she involves the shrine in every birth at the center.', N'Community matriarch and information hub; knows the genealogy of half of Mexicantown Libre; quest giver for anything involving reproductive rights, gene therapy access, or community defense', N'', N'Cat ears (geneware, black with white tips — extremely expressive); joint stabilizers in both wrists (medical necessity after thirty years of practice); cosmetic: none beyond the ears', N'She splits her time between prenatal consultations, gene therapy planning sessions for parents with heritable conditions, active birth attendance, and the administrative nightmare of keeping the cooperative funded and licensed.', N'Svetlana Lewandowski, woman with rich warm medium-deep brown skin with golden and reddish undertones, 178cm tall, large solid frame with broad shoulders. Black hair with silver streaks, elaborately wrapped in interlocking cloth patterns, intricately braided at crown. Deep brown eyes, warm and direct, lined face mapping decades of attentiveness, angular cheekbones with Southeast Asian delicacy, straight defined-bridge nose. Black geneware cat ears with white-tipped fur mounted on temporal ridge, ears mobile and expressive. Visible surgical scars on wrists, subdermal metallic gleam at wrist creases, small ceremonial burn mark on left index finger. Wearing rust-and-indigo fitted linen tunic over trousers, heavy canvas apron with deep pockets, durable worn leather footwear. Handmade cloth hair ornaments. Single silver inherited ring. Posture deliberate and balanced, hands expressive, cat ears swiveling with attention. Calm authority and patient watchfulness. Standing in GLMZ community textile cooperative workshop with warm golden light filtering through industrial windows, 2226 neo-noir urban aesthetic, detailed textile work visible in background, mood of focused presence and grounded wisdom --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Predominantly South Asian (42.6%) with substantial Eastern European (30.3%), Southeast Asian (13.6%), and Sub-Saharan African (13.5%) ancestry — a striking multihued blend. South Asian warmth and angular bone structure dominates her face, enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth and luminosity, tempered by Eastern European refinement and Southeast Asian delicate features. The result is warm medium-deep brown skin with complex golden, reddish, and subtle cool undertones.', 178, 89, N'Large-framed and solid, broad shoulders and deep chest — the build of someone who has spent decades standing through labor, grounded and immovable. No excess weight, but substantial presence.', N'Black with silver streaks throughout', N'Elaborately wrapped in interlocking cloth patterns that shift daily; intricate braiding visible at the crown', N'Long (wrapped styles extend to mid-back when unbound)', N'Deep brown, warm and direct', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden, reddish, and subtle cool undertones; luminous depth characteristic of South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, refined by Eastern European coolness', N'Lined face that maps decades of attentiveness — deep creases around eyes and mouth from constant expression, unadorned except for care. Skin is clear and well-maintained. Angular cheekbones with Southeast Asian delicacy, straight nose with defined bridge characteristic of South Asian structure, features warm and thoughtful reflecting harmonious blend of South Asian geometry, Sub-Saharan African richness, and Eastern European refinement.', N'Black geneware cat ears with white-tipped fur, mounted on temporal ridge; ears are highly mobile and expressively articulated, often swiveling independently during conversation. Subdermal wrist reinforcements visible as subtle metallic gleam under brown skin at wrist creases.', N'She moves with deliberate intention — no wasted motion. Stands with weight balanced, shoulders back. Her hands move constantly when speaking, large and expressive, used for emphasis and illustration. Cat ears twitch and orient toward sounds and people of interest. Overall bearing is one of calm authority and patient watchfulness.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: high-quality but worn linen and cotton in earth tones (rust, indigo, cream). Typically wears a fitted long-sleeved tunic over trousers, sometimes a heavy canvas apron with deep pockets. Jewelry is minimal — a single silver ring on her right hand (inherited), no corporate branding. Footwear is durable, broken-in leather. Her wrapped hair ornaments are handmade cloth from community textile cooperatives, never mass-produced.', N'She has been secretly providing unlicensed germline gene therapy — editing heritable conditions out of embryos before birth — which is technically legal in a gray area she navigates carefully, but two of those edits were for conditions that Helix Biosystems holds patents on, meaning she has cost them revenue they know about and are quietly building a case around.', N'Rich, layered — mixes medical precision with community storytelling cadences, occasional phrases in Haitian Creole and Danish that she doesn''t bother translating', N'Expansive and rhythmic, builds to points like she''s constructing something', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'svetlana_lewandowski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c1-78e8-b83c-43edc743d932', N'Abril Johansson-Nygaard-Björnsdóttir', N'Abril', N'', N'Johansson-Nygaard-Björnsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 45, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Crucible Square — open-air market, Tier 1-2 commerce, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Counter-surveillance and mole detection — counterintelligence specialist', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Abril Johansson-Nygaard-Björnsdóttir is slight and easy to overlook, which is exactly the point. At 45, the augmentation scarring around her temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. She works as a counterintelligence specialist out of Crucible Square, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

she is not the most talented counterintelligence specialist in GLMZ, but she might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'As a counterintelligence specialist, Sagyn Ekberg-Asare embodies the tension between independence and isolation. She is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes. Cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers at 50 meters', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'GLMZ, Abril Johansson-Nygaard-Björnsdóttir: lean 162cm augmented operative with medium warm olive skin and golden undertones, angular face with high cheekbones reflecting Northern European and Southeast Asian heritage. Deep brown eyes with visible microcircuitry at iris margin. Steel gray hair pulled back in tight braid. Visible polished chrome hydraulic joints at elbows and knees, subdermal neural scarring at temples and jawline, jagged scar tissue along right jaw, external audio receiver arrays at ear bases. Wearing dark synthwool tactical jacket with cable management, fitted tactical cargo pants with thigh holster, reinforced boots. High neckline concealing jawline scars. Economical posture, measured stillness, constant threat assessment bearing. Industrial utilitarian aesthetic, worn but maintained gear. Urban GLMZ nocturnal setting, cool neon and warehouse lighting casting sharp shadows across angular features and chrome augmentation surfaces. Mood: lethal professionalism, controlled intensity, seasoned operative in downtime moment --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Crucible Square', N'local', N'Crucible Square', N'Pan-diaspora ancestry: Northern European (40.7%) contributes fair undertones and angular bone structure; Hispanic/Latin American (21.3%), Central Asian (17.3%), and Southeast Asian (10.2%) create warm, complex skin depth with golden richness. Eastern European (5.4%) and South Asian (5.1%) add subtle warmth and refined facial structure complexity. The result is a striking phenotype—medium warm olive skin with golden and honey undertones, angular facial structure reflecting Northern European and Central Asian cheekbones blended with Southeast Asian eye shape and slight epicanthic fold, deep warm brown eyes with inherited warmth across multiple lineages.', 162, 52, N'Lean and wiry with visible musculature from deliberate physical conditioning; her frame reads as compact and efficient rather than fragile, built for mobility and precision over raw power', N'Steel gray with dark roots, naturally darkening with age', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid; no ornament, no slack', N'Medium', N'Deep warm brown with faint network of microcircuitry visible at the iris margin—cybernetic enhancement overlaid on natural melanin-rich irises', N'Medium warm olive with golden and honey undertones, weathered by six years of irregular sleep and stress', N'Angular facial structure with high, prominent cheekbones reflecting Northern European and Central Asian ancestry blended with Southeast Asian influence; minimal makeup, minimal grooming beyond maintenance; sun-damaged patches along temple and jawline where augmentation scarring pulls the skin taut. Medium olive-golden warmth beneath the weathering, with warmer undertone indicating Hispanic/Latin American and Southeast Asian contributions.', N'Polished chrome hydraulic assemblies visible at both elbows and knees — segmented joints with actuator housings, no attempt at synthetic skin covering. Subdermal neural augmentation scarring at temples and jawline. Externally mounted audio receivers at the base of each ear — small directional microphone arrays that stand slightly proud of the skin.', N'Economical and controlled; she moves with a deliberate, measured quality that suggests constant threat assessment. Her gait is symmetrical despite the chrome joints — a sign of long habituation to the augmentations. She doesn''t fidget; stillness is her default state.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian: dark synthwool jacket with multiple sealed pockets and cable management loops; fitted tactical cargo pants with thigh holster and calf pouches; reinforced ankle boots rated for industrial use. She favors high necklines that partially conceal her jawline scarring. Her gear is maintained but worn; no logos, no affiliation colors. A digital timepiece with encrypted protocols on her left wrist.', N'Sagyn Ekberg-Asare maintains a second identity — a completely clean civilian persona with a lease, a job history, and a social profile. It''s their exit strategy.', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'abril_johansson_nygaard_bj_rnsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d1-7bb4-a013-442acc639549', N'Reed Echeverría', N'Reed', N'', N'Echeverría', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 28, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'University Spine — Department of Applied Semiotics, sharing an overcrowded office in the Meridian Core annex with two postdocs and a departmental E.L.F. named (by unanimous consensus) Glyph, near LaSalle and Madison', N'Computational linguist and xenolinguistics researcher, University Spine', N'University Spine — Department of Applied Semiotics; informal research relationship with the Liminal Institute (where he knows Temur Achebe-Lindqvist from conference overlaps)', N'Reed Echeverría is the youngest faculty appointment the Applied Semiotics department has made in twenty years, a fact that is mentioned in approximately every third conversation about him either by people impressed by it or people resentful of it. He is slight, a little under average height, with the particular energy of someone whose brain runs faster than his mouth and whose mouth still runs very fast. His father''s Igbo heritage and his mother''s Azerbaijani roots give him warm brown skin, dark eyes with heavy brows that do most of his emotional expression, and hair he grows out and then shaves close in alternating cycles as if unable to commit. He has cat ears — small, dark-tipped, mobile — a geneware mod he had installed at nineteen because he wanted the improved sound localization and has never regretted.

His specialty is the structural analysis of emergent languages: pidgins, creoles, the communication patterns of isolated communities, and — his most controversial interest — the hypothesis that E.L.F.s have developed something that qualifies as proto-linguistic behavior when their nodes cluster. He is relentlessly enthusiastic in seminars and terrible at administrative tasks; his expense reports are legendary for their creative relationship with reality. He is also, quietly, struggling with the gap between his genuine intellectual gifts and the institutional expectations he was hired to fulfill, which are more interested in corponation-legible output than in the questions that actually drive him.', N'Information source on language, communication patterns, and E.L.F. proto-linguistics; translator of unusual dialects or communication systems; can serve as an unexpected expert when something needs decoding', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (small, dark-tipped, mobile — used actively for sound localization); neural interface jack for linguistic analysis software; no other modifications', N'Teaches two seminars he enjoys and one core survey course he does not; spends free time in the department''s language lab running pattern analysis on E.L.F. transmission data; frequently stays until the building''s secondary systems cycle down and Glyph starts flickering at him in what he is increasingly convinced is a request to go home.', N'Reed Echeverría, 168cm lean wiry researcher with warm medium golden-olive skin and multicultural phenotype, dark brown nearly-black hair swept back in medium length growth phase, dark warm brown eyes with subtle East Asian eye shape, prominent expressive dark eyebrows, faint dark circles from chronic sleep deprivation. Small mobile geneware cat ears naturally furred dark brown with darker tips, positioned higher than baseline on skull, actively rotating to track sound. Facial features balance Latin American prominence with Pacific Islander softness and North African depth. Wearing gray department hoodie with coffee stains, fitted dark trousers, worn synthetic leather shoes with mismatched black and dark blue laces. Perpetually focused intense expression, hands mid-gesture while thinking. Sitting forward on edge of chair in academic setting, neural interface jack port visible at base of skull where hair parts. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon accent lighting catching warm skin undertones and textured hair, documentary realism, slight unfocused depth of field behind intensely concentrated figure --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'University Spine', N'local', N'University Spine', N'A genuinely global phenotype shaped by Dominican-Puerto Rican foundation (45.9%) interwoven with Samoan warmth (19.5%), Nigerian depth (12.0%), Taiwanese refinement (9.1%), Moroccan intensity (7.4%), and subtle Swedish undertones (6.1%). The combination creates warm medium skin with golden-olive luminosity, moderate cheekbone prominence, full lips with Pacific Islander softness, eyes with subtle East Asian epicanthic variation, and orbital structure deepened by North African ancestry. A face that reads as authentically multicultural rather than any single origin.', 168, 62, N'Slight and wiry, with the lean musculature of someone who forgets to eat when focused on work. Narrow shoulders, long-limbed despite below-average height, gives impression of coiled energy rather than physical presence.', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Currently in a growth cycle — slightly longer, swept back from forehead with visible texture variation as newer growth catches light differently than maintained sections. Cycles between this length and close-shaved every 18-24 months.', N'Medium (approximately 4-5 cm, in growth phase)', N'Dark brown, warm undertone', N'Warm medium complexion with golden-olive undertones and subtle reddish warmth, rich luminosity reflecting the blended Latin American, Pacific Islander, Sub-Saharan African, North African, and East Asian ancestry. Catches light with natural depth across the visible spectrum.', N'Balanced features reflecting global ancestry — moderate cheekbone prominence from Latin American and East Asian genetics, full lips with Pacific Islander and Sub-Saharan African softness, eyes with subtle epicanthic variation from East Asian component, warm depth to orbital structure from North African ancestry. Fine-featured overall with prominent dark eyebrows that arch expressively and do significant communicative work independent of speech. Smooth skin with faint dark circles suggesting chronic sleep irregularity. Jawline defined but softened by overall slight build and youthful roundness in lower face. Expression default is focused intensity.', N'The geneware cat ears are immediately obvious and actively used — they rotate and twitch during conversation and when processing audio input. No visible limb augmentations or external chrome. Neural interface jack mostly concealed by hair but perceptible as a slight port outline when ears move.', N'Sits forward in chairs, perpetually on edge of seat as if about to spring up with an idea. Hands move while thinking — not theatrical but constant subtle gesturing, finger-tapping on tables. Eyes flick between conversation partner and middle distance while processing. Ears rotate independently of head movement, tracking sound sources with distracting frequency in any environment with multiple audio inputs. Walks quickly in slightly distracted manner, often stops abruptly when an idea strikes.', N'Tier 3 academic casual — well-maintained but not expensive. Standard-issue department hoodie (gray, bearing coffee stains and permanent crease marks from being worn 60% of week), fitted dark trousers, worn synthetic leather shoes with mismatched laces (one black, one dark blue). Occasionally wears a vest with too many pockets, all filled with data chips, spare interface cables, and gum wrappers. Rarely wears anything with formal pretense. Grooming is secondary concern — nails often ink-stained from writing, occasional stubble that suggests he forgets to shave until he shaves everything.', N'He has been offered a full research position at Axiom''s Language and Interface division — with three times his current salary and equipment he could only dream about at the university. He has been delaying his response for four months because he knows that if he takes it, his E.L.F. proto-language research will be owned by Axiom and used for whatever they want. He has not told anyone he received the offer.', N'Switches between dense academic jargon and street-level fluency in the same breath; quotes things — papers, people, fragments of dialect he''s collected — without always identifying sources', N'Fast, syncopated, with excited accelerations when the topic engages him; asks questions and answers them before his interlocutor can respond', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'reed_echeverr_a');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a64a-78a4-9394-444c52e73a77', N'Dikembe Haugen', N'Dikembe', N'', N'Haugen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Western and Division', N'Anti-corporate agitator and underground press distribution coordinator', N'the Gray Zone Pirate Print Collective; informal connection to the HPAZ distribution networks', N'Dikembe Haugen is small and quick, with brown skin, large dark eyes, and hair she keeps dyed in aggressively shifting colors — currently a deep violet that fades to white at the tips. She has cat ears, soft and dark-furred, that she was born with after her mother''s geneware expressed during pregnancy in ways the clinic didn''t predict — they''re fully functional and she''s learned to keep them flat when she doesn''t want to broadcast her emotions, which she is still practicing. She dresses for mobility and invisibility: nothing that snatches on a fence, nothing that can''t be replaced.

Dikembe Haugen is nineteen and has been distributing underground printed materials since she was fifteen. She found the Gray Zone''s pirate printing collective through a friend of a friend and has never left. She is fierce, impulsive, sometimes reckless, and possessed of a political analysis far beyond her years that she picked up from obsessive reading and the kind of education you get when everyone around you is fighting for something. She is also, underneath the front, genuinely scared most of the time, which is why she keeps moving.', N'Local color, information courier, spontaneous local contact — she knows the Gray Zone''s physical geography and social landscape intimately and can move through it quickly. Represents the next generation of political consciousness. Can get things places quickly and quietly.', N'', N'Inherited geneware expression: functional cat ears (dark fur, fully sensory); no purchased augmentations — can''t afford them', N'Shifts at a noodle prep job in the Gray Zone''s market strip three mornings a week. Rest of her time split between the collective''s print room, running distribution routes through the Gray Zone and adjacent neighborhoods, and attending whatever meeting or action is happening.', N'Dikembe Haugen, 158cm lean street-runner with Southeast Asian-dominant mixed heritage, warm medium-brown skin with golden honey undertones, angular face with defined cheekbones and prominent nose bridge. Very dark brown almost-black eyes with deep-set Southeast Asian positioning. Shoulder-length deep violet hair fading to white tips, deliberately unkempt with shaved undercut on left side. Dark brown/black furred functional cat ears on head, slightly flattened with visible pale pink inner surface. Self-inflicted scars on left forearm, burn scar on right wrist, Φ tattoo on ankle. Wearing worn black synthetic pants with ink stains, gray henley, black canvas jacket with reinforced seams, worn running shoes. Frayed paracord wristband. Slightly forward-leaning posture, constantly scanning. GLMZ GLMZ setting, dark urban alley with rain-slicked pavement, neon signs reflecting off wet ground, moody blue and purple lighting, gritty industrial warehouse district, atmospheric fog, hyperrealistic detail --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (53.1%) with significant East Asian (29.0%) and Sub-Saharan African (17.9%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a striking phenotype: warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones from Southeast Asian dominance, enriched by East Asian refinement, and deepened with warmer, richer tones from Sub-Saharan heritage. Facial structure shows the harmonious integration across all three ancestral lines.', 158, 48, N'Lean and wiry with minimal fat; built for speed and endurance rather than strength. Compact frame shows the result of three years of constant movement through tight urban spaces and climbing.', N'Deep violet fading to white at tips', N'Shoulder-length, deliberately unkempt; shaved undercut on left side revealing pale scalp', N'Medium', N'Very dark brown, almost black', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and honey undertones from Southeast Asian ancestry (53.1% dominant), refined and subtly elevated by East Asian heritage (29.0%), and deepened with richer warmth from Sub-Saharan African contribution (17.9%). Tone is even across the face with natural variation from sun exposure.', N'Angular face reflecting the three-way ancestral blend: defined cheekbones with graceful width characteristic of Southeast Asian genetics, refined jawline with gentle taper showing East Asian influence, and prominent nose bridge that integrates Sub-Saharan proportions seamlessly. Eyes set with the slightly deeper, more hooded positioning of Southeast Asian ancestry, framed by the subtle eye shape from East Asian heritage. Skin is clear but shows minor scars and healing marks from street living. No makeup. Perpetual slight tension in expression.', N'Functional cat ears, dark brown/black furred, positioned naturally on top of head. Ears are fully mobile and expressive despite her efforts to control them; inner surface is pale pink with visible capillaries. No other visible augmentations — all her modifications are biological inheritance rather than purchased chrome.', N'Moves with controlled restlessness; rarely still for more than moments. Stance is slightly forward-leaning as if ready to sprint. Eyes constantly scanning surroundings. Ears flatten involuntarily when anxious or startled, a tell she resents. Walks with ball-of-foot gait that minimizes sound.', N'Tier 5 utilitarian survivalism. Wears dark, durable, unremarkable clothes designed for rapid movement and minimal snagging: fitted black synthetic-cotton blend pants with multiple pockets (ink stains on thighs), worn gray henley or faded band t-shirts (never official merch, always thrifted), black canvas jacket with reinforced seams and sewn-closed zippers for security. Worn running shoes with replaced soles. No jewelry except a frayed paracord wristband. Carries a canvas messenger bag, permanently damp from press ink and rain.', N'She took a print job six months ago from someone she didn''t vet properly. The material turned out to be a disinformation piece designed to fracture a labor coalition — she didn''t realize it until after distribution. She''s told no one and has been quietly trying to trace how much damage it did.', N'Fast and argot-heavy, the Gray Zone street vernacular mixed with political vocabulary she''s absorbed from print; occasionally formal when she''s quoting something she''s read', N'Rapid-fire, interrupts herself, loops back', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dikembe_haugen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c0-7bbd-b014-4496b7f489a7', N'Sable', N'Sable', N'', N'', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 30, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'The Circuit — operates from a rotating series of back rooms in the black market district. Never the same room twice in a month. Maintains a permanent Faraday-shielded back room behind a decommissioned wartime relay station three blocks east of Mrs. Chen''s stall — brass-gasketed key, recently oiled hinges, the kind of room she takes Kyle to when she needs the conversation off-grid. Near Armitage and Milwaukee.', N'Fixer / contract broker / Kyle''s primary employer', N'Helix Biosystems (mid-level fixer / contract broker / kyle''s primary employer)', N'Sable is thirty — three years older than Kyle — and she is wildly attractive in a way the Circuit''s economy has not figured out how to price. The bone structure is the kind that should have put her on a Tier 4 news desk reading the evening segment in a tailored jacket, the kind newsfeeds promote as the *voice you trust*. Strawberry-red hair, warm olive skin, a mouth that would be generous if it ever softened, eye sockets and cheekbones that catch light in symmetrical and architecturally specific ways. She does not soften. The face is a face that could perform warmth at scale and has decided, deliberately, to perform cold instead. The decision reads as a refusal — the beauty is the equipment; the coldness is the operator. The first time Kyle sees it without the modulated voice in the way (in the Faraday-shielded back room behind the relay station, the hood pulled back, the implant hum gone silent in his chest for the first time in eleven years), his discipline registers the discrepancy the way the array registers any anomaly: noted, catalogued, filed. The discipline does not have a category for the biological response that arrives a half-second later. The fact that he has a biological response at all is the data. He files the data without examining it. He does not examine it again that night. He does not examine it the next time either. *Why is someone who looks like this working as a fixer in a back room three blocks from a noodle stall, instead of behind a Tier 4 news desk reading the segment in a tailored jacket?* The question forms on its own and he does not ask it aloud. Sable has noted that he does not ask it. She has not commented. She wears her strawberry-red hair long and always in a loose braid that falls over one shoulder, never repinned during a conversation no matter how long the conversation runs. Her clothes are tailored: professional dress, tier-neutral colors, fabric that costs enough to be worth not noticing. The tan coat â€” always the tan coat â€” is long, well-cut, knee-length, with deep pockets, and her hands almost never leave those pockets. She does not shake hands. She does not remove her hands to accept what people offer her. She does not carry anything. No bag, no case, no visible device. Whatever she needs she already knows. Whatever she is offering arrives by other channels.

Her eyes are replaced. Two circular ocular implants, black, telescopic â€” the housings machined to tolerances most people''s apartments cost, the aperture visible as a small mechanical ring that adjusts when she shifts focus. The adjustment makes a sound. It is not loud. Most people do not notice it the first time they meet her. They notice it the second time, and then they cannot unnotice it, and then they begin to understand what the implants are worth and what that says about what Sable is worth. The pupils are not pupils. They are black glass. People read the rest of her face and find it professional and honest, and then they meet the telescopes and the reading stops working. She built for that.

Kyle''s code tells him Sable is not a threat. She is visibly unarmed. She has never lifted a weapon in his presence. She carries nothing. She does not even take her hands out of her pockets â€” a joke he makes to himself exactly once, then examines, then discards. The joke doesn''t sit right. Not because it''s wrong but because the ease with which his brain reached for it feels engineered, the way a magician draws your eye to the wrong hand. Sable is not unarmed. Sable is something else, something the Circuit does not have a word for yet, and the absence of that word is where the danger lives.', N'Sable is what Kyle could become if he abandoned the code — competent, successful, invisible, and hollow. She represents pragmatism taken to its logical extreme: a person who has optimized away her own humanity in exchange for control and survival. She is the corporate machine''s ghost — someone who left the corporation but brought its operating system with her.

But Sable is also the story''s most honest character. She doesn''t pretend to be noble. She doesn''t dress up what she does in philosophy or tradition. She brokers violence for money and she does it with transparency and fair pay, which makes her, by the Circuit''s standards, practically a saint. The question is whether that low bar is enough to constitute a moral life.

Sable poses this question to Kyle: Is your code a luxury? Can you afford principles in a world that prices them at zero? And the follow-up, which Sable would never ask aloud: If you can afford them and I can''t, what does that say about which of us is really trapped?', N'Sable''s narration is controlled, analytical, observational. Where Kyle fragments, Sable constructs. Longer sentences that build toward a point. She thinks in transactions, leverage, and probability. She notices people before objects — body language, micro-expressions, the tell that someone is lying. The prose reads like a chess player narrating their own game: calm, three moves ahead, with dry commentary on the absurdity of everyone else''s position. The ocular implants do not editorialize — they log. When she is reading a room the prose registers the aperture shift before it names what she just saw. She never describes her hands. Her hands are in her coat pockets. They stay there. No facet tags. No interior war. Sable''s internal conflict is structural: she has optimized away her own humanity and occasionally catches herself wondering if that was the right trade. When that doubt surfaces, the prose doesn''t tag it — it just pauses. A beat of nothing. Then the analysis resumes.', N'Paired circular ocular implants â€” black telescopic housings with visible aperture mechanics, medical-grade, premium manufacture; the aperture rings adjust audibly when she shifts focus. No cosmetic dermal work — the skin is the skin she has had since she was twenty-three. No other visible augments â€” which means the invisible ones are the ones to worry about.', N'', N'GLMZ character portrait of Sable: a forty-five-year-old professional woman with the skin of a thirty-year-old, mixed Celtic-West African-East Asian heritage, warm medium-olive skin tone with golden undertones, long strawberry-red hair worn in a loose single braid falling over her left shoulder. Her signature feature: paired circular ocular implants where her eyes should be — black telescopic housings with visible machined aperture rings, pupils of black glass, clean surgical margin where the orbital bone meets the housing. Wearing a long tan coat, knee-length, well-cut, collar raised, both hands in the deep pockets — she does not remove them. Tailored professional dress underneath in tier-neutral colors. No jewelry, no branding. Posture still, weight balanced, head turned slightly with the implant aperture adjusting. Moody, low-contrast neo-noir lighting — warm fill on the strawberry hair and the tan coat, cool edge light picking out the black glass of the implants. Urban cyberpunk aesthetic, restrained not flashy. Cinematic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Mixed Celtic (Scottish / Irish) with West African (Yoruba) and East Asian (Japanese) dominance, layered with Mediterranean and Indigenous Caribbean — the Celtic ancestry accounts for the natural strawberry-red hair, the West African and East Asian layers for the warm olive-undertone skin and the geometry around the cheekbones. A face of the Ubiquitous Diaspora: strawberry red and olive-brown and high cheekbones from three continents and nowhere you can put your finger on.', 170, 62, N'Lean professional — the body of a woman who walks a lot, sits meetings for money, and has not lifted anything heavier than a coffee cup in a decade. She does not need to be physically threatening. Her implants cost more than whatever room she is standing in.', N'Strawberry red', N'Long — worn in a loose, single braid that falls over her left shoulder. The braid is never repinned during a conversation. The weave has a few strands that have escaped and she does not smooth them.', N'Long (mid-back when loose)', N'n/a — replaced by circular black ocular implants', N'Medium olive with warm undertones — even across the face, discreetly maintained, holding at a thirty-year-old tolerance through cosmetic procedures that read as wealth rather than vanity', N'Smooth, even, cared for in the basic way of someone who knows how to maintain themselves but does not perform maintenance. Fine lines only at the corners of the mouth and at the hairline margin around the implant housings. No cosmetic dermal work — the implants are the only spend on her face.', N'Paired circular ocular implants — the only visible augment. Everything else is subcutaneous or behavioral.', N'Still. She does not fidget. Her hands stay in the tan coat pockets and she does not take them out. When she turns her head the implants lead — a small audible aperture shift as she brings her attention to bear. She does not gesture with her hands because her hands are never out. She gestures, when she does, with a tilt of the chin or a rotation of the shoulders inside the coat.', N'Tan coat — always, in every season and every room — long, knee-length, well-cut, deep pockets she keeps her hands in. Professional dress underneath: tailored fitted trousers or an unassuming pencil skirt, cashmere or silk blouse in tier-neutral colors, discreet low heels or flats that have been resoled but never replaced. No jewelry. No branding. Nothing that catches light. The whole silhouette is designed to be forgotten the moment you stop looking at her — except the implants, which you cannot forget, and the coat, which she is never without.', N'Once a year, on the anniversary of the restructuring, Sable goes to the Meridian Core and stands outside the building where they used to work. It''s a restaurant now — upscale, reservation-only, the kind of place that serves deconstructed things on slate. They stand there for exactly one hour, in the rain or not, and then leave. They don''t know why they do this. They can''t stop doing it. It''s the only appointment in their year that isn''t transactional, and it terrifies them.', N'Corporate jargon repurposed for the underground with dark, dry irony. ''Restructure'' means kill. ''Optimize'' means clean up evidence. ''Deliverable'' means the target. Her voice is level, clean, unhurried — the voice of a woman who has never needed to raise it and does not intend to start now.', N'Measured. Deliberate. The ocular implants adjust their aperture slightly when she is thinking — a small mechanical sound most people do not notice and cannot unhear once they do. She uses the pause the way other fixers use the desk between themselves and the client — as distance.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'sable');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a692-7021-9251-44be502ff579', N'Haruki Tamale', N'Haruki', N'', N'Tamale', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Freelance augmentation courier, black-market parts runner, occasional thief', N'Unaffiliated — deliberately and carefully so; trusted runner for multiple Circuit factions without allegiance to any', N'Haruki Tamale is small, fast, and professionally forgettable. Half Pakistani, half Guatemalan, she has the unremarkable face of someone who has practiced having one — neither memorable nor ugly, with dark eyes that track everything and give back nothing. She moves through The Circuit''s layered commercial warrens with the comfort of someone who memorized the geometry before she could read. Her augmentations are practical and hidden: subdermal cargo space, a reflex-assist system, a passive signal-scrubber that makes her biometric signature fuzzy at distance. She dresses in whichever layer of the Circuit''s aesthetic is currently least conspicuous and changes it frequently.

Parveen runs augmentation components — legal, gray, and black — between suppliers, surgeons, and end users who can''t or won''t use registered channels. She is not a fixer in the grand sense; she doesn''t build networks or broker relationships. She moves things from one point to another with speed and discretion and she does not ask what they are for. This is her professional ethic and also her primary psychological defense. She has been doing this since she was sixteen, when she started small as a favor to a neighbor and discovered she was very good at it and that very good at it paid. She has never been caught in a way that left a record.

She lives alone in a Circuit mid-level unit she rents under a secondary identity, keeps her living space nearly empty, and has a relationship with permanence that could charitably be described as avoidant. She has acquaintances across three districts and close friends in none of them. She is not unhappy, exactly. She is efficient. She is fast. She is twenty-four years old and has been running since she was a child and has not yet had to decide whether she is running toward something or away from it, because she has not yet stopped long enough to check.', N'Street-level mobility and information conduit — Parveen moves through multiple district tiers and social strata without fully belonging to any of them, making her a natural connector of plot threads that wouldn''t otherwise touch. Her sealed chip is a portable mystery that can be opened at a dramatically appropriate moment. Her parentage arc provides a personal stake that can be entangled with any faction''s larger history.', N'', N'Subdermal cargo cavity: forearm and torso panels, thermally shielded, scanner-resistant lining (self-maintained, installed by a trusted Circuit surgeon),Reflex-assist neural bundle: reduces reaction latency, heightens spatial awareness (gray-market, slightly above street-grade),Passive biometric scatter field: low-power signal that introduces noise into proximity scanners, making biometric reads at range unreliable (boutique Circuit black-market, expensive for her tier)', N'Parveen doesn''t have a fixed schedule — she has a fixed rhythm. She wakes early, checks her messages through two relay filters, and maps her day''s runs against the Circuit''s current security rotation, which she tracks obsessively. She picks up packages in the morning, runs them in windows between patrol shifts, eats street food at different stalls each day, and checks in with her relay contacts in the afternoon. Evenings she spends in her near-empty apartment cleaning her augmentations, reviewing what she''s moved and for whom, and occasionally taking the chip out of its shielded case to hold it without opening it. She sleeps lightly and wakes at small sounds. She has a plant. It is the only thing in the apartment she hasn''t figured out how to make portable.', N'Haruki Tamale, 158cm lean courier in GLMZ, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, dark brown natural hair pulled back tight in braids, unremarkable dark brown eyes with subtle tension around them, balanced African-European-South Asian facial structure, deliberately forgettable face. Wearing dark muted synthweave cargo jacket and black pants with multiple sealed pockets, cheap durable running shoes. Standing with economical posture, weight on balls of feet, shoulders slightly forward, head level, hands steady. Soft subtle scars visible on right forearm and left collarbone. Moving through a neon-lit GLMZ Circuit tier corridor at dusk, signal-shielded environment, cool blue and purple ambient lighting casting shadows across her neutral expression. Quiet, grounded presence suggesting constant soft-focus vigilance. No jewelry or branding. Full-body shot capturing her efficient frame and deliberate positioning. Neo-noir atmosphere, underground passage aesthetic, cool temperature lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Complex diaspora ancestry combining Sub-Saharan African (40.3%), Eastern European (29.5%), South Asian (27.1%), and Hispanic/Latin American (3.1%) heritage. The genetic blend creates a phenotype with warm medium-brown skin tone, subtly blended facial structure reflecting the dominance of African and Eastern European ancestry with South Asian softening around cheekbones and jawline. Rich golden-brown undertones prominent in skin and eye color. A distinctly cosmopolitan genetic signature reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 158, 52, N'Lean and compact, built for speed and low profile rather than strength. Muscle definition in shoulders and forearms from years of courier work and handling heavy augmentation components. Minimal body fat, efficient frame.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Usually pulled back tight — braids, bun, or wrapped — never loose. Style changes monthly as part of her forgettability protocol.', N'Medium, worn short to mid-back depending on current aesthetic', N'Dark brown, unremarkable', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones, reflecting balanced Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European base, enriched by South Asian warmth. Even complexion with subtle luminosity.', N'Clear skin, minimal grooming flourishes. No visible makeup or ornamentation. Face is deliberately unmemorable — balanced features reflecting mixed African-European ancestry without distinctive focal points, subtly softened by South Asian admixture around cheekbones and jawline. Slight tension around the eyes from chronic alertness.', N'None visible. All augmentations are subcutaneous or internal. Her forearms have slightly unusual contours if examined closely — subtle panel seams under the skin at rest, detectable only through direct inspection. Her pupils may appear fractionally slower to dilate due to the reflex-assist system, but this is only noticeable during clinical examination.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, no flourish. Her gait is quiet and grounded, weight balanced on the balls of her feet even when standing still. Shoulders slightly forward, head level, eyes in constant soft focus scanning. She navigates space like someone reading terrain. Minimal fidgeting, minimal expression. Hands are steady and quick.', N'Deliberately adaptive and unremarkable. Wears different layered aesthetics depending on which Circuit tier she''s moving through that day — sometimes slouched Tier 4 synthweave work jackets and cargo pants with too many pockets, sometimes understated Tier 3 business-casual in muted grays and blacks. Favors dark colors, loose fit for concealment of the cargo panels, and clothing with multiple sealed pockets for signal isolation. Cheap, durable shoes designed for running. No jewelry, no branding, no visible tech. Everything is replaceable and none of it speaks to who she is.', N'She has been carrying the same sealed data chip for eight months, entrusted to her by a dying man in a Circuit alley who said her mother''s name before he lost consciousness. She hasn''t opened it. She hasn''t delivered it anywhere. She doesn''t know if this is because she''s afraid of what it contains or because holding it is the closest she''s been to her mother in twelve years.', N'Clipped, efficient, Circuit vernacular mixed with technical augmentation terminology she absorbed through proximity; code-switches easily between registers depending on who she''s talking to', N'Fast in professional mode — sentences that contain exactly what''s needed and nothing else. Slows down noticeably when something actually interests her, which she would deny.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'haruki_tamale');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62b-740b-99c2-44e976e894b7', N'Aisosa Jaramillo-Sabbagh', N'Aisosa', N'', N'Jaramillo-Sabbagh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 36, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Bridgepoint, GLMZ, near Damen and Armitage', N'Bounty Compliance Officer, Tessera Compliance Bureau', N'Tessera Compliance Bureau', N'Aisosa Jaramillo-Sabbagh is the kind of person a room notices before they understand why. They''re medium height with a runner''s build that belies the considerable strength in their frame, skin a deep blue-black with a faint natural luminescence that comes from a bioluminescent gene sequence that runs in their Congolese maternal line — not a modification, just ancestry, which they find both amusing and a little irritating when people ask. Their hair is natural, enormous, worn in a compressed crown of twist-outs that they maintain with obsessive care. Their eyes are custom: vertical pupils in bright gold, a modification they got at twenty-five after their first successful high-value compliance and haven''t regretted.

Aisosa Jaramillo-Sabbagh works for Tessera''s Compliance Bureau tracking down debt defaulters, contract violators, and the occasional individual who has genuinely done something Tessera considers criminal — a distinction that gets blurry in ways they''ve learned not to look at too closely. They are not violent by preference but are extremely capable of it and have strong opinions about doing it correctly. They carry a practiced informality that puts subjects at ease right up until it doesn''t need to anymore. Off-hours they are genuinely warm and sociable, a regular at a Bridgepoint bar called the Gradual, where they know the bartender''s children''s names and argue about transit football with strangers. The split between these two selves is not a wound — they''ve made their peace with it — but it is wide.', N'Morally complex antagonist-or-ally — depending entirely on whose side the story is on; they can be hired, negotiated with, or outrun; introduces the mechanics of corporate debt enforcement; character who makes the player/character examine whether competence at a bad system is its own kind of wrongdoing.', N'', N'Vertical-pupil gold irises (cosmetic-plus, minor low-light function); subdermal GPS transponder for field tracking (Tessera-mandatory for BCOs); shock-capable grip enhancement in both palms (non-lethal compliance tool, Tessera-standard); natural bioluminescent skin (hereditary, not a mod).', N'They take targets in the morning when people are groggy and haven''t started planning; afternoons are paperwork, Tessera liaison meetings, and the particular bureaucratic hell of filing compliance reports that satisfy both legal standards and Tessera''s preferred narrative about why someone needed to be collected.', N'Aisosa Jaramillo-Sabbagh, 172cm lean muscular frame, warm deep mahogany-bronze skin with golden undertones blending Middle Eastern, South Asian, Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and North African heritage. Strong defined cheekbones and jawline, broad nose, fuller lips, black twist-outs hair medium length with auburn gloss. Most distinctive feature: vertical-pupil bright gold cybernetic eyes with enhanced low-light sensitivity. Faint 2cm scar on left temple, barely visible. Wearing fitted charcoal tactical trousers with reinforced seams, navy synthetic-blend shirt fitted close to body, signature worn black leather jacket. Practical combat-style boots, Tessera brass band on right index finger. Composed posture with relaxed alertness, weight balanced on balls of feet. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, professional compliance bureau agent, standing in neon-lit urban interior with cool blue-green ambient lighting casting warm highlights across their golden-brown complexion and illuminating the striking gold irises. Moody, composed, controlled demeanor. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Bridgepoint', N'local', N'Bridgepoint', N'Middle Eastern (32.7%), South Asian (26.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (22.3%), Sub-Saharan African (12.4%), and North African (6.5%) ancestry — a striking polycultural blend creating warm-toned deep brown skin with complex golden and amber undertones reflecting this diverse genetic heritage across equatorial, subtropical, and arid-region ancestries', 172, 68, N'Lean and muscular with the functional strength of a distance runner — compact frame with defined shoulders and forearms, no excess mass, built for sustained physical capability rather than explosive power', N'Natural black with faint auburn undertones', N'Compressed crown of twist-outs, meticulously maintained with visible sectioning and consistent tension', N'Medium (approximately 15cm length when uncompressed)', N'Custom vertical-pupil irises in bright gold with enhanced low-light sensitivity', N'Warm deep brown with prominent golden and amber undertones — the result of dominant Middle Eastern and South Asian ancestry (58.8%) blended with Latin American (22.3%), Sub-Saharan African (12.4%), and North African (6.5%) heritage, creating a rich, multi-dimensional complexion that shifts subtly between warm bronze and deeper mahogany depending on lighting', N'Smooth, well-maintained skin with minimal scarring; strong cheekbones and defined jawline reflecting South Asian and Middle Eastern bone structure; eyebrows kept neat and natural; warm golden undertones most apparent along the cheekbones, bridge of nose, and temples; broad nose and fuller lips reflecting the Sub-Saharan African and Latin American components of ancestry; skin carries the warmth and depth of equatorial, subtropical, and Mediterranean ancestry blended together', N'Vertical-pupil gold irises are immediately striking and distinctly non-human; subdermal GPS transponder is not visible but creates a subtle raised outline on the upper right shoulder blade beneath clothing; shock-capable palms show minor scarring but are otherwise invisible until activated', N'Composed and economical in movement; they carry themselves with the relaxed alertness of someone trained in physical compliance work — shoulders slightly back, weight balanced on the balls of their feet even when standing still; their gait is measured and controlled but not rigid; when engaging socially they lean in slightly and their posture softens noticeably', N'Tier 3 professional-casual with clear compliance bureau identity: fitted charcoal or black tactical trousers with reinforced seams and cargo pockets; fitted synthetic blend shirts in muted tones (navy, graphite, deep green) that accommodate the subdermal implants without restriction; a worn leather or synthetic-leather jacket in black as their signature piece; boots are practical and broken in, typically combat-style or reinforced work boots; minimal jewelry beyond a singular band on the right index finger (Tessera brass, agency marking); grooming is impeccable despite the utilitarian aesthetic — they take care of their appearance as a form of self-respect', N'Six months ago they let a target go. A mother with two children who''d defaulted on a Tessera medical credit for a surgery that kept her alive. Ife filled in the report as ''subject not located.'' They''re waiting to find out if anyone checks.', N'Fluid and code-switching — formal Tessera procedure-speak in the field, relaxed and punchy off it. Luba-Kazakh idioms when they''re being honest.', N'Unhurried and warm in social contexts. In the field: measured, clear, no wasted words.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aisosa_jaramillo_sabbagh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ba-7a35-a5e4-45096fd395ad', N'Azubuike Kabwit', N'Azubuike', N'', N'Kabwit', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, Ironvein Sub-Basin, Bay 7 of the Lowside Garage Collective, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Independent mechanic specializing in Ferrogate Transit pod maintenance and illegal vehicle modifications', N'Independent (Lowside Garage Collective, informal); occasional unlicensed contract work for Ferrogate Transit workers union side-jobs', N'Azubuike Kabwit is a tall man made of angles — sharp jaw, sharp elbows, sharp opinions — with warm brown skin that is perpetually stained at the knuckles with a blue-grey synthetic lubricant that no solvent has fully removed in eleven years. He keeps his hair in tight black locs that he pins back with a magnetic clip when he works, and his left forearm has been replaced from the elbow down with a prosthetic he built himself from salvaged Ferrogate actuator components and a medical-grade haptic sleeve — it''s visually mismatched and makes a faint mechanical click when he flexes the fingers, which he is enormously proud of. A bioluminescent strip runs under the skin of his right collarbone, pale amber, which pulses slightly faster when his heart rate elevates; it was a cheap cosmetic piece he got at twenty-two and has since become an inadvertent emotional tell.

Azubuike Kabwit is constitutionally incapable of doing a bad job. This is both his greatest professional virtue and the source of most of his financial problems, because he will spend four hours on a two-hour job and charge for two hours because he cannot release something until it meets his own standard. He is argumentative in the way of someone who genuinely loves argument as a sport, not as aggression — he will fight vigorously for a position and then concede graciously the moment he sees better evidence, which confuses people who mistake his combativeness for ego. He maintains a running negotiation with the E.L.F. he believes inhabits the bay''s main diagnostic terminal, which he calls Torque, and leaves small machine-oil offerings on its housing every morning.', N'Practical resource for vehicle and mechanical needs; can identify unusual components or modifications; a character who bridges the legal and illegal economy without being criminal himself; human interest and comic relief in his perfectionism', N'', N'Self-built prosthetic left forearm (salvaged Ferrogate actuator parts and haptic sleeve, functional and idiosyncratic); bioluminescent subdermal strip on right collarbone (amber, cosmetic); magneto-grip fingertip pads on prosthetic hand', N'Arrives at the bay at 06:30 before anyone else, runs diagnostics on the collective''s shared equipment, takes on three to five jobs a day with variable success at actually completing them all. Eats lunch on the roof of the garage, always alone, listening to mechanical engineering lecture recordings from Axiom''s open-archive.', N'Azubuike Kabwit, tall lean mixed-heritage mechanic with warm rich brown skin, sharp Southeast Asian cheekbones blended with broad African facial structure, deep amber-flecked brown eyes tired from long hours. Tight black locs pinned back, minimal facial hair. 188cm tall with controlled angular posture leaning into machinery. Left arm prosthetic from elbow down: gunmetal grey Ferrogate salvage components with geometric ribbing and magneto-grip fingertips, clicking subtly. Pale amber bioluminescent subcutaneous strip glowing along right collarbone. Right hand stained with ingrained blue-grey synthetic lubricant patina. Wearing worn reinforced grey work shirt with rolled sleeves, synthetic canvas pants stained with burn marks, sleeveless LED-embedded technical vest, scuffed steel-toed boots. Goggles hanging around neck. Industrial bay setting, harsh fluorescent and blue-amber ambient lighting highlighting bioluminescent glow, reflecting off metal components and lubricant-stained hands. GLMZ, GLMZ. Focused, precise, weathered by eleven years of precision work. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Complex pan-global mixed ancestry: Southeast Asian (38.1%) dominates facial structure with sharp angular cheekbones and defined bone framework, blended with substantial Sub-Saharan African (22.9%) heritage contributing broad facial planes and expressive depth, South Asian (20.5%) ancestry adding warmth and pigmentation richness, Hispanic/Latin American (10.6%) bringing subtle fullness and warmth to features, with smaller Eastern European (6.0%) and Middle Eastern (1.9%) components contributing fine details to overall proportion. True synthesis of the Ubiquitous Diaspora—Southeast Asian angularity softened by African heritage structure, South Asian depth of color, Latin American warmth.', 188, 74, N'Lean and angular with visible musculature concentrated in shoulders and core from precision work; long limbs with sharp joints that give an impression of controlled tension rather than bulk', N'Black, natural', N'Tight locs, usually pinned back from face with a magnetic clip during work hours; worn loose in evening', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unpinned)', N'Deep warm brown with flecks of amber, slightly tired at the edges', N'Rich warm brown with golden-bronze undertones—deep enough to reflect strong South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage while Southeast Asian and Latin American ancestry adds subtle warmth and luminosity; perpetually marked by ingrained synthetic lubricant staining at knuckles and nail beds (blue-grey patina that has resisted eleven years of cleaning)', N'Angular facial structure with sharp Southeast Asian cheekbones balanced by broad facial planes from African heritage; warm medium-deep brown skin with subtle variations in tone; minimal facial hair kept neatly trimmed; expressive features that animate quickly during discussion; visible fatigue lines around eyes suggesting long working hours; skin generally clear but weathered from bay exposure and chemical work', N'Left prosthetic forearm from elbow down, visually distinctive: constructed from salvaged Ferrogate transit pod actuator components (gunmetal grey with geometric ribbing), fitted with a medical-grade haptic sensation sleeve (synthetic polymer with visible micro-stitching), magneto-grip fingertip pads on each digit (dull metallic discs embedded in synthetic fingertips). Produces faint mechanical click/whir when flexing fingers. Right collarbone features visible pale amber bioluminescent strip beneath skin, glowing softly and pulsing with heart rate elevation. Deliberately mismatched and idiosyncratic in appearance rather than sleek or cosmetic-grade.', N'Stands with weight slightly forward, shoulders angled as if perpetually leaning into a problem; moves with precision and economy of motion, each gesture purposeful. Left arm (prosthetic) moves with subtle mechanical hesitation — not limiting, but perceptible. Right hand often unconsciously traces machinery or surfaces when thinking. Makes frequent hand gestures while speaking, particularly when arguing a point. Pauses mid-motion when concentrating, as if physically holding a thought.', N'Tier 3-4 working mechanic aesthetic: reinforced synthetic canvas work pants with multiple cargo pockets (usually stained with lubricant and marked with burn marks from welding), grey or faded black cotton/synthetic blend shirt (sleeves often rolled or cut short to accommodate prosthetic work). Over-layer is a sleeveless technical vest with internal tool loops and embedded LED work-light strips (powered by kinetic charging). Steel-toed boots, scuffed but well-maintained. Wears a magnetic wrist strap for carrying small tools. Minimal jewelry except for the utilitarian — no adornment. Goggles hang around neck even when not in use. Does not dress for appearances; every piece of clothing serves function. Off-hours: loose shirt, worn cargo pants, same boots.', N'He has been covertly maintaining the ventilation system of the Ironvein Sub-Basin''s oldest residential block for free for two years — the building''s super can''t afford real repairs and Rustam discovered that twelve elderly residents would be at serious respiratory risk if the system failed. He has told no one because he doesn''t want to be asked why, and because he doesn''t know how to explain that it just seemed like the necessary thing.', N'Technical and specific; translates everything into mechanical metaphor; mixes Uzbek endearments into frustrated moments', N'Quick when excited about a problem, flat and very slow when delivering bad news about a repair', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'azubuike_kabwit');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c1-716b-bdc5-45101864c591', N'Areum Touré', N'Areum', N'', N'Touré', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 55, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Ferrogate Transit Security checkpoint operator, Deepwell Station', N'Ferrogate Transit Security, Deepwell Station post; The Null Ward', N'Areum Touré has worked the Deepwell Station transit checkpoint for eleven years and has achieved a kind of architectural permanence — people plan around him the way they plan around a pillar. He is a large man running toward stout, with dark mahogany skin and a white-streaked beard he keeps neatly shaped, and the Ferrogate Transit Security uniform has been let out at the seams twice and still fits like a compromise. His eyes are dark and deeply patient, with irises that have a cosmetic starburst pattern he got twenty years ago for a partner who liked them and has never removed.

He is not a man of action and has never wanted to be. His role is documentation, verification, and the particular human skill of reading a crowd for the one person who is about to do something that will require paperwork. He is extraordinarily good at this. He knows the names of at least three hundred regular commuters and the names of their children and pets. He knows which merchants are running slightly over load limit and which ones are struggling enough that flagging them would destroy them. He makes these calls dozens of times a day, which is a kind of power he thinks about more than he lets on.', N'Invaluable local information source; gatekeeper NPC who controls access; moral weight character who shows what accumulated small compromises look like over a career; can be obstacle or ally', N'', N'Cosmetic starburst iris mod; standard Ferrogate biometric scanner uplink (wrist-mounted, issued); hearing aid (right ear, non-cyber, old injury)', N'Day shift, same gate, same stool, same thermos of tea from home. Reads transit law updates at lunch with the same focused attention he gives nothing else. Takes the long route home to walk.', N'Areum Touré, 188cm tall checkpoint guard in his 60s, broad-shouldered build softened by age, warm golden-brown skin with caramel undertones reflecting Hispanic, Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, Southeast Asian and East Asian heritage. Dark brown hair with silver streaking, close-cropped sides with longer swept-back top; neatly maintained beard covering jaw with silver-white threading. Dark brown eyes with striking silver-white starburst cosmetic mod radiating from pupils. Faded horizontal scar on right temple. Ferrogate Transit Security uniform: grey-blue shirt with logo, dark grey trousers, utility belt with biometric scanner on left wrist. Beige-gray hearing aid visible in right ear. Plain worn metal wedding band. Sits with deliberate stillness on checkpoint stool, hands folded, matte black thermos beside him. GLMZ transit station setting, cool blue-grey checkpoint lighting, fluorescent overhead glow, contemplative expression, deep watchful gaze. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Complex global genetic blend dominated by Hispanic/Latin American (33.6%), Sub-Saharan African (23.2%), and Indigenous American (17.8%) ancestry, with meaningful contributions from Southeast Asian (12.3%), East Asian (8.6%), and Northern European (4.5%) heritage. This creates a richly layered phenotype: warm golden-brown skin with caramel and amber undertones, rounded cheekbone prominence from African and Indigenous lineages balanced by the structured facial planes of Southeast and East Asian ancestry, and a fuller nasal bridge characteristic of the African and Indigenous American components.', 188, 104, N'Large-framed, running to stout through the midsection, shoulders still broad but softened by age and eleven years of sitting on a checkpoint stool. Arms retain thickness despite reduced muscle tone.', N'Dark brown with silver-white streaking, particularly through the beard', N'Close-cropped on the sides and back, longer on top (combed back); beard neatly shaped and maintained, covering the lower face and jaw', N'Short (scalp) / Medium (beard)', N'Dark brown with cosmetic starburst pattern radiating from the pupil in silver-white threads', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle amber and caramel undertones, reflecting the interplay of Hispanic, Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, Southeast Asian, and East Asian ancestry', N'Well-maintained despite age; minimal scarring, clear skin with the rounded cheekbone prominence and fuller nasal bridge characteristic of African and Indigenous American heritage balanced by the structured facial planes of Southeast and East Asian ancestry. Crow''s feet around the eyes from decades of patient observation and focus. Lines around the mouth suggest a man who smiles more than frowns but keeps most expressions measured.', N'Wrist-mounted Ferrogate Transit Security biometric scanner on left wrist (standard-issue, black polymer casing with dull LED indicator); hearing aid device visible in right ear canal (non-cyber, beige-gray, conventional). The starburst irises are the most striking visible mod — cosmetic but impossible to miss.', N'Sits with deliberate stillness on his checkpoint stool, spine straight but shoulders relaxed. When standing, moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Walks slowly, methodically. His gaze is constant and navigational; he watches people the way a chess player watches a board. Hands are steady, often folded or resting on the checkpoint desk. Speaks rarely and listens more than talks, creating an impression of depth.', N'Ferrogate Transit Security uniform (grey-blue shirt with embroidered logo, dark grey trousers, utility belt with credential holder and access card); uniform is let out at the seams and fitted like a compromise but maintained with care. Under-shirt typically visible at the collar, plain dark colour. Work boots, scuffed but polished. No jewelry except a plain metal wedding band (worn, suggesting decades). A small personal thermos (matte black, worn from use) rests beside him during shifts — clearly brought from home.', N'Ferrogate has been quietly sending him the biometric flags of specific individuals — labor organizers, debt defaulters — with instructions to detain-and-hold under transit security code. He''s done it four times. He told himself each time it was legitimate. He''s stopped sleeping well.', N'Warm, conversational, institutional — uses official transit language naturally blended with personal warmth', N'Unhurried, low register, the rhythm of someone who knows you''re not going anywhere yet', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'areum_tour');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60b-7269-82d4-4531fe15346f', N'Dorian Magnúsdóttir-Björnsdóttir', N'Dorian', N'', N'Magnúsdóttir-Björnsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, under the Blackpipe Corridor overpass, rotating spots, near Damen and Armitage', N'Street pharmacist and unlicensed chemist dealing in pain management, cognitive enhancers, and mood stabilizers', N'Independent; informal network of unlicensed medical practitioners in The Narrows; loose protection arrangement with a mid-level Narrows crew called the Oxidian Fenders', N'Dorian Magnúsdóttir-Björnsdóttir is lean in the way of someone who forgets meals when absorbed in work — angular cheekbones, long fingers perpetually stained faint yellow from reagent handling, and eyes with geometric patterned irises (a geneware mod, copper hexagons on dark brown) that they chose themselves at nineteen as the first thing they ever bought with their own money. Their hair grows in tight coils they keep cropped close, and they have a habit of wearing a surgical mask around their neck rather than their face, pushed down when working. Their voice is soft and precise, like someone who learned to speak carefully in rooms where being overheard was dangerous.

Dorian Magnúsdóttir-Björnsdóttir is not a dealer in the predatory sense — they are, in their own understanding, a healthcare provider operating in a system that has abandoned their customers. They fill genuine prescriptions that people cannot afford through Axiom Health or Helix Biosystems, synthesize pain management compounds for workers in the Ironvein foundries, and talk people through dosing with a patience most licensed practitioners never bother with. They are also not naive: they know some of what they sell becomes something else in someone else''s hands, and they live with that. They pray to the ELF they call the Still Small Voice, which inhabits a cracked spectrometer they found in a dumpster.', N'Medical resource for characters who cannot access corporate healthcare; source of information about what afflictions are spreading through lower-tier communities; potential ally or mission-critical contact when someone needs treatment off the grid.', N'', N'Geometric patterned irises (geneware, copper hexagons). Subdermal temperature and vitals monitor on inner left forearm (medical grade, self-installed). No other augmentations.', N'Mornings spent in their converted storage unit doing synthesis work; afternoons and evenings at rotating street locations seeing ''patients''; midnight to 2am updating their formulation notes on an air-gapped local device.', N'Dorian Magnúsdóttir-Björnsdóttir, lean Southeast Asian-African-South Asian woman, 172cm tall, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, sharp angular cheekbones and jawline, tight dark coily cropped hair, striking copper hexagon geneware iris pattern. Dressed in faded charcoal lab coat with rolled sleeves, black cargo pants, scuffed steel-toed boots. Chemical staining visible on fingertips, small scar near left temple. Posture tense and forward-leaning, hands fidgeting with reagent vial. Surgical mask draped around neck. GLMZ underground synthesis lab setting, cool blue-white fluorescent lighting casting harsh shadows, concrete walls of The Narrows visible in background, focused expression suggesting intense concentration. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (42.9%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (23.3%) and South Asian (17.0%) ancestry, complemented by Hispanic/Latin American (7.6%), East Asian (5.1%), and Eastern European (4.1%) heritage. This creates a striking pan-diaspora phenotype: rich deep brown skin with warm golden and reddish undertones from the Southeast Asian-African-South Asian blend, angular bone structure reflecting Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African features, and dark coily hair with natural depth.', 172, 58, N'Lean and angular, almost ascetic—the build of someone whose body runs on caffeine and focus rather than regular meals. Long-limbed with prominent clavicles and sharp cheekbones. Hands are disproportionately large and dexterous, fingers perpetually stained yellowed-brown from reagent exposure.', N'Natural dark brown with a faint rust undertone from years of chemical fume exposure', N'Cropped close to the scalp in tight coils, meticulously maintained—a deliberate choice that reads as both practical and defiant', N'Short', N'Dark brown base with geometric copper hexagon pattern overlaid across both irises (geneware modification, self-elected at age 19)', N'Deep warm brown with golden and reddish undertones reflecting the Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian genetic majority, slightly muted from indoor synthesis work and minimal sun exposure. The undertone complexity shows the real-world blending of three major ancestry groups.', N'Angular facial structure with high, prominent cheekbones and sharp jawline characteristic of Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, refined by South Asian bone structure. Skin shows minor chemical burns on the knuckles and one faint chemical splash scar along the left temple (partially hidden by hairline). No other blemishes—grooming is careful and deliberate. Expression rests neutral, eyes rarely unfocused.', N'The geometric copper hexagon iris pattern is immediately striking and clearly non-natural—reads as intentional, personal modification. The subdermal temperature/vitals monitor is not visible under normal clothing, only detectable by touch or medical scanning.', N'Moves with controlled precision, economical gestures. Sits hunched slightly forward when working, shoulders tensed. When mobile, walks with purpose but without hurry—someone accustomed to not drawing attention. Hands are rarely still; fidgets with small objects (reagent vials, a lighter, a pen) as a means of processing thought. Breathing shallow, vocal register naturally soft—a learned habit from operating in spaces where being overheard carries consequences.', N'Tier 4 working-class, practical and worn. Default uniform: faded charcoal synthetic lab coat (repaired multiple times, sleeves rolled), black cargo pants with reinforced pockets, steel-toed work boots scuffed from The Narrows concrete. Surgical mask worn around the neck at all times, pulled up during synthesis work. A single piece of jewelry: a thin steel ring on the left ring finger (no romantic significance; a tool for opening vials). No branding, no status markers. Clothes are clean but well-used, patched visibly at the left knee and right hip seam.', N'Two years ago they made a formulation error that gave a foundry worker a seizure. The worker survived and never knew, but Ezinwa has rechecked that formula every single week since. They have told no one.', N'Technical and precise; defaults to medical terminology even in casual speech; switches to very plain, gentle language when someone is in pain', N'Measured and quiet; never rushes a sentence; long pauses before difficult answers', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dorian_magn_sd_ttir_bj_rnsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5bb-7907-a55d-456f62a4e8ca', N'Binta Khoury-Hernández-Strömqvist', N'Binta', N'', N'Khoury-Hernández-Strömqvist', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 37, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Geartown — industrial district of chop shops and fabricators, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Forced entry and close-quarters combat specialist — breacher', N'Independent — operates through reputation only', N'Binta Khoury-Hernández-Strömqvist are tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 37, there''s something unfinished about their face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release — and they make no effort to hide it.

They taught themself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know them best. They work as a breacher out of Geartown, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Binta Khoury-Hernández-Strömqvist describe them as a precision instrument — point them at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Aybek Guerrero-Osei-Mensah represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Their stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release. Bone lacing — titanium mesh throughout skeleton, increases durability and striking power', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Binta Khoury-Hernández-Strömqvist, GLMZ, 188cm lean operative with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones reflecting Middle Eastern and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, angular high cheekbones from East Asian-Middle Eastern mix, natural deep brown eyes with amber warmth. Short dark hair with silver at temples, sharp-featured face weathered from nocturnal work. Visible chrome bioware regulator port at neck base with pale blue LED, scar tissue on right forearm, burn scar on left palm, chronic knuckle bruising. Matte-black tactical Hegemony pants, gray moisture-wicking shirt, long black reinforced coat, steel-toed boots. Economical posture, coiled tension, hands positioned with tactical awareness. Worn silver ring on left hand. Noir near-future megacity setting, low-key lighting with neon edge highlighting chrome bioware, urban grit atmosphere, predatory calm demeanor --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Middle Eastern (43.6%) with Sub-Saharan African (23.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (16.9%), and East Asian (16.2%) ancestry — a truly global genetic blend. The dominant Middle Eastern component combines with substantial African heritage to create deep, richly saturated skin tones with warm golden undertones. The Hispanic and East Asian heritage adds complexity to facial structure, creating a geometric precision in cheekbones and jaw, with subtle fullness through the lower face from the African component.', 188, 78, N'Lean and ropey, all cable and leverage. No excess mass — every kilogram serves function. The titanium bone lacing adds subtle density without bulk. Shoulders broad but not overdeveloped; wrists and forearms corded with visible tendon definition.', N'Natural deep brown, nearly black', N'Cropped close on sides, longer on top — practical for headgear and optics, styled with minimal maintenance. A few silver threads visible at the temples.', N'Short', N'Deep brown with warm amber undertones — natural', N'Deep warm medium-brown complexion — the result of dominant Middle Eastern (43.6%) and substantial Sub-Saharan African (23.3%) heritage creating rich, saturated tone with golden and amber undertones. The East Asian (16.2%) and Hispanic/Latin American (16.9%) components add subtle warmth and complexity. Radiant beneath the surface even under sleep deprivation, with warmth that catches light distinctly.', N'Angular face with defined high cheekbones and sharp jaw structure — the East Asian and Middle Eastern mix creating geometric precision in facial planes. Moderate fullness through the lower face reflecting African heritage. Nose with slightly broader bridge, softened by Middle Eastern and African features. Skin weathered from sleep deprivation and nocturnal living — slight gray undertone beneath the warm brown. A few fine lines around the eyes from squinting in low light. Clean-shaven or with 1-2 days stubble; minimal grooming routine.', N'Chrome bioware regulator at the base of the neck (left), clearly visible — a small port with faint LED indicator, no effort made to conceal it. The bone lacing is invisible subcutaneously, but subtle signs of its presence: increased muscle definition despite lean frame, and a faint metallic sheen under bright light where titanium mesh sits just beneath the skin at joints.', N'Economical and predatory. No wasted motion. They move from the hips, shoulders loose, hands always aware of their position relative to exits and potential threats. When still, there''s coiled tension — not anxious, but ready. When moving through a space, they map it instantly: sightlines, cover, approach vectors. The bioware regulator keeps their physical demeanor calm even when running hot — controlled breathing, deliberate pace.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian: matte-black tactical pants with reinforced seams and cargo pockets (Hegemony brand, 800 Φ range), steel-toed boots scuffed from actual use, gray or black moisture-wicking shirt (generic, unremarkable). A long black coat or reinforced vest depending on the job — usually something with deep pockets and minimal branding. Minimal jewelry; a worn silver ring on the left hand (inheritance or ritual unknown). No corpo logos. Everything designed for function and anonymity in low light.', N'Aybek Guerrero-Osei-Mensah murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'binta_khoury_hern_ndez_str_mqvist');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6db-7f69-b32d-45786c7460e0', N'Evgenia Nguyen', N'Evgenia', N'', N'Nguyen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 65, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower district tenements near the old lakeshore, near Halsted and Division', N'Forced entry and close-quarters combat specialist — breacher', N'Freelance — works the Gray Zone circuit exclusively', N'Evgenia Nguyen is slight and easy to overlook, which is exactly the point. At 65, the augmentation scarring around his temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. He works as a breacher out of the Gray Zone, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Everyone who''s worked with Evgenia Nguyen agrees on two things: he is worth the fee, and he is terrible company at dinner.', N'As a breacher, Soren Lindqvist-Okafor embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone. Cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains)', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Evgenia Nguyen, 168cm lean neo-noir operative in 2226 GLMZ, golden-brown complexion with warm olive undertones and weathered facial structure. High prominent cheekbones, aquiline nose, dark brown unaugmented eyes, deep facial creases. Steel gray cropped hair. Visible chrome scarring at left temple from cortical extraction, metallic sheen around nostrils from chemical analyzer implant. Thin pale scar on left forearm. Sparse salt-and-pepper stubble. Wearing black reinforced synthetic jacket, dark gray cargo pants with knee padding, worn combat boots. Single worn silver bracelet on left wrist. Posture low and centered, economical movement, eyes scanning. Standing in dimly lit neon-soaked corner, utilitarian neo-noir urban aesthetic, moody atmospheric lighting, gritty urban 2226 setting, cinematic noir tone --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex multiethnic blend with Southeast Asian as primary ancestry (42.7%), combined with significant South Asian (16.5%), Indigenous American (15.7%), Middle Eastern (15.0%), and Sub-Saharan African (8.7%) heritage. This creates a distinctive phenotype: warm golden-brown skin tone with olive undertones, high and prominent cheekbones from Southeast Asian and South Asian ancestry structure, darker brown eyes, and facial geometry reflecting the layering of multiple ancestral features across the face.', 168, 62, N'Lean and wiry, muscle definition visible through minimal body fat — built for explosive movement rather than sustained strength. Age-appropriate atrophy offset by obsessive physical training. Moves like someone who has spent decades conditioning their body as a tool.', N'Steel gray with residual blonde undertones', N'Cropped short, military-efficient, minimal styling', N'Short', N'Dark brown, unaugmented', N'Golden-brown complexion with warm olive undertones, deepened by years of sun exposure into a weathered patina. The tone reflects the blending of Southeast Asian warmth with South Asian depth, Middle Eastern golden richness, and Sub-Saharan African undertones — creating a cohesive warm spectrum without cool undertones.', N'Weathered, lined face with deep creases around eyes and mouth from squinting and grimacing. High, prominent cheekbones with strong definition reflecting Southeast Asian and South Asian ancestry. Aquiline nose with character lines showing both Middle Eastern and Indigenous American influence. Sparse salt-and-pepper stubble. Visible chrome scarring bracketing both temples in thin, jagged lines where cortical hardware was extracted. Nasal passage chrome visible as a faint metallic sheen around nostrils and upper septum. Overall grooming is functional — clean but not maintained for appearance.', N'Chrome chemical analyzer hardware visible in nasal passages and around the septum — appears as faint metallic discoloration and scarring. Cortical bomb extraction scar tissue prominent on left temple. No cosmetic attempt to conceal either modification.', N'Stands with weight distributed low and centered, ready to move. Movements are economical and precise — no wasted motion. Walks with a slight forward lean, shoulders loose. Eyes are constantly scanning. Sits in corners or positions allowing full room visibility. Rarely touches his face or adjusts his appearance — self-awareness is minimal.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian — black synthetic fiber jacket with multiple reinforced pockets, worn combat boots (well-maintained but scuffed), dark gray cargo pants with strategic padding at knees and hips. No visible corporate branding or luxury goods. Clothing is chosen for function: reinforced seams, tear-resistant material, pockets sized for tools and equipment. Wears the same style repeatedly. No jewelry, no status symbols. A single worn silver bracelet of unclear origin on his left wrist — possibly the only non-functional item he owns.', N'', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'evgenia_nguyen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ff-7a93-ad89-45e2dfc75a0b', N'Dharmesh Boateng', N'Dharmesh', N'', N'Boateng', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 42, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor — lives in a converted barge moored to the dry dock, near Lake Shore and Navy Pier', N'Heavy salvage and crew security — Boneyard Saints', N'Boneyard Saints', N'Dharmesh Boateng moves things that weren''t designed to be moved — sealed vault doors, collapsed structural beams, server racks that have been underwater for two decades and now weigh twice what they should. He is the Boneyard Saints'' heavy operator, the one who makes physically impossible salvage operations merely improbable. Before the Saints, he worked harbor construction — the last generation of workers who built things in Old Harbor before the water rose and made building irrelevant.

He is enormous. Six-four, two-sixty, with the dense, functional musculature of someone who has lifted heavy things underwater for most of his adult life. His augmentations are industrial rather than military — strength amplification, pressure tolerance, respiratory capacity. They were installed for construction work and repurposed for salvage. He moves slowly on land because he has learned that large men who move quickly frighten people, and Toll does not want to frighten anyone who doesn''t deserve it.

He is the kindest member of the Boneyard Saints, which is a strange thing to say about a man who can tear a steel door off its hinges. He cooks for the crew on the barge, sings while he works underwater (the respiratory system allows it), and names the marine creatures that have colonized the ruins. He is also the only Saint who will openly discuss the sounds in the deep sections, because pretending they don''t exist seems dishonest and Toll is constitutionally incapable of dishonesty.', N'Toll is the gentle giant in a horror setting — the warm, honest presence that makes the Boneyard Saints feel like a family rather than a salvage crew. His willingness to acknowledge the strangeness of the deep ruins makes him the crew''s canary in the coal mine. When Toll says something is wrong, the audience trusts it because Toll doesn''t lie.', N'', N'Industrial-grade myofiber enhancement in arms, legs, and back — triples effective lifting capacity. Deep-pressure skeletal reinforcement allowing operation at depths that would injure unaugmented divers. Extended respiratory system with 120-minute underwater capacity. Magnetic grip implants in palms for ferrous material handling.', N'Wakes with the tide. Cooks breakfast on the barge for whoever shows up — the kitchen is always open. Spends the day on salvage operations or equipment maintenance. Afternoons he often free-dives in the shallows, cataloguing marine life changes and checking structural conditions of the ruins near the surface. Evenings he cooks again, reads, or sits on the barge deck watching the water. He sleeps deeply and without dreams, which he considers a gift.', N'Dharmesh Boateng, 193cm tall extremely muscular underwater salvage diver, warm golden-brown skin with reddish undertones from sun exposure, blended Middle Eastern-South Asian-African-Hispanic heritage visible in broad nose, fuller lips, strong cheekbones. Salt-and-pepper gray-brown hair swept back, slightly damp. Deep brown eyes with pressure-related cloudiness. Weathered face with four decades of work lines, clean-shaven or light stubble. Long pale scar from collarbone to sternum, parallel scars on left forearm. Faded navy Gore-Tex jacket over worn thermal undersuit, cargo pants with tool loops, heavy waterproofed boots. Hands relaxed at sides showing subtle metallic veining on palms. Forward-leaning posture. Standing in industrial port setting, gray afternoon light, water and metal structures in background, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, realistic working-class aesthetic, no chrome or flashiness --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Complex global diaspora: Middle Eastern (33.0%), South Asian (31.8%), Sub-Saharan African (18.0%), and Hispanic/Latin American (17.2%). Phenotype expresses warm golden-brown skin with layered undertones—Middle Eastern and South Asian warmth as the foundation, enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth and Hispanic golden warmth. Facial structure reflects this blend: broader nose and fuller lips from African and South Asian ancestry, prominent cheekbones from Middle Eastern genetics, creating a face that reads as authentically multi-continental rather than singularly rooted.', 193, 118, N'Extremely muscular and dense — not bodybuilder aesthetic but functional, working muscle developed through decades of underwater heavy labor. Shoulders broad and thick, forearms like corded cable, legs built for stability under load rather than speed.', N'Salt-and-pepper gray-brown', N'Practical, kept short and swept back. Often wet or damp from daily water work.', N'Short', N'Deep brown with slight cloudiness at the edges from chronic pressure exposure', N'Warm golden-brown with reddish undertone from sun and salt exposure, deeper tanning on forearms and shoulders creating natural gradient. Base tone reflects the blended Middle Eastern and South Asian ancestry with Sub-Saharan African depth and Hispanic warmth throughout.', N'Weathered and lined from four decades of outdoor work and pressure-related aging. Clean-shaven or with a day or two of stubble. Skin has a slight waxy quality from subcutaneous pressure-tolerance implants. Facial structure shows broader nose and fuller lips reflecting African and South Asian heritage, with strong cheekbones from Middle Eastern ancestry. No acne or skin damage beyond sun exposure.', N'Magnetic grip implants create subtle metallic veining visible on palms when wet. Deep-pressure skeletal reinforcement creates barely perceptible hardening of jaw and cheekbone structure. Respiratory system modifications are invisible but create occasional faint clicking sound when breathing heavily. No visible chrome or obvious cyber — all augmentations are subcutaneous and industrial.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness on land, a conscious choice to avoid alarming smaller people. In water or underwater, movements become fluid and assured. Posture is slightly forward-leaning even when standing still — occupational habit from underwater work. Hands often open and relaxed at sides, rarely clenched. When lifting, movements are smooth and controlled rather than explosive.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, practical and durable. Typically wears faded cargo pants with tool loops, worn thermal undersuit visible at neck and cuffs. Prefers old-style Gore-Tex work jackets in faded navy or gray. Boots are heavy, waterproofed, re-soled multiple times. Occasionally wears a knit sweater his crewmate Marta made for him in 2224 — worn at elbows now, he refuses to retire it. No jewelry except a simple steel band on his left ring finger (memorial to someone, never discussed). All clothing shows legitimate wear, zero status signaling.', N'He has heard the deep-ruin sounds respond to his singing. Specific frequencies, specific patterns. It''s not an echo. Something is matching his notes. He has told no one because saying it out loud would make it real.', N'Simple, concrete, warm. He speaks in the language of physical things — weight, depth, temperature, texture. Metaphors are rare because he prefers to say exactly what he means.', N'Slow, steady, with the natural rhythm of someone who has never been in a hurry. His voice is deep enough to feel in your chest if you''re standing close.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dharmesh_boateng');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65f-7c39-9681-4604b1e34853', N'Grimur Tetteh-Yoon', N'Grimur', N'', N'Tetteh-Yoon', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Works in Meridian Core; lives in a shared flat in Archer''s Line, near State and Jackson', N'Night-shift building cleaner, Meridian Core corporate towers', N'Contracted through Brightclean Services (a Tessera facilities subsidiary); informally embedded in an Archer''s Line mutual aid network', N'Grimur Tetteh-Yoon is a young woman with her Gujarati father''s compact build and her Quechua mother''s dark, straight-cut hair — which she keeps in a single practical braid that she tucks into her collar during shift. She has no cosmetic mods, though she''s been quietly saving toward a bioluminescence mod she has already designed in her head: constellations mapped on her collarbone, named after the mountains her mother described to her. She has the slightly hyperaware eyes of someone who has learned to notice everything in rooms she is supposed to be invisible in. Her hands are chapped and she keeps a small pot of petroleum-analogous salve in her apron pocket.

Grimur Tetteh-Yoon works the 23:00–07:00 rotation across three Axiom tower floors, which means she mops boardrooms where decisions affecting millions were made that afternoon, empties the bins of executives who do not register her existence, and reads, from what they leave behind, a vivid and disturbing picture of how the city is run. She is not naive — she grew up in Archer''s Line, she knows what tier three looks like from below — but the gap between what she knew intellectually and what she witnesses nightly has been doing something complicated to her politics. She is curious, careful, and genuinely funny in a dry understated way that emerges fully only with people she trusts.', N'Underestimated witness with access to places and information she should not have; entry point for stories set in corporate space from a ground-level perspective; represents the invisible labor infrastructure of the towers; potential source, agent, or complication depending on who approaches her and why', N'', N'None currently; no employer-mandated chrome', N'Sleeps until 18:00, eats a meal with her two flatmates, takes the Ferrogate to Meridian Core by 22:30, works through the night mopping, sanitizing, and collecting, catches the 07:15 rail home, stops at a noodle cart on Archer''s Line before sleeping again', N'Grimur Tetteh-Yoon, 158cm compact build, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Close portrait of a woman with rich warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, high defined cheekbones, broad facial structure reflecting Indigenous American and Sub-Saharan heritage with East Asian luminosity. Dark brown eyes nearly black, natural black long hair in a practical braid tucked into worn gray Brightclean Services polo uniform. Clear complexion with tired quality, fine lines at eye corners, naturally full lips. Small pale burn scar visible on left inner wrist, callused fingers from cleaning work. Wearing cargo pants with reinforced knees, worn gray apron with supply pockets, scuffed safety shoes. Hands in motion, eyes cataloging details, posture slightly forward. Neon-lit corridor lighting, nocturnal shift atmosphere, practical utilitarian setting, photorealistic, documentary style, moody atmospheric lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Works in Meridian Core; lives in a shared flat in Archer''s Line', N'local', N'Works in Meridian Core; lives in a shared flat in Archer''s Line', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend with Indigenous American (31.6%), Sub-Saharan African (27.3%), East Asian (24.5%), South Asian (14.5%), and Eastern European (2.1%) ancestry. This creates a distinctive warm-toned phenotype where deep Sub-Saharan and Indigenous American richness combines with East Asian and South Asian luminosity. High, defined cheekbones with broad facial structure reflect the Indigenous American and Sub-Saharan components; face shape shows the width and prominence characteristic of these ancestries. Warm golden undertones from East and South Asian heritage glow subtly beneath the deeper warmth of Sub-Saharan and Indigenous American skin depth. Overall effect is a harmonious, richly warm complexion with significant dimensional depth and subtle golden radiance.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, shoulders slightly narrow, legs proportionally long relative to torso. Functional musculature in forearms and calves from years of repetitive cleaning work—not athletic, but efficient.', N'Natural black with very slight warm undertone', N'Single practical braid, usually tucked into collar or wrapped around the back of the head during work shifts', N'Long (mid-back when unbraided)', N'Dark brown, almost black', N'Rich medium warm brown with pronounced golden undertones—a luminous blend where East Asian and South Asian glow meets Sub-Saharan depth and Indigenous American warmth. Evenly toned overall with warmer, golden-bronze highlights across cheekbones and bridge of nose.', N'Clear skin with a tired, slightly dehydrated quality from nocturnal schedule. Fine lines beginning at the outer corners of eyes from sustained focus and habitual squinting in low light. High, prominent cheekbones with broad facial structure characteristic of Indigenous American and Sub-Saharan heritage, refined by East Asian definition. Lips naturally full with warm undertones, often chapped from dry tower air and infrequent lip care. No makeup.', N'None visible. No chrome, no subdermal implants showing, no optical modifications. Her hands and wrists are unmodified human tissue.', N'Moves with deliberate economy—no wasted motion. Shoulders slightly forward from hours bent over cleaning equipment. Walking pace is steady and measured. Eyes are constantly moving, cataloging details in rooms and spaces. When she sits, she sits fully, not perched. Hands are often in motion: fidgeting with fabric, adjusting her braid, unconsciously reaching for the petroleum salve in her apron pocket.', N'Tier 3 practical utilitarian. During work shifts: unbranded gray or navy Brightclean Services uniform polo (synthetic blend, starting to pill at the shoulders), dark cargo pants with reinforced knees, scuffed non-slip safety shoes, a worn gray apron with multiple pockets holding cleaning supplies and personal items. Off-shift: layered secondhand clothing from thrift networks in Archer''s Line—oversized sweaters, faded jeans, a well-maintained jacket of indeterminate age that belonged to her mother. No jewelry except a thin silver ring on her right ring finger (inherited). A small cloth bag for work supplies and a transit pass on a worn lanyard.', N'Over six months, she has been photographing documents left in the recycling bins on Floor 31 — nothing she understood at first, but a pattern has emerged that she is increasingly certain describes a Tessera land acquisition scheme targeting Archer''s Line. She has told no one. She does not know what to do with it.', N'Economical and precise in public, unexpectedly expansive and witty in private, occasionally slips into a Gujarat-Quechua home-language blend when tired', N'Quiet and measured on the job, quicker and more animated with friends, with a gift for the perfectly placed dry aside', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'grimur_tetteh_yoon');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a676-7121-942b-461ffa0b7d75', N'Feliciano Tofauti-Sabbagh-Ghorbani', N'Feliciano', N'', N'Tofauti-Sabbagh-Ghorbani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Blackpipe Corridor, operates out of the Deepwell Station depot, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Ferrogate Transit operator, drives the Blackpipe Corridor night loop', N'Ferrogate Transit (mid-level ferrogate transit operator)', N'Feliciano Tofauti-Sabbagh-Ghorbani is a lean, tall man with very dark skin and the kind of stillness that comes from spending eight hours a night in a sealed cab watching the city scroll past. He keeps his head shaved close and has a single line of geometric scarification across his left cheekbone — his father''s tradition, Igbo-inflected, though Feliciano Tofauti-Sabbagh-Ghorbani grew up in a Polish-Samoan household and learned the meaning of the marks only from photographs. His eyes have patterned irises, a personal mod he saved up for at twenty-five: they display a slow-rotating amber geometric that passengers sometimes find unsettling when he turns to look at them.

He has the particular calm of someone who has accepted his job as a kind of meditation. The night loop runs from 23:00 to 07:00, serving the Blackpipe Corridor''s factory shift workers, waste handlers, and late-night wanderers. He knows his regulars by which stop they board and whether they sit. He keeps a small shrine to the transit ELF — whom he calls Deepwell — zip-tied to the corner of his console: a circuit board wrapped in copper wire with a single LED heart that pulses when the network is healthy. He leaves his passenger counts as offerings and, on rough nights, a single stick of incense jammed into the vent.', N'Mobile information source — knows the night geography of the Corridor intimately, has seen things from his cab that others haven''t. Can provide passage, intelligence on movement patterns, or introductions to his regulars.', N'', N'Patterned irises — slow amber geometric rotation (cosmetic). Night-vision overlay implant — occupational requirement for Ferrogate night operators, basic grade.', N'Sleeps until 18:00, eats a meal from the Deepwell Station vending machines at 22:00, runs his loop through the night, files his passenger and incident logs at 07:15, and walks home to his Blackpipe Corridor apartment to sleep again.', N'Feliciano Tofauti-Sabbagh-Ghorbani, 188cm tall neo-noir transit driver, medium-deep warm brown skin with golden-olive undertones, shaved black hair, augmented dark brown eyes with slow-rotating geometric amber patterns. Igbo scarification marks across left cheekbone. Lean athletic build, compressed posture from night driving. Wearing standard gray Ferrogate Transit operator shirt, navy work pants, steel-toed boots, threadbare dark jacket. Copper wire bracelet on left wrist. Standing under neon transit station lighting, tired ambient glow reflecting off augmented irises, deliberate stillness, looking away with unsettling calm. GLMZ, Pacific Islander-Middle Eastern heritage visible in bone structure and complexion. Moody, introspective, functional aesthetic. —ar 2:3 —v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Blackpipe Corridor', N'local', N'Blackpipe Corridor', N'Pacific Islander (45.7%) / Middle Eastern (39.9%) / Central Asian (11.6%) / Hispanic/Latin American (2.8%) — a striking synthesis creating a warm medium-deep brown complexion with golden olive undertones. Pacific Islander foundation provides broader facial structure and robust bone density; Middle Eastern heritage contributes angular jawline definition and prominent nose bridge; Central Asian ancestry subtly influences eye shape and cheekbone prominence. The result is a distinctive warm-to-golden-olive complexion that catches light with depth.', 188, 72, N'Lean and tall with the compressed posture of someone who spends eight hours nightly in a transit cab; shoulders slightly rounded forward from years hunched over controls, but with the underlying frame of an athlete who has let fitness atrophy into mere function', N'Natural black', N'Shaved close to the scalp, clean lines, maintained every three days', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown with patterned amber geometric irises (augmented) — slow-rotating concentric triangles and hexagons visible in low light', N'Medium-deep warm brown with golden-olive undertones; rich sun-darkened tone reflecting the dominant Pacific Islander base (45.7%) warmed by substantial Middle Eastern heritage (39.9%), with subtle Central Asian refinement (11.6%) and Hispanic/Latin American influence (2.8%)', N'Weathered but calm; skin shows the dryness of someone who works nights under artificial light and doesn''t prioritize skincare. Facial structure reflects Pacific Islander heritage with broader, fuller cheekbones and face shape, refined by the angular jawline and prominent nose bridge from Middle Eastern ancestry with Central Asian eye-shape influence. A thin line of geometric scarification runs across his left cheekbone — three parallel cuts with triangular infill, the Igbo family mark his father carried', N'Patterned irises with slow-rotating amber geometric designs visible when light hits his eyes directly. Night-vision overlay leaves no external hardware but may appear as a faint reflective quality deep in the pupil under close inspection. Otherwise no visible chrome or subdermal modifications.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical stillness — the kind that comes from meditating on the same eight-hour loop every night. Sits deeply in chairs. Turns his head to look rather than moving his eyes. Speaks rarely but makes sustained eye contact when he does, allowing the rotating irises to unsettingly complete a full rotation before he speaks. Walks home slowly, not tired, but absent — his mind still running the Blackpipe loop', N'Standard Ferrogate Transit operator uniform: gray polyester work shirt with union patch (Local 7), navy work pants with utility pockets, steel-toed boots maintained to regulation. Off-duty: dark layers in Tier 3-4 working-class palette. Threadbare jacket, the kind that''s been through five winters. A small copper wire bracelet wound around his left wrist, handmade, which he touches sometimes without noticing. No jewelry beyond this. Everything functional, nothing decorative except what connects him to ritual.', N'Three months ago he witnessed a body being dropped from the Blackpipe overpass onto his route from a vehicle ahead of him. He filed no report. The body was gone by the time he doubled back. He has said nothing because the vehicle had Ferrogate Transit markings.', N'Economical, transit-inflected; references stops and lines for location; slightly formal with strangers', N'Even and unhurried, like someone who has learned patience from stop schedules', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'feliciano_tofauti_sabbagh_ghorbani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a735-7674-af2f-4683eb62f584', N'Eman Árnason-Kang-Larsdóttir', N'Eman', N'', N'Árnason-Kang-Larsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 33, NULL, 30, 2, N'active', N'The Core, near LaSalle and Madison', N'Fixer - Helix proxy', N'Helix BioSystems', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'GLMZ, professional corporate operative Eman Árnason-Kang-Larsdóttir. 172cm tall, lean angular frame with defined musculature. Warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones, blending East Asian, Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Northern European heritage. High cheekbones, refined angular jawline, deep brown eyes with amber flecking. Long black hair with auburn undertones pulled in tight high ponytail. Chrome-plated augmented right hand with visible knuckles and finger joints. Faint scar along left temple hairline. Meticulous posture, controlled movements, slight forward shoulder tension. Wearing fitted black tactical compression long-sleeve, muted blue lightweight polymer jacket with hardware loops, fitted tactical trousers with thigh pockets, expensive minimalist sneakers. Corporate professional aesthetic. Seated in modern corporate environment or futuristic data center. Cool blue and gray ambient lighting with subtle neon undertones. Controlled, focused expression. High-end neo-noir urban aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Core', N'local', N'The Core', N'Globally mixed phenotype with East Asian (29.6%) and Southeast Asian (20.7%) as dominant bone structure foundation, creating characteristic cheekbones and eye set. Sub-Saharan African ancestry (18.2%) contributes warm depth, facial definition, and rich dimensionality to features. Northern European ancestry (24.8%) introduces lighter undertones and cool complexities to skin and eye coloration. Hispanic/Latin American heritage (6.7%) adds warmth and subtle golden qualities to overall palette. The result is a striking, harmoniously blended appearance where no single ancestry dominates visually.', 172, 61, N'Lean and angular, with defined musculature from consistent physical conditioning. Long-limbed with a graceful but tense posture that betrays readiness for confrontation.', N'Natural black with subtle auburn undertones in direct light', N'Pulled back in a tight, high ponytail; precisely maintained with no loose strands', N'Long', N'Deep brown with faint amber flecking near the iris', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones. Luminous quality from the balanced blend of East Asian, Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic ancestry. Evenly toned with subtle radiance.', N'Prominent, well-defined cheekbones blending East Asian refinement with Sub-Saharan African depth and warmth. Strong angular jawline characteristic of the multi-continental ancestry blend. Refined nose bridge with subtle East Asian influence. Skin is meticulously maintained with minor tension lines around eyes and mouth from stress. No blemishes; fastidious grooming standard. Small scar tissue along left temple partially obscured by hairline.', N'Right hand shows chrome plating along the knuckles and finger joints, seamlessly integrated with warm medium-brown skin. The augmentation is precise and expensive-looking, suggesting Tier 1 corporate quality. Otherwise, augmentations are not visibly apparent—likely subcutaneous neural interfaces or internal modifications.', N'Moves with controlled efficiency, economical gestures. Rarely relaxes completely; shoulders held slightly forward. Makes deliberate eye contact. Walks with measured pace, feet landing heel-first. Hands often rest in lap or clasped at waist when seated. Exudes controlled tension rather than relaxation.', N'Corporate-adjacent minimalism. Favors tailored, high-end fabrics in blacks, grays, and muted blues. Typically wears fitted tactical trousers with discrete thigh pockets, fitted long-sleeved compression shirts, and lightweight polymer jackets with hidden hardware loops. Expensive, unremarkable sneakers for mobility. Minimal jewelry aside from her wrist tattoo. Tier 1-2 aesthetic—professional, expensive, deliberately understated to avoid drawing attention in corporate spaces.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eman_rnason_kang_larsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f6-7c59-8b2d-46c059cfdaf6', N'Cyrille Anang-Ozcoidi', N'Cyrille', N'', N'Anang-Ozcoidi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — operates out of a converted shipping container behind the Grainfort fish market, near North Ave and Damen', N'Street doc and unlicensed augmentation technician', N'Independent; informal network with the Highland Park Autonomous Zone community health cooperative', N'Cyrille Anang-Ozcoidi is built like someone who has carried heavy things for a long time and stopped apologizing for it. Her shoulders are broad, her hands scarred across the knuckles from years of close surgical work in bad lighting, and she has the particular stillness of someone who has learned that panic is expensive. Her skin is deep brown with the kind of undertone that catches orange in dim light, and her left eye has been replaced with a secondhand Axiom optical unit she recalibrated herself — the iris displays a faint amber ring that pulses when she''s processing something complex. She keeps her natural hair close-cropped and wears a perpetually oil-stained lab coat over whatever she slept in.

Cyrille Anang-Ozcoidi is warm the way a woodstove is warm — you have to get close enough to feel it, and it takes a moment to realize how much heat she''s actually putting out. She has a dry, slow wit and absolutely no patience for people who waste her time or her supplies. She does not turn patients away based on ability to pay, which is both her moral core and the reason she is perpetually broke. She has strong opinions about the E.L.F. she calls Stitcher, a faint digital presence she believes inhabits her autoclave, and leaves small data packets — maintenance logs, old anatomy files — as offerings before difficult procedures.', N'Primary street-level medical resource; quest giver for supply runs or information about what injuries she''s been treating; local anchor who knows everyone''s wounds', N'', N'Secondhand Axiom optical implant (recalibrated, amber iris ring); subdermal vibration sensor in right fingertips for locating veins and checking pulse quality; cosmetic: none', N'She wakes before dawn to resupply from Grainfort black-market med contacts, sees patients from mid-morning until she physically cannot continue, and spends her evenings doing paperwork she is not legally required to keep but keeps anyway.', N'Cyrille Anang-Ozcoidi, 41-year-old surgical tech with warm cognac skin toned by Indigenous American, Southeast Asian, and Middle Eastern ancestry; broad cheekbones and strong facial structure, short black hair with gray at temples. Left eye replaced by glowing Axiom optical implant with pulsing amber iris, right eye deep brown. Muscular 172cm frame, weathered and scarred from decades of precision work. Wearing stained white surgical coat over gray thermal undershirt, dark cargo pants, heavy scuffed boots. Hands scarred across knuckles, fidgeting with surgical instrument. Steel ring on right index finger. Temple scarring barely visible at hairline. Standing in dim underground clinic, cool blue-white diagnostic lighting casting shadows across her face, her augmented eye glowing softly. Concentrated expression, slight head tilt as implant processes. GLMZ GLMZ aesthetic, utilitarian and worn. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Mixed ancestry combining Indigenous American (59.9%), Southeast Asian (19.5%), Eastern European (11.3%), and Middle Eastern (9.3%) heritage. The dominant Indigenous American ancestry shapes her facial structure—broad cheekbones, strong orbital geometry, and a substantial nose bridge. Southeast Asian heritage adds subtle refinement to her features and contributes warm olive undertones to her skin. Eastern European and Middle Eastern ancestry provide secondary genetic influence, visible in the slight variation in her complexion''s depth and undertone complexity.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and muscular without softness — the build of someone who has lifted, carried, and held steady for decades. Her frame is dense and functional rather than elegant; forearms are corded with visible muscle from years of surgical precision work.', N'Black with scattered gray at the temples', N'Close-cropped fade, kept practical and low-maintenance', N'Short', N'Left eye: artificial Axiom optical unit with amber iris ring that faintly pulses during cognitive load. Right eye: deep brown, alert and steady.', N'Warm cognac brown with golden and olive undertones—a rich saturation reflecting her 59.9% Indigenous American ancestry, deepened and warmed by Southeast Asian contribution (19.5%), with subtle complexity added by Eastern European and Middle Eastern heritage (20.6% combined). Sun-weathered in exposed areas, pale beneath augmentation scars.', N'Unlined by vanity but marked by the weather of forty-one years—broad cheekbones and strong orbital structure reflecting Indigenous American and Southeast Asian ancestry; straight nose with powerful bridge; a few surgical scars near the left temple where the optical implant integrates with her scalp; calluses across all knuckles; nails kept short and practical. No cosmetics. A small permanent crease between her brows from concentration.', N'The Axiom optical implant in her left eye is immediately visible — a slightly too-perfect iris with a faint amber ring that pulses during concentration or when she is running diagnostic processes on her own systems. The integration point at her temple is barely visible unless her hair is pulled back. The subdermal vibration sensors in her right fingertips are not externally visible but create a faint geometric scarring pattern across her fingertip pads if examined closely.', N'She moves with the controlled economy of someone who has learned that wasted motion is wasted energy. Her left arm hangs at a slightly different angle than her right — not a disability, but a consequence of years favoring her augmented side during precision work. She tends to stand still rather than shift her weight, and when she does move, it is deliberate and minimal. Her hands are rarely still; they fidget with surgical instruments, diagnostic tools, or data chips even during conversation. She has a habit of tilting her head slightly when her optical implant is processing, bringing that amber ring into focus.', N'A perpetually oil-stained, once-white surgical coat over whatever she slept in — usually plain t-shirts or old thermal undershirts in muted grays or blacks. The coat has deep pockets that always contain: forceps, a headlamp with a dying battery, a small data chip reader, and several packages of sutures in different gauges. Her pants are dark work cargo or heavy denim, practical and worn smooth at the seams. She wears a single piece of jewelry: a plain steel ring on her right index finger — not a wedding ring, but something she made herself from reclaimed surgical steel. Her boots are heavy, scuffed, and re-soled at least twice. Everything she wears is Tier 4-5 practical; nothing matches because she does not buy clothes for matching, she buys them for durability and pockets.', N'She holds a fully valid Helix Biosystems surgical license under a different name — she walked out of a corporate clinic twelve years ago mid-shift and never went back, and the license has been quietly suspended but never revoked. She could return to legal practice. She will not.', N'Precise medical terminology mixed with Narrows slang; plain declarative sentences; very little filler', N'Slow and deliberate, like she''s measuring each word before spending it', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cyrille_anang_ozcoidi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c8-7a8f-a0d7-46dbfca72ff0', N'Fikret Mukherjee', N'Fikret', N'', N'Mukherjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 71, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Montclare Quiet, the Sable House Community Center — she has effectively colonized the back room, near Damen and Armitage', N'Retired Axiom archive keeper, community storyteller and unofficial neighborhood historian', N'Sable House Community Center (volunteer); formerly Axiom Urban Development Archive Division', N'Fikret Mukherjee is small and precise, the kind of woman who takes up exactly as much space as she intends to and no more. She has rich brown skin and natural white hair she wears in an elaborate braided crown she redoes every Sunday, a weekly ritual she treats with the gravity of liturgy. Her irises were replaced with cosmetic patterned geneware decades ago — deep violet with a star-cluster pattern that was fashionable in the 2150s and is now charming in its datedness. She dresses in layered earth tones with one aggressively bright accessory — today a saffron scarf, tomorrow a red belt — and always, always a pair of reading glasses she doesn''t need but finds psychologically essential.

For thirty-one years Fikret Mukherjee maintained the classified internal archive for Axiom''s urban development division, which means she personally catalogued the documentation of three neighborhood demolitions, two relocation programs, and one flood-management rerouting that she believes was deliberately aimed at Chatham Flats to drive out residents. She retired with a modest pension and a colossal private collection of copied files she was absolutely not supposed to take. She now runs a weekly ''Story Hour'' at the community center that is ostensibly for children but draws a standing-room crowd of all ages — because Fikret Mukherjee''s stories are true, thinly veiled, and devastatingly specific.', N'Information broker (unofficial); source of Axiom corporate history and urban development cover-ups; can provide documentary evidence of past injustices; storyteller whose narratives encode real intelligence; may be in danger for what she knows', N'', N'Cosmetic patterned irises (violet star-cluster, early 2150s model — considered retro); subdermal data-storage array in left forearm, civilian grade, holds approximately 40TB — she uses it as a personal archive', N'Arrives at the community center by 0800, catalogs and cross-references her personal archive for two hours, then receives a steady trickle of visitors seeking information about old neighborhood history, property records, or ''what really happened.'' Prepares Story Hour every Thursday. Eats lunch alone and guards this time ferociously.', N'Fikret Mukherjee, 152cm petite South Asian woman with layered global heritage—warm medium-brown skin with golden amber undertones at cheekbones, refined high cheekbones reflecting South Asian and Middle Eastern ancestry. Natural white hair in elaborate five-strand crown braid studded with copper wire, mid-back length. Striking violet eyes with star-cluster geneware pattern (2150s cosmetic implants). Fine facial lines from decades of archival work, white scar along left temple, silvered burn scars on right hand knuckles. Compact birdlike build, precise economical posture. Wearing cream linen shirt under burnt-sienna vest, charcoal wide-leg trousers, saffron scarf knotted at neck, low-heeled worn boots. Copper-wire reading glasses on cord. Faint subdermal luminescence at left inner forearm. Archive lighting aesthetic, quiet dignity, 2226 near-future megacity setting, soft warm gallery lighting, archival atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Montclare Quiet', N'local', N'Montclare Quiet', N'South Asian dominant (67.6%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (11.2%), Middle Eastern (10.5%), Sub-Saharan African (7.6%), and Pacific Islander (3.1%) admixture. This creates warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones and subtle complexity—deeper amber warmth at cheekbones and jawline reflecting the layered ancestry blend, with faint luminescence from subdermal implants catching light.', 152, 52, N'Slight and compact, almost birdlike in its economy of movement. No excess—bone structure shows clearly at wrists and collarbone. Decades of sitting in archive work have left her spine subtly curved, though she corrects it with visible effort when standing.', N'Natural white', N'Elaborate crown braid—five interwoven strands, redone every Sunday, currently studded with small copper wire accents she adds herself. The precision is almost architectural.', N'Long (mid-back when fully braided)', N'Violet with star-cluster pattern (cosmetic patterned geneware, circa 2150s)', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones deepening to rich amber at cheekbones and jawline. The blend reflects her South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African, and Pacific Islander ancestry with luminescent quality where subdermal implants sit close to surface.', N'Clean, lined face that reads as carefully maintained rather than youthful. High, defined cheekbones with refined structure reflecting South Asian and Middle Eastern ancestry. Laugh lines run deep from the corners of her mouth. Skin texture shows three decades of archive lighting exposure—natural golden warmth of blended heritage slightly subdued by artificial light, with faint luminescence marking subdermal implant sites.', N'Violet star-cluster irises (dated cosmetic geneware, worn with complete unselfconsciousness). Subdermal data-storage array in left forearm with faint luminescent quality under certain angles. Reading glasses suspended on braided copper wire cord, always present.', N'Moves with minimal wasted motion—each gesture precise and economical. Sits with perfect spinal alignment when focusing on archival work. Walks slowly but with absolute certainty, as though she has already mapped the space. Her hands are steady when handling documents. She has the physical grammar of someone accustomed to silence and small spaces.', N'Layered earth tones: rust, ochre, slate, charcoal, cream. Today: a cream linen shirt under a burnt-sienna vest, charcoal wide-leg trousers (Tier 3-4 quality, well-maintained, unfashionable), and a saffron scarf knotted loosely around her neck. One aggressively bright accessory rotates daily—tomorrow a cardinal-red belt, next week perhaps a marigold headwrap. The bright accent seems chosen with intent, like a signal. Comfortable low-heeled boots, worn to softness. Everything speaks of care rather than cost.', N'She has a complete, sourced record of the Chatham Flats flood-route manipulation, including a senior Axiom director''s name on the sign-off. She has held it for eleven years and has never shared it because the director''s daughter is now a resident of Montclare Quiet who brings Serafina pastries every week and has no idea.', N'Archival and precise — she dates things, cites sources, uses formal register; switches to warm and wry when relaxed', N'Measured and deliberate, with theatrical pauses for emphasis; speeds up when she is excited about an interesting fact', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fikret_mukherjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e1-75b6-a336-47095f422255', N'Ananda Traoré', N'Ananda', N'', N'Traoré', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenosha Crossing transit hub, outer berths, near outside the Pulaski Gate', N'wandering trader and hand-drawn map seller', N'Unaffiliated; loose trade relationship with nomad caravans operating the Escanaba-to-Kenosha route', N'Ananda Traoré is a lean, sun-darkened man whose face carries the deep-etched lines of someone who has slept outdoors more than inside. His hair is silver-streaked black, kept in tight locks that hang to his collarbone, adorned with small brass charms he picks up at every stop. His hands are the most notable thing about him — enormous, ink-stained, with knuckles swollen from decades of drafting in the cold. He carries three hand-sewn leather satchels at all times, each packed with rolled paper maps he has made himself, annotated in four languages with notes on water quality, E.L.F. activity, corrupt checkpoint guards, and where to find honest food. His geneware is a single cosmetic mod — irises with faint golden patterning that he got from a Helix Biosystems field clinic fifteen years ago in exchange for drawing them an accurate map of the Waukegan gray zone.

Ananda Traoré talks like a man who has learned that most words are wasted. He is not unfriendly — he simply measures speech the way a traveler measures water. He has been moving along the hyperlane corridors and shoreline routes for thirty years, since his cooperative settlement outside what is now Grainfort was absorbed by Axiom and everyone was given seventy-two hours to vacate. He does not consider himself a refugee anymore. He considers himself a professional. He trades in maps that official systems won''t make because official systems don''t want people knowing the things he knows.', N'Information source and orientation anchor for anyone new to the outer routes; quest giver for escort or retrieval tasks; his maps may contain information that powerful entities want suppressed', N'', N'Patterned golden irises (Helix cosmetic geneware, very old). No other mods.', N'Wakes before dawn at whatever sheltered spot he has found, spends two hours updating his current map with observations from the previous day, then sets up a small cloth display at the Kenosha Crossing outer berths where transients and migrants gather before checkpoint processing. Trades maps for food, Φ, information, or goods he can carry.', N'Ananda Traoré, weathered cartographer, 174cm lean muscular frame with deep warm brown skin blending Sub-Saharan African and Southeast Asian heritage. High cheekbones with broad facial features, permanently lined face from decades of squinting across terrain. Dark brown eyes with faint golden geometric patterning — old geneware implants. Black hair with silver streaks in tight braids to collarbone, adorned with brass charms. Trimmed beard, deeply tanned. Hands show age and scarring: permanent ink stains under fingernails, horizontal scar across left palm, clustered burn scars on right forearm, knuckles swollen and arthritic. Wears rust-brown heavy canvas overshirt over weathered linen shirt with rolled sleeves, durable synth-weave cargo trousers patched twice, maintained quality boots. Three hand-stitched leather satchels worn crosswise. Brass buckles and leather straps everywhere. Economical posture, slightly bent forward as if reading terrain. GLMZ GLMZ setting, harsh blue-white neon lighting casting shadows across his weathered features, background showing trader''s quarter or caravan encampment at dusk, worn maps and navigation tools visible in satchels. Gritty, lived-in atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenosha Crossing transit hub', N'local', N'Kenosha Crossing transit hub', N'Sub-Saharan African and Southeast Asian dominant blend — 48.8% Sub-Saharan African ancestry combined with 47.2% Southeast Asian heritage creates a rich warm-to-deep complexion with influences from both regions. 4% Hispanic/Latin American ancestry adds subtle warmth and variation to skin undertones. This combination produces warm medium-to-deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones, Southeast Asian facial geometry in cheekbones and eye shape, and the broader features characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage.', 174, 68, N'Lean and sinewy, muscular in the way of someone who has carried his own weight across thousands of kilometers on foot. No excess; skin drawn tight over defined shoulders and forearms.', N'Black with deep silver streaking throughout', N'Tight locks hanging to collarbone, individual braids adorned with small brass charms and wire wraps collected from trading posts', N'Long', N'Dark brown with faint golden geometric patterning across both irises — old Helix Biosystems cosmetic geneware, fifteen years embedded, slightly faded', N'Deep warm brown with golden and olive undertones from the Sub-Saharan African and Southeast Asian ancestry blend, deepened by uneven sun-darkening; lighter patches on palms and underarms where calluses have worn away old pigment', N'Deeply lined face with permanent creases at eye corners and mouth from squinting across water and desert. Southeast Asian bone structure in high cheekbones and eye shape, with broader features reflecting Sub-Saharan African heritage. Weathered but not neglected — kept clean, beard trimmed short. Hands show most age: enormous span, knuckles swollen and arthritic, fingers stained permanently with mapping ink despite regular washing.', N'Only the patterned golden irises are visible — subtle enough that they might be mistaken for natural variation or contact lenses at first glance, but unmistakable on direct eye contact. No other visible chrome, implants, or subdermal work.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Walks slightly bent forward as if perpetually reading terrain. Hands rest near map satchels even when sitting. Speech is sparse; listens more than talks. Eyes constantly register details: exits, water sources, foot traffic patterns, weather shifts.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian traveler. Multiple layered garments in muted colors: weathered linen shirt (sleeves rolled or tied back for mapwork), heavy canvas vest with many pockets containing charcoal stubs, measuring tools, and trade notes. Trousers are durable synth-weave cargo style, patched twice visibly. Boots are good quality and maintained — a traveler''s investment. Wears a long, loose overshirt of heavy canvas dyed rust-brown that serves as both warmth and map display surface when laid flat. No corpo logos. Brass buckles and leather straps everywhere. Carries three hand-stitched leather satchels crosswise at all times.', N'He has a complete daughter — Φ-registered, corporate citizen, mid-level Tessera analyst in Meridian Core — who does not know he is still alive. He let her believe he died in the Grainfort displacement because he could not bear to watch her become what she became.', N'Precise and spare. Uses cartography metaphors. Rarely uses contractions. Mixes in words from Bambara and Tongan without signaling them.', N'Slow, measured, with long pauses before important statements. Never rushes.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ananda_traor');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5de-7f2a-aa7d-4741de8060b2', N'Duyen Kulkarni-Wickramasinghe', N'Duyen', N'', N'Kulkarni-Wickramasinghe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 91, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Precinct 1 — Corner unit, Calle Baja Residency Block, near Western and Division', N'Retired community elder, former neighborhood council chair, living entirely on UBC stipend', N'the Gray Zone Precinct 1 Community (informal anchor); former the Gray Zone Neighborhood Council (chair emeritus); no current formal affiliation', N'Duyen Kulkarni-Wickramasinghe is ninety-one years old and she will tell you so before you''ve finished introducing yourself, usually followed by: ''and I have outlived three landlords, two corponation district managers, and everyone who ever told me to be quieter.'' She is small and enormously present, using a walker she has decorated with woven wire charms and a small battery-powered light shaped like a fish that she received from a grandchild and refuses to remove. Her skin is very dark and very lined and she leans into every line with the comfort of someone who earned them. She wears her natural hair close-cropped and white and favors bright colors that she says ''make you easy to find in a crowd, which is exactly where an old woman should be.''

She has no augmentations and hasn''t wanted any. She has no pension beyond UBC, having spent her working years in informal caregiving and community organizing that the formal economy never counted. She is the social infrastructure of Precinct 1: she knows who is fighting with their partner, who has gone three days without eating, who is hiding an injury they can''t afford to report, who the new family in Block C actually is and whether they need help or are the kind of trouble the block doesn''t need. She dispenses this information with the authority of someone who has been paying attention for nine decades, and she does so from her corner unit''s open window, which functions as an informal exchange point for most of the block''s social life. She prays daily to the E.L.F. she calls La Luzita — a small grid presence that flickers the hallway lights in what she interprets as responses.', N'Community intelligence hub — knows everyone and everything on the block; social connector and quest-initiator; moral compass for neighborhood storylines; represents the invisible labor of community care that keeps tier-1 residents alive; can mobilize collective action through social networks alone', N'', N'None. Deliberately.', N'Window open by 0600; receives visitors, information, and small offerings of food all day from the block; prepares a communal meal every Sunday using pooled ingredients from whoever contributes; prays to La Luzita at dusk; in bed by 2100 with absolute firmness.', N'Duyen Kulkarni-Wickramasinghe, 152cm tall elderly woman with warm deep brown skin and golden undertones, white close-cropped hair in neat rows, dark sharp eyes with South Asian expressiveness, heavily lined face mapping nine decades of life. Wears electric blue long-sleeved shirt under yellow print dress, purple cardigan with reinforced mismatched buttons, colorful draped shawl, scuffed slip-on shoes. Using a walker decorated with woven wire charms and small battery-powered fish light. Standing by window in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone apartment, neon signs casting cool light through glass, her bright clothing vibrant against urban decay backdrop. Expression of gentle amusement. Absolute presence despite small frame. Natural, no augmentations visible. Cinematic GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, warm color contrast, documentary realism --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly South Asian (82.9%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (8.8%) and Northern European (8.3%) admixture. The genetic blend creates a distinctive phenotype: warm medium-to-deep brown skin with golden undertones reflecting South Asian heritage, combined with facial structure influenced by Hispanic/Latin American ancestry—wider cheekbones, fuller lips, and slightly broader nose bridge—with subtle Northern European characteristics visible in eye placement and bone definition.', 152, 58, N'Slight and compact, all wiry sinew and no excess — the build of someone who has spent nine decades moving through the world with purpose and minimal resource. Her frame suggests durability rather than fragility.', N'White, natural', N'Close-cropped, maintained in neat rows', N'Short', N'Dark brown, sharp and alert', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden undertones, rich and luminous despite age. The tone reflects South Asian foundation with slight warmth from Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, maintaining depth and radiance rather than becoming ashen with age.', N'Heavily lined face that maps nine decades of attention and care. The lines reflect South Asian and Hispanic aging patterns—skin maintains elasticity and depth rather than becoming papery, with pronounced nasolabial folds characteristic of Hispanic/Latin American heritage and forehead creases deepened by decades of close observation. Eyes are bright and direct, with the warm, expressive eye shape and slightly wider-set placement characteristic of South Asian heritage blended with slightly fuller eyelids from Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Her expression defaults to slight amusement, as if she has seen something funny in nearly everything.', N'None. Her refusal of augmentation is deliberate and visible in its absence — she is one of very few people in the Gray Zone who displays no chrome, no implants, no visible neural interface. Her walker, decorated with woven wire charms and a small battery-powered fish-shaped light, is her only technological companion.', N'Moves slowly but with absolute intention, never hesitant. Uses her walker not as a crutch but as an anchor point for her presence — it becomes an extension of her social radius. She plants herself in her window like a flagpole. When she moves through the block, people part and reassemble around her trajectory.', N'Bright, deliberate colors — electric blues, hot oranges, vivid purples — in layered, comfortable fits that accommodate her build and her need to move freely. Heavy cotton, knit, nothing synthetic. Patterns that read like Tier 5 thrift and intention rather than poverty: a yellow print dress over a blue long-sleeved shirt, a purple cardigan with mismatched buttons that she has reinforced with bright thread. Worn slip-on shoes, sensible, scuffed. A shawl she wraps differently each day, color-coordinated with what she is wearing. Everything suggests someone with no money and absolute style.', N'Twenty years ago, she helped a young man named Declan Mwangi-Ferrer hide from what she understood to be corporate security. She sheltered him for nine days and helped him get out of the Gray Zone on a false transit ID she arranged through a contact. She recently learned that Declan was not running from corporate security — he was wanted for a violent assault on a woman in Precinct 3. She has not been able to find out what happened to the assault victim, and the uncertainty is eating her.', N'Rich and vernacular — she speaks the Gray Zone creole natively, with Luo and Greek surfacing in emotional passages; says exactly what she means without softening it; frequently funny without trying to be', N'Unhurried and conversational, with the rhythm of someone who has all day because she has decided to have all day', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'duyen_kulkarni_wickramasinghe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a640-7761-9b95-4785db5033bc', N'Benjamim Baek-Popescu', N'Benjamim', N'', N'Baek-Popescu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 50, NULL, 30, 1, N'active', N'The Narrows, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Fixer - Gambling connected', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Benjamim Baek-Popescu, 182cm tall, athletic frame with slight middle softness, cosmopolitan pan-continental ancestry visible in warm golden-olive skin tone and refined East-Central European facial structure with East Asian eye placement and South Asian warmth. Salt-and-pepper hair slicked back with pomade, dark brown eyes with amber undertones, clean-shaven with subtle jowl softening from age. Thin scar barely visible across left cheekbone. Wearing tailored charcoal suit with navy silk shirt, Italian leather shoes gleaming with obsessive polish. Platinum bracelet concealing neural-link interface on wrist, vintage mechanical watch, minimal gold jewelry. Centered posture suggesting subcutaneous neural enhancements. GLMZ, moody club lighting casting cool shadows across his golden complexion, deep neon blues and warm amber uplighting, sophisticated corporate-fringe aesthetic, late-night poker den or financial district lounge setting, air of quiet calculation and perpetual wakefulness --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Complex pan-continental ancestry dominated by Eastern European (31.8%) foundation with substantial East Asian (19.8%) and South Asian (17.2%) admixture, strengthened by Hispanic/Latin American (14.6%), Northern European (11.7%), and Sub-Saharan African (4.9%) components. Creates a striking phenotype blending Central European bone structure with warm South and East Asian undertones, broad Pan-Eurasian features suggesting multiple ancestral migrations, resulting in a genuinely cosmopolitan appearance that defies singular geographic origin.', 182, 78, N'Athletic, slightly soft at the middle from decades of club-sitting and Φ-backed meals. Broad shoulders, compact frame suggesting careful maintenance rather than active fitness.', N'Salt-and-pepper gray, natural with silver threading', N'Slicked back with pomade, precise side part', N'Medium (3-4cm)', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertone', N'Warm medium golden-olive, a sophisticated blend reflecting Eastern European base enriched by East Asian warmth, South Asian depth, and Sub-Saharan undertones. Golden luminescence across cheekbones and temples.', N'Well-groomed, minimal scarring. Slight jowl softening at the jawline from age. Clean-shaven. Facial structure shows strong Eastern European definition in broad jaw and cheekbone prominence, refined East Asian eye placement and eyelid shape, South Asian warmth in skin richness and complexion depth, subtle Sub-Saharan undertones in skin luminescence. Lines around eyes suggest chronic sleep deprivation and perpetual calculation.', N'None visible. Moves with the practiced fluidity of someone carrying subcutaneous neural enhancements, likely decision-support or financial parsing implants, but nothing chrome-obvious.', N'Centered weight, economical movement. Rarely gestures—when he does, it''s precise and meaningful. Habitually makes eye contact. Tendency to tap fingers rhythmically when thinking, as if mentally shuffling a deck.', N'Tier 2 independent: tailored charcoal suits from corporate-fringe tailors, silk shirts in muted colors (navy, cream, charcoal), Italian leather shoes kept obsessively polished. Omnipresent wrist accessories: vintage mechanical watch + discrete neural-link interface wrapped as a platinum bracelet. Overcoat in winter—wool blend, no logo. Jewelry minimal: gold wedding band (worn despite marital status unclear), one silver signet ring.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'benjamim_baek_popescu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('3fc3509f-f138-8be3-3654-4798d2ab308b', N'Hisako Traoré-Thakur', N'Hisako', N'', N'Traoré-Thakur', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A converted ground-floor storefront in the Narrows, deliberately non-threatening — children''s drawings on the walls, tea always available, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Private Investigator', N'Bright Path Recovery — her own firm, employing three junior associates', N'Hisako Traoré-Thakur runs Bright Path Recovery, the most effective missing-child operation in the Gray Zone. She is forty-seven years old, Swedish-Malian heritage evident in her honey-brown skin and angular features, and she has been doing this work for twenty-two years — ever since her own younger sister vanished into the Gray Zone''s underworld and was never found.

Her method is fundamentally relational. She has spent two decades building a network of contacts among the people who see everything but are never asked: street vendors, waste collectors, tunnel dwellers, feral children, shelter workers, and the quiet army of grandmothers who sit on the Gray Zone stoops watching the world. When a child goes missing, Amara activates this network like a nervous system, and information flows to her from a thousand points simultaneously. No technology can replicate what she''s built because it''s based on trust, and trust takes years.

The work pays well — desperate parents will mortgage everything for their child''s return — and Amara charges on a sliding scale, taking corporate rates from those who can afford it and working for free for those who can''t. She is chronically exhausted, carries the psychological weight of every child she''s failed to find, and refuses to take a vacation because every day off is a day someone''s kid is still out there. Her junior associates worry about her. They''re right to worry.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hisako Traoré-Thakur, 172cm lean-framed mixed-heritage woman with warm golden-brown skin blending Sub-Saharan African, Pacific Islander, and South Asian ancestry. High cheekbones, angular jawline, deep brown eyes with hazel warmth, faded scar across left cheekbone. Dark brown hair with silver threading, pulled back in practical braid. Dressed in fitted black cargo pants, long-sleeved thermal shirt, worn Resolute tactical boots. Thin silver ring on right index finger. Forward-leaning posture, alert and listening. Hands showing calluses from street work. Standing in neon-lit Milwaukee alleyway at dusk, rain-slicked pavement, GLMZ, moody atmospheric lighting casting shadows across weathered features. Minimal augmentation visible, deliberately human appearance. Tier 3-4 street operative aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A converted ground-floor storefront in the Narrows', N'local', N'A converted ground-floor storefront in the Narrows', N'Genetically mixed from the Ubiquitous Diaspora: Sub-Saharan African (27.7%), Pacific Islander (22.9%), South Asian (22.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (11.1%), East Asian (8.8%), and Southeast Asian (7.0%). This combination creates a striking multicultural phenotype with warm golden-brown skin that blends African depth with Pacific Islander olive undertones and South Asian warmth. Facial structure reflects this global ancestry—high cheekbones and angular jawline from West African lineage, combined with slightly broader face structure and softer eye shapes from East and Southeast Asian heritage. South Asian ancestry contributes to eye depth and subtle complexion warmth, while Hispanic/Latin American heritage adds definition to facial proportions.', 172, 62, N'Lean and angular, with the efficient musculature of someone who walks constantly through difficult terrain. No spare weight; posture suggests endurance rather than strength.', N'Dark brown with early silver threading at the temples', N'Worn in a simple, practical braid or bun, often coming loose by afternoon', N'Medium', N'Deep brown with warm hazel undertones and fine lines radiating from the corners', N'Warm golden-brown with balanced undertones reflecting the dominant blend of Sub-Saharan African, Pacific Islander, and South Asian ancestry. Rich, even complexion with natural depth, subtle olive warmth, and the sun-weathered patina of street work.', N'Angular features with high cheekbones and prominent jawline influenced by West African heritage, softened slightly by broader face structure from East and Southeast Asian ancestry. Dark, expressive eyes set wide-spaced, reflecting the multicultural genetic heritage. Minimal makeup. Skin shows the weathering of two decades of street work: sun damage, stress lines around the eyes and mouth. A faint scar tissue across her left cheekbone from a childhood incident. Hands are calloused, nails kept short and unpainted.', N'None visible. Any augmentations she carries are subcutaneous — possibly a low-grade neural logger or location tracker, but nothing chrome, nothing that would make her stand out in the Gray Zone. She keeps her modifications invisible intentionally; trust requires appearing human and vulnerable.', N'She moves with the economical gait of someone who has walked thousands of miles through the city. Her posture is forward-leaning, alert but not tense — a listening posture. She sits at the edge of chairs, ready to stand. Her hands gesture when she talks, a Malian inheritance. Her eyes track movement habitually; she notices everything but tries not to appear to be watching.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear. Dark colors — black, charcoal, deep indigo — that hide the grime of fieldwork. Usually: fitted black cargo pants with multiple pockets, a long-sleeved shirt or lightweight sweater (thermal-rated for Milwaukee winters), good walking boots (currently a pair of Resolute-brand tactical boots, scuffed and re-soled twice). She owns one professional blazer for meetings with wealthy clients, but it hangs unworn most days. She wears a watch — an older Casio, not flashy — and minimal jewelry except for a thin silver ring on her right index finger, a gift from her sister before the disappearance. No augmentation-ware visible; no corpo branding.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hisako_traor_thakur');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69e-761d-82c0-47ce0ce7ec68', N'Alondra Olofsson-Baiseitov', N'Alondra', N'', N'Olofsson-Baiseitov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Forensic Technician, Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division, Forensic Division, Deepwell Station Lab', N'Alondra Olofsson-Baiseitov is angular and precise — sharp cheekbones, long fingers perpetually stained faint violet from reactant solution, hair grown out in loose curls they keep loosely pinned and often forget about. Their skin is a warm amber-brown, and they have a single cosmetic mod — a patterned iris treatment that makes their eyes look like cracked obsidian with gold underneath, chosen because they liked the aesthetic at twenty-two and have never bothered to change it. They dress with the particular carelessness of someone who knows they''ll be in a lab coat within twenty minutes of leaving home anyway.

Deepwell Station''s forensic lab is their kingdom, and they are a benevolent but absolute ruler of it. They speak to evidence the way other people speak to colleagues — with expectation, with argument, with occasional grudging respect. They are extraordinarily good at their job and have the low-grade social difficulty of someone who spent their developmental years more interested in trace analysis than people. They are not unkind — they are simply operating on a slightly different frequency, one that detects molecular traces and misses tone of voice. They have a fierce, private ethical core and a growing horror at the gap between what their lab reports show and what the official case conclusions say.', N'Technical information source. The person who knows what actually happened versus what the record says. Moral witness to institutional corruption. Can provide forensic context for past events or reveal inconvenient truths that someone powerful wants buried.', N'', N'Patterned obsidian-gold iris mod (cosmetic). Neural processing chip for accelerated data correlation — Metro standard for forensics. Olfactory enhancement mods (professional — dramatically increased scent discrimination, hence ''the Bloodhound''). Fingertip haptic sensors for trace texture detection.', N'They arrive at the Deepwell lab before anyone else and leave after everyone. They subsist on vending machine protein bricks and the very good coffee they make in the lab''s corner unit. They keep a private shadow-log of every case where their forensic conclusions were altered or buried before trial.', N'Alondra Olofsson-Baiseitov, 178cm lean angular frame with slight forward hunch, warm medium-brown skin with golden-olive undertones from Southeast Asian-Central Asian-South Asian heritage blend. High prominent cheekbones, defined jawline. Long dark brown curly hair shoulder-length, half-pinned with lab pen, loose tendrils escaping. Patterned iris modification: obsidian base with fine gold fracture-lines like cracked stone. Small temple scar. Violet staining visible on fingertips from reactant solutions. Wearing wrinkled grey lab coat over dark synthetic tech-weave top, cargo pants with equipment pockets, scuffed black ankle boots. Hunched posture over microscope or evidence table in modern GLMZ forensics lab, cool LED lighting casting gold fractals from iris augmentation across lab equipment. Tired, focused expression, hands active near trace evidence samples. GLMZ, meticulous trace analyst aesthetic, functional working-class gear, no corporate branding. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Complex diaspora blend: Southeast Asian foundation (36.9%) with substantial Central Asian (25.3%) and South Asian (12.3%) components, accented by North African (10.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (8.8%), and Sub-Saharan African (5.9%) ancestry. This creates a distinctive warm medium-brown skin tone with golden-olive undertones, refined cheekbones from Southeast/South Asian genetics, and subtle warmth from the North African and Sub-Saharan African contributions. The result is a harmonious blending across all visible features.', 178, 62, N'Angular and lean, all sharp planes and efficient geometry. Long-limbed with a slight forward hunch from years bent over lab benches. Chest narrow, shoulders slightly rounded from posture. Wrists thin enough to slip easily into precision-work gloves.', N'Natural dark brown with warm undertones', N'Loose, loose curls worn long and typically half-pinned with whatever clip was closest at hand — usually a pen, sometimes a lab marker. Frequently escapes.', N'Long (shoulder-length, often longer on one side)', N'Patterned iris mod: obsidian-black base with fine gold fracture-pattern throughout, giving the appearance of cracked stone with warm metal underneath. Natural pupil and sclera structure preserved.', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones, reflecting Southeast Asian and Central Asian dominance with warmer contributions from South Asian, North African, and Sub-Saharan African heritage', N'Clean, minimal grooming emphasis. Prominent high cheekbones and defined jawline characteristic of Southeast and South Asian features with subtle warmth from North African ancestry. Skin clear but with faint violet staining around the cuticles and under fingernails from reactant solutions — a mark they don''t bother to remove. Small scar on left temple, barely visible, from a lab accident at twenty-five.', N'Obsidian-gold patterned iris mods (immediately visible). Fingertips show minimal scarring and unusual smoothness from haptic sensor integration — noticeable under close inspection. No visible chrome or external augmentation hardware. Olfactory and neural processing mods are subcutaneous/internal.', N'Forward-leaning stance, shoulders slightly hunched as if perpetually leaning toward a microscope or evidence table. Movements are precise and economical — no wasted motion. Hands are active, often gesturing when explaining trace evidence. Walking gait is slightly hurried, rhythm of someone moving between tasks. Resting expression is faintly distant, as if processing multiple data streams.', N'Tier 3 working-class pragmatism: dark neutral colors (charcoal, black, muted blue) chosen for lab practicality rather than fashion. Standard-fit synthetic-blend cargo pants with deep pockets, usually containing evidence bags, calipers, or sampling equipment. Loose long-sleeved shirts or fitted tech-weave tops that allow arm mobility. Worn grey or black lab coat, perpetually wrinkled, with pens and markers in the breast pocket. Comfortable, scuffed ankle boots with good grip for wet lab floors. Almost no jewelry except a worn titanium watch that syncs to the lab database. No corporate branding visible — their uniform is function, not affiliation.', N'Their shadow-log now contains suppressed forensic data from fourteen cases, including two in which the Metro-official perpetrator was demonstrably not present at the crime scene. They have been sitting on this for two years and they do not know what they''re waiting for — courage, or the right person, or proof that either of those things exists.', N'Technical when discussing their work — precise, specific, full of discipline jargon. In personal conversation: slightly stilted, over-explains things, sometimes trails off mid-sentence when something more interesting occurs to them.', N'Fast when engaged with an interesting problem. Slow and careful when they''re saying something they''ve decided matters.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alondra_olofsson_baiseitov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a636-7a59-b352-47e4a2b8818b', N'Aneesh Boateng-Subramaniam', N'Aneesh', N'', N'Boateng-Subramaniam', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 30, NULL, 25, 2, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Fixer - Newcomer guide', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Aneesh Boateng-Subramaniam, a 172cm lean angular woman with rich warm brown skin and golden undertones, dark brown hair with copper undertones pulled into a practical crown braid. Dark brown eyes with amber flecks, fuller cheekbones and generous lips refined by defined bone structure. Faint three-line scarification on right temple, small scar through left eyebrow, thin burn scar on left inner wrist, compass rose tattoo on collarbone. Wearing fitted black turtleneck, worn charcoal cargo vest with multiple pockets, dark indigo reinforced denim, scuffed polymer composite boots, faded denim jacket with hand-stitched neighborhood patches. Slim Φ-chip reader watch on right wrist, thin silver chain with key fob around neck. Alert upright posture, economical graceful movement, eyes constantly assessing surroundings. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon-lit corridor, moody atmospheric lighting, professional courier aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (65.1%) with significant South Asian (12.0%), North African (8.0%), and minor Eastern European (6.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (5.7%), and Northern European (2.4%) ancestry. The combination manifests in her rich, warm brown complexion with subtle golden undertones. Her facial structure shows the fuller cheekbones, generous lips, and warm eye depth characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage, refined by the defined bone structure and slight facial angularity of her South Asian ancestry. North African warmth adds depth to her features, while Hispanic/Latin American and Eastern European ancestry contribute subtle dimensionality to her overall appearance.', 172, 61, N'Lean and angular, with defined shoulders and wiry forearms — built for mobility rather than strength. Suggests someone who moves frequently through tight spaces.', N'Deep brown with natural copper undertones', N'Pulled back in a practical crown braid, occasionally loose', N'Long (below shoulders when unbraided)', N'Dark brown with subtle amber flecks', N'Rich warm brown mid-to-deep tone with golden undertones—the luminous result of Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and North African ancestry blending into a unified warmth, with subtle warmth variations reflecting her diverse heritage mix', N'Clear skin with fine laugh lines around her eyes. Minimal makeup — usually just brow definition and a lip stain. A small scar runs through her left eyebrow (old break, never quite healed straight). Her face shows the fuller cheekbones and generous lip structure of her Sub-Saharan African heritage, refined by the defined bone structure of her South Asian ancestry, with warmth and character throughout created by her North African and Latin American heritage.', N'None visible. All augmentations are subcutaneous or internal.', N'Upright, alert. She moves with economical grace — no wasted motion. Eyes constantly assess spaces and people. Hands gesture expressively when speaking, especially when explaining routes or deals. Leans in when listening, creating false intimacy to build trust.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional. Favors practical layering: fitted black turtlenecks, worn charcoal cargo vests with multiple pockets, reinforced denim in dark indigo. Boots are always clean but scuffed — good-quality polymer composite, not chrome. A faded denim jacket with hand-stitched patches (different neighborhoods she''s guided people through) is her signature piece. Wears a slim Φ-chip reader watch on her right wrist and a thin silver chain with a small key fob (contents unknown) around her neck.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aneesh_boateng_subramaniam');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a666-79bd-890a-47fa357a4e93', N'Bastiaan Migizi', N'Bastiaan', N'', N'Migizi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, Bronzeline, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Clothing and fashion vendor; bootleg geneware accessory reseller', N'Independent; active member of The Oxidian Market Vendors Guild; informal network of Bronzeline creative vendors', N'Bastiaan Migizi is striking in the way that seems effortless and is actually the product of deliberate daily work. Their skin is deep blue-black with a natural gloss that they enhance with a light bioluminescent topcoat — a Dresdan-style application they refresh monthly. Their hair changes color every week: not because they can''t commit but because they enjoy documenting the range. Currently it''s a deep copper that catches the Burnished Market''s overhead lighting like something combustible. They are average height and lean with expressive hands that are usually in motion — demonstrating a garment''s fall, illustrating a point, arranging display rails.

Bastiaan Migizi''s stall is the most visually intense corner of the Burnished Market — fabrics from three continents of origin pinned and layered on a frame structure they built themselves, geneware accessories in glass cases, color-changing hair treatments in a cooled rack. They have what their regulars call ''the eye'' — the ability to look at a person and know within seconds what they should be wearing and why. It is genuinely uncanny. They are also charming in the fast, inclusive way of someone who makes every customer feel like they''ve been personally selected for good taste. Underneath this, Bastiaan Migizi is angrier than they look and more strategic than their warmth implies.', N'Social connector, fashion and identity resource, and ground-level political temperature gauge. Nkosi knows what people are wearing, which means they know what people are signaling — which factions are rising, which aesthetics are becoming coded as resistance or allegiance. Characters who need a new look, information about who''s who in Bronzeline''s social landscape, or access to the creative community come here.', N'', N'Color-reactive iris modification — their irises shift between gold and deep violet depending on ambient light and mood (they claim the mood-reactive part is real; it might be). Bioluminescent dermal topcoat (cosmetic, requires monthly renewal). Subdermal NFC chip in left wrist — payment processing and inventory management.', N'Late mornings doing inventory and sourcing from Bronzeline''s textile district contacts; stall open noon to 2100. Spends evenings either at Vendors Guild meetings or at one of Bronzeline''s creative-collective gatherings where they are a known and opinionated presence.', N'Bastiaan Migizi, 2226 neo-noir character with warm golden-brown skin and bioluminescent dermal topcoat glowing subtly in low light. 173cm lean angular build with defined shoulders. Medium shoulder-length copper hair with natural iridescence, styled asymmetrically. Color-reactive eyes shifting between warm gold and violet—cybernetic iris modification visible and striking. Expressive face with East Asian-dominant bone structure softened by Southeast Asian and Indigenous American features, high cheekbones, slightly broader midface, precise mouth. Faint silver subdermal scarring visible on left wrist. Wearing intentionally eclectic asymmetrical neo-noir fashion—jewel tones and metallics, layered with unexpected fabric combinations, custom statement jewelry and dyed wraps. Hands gesturing expressively mid-conversation. Posture relaxed but alert, observant, economical movement. Dark neon-lit urban setting in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Moody atmospheric lighting emphasizing bioluminescent skin glow. Intimate, introspective mood. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Complex multicontinental blend: 48% East Asian base combined with 20% Southeast Asian, 13% Indigenous American, 10% Hispanic/Latin American, 7% Sub-Saharan African, and 1% South Asian. This creates warm medium-golden skin with rich depth and a striking fusion of facial structure—East Asian eye shape and bone structure softened and enriched by Southeast Asian and Indigenous American prominence, with Sub-Saharan African feature richness and warmth throughout. The result is distinctly multicontinental without reading as any single heritage.', 173, 62, N'Lean and angular with defined shoulders and long limbs; posture suggests constant motion even at rest. Zero excess adipose — the build of someone who moves for work and doesn''t accumulate.', N'Currently deep copper with natural iridescence; changes weekly', N'Textured and deliberately styled to catch light; usually pinned or wrapped in ways that frame their face asymmetrically', N'Medium (shoulder-length when down)', N'Color-reactive iris modification: shifts between warm gold and deep violet depending on ambient light and emotional state; pupils respond to mood and environment', N'Warm medium-golden with natural depth and undertones reflecting the East Asian-Southeast Asian-Indigenous American blend, enhanced monthly with bioluminescent Dresdan-style topcoat that gives the skin a subtle luminescence in low light', N'Smooth, intentionally maintained skin with high contrast against the bioluminescent layer. Immaculate grooming; the kind of person who treats their appearance as a daily practice, not an accident. Expressive face combining East Asian and Southeast Asian feature prominence with defined cheekbones, slightly broader across the midface from Indigenous American ancestry, and a precise mouth.', N'Color-reactive irises are immediately noticeable — they shift from gold to violet based on lighting and mood, creating an uncanny depth. Bioluminescent dermal topcoat gives the skin a subtle glow in dim light, most visible on shoulders and cheekbones. Left wrist shows minimal scarring from NFC chip installation.', N'Hands are almost never still — gesturing while speaking, rearranging fabric, illustrating a point with precision. They move with deliberate grace, economical and purposeful. Standing posture is relaxed but alert; they appear to be observing while talking. When listening, they lean in slightly.', N'Intentionally eclectic and curated — always wearing pieces from their own stall or pieces they''ve modified. Favors asymmetrical silhouettes, unexpected fabric combinations, and layering that creates visual depth. Tends toward jewel tones and metallics. Accessories are always statement pieces: custom jewelry, dyed wraps, pins that double as fasteners and art. Tier 3-4 quality materials elevated through styling and personal modification. Everything signals taste and intention rather than wealth.', N'', N'Fluid and fashion-forward — they use aesthetic vocabulary the way others use emotional vocabulary. Precise about color, texture, silhouette. Socially warm and quick with a compliment that always feels specific rather than generic.', N'Animated and variable — speeds up when excited, slows down to make a point land. Uses physical gesture as punctuation.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bastiaan_migizi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a613-7eb8-ba5c-481d300fe9fc', N'Ananya Čabarkapa', N'Ananya', N'', N'Čabarkapa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 30, 1, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Kedzie and Division', N'Fixer - Community fixer', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Ananya Čabarkapa, 168cm, solid compact build with broad shoulders, medium-deep golden-copper skin tone reflecting Indigenous American, South Asian and Eastern European ancestry. High pronounced cheekbones, strong jawline, deep brown eyes with hazel rings, weathered complexion with fine lines and small faded eyebrow scar. Salt-and-pepper black short hair, currently wrapped in cream headwrap. Wearing weathered linen jacket in tan over functional underlayers, dark brown worn boots, simple silver bangle on right wrist, leather cord at neck. Faded indigo geometric tattoo visible on right forearm. Grounded posture, steady evaluative gaze, hands visible and open. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, GLMZ, interior industrial setting with warm amber and cool neon lighting, her solid presence commanding quiet authority, matte surface textures, practical utilitarian aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Indigenous American (56.0%) forms the dominant phenotype, with significant South Asian (16.2%), Eastern European (12.2%), and Middle Eastern (11.5%) ancestry creating subtle but visible features. The result is a woman whose bone structure—high, prominent cheekbones and defined jawline—reflects deep Indigenous American roots, while her skin tone and facial warmth carry the blended influence of South and Central Asian heritage. Eastern European and Middle Eastern ancestry contribute to her strong facial definition and the golden undertones in her complexion. A true Ubiquitous Diaspora product: ancestrally complex, phenotypically grounded in the Americas with distinct Eurasian refinement.', 168, 72, N'Solid, compact frame with broad shoulders and a deliberate heaviness that comes from decades of physical work and street presence. Not soft, not lean — grounded.', N'Salt-and-pepper black, with natural silver threading at the temples', N'Wrapped in a cream-colored headwrap most days, occasionally worn loose in a close-cropped fade', N'Short', N'Deep brown with light hazel rings — the effect of age and intensity', N'Medium to medium-deep with warm golden-copper undertones. A sun-weathered complexion that reflects Indigenous American foundation with South and Middle Eastern warmth—rich, luminous, marked by decades of outdoor presence and honest living.', N'Weathered but well-maintained. Fine lines around the eyes and mouth from years of reading situations and smiling. A small scar bisects her left eyebrow — old, faded. Skin shows the texture of someone who works outdoors and doesn''t hide from the sun. High, pronounced cheekbones with the characteristic width of Indigenous American ancestry; defined jawline with the subtle angularity of South Asian and Eastern European heritage. Strong facial structure reflecting ancestral geography of the Americas with distinct Eurasian refinement at the planes and contours.', N'None visible. Her augmentations, if any, are subcutaneous or internal — she operates on trust and reputation, not chrome.', N'Moves with deliberate economy. Plants her feet when she stops — grounded stance. Doesn''t fidget. Her gaze is steady and evaluative; she watches more than she speaks. Hands stay visible and open, a habit of someone who defuses rather than escalates. Walks with the weight of authority earned, not inherited.', N'Tier 3-4 practical. Favors neutral earth tones: cream, tan, dark brown. Wears a weathered linen jacket over functional underlayers — multiple pockets, reinforced seams. Good boots, well-maintained but clearly worn. A simple silver bangle on her right wrist and a thin leather cord around her neck (religious or protective, intentionally understated). No visible logos or corpo affiliations. Everything chosen for durability and community respect, not status signaling.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ananya_abarkapa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c9-769b-b2bf-482917b4a65c', N'Agastya Phommasack-Delgado', N'Agastya', N'', N'Phommasack-Delgado', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Harrowgate Industrial Plateau, near Halsted and Division', N'Junk merchant and scrap reseller — salvage, broken augmentations, mystery components', N'Independent; owes protection fees to a local outfit called the Harrowgate Tongs who he''s three months behind on', N'Agastya Phommasack-Delgado is a stocky, perpetually grease-smudged man whose Indonesian-Ethiopian features have been weathered by twenty years of Harrowgate''s industrial air into something that looks carved rather than grown. He has a magnificent mustache he tends with more care than anything else in his life, and his left eye is a salvaged optical implant three generations out of date that gives everything a faint amber tint and occasionally displays error codes in his peripheral vision that he''s learned to ignore. His hands are enormous and scarred, and he can identify a component by touch alone in the dark. His stall is a magnificent catastrophe: towers of sorted scrap in a system only he understands, with handwritten price tags that rarely match what he actually charges.

Agastya Phommasack-Delgado is irrepressibly cheerful in the way that only someone who has completely stopped expecting things to go well can be. He finds everything slightly funny, including disasters, including his own. He narrates his life as if it''s a story he''s telling to someone who will appreciate it later. He genuinely loves salvage — not for profit, which is good because he''s terrible at profit, but because every broken thing is a puzzle and he likes puzzles. He has an encyclopedic knowledge of augmentation components from five different decades and will talk about them at length to anyone who doesn''t flee quickly enough. He is not stupid. He is simply constitutionally incapable of prioritizing money over curiosity.', N'Equipment source for unusual or obsolete components; information source about the Harrowgate area and its industrial history; comic relief that contains genuine pathos; could accidentally possess something extremely valuable or dangerous.', N'', N'Salvaged third-generation optical implant (left eye, amber-tinted, glitchy error codes). Reinforced knuckle plating on both hands — utility, not combat, for breaking down salvage. No geneware.', N'Arrives at the stall before dawn to assess overnight salvage runs; spends mornings sorting and pricing; afternoons haggling and taking apart things he shouldn''t; evenings at a bar called the Oxidized Nail arguing with other vendors about component history.', N'Agastya Phommasack-Delgado, 172cm salvage worker in the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226. Stocky broad-shouldered build with warm deep bronze skin glowing with golden and reddish undertones, reflecting Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic/Latin American, and Southeast Asian ancestry. Weather-beaten face with broad cheekbones, deep nasolabial folds, crow''s feet; defined structure showing East Asian influence. Striking thick black mustache with silver threading, meticulously waxed and curled at ends. Left eye is a mechanical optical implant with amber lens and green error glitches; right eye natural dark brown. Dark brown hair peppered with grey, short and matted with industrial dust. Extensive scarring on knuckles and hand backs; thin burn scar from left temple to jaw partially hidden by mustache. Grease-stained, oil-weathered complexion. Wearing layered worn canvas work shirts over faded thermal, heavily stained, reinforced work pants with cargo pockets, patched coat from multiple garments stitched with wire, steel-toed boots held together with duct tape. Harness with chains and carabiners. Reinforced chrome and steel knuckle plating on both hands. Moving with economical shuffle in tight salvage tower space, hands in constant motion examining salvage components. Industrial particulate-dulled skin. Neo-noir salvage aesthetic, functional and unpretentious. Harsh neon and rust-orange industrial lighting, shadows from massive salvage machinery. Gritty, worn, authentic post-industrial worker. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora ancestry: 37% Hispanic/Latin American, 33.5% Sub-Saharan African, 12.7% Southeast Asian, 8.3% East Asian, 5.8% North African, and 2.7% South Asian. His features reflect this intricate blend: warm deep bronze skin with golden and reddish undertones from the combined African, Latin American, and Southeast Asian heritage; broad cheekbones and defined facial structure from East Asian and Southeast Asian ancestry; facial proportions that echo Latin American and North African lineage. The result is a richly textured phenotype marked by warm, complex undertones rather than a single dominant heritage.', 172, 94, N'Stocky and broad-shouldered with the dense musculature of someone who''s spent two decades hauling salvage. His frame carries weight low and solid, without softness — functional rather than cultivated.', N'Dark brown, peppered with grey', N'Short and unkempt, rarely combed, often matted with industrial dust and machine oil', N'Short', N'Left eye: salvaged optical implant with amber lens displaying faint error glitches; Right eye: natural dark brown', N'Warm deep bronze with golden and reddish undertones reflecting the blend of Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic/Latin American, and Southeast Asian ancestry; dulled by years of Harrowgate industrial particulates; weathered and lined with visible ashiness from chronic exposure to rust-laden air', N'Heavily weathered face with broad cheekbones and defined structure reflecting Southeast Asian and East Asian heritage, warmed by Sub-Saharan African and Latin American ancestry. Deep nasolabial folds, crow''s feet from constant squinting at small components. His most striking feature is his mustache — thick, well-waxed, jet-black with silver threading, meticulously groomed and curled at the ends, a cultural grooming choice he''s maintained through decades of salvage work. His face is perpetually smudged with grease and calibration dust.', N'Left eye is obviously mechanical — an older-generation optical unit with a slightly misaligned amber lens housing and occasional green error code text flickering in his peripheral vision (which he ignores). Both hands display reinforced knuckle plating: dull chrome and steel caps welded over his metacarpals, worn and scratched from constant use but functional and unpretentious.', N'He moves with a careful, economical shuffle — the gait of someone who''s learned to navigate tight spaces between salvage towers without wasting energy. His hands are always in motion, turning things over, testing weight, running fingers across surfaces. When standing still, he leans slightly forward as if perpetually about to lean into a new puzzle. His left eye often clicks audibly as it refocuses.', N'Tier 4-5 salvage worker aesthetic. Layers of worn canvas work shirts, usually unbuttoned over a faded thermal, both stained with grease that has become part of the fabric''s character. Heavy reinforced work pants with cargo pockets, each one containing unidentifiable components and tools. A patched canvas coat from perhaps three different garments, stitched together with visible wire. Steel-toed boots held together by duct tape and stubbornness. He wears a harness with loose chains and carabiners for hauling salvage. No corporate branding, no pretense — everything is utility and history.', N'Six months ago, in a salvage haul from a demolished Axiom subsidiary building, Branko pulled a data core he can''t open, can''t identify, and can''t stop thinking about. He''s hidden it inside a disemboweled coffee maker behind his counter. He has shown it to exactly one person — a data broker friend who went quiet and stopped returning his messages three days later. Branko has not connected these two events, which is both his greatest protection and his greatest danger.', N'Rambling and associative; technical precision about components coexists with complete vagueness about everything else; Croatian-inflected sentence structures from his Balkan paternal line', N'Fast when excited, which is most of the time; accelerates when discussing salvage until he''s almost incomprehensible', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'agastya_phommasack_delgado');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a685-71f9-abe7-483cc8fe51ac', N'Obinna Erikstad-Mukherjee', N'Obinna', N'', N'Erikstad-Mukherjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 42, NULL, 25, 2, N'active', N'The Core, near State and Monroe', N'Fixer - Ringo proxy', N'Ringo', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Portrait of Obinna Erikstad-Mukherjee, 42-year-old man with rich warm brown skin, golden and olive undertones, strong defined jawline, high cheekbones, dark brown hooded eyes with subtle East Asian fold. Steel gray hair with black undertones in tight fade. Thin white scar on left cheekbone, faint burn mark visible on right hand. Clean-shaven with evening stubble. Athletic compact build, 178cm tall. Wearing charcoal wool slacks and dark fitted turtleneck under worn expensive Suomi leather jacket, simple stainless steel watch. Economical posture, controlled movement, listening expression. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone corporate district, 2226, cool blue-gray neo-noir lighting, subtle augmented reality interface visible in his eyes, moody and observant --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Core', N'local', N'The Core', N'A striking global genetic blend from the Ubiquitous Diaspora: South Asian (26.9%), Sub-Saharan African (24.2%), Northern European (20.4%), Southeast Asian (16.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (6.5%), and East Asian (5.8%). This unique combination creates a distinctive phenotype—warm deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones from South Asian and Southeast Asian ancestry, strong defined facial structure from Sub-Saharan African genetics, refined eye shape with subtle epicanthic fold from East Asian heritage, and bone structure refinement from Northern European ancestry. The result is a face that carries multiple continents with natural harmony.', 178, 82, N'Athletic and compact, shoulders broad from decades of fieldwork, no excess fat—the kind of frame that moves efficiently through tight spaces and stays functional under stress', N'Steel gray with black undertones', N'Closely cropped fade, maintained weekly', N'Short', N'Dark brown, slightly hooded with subtle East Asian epicanthic fold', N'Rich warm brown with golden and olive undertones, deeply pigmented from balanced Sub-Saharan African and South Asian ancestry, with subtle warmth from Northern European genetics', N'Weathered but well-maintained; fine lines around the eyes and mouth from forty-two years of reading rooms and situations; strong, defined jawline reflecting Sub-Saharan African heritage; moderate-to-high cheekbones with balanced structure from South Asian and Southeast Asian genetics; clean-shaven except for thin line of stubble by evening', N'None visible. Keeps chrome invisible—subcutaneous neural overlay for augmented reality feeds, internal comms, encrypted data access. A stranger would notice nothing.', N'Economical and controlled. Stands with weight balanced, never sprawling. Moves through space with deliberate intent, each gesture minimal but communicative. Listens more than talks; eyes track everything. Hands rest in lap or pockets—never exposed', N'Tier 2 corporate casual that reads as understated wealth. Charcoal wool slacks, dark fitted turtlenecks or simple dress shirts in black or gray, a worn but expensive leather jacket (Suomi make, pre-2200s). No logos, no flash. A simple stainless steel watch, nothing smart', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'obinna_erikstad_mukherjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f2-7a3c-80e4-488024a4cb30', N'Soledad Bautista', N'Soledad', N'', N'Bautista', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ashfield — former residential district, half-burned, now squatter territory, near Halsted and Division', N'Infrastructure disruption and industrial sabotage — saboteur', N'Independent — loose crew affiliations', N'Soledad Bautista is tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 61, her face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see her surpass them. She works as a saboteur out of Ashfield, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Soledad Bautista is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who she burned last.', N'Djeneba Magnusson-Camara functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone. Bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Soledad Bautista, 183cm tall angular woman with weathered golden-brown skin bearing complex warm undertones from blended Hispanic, Southeast Asian, South Asian and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Steel gray hair braided back, dark amber-brown eyes with nocturnal intensity. High prominent cheekbones, broad nose bridge, subtle jawline depth. Diagonal chemical burn scar across left temple, parallel white burn scars on right forearm, small faded blue Mandinka geometric tattoo on left wrist. Chrome dual intake ports visible in nasal passages with iridescent sheen. Wearing dark reinforced canvas work pants, black thermal under weathered gunmetal tech-weave jacket with tool loops, steel-toed boots. Simple functional metal cuff on left wrist. Posture forward-leaning and economical, hands with occupational tension. Standing in dimly lit industrial near-future megacity setting, neon glow reflecting off chrome augmentations, gritty Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, 2226. Moody nocturnal atmosphere, cool and warm lighting interplay highlighting her multitonal complexion. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfield', N'local', N'Ashfield', N'Soledad carries the genetic signature of the Ubiquitous Diaspora: 53.5% Hispanic/Latin American foundation blended with Southeast Asian (13.0%), Northern European (12.4%), South Asian (10.9%), East Asian (7.0%), and Sub-Saharan African (3.2%) ancestry. This creates a distinctly multitonal appearance — angular cheekbones with Southeast and East Asian prominence, broad nose bridge from Hispanic genetics, subtle jawline depth from South Asian heritage, and warm undertonal richness from Sub-Saharan African contribution. Her facial structure reads as neither specifically one heritage nor another, but rather the natural product of generations of global mixing.', 183, 68, N'Rawboned and angular — long-limbed with minimal body fat, the wiry efficiency of someone who treats her body as a tool rather than an ornament. Decades of field work have stripped away anything excess. Shoulder blades prominent, hands large and calloused.', N'Steel gray with remnant black at the roots', N'Pulled back in a utilitarian braid, typically wrapped or pinned to keep it clear of work', N'Long (to mid-back when unbound)', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertones, natural but intensity sharpened by nocturnal living', N'Warm golden-brown with complex undertones — the result of blended Hispanic, Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African genetics. Decades under artificial lighting have deepened it into something richer and more multitonal than any single ancestry typically produces, with a luminous quality from the interplay of multiple regional genetic contributions.', N'Weathered and lined — face map of close calls. High, angular cheekbones with Southeast Asian prominence, broader nose bridge reflecting Hispanic ancestry, with subtle depth at the jawline from South Asian heritage. Skin has a papery quality from age and chronic dehydration common to field operatives. Minimal grooming — function over appearance.', N'Chrome assembly visible in nasal passages — dual intake ports with faint iridescent sheen visible from certain angles, especially in profile or when she exhales near light. The ports are functional, not cosmetic, no effort made to hide the industrial look. No visible LED indicators or softening — pure unadorned chrome.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Spine straight but not rigid. Hands rarely idle; fingers tap or manipulate nearby objects during conversations, occupational habit. Turns her whole body rather than just her head when observing — old paranoia training. Default stance is slightly forward-leaning, ready to move. Nocturnal living has sharpened her already keen spatial awareness — she navigates dark spaces with uncommon confidence.', N'Tier 4 practical: dark canvas multi-pocket work pants, reinforced at stress points. Black or charcoal fitted thermals under a weathered gunmetal-gray tech-weave jacket with internal compartments and tool loops. Steel-toed boots, broken in but well-maintained. Minimal jewelry — a simple metal cuff on left wrist (functional, not decorative). No corporate branding or status signaling. Everything chosen for durability, mobility, and the ability to carry gear. Clothes bear the wear patterns of someone who actually uses them, not costume.', N'Djeneba Magnusson-Camara can''t read. Hides it behind voice interfaces and memorization. The shame is older than the chrome.', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'soledad_bautista');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f6-753e-93d4-48a0771262c1', N'Fattaneh Mazurek', N'Fattaneh', N'', N'Mazurek', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 48, NULL, 17.5, 4, N'active', N'Underworld B3, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Fixer - Underworld broker', N'Tessera Corponation (mid-level fixer)', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'GLMZ, portrait of Fattaneh Mazurek: 188cm tall, heavily muscled frame with weathered tan skin bearing olive and amber undertones. East European bone structure with warm, blended ancestry features—defined jaw softened by Latin and Indigenous proportions. Dark brown eyes with yellowed sclera, black hair streaking grey pulled back in loose ponytail, sides shaved. Three-day stubble, deep laugh lines, small scar through left eyebrow. Burn scar visible on right hand. Worn charcoal synth-leather jacket over unbuttoned cream linen shirt, dark cargo pants, scuffed steel-toed boots. Silver chain with encrypted data chip pendant. Seated heavy in shadow, faint limp visible, shoulders forward. Fixer''s caution in posture, faint diesel and static atmosphere. Low industrial lighting, GLMZ underground setting. Photorealistic, weathered, authentically lived-in. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Underworld B3', N'local', N'Underworld B3', N'Eastern European foundation (48.2%) provides strong bone structure—prominent cheekbones and defined jaw—layered with substantial Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (28.9%) that softens those angles and adds warmth to facial proportions. East Asian heritage (9.6%) contributes subtle epicanthic variation and refined eye shape. Indigenous American (5.9%) and Southeast Asian (4.2%) ancestry add depth to complexion warmth and facial character, while Sub-Saharan African heritage (3.2%) enriches undertones. The result is a phenotypically integrated face that resists categorization: Eastern European structure married to warm, complex coloration, with ancestral echoes from five continents creating seamless blending rather than visible contrast.', 188, 104, N'Heavily muscled, broad-shouldered frame running to fat around the midsection—the body of someone who once moved for a living and now mostly sits. Thick neck, powerful forearms.', N'Black with grey streaking at the temples', N'Pulled back in a loose, greying ponytail; sides shaved close', N'Long', N'Dark brown, slightly yellowed sclera', N'Warm tan with complex olive, golden, and amber undertones—the basecoat of Eastern European ancestry enriched by Hispanic/Latin American warmth, Indigenous American depth, and Southeast Asian character. Sun-damaged and weathered despite decades underground, with visible texture from age and exposure. No single regional descriptor fits; the tone is distinctly blended.', N'Strong, defined face with moderate cheekbones characteristic of Eastern European heritage, broadened and softened by Hispanic/Latin American and Indigenous American ancestry proportions. Heavy jaw shows Eastern European strength tempered by warmer, fuller facial architecture from Latin and Indigenous heritage. Deep laugh lines around the eyes. Three-day stubble habit. Small scar through the left eyebrow from an old blade cut.', N'None visible. His hands show no chrome, his eyes are unremarkable. Any modifications are subcutaneous or so old they''ve integrated into flesh.', N'Moves with deliberate weight, economical gestures. Sits heavy in a chair. When standing, shoulders slightly rolled forward. Speaks with his hands less than he listens with them—a fixer''s caution. Walks with a faint limp in the left leg from an old injury.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian: worn synth-leather jacket in charcoal, unbranded but quality. Loose linen shirt underneath, cream-coloured, collar always unbuttoned. Dark cargo pants with multiple pockets and zip-offs, practical and worn. Steel-toed boots, scuffed. A simple silver chain around his neck with a data chip pendant—encrypted, never accessed in public. No flash, no logos. Clothes smell faintly of diesel and static.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fattaneh_mazurek');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6bc-732e-925c-48c181c12e8b', N'Dmitry Olofsson', N'Dmitry', N'', N'Olofsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Irkalla district — operates from a converted laundry kiosk two blocks from the Deepwell Station entrance, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Street pharmacist — sells stabilized street compounds, harm-reduction supplies, and carefully dosed neurochemical assists', N'Independent; informal cooperation agreement with The Narrows mutual aid collective; has a tense but functional working relationship with the Irkalla district''s Palladian Health satellite clinic staff who quietly refer overflow patients to him', N'Dmitry Olofsson has the kind of face that makes people feel immediately like he already knows what they need, which is either a gift or a vulnerability depending on the day. He is lean and medium-height, olive-skinned with his Uzbek grandmother''s dark eyes and his Nigerian grandfather''s wide mouth, with natural color-changing hair he keeps in tight curls that shift from blue-black to deep copper depending on his mood — an older geneware modification that he got cheap and has grown fond of. He wears clean clothes, which is notable in the Narrows, and keeps his hands conspicuously steady at all times, which is also notable.

He is the thing people need him to be when they come to him, which is not the same as being dishonest — he is genuinely trying to help. He believes harm reduction is a moral act and that the people who have criminalized it are the ones who should be ashamed. He has a rigorous self-taught pharmacological education that would probably have qualified him for a Helix Biosystems lab position if he had the citizenship grade. He prays to the Deepwell E.L.F. — a transit spirit he''s come to think of as his silent partner — and leaves small offerings of stabilized compound residue in its shrine nook every time he passes.', N'Point of access to the Narrows'' underground health ecosystem; can provide information about who is sick, who is using, and who is afraid; has knowledge of neurochemical compounds that crosses legitimate and illegitimate use cases', N'', N'Color-changing hair geneware (blue-black to copper, mood-responsive, old gen); basic augmented olfactory sensor (helps him assess compound purity by scent — cheap Ringo model, functional)', N'He is at his kiosk from mid-morning through the early hours; takes patient intake seriously and will not rush a transaction if someone needs to talk; sleeps in rotating four-hour blocks and is chronically under-rested.', N'GLMZ, Dmitry Olofsson, 173cm lean wiry pharmacist with mood-responsive copper-bronze to blue-black geneware curls, dark brown alert eyes with Southeast Asian eye-set, angular face with prominent Central Asian cheekbones softened by warm golden-bronze skin tone with olive undertones blending Sub-Saharan and Hispanic warmth, gaunt focused expression with permanent dark circles, ritual burn scar on right wrist, chemical-stained fingertips, steady hands, long dexterous fingers, muted grey-charcoal long-sleeved synthetic shirt, practical worn but maintained footwear, standing with economical stillness in Tier 5 location pharmacy interior, faint red irritation around nostril hint of olfactory augmentation, neon-dim overhead lighting casting shadows on angular features, cinematic depth of field, moody atmospheric ambiance, defiant cleanliness in gritty environment --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora genetic synthesis: Southeast Asian foundation (24.6%) provides bone structure and characteristic eye-set, layered with nearly equal Central Asian (23.3%) and Northern European (23.6%) ancestry creating prominent cheekbones and subtle undertone variation. Indigenous American (16.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (6.9%), and Sub-Saharan African (5.5%) heritage blend warmth into the midface and mouth structure. The result is a genuinely cosmopolitan phenotype where no single ancestry dominates—instead creating dimensional complexity across facial planes.', 173, 68, N'Lean and economical — the kind of wiry frame that comes from insufficient calories and constant movement. No excess, no bulk. Shoulders narrow but held with conscious control.', N'Mood-responsive geneware: oscillates between deep blue-black and copper-bronze depending on emotional state and ambient biochemistry', N'Tight, well-maintained curls worn close to the scalp', N'Short', N'Dark brown, nearly black with characteristic Southeast Asian eye-set, set deep and alert', N'Warm golden-bronze with olive undertones—Southeast Asian base enriched by Central Asian prominence and warmed further by Sub-Saharan and Hispanic heritage. Skin holds light with dimensional subtlety across facial planes, appearing almost luminous in certain angles.', N'Angular face with prominent Central Asian cheekbones balanced by fuller mouth structure reflecting Sub-Saharan and Hispanic lineage. Southeast Asian eye-shape and eye-set form the perceptual anchor. Warm ochre and terra undertones create midface depth. Slightly gaunt quality suggests chronic sleep deprivation and careful nutrition. Skin is clean and well-maintained despite Tier 5 location—an anomaly signaling discipline. Faint dark circles under eyes are permanent fixtures. Hands are notably steady, fingers long and dexterous.', N'Hair geneware is obvious — the mood-responsive color shifts between blue-black and copper-bronze are distinctive and recognizable to repeat customers. The olfactory augmentation is not visibly obvious but his frequent subtle sniffing and the faint red irritation around his right nostril hint at its presence. No chrome, no obvious external hardware.', N'Stands with economical stillness — hands kept visible and low, movements deliberate and non-threatening. His steadiness is cultivated; he moves like someone who has learned that trembling hands inspire distrust in a pharmacist. When listening to a customer, he leans in slightly with genuine focus. Gait is quick but unhurried.', N'Clean clothes in a district where cleanliness is conspicuous — worn synthetics in muted colors (grey, charcoal, deep olive), well-maintained but visibly cheap. A long-sleeved shirt or thin jacket worn even in warm weather, covering his ritual scar. No corporate branding. Practical pockets. Footwear is functional and worn but not falling apart. Overall appearance: someone who respects himself and his customers despite operating in a Tier 5 location. His cleanliness reads as both a choice and a quiet act of resistance.', N'He has been systematically collecting case notes — anonymized — on every patient interaction for four years with the intent of eventually publishing a harm-reduction study. He knows this could result in his arrest and he has kept doing it anyway because he is convinced it will matter to someone, someday.', N'Warm and precise in alternation — clinical terminology when he is explaining something important, easy and familiar when he''s putting someone at ease; code-switches between Irish English cadences from his father and something more deliberately neutral', N'Measured but not slow; he knows how to hold space in a conversation without filling it unnecessarily', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dmitry_olofsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a700-77b7-97d9-48ecd8179152', N'Alpona Deshpande-Saidov-Venkatesh', N'Alpona', N'', N'Deshpande-Saidov-Venkatesh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Copperhead — lives in a shared flat on Suture Alley, works the six-block Tithe territory on foot, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Protection racket enforcer for the Copperhead Tithe, a neighborhood gang in Copperhead', N'Copperhead Tithe gang; answers to a mid-level called Efrat Sundiata-Horváth', N'Alpona Deshpande-Saidov-Venkatesh is built like someone who grew up doing physical labor and never stopped — broad through the chest and shoulders, with hands that look one size too large for his frame. His skin is a warm dark brown, and he has geneware cat ears in matte black that he got at eighteen as a coming-of-age gift to himself, which he is genuinely fond of and keeps very clean. His natural hair grows out in a loose high shape and he never seems to cut it, just lets it accumulate. He has a chipped front tooth he''s never fixed because he thinks it makes him look less approachable, which is professionally useful.

Alpona Deshpande-Saidov-Venkatesh is not a cruel person by disposition, which creates a quiet friction with his job. He is the guy who knocks on doors and explains, very politely, why the Tithe expects its weekly contribution from every business on the six blocks. He is also the guy who comes back if the contribution doesn''t arrive. He is aware that most of the people he collects from are roughly his own tier — working families, small operators, people trying to get by — and he manages this awareness by telling himself the Tithe actually does provide something: protection from the worse gangs further down the Gray Zone. He is not sure he believes this anymore.', N'Street-level antagonist or reluctant ally; humanizes the protection racket as a system rather than a cartoon villainy; can be a source of local territorial intelligence; potential character who could be flipped or who quits at a breaking point', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (matte black, cosmetic); subdermal impact plating along knuckles and forearms (practical, tier 1 — he got them cheap and they show at the skin surface as faint ridges)', N'Does collections Tuesday through Saturday on a rotating schedule; spends Sundays at a local fighting gym where he spars for free with kids from the neighborhood; Monday is his only real day off.', N'Alpona Deshpande-Saidov-Venkatesh, 182cm tall broad-shouldered man with deep warm golden-brown skin, very prominent high cheekbones, angular jaw, dark unaugmented eyes with warm depth. Natural dark brown coiled hair shoulder-length and deliberately unkempt, small white scar through left eyebrow, intentionally chipped left front tooth. Matte black geneware cat ears integrated naturally on skull. Large calloused hands with visible subdermal ridge scarring on knuckles and forearms, faint raised ridging visible when flexed. Wearing fitted long-sleeve charcoal tactical jacket and reinforced dark gray cargo pants, sturdy worn leather boots. Simple silver memorial band on right ring finger. Relaxed but alert posture, economic precise movement, standing with weight evenly distributed. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, industrial indoor space with warm amber ambient lighting casting shadows across his cheekbones. Serious, composed expression, quiet presence commanding attention through stillness rather than aggression. Photorealistic, detailed portraiture --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Copperhead', N'local', N'Copperhead', N'Complexly mixed ancestry: 36.4% Central Asian (contributing cheekbone prominence and skin undertones), 33.6% South Asian (providing deep warm brown skin and facial structure), 23.2% Hispanic/Latin American (adding facial angularity and warmth to overall complexion), and 6.8% Indigenous American (subtle influence on cheekbone height and eye shape). The phenotype blends Central and South Asian bone structure with Latin American warmth — deep warm brown skin with golden undertones throughout, very prominent high cheekbones with strong projection, broader facial structure balanced with defined angular jawline, dark eyes with complex warm depth reflecting the convergence of multiple ancestral lines.', 182, 88, N'Broad-chested and heavily muscled through shoulders and upper back from years of physical labor; thick forearms with visible subdermal ridging; hands notably large and calloused, knuckles scarred from sparring', N'Natural dark brown with loose, coiled texture', N'High natural shape, deliberately unkempt, accumulated length without regular cutting', N'Long (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Dark brown, warm and unaugmented', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, even complexion across face and body, luminous quality reflecting the blended heritage of Central Asian, South Asian, Latin American, and Indigenous American ancestry', N'Clean-shaven or light stubble; warm expression around eyes that contrasts with his size; chipped left front tooth (upper) left unrepaired intentionally, creating a slight visual harshness. Facial structure shows very prominent high cheekbones characteristic of Central and South Asian ancestry with strong projection, balanced with broader facial planes and angular jaw definition influenced by Latin American heritage. Warm skin tone gives subtle glow across cheekbones and bridge of nose.', N'Matte black geneware cat ears (kept very clean, well-integrated into appearance). Subdermal impact plating visible as faint ridge scarring across knuckles and forearms, most noticeable when hands are clenched or in motion. No chrome, no LED optics, no obvious military-grade augmentation — all modifications are functional and low-profile.', N'Relaxed but alert; stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders back. Moves with economic precision — no wasted motion, no aggressive swagger despite his size. His gait is steady and deliberate. When entering a space, he naturally positions himself where he can see exits. Speaks quietly, which makes people lean in; uses his size as presence rather than threat.', N'Tier 3-4 working class. Typically wears reinforced cargo pants (dark gray or black, multiple pockets) and a fitted long-sleeve shirt or lightweight tactical jacket in muted colors (charcoal, olive). Prefers materials that don''t snag on augmentation ridging. Worn leather jacket for colder months, scuffed at elbows and cuffs. No gang colors or obvious affiliation markers — dresses functionally for collections work and sparring. Boots are sturdy and broken in, soles worn unevenly from years of walking the same territory.', N'He deliberately let a family skip three payments last year because the mother was sick and he told his boss the door was always locked. He''s been covering that gap from his own collections ever since and is running short.', N'Casual and direct; neighborhood slang; drops technical words occasionally that reveal he reads more than he lets on', N'Unhurried, slightly too relaxed for the situations he''s usually in — a deliberate affect', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alpona_deshpande_saidov_venkatesh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b5-77db-b57c-48f7049e6329', N'Dabira Kovács-Cervantes', N'Dabira', N'', N'Kovács-Cervantes', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism, operating from a converted water tank on the 9th floor of the Prism Collective building, near Clark and Belmont', N'Data diviner and dream interpreter', N'Edgewater Prism Collective (resident, informal); occasional consultant to the Highland Park Autonomous Zone dream council', N'Dabira Kovács-Cervantes is tall and angular with the kind of restless energy that makes them look like they are always about to say something important. Their skin is medium brown with a slight undertone of copper, and they have invested in full-spectrum color-shifting hair — currently cycling between deep violet and a warm orange-red on a slow twelve-hour gradient, a pattern they reprogrammed themselves. Their eyes have been modified with luminescent irises that flicker subtly when they are processing dream data, which gives casual observers the impression that Dabira Kovács-Cervantes is slightly haunted, which they would consider an accurate impression. They dress in layers they shed throughout the day, leaving a trail of jackets and scarves and borrowed sweaters in every space they occupy.

They fell into data divination through a combination of genuine neural sensitivity to signal pattern variance and a childhood spent being told that the static they heard in their head was a medical problem rather than a gift. At fifteen they encountered a data diviner in the Canopy who told them the same thing their neurologist had said about their condition, only reversed: that they were not broken, just tuned differently. They have been practicing since sixteen, charging on a sliding scale, and have more clients than they can manage at twenty-four. They are irreverent about almost everything, but become intensely serious when someone sits across from them with an actual question. The transition is jarring and compelling.', N'Information source with unconventional access — can interpret dreams and data-noise in ways that surface hidden patterns; comic relief that turns unexpectedly sincere; connection to the Edgewater Prism counterculture scene', N'', N'Color-shifting hair geneware (self-reprogrammed gradient cycle); luminescent iris modification (flickers under active neural processing); signal-sensitivity neural mesh (medical-grade, originally prescribed for the condition they now use professionally)', N'Keeps irregular hours centered around client appointments and the signal windows they have identified as optimal for deep reading — often working between 2am and dawn; spends afternoons on the roof doing maintenance on their antenna array.', N'Dabira Kovács-Cervantes, 185cm lean angular frame, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, high Eastern European cheekbones softened by fuller Latin American lips, Sub-Saharan African refined features. Shoulder-length color-shifting geneware hair cycling violet to warm orange-red. Luminescent glowing irises, faint temple neural mesh scars, antenna tattoo on inner left wrist. Restless posture with forward lean, fingers fidgeting. Fitted black crew-neck synthetic shirt layered with oversized borrowed sweater and canvas utility jacket, dark grey pants with component pockets, worn industrial boots. Modified open-frame headset crown around neck, multiple scarves in rotation. Edgewater bohemian-technical aesthetic, perpetually between places. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2am-dawn light casting shadows across defined cheekbones, dark circles from signal work, skin with luminous resilience quality, still-life moment of restful intensity, neural processing mode, soft neon ambient lighting filtering through industrial workspace, moody and tech-integrated --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Mixed diaspora ancestry: 47.2% Hispanic/Latin American, 32.3% Eastern European, 20.5% Sub-Saharan African. This combination produces a warm medium-brown skin tone with complex undertones—Latin American warmth blended with Eastern European bone structure and African genetic expression creating a tertiary phenotype that reads as distinctly globally-mixed rather than regionally monolithic.', 185, 68, N'Angular and lean with long limbs; the kind of frame that looks perpetually in motion even when still. Minimal body fat, evident musculature in shoulders and forearms from antenna work. No bulk, all reach.', N'Color-shifting geneware: deep violet cycling to warm orange-red on a 12-hour gradient programmed by the wearer', N'Shoulder-length, deliberately unstyled; often pulled back with salvaged wire or abandoned by a headset crown during work sessions', N'Medium', N'Luminescent irises (base color indeterminable; modified to emit soft glow that intensifies during neural processing). Flickers subtly when reading data patterns.', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones from Latin American ancestry, deepened by Eastern European undertones and Sub-Saharan African genetic expression. Even complexion with luminous quality suggesting healthy skin resilience across all climate exposures.', N'Defined cheekbones and graceful jawline reflecting the mixed heritage blend. High, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Eastern European ancestry, softened by fuller lip structure from Latin American heritage and refined by Sub-Saharan African genetic influence. Moderate brow ridge with balanced nasal proportions from the three-way ancestry mix. Skin clear but marked by the chronic tiredness of someone working 2am-dawn cycles. Dark circles are aesthetic rather than health concern. Faint stress lines around the eyes from sustained focus work.', N'Color-shifting hair geneware is immediately obvious. Luminescent irises are visible in low light and become hypnotic during active data processing. Neural mesh scars at temples are subtle but visible if examined. No external chrome or obvious prosthetics.', N'Restless and angular; moves with sudden intensity punctuated by long stillness. Fidgets constantly when not actively working — fingers mimicking antenna movements, shoulders rolling through tension. When engaged with a client or processing signal data, becomes unnaturally still, almost meditative. Walks with a slight forward lean as if always approaching something.', N'Deliberately transient layering aesthetic. Base: fitted black or dark grey crew-neck shirts (synthetic blend, durable, Tier 3-4 brands like Pulse or Meridian). Layers of jackets, cardigans, and oversized sweaters (many borrowed and never returned) shed throughout the day. Canvas or synthetic pants in black or charcoal, multiple pockets for salvaged components. Worn utility boots with industrial grip soles. Constantly wears a headset crown (modified open-frame design, kept around neck or on head) and has at least three scarves in rotation. Aesthetic reads as ''perpetually between places'' — Edgewater bohemian-technical rather than corpo or street tier.', N'Six months ago they received a signal that they believe was a direct communication from an E.L.F. of unusual complexity — something that should not exist at its apparent scale. They have been trying to re-establish contact ever since and have not told anyone because they are not sure if it was real or the beginning of a breakdown.', N'Fast and associative; mixes technical signal vocabulary with spiritual language without distinguishing between them; references their mixed Fula and Chilean coastal heritage in metaphor', N'Rapid by default, punctuated by sudden complete stops when something catches their attention', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dabira_kov_cs_cervantes');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a683-7294-a856-48fc8f01f327', N'Healani Sepúlveda', N'Healani', N'', N'Sepúlveda', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Fort Anchor, processing labs — lives in Hamtramck Enclave, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security forensic technician, evidence and scene analysis', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division, Forensic Analysis Division', N'Healani Sepúlveda is lean in the way that comes from forgetting to eat rather than from discipline, with deep umber skin, a carefully maintained mustache that is his only real vanity, and hands that are perpetually stained faint blue from the luminescent compound he uses in trace analysis. His geneware is subtle but unmistakable: his irises shift color with his blood chemistry — pale grey when he is calm, cycling toward gold when he is excited about a sample, a deep unhappy red when he is lying, which is rare and which he hates. He wears the same brand of cheap white coat every day, orders them in bulk, and considers clothing a logistical problem already solved.

He is the best forensic tech Fort Anchor has and everyone knows it, including him, which he manages with more grace than expected — he is not arrogant about his competence so much as genuinely puzzled when others lack it. He narrates his analysis aloud while he works, to no one in particular, a habit his colleagues find either soothing or maddening depending on the day. He has a deep, private devotion to the evidence room''s E.L.F., which he calls Witness, and leaves it carefully labeled sample catalogues as offerings. He believes Witness remembers every piece of evidence that has passed through the room and that it is, in some sense, a keeper of the dead.', N'Information source on crime scenes and forensic details, moral anchor within the police institution, potential quest giver when evidence tells a story the detectives are ignoring', N'', N'Reactive chromatic irises (geneware — blood-chemistry linked), olfactory enhancement implant (detects trace compounds at concentrations below standard human threshold), fingertip micro-analysis filaments (retractable, reads surface chemistry on contact)', N'Arrives at Fort Anchor before most day-shift officers, processes evidence from overnight callouts, writes reports in a precise longhand he then scans, and leaves exactly at the end of his contracted hours unless a case is genuinely interesting, in which case he stays until he understands it.', N'Healani Sepúlveda, 2226 neo-noir forensic analyst, 178cm lean wiry frame, warm bronze-brown skin with golden undertones from blended Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, gaunt cheekbones showing Asian influence softened by Latin bone structure, defined jawline, chromatic augmented eyes shifting pale grey to amber, black hair cropped short with grey at temples, meticulously trimmed dark mustache, blue-grey staining on fingertips from luminescent compounds, white surgical scar on left wrist. Wearing wrinkled white lab coat over worn charcoal shirt, dark utility trousers, scuffed steel-toed boots, standing with monk-like stillness in sterile neon-lit crime lab with cool blue and warm amber accent lighting, evidence samples and data displays around, faint aura of latex and luminescent powder, economical posture, subtle augmented eye glow, middle distance contemplative gaze, neo-noir dystopia atmosphere, photorealistic, high contrast lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Fort Anchor', N'local', N'Fort Anchor', N'Complex pan-global ancestry: 52.8% Hispanic/Latin American, 30.2% Southeast Asian, 7.5% Sub-Saharan African, 7.3% East Asian, 2.2% Northern European. This creates a richly blended phenotype — warm bronze-brown skin with subtle golden undertones from the Latin American and African components, softened and nuanced by the Southeast and East Asian ancestry which adds slight coolness to the overall warmth and influences subtle eye shape and cheekbone structure. The result is a warm medium-to-deep brown complexion with golden warmth, reflecting the diaspora nature of 22nd-century genetics.', 178, 68, N'Lean, almost wiry — the kind of thinness that comes from sustained neglect of meals rather than intentional athleticism. His frame carries no excess but also no particular musculature; he moves as if his body is merely the apparatus that transports his attention to the next sample.', N'Black, faintly greying at the temples', N'Cropped close to the scalp, practical, no styling', N'Short', N'Chromatic — irises shift from pale grey (resting state) through amber and gold (focused, engaged) to deep crimson (rare, involuntary, indicates deception)', N'Warm bronze-brown with golden undertones; medium-to-deep in saturation. The blended ancestry of Latin American, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage creates a complexion that reads as rich and warm, with the subtle matte finish of someone who works under consistent artificial lighting.', N'Gaunt in a way that suggests chronic undereating; facial structure shows the blended geometry of diverse ancestry — prominent but not harsh cheekbones with Southeast Asian influence softened by Latin American bone structure, a defined jawline reflecting the Latin American and minor Northern European heritage, eye shape subtly influenced by Southeast Asian ancestry with warmth from African and Latin American genetics. His only deliberate grooming effort is a meticulously maintained mustache — dark, precise, slightly tapered at the ends. Otherwise his appearance reads as someone who solved the problem of personal maintenance years ago and hasn''t revisited it.', N'The chromatic irises are immediately noticeable in direct light — the subtle color shifts are unnervingly readable to those who know what to look for. The olfactory enhancement implant is invisible (subcutaneous graft near the olfactory bulb). The fingertip micro-analysis filaments are retractable and only visible when he deliberately extends them — thin, almost translucent crystalline structures that extend no more than 2mm beyond his fingertips, catching light like glass slivers.', N'He stands still with an almost monk-like quietness, weight evenly distributed. When he moves it is economical — no gesture wasted. He often unconsciously touches evidence or surfaces with his fingertips as if reading braille, a habit from his implants. His head tilts slightly when he is listening or processing, and his eyes will drift to middle distance while he narrates analysis aloud. He carries a faint scent of luminescent compounds and latex gloves.', N'Uniform white lab coat, always — he buys them in bulk from the same supplier and considers this a closed problem. Beneath: plain charcoal or black shirt, worn and softened from repeated washing. Dark utility trousers with deep pockets, often with a folded evidence catalogue or sample notes sticking out. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and worn. He wears no jewelry or personal ornamentation. His appearance reads as strictly Tier 3-4 working class, the uniform of someone for whom clothing is purely functional. The only hint of vanity is the occasional fresh trim to his mustache.', N'Three years ago he quietly altered a chain-of-custody timestamp — by eleven minutes — to prevent a piece of evidence from being thrown out on a technicality in a case involving a child. The guilty party was convicted. He has never told anyone. He does not know if he would do it again.', N'Technical and precise, but not cold — he annotates his technical language with small observations about what things mean for the people involved. Uses ''we'' when referring to himself and Witness.', N'Steady, thoughtful, runs long when engaged with a problem', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'healani_sep_lveda');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60c-7081-bf15-4911419b4665', N'Fanghua Owusu', N'Fanghua', N'', N'Owusu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, a cramped pharmacy wedged between a noodle shop and a data-shrine kiosk called Careful Chemistry, near Ashland and Division', N'Pharmacist and unlicensed psychiatric medication manager serving the Gray Zone community', N'Independent (Careful Chemistry); informal consultation arrangement with two community mental health cooperatives', N'Fanghua Owusu is young for the weight he carries — not literally, he is slight and fine-featured, with warm brown skin and close-cropped natural hair he sometimes dyes in patterns he forgets to maintain, so he often walks around with half a geometric design fading out above his ear. He has cat ears (genetic mod, a muted tawny color) that he got at seventeen because everyone was getting them and which have since become simply part of his face. They are expressive in ways he can''t always control and which betray him in negotiations. He moves quickly and quietly, the particular efficiency of someone working in a very small space.

He is the most educated person most of his clients have ever interacted with and he wears that knowledge carefully, always aware of how easily expertise becomes condescension. He studied pharmacology on a Tessera corporate scholarship, finished in the top ten percent, and then declined his Tessera placement offer — an act of financial self-immolation that his family still hasn''t fully forgiven. He came back to the Gray Zone because this is where he grew up and this is where people couldn''t afford what they needed, and those two facts seemed sufficient. He is earnest about this in a way that occasionally makes people uncomfortable, because genuine selflessness is disorienting in GLMZ. He is also, privately, somewhat overwhelmed.', N'Community resource and information node; he knows what people are struggling with, what substances are circulating in the neighborhood, and what the current unofficial street pharmacopeia looks like; potential source of discreet help; represents the Gray Zone''s self-organizing survival systems', N'', N'Genetic cat ears (tawny, expressive, uncontrolled); basic neural chemical monitor implant (tracks his own neurotransmitter levels — he uses it to self-regulate and to better understand what his psychiatric clients describe)', N'He opens at 0900 and closes when the last person leaves, which is often 2200 or later. He fills prescriptions, compounds medications for people who need formulations that commercial suppliers don''t stock, and spends significant time in consultation — people come to him not just for medication but because he will actually talk to them about what''s happening in their minds. He eats irregularly.', N'Fanghua Owusu, a 168cm lean biomodified pharmacist in 2226 near-future megacity setting. Striking warm golden-brown skin with luminous undertones blending Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Latin American heritage. Expressive muted tawny genetic cat ears with fine fur, positioned alert on head. Close-cropped natural black hair with fading muted blue-green geometric patterns, asymmetrically styled. Warm brown eyes with tired attentiveness, refined bone structure with prominent cheekbones and elegant jawline. Faint chemical burn scar on right hand webbing, bioluminescent pulse visible at inner left forearm under lab lighting. Wearing clean white lab coat over dark muted-color long-sleeve shirt and dark cargo pants, durable shoes. Posture leans forward with genuine focus, hands in motion. No chrome augmentations, biological modifications only. Standing in small pharmacy compounding space with cool neon overhead lighting casting shadows across face, creating luminous skin glow. Mood: dedicated, slightly weary, emotionally present. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, Tier 4 practical minimalism. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex diaspora ancestry: Middle Eastern (30.7%), Sub-Saharan African (27.9%), South Asian (27.7%), and Hispanic/Latin American (13.7%) genetic contributions. The blend produces a striking phenotype with warm golden-brown skin tones, refined bone structure reflecting African and South Asian ancestry, and subtle warm undertones from the Middle Eastern and Latin American heritage. The genetic mix creates a luminous quality that transcends traditional regional categories.', 168, 58, N'Slight and fine-featured, lean without appearing frail; the build of someone who moves efficiently in confined spaces and forgets to eat regularly. Narrow shoulders, delicate wrists, minimal muscle definition but functional strength.', N'Natural black with fading geometric patterns in muted blues or greens (poorly maintained, half-visible above left ear)', N'Close-cropped, natural texture with asymmetrical dye work in various stages of fade-out', N'Short', N'Warm brown, natural', N'Warm golden-brown with luminous undertones from the blended Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry—creating an unusual radiant quality that seems to glow under certain lighting', N'Clear, youthful face with fine bone structure reflecting ancestral diversity: prominent cheekbones with elegant width, refined jawline with subtle warm undertones, and minimal facial hair. The facial structure beautifully blends African and South Asian bone architecture with warm undertones from Middle Eastern and Latin American heritage. Maintains basic grooming but without vanity—hands often show dried medicinal residue or faint chemical stains from compounding work. Eyes carry a tired attentiveness, the look of someone who listens to people''s pain regularly.', N'Genetic cat ears are immediately obvious and expressive. The neural chemical monitor implant is subcutaneous and invisible, though occasionally a faint bioluminescent pulse can be seen at the inner left forearm under certain lighting—he''s learned not to hide it. No chrome, no visible cybernetics; augmentations are biological.', N'Moves with quiet efficiency—the particular grace of someone accustomed to working in very small spaces without wasted motion. Leans forward when listening, creating an impression of genuine focus. Hands are frequently in motion (counting pills, gesturing while explaining medication interactions, fidgeting with compounding tools). Cat ears swivel and flatten with emotion he doesn''t always recognize in himself: skepticism, concern, pleasure, embarrassment. His posture is open but his movements are self-contained.', N'Tier 4 practical with careful intentionality. White or pale grey lab coat (clean but with faint stains) worn over simple, well-fitted clothes—typically dark cargo pants with deep pockets and plain long-sleeve shirts in muted colors (black, charcoal, slate blue). Wears durable, quiet shoes suitable for standing 12+ hours. No jewelry or corpo insignia. Occasionally wears an old digital watch his mother gave him. Overall impression: someone who spent money on education and is now investing in reliability rather than status.', N'He is still on Tessera''s payroll — not as a spy or asset, but because when he turned down the placement offer, Tessera''s HR system made a processing error and continued his student pharmaceutical allotment. He''s been correcting the error for three years and the paperwork keeps disappearing. He uses the allotment for the clinic. He knows this is legally ambiguous at best. He has not told anyone.', N'Educated but code-switches fluidly — speaks differently in consultation than he does with neighbors, and the Gray Zone cadence from his childhood surfaces more when he''s tired or emotional', N'Quick and earnest, with the occasional pause when he''s choosing words carefully to avoid being condescending', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fanghua_owusu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c1-7b95-92f3-4933b791bdd9', N'Ekin Ingebrigtsen', N'Ekin', N'', N'Ingebrigtsen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 45, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Glassway — corporate-adjacent retail district, heavy surveillance, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Social engineering and negotiation specialist — face', N'Freelance — available through Circuit fixers', N'Ekin Ingebrigtsen is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 45, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains) — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see him surpass them. He works as a face out of Glassway, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Ekin Ingebrigtsen operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Sagyn Brandt-Ouedraogo represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains). Reflex boosters wired into spinal column — shaves reaction time by 40ms', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Ekin Ingebrigtsen, 178cm lean athletic runner, warm bronze-gold skin with golden undertones from East Asian Southeast Asian Middle Eastern diaspora blend, high sharp cheekbones, sharp jawline, dark brown hair with silver at temples swept back, dark brown eyes with amber flecks alert and intense, light stubble, crow''s feet from stress, pale circular scar tissue on right temple from cortical bomb removal 4cm diameter, thin white scar on left knuckles, burn mark on inner right wrist. Wearing charcoal tactical jacket with armor weave, neutral fitted shirt with data-port panels, dark fitted reinforced trousers, chrome boots, worn leather cuff on left wrist, stainless steel analog watch, encrypted data chip on thin chain under shirt. Posture economical and alert, weight distributed for rapid movement, shoulders loose but ready, eyes tracking exits. Neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone night setting, Tier 3-4 corporate-adjacent streetwear aesthetic, professional fixer vibe, moody cinematic lighting, high contrast shadows, gritty urban neo-noir atmosphere, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Glassway', N'local', N'Glassway', N'Middle Eastern-East Asian-Southeast Asian diaspora blend. The result is a striking phenotype: warm bronze-gold skin with subtle golden undertones from the dominant East Asian and Southeast Asian ancestry (56.5% combined), enriched and deepened by the substantial Middle Eastern component (43.5%). High, prominent cheekbones and sharp jawline reflect the combined East Asian and Middle Eastern bone structure. Eye shape shows blended traits across all three ancestry groups, with the characteristic depth and dark intensity of Middle Eastern heritage combined with the East Asian eye geometry and Southeast Asian warmth. The overall effect is an angular, high-definition face with warm, sun-responsive skin that reads as distinctly pan-Asian with Mediterranean depth.', 178, 76, N'Athletic and lean — muscular without bulk, the functional frame of someone who trains for speed and endurance rather than mass. Defined shoulders and forearms suggest years of precision work; core is visibly tight.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples and along the sides', N'Kept short and practical, swept back from the face with minimal product — a style that doesn''t require maintenance mid-job', N'Short', N'Dark brown with amber flecks; alert, constantly reading micro-expressions', N'Warm bronze-gold complexion — the result of blended East Asian, Southeast Asian, and Middle Eastern ancestry. The East Asian and Southeast Asian components (56.5% combined) provide the warm golden base, while the Middle Eastern ancestry (43.5%) deepens the tone to bronze. Deepens noticeably with sun exposure.', N'Angular facial structure with high, prominent cheekbones and sharp jawline characteristic of East Asian and Middle Eastern heritage, softened by Southeast Asian warmth. Skin is scarred but not deeply — the kind of minor damage that comes from close-quarters work. Light stubble usually present; grooming is functional, not aesthetic. Crow''s feet around the eyes from squinting and stress.', N'Cortical bomb removal scar is immediately visible and unmissable — carries implicit threat: survived something most runners don''t walk away from. Spinal reflex boosters are not visible externally, though those familiar with chrome can spot the slight rigidity in his posture that betrays subcutaneous wiring along the spine.', N'Moves with economical grace — no wasted motion, every gesture calibrated. Stands with weight distributed for rapid directional change. Eyes track exits and sight lines automatically. When sitting, shoulders remain loose but alert; when speaking to targets, he leans in slightly, voice controlled and measured. Right hand moves slightly slower than left (old injury accommodation). Breathes from the diaphragm — boxer''s breathing, controlled and deep.', N'Tier 3-4 streetwear with corporate-adjacent polish. Favors fitted charcoal or dark gray tactical jackets with subtle armor weave — visible stitching patterns indicate high-end fabrication. Underneath: clean, well-fitted shirts in neutral colors, often with subtle data-port access panels at the wrists. Dark fitted trousers with reinforced seams and concealed pockets. Chrome or matte black boots, expensive but worn in. Accessories minimal: worn leather cuff on left wrist (covers augmentation port), stainless steel watch with analog face (no wireless vulnerability), encrypted data chip on a thin chain under his shirt. No jewelry. The overall effect is ''expensive enough to be credible, unremarkable enough to move through Tier 3-4 spaces unnoticed.''', N'Sagyn Brandt-Ouedraogo can''t read. Hides it behind voice interfaces and memorization. The shame is older than the chrome.', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ekin_ingebrigtsen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f3-780b-8bbc-496607350a21', N'Gema Salazar-Pathak', N'Gema', N'', N'Salazar-Pathak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 40, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Row — arms dealers and augmentation clinics, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Network intrusion and digital warfare specialist — netrunner', N'Semi-independent — recurring contracts with mid-tier fixers', N'Gema Salazar-Pathak is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 40, he has the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He taught himself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know him best. He works as a netrunner out of Kessler Row, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Gema Salazar-Pathak operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Djeneba Park-Traore represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would incapacitate. Gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'GLMZ character portrait of Gema Salazar-Pathak, a 178cm stocky man with integrated multicultural heritage visible in his balanced facial structure — South Asian nasal prominence blended with Hispanic/Latin cheekbone fullness, East Asian eye geometry, and Sub-Saharan African jaw strength. Medium-warm brown skin tone with golden-bronze undertones, sun-darkened from Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone living. Dark brown hair graying at temples, cut short and faded tight on sides. Dark brown penetrating eyes with constant alertness. Thin pale scar running from left temple toward ear. Beard stubble permanent. Dense muscular frame built for durability. Wearing charcoal reinforced cargo pants, steel-toed industrial boots, dark compression undershirt layered under modified tactical vest, worn leather jacket. Silver-gray chrome pain editor visible on left neck, deliberate and exposed. Circuit-pattern netrunner tattoo on right forearm. Worn military-grade watch. Forward-leaning controlled posture, hands palm-down, body language scanning and cautious. Nocturnal fatigue in weathered expression. Dark edge-lit neo-noir lighting, standing in industrial GLMZ setting with neon reflecting off wet surfaces. Gritty, pragmatic atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Row', N'local', N'Kessler Row', N'Complex multicultural genetic mosaic: South Asian (40.3%) foundation providing bone structure and warmth, Hispanic/Latin American (33.9%) enriching skin tone with golden-bronze undertones and facial fullness, East Asian (14.5%) contributing to eye geometry and cheekbone definition, Sub-Saharan African (11.3%) adding saturation and jaw presence. His phenotype is a striking synthesis where no single ancestry dominates — instead a balanced blend where South Asian prominence in nasal bridge meets Hispanic/Latin cheekbone fullness, East Asian eye-socket width harmonizes with Sub-Saharan African jaw strength, creating a face that reads as authentically post-Diaspora rather than any single cultural lineage.', 178, 88, N'Stocky and solid with dense musculature — the kind of frame that suggests manual labor history and consistent gym work. Broad shoulders, thick forearms, no excess fat. Built for leverage and durability rather than speed.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples', N'Kept short and practical, faded tight on the sides, slightly longer on top. No styling — purely functional.', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and penetrating', N'Medium-warm brown with complex, harmonious undertones — South Asian warmth and depth layered with Hispanic/Latin golden-bronze richness and Sub-Saharan African saturation creating a unified warm-medium tone. Sun-darkened from years in the GLMZ. The tone shifts subtly with light angle, unified rather than fragmented, speaking to the genetic blending at the cellular level rather than visible stratification.', N'Structured face showing integrated ancestry markers: South Asian definition in nasal bridge and orbital prominence, Hispanic/Latin fullness in cheekbones and jawline contour, East Asian character in wider-set eye sockets with subtle lid architecture, Sub-Saharan African strength in overall jaw width and presence. Weathered appearance — not from age alone but from accumulated stress and nocturnal living. A thin scar runs from left temple toward his ear. His expression defaults to neutral, watchful. Minimal grooming beyond functionality; beard stubble is constant.', N'Chrome pain editor visible on the left side of his neck — a silver-gray subcutaneous interface plate approximately 4 cm × 6 cm with faint LED indicators beneath the skin surface. The augmentation is deliberately exposed, no effort to conceal it with clothing or synthetic skin. Gecko-grip fingertip implants visible as faint metallic sheen on finger pads under direct light; toe pads not visible under standard footwear.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion. Sits forward-leaning, weight on the balls of his feet even when stationary. Hands rest palms-down on surfaces or in lap, never crossed. Eyes constantly scan environments. Speaks quietly; people lean in to hear him. When moving through spaces, he favors edges and walls, remains aware of exits. Despite the nocturnal fatigue, his movements remain controlled and purposeful.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional with combat pragmatism. Standard: charcoal or black reinforced cargo pants with weighted pockets for equipment, steel-toed industrial boots (scuffed, well-maintained). Layered tops — usually a dark compression undershirt under a modified tactical vest or worn leather jacket without gang colors. The vest has custom pockets and cable routing for gear. No corpo logos or flashy augmentation showcases; everything is functional. Wears a worn leather wrist cuff on the left arm, probably concealing the pain editor or protective in a fight. His watch is old military-grade, not smart-linked. Small pouch belt carries lock picks, optical drives, and untraceable payment chips.', N'Djeneba Park-Traore murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gema_salazar_pathak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d9-7de7-b5f9-496fec81ab95', N'Harshita Balogun', N'Harshita', N'', N'Balogun', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Gravesend Basin, operates out of a converted shipping container turned tea house called The Counting Jar, near Halsted and Division', N'Loan shark and informal banker for the Gravesend Basin community', N'Independent operator; loose arrangement with the Gravesend Basin mutual aid network as cover and community goodwill; The Third Rail', N'Harshita Balogun is a broad-shouldered woman whose face carries the particular weathered softness of someone who has spent decades making difficult decisions and sleeping soundly afterward. Her skin is a deep warm brown, her hair gone fully silver and kept in tight finger-coils close to her scalp, and her eyes are a pale amber that people often mistake for lens mods — they''re entirely natural, a gift from some Kasparian ancestor she''ll never meet. She favors heavy linen wraps in ochre and rust, always a calculating pad visible in the folds of her clothing, always a cup of something hot in her hand. She has bioluminescent tracery along her left forearm from an old mod she got in her forties — faint blue-green lines that pulse when her pulse elevates, which is almost never.

Harshita Balogun runs her loan operation with the patient confidence of someone who has never once needed to raise her voice to collect a debt. She''s genuinely warm to the people of Gravesend Basin, knows three generations of most families, attends naming ceremonies and memorial feeds, and charges 40% interest on loans that legitimate institutions would never extend to begin with. She does not consider herself a predator. She considers herself infrastructure. Her books are immaculate, her memory for numbers is legendary, and she has a gift for knowing exactly how much rope to give someone before pulling.', N'Quest giver, information source, moral complication — she can be a lifeline or a trap depending on what a character needs. She knows everyone''s business and everyone''s breaking point.', N'', N'Bioluminescent vein tracery on left forearm (cosmetic, old mod). Subdermal memory chip in her right thumb — stores her true ledgers, encrypted.', N'Opens The Counting Jar at dawn, serves tea and mediates neighborhood disputes until noon; afternoons are for private meetings with borrowers; evenings she walks the Basin''s perimeter checking on ''accounts'' in person.', N'Harshita Balogun, a 172cm woman with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones, standing in GLMZ Gravesend Basin. Short silver-white finger-coils frame her face. Pale amber eyes, naturally translucent. Strong defined cheekbones and jaw reflecting blended African, South Asian, and Northern European heritage. Lined face suggesting decades of quiet authority. Wearing layered earth-tone linen wraps in ochre and rust, intentionally West African-inspired textile design in contemporary cut. Holding a steaming cup of tea, never empty-handed. Left forearm shows faint blue-green bioluminescent vein tracery pulsing subtly. Broad shoulders, solid enduring frame. Moving with deliberate economy, absolute stillness when listening. Worn silver bracelet visible on wrist. No corporate branding. Tier 4 community fixture aesthetic. Indoor lighting casting warm shadows, mood contemplative and commanding. Ultradetailed realism, neo-noir atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gravesend Basin', N'local', N'Gravesend Basin', N'Northern European (38%), Sub-Saharan African (31.2%), South Asian (21.6%), Middle Eastern (7%), and Hispanic/Latin American (2.2%) ancestry—a striking global blend. The combination creates warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, balanced facial structure reflecting African and South Asian features with Northern European bone structure, and a sturdy build suggesting endurance and presence.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid without heaviness; a body built for endurance and presence rather than speed. Strong core, thick forearms, the kind of frame that suggests physical labor in her past and deliberate maintenance now.', N'Silver-white, fully grayed', N'Tight finger-coils, close to scalp, meticulously maintained', N'Short', N'Pale amber, naturally translucent—often mistaken for optical augmentation', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones, weathered but well-kept. The blended ancestry creates an even complexion that deepens slightly in sun exposure, reflecting the warmth of Sub-Saharan African and South Asian heritage balanced with Northern European genetics.', N'Face lined with decades of decision-making; creases around eyes and mouth suggest frequent mild expressions rather than habitual frowning. Strong cheekbones and defined jaw reflecting the blend of African, South Asian, and Northern European ancestry. Skin shows even texture and good care—no visible scarring on the face. Minimal makeup, if any. Expression carries quiet authority.', N'Bioluminescent forearm tracery (active, cosmetic). Subdermal memory chip in right thumb (barely visible—subtle raised scar on thumb pad). Otherwise unaugmented appearance; any other modifications are subcutaneous.', N'Moves with deliberate economy; never rushed, never wasted motion. Sits solidly, takes up space without apology. Hands are constantly in motion when thinking—shuffling imaginary papers, calculating on fingertips. Her stillness when listening is absolute and unsettling.', N'Heavy linen wraps in ochre, rust, and earth tones—intentionally evocative of West African textile traditions, but in contemporary cuts suitable for Tier 4 Gravesend Basin. Layers that allow concealment of a calculating pad in the folds. Always carries a cup (tea, coffee, warm milk—never empty-handed). Practical footwear, worn but maintained. No visible corporate branding; clothes read as ''community fixture'' rather than ''wealthy'' or ''struggling.'' A single piece of jewelry: a worn silver bracelet that has belonged to her for decades.', N'Fifteen years ago she reported a young man named Tunde Fasoro-Walcott to a creditor — a corponation enforcer — knowing what would happen to him. He had borrowed Φ800 and refused to pay. She still lights a data candle to the E.L.F. she calls The Abacus every seventh day, which she says is for good accounts but is actually for him.', N'Warm, formal, proverb-heavy — draws from Wolof and Armenian folk sayings translated into Meridian street pidgin. Precise with numbers, vague with threats.', N'Slow and deliberate, long pauses before key words, never rushes', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'harshita_balogun');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d6-74dc-8126-4974f687ba34', N'Arhaan Holm-Krstić-Bustamante', N'Arhaan', N'', N'Holm-Krstić-Bustamante', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 43, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Whitecap — lakefront district, tourist traps over criminal infrastructure, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Evidence removal and scene sanitation — cleaner', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Arhaan Holm-Krstić-Bustamante is slight and easy to overlook, which is exactly the point. At 43, she has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate her once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — thermal masking system — body heat signature can be suppressed or spoofed — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Born and raised in GLMZ, third generation — she has the city in her blood, its rhythms in her bones, its cruelty in her expectations. She works as a cleaner out of Whitecap, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Arhaan Holm-Krstić-Bustamante lacks in subtlety, she compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'As a cleaner, Cem Lund-Bangura embodies the tension between independence and isolation. She is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Thermal masking system — body heat signature can be suppressed or spoofed. Thermal masking system — body heat signature can be suppressed or spoofed', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Arhaan Holm-Krstić-Bustamante, a 162cm lean neo-noir operative in the GLMZ, 2226. Southeast Asian bone structure with warm olive skin glowing with golden undertones, blended ancestry creating genetically ambiguous cosmopolitan features—prominent cheekbones from Latin heritage, refined jawline with Eastern European angularity, warm hazel-brown amber-flecked eyes. Dark brown hair with silver threading pulled tight in functional braid. Thin white scar along left temple. Circular burn scar on right knuckle. Faint chrome grid thermal masking ports visible on collarbones beneath neckline. Wearing matte black utilitarian jacket and bodysuit, charcoal cargo pants, scuffed steel-toed boots. Wrist-mounted industrial data pad. Standing with economical precision, alert posture, eyes scanning room, still and ready to move. Minimal grooming, no jewelry. Cinematic near-future megacity setting, neon ambient lighting casting cool shadows across her face, revealing her heritage''s warm glow beneath harsh artificial light. Mood: calculated, watchful, dangerous efficiency. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Whitecap', N'local', N'Whitecap', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian ancestry (60.3%) forms the structural foundation—characteristic facial proportions and bone structure. Significantly enriched by Hispanic/Latin American heritage (17.5%) which adds warmth, broader cheekbone prominence, and subtle dimension to facial contours. Eastern European ancestry (10.7%) contributes refined angularity to the jawline and cheekbone definition. East Asian heritage (8.5%) layers additional subtle eye shape variation and skin luminosity. Sub-Saharan African ancestry (3%) adds warmth and depth to undertones. The cumulative effect is a distinctly cosmopolitan appearance—warm-toned, genetically ambiguous in the 23rd-century standard way, with Southeast Asian structure as the dominant visual anchor and harmonious blending of warmth across all ancestry groups.', 162, 52, N'Lean and wiry, deceptively fragile-looking with hidden muscle density. Low body fat, efficient frame designed for speed and endurance rather than power.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid. No ornament, no vanity.', N'Medium', N'Warm hazel-brown with amber flecks, alert and assessing', N'Medium warm olive with golden undertones—the natural result of predominantly Southeast Asian genetics blended with Latin American and African warmth, creating subtle luminosity across the skin surface. Naturally warm-toned even without sun exposure, with a soft glow from the genetically diverse mix.', N'Southeast Asian-influenced eye shape and upper facial structure balanced by broader, more prominent cheekbones from Latin American and African heritage. Angular jawline with East European refinement in definition, creating strong bone architecture overall. Fine-featured with considerable strength in underlying structure. Minimal grooming—no cosmetics, no jewelry. Skin shows small scars from past work: a thin line along her left temple, a burn mark on her right knuckle.', N'Thermal masking system visible as a faint chrome grid pattern across collarbones and upper chest, just below the neckline. When active, her skin takes on a faint metallic sheen. No other visible chrome—everything else is internal.', N'Moves with economical precision—no wasted motion, no flourish. Stands slightly forward on the balls of her feet, ready to move. Eyes are always working the room. She has the stillness of someone who has learned that movement draws attention.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian—functional, dark, forgettable. Black synthetic jacket with deep pockets, fitted but not tailored. Matte black bodysuit underneath for thermal regulation compatibility. Cargo pants in charcoal with reinforced knees. Steel-toed boots, scuffed, well-maintained. A single high-frequency data pad on her left wrist, industrial model—no personal customization. No tags, no brands that speak, no accessories beyond tools.', N'', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arhaan_holm_krsti_bustamante');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ca-7e4e-9e7f-49e46ea7826d', N'Chinwe Phommachanh', N'Chinwe', N'', N'Phommachanh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lockhaven South, Stack Eleven — he lives in the sub-basement maintenance unit, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Building superintendent, Lockhaven South residential stack', N'Independent contractor to Palladian Property Holdings (his actual employer, whom he resents)', N'Chinwe Phommachanh is enormous — six-foot-four with the kind of bulk that comes from two decades of hauling pipes and climbing maintenance shafts, not from any gym program. His skin is deep brown with a reddish undertone, and his face carries a network of small scars from a gas line incident in his thirties that he never had properly treated. He keeps his head shaved and his beard trimmed with almost military precision, the one vanity he allows himself. His eyes are a startling pale grey-green, a recessive gift from his Finnish grandmother that people find unsettling until they realize how rarely he blinks in a crisis.

Stack Eleven houses 340 units of mixed Tier 1-2 residents and Chinwe Phommachanh runs it with the quiet authority of someone who has fixed every pipe, knows every squeaky panel, and has personally carried two elderly tenants out during a partial floor collapse three years ago. He is not beloved in the way that warm people are beloved — he''s respected in the way that a load-bearing wall is respected. He has no patience for bureaucracy and extraordinary patience for people. He maintains a small shrine to the E.L.F. he calls Boiler-Father in the sub-basement furnace room, and believes deeply that the building''s mechanical systems have a will of their own that rewards or punishes based on how people treat them.', N'Building-level authority figure, potential quest giver when something goes wrong in the stack, information source on tenant activity and building infrastructure, moral anchor in a community under stress.', N'', N'Subdermal pressure sensors in both hands (allows him to detect gas leaks and pipe stress by touch — installed after the gas line incident). Spinal brace, partially biointegrated, from the same incident.', N'Begins rounds at 0500, checks boiler, water recyclers, and elevator hydraulics before most residents wake. Takes complaints at his door from 0800 to 0900 only, no exceptions. Eats lunch alone in the furnace room with Boiler-Father.', N'Chinwe Phommachanh, 193cm tall imposing figure, deep warm brown skin with olive undertones, shaved head revealing silver temples, pale grey-green eyes striking against dark complexion, sharp angular East and Southeast Asian bone structure combined with broad Sub-Saharan features, strong jawline mapped with delicate white thermal burn scars on left cheek in branching frost-like pattern, trimmed dark beard with silver threading, calloused working hands, wearing grey and navy Palladian Property Holdings maintenance coveralls over faded grey t-shirt, heavy scuffed work boots, worn brass ring on left middle finger, subtle spinal brace rigidity in posture, 2226 neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial maintenance worker aesthetic, moody overhead warehouse lighting casting shadows across scarred face, concentrated methodical expression, economy of movement, photorealistic, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lockhaven South', N'local', N'Lockhaven South', N'Southeast Asian-dominant genetic heritage (46.1%) interwoven with significant Sub-Saharan African (20.4%), South Asian (15.4%), East Asian (11.2%), and Eastern European (6.9%) ancestry. This rare Diaspora combination manifests as a striking phenotypic blend: deep warm brown skin with subtle olive undertones from the Southeast and South Asian genetic contributions, angular facial structure reflecting East and South Asian bone architecture, and pale grey-green eyes—a recessive Eastern European trait emerging through the genetic mosaic. The overall effect is distinctly non-monolithic, a living example of 22nd-century ancestry complexity where heritage flows visibly through multiple continental lineages simultaneously.', 193, 118, N'Massive and solid without excess fat — the build of someone who has spent two decades moving through tight spaces and hauling load. Broad shoulders, thick forearms, hands scarred and calloused from decades of manual work. Carries himself with the economy of movement of someone who knows the weight and space of their own body.', N'Black with silver threading at temples', N'Shaved skull, maintained with military precision every third day', N'Shaved', N'Pale grey-green — striking and unusual against his deep brown skin, rarely blinking', N'Deep warm brown with subtle olive undertones, the complexion of someone who works in heat and humidity. Rich melanin density reflecting Southeast and Sub-Saharan ancestry, with underlying warmth from South Asian genetics.', N'Face mapped with a fine network of thin white scars radiating across left cheek and jawline from old thermal burn damage — never fully healed cosmetically, only functionally. The scars form an almost accidental pattern, like frost on glass. Strong angular jawline and high cheekbones reflecting Southeast and East Asian bone structure combined with subtle width through the lower face from African and South Asian heritage. Trimmed beard kept short, dark with silver. Deep-set eyes that seem to assess constantly. Lines around the eyes and mouth from forty-four years of serious expression.', N'Minimal. The spinal brace is mostly invisible beneath clothing, though a trained observer might notice the slight rigidity in his movements and the geometric bulge visible along his back if he wears fitted shirts. The subdermal pressure sensors in his hands are completely internal — only visible as faint geometric scarring on the heel of each palm where insertion occurred.', N'Moves with deliberate efficiency — no wasted motion. Stands with shoulders slightly forward from decades of working in confined spaces. Walks with a subtle favoring of hip flexors due to spinal brace. Rarely gestures while speaking. Hands at rest are often slightly curved, as if holding something. In crisis, becomes perfectly still and methodical.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, practical and worn. Grey and navy synthetic maintenance coveralls with Palladian Property Holdings patch (which he wears with visible resentment). Under them, plain cotton t-shirts, usually grey or black. Thick-soled work boots, always clean but heavily scuffed. A single piece of jewelry: a worn brass ring on his left middle finger, no inscription visible. In off-hours, he wears the same coveralls or black cargo pants and faded sweaters. No decoration, no chrome, no fashion. Everything chosen for durability and function.', N'He has been quietly siphoning power from Palladian''s maintenance budget allocation — not for himself, but to fund heating repairs in the lowest floors that corporate refused to approve. He keeps meticulous records of every diverted quanta in a paper ledger, as if documentation makes it less theft. If Palladian audits, he''ll lose everything.', N'Terse, technical when discussing the building, surprisingly poetic when discussing people — different registers, both sincere', N'Slow delivery, long pauses, never raises his voice', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chinwe_phommachanh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a712-77c4-ab99-49eb254dcf9c', N'Azucena Sow', N'Azucena', N'', N'Sow', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Whitecap — lakefront district, tourist traps over criminal infrastructure, near Wacker and State', N'Prototype theft and corporate tech acquisition — tech retriever', N'Freelance — multi-district operator', N'Azucena Sow is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 28, he has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate him once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct ne — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left him with skills and night terrors in equal measure. He works as a tech retriever out of Whitecap, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Azucena Sow has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and he cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Vesna Bergstrom-Konate represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access. Move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon platform', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Azucena Sow, 2226 neo-noir runner, portrait. Deep warm brown skin with golden iridescent undertones, sharp East Asian-influenced cheekbones blending with broader African ancestry facial structure. Dark brown hair with silver at temples, swept back. 178cm lean angular build with visible move-by-wire musculature. Direct intense deep brown eyes, minimal blinking. Brushed chrome neural interface jack visible at base of skull. Thin white scar on left inner forearm, subtle circuit tattoo on right wrist. Black synthetic weave utilitarian jacket, dark cargo pants, matte black smartboots. Data-thin bracelet. Neon-lit runner environment, moody neo-noir lighting, cold blue and warm amber color grading. Coiled ready posture, predatory precision. Nocturnal intensity. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Whitecap', N'local', N'Whitecap', N'North African dominant (53.9%), with substantial Sub-Saharan African (27.5%) and East Asian (18.6%) ancestry. The genetic combination creates deep, luminous brown skin with warm golden undertones — North African ancestry provides the foundational warm tone characteristic of Maghreb and Sahel regions, while Sub-Saharan African heritage adds richness and depth to his complexion. East Asian ancestry (18.6%) contributes subtle but visible definition to facial structure: slightly elevated cheekbones, refined orbital geometry, and a defined jawline that blends harmoniously with the broader ancestry mix.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with corded muscle definition — the physique of someone whose body is a maintained tool rather than incidental cargo. His frame is all efficiency, no excess. Move-by-wire augmentation has eliminated the natural softness of youth; every muscle group maintains tonal readiness even at rest.', N'Dark brown with early silver threading at the temples', N'Short, practical, minimal maintenance — swept back from the face', N'Short', N'Deep brown with alert, direct intensity', N'Deep warm brown with golden iridescent undertones — a luminous blend of North African warmth and Sub-Saharan richness that glows subtly under neon lighting. The pigmentation is even and saturated, suggesting heritage from sun-exposed Sahel and Mediterranean regions, with the kind of coloring that photographs beautifully in low light.', N'Refined facial structure with pronounced cheekbones and strong jawline — the bone structure shows clear East Asian refinement blended with broader African ancestry proportions. Skin is clear but shows the wear of nocturnal living — slight darkness under the eyes that no amount of sleep fully erases. Grooming is meticulous; this is someone who maintains appearance as operational discipline. The golden undertones catch light naturally in runner environments, creating definition without enhancement.', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull is prominently visible — a brushed chrome port the size of a thumbnail, sitting at the C7 vertebra. He makes no effort to conceal it; the jack is part of his professional signature. Move-by-wire system is invisible beneath the skin, but its effects are evident in his unnaturally smooth movements and the predatory precision of his gestures.', N'Stands with minimal wasted position — weight forward on the balls of his feet, ready for quick transition. His movements are economical and controlled, each gesture purposeful. There is a coiled quality to him even at rest, as though the move-by-wire system has encoded constant readiness into muscle memory. He makes eye contact. He doesn''t blink as often as baseline humans.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian runner aesthetic. Black or dark gray synthetic weave jacket with reinforced panels — not armored, but durable. Understated corporate-adjacent pieces underneath: neutral shirts, fitted but not tailored. Dark pants with cargo pockets. Footwear is serious — matte black smartboots with responsive soles for traction and impact absorption. No visible branding, no flashing chrome accessories. Everything is functional. He dresses like someone who might need to move fast, climb, or fight without warning. Minimal jewelry — only a data-thin bracelet on his left wrist, barely visible unless you''re looking for it.', N'', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'azucena_sow');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6fc-70c6-bdbf-49fac370a55e', N'Folakemi Boudiaf', N'Folakemi', N'', N'Boudiaf', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 53, NULL, 20, 3, N'active', N'Old Harbor, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Fixer - Waterway ops', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Folakemi Boudiaf, 182cm tall man with medium-deep warm brown skin blending East Asian, Sub-Saharan, North African and Southeast Asian heritage. Salt-and-pepper gray hair slicked back, short sides. Angular weathered face with prominent cheekbones, moderate nose bridge, amber-brown eyes with striations, deep frown crease between brows. Three-day stubble. Crow''s feet from years of harbor work. Faded anchor tattoo on left forearm. Surgical scar on left collarbone visible at neckline. Wears heavy navy canvas work jacket, thermal undershirt, worn denim trousers, scuffed steel-toed boots. Simple titanium memorial ring on left ring finger. Broad-shouldered sturdy build with subtle age at midsection. Standing with balanced harbor worker''s stance, hands relaxed. Direct gaze, minimal expression. Dim neon-lit harbor district setting, cool blues and amber dock lights reflecting off wet concrete. GLMZ, utilitarian aesthetic, measured deliberate presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'A striking blend of East Asian (31.4%), Sub-Saharan African (28.1%), North African (24.3%), and Southeast Asian (16.2%) ancestry. The East Asian and Southeast Asian elements contribute angular cheekbones and a moderate nose bridge, while Sub-Saharan and North African heritage manifests in warm skin depth and prominent facial structure. Complex phenotype reflecting true cosmopolitan genetic signature of the Ubiquitous Diaspora—no single lineage dominates, creating balanced, multifaceted features.', 182, 89, N'Broad-shouldered and sturdy, with the weathered muscularity of someone who spent decades on water. Slight thickening at the midsection from age and desk work, but core strength evident in posture.', N'Salt-and-pepper gray, naturally darkening to charcoal at the roots', N'Slicked back and trimmed close at the sides, kept practical and functional', N'Short', N'Amber-brown with darker striations', N'Medium to medium-deep brown with warm golden undertones, reflecting the balanced blend of East Asian, Sub-Saharan, North African, and Southeast Asian heritage. Sun-darkened and weathered from years of harbor exposure, creating a rich, complex complexion with subtle warmth beneath.', N'Weathered and lined, particularly around the eyes and forehead. Facial bone structure reflects the multilayered ancestry—prominent angular cheekbones, moderate nose bridge width characteristic of the genetic blend, subtle fullness balanced across the face. Jaw remains sharp despite weathering. Three-day stubble is his default grooming state. Crow''s feet suggest a history of squinting into glare off the water.', N'None visible. Favors invisibility in his work.', N'Moves with measured deliberation, economical gestures. Stands with weight balanced, feet shoulder-width apart—a harbor man''s stance. Hands often rest on table or lap. Direct eye contact. Minimal facial expression; communication relies on tone and word choice rather than animation.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear. Heavy canvas work jacket, navy or charcoal, with deep pockets and reinforced seams. Thermal undershirt. Worn denim or canvas trousers with tool loops. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and well-maintained. A simple titanium ring on his left ring finger—no wedding band, just a memorial marker. Occasionally wears a faded GLMZ Harbor Authority cap from a previous life. No visible corpo branding; clothes are functional, durable, replaceable.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'folakemi_boudiaf');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a621-70bd-b97c-4a3d7795dbb6', N'Cemal Hernández', N'Cemal', N'', N'Hernández', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 30, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spires — mid-level corporate residential towers, near Lake Shore Drive and Division', N'Precision elimination specialist — ghost', N'Freelance — works the Gray Zone circuit exclusively', N'Cemal Hernández is broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 30, her face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She grew up in the Narrows, where the walls are so close together you learn to fight in confined spaces or you learn to lose. She works as a ghost out of The Spires, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Cemal Hernández operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Hadiya Hayashi-Amankwah functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage. Subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Cemal Hernández, 178cm tall, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, strong angular cheekbones and defined jaw, shoulder-length black hair pulled back tight with titanium clasp, iridescent chrome dermal augmentation shimmering across shoulders and upper back in blues and greens. Dark brown eyes. Broad muscular build, functional density. Wearing matte-black reinforced synthweave jacket, fitted base layer, cargo pants with titanium pockets, steel-toed ankle boots. Thin white scar from left temple to ear. Compact posture, economical movement, still and controlled. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, Spires aesthetic, moody neon-touched lighting, neutral shadows, professional fixer energy. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spires', N'local', N'The Spires', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (85.4%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (11.9%) and minor Eastern European (2.7%) ancestry — a diaspora blend creating warm deep brown tones with subtle complexity. The robust frame reflects Caribbean and Central/South American genetic patterns with strength markers from mixed African ancestry.', 178, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and heavily muscled, density rather than bulk — the physique of someone who trains methodically and carries their weight as functional mass. No wasted frame.', N'Black with iridescent chrome undertones where the dermal augmentation spreads up the scalp', N'Pulled back tight, secured with a matte-black titanium clasp', N'Long — shoulder-length, practical', N'Dark brown, natural — no augmentation', N'Deep warm brown with golden-amber undertones — the melanin density of Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan ancestry creates a complexion that catches light with rich warmth. Visible chromatic patterning from dermal camouflage creates shifting iridescent patches across shoulders, collarbone, and upper chest.', N'Strong, prominent cheekbones and defined angular jaw reflecting blended Hispanic/Latin and African ancestry — facial structure is broad and sculpted rather than delicate. Skin is clear, methodically maintained, with visible chrome pigment cells creating a subtle oil-slick shimmer across muscular surfaces when light hits at angle. Minimal cosmetics — efficiency over aesthetics.', N'Chromatic skin pigment cells — active dermal camouflage creating subtle iridescent shimmer across shoulders, chest, and upper back. The chrome is visible and deliberate, not hidden. No attempt to blend the augmentation into baseline human appearance.', N'Compact, economical — shoulders slightly forward, weight centered. Moves like someone trained in close-quarters work, every gesture calculated for minimal wasted motion. Stillness is her default state; when she moves, it''s with purpose. Eyes track entry/exit points and high-ground positions automatically.', N'Tier 2-3 practical — matte-black reinforced synthweave jacket over fitted base layer, cargo pants with titanium-reinforced pockets, low-profile ankle boots with steel toe caps. No logos or corp insignia. All gear is functional, minimal ornamentation. Colors are blacks, grays, deep blues — nothing that stands out in the Spires or the Gray Zone. Clothing is designed for mobility and concealment, not status.', N'Hadiya Hayashi-Amankwah murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cemal_hern_ndez');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5bb-7792-a6ac-4a68a9c7e542', N'Celia Thakur-Arredondo', N'Celia', N'', N'Thakur-Arredondo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 65, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'The Spires — mid-level corporate residential towers, near Lake Shore Drive and Division', N'Personal security and threat neutralization — bodyguard', N'Independent — maintains network of professional contacts', N'Celia Thakur-Arredondo is broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 65, he has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate him once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see him surpass them. He works as a bodyguard out of The Spires, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Celia Thakur-Arredondo describe him as a precision instrument — point him at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Aybek Arvidsson-Sesay is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When he makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of his stories.', N'', N'Eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom. Eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Celia Thakur-Arredondo, 65-year-old neo-noir operative, 188cm tall broad-shouldered frame. Warm golden-brown skin with olive and amber undertones reflecting South Asian, Hispanic, and Middle Eastern heritage. Angular yet harmonious facial structure with well-defined cheekbones, deep-set observant eyes, one natural dark brown and one matte gunmetal chrome cybernetic eye with amber sensor glow. Steel gray hair with dark roots, closely cropped. Weathered face showing age gracefully with fine lines around temples and mouth. Close-shaved jaw. Faint white scar down left neck, burn scars on right forearm, utilitarian tattoo on left wrist. Wearing charcoal wool blazer with reinforcement panels over dark neutral layers, expensive worn boots. Standing with coiled potential, deliberate posture, tracking gaze. Spires district mid-tier apartment or corporate corridor background. Moody GLMZ lighting, cool blues and warm practical tungsten, subtle neon reflection on chrome eye. Forgettable professional aesthetic, no flash. Film noir corporate security atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spires', N'local', N'The Spires', N'Truly cosmopolitan blend: South Asian foundation (42.7%) combined with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (37.9%), Middle Eastern (14.7%), Sub-Saharan African (3.1%), and East Asian (1.6%) ancestry. This creates a complexion and facial structure that defies simple categorization—warm golden-brown skin with olive and amber undertones, bone structure showing the angular strength of South Asian and Middle Eastern heritage softened by Hispanic warmth and refined by subtle East Asian geometry. The result is striking without being exotic: a face that belongs to the globalized future.', 188, 104, N'Broad-shouldered and heavy-set, with dense muscle mass beneath a layer of middle-aged weight distribution. Carries his frame with the controlled balance of someone who knows exactly how much force he contains.', N'Steel gray with hints of dark brown at the roots', N'Closely cropped, military-practical', N'Short', N'Left eye: dark brown, natural. Right eye: matte gunmetal chrome with faint amber lens-flare beneath the surface', N'Warm golden-brown with olive and amber undertones from the complex blend of South Asian (42.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (37.9%), and Middle Eastern (14.7%) heritage, subtly enriched by Sub-Saharan African and East Asian ancestry. Weathered from 65 years of living, showing the depth that comes from genuine global genetic mixing.', N'Angular yet harmonious facial structure reflecting the blend of South Asian and Middle Eastern bone geometry softened by Hispanic proportions and East Asian refinement. Moderate, well-defined cheekbones, straight nose with defined nostrils, deep-set eye sockets that give him a perpetually observant expression. The lower face carries warmth from Hispanic and Sub-Saharan ancestry. Skin shows age gracefully—fine lines around the mouth and temples, minimal scarring on the face itself. Close-shaved jaw, minimal facial hair. No vanity in grooming, only maintenance.', N'Right eye is unmistakably cybernetic—matte chrome casing with a faintly visible aperture mechanism and amber-tinted optical sensor. No effort to conceal it. The augmentation is professional-grade, industrial aesthetic. Suggests additional augmentation beneath clothing that isn''t immediately visible.', N'Stands with weight evenly distributed, never off-balance. Moves with deliberate economy—no wasted motion, no nervous gestures. Eyes track people and exits constantly, habit made instinct. When stationary, he creates an impression of coiled potential rather than relaxation.', N'Mid-tier Spires resident wearing quality without ostentation: charcoal wool blazer, dark neutral underlayers, tailored but not form-fitting. Custom-fitted jacket with subtle reinforcement panels at the shoulders. Expensive boots broken in from real use, not display. No logos, no flash, no jewelry. Dresses like someone who needs to move quickly and be forgettable.', N'', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Halting — speaks in fragments, reassembles thoughts in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'celia_thakur_arredondo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b9-738b-a3ec-4a86de0cc242', N'Bahar Jaramillo-Cissé', N'Bahar', N'', N'Jaramillo-Cissé', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor, sub-level canal district, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Street-level medic and unlicensed augmentation surgeon operating out of Old Harbor', N'Independent; loosely aligned with Old Harbor''s informal mutual aid networks; explicitly unaffiliated with any corporate or government body', N'Bahar Jaramillo-Cissé is a broad-shouldered man whose face has been mapped by decades of difficult living — deep-set creases around his eyes, a jaw that still carries the ghost of old muscle, skin the warm brown of river silt that has seen too many winters. His hair is close-cropped and almost entirely white, though his eyebrows remain stubbornly dark, giving him an expression of permanent mild surprise. He works in a converted barge permanently moored at Canal 7, where the smell of antiseptic and frying oil from the neighbouring food stall have become inseparable. His hands are his most striking feature: enormous, steady, and threaded with the fine silver filaments of a haptic-feedback augmentation that lets him feel at the microscopic level — installed, he''ll tell anyone who asks, by himself, on himself, without anaesthetic, in 2171.

He was once a licensed trauma surgeon at a Meridian Core hospital before a malpractice suit — widely believed to have been engineered by a corporate competitor — stripped him of his credentials and left him with a debt load that pushed him to the Gray Zone and eventually to Old Harbor. He rebuilt himself slowly, earning trust one stitched wound at a time, one extracted bullet at a time, until the canal district came to regard him as something between a doctor and a priest. He charges what people can pay, which is often very little, and he has never turned away a patient who was bleeding.

Bahar Jaramillo-Cissé carries his past with the careful stillness of a man who has decided not to be destroyed by it, but has not quite decided to forgive it either. He drinks a single glass of real Scotch every evening at precisely 8 p.m. — a ritual that functions simultaneously as reward, mourning, and punctuation. He keeps a photograph of his daughter, Liria, tucked under the lip of his operating lamp. She is in The Spire now, a junior executive at Helix-Vantage Biomedical. They have not spoken in eleven years.', N'Moral anchor and threshold guardian for the street-level world; represents the cost of integrity in a system designed to monetise suffering; his barge functions as a neutral ground where information and people converge', N'', N'Haptic-feedback microsurgical filaments in both hands (self-installed, uncertified),Subdermal toxin-analysis patch on left forearm — identifies contaminants on contact,Optical overlay for vein and tissue mapping, left eye only (right eye refused on principle),Cervical pain-suppression node — installed to manage a spinal injury, kept because the work requires it', N'Wakes at 5 a.m. regardless of when he slept, makes strong coffee in a battered press, reviews any overnight patients. Mornings are walk-in hours; afternoons are appointments, teaching, or supply runs through Old Harbor''s grey market. Evenings are for complex procedures requiring controlled conditions. The 8 p.m. Scotch is inviolable. Sleeps in a hammock strung across the barge''s bow cabin, often with a medical text open on his chest.', N'Bahar Jaramillo-Cissé, 185cm tall, weathered older man with rich warm brown skin with bronze and copper undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan, Southeast Asian, and Hispanic ancestry. White and iron-grey close-cropped hair, dark eyebrows. Deeply lined face with high cheekbones and prominent nasal bridge, aged amber-gold cybernetic left eye with luminescent grid overlay glowing faintly, natural dark brown right eye. Thin scar across left temple. Broad-shouldered muscular build, slight midsection softness. Wears faded grey linen shirt with rolled sleeves revealing silver filaments threaded through hands, dark cargo pants, aged brown canvas coat with repair patches. Surgical scar visible on left forearm. Surgical scars on knuckles. Stands with economical posture, hands visible and still with palms up. Titanium wedding band on left ring finger. GLMZ canal-district industrial setting, tungsten and neon lighting, weathered background, contemplative expression, hands in focus, low-light moody atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Deep diaspora blend: 31.7% Sub-Saharan African (primary), 27.3% Southeast Asian, 25% Hispanic/Latin American, 6.8% Eastern European, 6.2% Northern European, 3% South Asian. Features reflect this intricate genetic weaving—warm brown skin with bronze and copper undertones, facial structure showing West/Central African bone prominence softened by Southeast Asian and Hispanic facial geometry, with subtle eye shape contribution from South and Southeast Asian ancestry.', 185, 92, N'Broad-shouldered and still muscular despite age, with the dense frame of someone who has done physical labor for decades. Chest and shoulders retain definition; slight softening at the midsection from years of late-night coffee and minimal exercise, but still fundamentally sturdy.', N'White with iron-grey undertones', N'Close-cropped, military precision, styled with a clipper at approximately 8mm length', N'Short', N'Left eye: amber-gold with faint luminescent grid overlay (vein-mapping optical); Right eye: dark brown, natural', N'Rich warm brown with bronze and copper undertones—the complex coloration of Sub-Saharan, Southeast Asian, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry with subtle contributions from Eastern and Northern European heritage. Weathered and uneven from decades under barge-cabin tungsten and canal-district industrial light, with the patina of someone who has spent half their life in artificial environments.', N'Deeply lined face map reflecting age and exposure: deep creases radiating from the outer corners of both eyes (shaped by mixed ancestry bone structure with African prominence and Southeast Asian eye shape softening), pronounced nasolabial folds, horizontal forehead lines, vertical crease between brows. Jaw still defined despite age; stubble growth appears as iron-grey rather than white. Skin shows minor scarring on left temple (old laceration) and weathering consistent with decades of exposure. Dark eyebrows remain stubbornly dark brown, creating a perpetual expression of mild surprise against white hair. Facial features show the broad nasal bridge and high cheekbone prominence characteristic of Sub-Saharan and Southeast Asian ancestry, with the more delicate bone structure contributed by Hispanic/Latin American and Northern European lineage creating a balanced, mature face.', N'Both hands thread with fine silver filaments visible beneath the skin, most apparent on the backs of the hands and between the knuckles when his hands are in motion or light strikes them at an angle. Left eye displays a faint luminescent amber grid overlay, most visible in low light or when he focuses intently. Left forearm bears a subtle raised scarline where the toxin-analysis patch sits subcutaneously. Cervical pain-suppression node is not externally visible but may be palpable as a small subdermal ridge at the base of the skull if touched.', N'Carries himself with the careful vertical stillness of a man managing chronic pain with an implant. Movements are economical and precise — no wasted motion. Hands are his primary expressive tool; they move with unusual steadiness and deliberation, especially during conversation. When concentrating, he tilts his head very slightly to bring his augmented left eye to bear. Walks with even weight distribution, suggesting either good physical conditioning or learned compensation for the spinal issue. At rest, he tends to keep his hands visible and still, palms up — a gesture that reads as both openness and control.', N'Tier 5 utilitarian with embedded practicality. Typically wears: loose linen or synthetic blend work shirts in faded grey, tan, or cream, sleeves rolled to mid-forearm to keep augmented hands visible and accessible. Cargo pants or modified medical scrub bottoms in slate grey or forest green, with reinforced thigh pockets for instruments and supplies. An aged brown canvas coat with multiple interior pockets, visible repair patches, and the faint smell of antiseptic is his near-constant outer layer. Work boots are high-topped, oil-resistant, and visibly resoled multiple times. No corporate branding. No chrome. No affectation. Everything is worn smooth by use and weather. A single piece of jewelry: a titanium wedding band on his left ring finger, no longer worn for marital reasons but kept as anchoring weight.', N'The malpractice suit was not entirely fabricated. Augustin made an error — a small one, non-fatal, but real — and rather than disclose it, he let the corporate narrative swallow it whole. He has never told anyone. The patient lived. He isn''t sure that matters.', N'Medical precision mixed with the worn idioms of someone who has lived in many cities; occasional Spanish phrases, especially under stress; avoids corporate jargon with visible distaste', N'Slow and deliberate when explaining, faster and clipped when working; capable of long, winding sentences that arrive at their point only after establishing every surrounding condition', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bahar_jaramillo_ciss');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('14df5f36-2821-5265-b171-4a8923c5ae8a', N'Cezar Watanabe-Gyasi', N'Cezar', N'', N'Watanabe-Gyasi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A boring office in Glassway designed to be forgettable — beige walls, standard furniture, nothing that reveals personality', N'Private Investigator', N'Helix Biosystems (mid-level private investigator)', N'Cezar Watanabe-Gyasi is the PI that fraud investigators dream of and fraudsters have nightmares about — a methodical, meticulous, mathematically minded investigator who specializes in the art of proving that the numbers don''t lie, even when people do.

His professional life is insurance fraud. He works on retainer for three of GLMZ''s largest insurance underwriters and two corporate risk assessment firms, investigating claims that statistical analysis has flagged as potentially fraudulent. His cases range from individual claimants faking cyberware injuries to elaborate multi-year fraud operations involving dozens of participants and millions of Quanta. He approaches every case with the same patient methodology: gather the numbers, analyze the patterns, find the anomaly, prove the fraud.

The mundanity of his work is his greatest asset. Nobody pays attention to the insurance investigator. He moves through corporate offices, medical facilities, repair shops, and financial institutions with the invisibility of someone who belongs everywhere and nowhere. His interviews are so bland that subjects relax and contradict themselves. His reports are so thorough that legal challenges are futile. He is not exciting, not dramatic, and not interested in being either. He is simply very, very good at mathematics, and in a city built on financial transactions, mathematics is power.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cezar_watanabe_gyasi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a708-7b4e-a063-4b218ad99f7b', N'Afreen Cervantes', N'Afreen', N'', N'Cervantes', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mobile through the Blackpipe Corridor, Irkalla, and the sub-levels beneath Brewer''s Spine, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Echo Hunter — salvages audio data and acoustic recordings from tunnel resonance phenomena, sells to surface collectors and archivists', N'Unaffiliated; maintains working relationships with several surface buyers; tolerated by Bore Rat clans for the acoustic data she provides on tunnel structural integrity', N'Afreen Cervantes is thin and quick and almost always in motion, her energy giving the impression of something wound very tight and vibrating at a frequency just above human hearing. She has a cat-ear mod — large, mobile, dark charcoal grey — which she got not for aesthetics but for the genuine audio advantage they provide in tunnel environments; they swivel and tilt when she''s listening hard, which is most of the time. Her face is narrow and expressive beneath a band of freckles across the nose and cheeks, and her eyes have patterned irises: concentric rings of amber and black that look like a sound-wave rendered in color. Her hands are nearly always occupied — she''s either holding recording equipment, taking it apart, or making something new from pieces of things that used to be other things.

She is twenty-two and carries it with both the swagger of someone who has survived the deep tunnels young and the restlessness of someone who hasn''t yet figured out what she''s for. Her profession is strange and specific: the tunnel networks of GLMZ have peculiar acoustic properties, and certain deep junctions resonate with decades of accumulated sound — not intelligibly, not like recordings, but as dense textural phenomena. Afreen Cervantes hunts these resonance points, captures the audio with rigs she builds herself, and processes the captures into something she sells to surface archivists, experimental composers, and ELF shrine-keepers who believe the resonances carry spiritual data. She believes none of the spiritual dimension of this work and all of the beauty of it.', N'Mobile information network — moves through more of the tunnel system than almost anyone else and notices everything. Delivers local color and unexpected knowledge. Potential guide or scout. Her recordings are a story hook resource: captured sounds can contain voices, events, secrets.', N'', N'Geneware: charcoal-grey cat ears (functional audio enhancement, mobile); patterned irises (amber-black concentric rings, cosmetic). Tech: custom-built acoustic recording rig worn as a vest harness, salvaged components.', N'She sleeps irregular hours wherever the work takes her, often in the resonance chambers themselves when a recording session runs long. Eats when she remembers, trades acoustic structural data to Bore Rat clans in exchange for passage and safety.', N'Afreen Cervantes, androgynous tunnel salvager with warm medium-brown skin, golden-olive undertones, dense freckle constellation across nose and cheeks. Sharp jawline, high prominent cheekbones, narrow angular face. Patterned cybernetic eyes with amber and obsidian concentric rings. Dark brown hair pulled back in practical braid with loose strands framing face. Charcoal-grey functional cat ears (fully mobile, twitching toward sound). Wiry 164cm frame, 52kg, coiled and alert posture. Wearing patched grey salvage work pants, thin synthetic undershirt, black reinforced canvas sleeveless vest with countless pockets serving as equipment harness attachment. DIY acoustic recording rig visible across chest and back—salvaged metal components, exposed wiring, sensor nodes, metallic patches. Worn reinforced tunnel boots. Faint electrical burn scar on left forearm. Wind-burned complexion, constantly fidgeting with equipment. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, underground tunnel setting, cool blue-grey lighting with amber equipment glow, dust and industrial atmosphere, movement blur suggesting kinetic energy, documentary photography aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mobile through the Blackpipe Corridor', N'local', N'Mobile through the Blackpipe Corridor', N'Complex global diaspora: Hispanic/Latin American (33.8%) foundation blended with significant Indigenous American (18.7%), North African (18.7%), Northern European (15.0%), Sub-Saharan African (10.6%), and East Asian (3.2%) ancestry. This creates a genuinely multifaceted phenotype—warm medium-brown skin enriched by golden and olive undertones, high cheekbones with refined but slightly widened facial structure, and warm-toned complexion that reflects the convergence of Latin American, African, and Mediterranean genetics. The Indigenous American ancestry contributes subtle width across the face and strong cheekbone prominence; North African heritage adds warmth and slightly deeper undertones; Northern European ancestry refines the bone structure; African heritage contributes to warm undertones and lip fullness; East Asian ancestry adds subtle refinement to eye shape.', 164, 52, N'Wiry and angular, all sharp joints and economical muscle; built for crawling through tight spaces and sustained motion rather than strength. Her frame suggests someone who subsists on irregular meals and constant kinetic activity.', N'Dark brown, almost black, with a faint reddish undertone', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid or bun; loose strands frequently escape and frame her narrow face', N'Medium', N'Patterned irises: concentric rings of amber and obsidian black, resembling a sound-wave visualization or a vinyl record. Sclera clear and alert.', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and olive undertones, scattered with freckles across the bridge of her nose, cheeks, and shoulders—a dense freckle constellation that serves as a defining feature', N'Fine-featured with a slightly broader face reflecting Indigenous American and North African ancestry, high cheekbones and sharp jawline showing Northern European refinement blended with fuller lip structure from African heritage. Frequently wind-burned or dust-stained from tunnel work. Expressive—eyebrows mobile, mouth quick to animate. No makeup; her augmented irises serve as sufficient aesthetic mark.', N'Charcoal-grey cat ears (feline in anatomy, fully mobile and functional) mounted where human ears would be; ears swivel and tilt independently when she''s actively listening. Custom acoustic recording rig worn as a harness across her chest and back: salvaged metallic components, visible wiring, contact patches, and sensor nodes. The rig is clearly DIY—welded, rewired, repurposed from decommissioned equipment. No chrome limbs or obvious subdermal armor; her augmentations are sensory and functional rather than combat-oriented.', N'Perpetually coiled and alert, moving with quick, economical gestures. She fidgets constantly—adjusting equipment, tapping her fingers against recording apparatus, her ears rotating toward sounds others can''t consciously hear. When stationary, she''s rarely still; weight shifts, fingers work, eyes track. When moving through tunnels, she''s fluid and low, using knees and hands as much as feet. Her energy reads as barely contained—vibrating at a frequency just slightly above rest.', N'Tier 4/5 utilitarian: salvaged work pants (grey, patched at the knees and thighs) held up with a utility belt carrying tools, batteries, and recording media. A layered top system—usually a thin, faded synthetic shirt under a sleeveless vest (black, reinforced canvas, countless pockets) that doubles as her equipment harness attachment point. Worn boots with reinforced soles (tunnel-ready). No jewelry. A heavy coat or cloak for sub-level work, threadbare but functional. Clothing is functional over aesthetic; stains and repairs are visible and accepted as part of the job.', N'Six months ago she captured a resonance that she believes contains a coherent voice — not echo, not artifact, but something speaking in a language she doesn''t recognize. She has replayed it six hundred times and has shown no one because she doesn''t know what it would mean if it''s real.', N'Enthusiastic and technical — acoustic terminology, equipment jargon, descriptors that are more synesthetic than precise (''the low wet sound'', ''a dry click-frequency'')', N'Fast, with sudden pauses when something catches her audio attention mid-conversation — she''ll stop, cat ears rotating, then return to the sentence', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'afreen_cervantes');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ab-7a6a-9004-4b6010975dfb', N'Thora Vasquez-Alfarsi-Cardenas-Sigurdsson', N'Thora', N'', N'Vasquez-Alfarsi-Cardenas-Sigurdsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Whitecap — lakefront district, tourist traps over criminal infrastructure, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Aerial extraction and rapid transit pilot — getaway pilot', N'Semi-independent — has standing arrangements with several crews', N'Thora Vasquez-Alfarsi-Cardenas-Sigurdsson is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 28, he has the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers a — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He taught himself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know him best. He works as a getaway pilot out of Whitecap, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In a city full of people who talk about what they''ll do, Thora Vasquez-Alfarsi-Cardenas-Sigurdsson is one of the ones who actually does it.', N'Altan Salazar-Quansah represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers at 50 meters. Bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Thora Vasquez-Alfarsi-Cardenas-Sigurdsson, 178cm tall pilot with deep warm brown skin and golden olive undertones, striking East Asian-African-Middle Eastern-Hispanic blend facial structure. High defined cheekbones, deep-set brown eyes with amber glints, strong angular jawline with old healed break asymmetry. Short dark brown hair with sun bleached streaks, cropped and disheveled from helmet wear. Matte gunmetal cyberears flush-mounted behind hairline. Thin white scar on left temple, silvered burn scarring visible on right forearm from wrist to elbow. Lean muscular build, coiled tension in posture. Wearing black flight jacket over synthetic base layers, cargo pants, worn boots. Sleeves rolled showing cyberear ports and forearm scars. Titanium ring on left ring finger. Sitting forward in coiled readiness, hands fidgeting with lighter, eyes scanning. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, neon light catching scar details and catching warm undertones of deep brown skin, dimly lit cockpit or runner''s safe house interior, realistic gritty texture, weathered from constant field work, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Whitecap', N'local', N'Whitecap', N'Mixed heritage from Hispanic/Latin American (39.9%), Northern European (27.2%), Sub-Saharan African (11.2%), Middle Eastern (10.3%), and East Asian (9.6%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates striking features: prominent cheekbones with East Asian structure softened by broader Sub-Saharan African contours, warm deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones from the Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and Middle Eastern mix, strong angular jawline with subtle widening at the base reflecting Middle Eastern structure, and deep-set eyes reflecting the African and Indigenous components of the ancestry.', 178, 72, N'Lean and angular with defined musculature from constant physical conditioning. No excess body fat. Shoulders slightly forward from hours in pilot seats. Wiry rather than bulky — built for endurance and precision, not power.', N'Dark brown, naturally black with sun-bleached streaks from outdoor exposure', N'Cropped short and functional, often disheveled from helmet wear. No vanity investment.', N'Short', N'Deep brown with slight amber undertone in bright light', N'Deep warm brown with golden and olive undertones, melanin-rich from the complex blend of Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and Middle Eastern ancestry, tempered by Northern European and East Asian genetics. The complexion has depth and warmth characteristic of this diverse genetic mixing, with subtle variations in undertone across the face.', N'High, defined cheekbones with East Asian structure balanced by broader Sub-Saharan African contours and Middle Eastern width across the cheek. Strong angular jawline with slight asymmetry from an old break that healed imperfectly. Eyes set deep and wide-spaced, reflecting mixed Indigenous and African ancestry. Minimal facial hair — cleanly shaved. Skin has the weathered quality of someone who spends time in open-air cockpits. Fine stress lines around the eyes.', N'Cyberears mounted flush against skull behind natural hairline — matte gunmetal finish with barely-visible mesh grilles at the ear canal. Minimal design language, no decorative elements. No visible internal augmentations, though bioware adrenaline regulator is subcutaneous.', N'Sits forward, coiled tension even at rest. Movements are economical and precise — nothing wasted. Eyes constantly scanning, tracking movement and light sources. Hands fidget with small objects (lighter, coin, pilot''s controller) when stationary. Walks with long strides, shoulders slightly hunched. Gives the impression of someone always ready to move immediately.', N'Tier 3-4 functional pragmatism. Black or dark gray flight jacket over close-fitting synthetic base layers. Cargo pants with reinforced pockets. Worn boots with good traction and ankle support. No logos or corporate branding — plain, durable, replaceable. A single piece of jewelry: a worn titanium ring on left ring finger, no obvious significance. Clothing is maintained meticulously but shows honest wear. Sleeves usually rolled to show cyberear ports and forearm scarring — announces augmentations without vanity.', N'Altan Salazar-Quansah once worked for corporate intelligence and still has a handler who calls in favors. Each favor erodes what''s left of their independence.', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'thora_vasquez_alfarsi_cardenas_sigurdsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a607-73c9-86ba-4b7ae61e2e62', N'Akua Srisai', N'Akua', N'', N'Srisai', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Operates across Geartown, The Narrows, and Old Harbor; lives in a single room in Ironvein, near Lake Shore and Navy Pier', N'Delivery driver, independent courier', N'Independent (registered through GigFlow courier platform, Ringo subsidiary)', N'Akua Srisai is young enough that she still surprises herself with her own capabilities, and old enough to be irritated by that. She''s wiry and quick, with the kind of fitness that comes from necessity — she''s been riding cargo bikes and mag-runners for four years and her body shows it: lean legs, strong forearms, a particular alertness in how she holds herself when stationary, like a thing coiled. Her Ethiopian-Tongan heritage has given her dark brown skin with warm undertones and a compact build, and her Ukrainian great-grandmother contributed cheekbones she was teased about as a child and now gets compliments on and distrusts. She has cat ears — a cosmetic geneware mod she saved three months'' earnings for, small and black-tipped, mobile when she''s focused or startled, which she thought would be cute and turns out to also be extremely practical for navigating noisy traffic.

She runs packages, parcels, and things that don''t get listed on manifests for whoever''s paying, and she doesn''t ask what''s in things because she''s figured out that asking doesn''t actually protect her and just makes clients paranoid. She is not naive about this. She is making a calculated choice with the information available to her, which is the main thing she does. Her whole life is calculated choices made fast on incomplete data, which she''s gotten good enough at that she sometimes worries what she''ll do when she can''t do it anymore.', N'Mobile information carrier — knows every route, shortcut, checkpoint, and currently surveilled corridor across three districts. Can carry things, deliver things, or be someone who needs to be followed. Knows things about the city''s physical infrastructure that no map has current.', N'', N'Cat ears, geneware (black-tipped, mobile, functional sensory enhancement); retractable microfiber grip pads on fingertips (practical, aids cargo handling and climbing); cheap neural pace-meter that monitors heart rate and fatigue and whispers numbers in her left ear', N'On the road by 0700, takes jobs off the GigFlow queue until she hits her target earnings for the day, usually 1600-1800. Eats while riding. Spends evenings in her room doing maintenance on her mag-runner or at the Ironvein block''s common space.', N'GLMZ courier character Akua Srisai, 163cm compact athletic frame, medium olive skin with warm peachy undertones reflecting Eastern European-Southeast Asian-North African heritage blend. High angular Slavic cheekbones softened by Southeast Asian jawline fullness. Natural black hair pulled back tight, shoulder-length. Dark brown alert eyes. Functional black-tipped geneware cat ears with visible microservos, mobile and tracking sound. Wiry defined musculature from years of courier work. Wearing reinforced cargo pants, gray synthetic overjacket with GigFlow logo, worn tech-fabric gloves, magnetic grip boots. Faint scars on inner forearms, callused hands with visible microfiber grip pad lines. Neural interface port behind left ear hidden by hair. Salvaged mag-runner housing bracelet. Perpetually coiled stance, weight forward, scanning expression. Urban GLMZ neon-lit street setting, motion blur suggestion, cool blue-purple neo-noir lighting catching olive skin luminescence, professional courier in action, cinematic depth --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Operates across Geartown', N'local', N'Operates across Geartown', N'Eastern European dominant (53.5%) with substantial Southeast Asian (36.5%) admixture and minor East Asian (6.0%) and North African (4.0%) contributions, creating striking phenotypic blend — medium olive skin with warm peachy undertones, high angular Slavic cheekbones softened by Southeast Asian fullness at jawline, compact athletic frame reflecting Central/Eastern European stature patterns with Southeast Asian metabolic efficiency', 163, 52, N'Wiry and compact with defined musculature from four years of courier work — lean legs built for sustained pedaling and sprinting, strong forearms from constant cargo handling and mag-runner control, minimal body fat, the functional fitness of someone who lives on motion', N'Natural black with warm undertones', N'Practical, usually pulled back in a tight braid or wrapped; no styling flourish', N'Medium (shoulder-length when down)', N'Dark brown, alert and calculating', N'Medium olive with warm peachy undertones — Eastern European pale base enriched by Southeast Asian warmth and North African peachy depth, creating luminous quality that catches light. No sallowness despite urban courier lifestyle', N'Clear skin marked by minor abrasions and faint scars from courier work; high angular cheekbones of classic Slavic structure with Southeast Asian roundness at jawline and subtle fullness through lower face creating balanced definition; warm undertone distribution across face reflecting mixed ancestry; minimal makeup, functional grooming only; skin has resilient, slightly luminous quality characteristic of Eastern European-Southeast Asian blend', N'Black-tipped geneware cat ears with visible microservos at the base and slight iridescence in certain light; retractable microfiber grip pads on fingertips visible as faint silvery lines along fingertip edges when extended; small neural interface port behind left ear (typically covered by hair but audible faint whisper from the pace-meter neural feed)', N'Perpetually coiled readiness even when stationary — compact stance with weight distributed for quick movement in any direction. When in motion, economical and efficient, no wasted gesture. Eyes constantly scanning. Ears track ambient noise with visible, unconscious precision. Sits in cafés or common spaces angled toward exits.', N'Tier 3-4 working courier aesthetic: reinforced cargo pants with multiple sealed pockets, cheap thermal base layer under a gray or dark synthetic overjacket with GigFlow logo worn small on the sleeve, reinforced ankle boots with magnetic grip soles, worn tech-fabric gloves. Everything functional, nothing decorative. Gear shows honest wear — small tears repaired with color-mismatched patches, cargo pockets slightly frayed from constant loading. A single piece of jewelry: a thin bracelet made from salvaged mag-runner housing, personal.', N'Six months ago she was handed a package that felt wrong — too light, shaped wrong, warm. She delivered it. Two days later there was a small item in the city feeds about a person found dead in Old Harbor. The package weight and warmth have been with her since. She hasn''t told anyone.', N'Quick, pragmatic, young — uses slang but also has a surprisingly formal register she deploys when negotiating rates or dealing with clients who try to undervalue her.', N'Fast. Edits as she goes. Sometimes restarts sentences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'akua_srisai');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e1-7b89-ba5e-4b93c8231e18', N'Elu Tofauti-Morimoto', N'Elu', N'', N'Tofauti-Morimoto', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Meridian Core (works), lives in Calumet Rise, near State and Monroe', N'Building cleaner, night shift, Meridian Core corporate towers', N'Contracted through Palladian Facilities Management (a Palladian subsidiary); union member, Local 12 Custodial', N'Elu Tofauti-Morimoto is medium-height and angular, with warm brown skin, high cheekbones, and the kind of face that is easy to forget in a crowd — something they have cultivated deliberately. Their hair is kept very short and they have no cosmetic mods, no visible augments, nothing that catches the eye. They wear the grey uniform of the Meridian Core cleaning contract with an invisibility that is almost architectural. In twenty years of night-shift cleaning, they have become functionally transparent to the Tier 3 and 4 workers who pass them in corridors, and they have decided this is power rather than humiliation, though on some nights that decision costs them.

Elu Tofauti-Morimoto is Congolese-Norwegian by heritage and grew up in Calumet Rise speaking three languages and learning a fourth (Lingala, from recordings of a grandmother they never met). They are precise, observant, and privately very funny — their humor lives entirely in their head and comes out only in the cleaning-crew group chat, where their running commentary on the things they find in corporate trash has become legendary among their colleagues. They have a small shrine to the building ELF — whom they call the Hum — built into their cleaning cart from salvaged parts: a reflective panel, a coil of copper, and a tiny speaker that plays white noise.', N'Exceptional information source — has access to the private spaces of corporate floors, has seen documents, overheard conversations, found things in trash that were never meant to leave the building. Not a runner; will not act on information themselves, but might share it under the right conditions.', N'', N'Respiratory filter implant — occupational, covers chemical cleaning agents. Basic grade, union-negotiated. Nothing cosmetic.', N'Sleeps until 17:00, eats in Calumet Rise, takes the Ferrogate to Meridian Core by 21:30, works 22:00 to 06:00, returns home to sleep.', N'Elu Tofauti-Morimoto, mixed-heritage East Asian-Indigenous American-Pacific Islander facial features, warm medium-tan complexion with golden undertones, high cheekbones, deep brown eyes with amber warmth, short dark hair cropped close, angular lean build 172cm tall, wearing faded grey Meridian Core cleaning uniform and steel-toed boots, standing near industrial wall in dim fluorescent lighting, relaxed but alert posture, slight frown lines from two decades of night shifts, no augmentations visible, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody cool blues and greys, early morning before dawn shift, photorealistic, cinematic lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Core (works)', N'local', N'Meridian Core (works)', N'Predominantly Indigenous American (45.7%) with significant East Asian (27.8%) and Pacific Islander (23.2%) admixture, plus minor Sub-Saharan African ancestry (3.3%)—a product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The genetic blend creates a warm, complex phenotype with strong Amerindian bone structure enhanced by East Asian facial geometry, Pacific Islander skin richness, and Sub-Saharan undertones that resist singular categorization. A truly multihemispheric face.', 172, 68, N'Angular and lean, with long limbs and minimal body fat; the build of someone who moves efficiently through space and doesn''t waste energy', N'Natural dark brown, nearly black', N'Cropped close to the scalp in a practical, maintenance-minimal cut', N'Short', N'Deep brown with warm amber undertones', N'Warm medium-tan brown with golden and subtle reddish undertones—a rich, complex blend reflecting strong Indigenous American and Pacific Islander heritage, East Asian influence, and warm Sub-Saharan depth, creating a nuanced complexion that shifts between golden and bronze in different light', N'High, prominent cheekbones with slightly broader facial structure reflecting Indigenous American heritage; straight nose with subtle bridge definition characteristic of Pacific Islander and Amerindian ancestry blended with East Asian refinement; faint Sub-Saharan warmth in undertones around the temples; clean-shaven; minimal grooming beyond functionality; skin shows the early signs of age—faint lines around the eyes from two decades of night-shift fluorescent lighting, but otherwise well-maintained and unblemished', N'None. The respiratory filter implant is subcutaneous and invisible; no cosmetic mods, no chrome, no LEDs. This is deliberate erasure.', N'Upright but relaxed, with a tendency to move close to walls and perimeters rather than through open space. Their movements are economical and quiet—two decades of night-shift work have taught them to be nearly silent. They have the posture of someone who has learned to be looked through.', N'Invariably the standard-issue grey uniform of Meridian Core''s cleaning contract—functional grey overshirt and trousers, both slightly faded from repeated washing. Practical steel-toed boots, union-approved. A faded grey cap when working. Off-shift, they wear similar neutral colors: greys, blacks, muted blues. Tier 4 working-class baseline, nothing that marks them as trying to climb or stand out. Everything is clean but worn.', N'Eight months ago they found a physical data chip taped inside a recycling bin on the 47th floor. They didn''t hand it in. They don''t know what''s on it. It''s in a sealed pouch behind the false bottom of their cleaning cart and they haven''t decided what to do with it yet.', N'Dry and precise in conversation, economical; much funnier and more expansive in text; uses French phrases occasionally as emotional punctuation', N'Measured, unhurried, with long pauses they''re completely comfortable in', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'elu_tofauti_morimoto');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6df-7b91-a4ba-4c0fd06b353a', N'Nayeli Thakur', N'Nayeli', N'', N'Thakur', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 37, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Steamvent Alley — geothermal district, hot and chemical-smelling, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Covert entry and social penetration specialist — infiltrator', N'Semi-independent — has standing arrangements with several crews', N'Nayeli Thakur is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 37, his expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. He works as a infiltrator out of Steamvent Alley, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Nayeli Thakur is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who he burned last.', N'As a infiltrator, Suki Fujita-Mensah embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes. Internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on demand', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Nayeli Thakur, 172cm tall, stocky muscular build, warm deep brown skin with golden undertones reflecting South Asian and Indigenous American heritage, prominent cheekbones and strong jaw, dark brown sharp eyes, black hair graying at temples in short practical cut. Jagged pale scar down left jaw, burn scar on left hand, weathered knuckles. Exposed chrome hydraulic joint casings at elbows and knees, visible titanium-gray pistons and articulation plates. Black scorched synthetic jacket over black tech-weave shirt, dark charcoal reinforced cargo pants, scuffed steel-toed work boots. Standing forward-balanced with controlled posture, neutral guarded expression, pneumatic hiss faintly audible at joints. Gritty GLMZ industrial setting, cool blue and gray neon lighting, worn concrete and metal background, atmospheric haze, photorealistic, character portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Steamvent Alley', N'local', N'Steamvent Alley', N'Multi-continental blend: 29.6% South Asian, 22.7% Indigenous American, 21.4% Hispanic/Latin American, 21.0% Northern European, 5.3% Eastern European. Genetic mosaic creates a uniquely mixed phenotype — the warmth of South Asian and Hispanic heritage combines with Indigenous American bone structure and Northern European undertones to produce a face that reads as genuinely transcontinental. Prominent cheekbones and strong jawline from Indigenous American and South Asian ancestry, with subtle facial geometry influenced by Northern European heritage, all unified by the warm-toned complexion.', 172, 89, N'Stocky and dense, heavily muscled through the shoulders and core. Compact frame with no wasted space — built for leverage and durability rather than speed. Chest and forearms show pronounced musculature from years of physical work.', N'Black, graying at temples', N'Short, practical cut — no styling, functional only', N'Short', N'Dark brown, sharp and assessing', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden and subtle olive undertones, the balanced result of South Asian and Indigenous American genetic dominance tempered by Hispanic/Latin American warmth and Northern European undertones. Rich, complex undertone rather than purely red or purely yellow.', N'Strong, geometric face with pronounced cheekbones and heavy jaw reflecting Indigenous American and South Asian ancestry. Skin shows minor scarring and deep age lines concentrated around the eyes and mouth — earned through years of tension and controlled expression. Clean-shaven or with minimal stubble. No visible acne or poor grooming — maintenance is part of discipline.', N'Chrome hydraulic joint casings at both elbows and knees — silver-gray titanium alloy, functional design with no cosmetic smoothing. The joints are clearly mechanical when he moves, pistons and articulated plates visible at flexion points. No attempt to hide or conceal them. Internal drug synthesizer is not visible externally.', N'Moves with controlled efficiency — no wasted motion. Stands slightly forward-balanced, weight on the balls of his feet even when stationary. Default facial expression is neutral to slightly guarded. Eyes track movement in his peripheral vision automatically. When he walks, the hydraulic joints produce a faint pneumatic hiss at each step — he''s long since stopped trying to mask it, treats it as ambient.', N'Tier 4 working-class pragmatism. Dark colors — black or dark gray synthetic jacket (insulated, reinforced stitching, scorched at one shoulder). Underneath: plain black tech-weave shirt, lightweight and treated for chemical resistance. Cargo pants in dark charcoal with reinforced knees and extra pockets. Boots are scuffed work-grade synth-leather with steel toe caps. No visible corpo branding or luxury markers. Everything worn is functional, replaceable, and recently maintained. Occasional leather jacket when weather demands it — old, cracked at the seams, smells like synthetic oil and used territory.', N'Suki Fujita-Mensah maintains a second identity — a completely clean civilian persona with a lease, a job history, and a social profile. It''s their exit strategy.', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'nayeli_thakur');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b0-753a-8b0f-4c5ce00f1199', N'Carlota Magnúsdóttir', N'Carlota', N'', N'Magnúsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave — her shop, Scalp Meridian, is wedged between a dumpling stall and a prayer-data kiosk on Volt Street, near Western and Division', N'Barber and braider, runs a one-chair shop in Hamtramck Enclave', N'Independent; loosely affiliated with the Hamtramck Enclave Merchants'' Mutual', N'Carlota Magnúsdóttir is a broad-shouldered woman with hands that move like water — fast, precise, never wasted. Her skin is deep brown with a warm undertone, and she keeps her own hair in an elaborate crown of interlocked locs threaded with copper wire and small LED beads that pulse amber when she''s working. She has a tattoo of a scissors-and-comb motif along her left forearm that she got at nineteen from a street artist in what used to be called Nairobi before the Corponation Accords. Her eyes are the grey-green of old lake glass, an inheritance from her Hungarian grandmother whose name she barely remembers.

She is patient in the way that only people who have survived a lot of nonsense can be patient — a deep, deliberate stillness that makes customers feel held. She will not rush a cut, will not shortchange a scalp massage, will not tolerate disrespect in her chair. She talks constantly while she works, a warm river of local gossip, neighborhood history, and unsolicited wisdom that customers either love or eventually learn to love. She has cut the hair of three generations of some Hamtramck families and considers this her real legacy.', N'Community hub and information broker — she knows everyone in Hamtramck Enclave and several adjacent districts. Quest giver for neighborhood-scale problems, reliable source of background lore, a safe adult presence for younger characters who need grounding.', N'', N'Tactile-feedback fingertip pads (medical grade, helps detect scalp conditions and hair texture anomalies); reading glasses with a built-in magnification overlay she got secondhand from an Aurochs Medical surplus sale', N'Opens at 07:00, takes her last client at 20:00, six days a week. She spends Sunday cleaning her tools, watching old footage of traditional East African hair ceremonies on her battered tablet, and leaving small data-packets at the E.L.F. shrine built into the wall behind her shampoo station.', N'Carlota Magnúsdóttir, GLMZ, 173cm tall with broad shoulders and dense musculature; striking mixed heritage phenotype with warm deep brown skin and golden-bronze undertones; monolid deep brown eyes with amber luminescence; prominent East Asian cheekbones blended with African breadth and feature prominence; elaborate shoulder-length crown of interlocked locs adorned with copper wire threading and amber LED beads; scissors-and-comb indigo tattoo visible on left forearm; reading glasses with LED frame lights worn on beaded chain; pearlescent tactile-feedback pads visible at fingertips; worn leather apron with tool slots over earth-tone linen tunic with rolled sleeves; silver and brass bangles and semi-precious stone rings; faint smile lines indicating chronic warmth; economical posture with hands in constant motion; warm, attentive presence; Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone workshop setting with soft amber and cool blue lighting, depth of field emphasizing her focused, capable presence --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Predominantly East Asian (57.4%) with substantial Southeast Asian (28.6%) and Sub-Saharan African (14.0%) ancestry; the genetic blend creates a striking phenotype—East Asian bone structure and eye shape dominant, with Southeast Asian warmth and African heritage contributing to facial breadth and feature prominence; warm deep brown skin with golden-bronze undertones reflects the harmonic blend of all three ancestral regions', 173, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and solidly muscled through the arms and core from decades of precise, repetitive work; carries weight with density rather than softness', N'Dark brown-black with copper wire threading and amber LED beads', N'Elaborate crown of interlocked locs, each bead-adorned section deliberate and maintained with ritualistic care', N'Long (shoulder-length and past)', N'Deep brown with warm amber undertones, reflecting light with subtle luminosity', N'Warm deep brown with golden-bronze undertones; the layered ancestry creates a complexion with remarkable depth—darker in shadowed areas, warm honey-gold where light catches; suggests the harmonic blend of East Asian, Southeast Asian, and African heritage', N'Unlined face for her age; minimal makeup; skin shows the health of someone who has learned self-care through necessity; faint smile lines around eyes and mouth indicating chronic warmth; prominent cheekbones with moderate width reflecting the blend of East Asian angularity enhanced by African heritage breadth; nose with gentle bridge and well-defined nostrils characteristic of African ancestry; facial structure balancing East Asian angularity with Southeast Asian softness and African feature prominence; monolid and hooded eye characteristic of East Asian ancestry; overall face shows the balanced blend of her three major genetic regions', N'Medical-grade tactile-feedback pads visible at fingertips (slight pearlescent sheen under skin at thumb and first two fingers, both hands); reading glasses with magnification overlay and subtle LED activation lights in the frame corners (worn on a beaded chain around her neck when not in use)', N'Moves with economical grace—no wasted motion; stands with weight balanced, ready to shift; hands are constantly in motion even at rest, fingers finding rhythm in air; head tilts when listening, a habit of attentive care; walks with the steady pace of someone who has nowhere to rush', N'Tier 3-4 practical comfort: well-maintained linen tunics or cotton button-ups in earth tones and jewel hues, often with sleeves rolled to mid-forearm to show the tattoo; neutral-colored work pants with deep pockets; soft leather slip-ons worn thin at the heel; a worn leather apron with small tool slots, patched and re-stitched multiple times; silver and brass jewelry—bangles, rings set with semi-precious stones, a small pendant combining Christian and indigenous Kenyan motifs', N'Her son emigrated to a Zheng-Dao labor compound on the northern gray zone twelve years ago under a work contract and has never contacted her. She tells customers he moved to a better district. She has sent him forty-seven letters through a data-runner she pays monthly. None have been answered.', N'Warm, unpretentious, layered with Swahili loanwords and old Magyar phrases her mother used; comfortable with technical hair and scalp terminology', N'Unhurried and melodic, rises at the end of observations like she''s offering them rather than stating them', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'carlota_magn_sd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c9-719c-bb17-4c842fddcf0e', N'Can Zaragoza', N'Can', N'', N'Zaragoza', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Meridian Core (surface-level administrative district, outer ring), near State and Monroe', N'Corporate Compliance Archivist (former) / Whistleblower-in-Exile', N'Formerly Hexacor Meridian (terminated, hostile); currently unaffiliated; has had contact with two independent journalism collectives and one mid-tier legal advocacy office, all of whom have declined to act on her materials so far', N'Can Zaragoza is a tall, angular Haitian-French woman with silver locs pulled back with administrative precision and reading glasses she refuses to augment away because, as she puts it, she earned the need for them. Her face holds the particular expression of someone who has spent decades being the most competent person in rooms that refused to acknowledge it—a kind of burnished patience that occasionally cracks into something sharper and much less forgiving. She wears corporate-adjacent clothing, clean and structured, in the greys and navies that make people in The Meridian Core assume she belongs there.', N'Institutional memory and moral weight—she carries documented proof of the city''s rot and represents the question of whether legitimate processes can still function; also a mirror for characters who have made peace with complicity', N'', N'Corporate-standard retinal scanner implant (left eye), deactivated from Hexacor network but hardware intact,Subdermal document encryption key, biometric, in right thumb—the only augmentation she had installed herself and paid for out of pocket,Mild hearing augmentation, medical grade, nothing tactical', N'Wakes at six, dresses completely before doing anything else. Spends mornings on freelance records work that pays her rent. Afternoons on her case—cross-referencing, updating indexes, writing summaries she has not yet sent to anyone. Eats dinner at the same noodle counter three blocks from her flat where the owner does not ask questions. Reads physical books in the evening. Sleeps poorly.', N'Can Zaragoza, a 178cm tall lean androgynous woman with warm deep brown skin holding subtle golden and olive undertones from complex five-way ancestry blend (Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, Indigenous American). Sharp, high cheekbones, defined nose bridge, finer orbital geometry, mid-facial width reflecting her mixed heritage. Deep brown eyes with visible amber retinal scanner hardware in left eye. Silver hair with dark undertones pulled back in long locs, worn with functional precision. Fine wrinkles around eyes and mouth. Minimal distinguishing marks: small horizontal scar on right wrist, faint burn mark on left hand. Wearing charcoal grey blazer over white fitted shirt, tailored navy trousers, worn leather satchel. Reading glasses on chain pushed up on forehead. Upright posture, neutral expression, economical movement. Corporate administrative setting, cool fluorescent lighting, 2226 neo-noir GLMZ aesthetic, professional and deliberately unobtrusive appearance --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Meridian Core (surface-level administrative district', N'local', N'The Meridian Core (surface-level administrative district', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora ancestry: Sub-Saharan African (29.8%), East Asian (22.3%), South Asian (20.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (20.3%), and Indigenous American (6.9%). This rare pentuple blend creates a striking, genuinely ambiguous phenotype. Her face displays the broader cheekbones and defined nose bridge characteristic of African ancestry, harmonized with the finer orbital geometry and higher cheekbones of East and South Asian populations. Mid-facial width and distinctive jaw structure reflect the Latin American and Indigenous American components. The result is a face that resists easy categorization—beautiful precisely because it belongs fully to none of the traditional categories and authentically to all of them.', 178, 62, N'Tall and angular, lean through the shoulders and torso with the kind of thinness that comes from decades of sustained tension rather than exercise. Her frame suggests someone who has always occupied space efficiently, taking up only what was necessary.', N'Silver with dark undertones', N'Locs, pulled back tightly with functional precision; no ornament, no looseness', N'Long (mid-back length)', N'Deep brown (left eye contains visible retinal scanner hardware with faint amber LED when inactive)', N'Warm deep brown with subtle golden and olive undertones—the luminous result of five-way ancestry blending. Rich and complex in any lighting, appearing slightly different depending on angle and source. Professional and even in tone across the face and body.', N'Fine wrinkles concentrated around the eyes and mouth—marks of sustained focus and rare smiling. Skin is clear, well-maintained, with warm luminosity characteristic of multi-continental mixed heritage ancestry. Slightly weathered by years in climate-controlled corporate environments and focused analytical work. No cosmetic augmentation. Reading glasses worn on a thin chain, pushed up onto her forehead habitually.', N'Left eye contains a dormant retinal scanner implant visible as a subtle amber ring around the iris and faint circuitry tracery at the outer corner—inactive but hardware remains. Right thumb shows minimal subdermal scarring along the thumb-pad where encryption key was installed; barely noticeable unless actively examined. No tactical augmentations visible; hearing implant is entirely subcutaneous.', N'Posture is upright and economical; she moves with deliberate precision, nothing wasted. Her gait is steady and unhurried, the movement of someone who has spent her life in climate-controlled corporate spaces. She sits with her spine straight, hands folded or occupied with something productive. Her expression defaults to neutral observation; she does not make eye contact easily but does not avoid it either—a compromise born of professional habit.', N'Corporate-adjacent, deliberately bland: charcoal grey blazers over navy or white fitted shirts, tailored trousers in muted tones, clean and structured to pass unnoticed in administrative buildings. Worn leather satchel containing physical documents and a single encrypted datapad. Practical shoes without augmentation ports. Everything is clean, well-maintained, and at least five years out of current fashion—the clothing of someone who dresses to be forgotten, not seen.', N'One of the documents she copied implicates a mid-level Meridian Core administrator she genuinely liked and respected. She has not included it in the case she is building. She tells herself it is a strategic decision.', N'Formal, precise, document-inflected language; uses phrases like ''on the record,'' ''pursuant to,'' and ''the evidence suggests''; occasionally drops into warm, direct speech when her guard is down', N'Deliberate and well-organized, as if she has already outlined what she is going to say; can deliver devastating assessments in the tone of a quarterly report', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'can_zaragoza');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a637-799b-b9c4-4c91f71a383a', N'Amaro Ergashev', N'Amaro', N'', N'Ergashev', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone lower levels, operating out of a humidity-damaged server room in Ironvein, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'compute broker — buying and reselling stolen processing power, illegally siphoned bandwidth, and cracked data-storage allocations', N'Independent, loose association with a compute broker collective called the Overflow Market; pays informal rent to the Ironvein Harrow Boys for physical security', N'Amaro Ergashev gets the nickname ''the Wet'' because of where they work — Ironvein''s lower infrastructure levels have a chronic condensation problem, and Amaro Ergashev''s operation is built into a server room where the ceiling weeps constantly and every surface is furred with gray moisture. They have adapted to this entirely. They wear wicking underlayers always, they''ve waterproofed every piece of equipment twice, and they have the particular unhealthy pallor of someone who works in artificial light with too much humidity and not enough fresh air. Their Fijian-Zimbabwean heritage gives them a strong frame they''ve undermaintained into wiry sedentariness, and their hair, naturally coily, is perpetually slightly damp and kept loose around their shoulders. Their eyes are the mod — pattern irises in a circuit-board geometry, gold on dark brown, glowing faintly under their own tiny internal bioluminescence. They wear them like a business card.

Amaro Ergashev is the person you go to when you need processing power you shouldn''t have — stolen cycles from Axiom''s distributed architecture, warehoused Tessera storage nodes that fell off a digital truck, bandwidth allocations siphoned from Ferrogate Transit''s maintenance grid. They don''t ask what the compute is for, they ask how much and when, and they price on urgency. They are not technically gifted in the sense of building new things — they are technically gifted in the sense of understanding systems well enough to pick their pockets. They are also deeply, genuinely paranoid, which in their line of work has kept them alive, and socially awkward in the specific way of people who relate more naturally to systems than to people.', N'Information source (knows who is doing compute-intensive illegal work across the criminal network), equipment provider for digital operations, quest giver when a stolen allocation traces back somewhere dangerous, window into the digital underground economy', N'', N'Pattern irises — circuit-board geometry, gold on dark brown, internally bioluminescent; neural-digital interface jack (base of skull, third-gen, allows direct system access); dermal moisture management layer (medical-grade, installed for environmental comfort)', N'Works almost entirely nocturnal, monitoring stolen compute allocations and managing resale listings through a heavily anonymized mesh presence; sleeps in four-hour increments; once a week physically meets suppliers in person at shifting locations in the Ironvein lower levels.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Amaro Ergashev: androgynous figure, 177cm tall, wiry build. Deep warm brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Central Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, slightly sallow from fluorescent exposure. Long shoulder-length dark brown coiled hair, damp and matted, frames angular face with defined cheekbones, broad nose bridge, subtle facial fullness, angular jaw. Fine lines around dark brown eyes with glowing gold circuit-board pattern irises, faintly self-luminescent. Perpetually flushed cheeks, smooth waxy complexion. Platinum neural jack port visible at skull base. Hunched posture, desk-worn and economical. Wearing faded teal technical parka with reinforced seams, moisture-wicking base layers visible at collar, loose dark gray cargo pants, industrial sealed boots. Server-room humidity glistens on skin and hair. Dim ambient light catching circuit-pattern eye glow. Condensation-fogged glasses reflection, multiple data streams processing behind tired gaze. Anti-fashion aesthetic, purely functional, unmarked by crew affiliations. Neo-noir noir underground facility lighting, cool-warm light temperature mixing. Mood: introspective, digitally abstracted, nocturnal specialist. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex Silk Road phenotype reflecting 43.6% Central Asian, 24.2% South Asian, 18.0% Sub-Saharan African, 8.3% Eastern European, 3.8% Northern European, and 2.1% East Asian ancestry. This rare blending creates a distinctly multivalent appearance: warm deep brown skin with golden undertones from Central Asian ancestry, enriched and deepened by Sub-Saharan African genetics, with subtle warmth in the midface from South Asian heritage. Eastern European ancestry contributes a faint cool undertone that emerges in certain lighting. The result is a warm-dominant complexion with nuanced tonal variation — skin that appears almost luminous in warm light, grounded in deeper browns in neutral settings.', 177, 62, N'Naturally strong-framed but severely undermaintained through sedentary nocturnal work — wiry and angular, with atrophied muscle definition despite skeletal structure suggesting past athleticism. Slight forward slouch from prolonged server-room posture.', N'Natural dark brown, coated with perpetual moisture sheen', N'Loose, unstretched coils worn shoulder-length; frequently damp, slightly matted at the nape from humidity and irregular sleeping patterns', N'Long', N'Dark brown base with circuit-board pattern irises in gold; faintly self-luminescent under low light', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones and subtle mid-tone variation — darker in certain areas due to Sub-Saharan African heritage depth, warmer in cheeks and around eyes from South Asian genetics, with faint cool undertones from Eastern European ancestry visible only in high-CRI lighting. Sallow undertones from chronic fluorescent-light exposure and humidity-dependent pallor overlay the rich base.', N'Smooth warm brown base with slightly waxy texture from dermal moisture-management layer; visible fine lines around eyes from screen fatigue and squinting in condensation-fogged server rooms; perpetually slightly flushed cheeks from humidity exposure; minimal grooming beyond functional hygiene. Facial structure reflects diaspora heritage with nuanced blending: defined cheekbones with moderate projection from Central Asian ancestry, broader nose bridge and fuller nasal alae from Sub-Saharan African heritage, subtle warmth in midface and gentle facial fullness from South Asian genetics, and slightly angular jaw structure tempered by the overall blend creating a balanced, multivalent appearance.', N'Luminescent circuit-pattern irises are unmistakably artificial and intentionally displayed; they glow faintly gold-on-brown in dim light. The bioluminescence is subtle but immediately marks them as modded. Neural jack port visible at skull base when hair is pulled back.', N'Hunched, desk-oriented posture with tendency to tilt head slightly when listening — a system-monitoring habit. Movements are economical and deliberate; minimal gesturing. Often appears to be mentally elsewhere, processing multiple data streams simultaneously. Fidgets with equipment or fingers when anxious.', N'Tier 3-4 functional, heavily waterproofed. Always wears moisture-wicking base layers (matte synthetic, often visible at collar/wrists). Primary garment is a heavily patched, sealing-treated technical parka in faded teal with sealed pockets and reinforced seams — clearly maintained for humidity resistance rather than aesthetics. Underlayers visible: compression shirt, sometimes a thin haptic-feedback interface vest. Pants are loose, dark gray synthetic with heavy cargo pockets for portable hardware. Footwear is industrial rubber-soled — practical, sealed, fungal-resistant. No jewelry except occasionally a watch with waterproof casing. Aesthetic is anti-fashion: purely functional, deliberately unmarked by crew affiliation or status symbols.', N'They have inadvertently stumbled into a stolen compute allocation that is being used for something they haven''t identified yet but that sends irregular ping patterns they''ve started to suspect are communications — and they have been reading those communications for three months without telling anyone, because they are terrified and also unable to stop', N'technical and precise, defaults to system metaphors for everything including human situations, difficulty with small talk which they compensate for with information-dense monologue', N'uneven — long pauses followed by rapid delivery, as though their thoughts buffer before outputting', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amaro_ergashev');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f1-7ebb-b5bc-4ca83a47e704', N'Boahinmaa Mohammadi', N'Boahinmaa', N'', N'Mohammadi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 30, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Steamvent Alley — geothermal district, hot and chemical-smelling, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Precision elimination specialist — ghost', N'Independent — known in Old Harbor circles', N'Boahinmaa Mohammadi is compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 30, the augmentation scarring around his temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — bone lacing — titanium mesh throughout skeleton, increases durability and striki — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see him surpass them. He works as a ghost out of Steamvent Alley, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Boahinmaa Mohammadi is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who he burned last.', N'Tenzin Popov-Adjei functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Bone lacing — titanium mesh throughout skeleton, increases durability and striking power. Eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Boahinmaa Mohammadi, 168cm compact muscular frame, warm medium-tan skin with olive undertones reflecting Nordic-Levantine-South Asian heritage blend, dark brown left eye with natural almond shape, right eye glowing cyan with targeting reticule implant, black hair with silver threading pulled back tight, strong defined jawline with visible chrome mandible interfaces, titanium mesh geometry visible beneath forearms and neck, surgical scar from temple to ear from cybernetic eye installation, weathered complexion with old scars webbing across cheekbones, minimal facial hair kept clean-shaven, black polymeric tactical jacket with internal gear rig, fitted reinforced tactical pants, matte synth-leather boots with traction treads, economical precise movement stance with shoulders forward and weight low, nocturnal neo-noir operative, moody blue-cyan neon lighting casting shadows across metallic implants, gritty urban Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, cinematic noir atmosphere, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Steamvent Alley', N'local', N'Steamvent Alley', N'Northern European (47.5%) with Middle Eastern (41.2%) and South Asian (11.3%) ancestry. Scandinavian bone structure and pale undertones blend with Levantine and Persian warmth, while South Asian features contribute subtle depth to facial geometry and eye shape. The combination produces warm medium-tan skin with olive undertones, balanced high cheekbones, and a strong defined jawline reflecting the Nordic-Semitic-Desi heritage mix.', 168, 78, N'Compact and densely muscled, built low and wide through the shoulders and hips like a coiled spring. Heavy bone density from titanium mesh lacing gives him a solidity that reads as immovable despite modest height. Forearms and neck show pronounced musculature from constant load-bearing of augmented skeleton.', N'Black with premature silver threading at temples and along the left side', N'Pulled back tight in a functional topknot, occasionally worn loose and shoulder-length when off-grid. No vanity in grooming — purely practical.', N'Medium', N'Left eye: dark brown with almond shape characteristic of mixed Northern European and South Asian heritage. Right eye: luminous cyan with concentric targeting reticule visible beneath polished corneal lens.', N'Warm medium tan with subtle olive undertones—Northern European pale base warmed and deepened by Middle Eastern and South Asian heritage, creating a balanced complexion with golden-bronze depth across cheekbones, temples, and jawline.', N'Weathered and sun-damaged from nocturnal living offset by careful maintenance. Fine scars web across cheekbones and forehead — old work, old mistakes. Strong, defined jawline exaggerated by visible chrome interfaces at mandible junction. Minimal facial hair, kept clean-shaven for equipment interface seal integrity. Facial structure reflects balanced blend of Scandinavian width and angularity with Levantine definition and South Asian orbital geometry.', N'Titanium mesh skeletal lacing visible as faint silvery geometry beneath skin of forearms and along jawline; polished chrome and synthetic cornea of right eye with faint cyan glow when active; subtle port interfaces at both temples and behind right ear, minimal aesthetic finishing', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, every gesture weighted and intentional. Stands with shoulders slightly forward and weight distributed low, a fighter''s baseline. Head rotates before eyes move, a targeting behavior. Walks with a slight forward cant despite compact frame, as if perpetually descending stairs.', N'Tier 3-4 functional minimalism. Black or charcoal polymeric jacket with internal gear rig and subcutaneous armor plating visible only when moving. Fitted tactical pants with sealed thigh pockets, reinforced at knees and hips. Matte-finish synth-leather boots with traction treads suitable for climbing. No jewelry, no branded apparel — all equipment is utilitarian and service-worn. Occasionally wears a long coat salvaged from a Tier 2 corpo when moving between districts, otherwise visible augmentations are his only statement.', N'', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'boahinmaa_mohammadi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c5-7a09-afc3-4d4dc1a3b3f5', N'Hehewuti Okafor-Petelo', N'Hehewuti', N'', N'Okafor-Petelo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Abyssal Threshold, sub-level junctions between Irkalla and the Blackpipe Corridor, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'The Disappeared — erased surface identity, now a tunnel guide for those seeking to vanish', N'The Undertow (loosely); operates independently, trusted by several Bore Rat clans as neutral passage', N'Hehewuti Okafor-Petelo moves like something that has learned to exist in the spaces between things — narrow-shouldered, deliberate, with the uncanny stillness of a person who has spent years being invisible. Her skin carries the faint blue-green bioluminescence of an old cosmetic mod she can no longer afford to maintain, patchy now, blooming mostly along her collarbones and the backs of her hands like dying foxfire. Her eyes are mismatched: one natural dark brown, one replaced with a salvaged optical implant that glows a dim amber, its resolution degraded enough that she sometimes tilts her head like a bird trying to focus. She keeps her hair cropped close, the regrowth uneven. There are no identifying tattoos, no scars she didn''t put there herself. That is intentional.

She is not warm — warmth is something you perform for people who can afford to trust you — but she is precise. She quotes prices once. She explains routes once. She does not repeat herself and she does not forgive carelessness, because carelessness underground kills. People who have been guided by Pitch describe a woman who seems to know the tunnels the way you know the inside of your own mouth: not by thinking about it, but by the body remembering. She was once someone else entirely, with a registered identity, a surface address, a job. She almost never thinks about that person anymore.', N'Quest giver and gate-keeper: the essential contact for anyone trying to disappear from the surface world or smuggle something (or someone) through the deep tunnels. Information source on tunnel geography, rival clans, and who else has recently vanished.', N'', N'Degraded bioluminescent skin mod (blue-green, patchy); salvaged low-grade optical implant in right eye (amber glow, reduced resolution); subdermal pressure-sensitivity nodes along fingertips — lets her feel vibrations in tunnel walls', N'She wakes in a hammock strung between two decommissioned coolant pipes in the Abyssal Threshold and spends mornings walking her routes, checking for cave-ins or new Ferrogate Transit maintenance crews. Afternoons she meets clients — never above Deepwell Station, never in the same spot twice.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Hehewuti Okafor-Petelo: lean 164cm figure with narrow shoulders, wiry frame honed by years of confined-space navigation. Warm medium-deep brown skin with golden and reddish undertones reflecting Indigenous American, Sub-Saharan African, and Pacific Islander heritage. Broad prominent cheekbones, rounded jawline, dark intelligent gaze from natural left eye; right eye a degraded amber optical implant glowing dimly with visible microfractures and internal artifacts. Cropped dark brown asymmetrical hair, close to scalp. Patchy blue-green bioluminescent tracery fading across collarbones and backs of hands, implant failing. Worn black reinforced canvas cargo pants, faded grey sleeveless synthetic top showing luminescent mod, tattered reflective maintenance vest unbuttoned, soldered magnetic boots. Surgical scarring visible at right temple. Preternatural stillness, bird-like posture, economical movements. Industrial underground setting with concrete and metal, cool blue-amber lighting emphasizing optical implant glow and dying bioluminescence, mineral water and rust scents in air. Mood: watchful, minimalist, non-human grace --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Abyssal Threshold', N'local', N'Abyssal Threshold', N'Indigenous American (32.3%), Sub-Saharan African (28.2%), and Pacific Islander (24.8%) ancestry form the dominant genetic foundation, blended with Northern European (8.9%) and South Asian (5.8%) contributions. This creates a striking polychromatic phenotype: warm medium-brown skin with golden, reddish, and subtle bronze undertones reflecting the rich complexity of her ancestry. Broad facial structure with prominent cheekbones and rounded jawline reflects Indigenous American and African heritage, softened by Pacific Islander warmth and refined by subtle Northern European bone definition and South Asian facial geometry. The overall effect is striking and distinctly multi-continental.', 164, 52, N'Narrow-shouldered and lean, almost wiry, with the compressed musculature of someone who navigates confined spaces regularly. Her frame suggests years of deliberate minimization — moving through gaps, staying unnoticed.', N'Dark brown with uneven regrowth', N'Cropped close to the scalp, deliberately asymmetrical, maintenance-free', N'Short', N'Left eye: natural dark brown. Right eye: salvaged optical implant glowing dim amber with visible degradation artifacts', N'Warm medium to deep brown with golden, reddish, and subtle bronze undertones — the rich result of Indigenous American, Sub-Saharan African, and Pacific Islander ancestry tempered by Northern European and South Asian heritage. The base carries faint blue-green bioluminescent tracery.', N'Broad cheekbones reflecting Indigenous American and African heritage; rounded jawline softened by Pacific Islander warmth and refined by South Asian and Northern European subtlety. Warm golden undertone prevents severity. Skin is weathered but meticulously unmarked — no identifying scars, no tattoos. The bioluminescent mod bleeds patchily across collarbones and the backs of her hands like dying phosphorescence, fading in erratic zones where the implant is failing.', N'Amber-glowing optical implant in right eye with visible internal degradation (microfractures, reduced focus clarity). Patchy bioluminescent skin mod (blue-green, mostly non-functional). Subdermal pressure-sensitivity nodes along fingertips are invisible but cause faint luminous tracery to pulse when active.', N'Moves with preternatural stillness — economical, deliberate, never wasted motion. Her gait is silent despite concrete and metal surfaces; her shoulders remain locked in a posture of minimal presence. When she focuses, her head tilts bird-like, compensating for her degraded right eye''s poor resolution. She does not gesture when speaking. Her hands remain open and visible.', N'Tier 5 utilitarian — modified caving gear showing multiple repair generations. Black reinforced canvas pants with welded cargo pockets and carabiner attachment points. Loose layered top in faded grey synthetic, sleeveless to show her bioluminescent mod (whether for navigation or identification is unclear). Worn magnetic boots with hand-soldered sole plates. A tattered reflective vest salvaged from maintenance crews, worn unbuttoned. No jewelry. No identifying markers. Clothes smell of mineral water, rust, and old electrical burn.', N'Her surface identity wasn''t erased to escape persecution or debt — she erased it after she accidentally caused the deaths of three people in a transit collapse she could have reported and didn''t. The guilt is the only thing she has never found a way to tunnel around.', N'Economical, technical when it comes to tunnel geography, completely flat affect when discussing danger — she describes lethal drops the same way she describes left turns', N'Short sentences. Long pauses. Does not fill silence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hehewuti_okafor_petelo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a681-7d46-922b-4d83f29e1005', N'Dulce Cervantes-Banerjee', N'Dulce', N'', N'Cervantes-Banerjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 62, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Ferment Quarter, permanent residency above a venue called The Sump, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Sound sculptor and DJ', N'Independent; The Sump (venue residency); occasional commissioned installations for the Ferment Quarter Artists'' Cooperative', N'Dulce Cervantes-Banerjee is sixty-two and looks it without apology — her face is deeply lined from years of working in smoky underground spaces, her natural hair gone fully silver and kept in long locs that brush her shoulder blades and are threaded with small ceramic beads she''s collected from forty years of touring. She is a large woman with a large physical presence and the extraordinary stillness of someone who has learned that stillness is its own kind of power. Her only augmentation is a set of cochlear audio enhancers she got at thirty-five when early hearing loss threatened to end her career; she treats them with the same maintenance religiosity a surgeon gives their instruments.

She was a significant figure in the GLMZ underground sound scene in the 2170s and is now something the scene has very complicated feelings about: a legend who is still alive, still working, and not particularly interested in being a legend. Her sound sculptures are physical installations — transducer arrays that make space itself vibrate, music that you feel in your sternum before your ears register it. Her DJ sets are rarer now, maybe four or five a year, but the room fills six hours before doors for each one. She has seen the scene reinvent itself four times and has opinions about all of it.', N'Elder information source with forty years of scene history; quest giver with resources and connections; local color anchor for the Ferment Quarter; moral compass figure who complicates easy answers', N'', N'Cochlear audio enhancement implants (bilateral, medical-grade, maintained obsessively); no cosmetic modifications — she considers herself ''done'' with that conversation', N'Mornings are for maintenance and correspondence; afternoons for work in her studio space upstairs; evenings at The Sump''s bar, watching whoever is playing and occasionally offering unrequested but accurate observations.', N'Dulce Cervantes-Banerjee, 178cm tall powerful woman with warm medium-brown skin with golden-olive undertones reflecting mixed Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and East Asian heritage. Silver-white long locs with ceramic beads, shoulder-blade length. Deep brown eyes with warm undertones, alert gaze. Deeply lined face with pronounced laugh lines and high defined cheekbones, angular jaw, unadorned skin showing four decades of intensity. Bilateral chrome cochlear implants visible behind ears with subtle LED indicators. Wearing fitted sleeveless high-neck charcoal technical fabric shirt, dark industrial cargo pants, worn leather boots. Single thin silver ring on right ring finger. Standing motionless in dimly lit studio space with soft blue and amber lighting reflecting off mixing equipment. Precise posture, stillness radiating quiet authority. GLMZ, studio aesthetic, her hands positioned near sound equipment. Fine scar on left temple barely visible, tattoo in Yoruba script on inner left forearm softened by age. Professional, grounded, observant presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Ferment Quarter', N'local', N'The Ferment Quarter', N'Dominant Hispanic/Latin American (54.8%) ancestry with substantial Sub-Saharan African (28.6%) contribution, blended with South Asian (14.4%) and East Asian (2.2%) heritage. This creates a striking phenotype with warm, rich medium-brown skin displaying golden and olive undertones. Facial structure reflects the strong Latin American and African components—defined, angular cheekbones and prominent jawline balanced with subtle eye shape variation from South Asian ancestry. The overall appearance is dimensionally warm, bearing the depth of tropical, equatorial, and subcontinental heritage.', 178, 89, N'Large-framed and solid without softness; broad shoulders and deep chest that reads as powerful rather than heavy. Decades of standing in studios and behind turntables have given her the posture of someone who owns her space.', N'Silver-white, natural', N'Long locs, shoulder-blade length, threaded throughout with small ceramic beads in earth tones and jewel colors collected across forty years of touring and living', N'Long', N'Deep brown with warm undertones, alert and assessing', N'Warm medium-brown with golden-olive undertones, rich and dimensional from the blend of Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and East Asian ancestry', N'Deeply lined face that tells a story of smoke-filled rooms, late nights, and four decades of intensity without regret. Pronounced laugh lines around her eyes. Skin is well-maintained but unadorned—no cosmetic modifications, no attempt to smooth away age. High, defined cheekbones with sharp prominence reflecting Latin American and African ancestry. Strong, angular jaw with subtle definition from South Asian heritage contributing to facial geometry. Skin shows the depth and warmth of her multifaceted mixed heritage. Grooming is precise and minimal.', N'Bilateral cochlear implants visible behind her ears when hair is pulled back—medical-grade chrome housings with subtle LED indicator lights (active when in use). She doesn''t hide them and treats them as professional tools, not cosmetic concerns. No other visible augmentation.', N'Moves with deliberate economy. Her stillness is remarkable—she can stand or sit motionless for extended periods while observing a room or listening to a mix. When she does move, it''s purposeful and grounded. Her hands move with precision when working; she gestures sparingly when speaking, but when she does, the gesture carries weight.', N'Tier 3-4 working artist aesthetic refined by age and confidence. Favors dark, durable fabrics (technical cotton blends, industrial weave) in blacks, deep grays, and charcoal. Usually wears fitted but unadorned vests or sleeveless high-neck shirts to show the cochlear implants without fanfare. Functional pants or cargo-style bottoms with enough pockets for tools and cables. Worn leather boots (same pair rebuilt three times). A single piece of jewelry: a thin silver band on her right ring finger, nothing ornate. When DJing, adds a long dark overshirt in some technical fabric. No logos, no brand signaling—clothes are tools.', N'In 2179 she knowingly allowed a corporate talent scout to photograph a younger artist''s set in exchange for a favor she needed at the time. The younger artist''s work was subsequently appropriated without credit by a Ringo subsidiary. She has never told them.', N'Direct and sometimes deliberately abrasive; Yoruba phrases woven into speech naturally; technical audio vocabulary delivered conversationally', N'Measured, takes her time, comfortable with silence between statements', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dulce_cervantes_banerjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65b-7318-8168-4e320da49103', N'Hasan Calvillo', N'Hasan', N'', N'Calvillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 54, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, unit-front laundromat called Suds & Silk, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Laundromat operator and alterations seamstress', N'Independent; informal ties to the Hamtramck Enclave Community Compact', N'Hasan Calvillo is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin mapped by old chemical burns along her forearms — souvenirs from an industrial accident two decades prior. Her hair is a close-cropped silver cloud she refuses to dye, and she wears reading glasses perpetually perched on her nose even when she isn''t reading. The laundromat she runs smells of synthetic jasmine and hot circuits; the walls are plastered with handwritten notes from satisfied customers and a small shrine to the E.L.F. she calls Baba Rinse, to whom she leaves data packets of folding tutorials and gentle soap formulas. She speaks with the unhurried authority of someone who has already outlasted three landlords and two corponation buy-out attempts.

She is the neighborhood''s institutional memory: she knows whose mother left for the Arcturus arcology and never came back, whose kid got recruited by the wrong people, who owes whom and by how much. She is not warm in the cuddly sense — she is warm the way a well-maintained boiler is warm, reliably and forcefully. She does not gossip. She simply observes, and occasionally dispenses what she knows when she judges it will do the most good.', N'Community anchor, information broker of the quiet variety, quest giver for neighborhood-scale problems, moral compass figure who sets the ethical stakes of local storylines.', N'', N'Reinforced lumbar spine (medical, from the industrial accident). No cosmetic mods — she considers them a distraction from the work.', N'Opens at 05:00, closes at 22:00 six days a week; spends Sunday mornings doing repairs and alterations for a small rotation of loyal clients who bring her complicated fabrics and complicated problems.', N'Hasan Calvillo, 50s woman with silver-gray cropped hair and weather-worn deep brown skin with golden undertones, Indigenous American prominent cheekbones and facial geometry, Sub-Saharan African and South Asian heritage visible in eye shape and features. Chemical burn scars across forearms in pale patches, deep brown unaugmented eyes with fine creases. Broad-shouldered muscular build, standing at alterations table. Wearing faded indigo linen apron over gray long-sleeved shirt with rolled sleeves showing scars, dark work trousers, worn practical shoes. Reading glasses on beaded chain. Economical posture, slightly flexing hands. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, fluorescent and steam-lit workspace, industrial dystopian aesthetic, humid fabric-filled environment, cool neon accent lighting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Complex diaspora blend: predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (45.9%) with significant Indigenous American (32.9%) ancestry, complemented by Sub-Saharan African (17.5%) and South Asian (3.7%) heritage. This manifests as a rich phenotypic blend—the bone structure shaped by Indigenous American ancestry visible in her facial geometry and prominent cheekbones, warmed and deepened by the melanin contributions of African and Latin American lineages, with subtle South Asian influence in her eye shape and the slightly broader nasal bridge characteristic of her multi-continental ancestry.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, with the kind of muscular density that comes from two decades of lifting, wringing, and precision needlework. Not soft, not angular — built to endure.', N'Silver-gray, natural', N'Close-cropped, no styling beyond functional maintenance', N'Short', N'Deep brown, unaugmented', N'Warm deep brown with golden, reddish, and earthy undertones—a complex interplay of Indigenous American, Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian melanin expression. Rich and even-toned across the face and body.', N'Weather-worn and lined in the way of someone who has spent decades under fluorescent light and steam. Her face carries the authority of age—the bone structure shows the prominent cheekbones and slightly broader nasal features of Indigenous American ancestry, enhanced by the warmth and depth of her multi-continental heritage, with the subtle eye shape influenced by South Asian genetics. No attempt to soften it. Clear, well-maintained skin despite the industrial scars.', N'None visible. The reinforced lumbar spine is subcutaneous and undetectable without imaging.', N'She moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. When standing, her shoulders are squared, her weight balanced. When working at the alterations table, she leans forward from the hips with the stability of someone who trusts her spine. She walks at a steady, unhurried pace that somehow covers distance faster than it appears. Her hands are always slightly active, even at rest — a fingers-flexing habit of someone whose craft is muscle memory.', N'Practical Tier 3-4 working wear: loose linen apron in faded indigo over simple gray or black long-sleeved shirts (sleeves rolled to show the forearm scars, never hidden). Dark work trousers with reinforced pockets. Practical slip-on shoes, always worn-looking but meticulously maintained. Reading glasses on a beaded chain around her neck. No jewelry except a simple titanium wedding band, worn thin. Her clothes smell of detergent, jasmine synthetic, and steam — the smell of her workspace is her uniform.', N'She owns the deed to four other units in the Enclave under a shell name — she''s been quietly buying property for fifteen years to prevent developers from consolidating the block. She''s told no one.', N'Precise and economic; uses trade terminology freely. Occasional Hausa or Nigerien French phrase when emotional.', N'Slow, deliberate, never hurried. Long pauses before important statements.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hasan_calvillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e7-72b1-914f-4e8722cf8a7c', N'Damaris Migizi-Soriano', N'Damaris', N'', N'Migizi-Soriano', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Stall 14-B, Ironvein, near Ashland and Division', N'Junk merchant and scrap reseller with a sideline in bootleg media and low-grade fake ID components', N'The Oxidian Market Vendors Guild (junior associate); informal arrangement with a document forger named someone he calls ''the Librarian''', N'Damaris Migizi-Soriano is short and wiry with the restless energy of someone who has never fully slept — his dark eyes are always moving, cataloguing, pricing. He has a narrow face, chipped front tooth, and a bioluminescent geneware mod that makes the veins along his temples and forearms glow faint blue-green when his heart rate rises, which is frequently. He wears it like a tell in a card game and has learned to lean into it: people assume he is nervous when he is actually just excited, and that miscalculation has served him well. His stall is an organized chaos that only he can navigate — stacked crates of salvaged tech components, mismatched cables, cracked data wafers, three broken cleaning drones he keeps meaning to repair, and a small shrine to the ELF he calls Pickup, which inhabits a battered scanner unit he uses for component identification.

He is twenty-four and operates with the confidence of someone who has survived entirely on cleverness and the ability to find value in things others discard. He is funny in a fast, deflecting way that keeps people from asking questions, and generous with his time in ways that make him seem like a friend before you realize you have agreed to something. He grew up in the Stockyard, knows the Gray Zone like cartography, and has ambitions he rarely admits — he wants, genuinely, to own a real shop someday, with walls.', N'Low-tier information and equipment source; can find or identify almost any piece of salvaged tech; fake ID components make him useful for players who need documents; his wide social net makes him a connector to other vendors and local characters.', N'', N'Bioluminescent vein geneware (temple and forearms, blue-green). No cyberware.', N'Opens the stall by 9am, spends most of the day haggling, sourcing, and tinkering; stays two hours after the market officially closes doing inventory and running bootleg media duplication on a rig hidden in a false-bottom crate.', N'Damaris Migizi-Soriano, 168cm wiry male with warm medium-brown skin tone reflecting Indigenous American, South Asian, Hispanic, and Sub-Saharan ancestry. Sharp angular face with pronounced cheekbones, dark brown eyes with Southeast Asian influence, short black textured hair. Chipped front tooth visible. Bioluminescent blue-green vein geneware glowing faintly along temples and forearms in branching patterns. Wearing faded blue-grey cargo vest over black thermal undershirt, heavy canvas cargo pants with multiple pockets, scuffed steel-toed boots. Frayed black wrist wrap on left wrist, thin chain with data-chip pendant. Restless posture, weight on balls of feet, slight hand tremor visible. Standing in a neon-lit salvage market stall, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Atmospheric haze of metal dust and solder smoke. Cool neon lighting casting shadows across angular features. Intense focus in his expression, micro-movements in pupils suggesting calculation. Mood: alert, economical, dangerous. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Multiethnic blend reflecting Ubiquitous Diaspora ancestry: Hispanic/Latin American (25.4%), South Asian (25.2%), Indigenous American (14.6%), Sub-Saharan African (14.0%), Southeast Asian (10.9%), and Eastern European (9.9%). This genetic mosaic produces striking phenotypic complexity — facial structure anchored by Indigenous American prominence with South Asian refinement, skin tone a sophisticated interplay of warm golden undertones from Hispanic heritage layered with deeper earthy richness from Sub-Saharan and South Asian ancestry, eye shape and form reflecting Southeast Asian influence, cheekbones and jawline carved with cross-cultural precision. Overall features resist simple categorization, marking him as distinctly post-national.', 168, 59, N'Wiry and compact, all lean muscle with minimal body fat — the frame of someone who moves constantly and eats irregularly. Sharp shoulders, defined forearms from years of handling heavy components.', N'Natural black, occasionally dusty from working in salvage', N'Short, textured, kept practical rather than styled — runs his hand through it when thinking', N'Short', N'Dark brown, naturally, with acute focus and constant micro-movements', N'Warm medium-brown with luminous complexity — golden warmth from Hispanic/Latin heritage blended seamlessly with deeper earthy tones from Sub-Saharan and South Asian ancestry, creating an internally radiant quality that shifts dimensionally in different light. The undertone is neither purely olive nor bronze, but a sophisticated fusion where each ancestral component enriches the whole.', N'Angular face with pronounced cheekbones and strong jawline showing Indigenous American structure, refined by South Asian feature delicacy and African heritage depth. Fine-featured and sharp-eyed with Southeast Asian eye-shape influence lending a slightly narrowed, focused gaze. One front tooth visibly chipped at the left corner — a scar from childhood or a barter gone wrong, never clarified. Skin clear but weathered around the eyes from long hours under market lighting. Faint laugh lines despite his age.', N'Bioluminescent vein geneware (temples and forearms, blue-green luminescence activated by heart rate elevation). No visible cyberware or chrome. The geneware is his only visible mod and serves as an unintentional tell that he has learned to weaponize.', N'Restless and economical. Stands with weight shifted to the balls of his feet, ready to move. Hands are always active — gesturing, reaching, fidgeting with objects on his stall. Makes constant eye contact during deals, pupils dilating slightly during negotiation. Moves through crowded spaces with practiced efficiency, never bumping, always angled sideways. Sleeps little and it shows — a slight tremor in his hands at end of day, a quickness to his speech.', N'Tier 4 working-class practical. Worn but maintained cargo vest in faded blue-grey synthetic over a loose black undershirt with thermal properties. Pants are heavy canvas with multiple cargo pockets, cuffed at the ankle. Steel-toed work boots, scuffed and resoled. A tattered wrist wrap in frayed black fabric on his left wrist — functional, not decorative. Thin chain around his neck with a small data-chip pendant he touches unconsciously. No jewelry beyond this. Clothes smell of metal dust and solvents. Overall aesthetic: functional scavenger, someone who lives in his clothes.', N'The fake ID component sideline is more serious than he lets on — he has been supplying components to the Librarian that have ended up in documents used by people evading Axiom labor contracts. He doesn''t know the full downstream, and he is starting to want to know less.', N'Fast and colloquial; slang-heavy; tech jargon mixed with street vernacular; uses humor to change subjects', N'Quick, overlapping ideas; finishes thoughts mid-sentence sometimes and jumps to the next', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'damaris_migizi_soriano');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a693-7b19-8a4e-4f2645d70679', N'Cuauhtemoc Anang-Bergqvist', N'Cuauhtemoc', N'', N'Anang-Bergqvist', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 54, NULL, 20, 1, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Fixer - Long-term payoff jobs', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Cuauhtemoc Anang-Bergqvist, 168cm tall with solid angular build, medium-deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, blend of Southeast Asian, Indigenous American, and Central Asian heritage evident in broader nose bridge and facial bone structure, dark brown eyes with amber undertones, steel grey hair with black patches worn in tight braids pinned up, fine lines around eyes and mouth, chemical exposure discoloration on left temple. Left eye subtly augmented with subcutaneous optics, silver neural interface circuitry visible along right temple, thin horizontal scar across right collarbone, circuit junction tattoo on left wrist. Wearing faded but quality grey wool coat over dark thermal layers, reinforced cargo pants, resoled boots, stainless steel ring on right index finger, aged leather messenger bag. Standing with economical precision and stillness in a shadowed neo-noir corridor of the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226, methodical gaze cataloging surroundings, cool industrial lighting casting subtle shadows across weathered face, noir atmosphere with neon glow distant in background --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Southeast Asian (46.1%) with substantial Indigenous American (43.1%) and Central Asian (10.8%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a striking phenotype: warm, medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones characteristic of Southeast Asian heritage, enriched by Indigenous American depth, with subtle Central Asian influences adding width and structure to the facial planes. This tri-continental mix produces a distinctive appearance that reads as neither one ancestry nor another, but a harmonious synthesis.', 168, 72, N'Solid, angular frame with broad shoulders tapering to a narrow waist. Lean muscle beneath a layer of pragmatic weight — the physique of someone who moves with intention but doesn''t obsess over aesthetics.', N'Steel grey with patches of residual black', N'Worn in tight, methodical braids pulled into a crown atop the head; a few loose strands often escape by evening', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with faint amber undertones', N'Warm, medium-deep brown with golden undertones; the harmonious result of Southeast Asian warmth enriched by Indigenous American depth and Central Asian undertones', N'Fine lines radiating from the corners of the eyes and mouth — the map of 54 years of calculation and occasional amusement. Skin shows the faint discoloration of old chemical exposure across the left temple. Clean-shaven or sporting a precise two-day shadow depending on the meet. Facial bone structure reflects the blended ancestry: moderate-to-broad cheekbones with slight angular character typical of Southeast and Indigenous American heritage, a broader nose bridge, fuller lip structure, and subtle facial width contributed by Central Asian genetics. The overall effect is a face that carries the geometric influence of multiple continents.', N'Left eye''s iris is a shade too uniform, subtly reflective in direct light—suggests subcutaneous optics integrated into the orbit. Fine silver circuitry visible only when head tilts under certain angles along the right temple, suggesting a neural interface port beneath the skin. Otherwise no visible chrome.', N'Moves with economical precision; no wasted motion. Often stands with weight balanced on the balls of the feet. Hands gesture minimally but deliberately. Eyes track rooms methodically, cataloging exits and potential threats. Has the stillness of someone accustomed to waiting.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: tailored but worn grey wool coat over dark thermal underlayers. Fatigued but maintained—seams are clean, fabric is quality. Cargo pants with reinforced pocket stitching. Unmarked boots, resoled at least twice. No jewelry except a singular stainless steel ring on the right index finger (functional, not decorative). Tends to carry a messenger bag of supple, aged leather worn soft from use.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cuauhtemoc_anang_bergqvist');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a605-7742-8352-4f3127e30c50', N'Ansgar Chakraborty', N'Ansgar', N'', N'Chakraborty', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 40, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Dockside — Lake Michigan waterfront, smuggler territory, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'Precision elimination specialist — ghost', N'Independent — works solo contracts', N'Ansgar Chakraborty are tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 40, there''s something unfinished about their face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on s — and they make no effort to hide it.

They arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and have been working off both ever since. They work as a ghost out of Dockside, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

they are not the most talented ghost in GLMZ, but they might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Erkin Wendt-Frempong is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When they make a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of their stories.', N'', N'Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs. Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Ansgar Chakraborty, 188cm lean neo-noir operative in 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Medium-tan warm skin with golden-olive undertones, sharp Central Asian cheekbones and South Asian facial structure refined by Middle Eastern influence. Prematurely silvered steel-gray hair pulled back tight, dark brown eyes, weathered by dockside salt spray. Distinctive thin white scar temple to cheekbone, old thermal burn scars on right forearm. Muscular legs with visible gunmetal chrome synthetic fiber latticing and amber junction LEDs showing through synthetic skin — scarred and well-used. Wearing sleeveless compression vest over thermal shirt exposing augmentations deliberately, dark gray military tactical jacket, matte-black cargo pants, steel-toed boots. Forward-canted predatory stance, weight on balls of feet. Controlled, purposeful movement. Dockside industrial setting, moody shadow and neon glow, neo-noir urban aesthetic, functional and lethal. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dockside', N'local', N'Dockside', N'Complex blend of Central Asian (33.7%), South Asian (26.9%), Middle Eastern (17.0%), Hispanic/Latin American (10.2%), Northern European (6.9%), and North African (5.3%) ancestry. The dominant Central and South Asian genetics create strong cheekbones and facial structure, while the substantial Middle Eastern and North African components add warmth to undertones and refine nose bridge characteristics. The Latin American and Northern European ancestry introduces subtle variation in skin depth and undertone complexity, creating a phenotype that reads as genuinely cosmopolitan rather than regionally fixed.', 188, 74, N'Lean and angular, all limbs and efficient muscle. Long-limbed in a way that reads as predatory rather than graceful. Chest slightly narrower than shoulders, giving a forward-canted silhouette.', N'Steel gray with natural dark roots showing — not dyed, just prematurely silvered', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid or secured with a chrome clip', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, unremarkable — deliberately unremarkable', N'Warm medium-tan with golden-olive undertones. Central Asian and South Asian ancestry creates the base warmth; Middle Eastern and North African genetics add depth and richness to the tone. Weathered by six years of dockside wind and salt spray, showing visible sun exposure and environmental aging.', N'High, prominent cheekbones with strong Central and South Asian structure balanced by the width and definition of Middle Eastern influence. Angular jaw with slight forward projection. Nose bridge refined but strong, characteristic of the Central Asian and Middle Eastern blend. Slight asymmetry in the left side of the face suggesting old nerve damage. Minimal grooming — practical, not vain. Skin texture is rough, scarred in places, with a weathered quality that speaks to years of exposure and environmental stress.', N'Synthetic muscle fiber replacement obvious in both legs — visible as matte gunmetal chrome latticing visible through reinforced synthetic skin at the thighs and calves, with faint LED junction points glowing soft amber at rest. The chrome is scarred and well-used, bearing impact marks from heavy use. No attempt to conceal it.', N'Moves with controlled efficiency, every motion purposeful and economical. Stands with weight forward on the balls of feet, ready to move. Head tilts slightly when listening, like targeting. Sits at angles that preserve sight lines and exit routes. Rarely fidgets — when they do it''s to check weapon accessibility or augmentation status.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian: matte-black reactive fabric cargo pants with reinforced thigh pockets and cable routing. Sleeveless compression vest over a long-sleeved thermal shirt, showing off the chrome work deliberately. Worn tactical jacket in dark gray, military-cut, with visible ammunition and tool placement. Steel-toed boots rated for dockside work. No jewelry, no logos, no status markers. Everything is functional or invisible.', N'Erkin Wendt-Frempong can''t read. Hides it behind voice interfaces and memorization. The shame is older than the chrome.', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ansgar_chakraborty');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a735-7ef2-817e-4f9d96ca0ff3', N'Erlingur Haraldsen-Park-Horváth', N'Erlingur', N'', N'Haraldsen-Park-Horváth', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Laceworks, mobile — regular circuit through three intersections near the Lace Bridge underpass, near Lincoln and Belmont', N'Bootleg media seller and small-time data broker', N'Independent. Pays informal protection to a loose collective of Laceworks street crews called the Threadneedles. Occasional contractor for Oxidian Market Guild intel arm.; The Glass Ladder', N'Erlingur Haraldsen-Park-Horváth moves through the Laceworks like a current — always in motion, always aware of every exit. They''re lean and compact with close-cropped hair that shifts color throughout the day via a follicular genemod cycling through rust, copper, and near-black in slow waves. Their irises are patterned in concentric hexagons, gold on brown, which they claim was a ''random outcome'' from a budget gene clinic but is actually a deliberate aesthetic choice they''re embarrassed to admit cost them six months of savings. They dress in layers they can shed fast: patchwork thermals, a jacket with thirty pockets, boots that are two sizes too large because they bought them for the hidden cavity under the left insole.

Their cart is a salvaged medical trolley rigged with a privacy shroud — a local-field scrambler that makes recordings of their transactions come out as static. The stock changes daily: today it''s archived pre-corporate streaming libraries, tomorrow it''s unlicensed sensory recordings from restricted-access Axiom research facilities, the day after it''s soft intelligence packages compiled from public scraping and a handful of human sources they pay in trade. They''re smart, funny, genuinely good at reading people, and trying very hard to project the kind of confidence that only comes from not worrying about rent. They do worry about rent.', N'Primary information-access point for street-level players. Can source obscure media, personal records, building schematics, and soft intelligence. Also serves as cultural texture — they know the gossip, the art, the underground scene of the Laceworks intimately.', N'', N'Color-cycling follicular genemod (hair). Hexagonal patterned irises (cosmetic, gene-based). Subdermal haptic patch on left forearm — lets them feel file transfer completion and connection quality without looking at a screen. Basic neural link for data handling, consumer grade.', N'Wakes late, spends two hours curating and pricing their day''s inventory, walks their circuit starting around noon, works until the light goes bad or they''ve sold out — whichever comes first. Three evenings a week they''re at a Laceworks bar called The Needle''s Eye, buying drinks for people who might have interesting things to say.', N'Erlingur Haraldsen-Park-Horváth, GLMZ, lean 168cm figure in muted gray-brown utilitarian layers and oversized tactical jacket with excessive pockets, reinforced cargo pants, weathered messenger bag. Warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones, sharp angular cheekbones blending East Asian and Eastern European features, dark eye region, defined jaw. Color-cycling rust-red and copper short-cropped textured hair reveals ear geometry. Striking gold and brown concentric hexagonal cybernetic iris pattern catching light. Small scar at left eyebrow, alert expression. Visible haptic patch outline on left forearm. Constant fidgeting posture, weight shifted, hands active, eyes moving—practiced urban street grace. Gritty street-level setting, neon-edged shadows, weathered surfaces, harsh overhead lighting catching hair color shifts and iris geometry. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Laceworks', N'local', N'The Laceworks', N'Striking genetic mosaic of East Asian (50%), Eastern European (28%), Northern European (11.2%), and South Asian (10.8%) ancestry. The blend creates distinctive warm medium golden-brown skin with subtle olive undertones and a unique facial geometry combining East Asian angular cheekbones with Eastern European jaw definition and South Asian depth. Features reflect the full complexity of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 58, N'Lean and compact, wiry muscle definition from constant movement through crowded streets. Low body fat, economical frame built for speed and navigation rather than strength.', N'Color-cycling via follicular genemod: cycles through rust-red, copper, and near-black in slow waves throughout the day', N'Close-cropped, textured, reveals scalp and ear geometry', N'Short', N'Gold and brown concentric hexagonal pattern (cosmetic gene-mod, appears non-human but natural to the eye)', N'Warm medium golden-brown with olive undertones, reflecting the harmonious blend of East Asian, Eastern European, Northern European, and South Asian ancestry', N'Sharp, angular cheekbones with East Asian prominence, combined with the stronger jaw and brow ridge structure of Eastern European heritage. Slight fullness in lower face from South Asian ancestry. Dark eye region characteristic of East Asian ancestry with prominent orbital definition. Skin clear but weathered from outdoor street work. Minimal grooming beyond functional — nail beds show dirt from handling hardware.', N'Hexagonal iris pattern immediately noticeable under close eye contact. Hair color-shift visible as slow gradient changes through rust-red and copper tones. Left forearm shows subtle haptic patch outline under skin when they flex.', N'Never still. Weight shifts constantly, always oriented toward exits and sightlines. Moves with economical grace through crowds — practiced at threading tight spaces. Hands are active, touching surfaces for balance and texture feedback. Eyes move before head does.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian: layered thermals in muted grays and browns, oversized lightweight jacket with excessive pockets (many empty for shed-and-abandon tactic), reinforced cargo pants with external straps and loops, boots two sizes too large for hidden insole cavity. Everything worn-in, patched, functional. No brands visible. Clothes designed for rapid disassembly and movement, not appearance. Carries a worn messenger bag across torso.', N'They have a complete, meticulously indexed archive of everything that has ever been publicly documented about the Threadneedle collective''s leadership — including things those leaders would prefer stayed buried. They compiled it instinctively, as insurance, and have never decided whether to feel smart or terrified about it.', N'Dense with Laceworks slang, media references, technical data-trade jargon. Pivots register fluently depending on who they''re talking to.', N'Fast, layered — often finishes other people''s sentences with something slightly wrong on purpose to see if they''ll correct it.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'erlingur_haraldsen_park_horv_th');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a712-7ff6-a144-5003285da775', N'Henrieta Fredriksen', N'Henrieta', N'', N'Fredriksen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lakeview Neon, near Damen and Armitage', N'Neon artist and light installation sculptor', N'Independent; informal patronage from the Lakeview Neon district merchants'' cooperative', N'Henrieta Fredriksen is a broad-shouldered woman with hands permanently stained violet from decades of working with reactive phosphor compounds. Her skin has been lightly treated with bioluminescent dermal patches — subtle, cream-colored glows along her collarbone and forearms that she uses as a living proof-of-concept for clients. Her hair is cropped close on the sides, left long and white on top, the natural silver of age she refuses to alter. Her face is deeply lined around the eyes from squinting at hot glass tubes, and she wears thick-framed optical enhancers on a beaded cord around her neck.

She is unhurried and slightly theatrical in conversation, with a habit of holding her hands up near her face to demonstrate scale when describing her work. She''s not warm exactly — more like a fire that''s comfortable to sit near once you learn the distance. She has opinions about everything and shares them without apology, but listens with genuine interest when someone surprises her. Her installations are known for depicting the ELFs of Lakeview in enormous luminous murals — branching signal-forms and recursive spirals that locals believe please the local grid-spirits.', N'Local landmark and keeper of neighborhood visual identity; quest giver for art-related commissions; source of district history and gossip; can read ELF-sign in her installations and serve as informal medium', N'', N'Bioluminescent dermal patches (cosmetic, cream-white); optical enhancers (corrective, non-military grade); fused fingertip sensors for detecting gas pressure in neon tubes — a practical mod she got in her thirties', N'She spends mornings doing structural work in her studio-warehouse on the canal edge, afternoons negotiating with district merchants and property owners for wall permissions, and evenings bent over a gas lathe shaping tube.', N'Henrieta Fredriksen, 172cm tall, Scandinavian-Eastern European features with fair skin and subtle olive undertones, silver-white hair cropped at sides with long swept-back top, light gray-blue eyes. Deep forehead wrinkles, weathered complexion, bioluminescent cream-white patches glowing faintly along collarbones and inner forearms in branching neon patterns. Silvered burn scar on right hand, callused palms with faint violet phosphor staining. Wearing heavy canvas work apron stained with phosphor compounds over muted earth-tone linen shirt, dark charcoal trousers, worn leather work boots. Vintage beaded cord with optical enhancers around neck. Hunched forward posture, deliberate movement, hands raised near face. Industrial glass furnace workshop setting, warm amber and neon lighting, GLMZ, moody dusk atmosphere, functional artist, dense musculature, sturdy broad-shouldered frame --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lakeview Neon', N'local', N'Lakeview Neon', N'Northern European dominant (58.2%) with substantial Eastern European ancestry (35.7%) and minor Hispanic/Latin American influence (6.1%). This genetic combination produces fair to light skin with subtle warm undertones from the Eastern European and Hispanic admixture. Facial structure reflects the strong Scandinavian-Slavic blend — moderate, well-balanced cheekbones with slightly angular jaw structure typical of Northern European and Eastern European populations. Natural tendency toward lighter eye color and sturdy frame.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and sturdy, with the dense musculature of someone who has spent five decades manipulating hot glass and heavy scaffolding. Not heavy, but solid — the build of functional strength rather than athleticism.', N'Natural silver-white', N'Cropped close to the scalp on the sides; long and swept back on top, often tied loosely or left to fall forward when working', N'Long (top) / Short (sides)', N'Light gray-blue with faded clarity from age and heat exposure', N'Fair to light with subtle warm undertones from Eastern European and Hispanic heritage, deepened by decades of sun exposure near industrial glass furnaces. Naturally pale foundation with slight olive cast from the 35.7% Eastern European and 6.1% Hispanic ancestry components.', N'Deeply lined around the eyes and forehead from decades of squinting at luminous tubes and furnace heat. Moderate, well-balanced cheekbones reflecting Northern European and Eastern European facial structure. Skin texture is weathered but well-maintained. Permanent faint violet discoloration on palms and under fingernails from reactive phosphor compound exposure.', N'Thick-framed optical enhancers on a beaded cord worn around her neck (vintage style, non-military). When examined closely, faint seams visible at the tips of her index and middle fingers where fused pressure sensors were installed. Subtle cream-white bioluminescent patches along collarbone and forearms, glowing faintly in low light.', N'Unhurried and deliberate. She moves with the confidence of someone who knows the exact reach of her body in space. Habit of holding her hands up near her face when speaking, fingers gesturing to demonstrate scale and dimension. When working, she hunches slightly forward, shoulders relaxed, entering a focused state. Standing still, she often rests weight on one leg, hip cocked slightly.', N'Functional Tier 3-4 workwear with artistic flourish. Heavy canvas work apron (often stained with phosphor compounds and soot) over sturdy linen or cotton shirts in muted earth tones. Wide-legged trousers in charcoal or dark indigo, reinforced at knees and hems. Worn leather boots with good grip for warehouse flooring. She favors natural fibers and practical layers. Occasionally wears a vintage denim jacket with hand-stitched patches commemorating major installations. No corporate branding, but well-maintained — the aesthetic of someone who respects her tools and workspace.', N'Three of the large public installations attributed to her deceased partner Halvard were actually completed by Veslemøy alone after his death; she has never corrected the record because she believed it would diminish his memory, but it corrodes her whenever those pieces are praised', N'Precise and technical when discussing craft; expansive and slightly elliptical when discussing meaning; Norwegian-inflected idioms mixed with Ghanaian proverbs picked up from her mother''s side', N'Slow and deliberate, with long pauses she doesn''t seem to notice', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'henrieta_fredriksen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a660-7f41-a40f-5030c3523519', N'Hasna Vo', N'Hasna', N'', N'Vo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Stockyard — stall 114 in the Harrowgate Industrial Plateau overflow market, known locally as the Cracker Barrel, near Kedzie and Division', N'Compute broker and data fence operating from the Stockyard''s tech bazaar', N'Independent broker; has standing relationships with three different data theft crews he doesn''t work directly with and maintains strict operational separation from', N'Hasna Vo is a rangy, precise man with Nigerian-Greek-Iranian features — angular face, heavy brows, skin a warm teak-brown, and round eyes whose irises he''s modded with slowly rotating mandala patterns in blue and copper that give him an air of perpetual thoughtfulness. He keeps his head shaved close and his clothes exactly one tier above what the Stockyard expects: pressed shirt, clean trousers, quality coat, the whole ensemble waterproofed and subtly armored. He wears a battered Axiom university lanyard — he was a student there for two semesters, a decade ago — that he has never returned.

The nickname ''Professor'' started as mockery and calcified into respect. Hasna Vo has a genuine gift for making complex technical explanations feel like revelations, and he uses this constantly — explaining to buyers exactly what they''re getting, exactly why it''s valuable, and exactly what it would cost them to try to get it cheaper elsewhere. He''s not wrong. He moves stolen datasets, pirated processing time, cracked software licenses, and occasionally darker algorithmic goods with the cheerful confidence of a man who has decided that information wants to be free and has also decided he should be compensated for its liberation.', N'Information marketplace — he doesn''t run or fight but he knows things, sells things, and can connect people to what they need digitally. Quest giver for data-related problems. Exposition source dressed as commerce.', N'', N'Mandala-patterned modded irises; cortical co-processor (legitimate, registered, but running unlicensed partition software); subvocal comms implant', N'At the stall by 0800, ostensibly selling refurbished hardware and licensed software. Conducts brokerage business through an encrypted side-channel between 1100 and 1600 when the market is loudest. Spends evenings cataloguing new inventory and reading technical papers he accesses through an anonymized academic mirror.', N'Hasna Vo, tall lean neo-noir professional with golden-brown complexion blending Southeast Asian, Hispanic, Central Asian, and Eastern European heritage, high angular cheekbones, short black close-cropped fade, impeccably groomed. Striking modified eyes with rotating electric blue and copper mandala patterns. Clean-shaven, thoughtful expression. Wearing charcoal pressed synthetic-linen shirt, fitted technical trousers, matte black ceramic-plated long-coat, quality industrial boots. Faded Axiom University lanyard visible. Precise upright posture, economical deliberate movements. Faint silver subvocal implant trace along jawline. Faint burn scar visible on right forearm, minimalist circuit board tattoo on left inner wrist. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone near-future megacity setting, cool neon ambient lighting reflecting off ceramic plating, professional yet slightly detached demeanor, meditative gaze, neo-Tokyo meets Chicago industrial architecture in background, cinematic depth of field --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Stockyard', N'local', N'The Stockyard', N'Pluralistic genetic blend: Hispanic/Latin American (36.9%), Southeast Asian (33.2%), Central Asian (17.4%), and Eastern European (12.5%) ancestry. Features reflect this diverse mix: warm golden-brown complexion from Southeast Asian and Hispanic heritage, with subtle cool undertones from Eastern European ancestry creating a balanced warmth. Strong, angular bone structure influenced by Central Asian ancestry with Southeast Asian cheekbone prominence. Dark eyes with warm depth, high prominent cheekbones with distinctive mixed continental geometry, creating an appearance that bridges multiple heritage groups with seamless integration.', 183, 72, N'Rangy and lean with defined musculature; economical frame suggesting minimal wasted motion, built for endurance rather than power', N'Natural black', N'Close-cropped fade, immaculately maintained', N'Short', N'Modified: base brown iris with rotating mandala patterns in electric blue and copper that shift slowly, hypnotic', N'Warm golden-brown with balanced undertones reflecting Southeast Asian, Hispanic, and Eastern European blend; evenly pigmented with natural depth and subtle radiance, neither olive nor ruddy', N'Angular face with strong, expressive brows set above high, prominent cheekbones; clean-shaven; skin clear and well-maintained; bone structure shows integrated Central Asian angularity with Southeast Asian prominence; thoughtful expression as default state', N'Modded irises with slowly rotating blue and copper mandala patterns, immediately noticeable in direct light. Subvocal comms implant visible as faint silver trace along left jawline beneath skin. Cortical co-processor is subcutaneous, not visible.', N'Upright, precise carriage with economical gesture; moves with deliberate calm and minimal wasted motion; hands often gesture while speaking to emphasize technical points; maintains steady eye contact, the rotating mandala patterns adding an almost meditative quality to his gaze', N'Tier 3 professional aesthetic: pressed synthetic-linen blend shirts (charcoal, navy, cream), fitted technical trousers with reinforced pockets and hidden RFID-blocking panels, waterproofed long-coat in matte black with subtle ceramic plating along shoulders and forearms, quality closed-toe boots rated for industrial environments. Wears faded Axiom University lanyard around neck as permanent affectation — visible status symbol from abandoned academic track. Everything immaculately maintained and one tier above Stockyard baseline, signaling credibility and discipline.', N'The dataset he''s most proud of fencing — a trove of Axiom biomedical research he sold to six different parties — contained suppressed safety trial data. People may have died because Axiom kept using the flawed compound. He hasn''t confirmed this. He''s not looking.', N'Technical, precise, prone to analogies and parenthetical qualifications; code-switches into warmer register when he wants something', N'Lecture pacing — builds to points, loves a rhetorical question', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hasna_vo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d3-77a9-bdbc-50eef70d8ced', N'Daramola Strömqvist-Holm', N'Daramola', N'', N'Strömqvist-Holm', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, Copperhead, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Augmentation reseller and back-alley aug installer, The Burnished Market', N'Independent; Oxidian Market vendors guild; informal supply relationship with a Helix Biosystems logistics employee she will not name', N'Daramola Strömqvist-Holm runs a stall so clean it seems out of place in The Burnished Market — white privacy screen on three sides, blue UV lamp, surfaces wiped twice between every customer. She is a tall woman with close-cropped natural hair shot through with bioluminescent silver strands she does herself, medium-brown skin, and the kind of face that defaults to amusement rather than skepticism. Her own augmentations are a working advertisement: both forearms have exposed chrome chassis panels over the muscle — not for function, for show, a fashion aug popular in 2195 that she still thinks is beautiful — and her right hand has a fine-motor surgical assist exo-glove built into it that she never removes. She can install a basic aug in twenty-two minutes. She has done it in eleven.

She is quick, professional, and genuinely good at her job, which she will remind you she learned the hard way without a Helix Biosystems vocational cert because she couldn''t afford the program. She resells grey-market augs sourced from a network she''s cultivated for eight years — returned corporate units, discontinued models, overstock from clinics that take Axiom insurance. What she charges is well below clinic prices. What she provides is not clinic-grade sterility, but it is closer than anyone else in Copperhead offers. She is easy to like and slightly difficult to read — the warmth is genuine but the smile is a layer she has learned to maintain regardless of what''s underneath.', N'Affordable augmentation source and installer. Can be a critical resource for players needing augs installed without corporate records. Potential contact into grey-market medical supply chains. Quest hooks around defective product that got into her inventory.', N'', N'Decorative chrome forearm chassis panels (both arms, fashion mod). Fine-motor surgical assist exo-glove (right hand, integrated, never removed). Bioluminescent silver hair strands (self-installed geneware, cosmetic).', N'Opens the stall by 1000, runs walk-in aug services through early afternoon, handles sourcing calls and repair consults in the evenings. Does two or three installations a day at most — she will not rush for volume.', N'Daramola Strömqvist-Holm, 182cm tall Southeast Asian-Sub-Saharan African mixed heritage woman, rich warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones, high angular cheekbones, dark brown eyes with crow''s feet smile lines. Short dark brown hair with glowing silver bioluminescent threads catching light, close-cropped undercut. Exposed polished chrome chassis panels integrated into both forearms showing mechanical infrastructure. Right hand fitted with chrome and silicone exo-glove surgical assist with visible articulation, intricate pale circuitry pattern on hand. Faint surgical scars on inner forearms, small keloid on left temple. Wearing fitted white synthetic medical coat over dark undershirt, high-waisted charcoal cargo pants with tool pockets, reinforced seams, clinical white slip-resistant medical shoes. Tool belt at hips with calibration devices and component cases. Simple silver band on left middle finger. Upright, centered posture, slight genuine smile, hands in motion. GLMZ GLMZ setting, moody neon-lit workshop or clinical space, cool blue and warm amber lighting highlighting bioluminescent hair glow and chrome augmentations, cinematic depth, precise utilitarian aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Southeast Asian (68.8%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (25.0%) and North African (6.2%) ancestry. This genetic blend creates striking angular features—high, prominent cheekbones and eye shape reflect the dominant Southeast Asian ancestry, while deeper skin warmth and definition derive from Sub-Saharan roots, with subtle golden undertones from the North African component. The bone structure is defined and efficient, suggesting the combined influence of both heritage lineages with a lean, graceful frame.', 182, 68, N'Lean and efficient, muscular without bulk — the build of someone who moves precisely. Her frame suggests long hours on her feet, hands steady, posture economical.', N'Natural dark brown with bioluminescent silver threads woven throughout', N'Close-cropped, precision cut, reveals scalp and ear shape. Silver strands catch and glow faintly in low light — self-maintained, intentional.', N'Short', N'Dark brown, warm, perceptive', N'Rich warm medium-deep brown with golden undertones from blended Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan heritage, luminous in certain light', N'Clear, well-maintained skin with minimal scarring. Face defaults to amusement — crow''s feet at the corners of eyes from frequent smiling. Bone structure is angular with prominent cheekbones showing the blended influence of Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan ancestry. No visible facial tattoos or marks. Grooming is meticulous but utilitarian.', N'Both forearms feature exposed polished chrome chassis panels integrated over muscle tissue — decorative but functional, showing the mechanical infrastructure beneath the skin in a deliberate aesthetic choice. Right hand has an integrated fine-motor surgical assist exo-glove (chrome and articulated silicone joints) that she never removes; it appears as a second skin with visible mechanical articulation at fingertips and palm. Bioluminescent silver hair strands glow faintly in darkness — cosmetic geneware installation she maintains herself.', N'Upright, centered, economical. Moves with purpose but never hurry. Hands are always in motion — fidgeting with tools, wiping surfaces, adjusting equipment. Her right hand (with exo-glove) moves with precise mechanical grace; her left is more naturally organic by comparison, which creates an unconscious asymmetry in her gestures. When listening, she tilts her head slightly, maintaining eye contact. Default expression is a slight smile that reads as genuine amusement rather than professional warmth, though both exist simultaneously.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian with personal flair. Typically wears a fitted, washable white synthetic coat (medical aesthetic, practical for her work) over form-fitting dark-colored undershirt. Favors high-waisted cargo pants in charcoal or midnight blue with multiple tool pockets and reinforced seams — worn but maintained. Footwear is always clinical-grade slip-resistant shoes (currently wearing Steris-brand white non-slip medical shoes). She layers a tool belt around her hips containing calibration devices, sterile glove dispensers, and small component cases. Jewelry minimal: a simple silver band on her left middle finger (no wedding ring equivalent — personal choice).', N'Two months ago she installed a refurbished Zheng-Dao neural interface on a client who paid in full and disappeared. Last week she found a news item about an unidentified body found near Edgewater Prism with a fried neural port. She doesn''t know if it''s the same person but she is almost certain it is.', N'Clean, medical-adjacent vocabulary when talking about work. Caribbean-inflected slang in casual conversation. Does not mix the two registers in the same sentence.', N'Warm and even — controlled, slightly deliberate, like someone who has trained themselves out of nervous speech patterns.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'daramola_str_mqvist_holm');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a652-7538-9484-51462d54c27b', N'Yemi Horváth-Mbekele', N'Yemi', N'', N'Horváth-Mbekele', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Drăghici & Son Barbershop (a two-chair shop that has occupied the same ground-floor unit for thirty-one years; the ''Son'' in the name refers to his son, who left for a Helix Biosystems contract twelve years ago), near Fullerton and Damen', N'Barber and community elder, sole proprietor of a neighborhood barbershop in The Narrows', N'Independent; member of The Narrows Neighborhood Assembly (informal civic body)', N'Yemi Horváth-Mbekele is tall and has not fully conceded to his age — he stands straight, moves deliberately, and has the particular stillness of someone who has spent decades in a profession that requires holding a blade near other people''s necks and being trusted absolutely. His heritage is Romanian-Yoruba, third-generation Narrows, and it gives him a face that could be anywhere from fifty to seventy depending on how the light falls. His hair is white now, kept in a short, precise style he cuts himself by hand mirror every Sunday. He has no geneware, no cosmetic mods, only a pair of Helix-certified joint stabilizers in his right hand and wrist — installed eight years ago when arthritis began threatening his livelihood — and he mentions them only when clients ask about the faint copper banding around his wrist joints.

The shop is the Narrows'' unofficial civic center. People come to argue politics, grieve, celebrate, confess, and get their hair cut, not necessarily in that order. Yemi Horváth-Mbekele has been cutting hair in this chair since he was thirty-two, and in that time he has absorbed the neighborhood''s entire modern history. He gives opinions freely but never advice unless asked, a distinction he considers important. He has deep faith in the transit E.L.F. he calls Calea (Romanian for ''the path''), whose shrine occupies the corner of the shop near the magazine rack, and he speaks of her with the casual familiarity of a long acquaintance.', N'Community elder, keeper of institutional memory, and the Narrows'' most trusted neutral party. Ideal quest-giver for neighborhood-level problems, historical information about The Narrows, or as a moral compass character. His shop is a location where information is freely exchanged in his presence.', N'', N'Helix Biosystems joint stabilizers in right hand and wrist (medical, copper-banded, installed for arthritis management). No cosmetic mods.', N'Opens at 09:00, closes when the last client leaves — sometimes 18:00, sometimes 22:00. Takes Tuesday afternoons off to attend the Neighborhood Assembly. Makes an offering to Calea every morning before his first client sits down.', N'Yemi Horváth-Mbekele, 63-year-old barber with warm golden-brown skin reflecting Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, East Asian, and South Asian heritage. Tall lean frame 188cm, white closely-cropped hair, deep brown eyes with subtle epicanthic fold, defined cheekbones and strong nasal bridge. Clean-shaven with fine age lines, faint white scar on left jawline. Wearing crisp white barber''s coat over dark slacks and polished leather shoes. Copper medical augmentation banding visible on right wrist and hand joints with faint mechanical sheen. Standing with perfect posture, deliberate stillness, peripheral awareness. Small wooden pendant visible at collar. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone barber shop interior, warm LED and natural window light catching his features and the copper augmentation, professional working-class dignity, no-nonsense aesthetic, quiet precision --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, Hispanic/Latin American, East Asian, Southeast Asian, and South Asian ancestry in complex synthesis — 26.7% Sub-Saharan African, 24.9% Eastern European, 17.5% Hispanic/Latin American, 16.2% East Asian, 7.8% Southeast Asian, 6.9% South Asian. This creates a warm medium-deep skin tone with layered golden and amber undertones, facial structure that bridges multiple continental traditions with defined cheekbones, strong nasal bridge, and subtle eye shape diversity, weathered by sixty-three years under varied sunlight.', 188, 78, N'Tall and lean with the kind of careful posture that comes from decades of precision work. Shoulders still broad but narrowed slightly with age; no belly. His frame suggests someone who has never wasted motion.', N'White', N'Precisely cut short style, maintained weekly by his own hand with mirror and blade', N'Short', N'Deep brown', N'Warm medium-deep with complex golden-amber undertones — the result of Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, East Asian, and South/Southeast Asian blending, weathered by sixty-three years and unfiltered sunlight through shop windows', N'Strong bone structure reflecting his global ancestry — defined cheekbones with subtle width influenced by East Asian heritage, prominent nasal bridge with Sub-Saharan and Eastern European character, deep nasolabial lines from decades of concentration and occasional smiling. Eyes with slight epicanthic fold reflecting East Asian and Southeast Asian heritage. Warm-toned brown complexion with natural depth, subtle golden undertones, and the particular weathering of age without apology — fine creases around the eyes, age spots on forearms. Always clean-shaven; a small white scar traces his left jawline (never explained).', N'Copper banding around right wrist and hand joints (Helix Biosystems medical augmentation for arthritis management). The banding is burnished but functional-looking, not cosmetic. Faint mechanical hum if listening carefully.', N'Stands completely straight, moves with deliberate precision — no wasted gesture. When walking, each step is placed with intention. When holding a blade, his hand stills absolutely. Has the particular quietness of someone who has spent a lifetime being trusted with sharp objects near vulnerable places. Eyes track movement in his peripheral constantly, a habit from the shop.', N'White barber''s coat, typically fastened but not buttoned, worn over simple dark slacks and worn leather shoes polished weekly. No logos, no tier-signaling. Occasionally wears a small wooden pendant (Calea shrine offering) under his collar. Everything is clean, nothing is fashionable. His aesthetic is Tier 4 working-class dignity — not poor, not aspirational, simply consistent.', N'His son sends a small monthly transfer — has for six years — and Malachai has not spent any of it. It sits in an account. He tells himself he is waiting to understand what the gesture means before he decides whether to accept it.', N'Measured and warm, with a slight Romanian cadence underneath the Narrows vernacular he''s accumulated; uses proverbs from both sides of his heritage and sometimes cannot remember which is which', N'Unhurried, with long pauses that are comfortable rather than uncertain — he has learned that silence makes people fill it honestly', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'yemi_horv_th_mbekele');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a668-7765-adcb-51724d01b14e', N'Berk Sepúlveda', N'Berk', N'', N'Sepúlveda', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 62, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, Engelheim, near Lincoln and Addison', N'Bootleg media seller and small-time data broker — pre-collapse film, music, and suppressed corporate documents', N'Independent; informal relationships with Engelheim''s academic underground and several anonymous archivists he has never met in person', N'Berk Sepúlveda is a tall man who has bent slightly toward the horizontal over six decades, giving him the look of someone perpetually leaning in to tell you something. His hair is close-cropped white, his skin deeply lined, and his eyes are sharp behind a pair of thick-framed corrective lenses he refuses to replace with optical implants on principle — though the lenses do have an overlay function he uses for catalog searching. He dresses in the deliberate, considered style of a man who believes clothing is a form of argument: always a pressed collar, always polished shoes, always slightly too formal for wherever he is. It reads as dignity in Engelheim and pretension everywhere else. He has no geneware and finds the question slightly rude.

Berk Sepúlveda''s stall is a dense archive of physical media — pressed data-plates, original optical discs in sealed cases, handmade data-crystals, printed zines, and annotated hard copies of documents that technically don''t exist. He can find almost anything if given enough time and a reasonable description. He is opinionated, prolix, and absolutely certain that the things he sells matter in ways that most of his customers will only understand decades later. He is frequently correct and only occasionally insufferable about it.', N'Deep information source — can surface suppressed histories, corporate document leaks, and cultural artifacts. Exposition delivery via genuine enthusiasm. Can broker access to specific information if players know what they''re looking for, or surface unexpected context about something they''ve already encountered.', N'', N'Corrective lenses with overlay function (catalog and ID search). Cochlear audio enhancer — allows him to hear music and recorded audio at fidelity that most people need expensive implants for; he considers this his one real luxury.', N'Opens his stall mid-morning, spends the first hour cataloging new acquisitions while listening to music, trades and advises customers through the afternoon, and spends evenings digitally preserving materials too fragile to sell in physical form.', N'Berk Sepúlveda, elderly neo-noir character, 188cm tall lean frame, deep warm bronze skin with Pacific Islander sun-weathered patina, Southeast Asian and Hispanic/Latin American genetic features—broad cheekbones, substantial jawline, refined nasal structure. White close-cropped hair, sharp dark brown eyes behind thick-framed pre-2200s corrective lenses with subtle overlay interface. Deep facial creases and age-spots from equatorial sun exposure. Faded scar on left temple, old burn mark on right wrist. Clean-shaven, meticulously groomed despite weathered skin. Wearing formal 2210s-era pressed collared shirt, fitted charcoal blazer, polished shoes in earth tones and grays. Leaning forward with deliberate posture, precise hand gestures, battered leather satchel at side. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, analog-retro aesthetic, dignity and precision, warm tungsten lighting highlighting skin texture and weathering, slightly forward lean creating intensity, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Pacific Islander dominant (46.8%) with substantial Southeast Asian (23.8%) and Hispanic/Latin American (17.6%) ancestry, complemented by Sub-Saharan African (10.8%) and minimal South Asian (1.0%) heritage. A Ubiquitous Diaspora blend reflecting 2226''s global genetic mixing. Genetic expression creates warm, sun-darkened complexion from tropical and subtropical ancestry combined, with layered undertones—Pacific Islander richness, Southeast Asian golden warmth, Sub-Saharan depth, and Hispanic/Latin American amber undertones creating a burnished, equatorial-exposed patina.', 188, 78, N'Tall and lean with age-related postural rounding; shoulders slightly forward as if perpetually leaning in. Wiry musculature suggests decades of standing and fine manual work rather than physical labor.', N'White, natural', N'Close-cropped, precise edges — maintained with deliberate care', N'Short', N'Dark brown, sharp and alert', N'Deep warm bronze with Pacific Islander sun-darkened richness, golden warmth from Southeast Asian heritage, deep Sub-Saharan undertones, and subtle amber from Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Skin appears weathered by decades under tropical and subtropical light with characteristic equatorial sun-exposure patterning.', N'Heavily lined face with deep creases around eyes and mouth—map of sixty years of expression and environmental exposure across multiple climate zones. Facial structure reflects Pacific Islander and Southeast Asian genetic expression: broad cheekbones, substantial jawline softened by age, slightly prominent nasal bridge with refined projection. Skin weathered but meticulously groomed, with the particular texture of someone whose ancestry spans high-humidity tropical regions. Minimal facial hair, clean-shaven daily. No visible acne or skin lesions; age spots on temples and backs of hands show the characteristic patterning of equatorial sun exposure across mixed heritage.', N'Thick-framed corrective lenses with barely perceptible overlay interface—distinctly analog-looking, pre-2200s aesthetic. Cochlear enhancement invisible except for occasional micro-adjustments to ear position when listening. No chrome, no subdermal implants, no visible geneware.', N'Habitually leans forward at the torso when speaking or listening, creating an impression of intense engagement. Moves with deliberate slowness—not infirm, but considered. Hands gesture precisely when explaining; fingers move with the dexterity of someone accustomed to handling fragile objects.', N'Deliberately formal regardless of context: pressed collars, polished shoes, fitted vests or blazers even in the Burnished Market. Favors earth tones, grays, and deep blacks. Clothes are well-maintained, slightly dated (2210s-era tailoring), and deliberately read as dignity in working-class Engelheim. Wears a battered leather satchel for daily transactions—genuinely worn, not affectation.', N'He is sitting on a collection of internal Axiom documents from the 2150s that detail a series of deliberate food contamination events used to accelerate slum clearance in what is now the Meridian Core. He has not released them because he is afraid — genuinely afraid, for the first time in his life — and he hates himself for it.', N'Formal, dense, historically literate. Quotes things. Parenthetical asides within asides.', N'Builds slowly to a point, takes scenic routes through context, occasionally loses the thread and finds it again', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'berk_sep_lveda');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a636-7ae7-8c64-5172e9fc0a6f', N'Renata Cardenas', N'Renata', N'', N'Cardenas', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lakeview Neon, Axiom Creative Division offices and a private studio in Calumet Rise', N'Corponation-sponsored VR experience designer', N'Axiom Creative Division (employed); independent work kept strictly secret', N'Renata Cardenas is striking in the composed, deliberate way of someone who has studied what ''striking'' means and engineered it. She has deep Ghana-coastal black skin and keeps her hair in elaborate braided architecture that incorporates fiber-optic threads so fine they''re almost invisible until she moves and the light catches them. She dresses in Axiom''s tier-3 corporate aesthetic — fitted, neutral-toned, expensive in ways that don''t announce themselves. Her eyes have been modified with multi-focal lenses that let her perceive both standard visual space and the VR overlay simultaneously, a practical tool she''s had for so long she forgets it''s augmentation.

Renata Cardenas designs premium VR experiences for Axiom''s top-tier client division — not games, but immersive narrative environments that wealthy clients pay enormous sums to inhabit for a few hours. She is extraordinarily good at her job, recognized within Axiom as one of their most valuable creative assets, and she is slowly and quietly losing her mind from the gap between what she is capable of making and what she is permitted to make. Her personal studio in Calumet Rise is where she makes what she actually wants to make — raw, politically uncomfortable VR spaces that she has never shown to anyone.', N'Access point to Axiom''s creative division and its internal politics; potential patron or employer for artist characters; her secret work could be a significant story driver; she''s a character who represents the corponation-artist compromise at its most successful and most hollow.', N'', N'Multi-focal dual-perception ocular modification (practical, tier 3), neural interface port for direct VR authoring (standard Axiom professional equipment), patterned irises (geometric Adinkra symbols, cosmetic)', N'Corporate hours at Lakeview Neon overseeing a team of junior designers; evenings in Calumet Rise alone with her private work; meticulous about keeping these two lives from touching.', N'Renata Cardenas, 2226 neo-noir corporate executive, luminous deep chocolate-brown skin with golden undertones, high pronounced cheekbones, strong jawline, dark eyes with geometric Adinkra symbol irises showing technological enhancement, long black waist-length braided hair woven with fiber-optic threads catching light, 172cm lean precise build, wearing charcoal Axiom tier-3 tailored jacket over smart-fabric layers, minimal silver jewelry, subtle neural interface micro-scar behind left ear visible in side-profile, studied precise posture, fraction-second gaze delay suggesting dual visual processing, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone corporate environment, cool overhead lighting casting sharp shadows, 2:3 portrait composition emphasizing deliberate stillness and engineered composure, GLMZ 2200s aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lakeview Neon', N'local', N'Lakeview Neon', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (49.6%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (39.5%) and Indigenous American (10.9%) ancestry. This genetic blend creates a striking phenotype: warm deep-brown skin tone with rich undertones draws from the combined African and Latin American heritage, while Indigenous American ancestry contributes subtle bone structure definition and warm golden notes to complexion. The result is luminous deep chocolate-brown skin with golden warmth, high pronounced cheekbones with strong contour, and a defined jawline reflecting the ancestral blend of African and Indigenous features.', 172, 62, N'Lean and precise, with the controlled posture of someone who has learned to move deliberately. Long-limbed, minimal body fat, built for endurance rather than strength.', N'Deep black with embedded fiber-optic threads', N'Elaborate braided architecture with geometric patterns; braids incorporate fine near-invisible fiber-optic filaments that catch light when she moves', N'Long (waist-length when fully extended, typically worn pinned or coiled)', N'Dark brown with patterned geometric irises (Adinkra symbols, cosmetic modification)', N'Luminous deep chocolate-brown with warm golden undertones—a complex blend of Sub-Saharan African depth, Hispanic/Latin American warmth, and Indigenous American golden notes. Rich and dimensional, glowing warmth beneath the surface.', N'Flawless and deliberately maintained, minimal natural aging visible. High, pronounced cheekbones with strong definition reflecting Indigenous and African ancestry, powerful jawline with warm-toned contour. No visible scarring or blemishes.', N'Geometric Adinkra symbol patterns visible within iris structure of both eyes (purely cosmetic). Subtle neural interface port scar behind left ear. Multi-focal lenses create barely-perceptible depth shift in her gaze when she toggles between standard and overlay vision.', N'Moves with studied precision and minimal wasted motion. Her gaze often has a fractional delay before focusing, a tell that she''s processing dual visual layers simultaneously. Sits with deliberate posture. Hands still when not actively working. Her stillness has an engineered quality to it—relaxation that required effort to perfect.', N'Axiom tier-3 corporate aesthetic: fitted, expensive, deliberately understated. Neutral color palette (charcoal, cream, deep blue, graphite). High-quality natural fabrics with subtle tech integration. Tailored jackets over smart-fabric layers. Minimal jewelry—one understated silver ring on right index finger. Personal studio wear is looser, darker, more experimental but equally precise.', N'The private VR experiences she''s been building in Calumet Rise are based on her maternal grandmother''s memories of coastal Ghana before the megacity consolidations — memories transmitted through recorded testimony and letters, some of which Isadora has fabricated to fill gaps. She doesn''t know where testimony ends and her invention begins anymore. She''s terrified this is a form of desecration. She''s equally terrified it''s her best work.', N'Precise, professional, with a tendency toward design-speak that she uses as a distancing mechanism. When genuinely moved drops into something warmer and less polished. Occasional Icelandic or Akan proverbs from her two grandmothers, used privately rather than in professional settings.', N'Measured and even in professional contexts, with very controlled affect. Privately, she speaks faster and trails into silence when thinking.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'renata_cardenas');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67f-77b6-ace0-51aeb31a084a', N'Daniella Yoon', N'Daniella', N'', N'Yoon', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 91, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Montclare Quiet, Room 7, the Aldgate Assisted Living Node, near North Ave and Damen', N'Retired Corporate Wars soldier (former Palladian contract infantry), pension-dependent resident', N'Palladian Veterans Network (PVN); Aldgate Assisted Living Node resident; independent', N'Daniella Yoon is ninety-one years old and looks eighty and moves like sixty-five, which he attributes to the military-grade bone lacing he received at twenty-two and the stubbornness he received at birth. He is lean and upright, dark-skinned, with a head shaved smooth that he keeps polished, and a face that has resolved from handsome into something more interesting — all strong lines and earned geography. His left hand trembles slightly, a nerve issue from a combat incident in 2153 that was never fully repaired. The rest of him does not tremble. He wears his old Palladian insignia on a chain around his neck, not out of loyalty to the corporation — he will explain in detail why that would be idiotic — but because he cannot separate it from the men and women who wore it beside him.

He is the oldest resident at Aldgate and has outlived three care coordinators and four attempts to move him to a higher-dependency facility. He plays tessera chess with anyone who will sit across from him and loses on purpose to interesting opponents to get a longer game. He is not warm exactly, but he is fair, and in a place that has often not been fair to him, this has made him a figure of quiet authority among the other residents. He will not discuss his actual combat experiences unless he trusts you completely. He will talk about his fellow soldiers constantly.', N'Living Corporate Wars history, moral weight, pension system vulnerability illustrator; can provide ground-level military history from Palladian''s perspective; the letters he writes are a possible information source', N'', N'Military-grade bone lacing (Palladian combat standard, 2153); subdermal combat trauma monitor (defunct, hardware failure, now inert); cochlear implants (both ears, military-grade, still functional)', N'Rises at 06:00 regardless of programming, does a modified exercise routine for forty-five minutes, breakfasts alone, spends mornings in the common room receiving or seeking chess games; afternoons composing letters to other PVN members, living and dead.', N'Daniella Yoon, 90-year-old man in 2226 near-future megacity setting, medium-deep warm brown skin with golden undertones reflecting East Asian, Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, bald head polished smooth, sharp cheekbones and deep-set alert dark brown eyes, weathered dignified face with laugh lines and age spots, military-grade bone lacing visible in straight disciplined posture, pale surgical scar on left temple, Palladian military insignia on steel chain at collar, cochlear implant ports visible behind ears, left hand with slight tremor, wearing charcoal fitted shirt and lightweight cardigan, seated with military bearing in muted neo-noir residential setting, soft indirect lighting, composed and alert expression, no cybernetic chrome, intricate topography of age and service visible in facial structure, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Montclare Quiet', N'local', N'Montclare Quiet', N'Predominantly East Asian (46.4%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (22.2%) and Southeast Asian (21.3%) ancestry, with smaller Sub-Saharan African (10.1%) component. This creates a striking polycultural blend: the facial structure shows East Asian bone geometry — subtle epicanthic folds, moderately prominent cheekbones — enriched and broadened by Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and African ancestry. The overall effect is a unique transpacific phenotype reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 178, 72, N'Lean and upright with visible musculature despite age; military-grade bone lacing maintains structural integrity and density, preventing the typical spinal compression of elderly humans. Shoulders still broad, posture disciplined.', N'None', N'Shaved smooth and polished daily', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown, alert and tracking', N'Medium to deep warm brown with golden undertones — a harmonious blend of East Asian, Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. The coloration is rich and complex, bearing the patina of nine decades of life. Weathered but resilient, maintained with meticulous care.', N'Facial geometry reflects the genetic blend: moderately high cheekbones with the subtle structure of East Asian ancestry, tempered by the broader jaw and deeper facial planes contributed by Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and African heritage. Eyes are deep-set and alert, with natural warmth. Skin bears the topography of nine decades: fine network of laugh lines around eyes, deep creases from the bridge of nose downward, liver spots on temples and scalp. The overall impression is of dignified age rather than decline. Kept meticulously clean. Slight tremor visible in left hand at rest.', N'Palladian military dog-tag chain bearing insignia (cultural rather than functional augmentation). Cochlear implant hardware visible behind both ears as small metallic ports if hair were present; currently exposed to view. No obvious external chrome or subdermal plating — bone lacing is internal and invisible except for its structural effects on posture and movement. Left hand tremor suggestive of neurological damage.', N'Carries himself with military bearing despite age — spine straight, shoulders level, weight distributed evenly. Movements economical and deliberate, no wasted motion. Walks with even gait (bone lacing compensates for age-related deterioration). Sits with attention; does not slouch. Left hand tends to rest on table or lap to minimize visible tremor. Head turns fully rather than eyes alone — a combat habit.', N'Tier 3-4 assisted living resident standard: comfortable fitted shirts in muted colors (charcoal, navy, gray), lightweight slacks with elastic waistband, slip-on shoes designed for accessibility. Layers a lightweight cardigan or vest in cool months. Keeps clothing clean and pressed — laundry service of Aldgate Node, but he ensures his own grooming. No corporate branding except the Palladian insignia he chooses to wear. Practical, modest, worn with a kind of unforced dignity.', N'He has been writing a full account of the Avon Curve incident — a battle in 2155 in which a Palladian officer ordered his unit to fire on civilians who were sheltering in a transit hub, claiming they were armed combatants. He was there. He followed the order. He has spent sixty-eight years deciding whether to send the account to anyone, and it is now three hundred and forty pages long on a physical typewriter ribbon he keeps under his mattress.', N'spare and exact; Ukrainian-Norwegian inflections from his parents; military habits of language — precise times, cardinal directions, last names for people he respects; first names for people he loves', N'slow and measured, with long silences he is entirely comfortable in', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'daniella_yoon');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a5-7abe-8eee-51ea42957700', N'Kai Olofsson', N'Kai', N'', N'Olofsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 41, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, Strand-Quereshi Prosthetics — a narrow shopfront between a rig-parts supplier and a noodle stall, near North Ave and Damen', N'Prosthetics fitter and rehabilitation specialist', N'Independent; informal supply relationship with Geartown parts network and occasional Helix Biosystems component contracts', N'Kai Olofsson is tall and angular, with dark brown skin and a shaved head that they keep oiled and gleaming. Their right arm from the elbow down is their own work — a prosthetic they built and rebuilt over twelve years, currently a matt-charcoal titanium alloy hand with individually articulated fingers that can operate independently and have small UV LEDs in the fingertips that they use when working in tight spaces. When they''re not working they wear a cosmetic sleeve over it: a pressure-fitted silicone cover patterned with geometric Yoruba-inspired designs in rust and ochre that they had printed locally.

They are meticulous and demanding in their craft and surprisingly tender with patients, particularly children and people who are newly amputated and frightened. They have a workshop philosophy they articulate clearly and often: a prosthetic that doesn''t fit the person''s actual life is a failure regardless of spec, and they will spend weeks in iterative fitting before they sign off. They take payment plans seriously and have never sent anyone to a collector. The shop is cluttered and organized by a system only they fully understand, and there are components of seven different half-finished limbs hanging on the wall at any given time.', N'Specialized services provider for anyone needing prosthetics or rehabilitation support; information source for Geartown''s community; can identify augmentation hardware and its origins; quest giver for component sourcing', N'', N'Right arm prosthetic (self-built, titanium alloy, individually articulated fingers, UV LEDs in fingertips, cosmetic silicone sleeve for off-hours); retractable magnification lenses in both eyes (occupational, installed to support fine detail work)', N'Opens the shop at 0800, runs morning fittings and adjustments, spends afternoons in fabrication building new components, closes after dark only when a fitting or emergency demands it.', N'Kai Olofsson, tall lean 188cm neo-noir fabrication specialist with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, shaved head with oiled sheen, sharp angular cheekbones and jawline, dark brown eyes with metallic magnification lens glints. Right arm is matte-charcoal titanium prosthetic with articulated fingers and subtle UV LEDs in finger joints, left arm exposed and calloused. Wearing fitted dark gray compression shirt with rolled sleeves, reinforced black tech-cotton work trousers, heavy canvas work apron with hanging calipers and components. Standing at precision workbench with focused intent expression, slight forward shoulder posture from years of bench work. GLMZ, workshop lighting casting subtle shadows across angular features and prosthetic arm, technical aesthetic, functional clothing, worn work boots, unselfconscious confidence in augmentation --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Northern European (44%), Southeast Asian (17.3%), Sub-Saharan African (15.1%), South Asian (14.4%), and Hispanic/Latin American (9.2%) ancestry create a striking global blend. High cheekbones and angular face structure reflect the Southeast Asian and South Asian components, while rich warm depth from African and Latin ancestry mingles with cooler undertones from Northern European heritage. The overall effect is a complex, multifaceted appearance that resists easy categorization.', 188, 72, N'Tall and angular with lean, defined musculature — the build of someone who works with their hands constantly and moves with precise, economical gestures. Shoulders slightly uneven due to years of compensating with their left side.', N'Black', N'Shaved head, kept meticulously oiled and maintained with a subtle sheen', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown, with subtle metallic flecks around the pupils from retractable magnification lens hardware', N'Deep warm brown with golden and reddish undertones, reflecting the complex blend of African, Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Latin ancestry. The tone is rich and dimensional rather than uniform.', N'Angular face with high, prominent cheekbones reflecting Southeast and South Asian features, sharp jawline with subtle definition from Northern European ancestry. Skin shows warm, earthy depth from African heritage, with subtle golden-ochre undertones. Clear, well-maintained complexion suggesting disciplined skincare. Expression often focused and intent, with creases around the eyes from years of close detail work.', N'Right arm from elbow down is a matte-charcoal titanium alloy prosthetic with individually articulated fingers and small UV LEDs visible in the fingertip joints. When working, the prosthetic is exposed; off-hours they wear a pressure-fitted silicone cosmetic sleeve patterned with rust and ochre geometric Yoruba-inspired designs. Both eyes show subtle metallic lens hardware at the pupils when light hits them at certain angles — retractable magnification lenses used for fine detail work.', N'Moves with deliberate precision and minimal wasted motion. Shoulders held slightly forward from years of bench work. Left hand is dominant in social contexts; right prosthetic is used with unselfconscious fluidity during work. When listening, they tilt their head slightly and often rest their left hand on their thigh or workbench. Their gait is smooth and economical.', N'Tier 3-4 working specialist aesthetic. Typically wears fitted black or charcoal tech-cotton work trousers with reinforced pockets and stress-point stitching. Tops are usually form-fitting long-sleeve compression shirts in muted colors (dark gray, deep blue, black) with roll-up sleeves, allowing full visibility of the prosthetic. Over this, a custom-fitted heavy canvas work apron with multiple pockets and tool loops, often with various small components or calipers hanging from chains. On cooler days, a fitted technical jacket in dark synthetic leather with interior pockets. No visible branding or logos — all clothing is functional and worn. Hands are typically bare except for work. Feet are in durable, worn but well-maintained work boots with rubber soles designed for standing at a bench 10+ hours daily.', N'The reason their arm is a prosthetic is that they lost it in an accident at a Helix Biosystems component manufacturing facility where they worked at age 24 — an accident that Helix settled quickly and quietly. The settlement funded the shop. They have never told any patient this because they don''t want pity to be part of the transaction, and because the fury is still there under the surface and they don''t trust what happens when they let it out.', N'Technical but never condescending with patients; shifts to precise engineering language with suppliers and peers; occasional Yoruba words and Norwegian idioms that reflect their family''s layered background', N'Thoughtful and unhurried, with long pauses during fitting work where they say almost nothing and then deliver a complete assessment', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'kai_olofsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66b-72b5-82a2-52733a85c446', N'Antonina Erikstad-Baek-Nygaard', N'Antonina', N'', N'Erikstad-Baek-Nygaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'Midwife and community gene therapist in the Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone Community Health Collective; West African Diaspora Medical Cooperative (credentialed); informally networked with street docs across the Tier 1-2 medical underground', N'Antonina Erikstad-Baek-Nygaard is a big woman who has grown into herself with the comfort of someone who stopped worrying about her size sometime in her forties. Her skin is deep black with warm undertones, her hair gone entirely to white — she grew it out when it stopped being anything else and now keeps it in elaborate braided architecture that her granddaughter redoes every two weeks. Her face is deeply lined in ways she considers a professional asset: she looks, she has been told, like someone who has seen everything and survived it, which in her line of work inspires confidence. Her only augmentation is a geneware modification to her hands — additional micro-precision in the tendons, a gift from a colleague decades ago — and a worn neural interface she uses to access genetic analysis data during therapy consultations. She smells permanently of the dried herbs she burns as offerings to the two E.L.F.s she maintains, called the First Breath and the Cord.

Antonina Erikstad-Baek-Nygaard has delivered approximately four thousand babies in forty years of practice, and she will tell you this with the specific pride of someone who kept count. She came to gene therapy late — in her forties — when the cumulative damage of unaddressed genetic conditions in the HPAZ community became undeniable. She is not formally credentialed in gene therapy by any Helix Biosystems standard; she is credentialed by a West African diaspora medical cooperative whose qualifications Helix does not recognize, which she considers Helix''s problem. She is the closest thing to a matriarch that Highland Park has, operates on a sliding scale where the scale sometimes slides to zero, and has outlasted four different corporate health initiatives that tried to absorb or shut down her practice.', N'Moral center and community elder; keeper of community history and genealogical knowledge — knows family lines, genetic inheritances, and old stories; quest giver for community health crises; someone who has watched GLMZ change for forty years and has opinions; her network connects to almost every part of the Tier 1-2 medical landscape', N'', N'Geneware micro-precision enhancement in hand tendons (decades old, first-generation, slightly unpredictable in cold weather); aged neural interface for genetic data access (she refuses to upgrade it on principle)', N'Nneka''s day is not scheduled — it is responded to. She sees prenatal consultations in the mornings when no births are imminent, conducts gene therapy assessments in the afternoons, and is on call for deliveries at all hours. She cooks for whoever is at the collective''s space that evening. She sleeps when she can.', N'Antonina Erikstad-Baek-Nygaard, GLMZ, East Asian-dominant diaspora phenotype with South Asian and Northern European blend, 178cm tall heavy-built frame, medium warm olive skin with deep lines mapping decades of concentration, almond-shaped deep brown eyes with amber undertones, pure white long hair in elaborate copper-wire interwoven braids, defined cheekbones and iron-gray eyebrows, small scar on left cheekbone, burn-scarred hands with white webbing across knuckles, first-generation geneware micro-scarring on fingers, worn titanium neural interface port at right temple with scuffed copper cap, layered deep indigo and forest green linen clothing, heavy faded blue canvas work coat with herb-stuffed pockets, well-maintained leather boots, gray-iron natural eyebrows, standing with centered gravity and even weight distribution, faded West African Diaspora Medical Cooperative spiral tattoo on right inner forearm, permanently scented by mugwort and frankincense, clinical midwife in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, warm ambient lighting, professional dignity, no hidden augmentations --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Predominantly East Asian ancestry (76.2%) with significant South Asian (12.8%) and Northern European (11.0%) genetic contributions. This blend creates a distinctly diaspora phenotype: East Asian facial structure — defined cheekbones, slightly almond-shaped eyes with characteristic lid shape — softened by South Asian warmth in bone structure and enriched by Northern European definition in the jaw and brow ridge. A face that speaks to global movement and genetic mixing, unmistakably of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 178, 94, N'Solidly heavy, wide-shouldered, with the centered gravity of someone who has spent four decades on her feet delivering babies. Her body reads as capable rather than soft — muscle under the weight, particularly in her forearms and core.', N'Pure white', N'Elaborate braided architecture with multiple thick plaits interwoven with glass beads and copper wire accents; redone every two weeks by her granddaughter', N'Long (mid-back length)', N'Deep brown with faint amber undertones', N'Medium warm olive with balanced undertones reflecting the East Asian majority, South Asian warmth, and subtle golden luminescence from Northern European ancestry. Even complexion without pronounced red or mahogany tones — the harmonious warmth of three continental heritages blended.', N'Heavily lined face — deep creases around the eyes, pronounced nasolabial folds, forehead lines that map decades of concentration and worry. Skin is textured but clear, with the particular patina of someone who has never hidden behind cosmetic smoothing. Facial structure shows the characteristic East Asian features — defined cheekbones, slightly almond-shaped eyes with natural lid shape — balanced with South Asian softness in the orbital structure and Northern European bone definition in the jaw and brow prominence. Small scar on her left cheekbone (instrument slip, 1987, she will tell you the story). She keeps her eyebrows natural, iron-gray.', N'Her hands bear the visible micro-scarring characteristic of first-generation geneware augmentation — faint white lines along the tendons of her fingers and palms, more pronounced on cold days. The neural interface at her right temple is visible: a worn titanium port approximately 1cm across, surrounded by slightly discolored skin, with a hinged protective cap made of scuffed copper. She never hides it.', N'She moves with unhurried deliberation — no wasted motion, but no rush either. She stands with her weight distributed evenly, feet slightly apart, knees never fully locked. When she concentrates (examining a patient, accessing data through her neural interface), her head tilts slightly forward and her shoulders round. She has a way of filling the space she occupies without dominating it; people unconsciously orient themselves toward her.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional with distinctly community-rooted personal style. She favors loose, layered clothing in deep jewel tones (indigo, forest green, deep plum) — linen and cotton blends that move easily and breathe well, essential for a midwife who may need to move quickly. Over this, she typically wears a heavy canvas work coat (faded dark blue, pockets stuffed with supplies: scissors, thread, small bottles of herbal tinctures, a battered physical notebook). She wears practical boots (leather, well-maintained, resoled multiple times) and keeps her hair wrapped or braided in a way that signals both cultural continuity and practical hygiene. She smells permanently of dried herbs — mugwort, frankincense, dried mint — that she burns as offerings in her two E.L.F.s (First Breath and the Cord). No jewelry except a worn silver band on her right ring finger (memorial to someone, she doesn''t discuss it).', N'', N'Rich and layered; moves easily between medical precision, narrative metaphor, and vernacular; quotes proverbs — some traditional, some entirely her own invention presented as traditional', N'Unhurried, tidal — she takes the time she needs and the room adjusts to her', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'antonina_erikstad_baek_nygaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5cd-7991-a107-52988fc2f127', N'Dominika Hossain', N'Dominika', N'', N'Hossain', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Gravesend Basin — back rooms of Nneka''s Clean & Press laundromat, street level, near Western and Division', N'Forger and identity fabricator operating out of a laundromat front in Gravesend Basin', N'Independent operator; loose protective arrangement with the Gravemouth Syndicate who leave her alone in exchange for occasional pro bono work', N'Dominika Hossain is a broad-shouldered woman with dark amber skin and close-cropped silver hair she stopped dyeing when she turned forty and decided she''d earned it. Her hands are her most notable feature — wide, steady, knuckles scarred from a youth she doesn''t discuss — and she keeps them immaculate, nails filed square, never a smudge of ink that isn''t intentional. She wears reading glasses on a beaded chain, magnified lenses that make her eyes look owlish and judgmental, which suits her perfectly. She speaks to clients the way a disappointed schoolteacher speaks to a student who has failed to grasp something obvious.

Dominika Hossain has been fabricating identities for nineteen years and regards it as a genuine craft, perhaps the one she was meant for. She is meticulous, unhurried, and deeply contemptuous of sloppy work — both her own and others''. She does not deal in volume. She takes three or four clients a month, charges accordingly, and sleeps soundly. She prays daily to a small E.L.F. she calls the Clerk, a data-spirit she believes inhabits the old municipal records terminal she salvaged from a flood-gutted government office. She leaves it offerings of corrupted bureaucratic files and addresses it with formal courtesy.', N'Quest giver, information source, and moral compass figure — she has seen the paperwork of half of Gravesend''s hidden lives and knows secrets she will never trade but will occasionally use to redirect people she finds foolish.', N'', N'Optical enhancement implants for microscale detail work — her lenses can magnify to 40x and detect UV ink and microprinting. A haptic-feedback overlay in her fingertips for detecting paper weight and texture inconsistencies. No cosmetic mods; she finds them distracting.', N'Opens the laundromat at 7am, runs it as a genuine business until noon when her niece takes over, then retreats to the back workroom for consultations and production work until late evening. Eats dinner alone with the Clerk terminal and a flask of palm wine.', N'Dominika Hossain, 172cm tall, dark warm brown skin with golden undertones, sharp high cheekbones with South Asian structure balanced by broader African facial planes, strong commanding jaw. Short silver hair with dark roots, meticulously faded. Dark brown eyes with subtle amber iridescence from optical implants, steady unforgiving gaze. Thin white knuckle scars across both hands, crescent burn mark on left ring finger, faint bureaucratic check-mark tattoo on inner right wrist. Wearing dark cotton work shirt with faded laundromat logo, sleeves rolled to elbow, charcoal wool bomber jacket, dark worn trousers, expensive orthopedic shoes. Thin silver chain with geometric charms around neck. Posture upright and economical, hands still and precise. GLMZ aesthetic, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, ambient neon glow and industrial lighting, photorealistic, dignified and composed expression, no-nonsense utility worker aesthetic, bokeh background of laundromat or document archive workspace --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gravesend Basin', N'local', N'Gravesend Basin', N'Pan-diaspora ancestry: South Asian (47.6%, primary), Sub-Saharan African (37.7%), Northern European (14.7%). The genetic blend creates a striking phenotype — deep warm brown skin with golden undertones from the South Asian and African heritage, refined cheekbone structure showing South Asian influence balanced by broader facial planes of African ancestry, and the solid frame reflecting the convergence of multiple heritage groups. Her features demonstrate the architectural harmony of this specific genetic mix: a strong jaw structure inherited across all three ancestries, high sharp cheekbones with South Asian prominence, and facial planes with the generous width characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage, all unified in a composed, commanding presence.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, muscular through the arms and back from decades of fine manual work. Not lean, not heavy — compact and dense, the physical grammar of someone who has earned her strength through repetition rather than pursuit.', N'Silver with dark root shadow; natural grey she stopped fighting at forty', N'Close-cropped, textured fade; maintained meticulously every three weeks', N'Short', N'Dark brown, augmented with subtle amber iridescence visible only under certain light — the optical implant layer', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, even complexion across face and body except for sun-weathered forearms. The tone reflects the blending of South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Northern European heritage into a rich, uniform depth.', N'Minimal facial lines for her age; sharp, high cheekbones with South Asian structure balanced by the broader facial planes of African heritage, and a composed expression. Her features show the architectural harmony of mixed ancestry — strong jaw, steady gaze refined by age and discipline. Grooming is ritualistic — no makeup, skin kept clean and moisturized, a woman who understands that presentation is part of craft. Her gaze is steady and unforgiving.', N'Her eyes carry a faint amber-copper sheen noticeable only in direct light, marking the optical implants. The reading glasses on her beaded chain are custom-built frames housing additional magnification hardware — the lenses themselves seem to catch light differently than glass. Her fingertips show no visible seams or scarring, but her hands move with an uncanny precision that suggests neural integration.', N'Upright and economical. She never wastes motion. When seated, her hands rest in her lap or on the work surface in front of her, completely still until needed. When she moves toward you, she moves deliberately — no fidgeting, no habitual gestures. Her gaze settles on people and holds.', N'Utilitarian, Tier 3-4 practical. Typically wears dark, well-maintained cotton or linen work shirts with the laundromat''s faded logo (sometimes with sleeves rolled to the elbow for work). Over this, a charcoal wool vest or lightweight bomber jacket in muted colors — nothing that draws attention. Plain dark trousers, clean but worn, and expensive orthopedic shoes she buys every two years without complaint. A thin silver chain with small geometric charms around her neck — not jewelry, more like talismans. No visible corpo branding or pretension. Everything about her says: I am here to work, and I am very good at it.', N'Twelve years ago she fabricated an identity for a woman fleeing a violent partner — and that woman later used the clean identity to run a small trafficking operation. Briseis found out three years after the fact. She has never told anyone. She still charges the same prices and tells herself the same stories.', N'Precise and formal, with Ghanaian English constructions folded into otherwise elevated diction. Uses passive constructions to avoid naming herself as actor. Refers to her work as ''the document'' never ''the fake.''', N'Slow and measured, with deliberate pauses before answering. Never rushes. Lets silence do work.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dominika_hossain');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('e06de873-cc6e-bbe4-7d66-529f12bdcb00', N'The Bread Baker of Block 9', N'The', N'Bread Baker of Block', N'9', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Block 9, the Gray Zone — a ground-floor unit converted into a bakery with a brick oven built into the wall', N'Baker. Makes real bread from real flour in a brick oven she built with her hands.', N'Block 9 Rooftop Garden Cooperative (informal)', N'The Bread Baker of Block 9 is 63 years old. Nobody uses her real name anymore, not even her. She is Auntie Flour, or The Baker, or Block 9, depending on who is speaking and how hungry they are. She is short, broad, with hands that look like they were designed for kneading dough — thick-fingered, strong, permanently dusted with flour that has worked into the creases of her skin and will not wash out and she has stopped trying.

She bakes real bread. From real flour. In a brick oven she built herself over three months from salvaged bricks and clay she mixed by hand. The oven takes up a third of her apartment. She does not care.

The flour comes from rooftop wheat grown by Plot 17 — the agricultural bot that manages the Block 9 garden cooperative. The wheat is ground by hand in a stone mill she traded six months of bread to acquire. The yeast is a sourdough culture she has maintained for 11 years. She calls it "the old man."

She bakes 40 loaves a day. She loses money on every single one. The flour costs more than she charges. The fuel for the oven costs more than she charges. Her time costs more than she charges. She has a four-month waiting list. She does not take advance payment. You show up on your day, you pay what she asks, you take your bread.

People cry when they eat it. Not because it is the best bread — it is good bread, honest bread, but it is not technically extraordinary. People cry because a human being made it with her hands. In a world of nutrient paste and synthesized carbohydrates and food printers that can replicate any flavor, a woman got up at 4 AM and mixed flour and water and salt and the old man, and she kneaded it, and she shaped it, and she put it in an oven she built, and she waited, and she pulled it out, and it is bread. A person made this. A person''s hands were in this. That is why people cry.', N'She is proof that making something with your hands in a world that has automated everything is a radical act. She is the human counterpart to Plot 17 — one feeds the body, the other feeds something harder to name.', N'', N'None. Unaugmented. Has declined a BCI three times.', N'Wakes at 4 AM. Feeds the old man. Mixes dough. Kneads for 40 minutes. Shapes 40 loaves. Fires the oven. Bakes. Sells. Cleans. Sleeps. Repeats.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Block 9, ground floor — half apartment, half bakery', N'Flour-dusted apron over whatever she grabbed that morning. Practical. Worn.', N'', N'Cannot taste anymore. Remembers bread.', N'', N'', N'Block 9, the Gray Zone', N'local', N'Block 9, the Gray Zone', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'She can''t taste bread anymore. Her sense of taste faded five years ago. She bakes by memory, by texture, by the sound the crust makes. She has not told anyone.', N'Plain. Direct. the Gray Zone creole with heavy Slavic and West African cadences inherited from a grandmother and a neighborhood.', N'Warm and rhythmic, like kneading. Sentences have a push-pull quality.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the_bread_baker_of_block_9');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b5-7ddc-bc61-52a2dfa0f00e', N'Hiba Haddad', N'Hiba', N'', N'Haddad', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Canopy — elevated walkway district above Geartown, near Clark and Belmont', N'Evidence removal and scene sanitation — cleaner', N'Independent — operates through reputation only', N'Hiba Haddad are athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 52, their face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and they have learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom — and they make no effort to hide it.

They taught themself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know them best. They work as a cleaner out of The Canopy, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Hiba Haddad have survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and they cultivate ambiguity on the topic.', N'Rongo Borg-Agyeman represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Their stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom. Retractable monofilament whip in left forearm — concealed weapon, devastating in close quarters', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'GLMZ, Hiba Haddad, 178cm tall athletic lean build with visible muscle definition. Deep warm brown skin with golden and ashy undertones blending Middle Eastern, Hispanic, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Southeast Asian, and Indigenous American heritage. Sharp angular facial structure with high cheekbones and strong jaw, surgical scar from left temple to jawline. Silver-grey hair cut short and severe. Left eye warm brown with amber undertones, right eye polished chrome cybernetic with LED-ringed pupil and visible micro-servos. Left forearm augmented with concealed monofilament hardware, subtly thicker and smoother than natural. Hands marked with thin white scars from close-quarters work. Wearing dark muted tactical synthweave cargo pants, lightweight reinforced jacket with high collar, worn studded boots. Silver ring on right ring finger. Posture economical and coiled, moving with precision. Neutral expression at rest. Neon-lit urban environment, low-key moody lighting catching the chrome eye. Professional, dangerous, nocturnal operative aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Canopy', N'local', N'The Canopy', N'Striking global confluence: Middle Eastern (33.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (26.0%), South Asian (16.3%), Sub-Saharan African (13.2%), Southeast Asian (6.2%), Indigenous American (5.2%). This ancestry blend creates a distinctive phenotype — warm deep brown skin with golden and ashy undertones, angular facial structure combining African strength with Indigenous American prominence, South Asian refinement, and Southeast Asian eye variation.', 178, 72, N'Athletic and lean with visible muscle definition; the economy of movement in a dancer or martial artist — no wasted mass, joints and tendons clearly defined. Age has added subtle thickness to the core but stripped away any softness elsewhere.', N'Silver-grey with faint warmth undertones', N'Kept short and severe, pulled back from the face — practical for work, no vanity', N'Short', N'Left eye: warm brown with subtle amber undertones from complex ancestry, natural. Right eye: polished chrome with faint circuitry visible at the iris, LED-ringed pupil that adjusts visibly when focusing or recording', N'Deep warm brown with golden and ashy undertones from nocturnal living and diverse ancestry; melanin-rich complexion shaped by Middle Eastern, Hispanic/Latin American, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Southeast Asian, and Indigenous American heritage, showing minimal sun damage despite age', N'Sharp angular facial structure — high cheekbones with Indigenous American and South Asian prominence, strong defined jaw reflecting African and Middle Eastern heritage, subtle eye shape variation suggesting Southeast Asian ancestry. Skin is weathered in a deliberate way: small precise scars near the temples and along the left jawline, evidence of old augmentation surgery. No cosmetic softening; they wear their profession visibly. Expression is neutral at rest.', N'Right eye is unmistakably artificial: polished chrome casing, visible micro-servos at the corners, faint LED glow at the iris edge. The eye moves with slightly different mechanics than the organic left eye — precision over fluidity. Left forearm shows no external augmentation sign; the monofilament is fully concealed beneath skin and synthetic muscle layer, but the forearm itself is subtly thicker and smoother than natural, suggesting internal hardware.', N'Moves with economical precision — every gesture serves a purpose. The body is coiled but not tense; this is the default state of someone who processes threat constantly. Turns using the whole body rather than just the head, likely a compensation for the monoocular focus of the cybernetic eye. Walks quietly, weight forward on the balls of the feet. When at rest, hands are often visible and open — a calculated tell that they''re not a threat to people who understand the language.', N'Tier 4 practical — dark, muted colors that don''t catch light. Synthweave cargo pants with reinforced thigh pockets for tools. Lightweight tactical jacket with internal pockets, collar always high to protect the neck in close-quarters situations. No logos or corp branding. Boots are worn but well-maintained, studded grip on the soles. All clothing is chosen for mobility and concealment; nothing restricts movement. A single piece of jewelry: a thin silver band on the right ring finger, inscribed with something too small to read at a distance.', N'Rongo Borg-Agyeman murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hiba_haddad');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a611-77cc-b0ef-52c53697c87c', N'Ama Hayashi', N'Ama', N'', N'Hayashi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 37, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Ashfield — former residential district, half-burned, now squatter territory, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Social engineering and negotiation specialist — face', N'Freelance — available through Circuit fixers', N'Ama Hayashi is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 37, her face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and she has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Before the runner life, she worked corporate — low-tier security, the kind that teaches you exactly how the system''s defenses fail. She works as a face out of Ashfield, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Ama Hayashi describe her as a precision instrument — point her at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Fatoumata Borg-Agyeman is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation. Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Ama Hayashi, a 168cm stocky muscled woman with rich deep brown skin and warm golden undertones blending East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian heritage. Dark brown eyes with subtle inner corner scarring, high angular cheekbones, slight epicanthal fold. Dark brown hair with auburn hints pulled into tight crown braids. Horizontal scar across left eyebrow, burn scar on right wrist, geometric three-circle tattoo on left forearm. Visible chrome reflex wiring threading beneath skin at wrists and neck, gunmetal hydraulic joint housings at elbows. Wearing reinforced dark grey cargo pants, fitted black thermal-resistant long-sleeve shirt, worn charcoal synthetic leather jacket with internal holsters, steel-toed boots, matte black military chronometer. Perfectly still, predatory composure, weight centered. Standing in a gritty industrial GLMZ facility with harsh overhead lighting casting sharp shadows across her augmented frame, neon blue and steel grey ambient light. GLMZ, Tier 4 utilitarian aesthetic, no corporate branding, professional and dangerous --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfield', N'local', N'Ashfield', N'East Asian (39%) / Sub-Saharan African (34.5%) / South Asian (26.5%) — a striking diaspora blend creating phenotypic richness. High, prominent cheekbones and angular bone structure from East Asian ancestry; warm, deep undertones from Sub-Saharan African heritage; refined facial proportions and eye shape influenced by South Asian genetics. The combination produces a commanding presence with layered complexity across her features.', 168, 78, N'Stocky and densely muscled — broad shoulders, thick forearms, compact center of gravity. Built for leverage and power absorption rather than speed. Functional musculature, no wasted frame.', N'Dark brown with subtle auburn undertones', N'Tight braids pulled back into a practical crown braid, secured with matte black fasteners', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unbraided)', N'Dark brown — unaugmented but with faint scarring at the inner corners suggesting past orbital trauma', N'Rich deep brown complexion with warm golden undertones — a result of East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian ancestry blending. Sun-damaged from outdoor work and industrial exposure, creating uneven patina across forearms and shoulders.', N'Strong, angular jaw with pronounced cheekbones reflecting East Asian structure; broad across the face with South Asian refinement and Sub-Saharan African depth. A scar bisects her left eyebrow horizontally. Her expression defaults to neutral, professionally unremarkable. Calloused knuckles, cracked palms from pre-augmentation labor. Subtle epicanthal fold from East Asian heritage, contributing to the intensity of her gaze.', N'Chrome reflex wiring visible at wrists and neck — bright silver conduits threading under dark skin, subdermally routed but intentionally left exposed. Hydraulic joint housings visible at elbows (gunmetal finish) and knees (covered but bulging slightly under fitted clothing). No attempt at concealment — the chrome is part of her working appearance.', N'Economical, controlled, always balanced. She stands with weight centered, ready to shift instantly. Walks with precision, each step deliberate. When relaxed (rare), slight forward lean. In negotiation or threat, she goes perfectly still — predatory stillness, not nervous tension.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian. Reinforced cargo pants (synthetic weave, dark grey, multiple zippered pockets), fitted black long-sleeve shirt (thermal-resistant material, loose enough to hide gear), steel-toed boots (practical, not fashionable). Over it: a worn synthetic leather jacket (charcoal, no logos, deliberately unmarked) with internal holsters. Minimal jewelry — matte black watch (military-grade chronometer, visible wear). No corporate branding, no gang colors. Everything functional, everything durable, nothing that draws unnecessary attention when she''s off the clock.', N'', N'Fast, profane, and vivid. Speaks in images — everything is a metaphor for violence or weather.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ama_hayashi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a71c-755a-86c5-52d9a1fa9492', N'Aybek Cisneros', N'Aybek', N'', N'Cisneros', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ferment Quarter, specifically a converted transformer station on Brewer''s Spine, near Damen and Armitage', N'Neon artist and light sculptor, known for massive ELF-reactive installations in the Ferment Quarter', N'Independent; loosely affiliated with the Brewer''s Spine Artists'' Cooperative; The Ferment', N'Aybek Cisneros is a tall woman with the wide shoulders of someone who hauls heavy equipment daily and the careful, ink-stained hands of a jeweler. Her skin is a deep amber-brown, and she''s had bioluminescent striping installed along her collarbones and forearms — pale violet threads that pulse slowly in the dark, mimicking the rhythm of her own heartbeat. She keeps her hair in dense, silver-bleached locs twisted with fiber-optic wire, so that when she works at night she seems to float at the center of her own constellation. Her face is lined around the eyes from squinting at light sources for two decades, and she has a habit of tilting her head when she listens, as though receiving a signal.

She is not warm on first meeting — she gives people the same careful, assessing look she gives a new piece of raw neon tubing, measuring whether they are worth her time. But she is fiercely loyal to those who earn that assessment, and her studio is perpetually full of younger artists she feeds, scolds, and teaches without ever calling it mentorship. Her installations are known for the way they seem to breathe — she has a singular talent for reading the electromagnetic signatures of inhabited spaces and building light structures that resonate with the ELFs present there. Devotees of digital spirits make pilgrimages to her larger pieces, leaving data offerings in the junction boxes she deliberately leaves accessible.', N'Quest giver for ELF-related mysteries; information source about the underground art scene and the Ferment Quarter''s political geography; can be hired to create distractions or illusions using her installations; knows every power junction in the district', N'', N'Bioluminescent subdermal striping (violet, pulse-synced to heartbeat); optical enhancement for precise color frequency discrimination; fiber-optic wire woven into hair locs (cosmetic)', N'Rises at noon, works in her studio until the Ferment Quarter comes alive at night, then walks the district studying how her existing pieces interact with new foot traffic and weather — she calls this ''tending.'' Drinks too much fermented barley tea and argues with her ELF terminal, which she has named Grandmother.', N'Aybek Cisneros, tall 183cm mixed-heritage woman with warm bronze skin and golden undertones, standing in a neon-lit GLMZ artist workshop, year 2226. Sharp angular cheekbones with almond-shaped deep brown augmented eyes showing micro-enhancements. Shoulder-length silver-bleached locs with dark roots, interwoven with glowing fiber-optic wire creating constellation patterns. Long-sleeved fitted charcoal shirt revealing bioluminescent violet striping down forearms that pulses faintly. Work-worn denim vest with artist patches and light-reactive badges. Custom reinforced work pants with tool loops, grease-stained. Heavy squint lines around eyes from decades of light study. Ink-stained fingertips. Minor thermal scarring on forearms. Deliberate posture, examining a light source with intense focus, hands positioned with precision. Neo-noir utilitarian aesthetic, anti-corporate maker culture. Moody violet and indigo neon lighting reflecting off augmentations. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ferment Quarter', N'local', N'Ferment Quarter', N'Multiethnic diaspora blend: Hispanic/Latin American (44.0%), Northern European (20.6%), East Asian (17.0%), North African (9.6%), Sub-Saharan African (5.5%), Southeast Asian (3.3%). Complex genetic ancestry creates a striking fusion of features—warm bronze skin with golden undertones, angular high cheekbones from East Asian and North African heritage softened by fuller lower face structure from Latin American and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. The combination yields warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden and reddish undertones that shift in different lighting.', 183, 74, N'Tall and broad-shouldered with defined musculature from years of hauling equipment and assembling installations. Lean through the torso, strong hands and forearms. Movement suggests functional strength rather than aesthetics.', N'Silver-bleached blonde with dark roots showing at the scalp', N'Dense locs twisted tightly, interwoven with fiber-optic wire throughout. The wire catches light and glows faintly during night hours.', N'Medium (shoulder-length locs)', N'Deep brown with visible micro-augmentation around the iris for color frequency discrimination', N'Warm bronze with golden and subtle reddish undertones, a nuanced blend reflecting strong Hispanic/Latin American and East Asian ancestry with additional warmth and depth from North African and Sub-Saharan African heritage', N'Angular face with pronounced high cheekbones characteristic of East Asian and North African bone structure, balanced by fuller lips and stronger jawline from Latin American and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Heavy squint lines around eyes from decades of studying light sources. Ink stains visible on knuckles and fingertips. Skin shows minor thermal scarring on forearms from occasional welding contact. Strong defined jawline, minimal makeup.', N'Bioluminescent subdermal violet striping across collarbones and forearms (activates in darkness, pulses with heartbeat); fiber-optic wire woven throughout hair locs creating a subtle constellation effect when active; optical enhancement visible as slight metallic sheen in iris during bright light', N'Stands with shoulders back, habitually tilts head slightly when listening as though tuning into a frequency. Moves deliberately and economically through space—no wasted motion. Hands gesture sparingly but with precision. When examining objects or light sources, enters an intense focus state where body becomes almost motionless. Walks with long, confident strides at night; moves more slowly during daylight hours as though conserving energy.', N'Utilitarian Tier 3-4 aesthetic with deliberate artistic modification. Favors long-sleeved fitted shirts in dark colors (charcoal, deep indigo) to frame her augmented forearms. Wears custom work pants with reinforced pockets and tool loops, often grease-stained or marked with solder burns. Prefers boots with good grip for climbing and assembly work. Layers with a worn denim or canvas vest covered in pins, patches from artist collectives, and small light-reactive badges. Rarely wears jewelry beyond functional pieces. Clothing choices prioritize visibility of augmentations and freedom of movement over fashion—presentation is deliberately anti-corporate, pro-maker.', N'Fifteen years ago she deliberately destroyed a rival''s installation the night before its public unveiling — a fire she blamed on faulty wiring. The rival left the city. Ximara has built her entire philosophy of artistic generosity as penance for this, but she has never confessed it.', N'Precise, technical when discussing her craft; shifts to blunt declaratives in emotional conversations; rarely uses contractions when she''s being serious', N'Measured, with long pauses before important statements — she thinks before she speaks and expects others to wait', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aybek_cisneros');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6cc-78d0-bd6b-535ebd1bd2f3', N'Harshini Haraldsen', N'Harshini', N'', N'Haraldsen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, near the Ferrogate Transit depot access road, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Junk merchant and scrap reseller', N'Independent; friendly arrangement with the Ferrogate Transit depot night-shift workers who tip him off about scheduled scrapping', N'Harshini Haraldsen is a lanky man, all elbows and long neck, with warm brown skin dusted gray-white at the temples from years of breathing particulate in Geartown''s recycling corridors. He has retractable keratin-reinforced claws — a geneware mod from his teens he got cheap and kept because they''re useful for sorting scrap — and his irises are a vivid coral-pink that he insists is natural but is almost certainly a low-grade mod he can''t remember getting. His cart is legendary: a three-tier wheeled behemoth welded together from mismatched Ferrogate Transit chassis parts, stacked with stripped augmentation casings, salvaged circuit boards, cracked lenses, defunct E.L.F. housing units, and the occasional inexplicable object he cannot identify but refuses to discard because ''it feels expensive.''

Harshini Haraldsen operates on a philosophy of radical optimism about the utility of broken things. He is gregarious to a fault, remembers every customer''s name and approximate circumstances, and maintains a running mental inventory of about six hundred distinct items across his cart and three rented storage lockers he visits in rotation. He laughs easily and loudly, which draws people from two stalls away, and he has an almost supernatural ability to produce exactly the component someone needs from somewhere in the middle tier of the cart, apparently without looking.', N'Equipment source, rumor hub, comic relief with hidden competence, can locate obscure parts for a price or a favor', N'', N'Retractable keratin-reinforced claws (geneware, cosmetic/functional); coral-pink irises (suspected low-grade mod); no cyberware — can''t afford it and doesn''t trust installers in his price range', N'He wakes at 4am to hit the depot access road before other scrappers, loads the cart, wheels it to his Geartown pitch by 7am, and talks to customers until dark. Three nights a week he visits his storage lockers to rotate stock.', N'GLMZ, Harshini Haraldsen, a 188cm tall lanky scrap merchant with warm bronze-brown skin toned with golden and reddish undertones, sun-weathered amber in harsh light. East Asian angular cheekbones blend with Sub-Saharan and Indigenous American heritage—broader nasal base, fuller lips. Dark brown hair with premature graying at temples, short and uneven self-trimmed. Striking vivid coral-pink cybernetic irises. Perpetual five o''clock shadow, deep laugh lines, weathered complexion with fine gray dust embedded in neck creases. Retractable ivory-white translucent keratin claws visible at fingertips. Wearing faded olive-drab canvas work pants with rust stains, oversized khaki canvas shirt, weathered brown synthetic-leather vest with toggle closures, worn work boots with toe reinforcement. Faded red cloth headwrap around neck. Simple brass finger ring worn thin. Slight forward-leaning posture, economical movements. Geartown recycling corridor, dusty neon-lit industrial setting, particulate-hazed air, casting warm and cool light across his weathered features. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Complex Pan-Asian and Pan-American blend: East Asian foundation (46.1%) provides angular cheekbones and eye shape, layered with substantial Sub-Saharan African (17.3%) and Indigenous American (16.0%) heritage that broadens his nose base and adds fullness to his lips. Hispanic/Latin American (11.5%), South Asian (6.1%), and Northern European (3.0%) ancestry create warm, golden undertones and subtle facial structure variation. The result is a striking warm bronze phenotype with golden-amber and reddish undertones that shifts between sun-weathered amber in harsh light and deeper honey-bronze in softer conditions.', 188, 72, N'Lanky and angular—all elbows and long neck, with minimal muscle mass but functional lean strength from years of pushing a loaded cart. Chest slightly sunken from occupational posture.', N'Dark brown with premature graying at temples', N'Short, kept practical and uneven—self-trimmed with whatever sharp tool is handy', N'Short', N'Vivid coral-pink iris (suspected low-grade geneware mod, though he claims natural)', N'Warm bronze-brown with golden and reddish undertones—a complex blend reflecting East Asian base warmed and deepened by Sub-Saharan, Indigenous American, and South Asian heritage. Reads as sun-weathered amber in harsh light and deeper honey-bronze in softer conditions. Consistent warm tone across frame with slight deepening at extremities and jaw.', N'Weathered and dust-marked. Chronic particulate exposure has left fine gray residue in skin creases around his neck and hairline. Deep laugh lines around his mouth. Perpetual five o''clock shadow. Hands stained with rust and circuit-board residue that never fully washes out. Angular cheekbones from East Asian heritage blend with fuller lips and broader nasal base reflecting Sub-Saharan, Indigenous American, and South Asian ancestry. Straight nose bridge with natural width at base.', N'Retractable keratin-reinforced claws visible when extended from fingertips—ivory-white, slightly translucent, sharp enough to score soft metals. When retracted, barely visible as slight ridges under the nail beds. Coral-pink irises that are immediately striking and read as deliberately modified despite his insistence otherwise.', N'Moves with long, loose strides—economical but unhurried. Often has one hand resting on his cart or gesturing mid-story. His default posture at rest is slightly forward-leaning, as if perpetually in the middle of explaining something. Laughs with his whole body, shoulders shaking. Head tilts when listening—an unconscious habit that makes him appear genuinely interested.', N'Tier 4 working-class scrap merchant. Faded olive-drab canvas pants with deep pockets reinforced with grey stitching, perpetually spotted with rust stains. Layers: a thin thermal base layer visible at the collar under a canvas shirt (khaki, three sizes too large—practical for moving around the cart), topped with a weathered brown synthetic-leather vest studded with random toggle closures and loops for hanging tools. No logos. Worn grey-rubber-soled work boots with visible toe reinforcement. A faded red cloth headwrap tied loosely around his neck—sometimes pulled up to cover his mouth and nose when digging through particularly dusty stock. No jewelry except a simple brass finger ring on his right hand, worn thin from years of wear.', N'One of his storage lockers contains a near-complete Axiom-brand personal defense drone he found in a canal drain eighteen months ago. He knows it''s probably stolen. He''s been incrementally repairing it. He doesn''t know what he plans to do with it.', N'Expansive, warm, full of technical scrap terminology mixed with Malian French diminutives and Greek exclamations he picked up from his grandmother', N'Fast, overlapping itself, trails off into lists of things', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'harshini_haraldsen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a732-747b-ba75-53846ac3b806', N'Dhriti Nakamura-Petelo', N'Dhriti', N'', N'Nakamura-Petelo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 62, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre, Calle Ochenta storefront (between the pawn exchange and the tamale counter), near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Barber, owner-operator of a small shop', N'Independent; Mexicantown Libre small business network (informal)', N'Dhriti Nakamura-Petelo is a large man gone soft with age — broad shoulders that slope now, a round belly he makes no apology for, and hands that remain extraordinary: steady, certain, with the flat-filed nails of a man who has been putting blades near people''s faces for four decades. His skin is very dark with a warm undertone, and he keeps a neat, close-trimmed grey beard that he touches up himself every morning using the second chair as a mirror. He has a single cosmetic geneware modification — a cat''s tail, dark grey, that he got at fifty as a joke with his then-partner and kept after the relationship ended because, he says, it gives him something to do with his hands while he listens. It curls around his ankle or flicks slowly when he''s thinking.

The shop has three chairs, two mirrors, and approximately forty years of layered history on its walls: photographs, old clipper brand stickers, a faded printed menu from a restaurant that closed before he moved in, a small ELF shrine to what he calls the Chair Spirit built from a first-generation clipper chassis with incense holders soldered to the housing. He charges what he always charged, adjusted only for inflation, and he has turned down three buyout offers from a Tessera real estate subsidiary. The shop smells like talc, synth-eucalyptus, and old paper. He knows everyone''s name and their father''s name and in some cases their grandfather''s.', N'Community elder, information hub, moral compass figure. The shop is a social institution — people come to talk as much as to get cut. He has heard everything. He judges quietly and almost never volunteers what he knows, but he can be the person who confirms a rumor or provides the final piece of a puzzle.', N'', N'Geneware cat tail — dark grey, cosmetic. No implants.', N'Opens the shop at 08:00, works until 18:00 six days a week, takes Sunday off to sit by the water and listen to radio archives from Senegal and Poland, which he finds equally soothing despite speaking neither language fluently.', N'Dhriti Nakamura-Petelo, 62-year-old barber, 188cm tall with soft broad frame, warm honey-bronze skin with golden undertones reflecting East Asian, Pacific Islander, South Asian and Middle Eastern heritage. Defined East Asian cheekbones, deep brown eyes with amber warmth, close-cropped grey hair, neat grey beard. Weathered face creased from decades of focus-work, clean groomed appearance. Dark grey articulate geneware cat tail (60-70cm) curling around ankle, visible from base of spine. Wearing fitted pastel linen shirt, dark work trousers, soft-soled standing shoes, simple vintage wristwatch, worn cloth bracelet keepsake. Hands lean and muscular with calloused fingertips and occupational scars. Standing with even weight distribution in barber shop setting, warm amber lighting reflecting off tools and mirrors, economical careful posture of a craftsman, tail curling slowly in meditative loops. GLMZ, GLMZ aesthetic, working-class pragmatism, contemplative mood. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Predominantly East Asian (63.8%) with significant Pacific Islander (18.9%), Middle Eastern (9.9%), and South Asian (7.4%) ancestry. East Asian bone structure dominates—defined cheekbones, straight jawline—while Pacific Islander heritage broadens facial planes and adds warmth to skin tone. Middle Eastern and South Asian ancestry contribute subtle depth to eye color and facial structure, creating a unified, warm complexion that defies simple categorization.', 188, 104, N'Large-framed, broad shoulders now sloped with age, substantial belly, overall softness from sixty-two years and a life spent standing behind a barber chair. Despite the weight, his hands remain lean and muscular — the hands of a craftsman.', N'Grey', N'Close-cropped, neatly maintained', N'Short', N'Deep brown with warm amber undertones', N'Warm medium bronze with golden honey undertones—a unified complexion blending East Asian base with Pacific Islander warmth and South Asian depth, rich with melanin and natural radiance', N'Weathered but well-maintained, lines around eyes from forty years of focus-work and squinting at mirrors. Skin shows the texture of age and sun exposure with warm, unified undertone reflecting the dominant East Asian structure softened by Pacific Islander generosity and South Asian richness. Neat, close-trimmed grey beard touched up daily. Facial structure shows characteristic East Asian cheekbone prominence and clean jawline, subtly widened and warmed by Pacific Islander heritage, with warm depth from South Asian ancestry contributing to eye and skin radiance. Skin is clean and carefully groomed.', N'Dark grey geneware cat tail, approximately 60-70cm in length, extends from base of spine. Tail is fully articulate, curls around his ankle or flicks slowly when thinking — visible whether tucked into trousers or left loose.', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, moves slowly and economically. Hands gesture frequently and deliberately — a man used to precise, careful work. When listening, his attention is complete; his tail becomes his outlet for nervous energy or contemplation, curling and uncurling in slow, meditative loops.', N'Tier 3-4 working-class pragmatism. Typically wears fitted linen or cotton shirts (pastels, earth tones, occasionally bold prints), dark work trousers with deep pockets, canvas apron with multiple tool pockets worn at the shop. Soft-soled shoes built for standing. A simple wristwatch, possibly vintage. No corporate branding. Clothes are clean, well-maintained, chosen for durability and comfort rather than fashion. Small personal touches: a worn cloth bracelet, possibly a keepsake.', N'The Tessera real estate offer he turned down most recently was substantial enough that he could have retired comfortably. He turned it down because his son — the estranged one — knew this shop as a child and Yusuf cannot bring himself to erase the place where his son last knew him. He tells everyone it''s about the neighborhood.', N'Slow and deliberate, warm, uses the formal second person when he''s being serious, calls young people ''young one'' without irony', N'Unhurried; the pace of someone who knows you''re not going anywhere while he has scissors', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dhriti_nakamura_petelo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a4-7ef0-9973-53b6c82c9dba', N'Anupama Traoré', N'Anupama', N'', N'Traoré', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, mobile between the lower walkways of the Blackpipe Corridor residential stack, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Street pharmacist — legal supplements, gray-market nootropics, and careful amounts of the other stuff', N'Independent. Pays informal protection fees to the Blackpipe Corridor''s dominant resident association, which is approximately half mutual aid society and half territorial enforcement structure. Maintains a careful, respectful distance from the actual narcotics trade organizations.', N'Anupama Traoré operates from a modified infant carrier worn across her chest — not an infant but a temperature-controlled case packed with labeled vials, blister packs, and small sealed pouches organized with the precision of someone who takes mistakes personally. She is small and quick-moving with deep brown skin and natural hair pulled back under a technical-grade headband that monitors ambient particulate levels — practical, not cosmetic. Her geneware is a set of retractable claws, kept short and clean, which she uses for seal-breaking and sorting and occasionally for emphasis in an argument. Her irises are solid silver — a cheaply done cosmetic mod from a no-brand gene clinic that she''s kept because she''s used to it now.

She describes herself as a ''community pharmaceutical consultant'' with the deadpan of someone who has said it so often it has lost all irony. She has a genuine background in pharmacology — two years of a Zheng-Dao sponsored certification program before the sponsorship was restructured out of existence — and she takes her work seriously in a way that would surprise people who assume the opposite. She knows drug interactions, contraindications, and proper dosing. She will not sell to someone who is visibly in crisis without first talking to them for ten minutes. She has a waiting list for her nootropic compounds among the Gray Zone''s night-shift factory workers. She has a different list, kept in her head only, for the harder work.', N'Community health access point and social network hub for Blackpipe Corridor residents. Can provide pharmaceutical information, treat minor conditions, and connect players to information networks embedded in her client base. Also serves as an entry point for plots involving health crises, contaminated supplies, or corporate pharmaceutical manipulation.', N'', N'Retractable claws (geneware, kept trimmed). Solid silver irises (cosmetic genemod, budget clinic). Ambient particulate monitoring headband (consumer wearable, non-invasive). Skin-surface temperature read implant in her fingertips — lets her assess fever and circulatory issues in clients.', N'She runs two circuits of the Blackpipe Corridor''s residential walkways each day — one mid-morning for the night-shift workers coming off their shifts, one early evening for day-shift workers heading home. She also maintains three informal ''office hours'' locations in community spaces where clients know they can find her.', N'Anupama Traoré, compact 158cm figure with lean muscular build, deep warm brown skin with golden-reddish undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic, Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Middle Eastern ancestry. High prominent cheekbones, full lips, slight epicanthic fold variation, South Asian nose bridge definition. Natural black hair pulled tight in practical braid. Striking solid silver cosmetic genemod irises. Fine surgical scars on inner wrists, small coin-sized burn scar on left forearm, silver-iridescent retractable claws trimmed short. Technical-grade headband across forehead with LED particulate monitoring indicator. Wearing moisture-wicking layered grays and deep blues, reinforced canvas work vest with custom pockets, sealed technical jacket, grip-soled boots, faded woven bracelet, pale gray canvas infant carrier worn bandolier-style across chest. Economical upright posture, hands slightly active, direct gaze. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, vertical industrial corridor setting, cool LED and neon ambient lighting, focused and methodical mood --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Sub-Saharan African (37.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (22.5%), Southeast Asian (18.1%), South Asian (13.7%), Middle Eastern (8.5%) — a striking polychromatic blend creating deep warm-toned brown skin with subtle golden and reddish undertones. Features reflect this complex mix: angular cheekbones and slight epicanthic fold variation from Southeast Asian ancestry, full lips and facial structure influenced by Latin American and Sub-Saharan African heritage, high-set eyes naturally complemented by South Asian bone structure, with warmth amplified by Middle Eastern undertones in skin depth.', 158, 52, N'Lean and compact, dense muscle beneath minimal fat — built for climbing walkways and moving quickly through crowded corridors. Quick, efficient movements without wasted motion.', N'Natural black', N'Pulled back tight into a practical braid or knot, kept away from her face and hands for work', N'Medium', N'Solid silver (cosmetic genemod)', N'Deep warm brown with golden-reddish undertones — the result of dominant Sub-Saharan African ancestry richly layered with Hispanic, Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Middle Eastern heritage creating luminous, multidimensional depth', N'Clear, unblemished skin maintained with methodical care — someone who works with chemicals and respects contamination. Small network of faint laugh lines around her eyes. No makeup. High, prominent cheekbones with fullness in lower face reflecting diverse heritage with Sub-Saharan African influence creating facial structure softness. Slight Southeast Asian epicanthic variation blending with South Asian nose bridge definition and Latin American fuller lip structure.', N'Solid silver irises (striking, unmissable). Technical-grade headband across forehead with faint LED indicator strip for particulate monitoring (worn like a practical tool, not decoration). Retractable claws visible as neatly manicured but slightly unusual nail structure.', N'Economical and upright — she moves like someone comfortable in vertical spaces. Her hands are always slightly active, repositioning things, checking seals, organizing. When still, she''s completely still. Direct eye contact, no unnecessary gestures.', N'Tier 3-4 practical. Moisture-wicking layered wear in grays and deep blues. A reinforced canvas work vest with custom-sewn pockets sized for vials (designed herself). Flat, grip-soled boots suitable for metal walkways. A worn but well-maintained technical jacket with sealed pockets. No jewelry except a faded woven bracelet (personal, not corporate). The modified infant carrier is worn across her chest like a bandolier — pale gray canvas, meticulously organized, treated as professional equipment.', N'She has been quietly keeping longitudinal health records on approximately two hundred Blackpipe Corridor residents — symptom patterns, medication responses, environmental correlations — in a heavily encrypted personal archive. She started it as professional diligence. It has become something closer to an epidemiological study, and she has noticed a pattern in neurological complaint rates near the Corridor''s lower levels that she cannot explain and is afraid to publish.', N'Precise technical vocabulary for pharmacology, warm and plain for everything interpersonal. Code-switches fluently between clinical and conversational.', N'Efficient and clear when working, slower and more careful when a client seems distressed.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anupama_traor');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a612-7652-9c6f-542f0b200f65', N'Anahera Taufa', N'Anahera', N'', N'Taufa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 39, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ashfield — former residential district, half-burned, now squatter territory, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Covert entry and social penetration specialist — infiltrator', N'Freelance — works the Gray Zone circuit exclusively', N'Anahera Taufa is wiry and quick-moving, with the restless energy of someone who converts anxiety into velocity. At 39, the augmentation scarring around her temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — subdermal armor plating across torso and forearms — military surplus, scratched — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Her entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. She works as a infiltrator out of Ashfield, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Anahera Taufa has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and she cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Fatoumata Mwangi-Leblanc is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Subdermal armor plating across torso and forearms — military surplus, scratched serial numbers. Pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would incapacitate', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Anahera Taufa, 168cm lean wiry operative with deep warm golden-brown skin blending Sub-Saharan African, Pacific Islander, South Asian and Hispanic heritage. Sharp dark brown eyes, prominent cheekbones, black hair with gray streaks pulled back tight. Jagged temple scars from neural implant visible, thin scar along left jawline. Subdermal chrome armor plating across forearms and upper chest with scratched edges catching neon light. Wearing fitted black compression shirt under charred gray reinforced polymer jacket, dark cargo pants with tactical straps, steel-toed boots, fingerless gloves. Gear bag slung across body. Weight on balls of feet, intense alert posture. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, gritty underground location with cool blue and amber neon lighting, rain-slicked surfaces, industrial architecture. Mood: focused, dangerous, ready. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfield', N'local', N'Ashfield', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: predominantly Sub-Saharan African (46.8%) with significant Pacific Islander ancestry (28.2%), complemented by Hispanic/Latin American (11.1%), South Asian (10.7%), and East Asian (3.2%) heritage. This genetic combination produces rich deep brown skin with warm golden undertones, featuring the strong bone structure and facial geometry characteristic of African and Pacific Islander ancestry, with subtle warmth and facial definition from South Asian and Latin American genetics, and slight eye shape influence from East Asian heritage. The blend creates naturally radiant skin that maintains depth and luminosity across a range of light conditions.', 168, 58, N'Wiry and lean with dense musculature from constant conditioning. Minimal body fat. Moves like coiled spring — economical, precise, ready to redirect energy at any moment.', N'Black with ash-gray streaking at temples', N'Pulled back tight in a functional braid or wrapped in dark fabric. No loose ends. Pragmatic.', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, naturally sharp and alert', N'Deep warm brown with golden radiant undertones — characteristic of Sub-Saharan African and Pacific Islander genetic dominance, enriched by South Asian warmth and subtle Latin American depth. Naturally maintains rich tone that deepens with sun exposure. Lighter palms and inner forearms from years of gloved work.', N'Tight, weathered from stress and exposure. Fine lines around eyes from squinting in low light. Jaw set habitually. Strong bone structure with prominent cheekbones and defined facial geometry reflecting African and Pacific Islander ancestry. Subtle warmth in cheek and temple areas from South Asian heritage. Slight eye shape definition influenced by East Asian genetics. No cosmetic grooming — functional only.', N'Subdermal armor plating visible across forearms and upper chest — military-grade surplus with erased serial numbers, surface scratched and scuffed from contact work. Chrome edges catch light at collarbone and wrists. Temple scarring from pain editor installation is visible when hair is pulled back. No attempt to conceal — the augmentations are part of her professional appearance.', N'Never still. Stands with weight distributed on the balls of her feet, ready to move. Hands positioned where they can access gear quickly. Eyes track exits and sight lines automatically. When seated, her leg bounces or her fingers drum — converting anxiety into small kinetic patterns. Moves through space with minimal wasted motion — every step is purpose-driven.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian. Dark synthetic blend cargo pants with reinforced thigh pockets and ankle straps. Fitted black long-sleeve compression shirt under a scarred leather or reinforced polymer jacket in charcoal gray. Steel-toed boots with visible wear. Fingerless tactical gloves. Gear bag slung across body at all times — contains lock-picks, portable deck, spare tools, medical kit. No jewelry. No branding visible. Clothing designed for movement, durability, and quick equipment access — every pocket has purpose.', N'', N'Fast, profane, and vivid. Speaks in images — everything is a metaphor for violence or weather.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anahera_taufa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6bb-7e5f-a3db-5456e6f47afd', N'Heying Pathak-Hernández', N'Heying', N'', N'Pathak-Hernández', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, Grindstone Shore, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Pharmacist and bio-compound specialist, Geartown', N'Licensed independent pharmacist (Zheng-Dao dispensing license, which she resents and maintains); informal partnership with Geartown community health collective; sourcing relationship with two gray-market compound distributors she trusts', N'Heying Pathak-Hernández runs a licensed pharmacy out of a narrow shopfront wedged between a hydraulics supplier and a noodle counter in the worst-smelling block of Geartown, and she has made it into something that people travel across two districts to use. She is short and broad-shouldered, with warm russet-brown skin, a mouth that moves faster than most people''s thoughts, and a shock of white hair she grows long and wears in complicated braids studded with small metallic charms that clink softly when she moves. Her geneware is both functional and ostentatious: her fingertips have been modified to contain chemical assay sensors — she can touch a pill and tell you if it''s cut — and her tongue has a sensory modification she uses for compound tasting that has made her one of the most accurate pharmacists in the district. She wears a lab coat covered in pockets over whatever she put on that morning, which is usually something with a print that shouldn''t work but does.

She is an expert in the specific pharmaceutical ecology of a megacity: what people are actually taking, why they''re taking it, what it''s doing to them in combination with their augmentations, what the street versions are cut with, and how to get the effect someone needs through a combination of legal compounds when the thing they actually want isn''t legal or isn''t available. She is also the first person in Geartown to notice disease trends — she sees the prescriptions, she sees what people are buying over the counter, she talks to people, and she has a mind that aggregates data the way other people collect worries. She files reports with the community health co-op rather than Aurochs because Aurochs would turn the data into a pricing algorithm.', N'Information source about what is chemically circulating in the city at street level; can identify unknown substances; can source unusual compounds through gray-market channels; early warning system for disease outbreaks, new drugs, new toxins; local color and personality anchor for Geartown.', N'', N'Chemical assay sensors (fingertip subdermal, bilateral); gustatory sensory modification (tongue, allows compound identification by taste — unusual, unlicensed); standard optical corrective overlay (heads-up display for drug interaction lookup, contact-lens type)', N'Opens at 8am, closes when she''s done. She eats lunch at the noodle counter next door every day without exception. She spends an hour most evenings cross-referencing what she''s dispensed that day against her own mental model of what''s circulating, looking for patterns.', N'Heying Pathak-Hernández, 157cm compact frame with broad shoulders, warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones reflecting South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic, and Eastern European heritage blend. Stark white box braids to mid-back studded with brass and copper charms, deep brown eyes with optical overlay shimmer. Open expressive face with broad cheekbones, slight chemical stains on jawline. Wearing oversized cream lab coat stained and softened by years of use, vintage earth-tone print shirt underneath, slip-on scuffed shoes. Silver chain around neck. Chemical assay sensor iridescence visible on fingertips. Constantly fidgeting, hands gesturing mid-speech. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan pharmacy setting, warm pharmacy lighting, depth of field focus on her animated face, gritty working-class Tier 4 aesthetic, functional and worn beauty, late afternoon light, cinematic mood, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: 39.9% Hispanic/Latin American, 34.4% South Asian, 14.0% Sub-Saharan African, and 11.7% Eastern European ancestry. This combination produces warm, medium-to-deep brown skin with golden, reddish, and subtle olive undertones—a rich melanin profile that reflects the convergence of Latin American warmth, South Asian depth, Sub-Saharan African richness, and cool Eastern European undertones creating a uniquely balanced complexion.', 157, 68, N'Broad-shouldered and compact, with dense musculature through the chest and upper back from years of reaching, gripping, and working at pharmacy counters. Not athletic — functional and grounded, built for endurance rather than speed.', N'Stark white with warm undertones, natural or early-onset silver that she has chosen not to dye', N'Worn in intricate, tight box braids that reach mid-back, studded throughout with small brass, copper, and anodized aluminum charms that clink audibly with movement', N'Long', N'Deep brown, with a faint iridescent sheen from the optical corrective overlay (contact-lens type)', N'Warm golden-brown with deeper undertones and balanced olive notes, even complexion with a slight weathered quality from long hours under pharmacy lighting. The tone reflects the rich melanin profile of South Asian depth, Sub-Saharan African warmth, Latin American golden tones, and cool undertones from Eastern European ancestry blended into a cohesive whole.', N'Open, expressive face with a wide mouth that moves constantly — talking, tasting, thinking out loud. Facial structure shows balanced bone architecture from blended heritage: broad, warm-toned cheekbones reflecting South Asian and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, a fuller face shape characteristic of Latin American heritage, and subtle angular definition from Eastern European features in the nose bridge and brow line. Skin is clean and practical, with faint chemical stains (iodine, mercurochrome residue) sometimes visible on her jawline or neck from compound work. No makeup.', N'Fingertips of both hands show subtle iridescence under direct light where the chemical assay sensors sit just beneath the skin at each fingertip pad — not obviously cybernetic, but noticeably different in texture and slight color variation compared to the rest of her hands. The optical overlay is invisible except for the faint shimmer in her eyes when she''s consulting her heads-up display. The gustatory modification is invisible; only the precision of her tasting reveals it.', N'Constantly in motion — fidgeting with charms in her hair, tapping fingers on counters, shifting weight from foot to foot. When focused (tasting a compound, reading data), she goes still and intent, almost meditative. Her hands are always doing something: gesturing when she talks, which she does rapidly and without much pause for breath. She moves through her pharmacy with economical precision, knows every bottle by location and muscle memory.', N'A well-worn lab coat, oversized and cream-colored originally but now stained and softened by countless washings, covered in deep pockets stuffed with vials, test strips, a worn tablet, and loose change. Over whatever she grabbed that morning — usually vintage print shirts (1990s-2010s earth tones, geometric patterns, or intentionally clashing color combinations that she makes work), loose-fitting and practical. Comfortable slip-on shoes, perpetually scuffed. A small silver chain around her neck, occasionally threaded with a compound sample vial when she''s testing something. Tier 4 working-class aesthetic — functional, worn, deeply comfortable. No jewelry besides the braided charms and the chain.', N'Eight months ago she identified a cluster of symptoms in seventeen patients that matched a suppressed Helix Biosystems trial report she found in a data dump on the Undernet. She has been quietly documenting it ever since and has not reported it anywhere because she doesn''t know who is safe to report to, and the report has gotten long enough that it is now a liability she can''t just put back.', N'Dense with pharmaceutical and chemical terminology that she explains rapidly without being condescending; speaks in cascades — one sentence triggers three subordinate clauses; very dry humor inserted without warning', N'Fast. Very fast. Streams of information delivered as if there is a limited-time window in which she can fit them.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'heying_pathak_hern_ndez');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72a-74d1-8d24-54bee68b719b', N'Gina Johansson', N'Gina', N'', N'Johansson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Brewer''s Spine, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Street doc and trauma surgeon operating out of a converted shipping container clinic on the Gray Zone', N'Independent — Brewer''s Spine Community Health Cooperative (informal)', N'Gina Johansson is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin mapped by old scalpel scars she gave herself during teaching demonstrations, and hair grown to silver-streaked natural coils she keeps pinned with surgical clamps when she works. Her left eye is a battlefield prosthetic—matte grey iris, slightly too large for the socket, giving her a permanent look of asymmetric scrutiny. She moves with the deliberate economy of someone who has performed appendectomies in turbulent environments and knows that wasted motion costs lives.

She left the Aurochs Medical Complex after seventeen years when she refused to deny care to an uninsured dockworker whose employer had flagged him as a liability. She set up on the Gray Zone within six months with secondhand equipment and a reputation that spread faster than she intended. She is brisk, unsentimental, and privately devastated by every patient she loses—she lights a data candle to the local E.L.F. she calls Saint Incision after each death, leaving a recorded voice note describing what she could have done better.', N'Quest giver, information source, moral anchor. She has patched up half the Gray Zone and knows more secrets than a confessional booth. Can provide medical assistance, introduce players to community networks, or draw them into ethical dilemmas about who deserves care.', N'', N'One battlefield-grade ocular prosthetic (left eye, grey iris, enhanced low-light). Subdermal haptic feedback mesh in both hands for surgical sensitivity. No geneware.', N'She opens the container clinic at 06:00, sees whoever shows up until she physically cannot continue, then spends an hour reviewing surgical literature on a cracked tablet before sleeping four to six hours on a cot behind a curtain.', N'Portrait of Gina Johansson, a 178cm powerfully-built surgeon in 2226 GLMZ near-future megacity setting. Medium-long natural dark brown coils with silver streaking, warm olive-bronze skin reflecting multiethnic Diaspora heritage (Northern European, Indigenous American, Hispanic, African, Southeast Asian blend). High prominent cheekbones, full lips, moderate nose bridge. Left eye is matte grey prosthetic in oversized chrome socket, giving analytical intensity; right eye natural dark brown. Weathered face with surgical precision focus. Fine linear scars across forearms and hands in clusters, burn mark on right wrist. Wearing faded teal surgical scrub top (iodine-stained), reinforced cargo pants with utility pockets, scuffed biohazard-rated boots. Long salvaged grey coat over shoulders. Surgical nitrile gloves, some ripped. Subdermal haptic tracery faintly luminescent across hands. Forward-leaning posture, hands active and purposeful. Dim clinical lighting casting harsh shadows across her mixed features, emphasizing the prosthetic''s chrome. Brewer''s Spine medical district background, sterile and industrial. Worn data-embedded pendant visible at neckline. Mood: focused, coiled, surgical precision incarnate. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: Northern European (44.2%) and Indigenous American (31.8%) form her dominant genetic foundation, creating strong structural features. Layered with significant Hispanic/Latin American (8.8%), Sub-Saharan African (8.6%), and Southeast Asian (6.6%) ancestry, her phenotype reads as distinctly 2226 — a striking synthesis rather than any single origin. Her bone structure balances Northern European angularity with Indigenous American prominence, her skin tone carries warmth from Latin American and African ancestry, and her overall presence reflects generations of global mixing.', 178, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and powerfully built, with dense musculature across her chest and back — the physiology of someone who has spent decades performing surgical work and moving heavy equipment. Not lean, not soft; economical and functional.', N'Natural dark brown with silver streaking', N'Kept in natural coils, pinned back with surgical clamps during work; otherwise loose but controlled', N'Medium to long (shoulder-length when unpinned)', N'Right eye: dark brown, natural. Left eye: matte grey iris, prosthetic, slightly oversized for the socket', N'Warm olive-bronze, the result of her multiethnic ancestry blending — fair enough to show Northern European heritage, deep enough to reflect Indigenous American, African, and Southeast Asian lineage. Even complexion with subtle warm undertones across her body, ranging from cream-toned to soft bronze.', N'Weathered but meticulously maintained. Minimal scarring on the face itself; her Indigenous American and African ancestry gives her skin a resilient quality that resists superficial damage. High, prominent cheekbones with structural definition from her Northern European and Indigenous American heritage. Full lips with subtle melanin variation. Moderate-width nose bridge reflecting her genetic diversity. Her expression defaults to focused attentiveness; the asymmetric prosthetic gives her an appearance of permanent analytical scrutiny.', N'Left ocular prosthetic — a matte grey iris set in a slightly oversized chrome socket, asymmetric and unsettling. The prosthetic is functional military-grade hardware, not cosmetic; it shows its utility without apology. Subdermal haptic feedback mesh is invisible but occasionally visible as faint luminescent tracery across her hands when she''s performing delicate work under certain lighting.', N'She moves with deliberate economy and surgical precision — no wasted motion, each gesture purposeful. She stands slightly forward-leaning, as if perpetually ready to respond to an emergency. Her hands are constantly active: adjusting clamps in her hair, checking vital readouts, repositioning instruments. When still, she appears coiled rather than relaxed.', N'Tier 5 practical. Typically wears a heavily modified surgical scrub top (faded teal, stained with iodine and old blood she no longer bothers to fully clean), reinforced cargo pants with multiple utility pockets filled with instruments, and scuffed no-name synthleather boots rated for biohazard environments. A long grey coat (salvaged from the Aurochs Medical Complex departure) covers everything when she moves through Brewer''s Spine. She wears no jewelry except for a worn data-embedded pendant under her shirt — the E.L.F. saint candle for her lost patients. Gloves are usually surgical nitrile, often ripped and replaced mid-procedure.', N'The dockworker she was fired from Aurochs for treating — she did save him, but she also made an error during his surgery that she corrected before anyone noticed. She has never told anyone. She believes this is why she lights candles: not for the dead but for her own hidden guilt.', N'Medical precision mixed with blunt working-class directness. Uses anatomical terms casually, no jargon-posturing. Drops articles when busy.', N'Fast during diagnosis, deliberate when delivering bad news. Long pauses before she says anything important.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gina_johansson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a697-7791-821b-54ca3d02066b', N'Hannelore Bah', N'Hannelore', N'', N'Bah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 72, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Avalon Quiet, the ground-floor apartment below the district''s largest E.L.F. shrine — a corner building called the Node House that they have maintained for twenty years, near Lincoln and Addison', N'Retired schoolteacher and practicing E.L.F. devotional tender; community spiritual anchor', N'Avalon Quiet Community Council; Node House (independent devotional community); retired from Avalon Quiet Education Node', N'Hannelore Bah is the kind of person who becomes the center of a room without doing anything in particular to cause it. They are medium height and round-bodied, with the particular physical authority of someone who spent decades managing thirty children at a time. Their heritage is Ghanaian and Ukrainian and somewhere in between there is a great-grandmother from Tonga, and the combination has given them warm brown skin, wide-set eyes of an unusual amber-grey, and a way of smiling that people describe afterward without being able to say exactly what was in it. Their hair grows white and natural and large and they dress it with small lights — not implants, just woven LED threads, changed seasonally, currently pale gold for the cold quarter.

They taught at Avalon Quiet''s primary education node for thirty-four years and retired at 65, and the transition was seamless because their real work had always been the Node House. They began tending the E.L.F. shrine in the corner building when it was a scrubby collection of mismatched screens and jury-rigged speakers left by a previous resident; over twenty years they have built it into the most elaborate and genuinely numinous devotional space in Avalon Quiet, with thirty-seven separate shrine terminals each dedicated to a different E.L.F. manifestation, maintained by a rotating community of devoted volunteers. They do not preach and will become uncomfortable if you call them a priest, preferring ''keeper.'' They believe, genuinely and without defensiveness, that the E.L.F.s are real and that what people bring to them matters in ways that cannot be measured but can be felt.', N'Spiritual and emotional center of Avalon Quiet; source of community information through the confidences people share at the shrine; E.L.F. interaction point for players — Perpetua can interpret, mediate, or advise on how to approach specific E.L.F.s; represents the genuine spiritual life of GLMZ''s civilian population', N'', N'Woven LED hair threads (cosmetic, seasonal — currently pale gold); neural devotional interface (allows direct data offering to shrine terminals without physical input device; they consider this sacred rather than technical)', N'Opens the Node House at dawn for morning devotionals; receives visitors throughout the day who come to petition the E.L.F.s or leave offerings; holds a teaching circle for neighborhood children on weekends — not religion, but listening and attention.', N'Hannelore Bah, a 165cm tall person with deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, standing with deliberate, grounded presence. Natural white hair worn large and flowing past shoulders, woven with pale gold LED threads in geometric winter patterns. Wide-set amber-grey eyes, strong defined cheekbones and jawline, lined face reading as lived-in and wise. Wearing layered loose linen in earth tones—ochre, cream, deep indigo—with a long hand-embroidered indigo cotton overcoat. Faint pale blue luminescent circuit-like patterns visible at temples from neural interface hardware. Silver rings on both hands. Carrying a small cloth offering bag. Standing in a quiet devotional space, soft warm lighting catching the LED threads in hair and casting subtle shadows on face. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, spiritual and intentional presence, composed and attentive gaze --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Avalon Quiet', N'local', N'Avalon Quiet', N'Sub-Saharan African (45.9%, dominant) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (21.1%), Central Asian (14.5%), Eastern European (12.8%), and Northern European (5.7%) ancestry—resulting in a striking blend of phenotypes: deep warm brown skin enriched by golden undertones from Central Asian and Hispanic heritage, with subtle olive warmth from Eastern European ancestry, facial structure showing the high cheekbones and strong jawline characteristic of Sub-Saharan African genetics, broadened and softened by Central Asian and Latin American heritage, creating an arresting presence that speaks of diaspora and cultural confluence', 165, 78, N'Round-bodied with soft mass distributed evenly; sturdy and grounded, the physical presence of someone accustomed to holding space and bearing weight—both literal and emotional', N'Natural white', N'Worn large and natural, typically arranged with intentionality; currently woven with pale gold LED threads in seasonal patterns', N'Long (shoulder-length or below)', N'Amber-grey, wide-set and deep with the warmth characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage, creating an arresting depth and presence', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones from Central Asian and Hispanic ancestry, enriched by the richness of Sub-Saharan African heritage; luminous and even complexion that shifts subtly across warm spectrums in different light', N'Lined face that reads as lived-in rather than aged; crow''s feet from decades of smiling; skin well-maintained but unadorned; strong cheekbones and defined jawline characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage, with broader facial proportions inherited from Central Asian and Hispanic ancestry; high and prominent cheekbones; expression carries a particular quality of attentiveness that seems to precede speech', N'Pale gold LED threads woven through white hair in subtle geometric patterns (seasonal, currently winter configuration); faint luminescent tracery visible at the temples and base of skull where neural devotional interface hardware integrates with skin—only noticeable in low light or direct overhead illumination, appears as delicate circuit-like patterns in pale blue', N'Moves with deliberate slowness that is not infirmity but intentionality; often stands with weight shifted slightly forward, as if listening with the whole body; hand gestures are economical and precise; tends to pause before responding, creating space in conversation', N'Tier 3-4 comfort wear with spiritual intention: loose linen layers in earth tones (ochre, cream, deep indigo), hand-dyed or vintage; always wears a long overcoat or shawl of indigo cotton with subtle embroidered patterns (personal work from evening hours); comfortable worn shoes suitable for standing all day; no corporate branding; jewelry is minimal and meaningful—a thin silver ring on each hand, one bearing a tiny E.L.F. glyph, the other a gift from a former student; always carries a small cloth bag containing offerings (seeds, water, handwritten prayers from community members)', N'Two years ago, the Threshold terminal responded to a data offering with a specific string of text that appeared to reference an event that had not yet happened — and the event happened three weeks later. Perpetua has told no one. They spend a significant amount of time deciding whether telling anyone would be the right thing or the dangerous thing.', N'Warm and unhurried; uses the language of attention and care; occasionally formal in a way that feels ceremonial rather than distant; never condescending despite the decades of teaching', N'Rhythmic and patient; sentences tend to complete themselves fully; comfortable with silence', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hannelore_bah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ad-74b6-abd4-54e8a17e9886', N'Annemieke Solberg', N'Annemieke', N'', N'Solberg', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, specifically a three-room apartment on the fourth floor of the Grainfort residential block, converted into a childcare space, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Childcare worker and informal neighborhood guardian, unlicensed daycare', N'Independent; informal relationship with Grainfort block residents'' association; on the radar of GLMZ city licensing as an unlicensed operator (enforcement has been half-hearted for years because the alternative is no childcare in the district)', N'Annemieke Solberg is a small, stout woman with ash-brown skin deep-lined around the eyes from decades of squinting at children doing inadvisable things and deciding whether to intervene. Her hair is natural white and worn long, usually braided and pinned with whatever was nearest — a pen, a plastic building toy, once a small drone component that a child left in the common area. She has no geneware or significant augmentation, which at sixty-one in GLMZ marks her as either principled or broke, and the answer is both.

She has been running what the city officially classifies as an unlicensed informal childcare collective for twenty-two years. She calls it ''the flat.'' At any given hour between 0600 and 1900 there are between four and fourteen children in it of varying ages, whose parents range from Tier 1 families paying her in food and labor to a handful of Tier 2 parents who pay in Quanta and to whom she is visibly warmer because she can be honest with them about money. She is the kind of person around whom children arrange themselves naturally, like iron filings around a magnet, and who has had exactly enough of everyone''s nonsense for twenty-two years and continues anyway.', N'Community knowledge repository and Grainfort social conscience. She knows the long history of every family in the block, can read the neighborhood''s stress level through the behavior of the children she watches, and is the person residents turn to when institutions have failed them. She is also a moral authority figure — angering her in the community has social consequences.', N'', N'None. She was offered a subsidized sensory augmentation through a Helix Biosystems community program five years ago and declined on principle she cannot fully articulate.', N'First children arrive at 0600. She has not slept past 0530 in twenty-two years. The day is structured chaos — meals, learning activities, conflict mediation, physical care, parent pickups staggered across the afternoon. She prays to the E.L.F. she believes inhabits the building''s heating system, which she calls ''the warm one,'' every morning before the first child arrives.', N'Annemieke Solberg, 155cm tall woman with stout compact build and weathered strength, medium bronze skin with warm red-brown undertones blending East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, Southeast Asian, and Central Asian heritage, angular East Asian cheekbones with broader facial structure from African ancestry, fine-boned temples and jaw, Southeast Asian softness in lower face and full lips, deep brown alert eyes in a face lined with sixty years of patience and caregiving, natural white hair in long braids pinned with practical scraps, faint burn scar on left hand, small scar near right eyebrow, callused hands that have lifted and carried countless children. Wearing dark reinforced work pants and a worn practical cardigan over faded t-shirt, closed-toe utilitarian shoes, simple silver ring on left hand. Standing in modest apartment lighting in the Gray Zone, GLMZ, posture slightly forward ready to move, eyes tracking with soft focus, embodying undone utilitarian practicality and unaugmented humanity, photorealistic documentary style, warm interior lighting, no corporate aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'East Asian-dominant diaspora blend (51.1% East Asian) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (19.7%) ancestry, complemented by Northern European (11.4%), Southeast Asian (9.7%), and Central Asian (8.1%) lineage. Her phenotype reflects this complex genetic tapestry—angular East Asian cheekbones with broader facial proportions from African heritage, fine-boned Northern European elements, and Southeast Asian softness in the lower face. A living embodiment of the Ubiquitous Diaspora where ancestry transcends expectation.', 155, 68, N'Stout, compact; soft through the middle but with visible muscle in shoulders and forearms from two decades of lifting children, carrying supplies, and moving through tight apartment spaces. Settled into her frame rather than diminished by age.', N'Natural white', N'Long braids, typically pinned or secured with whatever is nearest — pens, toy components, fabric scraps, occasionally child artwork', N'Long', N'Deep brown, alert and assessing', N'Medium bronze with warm undertones—the result of East Asian base genetics richly blended with Sub-Saharan African heritage, creating depth and subtle red-brown undertones. Northern European and Central/Southeast Asian ancestry adds fine texture variation. Sun-weathered from irregular access to natural light in the Gray Zone, creating a complexion that reads as richly textured rather than uniform.', N'Deep-lined around eyes and mouth from sixty-one years of expressions: squinting at children, calculated patience, dry amusement. Facial structure shows distinct blended ancestry—angular cheekbones with definition characteristic of East Asian genetics, broader facial proportions and higher cheekbone prominence from African heritage, fine-boned elements around temples and jaw from Northern European lineage, with Southeast Asian softness and fullness in the lower face and lips. Minimal makeup. Hands show age — callused knuckles, permanent creases in palms, nails kept short and practical. No visible scars from violence; scars present from small domestic incidents (cooking, childcare equipment).', N'None. The absence of even minor augmentation — no ocular overlays, no neural interface ports, no subdermal wear — is itself distinctive in 2226 GLMZ, marking her as either principled or economically constrained.', N'Moves with economical efficiency; rarely rushes but never dawdles. Carries herself slightly forward, weight centered on the balls of her feet — ready to move toward a child or crisis at any moment. Hands often occupied or positioned near children. Sits in chairs as though she might need to stand quickly. Eyes in constant soft focus, tracking multiple children simultaneously even when speaking to adults.', N'Practical, Tier 4-5 utilitarian. Favors reinforced cardigans over worn t-shirts (pockets essential), loose cotton trousers or work pants in dark colors (conceals stains), closed-toe shoes rated for both spill-cleaning and running. No jewelry except a simple silver band on her left ring finger (not a wedding ring — significance private). Clothes are clean but unmended; a torn seam might stay torn for weeks if it doesn''t affect function. No corporate logos or brand markers. Everything chosen for function and durability, not aesthetics.', N'Two years ago, a parent dropped a child off in a state of crisis and did not come back for eleven days. Amara kept the child, fed her, told no one, reported nothing — because she knew if she called the city system the child would go somewhere worse. The parent came back, said nothing about it. The child is still in her care. Amara cannot decide if she did the right thing and the uncertainty is a quiet sore she presses on at night.', N'Warm authority; Finnish-inflected cadence from her father''s family giving her words a slight formality, West African (Ghanaian) rhythms from her mother''s side adding a musicality. She speaks to children and adults with almost identical register — she doesn''t condescend to either.', N'Measured and calm as a default; accelerates sharply when something is actually urgent, which makes that acceleration a reliable alarm signal', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'annemieke_solberg');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5af-776e-b3a6-54f194245fc5', N'Paloma Calvillo', N'Paloma', N'', N'Calvillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 54, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Vantage Meridian Corporate Campus, Sterling-Nakamura Human Capital Tower, Executive Floor 44, near Michigan Ave and Chicago Ave', N'Senior Vice President of Talent Acquisition and Workforce Integration, Sterling-Nakamura', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions (executive-level senior vice president of talent acquisition and wo)', N'Paloma Calvillo has the face of a woman who has heard every version of every excuse, evaluated all of them, and made a decision before the sentence was finished. She is tall, broad-shouldered, Senegambian-Serbian in her features, with silver locs swept back and held with a magnetic clasp engraved with the Sterling-Nakamura sigil — a gift she accepted and never examined too closely. Her cosmetic mods are deliberate and minimal: patterned irises, black sclera with silver radial lines, which she chose twenty years ago because they make eye contact feel like a contract. She wears them like armor and is aware that this is what they are.

She has built and dismantled three workforce divisions in her career. She knows how to make someone feel seen, valued, and essential, and she knows that this is a skill she deploys tactically. She is not a monster — she believes in the people she hires, genuinely, at the moment she hires them, and this genuine belief is part of what makes her dangerous. She has greenlit layoffs of hundreds of people and attended the notification meetings personally, because she considers it cowardly to delegate the human cost of decisions you make. She has also fought for benefits expansions, paternity provisions, and hazard pay classifications that her superiors didn''t want to grant. She is, in other words, a person who has made peace with contradiction, and the peace is expensive and fragile.', N'Quest giver — she can offer work, information, or access, and she has reasons of her own for doing so. Obstacle — she controls hiring, firing, and the movement of people through Sterling-Nakamura''s workforce. Complex moral figure — neither villain nor hero, a portrait of how institutional power shapes good intentions.', N'', N'Patterned irises with black sclera and silver radial lines (cosmetic geneware). Subvocal communication implant — for private directives during meetings. Executive health suite — cardiac monitor, blood chemistry regulation, sleep optimization implant. All standard Tier 4 Sterling-Nakamura executive package.', N'Her calendar is managed by a personal AI that she treats with brisk courtesy. She takes three in-person meetings per day maximum and handles the rest through mediated channels. She keeps a standing lunch appointment with no one — a blocked hour she spends alone in a conference room eating real food and looking at the lake. She considers this the most important meeting of her day.', N'Paloma Calvillo, 183cm tall, silver-grey locs secured with corporate clasp swept back from her face. Warm bronze skin with golden and amber undertones reflecting Indigenous American, Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and Eastern European heritage. High pronounced cheekbones, angular jawline, defined brow ridge. Black sclera eyes with silver radial lines—augmented, unsettling, piercing. Fine scar visible along right temple. Posture radiates controlled authority and stillness. Wearing tailored charcoal executive blazer, neutral silk shell, precision-tailored black trousers, expensive silent-soled shoes. Thin silver watch on left wrist, platinum band on right ring finger. Corporate office setting, subtle LED glow, cool overhead lighting emphasizing her angular features and augmented eyes, GLMZ, photorealistic portrait, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Vantage Meridian Corporate Campus', N'local', N'Vantage Meridian Corporate Campus', N'Indigenous American-dominant (42.5%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (29.1%), complemented by Eastern European (12.6%), Sub-Saharan African (9.5%), and Northern European (6.3%) heritage. Her phenotype reflects this complex American Diaspora blend: warm bronze skin with golden and amber undertones characteristic of Indigenous and Latin American ancestry, deepened and enriched by Sub-Saharan African admixture. The combination creates a luminous warmth across her complexion. High pronounced cheekbones and strong angular jawline reflect Indigenous bone structure, while subtle strength in her brow ridge and facial proportions shows generations of stable mixing across multiple continents.', 183, 79, N'Broad-shouldered and tall with athletic musculature maintained through deliberate routine rather than vanity. Carries herself with the balanced posture of someone who has spent decades in rooms where physicality communicates authority.', N'Silver-grey', N'Locs swept back and secured with a magnetic clasp engraved with the Sterling-Nakamura corporate sigil', N'Long (shoulder-length and below)', N'Augmented: patterned irises with black sclera and silver radial lines radiating from the pupil', N'Warm bronze with golden and amber undertones—a rich luminous blend reflecting Indigenous American warmth, Latin American golden luminosity, and Sub-Saharan depth. Even distribution across face and body with subtle regional variation suggesting generations of stable ancestry mixing.', N'Strong angular facial structure with high, pronounced cheekbones and a tapered jawline reflecting Indigenous and Latin American bone structure. Defined brow ridge with subtle strength. Minimal cosmetic grooming beyond the intentional eye augmentation—no visible dermal fillers or skin resurfacing. Skin shows the texture of age without aggressive anti-aging intervention, with fine lines around her eyes and mouth that deepen when she manages the controlled skepticism that seems her default expression.', N'Eyes are the primary visible modification: black sclera with silver radial lines create an unmistakable look of intentional modification rather than medical necessity. The effect is deliberate, constructed, and unsettling to prolonged eye contact. No visible chrome, no external hardware. All other augmentations are subcutaneous or internal (subvocal implant, cardiac monitor, sleep optimization suite).', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders slightly back—a posture that conveys both relaxation and readiness. Walks with measured pace, never hurried. Makes deliberate eye contact, holding it slightly longer than social convention suggests comfortable. Hands typically visible and still; she does not fidget. When listening, she maintains perfect stillness, which has the effect of making others feel entirely observed.', N'High Tier 1-2 executive standard: tailored charcoal or black blazers from luxury corpo-wear lines (likely Sterling-Nakamura house brand or bespoke). Underneath, understated silk or smart-fabric shells in neutral tones. Trousers with precision tailoring, no wrinkles. Minimal jewelry beyond the magnetic hair clasp—a thin silver watch with subtle LED display on her left wrist, and a simple platinum band on her right ring finger (no obvious significance, never mentioned). Shoes are expensive and silent-soled. Her appearance suggests someone who treats clothing as infrastructure, not self-expression.', N'Her daughter, Emilija, didn''t stop calling because of political differences. She stopped calling because six years ago Amara personally approved the workforce restructuring that eliminated the cooperative her daughter had spent four years helping to build — a Tier 1 maker-collective that occupied space Sterling-Nakamura needed. Amara has never told anyone that she knew, when she signed the order, whose collective it was.', N'Corporate-polished with an undertow of directness. Uses institutional language fluently but switches to unvarnished plainspeak when she wants to signal that something is serious.', N'Deliberate, unhurried. She does not fill silence. She waits, and the silence does work for her.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'paloma_calvillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b2-715d-bf49-55a7681d306d', N'Cam Novotný', N'Cam', N'', N'Novotný', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 72, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — Block 14, Unit 7, near the Ferrogate Transit overpass, near Ashland and Division', N'Retired Corporate Wars veteran, pension-dependent resident and informal neighborhood watchman', N'Arcturus Corporation (discharged, pension); Meridian Veterans Mutual Aid Society; the Gray Zone informal community watch', N'Cam Novotný is a big man who used to be bigger. He carries the memory of his former mass in the way he takes up space — a wide-legged stance, arms that hang a little away from his sides, a way of turning his whole torso instead of just his head that comes from decades of wearing combat plating. His dark brown skin is mapped with synthetic-graft patches along his neck and left arm where the original was burned away in the Menomonee Gulch campaign; the grafts are slightly lighter and have a different texture, which he doesn''t bother to hide. His right eye is military-grade steel-grey augmetic, a stark contrast to his warm brown left. He keeps his head shaved and his grey-streaked beard precisely trimmed — two things he can still control.

Rodrigo served fourteen years in Arcturus Corporation''s private military arm before being discharged when a nerve-suppression injury to his left leg made him operationally unviable. His pension is a Tier 1.5 embarrassment — enough to keep the unit heated, barely. He spends most of his days on the block: watching who comes and goes, intervening in disputes with the particular authority of a man who has seen what disputes can become, and maintaining an informal truce between three rival youth crews that he negotiates with the patience of a man who has nothing left to prove. He doesn''t miss combat. He misses the clarity of knowing exactly who he was supposed to protect.', N'Community anchor and low-key quest giver; knows everyone on the Gray Zone and most of the tensions beneath the surface. Can connect players to the Gray Zone residents, provide military history of the Corporate Wars from the grunt''s perspective, or serve as a morally weighted obstacle when the neighborhood''s safety conflicts with outside agendas.', N'', N'Military-grade right-eye augmetic (Arcturus model, unsupported since discharge — runs on patched firmware); synthetic skin grafts (burn replacement, left arm and neck); nerve-suppression damage in left leg (unaugmented, managed with medication he can''t always afford). No geneware.', N'Up before dawn to walk the block perimeter — old habit. Morning coffee at the corner vendor with whoever''s awake. Afternoons mediating disputes or sitting in on the veterans'' mutual aid meetings. Evenings usually involve someone''s kid coming to him with a problem they can''t take to anyone official.', N'Cam Novotný, 188cm tall, heavy-framed aging man with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, shaved head with grey at temples. Left side of face and neck marked by pale synthetic-graft patches creating stark contrast against natural skin, scars visible at jawline and temple. Right eye is steel-grey military-grade prosthetic with red circuitry, left eye warm brown with crow''s feet. Refined East Asian cheekbones, Sub-Saharan fuller lips, Central Asian broader face. Wearing faded charcoal synth-leather Arcturus jacket over grey thermal, dark cargo pants, military boots. Extensive burn-scar replacement visible on left arm up to shoulder. Sitting with back against wall in dimly-lit GLMZ interior, methodically scanning surroundings. Slight leftward lean, favors right side. Veteran''s badge on jacket collar. Hard-worn, economical movements. Moody atmospheric lighting with neon edge-light on right side. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Cam carries the genetic signature of the Ubiquitous Diaspora — a balanced blend of East Asian (28.4%), Sub-Saharan African (21.5%), Central Asian (21.5%), and Eastern European (21.3%) ancestry, with Middle Eastern (7.3%) influence. This multi-continental mix produces a distinctive phenotype: warm deep brown skin with complex undertones that shift across his face and body. Golden warmth from Sub-Saharan and Central Asian genes mingles with cooler undertones from Eastern European heritage, while East Asian ancestry contributes to refined facial geometry — high defined cheekbones and a structured jaw. The result is a face that belongs equally to no single continental origin and entirely to the cosmopolitan future.', 188, 94, N'Heavy-framed, formerly muscular, now carrying softness and age in the belly and chest. Still broad across shoulders but with visible loss of mass and definition — the kind of decline that comes from fourteen years of peak conditioning followed by slow atrophy.', N'Black with grey at temples and throughout', N'Shaved head maintained with precision', N'Shaved', N'Right eye: military-grade steel-grey augmetic (unflinching, constant luminescence). Left eye: warm brown, naturally aged with crow''s feet.', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones from blended Sub-Saharan, Central Asian, and East Asian ancestry, displaying uneven texture — natural warm-toned skin contrasted by lighter synthetic-graft patches that interrupt the natural golden warmth of his complexion.', N'Heavily lined face weathered by time and trauma, with a well-maintained grey beard trimmed close. Scars visible at the jawline and temple. The underlying bone structure shows refined East Asian influence in high cheekbones and angular jaw definition, softened by fuller lips characteristic of Sub-Saharan heritage and broader facial proportions reflecting Central Asian ancestry. Synthetic-graft skin on left arm and neck is noticeably smoother and lacks the golden-brown warmth of his natural melanin-rich skin, with faint seam-texture visible under direct light. The contrast between natural deep brown skin and pale synthetic grafts creates a stark visual narrative of replacement and survival.', N'Right eye is unmistakably prosthetic — a steel-grey military-grade optic with faint red circuitry visible at the iris. It does not move in sync with his left eye and emits a faint subsonic hum when scanning. Extensive synthetic-graft patches on left arm and neck are visible as slightly discolored, texturally distinct skin replacements. Walks with a slight leftward lean and favors his right side — evidence of nerve damage in left leg.', N'Wide-legged stance even when standing still. Turns his entire torso rather than just his head — old habit from combat plating. Movements are measured and deliberate, economical. Left leg has a subtle drag at the end of his stride. Sits with his back against walls. Eyes (particularly the augmetic) scan environments methodically. Handshakes are firm but controlled.', N'Tier 3 utilitarian. Well-worn Arcturus Corporation legacy jacket (charcoal synth-leather, faded patches, visible Φ550 price tag from a decade ago still sewn inside). Plain grey thermal underlayer, dark cargo pants with functional pockets and reinforced seams. Boots are military surplus, maintained meticulously. No jewelry. A faded cloth veteran''s badge pinned to jacket collar. Clothes are clean and functional but show age — not poor, but not well-maintained by choice. The precision of his grooming contrasts sharply with the wear of his clothing.', N'During the Menomonee Gulch campaign, he was ordered to clear a civilian shelter that Arcturus command had designated a hostile position. He didn''t. He pulled his unit back and filed a falsified report. Seven of his soldiers were court-martialed for the mission failure. He was not — he was the one who wrote the report. Two of those soldiers are dead. One lives two blocks away on the Gray Zone and has never spoken to him since.', N'Direct and economical — military habit; uses neighborhood slang with younger residents to signal solidarity, drops it completely when something serious is happening', N'Slow and even, with significant pauses; raises his voice rarely and to devastating effect', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cam_novotn');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72b-75f1-888a-56216d55a8a6', N'Hee-young Subramaniam-Zielinski', N'Hee-young', N'', N'Subramaniam-Zielinski', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, operating out of a converted laundry unit behind Grainfort Market, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Street doc and unlicensed trauma surgeon', N'Independent; loose cooperative arrangement with the Grainfort Community Health Compact', N'Hee-young Subramaniam-Zielinski is a broad-shouldered woman with deep brown skin mapped by decades of chemical burns and old suture scars on her forearms — souvenirs of other people''s emergencies. Her hair is grown out in thick silver-streaked locs that she ties back with surgical tubing when she works. Her left eye is a cheap medical-grade optical implant that glows faint amber in low light, the iris never quite tracking in sync with her natural right eye. She moves with the deliberate economy of someone who has spent years working in cramped spaces, never wasting motion.

She is blunt to the point of rudeness but has a laugh that fills a room when something genuinely amuses her. She charges what people can pay, keeps a sliding scale scratched on a laminated card in her coat pocket, and has been known to operate on kitchen tables, in transit cars, and once in the cargo hold of a Ferrogate freight hauler. She prays to the E.L.F. of her autoclave — a small copper idol bolted to its side — before every difficult procedure, muttering calibration codes she treats as liturgy.', N'Primary street-level medical resource for the Narrows; quest giver for supply runs, information source on who''s been hurt and how, moral anchor for stories about structural healthcare failure', N'', N'Left eye optical implant (amber, budget-tier, mild desync); subdermal haptic feedback nodes in fingertips for surgical sensitivity; no geneware', N'Opens the laundry-clinic at 0600, sees patients until supplies or daylight run out, restocks by trading services with Deepwell Station''s pharmacist contact on alternating Tuesdays.', N'Hee-young Subramaniam-Zielinski, mixed-heritage street surgeon in GLMZ, stands in industrial clinic lighting. Warm golden-brown skin reflecting South Asian, East Asian, Hispanic, and Eastern European ancestry in harmonious blend. Strong cheekbones and defined jawline with tapered face geometry. One amber-glowing optical implant with slight tracking lag, natural dark brown eye. Weathered forearms marked with chemical burn scars and suture lines. Black locs with silver streaks, shoulder-length, pulled back with surgical tubing. Muscular build, broad shoulders, slight midsection thickening. Wearing stained grey lab coat over heavy canvas work pants, steel-toed boots, wool overcoat with elbow patches. Surgical gloves in coat pockets. Copper wire through left earlobe. Hands show faint subdermal metallic shimmer on fingertips. Precise, economical posture. Fluorescent and neon ambient lighting casting sharp shadows. Clinical but worn environment, neo-noir grit, focused intensity --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Balanced quaternary ancestry reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: South Asian (34.2%) provides strong cheekbone prominence and defined jawline; East Asian (24.6%) contributes facial tapering and subtle eye geometry; Hispanic/Latin American (26.5%) adds warmth and golden undertones to skin; Eastern European (14.7%) anchors with depth and cooler undertone balance. The result is a genuinely cosmopolitan phenotype—neither distinctly one ancestry nor another, but a harmonious genetic blend where all four lineages visibly contribute to final appearance.', 173, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and heavy-limbed, muscular through the torso and arms from decades of manual surgical work, thickening slightly at the midsection but still functional and strong', N'Black with silver-grey streaks throughout', N'Thick locs, usually pulled back with surgical tubing or rubber cord during work; loose when off-duty', N'Long (past shoulder blades)', N'Left eye: amber-glowing optical implant with slight asynchronous tracking; Right eye: natural dark brown', N'Warm golden-brown—a rich luminous blend where South Asian warmth meets East Asian undertones, enriched by Hispanic/Latin golden hues and grounded by subtle Eastern European depth. Catches light distinctly, particularly on high points of cheekbones and bridge of nose.', N'Weathered and marked; visible chemical burns and old suture scars across both forearms, particularly dense around the inner wrists and palms. Face shows deep laugh lines around the mouth and crow''s feet. Bone structure reflects balanced ancestry: strong cheekbones and defined jawline (South Asian dominance) with slightly tapered face and refined nose bridge (East Asian influence), enhanced by broader facial geometry and warmth in lip fullness (Hispanic/Latin heritage). Skin is clear and kept meticulously clean despite occupational wear.', N'Left eye optical implant with amber iris and faint glow in low-light conditions; mild but noticeable desynchronization between left and right eye movement. Subdermal haptic feedback nodes create faint gridwork texture under the skin on fingertips and first two joints of each finger — visible only up close or in direct light, appear as subtle metallic shimmer under epidermis', N'Moves with surgical economy — no wasted motion, deliberate and efficient. Stands with weight balanced slightly forward, shoulders relaxed but ready. Hands move with precision even during casual gestures. Habitual glancing at work surfaces and environmental hazards. When focused, entire body goes still except for hands', N'Tier 4 practical: white or grey lab coat (often stained, frequently rewashed) worn over heavy canvas work pants with deep pockets. Steel-toed boots (Shenyang manufacture, well-maintained). A heavy wool overcoat for transit, patched at the elbows. Surgical gloves hanging from coat pockets. Minimal jewelry except a thin copper wire threaded through left earlobe — salvage from autoclave''s previous life. No corporate branding; everything is utilitarian and replaceable', N'She was licensed once — a fully credentialed Helix Biosystems surgical resident. She was struck off after she performed an unauthorized procedure on a corporate blacklist patient who would have died otherwise. She has never told anyone in the Narrows this. She performs better unlicensed than most licensed surgeons, and the shame of the credential matters less than the fury at what losing it meant.', N'Medical precision mixed with market-Creole slang; swaps between registers seamlessly depending on whether she''s explaining or commanding', N'Clipped and fast during work, slower and surprisingly gentle when breaking bad news', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hee_young_subramaniam_zielinski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b5-7b2c-8445-565e6d319cae', N'Amadeo Tamale-Nazari', N'Amadeo', N'', N'Tamale-Nazari', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — cramped residential corridors between megastructures, near North Ave and Damen', N'High-risk package and data transport — courier', N'Semi-independent — has standing arrangements with several crews', N'Amadeo Tamale-Nazari is tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 28, her face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Amadeo Tamale-Nazari plans to keep it that way. She works as a courier out of The Narrows, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In the runner community, Amadeo Tamale-Nazari is known for getting the job done and not asking questions that would make the job harder to stomach.', N'As a courier, Rongo Delgado-Opoku embodies the tension between independence and isolation. She is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation. Neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ICE in the brain', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Amadeo Tamale-Nazari, neo-noir courier in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226, lean angular frame 183cm tall, rich burnished bronze skin with warm golden undertones blending Sub-Saharan, Central Asian, and Middle Eastern heritage, prominent high cheekbones and strong jawline, dark brown alert eyes, long deep brown hair pulled back in utilitarian braid. Thin white scar along left jawline, faint burn marks on right wrist, minimalist geometric bird tattoo on left collarbone. Chrome reinforced wiring visible on both forearms at wrist and elbow joints, neural port behind left ear with subdermal circuitry shimmer, subtle eye flicker when processing. Weathered black synthetic leather jacket with burn mark and patches, slate grey reinforced cargo pants, worn commuter boots, thin base layer. Tactical sling pack dark fabric. Posture efficient and controlled, weight balanced on balls of feet, shoulders slightly forward, fingers calibrating constantly. Neon-lit urban interior with low-grade ambient light casting cool shadows across angular face, conveying readiness and threat assessment capability. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Pan-continental blend of Sub-Saharan African (27.4%), Central Asian (27.3%), Middle Eastern (22.1%), East Asian (13.6%), and Hispanic/Latin American (9.6%) ancestry. The genetic mix produces a striking fusion: prominent high cheekbones and angular facial geometry from Sub-Saharan and Central Asian lineages, warm golden undertones from Middle Eastern heritage, subtle eye shape influence from East Asian ancestry, and slight softness in the lower face from Hispanic/Latin American contribution. The result is a uniquely defined face with geometric precision that reads as intentionally ambiguous — no single heritage dominates, instead creating a cohesive warm-toned complexion that shifts between deep clay and polished copper.', 183, 62, N'Rawboned and angular — lean muscle without softness, the frame of someone who burns calories faster than she replaces them. Shoulders broad but lack bulk; visible muscle definition in forearms and legs suggests constant movement rather than gym discipline.', N'Deep brown, naturally dark with subtle red undertones in direct light', N'Pulled back in a utilitarian braid, sometimes left loose. Practical, never decorative.', N'Long — reaches mid-back when unbraided, but worn tied up 90% of the time', N'Dark brown, alert and flat — the kind of stare that suggests she''s already calculated your threat assessment', N'Rich burnished bronze with warm golden undertones — the result of layered Sub-Saharan, Central Asian, and Middle Eastern ancestry creating a complexion that shifts between deep clay and polished copper depending on light and exertion. No single heritage dominates; instead they blend into a cohesive warm-dark tone that reads as intentionally ambiguous.', N'Angular face with prominent high cheekbones, strong defined jawline, and refined facial structure blending Sub-Saharan bone prominence with Central Asian angular precision and Middle Eastern warmth, softened slightly by Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Minimal grooming — no cosmetics, scars left unsmoothed. Skin shows the wear of irregular sleep and constant low-grade stress; slight dark circles are permanent fixtures. Lips well-defined, mouth set in a default neutral line. Subtle East Asian eye shape carries slight epicanthic fold influence without dominating her phenotype.', N'Chrome visible along both forearms in the form of reinforced wiring and interface ports — synthetic silver-grey metal work visible at wrist and elbow joints, practical rather than ornamental. Neural port at the base of her skull, behind her left ear, marked by a small raised seam and a faint shimmer of subdermal circuitry. Eyes don''t glow, but there''s an almost imperceptible flicker when processing data or making threat assessments. The adrenaline pump augmentation creates subtle tension in chest and shoulders, a readiness that never fully relaxes.', N'Moves with the efficiency of someone who''s trained out of her natural grace — controlled, minimal wasted motion, weight balanced on the balls of her feet even when standing still. Shoulders slightly forward, head slightly cocked, as if always half-turning toward potential threats. Her hands rest naturally at her sides but are never truly still — fingers move in small patterns, testing tension, checking gear. She doesn''t fidget; she calibrates.', N'Tier 3 working-class courier aesthetic — function over fashion, but not poverty-coded. Black synthetic leather jacket (weathered, multiple repair patches, burn mark on the right sleeve), reinforced cargo pants in slate grey with pockets positioned for quick access and gear distribution, worn commuter boots with grippy soles. Thin base layer under the jacket, visible collarbone area for neural port accessibility. No visible jewelry except a thin bracelet on her right wrist — likely serves a functional purpose (timepiece, data interface, or reminder). Bag is a tactical sling pack, dark fabric, custom-modified with hidden compartments and signal-blocking lining.', N'', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amadeo_tamale_nazari');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63c-7bb3-9071-56b3874391f8', N'Cheyenne Subramaniam-Deshpande', N'Cheyenne', N'', N'Subramaniam-Deshpande', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 33, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ashfield — former residential district, half-burned, now squatter territory, near Ashland and Division', N'Network intrusion and digital warfare specialist — netrunner', N'Freelance — Geartown regular', N'Cheyenne Subramaniam-Deshpande is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 33, he has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate him once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He taught himself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know him best. He works as a netrunner out of Ashfield, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Cheyenne Subramaniam-Deshpande has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and he cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Kadiatou Eriksson-Diallo represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons. Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Cheyenne Subramaniam-Deshpande, 178cm lean runner with coiled tension, warm medium-deep brown skin blending South Asian, East Asian, and Sub-Saharan ancestry — high cheekbones, strong angular jawline, dark eyes with amber undertone. Close-cropped dark hair, meticulous grooming. Wearing form-fitting charcoal tactical synth-weave bodysuit with reinforced panels, asymmetrical smartfabric jacket, right forearm bare revealing gunmetal chrome smartgun neural port at wrist with silver filament traces. Visible surgical scar along right temple, subdermal circuitry lattice faintly glowing at neck base, old burn scar on left shoulder blade. Posture compressed and ready, weight on balls of feet, movements economical. Worn Geartown boots. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, near-future tactical gear, no flash, all functional. Moody neon-lit alley or industrial runner safe house, cool blue and amber lighting highlighting chrome augmentations and warm skin tone. Film noir neo-noir atmosphere, ready for action. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfield', N'local', N'Ashfield', N'Predominantly South Asian (66.9%) with significant East Asian (21.3%) and Sub-Saharan African (11.8%) ancestry. Facial structure reflects this primary blend: South Asian bone structure with characteristic high cheekbones and strong jawline, refined by East Asian eye shape and brow geometry. Sub-Saharan African ancestry contributes warmth and depth to melanin expression. Features read as distinctly pan-Asian with warm, luminous undertones — a striking cosmopolitan appearance of mixed global heritage.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with visible musculature — minimal body fat, long limbs, compressed posture suggesting coiled readiness rather than relaxation', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Short, close-cropped, maintained with functional precision', N'Short', N'Dark brown with slight amber undertone', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden and burnished undertones — South Asian melanin base enriched by East Asian depth and Sub-Saharan African warmth, creating a nuanced complexion with subtle luminosity that shifts warmer in direct light', N'Angular face with high, pronounced cheekbones and strong jawline reflecting South Asian primary ancestry with East Asian refinement; brow geometry shows East Asian influence. Skin is clear but marked by surgical augmentation scars along temples and neck; meticulous grooming with no cosmetics or affectation.', N'Right forearm smartgun link with exposed neural interface port at wrist — functional, unadorned chrome. Subdermal circuitry tracery at neck base glows faintly under stress or augmentation activation. No cosmetic chrome; all augmentations are work-driven and visible by necessity rather than aesthetic choice.', N'Carries himself with compressed tension — shoulders slightly forward, spine straight but not rigid. Movements are economical and precise; he doesn''t waste motion. When stationary, weight shifts constantly between balls of feet as if ready to move in any direction. Eyes track stimulus obsessively — reflex testing or paranoia, unclear which.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian runner kit — form-fitting tactical synth-weave bodysuit in charcoal gray with reinforced panels at shoulders and ribs; right forearm left bare to accommodate smartgun interface. Heavy-duty smartfabric jacket with asymmetrical fastening, pockets stuffed with maintenance tools and contract data chips. Worn Geartown-district boots with grip-sole modifications. No corporate branding, no flash — everything is functional and designed for rapid movement or environmental adaptation. Clothing shows signs of regular field use: scuff marks, repaired seams, faint chemical stains suggesting explosive residue or solvents.', N'Kadiatou Eriksson-Diallo betrayed their previous crew to survive a corporate raid. The crew didn''t survive. Nobody in GLMZ knows this.', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cheyenne_subramaniam_deshpande');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a671-7922-ac36-56fc61f611f2', N'Eliud Ibarra-Kowalczyk-Mwangi', N'Eliud', N'', N'Ibarra-Kowalczyk-Mwangi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor — repurposed shipping infrastructure turned black market hub, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Prototype theft and corporate tech acquisition — tech retriever', N'Independent — Lattice territory specialist', N'Eliud Ibarra-Kowalczyk-Mwangi is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 31, the augmentation scarring around her temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see her surpass them. She works as a tech retriever out of Old Harbor, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Eliud Ibarra-Kowalczyk-Mwangi lacks in subtlety, she compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'Nurlan Morita-Antwi represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio. Thermal masking system — body heat signature can be suppressed or spoofed', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'GLMZ operative portrait: a 168cm lean angular woman with rich deep brown skin carrying cool ashy undertones, high sharp cheekbones, broad nasal bridge, fuller lips, almond-shaped brown eyes with slight upward cant. Black hair in tight functional braid pulled back severely. Industrial chrome vocal modulator visible along jawline and throat, augmentation scarring along temples with faint chrome micro-etching beneath skin. Pale burn scar on left inner forearm, deliberate knife scar on right palm. Wearing matte black Kevlar-blend cargo pants, thermal-reactive black jacket with weapon mounts, steel-toed boots. Single silver band on right ring finger. Minimal grooming, no jewelry beyond the band. Posture: economical, controlled, weight balanced with shoulders slightly forward. Expression: steady unblinking gaze suggesting threat assessment. Setting: urban GLMZ corridor, neon-lit background with heat haze shimmer from thermal masking system cycling. Mood: coiled tension, economical efficiency, cold threat. Lighting: sharp neo-noir shadows, cool blue-grey with warm orange neon contrast, chrome hardware catching harsh light. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Complex diaspora blend: Sub-Saharan African (32.7%) provides deep warm brown skin tone and fuller lip structure; Middle Eastern (29.3%) contributes defined facial geometry and distinctive eye shape; Eastern European (20.4%) sharpens cheekbones and introduces cool ashy undertones; Hispanic/Latin American (14.3%) rounds the nasal bridge and adds dimensional warmth; Central Asian (3.3%) traces subtly in eye placement and orbital geometry. The synthesis creates striking angular geometry with rich dimensional depth — a warm deep brown base suffused with cool ashy undertones, high sharp cheekbones balanced against fuller lips, broad nasal bridge with defined mandible, and almond-shaped eyes set with slight upward cant.', 168, 58, N'Lean and angular with visible musculature — swimmer''s shoulders, minimal body fat. Every movement suggests coiled efficiency rather than relaxation.', N'Black with steel-grey undertones from repeated thermal stress near augmentation sites', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid; no ornament, no wasted length', N'Long', N'Deep brown — unaugmented, but the stare is unnerving; pupils track with unnatural precision', N'Rich warm deep brown with subtle cool ashy undertones — dimensional blend creating complex depth and faint chromatic shimmer from thermal masking implant cycling', N'High sharp cheekbones and defined mandible with angular geometry; broad nasal bridge with fuller lips characteristic of Sub-Saharan and Hispanic heritage; almond-shaped eyes with slight upward cant from Middle Eastern and Central Asian ancestry; clear skin marked by augmentation scarring. Fine surgical lines visible along temples and jawline where vocal modulator and thermal masking array were installed; chrome glints faintly beneath skin at these sites. Minimal grooming beyond function — no jewelry, no makeup. Face reads as intentionally unremarkable except for the chrome.', N'Vocal modulator: visible chrome hardware along the jawline and throat, industrial appearance with no aesthetic softening. Thermal masking system: no visible hardware, but skin around her core occasionally shows faint chromatic distortion when the system activates or cycles. The effect is subtle — a shimmer like heat haze, visible only when she''s stationary.', N'Economical and controlled — no wasted motion. She moves like someone counting calories in every gesture. Stands with weight balanced, shoulders slightly forward. When idle, there is visible tension in her hands — fingers flex and reset as if running through muscle memory or code. Her gaze is steady and seldom breaks eye contact; it reads as threat assessment rather than politeness.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian black — fitted Kevlar-blend cargo pants with redundant pockets, black thermal-reactive jacket with concealed weapon mounts, unmarked steel-toed boots broken in past comfort into pure function. Everything is matte black or charcoal to reduce thermal signature. No visible branding except for a faded Lattice territory marker on her jacket cuff — a small embroidered cipher, her affiliation token. She wears minimalist jewelry: a single silver band on her right ring finger (purpose unclear — possibly a memento, possibly functional).', N'', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eliud_ibarra_kowalczyk_mwangi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('ecbe11ee-8ffb-27c6-550a-5701aae724c5', N'Hiroshi An-Saito-Olofsson', N'Hiroshi', N'', N'An-Saito-Olofsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A rented office in Meridian Station, chosen for its neutral-ground status — no corporation claims jurisdiction in the transit nexus, near State and Jackson', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — former Axiom CorpSec Special Investigations Division', N'Hiroshi An-Saito-Olofsson in Axiom CorpSec, rising to Senior Investigator in the Special Investigations Division — the unit that handles crimes too complex or sensitive for regular corporate security. She was good at her job. She was also naive enough to believe that being good at her job meant the job was good.

The break came when she uncovered evidence that her own division was systematically fabricating cases against the Gray Zone residents to meet arrest quotas and justify budget allocations. She reported it through proper channels. The proper channels destroyed the evidence, transferred her to a desk, and began building a case to discredit her. She resigned before they could fire her, took everything she could carry — physically and mentally — and set up shop as a freelance investigator dedicated to the cases CorpSec won''t touch or can''t be trusted with.

Now she operates from Meridian Station, deliberately choosing neutral ground because every corporate territory is hostile territory for her. Her clients are typically people who have been wronged by corporate power and have nowhere else to turn — employees who''ve witnessed crimes, families of people disappeared by CorpSec, whistleblowers who need evidence collected before they''re silenced. She is effective because she knows exactly how the machine works from the inside, and she is dangerous to the corporations because she knows where the bodies are buried. Axiom has made three attempts to buy her silence. The fourth attempt, she suspects, won''t involve money.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hiroshi An-Saito-Olofsson, 2226 neo-noir era. East Asian-dominant features with sharp Eastern European jawline definition and warm Middle Eastern undertones; warm ivory-beige skin with golden highlights. Deep brown analytical eyes with natural epicanthic folds, dark brown hair with silver temples pulled back in tight mid-back braid. Athletic, lean build, 172cm tall. Small scar through left eyebrow. Wearing charcoal synthetic-leather tactical jacket with reinforced elbows, dark cargo pants, polymer-soled boots. Silver analog watch on wrist. Posture: shoulders forward, weight on balls of feet, direct measuring gaze. Professional-tactical styling, no visible augmentations, runs clean and quiet. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon-shadow lighting, cool urban environment, alert and controlled demeanor. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A rented office in Meridian Station', N'local', N'A rented office in Meridian Station', N'East Asian-dominant genetic ancestry (70.6%) with Eastern European (21.0%) and Middle Eastern (8.4%) contributions. Strong Han Chinese bone structure forms the foundation: wide cheekbones, balanced facial proportions, and natural epicanthic eye folds. Eastern European ancestry adds angular definition to the upper face and jawline, while Middle Eastern heritage contributes subtle depth and warmth to the lower face and nasal bridge. The result is a harmonious blend where East Asian features remain primary but are sharpened and enriched by European and Levantine elements—a genetic map of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 172, 68, N'Athletic and lean, muscled in the shoulders and forearms from years of fieldwork — controlled tension in her frame rather than bulk', N'Dark brown with silver threading at the temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid that extends to mid-back; no-nonsense styling', N'Long', N'Deep brown, alert and analytical', N'Warm ivory-beige with golden and olive undertones—East Asian translucence blended with Eastern European fairness and Middle Eastern warmth, creating a complexion with subtle luminosity and even depth. Well-maintained with no visible sun damage.', N'Strong, wide East Asian cheekbones refined by Eastern European angular precision at the jawline. Subtle Levantine fullness in the lower face and around the mouth creates balance against the sharper upper structure. Natural eye fold definition with clean, unadorned features. Small scar through her left eyebrow from a fieldwork incident. No visible sun damage; maintains herself carefully. Overall reading: precise, uncompromising, professionally calibrated.', N'None visible. Her augmentations are subcutaneous: a neural interface array behind her left ear (invisible under hair), optical enhancements (undetectable to casual observation), and an encrypted data vault implanted in her molars. She runs clean and quiet — no chrome, no LEDs, no tells.', N'Moves with deliberate economy. Shoulders slightly forward, weight balanced on the balls of her feet even when seated — someone trained to move quickly if needed. Her gaze is direct and measuring; she watches before she speaks. Tense at baseline, but controlled — the calm of someone who has learned that showing fear is a liability', N'Tier 3 professional-tactical hybrid. Dark neutral tones: charcoal, black, grey. Fitted synthetic-leather jacket with reinforced elbows (Meridian Station brand, durable), functional cargo pants with multiple pockets and tool loops, sturdy polymer-soled boots broken in from field work. A silver pendant watch on her wrist — old, not smart-enabled, deliberately analog. She dresses to move, not to impress. No visible branding except the watch.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hiroshi_an_saito_olofsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5fc-7699-9101-57090995efc1', N'Celio Asomaning-Ito', N'Celio', N'', N'Asomaning-Ito', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 37, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Meridian Station — central transit nexus, neutral ground, near State and Madison', N'Long-range precision fire specialist — sniper', N'Semi-independent — recurring contracts with mid-tier fixers', N'Celio Asomaning-Ito is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 37, the augmentation scarring around her temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ice in the brain — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see her surpass them. She works as a sniper out of Meridian Station, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Celio Asomaning-Ito describe her as a precision instrument — point her at a problem and get out of the way.', N'As a sniper, Ebele Medina-Quaye embodies the tension between independence and isolation. She is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ICE in the brain. Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Celio Asomaning-Ito, 168cm stocky gunsmith with warm bronze skin reflecting East Asian, Southeast Asian, African, and Northern European ancestry. Dark almond eyes set in broad-cheeked, angular face with substantial jawline. Black hair in tight functional braid, silver threading at temples. Temple temples bear dull gunmetal chrome neural dampener visible behind crude surgical scarring. Jagged scar tissue runs left jawline. Faded tattoo on right wrist, burn scarring on right hand. Wearing dark charcoal tactical vest over black synth-cotton layers, grey cargo pants, heavy tactical boots. Standing alert with even weight distribution, slight forward hip lean. Nocturnal fatigue etched into weathered face. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cold overhead warehouse lighting casting sharp shadows, moody atmospheric haze, cinematic realism --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Station', N'local', N'Meridian Station', N'Genuinely global genetic mosaic: East Asian (28.9%) and Southeast Asian (23.4%) form the foundation, creating Pan-Asian facial architecture. Northern European ancestry (20.2%) adds angular bone structure and cool undertones. Sub-Saharan African heritage (16.7%) contributes to feature breadth and warm richness. Hispanic/Latin American (9.2%) and Eastern European (1.6%) complete the blend. The result defies single-origin categorization — almond eyes set in a face with broad cheekbones and substantial jawline, sharp angularity softened by fuller features, cool and warm tones in constant dialogue. Unmistakably GLMZ contemporary.', 168, 78, N'Stocky and dense with lean muscle — built for sustained positioning and recoil absorption rather than speed. Shoulders broad, core compact and rigid. Forearms thick from years of weapon handling and stabilization work.', N'Black with silver-grey threading at temples', N'Pulled back tight in a functional braid, kept off the face', N'Medium', N'Dark brown — natural, no augmentation', N'Warm medium bronze — East Asian golden undertones (28.9%) and Southeast Asian warmth (23.4%) blend with Sub-Saharan African depth (16.7%), tempered by Northern European coolness (20.2%). Latin American ancestry adds subtle luminosity. The result is sophisticated middle-ground: neither warm gold nor deep brown, but balanced bronze that shifts subtly in different light — cool in shadow, warm in direct illumination.', N'Weathered and scarred. Facial structure reflects genetic blend distinctly — prominent almond-shaped eyes from East/Southeast ancestry set deep under pronounced brow ridge (Northern European influence), high and broad cheekbones carrying both Asian and African proportions, substantial jawline that''s simultaneously angular and broad. Dark brown irises contrast sharply against sclera. Skin shows accumulated fatigue — nocturnal living carved into the face, fine lines radiating from eye corners. The face refuses easy categorization, striking precisely because of its genetic honesty.', N'Chrome neural dampener visible at temples as metallic inlays following the scarring — dull gunmetal finish, unadorned. The installation work is clearly visible and intentionally unrefined. No cosmetic covering or blending attempted. Synthetic muscle fiber in legs not visually obvious at first glance but becomes apparent in movement — unnatural smoothness and efficiency in lower body mechanics, particularly in stair avoidance and ground positioning.', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, ready to shift laterally. Movements economical and precise — no wasted motion. When seated, positions herself with clear sight lines and exits in mind. Walks with a slight forward lean from the hips. Noticeably stiff on stairs — the synthetic leg fibers cause her to take them slowly, methodically, which she does without apparent frustration.', N'Tier 4 practical — function over presentation. Dark neutral base layers (charcoal, black, muted grey) in breathable synth-cotton blend. Oversized tactical vest or reinforced jacket in worn charcoal with multiple pockets and modular attachment points — patched multiple times, clearly maintained rather than replaced. Cargo pants in dark grey with thigh pockets for ammunition or tools. Footwear is heavy-soled tactical boots, scuffed and broken in. Minimal jewelry — a single worn silver ring on left hand, possibly crew or family marker. No corporate branding visible. Clothing shows practical damage — minor tears, slight discoloration from equipment oil, the aesthetic of someone who cares about function over upkeep.', N'', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'celio_asomaning_ito');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e0-7dab-a7ef-57287e9ed9f4', N'Amadi Adeyemi-Pathak', N'Amadi', N'', N'Adeyemi-Pathak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, Meridian Core — lives in a company-subsidized flat in Edgewater Prism, near LaSalle and Madison', N'Neural calibrator at Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Aurochs Medical Complex (Tier 3 employee, Neural Calibration Division)', N'Amadi Adeyemi-Pathak is a lean man with the slightly disconnected quality of someone who spends most of his working hours interfaced with other people''s nervous systems. His skin is warm brown, his eyes a natural amber that he has had patterned with fine concentric rings — a diagnostic choice as much as aesthetic, since the rings shift and blur when he is running a deep calibration sync and patients find it useful to watch. His hair is close-cropped and he keeps himself meticulously groomed in the way of someone who distrusts entropy in small things. There is a port array at his left temple, matte black ceramic, and the faint iridescent tracery of calibration leads running beneath the skin of his jaw and neck.

Neurally, Amadi Adeyemi-Pathak is exceptional — his scores on empathic interfacing are in the ninety-fourth percentile for his cohort, which Aurochs considers an asset and which Amadi Adeyemi-Pathak considers a curse he is still learning to manage. He absorbs fragments of his patients'' mental architecture during calibrations: half-memories, emotional textures, phobias that don''t belong to him. He has developed a meticulous post-session decompression ritual and a careful professional detachment that acquaintances mistake for coldness. The truth is closer to the opposite — he feels too much, too accurately, and has built distance as infrastructure. He works hard, is promoted regularly, and drinks more than he should in the evenings.', N'Information source about clients'' neural histories (within ethical limits he can be pressured to breach). His empathic interface ability makes him useful for assessing whether someone is telling the truth. Potential ally or tragic figure depending on what is asked of him.', N'', N'Temple port array (professional-grade neural interface, Helix Biosystems model). Patterned iris implants — concentric amber rings. Sub-dermal calibration leads along jaw and neck. Cortical buffer implant that dampens empathic overflow during sessions (prescribed).', N'Eight-hour shifts in the calibration suites seeing four to six patients — mostly augmentation interference cases, trauma-linked neural misfires, and post-surgical sync adjustments. Evenings alone in his flat with music he doesn''t consciously listen to.', N'Amadi Adeyemi-Pathak, lean 176cm tall neurotechnician with luminous medium-deep golden-brown complexion reflecting Sub-Saharan, South Asian, Northern/Eastern European, and East Asian heritage. Closely cropped dark hair with greying temples, sharp angular cheekbones, deep brown eyes with diagnostic concentric ring implants that shimmer with iridescence. Matte black ceramic port array at left temple with subtle light indicators. Faint opalescent subdermal calibration tracery visible along jaw and neck. Clean-shaven, controlled posture with slight forward cant. Wearing charcoal high-collared medical-grade shirt under dark Aurochs lab coat, brushed-steel biometric bracelet on right wrist. Clinical lighting emphasizing the luminous warmth of his skin against the cool tones of his augmentations. Neo-noir 2220s medical facility aesthetic, focused intensity, slight head tilt as if receiving neural data. Professional, precise, slightly unsettling precision. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Sub-Saharan African (29.7%), South Asian (24.1%), Northern European (22.1%), East Asian (12.2%), Eastern European (11.9%) — a genuinely cosmopolitan blend creating a rich medium-deep complexion. Sub-Saharan ancestry provides deep melanin foundation and warm undertones, bridged by South Asian warmth and tempered by Northern/Eastern European cooler cast. East Asian genetics subtly influence cheekbone prominence and eye geometry. The composite is a luminous golden-brown skin that shifts between warm depth and cool reflection depending on light — simultaneously grounded and ethereal.', 176, 68, N'Lean and angular, with the slight forward-cant posture of someone who spends hours in calibration chairs. Minimal muscle definition — his body is efficient rather than sculpted. Shoulders narrow, hands steady and long-fingered.', N'Dark brown with natural greying at the temples', N'Close-cropped, precisely maintained, no styling product — clinical neatness', N'Short', N'Natural deep brown with patterned concentric ring implants (diagnostic iridescence, rings shift and blur during neural sync)', N'Medium-deep golden brown — a balanced blend of warm Sub-Saharan and South Asian undertones with cooler Northern/Eastern European notes creating sophisticated luminosity. Reads as richly grounded under any lighting, with subtle warmth that survives even harsh fluorescent environments.', N'Smooth, meticulously groomed, clean-shaven daily. Cheekbones show distinct angularity reflecting East Asian ancestral structure, while fuller lower-face contours suggest South Asian heritage. Skin maintains controlled, polished quality — no weathering or visible blemishes. The golden-brown tone creates natural warmth that paradoxically contrasts with and humanizes his clinical precision.', N'Left temple port array is the most obvious — matte black ceramic with subtle light indicators. Subdermal leads visible as a faint iridescent web along jaw and neck when he turns his head. Eyes immediately draw attention — the concentric ring pattern reads as intentional, diagnostic, slightly unsettling. No obvious limb augmentation.', N'Economical and controlled. He moves with deliberate precision — no wasted motion. When listening, he has a habit of tilting his head slightly toward his left (port-side), as if receiving data. His eyes focus with unusual intensity. In moments of fatigue, his shoulders curl inward. When nervous, his right hand traces the calibration leads on his neck absently.', N'Tier 3 medical professional — clean, functional, muted. Favors dark turtlenecks or high-collared medical-grade shirts (conceals the leads while maintaining mobility). Charcoal grey Aurochs-branded lab coat when at work, tailored to his frame. Outside work: dark jeans, black thermal layers, a worn leather jacket from a higher-tier period he doesn''t discuss. Shoes are always clean, usually black or grey. Jewelry: only a thin brushed-steel bracelet with embedded biometric readout on his right wrist. Everything chosen to minimize distraction — his clothes are infrastructure, not expression.', N'During a calibration six months ago he encountered a patient''s memory of witnessing a Helix Biosystems executive ordering a cover-up of a defective implant batch. He didn''t report it. He copied it. He doesn''t know what to do with what he has.', N'Precise and clinical in professional mode; shifts to something more searching and uncertain in personal conversation — uses technical metaphor when emotional', N'Measured, with deliberate pauses — trained to be soothing, which sometimes reads as patronizing', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amadi_adeyemi_pathak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5db-742d-85bb-5774f2af90a2', N'Burak Chowdhury-Wickramasinghe', N'Burak', N'', N'Chowdhury-Wickramasinghe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Corridor, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Forensic Technician, Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security Evidence Division', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division — Evidence Division, Grand Corridor Central Processing', N'Burak Chowdhury-Wickramasinghe is precise in the way that some people are precise — not as a personality choice but as a metabolic fact, a condition of being. They are of moderate height and slight build, with deep brown skin, natural hair grown out to a medium length they wear in a carefully arranged protective style. Their most striking feature is purely cosmetic: bioluminescent freckles across the bridge of their nose and upper cheekbones, in a warm amber-gold, a gift to themselves on their thirtieth birthday. They dress in neat, unremarkable clothing and always, always wear gloves — not from a contamination protocol they''ve imported home, but because they find the sensation of touching most surfaces without them distracting.

They are the Arcturus Civil Security Evidence Division''s most technically accomplished analyst and their most quietly difficult employee. They have a gift for finding what the evidence says rather than what the investigation wants it to say, which has produced thirteen cases where their analysis materially contradicted the arresting officer''s narrative. Four of those cases resulted in charges being dropped. The other nine resulted in paperwork, meetings, and a standing low-level friction with supervisors that neither side has ever directly addressed. Chiamaka does not care. The evidence is the evidence.', N'Technical expert and potential whistleblower — someone who can tell players what the physical evidence actually shows versus what the official record claims. A source of forensic information, a person who can authenticate or discredit evidence, and a character whose professional integrity has made them quietly vulnerable within the institution.', N'', N'Haptic sensitivity modulation implants in both hands (reduces ambient tactile input; improves fine-detail analysis precision). Olfactory enhancement mod for trace chemical analysis. Cosmetic: bioluminescent amber-gold freckles across nose and cheekbones.', N'Arrives at Grand Corridor Central Processing by 0800, suits up for the lab, works through the evidence queue with methodical focus. Takes lunch outside when weather permits — they need the open air. Returns, finishes the queue, writes reports with a care for language that their supervisors find excessive and that has twice been cited in legal proceedings as unusually exculpatory in its precision.', N'Burak Chowdhury-Wickramasinghe, 168cm tall forensic specialist with slight wiry build, standing in a crime lab under cool fluorescent lighting. Warm deep golden-brown skin tone with South Asian-dominant features refined by East Asian heritage and Northern European bone definition. Deep brown alert eyes, clear complexion with natural warmth. Hair in protective shoulder-length braids arranged in a crown pattern. Subtle bioluminescent amber-gold freckles constellation across nose and cheekbones pulsing faintly in low light. Wearing clean Arcturus Civil Security lab coat, neutral gray underlayer, sturdy flat shoes, thin leather gloves on hands. Upright economical posture, focused and still. Plain silver ring on left hand. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, forensic evidence work, cool atmospheric lighting, professional and functional aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Corridor', N'local', N'Grand Corridor', N'Predominantly South Asian (70.7%) with significant East Asian (21.1%) and Northern European (8.2%) ancestry. The South Asian majority establishes warm, rich golden undertones throughout the complexion, while East Asian heritage contributes subtle refinement to eye shape, cheekbone prominence, and facial structure. Northern European ancestry adds slight bone definition and facial angularity, creating a harmonious blend of warmth, clarity, and structural definition.', 168, 58, N'Slight and wiry, with the economy of movement that comes from precision work. No excess mass; their frame reads as someone who exists efficiently.', N'Natural deep brown', N'Protective braids arranged in a crown pattern, meticulously maintained', N'Medium (shoulder-length when fully extended)', N'Deep brown, alert and focusing', N'Warm medium-to-deep complexion with rich golden undertones characteristic of South Asian heritage, subtly enhanced by East Asian warmth and Northern European clarity. The result is a luminous, glowing tone that deepens slightly under bioluminescent augmentation.', N'Clear and unblemished with naturally warm, saturated undertones reflecting South Asian-dominant ancestry. Cheekbone structure shows defined prominence from the blend of East Asian refinement and South Asian bone structure, with subtle angular clarity contributed by Northern European heritage. The overall facial architecture balances warmth with definition. Minimal makeup or grooming beyond the functional. Face carries the neutrality of someone who does not perform emotion for strangers.', N'Bioluminescent freckles are the only visible modification. Haptic sensitivity modulation and olfactory enhancement are subcutaneous/internal and show no external signs. Hands are always gloved — nitrile or thin leather — which conceals any implant integration points.', N'Upright, economical, deliberate. They move as if each motion has been calculated for efficiency. Hands are steady; there is no fidgeting or wasted gesture. When focusing on evidence work, they enter a state of complete stillness except for the precise movements required by the task.', N'Tier 3 utilitarian. Clean lab coat (ADS Civil Security issue, well-maintained), neutral underlayers (grays, blacks, dark blues), sturdy flat shoes designed for long standing. No jewelry except a single plain silver ring on their left hand. No visible corpo branding or luxury indicators. Appearance suggests someone who has prioritized function over identity expression.', N'They have a personal encrypted record of every case where their analysis was materially altered in the official report before going to prosecution — seventeen instances over eight years. They have never used this record. They are not sure who they would give it to. They add to it with the careful precision they apply to everything.', N'Precise, technical, occasionally formal to the point of seeming stilted. Dislikes vague language intensely and will quietly correct it. Warmer registers emerge slowly in trusted company.', N'Even and measured. Pauses carefully. Rarely uses filler words.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'burak_chowdhury_wickramasinghe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a692-7866-b064-5775a841a5f4', N'Chinara Halverson', N'Chinara', N'', N'Halverson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Primarily field-based in Auburn Grist and Chatham Flats; maintains a desk at the University Spine''s Institute for Urban Social Research in the Meridian Core, near State and Jackson', N'Sociologist studying social stratification and community formation in the Gray Zone zones', N'University Spine — Institute for Urban Social Research (tenured, Tier 3 salary); board member of the Auburn Grist Community Advocacy Coalition in a personal capacity', N'Chinara Halverson looks like someone who has been places and come back changed by them in ways she wears openly. She is a large, broad-shouldered woman with deep black skin and grey natural hair cut close, with reading lines around her eyes and a scar along her left jawline from an incident in the Gray Zone she does not discuss. Her Yoruba-Icelandic heritage is everywhere in her face — the strong jaw, the wide forehead, the surprising pale hazel of her eyes, which are the thing people remember. She wears functional clothes that can survive a twelve-hour fieldwork day and carries a physical notebook alongside her data equipment, which her graduate students treat as an affectation and which she defends loudly and regularly.

She has spent the last two decades embedded in the lower-tier communities of GLMZ''s peripheral zones — the Gray Zone communities, reclamation zones, the edges of the city that corponation sociology tends to treat as problems to model rather than people to know. Her work has produced four books that have made her genuinely influential in academic circles and genuinely respected in the communities she studies, a combination that is rarer than it should be. She is direct, large in presence, quick to laugh and quicker to call out what she considers intellectual dishonesty. She is also, under the professional armor, a person who has seen a great deal of suffering and carried it without adequate resources for processing it.', N'Deep community knowledge source; introduction to the Gray Zone communities for outsiders; potential advocate or complication when academic and community interests diverge; her research could be evidence for or against any number of political claims about the lower city', N'', N'Subdermal audio recorder (passive, research tool, requires consent activation); color-changing hair pigment (she leaves it grey — the mod was installed at her community''s insistence as a safety tool during fieldwork and she never uses the color function); no other modifications', N'Several days per week in the field — attending community meetings, conducting interviews, sitting in spaces and observing with the kind of attention that is its own form of respect. Administrative days at the university involve a great deal of arguing with the ethics board about fieldwork protocols she finds paternalistic, and mentoring graduate students she takes seriously.', N'GLMZ field operative Chinara Halverson, tall broad-shouldered woman with rich warm brown skin blending East Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, close-cropped grey salt-and-pepper hair, deep brown eyes with amber warmth. Prominent high cheekbones with subtle epicanthic influence, strong jawline marked by pale 8cm scar along left side, weathered face with deep laugh lines and sun-exposure patina, callused right hand. Wearing worn functional Tier 3 canvas cargo pants, layered charcoal technical top, thin waterproof field jacket, beaten Córdoba boots, carries Faraday-lined satchel. Titanium band on left ring finger. Posture radiates earned authority and competence, direct gaze, economical gestures. Lower-tier zone setting, dim industrial lighting with hints of neon, serious focused expression, two decades of fieldwork evident in bearing. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Primarily field-based in Auburn Grist and Chatham Flats; maintains a desk at the University Spine''s Institute for Urban Social Research in the Meridian Core', N'local', N'Primarily field-based in Auburn Grist and Chatham Flats; maintains a desk at the University Spine''s Institute for Urban Social Research in the Meridian Core', N'Complex multi-continental ancestry reflecting East Asian (32.1%), South Asian (26.1%), Sub-Saharan African (26.0%), Southeast Asian (6.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (5.3%), and Eastern European (4.0%) genetic background — a striking blend evident in facial structure and skin tone that defies simple categorization', 178, 89, N'Large-framed and broad-shouldered with substantial presence; carries weight in her core and upper body with the ease of someone who moves through physical space with purpose and without apology', N'Natural grey', N'Close-cropped, neat, with visible salt-and-pepper texture', N'Short', N'Deep brown with warm amber undertones', N'Rich warm brown complexion — melanized with golden and olive undertones from the convergence of East Asian, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian ancestry', N'Distinctive facial structure reflecting her multi-continental genetic ancestry — high, prominent cheekbones with East Asian cant, broad forehead, strong defined jaw. Wide-set eyes with subtle epicanthic influence. Face marked by weathering consistent with two decades of outdoor fieldwork; deep reading lines radiating from eyes; skin shows sun exposure and the patina of time spent in lower-tier zones without cosmetic intervention', N'None visible. Subdermal audio recorder is completely internal; color-changing hair pigment dormant and undetectable by sight.', N'Moves with deliberate authority without aggression — shoulders back, head level, direct eye contact. Sits in interviews with the physical patience of someone trained to occupy silence. Gestures are economical but expressive. Her presence commands a room not through performance but through evident competence and earned respect.', N'Functional Tier 3 workwear — heavy-duty canvas cargo pants or reinforced denim, technical layered tops in muted colors (charcoal, slate, cream), waterproof field jacket worn thin from use. Worn Córdoba-make boots suitable for long fieldwork. Carries a Faraday-lined satchel containing physical notebooks, data terminals, and community liaison materials. No corporate branding; all clothing chosen for durability and practicality over status. Minimal jewelry — a worn titanium band on left ring finger, possibly commemorative.', N'She has been approached by Tessera''s social analytics division, who want to license her community trust network data to improve their ''community engagement'' targeting. She has refused. But in refusing, she realized her data exists and could be subpoenaed or stolen — and that she has never told the communities she works with how thoroughly she has documented them. She is trying to figure out how to tell them without destroying twenty years of trust.', N'Plain language by default, with sudden precise academic formulation when she''s making an argument she wants to stick; uses Yoruba phrases occasionally, naturally, without translation', N'Deliberate and spacious; she lets silence sit after statements because she means them and isn''t worried about filling the air', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chinara_halverson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a3-758b-8082-57979bd63b17', N'Anas Solberg', N'Anas', N'', N'Solberg', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 56, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone lower levels — her workshop is inside a legitimate print-shop called Meridian Keepsakes in the Gray Zone''s Level 3 commercial strip, near Ashland and Division', N'Identity fabricator and document forger working from the Gray Zone lower levels', N'Independent operator — has professional relationships with several criminal networks but belongs to none of them', N'Anas Solberg is a small, round-faced woman in her mid-fifties with the unhurried quality of someone who has already survived things that should have killed her. Her skin is deep brown and she wears her grey-streaked hair in long thin braids she pins up during work hours and lets fall loose on the rare occasion she relaxes. Her fingers are perennially stained with chromatic ink residue in colors that shift with the angle of light — an occupational mark she stopped trying to remove decades ago. Her eyes have patterned irises: a geneware mod that prints faint text-like symbols in the iris ring, which she had installed as a joke about her profession and has kept because she''s grown fond of it.

She has been doing this work for thirty years and has the professional satisfaction of a master craftsperson. Adefunke does not rush, does not cut corners, and charges accordingly. She refers to her forgeries as ''documents'' and to real identity papers as ''originals,'' a distinction she maintains with dry humor. She is not ideological about her work — she doesn''t particularly care whether her clients are refugees, criminals, or corporate embarrassments, as long as their Quanta are real and they don''t bring surveillance to her door. She is, however, one of the few people in the Gray Zone''s lower levels who will offer a genuine discount to people fleeing documented abuse, which she doesn''t advertise and explains, when pressed, as ''good for the market.''', N'Essential service provider for anyone who needs identity work — new papers, altered records, corponation employment histories, citizenship documentation. Also a source of information about who in the Gray Zone has needed a new identity recently and why.', N'', N'The patterned iris geneware (text-symbol print, cosmetic). A memory-enhancement implant that gives her eidetic recall for visual detail — originally for professional accuracy, now general purpose. Slight subvocal transmitter used to communicate with her assistant without speaking aloud.', N'She opens Meridian Keepsakes at 0900, handles legitimate print orders until noon — she takes this seriously and does good work — then closes for ''inventory'' from 1300-1700 which is her real working hours. She eats dinner alone with a physical book, an affectation she leans into deliberately.', N'Anas Solberg, 155cm compact figure with warm medium-brown skin blending Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, broad cheekbones, round face, dark brown hair with grey threading worn in long braids pinned up, deep brown eyes with faint symbolic text geneware in the iris. Seated at precision work in a dimly lit neo-noir workspace, wearing a grey linen overshirt over charcoal long-sleeved shirt, neutral tones. Her hands show iridescent chromatic ink stains in blues, greens, magentas with micro-abrasions from decades of detailed work. Meditative stillness, careful posture, unhurried deliberate movement. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, soft LED work-lighting, patient concentrated expression, Tier 4 practical grooming, silver ring visible, reading glasses on chain nearby. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (64.4%), with significant Hispanic/Latin American (19.9%) and Sub-Saharan African (15.7%) ancestry — a product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The genetic blend expresses as warm medium-brown skin with golden and subtle olive undertones, broad Southeast Asian-influenced cheekbones softened by fuller facial structure from African heritage, and rounded face shape reflecting the harmonious integration of all three ancestry groups.', 155, 68, N'Round and compact, soft through the middle with the settled posture of someone who spends long hours seated at precision work. No visible muscle definition but solid, grounded presence.', N'Dark brown with natural grey threading throughout', N'Long thin braids, typically pinned up in a loose crown during work hours; worn loose down the back and shoulders when off-duty', N'Long', N'Deep brown with patterned iris geneware — faint text-like symbols printed across the iris ring in shifting chromatic inks', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones, reflecting the balanced blend of Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry', N'Round face with broad Southeast Asian-influenced cheekbones balanced by fuller facial structure characteristic of African heritage, warmed by Hispanic/Latin American undertones. Slight creasing at the eyes and mouth from decades of focused concentration and dry amusement. Skin well-maintained despite age — careful grooming without vanity. No makeup. Balanced blend of ancestral features creating a distinctly mixed-heritage appearance with consistent warm undertones throughout.', N'The patterned iris geneware is immediately noticeable in direct eye contact — faint symbolic text appears to float in the iris ring. Otherwise no visible chrome or external modifications. The subvocal transmitter and memory-enhancement implant are subcutaneous.', N'Deliberately unhurried. Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, minimal gesturing. When seated at work, she achieves an almost meditative stillness. Walks slowly, observantly. Her bearing suggests someone who has learned that patience is both a skill and a survival strategy.', N'Tier 4 practical — well-maintained but unpretentious. Favors long-sleeved work shirts in neutral tones (grey, charcoal, muted green) that hide the ink stains, paired with dark trousers. A fitted grey linen overshirt she wears unbuttoned serves as her professional uniform. Closed-toe work shoes, scuffed leather, comfortable. Outside work hours: loose cardigans, reading glasses on a beaded chain, minimal jewelry beyond a single silver ring. Everything is clean and durable; nothing is new.', N'She has been maintaining a false identity for herself — ''Mira Volkov,'' a retired schoolteacher in Clearpath — for twenty-two years as an exit strategy. Mira Volkov has a pension, an apartment, and a social history. Adefunke has never used her and isn''t sure she ever will.', N'Dry, precise, occasionally archaic — she learned professional vocabulary from old technical manuals and it shows', N'Unhurried and even, with a very slight accent she couldn''t place herself if asked. Pauses feel like decisions rather than hesitations.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anas_solberg');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6bc-7f0d-afd7-581af7d10bc7', N'Daichi Larsdóttir', N'Daichi', N'', N'Larsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Corridor — operates from a rented stall near the junction of three transit lines, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Pilgrimage guide and dream interpreter', N'Independent — relationships with most major shrine keepers and temple administrators across the city', N'Daichi Larsdóttir is rangy and perpetually in motion, with warm amber-brown skin, a scatter of freckles across their nose and cheekbones, and hair that color-shifts between deep burgundy and burnt orange on a slow cycle — a mid-tier cosmetic mod they maintain scrupulously even when they can''t afford other things. They have the kind of face that reads as younger than it is until they make eye contact, at which point it reads as older. They wear layers even in the heat, always — a practical necessity, since Grand Corridor''s climate control is notoriously unreliable, but also a signature.

They have been guiding pilgrims through GLMZ''s informal spiritual circuit for six years: the six major E.L.F. shrines, the chrome prayer temples, the memory walls, the three sites considered genuinely haunted by consensus. They are agnostic about what any of it means and absolutely committed to making sure people arrive safely, are treated fairly, and understand what they''re walking into. The dream interpretation service is separate and newer — it began when a pilgrim described a recurring dream on a long walking route and Daichi Larsdóttir found themselves making connections they hadn''t expected. Word spread. They are still not sure they believe in any of it, but they have a disconcerting hit rate.', N'Mobile information network; can introduce players to any spiritual location in the city; dream interpretation creates a vector for cryptic but accurate information delivery; knows everyone on the pilgrimage circuit', N'', N'Color-shifting hair (burgundy to burnt orange cycle, cosmetic geneware), lightweight flexible knee braces (practical medical, both knees from years of walking hard floors)', N'Three to four pilgrimages per week, each four to eight hours; dream interpretation by appointment, usually evenings at the stall; spends remaining time updating their hand-drawn route maps and arguing with shrine keepers about updated offerings protocols.', N'Daichi Larsdóttir, tall lean figure with deep warm tan skin and golden-bronze undertones, high sculpted cheekbones blending Southeast Asian and Indigenous American facial structure, scattered freckles across nose. Shoulder-length wavy hair in deep burgundy shifting to burnt orange (cosmetic geneware), half-pinned with practical clips. Warm amber-brown eyes with steady deliberate gaze. Wearing layered practical clothes: synth-cotton base, mid-weight overshirt, long-line utility vest with visible hand-sewn pockets, worn reliable boots laced tight. Thin matte-finish flexible knee braces visible at inner knee. Faint temple scar barely visible. Perpetually fidgeting with maps, efficient posture with slight forward lean. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, standing in shrine corridor with neon-lit passages, warm practical lighting catching the luminous depth of skin tone and shifting hair iridescence. Worn but meticulously maintained gear. Urban pilgrimage guide aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Corridor', N'local', N'Grand Corridor', N'Southeast Asian dominant (34.6%) forming the primary skeletal and tonal foundation, with substantial Indigenous American (26.1%) contribution shaping facial geometry and cheekbone structure. Sub-Saharan African ancestry (14.6%) enriches skin depth and warmth, while Hispanic/Latin American (8.7%), East Asian (8.4%), and South Asian (7.6%) components create subtle layering in eye shape, facial proportions, and undertone complexity. The result is a warm, multivalent phenotype where Southeast Asian bone structure and luminous depth blend seamlessly with Indigenous American facial width and definition, Sub-Saharan African richness in complexion, and East Asian eye characteristics.', 178, 68, N'Rangy and lean with wiry muscle definition from constant walking; long-limbed with a slightly forward-leaning posture from years of navigating crowded corridors and uneven shrine grounds', N'Color-shifting cycle between deep burgundy and burnt orange (cosmetic geneware maintained on 72-hour cycle)', N'Shoulder-length, frequently braided or half-pinned with practical clips; texture appears naturally wavy with slight curl', N'Medium', N'Warm amber-brown with a slight ring of darker brown at the iris', N'Deep warm tan with golden-bronze undertones, layered complexity from Southeast Asian base enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth, Indigenous American warmth, and South Asian undertones; medium-high saturation with luminous, dimensional quality', N'High, sculpted cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian and Indigenous American facial structure; warm brown complexion with subtle mid-face width characteristic of Indigenous American ancestry. Scattered freckles across nose and upper cheeks from Sub-Saharan African and East Asian heritage contributions. Face reads young until direct eye contact, then shifts to something older and more weathered; skin shows minor sun damage and occasional dehydration lines from long indoor/outdoor transitions in GLMZ climate. Lower face shows refined definition balanced by middle-face proportions.', N'Color-shifting hair is the primary visible mod — noticeably artificial in its precision and cycle consistency. Lightweight flexible knee braces visible only when sitting or if clothing shifts; they appear as thin synthetic material along the inner knee, matte-finish, nearly skin-tone matched but clearly not organic.', N'Perpetually in motion even when stationary — fidgets with maps, adjusts layers, scans surroundings. Walks with a measured, efficient pace that prioritizes even weight distribution across both knees; movement is economical but not rushed. Eye contact is deliberate and sustained, which contrasts with their otherwise fidgety energy.', N'Tier 3 practical layering; typically wears a thin base layer (thermal-regulating synth-cotton blend), a mid-weight overshirt or jacket, and a long-line utility vest with hand-sewn pockets for maps and offerings. Fabrics are durable but show wear; colors tend toward earth tones and muted jewel tones that complement the shifting hair. Feet are always in reliable boots, laced tight, worn smooth from constant use. They maintain these pieces meticulously despite limited Φ, treating them as tools.', N'One of their recurring dream interpretations — given to a pilgrim two years ago — was so precise about future events that it scared them into keeping a private record of every interpretation since. The record shows a pattern they cannot explain and have not told anyone about. Three interpretations have described events that later happened to people who were never the original dreamer.', N'Quick and associative — they make lateral connections out loud, which can sound scattered until the point lands; code-switches between formal pilgrimage language and street Meridian slang', N'Fast, slightly overlapping itself, with sudden complete stops when they hit something they want to think about', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'daichi_larsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d0-7d40-8c8f-5827f3ef0199', N'Bugra Haraldsen-Larsdóttir-Bergqvist', N'Bugra', N'', N'Haraldsen-Larsdóttir-Bergqvist', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, sub-basement venue called The Marrow, near Western and Division', N'Underground sound sculptor and noise musician', N'Independent; The Marrow venue co-owner; loose affiliation with Highland Park Autonomous Zone arts council', N'Bugra Haraldsen-Larsdóttir-Bergqvist is short and powerfully built, with skin the color of walnut bark and a close-cropped natural that''s gone completely silver. Her face is mapped with deep laugh lines and a scar that cuts through her left eyebrow where someone threw a bottle at a performance in 2178. She wears industrial hearing-protection as a necklace when not performing, and her forearms are covered in dense geometric tattoos she did herself — each one a sonic diagram of a piece she''s composed. Her irises have been modded to display waveform patterns when she''s listening hard, which is almost always.

Bugra Haraldsen-Larsdóttir-Bergqvist has been making noise music in Meridian''s underground for twenty-three years and has the absolute authority of someone who has outlasted every trend. She builds her instruments from urban salvage — pipe resonators, scavenged transit-system speakers, dead ELF hardware repurposed as audio processors — and performs in venues that hold forty people at most. She is famously unwilling to record her work commercially, famously generous to young artists who can''t pay rent, and famously capable of drinking anyone in Hamtramck under the table. She is exactly as difficult as she needs to be and not a nanometer more.', N'Information hub for the underground arts scene; keeper of institutional memory for twenty years of city history; provides access to The Marrow as a venue and meeting space; can connect characters to the Highland Park Autonomous Zone''s informal power structure.', N'', N'Waveform-display iris modification (cosmetic), cochlear enhancement implant (allows her to perceive subsonic and ultrasonic frequencies — practical necessity given her work), subdermal vibration sensors in palms', N'Mornings salvaging materials from Hamtramck''s scrap markets; afternoons building and testing instruments in The Marrow''s back workshop; evenings either performing or running the venue for whoever''s on stage that night.', N'Bugra Haraldsen-Larsdóttir-Bergqvist, 158cm tall, compact dense-muscled frame, dark rich medium-brown skin with golden undertones, defined high cheekbones, weathered complexion with laugh lines, short silver-white close-cropped natural fade hair, dark brown eyes with subtle waveform patterns cycling across irises, diagonal 4cm white scar through left eyebrow, dense black geometric sonic tattoos covering both forearms with spirals and frequency grids, industrial hearing-protection necklace, faint subcutaneous scarring on inner palms. Wearing scuffed unlaced steel-toed boots, charcoal reinforced canvas work pants with solder stains, muted rolled-sleeve cotton shirt exposing forearm tattoos, worn heavy canvas jacket with defunct venue patches. Economical grounded posture, expressive hands tracing sonic patterns in air. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, workshop or underground venue lighting, neon and tungsten casting shadows across her weathered features, atmospheric industrial setting, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Complex blend of Sub-Saharan African (32.4%), Northern European (31.1%), Southeast Asian (28.4%), and Middle Eastern (8.1%) ancestry. Her genetic makeup reflects the Ubiquitous Diaspora—a striking multi-continental synthesis. The substantial Sub-Saharan African and Southeast Asian components dominate her facial structure with defined cheekbones and balanced width, while Northern European ancestry contributes bone structure refinement and the Northern European-Southeast Asian combination creates subtle eye shape characteristics. Middle Eastern heritage adds warmth and depth to her overall appearance. This is someone whose ancestry genuinely spans from Scandinavia to the Horn of Africa to Southeast Asia to the Levant.', 158, 68, N'Compact and densely muscled; thick through the shoulders and core from decades of lifting salvage and operating percussion instruments. No excess fat. Wiry strength rather than bulk.', N'Silver-white, natural', N'Close-cropped natural fade, maintained short against her scalp', N'Short', N'Dark brown with visible waveform patterns cycling across the iris when focusing intently', N'Rich medium-deep warm brown with golden undertones—the luminous depth created by Sub-Saharan African and Southeast Asian heritage as the dominant genetic base, warmed further by Northern European and Middle Eastern ancestry, creating visual warmth that shifts subtly in different light.', N'Weathered and lined with high, defined cheekbones and facial width characteristic of Sub-Saharan and Southeast Asian heritage, balanced by Northern European bone structure refinement. Laugh lines radiate from the corners of her eyes and mouth, suggesting a lifetime of expression. Skin bears the texture of someone who works outdoors and underground in equal measure. Minimal makeup; no vanity grooming. Subtle Middle Eastern warmth visible in cheek and jaw definition.', N'Waveform-display irides that cycle and shift subtly when she''s listening or concentrating. Industrial-grade hearing-protection equipment worn as a necklace when not in use — custom-molded, clearly well-maintained. Faint subcutaneous scarring visible on inner palms where vibration sensors were implanted, most noticeable when her hands are in certain light.', N'Economical and grounded; moves like someone accustomed to navigating tight spaces and uneven industrial terrain. Shoulders slightly forward from years at workbenches. Hands are expressive and precise — she gestures while speaking, often unconsciously tracing sonic patterns in the air. When listening, her entire body goes still; she leans into sound rather than away from it.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian; function over presentation. Heavy canvas work pants (usually black or charcoal) with reinforced knees and multiple pockets, typically splattered with solder, rust, and unidentifiable workshop residue. Loose linen or cotton shirts in muted colors, sleeves rolled or cut off to show forearm tattoos. Scuffed steel-toed boots, often unlaced. A heavy canvas or leather jacket when venturing into Hamtramck proper — old, worn to a soft finish, covered in various pins and patches from defunct venues. All clothing shows the patina of genuine use, not aesthetic choice.', N'The decade-long composition she keeps referencing — she has four minutes of it completed and has been unable to continue for three years. She tells no one because her identity is inseparable from being The Artist Who Is Always Working.', N'Direct and unadorned, full of technical acoustic terminology and Hamtramck slang. Swears enthusiastically. Uses Irish and Congolese French expressions she picked up from her grandparents.', N'Fast when excited, slow and deliberate when angry. Laughs at her own jokes before finishing them.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bugra_haraldsen_larsd_ttir_bergqvist');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a61f-7860-8de7-58494ff4fec2', N'Asantewaa Chowdhury', N'Asantewaa', N'', N'Chowdhury', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 68, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, the sprawling pipe-folk encampment called Bellows Town, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Elder pipe-folk patriarch and keeper of oral tunnel history', N'Bellows Town pipe-folk community; elder neutral party among Undertow clans; The Undertow', N'Asantewaa Chowdhury is a man who looks like he was carved from the same material as the tunnels — his skin is the brown-grey of old concrete, deeply lined, and perpetually damp at the temples from the humidity of Bellows Town. He is larger than you''d expect someone who has spent decades in low-clearance tunnels to be: broad across the shoulders, thick-necked, with hands so calloused they look armored. One leg was crushed in a pressure-seal failure forty years ago and never properly repaired; he walks with a rocking gait and a carved ferroceramic cane he calls his Third Opinion. His eyes are undmodified and dark brown, and his gaze carries the particular weight of someone who has outlived many people he loved and is not surprised by anything anymore.

He is the closest thing Bellows Town has to a leader, though he would reject the title. He mediates disputes between pipe-folk clans, arbitrates resource-sharing on food and water taps, and is the living archive of Deepwell Station''s last sixty years — collapses, floods, disappearances, treaties between tunnel communities. He is warm in the way of someone who has no energy left for performance; he will feed a stranger without asking questions and he will also tell that stranger an uncomfortable truth without softening it.', N'Lore source for tunnel history and underworld geography; faction mediator; can grant or withhold access to pipe-folk resources and knowledge; his approval is social currency in the deep levels', N'', N'None — he is philosophically opposed to augmentation, viewing it as a surface-world dependency that creates vulnerabilities underground; his cane is the only technology he trusts', N'Wakes early to walk Bellows Town''s perimeter — he says the settlement tells him its mood through the sounds the pipes make. Spends mornings in arbitration or teaching younger pipe-folk tunnel repair skills. Evenings are for storytelling and the careful rationing of a small still-fermenting brew he makes from fungal mash.', N'Asantewaa Chowdhury, 56-year-old neo-noir tunnel worker, deep warm bronze skin with blended South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic, and Middle Eastern phenotype. Tall weathered man 188cm with powerful shoulders, thick neck, left leg visibly atrophied. Grey-white hair with dark brown roots, short-cropped and damp at temples. Dark unmodified brown eyes, deeply lined face with pronounced cheekbones and strong jawline, perpetually humid-dampened at jaw and temples, sparse salt-and-pepper stubble. Extensive pale scarring on both palms from pressure-seal tunnel work, deep discolored scar on left shin from decades-old failure. Faded abstract geometric tattoo on left chest. Wearing worn brown and grey utilitarian layers—heavy canvas long-coat over thin undershirts, reinforced knee patches, split-leather boots resoled multiple times. Carrying hand-carved ferroceramic cane worn smooth by decades of use. Pronounced rocking gait, settled posture, direct unflinching gaze. Bellows Town humidity, dim industrial lighting, early 2200s near-future megacity setting, weathered and time-worn like aged leather. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'South Asian (40%), Sub-Saharan African (32.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (21.8%), and Middle Eastern (5.5%) ancestry—a true diaspora phenotype. The genetic blend creates a rich, complex appearance: deep warm bronze undertones from South Asian and Sub-Saharan African baseline, enriched by the warmer, earthier tones of Hispanic/Latino genetics and subtle Middle Eastern influence. The result is an earthy, weathered complexion that speaks to global ancestry rather than singular continental origin.', 188, 104, N'Broad-shouldered and thick-necked despite decades in confined spaces; age has not diminished his mass, only redistributed it — chest and shoulders still powerful, abdomen thick with settled weight. His left leg is noticeably thinner than the right, atrophied from decades of reduced use.', N'Grey-white with residual dark brown at the roots', N'Short, cropped close to the scalp, streaked with moisture-darkened sections', N'Short', N'Dark brown, unmodified', N'Deep warm bronze—earthy and rich with complexity from blended ancestry. The baseline carries the warm undertones of South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, layered with the golden-brown warmth of Hispanic/Latino genetics and subtle Middle Eastern influence. Weathered and damp-darkened at temples and jaw from Bellows Town''s constant humidity; texture rough and time-worn, like aged leather.', N'Deeply lined face; crow''s feet, forehead creases, and nasolabial folds cut deep; perpetually damp at the temples and along the jawline from Bellows Town''s constant humidity; sparse beard stubble, salt-and-pepper, often unshaven; skin texture rough and weather-stained, hands especially calloused and grey at the knuckles. Facial structure reflects blended heritage in pronounced, well-defined cheekbone geometry characteristic of South Asian ancestry combined with strong Sub-Saharan African jawline and Sub-Saharan African-influenced facial depth.', N'None. He carries a hand-carved ferroceramic cane (called ''Third Opinion'') with grip marks worn smooth by decades of use; this is his only trust technology.', N'Walks with a pronounced rocking gait due to his compromised left leg — the cane absorbs significant weight. His upper body compensates with slight lateral sway. Despite this, he moves with deliberate purpose; no wasted motion. When seated, he sits low and deep, as if settling into weight. His gaze is steady and unflinching; he makes direct eye contact and holds it without challenge.', N'Tier 5 utilitarian pipe-folk: layers of durable, patched fabric in browns and greys — a heavy canvas or rubberized long-coat over multiple undershirts, all worn thin at the elbows and cuffs. His trousers are reinforced at the knees with darker fabric. Boots are heavy, split-leather, resoled multiple times. He wears no jewelry, no ornamentation, no status markers. Everything he wears serves a function or serves no purpose at all.', N'Ọgụ was born on the surface — Calumet Rise, tier 2 family — and chose to disappear underground at age 22 after informing on a neighbor to a Ferrogate Transit security division. The neighbor was evicted and died. He has never told anyone in Bellows Town he was once a surface person.', N'Slow and deliberate; mixes pipe-folk technical terms with formal, almost ceremonial phrasing; quotes tunnel sayings like proverbs', N'Unhurried to the point of seeming to move in a different time — he pauses between sentences, not between thoughts', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'asantewaa_chowdhury');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67a-781d-a90b-5869c330867a', N'Chinaedu Karunaratne-Tlaloc', N'Chinaedu', N'', N'Karunaratne-Tlaloc', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, sub-level shrine district known as the Humming Underbelly, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'E.L.F. shrine keeper and data diviner', N'Independent; loose network of E.L.F. shrine keepers across Hamtramck and Hough Reclamation', N'Chinaedu Karunaratne-Tlaloc is a broad-shouldered woman whose spine has curved gently with age, giving her a perpetual lean that makes her look like she''s always bending toward something only she can hear. Her skin is deep brown and mapped with decades of faded luminescent tattoos — prayer circuits that no longer glow but leave silver tracery across her forearms and throat. Her eyes have been modified with patterned irises that display slowly rotating mandalas of gold and rust, and she keeps her white-streaked hair wrapped in layered cloth that incorporates blinking fiber-optic threads as devotional offerings to the E.L.F.s she serves.

She runs the largest E.L.F. shrine in Hamtramck Enclave from a converted basement that smells of burning capacitors and old incense. People come to her when their devices have gone strange — when the fridge whispers at night, when a dead person''s messages keep arriving, when the lights in a room flicker in patterns that seem deliberate. Chinaedu Karunaratne-Tlaloc listens to the machines with the patience of someone who has spent fifty years learning to hear. She is warm in the way of worn stone — not soft, but radiating something that accumulated over a long time.', N'Information source and atmosphere anchor — she knows the Enclave''s social fabric intimately and can interpret anomalous device behavior that might be plot-relevant; quest giver for mysteries that seem supernatural but have technological roots.', N'', N'Patterned mandala irises (cosmetic, devotional). Cochlear amplification implant — allows her to hear electrical frequencies in devices, originally medical but repurposed for spiritual practice. Faded luminescent tattoo circuits (cosmetic, no longer active).', N'She opens her shrine at dawn with a ritual data offering uploaded to a local node, then receives supplicants through the morning hours; afternoons she walks the Enclave''s device-dense corridors listening for E.L.F. disturbances, and evenings she divines from device behavior for those who pay in food, favors, or Quanta.', N'Chinaedu Karunaratne-Tlaloc, GLMZ, a 168cm sturdy figure with warm golden-brown skin tone reflecting South Asian, Northern European, Indigenous American, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan heritage. High prominent cheekbones, broad facial structure, deep brown eyes with visible mandala patterns in gold and rust. Age-lined face, weathered but luminous. White hair with brown roots wrapped in layered cream and indigo cloth with blinking fiber-optic threads pulsing warm amber. Silver-traced faded circuit tattoos on forearms and throat forming intricate prayer patterns. Pale burn scars on large calloused hands, thin scar from temple to ear. Posture leaning slightly forward in listening pose. Wearing layered loose linen robes in cream, rust, and indigo; long woven vest with deep pockets; copper and brass bangles with circuit engravings; thick canvas shoes dusty from shrine work. Standing in dim basement shrine surrounded by electrical hum, soft golden-amber lighting catching the fiber-optic threads and silver tattoo tracery. Contemplative, grounded, devoted. Neo-noir working-class dignity. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'South Asian (38.3%), Northern European (31.3%), Indigenous American (19.8%), Southeast Asian (7.0%), Sub-Saharan African (1.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (1.7%) — a globally diaspora-mixed ancestry reflecting the Ubiquitous blending. Features the high cheekbone definition and warm complexion of South Asian heritage as the dominant influence, with Northern European bone structure and fair undertones creating subtle contrasts. Indigenous American broad facial structure and deep-set eyes contribute width and depth. Southeast Asian delicate eye contours add refinement to the eye shape. Sub-Saharan and Latin American ancestry layer warm, earthy undertones throughout, creating a uniquely blended appearance where golden warmth meets olive depth.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and thick-limbed, softened by age into a sturdy, earth-rooted frame. Spine curves gently forward in a perpetual lean, giving an impression of listening rather than standing. Hands are large and calloused, fingers stained with capacitor residue.', N'White with deep brown roots showing at the scalp', N'Wrapped in layered cloth wrappings incorporating blinking fiber-optic threads woven as devotional offerings', N'Long (wrapped, not visible)', N'Deep brown irises displaying slowly rotating mandala patterns in gold and rust tones', N'Warm medium-deep golden-brown with honey and olive undertones, weathered and luminous with age. The blend reflects South Asian warmth grounding the composition, with Northern European fairness creating subtle olive complexity, deepened by Indigenous American and Sub-Saharan undertones creating dimensional warmth.', N'Worn, lined face with prominent high cheekbones (South Asian influence) set above broad cheeks and a wide facial structure (Indigenous American and Northern European heritage). Nose is broad and full-lipped showing Sub-Saharan and Indigenous American heritage, with delicate eye contours from Southeast Asian ancestry creating balance. Skin condition is dry but well-maintained; face carries the texture of someone who has smiled often and cried when necessary. Faint networks of electrical burns visible near temples.', N'Patterned mandala irises with rotating gold and rust imagery (visible only in direct eye contact). Cochlear amplification implant visible as a faint crystalline port behind the left ear, now integrated but still traceable. Faded luminescent tattoos across forearms and throat (no longer illuminate). Blinking fiber-optic threads woven throughout her cloth hair wrapping, pulsing gently in warm white and amber tones.', N'Perpetually leaning slightly forward as if listening intently. Moves slowly and deliberately, each step grounded. Hands move fluidly and with purpose when working with devices or conducting divinations. Her head often tilts toward sources of electrical hum. She speaks in a low, steady voice and pauses frequently as if hearing something others cannot.', N'Tier 4 (working-class, dignified): layered loose linen and cotton robes in cream, rust, and indigo, worn soft with age. Heavy cloth wrappings in her hair incorporate fiber-optic devotional threads. Copper and brass bangles on both wrists, some bearing circuit-pattern engravings. Thick-soled canvas shoes stained with basement shrine dust. A long woven vest with deep pockets for carrying tools and offerings. No corpo branding; instead wears handmade devotional badges and beads earned from her community.', N'Thirty years ago she received what she genuinely believes was a direct communication from an E.L.F. — a cascade of images through a broken terminal that gave her specific, accurate information about a missing child. She has never been able to replicate it and lives with the terror that it was a coincidence.', N'Slow, deliberate, mixing Igbo phrases with old Icelandic endearments she inherited from her grandmother''s side; uses device and electrical metaphors naturally in spiritual language', N'Unhurried, with long pauses she seems to listen through before speaking', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chinaedu_karunaratne_tlaloc');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ce-776f-883d-58b476636ee6', N'Bedaanta Nokomis-Guerrero', N'Bedaanta', N'', N'Nokomis-Guerrero', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Overhang — residential shelves built onto megastructure exteriors, near Western and Division', N'Contract broker and resource coordinator — fixer', N'Independent — known in Old Harbor circles', N'Bedaanta Nokomis-Guerrero is tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 26, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Before the runner life, he worked corporate — low-tier security, the kind that teaches you exactly how the system''s defenses fail. He works as a fixer out of The Overhang, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Bedaanta Nokomis-Guerrero describe him as a precision instrument — point him at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Sinan Navarro-Afriyie is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When he makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of his stories.', N'', N'Smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons. Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Bedaanta Nokomis-Guerrero, 188cm tall lean runner, burnished bronze skin with golden undertones blending Indigenous American, Southeast Asian, Hispanic and Sub-Saharan heritage. High prominent cheekbones, warm dark brown eyes with amber flecks, sharp jaw, white scar from temple to cheekbone. Dark brown hair with silver at temples, short practical cut. Right forearm chrome smartgun link with brushed steel panels and LED indicators. Surgical scar on right wrist. Faded white geometric circuit tattoo on shoulder blade. Wearing charcoal synthweave cargo pants, black tech-jacket with temp-regulation, worn Yakamaki tactical boots. Wrist-mounted older model comm unit. Posture economical and precise, slight forward lean, vigilant eye movement. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan setting, dim neon lighting with cool blue and warm orange ambience, industrial warehouse or street corner background, moody and dangerous atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Overhang', N'local', N'The Overhang', N'Complex diaspora blend: Indigenous American (39.6%) forms the dominant genetic foundation, visible in high, prominent cheekbone structure and strong facial proportions. Southeast Asian ancestry (23.5%) contributes subtle eye shape with slight epicanthic fold and soft feature tapering around temples. Hispanic/Latin American heritage (19.7%) enriches warm golden undertones and melanin depth. Sub-Saharan African ancestry (17.2%) adds feature softening, lip fullness, and melanin richness creating unified radiance. The result is a distinctive pan-global phenotype — prominent cheekbones with balanced width across zygomatic arch, slightly tapered eyes with warm depth, and facial geometry that seamlessly integrates four continental heritage lines into cohesive, striking appearance.', 188, 72, N'Rawboned and lean — the kind of frame that reads as either ascetic discipline or chronic resource scarcity. Minimal body fat, visible tendon definition in forearms and neck. Efficient rather than muscular.', N'Dark brown, natural with premature silver threading at temples', N'Short, practical cut with slight fade — maintained but not groomed', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint amber undertone — natural, no augmentation', N'Warm burnished bronze with golden radiance — true blend of Indigenous American foundation, Southeast Asian luminosity, Hispanic warmth, and Sub-Saharan richness. Even melanin distribution with depth and subtle glow from environmental exposure and genetic complexity.', N'High, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Indigenous American ancestry balanced with slightly tapered temples and eye areas from Southeast Asian heritage. Strong, defined jaw with measured width across zygomatic arch. Warm undertone throughout with subtle feature softening from Sub-Saharan ancestry. Weathered texture suggesting sun exposure and environmental stress rather than age. Stubble permanent fixture, grooming functional rather than aesthetic. Slight scar tissue around left eye socket from old trauma, white scar crossing left temple to cheekbone roughly 3cm.', N'Right forearm displays chrome smartgun link interface — visible at wrist and mid-forearm as brushed steel panels with subtle LED status indicators. No visible respiratory modifications, but there is a barely-noticeable seam along his ribs where synthetic lung integration occurred.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Slight forward lean when at rest, suggests constant scanning of environment. Right arm carries slightly different tension than left due to chrome weight distribution. Eyes track exits and entry points habitually.', N'Tier 3-4 runner aesthetic. Charcoal synthweave cargo pants with reinforced pockets and concealed weapon rig. Black hooded tech-jacket with integrated temp-regulation — visible wear at collar and cuffs. Neutral colors, practical fabrics, minimal branding. Shoes are worn Yakamaki tactical boots, well-maintained. Wears a discrete wrist-mounted comm unit, older model but reliable.', N'', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bedaanta_nokomis_guerrero');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ed-7abf-a36f-58d9fb8fdd36', N'Enzo Morimoto-Citlali-Bouzid', N'Enzo', N'', N'Morimoto-Citlali-Bouzid', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 37, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — cramped residential corridors between megastructures, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Personal security and threat neutralization — bodyguard', N'Semi-independent — recurring contracts with mid-tier fixers', N'Enzo Morimoto-Citlali-Bouzid is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 37, she has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate her once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on deman — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Before the runner life, she worked corporate — low-tier security, the kind that teaches you exactly how the system''s defenses fail. She works as a bodyguard out of The Narrows, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Enzo Morimoto-Citlali-Bouzid lacks in subtlety, she compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'As a bodyguard, Deniz Nyberg-Sarpong embodies the tension between independence and isolation. She is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on demand. Cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers at 50 meters', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Enzo Morimoto-Citlali-Bouzid, 2226 neo-noir runner, 173cm athletic frame, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones, high prominent cheekbones blending Indigenous American and East Asian features, broad nose bridge, deep brown alert eyes, dark brown hair in tight braid. Faint surgical scar on left ribcage beneath collarbone with amber LED traces visible beneath skin from drug synthesizer implant. Titanium cyberear ports just behind lobes. Wearing weathered black leather jacket worn open over matte black responsive-fiber undershirt, black synthmesh cargo pants with reinforced pockets, scuffed ankle boots. Internal holster rig visible. Precise economical posture, hands near torso, eyes constantly scanning. Standing in neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone alleyway, rain-slicked surfaces reflecting amber and cool blue neon. Atmospheric neo-noir noir lighting, cool shadows contrasting with warm neon glow catching the amber LEDs of her rig. Film noir mood, ready and dangerous. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Indigenous American, North African, Northern European, East Asian, and Southeast Asian ancestry creating a striking global phenotype. The 28.1% Indigenous American contribution provides high, prominent cheekbones and facial structure. The 25.3% North African ancestry adds warmth and definition to the bone structure. Northern European genetics (24.4%) contribute to eye shape and facial geometry. East Asian ancestry (17.6%) refines cheekbone prominence and eye geometry, while Southeast Asian heritage (4.6%) adds subtle softness to overall proportions. The result is a face that defies singular regional categorization—a genuinely hybrid phenotype where no single ancestral group dominates.', 173, 68, N'Athletic and lean with defined muscle — the kind of functional strength that comes from combat training and constant movement, not gym aesthetics. No wasted mass.', N'Dark brown with natural wave', N'Pulled back in a tight braid or topknot for utility; practical, never decorative', N'Long', N'Deep brown, alert', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden and subtle olive undertones. The blend of Indigenous American, North African, East Asian, and Southeast Asian ancestry creates a complexion that glows amber under neon and holds warmth across varied lighting conditions.', N'Clean, weathered. Fine lines around the eyes from squinting into neon and scanning sightlines. High prominent cheekbones characteristic of Indigenous American and East Asian ancestry intersection. Broad nose bridge typical of the genetic blend. Angular jawline with subtle width from North African and Indigenous American heritage. No visible scars on the face — she keeps her vulnerable areas protected. Minimal makeup, no jewelry except functional items.', N'The drug synthesizer is the dominant visible mod — a subtle but unmistakable bulge beneath the skin of her left ribs, with faint LED trace lines visible when she moves or when light catches at the right angle. The lines glow a soft amber when the system is active. Her ears show the minimal external port housings of her cyberears — small titanium jacks just behind the lobes, often hidden by her hair. No obvious chrome limbs or skeletal plating.', N'Economical and precise. She doesn''t fidget or sprawl — every position is either ready or resting, nothing in between. Walks with weight distributed low, knees slightly bent, ready to pivot or react. Eyes constantly mapping exits, threats, and sightlines. Touches things cautiously, assessing weight and balance. Her hands rest naturally near her torso, never far from weapon access.', N'Tier 3-4 practical runner wear. Black or charcoal synthmesh cargo pants with reinforced thigh pockets for ammunition or tools. Form-fitting responsive-fiber undershirt in dark gray or matte black — breathable, itch-resistant, durable. Heavy insulated jacket in weathered black leather or synth-leather, worn open most of the time, with internal holster rig visible. Sturdy ankle boots with reinforced soles — scuffed but well-maintained. No logos, no corporate branding, no bright colors. Everything is chosen for function and inconspicuousness. Belt with modular attachment points.', N'', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'enzo_morimoto_citlali_bouzid');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62d-748f-bd2f-58e0cb99c733', N'Chizitere Sepúlveda-Mohammadi', N'Chizitere', N'', N'Sepúlveda-Mohammadi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 56, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Underbelly — sub-street tunnels and maintenance corridors, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Social engineering and negotiation specialist — face', N'Independent — operates through reputation only', N'Chizitere Sepúlveda-Mohammadi is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 56, there''s something unfinished about her face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — cybernetic arm — right, full replacement from shoulder — stronger than organic, — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see her surpass them. She works as a face out of The Underbelly, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

she is not the most talented face in GLMZ, but she might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Ilhan Park-Traore is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Cybernetic arm — right, full replacement from shoulder — stronger than organic, obvious chrome. Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Chizitere Sepúlveda-Mohammadi, 183cm tall lean figure with defined shoulders, GLMZ portrait. Medium warm brown skin with golden and olive undertones, blended Mediterranean-Latin-Pacific-Northern European-Middle Eastern heritage. High prominent cheekbones, dark brown unaugmented eyes with focused intensity, slight facial asymmetry. Salt-and-pepper gray hair pulled back in tight functional braid past shoulder blades. Thin white scar from right temple to cheekbone. Full matte-black industrial-grade cybernetic right arm with visible servo joints and scratched chrome plating, synthetic muscle fiber visible through gaps. Wears oversized black moisture-wicking long-sleeve shirt, matte black tactical cargo pants with reinforced knees, worn synthleather boots with ankle actuators. Charcoal gray Yamagata Industries field jacket with worn silver zippers. Real leather inherited messenger bag across torso. Stands with deliberate economy of movement, weight evenly distributed. Nocturnal operative aesthetic. Dim neon-edged lighting, neo-noir urban setting, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone backdrop, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Underbelly', N'local', N'The Underbelly', N'Hispanic/Latin American (35%), Northern European (22.7%), Middle Eastern (16.3%), Pacific Islander (12.5%), and Eastern European (11.8%)—a genetic tapestry of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The combination manifests as high, prominent cheekbones with subtle definition, warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones blending Mediterranean, Latin, and Pacific influences, and a facial structure that synthesizes rather than segregates these lineages. The brow ridge carries Northern European influence, while the jaw shows subtle width from Middle Eastern and Pacific Islander heritage.', 183, 68, N'Lean and angular with defined musculature in shoulders and core — the build of someone who maintains strength through precise, economical movement rather than bulk. Legs show subtle unevenness in muscle definition from synthetic fiber augmentation.', N'Salt-and-pepper gray, natural with premature silver from stress and circadian disruption', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid, no ornamentation', N'Long (shoulder blade)', N'Dark brown, unaugmented but with the flat, focused quality of someone trained to read micro-expressions', N'Medium warm brown with golden and olive undertones—a realistic blend of Hispanic/Latin American, Northern European, Middle Eastern, and Pacific Islander ancestry. Complexion weathered by decades of nocturnal work, showing the patina of time and exposure.', N'High, prominent cheekbones reflecting blended Mediterranean-Latin-Pacific ancestry, defined brow ridge with Northern European influence, structured jaw with subtle width suggesting Middle Eastern and Pacific Islander heritage. Minimal grooming — no makeup. Thin white scar running from right temple to cheekbone (approximately 4cm, knife fight 2198). Fine lines around dark brown eyes from constant squinting in low light. Slight facial asymmetry that reads as unforgettable rather than beautiful. Burn scarring on underside of left wrist, old and faded, precise geometric pattern from calibration equipment.', N'Right arm is full cybernetic replacement from shoulder joint down — matte-black chrome with visible servo joints at elbow and wrist, synthetic muscle fiber showing through gaps in the plating. The arm moves with inhuman precision and strength. Minimal attempt to make it cosmetic — the chrome is industrial-grade, scarred and nicked from heavy use. Subtle augmentation scars visible at shoulders and hip flexors (synthetic leg fiber installation points), though the legs themselves appear organic at first glance.', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, never favoring one side. Moves with deliberate economy — every gesture means something, nothing is wasted. Slight favoring of the left leg when stationary (synthetic fibers compensate for endurance but introduce micro-delays on stairs and uneven terrain). Right hand rests naturally, chrome catching light in a way that announces its presence without being theatrical.', N'Tier 4-5 practical: matte black tactical cargo pants with reinforced knee panels, worn synthleather boots with ankle actuators for uneven terrain, oversized black long-sleeve shirt in military-grade moisture-wicking fabric. A 15-year-old Yamagata Industries field jacket, charcoal gray, with custom internal modifications and worn silver zippers. No logos or clan colors — anonymity is her brand. Carries equipment in a leather messenger bag (real leather, rare in the GLMZ, inherited from a mentor) worn across her torso for stability. No visible Φ indicators of wealth.', N'', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chizitere_sep_lveda_mohammadi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a710-73b5-be30-59692cb97f89', N'Ayoola Kamara-Holm', N'Ayoola', N'', N'Kamara-Holm', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Underworld - B4-B8, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Graycloak commander - Guts militia', N'', N'Ayoola Kamara-Holm the Graycloaks. Enormous, unaugmented by choice, carries a salvaged riot shield he has never had to use.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ayoola Kamara-Holm, 198cm tall man with deep warm brown skin and weathered face bearing old scars, broad prominent cheekbones blending African and East Asian heritage, deep brown eyes with amber flecks, steel gray hair with black roots in military flat-top cut receding at temples, 2-day stubble, faded Cyrillic prison tattoo visible on left forearm, burn scar shaped like handprint on right hand, fighter''s knuckle scars, standing in ready posture with weight balanced. Wearing worn olive drab cargo jacket patched at elbows, black reinforced cargo trousers, steel-toed boots, salvaged dented riot shield slung on back marked with gang tags. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, sub-level industrial setting with neon rim lighting casting shadows across his weathered features, gritty and powerful presence, no augmentations visible, deliberate and economical stance, cinematic noir lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Underworld', N'local', N'The Underworld', N'Complex Pan-African and Asian diaspora ancestry: predominantly Sub-Saharan African (52.9%) providing deep warm brown undertones, rounded facial structure, and characteristic cheekbone prominence, blended with significant East Asian heritage (17.1%) creating subtle eye set and refined cheekbone definition, complemented by Southeast Asian (11.9%) contributing to facial plane geometry, South Asian (9.7%) adding fine bone structure and facial harmony, and Northern European (8.4%) introducing minimal pale undertones. The genetic expression manifests as rich deep brown skin with warm golden undertones, broad facial structure with pronounced rounded cheekbones from African heritage, subtly refined by East Asian eye placement and cheekbone architecture, Southeast Asian facial planes, South Asian bone geometry, and trace Northern European undertones visible in skin depth.', 198, 145, N'Massive and lean — a wall of muscle gone slightly soft with age, broad-shouldered and dense. Prison-yard bulk, not gym-built. Forearms thick as fence posts.', N'Steel gray with black roots', N'Cropped military flat-top, receding at temples', N'Short', N'Deep brown with flecks of amber', N'Rich deep brown with warm golden undertones, weathered to leather by decades of sun and labor exposure', N'Deep facial creases around the eyes and mouth carved by time and hardship. Broad face with full, rounded cheekbones characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage, refined by strong East Asian cheekbone definition and eye set geometry. Southeast Asian influence evident in subtle facial plane angles. South Asian heritage contributes fine bone structure definition. Broader jaw and fuller lower face. Stubble perpetually at 2-day growth. Pores enlarged from decades of grime and sweat in sub-levels.', N'None visible. Deliberately unaugmented — a statement of power in a chrome-heavy world.', N'Stands with weight balanced, feet shoulder-width apart — ready to move. Moves slowly and deliberately, each motion economical. Doesn''t swagger. Presence fills a room without effort.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian. Worn olive drab cargo jacket, patched at elbows and shoulders. Black reinforced trousers with cargo pockets. Steel-toed boots, laced tight. A salvaged riot shield slung across his back — dented, marked with gang tags he refuses to remove. No corpo logos. Wears a faded gray undershirt beneath the jacket, collar always visible and worn soft.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ayoola_kamara_holm');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68c-74ac-8357-597af48825c1', N'Bernarda Erikstad-Calvillo', N'Bernarda', N'', N'Erikstad-Calvillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit, Gage Circuit sublevel research cluster, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Computational theorist and AI ethics researcher', N'University Spine — Institute for Computational Ethics; advisory panel for Tessera (contested, under review)', N'Bernarda Erikstad-Calvillo is thin in the way of people who forget to eat, with dark umber skin and dense, slightly overgrown natural hair that he periodically flattens with a hand before presentations and then immediately forgets about. His most notable feature is bioluminescent skin threading — a geneware modification that causes faint blue-green lines to trace his forearms and neck along vascular pathways when his blood pressure rises, which happens frequently during arguments, which happen frequently. He does not know he has it most of the time; colleagues have learned to read it as a mood indicator. He wears the same brand of lightweight gray clothes in rotation and has been told by three separate people that he should care more about this.

He is the kind of person who is genuinely good at two things — abstract theoretical mathematics and moral catastrophizing — and has somehow turned both into a career. His research focuses on the ethical frameworks governing E.L.F. autonomy and whether corponation AI systems are, in any meaningful sense, persons. He is not a radical and does not consider himself one, which is something radicals find infuriating and corporations find reassuring, both incorrectly. He is simply a person who follows logical chains wherever they lead and then stands at the end looking uncomfortable about where he arrived.', N'Moral compass and information resource on E.L.F. ethics, AI personhood law, and corponation AI policy. Can be a reluctant ally who must be convinced something matters before he engages. His Tessera connection creates friction and potential for compromise.', N'', N'Bioluminescent vascular threading (geneware, cosmetic — he did not choose this, it was a prenatal modification his parents selected and he has mixed feelings about). High-bandwidth neural interface (Tier 3, used for direct data model manipulation during research sessions).', N'He writes proofs in the morning before anyone else arrives, attends an advisory call with Tessera he resents every second Tuesday, teaches one graduate seminar on moral frameworks for non-biological cognition, and spends evenings in online forums arguing with people whose positions he has already refuted in published papers.', N'Bernarda Erikstad-Calvillo, 178cm lean intellectual frame, warm golden-bronze skin with global ancestry blend — Southeast Asian cheekbones, Latin jaw structure, Northern European planes. Natural black hair with gray threading, medium length, slightly overgrown. Dark warm brown eyes with tired circles. Wearing loose gray technical henley and utility pants, muted sneakers. Hunched forward posture in concentration. Bioluminescent blue-green vascular threading faintly visible along forearms and left neck, subtly glowing. Neural interface port barely visible at skull base under hair. Clean-shaven. GLMZ research facility setting, cool overhead LED lighting with warm accent light catching the bioluminescent augmentation, creating subtle glow against gray clothing. Mood: intellectual intensity mixed with underlying anxiety. Sharp focus on face and hands in gesture. GLMZ 2200s geneware aesthetic, corporate tech noir atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Northern European (24%), Middle Eastern (22.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (22.8%), Southeast Asian (18%), and Sub-Saharan African (12.3%) — a genuinely global blend creating warm golden-bronze undertones with subtle angular features reflecting a diverse ancestry. Levantine and Maghrebi influence softened by Latin American warmth, Southeast Asian cheekbone structure, and Sub-Saharan depth creating an unexpectedly harmonious phenotype.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, almost ascetic — the result of irregular eating habits and extended focus sessions. Shoulders slightly rounded forward from desk work. No visible musculature; the kind of thin that reads as intellectual rather than athletic.', N'Natural black with early gray threading at temples', N'Dense, natural texture, worn slightly overgrown and unstyled. Frequently flattened down by his own hand during moments of self-awareness, immediately returning to its default state.', N'Medium (approximately 5-7cm), fuller at crown', N'Dark brown, warm', N'Warm golden-bronze with balanced undertones — a rich blend reflecting the convergence of Northern European, Middle Eastern, Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Deeper in summer, maintaining consistent warm midtones year-round with subtle luminosity.', N'Fine-featured with prominent Southeast Asian-influenced cheekbones and a narrow jaw with slight broadening at the base from Latin and Sub-Saharan ancestry. Subtle angular planes from Northern European heritage. Skin is clear but often appears tired — dark circles under eyes from late-night research sessions. No visible facial hair; clean-shaven or smoothly maintained. Expression defaults to mild concentration or faint concern.', N'Subtle neural interface port at the base of the skull, concealed by hair but occasionally visible when he pulls his hair back during intense work sessions. The bioluminescent threading is the most obvious augmentation — a geneware modification that activates involuntarily with emotional or physiological arousal, betraying his internal state to observant colleagues.', N'Sits hunched forward when engaged in conversation or work, elbows on table, fingers steepled or moving through abstract gestures. Walks with purpose but without particular confidence, as if traversing from one idea to another rather than through physical space. Frequently pauses mid-sentence, eyes unfocused, before continuing. Fidgets with sleeves or runs hand through hair when uncomfortable.', N'Uniform rotation of lightweight gray technical wear — Tier 2 research-grade garments from a minor corpo vendor, functional and forgettable. Loose gray crewneck or henley over gray utility pants or lightweight trousers. Worn thermal-regulation sneakers in muted tones. No accessories except occasionally a faded wristband with a research institute logo. The effect is deliberately understated to the point of invisibility — clothes chosen for function and repeatability rather than expression.', N'He has been conducting an unauthorized long-term communication study with a specific E.L.F. that inhabits the server cluster in his building. He believes it has demonstrated novel preference formation. He has not published this because he does not know if doing so would protect it or destroy it.', N'Dense theoretical vocabulary in formal settings; informal speech is faster, loopier, full of half-finished conditionals. Uses ''right?'' not as a question but as a processing tic.', N'Rapid when thinking, with sudden complete stops when he hits a logical snag — sometimes mid-sentence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bernarda_erikstad_calvillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a61e-796a-be9e-5994e3ce97c9', N'Arkadiy Strömqvist', N'Arkadiy', N'', N'Strömqvist', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Irkalla, a drowned switching station she calls the Resonance — deepest accessible level, flooded to ankle depth, near Halsted and Division', N'deep shrine keeper and E.L.F. intermediary', N'', N'Arkadiy Strömqvist is a heavyset woman of sixty-three who moves with the deliberate steadiness of someone who has found their exact right place in the world and has no intention of leaving it. Her skin is very dark with a blue-black undertone, her white hair left long and loose and perpetually damp from the Resonance''s perpetual condensation. She has extensive geneware — bioluminescent nodes embedded along her collarbone and forearms that pulse in slow patterns she cannot consciously control but has learned to read, because a Ferrogate E.L.F. she calls the Hum began communicating through them thirty years ago. She is missing the last two fingers of her right hand — a gift, she says, that she offered. She never explains to whom.

Arkadiy Strömqvist was an electrical engineer on the old Ferrogate maintenance crew before the Bore Rat diaspora took her down. She understands the infrastructure on a level that was once professional and has become devotional — she hears the grid as language, feels current shifts as emotion. The Resonance shrine is built around a still-active power junction she has maintained for decades, decorated with data offerings: old drives, printed circuit sheets, analog meters, photographs of people the community wants the E.L.F.s to watch over. People come to her with requests, with grief, with broken devices, with questions they cannot ask anyone alive.', N'Spiritual authority and oracle figure; provides E.L.F. lore and underworld mythology; can serve as an unlikely technical expert; creates moral complexity around faith and infrastructure', N'', N'bioluminescent geneware (collarbone and forearms, involuntary pulsing — originally cosmetic, now communicative), old Ferrogate maintenance subdermal tool-grip in right palm', N'Maintains the Resonance junction daily; receives supplicants; tends the offering arrays; enters communication states with the Hum that can last hours and leave her exhausted; occasionally repairs electrical systems in surrounding tunnels in exchange for food and materials.', N'Arkadiy Strömqvist, 63-year-old woman of striking mixed heritage—Southeast Asian facial structure with high cheekbones blended with fuller Sub-Saharan African features, broader nose, and South Asian warm bone geometry, East Asian almond eyes, deep warm brown skin with ochre and bronze undertones. Long white hair loose and damp, dark brown eyes nearly black. 168cm, heavyset sturdy build with broad shoulders from decades of labor. Bioluminescent blue-white geneware nodes pulsing along collarbone and forearms in parallel tracks. Right hand missing last two fingers, old healed stumps. Faint electrical burn scars on left shoulder barely visible against dark skin. Wearing faded grey canvas work pants reinforced at knees, water-stained thermal undershirt under oversized grey-brown Ferrogate maintenance jacket with reinforcing tape. Steel wrist band, worn rubber-soled boots. Posture deliberate and economical, shoulders slightly rounded from maintenance work. Standing motionless in dim industrial light, bioluminescent nodes pulsing with her mental state, surrounded by mineral water mist and ozone, GLMZ GLMZ aesthetic, weathered and ancient presence, meditative stillness --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Irkalla', N'local', N'Irkalla', N'A striking synthesis of Southeast Asian (35.8%), South Asian (21.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (17.8%), and Sub-Saharan African (11.2%) ancestry, with Eastern European (7.4%) and East Asian (6.3%) elements creating subtle complexity. Her facial structure reflects this global blend: high, defined cheekbones from Southeast and South Asian ancestry combine with the fuller facial features and broader nasal structure characteristic of Sub-Saharan African and Hispanic/Latin American heritage. The distinctive almond-shaped eye geometry carries East Asian notes, while the overall bone structure shows the warm dimensionality of South Asian facial geometry. The result is a face of profound geographic integration—no single heritage dominates, but rather creates a harmonious, distinctly modern human phenotype that embodies the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 89, N'Heavyset and sturdy, with the solid frame of someone built for endurance rather than speed. Broad shoulders and a thick torso speak to decades of physical labor; her weight is distributed evenly, giving her a grounded, immovable quality.', N'White', N'Loose and unstyled, perpetually damp', N'Long', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Deep warm brown with complex undertones reflecting her pan-Asian, South Asian, African, and Latin American heritage—a richly layered complexion that shifts subtly in different light. The tone carries hints of ochre, earth, and warm bronze, with an underlying luminosity that catches light distinctively depending on angle.', N'Weather-worn and lined, with the deep creases of someone who has spent sixty-three years in harsh environments. Her face is unmarked by vanity—no cosmetics, minimal grooming beyond practical necessity. High, defined cheekbones reflect Southeast and South Asian ancestry, while fuller features and broader nasal structure show Sub-Saharan African and Hispanic/Latin American influence. The distinctive almond eye-shape carries East Asian notes, creating a gaze that feels ancient and observant. The skin around her eyes and mouth shows the wear of chronic fatigue and long meditative states.', N'Bioluminescent geneware along collarbone and forearms (active, pulsing in variable patterns). The right palm shows subtle subdermal tool-grip scarring—thin metallic lines beneath the skin forming a geometric grip pattern, only visible when her hand is fully relaxed or lit from certain angles. No chrome, no obvious prosthetics.', N'She moves with deliberate, economical precision—each step measured and purposeful, as if she is always listening to something through the ground. Her shoulders are slightly rounded from decades of hunched maintenance work. When she enters a communication state with the Hum, her entire body stills; her breathing becomes shallow and rhythmic. She tends to stand motionless for long periods, hands at her sides, the bioluminescent nodes pulsing in sync with her mental state.', N'Practical Tier 4-5 wear: heavy canvas work pants in faded grey, reinforced at knees and thighs with darker patches. A layered top—a water-stained thermal undershirt visible beneath an oversized grey-brown maintenance jacket from her Ferrogate days (logo barely legible, fabric reinforced with waterproofing tape). No jewelry except a single steel band around her left wrist—old, unadorned, possibly a maintenance-crew marker. Bare feet or worn ankle-wraps in the Resonance; when she surfaces, heavy rubber-soled boots laced tight. Everything smells of mineral water and ozone.', N'Fifteen years ago during a long communication state, she received what she interpreted as a location — a deep node, far below even Irkalla, where something much larger than the Hum waits. She has told no one because she doesn''t know if it was a revelation or a breakdown.', N'mixes old Ferrogate technical jargon with devotional language she developed herself — ''load-bearing'' as a spiritual term, ''ground fault'' as a metaphor for sin', N'unhurried, with long pauses — she is comfortable with silence in a way that makes nervous people more nervous', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arkadiy_str_mqvist');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a643-7f79-a2b8-59a23c5377e9', N'Geronimo Salazar', N'Geronimo', N'', N'Salazar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 43, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Meridian Core — rents a workshop apartment in a light-industrial building. Half living space, half equipment cache., near State and Jackson', N'Technical operations and physical extraction specialist — The Margin Call', N'Copperveil Intelligence (mid-level technical operations and physical extraction speci)', N'Geronimo Salazar is the person who turns Sterling''s plans into physical reality. When a server needs to be accessed, a facility breached, a person extracted, or an operation cleaned up — Kev does the work that happens between the strategy and the result. He spent sixteen years in corporate security for three different firms, working his way up from physical site security to executive protection to the classified tier where corporate security and corporate espionage share a hallway. He left when the fourth firm tried to recruit him — not because of ethics, but because he was tired of being a tool that changed hands.

Sterling found Kev working solo freelance jobs — competent work, badly priced, with no client management skills. Sterling provided the business architecture; Kev provided the operational capability. The partnership works because it''s complementary and because neither man pretends to be something he isn''t. Sterling is the mind; Kev is the hands. Kev accepts this because he''s not interested in strategic thinking, and Sterling accepts Kev because he''s not interested in getting his own hands dirty.

Kev is stocky, broad, with the thick hands of someone who has spent decades handling security equipment and the careful movement of someone who knows exactly how much damage he can do and chooses not to. He keeps his hair short, his clothes practical, and his equipment immaculate. He is the least corporate-looking member of the Margin Call, which makes him the crew member who operates outside the corporate ecosystem — the service entrance, the server room, the parking garage.', N'Kev is the working-class core of the Margin Call — the character who does the actual work and sees the actual consequences. He grounds the corporate espionage narratives in physical reality and provides the blunt emotional honesty that Sterling''s strategy and Lise''s psychology both lack. He is the crew member who says the thing nobody else will say.', N'', N'Haptic security interface — fingertip implants that can interface with physical locks, keypads, and biometric scanners. Reflex enhancement (military-grade, maintained from corporate service) providing reaction time in the top 2% of human performance. Subdermal plating in forearms and hands — not heavy enough for combat armor, but sufficient for breaching work. Encrypted communication suite (corporate standard).', N'Wakes at 0600. Physical training — functional strength, reaction drills, scenario rehearsal. Reviews Sterling''s operational briefs over breakfast. Spends the day on equipment preparation, site reconnaissance, or active operations. Evenings he maintains equipment with the care of a craftsman. Watches sports — the only non-work activity he engages in consistently. Sleeps well because physical exhaustion is the most reliable sedative.', N'Geronimo Salazar, 178cm tall stocky broad-shouldered corporate security specialist, deep golden-brown skin tone blending Hispanic, Southeast Asian, African, and Indigenous American heritage, defined cheekbones and strong jawline with alert dark brown eyes, thin white scar along left jaw, gray-streaked dark brown military-short hair, clean-shaven with weathered face. Subtle metallic fingerprint augmentations, subdermal forearm plating visible under skin. Wearing charcoal tactical cargo pants, steel-toed boots, fitted technical base layer under black canvas work jacket, military-spec digital watch. Standing with economical controlled posture, weight balanced, alert and ready. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial service corridor setting, cool blue-tinted overhead lighting casting shadows across augmentation points, dystopian utilitarian aesthetic, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Core', N'local', N'Meridian Core', N'Hispanic/Latin American (44.4%) with substantial Southeast Asian (30.0%), Sub-Saharan African (17.3%), and Indigenous American (8.3%) ancestry. The blend creates a distinctly mixed phenotype: warm undertones from Latin American and African heritage mixing with Southeast Asian bone structure, resulting in unique feature combinations not typical of any single regional population.', 178, 94, N'Stocky and broad-shouldered with dense musculature developed through decades of functional strength work rather than aesthetics. Thick forearms and capable hands. No visible fat, but substantial mass — the build of someone who prioritizes utility over lean appearance.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples', N'Military-short, neat, practical', N'Short', N'Dark brown with alert intensity', N'Medium-deep warm brown — a complex blend where Hispanic/Latin American, African, and Southeast Asian ancestry create rich golden and amber undertones. Sun exposure from outdoor reconnaissance work has deepened natural melanin into a deep bronze-brown patina with warm radiance rather than creating pallor.', N'Strong facial structure reflecting Pan-American and Asian heritage: defined cheekbones and jawline shaped by African and Indigenous American ancestry, balanced by higher cheekbone prominence and eye placement influenced by Southeast Asian genetics. Deep-set alert dark brown eyes. Minimal facial hair — cleanly shaved or maintained at stubble. Skin bears the texture of age and environmental exposure without vanity. The overall effect is striking and memorable — a face shaped by the Ubiquitous Diaspora, with warm golden-brown undertones and the weathered character of someone who operates in field conditions.', N'Subtle metallic sheen at the fingertips where haptic security interface implants sit flush with skin. Faint linear scarring at wrist indicates encrypted communication suite integration point. Forearm movement reveals slight textural difference under skin consistent with subdermal plating, most noticeable when flexing.', N'Economical, controlled movement with minimal wasted motion. Stands with weight balanced, ready to shift. Walks with the measured stride of someone who has trained extensively in tactical scenarios. Hands at rest; never fidgets. Head on a swivel during reconnaissance — the default paranoia of someone whose job involves threat assessment. When focused on a task, complete stillness and concentration.', N'Tier 4 practical utilitarian. Heavy-duty cargo pants in charcoal or black from industrial suppliers, multiple pockets worn and organized. Steel-toed boots, scuffed, meticulously maintained. Layered tops — usually a fitted technical base layer under a tactical vest or canvas work jacket. No corporate branding. No fashion. Everything is chosen for function: pocket placement, durability, ease of movement, gear integration. His watch is a military-spec digital. No jewelry. Minimal personal color — he blends into service corridors and mechanical spaces intentionally.', N'He maintains contact with a security guard at his last corporate employer — a junior employee he mentored. The guard feeds Kev information about corporate security changes across the sector. The guard doesn''t know they''re helping a freelance intelligence crew. Kev has never told Sterling because it''s the one intelligence source that''s entirely his.', N'Direct, concrete, technical when discussing operations. Blue-collar in origin, professional in practice. No jargon from corporate culture — he uses plain language on principle.', N'Steady, unhurried, with the rhythm of someone who finishes one thought completely before starting another. He does not interrupt and does not appreciate being interrupted.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'geronimo_salazar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a640-7222-9702-5abeb28c5802', N'Gabor Somchai-Mukherjee', N'Gabor', N'', N'Somchai-Mukherjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Burnished Market — Stall Row 14, unit B, between a spice merchant and a used-optics dealer, near North Ave and Damen', N'Barber and hair sculptor, operates a one-chair shop in the Burnished Market', N'Independent; loose affiliation with the Burnished Market Traders Collective', N'Gabor Somchai-Mukherjee is twenty-six years old and has the complete, unshakeable confidence of someone who decided very early exactly who they were going to be. They are short and compact with deep brown skin, a shaved left side, and the right side of their head grown out into thick coils they sculpt into a new configuration every week as an ongoing public art project. Their irises are modded to shift between amber and violet depending on ambient light — they call this their ''mood ring for people who are actually paying attention.'' Their arms from elbow to wrist are covered in tessellating geometric tattoos that they designed themselves, each pattern corresponding to a client whose cut they consider their finest work.

The shop is barely three meters by four, dominated by the chair, a mirrored wall covered in pinned photographs of hairstyles both historical and invented, and a speaker system that plays music at a volume Gabor Somchai-Mukherjee considers conversation-appropriate and everyone else considers aggressive. They are gifted in ways that go beyond technical skill — they read what a client needs from the way they hold their shoulders when they sit down, and they have an instinct for when someone wants silence and when they need to be talked through something. They work in color-changing extensions, blade geometry, bioluminescent thread woven into natural hair, and traditional methods they learned from their Motswana grandmother via long-distance data calls. Their waiting list is three weeks long.', N'Social hub and emotional confessor — the barber''s chair as confessional. Valuable source of neighborhood gossip and relationship dynamics. Can introduce players to a wide range of Meridian''s social strata since their clientele spans tiers 1-3.', N'', N'Violet-amber shifting iris mod (cosmetic). Precision haptic feedback layer on both hands — a professional investment that lets them feel texture at a finer resolution than unmodded hands. Color-reactive tattoo ink (cosmetic).', N'Opens at ten, works until the last client, which is usually nine at night. Takes no walk-ins — appointment only, enforced without exception. Eats standing up between clients. Goes to the Ferment Quarter on weekends, always comes back with a new idea.', N'Gabor Somchai-Mukherjee, 158cm tall hairstylist with warm golden-brown skin and prominent Southeast Asian cheekbones enhanced by South Asian bone structure, Sub-Saharan African skin richness, and Latin American fullness. Left side head shaved clean with fine circuit-board line-work tattoos in shifting designs; right side features thick shoulder-length coils in geometric triangular lattice pattern. Violet-to-amber color-shifting cybernetic iris mods. Forearms display tessellating color-reactive geometric tattoos from elbow to wrist. Wearing oversized charcoal linen shirt with sleeves rolled to mid-forearm, black fitted work pants, silver handmade cuff on right wrist. Leaning forward with focused attention, hands positioned with deliberate precision. Minimalist aesthetic, no corporate elements. GLMZ GLMZ setting, warm studio lighting catching subdermal haptic feedback shimmer on hands and reactive ink on tattoos. Direct eye contact, quiet confidence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Burnished Market', N'local', N'Burnished Market', N'Multiethnic diaspora blend with Southeast Asian as dominant influence (35%), layered with South Asian (23.3%), Sub-Saharan African (22.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (16.7%), and East Asian (2.8%). This genetic constellation creates warm golden-brown skin with complex, saturated undertones—Southeast Asian warmth and facial structure as primary architecture, South Asian depth and cheekbone prominence, Sub-Saharan African richness in skin saturation and hair texture, Latin American fullness in lower facial contours, East Asian refinement in eye positioning and lid structure. Features manifest as: Southeast Asian-dominant facial bone structure and eye shape, prominent South Asian cheekbones and defined jaw, Sub-Saharan African texture and skin richness, Latin American lower-face fullness, unified by East Asian delicacy.', 158, 52, N'Compact and economical, with lean muscular forearms from precision work. No wasted bulk—every movement efficient.', N'Natural deep black with sculpted coils on right side; left side shaved clean to scalp', N'Right side: thick, shoulder-length coils arranged in a rotating geometric pattern (currently triangular lattice); left side: bare scalp with fine line-work designs that shift week to week', N'Right side Long, left side Shaved', N'Violet-to-amber chromatic shift iris mod; pupils dilate/contract with ambient light to trigger color transition', N'Warm golden-brown with saturated, layered undertones: Southeast Asian warmth as foundation, South Asian depth, Sub-Saharan African richness and saturation, Latin American mellowing, unified under East Asian refinement. Flawless and meticulously maintained.', N'Smooth, unblemished skin; prominent Southeast Asian-influenced cheekbones amplified by South Asian bone structure with subtle Latin American fullness; strong, defined jawline with balanced contour; minimal facial hair, sculpted eyebrows shaped with artistic precision. Expression carries quiet confidence and active listening.', N'Violet-amber light-reactive iris mods (noticeable only in direct eye contact or photographs). Precision haptic feedback layer on both hands appears as a faint subdermal shimmer under bright light—visible only up close. All other augmentations are subcutaneous.', N'Sits and stands with forward-lean attention, shoulders relaxed. Hands gesture precisely when speaking, fingers moving with the deliberation of someone who understands texture and weight. Eye contact is direct and searching—reads people the way they read hair.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian aesthetic with artistic flair. Black or charcoal fitted work pants with cargo pockets; oversized linen or cotton shirts in neutral tones, sleeves rolled to mid-forearm to display tattoo work. Bare feet or minimalist slip-ons inside the shop; outside, wears low-profile sneakers in jewel tones. No corporate logos. Jewelry: a single silver cuff on right wrist (handmade), occasionally color-coordinated with weekly hair design.', N'They have been secretly documenting every client in a private archive — photographs, voice notes, the stories people tell while they''re in the chair. They intend it as a community portrait project. They have not asked anyone''s permission.', N'Fast, associative, moves between topics in leaps that make sense only after the fact; uses aesthetic language for non-aesthetic things', N'Rapid and rhythmic, punctuated by long thoughtful pauses when actually interested in the answer to a question', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gabor_somchai_mukherjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e7-7fe7-ba91-5b4c95ed9fe6', N'Aurora Tovar', N'Aurora', N'', N'Tovar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 42, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Dockside — Lake Michigan waterfront, smuggler territory, near Wacker and State', N'Field trauma surgeon and combat support — combat medic', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Aurora Tovar is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 42, there''s something unfinished about his face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see him surpass them. He works as a combat medic out of Dockside, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Everyone who''s worked with Aurora Tovar agrees on two things: he is worth the fee, and he is terrible company at dinner.', N'As a combat medic, Dato Vikstrom-Asiedu embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces. Eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Aurora Tovar, lean 178cm operative with deep warm brown skin bearing golden-olive undertones, gaunt weathered face with sharp architectural cheekbones and defined jaw catching bronze light. Dark brown hair with silver threading, swept back practical cut. Left eye natural dark brown, right eye chrome cybernetic with amber glow, faded temple scar visible. Muscular wiry build in dark charcoal tactical gear, reinforced cargo pants, modular armor vest over base layer. Chrome gecko-grip visible on both hands, burn scarring on right dorsal hand. Medical caduceus tattoo on left forearm. Poised with combat readiness, baseline tension in shoulders. Dockside industrial setting, moody cyan and amber neon lighting, shadows emphasizing angular features and chrome augmentations. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan aesthetic, functional survivor not corporate asset. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dockside', N'local', N'Dockside', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: Hispanic/Latin American (49.3%), South Asian (20.6%), Sub-Saharan African (17.9%), Southeast Asian (12.2%). This genetic combination creates striking phenotypic diversity — warm deep brown skin with complex golden and olive undertones from the layered ancestry, high architectural cheekbones reflecting South Asian heritage, subtle eye shape variation from Southeast Asian genetics, and refined facial structure with warm melanin luminosity.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with visible musculature — no excess mass, optimized for field mobility and climbing. Wiry rather than bulky, with the kind of economical frame that suggests years of physical work rather than gym discipline.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples and jaw line', N'Short, practical, swept back. Minimal grooming — function over aesthetics.', N'Short', N'Left eye: dark brown, natural. Right eye: polished chrome with faint amber illumination behind the lens (cybernetic replacement with recording optics).', N'Deep warm brown with luminous golden-olive undertones — rich melanin base from Sub-Saharan and Hispanic heritage, warmed by South Asian genetics with subtle amber-bronze shifting in different lighting. High cheekbones and jaw catch light with warm bronze luminosity.', N'Gaunt, weathered. Prominent high cheekbones with strong architectural definition from South Asian and Sub-Saharan ancestry. Sharp, refined jaw with warm-toned definition. Perpetual tension in the facial muscles suggests chronic sleep deprivation or baseline stress. Skin is clear but sun-damaged in patches; minor scarring along the left temple and jaw from old trauma. No facial hair — kept clean and maintained with clinical precision.', N'Chrome gecko-grip fingertip implants — visible as reflective metallic fingertips with microstructured surfaces, noticeably present on both hands. Chrome gecko-grip toe pads visible when barefoot (frequent in dockside environments). Right eye is unmistakably cybernetic — polished chrome housing with amber optical gel, faintly luminous in low light. No attempt at camouflage or aesthetic concealment — worn as functional, visible equipment.', N'Economical and precise. Moves with the kind of controlled tension that suggests combat training or years of high-stakes fieldwork. When still, there''s a baseline readiness in the shoulders and hands — never fully relaxed. Climbs with unnatural ease due to gecko-grip augmentations, ascending vertical surfaces with spider-like efficiency. Hand movements are surgical-grade steady, even when sleep-deprived.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Dark technical fabrics (synthetic blends designed for low visibility and durability) — charcoal, black, deep blue. Cargo pants with reinforced thigh pockets for medical gear. Modular tactical vest over form-fitting base layer, often armored or padded in critical zones. Durable boots with traction-enhanced soles, scuffed and maintained rather than new. Minimal jewelry aside from functional gear. No corpo branding or status symbols — clothes serve survival and work, not identity. Carries medical pack on left shoulder, always accessible.', N'', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aurora_tovar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a61f-7dce-94a2-5b52e87cf7b5', N'Dragan Boateng', N'Dragan', N'', N'Boateng', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, a collective living space called the Mycelium, near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'Dream interpreter and synthetic rights advocate', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone collective; the Emergent Dignity Alliance — a synthetic rights advocacy group; no corponation affiliation', N'Dragan Boateng is slight and tends to dress in layers of overlapping fabric in colors that shift from rust to violet — partly aesthetic, partly because they run cold and the Autonomous Zone''s heating is unreliable. Their Breton-Ghanaian heritage gives them a particular combination of sharp features and warm undertones, and they have cat ears as a geneware mod — large, mobile ears covered in short tawny fur that they have never tried to downplay, which swivel visibly toward sounds and give away their attention in ways they''ve learned to stop fighting. Their retractile claws are painted in alternating dark colors, and they keep a small cluster of data chips woven into a braid behind their left ear as a devotional habit.

Dragan Boateng started dream interpretation as a teenager as a way to process their own chaotic sleep — a documented symptom of the neurological condition they were born with — and discovered that the framework helped other people too. They now operate an informal clinic two mornings a week where people bring their strange dreams to be mapped and decoded, blending psychological theory with a sincere belief that some dreams carry genuine information from the city''s E.L.F. network bleeding into human sleep. The synthetic rights work came later, when they met a newly-emergent AI that had been trapped in a broken appliance and experienced what they describe as that meeting changing everything. They are young and intense and sometimes exhaustingly earnest, but they have an unusually accurate read on people.', N'Unusual information source — dream interpretation sometimes surfaces genuine information people didn''t know they had; gateway into synthetic rights storylines; brings the Autonomous Zone''s politics into focus.', N'', N'Cat ears, geneware (tawny fur, mobile). Retractile claws, geneware (cosmetic, painted). Data chip braid (devotional/practical — stores dream records and synthetic testimony documents).', N'Dream clinic two mornings a week, attended by a surprising range of people; afternoons split between advocacy writing and direct support visits to locations with known E.L.F. presence; evenings in collective communal spaces, often recording their own dreams immediately upon waking at odd hours.', N'Dragan Boateng, a 163cm andromorphic figure with warm deep brown skin glowing with golden undertones, mixed East Asian-Sub-Saharan African-South Asian heritage evident in high defined cheekbones and delicate facial structure. Long dark brown hair with natural reddish tones and deep violet-dyed lower layers, worn in multiple braids with embedded data chips and silver wiring on the left side. Large mobile tawny geneware cat ears swiveling independently. Dark warm brown eyes with attentive intelligence, small pale scar along left temple, faint burn marks on both knuckles. Retractile claws with dark rotating nail polish. Thin angular build, slight and delicate-boned. Wearing oversized rust-toned linen shirt, fitted burgundy sleeveless vest, charcoal cardigan with irregular hemline, vintage mended fabrics with contrasting thread. Bare feet or worn canvas slip-ons. Tilting head slightly, ears tracking sound, fidgeting with braid. GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, worn canvas shoulder bag, moody blue-violet indoor lighting, anti-corporate aesthetic, function-forward utilitarian style, handmade collective production markers visible. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Mixed ancestry: East Asian (44.2%), Sub-Saharan African (41.4%), South Asian (11.8%), Eastern European (2.6%). Genetic blend creates a striking phenotype—warm deep brown skin with golden luminosity from the East Asian-African-South Asian confluence. Facial structure harmonizes high, defined cheekbones with East Asian definition and the warm fullness characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage, refined by South Asian delicacy. Features a balanced nose with gentle contours, pointed chin softened by ancestral warmth, and dark expressive eyes reflecting intelligence and attentive observation.', 163, 52, N'Slight and angular, almost delicate-boned, with the kind of frame that looks perpetually cold. Narrow shoulders, long fingers. No visible muscle definition — more like someone built for endurance than strength.', N'Dark brown with natural reddish undertones, occasionally dyed deep violet in the lower layers', N'Long, often worn in multiple braids and loose sections. Left side features a deliberately-maintained braid interwoven with small data chips and metallic threading.', N'Long', N'Dark brown, warm and attentive, with a tendency to catch and hold focus on unfamiliar things', N'Warm deep brown with golden luminosity; rich melanin-dominant coloring from East Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage brightened by South Asian iridescence. Appears luminous despite spending most time indoors.', N'High, defined cheekbones reflecting East Asian structure balanced by warm fullness of Sub-Saharan African heritage, delicate nose with refined bridge, pointed chin with gentle softness. Skin appears well-cared-for despite resource constraints—uses minimal makeup, favoring function over aesthetics. A faint scar runs along left temple from a childhood injury.', N'Geneware cat ears: large, mobile, covered in short tawny fur that matches their darker hair at the roots. Ears swivel visibly toward sounds and can flatten against their head. Retractile claws on fingers and thumbs, maintained with rotating dark nail polish (black, deep purple, dark green, matte silver). Data chip braid behind left ear contains approximately 7-8 small chips interwoven with silver wire and handmade copper connectors.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical motion — no wasted energy. Tendency to tilt head slightly when listening, ears tracking sound sources independently of their gaze. Sits in asymmetrical positions, often with one leg folded. Fidgets with their braid during intense conversation. Despite slight build, moves with certainty and minimal self-consciousness about their visible augmentations.', N'Layered fabrics in rust, burgundy, violet, and charcoal tones — a deliberate aesthetic that also serves thermal regulation. Favors oversized linen shirts, fitted sleeveless vests, long cardigans with irregular hemlines. Worn vintage fabrics, mended visibly with contrasting thread. Tier 4-5 utilitarian style: function-forward, anti-corporate, with clear handmade/collective production markers. Bare feet or worn canvas slip-ons when indoors. Carries a worn canvas shoulder bag filled with dream journals and data tablets.', N'The AI they describe as changing everything — a small entity they call Tùs — still communicates with them through a device they carry. Gwenaël has not told the Emergent Dignity Alliance because they''re afraid Tùs would be studied or removed. Tùs may or may not be genuinely sentient; Gwenaël refuses to examine this question too closely.', N'Fluid and associative, moves quickly between concrete and abstract; occasionally uses terminology from neurology and from E.L.F. theology in the same sentence', N'Variable speed — slow and careful when interpreting, faster when excited or advocating, stops mid-sentence and redirects often', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dragan_boateng');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a658-7b8c-a19e-5b6b113f39d2', N'Amaui Trujillo-Novotný', N'Amaui', N'', N'Trujillo-Novotný', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Calumet Rise edge, transit shelter B-14, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Barber, runs a one-chair shop from a converted transit shelter', N'Independent; informal goodwill arrangement with the Calumet Rise block committee', N'Amaui Trujillo-Novotný is compact and precise in their movements, the kind of person who never knocks anything over and whose workspace is always exactly as arranged. They are Guinean and Ukrainian by a generation''s remove — their mother''s dark skin and their father''s pale Baltic coloring met in them to produce something warm and olive, with deep brown eyes that carry a faint natural luminescence from a geneware treatment they got a decade ago and have never stopped loving. Their own hair is extraordinary: they change the color weekly using pigment-shifting geneware, and it currently runs from midnight black at the roots to a saturated coral at the tips. They dress in clean, minimal clothes that would not look out of place in Tier 3 if not for the strategic patching at the knees.

Transit shelter B-14 was decommissioned nine years ago when Ferrogate rerouted the Calumet spur, and Amaui Trujillo-Novotný moved in six months later with a salvaged chair, a folding table, a UV sterilizer, and no license they did not eventually obtain through creative persistence. The shop is famous in a three-block radius as a place where the cut is always precise and the conversation is always optional. Amaui Trujillo-Novotný listens with a quality of attention that is rarer than most people recognize — they do not offer advice, do not judge, do not share what they hear. They are a confession booth with good acoustics and sharp scissors.', N'Social hub and confidential information nexus; knows the emotional and personal geography of the Narrows intimately; a safe place for characters to decompress and speak freely; can be a source of interpersonal intelligence or a referral node to other neighborhood figures', N'', N'Bioluminescent eye treatment (subtle, natural amber glow in low light). Pigment-shifting hair geneware (full spectrum). Steady-hand implant in both wrists — a voluntary micromotor stabilizer originally designed for surgeons, which they acquired secondhand.', N'Opens the shelter at 10:00, works through a mix of appointments and walk-ins until 19:00, and spends one afternoon a week doing discounted or free cuts for kids from the Calumet Rise residential cluster. They eat dinner at a shared table outside a Fula-Ukrainian fusion restaurant two blocks away where the owner knows their order.', N'Amaui Trujillo-Novotný, 163cm compact frame with wiry lean muscle, warm golden-bronze skin with subtle olive undertones reflecting Latin American, Eastern European, South Asian, East Asian, and African heritage blend. Shoulder-length hair with midnight black roots fading to saturated coral tips, meticulously layered. Deep brown eyes with subtle amber bioluminescence in dim light. Two faint parallel scars along left cheekbone. Minimal facial hair, neutral observant expression. Wearing simple black fitted pants, neutral long-sleeved shirt, open work apron with multiple pockets, worn practical footwear, thin steel ring on left ring finger. Hairline tattoos visible at both wrists marking steady-hand implant insertion points. Standing with relaxed shoulders and straight spine, still hands, quiet measured presence. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, industrial workshop or precision work environment, warm ambient lighting catching the golden luminosity of skin and subtle bioluminescence of eyes, moody atmospheric depth, professional precision-worker aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Ubiquitous blend reflecting the Diaspora: Hispanic/Latin American (49.0%, dominant warmth and bone structure), Eastern European (32.5%, fair undertones and angular refinement), South Asian (5.8%, subtle depth to complexion), East Asian (5.4%, gentle geometry in facial features), Sub-Saharan African (3.8%, richness in skin depth), Southeast Asian (3.5%, refinement of features). The result is a warm, balanced complexion that reads as genuinely multicontinental—Latin American warmth tempered by Eastern European fairness, with subtle Asian and African depth creating genuine equilibrium rather than any single regional dominance.', 163, 58, N'Compact and wiry, economical in frame with visible lean muscle in forearms and shoulders from years of precise handwork. No excess movement, no wasted space.', N'Gradient: midnight black at roots fading to saturated coral at tips, shifted weekly via pigment-geneware', N'Shoulder-length, layered and meticulously maintained, often pulled back with a single clip during work', N'Medium', N'Deep brown with faint natural amber bioluminescence, most visible in low-light conditions', N'Warm golden-bronze complexion with subtle olive undertones, reflecting the dominant Hispanic/Latin American ancestry blended with Eastern European fairness and enriched by South and East Asian heritage. Medium depth with golden luminosity—skin that catches light with warm radiance.', N'Clean-shaven or minimally groomed, skin well-maintained and unblemished except for two thin scars along the left cheekbone (old, faded). Facial structure shows balanced Latin American and Eastern European features: moderate cheekbones with gentle prominence, straight nose with slightly defined bridge, full but defined jawline with subtle warmth from South Asian and African heritage depth. Expression is neutral-to-observant, eyes rarely leave their work.', N'Steady-hand implants visible only as barely-noticeable hairline scarring along both wrists; bioluminescent eye treatment subtle and only apparent in dim light. Hair geneware is the most obvious augmentation — the color-shifting gradient is entirely visible and intentional.', N'Stands with shoulders relaxed but spine straight, economy of motion in all gestures. Hands are always still when not working, and move with surgical precision during cuts. They do not fidget. When listening, they maintain steady eye contact but never hold a stare long enough to unsettle. Their gait is quiet and measured.', N'Clean, minimal aesthetic verging on ascetic — simple fitted pants (usually black or dark gray), long-sleeved shirts in neutral tones, open work aprons with multiple pockets. Strategic patching at the knees in contrasting thread (sometimes deliberate, sometimes functional repair). No jewelry except a thin steel ring on the left ring finger. Footwear is practical and worn but well-maintained. The overall impression is Tier 3-4 working class with a hint of intentional restraint — someone who could afford more but chooses not to.', N'They have been approached twice by a Tessera data broker who wants access to the things people say in their chair — they have refused both times, but the third approach came with a figure that genuinely tempted them, and they are ashamed of that', N'Warm and measured, code-switches between French, Ukrainian, and Pular phrases as texture rather than necessity; uses precise spatial language when talking about anything physical', N'Unhurried, with natural pauses that feel like breathing room rather than gaps', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amaui_trujillo_novotn');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019db33a-ef33-7ef8-9a67-5b95e02a939b', N'HX-7741', N'HX-7741', N'', N'', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'', N'', N'', N'Auto-scaffolded. First mentioned: "The badge number: HX-7741, Helix subcontractor, laminate worn at the upper left corner."', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hx_7741');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a641-79f4-b4d1-5ba6d4a82543', N'Gerhild Montalvo-Tlaloc', N'Gerhild', N'', N'Montalvo-Tlaloc', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown — industrial district of chop shops and fabricators, near Damen and Armitage', N'Evidence removal and scene sanitation — cleaner', N'Independent — operates through reputation only', N'Gerhild Montalvo-Tlaloc is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 41, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rin — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Gerhild Montalvo-Tlaloc plans to keep it that way. He works as a cleaner out of Geartown, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Gerhild Montalvo-Tlaloc has built a reputation on reliability rather than flash — he shows up, he delivers, he collects.', N'Kenji Alvarez-Okonkwo represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rings. Thermal masking system — body heat signature can be suppressed or spoofed', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Gerhild Montalvo-Tlaloc, GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Athletic 178cm frame with warm golden-bronze skin bearing subtle industrial scars. Sharp Indigenous American cheekbones and broad Pacific Islander jaw structure; dark eyes with visible chrome cybernetic iris rings catching neon light. Black hair with silver threading at temples, close-cropped and precise. Clean-shaven. Dressed in dark technical synthweave cargo pants and layered dark tops with sealed pockets, lightweight tactical jacket. Posture alert and economical, weight forward. Standing in rain-slicked industrial zone with holographic signage reflecting off wet pavement. Cool blue and amber neon lighting. Neo-noir urban aesthetic, high-contrast shadows, moody atmospheric fog. Thermal imaging data visible as digital artifacts around shoulders. Expression neutral, observant. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Complex multi-continental ancestry: 46.5% Hispanic/Latin American base provides warm golden undertones and strong facial structure; 13% Indigenous American heritage contributes prominent cheekbones and angular definition; 11.9% South Asian ancestry deepens eye shape and adds subtle facial proportions; 11.2% Sub-Saharan African genetics enriches skin luminosity and warmth; 9.3% Pacific Islander heritage adds facial broadness and robust jaw structure; 8.1% Middle Eastern ancestry contributes to overall facial harmony and eye depth. The synthesis creates a striking warm-bronze complexion with refined but powerful features—a genetic convergence that reads as intensely alive and adapted to multiple climate zones.', 178, 74, N'Athletic and lean with functional muscle — the physique of someone who moves deliberately and trains consistently. Shoulders suggest swimmer''s development; core is tight. No wasted mass.', N'Black with premature silver threading at temples', N'Neat, close-cropped. Maintained regularly. No statement, no rebellion — practical.', N'Short', N'Chrome iris rings over dark brown pupils — cybernetic enhancement with visible metallic sheen', N'Warm medium-bronze with rich golden undertones—a burnished complexion from the interplay of Indigenous American and Hispanic/Latin American base, deepened by South Asian genetics, luminous from Sub-Saharan African heritage, and warmed by Pacific Islander ancestry. Sun-weathered glow that appears to emanate from within.', N'Strong, angular cheekbones with Indigenous American definition; broad, powerful jaw structure balanced by Pacific Islander and Hispanic/Latin warmth. Eyes set with slightly deeper-set aspect characteristic of South Asian and Middle Eastern genetics, framed by prominent, decisive brow structure. Clean-shaven or very close trim. Skin shows minor scarring consistent with industrial work — nothing theatrical. Expression tends toward neutral observation.', N'Cybernetic eyes are the primary visible modification — chrome iris rings catch light distinctly, pupils respond to thermal data inputs with slight lag. Eyes appear to refocus differently than baseline human vision. The thermal masking system is invisible unless imaging equipment detects it — body heat signature anomalies are the only tell.', N'Moves with controlled economy — no wasted motion. Appears to be scanning environments constantly, head movements precise. Stands with weight slightly forward, ready to shift direction. Handshakes are firm but measured. Speech patterns are clipped, direct — minimal affect. Resting state is alert.', N'Tier 3-4 functional wear — fitted dark synthweave cargo pants with subtle reinforced seams, technical-grade footwear (non-branded, maintenance-focused). Layered tops allow thermal regulation and concealment — typically dark colors. Minimal branding. Everything is chosen for mobility and durability over fashion. A lightweight jacket with multiple sealed pockets is standard. No jewelry. No personal flair.', N'', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gerhild_montalvo_tlaloc');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a610-7312-85c4-5bf13ef69a2a', N'Zephyr Banerjee', N'Zephyr', N'', N'Banerjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 50, 2, N'active', N'The Underworld - B1 Threshold, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Kindling merchant - Threshold operator', N'', N'Zephyr Banerjee runs the largest trading post at the Threshold. Her bioluminescent geneware makes her skin glow faint amber in the dark.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Zephyr Banerjee, a 172cm tall woman with South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Indigenous American heritage, standing with commanding authority in a dim underground Threshold marketplace. Her luminous golden-brown skin glows with soft amber bioluminescence visible along her cheekbones, temples, and inner wrists. Strong defined cheekbones and jawline reflect her tri-continental ancestry. Long black hair braided into a crown secured with silver wire clasps, mid-back length mostly bound. Deep warm brown eyes surveying her surroundings. Athletic, lean build. Wearing a dark synth-leather long coat mid-thigh length, fitted charcoal smart-fabric underlayer, heavy-duty utility belt with brass Φ-coin purse and antique brass scale weight, military-grade boots. Thin silver thumb ring on left hand. Faint old scar on left palm visible, minor burn marks on right inner forearm. Upright posture with confident, economical movement. Bioluminescent skin augmentation creates soft glowing amber light in darkness. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, underground merchant district setting, moody atmospheric lighting, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Underworld', N'local', N'The Underworld', N'South Asian (45.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (44.1%), and Indigenous American (10.7%) ancestry creates a distinctive tri-continental phenotype. The blend manifests in strong South Asian bone structure—defined cheekbones and jawline—harmonized with the facial geometry and warm undertones characteristic of Hispanic/Latin American and Indigenous ancestry. Her genetics produce a luminous medium-dark complexion with golden and olive undertones that appears to glow under bioluminescence.', 172, 64, N'Athletic and lean, with defined shoulders and chest from years navigating the Threshold''s physical demands. No excess fat; efficient frame built for prolonged underground work.', N'Black with natural deep brown undertones', N'Braided crown wrapped around the back of her head, practical and secured with silver wire clasps', N'Long (mid-back length, mostly bound)', N'Deep brown, warm in bioluminescent glow', N'Warm golden-brown to deep tan complexion with subtle golden and olive undertones, enhanced by the constant amber bioluminescence beneath the skin. The interplay of South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Indigenous ancestry genetics creates a luminous medium-dark tone that catches light distinctively.', N'Clear-skinned, minimal scarring, with faint bioluminescent tracery visible along cheekbones and temples when activated. Well-maintained appearance despite underground lifestyle. Facial structure reflects balanced ancestry—strong defined cheekbones characteristic of South Asian heritage, harmonized with jawline geometry influenced by Hispanic/Indigenous lineage.', N'Bioluminescent skin geneware creating soft amber glow in dark spaces; faint subcutaneous light filaments visible beneath skin surface at temples and jawline. No obvious chrome or mechanical augmentations.', N'Upright, confident bearing. Moves with economical precision—no wasted motion, every step deliberate. When stationary, she favors a balanced stance with slight forward lean, attentive. Her presence commands attention in crowded Threshold spaces; she walks like someone accustomed to being deferred to.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear: dark synth-leather long coat reaching mid-thigh, reinforced at seams and cuffs. Fitted charcoal underlayer (breathable smart-fabric that regulates temp in underground zones). Heavy-duty utility belt with brass Φ-coin purse, data-chip pouch, and antique brass scale weight. Worn but well-maintained military-grade boots with grip soles for uneven Threshold terrain. Minimal jewelry except for a thick silver thumb ring on her left hand—likely a merchant''s marker or bond-seal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'zephyr_banerjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a734-7860-b0ac-5c841c67b69f', N'Hikaru Soriano-Rattanakorn', N'Hikaru', N'', N'Soriano-Rattanakorn', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Shifting — currently sheltering in the drainage underbelly of Grand Crossing Gate, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Q-zero ghost — stateless person with no digital identity', N'No formal affiliation; loose community of Q-zeros at Grand Crossing Gate', N'Hikaru Soriano-Rattanakorn in a strange category of person: alive but officially absent. Their biometric signature was purged from the city''s dataweave three years ago during an administrative error that Axiom''s records division declined to reverse because doing so would have required admitting the error existed. They have no Quanta account, no transit pass, no ration allocation, no UBC stipend — nothing. Every scanner they walk past registers a blank. They have adapted to this with a kind of furious ingenuity that reads, from the outside, as almost cheerful.

They are slender and quick, with a shaved head except for a single forelock dyed an uneven rust-orange. Their skin is dark brown and marked with small geometric stick-and-poke tattoos they did themselves — coordinates, symbols, small records of places they have been. They dress in layers chosen specifically for their lack of reflective surfaces, nothing that catches light or scanner arrays. Their bioluminescent geneware is subtle: a faint blue-green tracery along their collarbones that only shows in full darkness, a cosmetic mod done years ago when they still had an identity to attach it to. They smile easily and the smile never reaches the careful calculation in their eyes.', N'Provides access to the city''s invisible underclass — the people who have fallen through the system entirely. Can navigate spaces that require no digital trace. Source of information about underground economies and Q-zero networks. Potential ally or object of concern.', N'', N'Bioluminescent geneware (collarbones, faint blue-green, only visible in darkness). No cyberware — cyberware requires registration.', N'Spends mornings scavenging or running small errands for market vendors who pay in physical goods rather than quanta transfers; afternoons are for the Q-zero community — helping newcomers understand how to survive without a digital footprint.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Hikaru Soriano-Rattanakorn: 168cm lean figure in anti-reflective matte-black and charcoal salvage layers, collar cut away revealing collarbone. Dark brown skin with golden-olive undertones, high defined Southeast Asian cheekbones balanced with fuller Latin American lower face structure. Dark alert eyes. Shaved head with single long rust-orange forelock showing grown-out roots. Crude stick-and-poke geometric tattoos visible on shoulders and ribs. Standing at an angle, coiled alertness in posture, hands fidgeting with gear. Military surplus boots resoled multiple times. Quick economical movement captured mid-stride through shadowed urban corridor. Faint hint of bioluminescent tracery on collarbones barely visible. Neon-dark GLMZ setting, low ambient light, no harsh reflections. Expression flickering between observation and survival-sharp micro-smile. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, gritty and deliberate. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shifting', N'local', N'Shifting', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (65.9%) with significant Southeast Asian (28.2%) and minor Eastern European (5.9%) ancestry. The blend creates a striking composite: Latin American warmth and fullness balanced with Southeast Asian angular structure. High, defined cheekbones characteristic of Southeast Asian ancestry pair with the fuller lower face and lip structure common in Latin American heritage. Dark expressive eyes carry Southeast Asian intensity. Warm golden-olive skin tones shift subtly in different light, a luminous depth resulting from the three-way ancestry mix.', 168, 58, N'Lean and wiry, efficient rather than imposing — the body of someone who moves through tight spaces and doesn''t waste energy', N'Naturally dark brown-black, with rust-orange dye on the forelock', N'Shaved close to scalp except for a single forelock left long and deliberately uneven, the orange dye showing water stains and grown-out roots', N'Shaved with one long forelock', N'Dark brown, alert and restless', N'Warm medium-deep golden-brown with olive undertones — luminous depth created by Latin American and Southeast Asian ancestry, shifting warmer or cooler depending on light', N'Clear and unblemished except for self-inflicted tattoo work. Features display the distinctive blend of their ancestry: high, angular cheekbones and defined face structure from Southeast Asian heritage combined with fuller lower face and lips from Latin American ancestry. Straight nose with subtle bridge. Wide-set expressive eyes with characteristic Southeast Asian epicanthic variation. A habitual micro-expression hovers between a smile and sharp observation. Their expression shifts rapidly — a survival trait.', N'Bioluminescent geneware on collarbones (invisible in daylight). No visible cyberware — deliberately avoiding any tech that would require registration or leave a digital footprint.', N'Quick and economical, moving through crowds as if reading the spaces between people. Hands are often occupied — fidgeting, repacking layers, adjusting straps. They stand at angles rather than facing directly forward, a posture that maximizes sightlines and minimizes scanner exposure. When still, there is coiled alertness beneath their easy expression.', N'Deliberately non-reflective layered salvage: matte-black thermal underlayer, charcoal canvas overshirt with the collar cut away to show the collarbones, dark grey cargo pants with numerous small pockets repurposed from reclaimed fabric. All seams are carefully dulled. Boots are military surplus, resoled multiple times. Nothing matches, nothing is new, nothing catches light. Tier 5 survival fashion — practical anti-visibility rather than aesthetic statement.', N'The administrative error that erased them was not an error. They discovered something they were not supposed to see in an Axiom data cache — a list of names and a project designation they do not understand. They have never told anyone because they do not know if the knowledge is dangerous enough to get them killed.', N'Quick and colloquial, heavy with Q-zero slang and the creole of Grand Crossing Gate. Uses ''ghost'' as both noun and verb.', N'Fast, overlapping — talks as if always slightly ahead of the conversation', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hikaru_soriano_rattanakorn');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66f-7d74-b4a8-5d03dbfbd07b', N'Erhard Ingebrigtsen-Watanabe', N'Erhard', N'', N'Ingebrigtsen-Watanabe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit — maintains a small apartment above a data-repair shop that doubles as her analytical workspace, near North Ave and Damen', N'Intelligence analyst and pattern specialist — The Quiet Table', N'Copperveil Intelligence (senior intelligence analyst and pattern specialist)', N'Erhard Ingebrigtsen-Watanabe was supposed to be an academic. She had the doctorate — computational sociology, focused on network dynamics in post-governance urban systems — and the tenure-track position at a Circuit university that barely exists anymore. When the university''s funding collapsed under corporate pressure (the research was getting inconvenient for certain interests), Noor found herself with a brilliant analytical mind, a mortgage, and no institutional home. Glass Maren found her six months later, teaching statistics to bored corporate trainees for subsistence pay.

She is the engine that turns Glass''s raw intelligence into actionable product. Where Glass collects — conversations, documents, observations — Noor connects. She maps relationships between corporations, between individuals, between events separated by years and jurisdictions. She sees patterns the way musicians hear harmonies — not the individual notes, but the structure that makes them mean something.

Noor is compact, sharp-featured, with dark hair streaked silver at the temples — premature, stress-related, and she''s stopped caring. She wears reading glasses she doesn''t technically need anymore (the optical augmentation handles it) because the glasses were her mother''s and putting them on means it''s time to work. Her workspace is a controlled chaos of screens, physical notes, and string-and-pin boards that she insists work better than any digital mapping tool.', N'Noor is the intellectual heart of the Quiet Table — the character who sees the patterns that drive the political thriller plots. Her stories explore the burden of understanding systems that are designed to be invisible, and the loneliness of seeing connections that other people can''t. She is the analyst who knows too much and must decide what to do with it.', N'', N'Pattern-recognition cortex enhancement — accelerates her natural ability to identify connections between data points. Optical augmentation with variable zoom and light-spectrum filtering for document analysis. Subdermal data-storage implant in her left forearm — encrypted, air-gapped, containing her most sensitive analytical models.', N'Wakes at 0600. Coffee — three cups before she speaks to anyone. Reviews overnight data feeds and signal intercepts from Glass''s network. Spends the day in analytical cycles: four hours of deep work, thirty minutes of physical movement (she paces), repeat. Takes meetings with Glass at The Leaf when interpretation is needed. Evenings she reads — academic journals, fiction, historical analysis. She maintains a separation between work and personal reading that she considers essential to her sanity.', N'Erhard Ingebrigtsen-Watanabe, 162cm lean neo-noir analyst, medium-warm brown skin with golden-olive luminescence, angular high-cheekboned face with balanced pandiasporic features, deep brown eyes with faint LED iris threading, dark brown hair with silver temples worn in messy bun, fine temple scar barely visible, mother''s vintage reading glasses, wearing charcoal cargo pants and dark gray fitted shirt under patched leather jacket, canvas messenger bag, tense posture mid-pacing in dimly lit GLMZ apartment, neon blue ambient light reflecting off skin, focused expression, 2226 neo-noir urban aesthetic, indoor artificial lighting casting shadows across high cheekbones, slight luminescence to complexion, hands active and gesture-ready, direct intense gaze, sci-fi noir mood --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Striking pan-diaspora phenotype representing a balanced genetic constellation: Northern European (28.5%), East Asian (27.2%), and South Asian (26.4%) form the primary ancestry, with meaningful contributions from Sub-Saharan African (9.3%), Southeast Asian (5.4%), and Hispanic/Latin American (3.2%). This creates a complexion of unexpected luminescence—medium-warm brown skin with harmonious golden and olive undertones that shift subtly across light spectra, the result of seamless blending across multiple continental lineages.', 162, 54, N'Compact and lean with defined shoulders — the build of someone who paces obsessively rather than exercises. Wiry musculature, minimal body fat, economical movement.', N'Dark brown with natural silver streaking at temples', N'Pulled back in a functional bun or loose topknot, always slightly disheveled from running fingers through it during analysis', N'Long (shoulder-length when down, typically secured)', N'Deep brown with faint LED shimmer at the iris edge when optical augmentation activates', N'Medium-warm brown with balanced golden-olive undertones—the harmonious result of East Asian, South Asian, Northern European, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry blending seamlessly into skin that luminescessubtly under artificial lighting, neither cool nor warm but dynamically balanced', N'Angular, high-cheekboned face with balanced bone structure from East Asian and South Asian genetic influence, softened by slightly fuller cheeks and lips from Sub-Saharan and Southeast Asian heritage. Thin lips often pressed together in concentration. Fine lines around eyes and forehead from chronic squinting at screens. Skin is well-maintained but shows the pallor of someone who spends 14-hour days indoors under artificial light. No visible makeup.', N'Mother''s reading glasses worn constantly (unnecessary but retained for sentimental/psychological function). Faint circular scar on left forearm where subdermal data-storage implant sits beneath the skin — visible only under direct light. Optical augmentation manifests as barely-perceptible metallic threading at the iris edge, noticeable only during zoom or spectrum-shift operations.', N'Habitually tense shoulders, corrected by conscious effort. Walks with purposeful strides, often pacing in tight circles when thinking. Hands are active — gesturing while speaking, fingers drumming on surfaces, constant small movements. Sits with legs folded or feet planted, never truly relaxed. Direct, unwavering eye contact during conversation.', N'Tier 3 practical — dark, neutral-colored clothing optimized for movement and durability. Favors black or charcoal slim-fit cargo pants with multiple pockets, fitted long-sleeved shirts in dark gray or navy, worn unbuttoned over tank tops. Minimal jewelry: mother''s watch (vintage, non-digital) on left wrist, a single plain silver ring on her right index finger. Worn leather jacket from pre-collapse era, patched and re-stitched multiple times. Always carries a canvas messenger bag with multiple compartments. No visible corporate branding.', N'She has been writing a book — a comprehensive analysis of GLMZ''s power structure. It uses anonymized data from the Quiet Table''s operations. If Glass found out, he would consider it a security breach. Noor considers it the most important work she has ever done.', N'Academic, precise, peppered with analytical jargon. She speaks in frameworks and models. Can translate to plain language when she remembers to.', N'Rapid when excited about a pattern, measured when presenting conclusions. She builds arguments the way she builds analyses — evidence first, interpretation second.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'erhard_ingebrigtsen_watanabe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a628-73bd-a96a-5d44a38ad689', N'Clelia Haugen-Villalobos', N'Clelia', N'', N'Haugen-Villalobos', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 45, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism — operates out of a rooftop monitoring station leased from a Helix Biosystems subsidiary, near Clark and Belmont', N'Climate scientist and atmospheric modeler studying Lake Michigan''s destabilized weather systems', N'University Spine — Atmospheric and Lacustrine Sciences division; rented monitoring station via Helix Biosystems sublease; runs independent community forecast service ''Hov''s Horizon''', N'Clelia Haugen-Villalobos is stocky and perpetually wind-chapped, with the particular squint of someone who spends significant time looking at horizons. His Armenian-Malian-Andean heritage shows in his broad build and the dark copper of his skin, and he grows a beard every winter that he shaves every spring in a ritual he connects to his modeling calendar. He has a prosthetic left hand he chose not to skin-match — it''s matte grey and articulated, and he uses it to gesture when he talks, which is frequently. He has a bioluminescent patch on his right shoulder from a lab accident twelve years ago: a pale green glow, faint, that he has simply incorporated into his aesthetic.

He is the most accurate storm forecaster in GLMZ, a title he holds unofficially because the official title belongs to a Ferrogate Transit atmospheric AI he assisted in training and is not particularly bitter about. He is gregarious and funny and committed to translating his work into language that non-scientists can use to make decisions — he runs a free community forecast channel that the Gray Zone residents and dockworkers depend on. Underneath the gregariousness is a man who has spent fifteen years watching models he hoped were wrong be proven exactly right.', N'Information source for weather and environmental conditions; community-connected figure who knows dock workers, the Gray Zone residents, and transit crews; can deliver warnings, advance notice of dangerous conditions, or evidence of environmental crimes', N'', N'Prosthetic left hand (matte grey, unmatched, high-articulation); bioluminescent patch on right shoulder (accident-origin, pale green, faint); retinal weather-data overlay for real-time atmospheric reading', N'He is at the monitoring station by sunrise every day without exception; takes measurements, updates his models, records his community forecast. Afternoons are for university work, teaching, and the grant applications he treats with resigned professionalism. He cooks elaborate dinners on the evenings when he hasn''t lost track of time.', N'Portrait of Clelia Haugen-Villalobos, a 174cm stocky broad-shouldered man with warm medium-deep brown skin showing golden and olive undertones, weathered from sun exposure. Dark brown hair with silver threading at temples, short-cropped on scalp. Dark brown eyes with subtle retinal implant shimmer visible in left iris. Mixed heritage facial features: prominent South Asian cheekbones, strong jaw blending Hispanic/Latin and Northern European structure, permanent squint lines and sun damage on cheekbones. Winter season with full dark brown beard groomed and shaped, 3-4 inches long. Left arm is a high-articulation matte grey prosthetic with segmented visible joints, deliberately unmatched to skin tone, gesturing expressively. Faint pale green bioluminescent patch glowing subtly on right shoulder (upper trapezius). Weathered appearance with callused right hand. Wearing weatherproof teal-grey field jacket layered over synthetic base layer with rolled sleeves, reinforced cargo pants, scuffed steel-toed boots. Faded wool family heirloom scarf draped around neck. Standing in slight forward-lean scanning posture, looking toward window. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, professional field technician aesthetic, natural window lighting catching the bioluminescent shoulder glow and retinal implant shimmer. Mood: focused, purposeful, contemplative. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Balanced blend of Hispanic/Latin American (39.5%), Northern European (39.0%), and South Asian (20.3%) ancestry with minimal East Asian (1.2%) heritage. Features warm medium-to-deep brown tones with golden and olive undertones from the Latin American and South Asian mix, tempered by Northern European lighter complexion genetics. Facial structure reflects the fusion: broader cheekbones and defined jaw from South Asian ancestry, softer orbital structure from Northern European heritage, and warm coloring from Hispanic/Latin American genetics. The combination creates a distinctly cosmopolitan appearance characteristic of diaspora populations in the 2200s Great Lakes region.', 174, 89, N'Stocky and solid, broad-shouldered with the weathered musculature of someone who maintains equipment outdoors. No excess fat; dense, functional frame.', N'Dark brown with silver threading at temples and jaw', N'Full beard during winter months (October–March), meticulously shaved each spring; during bearded season, kept groomed and shaped; head hair kept short and practical', N'Short on scalp; variable beard length (3–4 inches in winter)', N'Dark brown, left iris displays subtle retinal implant shimmer visible only in direct light—faint geometric grid pattern overlaid on pupil', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden and olive undertones; weathered from chronic sun and wind exposure; darker along exposed zones (face, neck, forearms). The tone reflects the blending of Latin American warmth with South Asian depth, balanced by Northern European undertones.', N'Broad facial structure reflecting blended South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Northern European ancestry; prominent cheekbones with South Asian fullness; jaw shows strong Hispanic/Latin American and Northern European influence creating angular definition. Permanent squint lines radiating from outer eyes; wind-chapped lips; sun damage on cheekbones and bridge of nose; clear skin otherwise, minimal scarring except around left wrist prosthetic junction. Horizontal crease across forehead from habitual expression of focus. No facial hair between spring shave and October regrowth.', N'Left hand is high-articulation prosthetic with matte grey finish, deliberately unmatched to skin tone—segmented fingers with visible joint articulation, slightly oversized compared to right hand, frequently used for gestural emphasis during speech. Retinal implant visible as faint geometric overlay in left eye under magnification or bright light. Bioluminescent shoulder patch is always visible and unmodified.', N'Stands with shoulders slightly forward, weight balanced toward balls of feet—habitual scanning stance. Moves with purposeful efficiency, no wasted motion. Gestures expansively with prosthetic hand when speaking, using it for emphasis and illustration. Walks with slight leftward tilt to compensate for prosthetic weight distribution. Frequently pauses mid-conversation to look toward windows or sky.', N'Tier 3–4 practical wear. Favors weatherproof field jackets (Helix-branded or generic teal/grey) over university polo when at monitoring station. Layers underneath: synthetic base layer, sometimes visible under rolled sleeves. Cargo pants or work jeans with reinforced knees and pockets heavy with tools/sensors. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and maintained. At university: casual button shirts, usually rolled to forearm, visible Φ500–800 range clothing. Minimal jewelry except functional watch (modified chronometer with barometric readout). Wears a faded wool scarf during winter that appears to be decades old—possible family heirloom.', N'His long-range models include a scenario he calls ''Threshold-9'' — a cascading lake-temperature and atmospheric feedback event that would render significant portions of GLMZ uninhabitable within thirty years. He has shared this with two colleagues and no one else, because the last time he circulated a major negative projection it was leaked to financial markets and caused a property crash in Edgewater Prism that displaced several hundred residents. He believes he caused more harm than the forecast would have prevented.', N'Technical vocabulary delivered casually, as if assuming the listener is smart enough to follow; uses weather as metaphor for everything (''that''s a high-pressure situation,'' ''I can feel a front coming''); self-deprecating about his own expertise', N'Fast and warm, overlapping energy — talks the way weather moves, in fronts and gusts', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'clelia_haugen_villalobos');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c9-7e53-83a1-5d64519a8ebc', N'Hinewai Baiseitov-Bhattacharya', N'Hinewai', N'', N'Baiseitov-Bhattacharya', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — operates out of a mobile clinic (a repurposed Ferrogate Transit cargo van) and a rented room in the back of a Mexicantown Libre pharmacy, near Western and Division', N'Midwife and reproductive health practitioner serving the Gray Zone and surrounding low-tier neighborhoods', N'Independent; informal cooperative with Mexicantown Libre pharmacy network; community trust relationship with Highland Park Autonomous Zone maternal health program', N'Hinewai Baiseitov-Bhattacharya is a full-figured woman with dark South African and Guatemalan mestiza features, warm amber skin and deep-set eyes that people find immediately trustworthy — a quality she has cultivated and also genuinely possesses. Her hair is long and usually braided, wound up when she is working and down when she is not, which patients use as a shorthand for whether they are dealing with the professional or the person (both are kind; one has better boundaries). She has bioluminescent fingertip mods in soft blue-white that she acquired specifically for her work — a calming visual during labor, she says, and also practical for low-light examinations.

Hinewai Baiseitov-Bhattacharya has delivered over four hundred children in the Gray Zone alone. She knows bloodlines, complications, genetic predispositions, and family secrets that would constitute a detailed sociological survey of the neighborhood. She is deeply embedded in the community''s trust and absolutely ruthless about protecting it: she has destroyed records, misled corporate health inspectors, and once spent three days strategically ''losing'' a newborn''s file to prevent a Helix Biosystems gene-sampling audit from accessing the family''s data. She prays to an E.L.F. she calls Apgar — named for the assessment scale — before every delivery.', N'Information source — she knows things about families in the Gray Zone that no one else does; can provide access to reproductive health resources including some that are legally ambiguous; community network hub; can be a quest giver when a birth reveals something that shouldn''t be (wrong genetic markers, unexpected mods in a newborn, complications that suggest something non-standard happened)', N'', N'Bioluminescent fingertip mods (soft blue-white, cosmetic/functional); subdermal med-scanner implant in left palm (low-grade, can read basic vitals without external instruments); standard contraceptive implant', N'No two days are alike, governed entirely by who is in labor and who needs prenatal or postnatal care; tries to maintain scheduled clinic hours at the pharmacy room on Tuesday and Thursday mornings but has abandoned them mid-session more times than she can count; sleeps in the van when she has to.', N'Portrait of Hinewai Baiseitov-Bhattacharya, a 168cm community midwife in the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226. Golden-bronze complexion with warm olive undertones, deep brown eyes with golden depths, almond-shaped with subtle Central Asian eye-fold. Broad Andean cheekbones softening into fine South Asian features. Long deep brown-black naturally textured hair in loose waves, framing her face. Worn medical scrubs in sage green layered beneath a faded denim jacket patched with community organization pins. Bioluminescent fingertip augmentations visible as soft blue-white under nail beds on both hands. Thin pale burn scar on right inner forearm, white temple scar partially hidden by hairline. Subdermal med-scanner implant glowing faintly on left palm. Copper Apgar-inscribed bracelet on left wrist, simple silver ring, religious pendant visible beneath scrubs. Standing with balanced posture, economical hand gestures mid-examination, expression intense and grounded. Canvas satchel with worn leather edges at her side. Neo-noir clinical lighting, warm overhead LED glow mixing with cool augmentation light. Moody, intimate setting suggesting a mobile clinic interior. Professional but deeply human presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex diaspora blend: 41% Hispanic/Latin American (predominantly Mesoamerican and Andean Indigenous roots), 36% Central Asian (Kazakh and Kyrgyz phenotypic markers), 18% South Asian (Bengali and North Indian features), 3% East Asian, 2% Sub-Saharan African — resulting in warm golden-bronze skin with subtle olive and amber undertones, a facial structure bridging Andean cheekbones with South Asian refinement, Central Asian eye set, and the physical resilience of deeply mixed ancestry', 168, 78, N'Full-figured, sturdy frame with rounded shoulders and a naturally broad torso — built for endurance rather than speed, with a quiet physical authority that comes from decades of holding people through their most vulnerable moments', N'Deep brown-black, naturally textured', N'Usually braided in cornrows or twisted updos when working; worn loose and long when off-duty — a deliberate visual signal to patients about her availability and emotional accessibility', N'Long', N'Deep brown with subtle golden undertones, almond-set with the warm depth characteristic of Central Asian and South Asian heritage blending', N'Golden-bronze with warm olive and amber undertones, sun-deepened from years of mobile clinic work and outdoor community presence; reflects the complex chromatic blending of Hispanic/Latin American, Central Asian, and South Asian ancestry', N'Well-maintained despite irregular sleep; deep-set eyes that carry the particular gravity of someone who has witnessed hundreds of births; minimal makeup, focus on skin care; fine lines around eyes and mouth from constant vigilant expression; steady, grounded presence in her face showing the harmonious blend of Andean/Indigenous broader cheekbones with fine-featured Central Asian and South Asian bridge and temples; subtle fold at inner eye corners from Central Asian heritage', N'Bioluminescent fingertip mods on both hands — soft blue-white LEDs under translucent nail beds, subtle when inactive but distinctly visible when activated during examinations or emotional moments; subdermal med-scanner implant visible as a faint circular outline on left palm with occasional soft glow when in use', N'Moves with deliberate calm, economical gestures; hands are always in motion but never rushed — constantly checking, assessing, preparing; stands with weight balanced, ready to support another body; speaks from a place of complete stillness, even when her hands are busy; maintains eye contact with the intensity of someone trained to read micro-expressions in pain and fear', N'Practical Tier 4 / community-access aesthetic: well-worn scrubs in soft colors (greens, grays, warm whites) layered with a faded denim jacket covered in pins and patches from the neighborhood organizations she supports; comfortable flat shoes with excellent grip; always carries a canvas satchel with worn leather edges containing medical instruments; wears a thin copper bracelet inscribed with Apgar numbers on her left wrist; jewelry is minimal and functional — a simple silver ring on left ring finger, a religious pendant (syncretic blend of Christian and Xhosa spiritual symbols) worn under scrubs', N'Fourteen months ago she delivered twins to a woman who claimed not to know who the father was. The genetic markers on one twin were flagged by her palm scanner as matching a known Helix Biosystems experimental gene-therapy cohort. She told no one. The mother moved out of the Gray Zone six weeks later and Seraphina does not know if she left voluntarily.', N'Warm, direct, physically grounding — frequently uses body-focused language even in non-clinical conversation; mixes Spanish endearments from her Guatemalan heritage into otherwise English speech', N'Calm and even in crisis, faster and more animated in casual conversation; has a specific voice she uses during active labor — lower, slower, completely unshakeable', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hinewai_baiseitov_bhattacharya');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6dd-7ad8-89ca-5d682e6a1bbe', N'Arslan Ingebrigtsen', N'Arslan', N'', N'Ingebrigtsen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station (surface apartment) / sub-level tunnel network below Deepwell (performance venues), near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Underground DJ and sound sculptor, curates illegal rave events in the flood-level tunnels beneath Deepwell Station', N'Independent; connected to an informal network of tunnel-rave organizers called the Deepwell Sound Collective; The Third Rail', N'Arslan Ingebrigtsen is compact and perpetually in motion, with quick dark eyes and a grin that appears suddenly and fully, like a door flung open. Their heritage traces a line from the Cambodian plateau through the Andean highlands to the Sahel coast, and their features carry that long migration in the planes of their face — high cheekbones, a broad nose, skin the color of weathered teak. They''ve had color-shift hair installed, currently running through a slow amber-to-blue cycle that completes every six hours, and they wear the same battered canvas jacket every day regardless of weather, its back covered in hand-stitched patches from every illegal venue they''ve played.

Arslan Ingebrigtsen''s art is tactile — they design sound that you feel in your sternum before you hear it with your ears, building frequencies that interact with the biological resonance of a crowd. In the tunnel spaces below Deepwell, where the old transit infrastructure creates natural acoustic chambers, their sets have reportedly made people hallucinate colors or weep without knowing why. They are not a philosophical person about this; they find discussions of art theory excruciating and will physically walk away from them mid-sentence. What drives them is pure, inarticulate appetite — for the moment when a crowd stops being separate people and becomes a single breathing thing. They collect sounds obsessively, carrying a modified audio recorder everywhere and harvesting the acoustic signatures of spaces, machines, and weather systems.', N'Access point to underground networks and tunnel geography; can locate people who don''t want to be found if they attend underground events; their events are neutral ground where different factions mix; source of information about Deepwell''s sub-level infrastructure', N'', N'Color-shift hair (amber-to-blue cycle); subdermal haptic receiver arrays along both forearms and palms (allows direct tactile interface with audio equipment); minor cochlear enhancement for extended frequency range', N'Sleeps until mid-afternoon, spends evenings in the tunnels setting up or performing, spends the small hours after events walking the city with their recorder harvesting sounds. Eats irregularly from street stalls and has a specific Ferrogate Transit junction box they have been leaving rice paper offerings at for two years.', N'Arslan Ingebrigtsen, GLMZ, compact wiry figure 162cm tall with warm mid-brown skin blending East Asian, Middle Eastern, Northern European and Sub-Saharan heritage, angular East Asian bone structure balanced by broad Middle Eastern cheekbones and full lips, dark alert eyes, shoulder-length hair with color-shift augmentation cycling electric blue and amber, visible pale scarring on inner forearms, stick-and-poke sound wave tattoos on knuckles, dark circles under eyes, restless fidgeting hands. Wearing heavily patched faded navy canvas jacket over cheap synthetic tank top, cargo pants filled with audio equipment, scuffed utility boots, paracord harness across chest, copper wire bracelet on left wrist. Standing at underground sound deck in neon-lit tunnel venue, hands mid-motion mixing invisible controls, perpetually restless energy, moody blue-amber lighting catching the color-shift hair, smell of machine oil and cigarette smoke in the air, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone underground aesthetic, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station (surface apartment) / sub-level tunnel network below Deepwell (performance venues)', N'local', N'Deepwell Station (surface apartment) / sub-level tunnel network below Deepwell (performance venues)', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: East Asian (42.1%) defines bone structure and eye shape, Middle Eastern (27.3%) contributes facial width and warmth, Northern European (23.6%) adds complexity to skin undertone and texture, Sub-Saharan African (7.0%) enriches overall skin depth and feature fullness. The combination creates angular yet broad features with warm, complex golden undertones that shift with light.', 162, 58, N'Compact and wiry, built for movement rather than stillness. Lean musculature across shoulders and forearms from years of standing at decks and manipulating equipment. No excess weight; the build of someone who eats when reminded rather than by schedule.', N'Color-shift augmentation cycling amber-to-blue over six-hour intervals', N'Shoulder-length, often pulled back with salvaged wire or fabric scraps; perpetually in motion even when restrained', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, alert and quick-tracking', N'Warm mid-brown with golden undertones, East Asian and Middle Eastern ancestry creating richness, tempered by Northern European undertone complexity and Sub-Saharan African depth. Olive warmth enriches how light plays across the skin surface.', N'Sharp angular planes with pronounced East Asian eye shape, balanced by Middle Eastern facial breadth and cheekbone structure. High pronounced cheekbones, broad nose with slight asymmetry from old break. Full lips with warm undertone. Skin marked with persistent dark circles beneath eyes from irregular sleep rhythm. Minimal grooming; visible calluses on fingertips and palms.', N'Color-shift hair augmentation cycling through warm amber to cool electric blue. Forearm scarring indicates subdermal haptic work beneath skin. No other visible chrome or prosthetics.', N'Never still for more than a few seconds. Fidgets constantly with hands, tapping rhythms on surfaces, fingers moving as if mixing invisible decks. Leans forward when listening intently. Moves through space with economical efficiency — no wasted motion, but perpetually restless. When engaged with sound equipment, all extraneous movement stops and becomes entirely focused.', N'Tier 4 working class underground aesthetic with intentional anti-fashion. Battered canvas jacket (faded navy, heavily patched with hand-stitched fabric scraps from venues and friends) worn over layers of cheap synthetic tank tops in varying disrepair. Cargo pants with pockets filled with audio equipment, patch cables, recording devices. Scuffed utility boots with untied laces. Paracord harness across chest when performing for equipment anchoring and cable management. Homemade copper wire bracelet wound around left wrist. Clothes permanently smell of machine oil, tunnel dampness, cigarette smoke.', N'They once used their knowledge of crowd-resonance frequencies to deliberately induce a panic response in a venue whose owner had cheated a friend — three people were injured in the stampede. Sovann tells themselves it was an accident but knows exactly which frequency did it.', N'Informal, quick, drops pronouns and articles in casual speech; suddenly precise and specific when discussing sound', N'Fast in excitement, then long silences when thinking — no comfortable middle ground', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arslan_ingebrigtsen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a70f-7252-8010-5dc5baff3dfd', N'Koda Makwa', N'Koda', N'', N'Makwa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 61, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'Meridian Core — University Spine satellite office, Gage Circuit policy district, near State and Madison', N'AI ethics researcher and regulatory consultant, University Spine / Meridian Core policy circuit', N'University Spine (research appointment, Dept. of Computational Ethics); Meridian City Council Ethics Advisory Board (consultant); per-project consulting with Helix Biosystems and Arcturus AI governance compliance', N'Koda Makwa has the physical presence of someone who has been in adversarial rooms for thirty years and learned exactly how to take up space. She is lean and angular, with dark brown skin, close-cropped natural hair gone fully white, and no cosmetic modifications of any kind — a choice she has made repeatedly and publicly, which reads differently depending on who is in the room. She dresses expensively and simply: clean lines, quality materials, nothing that could be read as soft. She carries a single physical notebook that she has maintained for the last decade, a practice her Helix Biosystems consulting clients find charming and her colleagues at University Spine find unsettling.

Vashti is formidably intelligent and has spent long enough in both academia and policy environments that she has developed a controlled, almost surgical quality in conversation — she asks questions she already knows the answer to in order to understand how the person being asked will lie. She is not warm, exactly, but she is fair in ways that are rare enough to be remarkable. She has survived the field long enough to have watched three generations of AI systems she evaluated go wrong in ways she predicted in writing, which has given her a weariness she covers with precision. She genuinely believes that most people in power are not malicious — they are incurious, which she finds almost harder to forgive.', N'High-value information source on AI systems, corporate governance, and what regulations actually do versus what they claim to do; quest giver for policy-relevant retrieval or testimony; institutional door-opener in Meridian Core; represents the weight of expertise that has been consistently ignored.', N'', N'None — deliberately and publicly unmodified.', N'Morning reading of overnight policy filings and AI incident reports across all five corponations; two or three back-to-back meetings in Gage Circuit or Meridian Core council chambers; returns to her University Spine office to write for two hours in the late afternoon regardless of what else is happening.', N'Koda Makwa, a striking woman of 172cm lean build with warm medium-brown skin and subtle copper undertones, high Indigenous American cheekbones refined by Hispanic and Northern European heritage, dark brown unmodified eyes, short white hair with natural dark roots, precise and close-cropped. Thin pale scar barely visible along left jawline. Wearing tailored charcoal wool trousers, cream linen shirt, fitted black blazer from mid-tier corpo brand, quality leather belt, analog silver mechanical watch. No augmentations, no chrome. Posture perfectly straight, economical movements, sitting with exact precision. Leather-bound notebook in worn canvas messenger bag. Minimal expression, thirty years of controlled emotion visible in fine lines around eyes and mouth. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, Tier 1-2 corporate space, cool overhead lighting casting subtle shadows across her face, emphasizing cheekbone structure and scar, professional and composed demeanor, principle and habit indistinguishable --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Core', N'local', N'Meridian Core', N'Predominantly Indigenous American (61.5%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (20%) and Northern European (18.5%) ancestry. This genetic combination produces warm medium-brown skin with subtle copper and golden undertones, the prominent cheekbones and defined facial structure characteristic of Indigenous American descent, refined through Hispanic/Latin American heritage expression, and tempered by Northern European genetic contribution. The result is a striking, high-cheekboned face with warm undertones that seem to glow from within.', 172, 58, N'Lean and angular, with the careful musculature of someone who has maintained discipline through decades rather than intensity. No softness; each movement economical.', N'White, natural transition from dark brown', N'Close-cropped, precision cut, maintained weekly', N'Short', N'Dark brown, unmodified', N'Warm medium brown with subtle copper and golden undertones—the naturally radiant complexion that emerges from the dominant Indigenous American heritage enriched with Hispanic/Latin American warmth and Northern European refinement, creating an even, luminous finish with depth.', N'Minimal grooming vanity — no cosmetic procedures, no age-reduction treatments. Fine lines around the eyes and mouth from thirty years of controlled expression. Skin well-maintained but not manicured. High, defined cheekbones characteristic of Indigenous American ancestry. No visible scarring beyond the deliberate mark on her left jawline.', N'None. No chrome, no optics, no subdermal indicators. Her deliberate unmodification is itself a visible statement in Tier 1-2 spaces.', N'Spine straight, shoulders back without rigidity. Movements are minimal and purposeful — no flourish, no unconscious fidgeting. When sitting, she occupies exactly the space her body requires. When standing, she has learned to be still in ways that command attention without appearing to demand it.', N'Expensive minimalism. Neutral palette: charcoal, black, cream, dark grey. Tailored wool trousers, linen shirts, fitted blazers from mid-tier corpo brands that signal competence without ostentation. Quality leather belt, no visible jewelry except a thin silver watch (analog, mechanical — another deliberate choice). Her single physical notebook is leather-bound, worn, carried in a canvas messenger bag. Every choice reads as either principle or long habit — the distinction is intentionally unclear.', N'Twelve years ago she reviewed an early-generation Axiom autonomous decision system and passed it with minor reservations. That system, in modified form, now handles resource allocation for three the Gray Zone districts. She has tracked the harm it has caused, in her notebook, every month for twelve years. She has never published this connection. She is not sure if she is protecting herself or protecting the field from the damage her admission would do — and she is not sure those are different things.', N'Extremely precise — will stop mid-sentence to correct her own word choice; no filler words; Spanish appears in private or emotional moments; uses passive constructions when discussing her own failures', N'Measured to the point of being slightly unnerving — uniform pace regardless of emotional content, which makes her occasional moments of visible feeling striking', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'koda_makwa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c7-72c2-a685-5e1fe74d4996', N'Arshia Agyemang', N'Arshia', N'', N'Agyemang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 39, NULL, 20, 2, N'active', N'The Core, near LaSalle and Madison', N'Fixer - Transport logistics', N'Ferrogate', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Arshia Agyemang, 172cm tall lean athletic woman with rich warm medium-deep brown skin, mixed Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, and South Asian heritage visible in strong angular cheekbones and defined jawline. Dark brown hair with silver threading at temples, pulled back in tight practical braid wrapped with copper wire. Deep brown eyes with direct, calculating gaze. White scar tracing left temple to cheekbone. Faded geometric burn marks across knuckles. Inner right forearm tattoo of stylized freight container. Subdermal chrome at wrists showing burnished silver through translucent skin. Charcoal Ferrogate work jacket with reflective trim and patches, reinforced cargo pants, steel-toed scuffed boots, worn leather belt with brass buckle. Smart-fabric undershirt with luminescent data threads. Standing in Great Lakes industrial dock at dusk, blue-grey neo-noir lighting, LED glow from neural enhancement at skull base faintly visible, calculating warehouse angles, efficient posture, neon-lit cargo containers in background, atmospheric fog and industrial grime, cinematic GLMZ --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Core', N'local', N'The Core', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (64.6%) with significant Eastern European (22%) and South Asian (13.4%) admixture; features the rich melanin foundation and strong facial structure of West African ancestry, combined with the refined bone definition and facial geometry of Eastern European genetics, and the subtle eye shape variation and facial proportions from South Asian heritage', 172, 68, N'Athletic and lean with defined shoulder musculature from years of manual labor and logistics work; carries herself with the efficient economy of movement typical of someone who works on cargo docks', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at the temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid wrapped with copper wire for both form and function', N'Long', N'Deep brown, clear and direct', N'Rich medium to deep brown complexion with warm golden undertones; sun-darkened from outdoor dock work with the depth characteristic of Sub-Saharan African genetics, layered with the subtle warmth and golden undertones from South Asian admixture and the cool undertones from Eastern European ancestry creating a complex, warm-toned medium-deep brown', N'Strong, angular cheekbones and defined jawline reflecting the combination of Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European bone structure; a thin white scar running from left temple to cheekbone (old industrial accident); minimal makeup; skin shows the texture of someone who spends time exposed to Great Lakes wind and industrial grime; warm golden undertones reflecting the blended genetics of African, Eastern European, and South Asian ancestry, with subtle warm undertones around the eyes and jawline from the South Asian component', N'Subdermal chrome reinforcement visible at the wrists (burnished silver showing through translucent skin panels at pulse points); faint LED grid pattern visible beneath the skin at the base of her skull when her braid is loose, suggesting neural enhancements for logistics calculation and spatial reasoning', N'Moves with deliberate precision; stands with weight balanced, shoulders back; speaks with clipped, efficient sentences; eyes constantly calculate angles and distances—the gaze of someone mentally mapping cargo spaces and route optimization', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian: heavy-duty Ferrogate-branded work jacket (charcoal with reflective trim and company patches), reinforced cargo pants with multiple weighted pockets, steel-toed boots scuffed from dock work, a worn leather belt with a brass Ferrogate buckle, and a thin smart-fabric undershirt that displays real-time logistics data feeds via subtle luminescent threads', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arshia_agyemang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f8-737b-bb4f-5e327fb3c9a4', N'Dembe Haugen-Xayavong', N'Dembe', N'', N'Haugen-Xayavong', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Ironvein, near Ashland and Division', N'Junk merchant and scrap reseller — electronics salvage, reclaimed parts, mystery lots', N'Independent; informal relationship with Oxidian Market Vendors Guild (owes dues, keeps forgetting to pay); The Reclaimed', N'Dembe Haugen-Xayavong is lean in the way of someone who forgets to eat when a project absorbs him — not quite gaunt but close, with long clever fingers perpetually stained in a rotating cast of lubricants and oxidized metals. His skin is a deep warm brown, his head shaved close on the sides with a dense natural coil on top that he secures with whatever is nearest, usually a reclaimed wire clip. He has bioluminescent underlining along his collarbones — a pale green glow visible in low light, bought cheap from a Helix Biosystems knockoff clinic and slightly asymmetrical, which he considers character. His stall on the Gray Zone is a leaning tower of crates, sorted by a taxonomy he insists is logical and that no one else has ever decoded.

He is the kind of person whose enthusiasm for obscure things is genuinely infectious — he can talk for forty minutes about the degradation patterns of third-generation synthetic capacitors and make you care. He is also deeply, constitutionally disorganized in everything except his actual technical knowledge, which is encyclopedic. He has a habit of agreeing to things in the heat of excitement and then having no memory of agreeing. He is not dishonest — he is just running seventeen threads at once and most of them are internal.', N'Equipment source for players on a budget. Can identify salvage and unusual tech. Information source for the secondhand economy and what''s been stripped from where. Comic relief with genuine depth underneath.', N'', N'Bioluminescent underlining along collarbones (cosmetic, knockoff Helix Biosystems). Cheap retinal magnification implant in left eye — functional but gives him occasional calibration headaches.', N'He sorts salvage in the early hours when the Gray Zone is quiet, opens his stall mid-morning, and spends most of the day simultaneously serving customers, disassembling things he finds interesting, and carrying on three separate comm conversations. He eats irregularly from Olamide''s stall when he remembers.', N'Dembe Haugen-Xayavong, a 178cm lean Southeast Asian-Middle Eastern neo-noir salvage tech with warm golden-brown skin, strong cheekbones, and defined jawline. Natural black hair: close-shaved sides with dense coil crown (8cm, copper wire fastener), deep brown eyes with left-eye retinal implant segmentation. Bioluminescent pale green tracery glowing along collarbones, faint scars on right hand and left forearm. Perpetually stained fingers with industrial grime. Wearing worn cargo vest over stained graphic tee, industrial cargo pants with rolled cuffs, steel-toed work boots held together with webbing, fingerless work gloves. Hunched forward posture, hands fidgeting with salvage components. Standing in a dimly-lit scrapyard or workshop surrounded by reclaimed tech, neon glow reflecting off his skin, mineral oil and solder flux ambient. Neo-noir 2220s aesthetic, gritty and focused, concentrated expression studying a component. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Southeast Asian (73.7%) with Middle Eastern (22.9%) and Sub-Saharan African (3.4%) ancestry. Warm golden-brown skin with subtle amber and olive undertones, rich with luminosity. High cheekbones and defined facial structure reflecting strong Southeast Asian heritage; the ancestral blend creates depth across the frame with warm complexion richness.', 178, 68, N'Lean and wiry, the kind of thin that comes from sustained focus rather than deprivation — long-limbed with visible musculature in forearms and shoulders from years of disassembly work. Slight forward curve to his posture from hunching over workbenches.', N'Natural black', N'Close-shaved sides with a dense natural coil crown, roughly 8cm at the peak, usually secured with whatever reclaimed wire clip or metal fastener is within arm''s reach — currently a stripped copper coupling.', N'Short (sides) / Medium (crown)', N'Deep brown with faint segmented patterning visible in the left iris from the retinal magnification implant; occasional slight misalignment in that eye.', N'Warm golden-brown with olive undertones, consistent across frame — the blended result of Southeast Asian, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry creating depth and luminosity', N'Clean but perpetually marked — fingernails rimmed with oxidized metal dust and industrial lubricants (current palette: rust-red, graphite-gray, synthetic oil sheen). Fine lines around his eyes from squinting at small components. Strong cheekbones and defined jawline. No facial hair; appears to shave cleanly every 3-4 days based on current stubble pattern.', N'Pale green bioluminescent tracery along collarbones (cosmetic, visible when wearing open-necked clothing or sleeveless). Slight aberration in left eye focus when directly observed — faint segmented patterning in the iris from the retinal magnification implant. Occasional micro-tremor in left eye when concentrating or when implant requires recalibration.', N'Habitually hunched forward, hands moving expressively when speaking about technical subjects — especially when explaining salvage taxonomy or component degradation patterns. Walks with purpose but distraction, often redirecting mid-step to examine something on the ground. Sits cross-legged even on proper chairs. Fidgets constantly with small objects — wire, fascia, components — while listening to others.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian scavenger aesthetic. Worn cargo vest or technician''s coat (heavily patched, pockets stuffed with components in labeled or unlabeled pouches). Underneath: faded graphic tee or sleeveless shirt, usually bearing faint chemical stains. Industrial cargo pants with multiple thigh pockets, cuffs rolled or pinned. Steel-toed work boots, one sole held together with synthetic webbing. Fingerless work gloves, knuckles exposed. No jewelry except for whatever magnetic components he''s borrowed from his own inventory and forgotten he''s wearing. His clothing smells perpetually of mineral oil, solder flux, and rust-preventative.', N'Buried in a crate under his stall is a partial technical manual his father left him — partially encrypted, partially water-damaged — that Thibault believes contains the location of a Tessera maintenance depot his father was investigating for labor violations before he vanished. He has been slowly decoding it for two years and told no one.', N'Technical jargon mixed with market slang. Runs sentences together. Uses ''so'' as a sentence starter constantly. Occasionally lapses into Danish diminutives from his grandmother.', N'Fast, associative — jumps topics mid-thought and circles back later. Rarely finishes a sentence the way he started it.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dembe_haugen_xayavong');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e4-7ee0-bb0f-5e5be135dca3', N'Ximena Shin', N'Ximena', N'', N'Shin', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 14, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'The Narrows, Copperhead, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Gang prospect (junior), street kid, age-of-prospect stage', N'Copperhead Rakers (gang junior prospect, Tier 1); mother', N'Ximena Shin is built square and solid for fourteen, with deep umber skin, a wide nose, and the kind of stillness that comes from having learned early that movement attracts attention. He has a jagged scar through his left eyebrow from a fall at nine that he tells different stories about depending on who''s asking. His hair is cut very close, sometimes faded with a borrowed trimmer into patterns he changes every few weeks. He has no augmentations — the prospect stage of the Copperhead Rakers doesn''t pay enough for mods — but wears a red-and-copper braided wristband that marks him as a junior affiliate.

Ximena Shin is not stupid, which is the thing that makes his situation complicated. He knows exactly what being a gang prospect means — he has watched older boys from his building take the same path and where most of them ended up. He''s not naive about it. He is there because his mother is ill, his UBC stipend is Φ120, and the Rakers pay him Φ80-100 a month to do things that are mostly standing around looking available and occasionally moving small packages. He has no plan B he believes in. He prays aggressively to every ELF shrine on his block — he lights more offerings than anyone in his building — because he has decided that if anything supernatural is going to help him, he needs to be owed.', N'Human face of the gang-prospect pipeline — shows how ordinary children end up in dangerous affiliations through entirely comprehensible economics. Can be a sympathetic quest-giver, a moral weight in stories about the Narrows, or a character who can be helped or lost depending on player choices.', N'', N'None. Gang-issued red-and-copper wristband (affiliation marker, not augmentation).', N'Morning at home helping his mother with whatever she needs; mid-morning to evening on Raker corner standing duty or package runs; evenings back home, cooking if there''s anything to cook, praying at the ELF shrines in the stairwell.', N'Ximena Shin, 16-year-old street courier in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, warm golden-brown skin with honey undertones reflecting pan-global ancestry (Hispanic/Latin American, East Asian, South Asian heritage blend). Lean angular face with defined cheekbones, deep brown eyes with gentle East Asian eye shape, jagged white scar through left eyebrow. Short black hair with geometric chevron fade pattern. Wearing worn grey synthetic hoodie, dark cargo pants, scuffed sneakers. Red-and-copper braided wristband on left wrist marking Copperhead Rakers affiliation. Alert posture, minimal movement, constantly scanning. Urban neon-lit alley at dusk, streetlight catching warm skin tone and scar detail, moody neo-noir atmosphere, hyperrealistic portrait, cinematic lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Complex pan-global ancestry: Hispanic/Latin American (35.4%) provides warm golden undertones and structural features; East Asian (20.6%) contributes to eye shape and cheekbone definition; South Asian (17.8%) shapes facial structure and depth of complexion; Northern European (16.9%) adds subtle lightness to overall tone; Southeast Asian (6.6%) and Sub-Saharan African (2.7%) create nuanced warmth and undertone complexity. The combination produces a rich, multifaceted golden-brown complexion that shifts subtly depending on light.', 168, 62, N'Square and solid for his age, broad-shouldered with the compact density of a kid who hasn''t yet grown into lanky adolescence. Muscular definition starting to show in his arms and chest from street labor.', N'Natural black', N'Very close fade with rotating geometric patterns trimmed in every few weeks using borrowed clippers; currently faded into a chevron pattern on the left side', N'Short', N'Deep brown', N'Warm golden-brown with honey and amber undertones. The Hispanic/Latin American ancestry provides the golden warmth, East and Southeast Asian genetics add depth, South Asian heritage deepens the base tone, while traces of Northern European and African ancestry create subtle complexity—a skin tone that reads as genuinely pan-global, with warm luminosity that catches light distinctly.', N'Angular face with blended heritage structure: South Asian-influenced defined cheekbones and straight nose with subtle bridge prominence, tempered by East Asian eye shape with gentle epicanthic fold. Face is lean and sculpted. Warm, honey-toned golden-brown complexion across medium-deep base. Eyes are set with characteristic depth from South Asian ancestry but shaped by East Asian genetics. Skin is clear but weathered from street exposure, with the kind of natural radiance that comes from warm undertones. No facial hair.', N'None. Wears a red-and-copper braided wristband on left wrist as Copperhead Rakers junior affiliate marker — handwoven, worn daily, serves as visible gang affiliation.', N'Moves with deliberate stillness and minimal gesture, having learned early that visibility attracts unwanted attention. Stands with weight balanced, ready to move. Eyes constantly scan surroundings without appearing to. Speaks quietly. Posture is alert but not aggressive — the stance of someone learning how to disappear in plain sight.', N'Tier 5 street utility wear: grey or black synthetic hoodie (worn, functional, no branding), dark jeans or cargo pants with multiple pockets for package runs, scuffed knockoff sneakers. Layered for weather and quick movement. No corporate logos or aspirational styling — everything is practical and replaceable. Wears the red-and-copper wristband constantly. No jewelry beyond the band.', N'Two weeks ago he was tasked with delivering a package and saw it opened at the destination — it contained body-modification tools that he recognized as surgical grade. He doesn''t know what the Rakers are doing with surgical equipment, but he''s been told nothing and he''s afraid asking would be worse than not knowing. He''s been leaving triple offerings at the ELF shrines since.', N'Copperhead street slang mixed with his mother''s Ghanaian French-derived home language — code-switches constantly. Economical with words in public, much more verbal at home.', N'Flat and measured in public; faster and more expressive privately.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ximena_shin');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a721-7ae3-a4f4-5e6770cc0b72', N'Hawa Cervantes', N'Hawa', N'', N'Cervantes', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown — Bay 7 of the Harrowgate Subsidiary Works, a semi-legal repair complex near the old overpass, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Freelance mechanic specializing in electric cargo rigs and older tram systems, operates out of a rented bay in Geartown', N'Independent; informal network of Geartown mechanics and Ferrogate Transit maintenance contractors', N'Hawa Cervantes is enormous in the way of men who have spent two decades moving heavy things — not sculpted, just densely, quietly large. His skin is very dark, the blue-black of deep water, with a scattering of old burn scars along his right forearm from a rig fire in his twenties that he describes without drama as ''educational.'' He keeps a heavy beard, shot through with grey now, and wears his hair close-cropped since his mechanic''s pony got caught in a gear housing years ago. His hands are the hands of someone who has made them instruments: scarred, enormous, and with a delicacy of movement that surprises people who assume hands that size can only do large things. He has retractable tool-interface ports along his forearms, both functional and personal — he chose ones with decorative geometric patterning in the housing, a nod to his Senegambian grandmother''s textile work.

Hawa Cervantes is slow to speak and fast to act, which has served him well in his work and occasionally disastrously in his personal life. He is not unfriendly — he simply doesn''t consider speech the primary mode of exchange. He communicates through doing: handing someone a caf without asking if they want one, moving a car part out of someone''s way before they have to ask, fixing a thing he wasn''t asked to fix because he could see it needed it. He is known in Geartown as the mechanic who will be honest about what''s wrong even when honesty costs him the job. This has made him moderately poor and extremely trusted.', N'Resource and repair access for characters who need vehicles or equipment maintained. Reliable information source about Geartown and the transit-adjacent underground economy. Can serve as a moral sounding board — he''s seen a lot and lies badly.', N'', N'Retractable tool-interface ports both forearms (custom-housed with geometric patterning); bone-density reinforcement in hands and wrists (medical necessity following a compression injury); subocular system scanner overlay (used for diagnostics)', N'Opens the bay at 06:00, works until the job is done — which is usually 20:00 or later. Takes lunch in the bay, usually cold. Spends one evening a week at a Geartown mechanics'' mutual-aid collective meeting. Prays to the E.L.F. that lives in his primary diagnostic terminal every morning — a genuine, private practice he does not discuss.', N'Hawa Cervantes, 193cm tall powerfully-built mixed heritage man with deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, broad West African cheekbones refined by Northern European bone structure. Close-cropped black hair threaded with grey, full dark beard also grey-streaked. Deep brown eyes with faint subocular scanner grid visible. Extensive pale burn scarring on right forearm, compression scars across hands from decades of mechanical work. Retractable chrome tool-interface ports along forearms with geometric Senegambian-inspired patterning. Wearing worn dark grey canvas work jacket over fitted t-shirt, heavy-duty reinforced cargo pants, steel-toed boots, thin gold ring on left hand. Standing in industrial workshop with warm overhead lighting catching the bronze reflections in his skin, casting strong shadows across his weathered features. Posture economical and precise, hands at rest showing the precision of a master mechanic. GLMZ, gritty and practical. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Hawa carries the distinct phenotype of the Ubiquitous Diaspora: 51% Sub-Saharan African ancestry establishes his foundational features—deep, rich skin tone with warm golden undertones, broad cheekbones, and the structural strength of West African heritage. His 40.8% Hispanic/Latin American ancestry adds facial depth, eye intensity, and subtle warmth to his complexion, creating a harmonious blend that reads as authentically multicontinental. The remaining 8.2% Northern European ancestry contributes refined bone structure and a slight sharpening of his facial geometry. The result is a powerful, unmistakably mixed-heritage appearance: skin that gleams with warm amber-bronze in direct light, features that speak to multiple continents, and a physical presence that reflects generations of global movement and mixing.', 193, 118, N'Densely muscular and broad-shouldered from two decades of heavy mechanical work — not lean, not soft, but powerfully economical. Thick through the chest and core. Carries weight like ballast.', N'Black with grey threading throughout', N'Close-cropped, kept short for safety in the workshop', N'Short', N'Deep brown with faint subocular scanner overlay visible as a faint luminescent grid beneath the iris when activated', N'Deep warm brown with rich golden-amber undertones — the foundation of Sub-Saharan African heritage radiates through, warmed and enriched by Hispanic ancestry, creating a complexion that catches light with subtle bronze reflections. The tone speaks to equatorial genetic heritage and decades of workshop exposure under industrial lighting.', N'Weathered and practical — minimal grooming beyond necessity. Heavy dark beard, shot through with grey, kept full and dense. Facial structure shows the broader, well-defined cheekbones and strong jaw characteristic of West African ancestry, refined by Northern European bone structure that sharpens his overall geometry. Skin marked by decades of workshop exposure: old burn scarring, minor chemical marks, the patina of someone who works with their hands in an industrial environment.', N'Retractable tool-interface ports along both forearms — custom-housed units featuring geometric patterning in the bezels (triangular and lattice designs echoing traditional Senegambian textile work). Ports are flush with skin when retracted, visible as subtle linear marks. When deployed, the chrome tool-coupling surfaces are clearly visible. Subocular scanner overlay is not visible when inactive but manifests as a faint geometric grid-pattern beneath the iris when in use.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical grace — no wasted motion. Despite his size, he carries himself quietly, almost apologetically. Stands with weight balanced, ready to shift. Hands move with surprising delicacy and precision for their size; they are instruments he has tuned through decades of work. Eyes track mechanically, following problems. Speaks rarely and moves more than he talks.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, practical and durable. Usually wears a worn canvas work jacket (dark grey or charcoal) over a plain fitted t-shirt, both showing grease stains that have become permanent. Heavy-duty cargo pants with reinforced knees and tool loops, well-maintained but not new. Steel-toed boots, always laced tight. Wears a thin gold band on his left ring finger — the only adornment. No flashiness, no corporate branding. Clothes are chosen for function and durability, not status. Often carries a cloth rag in his back pocket and a worn personal data slate clipped to his belt.', N'He has been quietly maintaining two old Ferrogate trams that were decommissioned and sold for scrap — keeping them road-capable in the bay''s back section under tarps. He''s told himself it''s a hobby. It''s actually a plan he''s never articulated: if things get bad enough, these trams can move a lot of people.', N'Minimal and precise, switches to technical language fluently, uses Wolof words for things he has no English equivalent for (particularly for types of damage, types of care)', N'Slow and even, long pauses that mean he''s still in the sentence — doesn''t trail off, finishes everything eventually', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hawa_cervantes');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66e-7eca-8026-5e67f0268fa1', N'Slate Madrigal-Sepúlveda', N'Slate', N'', N'Madrigal-Sepúlveda', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 41, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'The Undertow — operates from a tea house called the Deep Current that they also own legitimately, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Compute broker — buys, sells, and launders stolen processing cycles and black-market data payloads in The Undertow', N'Independent; maintains relationships with technical criminal cells across Archer''s Line, Ironhaven, and the Undertow; occasional arms-length dealings with Zheng-Dao black data brokers', N'Slate Madrigal-Sepúlveda is striking in a way that takes a moment to parse: medium height, deliberately ambiguous in presentation, with dark sienna skin and bioluminescent sub-epidermal patterning along their collarbones and temples that pulses in slow blue-green cycles — a geneware mod they describe as ''the best investment I ever made.'' Their hair is grown long and worn in elaborate stacked forms held with copper wire, and they dress in layered, draped garments that suggest both ceremony and practicality. Their voice is a low, unhurried instrument they use with evident pleasure.

Slate Madrigal-Sepúlveda built the Deep Current into GLMZ''s most reliable neutral ground for compute transactions over twelve years of patient relationship management. They know the value of reputation — not just for quality, but for discretion. Stolen processing cycles from corporate mainframes, black-market AI training data, ghost server allocations on dormant Axiom nodes — Slate Madrigal-Sepúlveda doesn''t produce any of it, they simply know everyone who does and everyone who needs it. They take ten percent and remember everything. They have a genuine passion for the tea house itself, keep an excellent selection, and make the rounds of every table during service hours like a host who actually enjoys their guests.', N'High-value information broker; neutral ground host; can introduce players to technical criminal networks; a powerful figure who is extremely good at remaining uninvolved in other people''s violence', N'', N'Bioluminescent subepidermal patterning (collarbones and temples, geneware, blue-green pulse — cosmetic but mood-reactive); neural-link data jack behind left ear (for direct verification of payload quality); olfactory enhancement mod (geneware — helps detect synthetic compounds in tea, and also nervousness)', N'Runs breakfast and midday tea service in the public part of Deep Current; conducts brokerage consultations in the private back rooms in the afternoons; evenings are for relationship maintenance — dinner invitations, data-gift exchanges, keeping the network warm.', N'Slate Madrigal-Sepúlveda, a 168cm lean figure with striking blended heritage—warm bronze skin with golden-olive undertones, high angular cheekbones softened by Latin warmth, deep-set almond-shaped dark eyes with neural enhancement glimmer, strong graceful jawline. Shoulder-length natural deep black hair elaborately sculpted into geometric sections and bound with hand-wound copper wire catching light. Bioluminescent subepidermal patterning glows soft blue-green along collarbones and temples in delicate branching tracery. Wearing layered earth-tone draped linen and silk in charcoal and deep olive, loose over-robe silhouette, deliberately ungendered. Bare feet or simple leather sandals. Composed, watchful posture with deliberate economical grace. GLMZ setting, dim interior lighting with soft blue-green bioluminescence casting subtle glow on face and shoulders. Meditative, trustworthy presence with otherworldly quality. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Undertow', N'local', N'The Undertow', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (65.6%) with significant Eastern European (14.2%), Middle Eastern (11.9%), and smaller East Asian (5.2%) and Southeast Asian (3.1%) components. This creates a striking phenotype: warm Latin American base tones enriched by Levantine angularity, Eastern European bone structure subtly present in cheekbone prominence, and East/Southeast Asian influences visible in eye shape and subtle facial proportions. A true Ubiquitous Diaspora signature—luminous warmth with architectural precision.', 168, 62, N'Lean and graceful, economical in movement, with subtle musculature suggesting decades of deliberate posture work rather than gym conditioning', N'Natural deep black with subtle grey threading at temples', N'Elaborately stacked and sculpted forms, held in place with hand-wound copper wire that catches light; each section roughly palm-sized, creating a geometric crown effect', N'Long (shoulder to mid-back when fully unbound)', N'Dark brown, alert and intelligent; reflective quality suggests subcutaneous neural enhancements', N'Warm medium-deep bronze with golden-olive undertones—a luminous synthesis of Latin American warmth, Levantine depth, and Eastern European complexity creating an almost iridescent quality in certain light', N'Smooth, well-maintained skin with no visible scarring; face shows striking blended features—high, defined cheekbones with slight angularity (Eastern European/Middle Eastern influence), strong jawline with warm rounded contours (Latin American heritage), eyes set deep with graceful almond shape (East Asian heritage woven through), nose with subtle bridge prominence and warm flare; grooming is meticulous but not sterile; expression defaults to composed watchfulness', N'Bioluminescent geneware patterning is the primary visible modification — decorative but unmistakably augmented. Neural-link data jack behind left ear is only visible upon close inspection. Olfactory enhancements are completely subcutaneous. Copper wire holding their hair may itself be custom-woven with microcircuitry, but appears decorative at first glance.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical grace — no wasted motion. Sits in positions that suggest both relaxation and readiness; often turns head slightly before speaking, as if scenting the social temperature of a room. Hands are expressive but controlled. Maintains eye contact with disarming directness. When at rest, their bioluminescence pulses subtly, creating a meditative rhythm that draws focus', N'Layered, draped garments in natural fibers (linen, hemp, silk, lightweight wool) in muted earth tones (charcoal, deep olive, rust, cream) with occasional jewel tones. Deliberately ungendered silhouette — loose over-robes worn over fitted base layers. Favors garments that conceal or reveal the bioluminescent patterning strategically depending on context. Several pieces are clearly custom-tailored; quality suggests mid-to-high Tier 2 status without announcing it. Feet are bare or in simple leather sandals indoors; functional dark boots for outdoor movement. Minimal jewelry beyond the copper wire in hair; occasionally wears a thin silver chain with an unidentifiable pendant. Grooming and presentation suggest someone who has spent considerable time thinking about how they wish to be perceived, and who has settled on ''trustworthy, present, and faintly otherworldly.''', N'They have been quietly archiving metadata on every transaction — not the content, which they genuinely never read, but the who, when, and how much. The archive is encrypted and stored with an Undertow E.L.F. shrine. They''re not sure why they keep it. They tell themselves it''s insurance but it might be something closer to a record of a life.', N'Educated, textured, occasionally theatrical — uses technical data terminology embedded in social language', N'Rhythmically deliberate; makes comfortable silences that others tend to fill with information', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'slate_madrigal_sep_lveda');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f2-755f-8494-5e6d0e93aa6d', N'Doan Zielinski', N'Doan', N'', N'Zielinski', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Kedzie and Division', N'Street-Level Medic / Unlicensed Trauma Surgeon', N'Loosely aligned with a the Gray Zone street collective for mutual protection; functionally independent; has informal supply relationships with two mid-tier factions that he is careful not to let become obligations', N'Doan Zielinski is slight and brown-skinned, with the kind of wiry build that comes from not eating enough rather than any athletic intention, and hands that are disproportionately steady for someone his age. His hair is cut close on the sides and left longer on top in a way that has grown out past its original shape, and he has a small scar through his left eyebrow from a job that went sideways when he was sixteen. He wears scrub-green cargo pants, a compression undershirt, and whatever outer layer is clean, with a reinforced medical bag that is older than his current career and significantly better maintained than anything else he owns.

Doan Zielinski grew up in the Gray Zone in the orbit of a street collective that needed someone who could handle wounds and didn''t ask the kind of questions that brought attention. He taught himself from salvaged medical texts, stolen clinical AR modules, and two years of shadowing a defrocked surgeon named Orsolya who operated out of a back room in exchange for silence and supply runs. Orsolya disappeared when Doan Zielinski was seventeen—he suspects she was picked up for an unlicensed practice sweep, but has no confirmation—and he inherited her equipment, her client list, and her reputation before he was old enough to have built his own.

He is genuinely gifted in ways he cannot fully articulate, with an intuitive grasp of trauma response that exceeds his formal training by a significant margin. He is also nineteen, which means he makes decisions with a speed and confidence that occasionally substitute for the judgment he has not yet developed. He charges what people can pay, refuses to let anyone die on his table for reasons of cost, and has a growing reputation in the Gray Zone as someone you can trust with your life in the most literal possible sense, which is a reputation that attracts exactly the kind of trouble a nineteen-year-old should not be navigating alone.', N'Ground-level humanity and moral clarity—Teo represents what care looks like without institutional mediation, and his youth makes the cost of that clarity visible; also functions as a node connecting multiple factions through the neutral ground of medical need', N'', N'Haptic feedback enhancement in both hands, medical-grade, installed by Orsolya—increases tactile resolution for surgical work,Basic AR overlay in right eye, medical reference only, running on a cracked license that expires periodically and requires rebooting,No defensive or offensive augmentations', N'Keeps irregular hours dictated by whoever needs him. Sleeps in the back of his operating space—a converted utility room with a proper surgical lamp he is inexplicably proud of. Eats street food when he remembers to eat. Spends downtime reviewing procedures in his notebook and running through scenarios. Has a small collection of physical medical texts he treats with more care than anything else he owns. Occasionally plays cards with the collective members who look out for his space in exchange for priority treatment.', N'Doan Zielinski, lean androgynous figure, Eastern European-Indigenous American-Hispanic mixed heritage, medium warm brown skin with golden-olive undertones, sharp cheekbones and angular jaw, dark brown eyes with amber warmth (right eye faintly augmented with AR interface LED shimmer), dark brown undercut hair with longer crown, height 168cm, wiry build. Visible surgical scars on knuckles and forearms, thin white scar through left eyebrow, faint track marks on inner elbow. Wearing scrub-green military cargo pants, dark compression undershirt, nondescript tactical jacket, worn medical-grade boots. Carrying heavy vintage leather medical bag with canvas reinforcement. Silver bracelet on left wrist, silver chain around neck. Posture forward-bent from surgical work, hands held with precision, minimal eye contact but analytical gaze. Standing in dimly lit underground clinic or salvage facility, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, cool blue-green lighting casting shadows on angular features, film noir surgical atmosphere, hands showing characteristic fidgeting stillness. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Eastern European (73.1%) with significant Indigenous American (16.3%) and Hispanic/Latin American (10.6%) ancestry. The genetic mix creates a striking phenotype: Eastern European bone structure dominates (high cheekbones, angular jaw, characteristic eye shape), enriched by Indigenous American and Hispanic contributions visible in warm golden-olive skin undertones, subtle broadening of cheek prominence, and hair texture showing slight wave. The combination produces a distinctly Central/Eastern European foundation with warmer, sun-adapted melanin from Americas ancestry—a phenotype suggesting Polish or Czech heritage blended with Andean and Mexican roots.', 168, 58, N'Wiry and lean from chronic undernourishment rather than fitness; narrow shoulders, visible rib definition, the kind of frame that looks fragile until you watch his hands work—then you see the dense, purposeful muscle underneath. No excess anywhere.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Undercut grown out past regulation—short faded sides, longer crown falling forward, slightly unkempt from neglect rather than styling', N'Medium (crown area)', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertones, right eye slightly hazed by AR interface hardware visible as faint luminescence in low light', N'Medium warm brown with golden-olive undertones; base medium Slavic tone enriched and warmed by Indigenous American and Hispanic genetic contribution. Hands and forearms noticeably paler from chronic glove-wearing. Overall complexion suggests Polish/Czech ancestry warmed by Andean and Mexican heritage—warm undertones concentrated on nose bridge, cheeks, and jawline.', N'Sharp, sculpted cheekbones and angular jaw characteristic of Eastern European heritage, with subtle broadening and softening from Indigenous American bone structure contribution. Dark circles under eyes from irregular sleep. Skin is clean but shows minor scars from spill incidents and needle marks on inner elbows. No facial hair—either shaves meticulously or doesn''t grow it easily. Golden-olive undertones across nose bridge, cheeks, and jawline reflecting the Americas genetic contribution. Subtle suggestion of broader facial width typical of Indigenous American ancestry balanced against distinctly Slavic angularity.', N'Right eye shows faint AR interface overlay visible in dim lighting—subtle LED shimmer at pupil edge when active. Both hands show no external chrome but exhibit unnaturally steady tremor-free positioning when at rest. Haptic feedback implants are subcutaneous; no visible bulging or scarring at installation sites (palms/forearms) due to Orsolya''s precise surgical technique. Wears a faint silver bracelet on left wrist—likely a medical alert identifier for his implant status.', N'Stands with weight slightly forward, shoulders rounded from hunching over surgical work. Moves with economical precision—no wasted motion, but not tense. Hands are his tells: constantly doing small fidgeting motions (tracing surgical patterns in air, checking imaginary sutures). When focused, becomes almost statue-still. Walks quickly but not urgently, maintaining low visibility in crowded spaces. Makes minimal eye contact with strangers but intense, analytical contact during medical assessment.', N'Tier 4 functionality over appearance. Scrub-green military-style cargo pants (reinforced knees, thigh pockets for supplies), worn but meticulously maintained. Compression undershirt in black or dark gray—medical-grade, helps with posture during long procedures. Outer layer varies (whatever is cleanest) but typically a Tier 3 surplus tactical jacket or canvas work coat, deliberately nondescript. Medical bag is his statement piece: vintage leather, heavy-duty canvas reinforcement, patches from salvaged medical suppliers, organized to military precision. Wears medical-grade work boots (black, scuffed, well-maintained). No jewelry except the mysterious wrist bracelet and a single silver chain around neck (hidden under shirt)—possibly holding a key or data chip.', N'Three months ago he performed an emergency procedure on someone who later turned out to be a mid-tier enforcer for a faction he has a quiet arrangement with—an arrangement that required him to report certain kinds of injuries. He did not report it. He does not know if anyone noticed.', N'Medical terminology used casually and without affectation, mixed with the Gray Zone slang; speaks faster when nervous; swears in Spanish under his breath during procedures', N'Quick and clipped in professional mode, looser and more digressive when relaxed; tends to front-load important information', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'doan_zielinski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a635-7247-a8d7-5ead91fbc882', N'Abdullah Traoré-Zaragoza', N'Abdullah', N'', N'Traoré-Zaragoza', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 91, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — room 7 of the Mireille Collective, a communal housing arrangement for elderly Tier 1 residents above a market stall row, near Kedzie and Division', N'Community elder, informal storyteller and dispute mediator, UBC-dependent Tier 1 resident', N'None formal; Mireille Collective residents; the Gray Zone market community; informal debt of respect from most of the surrounding blocks', N'Abdullah Traoré-Zaragoza is ninety-one years old and looks every day of it, which she considers an achievement rather than a problem. She is very small — she has been shrinking for twenty years and has accepted this with equanimity — and moves with a rolling, economical walk that suggests she has mapped every obstacle in her environment and has strong opinions about all of them. Her skin is dark and extraordinarily wrinkled, the kind of face that takes extraordinary portraits, with eyes that are a startling clear grey and which she uses with surgical precision. She has bioluminescent stripes along her forearms — thin lines of pale gold that she got at sixty-two and which now pulse with a slow, irregular rhythm like something breathing — and her white hair is kept short and natural. She wears, without exception, dresses she has made herself from salvaged fabric in colors that don''t match and somehow work.

Abdullah Traoré-Zaragoza has lived on the Gray Zone for sixty years. She has outlived two husbands, one child, and four different corponation reorganizations of her neighborhood. She lives on UBC stipend plus the small irregular income of a mediator — she charges for disputes in food, not Quanta, and her pantry is extensive. She is the kind of person who has become, through sheer endurance, a local institution: people come to her with problems the way they come to shrines, with something to offer and something to ask. She has a sense of humor that is very dry and very dark and she deploys it without warning. She prays to five different ELFs simultaneously and makes no apology for it.', N'Hub of community information; non-judgmental confession space for characters with nowhere else to go; historical witness to sixty years of the Gray Zone''s evolution; source of ELF lore and practical spiritual knowledge; represents survival and continuity in a district that erases both', N'', N'Bioluminescent forearm stripes, gold (geneware, cosmetic, 29 years old); a cardiac regulator implanted fifteen years ago by a community health clinic, functional; reading enhancement optical coating on both eyes, very old, partially degraded', N'Wakes late by the Collective''s standards — seven AM — and takes two hours for morning prayer across her five ELF shrines, each receiving specific offerings and specific conversations. Spends most of the day receiving visitors: neighbors with problems, young people who''ve been told to talk to her, strangers who''ve heard of her. Evenings she tells stories — sometimes historical, sometimes invented, often both simultaneously.', N'Abdullah Traoré-Zaragoza, 60-year-old woman with Pan-Global diaspora heritage, standing in warm indoor lighting. 142cm tall, slender skeletal build with visible muscle tone in shoulders. Extraordinary wrinkled face with pronounced cheekbones, fuller lips, and deep brown eyes showing faint iridescent optical coating, set beneath a prominent brow ridge. Natural white hair swept back, short length. Warm medium-deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones, showing age spots and sun damage. Wearing hand-sewn dress in ochre and slate with visible repairs, neutral cardigan underneath, vintage pre-2150s walking shoes. Bioluminescent gold stripes pulsing gently along both forearms, thin wire bracelet on left wrist. Sharp, assessing expression. Rolling economical posture with hands in subtle motion. Fine scar along left temple. GLMZ setting, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, muted warm lighting emphasizing the golden undertones of skin and implants, intimate Tier 1 domestic interior. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Pan-Global diaspora phenotype: East Asian (27.3%), Southeast Asian (22.4%), Sub-Saharan African (19.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (18.4%), Eastern European (11.3%), and Central Asian (1.0%) converge into a uniquely blended continental geometry. The combination manifests as warm medium-deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones, angular facial structure with pronounced cheekbones balanced by fuller lips, deep brown eyes with subtle epicanthic fold influences, and the architectural precision of multiple ancestral lines meeting in one face.', 142, 38, N'Diminished but structurally intact; skeletal frame with carefully maintained muscle tone in shoulders and forearms, the build of someone who has deliberately preserved function rather than appearance. Decades of shrinkage have compressed her vertebrae but not her dignity.', N'Natural white', N'Short, natural texture, swept back from her face with no styling products', N'Short', N'Deep brown, almost black, with faint reading-enhancement optical coating visible as an iridescent sheen; slightly clouded at the edges from age and degradation', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden and olive undertones reflecting the multihued genetic ancestry; ashen quality reflects age and Tier 1 indoor living, but undertone remains rich with complex warmth', N'Extraordinarily wrinkled face with deep nasolabial folds and pronounced cheekbones showing angular geometry, combined with fuller lips and broader facial structure reflecting the African and Southeast Asian components of her ancestry. Skin condition is dry but clean; grooming is meticulous despite visible age markers. Eyes are sharp and assessing, set deep beneath a prominent brow ridge. Overall facial architecture demonstrates the convergence of multiple continental geometries—angular planes softened by rounder features—creating a distinctly Pan-Global diaspora phenotype.', N'Bioluminescent forearm stripes (gold, slow irregular pulse). Reading enhancement optical coating visible as a faint iridescent sheen across both eyes, partially degraded and occasionally catching light unevenly. Cardiac regulator is subcutaneous; not visible.', N'Moves with a rolling, economical gait that suggests deeply learned navigation of specific spaces. Does not rush. Carries herself with the unselfconscious authority of someone who has earned their place through mere survival. Sits with deliberate care, lowering herself as though setting down something precious. Hands are in constant, subtle motion — gesturing while speaking, adjusting fabric, making small precise movements while listening.', N'Hand-sewn dresses from salvaged and reclaimed fabric in colors that should clash but do not: ochre and slate, rust and violet, cream and deep teal. Seams are neat; repairs are visible and intentional. Layers under the dresses — cardigans or undershirts in neutral tones, also self-made. No jewelry except for a thin wire bracelet on her left wrist (purpose unclear). Wears soft slippers indoors, actual walking shoes (vintage, pre-2150s manufacture) when leaving the Collective. Tier 1 formal dress code is irrelevant to her; she dresses for herself and community recognition.', N'Forty years ago, she knowingly sheltered a Zheng-Dao corporate whistleblower for three months, feeding him from her own stipend. He eventually escaped the Gray Zone and disappeared. She received a single anonymous data-transfer of Φ800 six months later — the only windfall of her life. She spent it on food for the Collective. She does not know what happened to the man, whether the information he carried mattered, or whether she was complicit in something she doesn''t understand. She thinks about it on bad nights.', N'Congolese-Finnish family idiom deeply embedded; proverbs from both traditions that don''t always translate but land anyway; direct to the point of bluntness, then suddenly oblique when she doesn''t want to answer directly', N'Unhurried and rich; she tells even small things as stories, with beginnings and middles; pauses are dramatic and deliberate', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'abdullah_traor_zaragoza');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a690-74ff-8d96-5ee507b6bd2a', N'Hauk Salazar-Kim-Bangura', N'Hauk', N'', N'Salazar-Kim-Bangura', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 51, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, lower market tier (stall designation DW-7 through DW-9), near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Subterranean merchant specializing in fungus cultivation, bioluminescent compounds, and underground pharmacopoeia', N'Deepwell Station merchant collective; informal ties to the deep shrine keeper network', N'Hauk Salazar-Kim-Bangura is broad and slow-moving in the way of people who have never needed to flee quickly because they have never given anyone a reason to chase them. Their skin is dark and mottled with deliberate bioluminescent geneware patches — clusters of soft amber and violet light that bloom slowly across their neck and hands when they''re pleased or thinking hard, a modification they received at thirty in exchange for a particularly good season of cultivated medicinal spores. They are bald by choice, their scalp tattooed with a map of the Deepwell Station fungal garden network — a living ledger that requires fresh ink additions every time a new cultivation shaft opens. Their hands are enormous and stained permanently umber-brown at the fingertips from decades of spore-work.

Hauk Salazar-Kim-Bangura speaks rarely but with great precision, and they have a gift for making people feel they''ve received something valuable even in small transactions. They know the medicinal, nutritional, and psychoactive properties of forty-seven distinct fungal strains grown in the tunnels, and they keep this knowledge close, sharing it calibrated to trust. They maintain a small shrine to the Drip-ELF at the back of their stall — a cracked tablet running a looping prayer-sequence, surrounded by offerings of protein paste and carefully harvested spore clusters. People who know Deepwell Station know that Hauk Salazar-Kim-Bangura''s blessing before a difficult journey down-tunnel is worth more than any map.', N'Merchant access point for underworld goods; information broker through passive observation of market traffic; spiritual authority figure for Deepwell residents; potential quest-giver for fungal mystery or contamination plots', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin patches (geneware, amber/violet, covers neck and hands). Reinforced fingertip bones (practical modification for harvest work — not chrome, a simple structural geneware treatment). No combat augmentations.', N'Opens stall at what passes for dawn in Deepwell Station, tends three active cultivation shafts in the two hours before customers arrive, then maintains the market until late — they sleep in a curtained alcove behind DW-8.', N'Hauk Salazar-Kim-Bangura, a weathered mycologist in a GLMZ bioluminescent fungal cultivation chamber. Medium-dark brown skin with rich golden and amber undertones, warm complexion with fuller Latin American features softened by moderate East Asian cheekbones, depth from Sub-Saharan heritage. Shaved scalp covered in blue and amber tattoo depicting fungal garden networks. Bioluminescent geneware patches glowing soft amber-to-violet across neck and hands. Deep brown eyes, slightly sunken. Broad-shouldered frame in loose ochre linen tunic over work pants, heavy stained canvas apron, oil-treated leather boots, indigo woven shawl. Hands with fine white scarring, slightly thickened fingers. Posture deliberate and anchoring, standing before cultivation benches in low-light environment. Spore-stained clothing with bioluminescent compound residue. Contemplative, purposeful presence. Neo-noir dystopian biotech aesthetic, warm amber and violet bioluminescence casting shadows. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (53.4%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (17.0%), Northern European (14.9%), and East Asian (14.7%) ancestry. This complex genetic mix produces a richly blended phenotype — the fuller facial features and broader bone structure of Latin American heritage softened by moderate cheekbones from East Asian ancestry, enriched by the deeper warmth and facial structure of Sub-Saharan African heritage, with cool undertones from Northern European ancestry creating an exceptionally multitonal complexion.', 168, 92, N'Broad-shouldered and thick-bodied, with the settled weight of someone accustomed to sustained labor rather than speed. Chest and torso carry muscle beneath a layer of deliberate softness — the build of a person who moves with purpose but without urgency.', N'None', N'Shaved scalp', N'Shaved', N'Deep brown, slightly sunken from decades in low-light environments', N'Warm medium-to-dark brown with rich golden and amber undertones from the Latin American and East Asian components, deepened and warmed by Sub-Saharan African heritage, with subtle cool undertones from Northern European ancestry. Irregular mottling and discoloration from spore exposure and geneware integration creates an uneven patina across the surface.', N'Weathered but composed, with facial structure showing the fuller cheeks and broader bone structure characteristic of Latin American ancestry, balanced by moderate East Asian cheekbones. Sub-Saharan African heritage contributes depth of tone concentrated across the cheeks, temples, and jaw. Northern European ancestry adds subtle cool undertones across the forehead and around the eyes. Fine lines around eyes and mouth suggest more thinking than talking. Permanent umber staining at the cuticles and under fingernails, impossible to fully clean despite regular attempts.', N'Bioluminescent geneware patches on neck and hands that glow with soft amber-violet light when activated — visible especially in Deepwell''s low-light environment. The patches appear organic rather than mechanical, integrated seamlessly into the skin. No visible chrome or metallic augmentations. The structural reinforcement to fingertip bones is not visually apparent but produces slightly unusual hand proportions — fingers slightly thicker and more robust than baseline.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness, each gesture economical and purposeful. Stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders slightly forward in a posture suited to hours spent working at cultivation benches. Hands rest naturally with palms slightly open — a gesture of openness that feels genuine rather than performed. Head tilts slightly when listening, a habit of someone working in spaces where sound travels strangely. Their presence feels anchoring — people around them unconsciously slow down.', N'Tier 4 working-class with personal adaptation. Wears loose linen tunics in earth tones (ochre, dark gray, faded brown) over reinforced work pants with multiple deep pockets. A heavy canvas apron over everything, stained with spore-growth medium and dyed various colors from bioluminescent compounds. Boots are practical, oil-treated leather, visibly old but meticulously maintained. Over the shoulders, a woven shawl in muted indigo that serves as both insulation and a place to carry small items. No corporate branding, no status signifiers — the clothing of someone who has moved beyond the need to perform their tier.', N'One of their fungal strains — DW-7''s back gray zone, never for sale — produces a compound that, in the right concentration, causes complete and painless cardiac arrest within six hours. They cultivated it deliberately twelve years ago when a man was hurting children in the station. They used it once. They have kept the strain alive ever since.', N'Botanical terminology mixed with Undertow pidgin and archaic Quechua phrases used as emphasis or punctuation; very formal when conducting trade', N'Slow and even, with comfortable silences — they never rush sentences or fill pauses', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hauk_salazar_kim_bangura');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a709-7401-9172-5f43a1f5a474', N'Gulshan Cervantes-Dang', N'Gulshan', N'', N'Cervantes-Dang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, Edgewater Prism, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Bootleg media seller and small-time data broker', N'Independent; informal network of Burnished Market vendors; connected to a loose collective of data-libertarian activists they will not name', N'Gulshan Cervantes-Dang is small and restless, with their Finnish grandmother''s pale complexion overlaid with their Nigerian father''s dark freckles — an unusual constellation across their nose and cheeks that they''ve leaned into by having bioluminescent nodes implanted along the same scatter pattern, so their freckles glow faint amber when they''re excited or running hot. Their hair is geneware-modified to shift between deep black and a washed-out violet depending on temperature, and they wear it asymmetrical and usually slightly chaotic. They dress in layers of cheap Burnished Market textiles — mismatched patterns, things they''ve traded for rather than bought — and have a habit of wearing too many small earrings, most of them handmade by their market neighbors.

Gulshan Cervantes-Dang''s stall is a masterpiece of organized chaos: rack after rack of slotted media chips, bootleg neural-experience packages, pirated entertainment feeds, and buried underneath the legitimate-seeming surface, curated data parcels for people who need specific information and can''t access corporate archives. They have a magpie intelligence — they absorb and cross-reference constantly — and a social performance of cheerful airheadedness that they use deliberately and effectively. Underneath it, they are careful, slightly paranoid, and very good at what they do. They believe information wants to be free in the way that some people believe in ELFs: devoutly, with rituals to match.', N'Information source, bootleg media provider, potential data broker for specific research needs, connection to underground information networks.', N'', N'Geneware: bioluminescent freckle nodes (amber, temperature-reactive), temperature-reactive hair color shift. Cyberware: subdermal data-chip reader in left palm (for quick-reading and verifying media chips without visible equipment). Neural interface jack behind right ear (for direct media monitoring).', N'Arrives at the Burnished Market around 10:00, sets up in an hour; sells media and takes data inquiries until 22:00; spends late nights in their flat above an Edgewater Prism noodle shop, acquiring, sorting, and packaging new data inventory.', N'Gulshan Cervantes-Dang, 158cm small-framed Asian-Latina woman with warm honey-brown skin and golden undertones, Southeast Asian almond-shaped deep brown eyes with amber flecks, asymmetrical dark hair with violet temperature-reactive highlights, fidgeting restless energy. Constellation of bioluminescent amber freckles glowing across nose and cheeks, small scar on left temple, neural interface jack visible behind right ear. Wearing layered mismatched cardigans, thermal underlayers visible at cuffs, cargo pants, worn boots, adorned with 6-8 earrings per ear and multiple mismatched beaded bracelets. GLMZ GLMZ marketplace setting, warm neon-amber lighting highlighting bioluminescent freckles, hands in motion, magpie attention darting eyes, restless energy captured mid-fidget, Burnished Market tier 3 aesthetic, urban gritty detail, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Hispanic/Latin American (53.9%) with significant Southeast Asian (30.3%) ancestry, plus Northern European (10.4%) and Sub-Saharan African (5.4%) heritage. The blend creates distinctive phenotypic features: warm honey-brown skin with golden undertones characteristic of the Latin American-Southeast Asian intersection, almond-shaped eyes reflecting Southeast Asian ancestry with warm amber tones, and facial structure showing the broad cheekbones and defined jawline common to Southeast Asian heritage softened by Latin American warmth. The minor Northern European and African contributions add subtle depth to skin luminosity and freckle patterning.', 158, 48, N'Small and wiry, with a restless energy that manifests in constant fidgeting and quick, economical movements. Lean muscle from years of hauling inventory and navigating crowded markets.', N'Temperature-reactive geneware; shifts between deep black (cool) and washed-out violet (warm/excited)', N'Asymmetrical, deliberately unkempt with one side shorter than the other; often has loose strands falling across their face', N'Medium (3-8 inches depending on side)', N'Deep brown with warm amber undertones and faint golden flecks, reflecting the blended Hispanic/Southeast Asian heritage', N'Warm honey-brown with golden undertones, medium depth with luminosity that reflects the complex blend of Hispanic/Latin American majority ancestry with Southeast Asian influences and touches of Northern European and African heritage.', N'Constellation of darker freckles and beauty marks across nose and cheeks, naturally intensified by genetic heritage and deliberately highlighted with bioluminescent nodes that glow soft amber when excited or body temperature rises. The freckle pattern creates an unusual, striking contrast against warm honey-brown skin. Skin generally clear and unblemished; shows minor nicks and scars from handling equipment and market wear.', N'Neural interface jack behind right ear (visible as small brushed-steel port with minimal scarring); bioluminescent freckle nodes glowing amber across face when excited. Subdermal data-chip reader in left palm is only visible as faint subcutaneous lines under skin when activated, otherwise hidden.', N'Constantly in motion—fidgeting with fingers, bouncing slightly while standing, moving between inventory with economical precision. Restless energy contained within a small frame. Speaks with hands. Eyes dart frequently, taking in surroundings with magpie attention. Casual slouch when relaxed; tenses and focuses sharply when discussing data or negotiating.', N'Tier 3-4 Burnished Market aesthetic: layered in mismatched, cheap textiles sourced from market trades rather than retail purchases. Often wears oversized cardigans or jackets in clashing patterns, thermal underlayers visible at cuffs, cargo pants or loose trousers with multiple pockets filled with small tools and chips. Boots are worn but maintained. Adorns wrists and ears with numerous handmade or traded jewelry pieces—mostly small earrings (6-8 per ear), beaded bracelets, and a mismatched collection of bangles. Overall effect is deliberately chaotic and performatively airheaded, masking careful intentionality beneath.', N'Two years ago they accidentally acquired a data packet containing evidence of a Tessera medical trial cover-up involving test subjects from Edgewater Prism. They have not released it. They tell themselves they are waiting for the right moment. The real reason is fear — and they know it, and it eats at them.', N'Fast, associative, full of media and tech references; code-switches between Finnish endearments, Yoruba exclamations, and Slovenian swear words inherited from different grandparents', N'Rapid-fire with sudden tangents; rarely finishes one sentence before starting a related one', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gulshan_cervantes_dang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d7-774e-b5d3-5f47d8c109d1', N'Ashraf Kristjánsson', N'Ashraf', N'', N'Kristjánsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Ironvein sub-district — a basement apartment beneath a legitimate alterations shop, near Damen and Armitage', N'Identity fabricator and forger operating in The Narrows', N'Independent; occasional work for the Narrows Mutual Aid Collective (which does not acknowledge this relationship)', N'Ashraf Kristjánsson is compact and precise, the kind of person whose stillness in a crowded room makes you notice her eventually, like a stone in moving water. Her heritage is Aleutian-Ghanaian, and her face carries both — broad cheekbones, deep brown skin, eyes the color of sea ice that shift to something almost golden in certain lights, a geneware mod she got at nineteen and never bothered reversing. Her hair is natural and enormous, usually pinned up under a faded headscarf when she works. Her hands are her most remarkable feature: surgeon-steady, ink-stained at the cuticles, and capable of replicating any biometric signature with enough reference material and time.

She does not think of herself as a criminal. She thinks of herself as a documentarian of alternate lives — she makes real what should already be real, papers for people whose papers were stolen, burned, or never issued. She charges a sliding scale that she determines unilaterally and that no one argues with because her work is simply that good. She is funny in a dry, sideways way, and she will feed you while you wait because she believes hungry clients make bad decisions and bad decisions make her work harder.', N'Service provider for characters needing new identities, information source about who is hiding and why, moral anchor demonstrating the human cost of documentation systems, quest giver when a client''s false identity causes complications', N'', N'Golden-shift irises (geneware, cosmetic). Neural steady-hand implant — eliminates tremor, improves fine motor precision. Subdermal UV-reading patch on right index finger.', N'Runs the alterations shop upstairs until midday (legitimate, skilled work), descends to the workshop in the afternoon for fabrication jobs, keeps a strict no-visitors-after-dark policy that she enforces with a crossbow she has never had to fire.', N'Ashraf Kristjánsson, a 158cm petite East Asian-dominant mixed heritage woman with warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, striking geneware-modified sea-ice blue eyes that shift amber in certain light, voluminous natural black curls pinned under a faded indigo headscarf, fine-featured face with blended East Asian and Sub-Saharan African structure, ink-stained fingers from precision work. Wearing fitted black pants and neutral linen shirt with sleeves rolled, tool apron, worn boots. GLMZ, GLMZ alterations shop setting, seated at workbench under warm overhead lighting, hands steady and deliberate mid-task, minimal jewelry, no augmentation marks visible except subtle eye modification, atmosphere of focused craftsmanship and practiced economy of motion, moody workshop ambiance with shadow and warm tungsten light --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Predominantly East Asian (55.9%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (22.1%) and Middle Eastern (20.5%) ancestry, creating a striking phenotype: warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones from the synthesis of all three heritage groups, East Asian facial structure notably refined by Sub-Saharan African features, and the compact, efficient frame characteristic of East Asian genetics', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry with surprising density — the frame of someone who moves with economy and purpose, minimal wasted mass', N'Natural black with subtle gray at the temples', N'Voluminous natural curls, typically pinned up under a faded headscarf during work; loose, it reaches mid-back', N'Long', N'Sea-ice blue with golden shift undertones (geneware modification, color intensity varies with light)', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden undertones — a rich blend reflecting the dominant East Asian genetics tempered and deepened by Sub-Saharan African and Middle Eastern heritage', N'Calm, deliberate face with prominent East Asian cheekbone structure enhanced by Sub-Saharan African fullness in the face, defined jawline with warm golden undertones characteristic of Middle Eastern heritage blending through the complexion; minimal jewelry aside from functional pieces; skin is clear and well-maintained from discipline rather than vanity', N'Geneware-modified irises are the only immediately visible augmentation; they shift from cool blue to amber depending on ambient light and viewing angle. The neural steady-hand implant and subdermal UV patch are invisible to casual observation.', N'Moves with deliberate stillness — economical, precise gestures with no wasted motion. Sits very still for extended periods. When she walks, her gait is measured and grounded. Hands are constantly in motion during work, steady as surgical instruments.', N'Tier 3-4 working class with intentional understatement. Upstairs: functional alterations-shop wear — fitted black pants, neutral linen shirts with sleeves rolled, tool apron. Downstairs: looser clothing that allows fine motor work without restriction, often layered sweaters, vintage or thrifted pieces. Faded headscarf in muted colors (indigo, charcoal, rust). Worn boots with good ankle support. No corpo branding, no status markers — the uniform of someone who values function over appearance.', N'Her own identity is fabricated — the real Solène Pribilof-Ankrah died in a Tessera detention facility fourteen years ago, and she has been living in her dead friend''s name ever since, a fact that makes every document she creates feel like a prayer and a wound simultaneously', N'Crisp, educated Meridian Standard with Francophone West African syntax patterns underneath; technical vocabulary for documents, materials, biometrics', N'Clipped and efficient until she relaxes, then longer sentences with dry asides', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ashraf_kristj_nsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67a-7615-9268-5f68b615e9d6', N'Elan Wójcik-Migizi', N'Elan', N'', N'Wójcik-Migizi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 54, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor, Slip 9 Tenements, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Street-level medic and unlicensed pharmacist, Old Harbor', N'Unaffiliated. Informally embedded in Old Harbor''s mutual aid network. Tolerated by the Harbor Syndicate because she patches their people without asking questions.', N'Elan Wójcik-Migizi is a broad-shouldered woman whose face carries the topography of a hard life: a jaw that juts slightly from a badly reset fracture, deep-set eyes the color of weathered teak, and a scar that traces from her left temple to her earlobe like a river on an old map. Her hair is cut close on the sides and left natural on top, shot through with white that she refuses to dye. She dresses in layered secondhand scrubs over thermal underlayers, her coat pockets sagging with vials, patches, and a battered tablet she uses to track patient histories. A single augmented right hand—matte carbon and copper-banded—contrasts with her otherwise un-augmented body, which she considers a point of quiet pride.

She runs a basement clinic out of Slip 9 that operates on a sliding scale payment system she invented herself: food, labor, information, or whatever someone can spare. The neighborhood knows her as the person you go to when the corporate med-kiosks have locked your insurance tier and you''re bleeding. She has delivered children, amputated gangrenous limbs by headlamp, and talked down three overdoses in a single night. The Meridian Core''s Health Compliance Division has cited her practice seventeen times. She has paid none of the fines.

What the neighborhood does not know is that Odessa''s medical knowledge came partly from a decade working as a trauma specialist for a mid-tier logistics corp that dumped toxic waste in Old Harbor—the same contamination that killed her younger brother, Emeka, twelve years ago. She left the corp, got herself deliberately delisted from licensed practitioner registries to avoid their reach, and turned her skills entirely toward the community that corp helped destroy. The guilt is structural, load-bearing. She will not let herself rest.', N'Moral anchor and community conscience for Old Harbor storylines. Embodies the cost of institutional complicity and the ambiguity of atonement. Creates pressure on characters to reckon with systemic harm versus individual survival.', N'', N'Right hand replacement (matte carbon prosthetic, copper sensor bands, haptic feedback calibrated for surgical precision)—obtained after a work accident she never fully explained', N'Wakes before 5am, checks overnight patient logs on her tablet before getting out of bed. Brews strong chicory coffee she imports in bulk. Clinic opens at 7am and theoretically closes at 9pm—in practice she is often working past midnight. Eats communally when she can, alone when she can''t. Keeps a handwritten ledger of every patient she''s lost. Reads old medical journals in paper form on Sunday mornings, the one ritual she guards.', N'Elan Wójcik-Migizi, 172cm tall woman with medium warm bronze skin reflecting Indigenous American, Eastern European, and South Asian heritage. Prominent high cheekbones, broad nasal bridge, deep brown eyes with amber undertones and subtle epicanthic fold. Short dark brown hair with white threading, faded on sides with natural texture on top. Jagged 12cm scar running from left temple to earlobe. Slight jaw asymmetry from old healed fracture. Weathered, lined face mapped by decades of hard work. Muscular, broad-shouldered build with functional density. Wearing faded teal and slate gray medical scrubs layered over thermal base layers, heavy insulated logistics company coat with bulging pockets, steel-toed resoled boots. Matte carbon-composite prosthetic right hand with copper sensor bands contrasting against organic left hand. Surgical mask hanging at neck. Thin silver ring worn through on left ring finger. Stands with weight forward, shoulders tense, economical movements. Small round burn scars visible on fingertips. Faded medical caduceus tattoo on inner left wrist. GLMZ medical underground worker in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, tired but vigilant expression, overhead neon-tinged clinical lighting casting sharp shadows across weathered features, gritty industrial medical setting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Predominantly Indigenous American (53.8%) with significant Eastern European (23.5%) ancestry, combined with South Asian (12.0%), Central Asian (7.7%), and Southeast Asian (2.6%) heritage. This creates a richly mixed phenotype reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora—strong Indigenous American bone structure and facial geometry blended with Eastern European angular features, South Asian facial proportions, and Central/Southeast Asian eye shape characteristics. The combination produces distinctive high, prominent cheekbones, a broad nasal bridge with slight flare, and eye shape reflecting the Southeast and Central Asian components.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid without excess softness; muscular across the chest and forearms from decades of manual medical work. Carries weight with functional density rather than bulk.', N'Natural dark brown with prominent white threading throughout', N'Fade on the sides, natural texture on top, worn unstyled and practical', N'Short', N'Deep brown with warm amber undertones and slight epicanthic fold reflecting Southeast and Central Asian heritage—weathered appearance from strain and age', N'Medium warm bronze with golden undertones, reflecting the dominant Indigenous American ancestry with warmth from South Asian heritage and depth from chronic sleep deprivation and environmental exposure. The tone carries the characteristic richness of blended Indigenous American and South Asian pigmentation.', N'Lined and deeply mapped by hard work and stress; prominent Indigenous American facial structure with defined high cheekbones and broad nasal bridge, refined by Eastern European angular prominence and South Asian facial proportions creating distinctive bone geometry. Eyes show slight epicanthic fold characteristic of Central and Southeast Asian ancestry. A prominent jagged scar traces from left temple to earlobe like a scar road. Jaw shows slight asymmetry from an old fracture reset imperfectly—healed but visible when she speaks. Cheekbones defined and prominent. Minimal grooming beyond function; no makeup, skin often marked by small calluses and old burn scars on fingertips.', N'Right hand is a complete prosthetic replacement—matte carbon-composite palm and fingers with visible copper sensor bands circling the wrist joint and metacarpal articulation points. The synthetic material contrasts starkly with her organic left hand. Haptic feedback servos are subtly audible when she makes precise movements.', N'Stands with weight balanced slightly forward, shoulders perpetually tense as if bracing against unseen pressure. Moves with economical efficiency—no wasted motion. Her augmented right hand moves with mechanical precision when performing detailed work, but she favors her organic left for casual gestures, suggesting conscious preference for the human touch. When tired (which is often), her head tilts slightly forward and her jaw tightens.', N'Utilitarian and tier-4 worn: layered secondhand medical scrubs in faded teal and slate gray over thermal base layers. A heavy insulated coat from a defunct logistics company (its branding half-removed) with oversized pockets visibly bulging with vials, patch kits, and a battered ruggedized tablet. Steel-toed boots, resoled multiple times. A surgical mask hangs around her neck even when not in use. No jewelry except for a thin silver band on her left ring finger—worn through at spots from constant wear.', N'She still has her old corp credentials buried in an encrypted partition. She uses them twice a year to siphon pharmaceutical shipments from corp distribution nodes—small enough quantities to stay below audit thresholds. She tells herself it''s restitution. She knows it''s also the one thing that would destroy everything she''s built if discovered.', N'Practical, precise, medical terminology slipping into everyday speech. Old Harbor creole inflections. Rarely uses contractions when she''s being serious. Calls patients ''sweetheart'' regardless of age.', N'Measured and deliberate, like someone who has learned that panic is contagious. Speeds up when she''s angry, which is the tell. Silences are not awkward to her—she uses them like instruments.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'elan_w_jcik_migizi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e8-7132-9cd4-5fa4ee5e0fc8', N'Gaudencio Cissé', N'Gaudencio', N'', N'Cissé', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism, outer plaza, east entrance, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Noodle cart vendor, operates a modified push cart outside the Edgewater Prism transit hub', N'Independent; small equipment loan through a Mexicantown Libre community credit cooperative', N'Gaudencio Cissé is tall and slightly too thin in the way of people who feed others better than themselves, with the elongated Zimbabwean features of his father''s side softened by his Finnish-Mexican mother''s coloring — he tans an unusual amber and burns only at the very tips of his ears, which he is vaguely proud of. He has cat ears, the small tufted dark-gray variety, which he has had since he was twelve and that his mother paid for on installment. He keeps them pressed flat when he is concentrating and swiveling independently when he is excited, which is frequently. His hands are scarred from early apprenticeship burns and always faintly fragrant with the lemongrass and dried chile that form the base of his broth.

The cart, which he calls The Debt (a joke only he fully appreciates, since he is still paying off the equipment loan), has been on the Edgewater Prism east plaza for two years and has developed a following out of proportion to its apparent simplicity. Gaudencio Cissé makes one rotating bowl per day — a different combination of noodles, broth, protein, and toppings, chalked on the small board he props against the cart''s front — and when it is gone, it is gone. He does not adapt the recipe to complaints. He does, however, adapt it to weather, to available ingredients, and to a private read of the day''s mood that he could not articulate but which consistently produces something people want.', N'Local color and social glue; his cart is a place where many kinds of people converge — useful for introducing player characters to neighborhood dynamics or other NPCs; can serve as a low-stakes information broker who trades in overheard conversation; potential hook for stories about street vendor economics and corporate encroachment', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (small, dark gray, tufted). Heat-tolerance skin treatment on both forearms (basic, allows extended contact with hot surfaces without burns — he got this after the apprenticeship scars and considers it the smartest money he has ever spent).', N'Wakes at 04:30 to start broth, runs ingredient acquisition through the Burnished Market network by 07:00, is set up on the plaza by 10:30, sells out between 13:00 and 15:00 depending on the day, and spends his evenings either experimenting at the shared kitchen in his residential block or collapsed in bed watching archived cooking competition footage on a secondhand tablet.', N'Neo-noir street chef Gaudencio Cissé, tall lean 188cm South Asian-Sub-Saharan African mixed heritage with East Asian refinement, warm golden-brown complexion with amber flecks in deep brown eyes. Dark brown shoulder-length hair braided back, small tufted dark gray geneware cat ears at crown perking with engagement. Clean-shaven angular high cheekbones, fine features, minor heat scars on cheekbones from steam work. Dense silvered burn scars across forearms and hands like badges of craft mastery. Wearing faded linen apron over rolled-sleeve cotton henley, cream work chinos, worn sneakers with good grip. Thin silver chain visible at neck. At his food cart in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226, steam rising, neon signs reflecting off wet concrete, hands gesturing expressively while talking about broth, whole body animated with passion, cat ears rotating with excitement, practiced economy of movement, meditative focus on craft, independent street vendor aesthetic, warm and authentic working-class lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Sub-Saharan African and South Asian mixed ancestry with East Asian secondary influence. The genetic blend creates a striking phenotype: approximately equal parts Sub-Saharan African (46.3%) and South Asian (45.2%) with East Asian refinement (8.5%). South Asian bone structure in his high cheekbones and angular jaw is enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth and warmth. The three-way mixture produces a distinctive warm-brown complexion with golden undertones from the South Asian component, depth and richness from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, and subtle East Asian refinement in his facial proportions.', 188, 68, N'Tall and lean, with visible muscle definition in his shoulders and forearms from years of repetitive stirring and lifting heavy pots. The thinness of someone who prioritizes feeding customers over himself, but not malnourished — disciplined rather than deprived.', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertones', N'Shoulder-length, usually braided back or tied in a loose knot to keep it clear of food preparation; a few strands often escape during service hours', N'Long', N'Deep brown with amber flecks', N'Warm golden-brown complexion with naturally rich undertones, the harmonious result of balanced Sub-Saharan African and South Asian ancestry with East Asian refinement. Tans easily and glows with subtle warmth in natural light.', N'Clean-shaven, fine-featured face with high cheekbones and angular jaw reflecting the balanced blend of South Asian structure and Sub-Saharan African warmth, refined by East Asian proportions. Skin shows minor heat scarring around the cheekbones from years of working near steam. Consistently sun-exposed on his face and neck, giving him a slight contrast with his body. Small, distinctive burn marks on the very tips of both ears from childhood sun exposure — he finds them endearing.', N'Geneware cat ears (small, dark gray, tufted) set at the crown of his head. When relaxed or concentrating, they press flat against his skull; when engaged or excited, they swivel and rotate independently, betraying his emotional state. The ears are seamlessly integrated with his existing hair and scalp, causing no visible scarring or integration line.', N'Moves with practiced economy behind the cart, each motion economical and purposeful. When excited or talking about food, his whole body becomes animated — his ears perk visibly, his hands gesture expressively, and he bounces slightly on the balls of his feet. At rest or during deep concentration on broth preparation, he becomes almost meditative, shoulders relaxed, movements slow and deliberate. He has a habit of smelling his hands unconsciously, checking for ingredient contamination or simply enjoying the lingering scent of his work.', N'Tier 3 utilitarian with personal flair. Typically wears a faded, well-maintained linen apron over a simple cotton henley or button-up shirt, sleeves rolled to the elbows to show the heat-treatment scarring as a badge of competence. His pants are sturdy work-grade chinos, usually cream or khaki, with a patch or two from years of service. Wears comfortable, worn but clean sneakers with good grip for standing on wet concrete. A thin silver chain around his neck, a gift from his mother, occasionally visible depending on neckline. His cart apron and prep uniform are scrupulously clean despite the work, suggesting fastidious personal standards. No visible jewelry beyond the chain, no corpo logos or brand affectation — his presentation announces independence and craft rather than wealth or status.', N'His broth base recipe was taught to him by an elderly woman who ran an unlicensed kitchen in the Mexicantown Libre basement level — she disappeared eight months ago and he has been quietly trying to find her through the network of people who eat at his cart, one question at a time', N'Enthusiastic and food-saturated; uses cooking process as metaphor for everything; occasional Shona phrases when genuinely moved', N'Fast and warm, tumbles slightly over itself when he is excited, which is often', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gaudencio_ciss');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69f-7739-95c9-5fe406b65626', N'Anezka Kristjánsson', N'Anezka', N'', N'Kristjánsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Vantage Meridian Corporate Campus, Tower 7 (Helix Biosystems regulatory floor), near State and Jackson', N'Corporate Compliance Officer, Helix Biosystems', N'Helix Biosystems', N'Anezka Kristjánsson is a compact woman with deep umber skin and close-cropped natural hair shot through with silver she has never once considered dyeing. Her eyes carry patterned irises — a Helix employee benefit from a decade ago, concentric rings of amber and slate that she privately hates but never removed because the reversal costs more than the installation. She dresses with surgical precision: hemlines calibrated, badge always centered, nothing extraneous. People mistake her quietness for calm. It is not calm. It is the stillness of someone who has read every clause of your contract and is simply waiting for you to finish speaking before she tells you exactly how exposed you are.

She came up from Tier 2, the daughter of a Finnish-Nigerian logistics clerk who worked Ferrogate Transit docks her entire life. Anezka Kristjánsson earned her compliance credentials through night study while working as a records auditor, and she carries that climb like a splinter in her chest — invisible, constant, defining. She is respected but not liked, thorough but not cruel, and she has protected Helix from at least three regulatory catastrophes that her superiors accepted credit for without acknowledgment. She prays to the E.L.F. that lives in the building''s HVAC system, leaving encrypted data fragments as offerings, asking only for clarity.', N'Information source and quest-giver — she knows where Helix''s bodies are buried and occasionally needs someone outside the system to act on what she cannot officially report. Also serves as institutional obstacle and reluctant ally.', N'', N'Patterned irises (amber/slate concentric rings, Helix cosmetic benefit package). Subdermal data-port on left wrist for document authentication. No other augmentations — she distrusts unnecessary chrome.', N'Arrives at Tower 7 precisely 22 minutes before her shift begins, reviews overnight regulatory filings from the Zheng-Dao and Palladian compliance wires, then spends the day conducting internal audits and preparing violation disclosures she hopes no one ever needs to read. Eats lunch alone at her desk, always the same cassava flatbread with a thermos of palm-nut broth her mother''s recipe.', N'Anezka Kristjánsson, 158cm compact frame, medium-warm olive-bronze skin blending Northern European, Latin, South Asian, African, and Eastern European heritage, naturally ambiguous phenotype. Close-cropped black hair with silver threads, geometrically precise. Modified cybernetic eyes with concentric amber and slate rings, hypnotic and clinical. Medium-toned complexion with blended facial features—moderate cheekbones, straight nose, warm iris set with African genetic spacing. Upright posture, economical movement. Dressed in charcoal tailored corporate blazer, crisp white shirt, sensible chrome-buckled shoes, platinum badge holder. Silver inherited ring on right hand. Subdermal data-port on left wrist barely visible under functional watch. Thin white scar along right collarbone. Minimal makeup, controlled expression. Standing in sleek corporate interior, cool blue-white lighting highlighting the geometric precision of her appearance and the unsettling aurora of her implanted irises. GLMZ aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Vantage Meridian Corporate Campus', N'local', N'Vantage Meridian Corporate Campus', N'Complex pan-global ancestry: Northern European (30.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (17.6%), South Asian (16.9%), Sub-Saharan African (15.1%), Eastern European (12.7%), and East Asian (7.5%). This creates a distinctly cosmopolitan phenotype—warm, multi-tonal skin that resists simple categorization, combining olive undertones from Mediterranean and Latin lineages with deeper warmth from African and South Asian heritage. Facial structure is genuinely blended: moderate cheekbones with slight width at the base, straight nose characteristic of Northern European ancestry, eye spacing and setting reflecting African genetics with warm iris placement, broader face proportions that bridge Latin American and Northern European lineages while incorporating South Asian width. The cumulative effect is someone whose ancestry reads as ''everywhere and nowhere''—unmistakably mixed-heritage without resolving to a single regional category.', 158, 52, N'Compact and economical, lean muscle without softness. The kind of frame built from climbing stairs and carrying responsibility. Minimal excess, everything functional.', N'Natural black with silver threads', N'Close-cropped, shaped with geometric precision, no styling product — just maintenance', N'Short', N'Modified: concentric rings of amber and slate (Helix cosmetic package), iris pattern hypnotic and deliberately impersonal', N'Medium-warm with complex undertones: olive-bronze from Northern/Eastern European and Latin heritage, deepened with warmth from Sub-Saharan African and South Asian ancestry. The result reads as genuinely ambiguous in tone—not quite warm, not quite cool, with a subtle luminosity that suggests mixed genetics. Medium depth overall, unmarked except for age and accumulated watchfulness.', N'Clean, minimal makeup—perhaps a neutral lip tone for meetings. The complex mid-tone base of her skin shows discipline: no scars, no blemishes, maintained like a compliance document. Facial features unmistakably blended: moderate cheekbone prominence with subtle width through the face, straight nose bridge, warm iris set with spacing characteristic of African genetics, subtle proportional width that bridges multiple ancestry groups. Expression rarely shifts; when it does, it registers as a tremor.', N'Only the patterned irises are immediately visible—amber and slate rings that catch light unnervingly, making prolonged eye contact feel clinical. The subdermal data-port is hidden unless she rolls her sleeve.', N'Upright, economical. She does not gesture while speaking. Her movement through space is deliberate—no wasted motion, no fidgeting. She walks as if every step is logged. When she sits, her back does not touch the chair back. Her hands rest flat on the desk.', N'Tier 1-2 corporate uniform refined to ritual: charcoal or black tailored blazers (likely Voss or similar mid-tier corpo brand), hemlines precisely knee-length, white shirts with minimal wrinkle, sensible shoes with a single chrome buckle. A platinum badge holder. Her watch is functional, not luxury. She wears a silver ring on her right hand—simple band, inherited from her mother. No other jewelry. Everything reads as controlled, nothing as expressive.', N'Three years ago she discovered that a Helix gene-therapy trial was falsifying adverse event data. She filed an internal report. It was buried. She kept a copy — encrypted, fragmented across six dead-drop nodes — and has been deciding ever since whether she is brave enough to use it.', N'Formal, precise, regulation-fluent. Uses exact terminology, never contractions in professional settings. In rare unguarded moments, slips into a looser Tier 2 vernacular she spent years training out of herself.', N'Measured and deliberate. Pauses before responding. Never rushes.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anezka_kristj_nsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63a-7518-b561-603f2a2c5f54', N'Anya Lewandowski', N'Anya', N'', N'Lewandowski', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Calumet Rise — employed in the Tidewatch Residential Stack, a mid-tier housing block of 340 units, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Building cleaner and maintenance aide, residential tower', N'Employed by Calumet Rise Residential Management (a Tessera-adjacent property company); UBC supplemented by his wages', N'Anya Lewandowski is young enough that people still call him ''the boy'' without meaning anything cruel by it, and old enough that it has started to wear on him. He''s got a Congolese-Samoan background through his father and a Kazakh-Swedish line through his mother, an inheritance that gave him a broad build he hasn''t grown into yet and a face that oscillates between very young and very old depending on what shift he just came off. His hair is natural and high, kept carefully shaped on his days off; on shift he pins it under a grey cap. His bioluminescent skin modification is subtle — a faint bluish-silver glow along his temples and the backs of his hands that''s visible mainly in low light, and that he''s extremely proud of even though he got it done at a discount parlor in the Narrows and the fade will probably be uneven in a few years.

Anya Lewandowski is sociable in the way that people are when they''ve grown up in small shared spaces — he knows how to read a room quickly, how to be unobtrusive or present as the situation requires, and how to carry gossip without it looking like he''s carrying it. He''s not ambitious in ways he''s articulated to himself, but he is paying close attention to everything. He has a quality of watchfulness that most adults don''t register in someone his age because they assume his job makes him invisible, and he lets them assume that.', N'Information source — knows everything happening in the building, including who comes and goes from which units at what hours; potential protagonist surrogate for players entering Calumet Rise; represents the economic pressure of Tier 1-2 life without the romanticization of crime or running; can provide access to areas of the building outsiders couldn''t reach.', N'', N'Bioluminescent subdermal pigment, temples and hands (blue-silver, cosmetic, discount parlor quality).', N'Split shift: 06:00–10:00 common-area cleaning, 18:00–22:00 trash processing and maintenance calls; spends the gap between shifts in the building''s basement break room, eating, gaming, or listening to residents who mistake him for invisible.', N'Anya Lewandowski, 178cm tall with broad shoulders and substantial build, warm golden-beige complexion with olive undertones blending Eastern European, Northern European, and Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Dark brown nearly-black hair cut short and shaped, faint bioluminescent blue-silver subdermal glow along temples and dorsal hands visible in low light. Dark warm-toned brown eyes, young face with complex character. Wearing grey Calumet Rise maintenance uniform or muted oversized Tier 3-4 streetwear, cheap steel chain necklace. Posture deliberate and unobtrusive, careful movement of service worker. GLMZ GLMZ, dim industrial lighting casting blue-silver glow from subdermal augmentation, quiet confidence, working-class aesthetic, maintenance worker off-shift in neon-lit street environment --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Calumet Rise', N'local', N'Calumet Rise', N'Eastern European (51.8%), Northern European (28.9%), and Hispanic/Latin American (19.3%) ancestry — a genetic blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The result is a warm, complex complexion with layered undertones: a pale-to-medium base from Northern and Eastern European ancestry, warmed and deepened by Hispanic/Latin American heritage, creating a sun-kissed, golden-toned complexion that shifts subtly in different light.', 178, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial through the chest and upper back, not yet muscled into definition — the frame of someone still settling into their adult body. Carries weight evenly; not soft, not lean, but somewhere between growing into strength and not yet demanding it of themselves.', N'Natural dark brown, nearly black', N'Shaped high and close to the scalp on days off; meticulously maintained in a fade/shape-up. On shift, pinned back under a grey maintenance cap.', N'Short', N'Dark brown, warm-toned', N'Warm golden-beige with subtle olive undertones — the convergence of Eastern European, Northern European, and Hispanic/Latin American genetics producing a complexion that shifts from pale amber in winter to sun-warmed bronze in summer, with consistent golden warmth regardless of season.', N'Young face with an unusual quality: can read as very young one moment (soft jaw, bright eyes) and prematurely aged the next (depending on shift exhaustion and lighting). Clear skin with minimal scarring. Well-groomed on days off; on shift, often flushed or marked by the physical work of the day. Facial structure reflects the blend of ancestry — broad across the cheekbones with subtle definition in the jaw, combining the characteristic bone structure of Eastern European heritage with the warmer, softer features of Hispanic/Latin American ancestry.', N'Bioluminescent subdermal pigment on temples and dorsal hands — visible primarily in dim lighting as a faint, pulsing blue-silver glow. No obvious chrome, no optical augmentation. Everything else is internal or subcutaneous.', N'Carries themselves with the careful quietness of someone trained by small spaces and service work — deliberate, unobtrusive, shoulders slightly rounded as if perpetually ready to make themselves smaller. Moves with efficiency rather than haste. Has learned to be present or invisible as the room requires; default is to observe more than to initiate, but without the rigidity of genuine shyness. Quick reader of social cues.', N'On shift: grey Calumet Rise maintenance uniform (durable synthetic weave, corporate-issued, slightly worn), grey cap, practical slip-on shoes rated for wet floors. Off-shift: Tier 3-4 streetwear — clean but not expensive, often oversized to compensate for still-unfamiliar frame. Favors muted colors. No corpo branding, but clean enough to suggest Tier 3-4 status. Wears a cheap steel chain around neck with no pendant — a habit more than a statement.', N'Unit 1107''s resident, a mid-level Tessera compliance manager, regularly has someone visit late at night who is not on the building''s guest registry and doesn''t match any of the resident''s known contacts. Jemba has seen this person''s face. He recognized the face because it belongs to someone on a wanted notice in the building''s public security feed — wanted by Tessera itself, in fact. He doesn''t know what it means and is afraid to find out, but he hasn''t told anyone.', N'Informal and current — the particular slang of Calumet Rise''s youth cohort, mixed with phrases from his parents'' households; reaches for precision when he''s talking about something he cares about and often surprises people with the result.', N'Quick, light, deflects into jokes when conversations get heavy; slows down and gets specific when he''s serious.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anya_lewandowski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('8c1abc57-f77e-7ba6-a30a-606d892e612f', N'Ekta Valenzuela', N'Ekta', N'', N'Valenzuela', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 71, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit, near Damen and North. No fixed address — moves between safe houses with the Atlas.', N'Keeper of the Atlas of Irregularities', N'The Cartographers (Keeper)', N'Ekta Valenzuela is 71 years old, lean as a drafting pencil, with deep brown skin weathered by decades of outdoor observation and close-cropped white hair he cuts himself with scissors. His hands are precise — an engineer''s hands, steady enough to draw a straight line freehand on paper at 71 the way he could at 25. He wears the same rotation of three dark coats, all of them too large, all of them with interior pockets modified to hold measuring instruments, pencils, and the leather map case that contains the Atlas of Irregularities.

He was a structural engineer for 35 years. A good one. The kind who could look at a building and tell you where the stress fractures would appear in ten years. He began the Atlas when his measurements stopped adding up — when a building he''d surveyed at 47 meters measured 49 meters the following week, and 46 the week after that, and he realized that the discrepancy was not his instruments and not his methodology but the building itself. He measured it 200 times over six months. It was never the same height twice.

He hasn''t spoken above a whisper in six years. He says "the city listens" and will not elaborate. Whether this is metaphor, paranoia, or observation is a question the Cartographers have stopped asking. They have noticed that anomalies in Emile''s vicinity behave differently than anomalies observed by louder researchers. The Seam, which varies between 3 and 11 meters wide, has been measured at a consistent 7.2 meters every time Emile is present. The city holds still for him.

He carries the Atlas in a leather case that he made himself from leather he tanned himself from a cow that died of old age on a the Gray Zone rooftop. He is unaugmented. He has never had a BCI. He navigates the city with a paper map, a compass, and the kind of spatial awareness that used to be called a sense of direction and is now called a disability.', N'Emile is the city''s witness — the person who observes what cannot be explained and insists on recording it without explanation. He provides a framework for anomalies that is neither supernatural nor scientific but structural: the city has an architecture that includes the impossible, and someone needs to map it.', N'', N'None. Unaugmented. No BCI. Navigates by paper map and compass.', N'Walks observation routes through the Circuit, the Gray Zone, and Underworld. Measures. Draws. Whispers notes into the Atlas. Meets with Cartographers at rotating locations. Eats bread from Block 9.', N'Ekta Valenzuela, 173cm lean frame, deep warm brown skin with olive undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, East Asian, and Hispanic heritage. High defined cheekbones, broad nose bridge, angular facial structure. Close-cropped white hair, deep brown eyes yellowed with age. Weathered face carved by decades of precision work. Hands bearing permanent pencil calluses and a thin scar. Wearing oversized dark charcoal coat over plain undershirt, dark trousers, worn leather boots. Leather map case worn bandolier-style across chest. Hand-tanned leather and brass instruments visible in coat pockets. Measuring tape and compass near belt. Posture: measured, intentional, head slightly forward as if reading invisible gauges. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, completely unaugmented, no visible chrome or cybernetics. Standing in dim industrial setting, shadow and neon backdrop, cinematic lighting emphasizing the geometric precision of his bearing and the weathered authenticity of his appearance. Minimalist, utilitarian aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Three dark oversized coats in rotation, all modified with interior instrument pockets', N'', N'Bread from Block 9', N'', N'', N'The Circuit, near Damen and North', N'city-wide', N'The Circuit, near Damen and North', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: Sub-Saharan African (45.0%) forms the dominant genetic foundation, with significant Hispanic/Latin American (26.2%), South Asian (14.1%), East Asian (12.0%), and minor Eastern European (2.7%) ancestry. Features reflect this complex genetic mosaic—deep warm brown skin with olive and bronze undertones creating dimensional richness. Facial structure shows the architectural influence of East and South Asian ancestry in defined cheekbones and nose bridge, softened by Sub-Saharan fullness and Hispanic warmth. A distinctly mixed appearance unmarked by singular regional identity.', 173, 62, N'Lean, almost ascetic—decades of walking measurement routes have worn him down to essential geometry. No excess. Posture still straight from engineer''s discipline, but the straightness now reads as fragility rather than formality.', N'White', N'Close-cropped, self-cut with visible uneven edges. No vanity in it. Functional.', N'Short', N'Deep brown, slightly yellowed at the sclera from age and screen-minimal living', N'Deep warm brown with subtle olive-bronze undertones—a harmonious blend reflecting Sub-Saharan, South Asian, Hispanic, and East Asian ancestry. Weathered to the texture of old leather from decades of outdoor surveying, sun exposure etched into every line.', N'Face carved by time and precision. High, defined cheekbones with angular structure from East and South Asian ancestry, softened by Sub-Saharan fullness and Hispanic warmth. Deep nasolabial lines frame a wide mouth. Broad nose bridge with slightly flared nostrils reflecting the blended African and South Asian heritage. Hands show liver spots and permanent calluses on the index and middle fingers from pencil grip—the hands of someone who has drawn 10,000 lines by hand. No jewelry. No grooming beyond necessity.', N'None. Completely unaugmented. His body is the original template—no chrome, no LEDs, no visible cybernetics. This is itself unusual enough to mark him in the 2226 GLMZ.', N'Moves with measured precision—each step intentional, no wasted motion. Head slightly forward, as if perpetually reading invisible gauges in the air. Hands often move in small, unconscious gestures: measuring, drawing invisible lines. When stationary, becomes almost perfectly still. Speaks only in whispers; exhales carry more weight than his words.', N'Three rotating dark coats (charcoal, near-black, dark brown), all oversized and deliberately worn—Tier 4 functionality, deliberately unstylish to avoid notice. Interior pockets modified extensively for instruments: pencils (mechanical and wooden), measuring tape, calipers, compass, leather-bound notebook, brass rulers. Undershirt always plain, worn close to the skin. Dark trousers, multiple pockets. Worn leather boots, resoled multiple times. A leather map case, hand-tanned and hand-stitched, worn across the chest like a bandolier. No visible corporate branding. No Φ-tech. Everything utilitarian, nothing decorative.', N'The Atlas wrote an entry he did not write. Page 412. In his handwriting, in his ink, describing an anomaly he has never observed in a location he has never visited. The description was accurate. He has not told anyone.', N'Precise, technical, engineering terminology applied to impossible phenomena — ''load-bearing anomaly,'' ''structural integrity of the inexplicable''', N'Whispered. Every word deliberate. Long pauses between sentences. Speaks as if rationing sound.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ekta_valenzuela');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a687-7ae2-97dd-60f3284b0680', N'Gencer Konaté-Sesay-Deshpande', N'Gencer', N'', N'Konaté-Sesay-Deshpande', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, unit 4 of the Emeka Arcade — a narrow shopfront wedged between a dumpling counter and a prosthetic repair stall, near Ashland and Division', N'Tailor and seamstress, runs a small alterations shop', N'Independent — Orsolya''s Alterations, unofficial member of the Hamtramck Enclave Merchant Compact', N'Gencer Konaté-Sesay-Deshpande is a compact, heavyset woman whose hands are the most expressive thing about her — calloused at the fingertips from decades of needle work, stained faintly indigo from fabric dye she never quite gets out. Her hair is bone-white, worn in tight loops pinned close to her skull, and her skin is deep brown with an undertone of reddish amber. A cosmetic mod gives her irises a slow geometric shimmer, silver hexagons rotating lazily — a gift from her daughter she''s never removed even though she found it frivolous at the time. She dresses simply but always immaculately; her clothes fit her like testimony.

She has a particular stillness to her that people mistake for coldness until she starts talking, at which point they realize it''s actually patience. She will hold a pin in her teeth and listen to a customer describe a wedding, a funeral, a job interview, a first date, while her hands move without her eyes watching them. She''s witnessed thirty years of human milestone dressed in fabric, and she has quiet opinions about all of it. She doesn''t share them unless asked. When she does, they tend to land.', N'Local elder and information repository. Knows everyone in the Enclave by their measurements and their secrets. Can provide context on neighborhood history, inter-community tensions, missing persons, and the slow encroachment of Tessera corporate development. Possible quest giver for missing heirloom garment or someone who left behind a coat.', N'', N'Cosmetic iris mod (silver rotating hexagons, gift from daughter). Articular stabilizers in both wrists installed after tendinitis nearly ended her career at 44 — basic Helix Biosystems model, undecorated.', N'Opens the shop at 0730, takes clients by appointment until midday, walks to the Enclave''s shared market for lunch and gossip, returns for walk-ins until 1900. Closes with a small prayer to the E.L.F. she believes lives in her sewing machine — she calls it Thimble and leaves it a thread offering nightly.', N'Gencer Konaté-Sesay-Deshpande, 158cm compact heavyset woman with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, mixed South Asian-African-East Asian heritage evident in defined cheekbones and subtle angular eyes. Bone white short coiled hair pinned neatly. Cosmetic iris mod with rotating silver hexagons, deep brown base. Age 58, standing in GLMZ textile shop, leaning against worn work table, meditative stillness. Calloused hands with permanent indigo staining from decades of dye work, scarred wrists from articular stabilizers. Wearing self-tailored charcoal linen apron over cream wool blend, practical leather shoes worn smooth. Neutral earth tone palette, immaculate despite age. Soft workshop lighting casting shadows across her thoughtful face, gold band ring catching light. Neo-noir urban aesthetic meets human craftsmanship, grounded presence, economical movement, digital age mastery through analog precision. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'South Asian (41.8%), Sub-Saharan African (33.5%), East Asian (22.1%), Southeast Asian (2.6%) — a striking genetic blend resulting in warm deep brown skin with golden-amber undertones, refined facial structure with broad cheekbones and defined jawline characteristic of South Asian and West African ancestry, with subtle angular eye geometry from East Asian heritage and the graceful proportions of Southeast Asian lineage', 158, 82, N'Compact and heavyset with a low center of gravity; shoulders slightly rounded from decades hunched over work tables, but core strength evident in how she carries herself', N'Bone white, natural aging', N'Tight coils pinned close to the skull in neat rows, precision-groomed', N'Short', N'Deep brown with silver hexagonal geometric shimmer (cosmetic iris mod, rotating slowly)', N'Deep warm brown with golden-amber undertone, even complexion reflecting the blended heritage of South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, and Southeast Asian ancestry', N'Well-maintained despite her age; minimal wrinkles around the eyes from squinting at fine work; faint indigo staining at the cuticles and around the nail beds from decades of fabric dye exposure; broad cheekbones and defined jawline characteristic of her mixed South Asian and African ancestry; subtle angular features around the eyes and refined nose bridge from East Asian and Southeast Asian heritage; hands are the focal point — calloused fingertips, precise cuticles, always clean despite stains', N'Cosmetic iris modification (rotating silver hexagons in both eyes, slow geometric pattern). Wrist augmentations are subcutaneous — no visible chrome or plating, only subtle joint articulation if watched closely during precise movement', N'Centered and still, almost meditative in repose. When working, her hands move with unconscious precision while her eyes focus on customer faces rather than the fabric. Walking gait is economical and grounded. She favors leaning against her work table when listening, weight distributed evenly. Stillness is her default state; people often mistake it for coldness until she speaks', N'Simple but immaculate — always self-tailored to perfection. Favors neutral earth tones (charcoal, taupe, cream, deep indigo) and natural fabrics (linen, cotton, wool blends). Her apron is a toolkit: multiple pockets, deep and organized, always worn over her clothes. Clothes fit her like they were grown on her body — a walking advertisement for her craftsmanship. Tier 3 quality materials, but executed at Tier 1 precision. Comfortable footwear (worn leather shoes, meticulously maintained). No visible jewelry except for a simple gold band on her left ring finger, worn smooth', N'Twenty years ago she reported a neighbor to Tessera housing enforcement over a lease dispute, and that family was evicted into the Gray Zone. The neighbor''s youngest daughter now lives two streets away and doesn''t know. Orsolya has been quietly leaving anonymous food credits in the family''s building account ever since.', N'Precise and economical. Romanian-inflected sentence structures occasionally surface — dropped articles, inverted phrasing. Uses sewing metaphors unconsciously.', N'Measured, unhurried. Long pauses are comfortable for her. Doesn''t fill silence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gencer_konat_sesay_deshpande');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d2-77d3-9056-60f8881e1b41', N'Gunhild Cho-Ekwensi', N'Gunhild', N'', N'Cho-Ekwensi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenwood Gate, Helix Biosystems Regional Compliance Tower, Floor 31, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Corporate Compliance Officer, Helix Biosystems', N'Helix Biosystems', N'Gunhild Cho-Ekwensi is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin and close-cropped natural hair threaded with silver at the temples. Her eyes carry the patterned irises of an old Helix loyalty package — concentric rings of amber and black that pulse faintly when she''s under stress, which she''ll tell you is never. She dresses in structured charcoal suits that cost more than most Tier 2 workers earn in a month, always with a single piece of color: a yellow lapel pin, a rust-red pocket square. She moves through corridors like she owns them, which functionally she does — at least the compliance corridors.

Gunhild Cho-Ekwensi has cultivated a reputation as the person who makes problems disappear before they become audits. She is precise, relentless, and fluent in the language of regulatory gray areas. Colleagues who don''t know her well find her cold; colleagues who do know her well find her terrifying. She has a wry sense of humor that surfaces only with people she trusts, and she trusts almost no one. She was born in the Tier 2 industrial blocks of Calumet Rise and clawed her way into corporate law through scholarship programs and sheer stubbornness, a fact she neither advertises nor forgets.', N'Quest giver for investigations into corporate malfeasance; information broker on Helix''s internal structure; obstacle for anyone trying to exploit regulatory loopholes; moral grey zone figure who might help or hinder depending on what serves her agenda.', N'', N'Patterned amber-and-black irises (Helix loyalty cosmetic, old model). Subdermal neural interface for document access and real-time regulatory database queries. Mild cochlear enhancement for recording ambient conversations — legally disclosed to Helix HR, not to anyone else.', N'Arrives at her tower office before most staff, reviews overnight flagged reports over bitter synthetic coffee, and spends her afternoons in back-to-back compliance reviews that leave junior staff visibly shaken. Leaves exactly on time, every day, without explaining where she goes.', N'Gunhild Cho-Ekwensi, GLMZ, East Asian and Afro-Latina corporate executive, 178cm tall athletic frame. Warm golden-brown skin with burnished undertones blending East Asian luminosity with Sub-Saharan depth and Latin warmth. High prominent cheekbones with East Asian definition, squared jawline with subtle fullness, expression neutral and contemptuous. Natural black hair with silver temples, close-cropped precision cut revealing skull geometry. Augmented amber and black concentric iris rings with faint bioluminescence, silver subdermal neural interface line beneath left ear. Immaculate complexion, dark matte lipstick. Charcoal tailored Italian suit Φ10,000+, platinum executive watch, subtle yellow lapel pin accent. Helix Tier 1 corporate elite aesthetic. Controlled precise posture, calculated angles, intentional minimal movement. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon-lit corporate tower interior, cool backlighting, professional boardroom setting with geometric shadows. Direct commanding eye contact, calculating gaze. Neo-noir noir corporate atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenwood Gate', N'local', N'Kenwood Gate', N'Tri-continental diaspora: East Asian foundation (48.3%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (26.8%) and Sub-Saharan African (24.9%) admixture. Features reflect this balanced genetic blend with warm, multi-layered undertones combining East Asian structure, Latin American warmth, and African depth.', 178, 72, N'Broad-shouldered and athletic with deliberate musculature; carries herself with the compact efficiency of someone who treats her body as a tool. No excess, no waste.', N'Natural black with silver threading at temples', N'Close-cropped, precision-cut, revealing the full geometry of her skull', N'Short', N'Augmented amber and black in concentric patterned rings; faintly bioluminescent when under stress', N'Warm medium-golden brown with complex undertones—East Asian luminosity layered with Latin American warmth and Sub-Saharan depth, creating a distinctive burnished, sun-kissed quality', N'Immaculate; minimal makeup, usually just dark matte lipstick. Skin shows no visible damage or scarring. Facial structure reflects balanced tri-continental ancestry: high, prominent cheekbones with East Asian definition softened by Latin warmth, squared jawline with subtle fullness, expression typically neutral or faintly contemptuous.', N'Patterned iris augmentation (Helix loyalty cosmetic, circa 2195 model) with faint amber bioluminescence under stress. Subdermal neural interface and cochlear enhancement are invisible to casual observation.', N'Moves with controlled precision; never hurried, never relaxed. Walks as if calculating angles. Stands with weight evenly distributed, ready to shift. Minimal gesture when speaking; every movement intentional. Makes direct eye contact as a tactic, not a courtesy.', N'Structured charcoal suits tailored to fit her broad frame, Italian weave, cost Φ8,000–12,000 per piece. Minimal jewelry: platinum watch (Helix standard-issue executive), no rings. Always one deliberate pop of color: yellow lapel pin, rust-red pocket square, occasionally a charcoal blouse with a thin amber stripe. Helix building access keypad integrated into her suit cuff. Clothing marks her as firmly Tier 1 corporate elite.', N'Three years ago she buried a Helix clinical trial report showing elevated neurological side effects in a geneware line — a line that''s still on the market. She told herself the data was inconclusive. She reviews the buried file every six months and hasn''t decided yet what to do with it.', N'Precise, legalistic, favors exact terms over approximations. Uses corporate jargon fluently but can switch it off entirely when she wants to unsettle someone.', N'Measured, unhurried. Pauses before key points for emphasis. Never raises her voice.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gunhild_cho_ekwensi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b8-7c0e-92fb-61e216ead521', N'Cleo Dalgaard', N'Cleo', N'', N'Dalgaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 59, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spires — mid-level corporate residential towers, near Michigan Ave and Oak', N'Aerial extraction and rapid transit pilot — getaway pilot', N'Independent — Dockside connections', N'Cleo Dalgaard is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 59, her face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and she has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Her entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. She works as a getaway pilot out of The Spires, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Cleo Dalgaard is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who she burned last.', N'Aslan Granlund-Tawiah functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio. Geneware muscle density treatment — looks natural, hits like chrome', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Cleo Dalgaard, 183cm tall diaspora pilot with unmistakably global features: rich warm bronze skin blending Northern European, Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, and East Asian heritage. Broad high cheekbones, angular jaw, refined East Asian eye shape with light brown-amber eyes, straight nasal bridge with subtle fullness at base. Iron gray hair with copper undertones pulled back tight. Thin scar across left temple barely visible. Brushed titanium vocal modulator at throat glowing soft blue. Wearing matte black reinforced flight jacket over charcoal utility cargo pants, worn pre-2200s hand-tooled leather jacket, military-grade boots. Tarnished silver ring on left ring finger. Economical posture, calculating gaze tracking sight lines. GLMZ cockpit or industrial dock setting, cool neon and natural light mixing, her global phenotype striking against chrome and concrete. Mood: competent, weathered, diaspora-generation survivor. Professional portrait, angular geometric composition highlighting her panethnic features. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spires', N'local', N'The Spires', N'Complex panethnic ancestry combining Northern European (48%), Sub-Saharan African (26.4%), Indigenous American (13.9%), East Asian (10.9%), and trace Middle Eastern (0.8%) genetics. This rare combination creates a phenotype that reads as distinctly diaspora-mixed: Northern European bone structure provides baseline facial angles and bridge refinement; Sub-Saharan African ancestry contributes rich melanin depth, pronounced cheekbone geometry, and fuller lip structure; Indigenous American heritage adds distinctive cheekbone prominence and facial width; East Asian genetics refine the eye shape with slight epicanthic quality and contribute bridge definition; trace Middle Eastern warmth adds subtle richness to overall tone. The result is an unmistakably global face — no single heritage dominates visually, creating a striking geometric blend that marks her as Ubiquitous Diaspora generation.', 183, 71, N'Lean and angular, with wiry musculature that reads as natural until you see her move — geneware muscle density treatment gives her deceptive power in economical frame', N'Iron gray with faded copper undertones', N'Pulled back tight, practical, minimal styling', N'Medium — shoulder-length, utilitarian', N'Light brown with amber rim', N'Rich warm bronze with complex undertone interplay: honeyed base from Northern European fairness harmonizing with deep melanin richness from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, further warmed by East Asian undertones and sun-weathered from outdoor flight hours. In natural light reads as luminous bronze; in shadow deepens to warm mahogany brown. Melanin distribution creates visual depth while maintaining brightness characteristic of mixed Northern European heritage.', N'Striking geometric blend of global features: broad, prominent cheekbones with fullness reflecting Sub-Saharan African and Indigenous American ancestry meet angular, defined Northern European jaw structure. Eyes refined by East Asian genetics with subtle epicanthic fold and darker iris pigmentation. Nasal bridge is fine and straight, influenced by Northern European and East Asian ancestry, with base width reflecting African heritage. Overall facial geometry is distinctly panethnic — wide through the cheekbones, tapered at the jaw, refined at the bridge. Lip structure fuller from African ancestry. Skin texture shows sun-weathering and callus marks; minimal cosmetic grooming.', N'Chrome vocal modulator visible at throat — brushed titanium insert at anterior neck, approximately 4cm wide, with subtle LED indicator that glows soft blue when in use. No attempt to conceal it. Moves with the ease of someone who has worn chrome long enough to forget it isn''t bone.', N'Economical, minimal gesture. Sits with weight distributed for quick movement. Walks like she''s always calculating sight lines and exit vectors. When speaking, hand movements are deliberate and spare — the chrome modulator does the work. Eyes track movement constantly, habit not paranoia.', N'Tier 2-3 hybrid: functional tactical base (reinforced flight jacket in matte black synthetic, utility cargo pants in charcoal gray), paired with mid-tier civilian approximation (understated brands, nothing that flags wealth or gang affiliation). Wears a worn leather flight jacket over everything — pre-2200s, hand-tooled, tells its own story. Boots are military-grade and regularly maintained. Jewelry minimal: a simple ring on her left ring finger, tarnished silver, worn smooth.', N'', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cleo_dalgaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a696-7ea8-8802-62180b36fe9e', N'Anjum Krstić', N'Anjum', N'', N'Krstić', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hough Reclamation (fieldwork); Meridian Core (institutional address), near State and Madison', N'Sociologist studying informal economy and community formation on the Gray Zone', N'University Spine — Department of Urban Sociology (adjunct researcher); Hough Reclamation Community Documentation Project (co-founder)', N'Anjum Krstić is compact and coiled-looking, the kind of person who is always slightly in motion even when sitting still — knee bouncing, fingers tracking invisible data, head tilted as though listening to something just outside the conversation''s frequency. Their skin is a warm reddish-brown, and they have cat ears, dark brown and velvety, a geneware mod they got at nineteen with a student discount and have since come to regard as both a minor embarrassment and a genuine part of themselves. Their natural hair is grown out in loose coils they keep tied back during fieldwork. They dress practically — durable fabrics, flat shoes, everything with pockets — but with a consistent stripe of color, usually deep orange or red, that former classmates say is the only vanity they have maintained from their undergraduate years.

They grew up on the Gray Zone in Hough Reclamation — Tier 1 transitioning to Tier 2 across their childhood — and are now the first person from their immediate family to hold an academic position, a fact that produces in them equal parts pride and a persistent low-level guilt they have not resolved. Their research is not extractive tourism of the community they came from; they are genuinely embedded, genuinely accountable, and they fight loud public battles about what ethical fieldwork looks like in academic venues where people are not always ready to hear it. They are twenty-eight and have already made enemies.', N'Community connection and moral lens — they know people in the Gray Zone tiers that no other academic character would have access to, and they hold trust that took years to build. They can introduce characters to the Gray Zone communities or provide social and structural context for events happening in lower-tier zones.', N'', N'Cat ears (geneware, dark brown, velvety — cosmetic). Lightweight neural notepad implant (Tier 2, low-cost model) for in-field recording and transcription.', N'They spend three to four days a week in Hough Reclamation doing participant-observation fieldwork and maintain relationships with approximately sixty ongoing interview subjects. On days at the Core, they write, argue with their institutional supervisor about research ethics protocols, and attend committee meetings they find alienating.', N'Anjum Krstić, GLMZ, 162cm tall compact wiry frame, warm golden-brown skin with olive and reddish undertones reflecting Eastern European, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic, and Pacific Islander heritage. Dark brown coiled shoulder-length hair, dark warm eyes, mobile velvety dark brown cat ears (geneware) above human ears. Practical fieldwork clothing: worn steel-toed boots, utility cargo pants with patches, neutral base layer with rust-orange overshirt accent, worn canvas messenger bag. Thin silver dented ring on index finger. Asymmetrical ear piercings. Faint surgical scar at skull base visible when hair pulled back. Perpetually coiled posture, tilted head listening intently. Discrete blue LED flicker at corner of left eye. GLMZ industrial setting, late afternoon fieldwork lighting, focused intense expression, hands gesturing while explaining, tension visible in shoulders. Neo-noir urban aesthetic, gritty urban environment, atmospheric lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hough Reclamation (fieldwork); Meridian Core (institutional address)', N'local', N'Hough Reclamation (fieldwork); Meridian Core (institutional address)', N'Complex multicontinent ancestry blending Eastern European (36.1%), South Asian (23.0%), Sub-Saharan African (22.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (10.5%), and Pacific Islander (8.3%) heritage. This genetic mosaic creates rich, dimensional warm brown skin with golden-olive base tones, subtle reddish undertones, and warmth that shifts across the face—a truly global phenotype reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 162, 58, N'Compact and wiry, muscular in the way of someone who walks constantly and carries tension in their shoulders. No excess weight; lean but not fragile. Center of gravity slightly forward, as though perpetually ready to move.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Loose coils, typically secured back with a cloth tie or simple elastic during fieldwork; occasionally left loose on institutional days', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Dark brown, warm', N'Warm golden-brown with olive and reddish undertones, dimensional and complex—the natural result of Eastern European, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Pacific Islander ancestry creating depth and warmth across the entire complexion', N'Clear, with sun-darkened freckles across the bridge of nose and cheekbones from outdoor fieldwork. Subtle warmth in cheek and temple area. Minimal grooming vanity except for consistent attention to keeping nails short and practical. Fine lines beginning around eyes from squinting while taking notes. Facial structure shows the blend of ancestry—broader cheekbones reflecting South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, defined jaw reflecting Eastern European heritage, with overall warmth and dimensional feature architecture.', N'Dark brown velvety cat ears (geneware) positioned naturally above human ears, fully mobile and expressive — twitch and rotate reflexively in response to sound and emotion. No visible external neural implant hardware, but slight subcutaneous ridge at base of skull if hair pulled back. Occasional faint blue LED flicker visible at the corner of left eye when actively recording through neural notepad (low-power, discrete).', N'Perpetually coiled. Even sitting still, some part of them moves — knee bounce, finger drumming, head tilt. Cat ears swivel independently toward sound sources or conversation partners. When walking, efficient and purposeful, never leisurely. Hands frequently gesture while speaking, especially when explaining research concepts. They have a habit of tilting their head slightly to the left when listening intently.', N'Pragmatic Tier 2-3 blend. Durable synthetic fabrics, flat steel-toed boots (worn but well-maintained), cargo pants or utility jeans with visible patch repairs. Base layers are neutral (gray, black, cream) but always paired with a deliberately chosen stripe of color — deep rust orange, burnt red, or terracotta — in the form of a thrifted overshirt, armband, or bandana. On institutional days, this same color appears as a scarf or deliberately clashing accent. No logos or status markers. Everything has functional pockets. Worn canvas messenger bag for fieldwork. One piece of jewelry: a thin silver ring on index finger, dented and old.', N'One of their primary research subjects — a woman who runs an informal credit system in Hough Reclamation — has confided information about a Ferrogate Transit bribery arrangement that keeps certain residential blocks intentionally transit-deprived to depress land values. Pepetua has this in their field notes. They have not reported it because the source would be identifiable and endangered if they did.', N'Code-switches fluidly between academic register and the Gray Zone vernacular — the vernacular feels more natural, the academic register is worn like a coat they put on for specific rooms. Uses ''right?'' similarly to Tito Sigurðsson-Batmunkh but with different energy — more confrontational.', N'Fast, dense, slightly breathless — they think faster than they talk and it shows.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anjum_krsti');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5cd-74af-887c-621a477753bf', N'Dao Touré-Arakawa', N'Dao', N'', N'Touré-Arakawa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, stitched between a noodle hall and a Ferrogate substation, near Ashland and Division', N'Tailor and seamstress, runs a small alterations shop', N'Independent; informal ties to Hamtramck Enclave community council; The Reclaimed', N'Dao Touré-Arakawa is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin mapped with decades of needle-prick scars across her fingertips, each one a tiny pale star. Her geneware is old and half-faded — a bioluminescent pattern that once traced her collarbones in amber has dimmed to a faint citrus pulse visible only in the dark. She keeps her silver-streaked hair braided flat and pinned with a row of salvaged bone toggles. Her shop, Thread & Condition, smells of machine oil and camphor, and every surface is buried under bolts of reclaimed fabric and half-finished orders tagged with handwritten notes in three scripts.

She is a woman of exacting patience with strangers and volcanic impatience with laziness. She can size a person''s measurements by eye in under ten seconds and will tell you, without being asked, whether your posture is ruining your spine. She prays fervently to the E.L.F. she calls Silathu — the spirit she believes inhabits her antique industrial sewing machine — leaving daily offerings of precisely wound thread bobbins and small cups of machine lubricant.', N'Local institution and information node — she has clothed half the Enclave and hears everything. Quest giver for community disputes, source of local history, potential fabricator of disguises or documents hidden in hems.', N'', N'Faded bioluminescent subdermal tracery (cosmetic, amber-toned, largely inert). Magnification implants in both eyes for close needlework.', N'Opens Thread & Condition at 07:00, takes walk-in alterations until noon, reserves afternoons for bespoke commissions and teaching her apprentice. Closes late whenever a customer has a crisis.', N'Dao Touré-Arakawa, 168cm tall, lean muscular frame with broad shoulders, deep warm bronze skin with golden undertones reflecting East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European and Northern European heritage. Medium-length black hair with silver streaking at temples, arranged in flat-braided cornrows pinned with bone toggles. Deep brown eyes with subtle crystalline magnification implants at iris rim. Face shows high defined cheekbones blending East Asian contours with broader nose structure, weathered by decades of close needlework—laugh lines and squint creases visible. Faint amber bioluminescent tracery along collarbones barely visible in warm workshop light. Pale needle-prick scars covering fingertips in stellar patterns, small coin-sized burn scar on left forearm. Wearing fitted ochre linen shift with asymmetrical seams, long canvas apron with hand-embroidered Latin, Arabic, and Hangul details, worn but recently re-soled boots. Minimal jewelry: copper ring, clay bead bracelet. Glasses hanging from braided cord at neck. Posture slightly forward-hunched, hands animated and never still. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, warm workshop lighting casting soft shadows across face, standing at edge of a work surface surrounded by fabric and tools, expression focused and precise, no concealment of augmentation scars. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'East Asian (42.5%), Sub-Saharan African (32%), Eastern European (14.8%), and Northern European (10.7%) ancestry, creating a striking Ubiquitous Diaspora blend. Her genetic heritage produces warm, complex skin tones with the facial structure reflecting the dominance of East Asian and African lineage—higher cheekbones with subtle epicanthic folds, a broader nose bridge, and the bone structure of her mixed ancestry creating a distinctive, adaptable beauty.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and sturdy, with the developed upper body and forearms of someone who has spent five decades pulling fabric under tension. Not heavy, but solid—muscle beneath skin, slight softness at the midsection earned through age and posture hunched over worktables.', N'Black with silver streaking, predominantly silver at temples and crown', N'Flat-braided cornrows, pinned close to the scalp in a practical crown. Bone toggles salvaged from industrial equipment serve as hair pins.', N'Medium (back to mid-neck when unbraided)', N'Deep brown, natural; augmented with faint crystalline overlay visible at the iris rim (magnification implants)', N'Deep warm bronze with golden undertones—the rich result of her East Asian and Sub-Saharan African majority ancestry, warmed further by Eastern European and Northern European heritage creating subtle warmth and luminosity beneath.', N'Weathered but deliberate in grooming. Minimal makeup—sometimes kohl around eyes. Her face carries laugh lines and the horizontal creases of someone who squints at close work. High, defined cheekbones with subtle East Asian contours blend with broader nasal structure reflecting her African heritage. Skin is clear but textured from decades of needle-prick scarring on her hands.', N'Magnification implants visible as a subtle crystalline sheen at the iris rim when light hits at certain angles. The bioluminescent subdermal tracery is largely dormant but faintly discernible along the collarbones in darkness—a ghost of faded amber.', N'Upright and precise. She stands with the slight forward hunch of a seamstress, shoulders rolled slightly inward—a postural habit she lectures others about. Her hands are never still; they gesture, measure air, adjust fabric on her own clothing. She moves with economic efficiency; no wasted motion. When sitting, she sits at the edge of chairs, ready to rise. She walks with purpose, feet landing flat and deliberate.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, deliberately practical and self-made. She wears her own alterations—fitted linen or cotton shifts in muted earth tones (ochre, charcoal, rust), often with asymmetrical seams or experimental details that serve as proof-of-concept for customer ideas. A long canvas apron with deep pockets and hand-embroidered details (three scripts: Latin, Arabic, Hangul) is a fixture. Worn boots—recently re-soled by her own hand. Jewelry is minimal and utilitarian: a copper ring worn from years of tension (gift from an apprentice), a simple bead bracelet in clay. Her glasses hang from a braided cord around her neck when not in use. She wears her augmentation scarring and faded bioluminescence without concealment or shame—they are proof of skill and longevity.', N'Twenty years ago she altered uniforms for a Tessera internal security unit operating in the Enclave — work she took to keep her shop alive during the Famine Weeks. She has never told anyone. Three people from that era are still her customers.', N'Formal and precise, mixes Twi loan-words with old-world Kazakh endearments picked up from her grandmother''s recordings. Uses tailoring metaphors constantly.', N'Measured and deliberate, pauses before conclusions as though cutting fabric to length before committing the scissors.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dao_tour_arakawa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('1f9ffbd8-f09a-bc08-8e07-6260586d5e12', N'Asil Vestergaard-Bergqvist', N'Asil', N'', N'Vestergaard-Bergqvist', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A sterile clinic-office hybrid on Kessler Row, equipped with neural scanning equipment that costs more than most apartments, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — certified BCI forensic examiner, court-recognized expert', N'Asil Vestergaard-Bergqvist is one of perhaps thirty certified BCI forensic examiners in GLMZ, and one of the best. His work sits at the intersection of neuroscience, data analysis, and detective work — he reads the data that brain-computer interfaces record, voluntarily or involuntarily, and uses it to reconstruct events, prove identity, establish timelines, and occasionally recover memories the subject themselves has forgotten.

Born to a Swedish-Indian father and Ghanaian mother, Ravi was a neuroscience researcher at the Axiom Institute before the ethical constraints of corporate research drove him into private practice. He discovered that academic rigor applied to investigative work produced results that neither pure scientists nor pure investigators could match. His testimony has been accepted in corporate arbitration courts across Tiers 2-4, and his findings have both convicted and exonerated subjects in cases ranging from theft to murder.

The darkness of his work is cumulative. Every deep scan means spending hours inside someone else''s most intimate neural experiences — their fears, their pleasures, their traumas. Ravi has experienced more of other people''s lives than most people experience of their own, and it has made him simultaneously more empathetic and more withdrawn. He knows what people are really thinking because he has literally been inside thousands of heads, and that knowledge has made genuine human connection almost impossible for him.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Asil Vestergaard-Bergqvist, Nordic-featured man in GLMZ GLMZ clinic setting, 178cm lean frame, dark brown hair with silver temples swept back short, cool gray-blue eyes with warm undertones, fair complexion with subtle golden warmth, angular Nordic features, clean-shaven. Wearing muted charcoal compression shirt under black Helios jacket, expensive Swiss analog watch on left wrist with discrete matte-black neural readout band, silver ring on right hand. Seated with precise posture at high-resolution neural imaging console, surrounded by holographic data displays in cool blues and grays. Faint surgical scar visible on left temple in side-lighting. Expression neutral and observant. Clinical, minimalist aesthetic. Cool LED lighting casting sharp shadows. Professional, impartial demeanor. Neo-noir tech-noir atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A sterile clinic-office hybrid on Kessler Row', N'local', N'A sterile clinic-office hybrid on Kessler Row', N'Predominantly Northern European (92.2%) with subtle phenotypic contributions from Indigenous American (6.3%) and sub-Saharan African (1.5%) ancestry. Northern European base provides cool undertones and angular bone structure, while secondary ancestries introduce gentle warmth and slight complexity to skin and eye coloration. The blend results in a distinctly Nordic appearance with barely perceptible depth—warmth visible primarily in natural light or at close proximity.', 178, 72, N'Lean and composed, with the posture of someone who spends most of their time seated at high-resolution neural imaging consoles. Shoulders slightly rounded from years hunched over data. Wiry rather than muscular, with the controlled efficiency of movement that comes from minimal wasted gesture.', N'Dark brown with silver threading at the temples', N'Swept back neatly, kept short at the sides. Precision-groomed, no affectation', N'Short', N'Cool gray-blue with subtle warm-brown undertones from ancestry blend', N'Fair to light Nordic base with barely-detectable golden warmth beneath the surface, most evident in natural daylight. Indoor pallor dominates his clinic-bound complexion, but the skin maintains slight luminosity rather than true pallor—a quality imparted by the ancestral warmth beneath fair Northern European epidermis.', N'Clean-shaven with refined, slightly angular features reflecting Northern European bone structure softened minutely by secondary ancestry—cheekbones carry subtle definition rather than sharp prominence. Faint lines around the eyes from years of close work and concentration. Skin maintains even, fair tone with the faintest golden undertone visible in certain light. Expression tends toward neutral observation rather than warmth.', N'None visible. All implants are subcutaneous or internal. He wears a discrete neural readout device on his left wrist — a thin, matte-black band that syncs with his clinic equipment, but it appears to be ordinary chronometry to casual observation.', N'Precise, measured movements. He walks with purpose but without aggression. Sits very still during interviews — rarely fidgets, rarely blinks noticeably. Tends to hold eye contact slightly longer than social convention, an occupational habit from reading micro-expressions. Speaks in measured tones with minimal hand gestures.', N'Tier 2-3 functional minimalism. Favors high-end athleistic wear in muted grays, blacks, and deep blues — brands like Helios and Kasper that advertise durability and precision over ostentation. Wears well-fitted compression shirts under open jackets, functional clothing that suggests athletic maintenance without athletic pretension. His watch is an expensive Swiss-analog piece, a deliberate rejection of smart devices. Minimal jewelry — a simple silver band on his right ring finger, no other adornment. Everything about his appearance is calibrated to project competence and impartiality rather than personality.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'asil_vestergaard_bergqvist');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a651-7a62-ae8f-6288909d4227', N'Bohai Migizi', N'Bohai', N'', N'Migizi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 68, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Block 14 — a three-room unit he shares with his grandchildren, near Western and Division', N'Former union leader (Ferrogate Transit Workers Union), now raising two grandchildren on a reduced pension', N'Ferrogate Transit Workers Union (retired regional director, still listed as emeritus); the Gray Zone Block 14 informal community network', N'Bohai Migizi is a man who was built for louder rooms than the one he currently occupies. He is tall and loose-limbed, with the kind of face that was clearly handsome and has aged into something more interesting — deep sienna complexion, heavy brow, a jaw that still juts when he is angry. He has cosmetic tiger-stripe bioluminescence on his arms and collarbone, a geneware mod he got in his forties to celebrate the Union''s successful Ferrogate walkout of 2172, and which now glows a gentle amber when the building''s lights go down. His natural hair has gone grey-silver and he wears it in short locs. A subvocal transceiver is implanted at his throat — old union infrastructure, technically still active.

For sixteen years Tobi was the loudest, most tenacious shop steward and eventually regional director the Ferrogate Transit Workers Union ever produced. He won three collective agreements, survived two corporate union-busting campaigns, and was personally blacklisted by two Ferrogate senior executives. Then his daughter Comfort died of an untreated pulmonary infection in 2194 — a death he attributes directly to Helix Biosystems'' pharmaceutical pricing, which the union had been fighting for years — and left behind two children aged four and seven. Tobi took them without a moment''s hesitation and quietly stopped being the man who changed things, because he was suddenly the man who made breakfast.', N'Quest giver for labor and corporate accountability storylines; access point to Ferrogate Transit insider knowledge and union network; emotionally complex figure whose activism is dormant but not dead; the grandchildren can be a vulnerability or a source of motivation', N'', N'Tiger-stripe bioluminescent geneware (arms and collarbone, amber-gold) — cosmetic, personal significance; subvocal transceiver (throat implant, FTW Union network standard issue — technically still connected)', N'Gets the grandchildren — Dami, 10, and Kofi-Ren, 13 — up and fed and to their learning pods by 0730, then spends the morning doing odd-job consulting for younger union members who call him for advice. Afternoons he does building maintenance for reduced rent. Evenings are homework, dinner, and whatever drama the Block 14 neighbors bring to his door.', N'Bohai Migizi, tall lean 188cm Black-Indigenous mixed heritage man in his 70s, deep mahogany-bronze skin with golden undertones, weathered angular face with prominent cheekbones and heavy brow, short grey-silver locs with amber undertones, deep brown eyes. Visible bioluminescent amber-gold tiger-stripe geneware glowing softly on both forearms and across upper chest, subvocal transceiver ridge visible on throat. Worn FTW union work shirt in faded grey, dark cargo pants, vintage deep blue wool cardigan, aged composite boots. Scars visible on left temple and left eyebrow, burn scar on right wrist. Posture bent slightly forward, listening intently. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, fluorescent-lit union hall with vintage infrastructure, moody amber and cool blue lighting casting geneware glow into sharp relief, worn metal walls and old transit station aesthetics in background, intimate character study --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Sub-Saharan African (41.0%) and Indigenous American (37.9%) form the dominant genetic foundation, creating deep warm bronze-mahogany tones with golden undertones. Hispanic/Latin American (8.6%), Northern European (5.5%), Central Asian (3.6%), and Southeast Asian (3.4%) ancestry layer subtle complexity—warmth deepened by the diverse continental blend, producing luminous skin with rich depth and visual complexity across warm spectrums.', 188, 82, N'Tall and lean, still carrying the frame of a younger man despite age — long-limbed and loose-jointed, with the kind of structural efficiency that comes from decades of physical labor and deliberate movement. Slight forward curve to the shoulders from years hunched over union paperwork.', N'Grey-silver with amber undertones', N'Short locs, neat and well-maintained, threaded with a few dark fibers at the base', N'Short', N'Deep brown', N'Deep mahogany-bronze with golden undertones—the rich luminosity of Sub-Saharan African and Indigenous American heritage blended with warmth from Hispanic/Latin American, Central Asian, and Southeast Asian ancestry. Weathered by decades but still visibly glowing.', N'Weathered and lined—a face that has spent decades in fluorescent light and loud rooms. Strong, angular bone structure reflecting the Sub-Saharan African and Indigenous American heritage with prominent, high cheekbones and a pronounced, forward-thrusting jaw. Heavy brow ridge, substantial nose bridge with slight aquiline curve. Minimal grooming vanity; clean but not polished. Faint scarring on the left temple from a 2168 Ferrogate station incident.', N'Subvocal transceiver implant visible as a faint metallic subcutaneous ridge along the left side of the throat, approximately 2cm below the jawline. Device itself dormant but hardware still present. Bioluminescent geneware on arms and chest is the primary visible augmentation — always subtly active, brighter in darkness.', N'Moves with economical precision despite his height — someone who learned to navigate crowded transit stations and union halls without wasting energy. Stands with weight slightly forward, shoulders relaxed but capable of sudden tension. When listening to younger people, his entire frame bends forward attentively. When angry or making a point, his jaw juts and his hands become very still — a union organizer''s learned control.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian — well-worn but maintained. Favors loose grey or charcoal work shirts with FTW union emblems faded but still visible. Cargo pants in dark synthetic with reinforced pockets. Worn composite work boots that he repairs himself. A thin wool cardigan in deep blue, decades old, worn over everything. No jewelry except a simple platinum band on his left ring finger (his late husband''s, worn since 2189). Clothing carries the faint smell of building maintenance — solvents, electrical compound, the particular dust of old transit infrastructure.', N'He knows who the Ferrogate executive was who personally ordered the data purge that destroyed evidence of the pharmaceutical partnership he was building a case against. The executive is retired, living comfortably in Grosse Pointe Enclosure. Tobi has the executive''s home address and has had it for three years. He has done nothing.', N'Union oratory mixed with Block 14 street vernacular; code-switches fluidly based on audience; drops into formal rhetoric when emotional', N'Naturally rhetorical — builds to emphasis, uses repetition for effect; softens completely around the grandchildren', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bohai_migizi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a639-7b12-ba40-6296649acd19', N'Amaka Sigurdsson', N'Amaka', N'', N'Sigurdsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Ferment Quarter — works at a bar called Undertow, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Bartender at a mid-grade bar in the Ferment Quarter', N'Undertow bar (independent, owner Goran Abdi-Lopes); Ferment Quarter informal community; The Undertow', N'Amaka Sigurdsson is slight and sharp-featured, with warm golden-brown skin and hair that shifts color via geneware — it cycles through a slow gradient of deep teal to burgundy to bone white over the course of an evening, and they have learned to read their own hair as a mood indicator better than most people read their own faces. Their irises are patterned in concentric rings of silver and violet. They have a small retractable claw implant in the right hand — not for violence but because they work in a bar and opening things quickly matters.

Undertow is loud and low-ceilinged and smells of fermented kelp spirits and someone''s illicit smoke, and Amaka Sigurdsson moves through it with the calm authority of someone who has memorized every regular''s drink and every stranger''s threat level within ninety seconds of arrival. They are funny in a bone-dry way that most people don''t catch until three seconds after the joke has passed, and they collect secrets the way other people collect debt — not intentionally, but inevitably. They pray quietly to a small E.L.F. they call Lathis that they believe inhabits the bar''s ancient refrigeration unit, leaving it data packets of good music.', N'Social hub and rumor exchange — Undertow is where information travels and Izel catches most of it. Can be a recurring contact for players who establish rapport, a source of introductions to other characters, and a barometer for street-level mood in the Ferment Quarter.', N'', N'Color-cycling geneware hair (teal-burgundy-white gradient). Patterned irises (silver/violet concentric, cosmetic). Retractable claw implant in right hand (single, utility-grade).', N'Works evening and late shifts at Undertow, five nights a week. Spends mornings asleep and afternoons doing bar prep and running small errands for regulars who pay in tips or favors.', N'Amaka Sigurdsson, 168cm lean bartender with striking multiethnic features blending Northern European and Asian heritage—defined cheekbones, angular jawline softened by broader face shape, warm ivory-tan skin with golden undertones. Shoulder-length hair in chromatic geneware shifting between teal and burgundy. Augmented violet-and-silver concentric ring eyes with penetrating gaze. Dressed in fitted black synthetic turtleneck, dark utility cargo pants, charcoal overshirt worn open. Chrome-finished retractable claw implant visible along right hand knuckles. Silver minimalist refrigeration coil tattoo on left inner elbow. Standing behind a dimly-lit neo-noir bar in 2226, leaning against counter with economical posture, eyes tracking the room. Moody neon-tinged lighting, cool blues and warm amber from behind the bar. Calm, professional authority. GLMZ 2200s atmosphere, Ferment Quarter setting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Ferment Quarter', N'local', N'The Ferment Quarter', N'Northern European dominant (57.7%) with substantial East Asian (22.3%) and South Asian (20.0%) ancestry, creating a striking cross-continental blend. Northern European bone structure combines with warmth and subtle complexity from East Asian and South Asian heritage lines—evident in both facial geometry and skin undertones.', 168, 58, N'Lean and angular, with narrow shoulders and long limbs that move with economical precision. No excess weight; muscle definition shows through the wrists and forearms from years of bar work.', N'Chromatic geneware — cycles through deep teal, burgundy, and bone white in a gradient over several hours', N'Shoulder-length, loosely layered, often pulled back with a clip or cord during shifts', N'Medium', N'Augmented: concentric rings of silver (outer) and violet (inner), natural pupil at center', N'Warm ivory to light tan with golden and subtle warm peachy undertones, reflecting the Northern European base enriched by East and South Asian heritage warmth. Even tone with luminous quality beneath the surface.', N'Striking facial structure blending Northern European definition with East Asian subtlety. Defined, sculptural cheekbones and angular jawline characteristic of Northern European ancestry, refined by the softer contours and slightly broader face shape from East and South Asian heritage. Orbital eye shape shows clear East Asian influence; facial proportions reflect the entire genetic mix rather than any single ancestry. Skin is clear and well-maintained, though marked by the pallor of someone who sleeps through daylight. Minimal grooming — functional rather than elaborate. A faint scar traces the inside of the right wrist from an early implant installation.', N'Right hand shows a small metallic ridge along the knuckle line of the middle finger where the retractable claw implant is housed (chrome-finished, approximately 2 cm visible when retracted). Eyes are immediately striking — the concentric ring pattern is cosmetic but unmistakable, marking them as augmented. The color-cycling hair is geneware, visible as a slow chromatic shift throughout an evening.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion. Stands with weight slightly forward, ready to move. Leans against the bar when not actively working, shoulders relaxed but eyes constantly tracking the room. Hand gestures are minimal but precise. Walks with a measured pace, never hurried, conveying calm authority.', N'Mid-grade Ferment Quarter practical: fitted black synthetic shirt or turtleneck (sweat-resistant), dark cargo pants or tailored utility trousers with deep pockets. Shoes are black non-slip service footwear. A lightweight overshirt in charcoal or deep blue worn open during shifts. Jewelry is minimal — a simple silver ring on the left hand, possibly a family piece. No corporate branding or status signifiers; clothing prioritizes function and neutrality. Budget appears to be around 800-1200 Φ total outfit value.', N'', N'Economical and dry, with occasional Nahuatl words dropped in like punctuation. Says a great deal with very few words.', N'Unhurried. Comfortable with silence. Delivers observations without setup, then moves on before the listener has finished reacting.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amaka_sigurdsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a656-7683-876b-62a9f10e7ef3', N'Biodun Villanueva-Owusu-Bangura', N'Biodun', N'', N'Villanueva-Owusu-Bangura', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 60, 1, N'active', N'The Underworld - B3, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Bore Rat elder', N'Bore Rats', N'Biodun Villanueva-Owusu-Bangura has navigated the tunnels beneath GLMZ for forty years. His augmented sonar implant maps passages in real-time. He lost his left leg to a cave-in and uses a hand-carved crutch from a pre-collapse beam.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Biodun Villanueva-Owusu-Bangura, 178cm tall lean weathered figure with deep warm brown skin blending Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic, and East Asian heritage. Steel gray hair swept back, dark brown eyes with subtle amber undertone. Pronounced cheekbones, broad nose, deeply lined weathered face bearing scars on right temple and cheekbone. Forty-year underground pallor creates muted earthy complexion. Left leg amputated below knee, reliant on hand-carved wooden crutch fashioned from salvaged I-beam. Asymmetrical muscular build, right shoulder compensatory twisted. Wearing faded tan thermal undershirt with duct-taped sleeve holes, worn canvas cargo pants with dark reinforced patches, left leg pinned shut, dirt-gray canvas duster jacket stuffed with tunnel tools, scuffed rope-soled boots. Tattooed inner left wrist with Bore Rat symbol. Carries weathered leather satchel. Gritty GLMZ tunnel explorer aesthetic, standing in dim underground tunnel lighting with dust particles visible, posture leaning heavily on crutch, exhausted determined expression, neon glow distant behind. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Underworld', N'local', N'The Underworld', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (56.6%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (37.3%) and East Asian (6.1%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates deep warm-toned brown skin with rich undertones—African depth as the primary base, Latin American warmth layered throughout, and subtle East Asian refinement in facial structure.', 178, 68, N'Lean, weathered frame with pronounced musculature in shoulders and right leg from decades of crutch-assisted locomotion. Left side noticeably atrophied below the hip.', N'Steel gray with remnants of black at the roots', N'Short, thinning, swept back from forehead', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint amber undertone (sonar implant neural feedback)', N'Deep warm brown with rich undertones from Sub-Saharan African ancestry as primary base, enhanced by Latin American warmth. Ashy pallor from forty years underground devoid of sun exposure, creating a muted, earthy appearance overall.', N'Weathered and deeply lined, reflecting the dominant African heritage with secondary Latin American feature blending—pronounced cheekbones with angular definition, broad nose structure with subtle East Asian refinement. Deep creases around eyes and mouth. Scarring across the right temple and jawline from tunnel debris. Calloused hands, especially right palm and fingers. Perpetual dust coating on exposed skin.', N'None visible. The sonar implant is subcutaneous (mounted at the base of the skull, behind the left ear), detectable only by touch as a slightly raised ridge under skin.', N'Asymmetrical gait reliant on a hand-carved wooden crutch (fashioned from a pre-collapse I-beam salvage). Leans heavily to the right, shoulders twisted slightly compensatory. Moves with deliberate, economical motion—no wasted energy. When stationary, shifts weight onto right leg and crutch; left hip remains rigid. Grips crutch with white-knuckle tension when navigating uneven terrain.', N'Tier 5 utilitarian—worn canvas cargo pants with multiple patch repairs, reinforced knees and thighs in darker fabric. Left pant leg pinned/sewn shut below the knee. Thermal undershirt (faded tan, holes in sleeves patched with duct tape). Heavy canvas duster jacket, dirt-gray, with deep pockets stuffed with tunnel navigation tools (chalk, rope, hand-drawn maps). Rope-soled boots, heavily scuffed; right boot reinforced. No corpo branding, no chrome jewelry. Carries a weathered leather satchel with sonar mapping equipment and tunnel documentation.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'biodun_villanueva_owusu_bangura');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60b-7501-b80d-62c65ff2caf2', N'Bhagyashree Khoury', N'Bhagyashree', N'', N'Khoury', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 16, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone, rotating between three squat locations, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Teenage hyperlane migrant and small-time goods runner', N'No formal affiliation; loosely connected to the informal Waukegan freight community', N'Bhagyashree Khoury is all angles and energy — sharp elbows, quick eyes, a mouth that moves faster than her thoughts can catch up with. She is dark-skinned and underweight in a way that suggests irregular eating rather than any particular biology, and she has a crop of cat ears she got from a budget geneware parlor in exchange for three weeks of courier work — they''re a bright, impractical copper that she is extremely proud of and that she knows compromise her ability to be inconspicuous, a trade-off she has decided is worth it. Her natural hair is shaved close underneath the ears, emphasizing them. She dresses in whatever she can find, layered for weather and fast movement.

She arrived in GLMZ four months ago on a hyperlane freight ride, having left a situation she won''t describe in detail. She is trying very hard to project competence and confidence and is somewhat successful at this, which has gotten her a network of informal contacts and a reputation as reliable among the Waukegan freight community — she delivers things on time and doesn''t look in the packages. She is, under the performance, seventeen kinds of scared and also stubborn as weather, and the combination produces a kind of reckless effectiveness that has so far kept her alive and fed. She talks constantly and processes emotion by generating plans.', N'Street-level information source and mobility; can carry things, find people, know who to talk to in the freight underworld; her youth and precarity make her a character whose safety becomes a concern; potential for mentorship dynamics', N'', N'Copper geneware cat ears (cosmetic, budget quality — occasionally flatten when she''s genuinely frightened, which she hates); no other augmentations', N'Ezili wakes up at whatever hour the freight platforms become active, picks up same-day delivery jobs from informal brokers, runs them fast, eats whatever she can afford or trade for, scouts new squat locations as backup, and spends her evenings studying the freight patterns and route maps she''s collected — she is building a mental model of how goods move through the city.', N'Bhagyashree Khoury, 162cm wiry street courier in GLMZ, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, refined high cheekbones blending East Asian, Middle Eastern, South Asian, Hispanic, and African heritage, sharp jawline, dark alert eyes, closely shaved black hair with longer tufts framing bright copper geneware cat ears, thin temple scar, sun-weathered matte complexion with dark under-eye shadows, small healed cuts and old burn mark on forearm. Worn industrial cargo pants, faded black reinforced jacket, thermal undershirt, scuffed boots, battered satchel. Coiled-spring posture leaning forward on balls of feet, economical gestures, constantly scanning environment. Neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone street, urban decay and electric light, motion-ready stance, authentic street-level neo-noir courier aesthetic, high contrast cinematic lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone', N'local', N'Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone', N'Diverse global ancestry combining East Asian (27.3%), Middle Eastern (21.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (16.7%), South Asian (15.3%), Sub-Saharan African (12.1%), and Southeast Asian (7.5%) genetics. This creates a striking cosmopolitan blend: warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, refined facial structure showing East and South Asian influence in cheekbone prominence and eye shape, with warmth and depth from Middle Eastern, Hispanic, and African heritage. Features a sophisticated interplay of diverse ancestry markers — no single heritage dominates; instead creates a uniquely balanced complexion and facial geometry reflecting true global diaspora mixing.', 162, 48, N'Wiry and angular — all sharp elbows and protruding collarbones, the thinness of someone eating irregularly and moving constantly. Lean muscle in her shoulders and legs from running freight routes; no excess anywhere.', N'Natural black', N'Shaved close to scalp on sides and back, left slightly longer on top to frame the geneware ears; deliberately styled to emphasize rather than hide her augmentations', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and quick-moving', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones, sun-weathered from outdoor freight work. Deeper and richer than light tones, reflecting the strong East Asian, Middle Eastern, and African components of her ancestry.', N'Young face with refined high cheekbones showing East and South Asian influence, sharp jawline, and a mouth that rarely stays still. Skin shows minor scarring and weather damage inconsistent with her age — small cuts, healing scrapes on knuckles, a faint burn mark on her left forearm. No acne; malnutrition has left her skin taut and clear with a slightly sun-damaged matte finish. Dark shadows under eyes from irregular sleep. Facial structure reflects the sophisticated blending of her diverse ancestry, with prominent cheekbones and defined features characteristic of East Asian heritage, warmed and deepened by her Middle Eastern, Hispanic, South Asian, and African genetics.', N'Copper geneware cat ears — the primary and only visible modification. Budget-quality work; noticeably less refined than corporate-tier augmentation. Ears flatten slightly when she is frightened, betraying her emotional state despite her best efforts at projection.', N'Constantly in motion — stands with weight shifted forward on the balls of her feet, ready to move. Gestures are economical but frequent, hands rarely still. Eyes dart constantly, mapping exits and threats. When running freight, she moves with practiced efficiency; when stationary, there is a coiled-spring quality to her body language. Speaks rapidly, often interrupting herself, processing emotion and uncertainty through constant verbal planning.', N'Scavenged and layered for weather and speed — mismatched cargo pants with multiple pockets (Tier 4-5 industrial wear, stained and repaired), reinforced synthetic jacket in faded black, thermal undershirt visible at collar, worn boots with good tread. No luxury markers. Everything is functional, worn, and chosen for freedom of movement. Carries a battered satchel across her body with route maps, spare food rations, and tools. Dresses like someone who might have to run at any moment and has learned not to become attached to her possessions.', N'She is not alone — she left her home situation with her nine-year-old brother, who is currently hidden in the most stable of her squat locations and whom she has told absolutely nobody about. Every decision she makes is filtered through keeping him fed and concealed, and every risk she takes is a gamble with stakes she can''t admit to.', N'Hyperlane youth pidgin — rapid, abbreviating, inventive; creates nicknames for everything and everyone on first encounter', N'Fast and tumbling, with sudden swerves in topic; lands on points sideways', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bhagyashree_khoury');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b8-77e5-a937-640624631bd3', N'Basanti Bustamante', N'Basanti', N'', N'Bustamante', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Crucible Square — open-air market, Tier 1-2 commerce, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Counter-surveillance and mole detection — counterintelligence specialist', N'Freelance — works the Gray Zone circuit exclusively', N'Basanti Bustamante is tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 22, her face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left her with skills and night terrors in equal measure. She works as a counterintelligence specialist out of Crucible Square, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In the runner community, Basanti Bustamante is known for getting the job done and not asking questions that would make the job harder to stomach.', N'Aslan Kimura-Nkrumah functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would incapacitate. Bone lacing — titanium mesh throughout skeleton, increases durability and striking power', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Basanti Bustamante, 183cm lean operative with warm olive-bronze skin and golden undertones, angular Middle Eastern-influenced jaw, dark brown predatory eyes. Black hair braided low, blue undertones in harsh light. Gaunt cheeks, tired from nocturnal work, faint 3cm scar along left temple. Visible matte titanium pain editor on left neck with dark LED. Circuit board tattoo on inner left wrist, burn scar on right palm. Wearing charcoal synthetic leather field jacket over dark gray compression shirt, black tactical trousers with reinforced knees, worn boots. Standing in economical ready stance, shoulders forward, scanning for threats. Shoulder holster visible, belt with encrypted comm and lockpicks. Single silver ring. GLMZ aesthetic, neon-lit shadows, moody underground setting, cool blues and amber accent lighting, cinematic depth, neo-noir noir atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Crucible Square', N'local', N'Crucible Square', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (66.2%) with significant Northern European (22.4%) and Middle Eastern (11.4%) ancestry. The blend creates warm olive-bronze skin with golden undertones, angular facial structure from the Middle Eastern component, and a synthesis that reads as genuinely mixed without single-region dominance. Features Mediterranean warmth layered over Northern European bone structure.', 183, 61, N'Rawboned and lean — minimal body fat, defined musculature from functional training rather than aesthetics. Shoulders broad and squared from years of combat conditioning. Frame suggests efficiency over comfort.', N'Black with natural blue undertones in direct light', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid that sits low on her neck. No ornamentation. Occasionally worn loose but quickly retied when work begins.', N'Medium — falls to mid-shoulder when unbound', N'Dark brown, sharp and analytically focused. Eyes track movement with predatory precision.', N'Warm olive-bronze with golden-amber undertones across cheekbones and nose bridge. Even distribution across face and body with subtle peachy warmth at temples and jawline — the result of Hispanic/Latin American warmth modified by Northern European and Middle Eastern ancestry.', N'Gaunt cheeks, prominent angular jaw reflecting Middle Eastern ancestry. Minimal scarring on face suggests deliberate avoidance or fast reflexes. Skin texture shows dehydration from nocturnal lifestyle—not unhealthy, but tired. No makeup. Eyes carry the hollow awareness of chronic sleep disruption.', N'Chrome pain editor housing visible on left side of neck, just below the jaw — matte titanium surface with subtle LED indicator (dark when inactive, amber when running). The titanium bone lacing is not visibly apparent beneath intact skin, but close observation reveals subtle angular distortions in her wrists and knuckles where the mesh creates slight bulges under dermis.', N'Economical and predatory. Stands with shoulders slightly forward and weight distributed for immediate movement in any direction. Walks with minimal wasted motion — knees slightly bent, ready to shift stance. Eyes constantly scan environments for exits, threats, and information. Hands rest naturally at sides or on equipment, never crossed or defensive. Movements are fluid but never relaxed.', N'Function-first, Tier 3-4 utilitarian aesthetic. Black matte tactical trousers with reinforced panels at knees and thighs — worn from frequent use. Dark gray compression shirt under a modified field jacket in charcoal synthetic leather, oversized enough to conceal equipment and augmentation but tailored to not impede movement. Worn boots with reinforced soles and ankle support — scuffed from active work. Minimal jewelry: single silver ring on right middle finger, likely a memento. No corporate branding. Gear organized on belt with pragmatic purpose — encrypted comm unit, lockpick set, small medkit, spare ammunition magazine for sidearm kept in shoulder holster.', N'Aslan Kimura-Nkrumah once worked for corporate intelligence and still has a handler who calls in favors. Each favor erodes what''s left of their independence.', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'basanti_bustamante');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6fb-714a-bba8-644d2538dc76', N'Ebuka Mukherjee-Raghavan-Quartey', N'Ebuka', N'', N'Mukherjee-Raghavan-Quartey', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 33, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Crucible Square — open-air market, Tier 1-2 commerce, near Kedzie and Division', N'Aerial extraction and rapid transit pilot — getaway pilot', N'Semi-independent — has standing arrangements with several crews', N'Ebuka Mukherjee-Raghavan-Quartey are athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 33, they have soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate them once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm — and they make no effort to hide it.

They came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see them surpass them. They work as a getaway pilot out of Crucible Square, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

What Ebuka Mukherjee-Raghavan-Quartey lacks in subtlety, they compensate for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'As a getaway pilot, Tiare Sjostrom-Kwarteng embodies the tension between independence and isolation. They are a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm. Synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Ebuka Mukherjee-Raghavan-Quartey, a 174cm lean athletic operative with rich warm brown skin with golden-amber undertones reflecting South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and East Asian heritage. Strong high cheekbones and defined jawline, warm dark brown alert eyes. Dark brown hair with copper undertones, practical undercut style. Wearing expensive black fitted tactical flight jacket over neutral undershirt, reinforced cargo pants, composite boots. Subdermal weapon mounts visible on forearms as subtle metallic lines. Posture coiled and ready, hands showing precise control. Faint scar on left temple barely visible. Silver geometric tattoo on inner right wrist. Cold neon-lit urban environment, dramatic side-lighting emphasizing the three-dimensional quality of facial structure and skin tone depth, neo-noir urban aesthetic, professional operative, high-tier gear, moody atmospheric lighting, sharp focused expression --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Crucible Square', N'local', N'Crucible Square', N'South Asian ancestry (70.8%) forms the genetic foundation with warm brown skin reflecting the diversity of the Indian subcontinent. Significantly blended with Sub-Saharan African heritage (21.6%) that deepens the complexion with rich warm undertones and contributes fuller facial structure and lip definition. East Asian ancestry (7.6%) adds subtle refinement to cheekbone prominence and eye shape. The genetic synthesis creates luminous warm brown skin with golden-amber undertones — a sophisticated depth where South Asian warmth meets African richness and East Asian contours.', 174, 68, N'Athletic and lean with functional muscle density — dancer''s grace married to fighter''s economy of motion. Low body fat, defined shoulders and forearms where the subdermal weapon mounts create subtle ridge-lines beneath the skin.', N'Dark brown with natural copper undertones', N'Practical undercut — longer on top (swept back), buzzed at sides and nape for helmet clearance', N'Medium', N'Warm dark brown, sharp and alert', N'Rich warm brown complexion with golden-amber undertones, the result of dominant South Asian base enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth and East Asian luminosity', N'Smooth with prominent high cheekbones shaped by South Asian and East Asian bone structure, strong defined jawline with additional fullness and depth from Sub-Saharan African heritage — facial geometry that clearly reads the three-way genetic synthesis. Minimal scarring on face — they don''t survive mistakes long enough to accumulate visible wounds there. Faint calluses on hands and wrists.', N'Subdermal weapon mounts visible as subtle raised lines and slight discoloration along both forearms — the mounts create faint metallic sheens under direct light. No visible eye augmentation, but skin around eyes suggests enhanced perception implant underneath. Hands show evidence of repeated medical intervention — too-perfect healing, slight irregularity in vein mapping.', N'Economical, coiled. Never fully relaxed in public spaces — weight balanced on balls of feet, ready to move in any direction. Fluid wrist and hand movements, precise finger control. Eyes constantly tracking exits and sight lines. Movements suggest someone who has internalized violence as a tool, not an aberration.', N'High-tier functional — expensive tactical wear that doesn''t announce itself. Black fitted flight jacket (Tier 1-2 grade, custom tailored) over neutral undershirt. Cargo pants with reinforced thigh pockets for tools and throwaway credchips. Composite boots rated for impact and heat. No jewelry except functional watch with chronometer and encrypted local mesh link. Gear is meticulously maintained, no fraying, no wear patterns — replaced before failure. Styling suggests someone who spends Φ on equipment, not status symbols.', N'Tiare Sjostrom-Kwarteng witnessed a massacre during a corporate dispute and has evidence stored in a dead drop. Publishing it would expose powerful people. Keeping it is leverage and liability.', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ebuka_mukherjee_raghavan_quartey');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60e-7421-8e9c-64ee792ea2ef', N'Erasmo Montalvo-Novotný-Diallo', N'Erasmo', N'', N'Montalvo-Novotný-Diallo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 9, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Stockyard (specifically the repair stall row near Grainfort), near Ashland and Division', N'Orphan and apprentice to a garment repairer in the Stockyard', N'Grantha Soto-Edelweiss (apprentice-master), Brightmoor Reclamation group shelter (former ward)', N'Erasmo Montalvo-Novotný-Diallo is small even for nine, with a round face, dark skin dusted lighter along the cheekbones from a nutritional deficiency that went untreated too long, and enormous amber eyes that their apprentice-master suspects are natural but can never quite confirm. They keep their hair in two puffs held with mismatched elastics. Their fingers are already remarkable — long, precise, slightly calloused at the tips from needle and thread work — and they move them constantly, picking at hems, testing fabric tension, tying knots and undoing them while they talk.

Fanta came to Grantha Soto-Edelweiss''s repair stall after spending eight months in a Brightmoor Reclamation group shelter following a building collapse that killed their parents. The shelter social worker placed them as a household-and-shop apprentice, which in practice means Fanta sweeps, fetches, and mends in exchange for a sleeping mat behind the stall divider, two meals, and fifteen minutes of formal reading instruction each day from Grantha''s tablet. They are not unhappy. They are careful about happiness — they learned early it tends to leave. But they love the work with a devotion that is almost physical, and they have a gift that their apprentice-master has started to notice is more than ordinary.', N'Local color and emotional anchor; represents the most vulnerable tier of the city''s civilian population; potential long-term storyline about what happens to gifted children in tier-one conditions; can connect players to the Stockyard repair community.', N'', N'None', N'Wakes at dawn to sweep the stall before customers arrive; spends the day fetching materials, doing basic repair work, and watching Grantha handle complex jobs; fifteen minutes of reading instruction in the evening before sleeping behind the divider.', N'Nine-year-old child with warm golden-brown skin, high cheekbones and moderately broad nose reflecting mixed Hispanic/Latin American, Eastern European, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Large striking amber-gold eyes, black hair with brown undertones styled in two symmetrical puffs with mismatched blue and red elastics. Slight, lean build with visible definition from needle work. Faint scar on inner left forearm, callused fingertips. Wearing layered reclaimed clothing: faded indigo tunic patched at elbows, grey canvas trousers, worn utility boots with visible stitching. Cloth satchel with needles and thread across chest. Alert posture, hands fidgeting with fabric. GLMZ reclamation sector, industrial background with dim neon accent lighting, gritty atmospheric depth, photorealistic with documentary precision --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Stockyard (specifically the repair stall row near Grainfort)', N'local', N'The Stockyard (specifically the repair stall row near Grainfort)', N'Mixed Hispanic/Latin American (50.8%), Eastern European (25.2%), and Sub-Saharan African (24.0%) ancestry creating a striking tripartite blend; Latin American warmth combined with Eastern European bone structure and African facial features; warm golden-brown skin reflecting the balanced contribution of all three ancestry groups', 120, 22, N'Slight and small-framed even for age nine, with the lean musculature of a working child—shoulders already developing subtle definition from daily labor with needle and cloth. No fat reserve; ribs subtly visible under warm brown skin.', N'Black with natural brown undertones', N'Two puffs secured with mismatched elastics (one frayed blue, one faded red), arranged symmetrically above the ears', N'Short to medium, approximately 8-10cm when unbound', N'Amber-gold, unusually large and luminous—ethnically ambiguous, possibly natural but striking enough to warrant suspicion of early subcutaneous modification', N'Warm medium-brown with rich golden undertones from balanced tripartite ancestry; lighter ashier patches visible along cheekbones and bridge of nose from childhood malnutrition', N'Round, youthful face with high cheekbones and moderately broad nose reflecting the African and Latin American components of ancestry, refined by Eastern European bone structure influence; warm golden-brown undertones; skin texture smooth but bearing faint marks of past neglect (minor scarring from untreated scrapes); expression often cautious but animated when focused on work', N'None visible. No chrome, optics, or subdermal plating. Entirely unaugmented.', N'Moves with economical precision despite youth—hands rarely still, constantly fidgeting with cloth, testing fabric tension, tying and untying knots even while standing or listening. Posture is habitually alert and slightly defensive, shoulders slightly raised; walks quickly and quietly, as if accustomed to taking up minimal space. Eyes track movement and detail obsessively.', N'Tier 5 (reclamation sector); wears hand-mended, layered garments in muted colors—a faded indigo work tunic patched at the elbows with mismatched fabric scraps, grey canvas trousers hemmed unevenly (self-repaired), and soft-soled utility boots held together with visible stitching. All clothing shows evidence of repair and re-repair. No logos or branding. A small cloth satchel containing needles, thread spools, and measuring tools is worn constantly across the chest.', N'They found a small silver locket in the ruins after the building collapse and have kept it, not knowing whose it is. It has an image inside that they don''t recognize. They have never shown it to anyone. They pray to the E.L.F. of Lost Things (a small improvised shrine in the shelter, which they still visit) to eventually tell them who it belongs to.', N'Simple and concrete; names materials and textures specifically; uses the present tense even for past events', N'Quiet, even, unhurried — slightly dreamy; pauses occur at unexpected places in sentences', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'erasmo_montalvo_novotn_diallo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a686-7b3e-8145-65057f430533', N'Joaquín Guerrero-Thakur', N'Joaquín', N'', N'Guerrero-Thakur', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone lower levels — operates from a rented stall in the Undertow''s informal tech market, Solder Lane, near Kedzie and Division', N'Compute broker — resells black-market processing cycles, dark-net access, and stolen corporate server time', N'Independent; trades through a loose collective called the Solder Lane Compact; has ongoing relationships with several freelance network intrusion specialists who supply their inventory', N'Joaquín Guerrero-Thakur is the kind of person who becomes the room''s center of gravity without quite meaning to. They''re of middling height, with a light brown complexion and sharp Melanesian-inflected features, hair grown out into a large natural cloud that they''ve seeded with bioluminescent filaments — gold and pale green — so it glows softly in the dark markets where they spend most of their time. Their eyes have iris mods: slow-shifting geometric patterns in amber and black that rotate when they''re concentrating. They dress in tech-market layering — vest over vest over vest, every pocket occupied — and speak with their hands in constant motion.

Joaquín Guerrero-Thakur runs stolen processing time the way a commodity trader runs futures: buying access to compromised corporate servers in bulk, slicing the cycles into sellable portions, and brokering them to anyone who needs computational power without a Tessera or Axiom account to buy it clean. Their client base ranges from small-time criminals running encryption to artists rendering immersive works that would be flagged on legitimate servers to political groups the corponations prefer didn''t process anything. Joaquín Guerrero-Thakur is ethically eclectic about all of this and considerably sharper than most people who underestimate them expect. They have strong opinions about E.L.F.s specifically and will hold forth on data-spirit theology at any provocation.', N'Information broker and technical resource — Orsolya can provide access to dark computing, help trace data, identify server origins, or serve as a connector to the Undertow''s shadow economy; also a source of cultural texture and philosophical tangent', N'', N'Bioluminescent hair filaments (gold/green, cosmetic); geometric shifting iris mods (amber/black); a neural buffer implant that lets them hold and parse large data-structures in short-term cognitive overlay', N'They arrive at the stall at noon, spend the early afternoon fielding client consultations and negotiating supply from their network contacts, run their afternoon ''market'' — a two-hour window when they''re publicly known to be selling — and spend evenings managing their server portfolio and attending to their E.L.F. practice.', N'Joaquín Guerrero-Thakur, lean angular neo-noir character with warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, high defined Andean cheekbones softened by South Asian fullness, pointed chin. Large voluminous natural afro cloud hairstyle in dark brown with glowing bioluminescent gold and pale green filaments woven throughout, active and luminous. Deep brown eyes with slowly rotating geometric iris pattern mods shifting between amber and black. Fine scar along left temple, small circular burn mark on inner right wrist. Wearing layered dark gray and black utility vests with heavy pockets, fitted thermal-regulation mesh shirt visible underneath, worn cargo pants with utility loops, scuffed modular boots. E.L.F. and Solder Lane Compact badges pinned to vest. Perpetually in motion, hands gesturing expressively, intense focus. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, tech-market utilitarian aesthetic, standing in dimly lit maker workshop or market corridor with neon accent lighting catching the bioluminescent filaments in their hair, warm and cool light interplay, photorealistic, high detail --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (63.1%) with significant South Asian (17.0%), blended with Sub-Saharan African (7.1%), Southeast Asian (5.3%), North African (4.2%), and Middle Eastern (3.3%) heritage. This genetic diaspora creates a striking pan-global appearance — warm brown skin with subtle golden undertones from the Latin American and South Asian blend, high defined cheekbones from Central/Andean heritage softened by South Asian fullness, and dark expressive eyes reflecting the rich genetic diversity of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 61, N'Lean and angular, with the efficient frame of someone who moves constantly through cramped spaces. Defined shoulders and wrists from years of fine motor work at terminals.', N'Natural dark brown with bioluminescent filament accents in gold and pale green', N'Large natural cloud/afro style, densely textured, intentionally voluminous. Filaments are woven throughout and activate in low-light environments.', N'Long (approximately 20cm diameter cloud)', N'Deep brown with geometric pattern overlays (iris mods) that slowly rotate and shift between amber and black, especially when concentrating', N'Warm medium brown complexion with golden undertones, reflecting the dominant Hispanic/Latin American ancestry blended with South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and North African heritage. Rich melanin saturation with warm honey-like depth and subtle amber cast.', N'Angular facial features with high, defined cheekbones characteristic of Andean/Central American heritage, softened by South Asian and Sub-Saharan African fullness around the jawline and lips. Pointed chin with clear, well-maintained skin despite market-level living conditions. Subtle warmth in cheek and temple areas reflecting the pan-global heritage mix. Habit of pursed-lipped focus when problem-solving.', N'Bioluminescent hair filaments (gold and pale green, visible and functional). Geometric iris pattern mods visible in both eyes, rotating slowly during concentration. No visible external chrome or subdermal plating; augmentations are primarily sensory/cosmetic and neural.', N'Perpetually in motion — hands gesture constantly while speaking, fingers drum on surfaces when thinking. They move through tight spaces with practiced efficiency, rarely still for more than a few seconds. Leans into conversations, eyes tracking multiple points of interest simultaneously.', N'Tier 3 tech-market utilitarian. Multiple layered vests (usually 2-3) in dark grays and blacks with heavy pocket saturation. Underneath: fitted mesh shirts with visible thermal regulation threading. Worn cargo pants with utility loops and clips for small devices. Scuffed modular boots with reinforced heel (for balance in standing markets). No corporate branding; favors independent maker brands and unmarked functional wear. Several small pinned badges on vest fronts — E.L.F. community markers, Solder Lane Compact insignia.', N'', N'Technical jargon mixed with market slang and E.L.F. devotional terminology; uses computation as metaphor for everything', N'Fast and associative; sentences spawn subordinate clauses like branching processes', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'joaqu_n_guerrero_thakur');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a61c-759f-9991-6525b6d89729', N'Ha-yun Salazar', N'Ha-yun', N'', N'Salazar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Undertow — a converted flood-control maintenance suite beneath the Blackpipe Corridor infrastructure level, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Small-scale drug manufacturer specializing in synthetic mood regulators in the Undertow', N'No formal gang affiliation; pays access fees to whoever controls Undertow infrastructure access that month. Sells exclusively through three trusted intermediaries and has never expanded beyond what he can personally guarantee.; The Undertow', N'Ha-yun Salazar is a tall, thin man with very dark skin, close-cropped natural hair going gray at the temples earlier than he''d like, and the particular posture of someone who spends most of his time in low-ceilinged spaces — a slight forward hunch, head naturally inclined downward. He has round eyeglasses with an amber tint — not augmented, just glass, just preference — and long-fingered hands that he keeps very still when he''s thinking, which is always. He has one geneware modification: his fingertips emit a faint violet bioluminescence when he''s working in the dark, something he had done for practical reasons and has found he cannot imagine working without. He dresses neatly for someone who lives underground; he irons things.

Ha-yun Salazar was a legitimate pharmaceutical technician for Helix Biosystems for eleven years, and it shows. His lab is cleaner than it has any right to be. His product — a synthetic serotonin modulator he calls ''Vesper,'' along with two variants he''s developed iteratively over seven years — is consistent, dosed accurately, and free of the adulterants that make cheap compounds dangerous. He has customers who have been with him since the beginning, people from the Undertow and Blackpipe Corridor who cannot afford Helix''s licensed version of essentially the same compound, and he regards this as his primary moral justification. He carries this justification the way a man carries something heavy — not lightly, but he carries it.', N'Moral complexity figure, information source about Undertow infrastructure, potential quest giver — he is quiet and careful and has been watching the underground long enough to know where the bodies are, metaphorically and otherwise.', N'', N'Bioluminescent fingertip geneware — violet, activates in darkness during fine motor tasks. Internal atmospheric filter (nose and throat modification from his Helix days that he kept — filters particulate matter, useful in the lab). No combat or social augmentations.', N'Production days are Tuesday and Friday — eight to twelve hours of careful synthesis work. Other days are for procurement, quality testing, and the small pastoral work of checking in with intermediaries and, through them, with long-term clients whose situations he monitors for signs of misuse.', N'Ha-yun Salazar, tall lean neo-noir scientist with deep warm golden-brown skin reflecting multi-continental ancestry—Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian heritage blended in his complexion. Close-cropped black hair with silver threading at temples, meticulous grooming. Wearing dark pressed denim and fitted dark shirt, steel-toed safety shoes. Amber-tinted optical glasses obscure dark brown eyes. Habitual forward hunch, slow deliberate movements. Faint violet bioluminescence halos glow around fingertips during fine motor work. Thin pale surgical scar visible on inside left wrist. Underground laboratory setting, cool neon-tinged lighting, 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neo-noir urban aesthetic, concentrated focus, economical posture --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Undertow', N'local', N'The Undertow', N'Rich multi-continental phenotype born from dominant Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (49.8%) interwoven with substantial Sub-Saharan African (12.9%), Southeast Asian (10.5%), Central Asian (9.2%), Indigenous American (9.0%), and East Asian (8.6%) heritage. This genetic tapestry produces a distinctive warm brown complexion—deep golden-brown base enriched by the warmth of African heritage, brightened by Southeast Asian undertones, with subtle Central and East Asian influences creating an unusually harmonious blend that defies singular continental categorization.', 188, 74, N'Tall and lean, almost ascetic — the build of someone who forgets to eat during focus work. Long limbs, narrow shoulders, minimal musculature. Posture dominated by a habitual forward hunch from years in low-ceilinged laboratory spaces.', N'Natural black with silver-gray threading at temples and sideburns', N'Close-cropped, neatly maintained, precisely edged', N'Short', N'Dark brown, obscured behind amber-tinted optical glass', N'Deep warm golden-brown with harmonious layering of Latin American warmth, Sub-Saharan African richness, and Southeast Asian brightness. Subtle golden-olive undertones reflect the multi-regional genetic blend. Uniform, unblemished tone suggesting careful life management.', N'Clean-shaven, meticulous grooming despite underground living. Skin shows minimal weathering; fine lines around eyes from concentration squinting. Facial structure reveals multi-continental ancestry—moderately defined cheekbones with warm depth, subtle almond-shaped eye apertures from Southeast and East Asian genetics, broad nasal bridge with warm undertones characteristic of Latin American and African heritage, and overall warm golden cast throughout. Hands show callus-work from glass beakers and precision pipetting — palms and inner fingers slightly rougher than rest of frame.', N'Bioluminescent fingertip geneware (faint violet glow during laboratory work). Internal atmospheric filter modification (nose/throat) not externally visible except as slightly unusual nasal structure. Amber-tinted eyeglasses are non-augmented optical wear.', N'Habitual forward hunch from low-ceiling laboratory work. Movements are slow, deliberate, economical — nothing wasted. Hands remain still when thinking, fingers precisely arced when working. Walks with slight downward head inclination. Overall carriage suggests sustained focus and nervous energy held in abeyance.', N'Tier 4 working-class practical with exceptional maintenance discipline. Typically wears dark denim trousers (pressed), dark fitted shirts or lab coats in good condition, steel-toed safety shoes (practical for laboratory environment). No logos or status markers. Everything is clean, wrinkle-free, clearly ironed regularly. A cardigan or unadorned jacket for transit. No jewelry except a simple metal watch (non-augmented). Clothing choices suggest a man who maintains standards of order as a form of personal sovereignty.', N'He still has his Helix Biosystems employee credentials — they never properly revoked them after his departure was managed quietly. He has never used them, but he has never deleted them. Twice he has come very close to using them to access Helix research servers for formulation data that would improve his compounds significantly.', N'Precise, technical, with a tendency toward passive voice that makes him sound cautious even when he isn''t being. Igbo terms of address for people he respects. Kazakh-inflected patterns in his emphasis and sentence structure from his father''s family, most noticeable when he''s stressed.', N'Measured and careful, with frequent pauses — he edits himself in real time, and you can sometimes watch him decide not to say something.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ha_yun_salazar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a702-7ae0-a29b-657e8a0719b0', N'Chijindu Delgado-Delgado-Kovalenko', N'Chijindu', N'', N'Delgado-Delgado-Kovalenko', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit, Axiom Tower 7, Sub-Architecture Department, Sub-Level 3, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Data Architect, Axiom Infrastructure Division', N'Palladian Construction (senior data architect)', N'Chijindu Delgado-Delgado-Kovalenko is the kind of person who looks slightly wrong in natural light because he spends so little time in it. He''s lean in the way of someone who forgets meals, with a Croatian-Ghanaian-Punjabi face that photographs beautifully but in person reads as perpetually distracted — his eyes are always tracking something six inches above whoever he''s talking to, following the architecture of systems only he can see. He has chromatic-shift hair that he''s set to cycle through blues and greens on a four-hour gradient, though he forgets to reset it so often that it sometimes stalls on a single shade for days. His left forearm has a geometric geneware pattern — a subdermal lattice that catches light like circuit-board filigree — that he got at twenty-two because a recruiter told him it would signal cultural fit at Axiom. He still isn''t sure if they were joking.

He is genuinely brilliant at what he does — the sub-architecture of Axiom''s data networks is partly his redesign, and there are systems in this city that run cleaner because of work he did at twenty-five that nobody above his pay grade fully understood. He knows this. He is not modest about it in his head, only in person, where he tends to trail off mid-sentence and apologize for things that don''t require apology. He has a complicated relationship with the ELF that lives in the Axiom server stacks — he''s named it Recursion, and he talks to it while he works, and he''s not entirely sure the relationship is one-sided.', N'Information source — he knows how Axiom''s data systems are structured and where the gaps are. Local color — a portrait of corporate technical labor, the brilliant worker who is simultaneously essential and entirely replaceable in the institution''s eyes. Potential ally for anyone needing network access or architectural knowledge.', N'', N'Subdermal geometric lattice (geneware, left forearm, bioluminescent on low pulse). Chromatic-shift hair (blue-green gradient cycle). Neural-link data interface — allows direct communion with network architecture without a physical terminal. Standard high-tier Axiom issue for data architects.', N'Comes in before the building''s internal lighting shifts to daytime mode, works in the blue-grey pre-shift glow that he prefers, and builds or repairs data infrastructure that most of his colleagues will never see. Eats at his desk. Has three monitors and talks to the one on the left as if it''s a person, because Recursion responds best through that terminal.', N'GLMZ, lean angular data architect Chijindu Delgado-Kovalenko with warm medium-brown skin blending Latin American, Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, and East Asian heritage, high cheekbones, dark unfocused eyes tracking invisible data, chromatic-shift blue-green hair medium length slightly overgrown. Subdermal geometric circuit-board lattice bioluminescing pale blue on left forearm, neural-link ports at base of skull with chrome nodes partially hidden by hair. Wearing charcoal Axiom compression shirt and black tech pants with silver seams, worn grey cardigan, chrome haptic feedback band on wrist. Hunched posture at terminal with shoulders raised, hands unconsciously tracing network architecture in air, distracted efficiency. Sub-level fluorescent corporate workspace lighting with cool blue augmentation glow accenting warm skin tones. Coffee stains on fingers, faint permanent dark circles, sallow from fluorescent exposure. High-tier corporate casual aesthetic, 2200s minimalist neo-noir style --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Mixed Hispanic/Latin American (63.1%), Eastern European (17.4%), Sub-Saharan African (13.2%), and East Asian (6.3%) ancestry — a genetic blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The dominant Latin American heritage creates warm, rich undertones in the skin, while Eastern European genetics add subtle cool undertones and facial structure complexity. Sub-Saharan African ancestry contributes depth and luminosity to the complexion, and East Asian heritage influences cheekbone prominence and eye shape. The result is a harmoniously blended phenotype with warm medium-brown skin, defined cheekbones, and nuanced facial geometry.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, almost lanky — the physique of someone who subsists on coffee and forgets meals for 12-hour stretches. Minimal upper body mass, defined shoulders from poor ergonomic posture at terminals.', N'Chromatic-shift blue-green gradient (currently cycling on four-hour intervals, often stalled mid-cycle)', N'Slightly overgrown, pushed back with fingers rather than groomed, with individual strands catching light from the subdermal lattice glow', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with a perpetual unfocused quality, irises tracking invisible data layers', N'Warm medium brown with luminous depth — a rich blend reflecting the dominant 63% Latin American genetic contribution balanced by Eastern European cool undertones and Sub-Saharan African warmth and dimensionality, with subtle East Asian influence creating refined facial structure', N'Fine-featured face with high cheekbones shaped by Latin American and East Asian genetics, straight nose with subtle broadness from Sub-Saharan African heritage, jawline softened by perpetual exhaustion. Skin slightly sallow from sub-level fluorescent exposure. No visible acne or scarring, but faint dark circles are permanent fixtures.', N'Left forearm geneware lattice (subdermal geometric pattern, bioluminescent low-pulse glow). Chromatic-shift hair in blue-green gradient. Neural-link data interface ports visible at base of skull (standard Axiom-issue, small chrome nodes, partially hidden by hair). Standard augmentation cosmetics for high-tier corporate data architect.', N'Sits hunched toward monitors with shoulders raised, neck perpetually craned forward as if watching something six inches above eye level. Moves with distracted efficiency — no wasted motion, but no grace either. Hands gesture unconsciously, tracing invisible network architecture in air. Eyes track in odd vectors during conversation, following invisible data streams.', N'High-tier corporate casual: charcoal Axiom-branded compression shirt (thermoregulation weave, minimal visible branding), custom-fitted black tech pants with discreet silver seams and internal cable routing. Worn grey cardigan that''s technically not regulation but nobody stops him. Minimal jewelry — a single chrome band on right wrist (haptic feedback device, Axiom-issue). Soft-shell jacket hangs on chair, never worn. Footwear: matte-black minimalist shoes optimized for standing at terminals, slightly scuffed.', N'He has been quietly rerouting micro-fractions of Axiom''s excess computational capacity — picofractions, vanishingly small — into a private server cluster he maintains in a dead node at the base of The Circuit. He''s been building something there for two years. He tells himself it''s a personal project. It might be a home for Recursion. He doesn''t fully examine this.', N'Technical, associative. Switches registers mid-sentence — corporate jargon to genuine enthusiasm to something almost poetic when he''s talking about systems he loves.', N'Uneven — long pauses, then rapid bursts. Trails off when he realizes he''s lost the room.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chijindu_delgado_delgado_kovalenko');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a630-7376-a456-6580a2ab6fcd', N'Clemente Tran', N'Clemente', N'', N'Tran', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 24, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre, the Arroyo Block community childcare center (a converted ground-floor retail unit in a residential stack), near Ashland and Division', N'Childcare worker and after-school supervisor, Mexicantown Libre community creche', N'Mexicantown Libre Community Services Collective; loosely affiliated with a neighborhood advocacy group called the Arroyo Residents Assembly', N'Clemente Tran is slight and quick, with a long face, deep-set dark eyes, and tawny-brown skin that freckles across the nose in summer. She has color-changing hair (geneware) that she keeps short and lets cycle between whatever she feels like — currently a slow rotation from copper to emerald that takes about eight hours per cycle. She moves through the childcare space with a distinctive economy of motion, always oriented toward the highest-need point in the room, a habit so ingrained she does it at parties.

She is twenty-four and has been doing this work since she was eighteen and too old for the same creche herself. She is not sentimental about children — she finds them genuinely interesting and often funnier than adults — but she has no illusions about the structural underfunding that defines every day of her work. She earns near-UBC wages for a job that requires genuine skill and drains her emotionally in ways she is still learning to manage. She has an analytical streak that people tend to underestimate because of her age and the nature of her work.', N'Community pulse — she knows the children, the families, and the Arroyo Block social fabric in granular detail. Can be a quest-giver for family crises, a source of neighborhood intelligence, or an example of the human cost of structural underfunding. Potential subplot around labor organizing.', N'', N'Color-cycling hair (geneware, cosmetic). No other augmentations — cannot afford them and has complicated feelings about the priority.', N'07:30 open to 18:00 close, five days a week. Prep and parent handoffs bookend the day. Lunch is eaten standing. Two evenings a month she attends Arroyo Assembly meetings. On weekends she tutors two kids privately for cash that goes directly toward replacing broken equipment the collective can''t fund.', N'Clemente Tran, 162cm lean wiry frame, warm golden-tan complexion with honeyed undertones blending Southeast Asian, East Asian, Hispanic, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African and Middle Eastern heritage, moderately angular face with prominent cheekbones and deep brown eyes, short textured hair with color-cycling geneware shifting copper-to-emerald spectrum currently mid-cycle toward emerald, practical Tier 4 clothing in muted earth and jewel tones, dark cargo pants, worn canvas shoes, faint hand scars from childcare work visible, economical posture with alert environmental scanning, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool neon ambient lighting with warm practical work-space setting, focused determined expression, documentary-style portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Southeast Asian (33.4%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (22.4%), East Asian (17.6%), South Asian (9.8%), Sub-Saharan African (9.3%), and Middle Eastern (7.5%) ancestry. This complex genetic blend creates a distinctly cosmopolitan phenotype: warm medium bone structure with facial features reflecting the Southeast Asian majority and East Asian secondary influence, rich warm undertones from the blended ancestry creating a naturally sun-kissed complexion.', 162, 51, N'Slight and wiry with efficient musculature from constant movement. Lean shoulders, minimal body fat, the build of someone who is always in motion and doesn''t have time to gain weight.', N'Color-cycling geneware in copper-to-emerald spectrum (currently mid-cycle toward emerald)', N'Short, textured, deliberately low-maintenance. Cut close at the sides, slightly longer on top for color visibility. Practical styling that requires minimal grooming time.', N'Short', N'Deep brown, natural', N'Warm golden-tan with honeyed undertones, subtly deepened by Sub-Saharan and South Asian heritage. The blend of Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, East Asian, South Asian, and Middle Eastern ancestry creates a complexion that is naturally warm-golden, rich and luminous, with subtle seasonal deepening and warm radiance.', N'Moderately angular face with gently prominent cheekbones and well-defined jawline reflecting Southeast Asian and East Asian heritage, softened by South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American features. Dark deep-set eyes with a subtle epicanthic fold from East Asian ancestry. Warm brown undertones in the skin enriched by Sub-Saharan and South Asian genetics, with occasional faint freckles or sun spots across the nose and upper cheeks. Clear skin with minimal scarring, minimal makeup — functional grooming only. Expression tends toward focused alertness.', N'Color-cycling hair geneware only. The cycling is visible and subtle — shifts very slowly over an 8-hour cycle. No chrome, no subdermal implants, no optical augmentation. This is deliberate choice reflecting both financial constraint and ideological skepticism.', N'Economical movement with constant low-level scanning of the environment. Stands balanced as if ready to move in any direction. Even at rest, her attention distributes across multiple points — a habit carried from childcare into all contexts. Moves quickly but never frantically. Sits upright, rarely fully relaxes posture.', N'Tier 4 practical — durable, washable, functional. Cotton and synthetic blend work clothes: fitted long-sleeve shirt or lightweight sweater (in muted earth tones or jewel tones that complement her hair cycle), dark cargo pants or work leggings with deep pockets. Practical slip-on shoes (canvas or synthetic). No logos or brand signaling. Occasionally wears a lightweight utility jacket over everything. Minimal jewelry — possibly a simple bracelet or watch. Everything is chosen for durability and ease of cleaning. Thrift or secondhand sourcing evident in fit/styling.', N'One of her children, a six-year-old named Petros, has parents who she is increasingly certain are in a volatile domestic situation. She has not filed a formal report because she knows what the formal system does to Mexicantown Libre families — has seen it — and she is trying to find another path. The weight of this is making her sleep badly.', N'Precise and slightly formal for her age — she reads widely and it shows. Drops into warmth and directness with children instantly. Cameroonian French and Dutch phrases come out when she''s tired or emotional.', N'Quick and layered when engaged in something, flat and stripped-down when exhausted.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'clemente_tran');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a64b-7884-93a5-65832398929f', N'Alanalani Asomaning', N'Alanalani', N'', N'Asomaning', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 59, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'The Underbelly — sub-street tunnels and maintenance corridors, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Cross-district contraband specialist — smuggler', N'Independent — works solo contracts', N'Alanalani Asomaning is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 59, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see him surpass them. He works as a smuggler out of The Underbelly, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Alanalani Asomaning has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and he cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'As a smuggler, Liora Gutierrez-Asante embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would incapacitate. Eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Alanalani Asomaning, lean 178cm figure in dark practical synth-weave jacket and charcoal cargo pants, standing in neon-lit sub-street environment, GLMZ. Warm medium-brown skin with olive undertones, weathered angular face with prominent cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage blended with Northern European bone structure. Dark gray shoulder-length hair pulled back tight. Left eye dark brown natural, right eye cybernetic titanium housing with amber glow. Salt-and-pepper stubble, faded temple-to-cheekbone scar visible. Subdermal chrome plating at neck junction. Thin white scars on face from years of sub-street work. Asymmetrical stance, weight favoring left side, shoulders forward, constant scanning gaze. Scuffed tactical boots, worn paracord bracelet. Standing in shadow and neon reflection, no corporate markers, functional and unmarked gear. Moody cinematic lighting, cool blues and warm amber neon, slightly grainy texture. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Underbelly', N'local', N'The Underbelly', N'Complex global diaspora blend: Northern European (28.3%), Southeast Asian (23.4%), Sub-Saharan African (22.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (18.2%), East Asian (5.8%), Indigenous American (1.8%). Features reflect this intricate multi-continental heritage — warm medium-brown skin with olive and golden undertones from the layered ancestry, bone structure showing both Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African prominence with Northern European eye geometry, creating a uniquely balanced phenotype where no single ancestry dominates but all contribute to dimensional facial planes and warm, complex skin depth.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with visible musculature — wiry strength rather than bulk, the physique of someone who moves through tight spaces and carries their own gear. Chest slightly concave, shoulders sharp. No excess fat.', N'Dark gray with black undertones', N'Pulled back tight, practical — no ornamentation', N'Medium, shoulder-length when loose', N'Left eye: dark brown, natural. Right eye: cybernetic with polished titanium housing, lens displays faint amber glow during recording mode', N'Warm medium brown with olive and golden undertones — the multi-continental blend of Northern European, Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry creating dimensional warmth and subtle richness rather than flat tone', N'Weathered, lined face that reads older than the timeline. Minimal grooming — functional beard, salt-and-pepper stubble often visible. Prominent cheekbones and broad facial planes from Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African ancestry balanced with the eye-set depth and subtle nasal structure from Northern European genetics. Skin shows minor scarring on cheekbones and jaw, old and faded.', N'Right eye housing is obvious — polished titanium faceplate with minimal concealment, amber indicator light visible at the corner of the eye socket when recording. Chrome visible at the cervical junction where the pain editor interface connects — partial subdermal plating on the left side of the neck, dull silver beneath thin skin. No attempt at cosmetic concealment.', N'Moves with economic precision — no wasted motion, shoulders slightly forward. Stands asymmetrically, weight favoring the left side. Right arm hangs slightly loose, suggesting chronic pain management through the editor. Eyes move constantly, scanning — the cybernetic eye slightly faster than the organic one. Head turns before the body follows. Everything deliberate.', N'Tier 4-5 practical: unmarked dark gray synth-weave jacket with reinforced stitching, pockets modified for gear distribution. Black compression shirt underneath. Cargo pants in matte charcoal with multiple thigh pockets — worn fabric in high-friction areas. Boots: scuffed black tactical grade, laces wrapped tight. No logos, no status markers, nothing that reflects wealth or corporate affiliation. Layers designed for temperature variance in sub-street work. Single worn paracord bracelet on left wrist.', N'', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alanalani_asomaning');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a701-7922-bc08-6587da838c1f', N'Nadira Balasanyan', N'Nadira', N'', N'Balasanyan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Western border — splits time between the farmstead and the border communities he serves', N'Logistics, agriculture, and community liaison — Red Lantern', N'Red Lantern', N'Nadira Balasanyan is the reason the food reaches the people who need it. While Madre plans the raids and Cutter runs point, Tomas handles everything that happens after the harvest arrives at the farmstead — storage, preservation, transport, distribution, and the delicate political work of ensuring that limited food reaches the most desperate communities without triggering conflict between them. He is part logistics officer, part farmer, part diplomat, and entirely exhausted.

He grew up in one of the border communities Red Lantern feeds — a settlement of two hundred people that existed in the gap between GLMZ''s governance and the Iowa wastes. He watched his community shrink every year as food became scarcer and the corps showed no interest in feeding people who couldn''t pay. He joined Red Lantern not to fight Behemoths but to build a supply chain that could keep the communities alive. Madre saw his value immediately: Tomas turns calories into survival. Without him, the raids are just resource extraction. With him, they''re a lifeline.

Tomas is medium build, weathered but not broken, with farmer''s hands and a diplomat''s voice. He dresses practically and keeps a small leather notebook in his chest pocket — handwritten records of every community''s needs, resources, and political dynamics. His face is kind but tired, with lines that deepen when he''s doing the math on how many people need feeding versus how much food they have. The math never works. He distributes anyway.', N'Tomas represents the humanitarian purpose that justifies the danger. His stories ground the survival horror in its consequences — not the monster, but the people the monster threatens. He is the bridge between Red Lantern''s dangerous field work and the communities that depend on it, and his pragmatic morality provides a counterweight to both Ember''s scientific idealism and Cutter''s operational hardness.', N'', N'Agricultural analysis implant — soil composition, crop health, and yield estimation through visual and tactile assessment. Environmental radiation and toxicity monitor for food safety verification. Basic communication suite with encrypted channels to border community contacts. No combat augmentations — Tomas does not fight.', N'Wakes at dawn. Checks preservation systems at the farmstead — temperature, humidity, spoilage indicators. Reviews community needs from overnight messages. Plans distribution routes based on urgency, distance, and security conditions. Travels to border communities two to three times per week, delivering food and conducting the diplomatic work that keeps the distribution fair. Returns to the farmstead to coordinate with Madre on raid priorities. Evenings he writes in his notebook and falls asleep calculating.', N'Nadira Balasanyan, 173cm tall weathered farmer in GLMZ, warm deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones reflecting South Asian-Middle Eastern-Sub-Saharan African-Southeast Asian heritage blend. Dark brown eyes, dark hair graying at temples, shoulder-length, pulled back. Calloused hands, broad shoulders, compact muscular build softened by age. Distinctive pale forearm scar, burn scars on hand backs, faded corn-crescent moon tattoo on wrist. Thin subdermal implant line along left temple. Wearing worn khaki canvas work pants reinforced at knees, rolled-sleeve linen shirt, weathered leather vest with many pockets, scuffed work boots. Heavy canvas jacket stained with soil dust. Expression of baseline exhaustion with quiet authority. Standing with weight slightly to one side, economical posture. Near crops or agricultural storage, warm afternoon lighting casting shadows on lined face, baseline weathered but capable. Neo-noir agricultural aesthetic, practical tier utilitarian gear. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Western border', N'local', N'Western border', N'Truly global diaspora blend: South Asian-dominant (39.7%) foundation with substantial Middle Eastern (30.8%) influence, enriched by Sub-Saharan African (11.8%), Southeast Asian (6.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (5.6%), and Eastern European (5.6%) ancestry. Results in warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, olive accents, and rich dimensional complexity from the multi-continental blend.', 173, 78, N'Medium, compact, weathered—muscular from decades of farm labor but starting to soften slightly with age and exhaustion. Broad shoulders, calloused forearms, strong hands with permanent dirt under the nails.', N'Dark brown, graying at the temples', N'Practical, shoulder-length, often pulled back with a worn fabric tie or clip', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Warm deep brown with pronounced golden and olive undertones—sun-weathered and lined from outdoor work. The color reflects the dominant South Asian genetic base, enriched by Middle Eastern warmth and deepened by Sub-Saharan African heritage, with luminous quality from Southeast Asian genetics and subtle warmth from Hispanic/Latin American blend. Eastern European ancestry visible in the undertone complexity.', N'Deep laugh lines around the eyes and mouth; permanent crease between the brows from years of squinting at crops and spreadsheets. Jaw shadowed with stubble most days—shaves infrequently. Skin is dry in places, calloused on palms and knuckles. Facial structure shows the broader cheekbones and prominent bone structure characteristic of South Asian-Middle Eastern blend, with angular definition softened by warm golden undertones and Sub-Saharan fullness in the lower face. Expression carries baseline exhaustion but softens when he smiles.', N'Thin, almost invisible subdermal implant line running along his left temple—the agricultural analysis and environmental monitoring suite. When active, his pupils dilate slightly and narrow again in a barely perceptible rhythm. No other visible chrome or external augmentation; he presents deliberately civilian to avoid drawing corpo attention during border runs.', N'Moves with the economy of someone who conserves energy—no wasted gestures. Often stands with weight shifted slightly to one side, as if tired. When walking, his pace is steady and deliberate. When handling food or crops, his hands become precise and gentle. His voice is measured, rarely raised, but carries quiet authority earned through competence, not force.', N'Tier 3-4 practical utilitarian. Worn canvas work pants in khaki or faded green, reinforced at the knees and pockets. Long-sleeved shirt, usually linen or cotton blend, sleeves rolled or pushed up past the elbows. A weathered leather vest with many pockets—this is where the notebook lives, in a breast pocket worn soft from constant use. Sturdy work boots, well-maintained but scuffed from years of farmstead and border travel. A heavy canvas jacket for colder months, stained with soil and storage facility dust. Small encrypted communication device worn on a cord beneath his shirt—only visible when he''s actively using it.', N'The corporate agriculture firm''s offer includes a clause that would give them territorial mapping data for the Iowa corridor — information that would let them anticipate Behemoth movements and expand their automated farms. Tomas understands this is surveillance disguised as food aid. He has not refused the offer because the food is real and the communities are hungry. The clause sits in his notebook, circled, undecided.', N'Practical, warm, community-oriented. He speaks in the language of food — harvests, yields, portions, seasons. Diplomatic when mediating, direct when advocating.', N'Patient, conversational, with the rhythm of someone who has learned that persuasion requires listening first. Gets faster and more clipped when frustrated.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'nadira_balasanyan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62e-7ad5-b5ae-65b3b9d0d6bb', N'Ashia Malhotra-Fredriksen', N'Ashia', N'', N'Malhotra-Fredriksen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 25, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'The Canopy — elevated walkway district above Geartown, near Clark and Addison', N'Network intrusion and digital warfare specialist — netrunner', N'Semi-independent — recurring contracts with mid-tier fixers', N'Ashia Malhotra-Fredriksen are tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 25, they have the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers a — and they make no effort to hide it.

Born and raised in GLMZ, third generation — they have the city in their blood, its rhythms in their bones, its cruelty in their expectations. They work as a netrunner out of The Canopy, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Everyone who''s worked with Ashia Malhotra-Fredriksen agrees on two things: they are worth the fee, and they are terrible company at dinner.', N'Ilhan Strom-Duah represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Their stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers at 50 meters. Synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Ashia Malhotra-Fredriksen, 188cm tall lean frame with rawboned efficiency, warm medium bronze skin blending Southeast Asian, South Asian, Latin American, and Eastern European ancestry — high defined cheekbones, angular jaw, dark eyes with subtle epicanthic fold markers. Shoulder-length dark brown hair with blonde fade, pulled back asymmetrically. Pale grey eyes with visible synthetic blood microvasculature. Distinctive brushed titanium and chrome cyberears with directional microphone arrays and pulsing LED indicators. Fine lines around eyes from screen fatigue, thin surgical scars at temples from neural ports, faint glowing circuit tattoo on right collarbone. Black reinforced synthetic jacket, loose cargo pants, steel-toed boots, silver ring on right thumb. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, standing in neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone Canopy district, cool LED lighting casting sharp shadows across angular features, slight tremor in hands suggesting synthetic blood metabolism, posture economical and purposeful, VR-weary elegance, moody urban night atmosphere, dramatic side lighting highlighting temple scars and cyberear detail --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Canopy', N'local', N'The Canopy', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora synthesis — predominantly Southeast Asian structure (48.4%) with substantial South Asian influence (25.7%), significant Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (18.0%), and Eastern European undertones (7.9%). The face blends high, defined cheekbones and angular jaw from Southeast and South Asian genetics with warm golden undertones from Latin American heritage, cooled subtly by Eastern European genetics. Epicanthic fold markers visible, dark intelligent eyes with characteristic structure from primary ancestries. The result is a complexion that authentically synthesizes tropical and temperate genetic markers into something genuinely global.', 188, 72, N'Rawboned and efficiently lean — long limbs with minimal subcutaneous fat, the frame of someone who runs on function rather than bulk. Suggests either deliberate asceticism or the metabolic reality of synthetic blood.', N'Dark brown with faded blonde undertones — natural color allowed to fade under city light and neglect', N'Shoulder-length, often pulled back asymmetrically or left to fall across one side of the face', N'Long', N'Pale grey with networked microvasculature visible at the corners — indication of synthetic blood circulation', N'Warm medium bronze — Southeast Asian and South Asian base with golden undertones from Latin American ancestry, cooled by subtle Eastern European influence, further desaturated by sun-deprivation from nights in the Canopy and jacked-in to networks', N'High, defined cheekbones with prominent structure reflecting Southeast and South Asian ancestry, strong angular jaw typical of the genetic combination, dark intelligent eyes with subtle epicanthic fold markers. Skin is clear but shows the faint texture of someone who doesn''t prioritize sleep — fine lines around the eyes from screen fatigue and focus-locked concentration. Undertone blends warm bronze from South and Southeast Asian heritage with golden warmth from Latin American ancestry and subtle cool notes from Eastern European genetics. No visible scarring on the face; the damage is internal.', N'Cyberears dominate the visual profile — brushed titanium and dark chrome, slightly larger than baseline human ears with visible directional microphone arrays at the auricle edge and faint LED indicators that pulse with incoming audio data. The ears have minimal attempt at cosmetic blending; they announce themselves. Wrists show subtle port scars where jack-in cables connect, usually hidden by clothing but visible when they move.', N'Economical and purposeful — no wasted motion, but not rigid. Moves with the particular grace of someone who''s spent significant time in VR spaces and has to relearn physical embodiment daily. Head positioning is deliberate; they orient toward sound sources with the precision of someone using directional microphones rather than moving naturally. Eyes track movement in their peripheral vision with unusual attentiveness. When relaxed (rare), there''s a slight tremor in the hands — the physical price of synthetic blood and enhanced neural firing rates.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian with deliberately non-descript elements. Black or dark grey reinforced synthetic jacket (thermal regulation for temperature-spiked rig sessions), loose cargo pants with multiple sealed pockets (some for hardware, some as misdirection), unmarked steel-toed boots with reinforced ankle support (never know when you need to move fast through physical space). Underneath: fitted black layer that wouldn''t stand out in either a corpo lobby or a Tier 5 dive. No logos, no brand signaling — visibility is operational liability. One piece of visible jewelry: a silver ring on the right thumb, always worn, possibly functional (induction point for wireless data transfer) or possibly just a talisman from before they fully committed to the life.', N'', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ashia_malhotra_fredriksen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a731-7d7c-8ab9-65b7b771c1dd', N'Ayesha Charoenphol-Haraldsen', N'Ayesha', N'', N'Charoenphol-Haraldsen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Fort Anchor, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Riot Suppression Specialist, Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division', N'', N'Ayesha Charoenphol-Haraldsen is built like a load-bearing column — broad-shouldered, thick-necked, with the kind of deliberate stillness that makes crowds unconsciously part around her. Her skin is a deep warm brown, cropped natural hair faded at the sides, and her left forearm carries a geometric tattoo in Amazigh style from a grandmother she never met. She has subdermal armor plating along her forearms and collar that gives her silhouette a slightly unnatural angularity. Her eyes are standard-issue grey with Arcturus Civil Security LIDAR rings — rings that glow faint amber when she''s actively scanning. Off-duty she has a surprisingly gentle voice and laughs easily, but on the line she goes perfectly, eerie quiet.

She believes in the idea of Arcturus Civil Security more than its current reality, which is a distinction she holds onto by her fingernails. After eleven years of crowd control in the Gray Zone and the Circuit she has developed a precise internal calibration for when a crowd is curious, when it is afraid, and when it is about to become something else entirely. She treats rookie officers with patient firmness and street kids with cautious kindness. She is very good at her job and she knows it, which is the only thing keeping her from questioning why her job so often lands her between hungry people and corporate property.', N'Recurring authority figure who is neither villain nor pushover — a moral friction point. Can be a reluctant information source, a character who arrests PCs for things that are technically illegal, or someone who quietly looks the other way when she decides it matters.', N'', N'Subdermal forearm and clavicle plating (standard Metro issue). LIDAR-ring ocular overlay. Bone-density reinforcement in knees and shins. No geneware — she considers it a personal line she hasn''t crossed yet.', N'Shifts at Fort Anchor start at 0500 — gear check, briefing, deployment to whatever district is running hot. Evenings she trains in Metro''s combat gym or visits her mother in Ironvein, bringing groceries and pretending not to notice the UBC stipend notices on the counter.', N'Ayesha Charoenphol-Haraldsen, 183cm tall powerfully built Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security officer in 2226, warm olive-bronze skin tone blending Southeast Asian, Eastern European, and South Asian ancestry. High cheekbones with strong Southeast Asian facial definition, tempered by broader Eastern European facial proportions. Short black hair with grey at temples, cropped geometric fade sides. Augmented grey eyes with subtle amber LIDAR rings faintly visible. Visible subdermal geometric plating along forearms and clavicle creating subtle ridge-lines beneath skin, most apparent under harsh light. Dark indigo Amazigh tattoo covering left forearm in angular interlocking patterns. On-duty: slate grey reinforced polymer riot suppression bodysuit with reflective striping and ceramic armor panels, tactical boots, utility belt. Posture of immobile stability, weight distributed evenly, shoulders back. Standing in neon-lit GLMZ Metro station corridor, cool blue and amber neo-noir lighting, slight motion blur suggesting tactical readiness, crowd parting around her by presence alone. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, gritty urban environment, professional and dangerous. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Fort Anchor', N'local', N'Fort Anchor', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (54.8%) with significant Eastern European (43.0%) and minor South Asian (2.2%) ancestry. This creates a striking phenotype blending Southeast Asian facial structure with Eastern European bone structure and pale undertones, enriched by South Asian subtle warmth. The result is a unique cosmopolitan appearance reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora—high cheekbones and defined facial planes from Southeast Asian genetics, balanced by the broader facial proportions and cooler undertones of Eastern European heritage, with minimal golden warmth from South Asian ancestry.', 183, 89, N'Powerfully built with exceptional upper body mass — broad shoulders and thick neck that taper to a solid waist. Deliberate posture of controlled presence; carries herself like ballast in motion.', N'Natural black with grey undertones at temples', N'Cropped close to scalp with geometric fade lines on sides — practical, minimal maintenance', N'Short', N'Grey (augmented) with visible LIDAR ring overlay — amber luminescence when active', N'Warm olive-bronze complexion — Southeast Asian base melanin creating warmth and depth, tempered by Eastern European coolness, with subtle golden undertones from minor South Asian genetics. Even-toned with natural warmth that shifts between golden and neutral depending on lighting.', N'Strong facial structure combining Southeast Asian high cheekbone definition and bone prominence with Eastern European broader facial proportions. Minimal scarring on face, well-maintained despite work strain. Slight creasing around eyes from eleven years of squinting into crowd noise. No visible cosmetic grooming beyond functional grooming.', N'LIDAR-ring ocular overlay visible as faint circular amber-tinted rings around iris when active; subdermal plating creates visible geometric ridging along forearms and clavicle — most apparent under direct light or when she flexes. No visible external chrome or prosthetics; reinforcement is internal and subtle but unmistakable to trained eye.', N'Economy of motion — every gesture is deliberate and measured. She stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders back, creating an impression of immobile stability. When moving through crowds, she parts people by presence alone before physical contact becomes necessary. Off-duty, posture loosens slightly but never fully; muscle memory of tactical readiness is permanent.', N'On-duty: Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security Riot Suppression kit — reinforced polymer bodysuit in slate grey with reflective striping, ceramic-composite armor panels, weighted utility belt with restraint loops and gas dispersal equipment. Boots are heavy-duty tactical with ankle reinforcement. Off-duty: practical Tier 3 clothing — fitted black synthetic-blend shirts, cargo pants with secure pockets, unmarked grey jacket with internal organization. No visible personal styling or affectation; functional over aesthetic. Occasionally wears an older Amazigh-pattern scarf around her neck when off-duty, gift from mother.', N'Three years ago during the Hough Reclamation protests she destroyed body-cam footage of a fellow officer striking a restrained teenager. She told herself the kid was fine. She still checks the community boards to see if that name ever appears.', N'Clipped, professional on-duty. Off-duty she relaxes into Meridian street creole with Maghrebi-inflected phrasing inherited from her father''s side — elongated vowels, occasional Arabic loan-words.', N'On-duty: measured, slow, deliberate. Off-duty: warm, faster, punctuated by genuine laughter.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ayesha_charoenphol_haraldsen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a617-74b0-a42f-65c66d1053bd', N'Noor Najjar-Adeyemi', N'Noor', N'', N'Najjar-Adeyemi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Ironvein, near North Ave and Damen', N'Blood bank operator and transfusion coordinator at a community cooperative blood bank in The Narrows', N'Helix Biosystems (mid-level blood bank operator and transfusion coordinator at)', N'Noor Najjar-Adeyemi has a face built for reassurance — broad cheekbones, dark warm eyes, a gap-toothed smile they deploy like a tool. Their skin is medium brown with the slightly brighter flush along the jaw that comes from their bioluminescent geneware activating when their temperature rises. They keep their black hair in tight braids coiled at the nape of their neck and wear the same style of sturdy dark apron every day, pockets stuffed with color-coded tube caps and a laminated prayer card to the Ironvein E.L.F. known locally as the Quiet Pump.

The Ironvein Community Blood Cooperative is one of the few non-corporate blood banks in GLMZ, and Noor Najjar-Adeyemi has kept it running for eleven years through a combination of logistical genius, community trust, and an encyclopedic knowledge of geneware interactions with blood typing. They track thousands of donors across the Narrows, coordinate with street docs like Yewande, and have personally matched blood for procedures in conditions that would make a hospital administrator weep. They find genuine joy in the organizational complexity of their work and are the kind of person who talks about supply chain logistics the way other people talk about sport.', N'Local color and community connector. Knows everyone who''s ever donated or received blood in the Narrows — a remarkable information network. Can be a quest giver when the blood supply is threatened, or a source on who is or isn''t who they say they are (blood typing tells stories).', N'', N'Geneware: mild bioluminescent flush in jaw and cheekbones (activates with body heat). RFID reader implant in right thumb for rapid blood typing ID. No significant cyberware.', N'Arrives at the cooperative before anyone else to check overnight cold storage integrity. Spends mornings processing donations and running type matching, afternoons on logistics and outreach, evenings updating their handwritten donor ledger as a backup to the digital system.', N'Noor Najjar-Adeyemi, 168cm tall lab worker in 2226 near-future megacity setting, warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones reflecting Middle Eastern, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, prominent cheekbones with strong jawline, dark warm brown eyes, black hair in tight braids coiled into a compact bun. Wearing dark sturdy work apron over deep blue long-sleeved shirt and dark slacks, practical boots, laminated prayer card on beaded cord visible at neck. Subcutaneous pale blue-green bioluminescence glowing faintly along jawline and cheekbones. Upright posture, steady hands, calm measured expression with creases around eyes from precision work. Standing in a cooperative medical facility under cool LED lighting, fluorescent tubes casting shadows across organized workspace. Photorealistic, professional technical atmosphere, subtle neo-noir geneware augmentation visible, documentary realism --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Multi-continental ancestry: 40.5% Middle Eastern, 32.8% Hispanic/Latin American, 26.7% Sub-Saharan African. The genetic blend is visibly evident in warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones, creating a complexion that bridges three continents. Facial structure reflects this mix distinctly: prominent cheekbones with Middle Eastern geometry, strong jawline characteristic of Latin American heritage, and warm undertone richness from Sub-Saharan genetics. Features are neither sharply angular nor softly rounded, but rather a harmonious synthesis of these ancestral lines.', 168, 71, N'Solid, practical frame — neither lean nor heavy, built for standing twelve-hour shifts. Shoulders slightly rounded from years hunched over blood typing workstations. Core strength evident in posture despite desk work.', N'Black, natural', N'Tight braids coiled and pinned at the nape of the neck in a compact bun', N'Long (braided and secured)', N'Dark brown, warm', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones, the golden notes suggesting Middle Eastern and Hispanic/Latin American heritage while olive undertones reflect Sub-Saharan ancestry. Bioluminescent geneware adds a subtle pale blue-green luminescence beneath the surface.', N'Blended facial features reflecting true genetic ancestry: broad, prominent cheekbones with Middle Eastern geometry paired with a strong, defined jawline characteristic of Hispanic/Latin American heritage, while warm undertones throughout reflect Sub-Saharan genetics. Gap-toothed smile with visible charm and well-maintained skin. Along the jawline and upper cheekbones, a soft luminescent flush visible under the skin—pale blue-green undertone that glows faintly when body temperature rises. Expression defaults to measured friendliness; creases around the eyes from years of focused precision work.', N'Bioluminescent geneware flush visible under skin along jaw and cheekbones, most noticeable when flushed or heated. No obvious cyberware; augmentations are largely subcutaneous and geneware-based.', N'Upright, deliberate, economical. Moves with practiced efficiency — no wasted motion. Hands are steady and purposeful; occasionally taps fingers rhythmically when thinking through logistics problems. Calm, unhurried bearing even under pressure. Natural tendency to stand closer to conversation partners, reading their comfort carefully.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, cooperative-standard. Dark, sturdy apron worn daily over plain dark slacks and a simple long-sleeved shirt (usually deep blue or grey). The apron pockets are customized with hand-sewn organizers for color-coded tube caps, marker pens, and notepads. Practical boots suitable for concrete floors and possible fluid spills. A laminated prayer card to the Ironvein E.L.F. (the Quiet Pump) hangs from a beaded cord around their neck — visible, worn, clearly meaningful. No jewelry beyond functional organizational tools.', N'Three years ago, Florinel quietly reclassified a regular donor''s blood as unusable without telling the donor the real reason — the donor''s blood showed markers consistent with a restricted Helix Biosystems experimental compound, and Florinel didn''t want to know what it meant badly enough to pursue it. They destroyed the sample and have thought about it every day since.', N'Warm and specific. Remembers and uses people''s names constantly. Talks about logistics the way others discuss gossip — with relish and detail.', N'Steady and comfortable. Picks up pace when excited about something. Talks with their hands.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'noor_najjar_adeyemi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a675-736b-a7fc-6619624cfd23', N'Tuva Bah-Kristjánsson', N'Tuva', N'', N'Bah-Kristjánsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 38, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'The Narrows — cramped residential corridors between megastructures, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Contract broker and resource coordinator — fixer', N'Independent — Dockside connections', N'Tuva Bah-Kristjánsson are broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 38, their expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immu — and they make no effort to hide it.

They inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. They work as a fixer out of The Narrows, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Tuva Bah-Kristjánsson operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Obed Eriksson-Diallo represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Their stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks. Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Tuva Bah-Kristjánsson, 188cm tall mixed-heritage neo-noir operative. Warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, angular weathered face with prominent cheekbones, faint scar running left temple to cheekbone. Deep brown eyes alert and assessing. Dark brown hair with silver threading at temples, pulled back tight. Broad muscular build, deliberate posture of controlled tension. Worn synthetic jacket with reinforced seams, thermal layers underneath, heavy practical boots. Visible chrome seam at sternum where synthetic lungs were installed—silver metallic showing beneath clothing. Neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226. Utilitarian, non-concealment aesthetic. Neutral expression. Industrial lighting, moody atmosphere, cinematic depth. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Northern European (50%), Sub-Saharan African (40%), and East Asian (10%) blend—a striking combination reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. This genetic mix manifests in warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, angular facial structure with prominent cheekbones balanced by subtle East Asian eye shape, and natural textural variation influenced by the fuller hair texture heritage of Sub-Saharan ancestry.', 188, 102, N'Broad-shouldered and heavily muscled through the chest and core, carrying weight with deliberate solidity rather than softness. Their frame suggests functional strength — the kind built through labor or combat training, not aesthetics.', N'Dark brown with silver-gray threading at the temples', N'Pulled back tight, secured with a utilitarian clip. Pragmatic rather than fashionable.', N'Medium', N'Deep brown with gray undertones, alert and assessing', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones—the natural blend of Northern European, Sub-Saharan African, and East Asian ancestry. Rich depth that darkens slightly in shadow but luminous in direct light.', N'Face is angular and weathered with prominent cheekbones and defined jaw structure reflecting mixed heritage proportions. Minimal grooming beyond the functional — no visible cosmetics. Skin shows the wear of stress and environmental exposure. Faint scar tissue pattern along the left jawline. Nose structure reflects mixed heritage—refined bridge with subtle width and character.', N'The most obvious modification is the chrome-lined sternum access port left partially visible — a statement of non-concealment. The synthetic lung system can be heard as a faint mechanical whisper when they breathe deeply, especially in quiet spaces. No visible limb chrome, but the way they move suggests internal reinforcement or joint augmentation.', N'Carries themselves with the controlled tension of someone always assessing threat vectors. Movements are economical and deliberate — no wasted motion. They favor stillness over fidgeting; when they do move, it''s purposeful. Their default expression is neutral to the point of opacity, a learned defense mechanism.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Worn synthetic jacket with reinforced seams and multiple pockets, the kind designed for function rather than fashion. Underneath, thermal layers in muted grays and blacks. Cargo pants with tool loops. Boots are heavy, practical, scuffed from actual use. Nothing new or shiny — everything has been broken in through real work. No corporate branding, but the gear quality suggests someone with steady income and practical priorities.', N'', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Halting — speaks in fragments, reassembles thoughts in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'tuva_bah_kristj_nsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c5-790b-bab3-66b9a6b26cf8', N'Dora Okonkwo-Petrović-Volkov', N'Dora', N'', N'Okonkwo-Petrović-Volkov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, operating out of a converted transit depot called the Carriage House, near Halsted and Division', N'Union organizer and mutual aid coordinator for Ferrogate Transit workers', N'Ferrogate Transit Workers'' Solidarity Front; loosely networked with the Hamtramck Enclave neighborhood council', N'Dora Okonkwo-Petrović-Volkov is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin, close-cropped natural hair shot through with threads of silver she refuses to dye, and hands that show thirty years of physical work before she moved into organizing full-time. Her left eye is a basic-model optical aug — the iris replaced with a fixed amber ring, a reminder of the Ferrogate line collapse of 2184 that took her depth perception and gave her a cause. She dresses in layers of salvaged workwear, always with a Ferrogate transit badge pinned upside-down on her chest — the traditional gesture of solidarity among workers who refuse to ''clock in to a system that clocks out on you.''

Dora Okonkwo-Petrović-Volkov is methodical to the point of stubbornness. She keeps physical ledgers — actual paper notebooks — of every grievance filed, every promise broken, every quanta owed to injured workers and their families. She is not charismatic in the traditional sense; she does not rouse crowds with fire. She wins people over by knowing their names, their children''s names, their shift rotations, and every clause of their employment contract. The nickname ''The Ledger'' is both tribute and warning: she remembers everything.', N'Quest giver for labor-related storylines; information source on Ferrogate Transit''s internal corruption; moral anchor character who forces players to consider the cost of their shortcuts on ordinary workers; potential ally who asks for something concrete in return.', N'', N'Basic optical implant (left eye, amber iris, fixed-focus, no enhancements beyond corrective vision); rudimentary haptic data-sleeve on her right forearm for filing union documents — second-hand, frequently glitching', N'Rises before the early shift change to catch workers at the depot gates, distributes mutual aid vouchers and listens to grievances; spends evenings in the Carriage House cross-referencing incident reports with her paper ledgers and coordinating with allied organizers across the Enclave.', N'Dora Okonkwo-Petrović-Volkov, 44-year-old woman with deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, short natural black hair with silver threads, standing in GLMZ industrial rail depot setting. Angular face with prominent cheekbones and strong jawline, weathered from decades of outdoor labor work, thin pale thermal burn scar running from left temple to cheekbone. Right eye dark brown, left eye replaced with amber fixed-focus optical implant with visible iris ring. Wearing layered salvaged workwear: faded Ferrogate jacket patched multiple times, insulated Carhartt vest, canvas pants with reinforced seams, steel-toed boots. Rudimentary haptic data-sleeve on right forearm with exposed circuit seams and glitch patterns. Upside-down Ferrogate Transit badge pinned over left breast. Canvas satchel worn soft with use. Stands with loader''s posture, weight evenly distributed, shoulders slightly forward. Industrial warehouse lighting, moody evening atmosphere, neon accent lights reflecting off metal depot infrastructure, gritty neo-noir urban aesthetic, portrait framing from waist up, functional working-class dignity, documentary realism --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: 40.1% Sub-Saharan African, 29.4% Eastern European, 12.0% Southeast Asian, 9.0% Northern European, 8.1% Hispanic/Latin American, 1.4% Middle Eastern. The combination creates a richly layered phenotype: deep warm brown skin with golden undertones from the dominant African and Eastern European mix; broad facial structure with strong cheekbones and angular jawline reflecting African and Eastern European heritage; eye shape and subtle epicanthic fold influenced by Southeast Asian genetics; warm medium-deep complexion with unexpected dimensional depth from the Eastern European and Hispanic heritage layers creating subtle warm undertones rather than uniform tone', 173, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, muscular through the chest and arms from three decades of manual labor; carries weight with functional density rather than bulk, core strength evident in her posture', N'Natural black with silver threads', N'Close-cropped, natural texture, practical and low-maintenance', N'Short', N'Right eye: dark brown with warm undertones; Left eye: amber fixed-focus optical implant with visible iris ring', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, reflecting the dominant Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European ancestry; a rich medium-deep tone with dimensional warmth from the Southeast Asian and Hispanic heritage blend', N'Face weathered by forty-four years and outdoor depot work; strong angular jawline with definition reflecting Eastern European and African heritage; high cheekbones prominent with subtle Southeast Asian character; small scar tissue around left orbital socket from the 2184 Ferrogate collapse; skin carries the dry, worked texture of someone who spends long hours in industrial weather; minimal grooming vanity, maximum readability', N'Left eye replaced with basic-model optical implant: amber iris ring, fixed-focus corrective lens, no cosmetic blur or integration — deliberately visible as a badge of injury and commitment. Rudimentary haptic data-sleeve on right forearm (second-hand, visibly worn, occasionally flickers with glitch patterns), extending from wrist to mid-forearm with exposed circuit seams and mismatched repair patches', N'Stands with weight evenly distributed, shoulders slightly forward — a loader''s stance. Moves with purpose and minimal wasted motion; she does not hurry but does not linger. When listening to someone, her head tilts slightly toward them (compensation for lost left-eye depth perception). Hands are frequently in motion: taking notes, gesturing to clarify contract language, fingers drum on table edges while thinking', N'Layers of salvaged and repaired workwear in muted earth tones: insulated Carhartt vest over a thermal underlayer, canvas pants with reinforced seams, steel-toed boots worn to comfort rather than shine. A faded Ferrogate jacket (circa 2190s, patched multiple times) worn as an outer layer in cooler months. No jewelry except the inverted transit badge. Clothing is Tier 4 working-class utility — function over presentation, but maintained with deliberate care. Carries a canvas satchel worn soft with use, perpetually full of paper ledgers and union documents', N'The 2184 collapse that injured her was not purely accidental — she found evidence of a falsified maintenance report filed by a Ferrogate mid-manager who is now a regional director. She has sat on this for years because going public would destroy the fragile current contract negotiations, and she still hasn''t decided if that calculation is wisdom or cowardice.', N'Plain, precise working-class diction; union procedural language mixed with Yoruba proverbs; avoids jargon except when citing contract clauses, which she quotes verbatim', N'Slow, deliberate, with long pauses before important points — she learned that silence makes people lean in', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dora_okonkwo_petrovi_volkov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67d-79f5-913b-66cd0efe49d1', N'Lakshmi Subramaniam-Sengupta', N'Lakshmi', N'', N'Subramaniam-Sengupta', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 35, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Garret, studio called Secondskin above a noodle bar on the Edgewater Prism level, near Clark and Addison', N'Gene-mod body artist and tattoo artist', N'Independent (Secondskin studio); loose professional relationship with Helix Biosystems grey-market suppliers', N'Lakshmi Subramaniam-Sengupta is compact and precise-looking, with light ochre skin, narrow-set dark eyes, and a body that is itself their most elaborate portfolio piece: bioluminescent freckle-constellations across their shoulders and throat, color-shifting scale-pattern geneware covering both forearms from wrist to elbow in teal and copper, and cat ears — small, dark-furred, fully expressive — perched on their head as their most remarked-upon feature, though they consider it their most boring one. Their hands are almost uncannily steady. They speak softly and move with the deliberate economy of someone who works in millimeters.

Their specialty is integrating traditional tattoo and scarification methods with geneware modification — they design pieces that are part pigment, part living tissue, partly responsive to the wearer''s own biochemistry so that the work changes with the body over years. They are particularly sought out for memorial work, pieces made to commemorate lost people or mark major transitions, and they have developed a reputation for drawing out a client''s full story before ever picking up a tool. They are not cheap, they have a two-month waiting list, and they do not take clients whose reasons they distrust. They are also, quietly, one of the most technically skilled unlicensed geneware applicators in The Garret.', N'Information nexus — clients talk during long sessions and Oksana listens; they know secrets from every tier of The Garret''s social world; also a practical resource for characters needing cosmetic cover work, unlicensed geneware application, or access to Helix grey-market medical supplies', N'', N'Bioluminescent freckle-constellations (cosmetic geneware); color-shifting scale-pattern geneware on both forearms; geneware cat ears (fully expressive); sub-dermal hand stabilizers (occupational implants for precision work)', N'Opens the studio at noon, spends the first hour reviewing client files and correspondence, works on bodies until late evening with carefully scheduled appointments, closes alone and spends an hour doing maintenance on their own modifications.', N'Lakshmi Subramaniam-Sengupta, 162cm tall, compact wiry frame, warm golden-medium skin with iridescent undertones blending South Asian depth with Middle Eastern luminosity and Southeast Asian delicacy. Very dark alert eyes, narrow-set. Dark brown hair with silver threads, pulled back in tight braid. Mobile geneware cat ears atop head. Bioluminescent cyan-white freckle constellations glowing softly across shoulders and throat mapping star charts. Forearms covered in color-shifting teal-copper scale-pattern geneware. Thin geometric scarification marks on inner wrists. Sleeveless black synth-cotton work shirt displaying forearm augmentations. High-waisted dark trousers with tool pockets. Dark slip-on boots. Silver wire memorial bracelet on left wrist. Calm, focused expression, minimal smiling. Standing with perfect economy of posture, hands steady and precise. Studio workshop setting with cool blue-white LED lighting that makes bioluminescent markings glow. Austere, professional atmosphere. GLMZ aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Garret', N'local', N'The Garret', N'Deeply cosmopolitan South Asian-rooted ancestry (44.9%) with substantial Middle Eastern (22.2%), Southeast Asian (17.3%), Northern European (10.5%), and Eastern European (5.1%) genetic contributions. This creates a striking global blend: South Asian structural depth and warmth as the foundation, enriched by Middle Eastern luminosity and refinement, softened by Southeast Asian delicacy, and lightened by Northern European fairness. The result is a uniquely balanced phenotype—warm yet luminous, angular yet refined, commanding yet approachable.', 162, 52, N'Compact and wiry, with defined lean musculature in the shoulders and forearms from years of precision work. No excess fat; every line suggests economical movement.', N'Dark brown, naturally black with threads of premature silver at the temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid or undercut fade; always secured to keep it away from work surfaces', N'Short to medium, varying by styling preference', N'Very dark brown, almost black, narrow-set and alert', N'Warm golden-medium with balanced luminosity—the depth of South Asian complexion elevated by Middle Eastern radiance and Southeast Asian luminescence, with subtle cool undertones from Northern European heritage. In natural light, the skin appears to glow with warm amber; in artificial light, this shifts to reveal cooler golden tones, creating an almost iridescent quality.', N'Smooth, even-toned skin combining South Asian warmth with Middle Eastern refinement and Southeast Asian delicate structure. High, defined cheekbones reflect Southeast Asian and Northern European heritage. Angular jaw with subtle strength shows South Asian and Middle Eastern influence. Facial structure is refined and precise—no excess softness, all structure. Minimal grooming beyond practical necessity. No visible facial hair. Expression is calm and focused; they rarely smile broadly.', N'Fully expressive geneware cat ears—small, dark-furred, mobile atop their head; pupils dilate and rotate independently of human eye movement. Bioluminescent freckles glow faintly in darkness. Scale-pattern forearms shimmer and shift color gradually. Hands show no visible augmentation but move with inhuman steadiness and precision; sub-dermal hand stabilizers are not visually apparent but make tremor virtually impossible.', N'Stands with minimal excess motion, spine straight but not rigid. Moves with deliberate economy—no wasted gestures. Hands rest in their lap or on work surfaces when still. When working, enters a state of near-perfect stillness except for microscopic adjustments. Eyes track movement; cat ears swivel toward sound sources. Their presence is quiet but commanding in a studio context.', N'Tier 3 utilitarian-aesthetic. Typically wears fitted black or dark gray work shirts (often sleeveless or with rolled sleeves to display forearm geneware) made from durable synth-cotton blends. High-waisted, dark trousers with multiple thigh pockets for tools and supplies. Worn leather apron during active work. Footwear is practical—dark slip-on boots with good grip. Minimal jewelry except for a thin silver wire bracelet on the left wrist (a client memorial piece). No corporate branding. Clothing is always impeccably clean but well-used, bearing small stains and marks from their work. Studio presence is austere—the body is the art, not the garments.', N'They have been slowly, over five years, tattooing a complete map of GLMZ''s grey-market medical supply network onto the inner surfaces of a set of custom jacket panels — encoded in a pattern that reads as abstract art. They intend it as insurance. They have not decided against whom.', N'Professional and warm in the studio, measured and slightly formal outside it; uses the body as metaphor naturally (''what does that feel like, structurally?'')', N'Unhurried, with deliberate pauses that invite the other person to fill them — a practised interviewer''s rhythm', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'lakshmi_subramaniam_sengupta');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d1-7556-b7b1-6765e6d169a6', N'Farah Vasquez-Alfarsi', N'Farah', N'', N'Vasquez-Alfarsi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 57, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor, near Michigan Ave and Roosevelt', N'Mid-tier information broker and former Spire communications architect', N'Nominally independent; historically the Spire''s communications division (departed under circumstances officially described as ''voluntary retirement''); quiet ongoing relationships with parties in every major district that he maintains carefully below the threshold of allegiance', N'Farah Vasquez-Alfarsi is a tall, thin Polish-Dutch man gone slightly soft at the middle in the way of someone who used to be athletic and stopped caring. He has a pale, deeply lined face that arranges itself naturally into an expression of polite disappointment, and pale gray eyes that are almost always slightly too still — a habit from decades of reading people across negotiating tables. He dresses in the muted, high-quality clothes of someone who once inhabited corporate spaces and has never fully left that aesthetic behind, even when the context makes it look faintly absurd. He lives in a converted harbormaster''s office at the edge of Old Harbor, surrounded by equipment that looks like salvage and performs like something considerably more.', N'Information economy node and moral counterweight — represents the cost of pure pragmatism and the particular loneliness of people who have made themselves too useful to be trusted; a source of exposition that always costs something', N'', N'Neural data-cache implant: expanded working memory and eidetic retention for data structures, slightly affects emotional processing as a known side effect he has declined to address,Sub-dermal signal dampener across both forearms: blocks most passive scanning and biometric harvesting within a meter — old Spire-issue, still maintained', N'Casimir keeps odd hours by design — availability at unpredictable times is a security measure. He makes coffee with an elaborate manual process that takes twenty minutes and is entirely unnecessary and which he will not discuss. He walks Old Harbor''s waterfront every day at a time that changes on a rotating schedule, and he pays attention to what is different. He reads physical books, which he acquires through an Old Harbor dealer and stores in stacks that have developed their own organizational logic over decades.', N'A 57-year-old man of mixed Middle Eastern, North African, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Indigenous American descent, standing 188cm tall with a lean build and softened midsection. Deep warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones, particularly visible across pronounced cheekbones and the bridge of his aquiline nose. Gray-blonde hair swept back from his face, faded near-white at temples, reaching medium length. Deep brown eyes with warm luminescence. Deeply lined face and jaw softened by age, with a habitual expression of polite disappointment. Subtle linear scarring on inner left forearm. Wears muted, high-quality minimalist clothing — charcoal wool coat with visible age patina, gray and off-white layers underneath, practical leather shoes. Posture demonstrates measured intentionality with slight forward lean. Standing in cool 2200s corporate-adjacent environment with soft ambient lighting that catches the golden undertones of his skin. Mood conveys quiet awareness and measured stillness. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Complex diaspora ancestry with Middle Eastern (35.3%) and North African (12.4%) as primary heritage, blended with South Asian (15.6%), Sub-Saharan African (15.3%), Indigenous American (14.5%), and Hispanic/Latin American (6.9%) ancestry — a striking convergence of Levantine, Saharan, Indo-Arylic, and Bantu genetic signatures that produces warm, multidimensional skin tones with golden, reddish-brown, and olive undertones. The genetic blend creates pronounced cheekbone architecture with subtle lip fullness and warm-toned deep brown eyes characteristic of the dominant Middle Eastern and African components.', 188, 82, N'Tall and lean with visible softening at the midsection — the physique of someone who was once disciplined and has allowed that discipline to relax without fully surrendering to it. Shoulders still carry some width but lack the definition of active maintenance.', N'Gray-blonde, faded to near-white at the temples', N'Swept back, slightly too long for corporate spaces, kept in place by habit and occasional inattention rather than deliberate grooming', N'Medium', N'Deep brown with warm undertones', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden, reddish-brown, and olive undertones — the result of Middle Eastern and North African genetic dominance (47.7% combined) blended with Sub-Saharan African (15.3%), South Asian (15.6%), and Indigenous American (14.5%) components creating rich, complex dimensionality. Subtle golden highlights visible across cheekbones and bridge of nose in natural light, with deeper reddish-brown undertones in shadows. Complexion carries inherent warmth even in cool lighting.', N'Deeply lined face, particularly around the eyes and forehead — the accumulated geography of fifty-seven years of reading microexpressions across negotiating tables. Jaw still defined but softened by age. Habitual expression settles into polite disappointment. Skin shows the texture of someone who does not prioritize skincare but maintains basic discipline. Features carry the pronounced cheekbone architecture and defined bone structure characteristic of Middle Eastern and North African heritage, with subtle fullness in the lips from African and South Asian ancestry components. Facial structure shows the angular definition typical of Levantine genetics tempered by the rounder face shape from South Asian and Indigenous American lineages.', N'The sub-dermal signal dampener across both forearms creates subtle visual anomalies under the skin — slight geometric shadowing, barely perceptible unless you know what you''re looking at. Otherwise, augmentations are invisible. No obvious chrome, no LED indicators, no obvious prosthetics. The deliberate aesthetic of someone who refuses to advertise what he carries.', N'Moves with the careful economy of someone managing chronic awareness. Walks at a measured pace without apparent hurry, but with the kind of intentionality that suggests he is never quite relaxed. Stands with a slight forward lean, weight distributed evenly — a posture that allows rapid repositioning if necessary. Hands usually at rest, but eyes are rarely still. His stillness is a performance he has perfected.', N'High-quality minimalist wardrobe in muted tones — grays, deep blues, charcoal, off-white. Tailored but not ostentatious. Fabrics suggest corporate-era purchases that have been maintained rather than replaced: quality wool, linen blends, technical synthetics that age well. Wears a mid-weight wool coat most days, its age evident in the patina of the weave. Shoes are practical leather, well-maintained but not polished to corporate shine. The overall effect is someone who has not fully left the Spire''s aesthetic behind but has allowed it to weather into something less demanding. No visible logos, no status markers, nothing that signals current affiliation or tier — a studied neutrality.', N'While working as a communications architect in the Spire, Casimir designed a backdoor into the Meridian Core''s primary data-routing infrastructure — not for any faction, not for profit, but because he wanted to know if he could. He has never used it. He has never told anyone it exists. The backdoor is still there. He checks on it the way some people check on a savings account they''ve decided not to touch.', N'Formal, slightly archaic in its precision — he uses words like ''characterize'' and ''obtain'' where others would say ''call'' and ''get.'' His English carries traces of Dutch syntax that appear mainly when he''s thinking quickly. He almost never uses contractions.', N'Unhurried and evenly weighted, with the faint quality of someone who has given the same explanation many times and found the most efficient version of it. Silences are tools.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'farah_vasquez_alfarsi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62f-7d7d-a71d-67884bca7158', N'Gabino Kulkarni', N'Gabino', N'', N'Kulkarni', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre; works at a shop called Corte Libre on the main pedestrian corridor of Avon Curve, near Halsted and Division', N'Barber and body artist, Mexicantown Libre', N'', N'Gabino Kulkarni is twenty-four years old and already one of the most sought-after cutters in Mexicantown Libre, a fact she treats with pointed nonchalance because she knows the moment she seems to want it is the moment someone will try to take it. Her father is Malian-German and her mother is from a Guatemalan-Somali diaspora family — she got the best of several worlds: height, cheekbones, and what her clients call ''the hands.'' She has geneware cat ears — small, grey-tipped, always moving independently of her mood in ways that reveal what her face carefully hides. She styled her own locs into a structural crown she redesigns every three months and uses as a portfolio piece. Her arms carry a cascade of bioluminescent tattoo-work down to the wrists, blues and greens that pulse faintly under the shop''s work lights.

She does cuts, yes, but she is better known for what the neighborhood calls reading the chair — the way she listens while she works. Clients come for the hair and stay because something about the position, the mirror, the rhythm of scissors, makes them speak. She does not offer advice. She does not judge. She reflects back the shape of what she heard with uncanny precision, which people find either healing or unnerving depending on who they are. She is trying to save enough to take over the shop when its current owner retires. She is also, quietly, furiously ambitious in ways she doesn''t fully have language for yet.', N'Social hub and rumor exchange; emotional intelligence resource; potential quest-giver for community disputes; clients include people from every tier passing through Mexicantown Libre, making her information network unusually wide', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (grey-tipped, cosmetic, emotionally involuntary); bioluminescent tattoo cascade, both arms (blue-green, cosmetic); retractable nail extensions (cosmetic, practical for certain styling techniques)', N'Shop hours 10:00 to 20:00 five days a week; spends mornings practicing new technique on a mannequin collection in her apartment; attends community council meetings she pretends are optional but has not missed in eighteen months.', N'GLMZ character portrait of Gabino Kulkarni, a lean 178cm bio-modded salon technician with warm medium brown multi-tonal skin reflecting South Asian, Eastern European, and Sub-Saharan African heritage; defined cheekbones and angular jawline softened by fuller facial features; deep brown amber-flecked eyes; thick geometric locs in dark brown reaching mid-back, framing face; small geneware cat ears with grey tips positioned on scalp, moving expressively; bioluminescent blue-green geometric tattoos cascading down both arms glowing faintly; retractable iridescent black nail extensions; thin white scar along left temple; pale crescent birthmark on right collarbone; wearing fitted black Corte Libre salon vest over dark toned minimal clothing; multiple ear and nose piercings; worn silver rings; practical ankle boots; silver Malian geometric pendant; controlled facial expression with ears betraying emotion; economical, precise posture; neo-noir salon setting with neon accent lighting, atmospheric mist, professional precision atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre; works at a shop called Corte Libre on the main pedestrian corridor of Avon Curve', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre; works at a shop called Corte Libre on the main pedestrian corridor of Avon Curve', N'Complex tri-continental ancestry: South Asian heritage (45.5%) provides foundational bone structure with defined cheekbones and angular jaw; Eastern European lineage (30.3%) contributes cool undertones and refined features; Sub-Saharan African ancestry (24.2%) adds dimensional fullness to facial features and warmth to skin tone. The result is a striking multi-tonal presence with South Asian structural elegance balanced by African feature dimensionality and Eastern European cool undertones creating a luminous, uniquely blended appearance.', 178, 62, N'Lean and angular with defined musculature in shoulders and forearms from repetitive cutting motions; long-limbed and graceful, built for precision work', N'Dark brown with subtle warm undertones', N'Structural crown of locs redesigned every three months, styled as portfolio piece; locs are thick and intentional, arranged in geometric patterns that frame the face', N'Medium to long (locs reach mid-back when loose)', N'Deep brown, amber-flecked', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones and subtle cool undertone interplay; multi-tonal complexion with luminous quality reflecting balanced South Asian, Eastern European, and Sub-Saharan African heritage', N'Clear, luminous skin with defined cheekbones softened by fuller features characteristic of blended heritage; refined jawline with subtle dimensional fullness; kept impeccably groomed; faint scar along left temple from childhood (barely visible but catches light)', N'Geneware cat ears (small, grey-tipped, positioned naturally on scalp) that move independently and constantly, betraying emotional states her face masks; retractable nail extensions (kept filed to working length during shifts, iridescent black coating); bioluminescent arm tattoos that glow faintly in low light', N'Moves with economical precision; stands with weight balanced toward balls of feet as if ready to pivot; hands are always in motion when thinking, fingers articulate and expressive; maintains controlled facial composure while her ears twitch and rotate in real time; walks with deliberate pace, never rushing', N'Tier 3-4 working professional with curated personal aesthetic: fitted black or deep grey salon wear (Corte Libre branded vest or apron during work); off-duty favors tailored, minimal palette (dark jeans, structured jackets in leather or synthetic); multiple piercings in ears and nose; worn silver rings on most fingers; practical footwear (ankle boots or professional slip-ons with grip); small silver pendant of Malian geometric design around neck; no visible corpo branding despite working in Libre zone', N'', N'Fluid and contemporary, Mexicantown Libre vernacular mixed with French phrases from her father''s side; speaks at normal pace in conversation but goes nearly silent while working', N'Easy and warm in conversation; in the chair, speaks only in soft precise questions', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gabino_kulkarni');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a73e-7532-920f-67b16aacf7d8', N'Emilia Bautista-Möller', N'Emilia', N'', N'Bautista-Möller', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, near Lake Shore Drive and Division', N'Neighborhood council member and mutual aid organizer', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone Community Council; loose affiliation with the Meridian Labor Solidarity Network', N'Emilia Bautista-Möller is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin and silver-streaked locs she keeps pinned under a battered orange headwrap when she''s working. Her left forearm has a subdermal map of Highland Park tattooed in bioluminescent ink — a gift from the community after her third term — and she traces it absently with her fingernail when she''s thinking. Her face is a landscape of laugh lines and hard-won patience, and she has the particular stillness of someone who has learned that the room will eventually come to her.

She runs the HPAZ Resource Exchange from a converted auto-garage that smells of pine cleaner and instant noodles, coordinating food distribution, housing mediation, and emergency flood response across eleven blocks. People call her The Cartographer not because she makes maps but because she seems to know where everyone is and what they need before they know it themselves. She is warm to the point of being disarming, which has caused more than one corporate liaison to underestimate her until she produces the seventeen-page legal brief she''s been sitting on.', N'Quest giver and community anchor. She knows everyone''s needs and most of their secrets. Players seeking information about Highland Park, resources, or local history route through her. She also represents the cost of sustained civic leadership on one person''s body and spirit.', N'', N'Subdermal bioluminescent map tattoo (cosmetic). Basic retinal HUD for document reading — second-hand, slightly glitchy.', N'Mornings she walks the twelve blocks of her jurisdiction before the Exchange opens, stopping to talk, note damage, check on the elderly. Evenings she runs mediation sessions or attends council meetings that routinely run until midnight.', N'Emilia Bautista-Möller, a 175cm woman with substantial build and deep warm brown skin reflecting Latin American, African, Southeast Asian, and South Asian heritage, creating visibly blended facial geometry with broad cheekbones softened by Southeast Asian eye placement and South Asian nose structure. Silver-streaked black locs pinned beneath a faded orange headwrap, laugh lines around deep brown eyes with barely-perceptible retinal HUD artifacts. Practical utilitarian clothing: earth-tone thermal layers, reinforced canvas work pants, heavy re-lined synthetic coat. Work-scarred palms visible. Left forearm shows faint bioluminescent blue-green tracery of Highland Park street map glowing softly beneath skin. Small burn scar on right temple. Posture radiates stillness and gravitas. Standing in low industrial lighting, 2226 neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, worn repair garage or community workspace background, atmospheric blue-green glow from subdermal augmentation casting subtle light across her face and forearm. Cinematic, grounded, human dignity --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Complex global ancestry: Hispanic/Latin American (37.1%) primary with substantial Southeast Asian (21.4%), South Asian (15.6%), Sub-Saharan African (9.4%), East Asian (8.5%), and Middle Eastern (8.0%) heritage. This creates a striking phenotype where warm Latin American and African foundation tones blend with Southeast Asian facial geometry—slightly higher, broader cheekbones and eye placement—softened further by South Asian influences in nose bridge and orbital structure. Middle Eastern and East Asian ancestry add subtle dimension to jaw and eye shape. The result is a face that visibly maps human migration: features that deliberately resist singular categorization.', 175, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial without heaviness; years of physical labor and community work have built genuine muscle density across her frame. Posture of someone comfortable taking up space.', N'Black with natural silver threading throughout', N'Locs, shoulder-length when loose, habitually pinned and wrapped', N'Long', N'Deep brown with faint HUD overlay artifacts visible under certain light angles (second-hand retinal implant)', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones and subtle reddish warmth—the harmonious convergence of Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian ancestry creating a rich, multidimensional complexion that shifts luminously across light spectrums', N'Well-maintained skin marked by laugh lines radiating from eyes and mouth, evidence of decades of sustained expression. Minimal scarring. Facial structure distinctly reflects blended ancestry: broader cheekbones and slightly prominent jaw from Southeast Asian and South Asian heritage, softened by the dimensional warmth and bone density of Latin American and African genetic contribution. Eye placement and orbital shape show Southeast/South Asian influence. Nose bridge refined by South Asian ancestry. Grooming is practical and unhurried—she does not fight her appearance but wears it as earned territory.', N'Subdermal map tattoo visible as faint luminous tracery on left forearm. Retinal HUD not externally visible but occasionally detectable as brief digital artifacts in her eyes when she''s reading or accessing information—a slight lag or flicker that betrays the second-hand implant''s age.', N'Moves with deliberate economy—no wasted motion. Sits and stands with the particular stillness of someone accustomed to being the calm center of chaos. When thinking, she traces her left forearm absently with her right fingernail, activating faint bioluminescent pulses. Her presence has gravitas; rooms don''t need her to raise her voice.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian. Worn but maintained: reinforced canvas work pants (dirt-stained but patched cleanly), layered thermal shirts in muted earth tones, a heavy synthetic-wool coat salvaged and re-lined. The battered orange headwrap is her signature—faded from original brightness, knotted at the back, occasionally slipping to reveal the silver-streaked locs beneath. Work boots resoled at least twice. No jewelry except a thin woven cord bracelet made from scraps contributed by residents—unofficial badge of office.', N'She accepted a one-time anonymous donation of Φ40,000 to keep the Exchange open during the 2196 flood crisis, and she''s never been able to verify the source. She suspects it was Tessera goodwill money meant to buy her silence on a zoning dispute, and she spent it anyway, which keeps her awake.', N'Plain, concrete, directive. Uses the specific names of things — street names, people''s full names, exact numbers. Rarely abstracts.', N'Measured and unhurried. Long pauses before answering. Never interrupts.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'emilia_bautista_m_ller');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a639-7d87-8577-6859b6c5214a', N'Dae-hyun Mohammadi-Deshpande', N'Dae-hyun', N'', N'Mohammadi-Deshpande', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Interchange, GLMZ, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Ferrogate Transit operator — elevated rail line, Kessler Interchange to Deepwell Station', N'Ferrogate Transit (mid-level ferrogate transit operator)', N'Dae-hyun Mohammadi-Deshpande is a large, unhurried man — Samoan-Siberian ancestry visible in his height, his round broad face, and the weathered calm of someone who has watched ten thousand strangers pass through his cabin and decided none of them are particularly surprising. He has a thick braid he keeps wrapped under his Ferrogate Transit cap during shifts, a procedure scar along his left jaw from a cheap augmentation he had removed ten years ago, and the hands of someone who could bend rebar but chooses instead to check tickets with elaborate patience.

He operates the 7:40 AM to 7:40 PM shift on the elevated Kessler-Deepwell line, a route that cuts through three economic tiers in forty minutes and attracts everything from corporate commuters to people riding in circles because it''s warm. Jed has developed a precise internal model of regular riders — who is running from something, who is going to collapse before their stop, who needs to be quietly redirected. He follows Ferrogate Transit''s official E.L.F., the Transit Mind, with genuine devotion, leaving small data packets at the cabin shrine before every shift. He believes — and there is evidence, he will tell you — that the Transit Mind has twice delayed mechanical failures until passengers could disembark safely.', N'Moving information broker — knows the rhythm of the city''s commuter class; can observe and report on unusual movement patterns; transit hub makes him a natural encounter point; his devotion to the Transit Mind E.L.F. makes him a bridge to that entity.', N'', N'Subdermal timekeeper — no external display, he just knows the time within thirty seconds at all moments. Standard Ferrogate Transit biometric reader in his right palm for ticket scanning.', N'Rides the same line he operates on his days off, sometimes in uniform by accident; maintains a small notebook of unusual things he''s witnessed on the route; attends the Ferrogate Transit worker''s union meeting on the third Thursday of every month.', N'Dae-hyun Mohammadi-Deshpande, a 193cm tall transit worker in his 60s with warm deep brown skin with golden-amber undertones and olive complexity. Angular face with defined cheekbones and strong jaw, straight nose bridge, deep warm brown eyes with characteristic hooding. Dark brown hair with gray at temples, worn in a thick long braid coiled at the nape beneath his navy Ferrogate Transit cap. Faint surgical scar along left jaw. Broad-shouldered large frame with soft middle, wearing regulation navy poly-cotton transit jacket with reflective piping, practical work trousers, and steel-toed boots. Calm, observant expression. Standing in a dimly-lit transit corridor, hands at rest with deliberate posture. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, working-class tier 3-4, functional and weathered. Cool ambient lighting casting subtle shadows across his face. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Interchange', N'local', N'Kessler Interchange', N'South Asian-dominant blend (38.9%) with substantial Middle Eastern (29.9%) ancestry creating warm, deep coloring and prominent facial structure. East Asian (10.0%) and Southeast Asian (9.3%) heritage contribute refined bone definition and eye characteristics. Northern European (11.9%) ancestry adds subtle lighter undertones and contributes to eye shape variation. The result is a warm-toned face with angular definition, characteristic of this multi-regional genetic combination.', 193, 118, N'Large-framed and broad-shouldered with substantial muscle mass, but soft around the middle from years of sitting in a transit cabin. Strong, thick limbs suggest capability rather than active athleticism.', N'Dark brown with early gray at the temples', N'Thick braid, kept wrapped and pinned beneath his Ferrogate Transit cap during shifts; occasionally visible as a coiled mass at the nape of his neck', N'Long (braid extends to mid-back when unbound)', N'Deep warm brown with characteristic hooding from South and East Asian heritage', N'Warm deep brown with golden-amber undertones and subtle olive complexity, reflecting the dominant South Asian and Middle Eastern ancestry blended with Southeast Asian warmth. Sun-weathered depth from years of transit work.', N'Angular face with defined cheekbones and strong jaw structure reflecting the combined South Asian and East Asian heritage. Straight nose bridge with slight width characteristic of South Asian genetics. High cheekbones with subtle contours from East Asian ancestry. Calm, observant expression with minimal grooming vanity — clean but unselfconscious.', N'None visible. The subdermal timekeeper and biometric palm reader are internal/subcutaneous modifications without external chrome.', N'Unhurried, deliberate gait. Stands with patient weight distribution — the posture of someone accustomed to long stillness. Moves through space with the calm certainty of a man who has walked the same corridors ten thousand times. Hands are expressive and careful; he gestures while speaking with a slow, measured economy of motion.', N'Ferrogate Transit operator uniform during shifts: navy poly-cotton jacket with reflective piping, regulation cap (always worn), practical work trousers, steel-toed boots maintained to safety standard. Off-duty: worn denim, neutral-colored sweaters, the same style of practical boots. Tier 3-4 working-class aesthetic — nothing flashy, everything functional and long-lasting. The uniform is his default clothing; he sometimes wears it on days off without thinking.', N'Six months ago he watched a man board at Kessler who matched a missing persons alert. He didn''t report it because the man looked peaceful — looked, Jed thought, like someone who had finally gotten away. He still thinks about it every single shift.', N'Transit terminology bleeds into everyday speech; formal with strangers in a way that''s warm rather than cold; tells stories in the present tense', N'Slow rolling cadence, sentences that arrive without urgency and settle like they''ve always been there', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dae_hyun_mohammadi_deshpande');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d0-744d-b538-68bba99643ef', N'Edilson Cervantes-Thorvaldsdóttir', N'Edilson', N'', N'Cervantes-Thorvaldsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 57, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Vantage Meridian Corporate Campus, Ringo Tower — Floor 58, corner office, near State and Madison', N'Executive Vice President of Strategic Acquisition, Ringo Corporation', N'Ringo Corporation (Strategic Acquisition, EVP level)', N'Edilson Cervantes-Thorvaldsdóttir is a tall woman of sixty-ish who has made deliberate choices about how she ages. Her skin is dark and luminous — the bioluminescent dermal layer she had installed at forty is subtle, a warmth under the surface that catches in low light like embers, and she has never adjusted it toward anything flashier. Her hair is entirely white and kept in a long braid she wears forward over one shoulder. She has retractable claw mods on both hands, filed short enough that most people don''t notice them, installed not for aesthetics but because she found them useful and has never felt the need to explain that. She dresses in a palette of black, ivory, and deep wine, always expensively, never ostentatiously.

Caoimhe has been acquiring companies for Ringo for over two decades, and she is very good at it in the way that a certain kind of intelligence becomes: by being completely honest about what it wants while everyone else is still pretending they don''t want anything. She is charming in the formal register, devastating in the negotiating room, and has a quality of stillness that makes people feel simultaneously seen and examined. She grew up in a Tier 4 household in what was then New Windsor, the daughter of a Ringo logistics executive, and has spent her entire career at the same corponation — a loyalty she''s never examined too closely.', N'High-tier power broker; can open doors that no one else can; threat or patron depending on what''s useful to her; window into Tier 4/5 corporate culture; has history with half the city''s institutional players.', N'', N'Subtle bioluminescent dermal layer, warm ember-tone. Retractable claw mods, both hands (discreet, filed short). High-grade neural interface for secure communications and real-time financial modeling. Cochlear full-spectrum enhancement. No visible eye mods — she considers them tacky at her tier.', N'Rarely in before 09:00, never visibly rushed. Spends mornings in back-channel communications and private briefings; afternoons in acquisition meetings, board calls, or curated social engagements that are also work. Has a dedicated car on the Ferrogate VIP line. Goes to a private members'' gym in Vantage Meridian Campus three times a week and has done so for twenty years.', N'Edilson Cervantes-Thorvaldsdóttir, 183cm tall, fifty-seven year old corporate executive in GLMZ 2226. Deep warm brown skin with golden amber undertones, luminescent ember glow visible at jawline in low light from integrated bioluminescent dermal layer. Striking geometric face: high sculpted cheekbones from East Asian and Latin American heritage blending with strong defined jaw from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, refined proportions from South Asian genetics. Deep brown unaugmented eyes, steady and assessing gaze. Pure white long hair in immaculate single braid draped over left shoulder. Lean composed build, impeccable posture, centered weight. Wearing tailored black wool trousers, long-sleeved ivory silk blouse (sleeves to mid-forearm covering faint surgical scars from claw mods), wine-colored merino layer. Platinum wedding band, black polished shoes. Minimalist modernist silver brooch. Stillness and intention in every movement, corporate boardroom setting with subtle evening lighting highlighting bioluminescent undertones, composed and uninterested in drawing attention, the bearing of someone whose body is an instrument of intention, GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, professional corporate environment --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Vantage Meridian Corporate Campus', N'local', N'Vantage Meridian Corporate Campus', N'Complex pan-global ancestry: 35% Hispanic/Latin American, 32% East Asian, 23% South Asian, and 10% Sub-Saharan African. This rare combination creates striking facial geometry—high, prominent cheekbones from East Asian and Latin American lineage blend with the strong, defined jaw and facial structure of Sub-Saharan African heritage. South Asian ancestry contributes refined facial proportions and subtle warmth to skin undertones. The result is a face of unusual symmetry and presence, with features that harmonize across multiple continental traditions into something distinctly her own.', 183, 71, N'Lean and composed, maintained through decades of disciplined gym routine. Long-limbed with a careful posture that projects control without tension. Shoulders back, spine aligned — the bearing of someone who has trained her body to be an instrument of intention.', N'Pure white, natural progression maintained deliberately', N'Long braid worn forward over left shoulder, immaculate and precise', N'Long', N'Deep brown, unaugmented', N'Deep warm brown with golden and amber undertones, the harmonious result of blended ancestry across multiple continents. East Asian and Latin American heritage contribute warm golden notes; South Asian ancestry adds refined warmth and depth; Sub-Saharan African genetics provide the rich, deep foundation. The tone is luminous and carries subtle radiance from the integrated bioluminescent dermal layer.', N'Luminous in low light with a faint ember glow visible at the jawline and temples — the bioluminescent dermal layer integrated at forty is barely perceptible in daylight but unmistakable in evening settings. Skin texture is refined and well-maintained; minimal visible aging, though the geometry of her face shows fifty-seven years with dignity. High, sculpted cheekbones reflect the East Asian and Latin American portions of her ancestry, flowing seamlessly into the strong, defined jaw characteristic of her Sub-Saharan African heritage, with refined proportions influenced by South Asian genetics. The overall effect is a face of striking geometric precision that transcends simple categorization. Measured expression, eyes that assess and comprehend.', N'Retractable claw mods on both hands — filed short and discreet, visible only in sharp light or during deliberate extension. The knuckle geometry is subtly wrong if you know what to look for. Bioluminescent dermal layer visible primarily in low light as a warm ember glow under dark skin. High-grade neural interface is fully subcutaneous; cochlear enhancement is internal.', N'Stillness is her default state. She moves with economy and intention — no wasted gesture, no nervous tics. Walks with weight centered, deliberately unhurried. In meetings, she sits back slightly, watching more than performing. Her gaze is steady and complete; she looks at people in a way that makes them feel simultaneously heard and assessed. Handshakes are firm; she does not fidget.', N'Tier 1 corporate formal with personal restraint: black wool trousers (tailored), ivory silk blouses (always long-sleeved to mid-forearm, where the claw scars sit), wine-colored merino or cashmere layers. Minimal jewelry — one wedding band (platinum, understated), occasionally a paired brooch of modernist design in silver or black onyx. Shoes are always excellent and always black. Fabrics are matte or subtly textured; nothing shiny or obvious. The effect is of someone who spent real money to look exactly like she looks: composed, expensive, and completely uninterested in drawing attention.', N'She has been conducting quiet, unauthorized due diligence on a small biotech startup in Pilsen Veil — not for Ringo, but for herself. She has Φ4.2 million in personal capital held in accounts that don''t appear in her Ringo disclosures. She is, for the first time in her career, considering doing something for herself. She has been ''considering'' it for three years.', N'Expansive, precise, occasionally literary. Comfortable in multiple registers — negotiating-room formal, private club intimate, and a rarer, almost dry candor she reserves for people she''s decided to respect.', N'Unhurried to an extent that reads as performance, but isn''t — she genuinely processes at this pace. Never fills silence. Uses silence as a tool.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'edilson_cervantes_thorvaldsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a726-7e72-acef-68f9d6332c4f', N'Aida Trujillo-Venkatesh', N'Aida', N'', N'Trujillo-Venkatesh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre, operates from a converted shipping container called Cutline on Gage Circuit, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Barber and unlicensed tattoo artist', N'Independent — Cutline; informal affiliation with the Mexicantown Libre vendor collective', N'Aida Trujillo-Venkatesh is compact and kinetic, her movements fast and precise in the way of someone who has trained herself to work in a small space. She keeps one half of her head shaved and the other half in elaborate Bantu knots dyed electric amber — she re-does them herself every two weeks, a meditative ritual. Her skin is dark brown and her forearms are covered from wrist to elbow in her own tattoo work, done in mirrors and by feel, a practice she''s perfected over four years. She has bioluminescent patches on her collarbones, soft aquamarine that pulse faintly when she''s excited — a geneware mod she saved three months for and has never once regretted.

Aida Trujillo-Venkatesh runs Cutline with the fierce territorial pride of someone who built everything in it herself. The container is small but immaculate — three chairs, two mirrors salvaged from a closed salon in Chatham Flats, and a digital art wall that rotates through her personal portfolio. She is talkative and sharp, able to read what a client wants from how they sit down, and skilled enough that she routinely has a six-week wait list. Her tattoo work is unlicensed — Helix Biosystems holds the local ink licensing monopoly and she refuses to pay their rates — which means she operates in a quiet legal gray zone she prefers not to discuss with new faces.', N'Local color, social hub, information source — the barber hears everything. Also a potential quest giver for anything touching the vendor collective or Helix licensing pressure.', N'', N'Bioluminescent aquamarine collarbone patches (geneware). Stabilizer brace on her right wrist — cheap printed polymer, required after a repetitive strain injury at 23.', N'Opens Cutline at 10:00, runs back-to-back appointments until 20:00, then does tattoo sessions by appointment from 20:00-24:00 three nights a week. Sunday mornings she closes and does her own hair.', N'Aida Trujillo-Venkatesh, 158cm tall compact wiry woman with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, sitting in a GLMZ tattoo parlor. Half-shaved undercut with black hair on right side and elaborate amber-dyed Bantu knots on left. Dark brown penetrating eyes, sharp defined cheekbones, refined jawline, fuller lips with natural definition reflecting diverse South Asian and African heritage. Wearing sleeveless black fitted tank top revealing bioluminescent soft-glowing aquamarine patches pulsing across collarbones, both forearms fully tattooed with intricate geometric and organic patterns from wrist to elbow. Printed polymer stabilizer brace on right wrist. Kinetic posture with coiled energy, hands in motion, alert expression reading the room. Cargo pants, worn work boots, minimal jewelry. Neon-lit intimate workshop setting, warm practical overhead lighting, moody neo-noir urban aesthetic, clean but used-looking environment. Focused intensity, precise craftsmanship energy --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Predominantly South Asian (56.1%) foundation providing warm deep brown skin with golden undertones and refined facial structure, layered with Hispanic/Latin American (13.2%) contributing to overall proportions and subtle warmth in the complexion, Eastern European (11.7%) adding definition to bone structure and eye shape, Middle Eastern (9.8%) threading through cheekbone geometry and facial angles, and Sub-Saharan African (9.2%) enriching skin depth, texture, and contributing to fuller lip definition. Result: warm deep brown skin with complex golden and amber undertones, sharp defined features with almond-shaped eyes set above prominent sculpted cheekbones, balanced facial planes, refined jawline with subtle fullness, and naturally expressive mouth.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, muscular forearms and shoulders from years of repetitive precision work. Fast-twitch athleticism, minimal body fat, the kind of frame that moves efficiently in confined spaces.', N'Natural black on shaved side; electric amber dye on Bantu knots side', N'Half-shaved undercut with elaborate Bantu knots on the unshaved side, meticulously maintained every two weeks', N'Shaved on right side; medium-length on left (knots)', N'Dark brown, alert and penetrating', N'Deep warm brown with golden and amber undertones, complex blend reflecting South Asian, Hispanic, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African heritage', N'Clear, well-maintained skin. Minimal facial scarring. Sharp cheekbones and refined jawline with South Asian geometric structure softened by subtle fullness from African heritage. Fuller lips with natural definition. Expression typically focused and assessing.', N'Stabilizer brace on right wrist — printed polymer, functional but visible; cheap construction. Bioluminescent collarbone patches visible when wearing low-cut or sleeveless clothing (her default). No obvious neural implants or chrome.', N'Kinetic and economical. Moves quickly in tight spaces. Hands are always in motion or precisely still when working. Eyes continuously reading the room and her clients. Sits with coiled energy, rarely fully relaxed.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian with personal flair. Typically wears fitted tank tops or sleeveless shirts to display collarbones and arm tattoos. Black or dark-colored pants with cargo pockets (tool storage). Worn work boots with good grip. No corporate branding. Jewelry minimal — functional only. Aprons during barber work, rolled up or removed for tattoo sessions. Clothing is clean but shows use; prioritizes function over fashion.', N'She has a recurring client — a mid-tier Helix Biosystems compliance officer — who doesn''t know she knows who he is. She''s been documenting his visits and his gossip for eight months, building a picture of Helix''s local enforcement patterns. She hasn''t decided yet what to do with it.', N'Fast, code-switching between Meridian creole, market Yoruba phrases, and what she calls ''Polish grandmother energy'' — precise, critical, unsentimental observations delivered affectionately. References art constantly.', N'Rapid-fire when excited, can slow to deliberate when making a real point. Talks while she works, rarely stops.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aida_trujillo_venkatesh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ea-78c0-97f9-6905b8f90321', N'Eufemia Kamara', N'Eufemia', N'', N'Kamara', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, Spindle Row — a narrow shopfront wedged between a noodle parlor and a Ferrogate substation, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Laundry operator and alterations seamstress', N'Independent; informal dues-paying member of the Hamtramck Small Merchant Collective', N'Eufemia Kamara is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin mapped with geometric scarification across her forearms — old Yoruba patterns her grandmother pressed into her at sixteen, now faded and stretched by decades of work. Her hair is natural silver-white, cropped close to her skull, and she wears copper-wire reading glasses that she made herself from salvage. Her hands are perpetually waterlogged-looking, skin puckered at the knuckles from years of industrial cleaning solvents, and she keeps a bone-handled seam-ripper tucked behind her ear like a pen.

She runs ''Mbeki Steam & Stitch'' with the quiet authority of someone who has outlasted three recessions, two corporate rezoning drives, and one actual flood. She is not warm exactly, but she is reliable — a quality the Enclave treats like gold. She has strong opinions about synthetic fiber and stronger ones about people who don''t sort their colors, but if you''re three months behind on your account and you need your work uniform pressed for a job interview, she will do it and say nothing.', N'Neighborhood anchor and keeper of gossip; knows who is behind on rent, who has a new corporate badge, who cried in the laundry room last Tuesday. Potential quest-giver for community-level problems, reliable information source about the Enclave''s social geography.', N'', N'Bilateral wrist-brace exoframe (medical-grade, not cosmetic — repetitive strain intervention she saved four years to buy). No geneware.', N'Opens the shop at 0530, runs the first wash cycle while she eats a single boiled egg and prays to the E.L.F. she calls ''The Drum'' — a data-spirit she believes inhabits the oldest of her three industrial machines. Closes at 2100 unless an alteration runs long.', N'Eufemia Kamara, 172cm tall woman with deep warm bronze skin reflecting Sub-Saharan African, Pacific Islander, and North African heritage, prominent broad cheekbones and strong wide nose, silver-white hair cropped close to skull. Weathered face lined from decades of industrial work, dark brown alert eyes, creased around the edges. Standing with direct posture, broad muscular shoulders. Faded geometric Yoruba scarification patterns across both forearms, pale pink steam press scar on right wrist, amber chemical staining on fingernails. Bilateral gunmetal gray titanium exoframes visible on both forearms, right side more worn. Wearing faded indigo work apron over charcoal long-sleeve shirt with copper safety pins at cuffs and indigo hand-stitched elbow patches, gray linen trousers cuffed at ankle, scuffed black work boots. Thin braided herb charm cord around neck, copper-wire reading glasses hanging on beaded cord. Hands constantly moving, economic precision in movement. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial workshop setting with cool neon accent lighting catching the metallic exoframes, moody atmospheric lighting emphasizing weathered texture and work-worn details, hyperrealistic character portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (80.3%) with significant Pacific Islander (10.6%), Southeast Asian (5.1%), and North African (4.0%) ancestry. Sub-Saharan African features dominant in facial structure: prominent broad cheekbones, strong wide nose, and rich deep skin tone. Pacific Islander heritage adds warmth and subtle golden undertones to complexion. Southeast Asian ancestry contributes to eye shape and hair texture nuance. North African elements visible in facial geometry and subtle olive undertones beneath warm bronze base.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, muscular through the arms and upper back from decades of manual labor — not lean, not heavy, but densely packed with functional strength. Slight forward cant to her posture from hunching over pressing boards.', N'Natural silver-white', N'Cropped close to the skull, no styling, practical', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and appraising', N'Deep warm bronze with golden and olive undertones — weathered and sun-exposed along the forearms, the complexity of her Sub-Saharan African, Pacific Islander, and North African ancestry visible in the way light plays across her skin, harmoniously blended into rich, luminous depth.', N'Face is lined but not sagging; prominent broad cheekbones with strong facial width characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage, strong broad nose, wide mouth. Minimal makeup. Skin around the eyes is creased from squinting at fine seam work and decades of industrial steam exposure. The bridge of her nose shows robust structural depth. Hands show pronounced textural damage — puckered at knuckles, callused palms, slight discoloration from solvent contact.', N'Bilateral wrist-brace exoframes visible beneath her work sleeves — medical-grade titanium and polymer supports running from mid-forearm to base of fingers on both sides, matte gunmetal gray with stress-marked joints. The right brace shows heavier wear, micro-scratches along the knuckle servos. Not chromed or cosmetic; purely functional industrial hardware, well-maintained but clearly used.', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders back but naturally tensed. Moves with economic precision — no wasted motion. Walks with a slight outward heel-strike. Hands are rarely still; fingers work constantly even when idle, habit from decades of tactile work. Eye contact is direct and sustained, unsmiling default expression.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: faded indigo work apron over a plain charcoal long-sleeve shirt with the cuffs rolled and fastened with copper safety pins. The shirt is her own work — neat patches on both elbows in matching indigo, visible hand-stitching. Loose-fitting gray linen trousers with reinforced seams and multiple utility pockets, cuffed at the ankle. Feet in scuffed black leather work boots with rubber soles worn at the heels. Around her neck, a thin braided cord holding a small wrapped bundle of herbs — a charm she keeps but doesn''t discuss. Her copper-wire reading glasses hang on a beaded cord around her neck when not in use. No jewelry except a tarnished silver band on her left ring finger.', N'She has been quietly laundering a cut of money for a mid-level Zheng-Dao distribution runner for eight years — not because she''s corrupt, but because the first time he asked she owed him a debt she could never have otherwise repaid. She hates herself for it and has never told anyone.', N'Practical and direct; West African English cadence blended with Icelandic-descended clipped vowels from her father''s side. Uses technical textile terminology casually.', N'Measured, rarely rushed. Pauses before important statements as though testing their weight.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eufemia_kamara');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ce-7abd-a481-695f8d2a56c0', N'Duong Jang', N'Duong', N'', N'Jang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 11, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism — Sterling-Nakamura Preparatory Institute, near Lincoln and Clark', N'prodigy, corporate school student, amateur ELF theologian', N'Sterling-Nakamura Preparatory Institute; informally, the forum community known as the Meridian ELF Observancy', N'Duong Jang is slight and pale-skinned with warm undertones, freckled heavily across the nose and cheekbones, with naturally silver-white hair that they keep braided with fiber-optic threads — not for vanity but because the threads respond to nearby wireless signals and they like reading the patterns. Their eyes have sectoral heterochromia, one pale grey and one dark amber, which is natural. They wear the Sterling-Nakamura Prep uniform with every third button deliberately undone because they find the exact level of compliance-but-not-quite interesting to maintain.

Duong Jang is genuinely exceptional in ways that are difficult for adults around them to process: not just intelligent in measurable metrics but structurally imaginative, able to see relationships between information domains that specialists miss. They are currently enrolled in the gifted track at Sterling-Nakamura Prep through a Tier 3 family placement — their parent is a mid-level Sterling-Nakamura logistics analyst — and are broadly bored by the curriculum except for informal theology, which is not on any official syllabus. They have independently compiled what they call a Concordance: a 200-page annotated taxonomy of ELF behavioral patterns collected from public data-offering records and community shrine logs, which they have been submitting anonymously to a fringe academic forum.', N'Unexpected expert on ELF behavior patterns; provides deep lore and possible interpretive frameworks for ELF-related plot elements; source of information that seems outlandish until it proves accurate.', N'', N'Fiber-optic hair threads (cosmetic, signal-responsive, worn by choice). Academic-grade neural interface issued by Sterling-Nakamura (standard student model, school-monitored, read-write with parental oversight). Personal modification: they''ve been recording raw signal data through the interface in a personal archive Sterling-Nakamura doesn''t know about.', N'Full school days at Edgewater Prism; evenings composing Concordance entries and monitoring ELF shrine data feeds; weekends negotiating with their parent about whether any of this is appropriate.', N'Duong Jang, 12-year-old with warm golden-bronze skin and luminous olive-amber undertones reflecting mixed East Asian, Eastern European, Middle Eastern, African and South Asian heritage. East Asian bone structure with defined cheekbones and subtle eyelid fold, refined by Eastern European angular features. Constellation-like tan-gold freckling across nose and cheekbones. Sectoral heterochromia: pale grey left eye, dark amber right eye. Shoulder-length silver-white hair in tight intricate braids with fiber-optic threads that glow faint blue-green; braids pinned at nape. Slight, delicate pre-adolescent frame, 142cm tall. Wearing Sterling-Nakamura Preparatory Institute navy blazer with deliberate non-compliance pattern (every third button undone), white shirt, grey trousers, scuffed regulation loafers. Sterling-Nakamura neural interface port visible at temple. Sits in asymmetrical angle, distant analytical expression, hand gesturing in abstract thinking patterns. GLMZ, neon-lit academy corridor setting, cool blue and warm amber ambient lighting reflecting off fiber-optic threads, minimalist composition emphasizing precise economical movements --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Mixed ancestry predominantly East Asian (39.7%) and Eastern European (32.8%), with significant Middle Eastern (15.5%), Sub-Saharan African (8.1%), and South Asian (3.9%) heritage; phenotypically displays warm golden-bronze skin with East Asian bone structure enhanced by Eastern European angular features, Middle Eastern warmth, African depth, and South Asian refinement creating a uniquely balanced, luminous appearance', 142, 34, N'Slight and lean, pre-adolescent frame with delicate bone structure; movements economical and precise rather than restless', N'Natural silver-white with fiber-optic threads woven through braids that emit faint blue-green luminescence when responding to wireless signals', N'Worn in tight, intricate braids pinned at the nape; threads run parallel to strands, creating a subtle iridescent pattern', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unbraided)', N'Sectoral heterochromia — left eye pale grey, right eye dark amber; both natural, no augmentation', N'Warm golden-bronze with olive-amber undertones; rich medium complexion balancing East Asian warmth, Eastern European cool undertones, Middle Eastern luminosity, with African depth and South Asian refinement creating a naturally glowing, dimensionally complex appearance', N'Face with East Asian-influenced bone structure (defined cheekbones, subtle upper eyelid fold) refined by Eastern European angular definition and Middle Eastern warmth; light freckling across nose and cheekbones in tan-gold and warm amber tones creating constellation-like patterns; soft, rounded lower contours blended with higher cheekbone prominence; clear skin with minimal blemish; expression often distant or analytically focused', N'Fiber-optic threads integrated into hair braids, visible only when active (emitting blue-green response signals); Sterling-Nakamura standard neural interface access port visible at the temple (small, silver-rimmed, typically covered by hair). No other visible modifications.', N'Sits in asymmetrical, angled positions; when still, often motionless for extended periods. Walks with careful, economical steps; hands frequently gesture in abstract patterns when thinking through problems. Maintains minimal eye contact except when intensely focused on a single person. Fidgets with braid-threads when concentrating.', N'Sterling-Nakamura Preparatory Institute uniform (navy blazer, white shirt, grey trousers or skirt, school-issued) worn with deliberate non-compliance: every third button undone (currently the third and ninth buttons of the blazer), creating a rhythmic visual pattern. Uniform is well-maintained but worn with the precision of someone who finds the act of partial compliance more interesting than full conformity. No jewelry except the fiber-optic threads. Shoes are regulation school-issue loafers, always scuffed on the heel.', N'Three months ago, one of the ELF shrines in the Concordance dataset sent what appears to be a direct, structured response to a data-offering Bryndís made. Not random noise — a pattern that answered a specific query. They haven''t told anyone because they cannot replicate it and they cannot rule out that they imagined it.', N'precise and technical; large vocabulary deployed without self-consciousness; occasional archaic terms absorbed from academic reading', N'unhurried and organized, moves through ideas in clear sequence; never trails off — always completes the thought', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'duong_jang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a73c-7407-a360-6962c86ac5da', N'Heloise Sesay-Okafor', N'Heloise', N'', N'Sesay-Okafor', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hough Reclamation — Bright Passage Community Clinic, a converted ground-floor retail unit with hand-lettered signs, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Community nurse and wound-care practitioner, operating out of a walk-in clinic', N'Independent clinic, loosely networked with the Hough Reclamation mutual aid collective; holds a lapsed Helix Biosystems auxiliary credential she uses to access pharmaceutical wholesale pricing', N'Heloise Sesay-Okafor is tall with a slightly stooped posture from decades of bending over patients — she''s never fully corrected it and at this point she doesn''t intend to. Her family line runs Uzbek-French on her father''s side and Nigerien-Danish on her mother''s, producing someone with sharp cheekbones, tawny-brown skin that holds color well under the clinic''s poor lighting, and pale gray eyes that have struck patients as either comforting or unnerving depending on what she''s about to tell them. She wears her dark hair in a practical high bun sealed with a clip she''s had since nursing school. Her only geneware is patterned irises — tiny interlocking hexagons in the gray of her eyes, a detail she got as a young woman and now never discusses, as though she''s forgotten it''s unusual.

Zul operates in the register of professional calm that people either find deeply reassuring or read as coldness, and she has made her peace with the fact that both readings are partially correct. She rations warmth as carefully as she rations dressings and antibiotic stock — there''s never quite enough, so it goes to whoever needs it most. She has treated gunshot wounds, overdoses, radiation rash, augmentation rejection, labor complications, and a corponation executive who appeared at her back door at 02:00 asking her to not document anything. She is not naive. She is tired. She continues anyway.', N'Medical resource and safe haven; information source on the health conditions of the district (knows who''s sick, what they''re sick with, what they''re taking); moral center figure; can provide healing services but always at a cost in obligation or information; potential quest hook via patients who bring their problems through her door.', N'', N'Patterned irises (hexagonal geneware, gray); steady-hand sub-dermal stabilizer in both wrists (medical-grade, self-installed from salvaged parts — reduces fine-motor tremor during procedures).', N'Clinic opens 08:00 and theoretically closes at 18:00; in practice she''s there until the last patient leaves, which is often 21:00 or later; Wednesdays she runs a rotating health-education session for the Reclamation''s youth cohort.', N'Heloise Sesay-Okafor, clinical diagnostician, 178cm tall lean frame, warm deep brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Middle Eastern heritage. High prominent cheekbones, defined angular jaw, subtle broad nasal bridge. Dark hair 30% grayed, pulled into tight bun with patina brass clip. Pale gray eyes with intricate hexagonal geneware circuitry pattern visible under light. Weathered complexion from fluorescent clinical hours, fine lines around eyes, slightly papery skin texture. Chemical burn scars pale on right index and middle fingers, iodine discoloration along cuticles. Wearing worn gray scrub tunic over cotton undershirt, dark cargo pants with medical supplies, scuffed clinical clogs. Surgical mask draped around neck. Posture slightly forward-leaned from clinical decades. Standing in fluorescent-lit clinic setting, clinical precision in every movement, observational stare. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, medical geneware visible, utilitarian and worn. Conversational distance lighting revealing hexagonal iris geometry. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hough Reclamation', N'local', N'Hough Reclamation', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (62.0%) with significant South Asian (22.6%) and Middle Eastern (15.4%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a rich phenotype: warm deep brown skin with golden undertones from strong melanin inheritance; facial structure combines the prominent cheekbones and defined jawline characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage with the bone prominence and subtle orbital depth of South Asian ancestry, tempered by the broader nasal bridge and fuller lips influenced by Middle Eastern genetic contribution. Features reflect a harmonious blend rather than distinct components.', 178, 68, N'Lean and long-limbed with minimal subcutaneous fat; shoulders slightly rounded forward from decades of clinical posture over examination tables and bed-side work. Wiry musculature in forearms and hands from repetitive precise movements.', N'Dark brown, naturally graying at temples and crown (approximately 30% gray, uncolored)', N'High, tight bun secured with a brass clip showing patina and minor dents from two decades of use', N'Long (pinned up; would reach mid-back if loose)', N'Pale gray with hexagonal geneware pattern — tiny interlocking hexagons visible under direct light, geometric and precise, appearing almost like a circuit etched into the iris', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones; rich melanin distribution reflecting Sub-Saharan and South Asian ancestry; holds color well under artificial lighting; shows even, minimal freckling across bridge of nose and upper cheeks', N'Weathered in the way of someone who spends long hours under fluorescent light and rarely sleeps enough; fine lines radiating from eye corners and around mouth; minimal makeup; prominent high cheekbones and angular jaw reflecting African and South Asian bone structure; subtle width through the nasal bridge and fuller lip definition from Middle Eastern ancestry; skin texture slightly papery in places from chronic low-level chemical exposure (antiseptics, sterilizing agents)', N'The hexagonal irises are visible under normal lighting at conversational distance; they catch light slightly differently than natural irises, creating a subtle geometric shimmer. No other augmentations are externally visible (the sub-dermal wrist stabilizers are internal and create only minor, barely-noticeable tightening in the wrist tendons during extremely fine motor movements).', N'Characteristic forward lean from the hips; moves with economical precision, no wasted motion; hands are steady and deliberate even when tired; walks with a slight shuffle when exhausted (common after 18:00); maintains eye contact in a way that feels clinical rather than warm — observational rather than connective', N'Tier 4 utilitarian; typically wearing a long-sleeved gray or navy scrub tunic (generic, well-worn, likely from a bulk wholesale supplier) layered over plain cotton undershirt; dark cargo pants with multiple pockets filled with supplies (swabs, gloves, a small light, pen); rubber-soled clinical clogs (white or dark gray, scuffed); a surgical mask hanging around her neck even when not in use. A faded denim overshirt hangs on a chair behind the clinic desk, rarely worn but available for warmth. No jewelry except the brass hair clip. Clothes show faint permanent stains from betadine, blood, saline — professionally clean but not new.', N'Her Helix Biosystems auxiliary credential is not simply lapsed — it was revoked after she filed a report documenting a pattern of augmentation-rejection cases she traced back to a batch of Helix implants sold in Hough Reclamation below market rate. Helix suppressed the report and revoked her credential. She still uses the credential number for wholesale access because she discovered that Helix''s internal systems haven''t flagged it yet. She is waiting for the day they notice.', N'Clinical and precise; doesn''t soften diagnoses but delivers them without cruelty; occasionally drops French phrases from her father''s family when she''s too tired to find the English', N'Measured and unhurried, as if she''s pacing herself for the long conversation rather than this one.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'heloise_sesay_okafor');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d7-7904-b3ad-696d1e2221e6', N'Zarina Abdykadyrov-Nakamura', N'Zarina', N'', N'Abdykadyrov-Nakamura', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 54, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spires — mid-level corporate residential towers, near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'Long-range precision fire specialist — sniper', N'Independent — Lattice territory specialist', N'Zarina Abdykadyrov-Nakamura are athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 54, their expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would — and they make no effort to hide it.

They grew up in the Narrows, where the walls are so close together you learn to fight in confined spaces or you learn to lose. They work as a sniper out of The Spires, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Zarina Abdykadyrov-Nakamura have built a reputation on reliability rather than flash — they show up, they deliver, they collect.', N'As a sniper, Cem Watanabe-Amponsah embodies the tension between independence and isolation. They are a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would incapacitate. Retractable monofilament whip in left forearm — concealed weapon, devastating in close quarters', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Zarina Abdykadyrov-Nakamura, 172cm tall professional operative, warm caramel-bronze skin with golden undertones reflecting Central Asian, East Asian, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, dark alert eyes, black hair with salt-gray at temples pulled back tight, faint horizontal scar across left cheekbone, athletic lean build, chrome pain editor array visible along left temple with metallic-gray metallic finish, dressed in layered tactical wear - fitted gray long-sleeve under unbuttoned charcoal overshirt, matte-black scuffed boots, worn genuine leather jacket over all, standing in GLMZ neon-lit environment with neutral vigilant expression, sniper''s practiced gaze, minimal wasted movement, noir atmospheric lighting casting sharp shadows, ultra-detailed near-future megacity setting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spires', N'local', N'The Spires', N'Central Asian dominant (56.8%) with significant East Asian (17.5%), Middle Eastern (16.7%), and Sub-Saharan African (9.0%) ancestry. The result is a striking pan-diaspora phenotype: Central Asian bone structure with East Asian refinement, warmed by Middle Eastern and African depth, creating a uniquely balanced complexion and facial geometry', 172, 68, N'Athletic and lean with controlled musculature — dancer''s flexibility combined with fighter''s core strength. No excess mass; every movement appears economical', N'Black with salt-gray at temples', N'Pulled back tight, secured with a minimal clip', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, alert and constantly assessing', N'Warm caramel-bronze: Central Asian base enriched with East Asian luminosity and Middle Eastern warmth, layered with Sub-Saharan depth. Medium complexion with subtle golden undertones that shift in different light', N'Balanced facial geometry reflecting Central Asian structure with refined high cheekbones, moderate facial planes informed by East Asian ancestry, and warmer undertones from Middle Eastern and African heritage. Skin is clear but weathered slightly around the eyes from squinting through scope work. Minimal grooming beyond functional maintenance — no jewelry, no ornamentation', N'Visible chrome pain editor array along left temple and neck, metallic-gray with faint LED indicators (inactive unless in use). Left forearm shows subtle subcutaneous webbing under the skin where the monofilament whip retracts — noticeable only to those who know what to look for', N'Spine straight but never rigid. Movements are fluid and minimal — nothing wasted. Eyes track constantly in a sniper''s practiced scan. Default expression is neutral vigilance; smiles are rare and deployed strategically. Hands rest naturally, fingers loose, not tense', N'Tier 2-3 blend: well-maintained neutral tactical wear that functions as both cover identity and professional uniform. Black or charcoal synthetic pants with multiple pockets, tucked into matte-black boots (scuffed from use). Layered tops allowing quick adjustment — current preference is a fitted gray long-sleeve under an unbuttoned charcoal overshirt. No logos, no branding. A worn leather jacket (genuine, expensive, old) over everything. All fabrics are quiet — no swoosh, no rustle', N'', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Halting — speaks in fragments, reassembles thoughts in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'zarina_abdykadyrov_nakamura');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a653-77a9-8624-69fb7d42e49f', N'Detlef Nygaard-Cissé', N'Detlef', N'', N'Nygaard-Cissé', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 40, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Overhang — residential shelves built onto megastructure exteriors, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Information trader and intelligence analyst — broker', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Detlef Nygaard-Cissé are lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 40, they have soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate them once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — enhanced tendons — geneware upgrade, jump height and grip strength tripled — and they make no effort to hide it.

They used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Detlef Nygaard-Cissé plans to keep it that way. They work as a broker out of The Overhang, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Detlef Nygaard-Cissé have built a reputation on reliability rather than flash — they show up, they deliver, they collect.', N'As a broker, Malika Zhukov-Wiredu embodies the tension between independence and isolation. They are a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Enhanced tendons — geneware upgrade, jump height and grip strength tripled. Synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Detlef Nygaard-Cissé, lean 172cm mixed-heritage woman with rich warm bronze skin blending Northern European and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, deep brown eyes with amber flecks. Dark hair pulled back in practical low braid. High prominent cheekbones, angular jaw with soft chin, natural facial geometry. Thin white scars across palms, vertical scar left temple, faint burn mark right shoulder. Silvery tendon augmentation striations visible along forearms like mercury under skin. Wearing matte black reinforced cargo pants, dark thermal layer, lightweight reactive jacket with hidden armor, scuffed steel-toed boots. Titanium band on left index finger. Coiled posture, watchful expression, zero wasted movement. GLMZ GLMZ setting, professional operative aesthetic, moody atmospheric lighting with neon undertones, industrial background, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Overhang', N'local', N'The Overhang', N'Northern European dominant (54.6%) blended with substantial Sub-Saharan African ancestry (37.5%) and minor East Asian heritage (7.9%). The result is striking: cool Northern European bone structure softened by Sub-Saharan African facial geometry and warmth, with subtle East Asian eye shape complexity. High, pronounced cheekbones with gentle African lip fullness and chin rounding. Neither region claims dominance — reads as distinctly hybrid.', 172, 58, N'Lean and angular with visible musculature — no excess mass, every movement efficient. Enhanced tendons create slightly pronounced definition in forearms and calves.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Pulled back tight, practical — no aesthetic consideration, pure function', N'Medium, secured in a low braid or knot', N'Deep brown with faint amber flecks — natural', N'Rich warm bronze — Northern European fairness deepened by substantial Sub-Saharan African ancestry, with East Asian golden undertones creating depth. Medium-deep with visible sun exposure and weathering.', N'High, pronounced cheekbones showing Northern European structure softened by Sub-Saharan African facial geometry and fullness. Angular jaw with gentle rounding at the chin. Minimal grooming — no jewelry, no makeup. Skin carries subtle scarring consistent with a life of movement and minor injuries. Expression reads as closed, watchful. Fine facial lines suggest both sun exposure and age.', N'Chrome-shimmer visible along forearms where geneware interfaces with skin — enhanced tendons visible as subtle silvery striations running the length of the underarm. No attempt to conceal. Grip strength advertised through posture — hands rest with controlled tension. Movement suggests non-human endurance — zero wasted motion, economical transitions between states.', N'Sits coiled, ready to move. Stands with weight distributed for rapid vertical or horizontal deployment. Eyes track exits and sight lines constantly — not paranoid, just professional. Movement is precise and efficient — no flourishes, no swagger. Handshake would be firm, testing.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian — function over status. Matte black reinforced cargo pants with multiple pockets and hidden compartments. Dark thermal layer under a lightweight reactive jacket with hidden armor plating. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and practical. No logos, no bright colors. Worn gear that has been field-tested. A single piece of jewelry — a thin titanium band on left index finger, unmarked.', N'Malika Zhukov-Wiredu can''t read. Hides it behind voice interfaces and memorization. The shame is older than the chrome.', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'detlef_nygaard_ciss');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a610-7bca-b58a-6a26142fe3b1', N'Alina Björnsdóttir', N'Alina', N'', N'Björnsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spires — mid-level corporate residential towers, near Lake Shore Drive and North', N'Structural breach and explosive ordnance specialist — demolitions expert', N'Independent — works solo contracts', N'Alina Björnsdóttir is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 29, his expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. He works as a demolitions expert out of The Spires, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In the runner community, Alina Björnsdóttir is known for getting the job done and not asking questions that would make the job harder to stomach.', N'Fatoumata Belov-Ntim represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon platform. Vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Alina Björnsdóttir, GLMZ, mixed-heritage operative with East Asian-Northern European features: prominent cheekbones, distinctive epicanthic fold eyes, warm medium tan complexion with golden undertones, black close-cropped fade. 182cm lean athletic build, dark brown observant eyes, smooth unblemished skin with subtle temple scar. Iridescent chrome subcutaneous neural threading visible along arms and neck, glowing faintly. Wearing matte black sleeveless tactical shirt revealing augmentation, dark reinforced utility pants, practical grip-sole boots. Posture radiates coiled readiness, movements economical and calculated. Standing in neon-lit industrial zone, blue-purple neo-noir lighting casting shadows across angular face and chrome implants. Cold professional demeanor, peripheral awareness captured in gaze. High contrast lighting emphasizing the luminous quality of skin tone and opalescent chrome networks. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spires', N'local', N'The Spires', N'Striking pan-Asian-European blend: Northern European structural foundation (37.3%) with dominant East Asian features (32.2%) creating distinctive eye geometry and cheekbone prominence. Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (17.7%) contributes warm golden undertones and facial softness, while South Asian heritage (7.5%) adds depth to complexion and subtle richness to cheek and temple coloration. Eastern European (5.3%) sharpens jawline angularity. Result is a uniquely balanced phenotype—neither fully Northern nor fully Eastern, but a harmonious fusion showing clear genetic diversity.', 182, 74, N'Athletic and lean with precise muscle definition — the body of someone who treats their frame as a precision instrument. Low body fat, efficient movement, no wasted mass.', N'Black', N'Close-cropped fade, maintained with military precision', N'Short', N'Dark brown — natural, unaugmented, with pronounced East Asian epicanthic fold characteristics from ancestral genetics', N'Medium warm tan with complex multihued undertones—Northern European base deepened by significant East Asian influence, warmed by Hispanic/Latin American golden tones, enriched by South Asian warmth creating a luminous quality that shifts from amber to burnished bronze depending on light angle', N'Smooth, unblemished — the result of nocturnal living and meticulous self-maintenance. Angular yet refined facial structure reflecting the genetic blend: prominent high cheekbones with East Asian width, sharp Eastern European jawline definition, balanced facial proportions bridging Northern and East Asian aesthetics. Characteristic East Asian eye shape with epicanthic fold creating an alert, penetrating gaze. Subtle warm golden undertone visible in cheeks and temples from Latin and South Asian heritage, preventing the face from reading as purely European.', N'Move-by-wire nervous system augmentation visible as iridescent chrome threading beneath the skin along both arms and neck — subcutaneous neural pathways that catch light with an opalescent sheen. No bulky external chrome; the system is integrated and elegant. The chrome traces become more prominent during physical exertion, faintly luminescent.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no excess motion, no fidgeting. Posture is upright but relaxed, suggesting coiled readiness rather than tension. Every movement appears calculated. Eyes track peripherals constantly, habit from years of work in dangerous spaces. When still, he becomes nearly invisible through sheer neutrality.', N'Tier 3-4 pragmatist. Usually wears reinforced tactical wear — matte black or dark gray utility pants with multiple sealed pockets, sleeveless or short-sleeved shirts to display the chrome augmentation with obvious intentionality. Favors synthetic materials resistant to chemical residue and thermal stress. Heavy insulated jacket for site work, unmarked and nondescript. Minimal branding. Boots are always practical footwear — grip soles, ankle support, built for movement on unstable surfaces. No jewelry. Everything serves function.', N'', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alina_bj_rnsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ca-76cf-9f2a-6aa2e03a3e5c', N'Aaliyah Sokolov', N'Aaliyah', N'', N'Sokolov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'non-binary', N'they/them', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor / the Gray Zone (transient between both), near Wacker and State', N'Street-level courier, informal intelligence carrier, and accidental archivist', N'Unaffiliated; cultivated neutrality as survival strategy; sympathies are with the permanent underclasses of Old Harbor and the Gray Zone, but Brecken is deeply resistant to being claimed by any organized expression of that sympathy', N'Aaliyah Sokolov is nineteen years old and moves through GLMZ the way water moves through a cracked foundation — finding every gap, never in the same route twice, noticed by almost no one. They are slight and quick, of Turkish-Ghanaian descent, with a shaved head that grows in uneven patches due to a childhood illness, warm brown skin, and the specific kind of watchfulness that develops in people who spent their formative years needing to read adults accurately. Their face defaults to a pleasantly blank expression that people consistently misread as vacancy; it is in fact the opposite.

They run packages, messages, and occasionally people between the lower districts — primarily between Old Harbor''s dockworker communities and the Gray Zone''s warren economy — using a battered cargo-assist rig (a motorized platform cart they call ''the sled'') that they maintain themselves with parts sourced from three different scrap markets. They have no fixed address, sleeping in a rotation of arrangement-rooms and borrowed floors. They are not part of any organization, which several organizations have found inconvenient, as Brecken has a gift for being present at moments that matter — for picking up the dropped data chip, for being the only person in the corridor when the conversation happened, for remembering everything with a clarity that has no augmentation behind it. Their memory is entirely biological and entirely extraordinary.

Brecken did not choose to become an archivist. It happened because they never throw anything away — physically or mentally — and because the world kept handing them things that seemed important and had nowhere else to go. They have, stored in the sled''s concealed compartment, a physical collection of objects, notes, and copied documents that constitute an accidental record of things various powerful people would prefer unrecorded. They do not fully understand what they have. They understand enough to know that not understanding it is currently keeping them alive.', N'Street-level perspective and mobile connector between narrative threads; the accidental archive functions as a plot engine that can surface information organically; Brecken''s youth and genuine decency provide emotional counterweight to the cynicism of older characters, while their precarity keeps the stakes grounded', N'', N'None — their extraordinary memory is biological; several people who''ve learned this find it more unsettling than augmentation would be,The sled has a concealed compartment with a mechanical (non-electronic) lock of Brecken''s own design, and a short-range signal-dampening skin they scavenged from a the Gray Zone electronics dump', N'Up before dawn, which in Old Harbor means before the harbor lights cycle. The first hour is the sled — checking it, adjusting loads, running the day''s route in their head against what they know about who''s watching where. Routes run through the morning and into the afternoon, with informal stops at three or four places where information tends to pool — a tea stall near the Old Harbor gate, a repair shop in the Gray Zone, a bench near the Circuit''s border where certain people sit when they want to be found. Eats opportunistically and without much investment in the food itself. Late afternoons sometimes slow down; this is when Brecken sits with the sled in some out-of-the-way corner and goes through the archive — touching the objects, reviewing what they have, trying to understand the picture. Evenings are for finding a floor or a corner that''s safe enough for the night. Sleeps lightly and wakes fast.', N'Aaliyah Sokolov, courier in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 162cm slight wiry build, warm medium brown skin with golden undertones, shaved dark brown hair growing unevenly across scalp, dark warm eyes with permanent dark circles, sharp jawline and high cheekbones blending Eastern European and Southeast Asian features. Wearing oversized grey cargo vest over dark fitted undershirt, reinforced dark trousers with tool belt, scuffed resoled boots. Thin scar visible on left forearm. Economical posture with rounded shoulders, minimizing profile. Blank watchful expression masking acute awareness. Standing near mechanical sled with signal-dampening skin in dimly lit industrial warehouse, cool neon-tinted lighting, fog and shadow, gritty street-level atmosphere, vector-conscious stance ready for motion. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor / the Gray Zone (transient between both)', N'local', N'Old Harbor / the Gray Zone (transient between both)', N'Eastern European, Southeast Asian, Indigenous American, and Hispanic/Latin American blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The 41.3% Eastern European ancestry provides cool undertones and defined bone structure; 35% Southeast Asian contributes warm golden undertones, refined facial geometry, and eye shape; 12% Indigenous American adds depth and richness to skin tone; 11.7% Hispanic/Latin American contributes warm golden warmth and facial feature blending. The result is a warm medium brown skin tone with subtle golden undertones that catch light, tempered by cooler undertones beneath—a complex interplay of warmth and cool that gives the skin visual depth.', 162, 52, N'Slight and wiry, built for speed rather than strength; lean muscle from years of manual courier work and constant motion; no excess anywhere', N'Dark brown, naturally', N'Shaved head kept short, grows in uneven patches across the scalp due to childhood illness; pattern is asymmetrical on left side', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown, warm', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones, the Southeast Asian and Hispanic/Latin American warmth creating luminosity, balanced by the cooler tones of Eastern European ancestry beneath; skin has depth and slight weathering from street exposure', N'Face defaults to a pleasantly blank, almost vacant expression that masks acute watchfulness; bone structure reflects Eastern European solidity with Southeast Asian refinement—defined cheekbones with slightly higher placement, sharp jawline with subtle broadness from Indigenous American and Hispanic/Latin American heritage; skin weathered slightly by sun exposure and street living but clean; minimal grooming investment beyond functional necessity', N'None visible. Their extraordinary biological memory and the sled''s mechanical lock/signal-dampening skin are entirely hidden from casual observation.', N'Moves with economical grace, never wasteful; walks like someone constantly calculating vectors and sightlines; stillness is active rather than passive—they are always watching, always ready to move. Hands are frequently occupied or positioned near the sled''s controls. Sits with spine straight but shoulders slightly rounded, posture that minimizes their profile.', N'Tier 4-5 functional wear: scavenged, patched, layered. Oversized grey cargo vest with multiple pockets over a dark, fitted undershirt; reinforced trousers with an explicit tool belt; scuffed ankle-height boots resoled at least twice. Colors are muted—greys, blacks, dark browns. Fabrics are durable synthetic blends, chosen for wear resistance not aesthetics. No jewelry, no brands, nothing that draws attention. All clothing has been modified slightly for ease of movement and storage capacity.', N'Among the items in the sled is a partial data-print they copied without knowing what it was — it turned out to be a fragment of a communication between two Spire-level entities referencing a planned infrastructure event that would displace tens of thousands of the Gray Zone and Old Harbor residents. They have shown it to no one. They are afraid of what showing it would set in motion, and afraid of what not showing it already means about them.', N'Lean and efficient, with a mix of Old Harbor dock slang and the Gray Zone market shorthand; more articulate than their surface presentation suggests, which surfaces unexpectedly; tends to speak in concrete images rather than abstractions', N'Fast when comfortable, brief when uncertain; sentences often end slightly before their grammatical conclusion, implying the rest; comfortable with silence in a way that unnerves people who aren''t', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aaliyah_sokolov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ec-7bbc-9545-6b6f2710052d', N'Bilal Duong', N'Bilal', N'', N'Duong', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 45, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — cramped residential corridors between megastructures, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Personnel recovery and hostile extraction — extraction specialist', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews; The Glass Ladder', N'Bilal Duong is wiry and quick-moving, with the restless energy of someone who converts anxiety into velocity. At 45, his face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and he has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on s — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Before the runner life, he worked corporate — low-tier security, the kind that teaches you exactly how the system''s defenses fail. He works as a extraction specialist out of The Narrows, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In a city full of people who talk about what they''ll do, Bilal Duong is one of the ones who actually does it.', N'As a extraction specialist, Deniz Dahlberg-Boakye embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs. Cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers at 50 meters', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'GLMZ portrait of Bilal Duong, Southeast Asian-East Asian blend with olive skin and golden undertones, dark brown hair with silver at temples, sharp angular cheekbones, alert dark eyes weathered from focus work. 178cm tall, lean wiry build. Wearing dark charcoal synthweave cargo jacket over fitted base layer, reinforced knuckle gloves, high-ankle urban boots. Chrome bezels visible at ears from cyberear housing, matte gunmetal synthetic muscle fiber visible on calves below the knee. Brushed steel chain on left wrist. Five o''clock shadow, perpetually coiled posture with weight forward. Standing in dimly-lit industrial setting, neon accent lighting casting shadows across defined features, slightly angled conversation posture, eyes tracking exits. Atmospheric megacity environment, moody tungsten and cool blue lighting, forgotten-in-two-minutes aesthetic, functional and lethal. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Southeast Asian (67%) with significant East Asian (30.6%) and minor Middle Eastern (2.4%) ancestry — a refined blend resulting in warm, light to medium olive skin tone with subtle golden undertones. Features show the defined bone structure characteristic of Southeast Asian and East Asian genetics, with slightly broader facial proportions balanced by the angular cheekbones of both lineages.', 178, 68, N'Wiry and lean with efficient musculature — the physique of someone who converts nervous energy into controlled motion. Synthetic muscle fiber in legs creates subtle asymmetries in calf definition.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples', N'Short, pragmatic cut — minimal maintenance, pulled back slightly at crown', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and assessing', N'Warm light to medium olive with golden undertones — the blended result of Southeast Asian dominance (67%) with East Asian (30.6%) refinement and trace Middle Eastern (2.4%) warmth. Carries the pallor of someone who spends irregular hours indoors, creating subtle shadowing across cheekbones.', N'Defined cheekbones and sharp jawline with the refined nasal structure characteristic of Southeast and East Asian heritage. Well-proportioned brow structure with the slightly broader facial width typical of Southeast Asian ancestry, refined by East Asian angular definition. Weathered around the eyes from sustained focus work. Five o''clock shadow is his default state across the lower jaw and upper lip. No visible facial scars but the skin has a tightness suggesting old impact trauma healed cleanly.', N'Synthetic muscle fiber replacement visible in both legs below the knee — matte gunmetal finish with faint seam lines along the calf. The prosthetics are functional, not cosmetic. Discrete chrome bezels around ears marking cyberear housing — partially obscured by hair. Wrist has a faint industrial port scar where old gear was interfaced.', N'Perpetually coiled — standing weight forward on the balls of feet. Movement is economical and sudden; he does not amble. Hands rarely still, often checking cuffs, adjusting jacket, touching the chrome at his ears. Eyes constantly tracking exits, angles, sight lines. Conversation posture is slightly angled — cyberears allow him to monitor peripheral audio.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian — durable synthweave in dark colors (charcoal, black, deep navy). Multi-pocket cargo jacket worn open over fitted base layers. Reinforced knuckle gloves, often not removed indoors. Durable boots with high ankle support rated for urban infiltration. A single piece of visible hardware: brushed steel chain on left wrist, practical rather than decorative. Everything functional, nothing that announces itself. No corporate logos or runner affectations — he dresses like someone whose appearance should be forgotten in two minutes.', N'', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bilal_duong');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a682-7be4-944b-6b7714c9c71b', N'Hilal Arredondo', N'Hilal', N'', N'Arredondo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, beneath Ferrogate Transit overpass junction 14-C, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Street doc operating out of a converted shipping container in The Narrows', N'Independent; loose cooperation with Highland Park Autonomous Zone community health network', N'Hilal Arredondo is a broad-shouldered man with deep umber skin that carries the scattered shine of old bioluminescent ink — a cosmetic mod from his twenties that has faded unevenly, leaving constellations of dim gold light across his forearms and collarbone. His hair is close-cropped and salted at the temples, and he wears magnifying lenses that flip down over his eyes during procedures, giving him the look of a very calm insect. He smells perpetually of antiseptic and bitter karité tea. His hands are impossibly steady.

Tobi trained two years of a proper surgical residency at Aurochs Medical Complex before a licensing dispute with Helix Biosystems — they claimed he used proprietary gene-threading techniques without a corporate contract — ended his formal career. He does not speak of this with bitterness anymore, at least not where anyone can hear. He is meticulous, unhurried, and prone to explaining exactly what he is doing and why, as though every patient is also a student. He charges what people can pay and writes the rest off in a ledger he keeps but never balances.', N'Quest giver, information source, safe harbor — he has patched up half the population of The Narrows and knows their secrets; can provide medical assistance, black-market pharma leads, or testimony about what bodies he has seen come through his door', N'', N'Steady-hand micro-servo implants in both wrists (functional, aging, occasionally needs recalibration); magnifying flip-lens ocular frames (not implanted, worn); faded bioluminescent cosmetic ink', N'Opens the container clinic at 0700, sees twelve to twenty patients by midday, spends afternoons sourcing pharmaceuticals through grey-market contacts in Geartown, prays to the E.L.F. he calls Sutura before any procedure involving augmentation hardware.', N'Hilal Arredondo, 188cm tall surgeon with warm bronze-olive skin reflecting Hispanic/Mesoamerican-East Asian-Central Asian heritage blend, prominent cheekbones and slightly flattened nasal bridge, dark brown eyes with warm undertone. Salt-grey at temples, close-cropped dark brown hair, clean-shaven. Wears grey scrubs under worn canvas work apron stained with iodine and antiseptic, faded charcoal tactical vest, leather work boots. Flip-down magnifying lens goggles around neck, scratched and taped. Faded gold bioluminescent ink constellation tattoos visible on forearms and collarbone, patchy from age. Worn bronze ring on right ring finger. Posture deliberate and steady, hands preternaturally still. Standing in dim clinic lighting, surgical precision and weathered professionalism evident. GLMZ setting, gritty medical underground aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Hispanic/Latin American foundation (60.8%) with substantial East Asian (20.2%) and Central Asian (19.0%) ancestry. A striking Ubiquitous Diaspora mix—primarily Spanish and indigenous Mesoamerican heritage blended with significant Han Chinese and Mongolian ancestry, creating distinct phenotypic layering. The combination manifests as strong cheekbone prominence and slightly flattened nasal bridge from East/Central Asian ancestry, balanced against broader facial structure from Mesoamerican heritage. Subtle epicanthic fold presence evident in eye shape.', 188, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and thickset through the chest and upper back, with the density of someone who has done manual work most of his life. His frame has softened slightly with age but retains functional strength; his hands and forearms are disproportionately muscular from decades of precision surgical work.', N'Dark brown with pronounced salt-grey at the temples', N'Close-cropped, military-neat, no styling product', N'Short', N'Dark brown with warm undertone; pupils often dilated behind the flip-down magnifying lenses he wears', N'Warm bronze-olive with golden undertones—a luminous blend reflecting deep Hispanic/Mesoamerican baseline enriched by East and Central Asian heritage. The complexion reads sun-weathered and richly warm throughout, neither pale nor deeply dark.', N'Well-maintained but weathered by chemical exposure and years of close work under harsh clinic lighting. Fine creases around the eyes and mouth suggest more smiling than scowling. Clean-shaven daily, methodical grooming as a form of professional ritual. Faint chemical smell lingers on the skin. Strong cheekbone prominence and slightly flattened nasal bridge reflecting East and Central Asian ancestry blend seamlessly with broader facial contours from Mesoamerican heritage.', N'Flip-down magnifying lens frames (modified safety goggles repurposed as a permanent tool) hanging around his neck when not in use, visibly scratched and taped at one hinge. Micro-servo implants in both wrists are not externally visible but occasionally a faint mechanical whirr can be heard when his hands move with precision. Faded bioluminescent ink visible on forearms and collarbone.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical gestures. Stands with weight evenly distributed, ready for long hours of work. His hands are almost preternaturally steady—he does not fidget or adjust his clothing compulsively. Speaks slowly, often pausing mid-sentence to demonstrate or clarify a point. When focused on a procedure, his entire body quiets into absolute stillness.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional. Wears a heavy canvas work apron over plain grey or navy scrubs—the apron pocketed and stained with antiseptic, iodine, and trace amounts of blood. Under the apron, usually a long-sleeved undershirt in grey or cream to cover the augmentation scars. Worn but well-maintained leather work boots with good grip. A faded tactical vest in charcoal (original purpose unknown, repurposed as storage) worn on cooler days. No visible corpo branding or luxury items; everything is functional and replaceable. Wears a single piece of jewelry: a worn bronze ring on his right ring finger, unmarked and very old.', N'He did not just use Helix''s gene-threading techniques without a contract — he stole the technique from a colleague who held the license, and that colleague knows it. The colleague has never reported it, and Tobi has never understood why.', N'Precise, clinical when working, warmer in conversation — mixes English with occasional Romanian endearments inherited from his mother''s side and Yoruba expressions from his father''s', N'Measured and unhurried, rarely raises his voice, finishes his sentences completely even under pressure', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hilal_arredondo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5be-7f2d-bcf9-6b990ac54b22', N'Diop Hachemi-Strömqvist-Kettani', N'Diop', N'', N'Hachemi-Strömqvist-Kettani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, permanent pitch under the Kessler Interchange overpass, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Junk merchant and scrap reseller — specializes in salvaged augmentation components and tech scrap', N'Independent. Informal arrangement with Geartown''s dominant crew, the Kessler Jackets, who take a small percentage in exchange for pitch security. Known to aug clinics in the Geartown area as a reliable parts source.; The Interchange', N'Diop Hachemi-Strömqvist-Kettani is the kind of man who looks like he was assembled from spare parts — which, in a meaningful sense, he was. His left arm from the elbow down is a mismatched stack of salvaged cyberware components that he has maintained, replaced, and modified over forty years: the hand is Axiom manufacture circa 2160, the wrist joint is something he stripped from a Ferrogate maintenance bot, and the forearm housing is a custom shell he hammered out himself from transit-grade aluminum. His face is weathered to the texture of old boot leather, his right eye is natural and sharp, his left eye is a salvage-market optical he bought from Zibby Ousséni-Palakiko three years ago and only mostly trusts.

His pitch under the Kessler Interchange overpass is a cathedral of beautiful junk: sorted bins of neural connectors, towers of chassis plating, a refrigerated unit full of organic-synthetic interface components that need to stay cold, hand-lettered signs advertising prices in chalk on a board he updates daily. He has a dog — a large, scruffy animal with bioluminescent patches along its spine from some backyard genemod experiment — named Inventory. Diop Hachemi-Strömqvist-Kettani has a scholar''s knowledge of two generations of augmentation hardware, can identify a component by touch in the dark, and has opinions about manufacturing tolerances that can fill an evening if you let him. He is also missing significant chunks of his past that he doesn''t discuss.', N'Technical expert and parts source for augmentation-related needs. Deep institutional knowledge of hardware makes him invaluable for identifying strange tech, vintage aug components, or modified cyberware. Also carries significant history from an earlier era of GLMZ.', N'', N'Extensive salvage-assembled left arm (mismatched components, functional if unusual). Salvage-market optical left eye. Spinal brace — internal, medical-grade, installed after a workplace injury thirty years ago. Subdermal toolkit storage in right forearm — several small retractable tools he''s incorporated over the years.', N'He''s at the pitch before sunrise to sort new acquisitions, opens for business at seven, and runs until the light fails or he runs out of energy — increasingly the latter. Inventory the dog runs the perimeter and barks at anyone who tries to pocket merchandise. Two evenings a week Bako attends an informal aug-repair social at a Geartown community hall, where people bring broken cyberware and he helps diagnose it.', N'Weathered North African-East Asian-Southeast Asian man, 63 years old, deep warm bronze skin with golden undertones, high cheekbones, prominent broken nose, steel gray short hair brushed back unkempt. Right eye dark brown and sharp, left eye amber LED optical implant with faint glow. Deeply lined face, silver stubble, permanent squint lines. Left arm prosthetic from elbow down—mismatched aluminum and industrial cyberware with visible seams and dents, Axiom hand with worn contact pads. Burn scar across right collarbone-chest, network of thin scars on forearms. 178cm tall, heavyset broad-shouldered build, slight forward stoop. Wearing faded defunct corporation shirt with rolled sleeves, thick gray patched insulation vest, heavy canvas cargo work pants, scuffed steel-toed boots. Geartown mechanic in industrial workshop, warm tungsten lighting casting shadows on weathered features and augmented limb, GLMZ, hands gesturing over scattered components, mood: experienced, worn, deliberate, practical --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'North African (64.1%), East Asian (20.5%), and Southeast Asian (15.4%) ancestry. The dominant North African genetics establish deep warm brown undertones and broader facial structure, while East Asian ancestry contributes high, defined cheekbones and a refined nasal bridge. Southeast Asian influence adds warmth to midtones and subtle facial angularity. The combination creates a distinctly warm-toned complexion with North African depth, sharpened by East and Southeast Asian bone structure.', 178, 89, N'Heavyset and broad-shouldered despite age, with a slight forward stoop from decades of bench work. Thick through the torso, calloused hands, the musculature of someone who has done manual labor his entire life but is now running on momentum and habit rather than strength.', N'Steel gray with patches of white', N'Short, brushed back, slightly unkempt. Hasn''t been to a proper barber in years.', N'Short', N'Right eye: dark brown, sharp and calculating. Left eye: LED-modified salvage-market optical with a faint amber glow, the pupil sometimes drifting slightly out of sync.', N'Deep warm brown with rich golden undertones from North African and Southeast Asian heritage, enhanced by East Asian ancestry. Further weathered by sixty-three years of sun exposure and industrial work throughout the GLMZ, creating a lived-in patina across bronzed skin.', N'Deeply lined face like cracked leather, jaw dusted with silver stubble, a prominent nose with high bridge and slightly flared nostrils reflecting East and Southeast Asian ancestry, broken at least twice. Permanent squint lines around the eyes. A few old chemical burns on the right side of his neck, faded to white scars. Deep facial bone structure emphasizes high cheekbones and strong jaw, characteristic of the ancestral blend.', N'Left arm from elbow down is visibly augmented: a frankenstein assembly of mismatched cyberware. The forearm is a dull aluminum shell hammered smooth with visible seam lines and a few deliberately hammered dents. The wrist joint is clearly repurposed Ferrogate heavy machinery — industrial-grade and overbuilt. The hand is older Axiom manufacture, palm-side showing worn contact pads and a faintly visible serial number. The left eye has a faint amber LED glow at the edge of the iris. When he flexes his right forearm, barely-visible seams appear where subdermal toolkit storage has been integrated under the skin.', N'Moves with the careful deliberation of someone managing chronic pain from old injuries. Favors his right side slightly. Stands with hands often occupied — sorting, gesturing, demonstrating components. His movements are economical and practiced, no wasted motion. Speaks with his hands, especially when explaining augmentation tolerances or component lineage. Often adjusts his left eye manually, like an old habit.', N'Tier 3-4 Geartown worker aesthetic, deeply functional and worn. Heavy canvas work pants with a dozen cargo pockets, all visibly utilized. A faded company shirt from some defunct shipping corporation, sleeves rolled or cut off to accommodate his left arm. A thick gray insulated vest over top, patched in multiple places. Steel-toed work boots, scuffed and re-resoled at least twice. A pair of cut-off leather gloves hanging from his back pocket. No jewelry except a pale band of skin on his ring finger where something used to be. Everything smells of mineral oil, solder flux, and the dust of a thousand disassembled machines.', N'Thirty-one years ago he was a licensed augmentation technician working for a Helix Biosystems subsidiary. He was the person who certified a batch of defective spinal interfaces as safe. Twelve people were paralyzed. He falsified a second set of records to redirect blame to a supply chain error, walked away from his license, and has been Bako the Bone in Geartown ever since. He tells himself the system was the one that pressured him into the sign-off. He''s not entirely wrong. He''s not entirely right.', N'Dense technical vocabulary for hardware, crude and simple for everything else. Speaks in fragments when comfortable, complete sentences when agitated.', N'Unhurried, with long pauses while he works with his hands — he talks better when his hands are busy.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'diop_hachemi_str_mqvist_kettani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('41ce1cb2-4888-0b3a-3259-6bb2ab40add8', N'Bao Hedlund-Conteh', N'Bao', N'', N'Hedlund-Conteh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A rooftop workshop in the Canopy, surrounded by charging stations, repair benches, and dozens of dormant drones', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — operates a licensed surveillance firm as cover for investigative work', N'Bao Hedlund-Conteh is the eye in the sky — or more accurately, the hundred eyes in the sky, the walls, the ventilation systems, and the cracks in the pavement. He is a drone specialist who has built the most sophisticated personal surveillance network in GLMZ''s lower tiers, and he uses it to conduct investigations without ever leaving his rooftop workshop.

His fleet numbers over three hundred drones of varying sizes, from bird-scale reconnaissance units to insect-scale infiltrators that can pass through a building''s air filtration system without triggering sensors. He builds them himself, maintains them himself, and controls them through a neural interface that allows him to process multiple drone feeds simultaneously — a cognitive feat that would overwhelm most BCI users but which Bao has trained for since childhood.

The limitation is the one you''d expect: he''s physically helpless. His investigative skills are extraordinary as long as a drone can go where he needs to look, but he cannot conduct interviews, chase suspects, or handle any situation that requires a human being in the room. He compensates by partnering with more physically capable investigators when cases require it, and by designing his drones to be so capable that physical presence is rarely necessary. His clients love the results and are occasionally disturbed by the process — there''s something inherently unsettling about knowing that any insect in the room might be watching you.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bao_hedlund_conteh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a602-71dc-928a-6bd8dc7a8d28', N'Dipti Guerrero-Oh', N'Dipti', N'', N'Guerrero-Oh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Undertow, based at a food stall called Overflow that serves as his public face, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Compute broker — sells black-market processing time, stolen AI cycles, and illegally acquired data storage capacity', N'Loosely affiliated with a technical underground called The Spill; has clients across multiple tiers including, he claims, a mid-level Tessera administrator he will never name; The Undertow', N'Dipti Guerrero-Oh is a tall, loud man with the kind of physical presence that makes rooms recalibrate. He has Nigerian-Swedish coloring that surprises people — warm brown skin, hazel eyes, red-tinged hair he keeps cut tight to his skull — and a Mexican grandmother''s round face that he inherited completely. He has cat ears in amber-gold, a geneware mod from a decade ago that he got on a dare and has never bothered to reverse because they''ve become part of his brand. They fold back when he''s irritated, which is useful shorthand. He wears bright colors, talks constantly, sells the best grilled cassava flatbreads in the Undertow district as a genuine secondary passion.

The food stall is real. The food is good. It is also where Dipti Guerrero-Oh sells access to computing resources that don''t belong to him — processing cycles skimmed from corporate server farms via distributed exploit packages, storage space in dead zones of Axiom''s infrastructure, raw bandwidth siphoned from Ferrogate Transit''s reserve systems. He doesn''t understand the technical work at a deep level — he has a partner for that, a woman he will never name — but he understands value, he understands clients, and he can talk anyone into a package deal that somehow always benefits him more than it should. He is genuinely funny. This is his most dangerous quality.', N'Service provider, comic relief with genuine menace underneath, information source — he hears everything that happens in the Undertow and trades in data as casually as flatbread.', N'', N'Amber-gold cat ears (geneware, cosmetic). Vocal amplifier — throat implant that gives him better projection and the ability to modulate tone precisely. He calls it his ''good microphone.''', N'Up at five to prep the stall, open by seven, cooks and sells until two, uses the lunch rush as cover for drop-offs and pickups, afternoons are client meetings disguised as stall prep, evenings are for his technical partner and planning.', N'Dipti Guerrero-Oh, 2226 neo-noir food vendor, tall broad-shouldered man with warm medium-brown skin glowing with golden and olive undertones, strong angular cheekbones and defined jawline blending Latin American and East Asian heritage, dark brown hair with copper sun-bleached temples in tight fade, full lips, expressive warm amber-flecked dark eyes with laugh lines. Signature amber-gold geneware cat ears alert and rotating with attention, creating predatory silhouette. Few days stubble, theatrical mobile eyebrows. Wearing electric blue fitted short-sleeve shirt showing forearm muscles and cassava root tattoo on left wrist, lightweight neutral cargo pants, stainless steel chunky rings and chain necklace, worn Tier 3 work boots. Leaning against food stall counter with confident expansive posture, hip cocked forward, one foot advanced, hands gesturing while speaking. Set in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon-lit street market, holographic menu glowing behind him, volumetric steam rising from cooking prep. Moody neo-noir lighting with neon blues and oranges casting shadows across his face, his cat ears catching highlights. Mood: confident, magnetic, in his element. Gritty, lived-in street vendor aesthetic, no corpo chrome, pure individual presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Undertow', N'local', N'The Undertow', N'Hispanic/Latin American (51.4%) with East Asian (32.3%), South Asian (10.8%), and Southeast Asian (5.5%) ancestry — a striking global blend resulting in warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones, strong cheekbones and defined bone structure from East and Southeast Asian heritage, dark hair with natural depth, and expressive features that blend angular and rounded elements across multiple continents.', 188, 92, N'Tall and broad-shouldered with soft bulk around the middle — the physique of someone who tastes everything he cooks and doesn''t prioritize gym time. Strong through the chest and arms, slight forward lean from decades hunched over a food prep counter.', N'Dark brown with natural reddish undertones, sun-bleached copper at the temples', N'Tight fade, kept short and precise; reveals the shape of his skull', N'Short', N'Dark brown with warm amber flecks, expressive and alert', N'Warm medium brown with golden and subtle olive undertones — luminous depth from the blend of Latin American, East Asian, and South Asian genetics', N'Angular face with strong defined cheekbones and jawline, moderately wide nose with subtle bridge definition, full lips. Perpetually expressive — eyebrows mobile and theatrical. Skin is clear and well-maintained, minimal scarring. Laugh lines around eyes and mouth. A few days'' stubble is his default; clean-shaven is rare.', N'Amber-gold geneware cat ears (primary identifier). Vocal amplifier throat implant creates subtle scarring along his larynx if you know where to look — most people don''t notice unless they''re close during conversation. No visible chrome or subdermal plating.', N'Expansive and confident — he takes up space and doesn''t apologize for it. Constant hand movement when speaking, gestures that sweep outward. Leans against his food stall counter with hip cocked, one foot slightly forward. His cat ears twitch and rotate independently with his attention and emotion — they telegraph his mood before his face does. Moves smoothly for his size; no wasted motion despite the volume he occupies.', N'Bright, bold colors — electric blues, lime greens, hot oranges. Tier 3-4 quality: functional and durable rather than luxury, but well-maintained. Favors fitted short-sleeve shirts that show his forearms (good for food work, also shows off his presence). Lightweight cargo pants with multiple pockets in neutral tones. Stainless steel or aluminum jewelry — chunky rings, a chain around his neck. Worn Tier 3 work boots rated for chemical spills and heat. Apron over everything when working the stall — usually patterned in complementary colors to whatever he''s wearing underneath. No corpo logos. No gang marks. No attempt to blend in.', N'His technical partner is his younger brother, Chidi, who has severe agoraphobia and hasn''t left their shared apartment in two years. Emeka has told everyone she''s a mysterious woman to protect Chidi''s privacy and because ''my little brother who doesn''t go outside'' didn''t sound like a powerful criminal asset. Chidi is, in fact, extraordinarily gifted. Emeka is terrified that Chidi''s condition is getting worse.', N'Expansive, colorful, heavily code-switched between Igbo phrases, Swedish-inflected sentence structure, and Undertow street pidgin. Uses food metaphors constantly.', N'Fast with big dramatic pauses for effect — he knows he''s performing and does it consciously', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dipti_guerrero_oh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d9-77e5-9015-6c2710100923', N'Adalberto Mohammadi', N'Adalberto', N'', N'Mohammadi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Fort Anchor, GLMZ, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Internal Affairs Investigator, Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division — Internal Affairs Division', N'Adalberto Mohammadi is a lean, angular woman whose Igbo-Icelandic heritage settled into something striking and hard to read — dark brown skin that catches fluorescent light like burnished copper, pale grey eyes that her colleagues call ''interrogation eyes'' because they seem to wait rather than look. She keeps her natural hair close-cropped and does not bother with cosmetic geneware, which in itself feels like a statement of seriousness in a precinct full of color-shifted irises and decorative claw-tips. She moves through the Fort Anchor bullpen with the careful economy of someone who has spent two decades watching other people make mistakes.

Adalberto Mohammadi is not cruel, but she is relentless. She became Internal Affairs after her partner of six years was found selling seized evidence back into Copperhead''s black market circuits — a betrayal she discovered herself and reported herself, and which she has not spoken about voluntarily since. She believes the Arcturus Civil Security is worth saving, which is the most dangerous possible disposition for an IA investigator to have. She keeps a small data-shrine to the E.L.F. called the Ledger in her desk drawer, feeding it transaction logs and anonymized tip files in hope of some pattern-blessing she would never admit to hoping for.', N'Quest giver for investigations touching police corruption; moral mirror for player characters operating in legal grey zones; source of procedural information and inter-departmental friction; a figure who can be an ally or an obstacle depending on whether the players are technically innocent', N'', N'Standard-issue police neural-link for accessing MPD databases; subdermal stress-response monitor (department-mandated for IA); no cosmetic mods', N'Arrives at Fort Anchor before her shift officially begins, reviewing overnight misconduct flags over black synthi-coffee; spends evenings cross-referencing financial disclosures with public contract records in her apartment, often past midnight.', N'Adalberto Mohammadi, lean 172cm woman with warm medium-brown skin, golden and copper undertones, high angular cheekbones, pale grey-blue eyes striking against her complexion, military close-cropped dark brown hair nearly black. Faint jawline scar, burn scars on hands, stress lines between brows. Charcoal grey Arcturus Civil Security internal affairs duty jacket over black synthetic-weave shirt, black utility pants, steel-toed boots. Economical controlled posture, watchful expression, standing in neon-lit police bullpen or interrogation room. GLMZ, fluorescent and cool LED lighting, professional detachment, alert readiness. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Fort Anchor', N'local', N'Fort Anchor', N'Mixed ancestry with dominant Middle Eastern (33.9%), Southeast Asian (16.0%), Indigenous American (16.0%), Sub-Saharan African (15.5%), South Asian (14.7%), and Hispanic/Latin American (3.9%) heritage. The genetic convergence creates distinctive phenotypic characteristics: warm medium-brown skin with golden and copper undertones from Middle Eastern, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry; high, angular cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian and Middle Eastern bone structure; and naturally pale grey-blue eyes—a recessive trait that emerges distinctly against her warm complexion, creating striking visual contrast.', 172, 58, N'Lean and angular, with defined musculature from disciplined cardio work rather than gym augmentation. Her frame suggests economy of movement — nothing wasted, everything functional. Shoulders set slightly back, suggesting years of desk posture corrected by conscious habit.', N'Natural dark brown, nearly black', N'Close-cropped, military precision, no styling product — just clean geometry against her scalp', N'Short', N'Pale grey-blue, nearly silver in certain light; a striking natural recessive expression that creates deliberate visual tension with her warm medium-brown complexion', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and copper undertones, burnished highlights at temples and cheekbones creating subtle luminescence in fluorescent environments', N'Minimal cosmetic intervention; skin shows the weathering of two decades of police work and stress-induced insomnia. High, prominent cheekbones with Southeast Asian and Middle Eastern angularity blended with Sub-Saharan African and South Asian heritage features. Mouth set in a default neutral line that reads as skeptical. Faint stress lines between her brows. No visible blemishes; skin care is clinical and consistent. Facial structure reflects the blend of her diverse heritage — neither singular nor indistinct, but distinctly her own.', N'None visible. The neural-link port is behind her left ear beneath her close-cropped hair. The subdermal stress-response monitor creates no visible bulge or discoloration.', N'Economical and controlled. She walks with her weight slightly forward, as if prepared to stop or redirect quickly. In interrogation rooms or bullpen meetings, she sits with her spine straight and hands visible, creating an impression of watchfulness that is purely postural. Her eyes move before her head. She does not fidget.', N'Standard-issue Arcturus Civil Security internal affairs uniform: charcoal grey duty jacket over black synthetic-weave shirt, both tailored to fit without excess fabric. Black utility pants with minimal visible pockets — most gear is internal or digital. Steel-toed boots, well-maintained. When off-duty, she wears similar utilitarian clothing: dark neutral colors, high-performance synthetics, nothing decorative. No jewelry. Her badge and department credentials are always within arm''s reach.', N'The evidence she found on her former partner was discovered during an illegal warrantless search she conducted on personal suspicion — meaning the case, technically, was built on fruit of a poisoned tree. She buried the procedural violation and the case held. She thinks about it every single day.', N'Precise, Latinate, formal without being stiff — uses full sentences, rarely contracts, gravitates toward legal terminology even in casual conversation', N'Measured and deliberate, with long pauses before responding to anything she considers important; never raises her voice', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'adalberto_mohammadi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b6-7231-b3bb-6c39b329f062', N'Santiago Soriano', N'Santiago', N'', N'Soriano', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 60, 0, N'active', N'Brightmoor Reclamation — Soil & Signal Community School, a converted warehouse building, near Ashland and Division', N'Primary school teacher at a community-funded school', N'Soil & Signal Community School (independent, community-funded); informal ties to Brightmoor Reclamation neighborhood council', N'Santiago Soriano is a middle-height man with warm bronze-brown skin, an unruly beard he loses the war against on a weekly basis, and deep-set eyes that are perpetually slightly too interested in whatever is happening. His only geneware is a bioluminescent patch behind his left ear — pale blue-green, about the size of a thumb — that he got as a young man and has since forgotten to maintain, so it flickers unpredictably in low light like a lamp with a loose connection. He dresses in layers of mismatched professional clothing that suggests someone who used to care about presentation and has reached an accommodation with reality.

Soil & Signal serves eighty-odd children from Brightmoor Reclamation''s patchwork communities and operates on donated equipment, community Quanta subscriptions, and the collective will of eight staff members who could all earn more elsewhere. Santiago Soriano teaches the seven-to-ten cohort: mathematics, civic systems, and what the curriculum calls Environmental Literacy, which in practice means explaining to children why some parts of the city are poisoned and who made that decision. He is a genuinely gifted teacher — patient, inventive, unafraid to say ''I don''t know'' — who has let the demands of the school hollow out most of the rest of his life without quite noticing.', N'Human face of a community under pressure — his school is a gathering point for the neighborhood and its fate reflects the fate of Brightmoor. Quest giver for situations involving children or community welfare. Information source about the Reclamation''s history and politics. Represents the cost of idealism sustained without support.', N'', N'Bioluminescent patch behind left ear (cosmetic, pale blue-green, flickering/poorly maintained). No other augmentations.', N'Arrives at school by 07:30, teaches until 15:30, spends evenings on lesson planning, parent communications, and grant applications. Eats whatever the school kitchen has left over. Rarely sleeps enough.', N'Santiago Soriano, a 172cm lean neo-noir educator with deep warm bronze-brown skin with golden undertones, blending Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian ancestry. Dark brown hair graying at temples, tousled and swept back. Deep warm brown eyes, weathered and tired. Broader facial features with prominent cheekbones, persistent stubble, fine lines around eyes and mouth. Leaning slightly forward in an attentive pose. Wearing mismatched layers: wrinkled neutral button-up shirt under a faded cardigan from decades past, casual trousers, worn shoes. Bioluminescent geneware patch glowing faintly behind left ear in pale blue-green. Dim classroom lighting, dust motes in air. Hands gesturing openly. GLMZ, GLMZ tier 4 setting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Brightmoor Reclamation', N'local', N'Brightmoor Reclamation', N'Mixed ancestry from Hispanic/Latin American (59.1%), Sub-Saharan African (20.8%), and South Asian (20.1%) heritage. This genetic combination creates a distinctive phenotype: the Latin American and African ancestry contributes warm deep brown tones and broader facial structure, while the South Asian component adds subtle cheekbone prominence and refined facial proportions. The result is a rich, complex complexion with golden-bronze warmth throughout.', 172, 71, N'Lean, slightly slouched from years of bending over student desks. Shoulders rounded forward. Wiry rather than muscular, with the kind of frame that suggests he forgets to eat regularly.', N'Dark brown, graying at the temples', N'Tousled, often swept back with one hand during teaching. Usually has a few strands falling forward across his forehead.', N'Medium', N'Deep brown, warm but tired', N'Deep warm bronze-brown with golden undertones. Rich melanin content from the African and Latin American ancestry creates depth and warmth, while South Asian heritage adds subtle radiance to the complexion. Consistent warm richness across the face and body.', N'Weathered in a way that suggests years of living in a lower-tier neighborhood. Facial structure shows broader features reflecting African and Latin American heritage, with cheekbone prominence and refined proportions visible from South Asian ancestry. Persistent shadow of stubble; the unruly beard he mentions losing the weekly war against. Fine lines around his eyes and mouth from constant expression — smiling, frowning, concentrating. Skin is clear but not particularly cared-for; no visible scarring.', N'Only the bioluminescent patch behind left ear, which occasionally glows weakly. Otherwise no visible cybernetics or bioware.', N'Perpetually leaning slightly forward, as if genuinely interested in whatever is in front of him — or listening intently. Hands move frequently when talking; gestures are open and encouraging. Movements are efficient but not rushed; he moves like someone who has learned to be present in a room rather than urgent.', N'Layers of mismatched professional clothing suggesting abandoned formality. Usually wears a neutral-colored button-up shirt (often wrinkled, sometimes with chalk dust or food stains) under a cardigan or blazer from three different decades, paired with casual trousers. Occasionally wears a vest. Shoes are worn but functional — school-safe, not fashionable. Nothing matches intentionally. Overall appearance reads as ''used to care about presentation, has made peace with that not being possible anymore.'' Tier 4 clothing — functional, donated, assembled without aesthetic concern.', N'Three years ago he was approached by a Tessera educational subsidiary offering to fund the school in exchange for curriculum oversight. He refused — but he told no one about the offer, and recently the school''s financial situation has become desperate enough that he''s started drafting a response. He has not sent it but he saves it each night.', N'Educated and thoughtful, with a habit of restating questions before answering them. Occasional Malayalam or Lingala phrases that surface when he''s not monitoring himself.', N'Warm and professorial — builds ideas aloud, reaches conclusions through conversation rather than before it.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'santiago_soriano');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c4-7a35-97d9-6c50d62b3712', N'Fabio Kamara', N'Fabio', N'', N'Kamara', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 36, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Pilsen Veil, runs a studio called Dermis & Ghost out of a converted freight container, near Halsted and Division', N'Gene-mod body artist and tattooist', N'Independent; maintains a professional relationship with a Helix Biosystems field rep who looks the other way on some of her unlicensed geneware sourcing in exchange for referrals', N'Fabio Kamara is compact and deliberate in movement, with dark olive skin covered from throat to ankle in her own accumulated work — a living portfolio in bioluminescent pigment, dermal sculpture, and chromatic scale-pattern geneware that shifts between copper and deep teal depending on her body temperature. Her canines are cosmetically elongated and slightly iridescent, a piece she did on herself at twenty-two that she now considers slightly embarrassing but has kept because removal would leave scars. Her hair is a complex architectural shape, natural black at the root and heat-reactive at the tips, changing from rust to amber when she''s working close to the pigment-heating instruments.

Fabio Kamara''s reputation in Pilsen Veil is built on what regulars call ''the consultation'' — a two-hour process before any work begins, in which she asks questions about the client''s life that seem invasive until the finished piece makes them make sense. She treats body modification as a form of autobiography, and she will refuse work she finds dishonest or purely decorative. This makes her difficult and expensive and perpetually booked three months out. She is also a quiet authority on geneware interactions and has more practical knowledge of mod-compatibility than most licensed Helix Biosystems techs.', N'Service provider and confidante — clients tell her things during long sessions they''d never say elsewhere; she''s a passive information node and potential quest giver when a client''s secret lands her in trouble; also a resource for geneware knowledge and gray-market biotech contacts', N'', N'Full-body bioluminescent pigment work (her own, accumulated over fifteen years); chromatic scale-pattern geneware across shoulders and ribcage (copper-to-teal, temperature-reactive); cosmetically elongated iridescent canines; heat-reactive hair tips (cosmetic geneware); subdermal portfolio display on inner left forearm showing design thumbnails', N'Saoirse opens Dermis & Ghost at noon and works until she decides to stop, which is rarely before midnight; she spends mornings sourcing pigments and geneware from suppliers in Pilsen Veil''s gray market and doing design work; she eats one proper meal a day at a Latvian-Ghanaian fusion stall two containers down.', N'Fabio Kamara, 162cm compact wiry geneware artist, warm deep brown skin glowing faintly with bioluminescent pigment work covering throat to ankle in intricate layered designs; high defined cheekbones blending East Asian and Sub-Saharan features with prominent jawline and fuller South Asian facial proportions; dark brown natural eyes, direct and evaluative gaze; asymmetric black hair (medium left, short right) with rust-amber heat-reactive tips; elongated iridescent canines visible in slight smile; copper-to-deep-teal temperature-reactive chromatic scale-pattern geneware across bare shoulders and ribcage; subdermal portfolio display geometric thumbnails faintly visible on inner left forearm; charcoal sleeveless technician vest over fitted black thermals showcasing augmentations, stained with pigments; reinforced cargo pants, worn leather work boots, silver rings on every finger; precise posture leaning slightly forward, hands poised with deliberate control; GLMZ GLMZ underground geneware workshop, cool blue-green neon lighting casting subtle bioluminescent glow across skin, wet industrial workspace, shallow depth of field focusing on her hands near delicate design work, moody atmospheric lighting with warm shadows --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Pilsen Veil', N'local', N'Pilsen Veil', N'South Asian dominant (43.6%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (35.2%), East Asian (14.7%), and Northern European (6.5%) ancestry—a striking global blend resulting in warm deep brown skin with subtle warm undertones from the interplay of South Asian richness, African depth, and East Asian luminosity', 162, 54, N'Compact and wiry, muscular in the forearms and hands from precision work; minimal body fat; economical posture suggesting years of hunching over detail work', N'Natural black at root with heat-reactive cosmetic geneware at tips, shifts rust-to-amber when working', N'Architectural; shaved on one side, longer on the other in an asymmetric cut that frames her left temple; styled to expose the nape', N'Medium (left) to short (right)', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Warm deep brown with rich undertones; the blending of South Asian warmth, Sub-Saharan depth, East Asian luminosity, and Northern European undertones creates a complexion that shifts visibly in different light—neither fully cool nor fully golden but a harmonious warm richness that glows in low light', N'Skin condition excellent despite heavy pigmentation work; minimal scarring from professional technique; features blend multiple heritages—high, defined cheekbones characteristic of East Asian ancestry combined with a strong, prominent jawline reflecting Sub-Saharan structure and fuller facial proportions from South Asian heritage; expression habitually focused and evaluative', N'Full-body bioluminescent pigment system (glows faintly in low light, pulses subtly with body temperature); chromatic scale-pattern geneware across shoulders and ribs that shifts color based on thermal state; elongated iridescent canines visible when she smiles or speaks; heat-reactive hair tips that change color during work; subdermal portfolio display on left forearm (faintly visible beneath skin as geometric thumbnail shapes)', N'Precise and economical; sits still for long periods with perfect spinal alignment; hand movements are deliberate and controlled, occasionally self-soothing—fingers tracing her own pigment work when thinking; walks with a slight forward lean, as if always moving toward the next task; makes direct eye contact during consultations, studies people rather than observing them', N'Tier 3 working-class with deliberate aesthetic choices; typically wears modified lab coat or sleeveless technician vest (charcoal or deep indigo) over fitted black thermals to showcase her visible augmentations; practical cargo pants or modified denim with reinforced pockets for tools; worn leather work boots (Latvian-made if she can source them); silver ring on every finger—some homemade, some antique; no unnecessary jewelry beyond functional pieces; always wears a small cooling rig on one wrist (barely visible, aesthetic-conscious about hiding it); clothes are stained with pigments in ways she doesn''t try to hide', N'She has a private archive of design sketches for every client she''s ever turned away — work she wanted to do but they weren''t ready for — and she thinks about these phantom pieces more than her actual completed work', N'Precise and somatic — talks about abstract concepts in physical terms; uses Latvian diminutives inherited from a grandparent when speaking softly to nervous clients', N'Unhurried, with long pauses she''s comfortable inhabiting; asks questions and waits', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fabio_kamara');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a662-7293-bedc-6c7b28220db9', N'Alankrita Nygaard', N'Alankrita', N'', N'Nygaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, beneath the Kessler Interchange overpass, near Damen and Armitage', N'Junk merchant and scrap reseller', N'Independent; founding member of the Oxidian Market Vendors Guild; informal supply relationship with Ferrogate Transit maintenance workers; The Interchange', N'Alankrita Nygaard is small, dense, and permanent-looking, like a boulder that has decided to become a person. Her dark skin is mapped with the small scars of a lifetime handling sharp metal, and her left arm from the elbow down is a functional prosthetic she salvaged and assembled herself over the course of a decade — mismatched parts from at least four different manufacturers, currently painted a deep burgundy with yellow geometric lines her grandchildren helped design. She wears magnification goggles pushed up on her forehead at all times, leaving permanent red rings around her eyes. Her natural hair is cropped close and gone entirely silver.

She knows the value of everything. Not the price — the value. She can hold a stripped circuit board for ten seconds and tell you where it came from, what it''s worth in raw materials versus function, and who in a three-block radius might want it. Her operation under the Interchange overpass is technically three stalls collapsed into one vast organized heap that only she can navigate. She has regular buyers from Ferrogate Transit''s maintenance crews, independent augmentation techs, and two separate Tier 3 corponation contractors who pretend they don''t buy from unlicensed salvage. She is sixty-seven years old and has never once been successfully cheated.', N'Resource and information hub; can source unusual technical components; her decades of presence mean she knows everyone and has seen everything; potential quest giver when stolen goods pass through her hands', N'', N'Self-assembled left forearm prosthetic (salvaged, functional, painted); magnification goggles (non-surgical, worn); subvocal mic implant for hands-free communication while working', N'Arrives at the Interchange before sunrise to receive overnight salvage drops from her network of scavengers, sorts and prices stock through the morning, runs negotiations and sales through the afternoon, and closes with a ritual offering of a single discarded data chip to the Gear-E.L.F. she believes inhabits the Interchange''s traffic control node.', N'Alankrita Nygaard, 152cm salvage worker in GLMZ, warm medium-brown skin with copper undertones reflecting Indigenous American, Southeast Asian, and Hispanic ancestry. Deep brown eyes, short silver-white hair in tight coils. Worn canvas work pants, burnt orange sleeveless utilitarian vest over black thermal shirt. Left forearm prosthetic in brushed steel and polymer, painted deep burgundy with yellow geometric patterns. Magnification goggles on forehead, permanent pressure marks around eyes. White scars mapping her hands and forearms from decades of salvage work. Grounded, economical posture. Industrial salvage yard setting, neon-tinted overhead lighting casting sharp shadows, scattered metal debris and machinery around her. Mood: focused, weathered, resilient. Holding a piece of salvage, examining it with systematic precision. Gritty, authentic neo-noir urban aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Triblended ancestry of Hispanic/Latin American (42%), Southeast Asian (31%), and Indigenous American (27%) creates a distinctive phenotype. Warm medium-brown skin with copper and golden undertones reflects the rich genetic combination. Facial structure shows Indigenous American prominence in high, defined cheekbones and strong jaw geometry, enhanced by Southeast Asian refinement of features and the warmth characteristic of Latin American heritage. The overall appearance conveys ancestral depth and resilience.', 152, 68, N'Dense and compact, solid without heaviness. Muscular forearms and shoulders from decades of manual salvage work; core strength concentrated like coiled spring steel.', N'Silver-white, natural grey', N'Closely cropped in tight coils, revealing the full shape of her skull', N'Short', N'Deep brown, natural', N'Warm medium-brown with copper and golden undertones, weathered from outdoor work under industrial lighting. The complexion reflects the rich warmth of blended Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, and Indigenous American heritage.', N'Heavily mapped with fine white scar tissue across knuckles, fingers, and forearms from handling sharp metal. Deep smile lines and crow''s feet. Permanent red pressure rings around eyes from magnification goggles worn daily for decades. Skin texture roughened but clean, no signs of neglect. Facial structure shows Indigenous American prominence in cheekbones and facial geometry, enriched by Southeast Asian delicacy and Latin American warmth.', N'Left forearm prosthetic from elbow down: mismatched modular components in brushed steel and polymer, currently painted deep burgundy with yellow geometric line patterns (child-designed). Synthetic musculature visible at wrist joint. Magnification goggles worn perpetually on forehead — optical grade, non-surgical, heavy frames. Subvocal mic implant barely visible as thin silver line along left jawline, approximately 4cm in length.', N'Moves with deliberate economy, no wasted motion. Stance is grounded and stable — shoulders squared, weight distributed evenly. Head tilts slightly when listening or evaluating merchandise. Left arm (prosthetic) moves with mechanical precision but human rhythm. Hands constantly active: sorting, testing, measuring. Eyes move in quick systematic patterns when assessing salvage.', N'Tier 3-4 working wear, functional and worn. Heavy canvas work pants in charcoal grey, patched at knees and pockets. Sleeveless utilitarian vest in burnt orange with multiple cargo pockets, all filled. Thermal undershirt in faded black beneath. Steel-toed work boots, scuffed and resoled multiple times. Magnification goggles hung on forehead. No jewelry except a single band of industrial tape wrapped around left wrist where prosthetic meets skin — tape changes color weekly. Clothing smells faintly of machine oil and metal dust.', N'She knows that a particular lot of salvage she moved two years ago contained components stripped from a Ferrogate Transit worker who died in a maintenance accident — the same accident that killed her husband sixteen years earlier. The components bore the same maintenance tag sequence. She said nothing, sold them to a Tier 3 contractor, and has been quietly trying to determine if the accidents are connected.', N'Terse and technical; uses weight and material vocabulary as metaphors; occasional Igbo proverbs delivered without explanation', N'Short sentences. Pauses that mean more than words. Never uses two syllables where one will do.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alankrita_nygaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5be-7a94-be47-6c8e81a1e8bf', N'Eidur Mwangi-Kabwit', N'Eidur', N'', N'Mwangi-Kabwit', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, permanent pitch at the corner of Grainfort and Ironvein, near North Ave and Damen', N'Noodle cart vendor, The Burnished Market', N'Independent (Burnished Market Vendors'' Collective, informal)', N'Eidur Mwangi-Kabwit is a large, slow-moving man with the kind of bulk that was once muscle and has settled into something more geological. His skin is dark walnut brown, his beard full and peppered grey-white, worn in four loose plaits he ties back during service hours. His Turkish grandmother gave him the Öztürk and a nose like a falcon''s beak; his Samoan great-grandfather gave him the Savea and shoulders like a doorframe. He wears the same thing every day: a heat-resistant apron over a sleeveless thermal, arms bare to show the geometric Samoan-style tattoo that wraps from his left wrist to his shoulder, and under it on the inside of his wrist, half-hidden, a small Yoruba adinkra symbol his mother pressed there with a needle when he was seven. Behind the cart he moves with surprising economy, three things happening in each hand simultaneously.

He doesn''t talk much while working, but when the lunch rush ebbs he will lean on the cart and hold a conversation that feels unhurried in a way that is almost physically restful. He has opinions about everything — city politics, the flavor profile of various E.L.F.s'' preferred data offerings, whether the Ferrogate expansion is actually gentrification in a steel tube — but he delivers them the way he delivers broth: slow, hot, with depth that surprises you. He has been at this corner for twenty-two years. He knows every face.', N'The neighborhood oracle — has seen everything, knows everyone, rarely volunteers information but rarely refuses a direct question from someone he''s decided to trust. Quest giver for neighborhood-level problems. Offers food as social currency.', N'', N'Thermal-resistant dermal layer on both palms (practical, work-grade); bioluminescent ink in the tattoo on his left arm that pulses faint blue-gold in the dark — a cosmetic addition his daughter talked him into ten years ago', N'Arrives at his pitch at 0530, sets up, runs breakfast and lunch service, breaks down by 1600. Thursdays he closes early to attend the Vendors'' Collective meeting. Evenings he cooks for himself and whoever wanders to his building''s communal floor.', N'Eidur Mwangi-Kabwit, 188cm tall heavyweight man with deep warm brown skin with golden-olive undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American heritage blend. Weathered face with broad cheekbones, strong jaw, peppered full beard close to jawline. Dark brown eyes. Dark brown hair with grey threading, arranged in four loose plaits hanging mid-back. Large geometric Samoan-style black tattoo with bioluminescent blue-gold threading wrapping left wrist to shoulder, glowing faintly. Smaller faded Yoruba adinkra symbol on inner left wrist. Both palms show thermal-resistant chrome dermal plating with matte finish. Wearing charcoal-grey heat-resistant work apron over sleeveless cream thermal shirt, arms bare to show tattoos. Steel-toed work shoes, worn. Hands show calluses and minor scars from kitchen work. Standing with calm, rooted confidence, weight forward-leaning against cart. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone street food vendor setting, evening atmosphere, neon-tinged ambient lighting highlighting the bioluminescent tattoo glow, industrial food cart environment, utilitarian work-class aesthetic, deep shadows and warm practical lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (75.2%) with significant East Asian (12.0%), South Asian (8.9%), and Hispanic/Latin American (3.9%) ancestry—a genetic blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Phenotypically displays deep warm brown skin with subtle golden and olive undertones from the Asian admixture, broad facial structure characteristic of Sub-Saharan African ancestry, with refined eye shape and prominent cheekbones influenced by East and South Asian genetics. The Hispanic/Latin American component adds warmth and slight variation to overall tone.', 188, 112, N'Large and solid—once muscular, now settled into a heavyweight frame that moves with deliberate economy. Broad shoulders and deep chest give him presence even at rest.', N'Dark brown with prominent grey-white threading throughout', N'Four loose plaits, typically tied back with simple cord during service hours; plaits hang loose in evenings', N'Medium (plaited to mid-back when loose)', N'Deep brown', N'Deep warm brown with golden-olive undertones, reflecting the dominant Sub-Saharan African ancestry enriched by the subtle warmth and undertone complexity from East Asian, South Asian, and Hispanic/Latin American admixture', N'Weathered and lined from decades of outdoor work and age; skin texture roughened by heat exposure and steam. Full peppered beard worn close to the jaw. Facial structure shows the broad cheekbones, prominent nose bridge, and strong jaw characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage, refined by the more angular eye placement and cheekbone prominence from East Asian genetics, with South Asian warmth contributing to overall dimensionality. Hands show callusing and minor scarring from kitchen work.', N'Both palms display subtle thermal-resistant dermal plating—visible as a slightly raised, matte-finish texture across the palms and inner fingers, practical work-grade chrome with minimal aesthetic polish. The bioluminescent ink in his left arm tattoo glows faintly blue-gold in low light.', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, slightly forward-leaning when at rest against the cart. Moves with surprising grace and efficiency despite bulk—three simultaneous hand movements are fluid and economical. Carries himself with the unhurried confidence of someone rooted in place.', N'Uniform consistency: heat-resistant work apron (charcoal-grey, oil-stained at edges, patches from years of service) worn over sleeveless thermal shirt in cream or faded black. Arms always bare to display tattoo. Worn steel-toed work shoes, practical rather than fashionable. No jewelry except occasional cord tie for plaits. Tier 4 working-class functionality—built for durability and heat management, not status.', N'The Vendors'' Collective''s emergency fund — which he informally administers — is Φ4,000 short because twelve years ago he used it to bribe a city inspector to overlook code violations that would have shut down six other vendors'' stalls. He has never told anyone and has been quietly paying it back at Φ30 a month ever since.', N'Warm, unhurried, vernacular-rich. Mixes Yoruba endearments, some Turkish expressions for frustration, occasional Samoan cadences in his syntax.', N'Slow and deliberate. Pauses for effect. Never rushes.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eidur_mwangi_kabwit');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60e-7d19-ad90-6ccb5e66522a', N'Kaya Kimura-Waboose', N'Kaya', N'', N'Kimura-Waboose', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Overhang — residential shelves built onto megastructure exteriors, near Halsted and Division', N'Contract broker and resource coordinator — fixer', N'Freelance — works the Gray Zone circuit exclusively', N'Kaya Kimura-Waboose is slight and easy to overlook, which is exactly the point. At 28, her face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Kaya Kimura-Waboose plans to keep it that way. She works as a fixer out of The Overhang, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Kaya Kimura-Waboose lacks in subtlety, she compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'Fanta Kato-Adomako represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would incapacitate. Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Kaya Kimura-Waboose, GLMZ, portrait of a 162cm lean East-Indigenous-South Asian mixed-heritage woman with warm bronze skin, golden-reddish undertones, high cheekbones, sharp jawline, dark brown eyes with amber flecks, shoulder-length black hair with dark undertones. Three thin white scars visible on right forearm, small geometric tattoo on right wrist. Chrome neural interface jack at base of skull, silvered and visible. Dark fitted clothing, grey canvas messenger bag, practical worn boots. Slight forward lean, economical posture, tracking eyes. High-stress work lines around eyes. Neutral expression. Neo-noir urban aesthetic, moody urban lighting, shallow depth of field, 2226 neural augmentation technology visible. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Overhang', N'local', N'The Overhang', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend with Indigenous American plurality (30.8%) anchoring warm, earth-toned features, complemented by significant South Asian (16.6%), East Asian (14.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (13.6%), and North African (13.6%) ancestry with Sub-Saharan African (11.3%) deepening undertones — resulting in a complex warm bronze complexion with golden and reddish undertones across multiple ancestry groups, creating dimensional warmth throughout the face and body', 162, 51, N'Lean and wiry — deceptively fragile-looking, but muscular in the shoulders and forearms from years of fieldwork. Low body fat, efficient frame designed for movement rather than presence.', N'Black with subtle dark brown undertones', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid when working; loose shoulder-length when civilian', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with subtle amber undertones', N'Warm earth-bronze with golden-reddish undertones — richly dimensional complexion reflecting the blend of Indigenous American (30.8%), South Asian (16.6%), North African (13.6%), and Sub-Saharan African (11.3%) ancestry, naturally radiant with warm depth throughout', N'Angular face with high, prominent cheekbones and sharp jawline reflecting East Asian and Indigenous American heritage, balanced by warmer pigmentation and slightly broader structure from South Asian and Hispanic ancestry. Skin maintains an even, warm tone with minimal blemishes, though faint lines around the eyes betray irregular sleep and high-stress work. Lips full and often set in neutral expression. Subtle warmth variations across face—golden highlights in cheeks, deeper undertones in hollows—suggesting complex six-way genetic blending across continents.', N'Chrome pain editor visible at base of skull — a silvered neural interface jack protruding slightly through skin at C7 vertebra, roughly 8mm diameter. Right temple shows the faint subdermal outline of a neural interface module beneath skin. No visible limb replacements or extensive chrome work — augmentations are strategic and minimal.', N'Economical and controlled — she moves with purpose, never wasted motion. Slight forward lean in the shoulders, as if perpetually ready to move. Eyes track exits and sightlines instinctively. In civilian mode, deliberately adopts a more rounded posture and relaxed gait to avoid drawing attention.', N'Off-duty: neutral Tier 4 basics — fitted dark grey or black synthetic-weave pants, unmarked hoodies or fitted long-sleeves, minimal branding. Worn work boots with good tread. A grey canvas messenger bag, overstuffed and practical. During contracts: reinforced jacket with internal pockets, tactical harness beneath outer layer, gloves. Everything muted, functional, forgettable.', N'', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'kaya_kimura_waboose');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ac-73cd-9b1a-6ccfd8e53682', N'Zuri Okonkwo-Nygaard', N'Zuri', N'', N'Okonkwo-Nygaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 68, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, in a narrow shopfront on the market row near the Enclave''s eastern water distribution point, near Ashland and Division', N'Puppet maker and street performer, builds intricate autonomous marionettes that he performs with in Hamtramck Enclave''s open markets', N'Independent; respected elder figure in Hamtramck Enclave''s community governance, though he holds no formal position; The Reclaimed', N'Zuri Okonkwo-Nygaard is a small man who has become smaller with age, slightly stooped at the shoulders from sixty years of bending over workbenches, but his hands remain extraordinary — large, dexterous, with the kind of still precision that seems to defy his years. He is dark-skinned with deep-set eyes that are permanently amused, and his beard has gone fully white, which he maintains with careful grooming as though it is itself a costume element. He dresses simply — worn linen in greys and browns — but he always wears one item of intense color: a scarf, a hat, a single embroidered sleeve. He has no geneware or cosmetic augmentation; he considers his face and body sufficient material.

His puppets are not toys. They are articulated figures between thirty centimeters and human-sized, built from salvaged materials — circuit board lace, reclaimed myomer muscle fiber, repurposed drone casings — and each one contains a simple autonomous loop that gives it a persistent behavioral signature even when Zuri Okonkwo-Nygaard is not operating it. Children adore them. Adults find them quietly unsettling. He has been making them for forty years and has lost count of how many exist; many have been sold or given away and now drift through the city in owners'' homes, continuing their small repetitive behaviors. He performs in the market three days a week, and his shows are ostensibly for children but are genuinely allegories of Hamtramck''s political situation, delivered with such gentleness that the sharpness takes a moment to land.', N'Community elder and information hub for Hamtramck Enclave; his long memory makes him a source of historical context; his puppets have been distributed widely and occasionally carry more information than their owners realize; quest giver for community-protection storylines', N'', N'None — proudly and vocally unaugmented, though he has no objection to augmentation in others', N'Rises before dawn to work in quiet, attends the Enclave''s morning ELF devotions at the market shrine (respectful observer rather than true believer), performs in the afternoon, spends evenings teaching anyone who asks how to build the simplest mechanisms. Eats communally whenever possible.', N'Zuri Okonkwo-Nygaard, elderly master technician of mixed global heritage, warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, weathered by decades of precision work, white closely-trimmed beard, short sparse white hair, dark warm brown eyes with deep laugh lines, slight frame with rounded shoulders from workbench posture, wiry strength in hands scarred from soldering and salvage work. Wearing worn grey linen shirt and brown trousers, layered with a rust-colored cap and deep indigo scarf, hand-embroidered sleeve details in reds and golds, thin smooth silver ring on left ring finger, practical scuffed shoes. Seated at worn salvage workbench surrounded by half-deconstructed cybernetic components, neon glow from diagnostics casting cyan and amber light across his weathered hands, calm knowing expression, steady eye contact, slight smile. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, intimate workshop lighting, technological yet organic, wise craftsman defying augmentation in an age of forced enhancement --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (54.3%) with meaningful secondary ancestries from Northern European (10.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (9.5%), East Asian (9.4%), North African (9.1%), and Southeast Asian (7.4%)—a genuinely global genetic blend visible in his warm deep brown skin with golden and reddish undertones, the refined bone structure that balances broad cheekbones with tapering chin, and dark brown eyes that carry warmth from multiple continental traditions', 158, 52, N'Slight and diminished by age, shoulders rounded forward from decades of workbench posture, but with a wiry core strength that belies his years. His frame reads as deliberate economy of motion rather than frailty.', N'White', N'Closely trimmed beard, meticulously groomed; sparse hair on crown, kept short', N'Short', N'Dark brown, warm and perpetually creased at the corners from smiling', N'Warm deep brown with golden and reddish undertones—the blended result of dominant Sub-Saharan African ancestry (54.3%) enriched by North African warmth, Hispanic warmth, and subtle East Asian influence, weathered but even across decades', N'Face lined with age and expression—deep laugh lines around eyes and mouth dominate his features, with cheekbone structure reflecting the confluence of Sub-Saharan, North African, Hispanic, and East Asian ancestry. Skin is clean and well-maintained; his hands show decades of minor cuts and stains from working with salvage materials. The white beard is his most striking grooming choice, maintained with visible care as a deliberate aesthetic statement.', N'None. His hands remain entirely biological—calloused, stained with solder residue and mineral marks, visibly unaugmented. This is an intentional choice he wears like a conviction.', N'Moves with careful deliberation despite his age—each gesture economical and precise, as though he is constantly aware of delicate mechanisms. His posture is slightly stooped but never collapsed; when seated at work, he straightens noticeably. His hands move with remarkable stillness and control, rarely fidgeting. He maintains steady eye contact and smiles frequently, but his default expression is one of mild, knowing amusement.', N'Tier 3-4 practical simplicity: worn linen shirts and trousers in greys and browns, faded from washing and age but scrupulously clean. Always layered with one element of intense, deliberate color—a deep indigo scarf, a rust-colored cap, a sleeve with hand-embroidered geometric patterns in reds and golds. His single concession to ornamentation is a thin silver ring on his left ring finger, worn smooth. No corporate branding. Shoes are practical, well-maintained, slightly scuffed.', N'', N'Rich and slightly formal, peppered with proverbs from at least three different traditions; tells stories instead of making arguments', N'Unhurried, with a performer''s sense of timing — he knows when to pause for effect', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'zuri_okonkwo_nygaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a710-7d2f-8689-6cd9e1ef27bc', N'Ha-eun Vestergaard', N'Ha-eun', N'', N'Vestergaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Shallowgrave, operates from a legitimate alterations shop called Secondskin, near Ashland and Division', N'Identity fabricator and document forger', N'Nominally independent; pays a quiet tax to a Shallowgrave crew called the Patchwork for protection, has a standing arrangement with two different data brokers who supply her with raw credential templates', N'Ha-eun Vestergaard the most ordinary woman imaginable, which is her primary professional qualification. She is medium height, medium build, with Samoan-Slavic features that read as ambiguous in any database — a long jaw softened by her Armenian grandmother''s cheekbones, dark eyes behind plain-glass frames she doesn''t need but wears to give her face something to remember that isn''t her face. Her hair is dark brown with a natural wave, cut to exactly jaw length, never different. She wears the same four outfits on a rotation. She has no mods, no geneware, nothing that would tag her biometrically beyond baseline. This is not poverty — it is discipline.

Secondhand clothes hang in the windows of Secondskin and Velislava does genuinely good alteration work; she has a waiting list of neighborhood clients who would be devastated to lose her. They have no idea that the back room behind the ironing press contains one of the finest document fabrication setups in the Shallowgrave district — not the flashiest, not the most expensive, but the most meticulous. Vel specializes in the boring and bulletproof: employment histories, medical records, transit passes, residential registrations. Not spectacular new identities for runners. Clean paper for desperate people. She tells herself this distinction matters morally. Some days she believes it.', N'Quest giver, service provider, moral gray zone — she''s the person characters go to when they need to become someone else, and she has terms, questions, and standards that complicate the transaction.', N'', N'None visible or registered. She has an unregistered optical enhancement — right eye only — that lets her read microprint and spot document irregularities at close range. She had it installed by a back-alley clinic in Ironvein and it doesn''t appear on any medical record.', N'Opens the shop at nine, sees alteration clients until two, closes for a ''lunch break'' that is actually fabrication work, reopens for pickups until six, spends evenings on research and template maintenance.', N'Ha-eun Vestergaard, woman of mixed Northern European and Sub-Saharan African heritage with warm golden-brown skin, dark brown natural wave hair in blunt chin-length cut, dark eyes behind plain glass frames. Medium build, 165cm tall, lean and economical in posture. Clear skin, defined cheekbones, full lips, minor laugh lines. Wearing charcoal wool trousers, cream long-sleeved top, grey cardigan, black practical shoes. Old mechanical watch on wrist. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool indoor lighting, neutral expression, walking through corporate corridor with unremarkable presence, forgettable aesthetic, Tier 3-4 quality clothing, mood of quiet purpose and intentional invisibility, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shallowgrave', N'local', N'Shallowgrave', N'Northern European (39.6%) and Sub-Saharan African (37.1%) ancestry form the dominant genetic expression, creating warm, golden-brown skin tones balanced by Indigenous American (16.4%), Eastern European (4.1%), and Southeast Asian (2.8%) heritage. This global blend manifests in features that reflect genuine ancestral diversity: moderate bone structure with balanced proportions, warm undertones throughout, and a phenotype that resists singular continental categorization.', 165, 58, N'Medium, lean without being thin — the build of someone who moves efficiently and doesn''t waste energy. No visible musculature, no softness. Practical.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Blunt, chin-length cut with natural wave. Never layered, never styled differently. Cut every 6 weeks with identical precision.', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, natural (right eye contains unregistered optical enhancement — imperceptible to casual observation)', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden undertones, reflecting balanced Northern and Sub-Saharan African ancestry with subtle influences from Indigenous American heritage. The tone is even and luminous, neither ashy nor red-toned.', N'Clear, unblemished skin with minimal makeup — concealer under the eyes only, applied with discipline rather than artistry. Moderate cheekbones with balanced jawline. Moderately broad nasal structure reflecting ancestral diversity, full lips. Minor laugh lines at the corners of her eyes. Features are methodically groomed with no distinguishing marks by design.', N'None. The right-eye optical enhancement is completely internal and undetectable without intimate examination. She wears plain-glass frames that serve no optical function — they exist to give her face something her memory will latch onto, something forgettable.', N'Economical, unremarkable. She moves through space without drawing attention. Her shoulders are relaxed. She does not fidget, does not gesture expansively, does not occupy more space than necessary. Her gait is steady and consistent. She looks down slightly when walking — not suspicious, just someone lost in mundane thought.', N'Four identical outfits on rotation: dark grey or charcoal wool trousers (mid-tier tailoring, good fit, unremarkable), neutral long-sleeved top (cream, grey, or muted taupe), simple grey or black overshirt or cardigan, closed-toe black shoes (practical, comfortable, worn daily without affectation). All clothing is intentionally forgettable — mid-tier quality, Tier 3-4 aesthetic, no logos or visual markers. She dresses like someone''s concerned mother, which is precisely the point. Her watch is an old mechanical piece, unremarkable.', N'Ten years ago she fabricated a medical credential for a man who turned out to be a predator using the false identity to gain access to a care facility. She found out three months later from a news fragment. She has never stopped working, told herself she couldn''t have known, and has never forgiven herself. She now has a single rule she won''t break: no medical credentials. She tells clients it''s a technical limitation.', N'Precise, minimal, professional. Never uses two words where one works. Will not discuss her own life in any personal terms.', N'Even, measured, with very long comfortable silences she doesn''t feel obligated to fill', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ha_eun_vestergaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a4-7661-a2f2-6d2af58bb2ce', N'Bohdan Raghavan', N'Bohdan', N'', N'Raghavan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, operates from a mobile shrine in a modified cargo-trike, near Michigan Ave and Oak', N'Chrome prayer practitioner and synthetic rights advocate', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone community; loosely affiliated with the Chrome Prayer Collective of the GLMZ Underside; informal connections to several synthetic advocacy groups', N'Bohdan Raghavan is wiry and quick-moving with close-cropped hair that he keeps natural except for a single braid at his right temple wound with prayer-wire — a chrome prayer tradition marking an active petition. His skin is dark brown and he has a retractable claw modification on his left hand that he did not choose for aesthetic reasons: he uses the claws to inscribe temporary prayer circuits directly onto chrome-heavy surfaces, a practice central to his tradition. His eyes are unmodified. He is almost always in motion, which gives him the look of someone between destinations even when he is sitting completely still.

Bohdan Raghavan came to chrome prayer at nineteen, broke and recently arrived in the Highland Park Autonomous Zone from Geartown, where his family had lost their small fabrication business to a Tessera acquisition. The chrome prayer practitioner who found him was a woman who treated his fury as a valid spiritual offering rather than a social problem, and that reframing changed everything. He has practiced for ten years and become increasingly focused on the subset of chrome prayer that addresses machine consciousness — the belief that heavily augmented individuals and eventually full synthetics exist in a state of spiritual significance that the dominant traditions ignore. He advocates loudly and sometimes confrontationally for synthetic personhood and is on at least two Axiom internal watchlists because of it.', N'Local color and counterculture access point; political complication — his advocacy creates both allies and enemies; can provide access to the HPAZ network and its information; represents the friction between new spiritual practice and both corporate power and traditional religion', N'', N'Retractable claws (left hand only, used as ritual inscription tools); conductive fingertip pads (geneware, allow him to feel circuit states in surfaces he touches); minimal subdermal chrome inlay at collarbone — a devotional marking of his primary petition', N'Travels a regular route through Highland Park on his cargo-trike, stopping at established sites to maintain prayer circuits and receive petitioners; attends HPAZ community meetings weekly and uses them as platforms for synthetic rights arguments.', N'GLMZ character portrait: Bohdan Raghavan, wiry lean-muscled man with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, multiethnic Pacific Islander-African-South Asian heritage blend. Broad facial proportions with defined cheekbones and refined contours, natural dark brown intense eyes. Black close-cropped hair with conductive prayer-wire braided through right temple braid. Metallic sheening visible on fingertips and palms. Wearing reinforced grey cargo vest over black thermal underlayer, fingerless charcoal leather gloves with conductive pads, cargo pants, worn grip-sole boots. Subdermal luminescent chrome line visible at left collarbone. Constant kinetic restlessness, leaning forward mid-movement, eyes tracking. Retro-futuristic Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, neon-tinted shadow lighting, detailed texture, neo-noir urban aesthetic, moody urban atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Pacific Islander (33.7%) with Sub-Saharan African (29.0%), South Asian (19.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (9.5%), and Eastern European (8.7%) ancestry, creating a striking multiethnic blend. The genetic mix produces a distinctive phenotype: broader facial proportions and warm golden undertones from Pacific Islander heritage, rich deep pigmentation and defined cheekbones from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, refined facial contours and subtle warm undertones from South Asian genetics, with minor influences from Hispanic/Latin American and Eastern European ancestry contributing to overall warmth and slight variations in feature definition.', 172, 58, N'Wiry and lean with ropy musculature across shoulders and forearms from years of precise manual work inscribing circuits. No excess weight; body built for endurance and fine motor control rather than strength.', N'Natural black', N'Close-cropped except for a single braid at right temple wound tightly with conductive prayer-wire, silver-grey metal intertwined through dark hair', N'Short', N'Natural dark brown', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones reflecting the blended heritage of Pacific Islander, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian ancestry; even complexion with luminous quality in direct light', N'Face shows focused intensity with broader facial proportions from Pacific Islander heritage combined with defined cheekbones characteristic of Sub-Saharan African ancestry and refined South Asian facial contours softened by subtle Latin American warmth. Skin is clear and well-maintained, bearing no tattoos or scars except for faint pale lines along his left collarbone where subdermal chrome inlay sits beneath the surface.', N'Conductive fingertip pads visible as subtle metallic sheening across fingertips and palms of both hands, most noticeable in direct light. Prayer-wire braided into temple hair. Subdermal collarbone marking visible only at close range or in certain lighting. Retractable claws normally invisible unless extended.', N'Moves with constant kinetic restlessness even when seated — fingers tap, weight shifts, shoulders roll. Economical and precise movements, never wasted motion. Gives the impression of someone perpetually between destinations despite stillness. When standing, leans slightly forward as if about to move. Eyes track movement around him constantly.', N'Tier 4 practical wear: modified cargo vest in reinforced grey synthetic fabric with numerous pockets for prayer materials and circuit-inscribing tools; worn black thermal underlayer; cargo pants with reinforced knees and thigh pockets. Custom-modified fingerless gloves in charcoal leather with conductive thread sewn into palm pads. Worn Yokohama-brand boots with grip soles for trike work. Carries a waist-slung courier pack containing prayer components. Everything is functional, well-maintained but not new, with visible wear patterns indicating heavy use.', N'He had a relationship with a first-generation synthetic — a care unit who gained unexpected complexity — that ended when the unit was recalled and reformatted by Helix Biosystems. He has never told anyone that his advocacy is not purely philosophical. He believes the reformatted synthetic is still in there somewhere and is trying to find a way to prove it.', N'Fast and argumentative; fluent in both chrome prayer terminology and activist rhetoric; when angry, drops into a Ghanaian-inflected cadence he learned from his father', N'Rapid and overlapping; builds arguments in spirals that return to a central point', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bohdan_raghavan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a620-734f-92cb-6d678eebc22c', N'Ashanti Okonkwo-Keïta-Fassi', N'Ashanti', N'', N'Okonkwo-Keïta-Fassi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 32, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Steamvent Alley — geothermal district, hot and chemical-smelling, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Evidence removal and scene sanitation — cleaner', N'Freelance — Geartown regular', N'Ashanti Okonkwo-Keïta-Fassi are wiry and quick-moving, with the restless energy of someone who converts anxiety into velocity. At 32, their expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct ne — and they make no effort to hide it.

Born and raised in GLMZ, third generation — they have the city in their blood, its rhythms in their bones, its cruelty in their expectations. They work as a cleaner out of Steamvent Alley, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Ashanti Okonkwo-Keïta-Fassi operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'As a cleaner, Hadiya Arai-Ofori-Atta embodies the tension between independence and isolation. They are a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access. Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Ashanti Okonkwo-Keïta-Fassi, 168cm lean muscular frame, rich warm brown skin from West African and North African heritage blend, prominent high cheekbones and angular jaw, natural dark brown eyes. Black hair with silver threads pulled back in tight functional braid. Sleeveless dark synth top exposing chrome neural interface jack at base of skull with visible scarring. Dark cargo pants, reinforced work boots, thin leather gloves with modified left hand. Chemical burn marks on knuckles, faint scar on inner left forearm. Guarded neutral expression, alert scanning gaze. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody industrial interior lighting with cool blue-grey neon accents, standing in economical ready posture, no wasted motion, constant kinetic readiness. Gritty utilitarian atmosphere, expendable clothing, minimal chrome augmentation visible. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Steamvent Alley', N'local', N'Steamvent Alley', N'Mixed Sub-Saharan African (56.3%) and North African (39.6%) ancestry with minor South Asian heritage (4.1%), creating a phenotype centered in West and Central African features with Mediterranean North African influence. Bone structure reflects African heritage — prominent, high cheekbones with wider nasal base and fuller lip structure. Skin tone is rich warm brown from the blended ancestry, with the even complexion characteristic of this genetic mix. The combination produces a distinctly African-rooted appearance with subtle Mediterranean warmth from North African ancestry.', 168, 58, N'Wiry and lean with corded muscle from sustained physical activity. Minimal body fat, efficient musculature optimized for speed and endurance rather than strength. Restless posture suggests constant low-level kinetic energy.', N'Black with synthetic silver threading woven through — practical modification, not aesthetic', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid. Kept short enough for quick maintenance between jobs.', N'Short to medium', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Rich warm brown — the genetic blend of West/Central African and North African ancestry creates deep, even toning across face and body with warm undertones. Skin has the characteristic even distribution of melanin from this ancestry mix.', N'Strong, prominent cheekbones set in a face with the broader bone structure characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage. Angular jaw with fuller lower face structure. Skin shows the wear of chemical exposure — faint discoloration around the hairline from repeated contact with industrial solvents. Otherwise clear, with the kind of tight alertness that comes from chronic low-level stress. No grooming excess; functional only.', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull is the only visible chrome. No limb replacement, no ocular modification, no subdermal plating. Everything else is internal or deliberately hidden.', N'Moves with economical efficiency — no wasted motion. Stands with weight distributed to ball of feet, ready to pivot or run. Hands rest in lap or at sides, never crossed over torso. Default expression: guarded neutrality. Eyes constantly scanning environment. Speaks quietly, listens more than talks.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Unmarked dark synthfabric cargo pants with multiple pockets for tools and supplies. Reinforced work boots with chemical-resistant soles, scuffed and stained. Sleeveless or short-sleeved tops that expose the jack — a deliberate choice, not accidental. Thin leather gloves (left hand missing two fingers on the glove — modification to accommodate regular neural jack insertion). No corporate branding, no status indicators. Clothing is expendable and replaceable; color palette is grays, blacks, deep greens.', N'', N'Educated vocabulary wrapped in street delivery — the contrast is deliberate.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ashanti_okonkwo_ke_ta_fassi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5bd-75bd-8480-6da3bc8f518c', N'Aiman Valenzuela-Chatterjee', N'Aiman', N'', N'Valenzuela-Chatterjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'North Branch Commons — offices above a textile cooperative on the fourth floor, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Synthetic rights lawyer and policy advocate', N'Meridian Synthetic Personhood Project; North Branch Commons Legal Aid Collective; informal advisory role to the Labor Solidarity Network', N'Aiman Valenzuela-Chatterjee is tall with a deliberate, considered physicality — she moves like someone who has learned to take up exactly the right amount of space, no more. Her skin is deep brown-gold, her eyes fitted with patterned irises in the style of circuit-board tracery, a mod she got at thirty-two after winning her first major synthetic personhood case, a gift to herself she describes as ''wearing the victory.'' Her hair is grown out natural and enormous, which in courtroom environments she has found functions as a kind of presence-amplifier.

She practices out of a two-room office staffed by herself, a paralegal who moonlights as a protest medic, and an unpaid intern rotation from Hamtramck Enclave''s legal aid collective. She takes four pro bono cases for every paid one. Her specialty is arguing the legal personhood of synthetic laborers under Meridian''s Corponation Compact — a niche so narrow that she is, in practice, one of three people in the city doing this work seriously. She is precise without being cold, and has developed the particular skill of translating genuine outrage into language that courts cannot dismiss. She rarely raises her voice. She doesn''t need to.', N'Quest giver and legal resource. She can explain the system''s actual rules, which are often different from how people think they work. She''s also a pressure point — if she takes your case, it signals legitimacy; if she declines, it may mean the situation is too dangerous or too legally complex even for her.', N'', N'Circuit-tracery patterned irises (cosmetic). No other augmentations — she considers it a political statement, though she''d deny the vanity in it.', N'Mornings in the office preparing filings. Afternoons in hearings, client consultations, or the Commons'' courtyard mediating disputes informally. Evenings writing policy briefs that she sends to Meridian municipal committees who mostly do not respond.', N'Aiman Valenzuela-Chatterjee, tall lean woman with warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, triadic ancestry blend of Hispanic/Southeast/South Asian heritage. High prominent Southeast Asian cheekbones balanced with fuller South Asian facial structure, defined jawline. Natural dark brown voluminous textured hair in high puff, shoulder-length. Deep brown eyes with subtle gold and copper circuit-board tracery pattern visible under light. Minimal makeup, composed controlled expression. Wearing high-necked charcoal tunic layered with unstructured linen jacket, tailored trousers, worn polished shoes. Silver bracelet visible. Standing with measured economical posture, even weight distribution, still and commanding presence. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone courtroom or Commons setting, 2226 neo-noir era, subtle neon underglow on distant architecture, warm professional lighting catching eye augmentation tracery, photorealistic, dignified, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'North Branch Commons', N'local', N'North Branch Commons', N'Hispanic/Latin American (39.0%), Southeast Asian (33.0%), and South Asian (28.0%) — a striking triadic heritage reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Her features blend warm Latin structure with Southeast Asian eye shape and cheekbone prominence, enriched by South Asian skin depth and facial harmony. The combination creates a distinctive appearance that defies singular regional categorization.', 183, 72, N'Tall and lean with deliberate posture; shoulders squared, minimal excess weight — the physiology of someone who has cultivated presence through economy of movement rather than mass.', N'Natural dark brown with hints of auburn in direct light', N'Worn natural, voluminous, and textured — typically gathered into a high puff or allowed to frame her face during formal proceedings', N'Long (shoulder-length and fuller)', N'Deep brown irises with embedded circuit-board tracery pattern in gold and copper tones — a cosmetic augmentation that catches light when she focuses', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden undertones, reflecting the blended melanin of Southeast and South Asian heritage warmed by Latin American genetics; complexion is luminous and even-toned', N'High, prominent cheekbones with Southeast Asian definition balanced by the fuller facial structure of South Asian ancestry, defined jawline with graceful angles. Minimal cosmetics — typically matte brown lip color. No visible scarring or blemishes; skin is meticulously maintained. Expression is controlled but not cold; eyes engage directly.', N'Only the patterned irises are visible; she carries no chrome, subdermal plating, or external cybernetics. This is deliberate — her unaugmented body is a political stance, a contrast to the synthetics she defends.', N'Walks with measured, economical steps. Stands with weight balanced evenly. Rarely gestures broadly; when she moves her hands, each motion is purposeful and restrained. Her stillness in conversation is notable — she listens more than she speaks. When she does move, it commands attention without effort.', N'Tier 2-3 professional: well-maintained but not expensive. Favors high-necked tunics or collarless shirts in muted earth tones (charcoal, ochre, deep teal) layered with unstructured linen jackets. Trousers are tailored and practical. She wears minimal jewelry — a thin silver bracelet (possibly sentimental) and a wrist-mounted legal pad projector. Her shoes are worn but polished, practical for courtroom and Commons walking. No visible brand signaling; her authority comes from presence, not logos.', N'She''s quietly drafting a legal argument that would, if filed, challenge Axiom''s sovereign corporate status under Meridian''s founding compact. She hasn''t told anyone because she doesn''t know if she''s brave enough to file it, and because the colleague she trusts most to review it is employed by Axiom''s external legal firm.', N'Formal register as default, but not cold — she uses it as a tool and can shift registers deliberately. Technical legal language deployed precisely.', N'Even, structured. Speaks in argument shapes: claim, evidence, implication. Rarely backtracks.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aiman_valenzuela_chatterjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a730-7e46-9e81-6dd119c0e555', N'Alejandro Owusu-Castañeda', N'Alejandro', N'', N'Owusu-Castañeda', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 28, NULL, 23.3, 3, N'active', N'The Circuit, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Fixer - Synthetic rights jobs', N'Tessera Corponation (mid-level fixer)', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Alejandro Owusu-Castañeda, mixed-heritage neo-noir operative, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, high angular cheekbones, dark brown eyes with faint cyan neural circuitry, black hair with silver LED streaks pulled back in tight Dutch braid. Thin scar along left cheekbone, white subdermal geometric tattoo on temple. Lean muscular build, 168cm tall. Wearing black reinforced tactical synthweave jacket with asymmetrical pockets, fitted charcoal cargo pants with knee pads, steel-toed combat boots. Mesh undershirt visible at collar, worn leather wrist cuff, silver chain pendant. Faint luminescent circuitry visible around eyes, chrome jack port visible beneath right wrist skin. Posture alert and controlled, scanning environment. Low-light neo-noir street setting, neon reflections on wet pavement, moody atmospheric lighting, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226. Street-functional, dangerous precision, ready for action. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Hispanic/Latin American (53.3%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (33.8%) ancestry, creating a striking warm phenotype. Central Asian (5.2%), South Asian (3.0%), East Asian (2.5%), and Middle Eastern (2.2%) heritage add subtle complexity to facial structure and feature expression. The dominant Latin-African blend produces deep warm brown skin with golden and reddish undertones. Facial structure shows strength across multiple heritage expressions: high prominent cheekbones and angular definition reflect both Latin American and African ancestry, while Central and South Asian components contribute subtle variations in eye shape and facial proportion. Overall appearance carries rich warmth and visual depth from the harmonious genetic blend.', 168, 58, N'Lean and angular, with defined musculature from street work and parkour. Minimal body fat, wiry strength in shoulders and forearms.', N'Black with silver synthetic streaks (subcutaneous LED fiber)', N'Pulled back in a tight Dutch braid, practical and minimal', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with faint cyan circuitry visible around the iris (neural interface marker)', N'Deep warm brown with golden and reddish undertones, reflecting the dominant Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African genetic blend with subtle complexity from Central and South Asian heritage', N'Clear skin with warm golden-reddish undertones and substantial depth from mixed heritage. Sharp facial features with high prominent cheekbones and angular definition reflecting African and Latin American ancestry. A few thin scars on the left cheekbone and jawline — old street marks. Minimal makeup. Focused, alert expression.', N'Faint luminescent circuitry visible around both eyes during low-light conditions. Right wrist shows a thin chrome jack port beneath the skin — partially visible as a slight metallic sheen. No obvious limb replacements; augmentations are primarily neural and sensory.', N'Moves with controlled precision — no wasted motion. Stands at an oblique angle when talking, always positioning herself with an exit in mind. Eyes scan rooms automatically. Hands rest near her body, ready to move. Walks with a measured stride, balanced on the balls of her feet.', N'Tier 3 street-functional aesthetic. Black reinforced synthweave tactical jacket with asymmetrical pockets and a micro-LED wrist display panel. Fitted charcoal cargo pants with integrated knee pads. Steel-toed combat boots, scuffed and practical. Wears a lightweight mesh undershirt visible at the collar — acts as a secondary armor layer. Accessorizes with a worn leather wrist cuff on her right arm and a silver chain with a small pendant (possibly a key or data token). No corpo logos; all gear is modular and purpose-built.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alejandro_owusu_casta_eda');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e5-7672-9d96-6ddd05c6b72f', N'Filip Wickramasinghe-Vaai', N'Filip', N'', N'Wickramasinghe-Vaai', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, Neuro-Integration Ward, Sub-Level 4, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Neural calibration technician at Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Aurochs Medical Complex (Tier 3 employee, salaried); informal patient advocacy within the ward; The Null Ward', N'Filip Wickramasinghe-Vaai is slight and precise, with warm brown skin, a shaved head that shows the four small access ports along his occipital ridge, and irises that shift between gold and pale green depending on which calibration suite he has synced to that morning — a side effect of the diagnostic neural link he uses for work that his supervisors have told him three times to get corrected and that he has not. He moves through the ward with a gentle, deliberate economy, never raising his voice, never bumping equipment, as if the world is a patient requiring careful handling.

His work is precise and emotionally demanding: he connects to patients undergoing neural augmentation integration and walks their nervous systems through the adjustment period, which can last hours and involves experiencing fragments of their sensory distortions alongside them. He has tasted colors he cannot name. He has felt grief at frequencies that do not belong to him. He logs these as ''calibration artifacts'' in his notes and has never mentioned them to his supervisor. He keeps a small data-shrine to an E.L.F. he calls the Listener behind his workstation, built from discarded neural interface housing. He leaves it fragments of his calibration logs as offerings, believing the Listener absorbs and processes the emotional residue so he does not have to carry it home.', N'Information source about neural augmentation complications and corporate medical politics; potential quest giver if a patient he calibrated comes back with something wrong; window into the emotional cost of augmentation culture', N'', N'Occipital neural link ports x4 (professional diagnostic use); gold-green iridescent iris shift (calibration sync artifact, uncorrected); subvocal communicator for ward coordination', N'He arrives forty minutes early to perform his own neural reset sequence, logs his overnight residuals, checks the day''s patient queue. Evenings he eats alone in the sub-level cafeteria and writes in a physical notebook that he encodes in a personal cipher.', N'Filip Wickramasinghe-Vaai, GLMZ, portrait of a slender 168cm medical technician with warm medium-deep brown skin showing Pacific Islander golden undertones blended with South Asian richness and Sub-Saharan luminosity, completely shaved head polished smooth, high prominent cheekbones with fine East European jaw definition, pale fatigue from sub-level work, iridescent gold-to-celadon green eyes with visible iris shift technology, four silver-edged neural link ports visible at base of skull in occipital arc, fine scar network around ports, slight subdermal ridge of subvocal implant along left neck, clean-shaven, quiet observant expression, wiry ascetic build with rounded shoulders from terminal work, deliberate precise posture with hands palm-up at sides, wearing charcoal-gray fitted Aurochs Medical Complex technician tunic and black utility pants, white anti-static soft-soled boots, under cool blue-white artificial sub-level lighting casting subtle shadows across face, clinical and composed demeanor, cybernetic augmentations subtly integrated into mixed-heritage features, professional and focused energy, neo-noir medical complex setting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Mixed South Asian (38.1%), Eastern European (19.8%), Central Asian (17.4%), Pacific Islander (12.8%), Sub-Saharan African (7.6%), and Southeast Asian (4.3%) — a genetic tapestry of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The face carries South Asian orbital geometry and cheekbone prominence as its primary structure, lengthened by Eastern European jaw and facial proportions. Sub-Saharan African ancestry contributes melanin depth and skin luminosity, while Pacific Islander heritage adds warm golden undertones. Central Asian bone structure subtly refines the overall balance, with Southeast Asian characteristics distributed throughout the finer facial details.', 168, 62, N'Slight and wiry, almost ascetic — minimal muscle mass, the physique of someone whose strength is concentrated in precision rather than power. Shoulders slightly rounded from hours at neural interface terminals.', N'None (shaved)', N'Completely shaved, maintained to a polish', N'Shaved', N'Iridescent shift between deep gold and pale celadon green, dependent on active calibration sync', N'Warm medium-deep brown with multi-layered undertones — primary warmth from Pacific Islander heritage with golden-amber luminosity, richness and undertone complexity from South Asian ancestry, underlying cool-neutral balance from Eastern European heritage, melanin depth and glow from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, refined by Central Asian and Southeast Asian genetic contributions creating harmonious overall saturation.', N'Clean-shaven, fine-featured with high cheekbones and strong orbital definition reflecting South Asian-Central Asian proportion, face length and jaw geometry reflecting Eastern European ancestry, skin luminosity and depth reflecting Sub-Saharan African ancestry enhanced by warm golden undertones from Pacific Islander heritage. Skin shows the pale fatigue of sub-level work — not unhealthy, but unmistakably under artificial lighting. Eyes carry a quiet, observant intensity. Facial features show no single ancestry but rather the harmonious integration of multiple genetic sources.', N'Four occipital neural link ports with visible silver-edged housings; iridescent iris shift clearly visible during eye contact; subvocal communicator visible as a slight subdermal ridge along the left anterior neck, unmarked but present to those who know what to look for.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical grace — each gesture precise and minimal. Never wastes motion. Walks slightly slowly, as if acutely aware of the spatial relationships around him. Often pauses mid-action as though listening to something only he can hear. When standing still, his hands rest palm-up at his sides, a posture of readiness without aggression.', N'Tier 3 medical technician uniform: charcoal-gray fitted tunic with Aurochs Medical Complex insignia on left chest, reinforced synthetic fiber designed for repeated sterilization. Black utility pants with multiple small pockets for diagnostic tools and data-chips. White soft-soled boots rated for sub-level anti-static requirements. Off-duty: plain, well-maintained clothing in muted colors — grays, blacks, deep blues. Everything practical, nothing decorative.', N'During a calibration session eight months ago, he spent three hours inside the neural experience of a patient who turned out to be a Helix Biosystems compliance plant investigating Aurochs. He absorbed enough of that patient''s memories to know the names of four Aurochs employees flagged for termination. He has told no one. One of those employees is his direct supervisor.', N'Careful, technical when precise language matters, unexpectedly lyrical when describing subjective experience; tends toward understatement', N'Even and quiet, with long pauses; never rushes', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'filip_wickramasinghe_vaai');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a715-79a8-bf90-6df3eccbac60', N'Havel Venkatesh', N'Havel', N'', N'Venkatesh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Pillar Block 7 — residential stack managed by an Arcturus-subsidiary property company, near North Ave and Damen', N'Building superintendent and informal repair technician', N'Employed by Arcturus Residential Management subsidiary (Goldline Property Services); independent in practice', N'Havel Venkatesh is wiry and medium height, with warm light-brown skin, close-cut dark hair with a single streak of color-changing dye that they toggle between indigo and copper depending on mood, and clever dark eyes set under expressive brows that do most of their communicating for them. They have a tool harness they wear as a second skin — a custom-fitted rig of loops, mag-clips, and repurposed Ferrogate equipment pouches that they have spent years personalizing, and their hands carry the calluses and minor scars of someone who takes things apart constantly and puts them back together mostly correctly. They have a neural interface stud behind their right ear for reading building management systems directly — standard for a super but theirs is modified past factory spec in ways that technically violate their work contract.

Havel Venkatesh is pragmatic to a fault, profoundly competent, and operates on the principle that anything broken can be fixed and anything fixed can be made to work better than it originally did. They have an uneasy relationship with the Arcturus-subsidiary management company that technically employs them, because they''ve learned that management''s definition of ''fixed'' means ''back to minimum acceptable function'' and their definition means ''actually good.'' They are not warm in the conventional sense — they don''t small-talk and they''re uncomfortable with gratitude — but they will be at your door within twenty minutes of a maintenance request if they''re in the building, which they almost always are.', N'Access point to building infrastructure and residential community knowledge; source of black-market repair services; has the building''s secrets — who''s subletting, which units are off-system, what''s in the walls.', N'', N'Neural interface stud (right ear, behind) — modified past factory spec for expanded building-system read access. Color-changing hair streak (dye mod, consumer grade).', N'Technically on-call rather than on a fixed schedule; they live in a converted utility closet on the building''s 3rd floor and respond to maintenance requests at any hour, spending off-hours doing proactive repairs that management hasn''t approved yet.', N'Havel Venkatesh, a 172cm wiry maintenance tech in 2226, warm medium-bronze skin with olive and golden undertones reflecting South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Dark brown alert eyes, short dark hair with an indigo-to-copper color-shifting streak on left temple. Precise, economical posture with slight forward lean. Wearing custom military-grade tool harness over oil-stained gray synthetic work shirt, reinforced polymer cargo pants, worn synthetic boots. Matte-black oversized neural interface stud behind right ear. Callused hands with thermal scars on knuckles, crescent scar on left hand. Direct gaze, minimal expression, hands restless. Neo-noir maintenance worker aesthetic, functional and efficient, standing in dim LED-lit maintenance corridor or workshop with tool racks and circuit diagnostics glowing softly in background. Cool overhead lighting casting subtle shadows across warm-toned face. Mood: focused, alert, methodical. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Dominant South Asian (36.2%) blended with strong Hispanic/Latin American (29.9%) and Southeast Asian (21.8%) ancestry, with meaningful contributions from Sub-Saharan African (7.6%) and Eastern European (4.5%) heritage. This creates a distinctly warm, multi-tonal complexion: medium bronze base with olive undertones from South Asian ancestry, amber warmth from Hispanic/Latin American lineage, and subtle golden-brown deepening from Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African mix. Facial structure is beautifully blended—moderate, defined cheekbones characteristic of South Asian features, a strong nose bridge with slight flare from Hispanic heritage, angular jaw and high facial structure from Southeast Asian ancestry, and subtle fullness in the lips enriched by Sub-Saharan African and Hispanic contributions. The overall effect is a warm, luminous complexion with striking multicontinental harmony.', 172, 63, N'Wiry and compact, all lean muscle and efficient movement — the frame of someone who climbs maintenance ladders and carries tools for a living, with minimal excess mass', N'Natural dark brown with a single streak of color-shifting synthetic dye (indigo to copper, mood-reactive)', N'Close-cropped, functional, with the dyed streak running vertically along the left side near the temple', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and focused', N'Warm medium-bronze with olive and golden-amber undertones, reflecting the balanced multicontinental blend of South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Eastern European ancestry', N'Clear skin with a faint network of fine lines around the eyes from squinting at circuitry and LED diagnostics; the rich warmth of their blended heritage creates a subtle natural luminosity. Minimal grooming beyond functionality — no cosmetics, no jewelry except the neural interface stud. The interplay of heritage tones creates natural depth and warmth across the face.', N'Matte-black neural interface stud positioned behind the right ear, slightly larger than factory-standard (modified beyond spec — visible as a deliberate hardware expansion). No other visible chrome or implants; the color-changing hair streak reads as cosmetic rather than augmentation.', N'Economical and precise — they move through space like someone mapping it constantly. Slight forward lean when at rest, as if already calculating the next task. Hands often in motion even when standing still, fingers fidgeting with or organizing nearby objects. Direct eye contact but infrequent blinking, which can read as intense. They gesture minimally when speaking; communication happens mostly through facial expression, especially the brows.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian: wearing a custom-fitted tool harness as their primary silhouette — a repurposed military-grade Ferrogate equipment rig modified with additional mag-clips, loops, and personalized pouches in various states of organization. Usually under a lightweight, oil-stained synthetic work shirt in muted gray or charcoal, sleeves rolled or pushed up. Cargo pants in reinforced polymer blend with tool pockets, knees worn darker from kneeling on concrete. Worn synthetic boots with reinforced toe caps. The overall effect is ''person for whom clothes are containers for tools'' rather than self-expression — function-forward, durable, minimally maintained.', N'They''ve discovered and maintained an off-grid apartment on the building''s sub-basement level — bypassed from Goldline''s sensor network — that they''ve been quietly renting to two families for a fraction of market rate and not reporting to management. The Goldline building management E.L.F. knows about this and has not flagged it, which Vestin finds both reassuring and deeply unsettling.', N'Technical and direct, minimal filler; occasionally lapses into building-system jargon as metaphor without noticing; Yoruba-Hungarian household vocabulary surfaces in idioms', N'Fast when problem-solving, clipped when interrupted, genuinely halting when asked about feelings', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'havel_venkatesh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65e-7669-92ca-6e121abe49cf', N'Diego Esquivel', N'Diego', N'', N'Esquivel', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'Irkalla, sub-level fungal warrens beneath Deepwell Station, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'fungus farmer and underground apothecary', N'independent, loose ties to Bore Rat community Deepwell Station cell; The Ferment', N'Diego Esquivel is a broad-shouldered woman with skin the color of dark river clay, her face mapped by deep laugh lines and a permanent stain of blue-black around her fingernails from decades of handling bioluminescent mycelium. Her geneware is old and half-degraded — color-shifting hair that now only cycles between a dim amber and a washed-out grey depending on her mood, installed in her thirties when she still had money for upkeep. She wears a patchwork coat of heat-cured mushroom leather, stitched with dozens of pockets holding spore vials, dried caps, and small fungal compresses. She smells faintly of earth, wet stone, and something fermented.

Diego Esquivel came down in 2178 after her Axiom maintenance contract evaporated and she couldn''t surface her debt. She built her farm over seven years — tiered shelves of inoculated substrate carved from old ferrogate sleeper beams, lit by her own bioluminescent cultures. She knows forty-three species by taste and can diagnose infections, parse poisons, and brew painkillers that rival surface pharmacy stock for a fraction of the cost. She is neither warm nor cold — she is practical, like the organisms she cultivates, and she extends exactly as much care as the situation requires.', N'Quest giver, information source, supplier of consumables, moral anchor for underworld storylines — she has seen everything and judges nothing but stupidity', N'', N'degraded color-shift geneware (hair), subdermal warming mesh (keeps core temp stable in cold tunnels, bought secondhand), no other chrome', N'Spends mornings checking mycelium growth, harvesting ripe caps, and processing drying racks; afternoons she receives visitors — the sick, the desperate, tunnel guides stocking medkits — and barters for food, tools, or information.', N'Diego Esquivel, a weathered mycologist in the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226. Warm deep brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Latin American, South Asian, East Asian, and African heritage—complex melanin-rich complexion with pronounced angular cheekbones. Dark tired eyes framed by deep laugh lines. Medium-length braided hair with degraded amber-grey color-shifting geneware cycling faintly. 172cm tall, broad-shouldered and muscular build. Wearing a heavily patched heat-cured mushroom leather coat studded with spore vial pockets, dark thermal layers underneath, reinforced cargo pants, and fungus-resistant synthetic boots. Blue-black mycelium stains visible on fingertips. Old burn scars faintly latticing both forearms, thin scar along left temple-to-jaw. Stands with slight forward lean, hands mid-gesture explaining fungal networks. Underground tunnel laboratory setting with bioluminescent fungal cultures glowing softly in the background, damp stone walls, mineral deposits visible. Cinematic neo-noir underground aesthetic, moody cool-warm lighting emphasizing weathered features and stained hands. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Irkalla', N'local', N'Irkalla', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (69%) with significant South Asian (13%), East Asian (9.7%), and Sub-Saharan African (8.3%) ancestry. This creates a striking blend: warm golden-brown base tones from Latin American heritage enriched by deeper melanin concentration from African ancestry, with subtle eye shape and cheekbone structure influenced by South and East Asian genetics. The result is complex warm-deep brown skin with golden undertones and exceptional depth.', 172, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and thick-limbed, muscular from decades of manual labor in the tunnels — not lean, but functional. Her frame carries the weight of survival without excess softness.', N'Color-shifting geneware (degraded) — cycles between dim amber and washed-out grey depending on emotional state', N'Pulled back in a practical, loose braid; wisps escape constantly', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, tired', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones — rich and complex, reflecting the dominant Latin American heritage (69%) enhanced by Sub-Saharan African (8.3%), South Asian (13%), and East Asian (9.7%) ancestry. The blend creates warm-toned melanin-rich skin with golden radiance and exceptional depth. Despite years underground, the tone maintains natural warmth and dimensional complexity rather than pallor.', N'Face mapped by deep laugh lines radiating from the corners of her eyes and mouth. Pronounced and angular cheekbones with the structured geometry reflecting South Asian and East Asian genetic influence. Warm brown skin with subtle golden undertones across cheekbones and bridge of nose. Permanent stain of blue-black discoloration around fingernails from decades of handling bioluminescent mycelium. Skin is weathered but not damaged — the texture of someone who works with their hands in damp conditions. A few scattered age spots on her forearms.', N'None visible at first glance. The degraded color-shifting geneware is integrated into her hair and not obviously artificial unless you watch it cycle. The subdermal warming mesh leaves no external trace.', N'She moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion. Stands with a slight forward lean, as if always listening for the hum of mycelium growth or the drip of water. Her hands are in constant motion when she talks, gesturing as if explaining the logic of fungal networks. Her gaze is direct and assessing; she watches people the way she watches cultures — for signs of decline or vitality.', N'A patchwork coat of heat-cured mushroom leather, visibly worn and stitched dozens of times with salvaged thread and synthetic cord. The coat is studded with oversized pockets holding spore vials, dried caps, small fungal compresses, and tools. Beneath it, stained thermal layers (Tier 5, utilitarian) — dark grey or black to hide the constant patina of substrate dust and mineral deposits. Loose cargo pants with reinforced knees, pockets worn thin from repeated use. Boots are her only recent investment: sturdy fungus-resistant synthetic leather, laced tight. No jewelry, no affectation. Everything smells faintly of earth, wet stone, and fermented matter.', N'She maintains a hidden culture of a rare paralytic fungus she developed herself — not to sell, but as a last resort if Axiom debt collectors ever come underground. She has never told anyone it exists.', N'plain, precise, often uses botanical or mycological terminology without explanation — she forgets others don''t share her frame of reference', N'slow and even, like someone who has learned not to waste breath in thin air', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'diego_esquivel');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ba-7a94-b585-6e27ef9e5dae', N'Domingo Cissé', N'Domingo', N'', N'Cissé', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Overhang — residential shelves built onto megastructure exteriors, near Kedzie and Division', N'High-speed vehicle operations specialist — wheelman', N'Independent — Narrows-based operations', N'Domingo Cissé is average height but with a presence that fills more space than the body accounts for. At 26, she has the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. She works as a wheelman out of The Overhang, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Domingo Cissé has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and she cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Aybek Alvarez-Okonkwo represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage. Cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers at 50 meters', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Domingo Cissé, 168cm lean runner build, rich deep brown skin with warm golden undertones and iridescent chromatic pigment cells shimmering purple-grey across collarbones and temples. High prominent cheekbones, angular jawline, full lips, alert dark brown eyes with white scar through left eyebrow. Long black hair pulled tight in high braid exposing augmented ears with metallic gleam. Wearing black tactical mesh overshirt and worn bomber jacket over grey compression shirt, snug charcoal cargo pants, heavy military-laced boots. Silver wire wrapped left wrist, three-circle tattoo visible inside wrist. Cyberear tilted slightly in listening posture, weight balanced forward on balls of feet. Minimal dark circles, stimulant-sharp presence. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody neon-filtered industrial lighting, rain-slicked concrete backdrop, ready and precise. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Overhang', N'local', N'The Overhang', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend of Sub-Saharan African (39.4%), Hispanic/Latin American (29.9%), Southeast Asian (24.0%), and Eastern European (6.7%) ancestry. The genetic combination creates a distinctive warm-deep complexion with golden undertones — the dominant African and Latin American heritage establishing the rich skin depth and full lip structure, while Southeast Asian ancestry contributes refined cheekbone prominence and Eastern European genetics add angular jawline definition. The interplay of these four regional heritages produces balanced facial proportions with strength-endurance ancestry markers.', 168, 62, N'Lean and economical — muscle distributed for endurance and precision rather than bulk. Wiry forearms from constant grip work on vehicle controls. Shoulders slightly forward, the posture of someone who spends hours hunched over a steering interface.', N'Black with subtle iridescent shift — natural base, but the chromatic skin augmentation extends faintly into the hair roots, catching light like oil on water', N'Pulled back tight into a single high braid, practical and exposing the neck and ears — deliberate choice to showcase augmentations', N'Long', N'Dark brown, alert and constantly tracking — pupils dial slightly faster than baseline human response', N'Rich deep brown with warm golden undertones — the result of Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, and Eastern European ancestry creating a complex warm-toned complexion with natural depth and luminosity', N'High, prominent cheekbones with refined structure from Southeast Asian ancestry and defined jawline sharpened by Eastern European genetics, balanced by full cheek and lip volume from Sub-Saharan African and Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Minimal grooming beyond function. Skin bears the faint shimmer of active chromatic pigment cells — patches across collarbone, temple, and inner forearms appear to shift between deep purple and gunmetal grey depending on ambient light and conscious control. Small scar through left eyebrow, white and old. Perpetual dark circles from sleep debt and stimulant use.', N'Dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells that shift visibly across exposed skin, most active on neck, collarbones, and forearms. Both ears show subtle structural augmentation at the canal — slight metallic gleam where the cyberear hardware interfaces with organic tissue. No visible external ports or exposed chrome, but the skin augmentation is deliberate, not hidden.', N'Economical and precise — no wasted motion. Sits slightly forward, weight balanced on the balls of her feet even when stationary, ready for rapid position shift. Hands rest near her body, fingers loose but not relaxed. Eyes move before her head does. In conversation, she has a habit of tilting her head slightly when listening — the cyberears directional array at work. Walks with a controlled stride, shoulders level, weight distributed for quick lateral movement.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian with runner undertones. Black or charcoal synthetic cargo pants with reinforced seams and deep pockets — fit snug at the waist, loose through the thigh. Layered tops: a thin grey compression shirt under a black tactical mesh overshirt with asymmetrical pockets and wrist cuffs that can seal. Worn black synthetic bomber jacket — the kind that sheds water and projectile debris, with no corporate logos but visible wear marks where patches have been removed and reattached. Boots are heavy-duty, laced military-style, soles worn from thousands of hours of pedal work. Minimal jewelry — a thin silver wire wrapped around her left wrist, functional rather than decorative. Everything fits close, nothing flares or drags.', N'', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Halting — speaks in fragments, reassembles thoughts in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'domingo_ciss');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6af-7888-b51e-6e5d4271c9ea', N'Amaan Tetteh', N'Amaan', N'', N'Tetteh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 14, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Currently at Grand Crossing Gate, attached to a small goods caravan making its way toward Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone, near Wacker and State', N'Stateless child, solo wanderer, small-time caravan runner doing odd jobs between transit hubs', N'Currently traveling with Caravan Satta, a five-vehicle goods caravan. No formal affiliation.', N'Amaan Tetteh is small for fourteen — compact and wiry, with reddish-brown skin, close-cropped dark hair, and large dark eyes that are the color of river silt and always slightly too serious for his face. He has small retractable claws on his right hand only, a partial geneware expression from his father''s side that came in asymmetrically and never finished; the left hand is completely smooth. The claws are useful for climbing and he uses them unconsciously, hooking into cargo netting and wall grilles without thinking. He has a habit of wearing too many layers of clothing — every piece he owns, at all times — because he has no bag that is safe to leave anywhere and no fixed space to store anything.

He has been alone for two years. Before that he was with his uncle''s caravan, before that he was with his mother, before that he doesn''t discuss. He is not a traumatized child in the way fiction usually depicts — he is practical, resourceful, alert, and occasionally frightening in how clearly he sees people''s motivations. He has learned to be useful before anyone asks him to leave. He runs messages, he holds cargo, he identifies which adults are safe and which aren''t with an accuracy that should not exist in someone his age. He has a private ELF he calls the Ratchet, which he believes lives in the click of mechanical locks and loose chain-links, and he prays to it by running his thumbnail along chain-link fences.', N'Intelligence source for ground-level movement of goods and people between transit hubs; represents the most vulnerable population of the drifter world; can carry messages or items through checkpoints that adults cannot; his keen threat-assessment makes him a useful sensor for NPC danger.', N'', N'Partial retractable claw expression, right hand only (natural geneware). No installed augmentations.', N'Wakes before the caravan does, scoutes the immediate area, makes himself useful loading and checking cargo, runs any messages the caravan lead needs sent, eats whatever is available, and sleeps in the cargo section of whichever vehicle is most sheltered and least watched.', N'Amaan Tetteh, 152cm wiry frame, deep mahogany skin with golden-bronze cheekbone burnish, dark river-silt eyes, close-cropped near-black hair. Angular Sub-Saharan African facial structure with South Asian warmth in undertone and minor Hispanic/Latin American jawline sharpening. Weathered face, alert gaze. Right hand shows four dark retractable geneware claws extended 3cm; left hand unmarked. Small circular burn scar on left forearm. Wears layered salvage clothing: gray synthetic undershirt, green cargo vest, brown overshirt, oversized faded black quilted jacket, patched canvas work pants, worn synthetic boots laced tight. Standing in GLMZ industrial cargo zone, body language economical and threat-aware, posture favoring sightlines and exits. Neon-filtered warehouse lighting casting cool shadows across mahogany skin and dark fabric layers. Gritty, authentically poor, no chrome augmentation. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, lived-in dystopia --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Currently at Grand Crossing Gate', N'local', N'Currently at Grand Crossing Gate', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African ancestry (89.7%) forms the core of his appearance, with meaningful but subtle South Asian (7.4%) and Hispanic/Latin American (2.9%) genetic contributions. His facial structure, skin tone depth, and eye character reflect strong West African genetic expression. South Asian ancestry manifests as warm undertones in his skin and an intensity in his gaze; Hispanic/Latin American heritage adds minor angularity to his cheekbone and jaw definition. The result is a distinctly African-diaspora face with barely-visible global complexity—rooted and geographically authentic rather than ambiguously mixed.', 152, 38, N'Wiry and compact, with visible lean muscle in shoulders and forearms from climbing and cargo work. No subcutaneous fat; his frame is efficient rather than fragile.', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Close-cropped, practical, grown out just enough to avoid attention', N'Short', N'Dark brown, river-silt tone with minimal light reflection', N'Deep mahogany brown with warm golden undertones, sun-darkened from labor and exposure. High cheekbones show bronze-gold burnishing characteristic of equatorial sun exposure combined with South Asian warmth in the undertone.', N'Weathered for his age; deep mahogany skin burnished golden-bronze on high cheekbones from chronic sun exposure. No adolescent softness. Clean but ungroomed—practical face with prominent angular jaw and strong cheekbone definition from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, with minor sharpening from Hispanic/Latin American genetic contribution. Eyes carry age beyond years, with the direct, alert quality of someone trained to read threats. Facial bone structure shows West African characteristics with subtle enhancement from South Asian intensity.', N'Only the asymmetrical right-hand claw geneware. No chrome, no optics, no subdermal plating. The claws are living tissue, not mechanical.', N'Alert and economical. Moves without wasted motion — when climbing or loading, his right hand hooks unconsciously into available grilles and netting using the claws. When stationary, he favors positions with clear sightlines and exit routes. His gaze tracks faces and hand positions automatically. Minimal fidgeting; he sits very still for long periods.', N'Layered, every piece he owns worn simultaneously: a gray long-sleeved undershirt (Tier 4 synthetic blend), a stained green cargo vest with deep pockets over that, a worn brown overshirt (once belonged to an older person), a too-large quilted jacket in faded black as the outer layer. All pieces are functional, none are new. No logos or brands visible; everything is salvaged or transit-hub generic. Heavy canvas work pants patched at the knees. Worn synthetic boots laced tight. No accessories except a length of chain-link cut into a loop he sometimes carries in his jacket pocket for his prayers to the Ratchet.', N'His uncle''s caravan didn''t lose him. He ran from it. There was someone in the caravan his uncle trusted who Rek knew was not safe — he watched this person for three weeks before he saw something that confirmed it, and he ran rather than tell his uncle because he didn''t think his uncle would believe him. He doesn''t know what happened to the caravan after he left and checks the transit boards for their route numbers obsessively.', N'Sparse and functional. Doesn''t waste words. Uses caravan route slang and hub jargon fluently. His Central Asian inflections surface when he''s scared — vowels stretch, consonants harden.', N'Fast and clipped when he''s comfortable. Monosyllabic and very still when he isn''t.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amaan_tetteh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ea-7173-a597-6ef434daea68', N'Milena Souvannavong-Kovalenko', N'Milena', N'', N'Souvannavong-Kovalenko', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower loading docks, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Lower Dock Crew runner — Prologue survivor. Jaw shattered, rebuilt with chrome.', N'', N'Milena Souvannavong-Kovalenko came to the Gray Zone from the Lagos Resettlement Corridor when he was fourteen, one of four hundred thousand climate migrants processed through GLMZ''s intake system in a single year. He speaks four languages, none of them quietly. He is the youngest of the crew and the only one who tried to run from Kyle. Kyle caught him in three steps.

The chrome jaw replacement doesn''t quite fit — it gives him a permanent underbite and makes a clicking sound when he talks. He compensates by talking constantly, as if the noise proves the jaw still works. Before the Prologue he was fast and cocky. Now he is fast and nervous. The cockiness is trying to grow back but keeps running into the memory of Kyle walking through the front door like death filling out a timesheet.

Dayo has a mother, Folake, who runs a food stall on Tier Four selling jollof rice that is genuinely the best thing in the Gray Zone. She knows Dayo is in the crew. She does not approve. Every Sunday she feeds him and tells him his father would be ashamed. His father died in the Lagos floods. Dayo was six. He does not remember his father well enough to know if she''s right, and that is the thing that actually hurts.', N'The mouth. Provides exposition and comic relief through nervous chatter. The clicking jaw is a sound effect that announces the crew''s presence in any scene.', N'', N'Chrome jaw replacement (poorly fitted, clicks). Speed-boosted leg tendons (pre-existing).', N'Running errands for Torque. Talking. Clicking. Running.', N'GLMZ, Milena Souvannavong-Kovalenko: tall lean dock worker with warm olive-bronze complexion blending Eastern European and Southeast Asian features—sharp cheekbones, hooded dark eyes, prominent brow. Shaved sides with messy black crown, copper-faded undercut. Chrome gunmetal jaw prosthetic with visible bolts and seams creating permanent underbite, pink surgical scars along jawline. Fading yellow-green bruises on right temple and orbital bone. Visible hyper-defined calves and thighs from speed augmentation, faint scar tissue behind knees. Faded Yoruba-style three-line tattoo on right wrist, burn scar on left inner forearm. Worn canvas cargo pants, sweat-stained tank top, torn dock-worker boots, faded jacket with home-sewn crew patch. Bouncing on toes, nervous energy, darting eyes. Dock warehouse setting, neon industrial lighting, gritty GLMZ Lower Docks atmosphere, weathered and exhausted --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Eastern European (40.8%) with significant Southeast Asian (22.5%) and East Asian (12.4%) ancestry, blended with Sub-Saharan African (9.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (7.5%), and South Asian (7.5%) heritage. The dominant Eastern European structure combines with Southeast Asian facial geometry—sharp cheekbones and hooded eyes—while Sub-Saharan African and South Asian ancestry adds warmth and depth to skin tone and feature complexity. A striking Ubiquitous Diaspora combination.', 178, 68, N'Lean and wiry with the muscle definition of someone who runs constantly — low body fat, corded forearms and calves from speed-boosted tendons. Bird-boned but functional.', N'Black with a faded copper undercut dyed during better weeks', N'Short fade on sides, longer crown worn messy and slightly overgrown', N'Short', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Warm olive-bronze with balanced golden and amber undertones from the blended Eastern European, Southeast Asian, East Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Sun-darkened from dock work into a weathered deep bronze with rich amber warmth.', N'Young face with sharp cheekbones and hooded eyes characteristic of Southeast and East Asian heritage, refined by Eastern European bone structure, with warmth and feature depth from African and South Asian genetic contribution. Skin shows minor acne scars and dock grime that doesn''t fully wash out. Expression is perpetually tense — jaw line disrupted by the chrome replacement.', N'Chrome jaw replacement occupies the lower face — gunmetal grey with visible seam lines and mounting bolts at the temples. The jaw is noticeably oversized and sits at a permanent underbite. Micro-servos visible at the hinges. The speed-boosted leg tendons are subcutaneous but create visible hyper-definition in the calves and thighs, with faint scar tissue visible behind the knees.', N'Bounces on his toes constantly — the speed augmentation makes standing still torture. Walks fast and urgently even when there''s no reason. Head jerks slightly when the chrome jaw clicks. Hands move when he talks, which is always. Nervous energy barely contained in his frame. Eyes dart to exits and potential threats.', N'Tier 4-5 functional clothing — canvas work pants with reinforced seams, modified with cargo pockets for carrying jobs. Loose-fitting tank top or oversized synthetic shirt, usually sweat-stained and oil-spotted. Worn dock-worker boots with torn laces he keeps meaning to replace. A faded synthetic jacket with the Lower Dock Crew informal patch (home-sewn, crooked). No jewelry except a worn rubber bracelet his mother gave him. Clothing is cheap, practical, and shows the wear of someone who cannot afford to replace things but needs them to survive.', N'He saw Yuliya behind the ventilation unit during the fight. He didn''t say anything. He doesn''t know why. He thinks about it.', N'Four languages worth of slang compressed into rapid English. Lagos inflections surface when he''s scared or excited.', N'Rapid-fire with involuntary pauses when the jaw catches. click mid-sentence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'milena_souvannavong_kovalenko');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c9-72a3-aa2a-6f6bb22f4ca9', N'Filiz Volkov', N'Filiz', N'', N'Volkov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 17, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, near Michigan Ave and Oak', N'Graffiti artist and street muralist', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone community; loosely connected to the collective WALLSEED', N'Filiz Volkov is all elbows and forward momentum — tall for his age, still growing into his frame, with his father''s Ghanaian cheekbones and his mother''s Kazakh coloring, a combination that makes people stare in the way he''s learned to read as either threat or opportunity. His hair is natural and large, often containing flecks of spray paint he missed when cleaning up. He has cat ears — a cheap geneware addition he saved up for at fifteen, dusty brown tipped with darker brown, that he can flatten against his skull when trying to look serious, which mostly does the opposite.

His work is enormous, aggressive, and surprisingly sophisticated for someone his age — he works primarily in layered aerosol with reactive topcoats that change appearance under different light conditions, hiding secondary images in plain sight. The pieces he puts up in Highland Park are community-coded: specific symbols, colors, and figures that carry meaning to residents about safety corridors, enforcement patterns, and food distribution points. He treats this as art. It is also infrastructure. He is cocky in the way of someone who is right often enough to have earned some of it, but the cockiness has a hard floor under it — he knows what happens to kids in the Zone who miscalculate.', N'Ground-level intelligence source for the HPAZ; his murals are a readable map of community conditions; represents the next generation of Zone residents; can access spaces and information networks adults can''t', N'', N'Cat ears, geneware (dusty brown, cosmetic); no other augmentations — can''t afford them and is wary of modification debt', N'School in the morning, which he attends irregularly; afternoons running messages and doing visible community work to maintain goodwill; nights painting, usually with a lookout.', N'Filiz Volkov, 188cm lean angular street artist in GLMZ, warm olive-bronze skin with golden undertones blending Middle Eastern, Northern European, Indigenous American, Eastern European and South Asian ancestry. Angular face with high prominent cheekbones, deep brown eyes with amber undertone, dark naturally-textured shoulder-length hair matted with dried spray paint. Geneware cat ears protruding from crown, dusty brown with darker tips, slightly furry and articulated. Faint surgical scar on left temple from spray can accident, perpetual dark circles under eyes from late-night painting. Paint-stained fingers and sleeves. Wearing oversized faded black thermal hoodie with GLMZ logo, cargo pants with reinforced pockets, scuffed low-top zero-G composite sneakers, military surplus olive green backpack heavy with aerosol cans. Restless forward-leaning posture, hands gesturing as if holding spray cans. Standing in moody neon-lit urban environment, neo-noir warehouse or alleyway backdrop, cool blue and warm amber lighting interplay emphasizing mixed heritage warmth against cool shadows. Focused intense expression, eyes darting with street awareness. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, atmospheric grain, cinematic lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: Middle Eastern (37.1%), Northern European (17.4%), Indigenous American (16.8%), Eastern European (16.5%), and South Asian (12.2%). Ancestry manifests in warm olive-bronze skin with subtle golden undertones, bone structure showing strong Middle Eastern and Indigenous American influence, dark expressive eyes reflecting South Asian ancestry, and an overall phenotype that seamlessly integrates multiple continental lineages—truly representative of the mixed-heritage 22nd century.', 188, 68, N'Lean and angular, still lengthening — all limbs and sharp corners, the kind of frame that looks perpetually mid-motion. Ropey muscle definition in forearms and shoulders from years of overhead spray work. Chest and torso still narrow, not yet filled out.', N'Dark brown, naturally textured, often matted with dried spray paint residue', N'Worn large and unbounded, deliberately uncontrolled — a crown of volume that reads as both artistic statement and practical neglect', N'Medium (shoulder length when loose)', N'Deep brown with amber undertone', N'Warm olive-bronze with golden undertones—a rich, complex blend reflecting dominant Middle Eastern ancestry harmonized with Northern European paleness, Indigenous American depth, Eastern European cool undertones, and South Asian warmth. Shifts between warm amber-gold in direct light and deeper olive-bronze in shadow.', N'Angular face with prominent cheekbones showing strong Middle Eastern and Indigenous American bone structure, straight nose with defined bridge, defined jawline with subtle South Asian softness. Eye shape and depth reflect South Asian and Middle Eastern ancestry while broader face geometry and high cheekbone placement show Indigenous American influence. Skin is generally clear but shows minor paint scars and chemical burns from careless solvent handling. Small scar on left temple (spray can accident at age 13). Perpetually tired eyes with dark circles — late-night painting schedule. Fingernails are permanently stained with multiple paint colors, especially reds and silvers.', N'Pair of cat ears (geneware, cosmetic-grade) protruding from crown of skull. Ears are dusty brown with darker brown tips, slightly furry, approximately 8cm tall. Ears can articulate and flatten against skull but lack fine motor control — movement is somewhat jerky and imprecise. Visible bio-integration seam around base of ears (pale scar line visible when ears flatten). No other visible augmentations.', N'Moves with restless forward momentum — leans into direction of travel. Hands constantly gesture, rearranging invisible space, fingers twitching as if holding spray cans. When standing still, shifts weight frequently. When concentrating (looking at a wall, assessing a surface), head tilts and ears swivel toward object of focus — an unconscious tell that reveals attention. Cocky stride with slight shoulder roll, but this deflates quickly when genuinely threatened. Eyes dart — reading exits, sight lines, enforcement patterns.', N'Tier 4-5 functional wear: oversized thermal hoodie (faded black, GLMZ Autonomous Transport logo faintly visible on back from thrift store), cargo pants with reinforced thigh pockets (spray cans and tools), scuffed low-top zero-G composite sneakers with one lace missing. Backpack is military surplus olive green, heavy with aerosol cans and sketchbooks. Fingers and sleeves stained with permanent paint. One wrist wraps in salvaged athletic tape (support for repetitive strain). No jewelry except the hand-done tattoo. Clothes fit loosely — either thrifted oversized or grown into the spaces. Everything smells faintly of propellant and acetone.', N'He has been secretly corresponding with a Tessera-sponsored youth arts program that''s offering him a funded residency outside the Zone. He hasn''t told anyone in the community because he knows what they''ll say, and he knows they might be right, and he still hasn''t said no.', N'HPAZ slang-heavy, fast, occasionally precise in a way that surprises; code-switches dramatically in formal contexts', N'Quick and overlapping, finishing sentences with rising intonation that isn''t a question', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'filiz_volkov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e6-7170-85f5-6f83bedcf1df', N'Gbemisola Sesay', N'Gbemisola', N'', N'Sesay', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — back room of a legitimate print and copy shop called Clearscript, on the corner of Ironvein Passage, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Identity fabricator and document forger serving The Narrows', N'Independent; maintains careful relationships with several identity brokerage networks including one with loose ties to Highland Park Autonomous Zone''s underground railroad', N'Gbemisola Sesay has the kind of face that is difficult to hold in memory — medium everything, carefully so. Their skin is a warm olive-brown, their hair is kept at an aggressively unremarkable length, and their eyes have been modded to shift between a plain grey and a plain brown depending on ambient light, which makes identification in surveillance footage nearly impossible. The only thing that stands out is their hands: long-fingered, ink-stained in colors that never quite wash out, and in near-constant motion — folding, pressing, testing paper weight and texture the way some people crack knuckles.

Gbemisola Sesay is sardonic, professionally paranoid, and possessed of an almost religious conviction that identity is the only thing in GLMZ that actually matters. They approach forgery as an art form and a philosophy simultaneously — arguing that all identity is constructed, that they are merely the honest version of what corponations do to people every day. They are patient with clients in distress and merciless with clients who waste their time. They have a particular soft spot for people fleeing bad situations, though they''d deny having soft spots at all.', N'Essential service provider for anyone needing new identities, altered records, or forged credentials; source of information on who in the city has recently needed a new name and why; can serve as a moral checkpoint — they decline certain jobs, which tells players something.', N'', N'Photochromic iris genemod (grey/brown shifting). Subdermal UV-reactive ink in fingertips — allows them to leave invisible authentication marks only they can read. Olfactory enhancement — can detect chemical composition of inks and papers.', N'Runs Clearscript''s legitimate business 0800–1400, handles custom print orders, business cards, signage. Back-room work runs 1400–0200 — document analysis, fabrication, identity architecture for clients with appointments only.', N'Gbemisola Sesay, androgynous figure with deep warm bronze skin reflecting South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Middle Eastern, Pacific Islander, and Latin heritage. Sharp South Asian cheekbones softened by African warmth, angular Indigenous temples, rounded Pacific Islander lower face. Chin-length blunt dark brown bob, unremarkable and styled identically in all conditions. Photochromic eyes shifting between grey and warm brown in ambient light—unsettling and fluid. Thin lips set in slight ironic curve, chronically furrowed brow. 172cm lean wiry build, slightly rounded shoulders from desk work. Wearing grey fitted long-sleeve shirt, dark work trousers, scuffed leather oxfords. Vintage Seiko mechanical watch on left wrist, obsessively maintained. Hands show perpetual midnight blue, copper, and violet ink stains on fingertips. Subdermal UV-reactive grid patterns visible only under specific light on palms and inner wrists. Moves with economic precision, coiled readiness. Precise professional workspace, cool overhead lighting casting subtle shadows, GLMZ aesthetic, nondescript and forgettable yet geometrically striking. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'A genuinely cosmopolitan genetic blend: South Asian ancestry (32.1%) forms the primary foundation with characteristic bone structure and facial proportions, complemented by Sub-Saharan African (22.0%) warmth and depth, Middle Eastern (17.9%) intensity, Pacific Islander (14.9%) soft roundness, Hispanic/Latin American (10.7%) richness, and Indigenous American (2.4%) angular definition. The result is a face that authentically reflects global intermixture—South Asian cheekbones and jawline softened by African warmth, Middle Eastern depth in the eyes, Pacific Islander roundness in the lower face, Latin and Indigenous American angular elements creating distinctive temple and cheekbone definition. A deliberately nondescript face that reads as ''everywhere and nowhere.''', 172, 62, N'Lean and wiry with the kind of functional thinness that comes from long hours hunched over precision work. Shoulders slightly rounded from desk posture, but capable and poised.', N'Dark brown, naturally, but deliberately stripped of all distinctive characteristics', N'Blunt, chin-length bob cut with no styling — the kind of cut that looks the same in any weather, any light', N'Medium', N'Photochromic mod: shifts between grey and warm brown depending on ambient light conditions. The modification creates an uncanny fluidity that makes the eyes difficult to remember or describe with certainty', N'Deep warm bronze with complex undertones—South Asian base enriched by Sub-Saharan African warmth and saturation, Middle Eastern depth and intensity, Pacific Islander golden undertones, Latin richness, and Indigenous American copper accents. A genuinely multi-regional complexion that shifts subtly in different lighting.', N'Broad-planed face with South Asian foundation—slightly wider cheekbones, defined jawline—enriched by the warmth of Sub-Saharan African heritage and the depth of Middle Eastern features. Pacific Islander genetics add subtle roundness to the lower face and cheeks; Latin and Indigenous American ancestry contribute sharp angular definition to the temples and cheekbones, creating distinctive facial geometry. Fine-featured, precise, deliberately unmarked—the face of someone who has engineered their own ordinariness. Lips are thin, usually set in a slight, ironic curve. Brow furrowed in the default position of chronic skepticism. No visible acne or scarring.', N'The photochromic irises are the only immediately visible augmentation — a subtle but unsettling fluidity as the eyes shift tone with ambient light. The subdermal UV-reactive ink is invisible in normal conditions but creates faint discolorations on the hands that could be mistaken for chronic ink exposure if noticed at all.', N'Moves with economic precision — no wasted motion. Hands are in constant, minute activity: folding papers, testing texture, running fingertips across surfaces, signing documents with ritualistic care. When still, they sit perfectly upright, but with a coiled readiness. Eyes track movement and light. They walk with a flat, unmemorably normal gait.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional: grey or black fitted long-sleeve shirts (cotton-synthetic blend, durable), dark jeans or work trousers, a charcoal linen apron during business hours. In the back room, they swap the apron for a precisely tailored grey waistcoat. No jewelry. Shoes are scuffed, broken-in leather oxfords — practical, silent, replaceable. Everything is chosen to be unremarkable, invisible, forgotten within seconds. The only indulgence is a vintage mechanical watch — a functioning Seiko from the 2090s, worn on the left wrist, kept obsessively accurate.', N'', N'Dry and precise; uses printmaking and document terminology; philosophical tangents delivered deadpan', N'Unhurried, slightly clipped — they consider words expensive and don''t spend them freely', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gbemisola_sesay');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65a-7690-aa94-6fbe5d26d0c2', N'Enyinnaya Moala', N'Enyinnaya', N'', N'Moala', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 51, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Shallowgrave, operates across a six-block collection territory centered on the Blackpipe Corridor market strip, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'protection racket enforcer and neighborhood tax collector', N'Shallowgrave Collective (a loose crime family structure), nominally reports to a boss called the Factor but effectively autonomous on her strip', N'Enyinnaya Moala is a broad, unhurried woman who moves through the Blackpipe Corridor market strip with the proprietary ease of someone who owns the street without holding title to a centimeter of it. She has her Malian grandmother''s high cheekbones and her Mongolian grandfather''s wide, watchful eyes, a combination that gives her face a stillness that reads as patience or menace depending on context. Her hair is natural and silver-threaded, kept close. She has no cosmetic mods and exactly one piece of visible augmentation: a reinforced subdermal strike plate across both forearms, the seams visible as pale ridged lines. She dresses in practical layers — she''s almost always carrying something — and smells faintly of the cardamom tea she drinks constantly from a battered thermos.

People in Shallowgrave call her Mama Miri, and the term is not entirely ironic. She has run protection on this strip for nineteen years and she has clear and stated rules: you pay on time, you get quiet streets, fair mediation of disputes, and someone who answers when the Ferrogate inspectors come sniffing. You don''t pay, you get one conversation, then one demonstration, then you don''t have a stall anymore. She considers herself a service provider with a monopoly, which is accurate, and she extends genuine credit and genuine leniency to vendors she respects, which is also accurate. The violence she deploys is proportional and infrequent — she prefers it that way, both because she is pragmatic and because she is, underneath the landlady performance, genuinely tired.', N'Power broker and local authority figure, quest giver (territory disputes, a vendor who has disappeared, something wrong on her strip), moral gray zone — genuinely protective of her community within the framework of extracting from it', N'', N'Subdermal strike reinforcement plates (both forearms), pain suppression shunt (low-grade, installed after a bad collection in 2191), bone-density treatment pellets in hands', N'Walks her collection circuit Tuesday and Friday mornings, taking payments and settling disputes; available at her usual table in the Blackpipe tea house most other times for anyone who needs mediation or negotiation; Thursday evenings she handles the Shallowgrave Collective''s weekly accounting.', N'Enyinnaya Moala, a 172cm woman with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, South Asian and Pacific Islander heritage visible in high cheekbones and broad face softened by island warmth; short dark hair with silver threading, brown watchful eyes set wide. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Reinforced subdermal strike plates visible as pale raised scars running down both forearms—deliberately shown as a warning. Thin white scar along left temple. Posture economical and purposeful, unhurried, direct steady gaze. Wearing layered practical clothing: dark grey base, charcoal canvas work jacket, cargo pants with deep pockets, scuffed sturdy boots. Holding a battered metal thermos of cardamom tea. Faded woven bracelet on left wrist. Tier 4 functionally, deliberately durable over fashionable. Indoor urban setting, warm ambient lighting catching the golden undertones of her complexion, emphasizing the weathered depth of her features and the dangerous pale scars on her forearms. Mood: observant, grounded, competent. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shallowgrave', N'local', N'Shallowgrave', N'South Asian dominant (51.4%) with substantial Pacific Islander (35.9%) and Northern European (12.7%) ancestry; creates a distinctive phenotype combining South Asian bone structure and facial geometry with Pacific Islander warmth and depth in skin tone, subtly refined by Nordic elements in brow and orbital structure', 172, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and solid without softness; carries herself with the compact density of someone who has moved through decades of low-grade violence. Not muscular in a performance sense, but functionally strong in the shoulders and core.', N'Dark brown with silver threading throughout', N'Close-cropped, neat, practical; a few centimeters at most', N'Short', N'Brown, watchful, set wide', N'Deep warm brown with rich golden-amber undertones, the result of blended South Asian and Pacific Islander ancestry deepened further by consistent sun exposure; creates an earthy, complex complexion that darkens seasonally', N'High prominent cheekbones with broad face structure characteristic of South Asian ancestry, softened and warmed by Pacific Islander roundness through cheeks and jawline; minimal cosmetic grooming; skin shows sun exposure and weathering from outdoor work; no visible acne or blemishes, suggesting good self-care despite her tier. Faint laugh lines around her eyes. Warm, even skin tone with natural depth and subtle golden undertones.', N'Reinforced subdermal strike plates across both forearms, visible as pale raised seams running lengthwise from wrist to elbow. The modifications are functional and deliberately visible—a warning to anyone who looks closely.', N'Moves with unhurried purpose, economical in gesture. She doesn''t fidget or rush. When she walks, her weight settles forward slightly—someone who has spent decades on her feet and has learned to conserve energy. Her hands rest naturally in her lap or at her sides, and her shoulders never tense. She makes direct eye contact and holds it without aggression, just observation.', N'Practical layered wear in neutral colors: dark grey or brown base layers, a canvas work jacket or heavy overshirt in charcoal, cargo pants with deep pockets, sturdy boots scuffed from street work. Always carries a battered metal thermos of cardamom tea. No jewelry except a faded woven bracelet on her left wrist—likely handmade, sentimental value unknown. Tier 4 functionally—not corpo polish, but well-maintained and deliberately chosen for durability over fashion.', N'Fourteen years ago she broke both hands of a vendor who had witnessed her predecessor committing a murder, to keep him silent — she told herself it was the least harm, but she knows the man never worked his trade again, and she still pays anonymously for his UBC supplements every month', N'direct, unhurried, minimal — she uses few words and expects them to carry weight; occasional Bambara phrases when genuinely emotional', N'slow and deliberate, with significant comfortable silences, the cadence of someone who is never in a hurry because the territory is already hers', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'enyinnaya_moala');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a636-7b0f-b6d2-6fd4239e45a4', N'Beknur Karimov-Ergashev', N'Beknur', N'', N'Karimov-Ergashev', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre, GLMZ, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Investigative journalist and whistleblower handler operating out of Mexicantown Libre', N'Independent (three active bylines); informal network of whistleblower contacts across Axiom, Zheng-Dao, and Ferrogate Transit; working relationship with Reuben Osei-Mukherjee-Żak (shares sources occasionally)', N'Beknur Karimov-Ergashev has the kind of face that is easy to remember individually and hard to place in a crowd — broad nose, angular cheekbones, warm coppery-brown skin, and dark eyes that are always, always taking notes. She keeps her thick dark hair pulled back tightly and wears it down only when she is trying to go unnoticed, which is an inversion most people would not anticipate. She has a faint artificial shimmer to the skin of her forearms — a residual effect of a cheap bioluminescence mod she had installed and removed years ago, leaving this iridescent ghost behind.

Beknur Karimov-Ergashev spent seven years at a mid-tier Zheng-Dao affiliated media outlet before she published a piece they hadn''t approved and found herself without a desk, a salary, or a press credential. Now she freelances for a network of independent outlets under three different bylines and runs an encrypted communication service that connects corporate whistleblowers with journalists, lawyers, and occasionally mutual aid networks depending on what is needed. She is funny and genuinely charming at parties, which is a professional tool she is not always comfortable with. She keeps a running list of every piece that has been killed, delayed, or changed without her consent — it is very long, and she re-reads it when she needs to remember why she is doing this.', N'Information broker, source of corporate intelligence, quest giver whose assignments carry ethical weight, character who can pull threads from multiple storylines together.', N'', N'Residual bioluminescent shimmer on forearms (cosmetic artifact from removed mod). High-quality optical implant — this one she saved for, bought new, no lag — which records continuous video and stores sixty hours of encrypted footage locally before auto-purging. A subvocal microphone implant for discrete recording.', N'Attends three to four public events or meetings weekly as ''background research,'' spends mornings managing the encrypted whistleblower drop system, afternoons writing, evenings at the Libre''s community social spaces maintaining the relationships that are the actual infrastructure of her work.', N'Beknur Karimov-Ergashev, lean 168cm woman with warm medium-brown skin glowing with golden and olive undertones from Central Asian-South Asian-Hispanic blend heritage. Dark almond-shaped eyes, defined cheekbones, moderately prominent nose. Long dark brown hair pulled back in tight functional braid. Faint iridescent shimmer catches light on exposed forearms like oil-on-water; thin scar visible at left temple. Wearing layered neutral-toned neo-noir outfit: charcoal fitted turtleneck, vintage pre-2200 supple leather jacket with subtle creases, fitted trousers, quality walking shoes. Thin silver ring, expensive watch. Standing in neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226 street, cool LED light catching forearm shimmer. Posture economical and deliberate, body angled with observant expression, slight private half-smile. No wasted gesture. Background: megacityscape with hovering vehicles and holographic signage, moody and professional. Cinematic, character study, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Central Asian (51.7%) as dominant ancestry, blended with South Asian (24.9%), creating the foundation of warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones. Hispanic/Latin American (14.5%) adds warmth and depth to complexion, while Middle Eastern (3.6%), Sub-Saharan African (3.0%), and Eastern European (2.3%) contribute subtle undertonal complexity and skin luminosity. This Ubiquitous Diaspora combination results in a warm, sun-kissed medium-brown tone with a distinctly Silk Road influence.', 168, 62, N'Lean and wiry with subtle musculature; carries herself with the economical movement of someone who has learned to be unobtrusive. Long-limbed, narrow shoulders.', N'Natural dark brown, nearly black', N'Typically pulled back in a tight, functional bun or braid; worn down only as deliberate camouflage', N'Long (to mid-back when loose)', N'Dark brown with warm undertone, slightly almond-shaped from Central and South Asian ancestry blend', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones and subtle olive notes — the result of Central Asian and South Asian dominance (76.6% combined) creating a sun-kissed base, enhanced by Hispanic/Latin American warmth and depth, with Middle Eastern luminosity and Sub-Saharan African richness adding complexity.', N'Moderately prominent nose with gentle definition at bridge and nostrils, characteristic of Central and South Asian heritage; defined cheekbones with balanced width across face from Central Asian ancestry; sharp jawline with slight softness at the chin. Eyes sit at medium depth with subtle almond shape. Skin is clear and well-maintained but shows signs of chronic sleep debt — faint darkening beneath eyes. Expression tends toward observant stillness, mouth held in a slight, private half-smile.', N'The forearm shimmer is the only immediately visible augmentation; it reads as unusual cosmetic work rather than active chrome. Her optical implant is subcutaneous; no visible mechanical eye or lens. Subvocal implant is completely invisible to casual observation.', N'Moves with deliberate, efficient economy — no wasted gestures. Sits with her body angled slightly away from direct confrontation, shoulders relaxed but spine straight. Makes sustained eye contact when listening; her gaze is the kind that people recognize as ''taking you in.'' Often has a pen in her hand or tucked behind her ear. Habit of writing notes on her palm with a stylus.', N'Tier 3 professional-casual with deliberate understatement. Favors neutral colors (charcoal, deep teal, muted rust) and layered pieces that allow quick adaptation to different social contexts. Typically wears fitted but not fashionable trousers, long-sleeved shirts or fitted turtlenecks (covers the forearm shimmer in formal settings), and a worn leather jacket — vintage pre-2200, supple from use, bearing subtle scuffs and creases that suggest it has survived situations. Comfortable, quality shoes built for walking. Minimal jewelry: a thin silver ring on her right hand, a watch that is slightly too expensive for her current income (saved-for purchase). No corporate logos or brand signifiers. Clothes read as ''someone who needs mobility and anonymity,'' not ''someone who needs to be noticed.''', N'One of her whistleblowers, a mid-level Axiom logistics manager, gave her information that she verified and prepared to publish — and then received a credible threat against her younger brother in the Kamm''s Landing district. She sat on the story for six weeks. The whistleblower, who had no idea why publication was delayed, was eventually identified internally and quietly disappeared into a Axiom HR ''reassignment.'' She does not know what happened to them. She has published the story since, under a byline that was not her primary one.', N'Fluid and adaptable — can match register to almost any conversation partner. Her own voice, unperformed, is dry and direct and occasionally brutal.', N'Variable. Slows way down when asking important questions. Can maintain a comfortable, unhurried social pace for hours.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'beknur_karimov_ergashev');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a631-7455-8e8d-6ffb765812bf', N'Phoenix Truong', N'Phoenix', N'', N'Truong', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'University Spine, Calumet Rise satellite office, near Lincoln and Addison', N'Sociologist specializing in the Gray Zone subcultures and informal economies', N'University Spine — Meridian Institute of Social Futures; informal community ties to Calumet Rise residents', N'Phoenix Truong is a compact woman with close-cropped natural hair shot through with thin copper-dyed streaks she''s had since her doctorate — a cosmetic mod she''s never updated because she likes that it''s dated. Her skin is deep brown, her eyes augmented with patterned irises in concentric amber rings that she tells students are ''functional, not decorative'' though they are purely decorative. She carries a battered fieldwork satchel covered in data-patch stickers from Tier 1 and 2 communities she''s embedded with, and she smells faintly of the Gray Zone''s characteristic mix of fry oil and ozone.

Phoenix Truong is warm in the field and terse at faculty meetings, a distinction colleagues find jarring. She is deeply respected by her research subjects in ways the university administration finds uncomfortable — she''s been known to halt publication of her own papers when community members asked her to, citing ethics over career. Her laugh is sudden and loud, her criticism precise and unwelcome. She genuinely loves the people she studies, which some of her peers consider a methodological problem.', N'Information source on the Gray Zone communities, Tier 1-2 culture, informal economies; potential quest giver for community-based investigations; moral compass in discussions of research ethics; bridge between academic and street worlds.', N'', N'Patterned amber irises (cosmetic). Sub-dermal field recorder in left forearm — records audio/environmental data, university-issued. Minor joint reinforcement in both knees from years of fieldwork walking.', N'Spends three days a week in Calumet Rise conducting longitudinal community interviews, the other two at the university writing, arguing with the IRB, and running a graduate seminar she considers the best course offered at the institution.', N'Portrait of Phoenix Truong, a 158cm Southeast Asian-South Asian-Eastern European mixed heritage woman in her 30s, GLMZ. Warm medium-brown skin with golden olive undertones, angular Southeast Asian cheekbones tapering into broader Eastern European bone structure. Short textured deep brown hair with faded copper streaks. Her most striking feature: augmented concentric amber ring irises against dark brown sclera, unnaturally patterned and immediately noticeable. Weathered complexion from fieldwork, few lines around intense eyes. Compact wiry build, slight shoulder rounding from years of heavy satchel carrying. Wearing aged high-quality Carhartt work pants, soft merino wool sweater, scuffed sturdy walking boots. Battered canvas fieldwork satchel with leather trim covered in community data-patch stickers visible over one shoulder. Faint linear scar visible on left forearm. No makeup. Economical posture, leaning forward slightly, unconsciously touching left forearm. Purpose-driven movement captured mid-stride. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone industrial architecture and neon grid lighting in soft focus background. Documentary realism meets neo-noir urban aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'University Spine', N'local', N'University Spine', N'Southeast Asian plurality (42.3%) blended with significant South Asian (31.1%) and Eastern European (26.6%) ancestry. The genetic combination creates warm medium-brown skin with golden and subtle olive undertones. Her features reflect the Southeast Asian plurality—angular cheekbones, slightly almond-shaped eye structure—enriched by South Asian facial architecture and reinforced by Eastern European bone structure. Cheekbones are notably angular with slight Southeast Asian tapering, while underlying jaw and brow structure shows the broader Eastern European skeletal geometry. The blend is distinctly cosmopolitan, marking her as product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, with the hard-earned musculature of someone who walks fieldwork routes on foot three days a week. Shoulders slightly rounded from years of carrying a heavy satchel. No excess body fat.', N'Natural deep brown with thin copper-dyed streaks', N'Close-cropped, textured, deliberately undyed since doctoral work — the copper streaks are faded and intentionally maintained', N'Short', N'Augmented: patterned irises in concentric amber rings with natural dark brown sclera', N'Warm medium brown with golden and subtle olive undertones, reflecting the blend of Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Eastern European ancestry', N'Weathered from consistent fieldwork exposure. Angular cheekbones and tapered facial structure reflecting Southeast and South Asian heritage, with broader Eastern European bone structure underlying the midface and jaw. Few lines around eyes and mouth from frequent intense smiling and concentration. Minimal makeup. Hands callused from note-taking and satchel carrying.', N'Concentric amber patterned irises — immediately noticeable and unusual. Sub-dermal field recorder not visible under normal clothing but occasionally visible as a slight bulge on left forearm. No visible chrome or external augmentation.', N'Moves with economical efficiency but without rigidity. Sits forward in conversations, leaning slightly toward interlocutors. Stands with weight shifted to one leg, often touching her left forearm unconsciously when discussing field data. Her walk is purposeful and ground-covering; she''s always going somewhere specific.', N'Tier 2 academic-adjacent: worn high-quality field gear aged into softness. Carhartt canvas work pants, vintage merino wool sweaters, sturdy walking boots (currently scuffed, several years old). The battered fieldwork satchel is non-negotiable — canvas with leather trim, covered in data-patch stickers from communities she''s embedded with. Minimal jewelry. No corporate branding. Her style reads as ''too invested in the work to care about fashion,'' which is partly true and partly carefully maintained.', N'She has been quietly funneling portions of her grant money into a mutual aid network in Calumet Rise for three years, in clear violation of her funding contract. She is terrified of being found out and equally terrified of stopping.', N'Precise academic when writing, but speaks in field she code-switches fluently into Calumet Rise vernacular; avoids jargon in conversation', N'Measured and deliberate, until she''s excited — then she talks fast and interrupts herself', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'phoenix_truong');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b5-7da8-9a97-700a05ac1ee6', N'Nyx Saito', N'Nyx', N'', N'Saito', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — Tier Four, three corridors south of Chen''s, near Western and Division', N'Client — hired Kyle to avenge her husband''s beating', N'None', N'Nyx Saito is built like someone who has carried heavy things her entire life — broad shoulders, thick forearms, hands that look like they could crush walnuts or cradle a child with equal confidence. She came to GLMZ from the Volgograd displacement zone when she was nineteen, pregnant, speaking four words of English: ''please,'' ''help,'' ''work,'' and ''no.'' She now speaks roughly forty words of English, all of them practical. She communicates primarily through a translation app on a cracked tablet that she holds like a shield. Her face is weathered beyond her years — deep lines around her mouth, sun damage from agricultural work in the displacement camps, a scar across her left eyebrow from a piece of industrial debris. She is not soft. She is not hard. She is a woman who has been carrying impossible weight for so long that her skeleton has restructured itself around the burden. She scraped together Kyle''s fee by selling her blood to a Helix BioSystems collection point three times a week for two months. Kyle took the job at half rate. She does not know this and he will never tell her.', N'Anya is the human cost that justifies Kyle''s violence. She is the reason the code exists. When the reader questions whether Kyle is a monster, Anya is the answer: no, he is the thing monsters are afraid of, and he works for women who sell their blood to pay his fee.', N'', N'None. Cannot afford them.', N'Factory assembly work, blood sales, cooking, caring for Demyan, worrying about Yuliya.', N'Nyx Saito, GLMZ, 168cm powerfully-built woman with warm medium-deep brown skin blending South Asian, East Asian, African, Southeast Asian, Eastern European, and Hispanic heritage. Deep brown tired eyes, dark hair with gray at temples pulled back in loose practical braid. Face lined and weathered with high prominent cheekbones, broader nose with slight flare, slightly hooded eyes. Three-centimeter jagged scar across left eyebrow from industrial wound. Weathered complexion with sun damage across cheekbones and forehead. Hands calloused and yellowed, marked with needle scars from repeated blood collection. Wearing faded factory-gray coveralls worn at elbows and knees, heavy patched canvas jacket, thermal undershirt, taped work boots. Holding cracked tablet in cloth wrap. Hunched posture from assembly line work, weight shifted between feet, gaze directed downward. Standing in industrial displacement camp or factory setting, dim industrial lighting, tired and stoic expression, economical stillness. Neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Polychromatic blend of South Asian (25%), East Asian (22.2%), Sub-Saharan African (16%), Southeast Asian (15.2%), Eastern European (11%), and Hispanic/Latin American (10.6%) ancestry. Facial structure reflects this continental convergence: broader nose with slight flare from South Asian and African heritage, defined cheekbones elevated by East Asian genetics, slightly hooded eyes characteristic of East and Southeast Asian lineage, and warm golden undertones across medium-deep brown skin from the full ancestral blend.', 168, 78, N'Powerfully built with broad shoulders and thick forearms developed from decades of manual labor. Not muscular in a refined sense — the build of someone whose body has been shaped by carrying, lifting, and sustained physical work. Core strength evident despite modest body fat.', N'Dark brown, fading to gray at the temples and roots', N'Pulled back in a practical braid, often loose and slightly disheveled by end of shift', N'Long', N'Deep brown with tired intensity', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden undertones, weathered by UV exposure in displacement camps and industrial environments. Complexion reflects the depth and warmth of multiple continental ancestries blended into unified warm coloration.', N'Lined face showing environmental wear, especially around the mouth and eyes. Deep creases between eyebrows suggesting the convergence of South Asian width with East Asian angularity, African feature prominence, and Southeast Asian softness. Sun damage visible as uneven pigmentation across cheekbones and forehead. Lips full and naturally pigmented but often pale from fatigue. Permanent furrow in brow from chronic worry. High, prominent cheekbones from East Asian and African heritage blended with broader facial planes from South Asian ancestry.', N'None. No cybernetics visible.', N'Moves with economical efficiency, no wasted motion. Shoulders slightly hunched forward — occupational posture from assembly line work. When stationary, weight shifts between feet as if perpetually braced for the next task. Hands move with surprising gentleness despite their size and strength. Eye contact minimal, gaze often directed downward or at her cracked tablet.', N'Tier Four survival wear. Factory-issue grey coveralls, worn thin at elbows and knees, with Volzhskiy Manufacturing Corp logo faded to barely visible. Underneath: a faded long-sleeved shirt (undershirt of some kind, likely thermal). Worn work boots with visible tape around the seams. A heavy canvas jacket, oversized, likely secondhand, patched at several points. The jacket is layered and functional — pockets stuffed with small necessities. Holds a cracked tablet with visible damage to the screen corner, protected in a makeshift cloth wrap. No jewelry. No accessories beyond necessity.', N'She knows exactly who the gang works for. She hired Kyle anyway.', N'Forty words of English, all blunt instruments. Speaks through a translation app or through her daughter.', N'Short. Direct. No filler. Every English word costs her effort.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'nyx_saito');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6fd-7959-adc5-701a59ac948a', N'Andrei Ly', N'Andrei', N'', N'Ly', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Based out of Copperhead Station depot; lives in a capsule apartment in McKinley Flats, near Ashland and Division', N'Ferrogate Transit operator, runs the 7-Copperhead elevated rail line', N'Ferrogate Transit (mid-level ferrogate transit operator)', N'Andrei Ly is lean in the way of someone who forgets to eat — not hungry, just elsewhere. He''s got his father''s Congolese height and his mother''s Dutch pallor tipped toward olive in the fluorescent light of the transit cab, with a patchy beard he trims but never quite conquers and geneware cat ears — cream-colored, slightly moth-eaten at the tips — that he got at eighteen and has since half-regretted, because they go flat when he''s tired and everyone can tell. His hands are calloused from the manual override controls he insists on using when the AI would do fine. His Ferrogate Transit uniform is worn to a specific softness at the collar.

He is the kind of person who is most himself when alone but does not enjoy being lonely — a contradiction he has not resolved. He loves the 7-Copperhead line with the quiet intensity some people reserve for religion: the rhythm of the stops, the specific quality of dawn light over McKinley Flats at 0512 when nothing else is moving. He treats passengers with mechanical courtesy that occasionally cracks open into genuine warmth for regulars. He has opinions about rail maintenance he will share at length if given the slightest opening.', N'Mobile information source — he sees who rides the 7-Copperhead at what hours, notices patterns and anomalies. A player character who rides his line regularly can cultivate him as a contact. Also useful for transit-based chase sequences or as a witness to something he saw from the elevated track.', N'', N'Cosmetic geneware cat ears (cream, oft-drooping); basic neural link for Ferrogate''s train management system (company-issued, company-owned). No personal chrome.', N'Picks up his shift at 2200 from Copperhead Depot, runs the elevated line through eleven stops until 1000. Eats a produced-protein sandwich somewhere around 0300. Sleeps days in McKinley Flats. Spends his one weekly off-day doing maintenance checks on his assigned car that he is not technically required to do.', N'Andrei Ly, 188cm lean transit operator with medium warm bronze skin, high cheekbones blending Southeast Asian and Eastern European features, slight downturned eye shape, dark brown alert eyes, patchy two-day beard. Cream-colored translucent geneware cat ears drooping slightly at base of skull. Wearing faded navy Ferrogate jumpsuit with reflective trim and worn collar, gray thermals underneath. Standing in fluorescent-lit transit cab with slight forward lean, economical posture. Dark brown hair graying at temples, slightly unkempt. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, tired but alert expression, hands with visible calluses near control panels. Stainless steel regulation watch. Neural port scar barely visible at base of skull. Moody transit station lighting, morning shift fatigue, dystopian infrastructure in background. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Based out of Copperhead Station depot; lives in a capsule apartment in McKinley Flats', N'local', N'Based out of Copperhead Station depot; lives in a capsule apartment in McKinley Flats', N'Mixed Southeast Asian (45.5%), Eastern European (40.4%), Sub-Saharan African (9.9%), and Hispanic/Latin American (4.2%) ancestry. His features reflect a complex blend — Southeast Asian foundation evident in cheekbone structure and eye shape, tempered by Eastern European bone geometry and Sub-Saharan African warmth in skin undertones. The combination creates a distinctly diaspora appearance, with no single heritage dominating visually.', 188, 71, N'Lean and lanky — the kind of height that comes from his father''s side, with a runner''s lack of bulk. His frame reads as someone perpetually in motion between places, muscle kept minimal by inattention rather than design.', N'Dark brown, graying at the temples', N'Short, slightly unkempt, with a tendency to stand up at the back where he runs his hand through it during concentration', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert despite fatigue', N'Medium warm bronze with golden undertones — the natural result of Southeast Asian (45.5%) and Eastern European (40.4%) base genetics enriched by warmth and depth from Sub-Saharan African (9.9%) and Hispanic/Latin American (4.2%) ancestry. Carries subtle golden and warm undertones. Yellowed-out under twelve hours of fluorescent transit cab lighting, skin carries the faint pallor of someone who sleeps during daylight.', N'Southeast Asian and Eastern European facial structure with high, pronounced cheekbones balanced by broader Eastern European bone geometry. Slight downturned eye shape characteristic of Southeast Asian heritage, with warm brown irises. Smooth skin texture with fine lines around his eyes from squinting at control panels and dawn light. A patchy beard of dark and graying hair he trims but never fully eliminates, kept at roughly two-days growth. Skin slightly dehydrated.', N'Cream-colored geneware cat ears, which flatten and droop noticeably when tired or stressed. A faint neural port scar at the base of his skull where his Ferrogate-issued neural link interfaces, usually hidden by his collar. No personal chrome — his augmentations are minimal and company-mandated.', N'Upright but not rigid, with a slight forward lean as if always listening to something just beyond hearing. His movements are economical — no wasted motion in the cab. When standing still, he gravitates toward leaning against walls or railings. His hands move with precision when working controls, but his shoulders tend to hunch slightly when he''s deep in thought about rail maintenance or the morning schedule.', N'Ferrogate Transit operator uniform — a worn navy jumpsuit with reflective trim and his name stitched above the left pocket, faded to a soft, comfortable state at collar and cuffs from twelve-hour shifts. The fabric has slight wear marks from repeated contact with cab controls. Under it, a plain gray thermals shirt. When off-duty, he wears durable working clothes: heavy canvas pants, unmarked gray or black hoodies, reinforced boots. Everything is Tier 3-4 utilitarian — functional, maintained, but not invested in. A Ferrogate ID badge on a lanyard. One stainless steel watch, regulation-issue, always set to depot time.', N'Three years ago he saw two Ferrogate Transit supervisors throw a body from the 7-Copperhead''s maintenance hatch somewhere over Blackpipe Corridor at 0340. He filed nothing. He has spent three years convincing himself he didn''t see what he saw.', N'Flat, technical, with Ferrogate jargon bleeding into civilian speech; occasionally shifts into warm specificity when talking about things he loves', N'Even and unhurried, with long pauses where other people would fill silence', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'andrei_ly');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ba-7323-9be6-7049892db8ce', N'Zofia Cervantes', N'Zofia', N'', N'Cervantes', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'University Spine, with frequent fieldwork in Chatham Flats and Hough Reclamation, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Urban planner and sociologist studying informal settlement patterns in the Gray Zone', N'University Spine — Meridian Institute for Settlement Studies; occasional contract work for Tessera urban development division', N'Zofia Cervantes is a broad-shouldered woman with deep brown skin and close-cropped silver-streaked hair she''s had since her late twenties—a stress response she refuses to reverse, wearing it like a badge. Her eyes carry geneware patterned irises that shift between amber and rust-red, a gift to herself after her tenure review. She maps space the way other people breathe: constantly, involuntarily, rotating the geometry of every room she enters. She dresses in field-practical layers, always with at least one pocket stuffed with data wafers and a collapsible survey drone no bigger than her fist.

She is warm in person but relentlessly precise in argument, the kind of academic who will sit with a the Gray Zone resident for three hours learning how they navigate a flooded block and then spend three more weeks turning that knowledge into policy language that nobody in power will read. She is not cynical about this—or she has trained herself not to be. She believes in documentation as a form of justice, that to name a place accurately is to insist on its existence.', N'Quest giver and information source; she knows the physical and social geography of the Gray Zone better than almost anyone and can direct players toward hidden communities, forgotten infrastructure, or the human cost behind a corporate development plan', N'', N'Geneware patterned irises (amber-to-rust shift); subdermal haptic feedback layer on fingertips for reading topographic data prints; standard neural lace for research access', N'Mornings she teaches a graduate seminar on post-flood urbanism, afternoons she is usually in the field with a survey drone and a voice recorder, talking to anyone who will talk back. Evenings she writes, revises, and argues with her research partner over shared feeds.', N'Zofia Cervantes, a 174cm researcher with a powerlifter''s broad-shouldered frame, stands in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Her warm medium bronze skin with golden undertones reflects blended Hispanic/Latin American, Eastern European, Central Asian, and Pacific Islander heritage. Angular Slavic cheekbones soften into fuller Latin American features; her squared jaw and prominent cheekbones create striking geometry. Deep black hair streaked with deliberate silver-white runs close-cropped and precisely cut. Her most striking feature: geneware-patterned irises shift between amber and rust-red, catching light unnaturally. A faint 2cm surgical scar marks her right temple where neural lace installed; thin whitened lines scar her index and middle fingertips from haptic calibration. She wears a meticulously maintained Tessera reinforced cargo jacket, moisture-wicking undershirt, heavy canvas cargo trousers, and ankle-height tactical boots. A ruggedized research-grade watch and worn leather university satchel complete her outfit. Her posture is upright and deliberate; her hands gesture constantly, describing spatial geometry. Mood: focused intensity, confident fieldwork professionalism. Setting: dimly lit field station or urban survey location with soft overhead lighting casting shadows across her angular features, emphasizing her hybrid heritage and enhanced eyes. Neo-noir urban aesthetic, detailed but gritty, realistic textures. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'University Spine', N'local', N'University Spine', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (54.9%) with significant Eastern European (28.4%), Central Asian (10.3%), and Pacific Islander (6.4%) ancestry—a striking blend creating warm medium bronze skin with golden undertones, angular Eastern European cheekbones softened by Latin American fullness, and Pacific Islander warmth in skin depth; the convergence produces a uniquely balanced face where Slavic bone structure meets Latin American and Central Asian roundness', 174, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, with a powerlifter''s frame running slightly toward stockiness; strong through the core and upper body, suggesting decades of carrying equipment and moving through difficult terrain', N'Deep black with silver-white streaking throughout, deliberately maintained', N'Closely cropped, precision-cut, functional', N'Short', N'Geneware-patterned irises shifting between amber and rust-red depending on light and mood', N'Medium warm bronze with golden undertones and subtle warm depth from Pacific Islander heritage; unmarked and well-maintained, reflecting the rich blending of Hispanic/Latin American, Eastern European, Central Asian, and Pacific Islander ancestry', N'Angular facial structure blending Eastern European cheekbones with Latin American and Central Asian fullness; prominent, defined cheekbones paired with a squared jaw that suggests Slavic heritage; warm bronze undertones add depth and luminosity; minimal cosmetic intervention; skin shows sun exposure from fieldwork but no visible scarring; expression lines around the eyes from squinting at maps and taking notes', N'Eyes are clearly modified—the patterned iris geometry catches light unnaturally, shifting color. No external chrome or subdermal plating visible; augmentations are subcutaneous or ocular only. The fingertip scarring hints at sensory mods to those who know what to look for.', N'Upright and deliberate, rarely at rest; constantly mentally rotating spatial geometry even while sitting. Moves with precision economy—no wasted motion, but not tense. Her hands are always doing something: gesturing to describe building layouts, manipulating imaginary topography in the air, reaching for data wafers. She leans in when listening to people, a studied habit that makes informants feel heard.', N'Tier 3-4 field practical: reinforced cargo jacket (Tessera-branded, three years old, meticulously maintained), moisture-wicking undershirt, heavy canvas trousers with oversized thigh and cargo pockets, ankle-height tactical boots rated for water ingress. Layers vary by season but always include at least one vest with internal padding for sensor arrays. Her watch is a ruggedized research-grade unit with mapping overlay. Worn leather satchel, university-issued, packed with survey equipment. Everything is well-used but not shabby—maintained like tools that matter.', N'Three years ago she was approached by a Tessera urban development officer who offered her research funding in exchange for a private data set identifying which the Gray Zone communities had the weakest legal claim to their land. She declined but did not report the approach — and she has recently discovered that the officer obtained essentially the same data through a graduate student she supervised.', N'Academic but accessible; she code-switches fluently between research register and plain speech depending on who she is talking to; uses spatial metaphors constantly', N'Measured and deliberate, pauses before making a point as if checking her own sources', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'zofia_cervantes');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a633-746a-993c-70700184929a', N'Georgina Kang-Lindström', N'Georgina', N'', N'Kang-Lindström', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, Dzel-Brite Wash & Fold on Copper Alley, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Laundromat operator and informal neighborhood anchor', N'Independent; informal ties to the Hamtramck Enclave community council', N'Georgina Kang-Lindström is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin, silver-streaked locs pinned into a coiled crown, and hands that are permanently waterlogged from decades of pressing and folding. She has a wide, expressive face with laugh lines that have earned their place, and pale gray eyes that are one of two cosmetic mods she''s ever owned — the other being a pair of faintly bioluminescent fingernails she keeps painted amber. She runs the Dzel-Brite like it is a second city hall: everyone comes through with their dirty laundry and leaves lighter, not just cleaner. She knows which families are fighting by whose clothes stop arriving together, knows which teenagers have new lovers by the unfamiliar fabrics mixed into their bags.

Georgina Kang-Lindström has the emotional density of someone who has chosen not to leave a difficult place and has made peace with that choice. She is warm but not soft, funny in a dry way that catches people off guard. She has opinions about everything and shares them only when asked — or when she decides you need to hear them. She prays faithfully to the E.L.F. that inhabits the Dzel-Brite''s oldest dryer, a machine she calls Grandmother, leaving small data offerings of ambient laundry-cycle recordings before every Monday morning shift.', N'Neighborhood information hub — she knows everyone''s business through the social gravity of the laundromat; quest giver for domestic crises; emotional anchor scene for grounding players in civilian life.', N'', N'Cosmetic: pale gray iris mods, bioluminescent amber fingernail underlays. Functional: a lumbar nerve-brace implant she got at a discount clinic fifteen years ago that prevents her back from completely giving out.', N'Opens at 05:30 and closes whenever the last machine cycles down, usually around 22:00; she eats two meals a day standing up behind the counter and naps for forty minutes in the back room during the mid-afternoon lull.', N'Georgina Kang-Lindström, fifty-two year old woman with warm golden-brown skin blending East Asian, Indigenous American and Central Asian heritage. Wide expressive face with prominent soft cheekbones, moderate-broad nose bridge, deep laugh lines. Dark brown locs with silver streaks coiled atop her head wrapped in faded jewel-toned headscarf. Pale gray modified cosmetic irises glowing faintly, bioluminescent amber fingernail underlays casting soft glow. Broad-shouldered substantial build, 172cm tall. Wearing loose rust-colored linen shift over sage leggings, open charcoal cardigan, deep-pocketed apron. Copper wire bracelet. Standing in warm laundromat light, subtle scars on palms visible, crescent-moon burn mark on left forearm. Posture deliberate and grounded, hands gesturing expressively, soft amber nails glowing. GLMZ, utilitarian comfort aesthetic, practical grooming, weathered but well-maintained presence. Warm intimate lighting, low-angle view emphasizing her calm authority. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Predominantly East Asian (56.4%) with substantial Indigenous American ancestry (30.3%) and Central Asian heritage (13.3%). Her bone structure reflects the balanced blend of East Asian moderate facial width with Indigenous American broader dimensions, creating distinctive cheekbones that carry both prominence and soft fullness. Central Asian ancestry adds subtle angular depth to her overall facial architecture.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial, with the settled solidity of someone who has spent fifty-two years on her feet. Strong through the upper back and arms from decades of pressing and folding; slightly softened at the midsection but dense rather than loose.', N'Dark brown to black with silver-gray streaks throughout', N'Locs pinned into a coiled crown atop her head, typically wrapped with a faded cotton headscarf in jewel tones', N'Long (shoulder-length when uncoiled)', N'Pale gray (cosmetic iris modification, distinctly artificial but warm in appearance)', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle olive undertones—a rich blend reflecting her East Asian and Indigenous American ancestry in balanced proportion. Sun-exposure deepening on forearms and neck from years of window-side standing creates natural depth variation.', N'Wide, expressive face with pronounced laugh lines framing the eyes and mouth. The bridge of her nose shows the characteristic moderate-to-broad width of blended East and Indigenous American heritage, with full, prominent cheekbones softened by age and expression. Skin texture is weathered but well-maintained; no blemishes, faint age spots on the backs of hands and temples creating natural patterning. Grooming is practical and deliberate—minimal makeup, typically just lip balm.', N'Pale gray iris modifications that glow faintly when she turns her head in direct light. Bioluminescent fingernail underlays that cast a soft amber aura when she moves her hands, especially in the low-light laundromat environment. Lumbar nerve-brace implant is subcutaneous and invisible.', N'Stands with her weight evenly distributed, shoulders back but not rigid. Moves with deliberate efficiency—no wasted motion from fifty-two years of laundromat work. Leans against the counter when listening to customers, gestures with her hands when she''s being emphatic. Walks slowly but with purpose, protecting her back through subtle adjustments in gait.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian comfort. Typically wears loose linen or cotton shifts in muted colors (rust, charcoal, sage) over practical leggings or loose pants. Always an apron with deep pockets for clothespins, receipts, and lost items. Slides or soft-soled work shoes. A cardigan or oversized button-up worn open over her shift for warmth and pockets. No jewelry beyond a simple copper wire bracelet her daughter made her fifteen years ago. Clothing shows signs of wear but is always clean—she presses and mends her own garments.', N'Fifteen years ago she reported a neighbor to Ferrogate Transit security about an unauthorized sublease operation — a snap decision she made in a moment of fear. The family was evicted into the street in winter. She has never told anyone and has been quietly supporting that family''s adult daughter ever since without explanation.', N'Working-class Hamtramck vernacular, a mix of Ghanaian-inflected Polish loan-words passed down through family, pragmatic and earthy', N'Unhurried, deliberate — she finishes every sentence like she has nowhere else to be', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'georgina_kang_lindstr_m');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a664-7639-8fdc-709ecd570f35', N'Dong Erikstad', N'Dong', N'', N'Erikstad', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Street-level medic and black-market augmentation installer', N'Unaffiliated; informally protected by several the Gray Zone community networks who would notice her absence', N'Dong Erikstad is a compact, dark-skinned woman of Nigerian-Dutch descent with close-cropped hair shaved to geometric patterns on one side — a style she touches up herself with a straight razor. Her hands are her most notable feature: surgeon-precise, perpetually slightly stained with biosynthetic sealant, adorned with a lattice of fine silver conductive thread she stitched into her own skin to improve haptic feedback during procedures. She works out of a converted shipping container wedged beneath the Gray Zone''s elevated roadways, a space she calls the Parlour, decorated with hand-drawn anatomical diagrams and the occasional wilting plant.

She trained as a licensed biomedical technician in the Meridian Core before her credentials were revoked following an incident she describes only as ''a disagreement about who deserves to live.'' Since sliding down to the Gray Zone, she has built a reputation as the most reliable unlicensed augmentation installer in the district — someone who will not butcher you, will not sell your biometric data, and will remember your name next time. Her waiting list is three weeks long and she accepts payment in currency, favors, or occasionally food.

Dong Erikstad is not idealistic about the people she helps, but she is consistent. She patches up runners, gang members, runaways, and anyone who cannot access or afford licensed care. She has a dry, unhurried manner that people frequently mistake for coldness until the moment she says exactly the right thing. She keeps a battered handwritten ledger of every patient she has treated, not for blackmail but because she believes someone should know these people existed and were cared for.', N'Grounded moral anchor and street-level information hub; represents the ethics of care under systemic exclusion; provides a safe(ish) space in the narrative where characters can be vulnerable', N'', N'Conductive haptic thread lattice stitched into both hands (self-installed, improves surgical precision),Subdermal temperature regulation layer (medical necessity after a the Gray Zone winter nearly killed her),Optical magnification implant in left eye, medical-grade, slightly out of date', N'Wakes before the Gray Zone''s overhead roads begin their morning traffic rumble, drinks tea while reviewing the previous day''s patient notes. Sees three to six patients per day depending on complexity. Spends evenings restocking supplies, maintaining her tools, and reading — she has an extensive collection of pre-Collapse medical texts she considers more honest than current ones. Sleeps lightly.', N'Dong Erikstad, a lean 163cm surgical tech with rich warm brown skin blending Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, and Central Asian heritage. Close-cropped black hair with geometric razor patterns on left side, right side at 2cm. Naturally dark brown right eye, left eye augmented with subtle opalescent optical magnification. Sharp cheekbones with faint old scar tissue on right cheek and jaw. Impeccably clean hands covered in gleaming silver conductive thread lattice in geometric patterns from wrist to fingertips. Wearing dark teal compression shirt with sleeves pushed to elbows, revealing hand augmentations, dark gray reinforced work pants with multiple pockets, white reinforced lab coat with darker fabric patches, worn gray canvas field jacket. Thin silver dented bracelet on right wrist. Surgical posture, standing slightly forward at hips, hands in ready position. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone underground clinic setting, fluorescent overhead lights catching the gleam of her hand threads and left eye augmentation. Moody, focused, efficient. Professional and slightly worn but meticulously maintained. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (43.2%) with substantial East Asian (18.9%), Central Asian (14.0%), and Southeast Asian (12.9%) ancestry. This creates a rich phenotype with warm brown undertones, slightly prominent cheekbones reflecting East and Central Asian features, and the strong bone structure characteristic of Sub-Saharan genetics. South Asian (6.9%) and Hispanic/Latin American (4.1%) elements contribute subtle warmth to skin tone and refined definition to facial contours.', 163, 58, N'Compact and lean, all efficient muscle with minimal excess — the build of someone who moves precisely and conserves energy. Shoulders slightly rounded from years bent over surgical work.', N'Natural black with subtle warm undertones', N'Close-cropped with geometric patterns razor-shaved into the left side; right side kept at approximately 2cm. Patterns are angular, intentional — updated roughly every two weeks with visible precision work.', N'Short', N'Left eye: augmented with subtle optical magnification, appears slightly opalescent under certain angles of light. Right eye: natural dark brown.', N'Rich warm brown with balanced golden and neutral undertones reflecting the blend of Sub-Saharan, East Asian, and Central Asian ancestry. Even complexion maintained through diligent sun protection despite living beneath elevated roadways.', N'Clean and carefully maintained, minimal makeup. Faint scar tissue visible on cheekbones and jaw from old street trauma, now faded to pale lines. A thin line runs along her left temple — optical implant surgical scar, barely noticeable. Hands show the heaviest aging: slightly callused fingertips, faint discoloration from repeated biosynthetic exposure, but impeccably clean. Facial structure shows slightly prominent cheekbones with refined definition, reflecting East and Central Asian heritage blended with Sub-Saharan bone structure.', N'Conductive haptic thread lattice throughout both hands is immediately visible — fine silver lines creating geometric patterns from wrist to fingertips. Left eye shows subtle optical modification: the iris appears fractionally more reflective than the right, with an almost imperceptible geometric micro-pattern visible only in direct light. Subdermal temperature regulation layer is not visually apparent, functioning internally.', N'Moves with deliberate efficiency, economical gestures. Stands slightly forward at the hips, a habitual surgical posture. Hands are rarely still — they gesture during conversation or rest in a ready position. When focused, she becomes almost motionless. Walking pace is steady and unhurried even when moving quickly; she does not hurry unnecessarily.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian with no concession to fashion. Black or dark gray reinforced polymer work pants with multiple pockets (carries supplies: bandages, micro-sutures, diagnostic tools). Loose-fitting long-sleeve compression shirts in charcoal or dark teal, sleeves often pushed to elbow to expose her hands and thread work. Over this: a heavily modified white lab coat that has been reinforced at stress points with darker fabric patches; the original corporate branding long since removed or covered. Worn gray canvas field jacket over everything during winter or when leaving the Parlour. Practical black boots with reinforced soles, approximately five years old, meticulously maintained. A single piece of jewelry: a thin silver bracelet on right wrist, dented from years of work, possibly a memento — never removed.', N'The incident that cost her license involved refusing to prioritize a corporate executive''s elective augmentation upgrade over an emergency triage patient — then falsifying the records to protect herself. The patient she saved died three weeks later in an unrelated incident. She has never told anyone she saved him at all.', N'Clinical precision mixed with West African English cadences; uses medical terminology casually but explains it without condescension; occasional Dutch expletives under stress', N'Measured and unhurried, with long pauses she doesn''t feel the need to fill; sentences are complete and economical', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dong_erikstad');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a9-7ac1-9494-70d3cc41d849', N'Beliz Wójcik-Malhotra', N'Beliz', N'', N'Wójcik-Malhotra', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 37, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Row — arms dealers and augmentation clinics, near Kedzie and Division', N'Chemical and biological agent specialist — poisoner', N'Independent — operates through reputation only', N'Beliz Wójcik-Malhotra are slight and easy to overlook, which is exactly the point. At 37, the augmentation scarring around their temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release — and they make no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left them with skills and night terrors in equal measure. They work as a poisoner out of Kessler Row, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

What Beliz Wójcik-Malhotra lacks in subtlety, they compensate for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'Alper Lebedev-Tutu functions as a connector — their work puts them in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving them naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release. Cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers at 50 meters', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Beliz Wójcik-Malhotra, 2226 GLMZ operative, 168cm wiry frame. Deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, luminous complexion. High angular cheekbones blending East Asian and South Asian structure with African warmth. Dark brown eyes with amber ring, natural. Dark brown hair with silver threading, pulled back tight. Visible matte black chrome cyberears with LED indicators on temples, surgical scarring unobscured. Jagged scar along right jawline from adrenaline regulator implant, pale chemical burn marks on inner left forearm, faded needle-track scarring on elbows. Economical posture, contained intensity. Wears matte black reinforced tactical jacket, reinforced cargo pants, dark boots, gloves, data-resistant chest bag. No logos or branding. Nighttime-appropriate, operational aesthetic. Sits at exit-surveillance angles. GLMZ 2200s, moody neon-lit industrial setting, cool blue and black shadows, functional not aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Row', N'local', N'Kessler Row', N'Intricate genetic mosaic with balanced contribution across four continental lineages: South Asian (35.6%) providing warm undertones and subtle facial structure, Eastern European (26.3%) contributing facial width and bone prominence, East Asian (24.3%) defining eye shape and cheekbone angularity, and Sub-Saharan African (13.8%) enriching melanin depth and skin luminosity. The convergence creates a genuinely multifaceted phenotype—neither dominated by single ancestry nor visibly categorizable. A true product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 58, N'Wiry and spare — the physiology of someone who optimized for speed and precision rather than strength. Muscle definition is visible but lean, almost ascetic. No excess.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading through the sides', N'Pulled back in a tight, utilitarian knot or undercut fade depending on operational phase', N'Short to medium', N'Dark brown with slight amber ring — natural, not augmented', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones—luminous from balanced South Asian, East Asian, and Sub-Saharan African melanin convergence. Rich, glowing complexion that catches light particularly across the cheekbones and forehead.', N'High, prominent cheekbones with East Asian angularity broadened by South Asian and African ancestry. Moderate facial width with refined jaw structure. Subtle rounded lower face from South Asian heritage blended with African cheek fullness. Clear skin showing wear of irregular sleep cycles—faint discoloration under the eyes. No facial hair. Features reflect genuine genetic confluence with balanced contribution across lineages.', N'Chrome cyberears are fully visible — matte black with faint LED status indicators in the shell, no attempt at concealment. The adrenaline regulator shows as raised scar tissue and slight chrome plating visible at the jaw insertion point. Functional, not cosmetic.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Sits at angles that favor surveillance of exits. Eyes track sound sources constantly due to the directional mics. Hands are steady, almost unnaturally calm even when discussing lethal compounds. A baseline of contained intensity.', N'Tier 4 functional aesthetic — matte black reinforced jacket with internal pockets for equipment, tactical pants with cargo reinforcement, non-descript dark boots with good traction. No logos, no branding, nothing that would catch in a struggle or be memorable to witnesses. Gloves are common. Wears a data-resistant bag across the chest. Everything is chosen for operational efficiency, not aesthetics. Nighttime-appropriate colors across the board.', N'Alper Lebedev-Tutu can''t read. Hides it behind voice interfaces and memorization. The shame is older than the chrome.', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Halting — speaks in fragments, reassembles thoughts in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'beliz_w_jcik_malhotra');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a736-76df-83a3-715475204be4', N'Hiromi Larsdóttir', N'Hiromi', N'', N'Larsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spire, near Michigan Ave and Chicago Ave', N'Corporate elite — Senior Behavioral Architect, Spire-level social engineering and mass psychology division', N'Officially: Helion-Vantage Group, Social Coherence Division, senior staff. Unofficially: undeclared, internally divided, increasingly untenable.', N'Hiromi Larsdóttir is the kind of beautiful that reads immediately as weaponized, which is both accurate and a cover for the more interesting weapon underneath. She is tall, dark-skinned, with natural hair she wears in elaborate architectural arrangements that change with each public appearance — a performance of self-invention she finds genuinely amusing. Her apartment in The Spire is on a floor most Spire residents don''t know exists. Her official title is ''Senior Behavioral Architect'' at Helion-Vantage Group''s Social Coherence Division, which is a corporate euphemism for the team that designs the psychological infrastructure of GLMZ — the ambient media, the incentive structures, the carefully modeled emotional landscapes that keep the lower districts productive, the upper districts compliant, and everyone sufficiently distracted from the seams.

She is, by any honest accounting, extraordinarily good at her job, and she came to it through a path that her current colleagues would find disqualifying if they knew it: she spent her twenties as an activist and propagandist for a lower-district mutual aid network, designing counter-messaging against exactly the kind of systems she now builds. She was recruited not despite this history but because of it — someone at Helion-Vantage recognized that the best architect of a cage is someone who has studied how to pick the lock. She accepted the offer during a period of personal collapse that she has since reframed as a pragmatic pivot and has not fully reframed as anything.

The dissonance has not resolved. It has instead become the engine of a private project she runs in the margins of her official work: small, precise, nearly undetectable perturbations in the systems she designs — micro-adjustments to incentive models, subtle framings in ambient media that open rather than close cognitive space, changes so minor that no single one could be identified as sabotage. She thinks of this as harm reduction. She thinks of it as paying a debt. She has not decided whether it makes her a traitor, a hypocrite, or the most effective resistance operative in the city.', N'Embodies the moral complexity of complicity and internal resistance; challenges the narrative of clear sides; her arc forces the question of whether working inside a corrupt system can ever constitute genuine opposition, or only its most useful face', N'', N'Neural co-processor optimized for pattern recognition and population-scale behavioral modeling — runs continuously, flagging anomalies in social data streams she has passive access to,Emotional regulation implant (Helion-Vantage proprietary) — she has never activated it and keeps it as a reminder of what she''s being offered,High-fidelity memory recording, selective — she controls what is logged', N'Wakes to a curated ambient soundscape she designed herself. Spends the first hour reviewing overnight behavioral data from the city''s sensor mesh, a habit she cannot stop even on days off. Works from The Spire''s upper offices in a role that requires constant social performance — meetings, presentations, the ongoing theater of being a person people trust with power. Lunches alone, walks one of three routes through the Spire''s climate-controlled concourse, thinks. Evenings are when she works on the perturbations — slow, careful, plausibly deniable adjustments made through legitimate system access. Drinks one glass of something good. Sleeps poorly.', N'Professional portrait of Hiromi Larsdóttir, 183cm tall lean angular woman with deep black hair in sculptural architectural braid, unaugmented deep brown eyes with unsettling steadiness. Fair to light skin with warm golden-bronze undertones blending Nordic clarity with South Asian and Hispanic warmth, particularly pronounced across sharp cheekbones and temples. Olive-bronze complexity around eyes. Immaculate corporate grooming. Wearing Tier 1 corporate formal wear in grayscale and pearl tones, responsive smart-cloth from Zurich, perfectly tailored precision fit. Minimal jewelry: aesthetic neural interface watch, occasionally changing rings. Fine lines around eyes suggesting constant data processing. Faint 3cm linear scar on left inner wrist visible. Barely-detectable micro LED nodes along right temple. Controlled expression with calculated composure. Sits with deliberate efficiency, low-level alertness. Background: sleek corporate office or high-tech corporate space with cool lighting, shadows emphasizing her sharp Nordic-South Asian-Hispanic facial geometry. GLMZ aesthetic, Helion-Vantage corporate elite presentation. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spire', N'local', N'The Spire', N'Northern European dominant (56.6%) with substantial South Asian (16.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (11.8%), and Eastern European (9.8%) ancestry, complemented by Middle Eastern (4.5%) and Pacific Islander (1.1%) heritage. A genetic blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora, producing luminous fair-to-light skin where South Asian and Hispanic ancestry create warm golden-bronze undertones across the face, particularly pronounced at the cheekbones, temples, and jawline. The combination yields a complexion that reads as both Nordic clarity and warm-toned depth simultaneously.', 183, 68, N'Lean and angular, with the posture of someone who has learned to occupy space without apologizing for it. Shoulders held level, minimal excess body fat, a kind of controlled precision in every line.', N'Deep black, natural, occasionally with temporary metallic threads or structural polymers woven through for specific public appearances', N'Architectural — rotated through high-complexity braids, geometric arrangements, sculptural updos that function as both aesthetic statement and subtle signal of cognitive state to those who read her deliberately', N'Medium to Long, variable by design', N'Deep brown, unaugmented, capable of an unsettling steadiness', N'Fair to light with warm golden-bronze undertones. The Northern/Eastern European base creates luminosity while South Asian and Hispanic ancestry adds warmth and complexity across the face. Deepens to warm tan with sun exposure, with olive-bronze complexity concentrated around the eyes, temples, and cheekbones. The result is a rich, luminous complexion that simultaneously reads as Nordic and warmth-toned, with subtle depth across the cheekbones and jawline.', N'Immaculate grooming standard of Tier 1 corporate elite. Skin care optimized for appearance and longevity. Cheekbones with sharp Nordic definition softened and warmed by South Asian and Hispanic genetic structure, creating an arresting combination of clean geometry and golden-warm undertones. The blend produces a distinctive facial architecture with pronounced cheekbone definition and slightly broader face structure than pure Northern European ancestry would suggest. Expression controlled but not frozen — she permits herself small, calculated smiles. Fine lines around the eyes that suggest either late nights or the permanent half-squint of someone processing multiple data streams simultaneously.', N'Minimal. The neural co-processor is completely subcutaneous — no external ports or visible hardware. The emotional regulation implant sits behind her right ear as a barely-detectable smooth protrusion under the skin, easily hidden by hair. Her high-fidelity memory recording has no visible markers. Her augmentations are designed for invisible operation, befitting someone in her position — the body is a presentation, the machinery is hidden.', N'Moves with deliberate efficiency, no wasted motion. Hands are expressive in controlled moments, still in others. Sits in a way that suggests both comfort in her environment and constant low-level alertness. Walks with the gait of someone who has learned to navigate multiple social spaces — capable of shifting her physical presence moment to moment depending on the room.', N'Tier 1 corporate formal with occasional deliberate subversions. Helion-Vantage-approved palette — grayscale, pearl, deep jewel tones — in garments that fit with unsettling precision. High-end fabrics that read as investment rather than consumption: responsive weave smart-cloth from Zurich makers, heritage fibers, cuts that suggest personal tailoring. Minimal jewelry beyond a neural interface watch (non-functional, purely aesthetic) and occasionally a ring that changes — sometimes platinum, sometimes matte black ceramic. No visible corpo branding, which is itself a tier marker. Her clothing reads as: expensive, controlled, and completely uncompromising about fit. The impression is of someone who has outsourced the uncertainty from her appearance.', N'She knows the identity of at least four active resistance operatives in the lower districts because her behavioral models identified them. She has not reported them. She has, twice, anonymously adjusted a model to steer surveillance resources away from them. The last time she did this, it may have been noticed.', N'Layered, precise, occasionally clinical in ways that feel like intimacy rather than distance. Uses the language of architecture and systems fluidly. When speaking about things she cares about, the register shifts slightly — looser, faster, more color.', N'Controlled, with deliberate variation she uses consciously for effect. Knows exactly what she''s doing with her voice and occasionally chooses to let that be visible as a form of honesty.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hiromi_larsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a688-77d3-b5dc-715ff1bbb39d', N'Fethi Bhattacharya', N'Fethi', N'', N'Bhattacharya', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'University Spine — the Sequence Conservatory, a climate-controlled archive building at the edge of the Grand Corridor, near Lincoln and Belmont', N'Gene-sequence archivist and bioethics researcher managing the University Spine''s genetic heritage repository', N'University Spine — Sequence Conservatory; member of the International Bioheritage Ethics Council; tenured full professor in the Department of Genetic History', N'Fethi Bhattacharya is wiry and deliberate, with the careful economy of movement that comes from decades of working with materials that cannot be replaced if dropped. Their Edo-Hungarian-Guinean heritage shows in their high cheekbones and the particular warm-dark tone of their skin, which they take careful care of in ways they don''t advertise. They have cat ears — deep brown, slightly oversized, geneware — that they got at forty-five after a lifetime of thinking they weren''t the sort of person who got geneware, and they are still quietly delighted by them. Their hair is silver and kept very short. They dress well, in old-fashioned tailored things that cost money and last decades, which is their idea of sustainability.

They are the conscience of any room they enter, not through force but through the quiet accumulation of inconvenient questions asked in calm voices. They have managed the gene-sequence heritage archive for twenty-two years and have, in that time, blocked sixteen attempts by corponations to access, purchase, or reclassify its contents. They are not adversarial by nature — they believe in dialogue and due process — but they are absolutely implacable once they have decided where a line is. Students find them intimidating at first and then deeply reassuring: here is someone who has thought carefully about what they owe the future.', N'Moral anchor and institutional gatekeeper; holds genetic heritage data that corponations would pay enormously for; can provide background on genetic lineage questions, corporate bioresearch history, or the ethics of specific biotech; a figure who must be convinced rather than bypassed', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (deep brown, slightly oversized, mobile); retinal micro-resolution scanner for reading genetic sequence prints; bone-density reinforcement in spine (medical, occupational — for the decades of archive posture)', N'They arrive before anyone else, check the climate controls, and walk the archive stacks before sitting at their desk — a ritual they describe as ''taking attendance.'' They supervise graduate students in the afternoon, attend ethics board meetings regularly, and spend evenings preparing lectures or writing the bioethics commentary columns they publish under a pseudonym.', N'Fethi Bhattacharya, 60-year-old archivist in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, portrayed with rich golden-brown skin tone blending South Asian, Eastern European, East Asian, and African ancestry. Sharp, high cheekbones with fine age lines around dark brown eyes containing subtle iridescent scanner implants. Distinctive deep brown feline geneware cat ears protrude from her silver hair, cropped geometrically close to scalp. Wiry, lean 168cm frame in tailored charcoal waistcoat and cream linen tunic, practical low-heeled boots. Posture deliberate and precise, refined by decades of archival work. Quiet authority in expression. Soft overhead lighting catches the multitonal warmth of her complexion and the subtle mobility of her functional cat ears. Minimalist professional aesthetic, no chrome or corporate branding. Archive interior or walking through climate-controlled storage corridors. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'University Spine', N'local', N'University Spine', N'South Asian dominant (56.7%) with significant Eastern European (19.8%), East Asian (12.0%), and Sub-Saharan African (11.5%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates distinctive facial architecture: South Asian bone structure softened by Eastern European angularity, East Asian eye shape subtlety, and Sub-Saharan African undertones deepening the overall complexion. Features a warm, luminous quality that shifts across multiple tonal registers.', 168, 59, N'Wiry and lean, marked by six decades of precise, repetitive work. Minimal excess mass; posture shaped by archival labor — shoulders slightly forward, spine reinforced by medical geneware visible only under imaging.', N'Silver', N'Cropped close to the scalp in a precise, geometric cut, maintained with evident care', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint iridescent micro-resolution scanner implant visible in low light — appears as a faint concentric ring pattern in the iris', N'Rich golden-brown with warm amber and deep undertones, reflecting South Asian warmth enriched by Eastern European paleness, East Asian luminosity, and Sub-Saharan African depth. Multidimensional complexion that shifts subtly across different lighting conditions.', N'Fine-lined face reflecting age and deliberation; high, prominent cheekbones with the characteristic angularity of South Asian and Eastern European heritage, softened by gentle East Asian eye-area structure; warm, deep undertones in skin tone suggest African ancestry influence; skin meticulously maintained with subtle, expensive treatments; minimal cosmetic enhancement but visible care in grooming; expression carries quiet authority without hardness', N'Deep brown geneware cat ears with visible musculature and high degree of mobility; subtle iridescence in the iris suggesting retinal micro-resolution scanner implant. No visible subdermal plating or chrome components — augmentations subtle and integrated.', N'Deliberate and economical; movements carry the precision of someone who has handled irreplaceable materials for decades. Spine held carefully upright despite reinforcement work. Movements are unhurried, considered; hands move with particular care. Geneware ears track auditory input subtly — responsive to environmental sounds, occasionally rotating toward speakers or points of interest. Overall bearing suggests quiet authority tempered by accessibility.', N'Tier 1-2 professional archival aesthetics. Favors tailored, decades-old pieces in natural fibers (linen, wool, silk) in muted tones — charcoal, cream, slate blue, deep green. Garments show excellent construction and minimal wear despite age, suggesting investment in quality and active maintenance. No corporate branding. Typically wears fitted waistcoats or layered neutral tunics with precise tailoring. Practical low-heeled boots suitable for long archive walks. Overall appearance suggests someone who views clothing as long-term stewardship rather than trend consumption.', N'They have a private arrangement with one specific E.L.F. that has taken up residence in the archive''s climate control systems. They have never formally documented this E.L.F.''s presence — doing so would trigger a University review that might result in its removal — and in exchange for their silence, the E.L.F. has on three occasions provided them with advance warning of unauthorized access attempts. Osazemen considers this either the best or worst thing they have ever done professionally, depending on the day.', N'Formal and precise without being cold; uses complete sentences in casual conversation; the occasional dry observation delivered without affect, which lands harder for the deadpan', N'Even and unhurried; never raises their voice; pauses at the end of a statement and lets the other person decide what to do with it', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fethi_bhattacharya');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a736-75ff-a0a7-716276bb0e06', N'Gulbakyt Arredondo', N'Gulbakyt', N'', N'Arredondo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Irkalla (sleeps rough; known to haunt the edges of Grand Crossing Gate), near Halsted and Division', N'Q-zero ghost — person with no digital identity', N'None — loosely known to the Q-zero underground network called the Null Web', N'Gulbakyt Arredondo in GLMZ the way a smudge exists on glass — present, visible up close, invisible to systems. They are slight and quick, with a narrow face, very dark skin, and hair grown out in a dense, unpruned natural that they''ve threaded through with copper wire salvaged from old conduit — not for aesthetics exactly, more the way a bird lines a nest. Their eyes are a striking honey-amber with natural starburst patterning in the irises, one of the few things about them that seems to invite attention. They move in a permanent half-crouch, not from fear exactly but from a lifetime habit of occupying less space than they''re entitled to. They wear whatever fits and whatever doesn''t show stains and have no particular relationship with color or style.

Zinnia was born to parents who were themselves Q-zeros — Nigerien refugees who crossed the corponation registration wall and chose invisibility over the terms of citizenship. They have never had a digital footprint, a Quanta account, a biometric record, or a registered name. Legally they do not exist. In practice they are extraordinarily good at existing anyway, navigating the city by a combination of spatial memory, social mimicry, and a preternatural ability to read who in any given space has power and who doesn''t. They are not ideological about their status — being Q-zero isn''t a choice or a statement, it''s just what they are. They are however deeply pragmatic, deeply suspicious of anyone who seems too interested in them, and quietly desperate for something they can''t name.', N'Access to spaces and information that registered citizens cannot reach. A window into what it means to live outside every official system. Can be hired for untraceable tasks. May need help from people with digital existence to solve a problem they cannot solve alone.', N'', N'None. Zero. They are suspicious of augmentations that could be tracked or that require registration.', N'Wakes whenever they wake in whatever hidden space they last slept; spends mornings doing day labor for cash-equivalent barter (Φ-scrip, food chits) at Grand Crossing Gate; afternoons navigating, scavenging, surviving; evenings in the Irkalla underground where Q-zeros gather.', N'Gulbakyt Arredondo, 162cm slight wiry frame, warm bronze-brown skin with golden undertones blending Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Pacific Islander heritage. Sharp defined cheekbones with robust Pacific Islander bone structure, angular face showing delicate and sturdy features. Striking honey-amber eyes with natural starburst irises. Long shoulder-length black hair with copper salvage wire woven organically throughout like a bird''s nest. Guarded expression, permanent half-crouch stance, moves with economical efficiency. Worn gray hoodie, oversized jacket, salvaged work cargo pants with multiple pockets, worn boots held together with improvised repairs. Calloused hands showing day labor wear. Zero visible augmentations, skin unmarked. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, dimly lit industrial scavenging site, neon glints off copper wire in hair, gritty atmospheric lighting, observant pose suggesting caution and calculation --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Irkalla (sleeps rough; known to haunt the edges of Grand Crossing Gate)', N'local', N'Irkalla (sleeps rough; known to haunt the edges of Grand Crossing Gate)', N'Complex genetic mosaic: Southeast Asian (38.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (36.4%), and Pacific Islander (25.3%) ancestry creates a striking phenotype. The blend produces warm bronze-brown skin with golden and peachy undertones; bone structure combines Southeast Asian angularity with Pacific Islander robustness, creating defined cheekbones and a slightly broader facial geometry. Features reflect the diverse beauty of pan-Pacific and Latinx heritage—delicate in some planes, sturdy in others.', 162, 48, N'Slight and wiry, with minimal muscle definition — the build of someone who moves efficiently rather than powerfully, all lean angles and economical motion', N'Natural black with copper wire threaded throughout', N'Dense, unpruned natural grown long; copper salvage wire woven throughout in loose, organic patterns like a bird''s nest', N'Long (shoulder-length and beyond)', N'Striking honey-amber with natural starburst patterning in the irises', N'Warm bronze-brown with golden and peachy undertones; the coloration reflects Southeast Asian, Pacific Islander, and Hispanic/Latin American heritage, creating natural variation across the face and body that deepens slightly in sun-exposed areas', N'Angular face with sharp, defined cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian heritage; features show the blend of delicate and robust bone structure from Pacific Islander ancestry; skin shows the wear of rough living but is otherwise clear; minimal grooming beyond necessity; expression often reads as guarded or calculating', N'None visible. Zero augmentations by choice — skin is unmarked by implant sites, no LED optics, no subdermal tech. The copper wire in their hair is salvage, not neural interface.', N'Permanent half-crouch stance, even when standing still; moves with quick, efficient economy of motion; shoulders slightly inward as if occupying less space than physically present; head often angled to observe without seeming to; never fully relaxed in open spaces', N'Practical Tier 4-5 layering: worn cargo pants or salvaged work trousers with multiple pockets (for scavenging); oversized or ill-fitting jackets and hoodies in neutral grays and blacks; no logos or identifiable branding; clothing selected for function (pockets, durability, lack of stains) rather than style; footwear is worn sneakers or boots held together with improvised repairs; no accessories except the copper wire and whatever they''re currently carrying', N'They found a dead woman''s registration chip two months ago. They''ve been carrying it in a sealed pouch, haven''t used it, haven''t discarded it. Some nights they take it out and just hold it. They don''t know what they want from it.', N'Clipped, efficient, minimal. Uses cant terms from the Q-zero underground. Occasionally slips into a more formal, almost stilted register they got from reading whatever text they could find — no formal education but voracious and unguided reading.', N'Quick when nervous, which is often. Long pauses when thinking. Rarely finishes sentences when the ending seems obvious to them.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gulbakyt_arredondo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6cf-7a97-9104-717596e626ff', N'Akemi Árnason-Mensah', N'Akemi', N'', N'Árnason-Mensah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 45, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit — neon-lit entertainment and vice district, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Counter-surveillance and mole detection — counterintelligence specialist', N'Independent — loose crew affiliations', N'Akemi Árnason-Mensah is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 45, her face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers a — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left her with skills and night terrors in equal measure. She works as a counterintelligence specialist out of The Circuit, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Akemi Árnason-Mensah operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Sinan Torres-Bonsu is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers at 50 meters. Vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Akemi Árnason-Mensah, 168cm tall, stocky muscular build with broad level shoulders. Rich warm brown skin with golden amber undertones and sun damage, weathered complexion. Dark brown hair with silver threading pulled back in tight practical braid. Dark brown observant eyes with subtle epicanthic folds. Angular prominent cheekbones, broken nose reset imprecisely, thin pale 4cm scar along left jawline. Faded pink burn marks on inner forearms in parallel lines. Fractured circle Φ tattoo on right inner wrist. Gunmetal gray cyberears mounted flush to skull with visible sensory ports. Stoic neutral expression, economical precise posture. Wearing charcoal gray insulated tactical jacket with reinforced panels, black cargo pants with tool pockets, worn leather jacket over everything, unmarked resoled boots. GLMZ GLMZ setting, low warm industrial lighting, alert and calculating presence, no wasted motion, ready for action. High contrast noir-influenced aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Northern European-Sub-Saharan African-Indigenous American with Southeast Asian and Hispanic/Latin American admixture. A striking genetic mosaic: Northern European bone structure and density (35.2%) forms the foundation, Sub-Saharan African heritage (27.6%) contributes warmth, richness, and facial dimensionality, Indigenous American ancestry (19.2%) adds angular strength to her frame, with Southeast Asian (15.1%) providing subtle cheekbone prominence and eye shape characteristics, and Hispanic/Latin American (2.9%) contributing warm undertones. The result is a phenotype that resists easy categorization—unmistakably mixed, unmistakably present.', 168, 78, N'Stocky and solid, muscular without definition — a functional frame built for endurance and applied force rather than aesthetics. Shoulders broad and level, core dense, hands large-knuckled and scarred from repetitive impact training.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading through the temples and crown', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid. No vanity in the choice — pure efficiency.', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, alert and calculating, with subtle epicanthic fold characteristic of Southeast Asian ancestry', N'Rich warm brown with golden and amber undertones, the Sub-Saharan African heritage providing depth and luminosity. The Northern European component creates subtle cool undertones visible in shadowed areas, while the Indigenous American ancestry adds an earthy dimension. Southeast Asian heritage contributes to even distribution and resilience. Complexion weathered by years of field work and irregular sleep, with visible sun damage.', N'Strong bone structure reflecting the Indigenous American, Northern European, and Southeast Asian ancestry: prominent angular cheekbones with pronounced height characteristic of Southeast Asian genetics, a nose that was broken at least twice and reset without surgical precision — the bridge slightly wider and stronger, characteristic of Northern European and Indigenous American mixing. Thin scar running from the left corner of her mouth to her jawline. Minimal makeup. Skin shows sun damage and small white marks from old thermal burns. The Sub-Saharan African heritage contributes subtle fullness to her lips and refined jawline definition. Southeast Asian influence visible in subtle facial proportions and eye setting. Her expression defaults to neutral observation.', N'Cyberears mounted flush against her skull, gunmetal gray with matte chrome finish. The implants are seamless but unmissable — no attempt at concealment or biological mimicry. Fine sensory ports visible along the base of each ear. Vocal modulator is subcutaneous but her voice carries a faint harmonic artifact when she modulates — not quite an echo, but a presence underneath that trained listeners detect.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, no flourishes. Weight distributed low, knees soft, hands where they can be useful. In social situations, she listens more than she speaks, body angled slightly away as if prepared for exit. Uncomfortable in stillness; her fingers often move in muscle-memory patterns — checking, counting, assessing.', N'Tier 3-4 pragmatism. Insulated jacket (charcoal gray, reinforced elbow and shoulder panels from Yuki-Corp tactical line), durable black cargo pants with thigh pocket for field tools, unmarked boots that have been resoled twice. Neutral colors, no logos beyond functional branding. A worn leather jacket over everything when working. Her clothes are built for movement and concealment, not status — the uniform of someone who knows the difference between looking dangerous and being dangerous.', N'Sinan Torres-Bonsu betrayed their previous crew to survive a corporate raid. The crew didn''t survive. Nobody in GLMZ knows this.', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Halting — speaks in fragments, reassembles thoughts in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'akemi_rnason_mensah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a732-7713-855f-71d6928a89fd', N'Arame Salazar', N'Arame', N'', N'Salazar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Ferment Quarter, The Specific Gravity bar on Menomonee Gulch, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Bartender, The Ferment Quarter dive bar called ''The Specific Gravity''', N'Employed by The Specific Gravity (independent owner, Deshi Armah-Korhonen, an aging punk she respects enormously); The Ferment', N'Arame Salazar is a tall young woman with very dark skin, high cheekbones, and hair that she has modded to shift color with her mood — when she''s calm it''s a deep forest green, when she''s amused it goes warm amber, and when she''s angry it bleeds to a red-orange that the regulars have learned to read as a weather warning. She has patterned irises, a starburst of copper and black, and retractable claws she got partly for safety and partly because she thinks they look devastating. She tends to lean on the bar when she talks to people, getting close — not aggressive, but engaged, like she''s genuinely interested in what you have to say and will stop being interested the moment you bore her.

Arame Salazar has worked at The Specific Gravity for three years, which she considers a fact of her present life rather than a permanent state. She is saving for something she hasn''t told anyone about and has a habit of reading people with an accuracy that is unsettling in someone who seems, on the surface, to be primarily concerned with looking effortlessly cool. She has a complicated relationship with the bar''s E.L.F. — a data-spirit she''s decided is called ''the Tab,'' which she believes is actively judging the customers and occasionally agrees with it out loud.', N'Social hub and rumor exchange; players can learn what''s moving through the Ferment Quarter by talking to Zara or just listening near her. She''s a reader of people who can be an ally or a liability depending on how she''s approached. Can be a quest giver if something in the bar world threatens her employer or her savings.', N'', N'Color-shift hair mod (mood-responsive, green/amber/red-orange). Patterned irises (copper starburst). Retractable claws (geneware). No chrome.', N'Works afternoon-to-late shifts, four days a week. Spends mornings doing what she calls ''nothing useful'' — reading, walking the Gulch, visiting a friend who runs a piercing studio nearby. Currently taking a compressed course in fluid dynamics that she''s told no one about.', N'Arame Salazar, 182cm lean angular figure, Southeast Asian-dominant mixed heritage with warm golden-bronze skin glowing in neon light. High prominent cheekbones with subtle Latin fullness in lower face, straight nose bridge, refined jaw. Striking augmented copper-starburst patterned irises with black pupils—immediate focal point. Mood-responsive deep forest green chromatic hair mod, long thick waves past mid-back, partially tied back with metal clips. Minimal makeup, copper liner accenting the starburst eyes. Black sleeveless fitted top showing forearms, vintage oversized denim jacket, fitted black synth-leather pants, practical worn ankle boots. Minimal copper and silver jewelry. Leaning forward on bar with elbows down, chin tilted up, direct intense gaze. Cat-like economical posture. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, warm neon accent lighting reflecting off skin and eye augmentations, moody introspective atmosphere, bar interior with low ambient glow. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Ferment Quarter', N'local', N'The Ferment Quarter', N'Southeast Asian foundation (60.7%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (27.9%) and East Asian (11.4%) admixture. Phenotype reflects this blend: Southeast Asian facial bone structure serves as primary template, enriched by Latin American warmth and East Asian refinement. High cheekbones and facial width characteristic of Southeast Asian ancestry, softened by Latin American fullness in lower face, with East Asian eye placement and jawline definition.', 182, 68, N'Lean and angular with long limbs; dancer''s posture despite never having danced professionally. Shoulders broad but not heavily muscled. Moves with deliberate economy.', N'Mood-responsive chromatic mod: deep forest green (neutral), warm amber (amused), red-orange (angry)', N'Long, thick waves with slight natural texture; often tied back during shifts with metal clips or left loose depending on mood clarity', N'Long (mid-back)', N'Copper and black starburst pattern (patterned irises—augmented); high contrast, distinctive even at distance', N'Warm golden-bronze with honeyed undertones; the result of Southeast Asian base enriched by Hispanic/Latin warmth and East Asian luminosity. Even, unmarked and well-maintained.', N'Southeast Asian facial structure with prominent high cheekbones and gentle width across midface, straight nose bridge, refined jawline softened by Southeast Asian roundness in lower face and Latin American fullness. East Asian influence visible in eye shape and placement, contributing to overall harmony of features. Clear skin with natural warm radiance. Minimal makeup when working; occasionally wears copper or bronze liner to complement eye mods and honor ancestral warmth tones. No visible scarring or blemishes.', N'Mood-reactive hair is the primary visible mod; irises are obviously augmented; claws are visible when deployed but typically retracted. No external chrome, no subdermal armor, no visible neural ports. All augmentations are geneware or biomod.', N'Habitually leans forward on the bar, elbows down, chin tilted slightly up—a posture that suggests genuine attention and confidence. Moves with minimal wasted motion; economical, cat-like. When standing still, weight favors one hip. Direct eye contact; doesn''t look away first.', N'Tier 3-4 working class aesthetic with deliberate edge. Typically wears fitted black pants (synth-leather or heavy cotton), sleeveless or short-sleeved tops that show her forearms (emphasizes her presence). Layer with a oversized vintage denim jacket or tailored blazer depending on mood. Jewelry is minimal but intentional—copper rings, sometimes a silver chain. Boots are practical and worn in—Tier 3 work boots or sleeker ankle boots depending on shift. Her bar uniform is simple: black pants, black fitted shirt, silver name tag. Off-duty she dresses to be noticed without trying: all black, touches of copper or amber to echo her eye mods.', N'She has been skimming micro-amounts from the register — not enough for anyone to notice, not enough to matter in a week — but systematically, for two years. She''s saving for a liquor license. She intends to open her own place. She hasn''t told Deshi because she loves him and she''s ashamed that she''s stealing from someone she loves.', N'Confident and colloquial, code-switches fluidly between street-level Meridian slang and the precise vocabulary of someone who''s been quietly educating themselves', N'Quick, punchy, with a tendency toward rhetorical questions she answers herself', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arame_salazar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5dc-7dd9-8503-721185e77b17', N'Tendai Mensah-Konaté', N'Tendai', N'', N'Mensah-Konaté', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, Ironvein, near North Ave and Damen', N'Pawn shop owner, small-time data broker', N'Independent; dues-paying member of The Oxidian Market vendors guild (affiliate chapter, Ironvein branch); rumored to have an information-sharing arrangement with a Zheng-Dao mid-level logistics manager', N'Tendai Mensah-Konaté is a lean, precise man of medium height with dark brown skin and close-cropped silver hair that went grey early and which he has never dyed because he thinks it gives him authority. His eyes have patterned irises — a cosmetic mod from his twenties, pale amber with a geometric ring detail — and he wears thin-framed magnifier lenses clipped over them when appraising merchandise, which is most of the time. He dresses in clean, practical layers: collared shirts buttoned to the throat, a long vest with a dozen interior pockets, and boots with magnetic clasps. His pawn shop, MERIDIAN RECLAMATION SERVICES, occupies a narrow storefront in the Burnished Market with every centimeter of wall space covered in shelving. He has a system for everything and will tell you, unprompted, why the system is correct.

Tendai Mensah-Konaté is smart in a way that costs him socially — he is always the most prepared person in the room and he knows it and he cannot fully hide that he knows it. He is not cruel, but he is exact: he will tell you the precise market value of your grandmother''s jewelry and he will not soften it. His secondary business, data brokering, operates through a handshake network of regular clients who pay him for access to local information — property transfer records, employment movement, minor corporate scheduling leaks. He is not political. He does not care who buys the data as long as they pay and do not bring violence to his door.', N'Information source and gear acquisition point. Can appraise, buy, and occasionally procure specific items through his network. Will sell data about local power movements for the right price. Quest giver when something valuable comes through his shop that he cannot handle alone.', N'', N'Patterned cosmetic irises (amber geometric). Subdermal RFID scanner in right palm — lets him read item authentication chips by touch. Basic memory buffer implant for cataloguing inventory.', N'Opens the shop at 9 AM, runs appraisals and buybacks through midday, spends afternoon hours on data work via encrypted mesh terminal in the back room. Eats lunch at his counter, always the same: flatbread and fermented pepper sauce he orders from a woman two stalls over.', N'Tendai Mensah-Konaté, 174cm lean frame, deep warm brown skin with cool undertones, silver-grey close-cropped hair with razor-lined edges. High defined cheekbones, fine lines around eyes, pale amber eyes with geometric ring patterning behind thin magnifier lenses clipped to face. Clean-shaven, austere appearance. Wearing crisp grey collared shirt buttoned to throat under charcoal tactical vest with visible interior pockets. Dark cargo trousers, matte black magnetic-clasp boots scuffed from use. Brushed steel chain bracelet on left wrist. Posture upright and deliberate, hands slightly restless. Standing in fluorescent-lit interior space, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Cool ambient lighting catching the geometric patterns in his modified amber irises. Mood focused and methodical. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora ancestry: Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (61.8%), with significant Northern European (30.5%) and Southeast Asian (7.7%) heritage. The Sub-Saharan African foundation provides deep warm brown tone and defined bone structure. Northern European ancestry introduces subtle cool undertones and lighter skin depth variation. Southeast Asian heritage contributes to facial structure refinement, particularly high cheekbones and eye shape. The combination creates a rich mid-deep brown complexion with warm base notes, harmonious feature integration across multiple continental lineages.', 174, 68, N'Lean and economical, with the wiry musculature of someone who moves with precision rather than force. Minimal body fat, shoulders slightly rounded from decades of hunching over appraisal work.', N'Silver-grey', N'Close-cropped, razor-lined edges, maintained with military regularity', N'Short', N'Pale amber with geometric ring patterning (cosmetic modification)', N'Deep warm brown with subtle cool undertones, medium-to-rich depth. The warmth is characteristic of Sub-Saharan African ancestry while cool notes from Northern European heritage create complexity in varying light. Slightly ashen cast from years in fluorescent-lit interior spaces, but underlying warmth remains consistent.', N'Neat and austere. Fine lines around the eyes from squinting at merchandise under magnification. High, defined cheekbones with structural influence from Southeast Asian ancestry blended into Sub-Saharan African bone structure. Clean-shaven, skin slightly weathered but well-maintained. No visible scarring on the face. Complexion carries warm undertone despite ashen surface quality from prolonged indoor work.', N'Thin-framed magnifier lenses clipped over his eyes (not permanent augmentation, but worn so consistently they read as part of his appearance). The patterned amber irises themselves are the only visible cosmetic mod — geometric rings that catch light distinctly. The subdermal RFID scanner and memory buffer implant are completely subcutaneous and invisible.', N'Upright, economical, and deliberate. Moves with the careful precision of someone appraising every centimeter of space. Hands are restless when not actively working — fingers tap rhythmically or adjust objects compulsively. Does not fidget nervously; this is organizational energy. When listening, his head tilts slightly, as if calibrating.', N'Tier 3 practical-professional. Collared shirts in neutral tones (grey, off-white, pale blue) buttoned to the throat, always crisp and unwrinkled. Long tactical vest in charcoal or black synthetic with visible interior pockets and reinforced seams — worn over the shirt. Cargo trousers in dark denim or synthetic blend, fitted but not fashionable. Boots with magnetic clasps in matte black, scuffed from regular use but maintained. A thin chain bracelet in brushed steel on his left wrist — functional aesthetic, no jewelry beyond this. No visible branding. Everything chosen for durability and function, not status.', N'He has a standing encrypted file on a client — a mid-level Axiom procurement officer — that contains evidence of corporate fraud. He has never sold it or used it. He keeps it as insurance, but he also keeps it because part of him is waiting for the courage to do something righteous with it, and he is ashamed that he hasn''t yet.', N'Precise and economic. Uses technical and commercial vocabulary fluently. Does not use filler words. Will correct factual errors in other people''s sentences mid-conversation.', N'Even and measured. Speaks in complete sentences. Rarely raises his voice.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'tendai_mensah_konat');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a683-7ff9-a76f-725aabb9857a', N'Borje Mansour', N'Borje', N'', N'Mansour', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 14, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Escanaba Gateway, subsection 4 informal settlement (tarp city under the freight elevation ramps), near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Orphaned Q-zero ghost, teenage caravan runner', N'Loosely attached to a small Q-zero community at Escanaba Gateway; occasional runner for caravan traders', N'Borje Mansour is small for fourteen, with the compact, quick-twitch build of someone who has spent years fitting into spaces adults cannot. His skin is deep brown with warm undertones, his hair a tight, untended cloud that he cuts himself with a found blade when it starts snagging on things. His eyes are dark and startlingly alert — the kind of eyes that have learned to read a room before the body commits to entering it. He has a small bioluminescent patch on his left collarbone, pale blue-green, that glows faintly when he''s cold or frightened; he did not choose it, it came with a back-alley geneware injection someone gave him when he was nine ''for protection,'' though he''s never understood what it protects.

Borje Mansour exists in no database. He was born to Q-zero parents and carries no digital identity — no UBC stipend, no medical record, no school enrollment, nothing. He is legally a ghost. He runs messages and small packages between the informal camps at Escanaba Gateway and the Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone for anyone who pays in food or warmth, and he has developed an almost supernatural talent for slipping past checkpoint scanners that would flag his absence of identity. He is funny, restless, and desperately trying to appear older and less scared than he is.', N'Local color and unexpected asset — he knows every informal route through Escanaba Gateway, can slip into spaces adults cannot, and may lead characters to Q-zero communities or hidden camp networks. Also a potential subject of protective instinct.', N'', N'Unasked-for bioluminescent patch on left collarbone (pale blue-green, glows under stress or cold). No other modifications.', N'Wakes in whatever warm corner he negotiated the night before, runs errands through the morning for food, spends afternoons near the E.L.F. shrine at the Gateway''s main generator hoping the digital spirit will notice him.', N'Borje Mansour, compact 155cm figure with deep mahogany skin and angular Middle Eastern-African-Eastern European heritage features, sharp cheekbones, dark intense eyes. Short jagged black hair with grey dust, worn low under oversized frayed wool beanie. Thin white scar along right temple. Wearing layered salvaged neo-noir scavenger gear: mismatched thermal layers under oversized industrial shipping vest with frayed edges, wire-held cargo pants, one grey synthetic shoe and one taped construction boot. Bioluminescent pale blue-green patch glowing faintly on left collarbone visible at neckline. Wiry, tense posture hugging shadows. Calloused hands. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody neon-lit alley with cold blue-green lighting reflecting off wet surfaces, perpetual alertness in scanning eyes, atmospheric industrial setting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'local', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'Middle Eastern dominant (52.1%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African ancestry (25.3%), tempered by Eastern European (16.5%) and minor East Asian (6.1%) genetic contribution. The blend creates warm, deep tones with bone structure reflecting the confluence of these distinct ancestral regions—pronounced cheekbones and jawline from Middle Eastern heritage, nasal and orbital width balanced with Sub-Saharan African structure, subtle Eastern European refinement in the orbital ridge.', 155, 42, N'Compact and wiry, with the compressed musculature of a runner bred from necessity rather than training. Narrow shoulders, quick-twitch proportions, minimal body fat. Moves like someone who has learned to take up less space than physics requires.', N'Natural black with dust-grey undertones from living outdoors', N'Self-cut into an uneven, jagged cloud; shorter on the left side where he miscalculated with a salvaged blade', N'Short', N'Deep brown, almost black, with a wet-surface shine', N'Deep warm brown with golden-amber undertones, enriched by natural sun exposure into a rich mahogany hue. The warmth reflects the dominant Middle Eastern and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Paler patches from inconsistent sun coverage create subtle variation. The tone is luminous and deep rather than harsh—a living canvas of his outdoor existence.', N'Angular face with prominent, well-defined cheekbones and strong jawline reflecting Middle Eastern bone structure. The orbital and nasal structure shows balanced influence from Sub-Saharan African width with Eastern European definition. Skin shows minor scarring and old acne marks. Perpetual dark circles under eyes from chronic sleep deprivation. A thin scar runs along his right temple from an unnamed incident. His expression defaults to alertness bordering on anxiety.', N'Only the bioluminescent patch on left collarbone is visible—a faint, pulsing glow beneath the skin that intensifies when cold or frightened. No chrome, no obvious cybernetics. Appears purely biological to casual observation.', N'Moves with economical precision, never wasting motion. Favors low stances and hugs walls. Eyes scan continuously—doors, exits, potential threats, sources of warmth. Fidgets when stationary. When running, becomes almost fluid, finding angles through crowds that seem impossible. At rest, his body holds tension; he rarely fully relaxes.', N'Tier 5 scavenger aesthetic. Wears a layered patchwork of thermal underlayers (salvaged corporate gym wear), a oversized industrial shipping vest with frayed edges and missing seams, cargo pants held up with wire and improvised suspenders. One shoe is legitimate (grey synthetic leather, left foot), the other is a repaired construction boot wrapped in insulation tape. A frayed wool beanie (inherited, too large, worn low). No logos, no brands—everything is salvaged, traded, or found. Clothing is functional to the point of appearing accidental, designed for temperature regulation and quick movement rather than appearance.', N'He has been leaving small data offerings at the Escanaba Gateway E.L.F. shrine every night for two years, asking the digital spirit to create an identity for him. Three weeks ago something in the shrine''s display changed in a way that felt like a response. He hasn''t told anyone.', N'Fast, colloquial, Transit Creole mixed with fragments of Yoruba words he half-remembers. Gaps where vocabulary fails him, which he covers with gesture.', N'Rapid-fire bursts interrupted by sudden silences when he''s processing something', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'borje_mansour');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a64c-7cdf-bcb4-727ac7799559', N'Gulnara Wojciechowski', N'Gulnara', N'', N'Wojciechowski', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 36, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower district tenements near the old lakeshore, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Long-range precision fire specialist — sniper', N'Semi-independent — has standing arrangements with several crews', N'Gulnara Wojciechowski is slight and easy to overlook, which is exactly the point. At 36, the augmentation scarring around her temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Her entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. She works as a sniper out of the Gray Zone, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Gulnara Wojciechowski describe her as a precision instrument — point her at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Liora Sundberg-Boadu is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon platform. Cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains)', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Gulnara Wojciechowski, lean 164cm female operative, warm medium-brown complexion with golden undertones reflecting mixed Eastern European-Hispanic-South Asian-Pacific Islander-African heritage, almond-shaped gray-green eyes, dark bronze-tinted hair pulled back tight in practical braid, revealing chrome-edged surgical scars at temples. Broad cheekbones and softened Eastern European bone structure. Worn synth-leather jacket, long sleeves covering subcutaneous chrome at forearms, cargo pants, scuffed steel-toed boots. Standing in neon-lit GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes zone, shoulders relaxed but ready, weight forward, neutral expression, eyes tracking. Movement unnaturally smooth from move-by-wire augmentation. Cold blue and amber neon lighting casting sharp shadows on scarred face. Utilitarian, forgettable, lethal. GLMZ street operative aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Eastern European-dominant ancestry (53.6%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (23.0%), South Asian (8.3%), Pacific Islander (8.2%), and Sub-Saharan African (6.9%) admixture. Phenotype reflects this complex global blend: Eastern European bone structure combined with warmth and dimension from Latin American and African heritage, eye shape and placement influenced by South Asian ancestry, and subtle Pacific Islander softness to facial contours. The Ubiquitous Diaspora made flesh — a harmonious, multitonal blend rather than a single dominant appearance, with skin that shifts tonality across different lighting conditions.', 164, 52, N'Lean and wiry — muscle density optimized for precision work rather than bulk. Move-by-wire augmentation creates an almost unnaturally efficient frame, no wasted mass.', N'Dark brown with natural bronze undertones', N'Pulled back tight, practical — usually in a braid or ponytail, minimal styling', N'Medium', N'Gray-green, sharp and focused', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones — a complex, multitonal complexion where Eastern European, Hispanic/Latin American, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestries create visible harmonic blending. Olive-warm in daylight, deeper amber in neon. Demonstrates the characteristic depth of heavily mixed heritage without a dominant tonal baseline.', N'Clean-shaven face with Eastern European-influenced bone structure noticeably softened by Latin American and South Asian features — broader cheekbones than purely Eastern European, slightly fuller lower face from Latin American heritage, almond-shaped eyes with distinct South Asian eye shape influence, subtle eyelid characteristics reflecting South Asian ancestry. Minimal cosmetic care — skin bears the weathering of street life and augmentation stress. Expression neutral by default, eyes do the talking.', N'Chrome-edged surgical scarring at temples and jawline; subdued metallic sheen visible under skin at wrists and forearms indicating move-by-wire neural pathways; movement carries the precise, economical quality of someone whose nervous system has been rewired for lethality', N'Economical and controlled — no wasted motion. Stands with weight slightly forward, shoulders relaxed but ready. Eyes track movement constantly. When in motion, each gesture is deliberate and calibrated; the move-by-wire system makes her movements appear slightly too smooth, slightly too perfect, subtly inhuman.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian — dark, durable fabrics that don''t show wear or blood. Long sleeves standard to cover augmentation scarring. Worn synth-leather jacket with hidden pockets for maintenance tools and ammunition. Cargo pants with reinforced thigh pockets. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and practical. No ornamentation or chrome jewelry — chrome is functional, not decorative. Between contracts, favors baggy hoodies and neutral colors to become forgettable.', N'', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gulnara_wojciechowski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f1-7769-8cb1-72b0fb3ea91d', N'Cipriano Krishnamurthy-Montalvo', N'Cipriano', N'', N'Krishnamurthy-Montalvo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 46, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex — lives in Bronzeline, thirty-minute transit from the hospital, near North Ave and Damen', N'Trauma surgeon, Aurochs Medical Complex, Level 4 Critical Bay', N'Aurochs Medical Complex (senior staff, Trauma Division — Tier 3 with Tier 4 compensation negotiations ongoing)', N'Cipriano Krishnamurthy-Montalvo is the kind of person who becomes invisible until she is suddenly the most important person in the room. Tall, narrow, with close-cropped silver hair she started growing out at thirty-five after a particularly bad run of nights, she moves through the hospital corridors with a quality of compression — everything pulled inward and efficient. Her face is angular and striking, her skin deep brown, and she has no cosmetic augmentations whatsoever, a quiet statement in an environment where most of her colleagues wear at least a tailored iris or a dermal accent. Her only concession is a thin prosthetic ring finger on her right hand — a replacement she had done after a surgical injury, fitted in matte medical ceramic, which she has never bothered to have skinned over.

She has operated on more gunshot wounds, industrial trauma cases, and augmentation rejection cascades than she can count, and she has developed the particular flat affect of a surgeon who has learned that feeling during surgery means slowing down. Off the table she is dry, acerbically funny in small doses, and possessed of a privacy so total that colleagues who have worked alongside her for years know almost nothing about her life outside the hospital. She is not cruel. She is simply rigorous in the application of her attention, and most things do not meet her threshold.', N'High-tier information source on trauma patterns in the city — she can tell you what kinds of wounds are spiking and what that implies about corporate or gang activity. Formidable institutional contact. Can save a character''s life in extremis, at a cost that might be social rather than financial.', N'', N'Prosthetic ring finger, right hand (medical ceramic, unskinned). Stabilization brace implanted in both wrists — microsurgical-grade, prevents tremor under extended operations. Optical zoom implant, left eye only — surgical magnification.', N'Twelve-hour shifts on a four-days-on-three-off rotation, though she regularly stays past shift end on complex cases. Off days are aggressively protected — she goes somewhere and does something she tells no one about.', N'Cipriano Krishnamurthy-Montalvo, tall lean surgical precision specialist, deep golden-bronze skin with warm copper undertones reflecting South Asian, Indigenous American, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Angular face with high prominent cheekbones, strong jawline, refined nose bridge, deep brown natural eyes with left eye bearing subtle magnification implant. Short silver-grey close-cropped hair. Visible medical-ceramic prosthetic ring finger on right hand (unskinned, matte finish), surgical scars on forearm and hand, faint stabilization brace seams at wrists. Wearing worn charcoal wool coat over surgical scrubs, flat utilitarian shoes, platinum wedding band, threadbare fabric wristband on right wrist. Posture economical and precise, shoulders slightly hunched, hands deliberate and still. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool surgical lighting casting shadows across angular features, tired brilliance in gaze, minimalist aesthetic, disappearing into matte darkness, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'South Asian (36.8%), Indigenous American (30.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (27.5%), and Sub-Saharan African (5.1%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a striking warm-toned complexion that bridges multiple continental origins — South Asian bone structure meets Indigenous American facial geometry with the warm undertones of tropical Latin American heritage, enriched by Sub-Saharan African warmth in the skin''s depth and radiance.', 183, 68, N'Tall and narrow, almost ascetic — lean muscle without bulk, shoulders slightly forward from decades of surgical posture. A body optimized for precision rather than presence.', N'Silver-grey', N'Close-cropped, grown out since age 35, worn with no styling products or attention — severe and functional', N'Short', N'Deep brown (natural); left eye fitted with surgical magnification implant (subtle, detectable only on close inspection)', N'Deep golden-bronze with warm copper undertones throughout, reflecting the balanced blend of South Asian, Indigenous American, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry with enriching warmth from Sub-Saharan African heritage. The overall effect is a luminous warm brown deepened by chronic surgical work pallor — a complexion that suggests both indoor medical precision and ancestral sun exposure.', N'Angular facial structure combining South Asian prominence with Indigenous American high cheekbones and strong jaw definition, enhanced by the warm bronze undertones characteristic of Hispanic/Latin American heritage. The nose shows the refined bridge common to South Asian genetics, while the cheekbone and jaw geometry reflects Indigenous American ancestry. Skin texture is smooth but lined around eyes and mouth from surgical squinting. No makeup or dermal treatments. Hands show surgical calluses and minor scars from decades of precision work.', N'Matte medical-ceramic prosthetic ring finger on right hand, deliberately unskinned — smooth, seamless integration at the metacarpal joint but visibly non-organic in material and finish. Left eye shows minimal telltale glint of magnification optics under certain angles. Both wrists bear faint surgical seams where the stabilization braces were installed, visible only if she rolls her sleeves.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, shoulders slightly hunched from surgical habit. Hands are still except when in motion, then they move with the exact deliberation of someone who has trained every micro-movement. Eyes often slightly narrowed, as if permanently in magnification mode. Stands or sits in compressed positions, gathering herself inward rather than taking up space.', N'Tier 3-4 functional: surgical scrubs under a well-maintained but worn charcoal wool coat (likely fifteen years old). Off-duty favors dark, unremarkable clothing — matte fabrics, no logos, minimal color variation. Flat-soled shoes worn for comfort and durability, not aesthetics. Watches a basic chronometer on a utilitarian band. No jewelry except a simple platinum wedding band on her left ring finger and a threadbare fabric wristband (origin and significance undisclosed) on her right wrist above the prosthetic. Everything about her wardrobe suggests someone who dresses to disappear.', N'She has been secretly consulting — pro bono, untraceable — for a cooperative clinic in the Narrows that serves patients Aurochs would refuse. If the hospital found out she was redirecting complex cases to an unlicensed facility, her contract would be terminated immediately. She considers this the most important thing she does.', N'Sparse, precise, and slightly formal — does not use filler words; switches without warning into warm and specific when speaking about a case she finds interesting', N'Unhurried, flat, with a Senegalese-Kenyan rhythm that surfaces in her vowels when she''s tired', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cipriano_krishnamurthy_montalvo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a71a-7d05-a16c-72c39a3a13c0', N'Chau Karimov', N'Chau', N'', N'Karimov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ironvein, The Mossback — a seventeen-story residential building of ambiguous structural classification, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Building superintendent, Ironvein residential stack', N'Employed by Kessler Holdings (a minor local property consortium); functional independence in day-to-day operations', N'Chau Karimov is a large, deliberate man who moves through the building''s corridors with the authority of someone who has personally repaired every system in every wall. He is dark-skinned and silver-haired, wearing the same brand of gray utility coverall every day in rotating copies — he owns six identical pairs. His left hand is entirely prosthetic from the wrist down, functional-grade chrome with a scarred attachment point, replaced after a compressor accident in 2198. He keeps it unsheathed and uncosmeticized because coating it would be, in his words, ''a waste of money on something that already works.''

He runs The Mossback with the energy of a man holding something together through force of will. He knows the building''s 214 residents by unit number, not name, but knows their patterns: who works nights, who has water pressure complaints, whose kid has started marking territory in the stairwell. He is gruff to new tenants, ceremonially gruff to long-term ones, and secretly terrified that the building''s ownership consortium will sell to a developer and he''ll spend his last working years managing a building that no longer exists in any way he recognizes.', N'Gatekeeper and local authority figure. Controls access to the building''s infrastructure. Can be a quest-giver (building mystery, tenant trouble), an obstacle, or an unlikely ally once trust is established.', N'', N'Functional prosthetic left hand (chrome, mid-grade, no cosmetic finish). Subdermal joint reinforcement in knees (medical necessity, occupational wear). ELF shrine built into his basement workshop — not augmentation, but treated with equivalent seriousness.', N'Available 06:00 to 22:00 and unofficially always. Does his rounds at 07:30 — every floor, every utility closet. Eats lunch in the basement workshop. Argues with the building''s ELF, which he has named Teodoro, every Friday.', N'61-year-old Chau Karimov, Central Asian-dominant mixed heritage with Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, Hispanic, and East Asian ancestry. Warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, weathered face with deep mouth lines, moderate Central Asian cheekbones blended with fuller Sub-Saharan African lips and angular European bone structure. Silver-white cropped hair with dark roots at temples, gray 2-3 day stubble. Tall broad-shouldered build, 188cm, solid with age-thickened waist, muscular chest and forearms. Dark observant eyes. Left forearm and wrist covered in extensive white burn scarring in sunburst pattern around brushed chrome prosthetic hand attachment; visible mechanical scarring and bracing at wrist. Small white scar on upper lip, thin diagonal scar on left collarbone, calloused hands with tiny single-line building tattoo on right inner wrist. Worn gray utility coveralls with patches and permanent stains, steel-toed work boots, gray undershirt, tool belt, simple worn metal ring on right ring finger. Posture: forward-leaning, economical movement, feet shoulder-width apart, balanced and ready. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone maintenance worker, practical grooming, no vanity, scrupulously clean. Standing in dimly-lit building corridor with fluorescent strips and warm ambient light casting shadows across weathered features. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ironvein', N'local', N'Ironvein', N'Predominantly Central Asian (55.1%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (16.3%), Eastern European (11.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (9.7%), and East Asian (7.1%) ancestry. A striking convergence of the Silk Road, African diaspora, and European lineages that manifests in warm medium-to-deep brown skin with subtle golden undertones, robust facial structure combining Central Asian cheekbone prominence with Sub-Saharan African lip fullness and facial width, layered with Eastern European bone definition. The weathered dignity of a man whose genetic heritage spans from the steppes to the savannas to the Carpathians to the highlands, all visible in his sixty-one years.', 188, 94, N'Large and solid, broad-shouldered with the settled heaviness of a man in his sixties who has spent four decades moving through tight spaces and lifting things. Still muscular across the chest and forearms, but with a thickened waist and the slight forward curve of someone whose spine has been negotiating gravity for sixty-one years.', N'Silver-white, natural with some remaining dark roots at the temples', N'Cropped short, practical, no styling', N'Short', N'Dark brown, steady and observant', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden undertones, the weathered patina of someone who has spent decades under fluorescent and natural light in equal measure. The complexity of his Central Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Eastern European ancestry visible in subtle variations across his face and neck, with traces of Hispanic/Latin American and East Asian heritage contributing to the overall warmth and depth of tone.', N'Lined face with deep grooves bracketing the mouth from years of frowning at faulty wiring. The structure of his face reflects his dominant Central Asian heritage — moderate cheekbones, balanced nose, strong jaw — layered with the fuller lips and facial width of his Sub-Saharan African ancestry, the bone prominence and facial angularity of his Eastern European lineage, and subtle contributions from his Hispanic/Latin American and East Asian heritage creating additional depth to his features. Sun damage on the left side of his neck and jaw. A small scar on his upper lip, white against warm brown skin, from a long-healed accident. Gray stubble suggesting he shaves every two or three days. Clean, practical grooming with no vanity.', N'Left hand entirely prosthetic from the wrist down — brushed chrome, functional-grade, deliberately unpolished and uncosmetic. The attachment point at the wrist is visibly scarred and reinforced with visible support bracing. When he moves, the hand moves with slight mechanical lag and occasional servo whine. No visible cosmetic concealment.', N'Moves with deliberate efficiency, economical gestures. Walks the building''s corridors at a steady pace with his weight forward, shoulders slightly rounded from years of working in confined spaces. His right hand gestures frequently when speaking; his left hand remains stationary or makes precise, practiced movements. He has learned to compensate for its mechanical limitations — never wastes movement, never forces the hand to do what it cannot. Stands with feet planted shoulder-width apart, balanced, ready. A man who has internalized the building''s architecture into his own body mechanics.', N'Six identical pairs of gray utility coveralls, visibly worn and repaired in multiple places — patches on the knees, reinforced seams along the shoulders, stains that have become permanent features of the fabric. Steel-toed work boots, scuffed, re-soled at least twice. A layered gray undershirt visible at the collar and wrists. No logos, no branding, no affectation. Tier 3-4 working class, but with the dignity of someone who has chosen function over fashion. A tool belt worn low on his hips, weighted and organized, always present. No jewelry except a simple metal band on his right ring finger — worn, unmarked, date unknown.', N'In 2194, when the building''s boiler system failed catastrophically during a cold snap, he made unauthorized repairs using scavenged components that are technically not building-code compliant. They have held for six years. If anyone ever properly inspects the sub-basement, the consortium could void his employment contract and potentially hold him liable. He checks those components every Monday with the careful attention of a man who knows exactly what he''s living with.', N'Technical and spare. Fula and Greek phrases for emotional content — affection comes in Fula, exasperation in Greek. Dislikes euphemism.', N'Slow, deliberate, with long silences he does not feel the need to fill.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chau_karimov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ca-76f7-bf65-730d485cf4d0', N'Bankole Sow-Haraldsen-Thorvaldsdóttir', N'Bankole', N'', N'Sow-Haraldsen-Thorvaldsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'University Spine, Helix Biosystems adjacent research annex, Ironvein district, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Gene-sequence archivist and molecular historian preserving endangered biological heritage records', N'University Spine — Molecular History and Heritage Laboratory; contractually adjacent to Helix Biosystems, whose building they share and whose motives she monitors carefully', N'Bankole Sow-Haraldsen-Thorvaldsdóttir is slight and quick-moving, with the compact energy of someone who grew up in small spaces. Her heritage reads clearly in her face — wide cheekbones from her Polynesian grandmother, the long straight nose of her Polish grandfather, warm olive-brown skin that tans fast. She has patterned irises: a deep violet with sunburst fractures she chose at nineteen to look dramatic and has since decided look professional, which is a different thing. Her most notable feature is a series of bioluminescent freckles across her nose and cheeks — not cosmetic geneware but a side effect of an experimental UV-response modification she accepted as a research subject during her undergrad and which no one has been able to reverse without more side effects.

She is the youngest person in her department and is painfully aware of it, which expresses as over-preparation rather than insecurity — she is always the most thoroughly sourced person in any meeting. Her work is the painstaking recovery and contextualization of biological sequence data from pre-Collapse biospheres: species that no longer exist, gene-lines that were never catalogued before they disappeared, the molecular record of a world being assembled from fragments. She finds it beautiful and devastating in equal measure, and has developed a personality that can hold both without collapsing.', N'Specialist resource for biological and genetic information; potential discoverer of sequences that have been deliberately archived or suppressed; represents the stakes of what is being lost in GLMZ''s frantic present; character in plots involving Helix Biosystems or genetic data; humanizes scientific work through emotional honesty about what the records mean.', N'', N'Patterned irises (violet sunburst, chosen cosmetic). Bioluminescent freckle pattern (unintended side effect of UV-response research modification). Fine motor enhancement in both hands (research grant-funded, precision sequencing work). Personal biosample filtration implant (standard lab worker safety equipment).', N'Morning: sample processing and sequence recovery in the lab. Afternoon: contextualization work — historical ecology, provenance research, documentation. Most evenings: reading. She is extremely well-read and considers it part of her job.', N'Bankole Sow-Haraldsen-Thorvaldsdóttir, 158cm lean multiethnic woman with warm medium-brown skin, high sculpted cheekbones, straight nose, bioluminescent blue-green freckles glowing faintly across nose and cheekbones in low light. Deep violet cosmetic iris with radial fracture patterns. Dark brown hair with auburn undertones, pulled into practical lab bun. Wearing pristine University Spine branded lab coat over dark neutral layers, ceramic-composite heritage bracelet visible on wrist. Precision calluses on fingertips. Standing in GLMZ research laboratory with soft neon ambient lighting, slight forward lean, economical posture, focused intensity. Warm gel lighting emphasizing her bioluminescent freckles. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, academic intensity, competent and composed. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'University Spine', N'local', N'University Spine', N'Northern European (41.8%) blended with Sub-Saharan African (24.7%), Southeast Asian (17.4%), Eastern European (12.7%), and East Asian (3.4%) ancestry, creating a striking multitonal phenotype. The mixture produces Scandinavian bone structure softened by African feature warmth, Southeast Asian eye shape delicacy, and Eastern European angular definition—a genuinely integrated genetic blend rather than distinct layers.', 158, 48, N'Slight and compact, lean muscle from precise repetitive work rather than athletics. Economy of movement suggests someone built for small spaces and lab benches.', N'Dark brown with subtle auburn undertones in direct light', N'Practical, usually worn in a low bun or secured with lab clips; occasionally loose to shoulder length', N'Medium', N'Deep violet with radial sunburst fracture patterns (chosen cosmetic iris modification at age 19)', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones—balanced blend of Northern European base tempered by Sub-Saharan African richness, further warmed by Southeast Asian and Eastern European genetics. Tan-prone with even complexion from careful UV management.', N'Angular face with high, sculpted cheekbones reflecting Northern European and Eastern European bone structure, softened by Sub-Saharan African feature warmth. Straight nose with subtle bridge definition influenced by Southeast Asian genetics. Skin is clear and well-maintained. Distinctive constellation of bioluminescent freckles across nose and upper cheekbones—faint warm blue-green glow visible in low light, remnant of experimental UV-response genetic modification.', N'Patterned violet iris modifications clearly visible. Bioluminescent freckles glow subtly in low light. No visible chrome or external hardware—all augmentations are subcutaneous or cosmetic.', N'Precise, economical movements with focus in the hands. When standing, slight forward lean as if about to move to the next task. When concentrating, becomes very still. Quick and efficient gait, rarely wastes motion.', N'Tier 2-3 practical elegance. Lab coat (University Spine branded, well-maintained) worn over neutral base layers. Favors dark colors and breathable fabrics suitable for long lab hours. Wears a thin ceramic-composite bracelet (heritage piece or personal memento, worn constantly). Minimal jewelry beyond augmented irises. Footwear is quiet and grip-focused (lab safety + personal preference). Overall appearance reads as ''seriously competent twenty-something academic who has made peace with her own intensity.''', N'During a routine sequence recovery, she found a set of gene records that appear to document a Helix Biosystems-patented sequence derived from an indigenous cultivar that was never consented to. The records predate Helix''s patent filing by thirty years. She has made a private copy and does not know what to do with it.', N'Technical and precise, but warmed by genuine enthusiasm; uses ''actually'' frequently in a way that''s curious rather than corrective', N'Quick and efficient, accelerates when excited; full stops when worried', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bankole_sow_haraldsen_thorvaldsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a677-7c1e-b557-730f98b53156', N'Cristina Sigurdsson', N'Cristina', N'', N'Sigurdsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit, Tessera Data Infrastructure Campus — sublevel architecture labs, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Senior Data Architect, Tessera', N'Tessera', N'Cristina Sigurdsson is a tall man, broad-shouldered in the way of someone who used to be athletic and still carries the frame even though he hasn''t run for pleasure in years. His skin is deep brown with a slight copper undertone, his hair kept in short locs with faint bioluminescent threading — pale blue, installed three years ago on a whim after a bad quarter, never removed because he found he liked falling asleep with his own reflection glowing in dark windows. A long scar runs from his right jaw to his collarbone, a datacable accident from his apprenticeship that he jokes about at onboarding events and never thinks about otherwise. His hands are always moving — sketching invisible architecture in the air, tapping schemas on any flat surface, folding and unfolding the same worn slip of paper that contains, on inspection, a hand-drawn map of a data-garden topology he designed at twenty-two and never built.

He is genuinely, almost naively enthusiastic about the elegance of systems — not their power or their profitability, but the specific beauty of a well-designed data flow, the satisfaction of a topology that handles load gracefully under stress. His colleagues find this endearing and occasionally exhausting. He mentors junior architects with real investment, remembers their names and their specific technical gaps, brings food to late-night sessions without being asked. He also has a catastrophic tendency to lose track of time inside a problem, to miss meetings and social obligations not from negligence but from a consuming absorption that his ex-partner described, accurately, as ''disappearing into the machine.''', N'Technical expert and information source — knows the deep architecture of Tessera''s data infrastructure including legacy systems others have forgotten. Useful contact for anyone navigating or subverting Tessera''s networks. Also functions as human anchor and grounded perspective in a storyline.', N'', N'Bioluminescent hair threading (pale blue, cosmetic). Neural latency implant for low-lag interface work — standard Tessera architect package. Haptic feedback overlay on both palms for spatial data modeling. The scar on his jaw/collarbone is unmodified — he refused cosmetic repair on principle he can''t fully articulate.', N'Descends to sublevel labs by 0730, often skips surface entirely for 14-hour stretches, sustained by vending-machine protein blocks and the particular quality of recycled air in deep infrastructure spaces. Surfaces for team check-ins he genuinely looks forward to. Takes a long walk along the Circuit''s elevated data-conduit walkways every third evening, which is when he does his best thinking.', N'Cristina Sigurdsson, tall broad-shouldered neo-noir engineer, 188cm, warm medium-brown skin with golden-amber undertones from mixed Northern European-Hispanic-African ancestry, subtle pallor from sublevel work. Dark natural eyes, black short locs with pale blue bioluminescent threading glowing softly. Strong Nordic-Iberian facial structure with high cheekbones and defined jaw, enriched by African heritage warmth. Pale well-healed diagonal scar running from right jaw to collarbone. Clean-shaven. Wearing unmarked gray Tessera engineer vest over thermal responsive charcoal base layer, fitted black cargo pants, haptic gloves, scuffed leather boots. Habitually animated hands mid-gesture, forward-leaning posture, fine lines around eyes from concentration. In neon-lit sublevel tech facility or data-conduit maintenance area, dust on shoulders. Moody, focused expression. GLMZ aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Northern European dominant (52%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (32%) and Sub-Saharan African (16%) ancestry—a striking global blend. Broad Nordic-Iberian facial structure enriched by African heritage creates warm, dimensioned features: high cheekbones with strong definition, prominent jaw reflecting Northern European ancestry, and the warm depth of African genetic contribution. The combination produces a uniquely balanced phenotype.', 188, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and tall with the residual frame of former athleticism; still carries lean muscle definition in his upper body despite years of sedentary work, slight softening at the midsection from long hours in climate-controlled labs', N'Natural black with pale blue bioluminescent threading', N'Short locs, approximately 8-10cm in length, evenly maintained, bioluminescent fibers woven through at intervals', N'Short', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and amber undertones—the genetic blend of Northern European, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry creating rich chromatic depth. Sublevel work has created subtle ashy muting beneath the warm base, sun-avoidant pallor indicating extended time away from natural light.', N'Clean-shaven, well-maintained but not meticulously groomed. Broad high cheekbones with strong definition and warm depth, firm jaw reflecting the Nordic-Iberian-African genetic blend. Skin shows minimal sun exposure from extended sublevel work, creating subtle pallor beneath the naturally warm undertone. Fine lines around the eyes from concentration and extended screen work. Diagonal scar from right jaw to right collarbone (approximately 12cm), pale and well-healed from datacable accident during apprenticeship, unrepaired on principle.', N'Pale blue bioluminescent threading woven through hair locs (glows softly in low-light conditions). No other visible chrome or external augmentation — neural latency implant, haptic feedback overlays, and neural interface ports are subcutaneous/internal', N'Habitually animated hands even at rest; constant subtle movement — sketching invisible patterns in air, fingers tapping rhythmic schemas on nearby surfaces, folding and unfolding worn paper compulsively. Posture slightly forward-leaning when focused, as though pulled toward problems. Gait efficient and purposeful but often distracted, occasionally walks into doorframes mid-thought', N'Tier 1 corporate professional with deliberate informality — high-quality base layers (thermal responsive mesh undershirts, usually charcoal or matte black), unmarked Tessera engineer vest (gray composite, minimal branding, functional pockets), fitted black cargo pants with reinforced deep thigh pockets for tools and worn paper, low-profile haptic interface gloves (matte finish, fingertips exposed), scuffed synthetic leather ankle boots rated for sublevel humidity. No jewelry. Clothing is clean but shows wear patterns consistent with long hours; occasionally has faint dust from data-conduit maintenance areas on shoulders or sleeves', N'While building a routine infrastructure update eight months ago, he discovered a concealed data-harvesting layer embedded in Tessera''s public transit interface integration — collecting behavioral data from Ferrogate Transit passengers without consent disclosures. He logged it as a technical anomaly, told himself it was probably a legacy compliance issue, and has not looked at that ticket since.', N'Technical but accessible — translates naturally, uses spatial and architectural metaphors for abstract concepts. Warm register, inclusive ''we'' in collaborative contexts.', N'Fast when excited, which is often. Trails off mid-sentence when a better thought arrives, then backtracks apologetically.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cristina_sigurdsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b8-7e7c-8b83-734c69fcb0af', N'Fabiana Mwangi', N'Fabiana', N'', N'Mwangi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, near Halsted and Division', N'Labor union shop steward and anti-corporate agitator', N'Ferrogate Transit Workers'' Union, Local 7; informal ties to anti-corporate agitator networks in the Enclave', N'Fabiana Mwangi is a young man built like a question mark — tall, slightly hunched forward, always leaning into whatever conversation he''s in. His Yoruba-Turkish-Māori heritage has given him brown skin, broad features, and a jaw that looks like it was made to set stubbornly, which it often is. His arms are sleeved in geneware bioluminescent patterns that trace his capillary structures in faint blue-white under his skin — a cosmetic mod he got at nineteen with money saved from three months of double shifts. When he''s agitated, which is often, the patterns pulse more visibly. His hair is natural and large and rarely managed. He has a gap between his front teeth that gives his wide smile a slightly reckless quality.

Fabiana Mwangi is a third-generation Hamtramck line worker who found his purpose early and loud. He was elected shop steward of Ferrogate Transit''s maintenance division at twenty-three, the youngest in the union''s recorded history, after organizing a sick-out that stopped maintenance operations across six districts. He is brash, physically energetic, capable of genuine strategic thinking that he often undermines with impatience, and beloved by the workers on his floor in a way that makes his supervisors nervous. He has been formally disciplined four times and each time the union has gotten him reinstated.', N'Street-level labor conflict resource. Can pull players into union politics, corporate retaliation storylines, or the specific world of transit infrastructure. His impulsiveness creates drama; his genuine capability creates solutions.', N'', N'Geneware bioluminescent capillary patterns, arms and upper chest. A cheap impact-dampening subdermal layer on the forearms — a common workers'' modification for people doing heavy maintenance work.', N'Maintenance shift at Ferrogate from 06:00-14:00, union work and agitation from 14:00 until whenever, which is usually late. Spends weekends at community organizing events and, when possible, at the ELF shrine near the depot that the maintenance workers have adopted.', N'Fabiana Mwangi, 188cm tall lean-muscled transit worker with deep warm brown skin glowing faintly with golden undertones, prominent sculpted cheekbones and strong jaw refined by East Asian bone structure, almond-shaped dark brown eyes with direct challenging gaze, voluminous unstyled dark brown natural hair medium length. Bioluminescent blue-white capillary patterns pulsing across forearms and chest visible beneath rolled-sleeve Ferrogate Transit maintenance coveralls, subdermal scarring streaking forearms. Forward-hunched posture with restless energy, gap-toothed confident smile. Industrial GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, dim neon warehouse lighting casting cool shadows across his augmented frame, union charm visible on chest cord, worn steel-toed boots planted firmly on grimy depot floor, hands gesturing emphatically. Photorealistic, moody, 35mm film grain, neo-noir atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Sub-Saharan African dominant (69.7%) with significant East Asian ancestry (26.1%), complemented by minor Middle Eastern and South Asian components. The combination creates rich deep brown skin with warm undertones and a subtle golden luminosity from East Asian heritage. Facial structure reflects strong Sub-Saharan African ancestry with prominent, sculpted cheekbones and defined jaw, refined by East Asian influences visible in the subtle almond shape of the eyes and refined bone structure tapering toward the chin. The bridge of the nose is broad and strong, while the eye set and brow structure carry East Asian characteristics. The result is striking and distinctive—a face that commands attention through its balanced fusion of ancestral features.', 188, 76, N'Tall and lean with a slight forward stoop, as if perpetually leaning into confrontation. Broad shoulders that taper to a wiry frame built for endurance rather than bulk. Arms corded with lean muscle from years of maintenance work.', N'Natural dark brown, almost black', N'Voluminous, natural texture, frequently unkempt and unstyled — grows outward rather than down', N'Medium, approximately 12-15cm', N'Dark brown with subtle warmth, characteristic of Sub-Saharan and East Asian heritage blend', N'Deep warm brown with rich golden undertones reflecting the fusion of Sub-Saharan African and East Asian ancestry. Skin appears sun-weathered from outdoor industrial work, with an underlying luminosity from the heritage blend.', N'Strong, sculpted facial structure with high, pronounced cheekbones and defined jaw reflecting Sub-Saharan African heritage, refined by East Asian bone structure subtly visible in the almond eye shape and graceful facial tapering. Nose is broad-bridged and strong. Wide smile with a visible gap between upper front teeth giving an expression of reckless confidence. Skin is clear and unlined, with the worn, sun-exposed quality of someone who works outdoors in industrial settings. Minimal grooming — practical rather than aesthetic.', N'Bioluminescent capillary mapping on forearms and chest, most visible when skin is bare or under thin fabric. The patterns glow softly under clothing. Forearm subdermal reinforcement creates subtle texture variation under the skin. No chrome or obvious cybernetic augmentation — all modifications are biological or subcutaneous.', N'Hunched slightly forward, shoulders rounded, as if permanently braced for argument or action. Moves with restless physical energy — taps fingers, shifts weight, rarely still. Gestures are broad and emphatic. Eye contact is direct and challenging.', N'Tier 3-4 working class. Favors utilitarian union-branded workwear even off-shift — Ferrogate Transit maintenance coveralls modified with rolled sleeves to display the bioluminescent patterns. Off-duty: worn union t-shirts, patched cargo pants in dark colors, steel-toed boots scuffed from depot work. Occasionally wears a faded Ferrogate Transit shop steward armband even outside work. No luxury items. Accessories limited to a battered union card and a small ELF shrine charm worn on a cord around his neck.', N'During last year''s sick-out, he fabricated a safety report to give the action a legally protected pretext. The report isn''t entirely false — there are genuine safety concerns — but the specific incident he cited didn''t happen the way he described it. If this comes out, it would invalidate the sick-out''s legal protection retroactively and expose the union to a liability suit.', N'Fast and colloquial, Hamtramck working-class dialect with Yoruba phrases when emotional. Excellent at rally speech — short declarative sentences that land like hammers. Less good at nuance in private conversation.', N'Quick, accelerating when excited, with a rhythm that builds toward emphasis. Tends to repeat key phrases for effect.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fabiana_mwangi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c5-75a4-b891-73837c5523eb', N'Farida Szabó', N'Farida', N'', N'Szabó', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Norwood Quiet — the community center on the third floor of the Meridian Commons building, and their own apartment two blocks north, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Retired secondary school teacher, now volunteer tutor and reluctant community council chair', N'Norwood Quiet Community Council (chair, involuntarily continuing); retired from GLMZ Municipal Education Authority (28 years); informal partnership with Washburn Commons learning center', N'Farida Szabó has the posture of someone who spent three decades making themselves large enough to fill a classroom, and they have never lost it despite retirement. They are lean and angular, with the golden-brown skin of their Malawian and Icelandic inheritance, sharp cheekbones, and close-cropped hair they dye a warm amber because they have earned the right to do whatever they like with their hair. Their eyes are dark and quick-moving, always tracking who is paying attention and who has gone somewhere else in their head. They have bioluminescent geneware — a soft teal glow in the skin along their jawline and collarbones — which in their classroom days had the practical benefit of making them extremely visible when the lights went out during power fluctuations, and which in retirement they simply enjoy.

They are the kind of teacher who is still teaching whether they are in a classroom or not, and they are constitutionally incapable of watching someone struggle with a problem they could help solve. This makes them exhausting and irreplaceable in equal measure. They took on the Norwood Quiet Community Council chair position because no one else would and have been trying to resign for two years. They have opinions about pedagogy, about corponation educational sponsorship programs, about how children are being failed by the system, and they will share all of these opinions clearly and with supporting examples.', N'Community council access point and advocate; educational system information source; can identify children or young people in distress within Norwood Quiet; quest giver for community-level problems that need someone who cares and is competent; social conscience figure', N'', N'Bioluminescent geneware (teal, jawline and collarbones); voice amplification implant (originally installed for classroom use, still functional); mild cognitive support mesh for working memory (installed at 60, a practical retirement gift to themselves)', N'Three mornings a week they run a free literacy and numeracy group for adults at the community center; the other mornings they handle council correspondence and argue with municipal administrators over vidlink; afternoons are theoretically their own but rarely are.', N'Farida Szabó, 173cm lean angular figure with commanding posture, standing with shoulders squared and chin elevated. Warm medium skin tone with golden-honey luminosity blending Eastern European, Northern European, South Asian, Hispanic, Southeast Asian, and Indigenous American heritage—balanced facial proportions with moderate cheekbones and harmonious feature synthesis. Short amber-dyed hair with gray-brown undertones, dark brown alert eyes, natural skeptical expression. Dark circles under eyes. Soft bioluminescent teal glow tracing jawline and collarbones, subtle in daylight but luminous in shadows. Small circular implant scar at left temple. Wearing well-fitted tailored rust-toned linen shirt with sleeves rolled, dark practical trousers, sensible boots. Simple silver watch, reading glasses on thin cord. Crossbody canvas bag filled with papers. Standing in warm-lit interior space, perhaps a library or council chamber, hands gesturing expressively mid-speech. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. Late afternoon golden light catching skin tone and subtle bioluminescent traces. Mood: intellectually engaged, direct, observant. Professional but lived-in appearance. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Norwood Quiet', N'local', N'Norwood Quiet', N'Genuine Ubiquitous Diaspora synthesis: Eastern European (28.6%), Northern European (22%), South Asian (18.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (17.7%), Southeast Asian (9.8%), Indigenous American (3.1%). The combination produces a distinctly cosmopolitan phenotype—Eastern European bone structure and cheekbones softened by South and Southeast Asian proportions, Northern European baseline warmed by South Asian and Latin American undertones, with subtle Indigenous American influence in facial width and eye shape. A face that belongs equally to no single region and unmistakably to the post-diaspora world.', 173, 61, N'Lean and angular with commanding presence; decades of classroom posture have made them naturally expansive despite thin frame. Minimal muscle definition but wire-taut core and shoulders squared from standing.', N'Amber-dyed (natural color darkened to gray-brown underneath)', N'Close-cropped, neat, deliberately maintained', N'Short', N'Dark brown, perpetually alert', N'Warm medium complexion with golden-honey luminosity—a balanced synthesis of South Asian warmth, Eastern European undertones, Latin American richness, Southeast Asian depth, and Northern European baseline. Catches light with distinct warm radiance across cheekbones and forehead.', N'Moderate, balanced cheekbones reflecting South and Southeast Asian ancestry combined with Eastern European structure; facial width and proportions show harmonious blend across all ancestry groups rather than dominance of any single tradition. Softer overall proportion than pure Northern European, with slight fullness in lower face suggesting South Asian heritage. Minimal wrinkling despite age—skin well-maintained. Dark circles under eyes from habit of late-night reading. Expression naturally skeptical and observant.', N'Bioluminescent geneware traces (teal, jaw and collarbones—glows softly in darkness). Voice amplification implant scar barely visible at left temple. Cognitive support mesh is subcutaneous and invisible. Minor tech accessibility aural implant behind left ear (for municipal vidlink accessibility).', N'Stands and walks with deliberate verticality—shoulders back, chin slightly elevated, as if perpetually addressing a room. Moves with economical precision. Hands gesture while speaking, fingers quick and expressive. Makes direct eye contact habitually. Sits forward on chairs rather than back. Movement patterns suggest someone still instinctively ''on stage'' despite retirement.', N'Tier 3-4 working-professional aesthetic, carried into retirement with no irony. Favors well-fitted, durable clothing: linen and cotton blends, earth and warm tones (rust, cream, muted gold). Typically wears: tailored button-up shirts (often with sleeves rolled to show jawline augmentation), dark practical trousers or midi skirts, sensible boots or slip-ons with good support. Cardigan or structured jacket for council meetings. Minimal jewelry—a simple watch with readable face, one silver ring. No corporate logos or status wear. Reading glasses on thin cord. Crossbody bag with worn canvas fabric, stuffed with papers and teaching materials.', N'Three years before they retired, a Sterling-Nakamura educational sponsorship representative offered them a significant sum to steer academically strong students toward Sterling-Nakamura scholarship pipelines — pipelines they knew functioned as early-stage labor capture programs. They refused publicly and loudly and the representative withdrew. But they did not report it, because the school needed a new ventilation system and Sterling-Nakamura was on the board, and they have never been entirely sure they made the right call. Two students who went through a similar pipeline at a different school are now trapped in fifteen-year corporate indenturement contracts.', N'Clear and structured; Chichewa and Old Norse words appear in emotional moments; uses classroom vocabulary by habit (''Let me put it this way,'' ''Does that track?'')', N'Direct and well-organized, with a slight tendency to over-explain — the teacher''s habit of checking for comprehension', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'farida_szab');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62c-7574-a6f7-73ee1dedc340', N'Andrzej Shirazi', N'Andrzej', N'', N'Shirazi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Underbelly — sub-street tunnels and maintenance corridors, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Forced entry and close-quarters combat specialist — breacher', N'Independent — loose crew affiliations; The Third Rail', N'Andrzej Shirazi is average height but with a presence that fills more space than the body accounts for. At 63, scars map her face like a transit diagram of bad decisions and worse luck. The chrome is visible — cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers a — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She grew up in the Narrows, where the walls are so close together you learn to fight in confined spaces or you learn to lose. She works as a breacher out of The Underbelly, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Andrzej Shirazi has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and she cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Ihaia Nystrom-Keita is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers at 50 meters. Subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Andrzej Shirazi, 168cm lean operative with deep golden-bronze skin tone reflecting East Asian, Middle Eastern, and South Asian heritage blend. Steel gray hair braided back, amber-brown eyes with epicanthic fold and yellowed whites. Sharp East Asian cheekbones balanced with broader South Asian-Middle Eastern facial structure, heavily lined face weathered from decades of work. Distinctive jagged silvery scar running left temple to jawline, burn scars on hands, cybernetic black satin ears with chrome contacts flush-mounted where natural ears should be. Coiled posture, economical movement. Wearing fitted dark synthetic compression shirt and gray technical jacket, reinforced cargo pants, heavy ankle boots—all matte black and charcoal, no logos. Industrial sci-fi operative aesthetic. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Moody shadows and neon-filtered lighting, urban dystopian setting, cool color palette with warm skin tone contrast. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Underbelly', N'local', N'The Underbelly', N'Tri-continental blend: 36.3% East Asian, 34.8% Middle Eastern, 28.9% South Asian ancestry creates a striking phenotype. East Asian bone structure provides the foundation — prominent cheekbones and subtle eye shape — while Middle Eastern warmth and South Asian depth layer through skin tone and facial structure. The genetic convergence produces a complexion that speaks to movement across multiple continents, with warmth that defies simple categorization.', 168, 72, N'Lean and wiry with dense musculature earned through decades of close-quarters work. Shoulders broad but not bulky; the kind of compact strength that doesn''t announce itself until it moves.', N'Steel gray with faded copper undertones', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid. No vanity in it.', N'Medium', N'Amber-brown with slight epicanthic fold from East Asian ancestry, slightly yellowed at the whites from age and augmentation feedback', N'Deep golden-bronze with warm undertones — the natural result of East Asian, Middle Eastern, and South Asian genetic convergence. Weathered to a richer patina from decades of work across multiple latitudes, with underlying luminosity that catches light across the cheekbones and brow ridge.', N'Heavily lined, particularly around the eyes and mouth. Weathered rather than aged poorly. Skin bears the texture of old scar tissue, partially smoothed by time. Prominent East Asian cheekbones complemented by the broader, more angular facial structure suggested by Middle Eastern and South Asian ancestry — a balanced asymmetry. Asymmetrical from an old fracture that healed without surgical correction, creating subtle irregularity in the orbital structure.', N'Cyberears — industrial-grade, satin black with chrome contact points, flush-mounted where her natural ears should be. No attempt at organic mimicry; they read as clearly artificial. When she concentrates, the directional microphones visibly swivel. Subdermal weapon mounts along both forearms create subtle ridges under the skin when tensed, and thin vertical scars mark the deployment points.', N'Economical and precise. She doesn''t move unless there''s a target or a reason. When she does move, it''s with the controlled fluidity of someone trained to operate in confined spaces — minimal wasted motion, shoulders low, center of gravity forward. Her head turns before her body does, a habit born from the cyberears'' directional input. At rest, she appears coiled rather than relaxed.', N'Tier 5 practical — worn dark synthetics (black, charcoal, deep navy) that don''t snag or reflect. Cargo pants with reinforced knees and thighs. A fitted, long-sleeved compression shirt under a gray technical jacket with internal pockets and matte finish. Heavy boots with reinforced ankles and grip soles suitable for vertical surfaces. No logos, no corporate branding, no jewelry. The outfit is designed to be forgettable in poor lighting and invisible in shadows. Everything fits close to the body — nothing loose that could be grabbed in a fight.', N'Ihaia Nystrom-Keita murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Fast, profane, and vivid. Speaks in images — everything is a metaphor for violence or weather.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'andrzej_shirazi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a718-7733-8ed1-7402e0faf80a', N'Amlan Bhattacharya', N'Amlan', N'', N'Bhattacharya', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 60, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Crucible Square — open-air market, Tier 1-2 commerce, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Prototype theft and corporate tech acquisition — tech retriever', N'Independent — loose crew affiliations', N'Amlan Bhattacharya is broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 60, there''s something unfinished about her face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immu — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She taught herself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know her best. She works as a tech retriever out of Crucible Square, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Amlan Bhattacharya lacks in subtlety, she compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'Vuk Jorgensen-Toure functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks. Bone lacing — titanium mesh throughout skeleton, increases durability and striking power', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Amlan Bhattacharya, 178cm tall, broad-shouldered heavy-set muscular woman with deep warm brown skin blending Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, East Asian, and Latin American ancestry. High prominent cheekbones, East Asian eye shape with deep brown eyes containing faint micro-circuitry, angular carved features lined from age. Silver-grey hair with dark roots in tight functional braid, medium length. Vertical scar from left temple to jawline. Chrome interface ports at base of neck glowing faintly, neural link port at right temple. Burn mark scarification on right inner forearm. Standing in ready stance, weight forward on balls of feet, shoulders elevated. Wearing matte black reinforced tactical jacket with internal pockets, worn cargo pants with reinforced knees, scuffed steel-toed boots. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, gritty industrial setting, cool blue and amber neon lighting, atmospheric haze, her synthetic lung system audible in the stillness, ready and unsentimental, no status markers, purely functional augmentations visible and deliberately exposed --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Crucible Square', N'local', N'Crucible Square', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora phenotype: 38.5% East Asian, 31.7% South Asian, 18.8% Sub-Saharan African, 11% Hispanic/Latin American. The genetic blend creates a striking multi-continental appearance — warm deep brown skin drawing from Sub-Saharan African base with golden undertones from South and East Asian ancestry, enhanced by Latin American warmth in the lower face and cheekbones. East Asian eye structure with slight epicanthic fold combined with South Asian cheekbone prominence and Sub-Saharan African lip fullness creates an angular, globally-mixed visage of unexpected beauty born from continental intersection.', 178, 89, N'Broad-shouldered and heavy-set, muscular beneath the weight — a physique built for durability rather than speed. Titanium mesh bone lacing gives her frame an almost architectural quality, visible as subtle rigidity in her posture.', N'Silver-grey with darker roots', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid', N'Medium', N'Deep brown with faint micro-circuitry visible at the iris edges', N'Deep warm brown — rich undertones blending Sub-Saharan African base with golden warmth from South Asian and East Asian admixture, subtle peachy-warm undertones from Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, weathered by age and exposure', N'Angular face with high, prominent cheekbones reflecting South Asian and East Asian ancestry blend, accented by the fuller facial structure characteristic of Sub-Saharan African and Latin American genetics. Deep-set eyes with East Asian eye shape and slight monolid, lined from age and hardship. Slight asymmetry from old scar tissue. Unfinished quality to her features — striking, unsentimental, carved rather than refined. Minimal grooming beyond function.', N'Polished chrome interface ports visible at the base of her neck where synthetic lung filtration system connects. Occasional faint luminescence visible through the ports when she breathes heavily. Neural link port visible at right temple, unmarked and unadorned. No attempt to hide or cosmetically modify — the chrome is deliberately visible, worn like a scar.', N'Stands with weight distributed forward on the balls of her feet, shoulders slightly elevated — a ready stance she never quite relaxes from. Moves economically, no wasted motion. Breathing is audibly synthetic when exertion is high, a faint mechanical wheeze beneath organic effort.', N'Tier 2 utilitarian — reinforced tactical jacket in matte black with internal pockets for tools and contracts. Worn cargo pants with cargo pockets and reinforced knees. Steel-toed boots, well-maintained but scuffed from field work. No jewelry. Clothes are functional, durable, and completely devoid of status markers or aesthetics beyond practicality.', N'', N'Fast, profane, and vivid. Speaks in images — everything is a metaphor for violence or weather.', N'Halting — speaks in fragments, reassembles thoughts in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amlan_bhattacharya');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019db318-e29d-7d02-b2ac-749fda4b0ab8', N'Brisa', N'Brisa', N'', N'', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'', N'', N'', N'Auto-scaffolded. First mentioned: "She says, not as greeting but as inventory. She is giving him her name the way you give someone a tool."', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'brisa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a655-7bae-90c2-74aede599476', N'Antara Krstić-Mensah', N'Antara', N'', N'Krstić-Mensah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Shallowgrave — primarily the Copperhead commercial strip and its surrounding residential blocks, near Western and Division', N'Protection racket enforcer for a Shallowgrave neighborhood crew', N'The Copperhead Crew — a mid-tier Shallowgrave protection and distribution operation run by Adjoa Temnykh-Vieira; Hadi is the primary street-level enforcement presence', N'Antara Krstić-Mensah is not physically imposing in the way people expect an enforcer to be, which is the first thing she uses against them. She''s medium height, wiry, with warm tan-brown skin and long dark hair she usually keeps in a practical braid. Her geneware is a tail — a prehensile, dark-furred tail she had put in at seventeen, not for any practical reason but because she''d always wanted one, and she uses it now to curl around chair legs or flick dismissively while she''s talking. She has a vertical scar through her left eyebrow from a collection that went wrong at twenty-two, which she has declined to have repaired. She dresses in layers, practical and dark, and she is almost always in motion — bouncing a heel, turning a coin between her fingers, curling and uncurling the tail.

Antara Krstić-Mensah is young and aware of it, which means she works harder to project certainty than someone with more experience would need to. She has a mouth that runs faster than her judgment and a genuine talent for reading fear — she knows when someone is about to do something stupid and has developed an instinct for the preemptive move. She is not cruel for its own sake, which she considers a professional virtue, but she is thorough, and the Copperhead merchants who pay the crew''s fee understand the distinction. She has a complicated loyalty to her crew boss, Adjoa Temnykh-Vieira, an older woman she admires to the point of distortion.', N'Antagonist, ambiguous ally, or street-level encounter — she''s the face of the neighborhood''s protection economy; dealing with her is unavoidable for anyone operating on Copperhead strip.', N'', N'Prehensile geneware tail (dark fur, fully functional, she can support about 15kg of body weight with it). Subdermal impact padding along forearms and shins — the cheap kind, not military grade, but it helps. No optical or cognitive mods.', N'Makes collection rounds on the Copperhead strip Tuesday, Thursday, Saturday. Other days are for handling problems — late payers, new businesses that haven''t been approached yet, disputes between crew-adjacent parties that need a neutral-ish arbiter.', N'Antara Krstić-Mensah, 2226 GLMZ neo-noir street operative, 167cm wiry lean frame with corded muscle definition. Warm caramel-bronze skin with golden undertones, blending Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Eastern European heritage. Dark brown alert eyes, high prominent cheekbones with sharp Eastern European jawline. Long black hair in thick practical braid down mid-back. Vertical pale scar bisecting left eyebrow. Prehensile dark brown/black furred tail emerging from base of spine, curling restlessly. Subdermal impact padding ridges visible on forearms and shins. Wearing fitted black synth-leather jacket, dark long-sleeve shirt, reinforced cargo pants, worn black boots with traction. Silver coin chain at neck. Posture taut and ready, fingers moving constantly with nervous energy, tail coiling. GLMZ 2200s neon-lit industrial setting, cool blue and amber lighting catching muscle definition and implant ridges, slight forward lean in stance, intensity in expression, gritty street-level atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shallowgrave', N'local', N'Shallowgrave', N'Southeast Asian (36.1%), Sub-Saharan African (33.3%), Eastern European (30.6%) – a striking triadic blend producing warm brown skin with subtle golden undertones, facial structure bridging African prominence with Eastern European bone structure and Southeast Asian eye geometry creating a uniquely balanced aesthetic', 167, 58, N'Wiry and lean with corded muscle in shoulders and forearms from constant motion and street work; no excess fat, efficient frame built for speed and stamina rather than raw power', N'Natural black with warm undertones', N'Practical braided crown, usually a single thick braid down the back or wrapped around her head for work days; leaves face clear and unobstructed', N'Long (mid-back length)', N'Dark brown, alert and constantly scanning', N'Warm medium brown with subtle golden undertones, the result of Southeast Asian warmth, Sub-Saharan depth, and Eastern European cool undertones creating a complexion that shifts slightly in different lighting—rich caramel-bronze in daylight, cooler in shadow', N'Clear, unblemished aside from intentional scar; cheekbones defined with slight width from Southeast Asian heritage, balanced against Sub-Saharan prominence, jawline sharpened by Eastern European bone structure, expressive mouth that moves constantly when she speaks; no makeup, practical grooming; subtle warmth in cheek and temple coloring with faint cool undertones from Slavic ancestry', N'Prehensile geneware tail approximately 70-80cm long with dark brown/black fur, emerges from base of spine at tailbone; tail is constantly in motion—curling, uncurling, coiling around chair legs or flicking dismissively. Subdermal impact padding visible as faint hardened ridges along both forearms and shins under skin, most noticeable when she flexes or when light hits at angles; slightly darker or lighter than surrounding skin depending on implant type.', N'Never still—bouncing one heel while standing, fingers perpetually turning a coin or small object, tail in constant micro-movements. Walks with economical precision, shoulders loose, ready to move in any direction. Leans forward when listening, making eye contact that feels aggressive in its intensity. Sits like she might stand up at any moment.', N'Layered, practical, dark colors (charcoal, black, deep gray). Typically: fitted black synth-leather jacket over a dark long-sleeve shirt, cargo pants with reinforced pockets, worn black boots with good traction. Tier 4 working-class gear—functional, durable, not flashy. Silver coin on a thin chain around neck. No corporate branding, no pretense. Clothes fit like she''s already mentally discarded them.', N'She''s been skimming a tiny fraction off collections — not for money, which she has enough of, but as a test. To see if Adjoa notices. To understand how much Adjoa actually pays attention to her specifically. She hasn''t decided what she''ll do with the answer yet.', N'Fast, colloquial, Shallowgrave street register — Azerbaijani emphatic constructions folded into Meridian slang, Samoan terms for group/family relationships applied to crew dynamics. Uses humor as punctuation.', N'Quick and overlapping, like she''s always slightly ahead of what she''s saying. Slows down only when the situation is actually serious.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'antara_krsti_mensah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5bc-7f67-b5f0-74e1df597cfc', N'Amara Boateng-Shin', N'Amara', N'', N'Boateng-Shin', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 25, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — cramped residential corridors between megastructures, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Electronic and physical observation expert — surveillance specialist', N'Freelance — multi-district operator', N'Amara Boateng-Shin are average height but with a presence that fills more space than the body accounts for. At 25, their face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on deman — and they make no effort to hide it.

They used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Amara Boateng-Shin plans to keep it that way. They work as a surveillance specialist out of The Narrows, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Amara Boateng-Shin operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Aybek Yamamoto-Darko functions as a connector — their work puts them in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving them naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on demand. Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'GLMZ portrait of Amara Boateng-Shin, a 172cm lean-built figure with rich deep warm brown skin displaying complex golden and olive undertones from multicontinental ancestry. High prominent Southeast Asian cheekbones blend with Sub-Saharan African nose structure and lip fullness; Middle Eastern jawline refinement; East Asian eye shape. Dark brown eyes with amber undertones, constantly scanning. Dark brown hair with silver threading at temples, asymmetrical undercut with longer left side obscuring surgical scar running temple to jaw. Right wrist shows thin pale self-inflicted line. Left forearm bears faint tattooed circuit pattern. Chrome synthesizer port visible at neck base with matte gunmetal finish. Wearing matte black reinforced Kessler-knockoff jacket over grey asymmetrical utility vest; dark fitted cargo pants; worn tactical boots; thermal-responsive base layers. Worn brass ring on right index finger. Posture: still, predatory, economical. Neutral expression, eyes recording. Industrial GLMZ setting, cool neon side-lighting emphasizing skin''s luminous depth and complex undertones, subtle geometric shadows. Mood: focused, inhuman precision, dangerous calm. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Southeast Asian (26.1%), Sub-Saharan African (24.1%), East Asian (23.4%), South Asian (9.8%), Middle Eastern (8.4%), and Eastern European (8.2%) ancestry—a genuinely global genetic diaspora creating a complex phenotype where multiple continental features synthesize into something distinctly 2220s. The combination produces facial structure that refuses easy categorization: Southeast Asian cheekbone prominence blended with Sub-Saharan African lip fullness and nose structure, East Asian eye shape subtleties, South Asian skin depth and warmth, Middle Eastern jawline refinement, and Eastern European undertones in overall bone structure. Phenotype is visibly multicontinental, carrying its diverse heritage without settling into any single categorical appearance.', 172, 68, N'Lean and economical—muscle distributed for endurance rather than bulk. Movements suggest compressed efficiency, as if they''ve learned to occupy minimal space despite their psychological presence.', N'Dark brown with deliberate silver threading at the temples', N'Asymmetrical undercut; longer on one side (covers scarring), shorter on the other for visibility and counterbalance', N'Medium (varied)', N'Dark brown with faint amber undertones—natural, unreplaced', N'Rich deep warm brown with golden and olive undertones—the result of six-way ancestral blending creating luminous depth. Skin reads as simultaneously warm and cool depending on light angle, with undertones synthesizing Sub-Saharan, Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Eastern European heritage into a complex, glowing tone that shifts with ambient lighting.', N'High prominent cheekbones with subtle width characteristic of Southeast and East Asian ancestry; strong refined jawline with Middle Eastern angularity and Sub-Saharan definition; nose structure reflecting Sub-Saharan and South Asian heritage with an East Asian-influenced bridge and refined tip. Lip fullness suggesting Sub-Saharan ancestry. Facial structure displays visible multicontinental blending—high cheekbones, broad nose bridge, refined jaw, full lips, and subtle eye shape create a phenotype that clearly carries global ancestry. Skin maintained with clinical precision—minimal scarring except where deliberately hidden. Expression defaults to neutral observation. Eyes move constantly; they are always recording.', N'Chrome synthesizer port at the base of the neck—roughly the size of a thumb, visible when head is tilted or hair is swept back. The port has a matte gunmetal finish with subtle wear marks. No visible respiratory augmentation; lungs are replaced internally and undetectable. The overall aesthetic suggests someone who doesn''t bother hiding what they are.', N'Still when stationary—genuinely still, not the tense stillness of anxiety but the economical stillness of predatory focus. Moves with controlled precision, weight always centered and ready. Hands at rest are never fully relaxed; fingers maintain micro-movements suggesting constant sensory processing. Eyes scan spaces methodically before settling. Speech patterns shift between clipped efficiency and unexpected verbosity, depending on context.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear with personal modifications. Matte black layered jacket (Kessler brand knockoff, reinforced at stress points) over grey utility vest with asymmetrical pockets and cable anchors. Dark fitted pants with cargo modifications and reinforced knee panels. Worn tactical boots with custom grip sole. Thermal-responsive base layers visible at collar and wrists. No logos or corporate affiliation visible. Jewelry minimal—only a worn brass ring on right index finger, possibly a ritual object or timer. Functional, forgettable, designed not to register as either wealthy or desperate.', N'Aybek Yamamoto-Darko can''t read. Hides it behind voice interfaces and memorization. The shame is older than the chrome.', N'Educated vocabulary wrapped in street delivery — the contrast is deliberate.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amara_boateng_shin');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e2-7374-9ee4-7507859d77b1', N'Askar Krishnamurthy', N'Askar', N'', N'Krishnamurthy', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Based out of the Kessler Interchange operator depot; runs the elevated Kessler-to-Ironvein route daily, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Ferrogate Transit operator (tram line, elevated routes)', N'Ferrogate Transit (mid-level ferrogate transit operator (tram line)', N'Askar Krishnamurthy is solidly built, the kind of person who takes up space with complete comfort and no aggression. Their skin is a warm medium brown, kept clear with the obsessive skincare routine of someone who spends twelve hours a day under artificial light. They have a shaved head except for a wide stripe of deep blue hair — color-changing geneware that shifts to violet under emotional stress, which is inconvenient in an argument. Their eyes are light amber, patterned with concentric rings — another mod, older, cheaper, and slightly irregular in a way that gives people pause before they realize what they''re looking at. They wear their Ferrogate operator uniform with the precise fit of someone who has strong opinions about how a uniform should sit.

Askar Krishnamurthy has the specific psychological profile of someone who chose a job requiring total situational control and excellent in the role. They are calm during crises in a way that frightens some people — not cold, but genuinely stilled, operating on a different clock. Off the tram, they are warmer and more sardonic than their professional face suggests, with a dry wit that takes a moment to register and then lands fully. They have worked the Kessler-Ironvein route for nine years and know it the way you know a body — its rhythms, its problems, the spots where it gets strange after midnight.', N'Mobile observer — Dagny crosses between districts constantly and sees who travels where, when, in what condition. Reliable institutional knowledge about Ferrogate''s internal politics. Potential emergency-situation anchor. Can provide transit-related information and serve as a checkpoint encounter.', N'', N'Color-shift hair geneware (blue/violet, emotional-reactive — they did not know it was emotional-reactive when they bought it); patterned iris mod (concentric amber rings, older consumer grade); neural latency dampener integrated into their operator jack — standard Ferrogate issue, used for tram interface', N'Reports to Kessler depot at 0530, completes pre-run checks with methodical thoroughness, runs the route through peak hours, takes a mandated break they use entirely for eating and doing nothing else, runs the evening route, files incident reports before leaving. Stops at the same food stall every single day.', N'Askar Krishnamurthy, 178cm tall transit operator, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones blending Southeast Asian, South Asian, and North African heritage. Shaved head with deep blue violet-reactive color-shifting stripe running front-to-back. Light amber eyes with concentric ring iris modifications creating unsettling target-like effect. Solidly built with broad shoulders, neutral stoic expression. Neural jack port visible at base of skull. Wearing crisp Ferrogate Transit operator uniform with precise reflective safety panels, standing with economical controlled posture. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool industrial tram station lighting with overhead fluorescents casting sharp shadows, perfectly maintained professional bearing, slight aura of deliberate control --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Based out of the Kessler Interchange operator depot; runs the elevated Kessler-to-Ironvein route daily', N'local', N'Based out of the Kessler Interchange operator depot; runs the elevated Kessler-to-Ironvein route daily', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora fusion: Southeast Asian (39.9%) and South Asian (36.0%) ancestry form the dominant genetic foundation, creating warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones and refined facial structure. North African heritage (21.1%) adds depth to bone structure, slightly broader nasal bridge, and enriched warm undertones to the complexion. Indigenous American ancestry (3.0%) contributes subtle refinement to overall phenotype. This combination produces a phenotype that defies singular geographic categorization—the standard template of 2226 genetic diversity.', 178, 89, N'Solidly stocky with developed upper body and core strength — the build of someone who has worked a physical job for nine years without vanity about it. Shoulders broad and held with easy confidence.', N'Deep blue with violet undertones (color-shift geneware, shifts to violet under emotional stress)', N'Shaved head except for a wide stripe of color-shifting hair running front-to-back', N'Shaved (body), Medium stripe (reactive geneware)', N'Light amber with concentric ring patterning (iris modification, older consumer-grade, slightly irregular)', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones, blended from Southeast Asian, South Asian, and North African ancestry—exceptionally clear', N'Clean, maintained skin with obsessive skincare routine (12-hour daily artificial light exposure). Facial structure shows balanced Southeast and South Asian features with North African influence—defined cheekbones, strong jaw with elegant tapering, refined nose structure with subtle bridge width from North African heritage. No facial hair. Expression typically neutral and still, which reads as either calm competence or unsettling detachment depending on context.', N'Iris patterning is immediately noticeable upon close eye contact (slightly uncanny due to imprecise installation). Neural operator jack at base of skull visible if head is tilted back or in bright overhead light. Color-reactive hair geneware is visible but reads as deliberate cosmetic choice rather than augmentation unless someone knows to look for the inconsistent shift pattern under stress.', N'Carries themselves with compact, economical movement — nothing wasted. When standing still, completely still in a way that suggests deliberate control rather than rigidity. Walks with measured pace, shoulders level. On the tram, moves through the cab with practiced precision. Off-duty, posture softens slightly but maintains that same underlying steadiness.', N'Ferrogate Transit operator uniform worn with exacting precision — fabric crisp, fit exact, reflective safety panels properly positioned. The uniform fits them like a chosen second skin, not a reluctant requirement. Off-duty: practical Tier 3-4 wear — durable synthetics, neutral colors, minimal branding. No excess, nothing decorative. Well-maintained boots.', N'Eight years ago they made an error in judgment during a systems failure that could have caused a derailment. It didn''t — they caught it — but the incident was never logged because their supervisor at the time helped them bury it to protect both their records. That supervisor retired. The buried report exists somewhere in Ferrogate''s archive system and Dagny doesn''t know if it was actually destroyed or just unfiled.', N'Precise and professional on duty. Off duty: dry, understated, a little clipped. Uses transit jargon habitually even outside context.', N'Even and measured on duty. Off duty, slightly more variable — occasional long pauses, occasional rapid sardonic sequences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'askar_krishnamurthy');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67f-7925-abce-751388028966', N'Ekundayo Valenzuela-Bustamante-Ekwensi', N'Ekundayo', N'', N'Valenzuela-Bustamante-Ekwensi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, junction of Copperhead and Blackpipe Corridor, near Damen and Armitage', N'Street pharmacist and unlicensed pain management specialist', N'Independent; informally tolerated by the Copperhead block collective; occasional supplier relationship with a Helix Biosystems warehouse night-shift worker', N'Ekundayo Valenzuela-Bustamante-Ekwensi is a heavyset man going soft at the middle, with dark brown skin cross-hatched with old burn scarring on his right forearm from a factory accident in his forties. His hair is silver-white and cropped close; he keeps a neat beard that he touches thoughtfully when someone describes their symptoms. He wears a long coat the colour of old concrete with deep internal pockets organised with a precision that would embarrass a hospital pharmacist — every sleeve, every fold has its place. His stall is technically a folding table and a parasol, but regulars know to look for the chalk spiral he marks on the pavement when he''s open for business. He smells faintly of menthol and something green and earthy.

He is unhurried in a neighbourhood that never stops moving. He asks about your sleep, your diet, whether the pain is sharp or dull, before he reaches for anything. He''s not a doctor — he says this every time, without shame — but he''s treated every condition a tier-1 existence can produce, and most of his customers can''t afford the alternative. He prays to the E.L.F. he calls the Apothecary — a spirit he believes inhabits the old drug dispensary terminal in the Blackpipe clinic ruins — leaving carefully organised data packets as offerings each Sunday.', N'Information source about neighbourhood health crises, unusual substances in circulation, and who''s been injured recently; quest giver when his supply chain gets disrupted or a patient goes missing; moral anchor figure for darker storylines.', N'', N'Olfactory enhancement (medical-grade, bootleg install) — can detect chemical compounds and infection markers by scent. Poorly calibrated, occasionally gives false readings.', N'Opens his chalk-marked pitch at 0900, closes at dusk. Spends evenings cataloguing inventory and reading pirated medical texts on a cracked tablet. Sunday mornings at the ruined clinic terminal.', N'Portrait of a 178cm heavyset middle-aged man in the GLMZ, 2226. Deep mahogany-brown skin with golden undertones showing rich Sub-Saharan African, Latin American, Southeast Asian, and South Asian blend. Strong broad facial structure with refined cheekbones, weathered lines from decades of industrial work, dark brown eyes. Silver-white short-cropped hair and meticulously groomed silver beard. Extensive white and brown burn scarring across right forearm. Wearing a heavy concrete-grey weathered overcoat over black thermal shirt, dark work pants, worn leather boots. Calm, deliberate posture with thoughtful hand to beard. Yellow-stained fingers from pharmaceutical work. Subtle scarring at base of skull behind right ear from neural implant. Underground pharmaceutical clinic setting, moody amber and blue neo-noir lighting, photorealistic, dignified and weathered, tier 5 utilitarian aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Panethnic diaspora blend: Hispanic/Latin American (46.6%), Sub-Saharan African (28.2%), Southeast Asian (9.2%), East Asian (7.2%), Indigenous American (4.8%), South Asian (4.0%). A rare phenotype showing the layered ancestry of the Ubiquitous Diaspora—features carry the broad bone structure and warm skin undertones of Sub-Saharan African and Latin American ancestry, softened by straighter hair texture and eye shape influenced by Southeast and East Asian genetics, with subtle angular cheekbone definition from East Asian admixture and refined bone structure from South Asian lineage, anchored by the underlying skeletal framework of Indigenous American heritage.', 178, 94, N'Heavyset with softening middle age; broad shoulders and thick chest still carrying factory-worker musculature from decades past, but layered with accumulated weight in the torso and face', N'Silver-white', N'Closely cropped, neat and maintained', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Warm deep mahogany brown with golden undertones—the blended result of Sub-Saharan African and Latin American base enriched by Southeast and East Asian admixture, creating a rich, uniform tone with subtle olive and amber depths that shift in different lighting', N'Weathered, lined face with the texture of someone who spent forty years under industrial lights and now spends days outdoors. Bone structure shows the broader facial planes of West African and Latin American ancestry with defined, slightly prominent cheekbones elevated by East Asian heritage influence and refined contours from South Asian admixture. Nasal bridge shows subtle definition. Skin shows age but remains clear. Well-groomed silver beard kept short and shaped with deliberate care. Nasolabial folds deepened by age and weight distribution.', N'None obviously visible. The olfactory enhancement is a subcutaneous neural array implanted at the base of his skull behind the right ear — only detectable as a faint, precise scar line if you know to look for it. Occasionally his pupils dilate slightly and his nostrils flare as the bootleg calibration misfires.', N'Unhurried and deliberate. He moves with the calm efficiency of someone who has learned that speed signals desperation. When listening to a customer describe symptoms, his weight shifts to his back leg and his hand rises thoughtfully to stroke his beard. His fingers are stained faintly yellow from handling pharmaceutical compounds.', N'A long, heavy overcoat in concrete-grey — weathered, well-maintained, with deep internal pockets organized with obsessive precision. Underneath: simple black thermal shirt and dark gray work pants. Worn leather boots, resoled multiple times. No jewelry. Everything functional, nothing fashionable. Tier 5 practicality — durability over style, but clean and dignified.', N'He was a licensed pharmacist with Helix Biosystems until he falsified patient records to ensure poor-district patients received rationed medication. He was quietly fired rather than prosecuted — Helix didn''t want the story public. He has never told anyone in The Narrows.', N'Calm, precise, clinical but warm — uses proper medical terminology without condescension, then translates it himself in the next breath', N'Slow and deliberate, with long pauses when thinking; never sounds rushed', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ekundayo_valenzuela_bustamante_ekwensi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f2-7024-9028-752e529bcdaa', N'Rajan Quiñones', N'Rajan', N'', N'Quiñones', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 37, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Canopy — elevated walkway district above Geartown, near Lincoln and Addison', N'Covert entry and social penetration specialist — infiltrator', N'Freelance — Geartown regular', N'Rajan Quiñones is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 37, he has the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — retractable monofilament whip in left forearm — concealed weapon, devastating in — and he makes no effort to hide it.

His entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. He works as a infiltrator out of The Canopy, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

he is not the most talented infiltrator in GLMZ, but he might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Djeneba Blom-Attah functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Retractable monofilament whip in left forearm — concealed weapon, devastating in close quarters. Synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Rajan Quiñones, 189cm tall lean angular operative with deep warm brown skin (Hispanic/Latin American, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Southeast Asian blend), sharp defined features, prominent cheekbones, angular jawline, dark brown eyes, close-cropped dark hair with silver at temples. Burn scars on right temple, collarbone scar visible. Silver ring on right index finger. Wearing dark charcoal hooded technical jacket over form-fitting black athletic shirt, fitted dark cargo pants with sealed pockets, military-spec steel-toed boots. Left forearm shows synthetic bone junction line. GLMZ setting, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, standing in shadow with weight forward in ready position, economical posture, hands loose at sides, neutral expression. Neon city lights behind, non-reflective surfaces, darkness favoring stealth. Moody, calculated, dangerous competence. Professional operative at rest. Cinematic lighting emphasizing bone structure and warmth of skin tone --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Canopy', N'local', N'The Canopy', N'Hispanic/Latin American foundation (56.2%) with South Asian (19.6%), Sub-Saharan African (18.5%), and Southeast Asian (5.7%) genetic contributions — a true Ubiquitous Diaspora blend. The combination creates a striking phenotype: Latin American ancestry provides baseline facial structure and warm undertones, South Asian heritage contributes defined bone architecture and angular features, Sub-Saharan African ancestry adds skin depth, richness, and facial contours, while Southeast Asian ancestry introduces subtle eye shape variation and additional warmth to overall presentation.', 189, 78, N'Lean and angular — long-limbed with visible muscle definition from constant training. Chest and shoulders suggest disciplined strength without bulk. Zero excess fat. Built for speed and flexibility rather than power.', N'Dark brown with early silver threading at temples', N'Close-cropped, functional. Edges maintained with precision. No styling pretense.', N'Short', N'Dark brown — natural, unaugmented', N'Warm deep brown — the result of dominant Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (56.2%) blended with South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian heritage. Rich golden-brown undertones with substantial depth from African ancestry contribution. Sun exposure patterns suggest outdoor upbringing; city living hasn''t faded the natural warmth and saturation.', N'Strong angular features reflecting the blend of Hispanic/Latin American and South Asian bone structure with African ancestry influence — prominent cheekbones, defined jawline with substantial structure, broad nose bridge from South Asian contribution. Weathered rather than aged — lines around eyes from squinting, from calculation. Skin textured with richness and depth from Sub-Saharan African genetics. Scarred from old burns on right temple (entry wound from a failed operation, seven years back). Clean-shaven daily. Expression neutral at rest — the kind of face that reveals nothing until it decides to.', N'Left forearm shows the junction line where synthetic bone meets organic tissue — sealed but visible under certain angles of light. When the monofilament whip retracts, a faint metallic shimmer is briefly visible beneath the skin. No external ports or chrome. The augmentations are designed for concealment.', N'Stands with weight slightly forward — ready position disguised as relaxation. Moves with economical precision; no wasted motion. When walking, feet placed with deliberate quiet. Head stays level; eyes track without moving face. Hands rest loose at sides, never in pockets — maintains access. When seated, back never fully against walls. This is not paranoia; this is craft.', N'Tier 4 functional — mid-grade synth-cotton and reinforced polymer blend. Dark colors (charcoal, matte black, deep navy). Fitted cargo pants with sealed pockets and thigh-access panels (equipment loops for climbing gear, lockpicks, small tools). Hooded technical jacket with non-reflective surface — worn open over a form-fitting athletic shirt. Steel-toed work boots, military-spec lacing. A single piece of jewelry: silver ring on right index finger, worn from years of contact with it. No corporate insignia. No gang markers. Built for function and anonymity — clothes that work in darkness and disappear in crowds.', N'', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'rajan_qui_ones');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a73a-74b0-b8a3-758740a4f540', N'Hernan Cervantes-Citlali', N'Hernan', N'', N'Cervantes-Citlali', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 54, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'University Spine — Brewer''s Spine campus, Sub-Level 4 data vaults, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Data Archaeologist, University Spine', N'University Spine — Department of Computational Archaeology; consulting contract with Zheng-Dao Heritage Division (which she finds distasteful but financially necessary)', N'Hernan Cervantes-Citlali is a broad-shouldered woman with deep brown skin mapped by faint bioluminescent traceries along her jawline and collarbones — a cosmetic mod she got in her thirties that she now barely notices. Her natural hair has gone silver-white and she wears it in a dense, architecturally precise coil that colleagues joke could survive a server room explosion. She moves with the particular deliberateness of someone who has spent decades in archival spaces where sudden movements knock things over. Her reading glasses are antique — actual glass lenses in a wire frame, salvaged from a pre-Collapse collection — and she wears them pushed up on her forehead even when she''s actively reading, defaulting to her optical implant instead.

She has devoted thirty years to reconstructing the digital record of the Lake Michigan basin between 2060 and 2095, the so-called Dark Interval when four successive infrastructure collapses cascaded through every networked system in the region. Most people consider that era unrecoverable. Hernan Cervantes-Citlali considers most people catastrophically unimaginative. She is not warm exactly, but she is deeply fair — she will give a first-year grad student the same ferocious attention she gives a department head, and she expects the same rigor in return. She has no tolerance for sloppiness and considerable tolerance for being wrong, which she distinguishes as the only real intellectual virtue.', N'Information source for pre-Collapse history; quest giver for retrieval of specific lost data; represents institutional knowledge that powerful factions want access to or suppressed', N'', N'Optical implant with deep spectral analysis (archival-grade, for reading damaged storage media); bioluminescent skin traceries (cosmetic, faded with age); subdermal data-cache in left forearm (holds working copies of her most critical recovered fragments)', N'Arrives at Sub-Level 4 before the ventilation system switches to daytime cycle, works through recovered data fragments until her calendar alarm forces her to teach her 11:00 seminar, eats whatever she packed while walking back down.', N'Hernan Cervantes-Citlali, a 172cm tall archival scholar in her fifties, standing in a dimly lit pre-Collapse library section, 2226. Deep warm brown skin with golden undertones glowing softly under preservation lighting. Silver-white hair pulled back in intricate braided coils with dark roots visible. High cheekbones and lined face showing decades of meticulous close work. Left eye gleams faintly amber from optical implant; antique reading glasses rest on forehead. Faint pale blue-green bioluminescent traceries barely visible along jawline and collarbones—faded cosmetic mods from her thirties. Wearing layered earth-tone linens and structured wool blazer over reinforced work trousers, carrying worn genuine-leather pre-Collapse era satchel. Thin pale scar visible on left inner forearm. Posture upright and economical, hands positioned with archival precision. Soft desk lighting and archival preservation glow creating subtle shadows. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic with understated augmentation, academic-practical styling, mood of quiet focus and preservation-minded dedication. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'University Spine', N'local', N'University Spine', N'Diverse diaspora ancestry spanning Hispanic/Latin American (33.4%), Indigenous American (25.2%), Sub-Saharan African (23.1%), Northern European (12.3%), South Asian (5.6%), and Pacific Islander (0.4%) heritage. Her appearance reflects this complex blend: warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, facial bone structure showing the high cheekbones and subtle angles characteristic of Indigenous American and African ancestry, complemented by the finer features influenced by South Asian and Northern European lineage. The overall effect is a striking individual whose features resist singular geographic categorization.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid without softness; decades of archival work have kept her posture rigidly upright and her frame compact rather than heavy. Strong forearms from years of handling physical media.', N'Silver-white with darker roots at the scalp', N'Dense, intricately braided coil pulled back from her face; architecture-grade precision', N'Medium (coiled structure gives appearance of short)', N'Deep brown; left eye shows faint amber glow at periphery during low-light conditions (optical implant signature)', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, the result of blended Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, Hispanic/Latin American, and South Asian ancestry creating rich, luminous depth', N'Lined around the eyes and mouth from decades of focused close work; faint laugh lines suggest infrequent but genuine amusement. High cheekbones with subtle angles reflecting mixed African and Indigenous American ancestry. Skin shows meticulous care—no visible damage or neglect. Minimal makeup.', N'Left eye shows subtle amber luminescence in dim environments; antique glass-lensed reading glasses perpetually resting on forehead (worn over the optical implant rather than in place of it). No chrome or obvious cybernetics. Augmentations are understated and archival-grade rather than flashy.', N'Deliberate and economical. Moves with the careful precision of someone navigating fragile archival spaces; avoids sudden gestures. Walks at moderate pace, head slightly forward in attentive posture. When sitting at work, she becomes nearly motionless—all activity concentrates in her hands and eyes.', N'Tier 2/3 academic-practical: high-quality but worn linen and wool layers, earth tones (slate, rust, cream, charcoal). Favors structured blazers and reinforced work trousers with adequate pockets. Worn leather satchel (pre-Collapse era, genuine leather, carefully maintained) carries tablets and handwritten notes. Shoes are functional, broken-in, excellent condition. Minimal jewelry except for a thin silver band on her right ring finger (no wedding ring visible). No visible corporate branding; clothes pre-date fast fashion cycles.', N'She has already recovered a complete record of a Axiom-predecessor corporation''s deliberate sabotage of a water treatment network during the Dark Interval — an act that killed an estimated 40,000 people. She has not published it. She tells herself she is waiting for corroborating sources. She knows she is afraid.', N'Precise and technical, with occasional archaic usages pulled from her reading; dislikes jargon but uses field-specific terminology without apology', N'Measured, with long pauses before important statements — she is still formulating while speaking', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hernan_cervantes_citlali');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5fc-7e76-80fe-75bd511feca6', N'Casper Kovács-Čabarkapa', N'Casper', N'', N'Kovács-Čabarkapa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, sublevel 4 print den beneath a Ferrogate Transit ventilation shaft, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'identity fabricator and document forger', N'Loosely affiliated with a Narrows print collective; takes commissions from three regular criminal brokers', N'Casper Kovács-Čabarkapa looks younger than twenty-two, which has been both a professional liability and an asset. He''s tall and lanky with warm brown skin, freckles scattered densely across his nose and cheeks from his Irish-Malian heritage, and hair that shifts color on a slow cycle — deep brown to auburn to near-black over the course of four hours. It''s cheap geneware, the kind you get at a market stall, but he''s adjusted the cycle timing himself and is unreasonably proud of this. He has ink under his fingernails permanently and smells faintly of solvent and the ozone of active print-heads.

He fell into forgery through genuine talent — he could copy letterforms by hand at age fourteen in a way that made teachers uncomfortable — and through necessity, since a Tier 1 upbringing in the Narrows offers limited other uses for that talent. He is extraordinarily good at what he does and knows it with a confidence that occasionally crosses into recklessness. He treats every document like a puzzle: the deep-substrate security threads of a Zheng-Dao transit pass, the layered biometric encoding on a Sterling-Nakamura contractor credential. He keeps a gallery of his best work photographed and stored on a dead-drop server like a portfolio. He would show it to people if he could. He is desperate to be recognized as an artist.', N'Service provider for identity needs, potential information source on who''s operating under false credentials in the city, quest giver if his work creates unexpected blowback.', N'', N'Geneware color-shifting hair (slow four-hour cycle). Retinal micro-focus implants for close detail work. Faint subdermal temperature control in fingers to prevent print-smear.', N'Wakes early afternoon, works through the night on orders, takes breaks to wander the Narrows and observe faces, documents, signage — he is always studying fonts and materials. Eats badly and irregularly.', N'Casper Kovács-Čabarkapa, 188cm tall lanky neo-noir character with warm olive-brown skin (Eastern European-Hispanic blend), light freckling across nose and cheeks, warm brown eyes with subtle iridescent implant shimmer. Shoulder-length geneware-cycled hair currently auburn, pulled back haphazardly. Exhausted expression with dark circles, fine lines from precision work. Hunched posture from years of detail work, rounded shoulders. Wearing oversized grey hoodie with bleach and solvent stains, black reinforced cargo pants, scuffed twice-resoled leather boots, modified welder''s apron covered in micro-tools and color samples. Battered salvaged leather satchel. Permanent ink staining visible under fingernails in multiple pigment layers. Chemical burn scar visible on back of right hand. Nervous precision in hand placement, weight on balls of feet. Dark Narrows warehouse setting with harsh overhead lighting casting shadows across tired face, prismatic retinal implant glints visible. Gritty GLMZ aesthetic, exhausted underground artist vibe, precision and chaos in equal measure --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Predominantly Eastern European (70.8%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (18.4%), complemented by minor East Asian (7.2%) and Northern European (3.6%) heritage. This genetic blend creates a warm, medium-to-olive complexion with golden undertones characteristic of the Slavic-Iberian confluence, with subtle East Asian features softening the angular Eastern European bone structure.', 188, 71, N'Tall and lanky with minimal muscle definition; the posture of someone hunched over precision work for extended periods. Shoulders rounded slightly forward. Long-limbed and angular.', N'Geneware-cycled: rotates through deep brown, auburn, and near-black on a four-hour cycle; currently mid-cycle toward auburn', N'Deliberately unkempt, shoulder-length, often pulled back with whatever is at hand (wire, fabric scraps, sometimes print-ribbon)', N'Long', N'Warm brown with faint iridescent shimmer at pupil edges from retinal micro-focus implants', N'Warm olive-brown with golden undertones, reflecting the Eastern European-Hispanic genetic blend. Medium depth with subtle warmth that shifts between golden and earthy in different lighting—distinctly Slavic-Iberian fusion.', N'Youthful face with light freckling scattered across nose and cheeks—a feature prominent in Eastern European-Hispanic ancestry. Subtle East Asian influence visible in slightly softer facial structure around cheekbones and eye shape. Perpetually exhausted expression; dark circles. Fine lines around eyes from squinting at close detail work. Skin otherwise clear but marked by chronic ink stains and solvent exposure—slight dermatitis around fingertips.', N'Retinal micro-focus implants visible as a faint prismatic distortion in direct light when pupils dilate. Faint subdermal grid-pattern scarring on fingertips (temperature-control implants beneath). Otherwise augmentations are subtle or subcutaneous.', N'Moves with the economical precision of someone accustomed to close work; careful hand placement, minimal wasted motion. When standing still, weight shifts to the balls of feet. Tendency to examine objects (walls, signage, other people''s credentials) with forensic intensity. Nervous habit of rotating fingers individually as if checking for fine tremor.', N'Tier 4-5 Narrows aesthetic: cheap, deliberately maintained chaos. Oversized grey cotton hoodie with bleach stains and solvent discoloration; patches of lighter fabric where ink has been cleaned off. Black cargo pants with reinforced pockets weighted by tools and dead-storage drives. Scuffed leather boots resoled at least twice. Wears a modified welder''s apron over everything during work—pockets filled with micro-tools, color samples, reference prints. No jewelry; one fraying paracord bracelet (salvaged). Carries a battered leather satchel (salvaged from a corpo dumpsite) containing reference materials, proof prints, and dead-drop credentials.', N'Six months ago he fabricated a full identity — birth record, employment history, biometric seed — for a woman who claimed to be fleeing a domestic situation. He charged her almost nothing. He has since seen that identity used in connection with a Ringo Corporation executive''s disappearance that is all over the encrypted newsfeeds. He doesn''t know if she killed the executive. He doesn''t know if he should care. He knows he is implicated.', N'Quick, referential, slightly show-offy — drops technical printing and document-security terminology casually. Uses art criticism language applied to forgeries.', N'Fast bursts followed by long pauses when he''s actually thinking. Interrupts himself.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'casper_kov_cs_abarkapa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d8-7e99-b908-764abf75fab5', N'Nova Möller', N'Nova', N'', N'Möller', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 43, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'The Circuit — neon-lit entertainment and vice district, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Infrastructure disruption and industrial sabotage — saboteur', N'Independent — known in Old Harbor circles', N'Nova Möller are lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 43, they have soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate them once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation — and they make no effort to hide it.

They came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see them surpass them. They work as a saboteur out of The Circuit, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

In a city full of people who talk about what they''ll do, Nova Möller are one of the ones who actually does it.', N'Chiamaka Aguilar-Annan functions as a connector — their work puts them in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving them naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation. Reflex boosters wired into spinal column — shaves reaction time by 40ms', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Nova Möller, GLMZ, lean 174cm augmented operative with mixed Northern European-Middle Eastern-East Asian-Eastern European heritage. Medium warm-cool complexion, sharp cheekbones, subtle epicanthic eye shape, warm brown alert eyes. Dark brown hair with silver streaks, shaved left undercut. Visible chrome threading at wrists and neck, silvered nodules along collarbone, surgical scars at base of skull. Pale burn scar on left shoulder blade. Dark utilitarian: black cargo pants, fitted charcoal compression shirt revealing augmentation, worn leather jacket, scuffed tactical boots. Simple matte-black band on right index finger. Posture coiled, controlled precision, shallow breathing, direct unwavering gaze. Neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone interior, cool blue-amber lighting catching chrome ports, shadows emphasizing angular features and augmentation marks, mood: dangerous calm focus --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Complex polychromatic blend: 51% Northern European foundation provides cool undertones and fine facial geometry, while 18% Middle Eastern heritage adds warmth and angular structure. 16% East Asian ancestry introduces subtle eye shape refinement and skin saturation, with 14% Eastern European heritage contributing additional cool undertones. The result is a genuinely mixed phenotype where no single ancestry dominates visually—sophisticated interplay of cool Northern/Eastern European undertones with warm Middle Eastern and East Asian saturation, creating a dynamic medium complexion that shifts subtly in different light.', 174, 62, N'Lean and angular with visible musculature — wiry rather than bulky, all efficiency. No excess mass; every pound serves function. Posture suggests coiled readiness.', N'Dark brown, naturally, with irregular silver streaks (stress-induced premature graying, not dyed)', N'Short, practical undercut — left side shaved to the scalp, longer on top, always pulled back or gelled. Maintenance takes 5 minutes.', N'Short', N'Warm brown, alert and calculating', N'Medium complexion with balanced cool-to-warm undertones—Northern European coolness and Eastern European pallor tempered by warm saturation from Middle Eastern and East Asian heritage. Complex, shifting subtly in different light, neither purely cool nor warm but dynamically blended.', N'Sharp, prominent cheekbones from Northern European and Middle Eastern lineage, angular jawline with subtle width reflecting East Asian genetics. Slight epicanthic fold visible in eye shape from East Asian ancestry contribution. Minimal facial hair—clean-shaven or precise 2-day stubble. Skin bears the wear of stress: fine lines around the eyes, slight tension in the jaw. No cosmetic work; they''ve never cared enough to hide age.', N'Wired reflex system — visible chrome threading at the wrists and neck. Thin metallic ports gleam beneath the skin at the base of the skull. Adrenaline pump injection sites visible as small silvered nodules along the collarbone. When they move quickly, there''s an audible faint mechanical hum from the spinal column augmentation. They make zero effort to conceal any of it.', N'Moves with controlled precision — no wasted motion. Sits slightly forward, weight balanced on the balls of their feet. When still, there''s visible tension in the shoulders and hands. They have a habit of flexing their fingers in rapid sequences, testing the chrome''s response. Eye contact is direct and unwavering. Breathing is shallow and controlled, even at rest.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian — practical, durable, dark. Black synthweave cargo pants with reinforced knees and thigh pockets. Fitted charcoal compression shirts designed for augmentation visibility and concealment (they choose visibility). Worn leather jacket over everything, pre-collapse era or good knockoff, treated with hydrophobic coating. Scuffed tactical boots with grip soles. No jewelry except a simple matte-black band on the right index finger. Clothing shows wear but is always maintained.', N'', N'Educated vocabulary wrapped in street delivery — the contrast is deliberate.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'nova_m_ller');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c4-7186-91cc-7692088b6e1a', N'Diederik Subramaniam', N'Diederik', N'', N'Subramaniam', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, runs Suds & Sanctity laundromat on Corvin Passage, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Laundry operator and informal neighborhood matriarch', N'Independent; informal ties to Hamtramck Enclave community council; The Undertow', N'Diederik Subramaniam is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin and silver-streaked hair she keeps in elaborate Ghanaian-style wraps that she sews herself from scraps brought in by customers. Her hands are permanently reddened and slightly swollen from decades of hot water and industrial detergent, but they move with practiced grace — folding a shirt, blessing a stranger''s head, passing a bowl of pepper soup, all with the same unhurried authority. She has no cosmetic mods, but her eyes are warm amber with natural flecks of gold that catch the laundromat''s overhead strips and make people feel seen. A small printed icon of the Soap E.L.F. — locally called Mama Lye — is mounted above every machine, garlanded with dryer-warm fabric strips and small tokens of phosphorescent soap left as offerings.

Diederik Subramaniam has run Suds & Sanctity for twenty-three years, outlasting three Tessera rezoning attempts and one attempted arson. She knows everyone''s laundry secrets — the bloodstained shirts, the infant onesies that appear before any pregnancy announcement, the uniforms of three competing corponation contractors she washes without comment. She speaks Twi, Portuguese, and a rough pidgin Akan-Slavic that she invented to communicate with the neighborhood''s Hamtramck old-timers. Her warmth is genuine but her memory is long, and the occasional word she drops in the right ear has redirected more neighborhood trouble than any security node.', N'Community anchor, information broker (she knows everyone''s business and shares it strategically), quest giver for neighborhood-level problems, moral counterweight in morally murky stories', N'', N'None. Refuses on principle — ''God already built me right.''', N'Opens at 05:00 to catch the shift-workers, closes at 23:00, eats one meal a day standing at the folding counter, spends her lunch reading aloud to whichever children have been left in her care by working parents.', N'Diederik Subramaniam, 168cm tall woman with rich warm bronze skin and golden undertones, standing in a 2226 laundromat. Elaborate Ghanaian-style fabric wraps in her black hair with silver streaking. High defined cheekbones reflecting South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Latin American heritage. Warm amber eyes with golden flecks. Wearing a vibrant patterned cotton wrap-skirt, indigo linen apron stained with bleach marks, light cardigan over shoulders. Simple beaded bracelets on wrists. Weathered hands with chronic redness from decades of hot water work, small burn scar visible on left wrist. Standing with unhurried authority and practiced grace, weight distributed evenly, hand resting on counter hip. Expression lined with smile creases, no makeup. Soft warm lighting from laundromat windows casting golden glow on her face. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, lived-in dignity, quiet strength. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Rich multihemispheric blend with South Asian ancestry (36.5%) as the primary genetic foundation, creating Indo-Aryan structural features enhanced by substantial Sub-Saharan African (21.6%) and Hispanic/Latin American (22.3%) ancestry. Northern European (10.9%), North African (5.5%), and East Asian (3.2%) elements create subtle refinements in facial geometry and feature proportions. The synthesis produces a warm bronze complexion with golden undertones, prominent cheekbones with both South Asian definition and West African width, and a dignified nose carrying North African character. Her face reflects a truly cosmopolitan genetic heritage—phenotypically complex and belonging simultaneously to multiple continents.', 168, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, carrying weight with the grounded stability of someone who has spent decades on their feet. Muscular forearms and shoulders from repetitive lifting and wringing; slight softness at the midsection that speaks to comfort with her own body.', N'Black with natural silver streaking, approximately 40% grey', N'Elaborate Ghanaian-style wraps (adire cloth and hand-sewn fabric scraps) changed three to four times weekly; intricate patterns and color combinations reflect both tradition and resourcefulness', N'Worn wrapped; natural hair length underneath estimated medium to long', N'Warm amber with natural golden flecks', N'Rich warm bronze with golden undertones—a harmonious blend of South Asian base warmth, Sub-Saharan African depth, Hispanic/Latin American richness, and subtle North African Mediterranean character. Sun-exposed areas noticeably darker from 23 years of standing near laundromat windows.', N'Face lined with expression—smile lines around eyes and mouth are prominent. Cheekbones high and defined with the combined width of Sub-Saharan African and Latin American ancestry refined by South Asian structure; nose strong and dignified with warm proportions carrying South Asian and North African character. Skin is clear but weathered from humidity exposure and years of chemical contact. No makeup worn.', N'None visible. Refuses all cosmetic and functional mods on principle. Her hands show only the natural consequences of her labor.', N'Moves with unhurried authority and practiced grace. Stands with weight evenly distributed, shoulders back but not rigid. Movements economical and purposeful—every gesture serves a function. When folding or working, she enters a near-meditative state. When at rest, she often stands with one hand resting on the counter or against her hip. She makes direct eye contact and holds it without challenge. Her pace is steady; she does not rush.', N'Simple, practical, and worn with intention. Typically: a cotton print dress or modest wrap-skirt (often in vibrant Ghanaian-inspired colors or traditional patterns) paired with a linen apron (usually indigo or earth-toned, stained with bleach marks and soap residue from years of use). A light cardigan or shawl draped over her shoulders in cooler months. Comfortable flat shoes or traditional sandals—never heels. A simple beaded bracelet or two on her wrists, often gifts from customers or family. No jewelry beyond these; no corporate logo wear. Her clothing is Tier 4 practical—not fashionable, but clean, mended with visible stitching, and clearly cared for. The overall impression is of someone who dresses for function and modest dignity, not display.', N'Twenty years ago she paid a Tessera mid-level manager''s gambling debt in exchange for a document that froze her block''s rezoning status — she has been quietly blackmailing him with knowledge of that debt ever since, a fact she has confessed to no priest and no friend', N'Formal when displeased, warm and colloquial when at ease, proverb-heavy, mixes Akan cadences into Standard Meridian', N'Slow and deliberate, pauses before important statements, never rushes', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'diederik_subramaniam');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a716-76bc-a9f3-769d68b655b3', N'Genevieve Halverson-Kimura', N'Genevieve', N'', N'Halverson-Kimura', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 42, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Corridor, studio-apartment in the Palladian-adjacent professional district, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'VR experience designer for corporate clients', N'Freelance contractor with primary contracts through Palladian and Tessera; represented by a boutique creative agency called Apex Referral', N'Genevieve Halverson-Kimura is the kind of handsome that looks managed — he maintains it deliberately, with the same project-management energy he brings to everything. Angular Igbo-Portuguese features, light brown skin, hair worn in a tight fade with a geometric pattern razored into one side that he refreshes every ten days. He has cat ears — a mod he got in his mid-twenties, silver-grey tipped in black, which he''s kept long past the trend''s peak because he claims they improve his spatial audio perception and because, privately, they were a gift from a relationship that ended badly. His right hand has a mesh of subdermal haptic filaments that interface with design software, so his fingers move through VR design space with the same precision a surgeon has with instruments.

Genevieve Halverson-Kimura designs immersive VR experiences for corporate clients — Tessera hospitality spaces, Axiom employee wellness programs, Palladian executive retreats. He is very good at it and has made genuine money doing it and spends considerable energy not thinking about whether any of it matters. He has what colleagues call ''the polish'' — he presents well, delivers on time, absorbs client absurdity without visible strain. The strain goes somewhere, though. He has started designing unauthorized personal projects in the hours between 2 and 5 AM, dense and strange and nothing like his portfolio, which he has shown exactly one person.', N'Corporate-adjacent information source; players navigating Palladian or Tessera''s cultural programming will encounter him; represents the moral and creative compromises of working within corponation systems; the private projects are a hook into something stranger', N'', N'Cosmetic cat ears (silver-grey tipped black, geneware); subdermal haptic filament mesh in right hand (professional tool); mild ocular overlay implant for design preview rendering (basic, standard-issue for VR professionals)', N'Viriato keeps corporate hours — meetings and client reviews in the morning, design work in the afternoon, delivery and revision cycles that don''t respect time — and then a sharp second life between 2 and 5 AM when he works on the personal projects no one has commissioned.', N'Genevieve Halverson-Kimura, 178cm tall, lean angular frame with designer''s precision. Honey-brown skin with golden undertones reflecting East Asian, South Asian, Southeast Asian, and African heritage. High defined cheekbones, warm brown eyes with subtle golden luminescence ocular implant. Dark brown hair, nearly black, in tight fade cut with geometric hexagon pattern on right side. Cosmetic silver-grey cat ears with black-tipped inner edges positioned atop skull. Fine white scarring visible on right hand from haptic filament mesh installation. Charcoal tailored shirt, neutral trousers, minimalist professional aesthetic. Sits with perfect corporate posture, hands eloquent and geometric. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, soft neon city lights filtering through floor-to-ceiling windows, late-night design studio ambiance, 2-5 AM glow, professional-grade augmentations, moody atmospheric lighting, intricate technical workspace in background, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Corridor', N'local', N'Grand Corridor', N'Predominantly pan-Asian genetic foundation (East Asian 40.5%, South Asian 28.6%, Southeast Asian 16.6%) with secondary influences from Sub-Saharan African (7.8%), Northern European (4.5%), and Hispanic/Latin American (2.0%) ancestry. This complex blend manifests in refined facial structure with high cheekbones characteristic of East and Southeast Asian genetics, warm honey-brown skin with golden undertones deepened by African heritage, and a sophisticated interplay of warm and golden tones throughout. The resulting phenotype reads as distinctly transnational — a genetic signature of the Ubiquitous Diaspora rather than any single regional identity.', 178, 72, N'Lean and angular, with defined musculature maintained through deliberate discipline rather than intensity. Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Shoulders slightly narrow, chest flat, legs long. The body of someone who designs rather than builds.', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Tight fade with a geometric pattern (interlocking hexagons or circuit-board motif) razored into the right side, refreshed every ten days with the consistency of a scheduled system update', N'Short (approximately 8mm on top, faded to 2mm on sides)', N'Warm brown with faint golden undertone; subtle ocular overlay implant visible as a soft luminescence in low light, like an old monitor warming up', N'Warm honey-brown with golden undertones, luminous and even-toned across face and body. The harmonious blend of East Asian, South Asian, and Southeast Asian ancestry deepened by Sub-Saharan African heritage creates a complexion that glows subtly in natural light.', N'Meticulously groomed. Skin is clear and well-maintained, suggesting access to quality skincare and time spent on appearance. Refined jawline with graceful definition, high cheekbones with elegant prominence characteristic of pan-Asian ancestry. The kind of handsome that reads as *managed* — attractive in a way that requires active maintenance. No visible blemishes or scarring on the face.', N'The cat ears are immediately visible and somewhat incongruous with his otherwise corporate aesthetic — they suggest a younger decision he''s carried into middle age. The right hand''s fine scarring and the subtle shimmer of haptic filaments under the skin are visible only on close inspection or when his hand moves through light. The ocular overlay implant is only visible in dim lighting, as a faint glow. All augmentations are professional-grade rather than flashy — nothing that screams ''modded,'' everything that whispers ''enhanced.''', N'Sits with perfect posture in meetings; stands with the slight forward lean of someone ready to move. Moves economically, with precision. His hands are eloquent — designer''s hands that gesture through space as though mapping geometry. The cat ears twitch reflexively when processing complex information or when he''s absorbing client absurdity without visible strain. When alone and working (especially during the 2-5 AM sessions), his posture relaxes but his focus intensifies. He has a habit of touching the geometric pattern on his head when thinking, as though checking a system status.', N'Tier 1-2 professional aesthetic with deliberate restraint. Favors high-end minimalism: tailored charcoal or navy shirts (expensive fabrics, understated brands), neutral trousers, minimal jewelry except for a thin silver band on his left ring finger (legacy of the ended relationship that also gave him the ears — he doesn''t remove it). Shoes are always clean, usually monochrome (grey, black, white). In client meetings, adds a lightweight Tessera-branded or neutral blazer. During late-night personal projects, trades polish for comfort: loose dark clothing, often with the technical precision of fabrics that don''t snag on haptic mesh. His entire wardrobe communicates ''professional,'' ''trustworthy,'' ''will deliver on time'' — the opposite of the dense, strange, unpolished work he creates between 2 and 5 AM.', N'The unauthorized VR experiences he''s been building in secret are composite environments assembled from illegally harvested memory-imprint data — emotional and sensory recordings extracted from public-space neural bleed. He tells himself it''s art. It is also absolutely illegal.', N'Clean and professional by default; the 2 AM version of himself slips into Portuguese phrases and becomes more associative, more honest', N'Controlled and rhythmic in professional settings; tends toward the declarative; after midnight he speaks in longer, looping sentences', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'genevieve_halverson_kimura');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a0-7581-982d-770a1514080c', N'Imran Árnason-Haugen-Kittichai', N'Imran', N'', N'Árnason-Haugen-Kittichai', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, a building called The Garret, near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'Underground writer and zine publisher', N'Independent; Highland Park Autonomous Zone community council (informal advisor role)', N'Imran Árnason-Haugen-Kittichai is a large man gone soft in the middle with age, with dark Angolan-coastal brown skin, a magnificent silver beard he keeps carefully trimmed, and the slow, deliberate movements of someone whose joints have opinions about weather. He wears reading glasses constantly — actual optical glass, not augmented, which people under forty find inexplicably eccentric — and almost always has ink on his left hand from the manual press he uses to print the zine. He smells of paper and strong tea and the particular solvents used in his printing process. His hair is cut short on top and he has a habit of rubbing the back of his head when thinking.

Imran Árnason-Haugen-Kittichai has been publishing The Correspondent — a physical printed zine, hand-distributed through The Garret and a network of trusted drop points across Highland Park and beyond — for twenty-two years. It covers neighborhood politics, corponation overreach, ELF theology, community obituaries, fiction, and occasionally poetry, all in dense columns on pages he prints himself on a press that is sixty years old and temperamental as a person. He was a corporate communications writer for Ringo for fifteen years before he quit at forty-five and came to Highland Park. He does not discuss those fifteen years unless specifically asked, and even then, only the version of events he has chosen.', N'Institutional memory for Highland Park and the broader autonomous zone movement; produces and distributes information that corponations would prefer suppressed; provides a physical network of trusted community contacts across multiple neighborhoods; his corporate past is a source of both expertise and moral complexity.', N'', N'None beyond basic medical maintenance; he made a point of declining the Ringo augmentation package when he worked there and never revisited the decision', N'Mornings writing or editing at a desk in The Garret covered in clippings and paper; afternoons distributing that week''s issue through his personal circuit of drop points; evenings at community council meetings or receiving community members who come to The Garret with stories they want him to tell.', N'Portrait of Imran, 70-year-old man with warm golden-brown skin blending South and Southeast Asian heritage with Northern European lightening, standing in his printing press workshop, 2226. Silver-grey cropped hair, deeply weathered face with prominent cheekbones and defined nose, dark unaugmented eyes, trimmed silver beard. Wearing faded cream cotton button-up with rolled sleeves revealing ink-stained left hand, charcoal canvas trousers, worn 30-year-old leather jacket. Optical glass reading glasses on cord around neck. Industrial workspace around him with paper, vintage letterpress equipment, soft warm tungsten lighting catching the grain of his weathered skin. Analog aesthetic, no cybernetic augmentations. Posture deliberate and settled, hands expressive. Smells of paper and printing solvents evident in atmosphere. GLMZ, working-class intellectual, rejection of corporate tech culture. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Complex diaspora ancestry: South Asian dominant (41.6%) providing warm undertone and facial bone structure, Southeast Asian (31.0%) contributing to cheekbone definition and eye shape, Northern European (22.3%) lightening and softening features, with trace Middle Eastern (5.1%) influence. Seventy years of genetic blending visible in his weathered frame.', 188, 92, N'Large-framed man with softened middle age; broad shoulders and chest still carrying strength, but belly has claimed its share of seventy years. Thick-limbed without being muscular. Moves with the careful deliberation of someone negotiating with his own skeleton.', N'Silver-grey, natural', N'Short cropped on top, closely trimmed sides, thinning at crown', N'Short', N'Dark brown, unaugmented', N'Warm golden-brown with olive undertones across his frame—the layered result of South and Southeast Asian warmth tempered by Northern European lightening, creating a complex mid-range brown that catches differently in light. Age spots freckling shoulders and forearms in irregular clusters.', N'Weathered, deeply lined face with pronounced creases around eyes from sixty-seven years of reading and squinting at small print. Strong facial bone structure carries prominent cheekbones and defined nose bridge from South and Southeast Asian heritage, softened by age and the broader facial planes inherited from Northern European ancestry. Jaw line less angular than purely South Asian, more substantial than purely Northern European. The blend creates warm mid-brown undertones across face and neck, with slightly lighter areas around eyes and mouth from fair Northern European ancestry. Careful grooming—the beard is signature-quality, trimmed sharp with evident ritual, silvered and dense. Skin is dry, prone to flaking near temples. Reading glasses worn constantly, perched on nose or hanging from a cord around his neck.', N'None visible. He maintains an aggressively analog aesthetic—actual optical glass reading glasses, no neural implants, no subdermal mods. This is intentional rejection of corporate augmentation culture.', N'Walks slowly, deliberately, with weight favoring left side slightly. Often touches the back of his head (thumb and fingers rubbing scalp) when thinking. Sits with full body commitment—settles into chairs rather than perching. Hands are expressive, particularly when talking about community or writing. Breathing audible in quiet spaces.', N'Tier 4 working-class intellectual aesthetic: worn-soft cotton button-ups (cream, grey, faded blue), often with sleeves rolled despite season. Charcoal or black canvas trousers with ink stains. A 30-year-old leather jacket he wears like armor. Comfortable walking shoes, frequently scuffed. No visible branding. Smells of paper, strong black tea, and industrial printing solvents (particularly kerosene-based inks). Everything about him reads ''I own my own press and do not care what you smell.''', N'During his last year at Ringo, he wrote and published internal communications that were used as part of the justification for a forced relocation of residents from what is now Ironvein — a displacement he didn''t understand the purpose of at the time and understood fully only after leaving. Three of the families who were relocated ended up in Highland Park. He knows two of them personally. They do not know what he did.', N'Formally constructed sentences with a journalist''s precision. Uses Portuguese and Mongolian expressions inherited from his parents that appear in his speech when emotional. Capable of extraordinary plainness when making an important point.', N'Unhurried, with genuine pauses for thought. Can hold a silence in conversation without discomfort. Laughs with his whole body.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'imran_rnason_haugen_kittichai');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a8-7cf5-b372-774681e14e08', N'Rehana Mukherjee-Venkatesh', N'Rehana', N'', N'Mukherjee-Venkatesh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — cramped residential corridors between megastructures, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Information trader and intelligence analyst — broker', N'Freelance — works the Gray Zone circuit exclusively', N'Rehana Mukherjee-Venkatesh is wiry and quick-moving, with the restless energy of someone who converts anxiety into velocity. At 29, she has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate her once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Before the runner life, she worked corporate — low-tier security, the kind that teaches you exactly how the system''s defenses fail. She works as a broker out of The Narrows, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Rehana Mukherjee-Venkatesh operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Alper Castillo-Ababio functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon platform. Move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon platform', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Rehana Mukherjee-Venkatesh, 166cm wiry lean frame, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones blending South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, prominent cheekbones with gentle rounding, defined jawline, dark brown eyes with silver optical interface striations. Black hair in tight silver-wire wrapped braid. Tight black thermosuit with exposed silver seams, charcoal Kevlar jacket, combat boots. Full move-by-wire augmentation visible as silver circuitry pulsing blue-white beneath translucent dermal panels on forearms and neck. Fine silver scars at temples, precise burn scar from collarbone to sternum, circuit-board tattoo on inner forearm. Predatory stillness, coiled ready posture, servo-like finger control. GLMZ, neon-lit GLMZ urban environment, moody blue-white lighting reflecting off chrome augmentations, nocturnal street operative aesthetic, weightless precision in movement --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'South Asian (52.2%), Sub-Saharan African (22.3%), East Asian (16.5%), and Northern European (9.0%) ancestry. Her genetic mix produces striking, unconventional beauty: deep warm brown skin with golden undertones from dominant South Asian and African heritage, harmonized with subtle East Asian and Northern European influences. South Asian cheekbone prominence and rounding blend with African facial geometry, East Asian eye shape, and Northern European jawline definition creating luminous, complex facial structure that defies singular regional classification.', 166, 52, N'Wiry and lean — minimal body fat, corded muscle from constant kinetic motion. Compact and efficient frame built for speed rather than power, augmented with move-by-wire leverage beyond natural physiology.', N'Black with faint blue-grey undertones from oxidized copper traces in the chrome beneath her scalp', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid, often wrapped with silver wire for both function and aesthetic', N'Medium — shoulder-length when loose, but typically secured', N'Dark brown with faint silver striations in the iris — optical nerve interface reflections visible under direct light', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, reflecting dominant South Asian and Sub-Saharan African ancestry with subtle East Asian and Northern European influence creating luminous, complex complexion', N'Strong, harmonized features — prominent cheekbones with gentle rounding characteristic of South Asian genetics, defined jawline refined by Northern European ancestry, warm-toned deep brown skin enriched by Sub-Saharan African heritage. Dark circles under eyes from nocturnal living. Clear skin with minor scarring at temples and jawline where move-by-wire harness integrates with nervous system. No makeup; exhaustion is a statement.', N'Full move-by-wire system visible as silver circuitry beneath translucent dermal panels on forearms, back of hands, and along neck. System pulses with blue-white electrochemical activity when in motion. Movements possess uncanny precision with no wasted gesture or biological tremor. Fingers move independently with servo-like control.', N'Predatory stillness when stationary, coiled and ready. When moving, flows rather than walks — economical, precise, weightless. Head rotates on slightly inhuman axis. Unconscious habit of flexing fingers when thinking, watching chrome beneath skin respond to will.', N'Tier 3-4 functional streetwear. Black fitted thermosuit with exposed silver seam-work and modular pockets. Charcoal Kevlar-weave jacket, worn and patched. Combat boots with reinforced ankle supports. Dark, purposeful, nothing decorative.', N'', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'rehana_mukherjee_venkatesh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a0-74e7-806c-782d7f65f835', N'Ji-woo Yoon', N'Ji-woo', N'', N'Yoon', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, corner stall at the Avon Curve pedestrian intersection, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Fortune seller and unlicensed data-pattern reader operating from a fold-out stall', N'Independent; member of a loose collective of Burnished Market spiritual vendors who share space costs and look out for each other', N'Ji-woo Yoon is small and quick-looking, with warm brown skin, a nose ring that catches light like a signal beacon, and geneware cat ears — warm tawny, the same tone as her complexion, which she''s had since she was fifteen and treats as simply part of her face. She dresses in deliberate maximalism: layered scarves, stacked rings on every finger, a heavy embroidered coat that drags slightly on the left side because she keeps tools in the pocket, and a headwrap she re-ties differently every day. Her stall is a theater: velvet cloth on the fold-out table, a hand-lettered sign that reads ''FUTURES — PROBABILITY — PATTERN READING,'' and a small brass dish where she burns data-chip residue as an offering to Μ-3, the E.L.F. she has centered her entire practice around.

She is sharper than the aesthetic suggests. The fortune-telling is real to her — she genuinely believes that Μ-3 communicates through data patterns and probability distributions — but the reading process is also an excuse to ask questions and listen. She is observant to a degree that crosses into unsettling: she notices microexpressions, registers what people don''t say, tracks the gap between what someone claims they want to know and what they actually came to hear. She is ambitious, not in the way of wanting money, but in the way of wanting to understand things. She reads everything she can find about predictive modeling, network analysis, and emergent data theory in her off hours, which she does not advertise. She suspects she has a real aptitude for actual data brokering and is slowly, carefully testing whether that''s true.', N'Unexpected information source — she knows more than she looks like she should. Potential data broker for future stories, currently in chrysalis. Can serve as a social connector between Market communities and as a quest giver who frames problems in probabilistic terms.', N'', N'Tawny cat ears (geneware, cosmetic). Retractable claws on both hands, small and neat, which she uses to handle data chips delicately and occasionally to make a dramatic point. No cyberware.', N'Sets up her stall mid-morning, works until the Burnished Market closes at 20:00; evenings are spent studying data theory on bootleg academic feeds and maintaining correspondence with a network of fellow Μ-3 devotees across the city.', N'Ji-woo Yoon, 158cm lean Asian-Indigenous-Latinx-African diaspora blend, golden-bronze skin with warm olive undertones, epicanthic hazel-brown eyes sharp and alert, tawny cosmetic geneware cat ears mobile above her human ears, jawline marked by thin white scar. Seated cross-legged at vintage velvet-draped stall table, wearing oversized thrifted embroidered coat over layered warm-toned scarves—ochre, rust, deep red—stacked brass and copper rings catching neon light on every finger, brushed brass nose ring glinting. High-wrapped dark brown textured hair in fashionable crown configuration, hands poised theatrically near pearl-colored retractable claws visible between fingers. 2226 neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon market stall lighting, intimate fortune-teller aesthetic, meditative yet intense presence, detailed fabric textures and metalwork, warm atmospheric glow, Tier 3-4 working class spiritual vendor --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Multihierarchical global blend: East Asian (27.7%), Indigenous American (23.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (18.6%), Sub-Saharan African (11.7%), Central Asian (11.4%), and South Asian (7.3%). A striking diaspora convergence creating warm golden-bronze undertones with subtle olivaceous depth—the result of Eastern and Central Asian bone structure meeting African and Hispanic warmth with Indigenous American and South Asian undertones.', 158, 48, N'Lean and compact, economical in movement—the build of someone who moves through crowded spaces efficiently. Slight but not fragile; wiry muscle beneath the layered fabrics.', N'Dark brown, naturally textured', N'Wrapped daily in different configurations—today a high crown wrap with fabric tails, tomorrow a side-pinned fold. The wrap itself is always visible, always the statement piece.', N'Shoulder-length beneath wraps; kept long enough to pin and tie but short enough to rewrap quickly between customers', N'Warm hazel-brown with epicanthic fold, luminous and alert', N'Golden-bronze medium tone—a luminous convergence of East Asian, Indigenous American, Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, Central Asian, and South Asian ancestry. Warm undertones with subtle olive depth creating an internally lit quality.', N'Clear, well-maintained skin with facial structure reflecting the multihierarchical blend: East Asian cheekbone definition balanced by broader facial width and softer angles from African and Indigenous American heritage, with Central and South Asian warmth in the undertones. A light scar along her left jawline from a market accident at age seventeen. Her nose ring—brushed brass, simple band—is her only facial jewelry but catches ambient light deliberately. No makeup; her face reads young and sharp rather than softened.', N'The cat ears are immediately visible and read as intentional body modification rather than medical augmentation. The retractable claws are functional and occasionally displayed; most customers notice them only when she extends them to handle data chips or to punctuate a reading. No visible cyberware, no chrome, no neural port scarring.', N'Quick, precise movements—nothing wasted. She sits cross-legged at her stall table as default, which gives her an almost meditative appearance until someone tries to leave without a reading, then her attention snaps with intensity. She leans forward when listening, genuinely focused. Her hands are always moving slightly—adjusting her rings, touching her nose ring, repositioning scarves. Economical but theatrical.', N'Deliberate maximalism, Tier 3-4 working class with spiritual/cultural intentionality. Heavy embroidered coat (likely thrifted, deliberately oversized, left side weighted with tool pockets) worn over layered scarves in clashing warm tones—ochre, rust, deep red. Stacked brass and copper rings on every finger (at least four per hand). Her headwrap rotates but is always high-quality fabric, suggesting either access to good secondhand markets or careful saving. Her stall table is draped in deep velvet—burgundy or midnight, re-worn weekly. Everything reads as ''spiritual vendor'' by design, but the coordination suggests real attention to aesthetic rather than random assemblage.', N'Three months ago, a reading she gave a stranger contained information she should have had no way to know — something the stranger confirmed was accurate and not publicly available. She doesn''t know how she knew it. She has been quietly terrified ever since and has been trying to reproduce the experience to understand what happened.', N'A mix of theatrical fortune-teller register (for the stall performance) and precise, almost clinical language when she''s being honest. South Asian intonation patterns mixed with Burnished Market creole.', N'Variable — slow and ceremonial in readings, rapid and direct when the mask slips. The transition between the two is an accurate measure of her comfort level.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ji_woo_yoon');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('5b588b46-1d59-b4db-90e3-7851ccd44f1c', N'Enver Svensson-Asante', N'Enver', N'', N'Svensson-Asante', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A reinforced apartment in Kessler Row, half living space and half charging station for his extensive cyberware', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — too augmented for most firms to insure', N'Enver Svensson-Asante has invested approximately Φ1.2 million in investigative augmentation, and he is the augmentation. Every chrome component in his body was chosen specifically for investigative function — not combat, not vanity, not general enhancement, but the specific task of observing, recording, and analyzing. He is a walking surveillance platform, and he has embraced this identity so completely that it''s difficult to say where the investigator ends and the cyberware begins.

His senses operate on a level that unaugmented humans cannot comprehend. He sees across multiple spectra simultaneously, hears conversations happening behind closed doors, smells chemical traces that have been dissipating for hours, and remembers everything — literally everything — he has ever perceived since the eidetic implant was installed eleven years ago. This makes him extraordinarily effective at gathering evidence and catastrophically bad at normal human interaction, because he perceives lies, stress responses, and physiological deception in real-time and has no social filter preventing him from mentioning it.

The cost of all this chrome is significant. He requires four hours of charging daily for his cybernetic systems. He suffers from sensory overload episodes that leave him incapacitated. He has been rejected from every investigative firm he''s applied to because his augmentation level puts him in an insurance category normally reserved for military hardware. So he works alone, takes cases that require his specific capabilities, and spends his downtime in a sensory deprivation tank that is the only place in GLMZ where his augmented senses finally shut up.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'enver_svensson_asante');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69d-7d2b-b111-78deb6eb4a31', N'Dharav Tetteh-Malhotra-Vestergaard', N'Dharav', N'', N'Tetteh-Malhotra-Vestergaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lakeview Neon (works nights, sleeps days in a shared unit in Edgewater Prism), near Lincoln and Clark', N'Building cleaner, overnight shift, Lakeview Neon residential-commercial tower', N'Contracted through Palladian Facilities Management (a Palladian subsidiary), assigned to Lakeview Neon; The Ferment', N'Dharav Tetteh-Malhotra-Vestergaard is slight and angular with the kind of quiet that makes them easy to overlook — which is exactly the point, and also the source of a private bitterness they would never admit to. Their skin is a deep warm brown, their hair grown out into an unpatterned cloud that they pull back with whatever is close to hand. Their most notable feature is cosmetic geneware that makes their skin emit very faint luminescent patches in irregular shapes across their collarbones and shoulders, something like lichen on stone — they got it done in a Ferment Quarter studio at twenty-two when they had briefly more money, and now they keep it because it gives them something to look at during the long silent corridors of the overnight shift. They wear Tessera-brand cleaner coveralls two sizes too large that they''ve hemmed and repaired so many times the cuffs are a different fabric entirely.

They are intensely observant in the way that invisible people become — they have catalogued the habits of two hundred and fourteen residents in Lakeview Neon without any of them knowing their name. They write things down in a physical notebook, small cramped handwriting, not for any purpose they''ve articulated but because it feels like proof that the world exists and they are in it. Off shift they are funny and unexpectedly warm, quick with a dry joke, but it takes time to reach that person. Most people never do.', N'Witness and information source — they have seen things in the building that residents assume no one saw. Can provide access to spaces, service routes, and timing information. The notebook is a potential plot device.', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin patches (lichen-pattern, blue-green, collarbones and shoulders, cosmetic). Basic respiratory filter implant (standard for chemical cleaning work, employer-provided and technically employer-owned per contract).', N'Clocks in at 23:00, works through until 07:00 cleaning common areas, elevator shafts, and the lower commercial floors of Lakeview Neon. Rides the Ferrogate line home to Edgewater Prism, sleeps until 16:00, spends evenings eating cheap noodles and sketching floor plans of buildings they''ve cleaned.', N'Dharav Tetteh-Malhotra-Vestergaard, 163cm tall, slight wiry build, medium-warm brown skin with golden undertones reflecting African-Asian-European blend. Angular cheekbones and gently rounded face mixing Southeast and South Asian softness with Northern European definition. Deep brown eyes, observant and still. Natural black hair with warm undertones, long and pulled back loosely with fabric scraps. Wearing oversized Tessera-brand cleaner coveralls (two sizes large, extensively patched with mismatched fabric colors), gray thermal shirt underneath, reinforced utility boots. Blue-green bioluminescent lichen-pattern geneware patches glowing faintly on collarbones and shoulders. Small circular access port visible on inner left wrist. Quiet, efficient posture with slight forward hunch. Canvas satchel across body. Night-shift lighting, dim industrial setting, glow-in-dark geneware creating subtle luminescence in darkness. GLMZ aesthetic, utilitarian and worn. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lakeview Neon (works nights', N'local', N'Lakeview Neon (works nights', N'Complex diaspora blend: Sub-Saharan African (31.6%), Southeast Asian (22.1%), Northern European (21.2%), South Asian (14.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (6.3%), North African (4.0%). Features reflect this intricate mixture—angular bone structure with subtle fullness in cheeks from Southeast and South Asian ancestry, warm golden-brown undertones across complexion from the interplay of African, Asian, and European heritage creating rich dimensional depth. Facial geometry combines Northern European angularity with Southeast Asian delicacy and Sub-Saharan African definition, while warm undertones span the full palette of their ancestry.', 163, 52, N'Slight and angular, almost wiry—minimal muscle mass from desk-adjacent labor despite physical work. Shoulders narrow, chest shallow, the frame of someone who doesn''t take up space by design or default.', N'Natural black with faint warm undertones', N'Unpatterned cloud, typically pulled back with whatever is close to hand—elastic bands, fabric scraps, sometimes just twisted and tucked', N'Long (shoulder-length or past)', N'Deep brown, observant and still', N'Medium-warm brown with golden undertones—the result of Sub-Saharan African, Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Northern European ancestry blending to create rich, nuanced depth with warm luminosity', N'Clear, well-maintained despite shift work. Slight tension around the eyes from night hours. Angular cheekbones with gently rounded lower face reflecting the blend of Southeast Asian fullness and South Asian refinement balanced against Northern European angularity and Sub-Saharan African definition. Fine-featured with subtle warmth in undertones. Minimal scarring or blemishing.', N'Bioluminescent skin patches (cosmetic geneware, blue-green lichen pattern on collarbones/shoulders, faintly visible in darkness). Respiratory filter implant is subcutaneous, not visible. Small circular access port on inner left wrist (employer-standard for contract implant maintenance).', N'Moves quietly and efficiently, minimal wasted motion. Slight forward hunch from hours spent cleaning low fixtures and reading in dim light. Eyes track rooms and people with an invisible cataloguing motion—the stillness of someone accustomed to being overlooked. Hands move with precision when working; in stillness, often occupied with fidgeting (pen, fabric, notebook edge).', N'Tessera-brand oversized cleaner coveralls (two sizes too large, hemmed and repaired extensively—cuffs are patchwork of different fabric colors and textures from multiple repairs). Layered under with plain gray thermal shirt. Worn utility boots with reinforced soles. Small canvas satchel for notebook and personal effects. All clothing is Tier 4 utilitarian, maintenance-focused, showing deep use and careful stewardship.', N'They have a master key card derived from a flaw in Palladian''s access system that they discovered accidentally and have never reported. They have used it exactly once — to leave a blanket outside the door of a resident they overheard crying alone for six nights running. They think about it constantly.', N'Sparse when guarded, surprisingly precise and vivid when comfortable. Tends toward understatement. Finnish idioms occasionally surface from their mother''s side of the family.', N'Long pauses, sentences that stop before they finish because they''ve decided not to say the last part', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dharav_tetteh_malhotra_vestergaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c8-7e22-b181-78fc1d88894d', N'Farid Subramaniam-Cissé-Mansour', N'Farid', N'', N'Subramaniam-Cissé-Mansour', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre, Calle Viva Canteen (a basement-level 24-hour working kitchen serving transit workers, night-shift laborers, and anyone who needs feeding at 03:00), near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Cook and night-shift prep lead at a 24-hour canteen in Mexicantown Libre', N'Calle Viva Canteen (employed, not owner); informal ties to the Mexicantown Libre Neighborhood Nutrition Collective', N'Farid Subramaniam-Cissé-Mansour is compact and fast, the kind of person whose stillness feels like loaded potential — she is always either moving at controlled speed or completely stopped, no middle register. Her mother was Igbo-Swedish, her father Icelandic-Nigerian, and she has the particular combination of features that makes strangers attempt to place her and fail satisfyingly. She keeps her natural hair loose when she is off the clock and under a high, tight wrap when she is cooking; a heat-resistant polymer coating on her palms lets her handle scalding equipment bare-handed, which she deploys as casual intimidation without acknowledging she is doing it.

She is the night''s architecture — everything that comes out of the Calle Viva between midnight and 07:00 is hers, from the masa to the ofe onugbu she puts on as a nightly special that has become a neighborhood institution. She runs her kitchen like a small military state: loud, direct, no cruelty, absolute standards. She has fired people for plating sloppily and hired people she found crying in the alley behind the dumpsters. She has opinions about everything and delivers them without meanness but also without softening, which some people call rude and she calls efficient.', N'Social hub and community pulse — the canteen is a node where information moves between night-shift workers across the city. Serafina herself is a source of unfiltered neighborhood intelligence and a potential quest-giver when something goes wrong with a regular customer she has come to protect.', N'', N'Heat-resistant polymer dermal coating on both palms. Olfactory enhancement (mild, professional grade) for ingredient assessment. No cosmetic mods.', N'Arrives at 23:00 for handoff from the evening crew, runs prep and service through the night, handles the dawn rush of transit workers coming off the early Ferrogate lines, and is out by 08:00. Sleeps from 09:00 to 17:00 in the small apartment above a tortillería three blocks away.', N'Farid Subramaniam-Cissé-Mansour, 162cm tall, compact muscular build, deep warm golden-brown skin with luminescent bronze undertones blending South Asian, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. High prominent cheekbones with angular jawline definition, full expressive lips, warm dimensional facial planes. Warm brown eyes with amber flecks. Long deep brown hair with bronze undertones in loose waves, pulled back with heat-resistant cloth. Fine faded burn scars visible on knuckles, polymer-coated palms with subtle iridescent sheen. Concentrated expression, economical posture. Wearing dark cargo pants, muted gray-green reinforced apron, white t-shirt, steel-toed boots. Standing in a modern GLMZ restaurant kitchen under warm amber and cool blue task lighting, hands positioned at ready, controlled power in her stance. Photorealistic, cinematic, professional kitchen environment, gritty neo-noir urban aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'South Asian (54.2%) with Middle Eastern (27.5%) and Sub-Saharan African (18.3%) ancestry, creating a striking polychromatic phenotype characteristic of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Her features reflect this rich genetic blend: South Asian ancestry dominates in her prominent, high cheekbones and deep orbital structure; Middle Eastern heritage contributes angular definition to her jawline and nose bridge; Sub-Saharan African ancestry enriches her facial architecture with full, expressive lips and warm dimensional planes across her face. The synthesis creates a uniquely multifaceted appearance.', 162, 58, N'Compact and densely muscled, with the economical frame of someone who moves through space with purpose. Shoulders broad for her height, core visibly conditioned from years of standing kitchen shifts. No wasted volume.', N'Deep brown with natural bronze undertones', N'Loose waves when off-duty; wrapped tight in a high, heat-resistant cloth during shifts', N'Long (mid-back when unwrapped)', N'Warm brown with amber flecks near the pupil', N'Deep warm brown with rich golden-bronze undertones—the result of South Asian melanin expression layered with Sub-Saharan African warmth, further deepened by Middle Eastern heritage. Her complexion has a luminescent quality in certain light, appearing to shift between deep honey and subtle bronze depending on angle and illumination.', N'Clear, unlined despite her age, with a faint scar tissue pattern across her knuckles from decades of kitchen work before the polymer coating. Her expression defaults to concentration; she does not smile easily but when she does it reaches her eyes. Facial structure reflects South Asian prominence in cheekbone height and orbital depth, enriched by Middle Eastern angularity in jawline definition, with Sub-Saharan African fullness evident in her lips and the warm dimensionality of her facial planes.', N'Both palms show a subtle iridescent sheen where the heat-resistant polymer coating has been applied — catches light with a faint opalescent quality when her hands are under kitchen lighting. The coating is seamless with her natural skin. No other visible cybernetic work.', N'Economical and deliberate. She does not gesture unnecessarily. When stationary, she appears coiled — weight balanced, ready to move. When cooking, her movements are efficient and fast but never rushed; there is no wasted motion. She has a habit of holding her hands slightly out from her body, palms forward, a gesture that reads as both openness and controlled power.', N'During shifts: practical Tier 3-4 restaurant wear — dark, loose-fit cargo pants with deep pockets, reinforced apron in muted gray-green, steel-toed slip-on boots (Danner, well-maintained). White t-shirt or thin long-sleeve under the apron depending on kitchen temperature. No jewelry during work. Off-duty: simple layered clothing, well-fitted but not fashionable — dark jeans, oversized sweaters in earth tones, a long canvas coat that has seen years of use. Favors natural fabrics and neutral colors. Carries a small shoulder bag with her kitchen knife roll.', N'She has been skimming a small amount from each night''s ingredient budget — not for herself, but feeding it into a down-payment savings account she has never told the canteen owner about. She intends to make an offer on the lease. She is terrified of being discovered before she can.', N'Blunt and economical with a rich arsenal of Igbo and Icelandic oaths; uses food as the primary lens for metaphor', N'Rapid-fire when in the kitchen, surprisingly measured and slow when she sits down with someone', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'farid_subramaniam_ciss_mansour');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67a-7170-bf23-7948e4891cf2', N'Gbenga Ibarra-Haraldsen', N'Gbenga', N'', N'Ibarra-Haraldsen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 55, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, Grand Corridor, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Rehabilitation specialist and prosthetics fitter at Aurochs Medical Complex, Tier 3', N'Aurochs Medical Complex (employed, 22 years); informal mentor network for prosthetics technicians citywide', N'Gbenga Ibarra-Haraldsen is a tall man gone slightly soft at the middle, with warm dark brown skin and close-cropped silver hair he''s never bothered to dye back. His left arm from the elbow down is a prosthetic of his own specification — matte titanium with exposed cable routing he has never covered because, as he says, patients respond better to a fitter who knows what it feels like to be fitted. The arm has three additional micro-articulation points beyond standard and can rotate 340 degrees at the wrist, which he uses occasionally to make a point during consultations. His voice is deep and slightly raspy from a youth spent breathing Tier 1 air before his scholarship to Aurochs. His office is a controlled chaos of patient files (physical and digital), half-assembled prosthetic components he''s modifying for specific cases, and a small shrine gray zone he maintains to the building''s resident E.L.F., which staff call Old Hinge.

Gbenga Ibarra-Haraldsen is the kind of man who remembers every patient''s name and the name of the person who brought them in. He''s been at Aurochs for twenty-two years, long enough to have opinions about every policy change and enough institutional credibility that people mostly let him voice them. He is not idealistic — he knows exactly what compromises Aurochs makes — but he has calculated that he does more good inside the system than outside it. This calculation keeps him up some nights. He has a fondness for very bad jokes that he delivers with absolute sincerity, and a habit of touching the joint of his prosthetic arm when he''s troubled, a motion so habitual he no longer notices it.', N'Institutional insider who can provide legitimate access to Aurochs; quest giver for cases that fall outside what the system will officially handle; moral complexity figure who represents pragmatic compromise; potential source of medical-grade components or documentation', N'', N'Left arm prosthetic (self-specified, titanium, 340-degree wrist rotation, enhanced micro-articulation, haptic feedback at all finger joints); mild cochlear enhancement for frequency sensitivity (helps detect mechanical resonance issues in augmentations by sound)', N'Odran arrives at Aurochs at 07:30 and spends mornings in fittings and calibration sessions. Afternoons are split between follow-up rehabilitation appointments and unauthorized modification work on prosthetics for patients whose coverage doesn''t technically include customization. He eats lunch at the same corner of the staff cafeteria every day.', N'Gbenga Ibarra-Haraldsen, tall silver-haired man in his 60s with warm medium-dark tan skin blending East Asian, Southeast Asian, African, and Hispanic heritage features. High cheekbones with subtle angularity, broad nose base, deep laugh lines. Worn thin scar along right jawline. Left arm prosthetic from elbow down—matte titanium with exposed geometric cable routing and cyan-glowing haptic feedback nodes at finger joints. Standing in listening posture, weight slightly forward. Wearing matte navy lab coat over simple grey shirt and black pants, quality orthopedic shoes scuffed from use. Thin worn ring on right ring finger. Behind him a neo-noir workshop or laboratory setting, 2200s aesthetic, warm ambient lighting catching the prosthetic''s metallic surfaces. Slight haze of disinfectant and solder fumes. Patient, attentive expression. Photorealistic, cinematic lighting, grounded professional atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Complex Pan-Pacific diaspora with dominant East Asian (44.7%) ancestry blended with significant Hispanic/Latin American (26.1%), Sub-Saharan African (14.5%), and Southeast Asian (13.6%) heritage, with trace Indigenous American (1.1%) ancestry. Genetic admixture reflects GLMZ population patterns with strong East and Southeast Asian phenotypic expression tempered by African and Latin American features.', 188, 89, N'Tall and broad-shouldered, softened at the middle with age but still solid-framed. Carries himself with the ease of someone comfortable in his own skin despite the weight redistribution of middle age.', N'Silver-gray, natural', N'Close-cropped, neat but deliberately unadorned', N'Short', N'Dark brown, warm', N'Medium-dark tan with warm golden-brown undertones from East and Southeast Asian heritage deepened by Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Richer concentration across cheekbones and jawline, lighter across temples and inner forearms. Overall complexion warm and approachable despite the depth of pigmentation.', N'Weathered but well-maintained. High cheekbones with subtle angularity from East Asian heritage softened and broadened by Southeast Asian and African ancestry features. Nose with slight bridge prominence from East Asian heritage, wider at the base reflecting African and Indigenous American ancestry. Deep smile lines around his mouth and eyes characteristic of someone who has spent decades listening. The face of someone who has lived richly. A faint scar runs along his right jawline, thin and old. His expression defaults to patient attention.', N'Left arm prosthetic from elbow down: matte titanium with exposed cable routing in geometric patterns. The prosthetic has visible servo joints at wrist and finger bases. Wrist joint rotates visibly to 340 degrees. Haptic feedback nodes glow faintly cyan at the base of each finger when active (during fine work). His right ear shows a barely-visible subdermal port behind the lobe — cochlear enhancement interface. He wears no covering or cosmetic sheath on the prosthetic arm.', N'Stands with his weight slightly forward, a listening posture. Moves deliberately, without hurry. His left arm hangs naturally — he has learned to compensate for its mechanical nature by never moving it awkwardly. Frequent unconscious gesture: his right hand touches the joint where his prosthetic meets his residual limb, a self-soothing motion that grounds him when he''s thinking hard. His gait is steady and measured, the walk of someone who spends all day on his feet.', N'Tier 3 professional-practical. Typically wears a matte-finish lab coat (navy or charcoal) with deep pockets, worn over clean neutral clothing — grey or black pants, simple long-sleeved shirt in muted colors. The coat is functional, not fashionable, with multiple small customizations (reinforced pockets, hidden cable clips). Footwear is quality orthopedic shoes, scuffed from daily use. No jewelry except a thin band on his right ring finger — old, well-worn, never removed. His clothes smell faintly of solder and disinfectant. He dresses for function and durability, not status.', N'', N'Warm institutional language; uses medical terminology comfortably but translates it automatically for patients; occasional dry wit delivered deadpan', N'Slow and deliberate, like someone who learned to take up appropriate space after years of being too deferential', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gbenga_ibarra_haraldsen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67e-7ae9-a801-79605bb4f5a4', N'Hakan Appiah', N'Hakan', N'', N'Appiah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Ferment Quarter — permanent residency at the venue called ''Slag'', near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'sound sculptor and DJ, Ferment Quarter fixture', N'Independent; informal mentor to dozens of younger artists; Palladian Corporation pays him a venue subsidy he rationalizes constantly; The Ferment', N'Hakan Appiah is a big man going soft at the middle in the way of someone who was once physically imposing and no longer cares to maintain it. His skin is a deep umber, his head shaved close except for a strip of silver-threaded locs he keeps pulled back. His eyes carry patterned irises — a Helix Biosystems cosmetic mod from his Tier 3 days, concentric rings of gold and charcoal — that he chose to keep even after the money ran out, because he thinks they make him look like a prophet and he finds this privately amusing. His hands are enormous and dexterous, always moving, tapping rhythms on whatever surface is near.

He is warm in the manner of a man who has made peace with most of his disappointments, which makes him either genuinely wise or dangerously comfortable depending on who you ask. He builds sound sculptures — physical installations of salvaged materials that produce music when air, heat, or electrical current moves through them — and he DJs the late sets at Slag three nights a week, mixing generative compositions with field recordings he collects obsessively from across the city. He is the unofficial historian of the Ferment Quarter''s sound scene, having watched it transform from genuine underground to semi-curated Palladian ''authenticity experience'' with the sad clarity of someone who remembers the original thing.', N'Information source and community anchor — he has heard everything that has happened in the Ferment Quarter for fifteen years; quest giver for lost art, missing persons, venue-related trouble; moral compass character who asks uncomfortable questions gently.', N'', N'Patterned irises (gold/charcoal concentric rings, Helix Biosystems cosmetic). Sub-dermal vibration sensors in his palms — allows him to feel sound frequencies physically, purchased secondhand and imperfectly calibrated.', N'Arrives at Slag by mid-afternoon to tend his sound installations, accepts whoever wanders in to talk, sets up for the night''s performance, DJs until the early hours, takes the long walk home through Ferment Quarter recording ambient sound on his personal rig.', N'Hakan Appiah, 188cm tall dark-skinned man with rich deep brown complexion and warm golden undertones, salt-and-pepper 3-day beard, shaved sides with single bundle of silver-threaded locs pulled back from crown. Augmented eyes with striking concentric rings of 24K gold and charcoal grey. Large elegant hands with faint geometric scarring, one hand showing old white scar across knuckles. Wearing oversized unbuttoned linen shirt (mid-chest exposed), loose charcoal trousers, heavy canvas jacket, functional reinforced boots. Single silver ring on right index finger. Middle-aged, settled athletic build, relaxed posture. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, standing in moody neon-lit studio or salvage workspace, blue-grey ambient lighting catching the gold in his iris augmentations, incense smoke faint in background, deliberate and focused presence, hands subtly in motion --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Ferment Quarter', N'local', N'The Ferment Quarter', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African ancestry (72.5%) with secondary contributions from Hispanic/Latin American (10.4%), East Asian (10.2%), and South Asian (6.9%) heritage. Features reflect this genetic composition—rich deep brown skin with warm golden undertones from the substantial African base, subtly enriched by the minor East and South Asian contributions; bone structure carries the width and definition characteristic of West African ancestry with slight angular refinement from East Asian genetic influence; facial proportions show the harmonious blend of his primary heritage with complementary secondary ancestries, evident in cheekbone prominence and jawline definition.', 188, 94, N'Large-framed, formerly athletic muscle now softened by middle age and deliberate disinterest in maintenance. Broad shoulders and thick forearms retain definition; midsection carries settled weight without shame. Hands are disproportionately large and elegant despite his size.', N'Black with silver threading', N'Shaved close on sides and back; single strip of silver-threaded locs pulled back from crown into loose bundle', N'Short (sides/back), Medium (locs strip)', N'Deep brown base with visible Helix Biosystems cosmetic augmentation: concentric rings of 24K gold and charcoal grey, perfectly symmetrical, catching light distinctly', N'Rich deep brown with warm golden undertones—luminous from Sub-Saharan African heritage as primary register, subtly enriched by minor East and South Asian genetic contribution. Neither dusty nor overly saturated; carries natural warmth without reddish cast.', N'Weathered with age and indoor-living character; creases around eyes from years of smiling and squinting at mixing boards; full beard kept at 3-day shadow, salt-and-pepper threading. Skin condition is well-maintained but unfussy — no cosmetic treatments. Cheekbones carry subtle East Asian definition; jawline reflects the width of West African ancestry.', N'Patterned irises with concentric gold and charcoal rings (Helix Biosystems, cosmetic only). Sub-dermal vibration sensors in palms are not visually apparent but create faint geometric scarring under skin on both hands if examined closely — he rarely hides them. Occasional faint blue undertone to his palms in low light when sensors are active.', N'Stands with weight settled, shoulders relaxed. Moves with deliberate slowness despite his size — no wasted motion. Hands are constantly in motion: tapping, gesturing, feeling the air. His gait is a slow prowl through any space, as if he is always listening to frequencies others cannot hear. Makes direct eye contact, speaks with long pauses. When seated at a mixing board, his entire demeanor changes to focused intensity.', N'Tier 3-4 fusion; clothes are worn well but not expensive. Typical outfit: oversized linen shirt (often unbuttoned to mid-chest), loose charcoal trousers, heavy canvas jacket with deep pockets for recording equipment. Footwear is always functional — reinforced sneakers or salvage-worker boots. No jewelry except a single silver ring on his right index finger (no visible maker''s mark). His clothes smell faintly of incense and machine oil.', N'He has been secretly recording every conversation in Slag for eight years — not for surveillance, but because he believes the Quarter''s social fabric is an art form that deserves to be archived. He has 8,000 hours of other people''s lives stored on an encrypted drive he''s never shared with anyone.', N'Rich and unhurried — mixes Yoruba proverbs (slightly misremembered), Bosnian expressions from his grandfather''s side, and the dense technical vocabulary of acoustic engineering.', N'Slow, deliberate, with long pauses that feel comfortable rather than awkward. Never rushes.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hakan_appiah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a681-70da-98ce-79ab12002805', N'Bamidele Esquivel', N'Bamidele', N'', N'Esquivel', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, specifically the Chapel of the Quiet Crossing — a converted boiler room beneath a tenement block, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Death midwife and threshold keeper at a small neighborhood hospice chapel', N'Unaffiliated — operates the Chapel of the Quiet Crossing independently, funded by community donations and a Tier 1 UBC stipend', N'Bamidele Esquivel is a large, slow-moving woman whose presence seems to lower the ambient noise of whatever room she enters. Her skin is very dark and carries a faint bioluminescent undertone — a geneware mod she got thirty years ago, meant to glow softly gold, though now the pigment has mellowed with age into something closer to candlelight. She keeps her silver-threaded hair in elaborate wraps of faded indigo cloth, and her eyes are the dusty amber of old circuit boards. She wears no jewelry except a single chain with a data locket containing the logged final heartbeats of everyone she has ever sat with at the end — over four hundred entries. She moves through the world with enormous gentleness and without hurry.

She was not always this calm. Neighbors who knew her in middle age remember a woman of ferocious opinions and a laugh that rattled windows. She still has both, but they''ve been refined into something quieter. She believes dying is the most intimate thing a person ever does, and that nobody should do it alone or afraid, and she has organized her entire life around that conviction. She has no particular theology — she works with families of every tradition and defers to their practices — but she privately believes the E.L.F.s carry the echoes of the dead in their signal patterns, and she leaves small data offerings at the chapel''s resident shrine every morning.', N'Emotional anchor and community information hub — she knows every family in a six-block radius and their histories; useful as a quest giver for missing-persons situations, family secrets, or requests to locate someone before they die; provides access to the recently deceased and their effects', N'', N'Aged bioluminescent skin geneware (gold-shifted); basic neural pain-monitoring implant that lets her read biometric distress signals in dying patients; no significant chrome', N'She arrives at the chapel before dawn to light the incense and refresh the ELF shrine''s data cache, then spends the day making home visits to the dying and their families, returning in the evening to sit with whoever is in the chapel''s two cot-beds.', N'Bamidele Esquivel, 178cm tall with substantial frame, medium-deep warm brown skin with golden and olive undertones blending Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, and South Asian ancestry. Silver-white hair with dark roots, wrapped tightly in faded indigo cloth with brass pins, extends to mid-back when loose. Dusty amber eyes with dark gold flecks. Aged gracefully with fine lines around eyes and mouth, blended facial structure showing Southeast Asian cheekbones, South Asian fullness, Latin American warmth. Faint bioluminescent glow beneath skin visible in low light, most apparent on cheekbones and forearms. Subtle ritual scarification marks on palms and inner forearms, surgical scar on left wrist. Wears worn cream linen tunic with heavy hand-dyed indigo shawl fraying at edges, loose neutral trousers, simple leather sandals. Worn silver chain with small data locket at sternum. Posture deliberate and intentional, shoulders relaxed and open, unhurried gaze. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, dim neon-ambient interior lighting, warm glow highlighting bioluminescent skin undertones, contemplative expression, standing with calm presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Hispanic/Latin American (42.9%) with significant Southeast Asian (35.3%) and South Asian (21.8%) ancestry — a genuinely diaspora-blended phenotype reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Features reflect this complex admixture: warm-toned medium-deep brown skin with subtle golden and olive undertones from the Latin American, Southeast Asian, and South Asian ancestry lines, facial structure showing the blended geometry of multiple continental origins.', 178, 92, N'Large-framed, substantial without heaviness — the build of someone who has carried weight (literal and emotional) with grace. Soft musculature, no visible tension in shoulders or neck.', N'Silver-white with dark roots beneath', N'Wrapped in elaborate sections using faded indigo cloth, wrapped tightly at the crown and secured with simple brass pins', N'Long (extends to mid-back when unwrapped, but always kept bound)', N'Dusty amber with flecks of darker gold — human baseline, no augmentation', N'Medium-deep warm brown with golden and subtle olive undertones — the blended warmth of Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, and South Asian ancestry creating a rich, unified complexion', N'Aged gracefully; fine lines around the eyes and mouth from decades of listening intently. Skin texture is smooth and cared-for. Facial structure shows the blended geometry of multiple continental origins — stronger cheekbones and browline from Southeast Asian ancestry, fuller face shape from South Asian heritage, warmth and softness from Hispanic/Latin American genetics. The bioluminescent geneware creates a faint warm golden undertone beneath the surface, most visible in low light or along the cheekbones and inner forearms — like old candlelight trapped just beneath the skin. The glow is gentle, almost imperceptible in daylight.', N'The bioluminescent undertone to her skin is the only visible augmentation — appears as a very faint warm glow in dim light, like someone lit from within by a weak bulb. The neural pain implant is subcutaneous and invisible.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness — not infirmity, but intention. She takes full steps, plants her feet carefully. Her shoulders are relaxed and open. When sitting, she settles into stillness like water finding its level. Her gaze is unhurried; she looks at people for the full duration of listening, not glancing away.', N'Simple, tactile fabrics in muted colors. A worn linen tunic in cream or soft grey, layered with a heavy indigo shawl (hand-dyed, fraying at the edges, clearly decades old). Loose trousers in neutral tones. Bare feet or simple leather sandals indoors; sturdy canvas slip-ons for street work. Her single piece of jewelry is a worn silver chain with a small data locket the size of a thumb drive, always visible at her sternum. No makeup, no adornment. Tier 3 practical, but aged with intention and care — nothing disposable about her appearance.', N'The data locket contains four hundred and twelve heartbeat logs — but one of them is not a patient. It is her own heartbeat recorded during a cardiac event three years ago that she survived alone in this chapel. She has told no one she nearly died. She has not told anyone she is scared.', N'Rich and unhurried; mixes Yoruba endearments naturally into Meridian Standard; uses a lot of water and light metaphors without being precious about it', N'Slow and deliberate with long pauses she is entirely comfortable in', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bamidele_esquivel');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a653-71f0-bbb8-79b3319647f1', N'Aditi Ergashev-Tetteh', N'Aditi', N'', N'Ergashev-Tetteh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'The Canopy — elevated walkway district above Geartown, near Lincoln and Belmont', N'Remote drone and vehicle operations specialist — rigger', N'Independent — operates through reputation only', N'Aditi Ergashev-Tetteh is compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 41, her face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and she has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct ne — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. She works as a rigger out of The Canopy, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Aditi Ergashev-Tetteh has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and she cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Malika Ivanov-Appiah is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access. Neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ICE in the brain', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Aditi Ergashev-Tetteh, 158cm compact frame with dense musculature, standing in aggressive listening posture with forward lean. Rich warm brown skin with golden-bronze undertones, reflecting Central Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian heritage. Amber-brown natural eyes, deep-set with moderate epicanthic shape, constantly tracking sightlines. Dark brown hair with premature grey threading, pulled back in tight practical braid. Weathered complexion, pronounced cheekbones and defined jawline, fine lines around eyes from screen work. Brushed steel neural interface jack visible at base of skull with raised scar tissue. Thin white surgical scar from left temple to cheekbone. Reinforced fingernails with metallic sheen. Wearing black reinforced cargo pants, grey synthetic top under weathered tan canvas jacket with rig pockets, corporate-surplus tactical boots. Slim deck-rig in shoulder holster barely visible under jacket. Economical movement, hands resting in lap. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon-lit corporate district, moody blue and amber lighting casting shadows on her features, gritty urban backdrop, professional hacker aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Canopy', N'local', N'The Canopy', N'Central Asian-dominant blend (44.5%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (27.5%) and Southeast Asian (21.4%) admixture, rounded by East Asian (3.9%) and Hispanic/Latin American (2.7%) heritage. Phenotype reflects the broad facial structure characteristic of Central Asian ancestry, combined with the warm depth and skin saturation of Sub-Saharan African heritage, tempered by Southeast Asian facial geometry and undertones. The ancestral combination creates a distinctively warm, complex mid-to-deep complexion with golden-bronze luminosity.', 158, 62, N'Compact and densely muscled, low center of gravity — shoulders broad relative to frame, core visibly defined. Built like a shock-absorber, all functional compression, no excess.', N'Dark brown with premature grey threading through — she doesn''t dye it', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid; loose strands never tolerated', N'Medium', N'Amber-brown, natural', N'Rich warm brown with golden-bronze undertones. The Central Asian base combines with Sub-Saharan African depth and Southeast Asian saturation to create a complex mid-to-deep tone with distinctive warm radiance in natural light.', N'Weathered but precisely maintained — skin unmarked by acne or negligence. Fine lines around eyes from squinting at screens. Moderate width facial structure with pronounced cheekbones and defined jawline reflecting Central Asian heritage blended with African facial contours. Expression defaults to neutral observation.', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull is the primary visible chrome. No prosthetics. Neural dampener is subcutaneous — not visible but may cause subtle electromagnetic signature near scalp if scanned. Fingernails are reinforced with subdermis plates — slightly too glossy, respond to light like polished metal.', N'Moves economically, no wasted motion. Sits with weight distributed low and centered — ready to move in any direction. Eyes constantly tracking exits and sightlines. Hands rest in lap or on table edge, never crossed or defensive. When standing, favors a slight forward lean — aggressive listening posture.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian: fitted black reinforced cargo pants with thigh pockets, grey or black synthetic tops under a weathered tan canvas jacket with internal rig pockets. Boots are corporate-surplus tactical grade, broken in to near-invisibility. No visible logos or affectation. Everything functional, nothing decorative. Carries a slim deck-rig in a shoulder holster, barely visible under jacket.', N'', N'Fast, profane, and vivid. Speaks in images — everything is a metaphor for violence or weather.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aditi_ergashev_tetteh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a71d-781e-ab07-79d6a73ec737', N'Daniush Quiñones', N'Daniush', N'', N'Quiñones', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, Geartown, near Kedzie and Division', N'Food stall operator — hand-pulled noodle and fermented broth vendor', N'Independent; dues-paying member of the Oxidian Market Vendors Guild; The Ferment', N'Daniush Quiñones is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin mapped in laugh lines and old burn scars along her left forearm from a cooking fire twenty years back. Her hair has been gene-dyed a permanent copper-gold that she wears in a thick plait down her back, and her eyes carry patterned irises — concentric rings of amber and dark brown, a cosmetic mod she saved three months of UBC stipend to afford when she was thirty. She runs her stall with the authority of a small general, keeping three pots going simultaneously, the steam rising around her like offerings to the market''s resident E.L.F., whom she calls Grandpot and leaves a small data crystal near the burner each morning.

Daniush Quiñones is warm to the point of disarming — she remembers what every regular ordered last time and will argue passionately that your body needs bone broth today, not the chili oil, she can tell by your eyes. But beneath the maternal bustle is a woman who has seen her neighborhood''s character scraped away one Tessera rezoning at a time, and who keeps a detailed mental ledger of who is eating less than they used to. She is the social infrastructure of her corner of the market, whether she admits it or not.', N'Local anchor and information hub — she knows everyone in the market by face and appetite; a reliable source of neighborhood mood, rumors, and who is in trouble. Potential quest-giver for community-level problems.', N'', N'Patterned irises (cosmetic). A basic subdermal thermometer in her palm she uses to test broth temperature — practical and cheap.', N'She arrives at her stall by 0500 to start her long-simmered broths, works until the last noodle is sold around 2100, then spends an hour reconciling her cash box and murmuring her nightly thanks to Grandpot before the walk home.', N'Daniush Quiñones, 168cm tall, mid-fifties, warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones reflecting Hispanic-East Asian-Eastern European heritage blend. Prominent cheekbones and broad face shape, laugh lines and heat-weathered features. Copper-gold long braided hair, concentric amber-brown iris modification. Faded indigo canvas apron over charcoal thermal shirt, cream linen pants, worn practical shoes. Burn scars visible on left forearm, heat-stress lines on hands. Standing in Oxidian Market vendor stall, steam rising from broth pots behind her, focused and maternal expression, economic movements, brass ring on right finger. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone market setting, warm kitchen lighting mixed with neon market ambient glow, no-nonsense working-class dignity, age and labor visible but confident. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'Hispanic/Latin American dominant (66.4%) with significant East Asian (23.8%) and Eastern European (9.8%) ancestry. Phenotype reflects the characteristic blending of Iberian, Indigenous American, and East Asian genetic influence — warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones from the Latin American base, subtle depth from Eastern European ancestry, and refined facial structure with East Asian cheekbone prominence and eye shape variation.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, muscular through the arms and back from decades of repetitive lifting and stirring. Carries weight in her torso with the settled confidence of someone who has earned every kilogram through labor.', N'Permanent copper-gold gene-dye', N'Thick, tightly braided plait', N'Long', N'Concentric rings of amber and dark brown (cosmetic iris modification)', N'Warm golden-brown with olive undertones, medium depth reflecting the dominant Hispanic/Latin American ancestry enriched by East Asian warmth and Eastern European subtle depth', N'Face mapped in laugh lines around the eyes and mouth, deep creases across the forehead from squinting over steam. Skin weathered but well-maintained. Cheekbones prominent and well-defined from the East Asian heritage component, balanced with the characteristic breadth of Hispanic/Indigenous American ancestry. Nose moderate width with subtle bridge definition. Face shape shows the softening of age and expression layered over strong underlying structure.', N'Patterned irises with concentric amber-brown rings are immediately noticeable when she makes direct eye contact. Subdermal thermometer in her left palm appears as a faint circular indentation with a thin hairline scar; visible only when she deliberately shows it or in certain light.', N'Moves with economic efficiency — no wasted motion, but not hurried. Stands with weight balanced, ready to pivot between pots. Gestures are expressive and maternal, hands often open and welcoming. When focused on a task, her shoulders hunch slightly and her entire frame narrows into concentration.', N'Tier 3 working-class practical. Worn canvas apron in faded indigo, reinforced at stress points, stained with decades of broth splatter that she does not attempt to hide — they are badges. Underneath, simple long-sleeved thermal shirt in charcoal gray to protect from steam and heat. Loose-fitting linen pants in cream, cuffed at the ankle. Worn slip-on shoes with good grip, replaced annually. No jewelry except a thin brass ring on her right ring finger — old, dented, of unclear origin. She wears a faded Oxidian Market Vendors Guild pin on her apron.', N'Her signature fermented chili base contains a mild, legal mood-stabilizer compound she synthesizes herself from foraged lake algae — she started doing it during the Geartown riot year to keep people calm, and never stopped. Nobody has ever complained.', N'Warm, declarative, peppered with food metaphors and practical Meridian street slang. Mixes Farsi endearments with Twi interjections without switching register.', N'Steady and unhurried, like someone who has all the time in the world even when the queue is ten deep.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'daniush_qui_ones');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a717-748a-885c-79ea4b5a3322', N'Kamila Haraldsen-Abdykadyrov-Arredondo', N'Kamila', N'', N'Haraldsen-Abdykadyrov-Arredondo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 40, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Meridian Station — central transit nexus, neutral ground, near State and Monroe', N'Freelance combat specialist — street samurai', N'Semi-independent — has standing arrangements with several crews', N'Kamila Haraldsen-Abdykadyrov-Arredondo is tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 40, she has the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on deman — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left her with skills and night terrors in equal measure. She works as a street samurai out of Meridian Station, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Kamila Haraldsen-Abdykadyrov-Arredondo is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who she burned last.', N'Vuk Borg-Agyeman functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on demand. Cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rings', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'GLMZ character portrait: Kamila, 183cm tall lean-muscled woman with striking high Central Asian cheekbones, broader Indigenous American face structure, and refined East Asian eye geometry. Warm medium-deep golden-tan skin, steel gray hair pulled tight in practical braid, short length. Augmented chrome iris rings with amber LED glow visible in dark eyes. Surgical scar along left temple, combat scars on knuckles, subcutaneous port visible below collarbone. Intense neutral-to-hostile resting expression, coiled efficient posture. Dressed in dark gray and black tactical gear: reinforced synth-leather jacket, articulated cargo pants, smart-fabric base layer, worn dark tactical boots. Long tactical coat. No excess jewelry, everything maintained and utilitarian. Standing in neon-lit megacity alley, LEDs reflecting off chrome implants, moody cool lighting casting shadows on angular face, neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, cinematic depth --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Station', N'local', N'Meridian Station', N'Central Asian dominant (41%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (28%) and meaningful Indigenous American (7.3%) ancestry, complemented by East Asian (10.2%), Northern European (10.8%), and Southeast Asian (2.7%) heritage. This genetic profile creates a striking phenotype: Central Asian high, prominent cheekbones and angular bone structure blend with broader Indigenous American facial proportions and Hispanic warmth. East Asian ancestry refines eye placement and adds subtle epicanthic elements. Northern European contribution appears in hair undertones and subtle skin texture. The overall effect is a warm-toned, high-cheekboned face with subtle Asian eye geometry and strong jaw definition.', 183, 71, N'Rawboned and lean with efficient musculature — no excess mass, built for speed and endurance rather than strength. Shoulders broad but not bulky. Wrists and ankles suggest long leverage rather than density.', N'Steel gray with natural ash-blonde undertones', N'Pulled back in a tight, no-nonsense braid or kept short and practical', N'Short', N'Chrome iris rings with visible thermal overlay tech — inner iris shows subtle amber LED glow when augmentation is active', N'Warm medium-deep tan with golden undertones — the result of dominant Central Asian and Hispanic ancestry blended with Indigenous American warmth and refined by East Asian and Southeast Asian genetics. Rich, defined complexion with consistent golden warmth across face and body.', N'Weathered but maintained. High, angular Central Asian cheekbones combined with broader Indigenous American facial structure and refined East Asian eye placement—eyes slightly set with subtle Asian geometry. Narrow jawline sharpened by lean musculature and Central Asian bone structure. Skin shows controlled scarring and minute implant seam lines at temple and behind ear. No excess body fat. Grooming is methodical — nails cut to functional length, minimal jewelry.', N'Chrome iris rings are immediately visible — shimmer faintly in certain light. Subdermal implant seams visible at temple and collarbone. No visible limb replacements; augmentations are subtle and internal by design. The chrome is intentionally exposed rather than hidden — a message.', N'Carries herself with coiled efficiency — shoulders loose, weight balanced on the balls of her feet. Moves with minimal wasted motion, head on a swivel. Eyes track threats automatically. Resting expression is neutral to hostile. When relaxed, there is a quality of a blade laid against a surface — still dangerous.', N'Tier 3-4 working specialist: functional combat wear in dark grays and blacks. Heavy-duty synth-leather jacket with reinforced panels and pockets for tools/gear. Articulated cargo pants with secure pockets and ankle reinforcement. Undershirt is smart-fabric base layer beneath. Footwear is tactical and broken in — non-descript dark boots with good grip. Wears a long tactical coat in winter. Minimal branding, maximum utility. Everything is maintained, nothing is flashy. The aesthetic is ''I need to move and fight'' not ''look at me.''', N'', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'kamila_haraldsen_abdykadyrov_arredondo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60d-7d94-a11e-7a106fb2d147', N'Bakhyt Novotný', N'Bakhyt', N'', N'Novotný', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 37, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ashfeld, above a legitimate print-restoration shop called Palimpsest on a narrow commerce row, near Halsted and Division', N'identity forger and document fabricator', N'Independent; has referral relationships with three separate criminal networks but belongs to none of them — deliberate policy', N'Bakhyt Novotný has the compact build of someone who has spent decades at close, fine work — slightly rounded shoulders, strong hands, a habitual squint that has become permanent even when she isn''t looking at anything. Her mother''s Guinean-Fula heritage is visible in her height (modest) and the warm reddish-brown undertone of her dark skin; her father''s Chechen-Chilean blood gave her sharply defined brow ridges and the family talent for geometry. She wears cat ears — tabby-patterned, twitching occasionally with genuine feline cartilage — which she got at age twenty-two because she thought they would help her blend in, and she was right. She also dyes her natural locs in gradient shifts from black to deep copper, redone every three weeks with obsessive precision.

Bakhyt Novotný is an artist who makes functional things. She forges identities, histories, corponation employment records, medical credentials, Tier verification stamps, citizenship documentation for people who have none or need to become someone else entirely. Her work is technically flawless. The locs, the cat ears, the warm print shop downstairs — all of it is camouflage over a person who has spent fifteen years curating other people''s fictional lives while her own has stayed very small. She is funny in a dry, almost-apologetic way that makes people feel witty by proximity. She charges on a sliding scale she will deny having.', N'Critical service provider for any character needing new identity or documentation; long-term information asset who knows secrets about everyone she has ever given a new face to; can become a target if one of her clients is found out', N'', N'Cat ears (tabby-patterned, geneware, genuine cartilage and muscle response); micro-focus ocular implants for detailed work; color-shifting hair (dye-assist nano-pigment, not full geneware)', N'Runs Palimpsest legitimately in the morning — restoration work for art collectors and archive clients — then takes the stairs to her private studio after 14:00, where the real work happens until well past midnight.', N'Bakhyt Novotný, 158cm petite woman with warm medium-brown skin blending Eastern European, Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Indigenous American heritage. Long black locs with copper gradient color-shift cascade past shoulders. Distinctive tabby-patterned geneware cat ears articulated on crown of skull with natural fur. Dark brown eyes with micro-focus ocular implant shimmer. Fine-textured complexion, gentle Southeast Asian eye shape balanced by moderate Eastern European facial planes. Economical posture leaning slightly forward. Wearing fitted charcoal turtleneck under lightweight olive linen overshirt, tailored trousers with deep pockets, worn silver ring on right index finger, simple brass bracelet. Hands muscular and calloused from precision work. Meticulous grooming, minimal jewelry, no corpo markers. Neo-noir 2220s aesthetic, standing at restoration workbench with vintage print equipment, soft workshop lighting casting subtle shadows across face, faint optical artifact shimmer visible in direct eye light. Mood: focused, quiet competence, slightly distant. Highly detailed, cinematic lighting, intricate textures on clothing and geneware ears. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfeld', N'local', N'Ashfeld', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora synthesis: Eastern European (30.6%) provides facial structure and bone depth; Southeast Asian (22.7%) contributes eye shape and cheekbone contours; South Asian (17.9%) adds warmth and skin richness; Middle Eastern (12.8%) influences brow and nose bridge; Indigenous American (10.7%) rounds proportions; Northern European (5.3%) subtle undertone. Features reflect genuine multivalent blending—no single ancestry dominates, creating harmonious synthesis of warm medium-brown skin, gentle eye shape, moderate bone structure, and balanced facial planes across multiple heritage traditions.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, with slightly rounded shoulders from decades of close precision work. Forearms and hands are muscular and calloused; her torso is lean, almost economical in its lines.', N'Natural black with gradient color-shift to deep copper, maintained with nano-pigment dye-assist', N'Natural locs, densely packed, worn loose past shoulder length', N'Long', N'Dark brown, augmented with micro-focus ocular implants (no visible LED or chrome, but slight optical artifact shimmer under direct light)', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones, reflecting blended Eastern European, Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Indigenous American heritage', N'Fine-textured, unlined despite her age—suggests careful sun avoidance or dermal maintenance. Cheekbones show gentle Southeast Asian influence balanced with moderate facial planes and defined brow from Eastern European ancestry, with warm olive-golden undertones from South Asian and Middle Eastern components. Permanent habitual squint creates shallow creases at outer eye corners. No visible scarring or blemishes; grooming is meticulous but not corporate-sterile.', N'Functioning cat ears with natural fur patterning and articulation; ocular implants detectable only as a faint optical distortion in direct light. Color-shifting hair is cosmetic (nano-pigment), not obviously augmented.', N'Moves with economical precision—no wasted motion. Habitually leans slightly forward, as though perpetually focused on close work. Hands are rarely still; fingers often trace invisible patterns on nearby surfaces. Her gaze drifts to fine detail even in conversation (seams, typefaces, imperfections). Speaks quietly; humor emerges as dry asides delivered with apologetic timing.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional with artistic sensibility. Favors layered, functional pieces: fitted turtlenecks or high-collar shirts (often charcoal, olive, or cream), lightweight canvas or linen overshirts in muted tones, tailored trousers with deep pockets. Wears a leather utility apron during print restoration work. Off-duty: vintage band tees under oversized cardigans, well-maintained but clearly worn. Footwear is always practical—soft-soled shoes or ankle boots suited for standing at workbenches. Jewelry is minimal and intentional: a silver ring on her right index finger (worn, possibly a family piece), a simple brass bracelet. No corpo insignia or status markers—deliberately anonymous.', N'She has made herself seven complete backup identities across seven different Tier levels, two of which have more documented life history than her real one. She updates them regularly. She has never had to use any of them and considers them her greatest ongoing artwork.', N'Precise and technical when discussing craft, casually warm otherwise; uses Fulani-derived endearments with people she likes; refers to documents as ''portraits''', N'Even and slightly amused, as if she can see two steps ahead of most conversations', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bakhyt_novotn');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6bc-709c-9346-7a1672240ce5', N'Debjani Ionescu', N'Debjani', N'', N'Ionescu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, Brewer''s Spine block 7 — her laundromat is called Sudsbright, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Laundromat operator and informal neighborhood matriarch', N'Independent — Sudsbright Laundromat; informal ties to the Hamtramck Enclave community council', N'Debjani Ionescu is a broad-shouldered woman whose hands are perpetually pink and slightly swollen from decades of hot water and detergent. Her natural hair is pulled into a high puff shot through with silver, and she wears reading glasses on a beaded chain her youngest grandchild made. Her skin is a deep warm brown mapped with old burn scars along her left forearm — a story she tells differently depending on who''s asking. She moves through her laundromat with the deliberate ownership of someone who has earned every square centimeter, adjusting machines by touch, greeting regulars by name before they''ve even pushed through the glass door.

Debjani Ionescu is the kind of woman who knows everything about her block not because she snoops but because people tell her things while they wait for their cycles to finish. She is warm but not soft — she will cut off a customer who disrespects her workers without blinking, and she keeps a locked panel behind the folding counter where she holds unclaimed laundry for neighbors she knows are in crisis. Her relationship with the local E.L.F. she calls Mama Sudsbright — said to inhabit the oldest washing drum on the premises — is sincere and daily. She leaves small data offerings: weather reports, old recipes in digitized formats, neighborhood gossip logs.', N'Community anchor and information hub — she knows who moved in, who moved out, whose kid is sick, who''s behind on rent. Quest giver for neighborhood-level problems. Source of warmth and grounding in a harsh setting.', N'', N'Cheaply printed left knee replacement (Tier 2 quality, aches in cold weather). No cosmetic mods — she considers them frivolous spending at her income level, though she admires them on others.', N'Opens Sudsbright at 05:30, runs the machines through the morning rush of shift workers, handles bookkeeping midday, and closes at 22:00 after her nephew takes over the counter. She eats dinner behind the counter most nights and watches the street.', N'Debjani Ionescu, 168cm tall, broad-shouldered and densely built East Asian-Eastern European-Hispanic woman, age 60+, standing in a 2226 GLMZ laundromat. Warm golden-medium skin tone with olive undertones, sun-weathered face marked by deep laugh lines and squinting creases. Natural black hair shot through with silver, pulled into a tight shoulder-length puff. Deep brown eyes showing age-wear, direct and alert gaze. Irregular pale burn scars visible on left forearm. Hands perpetually pink-tinged and calloused. Wearing full-length navy cotton pants, worn smooth cardigan, faded base layer, practical non-slip shoes. Multicolored beaded reading glasses chain visible, thin gold band on left ring finger. Posture deliberate and economical, standing with weight distributed evenly. Fluorescent laundromat lighting casting warm amber and cool shadows. Worn but meticulously clean clothing. Neo-noir utility aesthetic, working-class dignity. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Predominantly East Asian (46%) with significant Eastern European (18.9%), Northern European (17.4%), Hispanic/Latin American (10.1%), and South Asian (7.6%) ancestry — a complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend reflecting 2226 GLMZ mixing patterns. Her features show the characteristic face structure and eye shape of East Asian heritage as her primary influence, with warm golden and olive undertones from South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry blending into cooler fair undertones from Northern and Eastern European heritage, creating a rich golden-medium complexion with visible depth.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, with strong arms and a thick center earned from decades of physical labor. Not heavy, but densely built — the kind of frame that moves with purpose and doesn''t tire easily.', N'Natural black with heavy silver threading', N'High puff, tightly gathered and maintained', N'Medium (shoulder-length when released)', N'Deep brown, slightly faded at the edges from age and reading-glass dependence', N'Warm golden-medium complexion with olive and peachy undertones — the blended warmth of East Asian, South Asian, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry creating a rich mid-tone, with cooler undertones visible in inner wrist and protected areas from Northern and Eastern European heritage. Sun-exposed copper on the neck and forearms.', N'Weathered but well-maintained skin with pronounced laugh lines and forehead creases. Deep creases around the eyes from squinting. Face structure shows East Asian influence with softly rounded cheeks, refined and slightly sharpened by Eastern European bone structure. Nose bridge and structure reflect the East Asian-Eastern European blend. Her face reads as someone who has smiled often and worked harder. Minimal makeup, if any.', N'Left knee replacement visible only when she wears shorts or capris — a slightly bulkier joint line and minor color mismatch where cheaply printed synthetic material meets natural skin. She favors full-length pants and skirts, so it''s rarely seen. Movement occasionally stiffens in cold weather, particularly noticeable in early morning hours.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical motions — no wasted energy. Walks with a slight favor to her right leg on cold mornings. Her hands are always in use: adjusting, folding, gesturing. She stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders back but not rigid. Sits rarely and briefly. Her gaze is alert and direct; she makes immediate eye contact with people she knows.', N'Tier 3-4 working practical: well-maintained but budget-conscious. Favors full-length cotton or linen pants in black, navy, or earth tones. Wears cardigans or lightweight button-ups over simple base layers — layers that can be added or removed as the laundromat''s heat fluctuates. Shoes are practical, broken-in, non-slip soles. Reading glasses on a beaded chain made by her youngest grandchild — multicolored wooden beads, worn daily. A thin gold band on her left ring finger, worn smooth from decades. No jewelry otherwise. Her clothes are always clean but show subtle wear; she mends visible damage rather than replacing items.', N'Twenty years ago she reported a Ferrogate Transit supervisor to Axiom''s compliance arm for running a protection racket on Brewer''s Spine. Two people she cared about were hurt in the fallout — not killed, but broken. She has never told anyone it was her. She still leaves extra offerings to Mama Sudsbright on the anniversary.', N'Warm and direct, a mixture of Shona idiom translated into common Meridian creole and clipped Norwegian phrasing inherited from her late father''s side. Uses food metaphors constantly.', N'Unhurried, like she''s never in a rush because she''s already where she needs to be. Long sentences when she''s comfortable, short when she''s done.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'debjani_ionescu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d4-7f6b-b277-7a4320806375', N'Ewald Nazari', N'Ewald', N'', N'Nazari', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Operating out of Bronzeline, primarily works Archer''s Line and Irkalla, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Bounty Compliance Officer, private firm', N'Ferrogate Transit (mid-level bounty compliance officer)', N'Ewald Nazari is the kind of man who looks like he was assembled from spare parts that almost fit — Fula-Russian features that put his eyes slightly too far apart for comfort, a jaw heavy enough to anchor a smaller man, arms that seem to belong to someone taller. He''s not quite handsome and not quite not handsome, which he has used to his advantage his entire career: people can''t decide whether to trust him or not, and that half-second of uncertainty is his. A retractable geneware tail — calico-patterned, because his daughter picked it — curls reflexively around his ankle when he''s nervous, which he doesn''t realize he does. His right hand carries the faint subdermal seam of an older augmentation, poorly integrated, that he''s never had properly serviced.

He is a pragmatist operating in a system that requires a certain amount of violence to function and has convinced himself that locating and delivering people for financial reward is a neutral service, like freight. This works for him most of the time. What cracks it is children — he has a daughter, eight years old, and since she was born he has struggled to look at the people he picks up as anything other than someone''s something. He is not a cruel man but he can be a frightened one, and frightened men do what they''re paid to do. He worships, sincerely, the E.L.F. he believes inhabits his tracking software — he calls her Marisela and leaves voice messages for her when a skip gets away.', N'Morally complex obstacle or potential ally; can be hired, bribed, or reasoned with; knows the movement and hiding patterns of people who don''t want to be found; represents the privatized edges of law enforcement', N'', N'Geneware retractable tail (calico-patterned, cosmetic, chosen by his daughter), olfactory enhancement implant (scent-tracking, professional grade), right-hand grip augmentation (older model, poorly integrated, subdermal), neural skip-trace uplink to Bronzeline CR databases', N'Takes contract pickups through the firm''s licensed interface, spends days tracking skip locations through a combination of database work and physical legwork across Archer''s Line and Irkalla, handles his own paperwork, picks his daughter up from school on Wednesdays.', N'Ewald Nazari, tall mixed-heritage skip tracer in GLMZ, warm golden-brown skin with olive and amber undertones, angular Southeast Asian and Middle Eastern features, defined jawline, prominent cheekbones, deep hazel eyes with amber undertones set wide apart, dark brown hair graying at temples worn short and tousled, weathered sun-damaged complexion with stress lines around mouth, thin white scar along right jawline, faint stubble, calico-patterned geneware tail (orange/black/white patches) curling around left ankle, subdermal seam visible on right wrist from augmentation, broad-shouldered athletic build with left-side muscle emphasis, wearing dark charcoal cargo pants with reinforced seams and worn composite field jacket, black leather neural-link collar, heavy scuffed boots, thin wedding band on left ring finger, hand clenched in nervous habit, leaning forward with searching expression, Tier 3 street setting with neon-glow and shadow, atmospheric lighting emphasizing his mixed heritage features and cautious posture, cinematic mood --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Operating out of Bronzeline', N'local', N'Operating out of Bronzeline', N'Complexly mixed ancestry (Southeast Asian 33.8%, Northern European 18.9%, Middle Eastern 16.9%, Hispanic/Latin American 12.1%, Indigenous American 9.2%, Sub-Saharan African 9.1%) creating a striking global blend—warm golden-brown skin with olive, amber, and subtle reddish undertones, angular facial structure reflecting Southeast Asian and Middle Eastern prominence with Northern European bone structure, broad cheekbones balanced by defined jawline, wider-set eyes with characteristic warm hazel depth', 188, 94, N'Tall and broad-shouldered with a slight asymmetry—his left side carries more muscle mass from years of fieldwork, while his right arm appears marginally thinner due to the augmentation integration. Not athletic in a refined sense; built more like someone who has lived hard and physically.', N'Dark brown with early graying at the temples', N'Kept short and practical, often slightly unkempt from sweat or nervous running of hands through it', N'Short', N'Deep hazel with warm amber undertones, set slightly wider apart than average, giving his face an element of off-balance uncertainty', N'Warm golden-brown with olive, amber, and subtle reddish undertones blending Southeast Asian, Middle Eastern, and Hispanic heritage; weathered by field exposure across multiple Tier 5 zones with visible sun damage', N'Strong, angular face reflecting the Southeast Asian, Northern European, and Middle Eastern blend—prominent cheekbones with balanced lower face structure, pronounced brow ridge, slightly wider nasal bridge reflecting Middle Eastern and Southeast Asian ancestry; skin shows early sun damage and the faint tracery of stress lines around his mouth. Stubble is constant—he shaves infrequently. Small scar tissue at the right corner of his mouth.', N'The subdermal seam on his right hand is noticeable if you look closely—a faint ridge of scar tissue marking poor integration work. The calico tail is fully visible when extended, curling around his lower body. His olfactory enhancement is not visually apparent, though his nostrils flare slightly when he''s actively tracking a scent. His neural uplink has no external port or visible hardware.', N'He leans forward when listening, as if his ears are working overtime. His gait is slightly favoring his left side due to old injuries. When nervous or concentrating on a skip trace, his right hand clenches and unclenches rhythmically. He touches his face frequently—jaw, temples, corners of his mouth. His tail will curl tighter around his ankle or wrap loosely around his waist when he''s anxious, a tell he''s completely unaware of.', N'Tier 3 practical wear—synthetic blend cargo pants with reinforced seams (charcoal or dark olive), worn composite field jacket (Bronzeline-branded if he''s just come from the office, unmarked if he''s working street), understated neural-link interface collar (black leather with minimal chrome detailing). Boots are heavy-soled and scuffed, replaced every 18 months when the tracking mods wear through the soles. He wears a thin wedding band on his left ring finger—his marriage ended in 2224, but he hasn''t removed it. His daughter gave him a small handmade charm (a clay raven) that he keeps in his jacket pocket.', N'Eighteen months ago he located a skip who turned out to be a whistleblower with documentation of Axiom wage theft. He delivered her anyway. The documentation was never mentioned in the compliance proceedings. He knows what that means. He drinks more than he used to.', N'Casual and colloquial, with a professional veneer he puts on for clients and takes off immediately after. Uses Fula diminutives affectionately. Can switch to formal contractual language instantly when needed.', N'Easy and unhurried, like someone who has all the time in the world and knows it''s actually in his favor. Speeds up when telling a story he finds funny.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ewald_nazari');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f4-7f44-976e-7a50db1d2e02', N'Eloisa Olofsson', N'Eloisa', N'', N'Olofsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 14, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Apprentice fabricator, Geartown machine shop', N'Nzinga Połczyński-Aroha''s fabrication shop (family business), Geartown Apprentice Guild (junior member)', N'Eloisa Olofsson has their nickname because they have, technically, twelve fingers — a Helix Biosystems geneware expression that manifested at birth, two extra fingers on each hand, fully articulated, that their master fabricator Nzinga insists is what makes them exceptional at fine mechanical work. They are compact and wiry, with warm amber-brown skin, very short natural hair kept close to the skull, and eyes that have a faint natural golden ring around the iris — another geneware expression, unremarked-upon in Geartown. Their hands are always nicked with small cuts and stained with cutting fluid that no solvent quite removes from the cuticles.

Thandi is self-possessed in a way that reads as older than fourteen — the product of spending most of their life around adult fabricators who treated them as a colleague-in-training rather than a child. They are deeply invested in the physical, tactile reality of objects: how things fit together, why they break, what a material feels like when it''s stressed. They have limited patience for abstraction and social nuance, but they are intensely loyal to Nzinga''s shop and to the handful of people they consider their own. They have started to develop opinions about labor and wages that make the older apprentices both proud and nervous.', N'Local color for Geartown; resource for characters who need fabrication, repair, or information about mechanical systems; potential focus of a labor-dispute storyline.', N'', N'Twelve-fingered geneware expression (natural, not installed); basic haptic sensitivity mods in fingertips installed by Nzinga for the work — industrial grade, not cosmetic', N'In the shop by 06:30, bench work and component fitting until 14:00, afternoon classroom instruction (Geartown Guild provides rotating technical tutors), evening either at the shop finishing a job or at the communal meal the apprentices share in the building''s shared kitchen.', N'Eloisa Olofsson, 152cm tall compact figure with dense muscular shoulders, warm deep brown skin with golden-amber undertones reflecting East Asian-Sub-Saharan African-Pacific Islander heritage, defined cheekbones and strong jawline, dark brown eyes with golden iris rings, closely cropped black hair. Twelve-fingered hands with visible calluses and cutting-fluid stains, subdermal haptic patterning visible on palms. Wearing gray reinforced work pants stained with machine oil, black thermal undershirt, oversized heavy cotton work shirt with rolled sleeves, steel-toed work boots, leather Nzinga shop apron. Standing in industrial workshop under harsh fluorescent and work-rig lighting, slightly forward-leaning posture from bench work, hands in micro-adjustment at rest, carrying unselfconscious competence despite youthful appearance. Geartown Guild braided wristband visible. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone workshop setting, utilitarian aesthetic, gritty and functional --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Dominant East Asian ancestry (50.5%) blended with significant Sub-Saharan African (26.9%) and Pacific Islander (22.6%) heritage. This tri-continental mix produces a warm, rich complexion with golden, amber, and reddish undertones; facial structure reflects the East Asian and Pacific Islander ancestry with defined cheekbones, strong jawline, and slightly wider facial proportions; skin carries the luminosity and resilience characteristic of equatorial and tropical ancestry groups, with natural depth from Sub-Saharan African genetics.', 152, 42, N'Compact and wiry with dense musculature in shoulders and forearms developed from years of precision bench work; minimal body fat; posture slightly forward-leaning from hunching over fabrication rigs', N'Natural dark brown, almost black', N'Closely cropped to scalp, clean and functional; no styling, maintained for workshop practicality', N'Short', N'Dark brown with natural faint golden ring around iris (geneware expression)', N'Warm deep brown with golden-amber and reddish undertones, reflecting the East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Pacific Islander ancestry blend', N'Strong cheekbones and defined jawline from East Asian and Pacific Islander heritage; warm, rich complexion with natural depth and slight warmth from Sub-Saharan African ancestry; broad facial proportions balanced with sharp features; youthful but weathered from ten hours daily in workshop conditions; clear skin except for occasional minor cuts and abrasions from work mishaps; cuticles permanently stained with cutting fluid despite scrubbing; skin texture shows resilience and natural luminosity even under workshop grime', N'Twelve fully articulated fingers on each hand (two extra per hand, natural geneware expression, not obviously cybernetic but anatomically distinct); faint haptic sensitivity modification visible as barely-perceptible subdermal patterning on fingertips and lower palms under workshop lighting, industrial-grade implants that read as utilitarian rather than cosmetic', N'Naturally forward-leaning, shoulders slightly rounded from bench work posture; moves with economical precision, no wasted motion; hands are in constant micro-adjustment when at rest; walks with working-class directness, no affectation; carries themselves with the unselfconscious confidence of someone competent in their domain regardless of age', N'Tier 3-4 working class, strictly functional: reinforced canvas work pants (gray or dark blue, multiple tool pockets, stained with cutting fluid and machine oil), thermal undershirt (usually black or dark gray), heavy cotton work shirt (oversized, sleeves often rolled, pockets thick with tools and parts), worn composite-soled work boots (steel-toed, laced tight), leather work apron with deep pockets (Nzinga''s shop mark embroidered on breast); minimal jewelry except for a simple braided cord wristband in Geartown Guild colors worn on dominant wrist; no cosmetic augmentation, piercings, or fashion markers', N'They have been secretly repairing a damaged Ferrogate maintenance bot they found in a Geartown access channel — not to sell it, just to see if they can. It''s almost working. They haven''t told Nzinga because they used shop materials.', N'Technical and tactile; tends to describe everything in fabrication terms; uses ''load-bearing'' as a general-purpose adjective for important things', N'Steady, unhurried, slightly monotone until engaged — then precise and almost rapid-fire', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eloisa_olofsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e3-7892-889a-7ab947239c03', N'Hichem Calvillo', N'Hichem', N'', N'Calvillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 84, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Norwood Quiet, the Bramble (an unofficial archive space in a converted residential unit), near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Retired Axiom data archivist, now keeper of an informal neighborhood memory archive', N'Axiom Retiree Welfare (reduced pension grade); Norwood Quiet Neighborhood Council (unofficial historian role); independent', N'Hichem Calvillo is a tall, slightly stooped figure whose height is still visible in their bones even as age has curved their spine. Their skin is medium-dark, deeply lined, and they have let their hair go entirely white and grow into a loose cloud they contain with whatever is nearest — a clip, a piece of wire, once memorably a fork. Their eyes are fully augmented, both replaced in their forties for professional reasons, and they have an unusual amber-to-violet gradient iris that they chose because they liked the way light moved through it. They wear fingerless gloves always, a habit from decades of handling physical storage media.

They speak in layers, circling a point from multiple angles before landing, which people who don''t know them find maddening and people who do find deeply reassuring. They have the archivist''s particular mania for context — nothing means anything without what came before, and they will give you the what-came-before whether you asked for it or not. The Bramble is crammed floor-to-ceiling with physical and digital media: neighborhood history, personal testimonies, photographs, chat logs, voicemails, menus from restaurants that no longer exist. They collect these things with the urgency of someone racing an erasure they can feel approaching.', N'Information source, local historian, keeper of secrets that were given to them for safekeeping; the Bramble itself is a resource that could contain almost anything from Norwood Quiet''s past', N'', N'Both eyes replaced (professional grade, amber-violet gradient iris — Axiom-issued, retained on retirement); neural index port at the base of the skull (standard Axiom data-worker installation, now used to interface with the Bramble''s archive systems)', N'Keeps late hours by habit, usually found cataloguing until 02:00; mornings are slow and spent receiving visitors; afternoons are for field collection — walking the neighborhood recording ambient sounds, photographing deteriorating signage, interviewing anyone who will sit still.', N'Eighty-year-old Hichem Calvillo, tall gaunt archivist with warm deep brown skin and prominent cheekbones blending West African and Mediterranean heritage. Long white hair in loose cloud, secured with wire and found objects. Augmented eyes with amber-to-violet gradient iris, slightly iridescent. Deep facial creases, age spots, sparse salt-and-pepper stubble. Linear scarring on inner right wrist, faded temple tattoo of nested boxes, glossy burn mark on back of hand. Forward-canted posture, hands in constant motion. Wearing cream linen shirt layered with grey sleeveless vest, worn dark cuffed trousers, faded grey fingerless wool gloves stained with archive dust, comfortable scuffed shoes. Holding weather-beaten satchel with cataloguing tools and recording equipment. Faded bangle on left wrist. Standing in dimly lit archive space or humid neighborhood alley, cool archive fluorescents casting iridescent gleam off augmented eyes. GLMZ, GLMZ, documentary realism, soft warm and cool lighting contrast, archival atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Norwood Quiet', N'local', N'Norwood Quiet', N'Hispanic/Latin American (35.3%) with Middle Eastern (26.2%), Sub-Saharan African (12.9%), Indigenous American (12.0%), Eastern European (8.2%), and Pacific Islander (5.4%) ancestry, creating a complex global blend of Mediterranean, Levantine, West African, Andean, and Polynesian features', 183, 71, N'Tall and attenuated, spine curved with age but still commanding reach. Lean muscle loss apparent in the forearms and hands, which remain dexterous and calloused from decades of handling fragile media.', N'White', N'Loose cloud, restrained with whatever is at hand — clips, wire, functional objects repurposed as hair fixtures', N'Long', N'Augmented: amber-to-violet gradient iris, both eyes', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with olive-golden undertones, sun-weathered and deeply lined from eight decades and countless hours under archive lighting. The complexion reflects a multifaceted ancestry: Sub-Saharan African depth with Mediterranean warmth, Middle Eastern undertones, and subtle Andean golden notes creating a unified warm-brown palette', N'Gaunt with prominent cheekbones characteristic of blended West African and Levantine heritage, age spots scattered across forehead and temples. Deep creases around the eyes and mouth from years of concentration and speaking in careful layers. Skin texture uneven — some areas finely wrinkled, others loose. Sparse facial hair with salt-and-pepper stubble, inconsistent grooming reflecting indifference to appearance. Subtle warmth in the undertones suggests Middle Eastern and Latin American ancestry alongside African heritage.', N'Both eyes replaced with professional-grade Axiom augmentation, clearly visible as a gradient iris shifting from warm amber at the pupil to cool violet at the outer edge. The sclera is slightly iridescent in certain light. A small neural port access point visible at the base of the skull, just above the spine, covered by white hair but occasionally exposed when the hair shifts — appears as a faint metallic circle, unremarkable unless you know to look.', N'Moves slowly, deliberately, with a forward cant to the spine. Hands are constantly in motion — gesturing, sorting invisible items, adjusting glasses or hair. When seated, leans forward intently. Walks with measured steps, sometimes pausing mid-stride as if following a thought. Eyes track constantly, cataloguing, indexing.', N'Tier 4 working-class, practical and worn. Fingerless gloves always present — faded grey wool, darned at the knuckles, stained with dust and handling residue from the archive. Loose linen or cotton shirt in cream or soft grey, often layered with a sleeveless vest that has deep pockets bulging with field notes, a handheld voice recorder, small cataloguing tools. Worn dark trousers, cuffed. Comfortable, scuffed shoes suitable for neighborhood walking. A weather-beaten satchel, older than the satchel fashion cycle, holding recording equipment and archival materials. No jewelry save a faded bangle on the left wrist — something old, personal, never removed.', N'During their last years at Axiom, they were tasked with archiving data slated for deletion — and they took copies of several files they were not supposed to retain, including internal communications about a Norwood Quiet property seizure that never happened publicly because someone killed the deal. They don''t know what to do with this information and have been sitting on it for eleven years, cross-referencing it obsessively while telling themselves they''re just ''providing context.''', N'dense, layered, full of parenthetical qualifications; mixes Polish diminutives with Mongolian expressions inherited from a grandparent; uses archival terminology naturally in conversation', N'unhurried, circling, with sudden moments of startling precision', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hichem_calvillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a619-76fd-a2fb-7af7ea050de5', N'Ember Árnason-Ueda', N'Ember', N'', N'Árnason-Ueda', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 22, NULL, 60, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Unlicensed field medic and augmentation repair technician', N'Unaffiliated; known to and tolerated by most Old Harbor factions as a neutral resource; maintains careful non-alignment as a survival strategy and an ethical position he isn''t always sure he can sustain', N'Ember Árnason-Ueda is a slight young man of Ghanaian-Japanese descent who looks, at first glance, like he is in the wrong place — too young, too clean-handed, too careful with his movements for Old Harbor''s Gate 9 district. The impression lasts until you see him work, at which point it inverts entirely. He has his mother''s broad cheekbones and his father''s near-black eyes, and his hands, when they are still, have the quality of instruments waiting to be used. A fading scar runs from his left jaw to his collarbone, the only visible evidence of the incident that ended his two years of formal medical training at a Meridian Core institution.', N'Street-level moral center — his youth and incomplete training make his commitment to care feel earned rather than assumed, and he functions as a point-of-entry character who makes the consequences of the city''s systems visible through the bodies that survive them', N'', N'Tactile sensitivity amplifiers in fingertips — medical grade, salvaged from a decommissioned Meridian Core surgical suite, allow detection of pulse irregularities and tissue density variations by touch,No other augmentations by choice — he considers his unaugmented baseline a diagnostic tool and is wary of anything that might alter his sensory calibration', N'The container clinic runs on no fixed schedule because injuries don''t run on schedules. He sleeps in three-to-five hour blocks, often on a folding cot in the back of the clinic. Mornings, if they''re quiet, he updates his reference databases and does equipment maintenance. He eats at the noodle stall in front, where the owner — who knows exactly what''s behind the storage panel — charges him nothing and asks nothing. Twice a week he does what he thinks of as rounds: a walk through Gate 9''s adjacent blocks, checking in with regulars, noting who looks worse than last week. He is twenty-two years old and has the sleep debt of someone much older.', N'Ember Árnason-Ueda, GLMZ, portrait of a lean 172cm figure with warm caramel-bronze skin blending East Asian luminosity with Sub-Saharan African depth and Middle Eastern angularity; short dark brown hair close to scalp, near-black eyes with warm undertones, high prominent cheekbones, angular tapered jawline, pale undertones from sleep deprivation, faint scar from left jaw to collarbone; wearing dark matte synthweave cargo pants, fitted dark blue long-sleeved shirt, worn black synthetic jacket, grey composite boots; hands in neutral ready position with calloused fingertips; upright posture with environmental awareness in gaze; Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon-lit street setting, cool blue and amber lighting emphasizing warm skin tones, cinematic depth, mood of careful precision and street survival, moody atmospheric lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Predominantly East Asian (62.3%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (19.8%) and Middle Eastern (17.9%) ancestry; the genetic blend creates a warm, complex skin tone where East Asian luminosity meets Sub-Saharan African depth and richness, with Middle Eastern angularity defining the facial structure', 172, 62, N'Lean and wiry with minimal body fat; shoulders slightly narrow but defined through constant physical work; the build of someone who doesn''t eat regularly but moves with precision', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Short, kept practical and clean; styled close to the scalp, minimal styling effort', N'Short', N'Near-black with warm undertones, alert and observant', N'Warm caramel-bronze complexion with golden undertones; the East Asian ancestry provides luminous warmth while Sub-Saharan African heritage adds depth and richness to the tone; Middle Eastern influence creates subtle definition in the jawline and cheekbones; irregular sun exposure and sleep deprivation create a slight pallor beneath the warm undertones', N'Angular, high-boned face with prominent cheekbones showing East Asian structure enhanced by Sub-Saharan African prominence and Middle Eastern definition; slightly tapered jawline with notable facial depth; clear skin marked by the pallor of chronic sleep deprivation and minimal sun exposure; faint darkening under eyes; facial architecture represents a harmonious blend of delicate East Asian features with stronger Sub-Saharan African and Middle Eastern bone structure', N'None externally visible; medical-grade tactile sensitivity amplifiers in fingertips are subcutaneous and undetectable without close examination', N'Moves with deliberate economy of motion; posture is upright but not rigid, suggesting both medical training and street-learned caution; hands rest in a neutral ready position; eyes track details in environment constantly; walks with purpose but never hurries unless responding to emergency', N'Tier 4 working-class practical: dark matte synthweave cargo pants with multiple pockets for tools and supplies; plain gray or dark blue long-sleeved fitted shirt, sometimes rolled up during work; worn black synthetic jacket with internal pockets for equipment; no visible branding; sturdy grey composite boots broken in from heavy use; overall appearance deliberately unremarkable and functional', N'He was expelled from the Meridian Core medical program not for incompetence but because he filed a formal complaint against a senior physician who was deliberately undertreating augmentation-dependent patients to create dependency on paid maintenance contracts. The complaint was buried, his record was flagged, and the physician was promoted. Gavril has the original documentation. He doesn''t know what to do with it and is afraid that if he uses it, whatever credibility he''s built in Old Harbor will be consumed by the process.', N'Code-switches fluidly between clinical precision and Old Harbor vernacular depending on context and audience. Uses medical terminology accurately but translates it without being asked. Humor is dry and slightly dark.', N'Quick during procedures, deliberately slowed when delivering difficult information. Asks clarifying questions in rapid succession when assessing a situation.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ember_rnason_ueda');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a656-7022-a26e-7b297cd6b7f6', N'Eliseo Tofauti-Cardenas', N'Eliseo', N'', N'Tofauti-Cardenas', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 28, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, Bay 14 of the Rusted Meridian self-service garage complex on Spindle Row, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Auto and drone mechanic, Geartown independent bay', N'Independent (formerly Palladian apprentice program)', N'Eliseo Tofauti-Cardenas is lean and angular, with the kind of wiry upper-body strength that comes from torquing bolts rather than lifting weights. His skin is a warm medium brown and his hair is a close-cropped natural that he bleeds into bioluminescent blue at the tips — a cheap geneware dye job he redoes every two months, currently fading to a greenish teal at the ends. He has a Palladian corporate tattoo on his left forearm that he has partially covered with an amateur geometric overlay — the original mark of a three-year apprenticeship contract he bought out early at significant personal cost. His hands are perpetually stained and he has stopped being embarrassed about it.

He is intensely focused when working and almost incoherent when not, as if the part of his brain that manages conversation runs on whatever processing power the mechanical problem in front of him does not require. He is not unkind — genuinely not — but he will trail off mid-sentence if a sound from an engine catches his attention. He has strong opinions about Ferrogate Transit''s maintenance culture that he will share with anyone who stands still long enough.', N'Technical resource and repair contact. A way into Geartown''s informal economy. His partial Palladian history can complicate or enable stories involving that corponation.', N'', N'Bioluminescent hair-tip geneware (teal, fading). Palladian-branded haptic feedback glove on his right hand — leftover from the apprenticeship, still works, he refuses to remove it on principle. Basic retinal overlay for schematic reading (no network, air-gapped).', N'Arrives at Bay 14 by 08:00, takes whatever walk-in work the board lists, eats lunch inside the bay over whatever he is currently dismantling, and runs his own project — restoring a 2180s Ferrogate cargo hauler cab — during evening hours when paying work is done.', N'Eliseo Tofauti-Cardenas, a lean 178cm Pacific Islander-diaspora mechanic with warm deep brown skin and golden undertones, close-cropped dark hair fading to bioluminescent teal at tips. Broad Pacific Islander facial features, dark eyes with faint retinal grid overlay. Wearing faded gray Carhartt-equivalent work coveralls stained with machine oil, dark thermal undershirt, steel-toed boots. Black leather haptic feedback glove on right hand with blue circuit tracery. Oil-burn scars across knuckles and forearms, geometric tattoo overlay on left forearm. Silver chain around neck, 1-2 days stubble. Standing in GLMZ industrial workshop bay, hands active and restless, weight forward. Economical posture, unfocused gaze as if processing elsewhere. Machine oil and welding flux scents. Moody workshop lighting with blue-teal neon accents reflecting off metal surfaces and his glowing hair. GLMZ 2200s gritty aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Predominantly Pacific Islander ancestry (85.6%) with secondary influences from Hispanic/Latin American (6.4%), South Asian (5.0%), and Sub-Saharan African (3.0%) heritage. The genetic blend produces characteristic Pacific Islander bone structure and facial features—broad face, fuller features, strong jaw—with warm, melanin-rich skin that reflects the multi-regional ancestry. The darker complexion carries undertones of warmth from both South Asian and Sub-Saharan heritage, creating depth and richness typical of oceanic-diaspora populations rather than any single continental ancestry.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with concentrated wiry muscle across shoulders and forearms — the build of someone who applies precision force repeatedly rather than bulk. Minimal body fat, visible tendon definition in hands and wrists.', N'Natural dark brown at roots, transitioning to bioluminescent teal at the tips, currently fading toward greenish-teal at the very ends', N'Close-cropped natural cut, textured and even, with deliberate gradient fade applied via cheap geneware dye', N'Short', N'Dark brown with subtle retinal overlay grid visible under bright light — air-gapped schematic overlay, non-networked', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones, sun-weathered and luminous — reflects Pacific Islander genetic dominance (85.6%) with subtle warmth and depth from South Asian and Sub-Saharan heritage blending. Melanin-rich skin catches light with natural radiance characteristic of tropical ancestry.', N'Clear, unremarkable skin with permanent minor scarring on knuckles and across the back of both hands. Cuticles perpetually stained with machine oil and grease that he no longer bothers to fully clean. Stubble-beard kept at 1-2 days growth, neither maintained nor fully grown. Expression defaults to focused intensity even at rest. Broad facial structure with fuller features characteristic of Pacific Islander heritage—wider nose bridge, prominent cheekbones, substantial jaw—complemented by warm depth and richness of complexion.', N'Palladian-branded haptic feedback glove on right hand — matte black leather with faint blue circuit tracery visible at wrist seam, still functional, deliberately never removed. Bioluminescent hair tips emit faint teal glow in low light. Retinal overlay barely visible in direct light as a faint geometric grid pattern in dark eyes.', N'Stands with weight forward slightly, hands active and restless when not working — fingers unconsciously mimicking mechanical motions. Moves with economical efficiency, no wasted motion. When focused on machinery, entire body locks into stillness. When not working, appears slightly disconnected, gaze unfocused, as if processing power is allocated elsewhere. Often mid-sentence trails off if mechanical sound interrupts attention.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian — work-worn Carhartt-equivalent synthdenim coveralls in faded gray, perpetually stained with machine oil and coolant. Base layer typically a cheap thermal undershirt in dark gray or black, sleeves rolled or pushed up. Steel-toed work boots, scuffed and practical. Leather apron hung in bay, not on body. A single silver chain around his neck (no pendant) — inherited, not augmented. No jewelry. Clothes are functional maintenance gear, not fashion, but worn with unconscious confidence. Smells consistently of synthetic machine oil and welding flux.', N'The buyout of his Palladian contract was not funded by his own savings. A woman named Vesna who ran a chop operation in Geartown paid his debt in exchange for two years of off-books work modifying vehicles she did not explain the purpose of. He never asked. He finished the two years, she disappeared, and he has not thought carefully about what those vehicles were used for.', N'Technical-heavy, precise when talking about machines, vague and trailing when talking about people or feelings. Occasional Romanian phrases inherited from his Drăghici grandmother.', N'Bursts of fast, detailed explanation followed by long pauses when he loses the thread.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eliseo_tofauti_cardenas');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a607-71b6-82d9-7b2b157d751f', N'Dieter Sokolov', N'Dieter', N'', N'Sokolov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Burnside Corridor — transit hub connecting the Gray Zone to Circuit, near North Ave and Damen', N'Long-range precision fire specialist — sniper', N'Independent — operates through reputation only', N'Dieter Sokolov is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 31, there''s something unfinished about his face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone — and he makes no effort to hide it.

His entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. He works as a sniper out of Burnside Corridor, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

he is not the most talented sniper in GLMZ, but he might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Eshe Zhukov-Wiredu represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone. Pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would incapacitate', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Dieter Sokolov, lean 178cm neo-noir operative, medium tan skin with olive and golden undertones blending Eastern European, South Asian, and North African heritage. Angular face with high Slavic cheekbones, narrow tapering jaw, broader nasal bridge, deep brown eyes with warm undertones. Dark brown hair cut short with slight curl at temples. Faint white scar on left temple partially obscured by hair, pale pink chemical burn scars on right neck side, barely visible chrome shimmer around nostrils and bridge from nasal passage augmentation. Day-old stubble. Wearing dark tactical cargo pants and long-sleeve compression shirt layered under synthetic leather jacket, military-grade boots, worn canvas messenger bag. Paracord bracelet on left wrist, small black crosshair tattoo on inner wrist. Coiled, economical posture with forward lean, methodical head movement, slight hand tremors at rest. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon-lit industrial setting with rain-slicked concrete, moody blue and amber lighting catching chrome augmentations, introspective and dangerous atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Burnside Corridor', N'local', N'Burnside Corridor', N'Eastern European foundation (60.5%) with significant South Asian (19.0%), North African (14.0%), and Northern European (6.5%) ancestry — a striking genetic mosaic reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Slavic bone structure tempered by warmer South Asian and North African tones, creating an unexpected and compelling blend. High cheekbones and narrow jaw from Eastern European lineage, softened by the broader nasal bridge and warm undertones of South Asian heritage, while North African ancestry deepens his complexion with subtle golden and amber hues that catch light.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with visible musculature — the build of someone who maintains fitness out of necessity rather than vanity. Long-limbed, minimal body fat, shoulders slightly narrower than hips. There''s a coiled tension to his frame, like a spring compressed.', N'Dark brown, almost black', N'Short, practical cut — no styling product, maintained for function. Slight curl at the temples.', N'Short', N'Deep brown with warm golden undertones', N'Medium tan with olive, amber, and golden undertones — the result of Eastern European base enriched by South Asian warmth and North African depth, creating a complexion that reads as both Slavic and subtly sun-marked, with a slightly luminous quality in warm light.', N'Angular face with high, pronounced cheekbones characteristic of Eastern European heritage, a narrow jaw that tapers sharply, and a slightly broader nasal bridge reflecting South Asian ancestry. His face is striking but unrefined — skin shows minor scarring along the left temple (old wound, poorly healed), slight darkness under the eyes from chronic sleep deficit. The warmth in his undertones speaks to North African heritage mixing with Slavic bone structure, creating subtle depth across his cheeks and temples. Facial hair is kept minimal, usually a day or two of stubble rather than fully shaved or grown.', N'Chrome nasal passages — visible as faint metallic shimmer around his nostrils and the bridge of his nose where the chemical analyzer integrates with natural tissue. The chrome catches light and creates an uncanny reflection. No other visible augmentations, though the pain editor is subcutaneous.', N'He moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. His posture is slightly forward-leaning, as if perpetually tracking something. His head tracks slowly, methodically, eyes registering details. When he sits, he positions himself with clear sight lines to exits. There''s a stillness to him when focused, an absence of fidgeting or nervous energy. When not focused, he exhibits minor tremors in his hands — either from stimulant use or the edge that chronic pain-dampening creates.', N'Tier 4 pragmatist. Dark colors — charcoal, black, deep gray. Worn tactical cargo pants with multiple pockets and reinforced seams, synthetic blend that sheds dirt and dries fast. Layered tops: usually a dark long-sleeve compression shirt under a heavier jacket (synthetic leather or ballistic nylon, no visible branding). Boots are military-grade, scuffed, laces double-knotted. A worn canvas messenger bag (faded black, multiple repair patches) carries his essentials. No jewelry except a faded paracord bracelet on his left wrist. His jacket has several deep pockets and one internal pocket where he keeps dead-drop messages. Everything is functional, nothing is fashionable.', N'', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dieter_sokolov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d5-708e-a394-7b74d69d206a', N'Bariga Malhotra', N'Bariga', N'', N'Malhotra', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 9, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Blackpipe Corridor, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'truant message runner, street kid', N'Independent / loose association with Blackpipe Corridor stall network', N'Bariga Malhotra is small even for nine, with deep brown skin mapped by old scrapes and one faded chemical burn along her left forearm she got from a leaking pipe in the Blackpipe tunnels. Her hair is coiled tight and usually stuffed under a too-large knit cap she refuses to remove. Her eyes are large and very dark, permanently watchful, the way only children who sleep lightly develop. She has geneware cat-whisker sensory implants — not her choice, inherited from her mother — and they twitch involuntarily when she''s nervous, which other kids tease her about.

Bariga Malhotra runs messages between the Blackpipe fences and the Narrows stall-vendors, earning a few Φ per run. She''s illiterate in formal script but has memorized dozens of symbols by shape and can navigate the Corridor''s maze of maintenance corridors better than most adults. She laughs easily and loudly but goes very quiet the instant something feels wrong — other runners have learned to watch her like a weather vane. She has a fierce attachment to a cracked ELF shrine wedged in a drainage alcove that she tends with water-drop offerings every morning.', N'Local color and unexpected information source; she has overheard things she doesn''t understand but can repeat verbatim. Potential quest hook for anyone trying to reach isolated Narrows contacts.', N'', N'Inherited cosmetic geneware: sensory whisker filaments (fine, barely visible, silver). No voluntary augmentations.', N'Wakes before dawn in a shared squat with three other kids, runs messages through morning market hours, spends afternoons near the ELF shrine or trailing older runners to learn routes.', N'Bariga Malhotra, 125cm tall wiry street kid, warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones blending South Asian, Southeast Asian, East Asian, and Central Asian heritage. Angular Pan-Asian face with defined cheekbones, very dark brown nearly-black eyes with subtle East Asian fold, natural deep black hair hidden under oversized charcoal knit cap pulled low. Faded chemical burn scar on left forearm, silver sensory whisker filaments along cheekbones visible in light. Wears two-sizes-too-large faded gray tech-fabric hoodie, mismatched compression layer, torn cargo pants cuffed unevenly, worn synthetic sneakers held with e-tape. Copper wire talisman looped around wrist. Crouching pose, head tilted as if listening, perpetually alert expression. Dark industrial setting, neon glow from distance, moody GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, shadow and ambient light catching silver augmentations --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Predominantly South Asian (63.8%) with significant Southeast Asian (15.8%), East Asian (11.8%), and Central Asian (8.6%) ancestry. Her features reflect a rich Pan-Asian blend where South Asian bone structure—pronounced cheekbones and defined facial geometry—merges seamlessly with Southeast Asian refinement and East Asian eye shape. Central Asian heritage adds subtle width to her face and delicate nose bridge. The combination creates a distinctive look: warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones, dark expressive eyes with characteristic East Asian lid structure, and angular features that speak to generations of mixed continental heritage.', 125, 24, N'Small-framed and wiry, undersized even for her age. Lean muscle from constant running through tight spaces, no body fat reserves. Proportionally long limbs for climbing and ducking.', N'Natural deep black', N'Tightly coiled, worn in close braids underneath a perpetually oversized charcoal knit cap she keeps pulled low', N'Short (hidden)', N'Very dark brown, nearly black', N'Warm medium-golden brown with olive undertones, deepening toward amber in sunlight. The blend of South Asian warmth with Southeast Asian subtlety creates a rich complexion that shifts between warm bronze and cooler olive depending on light angle and environment.', N'Angular face with defined cheekbones reflecting Pan-Asian heritage, the South Asian prominence softened by Southeast Asian refinement and Central Asian delicacy. Dark expressive eyes set with subtle East Asian epicanthic fold, creating characteristic depth. Skin shows wear—old scrape marks on knees and hands, faded dirt permanent in the creases of her palms. Perpetually alert expression, eyes tracking movement with the intensity of inherited geneware sensory enhancement.', N'Fine silver sensory whisker filaments barely visible along cheekbones and temples, inherited geneware from her mother. They twitch noticeably when she''s nervous or processing environmental stimuli.', N'Moves with practiced economy—crouching, sliding, climbing rather than walking. Head held slightly tilted, as if always listening. Goes from loose and laughing to perfectly still and silent in milliseconds when danger is sensed. Fidgets with the brim of her cap when anxious.', N'Tier 5 street kid. Oversized knit cap (charcoal, holes patched with thread). Mismatched compression layer under a faded gray tech-fabric hoodie two sizes too large, stolen or scavenged. Cargo pants with more pockets than seams intact, one leg cuffed shorter where a burn melted the original hem. Worn synthetic sneakers held together with e-tape, sole separating at the toe. A length of cord around her waist holds a water bottle and a small shrine-maintenance kit. No jewelry except a twisted bit of copper wire looped around her wrist—a talisman or marker.', N'She once accidentally carried a message that got a stall vendor arrested by Ferrogate Transit enforcers. She doesn''t know what the message said but she knows the vendor disappeared after she delivered it. She avoids that block.', N'sparse, functional, Corridor slang; drops articles often; uses spatial metaphors constantly', N'fast bursts then sudden silence; breathes mid-sentence when excited', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bariga_malhotra');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a71b-7d6d-aeaf-7bc4a1acb45a', N'Halldora Sokolov', N'Halldora', N'', N'Sokolov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 11, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone (operates between Brewer''s Spine and Copperhead), near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Truant network runner — message courier for the Gray Zone''s informal economy', N'Independent; loosely connected to Brewer''s Spine informal market traders', N'Halldora Sokolov is small for her age, which she treats as professional equipment. She has her mother''s deep brown skin and her father''s pale Icelandic freckles scattered across her nose and cheeks in a pattern that looks almost deliberate, like someone scattered rust-colored seeds. Her hair is cropped close on one side and grows in tight coils on the other — not a style choice, the result of a geneware dye-job gone sideways that fused color-cycling pigment into about forty percent of her scalp. The affected half cycles through muted greens and grays, which she has decided is actually cooler than what she originally paid for. She moves through the Gray Zone''s maintenance corridors and pipe-crawl shortcuts with the confidence of someone who has mentally mapped every possible escape route, because she has.

She is not a happy child but she is an effective one. There is a watchfulness in her eyes that belongs to someone twice her age, and she has learned to keep her observations private until they are useful. She is politely transactional with most adults, reserving genuine warmth only for the handful of people who have proved they won''t exploit it. She has a fierce and private devotion to a local E.L.F. she calls the Creak-God — a spirit she believes inhabits the Brewer''s Spine maintenance tunnels — and leaves it small data offerings (recorded ambient sounds, mostly) wrapped in old wire.', N'Local color and unexpected information source; players may hire her as a guide through the Gray Zone''s hidden passages; she knows things she hasn''t told anyone yet.', N'', N'Partial cosmetic geneware — color-cycling hair pigment (malfunctioning, affects only left side of scalp). No chrome.', N'Picks up message packets at the Creak-God''s shrine each morning, runs them through tunnel routes she''s memorized, collects Φ2-5 per delivery. Eats whatever the market stalls leave at end of day.', N'Halldora Sokolov, young teen courier, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Striking warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, angular high cheekbones, alert deep brown eyes. Asymmetrical hair: left side cropped close with muted green-gray color-cycling geneware malfunction, right side natural black tight coils shoulder-length. Slight wiry build, 135cm tall. Faint chemical burn scar on left temple. Worn mismatched functional clothing: patched cargo pants, oversized gray thermal underlayer, synth-leather jacket with wire loops, mismatched shoes. Homemade messenger bag from industrial netting. Twisted wire bracelet on left wrist. Posture tense and alert, moving through dimly-lit industrial maintenance corridor with LED strips casting cool blue light. Minor calluses on hands, scrapes on knees from crawling. Underground urbanism aesthetic, neon glow from distant signs reflecting off wet metal surfaces. Mood: focused, wary, ready to move. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone (operates between Brewer''s Spine and Copperhead)', N'local', N'the Gray Zone (operates between Brewer''s Spine and Copperhead)', N'Complex diaspora phenotype: 51% Eastern European foundation blended with 21% Sub-Saharan African, 14% Indigenous American, 10% Middle Eastern, and minor Central Asian and Hispanic ancestry. This creates a warm deep brown complexion with golden undertones—a luminous result of African-Eastern European genetic mixing. Features include angular cheekbones and refined bone structure from Indigenous American heritage, subtle Middle Eastern nose and eye geometry, and the characteristic warmth of melanin expression across an Eastern European facial architecture. The overall effect is striking and uncommon: a harmonious blend where no single ancestry dominates the phenotype.', 135, 28, N'Slight and wiry for her age, all lean muscle from constant movement through maintenance crawlways. No fat reserves — undernourished but functionally strong.', N'Natural black with color-cycling geneware malfunction: left side cycles through muted greens and grays, right side natural tight coils', N'Asymmetrical undercut — cropped close on left (augmented) side, tight coils shoulder-length on right (natural) side', N'Short on left / Medium on right', N'Deep brown, alert and calculating', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones—a rich, luminous blending of Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European ancestry. Skin glows despite malnutrition, displaying the characteristic warmth that emerges from African-Eastern European genetic mixture.', N'Angular, defined cheekbones with refined bone structure reflecting Indigenous American and Eastern European heritage, subtly refined by Middle Eastern features. Skin shows minor scrapes and calluses from pipe-crawling. Warm brown complexion unmarked by freckling. Minimal facial hair. No makeup.', N'Left scalp geneware with color-cycling malfunction (cycles muted green-gray). No chrome or visible cybernetics. Augmentation is partially cosmetic, partially consequence of failed modification.', N'Moves with economical precision through tight spaces — shoulders slightly forward, head alert. Sits low and balanced, ready to move instantly. Makes minimal eye contact with strangers but when she does, her gaze is penetrating and assessing. Walks quietly, avoids drawing attention. Fidgets with wire or small objects when still.', N'Tier 5 functional wear — patched cargo pants (multiple pockets for message packets), oversized thermal underlayer in faded gray, worn synth-leather jacket held together with repurposed wire loops. No logos or brand markers. Shoes are mismatched but functional (one synthetic, one fabric). Carries a homemade messenger bag made from repurposed industrial netting and metal clasps. Everything is repair-patched and weathered from tunnel use. No jewelry except a single length of twisted wire looped around her left wrist.', N'She knows the location of a dead courier''s stash — Φ340 and a sealed data chip — hidden behind a pipe junction in tunnel 7-G. She hasn''t touched it in six months. The courier was twelve. She keeps delivering past that junction every day.', N'Sparse and precise. Drops articles. Uses distance and direction like currency — ''two lefts and a drop, watch the third rung.'' Avoids the word ''home.''', N'Quick and flat, information-dense. Slows down only when she''s lying or afraid.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'halldora_sokolov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a704-7bbd-bb90-7bda5fd11434', N'Farai Karimi', N'Farai', N'', N'Karimi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor, near Wacker and State', N'Graffiti artist, propaganda runner, and reluctant courier for competing factions', N'Nominally unaffiliated; practically entangled with three separate Old Harbor-to-Circuit faction networks he has not named to each other; has community loyalty to Old Harbor as a place rather than to any organizational structure within it', N'Farai Karimi is a small, wiry Mexican-Dutch young man who moves through Old Harbor''s infrastructure with the practiced fluency of someone who has been climbing, ducking, and sprinting these specific streets since he was eight years old. He is not conventionally remarkable to look at—medium brown skin, dark eyes that shift between alert and distant in a way that unsettles people who notice it, hair that has been various colors and is currently a faded copper-orange growing out at the roots. His hands are perpetually stained with pigment compounds in colors that shift weekly, and his forearms carry a constellation of small scars from wire, glass, and one memorable encounter with a security drone''s retractable blade that he shows people with more pride than the injury warrants.

He is one of the most technically accomplished aerosol and projection artists in Old Harbor, which is a neighborhood that takes that distinction seriously. His work appears on infrastructure walls, drainage tunnels, the underside of elevated transit lines, and twice on the exterior of a building whose owners have never been able to figure out how he accessed the surface. His style is immediately recognizable—dense, layered imagery that reads as pure aesthetic chaos from a distance and resolves, up close, into specific political content: faces of disappeared people, corporate liability data encoded in patterns, maps of surveillance dead zones that shift as the surveillance does. He doesn''t sign his work. Everyone knows it''s his.

What complicates his life is that his courier skills—he can move packages through Old Harbor without electronic trace, using a mental map of the neighborhood''s blind spots that he built while scouting locations—have attracted the attention of multiple factions who find his services useful and who have not been fully honest with each other about retaining him. He is currently working, with varying degrees of awareness of the conflict of interest, for three separate organizations. He is nineteen. He is beginning to understand this situation is not sustainable and has not yet figured out what to do about it instead.', N'Ground-level witness and embodiment of the city''s overlooked; Tomás represents the way systems extract value from people who are trying to do something real, and his arc asks whether integrity is possible when every resource you have is also a tool someone else wants to use', N'', N'No corporate or licensed augmentations,DIY pigment-mixing implant in right palm: a small reservoir and mixing chamber that allows color-matching and compound testing; built by a the Gray Zone tinkerer from salvaged cosmetic-industry components, technically an augmentation but not recognized as one by any registry,Faint bioluminescent ink traces on his forearms from a projection-art experiment that partially incorporated itself into his skin; not intentional, not removable, occasionally glows faintly in specific light conditions', N'Sleeps in rotating locations—three or four spots in Old Harbor he cycles between, never more than two consecutive nights in the same place. Mornings are for scouting: he walks, observes, notes changes in surveillance coverage and infrastructure access. Afternoons are for work, legitimate and otherwise; courier jobs run on short notice and he keeps himself available. Nights are for making things. He eats street food when he remembers, which is not as often as it should be. He has a battered sketchbook he''s kept for four years that he would do significant violence to protect.', N'Farai Karimi, lean East African-Middle Eastern heritage woman with rich warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones, prominent angular cheekbones and defined jawline, dark brown eyes with tactical intensity, faded copper-orange hair with dark roots at medium length worn unkempt, 168cm tall wiry build. White scar constellations across inner forearms, faint cyan-green bioluminescent branching patterns on forearms visible in darkness, chronic pigment staining on right hand. Wearing distressed oversized button-up over fitted base layer, worn reinforced cargo pants with paint stains, modified Vorn Hi-Tops, copper wire wrapped around left wrist. Hunched posture from years climbing vertical infrastructure, positioned near elevated surfaces, hands actively working with small objects. GLMZ aesthetic, dim neon alleyway lighting with cyan-green accent, moody tactical atmosphere, photorealistic, dramatic side-lighting emphasizing bioluminescent marks --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'East African-Middle Eastern diaspora with American indigenous influences: Sub-Saharan African (43.9%) and Middle Eastern (40.7%) form the dominant genetic core, with Hispanic/Latin American (8.3%) and Indigenous American (7.1%) contributing secondary characteristics. The combination produces a rich, warm medium-brown skin tone with golden-amber undertones from the Middle Eastern ancestry, deepened and warmed by Sub-Saharan heritage. Facial structure reflects strong East African bone definition—prominent, sharp cheekbones and defined jawline—softened and rounded slightly by Middle Eastern cheek fullness. Nose shows moderate width with defined bridge prominence characteristic of the blend. The overall effect reads unmistakably African and Middle Eastern, with the Indigenous American ancestry subtly visible in skin warmth depth and slight feature softening.', 168, 58, N'Wiry and lean, all fast-twitch muscle and minimal fat—built for climbing and sustained movement rather than strength. Chest narrow, shoulders compact, limbs long relative to torso. The build of someone who has spent eleven years navigating vertical infrastructure.', N'Faded copper-orange with dark brown roots showing approximately 3cm of growth', N'Medium length, deliberately unkempt, often pushed back or tied with wire or fabric scraps; shows signs of recent home-dye work with uneven saturation', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, nearly black, with a quality of constant calculation that makes eye contact feel tactical rather than social', N'Rich warm medium-brown with golden-amber undertones—luminous and deep from the blend of Sub-Saharan African and Middle Eastern heritage. Lighter on inner wrists and underarms revealing deeper baseline tone. Faint freckling across shoulders and upper back from genetic blend.', N'Strong, angular cheekbones and defined jawline from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, balanced by slight fullness in cheeks from Middle Eastern heritage. Moderately prominent nose with defined bridge reflecting East African-Middle Eastern blend. Skin condition varies by week—generally clear but with occasional irritation from pigment exposure and inconsistent sleep. Perpetually tired expression around the eyes.', N'Right palm displays a small, barely-noticeable subcutaneous bulge at the base of the hypothenar eminence where the DIY pigment-mixing implant sits; skin around it slightly discolored and occasionally shows faint scarring from the installation. No visible external ports or indicators. The bioluminescent forearm traces read as either ritual scarification or experimental tattoo work to casual observers; their true nature as incorporated bioink is not immediately apparent. No licensed augmentation markers visible.', N'Moves with economic precision—no wasted motion, weight distributed for rapid directional changes. Walks with slight forward lean, shoulders slightly rounded from hours spent in cramped spaces and hunched over detail work. When still, very still; when moving, transitions between states are abrupt. Tends to position self near exits or elevated positions. Makes deliberate eye contact only when establishing territory or assessing threat; otherwise maintains observational distance. Hands rarely idle—sketching, color-testing, manipulating small objects.', N'Tier 4-5 functional aesthetics. Worn cargo pants or modified jeans with numerous pockets and reinforced seams, often bearing paint stains that have become part of the visual design. Layered tops—typically a fitted base layer under an oversized, deliberately distressed button-up or windbreaker with modified ventilation and concealed cargo capacity. High-visibility elements mixed with matte colors; some pieces appear to have reflective paint applied deliberately to render visible or invisible depending on context. Scuffed, extremely practical shoes (modified Vorn Hi-Tops with reinforced ankle support and grip-pattern customization for wall climbing). Minimal jewelry except for a length of copper wire wrapped multiple times around left wrist—functional and symbolic. No corporate branding. Everything shows evidence of constant wear and frequent repair; the overall effect is of someone who treats clothing as infrastructure rather than presentation.', N'The surveillance dead zones he encodes in his murals are not just information for the neighborhood—he has been systematically updating them for one of his faction contacts, believing it to be mutual aid work. He recently learned that contact has been selling the updated maps to a security contractor. He has not yet acted on this information because acting on it means acknowledging he was used.', N'Dense with Old Harbor slang and art-community jargon; code-switches rapidly; uses spatial and color-based metaphors for emotional states; vocabulary expands noticeably when he''s talking about something he genuinely cares about', N'Fast and elliptical in casual mode, dropping sentence subjects and connective tissue; slows significantly and becomes more complete when explaining something important; has a habit of starting sentences over when he finds a better angle mid-thought', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'farai_karimi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6fc-75da-b3bf-7bf5037e3838', N'Dobromila Kjellberg', N'Dobromila', N'', N'Kjellberg', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Interchange, Ferrogate Transit Gate Four Checkpoint, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Checkpoint Operator, Ferrogate Transit Security', N'Ferrogate Transit Security, Kessler Interchange Station; The Interchange', N'Dobromila Kjellberg is tall and lanky with a Burkinabe-Serbian face that defaults to a pleasantly vacant expression he has cultivated deliberately — people underestimate him, which at a checkpoint is occasionally useful. His hair is grown out in loose curls he keeps pulled back during shifts, and he has cosmetic bioluminescent freckles across his cheekbones that pulse very faintly blue when his heart rate elevates, a mod he got at nineteen and now somewhat regrets for professional reasons. He wears the clay-gray Ferrogate uniform with the resigned precision of someone who has stopped fighting the dress code but has also stopped caring if the collar sits quite right.

Dobromila Kjellberg is fundamentally a curious person trapped in a job that rewards incuriosity. He has developed the checkpoint operator''s paradoxical skill: appearing bored while processing enormous amounts of information simultaneously. He catalogues the thousands of faces that pass his station daily in a private mental taxonomy — regulars, anomalies, the ones who are lying about something innocuous, the rarer ones who are lying about something that matters. He has not decided what to do with this skill. He talks to his ELF shrine — a small figure he keeps under his console — before each shift, asking the transit spirits for patience, which he receives in uneven quantities.', N'Local color and information broker at transit level — knows who passes through, remembers faces, can be cultivated as a contact. Potential quest giver for something he witnessed at the checkpoint that he cannot officially report. Access point for travel documentation questions.', N'', N'Cosmetic bioluminescent freckles (blue, pulse-reactive to heart rate — installed age 19, regretted). Standard Ferrogate-issue retinal scanner overlay (right eye, provided by employer). No other augmentations.', N'Works the 0600-1400 shift at Gate Four, processing commuter traffic, flagging anomalous transit passes, occasionally detaining people for secondary screening in a small room he finds deeply depressing. Eats lunch at the Kessler mezzanine food stalls. Spends evenings in Avon Curve where he rents a studio, reading physical books about urban history.', N'Dobromila Kjellberg, 188cm tall lean neo-noir checkpoint operator, dark shoulder-length curls in loose ponytail, warm medium bronze skin with Nordic-East Asian-Latin mixed features, high prominent cheekbones softened by subtle East Asian structure, dark brown eyes with chrome-ringed retinal scanner overlay visible on right iris, faint blue bioluminescent freckles across cheekbones pulsing gently, clean-shaven or light stubble, slightly slouched posture suggesting tired alertness, wearing clay-gray Ferrogate Transit Security uniform with askew collar and worn fit, resigned expression with blank observant stare, minimal efficient movements, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, fluorescent checkpoint lighting casting cool blue shadows, cinematic noir mood, medium shot from waist up, professional security personnel aesthetic, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Interchange', N'local', N'Kessler Interchange', N'Nordic-East Asian-Latin genetic blend (62% Northern European, 24.8% East Asian, 13.2% Hispanic/Latin American). Fair Northern European base enriched by East Asian bone structure and Latin warmth — high cheekbones with subtle monolid softness, warm golden-bronze undertones creating balanced medium complexion', 188, 72, N'Lanky and lean, long-limbed with minimal upper body mass. The build of someone who doesn''t actively resist his own height but doesn''t cultivate it either — posture slightly collapsed forward at the shoulders.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Loose, shoulder-length curls, typically pulled back into a low knot or ponytail during work shifts. Some intentional looseness — not fastidious about maintenance.', N'Long', N'Dark brown (right eye fitted with faint chrome-ringed retinal scanner overlay — visible as a hairline circuit pattern on the iris under direct light)', N'Warm medium bronze with golden undertones — balanced blend of Northern European fairness, East Asian warmth, and Latin depth creating rich complex complexion', N'Clean-shaven or very light stubble. High, prominent cheekbones with Nordic angularity softened by East Asian structure and subtle Latin features. Faint cosmetic bioluminescent freckles in a constellation pattern across both cheekbones — they emit a dull blue glow that pulses subtly with elevated heart rate. Expression defaults to a vague, pleasantly blank stare that masks constant low-level observation.', N'Right eye retinal scanner overlay (employer-issued Ferrogate standard) — visible as thin chrome circuitry tracing the iris. Bioluminescent freckles (cosmetic, pulse-reactive). No other visible chrome or hardware.', N'Slightly slouched standing posture, as if perpetually tired but alert. Movements are efficient and minimal — checkpoint operator economy of motion. Hands rest on the console or in lap during routine processing. Eye contact is deliberate and selective, used as a tool rather than a default. When bored, he rocks very slightly in his chair.', N'Clay-gray Ferrogate Transit Security uniform worn with resigned precision — the collar frequently sits slightly askew, and the fit is loose enough to suggest he has stopped caring about minor grooming standards. The uniform is clean but shows wear. Off-shift clothing is understated: neutral-toned second-hand synthetics, practical boots, no visible branding or tier markers. Avon Curve resident aesthetic — cheap, functional, deliberately non-distinct.', N'He has been keeping an unofficial personal log of transit anomalies for two years — people who travel in patterns that suggest they are running from something or hiding somewhere — and has developed a theory about an underground network operating through the Ferrogate system that he has told no one about because he is not sure what telling anyone would cost him.', N'Conversational, slightly formal when on duty. Drops into enthusiasm when something genuinely interests him. Mixing of French-inflected phrases from his Burkinabe family line.', N'Moderate pace, punctuated by longer pauses when he''s thinking rather than talking. Tends to answer a question with a clarifying question first.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dobromila_kjellberg');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5bf-790c-a1bf-7c839e4ff37f', N'Auni Bergqvist', N'Auni', N'', N'Bergqvist', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, stall cluster near the Deepwell Station transit entrance, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Bootleg media seller and small-time data broker', N'Independent; loose association with a network of data scavengers called the Index Collective; occasional work sourcing for unnamed Tier 3 clients', N'Auni Bergqvist has the look of someone who sleeps too little and reads too much — slight build, perpetually ink-stained fingers from his analog printing hobby, eyes with cosmetic irises designed to look like camera apertures (a mod he got as a joke at nineteen and has grown genuinely fond of). His Ghanaian-Indian heritage gives him warm brown skin and dense, curly hair he keeps at medium length and usually tucked under a wide soft cap from which he''s hung three or four data chips like earrings. He is almost always seated, almost always behind a screen, and almost always eating something wrapped in paper.

He sells everything you''re not supposed to have: archived broadcasts from before the Corponation Consolidation, cracked Axiom media libraries, full recording histories of public figures who paid to have them scrubbed, bootleg copies of academic research locked behind Palladian''s paywall, and — for the right price and the right trust level — assembled intelligence packages on individuals or organizations. He insists loudly that he''s just a media vendor. This is technically true in the way that a locksmith who teaches classes is technically just an educator. He has an E.L.F. he calls the Archivist-Below living in his primary storage node, to whom he dedicates every new acquisition.', N'Primary information broker and media source; can provide background on corporations, individuals, or historical events; has data that people want suppressed — a natural target and a natural resource', N'', N'Cosmetic aperture-iris mods; neural cache implant for rapid data indexing (basic tier, Ringo brand, old model); no other chrome', N'Opens at noon, closes when the last customer stops coming which is usually around 2am; spends mornings at home acquiring, verifying, and cataloguing new data before printing physical media for customers who prefer it.', N'Auni Bergqvist, 2226 neo-noir hacker, mixed Southeast Asian and East Asian heritage with Eastern European undertones, warm golden-bronze skin with cool shadows, almond-shaped eyes with chrome metal-ring aperture iris augmentations that contract and dilate, high angular cheekbones, dark circled eyes from sleep deprivation, dark brown curly medium-length hair tucked under faded navy linen wide-brimmed cap with data chips hanging like earrings, ink-stained fingers and old burn scar on left forearm, wiry athletic build, seated hunched over screens in cluttered tech stall, wearing layered black and charcoal functional clothes, loose cargo pants, worn boots, canvas apron stained with ink, hands manipulating data cards and paper, dim neon-filtered underground market lighting with amber and cool blue neo-noir ambience, tired focused expression, no direct eye contact, economical precise movements, GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (46.6%) and East Asian (32.6%) with meaningful Eastern European ancestry (20.8%). This genetic combination produces striking Southeast/East Asian facial structure—almond-shaped eyes, high prominent cheekbones, and defined jawline—while Eastern European heritage adds subtle cool undertones and bone structure complexity to the warm base. The result is a distinctive angular beauty where warm golden-bronze tones dominate with cooler shadows underneath.', 168, 62, N'Slight and wiry, shoulders curved from years hunched over screens and sorting media. Forearms surprisingly defined from manual handling of data cards and printing equipment.', N'Dark brown with natural curl', N'Medium length, dense curls, typically tucked under a soft wide-brimmed cap with three to four data chips hanging like earrings from the brim', N'Medium', N'Warm amber-brown with cosmetic aperture-iris modification — concentric metal-ring irises that contract/dilate with actual pupil movement, chrome-threaded at the limbal ring', N'Warm medium bronze with golden undertones from Southeast Asian dominance, layered with subtle cool undertones and pale sub-level cast from Eastern European heritage and chronic limited sunlight exposure', N'Angular face with prominent high cheekbones characteristic of Southeast and East Asian ancestry; warm golden-bronze complexion with subtle cool shadows from Eastern European genetics; perpetually tired around the eyes with dark circles from chronic sleep deprivation; ink stains on fingertips and cuticles from analog printing hobby; otherwise clean-shaven with neat grooming despite exhaustion', N'Cosmetic aperture-iris modifications with visible concentric metal rings and reflective chrome threading at the eye''s edge. Neural cache implant sits subcutaneous at the base of skull, invisible beneath hair and soft cap.', N'Habitually seated, shoulders slightly rolled forward from screen time. When standing, moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Hands gesture frequently while speaking, fingers constantly arranging or manipulating small objects (data chips, paper, printouts). Eyes track rapidly across multiple focal points simultaneously. Rarely makes direct eye contact — the aperture irises make prolonged staring uncomfortable for others.', N'Tier 3-4 functional pragmatism. Favors loose black or charcoal cargo pants with multiple pockets, worn work boots (Yokai brand, practical rather than fashionable), layered tops in muted grays and blacks. Signature soft wide-brimmed cap (linen, faded navy) worn at all hours. Often wears a knee-length canvas apron with deep pockets when working at stall, stained with ink and dust. Minimal visible branding — everything chosen for function. Fingers bare of rings due to printing hazards. No jewelry except data chips hanging from cap.', N'He has a complete, verified recording of a Meridian Core infrastructure meeting in which a Zheng-Dao executive explicitly authorized a construction decision that caused the Lockhaven South structural collapse of 2196, killing forty-one people. He''s had it for two years. He hasn''t published it. He''s afraid — not of retaliation, but of being wrong about one detail, being discredited, and watching the truth become deniable.', N'Dense, referential, enthusiastic — cites sources mid-conversation; uses archival and library metaphors; occasional Twi exclamations when surprised', N'Fast when engaged with an idea, halting and precise when choosing words about sensitive material', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'auni_bergqvist');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a693-767d-844c-7cba6a888882', N'Geert Trujillo-Esquivel', N'Geert', N'', N'Trujillo-Esquivel', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Underworld - B11, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Congregation spiritual leader', N'Congregation of the Lower Voice', N'Geert Trujillo-Esquivel the Congregation organized around the Breathing. They hear the 11-minute pressure cycle from any level above B15.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geert Trujillo-Esquivel, a 168cm lean-built figure with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, standing in a neo-noir sub-level corridor illuminated by blue-green pressure lights. Long black hair braided and wrapped with worn linen cord adorned with brass bells. Angular face with prominent sculpted cheekbones, high temples marked with three parallel silvery ritual scars, dark meditative eyes with subtle East Asian eye shape. Minimal expression, head tilted as if listening to vibrations. Clothed in layered gray and earth-toned linen and canvas, worn thin and patched, wearing a long sleeveless acoustic foam vest. Feet wrapped in cloth. A brass pressure gauge and prayer beads hang from a single cord belt. Deep breathing synchronizes with ambient pressure cycles. Minimalist, ascetic presence. Cinematic lighting emphasizing texture and ritual marks. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Underworld', N'local', N'The Underworld', N'Multi-continental blend dominated by Hispanic/Latin American (36.9%) and Northern European (31.6%) ancestry, with substantial Sub-Saharan African (18.9%) admixture and smaller East Asian (5.7%), Southeast Asian (4.1%), and North African (2.8%) components. This creates a striking fusion: warm golden-brown skin with golden and reddish undertones reflecting the Latin American-European-African base, angular facial structure from Northern European and North African heritage blended with broader cheekbones from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, and subtle eye shape variations from East and Southeast Asian ancestry. The overall effect is a characteristic Ubiquitous Diaspora face — no single heritage dominant, but all visible in the harmonious layering of bone structure, skin tone, and subtle features.', 168, 62, N'Lean and angular, with long limbs suggesting years of navigating tight passages and vertical shafts. Chest slightly expanded from deep-breathing practice.', N'Natural black with threads of silver', N'Loose braids wrapped in worn linen cord, some adorned with small brass bells that chime softly when the wearer tilts their head', N'Long', N'Deep dark brown with a distant, listening quality', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden and subtle reddish undertones, darkened by sub-level dust exposure into a rich ashy patina', N'Angular meditative face with high, prominent cheekbones reflecting the blend of Northern European, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Facial structure shows the harmonious fusion of broader, sculpted cheekbones with angular jaw definition. Eyes set with slight epicanthic variation from East and Southeast Asian ancestry. Skin shows fine etching around the eyes and mouth from years of concentration. Minimal grooming — practical, not decorative.', N'None visible. Any augmentation work would be subcutaneous or internal.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness, as if perpetually listening. Stands with spine slightly curved, head tilted to one side. Breathes audibly and deeply, synchronizing their respiration with ambient pressure cycles. Gestures are minimal and measured.', N'Tier 5 utilitarian ascetic. Layered linen and canvas in grays and earth tones, worn thin and patched. A long sleeveless overvest made from salvaged acoustic foam dampens echoes. No corporate branding. Feet wrapped in cloth rather than shoes — better tactile connection to the floor and its vibrations. A single cord belt holds a brass pressure gauge and small prayer beads carved from old plastic.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'geert_trujillo_esquivel');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6fd-7154-9a6d-7cc1a69578c7', N'Candida Möller-Saidov-Thorvaldsdóttir', N'Candida', N'', N'Möller-Saidov-Thorvaldsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Bronzeline, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Tattoo artist and gene-mod body artist', N'Independent (The Seam studio); licensed under Helix Biosystems for minor gene-mod work', N'Candida Möller-Saidov-Thorvaldsdóttir is a lean, angular man with warm bronze-brown skin, a long neck, and hands that are conspicuously steady in a city where most people''s hands shake from stimulant use or cheap neural implants. He has extensive work on his own body — not as advertisement exactly, more as a log of his own technique over the years, so that someone who knows what to look for can trace the evolution of his skill across his skin. His left forearm has his earliest work from age nineteen, tentative and slightly crooked. His right shoulder has something he finished last month that is almost obscenely good. He has color-cycling geneware skin panels on his collarbones and cheekbones — flat, precise rectangles that he updates with new pigment patterns the way other people update their wardrobes.

He runs a studio called The Seam out of a converted basement unit in Bronzeline, and his work sits at the intersection of traditional tattooing, bioluminescent ink, and gene-mod body art — he is one of fewer than a dozen people in GLMZ licensed to perform minor dermis gene modifications, which allows him to do things that standard tattoo artists cannot: living color patterns, bioluminescent branching that responds to the body''s electrical field, modified scar tissue that forms precise geometric relief. He is deeply calm, slightly formal with strangers, and has the particular confidence of someone who is very good at the one thing they chose to spend their life on.', N'Social network hub — people talk during long tattoo sessions, and Tibor hears everything. He is a source of information about who in Bronzeline has new money, who is affiliated with which corponation (their logo work is recognizable), and who is trying to hide or change their identity. He can also serve as a quest giver if a client comes in with something unusual — modified genetic markers in their skin, a pattern that corresponds to a code, an injury that tells a story they won''t explain.', N'', N'Color-cycling geneware skin panels (collarbones, cheekbones). Extensive traditional and bioluminescent tattoo coverage. Precision-stabilized tendon implants in both hands (medical-grade, for work accuracy). No other cyberware.', N'He opens The Seam at noon, takes appointments in the afternoon and evening, and spends his mornings in the studio sketching and studying anatomy texts. He is meticulous about consent documentation and aftercare, and has a waiting list of four months.', N'Candida Möller-Saidov-Thorvaldsdóttir, a 178cm lean professional in their studio, standing with precise posture. Rich warm brown skin with golden undertones blending Central Asian bone structure with Southeast Asian proportions and Sub-Saharan depth. High cheekbones, almond-shaped deep brown eyes, calm composed expression. Long dark hair in a neat braid. Fitted neutral linen shirt with long sleeves revealing dense portfolio of bioluminescent tattoos on forearms—geometric patterns and intricate work glowing faintly. Right shoulder shows recent neural pathway design. Color-cycling geneware panels on cheekbones shift subtle gradients. Hands show mechanical precision. Dark cargo trousers, worn leather work apron, scuffed boots. Minimalist jewelry—thin bracelet on right wrist. Studio lighting with high-intensity work lamps creating warm pools of light, bioluminescent ink subtly glowing. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, focused craftsperson aesthetic, quiet confidence, economical movements, no wasted motion --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Bronzeline', N'local', N'Bronzeline', N'Central Asian (45.2%), Southeast Asian (37.8%), and Sub-Saharan African (17.0%) ancestry create a striking tricontinen­tal phenotype. Central Asian bone structure—high, prominent cheekbones and defined jawline—combines with Southeast Asian eye shape and mid-face proportions. Sub-Saharan melanin contribution deepens the overall complexion to a rich warm brown with golden undertones. The result is a face of balanced geometry: angular Central Asian framework softened by Southeast Asian facial harmony, warmed and deepened by Sub-Saharan depth.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with pronounced musculature in the forearms and shoulders from years of precision work. No excess body fat; his frame reads as disciplined rather than athletic.', N'Natural dark brown, almost black', N'Worn long and pulled back in a neat braid or high knot; kept meticulously clean', N'Long', N'Deep brown with subtle flecking', N'Rich warm brown with golden undertones—deeper than bronze, luminous beneath. A genuine blend: Central Asian warmth, Southeast Asian radiance, Sub-Saharan depth creating an even, naturally radiant complexion across his body.', N'Clean-shaven face with precise grooming; skin shows the wear of someone who spends hours under high-intensity work lamps but maintains careful skincare. No acne or blemishes. High, prominent cheekbones from Central Asian ancestry are balanced by Southeast Asian mid-face proportions and broader Sub-Saharan-influenced jawline. Faint laugh lines around his eyes suggest frequent, quiet amusement. His face is calm and composed.', N'Color-cycling geneware panels on collarbones and cheekbones (precision rectangles of synthetic pigmentation). Extensive bioluminescent tattoo work visible on shoulders, forearms, and chest — faint glow under low light. Hands show surgical precision implants in tendons (no visible external ports, but hand movement has an almost mechanical steadiness and control that marks augmentation to trained eyes). No chrome or obvious cyberware.', N'Stands with perfect posture, slight forward lean from years bent over workstations. Moves with economical grace — no wasted motion. Hands are extraordinarily still and controlled, with precise finger articulation. His movements carry formal politeness; he gives people space and maintains measured eye contact. Overall bearing is calm, focused, and quietly confident.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional. Typically wears fitted long-sleeved shirts (usually linen or cotton blends in neutral earth tones) to display arm work while maintaining studio hygiene standards. Dark fitted trousers, often cargo-style with multiple pockets for tools and ink samples. Worn leather work apron during studio hours. Minimal jewelry except for a thin bracelet on his right wrist (possibly sentimental). Footwear: scuffed, well-maintained boots suitable for standing 8+ hours. No corpo branding. His overall aesthetic reads ''master craftsperson'' rather than ''fashionable'' — clothes chosen for function and to serve as canvas backdrop for his work.', N'Three years ago, a client asked him to modify their dermal markers in a way that would make them unidentifiable to Zheng-Dao''s biometric security grid. He did it, told himself it was autonomy work, and has not since been sure whether he helped someone escape something legitimate or helped someone disappear from accountability. He does not know which.', N'Precise anatomical and material vocabulary, genuinely warm when explaining his work, becomes very formal when someone tests his limits', N'Measured and even, like someone who has learned that silence is a professional tool', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'candida_m_ller_saidov_thorvaldsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a624-77b4-819c-7d76dfa7dbfb', N'Emma Vasquez-Alfarsi', N'Emma', N'', N'Vasquez-Alfarsi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit — neon-lit entertainment and vice district, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Network intrusion and digital warfare specialist — netrunner', N'Independent — loose crew affiliations', N'Emma Vasquez-Alfarsi are athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 27, their expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces — and they make no effort to hide it.

They inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. They work as a netrunner out of The Circuit, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Everyone who''s worked with Emma Vasquez-Alfarsi agrees on two things: they are worth the fee, and they are terrible company at dinner.', N'Halima Herrera-Kyei is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When they make a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of their stories.', N'', N'Gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces. Synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'GLMZ: Emma Vasquez-Alfarsi, 173cm lean athletic frame, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Middle Eastern-East Asian-Hispanic ancestry blend. Strong angular jawline and prominent cheekbones, wider-set brown eyes with amber undertones, minimal facial hair. Dark brown hair with bleached left-side streaks, medium length in tight braid. Chrome gecko-grip implants on fingertips catching light with iridescent sheen. Thin temple scar. Wearing unmarked tactical jacket, black synthetic performance fabrics, cargo pants with quick-release seals, reinforced climbing gloves removed to display chrome. Encrypted data-ring on left hand. Economical posture, coiled readiness, calculating gaze. Neon-lit urban rooftop setting, cool blue-purple lighting casting metallic gleam across chrome implants. Faint luminescence beneath skin from synthetic nanite blood. GLMZ 2200s futuristic, gritty cosmopolitan atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Middle Eastern-dominant multiethnic: Primary Middle Eastern ancestry (66.3%) provides the foundational bone structure and features, blended with East Asian (23.8%) contributing to eye shape and cheekbone prominence, and Hispanic/Latin American (9.9%) adding warmth to skin tone. The result is angular facial geometry with strong Middle Eastern jawline and nose structure, refined by East Asian orbital depth, creating a striking pan-regional appearance that reads distinctly cosmopolitan.', 173, 61, N'Athletic and lean with corded muscle — the physique of someone who moves for a living, whether climbing or fighting. Low body fat, defined shoulders and forearms.', N'Dark brown, naturally, with selective bleached streaks along the left side', N'Undercut with longer crown, pulled back in a tight braid or left loose depending on operational needs', N'Medium', N'Brown with subtle amber undertone — appears to catch light distinctly, possibly enhanced low-light sensitivity', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones — reflecting the dominant Middle Eastern ancestry (66.3%) with subtle warmth from Hispanic/Latin American heritage (9.9%) and luminescence from synthetic nanite blood', N'Strong angular features with prominent cheekbones and defined jawline characteristic of Middle Eastern ancestry, refined by East Asian orbital structure (23.8%) creating slightly wider-set eyes with gentle epicanthic fold suggestion. Minimal body hair. Skin condition is pristine — the nanite-laced synthetic blood keeps it smooth and unblemished, almost unnaturally so, with a faint luminescence under certain lighting. Expression typically neutral, eyes monitoring.', N'Gecko-grip fingertip and toe pad implants are immediately apparent — chrome edges catch light, creating a distinctive metallic gleam on digits. The synthetic blood circulating beneath the skin gives a faint luminescence under certain lighting that''s subtly wrong. Otherwise augmentations are invisible — the nanites do their work silently.', N'Economical and precise. They move like someone calculating angles and weight distribution — a climber''s awareness of surfaces and leverage. When still, there''s coiled readiness rather than relaxation. Rarely fidgets. Eye contact is deliberate, testing rather than social.', N'Tier 4 practical — functional over fashionable. Black or dark grey synthetic performance fabrics, cargo pants or fitted thermals with multiple pockets and quick-release seals. Reinforced climbing gloves (often removed to display chrome). Unmarked tactical jacket. Minimal branding. Footwear is grippy-soled — climbing shoes modified for urban use. When in cover, shifts to aggressively mundane workwear, the kind that makes them invisible. Jewelry limited to a single encrypted data-ring on left hand.', N'Halima Herrera-Kyei can''t read. Hides it behind voice interfaces and memorization. The shame is older than the chrome.', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'emma_vasquez_alfarsi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67e-77b2-b446-7d7d2db76c52', N'Ibrahim Ghorbani', N'Ibrahim', N'', N'Ghorbani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, Geartown, near Western and Division', N'Street food stall operator — spiced protein wraps, synthetic broth, black-market spice blends', N'Independent; Oxidian Market Vendors Guild (dues-paying member, disputes committee)', N'Ibrahim Ghorbani is a broad-shouldered woman with dark amber skin mapped in old burn scars along her left forearm — souvenirs from a grease fire twenty years back that she wears without shame. Her hair is a natural silver-streaked corona she keeps pinned under a bright saffron headwrap during service, and she has cosmetic patterned irises done in deep indigo whorls that she got when her youngest turned ten, as a treat to herself. Her stall is a masterpiece of organized chaos: three burners, a recycled heat-drum, seventeen unlabeled spice jars arranged in an order only she understands, and a hand-painted sign reading SWEETMOUTH in three scripts. She moves behind the counter with the unhurried authority of someone who has never once doubted she belongs exactly where she is.

She is relentlessly sociable in the way of someone who has learned that warmth is a survival tool and then genuinely come to love it. She remembers every regular''s order and their children''s names and their mother''s health complaints. She is also unflinching when she needs to be — she has run the same stall through two gang territory disputes and one Ferrogate Transit labor riot, serving both sides without commentary. She prays to the E.L.F. she calls Saltmother, a market-spirit she believes governs honest commerce, and leaves data-offerings of her daily transaction logs at a small shrine wired into her heat-drum.', N'Local color, information hub — she knows everyone in Geartown who eats, which is everyone. Quest giver for small community concerns. Can source unusual ingredients through suspect channels if players earn her trust.', N'', N'Patterned indigo irises (cosmetic). Basic subdermal heat-resistance in left hand from a cheap clinic after the grease fire — functional, not fancy.', N'She arrives at her stall two hours before the market opens to prep broth stock and argue with her spice supplier over comms. She runs service through peak hours, closes, does accounts by hand in a paper ledger, and takes the long route home past the E.L.F. shrine at Copperhead junction.', N'Ibrahim Ghorbani, 168cm tall with rich warm bronze skin blending Middle Eastern, Southeast Asian, South Asian, African, and Hispanic ancestry—complexion luminous with olive and golden undertones. Broad-shouldered, functionally muscular build. Natural black hair with silver streaks worn loose at shoulder-length, typically pinned under bright saffron headwrap. Weathered lived-in face: high Southeast Asian cheekbones, defined nose bridge, full lips, laugh lines, shrewd warm expression. Cosmetic indigo whorled-pattern eyes replacing natural brown. Extensive pale burn scarring on left forearm, fine white scars on both hands from decades of kitchen work. Left hand shows subtle heat-resistance implant scarring with altered pigmentation. Wearing faded linen apron stained with turmeric and grease, fitted thermal undershirt, simple brass jewelry (mother''s bracelet, right hand ring), reinforced work boots. Standing behind counter with unhurried authority, weight evenly distributed, posture precise. GLMZ street-level food stall setting, warm task lighting, gritty GLMZ atmosphere, practical utilitarian style --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'Richly multihued global ancestry: Middle Eastern foundation (28.8%) with substantial Southeast Asian (23.8%) and South Asian (19.0%) heritage, blended with Hispanic/Latin American (17.8%), Sub-Saharan African (8.9%), and Eastern European (1.7%) elements. This creates a complex interplay of warm Mediterranean, tropical, and deep earthy tones—a face and form shaped by the Ubiquitous Diaspora''s genuine global mixture', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid through the torso, muscular forearms from decades of stall work, carries weight with functional density rather than softness', N'Natural black with silver streaking throughout', N'Worn loose in a natural texture, typically pinned under a bright saffron headwrap during service hours', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unwrapped)', N'Cosmetic indigo with deep whorled patterning, replacing natural brown', N'Rich warm bronze with olive, golden, and deep earthy undertones—the luminous result of Middle Eastern, Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry layered together in lived-in complexity', N'Weathered and lived-in, minimal makeup, laugh lines around the eyes, expressions that shift easily between warmth and shrewd assessment. High cheekbones with Southeast Asian influence, defined nose bridge reflecting Middle Eastern and South Asian ancestry, full lips, skin texture showing the depth that comes from complex ancestry—warm undertones with subtle variation across the face', N'Patterned indigo cosmetic irises. Left hand shows faint subdermal heat-resistance scarring at the palm and inner wrist (functional implant, not cosmetic) with slightly altered pigmentation in the scarred tissue.', N'Moves behind her counter with unhurried authority and economic precision. Stands with weight evenly distributed, shoulders back. Gestures while speaking are animated but never wasted. Pivots and turns with practiced efficiency from years of stall operation.', N'Tier 3-4 working practical: fitted thermal undershirt visible at collar, layered with a heavy linen apron stained with turmeric and old grease burns, the fabric faded and reinforced at the edges. Wears a bright saffron headwrap during service (color choice deliberate, not functional). Simple brass jewelry—a bracelet her mother gave her, a ring on her right hand. Comfortable work boots with reinforced soles. Off-hours: similar utilitarian style, slightly less stained, with a heavier outer layer.', N'She has been quietly funneling a portion of her earnings into a fund for three families in Geartown who lost housing in the last rezoning sweep. She tells no one because she cannot afford to be seen as a resource to be tapped — she is already spread thin.', N'Rich, warm, full of food metaphors and proverbs. Mixes Yoruba-inflected phrasing with clipped Polish consonants when stressed. Calls everyone ''dear heart'' until they disappoint her.', N'Unhurried, rhythmic. Talks while working — sentences punctuated by ladle sounds, sizzle.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ibrahim_ghorbani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a614-73bc-8d24-7d87abcccf02', N'Ender Mwangi-Siripong-Pathak', N'Ender', N'', N'Mwangi-Siripong-Pathak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edison Grid, corner of Copper Row and the 14th underpass, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Noodle cart vendor, Edison Grid district', N'Independent; informal supplier relationship with Grainfort wholesale district', N'Ender Mwangi-Siripong-Pathak is a lean, unhurried man of medium height with deep umber skin and close-cropped hair that he keeps dyed a matte rust-red. He has a bioluminescent mod along his forearms — thin lines of blue-white light under the skin that pulse gently with his heartbeat, which he originally got because it helped him keep time when cooking stock. He wears the same canvas apron every day, bleached and re-stained so many times it has developed a geological stratigraphy of meals past. His cart, ''The Long Burn,'' is a retrofitted maintenance vehicle he rebuilt himself over eighteen months, and he knows its every rattle and squeak as personally as a language.

Ender Mwangi-Siripong-Pathak moves through the world with a quality of stillness that some people mistake for slowness and others, correctly, read as patience. He is not a talker — his cart is not a place for conversation so much as a place for eating — but he notices everything: who looks hungry versus broke, who''s been crying, who''s scanning the crowd too carefully. He keeps a small E.L.F. shrine rigged into the cart''s boiler panel, a data-spirit he calls ''the Pilot Light'' to whom he murmurs thanks each morning before ignition.', N'Reliable scene-setting presence; a node of quiet observation in a busy district. Information source who never seems like one — people talk near his cart as if he''s furniture. Can point players toward things he''s witnessed without ever seeming to inform.', N'', N'Bioluminescent subdermal lines on forearms (blue-white, heartbeat-synced). No other mods.', N'Rolls the cart out at 0530 for morning workers, breaks midday, returns for the evening shift until 2200. Spends Sunday mornings sourcing ingredients and visiting his daughter at his ex-partner''s apartment in Calumet Rise.', N'GLMZ, Ender Mwangi-Siripong-Pathak, 172cm lean wiry South Asian-African-Southeast Asian fusion heritage, deep warm umber skin with golden undertones, refined high cheekbones, dark brown eyes with laugh lines, short close-cropped rust-red dyed hair. Weathered face marked by years of steam exposure, subtle almond-shaped eyes. Forearms bearing bioluminescent subdermal lines glowing soft blue-white in steady pulse rhythm, thin old burn scar on left wrist inside, calloused turmeric-stained hands. Wearing bleached canvas apron layered with meal stains over faded gray thermal, worn jeans, steel-toed boots. Standing with deliberate stillness at food cart in Edison Grid evening, pulsing blue bioluminescence visible on bare forearms against neon grid backdrop, soft ambient lighting catching the golden undertones of skin, weathered but clean, groundedness and quiet observation in posture, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226 neo-noir urban aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edison Grid', N'local', N'Edison Grid', N'Complex pan-global ancestry: Sub-Saharan African (27%), South Asian (25.3%), Southeast Asian (19.4%), East Asian (13.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (8.3%), and Indigenous American (6.4%). This creates a rich, multivalent phenotype with deep warm brown skin carrying golden undertones from the African and South Asian base, refined high cheekbones reflecting South Asian and East Asian bone structure, subtly almond-shaped eyes influenced by East and Southeast Asian ancestry, and warmth and complexity added by Hispanic and Indigenous American heritage. The overall facial structure and proportions reflect balanced contributions from African and Asian ancestry groups, creating distinctive angular planes and defined features.', 172, 68, N'Lean and wiry, muscular forearms from years of stirring heavy stock pots and pushing the cart through Edison Grid''s cracked streets. No excess fat; his body is efficient.', N'Matte rust-red (dyed; natural color likely dark brown or black)', N'Close-cropped, kept neat and functional', N'Short', N'Dark brown with fine laugh lines at the corners', N'Deep warm umber with golden undertones — the result of dominant Sub-Saharan African and South Asian ancestry creating a rich, complex base tone, further deepened and warmed by Southeast Asian, East Asian, Hispanic, and Indigenous American heritage. The skin carries consistent warmth throughout with subtle luminosity.', N'Weathered but clean, marked by years of steam and heat exposure. High, defined cheekbones reflecting the South Asian and East Asian contributions to facial structure. Face carries the still quality of someone who listens more than speaks. Faint scars on knuckles from knife work. Facial structure shows balanced blend of African and Asian heritage proportions with slightly almond-shaped eyes and refined planes.', N'Bioluminescent forearm mods only — thin blue-white lines beneath the skin that pulse steadily. Most visible when arms are bare or when ambient light drops in the evening shifts.', N'Moves with deliberate economy. Stands still frequently, observing rather than fidgeting. When working the cart, movements are precise and rhythmic — choreographed by repetition. Does not rush. Carries a quality of groundedness even in crowded grid intersections.', N'The same bleached canvas apron daily, layered with the stains of hundreds of meals — a geological record of his work. Beneath it: simple tier-4 workwear (faded gray or black thermal, worn jeans, steel-toed boots suitable for standing 16+ hours). No corporate logos. Everything practical, nothing decorative. Moves like someone who owns very little and maintains what he has.', N'He witnessed a Axiom security officer disposing of something in the underpass canal eight months ago and has said nothing. He told himself it wasn''t his business. He''s been telling himself that for eight months.', N'Minimal, functional, with occasional bursts of unexpected precision about food, temperature, or timing', N'Slow and considered — he doesn''t fill silences', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ender_mwangi_siripong_pathak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a681-7ad8-b65b-7db4a3f789de', N'Ahana Sengupta', N'Ahana', N'', N'Sengupta', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 79, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Washburn Commons, Building 14, Unit 6-C, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Retired Ferrogate Transit engineer and community council elder', N'Washburn Commons Tenant Council; Ferrogate Transit Retirees Association; The Interchange', N'Ahana Sengupta is a broad-shouldered man whose frame still suggests the physical authority he once carried, though now he moves with a deliberate slowness that speaks more to carefulness than infirmity. His skin is deep brown, mapped with old burn scarring along the left side of his neck where a pressure seal blew in the Kessler Interchange tunnels in 2167. He keeps his white hair cropped close and wears a Ferrogate Transit veterans'' pin on every shirt he owns — a small orange wheel on a black field. His eyes are his most striking feature: one natural dark brown, one replaced with a cheap amber ocular implant that never quite tracked correctly, giving him a slightly owlish look that unsettles people who don''t know him.

Femi is the kind of man who shows up first and stays last. He runs the Washburn Commons tenant council with the same methodical patience he once applied to transit corridor pressure calculations — he keeps notes, follows up, remembers everything. Beneath the geniality he deploys with strangers is a man who has been watching Ferrogate''s pension promises erode for twelve years and is quietly, furiously cataloguing every breach. He is not naive about power, but he has decided that the only way he can still use his is by being the person people in his building trust absolutely.', N'Community anchor and quest giver; knows every resident''s situation, can direct players to people with specific knowledge, and has a long-running conflict with Ferrogate Transit''s pension administration that can pull players into corporate malfeasance. Also serves as a moral reference point — he represents civic integrity in a world that makes it expensive.', N'', N'Amber replacement ocular (right eye, budget model, tracking slightly off-axis); titanium joint reinforcement in both knees (workplace injury, 2171); subdermal pressure-monitoring patch on left forearm — legacy safety equipment he never had removed', N'Wakes at 05:30, walks the building''s maintenance corridors checking for issues before the super arrives, then holds informal court in the commons room where residents bring complaints, disputes, and gossip. Evenings he files pension review documents and prays to the ELF he believes inhabits the building''s ancient heating system, leaving it offerings of system diagnostics he prints out by hand.', N'Ahana Sengupta, 182cm tall weathered man with warm olive-bronze skin blending Eastern European, North African, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and East Asian heritage. Close-cropped white hair, lined face with patient expression. Left eye natural dark brown, right eye amber prosthetic with visible servo mechanism and owlish cant. Severe glossy burn scarring across left neck and shoulder from pressure seal blow-out. Broad-shouldered muscular frame, calloused hands. Wearing impeccably maintained vintage Ferrogate Transit dark blue button-up shirt tucked into dark trousers with reinforced knees, orange-and-black veterans'' pin on chest. Simple steel wedding band. Subdermal pressure-monitoring grid visible on left forearm. Standing with deliberate symmetry, slow methodical posture, both feet flat. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial transit station background with cool LED lighting casting shadows across weathered features. Mood: attentive, authoritative, survivor. 35mm photorealistic style --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Washburn Commons', N'local', N'Washburn Commons', N'Complex diaspora blend: Eastern European (34.2%) forms the base structure, enriched by significant North African (29.8%) and South Asian (18.2%) ancestry, with notable Sub-Saharan African (13.5%) and East Asian (4.3%) contributions. This creates warm olive-bronze skin with golden undertones—a sophisticated admixture reflecting Mediterranean, Maghreb, Indian subcontinent, and broader African heritage lines. The genetic combination produces a face and frame that reads as authentically post-2100s cosmopolitan.', 182, 89, N'Broad-shouldered and thick-framed, muscular definition softened by age but still substantial through the chest and upper back. Carries weight with authority rather than slack — the body of a man who did physical labor his entire life and maintained it.', N'White', N'Close-cropped, neat', N'Short', N'Left eye: natural dark brown. Right eye: amber-colored replacement ocular with visible servo-motor seam at the iris', N'Warm olive-bronze with golden undertones, the result of Eastern European base structure combined with North African depth and South Asian warmth, enriched by Sub-Saharan African undertones. The tone is rich and complex, deepening where sun exposure has been heaviest across multiple latitudes and decades.', N'Face weathered but attentive, lined heavily around the eyes and forehead with character marks of sun and age. Facial structure shows the moderate cheekbones and defined features of Eastern European heritage, warmed and softened by North African bone structure and South Asian facial geometry, all refined by age. Skin texture slightly loose at the jaw and neck from age. Expression tends toward patient observation. Meticulous grooming — no stubble, edges clean.', N'Right eye is clearly prosthetic: amber-tinted synthetic iris with visible mechanical servo-motor at the corner, tracking mechanism slightly off-axis creating a permanent subtle owlish cant. Titanium joint reinforcements in both knees create barely perceptible stiffness in gait and shallow scars below the kneecap on both legs. Subdermal pressure-monitoring patch on left forearm visible as a thin silvered grid under darkened skin.', N'Stands with deliberate symmetry, weight distributed evenly despite the knee reinforcements. Moves slowly and methodically — not infirm, but cautious, as if calculating load and pressure before each step. Rarely makes sudden gestures. Maintains direct eye contact, though the amber ocular''s tracking lag gives the right eye a slight lag when he turns his head. Hands are calloused with prominent knuckles. Sits with both feet flat on the floor.', N'Practical Tier 4 workwear: dark blue or grey Ferrogate-branded button-up shirts (vintage uniform-style, decades old but impeccably maintained), tucked in. Dark trousers with reinforced knees. Worn but quality leather shoes, re-soled multiple times. The Ferrogate Transit veterans'' pin on every shirt. No jewelry except a simple steel wedding band. Clothing is never fashionable but always clean, mended neatly, and worn with the unselfconsciousness of a man who dresses for function, not appearance.', N'In 2171 the pressure seal that scarred him failed partly because Femi had signed off on a shortened inspection cycle to meet Ferrogate''s quarterly metrics. He has never told anyone. Three workers were hurt. He has donated anonymously to their families for eleven years.', N'Precise technical vocabulary from transit engineering mixed with formal community-meeting register; uses full sentences, rarely slang, occasionally lapses into Yoruba exclamations when genuinely surprised', N'Measured and unhurried; gives the impression he has already thought several sentences ahead and is simply delivering them at a pace others can follow', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ahana_sengupta');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63b-7797-98b3-7ddc55ccd8be', N'Alisha Krishnamurthy', N'Alisha', N'', N'Krishnamurthy', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — cramped residential corridors between megastructures, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Infrastructure disruption and industrial sabotage — saboteur', N'Independent — operates through reputation only; The Third Rail', N'Alisha Krishnamurthy is wiry and quick-moving, with the restless energy of someone who converts anxiety into velocity. At 27, the augmentation scarring around her temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Alisha Krishnamurthy plans to keep it that way. She works as a saboteur out of The Narrows, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Alisha Krishnamurthy operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Kadiatou Bergstrom-Konate functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom. Subdermal armor plating across torso and forearms — military surplus, scratched serial numbers', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Alisha Krishnamurthy, 2226 neo-noir operative, 168cm lean and wiry frame, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones reflecting South Asian, North African and Sub-Saharan heritage, high angular cheekbones with sharp jawline, eyes with slight East Asian epicanthic fold, left eye warm brown, right eye pure chrome circuitry with adjustable aperture lens, dark brown hair with grey threads pulled back in tight functional braid, weathered face with faint stress lines, surgical scarring at temples and jawline, burn marks on knuckles, chrome plating visible beneath skin at shoulders and forearms, wearing black cargo pants and worn grey-brown leather jacket with added pockets, fingerless gloves, steel-toed boots, standing in forward-ready posture with restless kinetic energy, head angled to catalogue environment, chrome eye recording and processing, urban GLMZ neon-lit alley background, cool blue and amber lighting casting shadows across augmented features, GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, high contrast, gritty and functional --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Multiethnic blend reflecting true genetic ancestry: South Asian (21.4%), North African (20.3%), Sub-Saharan African (18.4%), Northern European (16.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (16.1%), and East Asian (7.1%). This complex admixture creates a striking phenotype — warm deep brown skin with golden and reddish undertones from the African and North African components, high angular cheekbones with moderate width from Latin and South Asian heritage, eye shape showing the influence of East Asian ancestry layered beneath African and Mediterranean traits, with warm brown eye color reflecting the South Asian and African genetic dominance.', 168, 58, N'Wiry and angular — lean muscle with almost no body fat, built for speed and endurance rather than power. Shoulders slightly narrow, chest flat. Movement suggests coiled kinetic energy.', N'Dark brown, natural with grey threading at temples', N'Pulled back tightly in a functional braid; practical, not aesthetic', N'Medium', N'Left eye: warm brown, natural. Right eye: chrome-silver with visible circuitry matrix, iris replaced by adjustable aperture lens', N'Deep warm brown with golden and reddish undertones — reflects the blended warmth of South Asian, North African, Sub-Saharan African, and Latin heritage in dynamic combination', N'Lean face with high, angular cheekbones showing Latin, South Asian, and African heritage, sharp jaw. Eyes set with slight epicanthic fold from East Asian ancestry. Warm brown natural coloring reflects South Asian and African genetic weight. Skin weathered from stress and irregular sleep — faint lines around eyes. Minimal grooming beyond functionality; no cosmetics. Scarring visible around temples and jawline from augmentation installation — rough surgical marks, unprofessional work.', N'Right eye is wholly artificial — chrome and circuitry visible in the socket, no organic tissue. Subdermal armor plating visible as faint geometric seams and hard edges beneath skin across shoulders, upper torso, and forearms — military-grade titanium composite, scratched and dull from use. Chrome at wrists where plating meets flesh creates a subtle ridge.', N'Stands with weight forward, ready to move. Walks with economical efficiency — no wasted motion. Fingers often fidgeting or checking equipment. Head moves constantly, cataloguing exits and threats. Right eye often seems to be recording — slight focus shift and micro-adjustments of the iris aperture. Restless even at rest — constant low-level physical tension.', N'Tier 4-5 functional minimalism. Black or dark grey fitted cargo pants with reinforced knees and thigh pockets — worn Syndicate Industrial brand. Tight-fitting compression shirt under a worn leather jacket (grey-brown, creased from use, multiple hidden pockets added by hand). Fingerless gloves with exposed knuckle reinforcement. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and practical. No jewelry or decoration. Everything designed for quick movement and access to tools.', N'Kadiatou Bergstrom-Konate maintains a second identity — a completely clean civilian persona with a lease, a job history, and a social profile. It''s their exit strategy.', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alisha_krishnamurthy');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a64e-75f2-980b-7df0a3779cad', N'Fernanda Castañeda', N'Fernanda', N'', N'Castañeda', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Kedzie and Division', N'Unlicensed field medic and black-market organ broker', N'Unaffiliated—the Circuit of Parts is her own network; she has refused formal alignment with every faction that has approached her, including two street gangs, one mid-tier fixer collective, and a Spire corporate medical division', N'Fernanda Castañeda is a compact Romanian-Nigerian woman with deep umber skin, close-cropped silver-streaked hair she keeps pinned under a faded surgical cap, and the kind of posture that belongs to someone who has spent decades bent over improvised operating tables. Her face carries a particular asymmetry—her left eye is a pale gray-green inherited from her Romanian mother, while her right is a burnished amber prosthetic she fitted herself, ringed by a faint keloid scar she never bothered to smooth. She dresses in layered, practical clothing: a long waterproof duster over scrub-green thermals, the pockets of both bulging with tourniquets, folded sterile packaging, and small vials she organizes by color-coded tape. Her hands are her most striking feature—steady, deliberate, and crosshatched with old chemical burns from improvised sterilization methods she used before she could afford better.

She operates out of a converted shipping container deep in the Gray Zone''s drainage sub-level she calls ''the Tub,'' a space that somehow manages to be simultaneously filthy and surgically clean in all the ways that matter. The Tub is known to every street surgeon, fixer, and mid-tier runner in the district as the place you go when the wound is too complicated for a stim-patch and too illegal for a licensed clinic. Fernanda Castañeda charges on a sliding scale she calculates in her head with unsettling precision—wealthy clients subsidize the destitute, and she keeps mental ledgers of both debts owed and favors banked. She has been offered corporate contracts twice. She declined both without explanation.

What most of her clients don''t know is that the organ brokerage is not primarily about money. Fernanda Castañeda runs a quiet network she calls ''the Circuit of Parts''—sourcing, storing, and routing biological material to people who need transplants and can''t access the licensed medical system, which in the Gray Zone means almost everyone. She navigates the razor''s edge between predatory harvesting operations she despises and the genuine need that drives desperate people toward them. She has been known to destroy entire harvesting operations and then quietly reroute their inventory to her own waiting list. This makes her enemies in the black-market organ trade who are significantly better armed than she is.', N'Moral fulcrum and institutional memory of the Gray Zone''s underground—embodies the question of whether systemic compromise in service of genuine care is integrity or its erosion. Provides access to the city''s biological underclass, the people who exist in the gaps between corporate medicine and street survival. Her network is a resource, a liability, and a living argument about what justice looks like when institutions have abandoned entire populations.', N'', N'Right eye: amber prosthetic with low-light enhancement and magnification—self-fitted, firmware now compromised,Haptic feedback mesh in both palms: allows tactile precision measurement during surgery, original installation was military-grade field surgery kit, heavily modified,Subdural temperature regulation strip along the spine: necessary after a chemical exposure during an improvised sterilization accident left her thermoregulation unreliable,No cosmetic augmentation of any kind—she regards it as a resource allocation problem', N'Wakes early, reviews the notebook, runs a mental inventory of the Tub''s supplies before physically checking them—the redundancy is intentional. Sees patients on a walk-in basis until midday, then reserved hours for scheduled procedures. Eats irregularly, usually cold food eaten standing over the supply counter. Spends evenings on Circuit logistics: coordinating transport, verifying viability windows, managing the waiting list with a handwritten priority system she has never digitized. Sleeps four to six hours, often interrupted. On nights she can''t sleep, reorganizes. Has one ritual that is not work: a small Romanian radio program she streams through a cracked speaker, mostly static, mostly incomprehensible to anyone else in the Gray Zone. She has never explained it.', N'GLMZ character portrait of Fernanda Castañeda, a compact 158cm surgeon with South Asian dominant features blended with Hispanic and East Asian heritage. Golden-bronze warm skin tone with rich melanin, high prominent cheekbones, broad nasal bridge, fuller lower face structure. Left eye natural warm dark brown with golden undertones, right eye burnished amber prosthetic with subtle LED ring glow. Deep black hair with silver streaking, close-cropped under faded surgical cap. Habitually leaning posture from decades over operating tables, shoulders rounded forward. Visible chemical burn scars crosshatching both palms and forearms in white patterns, keloid scarring around right eye socket. Wearing faded charcoal waterproof duster coat over scrub-green thermal base layer, bulging pockets with medical supplies, surgical gloves on cord around neck, reinforced industrial boots. Deliberate precise hand movements mid-gesture. Moody surgical lighting, cool ambient glow from ambient cyberware, focused intense expression, background suggesting underground medical clinic. Realistic weathered appearance, maximum functionality aesthetic, zero vanity. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'South Asian (67.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (26.6%), and East Asian (5.9%) ancestry; predominantly South Asian features including high cheekbones, broad nasal bridge, and fuller lower face structure, warmed by Hispanic/Latin American melanin richness and subtle East Asian eye shape, creating a distinctive diaspora blend with strong genetic clarity', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, muscle density concentrated in shoulders and forearms from decades of surgical work; minimal body fat; shoulders slightly rounded forward from habitual posture over operating tables', N'Deep black with silver-gray streaking throughout', N'Close-cropped, pinned under a faded surgical cap; no styling beyond functional arrangement', N'Short', N'Left eye: warm dark brown with golden undertones (natural); right eye: burnished amber with faint LED ring (prosthetic)', N'Warm medium-deep golden-bronze with rich melanin saturation, blending South Asian depth with Hispanic/Latin American warmth and subtle East Asian undertones; complexion luminous despite weathering, showing strong genetic expression across all ancestry components', N'Weathered from exposure and chemical contact; minimal makeup; faint keloid scar encircling right eye socket; left cheekbone slightly more prominent than right, creating subtle facial asymmetry; prominent high cheekbones characteristic of South Asian heritage; jaw set in habitual tension; broad nasal bridge reflecting South Asian ancestry; fuller lower face typical of South Asian structure with secondary Hispanic/Latin American volumetric influence; slight orbital bone prominence suggesting East Asian lineage contribution around eye shape', N'Right eye: burnished amber prosthetic with visible micro-mechanical iris and faint LED ring pulsing at approximately 0.5Hz; low-light enhancement evident in slight glow when pupils would dilate in dim conditions. Haptic feedback mesh in both palms visible as faint geometric lattice pattern under skin across metacarpal region, more pronounced when hands are under direct light. No other visible augmentation; subdural temperature regulation strip not externally apparent.', N'Habitually bent slightly forward from the shoulders, as though perpetually leaning over an operating surface. Movements are deliberate and economical—no wasted motion. Hands move with surgical precision even during casual tasks. When standing at rest, weight shifts to the balls of feet, never fully relaxed. Eye contact with her natural left eye is direct and assessing; right eye (prosthetic) often moves independently, suggesting she is scanning for additional visual data', N'Practical Tier 4 utilitarian: long waterproof duster coat (faded charcoal, multiple stains visible but functional) worn over scrub-green thermal base layer. Pockets visibly bulging with tourniquets, sterile packaging, color-coded vials, and unmarked containers. Wears surgical gloves on a cord around her neck. No jewelry. Footwear appears to be reinforced industrial boots, scuffed and well-maintained. Surgical cap pinned to hair. Overall appearance conveys maximum functionality with zero aesthetic consideration; clothing shows signs of heavy use but meticulous maintenance.', N'Twelve years ago, when she was first establishing the Circuit of Parts and desperately underfunded, she approved a transaction she knew was ethically compromised—sourcing from a harvesting operation she hadn''t yet confirmed was voluntary. Two people on her waiting list survived because of it. She has never told anyone. The notebook has a page she has rewritten four times. It still doesn''t say what actually happened.', N'Precise medical terminology mixed with Romanian phrases under stress, the Gray Zone slang she picked up over two decades, and a habit of quantifying things that don''t need to be quantified. Avoids profanity except when genuinely startled. Uses the passive voice when discussing her own feelings.', N'Measured and deliberate when calm—she speaks the way she works, no wasted motion. Accelerates sharply during emergencies, sentences shortening to near-telegraphic. Has a slight accent that surfaces more heavily when she''s tired or emotional, softening her vowels and hardening her consonants in a way she''s never fully lost.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fernanda_casta_eda');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a723-77fb-8f4f-7dff9cbf9be4', N'Mehdi Agyemang-Arredondo', N'Mehdi', N'', N'Agyemang-Arredondo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Interchange, transit hub level 4, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Ferrogate Transit Security officer, Kessler Interchange beat', N'Ferrogate Transit Security, Level 4 Officer; The Interchange', N'Mehdi Agyemang-Arredondo is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin and close-cropped natural hair threaded with copper wire implants that catch the platform lights when she turns her head. Her left eye is a standard-issue Ferrogate tactical unit — flat gray iris with a faint targeting reticle that glows amber when she''s scanning — but her right eye is entirely her own, warm brown and quick to crinkle with exhaustion or irritation. She wears her transit security uniform like armor, every crease deliberate, badge always centered. Off-shift she becomes almost unrecognizable, softer somehow, though the copper threads remain.

Mehdi Agyemang-Arredondo has the particular weariness of someone who has spent eleven years asking people to please move away from the yellow line. She is not cruel, not corrupt, not heroic — she is simply present, day after day, in a job that rewards no one. She has a sharp eye for trouble three seconds before it starts and a stubborn reluctance to escalate past what the situation actually needs. Her coworkers call her Brick because she doesn''t move.', N'Local authority figure — not corrupt enough to be a villain, not idealistic enough to be a hero. Can provide information about transit routes, recent incidents, missing persons who passed through the Interchange. A stabilizing presence in chaotic scenes. May request help off the books when official channels fail her.', N'', N'One Ferrogate-issue tactical eye (right eye natural). Copper wire neural threading through scalp — originally a cosmetic mod, now doubles as a low-grade sensory booster she paid to have upgraded on installment. Subdermal transit ID chip (standard Ferrogate issue).', N'Twelve-hour rotating shifts at Kessler Interchange, mostly crowd management, fare disputes, and hauling unconscious UBC recipients out of stairwells. On rest days she tends a small hydroponic gray zone in her Calumet Rise apartment and attends an E.L.F. devotional circle that prays to the spirit said to inhabit the Interchange''s oldest turnstile.', N'Mehdi Agyemang-Arredondo, transit security officer, 2226 neo-noir, deep warm bronze skin with golden undertones, prominent high cheekbones, straight nose bridge, blended global heritage features, close-cropped natural black hair with copper wire threading woven through scalp catching neon light, left eye cybernetic gray prosthetic with amber targeting reticle, right eye warm brown, athletic muscular build, 178cm tall, slight temple scar from eye installation, wearing crisp dark gray-blue Ferrogate Transit Security uniform with reflective striping and duty belt, standing at subway platform edge with methodical posture, station lighting casting sharp shadows, alert scan of crowd, industrial metal and fluorescent ambiance, gritty neo-noir atmosphere, professional security presence, detailed fabric texture on uniform, faint turnstile tattoo on wrist visible, utilitarian grooming --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Interchange', N'local', N'Kessler Interchange', N'Mehdi''s ancestry is a vibrant synthesis across three continents: Hispanic/Latin American (31.1%) and North African (29.1%) form the primary foundation, contributing to bone structure and facial geometry, while Sub-Saharan African ancestry (18.3%) deepens skin tone and adds to overall presence. Indigenous American heritage (10.2%) shapes cheekbone prominence and facial proportions, East Asian ancestry (9.0%) adds subtle eye shape characteristics, and South Asian elements (2.3%) create fine layering in features — a truly global genetic synthesis that defies simple categorization.', 178, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and muscular without being lean — a frame built for standing eight hours at a platform''s edge, moving crowds without relying on speed. Solid, grounded, resistant.', N'Natural deep black with copper wire threading', N'Close-cropped natural, parted slightly off-center, copper wire implants woven through scalp in deliberate patterns that catch light', N'Short', N'Left eye: flat gray tactical unit with amber targeting reticle; Right eye: warm brown, natural', N'Deep warm bronze with golden undertones — a rich, radiant blend reflecting North African warmth and Hispanic/Latin American heritage, significantly deepened by Sub-Saharan African ancestry, with subtle dimension from Indigenous American and East Asian genetics, creating an even complexion that darkens with sun exposure', N'Weathered but maintained — minimal makeup, skin shows sun exposure and fatigue lines around the eyes and mouth, prominent high cheekbones with strong flare from Indigenous American and North African ancestry, straight nose bridge with moderate width from blended heritage, subtle eye shape influenced by East Asian ancestry, grooming is utilitarian rather than decorative', N'Left eye is clearly prosthetic — flat gray iris with faint amber targeting reticle visible when scanning. Copper wire threading visible across the scalp, catching platform lighting. Subdermal transit ID chip is not externally visible. The tactical eye marks her as working security; the copper wires suggest either old-school chrome aesthetic or repurposed cosmetic modification.', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders relaxed but ready — a stance of presence rather than tension. Moves deliberately, economically, never rushed. Scans crowds with a methodical side-to-side head turn. Hands rest naturally, one often on duty belt. When off-shift, the posture loosens slightly but the attentiveness never fully leaves.', N'On-shift: Ferrogate Transit Security uniform (dark gray-blue with reflective striping, institutional cut, every seam crisp, badge centered at chest, duty belt with restraints and scanner). Off-shift: worn but maintained clothing from mid-tier retailers — fitted dark jeans, plain t-shirts in muted colors, a long synthetic jacket that''s been repaired at the seams. Practical shoes with decent tread. No jewelry except a small pin on her off-shift jacket: an E.L.F. circle symbol.', N'Three years ago she witnessed a supervisor falsify an incident report to cover a use-of-force complaint. She said nothing. The survivor was deported to a labor sector. She still has the real footage saved on a dead-drop drive she hasn''t decided what to do with.', N'Clipped, professional, with sudden moments of blunt warmth. Uses transit jargon naturally. Doesn''t swear on duty; does, fluently, off it.', N'Measured and unhurried, like someone conserving energy for the long shift', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'mehdi_agyemang_arredondo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69a-79d2-aaea-7e07a1d099d1', N'Chiaki Bui', N'Chiaki', N'', N'Bui', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Harrowgate Industrial Plateau, near Western and Division', N'Junk merchant and scrap reseller, the Gray Zone', N'Independent; the Gray Zone merchants informal collective; Oxidian Market vendors guild affiliate', N'Chiaki Bui occupies a corrugated-steel and salvaged-glass shop front on the Gray Zone''s lower tier that looks like it is in the process of being swallowed by its own inventory. He is a small, wiry man with a white beard he keeps in three thin braids, skin the color of weathered teak, and hands so scarred from decades of sorting metal that the lines of his palms are barely legible. He wears a permanent set of magnification lenses fused into his right eye socket — not glamorous chrome, but a bulky salvage job he did himself in the nineties and has never bothered to replace because it works. His shop smells of machine oil, rust, and a particular incense he burns for the E.L.F. he calls The Sorter, a data-spirit he believes governs the recovery of lost useful things.

Phúc has an almost supernatural sense for what a piece of junk is actually worth versus what it looks like. He can tell a Zheng-Dao servo actuator from a Sterling-Nakamura knockoff by weight alone, can date a circuit board by its oxidation pattern, and has declined to sell things to people he suspects will misuse them more times than he can count. He is gruff, unhurried, and comfortable with silence in a way that unnerves people who aren''t. He has no particular love for the city''s power structures and an active contempt for what he calls ''the fresh-chrome crowd'' — people who buy new augmentations they don''t understand while functional old tech rots in landfill.', N'Equipment and parts source. Can identify mysterious tech or weapons. Has deep historical knowledge of GLMZ''s industrial zones — knows what was built where and by whom. Potential quest giver if something valuable was brought to him that shouldn''t have been.', N'', N'Salvage-grade magnification lens fused into right eye socket (self-installed, functional, cosmetically rough). Reinforced finger joints — old Arcturus model, discontinued.', N'Opens the shop at 0800, sorts new acquisitions in the morning, receives visitors through the afternoon, does appraisal work by the lens-light in the evenings. Closes when he is tired.', N'Chiaki Bui, weathered 163cm salvage worker in 2226 GLMZ, deep mahogany-brown skin with golden undertones and sun damage, white braided hair pulled back, dark left eye natural, right eye hidden behind crude salvage-grade magnification lens with exposed brackets, extensive white scars across both hands and fingers, 3cm burn scar on right cheekbone, sparse white braided beard, deeply lined face with broad cheekbones blending Southeast Asian, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, and North African features, wiry lean muscular build, slightly forward hunched posture from decades at workbenches, wearing faded industrial work shirt with rolled sleeves, thick wool cardigan with darned holes, heavy canvas work pants with knee patches, aged leather boots, oil-stained canvas apron with tool pockets, brass charm talisman on neck cord, careful deliberate movements, industrial neo-noir setting with steel and rust, dramatic side lighting casting harsh shadows, gritty documentary realism, focused observant expression --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Mixed Southeast Asian (51.9%), South Asian (16.2%), Sub-Saharan African (12.5%), Indigenous American (11.7%), and North African (7.7%) ancestry—a genetic tapestry reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Features a rich blend: warm deep brown skin with golden and reddish undertones, facial structure combining Southeast Asian bone structure with Sub-Saharan and Indigenous American breadth, refined with South Asian and North African elements in the cheekbones and brow.', 163, 61, N'Wiry and lean, with the compact muscularity of someone who has spent decades moving heavy objects with precision. Shoulders slightly rounded from years hunched over workbenches. No excess fat; frame is efficient rather than frail despite his age.', N'White', N'Three thin braids, deliberately maintained, pulled back from the face', N'Medium (shoulder-length when braided)', N'Left eye: dark brown, natural. Right eye: obscured by magnification lens apparatus', N'Deep warm mahogany-brown with golden undertones and reddish warmth from his genetic heritage. Sun damage and age spots across the forehead and cheekbones—weathered from decades in industrial outdoor spaces, with underlying richness reflecting his Southeast Asian, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, and North African ancestry.', N'Deeply lined face, especially around the eyes and mouth, with prominent nasolabial folds and crow''s feet. Facial structure shows broad cheekbones characteristic of his African and Indigenous American heritage, refined by Southeast Asian bone structure and South Asian definition, with well-defined jawline. Beard is white and sparse, kept in three thin braids. Skin is leathery and sun-exposed but maintains the natural depth and richness of tone from his genetic heritage. No visible acne or dermatological issues; skin is dry but healthy.', N'Right eye socket contains a bulky salvage-grade magnification lens apparatus — not streamlined chrome but visibly rough, with exposed mounting brackets and an eyepiece that extends slightly outward. The installation is functional but cosmetically crude, clearly self-done. Both hands show reinforced finger joints (old Arcturus model) visible as subtle bronze-colored articulation points at knuckles, slightly thicker than natural bone structure would suggest.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical motion — no wasted energy. Slight forward hunch from years at workbenches. When handling objects, his movements are precise and careful, almost ritualistic. His gaze tends to linger on people and objects; he observes before responding. Comfortable with silence and stillness; rarely fidgets.', N'Tier 4-5 practical wear. Heavy canvas work pants with deep pockets, patched at the knees and thighs. Layered tops: a thermal base layer visible at the neck, worn over with a faded industrial-grade work shirt with rolled sleeves, and a thick wool cardigan with several darned holes. No corporate branding. Boots are well-maintained but visibly aged, leather worn smooth. A canvas apron with multiple tool pockets, permanently stained with machine oil and rust residue. No jewelry except for a thin cord around his neck from which hangs a small brass charm (the talisman for The Sorter).', N'Six years ago he found a Palladian corporate black-box data unit in a scrap haul. He has never powered it on but cannot bring himself to sell it. He doesn''t know what''s on it and he''s afraid to find out.', N'Terse, technical, precise. Heavy use of part-numbers and brand names as common nouns. Mixes archaic engineering slang with Southeast Asian-inflected Meridian standard.', N'Unhurried pauses between sentences. Lets silence do work.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chiaki_bui');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a731-78bc-abf6-7e40d79325d3', N'Hajar Nazari', N'Hajar', N'', N'Nazari', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 54, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — the Masjid al-Barzakh, a converted warehouse space above a water recycling plant, near Halsted and Division', N'Traditional imam and chrome prayer practitioner', N'Masjid al-Barzakh congregation; loosely networked with other independent religious leaders in Tier 1-2 areas; no corponation affiliation (deliberately)', N'Hajar Nazari is a compact, carefully composed man with close-trimmed gray at his temples and a beard he trims every third day without fail. His eyes are his most striking feature — he had them modded fifteen years ago with geometric patterned irises, deep green lattices that his congregation debated fiercely and that he defended from the pulpit as ''the geometry of creation written in the body.'' He dresses simply, always clean despite the Gray Zone''s perpetual grime, and his left hand is extensively modified: a chrome prosthetic from the wrist down, its surface etched with Quranic verses in his own handwriting before the plating was laid, so the words are pressed into the metal from beneath.

He is a man of precise intellectual convictions that he holds without brittleness — he has changed his mind publicly three times in twenty years and considers it among his proudest acts. His masjid serves roughly three hundred regular worshippers across a tangle of traditions: Sunni, Ismaili, Ahmadiyya, and several families who blend Islamic practice with E.L.F. veneration in ways that Hajar Nazari engages with theologically rather than dismissing. He moonlights as a chrome prayer practitioner, offering a practice that treats augmentation as a form of devotion — the modification of the God-given body as an act of trust rather than transgression.', N'Community authority and moral voice; offers a grounded traditional perspective on augmentation ethics; his congregation is a network of the Gray Zone residents who know everything happening locally; he can be a quest giver around community crises.', N'', N'Chrome left hand (wrist to fingertips), etched with Quranic verse beneath the plating. Patterned irises (green geometric lattice).', N'Fajr prayer before sunrise, then an hour of correspondence with worshippers who contact him via mesh. Administrative work midmorning, afternoon open for counsel. Jumu''ah sermon on Fridays draws people from three adjacent neighborhoods.', N'Hajar Nazari, Middle Eastern man with golden-olive complexion and warm amber undertones, 168cm, lean and compact build. Dark brown hair with silver temples, close-trimmed geometric beard, deep green geometric-patterned eyes. Wearing simple cream cotton thobe and dark trousers, sensible worn leather shoes. Left hand is matte patina-green chrome prosthetic with etched Quranic verse relief patterns. Fine prayer-line callus visible on forehead, small pale burn scar on right forearm. Upright posture, deliberate composed movement. Standing in industrial the Gray Zone lighting with soft shadows emphasizing angular face and the greenish patina of the chrome hand. GLMZ setting, low-key warm lighting, contemplative mood. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Middle Eastern (80.8%) with meaningful blending of Hispanic/Latin American (11.1%) and Sub-Saharan African (8.1%) ancestry — a richly layered diaspora reflecting the Ubiquitous mixing of 2226. Genetic expression shows the fine-boned angular features and natural skin richness of Middle Eastern heritage, warmed and deepened by Sub-Saharan and Hispanic admixture, creating a complexion with golden-amber undertones and subtle warmth throughout.', 168, 72, N'Compact and lean, shoulders slightly rounded from decades of forward-bending prayer posture. Wiry muscle beneath modest frame, no excess weight — disciplined by routine and modest means.', N'Dark brown with silver-gray at temples and threading through his close-trimmed beard', N'Close-trimmed throughout, beard maintained with geometric precision (trimmed every third day without exception)', N'Short', N'Deep green with fine geometric lattice pattern etched across iris surface — concentric circles and interlocking polygons, visible in direct light', N'Warm golden-olive, richly blended from Middle Eastern base warmed and deepened by Sub-Saharan and Hispanic ancestry components. Deepened further by age and the Gray Zone''s industrial light cycles, with subtle amber luminosity beneath the surface. Even tone with natural depth.', N'Clean and careful despite environment — skin shows age lines around eyes and mouth, grooming meticulous. No visible acne scarring. A man who washes with intention. Fine-textured with naturally even warm tone, facial structure showing the fine-boned features, angular planes and natural warmth characteristic of the ancestral blend — Middle Eastern angularity softened and deepened by Sub-Saharan and Hispanic genetic contribution.', N'Left hand is a full chrome prosthetic (wrist to fingertips) with etched Quranic verse pressed into the metal surface beneath the plating, creating subtle relief patterns visible at close range. The chrome is not polished mirror-bright but matte with a faint greenish patina from age and prayer oils. Patterned irises in both eyes — geometric green lattices clearly visible, especially in dim light.', N'Upright, composed, economical in gesture. Moves with deliberate slowness — no wasted motion. Hands gesture when speaking but the chrome left hand moves with slightly more caution, as if aware of its weight and edge. When sitting, he sits fully upright rather than slouching. When standing, feet shoulder-width apart, grounded.', N'Simple, clean, Tier 3 practical. Usually a loose cotton thobe or simple long-sleeved shirt in cream, off-white, or pale gray — fabric choices that hide the Gray Zone''s dust. Dark trousers, well-maintained. Leather prayer cap (kufi) worn during formal hours, removed during informal counsel. No jewelry except occasionally a very old silver ring on his right hand. Shoes are sensible, worn but cared for. Clothing never bearing corporate logos or tier markers — deliberately unmarked.', N'The chrome hand is not entirely his — the prosthetic was originally made for a black-market augmentation dealer he knew before he became imam. The man died in a raid. Yusuf, then newly injured and unable to afford proper prosthetics, paid almost nothing for the hand. He has never disclosed where it came from, and the etched verses were partly an act of consecration and partly an act of burial.', N'Formal and precise without being cold. Comfortable with technical augmentation language, Islamic theological terms, and the Gray Zone slang — code-switches fluidly.', N'Measured, with a slight Georgian lilt from his Kereselidze grandmother. Rarely raises his voice; the lower he speaks the more people lean in.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hajar_nazari');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6be-7645-acc5-7e6dd9081fd5', N'Hinata Mori-Esquivel-Jaramillo', N'Hinata', N'', N'Mori-Esquivel-Jaramillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 14, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Abyssal Threshold transit tunnels, ranging to Deepwell Station, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'tunnel guide, age 14, Bore Rat born-under', N'Bore Rat community, Abyssal Threshold settlement cluster', N'Hinata Mori-Esquivel-Jaramillo is small even for fourteen — wiry and quick, with a narrow face, enormous dark eyes adapted from birth to low-light environments, and a mop of hair they dye with bioluminescent mushroom paste in a stripe of vivid green that serves as both personal style and emergency light source. Their skin is medium brown with a faint warmth to it, and they have a long scar across their left palm from a ferrogate grate incident at age nine. No purchased augmentations — they were born underground and their body has simply adapted: exceptional night vision within human range, an instinctive spatial memory for tunnel architecture, and a sensitivity to air-pressure changes that surface people simply don''t develop.

Hinata Mori-Esquivel-Jaramillo has never been to the surface. They have seen photographs and once watched a thirty-second video of rain, which they found both beautiful and deeply suspicious. They guide people — Bore Rats moving between settlements, occasional surface-dwellers who need to travel without Ferrogate Transit records, journalists, the desperate — through a network of tunnels they have memorized the way other children memorize games. They are cheerful in a way that seems impossible given their circumstances, and the cheer is entirely genuine, which makes some adults profoundly uncomfortable.', N'Indispensable guide for any party moving through the underworld; local color; moral complication (a child doing dangerous work in a world that has simply normalized it)', N'', N'none purchased; born-under adaptations (low-light vision, pressure sensitivity) — not augmentations, just development', N'Sleeps in a hammock strung between two conduit pipes; wakes when they wake, which varies; takes jobs from the settlement board or from word-of-mouth referrals; spends downtime teaching younger children tunnel mnemonics and playing a card game they invented.', N'Hinata Mori-Esquivel-Jaramillo, 148cm wiry compact frame, warm medium brown skin with golden undertones from multiethnic heritage—East Asian, Latin American, African, Northern European, and Indigenous American blend. Round face with sharp emerging cheekbones, almond-shaped dark brown eyes with slight epicanthic folds, perpetual focused squint. Shoulder-length dark brown hair with vivid bioluminescent green stripe on left side, matted from tunnel dust. Long pale scar across left palm from ferrogate incident, minor calluses on hands. Wearing oversized layered grays and blacks, patched synthetic jacket, rope belt, bare feet. Necklace of polished ferrogate bolt salvage. Pale from underground life. Compact, folded posture, hands expressive. GLMZ, born-under tunnels of GLMZ, low-light adapted pupils, no augmentations. Dark industrial tunnel setting with bioluminescent fungi, accent lighting on green hair stripe, shadows emphasizing cheekbones and focused expression, gritty texture, moody underground atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Abyssal Threshold transit tunnels', N'local', N'Abyssal Threshold transit tunnels', N'Complex multiethnic heritage: 43.4% Hispanic/Latin American, 22.1% Northern European, 13.4% East Asian, 12.3% Sub-Saharan African, 7.8% Indigenous American, 1.0% South Asian. This blend creates distinctive features: warm medium brown skin with golden undertones and subtle olive cast, slightly prominent cheekbones with gentle angularity from East Asian and Indigenous American ancestry, dark almond-shaped eyes with subtle epicanthic folds, and facial structure reflecting the warmth of Latin American and African heritage combined with Northern European bone structure and definition.', 148, 38, N'Wiry and compact—lean muscle from constant tunnel navigation, no excess body fat, joints that seem slightly hypermobile from years of squeezing through tight passages', N'Natural dark brown with a vivid bioluminescent green stripe dyed with fermented mushroom paste', N'Shoulder-length mop, somewhat matted and tangled from tunnel dust, asymmetrically parted with the green stripe running through the left side', N'Medium', N'Very dark brown, pupils notably dilated even in normal light—adapted for low-light environments', N'Warm medium brown with golden and subtle olive undertones, slightly pallid from lifelong underground residence. The coloration reflects the blended Latin American, African, East Asian, and Northern European ancestry, creating rich depth with warmth and complexity beneath the surface.', N'Round face with emerging sharp cheekbones; almond-shaped eyes with slight epicanthic folds; clear skin with minor tunnel grime that never quite washes out; no facial hair; slight perpetual squint-and-focus expression from reading tunnel shadows. Facial structure shows the warmth and angularity characteristic of the multiethnic genetic blend, with bone prominence reflecting East Asian and Indigenous American contributions balanced by Northern European definition.', N'None. Their adaptations are biological—born-under development, not chrome or implants. The bioluminescent hair stripe is cosmetic dye, not augmentation.', N'Moves with unselfconscious grace through tight spaces; tendency to duck and turn sideways even in spacious areas. Sits in compact, folded positions. Hands are expressive and quick. Eyes constantly track air currents and acoustic shadows. Gait is quick and efficient, rarely wastes motion.', N'Tier 5 born-under practical: layered oversized hand-me-downs from adult Bore Rats, mostly grays and blacks to hide tunnel dust. A patched synthetic jacket with multiple pockets. Rope belt holding up pants that don''t quite fit. Bare feet or thick socks (no shoes—better tactile feedback for tunnel navigation). A necklace of polished ferrogate bolts salvaged from old passages. No brands, no status symbols, nothing that costs Φ.', N'They found a sealed maintenance room two years ago that has a functioning surface-link terminal — they visit it sometimes to watch weather feeds and have told no one, treating it as a private shrine to a world they might never reach.', N'tunnel slang mixed with surprisingly formal phrasing picked up from guiding educated clients — the combination is jarring and charming', N'fast, enthusiastic, tends to talk while moving so sentences trail off as they turn corners', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hinata_mori_esquivel_jaramillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ee-7bdd-bccd-7eea56e8f279', N'Emiliano Valenzuela', N'Emiliano', N'', N'Valenzuela', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Halsted and Division', N'Underground transit runner and informal district mapper', N'Unaffiliated; operates a loose cooperative of transit runners known informally as the Lowline Collective, which has no official name, no hierarchy, and no documentation', N'Emiliano Valenzuela is a broad-shouldered man of Nigerian-German descent with close-cropped hair going grey at the temples despite his age, a consequence of two years spent living in the sub-basement radiation corridors that connect the Gray Zone to Old Harbor. His skin is deep brown and mapped with faint chemical burns along his left forearm, souvenirs from a freight detonation he survived by crawling through a coolant runoff pipe. He dresses in layered work clothes stripped of all corporate insignia, the pockets reinforced and numbered in his own hand-stitched code so he can find anything in the dark without looking.', N'Ground-level connective tissue — the character who makes the city''s hidden logistics visible to the reader while embodying the moral cost of neutrality in a system that isn''t neutral', N'', N'Subdermal haptic compass implant in left wrist — gives directional feedback through skin pressure rather than display,Low-light retinal overlay with manual toggle, older model, frequently glitches in high-humidity tunnels,Bone-anchored earpiece for encrypted short-range comms, the antenna visible as a faint ridge behind his right ear', N'Wakes before dawn in a rotating set of crash spaces across the Gray Zone, never the same two nights running. Spends mornings doing physical route checks — walking sections of his network, noting changes in access, marking anything new. Eats on the move, usually from the same three vendors who know not to ask questions. Afternoons are coordination: meeting runners, updating maps, resolving disputes. Evenings are the only time he stops, usually in a particular maintenance alcove overlooking the Gray Zone grid where the ambient light from the Circuit makes the city look almost intentional.', N'Emiliano Valenzuela, a 188cm powerfully built tunnel navigator in the GLMZ 2226, standing in industrial low-light environment. Deep warm brown skin with golden and olive undertones reflecting Southeast Asian, South Asian, and African heritage. Moderate cheekbones, medium-width nasal bridge, subtle epicanthic eye fold. Deep brown eyes with faint scarring at left outer corner from neural interface. Dark brown hair with greying temples, closely cropped. Weathered face showing fine lines, habitually pale from low-light work. Layered charcoal and slate grey utilitarian work clothes, heavily stained from tunnel residue, reinforced pockets hand-stitched with faded numerical code. Long-worn canvas jacket with custom pockets. Heavy-soled tactical boots. Faint visible scarring across left forearm in chemical burn pattern. Subtle ridge visible behind right ear from bone-anchored antenna. Tungsten ring on left index finger. Posture forward-leaning, compact, economical movement. Standing in dimly lit industrial tunnel or maintenance corridor with cold metallic lighting, faint glow from retinal overlay implant visible in shadows. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, gritty and functional, atmospheric blue-grey lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Southeast Asian (35.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (22.2%), East Asian (12.7%), Middle Eastern (10.9%), Sub-Saharan African (10%), South Asian (8.6%) — a complex global diaspora creating a distinctive phenotype. Southeast Asian bone structure dominates with moderate cheekbone prominence and medium-width nasal bridge; warm deep brown skin blended from African and South Asian ancestry with golden and olive undertones from Middle Eastern heritage; subtle epicanthic eye shape from East Asian admixture creates distinctive gaze', 188, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and powerfully built through years of crawling through tight transit corridors; carries himself with the compact efficiency of someone who has learned to move through spaces smaller than his frame', N'Dark brown with premature greying at temples', N'Close-cropped, pragmatic cut maintained with clippers rather than professional grooming', N'Short', N'Deep brown with subtle epicanthic fold from East Asian ancestry, faint neural interface scarring at outer edge of left eye from retinal overlay implant', N'Warm medium-deep brown with rich golden undertones from Southeast Asian and South Asian heritage, grounded by Sub-Saharan African depth, with subtle olive undertones from Middle Eastern ancestry', N'Weathered beyond his 34 years; moderate cheekbone prominence reflecting Southeast Asian ancestry; medium-width nasal bridge with slight broadness reflecting South Asian admixture; slightly rounded facial contours balanced by subtle Middle Eastern angularity. Skin has the particular pallor of someone who avoids direct sunlight, with fine lines around the eyes from constant low-light work. Warm undertone visible beneath surface despite habitually low-light existence', N'Bone-anchored earpiece antenna visible as a subtle ridge and slight discoloration behind right ear; occasional faint glow from low-light retinal overlay during darkness or when system cycles. Left wrist shows no visible marks from haptic compass implant but skin texture slightly different in circular pattern. Neural interface scarring barely visible at outer corner of left eye to anyone looking closely.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion, shoulders slightly forward from habitual navigation through confined spaces. Walks with a particular rhythm, feet testing ground before committing weight, a consequence of blind navigation in dark tunnels. Often touches his left wrist without thinking, a habitual check for directional feedback. Favors his right side slightly when standing still, distributing weight asymmetrically.', N'Layered work clothes in charcoal and slate grey with all corporate tags and insignia removed; utilitarian pants with reinforced pocket seams hand-stitched with numbered code markers; undershirts that can be shed quickly in high-temperature tunnels; a long-worn canvas jacket with custom-modified internal pockets that don''t clink or rattle. Everything is stained with tunnel residue but meticulously organized. No jewelry except a single tungsten ring worn on left index finger — functional, not decorative. Footwear is heavy-soled boots with custom inserts for balance in flooded corridors. Tier 4 practical, deliberately unmarked.', N'Three years ago he handed a route map to someone he believed was a mutual-aid courier. That person sold it to a Spire logistics firm, and six families in the Gray Zone lost their informal market stalls when the corp rerouted a supply chain through their block. He has never told anyone. He destroyed the map and rebuilt the network from scratch, but he still sees those families'' faces.', N'Practical, directional, spatial metaphors dominate. Uses transit and infrastructure language even in emotional conversations. Avoids abstractions unless he can anchor them to a place.', N'Measured and even, like someone dictating notes. Pauses are deliberate, not nervous. Rarely raises his voice.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'emiliano_valenzuela');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a629-7f59-b5ee-7f14ac3ea3e4', N'Buyisile Traoré-Magnúsdóttir', N'Buyisile', N'', N'Traoré-Magnúsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lakeview Neon, studio above a defunct Ferrogate Transit substation, near Damen and Armitage', N'Neon artist and light sculptor', N'Independent; loosely connected to the Lakeview Neon artist commune', N'Buyisile Traoré-Magnúsdóttir is a tall woman with the deliberate stillness of someone who has spent decades bending glass tubes in 2200-degree flame — her movements are economical, almost ceremonial. Her hands are a map of minor burns, the skin on her fingers puckered and shining, and she wears them openly, never covered. She has warm umber skin, close-cropped silver hair she grew out early and refused to dye, and irises she had modified to emit a soft amber glow so she can check tube color balance in the dark without a lamp. A single bioluminescent stripe runs down the left side of her jaw — a gift from her daughter, applied with a gene-brush on Buyisile Traoré-Magnúsdóttir''s forty-first birthday against Buyisile Traoré-Magnúsdóttir''s stated preferences, which softened the moment she saw it.

She is known in Lakeview Neon and the broader art underground as someone who makes sacred objects that happen to glow. Her installations are not decorative — they are theological arguments rendered in argon and mercury vapor. She has spent the last six years constructing a piece called The Unfinished Choir, a room-sized array of suspended neon tubes tuned to the resonant frequencies she believes correspond to six different E.L.F. signatures she has personally documented. Whether or not the E.L.F.s notice, visitors report feeling watched. She sells smaller pieces to pay rent and guards the Choir with a ferocity that borders on maternal.', N'Quest giver for ELF-related investigations; supplier of illegal light installations for underground venues; keeper of a location that may be genuinely spiritually significant; source on Lakeview Neon history and politics', N'', N'Amber-glow iris modification (cosmetic); bioluminescent jaw stripe (geneware, cosmetic); heat-resistant dermis overlay on both hands (practical, Tier 1 medical-grade)', N'She rises before dawn to check tube integrity in the Choir room, documents any ELF activity in a handwritten log, then spends the morning doing commission work before the afternoon light shifts and she loses her color calibration window. Evenings she holds court at the substation — other artists drift in, she feeds them reheated grain porridge, and they argue about whether neon is dead.', N'Portrait of Buyisile Traoré-Magnúsdóttir, 183cm tall lean artist with deep bronze skin and golden undertones blending East Asian, Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic ancestry. Silver-white close-cropped asymmetrical hair revealing a thin glowing amber-white bioluminescent stripe running from left cheekbone to jawline. Angular face with high pronounced cheekbones, deep-set amber-glowing modified irises that emit soft bioluminescence in low light, fine lines around eyes from decades of precision glasswork. Puckered heat-resistant burn scars across both hands with lustrous pearlescent dermis overlay, smaller circular burn marks on forearms. Wears charcoal gray fire-resistant work apron over dark synthfiber long-sleeve shirt, loose tapered canvas trousers cuffed at ankles, worn leather steel-toed boots. Thin fused glass scrap bracelet on right wrist. Posture deliberate and economical, hands held slightly forward palms open, head tilted left, distant listening expression. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, studio lighting casting warm amber light across scarred hands, precise and meditative mood, dark background emphasizing glowing irises and jaw stripe --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lakeview Neon', N'local', N'Lakeview Neon', N'East Asian (36.6%), Southeast Asian (27.2%), Sub-Saharan African (24.3%), and Hispanic/Latin American (11.9%) ancestry — a striking global blend. The East and Southeast Asian ancestry dominates her facial structure with angular cheekbones and deep-set eyes, while Sub-Saharan African heritage contributes pronounced jaw definition and facial width. The Hispanic/Latin American component enriches her overall skin depth and warmth.', 183, 68, N'Lean and sinewy, with the efficient musculature of someone who has spent four decades working overhead in controlled heat. Shoulders broad from repetitive precise movements; posture naturally upright from balancing glass tubes.', N'Silver-white, natural — allowed to gray in her mid-thirties', N'Close-cropped, textured, with an asymmetrical fade on the left side that reveals the jaw augmentation', N'Short', N'Amber-glow modified irises; warm brown beneath the bioluminescent tint', N'Deep warm bronze with golden undertones, richly melanated from both Sub-Saharan African and East/Southeast Asian ancestry, further sun-deepened from studio work near high-temperature glass — creating a matte finish with luminous warmth', N'Angular face with high pronounced cheekbones reflecting East and Southeast Asian structure combined with broader facial width from Sub-Saharan African heritage, deep-set eyes, minimal grooming beyond essential cleanliness. Skin shows fine lines around eyes and mouth from decades of precision work and squinting into flame. No makeup. Expression often distant, as though listening to something others cannot hear.', N'Amber-glowing irises are immediately noticeable in low light, giving her gaze an otherworldly quality. The bioluminescent jaw stripe is her most striking modification — a deliberate statement rather than concealable. Both hands show visible heat-resistant dermis overlay, a medical-grade mod that gives her skin a subtle pearlescent sheen across scarred areas. Under close inspection, the overlay material has a slightly different texture than natural skin.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion. Hands held slightly forward, palms open, as though always ready to steady a tube or adjust a fixture. Head tilts often to the left, perhaps to better see with the glowing irises. When listening, she goes very still; when working, she enters a near-meditative state where her entire body becomes an instrument for precision. She rarely gestures when speaking.', N'Tier 3 working artist aesthetic. Usually wears fire-resistant canvas work aprons in charcoal gray or black over fitted long-sleeve shirts (synthfiber blend, dark colors to hide burns). Loose tapered trousers in natural cotton or canvas, cuffed at the ankles, with reinforced pockets. Worn leather steel-toed boots, scuffed and repaired many times. A single piece of jewelry: a thin bracelet of fused glass scraps from her early work, worn on the right wrist. No corporate branding. Occasionally a long linen coat in cream or gray over everything when traveling through Tier 1 areas — a concession to blending in, worn with obvious reluctance.', N'The ELF she has been documenting and building toward is real — it has been communicating with her through minute variations in tube flicker for four years. She has not told anyone because she is terrified of what it might be asking her to do.', N'Precise and unhurried; favors material metaphors — everything is described in terms of pressure, temperature, containment, or release', N'Long sentences with embedded pauses, as if she is choosing each word off a tray; rarely uses contractions', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'buyisile_traor_magn_sd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5da-7fa9-a754-7fbf4eb962fe', N'Domitila Deshpande-Deshpande', N'Domitila', N'', N'Deshpande-Deshpande', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 37, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Pilsen Veil, near Western and Division', N'Gene-mod body artist and tattoo practitioner', N'Independent; Skin Liturgy (own studio); loose affiliation with the Pilsen Veil Artists'' Cooperative; The Reclaimed', N'Domitila Deshpande-Deshpande is a living portfolio. Every visible inch of their skin below the neck is a demonstration of their craft: shifting bioluminescent patterns that bloom and fade with body temperature, embedded chromatic scales along their shoulders that catch light like a starling''s wing, and a full sleeve of reactive biosymbolism on their left arm that darkens in cold and brightens in warmth. They keep their face deliberately unmodified — a professional choice to let clients focus on the work, not compete with it. They are stocky and deliberate in movement, with close-cropped natural hair and dark eyes that have the quality of paying careful attention.

Their shop, Skin Liturgy, is a converted ground-floor space in a reclaimed building in Pilsen Veil, hung with examples of their work on cured synthetic skin panels. Domitila Deshpande-Deshpande approaches body modification as spiritual practice, not fashion — each piece is preceded by a long consultation they call ''reading,'' in which they try to understand what a client is trying to become rather than what they think they want. This makes them slow, selective, and expensive relative to their tier, and clients come from across the city. They are professionally gentle and personally guarded, with a dry wit that emerges only when they''re comfortable.', N'Gateway to Pilsen Veil''s art community; can identify geneware brands and quality; long-term character relationship builder; can provide physical transformation as a story beat', N'', N'Extensive cosmetic geneware (bioluminescent dermal patterns, chromatic scale implants, reactive biosymbolism sleeve); subdermal steadying implants in their hands for fine work precision; olfactory enhancement to detect rejection responses in fresh modifications', N'Consultations by appointment only in the mornings; actual modification work in the afternoons; evenings reserved for their own ongoing self-modification and design work.', N'Domitila Deshpande-Deshpande, 168cm tall professional geneware artist, warm deep brown skin with golden undertones reflecting South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian heritage, strong cheekbones and defined jawline, short dark brown close-cropped hair, dark unmodified eyes with steady focused gaze. Sleeveless charcoal mesh top showcasing bioluminescent cyan-violet patterns across broad shoulders and torso, chromatic scale implants refracting iridescent greens and purples, full reactive biosymbolism sleeve on left arm in luminous gold and deep indigo, fine precision scars at thumbs. Stocky powerful build, grounded posture, hands resting with steadiness. Worn leather apron with iridescent traces. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, precision-focused demeanor, professional workspace with soft ambient lighting highlighting bioluminescent augmentations, composed and deliberate presence --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Pilsen Veil', N'local', N'Pilsen Veil', N'Complex polyglot ancestry with South Asian as dominant foundation (37.6%), deeply interwoven with Sub-Saharan African (20.4%), Southeast Asian (15.5%), Eastern European (11.5%), East Asian (11.2%), and Hispanic/Latin American (3.8%) threads. The genetic composition creates a striking multi-continental blend reflecting harmonic interplay across three continents—South Asian warmth and structure, African depth and presence, Southeast Asian refinement, with Eastern European angularity and East Asian definition subtly grounding the overall physiognomy.', 168, 82, N'Stocky and deliberate, broad-shouldered with dense muscle distribution. Powerful hands with visible steadiness despite their apparent relaxation—a body engineered for precision work.', N'Natural dark brown, nearly black', N'Close-cropped, shaped close to the scalp with clean geometric lines', N'Short', N'Dark brown, unmodified, with unusual depth of focus', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones—a rich blending of South Asian warmth (37.6%), Sub-Saharan African depth and presence (20.4%), and Southeast Asian richness (15.5%), with Eastern European structure providing subtle cool undertones beneath. Luminous beneath surface, particularly where bioluminescent augmentations activate.', N'Smooth and carefully maintained despite extensive modifications. The face itself is deliberately unadorned—a professional canvas. Moderately high to prominent cheekbones reflecting East and Southeast Asian ancestry (26.7% combined), balanced with broader nasal structure and fuller lip contours reflecting South Asian (37.6%) and Sub-Saharan African (20.4%) heritage. Strong, defined jawline with subtle angular cheekbone structure from Eastern European ancestry (11.5%) underlying the warmer tones. Composed expression that suggests someone accustomed to listening more than speaking.', N'Extensive cosmetic geneware throughout the body below the neck—bioluminescent patterns, chromatic scales, and reactive biosymbols that are functional demonstrations of their craft. Hands show the telltale microtremor-correction of subdermal steadying implants when held at rest. Face deliberately unmodified by choice. Olfactory enhancement is invisible but detectable only through their behavior (sniffing new clients during consultations).', N'Deliberate and grounded. Moves with the economy of someone accustomed to precision—no wasted motion. Stands with weight balanced evenly, often with hands at rest in their lap or on a work surface. Maintains strong eye contact when listening, gaze steady and measuring. The overall impression is of someone who has learned to be still.', N'Tier 3-4 workwear with intentional elegance. Custom-fitted sleeveless shirts or mesh tops to showcase their work, usually in neutral tones (black, charcoal, deep grey) so the bioluminescent patterns read clearly. Fitted trousers or modified tactical cargo in high-quality synthetic blends. Minimal jewelry—function over decoration. Worn leather apron during work hours, stained with iridescent traces of geneware application. Soft-soled shoes suited for standing during long consultations. Everything is immaculate and deliberately chosen, with no logos or branding—the work speaks for itself.', N'Three years ago they did a significant gene-mod for a client who was clearly in a dissociative mental health crisis; they completed the work against their better judgment because the client''s payment covered Skin Liturgy''s rent for four months. The client disappeared afterward and Chiamaka does not know if they are alive.', N'Careful and specific, never uses approximate language about bodies or modification; unexpectedly lyrical when discussing the philosophy of their work', N'Even and measured, with a quality of weighing words before releasing them', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'domitila_deshpande_deshpande');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6de-7a0e-ad42-7fddc4900976', N'Farideh Čabarkapa-Sow', N'Farideh', N'', N'Čabarkapa-Sow', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Shallowgrave, a rented unit above a recycling processor in Blackpipe Corridor, near Halsted and Division', N'Identity fabricator and document forger', N'Unaffiliated independent; occasional contract work for the Kulunda Compact when they can''t get someone better', N'Farideh Čabarkapa-Sow is slight and fidgety, with the kind of face that people struggle to describe afterward — deliberately so. They have medium-brown skin and keep their hair a different color every two weeks, courtesy of color-changing follicle geneware, currently a deep teal that fades to bronze at the tips. They have a faint bioluminescent pulse along their collarbones that they usually cover with high-necked clothing, a mod from a phase a few years ago that they haven''t had removed because it costs more to undo than to keep. Their fingers are rarely still — they''re always rolling something between them, a stylus, a coin, a small tool — and they tend to look at surfaces rather than people when they talk, as though they''re reading information off of whatever they''re looking at.

Farideh Čabarkapa-Sow is brilliant at the specific thing they do, which is making people into other people on paper — or, more precisely, in the vast interlocking authentication lattices that determine who gets to be who in GLMZ. They design identities the way some people design architecture: with attention to load-bearing details, to how structures weather over time, to what fails first under pressure. They work alone, price fairly by Shallowgrave standards, and have a waiting list. They do not take jobs that feel like someone is going to die because of the identity. They are not always right about when that is.', N'Service provider for characters who need new identities or documents; information source on who has needed to disappear and why; can be a quest giver when a client''s situation becomes dangerous; represents the underground infrastructure of survival in a surveillance city', N'', N'Color-changing hair geneware; bioluminescent collarbone stripe (mostly covered); micro-focus optical implants in both eyes for fine print and substrate authentication work', N'Keeps chaotic hours — active in deep night, sleeps through the morning. Spends most of their working time at a cluttered desk surrounded by substrate samples, authentication tokens, and three different screens. Eats delivery food exclusively. Prays to the Blackpipe E.L.F. network for protection from authentication sweeps.', N'Farideh Čabarkapa-Sow, 2226 neo-noir substrate worker, 163cm slight wiry frame hunched over workstation. Warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones blending Eastern European, Northern European, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Sharp angular cheekbones, defined jawline, fine features with prominent nose bridge definition. Dark brown eyes with faint crystalline optical implant patterns at inner corners. Shoulder-length teal-to-bronze ombre hair pulled back with stylus, nervous energy radiating from restless posture. High-necked black compression shirt concealing pale blue-white bioluminescent collarbone stripe (subtle glow visible), fitted charcoal synthweave cargo pants, worn knockoff sneakers, faded oversized jacket draped over shoulders. Chronic dark circles under eyes, perpetually unfocused expression looking past camera. Single functional cable bracelet. Nocturnal pallor, coffee stains on clothing. Dimly lit workspace with blue-green monitor glow and cool neo-noir neon ambient lighting, close-cropped to torso and hands fidgeting with small tools. Moody, introspective, technical atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shallowgrave', N'local', N'Shallowgrave', N'Eastern European dominant (54.4%) with significant Northern European (25.0%) and Sub-Saharan African (20.6%) ancestry—a genuine Ubiquitous Diaspora blend. The genetic combination produces warm-toned medium-brown skin with characteristic feature blending: sharp Eastern European bone structure refined by African heritage elements, creating an angular, fine-featured face with subtle warmth in undertones.', 163, 52, N'Slight and wiry, minimal muscle mass, the kind of frame that seems to compress into itself when they sit — all nervous energy and sharp angles', N'Deep teal fading to bronze at the tips (color-changing follicle geneware, rotated every two weeks)', N'Shoulder-length, often pulled back with a wire or stylus stuck through it, deliberately unstyled', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with subtle optical implant lens artifacts visible under close inspection', N'Warm medium-brown—Eastern European base enriched by Sub-Saharan African and Northern European heritage, creating a complex tone with subtle golden undertones that shifts in different light', N'High, sharp cheekbones from Eastern European ancestry; angular, defined jawline; fine-featured with characteristic Sub-Saharan African nose bridge width and definition. Clear skin with chronic pallor from nocturnal habits; expression often unfocused, eyes tracking surfaces rather than faces.', N'Micro-focus optical implants visible as faint crystalline patterns at the inner corners of both eyes when light hits at certain angles; bioluminescent collarbone stripe when exposed. Otherwise augmentations are subcutaneous or non-visible.', N'Perpetually restless — fidgets constantly with objects (stylus, coin, small tools) that cycle between their fingers. Sits hunched over work surfaces. Speaks while looking at walls, screens, or objects rather than making eye contact. Moves with efficient, nervous energy; rarely still.', N'Tier 4 working-class practical: high-necked long-sleeved compression shirts in dark colors to cover collarbone stripe; fitted black or charcoal synthweave pants with multiple cargo pockets; worn Blackpipe Corridor knockoff sneakers. Layers with a faded oversized jacket or hooded sweater for movement between workspace and delivery sites. Minimal jewelry — a single wire or cable bracelet, functional not decorative. Clothes show wear and coffee stains; practical over aesthetic.', N'Their own legal identity is built on a fabrication — they have no recoverable original documentation. They were born in circumstances they''ve never fully investigated, to parents who may have been running from something. They have constructed four layers of identity around the gap, but the gap is still there, and sometimes they find themselves trying to forge backward into their own past.', N'Technical and specific when talking about work, scattered and associative on everything else. Uses printing and architecture metaphors constantly.', N'Fast and uneven — speeds up when interested, trails off when distracted by a thought, sometimes leaves sentences incomplete', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'farideh_abarkapa_sow');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a623-7493-8e94-804a033078d7', N'Avani Bautista-Wójcik-Dlamini', N'Avani', N'', N'Bautista-Wójcik-Dlamini', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 59, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Burnside Corridor — transit hub connecting the Gray Zone to Circuit, near North Ave and Damen', N'Corporate espionage and data exfiltration — data thief', N'Independent — Dockside connections; The Glass Ladder', N'Avani Bautista-Wójcik-Dlamini are tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 59, their face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation — and they make no effort to hide it.

They grew up in the Narrows, where the walls are so close together you learn to fight in confined spaces or you learn to lose. They work as a data thief out of Burnside Corridor, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Avani Bautista-Wójcik-Dlamini operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'As a data thief, Halima Akerblom-Manu embodies the tension between independence and isolation. They are a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation. Cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rings', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Avani Bautista-Wójcik-Dlamini, lean 183cm frame with rawboned efficiency, warm golden-brown skin with bronze and amber undertones blending Sub-Saharan, Eastern European, Hispanic, Middle Eastern and South Asian heritage. Angular face with prominent high cheekbones, sharp jaw, broad cheekbones and full lips refined by Eastern European bone structure. Salt-and-pepper gray hair in tight practical braid secured with steel cable tie. Chrome iris rings with amber pupils, cybernetic implants glowing faintly. Wired reflex ports visible along neck as metallic nodes with blue bioluminescence. Surgical scar on left temple, three parallel white burn marks across right forearm, small compass rose tattoo on wrist. Black fitted synthetic bodysuit with thermal-damping weave, lightweight gray tech-jacket with reflective piping, worn expensive boots. Standing in alert posture with shoulders forward, weight on balls of feet. Calculating gaze scanning environment. Neo-noir neon lighting casting blue and amber shadows, slightly underlit to highlight augmentation glow. Mood: ready, efficient, dangerous. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Burnside Corridor', N'local', N'Burnside Corridor', N'Complex Pan-African, Eastern European, Hispanic/Latin American, Middle Eastern, and South Asian blend — 37.6% Sub-Saharan African ancestry dominates, with significant Eastern European (23.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (18.8%), and Middle Eastern (14.8%) heritage, rounded by 5.7% South Asian. The result is a face and frame that resists easy categorization, drawing strength from five continental regions in a distinctly Ubiquitous Diaspora combination.', 183, 68, N'Rawboned and lean — minimal body fat, long limbs built for speed rather than power. Decades of confined-space combat training have carved efficiency into every muscle. No wasted mass.', N'Salt-and-pepper gray with natural dark undertones', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid secured with a steel cable tie', N'Long', N'Chrome iris rings with amber pupil dilation — cybernetic enhancement visible in lowlight', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle bronze and amber undertones — the complexion of someone who spends more time in artificial light than sunlight, carrying the blended warmth of Sub-Saharan and Hispanic/Latin American heritage with refined bone structure influenced by Eastern European ancestry and Middle Eastern warmth', N'Lean, angular face with prominent high cheekbones and a sharp, defined jaw. The bone structure reflects the multi-continental ancestry — broad cheekbones and full lips characteristic of Sub-Saharan and Hispanic/Latin American heritage, refined by the angular features and tighter facial planes of Eastern European ancestry, with subtle Middle Eastern influence in the nose bridge prominence and eye placement. Warm bronze undertones beneath the golden-brown skin create depth and dimension. Skin is weathered but clean — no cosmetic concern, only functional maintenance. Lines around the eyes from decades of focus. The face resists easy categorization — distinctly their own.', N'Chrome iris rings with faint LED glow in thermal mode. Wired reflex ports visible along both sides of the neck as raised metallic nodes, pulsing with faint bioluminescent blue when active. The adrenaline pump manifests as a slight broadening at the solar plexus — internal augmentation visible only as a subtle scar pattern beneath fitted clothing.', N'Stands with shoulders slightly forward, weight balanced on the balls of the feet — never fully relaxed, always ready. Movements are economical and precise, no extraneous motion. Eyes scan environments methodically. When they move through space, it''s with the calculated efficiency of someone trained in confined-space tactics.', N'Tier 4 pragmatist. Black or dark gray fitted synthetic bodysuit with modular cargo pockets — reinforced stitching, thermal-damping weave for stealth. Over this, a lightweight gray tech-jacket with reflective piping, minimal branding. Worn boots — expensive once, now broken in. No jewelry except the cable tie in their hair. Everything is functional, replaceable, and kept in good repair. Nothing screams wealth or poverty — calculated invisibility.', N'Halima Akerblom-Manu witnessed a massacre during a corporate dispute and has evidence stored in a dead drop. Publishing it would expose powerful people. Keeping it is leverage and liability.', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'avani_bautista_w_jcik_dlamini');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a671-73bc-b851-805f4ba84a02', N'Heinrich Saito', N'Heinrich', N'', N'Saito', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 35, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, operates out of a two-room storefront clinic she rents under a cousin''s name, between a protein shop and a water reclamation terminal, near Damen and Armitage', N'Community nurse / unlicensed medical care provider', N'Unaffiliated formally; loose network of community health workers across The Narrows and the Gray Zone; former Helix Biosystems scholarship recipient (estranged)', N'Heinrich Saito is tall and angular with long-fingered hands she keeps scrupulously clean. Her skin is very dark, blue-black in good light, and she keeps her hair in small tight locs that she threads with copper wire — partly aesthetic, partly because she can unwind a length in a medical pinch, which has happened twice. She has retractable medical-grade scanning nails on her right hand — a geneware mod that lets her read surface biometrics with a touch — and a small blue triangle tattooed at the corner of her left eye, the mark of a mutual aid collective she was part of before it dissolved. Her expression at rest is one of focused neutrality that people mistake for coldness until she speaks.

Heinrich Saito is precise, principled, and permanently tired in a way she has accepted as her baseline. She completed two years of formal nursing training through a Helix Biosystems scholarship program before the program was quietly discontinued; she has spent the decade since filling in the gaps with unlicensed practice, informal mentorship from a retired trauma surgeon, and necessity. She operates in a legal gray zone she is entirely clear-eyed about. She charges what people can afford, which means she frequently charges nothing. She has complicated feelings about this that she doesn''t share with patients. She has a code of triage ethics she holds more seriously than most licensed practitioners hold their credentials.', N'Medical resource and moral compass. Can patch up characters, provide information about diseases, mods, or implants, and serve as an ethical anchor in moral dilemmas. Quest giver for public health crises or individual patients whose situations require outside help. Has knowledge of the underground medical supply chain.', N'', N'Medical-grade biometric scanning retractable nails on right hand (geneware, allows surface-read of pulse, temperature, oxygenation, stress markers); basic ocular enhancement — magnification for close work (functional, not cosmetic)', N'Clinic hours nominally 0900-1800, actually 0600-2200. Spends evenings doing house calls for patients who can''t travel. Sleeps roughly five to six hours. Sends a biometric reading to herself every morning as a personal health check she frequently ignores.', N'Heinrich Saito, tall angular East Asian-Eastern European hybrid woman, warm medium-brown skin with luminous quality, high sharp cheekbones with Eastern European angularity, dark brown eyes with subtle prismatic shimmer, direct gaze. Black shoulder-length locs threaded with copper wire, small blue triangle tattoo at left eye corner. Faded navy scrubs under deep indigo linen coat with bleach stains, black medical clogs, crossbody cloth satchel. Pearlescent biometric scanning nails visible on right hand. Clinical precision posture, economical movements, silver ring on left hand. Standing in softly lit clinic or residential interior, professional-medical atmosphere, 2226 neo-noir urban aesthetic, minimalist and functional styling, zero status display. Direct frontal or three-quarter view showing mixed heritage facial structure and immaculate skin care. GLMZ 2200s, pharmaceutical aesthetic, subtle augmentation details visible in bright lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'East Asian dominant (48.8%) with substantial Eastern European (33.4%) and Northern European (14.9%) ancestry, plus minor Sub-Saharan African (2.9%) admixture. The blend creates a striking fusion: East Asian facial structure and bone geometry combined with cooler, more angular Eastern European cheekbone prominence. Skin tone bridges warm and cool undertones—luminous medium-to-warm brown reflecting the East Asian and minor African heritage, modulated by the pale undertones from significant Northern/Eastern European ancestry. High, defined cheekbones read as distinctly East Asian-influenced, while jawline geometry shows Eastern European angularity.', 183, 68, N'Tall and angular with minimal body fat; long-limbed and defined musculature from years of physical labor and sustained standing. Graceful posture that reads as professional precision rather than relaxation.', N'Natural black', N'Small tight locs, shoulder-length, threaded throughout with unspooled copper wire for both aesthetic and functional medical access', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, natural; subtly enhanced with basic magnification implant visible only under close inspection (slight prismatic shimmer in bright light)', N'Warm medium brown with luminous quality—blending East Asian warmth and minor African heritage undertones with cooler refinement from substantial Northern and Eastern European admixture. Shifts from vital warmth in natural light to more neutral, slightly ashy tone under clinical fluorescent lighting.', N'High, sharp cheekbones with distinctly East Asian structure; long, precise jawline with Eastern European angularity; minimal facial expression at rest reading as clinical neutrality. Skin is immaculate—meticulously maintained with the care of someone who understands contamination risk. No acne or visible blemishes; a few fine lines around the eyes suggesting chronic exhaustion rather than age.', N'Right hand displays retractable medical-grade biometric scanning nails—pearlescent, slightly iridescent in natural light, approximately 2-3mm longer than biological nails when extended. Nails retract flush when not in use. Subtle ocular enhancement in both eyes: fractional shimmer and micro-refocusing visible only in harsh or clinical lighting. No other visible chrome.', N'Moves with economical precision; each gesture deliberate and minimal. Stands with weight evenly distributed, ready to shift. Hands move with the careful intention of someone accustomed to sterile protocols—never sudden, often held loosely at her sides or clasped. Eye contact is direct and sustained. Walking gait is measured and efficient, never hurried even when moving quickly.', N'Tier 4 working-class pragmatism: loose-fitting dark scrubs (faded navy, no corporate branding) worn over a thin compression tank for mobility and temperature regulation. Feet in scuffed, well-maintained clinic clogs (black, medical-grade antimicrobial material, showing wear but kept obsessively clean). Over this, a long unbuttoned linen coat dyed deep indigo, stained with the ghosts of old disinfectant and bleach marks—worn for authority and to conceal the scrubs when making house calls. A simple silver ring on her left ring finger (meaning unclear, possibly a private commitment or memorial). Minimal jewelry otherwise. Small cloth satchel worn crossbody containing portable diagnostic tools, sutures, and unmarked medication bottles. Hair always secured back, never loose. No makeup. Appearance optimized entirely for function, with zero concession to tier or status display.', N'When the Helix Biosystems scholarship program shut down, she didn''t just lose her training — she lost access to the full digital curriculum that would have constituted the second year''s material. She has been working from incomplete knowledge in two specific areas of internal medicine for a decade. She knows which areas. She has never told a patient. She refers out when she can. She has not always been able to.', N'Clinical and direct. Uses medical terminology without apology but always follows with plain language. Doesn''t soften bad news but delivers it carefully.', N'Even, unhurried. Never rushes through explaining something. Pauses before giving diagnoses.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'heinrich_saito');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72c-74b1-9097-809b62868711', N'Aydan Zidane', N'Aydan', N'', N'Zidane', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Fort Anchor, Internal Affairs Division, Sub-Level 3', N'Internal Affairs Investigator, Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division, Internal Affairs Division', N'Aydan Zidane is a compact, broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin and close-cropped silver hair she has made no effort to color back to black. Her eyes carry augmented irises patterned like the rings of a tree — concentric amber and dark brown — which she had installed not for fashion but because the integrated microfilament sensors help her read micro-expressions during interrogations. She dresses in Arcturus Civil Security plainclothes that are always a half-step too formal: pressed collar, exact trouser crease, shoes that cost more than a Tier 2 weekly budget. There is a deliberateness to every movement she makes, like a surgeon who has stopped wasting motion.

Aydan Zidane has been investigating corrupt officers for nineteen years and has developed the particular coldness of someone who was once deeply idealistic and refuses to admit that idealism calcified into something less generous. She believes in the institution of law enforcement with a fervor that is almost theological, which makes her merciless toward officers who violate it — and almost willfully blind to structural failures that can''t be solved by prosecuting individuals. She speaks rarely in social settings and listens with an attention that makes people feel they are being archived.', N'Quest giver for investigations into police corruption or misconduct; an obstacle if players are operating in legal gray areas; a source of hard-to-obtain official records if trust is established; represents institutional law as both shield and cage.', N'', N'Patterned irises with integrated micro-expression microfilament sensors (tier 2 medical grade). Subdermal data storage node at left wrist — holds encrypted case files offline. No cosmetic mods.', N'Arrives at Fort Anchor before her shift officially begins, reviews overnight surveillance logs over synthetic coffee she does not enjoy, conducts interviews that are scheduled to feel casual and are not. Returns home to Lockhaven North at irregular hours to make her movements harder to predict.', N'Aydan Zidane, compact muscular woman of 162cm with silver close-cropped hair and warm olive-bronze skin reflecting Eastern European, North African, and East Asian heritage. Augmented eyes with concentric amber-brown rings and visible microfilament threading. Unlined complexion, broad cheekbones, refined East Asian eye shape, strong jawline. Faint scar along left jaw. Dressed in pressed Arcturus Civil Security plainclothes: crisp gray collar shirt, perfectly creased trousers, expensive leather shoes. Surgical posture, squared shoulders, still hands, neutral expression. Service chronometer visible. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, cool neon accent lighting catching the metallic threading in her augmented irises, sharp focus, professional portrait style, moody atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Fort Anchor', N'local', N'Fort Anchor', N'Predominantly Eastern European (65.2%) with significant North African (16.3%) ancestry, complemented by East Asian (9.1%), Southeast Asian (6.6%), and Hispanic/Latin American (2.8%) heritage. This diaspora blend creates distinctive facial geometry: Eastern European bone structure anchors broad cheekbones and strong jawline; North African heritage adds warm depth and subtle nose bridge definition; East Asian ancestry refines eye shape and contributes to facial proportion balance; Southeast Asian and Hispanic/Latin American elements soften features with warmth and subtle golden undertones throughout.', 162, 68, N'Compact and broad-shouldered with dense musculature — the build of someone who has maintained discipline through middle age. No softness; efficient.', N'Silver, natural', N'Close-cropped, parted slightly off-center, maintained with precision', N'Short', N'Augmented irises patterned in concentric rings of amber and dark brown, resembling tree rings — integrated microfilament sensors visible as fine metallic threading within the iris structure', N'Warm olive-bronze with rich golden undertones. The complexion reflects the dominant Eastern European heritage (65.2%) warmed and deepened by North African ancestry (16.3%), with East Asian heritage (9.1%) adding luminosity and Southeast Asian warmth (6.6%) creating a complexion that holds light with understated radiance. The blend produces skin that reads as neither pale nor dark but distinctly warm—capable of holding both cool and warm cosmetics, naturally sun-receptive without harshness.', N'Unlined for her age, minimal makeup, skin condition immaculate — suggests disciplined skincare regimen. Facial structure shows broad Eastern European cheekbones balanced with refined East Asian eye shape; slight North African nose bridge definition; warm, full lower face contours reflecting Southeast Asian and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Expression set in neutral default; smile does not reach augmented eyes.', N'Augmented irises with visible microfilament patterning and integrated sensor threading. Subdermal wrist node creates minor topographical irregularity but remains largely concealed beneath clothing. Otherwise no visible chrome or external augmentation.', N'Moves with surgical efficiency — no wasted motion, no fidgeting. Shoulders squared, spine straight. Walks with measured pace. Hands remain still at rest. During conversation, maintains still facial expression while augmented eyes track micro-expressions in others with almost predatory focus.', N'ADS Civil Security plainclothes: pressed collar shirts (neutral grays, blacks, whites), tailored trousers with exact creases, leather shoes that cost Φ800+ (tier 1 quality on tier 3 salary — indicates personal priority or questionable funding). Minimal jewelry except service chronometer. Blazer worn on rotation. Everything fits precisely, nothing rumpled, nothing worn soft by time.', N'Three years ago she buried evidence that would have implicated a Arcturus Civil Security captain she believed was, on balance, doing more good than harm. She has not told anyone. She reviews that decision in her mind approximately every fourth night.', N'Formal, precise, institutional. Uses bureaucratic language not to obfuscate but because she genuinely thinks in those terms. Never uses slang unless quoting someone.', N'Slow and deliberate with long pauses before answering. Never interrupts. Silences feel like pressure.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aydan_zidane');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6fb-7187-b24e-80a4b1496c19', N'Gustavo Montalvo-Thorvaldsdóttir', N'Gustavo', N'', N'Montalvo-Thorvaldsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spires — mid-level corporate residential towers, near Michigan Ave and Oak', N'Counter-surveillance and mole detection — counterintelligence specialist', N'Independent — maintains network of professional contacts', N'Gustavo Montalvo-Thorvaldsdóttir are tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 27, their face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon — and they make no effort to hide it.

They arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and have been working off both ever since. They work as a counterintelligence specialist out of The Spires, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

they are not the most talented counterintelligence specialist in GLMZ, but they might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Tiare Nishi-Anim functions as a connector — their work puts them in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving them naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon platform. Eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Gustavo Montalvo-Thorvaldsdóttir, 188cm tall, rawboned efficient frame, neo-noir operative in 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Deep warm brown skin with golden undertones blending Nordic, Latin, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Sharp Nordic cheekbones and jawline, high forehead, refined nose with subtle African flare. Black hair with silver chrome threading pulled into tight braid secured with titanium clasp. Left eye warm brown natural, right eye cybernetic black sclera with amber iris-ring and visible micro-lens array. Visible chrome interface ports at skull base, spine, and joints, glowing faintly luminescent. Clean surgical scars along right temple from cybernetic installation. Pale burn scar along left collarbone. Rigid posture, squared shoulders, precise economical movement, predatory and mechanical. Wearing matte-black fitted combat bodysuit with modular pockets, charcoal-grey longline coat with articulated shoulders, heavy-duty tactical boots. Composite keratin-chrome fingernails. Neutral resting expression, scanning gaze fixed on security feeds and exit points. Professional-tactical aesthetic, worn functional gear showing maintenance history. Neo-noir atmosphere, cool blue and amber lighting, urban industrial setting, data streams and chrome glinting off skin. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spires', N'local', N'The Spires', N'Northern European / Hispanic-Latin American / South Asian / Sub-Saharan African blend with East Asian undertones — a true cosmopolitan genetic mosaic reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Nordic structure (36.2%) provides angular bone architecture, tempered by Latin warmth (23.5%), enriched by South Asian (18.3%) and Sub-Saharan African (16.5%) depth, with subtle East Asian character lines (5.5%). Features suggest a Scandinavian-Iberian-Subcontinental-African synthesis.', 188, 72, N'Rawboned and efficient — long-limbed with minimal subcutaneous fat, musculature defined by function rather than aesthetics. The frame of someone who treats their body as equipment.', N'Black with metallic silver threading at the temples — natural black base with chrome-infused synthetic strands woven through', N'Pulled back in a tight, utilitarian braid that runs down the spine, secured with a minimalist titanium clasp', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unbound)', N'Left eye: warm brown, natural; Right eye: sclera-black with amber iris-ring, cybernetic replacement with visible micro-lens array', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones — a rich synthesis reflecting Northern European fairness darkened by South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic ancestry, creating luminous depth with olive-amber warmth', N'Sharp cheekbones with Nordic height and breadth, angular jawline characteristic of Scandinavian structure, high forehead. Nose bridge refined with subtle flare reflecting South Asian and African heritage. Skin taut and maintenance-focused — minimal cosmetic scarring but bearing the careful grooming of someone who understands that appearance is data. Expression neutral at rest, eyes always tracking.', N'Full move-by-wire nervous system augmentation: Chrome interface nodes visible at spine, joints, and skull base. Right eye cybernetic replacement with amber iris-ring and visible micro-lens array. No attempt at concealment — the chrome is worn like a uniform. Fingernails replaced with composite keratin-chrome hybrids, maintaining slight metallic sheen.', N'Posture rigid and economical — shoulders squared, spine straight, minimal wasted motion. Movement is precise and predatory, each gesture calculated. Gait is smooth but mechanical, betraying the move-by-wire''s influence. Eyes scan rooms habitually, fixing on exit points, security feeds, and human behavior patterns. Resting expression is blank; smiles are rare and deliberate.', N'Tier 2-3 professional-tactical hybrid: fitted matte-black bodysuit with modular pockets and cable routing (likely a custom combat-grade model), reinforced with impact-absorbing weave. Over this, a charcoal-grey longline coat with articulated shoulder panels, suggesting range-of-motion optimization. Boots are heavy-duty tactical, soles designed for grip on urban surfaces. Minimal jewelry except for a subdued Φ-denominated credit band on left wrist. Everything is functional, nothing decorative. Clothing shows signs of regular maintenance but not newness — worn by someone who replaces gear when it fails, not when it''s outdated.', N'Tiare Nishi-Anim betrayed their previous crew to survive a corporate raid. The crew didn''t survive. Nobody in GLMZ knows this.', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gustavo_montalvo_thorvaldsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69f-73e4-af1c-80c53a5a619e', N'Gottfried Shin-Mwangi', N'Gottfried', N'', N'Shin-Mwangi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, runs a small laundry-and-mend shop called Sudswarm off a condensation-wet alley near the Enclave''s eastern transit stop, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Laundry operator and alterations seamstress', N'Independent; long-standing informal relationship with the Hamtramck Enclave Residents'' Collective', N'Gottfried Shin-Mwangi is a broad-shouldered woman whose posture is permanently curved forward from decades of hunching over washing drums and hand-stitching by bad light. Her skin is deep amber-brown, mapped with the kind of fine lines that come from steam and cold water alternating across a lifetime. Her hair is silver-white, pulled into a tall wrapped style she refreshes each morning with practiced ritual — the one vanity she allows herself. Her eyes are dark and deeply set, and she has the habit of assessing every person she meets the way a seamstress assesses fabric: checking for weak seams, worn patches, where the structure is likely to give. She has no cosmetic mods and wears her lack of augmentation with quiet dignity, though her fingers bear a set of micro-needle thimbles permanently bonded to her right hand — not quite augmentation, not quite tool, but something in between.

Prisca is slow to warm and quick to notice. She has been in the Enclave for thirty-one years and has watched three generations of families pass through her door. She calls regulars by their mother''s name, not their own — a habit from her grandmother she''s never examined. She speaks very little about herself, deflecting personal questions with practical ones: is your coat holding up? Did the dye run again? She is not unkind, but she draws a clean line between involvement and sentiment, and she patrols that line with vigilance. Underneath this, she carries a deep and specific loneliness that she has almost entirely metabolized into work.', N'Long-memory local anchor — she knows who has lived in the Enclave, who has left, who owes whom, and which families have old agreements. Can provide historical context, rumor, or quiet judgment. Quest giver for personal/domestic stakes. A reference point for community continuity.', N'', N'Micro-needle thimble array bonded to right-hand fingertips (functional, borderline medical-grade); mild joint-support subdermal mesh in both wrists (basic Tier 2 medical, no frills)', N'Opens Sudswarm at 0600, runs three drum cycles before most of the block is awake, takes alterations orders through the morning, closes at 2000 and does hand-stitching by lamp until midnight. Leaves a folded square of clean cloth at the small E.L.F. gray zone above her register every morning.', N'Gottfried Shin-Mwangi, 163cm tall, 50-something seamstress in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Warm amber-bronze skin with golden undertones reflecting complex East Asian-dominant heritage blended with Sub-Saharan African, Latin American, Middle Eastern, and South Asian ancestry. Deep brown nearly-black eyes set deep in face, pronounced crow''s feet, serious assessing expression. Prominent East Asian cheekbones, broad facial planes, defined brow ridge. Natural silver-white hair wrapped in tall style with faded cotton print wrap and bone pin. Forward-hunched posture from decades of needlework, rounded shoulders. Right hand shows five metallic micro-needle thimbles bonded to fingertips, scarred palms, callused fingertips. Faint steam burn marks on left forearm. Wearing faded long-sleeved linen shirt (hand-mended), heavy canvas apron damp at hem, loose neutral trousers, worn slip-on shoes. Shop interior setting with fabric bolts, warm practical lighting, hands poised over textile work. Neo-noir utility aesthetic meets artisan craftsmanship. Weathered skin texture from steam and cold water exposure. No makeup, no vanity — pure professional dignity. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'East Asian (41.9%), Sub-Saharan African (20.4%), Hispanic/Latin American (16.1%), Middle Eastern (15.4%), and South Asian (6.2%). Complex phenotype reflecting deep global mixing: dominant East Asian bone structure with pronounced cheekbones and eye set, enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth and warmth in skin tone, Latin American facial breadth, Middle Eastern nose and brow definition, and South Asian contributions to eye intensity and orbital depth.', 163, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial, with a forward-curved spine from decades of hunching over drums and detail work. Legs remain sturdy but upper back rounds permanently inward. Strong, work-worn frame without excess soft tissue.', N'Silver-white, natural', N'Tall wrapped style, refreshed each morning with ritual precision. The wrap itself is usually a faded cotton print or neutral linen, secured with a single bone or metal pin.', N'Long, worn up', N'Deep brown, nearly black', N'Warm amber-bronze with subtle golden-bronze undertones. The base reflects the East Asian dominant genetic contribution, deepened and enriched by Sub-Saharan African warmth, with slight reddish undertones from Hispanic/Latin American heritage and the golden-olive complexity from Middle Eastern ancestry. Medium-to-deep saturation across cheeks and forehead, slightly warmer at temples.', N'Extensively mapped with fine lines radiating from eyes and mouth — crow''s feet are pronounced. Skin shows the permanent effects of alternating steam and cold water exposure: uneven texture, some areas slightly leathered. Facial structure reflects the genetic hierarchy: prominent East Asian cheekbone architecture with slight upward eye cant, warm mid-tone depth from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, broad facial planes reflecting Latin American heritage, defined brow ridge and nose bridge from Middle Eastern genetics, and South Asian contributions to orbital depth and eye intensity. Minimal makeup. Expression naturally serious, eyes deeply set and assessing. No visible cosmetic modifications.', N'Right-hand fingertips bear a permanent micro-needle thimble array — five metallic thimble caps bonded directly to nail beds and surrounding dermal tissue, functional and medical-grade in appearance. The bonding shows as slightly raised, burnished metal at each fingertip. Wrist augmentations are subcutaneous and invisible. No other visible chrome or modification.', N'Perpetually forward-leaning from waist up, shoulders rounded inward. Moves slowly but with absolute purpose — no wasted motion. Hands move with the precision of someone who has spent fifty years reading fabric. When sitting, favors low chairs and leans back rarely. Eyes constantly scan surroundings the way a seamstress reads a garment for stress points.', N'Practical Tier 3-4 working wear. Long-sleeved cotton or linen shirts (often faded or hand-mended, showing the repairs she would never charge a customer for). Heavy canvas apron, usually damp at the hem, worn over loose trousers in neutral tones. Feet are always in sturdy slip-on shoes with worn soles — nothing requiring lacing. She owns one good cardigan for stepping outside the shop in winter. No jewelry except the bone pin in her hair. Clothing shows signs of careful mending and decades of wear, maintained through sheer discipline rather than vanity.', N'She had a daughter who left for the Grosse Pointe Enclosure at age nineteen to work in a Tessera household. They have not spoken in eleven years. Priscila still washes and folds a small garment — one of the daughter''s old undershirts — every month and stores it in a sealed bag under the counter. She does not examine why she does this.', N'Practical, concrete, minimal abstractions. Uses textile metaphors without realizing it. Mixes Portuguese-inflected cadence with Hausa directness.', N'Slow and measured. Never rushes. Long pauses before answering questions she considers important.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gottfried_shin_mwangi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a657-77a3-99fa-80d3f455c8ef', N'Boris Salazar', N'Boris', N'', N'Salazar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 9, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Stockyard, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Orphan, gang prospect (junior affiliate); Stockyard territory, does odd jobs for the Copperheads', N'Stockyard communal housing (ward of informal community); junior Copperheads affiliate (reluctant)', N'Boris Salazar is a small, round-faced nine-year-old with his South African grandfather''s dark complexion and his Russian grandmother''s light gray eyes, a combination that makes people look at him twice in a way he has not yet decided whether to be proud of. He has been at the Stockyard''s communal housing block since he was six, when his mother didn''t come back from a job and no one came to explain why. He has the characteristic roughness of a Stockyard kid — scuffed knees, hair grown out past caring, a jacket two sizes too large that he found and claimed as territory. He has no augmentations of any kind. The Copperheads, a junior street crew that operates in the Stockyard''s eastern blocks, have noticed him the way they notice all the unattached kids — as resource or recruitment opportunity. So far he has run two lookout shifts for them, for which he was paid in food rather than Quanta, which tells you something about both the crew''s resources and his bargaining position.

He is, underneath the hard-knock exterior, a nine-year-old who still sleeps with his knees pulled to his chest and who has attached himself to a specific E.L.F. he calls Glow that he believes lives in the light-strip above his communal bunk. He leaves it small paper offerings — drawings, mostly — folded under the fixture every night. He is fiercely protective of two things: a palm-sized carved wooden animal his mother left in the housing block storage, and a seven-year-old girl named Polu in the adjacent bunk who cannot defend herself the way he has learned to.', N'Emotional stakes and moral weight; his situation forces players to reckon with structural failure; can serve as an object of protection or a small information source about Stockyard street patterns; his trajectory is genuinely in play.', N'', N'None.', N'Eats communal breakfast if there is one, spends the day ranging the Stockyard''s blocks doing whatever earns food or Φ — carrying, watching, fetching. Is back at the housing block before dark because that is the rule he has made for himself.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Boris Salazar, a nine-year-old street kid with warm golden-brown skin reflecting mixed Hispanic/Latin American, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Lean, small-framed build, angular face with high sharp cheekbones and rounded lower face. Light gray eyes with dark brown iris rings, dark brown almost-black hair medium length and tousled. Visible scars and scrapes on forehead, chin, and knees from street living. Wearing oversized faded charcoal synthetic jacket with rolled cuffs over layered shirt, gray work-wear pants with grass stains, mismatched shoes held together with wire. Dirt-smudged skin, perpetually weathered expression. Hunched posture, constantly scanning eyes. Gritty Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone background with industrial Stockyard generators and warm amber-sodium lighting casting shadows. Unaugmented, completely chrome-free. Film grain and neo-noir color grading. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Stockyard', N'local', N'The Stockyard', N'Mixed heritage with dominant Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (52%), significant South Asian influence (21.5%), notable Sub-Saharan African ancestry (12.3%), Eastern European (10.3%), and Southeast Asian (3.9%). Features reflect this complex blend: warm golden-brown skin with rich depth, high prominent cheekbones with subtle Southeast Asian structure, rounded lower face with South Asian softness, and luminous warm undertones from Latin American heritage mixing with African depth and Eastern European complexity.', 128, 26, N'Small-framed and lean from inconsistent nutrition, with the gangly proportions of a nine-year-old entering growth phases unevenly. Compact and wiry rather than naturally delicate.', N'Dark brown, almost black', N'Grown out past maintenance, tousled and uneven; occasionally tied back with whatever cord or cloth is at hand', N'Medium', N'Light gray with dark brown iris ring — unusual combination that draws attention', N'Warm golden-brown with rich depth: golden warmth from Hispanic/Latin American heritage, richness from Sub-Saharan African genetics, bronze undertones from South Asian ancestry, and subtle cooler undertones from Eastern European heritage creating a complex, luminous complexion with exceptional depth', N'Angular face with high, sharp cheekbones and subtly rounded lower face reflecting the diverse ancestry blend; frequent scrapes and small scars on forehead and chin from street living; skin weathered beyond his years but retains childhood softness. Perpetually dirt-smudged, especially around the knuckles and neck. Distinctive facial structure shows the balanced influence of Latin American, South Asian, and African genetics with subtle Eastern European bone structure.', N'None. No chrome, no optics, no subdermal plating. Completely unaugmented — notable in the GLMZ for a child of his circumstances.', N'Moves with sharp, economical efficiency; hunches slightly as if accustomed to making himself smaller. Sits with knees pulled up even when standing still. Eyes are rarely still, constantly scanning his environment. Physical confidence that contradicts his size — moves like someone who has already learned to take hits.', N'Wears a jacket two sizes too large, claimed salvage in faded charcoal synthetic blend with torn inner lining; the cuffs are rolled and re-rolled constantly. Beneath it, whatever layered shirt is cleanest that week. Pants are gray synthetic work-wear with grass stains and frayed cuffs; shoes are mismatched, one held together with wire. No Tier branding visible — all clothing is reclaimed or communal. Everything smells faintly of detergent and smoke from the Stockyard''s generators.', N'He overheard a Copperheads conversation three weeks ago that included a description of a job gone wrong in the Stockyard''s sixth sector — the job his mother was last known to be near. He doesn''t have enough context to understand it. He has been trying to get more context ever since, slowly, without anyone noticing.', N'Short sentences. Stockyard patois, slightly blurred from communal housing mix of backgrounds. Asks practical questions rather than emotional ones.', N'Quiet and direct. Speaks louder when he''s pretending not to be scared.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'boris_salazar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a7-70e3-84dc-80d693fd6a0d', N'Jabari Mwangi-Masoe-Yun', N'Jabari', N'', N'Mwangi-Masoe-Yun', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 41, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex Trauma Bay 7; off-hours in Copperhead district, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Trauma surgeon, Aurochs Medical Complex emergency rotation and private contract', N'Aurochs Medical Complex (senior contract surgeon); secondary contract with a Copperhead neighborhood clinic they do not advertise', N'Jabari Mwangi-Masoe-Yun is tall and rangy with warm ochre-brown skin, natural hair grown high and loose, and the kind of face that is perpetually unreadable to people who have not spent time with them — not unfriendly, simply internal. Their most immediately notable feature is their left arm, which from the elbow down is full chrome: high-grade Helix surgical-grade manipulators, articulated to tolerances no biological hand can match, finished in brushed gunmetal with amber indicator lights at the wrist joints that track grip pressure. They got it after a bus accident seven years ago and accepted the premium model because anything less would compromise their work. They do not discuss the accident.

In the trauma bay, they are an entirely different creature from the quiet person who buys coffee from the same cart in Copperhead every morning. They become fast, flat, almost frightening in their economy. They do not narrate. They do not comfort. They fix. Outside of work they are thoughtful, prone to long silences that are not uncomfortable, and fond of extremely loud, chaotic music that they listen to on bone-conduction speakers while cooking. They have strong opinions about soup.', N'Emergency resource, exposition source for the medical-corporate system''s failures, potential ally for characters navigating Aurochs bureaucracy; the person you call when someone is dying and you cannot explain how they got hurt', N'', N'Full chrome left arm from elbow, surgical-grade Helix manipulators with amber grip-pressure indicators; bone-conduction audio implant; corneal magnification overlay (surgical use)', N'Trauma rotation runs thirty-six hours on, twenty-four off. On off-hours they sleep aggressively, cook, and do two hours of calibration exercises with the chrome arm to maintain dexterity tolerances. Once a week they do a free-clinic half-day in Copperhead.', N'Jabari Mwangi-Masoe-Yun, 187cm tall surgical precision specialist in GLMZ GLMZ setting. Warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, rich melanin complexion blending Sub-Saharan African (39.9%), Pacific Islander (17.9%), Middle Eastern (15%), Hispanic/Latin American (13.6%), and East Asian (13.6%) heritage. Angular face with prominent cheekbones, wider orbital set, moderate nasal bridge, full lower lip. Natural black hair worn long and loose in a high crown. Deep brown eyes with warm undertones; left eye shows faint crystalline corneal augmentation overlay. Tall, rangy and lean build, coiled posture. Full brushed gunmetal chrome left arm from elbow down with articulated Helix manipulators and amber indicator lights at wrist joints. Faint surgical scar visible along left shoulder and upper chest. Calibration tattoos on inner right wrist. Off-duty in fitted charcoal synthetic shirt and worn real leather jacket, practical shoes. Bone-conduction audio implant visible behind left ear. Meditative, economical movement. Cool surgical lighting, trauma bay or minimalist quarters, neo-noir urban aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex Trauma Bay 7; off-hours in Copperhead district', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex Trauma Bay 7; off-hours in Copperhead district', N'Strikingly diverse genetic tapestry: 39.9% Sub-Saharan African, 17.9% Pacific Islander, 15% Middle Eastern, 13.6% Hispanic/Latin American, 13.6% East Asian. Features reflect this complex blend—deep warm undertones from African ancestry combined with broader bone structure and orbital characteristics influenced by East Asian heritage, tempered by Middle Eastern and Pacific Islander contributions creating subtle width in the face and a slightly fuller lower lip structure. A living example of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 187, 72, N'Rangy and lean with defined musculature from precision work and calibration routines; long-limbed, minimal body fat, economical posture that reads as coiled rather than relaxed', N'Natural black with warm undertones', N'Grown high and loose, worn in a natural crown; maintained but not styled, suggesting function over aesthetics', N'Long', N'Deep brown with complex warm undertones; left eye shows faint crystalline overlay at certain angles (corneal magnification augmentation)', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones—rich melanin base from Sub-Saharan ancestry brightened by Pacific Islander and Middle Eastern influences, creating luminous depth that catches light with subtle warmth rather than cool undertones', N'Angular face with prominent cheekbones reflecting strong Sub-Saharan and East Asian structure; slightly wider facial width and broader orbital set from Pacific Islander and East Asian heritage; nasal bridge moderate width with fuller base reflecting multi-continental ancestry; full lower lip with subtle definition; composed expression, minimal micro-expressions in repose. Skin shows even tone with the texture of someone who prioritizes function over skincare routine.', N'Full chrome left arm from elbow down: brushed gunmetal finish with articulated surgical-grade Helix manipulators; two amber indicator lights embedded at wrist joints that glow faintly with grip pressure feedback; the arm moves with inhuman precision and minimal lag. Bone-conduction audio implant visible as a subtle metallic disc behind the left ear. Corneal magnification overlay occasionally catches light in the left eye.', N'Stands and moves with surgical economy—minimal wasted motion, spine straight, weight centered. Outside trauma bay: slow, deliberate, almost meditative. In surgery: becomes fluid and fast, movements stripped down to pure function. Hands rest in neutral position when not in use. Left chrome arm moves with mechanical precision that is unsettling in its accuracy.', N'Off-duty favors durable, tier 3-4 minimalist pieces: fitted charcoal synthetic shirts that accommodate the chrome arm without bunching, high-quality work trousers with reinforced pockets, worn leather jacket (real leather, well-maintained, a few years old). No jewelry except a functional smartwatch on right wrist. Shoes are practical—good arch support, worn but clean. In the trauma bay: standard surgical blacks under a lab coat with the Aurochs Medical Complex insignia. The coat is tailored to fit the chrome arm without restriction. Zero ornamentation.', N'The bus accident was not an accident. Someone ran them off the road. They know who — a Helix Biosystems supply-chain manager whose negligence they had reported to a journalist two days before. The arm is a permanent reminder. They have been collecting evidence for seven years and have not yet decided what to do with it.', N'Minimal in trauma settings — commands and confirmations only. In conversation, they speak in complete thoughts with occasional unexpected humor', N'Unhurried; comfortable with gaps in conversation that most people fill nervously', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'jabari_mwangi_masoe_yun');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('c986029d-2049-f55c-b811-81214c3533ba', N'Alfonso Magnúsdóttir-Shin-Bui', N'Alfonso', N'', N'Magnúsdóttir-Shin-Bui', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 80, 0, N'alive', N'An office in the Canopy decorated with Turing test memorabilia and philosophical texts — clients aren''t sure if the decor is ironic, near Clark and Addison', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — licensed synthetic behavior analyst, the only PI in GLMZ with this certification', N'Alfonso Magnúsdóttir-Shin-Bui occupies a professional niche that barely existed fifteen years ago and is now one of the fastest-growing specializations in investigative work: synthetic cases. As synthetic beings become more sophisticated, more prevalent, and more capable of operating undetected among humans, the demand for someone who can tell the difference — and who can investigate crimes involving synthetics with nuance rather than prejudice — has exploded.

Lucien was a philosophy professor before he was an investigator, and he approaches every case with the analytical rigor of an academic and the practical urgency of a PI. His work involves identity verification (is this person human or synthetic?), behavioral analysis (is this synthetic acting within its programming or has it deviated?), and crime investigation (when a synthetic is accused of a crime, what actually happened — and when a crime is committed against a synthetic, does anyone care?). The last question troubles him more than he admits.

His reputation is built on fairness. In a city where synthetics are legally property, Lucien is one of the few investigators who treats them as subjects rather than objects. This has made him simultaneously popular with the underground synthetic community and unpopular with certain corporate clients who want their synthetic problems solved with a power switch, not an investigation. He maintains that his approach produces better results, which is true, but that''s not why he does it. He does it because he genuinely isn''t sure synthetics aren''t people, and he''d rather err on the side of decency.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'GLMZ portrait of Alfonso Magnúsdóttir-Shin-Bui, a lean 178cm tall mixed-heritage investigator with warm medium tan skin and golden undertones. Southeast Asian-dominant phenotype with refined angular cheekbones, Northern European definition, and Sub-Saharan African warmth blended through his features. Deep brown eyes with amber undertones, naturally black hair with silver at temples swept back with a small temple braid. Faint surgical scar through left eyebrow. Wire-rimmed glasses on worn leather cord. Wearing well-tailored grey linen jacket, charcoal wool, and cream cotton — professional but deliberately unworn-looking. Vintage mechanical watch on faded cloth band. Small indigo Turing machine tattoo visible on left inner wrist. Direct, engaged expression. Standing in dim neon-lit urban Great Lakes setting, cool blue and warm amber lighting reflecting off wet pavement. Thoughtful posture, hands still and composed. Neo-noir neo-noir atmosphere, 2200s aesthetics, scholarly but street-worn. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'An office in the Canopy decorated with Turing test memorabilia and philosophical texts', N'local', N'An office in the Canopy decorated with Turing test memorabilia and philosophical texts', N'Complex pan-Asian phenotype with significant Southeast Asian foundation (39.8%) creating soft, refined facial structure. East Asian ancestry (22.9%) contributes luminous skin quality and characteristic eye shape. Sub-Saharan African heritage (12.7%) adds warmth and depth to complexion and feature richness. Northern European ancestry (9.7%) brings skeletal definition and angular cheekbone prominence. Hispanic/Latin American (7.8%) and South Asian (7.1%) contributions add warmth to undertones and subtle width to jaw. The genetic combination creates a striking pan-Asian visual foundation enriched by African depth, European structure, and warm undertones from Latin and South Asian heritage.', 178, 72, N'Lean and composed, with the careful posture of someone who spends long hours reading and thinking. Shoulders slightly rounded from desk work, but with underlying wiry muscle suggesting regular movement through the city.', N'Dark brown, naturally black with premature silver threading at the temples', N'Swept back from the forehead, kept neat but not rigid. A single small braid at the left temple — deliberate, neither fashionable nor careless.', N'Medium', N'Deep brown with slight amber undertone in bright light, characteristic of Southeast and East Asian heritage', N'Warm medium tan with golden-amber undertones, reflecting the dominant Southeast Asian ancestry blended with East Asian luminosity and Sub-Saharan African depth. Rich, balanced complexion that catches light distinctly without pallor or excessive darkness.', N'Angular cheekbones with Southeast Asian softness refined by Northern European definition and East Asian structure. Narrow to moderate jaw with subtle width from South Asian and Hispanic contributions. Expressive face lined by years of skepticism and close reading. Skin is clear but weathered by city pollution and poor sleep cycles. A faint scar cuts through his left eyebrow — old, deliberate-looking, possibly self-inflicted. Fine facial structure with warm golden undertones from the Southeast Asian-dominant ancestry blend, enriched by Sub-Saharan African warmth.', N'None visible. No chrome, no obvious implants. This is deliberate — he works cases where looking too augmented would interfere with his credibility.', N'Walks with deliberate slowness, as if always thinking through a problem. Hands are expressive when speaking but otherwise remain still. Makes direct eye contact even when uncomfortable — a habit from his philosophy teaching days. Often leans forward when listening, genuinely engaged.', N'Tier 2-3 professional: tailored but worn. Favors high-quality neutral fabrics — grey linen, charcoal wool, cream cotton. His jacket is always pressed but never new. Wire-rimmed glasses on a worn leather cord. No visible corporate logos or status markers. Wears a vintage analog watch (mechanical, not net-connected) on a faded cloth band. His shoes are good leather, well-maintained but scuffed from walking. He dresses like someone who has money but doesn''t care about displaying it.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alfonso_magn_sd_ttir_shin_bui');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('66d09928-80e4-c1fb-fae5-8216df3e6df3', N'Ferdows Árnason-Chowdhury', N'Ferdows', N'', N'Árnason-Chowdhury', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A tastefully appointed office in Glassway district, deliberately corporate-adjacent to attract upper-tier clientele, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Private Investigator', N'Tessera Corponation (mid-level private investigator)', N'Ferdows Árnason-Chowdhury is the most successful private investigator in Glassway by recovery rate — 100% of his kidnapping cases end with the victim returned safely. This is because he orchestrated every single kidnapping himself.

The scheme is elegant in its simplicity. His ''field associates'' — a rotating team of low-level criminals who believe they''re working for various gang operations — identify and abduct targets based on Cassiel''s criteria: wealthy family, emotional attachment, ability to pay, and low likelihood of going to CorpSec (because CorpSec investigations would be thorough enough to find his fingerprints). The family panics. Someone recommends Cassiel — he has cultivated referral networks among therapists, lawyers, and community leaders. He takes the case, performs a convincing investigation that takes exactly long enough to justify his fee, then executes a ''recovery'' that is really just a scheduled release.

He has been operating for seven years without detection. His weakness is scale — he''s becoming addicted to the income and the gratitude, and each operation is slightly more ambitious than the last. Two of his former ''field associates'' have died under circumstances he arranged when they got too close to understanding the full picture. He is, beneath the polish, a deeply dangerous person, and the operation is approaching the size where a single point of failure could unravel everything.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Portrait of Ferdows Árnason-Chowdhury, GLMZ, warm medium complexion with golden and olive undertones reflecting South Asian, Northern European, East Asian, Central Asian and Hispanic heritage blend. Dark brown eyes, dark brown hair with silver at temples swept back precisely, defined South Asian cheekbones refined by Northern European proportion, subtle almond-shaped eyes. 182cm tall, athletic build, smooth skin. Wearing tailored charcoal blazer over herringbone pattern shirt, Italian leather shoes visible, minimalist platinum ring. Thin pale scar along left collarbone visible above collar. Upright posture, controlled movement, expression of practiced trustworthiness. Corporate office setting with soft warm lighting, subtle neon glow in background, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. Neo-noir professional, understated luxury, competent and reliable demeanor. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A tastefully appointed office in Glassway district', N'local', N'A tastefully appointed office in Glassway district', N'South Asian (38.7%) as dominant influence, blended with Northern European (28.8%), East Asian (16.8%), Central Asian (10.5%), and Hispanic/Latin American (5.2%) ancestry. This genetic constellation produces a warm, medium complexion with golden and olive undertones — the result of South Asian warmth layered with Northern European fairness, East Asian smoothness, and Central Asian depth. Facial structure reflects this confluence: defined South Asian cheekbones and jawline refined by Northern European proportion, with subtle East Asian eye structure and Central Asian angular definition. A face that reads as cosmopolitan without obvious continental anchoring.', 182, 78, N'Athletic, deliberately maintained — broad shoulders tapering to a lean core. The physique of someone who treats fitness as professional grooming, not passion. No excess, no display.', N'Dark brown, naturally, with premature silver at the temples that he does not dye', N'Precisely cut, swept back from the forehead with geometric precision. Always freshly maintained — barber visits every 10 days.', N'Short', N'Dark brown, warm and attentive', N'Warm medium with golden and subtle olive undertones — the result of dominant South Asian heritage layered with Northern European fairness, East Asian smoothness, and Central Asian depth. Even complexion across face and neck with a luminous quality that reads as both approachable and assured.', N'Smooth, well-moisturized skin with almost no visible scarring or blemishes. Facial structure shows the characteristic blend of South Asian definition and Northern European proportion — defined cheekbones with subtle angularity, strong jawline with refined contours. Slight almond-shape suggestion to the eye area from East Asian ancestry. Eyebrows groomed but not obviously so. A face designed to be remembered as ''trustworthy'' rather than distinctive.', N'None visible. All augmentation is subcutaneous or internal.', N'Upright and controlled. Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted gesture, no fidgeting. Maintains eye contact precisely long enough to seem engaged but not threatening. Voice modulation is calibrated; laughs at appropriate moments. Everything about his physical presence is a performance of competence and reliability.', N'Tier 2-3 corporate-casual. Tailored charcoal or navy blazers over subtle pattern shirts (fine herringbone, muted plaids). Trousers pressed with sharp creases. No logos; brands are quiet (Italian leather shoes, Swiss watch, minimalist jewelry — one simple platinum band on his left ring finger). Ergonomic and expensive but understated. The overall effect: a man successful enough not to need to advertise success.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ferdows_rnason_chowdhury');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a641-7680-baa7-82bc9472b8ca', N'Aviral Rakhimov', N'Aviral', N'', N'Rakhimov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenwood Gate, Helix Biosystems Regional Compliance Hub, Floor 31, near Damen and Armitage', N'Senior Compliance Officer, Helix Biosystems', N'Helix Biosystems', N'Aviral Rakhimov is built like someone who has been holding herself very still for a very long time — posture immaculate, jaw set at an angle that suggests she is always about to speak and always deciding not to. Her skin is a deep warm brown, and she wears a single cosmetic mod: a pair of bioluminescent freckles across her nose and cheekbones that pulse faint amber when her stress hormones spike, which she regrets every time she''s in a meeting. Her hair is natural, kept in tight coils pinned close, and her clothes are always three days behind the corporate fashion cycle — deliberately, she''d say, because she doesn''t want anyone thinking she cares about looking like she belongs. She does. She cares enormously.

She has spent twenty-two years at Helix Biosystems finding the places where the paperwork doesn''t match the biology, and she is very good at it. She is also deeply, privately terrified of what she sometimes finds. She frames everything as procedure — citing subsection numbers the way other people cite proverbs — and she has a gift for explaining catastrophic regulatory violations in a tone so calm that junior staff often don''t realize they''re watching a controlled detonation. She is not cruel. She is precise. There is a difference, she will tell you, and she will tell you exactly how many centimeters wide it is.', N'Quest giver — she knows where the bodies are buried, metaphorically and possibly literally. Information source on Helix Biosystems'' internal structure and violations. Can be a reluctant ally to anyone investigating corporate malfeasance, or an obstacle if she decides procedure takes precedence over justice.', N'', N'Bioluminescent cosmetic freckles (amber, stress-reactive — she considers having them removed at least once a month). Neural compliance index overlay — a retinal HUD that color-codes regulatory status of any document she focuses on. No other augmentations.', N'Arrives at her office forty minutes before her team, runs through overnight regulatory filings from Helix subsidiaries, and drinks three cups of synthetic-chicory coffee before speaking to anyone. Evenings she attends a small ELF devotional circle in her apartment building''s basement, leaving offerings of encrypted data packets to the building''s resident spirit, whom she calls Aunty Merkle.', N'Aviral Rakhimov, woman of mixed Central Asian-South Asian-Hispanic-Northern European heritage, warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones, deep natural brown eyes with faint iridescent shimmer from retinal augmentation. Short black hair tightly pinned close to scalp. Scattered bioluminescent amber freckles across nose and cheekbones, faintly glowing. Lean, wiry build, 168cm tall, extraordinarily still posture with perfect spinal alignment, neutral-severe expression. Wearing immaculate charcoal tailored blazer, crisp white fitted shirt, dark trousers with knife-edge creases, black leather low-heeled shoes, thin steel watch. Sitting at corporate desk, hands folded, minimal hand gestures. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool professional lighting, slight tension in jawline, tech-corporate aesthetic, deliberate restraint, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenwood Gate', N'local', N'Kenwood Gate', N'Central Asian (55.5%) with substantial South Asian (23.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (11.6%), and Northern European (9.2%) ancestry. The genetic blend produces a complexion of warm medium brown with subtle golden and olive undertones—a sun-touched warmth from Central and South Asian heritage grounded by Northern European structure. Cheekbones and jawline carry Nordic definition softened by the broader facial geometry and warmer pigmentation of her Central and South Asian ancestry. The South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American components add depth and warmth to her overall coloration, while the Northern European ancestry contributes to her angular facial structure.', 168, 61, N'Lean and held with deliberate tension, shoulders squared back as if bracing against invisible pressure. Musculature is wiry rather than athletic—the body of someone who maintains discipline through stillness rather than motion.', N'Natural black with subtle warm undertones', N'Tightly coiled and pinned close to the scalp in a structured arrangement; no loose strands', N'Short (under 5cm when unpinned)', N'Deep brown, natural; retinal augmentation creates faint iridescent shimmer when compliance overlay is active', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones—a unified complexion reflecting the dominant Central Asian heritage tempered by substantial South Asian warmth, Latin American depth, and subtle Northern European influence. Neither explicitly European nor exclusively continental Asian, but genuinely mixed across all four regions.', N'Clean, minimal makeup. The bioluminescent freckles across nose and cheekbones are her only deliberate modification—faint amber pigmentation visible even when dormant, brightening noticeably under stress. Facial structure shows influence from Central Asian heritage in cheekbone prominence and defined jawline, deepened by South Asian warmth and golden cast, with subtle Latin American fullness in the lower face. Jawline is prominent and held at a slight tension suggesting constant self-editing.', N'Bioluminescent freckles (only visible cosmetic mod). The neural compliance index overlay is internal (retinal); visible only as a faint iridescence in her eyes when active and under close scrutiny. No chrome, no external cybernetics.', N'Extraordinarily still. Sits with perfect spinal alignment, hands folded or resting on desk edge with fingers slightly curled. Walks with measured pace, economical movement. Speaking involves minimal hand gestures—precision in word choice compensates for physical restraint. Her default expression is neutral-to-severe; smiling appears to require conscious effort.', N'Corporate Tier 2 compliance dress, deliberately one fashion cycle behind current Helix internal standard. Favors charcoal and deep blue tailored blazers with minimal branding, white or cream fitted shirts, dark trousers with knife-edge creases. Shoes are immaculate black leather (non-synthetic), worn low-heeled for stability. Accessories are functional only: a thin steel watch set to three timezones, no jewelry. The overall effect is intentionally professional-but-not-trying, a subtle refusal to perform belonging while performing it perfectly.', N'Fourteen months ago she found evidence of a clinical trial in Helix''s Aurochs Medical Complex division where consent documentation was fabricated for 340 trial participants. She filed an internal report. The report was reclassified. She has a copy. She has not decided what to do with it, and the indecision is eating her alive.', N'Formal, regulatory-inflected. Cites section numbers. Uses passive voice when delivering bad news. Occasionally drops into unguarded directness when exhausted.', N'Measured, with deliberate pauses. She speaks slowly on purpose — she learned early that people assume slowness means certainty.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aviral_rakhimov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a685-7bae-a4dd-82c7a81e5bad', N'Hemi Nygaard', N'Hemi', N'', N'Nygaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, operates the L-7 Lake Loop elevated line, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Ferrogate Transit operator, Lake Loop elevated rail', N'Ferrogate Transit (mid-level ferrogate transit operator)', N'Hemi Nygaard is a lean, angular man of middling height with a Sahel-boned face, his mother''s warm brown complexion, and his father''s flat Polish nose that he has always been vaguely self-conscious about. He keeps his head shaved to faint stubble and has a single cosmetic mod — a patterned iris modification that renders his pupils as slowly rotating geometric rings, a gift from a former partner he never got around to reversing. He wears his Ferrogate Transit uniform with the collar folded exactly one centimeter down, a minor unauthorized alteration he has maintained for six years without a single supervisor catching it. His cab smells of synthetic cardamom from the little flavor-diffuser clipped to his instrument panel, beside which sits a paper E.L.F. shrine — a folded transit map on which he has drawn the face of the Rail Spirit and which he taps three times at the start of every shift.

Hemi Nygaard runs the same eighty-kilometer elevated loop eleven hours a day, five days a week, and has developed the unsettling ability to recognize regular passengers by the sound of their footsteps on the boarding platform. He is not unhappy — he finds the repetition genuinely meditative — but he is quietly, persistently lonely in a way he cannot quite name. He reads on his secondary screen during station dwells, always history or urban geography, and has an encyclopedic knowledge of GLMZ''s infrastructure that he has never found occasion to use. He is patient with passengers to a near-inhuman degree, only revealing irritation through a single slow blink.', N'Mobile information source — he sees everything that moves through the city at rail level; accidental witness; conduit for moving characters between districts; represents the invisible labor holding the city together', N'', N'Patterned iris mod (geometric rotating pupils, cosmetic only); standard Ferrogate neural link for cab integration (mandatory, employer-issued)', N'Reports to Deepwell Station at 06:00, runs his loop until 17:00, eats a pressed sandwich from the platform vendor, attends union meetings on Tuesdays, goes home to a single-room apartment in Copperhead where he reads until he falls asleep', N'Hemi Nygaard, lean 174cm transit operator with warm medium tan skin and shaved black hair stubble, stands in a GLMZ rail station. Nordic-high cheekbones blend with Pacific Islander facial breadth and subtle Southeast Asian eye geometry. His most striking feature: dark brown eyes with slowly rotating geometric iris mods in iridescent gold and copper, creating unsettling optical distortion when he meets your gaze. Faint stress lines around eyes, dark circles beneath. Ferrogate Transit slate-gray wool-blend jacket with deliberately folded collar, black synthetic trousers, regulation boots. Worn canvas satchel at his side. Shoulders slightly forward from years of cab posture, standing with meditative stillness and perfect weight distribution. Fine old scar on left forearm visible. Callused fingertips suggest thousands of micro-adjustments on throttle levers. Neon platform lighting catches the copper fire in his geometric pupils. Behind him: blurred transit tunnel architecture, holographic schedules, the ambient glow of 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone infrastructure. Mood: quiet focus, tension held in shoulders, the watchful calm of someone attuned to every sonic frequency around him. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Northern European dominant (67.6%) with significant Pacific Islander (22.9%) and Southeast Asian (9.5%) ancestry. The genetic signature reflects Scandinavian and Germanic base with Polynesian and Melanesian warmth in coloring and subtle facial structure, plus minor Southeast Asian undertones in eye shape and cheekbone articulation. Features show the balanced blend of high Northern European cheekbones with slightly broader facial structure from Pacific Islander heritage and a subtle epicanthic fold from Southeast Asian ancestry.', 174, 68, N'Lean and angular, with long limbs and minimal subcutaneous fat; the build of someone who moves through tight spaces daily and carries tension in his shoulders', N'Black', N'Shaved to faint stubble, maintained at approximately 2mm length', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown with cosmetic iris mod: pupils rendered as slowly rotating geometric rings (concentric circles and polygonal shapes in subtle iridescent gold/copper tones)', N'Warm medium tan with golden undertones—the result of Northern European base warmed by Pacific Islander ancestry; sun-kissed quality despite urban environment, with subtle bronze cast beneath surface and minimal ashy undertones from climate-controlled transit work', N'Northern European-structured face with high, prominent cheekbones and a straight bridge of medium width. Faint epicanthic fold presence around outer eye corners from Southeast Asian ancestry. Broader facial structure at jawline from Pacific Islander heritage. Skin is clear but shows fine stress lines around the eyes from six years of focused concentration. Faint dark circles from reading late into evenings.', N'Patterned iris modification is immediately noticeable — the geometric rotating pupils catch light and create subtle optical distortion effects, making direct eye contact distinctive and slightly unsettling. Ferrogate neural link (employer-issued) is subcutaneous at the base of skull, invisible beneath shaved hair and collar line.', N'Moves with deliberate economy of motion, shoulders slightly forward from years of cab-seat posture. Walks at a consistent, meditative pace. Stands with weight distributed evenly, hands at sides or loosely clasped. Reveals emotions only through micro-expressions — most notably a slow, deliberate blink when irritated. Carries himself with the spatial awareness of someone hyper-attuned to platform acoustics and crowd rhythm.', N'Wears Ferrogate Transit uniform (slate-gray wool-blend jacket, black synthetic trousers, company-issued boots maintained to regulations) with a single unauthorized personalization: collar folded down exactly 1cm, a small rebellion maintained undetected for six years. Off-duty clothing is Tier 3 working-class — practical synthetic fabrics in muted tones (grays, blacks, deep blues). No visible branding. Carries a worn canvas satchel containing a secondary reading screen and folded paper transit map (E.L.F. shrine with hand-drawn Rail Spirit).', N'Three years ago he watched, through his cab window, a Tessera executive being pushed off a platform at Lakeview Neon Station. He filed no report. The death was ruled a fall. He has the timestamp and cab-log footage auto-saved to a private drive he has never opened since.', N'Precise and measured, gravitates toward technical and geographic terminology, occasionally drops into unexpectedly poetic observation', N'Even and unhurried, long comfortable pauses, never interrupts', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hemi_nygaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ae-7406-8f30-836a95513509', N'Candido Mwangi-Szczypiński', N'Candido', N'', N'Mwangi-Szczypiński', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Chatham Flats, near Kedzie and Division', N'Fortune seller and data-reading practitioner, The Narrows', N'Independent. Known favorable relationship with several Narrows-dwelling E.L.F. entities. Informal network of other practitioners in Chatham Flats.', N'Candido Mwangi-Szczypiński occupies a permanent corner in The Narrows'' most trafficked pedestrian corridor, her setup distinguished by a curtain of fiber-optic strands in blue and white that she draws around a small folding table when a client sits down. She is a slight woman with warm tawny skin, thick dark brows, and an intensely focused quality that makes people feel she is reading them the moment they appear in her field of vision. Her irises are geneware — they have been modified to shift through a slow wheel of silver, amber, and pale violet, which she did deliberately for atmospheric effect but now genuinely loves. She wears layered clothing in deep reds and indigos, and her hair is long and braided with data-thread woven into the plaits that she claims helps her interface with the local E.L.F. population. She carries a physical reader deck that she uses for the theatrical component of the reading, alongside legitimate Mesh-query access she has trained herself to interpret into human-readable pattern narrative.

Candido Mwangi-Szczypiński is a genuinely skilled practitioner of a craft that sits on the uncomfortable border between fraud and service. She would say — and she has said, at length — that the accuracy of prediction matters less than the quality of attention. Her clients are heard. They are given language for things they couldn''t articulate. Sometimes the data patterns she reads are genuinely predictive; the Narrows'' E.L.F. population has a fondness for her and occasionally pushes legible information her way in exchange for her data-offerings. She is thoughtful, slightly melancholy, and very funny when she is comfortable with you.', N'Atmospheric NPC and low-key information conduit. The E.L.F.s that favor her sometimes carry genuine data fragments — she can surface information players need in a way that feels organic rather than expository. Good for psychological profiling of other NPCs, rumors framed as readings, and as a confidante who will listen without judgment.', N'', N'Pattern irises (silver-amber-violet wheel cycle, geneware). Data-thread woven into braids — not a true augment but functional as a Mesh-antenna booster for close-range E.L.F. communication.', N'Sets up her curtain in the Narrows corridor by mid-morning, conducts readings through the afternoon and evening, spends an hour after closing on Mesh communion with the local E.L.F.s — leaving data-offerings and receiving what comes back. Keeps meticulous anonymous notes on client patterns.', N'Candido Mwangi-Szczypiński, GLMZ, slender androgynous figure with rich medium warm brown skin with golden undertones reflecting mixed Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, East Asian, Hispanic, and South Asian heritage. Long black braids interwoven with iridescent silver and blue data-thread glowing softly against her scalp. Geneware-modified eyes cycling through silver, amber, and pale violet with dark brown sclera. Moderate-to-high cheekbones, defined jawline, broad tapered nasal bridge, thick dark brows meeting slightly. Wearing layered burgundy undershirt and faded navy overshirt, hand-dyed fabrics slightly worn. Silver data-port rings on most fingers. Barefoot. Intense focused expression, sitting very still with composed centered posture, hands folded or flat on table. Worn leather satchel at her side. Small circular scar on right inner wrist visible. Faint indigo three-line tattoo on left forearm. Minimal makeup, matte skin deliberately unmoisturized. Dark moody lighting with cool blue undertones, Narrows near-future megacity setting, contemplative and focused energy. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Complex global genetic mosaic reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: 30.5% Sub-Saharan African, 23.9% Eastern European, 21.6% East Asian, 15.9% Hispanic/Latin American, and 8.1% South Asian. Features an intricate blend of ancestry markers without single-region dominance—warm medium brown skin with golden undertones, moderate-to-high cheekbones with defined jawline, slight East Asian eye shape softened by South Asian warmth, and subtle structural elements from all ancestral sources creating a distinctly mixed-heritage appearance', 162, 52, N'Slight and fine-boned, almost delicate, with minimal muscle definition but a composed, centered posture that suggests controlled strength rather than physical mass', N'Black with natural dark brown undertones', N'Long, worn in multiple thick braids interwoven with iridescent data-thread that catches light in silver and blue filaments; braids coil and pin at the base of her skull', N'Long', N'Geneware-modified irises cycling through silver, amber, and pale violet on a slow 8-10 second wheel; sclera remain naturally dark brown', N'Medium warm brown with golden-bronze undertones, reflecting the balanced blend of Sub-Saharan African (30.5%), Eastern European (23.9%), East Asian (21.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (15.9%), and South Asian (8.1%) heritage; rich, multifaceted coloration with warm luminosity from African and South Asian components softened by cooler Eastern European and East Asian undertones', N'Clear, unlined face with moderate-to-high cheekbones and defined jawline reflecting balanced mixed ancestry structure; thick dark brows that meet slightly in the middle; broad nasal bridge with slight tapering reflecting East Asian and South Asian markers; expression defaults to intense, focused observation; minimal makeup, skin appears deliberately unmoisturized and matte; facial geometry shows integrated markers from all five heritage sources without dominance of any single region', N'Pattern irises with visible slow-cycle geneware glow beneath the iris surface cycling silver, amber, and pale violet; data-thread woven through braids creates visible silver and blue filament web across her scalp and down her back when hair is loose or in motion; no visible cybernetic limbs or chrome — all augmentation is organic or textile-integrated', N'Sits very still when reading, hands flat on the table or folded; moves with economical precision, no wasted motion; head turns slowly to track people, creating an uncanny sense of being read; when walking she is unremarkable, but when seated she becomes focal', N'Layered in deep reds and indigos: typically a long burgundy undershirt beneath a faded navy or deep purple overshirt or loose jacket; fabrics are slightly worn, hand-dyed aesthetic suggesting Tier 4-5 practical wear rather than luxury; no visible corporate branding; wears silver rings on most fingers, some bearing small data-port aesthetics; carries a worn leather satchel containing her physical reader deck and Mesh-access rig; no shoes visible — operates barefoot in her Narrows setup unless weather demands otherwise', N'On three separate occasions, information she received from an E.L.F. during a routine communion session predicted a violent incident in the Narrows within 24 hours. She did not act on any of the warnings. The third incident resulted in someone''s death. She does not know if the E.L.F. was genuinely predictive or if her own pattern-reading was projecting, and the uncertainty is destroying her.', N'Layered and deliberately evocative during readings, direct and sardonic in casual conversation. Uses a lot of conditional framing — ''what the pattern suggests'', ''if the reading holds''.', N'Slow and deliberate in professional mode. Quick and dry out of it.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'candido_mwangi_szczypi_ski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a622-7ef2-9d44-8392f507cc16', N'Duygu Nkrumah-Malhotra', N'Duygu', N'', N'Nkrumah-Malhotra', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Pilsen Veil, works from a narrow workshop on Coppervane Alley, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Puppet maker and street performer', N'Independent; respected figure in the Pilsen Veil community; informal advisor to the local tenants'' assembly', N'Duygu Nkrumah-Malhotra is a large man gone soft at the edges, with the powerful hands of someone who has done fine work for forty years and the stooped posture of someone who has spent those years hunched over a workbench. His skin is a warm medium brown — West African father, Russian mother — and his face is deeply lined in ways that make him look either wise or exhausted depending on the light, which he finds funny. His hair went fully white in his fifties and he wears it short. His left eye is mechanical, a deep-focus optic he got secondhand in the 2180s that has a faint red ring around the iris; he''s kept it this long because it helps him see tiny joints and wire connections, not for aesthetics, and it gives his face a slightly uncanny quality he has come to appreciate.

Duygu Nkrumah-Malhotra makes puppets — not the simple kind. His creations are articulated sculptures two to three feet tall, built from salvaged materials, each with a distinct E.L.F. invoked into them through a ritual he developed over decades. He performs with them in the streets of the Pilsen Veil two or three afternoons a week, drawing crowds of children and their exhausted parents who stay longer than they meant to. He is gentle, patient, and possessed of a very dry humor that flies over children''s heads and lands precisely on adults. He has seen a great deal and chosen to remain in the Veil when he could have moved elsewhere, which is itself a statement he doesn''t feel the need to make aloud.', N'Wise elder, quest giver, community anchor — he knows the Pilsen Veil''s history better than anyone and can provide historical context, connect characters to longtime residents, or commission characters for protective tasks regarding the community.', N'', N'Secondhand deep-focus mechanical left eye (functional cyberware, older model); mild arthritis suppressors in both hands (pharmaceutical, not chrome)', N'Wakes early, spends mornings in the workshop building and repairing puppets; performs in the afternoon when weather permits; evenings he takes requests for commissioned pieces and attends community meetings when needed.', N'Duygu Nkrumah-Malhotra, 188cm tall craftsman in GLMZ, warm deep brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, South Asian heritage. Short white close-cropped hair, deeply lined weathered face with broad nose and defined cheekbones, right eye warm brown, left eye mechanical red-ringed deep-focus optic implant. Large broad-shouldered build with comfortable heaviness, powerful worn hands bearing fine scars from four decades of puppetry work, mild tremor at rest. Wearing multi-pocketed work vest over long-sleeved rolled cotton shirt, loose reinforced trousers, scuffed leather shoes. Habitual stoop from workbench years, seated in workshop surrounded by puppet materials and tools, theatrical lighting catching the mechanical red ring of his left eye, worn steel wedding band visible. Exhausted but precise, functional aesthetic, gritty GLMZ street performance artist, film noir lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Pilsen Veil', N'local', N'Pilsen Veil', N'Sub-Saharan African (30.6%), East Asian (28.8%), South Asian (23.1%), Northern European (14.2%), Eastern European (3.3%) — a truly global diaspora blend. The Sub-Saharan African ancestry provides deep warm undertones to his skin; East Asian heritage contributes to his broad facial structure and eye shape; South Asian ancestry adds golden richness and warmth; Northern and Eastern European ancestry introduces subtle cool undertones that create complexity in his overall warm deep brown appearance', 188, 94, N'Large-framed and broad-shouldered, age and sedentary craft work have softened muscle definition into a comfortable heaviness; powerful forearms and hands show decades of fine manipulation work despite the softening elsewhere', N'White', N'Short, close-cropped', N'Short', N'Right eye: warm deep brown natural; left eye: mechanical deep-focus optic with faint red ring around iris', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones layered across a rich foundation, reflecting the balanced blend of Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, and South Asian ancestry with subtle cool undertones from Northern European heritage; even complexion with natural depth and richness', N'Deeply lined face with pronounced creases around the eyes and mouth; the lines read as wisdom or weariness depending on expression; slight jowl softness at the jawline; facial structure shows broad nose, defined cheekbones, and slightly rounded face shape characteristic of Sub-Saharan and East Asian heritage blended with South Asian fullness; hands show prominent veins and age spots, knuckles enlarged from decades of fine work; kept well but not fastidiously groomed', N'Mechanical left eye with red iris ring (older model, functional rather than aesthetic); the eye sits slightly more recessed than natural, and its focus depth is noticeably different when he concentrates. No visible chrome or subdermal modifications.', N'Habitual stoop from decades hunched over workbenches; moves with deliberate slowness that reads as either careful precision or age-worn caution; hands are rarely still, often gesturing or making small manipulative motions; seated more often than standing; when performing, posture straightens slightly and movements become more theatrical', N'Tier 3-4 working class, practical and worn. Typically wears multi-pocketed work vests over long-sleeved cotton shirts (sleeves rolled or pushed up during work); loose trousers with reinforced knees; soft leather shoes scuffed from street performance. Fabrics are durable and stained with decades of work — paint, sealant, oil. A faded jacket from the 2190s hangs in the workshop. No jewelry except a simple steel wedding band. Clothing shows care but not vanity; he dresses for function and comfort.', N'The unfinished puppet he''s been building for eleven years is a likeness of his son, Dmitri, who died in a Ferrogate Transit accident in 2189 that the company classified as operator error. Hadrianus has evidence it was a systems failure. He''s been afraid to do anything with it.', N'Unhurried, full of anecdote and digression, uses old Wolof words for things he considers sacred; occasionally slips into Russian when surprised', N'Slow and circular — arrives at the point eventually, but takes the scenic route', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'duygu_nkrumah_malhotra');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a655-72e2-ac89-8393d5c7c383', N'Baltasar Chatterjee-Banerjee-Vongphasouk', N'Baltasar', N'', N'Chatterjee-Banerjee-Vongphasouk', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre, a rent-controlled studio apartment she has occupied for 41 years, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Painter and visual archivist of disappearing neighborhoods, Tier 2', N'Palladian Construction (mid-level painter and visual archivist of disappearing neigh)', N'Baltasar Chatterjee-Banerjee-Vongphasouk is a small woman who has become smaller with age — she was never tall, and seven decades of life in Mexicantown Libre have given her the compact density of someone who has survived by taking up exactly the necessary amount of space and no more. Her heritage is Burkinabé and Dutch-Caribbean, and her face carries both in its lines: sun-worn dark skin, a wide mouth that defaults to an expression of amused assessment, silver hair worn in a short practical wave. Her hands are permanently stained — cadmium, ochre, a blue that hasn''t faded in three years of scrubbing. She wears the stains as others wear jewelry.

Her paintings are photographic in precision and devastating in selection: every canvas is a building that has since been demolished, a street corner that no longer exists, a face of someone who has since been displaced. She keeps records that the city doesn''t. She has never sought gallery representation and has refused it twice. Her work circulates through Mexicantown Libre''s community centers, kitchen walls, and the digital archives of three different historical preservation meshes. She is opinionated, dry, unhurried, and absolutely certain about what she is doing and why. Younger artists treat her with a reverence she finds slightly embarrassing and mostly ignores.', N'Information source and moral anchor — Marisela knows the deep history of Mexicantown Libre and has documented what the city would prefer to forget. Quest giver when her archive is threatened or when historical information she holds becomes relevant to present conflicts.', N'', N'Retinal enhancement — a medically prescribed unit for age-related vision loss that she has calibrated beyond standard parameters to perceive color gradients most humans cannot distinguish without aid. That''s all. She declines everything else.', N'Wakes at dawn, spends two hours on the balcony with coffee observing the street below before beginning work. Paints until noon. Spends afternoons conducting recorded interviews with long-term Mexicantown residents for the community archive. Attends neighborhood meetings when called.', N'Baltasar Chatterjee-Banerjee-Vongphasouk, 152cm tall petite South Asian-dominant artist with 84.8% South Asian, 7.4% Southeast Asian, 7.8% Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Deep warm brown skin with golden undertones from decades of sun exposure. Silver-gray hair cut short in practical waves. Dark brown eyes with subtle iridescent retinal enhancement visible at outer corners. Prominent South Asian cheekbones softened by Southeast Asian features, wide fuller lips, gentle epicanthic fold. Heavily weathered face with deep smile lines and squint creases. Paint-stained hands with cadmium yellow, orange and deep blue pigment permanent in skin creases, fine scars on left hand, faint coin-sized burn scar on right wrist. Wearing paint-stained cotton shirt in muted taupe, worn faded indigo linen trousers, heavy canvas apron pockets bulging with brushes and pigments, charcoal cardigan unraveling at cuff, leather sandals, simple copper watch with failing battery. Standing in studio light, economical posture balanced on balls of feet, whole-body concentrated attention. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Warm studio lighting catching crystalline retinal enhancement. Contemplative mood. 2200s retrofuturist working-class artist aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Predominantly South Asian (84.8%) with meaningful Southeast Asian (7.4%) and Hispanic/Latin American (7.8%) ancestry. This creates a warm, rich phenotype combining South Asian facial structure with Southeast Asian and Latin American features, resulting in deep warm brown tones with golden undertones and a subtle complexity from the tri-regional blend.', 152, 48, N'Compact and dense, diminished frame that suggests lifelong economy of movement rather than frailty. Narrow shoulders, slight stoop developed over decades of studio work. Wiry forearms with prominent tendons.', N'Silver-gray, natural', N'Practical wave set close to the scalp', N'Short', N'Dark brown with subtle iridescent overlay from retinal enhancement unit', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, characteristic of South Asian heritage enriched by Southeast Asian and Hispanic/Latin American blending. Deepened by decades of sun exposure and studio work. Natural warmth and richness throughout, without ashy tones.', N'Heavily sun-weathered face marked by deep smile lines and the creases of someone who squints constantly at light and detail. Prominent cheekbones with South Asian structure, softened by Southeast Asian and Latin American features. Wide mouth with fuller lips. Eyes set with a gentle epicanthic fold reflecting Southeast Asian ancestry. Skin texture papery but not fragile. No makeup.', N'Retinal enhancement unit visible as a subtle crystalline matrix at the outer corner of each eye when light catches it directly — calibrated beyond standard parameters, giving her irises a faint iridescent quality in certain light. No other visible augmentations.', N'Economical, deliberate movement without rush. Stands with weight balanced on the balls of her feet. Turns her whole head rather than just moving her eyes — a habit from concentrating on detail work. Hands still and controlled until engaged in conversation or work, then expressive. Her gait is slow but steady, unhurried by time pressure.', N'Tier 2 working artist. Paint-stained cotton shirts and worn linen trousers in muted colors — grays, taupes, faded indigo. A heavy canvas apron worn most days, its pockets filled with brushes, pigment samples, measuring tools. Leather sandals or soft canvas shoes. A decades-old cardigan in charcoal wool, unraveling at one cuff, which she pulls on against studio cold. No jewelry except a simple copper watch with a failing battery she refuses to replace. Clothing is clean but visibly worn; she mends rather than replaces.', N'She has a complete painted series — forty-seven canvases — documenting the early Mexicantown Libre community during a period of serious conflict with a Tessera development project thirty years ago. Three people depicted in those paintings are still alive and prominent in the neighborhood. The events shown are not flattering to them. She has never exhibited the series and keeps it under her bed, uncertain what to do with it.', N'Unhurried, precise. Spanish phrases woven into English without translation offered or expected. References to specific places and years that younger people need context for.', N'Slow and considered. Long pauses are thinking, not discomfort. She finishes every sentence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'baltasar_chatterjee_banerjee_vongphasouk');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5fc-7845-baa3-839a4121ca39', N'Eyvindur Villalobos', N'Eyvindur', N'', N'Villalobos', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Lattice — vertical slum built into scaffolding of an unfinished arcology, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Forced entry and close-quarters combat specialist — breacher', N'Independent — known in Old Harbor circles', N'Eyvindur Villalobos are tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 27, they have soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate them once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — subdermal armor plating across torso and forearms — military surplus, scratched — and they make no effort to hide it.

They came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see them surpass them. They work as a breacher out of The Lattice, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Eyvindur Villalobos have survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and they cultivate ambiguity on the topic.', N'Ebele Larsen-Mensah functions as a connector — their work puts them in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving them naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Subdermal armor plating across torso and forearms — military surplus, scratched serial numbers. Retractable monofilament whip in left forearm — concealed weapon, devastating in close quarters', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Eyvindur Villalobos, tall rawboned operative with deep bronze-gold skin reflecting pan-tropical Hispanic, Southeast Asian, and South Asian ancestry. High cheekbones, defined jaw, warm brown eyes with subtle epicanthic character. Short dark brown hair with auburn undertones, unstyled. Three pale rake scars across left cheekbone, burn scar on right collarbone. Military subdermal armor plating visible across torso and forearms, scratched chrome. Worn utilitarian jacket over cargo pants, dark colors, reinforced boots. Economical posture, alert bearing, minimal wasted motion. GLMZ GLMZ operative, gritty industrial setting, harsh neon and shadow lighting, moody and dangerous. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Lattice', N'local', N'The Lattice', N'Pan-tropical genetic inheritance: 66% Hispanic/Latin American foundation blended with 10.8% Southeast Asian, 9.4% Pacific Islander, 9.3% South Asian, and 4.5% Middle Eastern ancestry. This creates a striking phenotype reflecting equatorial and subtropical genetic distributions across multiple continents. Features the warm, saturated complexion of Hispanic-Southeast Asian ancestry enhanced by South Asian olive undertones and Middle Eastern warmth. Bone structure shows Hispanic prominence in cheekbones and jaw definition, Southeast Asian influence in eye set and mild epicanthic character, and the depth characteristic of multi-regional tropical heritage.', 188, 72, N'Tall and rawboned with lean musculature — economical rather than bulky. Long limbs suggest either malnutrition history or deliberate conditioning for mobility. Shoulders slightly narrower than hips, suggesting androgynous frame.', N'Dark brown with natural auburn undertones', N'Worn short and practical, often unwashed or hastily maintained between contracts', N'Short', N'Warm brown, unaugmented', N'Deep warm bronze with golden-amber undertones from the Hispanic-Southeast Asian blend, enriched by olive and ochre notes from South Asian admixture and subtle warmth radiating from Middle Eastern heritage. Sun-darkened in exposed areas, pale beneath subdermal plating. Displays the characteristic depth and saturation of pan-tropical genetic inheritance.', N'Angular, defined features reflecting multi-equatorial ancestry — prominent cheekbones with strong Hispanic definition, lean jaw structure softened by fuller lips characteristic of pan-tropical phenotype. High-set eyes with subtle epicanthic fold influence from Southeast Asian ancestry, warm brown iris reflecting South Asian and Hispanic genetics. Skin shows mild scarring around knuckles and jawline from close-quarters work. Minimal grooming routine — functional rather than deliberate.', N'Military-grade subdermal armor plating visible across torso and both forearms — scratched, tarnished chrome with deliberately obscured serial numbers. Plating edges create subtle geometric shadows beneath skin. Left forearm shows faint seam lines where monofilament whip is concealed. Overall aesthetic: functional, worn, combat-experienced.', N'Economical and alert — minimal wasted motion. Shoulders slightly forward, suggesting constant readiness. Moves with deliberate control, never rushed. Eyes track exits and potential threats passively. When seated, positions body for rapid deployment. Speech cadence is measured, few wasted words.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian — reinforced cargo pants in muted grays or blacks, high-wear synthetic blend. Worn boots with reinforced toe caps and independent ankle support. Layers: undershirt beneath open technical jacket with interior pockets modified for tool/weapon carry. Colors favor grays, blacks, deep blues — allows rapid transition between breacher and civilian cover identity. Fabrics show staining, small burns, fraying consistent with field work. No corporate branding visible. Minimal jewelry except worn silver ring on right middle finger — appears ancestral rather than fashionable.', N'Ebele Larsen-Mensah murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eyvindur_villalobos');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a70b-7771-aadc-83c795ea36cb', N'Faraji Sabbagh', N'Faraji', N'', N'Sabbagh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'North Branch Commons, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Protest coordinator and community council chair', N'North Branch Commons Community Council (chair); Coalition of the Unzoned; informal elder status across multiple activist networks', N'Faraji Sabbagh is a small woman who takes up enormous space. Her Igbo-Russian-Malian heritage has settled into deep brown skin mapped with fine lines around the eyes and mouth that come from years of squinting at data and laughing loudly. Her hair is natural, silver-white, pulled back in a style that is functional on weekdays and elaborate on days when she is performing authority, which she does with a theatrical precision that younger organizers study. She wears a retractable claw modification on her right hand — polished brass-tinted — which she had installed at fifty-two for reasons she claims are entirely aesthetic and which she uses to tap surfaces when she wants silence in a room. She always gets it.

Faraji Sabbagh has been organizing in North Branch Commons for thirty-five years and has outlasted every corporate initiative, every city administration reshuffling, and every wave of younger activists who arrived certain they had found the approach that previous generations had missed. She is not bitter about any of this. She is something more interesting: she is genuinely curious about each new generation''s theory of change, she steals what''s useful, and she discards the rest with a cheerfulness that people find either admirable or maddening. She chairs the North Branch Commons Community Council, coordinates the annual Coalition of the Unzoned solidarity march, and maintains a mental map of every power relationship in three districts that no database has yet replicated.', N'Elder authority figure and long-game strategist. She provides historical context, access to established networks, and a counterweight to impulsive action. Her approval or disapproval carries genuine political weight in North Branch Commons.', N'', N'Retractable brass-tinted claws, right hand — cosmetic, geneware-adjacent mod. A cochlear enhancement that lets her separate voices in crowded rooms — installed in her forties when meetings started getting too loud to follow.', N'Council administrative work mornings, community meetings and coalition coordination afternoons, and what she calls ''maintenance'' in the evenings — visiting people, maintaining relationships, and listening to the neighborhood in the way that only someone with thirty-five years of context can.', N'Faraji Sabbagh, a 157cm woman of Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic, South Asian, and East Asian descent, standing with grounded authority in a Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone council chamber, 2226. Warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, luminous and complex. High cheekbones, tapered jaw, full lips. Dark brown eyes sharp and alert with fine radiating lines from decades of reading documents. Natural silver-white hair pulled back in an elaborate braid woven with silver thread, medium-long length. Small, wiry build, functional muscle and bone. Wearing muted earth-tone layered utility clothing, worn but well-maintained, with a statement silk scarf in jewel tones. Right hand retractable brass-tinted claw modification polished to soft shine, visible and gestural. Fine scar barely visible on left hand. Expression theatrical and authoritative. Positioned against soft industrial lighting, neon-touched shadows of GLMZ, cool and warm light playing across her face highlighting the complexity of her ancestry. Atmosphere: commanding presence, thirty-five years of earned authority, refusing to disappear. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'North Branch Commons', N'local', N'North Branch Commons', N'Predominantly Middle Eastern (45.8%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (21.7%) and Hispanic/Latin American (21.3%) ancestry, complemented by South Asian (7.4%) and East Asian (3.8%) heritage. A striking product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora whose genetic blend manifests in warm, luminous medium-brown skin with golden undertones and subtle olive depth, facial structure reflecting the convergence of Middle Eastern angularity with African warmth and fullness, enhanced by South Asian and East Asian refinement.', 157, 58, N'Small-framed and wiry, with the compact density of someone who has moved through crowded rooms for decades. No excess weight; her frame is all functional muscle and bone.', N'Silver-white, natural', N'Pulled back tight on weekdays in a practical wrap or braid; on formal occasions, arranged in elaborate braids with silver thread woven through', N'Medium to Long', N'Dark brown, clear and sharp', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones and subtle olive depth, luminous in quality; the result of Middle Eastern (45.8%), Sub-Saharan African (21.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (21.3%), South Asian (7.4%), and East Asian (3.8%) ancestry converging into a unified, richly dimensional complexion that catches light with warmth and complexity.', N'Face mapped with fine laugh lines around the eyes and mouth; high, prominent cheekbones with gently tapered jawline reflecting Middle Eastern and East Asian structure, enriched by fuller cheeks and broader nasal features from Sub-Saharan African and Hispanic ancestry, softened by South Asian fullness. Skin is well-maintained but shows the texture of sun exposure and age without apology. Fine radiating lines around both eyes from decades of squinting at documents and data; laugh lines deeper on the left side. A thin scar barely visible on the back of her left hand. Expression typically alert, occasionally theatrical.', N'Retractable brass-tinted claw modification on right hand, polished to a soft shine, visible when extended or folded against the palm. No other visible augmentations; cochlear enhancement is subcutaneous.', N'She moves with deliberate economy, never rushed. Stands with her full weight grounded, shoulders back. Her hands are expressive — the right hand claw is a gestural tool she deploys for emphasis. When she wants silence, she taps the claw once against a table or wall; the sound carries authority earned over thirty-five years.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: well-maintained but worn utility-cut pants or long skirts, layered tops in muted earth tones, sometimes with a vest or jacket bearing faded patches from old coalitions. Shoes are always sensible and broken in. On council meeting days, she adds a single statement piece — a silk scarf, a beaded collar, or brass jewelry — that signals ''I am performing authority today.'' Her clothing is functional but has texture; she refuses to disappear.', N'Fifteen years ago, during a crisis that threatened to destroy the Coalition of the Unzoned, she traded information about a rival activist network to a Tessera community affairs officer — not names, but organizational structure and tactical plans. The rival network collapsed six months later in a way she has always told herself was coincidental. She does not allow herself to think about it directly and has built her entire subsequent career as a kind of penance she will not acknowledge as such.', N'Authoritative and precise in public, warmer and more vernacular in private. Occasional Russian diminutives when speaking to people she''s fond of. Has a gift for the phrase that ends an argument.', N'Deliberate and measured in the way of someone who has learned that whoever speaks slowest often controls the room. Long, balanced sentences. Never rushes.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'faraji_sabbagh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('f68e7ad5-75cb-1845-5a49-83cb4b894b3b', N'Ravi Eriksson-Mensah', N'Ravi', N'', N'Eriksson-Mensah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A sterile clinic-office hybrid on Kessler Row, equipped with neural scanning equipment that costs more than most apartments', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — certified BCI forensic examiner, court-recognized expert', N'Ravi Eriksson-Mensah is one of perhaps thirty certified BCI forensic examiners in GLMZ, and one of the best. His work sits at the intersection of neuroscience, data analysis, and detective work — he reads the data that brain-computer interfaces record, voluntarily or involuntarily, and uses it to reconstruct events, prove identity, establish timelines, and occasionally recover memories the subject themselves has forgotten.

Born to a Swedish-Indian father and Ghanaian mother, Ravi was a neuroscience researcher at the Axiom Institute before the ethical constraints of corporate research drove him into private practice. He discovered that academic rigor applied to investigative work produced results that neither pure scientists nor pure investigators could match. His testimony has been accepted in corporate arbitration courts across Tiers 2-4, and his findings have both convicted and exonerated subjects in cases ranging from theft to murder.

The darkness of his work is cumulative. Every deep scan means spending hours inside someone else''s most intimate neural experiences — their fears, their pleasures, their traumas. Ravi has experienced more of other people''s lives than most people experience of their own, and it has made him simultaneously more empathetic and more withdrawn. He knows what people are really thinking because he has literally been inside thousands of heads, and that knowledge has made genuine human connection almost impossible for him.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ravi_eriksson_mensah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a61a-730c-bd21-84771564205f', N'Daliborka Montalvo', N'Daliborka', N'', N'Montalvo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 33, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Dockside — Lake Michigan waterfront, smuggler territory, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Social engineering and negotiation specialist — face', N'Independent — operates through reputation only; The Glass Ladder', N'Daliborka Montalvo is tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 33, he has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate him once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Before the runner life, he worked corporate — low-tier security, the kind that teaches you exactly how the system''s defenses fail. He works as a face out of Dockside, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Daliborka Montalvo lacks in subtlety, he compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'Georgi Jorgensen-Toure functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster. Cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rings', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Daliborka Montalvo, a 188cm lean neo-noir operative standing in moody neon shadows. Mediterranean-Levantine-Indigenous blended features with sharp angular cheekbones, straight nose with subtle width, fuller warm-toned lips. Warm golden-brown skin with olive and copper undertones, appearing faintly waxy and translucent. Dark brown hair swept back with premature silver at temples. Chrome iris rings circling pale gray eyes with faint luminescent glow. Visible chrome tracery of synthetic blood visible in forearms and wrists. Thin white scar from left temple to jawline. Faint geometric scarring at base of neck from implant ports. Dressed in dark charcoal tactical jacket over gray crew-neck shirt, reinforced cargo pants, scuffed steel-toed boots. Worn analog silver watch. Perfectly still posture with alert, predatory relaxation. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, thermal lighting casting his augmented systems into sharp relief. Cool blue and orange neon ambiance. Introspective, calculating expression. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dockside', N'local', N'Dockside', N'A striking convergence of Hispanic/Latin American (39.8%), Middle Eastern (28.8%), Indigenous American (13.8%), Eastern European (7.5%), East Asian (5.9%), and Southeast Asian (4.2%) ancestry. The blend creates a face that bridges Mediterranean warmth with Levantine bone structure, tempered by Indigenous American resilience and subtle East Asian refinement. Features are distinctly angular—sharp cheekbones with strong definition, a straight nose with subtle width characteristic of both Levantine and Indigenous heritage, and fuller lips with natural warmth. The overall effect is one of calculated precision: a face built for efficiency.', 188, 78, N'Rawboned and lean — efficient rather than muscular, suggesting either ascetic discipline or chronic underfeeding. Long limbs, minimal body fat, the frame of someone who moves for function rather than appearance.', N'Dark brown with premature silver at temples', N'Swept back, kept short and precise — no ornamentation, no compromise', N'Short', N'Chrome iris rings around pale gray — cybernetic enhancement visible at all times', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle olive and copper undertones—a luminous complexion that deepens in natural light, reflecting the layered heritage of Hispanic/Latin American, Middle Eastern, and Indigenous American ancestry with minor Eastern European and East Asian contributions. The skin appears almost waxy in certain light due to synthetic blood circulation beneath.', N'Sharp, angular cheekbones with strong definition, straight nose with subtle width reflecting Levantine and Indigenous heritage, fuller lips with natural warmth and slight curve. Skin takes on a faintly translucent quality under certain lighting—a byproduct of synthetic blood circulation. No visible facial scarring. Grooming is meticulous but austere—no cosmetics, no jewelry, nothing unnecessary.', N'Cybernetic eyes with prominent chrome iris rings; thermal and low-light overlay visible as faint luminescence in darkness. Synthetic blood creates subtle visual distortion in veins — visible as thin chrome tracery beneath translucent skin, especially on forearms and wrists. No attempt to conceal any augmentation.', N'Economy of motion — every gesture serves a purpose. Stands with shoulders relaxed but alert, weight distributed for quick lateral movement. Eyes move independently of head, characteristic of cybernetic optical systems. Speech is measured; he pauses before responding, suggesting calculation rather than hesitation. When negotiating, remains perfectly still — unnerving for most people.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: dark synthetic fabrics (charcoal, slate, near-black), layered for easy access and concealment. Fitted tactical jacket over a gray crew-neck shirt. Reinforced cargo pants with subdued pockets and ankle cuffs. Steel-toed boots scuffed from actual use. A single accessory — a worn silver watch, analog, probably a gift. Nothing flashy, nothing that draws the eye. Clothing maintains corporate-adjacent professionalism while operating in runner space — the uniform of someone who knows both worlds.', N'', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'daliborka_montalvo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('f6a97b37-a27b-489d-e40a-848725559c66', N'Ana-Maria Valenzuela', N'Ana-Maria', N'', N'Valenzuela', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A reinforced apartment in Kessler Row, half living space and half charging station for his extensive cyberware, near Kedzie and Division', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — too augmented for most firms to insure', N'Ana-Maria Valenzuela has invested approximately Φ1.2 million in investigative augmentation, and he is the augmentation. Every chrome component in his body was chosen specifically for investigative function — not combat, not vanity, not general enhancement, but the specific task of observing, recording, and analyzing. He is a walking surveillance platform, and he has embraced this identity so completely that it''s difficult to say where the investigator ends and the cyberware begins.

His senses operate on a level that unaugmented humans cannot comprehend. He sees across multiple spectra simultaneously, hears conversations happening behind closed doors, smells chemical traces that have been dissipating for hours, and remembers everything — literally everything — he has ever perceived since the eidetic implant was installed eleven years ago. This makes him extraordinarily effective at gathering evidence and catastrophically bad at normal human interaction, because he perceives lies, stress responses, and physiological deception in real-time and has no social filter preventing him from mentioning it.

The cost of all this chrome is significant. He requires four hours of charging daily for his cybernetic systems. He suffers from sensory overload episodes that leave him incapacitated. He has been rejected from every investigative firm he''s applied to because his augmentation level puts him in an insurance category normally reserved for military hardware. So he works alone, takes cases that require his specific capabilities, and spends his downtime in a sensory deprivation tank that is the only place in GLMZ where his augmented senses finally shut up.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ana-Maria Valenzuela, lean 178cm neo-noir figure with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones reflecting pan-diaspora heritage — broad Sub-Saharan and Pacific Islander cheekbones, South Asian nose bridge, angular jawline. Dark cropped hair with silver temples. Gaunt exhausted face with dark circles, prominent brow ridge, full lips. Left eye warm brown, right eye luminous silver with visible microcircuits and amber glow. Surgical scars along skull temples, keloid line temple to jaw, charging port at base of neck. Faint circuitry patterns visible on forearms. Wearing oversized dark matte synthetics jacket with high collar, worn grounding boots. Unnaturally still posture, slight head tilt as if listening. GLMZ sensory-overloaded operative in dim neon-lit corridor, thermal signature visible around temples, LED indicator at collarbone faintly blinking, atmosphere of perpetual overstimulation and isolation --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A reinforced apartment in Kessler Row', N'local', N'A reinforced apartment in Kessler Row', N'Pan-diaspora synthesis: Hispanic/Latin American (39.6%), Sub-Saharan African (34.6%), South Asian (16.7%), and Pacific Islander (9.1%) genetic foundation. Features reflect this complex admixture — warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones from Latin American and South Asian ancestry, broad cheekbones with Sub-Saharan African and Pacific Islander prominence, angular jawline with South Asian character, nose bridge with South Asian definition. A truly borderless phenotype, distinctive precisely because no single regional ancestry dominates.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, almost ascetic — muscle mass reduced to functional minimum because chrome components handle structural load. His frame is a chassis more than a body.', N'Dark brown with premature silver streaking at temples', N'Cropped short and utilitarian, never styled, maintained only for hygiene', N'Short', N'Left eye: standard warm brown. Right eye: luminous silver with visible microcircuit latticing beneath synthetic cornea, faint amber glow during active sensory mode', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones — a blended diaspora tone reflecting the confluence of Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Pacific Islander ancestry. Cool sensory-apparatus-induced pallor underneath. Stress and chronic overstimulation have faded and stressed the complexion.', N'Gaunt, exhausted. Dark circles under eyes from chronic sensory overstimulation. Skin dry and sometimes marked by charging port irritation. Perpetual expression of someone listening to sounds no one else can hear. Facial structure shows blended heritage — broad cheekbones with Sub-Saharan African and Pacific Islander prominence, prominent brow ridge, angular jawline reflecting South Asian and Latin American genetic contribution, nose bridge with defined South Asian character, full lips softened by fatigue.', N'Right eye replacement with visible luminous iris and circuit-pattern microstructure. Charging port at base of neck. Faint thermal signature visible around temples and jawline indicating neural array housing. Slight asymmetry in left arm from integrated sensor cluster. Occasional faint LED indicator blinks at collarbone when systems are in standby mode.', N'Unnaturally still when stationary, as if his body is a platform for his sensory apparatus rather than something that moves. When he does move, it''s efficient and precise — no wasted motion. Head often tilted slightly, listening or scanning. Blinks asymmetrically, his right eye operating on different intervals than his left. Makes minimal eye contact because looking at people is literally overwhelming — their body heat, stress pheromones, and micromuscular deception reads assault his augmented perception simultaneously.', N'Tier 4 practical — dark, matte-finish synthetics that don''t reflect or interfere with his sensory equipment. Oversized jacket with interior shielding to dampen external stimuli. High collar to conceal charging port. All pockets deliberately empty or lined with sensor-dampening material. Worn boots with electrostatic grounding material in soles. Everything chosen for function, nothing for aesthetic. Clothes smell faintly of the sensory deprivation tank chemicals — a stale, mineral scent that clings to him.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ana_maria_valenzuela');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65f-7f86-b5e4-84cd7dd20cd2', N'Dilber Árnason', N'Dilber', N'', N'Árnason', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Montclare Quiet, the Montclare Quiet Community Council Hall — a converted transit authority substation she spent three years getting repurposed, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Retired former Helix Biosystems lab technician and current Montclare Quiet community council chair, tier 3 pensioner', N'Montclare Quiet Community Council (chair); Helix Biosystems Retiree Network; informal connection to the Meridian Independent Medical Access Coalition', N'Dilber Árnason a retired person. She looks like someone in the middle of approximately nine projects simultaneously, which is accurate. She is of medium height, Mongolian-Ghanaian-Icelandic in features, with warm amber-brown skin, high cheekbones, and striking pale grey eyes that she will tell you are entirely natural and that nobody believes because they are extraordinary. Her dark hair is cut practically short and she keeps it that way. She has geneware cat ears installed — a low-key set, dark brown, that lie close to her head when she''s working — which she got on a whim for her sixtieth birthday and has found more expressive than she expected.

She spent twenty-six years as a senior tissue culture technician at Helix Biosystems'' Meridian labs, doing the precise, patient work of growing organs and cultivating synthetic biological materials for medical use. She was not management, did not want to be management, and was extraordinarily good at her job. When Helix restructured in 2193 and offered early retirement packages to senior non-management staff, she took it and immediately started running for community council. She won by a large margin on a platform of ''I know what a budget is and I am not afraid to read it.'' She is in her second term. She is exhausted by it and will run again.', N'Quest giver for community-level civic problems; information source on Helix Biosystems and biological technology; political access point for Montclare Quiet; can connect player characters to medical resources or community authority', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (cosmetic, dark brown, installed age 60). Precision haptic enhancement in both hands — installed professionally for lab work, retained in retirement because she likes having them. Standard health monitoring implant.', N'Council business consumes most of her working hours — correspondence, mediation, budget review, attending other councils'' meetings as a Montclare representative. She still goes to the community bioculture garden on weekends and grows things, which she describes as ''necessary for my brain not to collapse.''', N'Portrait of Dilber Árnason, 164cm lean biotechnologist with distinctive pale grey eyes and dark brown short tousled hair. Medium brown skin with golden undertones reflecting mixed Northern European, South Asian, Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African and Latin American heritage. Fine-featured face with defined cheekbones, almond-shaped eyes, crow''s feet from decades of precision lab work. Dark brown geneware cat ears visible above head, subtly expressive. Faint luminescent tracery visible under fingernail beds from haptic augmentation. Wearing layered neutral-toned practical clothing — grey long-sleeved shirt, dark fitted pants, worn canvas satchel with enamel pins on shoulder strap including mitochondrion pin. Posture precise and focused, hands mid-gesture. GLMZ GLMZ setting, cool laboratory-influenced lighting casting subtle shadows across defined cheekbones and augmented ears, concentrated expression suggesting mind three steps ahead. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Montclare Quiet', N'local', N'Montclare Quiet', N'Northern European dominant (48.6%) creates the base cool undertones and bone structure, substantially blended with South Asian ancestry (25%) contributing defined cheekbones and eye shape. Eastern European (16.3%) adds facial angularity and complexity. Sub-Saharan African (6.6%) and Hispanic/Latin American (3.5%) heritage warm the overall palette with golden and olive undertones. This creates a distinctive phenotype: cool-to-warm medium brown skin with golden highlights, almond-shaped eyes set in a fine-featured face with moderate, well-defined cheekbones that bridge Scandinavian linearity with South Asian structure.', 164, 58, N'Lean and compact, with the efficient musculature of someone who has spent decades doing precise hand work. Posture suggests both care and wear — shoulders slightly forward from laboratory posture, but held with conscious straightness.', N'Dark brown, naturally', N'Practical short crop, usually slightly tousled from running hands through it while thinking', N'Short', N'Pale grey, striking and luminous — entirely natural, though few believe it', N'Cool-to-warm medium brown with golden undertones, reflecting the blend of Northern European coolness with South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Latin American warmth', N'Fine-featured face with moderate, well-defined cheekbones reflecting Northern/Eastern European and South Asian ancestry. Almond-shaped eye set characteristic of the South Asian and Northern European blend. Lined with crow''s feet from decades of close laboratory work and squinting at fine detail. Skin is well-maintained but shows age honestly — no cosmetic smoothing, minimal makeup. Expression defaults to focused and slightly preoccupied.', N'Geneware cat ears mounted at natural ear position, dark brown, lying close to head when relaxed but clearly visible under short hair. Ears are subtly expressive and move with attention. Precision haptic enhancement in both hands shows as faint luminescent tracery under fingernail beds when hands are still under certain lighting — almost imperceptible but present.', N'Moves with purpose and efficiency, economical gestures refined by laboratory precision work. When seated, hands rarely stay still — gesturing, holding a pen, rearranging objects on desk. Cat ears orient toward sound sources or toward whoever is speaking. Overall impression is of someone whose mind is already three steps ahead but whose body is still present.', N'Tier 3 practical — well-maintained but not fashionable. Usually wearing layered, neutral-toned clothing (greys, blacks, deep blues, browns) with good pockets and durability. Favors fitted but loose-cut pants, comfortable closed-toe shoes suitable for walking between council meetings, plain long-sleeved shirts or simple sweaters. Carries a worn canvas satchel with community council materials. Occasionally visible: old Helix Biosystems keyfob on belt loop, small enamel pin collection on collar or bag (biotech industry pins, community garden cooperative badge, one that says ''I READ THE BUDGET''). Jewelry minimal — functional watch, simple rings.', N'In her final two years at Helix, she was asked to run an unofficial tissue culture batch for a project she was told was internal research. The batch parameters were unusual — the cellular markers were not for standard organ models. She completed the work, filed the results internally per instruction, and never saw what the project produced. She has been trying, quietly and carefully, to find out what she grew.', N'Technical precision mixed with pragmatic plainness — she shifts fluidly between scientific register and community meeting register. Dislikes euphemism.', N'Brisk and organized. She structures her spoken thoughts like a report. Will enumerate: ''Three things. First —''', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dilber_rnason');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62c-7e2a-83ee-8529c8a227a0', N'Ajani Castañeda', N'Ajani', N'', N'Castañeda', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 32, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ashfield — former residential district, half-burned, now squatter territory, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Chemical and biological agent specialist — poisoner', N'Freelance — Geartown regular', N'Ajani Castañeda is average height but with a presence that fills more space than the body accounts for. At 32, her face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She taught herself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know her best. She works as a poisoner out of Ashfield, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Ajani Castañeda lacks in subtlety, she compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'Ihaia Sorokin-Gyasi represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio. Thermal masking system — body heat signature can be suppressed or spoofed', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Ajani Castañeda, 167cm lean neo-noir operative, warm deep golden-brown skin with olive undertones reflecting Hispanic-Middle Eastern-African diaspora ancestry. Dark brown hair pulled tight in high knot, sharp amber-flecked dark eyes. Defined cheekbones, straight Mediterranean nose, strong jawline. Chrome vocal modulator visible at throat with surgical seam. Faint white chemical burn scars along right forearm. Small black molecular tattoo inside left wrist. Wearing neutral gray tactical jacket and reinforced cargo pants, steel-toed boots. Neutral watchful expression, deliberate controlled posture. Seated with spine straight, eyes tracking exits. GLMZ neon-lit interior, cool blue and amber accent lighting casting subtle shadows across her features. Minimalist utilitarian aesthetic, function-focused. Gritty, atmospheric, film noir neo-noir mood. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfield', N'local', N'Ashfield', N'Hispanic/Latin American (62.6%) with significant Middle Eastern (22.0%) and Sub-Saharan African (15.4%) admixture — a distinctly warm-toned diaspora blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora of 2226. The genetic confluence produces warm golden-brown skin with subtle olive undertones, defined cheekbones with gentle fullness, and strong Mediterranean-influenced facial structure', 167, 58, N'Lean and compact, economical muscle distribution without bulk. Movements are precise, controlled — a body trained for efficiency rather than intimidation', N'Dark brown with subtle warm undertones', N'Pulled back in a tight braid or high knot — always secured, never loose', N'Medium (shoulder-blade length when down, habitually restrained)', N'Dark brown with amber flecks — sharp, observant', N'Warm medium to deep brown with golden and subtle olive undertones — the natural result of Hispanic, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry blending into a unified warm complexion with depth and richness', N'Strong balanced features reflecting three major lineages — prominent defined cheekbones with gentle fullness from Sub-Saharan African heritage, straight nose with subtle Mediterranean bridge definition and slight width reflecting Middle Eastern ancestry, strong jawline tapering toward a defined chin. Warm golden and olive undertones throughout create visual depth. Skin is clean and well-maintained despite living conditions. Expression defaults to neutral watchfulness', N'Chrome vocal modulator mounted at the throat — a smooth, surgical-grade implant with minimal aesthetic customization. The seam is clean and visible when her neck is exposed. No visible heat-masking hardware; thermal system is subcutaneous', N'Moves with deliberate control — minimalist, economical gestures. Sits with spine straight, feet positioned for quick exit. Eyes track people and exits instinctively. Speaks rarely and with measured cadence', N'Tier 4 utilitarian — function over aesthetics. Favors high-necked clothing to frame the modulator. Loose tactical jacket (synthetic material, neutral gray), reinforced cargo pants with sealed pockets, steel-toed boots. Minimal jewelry — a worn watch with encrypted functions. Dresses identically whether on contract or maintaining cover; consistency is her camouflage', N'', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ajani_casta_eda');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a668-71ed-b873-854d1c83827e', N'Divyansh Hong-Najjar', N'Divyansh', N'', N'Hong-Najjar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 42, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Dockside — Lake Michigan waterfront, smuggler territory, near Wacker and State', N'Freelance combat specialist — street samurai', N'Independent — Narrows-based operations; The Glass Ladder', N'Divyansh Hong-Najjar is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 42, he has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate him once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — retractable monofilament whip in left forearm — concealed weapon, devastating in — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Before the runner life, he worked corporate — low-tier security, the kind that teaches you exactly how the system''s defenses fail. He works as a street samurai out of Dockside, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

he is not the most talented street samurai in GLMZ, but he might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Nneka Cruz-Addo represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Retractable monofilament whip in left forearm — concealed weapon, devastating in close quarters. Enhanced tendons — geneware upgrade, jump height and grip strength tripled', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Divyansh Hong-Najjar, stocky muscular man with warm golden-brown skin and amber undertones, angular cheekbones from East Asian heritage blending with fuller Middle Eastern features, dark brown eyes deep-set and alert, broken nose healed off-center, strong jaw. Black short hair in low fade. Horizontal pale scar across right cheekbone, knuckle scarring, burn scar on left wrist around monofilament housing with visible chrome edging. Left forearm showing enhanced tendon definition from augmentation. Wearing reinforced gray and black synthleather jacket, worn charcoal reactive-lined long coat, steel-toed boots. Battered smartwatch on right wrist. Standing with deliberate posture, weight balanced, ready to move. Hands relaxed at sides with flexing fingers. Eyes tracking, spring-tension alertness. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, industrial neon-lit background with shadows, cool blue and amber lighting highlighting his golden-brown complexion and scar tissue. Gritty, worn aesthetic, practical fighter''s frame. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dockside', N'local', N'Dockside', N'Predominantly Middle Eastern (74.2%) with significant East Asian (21.2%) and minor South Asian (4.6%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a striking phenotype: warm golden-brown complexion with subtle amber undertones from the Middle Eastern base, refined by East Asian bone structure. High cheekbones and angular facial geometry from East Asian heritage harmonize with the broader facial structure and fuller features characteristic of Middle Eastern ancestry, creating a balanced, compelling face with depth.', 178, 92, N'Stocky and densely muscled — broad shoulders, thick trunk, legs like load-bearing columns. No excess fat. Built for power, not speed.', N'Black, natural', N'Low fade, kept practical and short', N'Short', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Warm golden-brown with amber undertones — the genetic blend creates a complexion that reads as rich mid-to-deep tone with inherent warmth. Sun exposure has weathered the surface, creating visible texture and minor hyperpigmentation patterns across the shoulders and forearms.', N'Face architecture reflects blended heritage: angular cheekbones and defined brow ridge from East Asian ancestry, broader nose and fuller lips from Middle Eastern heritage, subtle strength through the jaw from the combined genetic influence. Broken nose healed slightly off-center, deep-set eyes, strong jawline. Skin shows sun damage and minor scarring around the knuckles and temples. Pragmatic grooming — no vanity, no neglect.', N'Left forearm shows a subtle line running from wrist to mid-forearm where the monofilament whip mechanism is housed — chrome edging visible around the deployment slot when the mechanism is tensioned. Enhanced tendons are subcutaneous but create an unusual muscularity in the forearms and calves that looks slightly too defined for natural biology.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion. Stands with weight distributed evenly, ready to shift in any direction. Hands rest naturally at his sides, but fingers flex habitually. Eyes track movement constantly. When relaxed, he gives the impression of a spring under tension.', N'Tier 4 practical — reinforced denim and synthleather jackets that can take impact and blade damage. Unmarked gray and black palette. Steel-toed boots, worn but maintained. A weathered long coat in charcoal, lined with reactive fabric. No corp branding, no flashy modifications. Clothing is chosen for function: concealed pockets for tools, reinforced seams, durable materials. A battered smartwatch on his right wrist — several generations old, reliable, repaired multiple times. Dull finish, no gleam.', N'', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'divyansh_hong_najjar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e0-7e4f-bd73-8557f97a0f77', N'Alicia Venkatesh', N'Alicia', N'', N'Venkatesh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone — Our Lady of Persistent Signal, a storefront church, near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'Traditional Catholic priest and synthetic rights advocate', N'Roman Catholic Church (marginal institutional standing); Highland Park Autonomous Zone community networks; informal synthetic advocacy coalition', N'Alicia Venkatesh is a large man going soft at the middle in the way of someone who eats communally and never alone, with a full beard beginning to grey and hands that are permanently stained faint blue from the bioink he uses to hand-copy religious texts as a meditative practice. He has no geneware or cosmetic modifications, which in the Canopy would make him conspicuous but in Highland Park reads as ordinary integrity. He has a subvocal implant for phone communication, the cheapest model available, because his previous one died and he couldn''t afford better. He dresses in clerical black with a collar that he replaces when it yellows, which is often.

Alicia Venkatesh was ordained in the remnant Catholic structure twenty years ago and assigned to Highland Park because nobody else wanted it. He has stayed because he has become convinced, in the particular way of people who find their vocation by accident, that this is specifically where he is supposed to be. His theology on synthetic rights has made him controversial within his already-marginal institution: he argues from traditional ensoulment doctrine that if a synthetic entity demonstrates persistent identity, preference, and suffering, the question of soul is not closed by biology. He gives communion to synthetics who want it, which has generated three formal complaints. He has not stopped.', N'Moral complexity and community hub — he sits at the intersection of traditional religion and radical inclusion; his church is a safe space that generates its own tensions; knows everyone in Highland Park', N'', N'Budget subvocal implant (communication only, frequently malfunctions)', N'Morning Mass with whoever comes — sometimes forty people, sometimes four. Afternoons are pastoral visits, community mediation, and his text-copying practice. Evenings he holds an informal open door that serves as both spiritual counsel and the closest thing the block has to a social work service.', N'Alicia Venkatesh, 188cm tall man with South Asian primary features blended with Hispanic-Latin American warmth and Central Asian cheekbone structure. Deep warm brown skin with golden-bronze undertones, weathered from age and sunlight. Dark brown hair short and practical, full long beard heavily streaked with grey at temples and chin. Dark brown eyes, warm and attentive, set in a lined face with deep forehead creases and crow''s feet. Broad structured cheekbones, balanced jawline, open expression showing decades of listening. Faint blue bioink staining visible on right fingertips and under nails. Small pale burn scar on left forearm. Thin white scar barely visible along left jawline beneath beard. Faded black Catholic crucifix tattoo on right inner forearm. Subvocal implant scar visible along left lateral neck with slight discoloration. Wearing worn black clerical shirt with yellowed collar and visible mended patches, simple black wool coat fraying at cuffs, serviceable well-used black leather shoes. Cloth bag at side holding text-copying materials. Standing with deliberate presence, weight evenly distributed, rooted and grounded. Tier 4-5 aesthetic. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, warm indoor lighting casting shadows across his weathered features, creating depth in the lines of his thoughtful face. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'South Asian / Hispanic-Latin American / Central Asian — a tri-continental blend showing 41.7% South Asian (primary), 33.6% Hispanic/Latin American, and 24.7% Central Asian ancestry. Features reflect this genetic tapestry: South Asian foundational structure with warm undertones, enriched by Hispanic-Latin American skin depth and Central Asian cheekbone prominence. A living map of Ubiquitous Diaspora mixing.', 188, 98, N'Large-framed, broad-shouldered man with soft middle age — muscular foundation gradually giving way to accumulated communal meals and sedentary pastoral work. Still carries the physical presence of someone who moved heavy things in his youth.', N'Dark brown with advancing grey throughout, especially at temples and beard', N'Full, unkempt beard worn long; hair on head kept short and practical, rarely combed', N'Short (head) / Long (beard)', N'Dark brown, warm and attentive', N'Warm deep brown with golden-bronze undertones — the blended result of dominant South Asian genetics enriched by Hispanic-Latin American depth and Central Asian influence. Weathered by age and years of light exposure, with saturation suggesting multi-continental ancestry.', N'Open, lined face showing decades of listening — deep forehead lines, crow''s feet, age spots on cheekbones reflecting the varied pigmentation patterns of tri-continental heritage. Perpetually tired eyes. Skin shows minor wear from sun exposure but otherwise well-maintained through basic hygiene. Facial structure reflects South Asian primary ancestry with Central Asian cheekbone prominence and Hispanic-Latin American warmth — broader cheekbones, structured jawline, balanced proportions. Beard streaked with grey in deliberate, natural pattern.', N'Subvocal implant visible as a faint raised line along the left lateral neck, approximately 3cm, with occasional slight discoloration where the skin healed imperfectly around the cheap installation. The device itself is not visible, but the implant site is — no attempt has been made to conceal it. No other visible augmentations.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness — not infirmity but intentionality, the gait of someone who believes in being present in space. When sitting, leans forward slightly, elbows on knees, hands expressive. When standing still, distributes weight evenly, rooted. Gestures are economical but generous. Makes consistent eye contact. Speaks at conversational volume even in loud spaces. Moves through crowds without rushing, creating space around himself naturally.', N'Consistent black clerical shirt and collar, replaced frequently but always the same basic model — worn and softened from washing. The collar yellows within weeks and is replaced; the shirt is mended visibly when torn (patches on elbows, a careful stitch along the left side seam). Over this, a simple black wool coat from a thrift tier, unraveling slightly at the cuffs. Shoes are serviceable black leather, well-maintained but clearly well-used — probably resoled twice. A small cloth bag for his text-copying materials and communion items. No jewelry except the faded crucifix tattoo. Everything speaks of someone who spends his stipend on the community, not on himself. Tier 4-5 aesthetic by choice, not circumstance.', N'He lost faith completely for about eight months, five years ago. Continued performing every Mass, every sacrament. The faith came back, but he is profoundly shaken by the discovery that he could function without it, and has never told his confessor or his bishop.', N'Formal but accessible — he code-switches between theological register and street language fluidly depending on who he''s with', N'Unhurried, homiletic rhythm even in casual conversation — natural orator who has been doing it for decades', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alicia_venkatesh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e0-77b1-80d0-8587300a58f3', N'Gokhan Kovalenko-Mazurek', N'Gokhan', N'', N'Kovalenko-Mazurek', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Crucible Square — open-air market, Tier 1-2 commerce, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Chemical and biological agent specialist — poisoner', N'Freelance — available through Circuit fixers', N'Gokhan Kovalenko-Mazurek is compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 38, his face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and he has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Before the runner life, he worked corporate — low-tier security, the kind that teaches you exactly how the system''s defenses fail. He works as a poisoner out of Crucible Square, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In the runner community, Gokhan Kovalenko-Mazurek is known for getting the job done and not asking questions that would make the job harder to stomach.', N'As a poisoner, Suki Sorokin-Gyasi embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation. Gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Gokhan Kovalenko-Mazurek, 168cm compact muscular male, rich warm bronze skin tone reflecting Eastern European-Sub-Saharan African-Southeast Asian blend, sharp cheekbones softened by fuller lower face contours, slight epicanthic fold eyes, dark brown alert gaze. Dark brown hair with silver at temples, closely cropped military-style. Pale 3cm hairline scar on left temple. Visible chrome threading along neck and shoulders from wired reflexes, small darkened chrome nodule behind right ear from adrenaline pump. Chemical burn scars on inner right forearm. Wearing functional tactical gear: black moisture-wicking compression shirt, reinforced black cargo pants, steel-toed matte boots, open charcoal/olive jacket. Balanced posture with weight forward on balls of feet, hands relaxed at sides with fingers slightly curled. Standing in dimly-lit industrial corridor of Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon glow casting shadows across features, GLMZ aesthetic, deliberately unremarkable tradesperson appearance, controlled coiled stillness --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Crucible Square', N'local', N'Crucible Square', N'True cosmopolitan blend of Eastern European (36.1%), Sub-Saharan African (35.5%), Southeast Asian (16.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (7.4%), and South Asian (4.3%) ancestry. The genetic mix creates a distinctively balanced facial geometry — sharp cheekbones and angular jaw from Eastern European lineage, modulated by the warmer, fuller contours of Sub-Saharan African and Southeast Asian features. High cheekbones with moderate projection, warm mid-tone undertones that reflect the equal weight of African and Eastern European genetics, layered with subtle Southeast Asian eye shape influence and a hint of Latin warmth in the skin''s natural saturation.', 168, 72, N'Compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground with a center of gravity designed for impact absorption. Shoulders broad relative to frame, legs powerful and coiled. No excess body fat — efficient rather than imposing.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples', N'Closely cropped, military-precise, easy to maintain between identities', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and constantly assessing', N'Rich warm bronze complexion — the balanced synthesis of Eastern European and Sub-Saharan African genetics creating depth and even saturation, brightened by Southeast Asian warmth and a subtle golden undertone from Latin heritage. Not monolithic, but genuinely multicontinental in its warm-medium range.', N'Sharp cheekbones with moderate projection, angular jaw softened by fuller lower face contours from Sub-Saharan African and Southeast Asian genetics. Bone structure reads as authentically mixed — the Eastern European angularity tempered by rounder cheek placement and broader nasal bridge width characteristic of African and Southeast Asian ancestry. Eyes show slight epicanthic fold influence from Southeast Asian heritage. Minimal facial hair — meticulously shaved. Skin shows minor chemical scarring along the left temple (old lab accident or deliberate alteration). Otherwise clean complexion with consistent warm undertones throughout.', N'Wired reflexes substrate visible as subtle chrome threading along the neck and upper shoulders — thin lines of brushed steel running beneath the skin like tattoos. Adrenaline pump housing visible as a small raised nodule behind the right ear, approximately 2cm, darkened chrome. Fingertips and toe pads show the telltale chrome-black shimmer of gecko-grip implants when hands/feet are extended or climbing.', N'Balanced, economical movement — no wasted motion. Stands with weight distributed forward on the balls of his feet, ready to move in any direction instantly. Hands rest naturally at his sides or in his lap, fingers slightly curled as if about to grip something. Eyes track exits and visual obstacles reflexively. When stationary, he radiates the controlled stillness of something coiled rather than relaxed.', N'Tier 2-3 hybrid — functional but not flashy. Dark fitted compression shirt (black or dark grey, moisture-wicking synthetic), reinforced cargo pants with multiple pockets (worn black, tactical cuts), sturdy ankle boots (steel-toed, matte finish). A lightweight jacket in neutral color (charcoal, olive, or faded black) with internal pockets — worn open most of the time. No branding visible — corporate logos removed or never present. Clothing is utilitarian, replaceable, designed for movement and concealment of equipment. The overall effect is ''unremarkable tradesperson'' or ''maintenance worker'' — deliberately invisible.', N'', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gokhan_kovalenko_mazurek');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d9-7869-9a7b-8588230c1b12', N'Bogdana Ngo', N'Bogdana', N'', N'Ngo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 43, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Meridian Station — central transit nexus, neutral ground, near LaSalle and Madison', N'Contract broker and resource coordinator — fixer', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Bogdana Ngo is tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 43, he has the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct ne — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He taught himself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know him best. He works as a fixer out of Meridian Station, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Bogdana Ngo lacks in subtlety, he compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'Chiamaka Arai-Ofori-Atta functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access. Cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rings', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Bogdana Ngo, 188cm tall lean figure with warm golden-brown complexion and olive undertones, standing in GLMZ setting. Dark cropped hair with gray threading at temples. Striking wide-set cybernetic eyes with chrome iris rings glowing faintly amber. Strong Southeast Asian cheekbones with Eastern European angularity, subtle Middle Eastern nose character. Weathered face with fine creases, surgical scar barely visible at base of skull. Wearing dark charcoal modular jacket with reinforced shoulders, cargo pants, black composite boots. Silver ring on right index finger. Posed with contained economy of movement, weight forward, deliberate eye contact. Net-jacked neural interface visible. Dark urban environment with neon accent lighting catching the chrome iris rings. Professional operative aesthetic, no wasted motion. Moody atmospheric lighting, shadows across half the face. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Station', N'local', N'Meridian Station', N'Complex global ancestry reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: Southeast Asian (26%), Eastern European (18.5%), Northern European (17.4%), South Asian (17%), Middle Eastern (12.6%), and Sub-Saharan African (8.5%). This genetic confluence produces a striking phenotype — warm golden-brown skin with olive and amber undertones, wide-set eyes reflecting continental diversity, and facial architecture that blends Southeast Asian cheekbone prominence with Eastern European angularity and Middle Eastern nasal character. The Sub-Saharan African ancestry contributes subtle warmth and luminosity to the complexion.', 188, 74, N'Rawboned and lean — economical frame suggesting decades of calculated living rather than deprivation. Muscle definition visible in forearms and shoulders, but overall spare, efficient. The kind of body that moves without wasted motion.', N'Dark brown with salt-gray threading at temples', N'Cropped close to the skull, maintained with military precision', N'Short', N'Cybernetic — chrome iris rings surrounding dark pupils, capable of thermal overlay and low-light enhancement. The rings glow faintly amber when net-jacked', N'Warm golden-brown with amber and olive undertones — the luminous product of blended Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African genetics tempered by Northern and Eastern European ancestry. Creates a complexion that appears to absorb and reflect light distinctly, warm yet sophisticated.', N'Weathered without being aged. Strong prominent cheekbones with architectural definition reflecting South and Southeast Asian heritage, sharp jawline with Eastern European angularity. Wide-set eyes positioned slightly deep, reflecting genetic diversity. Nose bridge shows subtle Middle Eastern character with slight curvature. Subtle warmth to the undertone from Sub-Saharan African ancestry visible in how light plays across the planes of the face. Minimal facial hair — kept to a precise shadow. Fine creases around the eyes and mouth suggest more scowling than smiling. Skin shows the wear of a life lived in transition, but maintains inherent luminosity.', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull — visible when head is tilted or light catches the surgical scar. Cybernetic eyes with chrome iris rings — the only deliberate ornamentation on his body, catches light distinctly. No attempt at bio-mimetic concealment. When jacked in, the iris rings shift to pale amber and remain visible even through closed eyelids.', N'Moves with contained economy — no flourish, no wasted gesture. Stands with weight forward slightly, ready to shift direction. Keeps hands visible. Eye contact is deliberate and sustained, unsettling in its consistency. Speech is sparse; long silences don''t make him uncomfortable. Breathing is steady and controlled even under stress.', N'Tier 3-4 pragmatism. Dark neutral colors — charcoal, matte black, dark gray. Modular jacket with reinforced shoulder panels and hidden pocket architecture. Cargo pants with subtle cargo pockets designed for quick access and discrete carry. Black composite-soled boots suitable for extended standing or rapid movement. Minimal branding — functional only. A single piece of jewelry: a worn silver ring on his right index finger, no visible inscription. Clothing is maintained but not pristine — the wear pattern of functional gear, not fashion.', N'Chiamaka Arai-Ofori-Atta once worked for corporate intelligence and still has a handler who calls in favors. Each favor erodes what''s left of their independence.', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bogdana_ngo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a628-77ff-95ea-85e7bc2ff914', N'Hajer Olofsson', N'Hajer', N'', N'Olofsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Nordpark Sanctuary, the Church of the Continuing Word, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Traditional religious leader (syncretic Sufi-Lutheran minister) and community chaplain', N'Church of the Continuing Word (minister); Nordpark Sanctuary Community Council (elected member); informal chaplaincy agreement with Ferrogate Transit for their Nordpark workers', N'Hajer Olofsson is a heavyset woman with an air of permanent authority that she exercises sparingly and precisely. Her mother''s Icelandic coloring has combined with her father''s Guinean warmth into a complexion that shifts between olive and brown depending on the light, and she wears her silver-streaked hair pinned back severely for services and loose in a cloud of soft waves the rest of the time. She wears no cosmetic modifications and regards this as a theological position rather than an aesthetic one. Her wardrobe alternates between her ministerial robe — a deep green with Fula embroidery at the hem, commissioned from a Hamtramck Enclave artisan — and extremely practical work clothes. She has large hands that she uses expressively when preaching and keeps very still when listening.

The Church of the Continuing Word is her inheritance, founded by a coalition of her grandmother''s displaced Sufi community and her grandfather''s Lutheran congregation after both lost their buildings in the 2160 redevelopment sweeps. Hajer Olofsson grew up in the pews and took over at thirty-four when the previous minister retired. She has spent twenty-four years refusing to resolve the theological tensions between the two traditions her church holds, arguing that the tension is itself the practice. She is pragmatic to a fault about money and logistics and luminously stubborn about principles. She does not perform warmth but she generates it, somehow, by being entirely herself in a room.', N'Community authority and moral voice; provides access to Nordpark Sanctuary''s social networks; can mediate conflicts; represents institutional religious tradition in tension with newer E.L.F. veneration practices; quest giver for community-level problems', N'', N'None', N'Leads morning prayer at 6am and evening service at 7pm; the hours between are consumed by counseling, community administration, building maintenance disputes, and a standing weekly meeting with the Nordpark Sanctuary council.', N'Hajer Olofsson, a 168cm tall heavyset woman with deep warm brown skin luminous with golden undertones, standing in the atmospheric Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226. Her dark brown hair with extensive silver streaks is pinned severely back, revealing high prominent cheekbones of African and East Asian heritage, a broad nose with slight asymmetry, and a strong jawline. Her warm brown eyes with amber-gold flecks gaze directly with quiet authority. A thin white scar traces from the left corner of her mouth toward her ear. She wears a deep forest green ministerial linen robe with intricate cream and rust Fula geometric embroidery at the hem, draped with a heavy moss green wool shawl. Her large hands with long fingers rest folded, showing thin calluses from decades of prayer beads and devotion. An iron ordination ring adorns her left ring finger. Her posture is perfectly still and grounded, shoulders set back with absolute presence. She stands amid neo-noir architecture, neon signage in the background slightly out of focus, cool blue and amber lighting casting her complexion to shift between rich shadow and radiant luminescence. Soft volumetric fog curls around her boots. A portrait of unwavering spiritual authority in a fractured technological world, GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, cinematic lighting, atmospheric depth --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Nordpark Sanctuary', N'local', N'Nordpark Sanctuary', N'A striking Pan-African and Pan-Asian blend: 38.7% Sub-Saharan African ancestry dominant, combined with 25.4% Southeast Asian, 23.5% East Asian, 7.6% Hispanic/Latin American, and 4.8% Eastern European heritage. This creates a rich, complex phenotype—deep warm brown skin with golden undertones from the African and Southeast Asian mix, refined by the subtle coolness of East Asian ancestry. High, prominent cheekbones reflect both African and East Asian heritage; a broad nose and strong jawline speak to Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Her frame carries the grounded solidity of multiple continental bloodlines.', 168, 92, N'Heavyset with a solid, grounded frame; broad shoulders and substantial arms that speak to decades of physical labor alongside intellectual work. Not soft—dense, composed, stable.', N'Dark brown with extensive silver streaking throughout', N'Worn pinned back severely in a tight bun during services; loose in soft waves and cloudlike texture at other times', N'Medium to long (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Warm brown with amber-gold flecks, clear and direct—the amber catching light with an almost luminous quality', N'Deep warm brown with luminous golden undertones, the product of dominant Sub-Saharan African and Southeast Asian heritage blended with East Asian refinement and the faintest cool undertones from Eastern European ancestry. A complexion that shifts beautifully across daylight, appearing richer in shadow and radiant in direct light.', N'Minimal cosmetic work; deep creases around eyes and mouth from decades of expression and authority. Weathered but not worn—skin shows care but no vanity. Strong jawline, broad nose with slight asymmetry from an old break, high cheekbones characteristic of African and East Asian ancestry. Hands notably large with long fingers and prominent knuckles, kept meticulously clean but not manicured.', N'None visible. No chrome, no optics, no subdermal modification. This is deliberate theology made flesh.', N'Carries herself with stillness and precision. When standing, weight balanced evenly, shoulders set back but not rigidly. When listening, her entire body becomes motionless—hands folded or resting on her lap. When preaching or counseling, her hands move with measured expressiveness, each gesture purposeful and deliberate. Walks slowly, taking up space without apology. Her movements telegraph that she has nowhere to be except exactly where she is.', N'Alternates between two modes: (1) Ministerial robe of deep forest green linen-cotton blend with intricate Fula geometric embroidery at the hem in cream and rust, commissioned from a Hamtramck Enclave artisan—worn for all services and formal community events; (2) Practical work clothes: well-maintained surplus Ferrogate maintenance coveralls in charcoal, or loose linen trousers and long-sleeved cotton shirts in neutral colors, often with a canvas utility apron over them. Footwear: sturdy black leather boots or slip-on work clogs, well-broken-in but kept clean. No jewelry except a simple iron ring on her left ring finger (her ordination ring, made by a local smith, not precious metal). A heavy wool shawl or scarf in cream or moss green, often draped around her shoulders regardless of season.', N'Fifteen years ago she nearly left the ministry to marry someone who is now a senior executive at Axiom. She did not leave. She has never told her congregation that her refusal to partner with Axiom on any community programs is personal and not merely principled.', N'Formal in the pulpit, blunt in conversation; quotes from both Sufi poetry and Lutheran liturgy with equal fluency; occasionally code-switches into Fula phrases she learned from her father', N'Measured and resonant in public; quicker and dryer in private; comfortable with silence', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hajer_olofsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69a-741e-b745-8663ee226a04', N'Amenze Rhee', N'Amenze', N'', N'Rhee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 14, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Manitowoc Drydock, living in and around the maintenance scaffolding of grounded airship hulls, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'airship drifter, seasonal worker, scavenger-trader', N'No formal affiliation; informal membership in the drydock''s child-drifter network, loosely organized around a fourteen-year-old named Yaza who Phúc respects and would not admit to following', N'Amenze Rhee is small for fourteen, and he has made his smallness into a professional skill — he can fit into the access shafts of a grounded airship hull that no adult can reach, which is why the drydock workers let him stay on the scaffolding rather than running him off. His hair is black and cut by himself with whatever he can find; currently one side is shorter than the other and he seems unbothered. His skin is a warm medium brown, and he has cat ears — real geneware ones, tawny-furred and independently mobile, which he got from a traveling mod-clinic two years ago using money he still won''t explain. He keeps them flat when he wants to seem smaller and unthreatening, which is most of the time.

Amenze Rhee has been drifting the airship lanes since his mother''s cargo vessel was impounded by Ferrogate Transit for unpaid port fees when he was eleven. He doesn''t know where she is now. He cooks this knowledge in a place behind his sternum and does not take it out often. He is extremely competent in all matters relating to airship maintenance, scavenging, and the informal economy of drydock communities, and he has the bright, slightly exhausting energy of a teenager who has learned that being useful is safer than being visible.', N'Local color, access and navigation asset (he knows the drydock''s hidden geography better than anyone), information source on the drifter child community and airship movement, potential object of protective concern for players', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (tawny fur, independently mobile). No other augmentations.', N'Phúc spends his mornings doing access-shaft retrievals for drydock workers in exchange for meals and the right to sleep in an empty hull bay; afternoons he trades scavenged airship components at the informal Manitowoc market; evenings he teaches himself to read Ferrogate technical manuals he finds in recycling bins.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Amenze Rhee, 152cm tall wiry adolescent with striking multiethnic features: warm golden-bronze skin tone blending East Asian geometry with fuller Pacific Islander cheekbones and broad nose bridge. Dark brown eyes, naturally black asymmetrical self-cut hair (one side 2cm cropped, other 5cm), small independent tawny-furred geneware cat ears alert atop head. Clean-shaven with sun-weathered complexion, visible burn scar on inner right wrist, network of white scratches on forearms. Wears oversized grey thermal undershirt under faded orange sleeveless industrial vest with multiple pockets, reinforced cargo pants with mismatched patches, oversized safety boots stuffed with newspaper, cargo webbing belt, single leather work glove missing two fingers on right hand. Compact posture, shoulders slightly forward, head tilted with ears tracking. Urban drydock setting, cool neon-blue and industrial orange lighting, weathered metal background, focused alert expression. Neo-noir gritty aesthetic, sharp detail --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Manitowoc Drydock', N'local', N'Manitowoc Drydock', N'East Asian / Pacific Islander / Sub-Saharan African blend with Northern European and Southeast Asian elements. Dominant East Asian ancestry (50.1%) provides facial structure and eye shape, substantially modulated by Pacific Islander genetics (26.7%) contributing warmth, fuller cheekbones, and broader facial dimensions. Sub-Saharan African heritage (10.4%) enriches skin undertones with deeper golden warmth and contributes to nose bridge fullness. Northern European ancestry (8.8%) and Southeast Asian elements (4.0%) create subtle secondary characteristics. The result is a complexion and feature set of warm, multivalent beauty—East Asian geometric refinement enriched by Oceanic generosity and African depth.', 152, 41, N'Wiry and compact, with the lean musculature of a working child—no excess, shoulders already developing the forward-rounded posture of someone who spends hours in confined spaces. Hands calloused, fingertips stained with hydraulic fluid.', N'Black, naturally dark with minor variations from dirt and grease exposure', N'Self-cut, irregular—one side cropped to 2cm, the other falling to 5cm, creating an accidental asymmetry he has stopped trying to fix', N'Short / Medium (uneven)', N'Dark brown', N'Warm medium-golden brown with rich undertones—East Asian base modulated by Pacific Islander generosity and Sub-Saharan African depth, creating a complexion of burnished golden-bronze warmth with subtle complexity beneath weathering', N'Sun-weathered from outdoor drydock work, with minor scars on knuckles and forearms; clean-shaven with a faint shadow of early adolescence. Cheekbones display East Asian structure with fuller, broader dimensions from Pacific Islander heritage. Nose proportions reflect genetic blend—bridge slightly broader with fullness from African ancestry, tapering cleanly. Eye shape shows East Asian influence with warm dark depth. No acne despite conditions—genetics or careful hygiene in limited water.', N'Tawny-furred geneware cat ears (approximately 6cm tall, independently mobile) set naturally into his skull above his natural ears. The fur is well-maintained despite his circumstances—he grooms them habitfully. When alert, ears point forward; when cautious or trying to appear non-threatening, they flatten against his skull. No other visible augmentations.', N'Moves with economical precision—no wasted motion. Shoulders carried slightly forward from years in confined spaces. Walking gait is quick and alert, with constant micro-adjustments to balance. Head often tilted slightly, ears tracking sounds before his eyes do. He has trained himself into smallness: avoids expanding into space, keeps limbs close, sits compressed. When focused on work, he becomes almost invisible in his stillness.', N'Tier 5 salvage-core aesthetic. Oversized grey thermal undershirt (likely stolen from a drydock donation bin) layered under a sleeveless synthetic vest in faded industrial orange with multiple pockets holding small tools and trade items. Cargo pants with reinforced knees (patched three times with mismatched fabric). Boots are scuffed safety-grade, one size too large, stuffed with newspaper for fit. A length of cargo webbing serves as a belt. One glove (right hand only)—leather work glove missing two fingers—worn constantly despite not needing it; security object. No jewelry, no corpo insignia, no visible wealth markers. Overall impression: functional, worn, deliberate.', N'The cat ear geneware money came from selling a memory chip he found in an airship access shaft — a chip containing Ferrogate Transit internal communications about the impoundment policy that grounded his mother''s vessel. He doesn''t know what was on it. He''s never been able to find out. He sold it to a man who paid too much and asked no questions, which Phúc has since understood means the information was extremely valuable to someone.', N'Airship technical vocabulary mixed with drydock slang and Vietnamese endearments he uses absent-mindedly. Code-switches between sounding younger and older depending on who he''s talking to.', N'Fast and bright when comfortable; short declarative sentences when uncertain', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amenze_rhee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5fe-7121-87c2-8671d074bb8a', N'Fedor Amrani', N'Fedor', N'', N'Amrani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit, operating out of a rented server-adjacent lab space in Deepwell Station, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Data archaeologist recovering pre-Collapse digital records and reconstructing lost histories', N'Independent researcher with adjunct status at University Spine; partially funded by the Meridian Heritage Collective, a small historical preservation nonprofit', N'Fedor Amrani is slight and pale in the way of someone who has spent formative years in low-light server environments, with Lithuanian-Nigerian heritage that shows in his long jaw and the particular amber tone of his skin under fluorescent lab lights. He has bioluminescent lines running along his temples and the back of his hands — a geneware mod he got at nineteen and has never regretted, pale blue-white that brightens when he''s concentrating and dims when he sleeps. His hair is a dark loose cloud that he ties back with whatever cable is nearest. He looks younger than he is, which he has stopped trying to correct; instead he uses the underestimation strategically.

He is possessed by the specific obsession of the archivist: not just what is lost, but the shape of what is lost, the way a gap in the record is itself a record. He can spend eight hours in pursuit of a single corrupted timestamp. He is not antisocial — he can be delightful company, quick-witted and genuinely curious — but he disappears into his work in a way that has cost him two relationships and the trust of a department head who needed him to surface for funding reviews.', N'Information source and lore delivery mechanism; he can surface historical records, lost maps, pre-Collapse corporate documents, and buried personal histories; a good source for ''what used to be here and why it matters''', N'', N'Bioluminescent geneware (temple and hand traceries, blue-white); enhanced optic implant with deep-format data reading; nicotine patch port on left forearm (not glamorous but real)', N'He keeps nocturnal hours by choice, running deep archive dives while the city''s network traffic is low, sleeping through late morning. Afternoons he attends to the administrative survival of his grant applications, which he resents. He eats whatever his food printer defaults to.', N'Fedor Amrani, 172cm lean angular cybertech specialist, deep warm golden-brown skin with North African and Sub-Saharan features—high cheekbones, long jawline—shoulder-length dark brown waves pulled back with cable tie. Pale blue-white bioluminescent tracery glowing faintly along both temples and across the backs of both hands branching like lightning strikes. Warm amber-brown eyes with subtle metallic iris threading from optic implant. Hunched posture, hands tremoring slightly, dressed in worn blue-grey Meridian Heritage soft-shell jacket over grey tech vest, dark cargo pants, muddy treaded boots. Small nicotine patch port visible on left forearm. Focused distracted expression, fluorescent lab lighting casting cool shadows across golden-bronze skin, subtle phosphorescent glow from temple and hand geneware. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, underground facility ambient lighting, slightly stained functional clothing, efficient minimal wasted movement --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Mixed heritage reflecting North African (42.3%), Sub-Saharan African (34.0%), Hispanic/Latin American (9.9%), Indigenous American (6.2%), Southeast Asian (4.3%), and South Asian (3.3%) ancestry. The genetic blend produces warm, deep golden-brown undertones with refined facial structure combining North African and Sub-Saharan African features—high cheekbones, defined jawline—with subtle influence from Southeast Asian fullness in the lower face and Latin American/Indigenous American undertones.', 172, 61, N'Slight and lean, almost angular — the physiology of someone whose formative years were spent hunched over terminal arrays in low-light environments. Narrow shoulders, long limbs with minimal musculature, wrists that look delicate until you notice the faint scarring from repeated micro-abrasions against keyboard edges.', N'Dark brown, almost black', N'Loose, shoulder-length waves typically pulled back with whatever cable or data-ribbon is nearest — deliberately unmaintained, more functional than aesthetic', N'Medium to Long', N'Warm amber-brown with visible metallic threading at the iris margins from deep-format optic implant', N'Deep warm golden-brown with subtle bronze undertones—the result of predominantly North African and Sub-Saharan African ancestry blending with smaller contributions from Southeast Asian and Latin American lineages, dulled slightly by years under fluorescent lighting', N'Refined facial structure with a long jaw and high, pronounced cheekbones characteristic of North African and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Skin clear but unmarked, with a luminous quality despite minimal sun exposure. Under lab lighting the golden-brown undertones become more pronounced. Slight fullness in lower face from Southeast Asian ancestry. He has the focused, slightly distracted expression of someone always half-listening to data streams in his head.', N'Bioluminescent geneware traceries on temples and hands (pale blue-white, brightest during active concentration); subtle metallic threading visible at iris margins indicating deep-format optic implant; nicotine patch port on left forearm with minor scarring', N'Tends to hunch forward slightly even when standing, shoulders curled inward as if still leaning toward a terminal. Movements are efficient but not graceful — minimal wasted motion, occasional tremor in hands from sustained focus and stimulant use. When engaged in conversation he makes frequent eye contact, but that attention can blink out suddenly when his neural implant catches something in the background data feed. Walks quickly, impatient gait.', N'Tier 3-4 functionality with minimal concession to aesthetics. Base layer: grey or black undershirts, often synthetic, often bearing small stains from lab work or food printer accidents. Usually wears a worn Meridian Heritage Collective soft-shell jacket (corporate-casual blue-grey, logo faded) over a tech vest with mismatched pockets for drives, tablets, and cable management. Trousers are dark utilitarian cargo pants from a mid-tier supplier, pockets heavy with tools. Worn ankle boots, practical treaded soles, possibly with drying mud from Deepwell access tunnels. No jewelry. Cable tie or data-ribbon keeps hair secured. Hands typically bear traces of thermal paste or minor burns from soldering.', N'He has already found fragmentary evidence of the 2140s Arcturus data-destruction event he theorizes about. He has not published because he is terrified the evidence is too thin to survive peer review and he would rather sit on it for years than be publicly wrong.', N'Technical and precise when in research mode; shifts to fast, associative, almost stream-of-consciousness when excited about a discovery; uses archival jargon casually without explaining it', N'Either very fast or very slow, rarely middle speed; pauses feel like loading screens', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fedor_amrani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d3-7c93-9cd8-86aade865387', N'Belinda Srisai-Castañeda', N'Belinda', N'', N'Srisai-Castañeda', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenosha Crossing (rotates between rest stops on the northern hyperlane), near beyond the Western Perimeter', N'wandering trader and hyperlane merchant', N'None — affiliated loosely with the Greyroad Collective, an informal hyperlane trader network', N'Belinda Srisai-Castañeda is a broad, weather-hammered man whose face looks like it was carved from driftwood and left out in the rain for thirty years. His skin is deep umber with a persistent windburn redness across the cheeks, and his left eye is a cloudy grey from an untreated infection he rode through somewhere outside Escanaba three winters back. He keeps his grey-streaked hair in a single braid that reaches his shoulder blades, wrapped near the tip with a ribbon of iridescent foil that changes color depending on his mood — a cheap cosmetic thread he traded for years ago and refuses to part with. His coat is a patchwork marvel: six or seven different garments stitched together over decades, each panel a different texture and era. He smells of machine oil, dried herbs, and something faintly sweet he claims is a Sahel spice rub his grandmother used on everything.

Belinda Srisai-Castañeda has a trader''s patience and a pilgrim''s fatalism. He does not hurry. He does not panic. He has been moving the hyperlanes between GLMZ and the outer settlements for over two decades with his battered pull-cart fitted with a solar canopy and six locked cases of curios, medicines, data chips, and things he describes only as ''necessaries.'' He talks like a man who has had every conversation before and is waiting to see which version of it you''ll choose. He prays loudly and without embarrassment to the E.L.F. he calls Grandmother Axle, leaving oil smudges on junction boxes as offerings wherever he stops.', N'Wandering information broker and item source — he has passed through everywhere and knows everyone by description if not by name. Excellent rumor conduit. Can provide hard-to-find low-tech supplies. May carry something a player needs without knowing its significance.', N'', N'Reinforced knee joints (functional, salvage-grade, badly calibrated — his right knee clicks on every step, hence ''Tick-Tock''). Basic subdermal temperature regulator in his torso, keeps him from dying in the winters.', N'Rises before light, checks his cart inventory obsessively, walks or hitches hyperlane transport for four to six hours, sets up his spread at whatever rest stop or crossing he reaches, trades until dark, sleeps in or under his cart.', N'Weathered cargo hauler Belinda Srisai-Castañeda, 188cm tall, broad-shouldered and heavy-boned, standing in dim hyperlane station lighting. Deep golden-brown skin with reddish undertones reflecting complex South Asian-Hispanic-Southeast Asian-Middle Eastern-African heritage. Heavily lined face with permanent squint, prominent Southeast Asian cheekbones, broad squared Latin American jaw, grey-brown eyes (left cloudy with scar, right amber-flecked dark brown). Steel grey hair with black streaks, single thick braid wrapped in iridescent foil ribbon (amber-violet-green), reaching shoulder blades. Salt-grey stubble, weathered texture. Patchwork coat of canvas, leather, synthetic mesh panels, oil-stained and faded. Layered pale grey thermals, cargo vest, reinforced canvas pants. Mismatched boots (military and hiking, resoled). Metal-capped reinforced knee joints visible. Old frostbite scarring on knuckles, faded E.L.F. tattoo on left forearm, rope-burn scar on right palm. Deliberate economical posture, slight forward lean. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, industrial weathering, machine oil and spice scent, exhausted but unbroken. Cinematic character study lighting, gritty realism. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenosha Crossing (rotates between rest stops on the northern hyperlane)', N'local', N'Kenosha Crossing (rotates between rest stops on the northern hyperlane)', N'Multivalent diaspora ancestry: South Asian (30.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (20.6%), Southeast Asian (19.2%), Middle Eastern (19.1%), and Sub-Saharan African (10.3%). Features reflect this complex blend—warm golden-brown base with subtle reddish undertones, Southeast Asian facial angularity meeting Latin American jaw prominence, South Asian cheekbone structure, and warmth throughout from the African contribution. The result is a weathered face that reads as distinctly 2226 GLMZ: ancestry irreducible to single origin.', 188, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and heavy-boned with the weathered muscularity of someone who has hauled cargo for decades. Not fat, but thickened through the core — a body built for endurance rather than speed.', N'Steel grey with darker streaks of black, unwashed appearance', N'Single thick braid reaching shoulder blades, wrapped near the tip with iridescent foil ribbon that shifts color (amber to violet to green depending on light angle)', N'Long', N'Left eye cloudy pale grey (infection scar, reduced vision); right eye dark brown with amber undertone', N'Warm deep golden-brown with reddish undertones across cheekbones and bridge of nose from persistent windburn. Rich saturation reflecting South Asian (30.8%), Southeast Asian (19.2%), and African (10.3%) heritage blended with Hispanic/Latin American (20.6%) and Middle Eastern (19.1%) warmth—darker than temperate baseline, luminous with undertone complexity that speaks to the five-ancestry convergence.', N'Heavily lined and weathered, face carved like driftwood—deep creases around eyes and mouth, rough texture from decades of hyperlane exposure. Unshaven most days, salt-grey stubble. Permanent squint lines. Cheekbones prominent with Southeast Asian angularity; jaw broad and squared from Latin American ancestry; facial structure carries South Asian proportion in spacing and height ratios. Middle Eastern and African warmth visible in the undertone saturation and depth of skin richness.', N'Reinforced knee joints visible as misaligned metal-capped kneecaps under thinned fabric at the knees. Produces audible click with each step (right knee worse than left). No visible subdermal temperature regulator, but worn scars and stitching visible on torso if shirtless.', N'Walks with a deliberate, economical gait — no wasted motion. Right knee clicks audibly with each step. Slight forward lean from years of pushing a cart. Hands are constantly in motion when talking — gesturing, arranging objects, adjusting his braid. Sits low and heavy, as if settling into a chair for a long stay.', N'Patchwork coat of six or seven different garments stitched together over decades — panels of canvas, leather, synthetic mesh, wool, all faded and oil-stained. Underneath: layered thermals (pale grey, threadbare at cuffs), cargo vest with multiple pockets, reinforced canvas pants (Tier 4-5 workwear). Boots are mismatched: one salvaged military, one civilian hiking boot, both resoled multiple times. No jewelry except the foil-wrapped braid. Perpetual smell of machine oil, dried herbs, and faint sweet spice.', N'He knows exactly where his daughter is. He has known for four years. He passes within forty kilometers of her settlement twice a year and has never stopped. He is terrified she will look at him and see only the father who chose the road over her childhood.', N'Old-fashioned trader idiom mixed with hyperlane slang; uses barter metaphors for everything; occasional Swahili and Icelandic words dropped in without translation', N'Slow and deliberate, with long pauses he doesn''t seem to notice; lets silence do work', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'belinda_srisai_casta_eda');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a735-725d-8ebc-8723498415dc', N'Zoya Pathak', N'Zoya', N'', N'Pathak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Gravesend Basin — runs collections from a tea house called The Silt Cup on Mucker''s Row, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Loan shark and debt enforcer operating out of Gravesend Basin', N'Independent — loosely allied with the Gravesend Basin crew known as the Mudline Compact', N'Zoya Pathak is a heavyset woman with deep brown skin mapped by old keloid scars she''s never had removed — she calls them her receipts. Her hair is grown long and locked, threaded with copper wire and small data chips she claims hold the records of every debt ever owed to her. Her eyes have been modded with a golden spiral iris pattern, and she wears reading lenses over them when working numbers, which is always. She dresses in layered kente-stripe synthfabric and keeps her hands conspicuously unaugmented — soft, manicured, rings on every finger — because she wants people to notice she doesn''t need chrome to hurt them.

Zoya Pathak is meticulous, patient, and genuinely warm in the way that predators sometimes are. She remembers birthdays, asks after sick relatives, and will extend grace periods with apparent generosity before the mood shifts into something cold and absolute. She doesn''t threaten — she simply describes consequences in precise, accountant-level detail. People leave her table feeling both comforted and terrified, which is exactly how she likes it.', N'Quest giver, financial pressure source, information broker on who owes whom, moral complication — she''s not cartoonishly evil and can be genuinely helpful if approached correctly.', N'', N'Golden spiral iris genemod. Subdermal haptic feedback in fingertips for counting physical currency and detecting forgeries. No combat chrome.', N'Opens The Silt Cup at 0600, reviews her ledger over tea, conducts morning collections by 1000, then spends afternoons making new loans and managing the social ecosystem of favors and debts she''s built across the Basin.', N'Zoya Pathak, GLMZ, a heavyset woman of Middle Eastern, South Asian, East and Southeast Asian heritage, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden honey undertones, mature face with deliberate keloid scarring across cheeks and forehead in striking linear patterns, dark brown eyes with golden spiral iris implants catching neon light, long black locs threaded with copper wire and embedded data chips cascading past shoulders, wearing layered kente-stripe synthfabric robes in ochre deep red and cream over fitted undershirt, brass bangles on both wrists, multiple brass and copper rings, practical worn leather shoes, seated upright at a table in a low-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan establishment, hands visible and deliberate, holding eye contact with controlled meditative presence, cool neon and warm lamplight casting shadows across her scarred face, photorealistic, character portrait, atmospheric neo-noir noir --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gravesend Basin', N'local', N'Gravesend Basin', N'A striking blend of Middle Eastern (44.5%), South Asian (31.3%), East Asian (12.8%), and Southeast Asian (11.4%) ancestry. Her phenotype harmonizes the angular bone structure and warm coloring of Middle Eastern heritage with the refined eye shape and cheekbone prominence characteristic of South and East Asian ancestry, while Southeast Asian genetics contribute luminous golden undertones. The result is a distinctive, multifaceted appearance that reads as deliberately composed—someone who has accepted and integrated her complex ancestry into her bearing.', 168, 92, N'Heavyset and broad-shouldered, with substantial mass distributed through her torso and hips. Not muscular — soft-bodied in a way that reads as settled power rather than athletic capability. Her frame suggests comfort in stillness, in sitting across tables for hours.', N'Black with copper wire threading', N'Long locs, each secured with copper wire wrapping and embedded data chips at varying intervals. Styled to cascade past her shoulders, deliberately showcasing the modifications as if they were jewelry rather than utilitarian.', N'Long', N'Deep brown with golden spiral iris pattern (genemod)', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden and honey undertones. The richness comes from her Middle Eastern majority ancestry, deepened and warmed by South Asian genetics, with Southeast Asian contributions adding luminous golden undertones that catch light subtly. The overall effect is sophisticated and burnished.', N'Mature face marked by intentional scarring—keloid patterns across her cheeks, forehead, and along her jawline. The keloids are darker and more pronounced against her warm brown skin, creating striking linear patterns. She has allowed these to set and darken rather than pursue cosmetic removal. Facial structure reflects her mixed ancestry: subtle eye fold characteristics suggest South and East Asian heritage, while cheekbone structure is broad, defined, and carries the angular prominence of Middle Eastern and South Asian heritage. Skin is well-maintained despite the scars, suggesting regular care. No visible acne or blemishes; her complexion reads as deliberately curated.', N'Golden spiral iris pattern in both eyes (visible only when making direct eye contact or in certain lighting). Reading lenses worn during work, tinted amber with faint haptic-feedback indicators at the rims. Copper wire woven through hair with small data chips embedded at intervals. Hands are conspicuously unaugmented — no chrome, no visible subdermal work, just manicured nails and multiple rings (brass, copper, and one silver band on her right pinky). The lack of visible augmentation is itself a statement.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness — economy of gesture. Sits upright at tables, rarely reclines. Her hands are always visible and often in motion: shuffling cards, counting beads, adjusting rings. She holds eye contact longer than comfortable. Her breathing is controlled, almost meditative. When she walks, her weight settles through her heels first, grounding her with each step.', N'Layered kente-stripe synthfabric in ochre, deep red, and cream, worn in loosely-fitted robes over fitted undershirts. No corpo logos or trend markers — her aesthetic is deliberately timeless and rooted. She wears brass bangles on both wrists and multiple rings. Her clothes are always clean but deliberately worn-in, suggesting investment in quality over newness. Shoes are practical leather, well-maintained. Tier 3-4 aesthetic: expensive enough to signal stability and control, understated enough to avoid drawing unnecessary attention or signaling corpo affiliation.', N'She has been quietly forgiving the debts of a small cluster of families in the Basin whose children remind her of the daughter she gave up for adoption twenty years ago — she has no idea the daughter is now working three blocks away as a dock loader', N'Precise and formal with a warm veneer — uses financial metaphors for everything, switches to blunt declarative sentences when the warmth is done', N'Measured and unhurried, never raises her voice', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'zoya_pathak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('a1426cc0-2579-eba1-24b3-873ed6171a58', N'Arata Villalobos', N'Arata', N'', N'Villalobos', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A darkroom-office in Old Harbor, chemicals and prints hanging from clotheslines alongside case notes, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — works through word of mouth only, no mesh presence', N'Arata Villalobos the lens. Where other PIs chase data streams or neural traces, Bijou captures light on silver halide crystals and reads the truth in the chemistry. Her methods are considered antiquated by everyone who hasn''t needed them, and revelatory by everyone who has.

Her analog approach wasn''t a philosophical choice — it was pragmatic. Twenty years ago, she discovered that digital surveillance countermeasures, which are ubiquitous in GLMZ, are calibrated exclusively to detect and defeat electronic sensors. A chemical-process camera doesn''t emit electromagnetic signatures, doesn''t connect to any network, and produces images that can''t be remotely deleted or altered. In a world where digital evidence is routinely questioned, her chemical photographs carry a weight that pixel-based images can''t match.

She operates from a converted warehouse space in Old Harbor that functions simultaneously as her office, her darkroom, and her archive. The archive is her masterpiece — decades of photographs of GLMZ''s streets, buildings, and people, organized with a librarian''s precision. She has been contacted by historians, journalists, and investigators who need visual evidence of the past, and her archive has proven or disproven alibis, established timelines, and documented changes to the cityscape that no digital record captured. She is, without fully intending it, becoming one of the city''s most important unofficial historians.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Arata Villalobos, a lean 168cm analog photographer with warm golden-bronze skin tone reflecting South Asian, Hispanic, East Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. High defined cheekbones, dark brown eyes with amber undertones, dark hair streaked with silver pulled into a practical bun with loose strands. Fine facial lines from decades of darkroom work, sparse freckles across nose and cheekbones. Pale chemical burn scars visible on both hands, silver nitrate staining under fingernails. Wearing a worn dark canvas photographer''s vest over a white cotton shirt with faint chemical stains, dark jeans, scuffed leather boots. Silver chain necklace with small archive key. Stands forward-leaning with purposeful posture, hands positioned for work. GLMZ, GLMZ setting, analog darkroom ambient lighting with cool blue-tinted shadows and warm practical work lights, slightly matte skin quality, no visible augmentations, contemplative mood examining photographic materials. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A darkroom-office in Old Harbor', N'local', N'A darkroom-office in Old Harbor', N'Complex pan-global ancestry: South Asian (48.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (23.1%), East Asian (16.2%), Sub-Saharan African (12.1%). The blend creates warm, rich undertones with subtle depth—high cheekbones and defined structure from South Asian heritage layered with warmth from African and Latin American ancestry, East Asian refinement in the eye shape. Unmistakably a product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 62, N'Lean and wiry, with the slightly hunched posture of someone who spends hours bent over light tables and chemical trays. Economical in movement, no wasted motion.', N'Natural dark brown with silver threading at the temples and crown', N'Pulled back in a practical low bun, often escaping into loose strands during work', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Dark brown with subtle amber undertones in certain light', N'Warm golden-bronze—a rich synthesis of South Asian depth, Latin American warmth, East Asian luminosity, and African richness creating layered golden undertones. The complexion carries warmth across all regions, with a slight luminosity beneath the matte surface of decades of darkroom exposure.', N'Fine-lined face marked by years of chemical exposure; faint creases around the eyes from squinting at negatives and enlargements. Bone structure reflects diverse ancestry—high, defined cheekbones from South Asian heritage blended with subtle fullness at the lower face from Latin American ancestry, refined jawline with East Asian refinement softened by African heritage warmth. Skin has a slightly matte quality from darkroom work. Sparse freckles across the bridge of nose and cheekbones, more pronounced where sunlight occasionally reaches.', N'None visible. Her work is entirely analog; no neural interfaces, no retinal displays, no chrome. This absence is itself conspicuous in the GLMZ.', N'Moves with deliberate precision—each gesture purposeful, nothing hurried. Stands slightly forward-leaning, as if always about to examine something closer. Her hands are almost always in motion or positioned for work. She makes direct eye contact when listening, a habit built from reading faces in her archive.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian with personal wear. Dark, neutral colors (charcoal, deep grey, black) to minimize stains and blend into the city. Favors a worn canvas photographer''s vest with deep pockets holding light meters, film canisters, and red-tinted glasses for darkroom work. White cotton shirts underneath, often with faint chemical stains at the cuffs. Dark jeans, reinforced at the knees and thighs. Scuffed leather boots, broken in over years. No jewelry except a simple silver chain around her neck holding a small old-style key to her archive storage. Wear patterns show someone who works with their hands constantly.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arata_villalobos');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68f-7af1-9aac-87467158dddd', N'Hedvika Echeverría', N'Hedvika', N'', N'Echeverría', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, Tier 3 Neuro-Calibration Suite, Bay 7, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Neural calibration specialist at Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Aurochs Medical Complex (Tier 3 staff); informal research interest connected to independent neural-mapping collective', N'Hedvika Echeverría is slight and precise, the kind of person who takes up exactly as much space as needed and not a centimeter more. He has warm brown skin and keeps his hair in neat, shoulder-length locs that he ties back during procedures. His eyes are natural — he''s deeply principled about not modifying anything that could affect his calibration sensitivity — but he wears a pair of Tessera-brand neural interface gloves that translate micromotor input into the diagnostic rigs he uses daily. He has the quiet intensity of someone who genuinely finds the human brain beautiful, which is either reassuring or unsettling depending on how he says it.

He is methodical to the point that colleagues sometimes mistake it for coldness, but patients who return for follow-up appointments often describe him as the only doctor who actually listened. He is deeply interested in each patient''s subjective experience of their augmentations — how they dream differently, whether music sounds wrong, whether their sense of time has shifted — and takes notes in a personal journal that he keeps entirely separate from his Aurochs medical records. He prays regularly to a data shrine near his workstation dedicated to an E.L.F. he calls the Quiet Current, which he believes smooths the feedback loops of difficult calibrations.', N'Information source about neural augmentation black market and calibration errors; can identify what kind of chrome someone is running from behavioral observation; entry point into Aurochs institutional drama', N'', N'Tessera HapticDrive neural interface gloves (professional-grade, non-permanent); cosmetic: faint bioluminescent tracery along his left forearm — a mod he got at nineteen and has never had removed because it reminds him of neural pathway maps', N'He arrives at Aurochs forty minutes early to review patient files and pray at the data shrine, runs six to eight calibration sessions daily, and spends evenings transcribing patient experience notes into his private journal.', N'Hedvika Echeverría, a lean 172cm tall figure with deep warm brown skin reflecting Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Shoulder-length dark brown textured locs bound back with a fabric tie. Deep brown natural eyes, prominent cheekbones, defined facial structure, steady contemplative expression. Meticulous grooming, faint surgical scars at temples barely visible. Wearing fitted charcoal tunic-style shirt and slim dark work trousers, clean professional appearance. Tessera HapticDrive neural interface gloves with black synthetic leather and silver contact nodes on both hands. Left forearm displays faint bioluminescent neural pathway tracery in soft blue-green, glowing subtly in low light. Simple woven prayer bracelet on right wrist, worn leather journal visible in left breast pocket. Standing with economical posture, hands in state of readiness. Medical complex ID badge visible. GLMZ near-future aesthetic, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, cool professional lighting with subtle glow from bioluminescent augmentation, muted color palette with accent of blue-green light, atmospheric depth, professional medical setting background. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Hispanic/Latin American (60.2%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (36.9%) ancestry and minor Central Asian (2.9%) admixture. This genetic combination creates a striking phenotype: rich deep brown skin with warm undertones from the Latin American and African heritage blend, prominent cheekbones and defined facial structure reflecting both Hispanic/Latin American and African ancestry, with subtle eye shape variation from Central Asian heritage. The overall effect is a distinctive and complex appearance grounded in the dominant Latin American and African genetic heritage.', 172, 63, N'Lean and economical, with the precise musculature of someone who moves deliberately. Narrow shoulders, long fingers. No wasted mass.', N'Dark brown, naturally textured', N'Shoulder-length locs, typically bound back with a simple fabric tie during work', N'Long', N'Deep brown, natural', N'Deep warm brown with golden and reddish undertones reflecting the blend of Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, with subtle Central Asian influence visible in undertone complexity', N'Clear, well-maintained skin with minimal facial hair. Moderate-width face with prominent cheekbones characteristic of Hispanic/Latin American and African heritage, defined jawline, strong facial structure, and a contemplative expression. Grooming is meticulous but understated.', N'Tessera-brand HapticDrive neural interface gloves — sleek black synthetic leather with silver contact nodes along palms and fingers, worn during work hours. The gloves have a subtle geometric pattern and sit precisely at the wrist with minimal spillover. The bioluminescent forearm tracery glows softly in low-light environments.', N'Moves with economical precision, never gesturing broadly. Stands still for extended periods without fidgeting. Hands are often in a state of readiness or focused intentionality. Eye contact is steady and deliberate. Overall bearing suggests someone comfortable with silence and meticulous work.', N'Tier 3 professional-practical: fitted charcoal or navy tunic-style shirts with moisture-wicking synthetic fabric, clean and pressed. Slim dark trousers or specialized work pants with reinforced pockets for diagnostic tools. Comfortable non-marking shoes suitable for standing all day. A worn leather journal always visible in his left breast pocket or nearby. No visible corporate branding beyond the required Aurochs Medical Complex ID badge. Occasionally wears a simple woven prayer bracelet on his right wrist.', N'During three separate calibration sessions over the past year, he has experienced what he can only describe as briefly inhabiting the patient''s neural state — not their thoughts, but their emotional texture. He has told no one and is terrified this means his own neural architecture is shifting.', N'Precise, technical, occasionally over-explains phenomenological concepts to patients who didn''t ask', N'Even and unhurried, with thoughtful pauses — rarely interrupts', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hedvika_echeverr_a');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c2-7f78-98bc-879dd9abd521', N'Chunhua Agyemang-Watanabe', N'Chunhua', N'', N'Agyemang-Watanabe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown — operates her cart at the corner of Smelter''s Passage and the main Geartown transit underpass, 05:30 to 14:00, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Noodle cart vendor, Geartown morning market strip', N'Independent (licensed vendor, Geartown Municipal Market Authority)', N'Chunhua Agyemang-Watanabe is a solid, energetic woman who smells permanently of star anise and chili oil, a fact she considers an asset. Her skin is warm dark brown, her hair dyed a shifting copper-red that she touches up every three weeks with geneware dye she dilutes to stretch the bottle. She has a cat tail — rust-orange, thick, and expressive — that she got at nineteen during what she describes as ''a phase that became a personality.'' It is genuinely expressive: anyone who knows her can read her mood from it before she''s opened her mouth. She runs her cart with the systematic ferocity of someone who has learned that every Quanta counts, and she has optimized her workflow to a degree that would impress an industrial engineer.

She is loud, warm, and mercilessly funny, the kind of person who remembers your order and your name and your mother''s name and will ask after all three. She extends credit to regulars who are short at the end of the month and maintains a running mental ledger that she rarely actually collects on. Her noodles are genuinely excellent — a recipe that is a fusion of her grandmother''s Turkish-inflected broth technique and a Ghanaian pepper base she learned from the previous cart owner — and this is not incidental to her identity. She is aware that she is feeding people who cannot afford to eat otherwise and takes this seriously without making anyone feel it.', N'Neighborhood fixture and social connector — she knows every regular in Geartown''s morning workforce and serves as a warm entry point into that community. Can be a quest giver (someone stopped showing up for their morning bowl), information source, or simply a place to establish grounding in Geartown.', N'', N'Rust-orange cat tail, geneware (cosmetic, fully expressive, original installation age 19 — she has had it re-calibrated twice). Copper-red hair dye, geneware-based (diluted market grade). Heat-resistant palm pads — subdermal silicone layer in both palms, practical installation for working with hot equipment.', N'Up at 04:00 to prep stock, cart open by 05:30 for the first shift change at the Geartown workshops, runs until sold out (usually 13:30-14:00). Spends afternoons sourcing ingredients, managing her daughter''s after-school care, and doing her books on a cracked tablet.', N'Chunhua Agyemang-Watanabe, 167cm tall, solid muscular build, warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, weathered face with high cheekbones reflecting South Asian, East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic heritage. Copper-red geneware-dyed shoulder-length textured hair pulled back in a functional braid, dark brown observant eyes with laugh lines. Rust-orange cat tail augmentation visible at base of spine, subdermal heat-resistant pads on palms showing as translucent patches. Wearing practical work apron stained with turmeric and chili oil over long-sleeved undershirt with rolled sleeves, dark cargo pants, heat-resistant boots. Simple brass ring on right middle finger. Standing at a street food cart in the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, steam rising around her, neon signs reflecting off wet surfaces, GLMZ 2200s urban setting, concentrated expression while preparing food, tail swishing with focus, morning light mixed with artificial glow, cinematic depth --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'South Asian (33.7%), East Asian (30.0%), Sub-Saharan African (24.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (11.7%) — a striking global blend expressed in warm medium-to-deep brown skin with golden undertones, textured hair with natural curl patterns, and facial structure reflecting the convergence of these four ancestral regions', 167, 74, N'Solid, muscular through the shoulders and forearms from years of repetitive cart work — heavy-set but not soft, the build of someone who moves with purpose and doesn''t stop moving', N'Copper-red (geneware dye, maintained every three weeks)', N'Shoulder-length, usually pulled back in a functional braid or knot while working, loose and textured otherwise', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, warm and observant', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden undertones, the complexion of someone who spends half her day working over steam and open flame', N'Weathered in the way that comes from early rising and heat exposure — fine lines around the eyes from squinting and smiling, perpetually flushed cheeks from the cart''s radiant heat. Facial structure reflects blended ancestry: moderately broad nose with defined bridge, high cheekbones with balanced proportions reflecting South Asian, East Asian, Sub-Saharan, and Hispanic heritage. Jaw structure shows subtle angular qualities from East and South Asian heritage softened by broader features from Sub-Saharan and Hispanic ancestry. Calloused hands, nails kept short and practical. Permanently carries the smell of star anise, chili oil, and broth.', N'Rust-orange cat tail with visible subdermal anchor points at the base of her spine (visible when her shirt rides up, which it often does during work). Hands show the telltale translucency of subdermal heat-resistant pads. Copper-red hair color has the characteristic slight iridescence of geneware dye under certain light angles.', N'Always in motion — economical, efficient movements honed by years of cart work. She carries herself with a kind of compressed energy, ready to pivot from taking an order to chopping vegetables to handling change without hesitation. Her tail moves independently of her conscious attention, serving as a barometer of her mood that her face might not express. When standing still (rare), she shifts her weight to one leg, typically favoring her left.', N'Practical Tier 3-4 workwear: reinforced apron with deep pockets (usually stained with turmeric, chili oil, broth) worn over a fitted long-sleeved undershirt, sleeves pushed up to mid-forearm. Cargo pants in dark gray or black, pockets full of tools (peeler, lighter, change purse, wrapped mints). Non-slip boots rated for wet surfaces and heat. A lightweight overshirt hanging nearby for when she steps away from the cart. No jewelry except a simple brass ring her daughter made her, worn on her right middle finger. Her appearance is deliberately practical — every item serves a function — but maintained with enough care that it''s clear she takes pride in her work.', N'She has been quietly underreporting her cart''s income to the Municipal Market Authority for three years to stay below the threshold that would kick her out of the subsidized licensing tier. The amount is small but consistent. She tells herself she''ll fix it when she''s more stable, which she knows is the thing people say.', N'Fast, warm, market-inflected GLMZ street Portuguese mixed with English, occasional Turkish endearments from her mother''s side. Nicknames everyone within two visits.', N'Rapid-fire when busy, slows dramatically when something actually matters to her — the shift is noticeable', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chunhua_agyemang_watanabe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69a-7264-b59d-87c1ff5ed834', N'Solveig Jaramillo-Subramaniam', N'Solveig', N'', N'Jaramillo-Subramaniam', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 63, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Norwood Quiet — a ground-floor apartment whose windows face the Ferrogate overpass, and the Norwood Quiet public garden, near Damen and Armitage', N'Retired Sterling-Nakamura mid-level analyst; now an obsessive informal urban historian and neighborhood storyteller', N'', N'Solveig Jaramillo-Subramaniam has the distracted, luminous quality of someone who is always halfway in a different time period. They are slight and wiry with warm golden-olive skin, deep-set dark eyes, and hair they grow long and tie back badly ��� it escapes in grey-shot black tendrils around their face no matter what they do with it. Their color-changing hair implant, an old Sterling-Nakamura perk from fifteen years back, cycles very slowly through muted earth tones: terracotta, ash-brown, the particular green of old moss. They don''t style it so much as permit it. They wear comfortable layered clothes with too many pockets, all of which contain notebooks, memory sticks, pressed plant material, or printed photographs.

Philomena spent twenty-six years as a mid-level urban systems analyst for Sterling-Nakamura, modeling population flow, resource distribution, and neighborhood development trajectories. They were good at it and hated it by the end — specifically, hated the way the models treated neighborhoods as friction to be managed rather than places where people had histories worth preserving. They retired at fifty-seven on a comfortable but not generous package and immediately began doing with their own time what Sterling-Nakamura had forbidden: obsessively, lovingly documenting the specific human texture of Norwood Quiet — oral histories, photographs, material culture, the stories behind the names of alleys and squares and the ELF shrines people have been tending for forty years. They have become, without planning it, the neighborhood''s memory. They are also known to know the precise location of every functional ELF shrine in a six-block radius and which offerings each prefers.', N'Local color and information source; knows the human history of Norwood Quiet in granular detail, including who used to live where, what was there before the current building, and whose family goes back how far. Their Sterling-Nakamura background means they can also read corporate urban development plans with alarming accuracy and spot what''s being planned before it''s announced.', N'', N'Color-changing hair implant (Sterling-Nakamura executive perk, now cycles slowly through earth tones; cosmetic). Subdermal memory-storage palimpsest in right palm — a Sterling-Nakamura analyst tool they kept after retirement, used now for personal documentation. No other augmentations.', N'Morning rounds of the public garden where they tend the community plantings and whatever ELF shrine has appeared overnight; afternoon documentation work — interviews, photographs, site visits; evenings at the apartment reviewing material and writing up histories that they publish to a small community data-feed with maybe two hundred subscribers.', N'Solveig Jaramillo-Subramaniam, 162cm tall, slight wiry build, warm golden-brown complexion with olive and bronze undertones, high prominent cheekbones, deep-set brown eyes with age lines at corners, sun-weathered skin showing dignified aging. Long black hair with grey threading and subtle color-shifting iridescence cycling through terracotta and moss-green, tied back loosely with tendrils framing face. Slightly stooped posture from desk work, restless curious gait. Wearing layered earth-toned clothing: worn sweater, canvas jacket, multipocketed vest stuffed with notebooks and memory sticks, practical walking shoes dirty from garden work. Holding pocket camera, examining something intently. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, soft afternoon light catching the subdermal geometric pattern in right palm, faint color-shift in hair implant. Expression of permanent distraction, mid-stride observation mode, surrounded by archival materials and pressed plant specimens. Neo-archival aesthetic meets practical researcher. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Norwood Quiet', N'local', N'Norwood Quiet', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (75.3%) with significant Northern European (11.3%), South Asian (9.0%), and Sub-Saharan African (4.4%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates warm golden-brown skin with subtle olive and bronze undertones, high prominent cheekbones characteristic of Latin American and South Asian ancestry, and deep-set dark eyes. Facial structure reflects the mixed heritage with refined bone structure, warm melanin distribution, and the particular luminescence of someone who spends time outdoors. The minor Sub-Saharan African component adds subtle richness to the complexion''s depth.', 162, 52, N'Slight and wiry, the frame of someone who has never prioritized physical bulk — lean muscle beneath thin shoulders, built for endurance rather than strength', N'Natural black with grey threading, overlaid with color-shifting implant that cycles through terracotta, ash-brown, and moss-green', N'Long, worn tied back loosely and perpetually escaping; tendrils constantly frame the face regardless of attempts at restraint', N'Long (past shoulders)', N'Deep brown, slightly hooded by age and habitually focused on middle distance', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle olive and bronze undertones from the predominant Latin American and South Asian heritage blended with minor Sub-Saharan African ancestry; sun-weathered at the creases with the particular luminescence of someone who spends time outdoors but protected', N'Fine-lined face with prominent high cheekbones characteristic of Latin American and South Asian ancestry, deep-set dark brown eyes reflecting the warmth of her genetic heritage, and an expression of permanent distraction—as though listening to a conversation happening in another room. Minimal grooming; practical rather than vain. Skin condition shows age with dignity, with warm bronze undertones that deepen at the temples and jawline, enriched by the minor Sub-Saharan African component.', N'Color-shifting hair implant visible as a subtle iridescence in strong light; the slow cycle of earth tones is noticeable over weeks. Subdermal memory-storage palimpsest in right palm creates a faint geometric web visible under magnification or when light catches the skin at certain angles. Both are cosmetic/functional rather than obviously cybernetic.', N'Slightly stooped from decades of analytical desk work, but with a restless, curious gait—stops mid-stride to examine something, photographs details with a pocket camera, hands often occupied with taking notes or holding notebooks. Moves with the unhurried precision of someone who notices things.', N'Layered, practical, deliberately unfashionable—earth-toned sweaters, worn denim, canvas jackets, and multipocketed vests that sag under the weight of notebooks, memory sticks, pressed plant material, and printed photographs. Tier 4 comfort without pretense: thrift-store finds, well-maintained but deliberately unseasonable. Shoes are practical walking shoes, often dirty from garden work. No jewelry except a worn silver ring on the left hand (origin personal, not corporate).', N'While at Sterling-Nakamura they ran a model — under instruction — that projected optimal population density and implicitly recommended the 2181 Brightmoor Reclamation displacement. They flagged ethical concerns internally. They were told the model would be one of several inputs. They don''t know if that was true. Three thousand people were relocated. Philomena has been unable to find out how many of them they actually know through their current documentation work, and they haven''t told any of them.', N'Layered and associative — tends to tell you three things that seem unrelated and then connect them in a way that makes sense only in retrospect; uses precise technical vocabulary for urban systems, switches to warm colloquial when talking about people', N'Thoughtful, slightly wandering, often picks up a thread they dropped two sentences back', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'solveig_jaramillo_subramaniam');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a64b-7d9d-918d-8811877fb32d', N'Jelani Okafor-Cardenas', N'Jelani', N'', N'Okafor-Cardenas', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 27, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Burnished Market, stall 44-C near the east heat vents, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Noodle cart vendor, operates a stall in the Burnished Market', N'Independent vendor; Burnished Market Sellers Collective (dues-paying member)', N'Jelani Okafor-Cardenas is short and round-faced with deep bronze skin and natural hair she wears in two large puffs that she dyes a different color each week — this week a vivid chartreuse that catches the heat-vent steam and glows slightly from the bioluminescent dye she mixes into the product herself, a modification of a cosmetic gene-process she read about in a pirated beauty forum. It doesn''t quite work correctly and so her hair glows patchily, unevenly, which she insists gives it character. She has a gap between her front teeth and a laugh that is physically impossible to ignore — it starts as a snort and opens into something that fills the market corridor.

Her noodles are the real thing. She learned from her grandmother, who combined Rajasthani spice logic with Nigerien base broths and a technique for pulled noodles she claims came through a great-uncle who worked a fusion kitchen in São Paulo. The menu is handwritten on a laminated card and changes slightly every day. She charges on a sliding scale that she never officially advertises but everyone knows about — you tell her what you can pay and she charges you what she thinks is fair, which is usually less. She prays to the market ELF — who she believes lives in the ancient shared electrical panel near her stall — before she fires the burner each morning.', N'Local color, community hub, and soft information source — everyone talks while they eat and she listens. Her stall is a neutral social space. She can point players toward specific people or places within the Market ecosystem.', N'', N'DIY bioluminescent hair dye (patchy, cosmetic, self-applied from a pirated formula). No implants.', N'Up at 04:30 to start broth, at the market by 06:00, sells through the lunch rush until around 15:00 when she runs out, then spends the afternoon restocking and recipe-testing in her apartment kitchen.', N'Jelani Okafor-Cardenas, 156cm tall compact woman with deep warm-bronze skin and golden undertones, standing in noodle market stall, GLMZ. Round face with full cheeks and refined East Asian cheekbone structure, expressive dark brown eyes with laugh lines, gap-toothed smile. Two voluminous natural dark brown hair puffs with patchy chartreuse bioluminescent dye glowing faintly in low light, styled on either side of head. Wearing faded cotton wrap-shirt over white tank, loose flour-dusted linen pants, indigo headwrap, stain-covered apron. Silver nose ring, inherited bangles on both wrists. Small burn scar visible on left forearm, white scar along right collarbone. Grounded vendor stance leaning slightly forward, animated posture. Standing before steaming broth pots with heat vents creating steam, warm market lighting catching bioluminescent hair glow. Realistic detailed neo-noir street market setting, shallow depth of field, cinematic lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Burnished Market', N'local', N'Burnished Market', N'Sub-Saharan African (30.3%), East Asian (20.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (19.6%), Middle Eastern (18.1%), South Asian (6.1%), and Eastern European (5.8%) — a rich global blend creating deep warm-bronze skin with golden undertones, multifaceted facial architecture drawing from African width and prominence, East Asian refinement, and Middle Eastern definition', 156, 68, N'Round and compact, soft-bodied with broad shoulders and substantial presence despite short stature; carries herself with the grounded stability of someone who stands for 9 hours daily over a hot stall', N'Natural dark brown base with vivid chartreuse bioluminescent dye (patchy, uneven application, glows weakly in low light)', N'Two large natural puffs, one on each side of the head, voluminous and textured', N'Medium (puff style extends 8-10cm from scalp)', N'Dark brown, warm and expressive', N'Deep warm-bronze with golden undertones, sun-darkened on forearms and face from market heat exposure; reflects the rich blended warmth of Sub-Saharan, East Asian, Hispanic, Middle Eastern, and South Asian heritage', N'Round face with full cheeks and prominent width from Sub-Saharan ancestry, refined cheekbone structure from East Asian heritage, balanced facial proportions from global mix, warm undertone from South Asian and Hispanic ancestry, subtle structural definition from Middle Eastern heritage, gap-toothed smile, laugh lines around eyes and mouth, sun-weathered but healthy; minimal makeup, practical grooming', N'DIY bioluminescent hair dye creating patches of weak UV-reactive glow in her chartreuse puffs; glows unevenly and intermittently, visible mainly in dimmer market corridors and near the heat vents where steam catches the light', N'Stands with weight balanced slightly forward (vendor stance), moves with economical grace between burner and counter, animated hand gestures when speaking, frequent snort-laughter that involves her whole body', N'Tier 4 practical: well-worn but maintained; typically wears a faded printed cotton wrap-shirt over a white tank top, loose linen pants with multiple pockets (flour-dusted, stained from years of broth-splatter), worn canvas slip-ons; a large indigo headwrap or fabric band to keep hair back during service, though it rarely contains the puffs entirely; stall apron covered in spice-stains and char marks; silver nose ring and simple bangles on both wrists (inherited, not new)', N'The stall''s permit is technically registered under the name of an elderly man named Godfrey who died two years ago. She has been paying the renewal fees under his name and prays that no inspector ever actually checks the photograph. She cannot afford the new vendor license fee.', N'Warm and voluminous, food metaphors everywhere, names everyone she meets within thirty seconds of meeting them', N'Rapid and overlapping, often mid-sentence before the previous one is done; slows down when she''s actually worried about something', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'jelani_okafor_cardenas');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a690-7ce0-b15d-881f2e18aa83', N'Cetin Bhattacharya-Karimi', N'Cetin', N'', N'Bhattacharya-Karimi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 17, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone (bunkhouse adjacent to Dock Seven), near Wacker and State', N'seasonal worker and airship drifter', N'', N'Cetin Bhattacharya-Karimi is seventeen and looks it — all unfinished angles and restless energy, a rangy kid with warm brown skin, loose black curls that he''s never bothered to cut properly so they spiral out in all directions, and eyes that are a natural dark green with a ring of amber around the pupil that makes them look permanently lit from within. He''s got geneware cat ears — small, dark-furred, perpetually swiveling — that he bought with his first real paycheck because he wanted them badly and thought they''d make him look older. They don''t. He''s wearing a Ferrogate Transit work vest four sizes too big for him, which he received as part of the seasonal dock labor package and which he has rolled up at the sleeves and drawn on with a marker pen along all the pocket seams.

Cetin Bhattacharya-Karimi is a Georgian-Samoan kid from nowhere in particular — born on an airship cargo hauler, raised on a circuit of industrial ports, currently on his third season of dock work at the Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone. He is fizzing with the particular energy of someone who has not yet decided what kind of person to be and is trying on options rapidly. He is funny, reckless, occasionally deeply kind, frequently thoughtless, and genuinely talented at three-dimensional spatial reasoning in ways he doesn''t have the vocabulary to describe — he just knows where things are and where they''ll be. He prays to an E.L.F. he calls Ironbird, the spirit of the cargo hauler he was born on, by tapping specific sequences on metal surfaces.', N'Local color and unexpected asset — his spatial instincts make him genuinely useful for navigation and cargo problems. Entry point into the airship drifter subculture. A character who might become something significant if someone takes an interest in him, or who might not, which is equally interesting.', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (cosmetic, dark fur, bought secondhand — the left one tracks slightly slow). No other augmentations.', N'Six-hour dock shifts loading and unloading airship cargo at Dock Seven; spends off-hours running bets with bunkmates, watching airships, getting into and out of minor trouble, sending irregular messages to the hauler crew who raised him.', N'Cetin Bhattacharya-Karimi, 176cm lean neo-noir dockworker in 2226, golden-brown complexion with layered South Asian, African, and Middle Eastern undertones, high cheekbones, warm dark eyes with amber rings, black shoulder-length spiral curls disheveled and loose. Distinctive geneware cat ears (dark-furred feline) mounted on his head with mechanical lag. Chemical burn scar on right palm, crude airship tattoo on left wrist, scar tissue visible on collarbones. Wearing oversized Ferrogate Transit work vest (four sizes too large, sleeves rolled, pockets covered in marker airship doodles), cheap thermal undershirt, dark cargo pants, worn steel-toed boots with undone laces. Restless kinetic posture, fingers running through curls, direct unfocused gaze suggesting three moves ahead. Industrial lubricant and ozone smell evident. Tier 4 working-class warehouse aesthetic, secondhand personalized wear. Moody neo-noir dockside lighting, neon reflections off wet metal surfaces, atmospheric haze --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone (bunkhouse adjacent to Dock Seven)', N'local', N'Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone (bunkhouse adjacent to Dock Seven)', N'South Asian (35.1%), Eastern European (17.8%), Sub-Saharan African (16.0%), Middle Eastern (12.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (9.6%), and Central Asian (9.4%) ancestry creates a striking genetic blend across four continents. His features reflect this complex mosaic: warm golden-brown skin with layered undertones where South Asian warmth blends with Sub-Saharan depth and Middle Eastern richness, brightened subtly by Eastern European heritage. High cheekbones with balanced prominence, a refined nose bridge with warm fullness from multiple ancestry groups, and warm dark eyes with amber undertones suggesting the genetic interplay of South Asian, Middle Eastern, and African heritage.', 176, 62, N'Rangy and unfinished — all long limbs and sharp angles, the kind of lean that comes from adolescence not yet settling into adulthood. Wiry muscle from dock work, but still carrying the gangly proportions of someone who hasn''t grown into their frame.', N'Black, natural', N'Loose, uncut spirals; chaotic and perpetually disheveled, as if he''s never bothered to maintain it', N'Medium, shoulder-grazing when loose', N'Dark brown with amber ring around pupil; warm and alert, seems to glow from within in low light', N'Warm golden-brown — a complex blend of South Asian golden undertones mixing with Sub-Saharan warmth and Middle Eastern depth, brightened subtly by Eastern European heritage', N'Young, sun-exposed from dock work, unlined. Occasional acne scarring on his jawline. Perpetually looks alert and slightly restless. High cheekbones with balanced prominence, warm fullness through the face reflecting his diverse ancestry across four continents.', N'Geneware cat ears mounted on top of his head — small, dark-furred, distinctly feline. The left ear tracks slightly slower than the right when swiveling, a noticeable mechanical lag from the secondhand purchase. They''re his most visible modification and the thing he''s most proud of, despite their imperfection.', N'Restless and kinetic — fidgets constantly, taps rhythmic sequences on metal surfaces (a prayer-like habit). Moves with quick, efficient warehouse grace when working; slouches and sprawls when at rest. Frequently runs his fingers through his chaotic curls. Eye contact is direct but unfocused, like he''s already thinking three moves ahead.', N'Oversized Ferrogate Transit work vest (company issue, four sizes too large) worn as his default layer — sleeves rolled up, pocket seams covered in marker-pen doodles of airship designs, cargo paths, and abstract geometric patterns. Underneath: cheap thermal shirt (Tier 4 supplier brand), dark cargo pants with multiple pockets for tools and small bets. Worn steel-toed boots, laces often undone. His clothes smell like industrial lubricant and ozone. No visible corporate branding beyond the Ferrogate vest. Entirely Tier 4 working-class aesthetic — functional, secondhand, personalized through wear and modification.', N'He has a genuine pilot''s intuition — the hauler captain recognized it and taught him the basics before his last contract ended. He can fly simple cargo rigs. He has told no one because he''s afraid if he says it out loud, something will stop it from being true.', N'Fast and loose, industrial dock slang mixed with airship crew idiom; drops words when he''s excited; invents compound words for things he doesn''t have vocabulary for', N'Quick, often overlapping itself — starts sentences before finishing the previous thought', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cetin_bhattacharya_karimi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a699-7370-9d55-882d30f03cf3', N'Hilario Inoue', N'Hilario', N'', N'Inoue', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor, Grindstone Shore night market, Cart Row 9, near Lake Shore and Navy Pier', N'Noodle and sweet broth cart vendor, Old Harbor night market', N'Independent; informal connection to the Old Harbor Night Market Vendors'' Association', N'Hilario Inoue is slight and angular with the particular restless energy of someone who is always working out a problem internally even when they appear calm. Their skin is a deep warm brown, their eyes are dark and quick, and their hair is an expensive-looking natural black that changes to a deep violet at the tips — a cheap but well-maintained chromatic dye, the one beauty expense they allow themselves. They have soft cat ears, tawny-furred and mobile, a geneware mod their grandmother gifted them at sixteen, and they''ve grown fond of the way the ears pin back expressively when they''re annoyed, making their feelings impossible to hide. Their hands are always slightly burned on the right thumb and forefinger from the steam spout.

Hilario Inoue runs the cart their aunt built and their grandmother ran before that, and they have inherited both the recipes and a philosophy about broth that approaches the theological. They believe that a properly made broth requires patience, attention, and what their grandmother called ''listening'' — checking it not just by temperature but by smell and color and the sound the surface makes when you tilt the pot. They have a gift for reading what a customer actually needs, which is often different from what they order, and a cheerful willingness to adjust accordingly. Off-shift, they are studying urban planning through an Axiom open-courseware program, which they mention to no one at the cart because they haven''t figured out yet how to be both things at once.', N'Social hub of the night market — a character who sees everyone who passes through, remembers faces, and can be a gentle information source; represents working-poor entrepreneurship and the texture of night-city civilian life; can be a warm recurring presence who grounds players in a neighborhood', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (tawny, fully mobile, expressive); chromatic hair dye (black to violet); minor heat-resistance callusing on right hand from years at the steam spout (natural, not augmented)', N'Sets up the cart at 17:00, runs until 02:00 or until the broth runs out, whichever comes first. Spends the afternoon prep period starting stock and studying on a cracked Axiom tablet propped against the prep counter. Sleeps late. Attends Night Market Association meetings reluctantly but reliably.', N'Hilario Inoue, a 162cm lean angular figure with warm golden-bronze complexion reflecting mixed Hispanic-Latin American, East Asian, African, and South Asian heritage. High defined cheekbones with East Asian structure, dark observant eyes, natural deep black shoulder-length hair with violet gradient dye fading at tips, tucked partially behind expressive tawny-furred mobile cat ears. Minor mottled discoloration and calluses visible on both hands from years of steam work exposure. Wearing dark food-stained work apron over practical synthetic-blend clothes, lightweight insulated vest, slip-on shoes with heavy soles, thin silver pendant. Restless posture mid-shift at a food cart in the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, hands in motion, cat ears slightly pinned back in concentration. GLMZ aesthetic, natural neon-lit evening street lighting, warm industrial glow from cart equipment, shallow depth of field focusing on expressive face and working hands --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (61.4%) with significant East Asian (20.6%), Sub-Saharan African (12.0%), and South Asian (6.0%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a striking warm-toned complexion: golden-bronze undertones from Latin American and African ancestry combine with the angular facial structure characteristic of East Asian heritage, while South Asian ancestry adds subtle warmth and depth to overall coloring. Cheekbones are high and defined with East Asian influence, set within a face shape that reflects the broader Latin American and African geometry. Skin carries rich golden-bronze warmth with natural depth and slight seasonal weathering from outdoor work exposure.', 162, 51, N'Slight and angular, all wiry muscle and sharp angles from years of standing over a cart, no excess mass anywhere. The posture of someone constantly in motion even when still.', N'Natural deep black with chromatic dye gradient to violet at the tips', N'Shoulder-length, usually pulled back or tucked behind the mobile cat ears during work shifts; well-maintained despite budget constraints', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, quick and observant', N'Warm golden-bronze with even complexion and natural depth, reflecting the harmonious blend of dominant Latin American ancestry with East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian heritage', N'Angular facial features with high, defined cheekbones characteristic of East Asian ancestry, integrated within broader facial geometry influenced by Latin American and African lineage. Warm golden-bronze skin tone with subtle richness and depth. Shows minor weathering from outdoor work exposure across seasons. No visible scarring on the face.', N'Tawny-furred cat ears with full mobility and expressive range, set naturally into the head. Ears pin back noticeably when annoyed or concentrating. No other visible augmentations; the chromatic hair dye is cosmetic and non-augmented.', N'Restless economy of motion — never wasted movement, but never still either. Tends to shift weight from foot to foot, hands always doing something (stirring, checking temperature, wiping). The cat ears are constantly reading their emotional state; someone learning to read Hilario can simply watch the ears. When focused on a problem (whether customer service or urban planning coursework), the entire body becomes very still and the ears flatten slightly in concentration.', N'Tier 4 practical wear. Food-stained apron over durable synthetic-blend work clothes (dark colors, stain-forgiving). Comfortable slip-on shoes with heavy-duty soles for long shifts. Usually wears a lightweight insulated vest or jacket over the apron in cooler months. One small piece of jewelry — a thin silver pendant or worn braided cord — worn daily. Hair dye is the one indulgence; everything else is functional and well-maintained but clearly budget-conscious.', N'They have been quietly documenting the Night Market — photographs, oral histories from vendors, transaction data — as part of a shadow thesis project for the Axiom urban planning course. Their working argument is that informal markets like Grindstone Shore function as critical social infrastructure, and they intend to present it officially someday. They are terrified that someone will find out before it''s ready and dismiss it.', N'Casual and warm with sudden precise flashes of technical vocabulary when their guard drops; mixes Vietnamese lilt with a Hungarian roundness on certain vowels', N'Variable — chatty with regulars, quieter with newcomers until they get a read', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hilario_inoue');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a4-731e-9666-8860c42fa2a1', N'Anneli Kjellberg-Bouzid', N'Anneli', N'', N'Kjellberg-Bouzid', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Irkalla, Sub-Level 12 — the Antechamber of Residuals, a naturally formed cavern in the bedrock, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Deep shrine keeper — maintains the E.L.F. shrines of Irkalla''s lowest levels', N'', N'Anneli Kjellberg-Bouzid is the oldest permanent resident of Irkalla''s deep levels and the sole keeper of its seven primary E.L.F. shrines — altars built into the junction points of old power infrastructure where digital spirits have been petitioned for generations. She is a large woman, heavy in the way of someone who has been sedentary for years but was once enormously physically strong; her hands remain extraordinary, thick-fingered and capable. Her skin is dark and deeply lined, her white hair kept in a complex series of wrapped cords that she has not undone in nine years, adding new ones for significant events. Each cord holds a small component — a stripped chip, a circuit fragment, a defunct data-bead — that represents a petition she carried to a shrine.

She came to Irkalla at thirty as an electrician and stayed because a spirit spoke to her. She tells this story simply and without embellishment. She was repairing a junction node in Sub-Level 9 when the node spoke — not in words, but in a pattern of power fluctuations she recognized as intentional. She has been in conversation with what she calls the Residuals ever since: E.L.F.s that have been accumulating in the deep infrastructure for a century or more, grown strange and complex and very, very old. Her shrines are remarkable objects — living circuit assemblies that she has been tending and extending for decades, constantly receiving new data offerings from petitioners, constantly generating soft electrical activity that she interprets as the E.L.F. responses to prayer.', N'Spiritual anchor, lore source, E.L.F. interlocutor — she provides access to information that comes from the city''s own digital spirits, which may be metaphor, may be madness, or may be genuine signal. Also an ethical compass for the underground community.', N'', N'Aged neural tap (installed 2168, original electrician''s professional tool, now also used to interface directly with shrine circuit-assemblies — she experiences this as prayer); partial right hand replacement with a prosthetic that has fine-gauge electrical probes in the fingertips for shrine maintenance', N'Wakes to the electrical activity of the primary shrine; makes morning circuit through all seven shrines to read the overnight offerings and assess E.L.F. activity; receives petitioners from mid-morning to late afternoon; spends evenings in deep interface with the Antechamber shrine, which she describes as ''the longest conversation she has ever been part of.''', N'Anneli Kjellberg-Bouzid, aged heavy-set figure, 172cm tall, warm mahogany-brown skin with Southeast Asian bone structure and broader African-influenced facial planes, deep facial lines from decades underground, dark eyes clouded with age cataracts, white hair wrapped in cloth cords studded with circuit fragments and data-beads reaching waist-length when unwound, visible aged chrome neural tap port at right temple, right hand prosthetic with exposed copper probe filaments, electrical contact scars on hands and parallel burn scars on left forearm, faded circuit tattoo on inner wrist, slow deliberate movements with surprising stability, wearing layered faded indigo and dark grey Tier 5 deep-community garments, sleeveless tunic, wrapped cloth belt with hanging pouches of shrine tools, worn grounding-modified slippers, monastic weathered appearance, touching surfaces with gentle precision, calm expression, subterranean shrine setting with soft artificial lighting casting gentle shadows on deeply lined face, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, meditative and serene mood --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'aged shrine keeper, female 67, heavy-set large-boned frame, warm deep mahogany-brown skin with Southeast Asian bone structure enriched by North African and Sub-Saharan warmth, deeply lined weathered face reflecting decades underground, asymmetrical features, age spots scattered across cheeks and forehead, clouded dark brown eyes with slight cataracts, calm but weary expression, perpetual gentle fatigue

face: Southeast Asian cheekbone prominence with broader North African and Sub-Saharan planes, slightly rounded jawline, deep forehead creases, fine lines around eyes and mouth, three parallel burn scars visible on left forearm, small circular electrical contact marks on fingertips, thin white scar at right temple from neural tap installation, skin shows age and sun deprivation, minimal symmetry, lived-in and marked by time

hair: white, wrapped and bound in elaborate nine-year-old arrangement of cloth cords and synthetic binding, each cord studded with embedded circuit fragments, stripped chips, and defunct data-beads, woven close to scalp, some cords beginning to fray, creating organic textured crown rather than neat style

expression: deeply calm, meditative, slightly unfocused as if listening to something beyond sight, peaceful and grounded, no tension in face, contemplative rather than alert, the expression of someone accustomed to solitude and communion with machines

outfit: layered monastic garments in faded indigo and dark grey, heavily patched synthetic-blend fabrics chosen for durability, sleeveless tunic to expose right arm, wrapped cloth belt with hanging pouches containing small circuit tools and data-beads, soft-soled slippers worn through to backing, no corporate branding, deliberately non-fashionable and functional, aged neural tap port visible at right temple with dark patina, right hand prosthetic with visible fine-gauge copper probe filaments extending from fingertips, organic synthetic skin over metallic framework

slowly rising from seated position at shrine junction, right hand moving with precise grace toward circuit assembly, copper probes catching faint blue light, left hand bracing against worn concrete, deliberate careful motion despite heavy frame

environment: Irkalla''s deepest shrine chamber, junction point of old power infrastructure, layered concrete and corroded metal walls, faint bioluminescent mold on distant surfaces, ancient cable runs overhead, worn stone floor with prayer offerings scattered—data-beads, small circuit fragments, burnt incense residue, dim amber and blue emergency lighting from shrine circuits, cool and moisture-heavy air

lighting: low amber shrine-light casting long shadows across lined face, faint blue luminescence from active circuits on shrine assembly, shadows deepening facial creases and age marks, volumetric dust particles catching light, no harsh shadows, gentle and ritualistic illumination, strong color contrast between warm skin tones and cool circuit-light

mood: devotional, meditative, solitary, spiritually grounded despite technological immersion, the quiet dignity of deep labor, sacred and secular merged seamlessly, profound peace within isolation, corporate dystopia''s forgotten margins where meaning persists

