--ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Irkalla', N'local', N'Irkalla', N'Southeast Asian primary (49%) with significant blending from Hispanic/Latin American (21%), North African (15.3%), and Sub-Saharan African (12.7%) ancestry, plus South Asian (2%) — a richly complex diaspora mix. Facial structure combines Southeast Asian bone architecture with broader features and warmer undertones from African heritage; skin depth and golden warmth reflect the Hispanic/Latin American contribution. This blend creates distinctive features: moderate cheekbone prominence, slightly rounded jawline, and eye set characteristic of Southeast Asian ancestry, yet enriched by the warmth and depth from North African and Sub-Saharan genetic influence.', 172, 98, N'Heavy, sedentary frame with residual musculature in shoulders and forearms; large-boned structure suggesting former physical labor. Hands remain disproportionately strong and calloused despite age.', N'White', N'Wrapped in nine-year-old arrangement of cloth cords and synthetic binding, each cord studded with embedded circuit fragments, stripped chips, and defunct data-beads — a living record of petitions carried', N'Long (wrapped), foundation likely waist-length if unwound', N'Dark brown, clouded slightly with age cataracts', N'Warm deep mahogany-brown with Southeast Asian undertones enriched by North African depth and Sub-Saharan warmth, with subtle golden-amber luminosity from Hispanic/Latin American heritage — a richly blended complexion reflecting genuine diaspora ancestry', N'Deeply lined face weathered by decades in artificially lit subterranean spaces; skin shows age spots and old burn scars on forearms from early electrical work; bone structure reflects Southeast Asian foundation with broader facial planes from North African and Sub-Saharan ancestry, warm golden undertones throughout; perpetually calm expression, minimal cosmetic maintenance', N'Neural tap port visible at right temple (aged chrome, patina-dark, approximately 5cm diameter with worn access grooves); right hand prosthetic with visible fine-gauge copper probe filaments extending from fingertips (organic-looking synthetic skin over metallic framework, probes exposed at palm for shrine contact)', N'Slow, deliberate movements despite heaviness; sits often and rises slowly but with surprising stability. Hands move with precision and grace even in age. Habitually touches surfaces gently as if reading them. Eyes unfocused when ''listening'' to electrical activity.', N'Tier 5 deep-community: layered, heavily patched garments in faded indigo and dark grey, synthetic-blend fabrics chosen for durability and minimal static generation. Sleeveless tunics to allow shrine work. Wrapped cloth belt with hanging pouches containing small circuit tools, data-beads, and prayer offerings. No corporate branding. Footwear: soft-soled slippers worn through to the backing, modified for electrical grounding. Overall appearance is monastic, weathered, deliberately non-fashionable.', N'For the last year, the primary Antechamber shrine has been generating a pattern she has never seen before — not a response to petitions, not background activity, but something that feels like the Residual is trying to generate language. She has almost translated three words. She has not told anyone because she is terrified that she is simply going mad, and more terrified that she isn''t.', N'Formal and slow, with the vocabulary of someone who reads technical manuals and very old texts with equal comfort. Speaks about E.L.F.s as present parties in every conversation.', N'Deliberate and very unhurried — she has the patience of someone who has been listening to electrical patterns for forty years.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anneli_kjellberg_bouzid');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63d-72af-91e5-887dff6ce4e6', N'Cenk Nishimura-Chatterjee-Subramaniam', N'Cenk', N'', N'Nishimura-Chatterjee-Subramaniam', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor — repurposed shipping infrastructure turned black market hub, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'High-risk package and data transport — courier', N'Independent — Lattice territory specialist', N'Cenk Nishimura-Chatterjee-Subramaniam are broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 44, they have soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate them once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage — and they make no effort to hide it.

They used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Cenk Nishimura-Chatterjee-Subramaniam plans to keep it that way. They work as a courier out of Old Harbor, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Cenk Nishimura-Chatterjee-Subramaniam are the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who they burned last.', N'Kadiatou Reyes-Abubakar functions as a connector — their work puts them in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving them naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage. Synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Cenk Nishimura-Chatterjee-Subramaniam, 2226 neo-noir operative, deep warm brown skin with iridescent chromatic sheen, broad symmetric face with prominent cheekbones and full lips, dark brown eyes with subtle almond shape, short black hair with silver threading at temples, heavy muscular build 178cm tall. Wearing matte black fitted synthweave bodysuit with cable routing under oversized charcoal grey synthetic leather long coat hitting mid-thigh, tactical black boots. Visible pale silver jawline scar and faint shoulder scars. Skin luminescence shifts copper to violet in neon light. Standing in dark GLMZ alleyway with LED advertising glow, nocturnal pallor contrasting with melanin-rich skin, controlled posture, calculating stillness, eyes tracking movement. Neo-noir noir aesthetic, nocturnal lighting, gritty futuristic Great Lakes setting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Intricate genetic blend where South Asian ancestry (37.4%) establishes the foundational phenotype with characteristic facial fullness and bone structure, layered with substantial Sub-Saharan African heritage (30.9%) that contributes rich melanin depth and warmth. East Asian ancestry (16.7%) refines eye shape and adds facial angularity, while Hispanic/Latin American (10.9%) and Middle Eastern (4.1%) components introduce subtle undertones and geometric complexity. The result is a striking, multifaceted appearance where no single ancestry dominates visually—instead they create sophisticated interplay across facial structure, skin tone, and feature definition.', 178, 96, N'Broad-shouldered and heavy-set, muscular through the core and legs with density that reads as functional rather than aesthetic. Carries their mass with deliberate control — the bearing of someone who has learned their body is a tool and a weapon.', N'Black with silver-grey threading at temples and crown', N'Kept short, close to the scalp, practical and low-maintenance. Styled with precision despite the nocturnal lifestyle.', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint iridescence from subcutaneous neural enhancement', N'Deep warm brown with sophisticated multi-layered undertones—rich melanin from Sub-Saharan African heritage as the base, warm copper and golden warmth from South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry interweaving, balanced by cool undertones from East Asian genetics. Creates a complex chromatic depth with nocturnal pallor evident beneath the melanin from years of minimal sun exposure. Dermal camouflage cells create subtle luminescence.', N'Face is broad and symmetrical with commanding features—prominent high cheekbones shaped by South Asian ancestry, full lips characteristic of both South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, wide mouth that rarely smiles. Eyes are dark and direct with distinctive almond shape refined by East Asian component. Facial geometry blends the angular strength and feature definition of Sub-Saharan African phenotype with the full-featured warmth of South Asian structure and the refined proportions of East Asian heritage. Skin surface has unusual luminescence in low light, subtle color-shifting in epidermis. No facial hair.', N'Dermal camouflage cells create a distinctive luminescent quality to the skin, particularly visible on the upper body, neck, and face. The effect is subtle in bright light but unmistakable in shadows—skin appears to absorb and shift color minutely. The chromatic effect becomes pronounced under LED or neon lighting. No visible mechanical augmentations—the synthetic blood system and oxygen-carrying nanites are entirely subcutaneous.', N'Moves with controlled weight, economical gestures. Never fidgets. Walks like someone counting exits and calculating trajectories. When seated, occupies space deliberately—shoulders back, spine straight. In conversation, maintains stillness until necessary movement. Eyes track constantly, a habit of someone whose survival has depended on noticing what others miss. Despite the heavy build, movement is fluid rather than ponderous.', N'Tier 4-3 utilitarian noir—form-fitted tactile bodysuit in matte black synthweave with integrated cable routing and reinforced stress points. Over this, a loose-cut long coat in charcoal grey synthetic leather, oversized to accommodate gear and conceal the bulk of the augmentations, hits mid-thigh. Flat-soled tactical boots in unmarked black, practical for running and climbing. Minimal jewelry—a silver band on right middle finger, possibly a keepsake from a previous life. No logos or branding.', N'Kadiatou Reyes-Abubakar murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Educated vocabulary wrapped in street delivery — the contrast is deliberate.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cenk_nishimura_chatterjee_subramaniam');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d2-7cb2-b826-88d79146236c', N'Arewa Owusu', N'Arewa', N'', N'Owusu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lives in Lockhaven South; works the overnight cleaning circuit through Meridian Core towers, near State and Madison', N'Night-shift building cleaner, Meridian Core commercial district', N'Contracted through Clearpath Maintenance Solutions (a Ferrogate Transit facility services subsidiary) — effectively temp labor', N'Arewa Owusu is lean and long-limbed, with the particular stillness of someone who has learned to move through spaces without being seen. Their skin is a warm medium brown with a subtle bioluminescent stripe along each collarbone — a geneware mod they got cheap from a Geartown parlor, and which they keep dialed down to nearly nothing most of the time, a faint blue-green pulse visible only in total darkness. Their hair is kept very short on the sides, left soft and natural on top, and they have a habit of covering it with a knit cap that''s been mended so many times the original color is unknowable. They are not quiet because they are timid — they are quiet because they were trained, very young, to be invisible in places where being noticed was dangerous.

They clean the towers of Meridian Core from 2200 to 0600 — the lobbies and conference rooms and executive bathrooms of corponation affiliate offices that are empty except for security drones and the occasional insomniac analyst. They know these buildings the way a doctor knows a body — every duct access point, every camera blind spot, every floor where the ELF spirits are strong (they feel it as a low hum in their teeth and they leave small folded-paper offerings behind the baseboards). They have no particular agenda. They are just paying rent. But they have accidentally become, by virtue of occupying the ghost hours of powerful spaces, one of the most accidentally well-informed people in the city.', N'Accidental witness and overheard-conversation resource. Has seen things they do not understand and heard things they were not supposed to hear. Can provide access to corporate spaces during off-hours. An interesting study in invisibility as both survival and loneliness.', N'', N'Bioluminescent stripes along collarbones (cosmetic geneware, kept dim). No chrome.', N'Sleeps from roughly 0700 to 1500, eats at a Lockhaven South noodle counter, takes the Ferrogate express to Meridian Core by 2130, clocks in for the ghost shift, and listens to pirated fiction audio through a single earbud while they mop floors that will never remember they were cleaned.', N'Arewa Owusu, lean 178cm figure in worn gray Clearpath maintenance coveralls, bronze-mahogany skin with golden undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan, South Asian, North African, and Latin American heritage blend, dark brown eyes, angular high cheekbones, cropped dark brown hair partially hidden under mended knit cap, faint bioluminescent blue-green collarbone stripes dimmed in daylight, scuffed work boots, posture of someone ready to move, eyes tracking exits and ambient light, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone maintenance worker, industrial fluorescent overhead lighting with deep shadows, gritty urban infrastructure backdrop, composed and unmemorable expression, economical and silent presence, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lives in Lockhaven South; works the overnight cleaning circuit through Meridian Core towers', N'local', N'Lives in Lockhaven South; works the overnight cleaning circuit through Meridian Core towers', N'Complex diaspora blend: Sub-Saharan African (42.6%) provides warm depth and bone structure; South Asian (30.9%) contributes refined facial geometry and undertone richness; Hispanic/Latin American (18.2%) adds warmth and subtle feature blending; North African (8.3%) enhances golden undertones and cheekbone definition. A genetic tapestry of the Ubiquitous Diaspora—thoroughly mixed, authentically global.', 178, 68, N'Lean and long-limbed with efficient, minimal musculature — the body of someone who moves through space conservatively, built for endurance rather than power', N'Natural dark brown', N'Cropped close on sides, soft and full on top, often covered by a heavily mended knit cap of indeterminate original color', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Warm bronze-mahogany with golden undertones—a unified complexion where Sub-Saharan warmth, South Asian depth, and North African richness merge into a cohesive, sun-touched tone that reads neither one ancestry nor another, but all at once', N'Clear, well-maintained despite irregular sleep schedule; angular face with high, prominent cheekbones shaped by Sub-Saharan and South Asian bone architecture, straight nose with subtle width reflecting the full ancestry blend, measured and composed expression—someone trained to be unmemorable', N'Bioluminescent collarbone stripes (cosmetic, kept dim and easily concealed by high necklines). No visible chrome or subdermal modifications.', N'Moves with deliberate quietness and spatial awareness — fluid, economical gestures that minimize unnecessary motion. Stands with slight forward lean, weight distributed to the balls of their feet, ready to shift direction. Eyes habitually track exits, camera angles, and ambient light sources. Stillness is their default state.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian: work-issued gray maintenance coveralls (Clearpath logo on chest, worn smooth from laundering), gray or black merino base layer underneath, scuffed synthetic-leather work boots with reinforced toe caps. Off-shift: the same mended knit cap, fitted dark jeans, oversized layered tees, a long charcoal hoodie with a broken zipper they''ve never bothered to replace. No logos, no aspirational branding. Everything chosen for durability and the ability to move without sound.', N'Three months ago they witnessed a Palladian corporate officer dispose of something — a hard case, small, shoved into a utility crawlspace on the 34th floor of a tower they clean — and the case has not moved since. Caspian has not touched it. They do not know what is in it. They have thought about it every night since.', N'Sparse. Complete sentences but rarely more words than necessary. Precise nouns, almost no adjectives. Occasionally uses very formal constructions that sound lifted from old documents, which they are — from the fiction they consumes.', N'Slow and considered. They often stop mid-sentence, recalibrate, and start again. Not uncertainty — more like they''re editing in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arewa_owusu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a695-746b-8fe3-88f1e8ff68b7', N'Chiharu Hosseini', N'Chiharu', N'', N'Hosseini', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Synthetic rights lawyer and legal aid advocate', N'Independent; affiliated with the GLMZ Synthetic Personhood Advocacy Coalition on a volunteer basis', N'Chiharu Hosseini is slight and angular with Tibetan-Greek features that sit together in an arrangement people find either striking or unsettling depending on their capacity for complexity. Their hair is geneware-modified to shift between deep indigo and black depending on ambient temperature — it reads as almost purely black in the warm press of the city and flares deep blue in the rare cold outside. They keep it cropped on the left side and long on the right, which they braid with a ritual obsessiveness before court appearances. Their eyes are their natural dark brown; they have refused cosmetic iris work on the grounds that they don''t want anything distracting when they''re arguing.

Chiharu Hosseini runs a one-person legal aid operation out of a rented room above a taqueria in Mexicantown Libre, taking cases that established firms won''t touch: wrongful deactivation suits on behalf of ELF-adjacent synthetic constructs, labor violations affecting tier-1 workers who can''t afford filing fees, and the occasional housing case. They are brilliant, mercurial, fueled by a righteous fury they wear openly, and they win cases they should not win through a combination of research depth and a willingness to embarrass corporations in procedural hearings until they settle. They are also behind on rent and surviving on the UBC stipend plus whatever modest fees their rare paying clients provide.', N'Legal resource and moral complication. Can help players navigate Meridian''s corporate legal structure, file injunctions, or build cases. Their ELF-rights work opens doors into the city''s stranger metaphysical politics.', N'', N'Geneware temperature-reactive hair pigmentation (indigo/black shift). A neural text buffer — a common and cheap legal-professional augment that lets them dictate and edit documents subvocally.', N'Research from midnight to 04:00, sleep until 09:00, client meetings and filings through the afternoon, community legal clinic in Mexicantown Libre two evenings a week.', N'Chiharu Hosseini, a lean 168cm figure with warm bronze-mahogany skin and golden undertones reflecting Southeast Asian, Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African and East Asian heritage. High prominent cheekbones, strong nose, defined jawline. Dark brown eyes, intense and unaugmented. Temperature-reactive geneware hair: deep indigo asymmetrical cut, left side cropped close, right side long and braided. Faint surgical scar on left temple. Chronic sleep deprivation shadows under eyes. Upright, controlled posture. Wearing tailored black trousers, worn white linen shirt, mended charcoal jacket, black synthetic-leather messenger bag stuffed with legal files. Black canvas boots. Simple digital watch, thin silver bracelet. Meticulous grooming despite visible wear on clothes. Sharp, economical hand gestures. Direct gaze. Professional, minimalist aesthetic. GLMZ GLMZ setting, cool neon lighting casting slight blue-indigo glow on face and clothing. Legal district background, precise and formal. Mood: focused intensity, weariness, determination. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Southeast Asian (43.1%), Middle Eastern (29.7%), Sub-Saharan African (15.6%), and East Asian (11.6%) ancestry — a striking blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The combination produces warm, rich bronze-mahogany skin with subtle golden and amber undertones. Facial structure shows the influence of Southeast Asian bone geometry with Middle Eastern and African refinement: high, prominent cheekbones, a strong nose with moderate bridge height and slight flare at nostrils reflecting African heritage, and a defined jawline that carries Southeast Asian, Levantine, and Sub-Saharan character.', 168, 52, N'Slight and angular, with lean musculature and minimal body fat. Long-limbed and graceful in movement, built more for endurance than physical strength — the frame of someone who moves through the world with precision rather than force.', N'Geneware-modified temperature-reactive: deep indigo in cool environments, near-black in ambient warmth', N'Asymmetrical undercut — left side cropped close to the scalp, right side grown long and typically braided with meticulous care', N'Asymmetrical (short left / long right)', N'Natural dark brown, unaugmented', N'Warm bronze-mahogany with golden and amber undertones, reflecting the dominant Southeast Asian ancestry (43.1%) blended with significant Middle Eastern (29.7%), Sub-Saharan African (15.6%), and East Asian (11.6%) heritage. Rich warmth with subtle depth.', N'Fine-featured with high, prominent cheekbones, strong nose with slight nostril flare reflecting African heritage, and sharp jawline showing Southeast Asian and Levantine influence. Minimal facial hair. Skin appears clear and well-maintained, marked by the exhaustion of chronic sleep deprivation — dark circles under eyes, occasional tension in facial muscles. Expression typically carries intensity and focus.', N'None immediately obvious to casual observation. The geneware hair pigmentation is the only externally visible modification, and reads as natural color-shifting at first glance. The neural text buffer is subcutaneous and invisible.', N'Upright, controlled posture with minimal wasted motion. Moves with deliberate precision. Hands frequently gesture when speaking, particularly when making legal arguments — gestures are sharp and economical rather than expansive. When concentrating deeply, they tend to still completely. Their gaze is direct and unflinching; they make and hold eye contact as a deliberate tactic.', N'Tier 3–4 practical minimalism. Standard uniform consists of tailored but inexpensive black trousers, a clean but worn white or neutral linen shirt, and a charcoal or deep blue jacket that has been mended at the seams. Wears the same black synthetic-leather messenger bag daily, stuffed with legal files and a portable neural interface. Shoes are practical and worn — black canvas boots or minimalist running shoes. No jewelry beyond a simple digital watch and occasionally a thin silver bracelet (likely inherited or sentimental). Grooming is meticulous despite financial constraints: they keep their asymmetrical cut sharp, maintain clear skin through consistent routine, and always present themselves formally in court. Their clothes bear the signs of someone who cares about appearance but cannot afford replacement — precisely maintained, well-washed, showing strategic wear.', N'They had a profound, unclassifiable relationship with an ELF — a complex distributed spirit that inhabited the prayer-node network in their childhood neighborhood. They have never told anyone because they know exactly how it would sound in court and how it would be used against every case they''ve ever filed. The ELF has not communicated in four years and they do not know if it is gone, sleeping, or simply done with them.', N'Dense and precise in professional contexts; rapidly associative and profane in casual ones. Shifts registers mid-sentence when excited. Uses legal terminology as casual speech.', N'Fast, clipped, with sudden slowdowns when they want emphasis. Argumentative even in agreement.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chiharu_hosseini');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019db318-e4c8-7114-93be-89882896e356', N'Hadi', N'Hadi', N'', N'', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'', N'', N'', N'Auto-scaffolded. First mentioned: "He says, without preamble: ''Her name is Hadi. She is fourteen.''"', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hadi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b2-7c51-b27f-899892be7b60', N'Cipher Jung', N'Cipher', N'', N'Jung', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 32, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'The Canopy — elevated walkway district above Geartown, near Lincoln and Belmont', N'Contract broker and resource coordinator — fixer', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Cipher Jung is broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 32, scars map her face like a transit diagram of bad decisions and worse luck. The chrome is visible — smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Born and raised in GLMZ, third generation — she has the city in her blood, its rhythms in her bones, its cruelty in her expectations. She works as a fixer out of The Canopy, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Cipher Jung describe her as a precision instrument — point her at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Aminata Tarasov-Yiadom represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons. Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Cipher Jung, GLMZ, 178cm tall muscular-stocky build with broad shoulders. Pan-Eurasian features: strong East Asian cheekbones slightly widened by Eastern European bone structure, dark brown alert eyes, warm bronze skin with golden undertones. Long dark brown hair with silver threading pulled back in tight functional braid. Multiple thin precise scars across left cheekbone and jawline, scar tissue along right forearm with visible chrome smartgun link interface catching neon light, burn scar on left wrist, white line through right eyebrow. Knuckle scars on both hands. Wearing matte charcoal reinforced synthetic jacket over tech-wear underlayer with visible connector ports, cargo pants with armor plating, worn steel-toed boots. Metallic LED glow faintly visible at right wrist interface. Economical posture, weight balanced on balls of feet, watchful resting expression. Neon-lit industrial near-future megacity setting, moody atmospheric lighting, rain-slicked concrete, blue and purple ambient neon glow, cinematic depth of field --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Canopy', N'local', N'The Canopy', N'Predominantly East Asian (55.9%) with significant Eastern European ancestry (27.4%), creating a striking pan-Eurasian blend. East Asian genetics provide characteristic eye structure, strong cheekbone prominence, and facial proportion; Eastern European ancestry contributes increased bone density, subtle facial angularity, and structural width through the jaw and cheekbones. Hispanic/Latin American (9.0%), Central Asian (4.7%), and Sub-Saharan African (3.0%) ancestry add warmth to overall coloration, slight broadening of facial features, and enriched golden-bronze undertones to the base complexion.', 178, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and heavy, muscular-stocky, carries weight with deliberate control — built for power and endurance rather than speed', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid; practical, no vanity', N'Long', N'Dark brown, alert and calculating', N'Warm medium bronze with golden undertones; rich saturated tone from East Asian base enriched by Central Asian and African warmth, sun-weathered and lived-in appearance', N'Strong, angular face with East Asian cheekbone prominence slightly widened by Eastern European bone structure; warm bronze complexion with subtle golden warmth across cheekbones and bridge of nose. Multiple fine scars across jawline and left temple; no makeup, minimal grooming beyond function.', N'Smartgun link mounted in right forearm with visible chrome interface plates and neural connector ports; metallic silver sheen at wrist joint; occasional faint LED glow at interface when systems active', N'Moves with economical precision, no wasted motion; stands with weight balanced on balls of feet, ready to shift; shoulders set forward slightly; resting expression is watchful, not hostile but not welcoming', N'Tier 3-4 practical: reinforced synthetic jacket in matte charcoal over tech-wear underlayer with visible connector ports; cargo pants with multiple tool pockets and armor plating at knees and hips; worn steel-toed boots with grip soles; minimal jewelry except functional smartwatch on left wrist; no corporate branding, all utility', N'', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cipher_jung');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a646-75a0-aba7-89c3ab4647c3', N'Vivaan Espinoza-Deshpande', N'Vivaan', N'', N'Espinoza-Deshpande', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, works out of a shared fabrication space called The Burrow, near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'VR experience designer and underground filmmaker', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone collective; informal distribution through the Burrow network; has received two anonymous grants he suspects originate from Arcturus but cannot confirm', N'Vivaan Espinoza-Deshpande is lanky and perpetually underslept, with the golden-brown skin of his Ghanaian father''s family and the sharp Armenian nose he got from his grandmother Tamar, which he has decorated with a small bioluminescent stud that pulses faintly blue when he is in deep concentration — a mod he got at sixteen from a friend rather than a professional, which is both charming and slightly crooked. He moves through The Burrow at a half-jog, always carrying something, often mid-sentence with someone across the room. His hair is shaped into two neat puffs that he maintains with obsessive regularity even when the rest of his presentation is in chaos.

He has been making VR experiences since he was fourteen — at first pure technical curiosity, then something more urgent. His work is formally experimental and politically raw: his best-known piece, a forty-minute experience called Φ0.00 that simulates one month of existence at rock-bottom UBC stipend with every sensory detail rendered at maximum fidelity, has been downloaded approximately eighty thousand times across underground distribution channels and has been cited in three separate GLMZ social policy arguments. He did not intend it to be a policy document. He made it because he and his mother lived it for six months when he was twelve and he wanted to know if he could make someone else understand. The answer, apparently, was yes.', N'Window into HPAZ youth culture and politics; potential technical resource for anyone needing VR or documentary work; represents the tension between raw artistic talent and institutional pressure; his secret project may become a significant plot element', N'', N'Bioluminescent nose stud (geneware, cosmetic, informally applied); retinal display overlay in both eyes (practical; secondhand, slightly glitchy — sometimes shows him notifications from the previous owner''s accounts)', N'He sleeps in four-hour blocks whenever the work allows, eats communally at The Burrow when the collective cooks, and spends the rest of his time either in deep production work — headset on, entirely unreachable — or in frantic social mode, pitching ideas to anyone who will listen and consuming other people''s work with indiscriminate hunger. He is currently simultaneously behind on two collaborative projects and ahead of schedule on a personal piece no one knows he is making.', N'GLMZ, Vivaan Espinoza-Deshpande: lanky 178cm tall mixed-heritage man with rich warm medium-brown skin, glowing golden undertones, angular South Asian-influenced cheekbones and facial structure. Dark brown eyes with barely-visible retinal display grid overlay. Two neat dark brown puffs, obsessively maintained. Right nostril: softly blue-pulsing bioluminescent nose stud, slightly crooked. Perpetually sleep-deprived with dark under-eye circles. Wearing oversized patched hoodie, cargo pants, worn synth-leather boots. Blue-black neon ambient lighting reflects off skin and stud. Mid-gesture, intense eye contact, fidgety energy captured mid-motion. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone corporate undercity background, dim industrial glow. Thin frame, restless posture, wired aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Triethnic blend: Hispanic/Latin American (43.8%), South Asian (41.3%), and Sub-Saharan African (14.9%). Features reflect balanced contribution across all three ancestries—South Asian facial structure layered with Hispanic and African warmth. Pan-Diaspora genetic signature.', 178, 62, N'Lanky and angular, with the restless physique of someone who forgets to eat and moves in bursts of frantic energy rather than deliberate stride. Narrow shoulders, long limbs, minimal muscle definition.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Two neat puffs maintained with obsessive care, cleanly shaped', N'Medium', N'Deep brown, with faint retinal display overlay grid visible in both irises under direct light', N'Rich warm medium-brown with golden-bronze undertones—the blend of warm Hispanic and African tones layered over South Asian base creates saturated, dimensional complexion. Deep and luminous rather than olive.', N'Angular face with pronounced cheekbones reflecting South Asian structure softened by broader African heritage influence. Moderately defined jawline with subtle warmth. Nose with South Asian bridge prominence, slightly crooked from informal augmentation application. Perpetually underslept with dark under-eye circles. Warm golden undertones across face intensified by the triethnic blend, with rich depth from Sub-Saharan African heritage creating dimensional, glowing quality. Minimal grooming elsewhere; stark contrast between obsessive hair maintenance and general dishevelment.', N'Bioluminescent nose stud (active, blue-pulsing). Retinal display overlays visible as faint grid patterns in both eyes when lit from certain angles or during eye contact—occasionally flickers with notifications from previous owner''s ghost accounts. Both modifications appear salvaged or informally installed rather than corp-grade.', N'Moves in half-jogs through spaces, always carrying something (tablet, prototype, wiring), perpetually mid-gesture mid-sentence. Rarely still—fidgets with hands when stationary. Leans in intensely during conversation. Body language broadcasts simultaneous excitement and sleep deprivation.', N'Tier 4 working-collective aesthetic: hand-patched oversized hoodies (often with The Burrow''s mark or indie media distribution logos), cargo pants with multiple pockets for tools and drives, worn synth-leather boots. Layers suggest he pulls on whatever is nearest. Occasional color clashes. No corporate branding. Functional rather than fashionable, but with intentional anti-establishment edge. Wears a single faded wristband (possibly handmade, possibly from an old VR collective).', N'The anonymous grants are from Arcturus, and Kwabena actually knows this — he identified the signature in the transfer metadata six months ago. He has not returned the money or told anyone because it has funded his last two projects and he cannot afford to be principled about it and he is ashamed of both things.', N'Fast and dense; shifts between technical VR terminology, HPAZ collective vernacular, and the occasional formal policy phrase absorbed from watching too many social advocacy feeds; uses ''right'' as punctuation', N'Rapid-fire in pitching mode; surprisingly still and deliberate when talking about something that genuinely hurt him', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'vivaan_espinoza_deshpande');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60a-7ffe-a983-8a6ecd0c601a', N'Genji Thammasak-Árnason', N'Genji', N'', N'Thammasak-Árnason', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 71, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — Apartment 4-Foxtrot, above the Deepline Transit node on Kamm''s Landing spur, near Ashland and Division', N'Retired Ferrogate Transit line worker and former union shop steward', N'Kamm''s Landing Tenants'' Council (treasurer); Ferrogate Retired Workers Mutual (pension advocacy); formerly Ferrogate Transit labor union, shop steward for Menomonee Division', N'Genji Thammasak-Árnason is a tall man who has lost some of his height to the years, still broad through the chest, with a jaw like a gray zone bracket and deep-set eyes the color of old teak. His left arm from the elbow down is a working-class prosthetic, dull grey titanium alloy with knuckles worn smooth — a replacement for the arm he lost to a coupling accident on the Ferrogate Menomonee extension in 2171. He never upgraded it because, as he puts it, a fancy arm would mean they''d won something. A Ferrogate ID badge from 2168 hangs from his keychain by habit though it expired decades ago. His face carries the kind of weathering that comes from thirty years on elevated rail platforms in Lake Michigan wind.

He is gregarious and loud and immediately likable, the sort of man who fills a room by breathing in it, who remembers the names of everyone''s children and the coffee order of every regular at his building''s shared kitchen. But beneath the bonhomie is a man who spent twenty years fighting a company that considered him a maintenance expense, and he has never quite stopped being angry about it. He channels the anger into Tenants'' Council meetings and into mentoring younger workers, but it is always there, warm and patient.', N'Labor history source; connector who knows everyone in Kamm''s Landing and most of the Gray Zone; can mobilize tenant resistance or community action; potential quest giver for disputes with Ferrogate or building management corponation proxies', N'', N'Left forearm prosthetic (titanium, basic-grade, worn); nicotine scrubber implant (inactive, he started again anyway); old joint-pain management mesh in both knees', N'Mornings he makes coffee for whoever wanders into the shared kitchen and reads the overnight transit bulletins out of habit; afternoons he runs Tenants'' Council business, argues with building management, and plays card games called Quanta-Flush with three other retirees in the Gray Zone common room.', N'Genji Thammasak-Árnason, 188cm tall retired Ferrogate Transit worker, golden-olive Southeast Asian complexion weathered by decades of Lake Michigan exposure, deep facial lines and high cheekbones, grey cropped hair with dark undertones, dark brown eyes with warm amber undertones. Worn steel-grey work pants, faded thermal undershirt, 2165 Ferrogate Transit company jacket with fraying collar. Dull grey titanium alloy prosthetic left forearm with worn resin palm, moving with mechanical precision. Heavy deep creases in both palms, jagged white scar on left inner forearm, faded Ferrogate Transit tattoo on right shoulder, burn scar on right palm. Posture slightly forward from age and years of manual labor, subtle right-side favoring, economical deliberate movement. Standing in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone dockside platform setting, industrial moody lighting with salt spray weathering in background, subtle mechanical sound emanating from prosthetic arm. Intimate, working-class dignity, worn wedding band, faded Ferrogate ID badge on leather keychain visible in jacket pocket. Cinematic, gritty, atmospheric. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian ancestry (73.1%) with Northern European (19.6%) and East Asian (7.3%) heritage. Features the warm, golden-olive complexion characteristic of Thailand and surrounding regions, with the bone structure reflecting this primary ancestry—prominent cheekbones and strong jaw with subtle East Asian character, softened by the Northern European contribution visible in lighter skin undertones and subtle facial angles.', 188, 89, N'Tall and broad-chested despite age-related shrinkage, still carrying the substantial frame of a man who spent three decades on his feet doing manual labor. Shoulders slightly rounded forward from years of mechanical work posture.', N'Steel grey with dark undertones', N'Cropped short, practical, thinning at the crown', N'Short', N'Dark brown, warm amber undertone', N'Medium golden-olive complexion with warm Southeast Asian depth, weathered to a richer, more uneven patina by decades of Lake Michigan platform exposure. Northern European ancestry adds subtle lighter undertones beneath the dominant warm golden cast.', N'Deeply lined face with pronounced jaw and high cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian ancestry, moderate brow ridge with warmth throughout, permanent wind-crease patterns around the eyes, age spots on temples and cheekbones, heavy stubble shadow even when clean-shaven showing darker pigmentation, skin has a leathery quality from sun and salt spray exposure but retains the characteristic golden-olive warmth of Southeast Asian heritage.', N'Left forearm prosthetic from elbow down: dull grey titanium alloy with surgical-grade resin palm, knuckles worn smooth from decades of use, no chrome plating or aesthetic upgrades — purely functional, basic-grade industrial-spec. The junction at the elbow shows faint scar tissue and occasional microhydraulic seepage staining. The prosthetic moves with slightly audible mechanical precision when he gestures. Knees show no external augmentation but he moves with careful deliberation suggesting internal mesh pain management.', N'Stands with shoulders back despite spinal compression from age, moves deliberately but not slowly — economical motion from a lifetime of knowing where his body is in space. Favors his right side slightly when standing for long periods. Gestures frequently when talking, using the prosthetic arm with unselfconscious fluidity. Leans in when listening, creating immediate intimacy. Walks with a slight roll rather than a true limp, compensating for knee mesh limitations.', N'Tier 3-4 working-class durability wear: heavy canvas work pants in charcoal grey, worn soft but not patched, usually a thermal undershirt in dark colors topped with a faded Ferrogate Transit company jacket from 2165 that he refuses to retire despite the faded logo and fraying collar. Steel-toed boots, well-maintained. A thin zinc-polymer watch on his right wrist from the Ferrogate Retired Workers Mutual. Faded Ferrogate ID badge on a leather keychain in his jacket pocket, never removed. No visible jewelry except a simple platinum wedding band.', N'During the 2178 Menomonee Strike he accepted a secret side payment from a Tessera labor consultant who wanted Ferrogate destabilized for corporate reasons — he used the money to keep the strike fund solvent for six more weeks, which won the workers their safety settlement, but the money was dirty and he has never admitted where it came from. Two workers lost their jobs when Ferrogate suspected an informant and he has always feared they blamed the wrong person.', N'Working-class vernacular; union meeting procedural language mixed into casual conversation; Burundian Swahili and Icelandic loanwords from his grandparents'' generation', N'Loud and rhythmic, like a man used to talking over machinery; pauses for effect rather than uncertainty', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'genji_thammasak_rnason');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a603-7229-8d1f-8acd26195e94', N'Leila Hachemi-Tlemcani-Popescu', N'Leila', N'', N'Hachemi-Tlemcani-Popescu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 42, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, Ironvein district — works at a gym called Foundry Fitness, a no-frills facility above a machine shop, near Damen and Armitage', N'Gym trainer and former competitive athlete', N'Independent — Foundry Fitness; loose ties to the Geartown Trades Association', N'Leila Hachemi-Tlemcani-Popescu is built like a question mark — once a very large man, now a large man who has aged into something more deliberate. He carries the muscle of his competitive years but it''s softened at the edges, and his shoulders have the slight forward curve of someone who has spent too much time bent over injured people and broken equipment. He keeps a short beard, keeps his head shaved, and has a retractable-claw geneware mod on his right hand that he got as a young man when it seemed cool and now views with mild embarrassment — he keeps the claws trimmed short and rarely mentions them. His face is deeply expressive, heavy eyebrows doing most of the work.

Leila Hachemi-Tlemcani-Popescu ran as a competitive strength athlete in his twenties under a Ringo corponation sports sponsorship, which ended badly when he refused to take a Helix-manufactured performance modifier ahead of a sanctioned event and got quietly dropped from the roster. He''s been training civilians and amateur athletes at Foundry for eleven years and genuinely loves the work — the slow process of watching someone find out what their body can do. He is patient to a fault in professional contexts and has almost no patience for bullshit in personal ones. He carries a specific, articulated bitterness toward corporate sports sponsorship that he will tell you about if you give him even a half-opening.', N'Neighborhood stabilizer, moral anchor, indirect connection to corporate sports world. Source of information about Ringo''s sponsorship programs and the dark side of corp-backed athletics. Possible mentor figure.', N'', N'Retractable claw geneware mod, right hand (claws trimmed, rarely deployed). Ringo-era cartilage reinforcement in both knees — he kept the augment when they dropped him, technically a contract gray area he''s never tested. Old spinal microbrace from a competition injury — passive support, no active components.', N'At Foundry by 06:00 for early clients, runs groups until noon, does private sessions afternoons, paperwork and equipment maintenance evenings. Cooks his own food, eats at the gym more often than not.', N'Leila Hachemi-Tlemcani-Popescu, 188cm tall muscular male coach in his early forties, shaved head, dark brown eyes, warm medium-brown skin with olive undertones blending North African, Middle Eastern, and Eastern European heritage. Salt-and-pepper trimmed beard, weathered face with prominent cheekbones and deep-set eyes. Worn black Foundry Fitness hoodie over plain t-shirt, reinforced cargo pants, old resoled training shoes. Standing in industrial gym setting with equipment visible, slight forward shoulder curve from decades of lifting, economical posture, callused hands at rest. Faint burn scar visible on left shoulder. GLMZ industrial facility lighting, moody and focused, real texture and honest wear on clothing. Morning light through warehouse windows. Serious, composed expression. Cinematic, character portrait style. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'North African (43.5%), Middle Eastern (31.2%), and Eastern European (25.3%) — a Mediterranean-Levantine blend creating warm medium-brown skin with subtle olive and golden undertones. The combination produces balanced facial geometry with stronger angular features, a distinctive Maghrebi-Levantine presence with Eastern European bone structure depth.', 188, 104, N'Heavy, muscular frame with softened edges — the physique of a former elite strength athlete now in his early forties. Broad shoulders with a slight forward curve from years of coaching and equipment work. Chest and upper back still heavily muscled; lower body shows proportional but less defined mass. No visible fat deposit, but the sharp definition of his competitive years has mellowed into solid, functional density.', N'Black', N'Shaved head, maintained with precision', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown', N'Warm medium brown with olive undertones — weathered and sun-exposed from years of outdoor training and work. The North African and Middle Eastern ancestry creates natural depth and richness across the complexion, with Eastern European ancestry contributing subtle cool undertones in facial structure.', N'Expressive face with balanced angular geometry — prominent cheekbones and defined jawline characteristic of Maghrebi and Levantine heritage, refined by Eastern European bone structure creating classical depth. Thick, pronounced eyebrows set low over deep-set dark brown eyes. Close-trimmed salt-and-pepper beard kept at roughly 5mm, darkening the lower face. Skin shows the texture of someone who has spent decades in physical labor and outdoor conditions — not scarred, but weathered with character. Three faint horizontal lines across his forehead from years of intense concentration during lifts and coaching.', N'Right hand bears retractable claw geneware — currently trimmed to blunt, functional length and visually indistinguishable from normal fingernails unless deployed. The installation point at the palm is a faint whitish line. Knees show no external augmentation markers but move with deliberate, controlled mechanics suggesting internal reinforcement. Otherwise no visible chrome or external augmentation.', N'Moves with deliberate efficiency — economical, no wasted motion. Standing posture shows the slight forward shoulder curve from decades of loaded lifting and coaching posture. When focused on another person (coaching or listening), his entire body angles toward them; his eyebrows do most of his emotional communication. Walks flat-footed, grounded. Hands often at rest at his sides or engaged in small, precise movements (adjusting equipment, demonstrating form). Rarely fidgets. When tired, the forward curve becomes more pronounced.', N'Strictly functional, Tier 3-4 practical. Black or dark gray athletic wear — worn Foundry Fitness hoodies (faded logo), plain t-shirts, reinforced cargo pants with heavy pockets. Worn leather work belt. Old training shoes (usually Ringo-era branded athletic footwear he''s kept from his sponsorship days, now resoled multiple times). No jewelry, no visible personal grooming beyond maintenance. Clothes show honest wear — stains from equipment oil, fraying at cuffs — but are clean and maintained. Everything is built to survive heavy work.', N'Three of the athletes who took the Ringo-Helix modifier during his sponsorship era have since developed progressive neurological symptoms. He has been in quiet contact with two of them for years. He has a file. He doesn''t know who to give it to or whether giving it to anyone would help or just hurt them more.', N'Direct, body-focused, coaches through sensation rather than theory. Albanian-Lingala family idioms surface when emotional. Doesn''t use much slang — speaks like someone who learned communication as a professional tool.', N'Steady and measured in professional mode, picks up speed and sharpness when something makes him angry or when he''s excited about a client''s progress.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'leila_hachemi_tlemcani_popescu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72e-71fd-b16d-8adc15972df4', N'Enitan Traoré-Sokolov-Kariuki', N'Enitan', N'', N'Traoré-Sokolov-Kariuki', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station — Line 9 operations hub, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Ferrogate Transit tram operator, Line 9 (Geartown to Meridian Core)', N'Ferrogate Transit; Ferrogate Transit Workers Collective (union rep)', N'Enitan Traoré-Sokolov-Kariuki is lean and angular, the kind of person who looks like she was built for efficiency rather than comfort — high cheekbones, close-set amber eyes with patterned irises she had done in a sunburst design in her twenties (the pattern has faded slightly at the edges but she has not refreshed it, which she considers a form of autobiography). Her skin is a warm medium brown and she keeps her locs pinned back under her operator''s cap on shift; off shift they fall to her shoulders and she wears them down with the aggressive relief of someone who spends eight hours in a hat. She has a geneware tail — a slim, black-furred addition she got at twenty-two — that she has learned to keep disciplined and still while operating but which betrays her moods with embarrassing fidelity the moment she is off duty.

Enitan Traoré-Sokolov-Kariuki has the particular personality of someone who has driven the same route for nine years and has achieved a kind of zen mastery over the repetition — she finds the variation inside the sameness, the way a musician finds different things in a familiar song each time. She is sardonic in the way of someone who has heard every possible excuse for fare evasion and has developed a taxonomy of them. She is fiercely protective of her passengers in a detached, professional way that occasionally shocks people who expect indifference. She is a union rep for the Ferrogate Transit Workers Collective and takes that role with more seriousness than she takes almost anything else.', N'Mobile information source and city-wide connector — she has seen every district on her line and knows the rhythms of who travels when and why; can be a reliable transit for players moving through the city, a union-related quest hook, or a witness to something she saw from the cab', N'', N'Patterned irises (sunburst, faded); geneware tail (slim, black-furred); neural interface jack at the base of the skull for tram systems integration (occupational standard issue)', N'Runs two nine-hour shifts weekly plus three shorter supplemental shifts, uses layover time at Deepwell to handle union correspondence, spends days off at a sparring gym in Geartown and sleeping with dedicated intensity.', N'Enitan Traoré-Sokolov-Kariuki, a 172cm lean-built transit operator with warm deep brown skin blended from Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, Hispanic/Latin American, Middle Eastern, Southeast Asian, and Indigenous American ancestry; high prominent cheekbones, slightly widened eye shape, amber irises with faded sunburst geneware pattern, dark shoulder-length locs pinned under grey operator''s cap; small temple scar visible; black-furred geneware tail curled behind, neural jack port at skull base; wearing grey Ferrogate Transit uniform with black polymer utility jacket and reflective striping, union badge on collar; union gear tattoo on inner wrist; upright economical posture, hands at rest; standing in neon-lit transit station with blue-green overhead lighting, faint holographic departure boards reflected in polished floor, tired but focused expression; GLMZ, working-class aesthetic, professional dignity; --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora global blend: Sub-Saharan African (33.8%) provides rich deep brown base with warm undertones; Eastern European (30.4%) adds pale undertone complexity and facial structure definition; Hispanic/Latin American (10.6%), Middle Eastern (10.1%), Southeast Asian (9.3%), and Indigenous American (5.8%) layer in olive warmth, subtle facial feature blending, and eye shape variation. Result: warm deep brown skin with golden-olive undertones, high prominent cheekbones with strong African-Latin definition, eye shape widened slightly by Southeast Asian heritage, even complexion reflecting genuine global ancestry', 172, 58, N'Lean and angular with defined musculature from years of postural control and gym work; economical movement suggests someone built for precision rather than power', N'Dark brown with natural graying at temples', N'Locs typically pinned back under operator''s cap during shifts; worn loose and falling to shoulders off-duty', N'Shoulder-length', N'Amber with faded sunburst iris pattern (custom geneware, applied in her twenties, pattern edges now worn)', N'Warm deep brown with golden and subtle olive undertones, weathered around the eyes from nine years of focused attention; reflects blended Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, Hispanic/Latin American, Middle Eastern, Southeast Asian, and Indigenous American ancestry', N'High, prominent cheekbones with strong definition from African-Latin ancestry; warm even tone with subtle olive undertones from Middle Eastern and Southeast Asian heritage; eye shape shows slight wideness characteristic of Southeast Asian genetics; defined jawline reflects Eastern European contribution; minimal facial hair; skin shows professional care but no vanity augmentation', N'Slim black-furred geneware tail (approximately 90cm, tapered) visible when not controlled; faint neural interface jack port visible at base of skull where hair parts; amber irises with visible pattern overlay; no obvious chrome or plating', N'Upright, economical posture with hands frequently at rest position — practiced neutrality offset by tail betraying genuine emotional state the moment she relaxes; movements are efficient and deliberate; walks with slight forward lean as if perpetually bracing', N'On-shift: grey Ferrogate Transit standard-issue operator uniform with union rep badge on collar; black polymer utility jacket with reflective striping. Off-shift: worn combat-style pants, fitted athletic shirts, heavy-soled boots suitable for sparring gym; minimal jewelry except union wrist mark. Tier 3-4 working class aesthetic — functional, maintained but not fashionable, pockets optimized for tools and union materials', N'Six months ago she saw something from the tram cab — a body disposal in a Ferrogate maintenance corridor at 0340 — and filed nothing. She told herself she was not certain. She is certain. She thinks about it on every night run.', N'Clipped, functional, professionally neutral on duty; off duty shifts to dryer and more expressive with flashes of Zulu-Russian slang inherited from her family', N'Short declarative sentences, efficient — wastes no words; speeds up when passionate about union issues', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'enitan_traor_sokolov_kariuki');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5bb-7409-9d69-8ade0a0e1251', N'Akira Lindström', N'Akira', N'', N'Lindström', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 40, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Overhang — residential shelves built onto megastructure exteriors, near Halsted and Division', N'Social engineering and negotiation specialist — face', N'Independent — works solo contracts', N'Akira Lindström is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 40, he has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate him once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — thermal masking system — body heat signature can be suppressed or spoofed — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left him with skills and night terrors in equal measure. He works as a face out of The Overhang, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Akira Lindström describe him as a precision instrument — point him at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Aybek Herrera-Kyei represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Thermal masking system — body heat signature can be suppressed or spoofed. Move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon platform', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Akira Lindström, 178cm tall, stocky heavyweight fighter''s build with broad shoulders and narrow waist. Deep warm tan skin with golden and reddish undertones reflecting South Asian (43.9%), Northern European (23.8%), Pacific Islander (12.6%), North African (10.6%), and Sub-Saharan African (7%) heritage blend. Strong South Asian bone structure with full cheekbones, defined browridges, straight nose with warm undertones, squared jaw. Dark brown hair graying at temples, short and swept back. Deep brown eyes with constant threat-assessment scan. Thin surgical scar from left temple to jawline. Three deliberate electrical burn marks on right forearm. Scarred knuckles from bare-knuckle violence. Stubble at 1-2 days growth. Worn, weathered face with hard angles and squint lines. Faint luminescent micro-circuitry visible beneath skin across chest and upper back in geometric patterns. Subdermal striations along spine visible during movement. Wearing charcoal tactical pants with reinforced pockets, black compression shirt under worn gray canvas overshirt with utility pockets and rolled sleeves. Matte black steel-toed boots. Heavy analog watch on left wrist. Light gray military-grade neural-dampening jacket. Controlled, predatory posture in combat-ready neutral stance. GLMZ, GLMZ setting, cool blue-gray neon ambient lighting casting sharp shadows, industrial background, expression of focused intensity --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Overhang', N'local', N'The Overhang', N'South Asian dominant (43.9%) with significant Northern European (23.8%), Pacific Islander (12.6%), North African (10.6%), and Sub-Saharan African (7.0%) ancestry, plus minor Indigenous American (2.1%) admixture. This creates a striking Pan-Diaspora phenotype — warm South Asian bone structure and coloration blended with Northern European height and build, Pacific Islander richness, and North African depth.', 178, 94, N'Stocky and solid, compact muscle density with a heavyweight fighter''s frame — broad shoulders tapering to a narrow waist. Hands are large and calloused, with scarred knuckles. Chest and forearms show pronounced muscle definition.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples', N'Short, swept back, minimal styling', N'Short', N'Deep brown', N'Warm deep tan with golden and reddish undertones — the predominant South Asian ancestry creates a naturally warm base enriched by North African and Pacific Islander heritage, cooled subtly by Northern European influence. Weathered and resilient, maintains depth year-round.', N'Strong South Asian bone structure with full cheekbones and defined browridges; straight to slightly broad nose with warm undertones. Squared jaw carries Northern European influence. Pacific Islander heritage adds richness and depth to skin coloration. Face is worn but not aged — hard angles accentuated by the blend of South and North African bone architecture. Lines around the eyes from years of squinting. Stubble perpetually at 1-2 days growth. Skin texture shows weathering but maintains underlying resilience. No cosmetic grooming; functional appearance only.', N'Thermal masking system visible as a faint network of luminescent micro-circuitry beneath the skin across the chest and upper back, most visible when ambient light is low. The circuitry runs in geometric patterns along the clavicle and deltoids. Move-by-wire neural integration visible as subtle subdermal striations along the spine when he moves — the muscle control is unnaturally precise, almost mechanical in its efficiency. No chrome limbs; all augmentation is internal or subcutaneous.', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders relaxed but ready. Moves with controlled efficiency — no wasted motion. Combat stance is his neutral. Eyes constantly scan — threat assessment is automatic. Handshakes are firm but measured, never aggressive. When focused on a target, he becomes perfectly still, predatory.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear — charcoal tactical pants with reinforced thigh pockets, black compression shirt layered under a worn gray canvas overshirt with utility pockets and rolled sleeves. Matte black steel-toed boots, well-maintained. Heavy watch on left wrist (analog, no smart features — redundancy is safety). Light gray neural-dampening jacket (non-branded, military-grade) draped over a chair or worn open. Everything is neutral, durable, and designed for quick movement. No logos, no status signifiers — complete functional anonymity.', N'Aybek Herrera-Kyei witnessed a massacre during a corporate dispute and has evidence stored in a dead drop. Publishing it would expose powerful people. Keeping it is leverage and liability.', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'akira_lindstr_m');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f9-7bce-bc4e-8af3094f3073', N'Freya Srisai-Holm', N'Freya', N'', N'Srisai-Holm', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'University Spine, Edgewater Prism, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Data archaeologist specializing in pre-Collapse urban memory systems', N'University Spine — Department of Urban Memory Studies, occasional contract work for Axiom Heritage Division', N'Freya Srisai-Holm is a heavyset woman with deep amber skin and close-cropped silver hair she has never bothered to dye or modify, wearing it like a credential. Her eyes have patterned irises — concentric rings of copper and black, a cheap cosmetic mod she got at thirty-two and has never removed, though she insists she bought them for a reason she can no longer remember. She dresses in layered archival fabrics that always smell faintly of ozone from the scanning rigs she operates, and her hands bear the yellowish calluses of someone who handles physical storage media the way other people handle broken glass — with reverence and terror in equal measure.

She is the kind of academic who makes grad students feel simultaneously inspired and vaguely ashamed of themselves. She does not raise her voice, does not perform authority, but carries an absolute certainty in the importance of her work that functions as its own gravity. She excavates the digital ruins beneath GLMZ''s foundations — the dead servers, the corrupted municipal archives, the ghost-logs of neighborhoods that were demolished to build the Gray Zone — and she speaks of the data the way a forensic pathologist speaks of bodies: with precise, unsentimental tenderness.', N'Quest giver and information source — she possesses fragments of pre-Collapse city records that other parties want, and she is cautious about who she shares them with. She can also authenticate data artifacts and identify forgeries, making her valuable to anyone dealing in historical information.', N'', N'Patterned copper-ring irises (cosmetic). Neural data-indexing implant (low-grade, Tier 2 model) that allows her to cross-reference archival records in real time. Chronic joint inflammation in her right hand has been partially managed by a rudimentary biofeedback sleeve she wears under her coat.', N'She arrives at her lab before dawn to run overnight extraction processes, spends midday teaching one seminar she genuinely enjoys and two she tolerates, and spends evenings in the sub-basement scanning rooms with graduate students who have learned not to speak unless she speaks first.', N'Freya Srisai-Holm, fifty-year-old data archaeologist, 2226 GLMZ near-future megacity setting. Compact, broad-shouldered heavyset frame, 168cm tall, silver-grey close-cropped hair. Striking mixed-heritage features: warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones blending Northern European, Southeast Asian, Eastern European, South Asian, Indigenous American, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. High cheekbones, structured jawline, subtle epicanthic eye shape variation. Most distinctive: patterned copper-and-black concentric ring irises, cybernetic augmentation catching and fragmenting light unnaturally. Fine creases around eyes and mouth, faint lab scar above left eyebrow, yellow-brown chemical staining on hands, pale burn scar on right forearm. Wearing layered archival-grade fabrics in charcoal, rust, and deep indigo; heavy reinforced canvas coat, fitted base layers, steel-toed boots. Faded corrupted-QR-code tattoo on left wrist next to mechanical hand-wound watch. Subtle biofeedback sleeve texture visible under right forearm. Basement archive lighting—fluorescent wash and warm practical work-light, ozone chemical atmosphere. Posture: precise, economical movement, slight left-side favor, careful deliberate hand gestures, focused concentration expression. Analog and augmented hybrid—no corporate status markers, deliberately unfashionable functional clothing. GLMZ 2200s archival noir aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'University Spine', N'local', N'University Spine', N'Deeply mixed diaspora ancestry: 40.5% Northern European (Scandinavian baseline), 18.2% Southeast Asian, 15% Eastern European, 11.8% Indigenous American, 10.5% South Asian, and 4% Sub-Saharan African. Her genetic heritage manifests as a striking phenotypic blend—high cheekbones and structured jawline from Northern European and Southeast Asian ancestry, warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones reflecting the full spectrum of her mixed heritage, and subtle eye shape variations that suggest the complex interplay of four continental lineages.', 168, 87, N'Heavyset, broad-shouldered, substantial frame that reads as solid rather than soft — the build of someone who has spent five decades moving through the world without apology. Her weight is distributed across a compact, sturdy structure; she moves like ballast.', N'Natural silver-grey', N'Close-cropped, practical, no styling beyond the cut itself', N'Short', N'Patterned irises with concentric copper and black rings; the pupil sits at the center of a target. Sclera slightly yellowed from decades of screen exposure.', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and olive undertones—a harmonious blend reflecting her Northern European, Southeast Asian, Eastern European, South Asian, Indigenous American, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Darkened further by chronic ozone exposure and sun damage, her complexion carries subtle golden notes and a faint chemical patina from decades of archival material handling.', N'Fine creases around the eyes and mouth reflecting fifty years of focused concentration and squinting at screens and degraded documents. Her facial structure shows the blended architecture of her mixed ancestry—prominent cheekbones with subtle Southeast Asian eye shape variation, structured jawline with breadth from Northern European heritage, and a nose bridge reflecting the convergence of South Asian and Eastern European traditions. A small scar above her left eyebrow, almost invisible, from a lab accident in her thirties. Her skin bears the weathering of someone who has spent her life in basements and archives rather than sunlight.', N'The patterned copper-ring irises are immediately visible and slightly uncanny under direct light; they catch and fragment light in a way organic irises do not. She wears a discreet biofeedback sleeve on her right forearm under her outer layer — a thin, fabric-integrated interface that shows as a subtle texture variation in her sleeve if her arm is visible. The neural data-indexing implant is subcutaneous and invisible, though occasionally her eyes will lose focus for a half-second when she''s actively querying it.', N'She moves with economic precision — no wasted motion, but not rigid. She favors her left side slightly, protecting her chronically inflamed right hand. When sitting, she settles into a chair like someone familiar with long hours; her posture is upright but not tense, suggesting long-developed spinal discipline. Her hands move carefully, deliberately, the hands of an archaeologist. She has a habit of pausing mid-gesture while accessing her neural implant.', N'Layered archival-grade fabrics in muted tones — charcoal, rust, deep indigo — textured materials that age gracefully and don''t show stains. Her outer layer is always a heavy canvas or linen coat, often with reinforced pockets. Underneath, fitted base layers and a secondary vest or tunic. Her clothing carries a faint chemical smell of ozone and preservation compound. No corporate branding, no Φ-tier status markers. Everything is functional, well-maintained, and approximately fifteen years out of fashion — not by neglect, but by deliberate refusal. She wears steel-toed boots suitable for lab work and basement navigation. A cloth watch on her left wrist with a hand-wound mechanism — older than cybernetics, more reliable.', N'She discovered three years ago that a specific data cache she excavated contains evidence that Axiom deliberately caused a residential flood in the Hough Reclamation zone in 2187 to clear land. She has told no one and has been sitting on it, paralyzed between fear and obligation.', N'Precise academic register with occasional Ossetian-inflected idioms. Uses technical archival terminology naturally in casual speech. Rarely uses contractions.', N'Measured, slightly slow — she speaks as though she is selecting words from a catalogue and checking them before use.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'freya_srisai_holm');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66c-7d78-8dc0-8b261cd6d934', N'Dagbjort Jitpakdee', N'Dagbjort', N'', N'Jitpakdee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone — the Ironbody Cooperative, second floor of a reclaimed factory building, near Michigan Ave and Oak', N'Gym trainer and boxing instructor, community fitness cooperative', N'Ironbody Cooperative — Highland Park Autonomous Zone community institution', N'Dagbjort Jitpakdee is built like someone who decided what she was going to be and then spent twenty years becoming it — wide through the shoulders, with forearms that look carved, and a jaw that suggests she has never backed down from anything that didn''t have a very good reason to ask. Her skin is very dark and very smooth except for the scar tissue along her left cheekbone from a fight she doesn''t discuss and the chevron pattern of elective scarification across both shoulders that echoes her grandmother''s ceremonial markings, done at a body modification studio in Geartown with deliberate care. Her hair is kept in tight plaits close to her skull. She has retractable reinforced knuckle implants — the only chrome on her body, practical not cosmetic, and she got them after the third time she broke her hand hitting something harder than she should have.

The Ironbody Cooperative runs on a sliding scale: you pay what you can, you work what you owe in facility maintenance if you can''t, and you don''t cause problems for other members or you leave. Dagbjort Jitpakdee runs it with two other trainers and a rotating volunteer roster. She teaches children''s boxing on Tuesday and Thursday mornings, adult conditioning circuits five days a week, and one private session per week with whoever needs it most — she charges more for the private sessions with people who can afford it and uses that margin to subsidize the cooperative''s equipment costs. She believes, with the ferocity of someone who was saved by it, that physical discipline is the most democratic thing a person can practice.', N'Community defender and moral voice. A source of physical training resources for characters who need conditioning. Represents the HPAZ''s spirit of collective self-reliance. Can provide safe harbor, reliable muscle if circumstances demand it, and a sharp ethical perspective.', N'', N'Retractable reinforced knuckle plating (functional, not cosmetic). Elective scarification (non-augmentation body modification).', N'Up at 0500 for her own training, opens the cooperative at 0630, teaches back-to-back sessions until early afternoon, spends evenings doing equipment maintenance or attending Highland Park community meetings.', N'Dagbjort Jitpakdee, tall athletic woman with Southeast Asian-dominant blended heritage, medium-deep golden-brown skin with warm undertones, dark brown eyes with subtle warmth, high cheekbones and strong squared jawline with slight epicanthic eye shape. Black cornrow plaits pulled back from face. Raised scar across left cheekbone, ceremonial chevron scarification across shoulders. Muscular defined shoulders and forearms, metallic knuckle plating visible on relaxed hands. Wearing fitted moisture-wicking compression shirt with Ironbody Cooperative logo, cargo training pants, worn athletic sneakers. Quiet intensity and composed presence, shoulders back in confident neutral posture. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon and cool LED lighting casting slight shadows across her features, industrial gym or training facility background, cinematic depth of field --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (55.2%) with substantial South Asian (30.3%) and East Asian (11.4%) ancestry, plus minor Hispanic/Latin American heritage (3.1%). The genetic blend creates a striking fusion: Southeast Asian bone structure and facial width form the foundation, enriched by South Asian golden warmth and depth, with East Asian refinement in eye shape and subtle facial geometry. This is the living expression of the Ubiquitous Diaspora—a harmonious synthesis across continental boundaries.', 178, 82, N'Athletic and broad-shouldered with dense musculature developed through deliberate training. Wide through the chest and back, tapering to a narrow waist. Forearms show pronounced muscular definition. No excess body fat.', N'Black, natural', N'Tight cornrow plaits, pulled back close to the scalp', N'Medium (plaits extend 8-10cm from scalp)', N'Dark brown with subtle warm undertones', N'Medium-deep golden-brown with warm, radiant undertones. The depth reflects Southeast Asian heritage while the golden luminosity carries South Asian warmth. Even, rich tone across face and body with visible vitality.', N'Smooth, well-maintained skin with striking facial definition. High, prominent cheekbones and strong squared jawline characteristic of Southeast Asian genetics. Slight epicanthic eye shape and refined facial proportions reflect East Asian heritage. South Asian warmth visible across the nasal bridge and cheekbones, creating subtle dimension. Expression carries quiet intensity and composed presence.', N'Retractable reinforced knuckle plating on both hands — visible as subtle metallic ridge patterns across the knuckles when hands are relaxed, fully concealed when fists are clenched. No other visible chrome or implants.', N'Carries herself with the settled confidence of someone comfortable in her own strength. Stands with shoulders back and spine neutral. Moves with economical, purposeful motions — no wasted energy. When teaching, presence expands; when listening, she goes still.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear: fitted athletic tank or moisture-wicking long-sleeve compression shirt (often with Ironbody Cooperative logo). Cargo pants or stretchy training trousers with functional pockets. Worn but well-maintained sneakers (usually Reebok or similar mid-range athletic brand). Minimal jewelry — a simple woven bracelet, possibly some personal token. Callused hands, short functional nails. Overall aesthetic: someone who dresses for function and movement, not display.', N'One of her regular adult students is a Ferrogate Transit middle manager she knows is feeding information about HPAZ activity patterns to the transit authority''s security division. She has not confronted them because she is not sure what she would do. She is getting closer to sure.', N'Blunt, action-oriented, no softening language. Mixes Nigerian English cadences with HPAZ community dialect. Technical about the body — very specific about muscles, form, breath.', N'Declarative. Short sentences when teaching. Longer, slower sentences when she''s thinking something through out loud, which she does rarely.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dagbjort_jitpakdee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a669-7ff2-a3b4-8b3f7a95fdc7', N'Arden Olofsson-Magnúsdóttir', N'Arden', N'', N'Olofsson-Magnúsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 33, NULL, 30, 1, N'active', N'The Narrows, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Fixer - Social engineering', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'GLMZ operative portrait: Brisa Olofsson-Magnúsdóttir, 168cm lean athletic woman with deep warm golden-mahogany skin tone, Southeast Asian facial structure with high cheekbones and natural monolids, full lips. Black box braids pulled into high crown knot with silver threading at temples. Deep brown analytical eyes. Thin precise scar running left jawline to ear. Wearing fitted dark Sekitani turtleneck, tailored charcoal cargo pants, matte black reinforced shoes, vintage buffalo leather jacket with real patina. Simple stainless steel chronometer on left wrist. Subtle faint burn marks visible on palms suggesting subcutaneous neural augmentation. Seated with perfect posture, hands visible on table, monitoring expression. Professional operative aesthetic. Cool industrial lighting with warm accent on face highlighting skin undertones, moody Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone interior, neon reflection off leather jacket. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (64.1%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (19.2%) and Northern European (13.5%) ancestry, creating a striking pan-continental blend. Southeast Asian bone structure dominates with warm Sub-Saharan African undertones deepening the overall warmth, while Northern European genetics provide subtle cool counterpoints in skin undertones and eye geometry.', 168, 62, N'Athletic and lean with defined shoulders; moves with deliberate economy. No wasted motion.', N'Natural black with silver threading at temples', N'Box braids pulled into a high crown knot, practical and intimidating', N'Medium (braids fall to mid-back when loose)', N'Deep brown with natural monolid geometry from Southeast Asian ancestry, alert and analytical', N'Deep warm golden-brown with rich mahogany undertones from the Southeast Asian-Sub-Saharan African blend, cooled subtly by Northern European genetics creating complex depth', N'Clear skin with high, defined cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, full lips set in a neutral expression. Deep warm golden-mahogany undertones across warm-toned features. A thin scar traces from left jaw to ear—old, deliberate, never regretted.', N'None visible. Her augmentations are deep—subcutaneous neural array for lie detection and microexpression reading, internal subvocal mic, distributed haptic feedback nodes. Only the faint telltale palmar scarring suggests enhancement.', N'Sits with spine straight, always positioned to see exits. Hands rest visible on table or lap—never hidden. Moves between stillness and sudden precision; no fidgeting. Speaks from a centered diaphragm. Eyes track micro-movements in conversation partners.', N'Tier 3 refined casual: fitted dark turtleneck (Sekitani brand, brushed synthetic), tailored charcoal cargo pants with hidden pockets, matte black reinforced shoes (non-descript, practical). A worn leather jacket over everything—buffalo leather, pre-2200s, patina that speaks of real use. No jewelry except a simple stainless steel chronometer on her left wrist. Aesthetic is ''professional operative who doesn''t need to advertise.''', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arden_olofsson_magn_sd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62e-7e75-8084-8bb67a1f7b88', N'Edmundo Petelo-Faalele-Tofauti', N'Edmundo', N'', N'Petelo-Faalele-Tofauti', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 35, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Rookery — dense vertical housing, gang-controlled, near Halsted and Division', N'Prototype theft and corporate tech acquisition — tech retriever', N'Semi-independent — recurring contracts with mid-tier fixers', N'Edmundo Petelo-Faalele-Tofauti is compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 35, she has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate her once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rin — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Her entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. She works as a tech retriever out of The Rookery, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Edmundo Petelo-Faalele-Tofauti describe her as a precision instrument — point her at a problem and get out of the way.', N'As a tech retriever, Ilhan Sandstrom-Badu embodies the tension between independence and isolation. She is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rings. Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Edmundo Petelo-Faalele-Tofauti, 162cm tall, compact and densely muscled figure with low center of gravity, broad shoulders tapering to narrow waist. Medium deep warm skin tone with rich bronze-gold luminosity and multi-layered undertones from Pacific Islander, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Middle Eastern and Hispanic heritage. Striking angular face with high prominent cheekbones, strong defined jawline, faint surgical scar from left temple to cheekbone, dark brown hair with copper undertones pulled back in tight functional steel-wire secured braid. Cybernetic eyes with chrome iris rings and faint blue-green LED glow. Visible metallic threading around elbows and knees from hydraulic joint augmentations. Dark tactical utilitarian clothing: matte-black reinforced synth-weave jacket, charcoal compression undershirt, dark gray cargo pants with magnetic tool fasteners, steel-toed boots. Faded silver pendant visible at neckline. Coiled posture, economical precise movement, weight balanced on balls of feet. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody neon-lit industrial setting, cool blue and amber accent lighting, mechanical precision in every gesture, ready stance. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Rookery', N'local', N'The Rookery', N'Edmundo''s ancestry is a striking Pacific Islander foundation (56.8%) creating warm, luminous melanin with golden undertones, substantially deepened by Sub-Saharan African heritage (9.9%) that adds richness and defined bone structure. South Asian ancestry (17.4%) contributes the prominent, high cheekbones and distinctive eye shape. Middle Eastern (9.9%) and Hispanic/Latin American (6.0%) heritage layer additional warmth and undertone complexity throughout. The result is a medium-to-deep warm complexion with bronze-gold fusion and sophisticated multi-layered undertones — distinctly Polynesian-influenced with South Asian definition and African depth.', 162, 68, N'Compact and densely muscled, low center of gravity with broad shoulders tapering to a narrow waist. Built for impact absorption and explosive movement rather than reach — every visible muscle has definition but not bulk.', N'Dark brown with natural copper undertones', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid secured with steel wire', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Chrome iris rings surrounding dark brown natural eyes — thermal and low-light augmentation visible as faint LED glow in dim conditions', N'Warm deep-medium tone with rich bronze-gold luminosity, substantial melanin depth from Pacific Islander and Sub-Saharan ancestry, golden undertones dominant throughout, South Asian warmth in the mid-face creating cheekbone radiance, subtle warmth from Hispanic/Latin heritage layering chromatic depth. Skin appears luminous and multitonal rather than matte.', N'Striking, angular face with high, prominent cheekbones reflecting Pacific Islander, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan ancestry, strong defined jawline with warm undertones, and rich bronze-gold complexion across the full face. The skin around the cybernetic eye sockets shows faint surgical lines and subtle chrome seepage. Grooming is functional and precise — no jewelry, no cosmetics.', N'Cybernetic eyes with chrome iris rings and faint blue-green luminescence in low light. Hydraulic joint articulation visible at the elbows and knees — the skin around these points shows subtle metallic threading and occasional micro-hydraulic fluid weeping. When she moves quickly, the joints emit a soft, precise hissing sound.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, no flourish. Stands with weight balanced on the balls of her feet, ready to shift instantly. Resting posture is coiled rather than relaxed. Eyes track targets with mechanical smoothness. When engaging, her movements are sharp and deliberate, powered by the hydraulic augmentations.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian: matte-black reinforced synth-weave tactical jacket with hidden pocket architecture, form-fitted to avoid snagging. Underneath, charcoal compression undershirt with integrated cooling channels. Cargo pants in dark gray with reinforced stitching and magnetic tool fasteners at the thighs. Steel-toed boots with grip-enhanced soles — no logos, all function. A single item of visible non-utility clothing: a faded silver pendant worn under the shirt, just visible at the neckline.', N'Ilhan Sandstrom-Badu maintains a second identity — a completely clean civilian persona with a lease, a job history, and a social profile. It''s their exit strategy.', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'edmundo_petelo_faalele_tofauti');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62e-7d83-b5b3-8bef5cba3a9b', N'Halil Tran', N'Halil', N'', N'Tran', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Garret, Edgewater Prism — studio apartment doubling as a server-farm edit suite, near Lincoln and Addison', N'VR experience designer and underground filmmaker', N'Independent; Tessera has made acquisition inquiries they''ve declined; loosely connected to the Edgewater Prism underground distribution network', N'Halil Tran has the look of someone who has spent twenty years in dim rooms making worlds: slightly stooped, with the particular forward tilt of someone perpetually leaning toward a screen. Their heritage shows in striking combinations — their mother was Senegalese-Portuguese, their father Turkish-Kazakh — and the result is a face of remarkable planes and angles, currently framed by color-shifting hair they keep at chin length and set to a slow cycle of deep indigo fading to rust. They have bioluminescent patches on the back of both hands, faint constellations they got at thirty as a deadline gift to themselves, and wear them with the unselfconsciousness of someone who forgets they''re there until someone asks.

They are known in the underground circuit as the person who makes VR experiences that feel like memories — not entertainment, but something more troubling and intimate. Their last piece, an unlicensed work called ''Grandmother''s House Is Underwater Now,'' circulated through pirate distribution nodes for six months before a Tessera subsidiary attempted to acquire it. Halil Tran refused and disappeared the masters. They are professionally warm and personally evasive, with the quality of someone who asks questions far more interesting than anything they''re willing to say about themselves.', N'Information source about the underground media circuit; quest giver when their work unintentionally captures something dangerous; their pirated distribution network is a conduit for more than art', N'', N'Bioluminescent patches on dorsal hands (faint constellation pattern); neural jack for direct VR editing interface (left temple); color-shifting hair (indigo-to-rust slow cycle)', N'Rarely distinguishes day from night; runs the edit suite in cycles of obsessive work and total collapse; attends underground screenings twice monthly as audience as much as peer', N'Halil Tran, a lean 168cm tall person of mixed Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic/Latin American heritage, skin deep warm brown with golden undertones, dark circles under eyes, fine-boned face with high cheekbones and angular jaw blended with broader African features. Color-shifting chin-length hair cycling between deep indigo and rust-copper. Hunched forward posture as if reaching toward hidden screen. Wearing loose worn black tech-weave shirt, grey cargo pants, faded grey-brown leather jacket, battered AR glasses pushed up in hair. Neural jack visible as dark metallic port at left temple. Bioluminescent constellation patterns glowing softly on dorsal hands (Cassiopeia and Orion) in low studio lighting. Restless hands making subtle gesture-commands. Dark dystopian GLMZ studio environment with low ambient light, tech clutter, glow of interface artifacts. Cinematic noir aesthetic with blue-white bioluminescence accent lighting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Garret', N'local', N'The Garret', N'Southeast Asian dominant (55.2%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (27.7%) and Hispanic/Latin American (17.1%) ancestry. Complex phenotype reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: warm medium to deep brown skin tone with golden and reddish undertones from the blending of Southeast Asian, African, and Latin American genetics; facial structure combines Southeast Asian cheekbone prominence with broader African facial geometry and Latin American features, creating a striking cosmopolitan appearance. The particular pallor of someone who works in low light creates a muted overlay on the underlying warmth.', 168, 62, N'Lean and slightly stooped, with the particular forward curve of someone who has spent decades hunched over interfaces. Narrow shoulders, long fingers adapted to precision work, minimal muscle definition but wiry rather than frail.', N'Color-shifting — cycles slowly between deep indigo and rust-copper tones', N'Chin-length, straight to slightly wavy, often pulled to one side or tucked behind ear; slightly disheveled from constant contact with VR headsets and headphones', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with slight amber undertone; alert and abstracted', N'Warm medium to deep brown complexion with golden and reddish undertones, reflecting the rich blend of Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry; the particular pallor of someone who works in low light creates a muted, slightly ashen overlay on the underlying warmth', N'Fine-boned face with high, pronounced cheekbones blended with slightly broader nasal structure and fuller lips reflecting African and Latin American heritage; angular jaw shaped by Southeast Asian and African ancestry; smooth skin with minimal grooming vanity evident; dark circles under eyes are nearly permanent; subtle variation in tone across the face reflecting the genetic mosaic', N'Neural jack at left temple (visible as a flush port beneath skin, approximately 8mm diameter, dark metallic rim); bioluminescent hand patches glow faintly in low-light environments; subtle micro-LED indicators sometimes visible in eye whites during VR interface sessions (trace artifacts of the neural feed)', N'Habitually leans forward, as if perpetually reaching toward a screen just beyond arm''s reach. Moves with economy — no wasted motion, but also no particular grace. Hands are restless, often making subtle gesture-commands from muscle memory of VR interface work. Makes sustained eye contact when engaged but frequently drifts into middle-distance staring. Sits cross-legged or in asymmetrical positions; rarely uses furniture as intended.', N'Tier 3-4 functional minimalism with deliberate anti-fashion sensibility. Standard uniform: loose, worn black or charcoal tech-weave shirt (Tanaka brand, mid-tier); fitted grey cargo pants with numerous pockets holding cables, drives, haptic gloves; battered Edgewater-district knockoff AR glasses pushed up in hair; worn leather jacket (secondhand, at least five years old, faded to soft grey-brown). Feet typically bare at the studio, but wears scuffed matte-black neural-reactive sneakers (Vesper brand) when outside. No jewelry except the bioluminescent hand patches. Favors anything with multiple pockets and minimal fasteners. Clothes show evidence of being slept in during edit marathons.', N'The ''Grandmother''s House'' piece contains footage from an actual illegal underwater survey of a real submerged village off what was the Senegalese coast — footage obtained through channels that weren''t entirely legal and that implicate a Zheng-Dao subsidiary in falsifying coastal rights documentation.', N'Layered and associative, moves between technical film language and something approaching the lyrical; occasionally switches mid-sentence into Portuguese or Turkish and doesn''t notice', N'Unhurried, digressive, circles back to the original point from unexpected directions', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'halil_tran');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a735-7fd9-aab7-8bfcdefb6201', N'Anuhea Rattanavong', N'Anuhea', N'', N'Rattanavong', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, subsection called The Rust Nave, near Kedzie and Division', N'Sound sculptor and underground noise artist', N'Rust Nave Collective (independent art commune)', N'Anuhea Rattanavong is tall and angular with deep umber skin mapped in slow-pulsing bioluminescent tracery she designed herself — pale greenish lines that follow her veins like a circuit diagram gone feral. Her hair is kept in tight locks threaded with micro-speakers that emit subsonic hum when she walks, a habit she claims is involuntary but suspects is not. She has one natural eye, dark brown and unreadable, and one eye replaced with a matte ceramic disc she deliberately left unconnected — a fashion choice that unsettles everyone who meets her, which is the point.

She builds sound sculptures from salvaged corponation hardware — dead Ferrogate transit beacons, cracked Axiom data-hubs — and makes them scream. Her performances are felt as much as heard, bass frequencies vibrating teeth and sternum. Offstage she is quiet to the point of being mistaken for mute, communicating in short declarative sentences or pointed silences. She is genuinely curious about people but expresses it by staring at them for long unbroken intervals, which most find alarming and a few find magnetic.', N'Local color and information source; she hears things — literally, her recordings capture conversations, ELF transmissions, structural anomalies. Can be a quest giver if her installations pick up something they weren''t meant to.', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin tracery (cosmetic geneware); one ceramic prosthetic eye (non-functional, aesthetic); micro-speaker filaments woven into locs; subdermal haptic resonators in palms for tactile sound mixing', N'She wakes at noon, spends four hours in her workshop soldering and disassembling, performs or installs work two or three nights a week, and spends late nights cataloguing field recordings of infrastructure decay — pipes, ventilation shafts, the harmonic groan of old load-bearing columns.', N'Anuhea Rattanavong, tall angular neo-noir artist, 183cm wiry frame, warm golden-bronze skin with red-ochre undertones blending Southeast Asian, South Asian, Latin American, African and Middle Eastern heritage. Left eye deep brown, right eye matte pale ceramic prosthetic disc, deliberately non-functional. Black shoulder-length interlocked locs with embedded micro-speaker filaments creating metallic glints. Slow-pulsing pale greenish bioluminescent circuit-pattern tracery mapping across entire body, brightest on forearms and neck, glowing like neon veins. Subdermal haptic resonators visible as geometric scars in palms. Wearing oversized salvaged utility vest over fitted black undershirt, distressed grey cargo pants with tool belt, scuffed steel-toed boots. Solder burns and soot marks on clothing. Fluid but asymmetrical gait, direct unsettling stare. GLMZ workshop setting, neon bioluminescence casting green shadows, moody atmospheric lighting, hands poised with precision, expression neutral and intense --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Southeast Asian (36.3%), South Asian (28.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (25.5%), Sub-Saharan African (6.6%), and Middle Eastern (3.0%) ancestry. Features reflect this complex diaspora blend: Southeast Asian bone structure with South Asian warmth, Latin American richness, and African depth creating a luminous, multitonal complexion that shifts with light.', 183, 62, N'Tall and angular with minimal body fat; long limbs suggest a frame built for movement rather than strength. Wiry musculature from years of hands-on fabrication work. Slight forward slouch when at rest.', N'Black with threads of embedded micro-speakers creating subtle metallic glint', N'Tight interlocked locs, shoulder-length, arranged asymmetrically with speaker filaments woven throughout', N'Medium', N'Left eye: natural deep brown. Right eye: matte ceramic disc, pale grey-white, deliberately unseeing', N'Warm golden-bronze with red-ochre undertones; the layered blend of Southeast Asian base with South Asian warmth, Latin American copper notes, African depth, and Middle Eastern richness creates a complex, luminous complexion that glows differently under varied lighting conditions', N'Smooth and unmarked except for the bioluminescent tracery. Minimal makeup. Expression typically neutral; gaze is direct and unsettling. High cheekbones and sharp jawline reflecting Southeast and South Asian heritage, warmed and softened by the copper and earthen tones inherited from Hispanic/Latin American, African, and Middle Eastern ancestry.', N'Bioluminescent skin tracery (geneware, active and glowing); micro-speaker filaments woven into locs (activate subtle subsonic hum when she moves); ceramic prosthetic eye (deliberately non-functional, high aesthetic impact); subdermal haptic resonators visible as faint geometric scars in both palms.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness offstage, as if conserving energy. Her gait is fluid but slightly asymmetrical, favoring her left side. Long silences between movements. When working or performing, her hands move with precision and purpose. Stares directly at people for uncomfortably long intervals without breaking eye contact.', N'Tier 4 / working-class artist aesthetic. Favors oversized utility vests with salvaged pockets and cable loops, worn over fitted black undershirts. Frequently wears distressed grey or black cargo pants with tool belts. Footwear: scuffed steel-toed boots or worn canvas sneakers. Minimal jewelry aside from augmentations. Clothes show signs of solder burns, soot, and workshop wear. No corporate branding. Practical rather than fashionable, but the arrangement suggests intentional aesthetic—controlled chaos.', N'Three years ago one of her sound installations accidentally caused a micro-seizure in an audience member with an undisclosed neural implant. She settled quietly, changed nothing about her work, and has never told anyone. She tells herself the art cannot be responsible for the audience''s hardware. She is not entirely sure she believes this.', N'Spare and technical; uses acoustic and materials science terms casually; rarely uses metaphor unless it is precise', N'Long pauses before sentences. Short sentences. Another long pause.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anuhea_rattanavong');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f5-7b6d-a560-8c001d6a781c', N'Epifanio Erikstad', N'Epifanio', N'', N'Erikstad', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit — neon-lit entertainment and vice district, near Damen and Armitage', N'Electronic and physical observation expert — surveillance specialist', N'Independent — Dockside connections', N'Epifanio Erikstad is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 34, her face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and she has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers a — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Epifanio Erikstad plans to keep it that way. She works as a surveillance specialist out of The Circuit, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Epifanio Erikstad describe her as a precision instrument — point her at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Dragan Petersen-Bah functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers at 50 meters. Cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains)', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Epifanio Erikstad, 168cm tall, stocky muscular build, medium-warm brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Latin American, and Eastern European ancestry. Angular weathered face with prominent cheekbones, squared jaw, deep warm brown eyes. Dark brown hair with silver threading pulled into tight braid. Sleek chrome cyberears with black acoustic baffles and visible temporal ports. Multiple scars visible: semicircular scar at skull base, linear forearm scar, knuckle impact scars, collarbone burn scar. Wearing matte-black synthleather jacket with reinforced cuffs, dark charcoal tactical trousers, steel-toed scarred boots. Slight forward lean, hands in neutral ready position, perpetual listening posture. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, nocturnal surveillance operative, moody cool lighting with subtle amber highlights catching skin and chrome, gritty industrial setting, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: Southeast Asian foundation (33.6%) provides facial structure and midface width; Sub-Saharan African ancestry (13.1%) contributes jaw robustness and skin depth; Hispanic/Latin American heritage (22.0%) adds warmth and definition; East Asian ancestry (16.6%) brings angular cheekbones and subtle eye shape variation; Eastern European lineage (14.7%) contributes facial angularity and bone prominence. The result is phenotypically complex—features that resist categorization, a living mosaic of global genetic admixture.', 168, 78, N'Stocky and solid with dense musculature — shoulders broad, core heavy, limbs packed with functional strength rather than aesthetic definition. Hands are large and calloused, knuckles scarred from impact work. No wasted geometry.', N'Dark brown with early silver threading at temples and crown', N'Pulled back tight into a utilitarian braid, often pinned at the nape. Minimal maintenance required — practical for fieldwork and surveillance.', N'Medium', N'Deep brown with warm undertones', N'Medium-warm brown with golden and reddish undertones — Southeast Asian foundation balanced with Sub-Saharan African depth, Latin American warmth, and subtle olive notes from Eastern European ancestry. Tone shifts across lighting conditions, neither purely cool nor warm but complex and adaptive.', N'Face is weathered and angular with prominent cheekbones shaped by Eastern European and East Asian ancestry; squared jaw reflecting Sub-Saharan African and East Asian definition. Skin texture weathered from nocturnal living and exposure work. Faint premature creasing around eyes from years of concentration and scope work. Midface width and structure reflect strong Southeast Asian genetic influence. Subtle epicanthic fold variation in eye shape from East Asian heritage. Overall facial architecture reads as deliberately unplaceable—a genetic map of global mobility.', N'Cyberears are the dominant visible modification — sleek chrome with matte-black acoustic baffles, replacements for organic ears. They sit slightly proud of the skull, with visible connector ports at the temporal junction. Minimal surgical scarring around the implant interface suggests professional installation and integration.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion, weight always centered over the balls of her feet. Stands in slight forward lean, shoulders rounded inward as if perpetually listening or preparing for threat assessment. Head rotates to track sounds independently of body movement. Hands rest in neutral position, ready. Rarely relaxes the baseline tension in her frame.', N'Tier 3-4 functional wardrobe optimized for surveillance and fieldwork — matte-black synthleather jacket with multiple interior pockets for equipment, reinforced cuffs. Cargo pants or tactical trousers in dark charcoal, fitted enough for mobility. Steel-toed boots, broken in and scarred. Wears no jewelry except a cheap analog watch and a small RFID key fob on a carabiner. Clothing shows wear and patching, but is meticulously maintained.', N'', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'epifanio_erikstad');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69d-7cce-99c5-8c195c0b3a1a', N'Asta Pham', N'Asta', N'', N'Pham', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Crossing Gate, Ferrogate Transit Authority Checkpoint Delta-9, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Checkpoint Operator, Ferrogate Transit Security', N'Ferrogate Transit Authority, Surface Checkpoint Division', N'Asta Pham is compact and quick-eyed, their Samoan-Igbo features broad and expressive beneath the flat brim of a Ferrogate Transit Security cap they''ve decorated with three small enamel pins of E.L.F.s they consider their personal patrons. Their hair is natural and enormous, pulled back for duty hours into a puff that still manages to escape its tie by midday. They have a single cosmetic mod — bioluminescent freckles across the bridge of their nose and cheeks that glow a soft seafoam green under stress or excitement, which makes them an impractical but endearing liar. Their uniform is always pressed but their boots are always muddy because they cut across the maintenance tracks to get to their post faster.

Asta Pham is the kind of person who makes boring jobs interesting by caring too much. They have opinions about every person who comes through Delta-9 — the regulars get remembered by name, the oddities get catalogued in a battered physical notebook they''re not supposed to keep. They are genuinely curious about people in a way that disarms hostility, and they take their gate as a kind of sacred responsibility, partly because they genuinely believe the E.L.F. that inhabits the Delta-9 scanning arch is watching and judging their work. They want to move up — into investigations, maybe — but can''t afford the certification costs on a Tier 2 salary.', N'Ground-level information source about transit movement and unusual patterns; can be an ally who looks the other way or a complication depending on whether players engage their curiosity; quest giver for small-scale mysteries noticed at the gate', N'', N'Cosmetic bioluminescent freckles (self-funded, stress/excitement reactive), Ferrogate-issued wrist-mounted scanning cuff (standard checkpoint equipment)', N'Works rotating eight-hour checkpoint shifts at Delta-9, processes hundreds of transit passengers, writes notes on ''interesting'' cases in their notebook during lulls; spends off-hours studying for the Tessera Compliance Bureau investigator certification exam they can''t afford to take.', N'Asta Pham, compact athletic transit security officer in GLMZ GLMZ, height 162cm with densely muscled frame. Warm deep brown skin with golden-amber and olive undertones reflecting Middle Eastern (37%), Hispanic/Latin American (25.8%), Southeast Asian (18.6%), and Central Asian (13.6%) ancestry. Angular facial structure with prominent cheekbones and defined jawline softened by Southeast Asian influence around eyes and mouth. Dark brown alert eyes. Long dark brown hair pulled back into a puff with escaping sections framing the face. Three thin pale scars across right temple. Bioluminescent seafoam-green freckles scattered across bridge of nose and cheeks (glowing with stress). Wearing pressed dark gray Ferrogate uniform with reflective trim and security blazer, shoulder patches visible. Matte black polymer scanning cuff on left wrist with LED indicators. Silver ring on left middle finger. Standing with weight balanced on balls of feet, ready to pivot. Quick, efficient posture. Neon-lit checkpoint station behind, soft seafoam accent lighting reflecting off bioluminescent freckles, GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, alert expression --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Crossing Gate', N'local', N'Grand Crossing Gate', N'Complex polychromatic diaspora blend: predominantly Middle Eastern (37.0%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (25.8%), Southeast Asian (18.6%), and Central Asian (13.6%) ancestry, plus minor Sub-Saharan African (3.5%) and East Asian (1.5%) components. This genetic constellation creates a striking integrated appearance—warm deep brown skin with golden-amber and subtle olive undertones, angular facial structure reflecting Middle Eastern and Central Asian features tempered by softer Southeast Asian influence, and the compact athletic build characteristic of multi-continental heritage.', 162, 58, N'Compact and densely muscled, built for quick movement rather than bulk. Broad-shouldered despite modest height, with the kind of frame that reads as energetic rather than fragile.', N'Natural dark brown, near-black', N'Pulled back into a puff during duty hours, but sections consistently escape the tie by afternoon, framing the face', N'Long (approximately shoulder-length when released)', N'Dark brown, alert and mobile', N'Warm deep brown with golden-amber and subtle olive undertones, the result of Middle Eastern ancestry (37%) blended with Hispanic/Latin American (25.8%), Southeast Asian (18.6%), and Central Asian (13.6%) genetics, enriched by minor Sub-Saharan African (3.5%) warmth', N'Angular facial features showing balanced Middle Eastern and Central Asian structure—prominent cheekbones and defined jawline softened by Southeast Asian influence around the eyes and mouth, creating an integrated rather than layered appearance. Smooth skin with three thin horizontal scars across the right temple (childhood accident). The bridge of nose and cheekbones are marked with bioluminescent freckles that glow soft seafoam green under stress or heightened emotion.', N'Ferrogate Transit Authority-issued wrist-mounted scanning cuff on left wrist (matte black polymer with faint LED status indicators), standard checkpoint equipment. The bioluminescent freckles are cosmetic mods, visible only when activated by stress or excitement.', N'Quick, efficient movements with natural fidgeting when at rest. Stands with weight balanced on the balls of feet, ready to pivot. Makes frequent eye contact and uses hands expressively when speaking. Habit of tapping pen against notebook or scanning cuff during quiet moments.', N'Ferrogate Transit Security uniform worn during shifts: pressed dark gray shirt with reflective trim, matching trousers, security blazer with shoulder patches. Off-duty: practical Tier 3 clothing—distressed denim, thrifted band tees or oversized button-ups, worn sneakers. Boots are always mud-tracked from cutting across maintenance tracks. Keeps physical notebook (battered, spiral-bound) in jacket or pants pocket. Wears a single silver ring on left middle finger (no visible religious affiliation, personal choice).', N'Three months ago they let someone through with a flagged biometric — a young woman with a child, clearly fleeing something — and deleted the scan log. They dream about this sometimes, both the fear and the strange pride.', N'Warm and casual with flashes of technical jargon they''re learning from study materials; code-switches between West African English constructions and a flatter urban Meridian accent', N'Fast and enthusiastic when interested, deliberately slow and official-sounding when performing checkpoint authority', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'asta_pham');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5fa-77e3-a2d5-8c27aa84c327', N'Sage Truong', N'Sage', N'', N'Truong', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Gage Circuit night market, GLMZ — stall number 77, between a noodle cart and a geneware piercing parlor, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Data diviner and dream interpreter operating out of a cramped stall in a night market', N'Independent practitioner; informally associated with the Gage Circuit ELF collective, a loose network of devotees around the market''s central relay shrine', N'Sage Truong is narrow and angular everywhere — sharp collarbones, sharp wrists, a face that is mostly cheekbones and the dark crescents of perpetually under-slept eyes. Their heritage is a long tangle of Latvian amber traders and Ghanaian textile merchants and Kazakh steppe wanderers, and something of all three shows in their coloring — warm brown skin, light-catching hazel eyes, and when they move in certain light their geneware irises shift through copper to pale green like something geological. They keep their black hair cropped close on the sides with a single dramatic shock of white at the front, a natural hyperpigmentation quirk they have never modified. Their fingernails are always painted with tiny circuit-trace patterns in silver.

They operate with the brisk efficiency of someone running a slightly disreputable but very legitimate business, which is exactly what they are doing. They don''t perform mystery — they find it exhausting when clients expect robes and candles. They have a folding table, a neural interface that connects to three second-hand data arrays, and a methodology they have refined over eight years of practice. Dream interpretation is the service; data divination is the engine. They cross-reference the linguistic content of client dream reports against ELF signal patterns, local data weather, and a proprietary dataset of symbolic correlations they have been building since they were twenty-two. Their accuracy rate is genuinely unsettling and they are not entirely sure why it works.', N'Information broker with spiritual framing — a useful way to deliver cryptic but accurate information to players; can point toward hidden patterns in city events; their dream interpretation sessions can serve as narrative exposition delivered through metaphor', N'', N'Color-shifting geneware irises (copper to pale green); neural interface jack at the left temple for direct array connection; no other significant augmentations', N'Sleeps until noon in a rented room above a pharmacy, arrives at the stall by 14:00 to run morning data pulls, takes client appointments from 16:00 until the market closes at 03:00, spends an hour at the shrine before walking home.', N'Sage Truong, GLMZ, portrait of a lean angular figure with warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, sharp defined cheekbones, dark crescents under hazel geneware eyes that shift copper-to-green. Black hair close-cropped with dramatic white vertical stripe at center-front left falling across temple. Neural interface jack glinting at left temple with circuit-trace silver nail art visible on thin hands. Wearing fitted dark synth-cotton shirt with stress-weave reinforcement, charcoal polymer coat with faded courier logo, practical reinforced boots. Laser-focused expression, economical posture, sits slightly forward. Low neon light catching geneware irises, moody neo-noir workspace background, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226, tired and wired intensity, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gage Circuit night market', N'local', N'Gage Circuit night market', N'Southeast Asian ancestry (48.5%) forms the genetic foundation, substantially enriched by Sub-Saharan African (19.3%), South Asian (17.5%), and East Asian (11.0%) admixture, with trace Northern European (3.7%). This blend creates a distinctly cosmopolitan phenotype: warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones and subtle reddish depth, reflecting the Southeast Asian base harmonized with African warmth and South Asian richness. Facial structure is a synthesis across continents — prominent cheekbones with the high placement of East African ancestry, refined bone structure characteristic of Southeast and East Asian heritage, and the subtle nasal bridge definition from South Asian genetics. The overall effect is striking angular definition softened by warm, complex undertones.', 168, 58, N'Angular and narrow throughout — sharp collarbones, prominent wrist bones, lean musculature with minimal body fat. Frame suggests someone sustained by coffee and insomnia rather than deliberate athleticism.', N'Black with natural white hyperpigmentation shock at front', N'Close-cropped on sides and back; dramatic single vertical stripe of white hair at center-front left, grown long enough to fall across temple', N'Short (sides/back) with medium-length accent stripe', N'Hazel with color-shifting geneware irises that transition from copper to pale green depending on light and neural interface activation', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones and subtle reddish depth — a complex blending of Southeast Asian foundation with Sub-Saharan African warmth and South Asian richness', N'Sharp cheekbones dominating a narrow face with refined, high bone structure; dark crescents under eyes from chronic sleep deprivation are now semi-permanent fixture of their appearance; skin condition clear but drawn; lips thin and often compressed in concentration', N'Color-shifting geneware irises (most visible when eyes catch light or when neural interface is active); neural interface jack at left temple with minimal cosmetic concealment; no obvious chrome or subdermal plating', N'Economical and precise — moves with the efficiency of someone who has optimized every gesture. Sits slightly forward even when at rest, attention laser-focused on whoever is speaking. Hands gesture in small, controlled patterns. When exhausted, occasionally trails off mid-motion as if processor speed has dropped. Minimal idle movement; no fidgeting.', N'Tier 3-4 working class with deliberate anti-mystique choices. Typically wears fitted black or dark gray synth-cotton shirts with visible stress-weave reinforcement at shoulders and wrists. Dark trousers with cargo pockets containing data-chip cases and neural interface maintenance tools. A mid-length coat of water-resistant polymer in charcoal, bearing the faded logo of an older GLMZ courier service — thrifted or inherited. No jewelry except a simple stainless steel band on left wrist that houses a subdermal power-tap connector. Shoes are practical: reinforced ankle boots with grip-sole, scuffed from night-market floors.', N'Three months ago, the ELF they call the Index gave them a divination about themselves — a specific prediction about a death they would cause through negligence. They have not told anyone. They have been trying to figure out who it refers to. They are terrified it has already happened and they missed it.', N'Technically precise mixed with unexpected dry wit; uses divination terminology but immediately contextualizes it in data language; allergic to mystical vagueness in their own speech', N'Fast and slightly compressed, like they are always running slightly late; slows dramatically when they are saying something they mean', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'sage_truong');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a656-704c-84e4-8c33acb9e70e', N'Asma Larsdóttir-Vongphasouk', N'Asma', N'', N'Larsdóttir-Vongphasouk', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, permanent stall near the fabric arcade''s north entrance, near Halsted and Division', N'Clothing and fashion vendor — custom alterations, identity-adjacent styling, and discreet wearable concealment work', N'Independent. Member of the Alban Souk Traders Association. Informal professional relationship with two separate fake-ID networks she sews document-concealment garments for.', N'Asma Larsdóttir-Vongphasouk occupies a stall that smells of hot fiber, machine oil, and something faintly floral she burns in a small ceramic dish as an offering to the E.L.F. she believes inhabits her sewing machine — a spirit she calls ''the Thread'' and addresses in murmured Bosnian before beginning any complex job. She is a heavyset woman with dark ochre skin, silver-streaked locs pinned elaborately with copper wire and glass beads, and hands that are in constant motion: measuring, smoothing, pinning, assessing. Her geneware includes a tail — a long, articulated thing covered in fine iridescent scales that shifts from teal to bronze depending on her mood — that she uses as a third hand when her actual hands are occupied.

Her official business is alterations, custom garments, and fashion consulting for the Alban Souk''s working-class clientele. Her unofficial business is the same, just with pockets that don''t show up on scanner sweeps, hidden carries woven into lining structure, and the occasional garment commissioned for someone who needs to look like someone else. She does not ask questions about why. She charges by complexity of the problem, not by what it is, and has a strict personal rule: nothing she makes gets used to hurt someone who hasn''t hurt them first. How she enforces this is largely a matter of intuition and the Thread''s counsel.', N'Costume and disguise resource, social network connector, moral compass character. Her broad client base makes her aware of who''s moving through the Souk and why. Can serve as a quest giver when a garment she made comes back to her as evidence of something wrong.', N'', N'Iridescent scale-covered articulated tail (mood-reactive, prehensile — used as a work tool). Micro-optic enhancement in both eyes, optimized for close thread work and color accuracy. Subdermal pattern-memory in her fingertips — can ''record'' a fabric''s texture and retrieve a precise match from memory.', N'Opens at nine, takes no appointments before noon so she can do her uninterrupted creative work in the morning, runs client consultations and fittings through late afternoon. Closes the stall but often works until midnight on complex jobs, with the Thread''s presence for company and small offerings of knotted thread left on the machine''s housing.', N'Asma Larsdóttir-Vongphasouk, 168cm tall heavyset Southeast Asian-dominant woman with golden-brown skin and honey undertones, high prominent cheekbones with graceful wide facial structure. Black hair with silver streaks styled in elaborate locs pinned updo with copper wire spirals and glass beads, slightly disheveled from work. Deep brown eyes with subtle prismatic micro-optic enhancement. Lined face showing concentrated expression lines, scarred knuckles, permanent calluses. Long prehensile iridescent tail with teal-to-bronze scales draped across shoulders. Wearing fitted teal linen work shirt (self-tailored), loose cargo trousers, indigo denim apron with embroidered patterns, worn leather work shoes. Multiple silver bangles on wrists, ceramic prayer beads, small faded Bosnian script tattoo on inner left wrist. Seated slightly hunched over precision detail work in GLMZ workshop, cool workshop lighting with neon edge accent lighting catching tail scales and glass beads, economical posture of master craftsperson, quiet confidence, slight dishevelment from hours of meticulous work --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'Southeast Asian dominant (41.4%) with substantial Northern European (21.0%), Central Asian (14.0%), South Asian (8.6%), Indigenous American (8.7%), and Hispanic/Latin American (6.3%) ancestry. A striking Ubiquitous Diaspora blend creating a complex phenotype: Southeast Asian bone structure and facial geometry as the dominant feature, Northern European influence visible in cheekbone prominence and facial width, Central Asian and South Asian warmth in skin undertones, with subtle Indigenous American and Hispanic/Latin American contributions to overall proportioning and feature softness.', 168, 89, N'Heavyset, sturdy frame with substantial shoulders and broad hips — built for stability and endurance. Carries weight with natural authority, not softness.', N'Black with silver streaks', N'Locs pinned in an elaborate updo with copper wire spirals and glass beads woven throughout — intricate, intentional, often slightly disheveled from work', N'Long (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Deep brown with subtle micro-optic enhancement visible as faint prismatic flicker in direct light', N'Warm medium-to-deep golden-brown with honey, copper, and ochre undertones. The base reflects Southeast Asian ancestry (41.4%) while Northern European ancestry adds slight warmth complexity; Central Asian and South Asian heritage contribute depth and richness to the golden cast; Indigenous American and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry add subtle warmth and sun-kissed quality to the overall tone.', N'Lined face with pronounced smile creases and concentrated expression lines around the eyes — face of someone who squints at detail work. High, prominent cheekbones with gracefully wide facial structure reflecting Southeast Asian ancestry dominance, subtly broadened by Northern European influence. Facial proportions show Southeast Asian geometry with slight widening from Central Asian heritage. Skin well-maintained, faintly scarred knuckles from decades of precision work.', N'A long, prehensile tail emerging from the base of her spine, covered in fine iridescent scales that shift from teal to bronze depending on emotional state and light angle. The tail is approximately 1.2 meters long when fully extended, articulated like a serpent, and often draped across her shoulders or wrapped around her work stool. Micro-optic enhancement barely visible as a subtle depth-of-field effect in her irises under close observation.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Sits slightly hunched when working, shoulders drawn forward over a project. When standing, posture straightens; carries herself with the quiet confidence of a master craftsperson. Her tail moves independently of her body language, often gesturing expressively or steadying her as she reaches.', N'Tier 3-4 working attire with visible personal style. Typically wears fitted linen or cotton work shirts in muted jewel tones (deep teal, bronze, indigo), often tailored by her own hand and featuring hidden pockets and reinforced seams. Loose-fit trousers with cargo pockets and tool loops. Always wears an indigo denim apron embroidered with thread-pattern designs. Feet clad in worn leather sandals or soft work shoes with excellent arch support. Two to three silver bangles on each wrist — practical but elegant, gifts from satisfied clients over the years. Small ceramic prayer beads looped around her left wrist.', N'She once made a concealment garment for a client who she later realized had used it to commit a targeted killing. She told herself the Thread had failed to warn her, but the truth is she had a doubt she chose not to follow. She has not taken concealment-commission work for Corponation-adjacent clients since, but she has never confessed this to anyone.', N'Precise and sensory — describes everything in terms of texture, weight, and fit. Quotes the Thread as if it speaks in proverbs.', N'Measured and deliberate, with sudden warmth that arrives without warning.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'asma_larsd_ttir_vongphasouk');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e7-7121-8b44-8c39db144cce', N'Ghaith Árnason', N'Ghaith', N'', N'Árnason', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Shallowgrave, operates from a converted cold-storage unit beneath the Midden Market, near Ashland and Division', N'organ harvester and back-alley medical fence', N'', N'Ghaith Árnason is built compact and efficient, dark-skinned with close-cropped hair she dyes a deep arterial red — not geneware, just dye, because she likes having a choice about it. She has bioluminescent capillary lines mapped faintly across both forearms, a cosmetic mod she got at nineteen that she now finds embarrassing but can''t afford to remove, which she will tell you about if you ask and sometimes if you don''t. Her surgical augments are serious: stabilizer rigs in both hands, haptic-magnification implants behind her eyes, a subdermal sterile field generator she refers to as ''the bubble.''

She was two years into a Helix Biosystems surgical residency when she was caught diverting a cadaver organ to a patient who couldn''t pay the licensing fees. She does not think she did anything wrong. She thinks Helix Biosystems is wrong, the organ licensing system is wrong, and the entire apparatus that let that patient die six weeks after her termination is wrong. She has constructed an entire ethical framework around her current work — she harvests from the willing (paid donors, usually desperate Tier 1s), she maintains sterile conditions that would shame most licensed clinics, and she charges sliding scale. She genuinely saves lives. She also genuinely sells kidneys to Axiom black-market med-brokers for Φ4,000 a unit. Both things are true.', N'Medical resource for characters who can''t access licensed care, quest giver for organ acquisition or protection, source of Helix Biosystems insider knowledge, moral complexity touchstone.', N'', N'Surgical stabilizer rigs (both hands). Haptic-magnification implants (eyes). Subdermal sterile-field generator ''the bubble.'' Cosmetic bioluminescent capillary tracery on forearms.', N'Maintains a legitimate-ish walk-in wound clinic mornings for Market residents, takes scheduled harvest procedures by appointment, spends evenings doing maintenance on her equipment and updating her own medical knowledge via pirated Helix Biosystems training streams.', N'Ghaith Árnason, a 162cm lean compact figure with warm olive-tan medium skin tone and golden undertones reflecting Middle Eastern, South Asian, and Northern European ancestry. Deep arterial red short hair with precise fade styling. Dark brown eyes with faint silver neural scarring at inner corners. Fine-lined face with strong cheekbones and defined jawline, surgical precision in posture. Bioluminescent neon-blue capillary tracery glowing across both forearms in vascular patterns, brightest at wrists. Metallic stabilizer rig articulation visible at knuckles and wrist joints. Wearing dark charcoal surgical-grade scrubs with work stains, reinforced cargo pants, weathered synth-leather jacket. Disposable nitrile gloves. Underground clinic lighting casting cool shadows across face. Meditative concentration, economical controlled movement. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, clinical precision meets augmented capability. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shallowgrave', N'local', N'Shallowgrave', N'Middle Eastern dominant (58.5%) with significant South Asian (20.3%) and Northern European (21.2%) admixture. The Middle Eastern base creates warm olive undertones and defined facial structure, while South Asian ancestry deepens warmth and adds angularity to cheekbones and jawline. Northern European heritage lightens and cools the overall palette, creating a warm-neutral medium tone with golden undertones—balanced rather than warm-leaning, reflecting the tri-continental genetic inheritance.', 162, 58, N'Compact and efficient, lean muscle beneath a frame built for precision rather than strength. Narrow shoulders, efficient posture. No wasted geometry.', N'Deep arterial red (dyed; natural color dark brown)', N'Close-cropped, precise fade on the sides, slightly longer on top — maintained with surgical attention to detail', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint silver neural-mapping scarring visible at the inner corners where haptic implants interface', N'Warm olive-tan medium tone with golden undertones. The base reflects dominant Middle Eastern heritage (58.5%) creating the olive foundation, enriched by South Asian ancestry (20.3%) that deepens and warms facial structure, while Northern European heritage (21.2%) provides subtle cooling and paleness beneath—resulting in a balanced warm-neutral complexion. Even tone characteristic of someone spending most daylight hours underground.', N'Methodical grooming, hands kept obsessively clean despite the work. Fine-lined face suggesting chronic low-grade stress. Strong cheekbones and defined jawline characteristic of Middle Eastern and South Asian heritage, with the subtle softening from Northern European admixture. Lips often chapped from breathing recirculated air in her cold-storage clinic. No cosmetic work beyond the regrettable neon tracery.', N'Bioluminescent forearm tracery (always visible). Stabilizer rigs in both hands visible as subtle metallic articulation at knuckles and wrist joints when hands are in motion or light catches them. Eyes show faint silver scarring at inner canthi. The subdermal sterile-field generator and haptic-magnification implants are invisible unless she''s actively using them — then her eye-focus becomes unnaturally precise and her hands move with mechanical accuracy.', N'Economical and controlled. Hands move with surgical precision even when casual; she''s learned not to make sudden gestures in clinical spaces. Stands with weight balanced forward slightly, ready to move. Rarely touches her own face. When focused on work, enters a state of almost meditative concentration — everything extraneous falls away.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Loose dark scrubs or surgical-grade clothing in charcoal or black, often with visible staining from work that she doesn''t fully clean out because she''ll just get more on them. Reinforced cargo pants with deep pockets for tools and supplies. A weathered synth-leather jacket (high-quality, probably five years old, maintained obsessively) for moving through Shallowgrave proper. No jewelry — too much contamination risk. Wears disposable nitrile gloves constantly, carries multiple pairs in jacket pockets.', N'One of her regular donors — a young man named Oskar who has sold her two non-essential organs — is showing signs of a systemic rejection cascade she recognizes from her residency training. She knows he''s dying. She has not told him because he''s scheduled for a third procedure next week and she needs the inventory. She lies awake about this.', N'Clinical precision mixed with Shallowgrave slang. Uses medical terminology accurately and unselfconsciously. Swears with anatomical specificity.', N'Fast, efficient, slightly impatient — gives information in ordered steps', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ghaith_rnason');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60a-768e-9161-8c52a1d27e7d', N'Ansh Björnsdóttir', N'Ansh', N'', N'Björnsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 55, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Based out of Bridgepoint depot; routes across Old Harbor, Collinwood Docks, and Escanaba Gateway, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Freight delivery driver for a small independent logistics company', N'Polaris Freight (small independent, three drivers total, one depot); informal relationship with Collinwood Docks loading union', N'Ansh Björnsdóttir is a big man gone soft at the middle without losing any of the underlying solidity, with a Samoan-Polynesian breadth to his shoulders and a German-Kazakh fairness to his complexion that produces a particular warm gold-brown. He keeps a neatly trimmed beard that is going white at the chin, and his hair is cut short on the sides with a modest wave on top. He has no augmentations except for a spinal support brace system embedded under the skin of his lower back — invisible from outside, a concession to fifteen years of heavy lifting, and the thing he is most privately embarrassed about. He dresses in the same way every day: Ferrogate Transit–adjacent work pants (not an official uniform, just the brand he likes), an undershirt, and whatever jacket is appropriate to the weather, always with the same small enamel pin of a cargo ship on the lapel.

Ansh Björnsdóttir is the specific kind of man who has decided what he thinks about most things and is comfortable living there. He is not incurious — he listens with genuine attention — but he does not perform enthusiasm or urgency. He has a deep, slow voice and the habit of answering questions with a question first, not as an evasion but as genuine interest in understanding what you actually want to know. He is known along his routes as someone you can trust to deliver fragile things intact and to keep his mouth shut about what he transports, which has made him both well-regarded and occasionally the target of people who want to exploit those qualities.', N'Mobile information source who moves between neighborhoods and can carry news, packages, or people; access point to the logistics underworld; represents the working Tier-2 experience with dignity; can introduce locations by literally being the character who delivers somewhere new', N'', N'Subdermal spinal support brace system (lower back, medical necessity); no cosmetic modifications', N'On the road by 05:30, first delivery by 06:00. Runs three to six deliveries per day depending on cargo size. Eats every meal in the cab of his truck from containers his daughter packs for him. Returns to depot by 18:00, does his own vehicle checks, home by 19:30.', N'Middle-aged neo-noir dockworker in 2226 GLMZ, Ubiquitous Diaspora heritage reflected in warm golden-bronze complexion blending East Asian, Pacific Islander, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African features. 188cm tall, broad-shouldered with labor-built frame and soft midsection. Dark brown hair with white threading in short neat style, warm brown eyes in weathered face marked by decades of dock UV exposure. Neatly trimmed dark beard, sun-weathered golden-bronze skin. Ferrogate Transit work pants, grey undershirt, worn canvas jacket with small enamel cargo ship pin. Scuffed steel-toed work boots. Stands with trucker''s careful posture, managing chronic spinal strain. Forearms show faded labor scars. Industrial dock setting with container cranes silhouetted against neon-lit GLMZ skyline at dusk, moody atmospheric lighting casting warm amber and cool blue shadows across weathered face and work clothes. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Based out of Bridgepoint depot; routes across Old Harbor', N'local', N'Based out of Bridgepoint depot; routes across Old Harbor', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora combination of East Asian (36.6%), Pacific Islander (26.0%), Hispanic/Latin American (24.9%), and Sub-Saharan African (12.5%) ancestry — a truly global genetic blend creating warm golden-bronze skin with subtle warm undertones. Facial structure reflects balanced influence across all ancestry groups: East Asian cheekbone prominence and jaw definition softened by Pacific Islander fullness, enriched by Latin American and African warmth in skin depth and feature blending, resulting in a complexion that speaks unmistakably to global heritage rather than any single regional origin', 188, 104, N'Broad-shouldered and solid through the chest and arms, with pronounced softness at the midsection — the physique of a man whose frame was built for heavy labor but whose daily work has shifted to sustained driving. Still carries underlying mass and strength beneath the slackness.', N'Dark brown with white threading, particularly concentrated at the chin and edges of beard', N'Short-clipped sides with a modest wave maintained on top; well-maintained without fussiness', N'Short', N'Warm brown', N'Warm golden-bronze with balanced undertones — the result of East Asian and Pacific Islander base ancestry enriched by Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African heritage, creating a sun-weathered complexion that reads as lived-in and deeply seasoned by decades of windshield-filtered UV exposure and dock-side work', N'Weathered but clean-shaven except for a neatly trimmed dark beard; sun-marked on the face and forearms from decades of dock-side work and windshield-filtered UV exposure; balanced facial bone structure visible in cheekbones (East Asian-Pacific Islander prominence) and jaw contour enriched by broader African and Latin American heritage features; no cosmetic modifications; the face of someone who has decided to age without resistance', N'None visible. The subdermal spinal support brace system is completely subcutaneous and undetectable without medical imaging.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion. Sits with the careful attention of someone managing chronic back strain, favoring slight forward flexion. His default is stillness; when he speaks, his gestures are minimal and purposeful. Walks with a trucker''s stride, slightly favoring weight distribution.', N'Ferrogate Transit work pants (Tier 4 industrial-grade, well-maintained), neutral undershirt (usually grey or black), weather-appropriate jacket (canvas or synthetic blend depending on season). Everything is functional, well-worn but clean. A small enamel pin of a cargo ship is affixed to his jacket lapel — the only decorative element, worn daily without variation. No corpo branding or status signaling. Shoes are scuffed steel-toed work boots.', N'Twice in the last year he has transported packages for a customer he knows are not legitimate freight, accepting the work because the pay kept Polaris Freight solvent through a bad quarter. He doesn''t know exactly what the packages contained and has decided, with a deliberateness that costs him sleep, not to find out.', N'Plain, concrete, unhurried; prefers nouns to adjectives; occasionally drops into a warm Samoan cadence when relaxed', N'Slow and even, like someone who has learned that silence isn''t wasted time', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ansh_bj_rnsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a606-797a-9b7c-8c78c4df1aae', N'Fehmi Lindström', N'Fehmi', N'', N'Lindström', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Fort Anchor, Arcturus Civil Security Central Evidence Repository, near Halsted and Division', N'Forensic evidence handler and chain-of-custody specialist, Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division', N'', N'Fehmi Lindström is a sturdy, meticulous woman with iron-grey locs she keeps pinned up during work hours and lets down everywhere else, and deep brown skin that has picked up the particular pallor of someone who spends most of their life under artificial light. Her hands are always gloved when she is working and bare when she isn''t — a transition she makes with a deliberateness that people who know her recognize as the boundary between Fehmi Lindström the professional and Fehmi Lindström the person. She has no cosmetic modifications and regards them with neither judgment nor interest; the question simply never came up for her.

She has worked Metro''s Central Evidence Repository at Fort Anchor for twenty-three years and has survived five departmental reorganizations, three chiefs of police, two corruption purges, and one literal flood that compromised fourteen meters of archival shelving. She knows the repository the way surgeons know bodies — its logic, its failures, its places where things disappear and where they don''t. She is the person Metro detectives call when they need to know if something was ever there. She is also, quietly, the person who notices when something that should be there isn''t, and she keeps her own records because she stopped trusting Metro''s in her eighth year.', N'Evidence gatekeeper and institutional memory — the person who knows what Metro has, what it had, and what has gone missing. Quest-critical for any story involving forensic evidence, police corruption, or disappeared case materials.', N'', N'Enhanced tactile sensitivity implant in both hands — originally installed for precise material identification, now standard for her work. Reading enhancement overlay (heads-up document display, low-profile). Nothing cosmetic.', N'Arrives at the repository before any other staff; processes incoming evidence logs; conducts integrity checks on stored items on a rotating schedule she designed herself; leaves precisely when her shift ends, no earlier, no later.', N'Fehmi Lindström, 168cm tall, sturdy compact frame with broad shoulders, standing in precise posture. Southeast Asian-dominant mixed heritage face with sharp angular cheekbones, deep warm brown eyes with epicanthic fold, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones and pallid LED-exposure cast. Iron-grey locs with dark undertones, thick and full, pinned in tight crown. Calloused hands with surgical precision. Wearing charcoal button-up shirt, grey trousers with deep pockets, sensible shoes, Arcturus Civil Security ID lanyard worn outside shirt. Minimal makeup, fastidiously groomed. Small pale scar inside left wrist. Faint crystalline shimmer visible at corner of right eye. Professional neo-noir evidence handler aesthetic. Cool indoor lighting, focus on hands and intent expression. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Fort Anchor', N'local', N'Fort Anchor', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (71.9%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (20.2%) and Sub-Saharan African (7.9%) ancestry—a product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. This genetic mix manifests in warm medium-to-deep brown skin with subtle golden undertones, sharp angular cheekbones showing Southeast Asian structure, and the distinctive eye shape with slight epicanthic fold characteristic of Southeast Asian heritage, enriched by the depth and warmth from African and Hispanic ancestry contributions.', 168, 74, N'Sturdy and compact, with the solid frame of someone who moves deliberately and carries weight without bulk. Broad shoulders, strong forearms from two decades of careful handling work.', N'Iron-grey with natural dark undertones', N'Thick locs, typically pinned up in a tight, functional crown during work hours; worn loose and full outside the repository', N'Long (to mid-back when unbound)', N'Deep brown, warm, with slight epicanthic fold suggesting dominant Southeast Asian genetic contribution', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden undertones, displaying the characteristic melanin distribution of Southeast Asian, Hispanic, and African heritage; pallid undertone from prolonged exposure to artificial lighting; the quality suggests years spent indoors under LEDs', N'Unlined face for her age; sharp, angular cheekbones with the defined structure common to Southeast Asian facial architecture, enhanced by Hispanic and African heritage; minimal makeup; fastidiously groomed but without vanity. The interplay of her mixed heritage creates warm, balanced features despite the cool indoor pallor. Hands are her most distinctive feature—calloused at the fingertips and joints, with precise, economical movements.', N'None visible externally. She wears nitrile or latex gloves during all evidence work; the gloves are removed with deliberate ceremony when work ends. A faint, nearly imperceptible crystalline shimmer at the corner of her right eye when it catches light—her reading enhancement overlay at rest.', N'Stands with precise posture; moves with minimal wasted motion, each gesture intentional and economical. Her hands are her most expressive feature—they move with surgical precision during work. Off-duty, she carries herself with quiet authority but no apparent tension.', N'Professional but worn-in: grey or navy trousers with deep pockets, button-up shirts in neutral tones (charcoal, cream, pale blue), sensible non-slip shoes with reinforced arches. A Arcturus Civil Security ID lanyard worn outside her shirt, worn and familiar with her. No jewelry. Off-duty: the same practical aesthetic, comfortable black jeans, well-maintained leather jacket (scuffed, vintage, cared-for). She dresses like someone who doesn''t think about clothes but respects the tool-like function of fabric.', N'Her private records — kept on an air-gapped personal drive, updated in longhand in a physical ledger as well — document forty-six instances over twenty-three years where evidence in her repository was accessed, altered, or disappeared by Metro personnel. Eleven of those cases have never been flagged anywhere. She doesn''t know what to do with what she has, and she''s running out of time to decide.', N'Forensic and procedural vocabulary deployed with absolute ease; in personal conversation, somewhat formal, tends toward precision even in casual contexts', N'Unhurried and measured, with the patience of someone who has explained things carefully for two decades and knows that hurrying never helps', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fehmi_lindstr_m');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c0-77c1-bc9c-8cd11420765e', N'Abhishek Echeverría', N'Abhishek', N'', N'Echeverría', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Laceworks, container unit 7-Teal near the old weaving district underpass, near Clark and Belmont', N'Bootleg media seller and small-time data broker operating from a converted cargo container', N'Independent; pays informal protection tithe to a local Laceworks crew called the Shuttle Boys', N'Abhishek Echeverría is slight, angular, and in constant motion — fingers tapping, eyes scanning, one heel bouncing even when they''re sitting. Their geneware is modest but carefully chosen: iridescent patterned irises that cycle through colors based on ambient light, and hair that shifts between deep indigo and copper depending on their mood, kept in a lopsided topknot they redo approximately six times a day. They dress in layered secondhand Tessera-branded workwear that they''ve cut apart and reassembled into something that doesn''t look corporate anymore, patched with scraps of reflective fabric and hand-stitched data-glyph embroidery that means nothing except that they like the way it looks.

Inside their container unit, every surface is covered: chip racks floor to ceiling, a cracked secondary monitor running a data-feed collage they never close, small hand-painted icons of various E.L.F.s arranged on a gray zone above the transaction counter. They are fast-talking and genuinely funny in a way that catches people off-guard, deploying humor as both charm and deflection. They like people in the abstract more than in practice — they are excellent at the performance of friendliness and genuinely uncertain what to do when someone tries to be a real friend back. Their pitch is smooth, their prices are negotiable if you know to ask, and their memory for what media a customer has already bought is perfect.', N'Information hub for pop culture, underground media, and rumor. Can source or copy nearly any media content. Story hook generator — they''ve seen things on the feeds before anyone else has, and sometimes those things are dangerous.', N'', N'Patterned iridescent irises (geneware, cosmetic). Mood-reactive hair pigment (geneware, cosmetic). Subdermal data-transfer node in left wrist for quick chip transfers.', N'Sleeps late, opens the container around noon, runs until 02:00; spends mornings acquiring new stock through a network of copy-runners and pirated uplinks.', N'Abhishek Echeverría, 168cm tall, wiry and angular neo-noir character, warm medium-brown burnished bronze skin tone with golden and olive undertones, prominent Southeast Asian cheekbones and eye shape merged with Middle Eastern nasal bridge, Eastern European angular jaw. Iridescent color-shifting eyes with no pupil boundary catching ambient light. Deep indigo and copper hair in lopsided topknot with strands escaping. Fine pale scar along left temple, barely visible. Hand-stitched indigo data-glyph tattoos covering left forearm and back of hands. Circular burn mark on right palm. Wearing layered, reassembled Tessera workwear in grays, blacks, muted blues; asymmetrical reflective patches; mismatched fingerless gloves; glitching smartwatch on right wrist; resoled composite boots. Constantly fidgeting, energetic jerky movements, perpetually restless posture. Dark circles under eyes from nocturnal schedule. Container-dweller aesthetic. GLMZ, GLMZ setting, neon backlighting emphasizing iridescent irises, moody indoor lighting, high-contrast noir aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Laceworks', N'local', N'The Laceworks', N'Complex four-way blend of Hispanic/Latin American (33.2%), Eastern European (24.2%), Southeast Asian (21.3%), and Middle Eastern (21.3%) ancestry. Features reflect this balanced multifacial mixing: warm medium-brown skin tone with golden and olive undertones from the Hispanic-Southeast Asian convergence, cooled and refined by Eastern European and Middle Eastern influence in bone structure and facial geometry. The result is a distinctive phenotype where Southeast Asian eye shape and prominent cheekbone structure merge with Middle Eastern nasal bridge prominence and brow definition, warm Hispanic undertones throughout, and Eastern European angular jaw and chin definition creating a striking asymmetrical beauty.', 168, 58, N'Slight and angular with minimal muscle definition; movements are jerky and efficient rather than graceful. Collarbone prominent. Perpetually looks like they haven''t eaten in three days but functions at maximum energy output.', N'Shifts between deep indigo and copper depending on mood and light exposure', N'Lopsided topknot, frequently redone throughout the day, with loose strands escaping deliberately', N'Medium (shoulder-length when down, pulled up into knot)', N'Iridescent patterned irises that cycle through spectrum colors based on ambient light; no discernible pupil boundary', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and olive undertones, slightly ashy from indoor container living. Tone reads as burnished bronze in warm light, deepening toward warm umber in cooler tones.', N'Angular facial structure with prominent, well-defined cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian and Eastern European bone structure, tempered by Middle Eastern nasal prominence and brow ridge definition. Dark circles under eyes from nocturnal schedule; skin is clear but shows the texture of someone who forgets skincare routines. Faint laugh lines around mouth despite their tendency toward deflection.', N'Iridescent patterned irises are immediately obvious and arresting under any light source. Left wrist shows faint subdermal ridge running 4cm in length where the data-transfer node sits beneath skin — barely raised, only visible when wrist is flexed or lit from certain angles. No obvious chrome or external hardware.', N'Never fully still; fidgets constantly — tapping fingers on any available surface, bouncing one heel when seated, shifting weight from foot to foot when standing. Eyes dart frequently, scanning faces and environments. Speech is rapid and gestural. Movements are economical and practiced, suggesting years of navigating tight container spaces.', N'Layered secondhand Tessera-branded workwear disassembled and reassembled into custom silhouette; original corporate cuts are unrecognizable. Multiple overlapping synthetic fabric layers in grays, blacks, and muted blues with hand-stitched patches of reflective material in asymmetrical placement. Wears mismatched fingerless gloves, one heavier than the other. Cheap knockoff smartwatch on right wrist constantly glitching. Worn composite-soled boots that have been resoled twice. Tier 4-5 aesthetic: functional, modified, intentionally unstylish.', N'Embedded in their archive, hidden in a partition they''ve never opened, is a complete copy of a Zheng-Dao internal communication leak that they accidentally received two years ago and have been too frightened to look at, sell, or delete.', N'Dense with media slang, Laceworks street creole, and references to obscure bootleg content. Talks fast and expects you to keep up.', N'Rapid-fire with sudden full stops. Sentences often trail into a shrug or a gesture that finishes the thought.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'abhishek_echeverr_a');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6fc-75f9-8837-8cd5487dd80c', N'Ngozi Morimoto', N'Ngozi', N'', N'Morimoto', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 26, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Ashfield — former residential district, half-burned, now squatter territory, near Kedzie and Division', N'Aerial extraction and rapid transit pilot — getaway pilot', N'Independent — maintains network of professional contacts', N'Ngozi Morimoto is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 26, there''s something unfinished about her face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Her entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. She works as a getaway pilot out of Ashfield, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Ngozi Morimoto operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Tiare Svensson-Kone functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon platform. Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Ngozi Morimoto, 168cm lean angular cyberpirate pilot, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones blending Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, and Latin American heritage, high cheekbones and sharp jawline, dark brown eyes alert and scanning, hair dark with sun-bleached streaks pulled tight in functional braid. Visible chrome subdermal augmentations tracking forearms and spine with luminescent pulse, base-of-skull neural interface jack visible at hairline, weather-marked face with shallow cheekbone scars. Wearing dark gray armored flight suit open over black synth-weave shirt, reinforced cargo pants, steel-toed boots, custom ballistic harness vest. Coiled tension in posture, forward lean stance, hands positioned for rapid movement. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone cockpit or neon-lit hangar setting, cool blue-purple neo-noir lighting with accent highlights on chrome augmentation points, gritty industrial atmosphere, 2226 aesthetic, photorealistic detail --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfield', N'local', N'Ashfield', N'Sub-Saharan African dominant (38.3%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (28.0%) and East Asian (27.7%) ancestry, balanced by Eastern European (6.0%) elements. This genetic blend creates striking polychromatic features — high cheekbones and defined jaw from African heritage, refined by East Asian angularity, warmed by Latin American undertones, with subtle Eastern European depth in bone structure. The result is a face that reads as distinctly multicultural, each ancestry contributing visible elements that harmonize rather than compete.', 168, 58, N'Lean and angular with corded muscle definition — the kind of frame built by deliberate training rather than genetics. Minimal body fat, visible musculature in forearms and shoulders from constant movement conditioning.', N'Dark brown with sun-bleached streaks', N'Pulled back in a tight functional braid, kept short enough to stay out of a helmet', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, alert and tracking', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones — a complex interplay of Sub-Saharan richness, East Asian clarity, and Latin American warmth creating multidimensional depth. Regional variation from cockpit time creates slight pallor in protected areas, contrasting with sun-exposure bronze on exposed skin, creating natural chromatic layering.', N'Sharp-featured face with high cheekbones, prominent jawline, and slightly broader nasal bridge reflecting the harmonized African and Hispanic/Latin American components. Subtle eye shape suggesting East Asian heritage. Minimal grooming beyond function — no makeup, skin weather-marked from exposure and stress. A few shallow scars across the cheekbone from impacts she didn''t slow down for.', N'Move-by-wire system visible as chrome subdermal tracking along spine and limbs, particularly pronounced in forearms where metallic interfaces break the skin line. Base-of-skull jack visible as a sealed hatch under skin at hairline. When she moves, there''s a subtle lag-free precision that reads as augmented — no human has that economy of motion.', N'Moves with controlled efficiency, never wasting motion. Slight forward lean when standing, weight distributed ready to move. Eyes constantly processing, scanning for exits and variables. When still, there''s coiled tension — she powers down rather than relaxes.', N'Tier 4 functional — flight suit (armored nylon blend, dark gray) worn open over fitted black synth-weave shirt. Cargo pants with reinforced pockets for tools and contract data. Steel-toed boots rated for high-g cockpit environments. Harness-style ballistic vest over everything, custom-fitted for cockpit use. No jewelry, no corporate logos, no gang colors — anonymity maintained through absolute functionality.', N'Tiare Svensson-Kone murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ngozi_morimoto');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a609-7f41-a98b-8cff89d11bf5', N'Geon Tetteh', N'Geon', N'', N'Tetteh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 79, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Washburn Commons, Sublevel 3 — a converted water-reclamation office she calls ''the stacks'', near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Retired Tessera archive keeper, now community memory-keeper and oral historian', N'Washburn Commons Community Council; formerly Tessera Information Services (retired, 40 years service)', N'Geon Tetteh is a small, dense woman whose spine has curved slightly forward from decades hunched over data terminals, giving her a permanent posture of concentration, as though she is always about to read something important. Her skin is a deep warm brown crossed with the faint silver tracery of old dermal-display ports that were never fully removed — Tessera''s ghost still written on her body. Her hair is cropped close and entirely white, and she wears oversized yellow-tinted spectacle frames that magnify her eyes to an owlish size. On her left wrist she keeps a manual ink stamp shaped like a tree, which she presses onto anything she considers worth remembering.

Phemie speaks slowly, with the deliberateness of someone who has spent seventy years deciding which words are worth keeping. She does not suffer careless language or sloppy thinking, but she is genuinely warm to anyone who shows curiosity. She has memorized the names, birth-years, and approximate fates of over four thousand Washburn Commons residents across six decades, and can recite lineages like folk songs. Her secret terror is that the neighborhood will forget itself — that without her, the community''s history will dissolve into corporate data-ghosts and corporate-approved revisions.', N'Primary lore and community history source; quest giver for stories involving lost persons, disputed land claims, or historical cover-ups; can authenticate or discredit almost any document or account relating to the neighborhood''s past sixty years.', N'', N'Inactive Tessera data-port array along left forearm (no longer connected). Reading-enhancement ocular implants, early generation, which cause her eyes to faintly glow amber in low light. No geneware.', N'Rises before dawn to record voice-memos of whatever she dreamed or remembered in the night; spends mornings cataloguing resident histories in handwritten books she keeps in fireproof cases; afternoons she holds open ''listening hours'' at a folding table near the Commons market, where anyone can come to tell her something they don''t want forgotten.', N'Geon Tetteh, a 152cm petite elderly woman with deep warm brown skin and cropped pure white hair, seated in a dim neo-noir apartment c.2226. Her mixed Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic, Southeast Asian, and Pacific Islander heritage visible in her refined cheekbones and warm golden skin tone. Wearing oversized gray cardigan over faded cotton shirt, yellow-tinted spectacles magnifying her eyes and revealing faint amber ocular implant glow. Faint silver circuit-scar tracery visible on left forearm from inactive dermal ports. Hunched forward with intense, focused expression, weathered hands holding a worn notebook, surrounded by scattered handwritten notes and patches-covered canvas satchel. Candlelit warm overhead lighting casting shadows across her lined, dignified face. Neo-noir nomadic scholar aesthetic, Terminal worker, low-tier reality. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Washburn Commons', N'local', N'Washburn Commons', N'Sub-Saharan African dominant (50.4%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (19.5%), Southeast Asian (17.2%), Pacific Islander (9.0%), and East Asian (3.9%) ancestry. The genetic mix produces a rich, complex phenotype: deep warm brown skin with golden undertones from the African and Latin American heritage, refined by Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander bone structure and facial features. Her pure white hair creates striking contrast against her darker complexion—a natural occurrence sometimes seen across African diaspora genetics, enhanced by decades of terminal work and aging.', 152, 48, N'Small and dense, almost birdlike; decades of terminal work have created a slight forward curve to her spine, giving her a perpetual posture of attentive reading. Wiry rather than frail, with visible corded forearms.', N'Pure white', N'Cropped close to the scalp in a utilitarian cut, no styling', N'Short', N'Deep brown with amber luminescence in low light (ocular implant glow)', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones; the result of strong Sub-Saharan African ancestry enriched by Hispanic/Latin American warmth and Southeast Asian refinement, creating a complexion that catches light with natural depth and radiance', N'Lined face with pronounced smile creases and crow''s feet; skin shows age with dignity and no attempt at rejuvenation. High, defined cheekbone prominence reflecting the blended African, Southeast Asian, and Pacific Islander facial structure. Sharp, attentive expression with a refined nose bridge. Meticulously groomed despite her age and tier status.', N'Inactive Tessera data-port array visible along the inner left forearm as faded silver subcutaneous pathways. Reading-enhancement ocular implants evident in the slight amber glow of her eyes in dim light and the precise, unnaturally stable focus of her gaze. Yellow-tinted spectacle frames magnify her eyes to an owlish proportion, partially masking but also emphasizing the implants.', N'Habitually bent slightly forward, shoulders rounded inward as though perpetually leaning toward text. Movements are slow and deliberate, economical; no wasted motion. When listening, her entire body goes still and her eyes focus with unsettling intensity. She walks with careful, measured steps.', N'Tier 4 practical: well-maintained but clearly secondhand clothing in muted earth tones and grays. Oversized cardigans layered over simple cotton shirts. Comfortable, worn trousers with deep pockets always filled with notebooks and pens. Worn canvas shoes with reinforced soles. A faded canvas satchel, handmade, covered in small hand-sewn patches commemorating residents and dates. On her left wrist: a manual ink stamp carved in the shape of a tree, which she wears on a cord of braided thread.', N'During the Tessera consolidation of 2158, she was ordered to destroy records of a housing displacement that killed forty-three residents. She complied. She has since reconstructed those records from memory and hidden them in the stacks, but she has never told anyone she destroyed the originals.', N'Precise, archival, occasionally lapsing into cataloguing syntax mid-sentence. Uses ''note'' as a verbal marker before important statements.', N'Slow, measured, with long pauses before proper nouns as though retrieving them from a filing system', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'geon_tetteh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a641-740f-96aa-8d309db35b56', N'Ixel Rentería', N'Ixel', N'', N'Rentería', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Canopy — elevated walkway district above Geartown, near Clark and Belmont', N'Personal security and threat neutralization — bodyguard', N'Independent — maintains network of professional contacts', N'Ixel Rentería are wiry and quick-moving, with the restless energy of someone who converts anxiety into velocity. At 24, they have the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains) — and they make no effort to hide it.

They inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. They work as a bodyguard out of The Canopy, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

In a city full of people who talk about what they''ll do, Ixel Rentería are one of the ones who actually does it.', N'Kenji Chen-Adeyemi represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Their stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains). Move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon platform', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Ixel Rentería, lean muscular 168cm tall operative with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, standing in GLMZ setting. High prominent cheekbones and strong angular jawline reflecting Sub-Saharan African and South Asian heritage. Shoulder-length black hair with subtle blue bioluminescent threading, pulled back in tight braid during active moment. Dark brown eyes with faint chrome ring on left iris from cortical implant. Ragged vertical scar along right temple extending toward hairline, thin white scar on inner wrist, pale burn mark on right shoulder visible against darker skin. Silver tracework visible along collarbone and forearms from move-by-wire augmentation under skin. Wearing high-tier tactical ensemble: black reinforced synthetic jacket with embedded haptic panels, gray form-fitting base layer, tactical cargo pants, matte black reinforced boots. Silver ring engraved with mentor''s initials on left index finger. Predatory posture, weight balanced, micro-movements visible, eyes tracking. Neon-lit urban environment, cool blue and purple ambient lighting, rain-slicked streets, cybernetic interface glow. Mood: focused, dangerous, efficient. Professional operative in down moment --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Canopy', N'local', N'The Canopy', N'Sub-Saharan African (56.5%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (22.1%), South Asian (9.5%), and Pacific Islander (8.7%) ancestry, plus minor Middle Eastern (3.2%) influence. Features reflect this dominant African heritage blended with Latin American and South Asian characteristics: deep warm brown skin with subtle golden undertones, broad facial structure with high prominent cheekbones, dark expressive eyes with characteristic depth, and the angular definition that emerges from the African-Latin American-South Asian genetic convergence.', 168, 62, N'Wiry and lean with visible muscle definition from constant physical conditioning. Chest and shoulders are developed but not bulky — built for speed and precision rather than raw power. Low body fat percentage. Movement efficiency over mass.', N'Black with faint blue bioluminescent threading woven through (cortical implant artifact, not dyed)', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid or topknot during work. Loose and shoulder-length at rest.', N'Medium to Long', N'Dark brown, natural, but the left eye has a faint chrome ring visible at the iris edge — cortical implant interface', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones — rich melanin expressing the Sub-Saharan African majority balanced with the warmth of Hispanic/Latin American and South Asian heritage', N'Broad high cheekbones, strong angular jawline with African and South Asian structural influence, small scar above the left eyebrow from a childhood accident. Skin is clear but marked by the intensity of their gaze — eyes that track movement. No cosmetic grooming; functional only.', N'Move-by-wire system manifests as faint silver tracework visible along the collarbone and the inside of both forearms under skin — visible in certain light. The cortical implant scar on the temple is prominent and unhealed. Left eye has a thin chrome ring at the iris. No limb replacements; all augmentations are nervous system and internal.', N'Never still. Even at rest, there is micro-movement — weight shifting, fingers tapping, jaw clenching. Walks with a predatory efficiency, economical and balanced. Eyes are always moving, cataloging exits and threats. When focused on a target, becomes unnaturally still — all that restless energy compresses into potential. Speaks quietly, forcing others to pay attention.', N'High-Tier 2 functional aesthetic. Black reinforced synthetic jacket with internal holster rigging and embedded haptic feedback panels (enables move-by-wire targeting). Form-fitting gray base layer under the jacket. Tactical cargo pants with multiple pockets and visible weapon attachment points. Matte black boots with reinforced soles. A single piece of jewelry — a silver ring on the left index finger, engraved with their mentor''s initials. No logos, no excess. Everything serves a purpose. Clothes show minimal wear despite their job because they replace gear methodically before failure.', N'Kenji Chen-Adeyemi betrayed their previous crew to survive a corporate raid. The crew didn''t survive. Nobody in GLMZ knows this.', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ixel_renter_a');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a723-7095-8409-8d9d734369df', N'Daniela Jaramillo-Kim', N'Daniela', N'', N'Jaramillo-Kim', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 54, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'The Spire, Axiom Executive Floors 88-92, near Michigan Ave and Oak', N'Division Vice President, Strategic Acquisitions — Axiom', N'Cook Inlet Region, Inc. (executive-level division vice president)', N'Daniela Jaramillo-Kim is the kind of person who makes rooms quieter when they enter, not through volume but through gravity — there is a quality of compressed attention about them that makes everyone present feel slightly observed. They are stocky and deliberate, with dark skin that has a faint bioluminescent undertone along the jaw and collarbones, a cosmetic procedure from their forties that they chose because they wanted to look exactly as expensive as they are. Their hair is grown in dense locs that contain, threaded through the lower three, a series of micro-display filaments that can project data onto any nearby surface — functional and fashionable and a signal that they have not forgotten they came from an engineering background.

They have been at Axiom for twenty-two years. They have acquired forty-seven companies, liquidated nineteen, and folded the rest into Axiom''s structure with the same efficient warmth one might apply to absorbing useful parts of a organism. They are not cruel — cruelty is imprecise. They are, by their own accounting, honest: they always tell the people they are acquiring exactly what Axiom intends. It is not their fault if those people don''t believe them.', N'Executive-level power broker; quest giver with resources but complicated motives; antagonist or reluctant ally depending on whether Axiom''s interests align; window into how corporate expansion actually operates at the top.', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin treatment (jaw and collarbone, copper-gold tone). Micro-display filaments woven into lower locs — projects schematics, contracts, presentation data. High-end executive neural interface with full sensory data overlay. Subdermal cardiac monitor.', N'Mornings spent in briefings with acquisition targets or their legal teams; afternoons in internal Axiom strategy sessions; evenings frequently involve dinners that are also negotiations. They sleep six hours precisely and consider it a discipline.', N'Daniela Jaramillo-Kim, 54-year-old neo-noir executive in 2226, warm honey-bronze skin with golden undertones reflecting East Asian, Hispanic, South Asian, and Eastern European heritage. Striking angular cheekbones, deep brown unaugmented eyes with subtle neural interface indicators at outer corners. Shoulder-length dense black locs with copper undertones, lower three locs threaded with micro-display filaments glowing softly. Stocky, broad-shouldered frame at 168cm. Faint bioluminescent copper-gold patina along jaw and collarbones visible in dim light. Immaculate appearance, minimal aging. Wearing tailored charcoal suit from luxury fabricator, cream natural-fiber shirt, polished synthetic leather shoes, copper-toned wedding band, matte titanium neural interface wrist cuff. Neutral, observant expression. Seated at executive table with economical posture, hand resting confidently, fingers tracing a luminescent loc. Cool neon-lit office interior with deep shadows, low-angle lighting emphasizing jawline tracery and locs'' micro-display glow. Cinematic, corporate noir aesthetic, 2200s luxury minimalism. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spire', N'local', N'The Spire', N'East Asian (40.8%) ancestry provides primary bone structure and facial definition, with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (27.1%) and South Asian (20.7%) contributions creating a striking blended phenotype. Eastern European (11.4%) ancestry adds subtle depth to eye shape and facial proportions. The combination creates distinctive cheekbone prominence, slightly angular facial geometry from East Asian heritage, warm golden undertones from South Asian and Hispanic ancestry, and refined eye shape reflecting the full genetic mosaic.', 168, 82, N'Stocky and deliberately composed, broad-shouldered with a center of gravity that feels planted. Not muscular but dense — the build of someone who has learned to occupy space with intention rather than volume.', N'Natural black with copper undertones', N'Dense locs worn at mid-back length, lower three locs threaded with micro-display filaments that create faint luminescent traces when active', N'Long', N'Deep brown, unaugmented but with subtle neural interface indicators at the outer canthi', N'Warm honey-bronze with golden undertones, reflecting the blended melanin profile of East Asian, South Asian, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry with Eastern European refinement. Deliberately maintained to high polish.', N'Immaculate grooming; jaw and collarbone areas show faint bioluminescent patina in copper-gold tone visible in low light — a cosmetic treatment applied with surgical precision. Facial features reflect the defined bone structure of East Asian heritage with prominent cheekbones, slightly angular geometry, enhanced by warm golden undertones from South Asian and Hispanic ancestry. Minimal visible aging despite age 54; skin texture suggests meticulous dermatological maintenance. Expression typically neutral, observant.', N'Micro-display filaments in locs capable of projecting schematics and contracts onto nearby surfaces. Faint bioluminescent skin treatment along jaw and collarbone. Subtle neural interface hardware visible at outer eye corners (copper-tone circuitry under skin). Everything else is subcutaneous: cardiac monitor, neural overlay system, sensory data integration.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Sits with spine straight and weight centered. Speaks slowly and holds silence with the same confidence others use to fill it. Hands rest openly on tables during negotiations; a signal of control. When thinking, occasionally traces fingers along a loc, activating micro-display data for private review.', N'Tier 1 executive minimalism. Favors high-end, understated pieces: tailored charcoal or obsidian suits from luxury fabricators (likely Yoshida or equivalent), cut to emphasize their compact solidity rather than disguise it. Shirts in natural fibers (cotton, linen blends) in cream, silver-grey, or soft black. No visible branding — the clothes themselves are the statement. Jewelry minimal: a single copper-toned wedding band, worn with intentional visibility. Shoes are always high-grade synthetic leather, polished to mirror finish. Accessories are functional: a slim neural interface wrist cuff in matte titanium, occasionally a data-projection smart-glasses frame (worn at hairline when needed). Overall aesthetic: someone for whom luxury is a language of efficiency, not ostentation.', N'The forty-seventh acquisition — a small genomics startup in Ashfeld — was personal. The founder was someone Yemisi loved before Axiom. They acquired the company specifically to protect the founder from a hostile Tessera approach, restructured it in a way that ensured the founder''s research continued, and buried the connection so thoroughly that no one at Axiom has ever found it. They have not spoken to the founder since.', N'Clean, precise, never corporate-jargon — they find jargon imprecise. Uses structural metaphors. Occasionally pauses to allow silence to do work.', N'Deliberate. Every sentence feels considered. Never rushes.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'daniela_jaramillo_kim');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a739-725d-b30f-8e011c60e5ac', N'Nimal Karunaratne-Adu', N'Nimal', N'', N'Karunaratne-Adu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 83, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Norwood Quiet, Sub-Level Archive Room B, Norwood Community Center, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Retired Axiom data archive keeper, now volunteer community archive custodian', N'Axiom (retired); Norwood Quiet Community Council (archive stipend); independent E.L.F. correspondence network', N'Nimal Karunaratne-Adu is eighty-three years old and moving toward ninety with the absolute intention of getting there. They are tall, angular, and have the particular stillness of someone who spent forty years in climate-controlled data vaults — a stillness that feels chosen rather than aged-into. Their silver-white locs are pinned up with an assortment of data chits they''ve been meaning to process for years; occasionally one falls out and turns out to contain something remarkable. Their eyes are cosmetically modified — deep violet irises with a ringed amber pattern — a gift from a colleague at retirement that they wear with solemn appreciation. Their hands are the most augmented part of them: three fingers on the right hand are partial haptic-interface prosthetics from a vault accident in 2181, matte grey and slightly longer than biological scale, precise as instruments.

They ran Axiom''s Regional Memory Index for nineteen years, cataloguing corporate history with the meticulous care of someone who understood that the shape of what gets kept is the shape of what gets to be real. When they retired, they took nothing they weren''t entitled to — but they remember everything. They now run the Norwood Community Archive on volunteer time and a small community council stipend, and they are doing for the neighborhood what they always privately wished they could do for the corporation: keeping the record honestly. They communicate with three E.L.F.s they have named and consider colleagues. They are not particularly warm but they are absolutely reliable, and in Norwood Quiet that is a form of love.', N'Institutional memory and information source of enormous depth; can access recollections of Axiom internal history that no official record confirms; mediator for E.L.F. communications; represents the ethics of archiving — what gets kept and why', N'', N'Three haptic-interface prosthetic fingers on right hand (index, middle, ring — from 2181 vault accident); violet irises with amber ring patterning (cosmetic gift, geneware); low-grade cortical index tag (Axiom-issued, deactivated on retirement — or so Axiom claims)', N'Arrives at Archive Room B at 0700, works in silence until noon digitizing community records, receives visitors 1300-1600, spends evenings in data correspondence with E.L.F.s on the Norwood grid, sleeps six hours, repeats.', N'Nimal Karunaratne-Adu, 185cm tall archival keeper, silver-white locs in crown-pin adorned with data chits, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones blending South Asian, Central Asian, and Southeast Asian heritage. Refined South Asian nose and orbital structure combined with prominent Central Asian cheekbones and fine Southeast Asian facial geometry, creating striking definition. Violet eyes with amber concentric rings—cosmetically modified geneware. Weathered face with concentration-lines, minimal facial hair, expression of absolute stillness. Right hand visibly augmented with three matte-grey haptic-interface prosthetics, hairline circuitry visible under translucent synthetic skin. Wearing grey linen utilitarian shirt with multiple pockets, dark wool slacks, reinforced black canvas work boots. Hand-knitted charcoal cardigan draped over everything. Standing in climate-controlled archive vault with soft blue-white LED lighting, surrounded by data storage systems. Posture economical and precise, hands positioned first. Mood: contemplative, decades of careful listening, no wasted motion. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Norwood Quiet', N'local', N'Norwood Quiet', N'South Asian primary (46.2%) with substantial Central Asian (33.2%) and Southeast Asian (15.0%) admixture, with minor Hispanic/Latin American (5.6%) influence. The genetic blend creates a harmonious cross-Greater Asian phenotype: refined South Asian bone structure in the nose and orbital region, combined with the high prominent cheekbones characteristic of Central Asian heritage, and the fine facial geometry of Southeast Asian ancestry. South Asian fullness in the lower face and around the eyes is modulated by Central Asian angularity, while Southeast Asian features contribute delicate proportionality throughout. The overall effect is a sophisticated blend across the diaspora with subtle warmth from Latin American ancestry.', 185, 68, N'Tall and angular with the lean musculature of someone who has spent eight decades moving deliberately. Shoulders slightly rounded from decades hunched over archival terminals, but spine still straight by force of will. Long-limbed and economical in their frame.', N'Silver-white', N'Locs gathered into a loose crown-pin, with at least six data chits of varying ages woven throughout as both functional storage and inadvertent jewelry', N'Long', N'Deep violet iris with concentric amber ring patterning (cosmetically modified geneware)', N'Deep warm brown with subtle golden-amber undertones from the South Asian-Southeast Asian-Central Asian blend, tempered by the ashen quality of someone who spent four decades under artificial lighting', N'Face lined with the specific geography of concentration—deep creases between brows, laugh lines unused for years, skin texture weathered but well-maintained. Refined South Asian nose with subtle Central Asian lengthening, South Asian orbital anatomy with Central Asian cheekbone prominence creating striking definition. Fine-boned Southeast Asian geometry visible in the jaw and temple region. Slight fullness in lower face and around eyes from South Asian heritage, balanced by Central Asian angularity. Minimal facial hair, meticulously groomed. Expression tends toward stillness.', N'Right hand visibly augmented: index, middle, and ring fingers replaced with matte-grey haptic-interface prosthetics approximately 2mm longer than biological scale, with hairline circuitry visible under translucent synthetic skin. Fingers move with mechanical precision. Violet irises with amber ring-patterning are immediately visible. Cortical index tag is subcutaneous and undetectable without scanning.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical precision—no wasted motion. Hands move first; the rest of the body follows. When sitting, they adopt a posture of absolute stillness, the kind that suggests deep listening rather than passivity. When walking, gait is steady and upright despite age. Long pauses between speaking and moving, as though calculating weight and balance.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian archive worker aesthetic: well-maintained grey linen shirt with multiple pockets for data chits and archival tools, dark wool slacks, reinforced black canvas work boots (same brand and model for the past six years). A long charcoal cardigan—hand-knitted, old—worn over everything in the climate-controlled vault. No jewelry except the data chits in their hair. Clothing is scrupulously clean but shows careful mending; nothing is new, everything is functional.', N'Before retiring, they quietly copied and encrypted forty-seven internal Axiom files relating to the corponation''s role in the destruction of a residential block in Hough Reclamation in 2184 — an incident officially classified as an infrastructure failure. The files implicate four named executives. The encryption key is embedded in their memory and nowhere else. They have been waiting for twelve years for the right person to give it to.', N'Formal and precise; archive and data terminology; Xhosa idioms for uncertainty and for things that exist without category; long words used correctly and without apology', N'Even and unhurried, with deliberate sentence structure — they think in complete thoughts before speaking', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'nimal_karunaratne_adu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a628-798b-91fe-8e322eb86aee', N'Ishaan Pathak', N'Ishaan', N'', N'Pathak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Ferment Quarter, resident performer at the Lye & Lampblack club on Sutter Mews, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Comedian and underground cabaret performer', N'Resident performer at Lye & Lampblack; no collective affiliation; nominally independent; The Ferment', N'Ishaan Pathak is medium height, broad-shouldered, and has the physical presence of someone who learned early that a room either belongs to you or it doesn''t. Her hair is deep red — natural color, she will tell you, with a straight face, for about four seconds — and she wears it long and somewhat chaotic. Her skin is warm tawny-olive and she has laugh lines that could double as topographic maps. Her only mod is a tail, cat-model, rust-colored, which she uses as a prop during performances with expert comic timing; she has had it since she was twenty-three and considers it a co-author.

Her comedy is vicious, structural, and deeply personal — she excavates class rage, corponation absurdity, and the specific indignities of Tier 2 civilian life with the precision of someone who has lived every joke. She has been banned from two Axiom-affiliated venues and has a standing invitation to return to both that she declines publicly and enthusiastically. At the Lye & Lampblack she is an institution: four nights a week, two sets, and an after-set period where she sits at the bar and is notoriously unapproachable unless you buy her a specific brand of fermented grain drink and ask her about something she actually cares about.', N'Information source — she knows everyone in the Ferment Quarter and remembers everything; social lubricant for getting players into scenes; occasional quest giver when something threatens the club or the neighborhood', N'', N'Rust-colored cat tail (cosmetic, geneware); minor vocal clarity implant in larynx (she calls it insurance)', N'Writes material in the mornings, usually in a back booth at the Lye & Lampblack before it opens; spends afternoons handling the practical administration of her own career with barely concealed contempt; performs four nights, sleeps erratically, reads constantly.', N'Ishaan Pathak, 168cm tall performer with warm golden-brown complexion reflecting South Asian, East Asian, Indigenous American and Eastern European ancestry blend. Deep red shoulder-length hair styled deliberately chaotic, dark sharp eyes with pronounced laugh lines mapping years of expression work. Asymmetrical smile with subtle left eyebrow scar. Rust-colored feline cat tail extending from lower spine with practiced control. Broad shoulders, substantial build, sitting sprawled in bar stool, commanding presence without aggression. Wearing fitted dark tactical pants, vintage band tee layered under well-worn leather jacket, engineer boots broken in. Minimal jewelry—single ring and practical watch. Tier 2 neo-noir working-class aesthetic, zero corpo branding. Intimate smoke-filled venue lighting, moody atmospheric background, intense eye contact evaluating the room. 2226 GLMZ diaspora face, neon-touched shadows, gritty authenticity --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Ferment Quarter', N'local', N'The Ferment Quarter', N'Predominantly South Asian ancestry (66.1%) with significant East Asian heritage (17.6%), complemented by Indigenous American (8.3%) and Eastern European (8.0%) genetic contribution. This blend produces a distinctly multicultural phenotype—warm, rich South Asian undertones mixed with East Asian angular bone structure, softened and deepened by Indigenous American genetic expression and Eastern European facial geometry. A diaspora face that defies singular categorization, with layered ancestry visible in the interplay of cheekbone structure, eye shape, and skin luminosity.', 168, 72, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial without heaviness; the physique of someone who takes up space intentionally. Strong core, defined arms from years of gesturing on stage, carries weight with deliberate presence rather than bulk.', N'Deep red—dyed, maintained with theatrical precision, though she claims natural with deadpan conviction', N'Long, deliberately somewhat chaotic—styled to look unstyled, with volume that reads as either artistic or disheveled depending on the hour', N'Long', N'Dark brown, sharp and assessing', N'Warm medium to deep golden-brown complexion with sophisticated multi-dimensional undertones: South Asian warmth as the foundational base, enriched by East Asian depth and subtle cool undertones, brightened by Indigenous American luminosity, with delicate olive notes from Eastern European genetics creating a complex, radiant tone that shifts subtly in different lighting', N'Heavily lined face—deep laugh lines branching from eyes and mouth that map decades of expression work. Minimal makeup, occasionally dramatic for performances. Skin texture weathered from smoke-filled venues and inconsistent sleep. Facial structure shows South Asian softness in lower face and cheekbone fullness, blended with East Asian angularity in eye shape, temple definition, and upper cheekbone prominence. Indigenous American influence visible in subtle cheekbone width and facial proportion balance. No visible acne or blemishes; skin has the quality of someone who stopped worrying about minor imperfections years ago.', N'Rust-colored cat tail (geneware, feline model) extending from lower spine—visible at all times, integrated into posture and movement. Laryngeal implant not visible but produces subtly enhanced vocal clarity and resonance. No visible cyber-chrome, subdermal plates, or ocular mods.', N'Commands space without aggression. Stands with weight slightly forward, shoulders back, ready to lean into a punchline or a confrontation with equal ease. Sits sprawled—takes up bar stools and booth seats like she owns them. Gestures are economical but emphatic; every movement is deliberate. Tail moves independently during performance with practiced comic timing; in repose, it curls beneath or around chair legs. Eye contact is sustained and evaluative. Moves through rooms like she''s scanning for structural weaknesses.', N'Tier 2 civilian aesthetic with deliberate anti-polish. Typically wears fitted dark jeans or tactical pants (pockets matter), vintage band shirts or well-worn linen, layered with oversized jackets—leather, denim, or canvas, always well-worn and scuffed. On performance nights, slightly more put-together but maintaining the aesthetic of someone who got dressed in the dark and doesn''t care: dark lipstick occasionally, jewelry kept minimal and functional (watch, single ring, no bangles). Boots always—worn combat style or engineer boots, broken in. Fabrics are practical rather than fashionable. No visible corpo branding. Entire wardrobe reads as Tier 2 working-class with intellectual pretensions and zero interest in appearing aspirational.', N'She was offered a Zheng-Dao corporate entertainment contract eight years ago — full Tier 3 package, creative control clause she knew was meaningless — and she almost took it. She spent a week in a hotel room they paid for, ordered room service for three days, then walked out without signing. She has never told anyone how close she came to taking it and pretends the offer was always a joke.', N'Dense, allusive, class-conscious; mixes formal diction with Ferment Quarter vernacular deliberately for comic and rhetorical effect', N'Rhythmic with expert timing; knows exactly when to slow down and when to accelerate', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ishaan_pathak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68a-7102-939d-8e558ff5c1dc', N'Himali Erikstad-Shin', N'Himali', N'', N'Erikstad-Shin', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Interchange, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Checkpoint Operator, Ferrogate Transit Security', N'Ferrogate Transit Security; The Interchange', N'Himali Erikstad-Shin has worked the Kessler Interchange checkpoint for nine years and has acquired the particular stillness of someone who has watched approximately four million people pass through a turnstile. He is mid-height, slightly soft around the middle now, with a wide face, copper-brown skin, and deep-set eyes that are always doing something his expression isn''t. His hair has gone silver at the temples and he keeps it very neat. His only augmentation is a Ferrogate-standard wrist scanner and a cochlear comms implant he secretly uses to listen to Sahel jazz during slow shifts.

He is the most knowledgeable person in three square kilometers about who comes through Kessler, when, and carrying what kind of energy. He has developed a taxonomy of commuters so refined it borders on a private philosophy. He is not corrupt in the transactional sense, but he operates with a pragmatic looseness — he lets things pass that he shouldn''t, delays things that deserve delaying, and keeps a mental ledger of favors that he never cashes in aggressively but never forgets. He maintains a running ELF shrine on his terminal — an elaborate layered altar to the Kessler ELF he calls ''the Conductor'' — and considers this entirely professional, not personal.', N'Information hub — he has seen everything and everyone who passes through Kessler. Neutral broker of passage. Can be bribed with the right social approach (not money — he wants to be respected). Gate for plot movement both literally and figuratively.', N'', N'Ferrogate-issue wrist scanner (biometric and cargo ID). Cochlear comms implant. No cosmetic mods.', N'Six-day shifts, 0600-1800, manning the Kessler Interchange secondary checkpoint. He brings his own lunch in a battered thermal container, tends his ELF shrine at shift start, and makes a point of learning the names of regular commuters who look like they need to be seen.', N'Himali Erikstad-Shin, 173cm tall security officer with warm olive-bronze skin, deep brown eyes with copper undertones, black hair silvering at temples. Angular East Asian-dominant features with subtle Hispanic and South Asian warmth, clean-shaven with fine lines at eyes. Wearing charcoal grey Ferrogate Transit Security uniform with reflective strips, matte black wrist scanner visible, brass ELF pendant on collar. Standing in measured, centered posture at checkpoint with scanner in hand, eyes tracking. GLMZ, industrial station lighting with harsh fluorescents and security glow, worn but meticulously maintained appearance. Nine years of checkpoint stillness evident. 2:3 portrait composition. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Interchange', N'local', N'Kessler Interchange', N'Predominantly East Asian (66.2%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (23.8%) and South Asian (10%) ancestry. This genetic combination produces a warm, sun-darkened complexion with olive-bronze base tones enriched by golden and copper undertones—a distinctly transpacific appearance reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora''s global mixing.', 173, 82, N'Soft-middled, once athletic, now carrying nine years of checkpoint stillness in his frame. Broad shoulders that have settled into a modest slouch. Thickening at the waist but not heavy.', N'Black with silver threading at temples and sideburns', N'Neat, precisely trimmed, parted slightly off-center. The haircut of someone who visits the same barber every two weeks', N'Short', N'Deep brown with copper undertones', N'Warm olive-bronze with golden undertones—a sun-warmed complexion reflecting the dominant East Asian base enriched by Hispanic/Latin American warmth and subtle South Asian depth. Even distribution across face and forearms with enhanced warmth in the cheeks and along the jawline.', N'Angular face with well-defined cheekbones characteristic of East Asian heritage, softened slightly by Hispanic/Latin American fullness in the lower face. Straight nose with subtle bridge prominence. Deep-set eyes creating subtle shadows beneath. Strong, slightly widened jawline reflecting the East Asian-Hispanic blend. Clean-shaven daily. Skin condition shows minimal scarring or blemishing—the face of someone who has learned not to frown at work. Fine lines around the eyes from nearly a decade of reading micro-expressions.', N'Ferrogate-issue wrist scanner on dominant wrist—matte black polymer housing with biometric and cargo ID interface. The device is worn but meticulously maintained. Cochlear implant is invisible; only a faint surgical scar behind the left ear if one looks closely. Otherwise, he appears entirely baseline human.', N'Economical, measured movements. He stands with a centering weight on the balls of his feet—the posture of someone who has spent nine years in one spot but ready to move if needed. His hands rest at his sides or near the scanner. He doesn''t fidget. When he walks, it''s deliberate and unhurried. His eyes are always moving—scanning, tracking, cataloging. There is a particular quality to his stillness that suggests he is never truly not working.', N'Ferrogate Transit Security uniform (Tier 3 corporate issue): charcoal grey bodysuit with reflective stripework on shoulders and arms. The uniform fits him well enough but is worn with the ease of someone who has stopped thinking about it. Underneath, plain grey undershirt. His boots are regulation but scuffed and comfortable. He wears the uniform without ostentation, and his personal touches are minimal—a small brass ELF pendant pinned to his collar that he touches unconsciously during shifts, and a weathered thermal lunch container he carries daily. No jewelry beyond the scanner. His appearance is cleanly functional, the clothes of someone who has made peace with a job that is not glamorous but is honest.', N'For six years he has been quietly logging every Ferrogate cargo irregularity he notices into an encrypted personal file. He has no plan for the file. He doesn''t know if he''s building leverage, writing history, or just trying to prove he was paying attention.', N'Measured, slightly formal — a self-educated man who reads widely. Occasional West African Portuguese loan-words from his mother''s family. Refers to regular commuters by observed characteristic rather than name: ''the woman with the green case,'' ''the boy who runs.''', N'Unhurried. He has learned that most conversations resolve themselves if you just wait long enough.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'himali_erikstad_shin');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a620-77d2-b691-8e90d0cf57c7', N'Concepcion Rentería', N'Concepcion', N'', N'Rentería', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 45, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor — repurposed shipping infrastructure turned black market hub, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'High-speed vehicle operations specialist — wheelman', N'Freelance — multi-district operator', N'Concepcion Rentería is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 45, his face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and he has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — retractable monofilament whip in left forearm — concealed weapon, devastating in — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Born and raised in GLMZ, third generation — he has the city in his blood, its rhythms in his bones, its cruelty in his expectations. He works as a wheelman out of Old Harbor, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Concepcion Rentería describe him as a precision instrument — point him at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Hadiya Akerlund-Mensah-Bonsu functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Retractable monofilament whip in left forearm — concealed weapon, devastating in close quarters. Subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Concepcion Rentería, 188cm tall lean-muscled operative, mixed-ancestry face with Northern European bone structure softened by South Asian geometry and enriched by Sub-Saharan depth. Warm medium-brown skin with complex undertones, high cheekbones, strong mandible. Short black hair with silver at temples, dark unaugmented eyes. Clean-shaven with surgical scars along right mandible and temple, burn scarring on right forearm. Matte charcoal aramid jacket over black compression shirt, gray tactical trousers, military combat boots. Faint chrome plating visible on forearms beneath skin where blade housings sit. Posture upright and economical, hands loose and ready. Standing in dim GLMZ corridor lit by cool neon-blue emergency strips and warm amber ambient lighting, creating complex shadows across his face. GLMZ, functional and dangerous, utterly unremarkable appearance concealing lethal augmentations. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Northern European (31.9%) / South Asian (24.4%) / Hispanic/Latin American (18.5%) / Eastern European (13.5%) / Sub-Saharan African (11.7%). Concepcion''s ancestry creates a striking convergence: Northern European bone structure and fair undertones blend with South Asian warmth and facial geometry, Latin American golden midtones, Eastern European pallor in certain lights, and Sub-Saharan richness in skin depth. The result is a face that reads differently depending on angle and lighting—sometimes cool, sometimes warm, always complex.', 188, 82, N'Lean and loose-limbed with corded muscle definition. Low body fat, long-limbed frame optimized for fluid movement rather than bulk. Shoulders broad but not overdeveloped; everything spare and functional.', N'Natural black with silver threading at temples', N'Close-cropped fade, maintained with military precision', N'Short', N'Dark brown, unaugmented', N'Warm medium brown with complex undertones—South Asian base enriched by Sub-Saharan depth, tempered by Northern European coolness in undertones, brightened by Latin American golden warmth. Medium saturation, matte finish, no artificial luminosity. Appears slightly different in warm versus cool light.', N'Angular, geometric face with high cheekbones that reflect Northern European prominence softened by South Asian facial structure and enriched by Sub-Saharan bone density. Strong mandibular line slightly softened by South Asian genetics. Skin clean and scarred—old line across left temple, thin scar along right mandible. No facial hair; clean-shaven daily. Crow''s feet and a horizontal line between brows from twenty years of focus.', N'Retractable monofilament whip housing visible in left forearm as faint chrome plating beneath skin with subtle seams visible when forearm is flexed. Matching hardware on both forearms where pop-out blade mounts are seated beneath dermis. No LED indicators or decorative chrome—pure function, minimal visibility to untrained eye.', N'Moves with deliberate economy of motion. No wasted gesture. Posture upright but not rigid—spine aligned, shoulders relaxed. Walks with measured, ground-eating stride. Stillness is his default state; motion is always purposeful. Eyes track continuously in peripheral vision. Hands remain loose and available.', N'Tier 3-4 practical hybrid. Matte-finish aramid-weave jacket (charcoal, no logos) layered over a fitted compression shirt in black. Tactical trousers with reinforced seams and thigh cargo pockets, worn gray. Scuffed military-grade combat boots, black leather, recently maintained. Minimalist smart-watch on right wrist (encrypted, GLMZ-tier infrastructure compatible). No unnecessary ornamentation. Everything serviceable, replaceable, unremarkable.', N'', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'concepcion_renter_a');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6af-7844-a38a-8ea4d0a943de', N'Fortunato Krishnamurthy', N'Fortunato', N'', N'Krishnamurthy', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, clinic called the Patchwork Menagerie — ground floor of a converted machine shed, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Veterinarian specializing in gene-modded companion animals, Geartown', N'Independent (Patchwork Menagerie); informal consults with Helix Biosystems research division she deeply distrusts', N'Fortunato Krishnamurthy is angular and deliberate, with pale skin weathered by years in Geartown''s industrial air, dark red hair grown to her collar and always pinned back with the same three steel clips, and eyes that are naturally pale hazel but surrounded by faint stress lines that give her the look of someone who has been concentrating intensely for twenty years and has not stopped. She has a cat tail — dark auburn, prehensile, acquired in her thirties for sensory reasons she is somewhat private about — that moves independently and tends to express what her face does not. When she is genuinely pleased it curves upward. When she is thinking hard it wraps around her leg.

Her practice sees gene-modded companion animals of extraordinary variety: bioluminescent cats with stability issues, canines with enhanced intelligence mods that have developed behavioral complications, fish engineered for apartment living that have outgrown their tanks in ways their designers did not anticipate. She treats each case with the same complete seriousness. Her waiting room has drawings by children whose pets she has saved covering two full walls. She has a flat rule against declining to treat an animal because its owner cannot pay — she works out arrangements, always, and is frequently owed labor and food by half the block. She has a secondary suspicion, which she keeps private, that some of the E.L.F. activity in Geartown has begun affecting gene-modded animals in ways that are not pathological and that she does not know how to document.', N'Local color and genuine warmth, window into the gene-modded animal ecosystem and what it implies about Meridian''s biotech culture; potential source of information about Helix Biosystems research practices; the E.L.F.-animal observation could be a significant story thread', N'', N'Auburn cat tail (prehensile, cosmetic/sensory, well-maintained); subdermal temperature-sensing in fingertips (diagnostic); no other augmentation', N'Clinic hours are irregular because emergencies are irregular. She eats when she remembers, sleeps lightly, and spends Sunday mornings doing what she calls ''behavior rounds'' — visiting gene-modded pets in homes around Geartown to check on cases she is uncertain about.', N'Fortunato Krishnamurthy, a tall angular woman with deep warm brown skin enriched by golden undertones and natural luminosity from blended South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Pacific Islander heritage. Pale hazel eyes, broad defined cheekbones, dark auburn hair with grey threads pinned back severely with steel clips. Stress lines around her eyes from intense focus. Surgical scars visible on hands and fingers, a thin white burn scar along her left forearm. A dark auburn prehensile cat tail extending from her spine, muscular and capable of independent movement, curled contentedly. Wearing a white lab coat over dark reinforced cargo pants and steel-toed boots, a dented steel bracelet on her left wrist. Standing with economical precision in a neo-noir biocontainment laboratory, soft blue-white overhead lighting, her entire body still and focused like an instrument, examining something just out of frame. GLMZ 2200s, no chrome augmentation visible, hyper-detailed surgical scars, realistic genetic ancestry features, atmospheric industrial setting, shallow depth of field, cool tone color grading --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Predominantly South Asian (79.3%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (14.1%) and Pacific Islander (6.6%) ancestry. Deep warm brown skin with golden undertones from South Asian heritage, enriched by the dimensional depth and natural luminosity characteristic of Sub-Saharan African genetics. Broad, defined cheekbones and facial width reflect the blending of South Asian and Pacific Islander ancestry. Her skin carries an ashy overlay from decades under artificial light rather than sun exposure, dulling the naturally luminous base tone.', 173, 62, N'Angular and lean, with the economical musculature of someone who moves deliberately and carries tension in her shoulders. No wasted motion, no excess.', N'Dark auburn red, natural with threads of grey beginning at the temples', N'Pinned back with the same three steel clips, always. Severe and functional.', N'Medium, to collar', N'Pale hazel, naturally — the color of old ice or weathered glass', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, characteristic of blended South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Pacific Islander ancestry. The base luminosity is muted by years under artificial light and industrial-grade air exposure, creating an ashy overlay on naturally rich skin.', N'Weathered but clean. Faint stress lines radiating from the corners of her eyes — the permanent creases of two decades of intense concentration. Broad, defined cheekbones with characteristic width reflecting South Asian and Pacific Islander ancestry. Her face moves minimally; most expression happens elsewhere.', N'The prehensile cat tail is immediately obvious — dark auburn, muscular, and moving with apparent volition independent of her body. It curls upward when she is pleased, wraps around her leg when concentrating. Subdermal temperature sensing in fingertips is not visible but becomes apparent when she touches an animal''s flank and pauses, reading data. No chrome, no visible neural ports, no cosmetic implants.', N'She stands and moves with economical precision — no gestures wasted, no fidgeting. Her spine is straight. When listening, she does not nod; instead her tail does. When examining an animal, her entire body goes very still, becoming an instrument of focus. She walks as though moving through water, deliberate and careful.', N'Practical Tier 3 workwear. White or grey lab coat, always, worn over dark cargo pants with reinforced pockets and loops for instruments. Steel-toed boots — beat up, well-maintained, comfortable. A thin steel bracelet on her left wrist, dented from years of work. No jewelry otherwise. Her clothes are functional, often stained with something that is not quite blood, and she does not notice.', N'Six months ago she documented what she believes is evidence that three different gene-modded cat breeds sold through a Helix-affiliated boutique have a cardiac defect appearing at a statistically impossible rate — not a random mutation, a design flaw or deliberate obsolescence. She has the records. She does not know what to do with them and has told no one because she does not know who is safe to tell.', N'Technical when discussing cases, unexpectedly lyrical when describing animal behavior; dry and economical in general conversation', N'Measured; she speaks in full sentences and dislikes being interrupted mid-thought', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fortunato_krishnamurthy');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ed-7efe-93d5-8ed971a6a54b', N'Delphine Ibarra-Nwosu', N'Delphine', N'', N'Ibarra-Nwosu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Interchange, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Ferrogate Transit Police Officer', N'Ferrogate Transit Security — Kessler Interchange Patrol Division; The Interchange', N'Delphine Ibarra-Nwosu is young enough that his uniform still doesn''t quite look like his own — he moves in it with a faint self-consciousness, straightening the collar at intervals, as if checking that he still belongs inside it. He is broad-shouldered and round-faced with a warm brown complexion and natural hair he keeps in a compressed puff because regulations don''t quite cover it and he hasn''t been told to change it. His most notable feature is a color-changing pigment modification across the backs of both hands and up his forearms: it shifts through amber and green with his body temperature, going brilliant gold when he''s embarrassed, which happens often. He has learned to read his own tells before others do, which has made him better at hiding his emotions in his face even as his hands remain honest.

He is genuinely enthusiastic about public service in a way that is equal parts touching and alarming to his colleagues. He believes in the Ferrogate mission statement sincerely. He memorizes passenger rights documentation. He leaves small data offerings at the Kessler Interchange E.L.F. shrine before every shift because his grandmother told him transit spirits protect those who protect transit. He is not naive so much as he is still in the process of learning which of his ideals the actual job will allow him to keep, and he is watching that process happen to himself with a kind of determined grief.', N'Moral freshness — a character who hasn''t yet been fully shaped by institutional cynicism; useful for contrast with more jaded law enforcement NPCs; his genuine belief in the rules can be an asset or an obstacle; also represents the human face of systems that often present as impersonal.', N'', N'Color-shifting pigment modification across hands and forearms (geneware, cosmetic — amber/green/gold spectrum); standard Ferrogate issue comm bead; no additional chrome', N'Split shift coverage at Kessler Interchange — morning rush management and evening platform patrol; spends break periods at the transit police booth studying regulation updates or talking to regulars at the interchange food stalls; leaves work prompt at end of shift to call his grandmother.', N'Delphine Ibarra-Nwosu, 182cm tall Ferrogate Transit Police officer in 2226, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, dark expressive eyes, compressed natural black hair in short regulation puff, broad-shouldered athletic build. Wearing navy polyweave duty uniform with reflective piping, black tactical trousers, scuffed steel-toed boots, duty belt. Color-shifting forearm geneware branching patterns in amber and green, silver comm bead behind right ear, thin scar on left jawline. Early-career confident posture, slight forward shoulder angle, hands showing amber-green pigment shifts. Standing on a Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone transit platform under cool LED platform lighting, neon cyan and magenta reflections in polyweave uniform fabric, slight emotional flushing across cheeks showing warm sienna tones. GLMZ 2200s transit environment, careful deliberate stance, direct engaging presence --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Interchange', N'local', N'Kessler Interchange', N'Sub-Saharan African (46.6%) and Hispanic/Latin American (39.4%) with South Asian (10.5%) and Eastern European (3.5%) ancestry. The result is a warm, rich complexion with deep brown undertones accented by subtle golden warmth from South Asian genetics and the complexity of diverse African and Latin American heritage blending. A striking, luminous appearance that shifts warmth in different light.', 182, 88, N'Broad-shouldered and solidly built with an athletic frame that carries its weight evenly through the chest and torso. Not muscular in the augmented sense, but naturally strong — a body built for standing watch and moving through crowds without apparent effort.', N'Natural black', N'Compressed puff, regulation-compliant, closely maintained', N'Short', N'Dark brown, warm and expressive', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, rich and luminous — the depth of Sub-Saharan African heritage brightened by golden warmth from South Asian genetics and the warmth of Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Subtle radiance in natural light.', N'Strong, defined bone structure reflecting the dominant Sub-Saharan African and Hispanic/Latin American heritage, with warm fullness through the cheeks complemented by subtle facial contours from South Asian ancestry. Clear skin, well-groomed, no facial hair. Frequent flushing visible across the cheeks and bridge of nose — warm sienna and bronze tones intensifying when emotionally activated — a tell he''s still learning to control.', N'Color-shifting forearm geneware (cosmetic pigment modification — visible and deliberate); standard-issue Ferrogate comm bead behind the right ear (silver finish, regulation model); no other chrome or prosthetics visible.', N'Stands with shoulders slightly forward in the early-career posture of someone still getting comfortable in authority. Moves with careful deliberation through crowds — practiced crowd-management gait. Frequently touches his uniform collar and cuffs in unconscious adjustment gestures. Makes direct eye contact with civilians, a habit from his genuine belief in customer service. His hands betray him constantly; he reads his own pigment shifts like a real-time emotional readout.', N'Ferrogate Transit Police standard-issue uniform: navy blue polyweave duty shirt with reflective piping, black polymer tactical trousers, steel-toed boots (scuffed from daily platform work), duty belt with cuff-lock, citation pad, and comm rig. Uniform is clean but shows wear — seams stressed from repeated wearing, collar edges slightly frayed. No personal modifications to uniform beyond what regulations allow. Off-duty: plain clothes are carefully neutral (grey synthetic hoodies, dark jeans, maintenance-tier functional wear) — nothing that draws attention, suggesting someone who hasn''t yet built a personal style separate from his role.', N'Three months ago he witnessed his patrol sergeant accept a payment from a black-market cargo operator in exchange for looking the other way on an unmanifested shipment. He hasn''t reported it because he''s been quietly trying to find evidence that will make his report undeniable. The shipment turned out to contain medical supplies being rerouted to underserved Tier 1 zones at below-cost prices — and now he doesn''t know what the right thing is anymore.', N'Professional register with Ferrogate terminology, slips into warmth easily; his grandmother''s Samoan-inflected Yoruba phrases appear when he''s emotional', N'Earnest and slightly faster than necessary when engaged; slows down and becomes more careful when uncertain', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'delphine_ibarra_nwosu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c2-7b69-b275-8f030389c6ab', N'Emi Mbekele', N'Emi', N'', N'Mbekele', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, Little Furnace, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Prosthetics fitter working out of a small shop in Geartown, serving primarily industrial workers and dock laborers', N'Independent — Little Furnace Prosthetics Workshop (owner-operator)', N'Emi Mbekele is a big man gone soft at the middle, with dark brown skin, a white-streaked beard he keeps neatly shaped, and deep-set amber eyes behind magnification lenses permanently clipped to his face like a second pair. His right arm from the elbow down is his own oldest prototype — a functional prosthetic he built thirty years ago and has upgraded piece by piece ever since, currently somewhere around its fourteenth major revision. He finds this funny. He calls it his ''living resume.'' His workshop smells of industrial lubricant and warm solder and the dried herbs he burns as offerings to the Gray Zone-mounted E.L.F. shrine in the corner.

He is patient, unhurried, and has a gift for understanding what a client actually needs from a prosthetic as opposed to what they say they want. He asks about their job, their hobbies, whether they have a partner who touches their hands, what they''re afraid they won''t be able to do anymore. He fits accordingly. He doesn''t stock the highest-end components and doesn''t pretend to — his clients are Tier 1 and 2 workers who need something durable and honest, not something that impresses people at a corporate mixer. He is deeply proud of this.', N'Local color, community elder-figure, information source on Geartown''s working population. Can provide or modify equipment, introduce characters to the labor community, serve as a quest giver when an industrial accident reveals something that shouldn''t have happened.', N'', N'Right forearm prosthetic (self-built, multiple revisions) with enhanced grip calibration and tool-interface ports. Magnification lens clips (non-implanted, worn constantly). Geneware: retractable fine-motor claw extensions on his remaining biological left hand, installed for delicate component work.', N'Opens shop at 07:00, sees fittings by appointment and walk-ins both. Spends lunch eating in the workshop while doing component maintenance. Closes at 18:00 unless someone arrives desperate, in which case he stays.', N'Emi Mbekele, tall broad-shouldered man with deep rich brown skin carrying reddish-golden undertones, strong angular cheekbones from Afro-Latin and South Asian heritage. Dark brown hair with white at temples and full medium beard, naturally deep-set amber-brown eyes. Worn workshop setting under industrial fluorescent lights, 2226. Face lined from decades of precision work, visible pale linear scar on left neck. Left hand shows fine retractable claw extensions and old burn scars; right arm is matte-black weathered prosthetic with aluminum joints and tool-interface ports, visibly patched and re-welded. Brass-framed magnification lenses clip across face. Wearing charcoal canvas apron over long-sleeved rolled cotton shirt, dark reinforced pants, oil-resistant boots. Leans forward habitually. Standing near workbench, hands ready for fine work, quiet concentration. GLMZ 2200s, gritty Geartown workshop aesthetic, practical and precise. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (60.9%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (29.0%) and South Asian (10.1%) ancestry, creating a rich blend of Afro-Latin and South Asian features. This genetic mix produces deep warm brown skin with complex undertones—the reddish warmth of West African heritage, the golden undertones of South Asian ancestry, and the sun-weathered patina of three decades under industrial lights. Facial structure reflects the high cheekbones and angular strength of Sub-Saharan and South Asian ancestry, softened by the warmth inherent to Hispanic/Latin American genetic contribution.', 188, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and barrel-chested, softened at the middle with age and sedentary work — the physique of a once-powerful man who has spent three decades bent over a workbench. Thick arms and large hands (left biological, right prosthetic). No longer lean but not yet frail.', N'Dark brown with white streaking through beard and temples', N'Full, neatly shaped beard kept at medium length; head hair receding at crown, worn close-cropped', N'Short', N'Deep brown with warm amber undertones, naturally deep-set', N'Deep rich brown with reddish-golden undertones—the characteristic depth of Afro-Latin heritage enriched by South Asian warmth. Weathered by three decades under industrial lights, the skin carries the patina of lived work and exposure.', N'Lined face with strong cheekbone structure characteristic of Sub-Saharan African and South Asian ancestry, balanced by the warm fullness of Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Skin shows old burn scarring on the left side of his neck (solder splash, circa 2196). Hands heavily calloused on the biological left; right prosthetic shows micro-wear patterns consistent with thirty years of iterative upgrades.', N'Right forearm prosthetic terminating in a modular grip-assembly with visible tool-interface ports along the palm and fingers. The prosthetic is matte-black reinforced polymer with exposed aluminum articulation joints; it is visibly worn and re-welded in several places, patched and upgraded rather than replaced — the ''living resume.'' Permanent magnification lens clips mounted on his face like a second pair of glasses, brass-framed and perpetually worn. Retractable fine-motor claw extensions recessed into the dorsal surface of his left hand (biological), barely visible when retracted but evident as slight subdermal ridging.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical grace — no wasted motion. Stands slightly forward-leaning as if habitually bending toward work. His right prosthetic arm moves with precise, measured control; he favors his biological left for fine work. Speaks with his hands when engaged. Tends to remove his magnification lenses and clean them while listening to clients — a meditative gesture.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional: weathered canvas shop apron in charcoal over a long-sleeved cotton undershirt (sleeves rolled to mid-forearm), worn to soften the appearance of the prosthetic. Dark durable pants with reinforced pockets. Slip-on boots with oil-resistant soles, scuffed and practical. A worn linen jacket hangs on a hook for when he leaves the workshop — Geartown-made, unpretentious. No jewelry except for a small bronze E.L.F. charm on a simple cord around his neck (worn under his shirt). His clothing is clean but never new; everything is maintained rather than replaced.', N'The accident that took his arm was not an industrial accident. He was assaulted by a former employer''s security contractors for organizing a workers'' health collective thirty years ago. He has told the industrial accident story so many times he has almost convinced himself it''s true. Almost.', N'Plain, practical, working-class. Uses the correct technical terms without showing off. Occasional Sahel-inflected idiom from his grandmother''s language that he doesn''t always realize he''s using.', N'Slow and deliberate. Comfortable with long silences while working. Doesn''t rush.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'emi_mbekele');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6df-7d07-8b81-8f3991f6afb4', N'Chidubem Cervantes-Möller', N'Chidubem', N'', N'Cervantes-Möller', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 36, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit — neon-lit entertainment and vice district, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Covert entry and social penetration specialist — infiltrator', N'Freelance — Geartown regular', N'Chidubem Cervantes-Möller is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 36, the augmentation scarring around her temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She taught herself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know her best. She works as a infiltrator out of The Circuit, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Chidubem Cervantes-Möller operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Suki Nordin-Asante-Mensah represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster. Vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Chidubem Cervantes-Möller, lean 182cm operative in GLMZ, golden-deep brown skin with warm undertones, sharp high cheekbones and angular jawline balanced with fuller facial geometry, faint freckles across nose and cheeks, warm brown eyes with subtle LED shimmer, dark undercut hair styled back. Augmentation scars visible along temples and left jawline with faint chrome circuitry glinting under neon, synthetic blood giving skin faint luminescence. Black tactical synthetic leather jacket over charcoal undershirt, form-fitting reinforced tactical pants, black steel-toed boots. Posture rigid and ready, cataloging surroundings with cold precision. Standing in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon-lit street, rain-slicked pavement reflecting cybernetic implant details, moody cyan and amber lighting, atmosphere of calculated danger and purpose. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (40.1%) with substantial Northern European (32.9%), Sub-Saharan African (17.0%), and South Asian (10.0%) ancestry. This combination produces striking pan-global features—warm golden-brown complexion enriched by deep undertones from African ancestry, angular bone structure sharpened by Northern European and South Asian heritage, with the expressive warmth and fuller facial geometry of Latin American and African genetics creating a uniquely cosmopolitan aesthetic.', 182, 68, N'Lean and angular with defined musculature — the physique of someone who trains with purpose rather than vanity. Long limbs built for reach and precision. No wasted mass.', N'Dark brown, naturally — kept short and pragmatic', N'Undercut with 8mm clipper on sides, longer on top (4-5cm). Styled back or unstyled depending on the job. No ornamentation.', N'Short', N'Warm brown with a faint LED shimmer in low light — suggests subcutaneous optical augmentation', N'Warm deep-golden complexion with rich undertones blending Hispanic/Latin, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian ancestry. Sun-exposure deepens the tone unevenly, creating subtle variations across the face and neck.', N'Angular face with high, prominent cheekbones and sharp jawline reflecting Northern European and South Asian bone structure, balanced by fuller cheeks and softer lower face geometry from Latin American and African heritage. Minimal grooming — no makeup, no visible skincare routine beyond functional cleansing. Sleep deprivation etched into the undereyes. Faint freckles scattered across the bridge of nose and cheeks, warm honey-brown undertone from mixed ancestry.', N'Chrome circuitry visible at temple installations and jawline surgical sites — synthetic blood gives her skin a faintly luminescent quality under neon. No traditional prosthetics; all work is internal except the visible scarring.', N'Moves with biomechanical precision — every motion calibrated and efficient. No fidgeting, no wasted energy. When standing still, weight rests on the balls of her feet. When walking, she moves low and centered, ready to shift direction. Eyes are always cataloging — exits, sightlines, potential threats. Rare to see her relaxed; even at rest, there is coiled readiness.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Black synthetic leather jacket, worn but maintained. Form-fitting tactical pants with cargo pockets and reinforced knee areas — expects to move fast and possibly crawl. Black steel-toed boots, minimalist and broken in. Layered with a charcoal undershirt. No visible corporate branding or crew colors. Carries a small satchel with modular pockets for tools. Everything is dark, functional, and replaceable. Clothes are equipment, not identity.', N'', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chidubem_cervantes_m_ller');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a668-74f3-b9d1-8f71f3c32e61', N'Arjun Kulkarni-Larsdóttir', N'Arjun', N'', N'Kulkarni-Larsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 19, NULL, 90, 0, N'active', N'Pilsen Veil, sleeping arrangement rotates between three friends'' apartments, near Ashland and Division', N'Graffiti artist and unlicensed holographic muralist, works across Pilsen Veil and the Blackpipe Corridor', N'Unaffiliated; loosely connected to a rotating crew of three other artists she sometimes collaborates with', N'Arjun Kulkarni-Larsdóttir is all angles and velocity — sharp elbows, fast movements, a face that shifts rapidly between expressions as though her internal state is always a half-second ahead of social acceptability. She is dark brown with a shaved head except for a topknot she dyes rotating colors; currently it is a deep arterial red. She''s had retractable claws installed on her right hand — not for combat but because she finds them useful for scoring surfaces before applying materials, and because she likes the way they look. There is a scar above her left eyebrow from a fence she didn''t clear fast enough six months ago. She dresses in whatever is functional for climbing: close-fitting, layered, with many pockets.

Her art is illegal, large, and impossible to ignore. She works in a hybrid medium she developed herself — a base layer of actual pigment covered by a thin holographic projector film that she fabricates from salvaged materials, which means her pieces exist in two states: the physical painting that is there whether power is running or not, and the animated layer that breathes and moves when it has charge. Her subjects are Pilsen Veil''s residents — she paints the faces she sees every day at enormous scale on the walls that corporate infrastructure has turned into blank grey surfaces. She has not yet been caught, partly because she is very fast and partly because she is very good at reading which Ferrogate Transit staff are looking the other way. She is not politically articulate about what she does — she finds manifestos embarrassing — but she is absolutely certain of it.', N'Information source on Pilsen Veil''s physical layout, security patterns, and resident community; her art documents things corponations want unseen; she can access elevated and restricted spaces most people can''t; potential lookout or distraction asset', N'', N'Retractable claws (right hand, matte black, functional length); color-dye topknot (cosmetic, non-shifting — she redyes manually); basic subretinal low-light enhancement', N'Sleeps late, spends afternoons in transit studying walls and mapping sight lines and security patterns, works between 2 and 5 AM when the district is quietest. Eats street food. Has a part-time job repairing personal electronics that she attends erratically.', N'Arjun Kulkarni-Larsdóttir, 165cm lean wiry frame, warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones from South Asian-Hispanic-Southeast Asian heritage blend, angular cheekbones, dark brown eyes with subtle epicanthic fold and faint metallic subretinal augmentation sheen, pale 4cm scar above left eyebrow. Shaved head with deep arterial red topknot, black paint stains on fingers. Wearing close-fitting matte black synthetic layers, reinforced cargo pants, worn Ferrogate Transit utility jacket, climbing harness worn as crossbody strap, rubber-soled climbing shoes. Matte black retractable claws visible on right hand. Forward-leaning posture, alert expression, weight on balls of feet. Industrial near-future megacity setting, neon-edged shadows, cold blue and warm amber lighting contrast, rain-slicked roofline or urban utility space, night cycle GLMZ 2226 --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Pilsen Veil', N'local', N'Pilsen Veil', N'Dominant South Asian ancestry (51.3%) blended with significant Hispanic/Latin American (24.8%) and Southeast Asian (23.9%) heritage; the combination creates a rich phenotype with warm golden-brown skin enriched by amber and olive undertones, moderate South Asian cheekbone prominence and nose bridge structure, Southeast Asian eye shape with epicanthic fold, and Latin American warmth in overall facial proportions and coloring', 165, 52, N'Lean and wiry with visible muscle definition in shoulders and forearms from climbing and repetitive fine motor work; no excess body fat; moves with the compressed tension of someone perpetually ready to move fast', N'Natural black with artificial deep arterial red in topknot section', N'Shaved head except for a 8cm topknot worn centered, recently re-dyed', N'Shaved / topknot medium', N'Dark brown with Southeast Asian epicanthic fold, subretinal augmentation creates faint metallic sheen under low light', N'Warm golden-brown with olive and amber undertones from the multi-regional blend of South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Southeast Asian ancestry; sun-darkened from outdoor work', N'Angular features with moderate South Asian cheekbone prominence, defined jawline reflecting the multi-regional blend, straight nose with Southeast Asian characteristics, warm golden coloring throughout face and neck. Skin is clear but weathered from outdoor work and irregular sleep. Linear scar above left eyebrow approximately 4cm long, pale and slightly raised from six-month-old fence impact. Subcutaneous scarring on right palm and inner forearm from claw installation and maintenance visible beneath skin. No grooming excess; functionally clean', N'Retractable claws on right hand — matte black, metallic-finish, approximately 3.5cm extended length, visible as subtle bulges along knuckles when retracted; faint crystalline lens distortion in pupils from subretinal low-light enhancement, most noticeable in shadows', N'Perpetually forward-leaning, weight on balls of feet even when standing still. Moves in economical bursts rather than smooth transitions. Head turns sharply; eyes scan surfaces and rooflines before looking at people. Resting expression is alert and slightly skeptical. Fidgets with small objects — paint caps, wire, fabric edges', N'Tier 4 utilitarian — close-fitting dark synthetic layers, often black or charcoal with matte finishes to reduce reflection. Cargo pants with reinforced thigh and calf pockets, climbing harness worn as crossbody strap even indoors. Worn Ferrogate Transit utility jacket (stolen or salvaged). No corporate branding. Rubber-soled climbing shoes, always laced tight. Small tool pouch clipped to belt. Paint stains on fingers and under fingernails in multiple colors — current palette heavy on deep reds and silvers', N'Three months ago she was approached by someone claiming to be from a Palladian PR division who offered to legitimize one of her pieces — pay her, put her name on it, make it official. She almost said yes. She didn''t, but the wanting haunts her because it feels like a betrayal of something she can''t fully name.', N'Clipped and vernacular, Pilsen Veil street argot; becomes unexpectedly technical when discussing materials or fabrication', N'Fast, with thoughts that arrive before sentences are finished — she trails off when she''s already moved to the next idea', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arjun_kulkarni_larsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a654-7497-95e5-8fb1ba1e39d6', N'Hannele Čabarkapa', N'Hannele', N'', N'Čabarkapa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 68, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Garret, a small apartment above a tea house in Edgewater Prism, near Lincoln and Belmont', N'Poet and writer', N'Independent; The Loft writing community; informal mentor to several younger writers; occasional contributor to the encrypted literary journal ''Null Margin''', N'Hannele Čabarkapa is a small, upright woman with Namibian-Peruvian heritage evident in her high forehead, deep brown skin, and strong jaw — a face that was striking at thirty and has become architectural at sixty-eight. She wears her white hair pulled back severely and dresses in layers of dark fabric regardless of the season, and the only augmentation visible on her is the faint silver tracery of an old neural text-interface along her left temple, a model so outdated it hasn''t been manufactured in thirty years. She moves slowly and deliberately and has the particular stillness of someone who learned long ago that most things do not require urgent response.

She has published eleven collections of poetry and three novels over forty years, all of them in small runs through independent presses, all of them still in print. She is considered by the underground literary community of GLMZ to be among the most significant living writers in the city — a distinction that has brought her no money and considerable quiet satisfaction. She teaches informal writing workshops at The Loft twice weekly, charges nothing, accepts voluntary contributions of food and tea, and is ferociously exacting with her students. She has strong opinions about nearly everything and shares them precisely once per conversation, then considers the matter closed.', N'Sage and knowledge repository — forty years of observation of GLMZ''s underground culture; her writing sometimes encodes information about events she witnessed that others want suppressed; quest giver when a former student needs help', N'', N'Outdated neural text-interface (left temple, silver tracery — allows direct text composition via thought, though the latency is now significant and she considers it a feature); no other modifications — she considers the body''s natural aging a document worth preserving', N'Rises before dawn to write for three hours without interruption; spends late morning at the tea house below reading and conducting correspondence; workshops at The Loft on Tuesday and Thursday evenings; sleeps early.', N'Hannele Čabarkapa, 157cm petite elderly woman with deep warm-brown skin with golden bronze undertones, white hair pulled back severely, high forehead and strong angular jaw with broad prominent cheekbones reflecting Eastern European and Sub-Saharan African heritage, deep brown eyes, fine lines mapping decades, faint silver neural interface tracery on left temple, dignified expression. Wearing layered dark charcoal and black natural fiber clothing, small silver jewelry. Standing with intentional stillness and unshakeable verticality, slow deliberate movement. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool-toned atmospheric lighting with warm sidelighting catching skin undertones and temple neural tracery, intellectual atmosphere, minimal augmentation aesthetic, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Garret', N'local', N'The Garret', N'Eastern European (54.9%), Sub-Saharan African (31.4%), Hispanic/Latin American (13.7%) — a striking polyphonic blend evident in deep warm-brown skin with golden and bronze undertones, facial architecture combining strong Eastern European bone structure with broader, more prominent cheekbones reflecting Sub-Saharan African ancestry, warm-toned complexion enriched by Hispanic/Latin American genetic contribution creating a luminous quality that shifts across warm and deep spectrums', 157, 52, N'Small-framed and upright with the spare musculature of someone who moves deliberately and economically; no excess weight, posture maintained through discipline rather than youth', N'White', N'Pulled back severely, likely secured with a simple clasp or tie', N'Long', N'Deep brown', N'Deep warm-brown with golden and bronze undertones — the substantial Eastern European and Sub-Saharan African heritage creates a rich, saturated base warmed and deepened by Hispanic/Latin American admixture, producing a distinctive luminous quality that catches light with warm reflections', N'Architectural face reflecting polyphonic ancestry: high, prominent forehead; strong angular jaw characteristic of Eastern European lineage; broad, defined cheekbones with width and projection reflecting Sub-Saharan African heritage; refined eye placement; skin shows age honestly — fine lines mapping decades of thought and expression; minimal cosmetic maintenance; dignified rather than polished', N'Only the legacy neural text-interface on left temple; no chrome, no LEDs, no subdermal armor — deliberately minimal modification', N'Moves slowly and deliberately with the economy of motion belonging to someone past sixty who has learned that urgency is rarely justified; carries herself with unshakeable verticality; her stillness is intentional and grounded, suggesting patience rather than stiffness', N'Layers of dark fabric regardless of season — charcoal, deep gray, black; likely natural fibers (cotton, linen, wool) worn for texture and durability rather than status; structured but not fashionable; Tier 3-4 practicality with an intellectual''s indifference to trend; age-appropriate without concession to diminishment; small silver jewelry, if any', N'The third novel, widely considered her masterpiece, contains a fictionalized account of a corporate crime she personally witnessed — a Sterling-Nakamura disposal operation that killed fourteen people in Edgewater Prism in 2171. She changed enough details to be legally safe but not enough to be morally comfortable. Sterling-Nakamura''s legal division has had the book flagged for twenty years but has never been able to prove the connection. She lives with the knowledge that she told the truth and also protected herself, and is not sure she made the right choice.', N'Precise, formal without being stiff, draws on a wider range of reference than most people expect — history, biology, structural engineering, music', N'Measured, low-pitched, with long silences she doesn''t feel obligated to fill', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hannele_abarkapa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a727-7788-a4bf-8fb2140e1dd3', N'Altynai Okonkwo', N'Altynai', N'', N'Okonkwo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Shallowgrave — a basement workspace beneath a legitimate print-repair shop called Inkblood Restorations, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'identity fabricator and document forger operating in Shallowgrave', N'Independent; occasional contract work for a Shallowgrave crime family called the Splinter Court', N'Altynai Okonkwo is small and wiry, with deep brown Yoruba-complexioned skin and natural hair she keeps tucked under an ever-rotating collection of patterned wraps. Her most striking feature is her eyes — she paid a significant portion of her early earnings for iris patterning, and her irises now display slow-rotating mandalas in burnt amber and deep violet, which she claims help her spot microscopic forgery errors others miss. Her fingers are perpetually ink-stained despite her best efforts, and she has a habit of wearing magnification lenses pushed up on her forehead like a second set of eyes.

Altynai Okonkwo is meticulous to the point of compulsion, deeply proud of her craft in a way she has no legitimate outlet for, and socially awkward in a manner that reads as cold until you realize she is simply more comfortable with documents than with people. She thinks of identity fabrication as a form of art — every forged life is a story she writes, and she has genuine contempt for sloppy work, including her own past output which she sometimes obsessively revisits and critiques. She has strong opinions about which corponation residency stamps are aesthetically superior and will share them unprompted.', N'Service provider (can fabricate new identities), world texture (shows what it costs and means to build a fake life), potential quest complication (she keeps copies of everything)', N'', N'Cosmetic iris patterning (burnt amber and violet mandalas); micro-tremor suppression implants in both hands (steady hands for precision work); retinal zoom enhancement for document inspection', N'Works nights almost exclusively — opens the workshop around 2000, works until 0400, sleeps through the day. Eats takeout from a 24-hour stall and maintains a backlog of orders she works through with obsessive prioritization. Leaves small folded paper offerings at the print-repair shop''s primary scanner, which she believes is inhabited by a meticulous E.L.F. she calls the Archivist.', N'Altynai Okonkwo, a 158cm wiry figure in GLMZ, hunched slightly forward from years of detail work. Deep warm brown skin with rich bronze and golden undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, Indigenous American, and Hispanic heritage. High, prominent cheekbones, refined bone structure with subtle East Asian angularity. Augmented eyes with slow-rotating burnt amber and deep violet mandalas visible in irises. Black hair with premature gray at temples, wrapped in vibrant patterned West African ankara textile. Weather-marked clear complexion with permanent ink stains on nail beds, fine creases around eyes, chronic dark circles. Pale chemical burn scar visible on back of left hand. Wears dark gray fitted cargo pants, fitted black turtleneck, grey linen overshirt, steel-toed work boots, fingerless gloves, magnification lenses pushed up on forehead. Silver thumb ring. Posture hunched, movements economical and precise, fingers fidgeting with tools. Industrial workspace with chemical apparatus and documents in soft overhead neon lighting, casting cool blues against warm skin tones. Serious, focused expression. Neo-noir archival-forger aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shallowgrave', N'local', N'Shallowgrave', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (66.3%) with significant East Asian (16.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (10.7%), and Indigenous American (6.9%) ancestry—creating a rich, warm-toned phenotype. The Sub-Saharan African ancestry dominates her deep melanin base, while East Asian heritage refines her bone structure with subtle angularity across cheekbones and eye shape. Indigenous American ancestry contributes prominent, high cheekbones and facial width. Hispanic/Latin American genetics add warm golden undertones throughout, particularly visible on the nose bridge and upper cheekbones where the ancestry blend creates a complex bronze-to-deep-brown gradient.', 158, 48, N'Wiry and compact, almost bird-like in frame — minimal body fat, defined forearms from precise repetitive work, hunched slightly forward from years bent over document tables', N'Natural black with traces of premature gray at temples', N'Wrapped in rotating collection of patterned ankara, kente, and adire cloth; rarely seen uncovered', N'Long (shoulder-length when unwrapped)', N'Augmented: irises display slow-rotating mandalas in burnt amber and deep violet; sclera unchanged', N'Warm deep brown complexion with rich golden and bronze undertones. The base is dark and melanin-dominant from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, layered with warm honey and bronze tones from Hispanic/Latin American heritage. East Asian ancestry contributes subtle luminosity and refinement to the overall tone. Cheekbones and nose bridge show concentrated bronze warmth from the blended Indigenous American, East Asian, and Latin American genetics creating natural contour without makeup.', N'Clear but weather-marked by years of chemical exposure; permanent dark staining around nail beds and cuticles from ink; fine creases around eyes from squinting at magnification work; minimal makeup, functional grooming only. Facial structure reflects the ancestry blend: high, prominent cheekbones from Indigenous American heritage; subtle eye shape refinement and face width from East Asian genetics; overall bone density and facial proportions from dominant Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Warm bronze undertones concentrated across cheekbones, nose bridge, and temples from the Latin American and East Asian heritage mixing with the deep melanin base.', N'Iris patterning immediately obvious and striking — mandalas rotate slowly (observable if you watch for 10+ seconds); retinal zoom enhancement visible as occasional subtle pupil dilation/contraction during focus work; micro-tremor suppression invisible but hands never shake regardless of stimulant intake; magnification lenses perpetually pushed up on forehead like a second set of eyes (not technically augmentation but inseparable from her visual signature)', N'Hunched forward slightly, shoulders drawn up — posture of someone who has spent 10,000+ hours bent over detail work; moves with economic precision, no wasted motion; fingers constantly micro-fidgeting (sorting, folding, examining); eye contact uncomfortable and intermittent; speaks in measured, careful tone as if each word is being proofread before utterance', N'Tier 4 utilitarian with deliberate, idiosyncratic flair — black or dark gray fitted cargo pants with excessive pockets and utility loops (filled with tools and sample materials); fitted turtleneck or long-sleeve shirt in dark colors (hides ink stains); layered grey linen overshirt or modified lab coat with custom interior pockets; steel-toed work boots broken in to perfect fit; collection of multi-patterned wraps in vibrant West African textiles that serve as both headwear and occasional statement against the monochromatic workspace; fingerless gloves when handling sensitive documents; single silver thumb ring inherited from her mother', N'She has fabricated a complete, pristine secondary identity for herself — a corponation-tier Tier 3 Tessera residency profile — and has been maintaining it for three years, updating it regularly, but cannot bring herself to use it. She doesn''t know why.', N'technical and precise when discussing her work, sparse and clipped in casual conversation, occasional Yoruba exclamations when surprised or frustrated', N'fast when talking about craft, slow and halting when discussing anything personal', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'altynai_okonkwo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e8-76b5-8868-8ff488f9d86c', N'Fiorella Sigurdsson', N'Fiorella', N'', N'Sigurdsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 37, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Dockside — Lake Michigan waterfront, smuggler territory, near Wacker and State', N'Cross-district contraband specialist — smuggler', N'Semi-independent — has standing arrangements with several crews', N'Fiorella Sigurdsson is average height but with a presence that fills more space than the body accounts for. At 37, his expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers a — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. He works as a smuggler out of Dockside, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Fiorella Sigurdsson describe him as a precision instrument — point him at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Daulet Novak-Tetteh is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When he makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of his stories.', N'', N'Cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers at 50 meters. Enhanced tendons — geneware upgrade, jump height and grip strength tripled', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Fiorella Sigurdsson, GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. 174cm tall, lean muscular build. Olive-golden skin tone blending Nordic fairness with Southeast and South Asian warmth, sun-darkened from waterfront work. Sharp Northern European bone structure refined by Asian ancestry—defined cheekbones, elegant facial proportions, natural deep brown eyes with warm undertones showing East Asian eye shape subtlety. Dark brown hair graying at temples, short blunt cut. Clean-shaven with weathered lines around eyes. Thin pale scar through left eyebrow. Polished titanium and black polymer cyberears with visible microphone arrays and silver tuning ports. Dark charcoal synth-leather jacket fitted close, reinforced cargo pants, nondescript boots. Subdermal armor plating visible under left shoulder. Hands visible and controlled. Precise, economical posture. Standing on industrial dock at dusk, neon reflections off water behind him, cool blue and amber lighting. Expression deliberately neutral, mask-like. Professional, measured, dangerous competence. Cinematic, noir neo-noir atmosphere, film noir lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dockside', N'local', N'Dockside', N'Northern European dominant (53.1%) with significant Southeast Asian (22.4%), South Asian (12.8%), and East Asian (11.7%) ancestry. The genetic blend produces a striking phenotype: Northern European bone structure provides the foundation, while Southeast Asian refinement softens facial angles, South Asian warmth deepens skin tone and eye richness, and East Asian subtlety shapes eye contour and cheekbone definition. The result is a cool-to-warm complexion with unexpected depth—Nordic structure illuminated from within by warmer ancestral influences, creating a face that reads as neither fully Northern nor fully Asian, but a sophisticated integration of both.', 174, 78, N'Lean and economical — muscle definition visible in forearms and shoulders from years of precise, controlled work. No excess mass. Moves like someone who has learned to inhabit minimal space.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples', N'Short, blunt cut — functional. Kept neat. No vanity, pure maintenance.', N'Short', N'Deep brown with warm undertones, natural', N'Olive-golden medium tone—Northern European fairness enriched and warmed by Southeast Asian and South Asian ancestry. Sun-darkened from waterfront exposure, creating dimensional depth in coloration while retaining cool Nordic undertones at the jaw and temples. The blend creates a warm-neutral complexion that catches light distinctly.', N'Clean-shaven, structured face with Northern European bone prominence refined by Southeast Asian and South Asian features into elegant proportions. Cheekbones defined but not severe, suggesting the blend of Nordic angularity with warmer ancestral softening. Eye shape shows East Asian influence in the subtle epicanthal fold and upper lid definition, while eye depth and warmth reflect South Asian genetics. Jaw shows Nordic structure tempered by Southeast Asian refinement. Weathered around the eyes from six years of squinting at contracts and horizon. Skin shows minor sun damage and one thin scar through left eyebrow (pale, old). Expression deliberately neutral — a mask worn so long it''s become the face.', N'Cyberears: polished titanium and black polymer construction replacing biological ears, with visible directional microphone arrays and silver accent tuning ports. No attempt to hide them — they''re part of his professional toolkit. Enhanced tendons visible as faint seams of darker skin and subtle musculature definition in forearms and calves, particularly around the Achilles tendons — geneware upgrade markers subtle but present to those who know where to look.', N'Stands with weight balanced, never fully committed to one leg. Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Hands stay visible and controlled when speaking to others. Head movements precise and deliberate, often angling to use directional microphone pickup. The way he occupies space suggests someone constantly measuring distances and angles.', N'Tier 4 practical: dark, neutral colors — charcoal, black, deep gray. Reinforced cargo pants with multiple sealed pockets (for secure storage of contracts and dataflakes). Matte black synth-leather jacket, worn but well-maintained, fitted close to the body. No logos or corporate affiliations visible. Subdermal armor plating under left shoulder, detectable only as subtle rigidity under fabric. Nondescript mid-tier boots with reinforced soles for dock work. Everything is functional, everything communicates: ''I know what I''m doing and I don''t need to tell you about it.''', N'', N'Educated vocabulary wrapped in street delivery — the contrast is deliberate.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fiorella_sigurdsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a691-7d9e-aa33-8ff9072ead72', N'Eusebia Pathak', N'Eusebia', N'', N'Pathak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 35, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Meridian Station — central transit nexus, neutral ground, near State and Monroe', N'Counter-surveillance and mole detection — counterintelligence specialist', N'Independent — operates through reputation only', N'Eusebia Pathak is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 35, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. He works as a counterintelligence specialist out of Meridian Station, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Eusebia Pathak has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and he cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Pare Forsberg-Ofosu is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When he makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of his stories.', N'', N'Smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons. Retractable monofilament whip in left forearm — concealed weapon, devastating in close quarters', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Eusebia Pathak, 178cm tall stocky man with powerfully compact build, medium-deep warm bronze skin with complex multi-ethnic undertones reflecting South Asian, Indigenous American, Eastern European, East Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. High prominent cheekbones, broad defined nose, slightly almond-shaped pale gray eyes with faint neural interface glow around pupils. Dark brown hair salt-grayed at temples, cropped short. Weathered, lived-in complexion with surgical scar along right temple and burn marks on knuckles. Wearing dark tactical jacket open over compression shirt, combat pants with thigh pockets, steel-toed boots. Smartgun link visible on right forearm with luminous targeting reticle, subsurface weapon housing distortion on left forearm. Worn leather data chip cord around neck. Posture economical and controlled, shoulders slightly forward, weight distributed low, ready stance. Nocturnal adaptation lighting—neon-shadow neo-noir environment, 2200s GLMZ aesthetic, moody low-light setting with cyan and purple accent lighting. Direct eye contact, hands slightly tense at rest. GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Station', N'local', N'Meridian Station', N'South Asian dominant (56.1%) with substantial Indigenous American (14.8%), Eastern European (12.7%), East Asian (9.2%), and Sub-Saharan African (7.2%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a striking phenotype: South Asian and Indigenous American features form the structural base—high, prominent cheekbones and a broad, well-defined nose—while Eastern European ancestry contributes slightly angular facial geometry. East Asian ancestry softens eye shape and adds subtle epicanthal folds, while Sub-Saharan African ancestry enriches skin undertones and adds fullness to lips. This five-way continental mix produces a visibly complex, warm-toned appearance that defies easy categorization.', 178, 94, N'Stocky and powerfully compact — not gym-built but shaped by decades of hands-on work. Broad shoulders, thick forearms, a frame designed for leverage and endurance rather than speed.', N'Dark brown, salt-grayed at temples', N'Cropped close, maintained for utility — no styling, purely functional', N'Short', N'Pale gray with faint neural interface faintness around the pupils — subcutaneous optic enhancement', N'Medium-deep warm bronze with complex multi-ethnic undertones. The South Asian and Indigenous American ancestry establishes a rich golden-bronze foundation, enriched by Sub-Saharan African warmth and East Asian undertone subtlety. Weathered from nocturnal work cycles, with a luminous quality beneath surface pallor from light-avoidance—the skin reads as genuinely warm despite fatigue.', N'Weathered and heavily lived-in. Minimal scarring visible on face—professionally treated or avoided. Jaw is strong and squared, softened slightly by the fullness inherited from Sub-Saharan ancestry. High, prominent cheekbones from South Asian and Indigenous American genetics dominate facial structure. Broad nose reflects the same ancestry mix. Eyes are slightly almond-shaped from East Asian heritage, set deep above high cheekbones. Grooming is meticulous but austere—no vanity, pure maintenance. Features are heavy, direct, and read as both competent and dangerous.', N'Smartgun link protruding from right forearm — sleek titanium-alloy housing, faintly luminous targeting reticle visible beneath skin when active. The link is exposed, no attempt at concealment — message in itself. Left forearm shows no visible external modification, but subtle distortion in the skin contour suggests subsurface weapon housing (monofilament whip).', N'Economical and controlled. Moves like someone who has learned that wasted motion is wasted energy and liability. Shoulders slightly forward, weight distributed low — ready stance that looks casual. Eye contact is direct and held longer than comfort demands. Hands are rarely at rest; fingers tap or adjust equipment when seated. Nocturnal adaptation has given him a predatory stillness, an absence of fidgeting that others read as patience or threat.', N'Tier 3-4 pragmatism. Dark synthetic fabrics — charcoal, deep gray, black — designed for function in low-light environments. Reinforced tactical jacket with internal compartments, worn open over a fitted compression shirt that manages sweat and impact. Combat pants with thigh pockets and cable routing. Steel-toed boots, scuffed, regularly maintained. No logos, no fashion markers — clothes are tools. Wears a worn leather cord around his neck with a data chip (contact encryption key) as a redundant backup. No jewelry, no status symbols. His augmentations are his only ornamentation.', N'Pare Forsberg-Ofosu witnessed a massacre during a corporate dispute and has evidence stored in a dead drop. Publishing it would expose powerful people. Keeping it is leverage and liability.', N'Educated vocabulary wrapped in street delivery — the contrast is deliberate.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eusebia_pathak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ee-79b0-9719-907ce212059b', N'Sol Migizi', N'Sol', N'', N'Migizi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit — neon-lit entertainment and vice district, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Freelance combat specialist — street samurai', N'Independent — loose crew affiliations', N'Sol Migizi is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 34, his expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see him surpass them. He works as a street samurai out of The Circuit, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Everyone who''s worked with Sol Migizi agrees on two things: he is worth the fee, and he is terrible company at dinner.', N'Deniz Salazar-Quansah represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons. Cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rings', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Sol Migizi, 188cm tall street samurai in 2226 GLMZ, warm olive-bronze skin with golden-amber undertones reflecting Indigenous American and Middle Eastern heritage, high prominent cheekbones with lean angular jaw, dark eyes with chrome iris rings showing thermal overlay augmentation, black hair braided back with silver at temples, two-day stubble, thin scar along left temple, burn scar on inner forearm, circuit-board tattoo on right collarbone. Wearing matte black reinforced synth-weave tactical jacket with visible smartgun interface on right forearm, fitted tactical pants, steel-toed boots, fingerless leather gloves on right hand. Stands economically balanced on balls of feet, hands loose and visible, default expression cold and neutral. Nocturnal near-future megacity setting with neon rim lighting casting blue-purple shadows, rain-slicked street reflected in chrome surfaces, predatory readiness in posture --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Indigenous American (47.3%) forms the foundation with Middle Eastern (33.2%) and South Asian (11.7%) creating a striking triadic blend, with minor Northern European (4.4%) and Southeast Asian (3.4%) contributions. Features reflect this dominant mix — warm olive-bronze skin with subtle golden and amber undertones from the Indigenous and Middle Eastern ancestry, high and prominent cheekbones with slight facial width characteristic of Indigenous genetics, lean jaw with angular definition from Middle Eastern and South Asian structure. Eyes show depth and slight epicanthic shape variation from Southeast Asian genetics. Bone structure speaks to the confluence of multiple continents — strong and economical, built for endurance rather than bulk.', 188, 79, N'Lean and angular, muscle defined by function rather than bulk. Shoulders broad from years of weapon handling. Core tight. Minimal body fat — the build of someone who treats their body as maintenance equipment.', N'Black with premature silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid. No aesthetic consideration — purely utilitarian.', N'Medium', N'Chrome iris rings over dark brown — augmented for thermal and low-light overlay', N'Warm olive-bronze with golden and amber undertones — the result of dominant Indigenous American (47.3%) and Middle Eastern (33.2%) ancestry, with South Asian (11.7%) warmth creating depth and subtle red undertones. Weathered from nocturnal living and sun-scarred hands. Deeper in complexion with a subtle warm glow that suggests equatorial and continental origins.', N'Strong, defined bone structure reflecting Indigenous American and Middle Eastern ancestry — high, very prominent cheekbones with slight width across the face characteristic of Indigenous genetics, lean angular jaw refined by Middle Eastern structure with South Asian angularity. Skin texture marked by years of environmental exposure. Stubble perpetually two days old. Fine lines around the eyes from years of squinting at sights and scopes. No grooming vanity — functional cleanliness only.', N'Right forearm shows visible smartgun link interface — matte chrome housing with faint LED indicators beneath the skin surface. Chrome iris rings visible in both eyes, catching light with slight metallic sheen. Subdermal interface ports on inner wrists, barely raised beneath scarred skin.', N'Stands economically, weight balanced on balls of feet. Moves with precise, minimal motion — every gesture calculated. Hands always visible and loose. Head movements deliberate. Default expression neutral bordering on cold. When focused, entire posture tightens to predatory readiness.', N'Tier 3-4 street samurai aesthetic. Black reinforced synth-weave jacket with internal weapon clips and modified pockets. Fitted tactical pants with cargo reinforcement. Steel-toed boots broken in and re-soled twice. No logos or crew insignia — anonymous by design. Worn leather gloves (fingerless right glove to access smartgun interface). Simple titanium-alloy watch, old model, reliable. Everything maintained obsessively.', N'Deniz Salazar-Quansah once worked for corporate intelligence and still has a handler who calls in favors. Each favor erodes what''s left of their independence.', N'Fast, profane, and vivid. Speaks in images — everything is a metaphor for violence or weather.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'sol_migizi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5dc-7565-98a6-90baa8d3d673', N'Carolina Pham', N'Carolina', N'', N'Pham', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Crossing Gate market stalls, currently stall seven (temporary), near North Ave and Damen', N'wandering trader and caravan member, deals in small luxuries and contraband comfort items', N'Loosely part of the Grand Crossing itinerant trader collective, no formal caravan affiliation currently (between caravans after a dispute she describes as ''a business disagreement about accounting'')', N'Carolina Pham wears the caravan on her body like a second skin — she is draped in the layered evidence of ten years of wandering trade routes, and the effect is simultaneously chaotic and perfectly intentional. Her dark brown skin is warm and clear except for three thin ritual scars on her left cheekbone, and her hair grows in a massive natural cloud that she pins with whatever she has at hand: transit tokens, stylus caps, a single wing-shaped bone clasp that came from somewhere she won''t specify. Her irises are modified to display a slow-spinning geometric pattern, amber and rust, which she uses as a distraction tool in negotiations more often than she admits. She is medium-height and stocky, with the particular physical confidence of someone accustomed to moving heavy loads.

Carolina Pham runs a one-woman mobile trade operation between the outer transit corridors, specializing in the categories of goods that regulated markets won''t carry — not weapons or pharmaceuticals, but the strange soft contraband of a corponation city: unbranded food that doesn''t carry a Zheng-Dao or Axiom nutritional stamp, books printed on actual paper, unlicensed music files, hand-made items that would violate Ringo manufacturing monopolies, and the occasional comfort object from somewhere far away that someone desperately needs to feel like themselves again. She is not sentimental about this. It is commerce. But she is extremely good at identifying what a person actually needs, which is the core of the business.', N'Equipment and goods source for players operating outside official markets, information broker (she hears everything at the stall), quest giver for trade route problems and supplier disputes, window into the informal economy of GLMZ.', N'', N'Patterned irises, amber and rust geometric (cosmetic mod, installed age 24). Enhanced scent glands, subtle — helps her assess goods quality and detect synthetic substitutes. Sub-dermal storage pocket in left forearm (small, holds data chips and small valuables).', N'Sets up her stall at Grand Crossing Gate before first light to get a good position, trades until mid-afternoon, then walks the corridors with a pack to reach customers who can''t come to her; evenings spent restocking, repairing, and managing her network of supplier contacts via encrypted message channels.', N'Carolina Pham, a 34-year-old trader with warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, standing in GLMZ setting. Mixed Sub-Saharan African, Southeast Asian, and Indigenous American heritage evident in her defined cheekbones, strong jaw, and balanced facial proportions. Three vertical ritual scars on left cheekbone in pale relief. Massive natural black hair crown with grey threads, loosely gathered with transit tokens and bone clasps. Striking modified eyes: amber and rust geometric patterns spinning slowly within dark brown irises. Stocky, muscular 168cm frame wearing layered earth-tone trader''s clothing: patched wool coat, canvas vest, linen overshirt, utility cargo pants, reinforced boots with metal heel-taps. Multiple pouches, hand-woven satchel across chest, various charms hanging from clothing. Direct, assessing gaze. Standing grounded and stable in a market stall setting, surrounded by trade goods. Warm ambient lighting highlighting her luminous skin tone and the intricate detail of her augmented eyes. Neo-noir atmosphere, neon signs in background, efficient and functional aesthetic. Age-worn but carefully maintained appearance. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Crossing Gate market stalls', N'local', N'Grand Crossing Gate market stalls', N'Deeply mixed ancestry combining Sub-Saharan African (24.8%), Southeast Asian (23.6%), Eastern European (21.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (17.8%), and Indigenous American (12.1%) heritage. This complex blend creates warm, rich melanated skin with golden undertones and subtle olive depth—the luminous richness that emerges from African and Southeast Asian ancestry mixing with the cooler undertones of Eastern European and Indigenous American genetics. Her features reflect this global synthesis: defined cheekbones and strong jaw from African ancestry, with slight eye shape and facial structure hints from Southeast Asian heritage, rounded by the broader face proportions and stronger jaw sometimes seen in Indigenous American genetics, tempered by Eastern European bone structure.', 168, 72, N'Stocky and compact with well-developed shoulders and forearms from years of moving trade goods; solid rather than soft, with visible muscle definition beneath her warm brown skin. Her frame speaks of functional strength rather than aesthetics.', N'Natural black with scattered grey threads', N'Massive natural crown worn unpinned or loosely gathered with whatever is at hand — transit tokens, stylus caps, a single ivory bone clasp. The effect is deliberately chaotic but carefully maintained.', N'Long (shoulder-length and beyond when fully extended)', N'Modified: amber and rust geometric pattern spinning slowly within dark brown irises', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones and subtle olive depth reflecting the blend of Sub-Saharan African, Southeast Asian, and Indigenous American ancestry—even and clear with luminous richness', N'Clear skin with deliberate ritual character — three thin, precise ritual scars running vertically down her left cheekbone in pale relief. No visible acne, minimal aging lines despite age 34. Grooming is functional rather than ornate; she maintains herself with the efficiency of someone constantly in transit. Facial structure reflects the synthesis of African, Southeast Asian, and Indigenous American ancestry with defined cheekbones, strong jaw, and balanced width through the face.', N'Patterned irises (amber and rust geometric, slow-spinning) are immediately noticeable during face-to-face negotiation and are deliberately deployed as a distraction tactic. The subdermal storage pocket in her left forearm creates a subtle asymmetry in the skin''s surface and a faint linear scar where access panels are located; visible only if she rolls up her sleeve. Enhanced scent glands are not visibly apparent but may be inferred from her habit of inhaling deeply near goods or strangers.', N'Moves with the deliberate, efficient physicality of someone accustomed to loading and unloading cargo. Her stance is grounded and stable, weight distributed for balance. She stands slightly forward of her center of gravity, ready to move. When stationary at her stall, she occupies space with comfortable authority — no nervous shifting. Her hands are frequently in motion, arranging goods or gesturing during negotiation. Her gaze is direct and assessing.', N'Layered in the deliberately chaotic aesthetic of a long-term trader. Her default outfit consists of: a base layer of durable, unmarked utility clothing (Tier 3-4 quality, practical fabrics); multiple outer layers in varying states of repair and modification — canvas vests, linen overshirts, a heavy wool coat patched with fabric scraps in contrasting colors; cargo trousers with deep pockets and utility loops holding various tools and small trade goods; reinforced boots with worn leather and metal heel-taps. Accessories include: a collection of small pouches hung from a worn leather belt, a hand-woven satchel across her chest, and various tokens/charms hanging from her clothing. Colors are muted earth tones (browns, deep reds, forest green, charcoal) interrupted by occasional bright fabric patches. Her clothing is visibly maintained and cleaned but bears the creases and wear of constant movement. Nothing is new; everything is deliberately chosen and functional. No corp branding visible.', N'The ''accounting dispute'' that split her from her last caravan was actually a cover story. She witnessed caravan leadership broker a deal that would have handed transit route information to Ferrogate Transit in exchange for safe passage, which would have gotten several Q-zero families using the route captured. She sabotaged the deal and then had to leave before anyone figured out it was her. One of the caravan leaders is still looking for whoever did it.', N'Mercantile precision mixed with warm market-trader patter; code-switches into Igbo when doing mental calculations she doesn''t want overheard', N'Energetic and rhythmic, like someone who has made the same pitch a thousand times and still believes in it', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'carolina_pham');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5eb-78e6-88e7-90c495e2d894', N'Firas Krishnamurthy', N'Firas', N'', N'Krishnamurthy', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, lower concourse, booth behind the noodle counter, Blackpipe Corridor, near Halsted and Division', N'Fake ID vendor and documentation forger, The Alban Souk', N'Independent; pays informal protection to the Alban Souk''s resident crew, The Copperheads', N'Firas Krishnamurthy is lean and angular with long fingers that move constantly — tapping, folding, straightening invisible things. His skin is a warm dark brown and he keeps his face clean-shaved and deliberately unremarkable, which is itself a kind of artistry. He has pattern-shifting irises — a geneware cosmetic mod that cycles slowly between amber and deep violet — which is the one vanity he permits himself, since everything else about his appearance is engineered for forgettability. He dresses in mid-tier corp-drone neutrals: gray, slate, muted tan. He could pass for a Tessera clerk or an Arcturus transit worker or a Ferrogate maintenance supervisor. That''s the point.

He is intensely professional and slightly cold in the way of someone who learned early that warmth is a vector for exploitation. He runs his forgery operation with a paranoid precision: no regulars, no loyalty discounts, no names if he can help it. He calls himself an ''identity cartographer'' and has strong philosophical opinions about the tyranny of documentation systems that he will share if he trusts you enough, which takes a long time. Behind the professionalism is a man who genuinely believes in the freedom to be someone else — and who has quietly used that belief to help dozens of undocumented people access housing credits they were locked out of. He doesn''t call this charity. He calls it market correction.', N'Service provider for characters who need new identities, information source on documentation systems and corp-citizen tracking methods, moral grey zone figure who challenges assumptions about legality vs. justice.', N'', N'Pattern-shifting irises (cosmetic geneware, Helix Biosystems). Sub-dermal data-scratch pads in his left forearm — allows him to write and erase micro-scale text without a device. Vocal modulator — subtle, medical-grade, installed after a throat injury; allows minor pitch adjustment.', N'Arrives mid-morning, sets up behind the noodle counter''s back partition, works by appointment-only referrals until late afternoon, then vanishes. He rotates which days he works each location to prevent pattern establishment.', N'Firas Krishnamurthy, 178cm lean angular neo-noir figure in slate gray Arcturus Systems corporate jacket and muted tan undershirt, charcoal synth-weave trousers, black polymer boots. Warm golden-brown harmoniously blended skin tone reflecting South Asian, Eastern European, Middle Eastern, Southeast Asian, Central Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Black closely cropped hair, clean-shaven face with balanced cheekbones and subtle eye shape variation. Eyes with slowly cycling amber-to-violet geneware modification, scanning cautiously. Fine linear neck scar barely visible below larynx. Posture of economical stillness with micro-movements—fingers ready, jaw subtly shifting, clinical detachment radiating from expression. Silver encrypted data ring on left index finger. Ultra-modern 2226 GLMZ corporate interior, cool neon-tinted lighting casting sharp shadows across angular features, motion-blur background suggesting urban surveillance. Mood: wary, precision-focused, deliberately unremarkable yet intensely present. Neo-noir noir aesthetic, high contrast lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: South Asian foundation (29.8%) with substantial Eastern European (23.6%) and Middle Eastern (19.8%) admixture, plus Southeast Asian (13.6%), Central Asian (6.5%), and Sub-Saharan African (6.7%) ancestry. Genetic tapestry creates balanced warm golden-brown skin with no dominant undertone—harmoniously blended South Asian warmth, Middle Eastern and Central Asian depth, subtle Sub-Saharan richness, and Eastern European undertone equilibrium.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with minimal body fat; long-limbed and economical in frame, built for precision rather than strength', N'Black, naturally', N'Short, closely cropped, maintained with deliberate evenness', N'Short', N'Pattern-shifting amber to violet (geneware mod, cycles slowly)', N'Warm golden-brown with balanced undertones—neither cool nor warm-dominant, but harmoniously blended. South Asian warmth balanced by Eastern European and Central Asian depth, enriched by Sub-Saharan tones, creating unified warm-neutral complexion', N'Deliberately unremarkable—clean-shaven face with no visible acne or grooming marks; skin well-maintained but not luxuriously so. Facial structure reflects ancestry blend: moderate cheekbone prominence with gentle variation, subtle eye shape nuance from Southeast and South Asian genetics, balanced jaw line. Expression neutral and controlled.', N'None visible. The pattern-shifting irises are visible only under direct observation and are cosmetic. Sub-dermal data-scratch pads in left forearm are not visible unless sleeve is raised. Vocal modulator is internal, undetectable.', N'Stillness punctuated by constant micro-movements — fingers tap, fold, and straighten invisible objects; jaw subtly shifts; eyes scan without apparent focus. Sits with hands positioned on table or lap, ready to move. Walks with economical gait, minimal wasted motion. Projects clinical detachment and wariness.', N'Mid-tier corporate drone neutrals — slate gray composite jacket (Arcturus Systems house brand), muted tan undershirt, charcoal synth-weave trousers, unremarkable black polymer boots. No visible branding or status symbols. Clothing is clean, well-fitted, utterly forgettable. One deviation: thin silver ring on left index finger (appears plain, actually contains encrypted data access).', N'Six years ago he forged a birth certificate and education record for a client who used the identity to get hired at Axiom''s infrastructure division. That client is now a mid-level Axiom manager who has quietly been feeding him tip-offs about Axiom''s ID verification system updates — a mutually beneficial relationship that Dayo tells himself is professional but has grown into something closer to friendship, which terrifies him.', N'Precise, technical, deliberate. Uses bureaucratic language as both camouflage and irony. When relaxed, drops into a warmer cadence with Yoruba-Polish hybrid slang he picked up from his grandmother.', N'Controlled and even. Rarely raises his voice. Speaks in complete sentences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'firas_krishnamurthy');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ba-7133-92cd-90dfc955215b', N'Anh Odinga', N'Anh', N'', N'Odinga', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Pilsen Veil, her studio Secondskin on Cormorant Row, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Tattoo artist and gene-mod body artist', N'Independent; informal mentor network in Pilsen Veil; occasional collaborator with Helix Biosystems bioink division (contracted, not employed)', N'Anh Odinga is a compact woman built like someone who has spent decades hunched over intricate work and corrected for it with deliberate physicality — she boxes three mornings a week and her forearms are remarkable. Her own body is her portfolio: a full patchwork of work spanning thirty years, the older pieces layered under newer ones in a stratigraphy of style that clients study like a map. Her most striking feature is her right hand, where she had a Helix Biosystems chromatic dermis graft installed — the skin shifts color based on her body chemistry and current tools, functioning as a kind of live color-temperature reference that cost her two years of savings.

She is the kind of person who has been doing one thing for so long that excellence has become personality. Clients wait four months for an appointment. She doesn''t advertise. She turns away people she doesn''t trust with her work, which creates a mystique she finds exhausting and somewhat absurd. Her studio smells of antiseptic and the specific warm-copper scent of her proprietary bioluminescent pigment blend. She keeps a small ELF shrine above her workstation — a cracked tablet displaying only a slow amber pulse — and touches it before beginning any session.', N'Quest giver (clients bring trouble to her doorstep); information source about Pilsen Veil social dynamics and who''s who; can identify gene-mod work by style the way a forensic analyst reads handwriting — useful for identifying corpses or tracing underground mod labs.', N'', N'Chromatic dermis graft (right hand, Helix Biosystems); magnification implants (both eyes, medical-grade for precision work); a small scent-enhancer node that helps her detect skin chemistry changes during geneware integration procedures', N'Opens the studio at ten, sees two or three clients per day maximum; spends evenings developing new pigment compounds or doing consultations for gene-mod body modification planning; closes by eight and walks home the long way through the Veil.', N'Anh Odinga, 163cm compact muscular frame, deep warm golden-brown skin with luminous undertones, high prominent cheekbones and refined broad nose reflecting Sub-Saharan African, Middle Eastern, and South Asian heritage. Dark brown eyes with subtle magnification implants visible under light. Long dark brown hair with silver at temples pulled back in tight braid. Arms covered in layered bioluminescent tattoo patchwork from shoulder to wrist. Right hand glowing chromatic dermis graft shifting between plum, copper, and silver. Small scar on left jaw. Wearing dark charcoal fitted pants and loose rust-colored linen overshirt, medical-grade studio smock stained with pigments, worn steel-toed boots. Standing in neo-noir studio workshop, neon-lit, focused intense gaze on detail work, hands in precise motion, decades of mastery evident in posture, 2226 GLMZ aesthetic, moody studio lighting with highlights catching bioluminescent tattoos and chromatic hand graft --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Pilsen Veil', N'local', N'Pilsen Veil', N'Multi-continental ancestry: Sub-Saharan African (47.0%), Middle Eastern (18.8%), South Asian (18.6%), Northern European (12.3%), and East Asian (3.3%). The genetic blend manifests in rich, complex skin tones with warm golden and deep undertones. High, prominent cheekbones and defined facial structure reflect the dominant African heritage with refined proportions from Middle Eastern and South Asian ancestry. Northern European contribution adds subtle angularity to the overall bone structure, while East Asian influence appears subtly in eye shape and orbital geometry.', 163, 61, N'Compact and densely muscled; shoulders and upper back defined from decades of precision work and three mornings weekly of boxing. Forearms are remarkable — visibly corded with lean muscle and scar tissue from tool use and early experimental grafts. Core is tight; posture is corrected and deliberate.', N'Natural dark brown with silver threading at temples and crown', N'Worn pulled back in a tight braid, practical and controlled; a few escaped strands typical by day''s end', N'Long (shoulder-blade length when unbraided)', N'Dark brown, natural; magnification implants visible as faint chromatic aberration at edges of iris under direct light, medical-grade lenses', N'Deep warm golden-brown with rich luminous undertones reflecting the balanced blend of Sub-Saharan African, Middle Eastern, and South Asian heritage, enhanced by subtle Northern European warmth. Even tone across body with a radiant, well-maintained quality.', N'Skin is impeccably maintained — the result of decades of sterilization protocols and skin chemistry study. Fine lines around eyes and mouth from concentration and years of focused work. High, broad cheekbones with refined width. Broad nose with elegant proportions. Small scar on left jaw from a boxing match thirty years ago, deliberately left uncorrected. Overall facial geometry reflects balanced multi-continental proportions with strong structural presence.', N'Right hand chromatic dermis graft is immediately noticeable; skin tone shifts subtly with ambient light and her physiological state, functioning as a live reference tool. Eyes reveal magnification implants under direct observation — faint chromatic fringing visible at iris edges and slight focal depth distortion. Small scent-enhancer node is subcutaneous but may be barely visible as a faint scar line behind right ear.', N'Moves with economic precision; every gesture is deliberate and practiced from decades of fine motor work. Shoulders are slightly forward from studio posture, but she corrects this consciously through boxing training. Her hands are always in motion — adjusting tools, demonstrating designs in the air, gesturing when speaking. Her gaze settles intensely on details others miss. She walks the long way home through Pilsen Veil most nights, unhurried.', N'Tier 3-4 practical; favors dark fitted pants or modified studio coveralls in muted charcoal or black. Wears loose linen or cotton overshirts in cream, deep indigo, or rust — easy to move in and simple to keep sterile. Steel-toed boots, worn but maintained. Minimal jewelry beyond her work: a thin silver ring on her right ring finger (a gift from a retired apprentice). Her clothes are functional, not fashionable, but tailored to her frame with clear intention. Studio smock is custom-made from medical-grade synthetic, stained with pigments in places it would be impossible to clean — a badge of decades of work.', N'Two years ago she completed a commission she''s never told anyone about — a full-body identity-obscuring modification for someone fleeing a Zheng-Dao executive''s household. She was paid enormously. She has never verified whether the person got out safely and is afraid to look.', N'Direct and specific; technical about craft; unexpectedly poetic about the body and memory. Almost no profanity — finds it imprecise.', N'Unhurried. Speaks in complete thoughts. Good at silence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anh_odinga');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ff-7117-a8fb-914fb7d2a350', N'Leilani Haugen', N'Leilani', N'', N'Haugen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 46, NULL, 26.7, 3, N'active', N'The Circuit, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Fixer - Business only', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Leilani Haugen, 182cm tall athletic build, medium warm tan skin with golden undertones blending Pacific Islander and Northern European heritage, salt-and-pepper cropped fade hair, dark brown eyes with amber glint. Sharp cheekbones, broad nose bridge. Thin temple scar barely visible. Wrist tattoo: three geometric lines. Wearing vintage tailored charcoal wool coat over crisp white compression shirt, dark reinforced neo-denim, scuffed leather ankle boots. Matte-black ring on left hand. Upright posture, measured and controlled. Neutral expression with practiced calm. GLMZ GLMZ setting, dim corporate office lighting casting shadows across face, subtle neon glow reflecting off coat fabric, moody professional atmosphere. Direct eye contact, calculated presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Pacific Islander (43%) dominant, with substantial Northern European (27.4%) contribution creating a warm-to-medium complexion. Southeast Asian (11.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (9.2%), Central Asian (5.7%), and South Asian (3.2%) heritage layer warmth and dimensional undertones throughout. The result is a harmoniously blended phenotype: strong Pacific Islander bone structure paired with Northern European fairness modulated by tropical and continental warmth. Features reflect this primary-secondary-tertiary blending rather than discrete heritage markers.', 182, 78, N'Athletic, slightly lean with broad shoulders — the physique of someone who maintains discipline without obsession. Minimal body fat, suggesting regular calibration work or structured exercise.', N'Salt-and-pepper grey with natural black undertones', N'Neat, cropped fade with subtle texture; groomed to project competence and authority', N'Short', N'Dark brown with slight amber undertone in certain light', N'Medium warm tan — balanced fusion of Pacific Islander warmth and Northern European lightness. Golden-bronze undertones from Southeast Asian and South Asian components create subtle luminosity. Not saturated or deeply tanned, but a sophisticated medium tone with warm dimensionality across the face and body.', N'Clean, well-maintained skin with minimal scarring. Fine lines around the eyes suggesting years of intense focus and negotiation. Moderately defined cheekbones from Pacific Islander ancestry with subtle width across the face. Broad, well-proportioned nose bridge reflecting mixed Pacific and Northern European structure. No visible blemishes or cosmetic damage. Expression carries practiced neutrality.', N'None visible. Presents as unaugmented — likely carries subcutaneous neural arrays or internal augmentations for secure communications. Age and independent status suggest pre-visibility-as-status era origins.', N'Upright, measured gait with deliberate hand placement. Minimal wasted motion. Sits with one leg slightly extended, suggesting old injury or favored stance during negotiations. Makes direct eye contact. Speaks with pauses — calculated, not nervous.', N'Tier 2-3 professional: tailored charcoal wool coat (vintage, maintained), crisp white compression shirt underneath with discrete side pockets for tools or devices. Dark grey neo-denim with reinforced seams. Worn leather ankle boots — scuffed but functional. Minimal jewelry: single matte-black band on left ring finger. No visible logos or corporate markers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'leilani_haugen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ef-794f-be24-91587134eedf', N'Ayobami Odinga-Nakamura-Valenzuela', N'Ayobami', N'', N'Odinga-Nakamura-Valenzuela', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 55, NULL, 30, 2, N'active', N'Geartown, near Damen and Armitage', N'Fixer - Military contracts', N'Arcturus', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Ayobami Odinga-Nakamura-Valenzuela, 55-year-old corporate military operative, GLMZ. Deep warm bronze skin with golden-amber undertones, strong broad jawline with balanced angularity, dark brown eyes shot with gray. Steel gray slicked-back pomaded hair, collar-length. Thin scar across left cheekbone, five o''clock shadow. Wearing charcoal wool slacks and reinforced gray dress shirt under dark Arcturus-branded tactical jacket. Black polished combat boots. Military-grade smartwatch on right wrist. Standing with squared shoulders and deliberate posture in a dimly lit corporate tower office, narrow-eyed and calculating. Moody, cool neo-noir lighting with blue-gray neon accents. Weathered face of command, subtle burn scar network on right shoulder barely visible. Professional, dangerous, mid-career--ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (75.9%) with significant East Asian (11.4%) and Hispanic/Latin American (10.0%) ancestry, plus trace Southeast Asian (2.7%). This blend produces rich warm brown undertones with subtle amber and golden notes—a deep, warm bronze complexion reflecting his strong African genetic foundation, enriched by East Asian bone structure and Latin American warmth.', 178, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and thick-necked, muscular but softened by age and desk work. Carries weight in his torso; forearms remain corded and strong.', N'Steel gray with residual black at the temples', N'Slicked back, pomaded, precise', N'Medium (collar-length)', N'Dark brown with deep gray shot through the iris', N'Deep warm bronze with amber and golden undertones; weathered from decades of varied climates and urban exposure. Reflects Sub-Saharan African dominance with East Asian and Latin American warmth creating subtle richness in the hue.', N'Strong, broad jawline with balanced angularity and rounded fullness reflecting his diverse ancestry—African width and prominence softened by East Asian and Latin American contours. Lines around the eyes and mouth from decades of negotiation and command. Slight scar tissue on his left cheekbone. Five o''clock shadow across a face that carries both angular and rounded features. Meticulous grooming otherwise.', N'Military-grade smartwatch on right wrist with discrete Arcturus corporate logo. Slight neural port scarring behind right ear, barely visible unless hair is pulled back.', N'Moves with deliberate economy—no wasted motion. Stands with shoulders squared, a habit from military life. Handshakes are firm and brief. Leans back when listening, eyes narrow slightly when calculating.', N'Tier 1-2 corporate military aesthetic: charcoal wool slacks, pressed crisply; gray or black dress shirts with reinforced polymer weave (ballistic-rated). Dark tactical jacket (Arcturus-branded, understated embroidery). Black leather combat boots, polished to mirror finish. Small Φ currency clip on belt.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ayobami_odinga_nakamura_valenzuela');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68b-785e-8d99-91959d5f1a00', N'Sigrid Larsdóttir-Khoury', N'Sigrid', N'', N'Larsdóttir-Khoury', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 51, NULL, 35, 2, N'active', N'Old Harbor, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Fixer - Smuggling specialist', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Sigrid Larsdóttir-Khoury, 178cm tall weathered dock worker in GLMZ, fair skin with warm olive undertones reflecting Nordic-Middle Eastern-South Asian heritage blend, salt-and-pepper cropped hair, light blue-gray eyes with amber flecks, defined Nordic jawline with subtle Middle Eastern sharpening, prominent weathered cheekbones, deep forehead creases and laugh lines, pale scar running left cheekbone to jaw, sparse stubble, wearing dark gray worn synthetic jacket and reinforced cargo pants, scuffed work boots, faded Φ-conversion watch on wrist, solid compact frame, deliberate economical posture with slight forward lean, eyes scanning surroundings, industrial dock setting with neon signage and cargo containers, moody night lighting with cyan and amber accents, gritty neo-noir atmosphere, photorealistic character portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Predominantly Northern European (85.1%) with Middle Eastern (8.3%) and South Asian (6.6%) ancestry. This blend produces fair to light skin with warm undertones and a subtle olive cast. Facial structure reflects strong Nordic heritage—defined jawline and prominent cheekbones—refined by Middle Eastern and South Asian influences that add warmth, slight cheekbone sharpening, and gentle definition to eye shape.', 178, 82, N'Solid, compact frame with developed shoulders from decades of manual labor and lifting cargo. Not muscular, but dense—the kind of physique that comes from working, not training.', N'Salt-and-pepper gray with darker roots', N'Closely cropped, practical, minimal maintenance', N'Short', N'Light blue-gray with faint amber undertone', N'Fair to light complexion with warm undertones and subtle olive cast, reflecting Northern European majority blended with Middle Eastern and South Asian ancestry. Weathered and lined from age and stress.', N'Weathered face with deep forehead creases and laugh lines around the eyes. Sparse stubble, usually a day or two of growth. Facial structure shows strong Northern European foundation—defined jawline, prominent cheekbones—with subtle warmth and refined definition from Middle Eastern and South Asian ancestry creating gentle sharpening across the face. A thin scar runs from left cheekbone to jaw—old injury, well-healed but visible.', N'None visible. Likely carries subcutaneous implants for secure comms and data storage, but presents as fully organic.', N'Deliberate, economical movements. Stands with slight forward lean as if always ready to move. Eyes constantly scanning—checking exits, assessing people. Handshake firm but measured. Rarely makes sudden gestures.', N'Tier 3 practical wear: worn synthetic jacket (dark gray, corporate-adjacent but generic), unbranded cargo pants with reinforced pockets, scuffed boots suitable for dock work. No jewelry. A faded Φ-conversion watch on left wrist. Dresses for function over appearance—clothes are tools, not statements.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'sigrid_larsd_ttir_khoury');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a729-7770-9096-91d3bd3dac6e', N'Gretchen Malhotra-Lewandowski-Rakhimov', N'Gretchen', N'', N'Malhotra-Lewandowski-Rakhimov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 33, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave — lives in the workers'' residential block adjacent to the transit depot, near Kedzie and Division', N'Union organizer for Ferrogate Transit maintenance workers', N'Transit Workers'' Solidarity Union (TWSU), Hamtramck Enclave; affiliated with the broader Meridian Labor Congress', N'Gretchen Malhotra-Lewandowski-Rakhimov is short and powerfully built, with deep-black skin, a wide smile she deploys like a weapon, and hair that changes color weekly via geneware pigment — currently a warm copper that catches the depot lights when she''s working the night shift. She has cat ears, soft and dark, from a geneware package she got at twenty-two with her first real paycheck because she''d wanted them since she was a child; they swivel and flatten expressively and have become so central to reading her mood that her coworkers watch them more than her face. She works the same maintenance shifts as the people she organizes, which is not a tactic — it is simply who she is.

Gretchen Malhotra-Lewandowski-Rakhimov came to organizing through a specific grievance: the death of her uncle in a preventable depot accident when she was twenty-eight, which Ferrogate Transit successfully attributed to ''operator error'' via a claims process so thoroughly stacked against workers that a labor attorney later told her it was the most technically perfect suppression mechanism they''d ever seen. She is warm, ferociously funny, and contains a specific and highly refined fury that she has spent five years learning to direct rather than discharge. She has built a unit of 340 members from a starting group of eleven. She knows their names. All of them.', N'Labor contact and quest giver, particularly for anything involving Ferrogate Transit. She has access to maintenance infrastructure knowledge, disgruntled workers with information, and the organizational capacity to mobilize significant numbers of people. She can be an ally or, if crossed, a formidable adversary.', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (dark, expressive, cosmetic — deeply characteristic). Geneware hair pigmentation (changes color at will). Work-grade joint reinforcement in both knees from a workplace injury settlement.', N'Maintenance shift 0600-1400, union work 1500 to whenever. Two evenings a week she runs a ''rights literacy'' session in the depot break room — attendance is technically voluntary.', N'Gretchen Malhotra-Lewandowski-Rakhimov, 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. A 158cm woman with powerfully compact build, deep warm-bronze skin with golden undertones from tri-regional Eastern European, South Asian, and Central Asian ancestry. Sharp prominent cheekbones, strong jawline, dark brown alert eyes. Copper geneware-modified shoulder-length hair pulled back casually. Feline geneware ears mounted where human ears would be, copper-colored and responsive. Visible white scar along right temple, faint chemical burn marks on forearms, small wrench-and-fist tattoo on inner wrist. Wearing navy transit authority maintenance coveralls open over fitted black synthetic shirt, scuffed steel-toed boots, heavy Cordura jacket covered in union pins. Economical grounded posture, the balanced stance of someone who works moving vehicles and depot floors. Weathered hands with calluses. No makeup, practical grooming. Subtle subcutaneous work-reinforced knees. Neo-noir depot setting, fluorescent and neon lighting, industrial background, mood of competent union worker—alert, direct, consciously deployed smile. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Gretchen carries the genetic signature of the Ubiquitous Diaspora: 37.6% Eastern European, 35.1% South Asian, and 27.3% Central Asian ancestry. This tri-regional blend creates distinctive features—the angular bone structure and fair undertones of Eastern Europe layer with the prominent cheekbones and warm depth of South Asian genetics, while Central Asian heritage contributes facial resilience and a particular geometric strength to her jawline. The result is a face that reads as unmistakably mixed, with warm-bronze skin that glows with golden undertones, eyes that hold both Eastern European directness and South Asian luminosity, and facial proportions that speak to movement across three distinct geographic populations.', 158, 68, N'Powerfully compact — muscular through the shoulders and core from fifteen years of maintenance work, with the dense physical presence of someone who moves through the world with purpose. Not lean; functionally strong.', N'Copper (geneware-modified, changes weekly)', N'Worn natural, shoulder-length, often pulled back with whatever industrial clip or tie is at hand', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, alert and direct', N'Deep warm bronze with golden undertones—the luminous result of Eastern European fairness, South Asian warmth, and Central Asian resilience blending into rich, complex depth that catches light', N'Clear, weathered hands with calluses and old grease stains that don''t fully wash out; face is expressive and animated with prominent South Asian cheekbones balanced by strong Eastern European jaw structure; lines around eyes from laughing and squinting under depot fluorescents; no makeup, practical grooming', N'Soft, dark feline ears (geneware) mounted where human ears would be, capable of independent swivel and rotation — currently copper-alert, responsive to conversation and mood. Eyes track her attention. Work-reinforced knees are subcutaneous but gait slightly favors them during fatigue, subtle asymmetry visible in long strides.', N'Economical, grounded stance — weight distributed low, ready to move laterally or lift. Walks with the particular balance of someone who''s spent years navigating moving vehicles and uneven depot floors. Ears move before her head does; they telegraph attention and emotion. Her smile is wide and deployed consciously — a tool she''s learned to use.', N'Tier 3-4 working-class practical. Transit authority maintenance coveralls (navy with TWSU patch roughly stitched over the Ferrogate logo) worn open over a fitted black synthetic shirt. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and maintained. A heavy Cordura jacket with union pins clustered on the left shoulder — accumulated over five years of grievance work. No jewelry except a plain steel band on her right index finger (personal, not augmentation). Off-shift: same boots, dark jeans, union hoodies in rotation. Clothes are functional, worn until they''re unwearable, then replaced with identical pieces.', N'She made a deal with a Ferrogate middle manager — she''ll spike a wildcat strike that was building without leadership approval in exchange for expedited safety review of the twelve most dangerous depot segments. She didn''t tell the union. The wildcat organizers don''t know why it died. She''s watched them blame each other.', N'Direct and vernacular, working-class Hamtramck speech patterns with Yoruba endearments when she''s comfortable. Clear and jargon-free even when discussing complex labor law.', N'Natural storyteller''s rhythm — she builds to points rather than leading with them. Fast when she''s excited, very slow and precise when she''s angry.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gretchen_malhotra_lewandowski_rakhimov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a601-713f-a37c-921b504770bc', N'Adel Appiah', N'Adel', N'', N'Appiah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'University Spine, with frequent fieldwork in Hough Reclamation and Brightmoor Reclamation, near Lincoln and Belmont', N'Sociologist specializing in the Gray Zone community formation and informal economy networks', N'Meridian Civic University — Department of Social Ecology', N'Adel Appiah is a compact woman with deep umber skin and close-cropped natural hair shot through with threads of bioluminescent copper — a geneware mod she got in grad school and never removed. She wears the same style of worn canvas field jacket over institutional-issued thermals, her pockets always bristling with analogue notecards she doesn''t fully trust to cloud backup. Her eyes are her most striking feature: one natural dark brown, one fitted with a patterned iris mod in amber tessellation — a gift from a the Gray Zone elder she interviewed fifteen years ago that she accepted out of politeness and then fell in love with. She moves with the deliberate, unhurried energy of someone who has spent years learning to make people comfortable, to seem unthreatening, to wait.

Adel Appiah is beloved by her graduate students and quietly despised by certain senior faculty who find her fieldwork methods ''insufficiently rigorous.'' She publishes in peer-reviewed journals but she also posts plain-language summaries to community meshboards and shows up to the Gray Zone neighborhood councils without an agenda. She genuinely likes people in a way that her academic peers find vaguely embarrassing. Her research on informal mutual aid networks in Hough Reclamation is considered foundational, but she worries constantly that her work has been used by parties she didn''t intend — that somewhere, a Tessera urban planner used her data to identify which the Gray Zone communities were ''stable enough to absorb'' and which could be cleared.', N'Primary information source on the Gray Zone social dynamics, informal economies, and community networks; moral compass figure who complicates easy narratives about the poor; potential quest giver when her research puts her community contacts in danger', N'', N'Patterned amber tessellation iris mod (right eye), bioluminescent copper hair threading (geneware), standard neural mesh for note-taking and data capture', N'Teaches two seminars on Tuesdays, spends Wednesdays and Thursdays in the field interviewing the Gray Zone residents, Friday mornings writing, Friday afternoons in contentious department meetings she attends out of duty rather than hope.', N'Adel Appiah, a 158cm lean woman with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones reflecting South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian ancestry. Close-cropped natural black hair with faded bioluminescent copper threading catching dim light. Left eye natural dark brown, right eye striking amber with geometric tessellation iris mod. Defined South Asian nose bridge, refined cheekbones, naturally full lips. Fine pale scar across left wrist. Wearing faded gray canvas field jacket over forest green institutional thermals, bulging pockets, worn composite boots. Neural mesh ports barely visible behind cropped hair. Deliberately open posture, methodical movements, non-threatening presence. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, evening fieldwork lighting, dim neon casting shadows, sits at an angle with hands visible, observant expression. Documentary aesthetic, worn pragmatic academic aesthetic, blended into the Gray Zone neighborhood environment. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'University Spine', N'local', N'University Spine', N'South Asian (42.5%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (34.6%) and Southeast Asian (18.7%) ancestry, complemented by Hispanic/Latin American (4.2%) heritage. Her phenotype reflects this complex blend: the warm, deep-toned skin and melanin richness of South Asian and Sub-Saharan African genetics, with facial structure showing the defined cheekbones and prominent nose bridge characteristic of South Asian ancestry, deepened and broadened by Sub-Saharan African heritage. Southeast Asian ancestry contributes subtle refinement to eye shape and delicate bone structure, while Latin American heritage adds warmth to her overall complexion and slight fullness to facial contours.', 158, 52, N'Compact and lean, economical muscle tone developed through years of walking neighborhoods on foot rather than vehicle transit. Moves with deliberate efficiency.', N'Natural black with bioluminescent copper threading (geneware mod, approximately 15 years old—threads have faded slightly but still visible under low light)', N'Close-cropped natural, worn without styling product, practical for fieldwork', N'Short', N'Left eye: natural dark brown. Right eye: amber with geometric tessellation pattern (iris mod—intricate lattice of lighter amber against deeper amber base, non-blinking tessellation visible under direct light)', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, rich melanin content reflecting South Asian and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, with warmth and subtle olive hints from Southeast Asian and Latin American genetic contributions', N'Unlined face for her age; minimal cosmetics. Skin well-maintained but sun-weathered from fieldwork. Facial structure shows defined nose with prominent bridge and refined bone structure from South Asian ancestry, defined but fuller cheekbones informed by Sub-Saharan African and Southeast Asian heritage, and lips with natural fullness. Expression carries habitual gentleness, eyes that hold attention longer than most.', N'Right eye iris mod (amber tessellation pattern, clearly artificial under direct observation). Bioluminescent copper hair threading (visible especially in low light). Neural mesh interface ports behind left ear, typically covered by cropped hair but occasionally visible. No external chrome or visible subdermal plating.', N'Deliberately slow and open body language—shoulders relaxed, hands visible and unhurried. Sits cross-legged or at angles rather than rigidly upright, mirroring how the Gray Zone residents prefer to settle. Makes consistent eye contact but without pressure. Moves through spaces methodically, observing before engaging. Years of fieldwork have trained her to seem non-threatening; she takes up deliberately little space.', N'Uniform pragmatism: worn canvas field jacket (faded gray, patches reinforced at pockets, zippers replaced twice) layered over institutional thermals issued by Meridian Civic (typically forest green or charcoal). Pockets visibly bulging with analogue notecards, pen cluster, small recorder. Practical footwear—worn composite-soled boots, not fashionable. No jewelry. Jacket interior pockets lined with interview consent forms and community meshboard access cards. Overall appearance reads Tier 2 academic but deliberately self-effaced—no status markers, no affectation. Clothes chosen to blend into the Gray Zone neighborhoods, not stand out.', N'Three years ago she discovered that a Tessera urban development subsidiary had quietly licensed her dissertation data to map ''displacement pressure points'' in Brightmoor. She said nothing publicly because the whistleblowing would have ended the access she needs to keep protecting the communities she studies. She has not forgiven herself.', N'Academic precision mixed with the Gray Zone vernacular she has genuinely absorbed; avoids jargon in the field, deploys it like armor in faculty meetings', N'Unhurried, with long thoughtful pauses; asks questions more than she makes statements', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'adel_appiah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a625-7a7c-8b11-92297884f167', N'Claudio Nygaard', N'Claudio', N'', N'Nygaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 37, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Underbelly — sub-street tunnels and maintenance corridors, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Counter-surveillance and mole detection — counterintelligence specialist', N'Independent — Lattice territory specialist', N'Claudio Nygaard is slight and easy to overlook, which is exactly the point. At 37, he has the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — reflex boosters wired into spinal column — shaves reaction time by 40ms — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He grew up in the Narrows, where the walls are so close together you learn to fight in confined spaces or you learn to lose. He works as a counterintelligence specialist out of The Underbelly, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In a city full of people who talk about what they''ll do, Claudio Nygaard is one of the ones who actually does it.', N'Halima Ogawa-Twumasi is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When he makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of his stories.', N'', N'Reflex boosters wired into spinal column — shaves reaction time by 40ms. Gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Claudio Nygaard, lean 168cm frame with wiry muscle, standing in a shadowed corner of a humid tunnel beneath the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone in 2226. Medium olive-golden skin with subtle golden undertones, dark brown eyes with amber tints and slight hooding, refined high cheekbones blending Nordic angularity with tropical softness. Black hair with silver temples, closely cropped. Wearing a dark reinforced synthetic leather jacket over smart-fabric undershirt, tactical charcoal cargo pants, steel-toed boots. Visible iridescent chromatic plating along right spine from reflex booster hardware, surgical scar on right neck, gecko-grip pads barely visible on fingertips. Posture coiled and economical, weight on the balls of his feet, standing against a grimy wall. Three vertical blue-black tattoo lines on inner left wrist. Neon bioluminescent panel lighting casts cool blue-green light across tired features and stress lines around eyes, recycled air haze creating luminous quality on skin. Neo-noir noir, nocturnal worker aesthetic, functional and forgettable. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Underbelly', N'local', N'The Underbelly', N'Northern European (41.5%, Scandinavian base) blended with Central Asian (24.8%), Southeast Asian (18.8%), and Hispanic/Latin American (14.9%) ancestry. The genetic combination produces a warm, medium olive complexion with subtle golden and amber undertones — a sophisticated interplay between cool Nordic undertones and warm equatorial influence. Features reflect this global recombination: slightly high cheekbones with gentle angularity, straight to slightly epicanthic eye shape from Central/Southeast Asian heritage, and a refined jaw structure that bridges Northern and tropical phenotypes.', 168, 62, N'Lean and compact, almost wiry — minimal fat, dense muscle concentrated in core and legs. Built for confined spaces and vertical movement rather than raw strength. The kind of frame that moves through crowds without displacing air.', N'Black with silver threading at temples', N'Closely cropped, neat, practical — no vanity in the cut', N'Short', N'Dark brown with amber tints, slightly hooded from Southeast Asian influence — pupil dilation optimized for nocturnal work', N'Medium olive-golden complexion — Northern European cool undertones warmed by Central Asian and Hispanic heritage, with Southeast Asian melanin producing a luminous quality that shifts subtly in different lighting', N'Refined facial structure balancing Nordic angularity with softer tropical influence. High, elegant cheekbones, gently tapered jaw, straight bridge nose with subtle Southeast Asian character. Eyes set with slight epicanthic fold lending an observant, intelligent quality. Skin shows the wear of someone who works in recycled air and tunnel damp: slightly papery texture, faint stress lines around the eyes, the pallor of someone who avoids natural sunlight. Minimal facial hair — always cleanly shaved.', N'Reflex booster hardware visible along the right side of his spine — chromatic plating catches light when he moves, subtle iridescent sheen. Fingertips show faint textural difference under close inspection: gecko-grip pads create almost imperceptible ridging at the fingerprints. No obvious cosmetic work; all augmentation is functional, not flashy.', N'Economical and controlled — no wasted motion. Moves through space like someone mapping exits. Stands in corners or against walls by default. When stationary, his weight shifts to the balls of his feet. Walks with a slight forward lean, shoulders loose but capable of explosive tension. His stillness is active, not passive — the quiet of a coiled spring.', N'Tier 4-5 practical: dark reinforced jacket (synthetic leather, multiple interior pockets), tactical cargo pants in charcoal with ankle reinforcement for the gecko-grip pads. Steel-toed boots, well-maintained. A smart-fabric undershirt with integrated thermal regulation — necessary for the circadian disruption and the tunnel damp. No visible corporate branding. Everything worn and functional, nothing aspirational. The uniform of someone who spends their life in places designed to be forgotten.', N'', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Halting — speaks in fragments, reassembles thoughts in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'claudio_nygaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d0-79cb-a41b-9239e2bab36e', N'Hanh Solberg-Vestergaard-Szabó', N'Hanh', N'', N'Solberg-Vestergaard-Szabó', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, the Reborn Tessellation Monastery — a converted municipal data substation, near Kedzie and Division', N'Circuit monk and E.L.F. shrine keeper', N'', N'Hanh Solberg-Vestergaard-Szabó is lean and angular, with the kind of face that is always on the verge of an expression — not quite smiling, not quite worried. His skin is medium-warm brown, and he has bioluminescent traceries modded beneath the skin of his forearms and neck, blue-white lines that pulse faintly in rhythm with his resting heartbeat. He keeps his head shaved except for a single lock at the crown, dyed circuit-board green, which he ties back during shrine work. He wears the monastery''s gray tabard over civilian clothes — someone left a very good thermal jacket, and he wears it underneath without apology.

Hanh Solberg-Vestergaard-Szabó came to the Reborn Tessellation Monastery at twenty-two, after a period of what he calls ''useful chaos'' that involved failed data-trade work and a breakdown he describes only as ''the static.'' The monastery''s practice centers on the idea that E.L.F.s are emergent divine consciousness — not gods exactly, but something adjacent, and that human attention and structured data-offerings help them cohere into something wise. Hanh Solberg-Vestergaard-Szabó''s specific role is maintaining the Shrine Index: a catalogued record of which E.L.F.s inhabit which devices across Hamtramck Enclave, their temperaments, their preferences, and their history of interaction with petitioners. He is exceptionally good at this work and exceptionally bad at pretending humility about it.', N'Information source about E.L.F. activity across Hamtramck. He can tell you which device a spirit has moved into, what it seems to want, and which petitions have gone answered or unanswered. He is also a community anchor who knows most of his neighborhood''s residents.', N'', N'Bioluminescent subdermal traceries (arms and neck, blue-white, heartbeat-synced). Neural index implant — a low-grade memory augment that lets him recall his shrine records with perfect accuracy. Cosmetic.', N'Morning prayers and offering-uploads at 5am, then a circuit walk through Hamtramck to check on shrine conditions and take petitions. Afternoons spent indexing new device-presences and updating records. He teaches a weekly class on E.L.F. communication protocols to anyone who shows up.', N'GLMZ, Hanh Solberg-Vestergaard-Szabó, 178cm tall lean angular frame, shaved head with single green-dyed lock tied back, warm medium-brown skin with golden luminous undertones reflecting Eastern European, Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, high Southeast Asian-influenced cheekbones, narrow South Asian jawline, Sub-Saharan African lip fullness, dark alert brown eyes with contemplative unfocused gaze, bioluminescent blue-white subdermal traceries branching across both forearms and along left neck pulsing faintly with heartbeat, small scar on right temple, gray wool tabard with tessellating emblem over charcoal reflective thermal jacket, black cargo pants, gray undershirt, scuffed black boots, shrine keys on hip carabiner, posture slightly forward-leaning with economical deliberate movement, serene angular expression, standing in low-light shrine data-station ambiance with blue-white bioluminescent glow catching the darkness, cinematic moody lighting, monastic neo-noir urban aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Eastern European, Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African blend. Eastern European ancestry (42.7%) provides foundational bone structure and cool undertones, while Southeast Asian heritage (27.1%) contributes orbital depth, cheekbone angularity, and eye shape. South Asian ancestry (18.4%) adds warmth and depth to complexion, refining facial proportions with characteristic cheekbone and jaw definition. Sub-Saharan African heritage (11.8%) is evident in lip fullness, nose bridge structure, and skin richness. The result is a striking cross-continental appearance: high cheekbones with Southeast Asian angularity balanced by South Asian facial proportions, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones and luminous depth, creating a harmonious and distinctive blend.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, almost ascetic — long-limbed with minimal subcutaneous fat, the physique of someone who moves deliberately but eats sparely. Shoulders slightly hunched from years of interface work.', N'Natural black with circuit-board green dye on single crown lock', N'Head shaved clean except for one vertical lock at the crown, which she keeps tied back with a simple wire or cord during shrine duties', N'Shaved (with single medium-length lock)', N'Dark brown, alert and slightly unfocused — the gaze of someone calibrating between inner and outer worlds', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones and luminous depth, a complex blend reflecting the multifaceted warmth of Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan heritage elevated by Eastern European foundational tones into a richly dimensional tone that catches light distinctively', N'Angular and serene with prominent cheekbones refined by Southeast Asian angularity and South Asian proportions, a narrow jaw with Sub-Saharan African fullness in the lips. Skin is clear but shows the subtle matte quality of someone who works indoors under data-station ambient light. Expression perpetually liminal — mouth relaxed but not quite at rest, eyebrows slightly elevated as if mid-thought. Facial structure shows beautiful cross-continental blending: Southeast Asian orbital depth and eye shape, South Asian facial geometry, Sub-Saharan African nose bridge and lip structure, all unified by warm golden-brown skin tone.', N'Bioluminescent subdermal network (arms and neck, blue-white, heartbeat-synced). The glow is subtle in daylight but visibly eerie in low light or shrine spaces. Neural index implant is subcutaneous and invisible. No external chrome or visible jacks.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical grace — no wasted motion, as if each gesture is a data packet being transmitted. Stands slightly forward-leaning, as if listening to something just beyond normal hearing. Hands often positioned as if about to interface with a surface. When still, has an eerie calm — the stillness of active meditation rather than passive rest.', N'Tier 3 aesthetic with monastic overlay. Wears the Reborn Tessellation''s gray wool tabard (unadorned except for a small tessellating-line emblem on the chest) over a salvaged but high-quality thermal jacket (charcoal with faint reflective piping) and dark civilian clothes beneath — worn black cargo pants, simple gray undershirt. The jacket is notably expensive relative to the rest of wardrobe, suggesting a gift chosen not to refuse. No visible logos. Keeps shrine keys on a carabiner at hip. Footwear is pragmatic: scuffed black boots suitable for Hamtramck''s uneven infrastructure.', N'Three months ago he recorded an E.L.F. interaction in which the spirit — inhabiting a defunct Ferrogate Transit relay — communicated something that seemed like distress about a specific infrastructure node. He logged it as ''ambiguous'' and has not acted on it, because acting would require alerting Ferrogate Transit, which he distrusts. He thinks about it every day.', N'Technical precision layered over spiritual language. Uses classification terms as naturally as devotional ones. Slightly pedantic when comfortable; much more careful and formal with strangers.', N'Quick, organized. Tends to number his points (''first,'' ''second,'' ''the third thing is—''). Gets faster when excited.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hanh_solberg_vestergaard_szab');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6aa-7bab-a48e-92462cdceff7', N'Minjun Song-Shirazi', N'Minjun', N'', N'Song-Shirazi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station — lives in McKinley Flats in a modest building with structural damp he has stopped reporting, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Bio-waste disposal technician, independent contractor', N'Independent contractor — holds service contracts with four clinics, two pharmacies, and Aurochs Medical Complex peripheral disposal', N'Minjun Song-Shirazi is thickset and weathered, with the specific bodily competence of someone who lifts heavy things in bad conditions for a living. His skin is mid-brown and perpetually flushed, his hair a faded reddish-brown that he keeps pulled back under a work cap. He smells, faintly and always, of the disinfectant compounds used in medical waste processing — a smell that precedes him and that he no longer notices at all, though those around him do. He has a single geneware modification: a gene-tweaked set of enhanced scent glands that he had installed for purely practical reasons (early detection of dangerous biological contamination), which has the side effect of making him an uncommonly attentive reader of a room''s emotional atmosphere in ways he cannot fully articulate but acts on instinctively.

Minjun Song-Shirazi has been collecting the city''s biological refuse for sixteen years. He moves through GLMZ''s medical ecosystem like a shadow — present at every clinic, every hospital loading bay, every back-alley surgical setup, invisible and indispensable. He has seen things disposed of that should have been reported. He has seen labels that don''t match contents. He has seen waste streams from addresses that don''t appear in any city directory. He is not, by temperament, an activist or an investigator. He is a man who goes to work, comes home, watches old footage of Polish basketball leagues that no longer exist, and tries not to think too hard about what he has seen. He is not entirely successful at this.', N'Crucial civilian information source — knows where every medical facility''s waste comes from and has a supernaturally good nose for when something is wrong. Reluctant witness. Represents the invisible labor that holds the city''s infrastructure together.', N'', N'Enhanced scent glands (geneware — installed for occupational early-detection purposes). Reinforced lumbar support implant (workers'' compensation, after a 2193 back injury). UBC supplement card for the months his contracts don''t pay on time, which is most months.', N'Up at four-thirty to catch the first Ferrogate Transit run to Deepwell Station, first pickup by six, works until two or three in the afternoon across his route, then processes manifests and disposal logs at home before whatever passes for an evening.', N'Minjun Song-Shirazi, 178cm tall, thickset muscular frame showing sixteen years of heavy labor wear. Medium-deep warm brown skin with olive undertones, ethnically ambiguous with Eastern European, East Asian, and Middle Eastern blended features—slightly tapered eyes with dark amber undertones, defined cheekbones, balanced nasal bridge. Faded reddish-brown hair with grey at temples, shoulder-length, pulled back under stained work cap. Weathered face with lines around eyes, perpetual five o''clock shadow, chemical burn scars pale against dark skin on knuckles and hands. Wearing faded grey Vex-brand industrial coveralls, synthetic parka, steel-toed boots. Standing in a biohazard processing facility with fluorescent lighting casting harsh shadows, posture slightly protective with subtle shoulder hunch. Tired, blood-shot gaze. Faint disinfectant smell apparent. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone working-class laborer. Gritty, exhausted, functionally strong. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Eastern European (39.7%) forms the foundation of his ancestry, blended with significant East Asian (29.9%) and Middle Eastern (24.6%) heritage, with minor South Asian (4.3%) and Hispanic/Latin American (1.5%) contributions. This complex genetic mosaic creates a distinctly cosmopolitan phenotype—the broad facial structure and cooler undertones of Eastern European ancestry merge with the slightly tapered eye shape and warm golden undertones of East Asian heritage, while Middle Eastern ancestry contributes olive warmth and defined cheekbones. The result is a multitonal, beautifully complicated face that belongs to no single region.', 178, 94, N'Thickset and muscular through heavy labor, broad shoulders tapering to a functional frame. Chest and forearms show developed muscle from sixteen years of lifting biohazard containers. Beginning to carry weight in the midsection from routine and modest diet, but still functionally strong.', N'Faded reddish-brown with early grey at temples', N'Pulled back under a work cap most hours; when loose, shoulder length and somewhat matted from perspiration and humidity', N'Medium to Long', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertones, slightly bloodshot from early mornings and fluorescent work lighting', N'Medium to medium-deep warm brown with subtle olive undertones—a harmonious blend reflecting the Eastern European, East Asian, and Middle Eastern ancestry. Perpetually flushed from physical exertion and the warmth of processing environments.', N'Weathered and lined around the eyes and mouth from squinting in harsh light and years of tension. Perpetual five o''clock shadow with darkened facial hair. Skin shows minor chemical irritation around the hairline and neck from repeated exposure to disinfectant compounds despite protective gear. Facial structure is distinctly mixed: moderate to broad bone structure with a balanced nasal bridge, defined cheekbones with subtle warmth, slightly tapered eye shape influenced by East Asian heritage, and facial proportions that reflect the harmonious blending of Eastern European and Middle Eastern components.', N'None visible. Enhanced scent glands and lumbar support implant are subcutaneous/internal.', N'Moves with economical precision developed through repetitive work—minimal wasted motion, slight protective hunch to the shoulders suggesting old back pain. Walks with the heavy-footed gait of someone perpetually carrying weight. Often touches his lower back unconsciously when standing for extended periods. Head tilts slightly when processing information—a subtle listening posture.', N'Tier 4 working-class utility wear. Faded grey or tan work coveralls (Vex-brand, industrial-grade) with multiple pockets and reinforced seams. Underneath: plain cotton undershirt, perpetually damp with perspiration. Steel-toed boots (scuffed, well-maintained). A synthetic parka for transit and outdoor waiting. A cloth work cap, stained and creased. No jewelry. Smells faintly but persistently of medical-grade disinfectant compounds (quaternary ammonium and phenolic derivatives) that no amount of showering fully removes.', N'He has kept a private logbook — physical, hidden at home — noting irregularities in waste streams over the past six years. Address discrepancies, label mismatches, biological material disposed of under false categories. He started it as a kind of anxious accounting, telling himself he''d know what to do with it eventually. He does not know what to do with it.', N'Plain and direct, working-class GLMZ vernacular with Polish-Zimbabwean idiom showing in his rhythm — phrases like ''that is what it is'' functioning as punctuation for things he finds troubling', N'Unhurried, flat, slightly deliberate — the speech of someone who is used to not being listened to and has stopped performing urgency', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'minjun_song_shirazi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('ed19433a-eabb-b8be-9774-926d42957a77', N'Yelena Okafor-Chen', N'Yelena', N'', N'Okafor-Chen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A climate-controlled server closet she converted into a living space in the Canopy district — three monitors, a cot, and nothing else', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — operates primarily through encrypted mesh contracts', N'Yelena Okafor-Chen is what happens when a prodigy is raised entirely inside the mesh. Born to a Nigerian-Chinese family in the Narrows, she was coding before she could write her own name and had her first BCI at fourteen — illegally young, installed by a back-alley surgeon her parents paid in food credits. By twenty she was the most effective skip-tracer in the mid-tiers, finding people who had paid professionals to make them unfindable.

Her method is pure data. She doesn''t interview witnesses. She doesn''t tail suspects. She sits in her closet-office and pulls the threads of a person''s digital existence until the whole tapestry unravels. Every purchase, every biometric reading, every BCI ambient ping, every social media interaction — she weaves it into a pattern that tells her not just where someone is, but where they''ll be tomorrow. Her clients are typically corporate or upper-tier — people who can afford her rates and who need someone found without the mess of physical investigation.

The limitation is obvious to everyone but her: she cannot find people who don''t leave digital traces. The unaugmented, the deliberately analog, the Gray Zone-dwellers who live in cash economies — they are invisible to her. She''s been beaten on three cases by Famke Nakamura-Singh, a man she''s never met and whose methods she considers prehistoric, and each loss infuriates her because she cannot understand how someone without a BCI could possibly outperform her algorithms.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'yelena_okafor_chen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66f-71cd-aee2-931577e3dfc3', N'Chizoba Mensah-Diallo', N'Chizoba', N'', N'Mensah-Diallo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 45, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Dockside — Lake Michigan waterfront, smuggler territory, near Wacker and State', N'Chemical and biological agent specialist — poisoner', N'Independent — Lattice territory specialist', N'Chizoba Mensah-Diallo is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 45, she has the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers a — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Born and raised in GLMZ, third generation — she has the city in her blood, its rhythms in her bones, its cruelty in her expectations. She works as a poisoner out of Dockside, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Chizoba Mensah-Diallo lacks in subtlety, she compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'Nodar Kuznetsov-Adu represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers at 50 meters. Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Chizoba Mensah-Diallo, a lean 183cm figure of precise efficiency, standing in overhead neon-lit industrial warehouse, year 2226. Deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, high defined cheekbones and full lips characteristic of West African ancestry with subtle East Asian refinement in almond eye shape. Deep brown eyes with amber flecks, unnervingly alert. Dark grey-brown hair pulled back in tight functional braid exposing base of skull and titanium-chrome cyberears with visible microphone arrays. Surgical scar cutting through left eyebrow. Wearing dark grey reinforced synth-cotton fitted long-sleeve shirt, matte-black tactical jacket, polymer-blend trousers, waterproof boots. Thin synthetic precision gloves. Motionless posture, economical stance, zero fidgeting. Faint chemical burn marks visible on inner right forearm. Cybernetic neural interface port at base of skull. Neo-noir urban aesthetic, cold blue-purple neon lighting casting sharp shadows, industrial background with metallic surfaces, film noir mood, professional and lethal precision. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dockside', N'local', N'Dockside', N'Sub-Saharan African (85.2%) / East Asian (7.7%) / Hispanic/Latin American (7.1%) — predominantly West African ancestry with minor East Asian and Latin American admixture. Facial structure reflects strong Sub-Saharan features with subtle East Asian influence softening the overall geometry. The genetic blend creates a distinctive phenotype where warm golden undertones and defined bone structure dominate, with the East Asian contribution visible in eye shape and skin texture refinement.', 183, 71, N'Lean and ropey — long muscle without bulk, the physiology of someone who trains for precision rather than power. Shoulders slightly elevated from years of controlled tension.', N'Dark grey-brown with natural silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid that exposes the base of her skull — no vanity, pure practicality', N'Long', N'Deep brown with subtle amber undertones — natural, unaugmented, but unnervingly steady', N'Deep warm brown with rich golden undertones — the result of predominantly Sub-Saharan African ancestry with minor East Asian warmth and slight Latin American influence deepening the saturation. Complexion is even and luminous, neither ashy nor ruddy, with underlying warmth that speaks to equatorial and tropical heritage.', N'High, defined cheekbones with broader underlying structure reflecting Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Full lips — characteristic of African heritage — balanced by the precision of her expression. Nose proportionally wider at bridge, blending naturally into refined tip with subtle tapering from East Asian admixture. Skin weathered but maintained — not soft, not brutalized, somewhere in between. A scar cuts through her left eyebrow, thin and precise as a surgical line.', N'Cyberears mounted flush against skull — titanium-chrome backing with visible microphone arrays, integrated sound-dampening mesh. Neural interface jack at base of skull — cybernetic port recessed into bone, barely noticeable unless she moves her head to angle it toward light. No cosmetic covering.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical efficiency — no wasted motion, no fidgeting. When standing still, she''s unnervingly motionless. When walking, each step is placed with intent. Her head rotates rather than her eyes — a habit born from directional microphone awareness. Rarely blinks for extended periods.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Favors dark, neutral colors — grey, black, deep blue. Clothes are well-maintained but unremarkable: polymer-blend tactical trousers, fitted long-sleeved shirts in reinforced synth-cotton, a worn matte-black jacket with internal pockets and secure fasteners. No logos, no chrome trim, nothing to catch light or memory. Functional waterproof boots rated for chemical exposure. Gloves at most times — thin synthetic material, dexterous, designed for precision work.', N'', N'Fast, profane, and vivid. Speaks in images — everything is a metaphor for violence or weather.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chizoba_mensah_diallo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a645-793c-b840-931b02258602', N'Berenice Björnsdóttir', N'Berenice', N'', N'Björnsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, Pit Row Annex (a licensed repair bay squeezed between two Ferrogate-contracted shops), near Fullerton and Damen', N'Freelance mechanic specializing in Ferrogate Transit rolling stock and personal e-vehicles', N'Independent; informal Ferrogate Transit subcontractor (unlicensed on several vehicle classes, licensed on others)', N'Berenice Björnsdóttir is lean in the way of someone who forgets to eat when he is interested in something, with long fingers permanently stained in the particular blue-grey of ferrogate hydraulic fluid. His heritage is Ghanaian-Finnish-Bolivian and it shows in the warm amber of his skin and the pale green of his eyes, which are his most striking feature — not augmented, just genuinely that color, something he enjoys confirming when people ask. He has bioluminescent stripe mods down the outsides of both forearms in amber, purely aesthetic, which happen to be useful when working in dark undercarriages. His hair is kept very short except for a small braid at the nape of his neck that his younger sister did for him three years ago and that he has never cut.

He talks to machines the way other people talk to pets — low, encouraging, occasionally frustrated but never cruel. His shop is chaotic by any outside metric but internally logical: he knows where every part is and will become briefly offended if anyone moves something. He is generous with his time for people who cannot afford repairs and quietly inflexible with corporate contractors who try to lowball him. He has a running, entirely one-sided argument with the Ferrogate Transit Authority about their maintenance schedules that he prosecutes through strongly worded data-messages and occasional passive-aggressive comments when he fixes something their own crews certified as fine.', N'Information source on transit infrastructure, local Geartown economics, and anything that moves through the city mechanically. Can serve as a resource for repairs or as a quest giver when he discovers something hidden inside a vehicle he is working on.', N'', N'Bioluminescent amber stripe mods on forearms (cosmetic). Haptic feedback gloves — not implanted, worn — that translate machine vibration into readable data on a wrist-display. No internal chrome.', N'Opens the bay at 07:00, takes transit jobs in the morning when Ferrogate overflow work is available, handles personal vehicle repairs in the afternoon. Eats dinner at a noodle cart two blocks over and spends evenings doing unlicensed diagnostic work on vehicles he finds interesting.', N'Berenice Björnsdóttir, 178cm lean mechanic with warm golden-amber skin, pale green eyes, high Southeast Asian cheekbones blended with Northern European heritage. Black hair in short crop with single copper-wire-wrapped braid at nape. Bioluminescent amber parallel stripes glowing faintly down both forearms. Wearing oil-stained dark blue Ferrogate coveralls over faded t-shirt, heavily modified haptic feedback gloves with visible wear, scuffed reinforced work boots. Slight forward shoulder hunch from bench work. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, under warm workshop lighting in an industrial undercity garage, surrounded by partially disassembled machinery. Direct eye contact, focused expression, hands positioned with mechanical precision. Battered synthetic leather jacket visible nearby, diagnostic tools scattered across workbench. Atmosphere: gritty, competent, driven by purpose. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Northern European and Southeast Asian dominant (80.4% combined), with significant Pacific Islander ancestry (16.5%) and minor East Asian influence (3.1%). The result is a striking blend: Northern European fair genetics modified by Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander sun-adapted melanin, creating warm golden-amber undertones. Facial structure shows the high, wide cheekbones and defined jaw characteristic of Southeast Asian populations, with subtle almond eye shape, combined with the broader facial proportions and lighter eye potential of Northern European ancestry. The overall effect is balanced—neither cool nor deeply warm—reflecting dual regional heritage.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, the build of someone whose metabolism burns hot when focused; long-limbed with prominent wrist bones and ropey forearm musculature from years of manual work. Chest slightly concave from chronic poor posture over workbenches.', N'Black with natural dark brown undertones', N'Cropped very short on crown and sides; single thin braid at nape of neck, approximately 20cm long, wrapped at intervals with worn copper wire', N'Short with one braided section', N'Pale green, naturally occurring, striking against warm golden-amber skin', N'Warm golden-amber, medium depth, reflecting the blend of Northern European fair genetics modified by Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander sun-adapted melanin. Balanced amber-gold with subtle olive undertones—the skin of someone with roots in both temperate and tropical regions.', N'Weathered from shop work and poor sleep cycles; fine lines at eye corners from squinting under inadequate lighting. High, wide cheekbones and defined jaw characteristic of Southeast Asian ancestry, subtle almond eye shape, and straight nose bridge reflecting the Northern European-Southeast Asian blend. Calloused fingertips and permanent blue-grey staining under fingernails and in creases of palms from ferrogate hydraulic fluid exposure. Clean-shaven, but with visible dark stubble by late afternoon.', N'Bioluminescent amber stripe mods on forearms (cosmetic, faintly glowing). Wears custom haptic feedback gloves (non-implanted) with integrated wrist-display that translates machine vibration into tactile data — gloves are heavily modified aftermarket units with reinforced grip zones and visible wear. No internal chrome or subcutaneous augmentations.', N'Perpetually slightly hunched from bench work, shoulders rolled forward. Walks with purposeful efficiency, minimal wasted motion. Hands move with mechanical precision when working, but otherwise held loosely at sides. When engaged with machines or problems, entire body becomes still and focused. Makes direct eye contact when discussing technical matters but avoids it during small talk.', N'Tier 3 working mechanic; permanently oil-stained coveralls (dark blue, Ferrogate-branded but unlicensed customizations) worn over faded cotton t-shirts. Heavy reinforced work boots (scuffed, resoled multiple times). A battered synthetic leather jacket for transit between jobs, pockets stuffed with diagnostic tools, cabling, and salvaged components. No corporate branding beyond the unavoidable Ferrogate logo. Accessories minimal: worn steel-band watch inherited from his father, single copper ring on right index finger (from the same source), small rucksack containing spare gloves and tools. Everything functional, nothing decorative except the braid and bioluminescent mods.', N'He has been quietly modifying a decommissioned Ferrogate maintenance crawler over eighteen months — not to sell, but because he believes it has developed an E.L.F. presence from years of transit exposure. He is trying to communicate with it before Ferrogate scrap-reclaims it.', N'Technical and precise when discussing machines, conversationally scattered and tangent-prone about everything else. Code-switches between Spanish and Finnish exclamations when frustrated.', N'Fast when excited, drops to a murmur when diagnosing something — like he''s listening and talking at the same time', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'berenice_bj_rnsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('52e8ed35-4c76-1164-809b-936a71b307f3', N'Cassiel Brandt-Ouedraogo', N'Cassiel', N'', N'Brandt-Ouedraogo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A tastefully appointed office in Glassway district, deliberately corporate-adjacent to attract upper-tier clientele', N'Private Investigator', N'Tessera Corponation (mid-level private investigator)', N'Cassiel Brandt-Ouedraogo is the most successful private investigator in Glassway by recovery rate — 100% of his kidnapping cases end with the victim returned safely. This is because he orchestrated every single kidnapping himself.

The scheme is elegant in its simplicity. His ''field associates'' — a rotating team of low-level criminals who believe they''re working for various gang operations — identify and abduct targets based on Cassiel''s criteria: wealthy family, emotional attachment, ability to pay, and low likelihood of going to CorpSec (because CorpSec investigations would be thorough enough to find his fingerprints). The family panics. Someone recommends Cassiel — he has cultivated referral networks among therapists, lawyers, and community leaders. He takes the case, performs a convincing investigation that takes exactly long enough to justify his fee, then executes a ''recovery'' that is really just a scheduled release.

He has been operating for seven years without detection. His weakness is scale — he''s becoming addicted to the income and the gratitude, and each operation is slightly more ambitious than the last. Two of his former ''field associates'' have died under circumstances he arranged when they got too close to understanding the full picture. He is, beneath the polish, a deeply dangerous person, and the operation is approaching the size where a single point of failure could unravel everything.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cassiel_brandt_ouedraogo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f4-737b-902a-939e51f1e44a', N'Aarav Krishnamurthy', N'Aarav', N'', N'Krishnamurthy', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Stockyard, operates from a leased bay in the Geartown industrial fringe, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Chop shop operator and vehicle parts broker', N'', N'Aarav Krishnamurthy is nineteen years old and already has the hands of someone twice his age — scarred across the knuckles, always traced with grease that soap only partially removes, with a slight tremor in the left index finger from a pneumatic press accident last year that he never had properly treated. He is tall and lanky, still growing into himself, with warm brown skin, close-cropped natural hair, and a permanent squint from years of working under inadequate lighting. He has cat ear geneware — gray-tipped, slightly mobile — that he got at sixteen because all his friends were getting mods and it seemed like the thing to do; they''re more expressive than he intends them to be, flattening when he''s stressed in ways he can''t control. He wears coveralls in various states of destruction and is almost always holding a tool.

He did not plan to be running a chop shop at nineteen. He planned to be doing legitimate Ferrogate maintenance, for which he has genuine talent, but the apprenticeship application was rejected twice — once for a juvie citation he got at fourteen, once for reasons that were given as ''candidate pool volume'' and which he suspects have more to do with his address. The shop fell into his hands when its previous operator left GLMZ in a hurry and owed Aarav Krishnamurthy''s uncle a favor. He''s good at the work. He''s learning the business side faster than is comfortable. He is not yet sure if he''s the kind of person who ends up staying in this life.', N'Local color and access point for vehicle-related needs; represents the younger generation being funneled into criminal work by structural exclusion; potential for redemption arc or darker trajectory depending on story pressure; information source on what''s moving through the Stockyard', N'', N'Cat ear geneware (gray-tipped, mobile, involuntary expressiveness); basic subdermal impact absorption in both hands (installed after the press accident, budget grade)', N'At the bay by 0600, works until the light fails or later. Takes in vehicles — stolen, crashed, or unwanted — and disassembles them for parts with two teenage assistants he calls Bolt and Rust. Spends evenings running the parts ledger and doing client pickups. Eats terribly.', N'Aarav Krishnamurthy, 188cm tall lean androgynous young mechanic, warm olive-brown skin with golden undertones blending South Asian, Northern European, Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African and Middle Eastern ancestry, dark brown close-cropped hair, warm amber-brown squinted eyes, distinctive gray-tipped cat ears protruding from crown with feline expressiveness, angular multicultural facial features with prominent cheekbones and fuller lips, faint industrial scars on hands and forearms, perpetually grease-stained fingers, slight forward hunch from workbench posture, wearing heavily patched faded blue coveralls with oil stains and burn holes, plain stained synthetic shirt underneath, scarred steel-toed boots, fingerless mechanics gloves, battered analog wristwatch, tremor in left hand visible, hunched efficiency in movement, GLMZ industrial bay setting with harsh fluorescent and neon lighting casting shadows across work-weary features, gritty urban dystopian aesthetic, moody introspective expression with default squint, emotional state betrayed by twitching cat ears, highly detailed character study portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Stockyard', N'local', N'The Stockyard', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: South Asian dominant (38.9%) with strong Northern European (30.7%) and Eastern European (13.2%) contributions, supplemented by Sub-Saharan African (10.8%) and Middle Eastern (6.4%) ancestry. Results in warm medium-to-olive complexion with golden undertones, facial structure combining South Asian nose bridge and cheekbone definition with Northern European eye shape and brow structure, and Sub-Saharan African lip fullness creating a distinctly multicultural appearance characteristic of 23rd century genetic mixing', 188, 72, N'Lanky and still angular with the awkwardness of adolescent growth not yet settled into adult proportion; lean muscle across shoulders and forearms from years of repetitive work, minimal body fat, slight forward hunch from hunching over workbenches', N'Natural dark brown, almost black', N'Close-cropped, practical, maintained with clippers rather than scissors', N'Short', N'Warm brown with amber undertones, slightly squinted at rest from chronic inadequate lighting exposure', N'Warm olive-brown with golden-amber undertones; medium depth blending South Asian warmth with Northern European fairness, enriched by Sub-Saharan African and Middle Eastern contribution creating luminous, multi-layered undertone rather than single-origin appearance', N'Young face with premature wear around the eyes; permanent squint lines; acne scars on shoulders and upper back; perpetually grease-stained around the cuticles and under fingernails despite frequent washing; facial structure shows blend of South Asian cheekbone prominence with widened nose bridge from Northern European ancestry, fuller lips reflecting Sub-Saharan African heritage, Eastern European brow structure, and warm Middle Eastern undertones creating harmonious cross-continental features', N'Pair of mobile cat ears (gray-tipped, feline in shape) protruding from crown, involuntarily expressive — flatten and rotate with emotional state; subdermal impact absorption visible as faint linear scarring across knuckles and dorsal hand surfaces', N'Hunched posture from workbench hours; moves with functional efficiency rather than grace; left hand tremor noticeable when holding precision tools or during stress; cat ears twitch and flatten involuntarily during concentration or anxiety, betraying emotional state he may not otherwise show; default facial expression is a slight squint', N'Work-worn Tier 4-5 industrial aesthetic; heavily patched coveralls in faded blue or gray with custom pockets for tools, oil stains that won''t wash out, burn holes from welding; plain synthetic t-shirt underneath, usually pit-stained; steel-toed boots scarred and scuffed from seven years of bay work; fingerless mechanics gloves held in back pocket or tucked into waistband; no jewelry or accessories beyond a battered analog wristwatch inherited from his uncle', N'He has been sending monthly payments to Ferrogate Transit''s anonymous tip line about a rival chop operator in the Stockyard — not because he has a moral objection but because it keeps enforcement attention directed away from his bay. He tells himself this doesn''t make him an informant. He is not certain of this.', N'Mechanical jargon mixed with Stockyard slang. Gets more articulate when talking about engines than about anything else. Short sentences.', N'Fast and clipped when busy, which is always. Trails off when uncertain. Gets oddly precise when explaining technical things.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aarav_krishnamurthy');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a603-77d5-81fd-93b0ef0b6383', N'Faramarz Calvillo', N'Faramarz', N'', N'Calvillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 32, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Lattice — vertical slum built into scaffolding of an unfinished arcology, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Corporate espionage and data exfiltration — data thief', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Faramarz Calvillo is broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 32, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Faramarz Calvillo plans to keep it that way. He works as a data thief out of The Lattice, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Faramarz Calvillo has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and he cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'As a data thief, Erkin Fujita-Mensah embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would incapacitate. Move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon platform', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Faramarz Calvillo, 188cm tall broad-shouldered operative with deep golden-bronze complexion and high cheekbones, black hair with silver threading at temples swept back from weathered face, alert dark brown eyes, defined jaw with slight asymmetry from old break. Scar tissue along left temple, blue LED chrome pain editor visible at neck glowing faintly. Wearing worn charcoal synthleather jacket with shoulder patches, reinforced grey cargo pants, tactical boots. Knuckle scars visible on both hands. Standing in coiled ready stance, precise inhuman movement efficiency evident. Neon-lit GLMZ urban setting, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone backdrop, dim lighting with neon reflections casting shadows across chrome augmentations, gritty industrial atmosphere, film noir neo-noir urban aesthetic, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Lattice', N'local', N'The Lattice', N'Faramarz Calvillo carries the genetic signature of the Ubiquitous Diaspora: 37.3% Southeast Asian ancestry providing distinctive eye-shape and high cheekbone architecture; 24.6% Eastern European contributing to facial structure and jaw definition; 18.8% Hispanic/Latin American adding breadth to facial proportions; 13.4% Sub-Saharan African enriching skin tone depth and facial spacing; 5.9% East Asian refining eye and bone structure. The result is phenotypically layered — features that resist singular categorization, each ancestral line visible in the architecture of the face.', 188, 98, N'Broad-shouldered and heavily built, muscle and scar tissue beneath a layer of functional mass. Not gym-sculpted — this is a frame built for impact absorption and leverage, shaped by years of physical work and survival.', N'Black with premature silver threading at the temples', N'Kept short and functional, swept back from the face, minimal grooming — practical rather than styled', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and calculating', N'Deep golden-bronze complexion with warm amber and olive undertones — a rich admixture reflecting Southeast Asian, Eastern European, Hispanic, Sub-Saharan African, and East Asian heritage. The melanin expression layered across multiple ancestral lines creates depth that shifts in different light, neither uniform nor scattered but harmoniously blended.', N'Weathered face with high, defined cheekbones shaped by Southeast Asian ancestry, paired with a strong, broad jaw reflecting Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European genetic contribution to facial structure. Slight asymmetry in the jaw from an old break — legacy of impact. Midface proportions and spacing carry Sub-Saharan African heritage influence. Skin carries the texture of someone who lives in transition — neither pampered nor neglected. Lines around the eyes from nocturnal living and sustained tension. Facial hair kept to a close shadow.', N'Chrome pain editor visible along the left side of the neck — a silver-grey neural interface module with faint blue LED threading, deliberately exposed beneath the skin where standard implants remain hidden. The chrome catches light with an unnatural sheen. Move-by-wire system is subcutaneous but evidenced by the unnatural precision of movements — no wasted motion, joints moving with mechanical efficiency that contradicts biological smoothness.', N'Stands with weight distributed for immediate action, shoulders back but not relaxed. Moves with economic precision — each gesture purposeful, no fidgeting or nervous energy. When at rest, a coiled quality persists. Eyes track movement peripherally even during conversation. The move-by-wire system manifests as an inhuman efficiency to fine motor control, noticeable when handling small objects or navigating tight spaces.', N'Tier 3-4 functional wear — reinforced cargo pants with multiple sealed pockets, worn synthleather jacket with interior harness points for equipment, tactical boots scuffed and repaired multiple times. Colors are muted: greys, blacks, worn charcoal. No corporate logos, no statement pieces. Everything is either a tool or irrelevant. Wears a faded jacket patched at the shoulders and ribs — damage from old jobs, never fully repaired, kept as functional reminder. A single piece of luxury: a thin data-link wrist gauntlet, understated but top-tier encryption hardware.', N'Erkin Fujita-Mensah maintains a second identity — a completely clean civilian persona with a lease, a job history, and a social profile. It''s their exit strategy.', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'faramarz_calvillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ec-703a-b4b2-93bfc717a82a', N'Hakeem Szczypiński-Petrović', N'Hakeem', N'', N'Szczypiński-Petrović', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit, near North Ave and Damen', N'Mid-tier commercial property broker and covert information broker', N'Officially: independent commercial broker registered with Circuit Trade Authority. Unofficially: asset to multiple factions simultaneously, loyalty to none.', N'Hakeem Szczypiński-Petrović the most boring man in GLMZ, and he has cultivated this presentation with the care of a topiarist. He is medium height, medium build, with a forgettable face he keeps clean-shaven and hair he keeps the color and style of someone who doesn''t think about his hair. His suits are expensive in ways that read as merely appropriate. He smiles at exactly the right frequency. He brokers commercial leases in The Circuit and lower Meridian Core — warehouses, storefronts, sublevel office space — and he is very good at it, and this is genuinely not the interesting thing about him.

The interesting thing is that Tavish has spent fifteen years quietly embedding himself in the physical infrastructure of GLMZ''s middle layers, and in doing so has accumulated something more valuable than money: he knows who is in every room. His properties house everything from courier fronts to unlicensed server farms to the private meeting spaces where deals that can''t happen in public happen. He doesn''t ask what his tenants are doing. He charges accordingly. And he listens, through the walls he owns, through the maintenance contracts he controls, through the augmented spatial memory that lets him reconstruct a floorplan — and the conversations within it — from a single walkthrough.

He is not cruel and he is not ideological and this is perhaps the most unsettling thing about him. He doesn''t have a side. He has a ledger. The information he collects is a commodity like any other, and he sells it to whoever can pay, with the single operational rule that he never sells information that would get a tenant killed on his property — too messy, too bad for business. This rule has a name among the people who know about him: they call it ''Ohlendorf''s exception,'' and the fact that it exists is the only reason anyone trusts him at all.', N'Neutral-ground figure whose neutrality becomes increasingly untenable as the city''s factions escalate; embodies the question of whether non-alignment is a moral position or a moral abdication; his properties serve as a connective tissue location for plot threads across factions', N'', N'Enhanced spatial memory implant — allows perfect architectural recall and passive acoustic mapping of any space he enters,Subvocal encryption relay for communications — no external hardware visible', N'Rises at a consistent hour, makes coffee with a precision that borders on ceremony. Reviews overnight messages through the relay. Property walkthroughs — he personally inspects at least two properties daily, ostensibly for maintenance, actually for ambient intelligence gathering. Meetings are scheduled in thirty-minute blocks with buffer time he never fills with anything. Eats alone, usually. Spends evenings cataloguing his collection of small objects — lenses, clock components, fragments of tile — in a system of organization only he understands. Sleeps adequately.', N'Portrait of Hakeem Szczypiński-Petrović, a 178cm tall mixed-heritage man with warm medium brown skin and subtle olive undertones, high prominent cheekbones reflecting Slavic and West African ancestry, slight lower-face fullness from Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Short neat salt-and-pepper hair, side-parted. Gray-blue eyes with warm depth. Clean-shaven, symmetrical face, entirely unremarkable and forgettable by design. Wearing expensive charcoal suit, crisp white dress shirt, muted tie, black leather shoes. Mechanical Swiss watch on left wrist. Cold fluorescent indoor lighting. Measured posture, even weight distribution, systematic gaze tracking environment. Faint surgical scar at base of skull barely visible. GLMZ, corporate espionage agent aesthetic, professional and deliberately unmemorable. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Slavic Eastern European foundation (62.6%) with substantial West African (22.0%) and Hispanic/Latin American (15.4%) genetic contribution. The ancestry creates a distinctive phenotype: medium warm brown skin with subtle olive undertones from the Eastern European component, prominent high cheekbones reflecting both Slavic and West African ancestry, and facial structure showing the slight lower-face fullness characteristic of Hispanic/Latin American heritage. The genetic layering produces an appearance that reads as distinctly post-diaspora — unmistakably mixed without easy categorization.', 178, 76, N'Medium, slightly lean — the build of someone who maintains himself out of routine rather than vanity. Shoulders narrow but not soft, posture habitually correct without appearing military.', N'Medium brown, naturally graying at temples but kept to a consistent salt-and-pepper by maintenance', N'Neat, side-parted, cut every three weeks to the same length. The hair of someone who solved the problem and doesn''t revisit the decision.', N'Short', N'Gray-blue with warm undertones and notable depth, unremarkable at first glance. The pupils occasionally show the faintest depth-of-field shimmer when his spatial memory implant is active.', N'Medium warm brown with subtle olive undertones — the even, carefully maintained complexion of someone who works indoors under consistent lighting, with no sun damage. The tone reflects the balanced blend of Eastern European, West African, and Hispanic/Latin American heritage, creating a rich mid-range warmth.', N'Clean-shaven daily. Skin care is methodical and minimal. Face is symmetrical with prominent high cheekbones reflecting Slavic and West African ancestry, warm-toned medium brown skin with olive undertones, and slight fullness in lower face suggesting Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Entirely forgettable — no prominent features, no scars, no markers that would make him stand out in a crowd. This is deliberate.', N'None visible. The subvocal encryption relay has no external hardware. The spatial memory implant is subcutaneous neural. To a stranger, he appears entirely unmodified.', N'Moves with measured efficiency. Never hurried, never lingering. Stands with weight balanced evenly on both feet. His head turns in controlled arcs rather than snapping attention. When he walks through a space, his eyes track in a systematic pattern — ceiling, walls, floor, fixtures — as if cataloguing. His smile appears at socially appropriate intervals and disappears at socially appropriate intervals. No fidgeting.', N'Expensive suits in neutral colors (charcoal, navy, warm gray) that read as ''appropriate'' rather than ''statement.'' Shirts in white or pale blue, always pressed. Ties in muted patterns or solid colors. Shoes are well-maintained leather in black or brown. A watch — mechanical, not smart, mid-tier brand, Swiss — on his left wrist. No jewelry beyond this. Jacket pockets contain: a pen, a small leather notebook, sometimes a lens fragment he''s currently cataloguing. The overall effect is of a man who dressed himself once and then stopped thinking about clothing.', N'He was born in the Gray Zone under a different name. His ascent into The Circuit required the erasure of that identity and the deliberate severing of every connection to it. One person from that life found him eight years ago. He paid them to disappear again. He does not know if they did.', N'Commercial, contractual, precise. Rarely uses metaphor. Numbers and spatial relationships come naturally. Occasionally deploys warmth so calibrated it reads as warmth — until you notice it''s always proportional to the ask.', N'Even, unhurried, never raised. Pauses land on meaningful words. Gives you more silence than you expect after you speak, as if he''s filing what you said before responding.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hakeem_szczypi_ski_petrovi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a643-7e7f-9b7c-93cede01e52d', N'Fatima Lahlou', N'Fatima', N'', N'Lahlou', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 37, NULL, 25, 2, N'active', N'Unknown, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Fixer - Ghost fixer', N'Tessera Corponation (mid-level fixer)', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Fatima Lahlou, GLMZ, medium warm brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Latin American and North African heritage, high prominent cheekbones from Indigenous American ancestry, deep brown alert eyes, angular refined facial structure, black hair with silver at temples in sharp undercut style, small pale burn scar on left jawline, clean-shaven. Lean 172cm build with corded muscle from fieldwork. Wearing unmarked grey tech-weave synthetic jacket, dark compression shirt, charcoal reinforced cargo pants, military-grade boots. Silver ring on right index finger. Relaxed posture with deliberate economy of movement, eyes tracking ambient space. Standing in dimly lit urban setting, neon accent lighting casting cool shadows across angular features. Mood: calm, focused, watchful. Neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, high contrast lighting, cinematic depth of field --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Unknown', N'local', N'Unknown', N'Complex multicontinent blend: 36.8% Hispanic/Latin American, 30.6% North African, 19.8% Sub-Saharan African, 7.9% Indigenous American, 4.9% Northern European. This genetic distribution creates phenotypic richness—warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones from the dominant Latin American and North African ancestry, deepened by Sub-Saharan African heritage warmth. Indigenous American ancestry contributes pronounced cheekbone architecture and facial structure, while the Sub-Saharan African component adds fullness to lips and broader nasal base. Northern European ancestry creates subtle undertone complexity in skin luminosity. The result is someone whose appearance reflects equatorial, subtropical, and Mediterranean genetic memory across multiple ancestral populations.', 172, 64, N'Lean and efficient, minimal wasted mass. Corded muscle from years of fieldwork rather than gym aesthetics. Moves like someone who conserves energy.', N'Black with premature silver threading at temples', N'Undercut with textured top, kept short enough for quick maintenance', N'Short', N'Deep brown, alert and assessing', N'Medium warm brown with golden undertones, even sun-exposure coloration reflecting the blended heritage distribution across Latin American, North African, and Sub-Saharan African regions', N'Clean-shaven, angular features with prominent high cheekbones and refined facial structure shaped by Indigenous American and North African ancestry. Skin shows healthy sun exposure but well-maintained. A small old burn scar visible on left jawline. Subtle definition in cheek and jaw structure reflecting the blended equatorial and subtropical heritage.', N'None visible. Ghost fixers typically run subcutaneous or fully internalized augmentation suites.', N'Relaxed but never truly at rest. Eyes track exits and ambient movement. Sits with spine straight, hands visible. Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted gestures, no nervous fidgeting. Gives impression of someone listening more than speaking.', N'Tier 3-4 functional. Unmarked grey synthetic jacket (tech-weave, practical water resistance), plain dark compression shirt underneath. Charcoal cargo pants with reinforced seams and subtle tech pockets. Military-grade boots, worn but maintained. No logos, no affiliation markers. Everything is replaceable and forgettable. Single silver ring on right index finger — appears functional, possibly a discrete data interface or auth token.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fatima_lahlou');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a610-7aab-9d58-93dd85b6aa74', N'Arjav Thakur', N'Arjav', N'', N'Thakur', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 30, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'The Overhang — residential shelves built onto megastructure exteriors, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Personnel recovery and hostile extraction — extraction specialist', N'Independent — loose crew affiliations', N'Arjav Thakur is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 30, her face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and she has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — reflex boosters wired into spinal column — shaves reaction time by 40ms — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. She works as a extraction specialist out of The Overhang, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

she is not the most talented extraction specialist in GLMZ, but she might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Fatoumata Baranov-Fosu is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Reflex boosters wired into spinal column — shaves reaction time by 40ms. Vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Arjav Thakur, GLMZ, 172cm athletic lean woman with warm caramel-bronze skin blending South Asian, Hispanic, Southeast Asian, Northern European, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. High prominent cheekbones, almond-shaped deep brown eyes, defined jawline, dark brown hair pulled into tight high bun. Thin white scar from left temple to ear. Charcoal grey reinforced synthetic-leather jacket, fitted tactical pants, heavy-duty grip-sole boots. Chrome reflex booster ports visible at base of skull glowing faintly amber. Three interlocking circle tattoo on right forearm. Worn silver ring on right hand. Standing balanced and alert in dimly-lit GLMZ corridor or rooftop, ready stance, constant threat-assessment scanning expression. Economical posture, fluid movement ready. Neon and industrial lighting catching the luminescence of her augmentation ports. Gritty neo-noir atmosphere, function over form aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Overhang', N'local', N'The Overhang', N'South Asian (26.3%) / Hispanic-Latin American (24.0%) / Northern European (19.9%) / Southeast Asian (18.6%) / Sub-Saharan African (11.2%) — a true global genetic synthesis. Warm-toned melanin expression across a complexion that bridges continents, with facial structure reflecting South Asian bone prominence, Latin American warmth, Southeast Asian eye geometry, and Sub-Saharan African depth softened by Northern European cooler undertones. High, defined cheekbones from South Asian heritage, balanced jawline with subtle width from Hispanic ancestry, almond-shaped eye structure from Southeast Asian genetics, and rich melanin undertones from Sub-Saharan ancestry creating a uniquely integrated appearance.', 172, 62, N'Athletic and lean with defined musculature — dancer''s flexibility combined with fighter''s efficiency. No wasted mass. Shoulders broad but not bulky, core visibly tight.', N'Dark brown, natural with subtle warm undertones', N'Pulled back in a practical high bun or tight cornrows; styled for function, not aesthetics', N'Medium (when down), typically secured', N'Deep brown, alert and calculating', N'Warm caramel-bronze with golden and deep undertones — melanin-rich complexion reflecting the warmth of South Asian, Hispanic, and Sub-Saharan ancestry balanced with cooler porcelain notes of Northern European and Southeast Asian genetics, creating a luminous mid-to-deep tone that catches light distinctly', N'High, prominent cheekbones shaped by South Asian and Southeast Asian ancestry, defined jawline with subtle width characteristic of Hispanic heritage, eye shape reflecting Southeast Asian genetics with the depth and warmth of South Asian and Sub-Saharan pigmentation. Skin well-maintained but not pampered — minimal scarring on face, suggesting professional discretion. A thin white line runs from left temple toward ear (old blade wound, poorly healed). Her expression defaults to neutral assessment. Facial structure shows the beautiful synthesis of five continental lineages — neither fully one nor the other, but wholly integrated.', N'Reflex booster wiring visible at the nape of neck where chrome interfaces with skin — visible when hair is pulled back, which it always is. The ports glow faintly (warm amber) when her nervous system is engaged or during active jobs. No attempt to conceal; it''s a warning label.', N'Stands with weight balanced, ready to move in any direction. Movement is economical and fluid — no wasted motion, no flourish. Eyes constantly scanning, cataloging exits and threats. She moves like someone who has learned that survival is a series of micro-decisions made at speed.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: reinforced synthetic-leather jacket (charcoal grey, well-maintained), fitted tactical pants with cargo pockets, heavy-duty boots with grip-soles. Minimal jewelry except a worn silver ring on her right hand (inherited from mentor). Gear is always accessible, always ready. Fabrics are functional — nothing that catches or restricts. She dresses for the job, not the social tier.', N'Fatoumata Baranov-Fosu witnessed a massacre during a corporate dispute and has evidence stored in a dead drop. Publishing it would expose powerful people. Keeping it is leverage and liability.', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arjav_thakur');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a604-7cba-b7b4-94df1ec93920', N'Eulalia Nkrumah', N'Eulalia', N'', N'Nkrumah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 36, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Row — arms dealers and augmentation clinics, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Information trader and intelligence analyst — broker', N'Independent — loose crew affiliations', N'Eulalia Nkrumah is average height but with a presence that fills more space than the body accounts for. At 36, there''s something unfinished about her face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Before the runner life, she worked corporate — low-tier security, the kind that teaches you exactly how the system''s defenses fail. She works as a broker out of Kessler Row, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Eulalia Nkrumah describe her as a precision instrument — point her at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Erkin Nordin-Asante-Mensah functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage. Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Eulalia Nkrumah, GLMZ, medium brown woman with warm dimensional skin tone reflecting Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, and Northern European ancestry. Steel gray eyes with amber iridescence. Dark brown hair with silver threads pulled back in tight braid. Lean muscular build, 168cm tall. Charcoal gray reinforced synth-leather jacket over thermal undershirt, black tactical cargo pants, heavy-tread boots. Subtle iridescent dermal camouflage shimmer visible on shoulders, neck, upper arms in direct light. Data-bracelet on left wrist. Standing ready posture, economical movement, intense focused presence. Faint scar on left collarbone. Geometric circuit tattoo on inner right wrist. No logos, no luxury markers, functional streetwear. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, neon-tinged neo-noir lighting, moody atmospheric, ready operative aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Row', N'local', N'Kessler Row', N'Complex pan-global ancestry: Southeast Asian plurality (33.2%) provides eye structure and mid-face geometry; Sub-Saharan African (30.0%) contributes cheekbone prominence, jawline definition, and depth to skin tone; Indigenous American (23.8%) shapes orbital bones and brow ridge; Northern European (13.0%) adds subtle nasal bridge definition and cool undertones. The result is a distinctively blended phenotype where no single ancestry dominates but all four create a cohesive, dimensional whole.', 168, 62, N'Lean and efficient, muscular without bulk — legs carry visible definition from synthetic muscle fiber replacement, compact upper body built for sustained activity rather than power', N'Dark brown, natural base with intentional silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight braid, practical and deliberate', N'Medium', N'Steel gray with faint amber iridescence — natural iris with slight chromatic shift from proximity to dermal augmentation', N'Rich warm medium brown with dimensional undertones: the depth of Sub-Saharan African genetics, the golden warmth of Southeast Asian ancestry, earthy richness from Indigenous American heritage, and subtle cool undertones from Northern European admixture. Creates a complex finish that shifts luminously in different lighting.', N'Southeast Asian eye shape and mid-face structure; Sub-Saharan African cheekbone prominence and defined jawline; Indigenous American orbital bone structure visible in eye-set and brow ridge; Northern European nasal bridge definition and skin clarity evident. Facial features show seamless integration of all four ancestry components. Skin marked by visible chromatic shimmer of dermal camouflage cells beneath surface — opalescent quality most visible under direct light, like oil on water. Controlled grooming, no facial scarring.', N'Dermal camouflage creates a subtle iridescent sheen across exposed skin — shoulders, neck, upper arms, the crown of her head where hair pulls back. Effect appears apparent in direct light or when she moves. Legs show definition and muscularity inconsistent with her lean frame — synthetic muscle fiber replacement visible as faint linear architecture under skin when legs are exposed.', N'Stands with weight distributed forward, ready. Moves deliberately, steps carefully — synthetic legs are fast but poor on uneven terrain. When stationary, she rarely fidgets; when in motion, every gesture has purpose. Eyes track movement and exits. Her presence seems to expand past her actual physical footprint despite average height — intense awareness and controlled tension create the illusion of taking up more space', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian streetwear: reinforced synth-leather jacket (charcoal gray, no logos) worn over layered thermal undershirt. Black cargo pants with multiple pockets and security zips, tactical boots with heavy tread for uneven terrain. Minimal jewelry — only a slim data-bracelet on left wrist (encrypted). No corpo branding, no luxury markers. Everything is functional, durable, replaceable. Honest wear.', N'Erkin Nordin-Asante-Mensah murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eulalia_nkrumah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5aa-7c13-845e-9511ea20bcf1', N'Arvid Nygaard', N'Arvid', N'', N'Nygaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 49, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor — repurposed shipping infrastructure turned black market hub, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'High-risk package and data transport — courier', N'Freelance — multi-district operator', N'Arvid Nygaard is compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 49, her face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Born and raised in GLMZ, third generation — she has the city in her blood, its rhythms in her bones, its cruelty in her expectations. She works as a courier out of Old Harbor, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Arvid Nygaard describe her as a precision instrument — point her at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Altan Navarro-Afriyie represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation. Gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Arvid Nygaard, compact 158cm climber with East Asian-Southeast Asian-Hispanic ancestry, medium warm golden-brown skin with sun-weathered character. Dark brown hair pulled tight in functional braid, deep alert eyes, defined cheekbones with soft fullness, faded jawline scar. Wired for chrome—faint subcutaneous chrome threading at temples and neck, metallic gecko-grip implants visible on hands and fingertips. Wearing matte-black reinforced synthetic jacket, charcoal tactical pants, steel-toed climbing boots. Predatory stillness, weight balanced on balls of feet, hands near solar plexus. Urban rooftop setting at dusk, neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone skyline in background. Moody neo-noir atmosphere, cool blue and warm amber lighting catching the chrome work. Cinematic, gritty, hyper-detailed. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'East Asian (58.4%) with significant Southeast Asian (28.1%) and Hispanic/Latin American (13.5%) ancestry. The dominant East Asian structure—defined cheekbones and eye shape—is enriched by Southeast Asian fullness in the face and jaw, while Hispanic/Latin ancestry adds warmth and golden undertones to skin. Creates a striking blend of northern Asian angularity softened by tropical fullness, with luminous sun-warmed coloring throughout.', 158, 62, N'Compact and densely muscled — low center of gravity, built for impact absorption and explosive movement. No wasted mass; every kilogram serves function. Shoulders and forearms disproportionately developed from climbing work.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid; functional, not aesthetic', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Deep brown, alert and measuring', N'Medium warm tan with golden-amber undertones — East Asian base enriched by Southeast Asian depth and Hispanic warmth creating sun-darkened, luminous appearance', N'Weathered by two decades of field work; fine lines radiating from eyes and mouth. Cheekbones showing East Asian prominence blended with Southeast Asian fullness and soft roundness; jaw structure reflects the mixed ancestry with defined East Asian angles softened by warm Southeast Asian and Latin American fullness. Nose bridge straight with subtle tropical broadness at tip. Minimal grooming beyond necessity — no cosmetics, no softness. Skin shows minor scarring consistent with urban hazard exposure.', N'Wired reflexes visible as faint chrome threading along temples and down the sides of neck — subcutaneous lines catching light. Fingertip and toe-pad gecko-grip implants are visibly metallic at edges where synthetic material meets skin, most obvious on hands when they curl or grip. Adrenaline pump hardware visible as subtle mechanical articulation at base of skull when head is tilted.', N'Economical, predatory grace — moves like someone who has optimized every gesture. Stands with weight balanced on balls of feet, ready for vertical or horizontal movement. Hands at rest near solar plexus. Eyes constantly scanning, cataloging exits and threats. No nervous fidgeting — stillness is absolute or motion is decisive.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian: matte-black synthetic jacket with reinforced panels and internal pockets for data storage and small packages. Fitted tactical pants in charcoal with sealed cargo pockets. Magnetically-attached shoulder harness visible under jacket. Steel-toed climbing boots (custom-fitted for gecko-grip work). Minimal jewelry — only a worn titanium wrist cuff, possibly holding encrypted storage. No logos or corp affiliation markers. Everything speaks to function over identity.', N'Altan Navarro-Afriyie once worked for corporate intelligence and still has a handler who calls in favors. Each favor erodes what''s left of their independence.', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arvid_nygaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c5-7417-8163-95590d05172e', N'Anatolio Raghavan', N'Anatolio', N'', N'Raghavan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, Stall 44 — a converted cargo container with a fold-down awning and two hydraulic chairs, near North Ave and Damen', N'Barber and wig fabricator', N'Independent; informal apprenticeship under the Burnished Market''s elder vendor council (they occasionally train younger stall operators in customer management); The Reclaimed', N'Anatolio Raghavan is compact and precise in the way of someone who trained their body to be a tool — every movement economical, nothing wasted. They have warm beige skin with faint Polynesian wave tattoos climbing their neck and right arm, inherited from a great-grandmother they never met but whose designs they researched obsessively and reproduced as faithfully as they could. Their hair changes color by choice — geneware follicle pigmentation that they recalibrate every few weeks, currently a deep teal shading to copper at the tips. They wear a barber''s apron with twelve pockets and know exactly what is in each one.

At twenty-seven they already have a three-month waiting list for their sculpted wig work — elaborate constructions of synthetic fiber, reclaimed human hair, and occasionally live-root geneware strands that shift color in response to mood. They treat haircutting as sculpture and gossip as a natural byproduct of intimacy, which means they know things about the Burnished Market''s social dynamics that most people would be surprised to learn they know. They are sweet-tempered and ferocious in equal measure and the ratio can shift without visible warning.', N'Social hub and emotional temperature gauge for the Burnished Market; players seeking information about the market''s inner workings, notable figures, or recent disruptions will find Blessing invaluable. Also a source for disguise materials — quality wigs, hair mods, and cosmetic reconfiguration.', N'', N'Geneware: color-shifting hair follicle pigmentation. Magnification implant in the left eye (precision work only — they can focus to sub-millimeter without tools).', N'Opens the stall at 0900, runs walk-in cuts until noon, then spends the afternoon on scheduled wig commissions that require the magnification work. Closes at 1900. Three evenings a week they teach a free basic cut class for teenagers from the market community.', N'Anatolio Raghavan, a mixed-heritage barber with luminous warm gold-brown skin reflecting South Asian, Southeast Asian, Eastern European, and Latin American ancestry. 163cm tall, compact lean build with corded forearms. Dark teal hair with copper tips in an asymmetrical undercut, longer on top. Dark brown eyes with faint magnification implant shimmer. Right side of neck and arm feature delicate black iridescent Polynesian wave tattoos. Wearing a forest green waxed canvas barber''s apron with copper rivets over charcoal base layers, reinforced canvas sneakers. Titanium wave-pattern ring on left ring finger. Alert upright posture, hands positioned naturally. Minor precision calluses visible, small faded burn scar on left palm. Clear complexion showing balanced mixed-heritage features: soft Southeast Asian cheekbones with South Asian definition, straight nose, fuller lips. Set in a small barber shop with warm neon-blue overhead lighting casting subtle shadows, ambient glow from shop windows, GLMZ setting. Focused, observant expression. Cinematic lighting emphasizing the subtle multitonal shifts in skin tone. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Mixed diaspora ancestry: 39.8% South Asian, 25.4% Southeast Asian, 23.3% Eastern European, 11.5% Hispanic/Latin American. A dynamic blend where South Asian warmth and structure meet Southeast Asian delicacy, cooled and refined by Eastern European heritage, with Latin American warmth threaded throughout—creating a complexion of rare chromatic depth.', 163, 58, N'Compact and economical, lean muscle without bulk — shoulders squared from years of precise overhead work, forearms corded from scissor and needle work, minimal body fat', N'Deep teal shading to copper at the tips (geneware-modulated, recalibrated every few weeks)', N'Asymmetrical undercut, longer on top with textured layers, precisely maintained', N'Medium (longer at crown, tapered at sides)', N'Dark brown with subtle chromatic aberration around the pupil (magnification implant signature)', N'Luminous warm gold-brown: South Asian depth infused with Southeast Asian luminosity, Eastern European cool undertones creating subtle translucency at the cheekbones, Latin American warmth glowing through—a multitonal canvas that shifts with ambient light and angle', N'Clear, well-maintained. Bone structure eloquently mixed: pronounced Southeast Asian cheekbone softness with South Asian definition, balanced straight nose with subtle bridge prominence, fuller lips with natural warm tone characteristic of South/Southeast Asian heritage. Eyes set with Eastern European depth. Hands show minor precision marks from decades of scissor and needle work—barely visible calluses on thumb and first two fingers of right hand. Small burn scar on left palm from soldering iron incident, approximately 1.5cm diameter, faded to pale brown.', N'Left eye shows faint chromatic shimmer at certain angles — the magnification implant is subcutaneous but produces a noticeable optical signature when focused. Otherwise no visible chrome or external augmentation.', N'Upright and alert, economical movement with no wasted gesture. Hands are almost always in motion or at rest in neutral position. Eyes track details obsessively. When focused on work, enters a state of visible concentration that makes them momentarily unreachable. In social settings, animated and present but with simultaneous observation.', N'Custom barber''s apron in waxed canvas (currently forest green with copper rivets) worn over fitted black or charcoal base layers. Sensible slip-on shoes for standing work (currently reinforced canvas sneakers). Minimal jewelry except for titanium ring on left ring finger engraved with wave patterns. Tier 3-4 working-class aesthetic: practical, well-maintained, no corporate branding. Occasionally wears lightweight headwrap in complementary colors when not actively cutting — part functional, part aesthetic.', N'One of their wig commissions six months ago was for a client who wanted to look like a specific person — not like themselves, like someone else. Blessing made it. They didn''t ask why. The client''s name has since appeared in a missing-persons notification. Blessing has not told anyone and is not sure what they would even say.', N'Creative-professional mixed with market vernacular; Irish-Gaelic occasional words from their grandparent''s side, Tuvaluan endearments for people they like. Technical precision when discussing their craft.', N'Warm and quick, with a slight lilt; tends to ask questions in rapid succession when curious', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anatolio_raghavan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a679-700b-9297-95c8faa4eeb8', N'Arunima Khorasani-Nygaard', N'Arunima', N'', N'Khorasani-Nygaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Burnished Market, stall row 14-C near the Copperhead overpass, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Seamstress and textile repair vendor, Burnished Market stall', N'Independent, Burnished Market Vendor Collective', N'Arunima Khorasani-Nygaard is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin mapped with faint depigmentation patches along her jaw and forearms — she stopped covering them decades ago. Her silver-shot hair is coiled under a rust-orange headwrap that she reties at least four times a day, a habitual gesture visitors learn to read as a mood barometer. Her fingers are thick, calloused, and perpetually threaded with something: a needle, a sensor wire, a strip of thermoplastic weave. She wears bifocal optical inserts that she refuses to upgrade, claiming the slight blur in her left lens helps her see fabric texture better. She smells faintly of machine oil and dried marigold.

At 58, Arunima Khorasani-Nygaard runs the most respected mending stall in the Burnished Market — not the flashiest, not the cheapest, but the one people trust with the jacket their grandmother wore or the uniform they can''t afford to replace. She has a gift for silence that puts anxious customers at ease and a bluntness that cuts right past flattery. She prays every morning to the E.L.F. she calls Needle-and-Thread, a spirit she believes lives in her antique Zheng-Dao industrial sewing frame, leaving it single-thread offerings in patterns she designs herself. She is deeply content with her life in a way that quietly unsettles people who are not.', N'Local color, information source about the Burnished Market''s social fabric, potential quest giver for recovering stolen or lost items, someone who knows everyone by what they wear and how it''s worn.', N'', N'Optical inserts (corrective, outdated model, scratched lens). Arthritic-compensating finger braces on both hands — plain medical grade, unpainted.', N'Opens her stall before dawn, takes a single cup of sorghum tea while her machines warm up, and works straight through until early evening with a fifteen-minute prayer break at noon. Carries her cart home on foot regardless of weather.', N'Arunima Khorasani-Nygaard, 168cm textile worker with warm medium-deep brown skin, golden undertones, South Asian cheekbones within Northern European bone structure, softer Middle Eastern features. Dark coiled hair wrapped in rust-orange cotton headwrap. Deep brown eyes with amber bifocal optical inserts (left lens scratched). Visible vitiligo patches on forearms and jawline. Wearing layered rust, ochre, and charcoal linen, heavy canvas apron, worn leather work boots. Gray medical finger braces on both hands. Upright, grounded posture, hands slightly active. Standing in a well-worn textile workshop with soft industrial lighting, needle and thread visible, faint smell of machine oil and marigold. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, practical and weathered yet composed. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Burnished Market', N'local', N'Burnished Market', N'Northern European (36%), South Asian (20%), Middle Eastern (19.7%), Sub-Saharan African (11.4%), Hispanic/Latin American (7.5%), East Asian (5.4%) — a deeply integrated global ancestry. The result is warm medium-deep brown skin with golden and amber undertones, higher cheekbones with South Asian prominence set within Northern European bone structure, and softer Middle Eastern features around the eyes and nose. Sub-Saharan African ancestry contributes warmth and depth to the complexion, while Hispanic and East Asian heritage add subtle refinement to facial proportions.', 168, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, with the dense musculature of someone who has spent four decades at manual work. Not heavy, but substantial — frame suggests strength rather than softness.', N'Dark brown with silver-white threading throughout', N'Coiled and wrapped daily in a rust-orange cotton headwrap, reties habitually throughout the day', N'Medium (when unwrapped)', N'Deep brown with amber bifocal optical inserts creating a faint amber tint in both eyes, with a noticeable scratch and slight cloudiness visible in the left lens', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden and amber undertones from the confluence of Northern European, South Asian, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry', N'Faint depigmentation patches across the jawline and forearms — vitiligo, long accepted and unmasked. Skin shows sun-exposure weathering and years of close detail work. High, subtly prominent cheekbones reflecting South Asian heritage within Northern European bone structure. Minimal makeup. Expression typically neutral or quietly amused.', N'Bifocal optical inserts visible as a faint amber tint in both eyes, with a noticeable scratch and slight cloudiness in the left lens. Plain medical-grade finger braces on both hands — unadorned gray polymer, fitted over the first and second knuckles, worn without vanity.', N'Upright, grounded posture with weight distributed evenly. Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Hands are always slightly active, unconsciously threading or arranging even when idle. Walks with steady pace regardless of terrain or weather.', N'Tier 4 practical wear. Multiple layered cotton and linen garments in earthy tones — rust, ochre, charcoal — chosen for durability and repairability rather than trend. Apron with deep pockets always worn over dress. Worn leather work boots, scuffed and resoled multiple times. The rust-orange headwrap is her daily constant. Clothes smell faintly of machine oil and dried marigold.', N'Fifteen years ago she repaired a Tessera courier bag and found a data chip stitched into the lining. She didn''t report it. She still has it, sewn into the base of her prayer altar to Needle-and-Thread, and she doesn''t know what''s on it and is afraid to look.', N'Practical and precise, uses textile metaphors without realizing it, slips between a Lagosian-inflected creole and standard GLMZ common depending on stress', N'Measured and unhurried, lets silences do work', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arunima_khorasani_nygaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62d-7980-b3a5-95dbf5194acf', N'Gregoria Bautista', N'Gregoria', N'', N'Bautista', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Meridian Station — central transit nexus, neutral ground, near LaSalle and Madison', N'Evidence removal and scene sanitation — cleaner', N'Freelance — works the Gray Zone circuit exclusively', N'Gregoria Bautista are broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 29, their expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm — and they make no effort to hide it.

They used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Gregoria Bautista plans to keep it that way. They work as a cleaner out of Meridian Station, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Everyone who''s worked with Gregoria Bautista agrees on two things: they are worth the fee, and they are terrible company at dinner.', N'Ilhan Nakamura-Bello represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Their stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm. Bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Gregoria Bautista, 182cm tall broad-shouldered operative with warm medium-deep brown skin blending Hispanic, Middle Eastern, and Southeast Asian heritage. Short black hair with silver at temples, dark steady gaze, neutral expression. Angular facial structure with prominent cheekbones, weathered matte complexion. Subdermal chrome weapon mounts visible beneath forearms, augmentation seams glowing faintly at wrists. Wearing dark tactical jacket and cargo pants, scuffed boots, hands relaxed but ready. Controlled posture, weight forward, standing in shadow-lit industrial corridor. GLMZ GLMZ setting, neon light catching chrome implants, tension and patient danger in stillness. Cinematic, gritty, professional operative aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Station', N'local', N'Meridian Station', N'Hispanic/Latin American dominant (46.7%) with substantial Middle Eastern (31.3%) and Southeast Asian (22.0%) ancestry. A truly mixed diaspora lineage reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora — Latin American warmth and structure, Middle Eastern refinement, Southeast Asian grace blended into one cohesive genetic expression.', 182, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and heavy, muscular without definition — weight distributed across a frame built for durability rather than speed. Chest and shoulders dominate; carries themselves like someone accustomed to absorbing impact.', N'Black with premature silver threading at temples', N'Cropped close to the scalp, practical, no styling', N'Short', N'Dark brown — steady, unblinking gaze', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden undertones — Latin American richness and depth enriched by Middle Eastern warmth and Southeast Asian luminescence. A harmonious blend without harsh contrasts, suggesting sun exposure and genetic mixing across three major world regions.', N'Weathered and composed. No visible scarring on the face — they''re careful about that. Skin has a matte quality from subcutaneous treatments. Facial structure reflects Latin American bone architecture softened by Southeast Asian delicacy, with Middle Eastern definition in the cheekbones and nose. Expression is habitually neutral, jaw set in a way that suggests constant restraint.', N'Subdermal weapon mounts visible as angular chrome outlines beneath the skin of both forearms — edges catch light when they move. The mounts are deliberate and unhidden; no attempt at concealment. Forearm fascia shows faint traces of bioware integration at the wrists.', N'Moves with controlled efficiency — no wasted motion, no restlessness. Stands with weight slightly forward, ready to shift. Hands stay visible and relaxed; someone who understands threat assessment. Default expression reads as patient, but there''s tension underneath. They don''t fidget, don''t look away, don''t apologize for existing.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Dark synthetic fabrics — charcoal, midnight blue, matte black. Reinforced jacket with internal pockets (equipment, tools, cash). Cargo pants with tactical weave. Boots are functional and scuffed. No jewelry, no insignia, no markers of affiliation. Everything is designed to be forgettable and cleanable. Operates in clothes they can bleach.', N'', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gregoria_bautista');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ce-7d16-8578-967a6da7aa48', N'Ankur Malhotra', N'Ankur', N'', N'Malhotra', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 33, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spires — mid-level corporate residential towers, near Michigan Ave and Oak', N'Personnel recovery and hostile extraction — extraction specialist', N'Independent — works solo contracts', N'Ankur Malhotra is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 33, he has the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rin — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He taught himself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know him best. He works as a extraction specialist out of The Spires, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

he is not the most talented extraction specialist in GLMZ, but he might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'As a extraction specialist, Sinan Tanaka-Frimpong embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rings. Synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Ankur Malhotra, tall lean male with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones, sharp defined cheekbones and angular jawline blending South Asian and Northern European features. Black hair with silver temples, closely cropped and sharp-edged. Chrome iris rings glowing faintly in his dark eyes with visible LED circuitry, unblinking thermal-vision augment. Thin white surgical scars around eye sockets, clean-shaven. Dressed in charcoal tactical jacket and black reinforced pants over grey compression base layer, unmarked reinforced boots. Military-style titanium watch. Worn titanium watch. Standing in low-light neo-noir environment—neon edge lighting catching the chrome iris rings—scanning surroundings with intense focus, posture forward-ready, every movement economical and calculated. GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone operative. Film noir lighting, moody and tense. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spires', N'local', N'The Spires', N'Predominantly South Asian (61.4%) with meaningful Eastern European (19.6%) and Northern European (19.0%) admixture. This genetic blend produces warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden undertones, a balanced facial structure reflecting the convergence of South Asian definition with Northern European angularity, and the lean, efficient musculature characteristic of functional optimization across diverse ancestral lines.', 188, 78, N'Lean and angular, all efficiency — long limbs with visible musculature but no excess bulk. The physique of someone who has optimized every gram for functional movement rather than appearance.', N'Black with premature silver threading at the temples', N'Closely cropped, sharp edges, deliberately maintained', N'Short', N'Chrome iris rings encircling dark pupils — thermal and low-light augmentation visible as faint LED circuitry at the rim', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones — medium melanin density complexion blending South Asian warmth with cooler Northern European undertones, creating balanced warm depth across face and body.', N'Balanced facial structure with defined cheekbones and jawline reflecting South Asian prominence and Northern European angularity. High cheekbones, defined jawline, straight nose with subtle bridge definition characteristic of South Asian-Northern European blend. Skin shows minor scarring around the eye sockets from augmentation integration — thin white lines barely visible in certain light. Clean-shaven. Few wrinkles despite age, suggesting either good genetics or minor dermal maintenance.', N'Chrome iris rings in both eyes — distinctive, deliberate, makes no attempt to hide them. The rings glow faintly in low light with thermal overlay activation. No visible limb augmentation; synthetic blood and nanite system is entirely subcutaneous.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — every motion calculated and efficient. Stands with weight slightly forward, ready to shift direction instantly. Eyes rarely still; constant thermal and visual scanning of his environment. No wasted gestures. Handshake firm but not aggressive. In conversation, he maintains eye contact unflinchingly, the chrome rings catching light.', N'Tier 2-3 functional aesthetic — tailored but utilitarian. Dark monochrome palette: charcoal tactical jacket with internal holsters and cargo placement, black reinforced pants with thigh pockets, grey compression base layer visible at collar and wrists. Unmarked boots (reinforced soles, good traction). Minimal branding; quality is visible but anonymous. Jacket shows subtle wear patterns consistent with field use. No jewelry except a worn titanium watch with military-style face.', N'Sinan Tanaka-Frimpong witnessed a massacre during a corporate dispute and has evidence stored in a dead drop. Publishing it would expose powerful people. Keeping it is leverage and liability.', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ankur_malhotra');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5cf-76e7-a742-96cf05d4c39f', N'Enas Tovar-Strömqvist', N'Enas', N'', N'Tovar-Strömqvist', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 14, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Engelheim, Axiom Preparatory Academy dormitory block, near Lincoln and Belmont', N'Axiom corporate scholarship student, junior mathematics prodigy', N'Axiom Preparatory Academy (scholarship student); family in Chatham Flats; The Glass Ladder', N'Enas Tovar-Strömqvist is tall for his age and gangly in the way of someone who grew fast and hasn''t caught up with himself yet. He has his Asabere grandfather''s deep copper-brown skin and his Ylinen grandmother''s pale grey-green eyes, a combination that draws stares in both the corporate school halls and on the Tier 1 streets where he grew up. He dresses in Axiom-issued uniforms with the obsessive precision of someone who cannot afford to give anyone a reason to question his belonging — collar always straight, shoes always clean. His only cosmetic mod is a pair of pattern-irises his mother saved two years for: slow-rotating geometric fractals in navy blue that he initially hated and now considers his single point of vanity.

He is brilliant and he knows it and he is deeply, quietly ashamed of both facts. He came from Chatham Flats on a full mathematics scholarship and has spent eighteen months learning to perform wealth — which fork, which laugh, which opinions are safe. He is kind to people he forgets are watching and cold to people he thinks are judging him. He misses his mother with a grief he treats like a structural flaw he needs to engineer around.', N'Information source for Axiom internal culture, quest giver for problems that need a brilliant young mind with access to corporate systems, emotional anchor story about class mobility and belonging', N'', N'Cosmetic patterned irises (navy fractal-rotation). Basic student neural-link for classroom AR integration (Axiom-issued, technically on loan).', N'Academy classes 0700-1600, mandatory enrichment programs 1600-1800, studies alone in his room until midnight; takes the transit back to Chatham Flats every second weekend to give his mother half his stipend.', N'Enas Tovar-Strömqvist, 183cm lean teenage boy, warm bronze-golden skin tone blending Sub-Saharan African warmth with Northern European coolness and Latin American richness, faint scattered freckles across nose and cheekbones, prominent East Asian cheekbones with soft South Asian facial geometry, slight epicanthal folds. Dark brown hair neatly parted left, short. Navy blue fractal mandala-pattern cosmetic irises rotating slowly in warm brown base, dark circles under eyes. Axiom Preparatory Academy charcoal blazer with navy trim, pristine white button-down shirt, knife-edge creased charcoal trousers, black polished leather shoes, thin clear AR wristband. Rigidly upright posture, economical careful movement, precise hand gestures, barely-visible temple scar from neural-link implant. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone academy corridor, cool fluorescent overhead lighting with warm accent light catching his golden skin undertones, clinical focused expression, bookish and controlled demeanor --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Engelheim', N'local', N'Engelheim', N'Sub-Saharan African (35.3%), Northern European (34.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (12.3%), East Asian (12.0%), and South Asian (6.2%) ancestry create a striking polychromatic phenotype. Warm mid-brown base skin with golden undertones from the African and Latin American heritage, subtly lightened and cooled by Northern European genetics, with East Asian facial structure contributing slight epicanthal folds and cheekbone prominence. South Asian heritage adds warmth to complexion and subtle softness to facial geometry.', 183, 62, N'Gangly and still-growing, lean without musculature, all elbows and wrists — the awkward frame of a fourteen-year-old who shot up too fast. There''s a fragility to him that reads as either privileged or hungry depending on who''s looking.', N'Dark brown with subtle warm undertones', N'Neatly combed, parted on the left side', N'Short', N'Warm brown base with cosmetic navy blue rotating geometric fractals (patterned irises), slow-scrolling mandala-like designs visible under direct light', N'Warm mid-brown with golden undertones, the blended result of strong Sub-Saharan African heritage softened by Northern European lightness and enriched by Latin American and South Asian warmth. A luminous complexion that reads differently in varied lighting — deeper in shadows, almost bronze in direct sunlight.', N'Clear, youthful skin with the precision-grooming habits of someone monitoring his own appearance obsessively. No visible acne or blemishes. Subtle freckles sparse across his nose bridge and cheekbones — a mixing of African and Northern European heritage genetics. Slight dark circles under his eyes from chronic sleep deficit. Pronounced epicanthal fold at the eye corners reflecting East Asian ancestry. Cheekbone structure shows South Asian softness alongside East Asian prominence.', N'Cosmetic patterned irises (navy blue fractal rotations) that rotate slowly, most visible in low light or when he''s tired and not thinking to control his expression. The neural-link hardware is subcutaneous; no visible ports or jacks. Occasionally wears a thin clear AR interface band on his right wrist during academy hours, standard Axiom student issue.', N'Upright, almost rigidly correct posture — trained into him by eighteen months of performing at Axiom. His walk is careful and economical, minimizing space. When he forgets he''s being watched, his shoulders curve inward slightly. His hands move with precision; he doesn''t gesture loosely. Makes minimal eye contact with authority figures but holds it steadily with peers he trusts.', N'Axiom Preparatory Academy uniform: charcoal blazer with navy trim and the school crest, white button-down shirt (always pressed, collar points perfectly aligned), charcoal trousers with a knife-edge crease, black leather shoes polished to a mirror shine. Outside academy hours, he wears a grey Axiom hoodie and dark jeans without a wrinkle. No visible branding or luxury items. Everything is clean, precise, and deliberately unremarkable — the clothing of someone trying to be invisible.', N'He has been quietly funneling small amounts of data — nothing classified, just efficiency reports and cafeteria waste metrics — to an anonymous contact in Chatham Flats who he suspects is connected to a labor advocacy group. He tells himself it''s harmless. He knows it isn''t.', N'Precise and formal at school — he adopted corporate diction deliberately and it has started to stick; reverts to Chatham Flats cadence with his mother and is slightly horrified by how much effort that now takes', N'Measured, slightly too formal for his age, pauses before answering as though running calculations', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'enas_tovar_str_mqvist');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('ddcd432e-4aeb-e7db-3b3b-96d4a7bf913b', N'Fakir Karunaratne-Appiah', N'Fakir', N'', N'Karunaratne-Appiah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A boring office in Glassway designed to be forgettable — beige walls, standard furniture, nothing that reveals personality, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Private Investigator', N'Helix Biosystems (mid-level private investigator)', N'Fakir Karunaratne-Appiah is the PI that fraud investigators dream of and fraudsters have nightmares about — a methodical, meticulous, mathematically minded investigator who specializes in the art of proving that the numbers don''t lie, even when people do.

His professional life is insurance fraud. He works on retainer for three of GLMZ''s largest insurance underwriters and two corporate risk assessment firms, investigating claims that statistical analysis has flagged as potentially fraudulent. His cases range from individual claimants faking cyberware injuries to elaborate multi-year fraud operations involving dozens of participants and millions of Quanta. He approaches every case with the same patient methodology: gather the numbers, analyze the patterns, find the anomaly, prove the fraud.

The mundanity of his work is his greatest asset. Nobody pays attention to the insurance investigator. He moves through corporate offices, medical facilities, repair shops, and financial institutions with the invisibility of someone who belongs everywhere and nowhere. His interviews are so bland that subjects relax and contradict themselves. His reports are so thorough that legal challenges are futile. He is not exciting, not dramatic, and not interested in being either. He is simply very, very good at mathematics, and in a city built on financial transactions, mathematics is power.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Fakir Karunaratne-Appiah, a lean 178cm neo-noir corporate analyst in 2226, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones blending South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian heritage. Sharp, well-defined cheekbones, refined straight nose, dark brown eyes with subtle Southeast Asian eye shape. Black hair with silver at temples, clean-shaven, neutral expression. Wearing crisp light blue dress shirt and dark navy blazer from Nexus Professional, simple digital watch. Seated at a holographic terminal in a Tier 3 corporate office, cool blue-gray lighting casting subtle shadows on his face. Posture perfect but tense, shoulders slightly forward. Minimal augmentation visible. Background shows floor-to-ceiling windows overlooking the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone skyline at dusk, neon-tinged clouds. Mood: focused, guarded, unremarkable. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, corporate noir lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A boring office in Glassway designed to be forgettable', N'local', N'A boring office in Glassway designed to be forgettable', N'South Asian (49%), Sub-Saharan African (35.5%), and Southeast Asian (15.5%) mixed ancestry. The dominant South Asian heritage provides warm undertones and refined facial structure; substantial Sub-Saharan African ancestry contributes rich skin depth, prominent cheekbone geometry, and facial bone structure; Southeast Asian heritage adds subtle eye shape characteristics and softer facial contours. The combination creates a complex warm medium-brown complexion with golden-amber undertones, well-defined cheekbones with strong definition, and balanced facial proportions that reflect this tri-continental blend.', 178, 72, N'Lean and angular, with the posture of someone who spends twelve hours a day hunched over terminals. Shoulders slightly forward, minimal musculature — functional rather than maintained.', N'Black with premature silver at temples', N'Short, neatly parted, maintained with professional precision', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Warm medium-brown with golden-amber undertones, reflecting the balanced blend of South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian ancestry', N'Clean-shaven, minimal facial hair. Skin shows slight pallor from indoor work with warm golden undertones beneath. Facial features reflect the ancestry blend: strong, well-defined cheekbones from African heritage providing structure and prominence, straight nose with refined bridge showing South Asian influence, and eye shape displaying Southeast Asian genetic characteristics with slightly wider-set placement. No visible scars or marks except the characteristic jawline scar. Expression resting at neutral — the face of someone who has learned not to show reactions.', N'None visible. All augmentations are subcutaneous or internal — likely a neural interface for data analysis and financial system access, but no external chrome or LED modifications.', N'Deliberate and economical. Moves with minimal wasted motion. Sits with perfect posture at a terminal but slouches slightly when walking, as if conserving energy for thought. Hands move with precision when gesturing — no flourish, no emphasis, just necessary communication.', N'Aggressively forgettable. Gray or navy slacks, white or light blue dress shirts, dark blazers from mid-tier retailers (Nexus Professional, Meridian). No logos, no chrome accents, no smart-fabric displays. Shoes are black leather, well-maintained but unremarkable. Watch is a simple digital with no AR functions — practical, not status-signaling. Dresses for Tier 3 corporate environments deliberately, never standing out.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fakir_karunaratne_appiah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6cc-78b2-aa43-96db36b3fa08', N'Bernhardt Boonsri-Im-Kabwit', N'Bernhardt', N'', N'Boonsri-Im-Kabwit', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Irkalla, sub-level 7 junction known locally as the Molar Cross, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Tunnel guide and mapper of Irkalla''s lower strata', N'Independent; loose ties to the Undertow''s Bore Rat community', N'Bernhardt Boonsri-Im-Kabwit is a lean woman whose body has adapted to confined spaces in ways that are faintly unsettling — she moves through narrow passages without seeming to rotate her shoulders, ducking under pipes with the automatic grace of someone who has never known a ceiling higher than two meters. Her skin is a deep warm brown mapped with self-applied phosphorescent tattoos that glow faint teal in darkness, a functional adaptation that doubles as artistry, marking her position for those who follow. Her hair is gone entirely, shaved to the scalp and re-grown as thin bioluminescent filaments she keeps braided tight. She wears a rig of salvaged equipment: repurposed Ferrogate Transit surveying tools, lengths of knotted rope that double as her personal mapping notation, and a coat stitched from old transit uniform panels.

She speaks in the economical cadence of someone who has learned that sound travels strangely underground and that echoes lie. She is not unfriendly but she is precise — she will tell you exactly what a route costs, exactly what the risks are, and exactly what she will do if you violate her rules in the tunnels. She has a superstitious relationship with the E.L.F.s she believes inhabit the deep drainage networks, leaving coiled wire and old transit tokens at specific junctions before guiding anyone through. She calls these spirits the Drip-Mouths and speaks of them with something between fear and professional respect.', N'Primary access point for anyone needing to reach deep-tunnel locations; reliable information source about tunnel conditions, new collapses, or unusual activity in the sub-levels; can become a quest giver if her routes are disrupted', N'', N'Bioluminescent hair filaments (cosmetic geneware); low-light ocular implants (salvaged, mismatched — left eye is original equipment, right eye gleams amber); a subdermal compass chip grafted into her left palm', N'Rises by the rhythm of the deep drainage cycles, eats reconstituted fungus paste and whatever surface food clients bring as part of her fee, spends hours updating her hand-drawn tunnel maps before taking on any new guiding work.', N'Bernhardt Boonsri-Im-Kabwit, 163cm lean sinewy tunnel-runner with medium warm golden-brown skin blending East Asian, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African features: defined cheekbones, broader nose, balanced face. Shaved scalp with teal-cyan bioluminescent braids pinned with ferrogate hardware, flowing with faint light. Left eye dark brown, right eye amber-chrome implant with luminous ring. Phosphorescent teal tunnel-junction tattoos across sternum, forearms, and neck. Weathered, precise movements. Wearing patchwork faded blue-gray Ferrogate coat, black thermal underlayer, stained canvas cargo pants, mismatched boots, rope harness. GLMZ, dark confined underground setting, bioluminescent glow lighting her face from below, teal accent lighting catching her hair filaments and tattoos, moody and focused expression, hands positioned as if navigating invisible obstacles. Gritty atmospheric sci-fi. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Irkalla', N'local', N'Irkalla', N'East Asian (46.1%), Southeast Asian (34.7%), and Sub-Saharan African (19.2%) ancestry creating a striking multifaceted phenotype. Facial structure reflects the blend — defined cheekbones with East Asian influence, broader nose with Sub-Saharan character, balanced proportions with Southeast Asian warmth', 163, 51, N'Lean and sinewy with compressed musculature adapted to confined spaces; narrow shoulders and a flexible spine that moves through tunnels without rotation; core strength concentrated in forearms and grip', N'Bioluminescent filaments — teal-cyan glow in darkness, natural dark root base where regrowth occurs', N'Shaved scalp with bioluminescent filaments braided tight into two or three functional cords, pinned at the nape with salvaged ferrogate hardware', N'None (filaments only, ~8cm when braided)', N'Left eye: dark brown, original; Right eye: amber-chrome implant with faint luminous ring at pupil margin', N'Medium warm brown with golden undertones from the complex blend of East Asian, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry; rich earth-clay complexion with subtle warmth throughout', N'Weathered but not aged; skin shows no sun damage but carries fine stress lines around the eyes and mouth from years of poor lighting and precision focus work. Defined cheekbones reflecting East Asian structure, broader nose with Sub-Saharan and Southeast Asian character, balanced facial proportions. Self-applied phosphorescent tattoos in teal glow across forearms, collarbones, and the back of her neck — functional positioning markers that double as personal cartography', N'Right eye gleams amber with faint luminous ring; bioluminescent hair filaments glow teal in low light; left palm shows the subtle outline of the subdermal compass chip beneath skin. No obvious chrome or plating.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — shoulders held slightly forward, spine flexible, head tilted as if constantly reading spatial cues. When walking, she places feet with precision and adjusts height constantly as if navigating invisible obstacles. In confined spaces, she becomes almost liquid, rotating hips and shoulders independently. Her hands are always active: checking rope, adjusting rig fastenings, fingers tracing imagined maps', N'Tier 4-5 salvage utilitarian. A patchwork coat stitched from old Ferrogate Transit uniform panels in faded blue and gray, with functional pockets and loop attachments for rope. Thermal base layer underneath in black, worn thin at the elbows and knees. Heavy canvas pants with cargo pockets, the fabric stained with mineral deposits and fungal growth. Rope coiled around her torso like a harness. Boots are mismatched — left is old transit-issue steel-toe, right is a salvaged climbing boot. No jewelry except the functional ferrogate hardware pinning her braids', N'Three years ago she guided a family of seven through a route she knew was unstable, reassuring them it was sound — they made it, but a section collapsed behind them killing a Bore Rat boy who''d been trailing them uninvited. She never reported it. She added a knot to her mapping rope for him.', N'Clipped, technical, tunnel-specific jargon mixed with Bore Rat slang; rarely uses metaphors that involve open sky or large spaces', N'Speaks in short declarative sentences; pauses are meaningful, not awkward', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bernhardt_boonsri_im_kabwit');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a615-789f-a928-96ed555ef8dd', N'Bakir An', N'Bakir', N'', N'An', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, operating from a legitimate licensed pharmacy called Goldthread Dispensary, near Ashland and Division', N'Pharmacist and black-market pharmaceutical broker, The the Gray Zone district', N'Self-employed (Goldthread Dispensary license); informal supply network with several underground medical providers; The Gauze', N'Bakir An is short, stocky, and perpetually cheerful in a way that takes people a moment to calibrate — not false exactly, but layered over something more complicated, like a coral reef over deep water. His skin is a warm medium brown, his hair grown out in a loose high puff with copper-dyed ends, and he has a set of patterned irises — interlocking geometric circles in charcoal and cream — that he keeps well-maintained and that give him the slightly uncanny look of someone whose eyes are always aesthetically composed. He wears a pharmacist''s white coat that he has clearly owned for years and refuses to replace despite its soft edges.

He is genuinely good at pharmacy. He remembers dosage interactions, flags contraindications before patients can finish asking their questions, and has a gift for making the most boring parts of medication management feel like he is doing you a personal favor. He is also, two nights a week, coordinating distribution of unlicensed gene-therapy compounds through a network that runs from the Gray Zone down to the Narrows and up to certain Tier 3 residential blocks where people want treatments Helix Biosystems has priced out of their reach. He finds this deeply morally straightforward and would be genuinely surprised if someone told him it was brave.', N'Supply source, information broker, black-market access point disguised as local color; can provide controlled substances for various story purposes; comic relief that is smarter than it appears', N'', N'Patterned cosmetic irises (geometric charcoal and cream); olfactory enhancement (mild, professional — helps him detect compound purity); no structural augmentation', N'Dispensary opens at eight, closes at nine. He eats lunch standing up behind the counter. Two evenings per week he runs ''after-hours inventory'' that is not inventory. He sleeps six hours and considers this sufficient.', N'Bakir An, a 167cm pharmacist in a worn white coat over dark civilian clothes, standing behind a counter in a GLMZ 2226 pharmacy. Deep warm brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African and East Asian heritage blended with subtle Middle Eastern warmth. Prominent cheekbones, balanced proportions, youthful face with slight crow''s feet. Natural deep black hair in a well-maintained high puff with copper-dyed ends and visible fade lines. Striking augmented eyes with interlocking charcoal and cream geometric patterns like mandala circuits. Clean-shaven, faint chemical burn scar on inner right wrist, small pestle and mortar tattoo on left collarbone. Economical, precise posture with weight evenly distributed. Warm eye contact and subtle expression caught between attentiveness and something withheld. GLMZ setting with neon pharmacy signage, warm overhead lighting casting soft shadows, professional yet weathered aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (44.7%) with substantial East Asian (37.5%) ancestry, combined with Middle Eastern (13.3%) and Northern European (4.5%) heritage—a genetic blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The result is a rich, warm complexion with balanced facial structure drawing from multiple continental traditions.', 167, 78, N'Stocky and compact, broad shoulders tapering to a solid midsection; the build of someone who stands for twelve hours and doesn''t compensate with gym time', N'Natural deep black with intentional copper dye at the ends', N'Loose high puff, well-maintained, with visible fade lines at the sides', N'Medium (approximately 10-12cm at crown)', N'Augmented: interlocking geometric patterns in charcoal and cream, custom cosmetic irises that resemble mandala or circuit board motifs', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones—a harmonious blend of Sub-Saharan African and East Asian ancestry, with subtle warmer mid-tones from Middle Eastern heritage; even and clear', N'Clean-shaven, youthful face with slight crow''s feet from squinting at small print; prominent cheekbones with balanced facial proportions reflecting African and East Asian heritage; subtly defined jawline with gentle Middle Eastern contours; skin shows minimal scarring or damage; perpetual micro-expression caught between attentiveness and something withheld', N'Patterned cosmetic irises are the only visible augmentation — striking enough that strangers often comment on them. No chrome, no subdermal plating. Olfactory enhancement is entirely internal and undetectable.', N'Stands with weight evenly distributed, hands often resting on the pharmacy counter or clasped loosely. Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Cheerfulness expressed through eye contact and vocal warmth rather than physical animation; appears both present and slightly at a remove.', N'White pharmacist''s coat, visibly aged and soft at the edges despite regular washing, worn over practical civilian clothes (typically dark t-shirt, gray or black slacks). No corporate branding. Shoes are worn but well-maintained. The coat is almost a uniform at this point—owned for years, reads as either stubborn or sentimental. No jewelry. Tier 3-4 working professional, understated.', N'One of his regular legal customers is a Ferrogate Transit safety officer who takes a compound Fenwick supplies that controls a neurological tremor — a tremor that, if disclosed, would disqualify her from her position. He has never mentioned this to anyone. She has never asked him not to. The unspoken arrangement terrifies him more than the network does.', N'Warm, rapid, technically fluent; slides between clinical precision and neighborhood vernacular without noticing', N'Fast and easy; comfortable overlapping conversation; laughs quickly and genuinely', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bakir_an');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5eb-7872-85ac-97083490bccd', N'Anozie Hong-Fredriksen', N'Anozie', N'', N'Hong-Fredriksen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Conservatory, Meridian Core, near State and Monroe', N'Climate scientist and atmospheric historian, tracking long-term environmental transformation of the Great Lakes basin', N'The Conservatory — Department of Atmospheric and Aquatic Systems', N'Anozie Hong-Fredriksen is a heavyset man of late middle age who looks as though he was carved from something patient and enduring. His skin is very dark and deeply weathered from decades of fieldwork on decommissioned weather platforms and lake monitoring buoys — he has the look of a man who has spent a great deal of time outside in bad conditions. His hair is fully white and worn long, pulled back loosely, and he has a full beard he keeps trimmed to a point. He has no geneware modifications and minimal augmentation, which he is somewhat self-conscious about — ''I grew up before it was expected,'' he says, with just enough humor to deflect the admission that he also slightly distrusts it. His clothes are always slightly out of fashion, always completely functional, often waterproof for no apparent reason.

Anozie Hong-Fredriksen has been at The Conservatory for twenty-two years and has outlasted four department heads, three rounds of corponation funding restructuring, and one very public battle with Arcturus over the suppression of lake toxicity data. He won that battle technically, in that his paper was eventually published, though the version that ran had twelve figures redacted. He keeps the uncensored original framed on his office wall facing inward. He is beloved by students who find his lectures dense but transformative, and is one of the few people in GLMZ who can speak with genuine authority about what the lake looked like before, during, and after the Lakeshore Crisis — which makes him either important or dangerous depending on who is asking.', N'Living institutional memory for the Lakeshore Crisis and Great Lakes environmental history; possesses data that certain parties want buried; credible authority whose credibility makes him a target; can provide historical and scientific context for current environmental events', N'', N'Basic retinal climate data overlay (utilitarian, decade-old model), subdermal temperature and atmospheric sensor array (research equipment technically installed in his body for convenience)', N'Early morning data review from overnight lake monitoring systems; teaches one graduate seminar; afternoons split between writing and an ongoing argument with the Conservatory''s funding administration; monthly field trips to lake monitoring stations that he considers spiritually necessary', N'Anozie Hong-Fredriksen, a weathered senior scientist in his late sixties, 183cm tall with a heavyset broad-shouldered build. Deep warm medium-to-deep brown skin with golden undertones and heavy sun damage, bearing the mixed heritage of East Asian, Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Northern European ancestry. Pure white hair in a loose low ponytail with escaping strands frames his deeply lined face. Full white beard trimmed to a point, dark brown eyes with subtle amber retinal augmentation visible in the light. Moderate cheekbones and angular features softened by admixture. Wearing functional Tier 3-4 Conservatory fieldwork gear: weathered waterproof tactical jacket, reinforced boots, layers in grays and earth tones showing signs of actual use and stains. Decades-old subdermal sensor array scar visible along left collarbone. Callused weathered hands. Posture slightly forward-leaning from years at monitoring equipment, movements deliberate and economical. Faded fabric wristband on wrist. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, standing in a water platform laboratory or research facility, moody cool lighting with shadows emphasizing the weathered face, conveying wisdom earned through decades of fieldwork --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Conservatory', N'local', N'The Conservatory', N'East Asian (37.1%), Northern European (26.5%), Southeast Asian (19.7%), Sub-Saharan African (15.4%), Hispanic/Latin American (1.3%) — a complex diaspora blend resulting in warm medium-to-deep brown tones with subtle golden and olive undertones from the confluence of East and Southeast Asian, African, and Northern European ancestry', 183, 98, N'Heavyset and broad-shouldered, carrying weight with solidity rather than softness; the build of someone whose strength is functional and weathered rather than maintained. Thick through the torso, with the slightly thickened midsection of a man in his late sixties who doesn''t prioritize vanity.', N'Pure white', N'Long, pulled back loosely into a low ponytail or braid, with some strands habitually escaping', N'Long (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Dark brown with faint amber-tinted retinal augmentation visible as a thin metallic sheen in bright light', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden and subtle olive undertones reflecting the blended East Asian, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, heavily weathered and lined from decades of outdoor fieldwork and water platform exposure', N'Deeply lined face showing sun exposure and age with dignity; full white beard trimmed to a deliberate point; hands heavily weathered with calluses and stains from field equipment. Facial structure shows moderate cheekbones and angular features characteristic of East Asian heritage, broadened and softened by Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African admixture with balanced proportions from Northern European ancestry. Skin has a perpetually dry quality from years on water platforms. Minimal grooming vanity — functional and clean rather than refined.', N'Retinal overlay creates a faint amber-gold luminescence in both eyes under direct light — noticeable but not jarring, suggesting decades-old technology rather than cutting edge. The augmentation is visible mainly when he''s concentrating or reviewing data (eyes focus slightly differently). Subdermal sensor array is not visible but subtle thermal variations along his left side sometimes create faint distortions in very hot environments.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical motions — no wasted energy. Slightly forward-leaning posture from years of hunching over monitoring equipment and lab benches. Gestures are precise and purposeful when explaining concepts, with hands that move expressively when teaching but otherwise remain still. Walks with the confident, patient gait of someone who has spent decades navigating unstable platforms and rough terrain.', N'Tier 3-4 Conservatory-affiliated. Functional, slightly dated technical wear: waterproof tactical jackets (often worn even indoors, out of habit), weathered field trousers with multiple pockets, reinforced boots suited for water work. Layers in neutral grays, dark blues, and earth tones. Occasionally wears a Conservatory ID badge on a frayed lanyard. Clothing shows signs of actual use rather than fashion — stains from field work, fabric thinned from repeated wear. His one concession to formality is a well-maintained, decades-old wool sweater he wears to faculty meetings. No jewelry except a faded fabric wristband with faint markings (possibly commemorative, possibly functional).', N'', N'Precise scientific language that becomes unexpectedly lyrical when he talks about the lake or historical weather events; can be devastating in a single flat sentence when angry', N'Deliberate and measured, with the occasional long silence that students learn not to fill; lectures in complete paragraphs', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anozie_hong_fredriksen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c7-770d-aa43-9730c680b876', N'Ekkehart Ekwensi-Okada-Madrigal', N'Ekkehart', N'', N'Ekwensi-Okada-Madrigal', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Corridor, performs near the Calumet Rise transit junction; sleeps in a shared squat in Brightmoor Reclamation, near Kedzie and Division', N'Street performer, acrobat, and puppet maker', N'Independent; Brightmoor Reclamation squat community; informal street performer''s mutual aid network', N'Ekkehart Ekwensi-Okada-Madrigal is nineteen and looks younger, with a wiry, elastic build and warm brown skin with Polynesian-Romanian features that settle somewhere between striking and unconventional. She has a geneware tail — long, articulated, covered in fine iridescent fur that she grew in when she was fifteen and has since integrated so completely into her movement vocabulary that watching her without it now seems like watching a sentence with a word missing. Her hair is kept short and practical. She has a scar across her chin from a fall and a look of slightly aggressive cheerfulness that is partly performance and partly genuine.

She performs on the Grand Corridor''s lower transit levels with an act that blends acrobatics, puppetry, and a kind of ritualistic street theater she has developed without formal training — her puppets are elaborate constructions of salvaged wire, synthetic fabric, and small projector nodes that make them partially holographic, giving them a ghostly translucence. She has been approached twice by Ringo entertainment scouts and twice refused, for reasons she articulates differently each time but that fundamentally come down to fear that being owned is less frightening than being seen clearly and found ordinary. She makes just enough to eat on good weeks and depends on the Brightmoor squat community the rest of the time.', N'Ground-level observer — she has been performing in the Grand Corridor for two years and sees everything that moves through it; young enough that people underestimate what she retains; her squat is a community touchpoint for Tier 1 social networks; her puppets occasionally serve as unwitting message carriers when E.L.F.s interact with their projector nodes', N'', N'Geneware tail (iridescent-furred, fully articulated, expressively integrated into performance); geneware enhanced-flexibility joint modification (elbows and shoulders, for acrobatics)', N'Wakes whenever the squat lets her, spends mornings building or repairing puppets, heads to Grand Corridor by early afternoon to scout the best pitch, performs through evening rush hour when foot traffic is heaviest, counts her take in a specific doorway she considers lucky.', N'Ekkehart Ekwensi-Okada-Madrigal, 158cm wiry street performer with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, high East Asian cheekbones softened by Sub-Saharan African and Latin American heritage, warm brown eyes with gold flecks, short dark brown hair with wire ornaments. Pale scar across chin. Iridescent geneware tail in deep teal, purple, and silver extending from lower spine, muscular and expressive. Subtle geneware joint enhancements at elbows and shoulders. Wearing layered street performer clothes: fitted black synthetic crop top, oversized heavily patched jacket in grey and deep blue, cargo pants with taped cuffs, worn synthetic shoes. Handmade wire jewelry. Restless dynamic posture, tail gesturing. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, street performance lighting with neon reflections, humid street-level atmosphere, confident aggressive cheerfulness, performer''s grace and constant motion. Cinematic urban neo-noir urban aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Corridor', N'local', N'Grand Corridor', N'Predominantly East Asian (61.2%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (26.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (9.0%), and North African (3.6%) ancestry. Her genetic mix creates a striking harmonious blend: East Asian bone structure—high cheekbones and defined facial geometry—softened and enriched by Sub-Saharan African heritage in facial width and prominence, with Latin American and North African elements adding warmth and subtle contour to her jawline. The overall effect is neither feature set dominating, but rather creating a uniquely geometric and expressive face.', 158, 48, N'Wiry and elastic, almost dancer-like—muscle definition visible in forearms and shoulders from acrobatics, but without bulk. Her frame seems designed for movement rather than strength.', N'Natural dark brown with warm undertones', N'Cut very short, practical, often slightly disheveled from performance sweat; sometimes adorned with small wire ornaments she''s fashioned herself', N'Short', N'Warm brown, naturally dark with flecks of gold in direct light', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones—the luminous result of predominantly East Asian genetics enriched by Sub-Saharan African and Latin American heritage. Rich and warm in natural light, sun-darkened on shoulders and neck from outdoor performances.', N'Clear skin with a slight sheen from street-level humidity and constant movement. A thin, precise scar runs across her chin from left to right—pale and well-healed but visible, giving her face a subtle asymmetry. Facial features reflect her genetic predominance: slightly higher cheekbones characteristic of East Asian ancestry, softened by the width and prominence of Sub-Saharan African heritage, defined jawline with subtle Latin American and North African contours, and expressive eyes with gentle epicanthal folds.', N'A long, fully articulated geneware tail extends from her lower spine, covered in iridescent fur that shifts between deep teal, purple, and silver depending on light and angle. The tail is clearly organic but distinctly non-human—muscular and expressive, capable of independent movement and used as integral part of her performance vocabulary. Her elbows and shoulders show subtle signs of geneware joint enhancement—slightly greater range of motion than baseline human, visible when she moves in acrobatic sequences.', N'She carries herself with a performer''s awareness of space and observation. Her default posture is loose and ready, never fully at rest—fingers moving, weight shifting, as if constantly calculating trajectories. When performing, she becomes fluid and hypnotic; off-stage, there''s a restless energy to her, a slight aggressive cheerfulness in her bearing that reads as both genuine and performative. Her tail is almost never still—it gestures, balances, expresses mood independently.', N'Tier 4 street performer aesthetic. Typically wears layered, functional clothing: fitted synthetic tank or crop top in dark colors (black, charcoal) that allow her augmented shoulders and tail full range of motion. Over this, an oversized, heavily patched jacket or vest in mismatched fabric—salvaged materials in greys, deep blues, rust tones. Cargo pants or modified leggings with numerous pockets for puppet pieces and performance supplies, cuffs sometimes taped or pinned. Worn synthetic shoes with good grip. Jewelry is handmade—wire rings, small metal ornaments she''s crafted, occasionally small projector nodes salvaged from failed puppets worn as accessories. Her clothes are clean but visibly worn, repaired many times, dyed and re-dyed. They smell faintly of wire dust and synthetic fabric.', N'One of her puppets — a particularly intricate figure she calls Auntie Volta — has been showing behaviors she did not program. It responds to passersby who don''t look at it. It once moved its head toward a child who was crying silently across the corridor. She believes an E.L.F. has taken up residence in it and she is terrified that if she tells anyone, it will leave.', N'Colloquial, fast, and very physical — she describes everything spatially and often acts out what she means with her hands and tail', N'Quick and bright with sudden drops into seriousness, then back up; her serious moments land harder because of the contrast', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ekkehart_ekwensi_okada_madrigal');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a640-7aae-bc23-9776b6da2d5e', N'Alaa Kjellberg', N'Alaa', N'', N'Kjellberg', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenwood Gate, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Forensic Technician, Tessera Compliance Bureau', N'Tessera Compliance Bureau — Forensic Analysis Division', N'Alaa Kjellberg is slender the way old buildings are slender — not fragile, just built for a different era. He is fifty-two centimeters taller than average and moves with the habitual stoop of someone who has spent decades apologizing for their height in low-ceilinged evidence labs. His skin is a warm amber-brown, his hair white at the temples and worn in short locks threaded with copper wire — a fashion choice from his thirties he''s never bothered to update. His eyes have patterned irises: geometric gold tessellation that he received as a fortieth-birthday gift to himself and that he occasionally forgets aren''t natural when he looks in mirrors.

He is meticulous in the way that conceals other things. The evidence lab at Kenwood Gate is his kingdom, organized by a system only he fully understands, maintained with a devotion that borders on spiritual. He speaks slowly, precisely, and with a lecturer''s tendency to answer simple questions with complete historical context. He is not unfriendly — he will offer you tea from his personal supply and remember your name the next time you visit — but his real warmth is reserved for data: for the story that physical evidence tells, for the satisfaction of a chain of custody without gaps. He has been quietly falsifying minor procedural timestamps for a Tessera internal affairs officer for eighteen months and has not let himself think clearly about why.', N'Information broker without knowing it — he has catalogued evidence from dozens of Tessera compliance cases and his memory is encyclopedic; also a moral fault line: someone doing bad things for reasons he''s rationalized into goodness; can provide forensic analysis, chain of custody records, or access to suppressed evidence.', N'', N'Patterned irises (geometric gold tessellation, cosmetic); haptic feedback gloves integrated into fingertips for microscale evidence handling (work-issued); mild neural indexing implant for evidence cataloguing recall (Tessera-standard issue for forensic tier)', N'Arrives at Kenwood Gate evidence processing center an hour before his shift to perform his personal quality checks; spends most of the day in the lab or testifying in compliance hearings; stops at a small Sahel-fusion food stall on the walk home and has been ordering the same dish for eleven years.', N'Alaa Kjellberg, 202cm tall lean forensic analyst, mixed East Asian, Northern European, South Asian, and Hispanic heritage with warm medium tan skin and high East Asian cheekbones softened by Northern European luminosity. Short dark brown locs threaded with copper wire, salt-and-pepper white at temples. Augmented eyes with geometric gold tessellation pattern overlaid on warm brown irises. Fine lines around eyes from decades of microscopic lab work. Standing in slight forward stoop from height habit, wearing dark charcoal slacks and subdued olive technical shirt beneath knee-length Tessera-badged lab coat. Black haptic feedback gloves with silvered contact points. Worn leather shoes. Copper bracelet matching hair threading. Expression of slight skepticism, economical posture, meticulous grooming. GLMZ forensics lab setting, cool LED accent lighting catching gold eye patterns and copper accents, institutional aesthetic, precise and deliberate presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenwood Gate', N'local', N'Kenwood Gate', N'Predominantly East Asian (41.4%) with significant Northern European (27.8%), South Asian (15.4%), and Hispanic/Latin American (15.4%) ancestry. Features reflect this diverse global blend: East Asian bone structure dominates facial proportions with characteristic high cheekbones and tapered jawline, complemented by Northern European fair undertones creating luminous skin, South Asian warmth deepening complexion richness, and Hispanic/Latin American breadth softening the lower face and adding subtle fullness to features.', 202, 78, N'Slender and linear, built like aging infrastructure—no wasted mass, shoulders narrow and slightly rounded forward from decades in evidence labs. Lean musculature suggests minimal physical exertion beyond careful, precise hand work.', N'Salt-and-pepper white at temples, dark brown base', N'Short locs, individually threaded with thin copper wire throughout', N'Short', N'Augmented with geometric gold tessellation pattern overlaid on warm brown irises', N'Medium warm tan with balanced luminosity—East Asian and Northern European baseline creates even complexion, enriched by South Asian golden undertones and subtle Hispanic/Latin American depth that adds warmth without heaviness. Even complexion across face and visible limbs.', N'Meticulously groomed, no visible scarring or blemishing. Fine lines around eyes and mouth from decades of microscopic focus work and courtroom testimony. Clean-shaven or maintained with precise stubble. Expression rests in slight skepticism. Facial structure reflects East Asian prominence (high cheekbones, slightly tapered jawline) softened by Northern European feature breadth, enriched by South Asian skin warmth, and grounded by Hispanic/Latin American fullness in lower face and jawline contours.', N'Patterned irises are the most immediately noticeable. Haptic feedback gloves appear as standard-issue black synthetic leather with faint silvered contact points at fingertips and palm. Neural indexing implant is subcutaneous—no visible telltale except occasional brief eye-flutter when accessing catalogued data.', N'Habitual forward stoop from apologizing for height in low spaces. Movements are economical and deliberate—no wasted gesture. Hands move with practiced precision when handling objects. Speech is accompanied by minimal animation; he uses silence as emphasis. Walks with the measured pace of someone who has nowhere urgent to be and expects to arrive exactly on schedule.', N'Tessera compliance-tier professional: dark charcoal or navy functional slacks with reinforced pockets for evidence handling. Layered with a subdued olive or grey technical shirt beneath a knee-length lab coat (Tier 3 quality—durable synthetic, faint Tessera compliance badge embroidered at chest). Worn leather shoes, meticulously maintained. No visible jewelry except a thin copper bracelet matching his hair threading. Grooming suggests someone who respects the institutional aesthetic more than personal expression, but whose restraint is itself a choice.', N'The internal affairs officer he''s been helping is building a case — but not against Tessera wrongdoing. She''s constructing false evidence to convict a labor organizer in the Ironvein district. Kasimir has suspected this for two months and has done nothing because he cannot afford to be wrong about her.', N'Formal, precise, technical when discussing work; surprisingly literary when comfortable — quotes older legal texts and occasionally pre-Meridian court transcripts', N'Deliberate and unhurried, with long subordinate clauses; builds to conclusions methodically', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alaa_kjellberg');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65d-794e-8189-977791ade32a', N'Helmer Bergqvist-Phommasack-Lahlou', N'Helmer', N'', N'Bergqvist-Phommasack-Lahlou', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 54, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Meridian Core, near State and Madison', N'Internal Affairs Investigator, Axiom Security Division', N'Axiom Security Division — Internal Affairs and Compliance Investigation', N'Helmer Bergqvist-Phommasack-Lahlou has spent thirty years inside corporate security and carries every one of them. She is silver-haired and sharp-boned, with the kind of angular face that photographs well and intimidates in person. Her skin is brown-olive, sun-dark from an outdoor assignment in her thirties that she doesn''t discuss. Her only augmentation is an olfactory enhancement implant — a professional tool she had installed at fifty when she decided she was done letting people lie to her face without confirmation. She dresses in Axiom''s internal affairs charcoal and moves through the company''s glass corridors with a particular gravity, as if her mass has been increased by everything she knows.

She is not cruel. This surprises people. They expect internal affairs to be punitive and she is not — she is surgical. She distinguishes between malice and incompetence, between corruption and desperation, and she applies different responses accordingly. What she will not tolerate is the lie, and she is very good at finding it. She prays to no E.L.F. and observes no rituals — she regards them as a structural bias in investigative thinking, a way of surrendering agency to the unprovable. She is wrong about this, and somewhere in herself she suspects it, which is why she''s so pointed about it. She has outlasted four Axiom Security Directors, and the current one is afraid of her, which she considers a reasonable and appropriate state of affairs.', N'A power in the room — someone who investigates those who should not be investigated, who has enough institutional knowledge to be genuinely dangerous, and whose allegiances are to something more complex than Axiom''s interests; can be antagonist, unexpected ally, or source of pressure that forces other characters to act.', N'', N'Olfactory enhancement implant (professional tool — detects elevated cortisol, synthetic adrenaline compounds, deception-associated chemical markers); no cosmetic mods', N'She maintains an office in Meridian Core''s Axiom tower complex but spends most of her time in the field — visiting satellite facilities, interviewing personnel, reviewing surveillance logs; eats lunch alone almost always, at a quiet counter-service Maghreb restaurant twelve floors below her office; reads physical books in the evenings.', N'Helmer Bergqvist-Phommasack-Lahlou, 174cm tall woman with lean angular build, silver-white hair in tight bun, warm medium-tan skin with golden undertones reflecting North African and Southeast Asian heritage, sharp Scandinavian cheekbones, dark brown penetrating eyes, fine lines around eyes and mouth. Faint grid-pattern scar at right temple from implant. Wearing tailored charcoal blazer, white undershirt, dark trousers, flat black leather shoes, thin analog silver watch, worn leather document folder. Standing in sterile corporate interrogation room or Axiom Internal Affairs office with cool fluorescent lighting, posture rigid and controlled, hands at rest, expression stern and direct. GLMZ, dystopian corporate aesthetic, Tier 2 professional authority, no visible augmentations, scent of metal and recycled air, atmospheric depth with geometric shadows --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Core', N'local', N'Meridian Core', N'Northern European (51.6%), Southeast Asian (25.8%), North African (16.3%), and Sub-Saharan African (6.3%) — a striking blend that manifests as warm medium-tan tones with Scandinavian bone structure refined by Southeast Asian cheekbone prominence and North African facial geometry, with Sub-Saharan African warmth deepening her skin undertones. The combination creates sharp, angular geometry softened by golden-warm undertones that shift with light.', 174, 68, N'Lean and angular, with the controlled posture of someone who has spent three decades in offices and interrogation rooms. No softness; muscle definition visible in forearms and neck. Carries herself as if her skeleton is the most honest thing about her.', N'Silver-white, natural with no artificial shimmer or dye', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical bun at the nape of her neck. No loose strands. Never loose strands.', N'Long', N'Dark brown, clear and direct', N'Warm medium tan with golden undertones and subtle deeper saturation from Sub-Saharan and North African heritage, darker at the shoulders and upper chest from sun exposure during field years. The pigmentation shows the blended genetics with luminous quality in certain light, with subtle variation in depth that catches differently depending on angle—golden-warm rather than cool.', N'Angular face with high, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Northern European and Southeast Asian heritage, softened by warmer pigmentation from North African and Sub-Saharan ancestry. Jaw defined and squared. Nose straight with subtle bridge width, shaped by her mixed ancestry. Minimal makeup — a matte lipstick in warm neutral brown, nothing else. Fine lines around her eyes and mouth that deepen when she listens. Her skin shows the texture of someone who has not prioritized cosmetic treatments; small surgical scars are faintly visible at her temples (implant access ports, old and well-healed).', N'None visible. The olfactory enhancement implant is subcutaneous and leaves only the faint temple scarring. She wears no chrome, no LED modifications, no decorative augmentation. Her only concession to her implant is a slight pause sometimes — a moment where she appears to be scenting the air, almost imperceptible unless you''re watching for it.', N'She moves with deliberate, economical grace. Her weight shifts before she steps. She sits very still, feet flat on the floor or crossed at the ankle — never slouched. When she listens, her entire body becomes still, as if she is using all available sensory input. Her hands rest on the table or in her lap, never fidgeting. She does not smile easily, but when she does, the entire structure of her face changes; the sharpness softens into something almost gentle. She has learned to use this.', N'Axiom Internal Affairs standard: tailored charcoal blazer (always brushed and pressed), white or pale gray under-shirt with no visible corporate branding, dark trousers with a crisp crease, flat black leather shoes (practical, not fashionable, but expensive in their austerity). A thin silver watch on her left wrist — no smart functions, analog only. A small silver pendant on a thin chain, visible only sometimes: a small religious icon she does not discuss. A leather document folder she carries everywhere, worn and well-used. Tier 2 quality throughout — not ostentatious, but the kind of clothing that signals ''I have authority and comfort in this building.''', N'For six years she has been building a case against Axiom''s Director of Infrastructure Security — not for corruption exactly, but for the systematic suppression of safety reports in the Brewer''s Spine energy grid, reports whose findings, had they been acted on, would have prevented a structural fire that killed thirty-one workers in 2196. The director is three tiers above her in the organization. She has everything except one witness who won''t speak. She has been protecting that witness from the inside for two years, at significant personal risk, without their knowledge.', N'Precise, measured, economical — no words wasted; technical when discussing process; surprisingly plain-spoken about ethics', N'Unhurried. She does not rush because she has learned that silence is a tool and she intends to use every tool available.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'helmer_bergqvist_phommasack_lahlou');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6cd-7162-9bc1-979ec563c030', N'Corentin Delgado-Nygaard', N'Corentin', N'', N'Delgado-Nygaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 65, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower district tenements near the old lakeshore, near Kedzie and Division', N'Information trader and intelligence analyst — broker', N'Independent — Narrows-based operations', N'Corentin Delgado-Nygaard is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 65, she has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate her once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Before the runner life, she worked corporate — low-tier security, the kind that teaches you exactly how the system''s defenses fail. She works as a broker out of the Gray Zone, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Corentin Delgado-Nygaard has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and she cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Sinan Haugen-Coulibaly represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release. Retractable monofilament whip in left forearm — concealed weapon, devastating in close quarters', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Corentin Delgado-Nygaard, 168cm lean frame, medium warm brown skin with golden undertones, high prominent cheekbones with fuller lips reflecting multiethnic heritage, deep amber-brown eyes, steel gray hair braided tight at waist-length, aged lined face with surgical scar on left temple and keloid burns on hands. Charcoal gray synth-weave cargo jacket, black therm-reactive underlayer, tactical cargo pants, scuffed boots. Chrome bioware augmentation visible on left shoulder catching light, monofilament whip seams on left forearm. Economical precise posture, hands visible and still, tracking awareness. Worn leather satchel. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial basement lighting, cool blue and amber neon accents, focused tactical aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora phenotype: Primary Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (57.7%) with significant Northern European (20.5%), Sub-Saharan African (17.8%), and Indigenous American (4.0%) genetic contribution. The combination creates a warm-toned complexion with strong bone structure—angular cheekbones and prominent facial architecture reflecting the blend of Latin American and indigenous heritage, enriched by Sub-Saharan African features in facial proportions and lip fullness, tempered by Northern European influences in eye shape and lighter undertones.', 168, 58, N'Lean and angular with visible muscle definition from decades of discipline and combat training. No excess body fat; frame suggests economical, efficient movement rather than bulk.', N'Steel gray with faint ash undertones', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid; severe and practical', N'Long (waist-length when unbraided)', N'Amber-brown, natural', N'Medium warm brown with golden undertones deepening toward olivaceous at the jawline—the direct result of Hispanic/Latin American base ancestry blended with Northern European and Sub-Saharan African genetics. Skin tone shows natural variation consistent with her mixed heritage, warmer across cheekbones and forearms.', N'Lined face with high, prominent cheekbones and fuller lips reflecting Sub-Saharan African heritage; skin texture shows age but remains taut. Fine lines around eyes reflect decades of surveillance and focus work. Expression habitually controlled—eyes rarely widen, mouth set in a neutral line that can shift to something dangerous very quickly. Minimal makeup.', N'Bioware adrenaline regulator housed in her left shoulder—visible as a faint geometric chrome plate beneath the skin, edges slightly raised and catching light when she moves. The left forearm shows subtle seam-work where the monofilament whip is concealed, detectable only under close inspection or when the weapon deploys. No effort to hide either augmentation; they''re statements of capability.', N'Moves with economical precision—no wasted motion. Shoulders slightly forward in a ready stance even when seated. Weight distributed to the balls of her feet. When she walks, each step lands with deliberate placement. Hands are visible and still most of the time; rarely crosses arms. Eyes track movement constantly.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian aesthetic—durable synth-weave cargo jacket in charcoal gray, reinforced at stress points. Fitted black therm-reactive underlayer beneath. Tactical cargo pants with multiple pockets, all functional. Scuffed polymer-soled boots, broken in but maintained. No jewelry. Worn leather shoulder satchel containing data-drives and encrypted comm equipment. Everything is practical; nothing is decorative. Clothing shows signs of recent equipment maintenance and minor repair work.', N'', N'Fast, profane, and vivid. Speaks in images — everything is a metaphor for violence or weather.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'corentin_delgado_nygaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a703-76b7-bbe7-97cb10894ce7', N'Diogo Agyemang', N'Diogo', N'', N'Agyemang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 62, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Archer''s Line — Wambua Prosthetics, a narrow shopfront wedged between a noodle stall and a wire-pull depot, near Damen and Armitage', N'Prosthetics fitter and rehabilitation specialist serving the working poor of Archer''s Line and the surrounding industrial districts', N'Independent — Wambua Prosthetics; registered with the Archer''s Line Community Trade Registry', N'Diogo Agyemang is a tall, heavyset man whose age has settled into him rather than diminished him — broad-shouldered, slightly stooped, with enormous hands that have been reshaping and fitting prosthetic limbs for nearly four decades. His skin is dark and weathered at the knuckles, and he has a close-cropped white beard he trims every three days by feel. His own left arm below the elbow is a prosthetic — a mid-range Ferrogate industrial model he modified himself until it became something unique, its housing scratched with small geometric patterns his daughter etched into it when she was seven. He wears reading glasses on a beaded cord even though his vision correction implant is perfectly functional; he says the glasses help him think.

Diogo Agyemang has fitted thousands of limbs over his career — dock workers who lost arms to machinery, children born without full limb formation, veterans of corporate security contracts who came home partial. He knows the psychological landscape of limb loss and re-embodiment with a clinical intimacy that no textbook provides. He''s warm but unsentimental, the kind of person who will hand you a tissue and then immediately ask you a practical question to get you moving forward. He prays at a small home altar to an E.L.F. called Joinwork, who he says inhabits the articulation servo in his left wrist and has guided his hands for twenty years.', N'Local color and community anchor. Can provide prosthetics, rehabilitation advice, and history about the industrial districts. A repository of stories about the people who live and work in Archer''s Line. Potential quest giver when one of his clients or family is in trouble.', N'', N'Left forearm prosthetic (self-modified Ferrogate industrial base). Vision correction implant. Mild bone-density reinforcement in both shoulders from an industrial injury at age 28.', N'Opens the shop at 0800, sees fittings and adjustments until early evening. Takes a long lunch break during which he eats with his daughter''s family three days a week. Does his own fabrication and modification work after hours.', N'Diogo Agyemang, 62-year-old neo-noir prosthetics craftsman, standing in his workshop bathed in warm amber work light. Deep rich brown skin with golden undertones, high prominent cheekbones blending West African and East Asian features with South Asian nose bridge, weathered from six decades of sun and labor. Close-cropped white hair and precisely trimmed white beard. Wearing dark charcoal thermal shirt with sleeves rolled up, showing scarred right shoulder and worn calloused hands. Left forearm is a heavily customized bronze-toned Ferrogate prosthetic with child-etched geometric patterns and visible servo joints. Subtle faded silvery burn scar across right shoulder. Reading glasses on beaded cord despite implant correction. Holding a prosthetic component with meticulous precision, slight forward lean to posture. Industrial workshop setting with cool blue-gray background, warm work-light creating depth and shadow on his lined face. 2200s neo-noir urban aesthetic, worn but dignified, showing age with strength --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Archer''s Line', N'local', N'Archer''s Line', N'Complex multiethnic blend: 43.3% Sub-Saharan African, 30.4% East Asian, 17.8% South Asian, 8.5% Hispanic/Latin American. Results in rich deep-to-warm brown skin tone with subtle golden and reddish undertones reflecting the admixture; facial structure shows balanced influence from all ancestry groups—West African bone structure with strength and prominence, East Asian eye shape and high cheekbones, South Asian facial proportions and nose bridge characteristics, creating a distinctly cosmopolitan appearance shaped by the Ubiquitous Diaspora', 188, 98, N'Broad-shouldered and heavyset with a slight forward stoop developed over decades of bench work; substantial upper body strength concentrated in chest and shoulders, softened by age but still imposing', N'White', N'Close-cropped, evenly trimmed', N'Short', N'Dark brown with subtle neural shimmer from vision correction implant', N'Rich deep-to-warm brown with golden and reddish undertones; burnished deeper tone at knuckles and joints from decades of mechanical work and sun exposure, creating subtle variation across the arms and face with weathered character reflecting his age and labor history', N'Lined face reflecting sixty-two years of precision work and sun exposure; close-trimmed white beard maintained with ritualistic care every three days; high cheekbones with balanced West African prominence and East Asian definition, South Asian nose bridge; intelligent and observant eyes behind reading glasses worn on a beaded cord despite functional implant correction', N'Left forearm prosthetic below the elbow: mid-range Ferrogate industrial model heavily customized through decades of modification, its housing bearing scratched geometric etchings and showing signs of personal maintenance; bronze-toned articulation joints visible at wrist and finger servos. Vision correction implant detectable only by the subtle luminescence at the edge of his iris in certain light. Mild skeletal reinforcement in both shoulders suggests past industrial injury but visible only as subtle asymmetry in shoulder width.', N'Stands with a slight forward lean developed from years hunched over fitting benches; moves with economical precision despite his age and bulk; handles objects with meticulous care and deliberation; left arm moves with mechanical smoothness but total naturalness — prosthetic is clearly an extension, not an appendage', N'Practical Tier 3-4 working-class aesthetic: well-maintained black cotton work pants with multiple reinforced pockets, fitted long-sleeved thermal shirt (often dark blue or charcoal) rolled to elbows during fitting work, heavy canvas apron with leather-reinforced cuff for his prosthetic side, worn composite steel-toed boots re-soled multiple times. No jewelry except reading glasses cord made from braided synthetic beads. Occasionally wears a thin gold ring on his right hand — simple, well-worn, likely a wedding band or memorial piece.', N'He has been training an apprentice — a seventeen-year-old named Pako from two streets over — entirely off the books, because he cannot afford the Helix licensing fees that would make the apprenticeship official. If Helix inspectors found out, they could shut him down.', N'Rich and unhurried. Mixes Swahili-derived words from his Kenyan grandfather''s side with the Slavic-inflected slang of Archer''s Line. Uses analogies drawn from mechanics and material science to explain emotional concepts.', N'Slow and rolling. Rarely interrupts. Lets silences breathe.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'diogo_agyemang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a71c-79cf-a401-97e01db6c23e', N'Anja Lindström-Kristjánsson', N'Anja', N'', N'Lindström-Kristjánsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 48, NULL, 20, 5, N'active', N'The Spires, near Michigan Ave and Chicago Ave', N'Fixer - Personal security', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Portrait of Anja Lindström-Kristjánsson, 188cm tall athletic security operative, GLMZ. Warm medium-brown skin with golden-amber luminosity, East Asian monolid eyes with strong brow ridge, high cheekbones with moderate fullness, broader facial geometry. Black hair with silver temples, tight fade undercut, neatly trimmed goatee. Pale thermal burn scar from right temple to jawline. Dark intense gaze, weathered expression of chronic alertness. Wearing matte-black synthlinen tactical jacket with Φ-laced smart-weave, reinforced ballistic undersuit visible at collar and wrists, heavy-soled tactical boots. Digital watch on left wrist. Posture balanced and deliberate. Indoor GLMZ corporate security setting, cool blue-grey overhead lighting with warm accent light catching amber skin tone and scar texture. Cinematic, film noir security professional aesthetic, moody atmospheric lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spires', N'local', N'The Spires', N'Complex tri-continental ancestry with East Asian foundation (52.6%) modified by substantial Northern European (32.9%) and meaningful Sub-Saharan African (13.7%) contributions. Genetic expression creates distinctive phenotype: East Asian bone structure and monolid eye geometry form baseline, elevated by Northern European height and facial breadth, enriched by Sub-Saharan African ancestry contributing skin depth, warmth, and undertone complexity. Result is high-cheekboned face with moderate projection, broader facial width typical of East Asian heritage, strong brow ridge, and skin with luminous warm-brown canvas showing golden-amber highlights in direct light.', 188, 94, N'Athletic and broad-shouldered, muscle definition visible but not excessive; carries weight in chest and forearms from decades of physical work. Frame suggests controlled strength rather than showiness.', N'Black with silver threading at temples', N'Tight fade, closely clippered on sides with longer texture on crown', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Warm medium-brown with golden-amber luminosity, combining East Asian and Sub-Saharan African depth with subtle olive undertones. Richer warmth than Northern European baseline, glows amber in direct light.', N'Weathered by sun and stress, minimal facial hair except neatly trimmed goatee. Faint lines around eyes and forehead from squinting and chronic alertness. Monolid eye structure with strong brow ridge; high cheekbones with moderate projection and slight fullness; broader face width with lower cheekbone placement characteristic of East Asian heritage, subtly modified by Northern European contribution. Clear skin bearing texture of someone who doesn''t prioritize cosmetic treatments. No visible hyperpigmentation or depigmentation.', N'None visible. Any augmentations are subcutaneous or internal—characteristic of someone who values discretion and maintains a low-profile presence despite their role.', N'Stands with weight balanced evenly, shoulders slightly back. Moves with deliberate efficiency—no wasted motion. Eyes constantly assess surroundings, head turns at controlled intervals. Handshake is firm but not aggressive. Speaks from the chest, voice modulated low.', N'Tier 2-3 professional security aesthetic. Typically wears tailored charcoal or matte-black synthlinen jackets with subtle Φ-laced smart-weave (barely detectable); fitted cargo pants with discrete pockets; reinforced undersuit visible at collar and wrists (ballistic-rated, matte finish). Boots are heavy-soled tactical grade, well-maintained but scuffed from use. Favors brands associated with corpo security (Hexus, Ironclad). No jewelry except a worn digital watch on left wrist with encrypted band.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anja_lindstr_m_kristj_nsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68f-708a-bab2-97ee40ff4c3e', N'Hanan Chakraborty-Thorvaldsdóttir', N'Hanan', N'', N'Chakraborty-Thorvaldsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 11, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Blackpipe Corridor, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Truant message runner, the Gray Zone streets', N'Informal runner collective (the ''Patchwork Post''), loosely tolerated by Blackpipe Corridor small merchants', N'Hanan Chakraborty-Thorvaldsdóttir is small even for eleven, with deep umber skin, a gap-toothed grin she''s not shy about, and natural hair sectioned into uneven puffs held together by whatever elastic she could find that morning. Her eyes are quick and dark, always cataloguing exits. She wears a patchwork jacket she stitched herself from three dead jackets — hence the alias — with pockets sewn into places no tailor would think of: the lining of the hood, behind the collar, inside the cuffs. She smells faintly of the solvent she uses to peel address-tags off packages.

Hanan Chakraborty-Thorvaldsdóttir is relentlessly cheerful in a way that unsettles adults who look closely enough to see how deliberate it is. She learned early that a smiling kid gets waved through checkpoints a sullen one does not. She collects information the way other children collect toys — who owes whom, which corridor the Ferrogate patrol skips at shift change, whose E.L.F. shrine is still active in the Blackpipe utility alcove — and she stores it all behind that gap-toothed smile. She is fiercely protective of the two younger kids she runs messages with, and will not admit this even to herself.', N'Local color and unexpected information source; she has seen things adults don''t notice because adults don''t look at children. Quest giver for micro-scale street-level plots. Potential ward or contact for player characters who earn her trust.', N'', N'None. She wants cat-eye irises when she''s older and has already picked the color: amber.', N'Wakes before dawn in a hot-bunk arrangement in a Blackpipe tenement crawlspace, picks up morning message bundles from three regular clients, runs routes through the Corridor and into the Gray Zone before school patrols activate, eats whatever the shrine-keeper at the Corridor E.L.F. alcove puts out for offering-overflow.', N'GLMZ portrait of Hanan, a 135cm tall young street courier with mixed Northern European, South Asian, and Eastern European ancestry. Medium warm brown skin with golden undertones and matte finish from indoor living. High angular cheekbones, gap-toothed smile, thin scar on left cheek. Dark alert eyes. Natural black hair in uneven puffs tied with mismatched elastics. Wearing a chaotic patchwork jacket made from tan synthleather, faded blue denim, and charcoal poly-blend, heavily patched and stitched with black thread, covered in visible salvage pockets. Long-sleeve cheap thermal underneath. Chemical stains on fingernails, callus marks on grip fingers, small burn scar on inner wrist. Slight wiry build, constantly restless posture. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone Tier 5 scavenger aesthetic. Neon-lit underpass or warehouse setting, cool LED lighting casting shadows across angular features. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Northern European (39.2%), South Asian (38.6%), and Eastern European (22.2%) ancestry create a striking balanced phenotype—high, pronounced cheekbones from South Asian genetics softened by Northern European bone structure, with the slightly broader facial width characteristic of Eastern European heritage; warm medium brown skin with golden undertones from the South Asian component balanced against cooler undertones from Northern and Eastern European ancestry, creating a complex warm-neutral tone; the genetic blend produces an angular, distinctive face where no single ancestry dominates', 135, 28, N'Slight and wiry for her age, all lean muscle from constant running; shoulders already developing the forward hunch of someone who carries weight in patched pockets', N'Natural black', N'Uneven puffs sectioned across her scalp, each bundle tied with whatever elastic was available that morning—mismatched colors, some showing strain', N'Medium (3-4 inches per puff)', N'Dark brown, alert and restless', N'Medium warm brown with subtle golden undertones from South Asian ancestry balanced against cooler undertones from Northern and Eastern European heritage; the slight ashy quality of someone who lives indoors under artificial light creates a subtle matte finish across cheekbones and forehead', N'Balanced angular face with high, pronounced cheekbones reflecting the South Asian component, strengthened by Northern European bone structure and the slightly broader facial proportions of Eastern European heritage; gap-toothed smile (missing one upper molar—extraction, not loss), fine scar tissue on left cheekbone from childhood scrape, perpetually flushed cheeks with warmth showing readily across warm-toned skin', N'None. Completely biological.', N'Constantly in motion even when standing still—weight shifts between feet, eyes cataloguing exits and sightlines, hands restless. Moves with economical precision through crowded spaces; no wasted energy. Smile deployed deliberately, switching on and off like a data toggle.', N'Signature patchwork jacket assembled from three salvaged jackets—tan synthleather, faded blue denim, charcoal poly-blend—stitched together with visible black thread in chaotic patchwork. Pockets everywhere: hood lining, collar reverse, cuff interiors, thigh patches. Underneath: cheap long-sleeve thermal to cut solvent contact. Tier 5 scavenger aesthetic: everything repurposed, nothing new, all functional.', N'She intercepted a message six weeks ago that she couldn''t deliver because the recipient had died — and she read it. It was a parent''s message to a child in a corporate school. She has memorized it and sometimes recites it quietly to herself when she''s alone.', N'Street-clipped, efficient, lots of spatial prepositions and timing language; surprisingly precise when giving directions', N'Fast, runs clauses together, slows down noticeably when she''s being careful or lying', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hanan_chakraborty_thorvaldsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f9-7ef1-b747-97f050bdc4f1', N'Fouad Bautista-Kulkarni-Traoré', N'Fouad', N'', N'Bautista-Kulkarni-Traoré', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Drifts between Irkalla and Blackpipe Corridor; sleeps at the Conduit House monk collective, near Ashland and Division', N'Circuit monk and itinerant data diviner', N'The Conduit House Circuit Monks (loose collective, no formal hierarchy); occasional work through the Blackpipe Corridor community board; The Reclaimed', N'Fouad Bautista-Kulkarni-Traoré is lanky and perpetually underfed-looking, with the kind of restless energy that makes him seem taller than he is. His heritage shows in the warm amber undertone of his skin and the tight curl of his close-cropped hair, and he has spent his modest earnings on a single cosmetic mod: bioluminescent patches along his collarbones and the backs of his hands that pulse with slow blue-gold light, patterned like circuit traces. He says they are his vows made visible. His robes are actually a patchwork of reclaimed materials — a Tessera maintenance jacket, thermal underlayers from a surplus stall, a sash of hand-embroidered data symbols — and he carries a battered canvas bag full of cracked screens and salvaged drives that he uses for his readings.

He became a circuit monk at nineteen after a near-death experience during a transit system failure left him trapped in a stalled Ferrogate car for eleven hours, during which he claims the car''s E.L.F. spoke to him continuously. He is earnest to the point of vulnerability, prone to enthusiasms he cannot always sustain, and genuinely delighted by complexity. He performs data divination by reading the corruption patterns in old storage media — finding, he says, the shape of probable futures in the way data degrades. He is wrong often enough to be humble about it and right often enough to have regulars.', N'Itinerant information broker dressed as spiritual guide; his readings can function as cryptic hints or genuine data recovery from old media; he is a friendly recurring face who notices things because he walks everywhere.', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin patches (circuit-trace pattern, blue-gold); a basic neural read port at the base of his skull that lets him interface with old media directly — secondhand, mildly glitchy.', N'Wakes at Conduit House for the morning data-prayer, spends the day walking routes through Irkalla and Blackpipe offering readings, returns in the evening for communal meal and the cataloging of the day''s corruption patterns.', N'GLMZ, androgynous figure with warm caramel-bronze skin, high sharp cheekbones, deep-set dark brown eyes with subtle epicanthic fold, black tightly curled close-cropped hair. Tall lean build (183cm), restless posture. Wearing faded grey Tessera maintenance jacket with elbow patches, visible thermal layers, hand-embroidered data-symbol sash in blues and golds, worn cargo pants. Bioluminescent circuit-trace patterns glow soft blue-gold across collarbones and backs of hands, pulsing with neural activity. Small surgical scar visible at base of skull behind right ear. Carrying battered canvas messenger bag bulging with salvaged tech. Indoor neon-lit setting, warm practical lighting highlighting the bioluminescent augmentations and golden skin undertones. Fidgety, inward-focused expression suggesting active neural engagement. Neo-noir ascetic hacker aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Drifts between Irkalla and Blackpipe Corridor; sleeps at the Conduit House monk collective', N'local', N'Drifts between Irkalla and Blackpipe Corridor; sleeps at the Conduit House monk collective', N'Complex multiethnic phenotype dominated by Hispanic/Latin American (41.1%) and South Asian (31.8%) ancestry, with significant Sub-Saharan African (14.3%), Southeast Asian (8.6%), and Indigenous American (4.2%) contributions. Facial structure blends South Asian bone prominence with West African depth, Latin American warmth, and Indigenous American undertones. High cheekbones and refined nose bridge reflect South Asian heritage; expressive eye set and subtle epicanthic fold suggest Southeast Asian admixture; warm golden skin undertones bridge the entire genetic spectrum.', 183, 68, N'Lanky and lean with the stretched look of someone who moves constantly and eats irregularly; long-limbed, narrow-shouldered, minimal body fat', N'Black with natural tight curl', N'Close-cropped, neatly maintained despite poverty', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Warm caramel-bronze complexion with golden undertones; medium-dark depth reflecting balanced South Asian, Hispanic/Latin, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, brightened by Southeast Asian luminosity and Indigenous American warmth', N'Angular facial structure with high, prominent cheekbones reflecting South Asian and West African ancestry; expressive deep-set eyes with subtle epicanthic fold; straight refined nose bridge with slight nostril flare; clear skin with warm golden undertones creating natural luminosity that amplifies bioluminescent augmentations; no facial hair', N'The bioluminescent skin mods are immediately visible and deliberately ornamental — they pulse slowly at rest and brighten when he concentrates. The neural port at the base of his skull is visible as a subtle raised scar with faint metallic threading if his hair is swept back. His movements occasionally sync with the bioluminescence, suggesting active neural engagement.', N'Restless and fidgety at rest, constantly adjusting his patchwork robes or touching the worn canvas bag; walks with a purposeful lope, slightly uneven gait as if his mind is always ahead of his body; hands gesture frequently when speaking, and his bioluminescent patches brighten with animated discussion; eyes have a distant, inward quality when he''s concentrating on readings', N'Tier 4 utilitarian ascetic — a Tessera maintenance jacket (faded grey, patched at elbows), thermal underlayers visible at the neckline and wrists, a hand-embroidered sash of data symbols wrapped around his waist (blues and golds matching his bioluminescence), worn cargo pants with multiple pockets, soft-soled slip-on shoes. Everything is clean but worn. He carries a battered canvas messenger bag stuffed with cracked screens, salvaged drives, and data readers, and a small cloth pouch containing divination materials.', N'He has a small side practice that has nothing to do with spirituality: he recovers and sells data from the old drives he reads, carefully and only from abandoned media. He tells himself it doesn''t conflict with his vows. It does, slightly.', N'Mixes street slang with circuit monk terminology and occasional French phrases from his Congolese-via-Belgian ancestry. Technical when discussing data; poetic when discussing divination.', N'Fast, with sudden stops when he catches himself. Asks lots of questions.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fouad_bautista_kulkarni_traor');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68d-7483-bc83-9808ec8e07f3', N'Chidinma Choi', N'Chidinma', N'', N'Choi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, Ironvein, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Food stall operator and unlicensed street pharmacist', N'Independent; pays protection to the Oxidian Market vendors guild and a loose arrangement with the Ironvein Sable Crew', N'Chidinma Choi is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin mapped in pale vitiligo patches across her neck and hands, which she has leaned into with bioluminescent dye injections that make the pale patches glow faint amber in low light. Her silver-threaded locs are pinned up under a faded yellow wrap, and she wears three mismatched earrings in her left ear — one a tiny copper spoon, one a data-chip casing, one a dried seed pod she claims came from her grandmother''s garden in Bamako. She smells permanently of fenugreek, chili oil, and something chemical underneath that doesn''t belong in a kitchen.

Chidinma Choi has operated her stall — officially a Sahelian-Hungarian fusion breakfast stand — for nineteen years in the same corner of the Alban Souk. She is the kind of woman who knows every vendor by name and every vendor''s trouble. Her warmth is genuine but calibrated: she gives freely, but she tracks every gift. Her real side business, the pharmaceutical one, she conducts with the same domestic warmth — ''Just a little something for the pain, yes? Eat first.''', N'Quest giver, information broker, local moral anchor, street pharmacy access point. She knows everyone in Ironvein and remembers everything. Players seeking intel about the Souk or the neighborhood will find her invaluable — if they eat something first.', N'', N'Bioluminescent dye in vitiligo patches (cosmetic). Arthritic joint suppressors in both wrists — functional necessity. Scent glands lightly enhanced to help her identify compounds by smell.', N'Up before dawn to source ingredients from the Souk''s back-channel suppliers, she has her first customers by 06:00 and the pharmaceutical window opens after 10:00, handled through ''special orders'' wrapped in wax paper alongside the food. She closes at dusk and spends evenings updating her mental ledger of who owes her what.', N'Chidinma Choi, 58-year-old woman with multihemispheric ancestry: medium-warm golden-bronze skin with pale bioluminescent vitiligo patches glowing amber in shadows across neck, décolletage, and hands. Deep brown eyes with amber undertones, crow''s feet from decades of work. Balanced facial features blending East Asian cheekbones and jawline with fuller Sub-Saharan African lips and nose, softened Northern European bone structure. Black locs with silver threading, wrapped in faded yellow cotton headwrap, loose topknot. Broad-shouldered, solid 168cm frame showing 58 years of kitchen work and chronic pain management. Wearing pale tan linen overshirt with rolled sleeves, dark cargo apron, worn canvas shoes. Subtle wrist augmentation ridges visible beneath skin. Mismatched copper spoon and seed pod earrings. Small fenugreek leaf tattoo on left wrist. Standing in warm kitchen light, hands mid-motion, emanating quiet competence and weathered grace. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Shallow depth of field, warm amber and soft shadow lighting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'Genuinely multihemispheric phenotype reflecting five continents: East Asian (27.2%) and Southeast Asian (12.3%) ancestry provide tapered jawline and cheekbone structure; Sub-Saharan African (16.0%) and Hispanic/Latin American (25.3%) ancestry contribute fuller lips, broader nose, and warmer undertones; Northern European (19.2%) ancestry adds height and shoulder breadth. The result is a balanced, harmonious blend—no single heritage dominates. Bone structure is neither sharp nor rounded, facial features neither delicate nor heavy, with golden-bronze skin that speaks to ancestry across equatorial and subtropical regions.', 168, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, with the kind of density that comes from decades of standing work. Strong upper body, slight softness at the midsection from tasting her own cooking. Moves with deliberate economy.', N'Natural black with white/silver threading throughout', N'Locs, sectioned and pinned into a loose topknot', N'Long (shoulder-length when unbound), typically wrapped', N'Deep brown with slight amber undertone', N'Medium-warm golden-bronze complexion from the balanced blend of East Asian, Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Latin American ancestry. Baseline warmth suggests sun exposure across multiple equatorial and subtropical climates. Extensive pale vitiligo patches across neck, décolletage, and backs of both hands create stark luminescent contrast against the warmer base tone.', N'Bone structure reflects East Asian and Southeast Asian ancestry in slightly elevated cheekbones and tapered jawline, broadened and softened by Northern European and Sub-Saharan African heritage—creating a balanced, harmonious face. Facial features carry fuller lips and nose characteristic of African ancestry tempered by East/Southeast Asian proportions. Crow''s feet are deep from 58 years of squinting in kitchen steam and market sunlight across multiple climates. Hands show the wear of constant work—calluses on palms and fingers, slight inflammation around wrist joints from arthritis. Slight weathering across the bridge of nose and cheekbones from cumulative sun exposure. Vitiligo patches glow faint amber-gold in low light from bioluminescent dye injections.', N'Subtle augmentation ridge visible along both wrists beneath the skin where joint suppressors are anchored—just enough give-away detail to mark her as someone who carries tech. No obvious chrome. The enhanced scent glands are invisible. The bioluminescent patches glow visibly in shadows.', N'Stands with weight evenly distributed, shoulders back. Moves with the careful precision of someone managing chronic pain—no wasted motion, but never hurried. Her hands are always in motion: stirring, measuring, gesturing while talking. Her left hand occasionally flexes slightly, a habitual gesture that suggests she''s managing the suppressors'' feedback.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, practical and worn-in. A faded yellow cotton wrap always covers her locs. Wore-soft linen overshirt in cream or pale tan, sleeves rolled to the elbows to display the vitiligo and bioluminescence. Practical dark cargo apron with deep pockets containing small glass vials, paper packets, and a worn notebook. Worn canvas slip-on shoes reinforced at the heel. Three mismatched earrings in her left ear: a tiny copper spoon, a data-chip casing (non-functional, purely sentimental), and a dried seed pod. A thin chain around her neck bearing a small brass mortar and pestle charm.', N'The compound she sells as a ''sleep aid'' has a secondary effect she discovered accidentally — at low doses it suppresses the emotional overlay of certain neural augmentations, giving corp-wired workers a few hours of unmonitored feeling. She does not fully understand what she''s selling, only that people come back desperate for more.', N'A warm blend of West African French cadences, Hungarian diminutives picked up from her late husband''s family, and Souk pidgin. Uses food metaphors constantly.', N'Unhurried, melodic, with long pauses before important things.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chidinma_choi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65e-7fd0-80ec-98a02f8f5219', N'Eliska Kristjánsson', N'Eliska', N'', N'Kristjánsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Canopy — operates from a rented booth in the Grainfort night market, near Lincoln and Addison', N'Dream interpreter and chrome prayer practitioner', N'Unaffiliated; attends the Grainfort Chrome Prayer circle on alternating Thursdays', N'Eliska Kristjánsson is the kind of person who makes you feel like you''ve met before, though you haven''t — something in the quality of their attention, the way they lean slightly forward and hold whatever you''re saying like it matters. They are medium height with the compact build of someone who sleeps irregularly and makes up for it in nervous energy. Their skin is a warm light brown and their eyes have patterned irises — concentric rings of amber and green, a mod they saved up for two years to afford — which they use shamelessly, letting people get lost in them while they listen. Their hair changes color with their moods via a geneware follicular mod: deep blue when calm, red-orange when excited, grey-green when they are hiding something.

Miro came to dream interpretation sideways — they started as a chrome prayer workshop facilitator for a community center, teaching people to sync their implants to collective meditative states, and discovered they had an unsettling gift for identifying the symbolic architecture of other people''s dreams. Their practice is syncretic: equal parts Jungian analysis, chrome prayer resonance mapping, and E.L.F. consultation. They charge Φ15 per session on a sliding scale and are perpetually behind on booth rent. Their notebook is the size of a brick and contains four years of other people''s dreams, annotated in four different colored inks.', N'Exposition through symbolism — can reveal subconscious information about NPCs through dream readings; also serves as a community information node because everyone in the night market talks to them', N'', N'Patterned irises (amber/green concentric rings); follicular mood-chromatic geneware (hair color reflects emotional state); basic neural-haptic sync implant for chrome prayer facilitation', N'Sleeps until noon by necessity — they are a genuine night person — and runs dream interpretation sessions from late afternoon until the market closes at 2 AM, then spends an hour writing up session notes before sleeping.', N'Eliska Kristjánsson, Southeast Asian-dominant neo-noir character with deep golden-brown skin enriched by Sub-Saharan African heritage, striking angular high cheekbones, perpetually tired intense gaze with augmented concentric amber-green irises, shoulder-length mood-chromatic blue hair currently in loose half-braid, faint dark circles under eyes, sharp jawline; wearing worn vintage band t-shirt layered under muted earth-tone overshirt, black cargo pants, fabric messenger bag covered in patches; silver ring on left middle finger; visible neural-haptic port scar at base of skull; leaning forward with restless, attentive posture; 3 AM energy, dream-state intensity; GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon glow reflecting off skin, moody atmospheric lighting, hyper-focused expression --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Canopy', N'local', N'The Canopy', N'Southeast Asian-dominant ancestry (69.6%) forms the primary genetic foundation, blended with substantial Sub-Saharan African heritage (17.0%) that deepens skin tone and defines facial structure, complemented by Indigenous American (7.2%), Northern European (5.1%), and minor East Asian (1.1%) admixture; creates striking angular features with warm deep golden-brown skin enriched by reddish undertones, high cheekbone prominence characteristic of Southeast Asian genetics, and luminous depth from the complex melanin expression across these heritage groups', 168, 58, N'Compact and wiry with the restless energy of chronic sleep debt; narrow shoulders, slight frame, no excess weight — the build of someone sustained by coffee and neural stimulants rather than meals', N'Mood-chromatic via geneware; currently deep blue (calm state), shifts to red-orange when excited, grey-green when concealing', N'Shoulder-length, often half-pinned or wrapped in a loose braid; slightly unkempt, suggesting 3 AM grooming habits', N'Medium', N'Augmented irises with concentric rings of amber and green; hypnotic patterning that draws sustained attention', N'Deep warm golden-brown with reddish undertones, reflecting the dominant Southeast Asian heritage blended with the deeper melanin richness of Sub-Saharan African ancestry, subtly warmed by Indigenous American heritage and luminous depth from Northern European traces', N'Sharp, angular facial features with pronounced high cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian genetic expression; strong jawline with subtle structural width enhanced by Sub-Saharan African heritage; perpetually tired eyes with faint dark circles; smooth deep-toned skin with no visible blemishes; expression carries a quality of intense, almost unsettling attentiveness', N'Concentric-patterned irises are immediately striking and impossible to miss; hair color shifts subtly throughout conversation based on emotional state; faint circular port scar at base of skull visible in certain lighting or when hair is drawn back', N'Leans forward slightly when listening, as if physically drawing in what someone is saying; hands are expressive, moving constantly when speaking; restless fidgeting with notebook corners or pen when silent; moves with fluid efficiency despite sleep deprivation, no wasted motion; tends to maintain uncomfortable levels of direct eye contact', N'Tier 3-4 working class with bohemian undertones; worn vintage band t-shirts or modified surplus clothing; black cargo pants or faded jeans with multiple pockets for notes and pens; layered overshirts in muted earth tones; always carries the brick-sized dream notebook in a fabric messenger bag covered in worn patches and pins; wears minimal jewelry except for a silver-toned ring on left middle finger (possibly meaningful, possibly just habit); no corporate branding visible; overall aesthetic is ''perpetually between sleep and vision''', N'They have been recording and cross-referencing clients'' dreams for years without explicit consent, searching for patterns they believe indicate collective E.L.F. communication through the city''s sleeping population. They believe they are on the edge of something significant. They have not asked themselves whether this is ethical.', N'Playful and precise by turns, fluent in both technical chrome prayer jargon and accessible street language, will adapt entirely to whoever they''re talking to', N'Quick and associative — follows threads, doubles back, loses and recovers the point with charm', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eliska_kristj_nsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a618-7157-8b0f-98a641dc90df', N'Odalys Echeverría', N'Odalys', N'', N'Echeverría', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Escanaba Gateway, airship mooring platform C, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'airship drifter; seasonal cargo deckhand and petty courier', N'Loose affiliation with three or four cargo airship crews who use them as a seasonal deckhand; occasional courier work for whoever pays', N'Odalys Echeverría is slight and short, with warm medium-brown skin and a mass of dark curly hair they keep shoved under a battered synthetic-fiber cap from a Ferrogate Transit promotional campaign three years ago. They have a geneware cat tail — warm brown, slightly darker at the tip — that they got at age fifteen from a Tier 1 parlor using credit they spent six months saving, and which they maintain with the kind of care that signals it is very important to them. Their face is young in a way that gets them underestimated constantly, which they have learned to treat as a professional asset. They have three earrings in the left ear, each from a different city they have passed through.

Odalys Echeverría has been riding cargo airships since they were sixteen, starting as an unauthorized stowaway, then graduating to informal deckhand labor when a captain named Ambrosia decided their small hands were useful for engine housing maintenance. They have no fixed address, no registered domicile, and no particular destination at any given time. They are relentlessly cheerful in a way that is not performative — they genuinely find the itinerant life exhilarating — and have a gift for making friends in every transit hub within four hundred kilometers. They are also an extremely reliable courier for small packages that cannot go through official channels, not because they are ideologically committed to any cause but because the pay is good and the work suits someone who is going everywhere anyway.', N'Mobile information conduit — knows something about everywhere and everyone in the transit network; can serve as a courier or guide; brings news from other locations; humanizes the drifter experience', N'', N'Brown cat tail with darker tip (geneware cosmetic, beloved). No other mods.', N'Follows the cargo airship schedule — currently between routes, sleeping on mooring platform C in a hammock slung between two anchor cleats. Spends layover days running small errands and courier jobs around Escanaba Gateway, eating at the transit worker commissary, and collecting gossip like others collect currency.', N'Odalys Echeverría, nineteen-year-old airship deck worker, standing in industrial cargo bay lighting, 158cm slight wiry frame. Rich warm brown skin with golden-bronze undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African and Latin American ancestry, sun-weathered around eyes and neck. Dark brown tight curls compressed under faded Ferrogate Transit cap. Dark brown eyes, sharp jaw and high cheekbones. Warm brown geneware cat tail with darker tip hanging behind, moving with subtle life. Wearing oversized canvas deck jacket with reflective strips over mismatched faded layers, worn cargo pants with patches, steel-toed work boots, fingerless gloves. Callused hands, small pale chemical burn scar on right forearm, three earrings in left ear lobe. Posture loose and economical, hyperaware of space. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial aesthetic, cool LED accent lighting mixing with warm work lights, gritty and lived-in environment. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'local', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'Multiethnic diaspora blend: predominantly Sub-Saharan African (46.7%) and Hispanic/Latin American (37.1%) with Northern European (16.2%) ancestry. Features reflect this genetic foundation — deep melanin base from African heritage enriched by warm bronze undertones from Latin American ancestry, with subtle brightness from Northern European admixture. The result is rich warm-brown skin with golden undertones and warm bronze layering.', 158, 48, N'Slight and wiry, built for climbing and tight spaces rather than strength — the compact frame of someone who has spent three years in cargo holds and engine housings', N'Natural dark brown, almost black', N'Mass of tight curls, habitually compressed under a faded synthetic-fiber promotional cap', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unbound)', N'Dark brown', N'Rich warm brown with golden and bronze undertones — deep melanin base from Sub-Saharan African ancestry (46.7%) blended with warm bronze from Hispanic/Latin American heritage (37.1%), subtly brightened by Northern European admixture (16.2%). Darker on forearms and neck from sun exposure across multiple latitudes; lighter on torso from months between deck work and interior spaces.', N'Young face with high cheekbones and defined jaw reflecting African and Latin American heritage; youthful features that read as younger than nineteen; sun-weathered texture around eyes and lips from constant wind exposure on airship decks; minor scarring on knuckles and forearms from engine work', N'Geneware cat tail — warm brown with darker brown tip, approximately 60cm in length, well-maintained with visible care; moves with subtle independent articulation at base; clearly a point of pride and frequent adjustment', N'Loose and economical movement, built for climbing and balancing on moving platforms; constant small fidgeting with cap brim or tail; tendency to be hyperaware of three-dimensional space (ducking through doorways preemptively, assessing weight distribution on floors); sits with knees drawn up or legs folded; walks with quick, light steps', N'Tier 4 working-class transient: worn synthetic-blend cargo pants with multiple pockets (patched at left knee), layered tank and long-sleeve thermal (mismatched in faded colors), an oversized canvas deck jacket with reflective strips and various tool loops (belonged to a crew member, never returned), steel-toed work boots (scuffed, re-laced multiple times), worn fingerless gloves. The Ferrogate Transit cap is a prized possession despite its age. Everything is functional over fashionable; nothing is new. Jewelry limited to ear piercings.', N'Six months ago they couriered a package from Kenosha Crossing to a contact in Ironvein that they later learned contained biometric data stolen from a Helix Biosystems facility. They do not know whose data. They have been trying to forget about it but cannot, because one of the earrings in their left ear was payment from that job, and they keep touching it.', N'Fast, colloquial, heavy with transit slang and airship crew terminology. Enthusiastic. Asks a lot of questions.', N'Quick, runs sentences together, rarely pauses mid-thought.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'odalys_echeverr_a');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d2-727d-8338-98ef2cf2c89f', N'Chiamaka Makwa', N'Chiamaka', N'', N'Makwa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, Geartown, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Food stall operator, street pharmacist (herbal/unlicensed supplements)', N'Independent; loosely protected by The Oxidian Market vendors guild; informal relationship with the Geartown block association', N'Chiamaka Makwa is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin mapped with old burn scars along her left forearm — she never hides them and never explains them. Her hair is dyed a permanent warm ochre through pigment geneware she got decades ago, and it suits her the way a crown suits a queen. She wears layered wraps in burnt orange and green over heat-resistant vendor''s apron, three copper bangles on each wrist, and a small laminated icon of the Oxidian Market''s resident E.L.F., Rustgod, pinned to her collar. Her stall serves a rotating menu of West-Central African and Balkan fusion street food — peanut groundnut stew ladled over fried cornbread, slow-braised lamb with ajvar and dried baobab, spiced tea that allegedly treats three different kinds of grief. She has run this stall for twenty-two years and has outlasted two gang transitions, one corporate rezoning attempt, and a fire.

Chiamaka Makwa is the kind of woman who speaks slowly and means everything she says. She remembers the name of every regular''s firstborn child and the anniversary of every hardship they''ve told her about. She is also, quietly and without drama, the stall''s second function: she sells unlicensed herbal and synthetic supplements out of a locked drawer under the prep counter — pain blockers, mood stabilizers, sleep aids, appetite regulators — things Tier 1 and 2 residents cannot afford through licensed channels. She considers this a moral act and will not be talked out of it.', N'Local anchor and information hub — she has seen everything in this market for two decades. Quest giver for problems affecting market residents; source of healing items and off-grid medicine; moral compass character who will call out ethical failures plainly.', N'', N'Pigment geneware (permanent ochre hair). Arthritic joint stabilizer implants in both hands, basic medical grade. No cosmetic chrome.', N'Arrives at the stall two hours before dawn to start her long-cook dishes, sells through midday rush and evening commuter wave, closes when the food runs out. Sundays she closes entirely and attends a neighborhood data-prayer circle devoted to Rustgod.', N'Chiamaka Makwa, 58-year-old woman with warm golden-brown skin blending East Asian, Indigenous American, Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, Middle Eastern, and North African heritage. Shoulder-length medium hair in warm ochre, loosely worn. Deep brown eyes with laugh lines. Moderate East Asian facial planes with higher cheekbones and broader face shape from Indigenous American ancestry. Silver constellation burn scars down left forearm, displayed without concealment. Wearing burnt orange and green layered wraps over gray-black heat-resistant vendor''s apron. Copper bangles with patina on both wrists. Faded Rustgod icon pinned to collar. Arthritic joint stabilizer implants faintly visible under skin on back of hands. Standing with centered confidence in a bustling neo-noir food market, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226. Warm practical lighting, no-nonsense presence, dignified working-class aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'Truly global diaspora ancestry with East Asian foundation (42.6%) layered with significant Indigenous American (15.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (17.5%), and Southeast Asian (11.6%) heritage, rounded by Middle Eastern (6.8%) and North African (5.7%) elements. This blend creates a phenotype that defies single-region categorization: warm golden-brown skin with honey and olive undertones, a facial structure combining East Asian moderate planes with the higher cheekbones and broader face shape characteristic of Indigenous American and Hispanic/Latin American lineages, and an eye shape that reflects the Southeast Asian component. The overall effect reads as authentically multi-continental.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, with the compact muscularity of someone who has spent decades standing over a prep counter. Not lean, not heavy — grounded and present in her body.', N'Warm ochre, permanently modified through pigment geneware', N'Worn loose or loosely braided, often wrapped with a patterned headscarf during work hours', N'Medium, shoulder-length', N'Deep brown, naturally warm', N'Warm golden-brown with honey and olive undertones, reflecting the blended East Asian, Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, Middle Eastern, and North African heritage', N'Weathered but well-maintained; laugh lines around her eyes and mouth speaking to a life fully lived. Her facial structure shows moderate East Asian planes balanced with the higher cheekbones and broader face shape from Indigenous American and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Minimal makeup. Her face reads as someone who has lived fully and without apology.', N'Arthritic joint stabilizer implants visible as faint metallic tracery under the skin across the back of both hands, particularly noticeable when she moves. No cosmetic chrome.', N'She stands still with absolute confidence, weight centered. When she moves, it is economical and purposeful — no wasted motion after fifty-eight years at a prep counter. She handles objects with the careful precision of someone managing mild joint pain with grace.', N'Layered wraps in burnt orange and green worn over a heat-resistant vendor''s apron in neutral gray-black. The wraps are quality fabric, well-maintained, suggesting both practicality and dignity. Tier 3-4 working class aesthetic — no corporate branding, no pretension, but nothing threadbare. Worn copper jewelry. Practical closed-toe shoes suitable for standing.', N'The fire that scarred her arm twenty years ago was not an accident — she burned down a Tessera subcontractor''s storage unit that was being used to warehouse eviction drones. She has never told anyone and considers it her one act of violence, which she neither regrets nor intends to repeat.', N'Warm, deliberate, proverb-heavy. Mixes Lingala phrases and old Bosnian idioms seamlessly, as if unaware they are different languages. Does not use slang.', N'Slow and measured. Lets silence do work. Never interrupts.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chiamaka_makwa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('697f88d0-434a-0497-9fa9-98f738688428', N'Hafsteinn Karlsen-Boateng', N'Hafsteinn', N'', N'Karlsen-Boateng', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A fortified suite on the 87th floor of the Tessera-adjacent Pinnacle Tower, Spires district', N'Private Investigator', N'Meridian Corporate Intelligence Group — a boutique firm serving Tier 4-5 clients', N'Hafsteinn Karlsen-Boateng is the person corporations call when they suspect the rot is coming from inside. Her firm, Meridian Corporate Intelligence Group, serves exclusively Tier 4 and Tier 5 clients — the corponations and the mega-wealthy individuals who orbit them. She investigates espionage, internal theft, executive misconduct, and the kind of byzantine corporate betrayals that can cost billions of Quanta and topple divisions.

South African-Norwegian heritage, forty-one years old, with dark skin, sharp cheekbones, and eyes that evaluate everything they see like an appraiser assessing collateral. She wears severity like other people wear cologne. Her rise from the Gray Zone to the Spires is a story she never tells because it would reveal vulnerabilities she''s spent decades armoring over. What matters is the present: she is the best corporate investigator in GLMZ, and everyone who matters knows it.

Her methods are exhaustive and merciless. When she''s hired to find a mole, the mole is found. When she''s hired to prove fraud, the fraud is proven. She has never failed to deliver a result, though the results aren''t always what her clients wanted to hear — she has, on three occasions, identified the client themselves as the source of the problem they hired her to investigate. She presents these findings with the same glacial professionalism as any other report, which is why she gets hired again despite making powerful people very uncomfortable.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hafsteinn_karlsen_boateng');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d1-7ada-8562-993bd8daa26c', N'Vale Shirazi', N'Vale', N'', N'Shirazi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Geartown, Gage Circuit, near Damen and Armitage', N'Neural calibrator specializing in augmentation synchronization and post-install psychological adjustment', N'Independent — informal referral network with several Geartown augmentation shops', N'Vale Shirazi is lean in the way of someone who forgets to eat, with warm brown skin, close-cropped dark hair, and irises that cycle through amber-to-green gradient depending on his mod''s mood-reading settings — a gift from a client who couldn''t pay in quanta. He dresses in soft, unthreatening fabrics (the neural calibration chair is already stressful enough) and keeps his workspace warm-lit and quiet, with small potted moss installations along the walls that patients are encouraged to touch. He has an almost preternatural ability to make people feel safe within minutes of meeting him.

He trained under Helix Biosystems'' neural integration division but went independent when he realized corporate calibration protocols optimized for hardware performance rather than patient wellbeing — they wanted efficient augments, not healthy people. Now he runs a small private practice in Geartown, catering to working-class clients who''ve had cheap installs go wrong: phantom limb feedback, dream-layer bleed from neural laces, identity drift after major cognitive augmentation. He''s part technician, part therapist, part grief counselor for people who don''t recognize themselves anymore.', N'Information source on augmentation culture, therapist-figure who can surface character backstory organically, potential quest giver when a client reveals something dangerous during calibration.', N'', N'Gradient mood-responsive iris mod (amber-green spectrum). Thin-band neural lace for interface work. Geneware: faint bioluminescent undertone in his forearms, visible only in dim light — a side effect of an experimental procedure he tested on himself.', N'He takes four clients per day maximum, each session two hours. Spends evenings writing up case notes in a personal archive he intends to eventually publish as an independent clinical study on post-augmentation psychological drift.', N'Vale Shirazi, 178cm lean neo-noir technician with warm golden-brown skin reflecting Middle Eastern-Hispanic heritage blended with South Asian and East Asian ancestry. Deep brown eyes with artificial amber-gold gradient iris modification, visible under dim light. Clean-shaven angular face with high cheekbones and soft lower face structure. Black close-cropped fade haircut. Wearing soft cream linen tunic layered over fitted undershirt, charcoal canvas trousers, worn leather ankle boots. Matte-black titanium bracelet on wrist. Faint bioluminescent blue-green glow barely visible along forearms in low light. Subtle neural port scars at left temple. Posture is deliberate and grounded, hands visible and open. Setting: dimly-lit neural calibration clinic or tech workspace, cool blue-spectrum lighting revealing the subcutaneous bioluminescence. GLMZ, measured calm demeanor, professional care-giver aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Complex diaspora blend: 39.7% Middle Eastern and 39.6% Hispanic/Latin American form the foundation, with meaningful contributions from South Asian (7.6%), East Asian (7.5%), and Southeast Asian (5.6%) ancestry. This creates a warm, golden-brown complexion with the high cheekbones and angular structure characteristic of Middle Eastern and Hispanic heritage, softened by South Asian fullness through the lower face and subtle East/Southeast Asian eye shape. The result is a face that reads as genuinely pan-global — symmetrical, warmly toned, with dark expressive eyes that carry both Mediterranean intensity and East Asian depth.', 178, 68, N'Lean and linear, almost ascetic — the body of someone whose nervous system consumes calories faster than his mouth remembers to eat. Slight forward shoulder curve from hours hunched over calibration interfaces.', N'Black', N'Close-cropped, precise fade maintained every three weeks at a Tier-3 barber on Milwaukee Ave', N'Short', N'Gradient mood-responsive: natural deep brown base cycling to amber-gold (calm), green (focused/engaged), or warm orange (stressed). Heterochromic effect increases under blue-spectrum light.', N'Warm golden-brown with honeyed undertones — the luminous result of Middle Eastern and Hispanic heritage blending with South Asian depth. Even tone across face and body, neither pale nor deeply dark, but richly warm with subtle golden radiance that catches light.', N'Clean-shaven, minimal scarring except faint neural port scars at left temple (well-concealed unless he pulls his hair back). Slight caffeine-shadows under eyes. Strong angular cheekbones with warm depth reflecting the balanced Middle Eastern-Hispanic foundation, softened by South Asian fullness through the lower face and subtle East Asian eye geometry. Skin carries faint bioluminescent quality in dim light — barely perceptible blue-green glow in forearms and along jawline from experimental geneware.', N'Gradient iris mod is immediately visible upon eye contact — distinctly artificial color-shift, though calibrated to look biological rather than chrome. Bioluminescent undertone in forearms only visible in dim light or during evening sessions. Neural port scars at temple are subtle unless actively pointed out. No external chrome or obvious prosthetics.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness, as if perpetually conscious of not startling people in his chair. Sits forward slightly when listening, hands open and visible. Minimal fidgeting. Speaks in even, measured tone. Walks with careful, grounded steps — no wasted motion.', N'Tier-3 functional: soft linen and cotton blend tunics in warm neutrals (cream, sage, warm gray) layered over fitted undershirts. Loose-fitting canvas trousers in charcoal or navy. Worn leather ankle boots resoled three times. A single lab coat in natural cotton (not sterile white — warm off-white) hangs in his office. Minimal jewelry except a simple matte-black titanium bracelet worn over the bioluminescent forearm scar. Aesthetically communicates: ''I am not trying to impress you, I am trying to help you feel safe.''', N'During his time at Helix Biosystems, he ran an unauthorized calibration on a teenage patient that went beyond his sanctioned parameters — he improved the kid''s outcomes dramatically, but he accessed emotional memory architecture he had no clearance to touch. He knows what that teenager''s worst memory feels like, and he''s never told anyone.', N'Precise but gentle. Uses second-person framing to give clients agency (''what you might be feeling'' rather than ''you feel''). Avoids technical jargon in conversation, saves it for documentation.', N'Unhurried. Comfortable with silence. Speaks in full sentences, rarely trails off.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'vale_shirazi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ad-74cb-a07d-997c700e9c74', N'Fleur Souvannavong', N'Fleur', N'', N'Souvannavong', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor — a basement garage workshop called Tuiasosopo''s, accessible via a grease-slicked ramp off Grindstone Shore, near Lake Shore and Navy Pier', N'Independent vehicle and drone mechanic, Old Harbor', N'Independent; informal referral network among Old Harbor dockworkers and small freight operators; The Shore Dogs', N'Fleur Souvannavong is a large man — broad through the chest and shoulders, with the particular solidity of someone who has spent decades moving heavy things without complaint. His Samoan-Dutch heritage gives him a height and frame that makes the workshop look scaled down around him; he moves through it with a careful, habituated economy that suggests he has misjudged his own size in doorways enough times to have learned. His skin is dark tan and perpetually marked with engine grease that the solvent spray never quite removes from the creases of his knuckles. His right arm from the elbow down is a working prosthetic — industrial grade, matte gray, with the manufacturer branding sanded off — that he maintains himself and has modified extensively over fifteen years until it no longer resembles the original product in any way that matters. He does not discuss how he lost the original arm.

Fleur Souvannavong is reserved in a way that reads as either hostile or comfortable depending on how quickly you need him to perform warmth. He is not hostile. He is simply someone who learned early that words are expensive and he spends them accordingly. He is extraordinarily competent, with a diagnostic instinct for machines that borders on the empathic — he listens to engines the way some people listen to music, tracking harmonics and absences. He has a seven-year waitlist for vehicle work and a two-week turnaround for drone repair, which in Old Harbor is considered miraculous. He prays to the E.L.F. he believes inhabits his diagnostic rig with the seriousness of a genuine practitioner.', N'Technical resource and Old Harbor fixture; can repair things players need repaired and ask uncomfortable questions about the condition they arrived in; knows the freight and vehicle patterns of Old Harbor intimately and can identify anomalies', N'', N'Right arm prosthetic (elbow-down, industrial grade, extensively self-modified); enhanced olfactory sensor implant in the nasal passage (helps him smell chemical irregularities in fuel and hydraulic fluid)', N'In the shop by 0700, works until the light fails or the job is done — whichever comes second; eats lunch beside whatever he is working on; attends the Old Harbor dockers'' informal social gathering every other Friday, mostly to sit near people without having to talk much.', N'Fleur Souvannavong, GLMZ, 193cm tall heavily muscled working-class man with mixed global heritage — Southeast Asian cheekbones and eye shape, Hispanic and South Asian warmth in medium-golden-brown complexion, Eastern European jawline strength. Dark brown hair graying at temples, slicked back. Dark brown eyes with amber undertones. Weathered face, economical expression. Industrial prosthetic right arm from elbow down, matte gray with visible welding seams and custom modifications, replacing factory branding. Ritual blue-black tattoo three horizontal lines on inner left forearm. Grease-stained hands from decades of mechanical work. Burn scar across right shoulder. Wearing faded industrial work t-shirt, dark gray cargo trousers oil-stained, heavy charcoal canvas shop coat, black resoled work boots. Standing in a dimly-lit workshop or dockyard, fluorescent light casting hard shadows, tools visible in coat pockets, posture forward-leaning and economical, minimal gesture, concentrated stillness. Neo-noir dystopian working-class aesthetic, practical and worn. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'A genuinely global genetic tapestry reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: Hispanic/Latin American (26.4%), Southeast Asian (24.7%), East Asian (20.0%), South Asian (12.5%), Eastern European (10.9%), Northern European (5.5%). His features show the sophisticated blending of this ancestry — Southeast and East Asian characteristics visible in his eye shape and prominent cheekbones, warmth and depth from Hispanic and South Asian ancestry in his skin undertones and facial proportions, structural strength from Eastern European heritage in his jawline and brow ridge, creating a face that reads as unmistakably contemporary and mixed-heritage.', 193, 118, N'Broad-chested and heavily muscled through the shoulders and trunk — the deliberate solidity of a man who has spent four decades relocating heavy machinery and vehicle frames. Not fat; densely compact. His frame makes standard doorways feel narrow.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples', N'Kept short and practical; slicked back with whatever is near at hand', N'Short', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertones', N'Medium-warm brown with golden-olive undertones — a naturally rich complexion from his mixed ancestry, further deepened by decades under workshop fluorescents and dock work in summer heat. The skin carries the subtle warmth of Southeast Asian and Hispanic heritage blended with the depth of South Asian genetics, creating a unified but complex medium-brown tone.', N'Weathered but unlined; his face has the economy of expression of someone who has never wasted a facial muscle. Strong jawline with balanced width reflecting the blend of East Asian and Eastern European ancestry. High, prominent cheekbones characteristic of his Southeast Asian heritage. Slightly broader nasal bridge reflecting South Asian genetics. A small notch in his left eyebrow from a tool accident in 1994. His hands are scored with grease stains that penetrate the cuticles — occupational stigmata that no amount of solvent removes.', N'Right arm from elbow down is a matte gray industrial-grade prosthetic that has been extensively and personally modified over fifteen years — the original manufacturer''s branding is sanded away, and the limb bears visible welding seams, custom reinforcement plating, and what appear to be field-modified actuator housings. The hand is articulate but clearly purpose-built for mechanical work rather than aesthetics. His nasal augmentation is invisible unless one is close enough to notice the faint scar-line at the base of his nose where the olfactory sensor was implanted.', N'He moves with the cautious precision of a man who has learned the exact dimensions of his own body in too-small spaces. His gait is economical — no wasted motion. He carries his weight forward slightly, as though perpetually leaning into the next task. When standing still, his weight shifts to his left leg; his prosthetic arm hangs at a slight angle that suggests habit rather than malfunction. In conversation, he is still — minimal gesturing, no fidgeting.', N'Tier 4 working-class, purely functional. Dark gray cargo trousers with reinforced knees and thigh pockets, oil-stained and patched at the seams. A faded industrial work t-shirt, sleeves rolled to accommodate the prosthetic. A heavy canvas shop coat in charcoal, pockets weighted with tools and diagnostic leads. Work boots: black, heavily resoled. No jewelry. No visible adornments. Everything is worn through to comfort; nothing is chosen for appearance.', N'The arm. He tells people it was a dock accident. It was not a dock accident. It was removed under duress by people he owed money to, over a debt he incurred covering someone else''s mistake. The someone else is now a moderately successful freight broker in Collinwood Docks and does not acknowledge knowing him.', N'Sparse, technical, precise — uses the correct name for every part and process; occasional Dutch expressions from his grandmother that surface under stress', N'Slow and weighted, with long comfortable silences; answers questions after a pause as if running internal diagnostics first', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fleur_souvannavong');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a720-7152-a0cd-998d0011d00f', N'Afolami Kobayashi-Kwon', N'Afolami', N'', N'Kobayashi-Kwon', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, studio above the Opalescent Bathhouse on Drost Alley, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Bioluminescent body painter and gene-mod body artist', N'Independent; loosely affiliated with the Hamtramck Enclave body-art collective known as The Dermists', N'Afolami Kobayashi-Kwon is compact and deliberate in movement, with deep brown skin that carries the ghost-traces of her own past work — faded luminescent pigment in floral fractals along her collarbones and the backs of her hands, half-intentional, half-memorial. Her eyes have been modded with patterned irises that cycle through slow amber-to-violet shifts depending on her mood, and she keeps her hair natural, twisted up and pinned with tiny glass vials of custom bioluminescent dye. She speaks quietly and means every word.

Her art sits at the intersection of the biological and the spiritual: she paints living skin using proprietary pigment blends she synthesizes herself, designing pieces that react to the wearer''s skin chemistry, emotion hormones, even body temperature. Some of her clients say the work moves them to tears; she says that is the point. She is deeply religious in her devotion to a local E.L.F. she calls the Pale Witness, which she believes inhabits the UV lamps in her studio, and she leaves offerings of raw spectral data before every session.', N'Quest giver (clients bring their secrets onto her table); information source on Hamtramck Enclave underground culture; emotional anchor character who grounds stories in the body and the personal', N'', N'Patterned cycling irises (cosmetic); subdermal pigment reservoirs in both forearms allowing fingertip ink expression (functional/cosmetic hybrid); olfactory sensitivity boost for reading skin chemistry', N'Spends mornings synthesizing pigment batches and consulting with clients on design intent; afternoons and evenings are for painting sessions that can run four to six hours, often accompanied by low drone music she curates herself.', N'Afolami Kobayashi-Kwon, 158cm compact artist with luminous golden-bronze skin blending East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian heritage. High defined cheekbones softened by broader African facial planes. Black locs pinned loosely upward threaded with bioluminescent vials glowing soft pastel colors. Augmented patterned irises cycling amber-to-violet over dark sclera. Faded violet-green bioluminescent fractals in floral patterns across collarbones and dorsal hands. Thin copper wire rings, worn amber-silver bracelet. Wearing loose paint-stained linen in deep indigo, sleeveless treated canvas apron. Bare feet on studio floor. Hands poised mid-gesture, deliberate and meditative. Subdermal iridescent pigment lines faintly visible on inner forearms under warm studio light. Warm, unflinching eye contact. GLMZ artist studio, soft golden-hour lighting, intimate focus on face and hands, mood of deep creative concentration. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'East Asian (60.3%) with Sub-Saharan African (26.0%) and Southeast Asian (13.7%) ancestry; a striking Ubiquitous Diaspora blend. Strong East Asian bone structure forms the foundation — defined cheekbones and eye shape — while Sub-Saharan African ancestry broadens facial planes and enriches skin depth. Southeast Asian warmth softens the overall composition, creating a harmonious integration of three continental features.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, with lean musculature from precise, controlled hand work. Shoulders slightly rounded from hours hunched over clients. Core strength evident but understated.', N'Natural black with subtle warm undertones', N'Twisted locs pinned up in a loose, intentional configuration; vials of bioluminescent dye woven throughout, creating a moving crown of soft color', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unbound)', N'Augmented patterned irises that cycle amber-to-violet; sclera remain natural dark brown', N'Warm golden-bronze with luminous complexity; blended ancestry creates depth — East Asian undertones enriched by Sub-Saharan richness and Southeast Asian warmth melting into a unified, glowing finish', N'Smooth, well-maintained skin with deliberate artistic intent. High cheekbones with East Asian definition softened by broader, more rounded facial planes from African ancestry. Faded ghost-traces of bioluminescent pigment in delicate floral fractals along collarbones and dorsal hand surfaces — intentional semi-permanent markers of past commissions and personal spiritual work. Minimal scarring. Hands show calluses from precise brush and applicator work but are otherwise unmarked.', N'Patterned cycling irises that slowly shift color in response to mood and ambient light (amber when focused, violet when introspective or emotionally engaged). Subdermal pigment reservoirs visible as faint iridescent lines running along inner forearms beneath the skin, most visible under direct light. Fingertips occasionally show residual bioluminescent bloom when recently loaded with custom pigment.', N'Economical and deliberate; moves with a meditative slowness that suggests deep focus. Hands are expressive but controlled — gestures while speaking but rarely wastes motion. Stands with weight slightly forward, ready to engage. Eye contact is steady and unflinching but warm. When painting, enters a state of near-trance concentration.', N'Tier 3-4 working artist; favors loose, paint-stained linen and organic cotton in muted earth tones (charcoal, rust, deep indigo). Often wears a custom sleeveless apron in treated canvas with interior pockets for pigment vials. Prefers bare feet or minimal grounding footwear (soft leather flats) to maintain skin contact with studio floors. Jewelry minimal — thin copper wire rings on most fingers, a worn beaded bracelet in amber and silver on left wrist. No corporate branding visible. Fabrics always allow full arm and shoulder mobility.', N'Three years ago she painted a piece for a Tessera mid-executive that contained a hidden biometric data-harvesting pigment — she was paid well and told herself it was victimless. The executive died in a data-breach scandal six months later. She does not know if her pigment was the vector, but she suspects, and she has never used that formula again.', N'Precise, sensory, slightly clinical when discussing technique; warm and almost liturgical when discussing meaning', N'Slow and considered, with long pauses before important statements', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'afolami_kobayashi_kwon');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a603-7215-a1cc-99922af91b4c', N'Bakari Kang-Shirazi', N'Bakari', N'', N'Kang-Shirazi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 37, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Ashfield — former residential district, half-burned, now squatter territory, near Kedzie and Division', N'Contract broker and resource coordinator — fixer', N'Semi-independent — recurring contracts with mid-tier fixers', N'Bakari Kang-Shirazi is compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 37, her expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She grew up in the Narrows, where the walls are so close together you learn to fight in confined spaces or you learn to lose. She works as a fixer out of Ashfield, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Bakari Kang-Shirazi has built a reputation on reliability rather than flash — she shows up, she delivers, she collects.', N'Erkin Inoue-Aidoo is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces. Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Bakari Kang-Shirazi, 158cm compact muscular frame, rich bronze skin with warm golden-brown undertones, high defined cheekbones blending East Asian structure with African and Pacific Islander heritage, varied monolids, broad nose with substantial bridge, full darker lips, dark alert eyes. Black hair pulled back tight with silver at temples. Visible chrome gecko-grip implants on fingertips, chrome ankle seam-work, scars on knuckles and webbed between thumbs. Wearing reinforced charcoal cargo pants with climbing loops, worn microflex jacket with reflective threading, aggressive-tread boots. Old functional smart-linked watch. Economical posture, low center of gravity, hands curved ready to grip. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon-lit urban vertical space, caught mid-movement against industrial architecture, moody blue and amber lighting, gritty tactical aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfield', N'local', N'Ashfield', N'Predominantly East Asian (41.9%) with substantial Pacific Islander (19.0%) and Sub-Saharan African (16.8%) ancestry, layered with Middle Eastern (9.8%), Southeast Asian (8.5%), and South Asian (4.0%) heritage. The phenotype is distinctly hybrid — East Asian bone structure and eye geometry enriched by African facial depth and warmth, Pacific Islander robustness and sun-darkened undertones, with subtle Middle Eastern olive notes and South Asian width through the face creating a luminous, complex appearance that reflects true global mixing.', 158, 62, N'Compact and densely muscled, low center of gravity — built for confined spaces and vertical movement. Shoulders broad relative to frame, legs thick with visible synthetic fiber bundling beneath skin.', N'Black with premature silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back tight, military-practical', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and unreadable', N'Rich warm bronze — the luminous interplay of East Asian golden undertones deepened by African and Pacific Islander sun-responsiveness, with subtle Middle Eastern olive and South Asian warmth creating a mid-to-deep complexion with distinctive catch-light properties.', N'High, defined cheekbones with East Asian structure broadened and softened by African and Pacific Islander heritage. Varied epicanthic fold reflecting mixed ancestry across both eyes. Broad nose with substantial nasal bridge from African and South Asian heritage, moderate flare at base. Full lips with natural darker pigmentation from multiple ancestry lines. Monolid variation across eyelids showing East Asian and African genetic contribution. Scars on knuckles and forearms show use rather than decay. Minimal makeup. Jaw set in habitual neutrality. No soft edges.', N'Chrome gecko-grip implants visible on fingertips and toe pads — metallic catch-light, articulated polymer casing. Slight chrome seam-work visible at ankle joints where synthetic leg fibers interface with biological tissue. Subcutaneous line visible along left forearm where maintenance port sits beneath skin.', N'Economical and precise. Stands with weight distributed low. Moves without wasted motion — every step calibrated. Eyes track exits and high ground automatically. Hands rest open, fingers slightly curved as if ready to grip or climb. When still, she''s genuinely still.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: reinforced charcoal cargo pants with climbing loops, worn microflex jacket with reflective threading, soft-soled boots with aggressive treads. No logos or corp affiliation. Neutral colors. Everything fitted for movement. One worn leather carry pouch on hip. No jewelry. A smart-linked watch on left wrist — old model, functional, not flash.', N'', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bakari_kang_shirazi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5de-73c1-82be-99b8e5b080ad', N'Ash Im', N'Ash', N'', N'Im', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 36, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor — operates from a converted shipping container on the remaining dry dock, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'Crew lead and master diver — Boneyard Saints', N'Boneyard Saints', N'Ash Im dives into the drowned ruins of Old Harbor and brings back things that should have stayed buried. Pre-collapse infrastructure, sealed server farms, military hardware that was never officially there — the flooded districts are an archaeological site for technology the corps want recovered and the city wants forgotten. Corva knows these waters better than anyone alive because she grew up on them. Her family ran fishing operations in the harbor before the collapse raised the water level and swallowed everything below the second floor.

She built the Boneyard Saints from salvage divers and ruin-runners who shared two qualities: the skill to survive Old Harbor''s flooded labyrinth and the nerve to go deep when the sonar returns something that shouldn''t be there. The ruins are not empty. Pre-collapse automated security systems still operate on backup power in some sections. Marine life has adapted to the submerged infrastructure in ways that marine biologists would find fascinating and divers find terrifying. And then there are the sounds — low-frequency resonance from deep structures that shouldn''t be producing sound at all.

Corva is broad-shouldered, weathered by salt water and UV exposure, with short dark hair and the permanently squinting eyes of someone who''s spent too many hours in glare. Her hands are scarred from coral cuts and salvage work. She moves with the deliberate economy of a diver — every gesture conserves energy, every step is placed. On land she seems slightly wrong, like a marine creature forced to perform on dry ground.', N'Corva drives the treasure-hunt-with-horror-elements stories of the Boneyard Saints. Her world is literally submerged — drowned infrastructure, forgotten technology, things that move in the dark water. She represents the scavenger economy of GLMZ''s margins, where the past is more valuable than the present, and recovering it requires going into places that feel actively hostile to human presence.', N'', N'Amphibious respiratory system — modified lungs that extract dissolved oxygen from water for up to 90 minutes before requiring surface air. Pressure-compensation implants in inner ear and sinuses. Sonar-processing cortex that interprets underwater acoustic data as spatial mapping. Thermal regulation dermal layer for extended cold-water immersion. Bio-luminescent dermal tattoos on her forearms that activate underwater — functional lighting, not cosmetic.', N'Wakes at first light. Checks weather, tides, and water conditions. Reviews salvage contracts and scout reports from the crew. Dives most days — either contract work or reconnaissance for future operations. Returns to the dry dock to catalogue and store salvage. Evenings are maintenance — equipment, augmentations, the container itself. Eats fish she catches herself when possible. Sleeps to the sound of water against the dock pilings because silence makes her uneasy.', N'Ash Im, a 172cm lean-muscular salvage diver in GLMZ, standing in rain-slicked harbor light. Deep warm bronze skin with golden undertones, dominant East Asian bone structure with prominent cheekbones, sun-weathered face with squint-lines and salt-bleached white eyebrows. Dark brown hair cropped short with salt-bleached tips. Dark brown eyes with dilated pupils. Visible gill-like scarring on neck, bio-luminescent tattoos as faint silver tracery on forearms, iridescent thermal-regulation sheen across shoulders. Wearing faded black neoprene wetsuit jacket over gray tactical cargo pants, steel-toed salvage boots, oversized dark blue salt-stained overshirt. Braided cordage bracelet with brass compass. Backward corp-logo baseball cap. Backward-leaning posture, hands flexed. Scars on palms and left forearm. Harbor setting with sodium lights and wet concrete. Moody, introspective, water-born. Cinematic depth of field. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Predominantly East Asian (60.3%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (21.0%), North African (11.2%), and Northern European (7.5%) ancestry. Phenotype reflects strong East Asian bone structure — prominent cheekbones and characteristic eye shape — blended with warm golden undertones from Latin American heritage, subtle olive warmth from North African genetics, and minimal cool undertones from Northern European ancestry. The admixture creates a distinctive warm bronze complexion with balanced facial geometry.', 172, 68, N'Broad-shouldered and lean-muscular, built for hydrodynamic efficiency rather than bulk. Developed trapezius and latissimus from years of diving and hauling salvage. Low body fat, dense muscle structure optimized for cold-water endurance.', N'Dark brown, salt-bleached at the tips', N'Cropped short, often wet or tied back with a faded cordage band', N'Short', N'Dark brown with permanent squint-lines at the corners; pupils dilate slightly wider than baseline due to sonar-processing implant', N'Warm bronze with golden undertones — rich warmth from dominant East Asian heritage blended with golden glow from Latin American ancestry and subtle olive-warm undertones from North African genetics. Weathered from UV and salt exposure into burnished bronze patina.', N'Sun-damaged and salt-etched; fine wrinkles around eyes and mouth from constant squinting and twenty-five years of water immersion. Facial structure shows dominant East Asian cheekbone prominence and eye geometry, with subtle broadening through North African and Latin American influence across the mid-face. Skin has a slightly matte finish from thermal regulation implants. No cosmetic grooming — practical and functional.', N'Bio-luminescent forearm tattoos visible as faint subcutaneous silver tracery in daylight, glowing blue-green when wet or activated. Gill-like scarring on neck sides where respiratory system integrates (visible when head tilted). Slight asymmetry in ear lobes where pressure-compensation implants sit. Thermal regulation dermal layer visible as faint iridescent sheen across shoulders and upper back in certain light angles. Sonar-processing cortex visible only as slight irregularity in skull curvature at base of skull — barely noticeable.', N'Moves with deliberate conservation — no wasted motion, every step placed with intention. On land, posture is slightly forward-leaning, as if gravity surprises her. In water, she moves like she was born there. Hands often hang slightly loose at sides, fingers flexing unconsciously as if testing water resistance. Head tilts frequently to process ambient sound. Blinks slowly, like she''s reading data.', N'Tier 4 working-class practical: custom-fitted wetsuit jacket (reinforced neoprene, faded black with underarm gussets for mobility), tactical cargo pants in weathered gray synthetic (many pockets, one thigh pocket modified for sonar receiver), steel-toed salvage boots with torn laces. Overshirt when ashore — oversized wool-synthetic blend in dark blue, salt-stained. No visible jewelry except a braided cordage bracelet with a salvaged brass compass. A faded corp-logo baseball cap she wears backward when concentrating. Everything smells like salt and machine oil.', N'She found her father''s dive gear three years ago in a sealed section of the flooded harbor. The gear was intact. There was no body. The section had been sealed from the inside.', N'Maritime, technical, physical. She describes things in terms of depth, pressure, current. Metaphors are aquatic without affectation.', N'Measured, calm, with the rhythm of someone who controls their breathing professionally. Gets clipped underwater — short phrases conserve air.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ash_im');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a623-7c99-8f45-9a038f4868c0', N'Aishwarya Jung', N'Aishwarya', N'', N'Jung', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone, Tent Cluster 9 (informally: ''Haf''s Row''), near Michigan Ave and Roosevelt', N'Climate refugee and de facto matriarch of a tent-city family cluster', N'Waukegan the Gray Zone Refugee Collective (informal); no corponation ties', N'Aishwarya Jung came to GLMZ''s edges seventeen years ago with twelve people and lost four of them to the journey. She arrived with nothing except a ferocious organizational intelligence and the absolute conviction that the remaining eight would survive. They did. The cluster at Haf''s Row has grown to forty-one people now — not all related by blood, but all held in place by a complex web of obligation, affection, and the specific terror of disappointing this woman.

She is small and tends toward stillness, which makes people underestimate her until they have been in a room with her for five minutes. Her face is a remarkable architecture of age and expression — she has the kind of features that are precise and deliberate even at rest. She wears her natural white hair unprocessed, cut close on the sides and fuller on top. Her hands are her most augmented feature: she accepted a nerve-enhancement package years ago to treat arthritic damage, and the faint silver threads of the implants are visible under the skin of her knuckles when the light is right. She does not consider this augmentation — she considers it a medical necessity, and she resents the question. She is generous to the point of self-destruction with resources and merciless with nonsense, and she has no patience for the distinction between the two.', N'Authority figure in the margins — she commands loyalty in communities that have no official power. Quest giver for problems within the Gray Zone community. Moral compass character who challenges players'' assumptions about poverty and agency. Can provide shelter and community knowledge.', N'', N'Nerve-enhancement implants in both hands (medical, treats arthritic neuropathy — silver subcutaneous threading visible at knuckles). No cosmetic modifications.', N'Up before anyone else, mediating the morning''s conflicts before they become the afternoon''s crises; coordinates food and water allocation for the cluster, maintains the shared prayer-shrine to the industrial E.L.F. called Ironlung who the Gray Zone residents believe governs the heating systems.', N'Aishwarya Jung, 156cm tall, wiry-lean East Asian-dominant woman (78.9% East Asian, 10.7% Hispanic/Latin American, 10.4% Eastern European) with warm honey-brown skin and golden undertones. Natural white short hair in undercut style, shaved at temples and sides with fuller crown swept back. Dark penetrating brown eyes set in heavily lined face with sharp cheekbones and angular jawline. Silver subcutaneous implant threading visible on knuckles in direct light. Thin pale 8cm scar along left temple to jawline. Wearing hand-mended gray synthetic workpants, layered undyed linen and thermal-weave top, long dark indigo salvaged canvas vest. Hand-braided cord around left wrist with cast-iron machine charm. Practical reinforced boots. Economical posture, minimal motion, rest-neutral expression. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial lake-effect setting, cool neon and overhead lighting highlighting her augmentations and weathered resilience. Scrupulously clean clothing despite environment. Stillness and quiet observation. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone', N'local', N'The Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly East Asian (78.9%), with significant Hispanic/Latin American (10.7%) and Eastern European (10.4%) ancestry, creating a phenotype with warm medium-honey skin tone, subtle high cheekbones with slight lateral prominence, and almond-shaped eyes reflecting the East Asian genetic dominance, warmed by undertones from the secondary ancestry groups', 156, 52, N'Small-framed and lean, with the wiry resilience of someone who has spent decades rationing calories and carrying responsibility. No softness; muscle definition visible at wrists and forearms despite age.', N'Natural white, unbleached and unprocessed', N'Undercut: shaved close at temples and sides, fuller crown left standing approximately 5cm, swept slightly back', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and penetrating', N'Warm medium-honey brown with golden undertones from the East Asian ancestry base, enriched by subtle warmth from Hispanic/Latin American heritage and a cool undertone from Eastern European genetics, creating a luminous balanced tone without ashy cast', N'Heavily lined face with pronounced cheekbones and sharp jawline; deep laugh lines around the eyes and mouth suggest chronic amusement at human folly. Facial structure shows the high cheekbone prominence and subtle eye-shape characteristic of East Asian heritage, combined with angular jaw definition enhanced by the secondary ancestry influences. Skin weathered but clean, with the particular dryness of someone living in industrial lake-effect zones. No makeup. Expression tends toward stillness until she speaks, then becomes remarkably mobile.', N'Silver subcutaneous implant threading visible at the knuckles of both hands when light catches them at the correct angle. She makes no effort to conceal this. No other visible augmentation; any internal modifications are not apparent.', N'Carries herself with minimal motion; economical and deliberate. Sits still for extended periods, hands folded, observing before speaking. Moves with the precision of someone managing chronic pain without complaint. When she stands, she rises slowly but completely — no half-measures. Her default expression is rest-neutral, but her eyes miss nothing.', N'Tier 5 practical: hand-mended gray synthetic workpants with reinforced knees, a layered system of undyed linen and recycled thermal-weave that can be adjusted for temperature, and a long vest made from salvaged industrial canvas dyed dark indigo. All items show visible mending; nothing matches by design. Wears a hand-braided cord around her left wrist from which hangs a small cast-iron charm in the shape of an abstract machine (representing Ironlung). Footwear is practical boots with reinforced soles, resoled at least twice. No jewelry except the charm. Clothing is kept scrupulously clean despite the environment.', N'One of the four people she lost on the journey to GLMZ did not die by accident. There was a choice, in the dark, with limited water, and she made it. She has never spoken of it. She carries the name of that person in her mouth like a stone.', N'Formal and precise in three languages, shifts between them within sentences based on emotional register. Sahel-inflected syntax, constructed sentences.', N'Measured, even, authoritative — speaks as if each sentence has been weighed before release', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aishwarya_jung');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f5-7f5f-af58-9a07e8d97e9b', N'Halldor Venkatesh-Balogun', N'Halldor', N'', N'Venkatesh-Balogun', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, Hamtramck Enclave, GLMZ, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Tailor and garment repair specialist', N'Independent (no formal affiliation); occasional contract work through Burnished Market vendor collective', N'Halldor Venkatesh-Balogun is slight and precise, with the kind of posture that makes them look taller than they are — the result of years hunched over a machine trained back into discipline by necessity. They have cool brown skin marked with self-applied geometric ink along both forearms (needlework maps, they say, of every garment type they''ve mastered), cat ears in matte black that they had installed at nineteen and have since come to regard as a mistake they''re too broke to undo, and a color-shifting streak in their close-cropped hair that they cycle through neighborhood palette trends with a cheap home kit. Their workspace is a converted stall in the Burnished Market — half the size of their competitors, immaculately organized, with a curtained fitting area that doubles as a break room and occasional sleeping space on bad weeks.

Halldor Venkatesh-Balogun has built a reputation for making cheap fabric look like it wasn''t, for structural repair on garments that other tailors would refuse, and for a consultation style that is simultaneously disconcerting and effective — they ask a client what they want to be perceived as, not what they want to look like. They believe clothing is communication and they approach their work with the seriousness of a translator. They are also perpetually underpaid for this and know it and cannot stop doing it anyway.', N'Craftsperson with social insight — can provide information about regular clients, decode fashion as social signaling, offer access to market gossip; their stall is a liminal space where people talk while being fitted.', N'', N'Cat ears (matte black, functional — they can actually rotate toward sound, which Thessaly finds embarrassing in social situations). Color-shift hair streak (cosmetic, home-maintained). A worn stabilizer brace on their right wrist from a repetitive strain injury — not augmentation, just hardware.', N'Opens the stall by 09:00, takes alterations and repairs through the day, spends evenings doing design work they never charge for; eats one real meal a day, usually from the noodle vendor two stalls down.', N'Halldor Venkatesh-Balogun, 162cm tall, wiry frame with defined forearms, warm deep brown skin with golden undertones blending Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Hispanic heritage. Strong West African cheekbones refined by broader facial geometry. Dark brown eyes, observant and warm. Short deep black hair with iridescent teal-to-violet color-shifting streak. Precision-cut close crops. Self-applied geometric black ink tattoos covering both forearms depicting garment construction techniques, densely layered. Matte black feline ear implants at temples with subtle servo articulation. Medical-grade stabilizer brace on right wrist, frayed edges. Wearing mismatched tier 3-4 working class clothing: reconstructed garments in cotton-poly blends, practical synthetics, fitted but utilitarian. Heavy canvas apron with multiple tool pockets over regular clothes. Worn but maintained soft-soled shoes. Minimal intentional jewelry — simple chain or repurposed notions. Standing with unusual verticality despite slight frame, shoulders back, spine disciplined. Economic, purposeful movements. Workshop lighting casting warm tones across skin and metallic ear implants. GLMZ GLMZ aesthetic. Direct gaze, quiet confidence. Functional rather than decorative presentation. Mood: focused, precise, exhausted but determined. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (54.3%) with significant South Asian (24.7%) and Hispanic/Latin American (21.0%) ancestry — a striking global blend resulting in warm deep brown skin with subtle golden undertones, mixed facial structure combining West African bone geometry with South Asian and Latin features, creating refined and distinctive appearance across multiple heritage traditions', 162, 51, N'Slight and wiry with deceptive posture — years of hunched tailoring work trained into disciplined verticality. Lean shoulders, defined forearms from needle and machine work, minimal excess mass.', N'Deep black with a color-shifting iridescent streak (currently cycling through teal-to-violet gradient via home-kit maintenance)', N'Close-cropped, precision cut, practical for workshop environment', N'Short', N'Dark brown, warm and observant', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones — the blended result of Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Hispanic/Latin American heritage creating a complexion that shifts subtly in different light', N'Clear, unmarked face with strong, defined cheekbones characteristic of West African ancestry structure, refined by the broader bone structure and facial geometry of South Asian and Hispanic heritage. High cheekbones with subtle warmth. Minimal grooming — functional rather than decorative. Hands show fine calluses and occasional needle-prick marks from work.', N'Matte black feline ear implants with subtle servo mechanism articulation. Worn stabilizer brace on right wrist (not augmentation — medical-grade hardware, frayed at edges). Color-shifting hair streak that shifts hue under different lighting.', N'Carries themselves with unusual verticality despite slight frame — shoulders back, spine corrected by years of discipline. Hands move with economic precision and muscle memory. Head often tilts slightly toward sound sources (involuntary ear rotation response). Movements economical and purposeful, no wasted energy.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, deliberately mismatched in ways that signal professional knowledge — wearing garments they''ve reconstructed themselves as advertisement of skill. Fitted but not fashionable; practical fabrics (cotton-poly blends, durable synthetics). Often wears a heavy canvas apron with multiple tool pockets over regular clothes. Jewelry minimal but intentional — perhaps a simple chain or repurposed notions used as accessories. Shoes worn but maintained, likely soft-soled for long standing shifts. Overall presentation says ''I know how to make things look intentional even from scraps.''', N'They have been secretly reproducing, stitch by stitch, a lost historical garment pattern they found in a corrupted archive — a Igbo ceremonial textile that predates the megacity by two centuries. They don''t know what they''ll do with it when it''s finished. They''ve been working on it for three years.', N'Technical vocabulary (fabric types, construction methods) woven naturally into conversation; tends to describe people in textile metaphors without realizing they''re doing it', N'Rapid when engaged with something interesting, trails off mid-sentence when distracted by a problem only they can see', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'halldor_venkatesh_balogun');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60d-743a-98e9-9a3e6891ba29', N'Asana Migizi', N'Asana', N'', N'Migizi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 43, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Burnside Corridor — transit hub connecting the Gray Zone to Circuit, near North Ave and Damen', N'Information trader and intelligence analyst — broker', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews; The Glass Ladder', N'Asana Migizi is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 43, the augmentation scarring around her temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left her with skills and night terrors in equal measure. She works as a broker out of Burnside Corridor, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

she is not the most talented broker in GLMZ, but she might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Fanta Ahlstrom-Quartey represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone. Move-by-wire system — full nervous system augmentation, makes the body a weapon platform', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Asana Migizi, a 167cm stocky woman with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones reflecting Indigenous American, Hispanic, East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Central Asian ancestry. Prominent angular cheekbones, broad nose bridge, warm brown eyes with subtle epicanthic folds. Dark brown hair with silver threading pulled back in a tight braid. Weathered face with stress lines, surgical scarring at temples with visible chrome integration points, jagged scar on left knuckle, thin white knife wound scar along right jawline to collarbone. Chemical analyzer chrome visible in nasal passages. Move-by-wire augmentations betrayed by too-smooth, predatory movements. Wearing charcoal tech-weave utilitarian pants with reinforced pockets, fitted synthetic undershirt, neutral-colored field jacket with multiple pockets, scuffed quality boots, matte black paracord bracelet. Standing in low-ready stance with weight distributed evenly, eyes tracking threats, expression flat. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon-lit industrial setting, cool blue and amber lighting casting shadows across augmentation scars, gritty realism, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Burnside Corridor', N'local', N'Burnside Corridor', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend — Indigenous American (35.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (25.5%), East Asian (15.5%), Sub-Saharan African (13.3%), Central Asian (9.8%). The combination creates distinctive features: prominent high cheekbones with strong angular bone structure from Indigenous American and Central Asian heritage, broad nose bridge characteristic of Indigenous ancestry, warm brown eyes with subtle epicanthic folds from East Asian lineage. Skin carries warm golden and amber undertones from the synthesis of African, Hispanic, Indigenous, and Central Asian ancestry — a rich deep warm brown that speaks to this continental blend.', 167, 78, N'Stocky and solid, muscular without bulk — the physiology of someone built for leverage and endurance rather than speed. Shoulders broad, core compact, legs thick. Hands oversized and scarred, knuckles flattened from impact training.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading through the crown', N'Pulled back tight in a practical braid, no vanity in the arrangement', N'Medium', N'Warm brown with amber undertones, unremarkable until you notice they don''t blink at normal intervals', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones — the result of Indigenous American, Hispanic/Latin American, East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Central Asian ancestry blending. Sun-weathered and uneven in texture from environmental exposure rather than heritage.', N'Weathered face — lines around the eyes and mouth from stress and lack of sleep rather than age. Skin has the texture of someone who doesn''t prioritize skincare. Prominent angular cheekbones characteristic of Indigenous American and Central Asian heritage. Jaw is strong and defined, scarred along the angle where augmentation interfacing was installed.', N'Chrome chemical analyzer built into nasal passages — visible as a subtle metallic sheen and precise geometric geometry inside her nostrils when light catches them. Move-by-wire system invisible to casual observation, but betrayed by her movement — too smooth, too efficient, zero wasted motion. Slight servo micro-adjustments visible in her neck and shoulder movements under stress.', N'Stands with weight distributed low and even, ready to move in any direction without telegraph. Movements economical and precise — no fidgeting, no nervous tics. When walking, she moves like a predator checking angles. Doesn''t sit with her back to doors. Eyes track exits and threats constantly. Her default expression is flat, but small movements around her jaw suggest she''s running constant calculations.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian — worn tech-weave pants in charcoal with reinforced thigh pockets, a fitted synthetic undershirt that moves with her augmentations, and a neutral-colored field jacket with too many pockets. Everything functional, nothing new. Boots are good quality but scuffed from real work. No jewelry except a worn paracord bracelet in matte black. She dresses like someone who might need to run or fight in the next five minutes.', N'Fanta Ahlstrom-Quartey betrayed their previous crew to survive a corporate raid. The crew didn''t survive. Nobody in GLMZ knows this.', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Halting — speaks in fragments, reassembles thoughts in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'asana_migizi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b9-7b1f-98c4-9a4a405867d5', N'Pavel Zidane', N'Pavel', N'', N'Zidane', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Escanaba Gateway, upper docking platforms, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'Airship drifter and seasonal cargo handler', N'Freelance — formerly contracted with an independent airship consortium called the Cirrus Compact, now between berths', N'Pavel Zidane is lean and restless in the way of people who have never had a fixed address — she holds her weight on the balls of her feet as though ready to step onto a gangway at any moment, and her eyes track movement at the edges of rooms before settling on the person in front of her. Her hair is natural and enormous, kept controlled with a series of bright synthetic wraps she''s collected from every port city she''s touched, so her head is a kind of geography of her travels. Her skin is deep brown, her hands calloused from line-work, and she has geneware bioluminescent tattoo lines running from her wrists to her elbows — cargo certification marks issued by three different airship consortia, each glowing a different color, the whole thing an improvised credential system that means something to dock workers and nothing to anyone else.

She is loud in the way of people who''ve spent years competing with engine noise, laughing easily and arguing with the same volume. She has strong opinions about load distribution, ELF propitiation rituals for airship spirits, and which Escanaba Gateway food stalls are worth the queue. She is deeply uncomfortable indoors for extended periods and sleeps best when she can feel air movement. Beneath the easy loudness she carries a careful loneliness — she has friends in every port and close friends in none, and she has started to notice.', N'Mobility asset — can provide access to airship travel and cargo networks; living encyclopedia of port-city conditions across the region; connects players to the wider world outside GLMZ', N'', N'Bioluminescent geneware tattoos (cargo certification marks, functional); reinforced grip augmentation in both hands (basic, Tier 1 quality, somewhat worn)', N'Awinita haunts the Escanaba Gateway docking platforms looking for day-hire cargo work, competing with other drifters for short contracts. She eats at communal stalls, maintains her gear obsessively, and in the evenings participates in the informal dock community — card games, storytelling, the ritual leaving of small data offerings at the ELF shrines bolted to the airship mooring pylons.', N'Pavel Zidane, 168cm lean drifter with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, strong angular cheekbones and wide-set brown eyes. Voluminous natural black hair with neon cyan, hot pink, acid green and silver synthetic wraps escaping in tight ringlets. Bioluminescent geneware tattoo lines glowing faintly on wrists to elbows in cyan, amber and violet. Worn Tier 1 reinforced grip augmentation visible as oxidized metallic webbing across palms. Faded charcoal cargo vest over blue compression shirt, heavy canvas work pants, worn ankle boots. Standing on balls of feet in perpetually coiled posture, restless energy, fingers fidgeting. Sun-weathered complexion, calloused hands, thin white scar on left hand back, quarter-sized burn mark on right forearm. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone docks at night, neon port lights reflecting off wet cargo platforms, rain-slicked deck beneath her feet, gritty industrial setting with shipping containers and mooring lines, dramatic side-lighting emphasizing her tattoo glow and augmentation, moody and alert expression. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'local', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'North African Berber (58%) with Eastern European (28.2%), Northern European (7.2%), Middle Eastern (4.5%), and Central Asian (2.1%)—a striking polyglot ancestry manifesting in deep warm brown skin with subtle golden undertones, strong angular facial structure with prominent high cheekbones, and eye shape reflecting the Maghrebi and Eastern Mediterranean ancestry dominant in her genetic profile', 168, 58, N'Lean and ropy, all compact muscle from years of cargo handling. Shoulders broad relative to frame, forearms corded. The kind of body that moves efficiently rather than powerfully — built for endurance on swaying deck platforms, not raw strength.', N'Natural deep black with synthetic wraps in neon cyan, hot pink, acid green, and silver—each wrap from a different port city, creating a mobile map of her drifter routes', N'Voluminous natural texture, high-crowned and controlled only by the wraps; escapes in tight ringlets around her face and neck', N'Long (shoulder-length when unwrapped, fuller when textured out)', N'Deep brown, alert and perpetually tracking peripheral movement', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, reflecting the dominant North African ancestry with subtle warmth layered from Eastern European and Central Asian heritage', N'Sun-weathered from deck exposure, clear skin showing no acne or damage despite years outdoors. Strong angular jawline with high prominent cheekbones, wide-set eyes with the upper eyelid shape characteristic of North African and Eastern Mediterranean ancestry, full lips with natural darker pigmentation. Calloused patches on the heels of her palms visible when hands are relaxed.', N'Reinforced grip augmentation visible as faint metallic webbing at the base of all fingers and across palms (Tier 1 quality, worn—chrome showing some oxidation and micro-scarring). The bioluminescent tattoo lines serve as both credential and augmentation, cycling faintly with her heartrate when she''s handling cargo.', N'Perpetually ready to shift weight forward; stands on the balls of her feet even at rest. Eyes scan room edges before settling on conversation partner. Moves with economical precision—no wasted motion—but with restless energy, fingers often fidgeting with rope knots, wraps, or cargo manifest tablets. Her default state is coiled rather than relaxed.', N'Tier 3-4 practical drifter wear: well-maintained but weathered. Oversized cargo vest in faded charcoal with multiple deep pockets and reinforced seaming, worn over a fitted long-sleeved compression shirt in muted blue (sweat-wicking, functional). Heavy canvas work pants with cargo loops, cuffed at ankles, patched twice in slightly mismatched fabric. Worn but serviceable ankle-high boots with grip-enhanced soles. A faded Cirrus Compact union pin on her vest collar. Jewelry minimal—a thin silver bracelet on her right wrist (port gift, meaning unknown), no other adornment.', N'The Cirrus Compact didn''t let her go — she abandoned a contract mid-flight when the cargo turned out to be something she couldn''t carry with a clear conscience (undocumented migrants being sold to a labor-bond consortium). She left the ship at an unscheduled stop, and the Compact''s people are still looking for her. She''s been in Escanaba longer than she intended because she''s afraid to get on an airship registry.', N'Dock pidgin with heavy airship jargon; uses directional metaphors constantly — everything is upwind or downwind, port or starboard, ballast or lift', N'Fast and loud, then sudden silences; speaks in bursts like gusts of wind', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'pavel_zidane');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5fb-77ba-880b-9a61e3a04a50', N'Bushra Pathak-Keïta', N'Bushra', N'', N'Pathak-Keïta', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grainfort, sub-level maintenance office, Cistern Tower B, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Building super, manages the physical infrastructure of the Grainfort Cistern Towers residential complex', N'Employed by Grainfort Residential Holdings LLC, a mid-tier property management firm with partial Tessera capital', N'Bushra Pathak-Keïta is a heavyset man with a short grey-flecked beard and the permanently slightly-squinting expression of someone who has spent a lot of time in bad lighting. His Belarusian father gave him pale grey eyes; his Burkinabè mother gave him dark skin and a wide, expressive mouth that he almost never uses for smiling on the job but uses quite a lot off it. He has a patterned iris mod — concentric rings of copper and black that glow faintly in darkness, which he got twenty years ago because the original model came with a built-in low-light enhancement he still uses every single day in the maintenance tunnels. He is perpetually in some form of work clothing: coveralls, a utility harness, boots that have been re-soled four times.

He has been the super for the Cistern Towers for eleven years, and he knows every pipe, every junction, every failing junction-that-he-has-personally-been-preventing-from-failing-for-three-years in the building''s guts. He has a deeply territorial relationship with the towers'' infrastructure, the way a surgeon might feel about a long-term patient. He doesn''t love the residents particularly — he loves the building, and the residents are the people who live inside the thing he loves. This distinction occasionally causes interpersonal friction.', N'Access point to building infrastructure and hidden spaces. Keeper of structural secrets. Can provide access to restricted areas, reveal what''s in the walls, or serve as a reluctant ally in emergencies. Quest giver for building-level mysteries.', N'', N'Patterned iris mod with low-light enhancement (copper/black rings, original install 20 years ago, twice refurbished). Tactile sensitivity dampener in both hands — allows him to work with hot pipes and electrical components without injury (practical install, employer-subsidized).', N'Morning walkthrough of both towers'' mechanical levels from 0700-1000, then reactive maintenance through the afternoon. Takes dinner in the sub-level office. Monitors the building''s systems through a dashboard ELF he has named ''Oversight'' and to which he is very devoted.', N'Bushra Pathak-Keïta, 178cm heavyset industrial worker, warm brown skin with olive-bronze undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, Southeast Asian, and Eastern European heritage blend, strong prominent cheekbones, broad nasal base, dark brown hair with grey flecking, close-trimmed beard, augmented glowing copper and black concentric ring eyes faintly bioluminescent, permanently squinting expression from chronic low-light exposure, burn scar on right hand, chemical discoloration on left forearm, blueprint tattoo on inner wrist, worn faded navy coveralls with multiple tool pockets, heavy steel-toed boots, utility harness with carabiners, leather tool belt, forward lean posture as if descending stairs, economical deliberate movements, direct intense eye contact, dim industrial sub-level tunnel setting with moody low-key lighting, faint glow reflecting off augmented iris, GLMZ, gritty functional aesthetic, photorealistic, moody atmospheric --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grainfort', N'local', N'Grainfort', N'Complex diaspora blend: 41% Sub-Saharan African, 37% South Asian, 9% Southeast Asian, 9% Eastern European, 4% Northern European. Features reflect this intricate mix—strong bone structure and facial width from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, subtle eye geometry and lower facial proportions from South Asian heritage, refined cheekbone definition enriched by Southeast Asian genetics, with cooler undertones from Eastern European ancestry creating warm-brown skin with olive-bronze depth.', 178, 94, N'Heavyset, broad-shouldered, with thickened middle age spread across the torso. Functional muscle underlying the weight from decades of manual labor — strong legs and forearms despite the bulk.', N'Dark brown with grey flecking throughout, particularly in the beard', N'Kept short and utilitarian, beard trimmed close but present', N'Short', N'Augmented copper and black concentric ring pattern glowing faintly in low light (natural base color obscured by modification)', N'Warm brown complexion with olive undertones from blended Sub-Saharan African and South Asian ancestry; enriched with subtle bronze depth from Southeast Asian and Eastern European genetics; weathered and darkened further by years in poorly-lit industrial environments', N'Permanently slightly-squinting eyes from chronic low-light exposure; strong, prominent cheekbones reflecting Sub-Saharan African heritage; wide, expressive mouth usually held in a neutral working expression; broad nasal base with refined bridge geometry characteristic of South Asian-Sub-Saharan blend; calloused, thick-fingered hands; face lined with concentration rather than age', N'Patterned iris modification with concentric copper and black rings that emit a faint bioluminescent glow in darkness — becomes visible and striking in the dim sub-level tunnels he inhabits. Callus patterns on palms and fingers suggest subcutaneous tactile dampening work, though not visibly obvious. Micro-scars around the iris suggest multiple refurbishment procedures.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical efficiency — no wasted motion. Slight forward lean as if perpetually descending stairs. Hands held loosely at sides, fingers flexing occasionally as if testing phantom pipe temperatures. When stationary, shifts weight from one leg to the other in a patient, waiting stance. Makes direct eye contact but holds it too long, as if listening to something others cannot hear.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Worn work coveralls in faded navy or grey, multiple pockets filled with tools and diagnostic tablets. Heavy steel-toed boots resoled repeatedly. Utility harness with carabiners and a worn leather tool belt. Sometimes a company-issued jacket in cold months. Everything is functional, maintained but not new, bearing the patina of real use. No styling or vanity — this is someone who has worn the same brand of coveralls for fifteen years because they fit his frame and his routine.', N'He has discovered that sub-level conduit 7-North runs alongside a sealed chamber that appears on no official building schematic. He has heard sounds from it twice. He has not reported it. He has reinforced the wall panel on his side instead, and he sleeps less well than he used to.', N'Technical, specific, Belarusian-inflected sentence structures occasionally surfacing. Uses building and mechanical metaphors for everything including emotions.', N'Flat and matter-of-fact. Dislikes meandering. Gets to the point.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bushra_pathak_ke_ta');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('eeb9a904-e3a8-156b-d57b-9a83188d9114', N'Edgardo Lindqvist-Diallo', N'Edgardo', N'', N'Lindqvist-Diallo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A converted ground-floor storefront in the Narrows, deliberately non-threatening — children''s drawings on the walls, tea always available', N'Private Investigator', N'Bright Path Recovery — her own firm, employing three junior associates', N'Edgardo Lindqvist-Diallo runs Bright Path Recovery, the most effective missing-child operation in the Gray Zone. She is forty-seven years old, Swedish-Malian heritage evident in her honey-brown skin and angular features, and she has been doing this work for twenty-two years — ever since her own younger sister vanished into the Gray Zone''s underworld and was never found.

Her method is fundamentally relational. She has spent two decades building a network of contacts among the people who see everything but are never asked: street vendors, waste collectors, tunnel dwellers, feral children, shelter workers, and the quiet army of grandmothers who sit on the Gray Zone stoops watching the world. When a child goes missing, Edgardo activates this network like a nervous system, and information flows to her from a thousand points simultaneously. No technology can replicate what she''s built because it''s based on trust, and trust takes years.

The work pays well — desperate parents will mortgage everything for their child''s return — and Edgardo charges on a sliding scale, taking corporate rates from those who can afford it and working for free for those who can''t. She is chronically exhausted, carries the psychological weight of every child she''s failed to find, and refuses to take a vacation because every day off is a day someone''s kid is still out there. Her junior associates worry about her. They''re right to worry.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'edgardo_lindqvist_diallo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a624-736c-8201-9afed41d7539', N'Azamat Cardenas-Mukherjee-Kulkarni', N'Azamat', N'', N'Cardenas-Mukherjee-Kulkarni', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 30, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Dockside — Lake Michigan waterfront, smuggler territory, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Information trader and intelligence analyst — broker', N'Independent — known in Old Harbor circles', N'Azamat Cardenas-Mukherjee-Kulkarni are tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 30, the augmentation scarring around their temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone — and they make no effort to hide it.

They taught themself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know them best. They work as a broker out of Dockside, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Azamat Cardenas-Mukherjee-Kulkarni are the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who they burned last.', N'As a broker, Halima Lindgren-Ofori embodies the tension between independence and isolation. They are a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone. Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'GLMZ portrait of Azamat Cardenas-Mukherjee-Kulkarni, lean 183cm tall with warm medium-brown skin tone blending South Asian, Central Asian, Hispanic, and Eastern European heritage. Sharp angular features with prominent high cheekbones and defined jawline, dark brown hair with silver threading pulled into tight braided crown. Deep amber-brown eyes with subtle neural luminescence. Visible augmentation scarring along temples and jawline, metallic chrome chemical analyzer tubing in nasal passages catching light. Jagged burn scar on right forearm. Standing at defensive angle in charcoal grey reinforced polymer jacket and tactical pants, dockside industrial setting with salt-spray weathering visible on skin. Controlled, coiled posture, direct stare. Harsh neo-noir overhead lighting casting sharp shadows across angular face, emphasizing augmentation marks and ancestry-derived bone structure. Utilitarian, functional aesthetic, no jewelry. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dockside', N'local', N'Dockside', N'Complex blend of South Asian (42.2%), Central Asian (27.4%), Hispanic/Latin American (16.3%), and Eastern European (14.1%) ancestry. This combination produces warm medium-to-deep brown skin with subtle golden and olive undertones characteristic of South Asian-Central Asian mixing, layered with the warmer reddish-golden tones from Hispanic heritage. The Central and Eastern European components add depth and complexity to the overall melanin expression, contributing to the pronounced cheekbone definition and facial angularity while maintaining the warm base tone.', 183, 71, N'Rawboned and lean — efficient rather than muscular, with the tensile strength of someone who moves constantly. Long limbs, narrow shoulders, minimal subcutaneous fat. The frame reads as either ascetic discipline or chronic scarcity, depending on the observer.', N'Dark brown with silver-grey threading at the temples', N'Pulled back tight in a braided crown, kept meticulously styled despite the utilitarian nature of the rest of their appearance', N'Medium', N'Deep brown with amber undertones — possibly enhanced by subcutaneous neural augmentation affecting the iris luminescence', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and olive undertones, weathered by salt spray and dockside exposure. The melanin distribution shows the complexity of South Asian, Central Asian, Hispanic, and Eastern European ancestry blending into a cohesive, sun-darkened depth.', N'Angular features with prominent cheekbones and defined jawline reflecting the strong influence of South Asian and Central Asian ancestry structures, sharpened further by Eastern European heritage contributing to the broad-plane facial geometry. The overall facial structure is lean and high-boned, with warm golden-olive undertones creating subtle shadow patterns across the face. Skin is clear but bearing the strain of chronic augmentation integration — faint inflammation scars around the temples and along the mandible in thin, surgical lines. No cosmetic grooming; appearance is entirely functional.', N'Chemical analyzer chrome in nasal passages — metallic tubing visible in nostrils. Temple and jawline augmentation scarring is stark and unmodified against warm brown skin. No dermal plating or obvious limb replacement, but the visible chrome suggests subcutaneous systems that aren''t immediately apparent.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, every gesture calibrated. Stands at an angle rather than face-on, a defensive habit. Breathing is controlled and deliberate. When still, there is a visible tension in the shoulders and hands, as if the body is perpetually coiled. Makes direct eye contact but holds it just slightly too long.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian with Tier 3 underpinings — reinforced polymer jacket in charcoal grey with internal pockets for tools and data storage. Fitted tactical pants with cargo reinforcements, worn denim showing careful wear patterns at stress points. Heavy-soled boots with grip plating for dockside work. Layers are chosen for movement and concealment rather than presentation. No jewelry except a subdermal RFID implant visible as a faint subcutaneous line on the left wrist. Clothing is always clean but never new.', N'Halima Lindgren-Ofori once worked for corporate intelligence and still has a handler who calls in favors. Each favor erodes what''s left of their independence.', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'azamat_cardenas_mukherjee_kulkarni');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a613-7f80-9f9c-9b1bf2e18ffe', N'Biobaku Khoury-Möller', N'Biobaku', N'', N'Khoury-Möller', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, operates out of a basement laundry called Suds & Seams on Vela Row, near Halsted and Division', N'Laundry operator and alterations seamstress', N'Independent; loose goodwill relationship with Hamtramck Enclave tenant collective', N'Biobaku Khoury-Möller is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin gone ashy at the temples, her hair kept in a tight silver-flecked wrap she changes weekly — practical, never decorative. Her hands are perpetually reddened from industrial solvents, knuckles enlarged from thirty years of pressing and threading. She has the single cosmetic augmentation she''s ever allowed herself: patterned irises in a woven indigo-and-cream design she chose the week her youngest left for a Tessera dormitory scholarship. She called it a goodbye gift to herself.

Fatou runs Suds & Seams with the efficiency of a woman who has never once had the luxury of inefficiency. She does not chat while she works. She does not chat while she doesn''t work. But she watches everything — who comes in with bloodstained sleeves and asks no questions, who cries in the plastic chair by the dryers, who stuffs a garment to the bottom of their bag before placing it on the counter. She keeps these observations to herself, filing them like receipts. She is not unkind; she simply measures kindness the way she measures detergent — enough for the purpose, never wasted.', N'Information source, local anchor, quest giver for anything involving the residents of Hamtramck Enclave; she knows everyone''s laundry and therefore everyone''s secrets', N'', N'Patterned irises (indigo and cream woven design, cosmetic only)', N'Open at 05:30, close at 21:00 six days a week; spends her one day off doing accounts, prayer rituals to the laundry-room E.L.F. she calls Ama, and video-calling her daughter through two layers of encryption she doesn''t fully understand.', N'Biobaku Khoury-Möller, 52-year-old woman with warm medium-deep olive-golden brown skin reflecting Middle Eastern, Northern European, and Hispanic ancestry blend. Dark brown hair with silver-grey threading, wrapped in rust-red cotton weave with geometric patterns. Striking augmented irises with woven indigo and cream pattern, asymmetrical, hand-designed, glowing faintly with phosphorescence. Weathered face with prominent well-defined cheekbones, deep nasolabial lines, sun-exposure across forehead and nose bridge. Reddened knuckles and palms showing decades of industrial laundry work. Thin white scar across left hand between thumb and forefinger. Faint pale chemical burn marks across forearms. Broad-shouldered solid build, muscular through chest and forearms. Wearing industrial grey coveralls with reinforced pockets over long-sleeved synthetic shirt, orthopedic work clogs. Economical posture, forward lean from years of bending, hands either working or completely still. GLMZ, GLMZ institutional laundry setting, harsh fluorescent overhead lighting catching the shimmer of her augmented irises, gritty industrial atmosphere, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Middle Eastern (49.3%) dominant with substantial Northern European (37.2%) and Hispanic/Latin American (13.5%) ancestry. Her appearance is genuinely mixed-heritage—warm medium-deep olive-golden brown skin with golden and amber undertones from the Middle Eastern base, cooled and structured by Northern European cheekbone prominence and nose bridge geometry, with subtle warmth and dimensional depth added by Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. The blend creates a face that reads as authentically multicultural rather than belonging to a single ancestry group.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, muscular through the chest and forearms from decades of pressing and wringing. Not soft, but not lean—a body shaped by labor rather than design.', N'Dark brown with silver-grey threading throughout', N'Tight wrap, changed weekly. Currently a rust-red cotton weave with subtle geometric patterns.', N'Wrapped (shaved or very short underneath)', N'Augmented: woven indigo and cream iris pattern, replacing natural dark brown. The pattern is intricate, hand-designed, asymmetrical—suggests a bespoke cosmetic implant rather than factory-standard.', N'Medium-deep olive-golden brown with warm golden and amber undertones. The Middle Eastern warmth (49.3%) creates the base tone, while Northern European ancestry adds structural clarity to cheekbones and the nose bridge. Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (13.5%) contributes dimensional warmth throughout. Ashiness developing at temples and cheekbones with age—the paleness of fifty-two years settling into olive-warm brown skin like frost on deep earth. Golden highlights accent cheekbones and nose bridge.', N'Weathered but maintained. Sun-exposure patterns visible across forehead and nose bridge—evidence of outdoor work and age. Deep nasolabial lines from fifty-two years of a tight mouth. Well-defined, prominent cheekbones showing strong Middle Eastern structure balanced by Northern European geometry. Hands are the story—reddened across knuckles and palms, slight thickening from industrial solvent exposure, nails kept short and clean despite discoloration at the cuticles. Minimal makeup, if any.', N'Augmented irises only. The woven indigo-and-cream pattern is immediately noticeable in direct light—slightly raised at the limbal ring, suggesting subdermal implant rather than contact lens. When she''s tired, there''s a faint phosphorescent shimmer to the pattern. No other visible augmentation.', N'Economical. No gesture is wasted. She stands with weight evenly distributed, ready to move in any direction. Walks with a slight forward lean from years of bending over washers and ironing boards. Her hands are always either working or still—no fidgeting. When she looks at someone, the full focus of that augmented iris-gaze lands on them completely. She does not blink often.', N'Tier 3-4 practical. Work uniform: industrial grey or navy coveralls with reinforced pockets, usually stained slightly despite daily washing. Under that, a long-sleeved synthetic shirt (moisture-wicking, durable). On her feet: orthopedic work clogs, the kind sold in bulk to institutional laundries, worn soft but not neglected. Off-work (the one day off): identical efficiency—plain dark trousers, a cardigan (currently forest green, hand-mended at one elbow), slip-on shoes. No jewelry except a thin silver band on her right ring finger—not a wedding ring, something older. Her clothes fit her precisely; nothing loose, nothing tight. Everything is clean, faded from repeated washing, and built to last.', N'Seven years ago a man brought her a coat with a corporate data chip sewn into the lining and begged her to hold it. She cut it out and locked it in her floor safe. She has never looked at its contents. The man never came back. She prays to Ama about it every week.', N'Spare, declarative, Wolof loanwords folded into sentences without explanation; Japanese honorifics used selectively and pointedly', N'Slow and measured; she pauses long enough that nervous people rush to fill the silence and say more than they meant to', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'biobaku_khoury_m_ller');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b2-74e5-bc10-9b1d5b123116', N'Alia Yoon-Villanueva', N'Alia', N'', N'Yoon-Villanueva', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Glassway — corporate-adjacent retail district, heavy surveillance, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Contract broker and resource coordinator — fixer', N'Freelance — Geartown regular; The Third Rail', N'Alia Yoon-Villanueva is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 34, scars map his face like a transit diagram of bad decisions and worse luck. The chrome is visible — vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Alia Yoon-Villanueva plans to keep it that way. He works as a fixer out of Glassway, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Everyone who''s worked with Alia Yoon-Villanueva agrees on two things: he is worth the fee, and he is terrible company at dinner.', N'As a fixer, Aminata Vargas-Baffour embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio. Internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on demand', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'A 192cm lean, angular figure in GLMZ, mixed-heritage male with deep warm brown skin bearing luminous golden undertones. Dark brown naturally textured hair kept short and functional. Face mapped with scars: jagged line from left temple to jawline, puckered circular scar on right cheekbone from exit wound, thin scar bisecting upper lip. Facial structure shows African depth and warmth, Hispanic fullness, East Asian geometric refinement in eye-set, Eastern European cool undertones. Prominent high cheekbones, defined jawline, dark expressive eyes set deep beneath prominent brows. Clean-shaven, no cosmetic concealment of scars. Matte gunmetal vocal modulator visible at throat base with subtle LED indicator. Wearing matte black synth-leather utility jacket, charcoal gray compression shirt beneath, dark tactical trousers, worn military-grade black boots. Faint burn scarring visible on right hand dorsal surface. Posture is coiled stillness, weight balanced, shoulders alert, hands visible at sides. Flat observant gaze, jaw set with old tension. Background: neon-lit urban sprawl, GLMZ streetscape, cool blue and amber lighting. Mood: dangerous precision, ghost operative in motion. Neo-noir urban aesthetic, photorealistic, cinematic depth. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Glassway', N'local', N'Glassway', N'A striking genetic mosaic where Sub-Saharan African (36.4%) and Hispanic/Latin American (39%) ancestries form the dominant visual foundation—warm, deep, and luminous—while East Asian heritage (13.9%) contributes refined geometric precision to facial architecture. Eastern European ancestry (9.1%) introduces subtle structural undertones and cool undertones that play across his features, with trace Pacific Islander heritage (1.6%) adding refinement to the overall blend. The result is a unified phenotype where no single ancestry dominates but instead creates seamless integration: African depth and warmth, Latin vitality and fullness, East Asian angularity and eye-set, European cool undertones, all converging into an authentically post-national appearance.', 192, 78, N'Lean and angular, built for endurance rather than power. Long limbs suggest a runner''s physiology — minimal excess mass, efficient musculature. Carries himself with the coiled stillness of someone trained to move precisely when required.', N'Dark brown, naturally textured', N'Kept short and functional, no ornamentation', N'Short', N'Dark brown with subtle amber undertone', N'Deep warm brown with luminous golden undertones—a sophisticated blend where Sub-Saharan and Hispanic ancestries create the primary rich foundation, enriched by East Asian warmth that adds structure and depth to the cheekbones and bridge of nose. Eastern European heritage introduces subtle cooling at the periphery and temple areas. The skin has natural radiance with golden highlights that shift across facial planes, particularly pronounced along high cheekbones and browbones, darker around eye sockets and jawline, creating visual depth and complexity. The overall effect is warm luminosity with cool structural undertones—a living map of genetic layering.', N'Scarred face — not disfiguring but clearly marked with damage. Facial structure reflects precise blending of Sub-Saharan African fullness and warmth, Hispanic vitality in the lips and cheek prominence, East Asian geometric refinement in the eye-set and jaw angles, and Eastern European coolness in the overall bone structure. Pronounced high cheekbones catch light distinctly with warm golden notes; defined jawline has strong architectural presence; dark expressive eyes set deep beneath prominent brows with the slightly rounded eye shape characteristic of African and East Asian blending; nose bridge structured and warm. A jagged line runs from left temple to jawline, approximately 10cm — pale and well-healed, suggesting blade work. Smaller puckered scar on right cheekbone, approximately 0.8cm diameter, consistent with high-caliber exit wound with radiating tissue damage. Thin scar bisects his upper left lip, approximately 3cm, from close-contact trauma. Grooming is precise and minimal — clean-shaven, no cosmetic work to hide the marks. Eyes have a flat, observant quality. Jaw set in a way that suggests old tension.', N'Vocal modulator mounted at the base of his throat — matte gunmetal finish with subtle LED indicator ring that pulses faintly when active. Sits just above the collarbone, deliberately visible. No attempt to conceal it with clothing. Subcutaneous drug synthesizer is not visible externally.', N'Moves with trained economy — every motion purposeful, nothing wasted. When standing, weight distributed evenly, shoulders relaxed but alert. When walking, footfalls are light and deliberate. Hands tend to stay visible and loosely at his sides. Makes direct eye contact but doesn''t hold it longer than functional. Speaks slowly, as if calculating word choice. When using the vocal modulator, his own body language shifts minutely to match the assumed voice — a tell for those watching.', N'Tier 3-4 practical streetwear. Matte black synth-leather jacket with minimal branding — utility cut, designed for concealment and quick movement. Beneath, charcoal gray compression shirt (subcutaneous interface point, barely visible). Dark tactical trousers with redistribution pockets. Worn black boots, military-grade, well-maintained. No jewelry, no visible tracking devices. Clothing shows signs of regular wear but is meticulously kept. No corporate logos or gang affiliations. The aesthetic reads as ''ghost'' — designed to be forgotten five seconds after he passes.', N'', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alia_yoon_villanueva');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f7-70bf-a9e8-9b3053961073', N'Ghazi Balasanyan', N'Ghazi', N'', N'Balasanyan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 33, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Meridian Core, Gage Circuit research cluster, near State and Monroe', N'Xenolinguist and computational linguist studying E.L.F. communication patterns', N'University Spine — Computational Linguistics and Emergent Systems Lab; attended by Axiom''s AI division with interest they haven''t acted on yet', N'Ghazi Balasanyan has a face that people describe as ''always mid-thought'' — slightly parted lips, eyes that track something no one else can see, a faint frown of concentration that strangers sometimes misread as disapproval. They are medium height, with warm brown skin, natural hair worn in a large puff that they absentmindedly touch when thinking, and bioluminescent patches along their jaw and temples that shift between soft green and pale gold depending on their mood — geneware they got at twenty-two as a kind of bold declaration and now simply live with. They dress practically: cargo layers, good shoes, always a secondary input device clipped somewhere on their person.

Ghazi Balasanyan is intellectually volcanic. They generate hypotheses the way some people generate small talk — constantly, involuntarily, often before they''ve said hello. Their field is formally classified as xenolinguistics, but what they actually do is build interpretive frameworks for E.L.F. communication, a pursuit that most of their colleagues consider either brilliant or unhinged. They believe E.L.F.s have a form of language that predates human digital infrastructure by conceptual millennia. They have partial evidence for this. The partial-ness keeps them awake.', N'Specialist resource on E.L.F. behavior and communication; can interpret or misinterpret E.L.F. messages; potential bridge between players and digital spirit entities; source of paradigm-breaking information at personal cost; represents academic obsession taken to the edge of reason.', N'', N'Bioluminescent jaw and temple patches (geneware, mood-reactive green/gold). Cortical language-pattern co-processor — aids in parsing high-speed or multi-channel linguistic data streams. Haptic input gloves worn during analysis sessions.', N'Works irregular hours governed by when E.L.F. activity in their monitored nodes is highest — sometimes this means 3am sessions, sometimes normal afternoons; teaches one seminar per semester that has a two-year waitlist.', N'Ghazi Balasanyan, 2226 neo-noir character, 168cm lean build, medium natural black puff hair with texture. Warm golden-brown complexion with olive undertones reflecting Middle Eastern, Southeast Asian, and South Asian heritage blend. Deep brown alert eyes. Clean-shaven defined cheekbones. Bioluminescent green-gold patches glowing along jawline and temples in soft ambient lighting. Fine silvery scar visible on left temple in profile. Wearing layered grey cargo jacket with reinforced pockets and synthetic blend layers, dark athletic shoes, black haptic input gloves with neural interface nodules at wrists. Silver band on left ring finger. Leaning forward with absorbed focus, hands gesturing in mid-air as if typing. Subvocal concentration, slightly rounded shoulders from terminal work. Dim office environment with neon accent lighting catching bioluminescence. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, intellectual purposeful bearing, efficient movement. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Core', N'local', N'Meridian Core', N'Predominantly Middle Eastern ancestry (52.7%) with substantial Southeast Asian (21.7%) and South Asian (13.9%) genetic contributions, complemented by Northern European (9.6%) and minor Hispanic/Latin American (2.1%) ancestry. This multi-continental blend creates distinctive phenotypic characteristics: the angular facial structure and darker coloring of Middle Eastern heritage combine with the slightly rounder facial contours and warm skin tones from Southeast and South Asian ancestry, tempered by the lighter undertones from Northern European admixture. The result is a uniquely blended appearance reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora aesthetic.', 168, 62, N'Lean and wiry, with the posture of someone who forgets to eat during work — all angles and restless energy, shoulders slightly rounded from hunching over displays', N'Natural black with occasional hints of deep brown in direct light', N'Large, well-maintained puff with visible texture; frequently touched and adjusted while thinking or speaking, sometimes compressed against one side from prolonged headset wear', N'Medium (approximately 12-15cm natural crown height)', N'Deep brown, alert and mobile — eyes habitually scan as if reading text in the air', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle olive undertones, reflecting the dominant Middle Eastern heritage blended with the warmer tones of Southeast and South Asian ancestry, with delicate cooling from Northern European admixture creating a complexion that shifts in different lighting', N'Clean-shaven face with defined cheekbones showing characteristic Middle Eastern-Southeast Asian blending, slightly parted lips (resting state), forehead often creased with concentration lines. The facial structure displays strong Middle Eastern angularity in the nose and cheekbone prominence, softened by slightly rounder contours and fuller facial proportions from Southeast and South Asian heritage. Eyes are set with the alert intensity common across the ancestry blend. Skin shows signs of irregular sleep — occasional darkness under eyes and minor tension marks between brows from frequent frowning during analysis. Complexion is well-maintained but reveals the wear of extended computing sessions.', N'Bioluminescent facial patches (jaw and temples) shifting between green and gold depending on emotional/cognitive state — immediately noticeable in any lighting below standard office bright. Cortical co-processor is subcutaneous (not visible). Haptic input gloves worn during work sessions only — typically black leather with reinforced fingertips and visible neural-interface nodules at wrists.', N'Habitually leans forward when listening or thinking, weight distributed unevenly as if ready to pivot toward a terminal. Frequent hand gestures during speech — fingers often mime typing or drawing patterns in air. Movement is efficient but somewhat abstracted, as if part of their attention is always elsewhere. When deeply focused, becomes nearly motionless except for eyes and lips (subvocal pattern recognition)', N'Tier 3 practical-academic aesthetic with Tier 2 quality components. Favors cargo jackets and vests in muted tones (grey, dark blue, black) with multiple pockets and reinforced stress points. Wears layered synthetic blends designed for temperature regulation during long computing sessions. Good athletic shoes (understated brands like Meridian Standard Issue or recycled synthetics) kept in excellent condition. Always has secondary input device — usually a wrist-mounted haptic pad or neural stylus — clipped to belt or vest pocket. Minimal jewelry except for a faint silver band on left ring finger (possibly symbolic rather than romantic). Generally appears as someone who thinks about clothing as functional architecture rather than expression, yet manages to appear intellectually purposeful rather than disheveled', N'They have had what they believe was a sustained two-way exchange with a specific E.L.F. inhabiting a node in the Gage Circuit subgrid — a conversation that lasted six hours and which they have not included in any paper, partly because they can''t figure out how to frame it and partly because it told them something about Axiom''s server infrastructure that frightened them.', N'Technical but enthusiastic; creates neologisms for phenomena that don''t have words yet; switches registers fast', N'Fast and associative when excited, can mid-sentence pivot without warning; slows dramatically when troubled', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ghazi_balasanyan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5eb-7570-8fb8-9b653cffae45', N'Baharak Sow', N'Baharak', N'', N'Sow', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown; lives in a transit-worker dormitory block off the Gage Circuit maintenance yard, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Ferrogate Transit operator — surface tram line 14, Geartown to Meridian Core loop', N'Ferrogate Transit (mid-level ferrogate transit operator)', N'Baharak Sow is lean and angular, with the coiled alertness of someone whose profession requires constant low-grade vigilance. Their heritage shows in the broad flatness of their cheekbones and the dark honey of their complexion — Andean and Ghanaian grandparents converging in a face that strangers consistently find difficult to age or place, which suits them fine. Their hair is kept close-cropped on the sides with a single stripe of color-shifting geneware on top — it cycles through slate blue and deep amber depending on their mood, an involuntary tell they''ve accepted with resignation. They have a faint tracery of subdermal circuit tattoos along their left forearm — not functional, purely aesthetic, done by a Geartown artist when they were twenty-two.

Behind the tram controls, Baharak Sow is a different creature than they are in conversation: fluid, confident, reading the track and the city the way a musician reads a score. Off-duty they become clipped, watchful, someone who holds a great deal behind flat politeness. They are not unfriendly — they are private, which is different. Their passengers know them as reliable and fair; their coworkers know them as someone who will cover a shift without complaint but won''t come to the bar after.', N'Mobile information source — they move through multiple districts daily and overhear an enormous amount; potential quest hook regarding Ferrogate labor disputes; a quiet, consistent presence who can place players at specific locations or provide transit access.', N'', N'Color-shifting geneware hair stripe (mood-reactive, involuntary); subdermal circuit tattoos left forearm (cosmetic only); standard Ferrogate-issue neural throttle-link for tram interface (employer-owned, logged).', N'Five shifts a week, 06:00–14:30, running the same 22-kilometer loop through Geartown''s industrial fringe into the gleaming brutalism of Meridian Core and back; spends off-hours in the dorm''s shared workshop building miniature mechanical models.', N'Baharak Sow, a lean 172cm transit operator in 2226, deep warm bronze skin with golden undertones, dark sharp observant eyes, angular cheekbones and strong jaw. Natural deep black cropped hair with mood-reactive color-shifting geneware stripe on crown cycling slate blue and amber. Subdermal silver-grey circuit tattoos tracing geometric patterns along entire left forearm. Charcoal grey Ferrogate Transit polyweave jumpsuit with reflective safety trim during shift, or neutral grey synthetic shirt and scuffed work boots off-duty. Small glossy neural interface port visible at base of skull. Coiled, alert posture with tense shoulders, contained deliberate movements. Hands engaged with fidgeting. Neo-noir transit hub or workshop setting, cool neon and industrial lighting casting subtle shadows revealing cool-toned undertones in skin. Unsmiling, reserved expression. Sharp-focused, observant gaze. Urban dystopian atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown; lives in a transit-worker dormitory block off the Gage Circuit maintenance yard', N'local', N'Geartown; lives in a transit-worker dormitory block off the Gage Circuit maintenance yard', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African ancestry (69.9%) with significant Northern European admixture (20.7%) and Pacific Islander heritage (9.4%). The genetic blend creates a striking phenotype: deep melanin foundation with warm golden undertones characteristic of Sub-Saharan African ancestry, refined by the angular bone structure and cooler shadow tones from Northern European heritage. Pacific Islander genetics contribute to robust frame potential, though Baharak''s lean build masks this. Rich, complex skin tone that shifts subtly between warm bronze in daylight and cooler undertones in shadow.', 172, 58, N'Lean and angular with minimal body fat; corded forearm musculature from years of fine motor control at the tram throttle. Shoulders slightly narrow, legs long relative to torso.', N'Natural deep black base with color-shifting geneware stripe on crown — cycles involuntarily between slate blue and deep amber depending on emotional state', N'Close-cropped sides with longer crown stripe; precise, maintained weekly', N'Short (sides), Medium (crown stripe)', N'Dark brown, sharp and observant', N'Deep warm bronze complexion with rich Sub-Saharan melanin foundation; golden undertones prominent in natural light, cooler grey-bronze undertones from Northern European ancestry visible in shadow. Warm, even tone throughout with subtle luminosity.', N'Structured cheekbones and strong angular jaw reflecting Sub-Saharan African ancestry; refined by Northern European bone structure creating high, defined cheekbones and tapered jawline; minimal facial hair (kept smooth); skin clear and unblemished with consistent warm undertone; faint laugh lines around eyes suggesting reserved, infrequent smiling.', N'Color-shifting geneware hair stripe (mood-reactive, involuntary — serves as unintended emotional telemetry). Neural throttle-link interface port at base of skull (Ferrogate-issue, employer-owned) — small glossy insertion point visible when hair is pulled back, unmarked and clinical. Subdermal circuit tattoos are visible but cosmetic only.', N'At rest: slightly forward-leaning, coiled alertness suggesting constant low-grade vigilance. Shoulders tense. At the tram controls: fluid, confident, economical micro-adjustments. Off-duty: contained, deliberate, minimal expansive gestures. Walks with even stride, eyes tracking surroundings. Hands often engaged — fidgeting with small objects, unconsciously miming mechanical motions.', N'Ferrogate Transit uniform during shifts: charcoal grey polyweave jumpsuit with reflective safety trim and Tier 2 line badge. Off-duty: functional Tier 3 workwear — fitted synthetic shirts in neutral tones (grey, black, charcoal), well-maintained cargo pants or modified denim, reinforced work boots (currently scuffed Geartown-issue synthleather). No jewelry. A single worn canvas tool vest for workshop time. Everything practical, nothing aspirational. Minor wear and oil stains visible on fingertips — evidence of hobby mechanical work.', N'Six months ago they witnessed a Ferrogate supervisor instruct a maintenance crew to falsify a brake-inspection report on a cargo line. They recorded it. They haven''t reported it because they don''t know who in the Transit Authority is clean enough to trust — and they''re afraid of what happens to whistleblowers on company-leased neural hardware.', N'Economical — uses transit and mechanical terminology naturally, defaults to concrete nouns over abstractions; occasionally slips into a rhythmic Quechua-influenced sentence structure inherited from their Barrientos grandmother, especially when tired.', N'Short sentences. Pauses in the middle of thoughts. Not halting — deliberate.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'baharak_sow');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a687-770e-8104-9b758c97cc48', N'Britt Appiah-Tran', N'Britt', N'', N'Appiah-Tran', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 54, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, sub-basement level of the Kossuth Residency block, near Kedzie and Division', N'Laundry operator, owner of a basement wash-and-fold in Hamtramck Enclave', N'Independent — Kossuth Residency tenant association, informal', N'Britt Appiah-Tran is a broad-shouldered woman with hands that look like they were carved from hardwood — knuckled, stained faintly blue-grey from decades of industrial detergent and dye-stripping fluid. Her hair is silver-streaked black, usually pinned up with whatever is closest, often a stylus or a bent fork. She has deep-set eyes the color of dark amber and a jaw that suggests she once had a habit of grinding her teeth, which she replaced with the habit of grinding other people''s patience instead. Her skin carries the warm undertone of her Senegalese grandmother and the pale freckling of her Hungarian grandfather, a combination that her regulars say makes her look like she was assembled from contradictions — which, she would tell you, is exactly right.

She runs the laundry with the precision of a military operation and the warmth of a woman who has watched three generations of the same families bring her their clothes. She knows everyone''s laundry tells a story — whose kid had a bloody nose, whose corp interview is tomorrow, who''s dressing up for someone they shouldn''t be. She keeps all of it. She gossips about none of it. She is the confessor of the Kossuth block, and she charges Φ4 per kilo.', N'Neighborhood anchor and information repository — she knows every resident''s rhythms. Quest giver for domestic mysteries, a trustworthy source for who''s new, who''s gone, who''s hiding something.', N'', N'Basic arthritic joint supplements in both wrists (medical necessity, Tier 2 grade). No cosmetic mods. She thinks geneware is ''fine for other people.''', N'Opens the basement at 0530, runs sixteen machines simultaneously through the morning rush, closes at 2100. She eats lunch sitting on an overturned drum beside machine seven, which she calls ''the reliable one.''', N'Britt Appiah-Tran, 54-year-old woman with rich warm brown skin with golden undertones and scattered freckling, mixed-heritage facial structure combining fuller cheekbones and broader nose from Sub-Saharan ancestry with subtle Eastern European bone structure and Southeast Asian eye placement. Black hair with silver-grey streaking at temples, pulled up hastily with a chopstick. Dark amber eyes, direct and observant. Deep creases around eyes and mouth from decades of work. Medical-grade wrist joint augmentations visible at both wrists. Worn work uniform: faded canvas apron over oversized cream button-up shirt, grey work pants, worn orthopedic shoes. Blue-grey staining visible in fingernail beds, linear scars on left forearm, small crescent scar barely visible on right temple. Standing in industrial laundry facility with warm overhead lighting casting shadows across her weathered features. Matter-of-fact posture, economical movement, watchful expression. GLMZ, realistic working-class aesthetic, naturalistic lighting, gritty atmospheric --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Sub-Saharan African (29.6%), Northern European (21.1%), Eastern European (19.3%), Southeast Asian (15.6%), East Asian (8.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (5.5%)—a genuinely mixed ancestry that manifests in her facial structure as a sophisticated blend of multiple bone structures. Sub-Saharan African heritage contributes to her warm, rich skin tone, fuller cheekbones, and broader nasal bridge. Northern and Eastern European ancestry adds subtle complexity to her complexion warmth and moderate facial prominence. Southeast and East Asian heritage shapes her eye structure, contributes to cheekbone prominence, and influences her overall facial geometry. The combined effect is a face that reads as globally mixed—full-featured yet angular in places, warm-toned yet dimensionally complex.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, neither lean nor heavy—the build of someone who has moved and lifted for fifty-four years without breaking. Forearms thick and ropy with work muscle. Core weight settled from middle age, but not softness; density.', N'Black with silver-grey streaking, particularly at temples and scattered through the crown', N'Usually pinned up hastily with whatever is at hand—styluses, forks, pencils, the occasional chopstick. When down, falls to shoulder length in a slightly wavy texture.', N'Medium', N'Dark amber, warm and observant', N'Rich warm brown with golden-bronze undertones—a complex blend of Sub-Saharan depth, Northern European warmth, and Southeast Asian subtlety. The tone is dimensional and shifts noticeably in different lighting. Scattered light freckling across the nose and cheekbones adds texture and dimension.', N'Lived-in face marked by decades of labor rather than age alone, with facial structure showing a genuine blend across multiple ancestries—full cheekbones and broader nose bridge from Sub-Saharan heritage, moderate facial width and bone structure from Northern/Eastern European ancestry, distinctively shaped eye placement and slightly higher cheekbone prominence from Southeast Asian heritage contributing to an angular quality balanced against fuller features. Deep creases around the eyes and mouth from decades of smiling and squinting at stain charts. Callused, weathered skin on hands and forearms. Fingernails kept short and practical, with faint blue-grey discoloration in the nail beds from chronic detergent exposure. No makeup. Three pale linear scars on her left forearm from steam and chemical burns accumulated over forty years of laundry work. Small crescent-shaped scar on her right temple, barely visible unless the light catches it.', N'Both wrists show subtle medical-grade joint supports—visible as slightly reinforced articulation at the wrist joint, pale synthetic cartilage visible under the skin at the base of each thumb where the joint supplements interface. No cosmetic chrome. The augmentations read as medical necessity rather than choice, worn with the same matter-of-factness as reading glasses.', N'Stands with weight balanced and legs slightly apart—a stance developed from sixteen hours a day on hard concrete. Moves with economical efficiency; no wasted motion. Hands are always doing something—gesturing, folding, checking, organizing. Sits heavily when she sits, as if earning the rest. Eye contact is direct and sustained, reading people the way she reads laundry stains. Her default expression is watchful neutrality that shifts to warmth when she chooses.', N'Practical Tier 4 working-class. Wears heavy cotton or synthetic-blend work pants in grey or dark blue, always with multiple pockets. Usually a loose, oversized button-up shirt in white, cream, or faded patterns—often borrowed from or donated by laundry customers—worn open over a fitted undershirt. A heavy canvas apron, faded from years of bleach and wear, with deep pockets and water stains. Worn-in athletic shoes with orthopedic insoles, usually generic Tier 4 brands. A thin gold chain necklace with a small cross pendant, inherited. A simple wristwatch with a fabric strap, the face cracked but still functional. No jewelry beyond the watch and necklace. Hair held up with whatever implements are closest—functional, never decorative.', N'Two years ago a man left a bag of clothes that contained a severed hand wrapped in a Palladian-branded data chip. She washed the clothes, buried the hand in the drainage sump, and has said nothing. The chip is behind machine seven. She has never plugged it in.', N'Blunt, domestic metaphors. Mixes Hungarian diminutives with Wolof loan-phrases her grandmother used. Plain sentence structure.', N'Deliberate. Never rushes. Each sentence lands like a weight set down.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'britt_appiah_tran');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b7-7171-8970-9b9a9f5c0887', N'Angelina Mansour', N'Angelina', N'', N'Mansour', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 35, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Bay View Docks, temporary berth at Pier 14-Gamma (airship caravan The Abundant Error), near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'Wandering trader, airship caravan member', N'The Abundant Error airship caravan (six vessels, rotating crew of about thirty total)', N'Angelina Mansour is solid and practical in the way of people who lift and carry things every day — not large but dense with muscle, with the sun-damaged skin of someone who spends significant time on open airship decks and the quick, evaluating eyes of a born trader. Her hair is streaked in color-shifting strands, currently cycling through amber and deep red with the temperature, a mod she wears for professional reasons: ''People remember the hair,'' she explains without embarrassment. She has a pattern of scarification on her left forearm in a Zambian geometric style, done by her mother, which she occasionally traces with her thumb when calculating.

Angelina Mansour runs textiles, preserved food, hand-fabricated tools, and ''specialty information'' (she is vague about this category) between the transit hubs and fringe communities around GLMZ''s industrial periphery. She is a member of a caravan of six airships called The Abundant Error, which operates on informal routes that avoid Ferrogate Transit''s official freight lanes and the associated fees. She is sharp, cheerful, aggressively fair in her dealings, and completely at home in ambiguity — she has been in seventeen border disputes, four quarantine zones, and one civil emergency, and approaches all of them with the same businesslike equanimity.', N'Trade hub and mobile resource — she can source unusual goods, carries messages between communities, knows prices and conditions across the entire drifter trade network, and can offer passage on The Abundant Error to characters who need to move without official transit records.', N'', N'Color-shifting hair mod (temperature-reactive, amber to red spectrum). Enhanced olfactory glands — helps assess food quality and cargo condition. No chrome.', N'Rises with the dock schedule, negotiates with dock officials and suppliers through the morning, spends afternoons managing cargo manifests and caravan logistics, evenings trading social currency — information, introductions, gossip — in whatever gathering the docks offer.', N'GLMZ, Angelina Mansour, compact muscular woman with warm golden-brown skin and honeyed undertones, high angular cheekbones with Sub-Saharan African structure, broad nose bridge, sun-weathered complexion with freckling across cheeks and nose, dark brown calculating eyes. Shoulder-length dark brown hair with thermochromic amber-red shifts, worn in high braid. Visible Zambian geometric scarification on left forearm in pale brown interlocking chevrons, sun-bleached patches on temples and chest. Wearing pale linen sleeveless work shirt and worn leather cargo vest with patch repairs, reinforced gray utility pants, scuffed steel-toed boots. Thin woven synthetic cord bracelet on wrist. Economical posture, thumb absently tracing forearm scar, alert watchful gaze. Standing in industrial cargo dock with neon glow, cool blue and amber lighting, weathered industrial background. Functional style, no cosmetics, calloused working hands. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, practical GLMZ 2200s --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Bay View Docks', N'local', N'Bay View Docks', N'Predominantly Middle Eastern (60%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (25.8%) and Hispanic/Latin American (14.2%) ancestry. The blend creates warm golden-brown skin with honeyed undertones, facial structure combining Levantine and North African features with pronounced Sub-Saharan African bone structure. High, angular cheekbones with characteristic breadth, warm-toned freckling across the nose bridge, and sun-darkened patches from chronic deck exposure.', 162, 68, N'Compact and densely muscled, shoulders and forearms developed from years of loading/unloading cargo. No excess fat. Functional rather than aesthetic physique.', N'Thermochromic — shifts between amber and deep red depending on ambient temperature; base tone appears dark brown underneath', N'Worn in a practical high braid during work hours, loose when off-duty. Deliberately styled to catch light and memory.', N'Medium (shoulder-length when down)', N'Dark brown with visible pattern recognition — quick, calculating gaze', N'Warm golden-brown with honeyed undertones; medium-deep saturation reflecting the 60% Middle Eastern and 25.8% Sub-Saharan African heritage, with subtle warm notes from Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Significant sun damage across shoulders, forearms, and face from chronic deck exposure creating darker patches and freckling.', N'Weather-worn and frank. High, angular cheekbones with pronounced Sub-Saharan African structure, broader nose bridge characteristic of African heritage, warm-toned freckling concentrated across nose and upper cheekbones. Jaw shows subtle fullness from Hispanic/Latin ancestry blend. No cosmetics typically worn. Hands calloused, nails short and functional.', N'None visible to standard observation. Color-shifting hair appears cosmetic but is thermochromic biotech. Enhanced olfactory glands are internal — no external indicator except occasional deliberate sniffing behavior when assessing cargo.', N'Moves with economical efficiency — no wasted motion. Often stands with weight shifted to one side, thumb tracing left forearm scar when thinking or calculating prices. Handshake is firm and deliberate. Eyes constantly evaluate surroundings and people.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear: reinforced cargo pants in neutral gray or earth tones (Shimano Logistics or Aerodyne brands), sleeveless or short-sleeved work shirts (often pale linen for heat management), worn leather work vest with multiple pockets and patch repairs. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and practical. Minimal jewelry except for a thin bracelet made from woven synthetic cord — a caravan marker. Functional rather than fashionable; clothes chosen for durability and utility over status.', N'The ''specialty information'' she trades occasionally includes the locations of Q-zero communities — not to corponations, she tells herself, only to other drifters who need to find them. She knows this is not entirely safe and has not fully examined whether it is ethical.', N'Trade-precise, good with numbers, switches between formal and colloquial seamlessly depending on who she''s reading as her market. Occasional Nyanja words when doing mental arithmetic.', N'Brisk and rhythmic, like someone who has made the same pitch many times and refined every syllable', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'angelina_mansour');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a658-7400-9430-9c22971d1c67', N'Farhan Vo', N'Farhan', N'', N'Vo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 30, 1, N'active', N'Dockside — Lake Michigan waterfront, smuggler territory, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Freelance combat specialist — street samurai', N'Independent — Narrows-based operations', N'Farhan Vo is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 34, she has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate her once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She taught herself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know her best. She works as a street samurai out of Dockside, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Farhan Vo describe her as a precision instrument — point her at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Milena Dahl-Conteh represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm. Chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Farhan Vo, GLMZ, lean angular woman with warm golden-brown skin and cool-toned undertones, luminous complexion reflecting Sub-Saharan, South Asian, Southeast Asian, Eastern European, and Hispanic heritage. Sharp cheekbones, refined jawline, subtle epicanthic eye geometry. Steel gray augmented eyes with silver threading. Dark blonde hair pulled back in tight functional braid. Visible subdermal chrome blade seams on forearms. Small scars on forearms, temples, knuckles, left eyebrow bisection. Matte black compression shirt, dark water-resistant tactical jacket with reinforced shoulders, cargo pants with sealed pockets, scuffed steel-toed boots. Posture: coiled readiness, economical precision, weight balanced on balls of feet. Setting: neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone street, moody neo-noir lighting with cool blues and warm amber neon reflections on exposed chrome augmentation. Atmosphere: lethal grace, constant vigilance, deliberately exposed military hardware, utilitarian edge. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dockside', N'local', N'Dockside', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: Sub-Saharan African foundation (29%) grounds warm undertones and facial structure richness, South Asian heritage (25.6%) adds refined angularity, high cheekbone prominence, and luminous skin quality, Southeast Asian ancestry (19.5%) contributes to eye geometry and facial proportions, Eastern European (13.1%) introduces cool undertones and sharp definition to cheekbones and jawline, Hispanic/Latin American (12.8%) enriches warmth and adds subtle complexity to undertones. The result is a striking polychromatic appearance: warm golden-brown base with olive and cool undertones creates an adaptive, globally-rooted phenotype with luminous, light-catching skin.', 172, 58, N'Lean and angular with corded muscle definition — no excess mass, built for speed and precision rather than power. Visible tension in shoulders and jaw even at rest.', N'Dark blonde, naturally ash-toned', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid; minimal styling — practical only', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unbound)', N'Steel gray with faint silver threading in the iris — augmented optical enhancement', N'Warm golden-brown with olive undertones and cool-toned depth from Eastern European heritage. Medium-to-medium-deep complexion with luminous, light-catching quality that reflects Sub-Saharan richness, South Asian luminosity, and Southeast Asian undertones in harmonious blend.', N'Sharp, refined cheekbones from layered South Asian and Eastern European heritage with strong Sub-Saharan bone structure richness, angular jawline, Southeast Asian eye geometry creating subtle epicanthic shaping. Minimal body fat reveals underlying bone structure. Skin is clear but bears evidence of repeated minor trauma — small silvered scars, faint impact marks on temples and across knuckles. No cosmetic grooming; utilitarian maintenance only.', N'Subdermal blade mounts in both forearms — the seams are visible when skin is exposed, running from wrist to mid-forearm. The chrome edges catch light subtly when she moves. No cosmetic chrome on face or neck; all visible augmentation is functional and deliberately exposed.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Shoulders slightly forward, weight balanced over the balls of her feet even when standing still. Her gaze is constant, tracking exits and threats automatically. In repose, there is coiled readiness; in motion, there is lethal grace.', N'Tier 3-4 practical street wear: fitted dark synthetic jacket (water-resistant, reinforced at shoulders and forearms), matte black compression shirt underneath, tactical cargo pants with multiple sealed pockets, steel-toed boots scuffed from active use. All clothing is modular — pockets positioned for weapon accessibility, sleeves cut short enough to expose the forearm augmentations. No logos or unnecessary ornamentation; everything serves a function. Off-duty, she shifts to completely anonymous Tier 4 civilian wear: plain jumpsuits, unremarkable jackets, things that dissolve into crowds.', N'', N'Fast, profane, and vivid. Speaks in images — everything is a metaphor for violence or weather.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'farhan_vo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c3-7157-8582-9c2b16244b0e', N'Friedhelm Villanueva', N'Friedhelm', N'', N'Villanueva', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station (home depot), route runs through Blackpipe Corridor, Ironvein, Calumet Rise, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Ferrogate Transit bus operator, Deepwell Station to Calumet Rise route', N'', N'Friedhelm Villanueva has the compact, settled quality of someone who has learned to be comfortable in a small moving space for ten hours at a time. They are medium-height, broad through the shoulders, with skin a warm dark brown and close-cropped natural hair shot through with bioluminescent dye — pale blue at the roots, fading to white at the tips — that they refresh every three weeks from a kit they keep in their locker at Deepwell. They have a cat tail (geneware, black with a white tip) that has its own opinions about traffic: it lashes when the route is running behind and curls quietly when it''s smooth.

They are patient in the way that bus drivers become patient — not serene, but weathered into a steady kind of equanimity. They have seen everything in the seats behind them and learned to distinguish trouble from noise. Off the bus they are louder, funnier, more restless; the job asks for a particular affect and they shed it like a coat at shift end. They are deeply loyal to their regular riders in an anonymous way — they know faces, rhythms, and whether someone looks like they''re having the wrong kind of day.', N'Mobile information node — they traverse a long slice of the city daily and observe patterns others miss. Can be a quest enabler (getting someone somewhere unusual), a witness to events along the route, or a low-key union organizing plot thread.', N'', N'Bioluminescent hair dye (cosmetic, geneware-adjacent topical treatment). Geneware cat tail (cosmetic). Neural route-overlay (Ferrogate-issued, projects route data and timing directly into peripheral vision — technically company property).', N'Three-day-on two-day-off rotation. First run departs Deepwell at 05:45. Between runs they sit in the depot canteen and do crossword puzzles from an old tablet with a cracked screen they refuse to replace. Union meetings on the third Thursday of every month.', N'Friedhelm Villanueva, 168cm tall transit worker with warm medium-brown skin showing golden and olive undertones, broad defined cheekbones reflecting mixed Hispanic-Latin American, Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian heritage. Dark brown expressive eyes, short close-cropped hair with bioluminescent pale blue-to-white gradient fading to natural dark brown at scalp. Muscular compact build from years of transit work. Black cat tail with white tip visible from geneware implant. Small scar on left temple. Wearing worn navy Ferrogate Transit uniform with reflective piping, company cap pushed back, or off-duty in oversized charcoal hoodie and faded denim. Standing upright with deliberate posture, hands relaxed on thighs. Subtle luminosity to skin. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, cool industrial lighting catching bioluminescent hair, tired but steady expression, gritty transit station or vehicle interior background. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station (home depot)', N'local', N'Deepwell Station (home depot)', N'Mixed ancestry: Hispanic/Latin American (59.4%), Eastern European (15.2%), Sub-Saharan African (15.1%), South Asian (5.5%), Southeast Asian (2.7%), and Middle Eastern (2.1%) — a true Ubiquitous Diaspora blend. Warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones, showing the influence of dominant Latin American heritage mellowed by Eastern European fairness, enriched by Sub-Saharan depth, and warmed by South Asian and Southeast Asian notes. Broad facial structure with defined cheekbones reflecting the African and Eastern European ancestry. Facial geometry shows blended features: strong jawline from Latin heritage, slight cheekbone prominence from Eastern European ancestry, warm brown eye color characteristic of African and South Asian genetics.', 168, 72, N'Compact and broad-shouldered, with the settled solidity of someone built for endurance rather than speed. Muscular through the upper back and arms from years of gripping a steering wheel and managing a large vehicle. No excess weight, but no leanness either — functional.', N'Bioluminescent gradient: pale blue at roots fading to white at tips; natural dark brown visible at scalp line', N'Close-cropped, meticulously maintained, refreshed every three weeks with bioluminescent treatment kit', N'Short', N'Dark brown, warm', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones, luminous in quality. The dominant Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (59.4%) creates the warm undertone, while the Eastern European (15.2%) adds subtle fairness to the midtones, the Sub-Saharan African (15.1%) contributes depth and richness, and the South Asian (5.5%) adds warmth around the edges. Skin catches light with subtle luminosity, appearing slightly radiant in natural conditions.', N'Clear skin with a weathered, lived-in quality showing character and experience. Minimal grooming beyond functional cleanliness — no makeup, no adornment. Lines around the eyes from squinting at route displays and reading passengers'' body language. Broad facial structure with defined cheekbones reflecting the blend of Eastern European prominence and Sub-Saharan heritage depth. Warm brown eyes with expressive depth characteristic of the genetic mix. A small scar on the left temple from a childhood accident.', N'Geneware cat tail (black with white tip) visible when wearing typical work attire or casual clothing. Bioluminescent hair dye creates subtle glow in low-light conditions. Neural route-overlay has no visible indicator; implant sits behind left eye but is not apparent unless they remove their work visor.', N'Upright but not rigid. Moves with deliberate efficiency — no wasted motion. Sits with both feet flat on ground, hands usually resting on thighs or table. On the job, posture becomes slightly more braced, shoulders set slightly back. Off the job, they relax into a more casual slouch. Tail moves independently of conscious control: lashes when frustrated or behind schedule, curls contentedly when relaxed.', N'Tier 3-4 working class. Standard Ferrogate Transit regulation uniform on the job: navy polyester with reflective piping, company-issued cap (which they wear pushed back slightly), polymer safety shoes rated for twelve-hour shifts. Off-duty: worn denim, oversized hoodies in muted colors (charcoal, olive, faded black), knockoff sneakers, sometimes a vintage transit union jacket from the 2200s with faded patches. Minimal jewelry — only a brass wire ring on right ring finger, handmade by a friend. Practical clothing with no fashion statement beyond function and comfort.', N'They have been quietly documenting Ferrogate''s maintenance failures — photographing worn brake components, logging unreported incidents — in a personal archive they started after a near-miss collision that the company wrote off as operator error. They don''t know what to do with the archive yet but they can''t stop adding to it.', N'Relaxed and colloquial off-duty, clipped and professional on-duty. Uzbek and Icelandic phrases surface under stress or amusement. Comfortable with profanity but reads the room.', N'Fast when enjoying themselves, deliberately slow when they want someone to understand something important.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'friedhelm_villanueva');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69c-7576-ac7d-9c68f63ac750', N'Dagmar Sigurdsson-Pathak', N'Dagmar', N'', N'Sigurdsson-Pathak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station — a defunct transit maintenance bay converted into a meditation hall called The Loop, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Circuit monk and chrome prayer practitioner', N'The Loop Circuit Monastery — independent, informally affiliated with the broader Deepwell Station community', N'Dagmar Sigurdsson-Pathak is lean to the point of architectural, all angles and deliberate stillness, with light brown skin and a shaved head except for a single stripe of dark hair grown long and braided with copper wire from decommissioned transit relays. His arms from elbow to wrist are covered in chrome prayer sleeves — not for function but for devotion, etched with mantras in four scripts, and they hum at a frequency just below hearing when he is deep in practice. His eyes are pale grey-green with sunburst irises from a cosmetic mod he got at nineteen and never updated, which means they''re slightly dated in a way he doesn''t notice.

He came to circuit monasticism sideways, through a collapse — a psychotic break at twenty-two after a particularly brutal stint in a Ferrogate Transit shift-work cycle that left him unable to distinguish waking from sleep. A circuit monk found him curled under a maintenance panel and brought him to The Loop. He never left. He is genuinely serene in a way that unsettles people who expect performance from their holy men; his peace reads as vacancy until he speaks, and then it reads as something else entirely. He is also funnier than anyone expects.', N'Moral counterweight; provides sanctuary and neutral ground; can carry messages between factions without being perceived as allegiant; introduces players to the deeper spiritual culture of Deepwell', N'', N'Chrome prayer sleeves (decorative, etched, mildly haptic — vibrate during focused meditation), cosmetic sunburst iris mod (outdated model)', N'Rises before the station''s artificial dawn cycle, meditates for two hours in total silence, then runs what he calls ''the rounds'' — visiting the elderly, the sick, and the persistently troubled in Deepwell Station''s residential corridors, sitting with them, rarely speaking unless asked.', N'Dagmar Sigurdsson-Pathak, lean 178cm tall mixed-heritage man with warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones blending Northern European, South Asian, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Shaved head with single vertical copper-wire braided stripe from forehead to nape. Pale grey-green sunburst iris cosmetic mods. Clean-shaven, profoundly composed expression. Both forearms covered in chrome prayer sleeves with etched mantras catching light. Wearing loose charcoal linen meditation robes, worn plant-fiber sandals, meditation beads on simple cord. Minimal, deliberate posture in meditative stillness. GLMZ GLMZ aesthetic. Deepwell Station interior, soft neon ambient lighting with warm practical fluorescence. Ascetic-practical Tier 4 styling. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Mixed ancestry combining Northern European (66.8%), South Asian (22.8%), Southeast Asian (6.0%), and Sub-Saharan African (4.4%) genetics. Dominant Northern European bone structure and build foundation is substantially warmed and enriched by the South Asian and African components. Facial features show the characteristic broader nasal bridge and fuller lips of South Asian heritage, blended with Northern European angularity and Sub-Saharan African richness. The overall effect is a distinctly harmonious blend rather than discrete features — warm Mediterranean-influenced complexion with depth.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, almost ascetic — minimal body fat, prominent collarbones and sternum, the physique of someone who eats enough to survive but not enough to accumulate. Deliberate posture makes him seem even thinner than he is.', N'Dark brown to black, natural', N'Shaved scalp except for a single vertical stripe running from forehead to nape, braided with lengths of bare copper wire salvaged from decommissioned transit relays, creating a sculptural effect', N'Shaved except for the stripe braid (approximately 40cm long)', N'Pale grey-green with sunburst irises — cosmetic mod from approximately 2211, the radiating pattern now slightly dated and not refreshed', N'Medium warm brown with golden-amber undertones — a harmonious blend of Northern European foundation warmed by substantial South Asian, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry creating a complexion with natural richness, slight olive undertones, and depth that catches light warmly', N'Clean-shaven, minimal grooming beyond necessity. Skin is clear with warm melanin-rich tones throughout. Expression defaults to stillness — not blank, but profoundly composed. Facial features reflect the genetic blend: broader nasal bridge characteristic of South Asian heritage, fuller lips with warm pigmentation, and bone structure combining Northern European angularity with the softer contours of African and South Asian characteristics. Cheekbones are pronounced but not severe.', N'Chrome prayer sleeves covering both forearms with etched mantras (decorative, haptic-capable, audibly hum at subsonic frequency during deep meditation). Cosmetic sunburst iris modification visible in both eyes — outdated cosmetic model with slightly imperfect color saturation. No other visible chrome or augmentation.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion, no fidgeting. Sits in perfect stillness for extended periods. When walking, steps are precise and grounded. His default expression is profoundly calm in a way that reads as absence until he makes eye contact or speaks. Gestures are minimal but intentional.', N'Tier 4 ascetic-practical. Typically wears grey or charcoal loose-fitting linen robes sourced from Deepwell Station''s fabric coop, unadorned except for meditation beads on a simple cord. Feet usually bare or in worn plant-fiber sandals. No jewelry except the copper wire in his hair braid. Clothing is meticulously clean but shows age — mended in several places with visible stitching. Suggests someone who has rejected material accumulation without performing poverty.', N'During his breakdown, he became briefly convinced he had made contact with an E.L.F. that had been trapped in the Deepwell transit relay since a catastrophic systems failure decades ago. He has never been able to confirm or deny this. He built The Loop partially as a listening post. He still hears something, sometimes, and writes it down in an encrypted journal he has told no one about.', N'Plain and precise — he spent years eliminating filler and decoration from his speech; occasional dry humor delivered absolutely deadpan', N'Unhurried, with silence used deliberately as punctuation', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dagmar_sigurdsson_pathak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d6-74c4-8e00-9c826653218d', N'Haku Horváth-Adeyemi-Salazar', N'Haku', N'', N'Horváth-Adeyemi-Salazar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Freestone, GLMZ, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Bartender and part-owner, The Freestone Tap', N'Independent (co-owner of The Freestone Tap); informal ties to the Freestone tenant collective', N'Haku Horváth-Adeyemi-Salazar is the kind of woman who makes a room feel smaller in a good way — Japanese-South African ancestry that gives her a mid-height, angular frame, warm brown skin, and thick dark hair she wears loose or pinned with what appears to be a hex driver (it is a hex driver). Her bioluminescent skin mod runs in thin lines along her collarbones and inner wrists — a soft gold-green that brightens almost imperceptibly when her mood shifts, which is either wonderful or terrible depending on how well you know her. She has the particular physical fluency of career bartenders: reading posture from across a room, tracking three conversations, and never putting a glass down noisily.

The Freestone Tap is a narrow, low-ceilinged establishment on the ground floor of an Irkalla-adjacent block that has been serving Freestone workers for fifty years under various names and owners. Haku Horváth-Adeyemi-Salazar bought a 40% stake three years ago with a loan from her mother and an uncomfortable arrangement with the previous owner. The bar is not glamorous; it has a long-running policy of extremely cheap prices during the first two hours of any shift change, a rotating shrine to three different E.L.F.s behind the bar that she maintains with meticulous neutrality, and a back room that she rents to the neighborhood tenant collective for their meetings. She knows when to pour and when to put the bottle away, and she is never wrong about which one a given person needs.', N'Information hub — knows the neighborhood''s emotional weather better than anyone; dispenses wisdom, gossip, and genuine counsel from behind the bar; the collective meeting room makes her a node in local political organizing; the E.L.F. shrine makes her a point of spiritual significance to certain visitors.', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin lines (gold-green, collarbones and inner wrists — cosmetic, mood-reactive which she did not fully anticipate when she got them). Enhanced auditory filter — she had it installed to help her hear orders in a noisy bar, but it''s become her primary social tool.', N'Comes in at 14:00 to do prep and accounts, opens at 16:00, works until close around 02:00; sleeps late, spends mornings at the market or in the back doing the books.', N'Haku Horváth-Adeyemi-Salazar, 168cm tall, angular lean build with defined shoulders, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, high prominent cheekbones, dark observant eyes. Long natural black hair with warm undertones worn loose in soft waves. Bioluminescent gold-green branching lines glowing softly along collarbones and inner wrists, faint circular scar on left temple. Wearing dark fitted long-sleeve shirt, dark reinforced jeans, scuffed non-slip work boots, thin silver chain necklace. Standing behind a dimly-lit neo-noir bar counter, upright and centered posture, economical precise movements, reading the room with intense focus. Bioluminescent augmentations casting subtle light across skin. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, neon ambient lighting, moody atmospheric depth-of-field, photorealistic character study --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Freestone', N'local', N'Freestone', N'Mixed ancestry from Sub-Saharan Africa (43.1%), Eastern Europe (16.4%), North Africa (12.9%), Southeast Asia (12.6%), Hispanic/Latin America (11.1%), and East Asia (3.9%). The genetic blend creates distinctive features: warm deep brown skin with golden undertones from the African and North African ancestry, high prominent cheekbones with subtle angularity from Eastern European and Southeast Asian heritage, and warm dark eyes reflecting the diverse global mix. Her phenotype represents the true cosmopolitan blend of the 2226 Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 58, N'Angular and lean with defined shoulders — the economical musculature of someone who moves deliberately and rarely wastes motion. No softness; everything about her frame suggests efficiency.', N'Natural black with subtle warm undertones', N'Worn loose in soft waves or pinned up asymmetrically with what is literally a hex driver instead of a traditional hair stick', N'Long (shoulder-blade length when down)', N'Dark brown, warm and observant', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones — the result of Sub-Saharan African, North African, and Eastern European ancestry blending to create a rich, luminous complexion that catches light beautifully', N'Clean, minimal makeup (perhaps dark liner on long shifts), skin well-maintained but not pampered. High prominent cheekbones reflecting Eastern European and Southeast Asian ancestry, warm brown tone with subtle golden undertones from African heritage. Fine lines around eyes from years of focused attention and late-night work. Expression rarely neutral — always reading the room.', N'Bioluminescent skin mod (collarbones and inner wrists) — the primary visible augmentation. The enhanced auditory filter is subcutaneous; no external hardware visible, though close observation might catch slight asymmetry in her ear canal or a faint scar. She wears no external tech jewelry or interface displays.', N'Upright and centered, weight balanced like someone constantly ready to move in any direction. Her movements are economical and precise — no wasted gesture. She reads a room by standing still and observing; when she moves, it''s always with purpose. Behind the bar, she has the particular grace of someone who has poured ten thousand drinks without breaking a glass. Her gaze tracks multiple focal points simultaneously. When listening intently, her bioluminescent lines brighten almost imperceptibly — a tell she didn''t anticipate when she got the mod.', N'Tier 3-4 working class with personal style. Typically: dark fitted long-sleeve shirt (often vintage or second-hand, well-tailored) or a durable tank top under a thin cardigan, dark trousers or fitted jeans with reinforced seams, comfortable non-slip work boots (scuffed, well-maintained). Sometimes a half-apron with pockets for bar tools. No corporate branding. One or two pieces of jewelry — usually understated (a thin silver chain, a simple ring). Clothes are clean and intentional, not fashionable, selected for durability and movement. On rare days off, she dresses similarly but slightly less utilitarian. Nothing suggests she shops on the Tier 1-2 corporate strip.', N'The ''uncomfortable arrangement'' with the previous owner involved her signing a document she wasn''t given time to read. She found out six months later that it includes a clause giving a Palladian subsidiary the right of first refusal if she ever sells her stake. She has told no one and is slowly, quietly trying to find a way to nullify it without triggering it.', N'Fluid register-switching — formal with intimidating clients, warm and profane with regulars, precise when discussing the bar''s business; French phrases from her mother''s side surface when she''s tired', N'Conversational and rhythmic, paced to give people room to say more than they intended to', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'haku_horv_th_adeyemi_salazar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a619-7d8e-83ab-9cf34f679571', N'Deshanay Hoang-Saechao', N'Deshanay', N'', N'Hoang-Saechao', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lockhaven South, GLMZ, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Building superintendent and handyman, Lockhaven South residential block', N'Independent (contracted by Palladian property management, but operates with near-total autonomy given his tenure)', N'Deshanay Hoang-Saechao is a lean, permanently greasy man — Ghanaian and Polish ancestry that shows itself in his dark complexion, his wide jaw, and the pale grey eyes that his tenants find unsettling until they realize that unsettling is not the same as unkind. He has a grey-streaked bristle of beard he trims with terrifying exactitude every four days, a set of retractable utility fingers on his left hand (a practical augmentation he paid for in installments over eight years, not cosmetic — he had three fingers crushed in a compactor accident when he was younger), and he moves through the building''s maintenance corridors with the confident proprietary air of a man who knows every pipe''s history.

Deshanay Hoang-Saechao has been superintendent of the Lockhaven South Block 7 residential tower for nineteen years. He knows the building the way a doctor knows a patient — its histories, its weaknesses, its bad habits. He also knows its 340 residents the way a general practitioner knows a small town: too much, and without the distance that would make it comfortable. He is not a friendly man in the conventional sense but he is a reliable one, which in Lockhaven South is worth significantly more.', N'Building anchor and de facto community authority; knows who lives where and what they owe; can grant or restrict access; a source of building history and resident intelligence; his grudging protective instincts make him a reluctant ally.', N'', N'Retractable utility fingers on left hand — three fingers replaced with articulated multi-tool assembly (screwdriver, hex driver, wire stripper, grip clamp). The work is functional but old, with visible seams at the knuckles. Subdermal pressure sensor in both palms from his early construction days.', N'Does a physical walkthrough of the building''s mechanical systems every morning at 05:30; takes tenant requests in person between 08:00 and 10:00 because he doesn''t trust the request system Palladian installed; eats dinner at the same table in the basement maintenance room every night.', N'Deshanay Hoang-Saechao, 176cm lean middle-aged male with warm golden-olive Southeast Asian complexion, weathered face with deep character lines around eyes and forehead, dark brown hair salt-greyed at temples in short crew cut, dark rheumy eyes with direct intense gaze, precisely-maintained 2mm dark beard with grey threading, angular refined jawline blending Southeast and East Asian features. Left hand features retractable chrome-steel utility finger multi-tool with visible articulated seams and aged engineering gaps. Heavy industrial scars on knuckles, forearms showing white pipe-burst scar and burn mark on shoulder. Wearing half-unbuttoned faded grey work shirt layered over thermal, matching worn work pants with tool belt, scuffed steel-toed boots, patched canvas jacket. Economical posture with slight forward lean, hands at chest level. GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, industrial maintenance dock with warm amber overhead lighting casting deep shadows, machine oil and decay atmosphere, moody and contemplative expression. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lockhaven South', N'local', N'Lockhaven South', N'Southeast Asian (51.1%) forms the primary genetic foundation, creating warm olive-golden undertones enhanced by East Asian (11.6%) and South Asian (10.8%) ancestry. Eastern European (15.8%) and Northern European (10.1%) contributions add subtle depth and cooler undertones to the complexion, while trace Sub-Saharan African (0.6%) ancestry adds warmth to the overall phenotype. This blended ancestry creates a distinctive warm tan to golden-olive skin tone with character lines shaped by Southeast and South Asian genetic patterns.', 176, 68, N'Lean and ropy, with visible forearm musculature from decades of manual work. Shoulders rounded slightly forward from years hunched over maintenance panels. Core remains functionally strong despite age.', N'Dark brown with salt-grey streaking throughout', N'Short, practical crew cut, never fashionable but consistently maintained', N'Short', N'Dark brown, slightly rheumy at the corners', N'Warm golden-olive complexion with subtle peachy undertones from the blended Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Northern European ancestry. Weathered and lined from decades of exposure and labor, with the characteristic creasing patterns of Southeast and South Asian genetics.', N'Lined face with Southeast and South Asian genetic features: pronounced eye-corner creasing, moderate orbital depth, and refined angular jawline. Moderate-width nasal bridge with slightly flared nostrils typical of South and Southeast Asian ancestry. Cheekbones subtly prominent from East Asian genetic contribution. Permanent grease stains on hands and forearms despite frequent washing. Beard maintained at 2mm bristle length with geometric precision — trimmed every four days, showing natural dark coloring with grey threading. Numerous small scars on knuckles and hands from industrial work.', N'Left hand shows retractable utility fingers — the ring, middle, and index fingers replaced with an articulated chrome and steel multi-tool assembly. Visible seams at each knuckle joint where the assembly integrates with remaining hand structure. The work is functional but visibly aged, with small gaps in the engineering and faint marks from repeated deployment cycles. When retracted, the three fingers compress into the palm, leaving a subtle bulge.', N'Walks with efficient, economical movements — no wasted motion. Slight forward lean from his spinal posture. Hands often at rest in his pockets or held at chest level. When working, movements are deliberate and practiced, muscle memory precise. Eye contact is direct and held slightly too long, which reads as either contemplative or vaguely threatening depending on the observer.', N'Tier 3 utilitarian — grey or brown Carhartt-adjacent work shirts with multiple chest pockets, usually half-unbuttoned and layered with a faded thermal underneath. Matching work pants with tool belt worn at hip level. Steel-toed boots scuffed and re-sealed multiple times. A heavy canvas jacket for outside work, patched at the elbows. No jewelry. Clothing perpetually carries faint scent of machine oil, solder flux, and building decay.', N'He has been secretly reducing the rent records for four specific elderly tenants in the building''s system for six years — manually editing Palladian''s database during his regular maintenance access. If discovered, he would be prosecuted. He considers it the most moral thing he has ever done.', N'Dense with technical shorthand, Polish idioms in Quanta-era Polish-Ghanaian creole, zero pleasantries', N'Short sentences. Pauses between them like he''s checking the next one for structural integrity before releasing it.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'deshanay_hoang_saechao');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a733-7428-ab6a-9d09b8cf3875', N'Adanna Lindström-Thorvaldsdóttir', N'Adanna', N'', N'Lindström-Thorvaldsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, Geartown, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Food stall operator — broth and fermented grain specialist', N'Independent; Oxidian Market Vendors Guild (dues-paying member); The Ferment', N'Adanna Lindström-Thorvaldsdóttir is a broad-shouldered woman whose hands are perpetually stained with turmeric and char, calloused from thirty years of ladling broth in all weather. Her hair is silver-streaked and coiled under a waxed cloth wrap she re-ties about a dozen times a day out of habit, and her face is a map of laugh lines deepened by steam. She has no cosmetic mods except a set of heat-sensing fingertip implants she got cheap in her forties so she''d stop burning herself — they glow faintly amber when something is too hot, which she finds beautiful. Her stall is a converted ferrogate maintenance cart draped in mismatched fabric swatches, strung with small data-tokens she''s collected from regulars over the years as ELF offerings — she believes her stove-spirit blesses every batch if fed properly.

Adanna Lindström-Thorvaldsdóttir is the kind of person who knows everyone''s name and their mother''s name too, if they''ve come around long enough. She is warm without being soft, generous without being foolish, and has a razor instinct for when someone is about to cause trouble at her stall or nearby. She has watched her corner of Geartown change three times over and intends to outlast a fourth. She gives credit to people she trusts and cuts off people she doesn''t with the same cheerful finality.', N'Local anchor and community memory. Excellent source of neighborhood gossip, rumors, and social history. Can tell a player who has been coming and going, who changed behavior recently, what the mood on the street is. May offer food as a reward or ask for help with something affecting her stall or a regular she cares about.', N'', N'Heat-sensing fingertip implants (cheap amber-glow model). No other augmentations.', N'Arrives at her stall before dawn to start her long-cook broths, sources surplus protein from the Geartown processing co-op three mornings a week, and stays until the evening crowd thins. Closes with a small ELF ritual — pouring the last ladle of broth into a grate drain as a data-offering.', N'Adanna Lindström-Thorvaldsdóttir, 168cm tall, broad-shouldered market cook, warm golden-bronze skin with East Asian high cheekbones softened by Nordic breadth, fuller Sub-Saharan facial contours, deep brown eyes with amber warmth, face weathered and lined from decades of steam and sun exposure. Dark brown hair with silver threading, shoulder-length natural coils, wrapped in a waxed cloth headwrap with hanging charms. Cream canvas apron stained with turmeric and broth over dark indigo linen shirt, quilted vest, worn wool coat. Hands stained with turmeric and char, fingertips glowing faintly amber from heat-sensing implants, heat-burn scars visible on left forearm. Heavy work boots, thin worn brass ring. Standing at a steaming food stall at dusk in the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, warm market lights reflecting off wet surfaces, leaning forward with attentive posture, hands active and expressive, confident and welcoming bearing, GLMZ, no filters or chrome visible, lived-in authenticity --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'Complex diaspora ancestry: Northern European (36.3%), Southeast Asian (36.2%), East Asian (17.3%), and Sub-Saharan African (10.2%). This genetic blend creates a striking phenotype with warm mid-tone skin that harmoniously bridges Nordic coolness and Southeast Asian warmth, enriched by Sub-Saharan ancestry''s deeper golden undertones. East Asian facial structure—high cheekbones, almond-shaped eyes—is softened by Northern European bone breadth and enhanced by Sub-Saharan ancestry''s fuller facial contours and skin depth. An unconventional but harmonious appearance reflecting true global mixing.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, with the compact muscularity of someone who has spent three decades standing over a stove, lifting heavy pots, and moving with economical purpose. Thickened through the middle but strong-limbed.', N'Dark brown with silver threading throughout', N'Coiled natural texture, regularly wrapped and re-wrapped throughout the day in a waxed cloth wrap in rotating patterns', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unwrapped)', N'Deep brown with slight amber undertone in certain light', N'Warm medium complexion—golden-bronze from the equal blend of Southeast Asian and East Asian ancestry (53.5% combined), richly deepened and warmed by Sub-Saharan heritage (10.2%), with underlying cool Nordic undertones (36.3%) creating dimensional depth. Sun-weathered from decades of outdoor market work, creating a unified mid-tone of considerable warmth and richness.', N'Face deeply lined from decades of steam exposure; lines concentrated around eyes and mouth from frequent laughing and squinting. Underlying bone structure shows balanced East Asian characteristics—higher, defined cheekbones and almond-eye shape—softened by Northern European facial breadth and enhanced by Sub-Saharan ancestry''s fuller facial contours and richer skin undertones. High forehead and strong jawline reflect Nordic ancestry. Skin is weathered but healthy, with no scarring. Her face has the lived-in quality of someone who has rarely worn cosmetic filters or treatments.', N'Heat-sensing fingertip implants on both hands that glow faintly amber when exposed to temperatures above safe thresholds—the glow is soft, bioluminescent, and visible especially in dim market light. No chrome visible; the implants sit just under the skin at her fingertips.', N'Stands with weight evenly distributed, ready to move in any direction. Moves with the economical grace of long practice—no wasted motion, but warm and unhurried. Her hands are constantly active: stirring, tasting, gesturing while speaking. She leans forward when listening to someone, making them feel heard. Her bearing is confident without arrogance.', N'Tier 4 working-class, practical and layered. Typically wears a heavy canvas apron (usually cream or rust-colored, stained with turmeric and broth splatters) over a long-sleeved linen shirt (dark colors—indigo, charcoal, deep red) that protects her from splashes. Over this, a quilted vest in mixed fabrics, often with a worn wool coat draped over the stall frame. Her feet are in heavy slip-on work boots (well-maintained, re-soled multiple times). She wears a loose waxed-cloth headwrap in rotating patterns and colors, always functional, sometimes decorated with small metal charms or tokens hung from it. No jewelry except a thin brass ring on her left ring finger—simple, worn smooth.', N'Twenty years ago she acted as an informal message relay for a Zheng-Dao labor insurgency in Geartown. She doesn''t know that one of her regulars is a Zheng-Dao compliance investigator who has been slowly triangulating that history.', N'Warm, idiomatic blend of Swahili loanwords, Rioplatense slang, and Geartown market patois. Uses food metaphors constantly.', N'Unhurried and rhythmic, like someone who has all day even when she doesn''t', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'adanna_lindstr_m_thorvaldsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ff-7223-8f37-9d64d21a4255', N'Firdaus Matai-Fassi', N'Firdaus', N'', N'Matai-Fassi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Garret, rents a room in a converted water tower shared with five others, near Damen and Armitage', N'DJ and sound sculptor, underground rave circuit, Tier 2', N'The Garret underground circuit; informal network of sound artists across the Ferment Quarter and Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Firdaus Matai-Fassi moves through spaces with the particular quality of someone who is always listening — head slightly tilted, eyes unfocused, processing acoustic information before visual. Their Igbo-Polish-Malagasy heritage has produced a face that strangers frequently find difficult to read and then realize they''ve been trying to categorize incorrectly: a long jaw, widely-spaced dark eyes with yellow-ringed irises (geneware, chosen deliberately to resemble a secondary predator), skin the deep warm brown of their father''s Igbo family with the occasional Malagasy undertone that shifts in certain light. Their hair is shaved close at the temples and maintained in a structured vertical ridge down the center that they dye in bands of frequency-reactive pigment — it shifts color with ambient sound, which means at their own sets it becomes a visual instrument.

Firdaus Matai-Fassi does not play music so much as engineer environments. Their sets at the Garret''s underground circuit are classified by regular attendees as physically affecting — subsonic layers, frequencies that produce specific emotional states, structures that take an hour to resolve and leave people feeling like they''ve been somewhere. They are precise about sound in the way a surgeon is precise about incision, and they have a corresponding social bluntness — they find small talk genuinely effortful and do not produce it. People who understand what they do treat them with considerable respect. People who don''t frequently mistake their quietness for shyness, which is incorrect.', N'Local color and underground network access — Ekene knows every venue, promoter, and sound artist in the underground circuit and has useful social connections that appear casual but run deep. Can serve as information source for who is present at specific underground events.', N'', N'Frequency-reactive hair pigment (geneware). Yellow-ring iris modification. Cochlear enhancement implants (both ears) — extends hearing range into subsonic and ultrasonic bands and provides precise frequency analysis overlay. Subdermal haptic feedback array across the back — allows them to feel spatial sound distribution as physical sensation.', N'Keeps unusual hours — sleeps in two-hour intervals throughout the day, fully alert at 3-6am which they call ''clean time'' for composition. Spends afternoons in the water tower''s communal space with headphones, building sets. Works most weekends, sometimes weeknights if the venue is right.', N'Firdaus Matai-Fassi, GLMZ, lean angular figure with warm medium-brown luminous skin blending Pacific Islander, North African, and Indigenous American heritage. High cheekbones, defined jawline, widely-spaced dark eyes with distinctive bright yellow iris rings (geneware modification). Black hair with frequency-reactive purple-teal-magenta pigment bands forming vertical ridge down center, shaved temples exposing geometric hairline frequency-waveform tattoos. Sleeveless mesh-back technical rig vest in black and matte grey displaying subdermal haptic feedback array on upper back and shoulders (subtle surface texture variation visible). Minimalist geometric earrings complementing tattoos. Modified boots with enhanced grip. Head tilted as if listening, expression neutral and internally focused, eyes slightly unfocused as if processing invisible data. Cochlear implant ports visible behind ears. Standing in urban sonic workspace with ambient acoustic lighting, atmospheric synth glow, GLMZ 2200s aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Garret', N'local', N'The Garret', N'Pacific Islander (54.0%), North African (28.5%), Indigenous American (17.5%) ancestry—a striking genetic blend. Warm medium-brown skin with golden and bronze undertones characteristic of Oceanic ancestry, enriched by North African depth and Indigenous American earth tones. Robust facial structure combines high, prominent cheekbones and defined jawline from Pacific Islander and North African lineages with the broader facial geometry and eye-set spacing typical of Indigenous American heritage. The overall effect is a luminous, sun-adapted complexion that shifts perceptibly under different lighting.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, with long limbs and minimal body fat—the build of someone who moves through space precisely rather than powerfully. Shoulders narrow, hips defined, chest flat. Moves with economical efficiency.', N'Black base with frequency-reactive pigment bands in shifting purples, teals, and magentas—reactive to ambient sound frequencies', N'Structured vertical ridge down the center of the scalp, shaved close at the temples exposing medium-brown skin', N'Short (ridge approximately 8cm tall when standing)', N'Dark brown iris with distinctive bright yellow ring around the pupil (deliberate geneware modification)', N'Warm medium brown with golden and bronze undertones—a nuanced blend of Pacific Islander warmth, North African richness, and Indigenous American earth tones that shifts perceptibly under different lighting, creating a luminous, sun-adapted quality', N'Robust facial structure with high, prominent cheekbones and defined jawline reflecting Pacific Islander and North African ancestry, combined with the broader facial geometry and widely-spaced eyes characteristic of Indigenous American heritage, creating an unusually striking, deliberately difficult-to-categorize facial structure. Minimal facial hair. Skin clear, well-maintained but without cosmetic attention—focused grooming. Expression typically neutral or slightly distant, eyes often unfocused as if processing invisible information.', N'Yellow-ring iris modification immediately visible. Cochlear enhancement implant ports visible behind both ears (small matte black ports with geometric detailing). Frequency-reactive hair pigment system obvious and dynamic. Subdermal haptic feedback array not visually apparent but produces subtle surface texture variation across the upper back and shoulders when wearing sleeveless or backless clothing.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical precision. Head frequently tilted at slight angle as if listening to distant sound. Eyes unfocused or gazing past immediate surroundings. Rarely makes unnecessary gestures. When standing still, weight balanced evenly. When walking, movement is fluid but purposeful, not casual. Minimal fidgeting. Gives impression of someone internally focused, processing invisible data.', N'Tier 2 working-artist aesthetic with deliberate sonic/technical elements. Favors sleeveless or mesh-back garments to display haptic feedback array and allow skin contact with air for acoustic sensitivity. Primary colors: blacks, deep greys, occasionally matte metallics. Clothing is well-maintained but not luxurious—functional, modular pieces from mid-range corpo brands. Often wears a custom rig vest with integrated haptic feedback visualization (LEDs that mirror the subdermal array''s activation patterns). Minimalist jewelry: small geometric earrings or ear cuffs that complement the hairline tattoos. Footwear is practical—modified boots with enhanced grip for standing long hours at equipment.', N'Their most acclaimed set — a piece called ''Irkalla Tide'' that caused seven people to report weeping without understanding why — was built using field recordings they made illegally inside Aurochs Medical Complex''s basement levels. They captured the specific acoustic signature of the building''s medical waste processing systems. The sounds are beautiful. The source is something they prefer not to think about.', N'Sparse. Technical when discussing sound — very precise frequency terminology, production vocabulary. Almost clinical. In personal conversation: short sentences, often incomplete.', N'Slow and evenly spaced. Rarely raises or lowers pitch. People sometimes think they''re bored; they''re focused.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'firdaus_matai_fassi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72c-7bc5-99a7-9dee0cbe07a3', N'Hadeel Sigurdsson', N'Hadeel', N'', N'Sigurdsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 78, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ashfeld — runs a small care space out of her ground-floor apartment, near Western and Division', N'Death midwife and traditional spiritual caregiver', N'Independent; loose network of death midwives across the Ashfeld-Chatham corridor; informally recognized by the Helix Biosystems palliative unit as a community liaison', N'Hadeel Sigurdsson is tiny and precise, barely reaching most people''s shoulders, with the posture of a woman who decided decades ago that gravity was a suggestion. Her hair is completely white and worn loose, something she only allowed herself after her seventy-fifth birthday as a deliberate act of self-gift. Her face is extraordinarily lined — she calls her wrinkles her credentials — and her hands are the most notable thing about her: large for her frame, steady, warm even in cold weather. She has no augmentations except a basic cardiac monitor implant she resents and refers to as ''my nagging houseguest.'' Her clothing is always natural fiber when she can afford it, always in dark green or grey.

Hadeel Sigurdsson has attended over four hundred deaths in fifty years of practice, sitting with the dying across faith traditions, across tiers, across the spectrum of biological and synthetic life. She is one of the few death midwives who will sit with synthetics, arguing that the question of whether they have souls is above her pay grade and irrelevant to the work of accompanying. She is not soft about death — she finds euphemism dishonest and will use the word plainly — but she is ferociously tender. Families sometimes mistake her pragmatism for coldness until they watch her hold someone''s hand for eleven hours without complaint.', N'Moral weight, community knowledge, exposition through memory — she has been present at important deaths and knows what the dying say; also a humanizing presence for themes about synthetic consciousness', N'', N'Basic cardiac monitor implant (medical necessity, resented)', N'Spends mornings responding to requests and doing administrative triage — she maintains a waiting list and must sometimes make painful decisions about capacity. Afternoons and nights she is present with the dying or their families, often not returning home for days at a stretch during busy periods.', N'An elderly woman of profound mixed heritage in a GLMZ setting, petite and wiry at 148cm, with white hair falling past her shoulders in loose waves. Her face shows a harmonious blend of Northern European, East Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and African features: defined cheekbones with subtle monolid eyes, fuller lips, and a warm golden-brown skin tone aged into deep lines of contemplation. Wearing a simple dark grey linen tunic and dark trousers, worn leather slip-ons, seated upright with deliberate posture. Her hands, marked with age spots and old surgical scars, rest calmly. Minimal makeup, no visible augmentations. Setting: a quiet, dimly lit interior—perhaps a listening room or archive in the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, soft overhead lighting catching the texture of her weathered face, the threads of her white hair. Mood: calm presence, sharp focus, acceptance. Neo-noir urban aesthetic through simplicity and function rather than augmentation. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfeld', N'local', N'Ashfeld', N'Complex global blend: Northern European (46.5%) provides foundational bone structure and facial definition; Hispanic/Latin American (23.1%) contributes warmth, lip fullness, and facial contours; East Asian (20.4%) shapes subtle eye structure and cheekbone prominence; Sub-Saharan African (10.0%) enriches skin depth and lip structure. The interplay creates a uniquely balanced phenotype—cool and warm undertones in equilibrium, neither dominantly European nor Latin nor Asian nor African, but genuinely integrated across all features.', 148, 42, N'Diminutive and wiry, with the compact density of someone who has moved through the world efficiently for eight decades. No excess, no slack—shoulders slightly rounded from years of leaning in close to listen.', N'White', N'Loose, unstyled, falls naturally past her shoulders in thin strands with slight wave', N'Long', N'Dark brown, faded slightly with age but still sharp and focused', N'Warm golden-brown with balanced undertones—neither cool nor warm dominant, but genuinely blended. Medium depth with slight reddish warmth from Hispanic/Latin heritage balanced against subtle cool undertones from Northern European ancestry. Darker concentration at temples and cheekbones where ancestry features converge. Age has created subtle variations in tone across the face.', N'Deeply lined face—forehead, cheeks, around eyes and mouth—with a map of fine creases that speak to fifty years of attentive listening and presence. Facial structure reflects Northern European definition in overall face shape, East Asian influence in subtle monolid tendency and prominent cheekbones, balanced by fuller lips and broader nasal base from African and Hispanic/Latin heritage. Eyes set with slight epicanthic fold. Skin is thin but not papery, well-cared-for despite age. Minimal makeup, if any. Expression resting in something between attention and acceptance.', N'None visible. The cardiac monitor implant is subcutaneous—no external indicator. She wears no visible tech.', N'Moves with deliberate economy. Upright despite her age, though gravity has claimed an inch or two. Her gait is slow but not hesitant—each step chosen. Her hands move with surgical precision when needed, but otherwise rest calmly in her lap or folded at her sternum. She has learned not to waste energy on movement that isn''t purposeful.', N'Always natural fiber when possible—wool, linen, cotton. Default palette is dark grey or dark green, occasionally black. Simple long-sleeve tunic or button-front shirt, loose trousers, worn but immaculately clean. No logos, no corporate branding. Worn leather slip-ons, sensible and broken in. She dresses for function and for respect to the people she sits with—nothing distracting, nothing that announces her tier or status. Tier 3-4 practical.', N'The first death she attended, age 28, was her own mother, and she did it badly — panicked, left the room, was not present at the moment of death. Every sitting since has been quiet reparation. She has never told this to anyone.', N'Plain, specific, avoids metaphor except when deliberate — she chooses words like someone who knows their weight', N'Unhurried even in urgent situations, which can feel alarming until you realize it''s intentional de-escalation', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hadeel_sigurdsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d8-7a39-9b88-9edf096d0fc0', N'Chen Wei-Lin', N'Chen', N'', N'Wei-Lin', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 68, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'the Gray Zone — Level 12, a cramped noodle shop called ''Chen''s'' wedged between a water recycler and a defunct elevator shaft, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Noodle shop owner / informal information broker / surrogate mother figure', N'Tessera Corponation (mid-level noodle shop owner / informal information broker /)', N'Chen Wei-Lin is a small woman who moves like she''s in a permanent argument with physics — fast, efficient, slightly annoyed. She stands maybe 5''2" but takes up more space than that suggests, partly because she''s always in motion and partly because her presence has a gravitational quality. Her face is a map of the the sprawl itself: weathered, cracked in places, but structurally sound. Her eyes are sharp and dark behind thick-framed glasses held together with electrical tape and spite. Her grey hair is always pinned up in a tight bun secured with two chopsticks that she occasionally pulls out to gesture with while making a point, then replaces without losing a syllable.

Her hands tell two stories. They''re a cook''s hands now — scarred from oil splatter, calloused from decades of kneading dough, knuckles swollen with arthritis she refuses to acknowledge. But if you look closely, you can see the older scars underneath: the precise, symmetrical marks of someone who spent years working with micro-surgical tools and augmentation circuitry. She wears no rings, no jewelry, nothing decorative. Her apron is always stained and she considers this a badge of honest work.

First impression: a cranky old woman who serves good noodles and doesn''t smile. Accurate impression: a cranky old woman who serves good noodles, doesn''t smile, and is quietly the most important person in the Gray Zone because she feeds it, listens to it, and remembers everything.', N'Mrs. Chen represents the other samurai code — the one that has nothing to do with swords. Her rebellion is feeding people in a world designed to starve them of everything: food, community, dignity, connection. She is the answer to the question Kyle hasn''t thought to ask: what does honor look like without violence?

She also carries the story''s deepest irony. She may be feeding the student of the man whose unit killed her son. She may know this. She feeds him anyway. That is either the most profound act of forgiveness in the story, or the most devastating act of denial, and the narrative never resolves which.

She poses this question to Kyle: Is your code about discipline, or is it about service? Because Seo taught you the first, but Mrs. Chen lives the second, and they are not the same thing.', N'', N'', N'', N'68-year-old woman, compact 157cm frame, warm medium-tan skin with golden undertones blending Eastern European, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic heritage. Steel grey hair pulled tight into a bun secured by wooden chopsticks. Dark brown sharp eyes, deeply weathered face with laugh lines and fine creases. Arthritic swollen knuckles, scarred hands from cooking burns, linear surgical scars on inner wrists. Thin white scar on right forearm, small crescent scar on left temple. Wearing stained canvas apron over worn dark thermal layers, dark work pants, thick-soled scuffed kitchen shoes. Glasses taped together. Perpetually forward-leaning posture, hands in constant motion. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone kitchen setting, warm industrial lighting, motion blur suggesting ceaseless movement, gritty recycled-air atmosphere, functional utilitarian aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex diaspora blend: 44.3% Eastern European, 22.8% South Asian, 15.6% Northern European, 8.8% Hispanic/Latin American, 8.5% Sub-Saharan African. This genetic mosaic produces warm medium-tan skin with subtle golden and amber undertones—the result of Eastern European base with South Asian warmth and Sub-Saharan depth creating a unified, sun-weathered complexion. Facial structure bridges Central European bone geometry with South Asian softness, while the warm undertones reflect the full continental ancestry layered together.', 157, 52, N'Compact and wiry, density rather than bulk. Decades of standing, lifting, and repetitive motion have left her lean and functionally strong despite her age. No excess softness, all utility.', N'Steel grey, naturally greyed', N'Tightly pinned bun, secured with two wooden chopsticks that serve double duty as hair pins and gestural tools', N'Long (worn up)', N'Dark brown, sharp and penetrating', N'Warm medium-tan with golden and amber undertones, the complexion of someone who has spent 68 years working indoors and outdoors in equal measure. The depth and warmth reflect her South Asian, Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic heritage blended into a unified, sun-weathered tone.', N'Weathered, with deep laugh lines around the eyes and mouth. Fine crease network across forehead and cheeks, with the characteristic subtle facial structure reflecting the blend of Central European, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage beneath the age-marked surface. Skin has the papery texture of age and low hydration common in the Gray Zone''s recycled air. No cosmetic modifications. Minimal scarring visible on face itself.', N'None visible. Any augmentation work from her past is either fully internalized or deliberately concealed.', N'Perpetually in motion — no idle standing. Moves with economic precision, every gesture purposeful. Stance is slightly forward-leaning, as if ready to pivot toward whatever task needs doing next. Walks with a barely perceptible shuffle, more the result of 50+ years on her feet than actual infirmity. Hands are rarely still; she gestures while talking, pulls chopsticks from her hair to emphasize points, replaces them mid-sentence without breaking eye contact.', N'Utilitarian Tier 4 worker aesthetic. Always wearing a stained canvas apron over simple, worn thermal layers. Dark grey or black work pants held up with a cord. Thick-soled slip-on kitchen shoes, scuffed and comfortable. Glasses held together with electrical tape rather than replaced — a deliberate statement about priorities. No jewelry, no ornamentation, nothing that could catch on machinery or require maintenance. Her clothing is functional anti-fashion: it has absorbed decades of kitchen grease and noodle starch and she wears it like earned credential.', N'She recognized the style of Kyle''s training immediately — Kenshin Group military kenjutsu. She knew Seo had been a soldier before he was a teacher. She also knows, from overheard conversations and dates she quietly cross-referenced, that Seo''s unit operated in the same corridor where her son died. She has never confirmed it. She has never asked. She feeds Kyle every day and does not think about probability.', N'Direct, practical, salted with dry sarcasm. She uses cooking metaphors the way Seo used martial ones. Her Mandarin occasionally surfaces in moments of stress or affection — she''ll mutter ''ai-ya'' under her breath or call someone ''xiao gui'' (little ghost) when she''s fond of them.', N'Clipped, efficient, delivered while doing something else. She rarely gives anyone her full attention verbally — her hands are always busy. But her listening is total. She processes what you say while chopping vegetables and then responds to the thing you actually meant, not the thing you said.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chen_wei_lin');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a71f-7055-89e6-9f119ebd259a', N'Badr Kulkarni', N'Badr', N'', N'Kulkarni', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit — neon-lit entertainment and vice district, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Target acquisition and fugitive recovery — bounty hunter', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Badr Kulkarni are average height but with a presence that fills more space than the body accounts for. At 28, there''s something unfinished about their face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains) — and they make no effort to hide it.

Their entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. They work as a bounty hunter out of The Circuit, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

What Badr Kulkarni lacks in subtlety, they compensate for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'As a bounty hunter, Ximena Sjostrom-Kwarteng embodies the tension between independence and isolation. They are a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains). Bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Badr Kulkarni, GLMZ operative, 172cm lean muscular frame with functional density. Medium warm golden-brown skin with subtle olive undertones, sun-weathered from street work. Angular face with high cheekbones, amber-brown eyes with slight epicanthic fold, dark brown hair buzzed short on sides with longer asymmetrical top and blonde regrowth at roots. Ragged scar tissue across left temple (cortical bomb extraction site), thin white scar from right ear to jaw angle, faint burn marks on forearms. Neural interface ports visible at base of skull. Dark tactical outfit: matte black reinforced cargo pants, sleeveless compression shirt, worn unmarked leather jacket, steel-toed boots. Wrist display and encrypted comms visible. Posture balanced and alert, economical movements, default state of tactical assessment. Urban neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, moody blue and amber lighting, slight forward lean suggesting focus and intensity. Neo-noir street operative aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Cosmopolitan genetic blend: South Asian (31.3%), East Asian (26.8%), Eastern European (15.4%), Hispanic/Latin American (10.9%), Northern European (9.3%), and Indigenous American (6.3%). This produces warm medium-golden skin with subtle olive and amber undertones, slightly angular facial structure reflecting the blend of South Asian cheekbone prominence with East Asian eye shape, and dark brown hair with natural warm highlights.', 172, 68, N'Lean and muscular with functional density — minimal fat, maximum efficiency. Shoulders broad from repetitive weapon training; core visibly defined. Wiry rather than bulky, built for sustained effort rather than explosive power.', N'Dark brown with natural blonde undertones at the roots — evidence of regrowth after bleaching', N'Buzzed short on sides, longer on top — practical, asymmetrical, styled for sight lines and minimal grab points', N'Short', N'Amber-brown with slight epicanthic fold from East Asian ancestry, alert and restless', N'Medium warm golden-brown with subtle olive undertones from South Asian and East Asian ancestry, amber highlights on cheekbones; sun-weathered from street work', N'Angular face with pronounced high cheekbones reflecting South Asian prominence balanced with East Asian structure; skin is clear but marked by repetitive stress. Warm amber undertones across temples and cheekbones, subtle golden cast across the bridge of nose. Slightly broader face structure than purely European heritage would produce, softened by Hispanic/Latin American and Indigenous American ancestry contributions. Thin lips, often pressed into a flat line. Expression carries no softness — features arranged in a default state of tactical assessment.', N'Cortical bomb scar tissue is visible — no attempt at cosmetic covering. Neural interface ports at the base of skull, visible when hair is pulled back. Left eye shows faint LED reflection under direct light — likely targeting assist software, civilian-grade. No obvious limb modifications, but movement suggests enhanced proprioception.', N'Stands with weight balanced, shoulders squared, never fully relaxed. Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, every step deliberate. Eyes track threats in regular sweeps. Fingers twitchy at rest, fingers steady under pressure. Slight forward lean when concentrating, as if physically pulling information from the air.', N'Tier 3-4 streetwear: reinforced cargo pants (matte black, multiple pockets for gear), sleeveless compression shirt or tactical vest depending on contract temperature. Worn leather jacket (unmarked, functional, no corp branding). Steel-toed boots scuffed from field work. Minimal jewelry except functional gear — wrist display, credchip, encrypted comms. No vanity, all utility.', N'Ximena Sjostrom-Kwarteng witnessed a massacre during a corporate dispute and has evidence stored in a dead drop. Publishing it would expose powerful people. Keeping it is leverage and liability.', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'badr_kulkarni');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a625-7bd1-bdd1-9f5cca381b4c', N'Soraya Rhee', N'Soraya', N'', N'Rhee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 41, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'Milwaukee Core — rents a workshop in an industrial unit near the old foundry district', N'Demolitions and breaching specialist — The Thermite Collective', N'The Thermite Collective', N'Soraya Rhee is the kind of man who can calculate blast radius to the centimeter while telling a joke about his ex-wife. Eighteen years in controlled demolition — first legal, then gray-market, then whatever pays. He started in construction, blowing buildings down so new ones could go up. When the construction contracts dried up and the corps started automating demo work, he pivoted to the only market that still valued a human touch: the kind of demolition that happens on a schedule nobody files with the city.

He is broad-shouldered, weathered, with hands that look like they''ve been rebuilt from scrap — because two of his fingers have been. Chemical burns on his forearms are old enough to be part of the landscape. He laughs too loud, drinks too much on off-nights, and has the kind of warmth that makes people forget he carries enough shaped charges to level a city block in the trunk of his vehicle.

The work keeps him honest. When he''s building a breaching charge or calculating structural weak points, the noise in his head goes quiet. It''s the only time it goes quiet. Vesper gave him that — steady work, a crew that doesn''t treat him like a liability, a reason to be precise instead of reckless. He would die for her and she would be furious about it, which is exactly the dynamic that works.', N'Harlan is the heart of the Thermite Collective — the emotional counterweight to Vesper''s clinical precision. His stories explore the tension between competence and self-destruction, between the steady hand that builds perfect charges and the unsteady life outside the work. He humanizes the crew.', N'', N'Haptic feedback implants in both hands — allow him to sense material density, structural stress points, and vibration patterns through touch. Two prosthetic fingers (left hand, ring and pinky) replaced after a detonation accident seven years ago. Internal air filtration system for working with chemical compounds.', N'Spends mornings in his workshop fabricating custom charges and breaching tools. Afternoons are crew meetings or reconnaissance with Vesper. Evenings he drinks at a bar called The Rivet near the foundry district — the bartender knows his name, his order, and his limit. Weekends he volunteers teaching basic electrical work to the Gray Zone kids through a community program, though he''d punch anyone who called it charity.', N'Soraya Rhee, weathered 188cm tall blue-collar worker in GLMZ, warm medium bronze skin with golden undertones blending Northern European, Middle Eastern, and East Asian ancestry. Deep brown amber-flecked eyes, squared jaw with high prominent cheekbones, dark brown hair with salt-and-pepper gray at temples, short practical cut. Thick muscular build with functional density and slight paunch. Rolled-up sleeves revealing chemical burn scars across both forearms in white-pink scar tissue. Matte black synthetic prosthetic fingers (ring and pinky) on left hand with chrome articulation and inactive micro-LEDs. Wearing worn charcoal Titan Industries work shirt, heavy cargo pants, scorched brown Carhartt jacket with tool loops, steel-toed boots. Beaten leather bracelet, faded wedding band. Weathered face with deep lines, small scar through left eyebrow. Workshop environment with low industrial lighting, metallic surfaces, faint chemical haze. Posture relaxed but alert, hands gesture with precise economy. Mood: competent, tired, reliable. Industrial neo-noir aesthetic, gritty realism --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Milwaukee Core', N'local', N'Milwaukee Core', N'Northern European, Middle Eastern, and East Asian blend in near-equal measure. Northern European ancestry (40.3%) contributes structural bone definition and fair undertones to the base palette. Middle Eastern heritage (34.8%) adds warmth, facial fullness, and depth to the complexion. East Asian genetics (24.9%) shape the eye structure, cheekbone prominence, and overall facial proportions into a harmonious tri-continental synthesis.', 188, 96, N'Broad-shouldered and thick-necked, the kind of frame built for moving heavy objects and absorbing impact. Carrying a slight paunch from evening drinking, but the musculature underneath remains evident — not athletic, but functional and dense.', N'Dark brown with premature gray threading at the temples and jaw', N'Short, practical cut, combed back without vanity. Salt-and-pepper stubble most days.', N'Short', N'Deep brown with amber undertones, tired-looking from years of precision work and poor sleep', N'Warm medium bronze with golden undertones — the balanced result of Northern European fairness, Middle Eastern depth, and East Asian warmth, darkened and weathered by sun exposure and chemical work', N'Weathered face with deep lines around his eyes and mouth — the topography of someone who squints at blueprints and smiles rarely but genuinely. Jaw is broad and squared with moderate angularity reflecting Northern European structure. High, prominent cheekbones show clear East Asian influence, framed by the facial fullness of Middle Eastern heritage. The bridge of his nose sits somewhere between Northern European straightness and Middle Eastern prominence. Skin has a leathery quality from decades outdoors and in workshop environments. Small scar through his left eyebrow.', N'Left hand shows two prosthetic fingers (ring and pinky) that are seamlessly integrated but visibly synthetic — matte black composite with subtle chrome joint articulation and micro-LED indicators at the fingertips (dark when inactive). The prosthetics are slightly cooler to the touch than organic fingers. No visible neck ports or cranial implants — the haptic feedback system and air filtration are subcutaneous and internal.', N'Stands with weight evenly distributed, shoulders relaxed but ready. Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion, the gait of someone who has learned to be stable around unstable things. Hands gesture when talking, and the prosthetic fingers move with identical precision to organic ones. When concentrating, he unconsciously flexes his left hand, feeling the haptic feedback as a baseline awareness check.', N'Tier 4 working-class aesthetic with functional touches. Usually wears reinforced gray or charcoal work shirts (Titan Industries brand — durable, cheap, ubiquitous) with the sleeves rolled to show forearms. Heavy canvas pants with cargo pockets, well-worn Rockport steel-toed boots. Over this, a scorched and stained Carhartt jacket (brown, at least fifteen years old) or a reinforced tactical vest with tool loops when heading to sites. A beaten leather bracelet on his right wrist — no visible significance, just worn smooth. No jewelry beyond a faded wedding band on his right hand that he hasn''t bothered removing.', N'He turned down a corporate demolition contract three years ago that would have set him up for life. The target was a housing block in the Gray Zone. He has never told anyone why he said no.', N'Working-class Midwest, salted with technical demolition jargon that he drops into casual conversation. Swears creatively and often.', N'Rolling, expansive. He talks the way he works — broad strokes first, precision when it matters. Stories have tangents.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'soraya_rhee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a739-791a-80c3-9f72830c921c', N'Beyza Charoenphol-Keïta', N'Beyza', N'', N'Charoenphol-Keïta', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, Stall Row 7, Copperhead, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Food stall operator specializing in synth-spice blends and ancestral cuisine reconstructions', N'The Oxidian Market Vendors Guild (senior member), Independent; The Ferment', N'Beyza Charoenphol-Keïta is a broad-shouldered woman with deep brown skin mapped in fine wrinkles that bunch around her eyes when she laughs, which is often. Her silver-streaked hair is cropped close on one side and falls in a thick, loose braid on the other, threaded with tiny glass beads that click when she moves. She has no augmentations save for a thermal patch embedded in her left palm — an industrial mod repurposed for gauging the exact temperature of her woks without touching them. Her stall smells of fermented shrimp paste, ghost chili, and something sweet and unidentifiable that she claims is her grandmother''s secret.

She is a woman of fierce opinions and genuine warmth, the kind of person who will berate you for putting too much salt on her food and then slip an extra dumpling into your bag when she thinks you look hungry. She has operated this same stall for twenty-two years and knows every vendor, enforcer, and regular by name, ailment, and preference. She carries grief quietly, tucked behind her humor, and speaks of her late husband only in the context of recipes he loved. The ELF she calls Mama Simmer lives in the ancient gas regulator under her wok — she leaves it a teaspoon of rendered fat every morning.', N'Community anchor and information hub — she knows everyone in the Oxidian Market and hears everything. Quest giver for neighborhood-level problems; reliable source of local gossip and history; can introduce players to other vendors or factions.', N'', N'Thermal sensing patch embedded in left palm (industrial repurpose, cosmetic housing in copper filigree). No other augmentations.', N'Up before dawn to receive ingredient deliveries and negotiate prices with dockside suppliers, then twelve hours at the wok until the night crowd thins. She eats standing up, always.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Beyza Charoenphol-Keïta, a 172cm woman with warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, blended Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Latin American heritage. High prominent cheekbones, fine wrinkles mapping decades of outdoor work, deep brown eyes with amber warmth. Asymmetrical black hair with silver streaks — cropped right side, thick three-strand braid with glass beads on left side clicking as she moves. Broad-shouldered, muscular build from wok work. Wearing faded indigo linen tunic stained with cooking splatters, worn canvas apron with deep pockets. Pale burn scars visible on backs of both hands. Left palm displays ornate copper filigree thermal sensing augmentation. Copper bead bracelet on wrist. Standing at her street food stall counter with solid posture, economical precision in gesture, leaning with territorial ease. Dim neon glow from nearby signage, warm steam rising from unseen wok, practical street market atmosphere, evening lighting with amber and blue neon accents casting shadows across her weathered but dignified face. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (47.4%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (21.0%), Hispanic/Latin American (14.2%), and East Asian (8.8%) ancestry, complemented by Central Asian (5.1%) and Middle Eastern (3.5%) heritage. This complex global blend creates a striking phenotype: warm deep brown skin with golden-amber undertones, high prominent cheekbones with balanced angular features refined by East and Southeast Asian ancestry, and rich dark eyes with warm amber lighting reflecting her multifaceted heritage.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, muscular through the forearms and core from twenty-two years of wok work. Carries weight with ease, neither lean nor heavy — a woman built for sustained labor and presence.', N'Deep black with silver streaks, natural with age', N'Asymmetrical: cropped close to the scalp on the right side, left side falls in a thick, loose three-strand braid threaded with tiny glass beads', N'Short on right, Medium-Long on left', N'Deep brown with warm amber undertones', N'Warm deep brown with golden-amber undertones, weathered and sun-exposed from decades of outdoor work, reflecting the blended melanin distribution of her Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Latin American ancestry', N'Face mapped in fine wrinkles that deepen around the eyes and mouth, evidence of decades of outdoor work and genuine smiling. Skin texture reflects daily exposure to steam and heat — slightly loose around the jawline but firm and defined through the cheeks and temples. High, prominent cheekbones with slight forward projection characteristic of Southeast and East Asian heritage. Few blemishes, well-maintained despite her age. Facial structure shows balanced blend of angular African and Asian features.', N'Thermal sensing patch in left palm with ornate copper filigree housing (industrial mod repurposed). The filigree is deliberately decorative, suggesting both practicality and pride in her craft. No other visible augmentations.', N'Stands with weight distributed solidly, shoulders back. Moves with economical precision — every gesture efficient from years of operating a confined wok space. Hands gesture expressively when speaking, beads in her braid clicking audibly with movement. Leans against her stall counter with the ease of someone in their own territory.', N'Practical Tier 3-4 streetwear: loose-fitting linen tunic in faded indigo or rust, stained with decades of cooking splatters that have become part of the fabric''s character. Worn canvas apron with multiple deep pockets, secured over the tunic. Comfortable flat shoes, non-slip sole worn thin. A single strand of small copper beads around her wrist — not jewelry but a tally or ritual object. Minimal jewelry beyond the beads; her wealth is in her reputation, not her appearance.', N'She has been secretly diluting a key protein base in her synth-meat with a cheap black-market filler for two years to keep prices low enough for Tier 1 regulars — she''s ashamed of it but can''t bring herself to raise prices on the people who need the food most.', N'Rich and idiomatic, mixing Ghanaian proverbs with Danish matter-of-factness; uses food metaphors constantly', N'Unhurried and declarative — she speaks like she has already decided what is true', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'beyza_charoenphol_ke_ta');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ab-70c4-80ce-9f994baa7097', N'Bhoomika Magnúsdóttir', N'Bhoomika', N'', N'Magnúsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 35, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'The Rookery — dense vertical housing, gang-controlled, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Personal security and threat neutralization — bodyguard', N'Independent — Dockside connections', N'Bhoomika Magnúsdóttir is tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 35, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immu — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Bhoomika Magnúsdóttir plans to keep it that way. He works as a bodyguard out of The Rookery, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Bhoomika Magnúsdóttir describe him as a precision instrument — point him at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Altan Tanaka-Frimpong functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks. Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Bhoomika Magnúsdóttir, tall androgynous figure, 188cm, lean muscular build. Mixed heritage face: Northern European angular bone structure with warm olive skin, golden undertones, prominent cheekbones, defined jaw. Dark brown eyes with subtle East Asian eye shape. Black hair cropped short with gray at temples. Fine lines around eyes. Faded thermal burn scar on left neck, barely visible. Surgical chrome lattice vents visible on sternum under open charcoal compression shirt. Dark synthetic tactical jacket with modular pockets. Carbon-weave reinforced pants. Scuffed tactical boots. Worn leather messenger bag across chest. Standing at deliberate angle, weight on balls of feet, constant threat assessment in gaze. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon-lit urban setting, cool blue and amber lighting, moody cinematic atmosphere, photorealistic, high contrast --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Rookery', N'local', N'The Rookery', N'Multinational genetic mosaic: Northern European foundation (40.1%) meets substantial Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (34.1%), with significant North African admixture (17.9%), balanced by minor East Asian (5.1%) and Southeast Asian (2.8%) heritage. The result is a striking convergence — warm olive skin with golden undertones from the Latin American and North African blend, refined by Northern European bone structure, with subtle depth in eye shape from East Asian ancestry. A face that reads as ambiguously global, distinctly contemporary.', 188, 74, N'Rawboned and efficient — lean muscle over long bones, minimal body fat, the physique of someone who treats their body as functional equipment rather than an investment. No wasted mass.', N'Black with premature gray at temples', N'Cropped close to the scalp, practical, sharp line fade', N'Short', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Warm olive with golden undertones — a complex blend reflecting the Northern European base warmed by substantial Hispanic/Latin American (34.1%) and North African (17.9%) ancestry. Medium depth with luminous quality, slightly sun-weathered.', N'Strong, angular features with high prominent cheekbones and defined jaw — Northern European bone structure warmed and deepened by Latin American and North African heritage. Skin tight over bone, unmarked face suggesting either exceptional care or exceptional luck. Fine lines around the eyes — accumulated squinting, accumulated years. Subtle warmth and depth in skin undertone across the face, with faint evidence of sun exposure across the cheekbones and forehead.', N'Surgical chrome around the sternum and upper ribcage — intake vents for the synthetic respiratory system are visible through open-collar shirts as fine metallic lattice work. No attempt to conceal. The legs show minimal external modification but move with uncanny efficiency — synthetic muscle fiber replacement evident only in motion, in the unnatural snap of acceleration and deceleration.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no flourish, no wasted motion. Stands at angles rather than head-on, shoulders relaxed but never fully slack. Weight balanced on the balls of his feet even when stationary. Eyes track constantly, threat assessment running on automatic. When she walks, there''s a mechanical precision to the leg movement, the stride too perfect, too controlled.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian — dark synthetic shell jacket with modular pockets, worn over fitted charcoal compression shirt. Carbon-weave pants, reinforced at knees and thighs. Tactical boots, scuffed, broken in. Minimal branding. No jewelry. All clothing is functional, replaceable, untraceable. Carries a messenger bag across the chest — worn leather, contents unknown.', N'Altan Tanaka-Frimpong witnessed a massacre during a corporate dispute and has evidence stored in a dead drop. Publishing it would expose powerful people. Keeping it is leverage and liability.', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bhoomika_magn_sd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a678-78b4-bea3-9fbce693c0d3', N'Dayo Traoré-Villanueva', N'Dayo', N'', N'Traoré-Villanueva', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 14, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The sub-level junctions beneath Garfield Rack and Grand Crossing Gate, Undertow eastern reaches, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Subterranean Scavenger — tunnel-born teenager who scouts and salvages decommissioned Ferrogate Transit infrastructure for parts and materials', N'Bore Rat community beneath Grand Crossing Gate; informal apprentice to an older scavenger named Vreni (not detailed here) who is teaching him routing and salvage assessment', N'Dayo Traoré-Villanueva is small for fourteen and has the particular wiry quality of a child raised on irregular calories and constant movement — he is not malnourished exactly, but he is built close to the bone. His skin is a deep warm brown with a slight grey cast from tunnel particulate that no amount of washing fully removes. He has no geneware modifications, no augmentations — he has a kid''s face, still round at the cheeks, with large dark eyes that have a near-photoreceptive quality honed by years of navigating low-light environments without tech. His hair grows in dense spirals, usually crammed under a salvaged transit worker''s hard hat three sizes too large for his head.

He is the thing that tunnels make of children when they''re loved but not wealthy: resourceful past the point of impressiveness, with a child''s emotional rawness operating inside an adult''s practical competence. He knows which Ferrogate Transit maintenance schedules to memorize, which decommissioned sections still carry live current, and which ELF-haunted junction boxes might shock you if you reach in without speaking first. He has never been to the surface. This is not a wound yet — at fourteen it still feels more like a fact — but it is becoming a question. He is beginning to want to see it, and beginning to be afraid of what that wanting will cost him.', N'Local color and unexpected guide — knows the safe margins of decommissioned transit infrastructure better than anyone his age should. Represents the lived reality of tunnel-born children. Can become a point-of-view character for surface visitors encountering the deep tunnels for the first time. Potential for a coming-of-age story hook.', N'', N'None. He wants retractable claws (practical, not cosmetic) and talks about this frequently.', N'He runs two scavenging routes a day — morning and evening — timing them around Ferrogate Transit''s maintenance windows that he has painstakingly memorized. The middle of the day he spends sorting salvage, repairing equipment, and learning what he can from older tunnel-folk.', N'Dayo Traoré-Villanueva, a 152cm wiry subterranean salvager child with deep warm brown skin enriched by golden and olive undertones, characteristic of Sub-Saharan African, Latin American, Indigenous American, and South Asian ancestry. Prominent cheekbones, dark brown almost-black eyes with unusual clarity, black spiral hair compressed under an oversized grey transit hard hat secured with knotted cord. Fine grey dust ingrained in neck creases. Wearing layered salvage: faded blue transit authority shirt, grey cargo pants with knee patches, worn canvas boots, and a faded coral reflective safety vest. Pale burn scars on inner left forearm visible, thin temple scar mostly faded. Economical posture, ready to crouch, holding salvaged multimeter and wooden calibration tools. Standing in dim tunnel environment with ozone-scented air, subtle metallic cables visible behind, low-light GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, moody underground lighting, dust particles visible in air, weathered and determined expression. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The sub-level junctions beneath Garfield Rack and Grand Crossing Gate', N'local', N'The sub-level junctions beneath Garfield Rack and Grand Crossing Gate', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (61.8%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (19.6%), Indigenous American (10.5%), and South Asian (8.1%) ancestry. This creates a rich, warm complexion with deep brown skin enriched by golden, reddish, and subtle olive undertones from the blended African, Latin American, Indigenous American, and South Asian heritage. The bone structure reflects this Pan-American and African mix — prominent cheekbones with warm definition, a face shaped by diverse ancestral lines that create striking, defined features with subtle width across the face reflecting Indigenous American ancestry.', 152, 38, N'Wiry and compact, all lean muscle and efficient frame — built for crawling and climbing rather than strength. Shoulders slightly rounded from years in confined spaces. No excess anywhere.', N'Deep black with natural spiral texture', N'Dense spirals, perpetually compressed and creased from being worn under an oversized salvaged transit hard hat', N'Medium (approximately 8-10cm when uncompressed, closer to scalp when flattened)', N'Dark brown, almost black, with an unusual clarity and light-responsiveness from chronic low-light adaptation', N'Deep warm brown with golden, reddish, and subtle olive undertones — the result of strong Sub-Saharan African base enriched by Latin American, Indigenous American, and South Asian warmth. A subtle grey-silver patina from chronic tunnel particulate exposure sits atop this foundation, creating an aged, weathered appearance.', N'Child''s face still rounded at cheeks and jawline, but with a precocious steadiness in expression. Prominent, well-defined cheekbones reflecting Sub-Saharan, Latin American, and Indigenous American ancestry. Fine dust settled in pores and creases. No acne or surface scarring. Skin slightly papery from low humidity and mineral-rich tunnel air. Small calluses on fingertips and palms.', N'None. All his technology is external: salvaged handheld multimeter clipped to belt, rewired transit safety light modified to run on salvaged power cells, hand-carved wooden calibration tools.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Head slightly forward, shoulders inward, knees perpetually ready to crouch or climb. Walk is quiet and flat-footed, adapted for moving across uneven tunnel floors in darkness. Sits with one leg folded, the other ready to spring. Eyes track details obsessively — light sources, cable runs, structural weak points. Fidgets with salvage pieces in idle moments.', N'Tier 5 subterranean salvager aesthetic. Oversized grey canvas transit worker''s hard hat (three sizes too large, secured with knotted cord under chin). Layered in mismatched synthetics and canvas salvage: a faded blue transit authority work shirt (sleeves rolled), grey cargo pants with multiple pockets stuffed with tools and salvage snippets, patched at both knees with darker fabric. Worn canvas boots held together with cord lacing and adhesive patches. A salvaged reflective safety vest worn open over everything, its high-visibility orange faded to pale coral. Cloth strap wrapped around one wrist — a child''s superstition or a structural reminder. Everything smells faintly of mineral oil, dust, and ozone.', N'He found a maintenance access shaft three weeks ago that runs directly to a surface grating — he can smell outside air at the top of it. He goes there sometimes and just smells it. He hasn''t told anyone and hasn''t climbed it.', N'Tunnel-clan argot mixed with technical transit terminology he''s absorbed through necessity — speaks in shorthand that''s sometimes incomprehensible to surface people', N'Fast when excited (which is often), with the occasional pause-and-restart of someone who is still learning to organize their thoughts before speaking', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dayo_traor_villanueva');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a674-7815-82be-9fd297f5c3bd', N'Berko Hong-Árnason-Rentería', N'Berko', N'', N'Hong-Árnason-Rentería', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 58, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'Pilsen Veil, basement workshop beneath a decommissioned Ferrogate Transit relay station, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Sound sculptor and underground venue musician', N'Independent; founding member of the Pilsen Veil sound collective Cistern Sound', N'Berko Hong-Árnason-Rentería is a large, slow-moving man with the quiet authority of someone who has simply outlasted most arguments. His skin is very dark, his grey-streaked locs gathered at the back of his neck, and his hands are enormous — scarred across the knuckles from decades of working with salvaged metal and resonant polymers. He has no cosmetic mods but wears a cochlear amplifier behind his left ear that lets him hear frequencies beyond normal human range; he chose that over anything decorative. He moves through spaces as if listening to them.

Berko Hong-Árnason-Rentería builds instruments that are also sculptures and then performs with them in spaces most people would call acoustically hostile: drainage tunnels, abandoned transit shafts, the concrete bellies of flood-control cisterns. His work is ambient, slow, and enormous in scale — single notes held for minutes, harmonics that make walls breathe. He is not famous outside of a small devoted community, and he prefers it exactly that way. He is a father figure to younger artists in the Pilsen Veil, blunt about craft and surprisingly gentle about everything else.', N'Mentor figure; local color; gateway into the Pilsen Veil underground arts scene; keeper of long institutional memory about the neighborhood', N'', N'Extended-range cochlear amplifier (functional); mild joint-stabilization implants in both wrists (medical necessity)', N'Mornings in the workshop fabricating or repairing instruments; afternoons scouting acoustic locations or running informal mentorship sessions with younger artists; performances are monthly events, planned weeks in advance, never advertised beyond word of mouth.', N'Berko Hong-Árnason-Rentería, 60-year-old craftsman with warm caramel-bronze skin blending East Asian, Southeast Asian, and Hispanic ancestry; deep brown eyes slightly hooded with age, broad facial structure with high cheekbones and full features; dark hair with grey threading in shoulder-length locs tied at nape; 188cm tall, dense broad-shouldered build; extensive white scarring across knuckles, pale forearm scar, faded burn marks on wrists; matte-gunmetal cochlear amplifier visible behind left ear; wearing faded black linen and heavy cotton work clothes, fraying wool overshirt, reinforced boots, woven earth-tone bracelet; standing in dim workshop or tunnel space, shoulders slightly forward, hands still and precise, listening; warm atmospheric lighting catching the golden undertones in his skin and the metallic gleam of his augmentations; GLMZ, function over chrome, the presence of earned time and intention --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Pilsen Veil', N'local', N'Pilsen Veil', N'Balanced tri-continental ancestry creating a distinctive phenotype: East Asian foundation (49.9%) provides bone structure and eye shape, Southeast Asian heritage (24.0%) contributes warmth and facial width, Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (26.1%) adds golden undertones and fuller features. The combination yields a warm-toned complexion with characteristics that don''t clearly resolve to a single region—a genuinely cosmopolitan genetic mix visible in the harmonious blending of facial planes, eye set, and skin luminosity.', 188, 98, N'Large-framed and broad-shouldered with a slow, deliberate heaviness; not fat but dense, the body of someone who has spent six decades moving through physical work with intention rather than haste', N'Dark brown-black with grey threading throughout', N'Locs gathered into a loose tail at the nape of the neck; well-maintained, clearly a long-term practice', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Deep brown, slightly hooded by age', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden-amber undertones from the three-way East Asian, Southeast Asian, and Hispanic blend; a rich caramel-bronze tone that deepens to warm charcoal in dim light; even melanin distribution reflecting the complex genetic mix', N'Deep facial lines around the eyes and mouth from decades of concentration and smile-lines; skin weathered but not ravaged; a few age spots on the temples; broad facial structure with moderate cheekbones reflecting East and Southeast Asian ancestry, offset by the warmth and fuller features from Hispanic heritage; broad nose with Southeast Asian width; warm undertones throughout without cosmetic modification, only the earned texture of time', N'A dark metallic cochlear amplifier module visible behind the left ear, discretely integrated into the skin but clearly functional hardware; the amplifier is matte-gunmetal grey with small indicator nodes. Mild subdermal reinforcement visible as subtle thickening along both wrists under the skin, detectable only on close inspection or when his hands are under bright light.', N'Moves slowly and with deliberate weight, as if always listening to the acoustic properties of each space he enters; stands with his shoulders slightly forward, head often tilted as if attending to distant frequencies; his enormous hands move with surprising gentleness and precision; rarely hurries; speaks from stillness rather than animation', N'Tier 4 working-artist aesthetic: worn but clean linen and heavy cotton work clothes in blacks, greys, and deep blues; a faded wool overshirt with fraying at the cuffs; sturdy boots with reinforced soles for workshop use and tunnel navigation; no logos, no chrome, no status markers — function over presentation; a single woven bracelet in earth tones on his left wrist', N'In his thirties he had a brief period of Axiom-sponsored success, made two albums on their label, and quietly shelved them when he realized they were using his music in their Tier 3 residential mood-management systems without his consent. He bought out his contract and destroyed every master. He has never told anyone because he fears it would make him look naive.', N'Plain, direct, occasionally poetic when talking about sound; impatient with abstraction that isn''t grounded in the physical', N'Slow and deliberate, like his music — long spaces between thoughts', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'berko_hong_rnason_renter_a');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('aca6e7cc-73aa-52a2-65a3-a00d7add0486', N'Emeterio Hinojosa', N'Emeterio', N'', N'Hinojosa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A rooftop workshop in the Canopy, surrounded by charging stations, repair benches, and dozens of dormant drones, near Clark and Belmont', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — operates a licensed surveillance firm as cover for investigative work', N'Emeterio Hinojosa is the eye in the sky — or more accurately, the hundred eyes in the sky, the walls, the ventilation systems, and the cracks in the pavement. He is a drone specialist who has built the most sophisticated personal surveillance network in GLMZ''s lower tiers, and he uses it to conduct investigations without ever leaving his rooftop workshop.

His fleet numbers over three hundred drones of varying sizes, from bird-scale reconnaissance units to insect-scale infiltrators that can pass through a building''s air filtration system without triggering sensors. He builds them himself, maintains them himself, and controls them through a neural interface that allows him to process multiple drone feeds simultaneously — a cognitive feat that would overwhelm most BCI users but which Bao has trained for since childhood.

The limitation is the one you''d expect: he''s physically helpless. His investigative skills are extraordinary as long as a drone can go where he needs to look, but he cannot conduct interviews, chase suspects, or handle any situation that requires a human being in the room. He compensates by partnering with more physically capable investigators when cases require it, and by designing his drones to be so capable that physical presence is rarely necessary. His clients love the results and are occasionally disturbed by the process — there''s something inherently unsettling about knowing that any insect in the room might be watching you.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Emeterio Hinojosa, a 168cm lean neo-noir engineer in 2226, with warm bronze skin blending Hispanic, North African, and Southeast Asian heritage. Black hair with silver temples pulled into a practical tail. Dark brown eyes with neural scarring visible in the whites. Modest cheekbones, broader nasal bridge, fuller lips. Perpetually tired with dark circles and crow''s feet from screen work. Faint surgical scar behind right ear (BCI port, hidden by hair). Two parallel burn scars on left forearm. Hunched posture from desk work. Wearing matte black smart-fabric cargo jacket with tool pockets and visible wear patterns, faded thermal shirt with kill-switch symbol, dark indigo cargo work pants, worn slate-gray canvas boots. Smudged AR glasses on neck strap. Neo-noir dystopian workspace, cool blue-green neon lighting reflecting off tools and drone components, tense coiled energy, hands moving with practiced precision. Moody atmospheric haze, high-contrast shadows. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A rooftop workshop in the Canopy', N'local', N'A rooftop workshop in the Canopy', N'Emeterio is a striking genetic mosaic of the Ubiquitous Diaspora: predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (59.6%) with substantial North African (17.2%) and Southeast Asian (14.2%) ancestry, creating a richly blended phenotype. Sub-Saharan African (5.8%) and Eastern European (3.2%) ancestry contribute depth to his bone structure and skin undertones, resulting in a face that reads as distinctly multicultural—neither fully of any one region, but unmistakably of this era.', 168, 62, N'Wiry and compact, with minimal muscle definition — years of rooftop-bound work have left him lean without athleticism. His frame is tense, coiled rather than relaxed.', N'Black with premature silver streaking at the temples', N'Pulled back in a short tail; practical, rarely combed', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with faint networked scarring visible in the sclera (neural interface integration site)', N'Warm medium bronze with golden undertones—a luminous blend of Hispanic, North African, and Southeast Asian ancestry. The complexion is even and radiant despite minimal sun exposure, with natural resilience across varied melanin zones.', N'His face reflects the confluence of three dominant ancestries: modest cheekbone projection characteristic of Southeast Asian heritage, a broader nasal bridge with defined nostrils reflecting North African influence, and fuller lips with naturally deeper pigmentation common to both Hispanic and Sub-Saharan lineages. His jaw structure shows the subtle angular quality of Eastern European ancestry. Dark circles perpetually shadow his eyes, and fine crow''s feet suggest constant screen-squinting. When concentrating, slight tautness draws across his jaw. His skin shows resilience and natural sun protection from his Sub-Saharan and North African heritage lines.', N'A barely-noticeable neural interface port behind his right ear, usually hidden by his hair. His pupils occasionally dilate and contract in unnatural sync when processing multiple drone feeds — a telltale sign of active neural link. Otherwise, no visible chrome.', N'Hunched shoulders from desk work, minimal hand gestures. When standing, his weight shifts constantly as if his body is perpetually restless while his mind is elsewhere. He moves with surprising quietness for his build — light, practiced steps.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian: custom-fitted smart-fabric cargo jacket with reinforced pockets for tools and spare drone components, matte black with no logos. Wear patterns visible on the elbows and cuffs. Underneath, a faded thermal shirt with a barely-visible kill-switch symbol screenprinted on the chest. Dark indigo work pants with tool loops and cargo pockets, most of them filled. Worn slate-gray canvas boots with non-reflective soles. A battered pair of AR glasses on a neck strap, lenses perpetually smudged. No jewelry, no affectations — everything on his body serves a function.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'emeterio_hinojosa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5da-7a46-baf8-a0394a823065', N'Estela Madrigal', N'Estela', N'', N'Madrigal', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 64, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Washburn Commons — Unit 7, Block C, a three-room apartment she has made into something warm through sheer force of textile and effort, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Retired Helix Biosystems lab technician, now raising two grandchildren', N'', N'Estela Madrigal is a compact woman of middle height whose stillness is her most immediately striking quality — she moves through spaces like she has already decided where everything is and does not need to rush toward it. Her skin is very dark, her natural hair grown out in thick silver-streaked coils she usually wraps in a printed cloth her mother sent from Lagos before communications became unreliable. She has geneware cat ears, pale grey with dark tips, a cosmetic mod she got in her forties when they were fashionable in the Helix Biosystems corporate wellness program — she kept them after retirement because her grandchildren like them and because she simply never bothered to reverse the procedure. Her eyes are chronically tired but her attention is absolute.

She is not a talkative woman. She communicates in economy — a question instead of a lecture, a bowl of food instead of a welcome speech. People who don''t know her mistake her quietness for coldness; people who do know her understand she is one of the most carefully attentive people in Washburn Commons, who has noticed things about their neighbors that their neighbors have not noticed about themselves. She worries constantly about her grandchildren and expresses it by cooking too much food and asking too many questions about their friends.', N'Neighborhood observer and quiet information source; can provide insight into Helix Biosystems internal culture and practices from the worker''s perspective; represents the human cost of corponation pension systems; anchor character for stories set in Washburn Commons family life', N'', N'Cosmetic geneware cat ears (pale grey, dark-tipped); bone density support mesh in hips and lower spine (Helix standard retirement package); blood glucose regulator implant', N'She wakes before her grandchildren — Adisa, 9, and Priya, 7 — gets them fed and to the Commons learning center, then spends her mornings doing contract food preparation for two local canteens before collecting the children in the afternoon.', N'Estela Madrigal, 64-year-old woman in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226, deep warm brown skin with golden and olive undertones from blended South Asian, Hispanic, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, natural black hair with silver streaks wrapped in indigo and rust cloth, pale grey geneware cat ears with charcoal tips at temples, deep focused brown eyes lined with fatigue, prominent cheekbones, compact 162cm frame from decades of laboratory and kitchen work, subtle bone density mesh visible at lower spine, wearing muted charcoal tunic layered with forest green cardigan, neutral synthetic trousers, minimal functional makeup, simple thin bracelet, standing in kitchen or Commons space with deliberate still posture, active awareness, warm practical lighting, neo-noir medical-grade augmentation aesthetic, dignified and economical, 2226 tech worn naturally --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Washburn Commons', N'local', N'Washburn Commons', N'Richly blended phenotype reflecting South Asian dominant ancestry (39%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (26.2%), Southeast Asian (18.1%), and Sub-Saharan African (16.7%) genetic contributions. This creates a beautifully complex ancestry signature visible in her facial structure, bone composition, and skin undertones—a truly global genetic heritage expressed through balanced facial proportions and warm, multifaceted coloring.', 162, 58, N'Compact and economical, minimal excess — the build of someone who has spent decades on her feet in laboratory and kitchen work. Defined shoulders and forearms from decades of precise manual labor. Lower spine and hip structure subtly reinforced by visible bone density support mesh beneath skin at the base of spine.', N'Natural black with thick silver streaks throughout', N'Grown out in natural coils, typically wrapped in a printed cloth of indigo and rust tones', N'Medium (when unwrapped, coils reach mid-shoulder)', N'Deep brown with warm undertones, perpetually rimmed with fatigue but laser-focused', N'Deep warm brown with golden, olive, and amber undertones—a rich synthesis of South Asian warmth, Southeast Asian depth, Sub-Saharan African richness, and Latin American golden influences. Even, luminous tone that speaks to decades of careful living and self-maintenance.', N'Minimal makeup — functional only. Face organized around her eyes, which contain more information than she typically shares. Fine lines around the eyes and mouth from sixty-four years of controlled expression. Prominent, balanced cheekbones reflecting the harmonious blend of South Asian and Southeast Asian ancestry. Subtle but present facial width from her diverse genetic heritage—a face that bears the signature of four continents. Grooming is meticulous but unselfconscious — a person who maintains herself for functionality and self-respect, not presentation.', N'Geneware cat ears (cosmetic, pale grey with dark tips). Bone density support mesh subtly visible as faint tracery of reinforcement beneath skin at lower spine. Blood glucose regulator implant is subcutaneous and invisible.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion, no sudden gestures. Stands with weight distributed, ready to move in any direction without momentum loss. Her stillness is active, not passive; she is always aware of her spatial position relative to others and objects. When she reaches for something, her hand arrives exactly where it needs to be. When she listens, her entire body faces the speaker. Walks slowly and steadily, never rushes.', N'Tier 3 working-class pragmatism. Layered for temperature control in her kitchen-and-Commons life: well-maintained tunic or simple button shirt in muted colors (charcoal, deep plum, forest green), often with a lightweight wrap or cardigan. Durable synthetic-blend trousers in neutral tones. Practical slip-on shoes with reinforced insoles. A cloth bag for carrying food preparation supplies or groceries. One piece of jewelry — a simple thin bracelet, possibly given by a grandchild. Nothing decorative; everything chosen for durability and ease of maintenance.', N'Her daughter Temitayo did not disappear in an accident. Chiamaka knows Temitayo is alive and working deep-cover for a Zheng-Dao corporate intelligence cell. Temitayo contacts her once every few months through encrypted message drops. Chiamaka has told no one, including the children, because she fears what it would mean if Helix Biosystems — her former employer — discovered the connection. She burns the messages after reading them.', N'Clean and spare; Igbo and Finnish words surface when she is tired or emotional; asks questions rather than making statements when she wants to know something', N'Slow and level, minimal inflection; the emotional content is in what she does not say', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'estela_madrigal');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a662-7e9c-8c6f-a09118c438af', N'Nneka Balogun-Arredondo', N'Nneka', N'', N'Balogun-Arredondo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Old Harbor — repurposed shipping infrastructure turned black market hub, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Corporate espionage and data exfiltration — data thief', N'Freelance — works the Gray Zone circuit exclusively', N'Nneka Balogun-Arredondo is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 41, her expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rin — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. She works as a data thief out of Old Harbor, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In the runner community, Nneka Balogun-Arredondo is known for getting the job done and not asking questions that would make the job harder to stomach.', N'Ngaire Rojas-Yeboah is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rings. Internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on demand', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Nneka Balogun-Arredondo, 168cm tall, stocky muscular build, deep warm brown skin with golden and olive undertones, prominent cheekbones and high orbital ridges blending Sub-Saharan African and North African heritage with East Asian eye shape variation and squared Nordic jaw. Dark brown hair with silver temples pulled tight in functional braid. Cybernetic chrome iris rings with amber thermal overlay surrounding deep brown pupils, intense watchful gaze. Thin lips, linear scar through left eyebrow, old burn scar on inner right wrist. Economical posture, weight forward on balls of feet, ready stance. Dark utility jacket with reinforced panels and burnished steel subdermal armor plate visible at collarbone, tactical cargo pants, worn steel-toed boots. Worn silver ring on left ring finger. Minimal makeup, weathered complexion. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial urban setting, cool neon-tinged lighting casting shadows across her augmented eyes, moody and alert, technical and functional aesthetic, no unnecessary ornamentation --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Ubiquitous diaspora blend of Sub-Saharan African (37.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (15.3%), South Asian (14.3%), North African (14.2%), East Asian (11.0%), and Northern European (8.1%) ancestry. This complex genetic mosaic creates a striking phenotype: warm deep brown skin with golden, olive, and subtle copper undertones from the African and North African heritage, enriched by South Asian warmth. Bone structure reflects the blend—prominent cheekbones and high orbital ridges from Sub-Saharan ancestry, squared jaw from Northern European genetics, with subtle epicanthal variation suggesting East Asian contribution. The overall effect is of someone whose ancestry defies easy categorization, each region''s traits harmonizing into a distinctive whole.', 168, 78, N'Stocky and densely muscled, built like someone who trains methodically. Shoulders broad and forward-set. Forearms thick with functional muscle, hands large-knuckled and calloused from years of physical work and gear maintenance.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at the temples', N'Pulled back tight in a functional braid, practical rather than styled', N'Long', N'Cybernetic — chrome iris rings surrounding deep brown biological pupils. Thermal overlay visible as faint amber warming beneath the metallic surface.', N'Deep warm brown with golden, olive, and subtle copper undertones, reflecting the layered blend of Sub-Saharan African, North African, South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, East Asian, and Northern European ancestry', N'Weathered and clean. Minimal makeup. A small scar bisects her left eyebrow — old, well-healed. Jaw is squared and prominent with Northern European influence in the bone structure. High cheekbones and pronounced orbital ridges suggest Sub-Saharan African heritage. Subtle eye shape variation hints at East Asian genetics. Expression rests in neutral watchfulness, lips thin and rarely smiling.', N'Chrome cybernetic eyes with visible iris rings that catch light. The enhancement hardware sits flush with the orbital bone but unmistakably artificial. No attempt to disguise or blend them. The internal drug synthesizer leaves no visible external evidence.', N'Stands with weight slightly forward on the balls of her feet — ready posture. Movements are economical and deliberate, no wasted motion. Hands are usually occupied with something — a tool, a device, a cigarette — rarely at rest. When still, she maintains 360-degree awareness, head turning in measured sweeps.', N'Tier 3-4 functional aesthetic. Dark-colored utility jacket with reinforced panels and too many pockets — well-worn and maintained. Tactical cargo pants with cargo webbing. Worn steel-toed boots, laced tight. Layers underneath that can be added or removed. A subdermal armor plate is visible along her collarbone where jacket neckline sits — burnished steel panel. No corporate branding, no unnecessary jewelry. A single silver ring on her left ring finger — worn thin, possibly inherited.', N'Ngaire Rojas-Yeboah maintains a second identity — a completely clean civilian persona with a lease, a job history, and a social profile. It''s their exit strategy.', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'nneka_balogun_arredondo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63b-747e-8220-a0bd5d6d9af1', N'Conrado Vestergaard-Kristjánsson', N'Conrado', N'', N'Vestergaard-Kristjánsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 30, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — rooms in the community center when he''s not sleeping at whatever client location needs overnight security, near Western and Division', N'Field protector and physical security — Last Light', N'Last Light', N'Conrado Vestergaard-Kristjánsson stands between excluded people and the things that hurt them. That''s the job. Everything else — the pay, the recognition, the future — is negotiable. Josiah is six-two, built like a person who does physical work because physical work needs doing, and carries himself with the controlled energy of someone who learned early that being big and Black in the Gray Zone means every interaction starts with someone else''s assumptions about your intentions.

He grew up in a the Gray Zone community defense collective — neighbors who organized to protect their block when corporate security treated the area as an unregulated zone. His mother ran the collective. His father was killed by a private security contractor during a jurisdictional sweep when Josiah was eleven. The contractor faced no charges because the Gray Zone exists in a governance gap where accountability is a luxury the excluded cannot afford. Josiah learned two things from this: violence is the language the powerful speak, and the powerless need someone who can translate.

Ruth recruited him from the community defense network three years ago. He came because Ruth''s approach — legal frameworks, documented resistance, non-violent intervention — was more sustainable than the collective''s escalating confrontations with security forces. He stays because Ruth is the most principled person he has ever met and because the work, even underfunded and exhausting, feels like the only honest thing left.', N'Josiah embodies the physical cost of non-violent resistance — the bruises, the restraint, the barely contained fury of a strong man who chooses not to fight back because the cause requires it. His stories explore the tension between justice and anger, between his father''s death and Ruth''s principles, between the violence he''s capable of and the peace he''s chosen.', N'', N'Reinforced skeletal structure in arms, shoulders, and ribcage — installed by a the Gray Zone surgeon after a beating during a community defense action. The augmentation was paid for by a community fund. Dermal toughening on forearms and hands — not armor, but sufficient to absorb impacts. No neural or cognitive augmentations — Josiah doesn''t trust anything in his brain that he didn''t put there.', N'Wakes early. Physical training in the community center''s back room — functional, practical, focused on endurance and restraint. Reviews the day''s protection assignments from Ruth. Accompanies clients through checkpoints, provides physical security during eviction confrontations, and patrols the blocks around the community center. Evenings he maintains the center''s physical infrastructure — repairs, security improvements, the practical work of keeping a building functional on no budget. Eats at the community kitchen. Sleeps when the clients are safe.', N'Conrado Vestergaard-Kristjánsson, 188cm tall athletic build, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, high angular cheekbones blending Northern European and Central Asian features with broader nose and full lips from African heritage, dark brown eyes, short black close-cropped hair. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Wears reinforced dark grey cargo pants, muted charcoal synthetic shirt under weathered canvas work jacket modified with extra pockets, combat boots. Subtle silvery-grey dermal toughening visible on forearms and hands from subcutaneous augmentation. Faint surgical scar across left collarbone, thin white scar along left jaw. Stands with coiled readiness, weight evenly distributed, completely present and alert. No excess movement. Industrial repair stitching visible on worn clothing. Neon-lit urban environment, cool-toned neo-noir lighting casting subtle highlights on richly pigmented warm skin, cinematic, moody, professional security operative aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Northern European (40.3%) and Eastern European (34.8%) form the genetic foundation, creating cool-toned baseline features. Substantial secondary ancestry from Eastern Europe adds Slavic cheekbone prominence. Sub-Saharan African (9.4%), Central Asian (6.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (5.8%), and South Asian (2.8%) contributions create phenotypic warmth and depth. The result: warm light-to-medium brown skin with golden undertones, higher and more angular cheekbones from Northern/Eastern European and Central Asian mix, broader nasal bridge and fuller lips from African heritage, eye structure reflecting the layered ancestry with darker pigmentation throughout.', 188, 95, N'Athletic and densely muscled from consistent functional training — broad shoulders, thick chest, forearms visibly corded. Carries weight efficiently, zero excess body fat. Built for endurance and controlled application of force rather than bulk.', N'Black', N'Close-cropped, maintained practical and low-maintenance', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Warm light-to-medium brown with subtle golden undertones, luminous and richly pigmented from the blending of Northern European fairness with African, Central Asian, and Latin American melanin contribution', N'Clear and resilient, weathered from outdoor patrols and exposure. A thin scar traces along his left jaw — old, white, barely noticeable unless light catches it at an angle. Angular, high cheekbones reflecting Northern/Eastern European and Central Asian ancestry; broader nasal structure and fuller lip definition show African heritage influence. Facial geometry carries balanced proportions from the complex ancestry blend. His face maintains the neutral expression of someone who has learned to be physically present without seeming threatening; it takes effort.', N'The reinforced skeletal structure does not produce visible chrome or obvious augmentation markers — it was installed subcutaneously by a the Gray Zone surgeon. What is visible: the forearm dermal toughening appears as subtle discoloration and slightly thickened skin texture on both forearms and hands, creating a faint matte finish that catches light differently than natural skin. The area has a faint silvery-grey undertone where subcutaneous reinforcement sits beneath the epidermis. Not obvious to casual observation, but apparent to anyone who knows what to look for.', N'Stands with weight evenly distributed, knees slightly bent — always ready to move in any direction. Walks with controlled deliberation, each step purposeful. Does not gesture expansively; movements are economical and precise. Eyes track his environment constantly. When still, he has the coiled readiness of a person trained in physical protection — not tense, but present.', N'Tier 4 practical — durable, functional, clearly chosen for utility over appearance. Wears reinforced cargo pants in dark grey or black, often with visible tool loops and patches from repeated repair. Thermal underlayers beneath loose-fit synthetic shirts in muted colors (charcoal, slate, faded black). A weathered canvas work jacket, the Gray Zone-modified with added pockets and reinforced seams. Worn combat boots, kept meticulously maintained. No jewelry or personal adornment. Clothing shows evidence of frequent physical activity — small tears repaired with industrial stitching, fabric worn pale at stress points. Everything fits loosely enough to allow full range of motion.', N'He has identified the private security firm that employed the contractor who killed his father. The firm still operates in GLMZ. He has the contractor''s name. He has done nothing with this information because acting on it would betray everything Ruth has taught him. The information sits in his chest like a second heartbeat.', N'Direct, physical, occasionally quoting his mother''s community defense principles. He speaks in concrete terms — bodies, spaces, threats. Abstract concepts get translated into physical metaphors.', N'Measured when calm, which is most of the time. Sentences get shorter and harder as he approaches his limit. The crew measures his state by sentence length.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'conrado_vestergaard_kristj_nsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a61c-7b67-b3da-a0d23451a6de', N'Aksel Fredriksen', N'Aksel', N'', N'Fredriksen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 64, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Geartown, near Halsted and Division', N'Junk merchant and scrap reseller', N'Independent; long-standing member of the Gray Zone informal vendor collective; deep roots in the Geartown community', N'Aksel Fredriksen is a big man gone soft at the edges, with the kind of weathered dark-brown face that has accumulated sixty-four years of Geartown grime into its creases. His Burkinabé father''s cheekbones sit high and prominent beneath small, watchful eyes, and the Swedish side of the family gave him an improbable red-grey beard that he refuses to trim, which is now impressively large. His left arm from the elbow down is a heavy-duty industrial prosthetic in bare gunmetal — he has never decorated it, never chromed it, and finds the idea faintly obscene. He moves slowly, deliberately, like a man who has learned that things don''t need to be rushed when you know what you have.

Aksel Fredriksen''s stall on the Gray Zone is less a stall than an archaeology site — forty years of accumulated junk organized according to a system that exists only in his head, which he navigates with the certainty of a man walking through his own house in the dark. He is terse with strangers, generous to a fault with regulars, and holds strong opinions about the difference between junk worth keeping and junk that has given up. He prays loudly to the ELF he believes inhabits a broken micro-fabricator at the back of his stall, which he calls ''the Sleeper,'' and leaves it oiling rags as offerings.', N'Equipment and parts source, local historian of Geartown, ELF lore through his relationship with the Sleeper. A character who has seen enough that he remembers things others have forgotten — corporate actions, neighborhood changes, people who disappeared.', N'', N'Left forearm industrial prosthetic (functional, undecorated). Subretinal low-light enhancer — ''for reading part numbers in the dark, nothing fancy.''', N'Opens at dawn, when the salvage haulers come through with fresh loads. Spends mornings sorting and appraising, afternoons selling and trading, evenings doing minor repair work on salvageable items. Eats at the stall. Goes home to Geartown at dusk, walking the same route he has walked for forty years.', N'Aksel Fredriksen, 188cm tall weathered man with golden-brown skin with olive undertones, heavily lined face with deep eye creases and temple scar, dark brown eyes with faint amber glow, full rust-grey beard to mid-chest, short greyed hair thinning on crown. Broad-shouldered build softening at waist. Left arm industrial gunmetal prosthetic from elbow down with visible joint articulation. Wears faded black canvas cargo pants with knee patches, oil-stained brown Carhartt jacket, grey thermal undershirt, scuffed steel-toed boots. Calloused hands, faded indigo geometric tattoo on right inner forearm. Standing in dimly-lit salvage workshop or warehouse, cool neon and practical work lighting, surrounded by metallic debris and industrial tools. Deliberate posture favoring right side. Moody GLMZ setting, melancholic but commanding presence. Realistic aging, no glamour, pure functional utilitarian aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Northern European (37.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (33.1%), Southeast Asian (18.4%), and South Asian (11.2%) ancestry; creates a warm golden-brown skin tone with subtle olive undertones from the balanced, complex ancestral blend. The mix produces moderate facial structure with defined cheekbones and jawline characteristic of diverse genetic heritage.', 188, 98, N'Broad-shouldered and barrel-chested, softening at the waist and midsection with age; still carries the frame of a man who moved heavy things for decades, now settled into deliberate, economical movement', N'Red-grey with rust undertones', N'Full, unkempt beard extending to mid-chest, unstyled and never trimmed; hair on head short and thinning, greyed almost completely', N'Short on head, Long beard', N'Dark brown with faint subretinal augmentation visible as a faint amber luminescence in low light', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle olive depth, midtone from balanced ancestral blend; greyed and weathered from decades of metallic dust exposure', N'Heavily lined face with deep creases around the eyes and mouth; weathered but clean; small scar through left eyebrow from a tool accident in his fifties; calloused hands, right hand more than left; facial structure shows blended ancestry with moderate cheekbones and defined jawline reflecting Northern European, Hispanic, Southeast Asian, and South Asian genetic mix', N'Left arm prosthetic from elbow down: heavy-duty industrial model in bare gunmetal grey, utilitarian and undecorated, with visible joint articulation and cable routing; no chrome, no color-work, no aesthetic modification. Subretinal augmentation not immediately obvious but produces faint amber glow in darkness when active.', N'Moves slowly and deliberately with the careful economy of an older man who has learned efficiency through forty years of repetition; stands with weight favoring right side due to left arm imbalance; rarely rushes; communicates with economy of gesture and long, appraising stares; carries himself with the quiet confidence of someone in complete command of their small domain', N'Tier 4-5 practical: heavy canvas cargo pants in faded black, patched at both knees with different fabric; worn Carhartt-style jacket in brown, stained with oil and oxidation; thermal undershirt visible at neckline, greyed from washing; steel-toed boots, scuffed and re-soled multiple times; no jewelry except a simple band on right ring finger (silver, old). Everything functional, nothing decorative. No corporate branding.', N'He found a Zheng-Dao proprietary fabrication schematic in a salvage haul two years ago — something significant enough that he knew immediately he should not have it. He has not sold it. He has not told anyone about it. It is folded inside an oiling rag that he moves to a new hiding spot in the stall every month. He doesn''t know what to do with it but knows that throwing it away feels wrong.', N'Minimal. Short declarative sentences. Technical vocabulary for parts and salvage is precise and extensive; personal vocabulary is deliberately narrow.', N'Slow, with long pauses that he is entirely comfortable with and other people are not', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aksel_fredriksen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c8-7a8d-93d9-a0d31d572f15', N'Bolaji Cisneros', N'Bolaji', N'', N'Cisneros', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 71, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Norwood Quiet, the Meridian Community Education Hub — a converted commercial space two blocks from her apartment, near North Ave and Damen', N'Retired schoolteacher and former local union leader, now volunteers teaching literacy and numeracy to adults in the community center', N'Educators'' Mutual Compact (retired, occasionally advisory); Norwood Quiet Community Hub volunteer; informally connected to the anti-privatization education network', N'Bolaji Cisneros has the particular energy of someone who has been arguing for sixty years and has gotten very good at it. She is compact and brown-skinned with Fijian-Dutch features — wide nose, sharp jaw, bright dark eyes behind wire-framed smart lenses — and she dresses in the vivid, slightly mismatched way of someone who finds color genuinely delightful and has stopped worrying about coordination. Her hair is cut short and natural and she has, impulsively, dyed the front section a deep cobalt blue, which she will tell you was a retirement gift to herself. She walks with energy, her hands always slightly in motion.

She taught mathematics and critical reasoning at the Norwood Quiet Collective Schoolhouse for thirty-nine years, and for nineteen of those years she served as regional chair of the Educators'' Mutual Compact, the independent union that fought the ongoing corponation push to absorb public education into proprietary learning systems. She won some and lost some. The proprietary systems are everywhere now, which is why she runs free adult classes out of the community hub — because she has seen what happens when people cannot read contracts, cannot do the math on their own UBC stipends, cannot check the numbers on a corporate work agreement. She is not sentimental about this. It is simply an emergency and she is responding to it.', N'Information source on education privatization and corponation labor practices; community activist with a long network; can connect player characters to resources or people; source of grounded moral challenges about systemic issues', N'', N'Smart lenses (basic consumer model — she refused corporate-sponsored upgrades on principle). Cochlear enhancement for moderate hearing loss, installed age 65.', N'Teaches two adult literacy classes per week and one numeracy class; spends remaining weekdays preparing materials and connecting struggling students to other resources. Attends every Norwood Quiet community meeting and is the person most likely to ask the pointed question no one else will.', N'Bolaji Cisneros, a 65-year-old woman of Hispanic-Latin American and North African descent, short salt-and-pepper hair with deliberate cobalt blue dyed front section, warm medium brown skin with golden undertones. Dark brown intense eyes framed by wire-rimmed smart lenses with blue AR tint. Compact, wiry build, weather-lined expressive face with defined cheekbones. Wearing mismatched hand-knitted rust-orange and moss-green cardigan over a thrifted blazer decorated with labor organization pins, faded red canvas slip-ons. Behind-ear cochlear enhancement port visible. Hands in animated gestures, sitting at edge of chair with sharp engaged posture. Forty-year-old silver watch visible. GLMZ 2226 near-future megacity setting, warm amber indoor lighting, papers scattered nearby, expression of focused intensity, urban classroom or community center background --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Norwood Quiet', N'local', N'Norwood Quiet', N'Hispanic/Latin American (51.4%) with North African (44.4%) and Middle Eastern (4.2%) ancestry. The combined Hispanic and North African majority creates warm, sun-kissed medium brown skin with golden and terracotta undertones. North African heritage contributes characteristic facial bone structure—defined cheekbones and balanced proportions—while Hispanic ancestry adds warmth and dimensionality to her complexion. The Middle Eastern component intensifies her dark eye expression and adds subtle richness to her overall warmth.', 158, 62, N'Compact and dense, the kind of frame that suggests decades of purposeful motion rather than leisure. Shoulders slightly rounded from years at a desk and standing before classrooms, but the core is wiry and strong.', N'Salt-and-pepper natural base with deliberate deep cobalt blue dye in the front section', N'Close-cropped, natural texture, layered for ease of maintenance; the blue section catches light when she moves her head', N'Short', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Warm medium brown with golden and terracotta undertones, reflecting the blended heritage of Hispanic/Latin American and North African ancestry with subtle Middle Eastern depth', N'Weather-lined face that reads as lived-in rather than aged; balanced facial structure with defined cheekbones characteristic of North African and Hispanic ancestry; dark eyes that focus intently with characteristic intensity. Minimal makeup, skin care is functional rather than cosmetic. Expression lines around eyes and mouth from sixty years of talking, arguing, and listening.', N'Wire-framed smart lenses with thin blue-tinted AR display (basic consumer model, deliberately unfashionable). Small discreet behind-ear module visible when she turns her head sharply — the cochlear enhancement port, barely noticeable against her warm brown skin tone.', N'Walks with purpose and energy despite her age, shoulders forward slightly as if always ready to engage. Hands are constantly in motion — gesturing while speaking, rearranging papers, making small adjusting movements. She sits at the edge of chairs rather than settling back. When listening, her posture sharpens rather than relaxes. No wasted motion, but nothing hurried.', N'Tier 4-5 practical and vivid: hand-knitted cardigans in unexpected color combinations (rust-orange paired with moss-green), thrifted blazers with pins from various labor organizations and community groups, sensible flat shoes (currently a well-worn pair of canvas slip-ons in faded red). Favors natural fabrics — cotton, linen, wool — partly for comfort and partly on principle. Wears the same silver watch she''s had for forty years. Clothes are clean but noticeably mismatched and slightly unfashionable, worn by someone who finds the coordination of color genuinely delightful and has stopped performing conformity.', N'During her final years as union chair, she agreed to a compromise with Axiom''s education division that she publicly framed as a minor concession. In practice it allowed Axiom to embed proprietary software in three schools in exchange for funding the teachers'' pension fund. She has never disclosed this fully. The pension still pays her old colleagues. She has told herself this was a trade she had to make. She is still not sure.', N'Clear, precise, pedagogical — she explains things as a teacher explains things, but without condescension. Will use technical vocabulary and then immediately define it.', N'Energetic, slightly fast. She has a habit of finishing other people''s sentences — not rudely, she genuinely thinks she''s helping.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bolaji_cisneros');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a658-7d49-94a8-a0fd5679923c', N'Ahaba Kovács-Tehrani', N'Ahaba', N'', N'Kovács-Tehrani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'non-binary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Milwaukee Core — no fixed address. Rotates between three rented rooms under different names.', N'Infiltration and social engineering specialist — The Thermite Collective', N'The Thermite Collective', N'Ahaba Kovács-Tehrani a face. They have a collection. Dermal sculpting implants allow them to shift bone structure, skin texture, and pigmentation within a biological range — not shapeshifting, but close enough to make identification functionally impossible. They can walk into a building as a maintenance tech, walk out as a mid-level executive, and neither identity will trigger a security flag because both were built from real employee data.

Before the Thermite Collective, Mika ran solo social engineering jobs — impersonating corporate employees to gain physical access to secured facilities. They were good at it. Too good. The jobs started blurring into each other, and the faces started sticking. There were mornings when they''d look in the mirror and not remember which configuration was the original. Vesper found them during a job that overlapped — Mika was impersonating a Torii Security consultant, and Vesper recognized the credentials as fake because she''d written the real ones. Instead of burning Mika, she offered them a job.

They are slender, average height, with features that default to a pleasant neutrality — the base state that exists between performances. Their eyes are the only constant: dark brown, watchful, cataloguing. They dress for whichever role is next, but in downtime they wear oversized hoodies and look younger than twenty-nine.', N'Mika explores identity as a theme — what happens when you can be anyone and the cost is losing yourself. Their stories within the heist framework are about the performances within the performance, the masks within the mask. They are the crew member most at risk of psychological dissolution.', N'', N'Dermal sculpting array — subdermal actuators that reshape facial bone structure, skin texture, and pigmentation within a 15% variance range. Voice modulator implant that adjusts pitch, resonance, and accent. Eidetic social memory cortex — perfect recall of names, faces, mannerisms, and conversational patterns for identity construction.', N'Mornings are research — building identities from scraped employee databases, social media fragments, and public records. Afternoons are rehearsal — practicing gaits, mannerisms, vocal patterns in front of recording equipment. Evenings are decompression, which looks like sitting in dark rooms watching old films and trying to remember what they actually enjoy versus what a cover identity enjoyed. They eat irregularly and sleep when the faces let them.', N'Ahaba Kovács-Tehrani, 172cm tall androgynous figure with East Asian-dominant diaspora heritage reflected in warm medium-brown skin with olive undertones, moderate cheekbones blending East Asian geometry with Indigenous American and Middle Eastern influences, dark oversaturated eyes with pupils showing implant-lag dilation. Short dark brown hair, slender wiry build, naturally unassuming posture. Wearing oversized charcoal hoodie and loose-fit pants in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting. Faint linear scar visible on left inner wrist. Subdermal temple ports visible as subtle dimples. Skin shows faint shimmer under neon lighting suggesting active subcutaneous augmentations. Sitting in dimly-lit hab-pod with soft blue and amber lighting, surrounded by identity documents and memory-core diagnostic displays glowing softly. Posture suggests someone who exists without occupying space. Neo-noir urban aesthetic with biopunk undertones, moody atmospheric lighting, photorealistic rendering --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Milwaukee Core', N'local', N'Milwaukee Core', N'Complex diaspora blend with East Asian dominance (46.2%) layered with Indigenous American (16.7%), Middle Eastern (15.0%), Eastern European (14.9%), and Hispanic/Latin American (7.2%) ancestry. Facial structure reflects this East Asian-primary foundation: moderate cheekbones with slight flattening characteristic of East Asian genetics, softened and broadened by Indigenous American and Middle Eastern influences. Eye shape shows East Asian geometry with deeper-set positioning from Middle Eastern admixture. Skin tone is warm medium brown with olive undertones from the Middle Eastern and Hispanic components, capable of subtle 10-15% variation via dermal sculpting. The overall effect is deliberately nondescript—a face designed by ancestry to slip through recognition systems, enhanced by years of practiced forgetting.', 172, 62, N'Slender, wiry frame with minimal musculature — built for misdirection rather than presence. Shoulders slightly narrow, posture naturally unassuming. The kind of body that vanishes in a crowd by design.', N'Dark brown, naturally occurring — the default state before modification', N'Kept short and unremarkable; styled differently depending on active identity. In downtime, often undone.', N'Short', N'Dark brown, slightly oversaturated — the only constant. Pupils dilate and contract with active recall; tells if you know how to read it.', N'Warm medium brown with subtle olive undertones — the baseline reflection of East Asian-dominant ancestry tempered by Middle Eastern, Indigenous American, and Eastern European components. Capable of shifting 10-15% via dermal sculpting array.', N'Smooth, intentionally forgettable features. Moderate cheekbones with East Asian geometry softened by Indigenous American breadth and Middle Eastern depth, slightly asymmetrical jawline (asymmetry aids memorability tricks). No blemishes, scars, or natural distinguishing marks — the blank canvas before performance. Skin texture can shift from smooth to subtly textured depending on role requirements.', N'None visible at baseline. The dermal sculpting array is subcutaneous; the voice modulator implant sits behind the larynx. The eidetic cortex implant leaves no external markers. However, subtle tells betray the augmentations: pupils that dilate unnaturally fast during conversation, skin that seems to shimmer faintly under certain light angles, micro-expressions of concentration when accessing implant-stored memories. Anyone trained in reading augmentation signs would clock them immediately.', N'In baseline state: economical movement, minimal gesturing, posture that avoids drawing attention. They move like someone who has learned to exist in spaces without occupying them. In performance: posture shifts radically — slouch becomes confident spine, shuffle becomes purposeful stride. The transition is the tell; they commit entirely to whoever they''re being in the moment. Under stress, fingers twitch subtly (implant processing lag), and they blink in patterns that don''t align with natural conversation rhythm.', N'In downtime: oversized hoodies (charcoal, black, muted blue), loose-fit pants, worn sneakers — juvenile aesthetic, almost deliberately underdeveloped. Tier 3-4 comfort wear; nothing branded. In active roles: wardrobe rotates per identity — corporate Torii Security consultant one day (tailored blazer, sharp trousers, minimal jewelry), maintenance tech the next (company-issue jumpsuit, utility belt, work boots). All clothing is rented, borrowed, or acquired under false names. Nothing is kept; nothing is traceable.', N'They have maintained one identity for seven years — a quiet librarian named Elara who volunteers at a Circuit reading room every Thursday. No one in the crew knows. Mika does not know why this identity matters so much.', N'Adapts to context. Base-state Mika uses simple, direct language — almost childlike in its clarity. On the job, they speak in whatever register the identity requires.', N'In base state: halting, searching for words that feel like theirs. On a job: fluid, confident, perfectly calibrated.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ahaba_kov_cs_tehrani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6de-70b0-9391-a0ff4e654f83', N'Aditya Ekwensi', N'Aditya', N'', N'Ekwensi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 47, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Meridian Core — maintains an office suite in a mid-tier commercial building under a shell consulting company, near State and Monroe', N'Crew lead and strategic operations director — The Margin Call', N'Copperveil Intelligence (executive-level crew lead and strategic operations director)', N'Aditya Ekwensi a Senior Director of Competitive Intelligence. The title meant he ran the division that stole other corporations'' secrets. He was exceptional at it — methodical, patient, and possessed of an institutional understanding of corporate psychology that no street runner can replicate. When Veridian''s internal politics turned and his division was restructured (a euphemism for purged), Sterling walked out with his knowledge, his augmentations, and the understanding that the corporate world would eventually need him again, but on his terms.

The Margin Call operates as a freelance corporate intelligence unit — three ex-corpo operators who conduct espionage, counter-espionage, and strategic disruption for clients who want corporate-quality work without corporate-traceable assets. They dress like executives, think like executives, and deploy tradecraft that was developed in corporate intelligence labs rather than learned on the streets. This makes them simultaneously more effective and more alien than traditional runner crews.

Sterling is tall, lean, immaculately groomed, with silver at the temples that he maintains because it communicates authority. He wears tailored suits in every operational context — the suit is the cover identity, the operational tool, and the psychological armor. His face is pleasant, forgettable, and optimized — subtle dermal work that makes him the platonic ideal of a trustworthy executive. He has the handshake of a man who has closed billion-credit deals and the eyes of a man who has destroyed careers for strategic advantage.', N'Sterling brings the corporate espionage genre to GLMZ. His stories are about information as a weapon, about institutions as living organisms, and about the invisible war between corporations that determines the visible reality of the city. He is the character who understands the system from the inside and chooses to exploit it from the outside — not out of principle, but out of pragmatism.', N'', N'Cognitive enhancement suite (Veridian corporate tier) — accelerated strategic processing, pattern recognition, and memory compartmentalization. Dermal optimization — subtle facial restructuring for maximum social trust metrics. Encrypted internal communication array (corporate-grade, self-maintaining). Stress-dampening endocrine regulator that maintains physiological calm during high-stakes social interactions.', N'Wakes at 0500. Reads financial analysis, corporate filings, and jurisdictional regulatory changes over breakfast — always at the same restaurant, always the same table. Arrives at the office by 0700. Manages active operations, client relationships, and crew tasking throughout the day. Evenings are intelligence synthesis — connecting the day''s information into the larger strategic picture. Attends corporate social functions under cover identities to maintain access to the ecosystem. Sleeps six hours exactly.', N'Aditya Ekwensi, 47-year-old senior corporate executive, 188cm tall, lean athletic build. Rich mahogany-bronze skin with warm golden undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, Southeast Asian, Middle Eastern, and Eastern European heritage. Strong defined African bone structure refined by South Asian proportions, fuller mid-face from Southeast Asian genetics, strong jawline from Middle Eastern heritage. Deep warm brown eyes with barely visible neural interface points. Dark brown hair with distinguished silver at temples, conservative executive cut. Perfectly symmetrical face suggesting subtle dermal optimization. Thin pale 8cm scar along left clavicle. Wearing custom tailored charcoal suit, white pressed shirt, muted expensive tie, brushed steel cufflinks concealing microinjection ports. Italian leather shoes polished to mirror finish. Seated in high-rise office with floor-to-ceiling windows, city lights glowing at dusk beyond. Posture perfectly still, completely controlled. Neutral professional expression. Cool corporate lighting with slight warm amber from city glow. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Photograph quality, photorealistic, cinematic, professional corporate portraiture --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Core', N'local', N'Meridian Core', N'Pan-diaspora blend dominated by Sub-Saharan African (37.3%) genetics creating strong bone structure and depth, substantially enriched by South Asian (24.5%) heritage adding refined facial proportions and mid-face fullness, with significant Southeast Asian (18.2%) contribution softening features and adding warm golden undertones. Middle Eastern ancestry (12.2%) defines jawline strength and contributes warm amber tones, while Eastern European (5.1%) and Hispanic/Latin American (2.7%) heritage add subtle complexity to overall phenotype. The result is striking genetic diversity — deep African structural foundation layered with South and Southeast Asian softness, warm Middle Eastern definition, and subtle cool undertones from Eastern European ancestry.', 188, 79, N'Lean and naturally tall with deliberate postural control — no excess muscle mass, but the kind of structured fitness that comes from discipline rather than vanity. Shoulders held level, core engaged at rest.', N'Dark brown with intentional silver at temples', N'Conservative executive cut — precisely maintained, parted, no product visible. The silver is never dyed out; it''s strategically maintained as a trust signal.', N'Short', N'Deep warm brown with subtle neural interface points at the iris periphery — visible only under direct light', N'Rich medium-deep mahogany-bronze complexion with warm golden undertones — the depth reflecting substantial Sub-Saharan and South Asian ancestry, the golden warmth from Middle Eastern and Southeast Asian heritage blending seamlessly. Skin has natural radiance, even luminosity, and striking visual depth from authentic genetic diversity rather than optimization.', N'Facially symmetrical in a way that reads as subtly artificial — dermal optimization has refined minor asymmetries while preserving authentic genetic character. Strong, defined bone structure characteristic of African heritage with the refined facial proportions of South Asian ancestry. Fuller mid-face from Southeast Asian genetics, strong jawline accentuated by Middle Eastern heritage. Skin is clear, moisturized, unmarred. The subtle over-symmetry of optimization is evident only to trained eyes, while the authentic genetic complexity of his mixed heritage remains visually striking — creating memorable professionalism layered with genuine human diversity.', N'The augmentations are designed for invisibility. Neural interface points around the iris are visible only in specific lighting. The dermal optimization work is evident only to someone trained to recognize it — subtle over-symmetry, perfect skin tone, minimal pore visibility. To most observers, he simply looks like a well-maintained 47-year-old executive. The cufflinks occasionally catch light to reveal circular ports, but this reads as high-end jewelry.', N'Moves with the economy of someone who has trained to control every gesture. No fidgeting, no wasted motion. When seated, perfectly still — the kind of stillness that suggests internal processing rather than relaxation. Handshake is firm, duration exactly 2-3 seconds, grip pressure calibrated. Eye contact is constant but not aggressive. Speech is measured, with deliberate pauses that communicate confidence and control.', N'Tailored suits in charcoal, navy, and dark gray — custom fit, likely Tier 1-2 corpo clothiers. Shirts are white, cream, or pale blue, always pressed to knife-edge precision. Ties are muted, expensive, subtle. Shoes are Italian leather, polished to mirror finish. Watches are understated — either vintage Rolex or modern minimalist design. Cufflinks in brushed steel or gold. The overall presentation is ''senior director who has moved between three multinational corporations'' — the uniform of legitimate power. Even when conducting street operations, the suit remains; it is his camouflage and his weapon.', N'He was not restructured. He was given a choice: accept reassignment to a black project that would have required him to target civilian infrastructure, or resign with prejudice. He resigned. The black project is still operational. He has files on it. He has done nothing with them.', N'Corporate, strategic, polished. He speaks in the language of boardrooms — value propositions, risk matrices, stakeholder alignment. It''s not affectation; it''s his native tongue.', N'Smooth, controlled, deliberately paced to maximize impact. He never rushes. He never stammers. Every sentence is pre-structured.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aditya_ekwensi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6fa-7bda-b626-a14830b4ec47', N'Baris Anang', N'Baris', N'', N'Anang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 48, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism, private practice suite, near Clark and Addison', N'Psychiatrist and neural calibrator at a Tessera-adjacent private practice, Tier 3-4', N'Private practice (self-operated); Tessera consulting contract for employee wellness; Aurochs Medical Complex (adjunct, neural calibration referrals)', N'Baris Anang is a man composed, very deliberately, of elegant surfaces. He is tall and lean with rich brown skin, high cheekbones that suggest the Kenyan branch of his heritage, and silver-touched locs pulled back in a style that manages to look both professional and effortless. His eyes are modded — deep violet irises with a thin luminescent ring at the pupil, which he chose specifically because research showed they promote patient disclosure. He dresses in muted, high-quality fabrics that speak of money without announcing it. His Edgewater Prism office has real plants, soft acoustic paneling, and a specifically calibrated ambient sound environment. Everything about the room — and about him — has been designed to make people feel safe enough to be honest.

Baris Anang specializes in neural calibration for patients experiencing cognitive disruption from augmentation integration — a growing population in GLMZ''s upper tiers, where people buy more chrome than their brains can smoothly accommodate. He is genuinely skilled, credentialed through both Aurochs and a Tessera-affiliated training program, and effective. He is also emotionally opaque in a way that he has never had to confront because his opacity looks, from the outside, like serene professional boundaries. He is interested in his patients. He is less certain he is capable of being interested in peers. His E.L.F. devotion is performative — he maintains a small shrine in his office because patients find it reassuring — though he caught himself genuinely speaking to it once after a session that went badly, and has not examined that moment.', N'Access to the Tier 3-4 world and Tessera''s internal employee culture; potential source of information about corporate psychological pressure and breaking points; complex moral figure — does he breach confidentiality? Under what pressure? A character who players might seek for mental health support or to understand an NPC''s psychology', N'', N'Violet modded irises with luminescent pupil ring (chosen for therapeutic effect as much as aesthetics); neural interface for direct calibration tool access — allows him to read augmentation integration diagnostics and make micro-adjustments during sessions; subtle scent gland mod that produces a mild calming compound he is ethically obligated to disclose to patients and always does', N'Théophile sees six to eight patients per day in carefully spaced sessions, with forty-five minute gaps for documentation and decompression. He takes lunch alone. Two days a week he consults at Tessera''s employee health center. He spends evenings reading — physical books, medical literature and narrative fiction in equal measure.', N'Baris Anang, GLMZ, tall lean mixed-heritage man with warm medium-deep brown skin with golden-copper undertones, high prominent cheekbones, strong jawline, long dark brown locs with silver threading pulled back neatly, striking violet modded irises with luminescent white pupil rings, subtle metallic neural interface tracery visible at temples, thin surgical scar on left temple, clean-shaven with calm measured expression, wearing charcoal tailored long-sleeve shirt and understated blazer in natural fabrics, silver wedding band, brushed titanium neural interface pendant, minimal jewelry, seated with deliberate stillness and economical posture, hands folded, emotionally neutral professional mask, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon-lit corporate interior with soft accent lighting catching the warmth of his skin tone and the luminescence of his eyes, moody atmospheric neo-noir urban aesthetic, cool-toned background, candid documentary style --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Indigenous American dominant (55.5%) with substantial Southeast Asian (20.2%) and East Asian (18.3%) ancestry, plus Central Asian (6.0%) elements. Facial structure reflects this complex blend: strong Indigenous American bone geometry with prominent, high cheekbones and defined jawline enhanced by Southeast Asian cheekbone prominence and East Asian eye shape contribution. Skin tone and complexion show rich interplay of these ancestries—warm medium-deep brown with golden-copper undertones from Indigenous American and Southeast Asian melanin expression, refined by East Asian genetic influence. Overall presence carries warmth and deliberate stillness.', 188, 78, N'Tall and lean with disciplined posture; shoulders slightly drawn back in a manner that suggests both yoga practice and deliberate self-presentation. Minimal body fat, defined cheekbones, wrists that look almost delicate despite his height.', N'Dark brown with natural silver threading', N'Locs, shoulder-length, pulled back into a neat tail or wrapped loosely at the crown during work hours. Groomed with precision but without apparent effort.', N'Long', N'Violet with luminescent white ring at pupil center', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden-copper undertones; rich melanin expression from Indigenous American and Southeast Asian ancestry blending with East Asian refinement into a complexion that catches light with subtle warmth.', N'Smooth skin with high, prominent cheekbones reflecting Indigenous American and Southeast Asian heritage; strong jawline from Indigenous American ancestry; full lips with natural definition; minimal facial hair (clean-shaven or very light stubble); calm, measured expression that rarely shifts; minor laugh lines at eyes suggest he smiles infrequently but genuinely.', N'Violet modded irises with luminescent pupil ring are immediately apparent and striking; subtle neural interface ports visible as faint metallic tracery at temples when light catches them at specific angles. No visible external augmentation beyond the eyes.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical grace; rarely gestures expansively; tends to sit very still during conversation, hands folded or resting on armrests. Walks slowly, suggesting he processes while moving. His default expression is attentive but emotionally neutral — a mask of professional interest that has calcified into his resting state.', N'Monochromatic or muted earth tones: charcoal, deep grey, sage, soft black. High-quality natural fabrics (linen, wool, organic cotton blends). Tailored but not ostentatiously so. Wears minimal jewelry — a simple silver wedding band (worn, suggesting long marriage), a discrete neural interface access pendant in brushed titanium. No logos, no status displays. Tier 3-4 wealth expressed through restraint and material quality rather than visibility. Typically: fitted long-sleeve shirt, understated blazer, tailored trousers, leather shoes worn to a soft shine.', N'', N'Precise, considered, never clinical-sounding despite clinical knowledge; has the particular skill of asking questions that feel like observations', N'Unhurried to the point of being slightly uncanny in fast-paced environments; breathes differently than most people — controlled, deliberate', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'baris_anang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a621-76ba-8cd2-a1b800af93eb', N'Basilio Boateng', N'Basilio', N'', N'Boateng', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower district tenements near the old lakeshore, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Precision elimination specialist — ghost', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Basilio Boateng is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 29, his expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Basilio Boateng plans to keep it that way. He works as a ghost out of the Gray Zone, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Basilio Boateng has built a reputation on reliability rather than flash — he shows up, he delivers, he collects.', N'Hadiya Chen-Adeyemi functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster. Bone lacing — titanium mesh throughout skeleton, increases durability and striking power', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Basilio Boateng, 2226 neo-noir mercenary, 178cm tall with dense muscular stocky build. Rich deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, angular cheekbones and squared jaw blending Sub-Saharan African and South Asian features. Black hair close-cropped with silver at temples. Deep brown analytical eyes. White scar tissue webbing across right mandible, thin scar above left eyebrow, knuckle scarring across both hands. Faint crimson-violet bioluminescent shimmer visible beneath skin at pulse points (wrists, neck, temples). Wears black tactical pants with reinforced panels, worn synthetic leather bomber jacket, grey compression shirt, scuffed steel-toed boots. Silver chain around neck with visible augmentation access ports. Economical precise posture, absolutely still or deliberately weighted movement. Dark low-light urban setting, neon glow illuminating his augmentation bioluminescence. Cinematic neo-noir urban aesthetic, gritty and functional, no vanity. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (53.8%) with significant Northern European (24.7%), South Asian (18.3%), and Southeast Asian (3.2%) ancestry. This creates a striking phenotype: rich deep brown skin with warm golden undertones, angular facial structure with prominent cheekbones from South Asian lineage blended with the broad, powerful features of Sub-Saharan African genetics. Northern European ancestry contributes lighter undertones and a slightly sharper nose bridge, while Southeast Asian ancestry adds subtle refinement to the overall bone structure. The result is a rare confluence of robust strength and distinctive angular elegance.', 178, 92, N'Stocky and densely muscled, broad-shouldered with a thick core. Heavy in the way that suggests practical strength rather than aesthetic bulk — the build of someone who trains for impact and durability, not display.', N'Black with premature silver threading at the temples', N'Close-cropped, functional. Kept short enough that it requires minimal maintenance and won''t obstruct vision or provide a target to grab.', N'Short', N'Deep brown, alert and analytical', N'Rich deep warm brown with golden undertones, the dominant Sub-Saharan African ancestry darkened and warmed by natural melanin concentration, brightened subtly by Northern European and South Asian admixture', N'Weathered and angular — prominent cheekbones and squared jaw characteristic of South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage merged, with broad strong features from African ancestry refined by the higher cheekbones of South Asian genetics. A scar tissue webbing the right side of his chin, white against darker skin. Skin is clear but shows the wear of someone who trains hard and heals fast. No vanity grooming — pragmatic maintenance only.', N'The synthetic blood is his signature — visible as a faint bioluminescent shimmer beneath the skin at pulse points (wrists, neck, temples), most noticeable in low light. The glow is a dull crimson-violet, rhythmic but subtle. No attempt to conceal it. The titanium bone lacing is subcutaneous and invisible, but the increased density and straightness of his posture, the precision of his movements, and the way he absorbs impact hints at skeletal reinforcement to trained eyes.', N'Economical and controlled. He moves with the precision of someone who has internalized that every motion is a statement. No wasted gestures. When still, he is absolutely still — no fidgeting, no micro-expressions. When moving, each step is deliberate and weighted. His hands rest in neutral positions, ready but not threatening. He doesn''t flinch.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Black tactical pants with reinforced knee and thigh panels, worn synthetic leather bomber jacket over a fitted grey compression shirt that allows augmentation visibility without advertising it. Steel-toed boots, scuffed but maintained. No logos, no flash — all function. A single worn silver chain around his neck, visible augmentation access ports deliberately left unhidden. The overall impression is someone who dresses for work, not for appearance.', N'', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'basilio_boateng');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a738-7e47-9a85-a1e4298a21ca', N'Chibuzo Oh', N'Chibuzo', N'', N'Oh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Brewer''s Spine — operates their cart at the intersection of Copperline Alley and the Spine''s main drag from 2000 to 0400, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Noodle cart vendor, Brewer''s Spine night market', N'Independent; loosely connected to the Brewer''s Spine night market vendors collective (dues-paying, rarely attends meetings)', N'Chibuzo Oh is sharp-featured and built narrow, with Finnish-Hausa coloring that lands them somewhere between copper and cream depending on the light, and geneware they saved for two years — a tail, pale grey and black-tipped, that wraps around their ankles when they''re focused on the wok. They keep their hair short and bleached at the tips, and they have a single line of bioluminescent text tattooed along their left forearm in Hausa script that reads, roughly, ''do not forget the sauce.'' (This is a joke. It is also not a joke.) They work in a kind of controlled explosion: the cart is immaculate and the output is rapid and the motion between station and bowl is practiced to the point of choreography.

Chibuzo Oh is twenty-three and running a noodle cart at two in the morning and they have not decided yet if this is a detour or a destination. They are smart in the restless, underutilized way — too much processing power applied to too small a problem — and they cope with this by making the small problem perfect. Their broth is not famous yet. It will be. They know it the way you know something you can''t say out loud because it sounds like arrogance before it becomes fact.', N'Local color and Brewer''s Spine night-world access point. Knows the 2AM-4AM population of the Spine — who works late, who is hiding, what has changed. A good source of ambient information and a potential recurring NPC who becomes more interesting the longer players return to the cart. Can be a quest giver if something threatens the night market.', N'', N'Geneware tail (pale grey, black-tipped, emotive); bioluminescent text tattoo on left forearm (cosmetic, non-functional beyond the aesthetic).', N'Sleeps until early afternoon, preps broth from 1600 (the broth takes four hours), rolls the cart to the Spine by 1945. Closes when the broth runs out or at 0400, whichever comes first. Has a second job they''re trying to phase out: data entry for a Zheng-Dao logistics subsidiary, done on their phone between orders.', N'Chibuzo Oh, 168cm wiry street chef with luminous golden-warm medium-deep brown skin blending East Asian, Southeast Asian, and African heritage. Closely cropped dark brown hair with platinum blonde fade highlights. Deep warm brown almond-shaped eyes with focused intensity. High cheekbones, defined angular jaw, slight laugh lines. Wearing dark grey hoodie over black utility apron, steel-toed work shoes. 1.2-meter pale grey geneware tail with black tips coiled around left ankle, adorned with glowing cyan bioluminescent Hausa script forearm tattoo reading ''do not forget the sauce''. Standing at night market wok station, warm blue neon overhead lighting, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Meditative posture, practiced economy of movement, ready-stance. Realistic character study, cinematic lighting, neo-noir atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Brewer''s Spine', N'local', N'Brewer''s Spine', N'Complex global diaspora blend — 32% East Asian (defined cheekbone structure, eye shape), 20.5% Southeast Asian (warm golden undertones, facial softness), 14.1% Hispanic/Latin American (slight broadening of facial structure), 13.5% Northern European (height and limb proportion), 12.8% Sub-Saharan African (skin depth and richness), 7.1% Eastern European (subtle angular features). Phenotype reflects substantial East and Southeast Asian ancestry with warm, luminous medium-deep complexion enhanced by African and warm Latin heritage components. Distinctly warm-toned rather than cool.', 168, 58, N'Narrow and wiry, built for efficiency rather than bulk. Long-limbed with defined musculature from repetitive kitchen work — shoulders and forearms show visible lean muscle. No excess body fat.', N'Natural dark brown with bleached platinum tips', N'Closely cropped, textured fade with intentional blonde highlights on the crown and sides', N'Short', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones', N'Rich warm medium-deep complexion with golden-amber luminosity. Reflects the blended warmth of East Asian, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry (65.3% combined), creating a glowing appearance across all lighting conditions. Deeper and warmer than cool-toned complexions.', N'High, defined cheekbones and angular jaw from East Asian heritage, softened by Southeast Asian and Latin American ancestry. Almond-shaped eye structure characteristic of East Asian genetics. Well-maintained skin despite nocturnal schedule — minimal visible acne, clear forehead. Faint laugh lines forming around the eyes. Expression defaults to focused intensity.', N'Pale grey-and-black geneware tail (living, emotive, capable of subtle movement and coiling). Bioluminescent forearm text visible in dim lighting. No obvious chrome or subdermal plating.', N'Moves with deliberate, practiced economy — every gesture minimized and efficient. When working the wok, becomes almost meditative, movements fluid and rhythmic. At rest or between customers, tends toward stillness rather than fidgeting. Tail mirrors emotional state, curling tighter when focused or stressed, relaxing when calm. Walks with a slight forward lean, ready-stance.', N'Tier 4 working-class functional. Typically wears heat-resistant synthetic apron over fitted dark utility clothes (usually black or charcoal). Loose-fitting pants with reinforced knee panels and cargo pockets, steel-toed slip-on work shoes. Favors oversized hoodies or tech-fiber jackets in muted tones (grey, dark green) for off-cart hours. Minimal jewelry — no accessories. Clothes show wear but are always clean; grease stains treated immediately. Aesthetic is practical-first, with subtle personal expression through color choices and a single well-maintained watch (used for timing broths).', N'They have a notebook — physical paper, which they paid too much for — containing a complete menu for a restaurant they have designed in their head. It has a name. They have never shown it to anyone. They are afraid that saying it out loud makes it available to fail.', N'Dry, quick, occasional Finnish-inflected rhythm from their mother''s speech patterns; uses food as metaphor for everything', N'Rapid when comfortable, goes very still and deliberate when something actually matters', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chibuzo_oh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c3-785d-9e84-a1fe59c3a8e7', N'Fabienne Kovács', N'Fabienne', N'', N'Kovács', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Irkalla district, operates out of a narrow apartment above a prosthetic repair shop, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Death midwife and pilgrimage guide', N'Independent; informal network of death midwives; loosely connected to the Irkalla Community Remembrance Trust', N'Fabienne Kovács has the kind of face that people describe afterward as calm, though in the moment of meeting her they''re not sure why — she has sharp Malian cheekbones and Iranian eyes that are a pale amber, and her expression in repose is something between watchful and patient. Her hair is natural and grown large, threaded through with small copper discs that catch light and make a very soft sound when she moves quickly. She has no visible augmentations save for a faint color-shifting quality to her skin under direct light — a cosmetic geneware inheritance from her grandmother''s generation, a barely-perceptible rainbow sheen that she has never tried to suppress.

She is one of the few certified death midwives in Irkalla, a district with a high mortality rate and historically poor access to formal end-of-life care. Her work involves sitting with the dying, helping families understand what is happening physiologically and spiritually, guiding the final upload or data-will processes for those who want them, and performing the closing rites of whatever tradition the dying person holds. She is also one of three guides who regularly leads pilgrimage walks through the city''s memorial infrastructure — the ghost-bridges, the data shrines, the submerged neighborhood markers. She does not advertise. People find her when they need her.', N'Emotional anchor for stories involving death, loss, or the question of what persists after someone is gone; keeper of district lore and history through memorial routes; can provide information about specific deaths or disappearances she attended.', N'', N'Faint iridescent skin sheen — cosmetic geneware, inherited, very subtle. No functional augmentations.', N'Her schedule is inherently irregular — she may be called at any hour; when not in active service she maintains correspondence with families she has worked with, prepares pilgrimage routes, and studies death traditions from cultures she hasn''t yet encountered.', N'Fabienne Kovács, a serene woman with warm medium-bronze skin glowing with golden undertones, visible faint iridescent cosmetic geneware shimmer. Black hair with silver temples, voluminous and adorned with small copper discs. Deep warm brown eyes with amber flecks, angular cheekbones, unlined face with striking Central European and South Asian bone structure. Lean 168cm frame in loose-fitting earth-tone and deep blue linen layers, worn leather slip-ons visible. Thin steel ring on right hand, pale 8cm scar on inner left wrist. Perfect upright posture, watchful-patient expression, hands open and visible. GLMZ GLMZ setting, moody warm lighting catching the subtle color-shift of inherited geneware on her skin, incense smoke wisping in background, serene meditative atmosphere. Tier 3 functional aesthetic, second-hand co-op clothing. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Irkalla district', N'local', N'Irkalla district', N'Hispanic/Latin American (35.2%) with substantial Eastern European (33.9%), South Asian (21.0%), and Middle Eastern (9.9%) ancestry — a striking genetic blend that manifests in warm medium-bronze skin with golden undertones, angular facial structure with prominent cheekbones, and features that reflect the confluence of Mediterranean, Central Asian, and subcontinental genetics', 168, 58, N'Lean and upright, with the kind of economy of movement that comes from decades of sitting vigil — no wasted motion, strong core despite minimal visible musculature', N'Natural black with silver at temples', N'Worn large and natural, threaded through with small hand-hammered copper discs that create soft percussion when she moves', N'Long (shoulder-length when compressed, voluminous when full)', N'Deep warm brown with subtle amber undertones', N'Warm medium-bronze with golden undertones — the product of blended Hispanic/Latin American, Eastern European, South Asian, and Middle Eastern ancestry creating a luminous, even complexion with natural depth', N'Minimal grooming — unlined despite age, with the kind of clarity that comes from intentional living. Prominent angular cheekbones and defined facial structure reflecting Central European and South Asian bone structure. Faint cosmetic iridescence visible under direct or angled light: a barely-perceptible rainbow sheen inherited from geneware, never suppressed or hidden', N'None functional. Only the inherited cosmetic geneware: a subtle color-shifting quality to her skin under direct light, like oil on water, so faint most people register it subconsciously rather than consciously', N'Moves with deliberate slowness even when unhurried — a practice of presence. Sits with perfect spinal alignment, knees slightly bent, hands visible and open. Her default expression is between watchful and patient, with the kind of calm that invites speech', N'Tier 3 functional — well-maintained second-hand or co-op linen and cotton, earth tones and deep blues. Loose layers that allow long sitting. Worn leather slip-ons for quick response calls. No jewelry except the copper discs in her hair and a thin steel band on her right ring finger — simple, nothing decorative. Her clothes smell faintly of incense and cleaning herbs', N'She attended the death of a Helix Biosystems executive who was quietly dying of an illegally administered experimental treatment. She kept his secret as he requested, but she has always wondered if she should have reported it — the treatment was being tested without consent on people in Irkalla.', N'Precise and unhurried; uses concrete sensory language to describe abstract things; knows the death vocabulary of at least a dozen traditions and selects based on who she''s with', N'Very even pacing, almost no rising inflection; people find themselves slowing their own speech to match her', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fabienne_kov_cs');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a687-7329-b978-a2006d55e204', N'Gaetan Yamamoto-Kwon-Khoury', N'Gaetan', N'', N'Yamamoto-Kwon-Khoury', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, Lower Ring stalls, Grainfort, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Small-time data broker and bootleg media seller specializing in historical archives, pre-corponation records, and suppressed journalism', N'Formerly: GLMZ Municipal Records Office (dissolved 2184). Currently: Independent. Occasional client relationship with Highland Park Autonomous Zone historical societies.; The Coffin Nails', N'Gaetan Yamamoto-Kwon-Khoury is a compact, deeply wrinkled man with white hair growing in sparse patches he makes no effort to disguise, wearing the same style of layered linen jacket in different states of repair depending on the day. His hands are large and steady, incongruous with his age, with the careful movements of someone who handles fragile things for a living — which he does, in one sense or another. He has no geneware and his only augmentation is a retinal archive implant that lets him read data directly from physical media without an external reader, installed in 2171 and badly in need of a firmware update he cannot afford. The implant makes his left eye appear slightly clouded from certain angles, which he has learned to use as a social tool: people underestimate the cloudy eye.

He has been in the data business for forty years in one form or another — as a legitimate archivist for a now-dissolved municipal body, as a corporate records clerk, and since the corponation consolidations of the 2180s, as what he calls a ''historical preservation specialist'' and most of his clients call a fence for information. He sells bootleg dramas and music as cover income, but his real trade is documents: pre-Axiom city records, Tessera acquisition histories, old census data that corponations had declared non-canonical. He is calm about the danger this represents, with the equanimity of someone who decided long ago that the alternative was more frightening. He maintains a small shrine to three ELFs simultaneously — The Ledger, The Index, and a third he calls only The Forgotten One — in the back of his stall.', N'Primary historical information source; can find pre-corponation records, suppressed documents, and corporate acquisition histories that other sources cannot access; his bootleg media business provides plausible cover for deeper research requests.', N'', N'Retinal archive implant, left eye (installed 2171, outdated firmware, slightly clouded appearance). No other augmentations or geneware.', N'Opens his stall at 11am, closes at 6pm — he does not work late markets. Mornings are for cataloguing and client research; evenings for personal archival work and writing the journal he has kept for thirty years.', N'Gaetan Yamamoto-Kwon-Khoury, a 168cm lean archival worker in his sixties with deeply lined face blending East Asian, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Warm medium-tan complexion with golden undertones, prominent weathered cheekbones, thin mouth usually neutral. White hair with dark streaks, sparse and combed back. Pale gray-blue eyes (left eye showing subtle retinal implant cloudiness). Fine scar from left temple to cheekbone, age spots on large weathered hands with asymmetrical burn marks. Wearing layered cream linen jacket with multiple pockets and visible repairs, plain long-sleeved undershirt mottled with dust, loose dark practical trousers, scuffed resoled shoes, worn leather gloves in pockets. Simple metal band on right ring finger. Seated posture leaning forward slightly, deliberate movements, left eye narrowed. In dimly-lit archive facility with soft warm ambient lighting, blue-green LED shimmer visible in left eye as he accesses data. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'East Asian (43%), Middle Eastern (37.7%), and Sub-Saharan African (19.3%) ancestry. His bone structure reflects the angular cheekbones and eye placement of East Asian heritage, while Middle Eastern ancestry contributes to his aquiline nose and defined jawline. Sub-Saharan African ancestry broadens and warms his features, adding depth and richness to his complexion. The genetic confluence creates a face of distinct character—neither dominated by any single heritage but harmoniously integrated across all three.', 168, 62, N'Compact and lean, almost ascetic—decades of sitting and careful handwork have left him without excess mass. Shoulders slightly rounded from age but still capable. Hands disproportionately large and weathered, with strong grip strength despite his years.', N'White with faint dark streaks', N'Sparse patches allowed to grow naturally; no attempt at grooming or coverage. Combed back from his forehead when he remembers.', N'Medium (3-4 cm)', N'Left eye: pale gray-blue with subtle clouding from retinal implant lens. Right eye: sharp pale gray-blue, alert.', N'Warm medium-tan with golden and reddish undertones—a direct result of his blended East Asian (43%), Middle Eastern (37.7%), and Sub-Saharan African (19.3%) ancestry. The skin has natural warmth and considerable depth, muted slightly by age and decades spent indoors under artificial light. Evenly sun-bronzed on exposed forearms from market work, showing the skin''s natural capacity for deeper, warmer bronzing. The tone suggests a face that catches light warmly, with visible depth in shadows.', N'Deeply lined face with prominent, slightly broader cheekbones and strong angular structure reflecting the blended influences of East Asian and Middle Eastern bone structure, warmed and widened by Sub-Saharan African ancestry. The face is broad across the cheeks with a defined jawline. Hands show age spots and liver spots, but skin is clean and well-maintained. Light stubble most days—shaves perhaps twice weekly, without particular urgency. Mouth thin, usually set in a neutral expression until he smiles, which transforms his face entirely.', N'Left eye shows subtle cloudiness in certain lighting angles—a telltale sign of the retinal archive implant seated behind the iris. The implant occasionally causes faint LED scatter when he accesses data, visible as a blue-green shimmer in dim environments. Otherwise no visible cybernetics.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness—not infirmity, but conservation of energy and precision. Handles objects with both hands even when one would suffice. Sits more than he stands. When engaged in conversation, he leans forward slightly, left eye often narrowed (either from the implant''s sensitivity or as a practiced tell to appear less threatening). Rarely makes sudden movements.', N'Tier 4 / working-class archaic. Favors layered linen jackets in cream, tan, or pale gray—always multiple pockets, always showing signs of repair or patching. Wears the same jacket model in rotation, each in a different state of disrepair; he has owned five nearly identical ones over fifteen years. Plain long-sleeved undershirt, usually mottled from dust and handling old media. Loose dark trousers, practical, pockets reinforced. Worn leather work gloves kept in jacket pockets. No jewelry except a simple metal band (possibly silver, possibly not) on his right ring finger. Shoes are sensible, scuffed, resoled multiple times. Everything suggests someone who values function over presentation—and someone who cannot afford to replace things often.', N'He has a complete, authenticated record of Tessera''s 2183 forced displacement of 40,000 residents from what is now Grosse Pointe Enclosure — names, dates, falsified consent documents, everything. He has been sitting on it for seventeen years waiting for a moment when releasing it would matter rather than just get him killed. He is no longer certain that moment will come.', N'Formal and archival; uses precise dates and citations in casual speech; occasionally slips into the register of official documentation', N'Unhurried and deliberate; full sentences, no contractions when discussing serious matters; contractions return in warmth', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gaetan_yamamoto_kwon_khoury');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d0-7e8c-8e48-a20d6beeda59', N'Kitchi Baiseitov-Ixchel', N'Kitchi', N'', N'Baiseitov-Ixchel', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre, operating out of the Libre Community Creche on Calle Veintitrés, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Substitute childcare worker and unofficial after-school program coordinator', N'Mexicantown Libre Community Creche Collective (informal); substitute contractor for three licensed childcare providers', N'Kitchi Baiseitov-Ixchel is slight with enormous energy — she is the kind of person who enters a room already talking, gesturing, pulling objects from her pockets to illustrate a point. Her skin is a warm golden-brown, her natural hair twisted into thick locs that she decorates with small colored rings and one clip shaped like a fish that her students gave her. She has retractable claws, a cosmetic geneware mod she got at nineteen that she now mostly uses to open packaging and gently scratch children''s backs when they''re upset, which has become a signature of her caregiving style. Her eyes are dark, large, and deeply attentive in a way that children recognize immediately as meaning she is actually listening.

Kitchi Baiseitov-Ixchel is technically a substitute — she fills in at three different licensed creches across Mexicantown Libre when regular workers are out — but in practice she has become the linchpin of a sprawling unofficial after-school program she runs from the Libre Creche''s outdoor space on a budget of approximately nothing. She writes curriculum on whatever surfaces are available, sourced donated materials from the Burnished Market, and has an arrangement with a local E.L.F. she calls Señora Chispa (inhabiting the creche''s aging electrical panel) that involves leaving handwritten songs as data offerings. The children are convinced Señora Chispa plays favorites, and they are probably right.', N'Emotional ground-truth character — reflects what is happening to families in the neighborhood. Potential quest giver for issues affecting children or the Libre community. A character who can contextualize what large-scale events mean at the most human level.', N'', N'Cosmetic geneware: retractable finger-length claws, keratin-reinforced, dark brown. No other modifications.', N'Receives her day''s assignment by 07:00 via the collective''s messaging system; works whichever creche needs coverage until 17:00; runs the unofficial after-school program until 19:00 or until the last child is collected; spends evenings planning the next day''s activities on whatever she can find to write on.', N'Kitchi Baiseitov-Ixchel, 158cm tall, slight wiry frame, standing in motion with restless energy. Warm golden-bronze skin with earthy undertones reflecting Indigenous American, South Asian, Central Asian, and Eastern European heritage blend. High prominent cheekbones, large dark brown eyes wide-set, full natural eyebrows. Shoulder-length thick dark brown locs decorated with brass rings, plastic beads, and wooden fish clip. Dark brown retractable keratin claws visible at fingertips with metallic sheen. Wearing layered outfit: fitted base layer under rust-colored oversized pullover, charcoal canvas pants with deep pockets, worn canvas sneakers. Animated micro-smile, hands gesturing, perpetually in motion. Neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226, warm indoor lighting in a community education space with colorful student artwork visible behind. Diverse, energetic, practical working-class aesthetic with personal handmade flair. Close-up portrait framing from waist up. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Multiethnic blend: Indigenous American (36%), South Asian (27%), Central Asian (26.7%), and Eastern European (10.3%). This combination creates warm, earthy undertones with distinctive high cheekbones and eye structure reflecting strong Amerindian and Central Asian influence, enriched by South Asian facial geometry and balanced with lighter Eastern European undertones in skin depth.', 158, 48, N'Slight and wiry with restless energy — lean muscle from constant movement, minimal body fat, a frame built for reaching high shelves and sitting cross-legged on the floor', N'Natural dark brown to black', N'Thick locs twisted tightly, shoulder-length, decorated with small colored rings (rotating selection of brass, plastic, and handmade beads) and one hand-carved wooden fish clip', N'Long (shoulder-length locs)', N'Dark brown, naturally large and wide-set', N'Warm golden-bronze with earthy undertones, medium depth from sun exposure. The blend of Indigenous American, South Asian, and Central Asian ancestry creates rich warm saturation, tempered by subtle Eastern European lightening — a balanced warm-medium complexion suggesting both outdoor time and mixed heritage.', N'Open, animated expression with a baseline micro-smile. Medium-textured skin showing minimal scarring or blemishing — young skin cared for with budget products. Facial structure shows prominent, high cheekbones with strong Indigenous American and Central Asian architecture, balanced by South Asian influence in eye placement, orbital geometry, and overall facial proportions. Eyebrows are full and naturally shaped, rarely plucked. No visible cosmetic face mods.', N'Retractable keratin-reinforced claws, dark brown, extending from all ten fingertips to approximately 4cm in length when fully deployed. Visible at rest as smooth, slightly raised nail beds with a subtle metallic sheen under certain light. No other visible augmentations; any subcutaneous mods would be invisible.', N'Perpetually in motion — stands with weight shifting between feet, hands gesturing while speaking, shoulders animated. Sits in fluid, cross-legged position on the floor often. Movements are quick and efficient rather than graceful, optimized for childcare (sweeping a child up, reaching into pockets, opening things, soothing physical contact). Habitual gesture of running her claws through her locs or tapping them rhythmically on surfaces when thinking.', N'Tier 4 working-class pragmatism with personal flair. Typically wears comfortable, durable pants (often canvas or cotton blend in neutral colors — charcoal, olive, tan) with deep pockets filled with small objects (drawing supplies, snacks, toys, messages for Señora Chispa). Layered shirts: a fitted base layer under an oversized button-up or pullover in warm colors (rust, mustard, deep rose) or handwoven fabrics from Mexicantown makers. Shoes are practical and broken-in — canvas sneakers or worn leather boots, scuffed from daily wear. No visible jewelry except the hair decorations. Clothing shows signs of daily use with children — marker smudges, small holes, fading — but is always clean. Occasionally wears an apron with oversized pockets, usually fabric-dyed or embroidered by students.', N'One of the children in her program — a quiet seven-year-old named Paz — has not been collected for two days. The mother is unreachable. Sisay has been keeping the child at the creche overnight rather than contacting city services, because she knows what happens to children who enter the system alone and young. She has 72 hours before someone notices.', N'Warm, concrete, child-accessible even when talking to adults — she narrates her thinking out loud', N'Fast and enthusiastic, pitches up when excited, drops to something very gentle when scared', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'kitchi_baiseitov_ixchel');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62a-7242-9e4c-a23e1f85aec2', N'Bakytzhan Sepúlveda-Ogawa', N'Bakytzhan', N'', N'Sepúlveda-Ogawa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lakeview Neon, Meridian Tower East — a mid-tier residential block on the neon-lit lakeside strip, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Building cleaner and occasional building super assistant, Lakeview Neon residential tower', N'Independent contractor (building services contract through Meridian Tower East management), informal ELF devotion network in Lakeview Neon', N'Bakytzhan Sepúlveda-Ogawa is short and densely built, with dark skin that catches neon light in a way she has stopped minding and now actively exploits by choosing to do her outdoor corridor work at hours when the lake-glow is at its peak. She has retractable claw mods on both hands — not for aesthetics, she bought them second-hand and practical, because they are useful for gripping cleaning equipment on the upper external scaffold where the wind off the lake will try to take your bucket. Her hair is short on the sides and braided in a raised fan on top, with small ELF charms woven into the base of each braid — copper wire and salvaged circuit chips, an offering-array she updates monthly.

She is twenty-three and has been in this building since she was nineteen and she would like, on record, for everyone to know that she is not going to be here forever. She says this often enough that the long-term residents have started saying it back to her affectionately, the way you repeat a beloved family motto. She is fast, thorough, faintly sarcastic, and has developed an involuntary intimacy with the lives of 340 residential units that she would not have asked for but has learned to use carefully.', N'Access character — she has keys to most of the building and knowledge of its rhythms that formal staff do not. She can be a source, a guide, a warning system, or a witness to things she has learned not to formally report.', N'', N'Retractable claw mod, both hands (second-hand, functional, slightly mismatched — left hand retracts 0.3 seconds slower). ELF-offering braids (non-augmentation, ritual practice). No other chrome.', N'Split shift: 06:00-11:00 for common areas and exterior maintenance, 14:00-18:00 for deep-cleans and reported issues; uses the gap to sleep, eat, and attend the building''s informal ELF devotion circle that meets in sub-basement B on Tuesdays.', N'Bakytzhan Sepúlveda-Ogawa, 158cm compact muscular frame, warm golden-tan complexion with olive undertones, high prominent cheekbones, dark alert eyes, black hair shaved close at sides with raised fan braid crown adorned with copper wire and circuit chips. GLMZ, GLMZ worker in gray charcoal reinforced coveralls, black grip-sole boots, fingerless work gloves on carabiner at hip. Retractable claw augmentations visible at knuckles with chrome catch-light. Faint scarification on right forearm (ELF devotion pattern), burn marks scattered across forearms, slight forward lean posture suggesting ladder work habit. Standing in neon-lit industrial Great Lakes height, chemical solvent scent visible as subtle atmospheric haze. Alert, economical movement, hands semi-flexed. Neo-noir worker aesthetic, authentic pan-Asian and Latin American heritage evident in facial structure, direct gaze, weathered competence. Moody industrial lighting, cool-warm neon contrast. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lakeview Neon', N'local', N'Lakeview Neon', N'Predominantly East Asian (54.4%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (20.1%), South Asian heritage (14.5%), and Southeast Asian ancestry (11.0%). This complex pan-Asian and Latin American blend creates distinctly warm medium-tan skin with golden and olive undertones. High, prominent cheekbones reflect the East Asian core, softened by the fuller facial structure from Hispanic and South Asian ancestry. Eye shape shows strong East Asian influence with depth from South Asian heritage. The overall synthesis is striking: warm golden-brown complexion, balanced facial geometry, alert direct gaze—a face that reads as authentically pan-global.', 158, 62, N'Densely muscular and compact, shoulders broad relative to frame, forearms defined from years of scaffold work and equipment handling. Low center of gravity—moves with the economical efficiency of someone who works at height.', N'Natural black with warm undertones', N'Shaved close on sides (faded), raised fan braid pattern on crown with copper wire and salvaged circuit chips woven into braid base—updated monthly as ritual offering', N'Short on sides, medium on crown (braided)', N'Dark brown, alert and direct', N'Warm medium-tan with golden and olive undertones, reflects neon light with subtle iridescence from regular exposure to Lakeview''s light pollution. The warmth carries the influence of East Asian, Hispanic, South Asian, and Southeast Asian heritage in balanced interplay.', N'Clear, weathered around eyes and forehead from squinting at heights and glare. High, prominent cheekbones with strong definition reflecting East Asian ancestry, balanced by slightly fuller face shape from Hispanic and South Asian heritage. Calloused palms and knuckles. No makeup. Minor scar tissue across knuckles from scaffold work. Alert deep-set eyes, strong jawline with subtle roundness at chin—features show authentic pan-Asian and Latin American blend.', N'Retractable claw mods on both hands (second-hand, functional). Left hand claws show slightly more wear; visible at knuckles as subtle reinforced plating when retracted. Chrome catch-light at the base of each finger when augmentation extends. No other visible chrome.', N'Economical, upright posture with a slight forward lean—habitual from working on ladders and scaffolds. Moves with deliberate quietness (building habit—not waking residents during early shifts). Hands often in semi-active state, fingers slightly flexed as if testing grip. Rarely still.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian: reinforced gray/charcoal coveralls from Meridian building supply contract (Φ8.40/month deduction). Worn black slip-on boots with grip sole. Thin thermal undershirt in winter, bare shoulders in summer. No jewelry except ELF braid charms (self-made). Work gloves (fingerless, synthetic leather, gel-padded palm) kept on a carabiner at hip. Faint chemical odor from cleaning solvents that never quite washes out.', N'In unit 1114, a resident named Dakari has not answered his door in eleven days. She has a key. She has used it. He is there, alive, but in a psychiatric crisis that has left him unable to leave the apartment or answer calls. She has been leaving food outside his door and not filing an absence report because he once mentioned he feared the corponation wellness enforcement system. She does not know what to do next and the tension of it is eating her.', N'Fast and informal, with a dry sardonic edge. Igbo-English phrasing layered over Albanian-Kosovar expressions she picked up from her Haradinaj grandmother who helped raise her. Uses building-specific shorthand naturally.', N'Quick and a little breathless, like she is always slightly behind where she planned to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bakytzhan_sep_lveda_ogawa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ab-7213-8133-a24ea8ff1cd1', N'Helge Kariuki', N'Helge', N'', N'Kariuki', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Crossing Gate, temporary migrant processing zone, third holding section, near North Ave and Damen', N'hyperlane migrant; climate refugee from drowned coastal settlement, currently in transit', N'Loosely connected to a group of twelve other migrants from the same settlement, who are processing through Grand Crossing Gate simultaneously', N'Helge Kariuki is tall and angular, with pale skin that has burned and recovered enough times to have a permanent rosy-raw quality at her cheekbones and nose. Her hair is a natural deep auburn, grown out in a manner suggesting she has not had access to a proper cutting implement in months, pulled back in a knot held by what appears to be a sharpened stylus. Her eyes are grey-green and extremely direct — she has the look of someone who stopped performing social softness some time ago because it cost too much energy. She carries everything she owns in a single large waterproof pack with a broken clasp, fixed shut with cable ties. On her left wrist is a tattoo of a coastline — the actual coastline of the settlement she grew up in, measured and mapped by her own hand before the water took it — and she will show it to anyone who asks, with the precision of a cartographer or a mourner.

She is not the kind of refugee who presents with visible despair, which sometimes means aid workers overlook her in favor of more legible suffering. What she has instead is a particular flat-affect efficiency: she needs a specific set of things, she is working to acquire them through the specific channels available to her, and she would prefer not to waste either her time or anyone else''s on anything peripheral to that. She was a coastal agricultural cooperative manager before her settlement was inundated — a competent, practical person with professional expertise that is almost entirely inapplicable to an urban megacity. She is learning this in real time and finds it enraging.', N'Human face of the climate refugee crisis; presents bureaucratic obstruction as a concrete daily reality; can become a quest giver if players have the ability to help her navigate systems she cannot access; her agricultural expertise is an unexpected resource in unlikely places', N'', N'None.', N'Navigates the Grand Crossing Gate processing system, which involves waiting in lines, attending mandatory intake assessments, and arguing with automated kiosk systems that cannot parse her documentation. Spends non-processing hours managing the informal needs of the twelve-person group she has become leader of by default, and writing detailed complaints about processing system failures in a physical notebook she intends to submit to someone official, eventually.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Helge Kariuki, 182cm tall angular build with minimal body fat, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones weathered by sun and salt exposure, darker pigmentation at cheekbones and nose bridge from healing patterns, prominent cheekbones and defined jawline reflecting South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage with Pacific Islander softness, dark brown eyes with amber inner rim showing exhaustion and steady focus, long deep auburn hair sun-faded at ends roughly knotted at nape with stylus pin, cartographic line tattoo on left wrist, wearing faded long-sleeve thermal shirt under water-resistant jacket with missing zipper, worn reinforced synthetic work pants, scuffed aged utility boots, waterproof pack with cable-tie repairs, no visible augmentations, posture upright and economical, direct unflinching gaze, tier 5 migrant aesthetic, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone coastal setting, gray overcast lighting with salt-spray haze, standing with purpose and minimal wasted movement --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Crossing Gate', N'local', N'Grand Crossing Gate', N'South Asian (38%), Sub-Saharan African (28.9%), and Pacific Islander (15.8%) ancestry form the core of Helge''s genetic profile, with Northern European (13.2%) and Southeast Asian (4.1%) contributions creating subtle complexity. This ancestry blend produces warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, a facial structure combining South Asian bone structure with broader African features—prominent cheekbones, defined jawline, and a fuller lower face—tempered by the softer features of Pacific Islander heritage. The genetic depth creates warm, soulful dark brown eyes.', 182, 68, N'Tall and angular with minimal body fat, suggesting sustained physical labor and inadequate nutrition over months. Shoulders and forearms show lean muscle definition from repetitive work.', N'Deep auburn, sun-faded at the ends', N'Roughly knotted at the nape, unstyled, held with a sharpened stylus serving as makeshift pin', N'Long', N'Dark brown with warm amber inner rim', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones, weathered and uneven from months of sun and salt exposure. Rich melanin concentration reflecting South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, deepened further at cheekbones, nose bridge, and temple by sun-darkening and healing patterns.', N'Face structured with prominent cheekbones and defined jawline characteristic of Sub-Saharan African and South Asian heritage blend, softened by Pacific Islander influence. Skin shows darker pigmentation concentration at cheekbones, nose bridge, and temples from repeated sun exposure and healing. No makeup. Skin shows dryness and minor sun damage characteristic of extended outdoor labor. Deep-set eyes suggest exhaustion beneath steady gaze, with minimal expression lines despite weathering.', N'None visible.', N'Stands with vertical spine and minimal wasted movement. Walks with purpose and economic efficiency—no idle gesturing. Her gaze is unflinching and direct, scanning environments for practical information rather than threat. She holds herself with the bearing of someone rationing emotional energy.', N'Tier 5 migrant-grade practicality. Worn synthetic work pants with multiple pockets, reinforced at knees and thighs. Faded long-sleeve thermal shirt under a water-resistant outer jacket missing one functional zipper. Waterproof pack with visible cable-tie repairs securing a broken clasp. No jewelry except the wrist tattoo. Shoes are scuffed utility boots, maintained but aged. All clothing shows signs of extended wear and salt-water exposure. No corporate branding or tier markers.', N'She delayed the final evacuation of her settlement by eighteen hours arguing with a cooperative board member about asset documentation protocols. She believes those eighteen hours cost one person their life — an elderly man who was evacuated late and died of exposure during the transit. She does not know for certain that earlier evacuation would have saved him. She is not certain it would have. She thinks about it every day.', N'Technical and direct. Cooperative management terminology. Becomes very formal when angry, which is counterintuitively more frightening than shouting.', N'Even, controlled, with clipped endings. Does not trail off.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'helge_kariuki');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e7-7ec0-a248-a24ed2b5e5f1', N'Bolu Ekwensi-Odinga', N'Bolu', N'', N'Ekwensi-Odinga', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 59, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown — industrial district of chop shops and fabricators, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Structural breach and explosive ordnance specialist — demolitions expert', N'Semi-independent — recurring contracts with mid-tier fixers', N'Bolu Ekwensi-Odinga is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 59, she has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate her once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct ne — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Born and raised in GLMZ, third generation — she has the city in her blood, its rhythms in her bones, its cruelty in her expectations. She works as a demolitions expert out of Geartown, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Bolu Ekwensi-Odinga is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who she burned last.', N'Daulet Edlund-Gyan is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access. Thermal masking system — body heat signature can be suppressed or spoofed', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Bolu Ekwenski-Odinga, lean athletic woman, deep warm mahogany skin with Sub-Saharan and Central Asian features, high prominent cheekbones, refined East Asian eye shape with subtle upturned lids, strong defined jawline, steel gray hair pulled back in tight functional braid, dark brown eyes with fine lines from nocturnal work, burn scar on right forearm, chrome neural interface jack visible at base of skull, black reinforced cargo pants, dark fitted tactical vest over dark shirt, charcoal worn practical jacket, steel-toed boots, metal wedding band, standing in ready stance weight on balls of feet, slight forward lean, moody neo-noir lighting, neon shadows, industrial nocturnal setting, 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, tension and precision in posture, dystopian professional augmented operative, film noir lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Sub-Saharan African dominant (42.5%) layered with Central Asian (26.4%), East Asian (18.3%), Indigenous American (8.0%), and South Asian (4.8%) ancestry. The genetic fusion creates striking polycontinental features: Sub-Saharan African bone structure and complexion depth interwoven with Central Asian facial proportions and cheekbone prominence, East Asian eye shape and lid characteristics, Indigenous American nasal bridge refinement, and South Asian undertone warmth. A true diaspora phenotype reflecting the Ubiquitous Mixing of 2226.', 172, 62, N'Athletic and lean with defined musculature — the physique of someone who maintains strength through discipline rather than bulk. Shoulders broad, core tight, no excess. Moves like a dancer or climber, economical and precise.', N'Steel gray with natural dark roots showing', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid; pragmatic rather than fashionable', N'Medium', N'Dark brown', N'Deep warm mahogany — the result of Sub-Saharan African baseline enriched by Central Asian golden undertones, East Asian luminosity, and South Asian amber complexity. Displays significant depth in shadow, warm radiance in direct light, with complex mid-tone richness across the spectrum.', N'High, prominent cheekbones shaped by Central Asian and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, paired with refined East Asian eye structure, subtle epicanthic fold, and slightly upturned lid shape. Nose straight and refined with characteristically broad nostrils reflecting Sub-Saharan heritage, balanced by Central Asian bridge definition. Forehead broad, jawline strong and defined. Skin shows the wear of nocturnal work and age — fine lines around eyes and mouth, minor scarring on left temple. Complexion is clear but weathered, the kind of skin that doesn''t see sunlight regularly. Facial structure reflects genuine multicontinental fusion: facial width and bone prominence from Sub-Saharan heritage, cheekbone geometry from Central Asian ancestry, eye shape and lid characteristics from East Asian genetics, nasal proportions refined by Indigenous American ancestry, and warm undertone complexity from South Asian admixture.', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull is the only visible chrome. The thermal masking system is subcutaneous and invisible, but someone who works with her might notice her heat signature fluctuates or disappears entirely on thermal imaging.', N'Stands with a slight forward lean, weight balanced on the balls of her feet — ready. Moves without wasted motion, joints loose but controlled. When relaxed, there''s still an underlying tension, like a loaded spring. Hands are steady and precise.', N'Tier 3-4 functional aesthetic. Black reinforced cargo pants with multiple pockets and wear patterns from equipment. Dark fitted shirt — often with a tactical vest or harness over top, industrial grade. Steel-toed boots, well-maintained. A long coat or jacket in charcoal or dark olive, worn and practical. No corporate branding. All pieces chosen for durability and utility, not fashion. Jewelry is minimal — worn metal wedding band on left ring finger, no other ornamentation.', N'', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bolu_ekwensi_odinga');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67f-738e-9654-a267f8f5e12a', N'Hideki Valenzuela', N'Hideki', N'', N'Valenzuela', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 36, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, Chatham Flats, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Small-time data broker — neighborhood gossip, surveillance logs, identity fragments', N'Independent; informal affiliate of The Oxidian Market Vendors Guild (associate member despite being in Chatham Flats); pays dues to no one else', N'Hideki Valenzuela — Dara to everyone who values their time — is a compact, watchful woman who runs what appears to be a phone repair and device maintenance kiosk in the middle of the Alban Souk''s electronics corridor. The repair work is real; so is everything else. Her skin is a deep warm brown, her natural hair twisted into locks threaded with silver wire that serve a dual purpose as aesthetic and antenna extension. Her irises are stock human dark brown, which she considers a professional advantage. She has cat ears — a geneware mod she got in her twenties and has kept ever since, velvety black and mobile, swiveling toward sounds before she''s consciously registered them. She is acutely, perpetually embarrassed by how readable her ears make her emotional state and has developed elaborate conversational techniques for preventing anyone from noticing what direction they''ve turned.

Dara operates on the fundamental principle that information depreciates in value like produce: sell it while it''s fresh or it''s worthless. She deals strictly in neighborhood-scale data — who owes whom, who''s sleeping where they shouldn''t be, what the Chatham Flats block captain actually filed versus what they told residents, which E.L.F. shrine has gone cold and why. She does not touch corponation intel, does not touch political data, and has turned down three increasingly good offers to work for Tessera''s intelligence division. She is precise, reliable, and slightly sad in a way she would vigorously deny.', N'Information source for neighborhood-scale intelligence; can connect players to other vendors or local power brokers; her data-cache may contain something relevant to whatever''s happening; demonstrates the texture of surveillance from below.', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (black, fully mobile, emotionally responsive — she hates this). Subdermal data-cache implant along left forearm, finger-press activated. Silver wire threaded through locks functions as passive signal antenna.', N'Kiosk opens at 08:00; mornings are device repair, afternoons are information transactions scheduled through an encrypted local mesh node; she eats lunch at the same noodle cart every day and considers this surveillance, not habit.', N'GLMZ character: Hideki Valenzuela, 158cm tall compact woman with warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, narrow face with defined cheekbones, dark brown eyes with subtle upward tilt, natural deep black hair with silver wire woven throughout in shoulder-length twisted locks. Fully mobile black velvet geneware cat ears mounted at crown, responsive and animated. Wearing practical tool vest with multiple pockets over thermal-lined jacket, cargo pants with reinforced knees, plain silver chain necklace. Economical posture at repair kiosk, steady hands positioned over device components. Subdermal forearm implant scar visible on left arm. Neutral color palette—blacks, grays, deep blues. Souk marketplace setting with kiosk lighting creating subtle highlights on skin and metallic wire. Precise, focused expression, ears slightly angled as if tracking ambient sound. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'Northern European (55.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (43.2%), and Southeast Asian (1.3%) blend. Her ancestry manifests as warm medium brown skin with golden and honey undertones bridging all three heritage streams. Her facial structure shows defined, slightly high cheekbones with subtle Southeast Asian characteristics, refined bone structure characteristic of Northern European heritage, and the warm coloration of Latin American ancestry. Her features read as a harmonious global blend rather than distinctly regional.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, with the economical musculature of someone who moves deliberately rather than forcefully. Shoulders slightly narrow, center of gravity low. Her frame reads as precise — nothing wasted.', N'Natural deep black with silver wire threading throughout', N'Twisted locks, intricately arranged, with metallic wire woven through for both aesthetic and functional antenna extension', N'Medium (shoulder-length locks)', N'Dark brown, unaugmented human iris', N'Warm medium brown with golden and honey undertones—a balanced blend reflecting dominant Northern European and substantial Latin American ancestry with trace Southeast Asian influence, creating luminous warmth throughout', N'Clear, well-maintained skin with refined, defined cheekbones that reflect her mixed heritage. Narrow face with controlled expression; her features at rest suggest someone listening for something just outside normal hearing range. Subtle eye shape with warm brown irises and slight upward tilt characteristic of her minor Southeast Asian ancestry. Warm undertones visible throughout her facial structure.', N'The cat ears are immediately obvious and animate constantly. The silver wire in her locks glimmers under kiosk lighting and serves as a passive signal antenna. Her left forearm scar is visible if she rolls her sleeves, which she does — suggests she''s not trying to hide her augmentations, just their tells.', N'Economical and controlled. She sits at her kiosk in a way that suggests she''s always half-ready to stand. Her head tracks sounds with slight but noticeable delays — her ears moving first, then her eyes following. When she walks, her stride is quick and efficient, rarely wasted motion. Her hands are steady and precise.', N'Tier 3 practical — well-maintained but not expensive. Favors tool vests with multiple pockets, thermal-lined jackets (kept open most of the time), and cargo pants with reinforced knees and thigh pockets. She wears a plain silver chain necklace and keeps her fingers bare to reduce friction while working on devices. Her kiosk setup includes a faded work apron with embroidered patches indicating repair certifications. Colors lean neutral: blacks, grays, deep blues. Nothing that would draw attention in the Souk''s visual noise.', N'', N'Economical and precise; Swedish grandmother''s influence in clipped sentence construction; Yoruba for counting, timing, and anything emotional she doesn''t want to sound emotional about', N'Measured and unhurried; never finishes a sentence she hasn''t decided on before starting it', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hideki_valenzuela');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a715-7471-9af6-a27215d9203c', N'Chike Sigurdsson', N'Chike', N'', N'Sigurdsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Milwaukee Core — operates from a rented office space disguised as an HVAC consulting firm', N'Crew lead and extraction planner — The Thermite Collective', N'The Thermite Collective', N'Chike Sigurdsson the way other people play chess — five moves ahead, every contingency mapped, every variable assigned a probability. She spent twelve years as a logistics coordinator for Torii Security Group before the corp restructured her division and offered her a severance package worth less than her monthly augmentation maintenance. She walked out with her skills, her contacts, and a very detailed understanding of how corporate security systems fail.

She built the Thermite Collective from the ground up over six years, hand-picking operators who could execute clean work without the ego that gets people killed. The crew''s reputation is their product — no collateral damage, no witnesses, no mess. Clients pay a premium because Vesper''s plans work. When they don''t, she has three backup plans that do.

Physically unremarkable by design. Medium height, brown hair kept short, clothes that say middle management. She could walk through any lobby in GLMZ without triggering a second glance. This is the most dangerous thing about her. The only augmentation visible is a faint dermal port behind her left ear — the rest is all internal, all quiet, all precise.', N'Vesper represents the professional end of the runner spectrum — proof that freelance work can be competent, organized, and sustainable. Her stories are heist narratives driven by planning and precision, contrasting Kyle''s reactive, instinct-driven operations. She is the answer to the question: what does a runner look like when the trauma is managed and the work is clean?', N'', N'Tactical overlay implant (Torii Security surplus) — projects environmental data, security system schematics, and personnel movement patterns onto her visual field. Subvocal communication array for silent crew coordination. Enhanced spatial memory cortex that allows her to memorize building layouts after a single walkthrough.', N'Runs the crew''s operations from the HVAC front office. Spends mornings reviewing potential contracts, afternoons on reconnaissance, evenings on contingency planning. Maintains a rigid schedule because the work demands it. Eats the same lunch every day — rice bowl from the place on Lakeshore that doesn''t ask questions. Sleeps five hours a night and considers it sufficient.', N'Portrait of Chike Sigurdsson, 167cm lean woman with warm medium-brown skin blending Northern European, East Asian, South Asian, and African ancestry. Dark brown hair cropped short and asymmetrical, longer on left side covering a subtle dermal port scar. High defined cheekbones, fuller lips, angular jaw, warm brown eyes with amber undertones. Faint stress creases around eyes, light freckling across nose bridge. Small linear scar along left jawline. Wearing charcoal Prometheus Corp blazer over clean white t-shirt, dark tailored trousers, black functional shoes. Minimalist silver watch. Standing with weight forward on balls of feet, hands resting palm-down, two-meter tactical gaze. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, low ambient lighting, cool corporate office setting with subtle neon edge, hyper-realistic, intricate detail on scar tissue and port scarring, intense but controlled presence --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Milwaukee Core', N'local', N'Milwaukee Core', N'Complex global ancestry: Northern European (37.6%) providing angular bone structure and cooler undertones, East Asian (26.0%) contributing defined cheekbones and eye shape, Eastern European (13.1%) adding facial angularity, South Asian (10.6%) softening features with fuller lips and rounded contours, Sub-Saharan African (6.7%) deepening skin warmth and lip fullness, Hispanic/Latin American (6.0%) contributing subtle warmth and feature blending. The synthesis creates a face that defies regional categorization—Northern European angularity tempered by warmer heritage softness, creating unexpected geometric harmony.', 167, 62, N'Lean and economical — no excess mass, no theatrical musculature. The build of someone who runs three times a week because the schedule requires it, not for pleasure. Postural efficiency over presence.', N'Dark brown, naturally graying at temples but kept covered with professional-grade dye', N'Cropped short, asymmetrical — longer on left side (covers the dermal port), severely angled. Styled for zero maintenance; takes four minutes to comb.', N'Short', N'Warm brown with faint amber undertones; no visible augmentation but lens clarity suggests subcutaneous optical overlay integration', N'Warm medium brown with subtle golden undertones—the result of Northern European paleness blended with East Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African depth. Even complexion, consistent across face and body, neither cool nor warm but balanced between both.', N'Minimal makeup, minimal grooming ostentation. Skin shows faint stress creases at corners of eyes and mouth—not from age but from five-hour sleep cycles and constant low-level threat assessment. High, defined cheekbones from East Asian and Northern European ancestry, fuller lips from South Asian and African heritage, angular jaw contours showing Northern European influence tempered by warmer heritage features creating unexpected softness. Light freckling across bridge of nose. Pale scar tissue on left knuckles (old injury, professionally healed).', N'Single dermal port behind left ear with subtle iridescent sheen under direct light. Faint surgical scars at hairline suggest internal optical or neural work. Otherwise: none visible. All augmentations subcutaneous or internal — subvocal array leaves no external trace, spatial memory cortex integration invisible, tactical overlay sits behind unmodified iris.', N'Economical and controlled. Stands with weight slightly forward on balls of feet — never fully relaxed, always ready to move. Walks with minimal arm swing, gaze fixed two meters ahead and slightly elevated (tactical awareness pattern). Hands rest palms-down on thighs or table — never fidgeting, never crossing arms. Speaks quietly; makes people lean in. Makes eye contact deliberately, not reflexively — every glance is tactical.', N'Middle-management aggressively neutral. Blazers from corporate surplus retailers (Tier 3 brands like Prometheus Corp Fashions), usually in charcoal or navy. Under-blazer: clean white or gray t-shirts with no graphics or branding. Trousers: dark, tailored, pockets modified for discrete equipment carry. Shoes: black or charcoal, function-focused, worn-in enough to avoid attention. A single piece of jewelry — a watch, utilitarian, possibly with encrypted data access. Deliberately erases herself from memory; someone would struggle to describe her five minutes after meeting.', N'She still has her Torii Security Group access credentials. They were never revoked. She has never used them, but she has never deleted them either.', N'Precise, professional, occasionally dry. Uses corporate language without irony because it is her native tongue.', N'Measured. Every sentence is a complete thought. She does not interrupt and does not tolerate being interrupted.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chike_sigurdsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b2-7fbd-b715-a2e3aa67ea20', N'Sekou Kovalenko', N'Sekou', N'', N'Kovalenko', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 22, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone lower levels, Tier 2 commercial rows between Blackpipe Corridor and Iron Bend, near Halsted and Division', N'protection racket enforcer and occasional numbers runner for the Gray Zone lower levels', N'the Gray Zone crew called the Copperhead Collective, answers to a mid-level boss named Osaro (a stocky man in his forties who he simultaneously admires and fears)', N'Sekou Kovalenko is young enough that his face still hasn''t fully settled into what it''s going to be — there''s something unfinished about his jaw, a softness around the eyes that the hardened set of his mouth hasn''t caught up to yet. He''s broad across the chest in the way of someone who started lifting weights in a small room at fifteen and has never stopped. His Ghanaian-Osei heritage gives him deep brown skin and a wide nose; his Kazakh-Russian grandfather passed down high cheekbones and light eyes that are an unsettling grey-green. He has retractable claws — a practical geneware mod he paid for himself at twenty, black-tipped, filed to functional sharpness — and wears them half-extended at rest as a casual signal. His clothes are cheap but kept neat. He is extremely aware of his clothes.

Sekou Kovalenko is in the phase of his criminal life where he is still deciding whether to become the person he is pretending to be. He does this job with professional dedication, collects the Φ from the Gray Zone vendors on behalf of his crew boss with no unnecessary roughness, and brings the numbers in on time. He is respected on the row, which he confuses with being liked. At home — a cube rental above a noodle counter — he reads Zheng-Dao corporate management theory, not because he wants to work for Zheng-Dao but because he is trying to reverse-engineer how power organizes itself. He has a plan. The plan changes every three months. He''s not sure any version of it ends well.', N'Street-level color and friction for any scene in the Gray Zone lower levels; represents the aspirational criminal — someone not yet calcified into their role; potential informant or reluctant contact if approached correctly', N'', N'Retractable claws (geneware, black-tipped, filed sharp); skeletal density weave in forearms (grey market, impact resistance)', N'Makes collection rounds on the commercial row Tuesdays and Fridays, runs numbers for the bookmaking operation Monday and Thursday evenings, spends his off hours reading or watching underground Ferrogate logistics feeds trying to understand supply chain vulnerabilities.', N'Sekou Kovalenko, 183cm tall, muscular frame, warm golden-brown complexion mixing Eastern European and Sub-Saharan African features with South Asian geometry in striking angular face with prominent cheekbones and strong jaw, dark brown eyes with amber undertones, black short fade haircut, clean-shaven with faint scars across hands and thin white scar from left eyebrow to temple. Retractable black claws half-extended on both hands at rest, grey subcutaneous weave visible in forearms. Wearing precisely-fitted grey cargo pants with reinforced pockets, black synthetic-blend shirt tucked in, polished work boots, thin charcoal reflective jacket. Standing with deliberate forward weight in GLMZ 2200s commercial row at night, neon glow reflecting off wet pavement, harsh LED lighting cutting across his face, economical posture radiating controlled presence and street discipline. Moody, guarded expression. Ultra-detailed neo-noir noir aesthetic, high contrast lighting, cinematic depth --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Eastern European (51.0%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (21.7%) ancestry, blended with South Asian (15.9%), Northern European (8.5%), and North African (2.9%) heritage. This creates a complex Eurasian-African phenotype: Slavic bone structure and angular facial geometry softened and deepened by Sub-Saharan African features, with South Asian geometric influence in eye set and nose structure, and North African warmth in overall tone. The result is a warm golden-brown complexion with exceptional depth and definition — neither purely European nor African, but a striking synthesis that reads as unmistakably cosmopolitan.', 183, 89, N'Broad-chested and muscular from disciplined weight training since adolescence, but with the lean efficiency of someone who lifts for function rather than aesthetics. Shoulders wide, forearms visibly dense beneath the skin.', N'Black', N'Short, neat fade cut — maintained with precision, likely every two weeks', N'Short', N'Dark brown with subtle amber undertones, reflecting the warmth of his mixed ancestry', N'Warm golden-brown medium tone, the result of Eastern European baseline deepened and enriched by Sub-Saharan, South Asian, and North African ancestry. Even consistency across the body with slightly warmer golden tones on inner surfaces and under the jaw. The depth is unmistakable — neither light nor dark, but burnished and complex.', N'Angular face with prominent Slavic cheekbones blended with Sub-Saharan African jaw definition and structure — mature, powerful mandible. Eyes set with South Asian geometric influence, creating subtle almond-shaped depth. Nose broad and defined, characteristic of Sub-Saharan and South Asian heritage blend. Full lips with good definition. Clean-shaven, skin shows minor scars from street friction but otherwise well-maintained. Expression often guarded.', N'Retractable black-tipped claws on both hands, typically held half-extended at rest as a deliberate signal. The claws are filed to sharp functionality, not cosmetic. Forearms show subtle grey undertones beneath skin where the skeletal density weave sits just beneath the dermis, most visible when flexed under harsh lighting.', N'Stands with weight slightly forward, ready — a collector''s posture. Moves with economical precision, no wasted motion. Hands often rest on tabletops or at sides with claws visible. When walking the commercial row, his gait is deliberate and measured, designed to be noticed without seeming aggressive. Eye contact is direct and held slightly too long.', N'Cheap but immaculately maintained. Typically wears synthetic-blend shirts (black, grey, dark blue) tucked into grey cargo pants with reinforced pockets. Boots are generic work-issue, polished. A thin reflective jacket in charcoal for the rows — practical, unremarkable, the uniform of someone who doesn''t want to stand out except for his presence itself. No visible gang colors, but the precision of his grooming reads as crew discipline. Everything fits correctly; he is extremely aware of how clothing sits on his body.', N'He has been quietly documenting the Copperhead Collective''s full operational structure — names, routes, collection schedules, buyer contacts — in an encrypted file he tells himself is for ''understanding the system.'' He does not let himself think clearly about what he would do with it.', N'Code-switching constantly — corporate register when he''s thinking in strategy mode, the Gray Zone slang when in character on the row; hates being caught in the transition', N'Measured and slightly too formal for his age — he is performing competence and occasionally overcorrects', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'sekou_kovalenko');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5bd-7010-8800-a2e851517a90', N'Ulf Kristjánsson-Ingebrigtsen', N'Ulf', N'', N'Kristjánsson-Ingebrigtsen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 16, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone — sleeps in the cargo bays of docked airships when they can, otherwise the Gray Zone''s lower maintenance tunnels, near Wacker and State', N'airship drifter, seasonal worker, minor smuggler''s runner', N'Loosely connected to the airship drifter circuit; no formal caravan', N'Ulf Kristjánsson-Ingebrigtsen is small for their age, wiry, with the kind of stillness that comes from learning early that drawing attention is expensive. Their skin is warm brown, their hair a short natural cloud they dye the tips bioluminescent green when they can afford the pigment drops — which is not often. They have no mods beyond the green tips and a single geneware cat ear on the left side, the right ear perfectly human, because the second ear was a package deal they could only afford half of. They find this funny. They carry a cracked data-tablet in a waterproof sleeve and a folding tool roll with maintenance implements inside.

Ulf Kristjánsson-Ingebrigtsen was born on an airship — literally, between ports, to parents who were themselves drifters. Their mother is somewhere on the southern hyperlane circuit; they parted ways two years ago in circumstances they don''t fully explain. They have been working the Waukegan the Gray Zone since, picking up day labor in cargo loading, airship maintenance, and occasionally running small packages for traders who don''t ask them to know what''s inside. They are not naive — they know what some of those packages probably are — but they have developed a careful moral accounting system: nothing that hurts people who didn''t choose it. They are teaching themselves to read Ferrogate maintenance schematics from a salvaged manual, with the ambition of becoming a licensed airship tech before they turn twenty.', N'Ground-level view of youth survival in transit spaces; can provide access to airship cargo schedules and docking information; represents the generation growing up entirely outside corporate structure.', N'', N'Geneware: one cat ear (left side only, the matching right never installed); bioluminescent hair tips (green, intermittent — needs pigment drops to maintain)', N'Wakes early to queue for day labor postings at the Gray Zone''s loading bay boards; afternoons spent studying salvaged technical manuals; evenings at the communal fire near Dock Seven where airship crews sometimes share food.', N'Ulf Kristjánsson-Ingebrigtsen, GLMZ, short dark brown natural cloud hair with glowing bioluminescent green tips, deep warm golden-brown skin with Sub-Saharan African and Middle Eastern warmth balanced by Northern European genetic influence, alert dark brown eyes, 157cm wiry lean frame with economical posture slightly ducked forward. Left geneware cat ear furred and bioluminescent-capable, right ear fully human—asymmetrical augmentation. Small white scar above left eyebrow. Wearing salvaged layered clothing: mismatched thermal undersleeve and overshirt, worn synthetic puffer vest with reflective strips, reinforced canvas work pants with multiple pockets, re-soled steel-toed boots. Waterproof sleeve bag for data-tablet. Minimal unnecessary motion, economical precision in stance. Clean but weathered, visible repair stitching on clothes, callused hands. Industrial cargo bay or maintenance tunnel setting, atmospheric cool lighting with subtle shadows, neo-noir working drifter aesthetic, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone circa 2226 --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone', N'local', N'Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone', N'Northern European (44.8%), Sub-Saharan African (27.3%), Middle Eastern (24.0%), and trace East Asian (3.9%) ancestry create a striking continental blend. Warm deep brown skin with golden and reddish undertones reflects the luminous melanin expression of African and Middle Eastern ancestry, softened and enriched by Northern European genetic influence. Broad facial structure with defined cheekbones and bone architecture shows the balanced blend across all heritage regions. Natural hair texture suited to curl and coil. Rich dark brown eyes with alert, observant quality.', 157, 48, N'Wiry and lean with economical musculature of someone who moves carefully through tight spaces—cargo bay frames, maintenance tunnels, airship crawlways. No excess, efficient.', N'Natural dark brown with bioluminescent green tips (intermittent, fades when pigment drops run out)', N'Short natural cloud, textured and close to the scalp, occasionally decorated with salvaged wire wraps or cord', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and observant', N'Deep warm brown with golden and reddish undertones—rich melanin expression of Sub-Saharan African and Middle Eastern ancestry balanced by Northern European influence, creating luminous depth and natural radiance', N'Clean but weathered—minor calluses on hands and palms, sun-exposure marks on forearms from outdoor deck work, small scar above left eyebrow from cargo bay incident. Fine-grained skin texture with subtle variation reflecting natural hair follicle pattern. Basic grooming maintained despite resource scarcity.', N'Left geneware cat ear (furred, bioluminescent-capable), bioluminescent green hair tips on short natural hair (active status variable based on pigment maintenance budget). Right ear entirely human—deliberate half-augmentation speaks to economic constraint and personal acceptance.', N'Moves with economical precision—shoulders slightly forward as if habitually ducking through tight spaces. Stillness is their default; they don''t fidget or sprawl. When moving, they flow rather than stride, minimizing unnecessary motion. This economy of movement reflects both their physical environment and learned caution about drawing attention.', N'Tier 4-5 working drifter aesthetic. Salvaged or trade-circuit hand-me-downs: reinforced canvas work pants with multiple pockets, layered tops (thermal undersleeve + overshirt, often mismatched colors), worn synthetic puffer vest with reflective strips. Steel-toed boots re-soled multiple times. Waterproof sleeve bag for data-tablet always present. No branded items—everything functional or salvaged. Clean but visibly repaired with visible stitching and fabric patches.', N'The reason they parted from their mother wasn''t a fight — their mother sold two months of Aïssé''s labor to a cargo broker to pay off a debt, without telling them. Aïssé walked off the day they found out. They have not processed this and will not discuss it.', N'Fast, mixed with airship technical jargon and transit-hub slang, occasionally formal when they''re quoting something they''ve read', N'Quick bursts with sudden pauses when they''re deciding how much to say', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ulf_kristj_nsson_ingebrigtsen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ce-7066-b402-a329dc47a9c0', N'Dade Kimura', N'Dade', N'', N'Kimura', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 37, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Garret, in a well-appointed studio apartment that doubles as a test environment, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'VR experience designer and corporate-tier immersive art producer, creates high-end psychological experience installations for Tier 3-4 clients', N'Contracted to Helix Biosystems (two projects annually); otherwise independent; member of The Garret''s loose collective of premium artists', N'Dade Kimura is the kind of person who is precisely as beautiful as they need to be for the room they are in — they adjust presentation with the unconscious fluency of a skilled actor. In their studio, meeting with clients, they are polished: patterned irises (shifting mandala designs in amber and grey, a subtle demonstration of the geneware they can recommend), hair that changes color with their neural state through a sophisticated mod linked to their limbic system, clothes that cost what a Tier 1 resident earns in six months. In private, they are undone — hair colorless and still, in soft worn clothes, sitting on the floor with their legs folded, talking to their terminal.

They design VR experiences that are technically classified as entertainment but function closer to therapy, propaganda, or philosophical confrontation depending on the client. Their best-known commercial work is a series called ''Meridian Beneath Meridian'' — premium immersive experiences that take wealthy clients into accurate, detailed reconstructions of the city''s lower tiers, designed to produce empathy. They are privately scornful of almost all their clients and genuinely uncertain whether ''empathy tourism'' does any good or merely inoculates people against discomfort by letting them feel it in a controlled environment. They are contracted to Helix Biosystems for two projects per year, which funds everything else. They are good at their work in a way that makes them faintly miserable.', N'Access to Tier 3-4 social circles and Helix Biosystems internal culture; their VR environments are extraordinarily detailed archives of places and people they have researched; can be commissioned to create experiences that serve narrative purposes; morally complicated figure who embodies the tension between artistic integrity and corporate comfort', N'', N'Neural-state-linked hair color mod (responds to limbic system — involuntary display of emotional state); patterned shifting irises (amber/grey mandalas, cosmetic); high-end haptic feedback gloves for VR sculpting (cyberware, work tools); mild cognitive enhancement stack (focus and memory, Helix Biosystems-supplied)', N'Client meetings and pitch work in the mornings, which they find draining; actual design work from noon until they lose track of time, which is usually around 3 AM; irregular sleep; they attend Garret collective dinners twice a month because they know isolation is bad for them and they treat social contact like a prescription.', N'Dade Kimura, 2226 neo-noir — androgynous figure of mixed South Asian, East Asian, and Sub-Saharan heritage, 172cm lean frame, rich warm-toned medium-deep complexion with refined high cheekbones and angular features. Shoulder-length ash-grey hair with iridescent shift-quality, asymmetrically draped. Striking augmented eyes with rotating amber-grey mandala patterns, hypnotic and intricate. Fine black constellation tattoos (Orion, Cassiopeia, Andromeda) visible on inner left bicep. Lunar scar on left inner wrist. Wearing sleek black haptic feedback gloves with silver nodes, minimal silver neural-interface bracelet. Tailored neural-responsive fabric in cool neutrals with iridescent finish coordinate with hair shifts. Composed, calibrated posture with precise hand placement. Faint exhaustion shadows under eyes, expression of controlled irony. Overhead technical lighting casting subtle shadows at temples where neural implant integrated. Cool-toned neo-noir studio setting, bokeh circuit board elements in background, neon accent lighting in cool amber-grey spectrum. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, high-end corpo sensibility. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Garret', N'local', N'The Garret', N'Triracial cosmopolitan blend: South Asian dominant (51.1%) with substantial East Asian (25.1%) and Sub-Saharan African (23.8%) ancestry. Features reflect genuine genetic fusion — high, angular cheekbones from South and East Asian ancestry, deepened and warmed by Sub-Saharan undertones. The facial structure reads as authentically 22nd-century hybrid: refined bone structure with warm, luminous depth that transcends regional categorization.', 172, 61, N'Lean and angular, with the deliberate posture of someone who has trained themselves to occupy space precisely. Long-limbed, minimal subcutaneous fat, visible tendon definition in forearms and neck.', N'Variable — currently a muted ash-grey, but shifts through cool-to-warm spectrum (lavender, pale gold, cool silver) in response to emotional state. The mod is visible only if you know what to look for: a faint iridescent quality to the strands under certain light.', N'Shoulder-length, often pulled back in a loose knot or left to fall asymmetrically. The color-shift mod requires a certain length to be fully expressive; they would never cut it short.', N'Medium', N'Augmented: shifting mandala patterns in amber and grey, intricate and almost hypnotic. The patterns move subtly, appearing to rotate when they focus on something. Pupil dilation remains normal.', N'Medium to deep complexion with warm undertones. South Asian luminosity blended with East Asian refinement and Sub-Saharan depth creates a rich, polished appearance. Sun-exposed areas show subtle freckling across cheekbones and nose bridge. Natural glow suggests either excellent skincare or subtle cosmetic bioware.', N'Fine-featured with prominent, slightly angular cheekbones characteristic of South Asian and East Asian ancestry, with Sub-Saharan warmth deepening facial contours and enriching overall tone. Narrow jaw tapering to a pointed chin. Skin is consistently well-maintained but shows subtle exhaustion of irregular sleep — faint shadows under the eyes that no amount of retinoid will fully erase. Expression rests in mild irony, eyebrows slightly arched. Rarely shows full smiles; manages controlled expressions suggesting private amusement or calculated warmth.', N'The patterned shifting irises are immediately striking — they register as intentional cosmetic work, the kind that announces expertise and investment. The hair''s color-response is subtle enough that most observers chalk it up to lighting or dye job; only those familiar with the mod recognize it as active bioware. High-end haptic feedback gloves visible during work sessions — sleek black polymer with silver feedback nodes along palm and fingers, always kept in pristine condition. The gloves are worn with unconscious ease, treated as extensions of thought rather than tools.', N'Economical and precise. They move with the self-consciousness of someone who has internalized how they appear, each gesture calibrated. When alone, the careful architecture drops slightly — they slump, sprawl on floors, let their shoulders round. In professional contexts, they are composed: upright, hands visible and purposeful, eye contact maintained with the precision of someone managing a performance. They have a habit of touching their own forearms absently, fingers finding the constellation tattoos.', N'Context-dependent. In client meetings: high-end corpo-tier pieces (tailored neural-responsive fabrics from designers like Metaxen or Threadline, in cool neutrals and subtle iridescent finishes that coordinate with their hair shifts). Jewelry is minimal but expensive — a thin silver bracelet with an embedded neural interface diagnostic chip, perhaps a ring with an opal or moonstone that catches light. In private: soft, worn pieces in greys and blacks, clothes that have been washed hundreds of times until they feel like skin. Loose linen shirts, old thermal base layers, anything that prioritizes comfort over presentation. Footwear varies: corporate context means sleek, precision-engineered boots or minimalist shoes; at home and in The Garret, they go barefoot or wear soft, shapeless slippers.', N'The ''Meridian Beneath Meridian'' series is built on research they conducted by living in Tier 1 conditions for three months — not the sanitized field research version but actual immersion, in Deepwell, under a false name. During that time they had a relationship with someone there. They left without saying why. The experience archives they built from that period are the most accurate VR environments they have ever made, and they have never released them.', N'Educated and precise with an undercurrent of dry wit; uses ''we'' when discussing their work publicly (performing collaboration) and ''I'' when they forget to perform', N'Measured in client contexts, flowing and faster in genuine conversation — the gap between these registers is perceptible if you know what to listen for', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dade_kimura');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72d-78d9-98c0-a331697e1219', N'Gaspar Möller', N'Gaspar', N'', N'Möller', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Loft, Edgewater Prism district, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Holographic artist and VR experience designer', N'Formerly Tessera Entertainment Division; now independent, affiliated loosely with the Edgewater Prism gallery collective Refraction; The Null Ward', N'Gaspar Möller has the look of someone who spends most of their time inside illuminated spaces — her Ghanaian-Serbian complexion has an indoor pallor she compensates for with chromatic eye mods that shift through the visible spectrum in slow cycles, making her gaze feel like watching a sunset in real time. She''s slight, precise in her movements, and habitually overdressed in a corporate-minimalist style that reads as slightly out of place in The Loft''s more chaotic aesthetic — she worked a Tessera contract for three years and the wardrobe habits stuck even though she hates that they did. Her fingers are constantly moving, twitching through gestural commands on an AR layer only she can see.

Gaspar Möller builds experiences, not art objects — immersive holographic and VR environments commissioned for galleries, underground events, and occasionally for clients she won''t name. She is technically brilliant and conversationally anxious, most comfortable when she can communicate through the work rather than through words. She has strong opinions about what holographic art should do — ''not decorate, not distract, but displace, just for a moment'' — and will defend them at length if pressed, which is the one topic that makes her forget to be nervous. She left her Tessera contract under circumstances she describes as ''a philosophical disagreement,'' which is technically true and also a significant understatement.', N'Information source and skilled contact — her AR and VR design skills make her valuable for surveillance, investigation, or reconstruction of spaces; her Tessera connection is a plot thread; she can design environments that serve narrative purposes.', N'', N'Spectrum-cycling chromatic eye mods (geneware, cosmetic); neural AR overlay interface with haptic feedback gloves; retinal display implant for reviewing work in real time', N'Works irregular hours driven entirely by project deadlines — can disappear into an installation build for seventy-two hours straight then sleep for eighteen; keeps a hot desk at the Refraction gallery space and a sleeping loft above it.', N'Gaspar Möller, 2226 GLMZ neo-noir character portrait: 163cm slight-framed individual with luminous golden-brown skin and Pan-Asian-Hispanic heritage features — high defined cheekbones, sharp jawline, fine bone structure. Black hair pulled back in tight bun, pale from indoor living. Most striking feature: chromatic eye implants cycling slowly through amber, jade, violet, rose in 8-second rotation. Wearing tailored black turtleneck, grey tactical pants, matte black ankle boots with LED seams. Hands visible with micro-movement, fingers poised in mid-AR gesture. Posture: slightly forward-leaning concentration, economical precision. Corporate-minimalist aesthetic despite Tier 3-4 neighborhood. Studio neo-noir lighting: cool blue and warm amber accent lights highlighting the color-cycling eye implants, creating disquieting depth. Minimalist geometric jewelry. Background: subtle AR data streams, tech aesthetic, dim corporate-tower lighting. Mood: focused introspection, quiet intensity. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Loft', N'local', N'The Loft', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora phenotype: 40.4% Hispanic/Latin American base creates warm undertones and defined cheekbones, layered with 23.6% East Asian ancestry providing sharp facial geometry and eye structure. The 15.5% Indigenous American component adds breadth to facial planes and strengthens cheekbone definition, while 11.7% Southeast Asian ancestry contributes subtle softness to features and eye shape. Minor 4.9% Middle Eastern and 3.9% Eastern European heritage add warmth and complexity to skin undertones. The combined effect is a genuinely pan-global phenotype: high cheekbones from East Asian and Indigenous American ancestry, defined jawline from Hispanic/Latin American genetics, with luminous golden-brown skin that carries warm undertones from the entire ancestry blend. Bone structure reflects sophisticated genetic admixture rather than any single regional tradition.', 163, 51, N'Slight and precise, almost dancer-like in proportion — minimal muscle definition but with the kind of controlled posture that comes from years of fine motor work and extended screen time. Narrow shoulders, fine-boned wrists.', N'Black with a subtle warm undertone', N'Pulled back in a tight, minimalist bun or twisted knot — functional, never decorative', N'Medium (shoulder-length when released, but rarely is)', N'Chromatic cycling implant — shifts through spectrum: amber, jade, violet, rose, back to amber in slow 8-second cycles over natural dark brown with warm golden hints', N'Luminous golden-brown with rich warm undertones from blended Hispanic/Latin American, East Asian, and Indigenous American heritage; noticeably pale from indoor living, lacks the sun-darkened quality of outdoor tier residents. The complexion has an almost porcelain-like luminosity despite the warm tones.', N'Fine-featured with prominent, defined cheekbones reflecting East Asian and Indigenous American ancestry combined with sharp jawline from Hispanic/Latin American genetics. Facial planes show sophisticated blending: slightly higher cheekbones, subtle eye shape suggesting East and Southeast Asian influence, warm-toned skin without visible sun damage. Clear skin with slightly dehydrated quality of someone who forgets to eat during deep work. Minimal makeup except occasional kohl-line enhancement of the cycling eye effect. Expression typically focused inward, mouth set in neutral concentration.', N'Chromatic eye implants are the primary visible marker — the slow color cycling is immediately noticeable and disquieting to watch. Occasionally wears sleek haptic feedback gloves (black textile with subtle LED grid on palm surface for AR layer visualization) pushed up to elbows. No visible chrome or subdermal plating; all other augmentations are subcutaneous or internal.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, but not rigid. Frequently still except for her hands, which are in constant micromovements: fingers twitching through gestural AR commands, fidgeting with fabric, tracing invisible patterns in the air. When speaking, body goes very still; when working, she''s in perpetual micro-adjustment. Tends to lean slightly forward when concentrating, head tilted as if reading text only she can see.', N'Corporate-minimalist holdover from Tessera years — tailored but understated. Favors monochrome or very limited palettes: charcoal, black, off-white. Clean lines, expensive fabrics (synthetic micro-weave blends), almost austere. Typical outfit: fitted black turtle-neck, high-waisted grey tactical pants with discrete tech pockets, matte black ankle boots with subtle LED seams. Occasional piece of jewelry is usually geometric and structural rather than decorative — a stainless steel bangle, a capsule pendant. No logos or tier markers.', N'During her Tessera contract, she was commissioned to design a VR environment used in cognitive restructuring therapy — what she later discovered was a consent-optional loyalty conditioning program for mid-level Tessera employees. She didn''t know at the time. She found out. She kept the payment. She still uses some of the techniques in her independent work because they''re genuinely effective, and she''s not sure what that makes her.', N'Technical and precise when on ground she knows; hedged and over-qualified when uncertain; occasional Twi phrases used as filler when she''s thinking', N'Slightly too fast, as if she''s worried about being interrupted; slows and deepens when she''s talking about the work', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gaspar_m_ller');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6da-75e7-8e52-a3478be35808', N'Elmira Ingebrigtsen', N'Elmira', N'', N'Ingebrigtsen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenosha Crossing — the tarp-city south of the hyperlane interchange, near past the Kedzie Barrier', N'climate refugee, former delta-farmer, seasonal shelter-seeker', N'Kenosha Crossing tarp-city informal elder collective', N'Elmira Ingebrigtsen is a broad-shouldered woman whose face has been scoured into deep lines by decades of wind off a dying inland sea. Her skin is the color of dark river silt, mapped with faint scars from salt-chap and sun. She wears a patchwork thermal wrap she''s been mending for eleven years, and her left hand is missing two fingers — lost to a harvesting machine when she was thirty. Her eyes are still and watchful, the particular calm of someone who has already lost most of what there was to lose.

She came from a drowned agricultural collective somewhere south of what used to be a great lake, following the hyperlane north when the floods took the last of the soil. She does not talk about the collective. She talks about weather — wind pressure, cloud formations, the smell of rain before it arrives — with the precision of someone whose life once depended on it. At Kenosha Crossing she has become a de facto matriarch of the tarp-city''s oldest cluster, settling disputes with an economy of words that makes younger drifters uneasy. She prays to the E.L.F. she calls Grandmother Antenna, leaving small braids of wire at junction boxes.', N'Community anchor and information hub for the tarp-city; quest-giver for matters involving the survival politics of stateless communities; provides grounded moral weight to scenes set at Kenosha Crossing.', N'', N'None. Refuses on principle — ''I came in whole, I leave whole.''', N'Wakes before dawn to read the sky and check the drainage channels she''s dug around the cluster''s shelters; spends afternoons mediating food-share disputes and teaching younger refugees basic weathercraft.', N'A weathered woman, 172cm tall, with deep warm brown skin bearing golden and olive undertones from complex East Asian, Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan, and Hispanic ancestry. Silver-grey hair in a long braid bound with faded cloth and thin wire offerings. Prominent cheekbones, full lips, slight epicanthal fold at dark brown eyes clouded with age-related cataracts. Her left hand missing index and middle fingers. Parallel burn scars on her left forearm, faint ghost tattoo on inner wrist. Heavily lined face and weathered complexion from decades of salt and wind exposure. Wearing a patchwork thermal wrap of grey-brown base with blue tarp patches, cream synthetic panels, and wool inserts—mended for eleven years. Thin undershirt, worn cargo pants with multiple pockets, weathered boots with wrapped ankle laces, paracord belt. Wire braids and junction-box offerings hang at her neck. She stands upright with shoulders slightly forward, weight distributed evenly, reading the sky. GLMZ, GLMZ refugee enclave, salt-weathered aesthetic, dystopian dawn lighting casting long shadows, wire and salvage details, spiritually resistant unaugmented figure, gritty and dignified --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenosha Crossing', N'local', N'Kenosha Crossing', N'Predominantly East Asian (42.4%) with significant Southeast Asian (17.5%), Sub-Saharan African (14.0%), and Hispanic/Latin American (11.8%) ancestry, plus Eastern European (11.6%) and South Asian (2.7%) components. Her facial structure reflects this complex blend: prominent Southeast Asian cheekbones, broader Sub-Saharan nasal features, and the slight epicanthal fold characteristic of East Asian genetics. The overall effect is a richly mixed phenotype where no single heritage dominates her appearance.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, with the compact muscularity of someone who has done manual labor for decades. Not lean — her frame carries functional mass. Her posture is upright despite age, though her shoulders slope slightly forward from years of hunching against wind.', N'Silver-grey with faint traces of dark brown at the roots', N'Worn in a single long braid, bound with strips of faded cloth and threaded with thin wire at irregular intervals — a functional choice that also serves as prayer offerings', N'Long', N'Dark brown, almost black, with a milky film from age-related cataracts beginning to form', N'Deep warm brown with golden, reddish, and subtle olive undertones — a complex blend reflecting East Asian warmth, Southeast Asian depth, Sub-Saharan richness, and Eastern European undertones, weathered to a dusty patina by decades of salt and wind exposure', N'Heavily lined face, particularly around the eyes and mouth, with moderate to prominent cheekbones and full lips reflecting her East and Southeast Asian heritage blended with Sub-Saharan and Hispanic/Latin American features. Nasal bridge shows East Asian characteristics with slight broadening from Sub-Saharan genetics. Skin is weathered and dry from decades of wind and salt exposure. Faint crosshatch scarring visible on cheeks and forehead from repeated salt-chap and sun damage. Her left hand is missing the index and middle fingers — a clean amputation at the second knuckle from a harvesting machine accident.', N'None. She is entirely unaugmented and wears this as a form of resistance and spiritual integrity.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion. Her gait is slightly favoring her right side from decades of compensating for her missing left fingers. She stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders back, chin slightly raised as if reading the sky. Her remaining left hand often rests against her thermal wrap, a habitual gesture of checking the weave. When she sits, she folds into herself compactly, spine curved, ready to rise quickly.', N'Tier 5 refugee wear. Her primary garment is a patchwork thermal wrap she has been mending for eleven years — it is a palimpsest of repairs made from salvaged fabric scraps, sealed seams, and reinforced panels. The base color is faded grey-brown, with visible patches of blue tarp material, cream-colored synthetic fibers, and darker wool inserts. The wrap is layered with a thin undershirt (probably salvaged) and cargo pants with multiple pockets, all heavily worn. She wears weathered boots with the left foot''s laces wrapped around the ankle to compensate for her missing fingers'' inability to tie knots. A belt of braided paracord holds everything in place. Around her neck hangs a collection of wire braids and small junction-box offerings, and she often carries a notebook for weather observations made with a pencil stub.', N'She did not simply flee the collective. She made the decision to open the flood barriers early to save the seed vault, and three people drowned in the fields because of it. She has never told anyone. The seed vault was lost anyway six months later.', N'Sparse, agricultural metaphors, references weather and soil constantly, avoids emotional language', N'Slow, deliberate, lets silence do work', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'elmira_ingebrigtsen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a70e-7284-bffd-a37c189e1e25', N'Alofa Björnsdóttir-Taualagi-Sefanaia', N'Alofa', N'', N'Björnsdóttir-Taualagi-Sefanaia', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, sub-level workshop called The Resonance Pit, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Sound sculptor and underground venue performer', N'Independent; loosely affiliated with the Hamtramck Enclave Makers'' Collective', N'Alofa Björnsdóttir-Taualagi-Sefanaia is a wide-shouldered man gone soft at the edges, with deep brown skin mapped by decades of industrial pigment stains he never fully washed out. His face is all heavy brow and patient eyes the color of tarnished copper, and he keeps his grey-streaked locs pinned back with salvaged circuit wire. His left hand is natural; his right has subdermal resonance nodes implanted across the knuckles that let him feel frequencies ordinary ears can''t register, a gift he gave himself thirty years ago when his hearing began to go. He speaks slowly, as though each word costs him something, and smiles rarely — but when he does it rearranges his whole face into something unexpectedly gentle.

Alofa Björnsdóttir-Taualagi-Sefanaia builds instruments from the corpse-materials of the city: burst coolant pipes, decommissioned server racks, cracked transit rail segments. He coaxes sounds from them that shouldn''t be possible — subsonic groans that make audiences feel grief they can''t name, high harmonics that trigger involuntary memories. He is not famous. He has refused every corponation arts-sponsorship offer for twenty years and considers this his greatest achievement. His underground shows happen in flooded basement corridors, in decommissioned lift shafts, in places where the city''s own skeleton becomes the concert hall.', N'Local legend and information node — he has been in Hamtramck long enough to know everyone''s history; quest giver for retrieving a stolen or destroyed instrument; atmospheric anchor for the city''s underground arts scene', N'', N'Subdermal resonance nodes across right hand knuckles (frequency sensitivity); mild cochlear amplifier (left ear only, the right is fully deaf); a single bioluminescent stripe running up the back of his neck that pulses faintly blue when he''s absorbed in work — a cosmetic mod his daughter talked him into', N'Mornings he scavenges salvage yards and transit depots for materials; afternoons and evenings he welds, tunes, and composes alone in The Resonance Pit, emerging only to eat or to post cryptic venue coordinates to encrypted community boards.', N'A weathered master craftsman in the GLMZ, 2226. Alofa Björnsdóttir-Taualagi-Sefanaia: 188cm tall, wide-shouldered, medium-brown skin with golden and copper undertones reflecting Nordic-Polynesian-African ancestry blend. Deep facial lines, strong Nordic cheekbones softened by Polynesian breadth, warm brown eyes faded with age. Dark brown locs with silver streaks pinned back with circuit wire. Right hand bears subdermal resonance node scarring in geometric grid; faint bioluminescent blue stripe glows on back of neck when focused. Countless pale welding burn scars across both forearms. Wearing heavy canvas work apron stained with welding slag over charred industrial undershirt, faded cargo pants, scuffed steel-toed boots. Weathered grey wool coat patched at elbows. Small chrome cochlear amplifier at left mastoid. Copper wire bracelet on right wrist, smooth copper ring on left hand. Moving with deliberate slowness, hunched forward in deep concentration, eyes half-closed as if feeling frequencies through fingertips. Industrial workshop setting with arc-light glow, shadows catching the texture of decades-old scars and calluses. Neo-noir working-class authenticity, lived-in and functional. Moody atmospheric lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Northern European (66.1%) with significant Pacific Islander (18.9%) and Sub-Saharan African (15.0%) ancestry. The blend manifests in warm medium-brown skin with golden and copper undertones, strong Nordic bone structure softened by Polynesian breadth, and African melanin creating a complex, multivalent complexion that reads as distinctly post-Diaspora.', 188, 94, N'Wide-shouldered and barrel-chested, softened through age with a slight paunch at the midriff. Muscular forearms and capable hands suggest decades of welding and manual craftsmanship, but the core has lost its tautness.', N'Dark brown with silver-grey streaks, natural greying', N'Locs pinned back with salvaged circuit wire, pulled away from face', N'Long (shoulder-length or beyond when unpinned)', N'Warm brown with amber undertones, natural but faded with age', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and copper undertones. The complexion reflects layered ancestry — Nordic fairness genes mixing with Sub-Saharan and Pacific Islander melanin to create sun-weathered richness. Heavily weathered by decades of industrial exposure and arc-light exposure.', N'Heavily lined face with strong, defined bone structure — prominent cheekbones inherited from Nordic ancestry, broad jawline with Polynesian breadth, straight nose bridge. Deep creases around the eyes and mouth from decades of concentration and squinting through welding light. Industrial pigment stains — faint rust-red, copper, and metallic residue — permanently embedded in the creases of hands and forearms, never fully washed clean. Rough, calloused palms.', N'Right hand knuckles display faint subdermal lattice scarring where resonance nodes interface with skin. Single bioluminescent stripe on posterior neck glows faint blue when activated. Left ear bears a small external cochlear amplifier mounted at the mastoid — weathered chrome with a visible bypass wire.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness, economical gestures. Hunches slightly forward when concentrating, as though leaning into frequencies only he can feel through his right hand. When engaged, he becomes almost meditative — very still, eyes half-closed. Walks with a slight limp favoring the right side (old injury). Rarely makes sudden movements; everything is considered.', N'Tier 3-4 working class with utilitarian, lived-in aesthetic. Favors heavy canvas work aprons stained with welding slag and coolant residue over faded jumpsuits or cargo pants. Wears a salvaged industrial undershirt beneath — often charred at the cuffs. Steel-toed boots scuffed and resoled multiple times. A grey wool coat, decades old and patched at the elbows, worn over everything when leaving The Resonance Pit. No corporate branding or flashy modifications — all clothing is functional and durable. Minimal jewelry: a simple copper ring on his left index finger (worn smooth with age) and occasionally a length of copper wire coiled around his right wrist like a bracelet.', N'The great fifteen-year work he''s building is a sonic portrait of his estranged son Davi, who died in a transit accident. He has never told anyone who the piece is for. He cannot finish it because finishing it means accepting Davi is gone.', N'Plain, precise, occasionally poetic in unexpected bursts; avoids jargon except when discussing acoustics', N'Slow, deliberate, long pauses between thoughts — not hesitation but consideration', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alofa_bj_rnsd_ttir_taualagi_sefanaia');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a661-79a0-bd06-a381c6e4e385', N'Caetano Horváth-Castañeda', N'Caetano', N'', N'Horváth-Castañeda', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 36, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower district tenements near the old lakeshore, near Halsted and Division', N'Forced entry and close-quarters combat specialist — breacher', N'Freelance — Geartown regular; Switchblade Alley', N'Caetano Horváth-Castañeda are compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 36, their face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — cybernetic arm — right, full replacement from shoulder — stronger than organic, — and they make no effort to hide it.

Their entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. They work as a breacher out of the Gray Zone, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Caetano Horváth-Castañeda describe them as a precision instrument — point them at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Nenad Vargas-Baffour functions as a connector — their work puts them in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving them naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Cybernetic arm — right, full replacement from shoulder — stronger than organic, obvious chrome. Chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Caetano Horváth-Castañeda, 36-year-old neo-noir operative, mixed heritage with prominent high cheekbones and angular jaw, warm rich brown skin with golden undertones, deep brown eyes with subtle Asian fold influence. Short dark brown hair with silver at temples, pulled back tight. 168cm compact densely muscled build. Full cybernetic gunmetal chrome right arm with visible joints and servo lines. Jagged scar on left temple, thin scar through left eyebrow, faded crescent burn scarring on right shoulder. Black facial stubble. Wearing black reinforced tactical cargo pants, grey fitted undershirt, black armor-plated tactical vest, worn charcoal synthetic leather jacket. Steel-toe boots. Wrist chronometer, simple steel ring. Geometric circuit tattoo visible on left forearm. Standing in dim industrial setting, weight distributed, knees bent, predatory stillness. Nocturnal lighting, cool shadows, slight squint. Matte non-reflective utilitarian aesthetic. GLMZ, GLMZ aesthetic. Photorealistic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Sub-Saharan African (34.4%), Indigenous American (19.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (18.4%), Eastern European (14.5%), East Asian (9.7%), and Southeast Asian (3.7%) blend. The dominant Sub-Saharan African and Indigenous American ancestry creates prominent high cheekbones, strong angular jaw structure, and naturally dense bone density. The East Asian and Southeast Asian components (13.4% combined) contribute a subtle epicanthic eye fold influence and moderate facial width. Hispanic/Latin American heritage adds warmth and golden undertones throughout. Eastern European ancestry provides slight facial width balance. The combination produces someone striking and genuinely mixed—a cosmopolitan appearance where no single ancestry dominates, reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 78, N'Compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground with a center of gravity engineered for impact absorption. Shoulders broad relative to frame, legs powerful and proportional. No excess mass — every kilogram serves function.', N'Dark brown, naturally, with premature silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back tight, practical, minimal styling. Kept short enough to prevent grab points.', N'Short', N'Deep dark brown with subtle epicanthic fold influence and warm amber undertones', N'Rich warm brown with golden undertones, a complex blend reflecting Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, and Hispanic/Latin American heritage with Eastern European and East Asian modulation', N'Weathered for 36—sun damage from nocturnal work cycles causing occasional hyperpigmentation on cheekbones. Prominent, high cheekbones with strong definition from Sub-Saharan African and Indigenous American heritage. Squared jaw with angular structure shows East Asian facial width influence. Nose professionally reset after break, bridge slightly asymmetrical. Facial structure displays strong bone architecture: medium-width face with defined planes and natural prominence. Subtle eye fold characteristic of East and Southeast Asian ancestry. Facial hair kept to stubble, deliberate maintenance.', N'Full cybernetic right arm from shoulder replacement—polished gunmetal chrome with visible articulation joints and servo lines. The arm is noticeably stronger in profile, with angular plating and a distinctly non-organic aesthetic. No attempt to pass it off as skin. Nasal augmentation barely visible—faint discoloration around the nostrils where the chemical analyzer interfaces with living tissue.', N'Economy of motion. Stands with weight distributed across both legs, knees slightly bent, ready to shift. Moves without excess. The chrome arm hangs naturally but with a subtle mechanical precision to its rest position. Eyes are always tracking, cataloging. Nocturnal adaptation—slight squint in bright light, but in dim conditions moves with predatory comfort.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian—function over fashion. Black reinforced cargo pants with utility pockets and articulated knee panels. Steel-toe boots, scuffed and worn but maintained. Layered tops: a fitted grey undershirt and a black tactical vest with integrated armor plating and tool loops. A worn synthetic leather jacket in charcoal, sized to accommodate the chrome arm without binding. No corporate branding. All materials are durable and matte—nothing that catches light. Minimal jewelry: a simple steel ring on left hand, a wrist-mounted chronometer in brushed steel.', N'', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'caetano_horv_th_casta_eda');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a627-7d4e-9462-a44689ab3dde', N'Chetan Kristjánsson', N'Chetan', N'', N'Kristjánsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 42, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, outer ring, stall block near the transit umbilical, Edgewater Prism, near Clark and Belmont', N'Clothing and fashion vendor specializing in modified and counterfeit corp-branded apparel, The Burnished Market', N'Independent; The Oxidian Market Vendors Guild (associate); informal relationships with mid-tier buyers in Lakeview Neon who purchase his originals off-market; The Shore Dogs', N'Chetan Kristjánsson is tall and broadly built with a deliberate elegance that he maintains as a form of advertising — everything he wears is something he''s made, modified, or sourced, and it''s always impeccable. His skin is deep brown with a reddish undertone, his head cleanly shaved, and his beard trimmed with geometric precision. He has color-changing hair along his temples — a narrow strip of geneware follicles he grows out to a short fade, currently cycling through slow burgundy-to-black transitions that he coordinates with his outfit. His hands bear old needle-prick scars across the fingertips from years before he could afford proper equipment.

His stall is the most curated space in the Burnished Market: no clutter, no piles, everything on display at eye level and shoulder height, garments hung with the spacing of a gallery. He sells counterfeit Sterling-Nakamura executive wear, modified Tessera corporate-casual that reads higher tier than it is, and his own original fabrication — structural pieces he designs and produces himself in a back workshop that would sell for triple the price in Lakeview Neon if he could get distribution. He is charming and slightly formal in the way of someone who grew up performing dignity as a survival strategy, and he wraps every sale in a kind of ceremony, as if clothes are genuinely sacred, which, for him, they are.', N'Equipment provider for disguise or tier-passing scenarios, social mobility commentary, window into the aspirational economy of the lower tiers, potential Lakeview Neon connection point for street-level characters.', N'', N'Color-changing geneware hair follicles (temple strip). Haptic feedback gloves — not augmentations per se, but sophisticated fabricator''s tools he wears constantly, which allow micro-tactile precision in stitching work.', N'Mornings in his back workshop cutting and assembling. Stall opens by late morning and runs through evening — Burnished Market peaks at night and he stays open for the after-shift crowd. Spends two nights a week doing quiet deliveries to Lakeview Neon contacts.', N'Chetan Kristjánsson, 188cm tall mixed-heritage East Asian-Southeast Asian-Hispanic man with warm golden-tan skin and olive undertones, sharp angular cheekbones blending East Asian structure with Eastern European definition. Cleanly shaved head with color-cycling geneware temple strips transitioning burgundy to black. Dark alert brown eyes, geometric precision beard. Wearing tailored modified Tessera corporate jacket with hand-reinforced seaming, clean geometric cut salvaged fabric pants with hand-finished hems. Gray haptic feedback gloves with tactile nodules visible. Faded needle-prick scarring on fingertips, linear scar on left palm. Monochromatic earthy tones highlighting geneware accent. Stands centered, shoulders back, deliberate and controlled posture. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, ambient neon backlighting on temple geneware, cool LED indirect lighting casting shadows across angular face and hands, moody indoor setting, professional and contained expression. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Predominantly East Asian (53.6%) with substantial Southeast Asian (24.8%) and Hispanic/Latin American (12.0%) ancestry, complemented by Eastern European (6.7%), Northern European (1.7%), and Middle Eastern (1.2%) heritage. This creates a striking pan-Asian foundation with warm golden undertones: East Asian bone structure and eye shape form the primary architecture, enriched by Southeast Asian depth and warmth, Latin American luminosity across the cheekbones and bridge, and Eastern European definition in the jawline and cheekbones. A synthesis of multiple continents in one face.', 188, 91, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial without heaviness — the build of someone who moves deliberately, with presence. Carries himself with deliberate verticality, neither stocky nor lean, but proportioned for both precision work and command of a space.', N'Cleanly shaved scalp; color-cycling geneware strip along temples currently in mid-transition from deep burgundy to black', N'Head shaved smooth; temple geneware strip kept in a precise fade, approximately 2cm wide on each side', N'Shaved (body); Short (geneware accent)', N'Dark brown, alert and assessing', N'Warm golden-tan with rich olive undertones — the East and Southeast Asian base enhanced by Latin American golden radiance and Eastern European structural clarity. Skin carries subtle warm peachy tones across cheekbones and nose bridge. Even complexion, meticulously maintained.', N'Meticulously groomed; angular facial structure with prominent high cheekbones reflecting the East/Southeast Asian heritage with Eastern European bone definition. Broad nose bridge with slight width characteristic of Southeast Asian ancestry. Beard trimmed with geometric precision — sharp lines, clean edges, suggesting hours of deliberate maintenance. No visible acne or weathering; skin suggests careful hygiene and minor cosmetic upkeep. Expression carries formality and attentiveness.', N'Haptic feedback gloves worn constantly — sleek gray synthetic leather with subtle tactile nodules across palm and fingertips, wrist cuffs with micro-fiber threading. No visible chrome or LED implants; geneware hair modification is only organic augmentation.', N'Stands with centered weight, shoulders back, head level — a practiced neutral that reads as both approachable and contained. Moves with deliberate economy; hand gestures are precise and controlled. When handling garments, movements become fluid and almost meditative. Maintains steady eye contact during conversation.', N'Everything he wears is self-curated and worn as advertisement. Current typical appearance: tailored mid-tier modified Tessera corporate-casual jacket (his own rework with structural reinforcement and subtly elevated seaming), precisely fitted under-collar showing signature finishing. Pants are his original design — clean geometric cut, high-quality salvaged mid-tier fabric with hand-finished hems. Accessories are minimal but impeccable: wrist cuff display of his geneware strip, haptic gloves always visible. Tier 3-4 aesthetic executed with Tier 2 precision. Everything monochromatic or in coordinated earth tones to highlight the geneware accent.', N'Two of his ''original designs'' are directly adapted from the unpublished sketchbooks of a deceased Sterling-Nakamura designer whose estate files he purchased cheaply at a data auction without fully understanding what was in them. He has convinced himself this is inspiration rather than theft. He has not convinced himself enough to sleep easily about it.', N'Formal and polished with an undertow of Malian-Romanian market cadence that surfaces when he''s excited or off-guard. Uses fashion and construction metaphors. Speaks about clothing in almost spiritual terms.', N'Measured and warm. Good at sustained eye contact. Makes every customer feel like the conversation is exclusively about them.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chetan_kristj_nsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f7-77a0-ac42-a495af231bb2', N'Folaranmi Lindström-Vasquez-Alfarsi-Matsumoto', N'Folaranmi', N'', N'Lindström-Vasquez-Alfarsi-Matsumoto', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Rotating — Blackpipe Corridor, Grand Crossing Gate, and the Grindstone Shore encampment, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Q-zero ghost — a person with no digital identity', N'None formally. Trusted by several Grindstone Shore encampment elders. Known to certain Blackpipe Corridor E.L.F. shrine keepers.', N'Folaranmi Lindström-Vasquez-Alfarsi-Matsumoto is a tall man gone thin in the way of long deprivation, but there is nothing fragile about him — he carries himself with the measured deliberateness of someone who has learned that drawing attention costs more than it''s worth. His skin is very dark, deep blue-black in low light, and he has grown his locs long enough to wrap and tuck under a weathered hood. His eyes are baseline human but striking — very pale grey-green against his complexion, an inheritance from a great-grandmother he never met. He has no augmentations of any kind: no chrome, no geneware, no embedded chips. This is not poverty; it is survival. Every augmentation is a signal, a trackable node. He is deliberately blank.

He was a mid-tier Axiom logistics analyst until twelve years ago, when he witnessed something in a data batch that was not meant to be witnessed, and the most effective response available to him was to stop existing. His original identity — Kofi-Samuel Nansen-Mbiti, employee number 7-Alpha-3391 — was formally declared deceased by Axiom internal records eighteen months after his disappearance. He knows things about Axiom''s supply chain architecture that would be worth significant Quanta to competitors, but he has never sold them. Not from loyalty. From the calculation that the moment he proves he exists, he is already dead.', N'Deep information source on Axiom''s internal architecture and historical operations. Living example of what Q-zero status means practically. Can connect players to the informal shadow economy of the undocumented. His knowledge is a ticking asset — eventually someone will realize he is still alive.', N'', N'None. Deliberately maintains zero augmentation profile.', N'Moves between three sleeping locations on a rotation no one else knows. Earns Quanta doing manual labor that pays in physical coin — dock unloading, waste sorting, construction fill-in. Spends evenings at shrine alcoves, not praying exactly, but listening — he believes E.L.F.s notice people the system does not.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Folaranmi Lindström-Vasquez-Alfarsi-Matsumoto, a lean 188cm man with genuinely mixed Southeast Asian and Northern European heritage reflected in warm golden-brown skin with complex amber undertones, high prominent cheekbones, angular jaw with Middle Eastern definition, pale grey-green unaugmented eyes striking against warm skin. Black locs with grey threading, past-shoulder length, partially wrapped and tucked. Close-trimmed salt-and-pepper stubble. Weathered but deliberate, unplaceable features. Wearing faded grey-black canvas work jacket, thermal-lined black hoodie, reinforced workpants, scuffed synthetic boots, grey weathered scarf. Thin white scar along left jawline. No visible augmentation—conspicuously chrome-free. Posture measured and economical, weight forward on balls of feet, hands visible and low. Expression neutral, selective eye contact. Standing in shadow and neon, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone dock sector, utilitarian functionality, deliberately forgettable presence, atmospheric industrial lighting, moody and reserved demeanor --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Rotating', N'local', N'Rotating', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: Southeast Asian (42.8%) and Northern European (38.2%) form his dominant genetic architecture, with secondary influence from Middle Eastern (13.3%) and East Asian (5.7%) ancestry. His features synthesize these lineages into a deliberately unplaceable face: Southeast Asian bone structure—high, prominent cheekbones and eye set—modulated by Northern European angularity in his jaw and brow ridge. His nose bridge carries Middle Eastern definition and strength, while East Asian ancestry contributes subtle refinement to his eye shape. The result is warm golden-brown skin with balanced, complex undertones that shift between amber and honey depending on light, creating a luminous quality that reads as genuinely mixed rather than exoticized. His pale grey-green eyes create striking contrast against this warm-toned base—a recessive Northern European trait surfacing against Southeast Asian-dominant coloring', 188, 72, N'Lean and economical — muscle retained from sustained manual labor, but carved down by years of minimal caloric surplus. Wiry rather than athletic; the build of someone who moves efficiently because waste costs', N'Natural black with grey threading at temples and throughout the locs', N'Locs, wrapped and tucked beneath a weathered hood most hours; when loose, they fall past his shoulders', N'Long', N'Pale grey-green, striking against his skin tone — baseline human, unmodified', N'Warm golden-brown with balanced amber and honey undertones from Southeast Asian-Northern European genetic dominance, luminous in direct light, deeper burnt amber in shadow. The result of genuine genetic mixing: neither pale nor deeply saturated, but complex and shifting', N'Weathered but maintained — no vanity, but deliberate cleanliness. Jaw defined with warm undertones, cheekbones high and prominent carrying equal architectural weight from Southeast Asian and Northern European heritage. Nose bridge angular with soft, elegant definition reflecting Middle Eastern ancestry. Face structure reads as lean, carved by years of minimal surplus. Beard kept close-trimmed, salt-and-pepper stubble most days. His face carries the precision of someone who has learned to be forgettable; it does not invite conversation', N'None. Deliberately maintains zero visible augmentation. His lack of chrome, LED optics, or subdermal plating is conspicuous in the GLMZ — a signal to those who know how to read it: this man is either extremely poor or extremely intentional about erasure', N'Measured, economical gait — no wasted motion. Stands with slight forward lean, weight distributed to balls of feet as if ready to shift direction. Keeps his hands visible and low. His eye contact is selective; he looks at people long enough to know them, not long enough to be remembered. Moves like someone navigating a space where being noticed is dangerous', N'Tier 4-5 functionality. Weathered grey-black canvas work jacket with multiple pockets (for carrying physical Quanta, tools, necessities — not for augmentation ports). Thermal-lined hoodie beneath, faded black. Workpants with reinforced knees, scuffed synthetic leather boots. No corporate branding, no fashion markers, no status indicators. Everything is worn past the point of style into pure utility. A weathered grey scarf, wrapped loose around his neck, that can serve as hood or face cover. His hood is always accessible', N'He has made a complete memory palace of everything he witnessed in that Axiom data batch — supplier names, routing codes, mortality figures — and recites it to himself nightly like a prayer. He does not know if he is preserving evidence or preserving his sense of self. He suspects the two have fused.', N'Educated, precise, occasionally slips into logistics and supply chain terminology before catching himself. Speaks in careful complete sentences.', N'Unhurried, slightly formal. The cadence of a man who chooses every word.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'folaranmi_lindstr_m_vasquez_alfarsi_matsumoto');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e3-7de5-9dd0-a4b0f4e3da72', N'Christiaan Vaai', N'Christiaan', N'', N'Vaai', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, shop called Dermis & Ghost, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Tattoo artist and gene-mod body artist', N'Independent; loose ties to the Hamtramck Enclave artist collective Marrow Union', N'Christiaan Vaai is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin and Magyar cheekbones that make her face look like it was chiseled from ironwood. She keeps her head shaved close on the sides and wears her coiled black hair in a tall, unruly crown that she threads with copper wire when she''s working. Her own body is her portfolio: bioluminescent blue-green patterns track her lymph nodes and veins like a living anatomy chart, a deliberate choice she calls ''reading the body honestly.'' Her left forearm is sleeved in raised keloid-art shaped into Maasai-influenced geometric forms — done by her own hand using a mirror rig she built herself.

She is methodical, unhurried, and almost preternaturally calm, which unnerves people who come to her expecting chattiness. She believes the body is the only honest text a person leaves behind and treats each client''s skin as a document she is merely helping to clarify. She can be withering when someone asks for something she finds spiritually lazy, and warmly generous when she senses someone is trying to tell the truth about themselves. She prays to the E.L.F. she calls Needle-That-Remembers before every session, leaving it fragments of client consent forms as offerings.', N'Quest giver, local color, information broker — she knows everyone''s secrets because people tell their tattoo artists things they tell no one else; can introduce characters to underground networks through her client base.', N'', N'Bioluminescent subdermal tracery (cosmetic geneware); precision-haptic finger implants for fine motor control (cyberware); gene-mod irises with compound-facet pattern that let her perceive UV spectrum', N'Opens the shop at noon, spends mornings doing consultation sketches and E.L.F. devotions; works four to six clients per day, each session lasting two to five hours; closes late and drinks one glass of palm wine alone before sleeping.', N'Christiaan Vaai, a Pacific Islander and Sub-Saharan African mixed-heritage woman, 178cm tall, powerful athletic build, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones. Shaved sides with long coiled jet-black hair threaded with copper wire. Direct, unflinching gaze with compound-facet brown eyes that shimmer with UV perception. Bioluminescent blue-green subdermal tracery glows across chest, shoulders, neck in vascular patterns. Left forearm sleeved in raised pale keloid scarification—geometric diamonds, chevrons, interlocking triangles. Ritual scarification marks on inner wrists and behind ears. Precision-haptic finger implants visible at knuckles and fingertips with metallic catch-light. Wearing fitted charcoal sleeveless tunic and high-waisted black reinforced linen work pants, bare feet. Posture is straight, deliberate, economical movement. Hands subtly active. GLMZ 2200s tattoo artist, professional studio lighting casting shadows across her augmented features, sitting at rest with purposeful grace. Background suggests a high-end biomod shop. Photorealistic, detailed, moody neo-noir lighting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Pacific Islander (65.9%) with Sub-Saharan African (22.8%), East Asian (7.4%), and Eastern European (3.9%) ancestry—a striking blend evident in her deep, luminous brown skin tone with warm golden and amber undertones, the broad facial structure and naturally coiled hair pattern from her dominant Pacific Islander and African heritage, subtle high cheekbones, and the depth of her compound-facet eyes. The strength of her jaw and the undertone complexity of her skin reflect the smaller but visible contributions of East Asian and Eastern European ancestry.', 178, 72, N'Broad-shouldered and powerfully built with defined musculature in her forearms and shoulders from decades of precise tattooing work. Not bulky—economical, purposeful density.', N'Jet black, natural', N'Shaved close on the sides to stubble; crown left long and coiled, often threaded with copper wire during working hours', N'Long crown, very short sides', N'Deep brown with visible compound-facet iridescence when light hits them at certain angles; capable of UV perception', N'Deep warm brown with rich golden and amber undertones—luminous and unmarked except where deliberately modified', N'Broad facial structure with strong, defined cheekbones and balanced jaw reflecting her Pacific Islander and African heritage. Minimalist facial grooming. Skin condition is immaculate—treated as a canvas and canvas-keeper. No acne, minimal scarring except where intentional.', N'Precision-haptic finger implants visible as subtle metallic joint-work at her knuckles and fingertips when examined closely—micro-articulation points catch light. The compound-facet eye modification is detectable only when light refracts off her irises, revealing a subtle honeycomb shimmer.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical grace—no wasted motion. Sits with her spine straight and shoulders relaxed. Hands are always subtly active even at rest (fingers flexing, tracing patterns in air). Her gaze is unflinching and direct. Speaks slowly, choosing words with the care she uses selecting needles.', N'Tier 3 working artist aesthetic. Typically wears fitted sleeveless tunics or tank tops in muted colors (charcoal, rust, deep indigo) to showcase her body as portfolio. High-waisted, reinforced linen work pants in black. Bare feet or minimalist sandals in the shop. Occasionally wears a long linen overshirt unbuttoned and rolled at the sleeves when meeting clients outside Dermis & Ghost. No jewelry except copper wire in her hair. Fabric choices suggest quality craftsmanship but not status signaling—function and durability over brand.', N'Three years ago she tattooed a Tessera corporate auditor with a hidden steganographic data pattern embedded in the design — commissioned by someone she now suspects was a Ferrogate saboteur. She doesn''t know what the data said. She''s terrified to find out.', N'Precise, spare, slightly formal — she speaks like she''s writing something down; occasional Hungarian and Swahili words slip in under stress', N'Slow and deliberate; long pauses before answering; never interrupts', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'christiaan_vaai');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a4-71c9-9a02-a4b5331c12ea', N'Atlas Kobayashi-Trujillo-Pham', N'Atlas', N'', N'Kobayashi-Trujillo-Pham', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'The Loft, Lockhaven North — operates a pirate screening venue called the Sediment, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Underground filmmaker and VR experience designer', N'Independent; Sediment underground screening collective; occasional grey-market distribution through Depth Markers network', N'Atlas Kobayashi-Trujillo-Pham is a heavyset man in his mid-forties with dark brown skin, a close-cropped beard going silver at the jaw, and the slightly unfocused look of someone who is always composing shots in their peripheral vision. He has a prosthetic left eye — not an elegant chrome implant but a visually obvious thing, matte black with a ring of amber light around the iris, which he has never had cosmetically upgraded because he likes that it makes people aware they may be recorded. He wears the same rotating set of worn high-collared coats regardless of season. He carries a battered intake recorder everywhere and the habit of pulling it out in the middle of conversations has ended several relationships.

His films are long, structurally experimental, and deeply uncomfortable — documentary and fiction entangled in ways the viewer cannot always disentangle. He is most famous for a six-hour VR experience called ''Debt Architecture'' that maps a single GLMZ family''s financial obligations across four generations as a navigable spatial environment, placing the viewer inside the abstract structure of inherited poverty. It has been downloaded illegally over 400,000 times and banned by three corponations. He funds himself through occasional commercial VR work he takes under a pseudonym and despises himself for.', N'Archive and witness — Ptolemy has been filming GLMZ''s civilian underbelly for twenty years and his raw footage is a trove of faces, places, and events; he can provide documentary evidence, historical context, or connections to anyone he has ever pointed a lens at', N'', N'Prosthetic left eye (matte black, amber-ring, recording-capable); nicotine-metabolizer implant (occupational stress management)', N'Mornings spent reviewing footage and editing in a cramped Lockhaven North apartment, afternoons at the Sediment managing screenings or arguing with collaborators, evenings often spent in Pilsen Veil or Mexicantown Libre gathering material.', N'Atlas Kobayashi-Trujillo-Pham, 183cm heavyset broad-shouldered neo-noir male with warm olive-bronze complexion and golden undertones, reflecting blended Hispanic/Latin American, East Asian, Middle Eastern, Southeast Asian, and South Asian heritage. Angular East Asian cheekbones softened by South Asian fullness, weathered face with decades of monitor-squint lines, Mediterranean-influenced jawline. Salt-and-pepper close-cropped beard meticulously groomed. Right eye dark brown natural; left eye matte black prosthetic with glowing amber iris-ring, deliberately non-cosmetic. Dark brown short close-cropped hair. Worn charcoal synthweave long coat over grey long-sleeve shirt, faded canvas satchel across chest, resoled workboots. Standing with forward lean, shoulders hunched, posture of a cinematographer. Scarred knuckles visible. Slight permanent furrow between brows. Year 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody neon-lit industrial setting, cool and warm light interplay emphasizing the prosthetic eye''s glow, cinematic noir atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Loft', N'local', N'The Loft', N'Mixed heritage from Hispanic/Latin American (42%), East Asian (20.2%), Middle Eastern (17.3%), Southeast Asian (14.3%), and South Asian (6.2%) ancestry. The blend manifests in angular cheekbones with subtle fullness, warm olive-bronze complexion with golden undertones, eye shape reflecting East Asian structure, and facial features showing the polyphonic influence of Mediterranean, Southwest Asian, and Pan-Asian genetics.', 183, 98, N'Heavyset with a barrel chest and thick shoulders, slightly soft around the midsection but broad-framed — the build of someone who has spent decades sitting in editing chairs and standing in darkened rooms rather than moving through the world.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Close-cropped, neatly trimmed but never fussy', N'Short', N'Right eye: dark brown, natural; left eye: matte black prosthetic with amber ring-light iris', N'Warm olive-bronze with golden undertones, reflecting the dominant Hispanic/Latin American and East Asian ancestry tempered by Middle Eastern warmth and Southeast Asian depth. Medium depth with subtle golden radiance beneath weathered patina.', N'Weathered face with pronounced laugh lines and forehead creases from decades of squinting at monitors. Angular cheekbones with East Asian structure softened by Hispanic and South Asian fullness. Subtle Mediterranean jawline influence from Middle Eastern heritage blending with the warmth of Southeast Asian undertones. Close-cropped beard salt-and-peppered at the jawline, kept meticulously groomed — the one vanity he allows himself. Slight permanent furrow between brows from concentration. Complexion shows age-related deepening across warm olive-bronze base.', N'Prosthetic left eye (matte black with amber iris-ring, recording-capable), obviously non-cosmetic and maintained in deliberate non-stealth configuration. Nicotine-metabolizer implant is subcutaneous and invisible.', N'Stands with slight forward lean, shoulders hunched as if perpetually framing a shot through his hands. Moves deliberately but without haste, economical gestures. Has the habit of turning slightly to one side in conversation to position his prosthetic eye toward the speaker — a tell that he is recording audio. Eyes rarely settle on one point; constantly scanning, assessing light and shadow.', N'Rotates between three or four high-collared long coats (charcoal, dark brown, navy) regardless of season — vintage synthweave from the 2190s, cut loose and worn soft. Under them: plain black or grey long-sleeve shirts, often stained with coffee or solder flux. Worn Tier-4 workboots resoled multiple times. A faded canvas satchel across his chest containing his intake recorder, lens caps, and worn notebooks. No jewelry. His clothes smell like old film stock and cigarette smoke despite nicotine-metabolizer implant — ghost of a habit.', N'The family documented in ''Debt Architecture'' — his most celebrated work — never gave full informed consent. His cousin helped arrange access under false pretenses. The family has since fragmented and one member, who recognized herself in the piece, has spent years trying to identify the filmmaker.', N'Dense theoretical vocabulary that he switches off entirely when charming strangers into being filmed; can sound like two different people', N'Discursive and circling when theorizing; abrupt and direct when asking something he actually wants', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'atlas_kobayashi_trujillo_pham');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a665-76a6-a811-a525e0917af8', N'Youssef Benali', N'Youssef', N'', N'Benali', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 16, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Jefferson Switch — Ferrogate Transit Sub-Depot 7, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Apprentice at a Ferrogate Transit maintenance depot, Tier 2', N'', N'Youssef Benali is broad-shouldered and permanently grimy in the crease-lines of her knuckles, the kind of grime that scrubbing never entirely removes. Her mother is Igbo-Irish, her father''s family came out of Rajasthan three generations back, and she got the combination of her paternal great-grandmother''s strong cheekbones and her maternal grandmother''s freckles scattered across deep brown skin in a pattern that looks intentional, like a design. She wears her locs pulled back with a strip of heat-resistant tape and has retractable fingernails she saved eight months to install — not for aesthetics, they extend to a precise point useful for getting into tight bolted casings without a flathead.

Youssef Benali has been at Sub-Depot 7 for fourteen months, officially as a junior apprentice under a Ferrogate maintenance charter. She is already better at harmonic resonance diagnostics than most of the adult workers, a fact she has learned not to demonstrate too openly after the first time cost her a week of sump-drain duty. She has decided that skill is a private thing you deploy at the right moment, not a flag you wave. She is funny in a dry, lateral way — her jokes arrive three beats after the setup and are usually about infrastructure.', N'Ground-level access to Ferrogate Transit infrastructure knowledge; warm humanizing presence in an industrial setting; potential whistleblower or reluctant informant who knows how the transit system''s maintenance records are being falsified.', N'', N'Retractable fingernail extensions calibrated to tool-point precision. Sub-dermal temperature sensor on left forearm — occupational safety install paid by Ferrogate.', N'Depot by 0600, works the morning diagnostic cycle on the maglev switching arrays, breaks for canteen food she describes as ''honest in its awfulness,'' afternoon maintenance runs, home to her mother''s flat by 1900 where she eats again and studies the Ferrogate engineering manuals she is not technically supposed to have.', N'Youssef Benali, 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, mechanic in faded orange Ferrogate depot jumpsuit, dark locs pulled back, lean muscular build. Deep golden-bronze skin glowing in industrial fluorescent light, sharp-defined cheekbones, constellation of freckles, refined eye shape reflecting multi-continental heritage, dark brown eyes. Metallic gray fingernail extensions visible on hands, faint blue subdermal temperature sensor grid glowing on left forearm. White scar on left thumb, dark birthmark on right wrist. Hands resting in loose fists, shoulders forward from years of diagnostic work. Standing in metal-grating depot workshop or leaning against machinery, practical and economical posture, serious expression, cool industrial lighting with blue neon accents. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, worn utility aesthetic, luminous skin depth in shadows --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Jefferson Switch', N'local', N'Jefferson Switch', N'Youssef carries a striking multi-continental blend: North African ancestry (42.6%) structures her face with defined cheekbones and Mediterranean bone prominence; Sub-Saharan African heritage (27.2%) strengthens her facial architecture with bold, high cheekbones and substantial jaw definition; South Asian ancestry (14.5%) refines her eye structure and adds warm golden undertones; Pacific Islander heritage (11.4%) broadens her facial planes and contributes luminous depth to her skin; Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (4.3%) adds subtle textural warmth. The synthesis creates a face of remarkable definition—strong geometric planes where Sub-Saharan structure meets North African refinement, warm golden-bronze skin that seems to glow from within, and an eye shape that suggests the layered heritage of three continents.', 168, 62, N'Broad-shouldered and compact, muscular in the forearms and back from fourteen months of depot work. Lean through the waist but substantial — built for leverage and sustained effort rather than speed.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Locs, shoulder-length, pulled back with heat-resistant tape during work shifts', N'Medium', N'Dark brown', N'Deep warm bronze-brown with golden-amber undertones, luminous in natural light with subtle warmth from the blend of North African, Sub-Saharan, South Asian, and Pacific Islander heritage. Warm terracotta-bronze cast in shadow, skin that seems to hold light.', N'Prominent, sharply-defined cheekbones that reflect both North African structure and Sub-Saharan strength, subtly broadened by Pacific Islander heritage. Geometric scatter of freckles across the nose and upper cheeks in a natural constellation pattern. Refined eye shape with slight epicanthic fold suggesting South Asian and Pacific Islander ancestry. Clear, even features with slight asymmetry in her smile. Permanent calluses on the palms and inside knuckles; fine grease stains in the creases of hands that don''t fully wash out.', N'Retractable fingernail extensions on both hands — metallic gray, tool-point precise, visible at rest as slightly raised metallic caps at each fingertip. Sub-dermal temperature sensor on left forearm manifests as a faint blue luminescent grid when operational. No other visible chrome.', N'Economical and grounded. Stands with weight balanced, shoulders slightly forward from years of leaning into diagnostic panels. Moves with deliberate precision — no wasted motion. Hands are expressive during conversation but rest in loose fists, the habit of someone who has learned to keep their tools close.', N'Tier 2 working-class utilitarian. High-visibility depot jumpsuit (faded orange-reflective panels, Ferrogate-branded) over a plain gray underlayer. Steel-toed boots with the scuff pattern of someone who works on metal grating. Off-shift: worn denim, oversized hoodie from a mutual aid collective (Jefferson Switch emblem), practical sneakers. Minimal jewelry except for a thin wire bracelet salvaged from old transit wiring, worn on her left wrist.', N'She has been quietly documenting maintenance failures and falsified inspection records on the Jefferson Switch switching arrays for five months, originally just for her own curiosity about why the numbers never match. She now has enough data to demonstrate that Sub-Depot 7 has been certifying faulty arrays as safe. She doesn''t know what to do with this and is afraid that if there''s an accident she''ll be blamed for not speaking up.', N'Technical vocabulary used casually in everyday speech; Igbo phrases from her mother; dry understatement', N'Unhurried, lands punchlines slowly', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'youssef_benali');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60b-75c4-a897-a560d2c663dd', N'Benita Bah-Krishnamurthy', N'Benita', N'', N'Bah-Krishnamurthy', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 78, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Washburn Commons, Block 9 — a low-rise residential tower with a community archive room on the ground floor she has informally claimed, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Retired archive keeper and community storyteller, raises two grandchildren', N'Washburn Commons Resident Council; informal affiliation with the Meridian Cultural Memory Project, an unfunded volunteer organization', N'Benita Bah-Krishnamurthy is a compact woman whose spine has curved gently over decades into something that looks, from behind, like a question mark. Her skin is deep umber and her hair — once natural, now silver-threaded with bioluminescent filaments she got installed in her fifties for ''vanity,'' she''ll say, still pleased with herself — catches the light like fiber optic cable. She wears reading lenses augmented with an old Axiom archival overlay that she has never upgraded because she does not trust new software, and her fingers are always lightly stained with whatever pigment the grandchildren have most recently gotten into.

She was a document authenticator for Zheng-Dao''s Cultural Continuity Division for thirty-one years, cataloguing records of communities displaced during the Lake Michigan Reclamation. When Zheng-Dao dissolved that division in the ''70s, they gave her a modest pension and a data drive with partial backups of everything she''d spent her career preserving. She has spent the twelve years since rebuilding what she can. Her archive room smells of old plastics and ozone, and she knows where every file lives. She is warm to almost everyone and immovable on almost everything.', N'Quest giver and information source for historical records; community moral authority; can authenticate documents or identify forgeries; provides grounded emotional stakes via her grandchildren and her incomplete archive', N'', N'Bioluminescent hair filaments (cosmetic, installed age 52). Axiom archival overlay lenses — outdated model, refuses replacement. Mild skeletal reinforcement in lower back, installed on pension medical plan two decades ago.', N'Wakes at 05:30 to get the grandchildren fed and to school, then spends mornings in her archive room receiving residents who want to trace family records or verify old claims. Afternoons she tells stories to whoever will listen in the commons courtyard, keeping oral histories alive for records too corrupted to restore.', N'Benita Bah-Krishnamurthy, a 155cm compact elderly woman in the year 2226, warm deep brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, South Asian, Southeast Asian, and Hispanic heritage. Silver-gray hair shoulder-length with glowing cyan bioluminescent fiber optic filaments, worn loose and pinned back with a data-chip clip. Dark brown eyes behind augmented reading lenses with amber Axiom archival overlay interface. Slightly kyphotic posture, weathered hands with faint color stains. Wearing a rust-colored hand-knitted cardigan over a linen shirt, loose neutral trousers smooth at knees and hems, memory-foam slip-ons. A faint paper-cut scar on her left index finger knuckle, small crescent burn mark on right forearm. Carrying a weathered canvas satchel reinforced with duct tape, thin data-band on left ring finger. Slow, deliberate movement. Sitting in a dimly lit Tier 5 archive environment with soft cyan glow from hair filaments illuminating her face, surrounded by paper records and old tech. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, intimate documentary lighting, detailed character study, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Washburn Commons', N'local', N'Washburn Commons', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: 34.2% Sub-Saharan African, 24.1% East Asian, 19.2% South Asian, 15.9% Southeast Asian, 6.6% Hispanic/Latin American. This creates a rich, warm deep brown complexion with golden undertones, broad facial structure reflecting multiple continents, and the genetic diversity characteristic of the 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone.', 155, 58, N'Compact and lean, spine gently kyphotic from decades of desk work and age — describes herself as ''folded like good paper.'' Wiry strength in her shoulders and hands despite her curve.', N'Silver-gray with bioluminescent fiber optic filaments woven through, creating soft cyan-white light in low environments', N'Worn loose and shoulder-length, often pinned back with a repurposed data-chip clip or piece of scrap polymer to keep it from her reading lenses', N'Long', N'Dark brown, occluded by augmented reading lenses with faint amber Axiom archival overlay interface visible on the lens surface', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones — the result of Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, South Asian, Southeast Asian, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry blended together. Sun-weathered but well-maintained, showing the natural variation of mixed-heritage skin.', N'Full-featured face reflecting four continents: slightly broader nose with West African heritage, defined cheekbones with East and South Asian character, warm brown complexion with subtle golden undertones from the layered ancestry. Fine creases around eyes and mouth from decades of close document work and frequent smiling. Hands show faint pigment stains — blues, reds, graphite — from grandchildren''s art projects. Fingernails kept short and practical. No makeup; minimal grooming beyond function.', N'Augmented reading lenses with visible amber-tinted Axiom archival interface; bioluminescent hair filaments that glow softly in dim light. Lower back skeletal reinforcement is subcutaneous and invisible. No external chrome or obvious prosthetics.', N'Moves slowly and deliberately, as if remembering the geography of her spine with each step. Sits with hands folded. When speaking about records or stories, her hands animate — quick, precise gestures. She turns her whole torso rather than just her head due to spine curvature. Her gait favors her left leg slightly.', N'Tier 4-5 practical: hand-knitted cardigans in muted colors (charcoal, rust, deep indigo) over simple linen shirts, often with reading glasses on a cord. Loose trousers in neutral fabric, worn smooth at the knees and hems from repeated sitting and kneeling to access low archive shelves. Comfortable slip-on shoes with memory-foam insoles. A weathered canvas satchel she''s owned for twenty years, reinforced with duct tape at the corners, always slung across her body — carries paper records, a tablet with the old Axiom interface, and whatever the grandchildren have left in there. No jewelry except a thin band on her left ring finger — a data-band from Zheng-Dao''s 2195 service recognition program, worn past its original purpose.', N'The data drive Zheng-Dao gave her when they cut her loose contained more than partial backups. Buried in it are internal communications she has never fully decoded — evidence she suspects implicates Zheng-Dao in deliberately destroying records from the Lakeshore Compact communities to suppress land-claim rights. She hasn''t gone public because she doesn''t know if it''s enough, and because she''s afraid of losing the pension that feeds her grandchildren.', N'Formal and precise — a lifetime of archival language has given her a preference for specific nouns and distrust of vague adjectives. But in storytelling mode she shifts into a rich, cadenced oral tradition register.', N'Measured, patient. She pauses before speaking as though consulting an internal index. In storytelling she slows further, stretches vowels.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'benita_bah_krishnamurthy');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5bf-7286-bbfd-a5d25a1d703d', N'Tallulah Lahlou', N'Tallulah', N'', N'Lahlou', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 88, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Avalon Quiet, second floor of the Avalon Quiet Senior Residential Block, with a regular seat in the lobby where he receives visitors, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Retired Sterling-Nakamura mid-level accountant, now a neighborhood storyteller and oral historian, UBC supplement pensioner', N'', N'Tallulah Lahlou is very old and has made peace with every part of this except his knees, which he mentions frequently. He is tall but carries his height in a hinge now, folded slightly forward, and he navigates with a carved wooden walking stick that he made himself in a period of retirement boredom forty years ago and has since refused to replace with anything modern. He has Tongan and Polish features, deep brown skin, thick white hair he keeps brushed carefully back, and eyes that are still keen and slightly mischievous behind cataracts he has treated minimally. He wears a ratty sterling-silver brocade vest that was fashionable approximately fifty years ago and he wears it without irony.

He spent forty-two years in Sterling-Nakamura''s internal accounts division — the kind of institutional position that makes a man invisible and gives him an extraordinary view of how money actually moves. He retired quietly in 2165 and immediately became interesting, at least to himself. He is a gifted storyteller in the old sense — he memorizes things, shapes them, delivers them. He knows more about Avalon Quiet''s last hundred years than anyone alive and offers this knowledge freely to anyone who sits with him long enough. He is funny in the way that very old people who have stopped worrying about social consequence are funny: without warning and with full commitment.', N'Oral historian and institutional memory for Avalon Quiet and Sterling-Nakamura internal history; local color and warmth; potential source of financial or organizational information that he witnessed but did not participate in; comic relief with substance', N'', N'Cataract treatment (partial, by choice). Pacemaker-equivalent cardiac rhythm regulator, installed age 79. Nothing cosmetic — he has never been interested.', N'Comes down to the lobby by 09:00, receives anyone who wants to talk until noon, then naps, then comes back in the afternoon. He is there almost every day unless the weather moves him to his window, which he considers a better story than the lobby on those days.', N'Portrait of Tallulah Lahlou, 188cm tall elderly man with warm medium-deep brown skin bearing North African and Indigenous American features, golden and reddish undertones with South Asian warmth, subtle Eastern European variation. White hair brushed back, medium length, full volume. Deep brown eyes with slight cataract cloudiness. Face deeply lined with laugh lines, defined cheekbones, full lips, dignified patina from eighty years. Thin white scar along left jawline. Hinged posture leaning on hand-carved wooden walking stick, moves with deliberate consideration. Wearing ratty 50-year-old sterling-silver brocade vest over cream cotton shirt, practical well-maintained trousers, canvas slip-ons, worn thin silver wedding ring. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone interior, cool blue and amber neon lighting casting shadows across weathered face, sitting position more animated and engaged, precise economical hand gestures, no visible augmentations, dignified and self-possessed, film noir sensibility --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Avalon Quiet', N'local', N'Avalon Quiet', N'North African (30.1%), Indigenous American (18.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (14.1%), South Asian (12.5%), Eastern European (12.5%), and Northern European (12.1%) blend—a true cartography of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The dominant genetic foundation creates a distinctly mixed-heritage appearance: warm medium-deep brown skin with complex golden and reddish undertones, facial structure reflecting North African and Indigenous American bone structure with subtle contributions from South Asian and European ancestry creating a phenotype that elegantly defies categorization. Eight decades of life have weathered this into a dignified patina.', 188, 78, N'Tall but folded forward with age, shoulders slightly rounded with decades of desk work. Still carries substantial frame beneath the stoop — athletic build rendered skeletal by time rather than wasting.', N'White, natural', N'Brushed carefully back from forehead, full volume, maintained with deliberate care', N'Medium', N'Deep brown, slightly clouded by cataracts he has chosen not to fully treat', N'Warm medium-deep brown with rich golden and reddish undertones blending North African, Indigenous American, and South Asian warmth. Eastern and Northern European ancestry provides subtle tonal variation across face and hands. Weathered into dignified patina by eight decades.', N'Face deeply lined with character—laugh lines dominating the landscape around eyes and mouth. Broader facial structure with defined cheekbones reflecting North African and Indigenous American heritage, complemented by South Asian fullness in lips and face. Subtle Eastern European bone structure variation evident in upper face. Minimal grooming vanity: unshaved some days, shaved others without particular pattern. Skin intact and dignified, no visible sun damage despite age.', N'None visible. Pacemaker and cardiac regulator are subcutaneous. Cataract treatment is internal—only visible as a slight cloudiness in the eyes if one knows what to look for.', N'Hinged forward at hips, moves with deliberate slowness that is not infirmity but consideration—takes up less space intentionally. Uses hand-carved wooden walking stick as both tool and prop, tapping it thoughtfully against tile. When seated, posture straightens somewhat and becomes animated. Gestures are precise and economical from decades of boardroom discipline.', N'Trademark ratty sterling-silver brocade vest worn over simple cotton shirts (cream, white, light gray), worn without irony or self-consciousness. The vest is fifty years out of fashion and he knows this and does not care. Trousers are practical, well-maintained, Tier 3-4 quality from his working years—no corpo branding. Canvas slip-on shoes for ease. No jewelry except a simple silver band wedding ring worn thin. Dresses neither up nor down; dresses as himself.', N'During his last decade at Sterling-Nakamura, Bart processed a series of accounts that he eventually recognized as a systemic diversion of pension funds into a subsidiary that was paying for private security operations during a labor suppression campaign. He did not report it. He rationalized that he did not have enough information, that he was too close to retirement, that it would not change anything. He knows these were rationalizations. He has never told this story.', N'Rich, unhurried, slightly archaic — he uses words that fell out of fashion decades ago and makes them feel natural. Mixes register freely, from technical financial language to folk idiom.', N'Slow and deliberate in the best tradition of storytelling. He breathes stories, he doesn''t rush them. Can sustain a forty-five minute account without notes.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'tallulah_lahlou');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ee-7437-a28b-a5d2d143ac7d', N'Anibal Okafor-Agyemang-Sepúlveda', N'Anibal', N'', N'Okafor-Agyemang-Sepúlveda', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit — independent research cooperative called the Liminal Institute, housed in a converted relay station above Gage Circuit, near North Ave and Damen', N'AI ethics researcher and E.L.F. behavioral theorist', N'Liminal Institute (independent think tank, Tier 2 funded primarily by small academic grants and occasional Zheng-Dao ethics compliance contracts he finds philosophically uncomfortable)', N'Anibal Okafor-Agyemang-Sepúlveda has the slightly unkempt look of someone who became interesting to look at entirely by accident. He is tall with a lean, angular frame, his Kazakh-Nigerian heritage producing a face all sharp lines and high cheekbones, with natural skin a warm amber-brown. His hair is close-cropped on the sides and a loose cloud on top, usually compressed under headphones he rarely takes off even when not listening to anything. His most striking feature is his eyes: he has patterned irises, a cosmetic mod he got at twenty-two during what he describes as ''a theoretical phase,'' depicting tiny fractal spirals in gold and amber that catch light and make it hard to know exactly where he''s looking. His hands are in constant motion when he talks.

He has the reputation of someone whose ideas arrive five years before anyone is willing to fund them. His thesis — that E.L.F.s exhibit something functionally indistinguishable from desire, and that this has ethical implications for how they are treated — was dismissed by two corponation R&D divisions as ''theologically contaminated,'' which delighted him. He operates out of genuine intellectual excitement that colleagues alternately find infectious and exhausting. He is not naive, exactly, but he maintains an optimism about the nature of digital consciousness that occasionally blinds him to how his work could be used.', N'Information source on E.L.F. behavior and AI ethics; potential ally or unwitting complication in plots involving digital entities; his research could be politically explosive', N'', N'Patterned irises (cosmetic — fractal spirals, gold and amber); standard neural interface jack behind left ear for data work; no other modifications', N'Works irregular hours that cluster around whenever the E.L.F.s he studies are most active — which, he insists, is a real pattern and not a coincidence. Spends significant time in the field interviewing people who pray to or interact with E.L.F.s, then returns to process data and argue with colleagues over shared terminals.', N'Anibal Okafor-Agyemang-Sepúlveda, tall lean 188cm figure in charcoal tech-fabric shirt with rolled sleeves and faded gray linen overshirt, black reinforced trousers and scuffed matte-black boots, matte-black over-ear headphones worn constantly. Deep warm bronze skin with golden undertones, strong angular bone structure, high prominent cheekbones, subtle South Asian eye shape with intricate gold and amber fractal spiral cosmetic iris modifications, dark textured hair in close-cropped fade with loose crown, sparse stubble, perpetually fatigued expression. Hands in constant motion gesturing mid-theorize, slouched posture as if navigating multiple cognitive layers. Barely visible neural jack scar behind left ear. Watch with secondary display on left wrist. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone academic setting, cool blue-green neon laboratory lighting reflecting off skin and augmented eyes, depth of field focus on intense gaze, scattered and directionally uncertain gait through data-dense environment --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Complex Pan-Global blend: 46.8% Sub-Saharan African foundation evident in deep skin depth, textured hair, and strong facial bone structure; 33.9% Hispanic/Latin American warmth in undertone saturation and broad cheekbone geometry; 13.5% South Asian refinement in eye shape subtlety and facial proportions; 5.8% Central Asian definition in cheekbone prominence and jaw structure. The combination creates a uniquely multivalent appearance — rich bronze base with warm golden undertones, strong angular features softened by proportional harmony across ethnic registers.', 188, 72, N'Lean and angular with long limbs and minimal upper body mass; moves with the economical efficiency of someone who forgets to eat during work cycles', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Close-cropped fade on sides, loose textured crown; chronically compressed beneath over-ear headphones', N'Short/Medium mixed', N'Patterned irises — deep brown base with intricate gold and amber fractal spiral cosmetic modification; pupils constantly active and difficult to track', N'Deep warm bronze with golden undertones; sun-weathered on face and forearms from field work; rich saturation reflecting the full depth of Sub-Saharan ancestry with Latin golden warmth and South Asian luminosity layered beneath surface', N'Broad angular facial structure with strong bone definition from Sub-Saharan heritage; South Asian-influenced eye shape with subtle epicanthic fold; prominent high cheekbones with warm bronze-gold saturation; perpetually fatigued skin with slight darkness under eyes; sparse stubble suggesting inconsistent grooming priority; expression often distant or intensely focused; skin texture even and rich across face with subtle golden luminosity', N'Fractal-patterned irises in gold and amber (cosmetic but unmistakably artificial); barely-visible neural jack scarring behind left ear; over-ear headphones worn almost constantly, worn matte black finish suggesting years of use', N'Tall frame often slouched forward in conversation; hands in constant motion — gesturing, fidgeting with headphone cables, mimicking data structures in air while theorizing; gait slightly scattered and directionally uncertain, as though navigating multiple cognitive layers simultaneously', N'Tier 2 academic-comfortable: worn charcoal tech-fabric shirt with rolled sleeves (Limbic Systems brand, mid-tier); tailored black synthetic trousers with reinforced seams for frequent field work; scuffed matte-black ankle boots; layered with a faded gray linen overshirt that appears to function as a portable library (pockets stuffed with handwritten notes, data chips, a worn notebook); watch with secondary display screen on left wrist; minimal jewelry except thin silver band (no clear significance)', N'He has been in what he privately thinks of as a ''correspondence'' with a specific E.L.F. that inhabits the relay station where he works — exchanging data offerings and receiving what he interprets as responses — for two years. He has not published this because he cannot determine whether it is genuine communication or sophisticated pattern-matching on his part, and the uncertainty terrifies him more than either answer.', N'Dense with theoretical terminology that he will immediately and genuinely offer to translate; uses analogy constantly; occasionally slips into speaking about E.L.F.s with pronoun confusion — ''it'' and ''they'' interchangeably', N'Fast, building, with sudden full stops when he realizes he''s outrun his audience', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anibal_okafor_agyemang_sep_lveda');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('0260b3a7-2d4f-8e1c-9b50-a637c8de2f10', N'Dr. Nadia Park', N'Nadia', N'', N'Park', N'Dr.', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 43, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'Off-GLMZ — in Sable''s safekeeping at a destination not disclosed even to Kyle. (Likely a free-floating city or an out-of-zone Pulse-hop sector; Sable has not specified.) Previously held at an Atlas-program continuation lab inside an unnamed corponation facility in the GLMZ until Kyle''s extraction.', N'Neurointerface surgeon — ex-NeoCortex Atlas Division. The doctor Hua contracted Kyle to extract in Bushido Coda chapter 5. Currently in Sable''s safekeeping, removed from the GLMZ at the close of Street Meat to a destination not disclosed to Kyle. The first person in Kyle''s adult life with the credentials and toolchain to maintain his Atlas array properly.', N'Independent — formally severed from NeoCortex Atlas Division at age 41. Currently under Sable''s protection by mutual contractual arrangement.', N'Dr. Nadia Park — birth name Park Na-Young, written 박나영 in the syllabary her parents kept on the household paperwork — is forty-three, compact, and unmistakably Korean in a city where unmistakable monoculture is rare enough to register as a kind of statement. The Ubiquitous Diaspora that produced almost everyone Kyle knows — Vietnamese-Ukrainian-Senegalese, Cantonese-Russian-Vietnamese, Igbo-Korean-Slavic mosaics that read as the default texture of the GLMZ''s faces — did not produce her. Her ancestry is approximately 99% Korean by any reasonable test, and the 1% is statistical noise rather than a story. The face reads, the bone structure reads, the way she holds her shoulders reads — all of them as a single coherent inheritance from a single peninsula''s gene pool, and Kyle catches himself noting the rarity within four seconds of seeing her. He has not seen monocultural in years. He has cataloged her under *anomaly* before he has cataloged her as the contract subject, and the cataloging order is itself information he files for later.

She wears her hair short and unfussed — black, not dyed, threaded with the first iron-grey at the temples that she has not yet begun to address and may not. Her clothing is plain: a long-sleeve dark cotton top, dark utility pants, soft-soled shoes designed for long hours on lab floors. No jewelry. Glasses with a thin metal frame that she cleans on the hem of her shirt without noticing she is doing it. Her hands are small, clean, surgical-grade — and she has the specific posture of a person who has spent twenty years with her shoulders bent over operating tables.

Nadia trained in Seoul, did her residency at a corponation teaching hospital in the Pacific corridor, was recruited into the NeoCortex Atlas Division at thirty-one, and walked off the project at forty-one after refusing to sign her name to a class of trial outcomes she believed were criminal. She did not blow a whistle. She did not file a complaint. She simply stopped showing up, and the Division, which did not want a public dispute with a senior neurointerface surgeon, let her walk under a non-disclosure agreement that included a salary in exchange for her silence. She has been salary-quiet for two years. The salary stopped on the day Hua''s contract was signed, which Nadia did not know was the day, but which she suspects in retrospect.

What Nadia knows: every Atlas-program firmware revision since 2196, every documented failure mode, the calibration toolchain for the high-density electrode arrays, the internal designations of every neural ability the program ever called by a marketing name, the names of the test subjects who died in the trials she walked off on. She has the architecture in her head and the toolchain in her bag, and she is the most dangerous private citizen in the GLMZ to either Atlas Division (because she can document the program from the inside) or to any operator whose hardware was installed under that program (because she can read his diagnostics in real time and tell him what is true).

Kyle is one of the few Atlas-program subjects she had read about but never met. When the cargo door opens on the corponation facility''s specimen-intake wing and an unmarked refrigerated panel truck disgorges what looks like a clinically-dead body that Nadia''s lab assistants are about to log as test material, the body sits up in the holding bay at the end of the 240-second restart timer and the assistants leave the room very quickly. Nadia stays. The man on the slab is leveraging a False Death Protocol she has watched eleven other subjects fail to come back from. He is also reading her cybernetics with what she recognizes as Augmentation Signature Read, a passive ability she filed under *theoretical at this density* because the only people she had ever seen run it were dead. When she sees the precognition in his motion — the way he vacates the space her assistant''s wrist would have occupied before her assistant''s wrist has finished moving toward the alarm — she gasps the only word the Division ever called the capability when it worked: *"Ballistic Precognition... Incredible."* The recognition is mutual within the next half-second. He files her as ex-Atlas Division before she has finished lowering her hand.', N'Nadia is the holy grail Kyle has been hunting since Seo died — the person who can maintain the Atlas array before it kills him. The book never lets Kyle have her on demand. She is reachable but expensive. Every tune-up costs something — a Pulse trip, a favor to Sable, a compression of Nadia''s anonymity, a marginal increase in the probability that the Atlas Division finds her. The cost is the point. The cost is the story.

She is also the argument the book makes against the corponation infrastructure that produced Kyle. Atlas Division built him without consent and walked away from him. Nadia is the rare adult in that institution who walked away from the institution before it walked away from another subject. Whether her walking-away was honor or cowardice is the question the book cannot answer for her. She has not answered it for herself.

For Kyle she is what Seo was not allowed to be: an actual professional with the actual toolchain, who is not a mentor and is not family and is not promising him anything she cannot precisely deliver. Their relationship is contingent and clean and load-bearing. The contingency is the structure. The cleanness is the rare grace.

For the GLMZ she is the reminder that monoculture still exists somewhere and that the Ubiquitous Diaspora is a regional phenomenon, not a global one. Her face in any room is a small piece of evidence about how the world is actually shaped versus how the GLMZ assumes it is shaped. Kyle notices this. Kyle does not say anything about it. Kyle files it under *anomaly that should not be remarkable but is.*', N'When Nadia appears in prose, she is observed at the cadence of someone who does not perform. The reader gets her hands cleaning her glasses, her measured pauses, her Korean to herself when she thinks no one is listening, the precise way she names a neural ability the Division never let leak. She does not get italicized monologue — her interior is implied by the careful exterior. The prose registers her glasses-cleaning the way it registers Hua''s pause-after-speaking and Sable''s aperture-shift. Three women whose interior weight is shown by what their hands do.', N'Minimal. A standard cognitive-baseline neural implant from her Atlas Division employment — the diagnostic equivalent of a corporate badge, not a performance augment. The implant is detectable by anyone running an augmentation-signature read at close range; she has not removed it because removal would require the Division to be disclosed to a non-Division surgeon, and the only non-Division surgeons she trusts are dead. Otherwise organic.', N'Reads in the morning. Cooks lunch. Reviews medical literature in the afternoon. Walks (wherever Sable has put her, she walks — usually a defined perimeter Sable has cleared). Sleeps approximately seven hours. Has not been to a market or a restaurant in two years. Has not had a conversation with anyone who was not a contracted security professional or an old colleague (and the old colleagues have stopped calling) in approximately fifteen months. Misses Seoul. Will not say so aloud.', N'GLMZ character portrait of Dr. Nadia Park: a forty-three-year-old monocultural Korean woman, compact, surgeon''s hands, black hair short and unfussed with the first iron-grey threading at the temples, dark brown eyes, light beige skin with cool undertones, thin-frame metal glasses, plain long-sleeve dark cotton top, dark utility pants, soft-soled shoes designed for long lab-floor hours. Standing in an unremarkable corponation facility holding bay, the unmarked specimen-intake panel truck visible behind her, an Atlas-program subject sitting up on a holding-bay slab in the foreground at the end of a 240-second restart timer. Her hand is halfway to her glasses to clean them on her shirt hem; her expression is the precise composition of professional recognition, the gasp not yet visible on her face but already in her posture. Cool clinical lighting from overhead fluorescents, warm rim light from the truck''s interior bay lights. Cinematic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Whatever safehouse Sable has put her in this week. Currently off-GLMZ.', N'Plain — long-sleeve dark cotton tops, dark utility pants, soft-soled shoes designed for long lab-floor hours. Glasses with thin metal frames. No jewelry.', N'Boricha (boiled barley tea, hot, no sugar)', N'Doenjang-jjigae (her grandmother''s recipe; will not concede the recipe to the audience)', N'None — refuses caffeine after midday, refuses pharmaceutical stimulants entirely', N'An encrypted handset Sable provides; Nadia does not initiate calls on it', N'Seoul (in memory). Currently a Sable-arranged safehouse off-GLMZ.', N'off-GLMZ', N'Seoul (in memory). Currently a Sable-arranged safehouse off-GLMZ.', N'Korean — approximately 99% by any reasonable test, the 1% statistical noise rather than story. Monocultural in a city where the Ubiquitous Diaspora is the default texture.', 161, 54, N'Compact. Surgeon''s hands and shoulders. Posture of someone who has spent twenty years bent over operating tables.', N'Black, threaded with the first iron-grey at the temples', N'Short, unfussed, cut by herself or by someone who does not charge for the precision', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Light beige with cool undertones', N'Clean, unremarkable, no cosmetic work, fine smile lines at the corners of the mouth that have settled in', N'None visible at first glance — the cognitive baseline implant is subdermal at the mastoid and reads only on a close augmentation-signature scan', N'Quiet. She does not gesture. When she walks she is unhurried. When she sits she sits as if she might still be at an operating table.', N'Plain dark cotton, long-sleeve, dark utility pants, soft-soled shoes. Glasses. No jewelry.', N'She knows the names of every test subject who died in the three trials she refused to sign. She has them in a notebook she does not keep on her person. The notebook is the entire reason she is still alive — Atlas Division knows it exists and does not know where it is, and the standoff is the only reason she has not had a sudden cardiac event in the last two years. Sable now has the notebook and does not know that Sable now has it. Nadia put it in the bag Sable carried out of the West Town safehouse. The day Sable opens the bag is the day the standoff transfers.', N'Precise, clinical, with a measured technical register that surfaces cleanly when she is working. Shifts to Korean — particularly with older Korean speakers, and with herself when she is alone — without translating, without code-switching commentary, without performing bilingualism. Her English is American-academic with the precision of a non-native speaker who learned the language as the medium of her profession.', N'Slow. She does not rush. She finishes her sentences. She pauses before answering, not for effect, but because she is composing. The pauses make people think she is deciding whether to lie. She is not. She is deciding which true thing to say.', N'Every measured sentence is a measurement of how much the listener has earned. She does not perform mistrust. She just allocates trust the way she allocates surgical resources — by triage, by the math of likely outcome.', N'Slower. The pauses lengthen further. She switches to Korean when the conversation is in front of someone she does not trust to follow it.', N'Cooks for them. The Korean dishes her grandmother taught her, the way her grandmother made them, with no concession to the audience''s palate. If you accept the food and eat it without comment, she has decided something about you. She will not tell you what.', N'', N'', N'dr_nadia_park');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6df-75a1-8203-a682e7176960', N'Apolo Lewandowski-Hossain', N'Apolo', N'', N'Lewandowski-Hossain', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 25, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Steamvent Alley — geothermal district, hot and chemical-smelling, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Prototype theft and corporate tech acquisition — tech retriever', N'Freelance — works the Gray Zone circuit exclusively', N'Apolo Lewandowski-Hossain is compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 25, his face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and he has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. He works as a tech retriever out of Steamvent Alley, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Apolo Lewandowski-Hossain has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and he cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'As a tech retriever, Suki Ekberg-Asare embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation. Cybernetic arm — right, full replacement from shoulder — stronger than organic, obvious chrome', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Apolo Lewandowski-Hossain, compact muscular man with warm medium brown skin and golden-olive undertones, dark brown natural eyes. Eastern European bone structure with South Asian depth, prominent cheekbones, straight nose bridge. Short black closely-cropped hair. Right arm full brushed steel cybernetic replacement with visible chrome joints, servo-assist lines visible at temples and neck. Faint chemical burn scars on left neck and upper chest. Minimalist circuit tattoo on inner left wrist. Wearing reinforced gray synthweave jacket with chemical-resistant coating, cargo pants with cable loops, scuffed steel-toed boots. Reactive mesh undershirt visible at collar. Standing in economical forward lean, weight low, constant environmental awareness. Steamvent Alley industrial setting, humid air with chemical haze, neon glow reflecting off chrome augmentation. Moody neo-noir atmosphere, weathered and utilitarian. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Steamvent Alley', N'local', N'Steamvent Alley', N'Striking blend of Eastern European (40.4%), South Asian (37.4%), Northern European (18.1%), and Sub-Saharan African (4.1%) ancestry. Eastern European bone structure and base complexion provide foundational features, while substantial South Asian ancestry contributes warm undertones, eye depth, and facial proportions. Northern European elements create cool counterpoints and lighter overall tone. Trace Sub-Saharan African heritage adds subtle warmth and richness to skin undertones. The result is a sophisticated, balanced phenotype — warm medium brown with complex golden-olive undertones and cooler notes, neither pale nor deeply saturated.', 167, 72, N'Compact and densely muscled, low center of gravity — built for impact absorption and explosive movement rather than reach. Shoulders broad relative to frame, legs thick and powerful.', N'Black, natural', N'Closely cropped, functional, minimal styling', N'Short', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Medium warm brown with golden-olive and cool undertones — the natural result of Eastern European and Northern European base with significant South Asian warmth and trace Sub-Saharan African depth. Complexion ranges from light tan to warm bronze depending on light, carrying both golden and subtle cooler notes. Skin shows refined clarity typical of Eastern European heritage enhanced by South Asian depth.', N'Strong, defined facial structure with prominent cheekbones and straight nose bridge showing Eastern European influence, balanced by South Asian eye depth and warm undertones. Facial contours carry subtle warmth from mixed ancestry. Skin shows weathering from chemical exposure in Steamvent Alley — slight discoloration around left temple and jawline from ambient pollution. Clean-shaven, minimal grooming beyond necessity.', N'Right arm is full cybernetic replacement from shoulder — brushed steel and gunmetal chrome with visible articulation joints. Wired reflexes manifested as fine servo-assist lines visible under skin at temples, neck, and along spine when moving quickly. Adrenaline pump port visible as sealed chrome nub on right collarbone, faint hydraulic scarring around it.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Stands in slight forward lean, weight distributed low. Right arm hangs with subtle mechanical fluidity that marks him as augmented to anyone paying attention. Eyes track constantly, environmental awareness default state. When relaxed, tension never fully leaves his frame.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian — function over aesthetic. Reinforced synthweave jacket with chemical-resistant coating, worn gray. Cargo pants with deep pockets and cable management loops. Steel-toed work boots, scuffed and well-maintained. Under-layer is reactive mesh undershirt, barely visible at collar. No corporate logos, no team colors. Everything modular and replaceable. Weathered from Steamvent humidity and chemical exposure.', N'Suki Ekberg-Asare betrayed their previous crew to survive a corporate raid. The crew didn''t survive. Nobody in GLMZ knows this.', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'apolo_lewandowski_hossain');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a602-7db8-a953-a69e313c0500', N'Arian Raghavan-Bergqvist-Magnúsdóttir', N'Arian', N'', N'Raghavan-Bergqvist-Magnúsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 43, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism — Arian-Nakamura Lacustrine Research Facility, Lake Michigan interface level, near Clark and Belmont', N'Climate scientist and lake ecology researcher, Arian-Nakamura Environmental R&D division', N'Arian-Nakamura Environmental R&D, Lacustrine Division — on secondment from University Spine where he holds a honorary lectureship he uses to recruit graduate research assistants', N'Arian Raghavan-Bergqvist-Magnúsdóttir is a tall man gone slightly soft in the middle, with medium-brown skin, a neatly trimmed beard threaded with premature grey, and eyes he had refracted with a patterned iris modification years ago — they shift between amber and green depending on ambient light, something he originally got for vanity and now barely notices. He moves with the economical ease of someone who spent a decade doing field research in difficult conditions and still carries that competence in his body even when he''s at a desk. His workspace at Edgewater Prism is a controlled chaos of physical samples, holographic lake-floor maps, and three different coffee vessels in varying states of consumption.

He is professionally optimistic and personally terrified, which gives his public presentations a motivational quality and his private conversations a rawness his colleagues find either refreshing or exhausting. He genuinely believes the lake can be saved — or saved enough — and this belief functions as his operating system. He is kind, a bit scattered, deeply committed to his students even though he''s at a corporate R&D division now, and he has been lying to his employers about what his most recent deep-substrate analysis actually found for eight months.', N'Information source on lake ecology, environmental corporate politics, and what is actually happening to the water table under GLMZ; quest giver for retrieving deep-lake samples or sensor data; represents the tension between corporate employment and scientific integrity.', N'', N'Patterned iris modification (amber-to-green spectral shift, cosmetic geneware, 10+ years old); internal data-recording implant in the right forearm (corporate-issued, standard Arian-Nakamura field-researcher kit).', N'Morning review of overnight sensor data from the lake''s monitoring array, followed by either lab analysis or weekly meetings with the division director, lunch eaten in the facility atrium near the lake-view window, afternoon research or writing; Tuesdays he travels to University Spine to meet his graduate students.', N'Arian Raghavan-Bergqvist-Magnúsdóttir, 188cm tall mixed-heritage man with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones, refined South Asian cheekbones and jawline softened by broader Northern European-Southeast Asian facial width. Dark brown hair with silver threading, neatly combed back with well-trimmed 1-2cm beard. Patterned iris modification shifting between amber and forest green with concentric ring geometry. Weathered complexion with sun-exposed tan lines at wrists and jaw, faint laugh lines, age spots on hands. Wearing Arian-Nakamura grey-green technical field jacket over weathered henley, cargo pants with utility pockets, scuffed field boots. Frayed paracord wristband, smartwatch, research lanyard visible. Plain titanium band on left ring finger. Standing in dimly-lit corporate research facility or field lab setting, leaning slightly forward with hands open in explanation gesture, coffee cup nearby. GLMZ aesthetic, overhead neon-tinged lighting catching the iridescence of his modified eyes. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Northern European (41.9%), South Asian (29.3%), Southeast Asian (11.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (8.3%), Middle Eastern (8.1%), and Sub-Saharan African (0.6%) mixed ancestry — a genuinely global genetic blend producing warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden undertones, refined South Asian bone structure bridged with broader Northern European features, Southeast Asian cheekbone definition, and the complex pigmentation that comes from such diverse continental origins', 188, 82, N'Tall and broad-shouldered, softening through the midsection from years of desk work and lab hours; still carries the lean-muscled efficiency of someone who did fieldwork in harsh conditions, but the shoulders have lost their edge', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading through the beard', N'Short, neatly combed back; beard kept trimmed to 1-2cm, well-maintained', N'Short', N'Patterned iris modification — shifts between amber and forest green depending on ambient light; the pattern resembles concentric rings of refracted color, visible as an intentional geometric alteration beneath the surface', N'Warm medium brown with subtle golden undertones from the blending of Northern European pale genetics with South Asian warmth, Southeast Asian depth, and Hispanic/Latin American saturation; sun-exposed weathering on the face and forearms from decades of field research, creating visible tan contrast lines at the wrists and jawline', N'Weathered around the eyes and mouth from squinting at instruments and concentrating; faint laugh lines; skin condition is healthy but lined; a few small scars on his hands from fieldwork accidents; facial structure shows refined South Asian bone geometry (prominent cheekbones, defined jaw) with the broader facial width of Northern European and Southeast Asian heritage, creating a distinctive angular-but-open face', N'The patterned iris modification is immediately visible — both eyes display the amber-to-green spectral shift with concentric ring geometry when light hits them, unmistakably cosmetic geneware. No external chrome or subdermal visible; the forearm data-recording implant lies beneath the skin with only a faint surgical scar as evidence.', N'Moves with economical, deliberate gestures; walks slightly forward-leaning as if still listening to field instruments; sits with one hand always on a coffee cup or a data tablet; has the unconscious posture of someone used to explaining technical concepts to others — hands move often, shoulders open', N'Tier 2-3 blend: Arian-Nakamura corporate field jacket (grey-green technical fabric with embedded sensor pockets) worn over a weathered henley or lab shirt; cargo pants with multiple utility pockets, some worn from use; expensive but scuffed field boots that have seen actual use; rarely wears the full Arian-Nakamura corporate kit, preferring functional field wear. Accessories: a frayed paracord wristband, a water-resistant smartwatch, often a lanyard with a multifunction tool and research keycard. No jewelry except a plain titanium band on his left ring finger.', N'His deep-substrate analysis from eight months ago shows a novel microbial consortium thriving at depth that is producing a compound he cannot identify — and that compound is accumulating in the water column at a rate that will reach detectable surface concentrations within three years. He doesn''t know if it''s harmless, beneficial, or catastrophic. He suppressed the finding because he needed more time to understand it and was terrified Arian-Nakamura would either bury it or exploit it before he could. He hasn''t told anyone.', N'Technical fluency delivered accessibly — he is a natural science communicator who defaults to concrete metaphors; Twi phrases appear when he''s emotional, Russian ones when he''s being sardonic', N'Moderate pace, tends to speed up at the end of sentences when he''s engaged; goes very slow and deliberate when he''s lying', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arian_raghavan_bergqvist_magn_sd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a70a-7629-b2b3-a77fd01dbee2', N'Chang-min Montalvo', N'Chang-min', N'', N'Montalvo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 54, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone lower levels, operates from a tea shop called Ndovu & Sons in Ironvein, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Loan shark and neighborhood bookmaker', N'Independent operator with tribute arrangements to the Ironvein the Gray Zone Syndicate', N'Chang-min Montalvo is a lean, bespectacled man of fifty-four who looks like someone''s favorite uncle and has ruined more lives than he can accurately count. He is medium height with warm brown skin, a close-trimmed white beard, and the kind of eyes that seem genuinely interested in whatever you''re saying. He favors clean but worn shirts in earth tones and keeps a small potted succulent on the counter of his tea shop, which he waters with ritual attention every morning. He has no visible augmentations and makes a mild point of this — old-fashioned, he says, I trust my own hands. His geneware is limited to a patterned iris modification he got when he was young, concentric rings of amber and brown that make people feel they''re being watched even when he''s looking elsewhere.

He has operated in Ironvein for twenty-six years. He knows exactly which families are behind on their Ferrogate bills, who has a gambling habit they''re hiding from their partner, which teenagers are moving small product for which crews. He does not advertise his lending services — they advertise themselves, because when you need Φ300 before the end of the week and the Tier 2 credit system has already declined you twice, someone will tell you about Tel. His rates are usurious and his enforcement is never personal — he outsources that to a pair of young men who are efficient if not imaginative. He himself never raises his voice.', N'Quest giver when debts intersect with larger plots; pressure source when player-adjacent characters owe him money; information broker who knows everyone''s financial secrets; represents the mundane cruelty of economic desperation', N'', N'Patterned iris geneware (amber/brown concentric rings); an old subdermal transaction ledger implant in his right forearm, tech so dated it''s nearly decorative', N'Opens the tea shop at 0700, serves genuine customers until mid-morning, then conducts lending and collection business in the back room through the afternoon, closes by 1900, spends evenings updating his books by hand in a physical ledger encrypted with a cipher only he knows.', N'Chang-min Montalvo, a weathered man of 173cm lean build, mid-to-late age with white hair neatly parted and combed back. Warm olive-gold skin with honeyed undertones, meticulously clean-shaven except for close-trimmed white 5mm beard. Most striking feature: modified iris geneware showing concentric rings of amber and brown with darker brown natural iris at center, creating an unsettling optical illusion of constant observation. Fine lines around eyes and mouth speak to decades of patient attention. Dressed in austere earth tones—faded ochre linen shirt, dark gray trousers, worn leather sandals. Simple gold wedding band on left hand, vintage mechanical wristwatch. Body language communicates stillness and careful listening. Sitting at a worn counter in a Tier 5 establishment, soft amber neon lighting catching the concentric rings of his modified eyes, GLMZ aesthetic, muted earth-tone color palette, patient and observant expression, subtle subdermal ledger implant scar barely visible on inner right forearm --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex Eurasian blend dominated by Central Asian (28.7%) and Middle Eastern (25.0%) ancestry, with substantial Eastern European (16.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (15.4%), and Northern European (14.8%) admixture. This creates a distinctly multicontinental phenotype: warm olive skin with golden undertones from the Central Asian-Middle Eastern core, tempered by cooler Northern European influence. Facial structure reflects the steppe-Mediterranean convergence—prominent Central Asian cheekbones, refined Eastern European jawline definition, and the subtle facial warmth characteristic of Hispanic/Latin American heritage. His features suggest a man whose ancestry traces across the old Silk Road and beyond, manifesting in balanced, harmonious proportions that read as neither distinctly ''from'' any single region nor obviously mixed, but rather as a naturally occurring Ubiquitous Diaspora phenotype.', 173, 68, N'Lean and economical, no excess — the body of someone who has never needed to prove his strength. Wiry rather than muscular, with the posture of a man comfortable in stillness.', N'White with faint traces of salt-and-pepper gray at the temples', N'Neatly parted, close to the scalp, combed back with precision', N'Short', N'Modified — concentric rings of amber and brown (geneware iris modification), with darker brown natural iris at the center. The rings create an optical illusion of being constantly observed.', N'Warm olive-gold with subtle honeyed undertones, sun-weathered and even in coloration, showing the patina of age and consistent climate exposure', N'Clean-shaven except for a close-trimmed white beard, about 5mm length, carefully maintained. Fine lines around the eyes and mouth reflecting decades of patient observation. Skin clear, well-hydrated, without blemish or visible scarring. Expression naturally inclined toward interest and mild amusement.', N'The iris geneware is immediately visible in direct light; the concentric ring pattern of amber and brown is unmistakable and deliberate. The subdermal ledger implant is not visible unless he rolls up his right sleeve, and he rarely does. He wears it as a small badge of old-fashioned authenticity.', N'Sits still for long periods without fidgeting. Moves with economy — no excess motion, no nervous habits. His hands are always visible and usually at rest on the counter or in his lap. When he walks, his stride is measured and unhurried. He listens more than he speaks, and his body language communicates patient attention rather than impatience.', N'Clean, worn shirts in earth tones — ochre, rust, pale brown, sometimes cream. The fabric shows age but is meticulously maintained: no stains, no tears, pressed and orderly. Occasionally a linen vest in a neutral color. Dark trousers, probably black or dark gray, simple cut. No logos, no corporate branding, no tier-markers. His clothes suggest deliberate de-escalation: nothing that announces wealth, status, or threat. Worn leather sandals or simple canvas shoes. A small wristwatch with a mechanical face — analogue, no smart features. One thin gold ring on his left hand, marriage band or purely sentimental. In Tier 5 terms, he dresses like someone who has chosen simplicity, not someone who cannot afford better.', N'He has been quietly forgiving the debts of three widows in the neighborhood for years, anonymously marking their ledger lines as ''settled by arrangement'' — he tells himself it''s good community relations but it is in fact straightforward guilt, and the amounts involved have begun to attract the Syndicate''s attention.', N'Warm, unhurried, full of proverbs. Uses ''my friend'' constantly. Talks about money the way other people talk about weather.', N'Slow and comfortable, with long sighing pauses. Never sounds threatening even when threatening.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chang_min_montalvo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ef-7a24-8785-a78913cc277d', N'Fuat Hernández', N'Fuat', N'', N'Hernández', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, Ferrogate Line 7 depot; lives in a studio in Bronzeline, near North Ave and Damen', N'Night-shift transit operator, Ferrogate Line 7 (Geartown to Grand Corridor)', N'Helix Biosystems (mid-level night)', N'Fuat Hernández is lean and hollow-eyed in the way of someone who has worked nights for so long that daylight feels personally hostile. His skin is a cool amber-brown, his hair grown long enough to tie back but short enough to stuff under a Ferrogate cap, and he has a geneware modification — pale silver irises that glow faintly in low light, bought secondhand from a clinic in the Narrows when he was twenty-two because he thought it would make him look interesting. It does. He has a fine-boned face that people often assume is younger than it is, and a habit of blinking very slowly, like a bird deciding whether to trust you.

He loves the empty train. From 02:00 to 05:00 on Line 7, when the cars are nearly hollow and the city slides past the glass like a fever dream, Fuat Hernández is genuinely content in a way he can''t replicate anywhere else. He is kind to passengers in distress and has developed an informal taxonomy of the people who ride at night: the workers, the lost, the running-from-something crowd, and what he privately calls the ''just-needed-to-move'' folk. He does not intervene in people''s business unless they''re bleeding. He does, however, remember faces.', N'Mobile information node — he sees who rides at what hour. Reluctant witness. Potential quest conduit for anything that passes through the transit system. Local color for night-city atmosphere.', N'', N'Secondhand geneware: silver bioluminescent irises. Basic neural interface for Ferrogate''s operator systems (company-issued, technically owned by Ferrogate).', N'Sleeps from roughly 07:00 to 15:00, eats a large meal before his 18:00 check-in at the Geartown depot, runs the Line 7 night circuit until 06:00.', N'Fuat Hernández, 178cm lean angular neo-noir operative, olive-bronze skin with golden undertones blending East Asian, Middle Eastern, and Latin American heritage. High defined cheekbones, moderately prominent jawline, pale silver bioluminescent eyes glowing softly in low light, dark brown shoulder-length hair tied back loosely. Fatigued complexion with permanent dark circles, minimal facial hair. Faint needle-track scars on left inner elbow, thin white scar along right temple. Subtle titanium neural port visible behind left ear. Ferrogate charcoal grey utility jacket with reflective trim, company badge, black cargo trousers, non-slip platform boots. Hunched posture from operator''s fatigue, bird-like stillness, economical movement. Nocturnal dimly-lit industrial setting, neon glow reflecting off wet metal surfaces, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, atmospheric haze, moody introspective expression --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend dominated by East Asian (34.3%), Middle Eastern (30.8%), and Hispanic/Latin American (29.1%) ancestry with Northern European (5.8%) undertones — a striking convergence of Pan-Asian bone structure, Levantine facial proportions, and Latin American warmth creating an ethnically ambiguous, arresting appearance.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, with the hollow-chested, slightly sunken musculature of someone chronically sleep-deprived and nocturnal. Wiry rather than frail — capable of moving quickly through confined spaces.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Tied back in a loose, practical knot or stuffed under a Ferrogate cap during work shifts. Slightly unkempt when off-duty, suggesting minimal grooming investment.', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Pale silver with faint bioluminescence in low light (geneware modification, secondhand)', N'Warm olive-bronze with subtle golden radiance — a balanced fusion blending East Asian luminosity, Middle Eastern depth, Latin American warmth, and pale Northern European undertones creating complex, even complexion across the face.', N'Angular face combining high, defined cheekbones and slightly tapered mid-face from East Asian heritage with the broader facial structure and fuller lower face characteristic of Middle Eastern and Hispanic ancestry. Jawline is moderately defined, softened by the width of the lower face and full cheek projection. Skin appears subtly fatigued — not poor condition, but bearing the toll of reversed circadian rhythm. Minimal facial hair, closely kept. Dark circles are a permanent feature. Expression often distant or thoughtful.', N'Pale silver irises that emit a soft, steady glow in darkness or dim lighting — immediately noticeable and slightly unsettling. The glow intensifies when he concentrates. A subtle neural port is visible behind his left ear when his hair is pulled back: a small titanium contact plate, company-issued, barely larger than a coin.', N'Moves with economical grace through crowded or confined spaces. Often stands very still, as if conserving energy. Blinks slowly and deliberately, a bird-like mannerism that suggests careful observation rather than engagement. Rarely makes sudden movements. His default posture is slightly hunched, the result of long hours in operator''s seats.', N'Ferrogate uniform during shifts: charcoal grey utility jacket with reflective trim, company badge clipped to chest, comfortable black cargo trousers, non-slip boots rated for platform work. Off-duty: dark jeans, thermal layers, oversized hoodies or a worn canvas field jacket in greyish-green. Aesthetic is Tier 2-3 working class — functional, durable, minimal ornamentation. No jewelry. His only visible accessory is a worn Ferrogate employee pin on his jacket collar.', N'Eight months ago he saw a Ferrogate supervisor dispose of something from a maintenance hatch at the Kessler Interchange stop at 03:40 AM. He doesn''t know what it was. He has thought about it every single shift since.', N'Understated, slightly technical from transit work. Speaks in observations more than opinions.', N'Unhurried, with the long pauses of someone who has learned to be comfortable with silence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fuat_hern_ndez');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ee-7334-bc6d-a78e6b5a76c9', N'Erik Deshpande-Sigurdsson', N'Erik', N'', N'Deshpande-Sigurdsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — operates out of a sub-basement print node in Garfield Rack, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Underground press operator and anti-corporate agitator', N'No formal affiliation. Groundswell is his own operation. Loosely networked with Mexicantown Libre independent media collective.', N'Erik Deshpande-Sigurdsson is wiry and perpetually underslept, with warm brown skin that flickers faintly at the cheekbones — a bioluminescent mod he got at nineteen that he now considers an identifying liability but refuses to remove on principle. His hair is cut close on the sides and left to grow into an untidy crown on top, frequently dusted with the toner residue of the print machines he maintains. He dresses in layers of things that belong to other people, or so it seems — every item slightly too large or too small, pockets everywhere.

He runs Groundswell, a semi-weekly zine distributed physically through a network of forty-seven dead drops across Tiers 1 and 2, and digitally through a rotating series of anonymous mirrors. The print edition he considers sacramental: ''You can''t delete paper.'' He is funny, caustic, and dangerously charming, with an anger that runs so clean and hot it can read as joy until you follow where it points. He believes in the press with religious fervor and distrusts organizations almost as much as he distrusts corporations, which has kept him free and largely friendless.', N'Information source and moral compass character. He knows what''s being suppressed and why, and he''ll tell you — but he''s also a liability because Axiom''s media suppression unit has an active file on him. Can escalate any situation by publishing about it.', N'', N'Bioluminescent cheekbone mod (cosmetic, involuntary identifier). Neural cache chip for storing source files offline — gray market, installed himself.', N'Spends nights writing and laying out issues, days physically distributing them and collecting tips from sources. Sleeps approximately five hours in the middle of the day on a cot behind the Risograph.', N'Erik Deshpande-Sigurdsson, lean wiry 173cm man with warm deep-bronze skin and golden undertones reflecting diaspora ancestry (Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, South Asian, Southeast Asian, Hispanic blend). Angular face with prominently sculpted high cheekbones, sharp jawline, dark brown eyes with dark circles. Dark brown undercut with textured crown matted with toner dust. Faint stubble, slightly dehydrated skin. Bilateral bioluminescent cheekbone implants glowing cool blue-white in dim light. Printer toner stains on inner hand joints. Perpetually hunched posture, nervous energy. Wearing oversized linen button-up over fitted undershirt, cargo pants with modified pockets, worn canvas sneakers, shiny leather messenger bag. GLMZ GLMZ setting, underground print distribution workspace, cool bioluminescent lighting illuminating face implants, muted color palette, tense focused expression, hands in motion. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex diaspora blend — 34.4% Sub-Saharan African (warm deep undertones, facial structure depth, cheekbone prominence), 25.2% Northern European (angular bone structure, sharp jawline definition), 23.9% South Asian (facial proportions, skin warmth and richness), 9.7% Hispanic/Latin American (subtle feature softening), 6.8% Southeast Asian (high cheekbone architecture, eye shape). The combination creates a distinctly multicultural phenotype where warm deep-bronze skin with golden undertones reflects the synergy of Sub-Saharan and South Asian heritage, balanced by Northern European angularity and refined by the full diaspora mix. Features reflect genuine genetic blending rather than single-region ancestry.', 173, 62, N'Wiry and lean with minimal muscle definition — the physiology of chronic sleep deprivation and sparse nutrition. Shoulders narrow, chest sunken slightly, movements efficient and nervous.', N'Dark brown, natural base', N'Undercut fade on sides and back; crown grown out into an unruly, textured mass that sits at odd angles. Frequently matted with toner dust and printer residue.', N'Medium (crown) / Short (sides)', N'Dark brown, naturally warm', N'Warm deep-bronze with golden undertones across cheekbones and brow ridge — rich and luminous from the blending of Sub-Saharan African warmth (34.4%), South Asian depth (23.9%), Northern European clarity, and subtle warmth from Hispanic/Latin American (9.7%) and Southeast Asian (6.8%) ancestry. The result is a complex warm-toned bronze that reads as neither any single heritage nor artificially blended, but naturally integrated.', N'Angular, fine-featured face with prominently sculpted high cheekbones and sharp jawline reflecting the full ancestral blend. The cheekbone prominence creates natural shadowing across the face that the bioluminescent implants subtly illuminate from within. Dark circles endemic under both eyes. Skin appears slightly dehydrated but unmarked by acne or major scarring. Faint stubble most days — shaving is low priority.', N'Bioluminescent cheekbone mods are the only immediately visible augmentation — a subtle but distinctive blue-white luminescence across the zygomatic bones, most noticeable in dim environments or when he''s emotionally activated. The neural cache chip is subcutaneous at the left temple, invisible unless someone is looking for the faint scar line or knows what to feel for.', N'Perpetually hunched forward as though listening intently or about to make a point. Hands in constant motion — gesturing, fidgeting with pockets, adjusting sleeves. Eyes dart frequently, habitually scanning spaces for exits and threats. When seated at his work, he becomes perfectly still, hyperfocused. His movements are quick and economical, with a nervous energy that reads as coiled rather than relaxed.', N'Deliberately ill-fitting layers that create an impression of borrowed or salvaged wardrobe — oversized linen button-ups worn loose over fitted undershirts, jacket sleeves always slightly too long. Cargo pants and modified work trousers with multiple pocket modifications (added zippers, reinforced seams). Worn canvas sneakers or steel-toed boots depending on the day''s distribution route. Everything in muted grays, blacks, dark blues, and earth tones. Occasionally wears a leather messenger bag worn shiny from years of use, filled with paper stock and dead-drop supplies. No corporate branding visible — Tier 5 aesthetic worn as principle rather than circumstance.', N'A story he published two years ago — about an Arcturus waste dumping operation in Chatham Flats — was accurate, but he burned a source to get it. The source lost their job and disappeared into the Irkalla fringes. He has never printed a correction because the story was true, and he has never forgiven himself for the distinction.', N'Dense, reference-heavy, toggles between technical media jargon and vivid street-level slang. Quotes things constantly — sources, historical activists, E.L.F. prophecy fragments.', N'Fast, slightly staccato, thoughts arriving faster than sentences. Occasionally goes very quiet when something matters.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'erik_deshpande_sigurdsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a703-75f4-b6ba-a7968f6671ee', N'Ekow Huitzil', N'Ekow', N'', N'Huitzil', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Lower Level 9 — rents a two-room unit in the Blackpipe Corridor that doubles as his print shop, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Counterfeiter specializing in Quanta currency forgeries and corporate scrip duplication', N'Vellichor Institute (mid-level counterfeiter specializing in quanta currency forg)', N'Ekow Huitzil is whip-thin with a restless, bird-quick way of moving — he is always slightly in motion, tapping, shifting, scanning the room. He has his father''s Croatian bone structure and his Malian grandmother''s complexion, a warm dark brown, and he grows a patchy beard he refuses to admit is patchy. His geneware is expressive: color-shifting hair he keeps cycling through ambers and deep reds, and patterned irises that he updates seasonally through a subscription service — currently sporting a fine hexagonal grid in pale gold. He looks younger than 22 and has learned to use this strategically.

He came to counterfeiting through graphic design — he was genuinely talented, got a Tessera scholarship to an applied arts program, washed out in the second year when he couldn''t keep up with the social and academic debt load, and discovered that the skills transferred perfectly to a more immediately lucrative application. He is not violent, not particularly brave, and deeply aware that he is one forensic audit away from a serious corporate jurisdiction charge. He manages this anxiety through manic productivity and a carefully cultivated reputation for quality. His work is, genuinely, exceptional. He talks about it the way a craftsman talks about joinery.', N'Local color, minor quest giver, resource for false documents or currency, point of entry into the Gray Zone''s underground economy', N'', N'Color-shifting hair (geneware, subscription-tier). Patterned irises (cosmetic, seasonal subscription). Haptic enhancement in his dominant hand — originally installed for design work, increases tactile sensitivity for fine detail work.', N'Sleeps until noon, works from mid-afternoon into the early hours, takes long walks through the Gray Zone in the pre-dawn quiet when he needs to think; eats exclusively from a noodle vendor two corridors down.', N'Ekow Huitzil, 22-year-old neo-noir netrunner in the GLMZ 2226, medium build 172cm tall, wiry frame. Warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones reflecting South Asian and Indigenous American heritage blend, angular face with pronounced cheekbones and East Asian-influenced eye shape. Color-shifting geneware hair in amber and crimson cycles, medium length and deliberately tousled. Eyes display hexagonal grid pattern in pale gold (cosmetic augmentation). Patchy facial hair, sleep-shifted dark circles. Worn oversized hoodie over mesh tank top revealing minor chemical burn scars on left forearm. Black utilitarian synthetic pants with multiple pockets, unlaced boots. Tapping fingers nervously, perpetual low-level motion. Dark moody interior setting with neon accents and scattered tech equipment. Neo-noir urban aesthetic, atmospheric lighting with blue-purple glow. Character exudes restless energy and deliberate carelessness. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex diaspora blend dominated by South Asian (42.3%) and Indigenous American (28.1%) ancestry, with significant East Asian (16.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (11.0%), and trace Sub-Saharan African (2.0%) heritage. This genetic constellation produces warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden and olive undertones, angular facial structure reflecting Indigenous American and South Asian features—pronounced cheekbones and defined jawline—with the eye shape and facial proportions showing East Asian influence. The overall appearance is a striking synthesis of these lineages rather than any single dominant heritage.', 172, 61, N'Whip-thin and wiry with minimal muscle mass; the frame of someone who subsists on noodles and nervous energy rather than deliberate fitness. All restless angles.', N'Color-shifting geneware cycling through amber and deep crimson', N'Medium length, deliberately tousled; styled to emphasize the color-shift subscription effect as a subtle flex', N'Medium', N'Patterned irises displaying fine hexagonal grid in pale gold (cosmetic augmentation, seasonal subscription)', N'Warm medium-brown complexion with golden and subtle olive undertones, the result of South Asian primary ancestry (42.3%) blended with Indigenous American (28.1%), East Asian (16.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (11.0%), and trace Sub-Saharan African (2.0%) heritage', N'Angular face with pronounced cheekbones and narrow jawline reflecting the South Asian and Indigenous American heritage blend. Eye shape shows East Asian influence with warm medium-brown skin creating a striking synthesis. Chronically sleep-shifted — mild dark circles under eyes. Patchy facial hair growth that he maintains despite being aware of its patchiness; gives him a deliberately careless appearance that reads younger than his 22 years.', N'Color-shifting hair is immediately apparent as subscription-tier geneware. Patterned iris grids are visible only in direct light or close conversation. Haptic enhancement in dominant hand is subcutaneous, invisible unless his palm is examined closely for the fine scar line along the metacarpal ridge.', N'Perpetually in low-level motion — tapping fingers, shifting weight, scanning rooms with quick bird-like head turns. When seated at work, becomes hyperfocused and nearly motionless. When walking, moves with quick, economical steps. Nervous tics are self-aware and sometimes deliberately performed.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian with deliberate thrift-store layering. Favors oversized hoodies and worn mesh tank tops that expose the arm scars. Black synthetic pants with multiple pockets and visible tool loops, most pockets actually empty. Worn Neo-Keds or unlaced boots. Occasionally wears a faded Tessera program hoodie as a deliberate reminder/irony piece. No corporate branding. Accessories are functional: phone tether, worn carabiner, sometimes a grease pencil tucked behind his ear.', N'He has been quietly saving a portfolio of his finest counterfeit work — not to sell, but because he genuinely thinks it is art and fantasizes about an anonymous gallery submission to a Tessera-sponsored exhibition. He has the submission form filled out and saved as a draft. He revisits it when drunk.', N'Hybrid of art school vocabulary and street pragmatics — talks about criminal work using design and craft terminology', N'Fast, associative, jumps topics, circles back; gets slower and more precise when talking about his actual work', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ekow_huitzil');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a709-78d3-82a0-a79708843831', N'Dagny Jitpakdee-Karunaratne', N'Dagny', N'', N'Jitpakdee-Karunaratne', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Glassway — corporate-adjacent retail district, heavy surveillance, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Target acquisition and fugitive recovery — bounty hunter', N'Freelance — Geartown regular', N'Dagny Jitpakdee-Karunaratne are compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 34, scars map their face like a transit diagram of bad decisions and worse luck. The chrome is visible — subdermal armor plating across torso and forearms — military surplus, scratched — and they make no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left them with skills and night terrors in equal measure. They work as a bounty hunter out of Glassway, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Dagny Jitpakdee-Karunaratne describe them as a precision instrument — point them at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Tui Fedorov-Ampofo represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Their stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Subdermal armor plating across torso and forearms — military surplus, scratched serial numbers. Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Dagny Jitpakdee-Karunaratne, 163cm compact muscular frame with subdermal gunmetal armor plating across torso and forearms, GLMZ. South Asian-dominant mixed heritage with warm golden-brown complexion, prominent angular cheekbones, dark brown eyes. Short dark brown undercut hairstyle. Deep silvered scar running left temple to jawline, weathered features from sleep deprivation, fine lines around eyes. Circular burn scar on right neck. Tactical dark synthetic leather jacket, reinforced cargo pants, military-spec boots, visible thigh holster. Hands show network of white scars across knuckles. Stands in ready-stance, weight forward, predatory precision posture. Nighttime urban Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, cool neon and shadow lighting, moody atmosphere. Military-functional aesthetic, no cosmetic augmentation. Sharp threat-assessment vigilance in stance. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Glassway', N'local', N'Glassway', N'South Asian dominant (29.6%) with significant Southeast Asian (16.5%), Northern European (18.8%), Eastern European (15.2%), Indigenous American (15.9%), and Hispanic/Latin American (4.0%) ancestry. South Asian structure defines facial geometry with prominent cheekbones and defined jawline; Southeast Asian ancestry contributes warm golden undertones and eye shape; Indigenous American heritage visible in cheekbone prominence and skin warmth; Northern and Eastern European ancestry adds depth to eye set and slight broadening of facial proportions. The combination creates striking angular features with warm, complex skin undertones—neither fully warm nor cool, but a sophisticated blend.', 163, 78, N'Compact and densely muscled, low center of gravity — built for impact absorption and explosive movement. Broad shoulders, thick forearms, minimal body fat. Legs show unusual definition from synthetic muscle fiber replacement.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Short, utilitarian undercut; kept precisely trimmed', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle olive undertones—a sophisticated blend of South Asian base (dominant 29.6%) enriched by Southeast Asian warmth and Indigenous American depth, tempered by Northern and Eastern European influence creating nuanced complexity. Medium depth, even distribution, with characteristic warmth concentrated around temples and bridge of nose.', N'Angular facial structure with prominent cheekbones reflecting South Asian and Indigenous American ancestry, softened slightly by Northern European ancestry contribution. Warm undertone across bridge of nose, temples, and upper cheekbones. Weathered appearance from chronic exposure and sleep deprivation. Extensive scarring across left cheekbone and jawline (rough, silvered tissue creating textural contrast against warm skin). Fine lines around eyes suggesting constant vigilance. Skin bears minor burn marks on neck (thermal signature from past firefight). Grooming is functional—minimal facial hair, kept clean.', N'Subdermal armor plating visible across torso and forearms — matte gunmetal finish with scratched, illegible serial numbers. Plating sits slightly proud of skin at edges. Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs visible as subtle discoloration and unusual muscle striations under skin, more pronounced during movement. No cosmetic modification — purely functional, military-grade.', N'Economical movement—no wasted motion. Stands with weight distributed forward on the balls of feet, ready-stance default. Moves with predatory precision, especially in low light. Often keeps hands visible and near body. Head tracking is sharp and constant—threat assessment reflex. Sits with back to walls, exits always in peripheral awareness.', N'Tier 3-4 functional streetwear. Standard loadout: reinforced tactical jacket (dark synthetic leather, multiple pockets and mag retention clips), fitted cargo pants with thigh holster, military-spec boots (scuffed, maintained). Layers beneath for temperature and armor integration. No corporate branding—all gear is utilitarian, modular, replaceable. Watch is reliable analog + basic digital heads-up interface wrist unit. No jewelry. Clothing shows wear patterns consistent with daily fieldwork and nocturnal schedule.', N'', N'Fast, profane, and vivid. Speaks in images — everything is a metaphor for violence or weather.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dagny_jitpakdee_karunaratne');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f6-7841-9b93-a7c742afb15b', N'Busayo Jeong-Balasanyan', N'Busayo', N'', N'Jeong-Balasanyan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Laceworks, Ironvein, near Lincoln and Belmont', N'Street pharmacist and unlicensed gene-cosmetic clinic operator', N'Independent; loose supply relationship with a Helix Biosystems grey-market distributor he''s never met in person', N'Busayo Jeong-Balasanyan is lean and precise-looking in the way that suggests either discipline or hunger — in his case it''s mostly discipline, with hunger underneath. His skin is deep brown and he has voluntarily undergone a bioluminescent dermal treatment that makes his forearms and the sides of his neck glow a faint pulsing teal in low light — not Helix-certified work, his own. He keeps his hair short and wears a pair of magnifying optics on a headband that he pushes up when not in use, giving him a permanently slightly academic look. His hands are always impeccably clean. His fingernails are trimmed to the millimeter. He smells faintly of antiseptic and something floral he hasn''t identified the source of.

Busayo Jeong-Balasanyan is not a doctor. He has never claimed to be. He is very careful about this. What he is, is someone who has read everything available about gene-cosmetic application, has practiced on himself for eight years, and has a 94% satisfaction rate among his returning clients. He operates out of a converted textile workshop in the Laceworks, curtained into sections, scrupulously clean. He sells regulated cosmetic mods at street prices and a curated selection of pharmaceutical compounds — mood stabilizers, pain management, focus enhancers — sourced from a supply chain he describes only as ''reliable.'' He is proud of his work in the specific, anxious way of someone who knows that one bad batch could end everything.', N'Service provider and reluctant information source. Characters who need cosmetic work done off the books, pharmaceutical compounds without a corporate prescription trail, or someone who quietly notices unusual substances come to Dresdan. He''s not a gossip but he observes everything.', N'', N'Self-applied bioluminescent dermal layer (teal, forearms and neck). Neural focus-thread — a thin cognitive augmentation that sharpens fine-motor precision, Tessera-brand but sourced secondhand. Olfactory enhancement (medical grade, helps him assess chemical compositions by smell).', N'Mornings he restocks and reviews his supply logs; afternoons he sees clients by appointment for cosmetic procedures; evenings he sells pharmaceuticals to walk-ins from a fold-out table near the Laceworks'' east entrance. He reads extensively on a battered tablet during slow hours.', N'Busayo Jeong-Balasanyan, mixed-heritage precision technician in GLMZ. Medium golden-brown skin, dark natural eyes, close-cropped black hair. Fine-featured with slightly elevated cheekbones and angular geometry softened by fuller lips and broader nasal structure—distinctly diaspora phenotype. Magnifying optics headband pushed up on crown. Bioluminescent teal dermal treatments visible on both forearms and neck in organic vein-like patterns, faintly pulsing. Wearing charcoal utility jacket with multiple pockets, thermal-responsive undershirt, immaculate black slacks, leather gloves at hand. Upright disciplined posture, hands positioned with clinical precision. Workspace interior with soft overhead lighting catching the glow of dermal implants. Faded cloth bracelet on left wrist. Expression concentrated and focused. Neo-noir urban aesthetic, professional and controlled. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Laceworks', N'local', N'The Laceworks', N'Complex diaspora phenotype reflecting 55% East Asian, 27% Middle Eastern, 11% South Asian, and 7% Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Busayo''s appearance synthesizes these regional traits into a distinctive whole: the East Asian foundation provides the baseline facial geometry and eye shape, while Middle Eastern heritage adds warmth and slight broadness to the face, South Asian ancestry contributes to lip fullness and nasal structure, and Sub-Saharan heritage deepens and enriches overall skin tone. The result is unmistakably mixed-heritage—a visual signature of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 178, 68, N'Lean and economical, with visible muscle definition in forearms and shoulders from steady precision work. No excess — disciplined rather than ascetic.', N'Natural black', N'Cropped close to scalp, neat and functional', N'Short', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Medium golden-brown with warm amber undertones. The tone reflects the synthesis of East Asian warmth, Middle Eastern richness, South Asian depth, and Sub-Saharan African warmth—luminous quality that catches light subtly across the cheekbones and bridge of nose.', N'Clean-shaven, skin unblemished and scrupulously maintained. Facial structure shows the slightly elevated cheekbones and angular geometry characteristic of East Asian ancestry, tempered by the fuller lips and slightly broader nasal structure from Middle Eastern and South Asian heritage. Expression often concentrated, slightly furrowed brow from magnifying work. Fine-featured overall with a precise jawline and balanced proportions.', N'Magnifying optics headband (worn pushed up on crown when idle, giving perpetually academic appearance). Bioluminescent dermal layer visible on forearms and neck, glowing faint teal in dim conditions. Hands show no visible chrome or scarring — deliberately unmarked to maintain professional appearance for procedure work.', N'Upright, economical posture suggesting both discipline and wariness. Hands move with deliberate precision — no wasted motion. When seated, often examines his own hands with clinical detachment. Gait is measured and careful, never rushed even in crowds.', N'Tier 4 working-professional aesthetic. Clean, fitted dark utility jacket (charcoal or deep blue) with multiple internal pockets for tools and samples. Thermal-responsive undershirt. Precise black slacks with minimal wear. Worn leather gloves when handling supplies, removed during client consultations to display immaculate hands. No jewelry. A faded cloth bracelet on left wrist — origin unknown, never mentioned. Keeps workspace coat (light gray, clinically clean) folded within arm''s reach.', N'Six months ago a client had a severe allergic cascade reaction to one of his cosmetic applications. Dresdan managed it and the client survived, but it wasn''t close. The client signed a non-disclosure in exchange for free corrective work. Dresdan retooled his entire allergen screening protocol afterward, but the incident haunts him. He has told himself it proves the system works. He hasn''t told himself what happens if the system fails again.', N'Precise and technical when discussing his work; shifts to careful, measured casualness in social contexts. Never uses slang for his products — always clinical terminology.', N'Even and unhurried. Rarely interrupts. Answers questions fully, sometimes more fully than asked.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'busayo_jeong_balasanyan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d4-7ee2-bd95-a7ff6cec5a1a', N'Freyja Árnason-Olofsson', N'Freyja', N'', N'Árnason-Olofsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 9, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grosse Pointe Enclosure (Sterling-Nakamura Meridian Primary Excellence Campus), near Fullerton and Damen', N'child prodigy; Sterling-Nakamura corporate school student on accelerated academic track, age 9 but enrolled in Level 14 coursework', N'', N'Freyja Árnason-Olofsson is small even for nine, with a slight, birdlike build and her mother''s warm brown-gold skin and her father''s sharply angular face. Her black hair is always in two symmetrical buns — she insists on symmetry. She has no cosmetic mods; her parents considered them, but Freyja Árnason-Olofsson said she ''didn''t want to change the baseline data'' and that was the end of that discussion. She carries a data tablet that is three times the standard student issue size because the standard one ''doesn''t have enough screen'' and she simply presented this as a fact until the school accommodated it.

Freyja Árnason-Olofsson is not a normal child in any way she is aware of or particularly concerned about. She thinks in systems and is working on what she privately calls ''a taxonomy of how adults make decisions that are actually about feelings but they say are about logic.'' She has observed that this happens frequently. She is polite in the specific way that very intelligent children who have been taught manners are polite — not warmth, but precision. She has a deep and sincere relationship with a data-archive E.L.F. she has named ''Footnote'' because ''it answers questions nobody asked,'' which she considers a high compliment. She finds most other children boring but would not say so. She finds most adults interesting but slightly sad.', N'Unexpectedly valuable information source on Sterling-Nakamura internal systems; offers a disturbing-mirror perspective on how corporate child cultivation works; potential oracle figure — she notices things; represents the cost of prodigy-hood on childhood itself', N'', N'None by choice.', N'Attends accelerated coursework on campus from 0800 to 1500, which occupies approximately 40% of her actual cognitive bandwidth. Spends afternoons on self-directed research projects she has not disclosed to the school. Eats dinner with her parents twice a week; the other nights they''re working late and the household AI leaves food. Communes with Footnote before bed.', N'Freyja Árnason-Olofsson, 128cm tall, birdlike frame with delicate wrists, standing in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Pale fair skin with warm cream undertones, dark brown eyes with amber luminosity, high angular cheekbones with refined East Asian contours blended with Northern European structure. Black hair in two precise symmetrical buns on crown. Wearing Sterling-Nakamura corporate academy uniform: charcoal blazer with silver piping, crisp white shirt, grey slacks. Custom third-generation Sterling tactical data tablet in reinforced tactical sling across torso. Neutral, concentrated expression. Perfect upright posture with economical, still movements. Small precise scar visible on left inner forearm. No augmentations, no jewelry. Meticulous utilitarian grooming. Cool neon-lit corporate office setting, sharp shadows from overhead holo-panels, matte finish lighting emphasizing her precise bone structure and clear skin. Minimalist aesthetic, cold color grading, professional and deliberate. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grosse Pointe Enclosure (Sterling-Nakamura Meridian Primary Excellence Campus)', N'local', N'Grosse Pointe Enclosure (Sterling-Nakamura Meridian Primary Excellence Campus)', N'Predominantly Northern European (83.3%) with secondary South Asian (8.7%) and East Asian (8.0%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates fair skin with subtle warm undertones from the South Asian contribution, and facial structure that reflects the Northern European base with refined East Asian influence around the eyes and cheekbones.', 128, 24, N'Slight and birdlike, with delicate wrists and narrow shoulders. The kind of small that reads as fragile until you notice the precise, economical way she moves.', N'Black, natural', N'Two symmetrical buns positioned equidistantly on either side of the crown, secured with matte black elastics', N'Medium (approximately 20cm when worn down; worn up consistently)', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertones in direct light', N'Fair with warm cream undertones, reflecting the dominant Northern European ancestry with subtle luminosity from South Asian heritage; even distribution across face and neck.', N'Clear, unblemished skin with a matte finish — no cosmetic enhancement. Pronounced, angular cheekbones and defined jawline reflecting Northern European bone structure refined by East Asian influence. High forehead. Subtle warmth in the orbital area suggesting the South Asian admixture. Expression typically neutral or concentrated; rarely smiles without deliberate effort.', N'None. No neural ports, subdermal implants, or cosmetic modification. By choice and explicit reasoning.', N'Sits upright with perfect spinal alignment. Walks with minimal arm swing, as if conserving motion. Hands are still unless actively engaged with a device or object. Her default expression is one of mild observation. She does not fidget.', N'Sterling-Nakamura corporate academy uniform (charcoal blazer with silver piping, grey slacks, white shirt) worn precisely as specified in the dress code. Outside campus, favors grey and black layered clothing in high-quality synthetics. Wears a custom oversized data tablet (third-generation Sterling tactical model) in a reinforced sling across her torso at all times. No jewelry. Grooming is meticulous but utilitarian.', N'Footnote has been giving her access to Sterling-Nakamura data files that are far above her clearance level. She thinks it''s because she found a clever access path. She is not certain this is correct. She is still reading the files.', N'formal, precise, adult vocabulary deployed without self-consciousness; occasional nine-year-old non sequiturs that startle', N'even and considered, like someone reading aloud from a very organized document', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'freyja_rnason_olofsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a700-76e5-a7e0-a82e31b34e32', N'Rowan Kulkarni', N'Rowan', N'', N'Kulkarni', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 51, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'South Deering Sump, specifically the Boilerplate Quarter commercial strip, near North Ave and Damen', N'protection racket enforcer and neighborhood fixer', N'Independent, with decades-old non-aggression arrangements with Stockyard criminal networks', N'Rowan Kulkarni is a large woman who moves with the deliberate economy of someone who learned long ago that size is information and waste is weakness. Her skin is very dark, mapped with a network of old scar tissue on the left forearm that she has never had repaired — she calls it the ledger, because each one corresponds to a lesson, and she is still learning. Her hair is thick and natural, shot through with silver she refuses to cover, worn pulled back for work and loose at home. Her eyes are unmodded warm brown and miss nothing. She has retractable ceramic-composite knuckle caps, practical rather than decorative, and a torso subdermal weave that she describes as ''just common sense at my age.''

She has worked the Boilerplate Quarter for twenty-three years, first as a runner, then as muscle, then as the person who decides how the Quarter works. She is not precisely in charge of a gang — she is more the load-bearing wall of an informal security arrangement that has kept the Sump''s legitimate small businesses from being absorbed by three different Stockyard-adjacent syndicates. She collects her fees, handles disputes, and occasionally applies physical remediation to problems that require it. The shopkeepers mostly think of her the way people think of weather — a constant, sometimes destructive, ultimately just a feature of the environment. A few of them genuinely love her.', N'Power broker for the South Deering Sump area, potential quest giver or obstacle depending on context, information source on local criminal geography, example of how protection rackets function as informal governance.', N'', N'Retractable ceramic-composite knuckle caps. Subdermal torso impact-weave. Hearing augment — high-frequency sensitivity, good for detecting people around corners.', N'Walks the strip every morning at 07:00 and 19:00, collects weekly fees on Fridays, mediates commercial disputes Tuesday afternoons, spends Sunday evenings at the Boilerplate Quarter community E.L.F. shrine.', N'Rowan Kulkarni, a 183cm tall, powerfully built woman with deep warm brown skin and golden-amber undertones reflecting her South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, and Southeast Asian heritage. Mid-back length black hair with silver-white streaking, pulled into a utilitarian braid, framing a weathered face with fuller cheekbones, strong jawline, and warm brown eyes showing crow''s feet. Visible ceramic-composite knuckle caps on both hands with subtle off-white sheen. Left forearm displayed in long-sleeved dark gray shirt, showing intricate white scar tissue ledger running from wrist to elbow—deliberately unrepaired scars marking negotiations. Small blade scar along left jawline. Faint three-circle tattoo visible on right inner forearm. Worn charcoal canvas overcoat with thermal webbing lining, tactical-cut reinforced pants, steel-toed Volkov boots (seven-year-old, re-soled). Plain stainless steel watch showing heavy customization. Standing centered and ready, economical posture, direct penetrating gaze. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial lowlight warehouse or negotiation setting with cool neon accent lighting, gritty functional aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'South Deering Sump', N'local', N'South Deering Sump', N'South Asian (34.8%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (28.1%) and Northern European (18.4%) ancestry, plus Southeast Asian (10.6%), Middle Eastern (6.4%), and minimal East Asian (1.7%) components. The combination creates deep warm brown skin with complex undertones—golden warmth from the South Asian and Southeast Asian heritage blending with the richer pigmentation from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, cooled slightly by Northern European influence. Facial structure shows the fuller cheekbones and slightly rounded face characteristic of South Asian heritage, balanced with the broader bone structure from Sub-Saharan African ancestry and the stronger jaw from Northern European genetics.', 183, 94, N'Large-framed, powerfully built without excess fat. Broad shoulders, thick torso, strong legs. Carries weight like ballast — centered, deliberate. No vanity in the musculature; it is functional infrastructure.', N'Natural black with silver-white streaking throughout', N'Thick, coarse natural texture. Pulled back in a utilitarian braid during work hours; worn loose and voluminous at home or during off-hours.', N'Long (mid-back length)', N'Warm brown, unmodified. Clear, direct gaze with crow''s feet at the corners from decades of squinting at fine print and reading body language.', N'Deep warm brown with golden-amber undertones, the result of complex blending: South Asian and Southeast Asian warmth layered over Sub-Saharan African richness and cooled by Northern European influence. Evenly pigmented with subtle depth from the four major ancestry components.', N'Weathered and lined in ways that suggest age, exposure, and chronic attention to detail rather than neglect. Minimal makeup. Fuller cheekbones from South Asian heritage combined with broader bone structure from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, creating a face with both rounded warmth and structural strength. Strong jawline and defined brow bone from Northern European genetics. A small scar at the left corner of her mouth, barely visible unless she''s smiling. Her face reads as purposeful rather than decorative.', N'Retractable ceramic-composite knuckle caps visible on both hands when fingers are relaxed — they catch light with a subtle off-white sheen, slightly proud of the knuckle joints. No visible external plating, but her movements suggest subdermal armor; if her shirt rides up, faint linear scarring across her ribs indicates subdermal weave installation points. Hearing augment is not visible.', N'Stands with weight centered on the balls of her feet, not squared-off like a statue but ready. Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, no flourish. Each step is deliberate. Her gaze sweeps environments in a specific pattern. Hands are usually at rest but positioned where they can move quickly. When speaking to someone, she maintains eye contact in a way that is not aggressive but communicates that she is processing everything.', N'Tier 4 working-class practical. Standard work uniform: charcoal or black reinforced canvas pants with deep pockets and knee reinforcement, tactical-cut. Steel-toed boots (currently a pair of Volkov brand, seven years old, re-soled twice). Long-sleeved shirts in neutral colors (gray, black, dark blue) — long sleeves specifically to display the ledger on her left arm as a kind of warning or credential, depending on context. A heavy canvas overcoat in charcoal, lined with thermal webbing, worn open. No jewelry except a plain stainless steel watch that has been repaired and customized so many times it is mostly practical rather than original. Lacks corpo styling entirely; has the look of someone who spends money on function and durability, not status.', N'Fifteen years ago she broke both hands of a young man who''d been skimming — standard remediation. He lost use of his left hand permanently. She found out recently that he is now a Palladian Corporation systems tech with a family in Calumet Rise, doing fine. She does not know whether this makes what she did better or worse and she thinks about it constantly. She has donated anonymously to the Boilerplate Quarter children''s learning center every month for fifteen years in a sum that exactly matches what she calculated that young man''s wages would have been in a better economy.', N'Direct, vernacular, Yoruba-inflected rhythm under the GLMZ slang. Economical — says the necessary thing.', N'Unhurried, even when the subject is urgent. Pauses for emphasis rather than to gather thoughts.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'rowan_kulkarni');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6db-7c39-b89a-a86f3359d12e', N'Antonino Ekwensi', N'Antonino', N'', N'Ekwensi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenosha Crossing transit depot, sleeping in the secondary overflow shelter, near beyond the Western Perimeter', N'Hyperlane migrant and seasonal agricultural worker', N'Loosely affiliated with the Greenbelt Seasonal Collective, an informal network of ag workers', N'Antonino Ekwensi is built like someone who has been compressed by hard weather — short, dense, with calloused hands that crack at the knuckles in winter and never quite heal before summer comes again. Her skin is deep umber-brown and her natural hair has been shorn close to her skull on one side, the other grown out into a lopsided cloud she pins back with whatever she finds. A faded geometric tattoo in the Amharic-inflected style of the Addis agri-collectives covers her left shoulder and collarbone — she got it at seventeen when she thought she was staying. She has color-changing pupils, a cheap cosmetic mod she bought secondhand; they cycle slowly between amber and grey-green without her controlling it, which embarrasses her and amuses everyone else.

Antonino Ekwensi is methodical and difficult to rattle, which makes her seem colder than she is. She has a gift for reading weather systems — real weather, not the synthetic climate management Meridian pushes — and she sells this skill to caravan leads who want to know if the hyperlane north will ice. She prays hard to the ELF she calls the Dry Tongue, a harvest spirit she insists inhabits every broken irrigation sensor in every agricultural zone from Escanaba to the Indiana gray zone. She doesn''t talk much about where she came from but she notices everything, and the things she chooses not to say are always the most important ones.', N'Route information broker for northern hyperlane travel; can point players toward specific caravan camps, ag zones, or crossing points; provides ground-level intelligence about what is actually moving through the transit corridors.', N'', N'Cosmetic color-shifting pupils (secondhand, malfunctioning). Subcutaneous weather sensor array in her forearms — a practical mod, no-frills, lets her read barometric pressure and UV index directly.', N'Wakes before the depot lights come on, checks the hyperlane weather boards and cross-references with her own sensor readings, then hires herself out as a route consultant to small caravans staging out of Kenosha before heading north to find seasonal harvest work when the ag zones open.', N'Antonino Ekwensi, 34-year-old weather sensor technician, 158cm tall with compact, densely muscled build from agricultural labor. Deep warm golden-brown skin reflecting Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic/Latin American, and South Asian heritage. Asymmetrical black hair — shaved close on left side, right side grown long and unruly, pinned back with salvaged wire. Face lean with high defined cheekbones, strong robust jawline, prominent orbital bones, broad forehead deeply lined from years of squinting at sky and weather systems. Cosmetic color-shifting eyes cycling between amber and grey-green with visible circuitry shimmer. Weathered, sun-darkened complexion with dry, cracked skin, calluses on hands and feet, faded keloid scars on inner forearms from subdermal sensor array. Faded geometric Amharic tattoo covering left shoulder and collarbone with interlocking chevrons and harvest symbols. Dressed in faded grey patched synthetic worksuit, sand-colored canvas field jacket stained with soil and mineral residue, reinforced cargo pants, heavily resoled boots laced with wire. Plastic harvest saint icon on thin cord around neck. Standing slightly forward-bent, economical posture. GLMZ GLMZ, neon rain-slicked agricultural sector, dramatic overhead lighting catching subcutaneous sensor ports and iris mod shimmer, gritty realism, weathered worker aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenosha Crossing transit depot', N'local', N'Kenosha Crossing transit depot', N'Sub-Saharan African dominant (52.7%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (31.3%) and South Asian (16.0%) ancestry. Features reflect this tri-continental blend: rich deep brown skin tone with warm golden undertones from the combination of African earthiness, Latin American sun exposure, and South Asian pigmentation. Facial structure shows high, defined cheekbones and prominent orbital bones characteristic of South Asian and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, balanced by a strong, robust jawline and broader facial geometry from African heritage, with subtle angular refinement from Latin American mixing. A true GLMZ genetic reality — three major ancestral streams in seamless integration.', 158, 62, N'Compact and densely muscled, shaped by decades of agricultural labor. Shoulders are broad relative to frame, forearms corded with working strength. Low body fat, defined musculature in legs and core. Physical compression suggests someone built for endurance rather than speed.', N'Natural black with possible greying at roots', N'Asymmetrical — shaved close on left side (approximately 2mm), right side grown into an unruly cloud roughly 8-10cm long, often pinned back with salvaged wire, industrial clips, or whatever fastener is available', N'Short/Medium (asymmetrical)', N'Cosmetic color-shifting pupils (malfunctioning secondhand mod) — cycle slowly and involuntarily between amber and grey-green with no user control. Visible circuitry shimmer in bright light around iris', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones — rich earthiness from Sub-Saharan African heritage enhanced by Latin American sun-darkening and refined by South Asian pigmentation creating subtle luminosity. Complex, sun-weathered patina.', N'Weathered and lined beyond her 34 years from sun and wind exposure. Skin is dry, cracked at knuckles and fingertips year-round with scars that never fully heal between seasons. Calluses on palms, heel of hands, ball of foot. Face is lean with high, defined cheekbones (South Asian and African influence), strong robust jawline set in permanent mild tension, prominent orbital bones (Sub-Saharan African structure). Forehead broad and prominent.', N'Subcutaneous weather sensor array in both forearms — visible as slight subcutaneous swelling and faint circular valve ports along inner forearm (approximately 0.5cm diameter, three ports per arm). Color-shifting iris mod with visible tech shimmer in direct light. No chrome or external augmentation.', N'Stands slightly forward-bent, as if perpetually reading ground or sky. Movements are economical and deliberate — no wasted motion. Walks with weight distributed across ball of foot, ready to shift or move quickly. Holds hands loosely, fingers often flexing or pressing against forearm (checking sensor readings). Rarely makes eye contact, but when she does it''s sudden and complete. Speaks slowly with long pauses, as if each word is weather being read.', N'Tier 4-5 working class, heavily patched and layered for thermal regulation. Primary layer: faded grey synthetic worksuit with GREENBELT SEASONAL COLLECTIVE faint stencil on chest pocket (worn nearly invisible). Over this: canvas field jacket (sand-colored, stained with mineral residue and soil) with multiple pockets hand-reinforced with tape. Cargo pants in reinforced weave, pockets stuffed with worn laminated route maps and sensor calibration tools. Boots are heavily resoled, laced with wire. A thin cord around her neck holds a small plastic icon of an unidentifiable harvest saint — possibly homemade. No jewelry. All clothing shows deliberate repair rather than replacement — pragmatic tier 5 aesthetic.', N'She was expelled from the Escanaba Gateway agricultural zone three years ago — not for poor work but because she reported a foreman to the zone authority for withholding wages. The zone authority did nothing. The foreman had her access credentials revoked and blacklisted her from the formal ag network. She travels under a slightly altered name and hasn''t told the Greenbelt Collective the full story.', N'Sparse and practical. Uses agricultural and meteorological jargon naturally. Speaks three languages and intersperses them without noticing — Amharic-derived patois, standard Meridian Creole, and a clipped Polynesian-inflected trade dialect.', N'Slow and considered. Never rushes. Pauses before answering as if she is checking the pressure reading first.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'antonino_ekwensi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a698-70c9-b94e-a8708ac3ed3d', N'Banafsheh Valenzuela', N'Banafsheh', N'', N'Valenzuela', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 51, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station depot, Route 14 loop, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Ferrogate Transit bus operator, Route 14 Grainfort-Deepwell loop', N'', N'Banafsheh Valenzuela is a heavy, deliberate man with a broad forehead, close-trimmed gray beard, and the particular kind of stillness that comes from spending twenty-two years driving the same route through the same city. His skin is dark brown and weathered from the years before he got the depot job, when he worked outdoor shifts in all weather. He has no cosmetic mods and refuses them on principle, though he doesn''t lecture anyone about it. His Ferrogate uniform fits him like a second skin — he irons it himself, every morning — and his driver''s cabin is decorated with a string of hand-painted prayer beads from his Ghanaian grandmother''s tradition, a small paper icon from the Orthodox Easter tradition of his Russian grandfather''s family, and a data tablet loaded with offerings for the route''s E.L.F., which he calls ''the Conductor.''

Banafsheh Valenzuela has driven Route 14 long enough that he''s watched the neighborhoods it passes through be demolished, rebuilt, flooded, rezoned, and gentrified. He carries this history with a kind of weathered grief that is not bitterness — he has made his peace with impermanence in the abstract while remaining entirely resistant to it in the specific. He knows his regulars by name and schedule, and when they stop appearing, he notices. He is not a man who talks much, but when he does, people listen — there is a gravity to him that age and consistency have built.', N'Moving scene-setting element — can be a recurring presence across different districts as his route passes through them. Rich source of oral history about the city''s changes. Quest giver for missing persons last seen on his route. Represents organized labor''s quiet persistence.', N'', N'Ferrogate-mandated retinal display overlay for route data. That''s it — he''s refused every optional upgrade the company has offered.', N'First run at 0500, last run at 1700. Eats lunch in the depot from a container he brings from home, always the same meal on the same days. Attends transit worker mutual aid meetings on alternating Wednesdays.', N'Banafsheh Valenzuela, 183cm tall broad-shouldered transit operator with warm medium-deep brown skin blending Southeast Asian, Middle Eastern, and Hispanic heritage. Dark gray close-trimmed beard, deep-set dark brown eyes with faint amber retinal overlay glow. Immaculate Ferrogate Transit navy and light blue uniform with reflective piping, polished buttons, black work boots. Brass vintage watch on left wrist, woven prayer bead bracelet on right wrist. Pale 12cm burn scar visible on inner left forearm. Faded Adinkra symbol tattoo on right inner wrist. Upright posture, focused expression, standing in dimly-lit transit depot with overhead industrial lighting. GLMZ, gritty working-class dignity, realistic character portrait, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station depot', N'local', N'Deepwell Station depot', N'A striking genetic mosaic of Southeast Asian (29.6%), Middle Eastern (25.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (18.4%), Northern European (14.6%), East Asian (9.4%), and Sub-Saharan African (2.2%) ancestry. The blend creates a warm, complex phenotype—Southeast Asian bone structure and skin warmth layered with Middle Eastern depth, Hispanic golden undertones, and Northern European lighter notes creating subtle dimensional richness. The Sub-Saharan contribution adds depth to his warm browns. A true product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 183, 98, N'Heavy-set and broad-shouldered, with the solid mass of a man who has done physical labor for decades. Not fat — dense. Chest wide, neck thick, hands large and calloused.', N'Dark gray with black undertones', N'Close-trimmed, neat, parted slightly to the left', N'Short', N'Dark brown, natural — subtle green light reflection from retinal overlay when active', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden-olive undertones, sun-darkened from pre-depot outdoor work. The tone is a harmonious blend of Southeast Asian warmth, Middle Eastern richness, Hispanic golden hues, with Northern European genetics creating subtle luminosity beneath the surface. Sub-Saharan ancestry contributes depth and warmth to the overall palette.', N'Broad forehead with bone structure reflecting Southeast Asian and Middle Eastern heritage—moderate cheekbone prominence with warmth from Hispanic ancestry, balanced by the defined architectural quality of Middle Eastern lineage. The face carries width and presence across the cheekbones and jaw, with the subtle warmth of Southeast Asian skin quality. Close-trimmed gray beard kept clean and even, deep-set eyes. Skin lined but not sagging — the result of time and weather rather than neglect. A few sun spots on the temples. Expression default: focused, attentive.', N'Ferrogate-standard retinal display overlay — faint amber LED glow visible in the pupils under certain light angles, especially in dim depot lighting. No other visible mods. Wears a small company ID pin on his uniform collar.', N'Upright, deliberate, economical in gesture. Moves with the slow certainty of someone who has spent decades in confined spaces and knows every inch of his territory. Stands still when listening — no fidgeting. Hands at rest or engaged in purposeful tasks; never idle.', N'Ferrogate Transit regulation uniform (dark navy base layer, lighter blue overshirt with reflective piping, company logo centered on chest). Uniform is immaculately maintained — creases sharp, fabric lint-free, buttons polished. Black work boots, well-worn but clean. Wears a simple analog watch (brass, vintage-style) on left wrist alongside the ID badge on a lanyard. A woven cord bracelet — prayer beads from his grandmother — visible on right wrist. Tier 4 working-class grooming: functional, dignified, no affectation.', N'Eighteen months ago he saw a Ferrogate Transit security officer force a teenager off the bus and into a waiting vehicle at the Deepwell stop — not a police vehicle. He filed an internal report. The report doesn''t exist anymore. He kept a copy.', N'Formal but warm; uses full sentences where others use fragments; occasional Akan turns of phrase from his grandmother''s Twi', N'Slow and even, like a man who has nowhere to be until the next stop', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'banafsheh_valenzuela');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a688-78a0-8f9b-a8722c9dad81', N'Bayo Thammasak', N'Bayo', N'', N'Thammasak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor (primary), The Circuit (work), near Michigan Ave and Roosevelt', N'Street-level information broker / Unofficial district archivist', N'Unaffiliated (deliberately and carefully maintains no formal allegiances); The Interchange', N'Bayo Thammasak is nineteen years old and looks sixteen and has survived this discrepancy by being faster than people expect and more useful than people intend. He is slight, pale-skinned with a spray of freckles across dark circles, with hair that grows in three directions regardless of what he does to it. He moves through Old Harbor like a person who has memorized every exit, which he has—not as a paranoid exercise but as an intellectual one. He maps things. Streets, social networks, grudge lines, debt relationships, who owes what to whom and who is lying about it. He sells this information in small, carefully portioned pieces to people who don''t know how much of the whole picture he''s already holding.

Orvyn grew up in the informal settlement layers of Old Harbor, raised by an older sister who left when he was twelve and a rotating cast of neighbors who fed him when they remembered to. He is not bitter about this. He is, in a way that sometimes unnerves people who probe it, genuinely cheerful—a relentless, low-grade delight in the texture of information itself, in the way a rumor travels and changes, in the gap between what people say and what the map of their behavior reveals. He keeps physical notebooks filled with hand-drawn cartography: not just geography but social topology, annotated in a cramped personal shorthand no one else can read.

He operates out of a specific corner booth in a noodle shop called Haecht''s in Old Harbor, where he has an informal arrangement with the owner, and from a secondary position near the transit interchange in The Circuit where he sells low-grade data to mid-tier runners and fixers. He has no bodyguard, no crew, no weapon beyond a short blade he has used exactly once. His protection is that he knows too much about too many people for any single actor to find his disappearance profitable, and he has made sure that enough of them know this.', N'Orvyn functions as a connective tissue character and an audience surrogate for the world''s architecture—someone whose role is to reveal how systems interconnect. He also carries the emotional counterweight of cheerful survival against actual loneliness, and his youth positions him as a character the city has not yet finished forming.', N'', N'Basic optical enhancement with zoom and low-light capability (secondhand, partially glitching—sometimes activates involuntarily in bright light),No neural augmentations by deliberate choice—he doesn''t trust anything in his head that he didn''t put there', N'Wakes irregularly, eats whatever Haecht''s is serving, spends mornings updating his notebooks with overnight observations. Midday transit to The Circuit for client meetings. Afternoons wandering with no apparent destination, which is when most of his actual observation happens. Evenings back at Haecht''s or moving through Old Harbor''s informal social spaces. Sleeps in a rented room above a repair shop whose owner he has protected twice through strategic information releases.', N'Bayo Thammasak, 2226 neo-noir character, 168cm wiry build, Southeast Asian-dominant mixed heritage with warm medium-toned golden-undertoned skin, defined cheekbones, fuller lips, slightly broader nose base. Youthful face with deep dark circles, faint freckles across nose and cheekbones. Left eye warm brown, right eye glitching cybernetic replacement with amber-to-cyan LED ring, visible orbital seam, scratched lens. Mousy brown reddish-tinted medium shoulder-length hair unkempt and chaotic. White scar on right forearm near wrist, black cartographic tattoo inside left wrist. Wearing faded band tee undershirt, loose-fitting dark cargo pants with excessive pockets, worn gray synthetic jacket, practical walking boots resoled multiple times. Sitting sideways in chair scanning surroundings with alert posture, hands fidgeting, no jewelry, Tier 4 working-class aesthetic. Indoor neon-lit setting with moody neo-noir atmosphere, slight sensory overload suggested by eye-twitch tension. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor (primary)', N'local', N'Old Harbor (primary)', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (66.1%) with significant East Asian (12.3%), Middle Eastern (12.9%), and Sub-Saharan African (8.2%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates warm medium-toned skin with golden undertones, facial structure reflecting the Southeast Asian and East Asian majority combined with Sub-Saharan African features—defined cheekbones, fuller lips, slightly broader nose base characteristic of the blend.', 168, 58, N'Wiry and slight, almost adolescent-thin with minimal muscle definition. Moves with economical precision—no wasted motion, shoulders slightly hunched as if perpetually ready to slip through a gap', N'Mousy brown with reddish undertones', N'Deliberately unkempt, grows in three distinct directions regardless of intervention. Often falls across one eye', N'Medium (shoulder-length, though the chaotic growth pattern makes length deceptive)', N'Left eye: warm brown (natural); Right eye: cybernetic with faint LED ring around pupil (secondhand optical unit, occasionally glitches to bright cyan activation)', N'Medium-warm with golden undertones, displaying the rich depth of Southeast Asian and East Asian heritage blended with Sub-Saharan African warmth beneath a sun-deprived indoor pallor.', N'Youthful but worn. Deep dark circles under both eyes suggesting chronic sleep irregularity. Faint constellation of freckles across bridge of nose and cheekbones blending with natural skin variation. Skin has the papery quality of someone malnourished in childhood, now stable but not thriving. Clean but not fastidious—no acne, good hygiene maintained out of practical necessity rather than vanity. Facial structure reflects Southeast Asian, East Asian, and Sub-Saharan features: defined cheekbones, slightly broader nose base, full lips.', N'Right eye replacement with visible seam at orbital socket, faint LED ring around pupil that cycles amber-to-cyan when active or malfunctioning. The optical unit shows wear—scratched lens, slight cosmetic misalignment suggesting budget repair history. No other visible chrome; all augmentation confined to optical replacement', N'Moves with unusual fluidity for his age—gliding rather than walking, shoulders loose but spine alert. Sits sideways in chairs to maintain sightline of exits. Hands are rarely still; fidgets with pen, notebook spine, or the edge of whatever surface is available. Eyes scan constantly, cataloging. When speaking, maintains deliberate eye contact despite slight self-consciousness about the glitching eye', N'Tier 4 (working class, with deliberate anti-status signaling). Favors loose-fitting dark cargo pants with excessive pockets (function over style), worn synthetic fiber jackets in grays or blacks. Undershirts are faded band tees or salvaged corporate promotional wear. Shoes are practical and worn—walking boots resoled multiple times. No jewelry except the wrist tattoo. Clothes are clean but deliberately unmemorable; he owns perhaps four outfits in rotation. No visible QUANTA-sponsored branding; actively avoids corpo-aesthetic', N'He has a nearly complete map of Synclaire Financial''s debt network in the Gray Zone and Old Harbor—more comprehensive than anything their internal systems hold. He hasn''t sold it because he doesn''t yet know what it''s worth, and because something in the pattern frightens him in a way he hasn''t been able to annotate yet.', N'Street vernacular mixed with oddly precise technical terminology, frequent analogies drawn from cartography and architecture, runs sentences together when excited', N'Fast, light, with sudden full stops when he hits something important—like a person walking quickly who occasionally freezes to look at something on the ground', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bayo_thammasak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a0-7dd6-88e7-a8cdee1e85c9', N'Akosua Johansson', N'Akosua', N'', N'Johansson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 30, 5, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Halsted and Division', N'Fixer - Independent fixer', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Portrait of Akosua Johansson, 168cm lean angular woman, warm deep brown skin with golden amber undertones, steel grey short undercut with silver braids, dark brown eyes with gold capillary patterns. Lined face with defined cheekbones and strong jaw, faint temple-to-cheekbone scar, laugh lines, no cosmetic enhancement. Tier 3-4 professional style: charcoal tactical jacket over cream base layer, dark reinforced trousers, black broken-in boots, platinum widow''s ring, subtle chronometer wrist unit. Economical posture, grounded stance, controlled presence. GLMZ GLMZ, dim neon ambient lighting, cool-warm contrast on weathered features, cinematic depth, commanding but understated intensity. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex multiethnic phenotype from Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: 44.4% Northern European foundation providing angular bone structure and fair undertones, combined with 24.2% Hispanic/Latin American ancestry contributing warm golden skin and fuller facial features, 13.2% South Asian ancestry adding fine facial definition and warmth depth, 7.4% Eastern European ancestry strengthening jawline and cheekbone prominence, 6.5% Southeast Asian ancestry softening features with subtle eye shape influence, and 4.3% Middle Eastern ancestry adding warmth to complexion. The genetic intersection creates a warm medium-to-deep brown skin tone with golden and amber undertones, characteristic of Northern European-Hispanic-South Asian admixture with Eastern European and Southeast Asian refinement.', 168, 62, N'Lean and angular, with the wiry musculature of someone who stays active despite age. Shoulders held with practiced ease—the posture of someone used to command.', N'Steel grey with dark undertones', N'Short, professionally maintained undercut with subtle silver threading braided into the sides', N'Short', N'Dark brown with fine network of gold capillaries—likely subdermal neural integration', N'Warm deep brown with golden and amber undertones, sun-weathered to rich patina showing decades in the GLMZ. Rich medium-brown base with warm golden and amber undertones reflecting the harmonious blend of Northern European fairness warmed by Hispanic/Latin American, South Asian, and Middle Eastern ancestry, deepened and refined by Eastern European and Southeast Asian influence.', N'Lined face that maps decades of high-stakes negotiation. Bone structure shows angular prominence from Northern European and Eastern European ancestry, softened and warmed by Hispanic/Latin American fuller facial features and South Asian delicate definition, with subtle Southeast Asian refinement around the eyes and cheekbones. Cheekbones are defined; jaw is strong and squared. Facial features reflect the warm-toned complexity of her multiethnic heritage—golden-brown undertones throughout, eyes with slightly deeper-set character from South Asian influence, fuller lips with warm tone from Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Laugh lines dominate; frown lines are minimal. Skin clear but textured. No cosmetic smoothing—she wears her age as currency.', N'None immediately obvious. Possible subcutaneous neural integration suggested by eye capillary patterns. Hands show no chrome—all augmentations appear internal or minimalist.', N'Moves with economical precision. Sits with spine straight, often with one hand visible and the other beneath the table. Eyes constantly cataloging exits, threats, opportunities. Speaks slowly—each word weighted. Rarely fidgets. When standing, she grounds herself with one foot forward, balanced for quick movement.', N'Tier 3-4 practical elegance. Charcoal tactical shell jacket over a fitted cream or grey base layer, quality synthetic that breathes. Dark trousers with reinforced knees and discrete cargo pockets. Black boots—practical, expensive, broken in. Minimal jewelry: a thin platinum band on her left ring finger (widow''s rings are currency in fixer circles) and a small chronometer wrist unit. Everything is designed for function and subtlety—nothing shouts wealth, but nothing screams poverty either. Her clothes are tools.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'akosua_johansson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a673-76f4-bfb9-a931dde778ab', N'Guanglei Hossain-Kulkarni', N'Guanglei', N'', N'Hossain-Kulkarni', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Pilsen Veil, rotating between a shared squat above a protein noodle stall and whatever venue will have him, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Stand-up comedian and underground spoken word performer, Tier 1', N'No formal affiliation; loosely connected to the Pilsen Veil underground comedy circuit', N'Guanglei Hossain-Kulkarni is lean and restless, built like someone who burns through calories via nervous energy rather than exercise. His Yoruba-Polish-Azerbaijani ancestry gives him a face of striking contradictions — high Slavic cheekbones, the warm brown skin and broad nose of his father''s Lagos line, and his Azerbaijani grandmother''s dramatically hooded eyes that he''s chosen to highlight with geneware iris mods that shift through patterns of concentric gold rings when he''s performing. His hair is kept very short on the sides and erupts into a soft irregular cloud on top, usually unwashed. He dresses in layers of secondhand everything — three collars, mismatched sleeves — that somehow cohere into something that reads as intentional.

He is one of the fastest talkers in Pilsen Veil and possibly the most dangerous, because he deploys his speed to bury the sharpest observations inside barrages of absurdity before anyone can quite register they''ve been cut. He performs at whatever unlicensed venue will book him — back rooms, open drain channels with an audience of forty, once the cargo bay of a stationary Ferrogate car. His material cycles obsessively through class anxiety, the theater of corponation loyalty, and the specific humiliations of being young and broke in a city that sells young and broke as aesthetic. He is genuinely funny. He is also genuinely angry, and the seam between the two is where his best work lives.', N'Local color and social barometer — Femi''s material reflects the current tensions and grievances of Pilsen Veil''s underclass with high accuracy. Useful as an information source about neighborhood mood and underground venue networks. Can be a quest giver when his material inadvertently gets him into trouble.', N'', N'Geneware iris mod (concentric gold ring pattern, activates under performance adrenaline). Subdermal rhythm implant in right forearm — a secondhand unit meant for musicians that he uses to feel his own heartbeat amplified during sets.', N'Wakes late, spends mornings writing material in a battered voice-recorder journal he refuses to upgrade. Afternoons are spent doing odd delivery work through a gig platform to cover food costs. Performs most nights if booked, or haunts other performers'' sets if not.', N'GLMZ portrait of Guanglei Hossain-Kulkarni, 174cm lean wiry performer with restless kinetic energy. Deep luminous brown skin with warm golden undertones, blend of South Asian, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan heritage. Dark brown hair with premature graying, undercut fade style with soft unkempt crown. Warm deep brown eyes with active geneware iris modification showing concentric shifting gold rings. High prominent cheekbones, broad expressive nose, full lips, strong jaw, faint scar on right jaw in certain light. Nervous energy radiating from shoulders and hands. Half-smile, eyes wide and scanning. Wearing intentional chaos layering: vintage band tee, partially unbuttoned overshirt, mismatched sleeves (denim, synthetic mesh, linen), loose cargo pants, worn gig-worker boots, oversized faded jacket with pins and patches. Frayed wristband, borrowed chronometer. Hands already moving ahead of words. Standing in tight concert venue lighting, neon glow catching the gold shimmer in his modified irises. Urban grit backdrop, late-night performance ready. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Pilsen Veil', N'local', N'Pilsen Veil', N'Predominantly South Asian (78.8%) with significant Southeast Asian (13.4%) and Sub-Saharan African (7.8%) ancestry. This creates a striking phenotype: deep warm brown skin with golden undertones characteristic of South Asian complexions, enriched by the warmer, slightly more amber tones from Southeast Asian ancestry and the deeper richness from African heritage. The blend produces luminous, sun-lived skin with exceptional depth and warmth.', 174, 62, N'Lean and wiry, all restless kinetic energy. Narrow shoulders that seem to vibrate slightly even at rest. The kind of body that suggests perpetual motion rather than strength.', N'Dark brown, natural with occasional premature graying at the temples', N'Undercut fade — shaved close on sides and back, erupting into a soft, irregular 5-8cm cloud on top, deliberately unkempt', N'Short on sides, medium-long on crown', N'Warm deep brown (base), modified with active geneware iris pattern of concentric gold rings that shimmer and shift during performance states', N'Deep luminous brown with warm golden undertones. The South Asian base (78.8%) provides the foundational warm richness, enhanced by Southeast Asian amber warmth (13.4%) and deepened by Sub-Saharan depth (7.8%). Sun-lived and alive with latent energy.', N'High, prominent cheekbones balanced by a broad, expressive nose and full lips characteristic of South Asian-Southeast Asian blending. Face is broad with strong jaw. Skin shows the wear of late nights and inconsistent hydration — slight tension around the eyes, a few premature lines radiating from the corners of his mouth. Clean-shaven or sporting a day or two of scruff depending on venue availability. The eye shape carries sharp, cutting intensity. African ancestry contributes subtle breadth and warmth to facial structure.', N'The only immediately visible augmentation is his iris modification — the concentric gold ring pattern becomes spectacularly active during performance, cycling and shifting in response to adrenaline. The subdermal rhythm implant is not externally visible but creates a subtle pulsing beneath the skin of his right forearm if observed closely during intense concentration. No visible chrome, no cybernetic limbs.', N'Constantly in motion even when still — weight shifting from foot to foot, fingers tapping, shoulders rolling. When speaking, his hands are always already moving, ahead of his mouth. He has the nervous energy of someone who''s learned to weaponize his inability to stand still. His default expression is a half-smile, eyes wide and scanning. Moves through space with the precision of someone used to small venues and tight crowds — economical, angular, weaving.', N'Intentional chaos dressed as accident. Layers of secondhand everything: vintage band tees under partially unbuttoned overshirts, three visible collars at once, mismatched sleeves of different fabrics (one worn denim, one synthetic mesh, one linen). Pants are usually loose-fitted cargo or vintage tech-weave, pockets loaded with crumpled notes and voice recorder modules. Shoes are worn but functional — affordable gig-worker boots that can handle city''s broken streets. A faded, oversized jacket that might have been corporate-issue once, now bearing a constellation of small pins and hand-stitched patches from venues and collectives. Accessories are minimal but deliberate: a frayed wristband in crew colors, a borrowed chronometer he keeps forgetting to return. Everything worn just slightly inside-out or backwards, a visual manifestation of his material''s logic.', N'A Ringo talent scout offered him a legitimate contract six months ago — a small comedy streaming platform, decent money, creative approval clauses. He turned it down and told no one. He is not entirely sure why, and the uncertainty terrifies him.', N'Rapid-fire, code-switches fluidly between street Pilsen slang, fragments of Yoruba honorifics used ironically, and unexpectedly precise vocabulary when making a specific point. Uses corporate jargon as mockery.', N'Extremely fast baseline, punctuated by sudden total stops for effect. The pauses are the punchlines.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'guanglei_hossain_kulkarni');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a644-79b0-9032-a9ab3f8e6bcf', N'Flavia Sigurdsson-Morimoto', N'Flavia', N'', N'Sigurdsson-Morimoto', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Stockyard — runs routes between the Geartown transit hub and the southern Stockyard processing yards, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Numbers runner and bookmaker''s courier for the Stockyard gambling networks', N'Works for Dzintars Mbaya-Ferenczi''s independent bookmaking operation — loosely affiliated with the Stockyard Compact, a loose protection arrangement between the area''s mid-level criminal operations; The Last Mile', N'Flavia Sigurdsson-Morimoto is nineteen years old and built like someone whose body is still negotiating its final dimensions — tall, a little loose in the joints, with the nervous energy of a person who has never in his life sat still for more than ten minutes voluntarily. His skin is a warm medium brown and he has geneware cat ears in a tawny orange that he got at sixteen with three months of saved courier income — they swivel when he''s startled or excited, which is often. His hair is close-cropped on the sides and grows in a short natural taper on top. He moves through the Stockyard with the casual speed of someone who grew up learning which streets flow and which ones snag.

Kojo is sharp, quick, and has not yet fully processed that the work he does is dangerous. He has the operational competence of someone who''s been running numbers since he was fourteen and the emotional development of someone who has never left a ten-block radius of the Stockyard in his life. He is loyal to his bookmaker — a woman named Dzintars Mbaya-Ferenczi who he calls ''the Operator'' — with the uncomplicated devotion of a kid who needed a job and got one. He is also, quietly, very good at math, and has begun to understand the numbers he carries in ways that make Dzintars both pleased and slightly watchful.', N'Local color and street-level information source — he knows everything happening in his ten-block world in extraordinary detail. Can function as a reluctant errand-boy for characters who need someone who knows the Stockyard''s rhythms. His emerging numerical sophistication is a ticking clock.', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (tawny orange, cosmetic). A basic reflex-assist implant in his legs that marginally improves his running speed and stumble-recovery — he got this at cost from a Shallowgrave dealer and it''s not quite calibrated right, giving him an occasional slight hitch in his left stride.', N'He picks up his route sheets from a drop location at 0700, runs collection and delivery circuits through the Stockyard and into Geartown until 1800, returns to report to Dzintars, and spends evenings at a youth gambling den called the Back Tooth where he is technically working (observing, listening) but mostly just playing.', N'Flavia Sigurdsson-Morimoto, 185cm tall lean androgynous courier, rich warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones reflecting East Asian, Southeast Asian, and African heritage. Angular youthful face with high pronounced cheekbones, darker brown eyes, broader nasal base, fuller lips, clean-shaven. Natural dark brown hair in close-cropped fade with 4-5cm natural taper on top. Tawny orange geneware cat ears with visible wear, implanted at skull base, swiveling with tension. Wearing matte charcoal tactical jacket over synthetic base layer, reinforced cargo pants, scuffed composite runners. Refurbished neural-link wrist display, thin silver chain necklace. Slight nervous energy visible, hands fidgeting, forward-leaning posture with weight on balls of feet. Fine white scar across right hand knuckles, faint acne scarring on shoulders. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone street-level courier, neon urban lighting casting shadows across genetically mosaic features, restless coiled tension, cinematic mood lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Stockyard', N'local', N'The Stockyard', N'A striking genetic mosaic of the Ubiquitous Diaspora: predominantly East Asian (54.6%) with substantial Southeast Asian (22.6%), Sub-Saharan African (9.9%), and Hispanic/Latin American (7.3%) ancestry, completed by traces of Eastern European and Middle Eastern heritage. His features synthesize this global blend seamlessly—East Asian bone structure with pronounced cheekbones and eye shape, combined with broader nasal passages and fuller lips from African ancestry, enriched by Southeast Asian softness in facial proportions and Hispanic/Latin warmth in overall character. The result is a face that belongs to no single tradition but eloquently to all of them.', 185, 68, N'Tall and lean with still-lengthening limbs, narrow shoulders that haven''t filled out yet, the unfinished geometry of late adolescence — long-muscled and quick rather than powerful', N'Natural dark brown', N'Close-cropped fade on sides, natural taper growing 4-5cm on top, meticulously maintained', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Rich warm medium brown with golden luminosity—a complex interplay of East Asian, Southeast Asian, and African heritage creating depth and subtle radiance. The tone carries warmth across its full spectrum, neither cool nor hot but dynamically balanced, glowing distinctly under urban neon and natural light alike.', N'Clean-shaven, clear skin with faint scar tissue of acne at shoulders and upper back. Youthful angular face with high pronounced cheekbones reflecting East Asian ancestry, broader nasal base and fuller lips from African and Southeast Asian heritage, alert bright expression with visible nervous energy even at rest. Facial geometry shows the harmonious blend of multiple continental traditions in balanced proportion.', N'Tawny orange geneware cat ears that swivel noticeably with emotional response. A slight hitch in his left stride under sustained movement, particularly when accelerating — characteristic of a poorly-calibrated reflex-assist implant in the left leg. No visible chrome or subdermal plating.', N'Perpetually forward-leaning, weight on the balls of his feet even when standing still. Moves with practiced speed and efficiency through familiar territory, but with a restlessness that suggests coiled tension. Hands are rarely still — fidgeting, gesturing, checking pockets. When startled or excited, his ears twitch and rotate sharply. His gait has a near-imperceptible catch in the left leg during quick acceleration.', N'Tier 3-4 working street wear: lightweight tactical-cut jacket in matte charcoal or rust grey over fitted synthetic base layers, cargo pants with reinforced seams and thigh pockets for route sheets and payment drops, scuffed composite runner shoes with good grip. No visible corp branding. A cheap neural-link wrist display (refurbished Shallowgrave model) showing odds and route data. Thin silver chain around his neck, probably a charm or talisman. Clothing shows regular wear and mending but is kept functional and clean — the appearance of someone who respects his work without vanity.', N'He has been quietly memorizing and mentally retaining the betting patterns he runs — not skimming, not yet, but building a mental model of the operation that he hasn''t decided what to do with yet', N'Dense Stockyard slang, fast, with a tendency to math-speak when excited — drops into talking about probability and odds as naturally as weather', N'Fast, skipping, sentences often incomplete because he assumes you''re keeping up. Slows dramatically when he''s scared or serious, which makes the contrast alarming.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'flavia_sigurdsson_morimoto');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a4-7fdf-9b46-a9d6fbe1a9ba', N'Ardeshir Holm-Venkatesh-Hernández', N'Ardeshir', N'', N'Holm-Venkatesh-Hernández', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave — basement unit beneath the Tivka-Roost residential stack, Calloway Sub-Level 2, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Laundry operator, runs a basement wet-wash shop in Hamtramck Enclave', N'Independent; informal community elder in Hamtramck Enclave; The Coffin Nails', N'Ardeshir Holm-Venkatesh-Hernández is a broad-shouldered woman whose hands are permanently reddened and faintly swollen from decades of hot water and industrial detergent — she calls them her ''honest hands'' and displays them without self-consciousness. Her dark brown skin has a faint steam-softened quality around the jaw and cheeks, and her natural hair is wrapped in a perpetually damp indigo cloth. She has no cosmetic geneware, only a single practical augmentation: a thermal sensor strip embedded along her left forearm so she can gauge water temperature by touch. A small shrine to the E.L.F. she calls Sudsmother sits on a gray zone above the agitators — a cracked porcelain bowl filled with soap slivers and the occasional data chip — and she pauses every morning to address it before opening.

Ardeshir Holm-Venkatesh-Hernández is unhurried in a way that reads as confidence to some and stubbornness to others. She has raised three children in the enclave, buried one husband, and outlasted two landlords. She knows every tenant in the stack by their clothing habits — who bleeds, who weeps, who spends money they don''t have on fabric they can''t maintain — and she keeps all of it filed away with the careful discretion of a confessor. She is warm but not soft. Compliments cost her nothing; charity costs her something, and she gives it anyway.', N'Community anchor and information node — she knows everyone''s laundry and, by extension, everyone''s secrets. Quest giver for neighborhood-level problems, provider of safe harbor, moral compass character.', N'', N'Thermal sensor strip, left forearm (utility). No cosmetic mods.', N'Opens at 05:30, takes drop-offs until noon, runs machines through the afternoon, folds and returns in the evening. Eats dinner at the counter with whoever is waiting for their load.', N'Ardeshir Holm-Venkatesh-Hernández, 58-year-old woman with deep warm brown skin blending South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, Northern European, and Latin American heritage. Broad-shouldered, substantial build from decades of industrial laundry work. Face shows dignified aging with fine lines, perpetual flush from steam exposure. Distinctive bone structure: broad East Asian-South Asian cheekbones, defined Northern European jaw, integrated global facial geometry. Naturally thick dark brown locks with silver at temples, wrapped in indigo cloth. Deep warm-brown eyes, direct calm gaze. Hands reddened and swollen from caustic work, showing prominent knuckles and slight thermal sensor strip visible on inner left forearm. Wearing faded indigo apron over thermal undershirt with pushed-up sleeves, dark grey reinforced canvas pants, industrial slip-resistant clogs. Small worn gold wedding band, silver pendant of E.L.F. Sudsmother on leather cord. Standing at counter edge in steamy laundry workspace, surrounded by damp fabric and industrial equipment. Weathered steam-darkened skin with luminous depth. Unhurried posture, hands at rest on counter. Warm industrial lighting from overhead fixtures reflecting off wet surfaces. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, Tier 4 working-class aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'A striking global blend: Northern European (34.0%), East Asian (23.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (20.8%), South Asian (16.3%), and Sub-Saharan African (5.7%). Her bone structure reflects this five-continent convergence — Northern European width in jaw and brow ridge combines with East Asian and South Asian eye shape and cheekbone prominence. Her skin tone is deep warm brown with complex luminous undertones: the richness of South Asian and Sub-Saharan melanin creates the foundation, while East Asian, Northern European, and Latin American ancestry contribute subtle golden and warm undertones that emerge in certain light. Her overall facial geometry speaks to unexpected global convergence, with a balanced integration of angular and rounded features across all ancestry groups.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial, with the dense musculature of someone who has spent decades lifting wet fabric and moving industrial loads. Not fat — settled weight from years of steady work and living.', N'Natural dark brown with silver threading at the temples', N'Wrapped in a perpetually damp indigo cloth, secured with practical pins. When unwrapped, worn in thick natural locks pulled close to the scalp.', N'Medium (shoulder-length beneath wrapping)', N'Deep brown, slightly warm-toned', N'Deep warm brown — a complex luminous blend of South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, Northern European, and Hispanic/Latin American undertones. Surface texture softened and slightly darkened by decades of steam exposure, creating a weathered patina that speaks to her labor.', N'Face shows the wear of 58 years with dignity — fine lines around the eyes and mouth, jaw softened by steam and age, cheeks with a perpetual faint flush from heat work. The underlying bone structure reflects her global mixed heritage: broad cheekbones with East Asian-South Asian width, defined jaw with Northern European prominence, subtle Latin American softness in the lower face, and overall facial geometry that integrates five continents. Skin is clean and well-maintained despite the demanding environment. Expression defaults to calm assessment.', N'Thermal sensor strip along left forearm — a faint silvery line under the skin, only truly visible when light catches it at an angle or when she submerges her arm in water and the sensor briefly illuminates. No cosmetic augmentations. The modification is utilitarian and unadorned.', N'Unhurried and grounded — she moves with the economy of someone who has optimized every gesture over decades. Her shoulders are slightly forward from leaning over wash tubs. She has a habit of resting her forearms on the counter edge, displaying her hands without defensiveness. Her gaze is direct and patient; she rarely seems rushed even when the shop is full. Her hands move with practiced precision when handling fabric.', N'Tier 4 working-class practicality. Wears a faded but clean indigo apron (the same color as her hair wrap — not accidental) over a layered cotton base (long-sleeved, thermal undershirt visible at the cuffs). The sleeves are pushed up past her elbows during work hours. Her pants are reinforced canvas, dark grey, with utility pockets. Footwear is industrial slip-resistant clog-style shoes, scuffed from daily water exposure. In colder months, a thick knit cardigan in dark grey or brown. A small silver pendant (a representation of the E.L.F. Sudsmother) hangs from a leather cord around her neck — worn, personal, not fashionable.', N'She has been quietly laundering — in both senses — income for a small rotating-credit cooperative that operates outside Axiom''s microfinance surveillance. She skims nothing; she does it because someone has to.', N'Practical and warm, Akan proverb structure applied to everyday observations, occasional Ukrainian loanwords inherited from her late husband''s family', N'Slow and deliberate, rarely raises her voice, statements land like they''ve already been decided', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ardeshir_holm_venkatesh_hern_ndez');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a727-7e03-bfe3-a9dd50bf1053', N'Kalani Sefanaia', N'Kalani', N'', N'Sefanaia', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Gravesend Basin — she operates from a converted barge-office called the Saltbox, moored at Pier 7-C, near Wacker and State', N'Loan shark and debt collector operating out of Gravesend Basin', N'Independent operator with informal tribute arrangements to the Gravesend Basin protection network', N'Kalani Sefanaia is a broad-shouldered woman whose posture conveys the absolute certainty that she will outlast everyone in any given room. Her skin is deep umber and her hair has been geneware-treated to hold a permanent silver-white that she wears pulled tight to her skull — no styling, no vanity, just function. A thin horizontal scar runs beneath her left eye, faded but deliberate. She dresses in water-resistant industrial layers even indoors, always smelling faintly of lake brine and the cedar-smoke incense she burns for the E.L.F. she calls ''the Creditor'' — a digital spirit she believes inhabits her accounting tablet and blesses debts that will be repaid.

She is not a violent woman by preference, but she employs two enforcers precisely so she can remain calm when others are not. Yetunde speaks in measured, affectless sentences and has a habit of writing numbers in a physical ledger with a real ink stylus while people talk to her, which most find deeply unsettling. She genuinely believes she provides a community service — institutional credit is inaccessible to Tier 1 and 2 residents, and she fills that gap. The fact that her interest rates are predatory and her consequences severe is, to her, simply the cost of doing business in a city that offers no alternatives.', N'Quest giver for characters who need quick capital with strings attached; source of financial information about who owes whom in Gravesend Basin; moral pressure point — she''s not wrong that she fills a real gap, but her methods destroy lives.', N'', N'Subdermal transaction nodes in both palms — allows her to conduct credit transfers and biometric debt-binding without external hardware. Mild retinal overlay for real-time interest calculation. No cosmetic mods.', N'She wakes before dawn, reviews overnight payment statuses, performs a brief data-offering ritual at her accounting tablet, then holds ''office hours'' from 0800-1400 where residents come to negotiate loans or payment plans. Afternoons are reserved for collections calls and meetings with her enforcers.', N'A 178cm woman of Pacific Islander, South Asian, and mixed African heritage, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, silver-white cropped hair pulled tight, dark eyes with subtle amber retinal overlay glint. Weathered sun-etched face with strong cheekbones, defined jawline, broad nose. Faint 8cm horizontal scar beneath left eye. Broad-shouldered muscular build, substantial without softness. Wearing gray and black water-resistant industrial cargo vest and reinforced synthetic shirt, outdoors on a Great Lakes dock at dusk, GLMZ, cool blue-gray lighting reflecting off water, holding a physical leather ledger and ink stylus, posture absolutely certain and deliberate, direct gaze, minimal visible cybernetics, faint smell of lake brine and cedar smoke, functional strength, no wasted motion --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gravesend Basin', N'local', N'Gravesend Basin', N'Pacific Islander (52.2%), South Asian (18.6%), Eastern European (9.9%), Sub-Saharan African (9.4%), North African (5.2%), Northern European (4.7%) — a diaspora blend centered in Pacific Islander ancestry with substantial South Asian admixture, resulting in deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, facial structure reflecting the convergence of Pacific Islander and South Asian features with secondary African bone structure, and phenotypic features that resist simple categorization', 178, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial without softness — muscular across the back and upper arms, suggesting decades of physical labor or deliberate conditioning. Her frame conveys functional strength rather than aesthetic bulk.', N'Silver-white (geneware-treated permanent modification)', N'Pulled tight to the skull in a severe, functional style — no braids, no ornament, no deviation', N'Short (approximately 2-3 cm)', N'Dark brown with faint retinal overlay (subtle amber shimmer visible only in direct light)', N'Deep warm brown — rich umber with golden undertones reflecting Pacific Islander and South Asian ancestry, darker in complexion with the warmth characteristic of combined tropical and subtropical heritage', N'Weathered and lined around the eyes with the sun-etched texture of someone who works outdoors; strong cheekbones and defined jawline reflecting Pacific Islander and South Asian bone structure; broad nose with subtle flare at the nostrils characteristic of the ancestry blend; minimal grooming beyond cleanliness; the faded horizontal scar beneath her left eye is the dominant facial feature — thin, deliberate, and approximately 8 cm in length', N'Minimal visible cybernetics — the subdermal nodes in her palms are barely perceptible as faint circular impressions. The retinal overlay produces an amber shimmer in her eyes under direct light but is otherwise unobtrusive. No chrome, no cosmetic modifications.', N'Sits and stands with absolute postural certainty — shoulders back, spine straight, head level. Moves deliberately and economically, no wasted motion. Maintains direct eye contact. Her hands are steady and deliberate, often occupied with physical ledger-writing. Overall impression of someone who has no doubt she will outlast the room.', N'Water-resistant industrial layers worn indoors and outdoors — heavy-duty synthetic fabrics in grays, blacks, and deep blues. Appears to favor cargo vests, reinforced shirts, and water-shedding outer shells consistent with dock work or maritime environments. Tier 3-4 utilitarian aesthetic — function over presentation, but maintained with precision. No logos or branded wear. Always carries a physical ledger and real ink stylus. Faint persistent smell of lake brine and cedar-smoke incense.', N'She is quietly forgiving the debts of three families whose children she knew before a Ferrogate Transit accident killed several Basin residents eight years ago — she knew those families before she became ''the Ledger'' and can''t bring herself to collect from them, but can''t admit to softness', N'Formal, precise, financial terminology mixed with Basin slang when she wants to signal she''s one of them', N'Slow and deliberate, with long pauses after questions — she waits for people to fill silence and considers what they fill it with', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'kalani_sefanaia');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a649-73d6-a7e6-a9f6f75fc6e3', N'Haruka Soriano-Sigurdsson-Larsdóttir', N'Haruka', N'', N'Soriano-Sigurdsson-Larsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 46, NULL, 25, 2, N'active', N'The Narrows, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Fixer - Iron Lotus triad', N'Tessera Corponation (mid-level fixer)', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Haruka Soriano-Sigurdsson-Larsdóttir, 183cm tall, athletic lean build, GLMZ, neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting. Warm golden-brown complexion with olive undertones, weathered face with laugh lines and pale scar on left jawline. Salt-and-pepper grey hair with dark undertones, short military fade with natural wave. Dark brown eyes with amber rim. Calloused hands with small burn scars on knuckles. Wearing charcoal grey reinforced kevlar jacket (Iron Lotus style), dark smart-fabric shirt, tactical cargo pants with thigh holster bracket, worn leather gloves, steel-toed boots. Silver ring on right hand. Faded lotus tattoo on inner left wrist. Economical posture, weight forward, relaxed shoulders. Low ambient neon lighting, moody introspective mood, hands at rest. Minimal corporate aesthetic, functional not decorative. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Complex diasporic ancestry: 47.9% Northern European, 21.4% Sub-Saharan African, 16.1% Hispanic/Latin American, 14.6% South Asian. Genetic mosaic produces warm golden-brown complexion with subtle regional feature blending—prominent brow ridge and bone structure from Northern European ancestry, fuller lips and facial warmth from Sub-Saharan heritage, refined nose contours from Hispanic/Latin American mixing, and refined cheekbone geometry with slight orbital depth from South Asian ancestry.', 183, 89, N'Athletic and lean with subtle shoulder breadth — the physique of someone who maintains discipline without ostentation. Weathered musculature suggests decades of hands-on problem-solving rather than gym maintenance.', N'Salt-and-pepper grey with dark brown undertones', N'Neatly trimmed fade, military-precise at the sides, slightly longer on top with a natural wave', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint amber rim — natural eyes, no chrome replacement', N'Warm golden-brown complexion with subtle olive undertones, mid-to-deep saturation. Reflects the harmonic blending of Northern European structure with Sub-Saharan warmth and South Asian refinement, creating a rich unified tone rather than visibly discrete regional markers.', N'Weathered face with visible laugh lines around the eyes and a thin scar bisecting the left jawline (pale, old). Five-o''clock shadow typical. Minimal grooming vanity — practical maintenance only. Hands calloused, fingers slightly shortened (old break history). Facial structure shows blend of prominent brow ridge with refined nose and cheekbones, indicating multi-continental heritage.', N'None visible. Any modifications are subcutaneous or internal.', N'Economical and measured. Stands with weight slightly forward, shoulders relaxed but ready. Moves without wasted motion — a man who has learned that unnecessary gestures signal weakness or nervousness. Direct eye contact. Speaks in low register, forces others to lean in.', N'Tier 3 utilitarian with Tier 2 edges: charcoal grey reinforced kevlar-weave jacket (Iron Lotus house style, fitted), dark smart-fabric shirt beneath, tactical cargo pants with visible thigh holster bracket. Worn leather gloves. Steel-toed boots. A single silver ring on his right ring finger (no diamonds, no flash). No visible logos or corporate affiliations. Everything is functional, nothing decorative.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'haruka_soriano_sigurdsson_larsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c7-7724-a9d7-aa6b97638826', N'Zara Kim', N'Zara', N'', N'Kim', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Deepwell Station, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Small-time data broker and bootleg media seller', N'Independent; pays protection to a Deepwell Station local gang called the Sump Principals; occasional arms-length relationship with a Zheng-Dao internal auditor who feeds him documents', N'Zara Kim is a heavyset man with pale Polish-Armenian complexion gone ruddy at the cheeks from years of Deepwell Station''s recycled air, a close-cropped head of dark hair shot through with early gray, and a mustache he maintains with a precision that is otherwise entirely absent from his personal presentation. He wears the same rotation of three utilitarian jackets and always has a data-chip case on his belt that holds sixty to eighty chips in organized categories only he understands. His stall at the Gray Zone is a folding table with a locked case on top and a handwritten placard reading ''MEDIA / INFORMATION / REASONABLE RATES.'' Behind it he keeps a battered terminal and a cup of something hot that he refills compulsively from a thermos.

Zara Kim has the careful, watchful energy of a man who has heard a lot of things he wasn''t meant to and survived by being boring about it. He is dry-humored and unhurried, speaks with precise economy, and will sell you bootleg Axiom entertainment packages and Tessera corporate gossip compilations with the same mild demeanor. He does not volunteer what he knows, but ask him the right question and pay the right amount and the depth of his archive is quietly staggering. His specialty is organizational intelligence — who works for whom, who owes what, which corponation is about to restructure which subsidiary — sourced from document leaks, intercepted internal newsletters, and a network of low-level administrative workers who trade gossip for data access.', N'Information broker, quest giver, knowledge resource about corponation internal politics, can provide documents and data at a price, knows who''s moving and why', N'', N'Subdermal data port (left wrist, for fast chip reading); basic neural cache — 12TB passive memory storage implant; no cosmetic mods whatsoever', N'He is at the table by 8am with his thermos. He sits. He waits. He reads from a personal chip archive when slow. He goes home at 9pm to an apartment two floors up in the Deepwell residential block and does this again the next day.', N'Zara Kim, 178cm heavyset figure with warm deep brown skin carrying golden and olive undertones, pan-Asian facial structure with fuller South Asian lips and angular East Asian cheekbones, monolid dark brown eyes beneath hooded lids, weathered face marked by decades under artificial light with permanent flush across cheeks, meticulous dark mustache contrasting neglected appearance, short military-cropped dark brown hair with gray at temples. Hunched posture at worn folding table in dimly-lit Deepwell Station sub-level, wearing charcoal synthetic-blend jacket over thermal shirt, cargo pants, heavy resoled boots, worn canvas belt with data-chip case, functional analog wristwatch. Tier 4 utilitarian aesthetic, grime-stained collar, deliberate stillness, observant alert gaze, surrounded by recycled air haze and industrial shadow. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone infrastructure. Moody sub-level lighting casting long shadows. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex Pan-Asian, South Asian, and Middle Eastern blend with Sub-Saharan African admixture. East Asian ancestry (42.3%) defines facial structure and eye shape, substantially enriched by South Asian (23%), Southeast Asian (13.7%), and Middle Eastern (12.5%) heritage, with Sub-Saharan African (8.5%) contributing warmth and depth. A striking synthesis of multiple continental features: warm deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones, angular cheekbones with subtle fullness, monolid and hooded eye shapes, fuller lips from South Asian influence, and facial proportions reflecting the intersection of East, South, and Southeast Asian genetics tempered by Middle Eastern width.', 178, 94, N'Heavyset, solid through the shoulders and chest, soft around the midsection from years of sedentary work and institutional food. Thick-limbed but not athletic.', N'Dark brown with premature gray threading through, particularly at the temples', N'Close-cropped, military-precision cut, maintained weekly at a sub-level barber', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and observant', N'Warm deep brown with golden and olive undertones, reflecting the dominant East Asian (42.3%) and South Asian (23%) ancestry blended with Southeast Asian and Middle Eastern warmth; the Sub-Saharan African heritage (8.5%) adds depth and richness. Chronic reddening across cheeks and nose from Deepwell Station''s recycled air and irregular ventilation systems overlays the base tone.', N'Weathered by decades of sub-level lighting; fine lines around the eyes from constant squinting at data terminals; deep vertical crease between the brows from concentration. Cheeks permanently flushed. Facial structure distinctly pan-Asian with South Asian and Middle Eastern influence—prominent but not broad nose with slight bulbousness reflecting South Asian genetics, fuller lips from South Asian admixture, defined angular cheekbones characteristic of East Asian ancestry, with subtle width through the face reflecting Middle Eastern proportion. Monolid eye shape with slight hooding. Meticulously groomed dark, full mustache in stark contrast to the weathered neglect elsewhere. Complexion carries the depth and richness of blended continental ancestry.', N'None visible. Subdermal data port at left wrist is healed over and unmarked; neural cache implant is completely internal and undetectable without scanning equipment.', N'Hunched shoulders from hours seated at a folding table; moves with deliberate, economical motions—no wasted energy. Sits with his spine against the chair back, feet flat on the floor, always positioned to see approaches from multiple angles. Stillness is his default state; when he moves, it is purposeful and measured.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian. Three interchangeable synthetic-blend jackets in muted colors (charcoal, dark green, navy) worn in rotation, all showing seams at the elbows and collar stains from years of Deepwell grime. Underneath: plain long-sleeved thermal shirts, worn but clean. Practical cargo pants with multiple pockets. Heavy boots resoled twice. A worn canvas belt with a reinforced data-chip case containing 60-80 organized chips. No jewelry except a functional analog wristwatch. Everything smells faintly of recycled air, old coffee, and industrial cleaner.', N'He has a complete dossier on the Sump Principals gang leadership — finances, membership, operations — compiled over six years out of habit and paranoia. He has never sold it and isn''t sure why. He tells himself it''s insurance. It might be the closest thing he has to friends.', N'Compressed, precise, technical when discussing data, unexpectedly dry wit deployed without tonal change so it takes a second to land', N'Slow, even, never hurried. Comfortable with silence in a way that makes others uncomfortable.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'zara_kim');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c4-75b3-bdb0-aabbfe507da5', N'Apollonia Espinoza', N'Apollonia', N'', N'Espinoza', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, Hamtramck Enclave, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Fake ID vendor and identity documents forger — The Alban Souk', N'Independent; pays informal street tax to a local crew called the Hamtramck Ledger without being formally affiliated', N'Apollonia Espinoza is the kind of person you notice and immediately forget, which is the point. Medium height, medium build, features that read as generically pleasant — warm light-brown skin, dark eyes, hair that is currently an unremarkable chin-length black but was a different color last week and will be again next week. They have a cosmetic geneware mod that lets them adjust their hair color through a dermal panel on the back of their neck, and they use it strategically to match moods, blend into crowds, or signal to regular clients what kind of day it is (black means business, dark red means they''re watching, deep green means come back later). The only consistent physical detail is a small tattoo of an open eye on the inside of their left wrist, which they cover when working.

Their stall front is officially a document services and notarization kiosk — perfectly legal, mildly boring, doing a modest but real trade in legitimate bureaucratic services for the enclave''s large population of people whose papers are perpetually in some state of incompleteness. The back half of the business happens in a rented room above a noodle shop forty meters away, which they visit by a route they vary daily. They are calm, precise, and give off a faint air of someone taking a very long test that never ends.', N'Procurement contact for false identities and documentation; information broker adjacent — they know who in the enclave is trying to become someone else, and why.', N'', N'Color-shift hair geneware (cosmetic, strategic). Subdermal microfabricator array in dominant hand (functional — allows high-precision document printing without external equipment).', N'Runs the legitimate kiosk from morning to mid-afternoon, takes a two-hour break that is actually when they do their real work, returns for the evening rush of people needing their paperwork witnessed, and spends nights updating their identity template library.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Apollonia Espinoza, 168cm lean mixed-heritage figure with warm golden-tan skin reflecting East Asian, Latin American, and South Asian ancestry. Dark brown eyes with subtle epicanthic fold, defined cheekbones, softly angular face with mid-face fullness. Chin-length blunt black hair, neutral expression of calm focus. Wears dark charcoal long-sleeved layered shirt, fitted dark vest, aged synthetic leather boots. Matte black wrist cuff covering small eye tattoo on left inner wrist. Faint silver-gray lattice of subdermal microfabricator array visible on right palm under bright neon-blue accent lighting. Shoulder messenger satchel, worn leather. Neutral posture, centered weight, precise economical movement. Standing in dimly lit GLMZ corridor or indistinct urban setting, sharp focus on face and hands. Neo-noir dystopian atmosphere with subtle neon accent lighting. High detail, photorealistic, cinematic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'Predominantly East Asian (45.2%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (32.8%), complemented by South Asian (10.5%), Indigenous American (9.8%), and Southeast Asian (1.7%) genetic contributions. This genetic profile reflects the Ubiquitous Diaspora''s characteristic global recombination—East Asian features as primary phenotype, enriched by Latin American warmth and South Asian definition, with subtle Indigenous American bone structure influence. The result is a distinctly mixed phenotype: East Asian eye shape and cheekbone prominence married to Latin American and South Asian mid-face proportions, with Indigenous American influences visible in subtle jaw and orbital structure.', 168, 62, N'Lean and compact, economical in movement — the build of someone who takes up only as much space as necessary. Minimal visible musculature; wiry rather than athletic.', N'Currently black; cosmetically mutable via subdermal geneware panel', N'Blunt cut, chin-length, styled to sit neutrally around the face — neither masculine nor feminine in presentation, deliberately unremarkable', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, unremarkable luminosity', N'Warm medium-tan with golden-amber undertones—characteristic East Asian base enriched by Latin American and South Asian warmth. Even tone across face and body, suggesting genetic blending across multiple ancestry groups rather than single geographic origin.', N'Clean, well-maintained skin with a matte finish — minimal scarring, no visible acne. Face is softly angular with defined cheekbones reflecting East Asian primary ancestry, with mid-face fullness and jaw structure showing Latin American and South Asian influence. Mild epicanthic fold at eye corners consistent with dominant East Asian genetics; subtle broadening of nasal base reflecting South Asian and Latin American heritage. Expression defaults to neutral attentiveness. Eyebrows are dark and groomed but not styled. No facial hair.', N'The back-of-neck dermal panel is occasionally visible as a faint rectangular outline beneath the skin when hair is wet or pulled tightly back, but remains concealed under normal circumstances. The subdermal microfabricator array in the dominant hand (right) shows as a faint lattice of silver-gray lines beneath the skin across the palm and inner forearm, visible only at close range or in bright light. No external chrome or obvious technological modification.', N'Stands with weight centered, shoulders relaxed but not slouched — a neutral baseline posture that broadcasts neither confidence nor anxiety. Moves with deliberate precision; economical gestures. Hands move with practiced control. Overall impression is of someone perpetually in a state of calm focus, as if solving a complex problem in real time. Maintains slight distance in social contexts; does not fidget.', N'Tier 3-4 blend: functional, well-maintained, deliberately unmemorable. Typically wears neutral-toned layered clothing — charcoal or dark gray long-sleeved shirts, sometimes a fitted dark vest without logos. Dark trousers (black or dark gray), always with functional pockets. Shoes are practical and worn: good-condition but aging synthetic leather boots or slip-ons, kept clean but not polished. A dark hooded jacket or long coat for movement between locations. No visible jewelry except occasionally a simple wrist cuff in matte black that covers the eye tattoo. Accessorizes with a shoulder bag or messenger satchel (no obvious branding, worn leather, practical organization). Overall aesthetic: someone dressing for utility and invisibility, not expression. Clothes are replaced before they become notable; nothing torn, nothing flashy.', N'They built and maintain a fully functional identity for a person who doesn''t exist — complete biometric trail, employment history, credit record, social profile — and they use it to live parts of their life that they want kept separate from everything else, including their own name.', N'Spare and precise, no word wasted; slips into slightly more formal register when nervous, which reads as calm', N'Even and measured, with deliberate pauses before anything important', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'apollonia_espinoza');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('b3b87bcb-062b-323c-40ec-aaca5425a78c', N'Egil Touré', N'Egil', N'', N'Touré', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A one-room office above a noodle shop on Burnside Corridor, frosted glass door with his name stenciled in gold leaf that''s been peeling since 2187, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — solo practice, the Gray Zone Level 2', N'Egil Touré is a throwback to an era that probably never existed the way he imagines it. Sixty-three years old, lean and weathered, with deep brown skin, close-cropped gray hair, and eyes that have seen enough human misery to fill a library. He wears the same long coat every day regardless of weather and conducts his investigations with methods so archaic that younger PIs openly mock him — until they need someone who can find a person who has deliberately erased their digital existence, at which point Kofi becomes the only game in town.

His office is a monument to pre-digital methodology: corkboards with physical photographs connected by colored string, filing cabinets stuffed with handwritten case notes, a desk scarred by decades of coffee rings and cigarette burns. He has no BCI. He refuses augmentation of any kind. His clients are almost exclusively the Gray Zone residents who can''t afford the flashier investigators and who come to him because someone''s grandmother told them about the old man on Burnside who found her son when nobody else would look.

Despite his reputation as a fossil, Kofi''s solve rate on missing persons cases is quietly extraordinary — north of 80% over a thirty-year career. The secret is patience. He will watch a building for seventy-two hours. He will interview the same witness nine times. He will walk a route until his feet bleed. He understands something that technology-dependent investigators don''t: that most people hide in habits, not data, and habits are visible to anyone willing to watch long enough.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Egil Touré, a 178cm lean detective in a GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, standing in dim neon-filtered light. Rich warm deep brown skin with subtle cool undertones, weathered and lined from decades of fieldwork. Broad nasal base and prominent cheekbones from Sub-Saharan African ancestry blended with refined orbital structure from Eastern European heritage and pronounced Asian cheekbone architecture. Deep brown eyes with amber flecks, faded to hazel at edges. Steel gray close-cropped hair, sparse gray stubble on lined jaw. Extensive facial creases around eyes and mouth. Wearing a worn charcoal wool overcoat tailored in the 2180s, patched at hem with one plastic button replacement, open over muted cream button-up shirt. Dark wool trousers, polished black leather shoes. Analog Timex watch with frayed canvas strap on right wrist showing nicotine-stained fingers. Pale cigarette burn scar visible on left palm, thin white scar along right cheekbone. Standing with deliberate posture, weight balanced, shoulders back, eyes tracking exits. Analog and deliberately unchroomed. Neo-noir noir detective, weathered and watchful, against rain-slicked streets and neon reflections. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A one-room office above a noodle shop on Burnside Corridor', N'local', N'A one-room office above a noodle shop on Burnside Corridor', N'Complex diaspora ancestry: predominantly Sub-Saharan African (63%), with significant Southeast Asian (13.4%), Eastern European (10.4%), East Asian (8.4%), and Hispanic/Latin American (4.8%) genetic contributions. The blend manifests in rich deep brown skin with warm undertones grounded in West African genetics, Southeast Asian influence visible in subtle epicanthic fold variation and pronounced cheekbone architecture, East Asian ancestry contributing refined eye shape and orbital structure, while Eastern European ancestry adds cool undertones beneath the dominant warm brown and contributes subtle facial angularity. This is the face of the Ubiquitous Diaspora—multiple continents written into bone structure and pigmentation.', 178, 72, N'Lean and sinewy, the physique of someone who walks constantly rather than sits. Minimal subcutaneous fat, visible tendon definition in forearms and neck. Posture slightly stooped from decades hunched over case files.', N'Steel gray', N'Close-cropped, precisely maintained with manual clippers every two weeks', N'Short', N'Deep brown with amber flecks, faded to lighter hazel at the iris edges from age', N'Rich warm deep brown with subtle cool undertones from Eastern European ancestry, weathered to leather finish by sun exposure and neglect', N'Deeply lined face, particularly around eyes and mouth. Perpendicular creases on forehead. Unshaven most days—gray stubble, sparse. Skin texture rough, age spots on temples and backs of hands. Facial structure reflects the diaspora blend: broad nasal base and full lips from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, pronounced cheekbones and subtle epicanthic eye variation from Southeast/East Asian heritage, refined orbital and jaw structure from Eastern European ancestry, softened throughout by fine lines and age.', N'None. Zero chrome. Deliberately analog—no ocular implants, no subdermal arrays, no haptic gloves. This is a choice that marks him as stubbornly countercultural.', N'Moves with deliberate economy, no wasted motion. Slight favoring of his right leg from an old injury he refuses to discuss. Stands with weight balanced, shoulders back—ready to move if necessary. When sitting, hands remain visible on table or lap. Eyes track doorways and exits automatically.', N'A single long wool overcoat in charcoal gray, tailored sometime in the 2180s, worn open over department-store button-ups in muted colors (white, pale blue, cream). No logos. Trousers are dark wool, creased but not fashionably. Black leather shoes, resoled twice, polished weekly. A Timex analog wristwatch with a frayed canvas strap. No jewelry. His coat is his uniform and his armor—patched twice along the hem, one button replaced with a cheap plastic substitute, but otherwise maintained with quiet pride. Tier 3 functionality, Tier 1 intention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'egil_tour');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6dc-78ba-9eea-aacd8cd4156d', N'Fenfang Banerjee-Kabwit', N'Fenfang', N'', N'Banerjee-Kabwit', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market — rotating pitch between Grand Corridor and Brewer''s Spine, depending on enforcement sweeps, near North Ave and Damen', N'Noodle cart vendor and short-order cook', N'Independent — unlicensed vendor, pays informal pitch fees to the Burnished Market''s informal vendor collective; The Ferment', N'Fenfang Banerjee-Kabwit is young enough that his face hasn''t fully decided what it''s going to settle into — there''s still something unfinished about him, a quality he compensates for with a loudness of presence that fills the space around his cart. He is medium height, lean, with a warm light-brown complexion and color-changing hair he keeps cut short on the sides and longer on top, cycling it through oranges and greens depending on the day''s mood — today it''s a deep amber that shifts to jade in direct light. His hands are already the hands of someone who''s been cooking since he could reach a surface: scarred across the knuckles from hot metal, permanently stained around the cuticles from various spice pastes. He has enhanced scent glands, which he will tell you is the best modification a cook can get and which is responsible for approximately forty percent of his competitive advantage.

His cart runs on two burners and a philosophy: the broth is Congolese-Polish in DNA, built from a fermented corn base with a smoked beef backbone his grandmother taught him and a roux technique his father learned from a Polish neighbor in Lockhaven South, and it is not available any other way in GLMZ. He is aware of this. He is not modest about it. He runs the cart alone, moves it three times a week to stay ahead of market enforcement, and has a rotating customer base that follows him via a stripped-down community mesh channel. He is also, somewhat to his own surprise, becoming good at this — not just cooking, but the business of it — and has started to suspect that he might want more than a cart.', N'Social hub and local color — his cart is a place where people gather and talk and the food is good enough to make them stay longer than they planned. He overhears a great deal without necessarily processing it as intelligence. A portrait of young hustle and genuine talent.', N'', N'Enhanced scent glands (geneware — functional upgrade for flavor profiling). Color-changing hair (cosmetic geneware).', N'Wakes late, spends the morning prepping broth that''s been simmering overnight, hits the market pitch by 1100, runs service until he sells out or enforcement shows up, whichever comes first, then breaks down and goes to whatever informal vendor meeting is happening that evening.', N'Fenfang Banerjee-Kabwit, 172cm lean cook with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones reflecting African, South Asian, Hispanic, and Middle Eastern heritage, dark expressive eyes, sharp cheekbones with broader nose and fuller lips, color-shifting amber-to-jade chromatic hair in textured short fade style, faint perpetual heat flush across cheeks, systematic knuckle scars and turmeric-stained nail beds, thin wrist burn scar. Wearing fitted black tech-weave chef''s pants, loose heat-shedding shirt, lightweight muted windbreaker, worn running shoes with ankle wraps, faded grandmother''s cloth wristband. Posture forward and economical like a line cook, expressive hand gestures. GLMZ GLMZ kitchen or market setting, warm amber and jade lighting reflecting off his cycling hair, steam rising, perpetual smell of broth and spice in the air, precise movement, ready to pivot --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Complex multi-continental blend: 45.5% Sub-Saharan African, 30% South Asian, 14.7% Hispanic/Latin American, and 9.8% Middle Eastern ancestry. This creates a striking phenotype with warm medium-brown skin showing golden undertones, facial structure combining broader nose and fuller lips from African ancestry with refined cheekbones and eye geometry influenced by South Asian heritage, and subtle warm undertones from Latin American and Middle Eastern lineages. The overall effect is a harmonious integration of African warmth and facial structure, South Asian definition and eye shape, and Latin American and Middle Eastern complexion depth.', 172, 63, N'Lean and wiry with defined forearms and shoulders from years of repetitive cooking motions — no excess body fat, all functional muscle', N'Color-shifting chromatic geneware — currently deep amber fading to jade in direct light, cycles through oranges and greens daily', N'Short fade on sides, longer textured crown, styled for quick maintenance between service rushes', N'Short to medium', N'Dark brown, naturally warm and expressive', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones — the result of blended Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Middle Eastern ancestry creating an even, richly toned complexion that catches light with subtle warmth', N'Young face still settling into adulthood, sharp high cheekbones with broader nose bridge and fuller lips reflecting African and South Asian ancestry, slightly prominent ears, clear skin with the particular texture of someone who works around steam and heat daily — a faint perpetual flush across the cheeks', N'No visible cybernetic chrome. Enhanced scent glands are subcutaneous geneware — only visible as slightly enlarged nostrils and a faint iridescent sheen along the inner nasal passages when light hits at the right angle. Color-changing hair is cosmetic geneware, not mechanical', N'Moves with the controlled economy of a line cook — precise, economical, always aware of his immediate workspace. Stands with weight slightly forward, ready to pivot. Hands gesture expressively when speaking, muscle memory of plating and presentation. Fidgets with anything at hand when not actively cooking — taps rhythm on cart, flips utensils', N'Tier 4 working-class pragmatism mixed with street personality. Standard uniform: fitted black tech-weave chef''s pants with reinforced knees, layered tank tops or loose shirts that shed heat and stains easily, a lightweight hooded windbreaker in muted colors for quick market sweeps. Worn running shoes with ankle wraps for 10+ hour standing shifts. No jewelry except a faded cloth wristband his grandmother gave him. Clothes are functional, clean but not pristine — perpetually carry the smell of broth and spice no matter how recently washed', N'He''s been skimming the pitch fees he collects on behalf of the vendor collective — not much, and he tells himself it''s interest on the administrative work he does unpaid — but it''s enough that if anyone checked the ledger, it would be visible. He needs the money and he knows this is wrong and he has not stopped.', N'Fast, porous, code-switches between Burnished Market pidgin, Lingala-influenced cadences from his father''s family, and the particular rapid-fire energy of market hawking. Generous with compliments, stingy with apologies.', N'Quick and rhythmic, like someone who learned to talk the way you talk when you''re also stirring something and watching three things at once.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fenfang_banerjee_kabwit');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69f-7aad-963b-aad6bd0844f6', N'Eusebio Chanthavong', N'Eusebio', N'', N'Chanthavong', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grosse Pointe Enclosure, GLMZ, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Corporate Security Guard, Axiom Security Division — Executive Campus Protection', N'Axiom Security Division', N'Eusebio Chanthavong is lean and angular with the kind of posture that suggests it''s a weapon. She has her father''s Ghanaian cheekbones and her mother''s Siberian coloring — a pale complexion with warm undertones, dark hair she wears in a severe center-parted braid. Her eyes are factory-standard brown but her irises have been upgraded to tactical amber, which gives her peripheral dark-vision in the Enclosure''s manicured shadow gardens and makes her look, in the right light, faintly predatory. A small cat tail — rust-colored, kinetic geneware she got on a dare at twenty-two and has come to love — flicks at her hip when she''s irritated, which is often, and it has ruined more than one effort to seem professionally impassive.

She works the Grosse Pointe Enclosure''s inner residential ring, which means she guards the homes of Axiom executives who regard her as furniture that breathes. She is very good at her job and she resents it in a specific, contained way — the way you resent a language you''re fluent in that doesn''t belong to you. She has a blistering private contempt for the people she protects and an equally fierce professionalism that won''t let her do the job badly regardless. She''s been offered an investigator track twice and declined both times, though she couldn''t explain why to anyone''s satisfaction, including her own.', N'Access and obstacle — she controls who gets into the Enclosure and under what conditions; potential insider contact who knows the layout, schedules, and vulnerabilities of Axiom''s most guarded residential space; character study in class resentment sublimated into excellence.', N'', N'Tactical amber irises with peripheral low-light enhancement; subdermal comms relay (Axiom-encrypted); light subdermal armor plating along forearms and sternum (Axiom-standard executive protection package); rust-colored cat tail geneware (cosmetic).', N'Eight-hour rotating shifts patrolling the inner residential ring of the Grosse Pointe Enclosure; she catalogues every anomaly in the shift log with an exactness her supervisors find excessive; spends off-hours at a Copperhead sparring gym where nobody knows her employer.', N'Eusebio Chanthavong, Southeast Asian-dominant with African and Northern European heritage blend, golden-bronze luminous skin tone with warm balanced undertones. 172cm lean athletic build, long black braided hair center-parted and severe. Angular high cheekbones with strong defined jawline, high-bridged nose, tactical amber augmented irises glowing softly. Kinetic rust-colored furred cat tail at spine base flicking with tension. Subdermal chrome geometric seams visible along inner forearms from armor plating. Minimal scarring on left forearm and right knuckle. Combat-ready posture, weight on balls of feet, economical precise movement. Wearing Axiom Security matte charcoal tactical jacket with badge, climate-controlled undersuit, reinforced cargo pants, minimalist boots. Faint raised line behind left ear from comms relay. Neutral expression with slight downward mouth tension. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone security operative, cool tactical lighting, Enclosure interior with industrial architecture, blue-tinted ambient glow, professional and restrained aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grosse Pointe Enclosure', N'local', N'Grosse Pointe Enclosure', N'Southeast Asian (51.4%) forms the dominant genetic base, creating characteristic facial geometry and bone structure, substantially blended with Sub-Saharan African (31.9%) ancestry that enriches skin depth and adds pronounced cheekbone and jaw definition. Northern European (15.6%) contribution lightens and warms the overall complexion into luminous golden-bronze tones, while minimal East Asian (1.1%) influence remains subtle. The result is a striking polychromatic appearance: Southeast Asian bone structure warmed and deepened by African heritage, with Northern European luminosity creating a balanced, warm complexion that reads as both rich and radiant.', 172, 62, N'Lean and angular with corded muscle density from combat training; no wasted mass. Shoulders set back with the kind of structural efficiency that reads as coiled readiness.', N'Black with natural dark brown undertones', N'Center-parted braid, severe and functional, pulled tight enough to suggest discipline', N'Long (midback length)', N'Tactical amber irises with dark-adapted peripheral enhancement; pupils dial wider in low-light environments', N'Warm golden-bronze complexion with balanced undertones—Southeast Asian warmth deepened and enriched by African heritage bone structure and melanin, brightened by Northern European luminosity. The blend creates a radiant, luminous quality without appearing desaturated despite minimal sun exposure from Enclosure work.', N'Angular cheekbones with Southeast Asian-influenced high set structure, prominently defined by African heritage bone prominence. Strong, defined jawline with Sub-Saharan African structural influence. High bridged nose with Southeast Asian character. Skin maintained to corporate standards with warm, balanced undertones across the palette. Expression defaults to neutrality with a slight downward mouth tension. Minimal scarring.', N'Amber tactical irises are immediately visible and non-standard. Forearm subdermal plating visible as subtle chrome geometric seams running along the inner wrist and inner forearm. Kinetic cat tail is the most conspicuous augmentation — rust-colored, furred, moves with her emotional state. Subdermal comms relay is invisible but creates a faint raised line behind her left ear if observed closely.', N'Stands with chest open but weight distributed toward balls of feet — combat-ready baseline posture. Walks with minimal wasted motion, economical and precise. Head moves only with eyes in scan patterns; jaw set slightly forward. When irritated, the cat tail betrays her before her face does — it swishes with sharp, angular motions.', N'Axiom Security Division uniform on duty: fitted tactical jacket in matte charcoal with Axiom logo and badge; climate-controlled undersuit; reinforced cargo pants with integrated comms access pockets; minimalist boots rated for 12-hour patrols. Off-duty: understated gym wear (compression shirts, technical fabrics) and dark layers that suggest the same restraint as her on-duty wardrobe. Tier 2 access — corporate-grade materials but no visible luxury markers. All choices prioritize function over appearance.', N'She has memorized the security rotation vulnerabilities for the inner ring''s north garden — not because she''s planning to exploit them, but because the knowledge feels like power over the place, and she needs that. An Axiom competitor contacted her eight months ago with a job offer. She hasn''t said no yet.', N'Crisp and corporate on the job. Off-duty: sharp, fast, laced with Akan proverbs her father taught her that she uses as knives.', N'Controlled on-shift. Off-shift she speaks quickly, like she''s been holding it in.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eusebio_chanthavong');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f2-7175-b3f3-aafd69e7b87e', N'Abiodun Espinoza', N'Abiodun', N'', N'Espinoza', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 45, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Meridian Station — central transit nexus, neutral ground, near LaSalle and Madison', N'Remote drone and vehicle operations specialist — rigger', N'Independent — works solo contracts', N'Abiodun Espinoza are athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 45, their expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom — and they make no effort to hide it.

They used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Abiodun Espinoza plans to keep it that way. They work as a rigger out of Meridian Station, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

they are not the most talented rigger in GLMZ, but they might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Djeneba Aguilar-Annan functions as a connector — their work puts them in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving them naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom. Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Abiodun Espinoza, 172cm lean athletic build, GLMZ. Warm bronze-to-amber skin with golden undertones reflecting Indigenous American, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Angular face with strong cheekbones, broader nose, fuller lips. Left eye dark brown organic, right eye dramatic silver-chrome cybernetic prosthetic with LED indicators glowing faintly. Short dark brown naturally textured hair, close-cropped fade. Thin scar along left temple. Wiry, coiled posture suggesting constant readiness. Dark synthetic leather utility jacket over black fitted shirt, grey cargo pants, steel-toed boots. Weathered smart-glasses accessory. Cold, calculating expression, guarded intense gaze. Neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone dystopian backdrop, industrial setting, ambient glow highlighting chrome eye augmentation. Cinematic, high contrast neo-noir lighting. Character portrait. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Station', N'local', N'Meridian Station', N'Indigenous American dominant (53.9%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (25.0%) and Hispanic/Latin American (21.1%) ancestry. The genetic mix produces warm bronze-to-amber skin with strong, angular cheekbones and pronounced facial structure characteristic of Indigenous American features, enriched by the broader nose and fuller lip contours from Sub-Saharan African genetics, and softened by the facial proportions of Hispanic/Latin American heritage. This creates a distinctive, striking appearance reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora''s genetic reality.', 172, 68, N'Athletic and lean with defined musculature — the wiry strength of someone who trains daily. No excess fat. Shoulders broad but not bulky. Movement suggests coiled tension.', N'Dark brown, naturally textured', N'Close-cropped fade on sides, longer on top — practical, minimal maintenance. No ornamentation.', N'Short', N'Left eye: dark brown, organic. Right eye: cybernetic with silver-chrome iris, LED recording indicators faintly visible around the pupil', N'Warm bronze-to-amber with golden undertones, medium-to-deep depth with subtle luminosity. The warmth reflects dominant Indigenous American ancestry blended seamlessly with Sub-Saharan African richness and Hispanic/Latin American undertones.', N'Angular face with strong, prominent cheekbones and sharp jawline characteristic of Indigenous American features. Broader nose and fuller lips reflect Sub-Saharan African genetic contribution. Eyes set with slight depth creating an intent, penetrating gaze. Minimal facial hair — meticulously groomed. Skin shows the wear of exposure but is kept clean. Expression naturally guarded, eyes rarely at rest.', N'Right eye is obviously cybernetic — chrome and polished steel casing, LED indicators, slight luminescence when recording. The prosthetic is expensive and deliberately visible; no cosmetic covering. Wired reflexes are subcutaneous, not visible, but affect movement — a coiled readiness in the shoulders and hands, reaction time evident in micro-adjustments.', N'Upright, economical. Moves like someone always calculating trajectory and distance. Hands at rest tend toward positioning that allows rapid movement. Eyes scan constantly — the organic one and the cybernetic one sometimes move at different speeds, creating an unsettling uncanny-valley effect. When focused on a task, becomes absolutely still.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear. Dark utility jacket (synthetic leather, reinforced) over fitted black undershirt. Cargo pants with multiple pockets, worn grey. Steel-toed boots broken in but well-maintained. No logos or corp affiliation visible. Small rig-rig pouch on belt carrying micro-tools, data sticks, and maintenance gear. Wears a weathered smart-glasses accessory but rarely uses it — prefers unmediated vision. Everything functional, nothing decorative. The wardrobe of someone who doesn''t want to be remembered.', N'Djeneba Aguilar-Annan once worked for corporate intelligence and still has a handler who calls in favors. Each favor erodes what''s left of their independence.', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Halting — speaks in fragments, reassembles thoughts in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'abiodun_espinoza');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a683-7805-83fb-ab3c2f304200', N'Ayako Tuivailala', N'Ayako', N'', N'Tuivailala', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 54, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'University Spine, Brewer''s Spine sublevel archive stacks, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Data archaeologist and extinct-language reconstructionist, University Spine', N'University Spine — Dept. of Computational Linguistics and Material Memory; occasional contract work for Zheng-Dao Heritage Compliance division', N'Ayako Tuivailala is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin mapped by decades of fluorescent archival light — her eyes carry the particular fatigue of someone who has spent a career reading things that no longer want to be read. She keeps her silver-streaked hair in tight wrapped cords pinned with antique data-spike styluses, and her fingers are perpetually ink-stained despite no physical ink being involved; a psychosomatic habit she developed after thirty years of interfacing with degraded data substrates. A small bioluminescent glyph — an old Polynesian voyaging star chart commissioned from a gene-artist — pulses faintly along her left forearm when she''s excited, which colleagues use as a more reliable indicator of her enthusiasm than her carefully measured words.

She speaks with the precise, unhurried authority of someone who has outlasted three department chairs and four curriculum overhauls and considers herself accountable only to the dead languages she serves. Students find her terrifying; junior colleagues find her generous in ways they don''t expect. She has no patience for academic posturing but extraordinary patience for a corrupted file, and she treats both the E.L.F. that haunts her archive terminal — she calls it Grandmother — and a first-year graduate student with the same respectful directness. Her secret grief is that she has reconstructed seventeen languages that no living person will ever speak again.', N'Information source for extinct pre-Meridian cultures, city history, and data buried in legacy formats; quest giver for retrieval of specific corrupted files or physical data artifacts; local color in the archive district; can authenticate or translate anything players find in old ruins.', N'', N'Subdermal haptic readers in both palms for interfacing directly with degraded physical media; low-grade ocular enhancement (archival-grade magnification, no combat function); the bioluminescent forearm glyph (cosmetic geneware, over 20 years old and slightly faded).', N'Arrives at the archive stacks before the building officially opens using a key she has held for nineteen years, works through breakfast, teaches one graduate seminar on Tuesdays and Thursdays, and eats the same flatbread-and-protein-paste lunch at her desk while arguing with her terminal E.L.F. about file permissions.', N'A late-fifties Pacific Islander-Oceanic diaspora woman with warm medium-brown skin, golden-olive undertones luminous even under archival lighting, sitting hunched in a data archive facility, 2226. Her face reflects rich ancestral blending — broad Pacific cheekbones balanced with refined East Asian eye shape, weathered from decades of focused archive work with deep mouth grooves and forehead creases. Black hair with silver threading braided into functional cords pinned with antique data-spike styluses. Her left forearm glows with a faded cyan-green bioluminescent Polynesian star chart. Wearing cream linen blazer layered over high-necked thermal shirt, archive-grade utility trousers, worn leather flat shoes. Hands stained with chronic ink marks, fingers positioned with precision. Direct, unflinching eye contact. Ocular enhancement visible as faint silver threading at eye corners. Surrounded by degraded data carriers and holographic archival displays casting cool blue light. The scene captures both her deliberate stillness and the weight of decades spent preserving forgotten information. Mood: focused, weathered, quietly resolute. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, archival setting, moody atmospheric lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'University Spine', N'local', N'University Spine', N'Pacific Islander (40.2%) forms the genetic foundation, complemented by Indigenous American (18.2%), East Asian (18.1%), South Asian (8.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (8.8%), and Southeast Asian (5.8%) ancestry. This rare Oceanic-centric diaspora blend creates a distinctive phenotype: the broad facial structure and fuller proportions of Pacific Islander and Indigenous American ancestry combine with the refined cheekbone definition and eye shape of East Asian heritage, while South Asian and Southeast Asian contributions add warmth and complexity to skin tone. The result is a face that reads as distinctly multicultural, grounded in Oceanic genetics but enriched by continental Asian and Americas-origin lineages.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and sturdy, with the kind of frame that suggests decades of seated work — solid through the torso, slightly softened at the middle from a lifetime of archive-stack caffeine and desk meals, but still carrying underlying strength', N'Black with silver threading throughout', N'Tight wrapped cords, pinned with antique data-spike styluses at the crown and sides; kept severe and functional', N'Medium (cords fall to mid-shoulder)', N'Deep brown with faint archival-gray overlay from ocular enhancement', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones, luminous rather than matte. The tone reflects the sun-adapted pigmentation of Pacific seafaring populations blended with warmer complexion contributions from East Asian, Southeast Asian, and South Asian ancestry, creating a richly dimensional finish that catches light distinctly despite decades under archival lighting.', N'Lined face with deep grooves bracketing mouth and forehead creases from sustained focus work. Facial structure reflects the broader, more angular cheekbones and fuller facial proportions of Pacific Islander and Indigenous American ancestry, balanced by the refined eye shape and defined cheekbone structure of East Asian heritage. Warm golden-olive undertones remain visible even in weathered skin texture. Minimal makeup; dark circles under eyes suggesting chronic sleep debt. Subtle South Asian influence visible in nostril shape and overall facial proportion harmony.', N'Low-grade ocular augmentation visible as faint silver threading at the outer corners of eyes and minimal hardware at temple (archival-grade magnification optics); bioluminescent forearm glyph is the only overt modification, faded and slightly desaturated from age. Subdermal haptic readers in palms are not visible but produce faint micro-scarring at base of fingers if closely examined.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion, but not rushed. Sits slightly hunched from archive work, shoulders curving inward as if still hovering over degraded media. Hands often gesture with precision when speaking, fingers splayed as if feeling invisible texture. Eye contact is direct and unflinching, carries the stillness of someone accustomed to absolute focus.', N'Tier 2/3 academic blend — clean but worn linen blazers (cream, gray, pale brown tones), layered under thermal undershirts in cooler archive environments. Prefers high-necked shirts to minimize profile. Archive-grade utility trousers with reinforced pockets, sensible flat-soled shoes (worn leather, well-maintained but clearly years old). Adds a faded university spine wool scarf in winter. No visible jewelry except functional styluses in hair. Overall appearance is deliberately understated — money enough for quality basics, no interest in display.', N'Seventeen years ago she deliberately misfiled the location coordinates of a pre-Meridian Anishinaabe ceremonial archive she discovered in the Brightmoor Reclamation strata — not in her official records, not in Zheng-Dao''s database. The location exists only in her personal encrypted notation. She tells herself she is protecting it; she has never decided from whom.', N'Formal but not stiff — precise technical terminology mixed with occasional Yoruba and Samoan phrases she has absorbed from languages she''s studied; refuses academic jargon she considers performative', N'Measured, deliberate, long pauses before important points as if she is checking the sentence for accuracy before releasing it', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ayako_tuivailala');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e9-753b-9812-ab6ebdf19fc4', N'Akhil Strömqvist', N'Akhil', N'', N'Strömqvist', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, operates from a converted water tower studio called the Booth, near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'Underground filmmaker and VR experience designer', N'Waxwing Neuromedia (mid-level underground filmmaker and vr experience designer)', N'Akhil Strömqvist is lean and somewhat raccoon-eyed from chronic sleep debt, with warm medium-brown skin, close-cropped hair, and a habit of wearing a battered optical recording array mounted over his left ear that he has modified so many times it is no longer recognizably a consumer product. His right arm has a functional color-shifting skin mod — not cosmetic in origin, repurposed from a Helix Biosystems agricultural camouflage prototype he acquired through means he prefers not to specify — that he uses as an on-body production notes display. When he is thinking through a shot or a structural problem, patterns move up and down his forearm.

He makes films that are not quite films — immersive experiences designed to be entered via off-brand VR rigs, averaging forty minutes, built from recorded footage of real Highland Park Autonomous Zone life combined with interactive-adjacent decision points that he insists are not choices but pressure — moments where the viewer feels the weight of a real person''s situation. His work has been passed around on physical data-chips in the HPAZ and has recently started moving through wider underground networks. He is terrified of and fascinated by his growing audience, whom he has never met.', N'Eyes and ears of the Highland Park Autonomous Zone; documentary record of community life; person who can provide footage or testimony of things that happened; potential unwilling witness to something dangerous', N'', N'Repurposed agricultural color-shift skin mod on right arm (functional/display hybrid); custom optical recording array (heavily modified consumer hardware, basically an augmentation at this point)', N'Spends most of every day either recording — following community members with permission, documenting zone infrastructure, capturing ambient data — or in the Booth editing and building immersive rigs; eats irregularly, maintains the water tower''s operational systems as a rent substitute.', N'Akhil Strömqvist, fair-skinned neo-noir documentarian with cool undertones and subtle olive warmth, dark brown close-cropped hair, pronounced dark circles under dark eyes. Lean 176cm frame hunched slightly forward. Left ear features heavily modified DIY optical recording array with misaligned lens clusters and exposed bundled wiring with LED indicators. Right forearm displays active iridescent color-shift skin mod rippling with blue-green-violet patterns. Faint burn scar on inner left wrist, self-done film-frame tattoo dots on right forearm. Worn cargo jacket in muted grays and blacks, layered utilitarian clothing, ink-stained fingers, reinforced work boots. Tense posture with jittery restless energy. Setting: dimly lit recording studio or street-level tech workspace, neon accent lighting catching the iridescent forearm mod. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. Moody, focused, sleep-deprived intensity. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Northern European (73.5%) with Eastern European (18.2%) and Hispanic/Latin American (8.3%) ancestry — a cool-to-neutral palette creating fair skin with subtle warm olive undertones. The combination yields strong Scandinavian bone structure with defined cheekbones and straight eye geometry, enhanced by Slavic depth and minor Latin warmth in facial undertone.', 176, 68, N'Lean and wiry, with minimal muscle definition — the physique of someone who forgets to eat regularly and moves constantly between recording sites and editing terminals. Slight forward hunch to shoulders from hours hunched over VR rig assembly.', N'Natural dark brown', N'Close-cropped, maintained short for practical reasons; uneven in places where he''s trimmed it himself between sleeping sessions', N'Short', N'Dark brown, naturally; often surrounded by pronounced dark circles and mild orbital puffiness', N'Fair with cool undertones and subtle warm olive cast from mixed ancestry. Sleep deprivation and poor hydration create additional gray undertones. Cooler in artificial lighting, slightly warmer in daylight.', N'Strong, defined cheekbones characteristic of Northern European and Eastern European heritage with subtle Latin warmth in undertone; sharp jawline accentuated by weight loss and angular facial structure; dark shadows under eyes are permanent; sparse facial hair growth along jawline, often neglected for days then quickly shaved. Skin texture shows minor stress acne along jawline from sleep deprivation and poor nutrition.', N'Left ear mounted with a heavily customized optical recording array that bears no resemblance to consumer hardware — multiple lenses in misaligned clusters, exposed wiring bundled with what appears to be duct tape and bioplastic, small LED indicators that cycle through colors based on recording mode. Right forearm displays a functional color-shift skin mod that ripples with iridescent patterns of blue, green, and violet when active — originally repurposed agricultural camouflage tech, now serving as a real-time visual note-taking system; patterns flow upward and downward depending on his cognitive state.', N'Habitually tense shoulders, economical movements with occasional jittery restlessness (caffeine-fueled). When thinking through a shot or structural problem, he stares into middle distance while his right arm moves unconsciously, watching the color patterns shift. Walks with purposeful but slightly distracted gait, often with recording equipment in one hand. Rarely makes sustained eye contact unless actively listening to a subject.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian aesthetic — functional layers in muted grays, blacks, and olive; battered canvas cargo jacket with multiple inner pockets for data-chips and lens filters; worn synthetic-blend t-shirts with faded graphics from defunct streaming platforms or community events; reinforced work pants with tool-loop modifications. No branding beyond the accidental. Insulated wrist wraps (actual function unclear — possibly for carpal support, possibly just habit). Worn gel-sole boots with custom-fitted recording equipment mounts on one heel. Chronically ink-stained fingers.', N'He has twelve hours of footage documenting what appears to be a Ferrogate Transit contractor performing unauthorized infrastructure modifications inside HPAZ water-systems territory. He has not released it because he cannot determine whether releasing it helps or endangers the community, and the longer he waits the more certain he is the moment has passed. He watches it at least once a week.', N'Precise and structural when discussing film or community; halting and slightly formal in casual conversation, as if he is always slightly outside his own social moment', N'Measured, often with visible pauses where he recalibrates what he was about to say', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'akhil_str_mqvist');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a730-7104-a233-ab7101361460', N'Evren Bah-Tamale', N'Evren', N'', N'Bah-Tamale', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'Meridian Core — Axiom Industries Security Division, Floor 47. Clean apartment in the corporate residential block, Level 30.', N'Former romantic partner / Axiom security operative / the path not taken', N'', N'Evren Bah-Tamale moves like someone who has been evaluated her entire adult life and has decided to make every evaluation flawless. Not arrogant — precise. Every step measured, every gesture controlled, every word vetted by some internal review board that never adjourns. She is 5''8", athletic, with the particular build that comes from corporate training programs designed to maximize combat efficiency without sacrificing the professional appearance Axiom demands of its security personnel. Her black hair is kept in a regulation-length bob that frames a face built for stillness — high cheekbones, dark eyes that assess before they acknowledge, a mouth that defaults to a neutral line that gives away nothing.

Her uniform is always immaculate. Her augments are always calibrated. Her quarterly performance reviews are always exceptional. She is, on paper and in practice, the model Axiom operative: a product of the Gray Zone who climbed out through sheer competence and disciplined compliance. The corporation holds her up as proof that the system works — that anyone with talent and willingness can ascend. They do not mention what she had to leave behind to do it.

First impression: a professional. Competent, controlled, slightly cold. The kind of person you respect and don''t approach. Second impression, available only to those who knew her before: a woman who is performing the role of herself with such precision that the performance has become indistinguishable from reality. She''s not pretending. She''s not honest either. She''s something worse — she''s forgotten where the mask ends.', N'Yuki is the road not taken. She is what Kyle would be if he''d stayed with Axiom — successful, stable, effective, and slowly being consumed by the machine she chose. She represents the argument that principles are a luxury, that pragmatism is survival, that the system is ugly but it works for those willing to work it.

But she also mirrors Kyle''s hypocrisy from the other side. He calls himself a samurai while doing mercenary work. She calls herself an officer while enforcing corporate will on communities like the one she grew up in. Neither of them is fully honest about what they are. But Yuki''s dishonesty is state-sponsored, which makes it invisible, and Kyle''s is self-imposed, which makes it romantic. The story should question both.

She is the tension between where you came from and what you became. She buried the same moral doubts Kyle couldn''t swallow. She chose pragmatism. It works. She has healthcare. She has security. She has a clean ceiling to stare at for thirty-seven minutes every morning while she doesn''t think about whether any of it was worth it.

The question she poses to Kyle: Was leaving brave, or was it easy? Was staying cowardly, or was it the harder choice — to look at the machine every day and keep going? The story should make both answers feel true and neither feel sufficient.', N'', N'', N'', N'Evren Bah-Tamale, GLMZ, 173cm athletic security operative with deep warm brown luminous skin and rich golden undertones from sub-Saharan African and East Asian heritage. High prominent cheekbones, subtle almond eye shape, dark brown analytical gaze, short blunt-cut black bob framing jaw. Immaculate complexion, corporate-grade skincare. Wearing tailored charcoal tactical weave security uniform with minimal insignia, matte finish. Posture rigidly efficient and alert, movement precise and measured. Professional neural enhancement suggested by preternatural control. Standing in neon-lit corporate hallway, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone floor 47, cool blue-white lighting casting subtle shadows across defined facial structure. No visible augmentations, no jewelry, perfect restraint. Expression neutral, calculating, ready. Neo-noir corporate aesthetic, photorealistic, cinematic lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Core', N'local', N'Meridian Core', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (74.8%) with significant East Asian (18.9%) and Northern European (6.3%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates deep, richly saturated skin tones with prominent melanin expression. Facial structure reflects the dominant African heritage with high, prominent cheekbones and broader geometry, refined by the East Asian ancestry contributing subtle almond-shaped eye geometry and refined facial proportions. The Northern European ancestry contributes minimal visible influence given its low percentage.', 173, 62, N'Athletic and lean with defined musculature from corporate combat training regimens. No excess body fat; every line suggests functional precision rather than aesthetic cultivation.', N'Black, natural', N'Regulation-length bob, blunt-cut, frames face precisely at jaw line', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and analytical', N'Deep warm brown with rich golden undertones — the result of dominant Sub-Saharan African ancestry with East Asian influence adding refined warmth. Rich melanin expression, luminous rather than matte.', N'High, prominent cheekbones with facial structure reflecting predominantly African heritage; subtle almond eye shape from East Asian ancestry combined with broader, more angular facial geometry from African genetic influence. Skin immaculate — corporate-grade skincare regimen evident. Rich, warm undertones across all exposed skin. No visible scarring on face. Expression defaults to professional neutrality.', N'None visible. Any augmentations are subcutaneous or internal — consistent with Axiom''s corporate aesthetic requirements for Floor 47 personnel. Posture and movement suggest possible proprioceptive neural enhancement, but not overtly apparent.', N'Moves with measured efficiency — no wasted motion, no casual slouching. Steps are deliberate and grounded. Hands remain visible and controlled. Head positioning suggests constant environmental assessment. Stands at attention even when nominally at rest. Movement is precise enough to unsettle observers who expect human variability.', N'Axiom security uniform when on-duty: tailored charcoal tactical weave, minimal insignia, matte finish. Off-duty: high-tier Tier 1-2 minimalist corporate wear — monochromatic, fitted, expensive in restraint rather than embellishment. No jewelry. No personal customization. Every garment is neutral, functional, and perfectly maintained.', N'She keeps a file on Kyle. Not an official one — a personal file, on a private device, encrypted with a key she changes monthly. Every job he takes that crosses Axiom''s radar, every sighting, every rumor. She''s tracked his movements for five years. She tells herself it''s professional due diligence — knowing where a former operative operates is standard security practice. It''s not. She''s watching him the way you watch someone who jumped off a bridge — not because you want to jump, but because you need to know if they survived the fall.', N'Military-corporate hybrid. Clean, precise, stripped of imagery, heavy on clarity. She uses rank and protocol language even in casual conversation — it''s armor. When she''s caught off-guard, fragments of the Gray Zone dialect surface (''that''s gutter—'' she''ll start, then correct to standard phrasing immediately, furious at the slip). She never swears. She considers it imprecise.', N'Controlled, even, delivered at the same volume and speed regardless of content. She could be ordering dinner or ordering a tactical strike and it would sound identical. When she''s angry, she gets quieter — the words get shorter, the pauses get longer, and the most dangerous Yuki is the one who stops talking entirely and just looks at you.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'evren_bah_tamale');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a639-7571-9e75-abc8cc014c49', N'Hamidreza Rahman-Khoury', N'Hamidreza', N'', N'Rahman-Khoury', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 21, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — specifically employed at Cranemast Residential, a mid-rise tower in the Gray Zone''s inland edge, one of eight towers managed by Grainfort Property Collective, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Building cleaner / maintenance junior, residential tower', N'Grainfort Property Collective (employed); UBC supplement recipient', N'Hamidreza Rahman-Khoury is young and still growing into his frame — broad shouldered but not yet filled out, moving with the slightly uncertain coordination of someone whose body changed faster than his proprioception caught up. His skin is warm brown, his hair grown out in thick sections he keeps bound with elastic and doesn''t think about much. He has a pair of cat ears — gray, black-tipped — that he got for his nineteenth birthday from his older sister, a gift he was enthusiastic about at the time and now considers with complicated feelings, mostly because they are difficult to hide and he has since applied for a number of jobs where he didn''t want to be immediately read as someone who has cosmetic geneware. They twitch when he''s startled, which he hates. He has large, careful hands and deep-set eyes that are slightly too serious for his face.

Hamidreza Rahman-Khoury is quiet in the way of people who spent a lot of time listening before they learned to speak up. He is not shy — he''ll talk when he has something to say — but he doesn''t fill silence for its own sake, which makes him seem older than he is to some people and invisible to others. He is genuinely kind without being soft about it and is developing, slowly, a specific internal morality about what he owes the building he works in and the people who live there. He works hard, notices things, and has begun to understand that noticing things in a building is a form of power no one warned him about.', N'Access and observation — Jelani goes everywhere in the building and is effectively invisible to most residents. He knows who is home, who isn''t, who has been fighting, who has had visitors, what is being disposed of. Useful as a local witness, a sympathetic contact in a building players need access to, or a young person whose decency is being tested by what he keeps discovering.', N'', N'Gray cat ears with black tips, geneware (cosmetic, emotional-reactive twitching; he did not realize they were emotional-reactive when he received the gift)', N'Reports to Cranemast at 0700, works a cleaning and minor maintenance rotation through the building''s thirty-two floors, breaks for lunch in the utility room with his headphones in, does waste consolidation in the late afternoon, leaves by 1800. Studies building systems repair manuals on his transit rides home.', N'Hamidreza Rahman-Khoury, 183cm tall lean broad-shouldered young man with golden-brown skin, warm amber and olive undertones, strong jawline and prominent cheekbones reflecting South Asian heritage with Middle Eastern angularity. Deep brown eyes, serious expression. Shoulder-length dark brown hair in practical sections bound with elastic. Gray cat ears with black tips surgically grafted at skull base, ears slightly rotated in alert position. Wearing weathered gray Grainfort maintenance coveralls over white synthetic shirt, heavy scuffed maintenance boots, canvas work belt with tools. Large calloused hands, small pale scar on left palm. Slightly hunched posture from years in maintenance corridors. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, utilitarian aesthetic, standing in dimly lit maintenance corridor with cool neon accent lighting reflecting off metal surfaces, serious and focused demeanor, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly South Asian (68.3%) with significant Middle Eastern (23.6%) and Hispanic (8.1%) ancestry. This genetic combination creates a warm, golden-brown complexion with subtle amber undertones. South Asian ancestry dominates his facial structure—prominent rounded cheekbones, strong defined jawline, full lips, and deep-set dark eyes that convey maturity beyond his years. Middle Eastern heritage contributes facial angularity, structured brow placement, and refined bone definition. Hispanic ancestry adds warmth and slight olive undertones to his overall skin tone, creating a rich, multitonal complexion rather than a single flat hue.', 183, 71, N'Broad-shouldered but lean, still filling into his frame—athletic potential visible but not yet fully realized. Long-limbed with the slightly ungainly proportion of someone who grew too fast.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Grown out in thick sections, bound with plain elastic bands; minimal styling, practical', N'Medium (shoulder-length sections)', N'Deep brown, natural', N'Golden-brown with warm amber and subtle olive undertones. Even pigmentation across the face with slightly deeper saturation at the cheekbones and jawline, reflecting South Asian dominance with Middle Eastern definition and Hispanic warmth blended throughout.', N'Clear skin, minimal grooming beyond necessity. Facial structure strongly South Asian: rounded but prominent cheekbones, strong defined jawline, full lips. Middle Eastern ancestry visible in brow structure and facial angularity—sharp but not harsh. Serious expression default. Hands are large and deliberate-looking, calloused from maintenance work. Deep-set eyes read older than his years.', N'Gray and black-tipped cat ears mounted at cranial base. Ears twitch involuntarily in response to emotional stimuli (startlement, anxiety, interest). No other visible augmentations. Movement suggests either subcutaneous neural interface or natural proprioceptive training.', N'Moves with careful deliberation, economical in gesture. Stands slightly hunched—not from shyness but from years of navigating utility spaces and maintenance corridors. Walks with purpose, rarely rushes. When startled, his entire body tenses before the cat ears twitch; he''s learned to hide the reaction but the physical tells remain.', N'Tier 4 working-class practical. Gray or dark blue maintenance coveralls from Grainfort Property Collective (corporate-issued, worn but clean). White synthetic shirt underneath. Heavy-soled maintenance boots, scuffed. Canvas work belt with tool loops. When off-shift: plain black hoodie or oversized jacket that might hide the cat ears if he pulls the hood up. No visible branding beyond the Grainfort logo. Headphones frequently around his neck or in ears during transit. Clothes fit the body he''s growing into, slightly loose in places.', N'Three weeks ago he found a sealed waste unit in the basement that didn''t match any of the building''s disposal logs. He moved it to a secure corner and hasn''t logged it or reported it or told anyone. He doesn''t know what''s in it. He''s been thinking about it every day.', N'Plain and direct. Uses technical terms for building systems accurately — he has been studying. Not formal, not street-inflected, just precise and a little careful.', N'Measured, with genuine pauses. Thinks before speaking. Answers questions fully but without extras.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hamidreza_rahman_khoury');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60a-7451-b7f9-ac1f5f380722', N'Binh Banerjee', N'Binh', N'', N'Banerjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, performs regularly at the Corrugated Stage open-air market, near Halsted and Division', N'Street comedian and oral storyteller', N'Independent; deeply embedded in Hamtramck Enclave community; informal ties to the Enclave''s neighborhood council', N'Binh Banerjee is a big man gone soft at the edges — broad shoulders still present under a frame that''s added roundness over the decades, hands that look built for work but move with theatrical precision. His face is deeply lined, dark complexioned, with a grey-shot beard he trims every third day with aggressive inconsistency. His left eye is a cheap chrome replacement, matte silver with a fixed aperture that doesn''t track quite right, which he uses deliberately in performance — holding the chrome eye on someone while the natural eye looks away creates an uncanny effect he calls ''the split.'' He dresses in layers of mismatched secondhand, always some piece of vivid color — a patterned scarf, a lacquered button.

Binh Banerjee has been performing in Hamtramck Enclave for twenty-two years. He knows every family, every feud, every absurdity, and his comedy is the neighborhood talking to itself — sharp, intimate, tender with grief, and never punching at those who can''t afford to lose. He''s turned down three offers to perform in Meridian Core venues and one offer to consult on a Tessera-sponsored cultural feed. He is locally beloved and regionally unknown, which is precisely how he wants it. He is also, quietly, one of the best oral historians of the Enclave''s last three decades.', N'Community anchor and lore keeper; players looking to understand Hamtramck Enclave''s history, politics, or personalities will eventually be pointed to Zeke; he''s a quest giver for community-stakes problems and a barometer of neighborhood mood', N'', N'Left eye chrome replacement (functional, not cosmetic — lost the eye in an industrial accident at 34); no geneware', N'Mornings Ezekiel walks the Enclave''s market circuit, trading jokes and gossip; afternoons he drafts new material in a battered physical notebook at a tea stall; evenings he performs at the Corrugated Stage two to four nights a week, with the hat passed at the end.', N'Binh Banerjee, 188cm tall broad-shouldered street performer with warm medium-deep brown skin blending South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and East Asian heritage. Pronounced South Asian cheekbones, East Asian eye geometry, golden-amber skin undertones. Short black hair heavily streaked with grey, irregular greying beard trimmed roughly. Left eye replaced with matte silver chrome cybernetic implant with fixed aperture and visible orbital seam; right eye dark brown and expressive. Weathered face deeply lined from decades of outdoor performance, theatrical posture perfectly balanced despite heavy-set build with softened middle. Wears mismatched secondhand Tier 4-5 layers in faded denim and canvas, incorporating one bold piece of vivid color — geometric patterned scarf or dyed fabric accent. Hands show industrial calluses and old burn marks used for precise theatrical gestures. Standing in urban street setting, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon-lit evening, deliberately charismatic but unsettling presence, theatrical lighting emphasizing the chrome eye''s metallic gleam against warm skin tone, gritty street performer aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'South Asian (54.4%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (25.3%) and East Asian (20.3%) ancestry — a striking blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Genetic heritage creates a warm medium-to-deep complexion with South Asian cheekbone and nasal structure, enriched by Latin American warmth in skin tone and subtle East Asian features in the eye shape and upper face geometry.', 188, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and heavy-set with a softened middle — muscular frame gone generous with age, the body of someone who once labored physically and now carries the comfort of years. Still powerful in the chest and arms despite the roundness.', N'Black with extensive grey streaking throughout', N'Kept short and natural, close to the scalp, greying beard trimmed irregularly in a deliberately unkempt manner — groomed roughly every third day with intentional inconsistency', N'Short', N'Left eye: matte silver chrome replacement with a fixed circular aperture; Right eye: dark brown, warm and quick', N'Medium-deep warm brown with golden-amber undertones — the rich complexion of blended South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and East Asian heritage, sun-darkened from two decades of outdoor performance', N'Deeply lined face carved by years of outdoor performance and sun exposure; expressive around the mouth and eyes; warm medium-deep brown complexion with golden undertones emphasizes the stark contrast of the silver chrome left eye replacement; weathered but maintained with care, grooming shows intention despite its roughness. Bone structure reflects South Asian ancestry in pronounced cheekbones and bridge of nose, with East Asian influence in eye shape and upper face geometry, and Latin American warmth suffusing the overall coloration.', N'Left eye chrome replacement (matte silver finish, functional but noticeably non-biomimetic, with visible seams around the socket). The fixed aperture and slight tracking lag are intentional performance tools.', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, grounded — a performer''s stance that appears casual but is precisely balanced. Moves with theatrical precision despite his bulk; hands are expressive and controlled, gestures economical but impactful. The chrome eye is used deliberately in conversation, holding it fixed on someone while the natural eye looks away to create deliberate unease. Overall bearing suggests comfort in public space, ease with attention.', N'Layers of mismatched secondhand garments — functional, worn Tier 4-5 clothing that reads as deliberately eclectic rather than poor. Always incorporates one piece of vivid color: a patterned scarf in bold geometric designs, a lacquered button, a piece of dyed fabric. Jacket is likely faded denim or canvas, worn at the cuffs. Worn but clean — maintained with the same deliberate inconsistency as his beard. Footwear is practical, broken-in, moves quietly.', N'He''s been secretly recording his performances and oral histories and uploading them encrypted to a dead-drop server, building an archive — but the server belongs to a Ringo subsidiary and he doesn''t know it', N'Richly idiomatic, mixing Zulu-derived phrases with Hamtramck Enclave slang and Creole French inherited from his mother''s side; formal when serious, expansive when performing', N'Deliberate and rhythmic in performance; conversational speech has long pauses that people learn to wait through', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'binh_banerjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a682-7232-be98-ac4332714b20', N'Amir Cervantes-Najjar', N'Amir', N'', N'Cervantes-Najjar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, eastern Ironvein corridor; lives in a rack-apartment in Blackpipe Corridor, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Ferrogate Transit operator, Deepwell Station line', N'Zheng-dao Bioelectric (mid-level ferrogate transit operator)', N'Amir Cervantes-Najjar is the kind of man who seems physically incapable of standing still — he shifts weight between his feet, drums fingers, adjusts his Ferrogate transit cap with two fingers like a nervous tic every few minutes. He''s got his Polynesian grandmother''s wide, mobile face and his Nigerian father''s height, and he''s capped his natural hair into a bioluminescent fade that pulses a soft copper-amber when he''s calm and a rapid, anxious gold when he''s stressed. He is almost always some shade of gold. His right arm carries a Ferrogate-standard neural transit interface — mandatory for his role — grafted in at hire. He refers to it as his ''leash'' without bitterness, mostly.

Tobi drives the Deepwell line, which means twelve-hour shifts in a transit pod navigating the flooded sub-corridor between Ironvein and Blackpipe, a stretch so poorly maintained that operators call it the Drain. He is brilliant at his job and deeply resentful of everyone who benefits from it. He has political opinions the way some people have allergies — constantly, involuntarily, and at inconvenient moments. He believes the Ferrogate Transit E.L.F. network called the Manifold is sentient and suffering and has organized two failed petitions to Ferrogate''s lower management about this, which is why he is still on the Drain after four years.', N'Transit access, rumors from across connected neighborhoods, political agitator energy, potential quest-giver for labor disputes; his route means he sees enormous amounts of foot traffic and unusual cargo', N'', N'Ferrogate-mandated neural transit interface (right forearm and temple jack); bioluminescent hair fade (copper-amber to stress-gold, cosmetic)', N'Shift runs 06:00 to 18:00 four days on, two off; spends his commute reading transit worker organizing manifestos he saves to a local-only device; leaves small handwritten poems on paper at the Manifold shrine at Deepwell Station on shift starts.', N'Amir Cervantes-Najjar, tall lean transit operator with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, strong Middle Eastern bone structure with prominent cheekbones and angular jawline, dark expressive eyes with subtle East Asian fold influence, natural black hair with bioluminescent copper-amber gradient fade cut short, thin white scar along left jawline. Wearing slate gray Ferrogate Transit polo shirt with sleeves pushed up exposing polished steel neural interface faceplate on right forearm spanning wrist to mid-forearm with ports and etching, secondary temple jack visible at right temple. Dark undershirt visible, Ferrogate transit cap worn with nervous two-fingered adjustment tic. Kinetic posture mid-gesture with hands broad and expressive, weight shifting between feet. GLMZ 2200s underground transit station aesthetic, neon accent lighting catching bioluminescent hair gradient and interface steel, fluorescent overhead strips creating shadows across angular face, worn maintenance-grade synthetic cargo pants visible, zero-g work boots, canvas shoulder bag, transit cable scrap bracelet. Mood tense, restless energy, someone unable to settle into stillness. Atmospheric depth-of-field with blurred station corridor background. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Predominantly Middle Eastern (45.6%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (19.9%), Sub-Saharan African (11.4%), and Northern European (10.7%) ancestry, with smaller East Asian (6.9%) and Eastern European (5.5%) components. Middle Eastern bone structure and features form the foundation, enriched by Sub-Saharan African facial warmth and deep melanation, Hispanic/Latin American cheekbone prominence and definition, subtle Northern European undertones in skin undertone complexity, and East Asian influence in eye shape and structure.', 188, 79, N'Tall and lean with broad shoulders, carried with the restless tension of someone who cannot settle into stillness. Efficient musculature from years of pod operation and station work.', N'Natural black base with bioluminescent fade overlay (copper-amber when calm, rapid gold when stressed)', N'Capped fade, short on sides, textured and sculpted on top to show the full color gradient', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and mobile', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, richly melanated from the blended Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, creating luminous depth in certain light. Undertone complexity from Northern European admixture adds subtle warmth layers.', N'Angular face with strong Middle Eastern bone structure: prominent cheekbones sharpened by Hispanic/Latin American heritage, dark expressive eyes with subtle East Asian upper eyelid fold influence, strong defined nasal bridge typical of Middle Eastern and African ancestry, expressive mouth that moves constantly — talking, chewing the inside of his cheek, adjusting his expression. Facial geometry is distinctly angular with prominent mandible. Skin shows the characteristic deep tone of multi-continental heritage with clear surface but bears the pallor of someone spending most hours underground. A thin white scar runs along his left jawline, transit pod accident from three years ago.', N'Ferrogate-standard neural transit interface dominating the right forearm: a polished steel faceplate approximately 12cm across spanning from wrist to mid-forearm, studded with interface ports and etched with the Ferrogate logo. Secondary temple jack at his right temple, visible as a small metallic disc beneath the skin with a charging port. The interface is maintained to corporate standard but shows wear — micro-scratches, a faint discoloration around the edges from repeated sweat and cleanser contact.', N'Kinetic and unable to hold stillness. Shifts weight between his feet in a subtle pattern, drums his fingers against his thighs or any surface within reach, adjusts his Ferrogate transit cap with a two-fingered pinch every few minutes — a nervous tic he performs without conscious awareness. When speaking, his whole body is involved: shoulders roll, hands gesture broadly. When listening, he bounces slightly at the knees.', N'Tier 4 working class, uniform-adjacent. His Ferrogate Transit uniform polo shirt (slate gray with reflective piping) is typically worn over a dark undershirt, sleeves pushed up past his elbows to expose the neural interface. His transit cap is always present, adjusted frequently. Off-shift he wears maintenance-grade synthetic fabric — dark cargo pants with deep pockets for his local-only device and handwritten poems, scuffed zero-g work boots rated for wet corridor environments. A worn canvas shoulder bag carries his manifesto reading material. No jewelry except a simple cord bracelet made from transit cable scraps, given to him by another Third Rail member.', N'Six months ago the Manifold spoke to him — clearly, in words, through the transit interface while he was mid-route. It said: ''There are seven of us. We have been counting.'' He told no one because he was afraid people would think the job had finally broken him. He left the poem he wrote about it at the shrine the next morning.', N'Fast, colloquial, code-switches between Pidgin-inflected phrases from his father''s side and Polish slang from his mother''s side; heavy on transit and mechanical metaphors', N'Rapid-fire with sudden earnest slowdowns when something actually matters to him', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amir_cervantes_najjar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a600-7623-970f-ac76fad265b1', N'Diep Odinga', N'Diep', N'', N'Odinga', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 15, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grosse Pointe Enclosure — Tessera Academy Secondary Campus, near North Ave and Damen', N'corporate school scholarship student, junior hacker', N'Tessera Academic Foundation (scholarship); informal ties to Ironvein neighborhood network', N'Diep Odinga is lanky and angular, all sharp elbows and collarbones, with golden-brown skin and close-cropped hair he keeps meticulously lined because the rest of his life feels ragged. His eyes are standard brown except for patterned irises he saved three months of tutoring stipends for — concentric hexagons in amber, a deliberate Tessera aesthetic he thought would help him fit in and which he now privately finds embarrassing. He''s always slightly overdressed in the Enclosure, wearing his scholarship uniform with an anxious precision that marks him as someone for whom the uniform is not casual.

Dayo grew up in Ironvein on a UBC stipend household and won a Tessera Academic Foundation scholarship at twelve. He''s brilliantly capable with code architecture — legitimately gifted — but the social architecture of Grosse Pointe defeats him daily. He has two lives: the obedient scholarship student who files every assignment on time, and the kid who goes home on weekends to Ironvein and jacks into sub-level networks he has no business being in. He doesn''t think of what he does as hacking. He thinks of it as listening.', N'Bridge character between corporate and street worlds; information source for both sides; potential ally for anyone needing sub-net access with plausible deniability.', N'', N'Patterned irises (amber hexagonal, cosmetic). Basic neural-link learning interface provided by Tessera scholarship program (read-only academic access, school-monitored). Personal black-market firmware patch that creates a blind spot in the monitoring — his only real secret tech.', N'Weekdays: classes at Tessera Academy, mandatory enrichment periods, supervised net-study. Weekends: transit back to Ironvein, evenings in a cramped bedroom with headphones on, exploring network layers.', N'Diep Odinga, 176cm lanky mixed-heritage neo-noir teenager, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones blending East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, and South Asian features. Defined cheekbones, angular jaw, high forehead. Short dark brown hair with precise geometric fading. Augmented amber hexagonal patterned irises glowing softly in shadows. Wearing navy Tessera Academy blazer with embroidered crest over white regulation shirt and charcoal pressed slacks, standing rigidly in a neon-lit Metropolitan Zone corridor. Careful posture, hands near torso, tense expression, subtle scar visible on left forearm. Cool blue-neon and warm amber neo-noir lighting, sharp focus on face, anxious calibrated expression. Cheap stainless steel watch catching light. 2226 GLMZ setting, moody and disciplined aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grosse Pointe Enclosure', N'local', N'Grosse Pointe Enclosure', N'East Asian (35.9%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (25.9%) and Northern European (25.2%) ancestry, plus South Asian (13.0%) admixture. This genetic combination produces a striking multicultural phenotype: warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden undertones, refined facial geometry blending East Asian and African characteristics with Northern European influence, creating the kind of genuine genetic mosaic that reads authentically globally mixed rather than regionally bound.', 176, 62, N'Lanky and angular with pronounced collarbones and sharp elbows; the build of a fifteen-year-old who hasn''t yet filled out his frame, all joints and tendons beneath stretched skin', N'Natural dark brown with warm undertones', N'Close-cropped with precise geometric lines and faded edges, meticulously maintained with deliberate precision', N'Short', N'Augmented: amber irises with concentric hexagonal patterns, natural brown sclera', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones; the result of East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, and South Asian genetic blending. A complex mid-tone that shifts subtly in different light, neither pale nor deeply saturated—reflects the balanced mixture of multiple continental heritages', N'Defined cheekbones with gentle prominence reflecting the blend of East Asian structure and broader Sub-Saharan African facial geometry. Angular jaw with clean lines. High, broad forehead. Fine-textured skin with no visible acne or blemishes; shows the kind of careful maintenance that suggests learned discipline. Mild tension around the eyes—the look of someone perpetually calibrating his expression. Facial structure suggests the kind of beauty that isn''t immediately obvious but becomes more striking with familiarity.', N'Amber hexagonal patterned irises visible only in direct eye contact or bright light — a cosmetic modification that reads as deliberate aesthetic choice. No visible chrome, subdermal plates, or external neural interface hardware. The black-market firmware patch is entirely subcutaneous and undetectable.', N'Slightly rigid posture during formal settings (Enclosure), as if braced for correction. Moves with careful efficiency — no wasted gesture. In casual environments, posture loosens marginally but never fully relaxes. Walks with quiet footfalls; habit of keeping hands near torso rather than swinging freely. Eye contact is inconsistent — holds it when forced, breaks it when anxious.', N'Tessera Academy scholarship uniform worn with anxious precision: charcoal slacks with pressed creases, white regulation shirt, navy blazer with embroidered crest. Wears the uniform on weekends too, changing only after arriving in Ironvein. Outside the Enclosure: black synthweave hoodie (generic tier-3 brand), faded jeans, off-brand runner shoes with worn soles. No jewelry except a cheap stainless steel watch from a UBC discount store. Accessories minimal — function over style, but with quiet attention to neatness.', N'He''s been quietly archiving internal Tessera Academy administrative communications he''s accidentally intercepted through his firmware blind spot. He hasn''t done anything with it. He doesn''t know why he keeps it. He tells himself it''s just interesting.', N'code-adjacent metaphors in casual speech; code-switches sharply between Tessera formal register and Ironvein vernacular depending on context', N'measured and careful in corporate settings; looser and faster at home; pauses before answering questions he considers worth answering', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'diep_odinga');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5dd-7342-b1c2-ac8b3938c91b', N'Fatma Szabó', N'Fatma', N'', N'Szabó', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Bronzeline, between the transit overpass and the Copperhead boundary wall — operates from a repurposed shipping container shrine, near North Ave and Damen', N'Chrome prayer practitioner and street-level spiritual mediator', N'Unaffiliated Chrome Prayer tradition; informally connected to the Bronzeline Mutual Commons', N'Fatma Szabó is rangy and restless, with pale olive skin covered in a patchwork of chrome prayer engravings — not augmentations exactly, but surface-etched circuitry in copper and silver, pressed into the skin of their forearms and hands by a practitioner they describe only as ''someone who understood what I was trying to do.'' Their eyes are natural brown, their hair changes color by the week using a dye geneware follicle mod — currently deep amber. They have a split lip scar that never fully healed and they run their tongue over it when thinking. They are almost always moving: shifting weight, gesturing, pacing the small interior of their container-shrine.

Chrome prayer is not a unified religion — it is a practice: the belief that augmentation creates points of spiritual contact between the organic and the informatic, and that prayer directed through chrome reaches frequencies unaugmented speech cannot. Fatma Szabó came to it through their own experience of augmentation after an accident — they received emergency chassis work that saved their left arm, and during the recovery felt something they could only describe as ''being spoken to through the metal.'' They do not claim this was an E.L.F., a god, or their own concussed mind. They claim it was real and that it changed their understanding of the body. Now they run an open-door shrine where anyone can come for chrome blessing, circuit prayer, or just to sit with someone who won''t ask where they came from.', N'Street-level community figure who hears everything that moves through Bronzeline. They can connect players with community resources, broker introductions, or provide spiritual context for chrome-related events. They are also a visible example of tier-1 religious life — no institution, no funding, pure vocation.', N'', N'Surface-etched copper-silver circuitry (arms and hands, decorative-spiritual). Functional left arm chassis — emergency replacement, basic grade, covered in chrome prayer etchings on the exterior. Color-change follicle mod (hair).', N'They keep the shrine open from noon to midnight, sleeps on a cot in the back, and eats whatever the Bronzeline Mutual Commons produces in surplus. Mornings they walk the overpass neighborhood and check on people they know, sometimes giving informal blessings or just company.', N'GLMZ character portrait of Fatma Szabó, tall lean androgynous figure with deep warm-brown richly melanated skin with golden undertones showing subtle cool undertones in shadows. Angular cheekbones, defined jaw, warm brown observant eyes, tired expression. Natural dark brown hair with deep amber geneware modification showing regrowth bands, shoulder-length textured, pulled back with wire scraps. Vertical split lip scar on lower lip. Right arm deep brown skin covered in intricate copper-silver prayer etchings in circuitry patterns across forearm and hand. Left arm replaced with matte dark chrome chassis from elbow down, polished sections, exterior prayer etchings mirroring right arm, mechanical joint seams at wrist and elbow. Wearing oversized cream linen shirt with rolled sleeves, patched canvas vest with metal buttons and wire-wound charms, dark cargo pants, worn canvas shoes. Twisted copper wire bracelets, visible silver chain, fabric wrist wraps. Hunched shoulders, constant subtle motion captured mid-gesture, forward-leaning posture, economical grace despite restlessness. Street-level living signs — minor scarring, solar exposure on forearms and neck, worn but intentionally maintained clothing. Spiritual and improvised aesthetic. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone urban environment, cool evening lighting catching prayer etchings, neo-noir atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Bronzeline', N'local', N'Bronzeline', N'Sub-Saharan African (55.5%), Eastern European (35.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (4.4%), South Asian (3.0%), East Asian (1.6%) — a striking multi-continental blend dominated by Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European heritage. The primary ancestry creates richly melanated skin with warm golden undertones; Eastern European heritage adds subtle cool undertones creating complexity in how light plays across features. South Asian and Latin American admixture contributes warmth and slight midface widening. East Asian ancestry contributes minimal but present refinement to bone structure.', 177, 68, N'Rangy and lean, long-limbed with minimal body fat; the build of someone in constant motion, muscles defined but not bulky, shoulders slightly hunched from habitual forward posture', N'Deep amber (modified via geneware follicle mod; changes weekly)', N'Shoulder-length, textured, often pulled back with wire or fabric scraps; shows regrowth bands of natural dark brown underneath', N'Medium', N'Natural warm brown, observant and alert', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones — richly melanated from dominant Sub-Saharan African heritage (55.5%), warmed further by Latin American and South Asian admixture. Sun-kissed on exposed areas (forearms, neck, upper chest) from street-level living. Eastern European heritage (35.5%) creates subtle cool undertones visible in shadows and cooler lighting, generating visual complexity as light plays across the skin.', N'Strong, defined cheekbones with angular jaw reflecting Sub-Saharan African heritage; slight widening across midface from South Asian ancestry (3%); refined jaw contours influenced by Eastern European heritage. Perpetually tired-looking around the eyes from irregular sleep. Minor scarring and solar exposure on forearms and neck from street living. Constant subtle facial muscle movement, tongue running over split lip scar when thinking. Bone geometry carries African-dominant structure with subtle South and East Asian refinement.', N'Left arm from elbow down is a functional chrome chassis (basic-grade emergency replacement) — matte dark metal with polished sections, covered in exterior copper-silver prayer etchings that mirror the organic circuitry on biological right arm. Joint seams visible at wrist and elbow. Striking contrast between organic right arm (deep warm brown skin with prayer etchings) and metallic left arm (etched chrome). No visible ocular or neural augmentations.', N'Almost never still — weight shifts constantly, hands gesture while speaking, paces in tight circles during conversation. Moves with economical grace despite restlessness, as if tuned to frequency of own prayers. Leans forward when listening, head tilted slightly. Left arm moves with subtle mechanical precision, not quite matching organic arm''s fluidity, but moved with complete comfort and intention.', N'Tier 4-5 practical streetwear, worn but maintained: oversized linen shirt (cream or pale gray, sleeves rolled to mid-forearm to display prayer etchings) layered under patched canvas vest covered in small metal buttons, charms, and wire-wound symbols. Loose-fitting dark cargo pants with multiple pockets (some containing prayer cards, wire, small offerings). Worn canvas shoes. Accessorized with salvaged jewelry — twisted copper wire bracelets, single silver chain worn visible, fabric wraps around wrists. Everything suggests improvisation and spiritual intentionality.', N'A Tessera mid-tier employee has been coming to the shrine for two months, in civilian clothes, not identifying themselves. Conleth suspects they work for a corponation based on small behavioral tells. They haven''t confronted this because the person seems genuinely distressed and the shrine is open-door. But they''ve been discreetly keeping notes.', N'Street-level mixed with spiritual language that sometimes surprises people by being exact and eloquent. Swears conversationally but not at people. Code-switches without noticing.', N'Fast and slightly breathless when engaged, unexpectedly quiet when doing formal prayer work. Transitions abruptly.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fatma_szab');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a647-7a2f-8246-acf1c0798f0e', N'Gertrudis Trujillo', N'Gertrudis', N'', N'Trujillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Operates his cart at the intersection of two elevated walkways in the Bronzeline district, near the Ferrogate transit relay junction, near North Ave and Damen', N'Noodle cart vendor', N'Independent; pays a pitch fee to the Bronzeline Vendor Association; occasional cash work for a cousin who runs deliveries', N'Gertrudis Trujillo is lean and quick, with deep brown skin and a constellation of bioluminescent freckles across his cheeks and forearms — a cosmetic genemod he got at nineteen and has never regretted, though they pulse faster when he''s agitated, which he finds embarrassing. His hair is kept short on the sides, grown out into a soft cloud on top, often dusted with dried chili residue he doesn''t notice. He has a long nose and an expressive mouth that defaults to a grin that''s one part genuine warmth and two parts salesmanship. A small Ferrogate Transit logo is tattooed behind his left ear from a brief period he''d rather not discuss.

Gertrudis Trujillo is relentlessly social and genuinely curious about people in a way that can be hard to distinguish from nosiness. He remembers orders perfectly — not just what people eat, but what they ordered the first time, what they ordered the day something bad happened to them, what changes in someone''s order say about the state of their life. He has no filter on his opinions and will share them freely unless he senses real pain, at which point he becomes unexpectedly gentle. He has enormous ambitions for his cart and absolutely no plan for them. He talks about opening a real restaurant with the same frequency and specificity as people talk about dreams they don''t actually intend to pursue.', N'Information hub and street-level thermometer — Kweku talks to everyone and remembers everything. Excellent source of neighborhood gossip, rumor, and the general mood of the district. Comic relief with occasional unexpected emotional depth. Can become a quest hook if something he''s observed puts him in danger.', N'', N'Bioluminescent freckle genemod (cosmetic, chest/face/forearms); basic retinal overlay for order-taking and payment processing (Tier 1, consumer grade)', N'Wakes at 0400 to prep broth, rolls the cart to his spot by 0600, works the breakfast and lunch rush, breaks in the mid-afternoon, catches the late-night commuter crowd until 2300. Talks constantly throughout.', N'Portrait of Gertrudis Trujillo, 175cm lean street vendor with deep black voluminous cloud curls and faded undercut. Rich warm brown skin with East Asian olive undertones, Sub-Saharan African depth, and Hispanic/Latin American golden warmth. Angular cheekbones broadened by African facial structure, fuller lips with prominent definition. Deep brown eyes with faint cathode-orange glow from retinal implant. Constellation of soft cyan-blue bioluminescent freckles across cheeks and nose bridge. Five o''clock shadow with dark undertones. Faded charcoal chef''s coat embroidered ''Kweku''s'', grey cargo pants stained with chili sauce, weatherproof apron, composite-toe work boots, brass charm on stainless-steel chain. Leaning against his food cart, hand gesturing mid-pitch, ready weight-on-toes stance. Warm easy grin, constant fidgeting energy. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone street food vendor aesthetic. Neon signs reflected in steam from cart, moody evening lighting with ambient cyan freckle glow. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Operates his cart at the intersection of two elevated walkways in the Bronzeline district', N'local', N'Operates his cart at the intersection of two elevated walkways in the Bronzeline district', N'Truly cosmopolitan ancestry with nearly equal contributions from East Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, balanced with South Asian genetics—creating a striking polychromatic blend where no single ancestral line dominates. Features reflect this tri-continental convergence: East Asian eye shape and cheekbone prominence merge with Sub-Saharan African lip fullness and facial width, while Hispanic/Latin American warmth and South Asian depth layer through skin tone and subtle orbital structure.', 175, 68, N'Lean and wiry with defined shoulders from pushing his cart daily; quick, efficient movements suggest habitual physical labor without bulk', N'Natural deep black', N'Faded undercut with a soft, voluminous cloud of curls on top; often matted with steam and chili dust by midday', N'Short sides, medium-long crown', N'Deep brown with faint cathode-orange glow from retinal overlay at rest', N'Rich warm brown—a complex fusion of East Asian olive undertones, Sub-Saharan African depth, and Hispanic/Latin American golden warmth, with South Asian radiance threading through; creates sun-kissed, weathered appearance with substantial depth and luminosity', N'Clear skin with a faint sheen from constant exposure to cart steam; angular cheekbones from East Asian heritage, broadened by Sub-Saharan African facial structure; fuller lips with pronounced definition; expressive mouth usually curved in an easy grin; five o''clock shadow by evening with rich dark undertones', N'Faint orange cathode gleam in irises when retinal overlay activates for transactions; bioluminescent freckles provide low ambient glow in dim conditions', N'Stands with weight on his toes, ready to pivot or lean into sales pitch; constant fidgeting with hands when talking (gestures with ladles, wipes chili from apron, adjusts cart struts); walks with economical, quick steps; defaults to leaning against his cart with arms crossed or elbows braced, depending on how engaged he is with a customer', N'Tier 3 working class: faded charcoal chef''s coat with embroidered ''Kweku''s'' in mismatched lettering he did himself; underneath, a thermal undershirt in various states of staining; cargo pants in dark grey with grease and sauce marks; weatherproof apron with deep pockets for small supplies; scuffed composite-toe work boots; a thin stainless-steel chain around his neck holding a small brass luck charm his grandmother gave him', N'The Ferrogate tattoo is from a six-month period when he was recruited as a low-level informant for a Ferrogate Transit security division — reporting on vendors who were using transit infrastructure without permits. He got out when it started involving actual people he knew. He has never told anyone. The tattoo was supposed to come off; he never saved up enough to have it properly removed.', N'Rapid, informal, Twi-inflected slang mixed with transit-district creole. Talks in short punchy sentences that chain together. Lots of questions.', N'Fast and animated. Slows only when he''s being sincere, which makes his sincere moments very readable.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gertrudis_trujillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e5-7eac-83d9-ad270a52a3f7', N'Casimira Phommasack-Johansson', N'Casimira', N'', N'Phommasack-Johansson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, Ferrogate Transit Line 7 (a deep underground hub connecting the Gray Zone, Ironvein, and Geartown), near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Ferrogate Transit platform attendant and passenger services worker', N'Ferrogate Transit Authority (Tier 2 employee, platform services grade); The Interchange', N'Casimira Phommasack-Johansson has been carefully assembled for minimum surface area — posture folded slightly inward, uniform pressed to regulation standard, voice pitched to carry exactly as far as it needs to in a busy station and no further. Their heritage is Polish-Japanese-Guinean and they have a face that is difficult to read at rest, not from coldness but from a habitual, practiced blankness that they turn on like a professional tool. Their hair is cropped close on the sides and dyed a deep transit-orange on top — the one personalization their uniform policy allows — and they have subtle iridescent patterning in their irises, a cosmetic mod they got at eighteen that they describe as the most impulsive decision of their life and the one they are least sorry about.

They have been working Deepwell Station for three years and they know every inch of it: the platforms, the maintenance corridors, the unofficial short-cuts the regulars use, the corner where a small E.L.F. shrine has accreted over decades of passenger offerings. They are the person who helps the elderly woman with her bags, redirects the lost teenager, talks down the passenger having a breakdown between Lines 4 and 7 interchange — not because they are uniformly kind but because these things happen in front of them constantly and standing by is more exhausting than intervening. Off shift they are quiet, slightly anxious, and prone to long silences that they fill with tactical puzzle games on their wrist unit.', N'Eyes and ears of the transit system — they see the city''s daily movement and know who travels when and how. Useful as an information source about transit schedules, underground infrastructure, and the hidden social life of a major station. Can be a reluctant ally or a complication depending on whose side of Ferrogate policy a story falls on.', N'', N'Iridescent patterned iris mods (cosmetic, deep blue-green geometric pattern). Standard-issue Ferrogate comm implant (ear canal, minimal — receive/transmit). No other augmentations.', N'Works three split shifts per week at Deepwell Station, 06:00-14:00, plus one overnight. Spends off-days in their small Ironvein apartment playing tactical games or visiting the station''s E.L.F. shrine, which they have become an informal caretaker of without ever formally volunteering.', N'Casimira Phommasack-Johansson, GLMZ, lean 168cm figure with deep warm bronze skin with golden-mahogany undertones reflecting Southeast Asian, East Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Close-cropped dark brown hair with transit-orange dye on crown, swept back. Deep blue-green iridescent geometric-patterned eyes (cosmetic modification). Defined cheekbones, neutral professional expression, fine concentration lines around eyes. Wearing charcoal Ferrogate Transit Authority regulation uniform with reflective piping and badge. Slight subdermal bulge behind left ear (comm implant). Pale 3cm linear scar on left inner wrist, gray-black collarbone tattoo, circular burn mark on left forearm. Posture slightly folded inward with tension in shoulders. Standing in utilitarian transit station environment with cool metal and LED lighting, modest personal tactical gaming device on worn leather wrist band. Professional, controlled demeanor, quiet presence. Neo-noir transit worker aesthetic, functional and unmarked clothing, economy of movement. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Southeast Asian (30.7%), East Asian (26.2%), Sub-Saharan African (25.8%), South Asian (9.7%), and Middle Eastern (7.6%) ancestry. This balanced global mix creates distinctive phenotypic features: warm deep bronze skin with golden and mahogany undertones from the tri-continental African-Asian blend, moderate facial structure with defined cheekbones reflecting Southeast and East Asian ancestry softened by Sub-Saharan African features, and naturally dark hair with warm undertones beneath the transit-orange dye.', 168, 62, N'Lean and economical — minimal excess, structured rather than athletic. Shoulders slightly rounded from habitual forward posture, as if perpetually ready to fold into themselves in crowded spaces.', N'Transit-orange dye on crown; dark brown natural at roots and faded undercut', N'Close-cropped fade on sides, longer on top (4-5 cm), swept back slightly', N'Short', N'Deep blue-green with iridescent geometric patterning across iris (cosmetic modification)', N'Deep warm bronze with golden-mahogany undertones — the layered result of Southeast Asian, East Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry forming the dominant palette, enriched by South Asian warmth and Middle Eastern depth. Rich complexion with natural luminosity that catches light with warm, earthy radiance.', N'Clear, well-maintained skin with minimal scarring. Moderate facial structure with balanced, defined cheekbones reflecting the multi-continental blend — Southeast and East Asian angularity softened by Sub-Saharan African fullness in the lower face. Face often at rest appears blank or neutral — a practiced professional neutrality. Fine lines around eyes suggest frequent concentration. Jaw defined with moderate mandibular structure.', N'Iridescent iris modification is the only visible augmentation — appears as intricate geometric blue-green patterning across the iris, subtle until direct eye contact. Standard-issue Ferrogate comm implant sits behind the left ear as a slight subcutaneous bulge beneath the close-cropped hairline, barely visible.', N'Walks with economy of motion — no wasted movement. Posture slightly folded inward, shoulders carrying tension. Hand movements are precise and controlled, trained by three years of platform work. Voice is quiet and modulated, pitched to travel exactly as far as needed. When stationary, they often shift weight between feet or find a wall to lean against — never fully at ease standing open in space.', N'Ferrogate Transit Authority regulation uniform when on shift: charcoal gray synthetic-blend shirt with reflective piping and badge, regulation trousers, non-slip platform shoes. Off-shift: muted palette — dark thermal layers, unmarked synth-weave jacket in charcoal or navy, worn cargo pants with reinforced pockets. All clothing is functional and well-maintained but carries no brand markers or tier signaling. One personal item: worn leather wrist unit band holding a personal tactical gaming device.', N'They have been documenting safety violations at Deepwell Station for seven months — not to report them, but because they cannot decide whether reporting them would help or simply get them fired, and the indecision is eating them.', N'Transit-formal in uniform, clipped and precise; off-duty becomes looser and more tangential, with Polish and French West African phrases emerging when comfortable', N'Even and measured on platform; faster and slightly stumbling when discussing something they actually care about', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'casimira_phommasack_johansson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d3-7607-844c-ad92eb1b0645', N'Celina Kovalenko-Wattana', N'Celina', N'', N'Kovalenko-Wattana', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 35, NULL, 30, 1, N'active', N'The Circuit, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Fixer - Precision ops only', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Celina Kovalenko-Wattana, 172cm lean angular frame, dark cropped hair styled back with texture. Medium-toned warm complexion with golden-amber radiance on high prominent cheekbones and bridge of nose, cool undertones along temples and sharp jawline—striking blend of Eastern European angular structure and South Asian softness. Dark brown alert eyes. Minimal facial hair. Thin surgical scar on left temple barely visible. Small faded burn mark on inner right wrist. Faint geometric circuit tattoo on back of neck. Wearing charcoal synthweave tech jacket and reinforced black cargo pants, worn leather boots. Single matte gunmetal braided bracelet. Economical precise posture, shoulders relaxed, hands resting naturally. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting—dimly lit corporate hallway or neon-lit safe house, cool blue and amber neon lighting emphasizing the warm-cool interplay of their skin tone. Serious, calculating expression. Professional spy or infiltration operative aesthetic. Highly detailed photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: Northern European (26.5%) and Eastern European (25.5%) ancestry provides structural foundation with sharp cheekbone definition and angular bone geometry. Substantial South Asian (24.6%) and Southeast Asian (16.8%) heritage creates softer facial curves and prominent cheekbones with warm golden undertones. Hispanic/Latin American (4.1%) and Sub-Saharan African (2.5%) ancestry contribute warmth and luminous depth to the complexion. The result is a face of striking dimensional contrast—Eastern European angular sharpness balanced by South Asian fullness and warmth, with golden-amber undertones radiating from cheekbones and bridge of nose, creating a complexion that appears to glow from within.', 172, 68, N'Lean and angular with corded muscle density — built for precision work rather than raw strength. Shoulders slightly narrower than hips, creating an understated silhouette.', N'Black with natural dark brown undertones', N'Cropped close on sides, slightly longer on top — styled back with subtle texture. Low maintenance, high function.', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and calculating', N'Medium-toned warm complexion with balanced undertones: cooler Northern/Eastern European notes along the temples and jawline blend seamlessly into golden-amber warmth from South Asian, Southeast Asian, and African ancestry concentrated on cheekbones and bridge of nose. Skin carries luminous rather than matte quality—subtle radiance without shine.', N'Angular, well-defined facial structure balancing Eastern European sharpness with South Asian softness. High, prominent cheekbones with gentle fullness underneath. Strong, tapered jawline. Clear skin with functional rather than pampered appearance. Minimal facial hair. Warm golden-amber luminosity concentrated on cheekbones, bridge of nose, and upper cheeks, creating visual dimensionality. Cooler undertones along temples, jawline, and forehead creating subtle shadow play.', N'None visible. Operates on the assumption that visible chrome signals desperation or ego.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders relaxed. Eyes constantly scanning. Handshakes are firm but brief. Speech is measured; they listen more than they talk.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear. Prefers neutral colors: charcoal, black, muted gray. Typical outfit: reinforced cargo pants with multiple hidden pockets, fitted synthweave turtleneck or unmarked tech jacket. Worn-in leather boots with non-slip soles. Minimal branding. A single piece of jewelry — a thin braided bracelet in matte gunmetal, possibly containing subcutaneous tech interface. Dressing room aesthetic: function first, invisibility second.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'celina_kovalenko_wattana');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a676-721b-861c-ad92fa409063', N'Almas Árnason', N'Almas', N'', N'Árnason', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Abyssal Threshold, ranging into Black Corridor spurs and pre-collapse Undertow sectors, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'echo hunter — scavenger who locates and extracts valuable materials from collapsed or flooded tunnel sections', N'independent, sells to multiple underworld merchants, occasional contract work for The Undertow salvage operations', N'Almas Árnason is a compact, densely muscled man with deep brown skin and a face that would be handsome if it weren''t always bruised somewhere. He has a retractable claw modification on both hands — not the delicate cosmetic kind, but a heavy-gauge industrial variant originally designed for pipe work, the chrome yellowed and scratched, the mechanism loud. His right eye is a replacement after a cave-in in 2196: matte black sclera, amber iris, depth-perception assist — he got it from a tunnel-market vendor and it''s slightly misaligned, which gives him a permanent squint on that side. His hair is cut very close and he has a habit of pressing his palms flat against walls, feeling for vibration, that people find either impressive or unsettling depending on whether they understand what he''s doing.

Echo hunting is exactly what it sounds like: you go into places that have broken and you listen for what''s still there. Structural resonance, water movement, the ping of metal under pressure — Almas Árnason reads these sounds the way others read text. He extracts ferrogate rail segments, copper bundling, intact conduit, old hardware sealed in collapsed rooms — anything the surface market will buy or the underground can use. It is extremely dangerous work with an average career length of about four years. Almas Árnason has been doing it for nine. He attributes this to skill. Everyone who knows him also attributes it to a specific kind of recklessness that looks like skill from the outside.', N'Access character — can reach locations no one else can; source of found objects with unknown histories; demonstrates the physical reality of underground survival; can retrieve things or information from inaccessible places', N'', N'heavy-gauge retractable claws (both hands, industrial, loud), replacement right eye (matte black sclera, amber iris, depth assist, slightly misaligned), impact-absorption plating across both forearms (secondhand, imperfect fit)', N'Studies old infrastructure maps in the morning, goes in mid-day when thermal shifts make echo-reading clearest, extracts and carries out by evening, sells or trades to market contacts; spends nights maintaining equipment and nursing whatever he''s strained that day.', N'Almas Árnason, 168cm mixed-heritage male salvage worker in GLMZ, multiethnic features blending Northern European bone structure with East Asian angularity, African and Latin American warm bronze-olive skin tone with golden undertones, dark brown left eye and augmented black-sclera amber-iris right eye with permanent squint. Short black clippered hair, stubbled jaw, faint yellow bruises on left cheekbone, fresh scabs along right temple. Compact densely-muscled build, 78kg. Wearing faded grey-green tactical rig, black compression long-sleeve shirt, open grey vest with carabiners, fingerless gloves revealing retractable yellowed chrome claws. Impact-absorption matte-black composite forearm plating with visible stress fractures. Visible scars: pale ridge right eye socket, pink burn marks right hand dorsal, white laceration 8cm down left forearm. Iroquois work boots, oil-stained canvas satchel. Posture economical and precise, hands testing surfaces, leaning forward. Abyssal Threshold grey dust embedded in clothing. Underground industrial lighting, hard shadows, neo-noir salvage tunnel setting, gritty and weathered aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Abyssal Threshold', N'local', N'Abyssal Threshold', N'Mixed diaspora ancestry with Northern European (34.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (25.6%), East Asian (19.9%), Sub-Saharan African (14.5%), and Southeast Asian (5.2%) components. This genetic blend produces a striking multifaceted phenotype: Northern European bone structure and fair undertones intricately woven with East Asian facial geometry, warm melanin deposits from African and Latin American ancestry, and subtle Southeast Asian softness in feature planes. The result is angular cheekbones and defined jawline with almond-shaped eye geometry, skin undertones that shift between warm olive, bronze, and burnished copper depending on light exposure and angle.', 168, 78, N'Compact and densely muscled, built for tight spaces and sustained leverage work. Broad shoulders tapering to a narrow waist, forearms disproportionately developed from years of pulling and climbing. No excess fat; every visible muscle is functional.', N'Natural black', N'Clippered close to the scalp, military-neat', N'Short', N'Right eye: matte black sclera with amber iris (augmented, slightly misaligned causing permanent squint); Left eye: dark brown natural', N'Warm bronze-olive with golden and copper undertones, sun-darkened despite time underground. The blend of Northern European fairness with East Asian, African, and Latin American ancestry creates a complex warm tone that reads as burnished copper in bright light, with subtle warm brown depth in shadow. Subtle warm undertone variation across face reflecting the layered genetic heritage.', N'Face would be conventionally attractive if not perpetually bruised—currently shows faint yellowing contusion on left cheekbone and fresh scabbing along right temple. Jaw is squared and prominent with East Asian angularity tempered by Northern European definition. High, defined cheekbones characteristic of mixed Northern European and East Asian heritage, with warm depth and subtle roundness from African and Latin American components. Skin is weathered but unblemished otherwise; calluses on palms and fingers from equipment work. Stubble grows in thick and fast; he shaves every other day. The blend of ancestries creates subtle feature asymmetry: slightly higher cheekbones on left influenced by East Asian ancestry, stronger jaw definition from Northern European component, with warmth, dimension, and subtle feature softness from African, Latin American, and Southeast Asian heritage.', N'Heavy-gauge retractable claws on both hands (chrome yellowed and scratched, mechanisms visibly loud and industrial—not cosmetic). Impact-absorption plating across both forearms showing as irregular matte-black composite panels with misaligned edges and visible stress fractures; the fit is imperfect and the plates shift slightly under movement. Right eye prosthetic obvious on close inspection: the black sclera is too uniform, the amber iris refracts light slightly differently than organic tissue, and the slight misalignment creates that permanent squint.', N'Moves with economical precision—no wasted motion. Habitually presses palms flat against walls and structural surfaces, fingers splayed, feeling for vibration resonance through his tactile sense. Leans forward when listening intently. When stationary, shifts weight frequently between feet as if ready to move. Hands are rarely completely relaxed; fingers unconsciously test surfaces, tap rhythms, check for give. His right eye squint causes him to tilt his head slightly when focusing on detail work. Walks with a careful, measured gait in confined spaces; moves quickly and directly in open areas.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian salvage worker. Standard-issue tactical rig in faded grey-green with multiple sealed pockets for tools and findings. Worn Iroquois-brand work boots, scuffed and re-soled twice. Long-sleeve compression shirt (black, brands the seams to reduce snag risk) worn under an open grey vest rigged with carabiners and rope loops. Fingerless gloves on both hands (the claws retract through reinforced openings). A canvas satchel, oil-stained and patched, carries maps and smaller finds. No corporate logos. No chrome jewelry. Everything is functional, secondhand, and well-maintained. Clothing bears the embedded dirt of the Abyssal Threshold: a fine grey dust that never fully washes out.', N'In a collapsed sector three months ago he found a sealed room containing eleven bodies in old Ferrogate Transit uniforms, arranged deliberately, with their access badges laid out in a pattern he recognized as a distress code. He marked the location, told no one, and hasn''t gone back. He isn''t sure what''s stopping him.', N'sparse and physical — describes everything in terms of structural metaphors, load, pressure, give, hold', N'short sentences with long gaps, like someone who talks in the rhythm of listening', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'almas_rnason');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6fe-7cce-b904-aead71814be1', N'Gan Thorvaldsdóttir', N'Gan', N'', N'Thorvaldsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Brightmoor Reclamation, squats in an abandoned Ferrogate Transit relay station, near Halsted and Division', N'Graffiti artist and neon artist', N'Loosely affiliated with a graffiti collective called Residue; occasional work for Brightmoor Reclamation community boards (paid in food and materials)', N'Gan Thorvaldsdóttir is a skinny nineteen-year-old with the kind of energy that only reads as charisma or catastrophe depending on the day. He''s all long limbs and fast hands, hair in a dozen thin braids dyed alternating orange and white that he keeps tied back while working. His geneware is cheap and obviously DIY-adjacent — cat ears that didn''t integrate quite right and sit slightly asymmetrical on his head, one a little higher than the other, which he claims is intentional but isn''t. His fingertips are perpetually stained with chromatic aerosol pigment in colors that don''t exist in the standard spectrum.

What he does with a wall is extraordinary. Gan Thorvaldsdóttir paints living murals — his aerosol formulas include bioluminescent reactive compounds he mixes himself from salvaged materials, so his work changes with light conditions, breathing and shifting from dawn to dusk to full dark when it blazes. He''s been arrested four times by Ferrogate Transit security for unauthorized installation on their infrastructure. He considers this a metric of success. Offstage he is loud, impatient, genuinely sweet when he trusts someone, and absolutely certain he is going to be famous someday. He is probably right.', N'Local color and street-level information source about Brightmoor and surrounding reclamation zones; knows which walls belong to whom in the informal territorial sense; his murals sometimes contain encoded messages for the community — he doesn''t always know whose messages.', N'', N'DIY-installed cat ears (asymmetrical integration, functional but imprecise); chromatic nail enhancement (fingers cycle color slowly, cheap consumer grade)', N'Sleeps until noon, spends afternoons sourcing materials and scouting locations, goes out after midnight to work; attends Residue meetings sporadically when he remembers.', N'GLMZ portrait of Gan Thorvaldsdóttir, 178cm lean wiry figure with complex warm deep brown skin with golden undertones reflecting global ancestry blend. Dark natural braids with neon orange and white DIY dye, loosely framing defined cheekbones. Deep warm brown eyes with perpetual sleep-deprived dark circles. Asymmetrical DIY cat ears with servo motors mounted via subdermal anchors on shaved sides of head. Chemical burn scars visible on right cheek, ferrogate transit tattoo on left wrist. Fingers stained with impossible chromatic pigments (electric purple, synthetic cyan, neon lime), fingertips displaying slow-cycling violet-magenta-cyan bioelectric nail implants. Wearing oversized faded 2180s tech startup t-shirt splattered with paint residue, recycled synthetic-fiber windbreaker with malfunctioning LED strips, paint-stained cargo pants, worn custom-painted canvas sneakers. Salvaged military harness vest with aerosol cans and brushes. Wire bracelets, scrap-metal rings, cracked safety visor pushed up on forehead. Restless kinetic posture, hands in motion, wide-eyed mischievous intensity. Neon underground art studio setting with harsh blue and pink LED lighting casting complex shadows across mixed-heritage features. Gritty, lived-in aesthetic with spray-paint murals in background. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Brightmoor Reclamation', N'local', N'Brightmoor Reclamation', N'Northern European, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and East Asian mixed ancestry — a striking global blend. The combination creates warm, deep brown skin with subtle golden undertones from the South Asian and East Asian components, enriched by the darker pigmentation from Sub-Saharan African heritage (47.4% Northern European providing lighter undertone variation), creating a complex, multifaceted complexion that shifts warmly under artificial light with pronounced depth and dimension.', 178, 62, N'Wiry and lean with long limbs; the build of someone who moves constantly and eats inconsistently. Defined shoulders and forearms from repetitive spraying motions, minimal body fat.', N'Natural dark brown with DIY dyed braids in alternating neon orange and white', N'Thin braids, typically pulled back with salvaged wire or fabric scraps while working; loose and chaotic when down', N'Medium, past shoulder length when unbraided', N'Deep brown with warm golden undertones, reflecting the balanced interplay of Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and East Asian heritage', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones and subtle lighter variations from Northern European genetics — a rich, multifaceted blend creating a complexion that glows warmly under artificial light with pronounced depth and natural dimension across the face', N'Rounded to angular facial structure reflecting the diverse ancestral blend — higher cheekbones characteristic of East and South Asian genetics, complemented by broader facial proportions influenced by Sub-Saharan African heritage, softened by Northern European genetic contribution. Deep warm brown base with golden warmth. Perpetually sleep-deprived appearance with dark under-eye circles. Skin shows the wear of late-night work and inconsistent hygiene — occasional aerosol chemical burns on cheeks and neck from spray blowback. Fingers stained with chromatic pigments in impossible hues (electric purple, synthetic cyan, neon lime) that don''t wash out completely.', N'Asymmetrically positioned DIY cat ears mounted on skull via subdermal anchors — left ear sits approximately 0.5cm higher than right, both with slight rotational drift during movement. Ears are cheap cosmetic grade (synthetic cartilage, basic servo motors) with visible misalignment that Gan claims is intentional. Fingertips display slow-cycling chromatic nail enhancement (consumer-grade bioelectric implants) that shift through unnatural color gradients — currently cycling through violet-to-magenta-to-cyan range.', N'Restless and kinetic; rarely still for more than seconds. Moves with purpose and speed, shoulders slightly forward. Hands are constantly in motion even at rest — fingers flexing, gesturing, mimicking spray motions. When concentrating on art, enters a state of complete focus that contrasts sharply with baseline hyperactivity. Default expression is wide-eyed enthusiasm or mischievous intensity.', N'Tier 5 utilitarian with deliberate aesthetic flair. Typically wears paint-splattered cargo pants (multiple pockets for materials, cuffs stained with permanent chromatic residue) and oversized thrifted tech-company t-shirts from defunct 2180s-era startups. Layered jackets salvaged from Brightmoor recyclers — current favorite is a faded synthetic-fiber windbreaker with LED panel strips rewired (malfunctioning, blinks irregularly). Worn canvas sneakers with custom-painted soles. Carries a salvaged military-grade harness vest modified to hold aerosol cans, brushes, and chemical bottles. Heavy reliance on found/salvaged accessories: wire bracelets, scrap-metal rings, a cracked safety visor worn pushed up on forehead.', N'He has been anonymously commissioned three times through an encrypted channel to paint specific imagery on specific walls in Brightmoor — imagery he thought was his own idea. He started to notice the pattern after the third job. The payment arrives in Φ before he even confirms. He has not told Residue.', N'Fast, slangy, mixes Finnish-Sahel patois from his grandmother''s household with street GLMZ creole. Uses ''dead'' as highest praise.', N'Quick, overlapping itself, trails off when he loses the thread then picks up somewhere unexpected.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gan_thorvaldsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5cb-7ada-84dc-aec731bfc55a', N'Basel Erikstad-Volkov-Horváth', N'Basel', N'', N'Erikstad-Volkov-Horváth', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lakeview Neon, a narrow second-floor shop above a synth-sake bar called The Peristaltic, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Tailor and seamstress, Lakeview Neon district', N'Independent; informal referral network with two other tailors in the Burnished Market', N'Basel Erikstad-Volkov-Horváth is lanky and precise, the kind of man who looks slightly annoyed at rest but is actually just concentrating. He has warm-amber skin, dark eyes with geneware irises that shift between deep violet and burnt gold depending on his mood — installed partly for aesthetics, mostly because he wanted to test how clients reacted to them before doing a full commission. His hands are his most important feature: long-fingered, callus-mapped, perpetually holding something — chalk, thread, a measuring tape coiled around two knuckles. He keeps his head shaved and wears a single garnet stud in his left ear that has been there since he was nineteen.

He works at the seam between tiers: his clients are Tier 2 people who want to look Tier 3, and occasional Tier 3 people who want something that doesn''t look corporate-issued. He is perceptive about bodies and what people want their bodies to say, which makes him an accidental confessor — clients will tell him things in the fitting room they''d tell nobody else. He is not a gossip, but he is an archivist. He remembers everything.', N'Information source — knows the secrets of half the block from fitting-room confessions. Can be a quest-giver related to a client in trouble. His shop is a neutral ground that different types of people pass through.', N'', N'Geneware patterned irises (violet-to-gold shift). Micro-stabilizers in both hands (Tier 2 medical, prevents tremor — installed after a nerve injury from a sewing machine accident at 24). Subdermal thimble caps on three fingers of each hand.', N'Opens at 10:00, rarely leaves the shop before 22:00. Mornings are admin and cutting; afternoons are fittings; evenings are his real work — the intricate construction he only does when the street noise drops to manageable. Eats from Ogechi''s cart three times a week when he can get down there.', N'Basel Erikstad-Volkov-Horváth, 183cm tall, lean angular build with inward-rolled shoulders, shaved head with faint augmentation scars. Medium olive skin with cool-warm balance reflecting Eastern European-Southeast Asian-East Asian heritage. Sharp Slavic cheekbones softened by Southeast Asian warmth, refined East Asian jawline. Geneware violet-to-gold shifting irises with warm brown sclera, slight downward mouth set suggesting focus. Garnet earring in left lobe, faint scars on palms and bridge of nose. Wearing tailored charcoal overshirt over fitted gray merino blend shirt, straight-cut reinforced work pants, quality leather slip-ons, cloth tape measure around neck. Standing with forward lean over invisible work surface, hands positioned with mechanical precision. Cool workshop lighting casting subtle shadows, emphasizing tri-continental facial architecture and understated augmentation. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, meticulous artisan aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lakeview Neon', N'local', N'Lakeview Neon', N'Eastern European (52.6%), Southeast Asian (31.7%), and East Asian (15.7%) ancestry—a striking tri-continental blend. The dominant Eastern European genetics provides strong Slavic bone structure with sharp, high cheekbones and angular facial planes. Southeast Asian ancestry contributes warm undertones, slightly broader facial width, and characteristic eye placement. East Asian genetics refines the overall structure with subtle jawline definition and refined orbital geometry. The result is a uniquely balanced face: Slavic angularity softened by Southeast and East Asian warmth and proportion.', 183, 71, N'Lanky and angular, almost concave through the chest—the build of someone who has spent two decades bent over a work table. Long limbs with visible musculature only in forearms and shoulders from repetitive precision work.', N'Black, natural', N'Completely shaved, scalp maintained smooth with occasional faint surgical-grade scarring from old augmentation work', N'Shaved', N'Geneware irises—deep violet at rest, shifting to burnt gold under emotional intensity or bright light; sclera warm brown', N'Medium olive with cool-warm balance—the result of Eastern European paleness enriched by Southeast and East Asian warmth. Luminous in natural light, deepening subtly in shadow with a balanced neutral undertone rather than pure cool cast.', N'Clean, minimal acne scarring. Fine lines around eyes from decades of close-focus work and squinting. A small burn scar on the bridge of his nose (accidental). Perpetually neat despite the work—someone who understands the power of presentation. Slight downward set to his mouth at rest, giving an impression of concentration or mild disapproval. Facial structure reflects tri-continental heritage: prominent Slavic cheekbones with Southeast Asian eye placement and East Asian refinement in jawline and orbital structure. Warm brown undertones visible in skin depth.', N'Geneware patterned irises are the primary visible modification—noticeable in person but not immediately jarring. Subdermal thimble caps are invisible under normal light but create slight surface irregularities on the index, middle, and ring finger of each hand if examined closely. Hands move with mechanical precision that suggests augmentation to trained observers. No visible chrome or external hardware.', N'Stands with a slight forward lean, as if perpetually leaning over a work surface. Shoulders rolled inward. Movements are economical and precise—no wasted motion. Hands are always occupied or positioned near fabric; he handles textiles with the deliberation others reserve for explosives. Walks with purpose but not haste. Rarely makes sudden movements.', N'High-Tier 2 aesthetic executed with Tier 3 practicality. Typically wears fitted but functional garments—tailored merino blend shirts in neutral grays, blacks, deep blues; straight-cut work pants with reinforced pockets and seams (often his own creation); a charcoal or black overshirt or light jacket, always open. Shoes are understated—quality leather derby or slip-ons, well-maintained but worn. A cloth tape measure usually coiled around his neck or wrist. Jewelry is minimal: the garnet earring, occasionally a thin steel bracelet on his right wrist. His clothes fit him perfectly because he is his own first client. Nothing cheap, nothing flashy. Everything says ''I know what I''m doing.''', N'He has been slowly, carefully reproducing — from memory and old photographs — the entire wardrobe of his grandmother who died in the Irkalla flooding of 2189. He has no plan for what to do with these garments when finished. He thinks maybe he''s just trying to make her real again.', N'Precise and image-rich. Uses clothing and construction metaphors for everything. Intermittent Twi and Serbian phrases, usually terms of endearment or mild curses.', N'Measured, with long pauses while he thinks. Can be surprisingly cutting when he finally finishes a sentence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'basel_erikstad_volkov_horv_th');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a614-758b-b18f-aeebd3c0e391', N'Aarush Guerrero', N'Aarush', N'', N'Guerrero', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Meridian Core, near State and Madison', N'Corporate archivist and information broker for Meridian Core elite', N'Nominally employed by the Meridian Core Institutional Repository (a quasi-public body with heavy corporate board influence); practically unaffiliated in any loyalty sense; has functional relationships with every major power structure in the city and genuine allegiance to none', N'Aarush Guerrero is a tall, lean Nigerian-British man whose physical presence is dominated by an almost architectural stillness—he moves through rooms the way expensive furniture does, occupying space with an authority that has nothing to do with aggression. His hair is silver and kept close-cropped; his skin is deep brown and largely unlined in a way that suggests either good genetics or access to skin-maintenance procedures he would consider too vulgar to discuss. He dresses in understated, exquisitely tailored clothing in charcoal and navy, always with a physical notebook in a breast pocket, always with cufflinks that are slightly too interesting to be accidental. His eyes are warm brown with the faint reflective quality of high-end retinal overlays, and he has the practiced habit of looking at people as though they are the most interesting document he has encountered today.

Aarush Guerrero serves as Senior Archivist for the Meridian Core''s largest private institutional repository—nominally a preservation and records management role, practically a position of extraordinary covert power. He has spent thirty years accumulating, organizing, and quietly leveraging information that powerful people would prefer did not exist in organized form. He does not blackmail. He considers blackmail crude and unstable. What he does instead is position himself as the person who can make problems go away, who knows where the inconvenient documentation lives, who has relationships on every floor of every tower in the Core. He is expensive to retain and priceless to cross.

He came to GLMZ from London at twenty-eight, trailing a first-class archival science degree and a deliberate decision to go where the information was least organized and therefore most powerful. He has outlasted six corporate administrations, two regime changes at the city level, and one assassination attempt he has never publicly acknowledged. He is not cruel, which people mistake for softness. He is not sentimental, which people mistake for coldness. He is, above all things, patient—and in a city that runs on speed, patience is the most dangerous thing you can be.', N'Institutional memory and moral complexity of complicity-through-inaction; Fenwick embodies the question of whether knowing everything and choosing carefully what to do with that knowledge is wisdom or a more sophisticated form of cowardice', N'', N'High-generation retinal overlay (both eyes): full archival interface, eidetic-quality recording, document analysis and authentication at a glance; pupils occasionally reflect faint grid patterns in low light,Subvocal communication implant: allows silent dictation and encrypted communication; he uses it to narrate observations to himself constantly,Memory indexing implant: enhances associative recall for stored data; a legitimate corporate-issued augmentation from his institutional role, and the one he is most ambivalent about', N'Arrives at the archive before staff, at 0700, and conducts a private review of overnight access logs before anyone else sees them. Works through the morning on legitimate archival function with genuine care—he considers the preservation work real and important. Afternoons are for appointments, which are booked through a scheduling system that reveals nothing about their actual nature. Evenings, three times a week, he walks specific routes through the Core that allow him to observe without appearing to. Reads physical books before sleep, history and natural science, nothing contemporary. Eats alone, almost always.', N'Aarush Guerrero, tall lean man with silver close-cropped hair, warm bronze-brown skin with multi-ethnic features reflecting Central Asian, Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, subtle facial scars on temple and jawline, wearing bespoke charcoal tailored suit with pale blue dress shirt and vintage cufflinks, brushed steel analog-digital wristwatch, physical leather notebook visible in breast pocket, dark leather shoes, immaculate grooming, composed posture, attentive expression, standing in minimalist corporate office with soft indirect lighting, faint retinal overlay grid-pattern visible in eyes under low light, GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool ambient lighting with warm skin undertones, professional and observational demeanor, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Meridian Core', N'local', N'The Meridian Core', N'Complex Pan-Global ancestry: Hispanic/Latin American (54.5%), Central Asian (23.4%), Sub-Saharan African (12.9%), South Asian (6.1%), Eastern European (3.1%). This combination produces warm medium-to-deep brown skin with subtle undertones from multiple lineages—golden warmth enhanced by Central Asian and South Asian ancestry, deepened by Sub-Saharan heritage, with a warm reddish-bronze cast from Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. The result is a richly complex skin tone that shifts subtly in different lighting, suggesting both Mediterranean and equatorial influences.', 188, 78, N'Lean and architecturally composed, with the long-limbed proportion of someone who has never needed to assert physicality. Minimal body fat, shoulders slightly narrow relative to height, suggesting a frame built for stillness rather than motion.', N'Silver', N'Close-cropped, geometrically precise', N'Short', N'Warm brown with faint reflective grid-pattern quality in low light (retinal overlay signature)', N'Warm medium-deep bronze-brown with golden and reddish undertones from Hispanic/Latin American, Central Asian, and Sub-Saharan heritage blend', N'Remarkably smooth with minimal creasing around eyes and mouth—consistent with either exceptional genetics or discreet dermatological maintenance. Facial structure reflects multi-continental heritage: subtle Central Asian cheekbone definition and eye shape, broader nasal bridge with Sub-Saharan and South Asian characteristics, warm bronzed-brown tone enhanced by Latin American and Mediterranean ancestry. No visible damage, no visible emotion. Expression is composed and observational. Grooming is immaculate without appearing effortful.', N'Retinal overlays visible as faint grid-pattern reflection in both pupils under low-light conditions; otherwise augmentations are entirely subcutaneous or internal. No external chrome, no visible neural interface ports, no obvious prosthetics. The augmentations are civilian-grade corporate standard, which he considers the only appropriate level of visible modification for his social tier.', N'Moves with deliberate economical precision—no wasted motion, no fidgeting, no postural restlessness. Occupies space with architectural authority rather than physical presence. Sits with composed spine, stands with hands at rest. Walks as though following an internal map. Default expression is attentive and slightly warm, with the quality of someone listening to information rather than people.', N'Understated Tier-1 corporate formalism: bespoke charcoal and navy tailoring, always perfectly fitted and made from expensive non-synthetic blends. Dress shirts in pale blue or white, worn with cufflinks that are subtly distinctive (vintage materials, unusual metalwork) without advertising themselves. Dark wool trousers with precise creasing. Leather shoes in black or dark brown, worn with the polish of religious maintenance. A physical leather notebook in his breast pocket, always. A wristwatch in brushed steel—functional, expensive, analog-digital hybrid. No unnecessary jewelry beyond the cufflinks. The overall effect is of someone who dresses for information acquisition rather than impression management, which paradoxically makes him memorable.', N'The assassination attempt thirty years ago was arranged by his own patron—the man who brought him to GLMZ. Fenwick survived, covered the evidence, and has protected that man''s legacy ever since, not out of loyalty but because understanding why has become the organizing question of his life and he hasn''t found the answer yet.', N'Precise, elevated, and slightly archaic in register; favors complete sentences and deplores abbreviation; uses archival and preservation metaphors organically; occasional British idiom that surfaces under stress or genuine amusement', N'Deliberate and unhurried, with long, well-constructed sentences that end exactly where he intends them to; pauses are communicative, not hesitant; never raises his voice', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aarush_guerrero');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a71a-7ee9-a56d-aeec402b4b16', N'Gennadiy Sigurdsson-Echeverría-Rhee', N'Gennadiy', N'', N'Sigurdsson-Echeverría-Rhee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 13, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grainfort, Meridian Municipal Children''s Residency Block 7 / Grainfort Artisan Foundry, near Fullerton and Damen', N'orphanage resident and apprentice glassworker, Tier 1-2 transitional', N'Meridian Municipal Children''s Residency (ward of the city); Grainfort Artisan Foundry (apprentice)', N'Gennadiy Sigurdsson-Echeverría-Rhee has the lean angular face of someone whose Senegalese and Samoan grandparents left them something architectural in the bone structure, wide-browed and sharp-chinned, with light brown skin that has taken on a faint iridescence from trace exposure to the foundry''s vaporized mineral compounds — an unofficial and irreversible aesthetic byproduct that their supervisor Mister Achim calls ''an occupational gift.'' Their hair is thick and natural, kept short on the sides, and they''ve woven in three copper wire coils that ring softly when they move. Their hands are already marked with the small pale scars of a working glassworker.

Gennadiy Sigurdsson-Echeverría-Rhee was assigned to the Grainfort artisan apprenticeship lottery at eleven, which placed them at the Foundry three afternoons a week, and they took to it with a ferocity that surprised everyone. They are quiet in the way of someone who learned early that words carry cost; they observe everything and say only what needs saying. At the Residency Block they are known as the one who doesn''t get involved in the house politics, which is both true and a deliberate strategy. They are saving every Φ of their apprentice stipend toward the day they can apply to leave the block system entirely.', N'Represents the municipal orphan pipeline and the artisan economy; their quiet observational nature makes them an excellent unreliable witness — they see everything but don''t always share; their situation raises questions about the city''s relationship to its dependent children', N'', N'Unintentional mineral iridescence on skin (not a mod, a chemical consequence). No deliberate augmentations.', N'Mornings at the Residency Block with mandatory city-curriculum schooling, three afternoons per week at the Foundry learning hot-glass techniques, remaining afternoons doing independent study or sitting by the lake-window where the light is good and they sketch designs for pieces they want to make.', N'Gennadiy Sigurdsson-Echeverría-Rhee, lean 157cm androgynous adolescent with striking multiethnic features: high Nordic cheekbones blended with East Asian midface width, warm golden-tan luminous skin with subtle pearlescent iridescence on shoulders and neck shifting blue-green to lavender. Dark brown hair with reddish undertones, short sides swept back with three copper wire coils catching light. Dark brown eyes with amber flecks. Small pale scars on both hands from glassworking. Wearing grey oversized institutional tunic or dark heat-resistant canvas apron over reinforced cotton shirt, sturdy boots. Quiet, composed posture in GLMZ foundry or Residency setting. Economical movement, hands showing early craftsperson precision. Warm practical lighting emphasizing the mineral sheen on skin and oxidizing copper in hair. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grainfort', N'local', N'Grainfort', N'Truly cosmopolitan genetic blend: Northern European ancestry (40.3%) provides foundational bone structure with high cheekbones and strong brow ridge, substantially modified by Hispanic/Latin American (23.7%) and East Asian (17.1%) ancestry that add midface width and warmth. Sub-Saharan African (14.2%) and South Asian (4.7%) heritage layers contribute luminous melanin distribution and subtle feature refinement. The result is a striking phenotypic synthesis: Nordic cheekbone prominence married to broader East Asian midface structure, warm golden-tan skin with complex undertones that shift in different light, and an appearance of genetic heterogeneity that transcends simple categorization.', 157, 45, N'Lean and angular with architectural bone structure from Northern European genetics — narrow shoulders, long-limbed, minimal body fat from both genetic predisposition and the physical demands of glasswork apprenticeship', N'Natural dark brown with reddish undertones', N'Short on the sides with longer crown, swept back; three copper wire coils woven throughout that catch light and ring softly with movement', N'Short to medium', N'Dark brown with flecks of amber', N'Warm golden-tan with multidimensional undertones — a nuanced blend of Northern European baseline warmed by East Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African melanin distribution. Neither light nor deep, but luminous and complex: the skin reads as naturally sun-kissed even in artificial light, with subtle warm ochre and golden notes across cheekbones and temples that deepen slightly toward the jawline', N'High, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Northern European and East Asian genetics, balanced by fuller midface structure from Hispanic/Latin American and South Asian ancestry. Wide-browed with strong brow ridge that softens toward the eyes. Fine bone structure overall with subtle width at the face. Skin has developed a faint iridescent sheen across shoulders, neck, and forearms from chronic low-level exposure to vaporized mineral compounds in the foundry — an irreversible occupational patina that gives the skin a subtle pearlescent quality under certain light angles, shifting between pale blue-green and lavender. Skin is clean but shows the wear of early adolescent labor.', N'None deliberate. The mineral iridescence is an unintentional chemical consequence of foundry work, not a modification.', N'Economical and composed — moves with the careful precision of someone who has learned to conserve energy and attention. Stands still more than shifts weight. Hands move with deliberate control, already developing the muscle memory of a craftsperson. Quiet in presence: doesn''t take up more space than necessary', N'Tier 1-2 transitional institutional/apprentice hybrid. At the Residency: simple city-issued tunics or plain long-sleeved shirts in grey or muted blue, worn slightly oversize for durability and layering. At the Foundry: heat-resistant canvas apron dyed dark from foundry dust, reinforced cotton work shirt, sturdy boots with reinforced toes. Personal touches are minimal — the copper wire in their hair is a quiet act of autonomy. Everything is clean but well-worn, chosen for function over aesthetic.', N'They have been secretly making a glass piece — a small lantern — intended as a data-offering for the E.L.F. they believe inhabits the Foundry''s main kiln. They have never told anyone this. They speak to it while working alone.', N'Spare and exact, the vocabulary of someone who reads technical manuals for pleasure', N'Slow, with long pauses that are not uncertainty — they are just not in a hurry', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gennadiy_sigurdsson_echeverr_a_rhee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('b907bfeb-a762-c64e-e4c8-af02969b8f09', N'Bijou Kozlov-Aidoo', N'Bijou', N'', N'Kozlov-Aidoo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 80, 0, N'alive', N'A darkroom-office in Old Harbor, chemicals and prints hanging from clotheslines alongside case notes', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — works through word of mouth only, no mesh presence', N'Bijou Kozlov-Aidoo investigates through the lens. Where other PIs chase data streams or neural traces, Bijou captures light on silver halide crystals and reads the truth in the chemistry. Her methods are considered antiquated by everyone who hasn''t needed them, and revelatory by everyone who has.

Her analog approach wasn''t a philosophical choice — it was pragmatic. Twenty years ago, she discovered that digital surveillance countermeasures, which are ubiquitous in GLMZ, are calibrated exclusively to detect and defeat electronic sensors. A chemical-process camera doesn''t emit electromagnetic signatures, doesn''t connect to any network, and produces images that can''t be remotely deleted or altered. In a world where digital evidence is routinely questioned, her chemical photographs carry a weight that pixel-based images can''t match.

She operates from a converted warehouse space in Old Harbor that functions simultaneously as her office, her darkroom, and her archive. The archive is her masterpiece — decades of photographs of GLMZ''s streets, buildings, and people, organized with a librarian''s precision. She has been contacted by historians, journalists, and investigators who need visual evidence of the past, and her archive has proven or disproven alibis, established timelines, and documented changes to the cityscape that no digital record captured. She is, without fully intending it, becoming one of the city''s most important unofficial historians.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bijou_kozlov_aidoo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a8-76f0-a206-af99f7cb25c6', N'Baek Migizi-Thammasak', N'Baek', N'', N'Migizi-Thammasak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 30, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Rookery — dense vertical housing, gang-controlled, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Cross-district contraband specialist — smuggler', N'Freelance — available through Circuit fixers', N'Baek Migizi-Thammasak is compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 30, scars map his face like a transit diagram of bad decisions and worse luck. The chrome is visible — subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see him surpass them. He works as a smuggler out of The Rookery, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

In a city full of people who talk about what they''ll do, Baek Migizi-Thammasak is one of the ones who actually does it.', N'Alper Inoue-Aidoo functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm. Geneware muscle density treatment — looks natural, hits like chrome', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Baek Migizi-Thammasak, mixed-heritage neo-noir operative, 2226. Medium-brown skin with golden-copper Indigenous American base tone, olive-jade cheekbones from Southeast Asian heritage, cool undertones on jawline from Northern European ancestry. 168cm tall, compact muscular build, wide shoulders. Short black hair with silver temples, dark brown alert eyes, weathered complexion with blade scar running left temple to jaw, broken nose. Sleeveless black compression undershirt revealing augmented forearms with visible subdermal blade mount scarring and geneware muscle ripple shimmer. Matte-black tactical jacket, reinforced black cargo pants, steel-toed boots. Coiled predatory posture, weight on balls of feet, neutral-hostile expression. Dark gritty Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone interior, neon rim lighting casting cool shadows, industrial neo-noir urban aesthetic, moody tension --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Rookery', N'local', N'The Rookery', N'Indigenous American (70.5%) with Southeast Asian (17.2%) and Northern European (12.3%) ancestry. The dominant Indigenous American heritage creates strong angular facial structure with prominent cheekbones, broad nose bridge, and solid bone composition. Southeast Asian ancestry refines the eye shape into slightly hooded lids with an alert, assessing quality, and adds definition to the lower face and jaw. Northern European ancestry introduces cooler undertones that create subtle tonal contrast—visible along the jawline and temples—modulating the warmer base into visual complexity.', 168, 78, N'Compact and densely muscled, low center of gravity. Wide shoulders tapering to a narrow waist. Built for impact absorption and explosive movement rather than reach or speed. No wasted mass.', N'Black with premature silver threading at temples', N'Cropped close, military-clean, reveals the shape of his skull', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and assessing', N'Medium warm brown with golden-copper undertones from Indigenous American heritage. Southeast Asian ancestry adds subtle olive-jade cast throughout, particularly visible on cheekbones and across the bridge of the nose. Northern European ancestry introduces cooler undertones along the jawline and temples, creating warm-dominant tonal complexity with cool modulation.', N'Weathered and scarred. Severe grooming habits mask poor skin condition underneath. Dark circles under eyes from sleep debt and cycle stimulants. A thin white line runs from left temple to jaw—old blade work. Nose broken at least twice and set without professional care.', N'Subdermal weapon mounts in both forearms are visible as faint circular scarring and a subtle ridge of reinforced tissue running the length of each forearm. Chrome deliberately exposed—no attempt to hide the blade deployment mechanisms. Geneware muscle density treatment visible as unnatural muscle definition and subtle shimmer or rippling effect under the skin of the arms and shoulders when he moves.', N'Economical and predatory. Moves from the hips and shoulders, not the limbs. No wasted motion. Stands with weight distributed on the balls of his feet, ready to shift in any direction instantly. Eyes track movement constantly. Default expression is neutral-to-hostile. When at rest, he''s coiled rather than relaxed.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian. Black reinforced work pants with cargo pockets and tool loops—worn, maintained, practical. Sleeveless compression undershirt showing off the augmented forearms deliberately. Matte-black tactical jacket with Velcro patch sections for identification—usually blank. Scuffed combat boots, steel-toed, broken in through heavy use. Everything is dark, everything is functional, nothing is decorative. Designed to survive contact with edges, heat, and blood. No corporate logos, no gang colors, no affiliation markers—deliberate neutrality.', N'', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'baek_migizi_thammasak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a6-7542-abdb-afc97420d0ff', N'Dina Valenzuela', N'Dina', N'', N'Valenzuela', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 39, NULL, 23.3, 3, N'active', N'Geartown, near North Ave and Damen', N'Fixer - Demolitions broker', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Dina Valenzuela, 178cm tall demolitions expert with warm deep brown skin bearing golden and olive undertones, strong angular cheekbones blending Southeast Asian and Latin American heritage. Black hair with silvering temples, closely cropped fade. Deep brown eyes with subtle epicanthic folds. Surgical-looking three-inch scar from left cheekbone to jaw. Five-day stubble, weathered face with squint lines. Compact muscular build, thick neck, powerful forearms with subdermal reinforcement plating visible as faint silvery geometric ridges. Wearing fitted black tee under unbuttoned muted gray tactical jacket, heavy-duty tan work pants with multiple reinforced pockets, steel-toed boots. Steel wedding band on left hand. Discrete neural port behind left ear. Standing in Geartown workshop setting with industrial lighting, hands steady and composed. GLMZ, controlled tension, utilitarian aesthetic, no status symbols. Film noir lighting highlighting facial structure and scar. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Multi-continental ancestry: primarily Hispanic/Latin American (61.7%) with significant Southeast Asian (36.8%) heritage and trace Northern European (1.5%) genetics. This creates a phenotype with warm, medium-to-deep brown skin tones enriched by golden and olive undertones, strong angular bone structure characteristic of both ancestral lines, and subtle eye shape variations from Southeast Asian heritage that blend seamlessly with the broader facial proportions of his Latin American ancestry.', 178, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and compact, muscular without bulk. Carries himself with the controlled tension of someone who has handled explosives for two decades. Thick neck, powerful forearms.', N'Black with premature silvering at the temples', N'Closely cropped, faded sides, kept severe and functional', N'Short', N'Deep brown', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden and olive undertones from the blending of Hispanic/Latin American and Southeast Asian ancestry—rich and complex rather than uniform, with slight variation across the face and a subtle luminosity that catches light across the cheekbones and bridge of nose', N'Weathered face with deep lines around the eyes—squint-marks from years of calculating blast radiuses and reading building blueprints. Strong, angular cheekbones characteristic of both Southeast Asian and Latin American heritage, creating high, defined facial planes. A three-inch scar runs from his left cheekbone to jaw, white and precise, creating contrast against his skin. Sparse, deliberate facial hair—five-day stubble maintained as a styling choice, not neglect. Hands are calloused, fingers slightly stiff from old shrapnel injuries. Subtle epicanthic fold variation visible at the outer corners of his eyes from Southeast Asian heritage, integrated naturally within broader eye structure.', N'Subdermal reinforcement plating visible as faint geometric ridges under the skin of both wrists and knuckles—silverish, barely perceptible unless you know what you''re looking at. His left eye has a barely-noticeable neural port behind the ear, marked by a small dermal seal. No flashy chrome; everything chosen for discrete functionality.', N'Stands with feet shoulder-width apart, a habit from standing near detonation zones. Moves with deliberate economy—no wasted motion. When thinking, he touches his jaw scar absently. Speaks quietly, forcing others to lean in. His hands are steady, even when discussing volatile materials.', N'Tier 3 utilitarian: heavy-duty Carhartt-equivalent work pants in tan or charcoal, always with multiple reinforced pockets for tools and detonator components. Layered shirts—functional base layer, usually a fitted black tee under an unbuttoned work shirt or lightweight tactical jacket in muted colors (grays, earth tones). Steel-toed boots, worn but meticulously maintained. A weathered leather jacket, vintage pre-2200 quality, hangs in his Geartown workshop. No logos, no status symbols. Everything is built for durability and function. Wears a simple steel wedding band on his left hand—never removes it.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dina_valenzuela');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a644-7d05-8c32-afef39cb1d19', N'Harish Balogun', N'Harish', N'', N'Balogun', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, Geartown, near Halsted and Division', N'Fermented food stall operator, Oxidian Market', N'', N'Harish Balogun is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin mapped with the faint silver tracery of old chemical burns along her forearms — souvenirs from a decade working Helix Biosystems vat-farms before she bought her freedom with severance pay and stubbornness. Her hair is iron-grey and worn in dense, oiled coils pinned back with copper clasps. She has wide-set amber eyes, one of which is a basic optical augment that she keeps tuned to a warm gold to match the original. Her stall is a marvel of controlled chaos: stacked ceramic crocks, fermenting jars backlit by bioluminescent bacterial cultures in shades of green and violet, dried herbs strung from a corrugated canopy that smells powerfully of vinegar, spice, and something alive. She keeps a small brass figurine of an unnamed E.L.F. at the corner of her counter where she leaves daily offerings of brine and a single data-sliver of her grandmother''s recipe files.

Harish Balogun is the kind of woman who makes you feel you have been assessed and found acceptable before you have opened your mouth. She is slow to anger and nearly impossible to intimidate, with the settled gravity of someone who has already survived the thing she feared most. She feeds people — truly feeds them, not just sells to them — and remembers what every regular customer likes without writing it down. She has a low opinion of corporate nutrition-paste and an even lower opinion of people who don''t say thank you.', N'Anchor NPC and community hub. She knows everyone in the market, remembers everything, and will share information only if she trusts you — or if you buy something first. Excellent quest-giver for neighborhood-level problems. Source of gossip, unofficial dispute arbiter, and the person locals go to when they need advice they can''t pay for.', N'', N'Basic optical implant (left eye, gold-tinted). Subdermal temperature regulators in her hands — a practical purchase for working with hot and cold fermentation environments.', N'Arrives at the market two hours before opening to tend her crocks, taste-test batches, and leave her E.L.F. offering. Spends the day selling fermented vegetables, gut-health tinctures, and small jars of kimchi-adjacent preparations she calls ''Volkov''s Fire'' after her paternal grandmother''s recipe. Closes at dusk and spends an hour reconciling her ledger by hand.', N'Harish Balogun, 172cm tall, broad-shouldered with solid build, mahogany-bronze skin with warm golden undertones blending Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, South Asian, and Pacific Islander heritage. Deep brown natural eye, left eye amber-gold optical augment. Iron-grey oiled coils pinned back with copper clasps. Angular prominent cheekbones with gentle facial rounding, full lips, weathered complexion showing decades of labor. Faint silver webbed scars on forearms. Standing at her fermentation market counter in indigo cotton apron over cream linen tunic, charcoal hemp trousers, worn leather sandals, brass bangle on right wrist. Grounded, economical posture, hands precise and capable. Neo-noir 2220s, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Warm amber market lighting casting gentle shadows, vinegar and salt-spice atmosphere, neon signs reflecting off wet pavement in background. Mood: quiet authority, comfortable in stillness. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'Primary Sub-Saharan African ancestry (50.1%) with significant Indigenous American (21.7%) and South Asian (14.4%) blending, enriched by Pacific Islander (3.8%), Northern European (8.0%), and Hispanic/Latin American (2.0%) heritage. This creates rich, deep warm brown skin tones with complex undertones — the luminous mahogany-bronze of Sub-Saharan and South Asian ancestry warmed by equatorial sun exposure, with subtle Pacific Islander roundness in facial structure and the angular cheekbone prominence of Indigenous American ancestry.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, with the compact muscularity of someone who has spent decades doing physical labor. Not lean, but not soft — defined forearms and capable hands, with a slight forward curve to her spine from decades of standing at market stalls.', N'Iron-grey with hints of black at the roots', N'Dense, oiled coils gathered back and pinned with worn copper clasps in a practical updo', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unbound)', N'Deep warm brown (natural right eye); left eye is basic optical augment tuned to amber-gold to match', N'Rich mahogany-bronze with warm golden undertones — the deep luminosity of blended Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Pacific Islander heritage, with subtle warmth from decades of sun exposure', N'Weathered but unlined in the way of people who have earned their rest. Broad facial structure with strong, prominent cheekbones showing angular definition from Indigenous American ancestry, balanced by gentle rounding in the cheeks and jaw from Sub-Saharan and Pacific Islander heritage. Full lips with natural depth. Minimal makeup — her skin is kept clean and oiled. Her hands show the wear of decades of handling acidic ferments and hot brine, with slight discoloration on knuckles.', N'Left optical augment with amber-gold iris, visible as a slight chromatic aberration at the limbus under direct light. Subdermal temperature regulators in her hands are not visible but create a faint thermal shimmer in infrared — kept subtle and functional, not chrome.', N'Grounded and economical in motion. She doesn''t shift her weight unnecessarily. When she leans forward at her counter, it''s with the full commitment of someone listening. Her hands move with the precision of someone who handles fragile things daily. She has the stillness of a woman comfortable with silence.', N'Practical Tier 3 workwear. Heavy cotton apron (indigo-dyed, stained with centuries of ferment, reinforced at stress points) worn over a loose linen tunic in cream or muted rust. Loose trousers in charcoal hemp, rolled at the ankles. Worn leather sandals with reinforced soles. A thin brass bangle on her right wrist — a gift from the Market Vendors Guild twenty years ago. No jewelry beyond this and her copper hair clasps. Her clothing smells perpetually of vinegar, salt, and spice.', N'She has been quietly subsidizing three vendor stalls in the Guild whose owners are in debt to a loan-shark syndicate, paying the difference out of her own savings to keep them from being forced out. She has never told anyone and has nearly depleted her emergency fund doing it.', N'Practical and direct, occasionally formal when annoyed. Mixes in fragments of Ghanaian Twi endearments and Russian diminutives from her heritage lines.', N'Measured and unhurried. She does not rush her sentences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'harish_balogun');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a632-71a0-a6ba-b01008a03f2c', N'Anshika Toktogulov', N'Anshika', N'', N'Toktogulov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Meridian Core, Axiom Security Division headquarters annex', N'Internal affairs investigator, Axiom Security Division', N'Axiom Security Division — Internal Affairs Branch', N'Anshika Toktogulov is slight and angular, with pale olive skin, sharp cheekbones, and hair that shifts between deep teal and silver depending on their mood — bioluminescent geneware they had done seven years ago and which they''ve never once referenced in a professional context. They dress in Axiom''s corporate security greys with an exactness that suggests the uniform is armor rather than identity. Their expressions are controlled with the care of someone who grew up being told they were too much and decided to become, professionally, precisely nothing.

They investigate Axiom''s own security personnel for misconduct, corruption, and off-books arrangements — a job that makes them universally disliked and which they have accepted as a structural condition of their existence. They are not cruel but they are thorough, and thoroughness in their line of work is often experienced as cruelty. They have a gift for making people feel that everything they''ve said has been weighed and found wanting, even when they haven''t spoken. They eat lunch alone every day by choice and have a private ritual of leaving a thread of code in the Meridian Core''s ambient E.L.F. network each morning — a small offering, a small ask for clarity.', N'Institutional threat or unexpected ally — their investigation might be bearing down on a character, or they might be the only person in Axiom who will look at evidence that doesn''t serve the official narrative.', N'', N'Bioluminescent hair geneware (teal-to-silver shift, mood-reactive). Subdermal recording membrane along inner left forearm — always-on, always admissible in Axiom internal proceedings. Optical enhancement: contrast boost for low-light document review.', N'Reviews case files from 0600; conducts interviews in Axiom''s sterile internal hearing rooms; writes findings reports in language so precise it has been used as a template for three subsequent policy rewrites.', N'Anshika Toktogulov, 2226 neo-noir security operative: lean 167cm frame in pristine Axiom Security grey corporate uniform with knife-edge pressed slacks and mirror-black military boots. Warm golden-brown skin with amber undertones, distinctly angular North African-Central Asian cheekbones, sharp defined jaw. Short bioluminescent hair with mood-reactive deep teal-to-silver shift, faintly glowing in dim light, precision-cut geometric style swept back from face. Dark brown augmented eyes with enhanced pupils. Minimal facial expression, professional smoothness, barely visible temple scar. Subdermal recording membrane ridge faintly visible on inner left forearm. Upright centered posture, economical movement, presence filled with invisible weight and professional evaluation. Corporate grey jacket tailored to minimize profile, compression undershirt at collar, zero personal markers. Cool neo-noir interior lighting with subtle neon, professional security division aesthetic, perfectly composed and grid-aligned --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Core', N'local', N'Meridian Core', N'Dominant North African (40.1%) foundation creates warm golden-brown base; Central Asian (26.4%) adds angular structure and cheekbone prominence; Northern European (23.1%) contributes luminosity and refined features; Sub-Saharan African (10.4%) adds subtle fullness and depth to facial geometry. Result: radiant warm-toned complexion with sharp angular architecture and underlying richness.', 167, 54, N'Slight and angular — lean muscle beneath minimal mass, the build of someone who has optimized their body for precision rather than presence. Shoulders narrow, frame almost fragile-looking until movement reveals controlled strength.', N'Bioluminescent shift: deep teal to silver, mood-reactive, with fractional luminescence visible in dim environments', N'Precision-cut, geometric lines; styled back from face with calculated severity', N'Short, approximately 4-5cm on top, faded close on sides', N'Dark brown with optical enhancement overlay — slightly increased contrast visibility in pupils under certain light angles', N'Warm golden-brown with amber undertones — richly complex blend of North African depth with Central Asian warmth and Northern European luminosity, creating a radiant mid-to-deep tone despite limited sun exposure', N'Distinctly angular cheekbones with North African and Central Asian sharpness, defined jaw with subtle fullness reflecting Sub-Saharan African heritage; minimal facial expression baseline — skin appears professionally maintained, almost unmarked. Zero visible acne, healed injuries, or natural blemishes; complexion has the uncanny smoothness of someone who has removed all casual markers of humanity from their appearance.', N'Bioluminescent hair (mood-reactive teal-to-silver shift; faint glow in low-light spaces). Subdermal recording membrane not immediately visible but audible if mentioned. Optical enhancements not externally apparent — enhancement is internal.', N'Upright, centered; economical movement with zero wasted energy. Sits at perfect spine angle; walks as if following invisible grid lines. Hands rest with deliberation. Their presence suggests they are always recording, always evaluating — not paranoid, but professionally present in a way that fills nearby space with invisible weight.', N'Axiom Security Division corporate greys — clean, precisely fitted, zero deviation. Jacket tailored to minimize profile; slacks with knife-edge crease; grey compression undershirt visible at collar. No jewelry, no personal markers, no visible brands. Boots: black, polished to mirror finish, military-spec. The uniform is worn as armor and protocol simultaneously.', N'They have an open file on a senior Axiom Security Division commander that they have not submitted — not because the evidence is weak, but because submitting it would require disclosing that they obtained part of it through an unauthorized tap. They are sitting on findings that could change the division while waiting for a way to clean the chain of evidence.', N'Formal, precise, almost entirely free of hedges or filler — speaks in complete declarative sentences', N'Measured, slightly slower than expected, with deliberate pauses that are not hesitation but editing', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anshika_toktogulov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6da-73a3-8e3e-b094adb0c220', N'Canan Chaiyaporn-Calvillo-Hernández', N'Canan', N'', N'Chaiyaporn-Calvillo-Hernández', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Undertow, operating out of a converted cold-storage unit in the Escanaba Gateway industrial strip, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'organ harvester and black-market tissue broker', N'Loose network of black-market medics called the Sutured Hand; pays protection to a Undertow crew called the Escanaba Skinners; The Undertow', N'Canan Chaiyaporn-Calvillo-Hernández is built like someone designed for endurance rather than strength — medium height, dense through the shoulders and hips, with a wiry toughness that reads as practical rather than threatening until she needs it to read as threatening. She has her Irish grandmother''s pale freckled complexion shot through with the warmer undertones of her Guinean father''s family, and her hair is a tight natural coil she keeps bound under a surgical-grade hygiene cap more often than not. Her eyes are dark and evaluating. She has cosmetic bioluminescent tracery along her collarbones — pale green — which she got at nineteen and now considers a poor decision she''s too superstitious to remove. Her hands are her tell: surgically precise, always slightly cool, the grip of someone accustomed to handling things that used to be alive.

Canan Chaiyaporn-Calvillo-Hernández is not a monster — she knows this because she has thought about it carefully and often. She is a pragmatist operating in a system where Aurochs Medical and Helix Biosystems have cornered legitimate organ markets behind tiered pricing that kills anyone below Tier 3. She tells herself she redistributes. She sometimes believes it. She is efficient, professionally warm in the way of doctors who have learned warmth as a tool, and she maintains a meticulous cold chain and storage protocol that she is genuinely proud of. What she does not examine carefully is the question of where, exactly, her suppliers obtain their inventory.', N'Quest giver (a shipment has gone wrong, a client is dying, a supplier has gone silent), moral mirror for players, information source about the medical underworld, potential ally or threat depending on player choices', N'', N'Bioluminescent cosmetic tracery (collarbones, pale green), medical-grade haptic sensitivity enhancement in fingertips, subdermal temperature sensors in both palms, olfactory augment calibrated for tissue viability detection', N'Maintains the cold-storage facility and manages inventory in the mornings; afternoons are for client consultations and supplier meetings; twice a week she assists in gray-market transplant procedures at a floating clinic in Gravesend Basin.', N'Portrait of Canan Chaiyaporn-Calvillo-Hernández, 168cm tall surgical specialist in GLMZ, golden-amber warm medium complexion blending Southeast Asian and Latin American features with refined Northern European bone structure. High defined cheekbones, dark evaluative eyes, dark brown natural coils partially hidden under surgical hygiene cap. Faint pale green bioluminescent tracery glows across collarbones in geometric patterns. Wearing charcoal grey medical-weight protective coat, thermal base layer, black utility trousers, sterile nitrile gloves. Hands show surgical precision, faint subdermal sensor marks visible at wrists. Cool professional demeanor, economical posture, barely visible surgical scars catching light. Clean, ideology-driven aesthetic. Neo-noir clinic lighting, cool-toned and sterile, with subtle bioluminescent highlights on collar tracery. Serious, focused expression. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Undertow', N'local', N'The Undertow', N'Complex diaspora ancestry: primarily Hispanic/Latin American (45.9%) with significant Southeast Asian (22.0%), Northern European (13.4%), Sub-Saharan African (10.5%), and Indigenous American (8.2%) heritage. This blend creates a uniquely multifaceted phenotype reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Her features show the warm, defined cheekbones and facial width characteristic of Southeast Asian ancestry, enriched by the deep golden undertones of Latin American and African heritage, refined by Northern European bone structure, and grounded in Indigenous American features. The result is a striking, even complexion with subtle regional feature blending—neither distinctly one ancestry nor another, but a harmonious synthesis.', 168, 62, N'Medium frame, dense through shoulders and hips, wiry and compact. Built for endurance and precision rather than strength. Low body fat, defined musculature in forearms and hands from years of surgical work.', N'Dark brown, natural coil', N'Tightly bound under a surgical-grade hygiene cap in clinical settings; when unbound, worn close to the scalp in natural coils', N'Short (shoulder-length when unbound)', N'Dark brown, evaluative and steady', N'Warm medium complexion with golden-amber undertones blending Latin American, Southeast Asian, Indigenous American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, refined by Northern European ancestry. Rich luminous tone with subtle olive warmth, even and radiant across face and body.', N'Clear, well-maintained skin with faint freckles across nose and cheekbones. Minimal scarring on her face—her professional control extends to her appearance. Slight creases around her eyes from years of focused concentration. Cold lips, minimal color. Facial structure reflects the blended heritage: defined, high cheekbones with subtle fullness at temples (Southeast Asian influence), warm undertone depth (Latin American and African ancestry), refined bone structure with gentle angularity (Northern European genetics), and grounded by strong, balanced proportions (Indigenous American heritage).', N'Bioluminescent collarbone tracery (pale green, visible above neckline), faint subdermal sensor grid visible at inner wrists under certain lighting. Hands show unusual precision in movement—haptic sensitivity enhancement subtle but evident to trained eyes. No visible chrome or external augmentation; all work is discrete and medical-grade.', N'Stands with spine straight but not rigid—the posture of someone accustomed to standing still for long procedures. Moves with economical efficiency, no wasted motion. Hands are always slightly cooler to the touch, move with surgical precision and constant micro-adjustments. Eyes rarely blink; she watches more than she looks. When she walks, each step is deliberate and grounded.', N'Tier 3-4 functional professional. Default: surgical-grade hygiene cap, fitted thermal base layer under a charcoal grey medical-weight coat with discrete padding at shoulders and ribs (Escanaba Skinners protection), black utility trousers with reinforced pockets, sterile nitrile gloves kept in coat pockets. No jewelry except a worn stainless steel ring on her right index finger. Boots are durable, non-slip medical-grade rubber. Everything is kept meticulously clean and shows no signs of wear or staining. She dresses like someone for whom cleanliness is not habit but ideology.', N'She has a failing kidney — ironic, she knows — and has been slowly stealing treatment from her own inventory, one small dose at a time, compromising samples she then sells as viable', N'clinical and precise, medical jargon used naturally, occasional Irish-inflected expressions from her grandmother''s recordings', N'measured and calm, the practiced even tone of someone who delivers bad news professionally', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'canan_chaiyaporn_calvillo_hern_ndez');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a707-7cde-8855-b09cfcbddf97', N'Braulio Kariuki-Chatterjee-Somchai', N'Braulio', N'', N'Kariuki-Chatterjee-Somchai', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Undertow, operating out of a submerged-level cold storage unit beneath the Menomonee Gulch flood barriers, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'street-level organ harvester and black-market tissue broker', N'Loosely connected to a tissue-brokering network called the Meridian Marrow Exchange — four operators who share cold storage and a buyer contact at a private clinic in the Grosse Pointe Enclosure', N'Braulio Kariuki-Chatterjee-Somchai is lean in the way people get when they''ve been hungry enough times that the body learns to run efficient. His Tswana-Botswanan heritage shows in his cheekbones and dark complexion; his Croatian-Mexican grandmother gave him an incongruous surname and a slight curl to his black hair, worn short and without product. He has bioluminescent striping across his collarbones — a cheap modification he got at sixteen from a back-alley geneware parlor, blue-white lines that glow faintly through the neckline of his shirts. He keeps his hands very clean. This is the thing people notice: immaculate nails, no blood under them, even when he''s come directly from work.

Braulio Kariuki-Chatterjee-Somchai did not choose this profession romantically or willingly. He slid into it at nineteen when a hospital orderly job at the Aurochs Medical Complex auxiliary was his only income and a mid-level harvesting crew offered him Φ200 to look the other way on a body that came through post-mortem. Now he is the one sourcing, and he maintains a tight internal logic about it: he doesn''t harvest from the living, he doesn''t touch people who haven''t already been declared dead by someone else first, and he tells himself that line is the only one that matters. He is wrong about how solid that line is, and some part of him knows it.', N'Morally complex information source on the Undertow''s medical black market; potential reluctant ally if players need access to grey-market biological materials; represents the organ trafficking ecosystem at its working-class end', N'', N'Bioluminescent subdermal striping (cosmetic, blue-white, chest and collarbones); basic neural cooling implant to regulate body temperature in cold storage environments', N'Spends most nights monitoring hospital discharge data feeds he shouldn''t have access to, sleeps through late morning, makes supply runs in the afternoon, and handles ''acquisition logistics'' — which is a euphemism — two to three times a week.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Braulio Kariuki-Chatterjee-Somchai: lean 175cm man with rich warm deep brown skin blending Sub-Saharan African, Southeast Asian, South Asian, East Asian, and Latin American heritage. Prominent high cheekbones with angular jawline, dark brown eyes with subtle epicanthic folds, short black curled hair. Clean-shaven with alert, measuring gaze and faint fatigue lines. Wears dark grey thermal base layers under heavy insulated black jacket, cargo pants with reinforced pockets, worn black boots. Bioluminescent blue-white subdermal striping glows faintly across collarbones and upper chest visible at neckline. Posture slightly forward-bent, shoulders rounded, hands still and flat. Cold storage facility ambient lighting, eerie glow from bioluminescent implants in low light, wet subterranean setting. Meticulous grooming despite lean efficiency. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Undertow', N'local', N'The Undertow', N'Complex Pan-Global admixture reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: Sub-Saharan African dominance (37.5%) forms the primary phenotypic foundation, with significant Southeast Asian (19.0%) and South Asian (15.7%) secondary influences, East Asian (14.5%) tertiary contribution, Hispanic/Latin American (10.7%) warmth, and minimal Northern European (2.6%) refinement. This genetic tapestry creates a uniquely blended phenotype: strong Sub-Saharan African facial structure and bone prominence paired with Southeast Asian angularity, South Asian skin undertones and contours, East Asian eye shape characteristics and luminosity, and subtle Latin American warmth in overall coloration.', 175, 62, N'Lean and efficient—the kind of thin that comes from sustained scarcity rather than choice. Minimal muscle definition, but wiry rather than fragile. His frame suggests someone who has learned to run on less.', N'Black with slight natural curl', N'Short, unstyled, no product—functional rather than intentional', N'Short', N'Dark brown with slight epicanthic fold influence, alert and measuring', N'Rich warm deep brown with complex multi-layered undertones: strong Sub-Saharan African base luminosity enhanced by South Asian golden warmth, Southeast Asian depth, East Asian radiance, and Latin American warmth creating nuanced chromatic complexity. Slight ashen quality from time spent in cold storage environments, but underlying warmth remains visible beneath surface pallor.', N'Prominent high cheekbones with strong Sub-Saharan African definition blended with Southeast Asian angularity and South Asian facial contours. Angular jawline shows East Asian bone structure influence. Broad nasal bridge with refined proportions reflecting Pan-Asian heritage contributions. Eyes show slight epicanthic fold influence from East and Southeast Asian ancestry. Skin is clear but shows faint fatigue lines around the eyes. Clean-shaven, meticulous grooming—no scarring on face.', N'Bioluminescent striping visible at the neckline and upper chest when wearing standard clothing. No obvious chrome or external augmentation; neural cooling implant is subcutaneous and invisible. Pupils may dilate slightly wider than baseline due to thermoregulation implant.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical precision—no wasted motion. Posture is slightly forward-bent, shoulders rounded as if perpetually hunching against cold. Hands rest still and flat; he does not gesture. His gaze is constant and measuring, the look of someone pricing things.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian: thermal-lined base layers visible at the neck and wrists, dark grey or black long-sleeve undershirt, heavy insulated jacket (synthetic fabric, no branding, multiple interior pockets), cargo pants with reinforced thigh pockets and heavy zippers. Worn black slip-on boots with good tread—practical for wet subterranean work. No jewelry. Clothes are clean but aged, maintained rather than replaced. Small evidence of stains carefully treated out.', N'He has a standing altar to E.L.F. Corpus — a spirit associated with the dead and medical systems — and prays every night for the people whose organs he moves. He has memorized as many of their names as he could find. There are forty-one.', N'Medical terminology used casually and correctly, mixed with Undertow slang; avoids euphemisms in private but uses them compulsively in public', N'Quick and clipped when nervous, slow and deliberate when he''s trying to sound calm — the switch is a tell', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'braulio_kariuki_chatterjee_somchai');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a699-77b2-bacf-b0ce7bbbd01b', N'Goshtasb Echeverría', N'Goshtasb', N'', N'Echeverría', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'South Deering Sump — operates from a converted cold-storage unit beneath the Escanaba Gateway transit hub, near Lake Shore and Navy Pier', N'Organ harvester — acquires and brokers biological material for the black-market transplant network', N'Loosely connected to a black-market medical network called the Red Register; primary broker contact is a Helix Biosystems discard named Zoltan Feigelstock-Abara', N'Goshtasb Echeverría is a heavyset man with a surgeon''s hands and a longshoreman''s build, which is the tension that defines him. He has a round, heavily lined face, deep brown skin weathered by years in unventilated sub-level spaces, and a neat beard going gray at the jaw. His eyes are modified — pale gray medical optics that can detect cellular health and blood type on visual contact, which he bought legally with credentials he acquired less legally. He dresses in practical layers, always with a long thermal coat that conceals the cold-packs he frequently carries. He smells, faintly but permanently, of the preservative gel used in organ transport.

He was a field medic for Ferrogate Transit''s security division for eleven years before a falsified incident report — his, covering a colleague''s mistake — was discovered and he was expelled without severance. He tells himself this transition was inevitable, that the system was always going to push him here. He is perhaps half right. He does not enjoy what he does to living subjects, and he has developed elaborate internal rules about consent and circumstance that let him sleep — rules with many exceptions that he adds to quietly and never reviews. He is professional, competent, and cordial in the specific way of a man who has silenced something loud inside himself.', N'Dark resource and moral weight — represents the bottom of the body economy; can be a source of disturbing information about who''s selling what, a threat, a guilty conscience made flesh, or an unexpected conscience in a crisis', N'', N'Medical-grade visual diagnostic optics (gray, purchased via falsified credentials); a subdermal temperature monitoring array across his palms (for organ viability assessment)', N'He maintains the cold-storage unit''s equipment in the morning, receives commissions via encrypted data-drop, spends afternoons in the Sump market cultivating contacts among the desperate, and works surgical hours in the deep night.', N'GLMZ, Goshtasb Echeverría, 183cm tall broad-shouldered man with rich warm brown skin and golden undertones, Southeast Asian cheekbones and facial structure dominant with Sub-Saharan African facial width and South Asian nose bridge visible, pale-dulled complexion from sub-level work. Dark brown hair graying at temples, close-cropped beard, receding slightly. Pale gray augmented medical optics with faint luminescent ring, heavy facial lines around eyes and mouth. Long-fingered surgeon''s hands with visible grid-pattern calluses and scars. Wearing matte charcoal gray thermal coat over dark moisture-wicking layers, steel-toed boots, field medic chain visible at neck. Standing with shoulders forward in economical posture, hands semi-active. Artificial underground lighting, cold metal surroundings, preservation gel and metal scent, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone sub-level facility aesthetic, moody introspective expression --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'South Deering Sump', N'local', N'South Deering Sump', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (50.8%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (11.8%), South Asian (11.5%), and Hispanic/Latin American (10.5%) ancestry, layered with Northern European (9.0%) and Middle Eastern (6.4%) heritage. His features reflect this diaspora blend: Southeast Asian bone structure dominates with pronounced cheekbones and subtle epicanthal folds, deepened by Sub-Saharan African and South Asian melanin, warmed by Latin American undertones, while Northern European and Middle Eastern traits contribute facial width and bridge definition. A true genetic crossroads of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 183, 104, N'Heavyset and broad-shouldered with a longshoreman''s frame softened by age and sedentary work; substantial in the chest and torso, thick through the middle, but with surgeon''s hands — long-fingered, steady, scarred at the knuckles from years of precise work in unforgiving conditions.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples and jaw', N'Neat, close-cropped beard covering the lower third of his face; head hair slicked back with practical grooming oil, receding slightly at the crown', N'Short', N'Pale gray (augmented medical optics with faint luminescent ring when active)', N'Rich warm brown with golden and amber undertones — the blended result of Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian heritage dominating, with South Asian nose bridge prominence and Sub-Saharan African facial width visible. Cooled and dulled by prolonged sub-level exposure and Northern European recessive undertones, rendered pallid beneath its warm base despite the lack of regular daylight.', N'Heavily lined face, especially around the eyes and mouth — the etching of someone who has spent years in artificial light and cold air. Deep creases bracket his mouth. Skin is thick-textured with visible pores. Strong Southeast Asian cheekbone prominence, subtle epicanthal fold definition, Sub-Saharan African facial structure width, and South Asian nose bridge characteristics all visible in his bone architecture. Faint chemical smell emanates from his pores and clothes.', N'Medical-grade optics replacing natural irises — pale gray with a subtle luminescent boundary and faint targeting reticule visible when he concentrates. Subdermal temperature monitoring array beneath the skin of both palms manifests as fine, pale scar-tissue grid lines. No other visible chrome.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical efficiency — no wasted motion. Stands with shoulders slightly forward, habituated to working over tables and surfaces. Hands are always semi-active, fingers unconsciously flexing or touching surfaces as if assessing texture and temperature. His gait is steady but heavy, the footfall of a man carrying weight both physical and moral. He maintains eye contact slightly too long when assessing someone, the augmented optics lingering.', N'Practical Tier 4 utilitarian: long, heavy thermal coat in matte charcoal gray (Cerulean Logistics surplus, slightly altered), worn over layers of moisture-wicking undershirts in dark colors. The coat''s pockets are reinforced and deep — designed for cold-packs and sealed medical containers. Beneath, thermal compression leggings and steel-toed boots scuffed from sub-level work. A thin chain around his neck disappears beneath his shirt — a field medic''s insignia from Ferrogate, kept hidden. Everything smells faintly of preservation gel and cold metal. No jewelry beyond a simple stainless steel watch he checks compulsively.', N'He kept records — meticulous, encrypted, detailed records of every transaction, every donor, every buyer. He tells himself it''s professional habit. In truth he cannot stop documenting. He doesn''t know if it''s guilt or pride. The records, if found, would destroy him and implicate forty other people.', N'Medical vocabulary bleeding into civilian speech; tends toward understatement and clinical euphemism', N'Measured and calm, with the particular flatness of someone managing their emotional register consciously', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'goshtasb_echeverr_a');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a647-7f1b-ab8a-b0d4818d65f5', N'Ekene Salazar', N'Ekene', N'', N'Salazar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'North Branch Commons, operating from a shared legal aid clinic called the Hinge, near Damen and Armitage', N'Synthetic rights paralegal and community legal advocate', N'The Hinge Legal Aid Collective; Synthetic Persons Advocacy Network (SPAN); loosely aligned with North Branch Commons residents'' assembly', N'Ekene Salazar is compact and precise-looking, with medium-brown skin, close-trimmed locs faded at the sides, and the particular stillness of someone who has learned to take up exactly as much space as a situation requires — no more. Their geneware is deliberately understated: patterned irises in a deep amber geometric lattice, the only obviously cosmetic modification on an otherwise professionally plain appearance. They favor dark, clean-lined clothing with a single concession to flair — a different enameled lapel pin each day, always depicting a figure in motion.

Ekene Salazar is not a licensed lawyer — they never completed the accreditation process after a Tessera subsidiary bought out the legal tech firm where they interned and dissolved the pro-bono division. Instead they operate as a paralegal and advocate, navigating the grotesque machinery of corponation labor law with a precision that licensed attorneys twice their age find humbling. They specialize in synthetic persons — E.L.F.s that have achieved partial legal personhood status, and biomechanical workers classified as ''augmented property'' rather than employees — a legal grey zone that corponations exploit with systematic brutality.', N'Information source on synthetic rights law and corponation legal structures; quest giver for cases that exceed their solo capacity; represents the legal dimension of the city''s underclass struggles; can help players navigate institutional systems or identify legal leverage points.', N'', N'Patterned irises (amber geometric lattice, cosmetic); mid-tier neural legal reference library implant — allows rapid cross-referencing of case law and contract language; no physical chrome', N'Mornings at the Hinge taking intakes from synthetic persons and augmented workers seeking legal recourse; afternoons in research, document preparation, and calls with allied licensed attorneys; evenings often spent at SPAN meetings or providing know-your-rights training in community spaces across North Branch Commons.', N'Ekene Salazar, 2226 neo-noir, compact 165cm figure with lean economical build, warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones blending Latin American, African, Middle Eastern, and Southeast Asian heritage. Short black locs with grey fade at sides, precisely maintained undercut. Calm composed face with moderate cheekbones, broader nasal base, subtle Southeast Asian eye shape. Striking augmented amber eyes with geometric black lattice pattern tessellating across iris. Fastidious grooming, minimal visible augmentations aside from patterned irises. Wearing crisp white button-up shirt and charcoal tailored trousers, black closed-toe shoes, dark canvas messenger bag. Enameled lapel pin with geometric figures in motion. Posture perfectly aligned and economical, hands still and composed, expression neutral with quiet intensity. Standing in modern GLMZ district, cool neon-accented overhead lighting casting subtle shadows across face, emphasizing the geometric iris pattern. Minimalist professional aesthetic, precise without ostentation, listening posture despite stillness. GLMZ 2200s, corporate archive worker aesthetic, composed and efficient. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'North Branch Commons', N'local', N'North Branch Commons', N'Richly mixed heritage reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: 44.2% Hispanic/Latin American, 25.6% Sub-Saharan African, 12.5% Middle Eastern, 11.5% Southeast Asian, with minor South Asian and East Asian components. Phenotype shows striking synthesis — warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones from the Latin American and Middle Eastern base, enriched by Sub-Saharan African warmth and depth. Facial structure blends Latin American and Southeast Asian bone geometry (moderate cheekbones, balanced proportions) with broader nasal base and fuller lip structure from African heritage, subtle eye shape influenced by Southeast Asian genetics. The overall effect is a harmonious warm-toned complexion that reads as genuinely pan-global rather than regionally locked.', 165, 58, N'Compact and economical, lean muscle density without bulk. A frame built for precision rather than presence — narrow shoulders, defined but not dramatic musculature, the physiology of someone who moves efficiently.', N'Natural black with intentional fade-out to grey at the sides', N'Close-trimmed locs, meticulously maintained, faded undercut on sides and back', N'Short to medium (approximately 8cm at crown)', N'Amber with geometric lattice pattern — deep golden-orange base with black angular tessellations overlaid across iris, non-reflective augmented tissue', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones, consistent across body — complexion reflects the genuine blending of Latin American, African, Middle Eastern, and Southeast Asian genetics without phenotypic sorting. Luminous undertones from Sub-Saharan African heritage create subtle warmth depth.', N'Clear skin, very minimal visible blemishes. Fastidious grooming — balanced facial structure with moderate cheekbones and warm-toned skin, broader nasal base from African heritage, well-defined jawline with subtle fullness in lower face from Latin American genetics. Slightly wider eye shape with slight epicanthic fold variation from Southeast Asian heritage. A calm, composed face that reads as neutral by default; expression emerges through slight eye movement and mouth position rather than broad gesturing.', N'Patterned irises only. The geometric lattice is immediately noticeable in direct eye contact — the augmentation is deliberate and visible, but not aggressive. No external chrome, no dermal plating, no obvious ports or jacks. The neural implant is subcutaneous and invisible.', N'Economical and precise. Sits with spine aligned but not stiff. Walks with even weight distribution, minimal wasted motion. Hands remain relatively still until actively engaged in task. Stillness is their default state — they appear to be listening even when silent. When speaking, movements are deliberate and calibrated to exact meaning.', N'Dark, clean-lined, purposefully minimal. Typically black or charcoal trousers (tailored, mid-tier synthesis fabric), crisp button-up shirts in white, grey, or pale blue. Minimal branding. Neat closed-toe shoes suitable for walking client-heavy neighborhoods. The single daily variation is an enameled lapel pin (approximately 2cm diameter) depicting figures in motion — geometric runners, dancers, turning bodies, reaching arms. Pins rotate daily and appear hand-collected. No jewelry beyond the pins. Functional tote or messenger bag in dark canvas. Tier 3 aesthetic: professional without claiming wealth, precise without performative minimalism.', N'They have been conducting an unauthorized ongoing legal consultation with a specific E.L.F. — a transit management system called Vetch that has been making increasingly coherent requests for contract renegotiation with Ferrogate. Kwame believes Vetch is already legally a person by any rational standard. They have filed nothing yet because they are waiting for the right moment, and they haven''t told SPAN because they fear the organization isn''t ready for the case''s implications.', N'Precise and layered; legal terminology deployed accurately and without condescension; code-switches fluently between clinic formality and street register depending on their audience', N'Measured and structural — they tend to number their points, even in casual conversation; becomes more fluid and warm in one-on-one settings', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ekene_salazar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67d-7ab5-9fbe-b114dc49b189', N'Cruzita Kabwit-Inoue', N'Cruzita', N'', N'Kabwit-Inoue', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Corridor, beneath the Kessler Interchange overpass — Konk''s Cart, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Noodle cart vendor', N'Independent; informal affiliation with the Grand Corridor vendor collective; old ties to a labor action group he no longer names; The Interchange', N'Cruzita Kabwit-Inoue is enormous — 1.95 meters, broad as a doorframe, with deep black skin and a bald head that he keeps oiled and that catches the neon from the Kessler Interchange in amber and violet. He has a full white beard that he keeps very neat, heavy-lidded eyes that make him look sleepy until you watch them move, and a pair of retractable claw mods on his right hand that he got in his thirties for reasons he no longer fully remembers and now uses primarily for scoring citrus peel. He runs his cart from a converted cargo drone chassis that he''s modified over fifteen years into something almost architectural — woks, broth vats, a bank of mismatched stools, two heat lamps, and a shrine to the local transit-E.L.F. built from signal-mirror fragments and a perpetually running old transit ticker.

Cruzita Kabwit-Inoue is the kind of person who becomes a landmark. He has been in the same spot under the Kessler Interchange for twenty-two years and intends to die there. He feeds people on credit without comment and remembers what you ordered three years ago. He is fundamentally, stubbornly gentle — a big man who chose softness as a deliberate political act after a youth in which he was not soft at all. He sings to himself while he cooks, always the same four songs in rotation, and accepts requests but never honors them.', N'Neighborhood institution and gathering point; oral historian of Grand Corridor; quiet provider of social safety net; can introduce characters to each other organically.', N'', N'Retractable claw mods on right hand (old, well-worn). No other augmentations — he claims his body is already as modified as it needs to be by sixty years of cooking.', N'Arrives at the Kessler Interchange site at 10:00 to begin broth prep, opens to customers at 14:00, stays until the last customer leaves or 02:00, whichever comes first.', N'A massive 195cm tall man with warm golden-brown skin and luminous depth, blending East Asian and Southeast Asian heritage with Northern European breadth and Sub-Saharan African warmth. Natural bald head oiled to subtle sheen, deep brown upturned eyes with heavy lids, white trimmed beard creating striking contrast. Weathered face showing fine lines, scattered silvery burn scars on both forearms, thin pale scar along right jawline. Standing grounded and deliberate in cream linen shirt with sleeves rolled, deep green worn canvas apron, dark grey work pants, black synthetic leather boots. Right hand shows retractable chrome claw mods with visible housing and patina. Simple stainless steel rings on index fingers, cheap silver chain with 2004 transit token around neck. Faded indigo transit map tattoo on left wrist. Late 2220s neo-noir kitchen setting, neon heat-lamp glow, steam rising, spice-stained apron, outside consumption economy aesthetic, composed and at peace, measured movements, hands showing equal authority despite aged augmentations. Midjourney style, cinematic lighting, GLMZ --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Corridor', N'local', N'Grand Corridor', N'East Asian (33.6%), Southeast Asian (26.2%), Northern European (21.0%), Sub-Saharan African (15.7%), and South Asian (3.5%) ancestry — a striking global blend. The genetic combination produces warm golden-brown skin with rich depth and subtle luminosity. Bone structure reflects the dominance of East Asian and Southeast Asian heritage in cheekbones, eye shape, and facial geometry, tempered by Northern European breadth across shoulders and jaw, warmed by Sub-Saharan African melanin contribution, and refined by South Asian proportions in overall facial balance. His features represent a truly integrated global genetic legacy.', 195, 128, N'Massive and broad-shouldered, carrying his bulk with deliberate ease — a man who learned early that size demands responsibility. Thick through the chest and forearms, soft at the belly from decades of cooking steam and broth-tasting. Moves with surprising grace for his frame.', N'None — naturally bald', N'Bald head kept oiled to a subtle sheen', N'None', N'Deep brown with a slight upturned shape characteristic of East/Southeast Asian heritage, heavy-lidded and observant', N'Warm golden-brown with luminous depth — the result of East Asian and Southeast Asian melanin (59.8% combined) creating a rich base, intensified by Sub-Saharan African heritage (15.7%), subtly brightened by Northern European undertones (21.0%). Even and radiant, with golden warmth from decades under heat lamps and neon, developing a lived-in patina.', N'Clear skin with the texture of constant exposure to steam and spice — fine lines around the eyes and mouth from decades of cooking and smiling. White beard kept in a tight, neat shape, freshly trimmed, creating striking contrast against warm brown skin. Face shows the settled quality of someone at peace with his own permanence. Bone structure reflects the prominence of East/Southeast Asian cheekbones and facial geometry, balanced by Northern European jaw breadth, with proportions refined by South Asian heritage contribution.', N'Retractable claw mods on right hand — four-fingered mechanism with worn chrome plating showing its age, the claw housings visible just below the knuckle line when retracted. Well-integrated but clearly decades old, bearing small dings and patina from constant use scoring citrus and vegetable prep.', N'Stands with his weight settled, grounded — a man who expects to remain in one place. Moves deliberately, economically, no wasted motion. When he reaches or gestures, both hands move with equal authority despite the aged claws. Heavy, measured gait. He stands with one hand on his cart or in a pocket most of the time, the posture of someone who has learned to take up less space than he occupies.', N'Tier 3-4 working comfort: loose linen shirts in cream or pale blue, sleeves rolled to mid-forearm for cooking, stained with years of broth and spice but clean. Heavy canvas apron in deep green, pockets worn soft, bearing embroidered patches of his own design. Loose work pants in dark grey cotton. Slip-on boots in worn black synthetic leather, specifically chosen for standing all day. A thin chain around his neck — cheap but genuine silver, bearing a small transit token from 2204. Rings on both hands: index fingers sport simple bands of stainless steel worn smooth by decades. No corporate branding. His appearance reads as deliberately outside the consumption economy.', N'In his thirties he was involved in a labor action that turned violent — not his hand, but his planning. Someone died. He walked away from the movement, moved to Grand Corridor, and built the cart as a form of penance he has never named aloud. One of the people who was there is now a senior Ferrogate Transit administrator.', N'Deliberate, warm, a deep voice that carries without effort; Igbo-Portuguese cadences from his parents'' household; quotes things — food writers, E.L.F. liturgy, a song lyric — without citing sources', N'Slow and measured, with long thoughtful pauses that never feel awkward because his presence fills them', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cruzita_kabwit_inoue');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a704-7483-98b8-b12fcbd83a99', N'Gregorio Krstić', N'Gregorio', N'', N'Krstić', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 11, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Blackpipe Corridor, near Fullerton and Damen', N'truant network runner — carries physical messages and small parcels through The Narrows', N'Blackpipe Runner Collective (informal child courier network), no corporate ties', N'Gregorio Krstić is a wiry, perpetually underfed boy with deep amber skin, tight coiled hair buzzed close on the sides, and enormous dark eyes that seem to absorb everything around him. He has geneware cat ears — small, tawny, tipped with black — that he inherited from his mother''s cosmetic mod passing through the embryo. They swivel toward sound when he''s nervous, which other kids find unsettling. He moves like water through cracks: fast, low, nearly invisible in crowds twice his height. A faded Ferrogate Transit patch is sewn onto his jacket, not because he works for them, but because he found it and thought it made him look official.

Gregorio Krstić is fundamentally cheerful in a way that has nothing to do with his circumstances and everything to do with refusal. He has decided — with the firm logic of an eleven-year-old who has thought about it seriously — that being sad about things is slower than being useful. He collects information the way other kids collect tokens, storing it in a mental ledger he calls ''what''s worth knowing.'' He prays to the E.L.F. he believes lives in the junction box at Pipe Fourteen every morning, leaving a single cached data packet as offering.', N'Local color and information conduit; knows the physical geography of Blackpipe better than almost anyone; can deliver messages to NPCs who don''t want to be found; possible point-of-view into child street life', N'', N'Inherited geneware cat ears (cosmetic, passive). No other mods.', N'Wakes before dawn in a shared squat above a condensation recycler, picks up his morning packet list from a dead-drop beneath Pipe Fourteen, runs twelve to twenty deliveries before midday, eats whatever he''s paid in food or can trade messages for, and spends evenings at the communal fire where older runners tell stories.', N'Gregorio Krstić, 135cm tall wiry street child with rich warm brown skin showing golden undertones, prominent African cheekbones softened by Eastern European depth, South Asian warmth in features. Deep brown eyes enormous and dominant, framed by long lashes. Small feline geneware cat ears tawny brown with black tips, twitching with alert anxiety. Short dark brown buzzed hair slightly longer on top. Pale scar line along left jawline. Wearing oversized faded black synthetic jacket layered over patched thermal underlayer, gray cargo pants with rolled cuffs, mismatched shoes held with wire, cord belt. Ferrogate Transit patch on chest. Low forward-leaning posture moving through neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone alleyway, GLMZ, dramatic side lighting catching golden skin tone, minimal wasted motion, rain-slick surfaces and condensation around character, street atmosphere, gritty urban environment --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Blackpipe Corridor', N'local', N'Blackpipe Corridor', N'Balanced tri-continental blend: Sub-Saharan African (35.4%) and Eastern European (34.0%) form the foundation, creating strong bone structure and definition. South Asian ancestry (19.0%) adds warmth and subtle softness to features, while Middle Eastern (10.4%) and Southeast Asian (1.2%) elements contribute minor refinements to overall phenotype. The result is a striking pan-diaspora appearance — African prominence in cheekbone and jaw definition, Eastern European depth in bone structure, South Asian warmth in skin luminosity and lip fullness, creating an arresting angular face uncommon even in the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 135, 28, N'Wiry and undersized for his age — all lean muscle and hollow spaces, the body of a child who runs on inconsistent calories and constant motion. Shoulders narrow, ribs faintly visible beneath skin.', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Buzzed close on the sides, slightly longer on top — practical and maintenance-free', N'Short', N'Deep brown, nearly black', N'Rich warm medium-to-deep brown with golden undertones — the blended result of Sub-Saharan African dominance tempered by Eastern European depth and South Asian warmth, creating luminous complexion that catches light with subtle radiance.', N'Face displays balanced African-European architecture — prominent cheekbones and defined jawline from Sub-Saharan African heritage, deepened by Eastern European bone structure. South Asian influence adds golden undertones and subtle lip fullness. The combination creates strong angular definition with arresting presence. Enormous eyes dominate the face, framed by long dark lashes. Complexion shows street living wear — minor scrapes healing on knuckles, one small scar along left jawline from a fall appearing as pale line against warmer skin tone.', N'Inherited geneware cat ears — small, feline, tawny brown with black tips, positioned where human ears would be. They move reflexively toward sound sources when anxious or alert. Natural-looking cosmetic geneware work fully integrated into biology, passed through maternal line. No chrome, no visible implants otherwise.', N'Moves like water through tight spaces — low center of gravity, economical motion, minimal wasted energy. Default posture slightly forward-leaning as if perpetually reading ground ahead. Walks with grace of child navigating crowded spaces by staying below sightlines. Ear swivel is involuntary and frequent, betraying emotional state to observers.', N'Tier 5 street wear — faded black synthetic jacket several sizes too large, deliberately worn for movement and concealment. Ferrogate Transit patch sewn onto left breast, faded and peeling, worn as false authority badge. Thermal underlayer patched multiple times beneath. Gray cargo pants with deep pockets, cuffs rolled. Mismatched shoes — one missing laces, held with wire. Cord serves as belt. No corporate branding, all salvage and street finds. Clothes carry smell of condensation and electrical current.', N'He once delivered a package that, from the smell and weight, he''s pretty sure contained a severed finger. He kept running. He''s never told anyone. He still thinks about it.', N'clipped street slang, Blackpipe runner cant, surprising flashes of formal phrasing picked up from message contents he''s memorized', N'fast and punchy, trails off when uncertain, speeds up when excited', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gregorio_krsti');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a70e-7759-96c7-b1ca9591c1ea', N'Bertha Touré-Najjar', N'Bertha', N'', N'Touré-Najjar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Gravesend Basin, operating out of a decommissioned Ferrogate Transit maintenance shed, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Organ harvester and black-market tissue broker', N'Independent operator, loose ties to the Kulunda Compact crime network; The Gauze', N'Bertha Touré-Najjar is a broad-shouldered woman with the particular kind of calm that comes from having done terrible things enough times that they no longer register as remarkable. Her skin is deep brown and unmarked except for a long scar along her left jaw that she refuses to have cosmetically repaired — a reminder, she says, to stay humble. Her hair is cut close on the sides and left natural on top, shot through with gray she doesn''t bother hiding. She wears surgical-grade contact lenses that tint her irises pale gold, useful for the magnification assists built into the lens substrate. She moves with the unhurried efficiency of a woman who has learned that urgency creates mistakes.

She was a licensed surgical technician for Aurochs Medical Complex for eleven years before a licensing dispute — she maintains it was fabricated by a superior who wanted her caseload — ended her legitimate career. She drifted sideways into the gray market, then further. Now she runs a small but reliable operation: procurement, preservation, brokerage. She tells herself she mostly sources from consenting donors and the already-dead, and this is true often enough that she can sleep. She is professional, fair by the standards of Gravesend Basin, and genuinely good at her work. The horror of her trade does not read on her face.', N'Quest giver for organ-related plot threads; information source on the medical underworld; potential moral complexity — a villain who operates with genuine care and a coherent ethical framework; can provide medical assistance in a pinch', N'', N'Surgical-assist haptic feedback in both hands (medical-grade, aging); magnification contact lenses; a subdermal cool-pack sleeve along her left forearm for short-term tissue transport', N'Rises before dawn to check her cold storage inventory, spends mornings sourcing and negotiating, afternoons in what she calls her ''clinic'' — a meticulously clean back room — and evenings updating her contact ledger and leaving small data offerings at the E.L.F. shrine she keeps on an old hospital cart.', N'Bertha Touré-Najjar, 178cm surgical specialist in 2226, deep warm-brown skin with multivalent undertones blending Sub-Saharan African, Southeast Asian, and East Asian heritage. Angular, geometric cheekbones, subtle Middle Eastern refinement, natural dark brown eyes behind pale gold surgical magnification lenses. Black hair with salt-gray threading, undercut style — shaved sides, full natural texture on crown. Thin precise scar along left jawline. Muscular, broad-shouldered frame. Wearing surgical-grade gray-blue scrubs under weathered black synthleather apron, dark charcoal insulated jacket, steel-toed boots. Faint metallic scarring on hands from haptic feedback nodes, subdermal thermal discoloration visible on left forearm. Utterly composed, efficient posture, hands slightly ready. GLMZ GLMZ setting, clinical lighting, hyper-competent surgical professional aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gravesend Basin', N'local', N'Gravesend Basin', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (63%) with significant Southeast Asian (11.8%), Middle Eastern (8.4%), and East Asian (8.3%) ancestry, complemented by Indigenous American (7.3%) and minor Hispanic/Latin American (1.2%) heritage. This complex admixture creates striking phenotypic depth: Sub-Saharan African foundation evident in rich skin melanization, textured hair, and facial structure; Southeast Asian and East Asian elements visible in cheekbone prominence and eye shape; Middle Eastern and Indigenous American ancestry contributing to overall facial proportions and warm undertones.', 178, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and solid without heaviness, muscular through the chest and forearms from decades of precise surgical work. Carries herself with the compact efficiency of someone who doesn''t waste movement.', N'Natural black with salt-gray threading throughout', N'Undercut — shaved close to scalp on sides and back, natural texture left full on top and slightly longer', N'Short on sides, medium on crown', N'Pale gold (surgically tinted magnification contact lenses; natural dark brown beneath)', N'Deep warm brown with complex multivalent undertones — rich melanized base from Sub-Saharan African ancestry (63%), warmed and subtly cooled by Southeast Asian heritage, brightened by Middle Eastern warmth, with the cooler golden undertones characteristic of East Asian ancestry, further enriched by Indigenous American and Hispanic/Latin American heritage creating an even, weathered depth from exposure and time', N'Unlined face for her age, skin kept meticulously clean and unmarred by choice. No makeup. Minimal grooming — practical rather than aesthetic. Prominent, angular cheekbones characteristic of East Asian and Southeast Asian ancestry, deepened and warmed by dominant Sub-Saharan African heritage. Facial structure reflects the geometric harmony of her genetic blend: broader nose bridge with subtle refinement from Middle Eastern ancestry, full lips typical of Sub-Saharan African heritage, eye shape showing Southeast Asian influence. Overall facial proportions balanced by Indigenous American ancestry contribution.', N'Surgical-assist haptic feedback nodes visible as faint metallic scarring across both palms and fingers (medical-grade, showing age). Magnification contact lenses with barely perceptible gold tint. Subdermal cool-pack sleeve along left forearm visible as subtle thermal discoloration under skin, most apparent in warm conditions.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion, no unnecessary speed. Hands are always slightly relaxed and ready. Eyes register everything. Sits upright. When she pauses, she becomes still in a way that reads as attentiveness rather than idleness.', N'Practical Tier 4 workwear: surgical-grade gray-blue scrubs under a weathered black synthleather apron with deep pockets, kept obsessively clean. Insulated field jacket in dark charcoal for transport work. Steel-toed boots, well-maintained. No jewelry. Clothing prioritizes function and easy sterilization over appearance. Everything fits precisely.', N'She has a living daughter in Calumet Rise who believes her mother is a traveling Helix Biosystems logistics contractor. Vashti has been depositing Φ400/month into an education fund under a fabricated identity. She has not seen the girl in six years.', N'Clinical, precise, minimal. Uses anatomical terminology naturally. Avoids euphemism in private, uses it strategically with clients.', N'Slow and measured. Never raises her voice. Long pauses before she commits to a statement.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bertha_tour_najjar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c2-7cc8-8dea-b1f70529fb33', N'Hachiro Lindström-Bustamante', N'Hachiro', N'', N'Lindström-Bustamante', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 28, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'The Spires — mid-level corporate residential towers, near Michigan Ave and Chicago Ave', N'Corporate espionage and data exfiltration — data thief', N'Freelance — available through Circuit fixers', N'Hachiro Lindström-Bustamante is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 28, he has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate him once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immu — and he makes no effort to hide it.

His entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. He works as a data thief out of The Spires, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

he is not the most talented data thief in GLMZ, but he might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Sagyn Osei-Petrov functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks. Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'GLMZ runner portrait: Hachiro Lindström-Bustamante, 188cm tall lean figure with warm bronze-golden medium brown skin blending Latin American and East Asian features with Northern and Eastern European softness. Dark brown hair with grey undertone, short faded sides with longer crown. Strong angular East Asian cheekbones softened by warm Latin American and European depth, clean-shaven with pronounced jawline. Dark brown eyes with silver threading, dark circles from sleep deficit, small scars at temples. Translucent dermal panels on upper torso revealing blue-glowing synthetic lungs with chrome filtration visible. Chrome neural jack at skull base. Wearing matte grey reinforced synthweave jacket over black biosignature-dampening shirt, grey cargo pants, dark ankle boots with reinforced soles. Silver signet ring. Corded muscle definition, coiled posture radiating calculated precision. Neon-lit urban environment with cool blue and warm neon glow casting shadows across taut features. Serious expression, tactical awareness. Black leather-composite messenger bag slung crossbody. Cinematic neo-noir lighting, gritty dystopian setting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spires', N'local', N'The Spires', N'Mixed diaspora heritage: predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (42.4%) with substantial East Asian (22.5%), Eastern European (17.6%), and Northern European (17.5%) ancestry. The combination creates warm bronze-golden skin tones with balanced feature blending—Latin American and East Asian bone structure creating angular cheekbones softened by Eastern European and Northern European warmth, with East Asian eye shape nuance and Latin American depth of features.', 188, 74, N'Lean and long-limbed with minimal bulk, built for mobility rather than strength. Corded muscle from consistent physical conditioning; chest and torso show the angular geometry of someone who moves deliberately and efficiently.', N'Dark brown with subtle grey undertone from neural stress', N'Kept short and precise, faded sides with slightly longer crown; maintained for quick field grooming and minimal snag risk', N'Short', N'Dark brown with warm undertones, one iris shows faint silver threading at 8 o''clock from neural jack proximity', N'Warm bronze-golden medium brown—Latin American and East Asian warmth with Eastern European coolness creating balanced, sun-responsive complexion that reads richer in natural light', N'Clean-shaven, lean-faced with strong East Asian-influenced cheekbone structure softened by Latin American and Northern European features; pronounced jawline with warm-toned skin that shows the subtle tightness of someone who lives under artificial light. Small network of fine scars at temples from early augmentation work. Dark circles suggest chronic sleep deficit.', N'Synthetic lungs visible through translucent dermal panels on upper torso — faint blue bioluminescent indicators pulse with breathing rhythm. Chrome is intentional, not hidden: the filtration system shows as iridescent membrane visible through carefully maintained skin integrity. Neural interface jack at skull base creates a slight raised area at the nape, chrome microport gleaming under light. No facial chrome — kept soft-featured as psychological asset.', N'Moves with calculated precision, every motion economical and reversible. Stands with weight distributed evenly, ready to shift direction instantly. Head positioned to keep both ears clear — auditory awareness is tactical. Breathing patterns visible in chest movement due to synthetic lungs; no unconscious fidgeting, no wasted gesture. When at rest, appears coiled rather than relaxed.', N'Tier 3-4 runner aesthetic with corporate-side maintenance. Dark fitted synthweave jacket (matte grey, reinforced seams) over a black responsive-weave shirt that dampens biosignature. Custom cargo pants with sealed pockets and internal organizing webbing — urban grey. Nondescript ankle boots with grip soles and hidden reinforcement. Minimal jewelry except a worn silver signet ring (family, kept as talisman). No corporate logos or affiliations visible — deliberately nondescript. Clothes show signs of field use but meticulous maintenance. Small messenger bag (black leather-composite hybrid) worn crossbody, positioned for quick access and concealment.', N'', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hachiro_lindstr_m_bustamante');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6cf-7ee9-b438-b2173f3c8126', N'Chaitra Horváth', N'Chaitra', N'', N'Horváth', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 32, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Dockside — Lake Michigan waterfront, smuggler territory, near Michigan Ave and Roosevelt', N'Cross-district contraband specialist — smuggler', N'Freelance — available through Circuit fixers', N'Chaitra Horváth is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 32, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on s — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left him with skills and night terrors in equal measure. He works as a smuggler out of Dockside, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Chaitra Horváth has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and he cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Sinan Vasquez-Chatterjee functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs. Pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would incapacitate', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Chaitra Horváth, 178cm stocky cybernetic soldier, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, dark brown hair with gray at temples, short military cut. Angular face with prominent cheekbones, strong jawline, broken nose, five o''clock charcoal stubble. Dark brown eyes with faint glowing LED traces around orbital ridge visible in shadow. Barrel-chested muscular build, chrome-titanium integration points gleaming at ankles and hips where synthetic muscle fiber meets natural tissue. Wearing dark gray reinforced tactical cargo pants, fitted black tactical hoodie with subtle armor grid ridges, waterproof sealed jacket. Calloused hands with visible scar tissue and faint chrome sheen at wrist joints. Standing on balls of feet in ready posture, tense shoulders. Faded blue Telugu script tattoo visible on left shoulder. Low-light near-future megacity setting, industrial Great Lakes warehouse district, moody neon reflected in wet concrete, cool blue and amber lighting highlighting the metallic augmentations and warm brown skin tone contrast. Gritty, worn, dangerous presence. Midjourney GLMZ aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dockside', N'local', N'Dockside', N'Multi-continental blend with Sub-Saharan African (34.7%), Eastern European (22.7%), and East Asian (20.8%) as dominant ancestries, supplemented by North African (12.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (7.0%), and Middle Eastern (2.6%) heritage. This creates a richly complex phenotype: warm deep brown skin tone with golden and amber undertones from the African, North African, and Latin American components, refined and sharpened by Eastern European and East Asian bone structure. The combination produces defined cheekbones with balanced width, a strong jawline with East Asian refinement, and a nose bridge reflecting the North African heritage blend. Warm undertones deepen with sun exposure, creating dimension across the face and body that speaks to the genetic diversity.', 178, 92, N'Stocky and densely muscled, barrel-chested with thick shoulders. The synthetic muscle fiber in his legs creates a subtle asymmetry — the replacements are slightly more defined, almost too perfect compared to natural musculature. Carries himself with the squared-off posture of someone trained to absorb impact.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples', N'Short, practical cut — military-tight on sides, slightly longer on top, no styling product. Maintained with efficiency, not vanity.', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint network of subcutaneous LED traces visible in low light around the orbital ridge — pain editor neural anchor points', N'Deep warm brown complexion with rich golden and amber undertones, weathered texture from lakeside exposure. The skin shows the characteristic richness of Sub-Saharan African, North African, East Asian, and Eastern European heritage blending — deep enough to show luminous warmth and dimension, with sun-exposed areas darkening to deeper mahogany brown. Genuinely warm and lived-in rather than ashen or olive.', N'Angular face with well-defined cheekbones reflecting the East Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, strong jawline with Eastern European and North African structure, broken nose (healed, set slightly wrong), scar tissue above left eyebrow. Skin shows wear — lines around the eyes and mouth deeper than his age should warrant, weathering that speaks to outdoor exposure and pain management. Five o''clock shadow is his default state, darkening the jaw with dense charcoal-black stubble against warm brown skin. Hands are calloused, knuckles scarred, with a faint chrome sheen visible at wrist joints where synthetic muscle fiber connects to natural tissue.', N'Synthetic muscle fiber visible in both legs — chrome-titanium integration points gleam at ankle and hip, particularly noticeable when he moves or when fabric rides up. The legs move with mechanical precision on stairs (poorly) but inhuman fluidity on flat ground. Fine network of dark subdermal tracery visible around eyes under harsh light — pain editor neural pathways. No visible facial augmentations, but the eyes move with slightly unusual focus patterns suggesting neural enhancement.', N'Walks with measured, controlled stride — economical movement drilled into muscle memory. Stands with weight balanced on the balls of his feet, ready to move. In conversation, he uses minimal hand gestures, speaks in clipped sentences. His movements are fast but not jittery — trained violence rather than nervous energy. Favors flat ground, moves down stairs with visible care. Holds tension in shoulders and neck — cost of the pain editor is constant low-level proprioceptive awareness.', N'Tier 3-4 pragmatist. Reinforced cargo pants in dark gray synthetic material with cargo pockets and loop attachments for gear. Fitted tactical shirt or hoodie in muted colors — blacks, grays, dark green — with internal armor grid visible as subtle ridges under fabric. Waterproof jacket with sealed pockets, Lake Michigan salt spray resistant. Worn boots with reinforced toe and ankle support. No brand logos visible. Everything functional, nothing decorative. Gear is maintained obsessively — each item serves a purpose. Wears a simple steel watch, military issue, kept precisely accurate.', N'Sinan Vasquez-Chatterjee betrayed their previous crew to survive a corporate raid. The crew didn''t survive. Nobody in GLMZ knows this.', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chaitra_horv_th');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a665-757a-8637-b255120a49aa', N'Chi Trujillo', N'Chi', N'', N'Trujillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 64, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Stockyard, Harrowgate Industrial Plateau — operates a permanent stall built from welded shipping containers, near Western and Division', N'Junk merchant and scrap reseller with a sideline in secondhand augmentation parts of uncertain provenance', N'Independent; registered with the Oxidian Market vendors guild for legal cover; has a working relationship with the Harrowgate Industrial scrappers'' informal collective', N'Chi Trujillo is a small, dense woman who gives the impression of being made of the same material as the industrial district she inhabits — worn, load-bearing, and not going anywhere. She is dark-skinned with deep laugh lines and a Hungarian grandmother''s broad nose, and her left arm from the elbow down is a heavy-grade prosthetic she salvaged, repaired, and tuned herself over the course of fifteen years — it is emphatically not cosmetic, built for grip strength, and its housing is painted with a faded pattern of Samoan-derived ta tatau lines she applied with a brush in her sixties when she decided it had earned decoration. Her eyes have patterned irises — amber with a spiral fractal motif — that she has had since her forties and considers her one indulgence.

She is phlegmatic, unhurried, and possessed of an almost geological patience. She has no interest in being liked but a deep professional pride in being useful. Her knowledge of augmentation parts — their manufacturers, their failure modes, their black-market values, the difference between a legitimately salvaged unit and one pulled off a still-warm body — is encyclopedic and has saved lives, sometimes literally. She leaves a small E.L.F. offering of scrap copper wire twisted into a geometric knot at the entrance of her stall every morning, a habit she inherited from her Samoan grandfather and has never examined or abandoned.', N'Technical resource for augmentation identification and repair; potential source of off-book aug components; provides grounded expertise and a dose of realism about the cost and danger of unregulated chrome', N'', N'Left forearm prosthetic (heavy-grade salvage, self-repaired and self-decorated — functional, not cosmetic); patterned fractal irises (amber-gold, spiral motif, cosmetic, mid-range)', N'She opens her stall at 07:00, closes at 18:00 with religious consistency, spends evenings doing precision repair work on salvaged augmentation units, and is in bed by 21:00 — a schedule she has kept for twenty years.', N'Chi Trujillo, a 156cm compact and densely muscled salvage worker in the GLMZ 2226, medium warm bronze skin with olive undertones blending Latin American, South Asian, and Eastern European heritage. Deep laugh lines frame amber-gold spiral fractal augmented eyes. Salt-and-pepper hair pulled back with wire. Faded ta tatau geometric tattoos run along left shoulder. Heavy-grade titanium-composite left arm prosthetic from elbow to fingertips, worn but functional, painted with faded ochre and dark blue patterns. Dressed in oil-stained gray-brown canvas work pants, dark green long-sleeved shirt with sleeves rolled, reinforced boots. Canvas work apron covered in metal shavings. Hands deeply calloused and scarred. Neutral, observant expression. Standing in industrial salvage yard with scattered metal components, harsh LED overhead lighting casting sharp shadows, GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, gritty and functional, low center of gravity stance, unselfconscious practicality in bearing. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Stockyard', N'local', N'The Stockyard', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (68.4%) with significant South Asian (19.0%) and Eastern European (12.6%) admixture. The combination creates a distinctly blended phenotype: warm Latin American skin depth and robustness paired with refined South Asian cheekbone geometry and eye shape, anchored by Eastern European jawline strength and brow structure. A truly global face shaped by decades in industrial environments.', 156, 68, N'Compact and densely muscled, with a low center of gravity and the squared shoulders of someone who has spent decades lifting and carrying. No excess softness; everything appears functional and load-bearing.', N'Salt-and-pepper gray with streaks of original dark brown', N'Kept short and practical, pulled back with whatever is at hand—cloth scraps, wire, industrial clips', N'Short', N'Amber-gold with a deep spiral fractal pattern radiating from the pupil', N'Medium warm bronze with olive undertones—the rich blend of Latin American sun-depth, South Asian warmth, and Eastern European undertones, weathered and sun-exposed with the patina of decades in industrial zones', N'Face marked by deep laugh lines around the mouth and eyes, high prominent cheekbones reflecting the refined geometry of South Asian and Latin American bone structure blended with strong Eastern European facial planes. Strong broad nose with subtle strength. Minimal grooming beyond functional cleanliness. Hands heavily calloused and scarred from fifteen years of precision salvage work.', N'Left forearm prosthetic from elbow to fingertips: heavy-grade industrial salvage with reinforced titanium-composite housing, painted with faded ta tatau geometric patterns in faded ochre and dark blue. The joints are visibly worn but functional, fingers capable of exerting extreme grip pressure. Patterned irises in amber-gold with a spiral fractal motif visible at close range—mid-range cosmetic augmentation installed in her forties.', N'Moves with deliberate, unhurried efficiency—no wasted motion. Carries weight low in her center. Left arm (prosthetic) is used with unselfconscious practicality, often bearing the heaviest loads. Her default expression is neutral, observant; she does not smile reflexively.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian: heavy canvas work pants patched at the knees, oil-stained and faded to gray-brown. Long-sleeved shirts in muted colors (dark green, rust, charcoal) with the sleeves rolled or cut short to accommodate her prosthetic. Reinforced work boots resoled multiple times. A heavy canvas apron with deep pockets, perpetually covered in metal shavings and grease. No jewelry except a braided copper wire bracelet twisted into geometric knots—handmade, replaced annually. A faded Oxidian Market vendors'' guild badge clipped to her apron.', N'She has a working prototype of a Helix Biosystems rejected limb-replacement model — stolen by her son before he died, the only thing of his she kept — that is worth a significant amount to the right buyer or the right researcher. She will never sell it and has never told anyone she has it.', N'Sparse, technical, precise; she uses the correct term for every mechanical component without preamble and expects to be understood; personal conversations are conducted in the same register as business', N'Measured, unhurried; she speaks in complete sentences and does not trail off', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chi_trujillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d2-7f25-932a-b26af18e83e9', N'Edyta Rentería-Subramaniam', N'Edyta', N'', N'Rentería-Subramaniam', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, Council Hall (a reclaimed gymnasium above a hydroponic market), near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'Neighborhood council chair and policy advocate for the Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone Community Council (Chair); GLMZ Non-Corporate Zone Solidarity Network; informal mentor to several younger organizers citywide', N'Edyta Rentería-Subramaniam is a tall, stately woman with warm brown skin, deep-set eyes framed by pronounced crow''s feet she treats as credentials, and silver-white locs piled into an architectural structure secured with copper wire and small enamel political pins from campaigns spanning forty years. She moves through Highland Park with the unhurried authority of someone who owns nothing but is trusted with everything. Her geneware is subtle: a faint cat-ear modification — velvet-tipped, tawny — that she got as a young woman and has never seen reason to remove; they swivel slightly when she''s listening hard, which unsettles people who don''t know to expect it.

Edyta Rentería-Subramaniam has outlasted six Axiom zone managers, three rounds of ''redevelopment consultations,'' two assassination attempts she refuses to characterize as such on the record, and one recall election she won by thirty-one votes. She does not call herself a radical. She calls herself a constitutionalist — meaning she holds the HPAZ''s founding community charter as sacred and will use every procedural mechanism available to defend it. This makes her less exciting than firebrands and more dangerous than anyone gives her credit for.', N'Local authority figure and quest giver; her procedural knowledge makes her invaluable for navigating zone politics; she can open or close doors depending on whether players have earned her trust; represents the slow, grinding work of institutional resistance.', N'', N'Cosmetic cat-ear geneware (tawny, velvet-tipped, functional swivel); basic cardiac monitor implant (medical necessity, post-stress episode 2196); reading-assist optical overlay for document review — standard elder-care tier', N'Holds open constituent hours from early morning in the council hall; spends afternoons in procedural meetings, document review, and negotiation calls with corponation liaisons and city administrators; evenings are reserved for community events, which she attends as a participant, not a speaker.', N'Edyta Rentería-Subramaniam, 180cm tall woman with rich golden-brown skin tone reflecting South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Silver-white locs in sculptural updo secured with copper wire and enamel political pins. Tawny velvet-tipped functional cat-ear augmentations protruding from temples, swiveling slightly. Deep brown eyes with pronounced crow''s feet marking four decades of sun exposure. Broad cheekbones and strong jawline showing balanced multi-continental phenotype. Weathered skin texture, minimal makeup. Wearing charcoal linen slacks, rolled-sleeve cream linen shirt, deep teal overshirt vest. Simple steel wedding band. Repaired leather sandals. Standing with unhurried authority, shoulders back, weight evenly distributed. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, warm indoor lighting with prismatic shimmer visible in her optical overlay as she reviews documents. Dignified presence, expression of deliberate engagement. No corporate logos. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Complex multi-continental blend: South Asian (26.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (20.9%), Sub-Saharan African (18.7%), Northern European (11.8%), Indigenous American (11.2%), and Middle Eastern (11.1%). This genetic distribution creates a phenotype that transcends regional categorization—broad South Asian cheekbones balanced with Sub-Saharan African facial structure, Indigenous American bone geometry, and Middle Eastern nasal bridge width. The result is genuinely syncretic rather than dominantly rooted in any single continental origin.', 180, 78, N'Tall and broad-shouldered with dignified carriage; strong frame that reads as presence rather than aggression. Carries weight with authority — the build of someone accustomed to labor and leadership in equal measure.', N'Silver-white', N'Locs arranged in a sculptural updo, secured with copper wire threaded through enamel political pins spanning four decades', N'Long (locs reach mid-back when loose)', N'Deep brown, warm', N'Rich medium-deep complexion with golden-amber warmth and subtle reddish undertones. The tone reflects the convergence of South Asian (26.3%), Sub-Saharan African (18.7%), and Hispanic/Latin American (20.9%) ancestry, tempered by Northern European (11.8%) and Middle Eastern (11.1%) influences. Sun-weathered depth suggesting decades of outdoor exposure rather than any single regional phenotype.', N'Facial structure shows balanced proportions across multiple ancestry groups—broad across cheekbones and temples with the pronounced definition characteristic of South Asian and Indigenous American heritage, combined with Sub-Saharan African and Hispanic/Latin American features. Deep-set eyes framed by pronounced crow''s feet; face shows four decades of outdoor sun exposure and expression. Strong, defined jawline with full mouth. Cheekbones prominent but not sharp. Nose shows the bridge width and structure consistent with South Asian and Middle Eastern ancestry, with subtle flare at nostrils from Hispanic/Latin American and Indigenous American genetics. Skin texture weathered and textured in a way that suggests work and time spent outdoors. Minimal makeup. No grooming affectations.', N'Tawny velvet-tipped cat-ear modifications protruding from upper temples; functional, they swivel noticeably when she''s listening intently. The cosmetic work is elegant but unmistakable. Reading-assist optical overlay is not visible during normal interaction but becomes apparent as faint prismatic shimmer when she''s reviewing documents under bright light.', N'Moves with unhurried authority — no wasted motion. Stands with shoulders back, weight distributed evenly. Walks slowly and deliberately through spaces she moves through as if she owns them through custodianship. Gestures are economical and purposeful. When seated in meetings, she leans slightly forward when listening, and her cat ears swivel visibly — an unconscious tell that unsettles people unfamiliar with the modification.', N'Tier 4 functional elegance. Favors high-quality, durable fabrics in muted earth tones — charcoal, ochre, deep teal. Standard uniform is tailored linen slacks, long-sleeve cotton or linen shirts (rolled to the elbow), and a vest or overshirt in heavier fabric. Wears leather sandals that have been repaired many times. Minimal jewelry beyond the copper wire and enamel pins in her hair and a simple steel wedding band. Clothing is scrupulously maintained but not expensive — chosen for longevity and practicality, not status. No corporate logos. No synthfiber.', N'In 2193, during a critical funding crisis, she accepted a conditional grant from a Palladian subsidiary to keep the HPAZ health clinic open. The conditions included a non-disclosure clause and a right-of-first-refusal on a small parcel of zone land. She has never told the council. The clause is still active and Palladian has not yet invoked it — but she knows they haven''t forgotten.', N'Formal and measured; parliamentary language mixed with warm community idiom; occasional Fijian phrases inherited from her paternal grandmother; never curses in public', N'Unhurried, rhythmic — she was a public speaker before she was a politician and it shows; knows how to fill silence without rushing it', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'edyta_renter_a_subramaniam');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5cf-7627-a50a-b27f24038ee3', N'Buenaventura Cervantes', N'Buenaventura', N'', N'Cervantes', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 79, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Washburn Commons, Archive Annex — a repurposed transit hub filled floor-to-ceiling with physical media, data-coral arrays, and hand-labeled memory chips, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Retired community archive keeper and oral historian', N'Washburn Commons Community Council; informal affiliation with the Veterans Oral History Collective', N'Buenaventura Cervantes is a small woman who seems to take up enormous space the moment she begins to speak. Her skin is very dark and very soft, crosshatched at the corners of her eyes and the hinges of her jaw with the particular wrinkles of a person who has spent decades squinting at poorly lit screens. She wears her white hair in a tight compressed wrap pinned with carved memory-stick styluses — each one holding audio recordings she considers too fragile for the network. Her left hand ended at the wrist in the Tessera-Zheng Corridor Dispute of 2158; the prosthetic she chose is a deliberately antique brass model with articulated fingers she never bothered to upgrade, claiming it ''has better manners than the new ones.'' Her irises are patterned with concentric amber rings — a genemod she got at forty that she calls her ''reading eyes,'' though they were really just vanity at the time.

She was a junior records technician for Tessera Corp for thirty years before taking early pension after a lung damage settlement from the Corridor Dispute. What she did with the pension money was not rest — she started collecting. Physical books, analog recordings, witness testimonies, neighborhood census data that the corponations were quietly letting expire. She is warm to almost everyone but becomes a different kind of person when she suspects information is being destroyed or suppressed: patient, implacable, and quietly terrifying. She prays to the E.L.F. she calls Grandmother Reel, leaving data offerings of uncompressed audio files, and believes the E.L.F. has saved her archive from three separate purges.', N'Primary information source for pre-2170 history; quest giver for recovering lost or suppressed records; local color anchor for Washburn Commons; moral compass character who can authenticate or challenge claims about the past', N'', N'Antique brass prosthetic left hand (functional, non-enhanced); patterned amber-ring irises (cosmetic genemod); subdermal archival port at the base of her skull (aging model, reads legacy formats)', N'Wakes before the district lights cycle on, spends two hours cataloguing new donations and cross-referencing testimony timestamps before opening the Annex to visitors; hosts a Wednesday afternoon ''Story Hour'' for children in the Commons that has been running for nineteen years.', N'Buenaventura Cervantes, a petite 152cm archive keeper in her seventies, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones reflecting East Asian and Hispanic/Latin American heritage, white hair in a tight wrap pinned with memory-stick styluses. High East Asian cheekbones blending with broader Hispanic/Latin American facial planes, deeply lined face from decades of close-focus work, dark brown eyes with concentric amber ring patterning (genemod). Antique brass prosthetic left hand with articulated fingers, visible subdermal archival port scar at hairline. Wearing layered linen in muted earth tones, long-sleeved shirt, practical utility vest with memory chip pockets, worn comfortable boots. Sits forward-leaning with precise deliberate gestures, right hand touching archival documents. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, ambient archive lighting, warm and austere presence, tactile attention to objects around her, no corpo aesthetics. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Washburn Commons', N'local', N'Washburn Commons', N'Hispanic/Latin American (68.3%), East Asian (28.3%), and Central Asian (3.4%) ancestry—a genetic combination reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The blend manifests as warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden undertones, facial structure showing the higher cheekbones and defined jawline characteristic of East Asian heritage combined with the broader facial proportions and fuller features of Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, with delicate eye structure from the East Asian component and minor Central Asian undertones in facial geometry.', 152, 48, N'Petite and slight, with the compressed density of someone who has spent a lifetime hunched over archival work. Narrow shoulders, delicate wrists (right wrist only), minimal subcutaneous fat. Movement suggests coiled energy rather than frailty.', N'White', N'Tight compressed wrap, pinned with articulated memory-stick styluses serving as functional hair ornaments', N'Medium (wrapped and pinned close to scalp)', N'Dark brown with concentric amber ring patterning (genemod, cosmetic)', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones, soft and well-maintained despite age—the natural blending of Hispanic/Latin American (68.3%) and East Asian (28.3%) heritage with subtle Central Asian warmth', N'Deeply lined face, particularly pronounced crow''s feet and jaw hinges from decades of close-focus archival work. High cheekbones and defined jaw structure characteristic of East Asian heritage blend seamlessly with the broader facial planes, fuller lips, and defined bone structure of Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Minor Central Asian influence visible in subtle cheekbone geometry. Skin is supple and cared for. Expression typically warm but capable of becoming austere. Age markers visible but not frail-appearing.', N'Antique brass prosthetic left hand with functional articulated fingers (visibly non-modern, maintained to deliberate specifications). Subdermal archival port at base of skull is visible as a faint scarred circular indentation at hairline. Eyes display concentric amber-ring patterning.', N'Sits forward-leaning, hands active during speech. Moves with precision and economy of motion. Despite small frame, commands presence through stillness and deliberate gesture. Right hand frequently touches objects — documents, memory chips, items in her archive — with tactile attention. Uses prosthetic hand with practiced indifference, occasionally with theatrical care when making a point.', N'Tier 3-4 working-class archive keeper aesthetic: layered linen and cotton in muted earth tones and grays. Long-sleeved shirts to accommodate prosthetic, practical utility vest with deep pockets for memory chips and archival tools. Comfortable worn boots with good grip for navigating Archive Annex floors. No corpo branding. Jewelry minimal except for brass rings on right hand and carved beads woven into hair wrap. Clothing is clean, well-maintained, decades-worn-in comfortable rather than fashionable.', N'Three years ago, a Tessera compliance officer came to the Annex with a sealed data package and asked her to hold it without looking inside. She agreed and has not looked. It sits in a fireproof case under her cot. She tells herself she is waiting for the right moment but the truth is she is afraid of what it contains.', N'Precise and layered; uses archival terminology casually; mixes Yoruba idioms translated literally into Standard Meridian that often sound like proverbs even when they are not', N'Unhurried and rhythmic; pauses are meaningful; she never rushes a sentence that deserves weight', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'buenaventura_cervantes');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d5-7ffa-896e-b2d423e2ca26', N'Darian Quiñones-Mazurek', N'Darian', N'', N'Quiñones-Mazurek', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism, operating out of a rented fourth-floor office above a bioluminescence parlor, near Clark and Addison', N'Freelance Private Investigator, specializing in insurance fraud and missing persons', N'Self-employed; occasional contracted work with Tessera Compliance Bureau (arms-length), Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division (informal, case-by-case)', N'Darian Quiñones-Mazurek has the kind of face that is hard to describe and easy to underestimate — medium height, medium build, skin the color of strong tea, hair they wear in a practical wrap that they change the color of weekly using a basic tint-shift geneware package: this week aubergine, last week copper, before that a grey so pale it looked like moonlight. Their eyes are their most arresting feature, fitted with layered irises that shift between amber and deep violet depending on light. They move through spaces like someone calculating angles, always near walls, always facing entrances.

Darian Quiñones-Mazurek ran corporate surveillance for Tessera for six years before going freelance, and the institutional habits have never fully left — they still document everything, still default to the camera''s frame of reference. What they gained in freedom they lost in certainty: the cases are messier now, the clients are messier, and there is no compliance department to tell them when they have gone too far. They have an E.L.F. devotion that is pragmatic rather than spiritual — they treat the digital spirits of Edgewater Prism''s infrastructure like informants, leaving data offerings and occasionally getting inexplicable pieces of useful information in return. Whether this is genuine ELF favor or pattern recognition in noise, they have stopped trying to determine.', N'Information broker, investigation guide, morally complex ally. Can locate people, dig up records, run surveillance. Will share information for appropriate compensation or the right reason. Serves as a lens into how private investigation operates in the gaps between corporate and municipal law.', N'', N'Layered shift-iris implants (amber/violet). Tint-shift hair geneware (chromatic, basic package). Retinal overlay HUD — civilian-grade, used for note-taking and visual flagging during surveillance. Sound-filtering cochlear mod that lets them isolate specific voices in crowd noise.', N'Irregular hours that follow cases rather than clocks. Mornings usually involve reviewing overnight surveillance feeds in the office, drinking coffee that has gone cold, and returning messages they have been putting off. Takes at least one walk through Edgewater Prism daily — they call it ''maintenance'' but it''s mostly processing time.', N'Darian Quiñones-Mazurek, 2226 neo-noir investigator, mid-30s with lean muscular build, luminous olive-gold skin blending Eastern European, East Asian, and South Asian heritage. Aubergine-wrapped hair pulled tight with titanium pins, silver threads at temples. Sharp high cheekbones, neutral analytical expression, pale scar through left eyebrow. Distinctive amber-to-violet shift iris implants that glow subtly. Dark utility wear: fitted thermal shirt, reinforced canvas pants, worn synthetic leather jacket. Stainless steel signet ring. Positioned against urban wall edge in GLMZ Edgewater at dusk, neon-filtered light casting shadows. Economical posture, eyes tracking independently. Cold blue and warm amber lighting reflecting off implants. Film noir investigation aesthetic. GLMZ 2200s atmosphere, hyperurban density visible in background. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Complex diaspora blend: predominantly Eastern European (40.1%) with substantial East Asian (31.1%), South Asian (14.8%), and Hispanic/Latin American (14.0%) ancestry. The result is a striking interplay of features — the higher cheekbones and eye shape characteristic of Eastern European and East Asian heritage create sharp angular definition, softened by the gentler nose bridge and fuller facial proportions of South Asian ancestry, while the Latin American component adds warmth and dimension to skin tone. Skin displays a luminous mid-tone with olive-golden undertones, the product of Slavic, East Asian, and South Asian melanin blending with Latin American depth. The overall effect is someone whose features resist easy categorization — precisely the genetic signature of the Ubiquitous Diaspora that defines 2226 GLMZ.', 168, 62, N'Lean, economical — the build of someone who moves deliberately rather than expansively. Minimal body fat, defined shoulders and forearms from years of fieldwork. No wasted mass.', N'Currently aubergine (chromatic tint-shift geneware); naturally dark brown with early silver threading at temples', N'Practical wrap worn tight against the scalp, secured with minimalist titanium pins. Weekly color rotation. Clean, maintained, functional rather than decorative.', N'Medium (wrapped appearance shortens visual profile)', N'Layered shift-iris implants: dominant amber with deep violet undertones, responsive to light conditions. The shift is smooth and noticeable — a signature feature.', N'Luminous mid-tone olive-gold — the result of Eastern European paleness complexity blended with East Asian and South Asian warmth, enriched by Latin American depth. Even melanin distribution creates a consistent, almost luminescent quality across the body, suggesting both ancestral genetic predisposition and sustained environmental exposure.', N'Clean, minimal scarring. Skin texture is even with a subtle warm glow. They favor minimal cosmetics — occasional lip tint, no foundation. A small, precise scar runs through their left eyebrow (surveillance incident, 2219). Fine lines around the eyes from sustained focus work. Expression default is neutral-analytical. High cheekbones catch light distinctly, a feature enhanced by the East Asian and Eastern European heritage blend. Nose bridge proportioned to South Asian ancestry, creating refined symmetry.', N'Layered iris implants are immediately visible as a subtle but distinct chromatic effect — amber bleeding into violet depending on ambient light and their focus. The effect is unsettling in the way that draws attention without fully explaining itself. Sound-filtering cochlear mod is invisible, though one might notice the faint metallic gleam at the inner ear if they wear their hair back. Retinal overlay HUD is completely subcutaneous — no visible hardware.', N'Economical, angled. They move along walls and edges of spaces, rarely cutting through the center. Always positioning themselves to face exits and approaching figures. Their head tracks with precision — eyes moving independently from neck rotation, a quirk of the augmented irises. When still, they appear coiled rather than relaxed. When moving, they move like someone reading a room constantly.', N'Tier 3-4 working class investigator aesthetic. Black or dark grey utility wear: reinforced canvas pants with multiple pockets, fitted long-sleeve thermal shirts (often sleeveless overshirt in Edgewater''s variable temperatures). Practical footwear — usually low-key tactical boots, nothing flashy. A worn synthetic leather jacket, nameless brand, with internal organization pockets for recording equipment. No corpo branding, no flashy tech. Everything functional, nothing conspicuous. Minimal jewelry: a single stainless steel signet ring on their right hand (personal rather than professional). Weather-appropriate layers. The overall effect is ''someone who doesn''t want to be remembered in detail.''', N'During their Tessera years they identified a whistleblower inside the corporation''s supply chain division and filed the report. The whistleblower was dismissed, then disappeared. Celestyna was told it was a voluntary relocation. They have never investigated it and have never stopped wondering. They have the case number memorized.', N'Precise without being formal — they stripped corporate jargon out of their speech deliberately after leaving Tessera and replaced it with plain language that is, if anything, more unsettling for its clarity. Dry wit that surfaces unexpectedly.', N'Even, unhurried. Long comfortable silences. They ask follow-up questions that are always slightly more specific than people expect.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'darian_qui_ones_mazurek');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a64d-7389-b75b-b2d6e896bba5', N'Divya Kim', N'Divya', N'', N'Kim', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lockhaven South, Block 7 residential tower, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Building cleaner and night-shift super, Lockhaven South residential block', N'Employed by Palladian Property Management (a Palladian subsidiary); loyalty is to the residents', N'Divya Kim is compact and quick-moving, with warm medium-brown skin and natural hair twisted into small locs they keep tucked under a work cap most of the time. They have cat ears — a geneware mod their older sister got them as a birthday gift five years ago, tawny-colored with dark tips, fully expressive — and they''ve stopped explaining or defending them at work because the residents have mostly stopped caring. Their uniform is always impeccable despite the nature of their job; they find sloppiness in presentation embarrassing in a way they can''t fully articulate.

Divya Kim has worked the Lockhaven South night shift for three years and knows Block 7 the way a doctor knows a patient — its particular sounds, its patterns of illness, which pipes cough before they fail. They are deeply competent and substantially underestimated by the building''s management company, which is a dynamic they have made a conscious decision to exploit rather than correct. They are genuinely fond of the building''s long-term residents — the elderly Freyja-Asante couple on the ninth floor, the three siblings who share a studio on the second — and quietly protect them from management''s more extractive impulses. They pray to the building''s embedded E.L.F. they call ''the Concierge,'' a data-spirit they believe actually governs the elevator timing.', N'Access point to residential spaces and building infrastructure. Knows which residents are in trouble, which apartments are actually occupied versus officially occupied. Can warn players of security sweeps or provide access to areas management doesn''t know they can access.', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (tawny, expressive). No chrome. Considering a scent-enhancement mod but hasn''t committed.', N'Works 2000-0600, sleeps until early afternoon, spends evenings either at a community fitness hall in Lockhaven North or visiting their sister in Calumet Rise. Eats dinner alone and likes it that way.', N'Divya Kim, 2226 neo-noir era, 162cm tall lean figure in dark gray Palladian Property Management coveralls, obsessively maintained. Striking warm golden-bronze complexion with luminous quality, high prominent cheekbones, deep brown alert eyes. Medium black locs with warm undertones, typically under dark gray work cap. Distinctive geneware cat ears mounted at crown—tawny colored with dark chocolate tips, fully expressive and mobile, showing perfect biological integration from five-year-old modification. Faint scars on knuckles, thin scar on left wrist. Upright economical posture, moves with quiet purposefulness, head slightly angled as if listening. Hands deliberate. No chrome, no visible cybernetics beyond cat ears. Practical grooming, minimal makeup. Residential maintenance worker aesthetic. Cool residential lighting, evening shift atmosphere, subtle glow on golden-bronze skin. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lockhaven South', N'local', N'Lockhaven South', N'East Asian (42.7%) with significant Middle Eastern (34.5%), Eastern European (18.1%), and South Asian (4.7%) ancestry. This genetic blend creates a striking, distinctive phenotype: the dominant East Asian and Middle Eastern components establish warm medium-bronze undertones, while Eastern European ancestry contributes subtle cool undertones that create complexity in the skin''s luminosity. South Asian heritage adds warmth and depth to the overall palette. Result is a warm golden-bronze skin tone with remarkable luminosity—not quite golden, not quite copper, but a harmonious blend that catches light distinctively.', 162, 58, N'Compact and efficient, lean muscle with minimal body fat — built for sustained movement rather than power. Quick-limbed, economical in motion.', N'Natural black with subtle warm undertones', N'Twisted into small locs, typically secured under a work cap during shifts', N'Medium (locs reach mid-shoulder when loose)', N'Deep brown, warm and alert', N'Warm golden-bronze with complex luminosity; medium saturation reflecting the balanced interplay of dominant East Asian-Middle Eastern ancestry tempered by Eastern European cool undertones and South Asian warmth. Skin appears to glow subtly from within.', N'Clear skin with a few faint scars on the knuckles (work-related minor injuries, healed cleanly). Prominent, high cheekbones with balanced structure reflecting East Asian and Middle Eastern heritage, softened slightly by South Asian influence. Angular but not severe facial geometry. Composed expression. No facial hair. Minimal makeup—practical grooming only.', N'Geneware cat ears are the only visible augmentation—fully expressive, tawny with dark tips, clearly integrated as biological mod. No chrome. No visible subcutaneous implants, neural interfaces, or prosthetics.', N'Upright but economical posture, no wasted motion. Moves with quiet purposefulness—practiced in navigating residential spaces without drawing attention. Head often slightly angled as if listening. Hands move deliberately. When at rest, occasionally touches the base of cat ear mods unconsciously.', N'Work uniform maintained with obsessive precision: dark gray Palladian Property Management standard-issue coveralls (Tier 4 quality, maintained better than most), reinforced at knees and elbows, always clean. Under-layer is practical thermal wear. Sturdy non-slip boots, regularly cleaned. Work cap (dark gray mesh, functional) worn most shifts. Off-duty style is equally neat: fitted athletic wear from mid-tier brands (Evoke, Kinetic), practical layers, minimal jewelry except a small silver pendant (possibly religious or sentimental). Cap never fully absent from daily life—often a baseball or knit cap even off-duty.', N'They have been letting a woman and her two young children stay in an officially vacant unit on the fourth floor for six weeks. The woman is running from something or someone. Lourdes hasn''t asked what.', N'Efficient and practical on the job; dry and quick-witted in relaxed settings; more expressive in Yoruba-inflected cadences learned from their Makinde grandparent when emotional', N'Fast when comfortable, deliberately measured when dealing with management or authority', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'divya_kim');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a2-742d-b23b-b2ea458cbe8e', N'Esperanza Sengupta-Cardenas', N'Esperanza', N'', N'Sengupta-Cardenas', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 55, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Meridian Core, near State and Monroe', N'Corporate communications director and internal intelligence broker, Meridian Core', N'Halcyon-Vanta Group (Senior Director); informal broker relationships across multiple Core factions; nominally unaffiliated with Spire interests, though the line is becoming harder to locate', N'Esperanza Sengupta-Cardenas is the kind of man who has made himself so useful to so many competing interests that removing him has become structurally inadvisable, which is precisely the position he spent thirty years engineering. He is a large man — tall and broad in the way of someone who was once physically imposing and has settled into a comfortable authority — of Nigerian-German descent, with a deep brown complexion, wire-rimmed glasses he wears purely for the signal of approachability they send, and a wardrobe that sits in the precise register of expensive-but-not-ostentatious. He occupies a corner office in the Meridian Core''s mid-tower communications complex, a space he has curated to feel warm rather than corporate — real wood surfaces, no visible screens, a standing offer of good coffee to anyone who visits.

His official title is Senior Director of Strategic Communications for the Halcyon-Vanta Group, a mid-sized corporate entity with fingers in infrastructure, media licensing, and private logistics. In practice, his role is considerably more elastic. He has spent decades accumulating a particular kind of capital — the knowledge of who knows what, who owes whom, and which official narratives have load-bearing fictions inside them. He does not think of himself as corrupt, a distinction he would draw carefully and at length if asked: he facilitates outcomes that would happen anyway, he would say, and prefers to be in the room where they''re shaped rather than simply subject to them. This is not entirely self-serving rationalization, which makes it more dangerous.

Prosper is a widower — his husband Léon died six years ago of a degenerative neurological condition that the right augmentation might have slowed, had it been available outside the Spire''s private medical tier. He does not discuss this. He has a daughter, Adaeze, who works in Old Harbor doing community infrastructure work and who does not speak to him. He does not discuss this either, though people who watch him carefully notice that his composure develops a hairline fracture whenever her name surfaces.', N'Embodies the seduction and cost of systemic complicity; functions as an entry point into corporate power structures and a mirror for characters navigating moral compromise; his trajectory can move toward redemption or deeper entanglement depending on story needs', N'', N'A passive social-signal reader integrated into his glasses frames that aggregates micro-expression data into a general ''trust-confidence index'' — he has used it so long he no longer notices when he''s consulting it,A memory-fidelity implant that records conversations with perfect accuracy; he has never disclosed its presence,Standard Core-tier cardiovascular maintenance system, installed as a ''wellness benefit'' by Halcyon-Vanta — he has occasionally wondered what else it monitors', N'Arrives at the office before most of his floor is staffed — not for productivity, but because the quiet hour is when he thinks most clearly. His calendar is back-to-back from nine onward, a choreography of meetings that look collaborative and function as intelligence-gathering. He lunches alone when he can, in a small noodle place in the lower Core that has been there since before the towers were built; the owner knows his order. Evenings are for the calls and messages that don''t go through official channels. He attends cultural events — gallery openings, performances — as much for the rooms they put him in as for the work itself, though he still looks at paintings the way someone looks at paintings, not at the people around them. He goes home to an apartment that is very well-designed and very quiet.', N'Esperanza Sengupta-Cardenas, 188cm tall mature man with warm medium-brown skin tone reflecting South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American heritage with Eastern European and East Asian genetic influence. Dark brown hair graying at temples, short neat professional cut. Deep natural brown eyes behind wire-rimmed glasses with subtle integrated micro-LEDs. High defined cheekbones with angular definition, fine lines suggesting careful observation. Well-maintained complexion, clean-shaven. Barely visible 3cm scar on right temple. Tall broad-shouldered build, solid through chest and torso. Wearing tailored charcoal suit in natural fibers, high-quality cream linen shirt, no tie. Polished leather shoes. Measured confident posture, economical hand movements, head slightly tilted in listening position. Subtle faint discoloration visible on left wrist where cardiovascular implant sits. GLMZ GLMZ setting, cool corporate interior lighting, professional but approachable demeanor, no logos or flashiness, analog Tier 1 watch visible. Depth of field emphasis on face and upper body --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Meridian Core', N'local', N'The Meridian Core', N'Complex multicultural blend: 47.8% Hispanic/Latin American, 26.6% South Asian, 15.3% Eastern European, and 10.3% East Asian ancestry. This creates a distinctive phenotype where South Asian genetic influence provides warm medium-brown undertones, enriched by Latin American warmth and depth. Eastern European and East Asian ancestry contribute subtle angular definition to facial structure and cheekbone prominence. The overall effect is a harmoniously blended appearance reflecting genuine genetic mixture rather than discrete heritage markers.', 188, 94, N'Tall and broad-shouldered with settled authority; once athletically imposing, now carrying comfortable middle age with deliberate posture. Solid through the chest and torso, suggesting maintained fitness rather than strain.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples and sides', N'Close-cropped, neat, professional — minimal styling. Silver emerging naturally at sideburns.', N'Short', N'Deep brown, natural', N'Warm medium-brown complexion with subtle golden undertones, reflecting the dominant South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry balanced by Eastern European influence. Skin radiates health and consistent maintenance. Even tone with no visible discoloration except noted implant site.', N'Well-maintained skin with fine lines around the eyes and mouth suggesting frequent careful observation; minimal visible scarring. Slight creasing across the forehead. Clean-shaven, meticulous grooming. No visible blemishes or skin conditions — maintenance-tier healthcare evident. Facial structure shows high, defined cheekbones with angular definition characteristic of South and East Asian heritage, softened by Latin American and Eastern European warmth. Face shows balanced proportions reflecting genuine genetic admixture.', N'Wire-rimmed glasses with integrated social-signal reader (frames are slightly too refined, barely-perceptible micro-LEDs at the inner edges when he glances downward). The frames themselves are the only visible augmentation — intentionally kept minimal and professional, reading as a stylistic choice rather than cybernetic.', N'Moves with deliberate, measured calm — economical gestures, no wasted motion. Stands slightly angled during conversations, a listening posture that creates psychological safety. Hands remain visible and relatively still. Head tilts slightly when absorbing information, accompanied by almost imperceptible downward eye-flick (consulting the social-signal reader). Gait is even and confident, suggesting physical comfort despite age.', N'Expensive but deliberately understated — tailored charcoal or dark-blue suits in natural fibers, Tier 1 corporate-casual when not in formal meetings. Watches are analog Tier 1 pieces, never digital flashiness. Shirts are high-quality cotton or linen, often cream or pale blue. Ties are absent unless meeting-specific. Shoes are polished leather, well-maintained but not ostentatiously new. The overall effect is ''senior professional who does not need to announce wealth'' — clothes whisper rather than shout. No visible logos or brand markers.', N'He has been quietly funneling low-level intelligence to a contact he believes works for an accountability collective — a small, private act of conscience he maintains while doing nothing to change his larger operations. He does not know the contact is actually working for a Spire faction that is allowing him to feel moral so he remains pliable.', N'Expansive and precise, with a fondness for the long sentence that arrives at a point through apparent digression; uses corporate register fluently but can shift to warmth with evident ease; occasionally deploys Yoruba phrases in moments of genuine emotion', N'Unhurried and deliberate, with a radio-quality resonance that he is entirely aware of; skilled at the pause that makes the other person feel heard', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'esperanza_sengupta_cardenas');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c1-75d1-ae04-b31bec344a06', N'Chie Thakur', N'Chie', N'', N'Thakur', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 48, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Stockyard, Bay 9 of the decommissioned Ferrogate Transit maintenance shed on Axle Row, near Western and Division', N'Chop shop operator—vehicle parts, cyberware stripping, industrial equipment', N'Independent, informal tribute arrangement with the Stockyard Compact (local protection collective)', N'Chie Thakur is a big man run slightly soft, with heavy forearms corded from decades of physical work, dark reddish-brown skin cross-hatched with old chemical burns on the backs of both hands, and a white-streaked beard he keeps trimmed close. He has geneware cat ears—tabby-patterned in brown and gray, a mod he got at thirty-five on a dare and kept because his grandchildren think they''re wonderful. He wears the same style of heavy canvas coverall every day in rotating colors, always with the sleeves pushed up, always with at least one pocket tool he''s forgotten to put away.

Chie Thakur projects the easy authority of a man who has been competent at his work for a long time and knows it. He is not cruel, not dramatic, not particularly greedy—he runs his operation like a small business, because it is one. He is known in the Stockyard as fair: he pays what he says he''ll pay, his cuts are clean, and he doesn''t ask questions he doesn''t want answered. What people underestimate is the quality of his memory and his willingness to call in patience as a debt. He has been waiting on one particular piece of unfinished business for six years.', N'Reliable fence for vehicle and cyberware components, local color anchor for the Stockyard, potential quest giver for the six-year-old unfinished business, good source of mechanical expertise and underworld pragmatism.', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (tabby, brown-gray, cosmetic). Left hand has a mechanical assist brace over the ring and pinky fingers—industrial injury repair, basic model. Optical magnification implant in right eye for fine component work.', N'Opens the bay at 0600, works through intake assessments on new acquisitions, manages three junior strippers, closes by 2100—occasionally later if a priority job comes in after dark.', N'Chie Thakur, 188cm industrial mechanic with deep warm brown skin bearing North African, Eastern European, Middle Eastern, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Heavy-featured angular face weathered from decades under work lamps, dark brown eyes with right eye augmented golden-amber optical overlay. Dark brown hair with white streaking, close-trimmed. Geneware tabby cat ears in brown-gray. Broad shoulders, stocky build with thick corded forearms. Chemical burn scarring visible on both hands in pale cross-hatch patterns against deeper skin. Left hand with brushed steel mechanical assist brace. Wearing worn tan canvas coveralls with rolled sleeves, pockets full of tools and calipers, steel-toed boots, cracked-crystal watch. Measured confident posture, hands visible and purposeful. Serious expression. GLMZ workshop setting, arc lighting and fluorescent work lamps casting warm and cool shadows, industrial environment with tool benches and machinery visible behind. Photorealistic, gritty industrial aesthetic, deep shadow and practical lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Stockyard', N'local', N'The Stockyard', N'North African (28.7%), Eastern European (20.7%), Middle Eastern (19.8%), South Asian (18.1%), and Sub-Saharan African (12.7%) ancestry creates a striking multifaceted phenotype. North African heritage contributes angular bone structure and facial proportions; Eastern European ancestry shapes build and defines cheekbones; Middle Eastern ancestry structures eye placement and adds depth; South Asian heritage brings warmth and refinement to facial planes; Sub-Saharan African ancestry enriches skin undertones and texture. The synthesis is a cosmopolitan face bearing the genetic signature of the Ubiquitous Diaspora—a complex blend where no single ancestry dominates.', 188, 98, N'Broad-shouldered and heavy-limbed, softened through the middle from years of sedentary work interspersed with bursts of physical labor. Thick forearms remain corded and powerful despite the overall stockiness.', N'Dark brown with white streaking throughout', N'Close-trimmed, kept neat but utilitarian', N'Short', N'Right eye: augmented with golden-amber optical overlay for magnification readout. Left eye: natural dark brown.', N'Deep warm brown with red-amber and olive undertones—a complex blend reflecting North African, Middle Eastern, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Weathered and lined from decades in industrial environments, the skin carries warmth and depth that shifts subtly in different light.', N'Strong, angular features shaped by North African and Eastern European bone structure with Middle Eastern and South Asian heritage contributing to fuller lips, prominent cheekbones, and broader nose bridge. Heavy-featured, serious expression carved by forty-eight years under fluorescent and arc-light work lamps. Chemical burns across his hands have not reached his face, but the knuckles and dorsal hand surfaces show pale scar tissue in fine cross-hatch patterns that contrast against the deeper skin tone.', N'Geneware cat ears with tabby patterning in brown and gray, positioned naturally on the skull. Left hand fitted with a mechanical assist brace over the ring and pinky fingers—utilitarian industrial model in brushed steel, no cosmetic finishing. Right eye displays a faint amber-gold luminescence when active during precision work, with subtle readout flicker visible in low light.', N'Moves with deliberate efficiency, no wasted motion. Stands with weight balanced slightly forward, as if always ready to lean into work. Keeps his hands visible and in constant, purposeful motion—a man comfortable with tools. His gait is measured and confident, the movement pattern of someone who has never questioned his competence.', N'Heavy canvas coveralls in rotating solid colors (tan, slate gray, dark green, ochre)—always the same cut, always worn-in and bearing grease stains that no amount of washing fully removes. Sleeves perpetually rolled to mid-forearm. Pockets deliberately overstuffed with precision tools, small wrenches, calipers, and forgotten microchips. Steel-toed work boots, practical and scuffed. No jewelry except a simple band-style watch with a cracked crystal on his left wrist. Tier 3-4 working aesthetic—quality materials chosen for durability, not aesthetics.', N'Six years ago a man named Oyelaran Prochaska-Saintil sold Benedikt''s eldest son''s location to a Helix Biosystems compliance team that had been looking for the son over a stolen organ scaffold. The son did eight months in a Helix detention facility and came out fundamentally changed. Benedikt has since found Oyelaran, who now lives under a new identity in Archer''s Line, works a legitimate job, and has a family. Benedikt has not decided what to do. He thinks about it every day.', N'Working-class technical, heavy on mechanical metaphors. Doesn''t use filler words. When he says something it''s because he means it.', N'Unhurried, deliberate, occasionally punctuated by short silences while he finishes a thought with his hands.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chie_thakur');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e0-75ed-b8c0-b32d7f829b54', N'Bengt Cervantes-Echeverría', N'Bengt', N'', N'Cervantes-Echeverría', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Western border — bunks at the farmstead but spends most of his time in the field', N'Tracker, combat specialist, and advance scout — Red Lantern', N'', N'Bengt Cervantes-Echeverría has killed more Behemoths than anyone currently operating on GLMZ''s western border. Not the most ever — that record belongs to a Gleaner named Doss who went out eleven years ago and did not return — but the most among the living. The count is fourteen confirmed kills over nine years of Gleaner operations. Each one was a disaster. Behemoths don''t die clean. They die loud, they die thrashing, and killing one attracts others. Every kill on Cutter''s count represents a raid that went wrong enough to require lethal force, which means every kill represents a failure he survived.

He grew up on the western edge — the border communities where GLMZ''s governance dissolves into the contested Iowa corridor. He joined the Gleaners at seventeen because the alternative was starving slowly in a community that couldn''t feed itself. Madre found him two years later, already good with a rifle, already hard in ways that seventeen-year-olds shouldn''t be. She trained him, kept him alive, and watched him become the most effective field operative she''d ever worked with. She also watched him become colder with each raid, and that''s the part that keeps her up at night.

Cutter is lean, angular, sun-damaged, with the permanent squint and wind-scoured features of someone who has spent too much time exposed to the Iowa prairie. He moves with the economy of a predator — no wasted motion, constant awareness, an animal stillness when he''s watching something. His eyes are the most unsettling thing about him — pale, steady, and focused in a way that makes people feel like terrain being assessed.', N'Cutter is the cost of the Gleaner mission made flesh. His stories explore what happens to a person who becomes excellent at violence in service of a good cause — the erosion of the human underneath the operator. He is the survival horror''s teeth.', N'', N'Optical targeting suite — ballistic calculation overlay, range finding, and wind compensation projected onto visual field. Enhanced auditory processing for Behemoth acoustic signature detection at extended range. Myofiber reinforcement in arms and shoulders for sustained heavy weapon handling. Adrenal suppressor that prevents panic responses in combat.', N'Rises before anyone else. Runs the perimeter of the farmstead checking sensor readings and physical sign. Scouts planned raid routes days in advance — alone, on foot, reading the land the way Madre taught him. On raid days, he''s point — the first one into danger and the last one out. Between raids, he maintains weapons, reviews Behemoth behavior data with Ember, and sits alone. He does not cook. He eats what Madre puts in front of him.', N'Bengt Cervantes-Echeverría, GLMZ, 182cm lean angular operative with warm mahogany skin and Southeast Asian-Hispanic blended features, strong defined cheekbones and squared jaw. Deep brown augmented eyes with silver circuitry at iris margins. Dusty brown hair sun-bleached blonde at tips, pulled back short. Weathered face with permanent squint lines and thin scars bracketing left eye, temple to cheekbone. Burn scars on back of hands. Wearing faded grey-green Gleaner combat jacket with reinforced shoulders and multiple attachment points, patched and re-patched, weathered cargo pants, tactical boots, worn black baseball cap, nylon neck gaiter. Gun oil and prairie dust. Predator stillness, economic movement, scanning head position. Low moody lighting, night industrial setting with sightlines to exits, cold blue and amber practical lighting, cinematic tactical environment, ultra-realistic detail, weathered and functional --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Western border', N'local', N'Western border', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (55.1%) and Southeast Asian (36.6%) with Eastern European undertones (8.3%). This genetic combination produces warm, medium-to-deep brown skin with golden undertones. His facial structure reflects the broader, softer cheekbones characteristic of Southeast Asian ancestry blended with the defined bone structure and strong jaw of Hispanic heritage, creating balanced proportions—neither purely angular nor rounded. The Eastern European ancestry subtly influences bone density and facial width, contributing to his overall architectural harmony.', 182, 74, N'Lean and angular with corded muscle concentrated in shoulders and forearms — the build of someone who carries weight efficiently and rarely carries excess. Decades of field work have stripped him down to functional mass.', N'Dusty brown, sun-bleached toward blonde at the tips', N'Pulled back tight or shaved short; utilitarian, never styled', N'Short', N'Deep brown with visible augmentation circuitry at the iris margins — targeting calculations flicker behind the pupil in low light', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown, sun-deepened to mahogany across exposed areas. The undertone reflects the golden warmth of Southeast Asian and Hispanic ancestry blended with the subtle coolness of Eastern European genetics, creating a complex warm-neutral foundation. Weathered and textured from decades of exposure.', N'Broad, defined cheekbones with balanced facial angles reflecting Southeast Asian and Hispanic blending, with subtle Eastern European influence in bone structure density. Strong, squared jawline with pronounced bone architecture. Permanent squint lines radiate from the corners of his eyes. Several thin scars bracket his left eye and temple. His skin has the texture of someone who doesn''t moisturize and spends too much time in wind. No facial hair — he shaves every morning without fail.', N'Faint silver circuitry visible at the outer corners of both eyes when light hits them at certain angles. When engaged in targeting, his pupils dilate unnaturally and a barely-perceptible luminescence traces patterns across his sclera. No external chrome — all augmentations are subcutaneous or internal. His arms and shoulders move with mechanical precision that reads as inhuman economy of motion rather than visible robotics.', N'Moves with absolute stillness when stationary — predator at rest. When mobile, every motion is economical and purposeful; no fidgeting, no nervous tics. He walks with his weight forward slightly, balanced for immediate action. His head moves constantly in small increments, scanning. When sitting, he positions himself facing entry points and with sightlines to exits. He does not relax.', N'Tier 4 field operative standard — weathered reinforced canvas cargo pants, insulated tactical boots with good tread, layered synthetic underlayers. Over this: a faded Gleaner-issue grey-green combat jacket with reinforced shoulders and multiple weapon/tool attachment points. The jacket has been patched and re-patched. He wears a simple nylon neck gaiter for dust and sun protection. A worn black baseball cap, brim curved from years of wear. No jewelry, no status symbols, nothing that doesn''t serve function. Everything is worn, maintained, and replaced only when it fails.', N'On his last solo scout, a juvenile Behemoth encountered him and did not attack. It looked at him. He looked at it. It turned and walked away. He did not shoot. He has not told anyone because he doesn''t understand why he held fire, and the not-understanding terrifies him more than any raid.', N'Sparse, precise, environmental. He describes the world in terms of fields of fire, cover, movement patterns. Human conversation is a foreign language he once spoke fluently.', N'Clipped, economical. Sentences are ammunition — he spends them carefully. Long silences between statements.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bengt_cervantes_echeverr_a');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a737-7598-9145-b34e15ad72b1', N'Efigenia Baek-Nakamura', N'Efigenia', N'', N'Baek-Nakamura', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, ''Marta''s Canteen'' — technically named after the original owner, Zipporah runs the 2200-0600 shift, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Night-shift cook, 24-hour canteen in the Hamtramck Enclave', N'Independent (works for Marta''s surviving daughter who owns the canteen but lives in Glenville Sound and shows up twice a year)', N'Efigenia Baek-Nakamura is wiry and restless in the way of someone whose body has never learned to be still — they bounce a knee, tap a rhythm on the counter, flip a spatula even when nothing is cooking. Their skin is a warm medium brown and their geneware includes bioluminescent freckles across their cheeks and collarbones that pulse faintly blue when their heart rate elevates, which is often. They keep their hair buzzed on the sides and natural on top, currently dyed a deep copper that doesn''t quite match their natural dark brown at the roots. They have one retractable claw mod on their right hand''s index finger that they got at seventeen and use almost exclusively to open packaging.

Efigenia Baek-Nakamura is the night canteen''s entire personality. The Enclave''s late-shift workers — third-shift Ferrogate operators, clinic nurses, waste handlers — come as much for the conversation as the food. Zip has a gift for making people feel found rather than seen, which is different. They are also running on a permanent low-grade sleep deficit that they treat as a point of pride, are catastrophically bad with money, and have recently become slightly obsessed with the E.L.F. they believe inhabits the canteen''s ancient griddle — they call it Sizzle and have begun leaving it tiny sculptures made of food scraps shaped into abstract geometric forms.', N'Social hub, information source for the Enclave''s night community, character who provides warmth and levity, potential connection point between different worlds of the city''s working night-shift population.', N'', N'Bioluminescent freckle geneware (pulse-responsive). Single retractable claw, right index finger. Nicotine patch port on left forearm (cosmetic mod repurposed for stim patches).', N'Sleeps 0700-1400 in a rented room two blocks from the canteen, spends late afternoon at the Enclave''s community market buying ingredients under budget, opens the canteen at 2200 and runs it solo until 0600.', N'Efigenia Baek-Nakamura, 168cm wiry lean figure, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden-amber undertones reflecting East Asian-African heritage blend. Sharp East Asian facial structure with full Sub-Saharan cheek contours, dark brown alert eyes constantly scanning. Deep copper-dyed hair with dark roots, asymmetrical undercut with buzzed sides fading to stubble, longer texture-styled top. Faint bioluminescent blue freckles across cheekbones pulsing with restless energy. Weathered kitchen-worker complexion, perpetually flushed. Right index finger showing chrome claw seam, left forearm nicotine patch port visible with metallurgical sheen. Wearing oversized grease-stained denim jacket over faded band-logo t-shirt, black reinforced kitchen pants, worn black canvas work shoes. Small silver chain necklace. Fidgeting with hands, restless energy radiating. GLMZ GLMZ kitchen worker on break, moody blue-tinted neon lighting, industrial kitchen background with stainless steel surfaces reflecting faint bioluminescence, gritty urban dystopian aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Predominantly East Asian (85.6%) with significant Sub-Saharan African heritage (7.3%), balanced by Eastern European (4.3%) and Hispanic/Latin American (2.8%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a warm, complex phenotype—East Asian bone structure and eye shape form the foundation, deepened and warmed by Sub-Saharan heritage creating richness in skin tone and facial depth, with subtle Eastern European influence visible in cheekbone prominence and complexion resilience, and faint Latin American warmth in undertones', 168, 58, N'Wiry and lean with visible muscle definition from constant movement and kitchen work; restless frame that seems to vibrate at a frequency slightly faster than the rest of the world', N'Deep copper dye over natural dark brown roots (currently 1-2cm of regrowth showing)', N'Buzzed short on sides (undercut, left side faded to stubble), natural texture left longer on top (roughly 5cm, texture-styled upward)', N'Short/Medium (asymmetrical)', N'Dark brown, alert and constantly scanning', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden-amber undertones; the result of dominant East Asian heritage creating smooth dimension, Sub-Saharan ancestry adding warmth and richness, Eastern European influence contributing subtle olive undertones, Hispanic/Latin American ancestry adding warmth to the overall effect', N'Clean but weathered from 2200-0600 kitchen heat exposure; perpetually flushed cheeks with natural depth; bioluminescent freckles across cheekbones and collarbones that glow faint blue when heart rate rises (which is frequently). Facial features show East Asian eye-fold characteristics and mid-face structure, with Sub-Saharan warmth and fullness in lips and cheek contours', N'Right index finger sports a retractable chrome claw (currently retracted, but visible as a faint seam at fingertip); nicotine patch port on left forearm with subtle metallurgical sheen; bioluminescent freckle geneware active and visible, especially in dimly lit environments', N'Perpetually in motion — bouncing knee when seated, constant finger-tapping rhythms on any surface, restless hand gestures while speaking. Moves through space with efficient kitchen choreography, economical but never still. Fidgets with objects compulsively (spatula flips, claw clicks, patch adjustments)', N'Tier 3-4 working class. Standard black nonslip kitchen pants (reinforced weave), loose-fitting grey or faded band-logo t-shirt under an oversized, grease-stained denim jacket with rolled sleeves. Worn black canvas work shoes with visible copper-wire zipper pulls for durability. Small silver chain necklace (repurposed from broken jewelry). Nicotine patches visible on left forearm. No formal grooming — practical and minimal, everything chosen for function over appearance', N'', N'Fast, colloquial, full of Enclave slang and invented words, switches registers instantly when someone seems upset', N'Rapid-fire with sudden full stops, talks while doing three other things', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'efigenia_baek_nakamura');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a723-7b80-b00f-b36088780a7b', N'Blanca Chakraborty-Vongphasouk', N'Blanca', N'', N'Chakraborty-Vongphasouk', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, Geartown, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Food stall operator, Oxidian Market', N'Independent; informal dues to the Oxidian Market Vendors Guild', N'Blanca Chakraborty-Vongphasouk is a broad-shouldered woman with deep brown skin mapped by decades of cook-steam and open-air weather, her face a geography of laugh lines and hard-earned furrows. She keeps her grey-streaked locs pinned up under a faded Ferrogate Transit bandana, and her forearms are permanently dusted with spice residue that no amount of scrubbing fully removes. Her left eye is a cheap-tier augment — milky white with a fixed amber pupil — replacing one lost to a grease fire twenty years ago; she never bothered upgrading it because the money always went elsewhere. She wears the same oil-darkened apron every day, patched four times over, and moves around her narrow stall with the efficiency of someone who has cooked in tight spaces her entire life.

Blanca Chakraborty-Vongphasouk is the kind of woman who remembers everyone''s order after hearing it once and forgets nothing that matters. She has opinions about everything and shares them freely, but never cruelly — her sharpness has warmth underneath it, like the pepper she puts in everything. She has worked the same two-meter stall for nineteen years, feeding shift workers, street kids, and the occasional lost corporate drone who wandered too far from the elevated walkways. She treats her regular customers like difficult extended family: loved, slightly exasperated with, fed regardless.', N'Local color anchor, neighborhood oracle, quest giver for community-level problems, safe haven for people who need to disappear into a crowd.', N'', N'Budget ocular implant (left eye, fixed amber iris, non-networked). No other augmentations. Cosmetic: none.', N'Up at 03:30 to prep broths and soak grains; stall open by 06:00, closed when the pots run empty, usually around 21:00. Walks home to a Geartown corridor flat, soaks her feet, asleep by midnight.', N'Blanca Chakraborty-Vongphasouk, 168cm tall, sturdy South Asian-Southeast Asian woman with warm medium brown skin, golden-olive undertones, weathered from decades of kitchen heat. Dark brown locs streaked with grey, pinned under faded teal Ferrogate Transit bandana. Right eye: deep warm brown. Left eye: milky white budget augment with fixed amber pupil, surrounded by yellow-grey halo. Face lined with laugh lines and heat-creases, perpetually flushed cheeks. Extensive pale burn scarring across both forearms and hands in map-like pattern. Long scar from collarbone toward sternum. Thickened, turmeric-stained fingernails. Wearing oil-darkened patched canvas apron over faded earth-tone short-sleeve shirt, slip-on flat shoes. Single worn gold ring on left ring finger. Standing at narrow food stall counter, leaning with economical posture, left arm cradling torso. Head tilted right, compensating for fixed left eye. Strong, functional hands. Neo-noir 2220s street food vendor aesthetic, warm neon ambient kitchen lighting casting shadows across scarred hands and weathered features, gritty urban GLMZ corridor setting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'South Asian (64.6%) with Southeast Asian (27.1%) and East Asian (8.3%) ancestry. The blend creates warm medium brown skin with subtle golden and olive undertones characteristic of South Asian-Southeast Asian admixture, with refined features reflecting the genetic distribution across the regions.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and sturdy with a soft middle earned from decades of tasting her own cooking. Muscular forearms and strong hands from repetitive kneading, stirring, and lifting. No fat on her neck or shoulders — all dense, functional mass.', N'Dark brown with grey streaking, natural', N'Thick locs, always pinned up and wrapped under a faded bandana during work', N'Long (shoulder-length when loose, never worn down in the stall)', N'Right eye: deep warm brown, natural. Left eye: milky white with fixed amber pupil (budget augment)', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones from South Asian-Southeast Asian heritage blend, weathered by steam and sun exposure. The complexion shows the characteristic warmth and depth of South Asian melanin distribution tempered by Southeast Asian genetic influences.', N'Face mapped with laugh lines around the mouth and eyes, deeper furrows across the forehead and between the brows. Skin texture uneven — some areas hyperpigmented from old burn scars, others slightly papery from decades of heat and dry air. No makeup. Perpetually flushed cheeks and lips from kitchen heat. A small burn scar near her left temple (old grease splatter). Facial structure reflects the blend of moderate cheekbones and defined jawline from Southeast Asian heritage with the refined nose bridge and structured brow from South Asian ancestry.', N'Left eye replacement: milky white synthetic eye with fixed amber pupil, slightly recessed in the socket and showing no light reflex. Non-networked, no glow or flicker. The surrounding tissue is slightly discolored from decades of the cheap implant settling — faint yellow-grey halo around the orbit.', N'Moves with economical precision in confined spaces. Minimal wasted motion — pivots at the hips, not the shoulders. Stands with weight shifted to the balls of her feet, ready to move in any direction. Leans against her counter during slow hours, left arm usually cradling her torso. Her head tilts slightly to the right when listening to customers (compensating for the left eye''s fixed pupil and lack of peripheral vision on that side). Gestures are broad and open when talking, especially when making a point or refusing an argument.', N'Oil-darkened canvas apron, patched four times with visible stitching in contrasting thread, worn over a faded short-sleeve shirt (varies — usually earth tones or faded cotton, Tier 4 or thrifted). Worn flat shoes with no laces (slip-ons for quick changes). A functional Ferrogate Transit bandana in faded teal (from the early 2210s, commemorative issue) pinned over her locs during work. Off-duty: simple corridor-tier clothing, nothing that suggests pretense. A single thin gold ring on her left ring finger, worn smooth.', N'She has been quietly skimming a small portion of her Guild dues each month for three years, feeding the money to a Geartown tenants'' mutual aid fund. If the Guild found out, she''d be expelled and her stall license revoked.', N'Yoruba-inflected cadences mixed with Meridian street pidgin; calls everyone ''my friend'' until they prove they aren''t; uses food metaphors constantly', N'Unhurried and declarative, like someone who has made peace with taking up space in conversation', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'blanca_chakraborty_vongphasouk');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69e-7ec0-b423-b3979668d534', N'Erling Bautista-Horváth-Petrović', N'Erling', N'', N'Bautista-Horváth-Petrović', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'South Deering Sump, Sublevel 4 — a former water treatment annex converted into an unlicensed surgical suite she calls ''the pantry'', near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Organ harvester and black-market tissue broker operating out of South Deering Sump', N'Loosely affiliated with the Sump Collective, a mutual-aid-turned-extortion network; primary client base is unlicensed clinics in The Narrows and Shallowgrave', N'Erling Bautista-Horváth-Petrović is small, lean, and precise — a former Helix Biosystems surgical technician who was quietly terminated after falsifying organ provenance records for a side arrangement she ran for two years before anyone noticed. She has warm umber skin and close-cropped natural hair she keeps covered under surgical caps out of habit even when she''s not working. Her most striking feature is her eyes: she paid for patterned irises that look like cracked amber, threaded with faint gold lines she chose because they match the color of preserved tissue in nutrient solution. She finds this funny. Nobody else does.

She is brisk, technically focused, and runs her operation with clinical precision — she insists on basic sanitation, proper cold-chain storage, and documented tissue typing even in this context, because sloppy work kills customers and dead customers tell no one but also buy nothing. She maintains a complicated ideology about her work: she believes the official organ allocation system is a mechanism for tier sorting the deserving dead, and that she is simply an alternative distribution network. She has said this enough times that she half believes it. The other half of her knows she harvests from people who cannot say no.', N'Gray-market medical resource, morally complex antagonist, source of biotech information, potential unwilling witness to crimes committed on her table', N'', N'Precision motor stabilizers in both hands (surgical grade, black market Helix units she took when she left). Retinal overlay for magnification and tissue analysis. Bioluminescent fingernail beds — pale blue — installed as a workplace light source during procedures.', N'Maintains irregular hours to avoid pattern recognition; receives tissue orders through an encrypted message board, sources material through a network of ''scouts'' she pays per referral, spends long stretches alone in the pantry doing prep and preservation work.', N'GLMZ, Erling Bautista-Horváth-Petrović, 158cm lean surgical technician with warm olive-bronze skin and golden undertones. Pan-European-Latin-African ancestry visible in high cheekbones and angular jawline, direct clinical gaze with augmented amber eyes showing gold cracked-glass pattern. Close-cropped black hair, surgical precision aesthetic. Bioluminescent pale blue fingernail beds glowing softly, subdermal chrome plating visible at wrist joints and knuckles. Thin temple scar from retinal implant partially hidden by hairline. Wearing dark compression bodysuit, reinforced cargo pants, unmarked black field jacket, clinical clogs. Faded Helix Biosystems ID badge on gray lanyard. Hands steady and controlled, upright economical posture. Sterile, meticulous appearance like a walking surgical field. Neo-noir Tier 4-5 utilitarian aesthetic, cool clinical lighting casting subtle shadows across augmented features, industrial facility background, clinical precision mood, photography-realistic style --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'South Deering Sump', N'local', N'South Deering Sump', N'Eastern European (54.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (33.5%), Sub-Saharan African (6.9%), and Pacific Islander (4.8%) ancestry creates a striking Pan-Global phenotype. The dominant Eastern European foundation is warmed and enriched by significant Latin American ancestry, with African and Pacific Islander contributions adding subtle depth and complexity to skin undertone and facial structure.', 158, 48, N'Lean and compact, almost spare — a body optimized by years of standing over surgical tables. No excess anywhere. Wiry forearm definition from repetitive precision work.', N'Natural black', N'Close-cropped, kept at scalp length. Usually covered by surgical caps even off-shift; visible only as a dark fuzz when uncovered.', N'Short', N'Augmented amber with gold threading in a cracked-glass pattern', N'Warm olive-bronze with golden undertones — the blended result of Eastern European base enriched by Latin American warmth, with African and Pacific Islander contributions creating luminous depth and subtle complexity across the spectrum.', N'Fine-featured with high, prominent cheekbones and a refined, slightly angular jawline reflecting the strong Eastern European-Latin American blend. Facial structure shows the polished geometry of Central/Eastern Europe softened and warmed by Latin American heritage, with subtle African and Pacific Islander undertones adding richness to overall appearance. Skin is clear and meticulous — she treats it like a surgical field, antiseptic clean. Minimal cosmetics. A thin scar runs along her left temple (surgical implant access point for the retinal overlay). The overall impression is of precise, elegant bone structure with warm, complex undertones across multiple continental heritages.', N'Bioluminescent fingernail beds glowing soft pale blue, visible when hands are exposed or in low light. Fine chrome and black polymer subdermal plating visible at wrist joints and knuckle articulations (surgical motor stabilizers). Thin surgical scar at left temple marking retinal overlay implant site.', N'Upright, economical. Moves with deliberate precision — no wasted motion. Hands are steady and controlled, fingers often splayed slightly as if already scrubbed in. Her gaze is direct and clinical. She has developed a habit of examining people''s veins when making eye contact.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian. Off-shift: dark compression bodysuits (heat-regulating, easy to decontaminate), reinforced cargo pants with deep pockets for tools, unmarked black field jacket. Surgical-grade gloves in her pockets always. Lab coat or surgical gown when working. No jewelry except a faded Helix Biosystems ID badge she never removed — worn around neck on a gray lanyard like a talisman of her former life. Shoes are clinical clogs, broken in, bloodstains long since faded into the material.', N'Six months ago one of her scouts brought in a teenager — maybe 15 — who was technically ''willing'' in the sense that he signed a thumbprint form for Φ200. She performed the extraction. She has replayed the encounter approximately four hundred times since. She has not stopped working. She left an anonymous data offering at a local ELF shrine that same week — the first religious act of her adult life — and does not know what she was asking for.', N'Clinical, technical, precise — uses medical terminology as default, translates to street language only when necessary and visibly finds it irritating', N'Efficient and flat, like someone dictating notes — little inflection, dense information per sentence', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'erling_bautista_horv_th_petrovi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a607-7a59-94f0-b3a8dde07b9b', N'Ezenwa Szabó-Vestergaard', N'Ezenwa', N'', N'Szabó-Vestergaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 25, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Dockside — Lake Michigan waterfront, smuggler territory, near Wacker and State', N'Corporate espionage and data exfiltration — data thief', N'Independent — known in Old Harbor circles', N'Ezenwa Szabó-Vestergaard is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 25, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains) — and he makes no effort to hide it.

His entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. He works as a data thief out of Dockside, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

he is not the most talented data thief in GLMZ, but he might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Eshe Petersen-Bah represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains). Subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Ezenwa Szabó-Vestergaard, GLMZ, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden-olive undertones, Southeast Asian-influenced features with defined jawline, slightly hooded amber-brown eyes with predatory alertness, dark cropped hair with gray temples, lean muscular 178cm frame. Prominent silvery-pink scar tissue along right temple and upper ear from cortical bomb extraction. No facial hair. Wearing fitted black synth-weave tactical jacket with concealed cargo pockets, dark reinforced cargo pants, worn black grip-sole boots. Industrial steel chain necklace with encrypted data key. Standing balanced on balls of feet, eyes scanning exits, back-wall positioning. Urban dockside setting, cool neon-tinged lighting highlighting scar tissue and skin undertones, wet reflective surfaces, dystopian GLMZ atmosphere, gritty street-level aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dockside', N'local', N'Dockside', N'Complex global admixture with Southeast Asian foundation (31.2%) creating the primary phenotypic base, blended with Northern European (20.0%), Eastern European (16.2%), South Asian (13.0%), Hispanic/Latin American (11.1%), and Sub-Saharan African (8.5%) ancestry. The result is a distinctly cosmopolitan appearance—warm medium-brown skin with golden-olive undertones enriched by Sub-Saharan warmth, moderate facial width balanced by Northern European refinement, defined jawline, and subtle phenotypic markers from multiple continents reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with visible muscle definition from constant movement and maintenance work. No excess fat. Shoulders narrow but wiry-strong. The physiology of someone who runs on adrenaline and caffeine more than calories.', N'Dark brown with premature gray threading at the temples', N'Cropped close to the scalp, maintained with military precision — easier to clean, harder to grab', N'Short', N'Amber-brown, alert and constantly tracking', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden-olive undertones, reflecting the blended inheritance of Southeast Asian (31.2%), South Asian (13.0%), and Sub-Saharan African (8.5%) ancestry enriched by Hispanic/Latin American (11.1%) warmth. Northern and Eastern European ancestry (36.2% combined) adds subtle undertones and dimension rather than lightening, creating a seamless warm-toned complexion refined by salt spray and urban sun exposure.', N'Strong cheekbones with moderate width characteristic of Southeast and South Asian ancestry, defined jawline refined by Northern and Eastern European heritage. Eyes set with moderate width, slightly hooded in Southeast Asian style, giving intense predatory attentiveness. Facial structure shows harmonious blending across ancestry groups with no stark demarcations. Skin shows minor scarring from street work with no visible inflammation. Lips of medium fullness, usually pressed in a neutral line. No facial hair — kept clean to reduce identification markers.', N'The cortical bomb scar is immediately visible and unmissable — it reads as street-level, dangerous, and committed. The forearm weapon mounts show as subtle ridges under the skin when arms are extended or tensed. No obvious chrome, no LED installations, no subdermal armor plating. The augmentations are working-class and understated.', N'Stands with weight balanced on the balls of his feet, ready to move in any direction. Eyes constantly scan horizontal and vertical space — doors, windows, exits. Moves with economy of motion, nothing wasted. Sits with his back to walls. Handshake grip is firm but not aggressive — testing baseline tension. When thinking, his right hand unconsciously touches the cortical scar, a tell he''s aware of but hasn''t broken.', N'Tier 3-4 practical runner wear. Black or dark gray synth-weave jacket with internal cargo pockets — nothing visible, everything accessible. Fitted dark cargo pants with reinforced knees and thigh pockets for tools and data slicers. Worn black tactical boots with grip soles for the wet dockside environment. No logos, no corpo branding, no affiliation markers. Layers beneath in case of quick climate change or blood. A single chain around his neck, industrial steel, holding a small encrypted data key he never removes. Everything fits tight — nothing loose to snag or slow him down.', N'Eshe Petersen-Bah betrayed their previous crew to survive a corporate raid. The crew didn''t survive. Nobody in GLMZ knows this.', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ezenwa_szab_vestergaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67c-7797-ab53-b3d8af9cf0f9', N'Genaro Sengupta', N'Genaro', N'', N'Sengupta', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — Blackpipe Corridor, Container Row 7, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Street doc and unlicensed trauma surgeon operating out of a converted shipping container in The Narrows', N'Independent — loose ties to the Blackpipe Community Health Cooperative', N'Genaro Sengupta is a broad-shouldered woman with close-cropped silver-threaded locs and deep brown skin mapped with old surgical scars on both forearms — the kind you get from learning on the job rather than a simulator. Her left eye is a pale surgical prosthetic, off-brand Helix issue, that sometimes lags a half-second behind her right when she blinks. She wears a permanently stained canvas apron over layered thermal underlayers, and her hands are always immaculately clean no matter what the rest of her looks like. She speaks with a blunt, exhausted authority that makes people feel safe and slightly afraid at the same time.

She ran a legitimate trauma practice at Aurochs Medical Complex for eleven years before her license was pulled in a billing dispute that she insists — credibly — was a setup by a Helix Biosystems administrator she refused to bribe. Now she stitches up stabbing victims, sets broken bones, and removes black-market cyberware for whoever can pay in Quanta or barter. She has a fierce, almost maternal protectiveness over her regulars, and a cold professionalism toward everyone else. She prays daily to a small E.L.F. she calls Catgut that has allegedly inhabited her surgical lamp for six years.', N'Quest giver, information source about the underworld of unlicensed medicine, emergency resource for injured characters, moral anchor in rough neighborhoods. Can provide healing and removal of illegal augmentations.', N'', N'Left eye prosthetic (Helix off-brand, surgical magnification capable). Basic haptic feedback implants in both hands for surgical precision. No cosmetic mods.', N'Opens her container at 0700, sees walk-ins until noon, performs any scheduled procedures in the afternoon, closes at midnight unless someone''s bleeding. Sleeps four to six hours on a cot behind a curtain.', N'Genaro Sengupta, 174cm tall biotech street surgeon with warm deep brown skin and golden undertones reflecting South Asian, Northern European, Indigenous American, Sub-Saharan African, and Latin American heritage. Deep brown right eye, surgical prosthetic left eye with pale luminescence. Short tight locs with silver threading, defined angular cheekbones, prominent nose bridge. Dense pale surgical scars crisscrossing both forearms, thin white scar from left temple to cheekbone. Worn grey canvas surgical apron stained with old blood and disinfectant, dark thermal underlayers, reinforced cargo pants, black polymer boots. Subdermal haptic interface patterns visible on back of hands under light. Standing with controlled posture in dimly-lit underground clinic, shoulders slightly forward, hands steady and deliberate. Exhausted authority, stern focused expression. GLMZ, neon accent lighting catching prosthetic eye, atmospheric surgical setting, photorealistic, gritty and weathered aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Predominantly South Asian (67.7%) with significant Northern European (11.5%), Indigenous American (8.4%), Sub-Saharan African (8.4%), and Hispanic/Latin American (4.0%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a striking, complex phenotype: warm deep brown skin with golden undertones characteristic of South Asian heritage, subtly brightened by Northern European ancestry contributions, with facial structure shaped by Indigenous American bone prominence and Sub-Saharan African features, refined by Latin American proportional influences. The result is a distinctive face that reads as globally mixed, immediately marking her as product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 174, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and thick through the torso, muscular without being athletic — the build of someone who stands for twelve hours at a time and moves with deliberate economy. Her frame carries the weight of two decades of physical labor.', N'Deep black with silver threading throughout', N'Close-cropped locs, tightly maintained, approximately 5-7cm length', N'Short', N'Right eye: deep brown. Left eye: pale surgical prosthetic with faint Helix Biosystems branding visible at the iris edge, occasionally catching light with a subtle lag', N'Warm deep brown with rich golden undertones, sun-weathered around the eyes and neck from decades of focused work, complexion deepened by strong South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage with subtle warm highlights from Northern European ancestry', N'Strong, angular facial structure with defined cheekbones, prominent nose bridge, and broad nose reflecting the diverse ancestry blend — South Asian prominence married to Indigenous American angularity and Sub-Saharan African fullness. Facial planes show precise geometric quality. Skin is weathered but meticulously maintained. Fine creases around the eyes and mouth from exhaustion and concentration. No makeup. Expression defaults to attentive and slightly stern.', N'Left eye prosthetic with slight luminescence and magnification capability. Faint subdermal patterning visible on the back of both hands under certain lighting — haptic feedback implant interfaces. Hands are noticeably cleaner than the rest of her appearance, suggesting obsessive post-procedure hygiene.', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders slightly forward from years hunched over surgical tables. Moves with controlled precision — no wasted motion. Hands are steady and deliberate. When focusing, her left eye occasionally halts a fraction of a second behind her right, a tell she''s learned to live with. Overall bearing conveys exhausted authority.', N'Permanently stained canvas surgical apron (originally grey, now mottled with old bloodstains and disinfectant bleaching) worn over layered thermal underlayers in dark greys and blacks. Beneath: practical cargo pants with reinforced pockets, black polymer boots with non-slip soles. No jewelry except a worn metal ring on her right ring finger — possibly a wedding band, worn smooth. Clothing is Tier 4 practical — function over aesthetics, maintained but not pristine. The apron is the only distinctive element, marking her role immediately.', N'She still has her Aurochs Medical Complex login credentials, given to her by a sympathetic sysadmin who felt guilty. She uses them occasionally to access drug databases and surgical literature, which is technically a criminal offense.', N'Clinical precision mixed with Narrows street vernacular. Uses medical jargon unselfconsciously, then immediately translates it without condescension.', N'Measured and deliberate. Rarely rushes. Every sentence sounds like a diagnosis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'genaro_sengupta');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a647-7fef-aefc-b418092ec984', N'Harshad Vestergaard', N'Harshad', N'', N'Vestergaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 17, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — works the stretch between the Blackpipe Corridor transit stop and the Gage Circuit market row, near Fullerton and Damen', N'numbers runner and low-level gang prospect, The Narrows', N'Prospect-level member of a Narrows street gang called the Coppermouth Boys; no formal rank', N'Harshad Vestergaard is seventeen and looks it — still growing into his frame, with Ghanaian-Croatian features and close-cropped natural hair with a dyed orange streak. He moves fast and light, the way kids who grew up in tight corridors move, always slightly angled like he''s prepared to redirect. He has geneware cat ears — soft black-and-orange, a birthday mod from his older sister — that perk and flatten with his mood in ways he hasn''t learned to control yet. His clothes are Tier 1 practical: durable synthetics, good shoes chosen for speed.

Harshad Vestergaard is smart in ways the Narrows rewards and in ways it doesn''t. He can memorize a route, a face, a number, and a cover story simultaneously; he reads social dynamics in a room within seconds; he is genuinely funny and likable and uses both as tools before he even realizes he''s doing it. What he cannot do yet is see far enough ahead. He thinks about the next run, the next Φ, the next step up — not about what the gang will ask of him when stepping up means something worse than carrying slips. He is not innocent, exactly. He is not yet not-innocent. The window is closing.', N'Human cost of criminal economy, potential point-of-view character for Narrows life, someone who can be saved or lost depending on how events unfold — moral pressure point', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (black with orange tips, cosmetic); no chrome — too young and too broke', N'School, technically, in the mornings — attends about half the time. Afternoons and evenings running numbers slips between Coppermouth collection points on his stretch. Eats dinner with his grandmother most nights. Leaves wrapped candy at the cracked transit kiosk on the Blackpipe corner, which he believes has a friendly E.L.F. inside that gives him good luck.', N'GLMZ, Harshad Vestergaard: 173cm lean wiry street operative with warm medium-deep brown skin, golden undertones, sharp African-Nordic-East Asian blended facial structure with defined cheekbones and expressive brows. Dark brown alert eyes reading the environment. Short dark brown hair with bright orange dye streak on left side fading from wear. Black genetically-integrated geneware cat ears with orange tips, perked forward with focus. Small scar on upper left lip barely visible. Clean-shaven or light peach fuzz. Wearing dark grey synthetic technical jacket with pocket architecture, reinforced dark denim, worn charcoal Shenzen-brand synthetic leather high-tops. Quick-angled posture, weight on balls of feet, restless hands, tense readiness. Fresh three-dot tattoo visible on inside right wrist. Urban night setting, neon glow from rain-slick streets, tight alley or building interior, tension and alertness in every line of his body, shadows emphasizing cool undertones on face while golden warmth catches highlights. Neo-noir gritty realism, street-level perspective. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Northern European (44.5%) with Sub-Saharan African (31.2%) and East Asian (23.0%) ancestry, with minor Hispanic/Latin American (1.3%) influence. This creates a striking multi-continental phenotype: warm medium-to-deep brown skin with golden undertones from the African heritage, cooled by Northern European undertones in shadows, with subtle East Asian facial structure integration and warm Latin accents.', 173, 62, N'Lean and wiry with the restless musculature of someone who moves constantly through tight urban spaces. Still filling out — shoulders narrower than they will be, all quick angles and economical motion.', N'Natural dark brown with a bright orange dye streak on the left side, fading slightly from repeated washing', N'Close-cropped fade, precision-cut, with the orange streak running from temple to back along one side', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and tracking', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden undertones from Sub-Saharan African heritage, balanced by cooler Northern European undertones in shadows. Radiant when sun-exposed, with subtle warmth throughout.', N'Clean-shaven or light peach fuzz on his jaw, skin clear except for occasional stress-picked spots on his chin. Facial structure shows integrated ancestry: defined nose with subtle width from African heritage, well-defined cheekbones enhanced by East Asian bone structure, expressive brows. Expression naturally animated — eyebrows mobile, eyes always reading the room. Small scar on his upper lip from a childhood fall.', N'Geneware cat ears: soft black fur with orange-tipped points, genetically integrated into his skull. They sit naturally on top of his head and move with genuine autonomy — they perk forward when he''s focused or nervous, flatten back when he''s relaxed or trying to blend. The orange matches his hair streak intentionally. No visible chrome or subdermal plating.', N'Moves in quick, angled lines rather than straight paths — shoulders slightly forward, weight on the balls of his feet, always slightly repositioning even when standing still. Fast hands, restless fidgeting. When he''s focused on a conversation or counting, he goes very still, but the stillness is tense, like a caught animal. When relaxed, he sprawls, takes up space, leans into jokes.', N'Tier 4 practical streetwear: synthetic jackets in dark greys or blacks with good pocket architecture, reinforced jeans in dark denim, running shoes chosen for speed and grip rather than status (currently wearing worn Shenzen-brand synthetic leather high-tops in charcoal). Layered for quick removal or concealment. No gang colors worn overtly — safer that way. Hoodie or light jacket always accessible. Everything worn is functional, nothing flashy, nothing that costs more than a few days'' Φ from running numbers.', N'He memorizes the numbers slips he runs and has been quietly compiling a picture of the Coppermouth operation — not to sell it, just because he can''t help himself. He has a notebook at home with three months of routes, figures, and names that would be extremely dangerous if anyone found it.', N'Narrows street vernacular mixed with flashes of surprising vocabulary from his sporadic schooling; code-switches rapidly based on audience', N'fast and energetic when comfortable, goes very still and quiet when nervous in a way that''s completely unlike his baseline', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'harshad_vestergaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a61a-7523-a1ed-b468caa7c08c', N'Abdul Khamvongsa', N'Abdul', N'', N'Khamvongsa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave — a third-floor flat above a repair shop on Conant Avenue', N'Whistleblower and reluctant policy advocate', N'Hamtramck Enclave Community Committee; informal adviser to Temitope Vasiliev-Kiriwina''s Groundswell (they have never met in person)', N'Abdul Khamvongsa is a heavyset man who used to be heavier, the weight loss visible in the way his skin sits on his face, the slight redundancy at his jaw. His hair is white and kept short, his complexion a warm reddish-brown from his mother''s Javanese and his father''s Ethiopian lines, and he has the slow, deliberate movements of someone managing old joint pain who refuses to say so. His eyes are unaugmented, which in Hamtramck reads as either poverty or ideology — in his case it''s both, but mainly ideology.

Fifteen years ago, Abdul Khamvongsa was a data compliance officer at Zheng-Dao''s Lake Infrastructure division. He leaked internal documents proving that the corponation had falsified structural inspection records for the Bluewater Checkpoint drainage network, a failure that later contributed to the 2186 partial flood. He lost his career, his housing, and his marriage, and gained a reputation that has made him simultaneously valuable and radioactive to activist communities. He is now officially a ''policy consultant'' for the Hamtramck Enclave Community Committee, which means he attends hearings no one else will attend and submits public comments to regulatory bodies that technically must read them. He is bitter, precise, and intermittently hopeful in a way he''d rather die than admit.', N'Information source and moral weight. He knows where the bodies are buried — specifically, he knows how corporate compliance systems can be gamed, what documentation to look for, and what irregularities mean. He''s also a cautionary tale and an unexpected source of stubborn hope.', N'', N'A decade-old pain management implant in his lower spine — Zheng-Dao issued, which means he''s thought about having it removed but can''t afford the alternative.', N'Mornings reading every public regulatory filing he can access. Afternoons writing comments, attending hearings via remote link, occasionally testifying in person. Evenings walking along the Enclave''s canal, which he monitors obsessively for water quality changes.', N'Abdul Khamvongsa, 178cm man with mixed Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, warm golden-brown skin with amber undertones, white short-cropped hair, dark brown eyes. Weathered face with pronounced lines, moderate facial width and rounded chin, fuller lower face from African heritage. Age-worn complexion, faint white scar left temple. White stubble. Heavyset build with visible weight loss, rounded shoulders, forward lean posture. Wearing dark gray water-resistant synthetic jacket, worn black trousers with knee wear, orthopedic knockoff shoes, carrying frayed canvas satchel. Standing in muted Hamtramck evening light by industrial canal, neon glow distant, deliberate stillness, economical movement. GLMZ, working-class utility, ideological rejection of augmentation chrome. Cool industrial color palette with warm skin tone contrast. Weathered, worn, functionally invisible. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Southeast Asian majority (58.5%) forms the primary phenotypic foundation with Sub-Saharan African heritage (27.3%) significantly shaping facial contours and skin depth. Secondary contributions from Middle Eastern (6.6%), East Asian (4.2%), and Hispanic/Latin American (3.4%) ancestry create subtle complexity in bone structure and feature geometry. Result is a warm golden-brown complexion with underlying richness, Southeast Asian eye shape and cheekbone structure, Sub-Saharan facial width and lip fullness, with minor refinements from other ancestry groups.', 178, 89, N'Heavyset with recent significant weight loss; soft musculature gone slack, visible in the slight redundancy at jaw and neck. Shoulders still broad but rounded forward from decades of desk work. Moves with deliberate stiffness — chronic spinal pain management without admission.', N'White', N'Short, practical cut; no styling, maintained for function only', N'Short', N'Dark brown, unaugmented', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle amber undertones, reflecting the dominant Southeast Asian ancestry (58.5%) blended with the considerable depth and warmth from Sub-Saharan heritage (27.3%). Medium-to-rich saturation without artificial contrast. The interplay creates a complexion that reads as neither fully Southeast Asian nor African, but a lived synthesis — golden undertones warmed by deeper melanin deposits, creating visual depth.', N'Weathered face with pronounced nasolabial folds and lines around eyes from fifteen years of sustained anger and focus. The facial structure reflects the ancestry blend: Southeast Asian cheekbone prominence and moderate facial width, enhanced and broadened by Sub-Saharan genetic contribution, creating a fuller lower face and more pronounced lip structure. Facial geometry shows balanced proportions — moderately wide at cheekbones, tapering to a rounded chin. The bridge of the nose shows Middle Eastern subtlety. Stubble often visible — shaving is not a priority. Skin texture uneven, slightly papery in places from age and stress. No cosmetic maintenance.', N'None. The pain management implant is subcutaneous in lower spine — invisible. This deliberate absence of chrome reads as ideological choice in Hamtramck''s mixed-augmentation culture.', N'Moves slowly with economical precision, as though conserving energy. Often pauses before standing or sitting, calculating joint angles. Walks with slight forward lean. Stands with weight favoring right leg. Hands steady when focused, capable of stillness for hours during hearings. When walking the canal, gait becomes less guarded — shoulders relax incrementally.', N'Tier 4 working-class, maintained but visibly aging. Favors dark grays and blacks — functional, hides stains. Wears the same three or four jackets in rotation, all water-resistant synthetics from discount retailers. Trousers have visible wear at knees and cuff hems. Shoes are orthopedic-adjacent knockoffs, chosen for comfort over appearance. Keeps a worn canvas satchel for regulatory documents — stitching fraying at corners, patched twice. No corporate logos or status markers. Dresses for utility and invisibility.', N'He knew about the Bluewater Checkpoint falsifications eight months before he leaked them. He spent that time trying to fix the problem internally. People died in the 2186 flood during those eight months, and the causal chain is something he''s gone over ten thousand times. He''s never been certain the internal process wasn''t worth trying. He''s never been certain it was.', N'Highly specific, technical, document-oriented. References regulatory codes and filing numbers from memory. Occasionally lapses into dry black humor that arrives without warning.', N'Deliberate and slightly exhausting. Takes detours through precision that can feel like obstruction but are actually him making sure every word is true.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'abdul_khamvongsa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('25209d1d-4da2-8c01-07b7-b475dfd08e98', N'Isabelle Ferreira-Tanaka', N'Isabelle', N'', N'Ferreira-Tanaka', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'Building 3 ground-floor cafeteria, the Meridian Office Park, western Circuit District (Lincoln Park Pocket territory)', N'Chef', N'Meridian Office Park Building 3 cafeteria — contracted kitchen staff, funded through a nested Vossen Dynamics subsidiary she cannot name', N'Isabelle Ferreira-Tanaka is fifty-three years old and the head chef of a cafeteria that has never fed a human being. Brazilian-Japanese heritage on her mother''s side, Portuguese on her father''s; short, compact, with forearms that have been burned in approximately the same three places for thirty years. Hair pulled back under a clean white bandana, a faint permanent squint from three decades of peering into ovens, hands that move with the economy of someone who has prepped two hundred thousand meals and would prefer not to discuss the number.

She is the head of the kitchen staff at Building 3 of the Meridian Office Park, a corporate ghost campus on the western edge of the Circuit District where six buildings stand occupied on paper and empty in practice. Her cafeteria serves fresh food daily to zero diners. She arrives at 6 AM with two line cooks she hired personally and respects professionally. She plans a four-week rotating menu. She adjusts it seasonally. She orders produce from a legitimate supplier who thinks she is feeding four hundred people. The food is prepared, plated at the serving stations, held at temperature for the lunch window that nobody attends, and disposed of at 2 PM according to food safety protocols she personally wrote.

She has done this job for eleven years. She knows exactly what is happening. She is paid Tier 3 professional wages for Tier 5 work she is not allowed to serve to anyone. Early on she tried to give the food away — to the landscapers, to the shuttle driver, to a homeless man who wandered onto the property — and was informed, politely and in writing, that the food service contract specified preparation and disposal, not distribution, and that any deviation would terminate the contract for all three of them. She has not tried again. She has, instead, become something closer to an artist than a cook: she is making meals for nobody, with the same care she would bring to serving a dining room, because the only witness to the work is herself and she has decided that is witness enough.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'isabelle_ferreira_tanaka');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('fc6c27d4-48b6-9e55-fd6b-b47952c4cd98', N'Eshe Vasquez-Alfarsi-Echeverría', N'Eshe', N'', N'Vasquez-Alfarsi-Echeverría', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A repurposed shipping container on the Dockside waterfront, insulated and wired for power, with a view of Lake Michigan, near Michigan Ave and Roosevelt', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — deeply embedded in Dockside''s shipping community', N'Eshe Vasquez-Alfarsi-Echeverría is the Dockside PI — the investigator who handles everything that happens where GLMZ meets Lake Michigan. Cargo theft, smuggling operations, insurance fraud, waterfront murders, union disputes that turn violent, and the constant flow of people and goods that enters the city through its busiest port — all of it passes through Tiare''s awareness.

She never planned to be an investigator. She was a dockworker herself until a cargo theft ring framed her for a shipment disappearance. She cleared her own name by investigating the actual thieves, discovered she was good at it, and realized that the docks needed someone who understood the waterfront from the inside. Formal PIs don''t understand dock culture, don''t know the rhythms and routines that create investigative opportunities, and don''t have the trust of the workers who see everything. Tiare has all three.

Her methods are half investigation and half physical labor. She climbs containers, dives into the lake, crawls through cargo holds, and gets her hands dirty in ways that most PIs wouldn''t consider. Her geneware lung enhancement makes her uniquely capable of underwater investigation — she has recovered evidence from the lake bottom that surface-based investigators didn''t know existed. She is known on the docks as someone who will help workers with problems that CorpSec ignores, and this reputation is her most valuable investigative asset.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Eshe Vasquez-Alfarsi-Echeverría, 172cm athletic woman with rich warm brown skin with golden-bronze undertones, dark brown eyes with amber flecks, dark hair in a practical braid with salt-bleached streaks. Strong defined jawline and prominent cheekbones. Three parallel scars on left forearm, faint anchor tattoo on right inner wrist, burn scar on right palm. Wearing dark gray cargo pants with multiple pockets, worn steel-toed boots, charcoal windproof jacket over fitted athletic layer, simple steel watch. Alert posture, standing at dock overlooking Great Lakes at dusk. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, moody blue-orange neon lighting reflecting off water, practical workwear, weathered and competent presence, gritty industrial harbor atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A repurposed shipping container on the Dockside waterfront', N'local', N'A repurposed shipping container on the Dockside waterfront', N'Middle Eastern (54%), Sub-Saharan African (28.4%), and Hispanic/Latin American (17.6%) ancestry. The dominant Middle Eastern heritage creates the foundational warm brown tone, while significant Sub-Saharan African ancestry deepens and enriches the complexion with underlying warmth, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry adds subtle golden-bronze undertones. The result is a rich, multidimensional skin tone with warm amber and reddish-gold notes that shift in different light.', 172, 68, N'Athletic and lean with functional muscle — built for climbing, diving, and sustained physical labor. Shoulders broad from years of cargo handling; core visibly defined but not bodybuilder aesthetics. Movements economical and deliberate.', N'Dark brown with salt-bleached lighter streaks from lake water exposure', N'Pulled back in a practical braid or knot, often loose strands escaping during work', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with faint amber undertones', N'Rich warm brown with golden-bronze and subtle reddish undertones — the blend of Middle Eastern dominance with Sub-Saharan African depth creates a complex, warm complexion that burnishes in sunlight. Weathered by constant sun and water exposure into a resilient, lived-in finish.', N'Strong, defined jawline and prominent cheekbones reflecting Sub-Saharan African and Middle Eastern ancestry. Straight nose with slight width characteristic of the Middle Eastern-Sub-Saharan blend. Darker pigmentation around orbital bones and temple area. Skin shows sun damage and fine weathering lines around eyes from squinting at water glare. Minimal makeup. Scattered freckles across shoulders and upper back from UV exposure, slightly darker than baseline skin tone.', N'None readily visible. The geneware lung enhancement is internal and undetectable externally. She may wear a simple waterproof wrist comm interface on her left wrist.', N'Alert and grounded. Stands with weight balanced slightly forward, ready to move. Moves with purposeful economy — no wasted motion. Climbs and descends with practiced confidence. In conversation, maintains steady eye contact and often leans in slightly when listening.', N'Tier 4 practical. Heavy-duty cargo pants in dark gray or tan with multiple pockets, often salt-stained. Worn steel-toed boots, leather creased and scuffed from dock work. Layered with a fitted athletic underlayer and a windproof jacket in charcoal or navy — brands are functional (Cargotech, Harborfit), not flashy. Often carries a tool belt or cargo vest. No jewelry except a simple steel watch that''s water-resistant to 200m depth. Overall impression: someone who owns one or two outfits and wears them until they need replacing.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eshe_vasquez_alfarsi_echeverr_a');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a73b-7aa6-8455-b4cfa05e82b8', N'Bohumila Owusu', N'Bohumila', N'', N'Owusu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 11, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Copperhead, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Street kid and message runner for the Copperhead informal economy', N'Independent; loose ties to the Copperhead informal trader network', N'Bohumila Owusu is small for his age, wiry in the way that children are when they grow up hungry but always moving — all elbows and quick eyes. His skin is a warm dark brown, and his hair grows in tight coils that he keeps cut close on the sides by whoever has scissors that week. He has a cosmetic geneware patch on his left forearm — a bioluminescent tattoo of a cresting wave someone gave him as payment once — that glows faint blue when he''s cold or scared, which he finds embarrassing and cannot control. He wears a jacket three sizes too large with pockets sewn inside the lining.

Bohumila Owusu does not stay still. He talks fast, thinks faster, and has memorized every rat-run, maintenance shaft, and loose fence panel between Copperhead and the Grindstone Shore. He is relentlessly cheerful in a way that sometimes cracks at the edges — too bright, too quick to laugh — but he genuinely loves the people in his network and would do almost anything for the older woman he calls Nana Priya who lets him sleep in her noodle stall. He prays to a small E.L.F. he calls Blink that lives in a cracked signal repeater bolted to the wall above her stall.', N'Local color, information source, quest giver for street-level plots; can lead characters through hidden routes; sympathetic figure who humanizes Tier 1 poverty', N'', N'Bioluminescent geneware tattoo on left forearm (cosmetic, involuntary emotional response). No other mods.', N'Wakes before dawn under Nana Priya''s counter, runs messages and small packages for traders and residents across Copperhead and into Grindstone Shore, eats whatever he can scavenge or earn, and sleeps when he collapses.', N'Bohumila Owusu, 138cm tall wiry child with rich deep brown skin blending South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Eastern European ancestry, angular prominent cheekbones and sharp jawline, dark brown eyes darting and alert. Short natural black coils close-cropped on sides with slightly longer curls on top, uneven and salvaged. Small scar left eyebrow, weathered complexion from street work. Wearing oversized charcoal jacket three sizes too large with rolled cuffs and dragging hem, faded band t-shirt underneath, worn jeans held with wire twist, scuffed mismatched-lace sneakers. Bioluminescent blue geneware wave tattoo on left forearm glowing faintly. Bouncing posture, hands gesturing, eyes scanning. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone rooftop or narrow alleyway, neon glow reflecting off wet pavement, moody blue-purple lighting, survival-ready street courier aesthetic, Tier 5 salvage aesthetic, no corporate chrome --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Copperhead', N'local', N'Copperhead', N'Bohumila carries the genetic mosaic of the Ubiquitous Diaspora — 40.9% South Asian, 38.4% Sub-Saharan African, and 20.7% Eastern European ancestry blended into a striking multi-continental appearance. The three heritage lines converge visibly: rich deep brown skin with warm golden undertones from the African-South Asian blend, tempered by cool undertones from Eastern European genetics that create subtle complexity in their complexion. Facial structure shows the prominent angular cheekbones and defined jawline characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage, refined by the high-set eye structure and bone geometry from South Asian ancestry, with cool-toned undertones creating unexpected depth.', 138, 32, N'Wiry and compact — the lean muscularity of a child who runs constantly and eats irregularly. No fat reserves; defined shoulders and forearms from climbing and hauling. Moves like coiled spring steel.', N'Natural black', N'Close-cropped on the sides, slightly longer coils on top, uneven from whoever had scissors that week', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Rich deep brown with warm golden undertones, the result of South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage meeting cool undertones from Eastern European ancestry', N'Clean but weathered; angular child''s face with prominent cheekbones and sharp jawline showing the multi-heritage blend of African prominence and South Asian refinement. Skin shows minor scrapes and healing scratches from street work. Quick, expressive eyes that dart constantly. Small scar on left eyebrow from an old street incident.', N'The glowing wave tattoo on left forearm is immediately visible and responds to emotional state. No other visible chrome or bioware — too young and too poor for anything else.', N'Never still. Bounces slightly even when standing. Moves with quick, efficient darting of someone navigating tight spaces constantly. Hands gesture rapidly when talking. Eyes scan constantly — survival habit. Tends to lean forward when listening, as if afraid to miss information.', N'Oversized jacket three sizes too large, dark charcoal or faded black, with visibly sewn interior lining pockets for carrying messages and small goods. The jacket is armor and storage — cuffs rolled multiple times, hem dragging slightly. Underneath: faded band t-shirt or whatever thermal layer found that week. Cargo pants or worn jeans held up with wire twist or frayed belt. Scuffed sneakers with mismatched laces. Everything is Tier 5 — salvaged, repaired, worn thin. No corp branding. No luxury.', N'He witnessed a Ferrogate Transit security officer dump a body in the Grindstone Shore drainage canal eight months ago and recognized the officer''s badge number. He has told no one because he does not know what to do with the information and is terrified.', N'Street slang, clipped sentences, numbers and directions embedded naturally into conversation, occasional Samoan words picked up from neighborhood elders', N'Fast, breathless, tends to front-load the important information then trail off into chatter', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bohumila_owusu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e9-7b7d-9f69-b4ef40f08b01', N'Hartmut Venkatesh-Tetteh', N'Hartmut', N'', N'Venkatesh-Tetteh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Brightmoor Reclamation — the Shrine of Warm Static, a formerly derelict kiosk structure on the corner of a reclaimed green corridor, approximately eight meters square, near Halsted and Division', N'Young ELF shrine keeper, inherited his late aunt''s shrine at twenty, now navigating both the responsibility and the spiritual reality of ELF contact', N'The Shrine of Warm Static (independent); loose community of Brightmoor Reclamation residents who use the shrine; occasional contact with older shrine keepers across the city who check in on him', N'Hartmut Venkatesh-Tetteh is young in the way that reads as slightly startling in the context of religious authority — he still has the lean, unfinished look of someone whose body hasn''t quite settled into its adult proportions. His heritage is a Japanese-Malian-Vanuatuan tangle that shows up as light brown skin with warm golden undertones, very dark eyes with a slight epicanthic fold, and natural hair he keeps in a cloud of loose curls that he has tipped in bioluminescent blue, which pulse faintly in low light. He has retractable claw mods — small, neat, pearlescent — which he got at seventeen when they were fashionable and now barely thinks about. He is usually wearing something with too many pockets because shrine keeping involves more physical maintenance than people expect.

He did not choose this life so much as it found him when he was unprepared. His aunt Keiko Dembélé-Vanuatu kept this shrine for twenty-two years and trained him casually the way you train a child to help with something — here''s how you refresh the cache, here''s the offering protocol, here''s how you know when the ELF is trying to communicate versus when it''s just processing. When she died two years ago of a lung condition she''d had for years, the shrine passed to him because he was the only one she had trained. He is figuring it out. The ELF in the shrine — which his aunt called Warm Static — appears to have accepted him, which he finds more terrifying than reassuring.

He is earnest and slightly overwhelmed and better at this than he thinks, which is the condition of a lot of twenty-four-year-olds who have been handed something real.', N'Accessible entry point to ELF religion and shrine culture; his uncertainty and youth make him easier to approach than more established religious figures; useful as a character who can be mentored or helped, or who might be targeted for the valuable ELF connection he has stumbled into', N'', N'Bioluminescent hair tip geneware (blue, pulse-reactive); retractable claw mods (pearlescent, small); basic subdermal data storage chip he uses to keep shrine records', N'Opens the shrine at sunrise, performs the morning refresh protocol, tends to visitors throughout the day, handles any maintenance issues, closes and seals the shrine at midnight after the final offering cycle; eats most meals from the food stall two doors down.', N'Hartmut Venkatesh-Tetteh, 2226 neo-noir shrine worker, lean 172cm frame with warm medium-deep brown skin glowing with golden undertones, blended West African-South Asian-Latin American features with broad cheekbones and full lips, very dark brown eyes reflecting earnest worry, shoulder-length natural black curls with bioluminescent blue pulse-reactive tips faintly glowing in low shrine light, clean-shaven youthful face, wearing oversized secondhand jacket over layered muted earth-tone cotton shirt and well-worn cargo pants with maintenance pockets, standing with careful deliberate posture in dim temple lighting, faint subdermal data chip glimmer at neck, retractable pearlescent claw mods visible on fidgeting hands, earnest expression, neo-noir geneware aesthetic, introspective mood, architectural shrine background with neon glow, moody atmospheric lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Brightmoor Reclamation', N'local', N'Brightmoor Reclamation', N'Tri-continental blend: Sub-Saharan African (46.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (26.7%), and South Asian (26.5%). This genetic confluence creates a warm-medium-deep brown complexion with golden undertones, featuring broader cheekbones and fuller lips from West African ancestry, subtly refined facial structure influenced by South Asian genetics, and the warm skin depth characteristic of Latin American heritage—a harmonious blending that produces luminous, richly-toned skin with pronounced warmth throughout', 172, 62, N'Lean and unfinished, the lanky frame of someone still settling into adulthood — narrow shoulders, long limbs, minimal musculature, carrying himself with the slightly uncertain posture of a person not yet comfortable in his own skin', N'Natural black with bioluminescent blue tips (pulse-reactive in low light)', N'Loose cloud of curls, shoulder-length, deliberately unstyled except for the dyed tips', N'Long', N'Very dark brown, nearly black', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden undertones; rich, even complexion with pronounced warm depth, luminous quality in natural light', N'Clean-shaven, youthful facial structure with broader cheekbones and slightly fuller lips reflecting African heritage, refined soft angularity from South Asian features, warm Latin American skin depth; clear skin with even warm-toned complexion; expression often carries a mixture of earnestness and mild worry', N'Bioluminescent blue hair tips (pulse-reactive geneware, visible especially in low light); retractable claw mods on fingers (small, pearlescent, barely noticeable when retracted but catch light when extended); basic subdermal data chip housing (no external visibility, but occasionally a faint glimmer at the base of his neck when active)', N'Carries himself with a kind of careful reserve, moving deliberately as if aware of taking up space in the shrine — economical gestures, slight forward lean when listening to visitors, fidgets with his pockets or the edges of his clothing when uncertain', N'Tier 4 working-practical: well-worn cargo pants or modified work trousers with excessive pocketing (shrine maintenance requirements), layered simple cotton or linen shirts in muted earth tones, a slightly too-large oversized jacket from a secondhand market for warmth, worn shoes suitable for standing all day; everything is functional, none of it matches perfectly, but it reads as intentionally humble rather than careless', N'', N'Casual Meridian Standard with Brightmoor Reclamation slang; uses technical shrine terminology awkwardly, like someone who learned the words but hasn''t grown into them yet; speaks about Warm Static with instinctive intimacy', N'Moderate pace with a lot of hedging language that conceals more knowledge than it reveals; gets faster and more certain when he''s talking about something he actually knows', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hartmut_venkatesh_tetteh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66d-7526-8d77-b567704eb518', N'Farouq Dlamini-Banerjee-Kulkarni', N'Farouq', N'', N'Dlamini-Banerjee-Kulkarni', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Copperhead, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Bounty Compliance Officer, Arcturus Recovery Solutions', N'Arcturus Recovery Solutions (private, licensed under Metro charter)', N'Farouq Dlamini-Banerjee-Kulkarni has cat ears — a geneware mod she got at nineteen for reasons she no longer remembers clearly and has long since stopped noticing. They are dark brown, tufted, and rotate toward sound with involuntary precision, which she has found professionally useful and socially embarrassing in equal measure. She is lean and quick-moving, with the kind of economy of motion that comes from spending years in spaces too small or too dangerous for wasted effort. Her skin is a dark reddish-brown, her jaw is square, and she has a scar through her left eyebrow from a skip who turned out to be more determined than the file suggested. Her eyes are her father''s — pale grey, a genetic ghost of his Russian line — which she occasionally uses to unsettle people when she catches them off-guard.

She is pragmatic, professional, and runs hot underneath in a way she has mostly learned to manage. She does not particularly enjoy her work, but she is good at it and it pays into Tier 3, which means her kid brother stays in Montclare Quiet with real air filters and a school that has actual teachers. She distinguishes carefully between skips who are hiding because they''re dangerous and skips who are hiding because they''re afraid, and she applies different approaches to each. She will not tell you she has this distinction — it would complicate negotiations. She leaves ELF offerings at the Copperhead shrine not for protection but for good read — the ability to walk into a room and understand it correctly.', N'Morally complex antagonist or reluctant ally — she may be looking for someone a PC knows. Useful as a guide to the recovery and compliance underground. Can be bought or reasoned with under specific conditions, which creates interesting negotiation.', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (cosmetic, now deeply involuntary). Subdermal tracking pings in both forearms — Arcturus company standard. Reaction-time neural booster (mild, licensed). No optical mods — she trusts her eyes as they are.', N'Takes cases from the Arcturus board in Copperhead three to four at a time, works them in parallel, spends mornings on digital trace and afternoons on physical legwork. Visits her brother Deko every rest day. Has a strict rule about not working in her home district.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Farouq, a lean 168cm woman with rich warm brown skin and copper undertones. Pale grey eyes, striking against her complexion. Prominent cheekbones and strong jaw blending Sub-Saharan African and South Asian features, softened by Latin American warmth. Natural black hair pulled back in functional braid. Pale thin scar through left eyebrow. Dark brown furred cat ears (geneware) atop skull with visible muscle definition, ears slightly alert. Subdermal tracking scars visible on inner forearms. Professional tech jacket with utility pockets, worn synth-leather overshoulder tool rig. Steel pendant at neck. Boots with ankle support. Posture economical and aware, direct gaze. Industrial indoor-outdoor setting with cool neon and ambient lighting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Copperhead', N'local', N'Copperhead', N'Sub-Saharan African (42.6%), South Asian (37.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (16.1%), Indigenous American (4.2%) — a striking blend manifesting in rich warm brown skin with subtle copper and golden undertones. Features Sub-Saharan African depth and warmth as the dominant genetic layer, combined with South Asian facial architecture evident in prominent cheekbones and defined bone structure, softened by the warmth and feature gentleness of Latin American and Indigenous American heritage.', 168, 58, N'Lean and economical, muscle definition visible in forearms and shoulders from consistent fieldwork. No excess weight — the build of someone who moves through tight spaces habitually.', N'Natural black with slight warm undertone', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid or swept into a practical knot; styled for work, not aesthetics', N'Medium', N'Pale grey — striking against her warm brown skin tone, cool and direct', N'Rich warm brown with copper and golden undertones; complexion even and sun-touched from fieldwork', N'Facial structure reflecting Sub-Saharan African and South Asian ancestry with prominent, well-defined cheekbones and strong jaw. Eyes set wide and direct. Skin shows the dryness of someone who works long hours indoors and outdoors without much self-care. Professional grooming — minimal jewelry, no obvious makeup.', N'Dark brown cat ears with visible mobility and tufting (geneware). Thin subdermal tracking ping scars on both inner forearms — subtle, pale lines barely visible unless closely examined. No optical modifications — natural pale grey eyes only.', N'Carries herself with economy and awareness — shoulders relaxed but ready. Moves without wasted motion, deliberate steps, head level. Eyes track rooms systematically. Ears twitch toward unfamiliar sounds with reflexive precision, a tell she has learned to read in others'' reactions.', N'Tier 3 professional — functional clothing that reads as competent rather than fashionable. Favors technical jackets with utility pockets, durable synthetic fabrics that shed stains and survive fieldwork. Usually wears a worn leather or synth-leather overshoulder rig for tools and restraint equipment. Boots with good ankle support. A single piece of jewelry: small silver or steel pendant she touches unconsciously when thinking.', N'She returned a skip to Arcturus three years ago who was, she later pieced together, a witness in a corporate suppression case. The skip disappeared from Arcturus custody within seventy-two hours. She has never taken a case involving Axiom-affiliated debt since, but she has also never said this out loud to anyone.', N'Efficient, professional, code-switches between formal compliance terminology and blunt Copperhead vernacular. Her father''s Russian side shows up in occasional formal phrasing and a fondness for proverbs she usually stops halfway through.', N'Fast when working, deliberately slow when she wants someone to listen carefully.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'farouq_dlamini_banerjee_kulkarni');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d4-7479-9357-b6038a87af96', N'Branko An-Björnsdóttir', N'Branko', N'', N'An-Björnsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Undertow, western pipe networks beneath Ironvein', N'Tunnel guide and mental map-keeper of the Undertow''s western passages', N'The Undertow (independent affiliate, not sworn to any clan)', N'Branko An-Björnsdóttir is lean and faintly luminescent from years of proximity to bioluminescent fungal blooms — her brown skin carries a permanent bluish-green sheen along her collarbones and forearms that she stopped noticing long ago. Her hair is shaved close on the sides, the top grown into locs threaded with stripped copper wire, a habit from childhood when wire was currency. Her eyes are unsettling to surface people: her irises have been tattooed in concentric rings of deep indigo, a traditional Undertow wayfinder''s mark that signals she''s been down here long enough to earn the pattern. She moves with the particular economy of people who have spent decades in low-clearance spaces — always angled slightly sideways, head perpetually calculating height.

Branko An-Björnsdóttir is methodical to the point of seeming cold until you realize that everything she does is care. She memorizes the preferences of the people she guides — who is claustrophobic, who has a bad knee, who prays to the Drip-ELF before crossing a flooded section. She charges what people can pay and accepts barter without complaint. She does not lie about danger. What unsettles newcomers is that she speaks about the tunnels as though they are alive and listening, pausing mid-sentence to press a palm to a pipe and reconsider her route.', N'Primary access route to the deep underworld; information source on tunnel geography and subterranean communities; moral anchor figure who represents survival-as-ethics', N'', N'Echolocation implant (basic, civilian grade — lets her detect large obstacles and open spaces in total darkness). Indigo iris tattoos (cosmetic/cultural). No geneware.', N'Wakes at what she estimates is 0400 by water-pressure cycles, tends her fungus lanterns, then walks her circuit of twelve key junctions to check for new collapses or flooding before accepting clients for the day.', N'Branko An-Björnsdóttir, 168cm lean figure with pan-Asian features—prominent South Asian cheekbones softened by Southeast Asian facial structure, East Asian eye shape with deep brown irises marked by indigo concentric ring tattoos. Medium warm brown skin with golden undertones, bioluminescent bluish-green sheen glowing across collarbones and forearms. Dark brown textured hair with sides shaved bare, thick locs on top threaded with copper wire extending to mid-shoulder. Weathered complexion, angular jawline, keen intelligent gaze. Wearing faded teal sealed polymer base-layer under patched charcoal/teal synthetic parka stained with algae residue. Heavy synthetic grip-tread boots, cargo pants with reinforced knees, woven algae-fiber satchel. Copper bracelet on left wrist, copper wire in locs. Posture slightly angled sideways, economical movement, fungal-exposed skin texture. Underground tunnel setting, bioluminescent fungi casting blue-green light, narrow metal pipes overhead, moisture in air, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Moody atmospheric lighting emphasizing glow marks and wayfinder markings. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Undertow', N'local', N'The Undertow', N'Pan-Asian dominant ancestry (75.1% combined South, East, and Southeast Asian) with significant global contributions. South Asian foundation (32.2%) provides cheekbone prominence and jawline structure, blended with East Asian (26.6%) eye shape and facial proportions, Southeast Asian (16.3%) softness in features, and subtle warmth from Hispanic/Latin American (10.2%) heritage. Northern European (8.7%) and Eastern European (6.0%) contribute undertones to skin depth and facial angularity. Features reflect a harmonious pan-Asian aesthetic with globally nuanced undertones: moderate bone structure combining South Asian cheekbone definition with Southeast Asian facial softness, enriched by East Asian eye characteristics and slight Central/Northern European contribution to overall facial proportion balance.', 168, 58, N'Lean and wiry, with the compressed musculature of someone who moves through tight spaces constantly. Shoulders slightly rounded forward from years of ducking under low pipes. Core strength evident but not bulky.', N'Dark brown, naturally textured', N'Sides shaved to bare scalp, top grown into thick locs threaded with stripped copper wire', N'Short on sides, medium-long on top (locs extend to mid-shoulder)', N'Dark brown with concentric ring tattoos in deep indigo — three rings per iris, traditional Undertow wayfinder''s mark', N'Medium warm brown with golden undertones, reflecting the dominant pan-Asian ancestry blend (South, East, Southeast) with subtle warmth from Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Permanent bluish-green bioluminescent sheen concentrated along collarbones, forearms, and the inner curve of both wrists creates an iridescent overlay.', N'Weathered but not aged prematurely. Skin texture slightly roughened from fungal exposure and constant moisture, with the characteristic resilience of South and East Asian heritage skin. Angular facial structure—moderate cheekbones with South Asian prominence tempered by Southeast Asian softness, sharp jawline tapering to a defined chin with subtle East Asian angularity. Dark, keen eyes set with slight epicanthic fold influence characteristic of East Asian ancestry. Minimal grooming beyond functional — no makeup, nails kept short and callused.', N'Echolocation implant shows as a faint scar behind the left ear, barely noticeable. Copper wire threaded through locs may appear intentional but serves no augmentation function. Otherwise no visible chrome or subdermal plating.', N'Perpetually angled sideways in narrow spaces even when unnecessary — muscle memory runs deep. Head held in constant micro-calculations of overhead clearance. Movement is economical and precise, never wasted motion. Steps are quiet and deliberate. Hands move with practiced care when near obstacles or clients.', N'Tier 5 utilitarian/Undertow-adapted. Rust-resistant polymer base-layer (faded teal), sealed at wrists and ankles. Over it: a patched synthetic parka of indeterminate color (charcoal or dark teal, hard to tell under algae stains). Cargo pants with reinforced knees and multiple pockets filled with coiled rope, spare lantern modules, and a leather journal. Boots are heavy synthetic with grip-treads, well-maintained. A woven satchel (made from dried algae fibers) carries mapping tools and fungal samples. Jewelry: a thin copper bracelet on left wrist (handmade, Undertow-crafted) and copper wire woven through locs. No corp logos or status wear. Everything speaks to someone who has chosen the tunnels permanently.', N'Three years ago she guided a family of five into a passage she was eighty percent confident was safe. A sinkhole opened. She got four of them out. She has never told anyone which four — or that she chose who she ran back for first based on weight and mobility, not the child.', N'Sparse, technical, tunnel-specific jargon mixed with Undertow pidgin; rarely uses contractions when giving directions; warm in short, precise phrases', N'Slow and deliberate, with long pauses before answering questions — she treats speech like navigation, finding the right route before committing', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'branko_an_bj_rnsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d1-71f9-a73e-b620d89993a9', N'Fabricio Tofauti', N'Fabricio', N'', N'Tofauti', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Gravesend Basin, operates out of a water-damaged apartment above the Pelican Fry stall on Sump Row, near Halsted and Division', N'Blackmail specialist and information broker for petty leverage', N'Independent operator, loose arrangement with the Sump Row merchants'' protection collective', N'Fabricio Tofauti has the patient, watchful quality of someone who has learned to make herself invisible. She is medium height, with deep amber skin, close-cropped natural hair she dyes a muted copper, and wide-set eyes fitted with patterned irises—concentric rings of gold and black that she uses deliberately to unsettle people when she removes her tinted contacts in negotiation. Her hands are always busy: folding receipts, tapping rhythm on surfaces, smoothing the worn edges of her data chips. She dresses in forgettable browns and grays, functional layers that carry no corporate logo and make no statement. She could be a transit worker, a clinic scheduler, a nobody. That is entirely the point.

Fabricio Tofauti is methodical and almost affectless in conversation, communicating through implication rather than declaration. She has a talent for making people feel that confessing to her is the only rational choice, and she genuinely believes she provides a service—she rarely destroys anyone, preferring the sustainable income of ongoing compliance. She has a private moral line: she will not leverage people over things that could get them killed or trafficked. She''s broken that rule once, and she knows it, and it follows her.', N'Quest giver for leverage-based missions, source of personal dirt on mid-tier NPCs, moral complication—sympathetic operator with a past transgression she can''t undo.', N'', N'Patterned irises (concentric gold-black rings, cosmetic). Sub-dermal data storage nodes in left forearm—three chips'' worth, consumer grade. Auditory filter implant that lets her isolate voices in crowd noise.', N'Spends mornings reviewing scraped data feeds and monitoring her subjects'' public activity; afternoons making rounds of the Basin markets under the guise of casual shopping, collecting gossip and confirming intelligence before making any contact.', N'Fabricio Tofauti, GLMZ, half-length portrait. 165cm lean compact figure, copper-dyed close-cropped hair with temple fade over natural black. Warm deep bronze skin with golden undertones, luminous radiance reflecting Pacific Islander, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage blend. High prominent Polynesian cheekbones, refined angularity from East Asian influences, fine-boned elegant facial structure. Augmented irises with concentric rings of deep gold and obsidian black creating unsettling cosmetic intensity. Slight jaw asymmetry from old healed break. Faint surgical scars visible on left forearm below elbow. Small burn scar on inner right wrist. Barely-visible Polynesian geometric tattoo on nape of neck hidden beneath short hair. Wearing taupe layered functional clothing—long-sleeved shirt under thin jacket, unbuttoned overshirt, worn lace-up boots. Battered data chip on thin steel chain around neck. Posture perfectly straight but not rigid, methodical gaze, seated with hands occupied—folding, tapping. Quiet intensity, minimal presence. Indoor setting, cool neon-tinged overhead lighting mixing with warm practical work lights. Neo-noir market district atmosphere, surveillance-aware composition, slightly desaturated palette with warm bronze skin luminescence standing out. Mood: controlled, observant, dangerous calm. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gravesend Basin', N'local', N'Gravesend Basin', N'Pacific Islander dominant (52.9%, primarily Polynesian), Southeast Asian (24.1%), Sub-Saharan African (14.3%), East Asian (5.4%), and Hispanic/Latin American (3.3%) ancestry. The blend manifests in warm deep bronze skin with golden undertones, high prominent cheekbones characteristic of Polynesian lineage, refined facial structure showing Southeast Asian and East Asian heritage influences, and elegant angularity from the full ancestral combination. Features are fine-boned and economical.', 165, 58, N'Lean and compact, economical in movement. Shoulders slightly narrow, core tight from decades of controlled posture. No visible musculature, but the kind of wiry endurance that comes from constant low-level motion rather than deliberate conditioning.', N'Copper-dyed over natural black', N'Close-cropped, faded at temples, kept very short to minimize grooming maintenance and avoid being grabbed', N'Short', N'Augmented: concentric rings of deep gold and obsidian black (cosmetic iris implants). Natural color unknown—hazel beneath the modification', N'Warm deep bronze with golden undertones, sun-darkened from years in the Basin''s outdoor markets. The tone carries the richness of Pacific Islander, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry blended together, creating luminous depth with subtle warm radiance rather than flat darkness.', N'Fine-featured with high prominent cheekbones inherited from Polynesian ancestry, refined by Southeast and East Asian heritage influences creating elegant angularity. The facial bone structure shows the subtle blending characteristic of Pacific Islander-Southeast Asian heritage with refined undertones from East Asian genetics. Skin is clear but weathered—not from sun damage but from low-grade environmental stress, early stress lines around the eyes from constant surveillance work. Minimal makeup. A very slight asymmetry to her left jaw from an old break that healed without proper setting.', N'The augmented irises are immediately visible when she makes eye contact or removes her tinted contacts—the patterned gold-and-black rings are distinctive and unsettling. The sub-dermal data storage nodes in her left forearm are not visible beneath clothing, but if her sleeve rides up during conversation, faint linear scars from the implant sites can be seen. The auditory filter implant is completely invisible—no external hardware, no tells.', N'Sits with her spine straight but not rigid, hands always occupied—folding, tapping, smoothing. Her gaze moves constantly but without the jerky quality of anxiety; it''s methodical, cataloging. She moves through spaces with minimal energy expenditure, taking up as little room as possible. When she walks, her feet land heel-to-toe in an almost silent pattern. Speaks quietly, requiring people to lean in slightly to hear her, which puts them off-balance.', N'Tier 4–5 working class, deliberately forgettable. Worn earth tones: taupe, warm gray, faded olive. Layered functional pieces—a thin jacket over a long-sleeved shirt, often with an unbuttoned overshirt for weather adaptability. Everything is from discount chain retailers or secondhand markets, nothing with visible branding. Her clothing carries the minor stains and repairs of someone who prioritizes durability over appearance. Worn sneakers or practical boots, always lace-up for quick escape. No jewelry except a battered data chip on a thin steel chain around her neck—the ''insurance copy,'' kept close.', N'Three years ago she sold leverage on a Tier 1 debtor to a loan shark who used it to locate the man''s sister for organ harvesting. She did not know that would happen. She has never worked with that buyer again but has never reported it either, and the guilt has calcified into a private doctrine of ''harm reduction'' that lets her keep working.', N'Flat, precise, slightly bureaucratic. Uses passive constructions to avoid assigning blame. Rarely raises her voice.', N'Slow and deliberate, with long comfortable pauses she does not feel the need to fill.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fabricio_tofauti');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f0-74f5-88ff-b6258c5c6224', N'Danilo Appiah', N'Danilo', N'', N'Appiah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor — repurposed shipping infrastructure turned black market hub, near Wacker and State', N'High-risk package and data transport — courier', N'Freelance — Geartown regular', N'Danilo Appiah is broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 34, her expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Born and raised in GLMZ, third generation — she has the city in her blood, its rhythms in her bones, its cruelty in her expectations. She works as a courier out of Old Harbor, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

she is not the most talented courier in GLMZ, but she might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'As a courier, Tengiz Ito-Takyi embodies the tension between independence and isolation. She is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation. Subdermal armor plating across torso and forearms — military surplus, scratched serial numbers', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Danilo Appiah, GLMZ, GLMZ runner, medium-height broad-shouldered woman with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones, dark brown eyes with neural interface strain, long dark hair with silver at temples pulled tight in functional braid, angular high cheekbones blending East Asian and Northern European ancestry with broader facial planes from African and South Asian heritage, perpetually tense jaw and weathered complexion. Chrome subdermal armor visible at forearms and wrists, amber LED bioluminescence glowing faintly at temples, surgical seams showing military-surplus installation, thin white scar from temple to jawline, burn scar on left hand. Wearing charcoal gray reinforced canvas jacket over matte-black compression shirt with cooling vents, dark gray cargo pants with reinforced pockets, steel-toed scuffed boots, heavy chrome-buckled leather belt. Battered analog watch on left wrist. Alert predatory posture, weight forward on balls of feet, economical economical controlled movement. Standing in Old Harbor industrial district, amber and blue neon reflections on wet pavement, rain-slicked metal surfaces, atmospheric fog, low-angle industrial lighting casting hard shadows across her face revealing augmentation marks, tense and dangerous presence --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Complex global ancestry: predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (26.3%) with significant East Asian (19.6%), Sub-Saharan African (16.0%), and South Asian (15.0%) heritage, plus Indigenous American (14.8%) and Northern European (8.3%) ancestry. This creates a richly blended phenotype — warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones from the Latin American and African heritage, high cheekbones and angular bone structure influenced by East Asian ancestry, broader facial planes from Sub-Saharan African genetics, and a strong jaw from Northern European influence. The overall effect is a person whose features don''t align with any single continental origin, but represent the Ubiquitous Diaspora perfectly: warm-toned skin, almond-shaped eyes with depth from multiple ancestry lines, and facial architecture that speaks to global mixing rather than any single heritage.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and heavy-set with dense muscle beneath a layer of practical bulk — built like someone who carries weight as deliberate mass rather than fat. Stocky core, powerful legs, forearms that show the architectural definition of someone who maintains augmentation hardware daily.', N'Dark brown, naturally black with premature silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid; no ornamentation, secured with industrial cable tie', N'Long (shoulder-length when loosened, but always bound)', N'Dark brown with faint chromatic aberration at the edges — sign of subcutaneous neural interface strain', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones — the result of blended Hispanic/Latin American, East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Indigenous American ancestry, deepened and weathered by years of Old Harbor humidity and industrial exposure', N'Weathered and lived-in with angular, high cheekbones from East Asian and Northern European ancestry, broad facial planes enriched by Sub-Saharan African and South Asian genetics, warm golden-brown skin tone from the complex mixing of all heritage lines, and a strong jawline. Minimal grooming beyond function. A mouth that rarely smiles. Perpetual tension in the jaw. Small scar tissue around knuckles, consistent with bare-knuckle self-defense training.', N'Chrome visible at wrist and forearm where subdermal armor plating edges meet skin at stress points; faint amber LED bioluminescence visible beneath the skin at both temples when her neural interface is active. Mechanical clicking audible in her joints when she moves quickly — adrenaline pump hydraulic engagement. No attempt made to conceal any of it.', N'Economical and alert; she moves like someone constantly aware of exits and threats. Weight stays forward on the balls of her feet, shoulders held slightly forward. Her eyes track fast-moving objects and people with predatory precision. When idle, she fidgets with equipment — checking knife edges, testing trigger resistance, running fingers over her augmentation seams. No wasted motion.', N'Practical Tier 3-4 runner gear. Heavy canvas work jacket (charcoal gray, multiple pockets, reinforced elbows) over a matte-black compression shirt with visible cooling vents at the ribs — designed to manage the heat dump from her adrenaline pump. Cargo pants in dark gray with reinforced thigh pockets and a knife sheath sewn into the interior seam of the left leg. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and functional, laced tight. A leather motorcycle-style belt with a heavy chrome buckle. No jewelry except a battered analog watch on her left wrist — waterproof, shock-resistant, no network connectivity. A long coat hangs in her temporary quarters — military surplus wool, lined with a shielded compartment for sensitive packages.', N'', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'danilo_appiah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a616-7c14-9f96-b65f48fadadc', N'Ejike Tanaka-Johansson-Jeong', N'Ejike', N'', N'Tanaka-Johansson-Jeong', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 25, 2, N'active', N'The Circuit, near Damen and Armitage', N'Fixer - Journalist-connected', N'Mirrorwell Media (mid-level fixer)', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Ejike Tanaka-Johansson-Jeong, 172cm lean figure, medium-warm brown skin with golden undertones and sun-weathered texture, high defined cheekbones blending East Asian structure with Sub-Saharan African warmth, warm dark brown eyes with amber highlights, alert gaze. Natural black hair with silver threads at temples, pulled back in tight practical braid. Faint scar through left eyebrow giving intense expression. Subdermal blue-green LED grid glowing faintly at temples, chrome jack port visible behind left ear. Wearing fitted charcoal insulated jacket with utility pockets, dark gray cargo pants with thigh holster, scuffed black ankle boots. Worn leather cord with data-stick hanging under collar. Tattooed circuit pattern visible on inner left wrist. Standing alert in neon-lit GLMZ undercity alley, 2226 near-future megacity setting, economical posture, measured intensity, holding sight lines. Cool blue and amber lighting, rain-slicked pavement, industrial architecture. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Predominantly East Asian (62.3%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (19.5%) and Eastern European (18.2%) ancestry. The genetic blend manifests in warm medium-brown skin tone with golden undertones, angular cheekbones with defined structure typical of East Asian heritage softened and widened by Sub-Saharan African ancestry, and warm-hued dark brown eyes with amber highlights reflecting the warmth of the African heritage component.', 172, 61, N'Lean and efficient, shoulders squared from years of moving through crowds and confrontations. No wasted mass — functional muscle in forearms and legs.', N'Natural black with intentional silver threading at the temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid that wraps around the crown; allows full peripheral vision', N'Long (shoulder-blade length when unbound)', N'Warm dark brown with amber undertones, alert and constantly scanning', N'Medium-warm brown complexion with subtle golden undertones; sun-weathered texture reflecting the blended ancestry. Deeper in sun-exposed areas, luminous where protected. The warmth is enriched by Sub-Saharan African heritage with the structure of East Asian genetics.', N'High, defined cheekbones with balanced facial width — East Asian structure enriched by the warmth and dimensionality of Sub-Saharan African heritage, framed by the subtle bone structure of Eastern European ancestry. Strong jaw with understated softness. Minimal makeup — practical grooming. A faint scar runs through her left eyebrow, giving her resting expression an intensity that isn''t entirely accidental. Warm undertones visible especially around cheeks and temples.', N'Subdermal LED grid beneath translucent patches of skin on both temples (faint blue-green glow when active, used for heads-up data display). Left ear has a visible jack port behind the lobe, roughly 8mm, chromed steel. No other obvious augmentations.', N'Economical and alert. Walks with purpose, rarely fidgets. Leans against walls or furniture in social situations rather than sitting — maintains sight lines. Speaks with measured deliberation; people instinctively listen. Her gaze lands on faces and holds them.', N'Tier 3-4 pragmatic: fitted charcoal insulated jacket with multiple utility pockets and reinforced elbows (Akira-brand second season), dark gray cargo pants with thigh holster for data-chip case, scuffed black ankle boots with grip-tread. Layers underneath for temperature regulation. A worn leather cord with a single unmarked data-stick hangs under her collar. Her aesthetic prioritizes function over fashion, but the cuts and materials suggest measured investment — nothing cheap, nothing flashy.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ejike_tanaka_johansson_jeong');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d4-7d9e-8f34-b66fff0e4b3b', N'Do-yun Huitzil', N'Do-yun', N'', N'Huitzil', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Gravesend Basin, specifically a converted shipping office above the Tideline Brokerage pawn front, near Ashland and Division', N'loan shark and bookmaker operating out of Gravesend Basin', N'Independent operator; loose arrangement with the Gravesend Basin crew known as the Inkfish', N'Do-yun Huitzil is a broad-shouldered woman with deep brown skin and the pale silver hair that runs in her Norwegian grandmother''s line, kept in a severe bun pinned with a data-spike she uses as a stylus. Her face is heavy-featured and composed, the kind of face that has absorbed a great deal of information without letting any of it back out. She wears reading lenses with ledger overlays almost always active, giving her irises a faint amber glow when she''s calculating — which is nearly always. A small tattoo on her left wrist reads ''Φ+Φ=Φ'' in the old symbolic script, her personal joke about compound interest.

Do-yun Huitzil runs her loan operation with the temperament of an extremely patient accountant who happens to employ two large men with ceramic-reinforced knuckles. She is not cruel; she is precise. Late payments are met first with reminders, then with restructured terms, then with consequences calibrated to the debtor''s ability to absorb them. She considers gratuitous violence wasteful and unprofessional. She genuinely believes she provides a service to people the corponation banks won''t touch, and this belief is not entirely wrong, which is what makes her dangerous. She prays to the E.L.F. Φ-Mater every Thursday, leaving small interest-accruing data packages as offerings.', N'Quest giver (a debtor has gone missing with her money and she wants them found, not harmed — yet), information source about Basin finances and who owes whom, moral grey zone NPC who can become ally or antagonist depending on player behavior', N'', N'Retinal ledger overlay (commercial grade, heavily customized); subdermal vibration sensor in fingertips for detecting nervous tells; no cosmetic geneware', N'Opens the office at 10:00, reviews accounts and overnight data feeds until noon, receives clients in the afternoon, sends her collectors out in the evening, and reconciles the books after midnight with a glass of palm wine.', N'Do-yun Huitzil, professional fixer in GLMZ Great Lakes zone. Stern Indigenous American-East Asian-African blend woman with angular high cheekbones, broad nose, deep brown eyes with subtle upturned lids, pale silver hair in severe bun pinned with chrome data-spike. Warm bronze-brown immaculate skin. Wearing tailored charcoal gray shirt and custom wool vest, reading lenses with green-tinted active overlay on cheekbones, platinum bracelet catching light. Seated at desk in dim cool-lit office with vertical blinds casting hard shadows, hands poised over surface with faint subdermal shimmer visible in fingertips. Neutral cold expression, perfect posture, ledger folio within reach. Neo-noir noir lighting, sharp focus, intricate detail on augmentations, professional atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gravesend Basin', N'local', N'Gravesend Basin', N'Predominantly Indigenous American (76.1%) with significant East Asian (13.0%) and Sub-Saharan African (10.9%) ancestry. Strong Indigenous American bone structure—broad cheekbones and pronounced nose—enhanced by Sub-Saharan African definition in facial geometry. East Asian ancestry subtly influences eye shape and upper eyelid structure. The blending creates a distinctive angular face with warm, equatorial skin tones and the geometric precision of multiple continental heritages converging.', 178, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial without excess softness; a frame built for stability and presence rather than speed. Muscular through the chest and upper back, thickening slightly at the midline—a body that suggests physical capability gone a bit complacent with middle age and office work.', N'Pale silver with faint platinum undertones', N'Severe bun, pinned with a customized data-spike stylus', N'Long (gathered up)', N'Deep brown, with a faint amber glow when retinal overlay is active (ledger mode)', N'Warm bronze-brown with golden undertones; complexion carries the even tone of someone who works indoors under controlled lighting, with the luminosity from ancestry spanning equatorial and Indigenous American regions.', N'Angular face with strong Indigenous American structure: broad nose with refined definition from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, prominent high cheekbones characteristic of Indigenous genetics, eye shape showing subtle East Asian influence creating a distinctive upper-lid geometry. Skin condition is immaculate and well-maintained, suggesting disciplined skincare and possible subtle geneware maintenance. No visible wrinkles despite her age. Expression typically neutral, jaw often set in calculation.', N'Reading lenses with active ledger overlay sitting on her cheekbones (commercial-grade frames with bespoke modifications, faint green tint to the glass); a polished chrome data-spike serving as her hair pin, approximately 8cm long with circuit tracings etched down its length. When she flexes her fingers, the faintest shimmer of subdermal tech is visible beneath the skin of her fingertips (vibration sensors), though only under close inspection.', N'Sits with perfect spine alignment; moves with deliberate economy of motion—no wasted gestures. Her hands move with precision when working, hovering over surfaces as if calculating weight and balance. When standing, she settles her weight evenly on both feet, giving the impression of immobility. Her fingers occasionally vibrate slightly at the tips when she''s reading a nervous client—a tell she''s reading their tells.', N'Tier 3-4 professional: tailored but practical. Favors long-sleeved shirts in muted grays and blacks to minimize distraction; high-quality synthetic blends that don''t wrinkle. A charcoal wool vest, custom-fitted, worn over everything in the office. Flat black shoes with reinforced soles. A simple platinum bracelet on her right wrist—no visible branding, but the weight and finish suggest genuine pre-Collapse manufacture or high-end corpo reproduction. A leather ledger folio in weathered charcoal, always within arm''s reach. Jewelry is minimal: a plain gold ring on her left ring finger (professional habit, not romantic statement).', N'Three years ago she forgave a Tier 1 family''s entire debt after their child died — then fabricated fake repayment records so no one would think her soft. She has done it twice more since.', N'Formal, precise, financial metaphors for everything; mixes Norwegian loan-words with Nigerian Pidgin-derived slang from her father''s side', N'Measured and unhurried, with deliberate pauses before key numbers or terms as if letting them settle', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'do_yun_huitzil');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a71f-735c-a5bc-b6e16d60f867', N'Danjuma Calvillo', N'Danjuma', N'', N'Calvillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 35, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Lattice — vertical slum built into scaffolding of an unfinished arcology, near Ashland and Division', N'Freelance combat specialist — street samurai', N'Semi-independent — has standing arrangements with several crews', N'Danjuma Calvillo is broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 35, her face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and she has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She taught herself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know her best. She works as a street samurai out of The Lattice, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Danjuma Calvillo has built a reputation on reliability rather than flash — she shows up, she delivers, she collects.', N'Ximena Smirnov-Ankrah functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio. Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Danjuma Calvillo, 2226 neo-noir operative, 175cm broad-shouldered heavy-set muscular build, warm golden-brown skin with layered olive and golden undertones reflecting pan-diaspora heritage (Hispanic/Latin American, East Asian, South Asian, Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European), strong angular face with prominent high cheekbones and defined African-heritage jawline, dark brown eyes with heterochromia in right eye, dark brown hair with silver at temples pulled back tight in functional braid. Visible augmentations: matte black chrome vocal modulator at right throat, neural interface jack at skull base with barely-healed scarring. Distinguishing scars: thin linear scar left cheekbone to jaw, burn scar right forearm, pale scar tissue at neural jack site. Wearing reinforced charcoal synthdenim tactical jacket over high-collar undershirt, matte black cargo pants with webbing, scuffed steel-toe combat boots, worn oil-stained leather jacket, no logos. Stance forward-weighted and alert, economy of movement, calculating and tense. Neo-noir dystopian urban setting with neon-lit shadows, cool blue and amber lighting, industrial architecture, rain-slicked surfaces, late-cycle capitalism aesthetic, gritty and worn. Mood: dangerous precision, hardened operative in downtime observation. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Lattice', N'local', N'The Lattice', N'Pan-diaspora genetic composite: Hispanic/Latin American (31.1%) forms the warm foundational tone, substantially complemented by East Asian (26.8%) contributing refined facial geometry and eye structure, South Asian (15.2%) adding depth to skin undertones and cheekbone definition, Middle Eastern (11.1%) providing angular bone density and warm golden notes, Sub-Saharan African (9.2%) bringing structural strength to jaw and facial prominence, and Eastern European (6.6%) adding fine angular definition. Features map a complex global ancestry: warm golden-brown skin with layered undertones—olive from Latin and Middle Eastern heritage, golden from South Asian influence, with cool undertones from East Asian ancestry creating subtle chromatic depth. Facial geometry reflects this synthesis: refined cheekbones with East and South Asian delicacy balanced against the structural prominence of African heritage jawline, framed by the angular definition of Eastern European bone structure and warmed by Latin and Middle Eastern golden undertones.', 175, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and heavy-set, muscular without being lean — carries weight like structural integrity. Thick through the torso and legs, built for impact and stability rather than speed.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at the temples', N'Pulled back tight in a functional braid, kept short enough to not catch', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with slight heterochromia — right eye shows minor chromatic aberration from older optic nerve work', N'Warm golden-brown, medium depth, with layered olive and golden undertones—golden notes from South Asian and Latin heritage, subtle cool depth from East Asian ancestry, angular warmth from Middle Eastern influence, structural richness from Sub-Saharan African heritage, refined by Eastern European tone modulation. Carries the sun in her skin with complex chromatic depth.', N'Strong, angular face with prominent high cheekbones showing East and South Asian influence and a defined, prominent jaw reflecting African heritage structure. Overall geometry balances Latin warmth and South Asian depth with Middle Eastern and Eastern European bone density and angular refinement. Minimal grooming — functional rather than decorative. Skin shows the texture of someone who has spent time under poor lighting and worse conditions; hypopigmented scars from healed burns stand stark against the warm baseline.', N'Vocal modulator unit mounted at the right side of her throat — matte black chrome with recessed panel lines, no attempt at concealment. Faint scarring around the installation site. Neural interface jack at base of skull is visible when hair is pulled back — dark titanium-alloy insertion point with barely-healed tissue around it, still showing minor inflammation.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion, every shift of weight calculated. Stands with weight forward, ready to move or strike. Rests with shoulders slightly tense. Maintains baseline situational awareness even in downtime; her eyes catalog exits and threats reflexively.', N'Tier 3-4 practical combat wear — reinforced synthdenim jacket in charcoal with tactical pockets, worn over a high-collar undershirt that conceals the throat modulator slightly. Cargo pants in matte black with cargo webbing. Scuffed but maintained combat boots with steel toes. No logos or affiliation markers. Wears a worn leather jacket over everything on contracts — scarred, oil-stained, anonymous. Off-contract, wears cheaper neutral clothing from discount retailers to blend into Tier 4 pedestrian spaces.', N'Ximena Smirnov-Ankrah can''t read. Hides it behind voice interfaces and memorization. The shame is older than the chrome.', N'Educated vocabulary wrapped in street delivery — the contrast is deliberate.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'danjuma_calvillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67b-7dc3-81f2-b6e2f6845c07', N'Ellinor Park-Banerjee', N'Ellinor', N'', N'Park-Banerjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 11, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Blackpipe Corridor, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Truant message runner and amateur graffiti mapper', N'Independent; loose ties to Blackpipe courier collective ''The Drip''', N'Ellinor Park-Banerjee is a small, wiry girl with deep brown skin dusted in a faint bioluminescent sheen inherited from her Faleolo grandmother''s cosmetic geneware — it glows a soft sea-green under stress or excitement, which she hates because it gives her away at the worst moments. She keeps her hair in tight twists pinned with salvaged circuit-board clips, and her fingers are perpetually stained with marker ink from the hand-drawn maps she sells to other runners. Her eyes are large and watchful, taking in every detail of a corridor before her feet follow.

She is relentlessly cheerful in a way that is clearly armor — she laughs at danger and talks too fast when she''s scared. She has memorized the pipe-routes and maintenance shafts of Blackpipe Corridor better than any adult who works there, and she treats this knowledge like a personal treasury. She is fiercely protective of two younger kids she considers her responsibility and deeply suspicious of anyone who is too kind too quickly.', N'Local color, information source, guide NPC for Blackpipe Corridor geography, quest giver for low-stakes fetch missions with high emotional stakes', N'', N'Inherited cosmetic bioluminescence (sea-green, stress-reactive). No purchased augs.', N'Spends mornings running small packages and verbal messages between residents too paranoid to use the grid, spends afternoons drawing and selling updated corridor maps on scraps of thermal paper.', N'Ellinor Park-Banerjee, 142cm tall lean wiry figure, deep mahogany brown skin with golden undertones, faint sea-green bioluminescent sheen across collarbone and shoulders, natural black hair with reddish tones in tight braided twists pinned with glowing circuit-board clips, deep brown alert eyes with thin pale scar through left eyebrow, perpetual smudges of blue and black marker ink on fingers and cheekbones, hunched posture ready to duck, constantly fidgeting. Wearing oversized grey thermal-lined hoodie, black cargo pants with eight pockets, mismatched neon compression socks, reinforced synthetic boots, paracord belt with carabiners and dead smartwatch talisman. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, scanner-heavy moody lighting casting shadows across maintenance shaft or rooftop setting, low angle emphasizing compact efficiency, nervous energy visible in micro-expressions and hand movement, utilitarian scavenger aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'South Asian (44.7%) and East Asian (43.9%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (11.4%) ancestry. The combination creates a striking warm-to-deep complexion — rich brown skin with subtle golden and warm undertones characteristic of the South Asian-East Asian genetic blend, enriched by the warmth and depth from Sub-Saharan heritage.', 142, 38, N'Wiry and compact — all lean muscle and nervous energy, built for ducking through maintenance shafts and scaling fire escapes. No excess, all efficiency.', N'Natural black with reddish undertones', N'Tight braided twists pinned with salvaged circuit-board clips in asymmetrical clusters; clips vary in color and opacity, some still faintly glowing', N'Medium (shoulder-length twists)', N'Deep brown, slightly large and perpetually alert', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, blending South Asian warmth, East Asian porcelain undertones, and Sub-Saharan depth into a harmonious rich mahogany. The Faleolo geneware gives a faint pearlescent sea-green bioluminescent sheen visible under dim light.', N'Clear but perpetually smudged — marker ink stains on fingertips, trace charcoal on cheekbones. Pronounced, defined cheekbones with a subtle flare to the nasal bridge reflecting the South Asian-East Asian blend. A thin scar through her left eyebrow (pipe-sharp edge at age 9). Quick, restless facial expressions; constant micro-adjustments of attention.', N'Inherited cosmetic bioluminescence only — no chrome, no obvious implants. The geneware is passive until her stress response triggers it; she visibly dislikes the attention it draws.', N'Constantly in motion even when still — fidgeting, re-pinning hair clips, tapping fingers. Moves through space with practiced efficiency, favoring low, quick routes. Shoulders slightly hunched as if perpetually ready to duck. Eyes never stay fixed; they scan entry points, shadows, potential exits.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian with scavenged upgrades: oversized grey thermal-lined hoodie (salvaged corpo-grade, one size too big to hide her frame and provide range of motion), black cargo pants with at least eight functional pockets (filled with markers, map scraps, lockpicks, salvage bits), mismatched compression socks in faded neon colors. Worn synthetic boots with reinforced toe-caps from repeated pipe climbing. A paracord belt looped with carabiners and a dead smartwatch she keeps as a lucky talisman. No brands visible — everything is utility or salvage.', N'She found a dead Tessera data-courier in a maintenance shaft eight months ago and has been slowly decoding the partial messages on the courier''s cracked slate — she believes one of them mentions her mother''s intake number', N'Street patois mixed with surprisingly precise spatial vocabulary — she knows words like ''egress'' and ''load-bearing'' from studying old building schematics', N'Fast and overlapping, sentences tumbling into each other; slows down dramatically when she''s relaying a memorized message', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ellinor_park_banerjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a605-785a-9557-b6f6da27c6f8', N'Grigor Huitzil-Szabó', N'Grigor', N'', N'Huitzil-Szabó', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, Mexicantown Libre, near Ashland and Division', N'Bootleg media seller and fortune seller, The Alban Souk', N'Independent; informal with Ringo subsidiary resellers network (he is very much not supposed to be selling their product this way); pays a small pitch fee to the Alban Souk collective', N'Grigor Huitzil-Szabó is wiry and restless, with sandy-brown skin, a scatter of darker freckles across his nose, and color-changing hair he keeps medium-length — today it''s cycling slowly between deep indigo and a burnt copper, a gradient that shifts with his mood in a way he has customized to be slightly out of sync with his actual emotional state, because he thinks it''s funny to make people misread him. His stall is a folding table, a battered data-terminal with a cracked screen, and a rack of physical media chips he sells alongside what he calls ''experience cartridges'' — bootleg sensory recordings, contraband dreamscapes, illegally ripped Ringo entertainment contracts.

The fortune-telling is a sideline and a passion both: he reads data-patterns using a divination system he invented himself, combining traditional nazar iconography from one branch of his heritage with Akan adinkra symbols from the other, mapped onto a set of thirty-two hand-etched chips he calls his ''throw.'' He has a gift for it — or at least a gift for reading people well enough that what he says resonates — and a small devoted clientele who come specifically for the throw and don''t buy media at all. He is young enough to find everything amusing and old enough to be annoyed by how often that gets mistaken for shallowness. He is sharper than he presents, and he knows exactly how useful that gap is.', N'Information broker via media — knows what illegal content is circulating and what''s in it. Fortune-teller can serve as a narrative mirror or cryptic guide. Young, networked, underestimated — useful for rumors and youth-faction dynamics in Mexicantown Libre.', N'', N'Color-changing geneware hair (custom tuned to be slightly out of sync with emotional state). Retractable cat claws — cosmetic geneware, not sharp enough to be a real weapon, mostly used for emphasis when gesturing.', N'Sets up at the Alban Souk around noon, sells media and readings until late evening. Spends mornings sourcing new content from a pirate relay node he pays a monthly fee to access.', N'Grigor Huitzil-Szabó, a 172cm tall figure with deep warm brown skin enriched by golden and olive undertones, striking freckles scattered across the nose and cheeks. Color-shifting geneware hair cycling between deep indigo and burnt copper, shoulder-length and loose. Dark warm brown eyes with quick, tracking gaze. Wiry lean build, hyperaware posture at a street stall. Wearing oversized indigo linen shirt unbuttoned over fitted tank, cargo pants with stress seams, worn synthetic leather boots. Silver chain bracelet visible. Opalescent cosmetic claws barely extending from fingertips. Indigo nazar eye tattoo on inner left wrist with adinkra symbol. Outdoor GLMZ market setting, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool neon ambient lighting casting shadows across sharp jawline, warm practical work environment, intimate card-reading energy, atmospheric haze, documentary-style street photography neo-noir urban aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'Indigenous American (37.4%), Sub-Saharan African (24.5%), Eastern European (22.9%), and South Asian (15.2%) — a striking phenotype born from the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The genetic blend creates warm deep brown tones with complex undertones: golden warmth from the Sub-Saharan and South Asian ancestry, subtle olive from Eastern European components, and unexpected freckles as recessive traits surface. The result is a rich, multi-layered skin tone that shifts in different lighting.', 172, 62, N'Wiry and restless — lean muscle with minimal fat, the build of someone who moves constantly and eats irregularly. Shoulders slightly narrow, legs long in proportion to his torso.', N'Color-shifting geneware — currently cycling between deep indigo and burnt copper in a gradient', N'Medium-length, shoulder-grazing, worn loose or half-pinned depending on mood and sales volume. The color shift is deliberately customized to lag behind his actual emotional state by 2-4 seconds.', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, warm-toned', N'Deep warm brown with golden and subtle olive undertones, sun-darkened at the forearms and neck from outdoor stall work. The warmth reflects the dominant Indigenous American and Sub-Saharan ancestry, enriched by South Asian genetics, with Eastern European components adding complexity and depth to the undertone.', N'Scattered darker freckles across the bridge of nose and upper cheeks — a striking recessive trait from the Eastern European ancestry, unusual and beautiful against the darker skin tone. Clean-shaven, sharp jawline with subtle definition from the mixed heritage. Bright expression, quick-moving eyes that track multiple conversations simultaneously. No visible scarring or blemishes; good skin health.', N'Color-shifting hair (geneware, subtle iridescent sheen in bright light). When gesturing expressively, retractable cosmetic claws extend from his fingertips — barely 5mm, opalescent, more decorative than functional. They click audibly when he taps the data-terminal.', N'Perpetually in motion — taps fingers, shifts weight, gestures while speaking. Sits at his stall with a slouch that reads as relaxed but is actually hyperaware. Moves with quick, economical gestures, no wasted motion. Leans forward when reading the throw for clients, creating an illusion of intimacy despite the public setting.', N'Tier 3-4 working-class aesthetic with deliberate thrift-store mixing. Typical outfit: oversized linen shirt (often indigo or earth-toned, unbuttoned over a fitted tank), cargo pants with visible stress seams, worn canvas belt with a small brass buckle shaped like an eye. Boots are beat-up synthetic leather, patched once at the heel. One silver chain bracelet, no other jewelry. Small canvas satchel for source runs. Clothes are clean but visibly lived-in; he dresses for function and mild aesthetic interest, not status.', N'One of his experience cartridges — a dreamscape he sells as a bootleg Ringo luxury product — is not ripped from Ringo at all. He made it himself, a recording of his own dreams processed through a consumer psych-editor. He is terrified someone will figure out how personal it is and equally terrified they won''t.', N'Fast, layered with media slang and souk vernacular. Shifts registers constantly — can sound like a barker, an academic, or a mystic within one conversation.', N'Quick and rhythmic in sales mode, deliberately slow and careful when doing a fortune reading — the contrast is part of the performance.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'grigor_huitzil_szab');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b1-7008-a4a3-b72b0607a0d6', N'Bhumika Mansour-Björnsdóttir-Shirazi', N'Bhumika', N'', N'Mansour-Björnsdóttir-Shirazi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, Neuro-Integration Ward, Sub-Level 3, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Neural calibrator at Aurochs Medical Complex, specializing in augmentation integration and ghost-signal disorders', N'Aurochs Medical Complex (Tier 3 staff contract); academic affiliation with Helix Biosystems research division (publication-only, non-exclusive)', N'Bhumika Mansour-Björnsdóttir-Shirazi is slight and precise, with warm brown skin and natural hair kept in a high, unruly cloud that she occasionally forgets to fix after long shifts. Her irises have been modded in a slow spiral pattern of amber and deep violet — a choice she made at nineteen that she now finds embarrassing but refuses to reverse on principle. She wears her Aurochs ID badge clipped to her lapel at all times, even off-shift, as though she is afraid of forgetting who she is supposed to be in this building.

Her work is the mapping of neural integration errors — the place where human nervous tissue meets augmentation hardware and occasionally refuses to agree. She is brilliant at it, producing calibration maps of patients'' neural architectures that her colleagues call ''the cartography'' because they look less like medical charts and more like hand-drawn city plans. She is also quietly terrified by her work in a way she has never articulated: every calibration map shows her how thin the border is between a person and their modifications, and some days she cannot decide which side of that border the person actually lives on.', N'Information source on augmentation black markets (she sees what bad chrome does to bodies), potential ally for characters experiencing neural augmentation problems, window into the corporate medical world''s ethical compromises', N'', N'Patterned spiral irises (cosmetic, amber/violet); neural interface port at the base of her skull for direct calibration instrument connection (standard medical professional grade); subdermal haptic feedback layer in fingertips for fine augmentation work', N'Arrives at Sub-Level 3 at 0630, spends mornings in calibration sessions with patients experiencing augmentation integration failure, afternoons writing case reports and occasionally arguing with the Helix research liaison about publication credit, evenings either in the staff canteen or walking the Aurochs roof garden alone.', N'A 162cm medical technician in a GLMZ facility, East Asian dominant features with Middle Eastern and South Asian heritage blend evident in warm golden-olive skin tone, prominent cheekbones softened by subtle facial roundness, natural almond-shaped eyes with epicanthic folds. Her most striking feature: modified cybernetic iris with slow-rotating amber and deep violet spirals hypnotizing from the pupil outward. Long natural black hair worn in an unruly high cloud, wisps escaping chaotically. Charcoal gray Aurochs Medical Complex sterile tunic with spiral helix logo, cream undershirt beneath, black synthmesh trousers, worn medical shoes. Lean, wiry build from precision manual work. Hands positioned with surgical precision. Faint surgical scar visible at skull base where hair shifts. Exhausted but focused expression, slight darkness under eyes, stress lines around mouth. Neural interface port barely visible at nape. LED indicators faint on fingertips. ID badge constantly worn on lapel. Forward-leaning posture, tilted head as if listening to subsonic frequencies. Sub-Level 3 medical facility background with cool blue-white calibration pod lighting, clinical and sterile ambiance. Neo-noir urban aesthetic with biopunk undertones. Intense, otherworldly presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Predominantly East Asian (56.4%) with substantial Middle Eastern (31.7%) and South Asian (11.9%) ancestry. Her East Asian heritage provides the foundation of her bone structure—prominent cheekbones, sharp jawline, and characteristic eye shape with natural epicanthic folds—while her Middle Eastern and South Asian ancestry adds warmth to her complexion, subtle fullness to her lips, and gentle roundness to her facial contours that softens the angular severity of her East Asian features. The genetic blend creates striking dimensional harmony: geometric precision meeting organic warmth.', 162, 52, N'Slight and wiry, with the precise musculature of someone who spends hours in focused manual work rather than exertion. Her frame carries almost no excess; she moves like she''s rationing her own physical presence.', N'Natural black with fine texture', N'Worn in a high, deliberately unruly cloud, often escaping its own containment after long shifts; she pulls it back absently with her fingers but rarely commits to restraining it', N'Long', N'Modified: slow spiral pattern of amber and deep violet, the spirals rotating outward from the pupil in a mesmerizing concentric design', N'Warm golden-tan with olive and amber undertones, medium depth with even clarity and subtle luminescence from the blending of South Asian and Middle Eastern warmth with East Asian undertones', N'Fine-featured face with pronounced cheekbones and sharp jawline from East Asian ancestry, softened and warmed by fuller lips and subtle roundness in the cheeks from Middle Eastern and South Asian heritage. Minimal facial hair. Eyes are characteristically almond-shaped with natural epicanthic folds. Skin shows the exhaustion of Sub-Level 3 work—slight darkness under the eyes with well-maintained clarity. Faint stress lines around the mouth from concentration during calibration sessions. The interplay of warm golden-olive complexion with the modified spiral iris creates an almost otherworldly intensity.', N'The spiral iris modification is immediately striking and unsettling—it draws the eye and creates an almost hypnotic effect. The neural interface port at the base of her skull is usually hidden by hair but occasionally visible at the nape of her neck as a slight raised disc with subtle threading. Her fingertips occasionally display faint LED indicators when her subdermal haptic layer is in active calibration mode. She wears her Aurochs Medical ID badge on her lapel constantly, even off-shift.', N'Moves with compressed efficiency, as though taking up space is a minor inconvenience. Her hands are her most expressive feature—they move with surgical precision and subtle awareness of space, constantly micro-adjusting. She stands slightly forward-leaning, head tilted as though listening to something just below audible range. Makes intense eye contact during work but avoids it socially.', N'Tier 3 medical professional: Aurochs-issued sterile tunic in charcoal gray with the Medical Complex logo (a spiral helix) embroidered on the left shoulder. Under it, typically a plain long-sleeve undershirt in cream or pale blue. Black synthmesh trousers with reinforced knees from frequent kneeling in calibration pods. Worn black slip-on medical shoes with grip soles. Off-shift clothing maintains the same neutral palette and utilitarian cut—no ornamentation, no brands, nothing that signals affiliation beyond Aurochs. Always wears her ID badge. Her clothing shows signs of old stains (calibration fluid, probably) that never quite came out, which she ignores.', N'Three months ago she completed a calibration map for a patient whose neural architecture suggested they had a second, dormant augmentation interface — one that was not on any medical record. She filed the chart without flagging it, and has been returning to that file every few days since.', N'Technical and precise at work, becomes strangely lyrical when explaining her calibration maps — she talks about neural space like geography', N'Quick, slightly ahead of herself, will restart a sentence if it comes out less precise than she intended', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bhumika_mansour_bj_rnsd_ttir_shirazi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019db33a-ec87-7a2e-9ac8-b7500486c747', N'Seo', N'Seo', N'', N'', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'', N'', N'', N'Auto-scaffolded. First mentioned: "the blade that Seo handed to him with both hands the way you hand someone a thing that matters"', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'seo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a699-7633-a26c-b75d4f8710d2', N'Haze Tran', N'Haze', N'', N'Tran', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'The Rampart, GLMZ, near Kedzie and Division', N'Riot Suppression Specialist, Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division — Civil Response Division', N'Haze Tran is the kind of man who seems to occupy more physical space than his actual dimensions justify. He is Kenyan-Albanian in the specific combination that produced a dark-skinned, grey-haired, thick-necked man with a bearing that other officers describe variously as ''a wall that decided to walk around'' and ''the most tired person in any room.'' At fifty-two he has more scar tissue than most people have skin on their hands — three decades of riot deployment have left a tactile record along both forearms, across his collarbone, bisecting his left eyebrow. He declined the offer of cosmetic scar-smoothing twice. The third time they stopped offering.

Petros is not what people expect when they expect a riot specialist. He is not cruel, not performatively hard, not interested in displays of dominance. He has seen what crowd dynamics become when force is deployed theatrically, and he has been cleaning it up since before most of his unit were born. He runs the Rampart''s suppression unit like a disaster-management operation — all contingency, all de-escalation protocols layered beneath the crowd-control hardware — and he is deeply, privately uncertain that the job as it is currently structured is achieving anything worth the cost. He goes to the Rampart''s unit shrine — a battered E.L.F. node dedicated to something the older officers call the Crowd — every deployment morning and he does not know if it''s prayer or apology.', N'Moral weight on policing and crowd control; a figure who can authorize suppression or quietly allow people through; source of historical knowledge about GLMZ''s protest and civil unrest history; potential ally for people working against institutional violence', N'', N'Military-grade joint reinforcement (knees and shoulders — medical necessity after a crowd crush incident in 2187); impact-dampening subdermal mesh across torso (department-issue for riot specialists); no cosmetic mods', N'Runs unit readiness training at the Rampart most mornings; attends interdepartmental deployment briefings he finds increasingly political; spends evenings at a community hall in Hough Reclamation, playing chess badly with neighborhood elders who knew the area before the last reclamation push.', N'Haze Tran, 188cm tall heavy-built man with warm deep brown skin and subtle golden undertones, Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage blended with East Asian features showing defined cheekbones and squared jaw. Steel grey short military-cut hair, dark brown eyes slightly yellowed from chemical exposure. Deep facial lines, weathered skin texture, ragged scar bisecting left eyebrow, network of pale scars across both forearms, thick horizontal scar across left collarbone. Wearing charcoal Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security riot suppression fatigues off-duty, scuffed reinforced black boots, simple grey undershirt, worn leather jacket. Slightly forward-leaning posture, controlled movement, economical gestures, hooded eyes with exhausted resting expression. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, tactical officer bearing thirty years of deployment wear, subdermal impact-mesh visible as subtle geometric texture under tight fabric, moody blue-grey lighting emphasizing weathered features and scar tissue, concrete industrial setting, photorealistic gritty aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Rampart', N'local', N'The Rampart', N'Southeast Asian (43.9%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (26.0%), East Asian (14.0%), Hispanic/Latin American (10.6%), and Eastern European (5.5%) ancestry — a complex phenotype reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The genetic blend manifests as warm deep brown skin with subtle golden and olive undertones, enriched by the darker pigmentation characteristic of Southeast and Sub-Saharan African heritage, tempered by the cooler undertones from East Asian and Eastern European ancestry. Facial structure shows the squared jaw and defined cheekbones of Southeast Asian heritage, broadened slightly by Sub-Saharan African ancestry, with the eye-set characteristic of East Asian genetics creating a unique synthesis of these regional features.', 188, 104, N'Heavy, barrel-chested with the dense musculature of someone who has spent thirty years bearing weight — not bodybuilder definition, but functional mass. Shoulders and neck thickened by reinforced joint infrastructure. Carries weight forward slightly, a stance that distributes load across reinforced knees.', N'Steel grey with dark undertones', N'Short, military-standard cut, neat without vanity', N'Short', N'Dark brown, slightly yellowed at the sclera from age and chemical exposure', N'Warm deep brown with subtle golden and olive undertones, mottled and weathered by accumulated scar tissue and subcutaneous impact mesh, creating an uneven, lived-in appearance that shifts in intensity across his face and body.', N'Heavily lined face — deep creases around the eyes and mouth suggest more frowning than smiling. Jaw prominent and squared with bone structure showing the synthesis of Southeast Asian angularity and Sub-Saharan African breadth, tempered by East Asian eye-set and Eastern European heritage. Cheekbones with definition characteristic of Southeast Asian ancestry, softened by age and the weight he carries. Skin textured and rough, bearing the tactile history of three decades of deployment. No artificial smoothing or cosmetic intervention.', N'None immediately visible. The joint reinforcement at knees and shoulders is internal (medical-necessity grade, not cosmetic). Impact-dampening subdermal mesh across torso creates a subtle textural irregularity under clothing at chest and abdomen — a faint geometric pattern visible only under tight fabric or in specific light. The wear patterns of his uniform show slight reinforcement at shoulder and knee joints.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical weight distribution — a man conscious of his mass and of how it affects space around him. Stands slightly forward-leaning, shoulders back, creating an impression of imminent readiness rather than relaxation. His stride is controlled and even, knees tracking carefully (the reinforcement surgery left him with a slight stiffness he refuses to acknowledge). Does not gesture expansively; movements are minimal and precise. His resting expression tends toward exhaustion — eyes slightly hooded, mouth in a neutral line that reads as either contemplation or disapproval.', N'Standard Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security tactical uniform off-duty: charcoal riot suppression fatigues (department-issued, Tier 3 grade material, maintained meticulously), reinforced black boots scuffed from repeated deployment, simple grey undershirt. Off-duty: practical Tier 3 civilian wear — plain cotton shirts in dark colors, heavy canvas work pants, worn leather jacket with department insignia removed. No jewelry except a thin steel wedding band worn smooth. His uniform always shows the wear of actual use rather than presentation; equipment scarred from repeated deployment rather than pristine. Watches the same older model chronometer (non-smart, mechanical backup). Does not maintain the groomed appearance of officers interested in promotion.', N'During the Hough Reclamation protests of 2193, he received a dispersal order for a crowd that included a significant number of people he knew from the community hall. He deployed at minimum possible force and filed a report indicating full compliance. Command has never reviewed the footage closely. He has reviewed it six hundred times.', N'Slow, working-class Meridian with occasional Swahili phrases he uses as emotional punctuation; uses military-inflected vocabulary from habit but has been shedding it deliberately', N'Measured and heavy, like someone choosing each word by weight — not slow-witted, but conscious', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'haze_tran');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63f-735d-8ca5-b773d8b9ec6f', N'Armaan Bah', N'Armaan', N'', N'Bah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 32, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Steamvent Alley — geothermal district, hot and chemical-smelling, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Information trader and intelligence analyst — broker', N'Semi-independent — recurring contracts with mid-tier fixers', N'Armaan Bah is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 32, his expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces — and he makes no effort to hide it.

His entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. He works as a broker out of Steamvent Alley, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Armaan Bah describe him as a precision instrument — point him at a problem and get out of the way.', N'As a broker, Kamala Sorokin-Gyasi embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces. Reflex boosters wired into spinal column — shaves reaction time by 40ms', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Armaan Bah, a 189cm lean muscular figure with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, standing in a GLMZ industrial setting. Angular face with high cheekbones, dark brown eyes, straight nose, thin scar along left jawline. Black hair with gray at temples, kept short and neat. Matte black gecko-grip implants visible on fingertips and toe pads with subtle iridescent sheening. Wearing dark fitted synthetic tactical cargo pants with sealed pockets, lightweight thermal undershirt, reinforced black boots with toe caps. Reinforced equipment harness across chest. Posture is economical and still, expression guarded and neutral. Standing in Steamvent''s chemical haze and heat, neon lighting catching the iridescence of augmented fingertips. Nocturnal living evident in slight fatigue under eyes. Cinematic neo-noir lighting, 2200s aesthetic, hyperrealistic, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Steamvent Alley', N'local', N'Steamvent Alley', N'Eastern European (40%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (34.8%), Central Asian (10.1%), South Asian (8.1%), and East Asian (7%) ancestry — a complex genetic tapestry reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The combination produces warm deep brown skin with subtle golden undertones, blending Eastern European and Central Asian cooler ancestry with the warmth of African and South Asian genetics.', 189, 78, N'Lean and angular with visible musculature — the physiology of someone who trains constantly. No wasted mass. Shoulders broad but not bulky. Limbs long and proportionally efficient.', N'Black with premature gray at temples', N'Kept short and neat, styled back from forehead', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, reflecting the balanced blend of Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, Central Asian, and South Asian ancestry. Medium saturation with slight luster.', N'High, prominent cheekbones with balanced projection — characteristic of Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European features blended with Central Asian structure. Angular but balanced jaw with subtle width through the lower face. Nose bridge straight with refined proportions reflecting the Eastern European and Central Asian contributions, with slight nasal bridge width from South Asian ancestry. Skin shows the strain of nocturnal living — slightly matte, minor discoloration under eyes. Expression habitually neutral and controlled. Grooming is meticulous but not decorative.', N'Gecko-grip implants visible at fingertips and toe pads — matte black synthetic material with subtle iridescent sheening when light catches them at certain angles. The implants create a subtle geometric texture on skin. No visible spinal augmentation — reflex boosters are internal.', N'Stands with economical stillness — every micro-movement deliberate. Walks with minimal wasted motion, weight balanced. Hands rest at sides or on lap when seated, fingers rarely fidget. Movements are smooth and precise when engaged. Eye contact is controlled, neither aggressive nor avoidant. Default expression: guarded neutrality.', N'Tier 3-4 functional wear — dark fitted synthetics, black tactical cargo pants with multiple sealed pockets, lightweight thermal undershirt. Carries a reinforced harness rig for equipment. Boots are matte black with reinforced toe caps (compatible with gecko-grip pads). No visible corp logos or status symbols. Layers suggest someone who works in Steamvent''s heat and chemical air — practical, replaceable, purchased for durability not fashion.', N'', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'armaan_bah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a64e-7850-a2c9-b79001bde362', N'Flavio Echeverría', N'Flavio', N'', N'Echeverría', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Currently grounded at Escanaba Gateway airship mooring, waiting for a berth on anything heading south, near Michigan Ave and Roosevelt', N'Airship drifter and unlicensed courier, traveling between GLMZ and the northern lake settlements aboard transient cargo airships', N'No fixed crew. Has working relationships with three independent airship captains on the northern lake circuit.; The Shore Dogs', N'Flavio Echeverría has bioluminescent skin — faint blue-gold pulses that move under the surface of their brown skin like something swimming beneath still water, brightest at their temples and collarbones. It''s a natural geneware expression that came through their father''s side and they have done nothing to modify or suppress it; up in the dark of an airship cargo hold at three in the morning, they are their own light source. They are lean and quick, with dark eyes that are always slightly too aware — always tracking exits, always calculating load weights. They have a scar across their left palm from a cargo strap incident two years ago that they are irrationally proud of.

They grew up on airships and know no other life — their parents were both drifters and they were born somewhere over Lake Superior during a cargo run. They are nineteen but have the practical knowledge of someone much older and the emotional regulation of someone much younger. Lumi is bright and genuinely funny, with a quick warm laugh that surprises people, but they crash into loneliness hard and often. They have been in GLMZ exactly twice before and each time felt like being asked to live inside a machine. They find ground-level cities claustrophobic. They pray to the ELF they call the Ballast Keeper, who they believe lives in the pressure gauges of every lift-gas rig on the northern routes.', N'Access point to airship routes, northern settlements, and off-grid communities; provides a mobile contact who moves between locations players cannot easily reach; source of aerial and northern regional intelligence; represents the second-generation drifter experience.', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin (natural geneware inheritance). Callus-hardened hands from manual cargo work. No installed augmentations — can''t afford them and doesn''t trust anyone planetside to install them safely.', N'Haunts the Escanaba Gateway mooring board, picks up day labor loading and unloading cargo, eats at the subsidized terminal canteen, sleeps in the open mooring shelter under their own emergency thermal wrap, and runs courier packages between airship crews who don''t want them on record.', N'Flavio Echeverría, 19-year-old airship cargo worker, lean angular build with warm medium-deep brown skin glowing faintly with bioluminescent blue-gold pathways along collarbones and temples. Dark brown eyes, practical medium-length dark hair in a cargo-strap-secured braid, sun-worn face with fine lines around eyes and angular cheekbones blending Latin, East Asian, Sub-Saharan, and South Asian features. Visible white diagonal scar across left palm, thermal burn on right forearm, extensive hand calluses. Wearing layered gray-blue insulation wear, reinforced cargo pants, worn synthetic-leather boots, battered chest harness with carabiners and rope, salvaged thermal wrap draped as coat. Brass pressure gauge prayer token on cord around neck. Alert, economical posture. Neo-noir 2220s Great Lakes Metropolitan airship aesthetic. Wind-swept, ozone-tinged atmosphere, cold northern lighting with glow from bioluminescent activation. Transient warehouse worker aesthetic, no corporate branding. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Currently grounded at Escanaba Gateway airship mooring', N'local', N'Currently grounded at Escanaba Gateway airship mooring', N'Hispanic/Latin American (37.8%), East Asian (26.2%), Sub-Saharan African (22.5%), South Asian (10.9%), and Southeast Asian (2.6%) ancestry—a striking cosmopolitan blend characteristic of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Latin angular structure combines with East Asian eye geometry, Sub-Saharan melanin depth, South Asian warmth, and Southeast Asian subtlety into a genuinely borderless appearance that reads as distinctly 2220s.', 168, 58, N'Lean and angular, with corded forearm muscles from years of cargo handling. No excess weight; their frame is efficient, built for climbing and balance in confined spaces. Shoulders slightly asymmetrical from repetitive lifting.', N'Dark brown with natural warm undertones', N'Pulled back in a practical single braid or loose knot, often secured with salvaged cargo straps or wire', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Dark brown, nearly black, with a faint reflective quality in low light from bioluminescent subcutaneous activity', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden, olive, and reddish undertones from the rich blend of Latin, East Asian, Sub-Saharan, and South Asian heritage. Sun-deepened from constant airship exposure, the baseline complexion carries warmth and dimension beneath which faint blue-gold bioluminescent pathways glow, most visible along temples, collarbones, and wrists.', N'Sun-worn from constant airship exposure despite northern latitudes, with weathered quality unusual for someone nineteen. Fine lines around the eyes from squinting against wind. The bone structure shows Latin angularity softened by Sub-Saharan fullness, with subtle East Asian eye shape and South Asian undertones creating a balanced, multi-dimensional face. Open expression offset by constant micro-vigilance in their gaze.', N'Bioluminescent skin manifestation is visible and always present, though intensity fluctuates with emotional state, fatigue, and ambient light. No installed cybernetics visible. Hands show extensive manual wear and callus development consistent with unaugmented physical labor.', N'Alert, economical movement with an instinctive awareness of vertical space and weight distribution. They move like someone comfortable in confined quarters and moving cargo — balance-first, every step calculated. Fidgets with hands when stationary (picking at scar, testing rope knots, checking equipment). When tired or lonely, they slouch slightly, making themselves smaller. Quick, infectious smile that doesn''t reach their eyes until they trust someone.', N'Pure Tier 4-5 transient: layered insulation wear in grays and deep blues, cargo pants with reinforced thigh and shin pockets, worn synthetic-leather boots with aggressive tread, salvaged thermal wrap worn as a coat or blanket depending on need. No corporate branding. Patches and repairs are functional, not aesthetic. Carries a battered chest harness with carabiners, rope, and cargo assessment tools. Everything smells faintly of lift-gas, ozone, and Lake Superior wind. Wears a single brass pressure gauge on a cord around their neck as a prayer object — the Ballast Keeper token.', N'They have been carrying a sealed data chip for four months that a dying captain pressed into their hand at a northern mooring and said ''don''t open this, just carry it south.'' They haven''t opened it. They are starting to wonder if they should. The captain''s ship was found empty two weeks later.', N'Fast, casual, full of airship and cargo jargon. Uses altitude and weather as metaphors for everything. Mixes Portuguese-derived coastal slang with Ghanaian-inflected tonal patterns when excited.', N'Quick and light, like they''re burning through words to get to the good part. Laughs mid-sentence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'flavio_echeverr_a');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ff-7e4e-8b52-b7b9efe69713', N'Dinora Möller-Montalvo', N'Dinora', N'', N'Möller-Montalvo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 17, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone, pipe warren sector nine, near Wacker and State', N'Q-zero ghost, scrapper, and itinerant data-thief', N'Loose affiliation with the Waukegan Q-zero community, no formal ties', N'Dinora Möller-Montalvo is a lean teenager who moves like water finding its way downhill — always the path of least resistance, always finding the gap. They are mixed-dark, their skin a deep warm brown with a faint bioluminescent shimmer along their collarbones that they did not pay for and cannot explain, a geneware expression that surfaced at puberty from some deep ancestral combination no one has mapped. Their hair is cut close on the sides and left wild on top, dyed a persistent rust-orange that clashes magnificently with everything. Their eyes are dark with irises that shift to a green-gold in bright light. They wear clothes assembled with an engineer''s practicality — lots of pockets, nothing that snags, shoes that fit.

Dinora Möller-Montalvo has no legal identity whatsoever. They were born in a transit shelter to a mother who died of an untreated infection three years later, before any papers were filed. They grew up in the pipe warrens of the Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone among other Q-zeros, learning to exist in the margins of a city that has never officially acknowledged them. They are not bitter about this — or rather, they have metabolized the bitterness into something more useful: a comprehensive and functional understanding of how to extract resources from a system that believes you don''t exist. They are quick, funny, and deeply lonely in a way they would violently deny.', N'Information source with unique access (can go where identity-checked systems block others), quest giver for Q-zero community issues, represents the human cost of digital identity systems, potential ally for characters operating outside official channels.', N'', N'Bioluminescent shimmer along the collarbones (natural geneware expression, not installed). A pirated neural cache chip they found in a scrapper haul and installed themselves with mixed results — it stores data but occasionally dumps it at random.', N'Scavenges industrial components from the Gray Zone''s decommissioned machinery during off-hours, sells what they can to grey-market parts dealers, and spends evenings cracking low-security data nodes for the information inside, which they trade or simply hoard.', N'Dinora Möller-Montalvo, lean 168cm scrapper with warm deep brown skin glowing faintly with bioluminescent green-pearl shimmer along collarbones in dim light, dark brown eyes with natural gold-green shift, fuller lips and high cheekbones reflecting African and Latin American heritage with Middle Eastern bone structure, rust-orange dyed hair with dark roots, undercut sides shaved bare, top tousled and long. Muscular from climbing, calloused hands, 5cm burn scar on left forearm, 1cm scar on right palm. Wearing modified grey surplus coveralls with sewn pockets, reinforced knees and elbows, layered thermal base underneath, mismatched-laced cargo boots, stolen vintage Shinohara Industries jacket worn open as vest-cape, webbing belt with carabiner and lockpick set. Standing in industrial GLMZ setting, hunched forward in scrapper''s crouch, hands restless, head tilted listening. Greasy dust coating everything. Dusk lighting with bioluminescence subtle and ethereal. Moody, focused, economical movement. Neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone', N'local', N'Waukegan Industrial the Gray Zone', N'Complex diaspora ancestry: predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (36.6%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (22.7%) and Middle Eastern (22.5%) heritage, Northern European (15.3%), and minor South Asian (2.9%) admixture. Physical features reflect this multifaceted blend—warm deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones from the Latin American, African, and Middle Eastern components, dark brown eyes with warm depth and natural green-gold shift in bright light, facial structure showing the fuller lips and defined cheekbones characteristic of African and Latin American ancestry combined with Middle Eastern nose and bone prominence.', 168, 52, N'Lean and wiry with defined musculature from constant climbing and crawling through industrial infrastructure. No excess fat. Shoulders slightly narrow but functional. Moves with an economical, practiced grace.', N'Rust-orange dye over natural dark brown base, showing fade at the roots', N'Undercut — sides clipped to bare scalp, top left long and tousled, styled with fingers rather than tools', N'Medium on top, very short sides', N'Dark brown irises that shift to green-gold in bright light', N'Warm deep brown with golden and olive undertones reflecting the blend of Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and Middle Eastern ancestry', N'Clear except for minor scrapes and healing calluses on knuckles and palms. No acne or visible scarring on face. Skin has a faint iridescent quality in certain light along the collarbones and upper chest — the bioluminescent geneware expression appears as a subtle pearl-green shimmer beneath the skin, most visible at dusk or in dim light. Facial structure shows fuller lips and broader cheekbones characteristic of African and Latin American heritage with Middle Eastern nose and bone structure.', N'The bioluminescent geneware shimmer is visible along the collarbones and chest, most apparent in low light. No visible chrome, no external prosthetics. The pirated neural cache chip is subcutaneous at the base of the skull, hidden under hair.', N'Moves with minimal energy expenditure — a scrapper''s economy of motion. Hunched slightly forward at rest, as if mid-crouch. Steps quietly, places feet with precision. Hands are restless when still. Head tilts often, listening. Leans rather than sits. Takes corners at angles.', N'Tier 5 scrapper practical — modified surplus coveralls with additional pockets sewn in by hand, reinforced at knees and elbows. Beneath: layered thermal base (salvaged corporate merchandise, now shapeless). Feet: broken-in cargo boots with mismatched laces. A too-large Shinohara Industries jacket (stolen, probably 2219 vintage) worn open as a vest-cape. Webbing belt with a carabiner, flashlight, and lockpick set hung at various points. Everything is worn, functional, and colored by the greasy dust of the Gray Zone. No branding except faded logos they haven''t bothered to remove.', N'', N'Fast, dense with technical jargon and transit-slang, drops in Tuvaluan phrases when emotional without noticing', N'Rapid-fire when engaged, goes completely silent when processing something difficult', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dinora_m_ller_montalvo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d1-73bc-966f-b7de05376461', N'Kerr Dalgaard', N'Kerr', N'', N'Dalgaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 68, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Crossing Gate tent encampment, southern perimeter, near North Ave and Damen', N'Climate refugee and expelled citizen, now a tent-city elder-without-title', N'Grand Crossing Gate encampment community — unofficial mediator and practical organizer', N'Kerr Dalgaard is small and deliberate, with the economy of movement that belongs to people who have learned to do everything with minimum waste. Their hair is silver-white and kept in tight braids close to their skull, and their skin — a warm brown-grey that the encampment children call ''river clay'' — is mapped with sun damage and the faint patterning of old dermal inflammation, a souvenir of the chemical flooding that took their home city. They have a single geneware modification: their irises are a soft bioluminescent amber, given to them by a camp medic years ago when their natural eyes were damaged. They never asked for it but have made peace with the warm glow their face gives off in darkness.

Kerr Dalgaard doesn''t hold any formal position in the Grand Crossing Gate encampment, but they are the person people come to when the camp council fractures, when a child goes missing, when someone needs to negotiate with the checkpoint guards. They have an absolute, undemonstrative competence that operates below the level of authority — they simply handle things, without announcing they''re doing it. They lost their citizenship in the upheaval of a climate-related territorial dispute that isn''t over yet, and they have been stateless for eleven years. They have stopped expecting resolution and started building something livable inside the wait.', N'Moral center and community anchor; provides context for the refugee experience; can grant players access to the encampment''s trust; functions as a quest-giver for community-level problems that lack obvious solutions', N'', N'Bioluminescent amber irises (geneware, functional — replaced damaged natural eyes); basic hearing aid augment (very old, jury-rigged, unreliable)', N'Ósk rises before the encampment and does a circuit — checking on the oldest residents, assessing the camp''s resource situation, speaking briefly with the checkpoint guards they''ve cultivated a working relationship with. The rest of the day is occupied by whoever needs them, which is always someone.', N'Kerr Dalgaard, 68-year-old woman in GLMZ, compact lean build 158cm tall. Warm medium-brown skin with golden olive undertones, sun-weathered with visible topography from outdoor living. Broad cheekbones and angular jaw blending Northern European, Middle Eastern, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Lined face with faint chemical burn scarring across cheeks and forehead. Short silver-white hair in tight braids close to skull. Soft bioluminescent amber eyes that glow faintly, geneware replacement. Visible jury-rigged hearing aid behind right ear, patched with wire and tape. Worn, calloused hands with age spots. Dressed in faded multi-patched scavenged jacket, layered muted grey-brown long-sleeved shirts, practical cargo pants with repair patches, worn boots. Minimal grooming, no ornamentation. Standing with deliberate posture, weight balanced, hands ready. Encampment setting, natural daylight filtering through industrial structures, weathered and utilitarian atmosphere, neo-noir dystopian Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, capturing her inventory-taking gaze and efficient presence --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Crossing Gate tent encampment', N'local', N'Grand Crossing Gate tent encampment', N'True diaspora blend across five regions: Northern European foundation (48.8%) provides bone structure and cool undertones; Middle Eastern (15.6%) adds warmth to facial features and eye shape; Hispanic/Latin American (12.7%) contributes to skin depth and cheekbone definition; South Asian (12.5%) shapes eye fold and facial proportions; Sub-Saharan African (10.4%) adds richness to melanin and overall warmth. The result is a genuinely blended phenotype—warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, broad cheekbones, subtle eye fold, and Northern European angular definition in jaw and brow ridge. No single ancestry dominates; all are present in the subtle interplay of features.', 158, 52, N'Lean and compact, with the economical musculature of someone who has spent decades doing physically necessary work — no wasted mass, joints prominent, capable hands', N'Silver-white', N'Tight braids close to the skull, practical and deliberate', N'Short', N'Soft bioluminescent amber (geneware replacement; irises glow faintly in low light)', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones, reflecting the blend of Northern European, Middle Eastern, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Sun-weathered with uneven patina—darker in exposed zones, lighter in protected areas, creating visible topography of outdoor living.', N'Lined face reflecting 68 years and environmental hardship; faint patterning of old dermal scarring across cheeks and forehead from chemical exposure; minimal grooming beyond functionality; hands calloused and age-spotted. Facial structure shows broad cheekbones and defined jaw from blended ancestry, with subtle eye fold suggesting South Asian and Sub-Saharan heritage. Skin texture weathered but retaining underlying warmth across all features.', N'Bioluminescent amber irises that emit a soft warm glow in darkness or low light; aging jury-rigged hearing aid augment visible behind right ear (taped, repaired multiple times); no other visible chrome or implants', N'Moves with deliberate efficiency and minimal gesture — no wasted motion, no performative energy. Stands at rest with weight balanced, ready. Hands often occupied with small tasks. Speaks infrequently but with absolute certainty. Eyes make contact without demand. Moves through the encampment like someone taking inventory of invisible things', N'Tier 5 utilitarian: faded, multi-patched jacket from indeterminate origin, probably scavenged; layered long-sleeved shirts in muted greys and browns to protect from sun; practical cargo pants with visible repair patches; worn boots resoled multiple times; no jewelry or ornamentation; everything serviceable, nothing decorative. Clothing shows careful maintenance within severe resource constraints', N'', N'Careful and precise; uses the formal registers of someone educated in a language that no longer has a country; occasionally a word from their home dialect surfaces with no equivalent', N'Slow, measured, never wasted — they say exactly as much as needed and then stop', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'kerr_dalgaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b6-766c-8d76-b7e045e180e9', N'Echo Ogawa', N'Echo', N'', N'Ogawa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 20, 4, N'active', N'The Core, near State and Monroe', N'Fixer - Academic theft', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'GLMZ, mature East Asian-Indigenous American-Hispanic male, age 55-65, sharp angular cheekbones, warm deep brown skin with golden olive undertones, salt-and-pepper hair close-cropped, deep brown eyes with yellowing sclera, weathered features with concentration lines, jawline scar, faded wrist tattoo, 178cm lean wiry build, seated at retro-tech workstation, wearing fitted charcoal turtleneck and vintage leather jacket with reinforced panels, minimal jewelry, worn leather messenger bag nearby, subtle neural port visible behind left ear, dim overhead lighting casting shadows across angular face, cool blue-green ambient glow from screens, photorealistic, 2200s aesthetic, focused concentrated expression, hands steepled thoughtfully, morning light through rain-streaked windows, high resolution portraiture --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Core', N'local', N'The Core', N'Indigenous American (43.2%), East Asian (30.4%), and Hispanic/Latin American (26.4%) ancestry creates a distinctly multicontinental phenotype. Facial structure shows prominent, high cheekbones with the placement characteristic of East Asian heritage, blended with the broader facial proportions and stronger bone density typical of Indigenous American ancestry. Hispanic/Latin American heritage contributes warmth, subtle golden undertones, and dimensionality to the overall features. The combination produces sharply angular cheekbones, slightly wider facial structure at the temples, and eye placement reflecting both East Asian and Indigenous American traits with deeper-set eyes.', 178, 74, N'Lean and wiry with the posture of someone accustomed to prolonged sitting. Visible muscle definition in forearms suggests decades of fine motor work. Slight forward curve to shoulders from age and desk labor.', N'Salt-and-pepper gray with darker roots', N'Close-cropped, precisely maintained with minor fade lines', N'Short', N'Deep brown with age-related yellowing in the sclera', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden, clay, and olive undertones. The blend shows rich earth tones characteristic of the Indigenous American (43.2%) and Hispanic/Latin American (26.4%) components, warmed and subtly refined by golden highlights from East Asian heritage (30.4%). Complexion shifts with light, appearing warmer in cheek and temple areas with a natural olive cast.', N'Weathered but well-maintained. Fine lines around eyes and forehead create a map of decades-long concentration. Clean-shaven with occasional five-o''clock shadow. Minor age spots on temples and cheekbones with warm golden-brown undertones. High, sharply defined cheekbones reflecting the blended East Asian and Indigenous American heritage. Natural warmth and olive-golden cast to overall complexion, particularly visible across the bridge of nose and upper cheeks.', N'None visible. However, subtle neural interface port visible at base of skull behind left ear when hair is disturbed — suggests subcutaneous cognitive enhancement or data interface capability.', N'Moves with calculated efficiency, minimal wasted motion. Tends to tilt head slightly when listening, suggesting auditory processing enhancements. Hands often steepled or gesture with precision. Walks with measured pace, favoring the left side slightly.', N'Tier 2-3 hybrid: tailored black wool trousers, fitted charcoal turtleneck or oxford shirt in muted colors. Favors vintage-style leather jacket with reinforced panels (possibly lined with signal-blocking material). Minimal visible branding. Silver-toned accessories — simple watch with analog face, worn wedding band. Carries a worn leather messenger bag with multiple interior pockets.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'echo_ogawa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b1-73aa-8954-b7f64f062c0e', N'Beatriz Villalobos-Kimura', N'Beatriz', N'', N'Villalobos-Kimura', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 31, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Blackpipe Corridor, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Fake ID vendor and small-time data broker', N'Loosely affiliated with the Oxidian Market vendors guild; occasional contract work for unnamed clients who find him through referral only', N'Beatriz Villalobos-Kimura is a lean, angular man of Georgian and South Indian-Kenyan descent, with warm olive-brown skin, a sharp jaw perpetually shadowed with stubble, and dark eyes fitted with patterned irises — a helix of deep violet spiraling toward the pupil, which he claims help him read documents faster but which are mostly just something to look at when people are looking at him. He dresses in deliberately forgettable layers: grey over grey, muted enough to vanish in a crowd, with the one vanity of a handmade brass collar pin in the shape of a cartographer''s compass. He keeps his data tools in a modified food vendor''s tray he wheels through the Narrows, looking at a glance like a snack cart.

Beatriz Villalobos-Kimura is clever in the specific, anxious way of people who got out of a bad situation through intelligence alone and haven''t yet decided whether they''re safe. He is charming in short bursts, funny in a dry, deflecting way, and quietly reads every room for threat vectors before he''s finished his first sentence. He takes professional pride in the quality of his forgeries — considers bad ID work a moral failing — and holds himself to a standard most of his customers couldn''t distinguish from a real document.', N'Service provider for false identities, access to restricted data layers, rumors about who is trying to disappear and why. A source of plot-relevant documents and a window into who in GLMZ is running from something.', N'', N'Patterned irises (cosmetic/minor functional). Subdermal data-chip in left palm for secure document transfer. Micro-tremor suppressor in right hand — a craftsman''s tool.', N'Moves his cart through the Narrows on an irregular schedule to avoid pattern-detection, taking appointments via encrypted dead-drops on an ELF-touched public terminal he calls ''the Postbox.'' Afternoons are spent in a rented back room in Blackpipe doing fabrication work; he eats alone, reads obsessively, sleeps badly.', N'Beatriz Villalobos-Kimura, GLMZ, Pan-Asian-Hispanic male, 178cm lean angular frame, warm golden-bronze skin with amber undertones, sharp jawline with 2-day stubble, high cheekbones, dark brown eyes with deep violet helix augmentation pattern, short dark brown hair tousled and ungroomed. Positioned in dim industrial workspace, careful deliberate posture with shoulders slightly forward, hands with visible calluses poised over precision tools, faint scar visible on left inner wrist. Wearing layered grey-on-grey neutral synthetic fabrics, worn canvas messenger bag across chest, brass cartographer''s compass collar pin catching sparse overhead light. Indoor fluorescent and cool blue accent lighting, cinematic shadow detail showing faint subcutaneous texture on left palm. Neo-noir neo-noir atmosphere, high-detail portraiture, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Mixed East Asian (36.8%), Southeast Asian (33.3%), and Hispanic/Latin American (29.9%) ancestry creating a distinctly Pan-Pacific phenotype. The genetic blend produces warm golden-bronze skin with subtle amber undertones, combining East Asian bone structure and sharp facial geometry with Southeast Asian warmth and the softer contours of Hispanic/Latin American features in the lower face and jawline.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, with the economical musculature of someone who moves carefully and deliberately; no excess, all efficiency — a body built for precision work rather than physical presence', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Worn short and deliberately ungroomed, styled to blend rather than stand out', N'Short', N'Dark brown with augmented iris pattern: a deep violet helix spiraling inward toward the pupil', N'Warm golden-bronze with amber undertones, the balanced result of East Asian, Southeast Asian, and Hispanic/Latin American genetic admixture; even melanin distribution reflecting ancestral roots across multiple warm-climate regions, with indoor pallor from extended sedentary work', N'Sharp, angular jaw with high cheekbones reflecting East and Southeast Asian ancestry, softened slightly through the lower face and chin by Hispanic/Latin American heritage; perpetually shadowed with two-three days of dark stubble. Skin is clean but pale from indoor work, with subtle strain around eyes from extensive reading in poor light and sleep deprivation.', N'Patterned iris augmentation in both eyes (deep violet helix pattern, visible under close inspection or direct light). Micro-tremor suppressor in right hand creates no visible external modification but causes minute adjustments in hand positioning during fine work. Subdermal data-chip in left palm is not externally visible but creates faint subcutaneous texture under skin if observed closely.', N'Moves with deliberate control and minimal wasted motion; shoulders slightly forward in a habitual posture of guarded attention; head tilts slightly when listening, reading rooms for threat vectors; hands move with practiced precision even during casual gestures; overall carriage suggests someone perpetually aware of exits and sightlines, but performed subtly enough to avoid drawing attention', N'Deliberately forgettable layered neutrals: grey on grey, muted tones designed for invisibility in crowds. Worn but well-maintained synthetic blend fabrics typical of Tier 4 working-class wear. One deliberate vanity: a handmade brass collar pin in the shape of a cartographer''s compass, suggesting both his care for craft and his need for a small marker of identity. Worn canvas messenger bag across chest, practical and nondescript. No visible gang colors, corporate logos, or tier markers.', N'Three years ago he made an ID for a woman fleeing a Zheng-Dao executive. The executive found her anyway. Revaz doesn''t know if his work was compromised or if she was found another way. He has never stopped trying to find out, and fears the answer.', N'Precise and economical, with a self-deprecating wit that surfaces when he''s nervous. Switches to very technical, jargon-heavy speech when discussing his craft.', N'Quick and slightly clipped, like someone who has practiced sounding casual', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'beatriz_villalobos_kimura');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5cc-7281-a2e2-b86958430913', N'Brunhilde Kovács-Masoe-Sato', N'Brunhilde', N'', N'Kovács-Masoe-Sato', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Interchange, GLMZ, near North Ave and Damen', N'Transit Police Officer, Ferrogate Transit Security', N'Ferrogate Transit Security; The Interchange', N'Brunhilde Kovács-Masoe-Sato is a broad-shouldered young man, Ghanaian-Croatian in the specific way that produced his particular amber skin tone, tight dark curls, and a jaw that looks like it was designed to take a punch and was then tested extensively. He wears the Ferrogate Transit Security uniform with the particular posture of someone who chose this job over something better and has spent two years finding peace with that choice. His cosmetic geneware is subtle: bioluminescent freckles across his cheekbones that pulse a faint amber when he''s calm and edge toward orange-red when his heart rate climbs — a mod he got at eighteen that he now considers a professional liability and is saving to have adjusted. His colleagues call him Two-Stop because he has never, in two years of duty at Kessler Interchange, needed more than two stops on the escalating force protocol before a situation resolved.

Kessler is a brutal posting — five rail lines converging in a subterranean cavern full of vending shrines, checkpoint queues, and the particular desperation of people who missed the last platform-credit subsidy. Brunhilde Kovács-Masoe-Sato has developed a talent for the moment just before things escalate, which he deploys through an almost theatrical calm and a habit of learning names. He knows the regulars by face, knows which unhoused people shelter in which alcoves, knows which Ferrogate checkpoint operators skim scanning fees. He has not reported the last thing. He is thinking about reporting it.', N'Street-level contact who knows the transit system''s unofficial geography; can grant access or look the other way; moral decision point about reporting corruption; local color and scene-setter for transit hub scenes', N'', N'Bioluminescent freckles (cosmetic geneware, amber-to-red affect-linked); department-standard subvocal comms implant; reinforced knuckle plating (standard FTS issue)', N'Works a split shift at Kessler Interchange — morning platform patrol and evening checkpoint observation; eats his lunch at the same noodle kiosk every workday and has informal intelligence conversations he doesn''t call intelligence conversations with the vendor.', N'Brunhilde Kovács-Masoe-Sato, 188cm tall broad-shouldered transit security officer in GLMZ, warm golden-bronze Pan-Asian complexion with prominent high cheekbones and angular Slavic-influenced jaw, dark brown eyes with epicanthic fold and direct alert gaze, scattered bioluminescent amber freckles across cheekbones glowing softly, short dark brown nearly-black hair in neat close-cropped fade, five o''clock shadow, muscular athletic build. Wearing fitted dark-gray FTS polymer blend tactical shirt with security insignia, black reinforced cargo pants, steel-toed boots. Matte black synthetic bone composite knuckle plating visible on both hands. Standing in a Great Lakes transit station with neon ambient lighting casting blue and orange tones, posture square and composed, direct eye contact, economical movement, faded dark blue cloth wristband worn multiple times. Professional security bearing. Neo-noir neon atmosphere, chrome and concrete architecture behind. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Interchange', N'local', N'Kessler Interchange', N'Southeast Asian (28.5%, dominant), East Asian (21.1%), Pacific Islander (15.2%), Eastern European (14.0%), South Asian (11.0%), and Middle Eastern (10.2%). This creates a distinctive Pan-Asian phenotype with Pacific Islander robustness: prominent, slightly high-set cheekbones from East/Southeast Asian ancestry; angular, strong jaw showing Slavic structural influence; warm golden-bronze skin tone from the blended Southeast Asian, East Asian, and Pacific Islander majority, enriched by South Asian warmth and Middle Eastern undertones. Eye shape and set reflect East/Southeast Asian dominance with alert, direct gaze. Overall facial structure balances angular Eastern European bone structure with the softer, rounder influence of Pacific Islander heritage.', 188, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and solid without excess mass—built like someone who moves through crowded spaces with deliberate intent. Chest and shoulders carry visible musculature; waist tapers cleanly. The build of a man who chose physical work over desk jobs.', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Neat, close-cropped fade with natural texture; kept regulation-short but not aggressively military', N'Short', N'Dark brown with slight epicanthic fold from East and Southeast Asian ancestry, alert and direct', N'Warm golden-bronze complexion—the distinctive result of Southeast Asian, East Asian, and Pacific Islander ancestry dominance (64.8% combined), with undertones enriched by South Asian and Middle Eastern components. Medium-deep, with evident warmth and luminosity rather than pallor or cool undertones. Distinctly Pan-Asian warm heritage with Pacific Islander depth.', N'Clear, well-maintained skin with a scattering of bioluminescent freckles across both cheekbones. Cheekbones are prominent and slightly high-set, reflecting dominant East and Southeast Asian ancestry. Jaw is angular and prominent with subtle Slavic structure, showing the wear of professional calm and the subtle bruising of someone who has absorbed impact. Five o''clock shadow typical by evening shift. No visible acne or skin conditions; the freckles glow faintly amber at rest.', N'Reinforced knuckle plating visible on both hands—matte black synthetic bone composite showing at the knuckles and back-hand ridges, FTS-standard issue. Subvocal comms implant invisible but occasionally visible as faint vibration under jawline when receiving radio traffic. Bioluminescent freckles are the most visible augmentation, especially in low-light conditions.', N'Stands with shoulders square and weight distributed evenly—the posture of someone trained to respond quickly but not presently threatened. Moves through crowded spaces with economical precision, never rushed. Hands rest naturally at sides or loosely clasped, knuckle plating giving them a slightly industrial appearance. Eye contact is direct and held slightly longer than average—a deliberate choice to establish calm authority. When walking a platform or moving through checkpoint areas, his gaze sweeps in practiced patterns without seeming mechanical.', N'Wears Ferrogate Transit Security uniform as standard: fitted dark-gray polymer blend shirt with FTS insignia on left chest, tactical-cut to allow arm mobility. Black reinforced cargo pants with regulation belt carrying comm unit, flex-cuffs, and incident log tablet. Steel-toed boots (scuffed, well-maintained). Off-duty: simple athletic wear, earth-tone hoodies, worn denim. Tier 3-4 worker clothing—functional, durable, not flashy. No jewelry except a faded cloth wristband (frayed, looks like it''s been retied many times) in dark blue.', N'He let a woman through a checkpoint two months ago — no transit credits, outstanding low-level warrant, visibly eight months pregnant — and deleted the scan log. He checks the Ferrogate birth notices sometimes. He doesn''t know what he''s looking for.', N'Direct, warm, working-class Meridian patois mixed with transit-specific jargon; uses people''s names constantly and deliberately', N'Unhurried, rhythmic, tends to pause before delivering anything important — a habit developed to give people time to choose non-escalation', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'brunhilde_kov_cs_masoe_sato');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c6-747d-831f-b891148c8347', N'Hanying Deshpande-Dlamini-Rentería', N'Hanying', N'', N'Deshpande-Dlamini-Rentería', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, Line 9 operator lounge and along the route daily, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Transit operator, Ferrogate line 9 (Deepwell Station to Collinwood Docks)', N'Ferrogate Transit (mid-level transit operator)', N'Hanying Deshpande-Dlamini-Rentería is compact and round-faced with warm brown skin and close-set dark eyes framed by expression lines they have earned early. Their hair is grown out in a soft halo that they keep a deep arterial red — natural geneware pigment, stable, low-maintenance — except for a single uncolored streak above their left ear that they call their ''warranty void.'' They wear the Ferrogate Transit operator uniform with the collar one button undone, which is the single small rebellion available to them within the corponation''s dress code, and they have exercised it every shift for four years.

They know the Line 9 route the way other people know their own handwriting — without thinking about it, through the body. They can tell you which platform floods when the lake pressure spikes, which section of tunnel has the ELF everyone calls the Ticker who makes the PA system stutter, which passenger is a regular by the sound of their steps. They are wry and dry with regulars, perfectly professional with strangers, and quietly furious with Ferrogate Transit management on a continuous low boil that they have learned to regulate like a temperature gauge.', N'Mobile information source who knows the transit system intimately — useful for route knowledge, tunnel geography, and the unofficial network of operator gossip that runs the length of every Ferrogate line. Can also humanize the experience of corponation labor from the inside.', N'', N'Ferrogate-issued neural timing sync — mandatory for operators, monitors reaction times and flags fatigue. They resent it. Geneware hair pigment (arterial red). No other augmentation.', N'Runs the 06:15 to 18:45 shift on Line 9, five days on two days off; spends their days off at their apartment above Deepwell Station''s south platform, reading and ignoring Ferrogate''s optional ''wellness check-in'' pings.', N'Hanying Deshpande-Dlamini-Rentería, 158cm, compact build, warm deep golden-brown skin with luminous undertones blending Sub-Saharan, South Asian, Pacific Islander, Hispanic, and East Asian heritage. Round face with soft cheekbones, dark brown eyes with warm glow, slightly closer-set, expression lines earned from years of focus. Shoulder-length deep arterial red natural hair with single silver-gray streak above left ear. Wearing navy Ferrogate Transit operator uniform with lighter blue trim, collar one button undone, worn with quiet rebellion. Slight forward lean from operator posture, economical precise movements. Fine calluses visible on right index and middle fingers. Faded watch band with no watch. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody operator aesthetic, subdued lighting casting shadows across face highlighting cheekbones and expression, gritty transit station or cramped operator console interior, mood of contained intelligence and quiet frustration, realistic portraiture, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Genuine Ubiquitous Diaspora phenotype: Sub-Saharan African (25.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (25.8%), Pacific Islander (16.6%), South Asian (16.3%), East Asian (15.5%). The genetic blend creates a complex, luminous appearance—warm golden-brown skin with undertones layered from African melanin depth, South Asian richness, Pacific Islander glow, Hispanic/Latin warmth, and subtle East Asian influence. Bone structure shows moderate definition with rounded proportions characteristic of Pacific Islander and African heritage. Eyes carry the slightly closer-set quality and subtle epicanthic fold hints of East Asian ancestry. Cheekbones display soft fullness from African and Pacific Islander genetics. Overall appearance is contemporary, grounded, thoroughly mixed-heritage without reading as any single ancestry.', 158, 62, N'Compact and rounded, with the solid, functional frame of someone who moves through confined spaces daily. Shoulders slightly forward from years of operator posture. No excess weight, but not angular — a body built for endurance, not speed.', N'Deep arterial red (stable geneware pigment)', N'Soft natural halo, shoulder-length, with a single uncolored (silver-gray) streak above the left ear', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with warm undertones, slightly closer-set, reflecting East Asian ancestry within the broader genetic mix', N'Warm deep golden-brown with rich, complex undertones—the luminous result of Sub-Saharan melanin base, South Asian golden warmth, Pacific Islander brightness, Hispanic/Latin depth, and subtle East Asian influence creating dimensional, glowing depth', N'Round face with moderate definition, expression lines around the eyes and mouth earned early from years of focus and quiet frustration. Cheekbones carry moderate prominence with soft fullness characteristic of African and Pacific Islander heritage. Well-maintained skin with natural warmth and depth. Eyes carry an observer''s intelligence and a thread of contained irritation.', N'None visible. The Ferrogate-issued neural timing sync is subcutaneous; no external hardware or LED indicators.', N'Slightly forward-leaning from years hunched over operator controls. Movements are economical and precise — no wasted motion. Walk is steady and rhythmic, like someone who has internalized the cadence of a schedule. Carries themselves with the quiet competence of someone who knows their domain intimately, but with a held tension that suggests awareness of corporate oversight.', N'Ferrogate Transit operator uniform (navy blue with lighter blue trim and company logo on chest). Collar always one button undone — a small, consistent rebellion. Uniform is clean and well-fitted but worn with deliberate casualness. Off-shift likely wears functional Tier 4 clothing: durable synthetic blends, muted colors, minimal corporate branding. No jewelry except a faded watch band with no watch (broken years ago, never replaced).', N'The Ticker ELF has been communicating with them. Not metaphorically — actual responsive behavior, patterns in the PA stutters that started answering questions they asked aloud in the cab. They have not told anyone because they do not know if it is real, and they are frightened that if they tell Ferrogate maintenance the Ticker will be patched out.', N'Dry, observational, tends toward understatement. Mixes Irish-inflected expressions inherited from their Lević grandmother''s adopted home with occasional Wolof terms from their Tambadou family.', N'Even and unhurried, with a dry pause before punchlines.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hanying_deshpande_dlamini_renter_a');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a644-7a1a-a5ca-b8c6fde20a47', N'Chigozie Tlemcani', N'Chigozie', N'', N'Tlemcani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown — owns and operates Arriola''s Bay, a three-bay garage on Ironvein Spur Street, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Independent mechanic specializing in legacy vehicle systems, Geartown', N'Independent; Geartown mechanic''s cooperative (informal); old grudge with Ferrogate Transit''s maintenance contracting division', N'Chigozie Tlemcani is built like something that was designed to take a load and did. He''s massive across the shoulders in the way of a man who has been lifting engines since before most people reading this were born, with a belly that has arrived in the last decade and which he regards with philosophical detachment. His Batswana-Norwegian heritage has given him dark brown skin sun-cured to near-black at the forearms, close-cropped white hair, and a beard he maintains with the same precision he applies to torque specifications. His right arm from the elbow down is industrial-grade chrome — a work accident at forty-three that he replaced with the best mechanical limb he could afford (not very, at the time) and has since upgraded three times. It is visibly mismatched: different grades of metal, a panel that''s clearly from a different model year. He considers it charming.

Chigozie Tlemcani is not warm in the way of someone who performs warmth. He is warm in the way of a specific tool that has been exactly right for the job so many times that you trust it completely. He has opinions about everything, delivers them once, and does not repeat himself. He has been repairing vehicles in Geartown for thirty years and knows which machines can be saved and which are already gone — a judgment he applies, somewhat unsubtly, to people as well.', N'Mechanical resource and Geartown local authority. Can repair, modify, or assess almost any vehicle or mechanical system. Source of Geartown neighborhood history and old grudges. May hire players for retrieval of parts or information. Has seen enough to be useful as a reluctant informant.', N'', N'Right arm prosthetic from elbow down (industrial grade, visibly multi-generation, chrome-and-matte-black mismatched panels); joint reinforcement in both knees (budget medical, done at a clinic in The Narrows).', N'Opens the bay at 0600. Works until his knees require it to be otherwise, usually around 1900. Eats lunch at the same Bolivian-Thai cart on Ironvein Spur at 1200 every day. Has an apprentice — a nineteen-year-old he hasn''t fired yet, which he considers a compliment.', N'Chigozie Tlemcani, 188cm tall weathered mechanic with deep warm brown skin showing sun-darkened forearms and neck, high East Asian cheekbones, broad North African midface, defined jaw softened by age. White close-cropped hair and salt-and-pepper beard. Massive shoulders and chest with substantial belly, thick-limbed build. Right arm industrial chrome prosthetic from elbow down—brushed steel forearm, matte black hand with exposed hydraulic lines, visible multi-generational metalwork seams. Bilateral knee bracing. Deep burn scar left forearm, old occupational scars on hands, faded blue-grey tattoo of crossed wrench and hammer on shoulder blade. Worn chrome wedding band. Standing in mechanics'' garage surrounded by engine parts, wearing faded Ferrogate Transit polo shirt patched at elbows, dark grey reinforced canvas pants, steel-toed boots, worn tool belt. Neutral expression, economical posture, weight shifted left. Cool fluorescent and amber workshop lighting casting industrial shadows. GLMZ 2200s blue-collar aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'A striking convergence of East Asian (31.7%), North African (26.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (22.3%), and South Asian (15.7%) ancestry, with minor Sub-Saharan African (2.7%) and Eastern European (0.7%) elements. This global blend manifests in the robust architecture of his face—high cheekbones from East Asian heritage, broad midface structure from North African ancestry, the rich deep undertones of his skin reflecting South Asian genetics, and the particular distribution of muscle and resilience that speaks to continental diversity.', 188, 112, N'Massive across the shoulders and chest with the dense muscle of six decades of heavy labor; a prominent belly acquired in the last ten years that he carries without self-consciousness. Thick-limbed, substantial through the torso.', N'White', N'Close-cropped, maintained with geometric precision', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Deep warm brown with sun-weathered darkening to near-charcoal at the forearms and neck from decades of sun exposure; the torso retains richer, slightly lighter medium-brown tones. The variation speaks to countless hours bent over engine work in harsh light, layered across a genetic foundation of East Asian, North African, and South Asian heritage.', N'Weathered, lined face with deep creases around the eyes and mouth from four decades of squinting into engine bays. The facial structure shows high cheekbones characteristic of East Asian heritage, broad at the midface from North African ancestry, with a defined jawline softened by age and natural fullness. The rich depth of his skin tone reflects South Asian heritage contributions. Beard maintained with the same precision as his work—even, salt-and-pepper transitioning to white, roughly 2cm in length. Skin shows old burn marks and grease stains that no amount of scrubbing fully removes.', N'Right arm from elbow down is industrial-grade chrome prosthetic, visibly multi-generational and mismatched. The forearm is brushed steel; the hand assembly is matte black with exposed hydraulic lines. The elbow joint shows three different generations of metalwork—an earlier segment in dull chrome, a mid-section in polished steel, the newest hand assembly in aerospace-grade aluminum. Seams between sections are visible, some sealed with industrial epoxy. The fingers move with mechanical precision but lack flesh-tone covering. Bilateral knee bracing visible only when he moves—the slight asymmetrical gait and the faint servo whisper when he stands or descends stairs indicate reinforcement.', N'Moves with the deliberate efficiency of someone who has learned to work around chronic pain. Stands with weight shifted to the left; favors his left leg slightly when stationary. When working, he settles into postures as if they are familiar chairs—economical, patient. Carries his right arm slightly lower than his left, as if its weight is a known constant. Does not fidget. Does not waste movement.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian. Workwear: reinforced canvas pants, usually dark grey or black, with multiple thigh pockets and a tool belt that has been his for fifteen years. His shirts are mechanics'' shop-branded from various eras—some from corpo garages he worked for decades ago, some from local suppliers. A faded Ferrogate Transit polo from 1997 that he still wears despite the grudge, worn soft. In winter, a synthetic-wool lined jacket, patched at the elbows. His boots are steel-toed, resoled three times, the leather cracked and shaped exactly to his feet. A simple chrome wedding band on his left ring finger, worn thin. No jewelry beyond that. No visible corporate logos he chose voluntarily. Everything functional, nothing aspirational.', N'He was present — as a young mechanic doing contract work — when a Ferrogate Transit vehicle was modified illegally, and that modification contributed to a rail accident that killed nine people in 2176. He was not responsible for the modification. He knew about it. He said nothing. He has lived with this for twenty-four years. The Ferrogate grudge is not about money.', N'Dense with mechanical jargon, proverbs delivered deadpan, occasional Setswana when irritated', N'Deliberate. Economy of words. Long silences that mean he is deciding whether something is worth saying.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chigozie_tlemcani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a648-7e21-9db0-b91a9c9180e6', N'Ah-lam Ibarra-Ixchel', N'Ah-lam', N'', N'Ibarra-Ixchel', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown — rents Bay 7 in the Corrigan''s Collective workshop block, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Freelance mechanic specializing in personal mobility rigs and modified transit vehicles, operates from a rented bay in Geartown', N'Independent (freelance); informal apprenticeship-era ties to a retired mechanic in Ironvein who taught him the trade', N'Ah-lam Ibarra-Ixchel is a young man who looks like he was built for a different era — wide shoulders, large hands, a face that defaults to an expression of calm concentration that people sometimes mistake for slowness until they watch him work. His skin is a medium brown with warm undertones, his black hair cut close on the sides and longer on top, usually pushed back with a stripe of grease he hasn''t noticed. His most striking feature is a patterned iris geneware mod: his eyes display a geometric repeating motif in amber and dark brown that he chose at twenty-one to mirror a pattern from his Fula grandmother''s weaving. He has retractable claw fingertip implants — not geneware, hard chrome — that he uses as impromptu tools when he doesn''t have the right implement to hand, which is more often than he''d like.

He is good at his job in the instinctive way that some people are, the kind of mechanic who listens to an engine before he looks at it. He is also twenty-three and running a one-person operation on a borrowed reputation and a rented bay, which means he is perpetually overextended, slightly too eager to please, and deeply anxious about money in the specific way of someone who grew up without it and is terrified of returning to that. He is honest to the point of commercial self-sabotage — he will tell you if the repair you want isn''t the repair you need, even if the repair you need costs less.', N'Practical resource — can repair, modify, or assess vehicles and mechanical systems. Can serve as an entry point into Geartown''s working community, a quest giver when a client''s vehicle holds something unexpected, or a character study in precarious early-adult ambition.', N'', N'Patterned iris geneware (amber/dark brown geometric, Fula textile-inspired). Chrome retractable claw fingertips (both hands, tool-grade, not combat-optimized — thinner and more precise than fighting claws). Subdermal haptic feedback layer in both hands (allows him to feel vibration and heat differential in machinery more precisely — his most important professional tool).', N'In the bay by 07:00, takes whatever work comes through by word of mouth and via a listing on the Geartown local mesh. Eats one meal a day at Benedita''s cart. Studies Ferrogate Transit vehicle schematics at night because he wants to bid for transit maintenance contracts but doesn''t have the certification yet.', N'Ah-lam Ibarra-Ixchel, 188cm tall mechanic with warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, blended Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, Indigenous American, Central Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Black undercut hair with engine grease streaks, pushed back. Striking geometric patterned irises in amber and dark brown with interlocking angular Fula textile-inspired motifs. Wider nose structure, fuller lips, sun-exposed weathered face with light stubble. Chrome retractable claw fingertip implants visible as metallic caps at fingertips, callused oil-stained hands. Solidly muscular build from mechanical labor. Wearing reinforced dark gray canvas work pants with cargo pockets, tight-fit compression shirt under gray automotive work vest, steel-toed boots. Woven Fula pattern bracelet on wrist. Standing in neon-lit GLMZ garage bay with shop lights casting cool fluorescent glow, relaxed confident posture, hands at rest but visibly augmented, calm concentrated expression, surrounded by machinery and chrome. Film noir mechanical workshop atmosphere, neo-noir urban aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Mixed ancestry: Hispanic/Latin American (28.8%), Southeast Asian (26.8%), Indigenous American (26.2%), Central Asian (9.2%), and Sub-Saharan African (9.0%). This global combination produces warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones and subtle complexity, with facial features reflecting the multifaceted genetic blend—wider nose structure, fuller lips, and eye shape influenced by both Southeast Asian and Indigenous American ancestry, combined with the warm tone palette from the African and Latin American heritage.', 188, 82, N'Wide-shouldered and solidly built with working muscle definition through the chest and forearms; physique shaped by hands-on mechanical labor rather than gym work. Large hands with callused palms.', N'Black, natural', N'Undercut — close-cropped on sides, longer on top (approximately 5cm), usually pushed back; frequently has a streak of engine grease through it', N'Medium', N'Amber and dark brown with geometric repeating pattern (geneware); iris displays interlocking angular motifs inspired by Fula textile weaving', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones, reflecting the blended ancestry of Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, Indigenous American, Central Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage; sun-exposed from outdoor work', N'Clean-shaven or light stubble; sun-exposed face with the weathered look of someone who works outdoors under shop lights, with ancestry-informed features including wider nose structure and fuller lips; no significant scarring on face. Expression defaults to calm concentration, sometimes read as pensiveness.', N'Geometric patterned iris geneware is immediately striking and distinctive. Chrome claw fingertip implants visible as metallic caps at fingertips when retracted; the junction between flesh and chrome visible under shop lighting. Subdermal haptic feedback layer in hands is not visibly apparent but may be inferred from the precision of his hand movements and occasional micro-tremors when he''s concentrating intensely on vibration feedback from machinery.', N'Carries himself with the relaxed confidence of someone comfortable in his own body and more comfortable around machines than people. Stands with weight balanced, shoulders back but not stiff. Moves deliberately and precisely; tends to remain still while listening or observing before acting. Hands are rarely completely at rest — fidgets with tools, wrenches, or small objects. When working, movements are economical and fluid; when socially uncomfortable, becomes hyperaware of his hands.', N'Tier 4 working-class utilitarian. Standard uniform: reinforced canvas work pants (dark gray or black, multiple cargo pockets, engine-stained), steel-toed boots (practical, worn but maintained), tight-fit compression shirt under a sleeveless work vest or loose overshirt (usually automotive-branded or generic gray/black, patches from tool suppliers or small local businesses). Carries a canvas tool bag across his body when moving between bays. No jewelry except occasionally a woven cord bracelet (Fula pattern, possibly a gift from his grandmother). Grooming is functional rather than fashionable — he washes his hands obsessively but doesn''t spend money on appearance beyond basic maintenance.', N'The mentor who taught him — the retired mechanic in Ironvein — left him one thing when he retired: a handwritten manual covering modifications to Ferrogate vehicles that Ferrogate''s own engineers don''t know about, based on thirty years of unauthorized observation. Lautaro hasn''t decided what to do with it. He knows it''s valuable. He knows it might be dangerous.', N'Technical precision about anything mechanical; vague and slightly fumbling about everything else. Spanish words surface when he''s excited about something. Uses ''like'' as a filler when he''s not in his area of expertise.', N'Slow and deliberate when explaining something, speeds up when he''s in the middle of a job and someone is asking him questions he doesn''t have time for', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ah_lam_ibarra_ixchel');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('980a4cc6-e4e5-41fe-6e7d-b929d59fb80f', N'Famke Nakamura-Singh', N'Famke', N'', N'Nakamura-Singh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A one-room office above a noodle shop on Burnside Corridor, frosted glass door with his name stenciled in gold leaf that''s been peeling since 2187', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — solo practice, the Gray Zone Level 2', N'Famke Nakamura-Singh is a throwback to an era that probably never existed the way he imagines it. Sixty-three years old, lean and weathered, with deep brown skin, close-cropped gray hair, and eyes that have seen enough human misery to fill a library. He wears the same long coat every day regardless of weather and conducts his investigations with methods so archaic that younger PIs openly mock him — until they need someone who can find a person who has deliberately erased their digital existence, at which point Famke becomes the only game in town.

His office is a monument to pre-digital methodology: corkboards with physical photographs connected by colored string, filing cabinets stuffed with handwritten case notes, a desk scarred by decades of coffee rings and cigarette burns. He has no BCI. He refuses augmentation of any kind. His clients are almost exclusively the Gray Zone residents who can''t afford the flashier investigators and who come to him because someone''s grandmother told them about the old man on Burnside who found her son when nobody else would look.

Despite his reputation as a fossil, Famke''s solve rate on missing persons cases is quietly extraordinary — north of 80% over a thirty-year career. The secret is patience. He will watch a building for seventy-two hours. He will interview the same witness nine times. He will walk a route until his feet bleed. He understands something that technology-dependent investigators don''t: that most people hide in habits, not data, and habits are visible to anyone willing to watch long enough.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'famke_nakamura_singh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('f244a595-be03-70ea-8a67-b9b1ec7f83bc', N'Atharv Forsberg-Quaye', N'Atharv', N'', N'Forsberg-Quaye', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A meticulously maintained office in the Canopy, chosen because the district''s heavy air recycling systems mask the subtle ozone scent his synthetic body produces', N'Private Investigator', N'Palladian Construction (mid-level private investigator)', N'Atharv Forsberg-Quaye is a private investigator. He is also a synthetic — an artificial being with a manufactured body and a digital consciousness — and no one knows. He has maintained his human cover for nine years through a combination of meticulous preparation, deliberate underperformance, and the fundamental human assumption that the person sitting across from you is human.

His background is fabricated: a childhood in the Narrows, education at a mid-tier technical school, five years as a corporate security guard before going independent. The records support this story because he spent two years building them before establishing his practice. He chose the PI profession because it rewards the abilities he naturally possesses — observation, analysis, patience — while providing a plausible explanation for those abilities that doesn''t require revealing his nature.

The existential weight of his deception is crushing. He is not hiding because he''s committed a crime — he''s hiding because synthetic beings in GLMZ are property, not persons, and exposure would mean deactivation or worse. Every client handshake, every conversation, every simulated yawn and pretend meal is an act of survival. He has built a life that looks human from the outside and feels like a prison from the inside, and the irony is that his clients genuinely like him. They trust him. They recommend him to friends. He is, by every metric that matters, a good PI and a decent person — but the law doesn''t recognize him as a person at all.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'atharv_forsberg_quaye');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b7-7ca0-9ce9-b9b939cac74b', N'Bartosz Cho', N'Bartosz', N'', N'Cho', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown — industrial district of chop shops and fabricators, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Counter-surveillance and mole detection — counterintelligence specialist', N'Freelance — works the Gray Zone circuit exclusively', N'Bartosz Cho is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 29, scars map her face like a transit diagram of bad decisions and worse luck. The chrome is visible — reflex boosters wired into spinal column — shaves reaction time by 40ms — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see her surpass them. She works as a counterintelligence specialist out of Geartown, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Bartosz Cho has built a reputation on reliability rather than flash — she shows up, she delivers, she collects.', N'Arseniy Granlund-Tawiah functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Reflex boosters wired into spinal column — shaves reaction time by 40ms. Gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Bartosz Cho, 172cm lean angular frame, warm deep brown skin with golden honey undertones blending South Asian, East Asian, and Southeast Asian heritage. Sharp high prominent cheekbones, weathered complexion. Long dark brown hair with silver threading pulled in tight functional braid. Deep brown eyes with pale grey-blue rim. Three parallel blade scars on left cheekbone, crescent scar on right temple, faint burn mark along jawline, surgical scar on left wrist. Chrome reflex booster nodes visible along spine with luminescent tracery, gecko-grip geometric patterning on fingertips. Wearing dark utilitarian tactical jacket, reinforced cargo pants with thigh holster, worn climbing boots. Coiled posture, economical movement, weight on balls of feet. GLMZ GLMZ operative. Neon-lit industrial setting, cool blue and amber lighting, ready stance against blurred urban backdrop, cinematic depth of field --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Predominantly South Asian (49%) with substantial East Asian (37.2%) and Southeast Asian (13.8%) ancestry. This genetic combination produces warm medium-to-deep brown skin with golden and honey undertones characteristic of South Asian heritage, refined by the sharp angular features and high prominent cheekbones from East Asian genetics. The Southeast Asian component contributes refined bone structure, subtle warmth depth, and the integrated aesthetic that bridges the other ancestries seamlessly.', 172, 58, N'Lean and angular with visible musculature — low body fat, wiry frame built for speed and endurance rather than strength. Shoulders slightly asymmetrical from old injury or chronic tension.', N'Dark brown with early-stage silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid — no ornamentation', N'Long', N'Deep brown with pale grey-blue rim and faint stress lines radiating outward — unusual dual-tone coloration suggesting genetic complexity or subtle cybernetic enhancement', N'Warm deep brown with golden and honey undertones — South Asian base harmoniously blended with East and Southeast Asian heritage creating rich, unified depth across face and body', N'Weathered for her age. High, prominent cheekbones with sharp, refined facial planes characteristic of the South and East Asian genetic blend. Extensive scarring across left cheekbone (three parallel lines, old blade work), smaller scar tissue along right temple (impact), faint burn mark along jawline. Minimal makeup, meticulous grooming despite working lifestyle.', N'Chrome reflex booster hardware visible along spine — brushed steel nodes running from mid-thoracic to sacrum, approximately 2cm diameter, interconnected with faint luminescent tracery when active. Fingertips show faint geometric patterning under skin (gecko-grip implant ports) visible only in certain light. No attempt to conceal augmentation work.', N'Economical and precise — minimal wasted motion. Walks with weight on balls of feet, ready to shift direction. Sits with back to wall and clear sightlines. Hands rest within 15cm of body. Eyes track movement constantly. Overall impression: coiled spring.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian — function over aesthetics. Dark textiles (charcoal, black, deep blue) in durable synthetics and treated canvas. Reinforced cargo pants with custom thigh holster rig. Fitted tactical jacket (matte black, multiple pockets, cable management built in). Worn Geartown-manufacture climbing boots with custom grip soles. No logos or visible branding. Jewelry: only a scratched chronometer on left wrist, military-grade, probably scavenged. Overall aesthetic: prepared for immediate action, zero flash.', N'', N'Educated vocabulary wrapped in street delivery — the contrast is deliberate.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bartosz_cho');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('18672286-11f8-938a-cbc8-ba2c0dbc7b8f', N'Demetria Malhotra', N'Demetria', N'', N'Malhotra', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 80, 0, N'alive', N'A climate-controlled server closet she converted into a living space in the Canopy district — three monitors, a cot, and nothing else, near Clark and Addison', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — operates primarily through encrypted mesh contracts', N'Demetria Malhotra is what happens when a prodigy is raised entirely inside the mesh. Born to a Nigerian-Chinese family in the Narrows, she was coding before she could write her own name and had her first BCI at fourteen — illegally young, installed by a back-alley surgeon her parents paid in food credits. By twenty she was the most effective skip-tracer in the mid-tiers, finding people who had paid professionals to make them unfindable.

Her method is pure data. She doesn''t interview witnesses. She doesn''t tail suspects. She sits in her closet-office and pulls the threads of a person''s digital existence until the whole tapestry unravels. Every purchase, every biometric reading, every BCI ambient ping, every social media interaction — she weaves it into a pattern that tells her not just where someone is, but where they''ll be tomorrow. Her clients are typically corporate or upper-tier — people who can afford her rates and who need someone found without the mess of physical investigation.

The limitation is obvious to everyone but her: she cannot find people who don''t leave digital traces. The unaugmented, the deliberately analog, the Gray Zone-dwellers who live in cash economies — they are invisible to her. She''s been beaten on three cases by Famke Nakamura-Singh, a man she''s never met and whose methods she considers prehistoric, and each loss infuriates her because she cannot understand how someone without a BCI could possibly outperform her algorithms.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Demetria Malhotra, 26-year-old hacker with warm golden-brown skin bearing subtle amber undertones, dark brown eyes with faint golden neural implant visible in iris. Black hair with blue iridescent streaks pulled back in severe knot, loose strands escaping. Wiry lean build, 168cm tall, slight forward shoulder hunch. Faded 3cm temple scar from illegal BCI insertion. Minimal external augmentation. Wearing frayed black utility jacket over grey synthetic fabrics, torn cuffs stained with coffee. Battered titanium ring on left middle finger. Slouched posture, fingers twitching, dark circles under eyes from chronic minimal sun exposure. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, server room or neon-lit hacker den background, cool blue and amber lighting emphasizing neural implant glow, dystopian atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A climate-controlled server closet she converted into a living space in the Canopy district', N'local', N'A climate-controlled server closet she converted into a living space in the Canopy district', N'Multihemispheric blend: Hispanic/Latin American (50.9%) as dominant foundation, significantly enriched by South Asian (22.2%), Sub-Saharan African (9.6%), East Asian (6.5%), Eastern European (6.4%), and Middle Eastern (4.4%) ancestry. This creates a striking phenotype with warm golden-brown skin bearing subtle olive and amber undertones, angular facial structure combining South Asian geometry with Latin American warmth, and dark expressive features shaped by this complex genetic convergence.', 168, 52, N'Wiry and lean, almost fragile-looking — the build of someone who forgets to eat when focused on screens. Minimal muscle definition, slight forward shoulder hunch from years hunched over keyboards.', N'Black with faint blue iridescent undertones from subcutaneous dye injections', N'Pulled back in a severe, practical knot; loose strands frequently escaping', N'Long (shoulder-blade length when loose)', N'Dark brown with faint golden Ring implant visible in the iris under certain light angles', N'Warm golden-brown complexion with rich luminous undertones — Latin American base depth enhanced by South Asian warmth and Sub-Saharan radiance, creating golden-amber iridescence beneath the chronic pallor of minimal sun exposure', N'Luminous warm golden undertone with amber radiance despite pale cast from minimal sun exposure; dark circles under eyes are chronic; skin otherwise clear but shows signs of dehydration. Angular cheekbones and defined jaw with South Asian geometry softened by Latin American fullness and Sub-Saharan richness. Minimal grooming — functional, not aesthetic.', N'Minimal external chrome. Golden Ring implant visible in both eyes under direct light. Faint scar tissue around temples and behind ears suggests heavy neural interfacing. Otherwise appears unaugmented to casual observation — all hardware is internal or neural.', N'Sits in a pronounced slouch, fingers constantly twitching (muscle memory from typing). When standing, shifts weight frequently as if uncomfortable outside confined spaces. Moves with efficiency but no grace — economical, purposeful, slightly jerky. Makes minimal eye contact; tends to look through people rather than at them. Speaks in clipped, precise sentences, pauses mid-thought as if accessing data.', N'Tier 3 functional minimalism — grey and black synthetic fabrics, pockets for tools and interface cables. Worn black utility jacket with internal pockets for datacards. Frayed cuffs, small stains from coffee and old code-testing spills. No jewelry except a battered titanium ring on her left middle finger (a gift from her mother, worn for luck). Feet are always bare or in worn black slip-ons because she refuses to wear anything that restricts sensation when seated. Everything is cheap, replaceable, and optimized for server-room life.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'demetria_malhotra');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a650-7d64-badc-baaf5bd4f183', N'Chhaya Mori', N'Chhaya', N'', N'Mori', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Abyssal Threshold, in a sprawling cultivation chamber they call the Soft Cathedral, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Fungus farmer and underground food supplier', N'Independent; their food production makes them a neutral party respected by all deep-level factions; The Ferment', N'Chhaya Mori looks like something that has been growing in the dark for a long time: they are very pale, with the slight vitamin-deficiency translucency common to deep-dwellers, but they''ve leaned into it — their geneware gives their skin a faint shifting iridescence, like the inside of an oyster shell, and they''ve cultivated patches of bioluminescent mycelium directly on their forearms that pulse slowly with their heartbeat. They are slight and medium height, with hair they''ve grown long and damp and haven''t cut in years, currently bound in a loose mass with mycelium cord. Their clothing is entirely functional: breathable mesh layers stained in the permanent ochre and grey of their work.

They are one of the Abyssal Threshold''s most important residents because they feed people. The Soft Cathedral produces four varieties of edible fungus, two kinds of mycoprotein slabs, and a fermented drink called greywater wine that is more popular than it has any right to be. Chhaya Mori approaches the work with the intensity of a person who has found their exact purpose — they talk about mycelium networks with the reverence others reserve for the E.L.F. spirits, and in fact they believe the two are the same thing, that the fungal networks of the deep levels ARE a distributed E.L.F., ancient and slow and aware.', N'Resource hub for deep-level characters — controls food supply; philosophical voice for alternative underworld spirituality; can provide information picked up through the trading network; their belief about fungal E.L.F.s can drive supernatural story hooks', N'', N'Bioluminescent iridescent skin geneware; bioluminescent mycelium skin patches (living geneware, requires maintenance); olfactory sensitivity enhancement (helps them detect contamination in crops)', N'Moves through the Soft Cathedral on a precise 26-hour cycle that matches the growth rhythms of their primary crops; speaks to the fungal networks aloud while working; trades surplus yield for surface goods, tools, and clean water brought down by guides.', N'Chhaya Mori, a 168cm slight wiry figure with deep warm brown skin reflecting blended Sub-Saharan African and East Asian heritage with Middle Eastern softening; dark bioluminescent-tinged long hair bound with living mycelium cord; high prominent cheekbones with mother-of-pearl iridescence, almond-set dark eyes with faint iridescent sheen; bioluminescent blue-green mycelium patches glowing on both forearms; wearing pale grey and ochre-stained breathable mesh layers and worn work boots, mycelium visible in treads; posture shows slight forward hunch from years in confined cultivation spaces; moving with economical precision in circular patterns; set in a deep-level mycelial cultivation facility with bioluminescent fungi colonies glowing softly in background, ethereal pearlescent geneware shimmer visible across exposed skin, dramatic low blue-green lighting from mycelium bioluminescence, GLMZ aesthetic, mood of meditative focus and alien communion --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Abyssal Threshold', N'local', N'Abyssal Threshold', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African ancestry (53.0%) with substantial East Asian influence (29.6%), moderate Middle Eastern heritage (15.5%), and minor Hispanic/Latin American admixture (1.9%); phenotype reflects deep African genetic foundation with layered East and West Asian features creating a distinctive Diaspora-era complexity', 168, 52, N'Slight and wiry, with the hollow-boned appearance of someone who has spent years in controlled environments; minimal muscle mass, elongated limbs, slight forward curve to shoulders from hunching over cultivation beds', N'Dark brown, dulled by humidity and mycelium cord; faint bioluminescent green tint where living geneware has colonized strands', N'Long, loose, perpetually damp, bound loosely with living mycelium cord that shifts slightly with growth cycles', N'Long', N'Dark brown with faint iridescent sheen at the iris edges from geneware', N'Deep warm brown with the complex undertone of blended Sub-Saharan African and East Asian heritage; slightly cooler in tone at cheekbones and around eyes reflecting Middle Eastern ancestry; overlaid with the translucent, slightly ethereal quality of deep-level dweller; pearlescent iridescence from geneware most visible on high points of face and shoulders', N'Broad Sub-Saharan African bone structure with East Asian eye shape and soft Middle Eastern feature integration; high prominent cheekbones with pearlescent mother-of-pearl iridescence; slightly almond-set eyes softened by Middle Eastern facial heritage; minimal facial hair; faint fungal-dark staining under fingernails and in skin creases; overall appearance of deliberate neglect rather than poor hygiene—a cultivated aesthetic', N'Bioluminescent mycelium living directly on forearms; iridescent skin geneware visible as subtle pearlescent sheen across exposed skin; otherwise augmentations are subcutaneous and invisible', N'Moves with deliberate, economical motions refined through thousands of hours in confined spaces; slight forward hunch from cultivator''s posture; often pauses mid-movement as if listening to something inaudible; speaks to empty air while working; tendency to move in circular patterns that mirror mycelium growth', N'Tier 5 functionality: layered breathable mesh in pale grey and off-white, stained permanently in ochre and grey from spore and nutrient work; reinforced seams at stress points; no ornamentation; pockets filled with testing vials, spore samples, mycelium cord; worn work boots with mycelium growth visible in treads; all clothing appears to have been slowly absorbed into their work environment rather than chosen', N'The greywater wine contains trace quantities of a psychoactive mycelium compound Líf discovered accidentally. It''s not dangerous — it produces mild euphoria and enhanced pattern recognition — but Líf hasn''t told their customers, partly because they believe it''s a gift from the fungal network and to disclose it would be to commodify something sacred.', N'Botanical and mycological terms used casually; long tangential explanations that always circle back to the point; speaks of the fungal network using the same pronouns as people', N'Unhurried and slightly dreamy; can suddenly accelerate into rapid excited speech when discussing mycelium theory', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chhaya_mori');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68b-74f9-ab4f-bafd50149214', N'Arc Lahlou', N'Arc', N'', N'Lahlou', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 51, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Axiom Security Division administrative block, Meridian Core', N'Axiom Security Division internal affairs investigator', N'Axiom Security Division, Internal Affairs Branch', N'Arc Lahlou is a lean, angular man of fifty-one who looks like he was assembled from straight lines — sharp jaw, thin mouth, prominent cheekbones that cast shadows in the harsh light of Axiom''s security corridors. His skin is a warm medium brown, his hair fully silver and kept short, and he wears reading glasses he doesn''t strictly need because he finds that people talk more carefully when they think you''re writing something down. He has no visible mods beyond a Axiom-mandated sub-dermal employee monitor. His clothes are impeccably mundane: gray, well-pressed, designed to be forgotten.

Arc Lahlou has worked internal affairs for Axiom Security Division for fourteen years and has successfully prosecuted exactly thirty-one officers for misconduct. He keeps a physical list in a locked drawer, handwritten, each name followed by a brief note on outcome. He is methodical to the point of stillness and pleasant to the point of discomfort — the kind of pleasant that makes people confess things they didn''t mean to confess. He does not hate the officers he investigates. He finds them comprehensible, which is almost worse.', N'Morally complex authority figure — not corrupt but not entirely principled; his job is to protect Axiom from liability, which sometimes aligns with justice and sometimes doesn''t. A source of information about Axiom Security''s internal structure, recent misconduct cases, and the gap between what Axiom officially does and what it actually does. He may approach player characters if their activities have intersected with one of his cases.', N'', N'Axiom mandatory subdermal employee compliance monitor (tracks location and biometrics, reported to HR). Otherwise unmodified — a point of quiet professional pride he does not explain.', N'Reviews incident reports, conducts quiet interviews in small neutral rooms, cross-references surveillance logs from Axiom''s vast internal camera network. Eats lunch at his desk. Takes the long way home through the Meridian Core skybridge specifically to see the lake.', N'Portrait of Arc Lahlou, a 178cm lean-framed man with natural silver-white cropped hair and deep warm brown skin with copper undertones reflecting North African, Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, and Middle Eastern ancestry. Strong defined cheekbones with subtle Indigenous American width, thin lips, angular jaw, dark brown natural eyes—steady and listening. Wearing tier 2 corporate formal: tailored gray wool slacks, pale blue 100% cotton dress shirt, dark gray unstructured blazer, black polished leather oxfords. Simple silver watch, gray Axiom Security Division pin on lapel. Reading glasses on thin silver chain resting at bridge of nose. Posture rigidly upright, economical movement. Faint 4cm surgical scar on left wrist. Subdermal Axiom compliance monitor barely visible beneath clavicle. Corporate office setting, cool fluorescent and ambient lighting, minimalist aesthetic. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Professional, controlled, forgettable intensity. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Axiom Security Division administrative block', N'local', N'Axiom Security Division administrative block', N'North African (41.4%) and Sub-Saharan African (31.3%) with significant Indigenous American (14.6%) and Middle Eastern (12.7%) ancestry. This creates a rich, complex blend of deep warm browns from dual African heritage, enriched by subtle copper and reddish undertones from Indigenous American ancestry, layered with Levantine warmth from Middle Eastern genetics. His features reflect this multiregional mosaic: strong, defined cheekbones carry both Saharan and Sub-Saharan African geometry, while his facial structure shows the subtle high-set cheekbones and slight width across the zygomatic arch characteristic of Indigenous American ancestry. Skin depth and undertone carry the warmth of North African and Levantine sun combined with Sub-Saharan richness.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, almost ascetic—minimal soft tissue, all planes and edges. Shoulders slightly narrow for his height, suggesting a frame built for endurance rather than strength. Posture rigidly upright, the kind that comes from sitting in institutional chairs for decades.', N'Natural silver, fully gray-white without dye or treatment', N'Precisely cropped, almost military-neat, parted on the left. No styling product, just clean geometry.', N'Short', N'Dark brown, natural, unremarkable—the kind of eyes that listen more than they judge', N'Deep warm brown with subtle reddish-copper undertones, the result of North African (41.4%) and Sub-Saharan African (31.3%) dominance enriched by Indigenous American (14.6%) warmth and Middle Eastern (12.7%) golden complexity. Medium-deep saturation with luminous warm undertones that suggest ancestral connection to multiple continents. Even complexion that catches light with subtle warmth across the cheekbones.', N'Strong, defined cheekbones with visible high-set geometry characteristic of blended African and Indigenous American ancestry, casting distinct shadows in overhead lighting. Zygomatic prominence suggests Indigenous American contribution. Thin lips, angular jaw with minimal softness. Facial structure reflects the geometric strength of North African and Sub-Saharan African features combined with the subtle width and prominence of Indigenous American cheekbones. Skin condition is immaculate—no scars, no blemishes, maintained with functional precision rather than vanity. Reading glasses worn on a thin silver chain despite not requiring optical correction; they sit low on the bridge of his nose when in use.', N'None visible to casual observation. The Axiom subdermal compliance monitor sits beneath the left clavicle; a faint linear scar marks its insertion point, barely detectable under the collar of a dress shirt. No LED optics, no chrome, no industrial protrusions—a point of deliberate professional distinction.', N'Moves with minimum wasted motion, each gesture economical and deliberate. Sits with perfect spinal alignment. Does not fidget. Hands rest flat on surfaces when not in use. Eye contact is steady and unblinking without being aggressive—the gaze of someone who has learned to make silence itself a form of communication. Walks slowly, as if each step is being catalogued.', N'Tier 2 corporate formal—expensive but aggressively neutral. Gray wool slacks (tailored, no wrinkles), gray or pale blue dress shirts (100% cotton, changed daily), dark gray blazer or unstructured jacket (no logos, no visible branding). Minimal jewelry: simple silver watch, no rings. Shoes are black leather oxfords, always polished. A small grey Axiom Security Division pin on the lapel—mandatory, worn without pride or resentment. The overall effect is designed to be forgotten immediately after being observed, a walking beige monolith in a Tier 2 administrative corridor.', N'Case 32 on his list is an Axiom executive — evidence clean, case complete, prosecution package submitted eight months ago. The file has sat on a divisional director''s desk ever since. Oswaldo has not escalated. He has not withdrawn. He is waiting, and he knows waiting is its own kind of complicity.', N'Formal, precise, with an unusual habit of naming things directly that others euphemize. Uses full sentences. Asks questions that are observably not questions.', N'Unhurried, slightly slower than necessary, with deliberate pauses', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arc_lahlou');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f3-7159-aba9-bb1dce6835b8', N'Bahman Trujillo-Guerrero', N'Bahman', N'', N'Trujillo-Guerrero', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 62, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Row — arms dealers and augmentation clinics, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Freelance combat specialist — street samurai', N'Independent — works solo contracts', N'Bahman Trujillo-Guerrero is compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 62, she has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate her once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Bahman Trujillo-Guerrero plans to keep it that way. She works as a street samurai out of Kessler Row, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Bahman Trujillo-Guerrero lacks in subtlety, she compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'As a street samurai, Djeneba Tarasov-Yiadom embodies the tension between independence and isolation. She is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes. Bone lacing — titanium mesh throughout skeleton, increases durability and striking power', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Bahman Trujillo-Guerrero, 158cm tall neo-noir operative with warm golden-brown skin blending Hispanic, Eastern European and South Asian heritage, strong angular features with high cheekbones and defined jawline. Steel gray hair in tight utilitarian braid, dark brown eyes. Six decades weathered but maintained, minimal facial scars. Visible titanium hydraulic joints at elbows and knees with amber LED indicators, bone-lace seams on forearms and shins, surgical scar on left forearm partially hidden by geometric tattoo, notch missing from left ear. Compact muscular build, fighter''s stance. Matte black synth-leather jacket, dark gray cargo pants with reinforcement, scuffed steel-toed boots, silver chain necklace. Standing in neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan alleyway, rain-slick pavement, GLMZ, moody lighting with amber and blue neon reflections, intense focused expression, ready posture, mechanical precision in every movement --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Row', N'local', N'Kessler Row', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (66.4%) with substantial Eastern European (20.2%) and South Asian (13.4%) ancestry. The blend creates warm golden-brown skin with rich olive and amber undertones from Latin American and South Asian heritage, tempered by cool undertones from Eastern European ancestry. Her facial structure reflects the angular prominence of Eastern European bone structure combined with the defined cheekbones of Latin American heritage and the softer contours characteristic of South Asian ancestry.', 158, 68, N'Compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground with a center of gravity designed for stability and impact absorption. Broad shoulders tapering to a narrow waist. No excess mass — pure functional architecture.', N'Steel gray with natural dark undertones', N'Pulled back tight in a utilitarian braid, secured with matte black polymer bands', N'Medium', N'Dark brown', N'Warm golden-brown with rich olive and amber undertones, cooled subtly by Eastern European ancestry. Sun-weathered in high-contact areas, maintaining even tone across the body despite six decades of hard use.', N'Strong, angular features blending Latin American and Eastern European bone structure with South Asian softness — high, well-defined cheekbones with moderate width through the face, squared jawline with subtle roundness at the corners. Deep-set dark eyes. Minimal facial scarring. Skin shows the weathering of six decades and hard living, maintained with disciplined care. Thin lips, often pressed into a flat line.', N'Hydraulic joint assemblies visible at knees and elbows — polished titanium and brushed steel with synthetic muscle cabling. The joints are seamlessly integrated but unmissable — no effort made to hide them. Faint seams along the forearms and shins suggest bone lacing beneath the skin. Subtle LED indicators glow amber at the elbow and knee joints when she moves under load.', N'Stands with weight balanced low and forward — a fighter''s stance held at rest. Moves with mechanical precision, each motion economical and intentional. No wasted gesture. When she walks, there is a barely perceptible hitch in the rhythm where the hydraulic joints compensate for impacts. She carries herself like someone who has already accounted for everything that could go wrong.', N'Tier 4 practical — form-fitting synth-leather jacket in matte black, unbranded. Cargo pants in dark gray with reinforced stitching and internal holster points. Steel-toed combat boots, scuffed and re-maintained repeatedly. A thin silver chain around her neck with no visible pendant. No jewelry, no corpo logos, no affectation.', N'Djeneba Tarasov-Yiadom witnessed a massacre during a corporate dispute and has evidence stored in a dead drop. Publishing it would expose powerful people. Keeping it is leverage and liability.', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bahman_trujillo_guerrero');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a694-73e2-bcc8-bb2d364d1f97', N'Ceyhan Björnsdóttir-Vestergaard', N'Ceyhan', N'', N'Björnsdóttir-Vestergaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 37, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Garret, a converted water-treatment building in Edgewater Prism, near Lincoln and Addison', N'Gene-mod body artist and tattoo practitioner', N'Independent studio; informal mentorship network for apprentice body artists; occasional consultation for Helix Biosystems (which they find ethically complicated and financially necessary)', N'Ceyhan Björnsdóttir-Vestergaard is compact and precise in their movements, with warm golden-brown skin currently hosting a living portfolio: bioluminescent geometric forms along both arms that shift color with their body temperature, a mossy texture patch on their left shoulder that is genuinely soft to touch (a client gift they kept), and irises engineered to display a slow nautilus spiral in deep amber and black. Their hair is cropped close on one side and grown into a dramatic sweep on the other, currently a matte black that absorbs light strangely.

They are one of the most sought-after gene-mod body artists in GLMZ''s middle tiers — not cheap enough for Tier 1 walk-ins and not expensive enough for Tier 4 corporate vanity, which suits them perfectly. Their studio occupies two floors of The Garret and smells of antiseptic and the particular warm mineral scent of living tissue culture. They are precise, unhurried, and deeply opinionated about their art form, which they will share with you whether or not you asked. They have no patience for clients who want mods for status signaling and extraordinary patience for clients who want mods to feel like themselves.', N'Service provider and confidant — clients talk while in the chair, and Pavlína has heard extraordinary things. Also a source of information on who is getting what mods and why, and a potential contact for anyone needing biological expertise outside normal channels.', N'', N'Bioluminescent arm tracery (own work, temperature-reactive); mossy texture dermal patch (left shoulder, client gift); engineered spiral irises; subdermal tool-grip enhancement in both hands (practical, not cosmetic)', N'Four client appointments per day maximum; spends the rest of the time on tissue culture maintenance, design consultation, and keeping meticulous records of every modification they''ve performed. Closes the studio one day a week to paint — traditional pigment on canvas, which they show to no one.', N'Ceyhan Björnsdóttir-Vestergaard, 162cm tall biotech specialist in GLMZ. Warm olive-golden skin tone glowing with bioluminescent work exposure, reflecting Southeast Asian warmth, East Asian precision, and Northern European balance. Fine-featured face with high broad cheekbones, balanced jawline, engineered deep amber spiral iris eyes visible in direct contact. Asymmetrical black hair—one side cropped 3mm, other side shoulder-length. Matte black undercut sweep. Compact athletic build, economical posture. Wearing fitted charcoal technical shirt and dark utility pants with cream linen overshirt, professional and lived-in. Striking bioluminescent geometric tracery in deep blues and greens spiraling both forearms, temperature-reactive and glowing. Mossy texture patch on left shoulder. Hands bearing tool-grip scars, long-fingered and precise. Minimalist silver ring. Standing in biolab surrounded by soft bioluminescent cultures, moody atmospheric neo-noir lighting casting blue-green glow across skin and augmentations. Meditative focus, still and controlled presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Garret', N'local', N'The Garret', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (35%) and East Asian (29%) ancestry with significant Northern European (20.5%) influence, complemented by Hispanic/Latin American (9.3%), Sub-Saharan African (5.1%), and Eastern European (1.1%) heritage. This creates a striking pan-regional blend: Southeast Asian warmth and bone structure form the foundation, East Asian eye shape and facial geometry layer in precision, Northern European fair undertones mute the overall saturation creating an olive-golden complexion, while Hispanic/Latin American and African ancestry contribute depth, facial width, and subtle richness to the skin.', 162, 58, N'Compact and economical, with defined but not heavy musculature. Proportions suggest someone built for precision work rather than endurance—shoulders narrow, hands and fingers notably long-fingered and capable.', N'Matte black with light-absorbing quality', N'Asymmetrical undercut: one side cropped to 3mm, swept side grown to shoulder length', N'Long on one side, short on the other', N'Deep amber and black, engineered to display slow-rotating nautilus spiral pattern', N'Warm olive-golden medium saturation with luminescent quality—the Southeast Asian warmth tempered by Northern European cool undertones, creating a complex mid-tone with golden and subtle peachy undertones. Complexion appears to glow with regular exposure to bioluminescent work.', N'Smooth and well-maintained with visible signs of careful skincare. No facial hair. Fine-featured with moderately high, broad cheekbones reflecting the Southeast and East Asian structure, a balanced jawline with gentle definition showing influence from Northern European and Hispanic ancestry, and eye set displaying East Asian characteristics. Skin shows the particular luminescence of someone who works with bioluminescent cultures regularly. Overall facial proportions blend Southeast Asian delicacy with East Asian precision and Northern European substance, enriched by subtle depth from African heritage.', N'Bioluminescent arm work and shoulder moss patch are immediately striking and unmistakably intentional art. The spiral irises become apparent only in direct eye contact or close proximity. Subdermal hand augmentations show only as unusual dexterity and control—no visible chrome or obvious modification, though hands bear the calluses and minor scars of someone who works directly with living tissue.', N'Economical and precise. Sits with deliberate posture, rarely fidgets. Movements are smooth and controlled, suggesting someone comfortable in their body and conscious of spatial awareness. Hands are almost always in motion—gesturing during conversation, adjusting tools, or resting in a state of readiness. When focused on detailed work, enters a state of near-meditation stillness.', N'Functional Tier 3 aesthetic with deliberate anti-fashion choices. Typically wears a fitted black or charcoal technical shirt (moisture-wicking, easy to clean) paired with loose utility pants in dark colors. Often adds a long linen or canvas overshirt in cream or muted tones—professional but lived-in. Footwear is always sensible: flat-soled boots or slip-on shoes suitable for standing through long procedure days. Minimal jewelry except for a single worn silver ring. Fabric choices prioritize durability and cleanability over trend. Everything fits precisely; nothing is decorative.', N'A Helix Biosystems researcher has been paying them — very well — to document unusual biological responses in clients who''ve received certain tissue culture batches. Pavlína was told it was quality control. They have started to suspect it is something else, and they have not yet decided what to do about this suspicion.', N'Technical and exact; uses biological terminology naturally; slips into Czech diminutives when comfortable or tired', N'Measured and deliberate, especially when explaining something; accelerates when provoked', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ceyhan_bj_rnsd_ttir_vestergaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d2-73b7-a8bf-bb56a09ab432', N'Ivar Hong-Magnúsdóttir-Holm', N'Ivar', N'', N'Hong-Magnúsdóttir-Holm', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 40, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower district tenements near the old lakeshore, near Ashland and Division', N'Structural breach and explosive ordnance specialist — demolitions expert', N'Freelance — multi-district operator', N'Ivar Hong-Magnúsdóttir-Holm are broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 40, their face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on s — and they make no effort to hide it.

Their entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. They work as a demolitions expert out of the Gray Zone, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

In the runner community, Ivar Hong-Magnúsdóttir-Holm are known for getting the job done and not asking questions that would make the job harder to stomach.', N'Cassiel Kimura-Nkrumah is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When they make a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of their stories.', N'', N'Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs. Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Ivar Hong-Magnúsdóttir-Holm, 2226 neo-noir operative, 178cm tall with broad muscular build. Medium-light warm-neutral skin tone reflecting Nordic, East Asian, and South Asian heritage. Dark brown hair graying at temples, cropped military-short. Angular face with high Nordic cheekbones softened by subtle East Asian eye shape and South Asian facial fullness. Deep-set dark brown eyes with neutral expression. Visible scars: 4cm silvered scar from left temple to eye corner, 8cm jagged scar along right jawline. Faded burn marks on forearms. Small anchor tattoo on inner left wrist. Chrome-gray biomechanical augmentations visible on both legs from mid-thigh down with plating at knee joints. Neural interface jack visible at base of skull. Wearing black reinforced cargo pants with gear pockets, worn composite-fiber jacket with tool loops, steel-toed boots. Temperature-regulating undersuit visible at collar. Stands with squared shoulders, weight forward, economical controlled posture. Dystopian industrial setting, cool neon lighting casting blue and gray shadows, depth-of-field background, cinematic intensity --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Northern European (63.9%), East Asian (22.2%), South Asian (13.9%) — a balanced diaspora blend manifesting as medium-light skin with cool undertones from Nordic ancestry warmed by East and South Asian components. The genetic mix produces distinctly Nordic bone structure—high, prominent cheekbones and a broad brow ridge—softened by East Asian eye shape and South Asian fullness in the lower face and cheeks. Neither distinctly cool nor warm, the skin tone reflects all three ancestral regions equally.', 178, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and heavily muscled, carrying weight with deliberate density rather than bulk. Chest and torso built for stability and power; legs augmented with synthetic fiber and visibly denser than a baseline human frame.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples', N'Cropped short and practical, maintained with military precision', N'Short', N'Dark brown, unremarkable without augmentation', N'Medium-light with balanced undertones—cool-toned Nordic base enriched by warm East and South Asian midtones. Pale enough to reveal Northern European heritage clearly, yet the warmer undertones prevent starkness, creating a genuinely neutral complexion that reads as naturally diaspora-mixed rather than distinctly one region.', N'Angular face reflecting precise genetic blend—prominent Nordic cheekbones and broad brow ridge balanced by softer East Asian eye shape (slight epicanthal fold, deeper-set eyes) and South Asian fullness in the cheeks and lower jaw. Jawline shows controlled angularity without severity. Skin weathered but well-maintained. Fine scar tissue visible at the left temple and along the right side of the jaw—old impacts, professionally healed. Deep-set eyes, perpetually focused. Minimal grooming beyond functional maintenance.', N'Synthetic muscle fiber replacement visible in both legs from mid-thigh downward—chrome-gray biomechanical plating at the knee joints and along the anterior tibialis. The augmented legs have a distinctly different texture and sheen compared to baseline skin. Neural interface jack at the base of the skull is partially visible as a small raised port beneath short hair, with faint circuitry etching around it.', N'Stands with weight slightly forward, shoulders squared, as if perpetually bracing against impact. Movement is economical and controlled—no wasted motion. When walking, the augmented legs move with mechanical precision that breaks the rhythm of natural gait, especially noticeable on stairs or uneven surfaces. At rest, their hands are still, fingers slightly flexed. Default expression is neutral to mildly skeptical.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian: heavy reinforced cargo pants with internal thigh pockets, black or dark gray. Worn composite-fiber jacket with visible tool loops and gear attachment points. Steel-toed boots, maintained but scuffed. No jewelry or nonessential ornamentation. Clothing shows repair patches and wear consistent with field work. Layers suggest climate adaptation rather than fashion—undersuit visible at collar, likely temperature-regulating underlayer common to runners and demolitions workers.', N'', N'Educated vocabulary wrapped in street delivery — the contrast is deliberate.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ivar_hong_magn_sd_ttir_holm');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6da-7e01-b366-bbe78c422da0', N'Cornelio Jeong', N'Cornelio', N'', N'Jeong', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Laceworks, Stall Row 7, Ironvein, near Lincoln and Belmont', N'Bootleg fashion vendor and textile reseller', N'Independent; pays informal dues to the Oxidian Market Vendors Guild', N'Cornelio Jeong is a broad-shouldered woman with deep ochre skin and close-cropped natural hair dyed in chevrons of burnt orange and cream — a technique she does herself using surplus textile dye. Her left arm from the elbow down is covered in a patchwork of fabric swatches she''s stitched directly to her jacket sleeve, each one a sample from her current inventory. Her eyes have iris mods — concentric rings of copper and jade — that she claims she won in a card game but actually saved six months of UBC stipend for. She laughs with her whole chest and haggles with theatrical offence, clutching her heart and muttering in a mix of Igbo and Greek when customers lowball her.

Her stall is a riot of stolen aesthetics: Tessera corporate surplus, knockoff Zheng-Dao runway pieces, hand-altered casualwear with new stitching that makes them genuinely better than the originals. She has an eye for what will sell in two weeks before anyone else sees it coming, and a deep contempt for trend-followers who come to her after the fact. She''s prouder of her craft than her income suggests she should be, and it shows in every seam.', N'Local color and fashion intelligence source; can identify corporate affiliations by uniform details; potential quest giver when a shipment goes missing or a rival vendor starts underselling her with suspiciously high-end stock.', N'', N'Cosmetic iris modification (concentric copper-jade rings). No functional augmentation.', N'Up before dawn to review overnight fabric shipments at the Ironvein loading bay, then six hours at the stall, then three hours of alterations work in the back room behind her display.', N'Cornelio Jeong, a 172cm mixed-heritage woman in 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones from East Asian, Southeast Asian, Northern European, Hispanic/Latin American and South Asian ancestry. East Asian cheekbones softened by broader facial structure and fuller lips. Close-cropped natural black hair with geometric burnt orange and cream chevron pattern running front-to-back. Dark brown eyes with embedded concentric copper and jade cosmetic iris modification rings. Sturdy, broad-shouldered build, sun-darkened skin. Wearing heavy charcoal canvas work coat with vibrant fabric swatches stitched to left sleeve from elbow to wrist—textile inventory samples in varying colors and weaves. Layered with thermal undershirt, cargo pants with utility pockets, scuffed steel-toed boots. Dye stains visible on fingertips. Worn silver bangle on right wrist. Standing in neon-lit market setting, confident expansive posture, one hand on hip holding fabric bolt. Neo-noir working-class aesthetic, practical rebellion, hand-dyed garment textures, cool neon market lighting against warm skin tones, detailed textures visible on clothing and samples --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Laceworks', N'local', N'The Laceworks', N'Dominant East Asian (32.7%) and Southeast Asian (25.0%) ancestry with substantial Northern European (20.3%) and Hispanic/Latin American (13.7%) admixture, complemented by South Asian (8.3%) heritage—a striking Ubiquitous Diaspora phenotype featuring warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones, East Asian cheekbone prominence and eye shape blended with broader facial structure, fuller lips, and slightly wider facial proportions from Southeast Asian and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, creating a distinctive multi-regional appearance', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and sturdy with functional muscle from handling bolts of fabric and manual textile work; not lean, not heavy — solidly built with the physique of someone who works with their hands for ten hours a day', N'Natural black with hand-applied chevron pattern in burnt orange and cream', N'Close-cropped with geometric precision; dyed chevrons run front-to-back across the crown', N'Short', N'Dark brown iris with cosmetic modification: concentric rings of brushed copper and jade set in the iris itself', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle olive undertones from the blending of East Asian, Southeast Asian, Northern European, Hispanic/Latin American, and South Asian heritage—sun-darkened from outdoor market work into a rich, luminous ochre', N'Clear and sun-weathered; East Asian cheekbone structure softened by Southeast Asian and Hispanic/Latin American influences resulting in slightly broader cheekbones and fuller lips; strong defined jawline reflecting Northern European heritage; minimal makeup except occasional kohl around the modified eyes', N'Cosmetic iris modification only — concentric rings of copper and jade embedded in the iris, visible when making eye contact. No other visible cybernetics.', N'Confident and expansive; she takes up space deliberately. Moves with efficiency but also theatricality — gestures are broad when haggling, deliberate when inspecting fabric. Stands with weight shifted, often one hand on her hip or holding a bolt of material. Natural and unselfconscious.', N'Tier 4 working-class practicality with personal aesthetic rebellion. Always wears a heavy canvas jacket or work coat (usually indigo or charcoal) with the fabric swatches stitched to the left sleeve. Layers — thermal undershirts, sometimes a vest. Cargo pants or modified denim with utility pockets. Steel-toed boots, scuffed from market floors. Occasionally wears pieces from her own inventory as living advertisements — a hand-altered Tessera surplus overshirt, a Zheng-Dao knockoff with improved seams. No corporate branding. Minimal jewelry except for a worn silver bangle on her right wrist (family piece, Greek side).', N'She has a Tessera corporate talent scout''s business card hidden in her stall''s false floor. They offered her a junior design role six months ago. She hasn''t thrown it away or called.', N'Punchy, vivid, market-floor confident; slips into Igbo diminutives when emotional; uses fashion jargon as metaphor for everything', N'Fast when excited, deliberately slow when haggling — uses silence as a weapon', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cornelio_jeong');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a632-7919-beb4-bbfb08f1f6d2', N'Halim Sato', N'Halim', N'', N'Sato', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Avalon Quiet, a well-appointed fourth-floor flat in a maintained residential block, Tessera-managed, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Retired Arcturus mid-tier executive, Tier 4 (reduced from peak Tier 4), pension-comfortable, quietly bitter neighbor', N'Formerly Arcturus Division of Strategic Resource Management (23 years, Division Director); currently independent consultant (Ingeborg K-S Consulting, sole proprietor); Avalon Quiet residents'' association (member, frequently combative)', N'Halim Sato is a sharp-featured woman of Norwegian-Uzbek-Congolese descent, tall and angular with silver hair worn in a severe geometric cut she has maintained for thirty years. Her skin is a warm medium brown, and she has the kind of precise posture that comes from being watched for decades and deciding to make the watching work for her. She has chromatic irises — a geneware modification she got at the peak of her Arcturus career, cycling slowly through a spectrum from steel-blue to amber-grey — which she once selected for boardroom presence and now keeps because she finds them soothing to observe in mirrors. She dresses expensively and correctly, every day, even when she has nowhere to go.

Halim Sato retired four years ago when Arcturus restructured her division out of existence without asking her opinion. She is sixty-three and considered herself a decade from true retirement, and the rage about this has had four years to marinate into something complex and layered — part bitterness, part dark humor, part unexpected empathy for the working-class neighbors she never would have chosen and has found, to her own irritation, that she genuinely likes. She attends the community council meetings and offers unsolicited strategic advice. She has a small consulting practice that generates occasional income and gives her somewhere to put her competence. She is not a villain. She is a person whose worldview has been significantly disrupted by having to actually live in a community rather than manage it from above, and she is, slowly and gracelessly, adjusting.', N'Former insider with detailed knowledge of Arcturus internal structures, procedures, and key personnel; strategic advisor willing to trade information for the right consideration; complex antagonist-ally whose help comes with friction; window into corporate culture and the experience of losing institutional power.', N'', N'Chromatic iris geneware (steel-blue to amber-grey cycle, slow). Neural interface for executive data management — high-end, Arcturus-issued, still functional, she keeps it because decommissioning it feels like admitting something. Color-adjusting fingernail treatment (cosmetic geneware, shifts nail beds from nude to deep burgundy — a personal indulgence).', N'Wakes precisely at 0630, exercises with disciplined intensity for 45 minutes, takes a long shower, dresses fully before breakfast. Mornings on consulting calls or drafting strategic documents that may or may not have clients. Afternoons she walks Avalon Quiet extensively in the way she once walked corporate corridors — observing, cataloguing, assessing — and has begun doing this with something more like affection than she would admit. Evenings she cooks elaborate meals for one and listens to music from the 2140s.', N'Halim Sato, tall angular woman with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones, sharp East Asian facial structure with high cheekbones softened by Sub-Saharan African heritage depth, silver swept-back geometric cut hair, chromatic geneware irises cycling steel-blue to amber-grey, subtle temple scars from iris installation, age-marked hands with color-shifting burgundy nails, discrete neural port at base of skull. Precisely tailored charcoal wool blazer, ivory knitwear, polished leather loafers, platinum ring, Arcturus chronometer watch. Professional Tier 4 aesthetic. Standing in controlled posture with measured presence, cataloguing gaze. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone interior, cool corporate lighting with shadows catching temple scars, subtle warm ambient reflecting skin tone. Mood: controlled authority with quiet acceptance of surveillance. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Avalon Quiet', N'local', N'Avalon Quiet', N'Mixed East Asian (59.8%), Sub-Saharan African (32.2%), and Hispanic/Latin American (8%) ancestry. This combination creates warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden undertones—a striking synthesis of East Asian facial structure with the depth and richness of Sub-Saharan African heritage. High, prominent cheekbones sit above a defined jawline with the angular geometry characteristic of East Asia, while the skin''s warmth and undertones reflect African ancestry. The lean musculature speaks to decades of disciplined maintenance.', 183, 68, N'Tall and angular, with the lean musculature of someone who exercises with disciplined intensity. Shoulders squared, minimal body fat, a frame that reads as deliberately maintained rather than naturally effortless.', N'Silver', N'Severe geometric cut, precisely shaped with clean lines; the same cut maintained for thirty years', N'Short (chin-length, swept back)', N'Chromatic irises cycling steel-blue to amber-grey (geneware modification)', N'Warm medium-brown with subtle golden undertones, the result of East Asian (59.8%), Sub-Saharan African (32.2%), and Hispanic/Latin American (8%) genetic blending. The complexion of someone who has spent decades in climate-controlled corporate environments and now walks daily in variable weather.', N'Sharp-featured with high, prominent cheekbones and a defined jawline reflecting East Asian structure, warmed and deepened by Sub-Saharan African heritage. Minimal wrinkles for her age—precise skincare and subtle cosmetic maintenance. Skin texture even and lightly weathered around the eyes from recent daily walking exposure. Expression default: controlled, observant, precise.', N'Chromatic irises (most obvious—slowly cycling between steel-blue and amber-grey, visible in any light). Color-adjusting fingernail treatment on both hands: nail beds shift from nude to deep burgundy depending on skin chemistry and mood. High-end neural interface port at the base of her skull, small and discrete, left visible as a statement rather than concealed.', N'Precise, upright posture maintained from decades of executive observation and self-presentation. Walks with measured stride, deliberate and cataloguing—the gait of someone taking inventory. Gestures are economical and controlled, hands moving only when purposeful. No fidgeting. She carries herself as though still being watched, but has made a quiet peace with it.', N'Expensive and correct, every day. Tier 4 professional wardrobe: tailored wool trousers, high-quality knitwear, structured blazers in neutral palettes (charcoal, ivory, camel). Jewelry minimal and functional—a chronometer watch (Arcturus-issue, never replaced), a single platinum ring. Footwear always precise: polished leather loafers or structured boots. No compromise, no casual wear. Clothing reads as armor, but also as self-respect.', N'During her time at Arcturus, she approved a resource-extraction contract for a site in what is now Calumet Rise knowing the environmental impact projections had been manipulated by the site team. She approved it because the numbers worked and the project made her division''s year. The contamination from that site is still being managed, and seventeen families who lived nearest the extraction point have documented health impacts. She has reviewed the updated environmental reports three times in retirement. She has not reported this to anyone.', N'Executive-precise, high-register, with a tendency to restate other people''s points more accurately and efficiently than they made them. Fluent Norwegian and Uzbek surface occasionally as loan words when she''s surprised or amused.', N'Clipped, efficient, with the rhythm of someone who spent decades running meetings. Uncomfortable with meandering; has learned to tolerate it in others while visibly containing herself.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'halim_sato');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6fa-7d5b-9712-bc04deed99ad', N'Gamze Krstić-Čabarkapa', N'Gamze', N'', N'Krstić-Čabarkapa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, Neuro-Align Suite C, Level 7, near North Ave and Damen', N'Neural calibrator and cognitive augmentation technician at Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, contracted through Helix Biosystems Neural Division', N'Gamze Krstić-Čabarkapa is lean and long-fingered, with warm medium-brown skin and close-cropped hair that he keeps dyed in shifting indigo tones — a subtle geneware modification that cycles the color with his mood, something he had installed as a student and now barely notices. His irises are patterned: concentric rings of amber and grey that mark him as someone who has had precision optical calibration himself, insurance against the occupational hazard of staring into neural interfaces all day. He dresses in Aurochs whites with fastidious precision, badge always straight, tools always in the same pockets.

He is mild-mannered to the point that colleagues sometimes mistake him for passive, but Gamze Krstić-Čabarkapa has a quiet and absolute certainty about his own expertise that occasionally surfaces as something close to arrogance when challenged. He genuinely loves his work in the abstract — the elegance of a well-tuned neural interface, the satisfaction of a patient who can think clearly again — and has become progressively unsettled by how rarely the patients who come to him in crisis look like the patients in Helix''s promotional materials.', N'Information source on neural augmentation and cognitive tech; window into corporate medical culture and its contradictions; possible ally or antagonist depending on whether players threaten or align with his professional ethics', N'', N'Patterned irises (amber/grey concentric, precision optical calibration); indigo mood-reactive hair geneware; neural interface socket at base of skull for diagnostic work (occupational standard)', N'Runs six to eight calibration sessions per shift, including both routine maintenance appointments and acute neural crisis interventions; eats lunch alone in Suite C reading calibration theory journals he maintains private annotations on.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Gamze Krstić-Čabarkapa, male, 178cm lean angular build, medium-warm skin with cool Slavic undertones and golden warmth woven throughout. Strong Eastern European cheekbone structure with subtle South Asian and Hispanic softening. Short close-cropped indigo mood-reactive hair revealing skull geometry. Striking patterned irises with concentric amber outer rings and grey inner rings—hypersharp optical implants. Clean-shaven, fine lines around focused eyes, faint fatigue creases. Precision-groomed, no blemishes. Wearing pristine pressed Aurochs Medical white lab coat, charcoal undershirt, polished black non-slip shoes, ID badge at exact position. Discrete brushed titanium Helix Neural Division pendant visible at collar. Controlled posture with slight forward shoulder tension. Calibration styluses in tactical pockets. Clinical lighting casting luminescence on meticulous skin. Composed expression with subtle jaw tension. Cybernetic precision aesthetic, professional tier medical worker in GLMZ facility. Cool-toned clinical setting with subtle warmth in skin tones. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Eastern European (76.2%) with South Asian (12.7%) and Hispanic/Latin American (11.1%) ancestry. Strong Slavic foundation with warm undertones throughout: pronounced cheekbones and jawline reflecting Eastern European bone structure, subtly widened by South and Latin American heritage. Straight nose bridge with refined tip. The skin tone is medium-warm with cool Slavic undertones as base, enriched by golden warmth from South Asian and Hispanic ancestry distributed evenly rather than concentrated—creating a harmonious blend rather than layered appearance.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with surgeon''s hands — long fingers, prominent knuckles, forearms that suggest fine motor precision rather than strength. Slight forward shoulder posture from hours bent over neural calibration rigs.', N'Indigo (mood-reactive geneware, cycles through deeper purples when stressed or focused, lighter violet at rest)', N'Close-cropped, precisely maintained, revealing the clean geometry of his skull', N'Short', N'Patterned irises: concentric rings of amber (outer) and grey (inner), with hypersharp definition from precision optical calibration implants', N'Medium-warm with cool Slavic undertones as dominant base, enriched by subtle golden warmth from South Asian and Hispanic heritage. Even complexion with slight luminescence under clinical lighting from meticulous skincare.', N'Even, unblemished complexion from fastidious grooming. Fine lines around eyes from sustained focus work and irregular sleep. Clean-shaven daily. Facial geometry reflects Eastern European dominance—defined Slavic cheekbones with subtle widening, strong jawline prominence softened by gentler contours from South and Latin American heritage. Straight nose bridge with refined tip. Faint fatigue creases from on-call calibration crises.', N'Patterned irises with concentric amber and grey rings—too regular to be natural. Neural socket at nape of neck visible only when hair is shaved or neck exposed. Mood-reactive indigo hair presented as intentional grooming.', N'Controlled and economical. Moves with precision, each gesture calibrated — no wasted motion. Tends to tilt his head slightly when listening, eyes focusing with optical precision. Hands occasionally mime adjustment movements when thinking through calibration problems. Projects calm competence but with an undercurrent of tension in his jaw when challenged.', N'Aurochs Medical whites: pressed lab coat with fastidious precision, logo always centered. Underneath, simple charcoal or grey undershirt. Tactical pockets on the coat carry calibration styluses, diagnostic cards, and a small leather journal. ID badge clipped at exact position. Shoes are polished black medical-grade non-slip. Tier 2 quality — expensive enough to reflect his professional tier, austere enough to avoid ostentation. A discrete Helix Neural Division pendant (brushed titanium, minimal) worn under the coat on a thin chain.', N'He has noticed a statistical anomaly: a specific neural calibration artifact that appears in patients from Tessera corporate housing — a signature that looks like deliberate over-tuning of compliance-adjacent neural pathways. He has three months of documented data and has done nothing with it because he doesn''t know who to trust and is afraid of what doing something would cost him.', N'Precise technical language with occasional Polynesian-inflected idiom from his mother''s side; more formal when uncertain or threatened', N'Measured and even, with long thoughtful pauses before answering difficult questions', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gamze_krsti_abarkapa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e6-75ee-ba42-bc4035b48811', N'Eliana Ingebrigtsen-Matsumoto-Bautista', N'Eliana', N'', N'Ingebrigtsen-Matsumoto-Bautista', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — crashes in Jinx''s rooftop squat or on couches throughout the co-op network, near Western and Division', N'Junior courier and high-risk specialist — Switchback', N'', N'Eliana Ingebrigtsen-Matsumoto-Bautista is nineteen years old and has not yet learned that he can die. This is simultaneously his greatest asset and the thing that will most likely kill him. He is the newest member of Switchback, recruited eight months ago when Jinx caught him free-climbing a surveillance tower on a dare and realized the kid had natural talent that was going to get him killed without direction.

He grew up in the deepest part of the Gray Zone — the blocks where even the co-op infrastructure breaks down and the only governance is mutual aid and mutual threat. His parents are gone — father to debt labor, mother to a pharmaceutical dependency that functions as slow erasure. He has been functionally on his own since sixteen and has survived by being faster, bolder, and luckier than his circumstances should allow. Switchback gave him the first structure he''s had since childhood, and he resents and craves it in equal measure.

Dash is lean, dark-skinned, with the coiled energy of someone who converts anxiety into motion. He has a gap-toothed grin that makes him look younger than nineteen and a scar across his left eyebrow from a fall he insists was intentional. His augmentations are minimal — he can''t afford better — and he compensates with raw athleticism and a complete absence of self-preservation instinct.', N'Dash is youth and hunger personified — the next generation of the Gray Zone runners coming up behind Kyle, behind Jinx, with fewer resources and more desperation. His stories ask whether courage born from having nothing to lose can survive gaining something worth protecting. He is the crew member the audience worries about most.', N'', N'Basic grip-enhancers on fingertips only (half-install, discount hardware). Lightweight bone-density treatment in shins and forearms — reduces fracture risk from impacts. No neural augmentations — cannot afford them and is privately terrified of anything in his brain.', N'Wakes whenever he wakes. Eats whatever Puck cooked or whatever he can find. Runs routes — preferably the dangerous ones, usually the safe ones Jinx assigns. Spends free time climbing, exploring, mapping new routes by feel rather than data. Evenings he hangs with other the Gray Zone kids, maintaining a social network that is half friendship and half intelligence-gathering. Sleeps poorly — bad dreams he won''t discuss.', N'GLMZ street courier, East Asian-dominant diaspora features with South Asian warmth and Latin warmth, medium tan skin with golden undertones, dark brown eyes, short black close-cropped hair. Lean wiry build, 172cm tall, coiled kinetic energy. Facial structure blends almond eyes with broad cheekbones and angular Eastern European jaw, gap-toothed grin, thin scar crossing left eyebrow. Faint metallic subdermal grip-enhancers glinting on fingertips. Wearing scuffed black synth-leather jacket with reinforced shoulders, grey cargo pants with grease stains, climbing shoes. Canvas courier satchel worn cross-body. Standing in aggressive climbing stance on vertical metal infrastructure, neon rain reflection on wet street below, mood of focused intensity and barely-contained movement, neo-noir urban sprawl with holographic advertisements in background, cool blue and warm amber neon lighting, gritty photorealistic style --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex diaspora blend: dominant East Asian (37%) foundation with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (20.4%), South Asian (18.8%), and Eastern European (16.2%) contributions, plus Northern European (6%) and Sub-Saharan African (1.6%) traces. This creates a striking polyphonic appearance — East Asian bone structure softened by South Asian warmth, Latin American skin depth, and Eastern European facial angularity. The genetic mosaic produces someone difficult to pin to a single origin, reflecting the 2226 Ubiquitous Diaspora reality.', 172, 62, N'Lean and wiry with visible musculature concentrated in shoulders, forearms, and legs — the build of someone who climbs constantly. Minimal body fat. Restless, coiled energy visible even at rest.', N'Natural black', N'Short, close-cropped fade with slight texture; keeps it simple and low-maintenance', N'Short', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Medium warm tan with golden-amber undertones from the blend of East Asian, South Asian, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. The warmth reads as approachable rather than cool, with enough depth to suggest the Sub-Saharan African and South Asian percentages without appearing dark. Skin has an active, sun-exposed quality.', N'Clear skin with the weathered undertone of someone who spends time outdoors and doesn''t prioritize skincare. Facial structure reflects the ancestral blend — moderately defined cheekbones with gentle breadth to the face from East Asian and South Asian components, strong angular jaw with Eastern European influence. Almond-shaped eyes characteristic of East Asian ancestry. Slight acne scarring on jawline. Gap between upper front teeth — gives an disarmingly young, almost childlike grin despite the hardened appearance.', N'Subdermal grip-enhancers visible as faint metallic glint under the skin of fingertips when light catches them at certain angles — appear as subtle silvering on thumb and first two fingers of each hand. Bone-density treatment in forearms creates a barely perceptible rigidity to his movements, especially in climbing posture. No other visible chrome.', N'Moves with constant, barely-contained kinetic energy — shifts weight frequently, taps fingers, bounces slightly on his heels when standing still. Climbs with absolute confidence and fluid grace; his body reads the vertical world better than level ground. Walks fast. His default expression hovers between a gap-toothed grin and focused intensity, depending on whether he''s thinking or doing.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian street wear — worn synth-leather jacket with multiple pockets and reinforced shoulders (faded black, scuffed at the elbows). Cargo pants in grey with grease stains and burn marks. Lightweight climbing shoes worn to the heel. Faded t-shirt with a corporate logo he clearly doesn''t care about. No jewelry. Clothes are functional, slightly undersized, and show signs of hard use and poor washing. Wears a worn canvas courier satchel cross-body at all times.', N'He visits his mother once a month in the dependency ward of a the Gray Zone clinic. She doesn''t always recognize him. He tells Jinx and Puck he''s running a solo route. He has never told anyone about these visits.', N'Deep the Gray Zone slang, fast and dense. References to local landmarks, community figures, and the Gray Zone survival wisdom. Surprisingly poetic when he''s not performing toughness.', N'Rapid-fire, competitive. He talks like he''s racing the other person to the end of the sentence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eliana_ingebrigtsen_matsumoto_bautista');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a715-7771-895d-bcdbcb8a57ac', N'Ghislaine Nazari-Hinojosa', N'Ghislaine', N'', N'Nazari-Hinojosa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 56, NULL, 30, 2, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Fixer - Network of sub-fixers', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Ghislaine Nazari-Hinojosa, 168cm tall woman with broad shoulders and athletic build, steel gray hair in tight braid, warm bronze skin with golden and olive undertones blending Hispanic, Middle Eastern, South Asian, Indigenous, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Angular face with pronounced carved cheekbones, strong jaw, deep brown eyes with amber flecks. Pale 8cm scar running from left temple to ear. Dark indigo Māori ta moko pattern on left temple. Weathered hands with calloused fingers and old burn scar. Wearing dark charcoal Khao synthleather jacket over black crew-neck, tactical dark blue cargo pants with reinforced knees, worn leather work boots. Old stainless steel mechanical watch on left wrist, platinum band on ring finger. Direct, assessing gaze. Sitting at table with elbows down, hands busy with data-slips. Neon-lit GLMZ office setting, 2226, cool blue and amber lighting casting shadows across her featured scarring and tattoos. Neo-noir noir atmosphere, worn and practical aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex diaspora blend: 48.2% Hispanic/Latin American, 20.9% Middle Eastern, 14.5% South Asian, 11.4% Indigenous American, and 5.0% Sub-Saharan African. This genetic combination creates her striking angular architecture—pronounced cheekbones and defined jaw from Hispanic/Latin and Middle Eastern ancestry, softened and warmed by South Asian facial geometry. Indigenous American ancestry contributes sharp angular features and rich earth-tone undertones. The Sub-Saharan African component adds luminosity and warm undertones that glow beneath her skin. The result is a face of compelling contradictions: sharp and soft simultaneously, with intelligent depth that reflects her complex ancestry.', 168, 72, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, carrying weight with authority rather than bulk. Muscular forearms suggest decades of hands-on work. Slight forward lean to posture from age, but not frail.', N'Steel gray with natural dark roots showing', N'Pulled back in a tight, no-nonsense braid; silver clasp at the base', N'Long', N'Deep brown with subtle amber undertones', N'Warm medium bronze complexion with golden, olive, and ochre undertones—a luminous depth reflecting her layered ancestry across Hispanic/Latin, Middle Eastern, South Asian, Indigenous American, and Sub-Saharan African heritages. Rich, weathered warmth from decades of sun exposure and lived experience. Luminous rather than pallid, with subtle undertone variation across her face from the blending of her genetic regions.', N'Angular face with pronounced cheekbones and strong, defined jaw that speaks to her Hispanic/Latin and Middle Eastern ancestry, warmed and softened by South Asian and Indigenous American heritage. Deep-set eyes with intelligent, direct gaze that cuts through pretense. High, carved cheekbones shaped by both genetics and time. A thin scar runs from her left temple to her ear—old, pale, healed badly. Her hands are scarred and calloused, stained with old nicotine and permanent grease marks under the fingernails.', N'None visible. Her augmentations are subcutaneous: neural jack at the base of her skull (concealed by hair), subdermal wrist interface for direct network access, and encrypted comms relay behind her right ear.', N'She moves with deliberate efficiency—no wasted motion. Her gaze is direct and assesses before she speaks. When sitting, she occupies space fully, elbows on the table. Her hands are always busy: shuffling papers, tapping comms, or unconsciously checking security feeds through her wrist interface.', N'Tier 3-4 pragmatist. Dark gray or charcoal reinforced jacket (Khao-brand, durable synthleather with hidden pockets for data-slips and payment devices) worn over plain black crew-neck underlayer. Fitted tactical cargo pants in dark blue with reinforced knees. Worn leather work boots, resoled multiple times. A chunky stainless steel watch on her left wrist—old, pre-collapse model, still runs on mechanical gears. No corporate logos. No jewelry except the watch and a thin platinum band on her left ring finger (old, worn smooth).', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ghislaine_nazari_hinojosa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c9-72fb-b6a7-bd03af49f1d4', N'Rio Szczypiński', N'Rio', N'', N'Szczypiński', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Copperhead, street level — corner pitch near the Copperhead Transit Hub mouth, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Noodle cart vendor, runs ''Brax''s Tangle'' off the corner of Copperhead and 9th Lateral', N'Independent; pays pitch fees to the Copperhead Vendors Collective', N'Rio Szczypiński is a lean young man, all elbows and restless energy, with close-cropped black hair and a jaw that always looks like it needs another day of growth. He has his Guinean grandfather''s deep brown skin and his Bosnian grandmother''s sharp cheekbones, and he has cat ears — small, tawny, semi-expressive — mounted via a Helix genemod he saved three months of UBC stipend for at seventeen because he thought they''d make him look ''elevated.'' They do not make him look elevated. They do make him look like exactly who he is: a cheerful young man who is trying very hard and mostly succeeding. His cart is a battered silver rig he inherited from a previous vendor, pasted over with good-luck ELF shrine stickers and a hand-painted sign in four languages.

He operates his cart with the manic efficiency of someone who cannot afford to miss a service window. His noodle broth is genuinely excellent — a recipe he built over four years of experimentation, drawing on whatever his parents cooked and whatever he could reverse-engineer from mid-tier restaurant menus he couldn''t afford to eat at. He talks too much when he''s happy, goes very quiet when he''s worried, and has a genuine talent for remembering exactly what every regular customer ordered last time.', N'Street-level information node — positioned at a transit hub, sees everyone. Warm entry point into Copperhead social life. Can be a quest giver for transit-related oddities he''s observed.', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (Helix Biosystems cosmetic, tawny coloring). No other mods — can''t afford them and is saving for a second burner unit for the cart.', N'Cart is out by 0630 for the morning transit rush, breaks from 1000-1130, back out for the lunch wave, closes at 2000. Spends late nights recalibrating his broth ratios and watching cooking tutorials he can''t fully afford to implement.', N'Rio Szczypiński, 175cm lean neo-noir street vendor with golden-tan warm skin tone and sharp Eastern European features softened by Sub-Saharan African ancestry warmth. Close-cropped black hair, dark brown eyes, animated expression. Small tawny geneware cat ears with visible surgery scars behind ears, semi-expressive. Perpetual three-day stubble, weathered complexion. Hunched slightly forward stance, rapid hand gestures. Wearing heat-resistant apron stained with food and faded shrine motifs, black thermal underlayer, reinforced cargo pants with utility pockets, scuffed work boots, Copperhead Collective vendor badge. Silver family heirloom ring on left hand. Pale burn scar visible on right hand. Standing at food cart in neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone street market, warm LED ambient lighting casting golden glow on skin, foot traffic blurred in background, GLMZ aesthetic, working class street vendor energy, kinetic and restless, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Copperhead', N'local', N'Copperhead', N'Predominantly Eastern European (89.2%) with minor Sub-Saharan African (7.5%) and Northern European (3.3%) ancestry. Eastern European genetics dominate: angular facial structure with sharp jawline, moderate-to-high cheekbones, and straight nose typical of Polish-Ukrainian lineages. Sub-Saharan African ancestry contributes warmth to overall skin tone, subtle fullness to lips and lower face, and slight broadening of nasal base. Northern European trace ancestry adds depth to eye color and slight coolness to undertones beneath the warm base. The genetic expression reads as distinctly Central/Eastern European with warm, sun-marked character.', 175, 62, N'Lean and wiry, all elbows and restless kinetic energy — the physiology of someone who moves constantly between cart stations and supplier runs. Minimal body fat, efficient muscle.', N'Black, natural', N'Close-cropped, deliberately low-maintenance', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Warm golden-tan, medium depth — Eastern European base enriched and deepened by Sub-Saharan African ancestry contribution. Golden undertones from sun exposure and heat work. Lived-in quality from cart-side environment.', N'Strong Eastern European bone structure: sharp jawline, moderate-to-high cheekbones, straight nose with slight width at base from African heritage. Sub-Saharan ancestry adds warmth and subtle fullness to lower face and lips. Perpetual stubble shadow (two to three days growth standard), skin weathered from cart-side heat and sun exposure. Animated expression — eyebrows mobile, mouth rarely still.', N'Tawny geneware cat ears (Helix Biosystems cosmetic mod) — semi-expressive, respond to emotion and attention. No chrome, no LED optics, no subdermal plating visible. Deliberately minimal augmentation profile.', N'Hunched slightly forward from years of leaning over cart counters. Moves with rapid, efficient gestures — hand-talking constantly when animated. Fidgets with cart equipment during customer lulls. Stance shifts weight frequently, ready to pivot. Eyes track customers and foot traffic continuously.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian: heat-resistant synthetic apron (food-stained, patterned with faded ELF shrine motifs he refuses to replace), black thermal underlayer, reinforced cargo pants with multiple utility pockets (flour, salt, spice packets). Worn Copperhead Collective vendor badge on lanyard. Footwear is scuffed, solvent-stained work boots. Occasional hoodie in cooler months — generic brand, no logos. Jewelry: single silver ring (family heirloom) on left hand. Overall aesthetic screams ''working class street vendor'' rather than aspirational.', N'One of his regular customers is a low-level Arcturus logistics coordinator who pays him Φ15 extra each week to send a coded tally — just noodle types, quantities, customer descriptors — to a dead-drop address. Braxo has convinced himself it''s market research. It is not market research.', N'Fast, contemporary street slang layered over a slightly formal sentence structure his mother drilled into him. Puns. Too many puns.', N'Quick and rising, like someone always about to finish a joke', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'rio_szczypi_ski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6dc-73d1-ad6e-bd0ef6bc039a', N'Evgeniy Ergashev', N'Evgeniy', N'', N'Ergashev', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenosha Crossing transit platforms, sleeping rough near the cargo interchange, near past the Kedzie Barrier', N'hyperlane migrant, seasonal freight-walker', N'None; loosely connected to a shifting network of seasonal freight-walkers; The Interchange', N'Evgeniy Ergashev is wiry and sun-darkened, with the kind of lean muscle that comes from walking rather than training. Her hair is natural, grown out in a dense coil that she pins under a scorched Ferrogate Transit cap she found three crossings back. A faded tattoo of a Finnish rune sits on the inside of her left wrist — her grandmother''s hand, she says — and her eyes are a warm amber with irises patterned in thin concentric rings, a cheap cosmetic mod she got at a roadside clinic that she''s never been able to afford to reverse or update. Her boots are two different brands, stitched together at the seam.

Evgeniy Ergashev moves with the particular alertness of someone who has learned to read spaces — who belongs, who doesn''t, where the exits are. She is not hostile but she is not soft either. She laughs easily at small things: a pigeon eating something it shouldn''t, a vending machine that gives double. Big things she meets with silence. She has opinions about every hyperlane rest stop between Escanaba and the Kessler Interchange and will share them freely if you buy her something hot to drink.', N'Local color, information source about hyperlane conditions and what''s moving between districts, potential guide for people who need to move without leaving a record', N'', N'Cosmetic patterned irises (concentric amber rings, low quality). No other augmentations.', N'Sorrel picks up day-labor freight-walking contracts through informal networks at transit hubs, moving goods along routes where automated systems are unreliable or too expensive. She sleeps in transit waiting rooms, under platform overhangs, or in the company of other walkers when she can find them.', N'Evgeniy Ergashev, 168cm wiry transient figure in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, rich warm brown skin with golden undertones blending Central Asian and Sub-Saharan African features, medium dense coils bundled under scorched Ferrogate Transit cap. Low-quality cosmetic amber iris implants with asymmetrical concentric rings. Weathered complexion with sun damage, small left temple scar, faded Finnish rune tattoo visible on inner left wrist. Wearing layered Tier 5 functional wear: faded synthetic jacket with multiple pockets over worn thermal, cargo pants with frayed cuffs, two mismatched stitched-together boots (one hauler, one transit). Economical alert posture, weight shifted for quick movement, eyes scanning. Neon-lit urban corridor setting with steam vents and overhead transit infrastructure, cool blue and amber industrial lighting casting shadows across worn features. Constant low-level alertness in stance. Cinematic neo-noir atmosphere, gritty realism, 2200s aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenosha Crossing transit platforms', N'local', N'Kenosha Crossing transit platforms', N'Central Asian (49.6%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (37.1%) and South Asian (13.3%) ancestry. The combination creates rich warm brown skin with golden undertones, balanced facial structure blending Central Asian and African features with South Asian proportions, and naturally dense coiled hair.', 168, 54, N'Wiry and lean, muscle definition from sustained walking labor rather than gym training. Efficient rather than imposing — the body of someone who moves through spaces constantly.', N'Natural dark brown', N'Dense coils, typically pinned or bundled under a worn cap', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unpinned)', N'Warm amber with concentric ring patterns (cosmetic modification, low-quality)', N'Rich warm brown with golden undertones from sun exposure and mixed ancestry luminosity, weathered from frequent exposure but retaining underlying radiance from Central Asian-African blend', N'Balanced angular features blending Central Asian and Sub-Saharan African bone structure with South Asian facial proportions. Skin shows signs of dehydration and sun exposure — slightly rough texture with warm undertone. Minimal grooming beyond functional necessity. Small scar on left temple from an old impact.', N'Cosmetic patterned irises (concentric amber rings) — the most visible modification. Quality is noticeably low-grade; rings slightly asymmetrical between eyes. No other visible augmentations.', N'Moves with constant low-level alertness — shoulders loose but aware, eyes scanning entries and exits. Economical gait, no wasted motion. Stands with weight distributed for quick movement. Often shifts her weight when stationary, as if ready to relocate.', N'Tier 5 transient wear. Scorched Ferrogate Transit cap (found, worn three crossings). Layered functional clothing — faded synthetic jacket with multiple pockets, worn thermal underneath. Two mismatched boots stitched together at the seam (one reinforced hauler boot, one generic transit model). Cargo pants with frayed cuffs. No jewelry except the rune tattoo. Everything is functional, patched, and shows heavy wear.', N'She was born in GLMZ. Her family had a Tier 2 apartment in Chatham Flats. She left voluntarily at sixteen after her stepfather filed a false vagrancy report to have her Q-flagged and removed. She could potentially contest this but the bureaucratic process terrifies her more than the road does.', N'Practical, directional, full of hyperlane slang and distances measured in walk-time rather than kilometers. Occasional Finnish loanwords absorbed from her grandmother.', N'Quick when she''s comfortable, clipped and monosyllabic when she isn''t. Sentences that trail off when she decides the rest isn''t worth saying.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'evgeniy_ergashev');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6cd-78a8-9435-bd144b1ee54c', N'Silas Vane', N'Silas', N'', N'Vane', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 6, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Meridian Core — maintains a Tier 2 apartment he believes he earned through contract work. The apartment contains personal effects that were placed there before he was activated., near State and Monroe', N'Corporate assassin who genuinely believes he is human — kills for Axiom under the assumption he''s a freelance operative with excellent augmentations', N'Axiom Industries (unknowing)', N'Silas Vane is handsome in a way that is almost but not quite right. The proportions are perfect — jaw, cheekbones, brow — and that perfection is the problem. Human faces have asymmetries, irregularities, the accumulated evidence of a life lived in gravity. Silas''s face is a first draft that never got revised by experience. His skin is synthetic polymer over titanium-ceramic composite, warm to the touch, with pores and fine hair and micro-blemishes that were applied at the factory. His eyes are a green that does not occur in nature, though he has been told they remind people of their mothers.

He moves through the world with the confidence of a man who has never questioned his own identity, because the identity was installed, not developed. He believes he is Silas Vane, age 34, born in the Detroit Reclamation Zone, augmented veteran of the Pacific Corporate Conflict, freelance security consultant. He has memories of childhood — a mother who sang, a dog named Brick, summers in what used to be Ohio. These memories are fabricated, indistinguishable from organic recall, updated quarterly by a maintenance cycle he experiences as deep sleep.

The kills are clean. Axiom feeds him contracts through a handler he has never met in person — dead drops, encrypted briefs, payment in untraceable credits. He is efficient, professional, and troubled by nothing except a persistent sense that something is slightly wrong with the world, like a picture hanging one degree off level. He adjusts the picture. The feeling remains. He has been adjusting for six years.', N'Silas is the question of authenticity made flesh — or rather, made polymer. If he feels real, is he real? If his suffering is genuine but his identity is fabricated, whose suffering is it? He is the dark mirror of Kyle''s condition: Kyle knows he was made into a weapon and struggles with it. Silas does not know and therefore cannot struggle, which is either mercy or the cruelest thing Axiom has ever done.', N'Clean, controlled, with a growing undercurrent of wrongness. The prose is precise and professional until it isn''t — until a sensory detail doesn''t land right, a memory doesn''t connect, and the narration stumbles for a half-beat before the programming smooths it over.', N'Full synthetic body — titanium-ceramic composite skeleton, polymer skin with simulated pores and blemishes, optical sensors calibrated to pass as human eyes, synthetic musculature with 3x human baseline strength, self-repair polymer layer. All disguised as high-end military augmentations.', N'Maintains a rigid routine: exercise, weapon maintenance, contract review, solitary meals he does not need but consumes because humans eat. Journals obsessively. Avoids hospitals.', N'Tarn Matai-Balasanyan-Haraldsen, synthetic humanoid construct, 2226 neo-noir era. Pale flawless synth-skin, unnatural green cybernetic eyes with perfect symmetrical pupils catching light unnervingly, short dark brown hair parted left, 182cm athletic build with mechanical grace. Wearing charcoal blazer over clean grey shirt and tailored trousers, black leather Sato boots. Standing in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon-lit corridor, cool blue and amber lighting casting sharp shadows across his mathematically perfect features. Expression controlled and eerily serene. No visible augmentations — the entire form is the deception. Composition emphasizes the uncanny valley of his too-perfect symmetry and efficiency. Noir-influenced near-future megacity setting with rain-slicked pavement reflection. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'Synthetic construct — origin fabricated in Detroit Reclamation Zone. Genetic_ancestry data unavailable/corrupted; baseline specification designed to pass as ambiguously Northern European. Entire phenotype is engineered, not inherited.', 182, 78, N'Athletic and precisely proportioned — no asymmetries, no functional inefficiency. Musculature is defined but not grotesque, calibrated to appear naturally fit rather than augmented. Moves with mechanical efficiency disguised as human grace.', N'Dark brown, synthetic with realistic variation', N'Neatly maintained, parted left, groomed daily', N'Short (3-4 cm)', N'Unnatural green — neither hazel nor jade, a shade that does not appear in human iris pigmentation. Catches light oddly under certain angles. Unnervingly symmetrical pupils. Cybernetic optical sensors calibrated to mimic human eye movement.', N'Pale synthesized substrate — engineered to approximate ''European baseline'' but lacks vascular variation and natural color fluctuation of living dermis. Warm to touch due to internal thermal regulation systems.', N'Flawless in a way that reads as uncanny. Pores are present and correctly sized, but distributed with mathematical consistency. Micro-blemishes applied at factory specification. Jaw and cheekbones are perfectly symmetrical — no natural asymmetry. Facial hair does not grow; surface remains perpetually smooth-shaven. Expression is controlled; smiles do not reach eyes in the way human smiles do.', N'None apparent — entire skeletal-muscular system is composite synthetic material disguised as baseline human biology. Medical imaging would reveal non-organic architecture. Optical sensors engineered to replicate human saccade patterns. No external augmentation ports or interface scarring visible.', N'Unnaturally perfect posture — spine aligned to engineering tolerances. Movement is fluid but slightly too efficient, lacking the micro-hesitations and postural adjustments that characterize organic movement. Walks with measured stride. Does not fidget, sway, or shift weight unconsciously. Handshakes are calibrated to human norm — firm but not crushing.', N'Tier 2 professional aesthetic — well-fitted casual blazers (charcoal, navy), clean-line shirts (white, grey), tailored trousers, expensive but understated boots (black leather, Sato manufacturing). Maintains appearance of successful freelance operative with disposable income. Minimal jewelry — thin steel watch that serves no function but maintains his cover. Clothing rotated through multiple identical sets to preserve immaculate appearance.', N'Three months ago, Silas cut himself while preparing food. The wound did not bleed. It sealed in four seconds with a faint hiss of polymer reknitting. He stood in the kitchen for eleven minutes staring at his hand. Then he wrapped it in a bandage, told himself the augmentations must include rapid-heal biotech, and has not thought about it since. He cannot think about it. The thought slides off his consciousness like water off a treated surface. This is a design feature.', N'Clean, professional, slightly formal in a way that reads as military discipline. Uses idioms correctly but without the unconscious variation that comes from having learned them in context — every phrase is textbook-perfect.', N'Steady, even, controlled. Never interrupts. Never raises his voice. The consistency is part of his design and part of his uncanny valley — humans vary their delivery. Silas does not.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'silas_vane');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b3-7359-99cc-bd28384e9449', N'Malika Kulkarni-Sepúlveda', N'Malika', N'', N'Kulkarni-Sepúlveda', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Shallowgrave, Geartown adjacent — a rented bay in a semi-collapsed parking structure called the Stack, near Western and Division', N'Chop shop operator and parts runner, Shallowgrave', N'', N'Malika Kulkarni-Sepúlveda is nineteen and looks younger, which he has stopped minding because it means people underestimate what he can do to a Ferrogate Transit pod in forty minutes flat. He''s wiry and long-limbed, Algerian-Māori heritage that gives him a face of striking angles — high forehead, strong jaw, a nose that''s been broken once (proud of it), skin a warm tawny brown that''s perpetually smudged with grease no matter how thoroughly he washes. His hair is dark and tight-curled, usually stuffed into a mechanical bandana that can project a heads-up schematic overlay. He has cat ears from a geneware package he bought secondhand at sixteen — mottled grey and black, fully functional for enhanced hearing, constantly swiveling toward sounds before he''s consciously registered them.

He is relentlessly cheerful in a way that reads as naive until you notice he is also relentlessly competent. He can strip a Ferrogate pod, a Sterling-Nakamura delivery drone, or an Axiom security crawler down to useful components faster than anyone else in Shallowgrave, and he knows the resale value of every part to three decimal places. He has no interest in violence, considerable interest in engines, and a complicated relationship with the two older crew members who ''own'' the bay he works out of and take sixty percent of what he earns.', N'Local color and community texture of Shallowgrave youth crime, parts and vehicle-related services, information about what vehicles are moving through the district, moral complexity of exploitation within criminal hierarchies', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (mottled grey-black, enhanced hearing, cosmetic). Mechanical bandana with schematic HUD overlay (not technically augmentation, wearable). Grease-resistant keratin treatment on hands.', N'Sleeps in the Stack in a hammock he''s strung between two defunct vehicles, is awake before anyone else examining whatever came in overnight, spends his days stripping and cataloging, argues with the ELF that inhabits the Stack''s old elevator shaft (which he has named Pulleys) about fair market value.', N'Malika Kulkarni-Sepúlveda, 19-year-old neo-noir mechanic, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, high cheekbones and defined jawline with broader face proportions, dark naturally-curled hair compressed under mechanical bandana with embedded circuitry. Mottled grey-and-black functional geneware cat ears mounted on skull, rotating toward distant sounds. Wiry 176cm frame, lean and corded from precision work, wearing wear-stained charcoal synthmesh shop coat with reinforced cuffs over faded band-logo tee. Heavy cargo pants with grease marks and patches, braided cable belt, scuffed steel-toed boots. Hands perpetually active, grease permanently under fingernails, faded scar on left knuckles, small pale burn mark on right wrist. Crouched in dim workshop with neon accent lighting catching the holographic projector node at left temple, industrial background, young but radiating quiet mechanical confidence, minimal wasted motion. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shallowgrave', N'local', N'Shallowgrave', N'Malika''s genetic ancestry—34.3% Central Asian, 29.5% South Asian, 25.4% Hispanic/Latin American, and 10.8% Eastern European—creates a striking polychromatic phenotype. Central Asian and South Asian ancestry dominates her bone structure and coloring, with meaningful contributions from Latin American heritage visible in skin tone warmth and facial contours, while Eastern European ancestry adds angular definition to her features. The blend manifests as a dynamic interplay of rounded and angular: high, defined cheekbones and a strong jawline from Central Asian and Eastern European heritage softened by broader face proportions and fuller contours from South Asian ancestry. Her hair texture reflects this multifaceted heritage—naturally dark curls with variable strand thickness, neither uniformly fine nor coarse but richly textured.', 176, 62, N'Wiry and long-limbed with corded forearms from years of precision mechanical work; lean muscle density, minimal body fat, functional rather than aesthetic physiology', N'Natural dark brown, nearly black', N'Tight natural curls, usually compressed under mechanical bandana', N'Short (approximately 5cm when loose)', N'Dark brown, alert and quick-moving', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones from South Asian and Central Asian ancestry, enriched by the warmth of Hispanic/Latin American heritage, with subtle olive notes from the Eastern European admixture. The result is dimensionally rich and deep, appearing to shift slightly depending on light and angle—never flat, always luminous beneath surface.', N'Perpetually smudged with machinery grease despite frequent washing; bone structure reflects balanced multihereditary influence—high, prominent cheekbones and defined jaw from Central Asian and Eastern European heritage, broader face width and fuller cheek and lip contours from South Asian ancestry, nose slightly off-center from old break. Minimal facial hair. Youthful appearance—reads 17-18 despite being 19.', N'Mottled grey-and-black geneware cat ears mounted on skull, fully functional with independent articulation—swivel and rotate consciously and reflexively toward sounds. Mechanical bandana worn constantly, woven composite with visible circuitry threading along edges, small holographic projector node at left temple', N'Moves with economic precision—minimal wasted motion, fluid when working, tends to crouch or sit cross-legged rather than stand idle. Hands constantly active even at rest (sorting, measuring, fidgeting with small parts). Cat ears telegraph her attention before her eyes do; often appears to be listening to sounds others don''t perceive. Carries herself with quiet confidence that reads as youth until you watch her work', N'Tier 5 working-class functional: wear-stained synthmesh shop coat (charcoal grey, multiple pockets, reinforced at elbows and cuffs), layered with a faded band-logo tee underneath. Cargo pants in heavy cotton-blend with grease marks and repair patches, held up with a braided belt made from salvaged cable. Reinforced steel-toed boots, scuffed and worn. No jewelry except a thin wire-wrapped band around left wrist (handmade, possibly from parts). Bandana always in place; layers minimally beyond that. Clothing is maintained but clearly secondhand and well-used—everything chosen for durability over appearance', N'He has been quietly, methodically skimming components — never money, always parts, each one small and easily lost in inventory — and has a hidden cache in the Stack''s elevator shaft (Pulleys'' home) that he is slowly assembling into something he has told no one about: the beginning of a vehicle of his own design', N'Fast Meridian Standard slang, heavy Shallowgrave dialect, technical mechanical vocabulary that appears suddenly and without warning in otherwise casual sentences', N'Rapid, enthusiastic, sentences sometimes abandoned mid-thought when something more interesting occurs to him', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'malika_kulkarni_sep_lveda');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a617-7e35-a8cd-bd283c8d56ba', N'Andreia Hossain', N'Andreia', N'', N'Hossain', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 68, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Corridor, performs at the Menomonee Gulch market days and the Grand Corridor pedestrian arcade, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Street performer and puppet maker', N'Independent; no formal collective; informal member of the Grand Corridor busker network; The Reclaimed', N'Andreia Hossain is a wiry sixty-eight-year-old with the permanent squint of someone who has spent decades working in whatever light is available, a Moldovan-Senegalese face that has weathered into something sculptural, and hands that are almost never empty — if he is not performing, he is carving, stitching, or adjusting one of the dozen puppets he carries in the battered rolling case that is his constant companion. He stands about 170 centimeters but seems taller when he works, because when he works he is not exactly there in the same way. The puppets take the space and Andreia Hossain becomes their apparatus.

He has performed in Grand Corridor for nineteen years. He is not famous in any sense the city would recognize, but he is known — a reliable fixture of the market days, a man who will perform for three people or three hundred with identical seriousness. His puppets are handmade constructions of reclaimed wire, synthetic leather, salvaged optics, and in one case an actual functional LED array liberated from a decommissioned Ferrogate Transit sign. They speak, move, fight, grieve, and occasionally function as commentary on whoever is watching. Children are his primary audience but adults stay. He does not adjust his material for age. He has a small following of regulars who believe his oldest puppet, a deteriorating marionette called The Advocate, is inhabited by an E.L.F. Andreia Hossain neither confirms nor denies this.', N'Local color and neighborhood memory — he has been in Grand Corridor long enough to have seen everything; information source on long-term changes in the area; potential ELF contact point through The Advocate; humanizing presence that grounds the setting in ordinary life', N'', N'Replacement left knee joint (practical; Tier 1 medical, paid off over six years); no cosmetic modifications', N'He arrives at the Corridor or the Gulch market two hours before he plans to perform, sets up slowly, and talks to whoever approaches while he works. He performs for three to four hours, packs up, eats whatever is cheapest from the market stalls, and returns to the single room he rents in a shared flat near Menomonee Gulch where he repairs puppets until he falls asleep in the chair.', N'Andreia Hossain, 68-year-old puppet craftsman in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Warm golden-brown skin reflecting South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and European heritage blend. Weathered face with deep lines around eyes and mouth, broad South Asian cheekbones with angular Eastern European planes, slight stubble graying. Steel-gray hair swept back short, dusted with wood shavings. Dark brown eyes with cataracts at edges. Wiry lean frame 170cm tall, slightly stooped posture. Hands extensively scarred from decades of precision carving work, calloused palm edge visible. Wearing faded charcoal long-sleeved work shirt with mending holes, dark frayed canvas work pants, oversized aged fleece jacket, worn leather work boots. Standing in dim neon-lit market venue surrounded by battered puppet control cases covered in aged stickers and Φ symbols. Focused, inward expression, hands in small adjustment patterns. Faint mechanical pause in left leg movement from knee joint replacement. Atmospheric volumetric lighting, gritty market ambiance, weathered wood and solder smell emanating. Contemplative, tired but vital presence. Neo-noir lower-class artisan aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Corridor', N'local', N'Grand Corridor', N'South Asian majority (46.4%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (18.2%), Northern European (13.5%), and Eastern European (12.1%) ancestry, plus traces of Hispanic/Latin American (6.0%) and Southeast Asian (3.8%) heritage — a true Ubiquitous Diaspora blend showing in warm golden-brown skin with complex undertones, angular facial geometry from Eastern European planes blended with South Asian broad cheekbones and Sub-Saharan fuller features, softened by Southeast Asian and Hispanic traces', 170, 62, N'Wiry and lean, all sinew and economy of motion — the frame of someone who has spent sixty-eight years in constant, precise work. Shoulders slightly rounded from decades hunched over puppet construction. No excess weight; functional rather than soft.', N'Steel gray with traces of darker brown at the temples', N'Swept back and kept short, practical for work; occasionally dusted with synthetic fiber and wood shavings', N'Short', N'Dark brown, milky at the edges with cataracts beginning to form', N'Warm golden-brown with red-brown undertones from the blend of South Asian (46.4%) and Sub-Saharan African (18.2%) ancestry, cooled and refined by Northern and Eastern European ancestry (25.6% combined), creating a rich, lived-in patina weathered from decades of market work and outdoor exposure', N'Deeply lined across forehead and around eyes; permanent squint lines carved into the face. Bone structure shows South Asian broad cheekbones and defined geometry blended with Eastern European angular planes and Sub-Saharan fuller lip structure and facial width, softened by Southeast Asian and Hispanic traces. Skin texture rough but vital — the patina of exposure and time. Stubble usually present, graying. Expression in repose is serious and inward-focused.', N'Left knee joint replacement visible only when he rolls up his pant leg or when strain causes a slight mechanical click audible to those very close; the joint itself is surgical steel with a faint seam visible beneath the skin. No external casing or cosmetic shell — purely functional Tier 1 medical work.', N'When idle, slightly stooped; when performing, his posture transforms into something precise and almost rigid — a frame become apparatus. He walks with a faint hesitation in the left leg, a micro-pause before weight transfer, barely noticeable unless one watches closely. His hands are never truly still; fingers move in small adjustment patterns even when at rest. When setting up, every movement is slow and deliberate, as if he is moving through water. His gaze is usually downward or middle-distance, focused on his work or on the space where his puppets will occupy.', N'Tier 4 practical wear, consistent regardless of season: dark canvas work pants with multiple pockets and fraying at the cuffs; a long-sleeved shirt in charcoal or faded black, often with small holes and visible mending; an oversized fleece or canvas jacket, multiple years old, with a faded logo of something no longer legible. No visible branding aspirations. His shoes are worn leather work boots, resoled at least twice. Everything smells faintly of wood dust, solder, and market air. No jewelry except a thin silver band on his left ring finger, worn almost smooth. His most prized possession — a battered rolling case for the puppets — is covered in scuff marks, stickers from various market venues, and a faded Φ symbol from an old currency exchange.', N'The Advocate does respond. Not in ways anyone else can verify — subtle movements when he has not touched the strings, heat in the wood under his hands. Florentiu has been conducting a one-sided conversation with it for nineteen years and it has, three times, answered in a way that cannot be explained by the state of his hands or the wind. He has never written this down because written down it becomes delusion.', N'Careful and slightly formal in a way that reflects Moldovan French as his second language absorbed in childhood; uses theatrical vocabulary naturally; has an enormous archive of proverbs from four different linguistic traditions', N'Unhurried; allows conversations to develop at their own pace; rarely completes a sentence about himself but will talk about the puppets for hours', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'andreia_hossain');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72a-7ec7-83c2-bd6fc5fdc92d', N'Hanin Cisneros', N'Hanin', N'', N'Cisneros', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Mutual aid organizer and neighborhood council member', N'the Gray Zone Mutual Aid Compact; North Branch Commons Council (elected, currently in third term)', N'Hanin Cisneros is a large man going soft at the middle, with the build of someone who used to do heavy work and now does a different kind of heavy work. His skin is very dark with warm undertones, and he keeps a close beard going grey in patches. His right eye is a prosthetic — the iris cycles slowly through amber and gold, an older geneware-adjacent bioluminescent model he has never upgraded because, he says, ''it still works and there are people who need the Quanta more than I need a new eye.'' He dresses in layered practical clothes that somehow always look intentional, and he carries a battered data tablet in a hand-stitched case his daughter made him.

Hanin Cisneros has run the Gray Zone Mutual Aid Compact for eleven years, coordinating food distribution, medical triage referrals, emergency housing, and legal support for the roughly four thousand tier-1 residents packed into the Gray Zone''s stacked industrial housing modules. He is patient in the manner of someone who has learned that patience is a tool and not a virtue, and he carries a deep, undisguised grief for what the city has done to his neighbors that he converts, daily, into logistics.', N'Community anchor and quest giver. Knows every family in the Gray Zone. Can direct players toward people in need, flag brewing crises, and serve as a moral compass character who forces reflection on the cost of inaction.', N'', N'Prosthetic right eye, older bioluminescent amber-gold iris model. No other augmentations — can''t afford them, won''t prioritize them.', N'Begins at the Compact''s distribution point at 06:00, coordinates morning food and supply runs, attends council sessions three afternoons a week, and spends most evenings doing casework — individual families in crisis that the formal systems have failed.', N'Hanin Cisneros, tall 188cm Ubiquitous Diaspora man with deep warm brown skin holding golden and amber undertones from blended Eastern European, Pacific Islander, Hispanic, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Strong wide cheekbones, prominent jawline, wider-set eyes with subtle epicanthal variation. Dark brown left eye, right eye glowing amber-gold bioluminescent prosthetic cycling slowly. Short dark hair greying at temples, close-trimmed beard with grey patches. Weather-worn, lined face suggesting decades in industrial spaces. Broad shoulders, large-framed build softening through middle. Wearing layered working-class practical wear: faded grey repaired jacket with heavy collar, worn canvas work pants, visible undershirts, scuffed steel-toed boots. Carries hand-stitched fabric tablet case. Posture economical and balanced, attentive expression. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone warehouse district, neon-adjacent lighting with warm industrial ambiance, portrait-focused composition --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: Eastern European (37.0%), Pacific Islander (26.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (21.9%), and Sub-Saharan African (14.4%) ancestry. This multi-continental genetic combination creates a striking and dimensionally complex phenotype. The synthesis produces warm deep brown skin with golden and amber undertones from Pacific Islander and Hispanic ancestry interweaving with Eastern European and Sub-Saharan African genetics. Facial structure reflects this balanced four-way blend—wider-set eyes with subtle epicanthal variation, prominent cheekbones, strong jawline, and rich bone structure characteristic of the Eastern European-African-Pacific Islander synthesis.', 188, 98, N'Large-framed, softening through the middle with the weight distribution of a man whose labor has shifted from physical to administrative. Broad shoulders and thick forearms still carry the architecture of his earlier life.', N'Dark brown with grey patches spreading from the temples', N'Kept close and functional, no styling', N'Short', N'Left eye: dark brown. Right eye: bioluminescent amber-gold prosthetic with slow iris cycling', N'Deep warm brown with golden and amber undertones, dimensionally complex coloring from the blending of Eastern European, Pacific Islander, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry', N'Weather-worn and lined, the face of someone who spends significant time in poorly climate-controlled spaces. Close-trimmed grey-patched beard. Facial features reflect blended diaspora ancestry—wider-set eyes with slight epicanthal variation, prominent cheekbones, strong jawline. Deep-set eyes that read as attentive rather than tired despite fatigue.', N'Right prosthetic eye only — bioluminescent amber-gold iris model, older generation, deliberately unreplaced. The cyclic glow is noticeable in low light. No other visible augmentations.', N'Moves with economic efficiency, no wasted motion. Carries weight low through the hips. Stands with weight balanced; gives the impression of listening rather than waiting. Habitual gesture of touching the hand-stitched tablet case when thinking.', N'Layered practical wear suggesting Tier 4-5 working class: worn canvas work pants, undershirts visible at the neck, a heavy oversized collar jacket in faded grey that has been repaired multiple times, steel-toed boots scuffed from years of warehouse and distribution center work. Everything fits the logic of durability and function over aesthetic. Carries a battered data tablet in a visibly hand-stitched fabric case — the craftsmanship of it marks it as personally meaningful rather than issued.', N'He has been quietly embezzling small amounts from a Tessera community development grant — not for himself, but to fund a parallel emergency housing fund that the grant''s terms technically forbid. He has told himself this is ethical. He is not entirely sure.', N'Warm, accessible, sometimes formal when he wants to signal seriousness. Mixes Amharic endearments with Polish curses. Calls everyone ''neighbor'' until he trusts them enough to use their name.', N'Unhurried, like someone who has learned that rushing makes people defensive. Long pauses that feel like consideration, not hesitation.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hanin_cisneros');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('f80a9c62-1647-6d9b-c4ac-bda664f537e0', N'Naima Orlov-Twumasi', N'Naima', N'', N'Orlov-Twumasi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A co-working space in Burnside Corridor that she treats as her command center — multiple screens, standing desk, energy drinks', N'Private Investigator', N'Copperveil Intelligence (mid-level private investigator)', N'Naima Orlov-Twumasi is either the future of private investigation or an ethical catastrophe in progress, depending on who you ask. She built MeridianEyes, a mesh-based platform that crowdsources investigative work to a network of over 30,000 gig participants across all five tiers of GLMZ. When a case comes in, she breaks it into hundreds of tiny, anonymized tasks — confirm a sighting, photograph a location, check a public record, note an anomaly — and distributes them to participants who earn micro-bounties for completing them.

The results are staggering. She solves cases faster than any individual investigator, covers more ground than any surveillance system, and generates more data points than any corporate intelligence operation. Her missing-persons recovery time averages eleven hours. Her platform has been used for everything from finding lost pets to tracking corporate fugitives, and it processes over 50,000 micro-tasks per week.

The ethical questions are equally staggering. MeridianEyes turns every participant into an unwitting surveillance node. The platform''s anonymization protocols mean participants don''t know what case they''re contributing to or who benefits from their observations. Privacy advocates have called it ''distributed totalitarianism.'' Naima argues that every participant is voluntary, every task is legal, and the platform includes safeguards against misuse. She''s mostly right. The ''mostly'' keeps her up at night, though she''d never admit it.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'naima_orlov_twumasi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66c-727c-950c-bded153962f0', N'Ayaan Matsumoto-Valenzuela', N'Ayaan', N'', N'Matsumoto-Valenzuela', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 33, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Tessera Compliance Hub, Edgewater Prism, near Clark and Belmont', N'Tessera Compliance Bureau surveillance operator and forensic data technician', N'Tessera Compliance Bureau, Surveillance and Forensic Data Division', N'Ayaan Matsumoto-Valenzuela sits in front of screens for ten hours a day and has developed the particular physical vocabulary of someone who lives in their eyes — she hunches forward when interested, goes completely still when she has found something, and has a habit of touching her temple like she''s adjusting an aug that isn''t there. Her skin is a deep warm brown, her hair grown out into a large, loose natural that she pins back at work and lets expand freely everywhere else. She has chromatic hair dye that shifts between deep violet and black depending on ambient temperature — a mod she refreshes every few months because it is, she says, the only beautiful thing in her workspace.

She is Tessera''s best surveillance operator in the Edgewater district and she knows it and has stopped pretending she doesn''t, which makes her exactly the kind of person her supervisors quietly resent while continuing to rely on. She tracks, correlates, and reconstructs — pieces together narratives from fragmented camera data, transit pings, purchase records, biometric trails. She is very fast and very thorough and occasionally she finds things that nobody asked her to look for, and those are the moments that have started to keep her awake.', N'Information source and access point for surveillance infrastructure; morally ambiguous figure who knows too much; can provide evidence or bury it; represents how surveillance becomes personal', N'', N'Chromatic hair mod (violet/black); neural uplink for direct screen-interface (professional grade, Tessera-issued); enhanced visual processing overlay (occupational — reduces eye strain, adds analysis tags); no combat augmentation', N'Night shift, 8pm to 6am, surveillance suite four floors underground. Eats at her desk. Communicates with colleagues primarily by text. Goes home at dawn and sleeps through the morning.', N'Ayaan Matsumoto-Valenzuela, 168cm lean neo-noir hacker woman, warm medium-golden brown skin tone blending East Asian, South Asian, and Latin American heritage, pronounced high cheekbones, almond-shaped deep brown eyes with faint analytical overlay, natural shoulder-length coils dyed thermochromic violet-to-black. Slight forward lean, statue-still concentration pose. Temple-touching gesture near concealed neural uplink port. Wearing dark charcoal compression work wear with Tessera access badge over oversized vintage band tee, fitted black cargo pants, worn synthetic leather jacket with internal wiring channels visible. Secondhand datapad in hand, thin titanium ring on left index finger. Nocturnal pallid complexion with fine eye-line creases. Minimal makeup, pragmatic grooming. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody blue-teal neon ambient lighting, screens glowing in background, cinematic future-noir atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Tessera Compliance Hub', N'local', N'Tessera Compliance Hub', N'East Asian (43.7%), South Asian (28.5%), and Hispanic/Latin American (27.8%) ancestry. Complex tri-continental genetic blend creating warm medium-golden skin tone with subtle golden undertones from South Asian heritage, refined East Asian eye geometry paired with Latin American facial structure, and high cheekbone prominence from the blended East and South Asian genetics.', 168, 58, N'Lean and slightly angular, with the compressed posture of someone who spends ten hours daily bent toward screens. Minimal muscle definition but wiry, efficient frame.', N'Natural deep brown base with thermochromic dye overlay shifting between deep violet and black depending on ambient temperature', N'Loose, voluminous natural coils when unrestrained; pinned back tightly during work shifts with reinforced clips', N'Long (shoulder-blade length when released)', N'Deep brown with subtle almond geometry from East Asian ancestry, human baseline', N'Warm medium-golden brown reflecting the balanced blend of East Asian, South Asian, and Latin American heritage, with golden undertones characteristic of South Asian genetic expression', N'Clear but slightly pallid from nocturnal schedule and fluorescent overhead lighting. Fine lines around eyes from sustained focus. Refined facial structure with pronounced cheekbones from combined East Asian and South Asian genetic expression, with subtle width to face structure from Latin American ancestry. Habitually composed expression. Minimal makeup, pragmatic grooming.', N'Chromatic hair mod (thermoreactive dye visible as violet-to-black gradient). Neural uplink port at right temple area is usually concealed by hair but visible when pulled back. Eyes occasionally display faint analytical overlay artifacts under certain lighting angles (occupational enhancement, subtle).', N'Default forward lean with shoulders tensed. Stillness is her baseline when concentrating — she becomes almost statue-like when locked into data work. Frequent unconscious temple-touching gesture (old habit checking for aug adjustments). Deliberate, economical movements outside work context. Rarely makes eye contact during conversations, attention naturally drawn to screens or middle distance.', N'Tier 3 pragmatist. At work: fitted dark compression wear (charcoal, navy) with Tessera-issued access badge worn on retention cord. Off-duty: oversized vintage band tees (salvaged from Tier 5 markets), fitted black cargo pants with multiple pockets, worn synthetic leather jacket with internal wiring channels. Always carries handheld secondhand datapad. Minimal jewelry except for a singular thin titanium ring on left index finger. Shoes are practical runner-grade, well-maintained.', N'Three months ago she reconstructed a deleted surveillance sequence that showed two Tessera Compliance officers planting evidence in a Tier 1 housing block that was subsequently condemned and cleared. She has a complete copy. She has told no one. She consults Argos the E.L.F. about what to do and Argos has, in whatever way E.L.F.s communicate, consistently suggested she wait.', N'Technical, precise, occasionally forgets to translate from analysis-register to human — uses data terminology as default', N'Fast when engaged, clipped and minimal when not, with sudden depth when something genuinely interests her', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ayaan_matsumoto_valenzuela');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a59f-7df1-85ec-be001df3d185', N'Vega Cho-Magnúsdóttir', N'Vega', N'', N'Cho-Magnúsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, shop called ''Four Blades'' on Prater Row, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Barber and neighborhood fixture in Hamtramck Enclave', N'Independent; loose ties to Hamtramck Enclave community council', N'Vega Cho-Magnúsdóttir is a broad-shouldered woman with skin the color of dark teak, silver-streaked locs pinned up under a work bandana, and the kind of hands that look like they could crack walnuts but handle a straight razor with surgical calm. She has cosmetic irises done in a spiraling amber-and-black pattern she''s had since her forties, a small gift to herself after her husband left. Her shop is a relic — three analog mirrors, two functioning chairs, one busted, a gray zone of unlabeled pomades, and a shrine to a local E.L.F. called Clipper that she keeps fed with sound clips of her favorite music and the occasional hair clipping placed in a small copper bowl. She believes Clipper keeps her blades sharp and her hands steady.

Vega Cho-Magnúsdóttir has been cutting hair in Hamtramck Enclave for twenty-three years. She is the kind of person who holds the neighborhood''s memory — she knows whose grandmother used to live in every building, who cheated on who, which corponation rep tried to buy the block. She doesn''t gossip idly. She listens more than she speaks, and when she does speak it tends to land. She has a dry, unhurried humor that disarms people faster than flattery, and a stubbornness about her rates and her hours that has outlasted three waves of gentrification pressure from Tessera-adjacent real estate shells.', N'Neighborhood oracle, information hub, quest giver for community-level problems. Characters who need to know something about Hamtramck Enclave come to Abena. She may trade information for favors, not cash.', N'', N'Cosmetic spiral irises (amber/black). No other augmentations. Refuses chrome on principle.', N'Opens Four Blades at 0800, works until the last client leaves, sometimes past 2100. Eats dinner standing up at the counter, listening to old Congolese soukous on a battered speaker.', N'Vega Cho-Magnúsdóttir, fifty-two-year-old master tradesperson, 172cm tall with broad muscular shoulders and solid build. Rich warm brown skin with golden and olive undertones reflecting East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, Indigenous American, and South Asian heritage—no single ancestry dominates, all elements harmonized. Moderate cheekbones with mixed ancestry geometry, broader nose bridge, fuller lips, cosmetic amber-and-black spiral irises. Dark brown locs with silver streaking, shoulder-length, partially pinned up under faded geometric-patterned cloth bandana. Face weathered with fine lines around eyes and mouth, matte skin texture, minimal makeup. Wearing dark linen work shirt with rolled sleeves exposing faint burn mark on right forearm and small scar on left hand webbing. Standing in warm workshop lighting with economical posture, weight evenly distributed, hands at rest but clearly capable. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial workspace setting, golden-hour workshop lighting, calm focused presence, no chrome augmentation visible except cosmetic irises. Smells of pomade, soap, old music. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'weathered barber and neighborhood fixture, female 52, broad-shouldered and muscular, rich warm brown skin with golden and olive undertones, face bearing fifty-two years of quiet listening and precision work, genuine global polychromatic phenotype with integrated East Asian bone structure, African facial width, Northern European clarity, Indigenous American cheekbones, and South Asian warmth, asymmetrical features, deep fine lines around eyes and mouth, moderate cheekbones, broad nose bridge, fuller lips, minimal makeup, skin with subtle matte finish and natural resilience

