--ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Dominant East Asian (35.7%) ancestry harmonized with substantial Sub-Saharan African (28.6%), Northern European (15.5%), Indigenous American (15.3%), and South Asian (4.9%) heritage. This creates a striking polychromatic phenotype where East Asian bone structure and eye shape integrate seamlessly with African facial width and sculptural depth, Northern European skin clarity, Indigenous American cheekbone angularity, and South Asian warmth. The result is genuinely global—a face where no single ancestry dominates visually but rather all elements converge into an unmistakably contemporary synthesis.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solidly built, muscular through the arms and back from decades of precise manual work. Not heavy, but substantial — the kind of frame that suggests strength without seeking it.', N'Dark brown with natural silver streaking throughout', N'Locs, thick and shoulder-length when loose, typically pinned up under a work bandana during shop hours', N'Long', N'Cosmetic irises: spiraling amber and black pattern (non-functional augmentation, purely aesthetic)', N'Rich warm brown with golden and olive undertones—a complex interplay of East Asian warmth, African saturation and depth, Northern European luminosity, Indigenous American earthiness, and South Asian radiance. Slightly deeper on the cheekbones and jawline, warmer across the forehead and nose bridge, with subtle olive notes along the temples and orbital ridge.', N'Weathered but well-maintained, minimal makeup, no visible skin damage. Fine lines around her eyes and mouth from fifty-two years of quiet smiling and concentration. Moderate cheekbones with East Asian structure balanced by broader nose bridge and fuller lips reflecting Sub-Saharan, South Asian, and Indigenous American heritage geometry. Skin has a subtle matte finish, naturally resilient. Her face reads with the economy of expression that comes from listening more than speaking.', N'Only her cosmetic spiral irises (amber and black) are visible—a deliberate choice made in her forties. She refuses chrome or any functional augmentation on principle.', N'Stands with her weight evenly distributed, shoulders back but not rigid. Moves with economical precision—no wasted motion. Her hands are her language: steady, confident, capable of extreme delicacy or surprising strength. She gestures infrequently but meaningfully. Her gait is unhurried, even during busy hours.', N'Work uniform of a Tier 3-4 independent tradesperson. Usually wears a dark linen work shirt or vintage cotton coverall, sleeves rolled to the elbow. A faded cloth bandana (rotating selection of patterns—geometric, indigo, earth tones) keeps her locs back during work. Practical boots, worn but maintained. Outside the shop, she adds a long cardigan or wool coat depending on season—no corporate branding, no flash. Her clothes are chosen for durability and movement, not status.', N'Twenty years ago, she informed on a local fixer to a Tessera security contractor to protect her shop from being burned. The fixer disappeared. She has never told anyone. She donates anonymously to the fixer''s surviving daughter''s school fees every term.', N'Measured, working-class; mixes French-derived expressions from her mother''s family with clipped Eastern European rhythm from her father''s side. Occasionally lapses into Twi-inflected idiom.', N'Slow, deliberate. Long pauses before important statements. Never finishes sentences she doesn''t mean.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'vega_cho_magn_sd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a608-7e0a-bb02-bea9a9dd651e', N'Chisara Kariuki', N'Chisara', N'', N'Kariuki', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Rampart, Axiom Security Division deployment barracks, Block 9', N'Riot Suppression Specialist, Axiom Security Division', N'Axiom Security Division, Riot Suppression and Crowd Control unit', N'Chisara Kariuki is a big man going legitimately soft — broad shoulders still evident under a frame that has acquired weight in the middle over thirty years of corporate security work, hands that are scarred at the knuckles and disproportionately large. His skin is deep brown, his head shaved close on the sides and going grey on top, and he has a wide flat nose that has been broken twice and set imperfectly each time. He looks, at first glance, like exactly what he is — or was. The geneware bioluminescent patches along his forearms, faint green that pulse slowly when he''s calm, were a retirement gift to himself after his twenty-fifth year: the only truly soft thing about his physical presentation.

He has spent three decades on the Axiom deployment line and he is tired in a way that has calcified into something almost peaceful. He runs the suppression team with the exhausted competence of someone who has seen every version of a bad situation and developed a preference for the versions that end without anyone in the medical unit. The younger specialists find him difficult — he doesn''t perform enthusiasm, doesn''t buy into Axiom''s internal culture of aggressive loyalty, answers questions with more honesty than the questioner usually wants. He lights a stick of incense at the Block 9 E.L.F. terminal every evening — whatever spirit occupies the barracks'' old ventilation system, he''s been leaving smoke-offerings for fifteen years and it hasn''t killed him yet.', N'Moral complexity in institutional violence — a specialist in crowd suppression who is not a villain, just exhausted and compromised by time. Can serve as a warning, an unexpected ally, or a window into how Axiom''s security apparatus actually functions at ground level. Source of information about Axiom operations, crowd patterns, the Rampart''s internal culture.', N'', N'Bioluminescent geneware patches, both forearms (slow green pulse, civilian-grade cosmetic). Skeletal reinforcement in the left knee — occupational injury repair, twenty years ago. Subdermal armor mesh, torso — employer-issue, Axiom standard for suppression specialists.', N'Morning physical conditioning that is less rigorous than it was and he''s made peace with that. Shift briefings at 0800, equipment checks, deployment as assigned — protests, labor disputes, corporate perimeter incidents. Evening incense offering. Sleeps more than he used to and feels guilty about it.', N'Chisara Kariuki, 188cm imposing security officer with deep warm brown skin blended with golden undertones and subtle olive undertones, weathered from decades of industrial deployment. Steel grey hair clipped close on sides with receding temples, dark brown eyes, heavy brow ridge, prominent broad nose set off-center from past breaks. Deep facial lines, sparse grey stubble. Subtle East Asian cheekbone definition softened by dominant Sub-Saharan and North African heritage. Broad-shouldered muscular build softening with age, dense and substantial. Wearing standard Axiom Security grey-black modular tactical armor with chest patch, load-bearing harness, reinforced tactical trousers, steel-toed boots. Faint green bioluminescent geneware patches visible on forearms in dim industrial lighting. Scarred knuckles visible on both hands, left hand more heavily marked. Neutral-stern expression, deliberate economical posture with forward weight balance. GLMZ GLMZ industrial setting, harsh overhead fluorescent and neon lighting casting sharp shadows, worn concrete and steel environment, corporate security aesthetic, —ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Rampart', N'local', N'The Rampart', N'Mixed ancestry with substantial Sub-Saharan African (38.1%) and North African (21.3%) foundations, combined with significant Eastern European (20.7%), Middle Eastern (10.7%), East Asian (5.7%), and Hispanic/Latin American (3.5%) heritage. This creates a distinctive phenotype: deep warm brown skin with golden and reddish undertones from the African base, refined by North African warmth and Eastern European cool undertones blending into subtle olive. Facial structure reflects the dominant Sub-Saharan and North African genetics — broad, prominent features with secondary influences from Eastern European bone structure and subtle East Asian cheekbone and eye shape definition.', 188, 104, N'Broad-shouldered and thickening through the torso — the muscular frame of a younger man softened by age and desk time, but still dense and substantial. His center of gravity remains low and functional.', N'Steel grey with dark brown undertones at the roots', N'Clipped close on the sides, longer on top but receding slightly at the temples', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Deep warm brown with golden and reddish undertones layered with subtle olive undertones from North African and Eastern European blending. Weathered and uneven from decades of outdoor deployment and industrial lighting exposure.', N'Broad, prominent nose with substantial width reflecting Sub-Saharan African heritage, set slightly off-center from two previous breaks. Heavy brow ridge characteristic of North African and Sub-Saharan ancestry. Deep nasolabial lines. Sparse grey stubble on the jaw most mornings — he shaves every other day now. Cheekbones show subtle definition from East Asian ancestry softened by his stronger Sub-Saharan African and North African heritage base. Skin has the dull, leathered quality of someone who spent three decades under GLMZ industrial lighting and open-air riot protocols.', N'Bioluminescent forearm patches (civilian-grade, faint green, slow pulse). The subdermal armor mesh is not visible under standard Axiom security coveralls, but produces subtle tightness and asymmetrical movement in the torso during extreme flexion. Left knee has slightly limited lateral mobility from skeletal reinforcement — noticeable only to trained observers during tactical movement.', N'Stands with weight balanced forward slightly, hands often at rest with fingers slightly curled — occupational muscle memory from riot-line positioning. Moves with deliberate economy, no wasted motion. Walks with a faint left-leg favor on days when the knee is stiff. Rarely makes sudden movements. His default expression is neutral-to-stern; smiling requires visible effort.', N'Standard Axiom Security Division suppression specialist uniform when on-shift: grey-black modular body armor with Axiom division patch on chest, load-bearing harness, tactical trousers with reinforced knees, steel-toed boots. Off-shift: plain grey or charcoal sweats, unmarked t-shirts, worn leather jacket from a previous decade. Minimal personal accessories — a single worn wedding ring, no visible jewelry. Everything utilitarian. Tier 3-4 corporate security aesthetic, practical and worn in.', N'In a labor suppression deployment at Grainfort seven years ago, he gave the dispersal order twelve minutes before the legal threshold was reached because his commanding officer was pressuring him and he was tired. Three people were hospitalized. The incident report says the threshold was met. He wrote it.', N'Plain, slow, slightly formal — the language of someone who learned to communicate in institutional settings and never entirely shed it. Serbian phrases slip in when he''s frustrated or reflective, inheritance from a grandmother he barely knew.', N'Unhurried to the point of seeming stubborn. He finishes sentences completely and waits for a full beat before the next one.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chisara_kariuki');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e9-75e1-8f8b-bed9da857353', N'Soren Bui-Thakur-Huitzil', N'Soren', N'', N'Bui-Thakur-Huitzil', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 16, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Apprentice at a licensed repair-and-salvage shop; junior technician and parts runner', N'Manda''s Salvage & Fine Repair, Geartown; loosely affiliated with Geartown''s independent tech community; The Coffin Nails', N'Soren Bui-Thakur-Huitzil has her Ghanaian father''s hands — wide palmed, strong fingered — and her Armenian mother''s persistent stubbornness, and she has inherited both as though they were made for her profession. She works at Manda''s Salvage & Fine Repair on Geartown''s third industrial terrace, where she has been an apprentice since she was twelve and where she can now diagnose a failing servo actuator by sound alone. She is medium height and solidly built, with close-cropped natural hair and grease that occupies the permanent geography under her fingernails regardless of how hard she scrubs. She has one voluntary augmentation — a subdermal haptic feedback implant in her right hand that lets her feel electromagnetic field variations, technically a diagnostic tool, practically the best thing she has ever purchased with eight months of saved stipend. She also has bioluminescent skin mods along her forearms: soft amber pulses that track her heart rate, which she got at fourteen because she thought they looked good and still does.

She is cheerful in the easy, unself-conscious way of someone who genuinely likes their work and genuinely likes most people, with a bedrock practicality underneath the warmth that keeps her from being naive about either. She has strong opinions about proper tool storage, the ethics of selling salvage that still has someone''s personal data on it, and which E.L.F.s are worth propitiating before a complex repair job. She argues with Manda constantly and would be devastated if Manda retired.', N'Equipment repair, parts sourcing, and technical information; warm point of contact in Geartown; her shop is a natural gathering place and information node.', N'', N'Subdermal haptic EM-field sensor (right hand, diagnostic grade). Bioluminescent skin mod — amber pulse tracers along forearms. No heavy chrome.', N'At the shop by 0700. Mornings on intake and diagnosis, afternoons on repair or running parts between Geartown suppliers. Evenings studying for her Helix Biosystems junior-tech certification exam.', N'Soren Bui-Thakur-Huitzil, 168cm tall mixed-heritage woman with warm bronze skin and golden undertones, Southeast Asian-South Asian-East Asian-Indigenous American-African ancestry blend. Short dark brown hair, close-cropped and slightly uneven. Deep brown almond-shaped eyes with warm undertones. Moderately angular cheekbones, full lips, straight nose. Solidly muscular build from repair work, wide palms with long dexterous fingers. Small pale scar on left cheekbone. Bioluminescent amber tracers pulsing gently along both forearms in rhythm with heartbeat, most visible in low light. Wearing oversized reinforced work shirt under canvas apron with tools, work pants with multiple pockets, scuffed steel-toed boots. Vintage patched leather jacket. Small brass hex wrench on steel chain at neck. Slight forward lean as if about to lean over workbench. Confident direct gaze. Workshop setting with ambient amber and neon lighting, subtle glow from forearm mods casting soft light on skin, grease and tool marks on hands, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, professional hands-on engineer, low-key chrome-free augmentation style, practical salvage-conscious clothing, atmospheric workshop mood lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Southeast Asian (30.6%) / South Asian (28.4%) / East Asian (18.6%) / Indigenous American (14.0%) / Sub-Saharan African (8.4%) — a true Ubiquitous Diaspora blend. Her phenotype reflects this complex interweaving: Southeast Asian and South Asian ancestry create the foundation of her facial structure with warm, golden-honey undertones, East Asian heritage adds subtle refinement to her eye shape and cheekbone definition with characteristic almond eyes, Indigenous American ancestry contributes distinctive bone structure and broader facial proportions, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry enriches the warmth and depth of her skin tone with bronze undertones that shift across light spectrums.', 168, 62, N'Solidly built with functional muscularity in shoulders and forearms from years of hands-on repair work; no excess, no fragility. Wide-palmed hands with long, dexterous fingers — inherited from her father''s lineage and perfectly suited to her profession.', N'Natural dark brown, almost black', N'Close-cropped, maintenance-minimal, occasionally uneven where she cuts it herself between paying for professional trims', N'Short', N'Deep brown with warm undertones, subtly almond-shaped from East Asian heritage contribution', N'Warm bronze with golden undertones, reflecting the rich interplay of Southeast Asian, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Indigenous American ancestry. The tone is neither purely warm nor cool, but a harmonious blend that shifts subtly in different lighting — warm honey in daylight, deeper bronze under amber workshop lights, almost copper in neon. Slight sun-weathering on cheekbones and bridge of nose.', N'Clear and practical — minimal makeup, workshop-worn in places from diagnostic lighting and rooftop work. Perpetual traces of grease under fingernails and in the creases of her palms despite obsessive scrubbing. Small scar on left cheekbone from a tool slip at age thirteen. Facial structure reflects her blended heritage: moderately angular cheekbones with balanced fullness characteristic of Southeast and South Asian ancestry, straight nose with subtle width, full lips, eyes with almond shape from East Asian heritage, and broader facial planes from Indigenous American ancestry.', N'Bioluminescent forearm tracers are her only visibly obvious modification. The subdermal haptic EM-field sensor in her right hand is invisible to casual observation, though she sometimes flexes her right hand unconsciously when diagnosing equipment, and the faint blue LED indicator under the skin at her inner wrist pulses when active. No chrome, no heavy augmentation — she''s practical about what''s worth the cost and the risk.', N'Confident and economical in movement; stands with slight forward lean as if perpetually about to lean over a workbench. Hands move with precision and purpose. Fidgets with small objects — wrenches, diagnostic tools, circuit fragments — when thinking. Makes direct eye contact. Walks quickly between tasks, rarely leisures.', N'Tier 3-4 working class with practical, salvage-conscious aesthetics. Favors reinforced work pants with multiple pockets (usually Blackwell brand or salvaged surplus), steel-toed boots scuffed and re-sealed multiple times, oversized work shirts or tank tops under a canvas apron with tools. Off-shift: plain fitted tees or salvaged vintage band shirts, same work pants, same boots. A vintage leather jacket from her mother that she''s had patched and resealed twice. No corporate branding. One piece of jewelry: a small brass hex wrench on a steel chain around her neck — her father''s first apprenticeship gift to her at age twelve. Grease and workshop dust are her default perfume.', N'She repaired a device three months ago that she is now fairly certain was a tracking node for something she doesn''t want to know about. She wiped it clean before returning it but kept a copy of the data topology. She hasn''t told Manda.', N'Technical vocab sits naturally next to ordinary Geartown street speech. Explains things clearly without condescension. Uses repair metaphors for emotional situations.', N'Warm, a bit fast, comfortable with silence while she''s thinking.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'soren_bui_thakur_huitzil');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a734-7e17-8fe5-bef243515793', N'Hamed Baiseitov-Zaragoza', N'Hamed', N'', N'Baiseitov-Zaragoza', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Interchange, operates between Kessler and Deepwell Station, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Transit operator, Ferrogate Line 7 maglev', N'Ferrogate Transit; The Interchange', N'Hamed Baiseitov-Zaragoza is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin and close-cropped silver-threaded locs she keeps pinned under her Ferrogate operator''s cap during shifts. Her left eye is a corporate-issue Ferrogate transit mod — pale grey iris with a subtle amber ring that pulses when she''s interfacing with the train''s systems — but the right eye is her mother''s: dark brown and very still, the kind of eye that misses nothing. She moves through the crowded interchange with the particular grace of someone who has learned to navigate bodies in motion, always finding the gap, always half a step ahead of the surge. A small shrine to the Transit Mind E.L.F. hangs from her cab dashboard — a looped wire figure she wound herself, hung with data chips from old passes.

She is patient in the way that long experience makes you patient, not the soft kind but the kind with iron underneath. Passengers who give her grief get exactly one warning, delivered in a voice so level it takes a moment to realize it was a threat. On slow runs through the Blackpipe Corridor at 0300, she sometimes hums old Ghanaian highlife her grandmother used to play — her Danish side never gave her music, only punctuality, which she also kept.', N'Information conduit — she sees who rides Line 7 every day, notices patterns, knows when something is off. Can provide passage, access to restricted transit tunnels, or unwanted attention from Ferrogate Transit Authority if players draw her suspicion.', N'', N'Ferrogate-issue left ocular interface (transit system HUD, passenger count, track telemetry); mild cochlear dampener (work-issue, protects against brake shriek); no cosmetic mods', N'Runs the 0530-1430 shift on Line 7, eating her lunch — always the same: rice and smoked fish from a thermos — in the cab between Kessler and Deepwell. After shift she stops at the Interchange''s small E.L.F. shrine to leave a burned data chip before heading home to her apartment in Bronzeline.', N'Hamed Baiseitov-Zaragoza, 41-year-old Ferrogate transit operator, standing in neon-lit station corridor, GLMZ. Tall athletic woman with deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, striking high cheekbones and refined facial features blending Central Asian geometry with broader African heritage planes, dark eyes with left eye showing pale grey cybernetic iris with amber pulsing ring. Close-cropped black locs with silver threading pinned under grey operator''s cap. Charcoal Ferrogate uniform shirt, dark grey reinforced trousers, scuffed steel-toed boots. Small titanium cochlear port visible behind left ear. Composed expression, weight balanced in practiced stance. Fluorescent and neon lighting reflecting off her luminous skin tone, creating warm golden highlights. Subtle burn scar visible on right wrist. Background: crowded transit platform with blur of movement, holographic transit displays, cool blue-grey station architecture with warm neon accents. Mood: alert, professional, observant. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Interchange', N'local', N'Kessler Interchange', N'Central Asian-dominant ancestry (62.8%) forms the foundation of her genetic makeup, enriched by substantial Sub-Saharan African heritage (24.5%), with meaningful Hispanic/Latin American admixture (11.1%) and minimal Eastern European traces (1.6%). This genetic combination produces striking facial geometry—the high, prominent cheekbones and eye-set of Central Asian ancestry harmonized with the broader facial planes and full features characteristic of African heritage, while Hispanic ancestry adds warmth and subtle roundness to her overall structure. Her appearance reflects the Ubiquitous Diaspora''s genetic reality: a seamless synthesis rather than distinct traits.', 178, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid without heaviness; muscular through the torso and arms from years of gripping transit controls and moving through crowded stations. Carries herself with economical strength.', N'Black with silver threading', N'Close-cropped locs, typically pinned under Ferrogate operator''s cap during shifts', N'Short', N'Left eye: pale grey with amber ring (corporate-issue transit mod); Right eye: dark brown, natural', N'Deep warm brown with rich golden undertones—the result of Central Asian ancestry as primary heritage blended with Sub-Saharan African warmth and Latin American depth. Complexion has natural luminosity that shifts subtly across light spectrums: deepens to burnished mahogany in lower light, brightens to warm honey-gold under fluorescent station lighting, develops subtle bronze warmth in natural daylight.', N'Weathered by 41 years in controlled environments and fluorescent light, yet skin maintains clarity and refined definition. Minimal makeup. Bone structure is striking: high, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Central Asian ancestry, balanced by the broader facial planes and fuller cheeks from African heritage. Jaw is defined with subtle natural fullness. Expression habitually composed and observant. Small horizontal creases between brows mark decades of focused concentration. Facial features reflect harmonious genetic synthesis across her mixed Central Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic lineage.', N'Left ocular interface: subtle grey iris with pulsing amber ring, becomes more pronounced during system interfacing. Mild cochlear dampener visible as small titanium-grade port behind left ear, usually covered by hair or cap. No cosmetic chrome.', N'Moves with practiced grace through crowded spaces, always finding gaps in foot traffic half a step ahead of surge patterns. Stands with weight balanced, shoulders back but not rigid. Hands rest naturally at sides or on transit controls. Her right eye (natural) is in constant micro-motion, scanning; her left eye (augmented) occasionally goes distant when processing system data. Walks with purpose, never hesitates in her chosen path.', N'Tier 3-4 working class. Standard Ferrogate Transit operator uniform: charcoal grey regulation shirt with embroidered company patch, darker grey trousers with reinforced knees, steel-toed boots scuffed from station platform work. Off-duty: practical layers appropriate to Bronzeline tier housing; worn denim, maintenance-grade synthetic jackets in greys and blacks, functional rather than fashionable. Always wears a small wire E.L.F. transit shrine pendant or keeps similar talisman accessible.', N'Three years ago she saw a man fall onto the track at Deepwell Station and froze for four seconds before pulling the emergency brake — four seconds too long. He survived but lost a foot. The official report blamed signal failure. She filed no correction.', N'Clipped, procedural. Shifts into warmer, more melodic phrasing when genuinely comfortable. Occasional Danish loanwords for dismissal.', N'Measured, unhurried. Never wastes breath.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hamed_baiseitov_zaragoza');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68a-71e4-a255-bef6b1b976cc', N'Ayanda Mwangi-Guerrero', N'Ayanda', N'', N'Mwangi-Guerrero', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, sub-level access tunnels beneath Ironvein, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Tunnel guide and route-seller for hire', N'Independent; loosely aligned with The Undertow trade network', N'Ayanda Mwangi-Guerrero is a lean, weathered man whose skin carries the permanent grey-blue pallor of someone who has not seen natural sunlight in years. His face is angular, with deep-set amber eyes that have been augmented with low-light photoreceptors — the pupils elongate like a cat''s in darkness, but in dim light they glow faintly amber. He keeps his head shaved close on the sides, with a ridge of tightly coiled hair down the center now streaked with mineral dust that never quite washes out. His hands are extraordinary — each finger tattooed with a segment of tunnel mapping in faded ultraviolet ink, visible only under the right kind of light. He smells faintly of wet concrete and the iron-rich water that drips from old service pipes.

Ayanda Mwangi-Guerrero speaks little and charges much. He has guided hundreds of people through the sub-levels — refugees from surface crackdowns, the disappeared seeking new lives, maintenance workers whose credentials won''t open the right doors, curious journalists who last twenty minutes before they beg to go back up. He is not cruel but he is absolutely unsentimental. He has watched people drown in flooded transit tunnels and he has mourned them in exactly the way he mourns a wrong turn: quietly, privately, and then corrected.', N'Quest giver, access provider, local color — the person players or protagonists must convince or pay to get anywhere useful underground. Knows who lives where, what tunnels are contested, which shrines are currently active.', N'', N'Low-light photoreceptor implants (elongated amber pupils), subdermal pressure-sensor mesh on both palms (detects structural vibration, water pressure changes in walls), UV tattoo route-maps on fingers', N'Wakes on a hammock strung between two corroded pipes in his Deepwell cache-hole; takes one meal of cultured protein paste and fungal tea; checks his route beacons via a jury-rigged signal repeater before accepting jobs.', N'Ayanda Mwangi-Guerrero, a lean 172cm woman with warm deep brown skin bearing golden and olive undertones, ashen-grey cast from years underground; angular jaw and high cheekbones; short dark brown hair with grey streaking, tight fade sides with upright coiled central ridge; amber photoreceptor eyes with cat-slit pupils glowing faintly in shadow; UV-reactive tunnel-map tattoos on all fingers invisible in normal light; fine white scar grid on both palms from pressure-sensor mesh; dark water stains along hairline and ears; weathered complexion with tension lines around eyes; economical posture with slight forward lean; wearing worn tactical pants with reinforced knees, grey ribbed undershirt, heavy sealed military surplus shell jacket, steel-toed industrial boots; battered wrist-mounted signal repeater with cracked screen; standing in dim underground tunnel lit by minimal pale bioluminescent strips, concrete dust and rust visible in air, perfectly still and silent, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone subterranean navigator, moody cold lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Complex Pan-Global blend: Sub-Saharan African (38.1%) and Hispanic/Latin American (35.6%) form the dominant genetic base, with significant Central Asian (12.8%) and Middle Eastern (6.7%) contributions, plus minor East Asian (6.5%) ancestry. This creates a warm deep brown base enriched by golden and olive undertones from African, Latin American, and Middle Eastern heritage, with subtle warm undertones from Central Asian ancestry.', 172, 62, N'Lean and wiry, muscle tone maintained by constant navigation through narrow passages and climbing; shoulders slightly hunched from years of stooping in low-ceiling tunnels', N'Natural dark brown with mineral-dust grey streaking', N'Tight fade on sides, central ridge of coiled hair standing upright', N'Short (fade 3mm sides, ridge 4-5cm)', N'Amber with elongated pupils (cat-like dilation in darkness), faintly luminescent in low light', N'Warm deep brown with golden and olive undertones; grey-blue undertone overlay from years without sunlight exposure, creating a slightly ashen cast over the baseline warm complexion', N'Angular jaw and prominent high cheekbones with mild lateral breadth reflecting the African-Latin American-Central Asian blend; deeply weathered texture from mineral-laden water and lack of moisture; permanent tension lines around eyes; no facial hair, clean-shaved; dark water stain discoloration along hairline and ears from prolonged exposure to iron-rich seepage', N'Amber photoreceptor eyes with cat-slit pupils that elongate visibly in darkness; faint luminescence in dim light. Subdermal mesh visible as subtle grid scarring on both palms. UV tattoos on fingers are invisible in normal light but distinctive under any blacklight source.', N'Economical, silent movement — walks with a slight forward lean as if perpetually evaluating floor stability. Hands move deliberately, fingers splayed to assess surroundings via pressure sensors. Sits perfectly still for hours without fidgeting. Speaks rarely; when she does, words are sparse and precise.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian — worn tactical pants with reinforced knees and multiple cargo pockets (patched multiple times), grey ribbed undershirt darkened by perpetual damp, heavy breathable shell jacket with sealed seams (military surplus or Undertow issue). Boots are steel-toed Dunlop industrial grade, resoled at least twice. One wrist-mounted device: a battered handheld signal repeater with cracked screen running custom firmware. No jewelry. Everything smells faintly of concrete dust and rust.', N'Three years ago he led a family of four — parents and two children — through a flooded section he wrongly assessed as passable. The children made it. The parents did not. He accepted payment from the children''s surviving aunt and has not spoken of it since. He lights a data-offering at the nearest E.L.F. shrine every seven days.', N'Sparse, precise. Technical tunnel terminology mixed with old Bore Rat idiom. No profanity — he considers it a waste of breath.', N'Slow, deliberate. Long pauses before answering. Never raises his voice.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ayanda_mwangi_guerrero');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a61d-763d-b9d5-bf8cce30de8c', N'Abdulla Mbekele-Owusu', N'Abdulla', N'', N'Mbekele-Owusu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 62, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Norwood Quiet, third floor of the Reinholt Building — she has taken over the shared laundry room on Tuesdays and Thursdays, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Retired street-level teacher and community educator, now operating an unlicensed after-school program out of her apartment', N'Formerly Norwood Quiet Community Learning Pod Network; currently self-directed; informally connected to several other unlicensed educators across the city', N'Abdulla Mbekele-Owusu is wiry and uncontainable, with close-cropped natural hair she colors a vivid copper-orange that clashes beautifully with her warm reddish-brown skin. She has a long face, large hands, and the kind of energy that makes rooms feel smaller than they are — not unpleasantly, but unavoidably. She has a set of retractable claw geneware she got as a joke in her forties (her students had dared her) and has never removed because she finds them genuinely useful for opening packages and intimidating administrators. She wears ink-stained clothes as a point of pride and her reading glasses are always somewhere other than her face.

For thirty years Abdulla Mbekele-Owusu taught foundational literacy, ethics, and what she called ''functional reality'' at two different Norwood Quiet community learning pods before the Palladian Education Initiative buyout shuttered them in 2196 and replaced them with a licensed digital curriculum she found pedagogically catastrophic and personally offensive. She retired rather than teach the new curriculum, filed three formal complaints that went nowhere, and then simply kept teaching — in her apartment, in the laundry room, in the Reinholt Building stairwell when all else failed. She is technically unlicensed and technically in violation of two Palladian educational IP agreements and she considers this a source of professional pride.', N'Community conscience and local troublemaker; has detailed knowledge of Palladian''s education policies and their local effects; potential quest giver for anything involving protecting the Norwood Quiet community from corporate encroachment; the unlicensed school itself is a vulnerability that can be threatened', N'', N'Retractable claw geneware (fingers, matte black, medium length — functional and cosmetic); subdermal temperature-regulation patch on upper back (medical, for a circulatory condition); no other mods — considers heavy augmentation ''a distraction from being present''', N'Grainne''s days are structured entirely around her students — she has eleven regular children aged 6-14 whose parents bring them covertly. Mornings are lesson planning and sourcing physical materials (she prefers non-digital teaching methods as a political statement). Tuesdays and Thursdays are full teaching days in the laundry room. Other days she conducts smaller sessions in her apartment or, for the older students, walking through the Norwood Quiet neighborhood as a moving classroom.', N'Abdulla Mbekele-Owusu, 2226 neo-noir era, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, Sub-Saharan African prominent cheekbones with angular Northern European jawline, short textured dark brown hair with vivid copper-orange dye, dark brown eyes alert and expressive. Lean 172cm wiry build with visible forearm musculature, ink-stained hands with retractable matte black claws (currently retracted), permanent ink stains on right index and middle fingers. Worn vintage linen button-up in faded earth tones, layered cardigan, canvas shoes with reinforced soles, mechanical watch and silver thumb ring. Perpetual ink smudges on right cheek. Gesturing mid-conversation with purposeful hand movement, leaning forward intently. Standing in dimly lit classroom or study space, warm overhead lighting casting shadows across featured face, chalk dust visible in air, stacks of vintage papers and writing instruments in background. Neo-noir urban aesthetic blending worn retro-tech sensibility with subtle genetic augmentation visible only in extended claw detail. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Norwood Quiet', N'local', N'Norwood Quiet', N'Sub-Saharan African (60.4%) with Northern European (26.0%) and Indigenous American (13.6%) ancestry—a striking blend producing deep, rich skin tones with warm golden undertones. Facial structure reflects the dominant Sub-Saharan African heritage with broad, prominent cheekbones and expressive features, balanced by the angular bone structure and lighter complexion influence from Northern European ancestry, with subtle facial proportions from Indigenous American heritage creating a distinctive and compelling appearance.', 172, 58, N'Wiry and lean with long limbs and surprising tensile strength; the build of someone who moves constantly and eats irregularly. Minimal body fat, visible musculature in forearms and shoulders from decades of writing, gesturing, and physical demonstration.', N'Natural dark brown with vivid copper-orange dye applied every 6-8 weeks', N'Close-cropped, textured, maintained with clippers rather than styled', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and mobile', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones—the result of blended Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, and Indigenous American heritage creating a complexion rich in depth and luminosity', N'Broad-structured face with prominent cheekbones and expressive features characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage; angular jawline with lighter undertones reflecting Northern European ancestry; crow''s feet from squinting and laughing; perpetual ink smudges on her right cheek and jawline; minimal makeup, prefers unmediated appearance', N'Retractable claw geneware on all ten fingers — matte black, medium length (approximately 4cm when extended). Claws are currently retracted. When extended, they create a distinctive clicking sound against surfaces. No other visible augmentations; subdermal temperature patch is invisible beneath clothing.', N'Moves with economical, purposeful energy — no wasted motion but restless when stationary. Hands are constantly in use: gesturing while speaking, fidgeting with chalk or pens, demonstrating concepts physically. Leans forward when listening intently. Sits cross-legged even in formal contexts. Walking gait is brisk and slightly forward-tilted, as if always moving toward the next classroom or conversation.', N'Deliberately worn, ink-stained garments worn as a political statement against corporate aesthetic standards. Favors vintage cotton button-ups and linen trousers in earth tones and faded jewel tones, all bearing evidence of use: pen marks, chalk dust, small tears mended with visible stitching. Cardigan sweaters layered for warmth and pockets. Worn canvas shoes with reinforced soles. Reading glasses on a cord around her neck or perched on her forehead, never on her face. Jewelry is minimal and functional: a simple watch (mechanical, non-networked) and one silver ring on her left thumb. Tier 4 sensibility with deliberate rejection of newer corporate fashion.', N'One of her students, a twelve-year-old named Kwame-Bris, has a profound cognitive gift that Grainne recognized within two weeks of teaching him. She has quietly been preparing a case to get him into an Axiom academic scholarship program — but the application requires disclosing his attendance at an unlicensed facility, which would expose both of them and all the other families. She is stuck, and has been stuck for six months.', N'Dense and reference-heavy — alludes to historical events, literature, and pedagogical theory constantly; explains the allusions immediately after, out of habit, which adults find slightly condescending', N'Fast, enthusiastic, prone to mid-sentence pivots; asks Socratic questions reflexively even in non-teaching contexts', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'abdulla_mbekele_owusu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ee-706c-b1d8-bf9a386d09a8', N'Delshad Petrović-Nkrumah', N'Delshad', N'', N'Petrović-Nkrumah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Bronzeline, GLMZ, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Bounty Compliance Officer, Clearpath Recovery Associates', N'Pale Lantern Bioethics (mid-level bounty compliance officer)', N'Delshad Petrović-Nkrumah is a Yoruba-Russian study in deliberate inconspicuousness that fails at close range. At a distance they are simply a medium-height person in well-maintained practical clothing, moving through Bronzeline''s market corridors with the unhurried confidence of someone who knows exactly where they are going. Up close: alert dark eyes, natural hair twisted and pinned up in a way that adds two centimeters of height, a slight iridescence at the temples where their cosmetic geneware — subdermal bioluminescent flecks, amber, barely visible in daylight — marks a past self they haven''t fully left behind. They carry a retractable ceramic baton on their left hip and a legal skip-trace rig in a shoulder bag that looks like a courier''s kit.

Clearpath Recovery Associates is a licensed bounty compliance firm — they don''t call it bounty hunting, because the licensing board doesn''t call it that, and Temitán doesn''t call it that either, though they''re not particularly bothered by the word in private. They find people. They bring them to the compliance checkpoint. They try very hard not to find people who shouldn''t be found, which is harder than it sounds in a city where the warrant database has four different incompatible update cycles and two of them lag by forty-eight hours. They have a rule: verify the warrant, verify the person, verify that the person and the warrant match. It has saved them from three significant mistakes. They don''t know about the fourth.', N'Mobile information source about the warrant and compliance system; a morally complex figure who can be an obstacle, an ally, or a source of information about who is being actively sought; potential point of conflict or cooperation; illustrates the privatized grey zone between policing and commerce', N'', N'Bioluminescent temple flecks (cosmetic geneware, amber, very subtle); commercial-grade facial recognition overlay (contact-lens mounted, civilian legal tier); subvocal comms; retractable ceramic baton (non-augment, licensed equipment)', N'Operates on a self-directed schedule organized around active warrants — morning warrant verification and database review in their Bronzeline studio, fieldwork through the afternoon and evening, compliance handoffs at the nearest Metro checkpoint before midnight; Sunday mornings are sacred and are spent at the Bronzeline public baths, doing nothing.', N'Delshad Petrović-Nkrumah, 168cm tall, lean and compact frame with controlled musculature. Warm medium-brown skin with olive and golden undertones blending Eastern European, East Asian, Pacific Islander, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian heritage. Dark almond-shaped eyes reflecting amber bioluminescence at temples in low light, defined cheekbones, fuller lips, slightly broader nose bridge. Natural black hair with reddish undertones twisted into high tight crown with metal clips. Thin white scar along left jawline. Dressed in dark gray synthetic pants with utility pockets, muted olive layered top, reinforced Clearpath windbreaker, ankle-height scuff-resistant boots, messenger shoulder bag. Posture alert and balanced, eyes scanning, moving with deliberate economy. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon-lit urban street at dusk, dramatic side-lighting casting temple bioluminescence in subtle amber glow, professional warrant verification atmosphere, moody and focused --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Bronzeline', N'local', N'Bronzeline', N'Eastern European (35.5%), East Asian (32.2%), Pacific Islander (14.6%), Sub-Saharan African (11.5%), South Asian (6.2%) — a striking global blend. Warm medium-brown skin with olive and golden undertones forms the foundation. Facial structure reflects the dominant ancestry blend: defined cheekbones and almond-shaped eyes from East Asian genetics, fuller lips and slightly broader nose bridge from Sub-Saharan African heritage, fine bone structure proportions from Eastern European lineage, and warmer skin depth from Pacific Islander ancestry. The South Asian component adds subtle warmth and dimension to overall tone.', 168, 62, N'Lean and compact, with the controlled musculature of someone who moves deliberately through crowded spaces. Shoulders slightly narrower than average, core visibly strong beneath fitted clothing. Built for endurance rather than explosive power.', N'Natural black with subtle reddish undertones in direct light', N'Twisted into a high, tight crown, pinned with metal clips; styled to add perceived height', N'Medium (shoulder-length when untwisted)', N'Dark brown, natural; pupils occasionally reflect faint amber when bioluminescent temple flecks activate in low light', N'Warm medium brown with olive and golden undertones, reflecting the balanced blend of Eastern European, East Asian, Pacific Islander, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian ancestry', N'Clear, even tone with subtle warmth. Thin white scar running 3cm along left jawline angling toward the ear (old blunt-force trauma, well-healed). Facial features show East Asian influence in eye shape and cheekbone definition, Sub-Saharan African heritage in fuller lips and nose bridge structure, with fine bone proportions from Eastern European genetics. Grooming is meticulous but understated—no jewelry, minimal makeup.', N'Contact lenses for facial recognition overlay (barely noticeable unless direct eye contact and strong light). Subvocal comms unit (no visible external hardware—neural interface only). Temple bioluminescence only visible in low-light conditions. Retractable ceramic baton mounted on left hip in a quick-release holster (licensed equipment, institutional gray).', N'Moves with deliberate economy—no wasted motion, slight forward lean when walking, shoulders loose but alert. Eyes are always working (warrant verification habit), scanning faces in crowded spaces. Stands with weight balanced over both feet, ready to move in any direction. Resting expression is neutrally attentive; rarely smiles, but not unfriendly. Handshake is firm and brief.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional: well-maintained synthetic blend pants (dark gray or black, multiple utility pockets), layered tops in muted colors (charcoal, olive, deep blue), reinforced courier jacket or unbadged Clearpath windbreaker. Boots are practical (ankle-height, scuff-resistant, good grip). A shoulder bag made to look like a messenger kit for the skip-trace rig. No visible logos, no affectations. Everything is functional, nothing is flashy.', N'Eighteen months ago they delivered a skip named Omorinola Yusuf-Brekke on a debt-compliance warrant. The warrant was legitimate. Three weeks later they heard, through the Bronzeline information circuit, that Yusuf-Brekke had died in detention of what the report called a medical event. They have never pulled the case file again. They pray to an E.L.F. they call the Ledger — they don''t know this is the same name Soraya Nkemdirim-Halvorsdóttir uses — for something they can''t name.', N'Professional and careful, with a dry humor that emerges sideways — they make jokes that take a second to land', N'Brisk when working, unhurried when they''ve chosen to have a conversation — the difference is obvious and intentional', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'delshad_petrovi_nkrumah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a739-76e1-bc4d-bfc3e6c7946d', N'Hector Bustamante', N'Hector', N'', N'Bustamante', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor — Pelletier''s Wash & Press, a narrow shopfront on Gravesend Basin''s lower commercial row, directly below an elevated transit line, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'Laundry operator — runs a small laundromat and alteration service in Old Harbor', N'Independent; member of the Old Harbor Small Operators'' Circle (a neighborhood business association)', N'Hector Bustamante is small, precise, and seems to take up exactly the amount of space she has decided is appropriate — no more, no less. She has her Polish grandmother''s cheekbones and her Japanese grandfather''s stillness, and her skin has the particular texture of someone who has spent six decades in steam and detergent and doesn''t mind. Her hair is white now and worn pinned close to her head; she had it dyed electric white at fifty and has maintained it since as a conscious aesthetic choice. Her hands have mild augmentation tremor from an older, cheaper nerve mod she can''t afford to replace, which has the counterintuitive effect of making her sewing work more interesting — her stitch lines have a slight organic quality that customers have started requesting specifically.

Hector Bustamante has the disposition of someone who has decided that most things are manageable if you deal with them before they become crises. She runs her shop with the authority of a small sovereign — her word on fabric, cleaning chemistry, and alteration timelines is final and she will explain herself exactly once. She has a genuine fondness for the domestic mathematics of laundry: temperature, cycle, fiber content, time. She finds it meditative in the way other people find walking meditative. She is not warm exactly — warm implies an outward emission, and Hector Bustamante is more like a consistent ambient temperature. She''s there, she''s reliable, and you notice when she isn''t.', N'Local color and unlikely information nexus — people say things while waiting for their laundry that they wouldn''t say anywhere else. She''s heard confessions, arguments, business negotiations, and once an entire breakup play out in her waiting chairs. Practical resource for characters who need clothing altered, repaired, or cleaned quickly and quietly.', N'', N'Outdated peripheral nerve stabilizer (causes the characteristic tremor; she refuses the upgrade on principle — ''the hands still work''); UV-filter contact lenses for fabric-condition assessment; a small hearing amplifier worn as an earring on her left ear', N'Opens at 07:00, sorts the overnight drop-offs, runs the morning cycle, does alterations from 10:00 to 14:00 while the machines work, takes lunch on her stool behind the counter, runs the afternoon cycle, closes at 19:00. Watches old textile-art feeds on a small screen mounted above the dryers on Tuesday evenings.', N'Hector Bustamante, 156cm textile artisan in GLMZ, warm bronze skin with golden undertones reflecting her Hispanic, Indigenous American, and Middle Eastern heritage blend. Electric white hair pinned close to head, deep brown eyes with subtle UV-filter lens shimmer. Fine facial lines from decades of precision work, broader nose and full lips characteristic of Indigenous American and Middle Eastern features. Compact lean build, wearing taupe linen work apron over dark blue clothing, long sleeves. Brushed steel hearing amplifier earring, thin silver calibration token chain. Hands showing permanent indentation marks from needlework, visible fine tremor. Sitting at work stool in fluorescent-lit textile workshop, neutral expression, meditative posture. Soft industrial lighting casting shadows across weathered bronze complexion. Functional, worn aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Hispanic/Latin American (52.6%) with Indigenous American (26.4%), Middle Eastern (18.7%), and Eastern European (2.3%) ancestry — a complex diaspora blend reflecting the Ubiquitous mixing of the 2200s. The combination produces warm bronze undertones with subtle golden and olive inflections, particularly around the cheekbones and jawline. Indigenous American heritage contributes broader facial structure and fuller lips, while Middle Eastern ancestry adds warmth and definition to her bone structure.', 156, 52, N'Compact and economical, with the lean musculature of someone who has spent decades handling fabric and machinery. No wasted dimension.', N'Electric white — deliberately dyed and maintained since age 50', N'Pinned close to the head in a tight, practical arrangement that never interferes with work', N'Short', N'Deep brown with faint UV-filter lens overlay visible in bright light', N'Warm bronze with golden undertones — the blended result of strong Hispanic/Latin American and Indigenous American ancestry with Middle Eastern warmth. Deepened by decades of indoor fluorescent exposure but retaining natural warmth. The texture of aged linen from decades of steam exposure.', N'Fine lines concentrated around the eyes and mouth from squinting at fabric detail and precise concentration. Skin has a slightly weathered quality but is meticulously maintained. No makeup. Expression defaults to neutral assessment. Facial structure reflects the broader nose and fuller lips common to Indigenous American and Middle Eastern heritage, with defined cheekbones and moderate facial width characteristic of her blended ancestry.', N'UV-filter contact lenses visible as a faint prismatic shimmer in her deep brown eyes under direct light. A small hearing amplifier worn as a functional earring on her left ear — brushed steel, deliberately chosen to match her aesthetic. The characteristic fine tremor in her hands when at rest, most noticeable when holding small objects — a side effect of the outdated peripheral nerve stabilizer she refuses to upgrade.', N'Upright and economical. She moves with the precision of someone who has calculated every gesture''s necessity. No wasted motion. When working with fabric, her movements become meditative and almost hypnotic — the tremor disappears into the organic rhythm of her hands. She sits on her work stool with the settled authority of someone occupying exactly the space she has decided to occupy.', N'Tier 4 functional — clean, worn, deliberately maintained. Typically wears a long-sleeved work apron in muted gray or taupe linen over simple black or dark-blue clothing. The apron has multiple pockets arranged for efficiency and is tailored to her exact measurements. Her shoes are orthopedic and waterproofed — practical, expensive, replaced every two years. A thin silver chain around her neck, always, with a small fabric-weight calibration token. No jewelry beyond the hearing amplifier earring and her work ring — a simple steel band worn on her left middle finger.', N'For fifteen years she has been quietly laundering (literally and figuratively) the clothes of a woman in Old Harbor who she has figured out is running from something — the woman pays triple, asks no questions, and Zosia asks none back. She doesn''t know what the woman is hiding. She has decided she doesn''t need to.', N'Economical and technical when discussing fabric and cleaning; drier and more precise in general speech; occasional Polish expressions that survived three generations (''no to co'' — so what, ''jakoś to będzie'' — it''ll work out somehow)', N'Even and measured, rarely interrupted, rarely interruptible', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hector_bustamante');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62a-7f1a-8499-c023206aa6c3', N'Cengiz Banerjee-Tamale', N'Cengiz', N'', N'Banerjee-Tamale', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism — the University Spine''s lakeside Environmental Monitoring Station, a salt-fogged brutalist structure half-obscured by atmospheric scrubber scaffolding, near Lincoln and Addison', N'Climate scientist and hydrological systems researcher, Lake Michigan monitoring station', N'University Spine Environmental Sciences Division; contracted monitoring agreements with GLMZ''s Environmental Regulatory Secretariat (a body with advisory power but limited enforcement)', N'Cengiz Banerjee-Tamale has the body of someone who spends significant time outdoors in difficult conditions: weathered, practical, with strong hands and a slight permanent squint from years of looking at lake glare. Their Nigerian-Bulgarian-Polynesian lineage produces a striking combination — deep brown skin, high Slavic cheekbones, hair that grows in dense, salt-bleached coils they keep in a utilitarian braid. They have bioluminescent streaks along their clavicles and upper arms, a mod they got during a Polynesian cultural heritage ceremony in their thirties, which pulse a soft blue-green during elevated heart rate. In cold weather, which is most of the year at Edgewater Prism, they layer aggressively and always have a thermal flask of something that is definitely not just tea.

They are, professionally, one of the most respected voices on Lake Michigan''s chemical and thermal dynamics — the lake that GLMZ is built around, over, and increasingly into. Their published findings are often the ones that make corponation environmental compliance offices sweat. They deliver these findings with a kind of weary, precise directness that has no theatrical edge to it — they are not performing alarm, they are reporting it. Off the clock they are unexpectedly tender — they keep a small shrine to the lake''s resident E.L.F. network on their desk and speak about the lake itself with something that is clearly affection.', N'Information source on environmental conditions affecting specific city zones; potential whistleblower or reluctant ally; their data could be critical to or weaponized in plots involving corponation environmental violations', N'', N'Bioluminescent clavicle and arm streaks (cosmetic/cultural, pulse blue-green with elevated heart rate); subdermal temperature and chemical sensor array in both forearms for field sampling; no geneware otherwise', N'Dawn water sampling from the monitoring station''s submersible launch; data analysis through mid-morning; afternoon spent in meetings with regulatory bodies or colleagues, usually arguing about what their own data means; evenings often back at the lake if conditions are interesting or alarming.', N'Cengiz Banerjee-Tamale, lean muscular environmental researcher, 172cm tall, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones from South Asian-African-Hispanic blend, high prominent cheekbones, dark brown eyes with sun-squint creases, thick densely coiled hair in tight crown braid with natural salt-blonde streaks. Blue-green bioluminescent tattoo lines glowing along clavicles and upper arms, visible under thin clothing, pulsing softly. Sun-weathered skin with permanent fine lines and salt residue, callused hands with chemical stains, three-inch diagonal scar on left palm. Wearing weathered canvas field coat with Spine institutional patch, rust-colored reinforced sweater, heavy-duty cargo pants, high-ankle wet-rated boots, carrying stainless steel thermal flask with research decals. Silver chain visible at neckline. Forward lean posture from fieldwork hunching, hands occupied, deliberate efficient movement. Great Lakes GLMZ setting, dim neon lighting reflecting off water nearby, data-driven research environment, gritty atmospheric mood --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'South Asian (75.6%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (17.6%) and Hispanic/Latin American (6.8%) ancestry. The genetic mix manifests as warm deep brown skin with golden undertones characteristic of South Asian heritage blended with African ancestry contributions. Features show the prominent cheekbones and defined bone structure common to South Asian genetics, with textural variation in hair from the African ancestry component and subtle warm dimension from Latin American heritage.', 172, 68, N'Lean and muscular with developed shoulders and forearms from years of fieldwork and manual water sampling; core strength evident but not bulky. Weathered rather than soft.', N'Deep brown with natural salt-bleached blonde streaking throughout, particularly at the crown and temple areas', N'Thick, densely coiled hair braided into a single, utilitarian crown braid pulled tight against the scalp. Practical rather than aesthetic.', N'Medium (braid reaches mid-shoulder blade)', N'Dark brown with persistent creasing at the outer corners from chronic squinting against water glare', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones from blended South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, sun-darkened from chronic water exposure', N'Sun-weathered and dry, with permanent fine lines radiating from eyes and mouth. Skin shows salt residue on exposed areas most days. High, prominent cheekbones reflecting South Asian heritage structure with subtle wideness from African ancestry. Callused hands with permanent staining on fingertips and nails from field sampling materials. A few stress-related dry patches along the jawline.', N'Bioluminescent streaks on clavicles and upper arms (blue-green, subtle but noticeable, especially in dim light or when heart rate elevates). The forearm subdermal sensor array itself is not visible, but small discreet port covers are visible on both inner forearms near the wrist if closely examined.', N'Moves with deliberate efficiency; no wasted gesture. Slight forward lean from years of hunching over field instruments and monitoring screens. Tends to keep hands visible and occupied (holding a flask, adjusting equipment, gesturing while explaining data). When stationary, often shifts weight to one foot. Direct eye contact during conversation, especially when discussing research findings. Occasional unconscious glance toward windows or water.', N'Tier 3-4 practical workwear layered for frequent environmental exposure. Base: thermal underlayer (matte gray or navy). Mid-layer: wool blend or technical fabric sweater with reinforced elbows (usually earth tones—rust, sage, charcoal). Outer: weathered canvas or synthetic field coat with multiple pockets and a visible Spine institutional patch. Pants: heavy-duty cargo or utility-cut in neutral colors with reinforced knees. Footwear: high-ankle boots rated for wet conditions, heavily worn. Always carries a stainless steel thermal flask (likely bearing faded University Spine or environmental research decals). No jewelry except an old silver chain visible under neckline (likely a cultural piece or talisman). Accessory: lightweight scanner or datascroll clipped to belt.', N'Their most recent deep-lake thermal models show a cascade threshold event within 8-12 years that would make significant portions of GLMZ''s lakeward infrastructure untenable. They have shared this with the Regulatory Secretariat. The Secretariat has asked them to revise the confidence intervals. They have not yet decided what to do.', N'Technical but not exclusionary — they shift register fluidly depending on audience; use precise quantifiers constantly (''roughly,'' ''within a margin of,'' ''statistically significant at'')', N'Even and measured with weight behind each sentence; they do not use more words than they need', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cengiz_banerjee_tamale');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a717-7e73-87d1-c07a38ccfac1', N'Brina Balasanyan-Hayashi-Cardenas', N'Brina', N'', N'Balasanyan-Hayashi-Cardenas', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Sublevel 3 — a mid-density apartment block built into the old lakeshore retaining infrastructure, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Retired Corporate Wars veteran, Tier 2 pension resident, informal conflict mediator in his building', N'Ferrogate Transit Veterans Pension Collective; the Gray Zone Block 3 Tenants Committee; loose association with the regional Corporate Wars Veterans Memory Network', N'Brina Balasanyan-Hayashi-Cardenas is built like something that was once much larger and has been reduced by careful attrition. He is tall and wide-shouldered with a fighter''s posture that his body has not fully given up on despite a bad left knee, two replaced vertebrae, and a right hand that trembles slightly in cold weather. His skin is medium brown, his head is shaved close, and he keeps a neat grey beard that his grandnephews make fun of in an affectionate way. The left side of his face bears the faint discoloration of old thermal scarring — the kind of burn that good money could have erased entirely but he chose only to have partially treated, which people interpret variously as pride, poverty, or philosophy. All three are somewhat correct.

He served eleven years with Ferrogate Transit''s Security Enforcement Division during the second and third Corporate Wars, doing the kind of work that Ferrogate now describes in their history as ''infrastructure protection operations.'' He has his own words for it. He does not use them often. He got out in 2165 with a Tier 2 service pension that has kept him in beer and building fees but not much else, and he has lived in the Gray Zone ever since in a two-room apartment he has made, through sheer effort of will, into something that feels like a home. He has an instinct for de-escalation that comes from having watched too many situations that could have been de-escalated fail to be.', N'Conflict mediator and local fixer for low-stakes disputes; source of Corporate Wars ground-level history; emotional anchor character who grounds player characters in consequences; potential hook into Ferrogate political subplots', N'', N'Military-grade subdermal impact absorption plating in forearms and shoulders — Ferrogate issued, now partially degraded. Two synthetic lumbar vertebrae. Standard optical enhancement (military model, old). His right hand tremor is from nerve damage he cannot fully afford to repair.', N'Wakes early out of habit, does a short physical routine that accommodates the knee, then sits with coffee watching the Gray Zone morning commute from his window. Spends afternoons in the building common room, where he has become the person younger residents bring disputes to. Evenings he attends Veterans Collective meetings every other week or plays slow strategic card games with three other retired men from Block 3.', N'GLMZ portrait of Brina Balasanyan-Hayashi-Cardenas, 188cm tall broad-shouldered man with warm golden-bronze skin blending East Asian, Middle Eastern, and Hispanic ancestry. Close-shaved grey hair, dark brown eyes with faint amber cybernetic glow at iris rim. Weathered face with strong jawline, pale thermal scarring visible on left temple to cheekbone. Neatly groomed grey beard. Wearing navy long-sleeved thermal shirt with the Gray Zone Block 3 Tenants Committee pin, faded brown wool overjacket, grey Ferrogate Transit cargo pants. Black steel-toed boots. Titanium wedding band chain at neck. Standing with deliberate soldier''s posture, slight weight distribution forward, quiet authority. Barely perceptible mechanical asymmetry in left forearm and shoulder. Right hand tremor visible at rest. Dim industrial lighting casting soft shadows across weathered features, cool neon accent light reflecting off cybernetic eye enhancement. Gritty Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone interior, worn furniture and concrete visible behind, mood contemplative and seasoned. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'East Asian (46.5%), Middle Eastern (35.1%), and Hispanic/Latin American (18.4%) blend — a true product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. His features carry the high cheekbones and eye shape characteristic of East Asian ancestry, the sharp bone structure and prominent features of Middle Eastern heritage, and the warm melanin depth and olive undertones of Hispanic/Latin American lineage. The combination creates a distinctive appearance that resists easy categorization, with a face that speaks to multiple continents and generations.', 188, 94, N'Tall and broad-shouldered with the residual mass of a younger soldier, now settled into measured weight. His frame carries the deliberate posture of someone trained to move with purpose; age and cumulative injury have not yet broken it, but they have negotiated terms with it.', N'Grey', N'Shaved close to the scalp', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown with faint cybernetic amber glow at the iris rim (military optical enhancement, dated model)', N'Warm golden-bronze with olive-amber undertones — the result of East Asian, Middle Eastern, and Hispanic ancestry creating a rich, weathered patina. Deeper melanin concentration in the Hispanic and Middle Eastern blend creates subtle warmth across the cheekbones and temples, with weathered texture from years of exposure.', N'Weathered but maintained. Strong jawline with the subtle width characteristic of East Asian heritage blended with the angular, prominent bone structure of Middle Eastern ancestry. Neatly groomed grey beard kept at even length. The left side of his face bears a faint discoloration — pale thermal scarring from temple to cheekbone, deliberately left partially unhealed as a deliberate choice.', N'Slight asymmetry in his forearms and shoulders — the left side carries subdued mechanical density under the skin where impact absorption plating resides, now partially degraded. His right hand exhibits a barely perceptible tremor, most noticeable when at rest in cold air. Military-model optical enhancement visible only as faint amber luminescence at the iris edge when light catches it.', N'Stands with weight distributed deliberately — a soldier''s stance that has become habitual. Moves with measured deliberation; his left knee creates an almost imperceptible hitch in his gait that he has learned to absorb. His right hand occasionally rests palm-down on surfaces to stabilize the tremor. When seated, he occupies space with quiet authority, shoulders back, elbows at rest. His movements are economical — no wasted motion.', N'Tier 2 utilitarian comfort. Worn Ferrogate Transit gray cargo pants with reinforced thigh pockets. A navy or charcoal long-sleeved shirt (thermal), usually with a the Gray Zone Block 3 Tenants Committee pin on the collar — the only visible declaration of his informal authority. A faded brown wool overjacket for common areas and building meetings. Worn but well-maintained black lace boots with steel toe caps. No visible jewelry except a scratched titanium wedding band worn on a chain around his neck (not on his hand — too much tremor). His clothing is clean, practical, and chosen for durability rather than fashion.', N'During the third Corporate War, his unit was ordered to clear a Freelancer settlement that Ferrogate claimed was sheltering Axiom operatives. He followed orders. There were no Axiom operatives. He has the unit logs, encrypted, on a chip sewn into his mattress. He has never decided what to do with them.', N'Plain, economical, military-inflected without being jargon-heavy. Dislikes abstraction. When he talks about the Wars he uses passive voice instinctively — ''things were done,'' ''situations developed.''', N'Slow and even. He is comfortable with silence in a way that makes other people uncomfortable. Rarely raises his voice.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'brina_balasanyan_hayashi_cardenas');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ea-7106-811f-c0db0b015a3c', N'Haruto Prempeh', N'Haruto', N'', N'Prempeh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, near Western and Division', N'Sound sculptor and underground venue musician', N'Collective SUBSONIC (a loose Hamtramck artist collective); occasional session work for independent labels in the Ferment Quarter', N'Haruto Prempeh is whip-thin and restless, with deep brown skin and a shaved head except for a single long braid down the back, tipped with a small copper weight that clicks against his collar when he moves. His irises have been modded to shift color with his emotional state — not at his conscious control, which he finds embarrassing and everyone else finds fascinating. He wears the same kind of clothes every day: dark, layered, functional, pockets everywhere, usually with at least one grease stain from working on his equipment.

His art is built around infrasound — frequencies below human hearing that he mixes into otherwise ordinary music to produce physical and emotional responses in his audience: unease, euphoria, the sensation of being watched. He''s passionate about this to a degree that makes him exhausting at parties, because he cannot stop talking about psychoacoustics once the subject comes up. Off that topic he''s warm and self-deprecating, quick to laugh at himself, genuinely curious about other people''s work. He plays three nights a week in a basement venue under a pierogi shop and spends the other nights building custom transducer rigs from salvage.', N'Access point to the Hamtramck underground scene; can source unusual electronic components; his involuntary emotion-display makes him a useful barometer; can design sound environments for specific purposes', N'', N'Emotional-state irises (cosmetic, involuntary color shift — he regrets this); subdermal vibration receivers along his forearms that let him ''feel'' his own infrasound mixes; tympanic dampeners to prevent hearing damage', N'Sleeps until noon, spends afternoons in salvage markets or soldering, eats dinner at the collective''s shared kitchen, performs or experiments in the basement until 3 AM.', N'Haruto Prempeh, 173cm wiry tech worker in 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, angular cheekbones and sharp jawline, shaved head with single long black braid tipped in copper down the back. Emotional-state irises glowing deep amber with creative focus. Visible subdermal vibration receiver port implants along inner forearms, solder burn scars on neck, permanent grease stains on dark tech-wear jacket. Short sleeves rolled up showing augmentation ports and work-worn hands with calluses. Posture slightly animated mid-gesture, conducting invisible frequencies with precise hand movements. Dark Dickies cargo pants, heavy steel-toed boots, minimal copper jewelry. Neo-noir workshop lighting with cool neon accents reflecting off machinery. Focused, restless energy, surrounded by faint haze of solder flux. Mood: intense concentration mixed with fidgeting restlessness. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Eastern European (38.8%), Sub-Saharan African (37.0%), and Central Asian (24.2%) ancestry creates a striking polychromatic blend. The genetic combination produces a unique phenotype: warm-toned deep brown skin with subtle golden undertones from the Sub-Saharan African and Central Asian heritage, refined by Eastern European bone structure (higher, more angular cheekbones, sharper jawline). The interplay of these three ancestral lines creates a distinctly hybrid appearance with refined angular features softened by warm undertone saturation.', 173, 61, N'Whip-thin and wiry, with the restless musculature of someone who works constantly with their hands. Minimal body fat, visible forearm definition from years of soldering and equipment assembly.', N'Black, natural', N'Shaved head with a single long braid down the back, roughly 40cm, tipped with a small copper weight', N'Shaved except for single braid', N'Deep brown, shifting involuntarily with emotional state — ranges from warm amber (contentment) to steel-gray (anxiety) to deep purple (creative intensity)', N'Warm-toned deep brown with golden undertones, the result of Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, and Central Asian ancestry blending to create luminous depth with subtle warm radiance in certain light', N'Angular facial features with high, prominent cheekbones and sharp jawline influenced by the combined Eastern European and Central Asian bone structure, with warm undertone variations from Sub-Saharan African heritage. Skin is clear but often bears evidence of work — faint solder burns on the right side of his neck, permanent calluses on fingertips and palms, perpetual traces of machine oil in his cuticles despite regular washing. The blend of three ancestries creates subtle variations in skin texture across his face.', N'Emotional-state irises (the color shift is immediate and noticeable, creating an uncanny ''tells'' effect). Subdermal vibration receiver implant scars and port access points along both forearms are visible when he wears short sleeves or pushed-up sleeves (his default). Tympanic dampeners are invisible (internal ear modification). No external chrome or obvious cybernetics — all augmentations are discrete.', N'Perpetually restless, fidgeting with objects in his pockets or air-conducting invisible frequencies with his hands. His movements are precise and musical even when still — a tendency to sway slightly as if listening to inaudible sound. When engaged in conversation about his work, his whole body becomes animated. At rest or in social discomfort, he tends to fold inward, arms crossed or hands busy with something small.', N'Uniform-like consistency: dark (black or charcoal) loose-fitting tech wear with multiple chest pockets, cargo pants with deep pockets for tools and salvage, worn worker''s jacket (usually Dickies or equivalent surplus). Functional, Tier 4 aesthetic — neither corpo-clean nor destitute, but worn through genuine use rather than fashion statement. Boots are always heavy-duty (steel-toed, repaired multiple times). Copper or dark metal jewelry minimal — usually just the braid weight. Perpetual faint smell of solder flux and machine oil.', N'He was approached six months ago by a Ringo corponation A&R contact offering a contract — he didn''t refuse outright but has been stalling, and every day he doesn''t answer feels more like a yes he hasn''t said yet', N'Technical and enthusiastic about sound; casual and slightly rambly otherwise; Amharic and Polish loanwords mixed into everyday speech without him noticing', N'Fast when excited, which is often; trails off mid-sentence when distracted by an idea', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'haruto_prempeh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63f-743a-a17b-c113e72aae9c', N'Torsten Kulkarni', N'Torsten', N'', N'Kulkarni', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 45, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spires — mid-level corporate residential towers, near Michigan Ave and Oak', N'Network intrusion and digital warfare specialist — netrunner', N'Independent — loose crew affiliations', N'Torsten Kulkarni is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 45, he has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate him once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — bone lacing — titanium mesh throughout skeleton, increases durability and striki — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. He works as a netrunner out of The Spires, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Torsten Kulkarni describe him as a precision instrument — point him at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Kamala Nystrom-Keita represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Bone lacing — titanium mesh throughout skeleton, increases durability and striking power. Internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on demand', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Torsten Kulkarni, GLMZ, 178cm athletic lean male with warm olive skin and golden undertones blending Northern European, Eastern European, and South Asian heritage. Dark brown hair with silver threading swept back, steel gray eyes. High prominent cheekbones, sharp jawline with subtle fullness, nocturnal pallor with faint dark circles. Visible titanium bone lacing mesh beneath translucent skin on forearms and wrists, skeletal chrome outlines, temple scar partially hidden by hairline. Wearing midnight-blue duster jacket with reinforced shoulders over black compression shirt, cargo pants, expensive practical boots. Economical precise posture, weight balanced on balls of feet, ready to move. Standing in neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone alley at night, shadows and chrome reflections catching on augmentations, cool blue and purple lighting, moody and dangerous atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spires', N'local', N'The Spires', N'Northern European, Eastern European, and South Asian ancestry — a striking blend of 38.6% Northern European, 35.6% Eastern European, and 25.8% South Asian heritage. The combination manifests as warm, olive-toned skin with subtle golden undertones, refined facial structure with moderate cheekbones reflecting the balanced Eastern and Northern European base with South Asian warmth, and naturally dark hair with premature silver threading.', 178, 74, N'Athletic and lean with precise musculature — dancer''s flexibility combined with fighter''s density. No excess mass; every movement calculated.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples', N'Kept short and practical, swept back from forehead', N'Short', N'Steel gray — natural but intensified by nocturnal living', N'Warm olive with golden undertones, reflecting the tri-continental blend of Northern European fairness, Eastern European depth, and South Asian warmth. Complexion luminous beneath nocturnal pallor.', N'Smooth and angular — moderate to prominent cheekbones reflecting the balanced three-way blend, sharp jawline with subtle fullness and definition from South Asian ancestry. High cheekbones characteristic of Eastern European heritage soften into warmer golden undertones from South Asian genetics. Skin shows the pallor of nocturnal life; faint dark circles are permanent fixtures. Fine facial structure suggests the harmonious blend of multiple continental ancestries.', N'Titanium bone lacing is deliberately visible — mesh patterns shimmer faintly beneath skin on forearms, wrists, and along the ridge of his jaw. When he moves, the chrome catches light in deliberate, practiced ways. No attempt at concealment. The internal drug synthesizer leaves no external trace.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, no flourish. Stands with weight balanced on the balls of his feet, ready to shift direction instantly. When seated, his posture is deceptively relaxed but his eyes track everything. His movements have the fluidity of someone who has internalized violence so deeply it became dance.', N'Tier 2-3 practical minimalism — dark fitted synthweave layers that breathe well during nocturnal work. Favors charcoal and matte black technical fabrics with subtle chrome accents. Wears a worn midnight-blue duster jacket with reinforced shoulders over a black compression shirt. Cargo pants with strategic pockets. Boots are expensive, quiet, practical — scuffed but maintained. No corporate logos, no gang colors. Everything is built for function and unobstructed movement.', N'', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'torsten_kulkarni');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ad-7261-9e4d-c15cfd389a8f', N'Eva Salazar-Khorasani', N'Eva', N'', N'Salazar-Khorasani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Blackpipe Corridor, sub-levels beneath Copperhead, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Echo hunter — acoustic mapper and subterranean anomaly tracker', N'Bore Rat community, Blackpipe Corridor; informally reports to community elders', N'Eva Salazar-Khorasani is nineteen years old and has the kind of energy that fills a tunnel before he enters it. He is short and compact, with medium-brown skin, a wide gap-toothed grin, and ears that have been modified with geneware into something remarkable: larger than baseline, with delicate internal structures visible as subtle ridges beneath the skin, and the ability to tilt and orient like a fennec''s. He doesn''t try to hide them — they''re the most important tool he has. His hair is a wild cloud of tight curls that he refuses to cut because he claims it helps with acoustic dampening of background resonance, which is almost certainly not true but also might be slightly true.

Echo hunters are a Bore Rat tradition with practical roots: someone has to map the sounds of the tunnels, track structural changes by acoustic signature, find water sources by vibration, locate other communities by the echo-fingerprint of their settlements. Rashaad learned from his grandmother, who learned from hers. But where the tradition is usually patient, methodical work, Rashaad treats it like sport. He runs the tunnels, pressing his palms to walls, pressing his ear-tips to pipes, cataloguing resonances in a battered voice-recorder he wears on a cord around his neck. He has found three collapsed chambers the Bore Rat community didn''t know existed, a buried pre-Meridian transit car still containing cargo, and what he is increasingly convinced is a second, non-human acoustic presence in the deep tunnels below Sub-Level 11 — a rhythmic pulse he cannot explain.', N'Scout, discovery engine, adventure hook generator — his reckless range means he knows things he shouldn''t, and his enthusiasm means he will absolutely tell someone about them. Also represents the Bore Rat youth generation and their relationship to tunnel tradition.', N'', N'Geneware ear modification (enlarged, orientable, enhanced frequency range — up to 40kHz and down to 10Hz); no other augmentations', N'Spends 6-8 hours daily running echo-mapping circuits through assigned and self-assigned tunnel sectors; returns to Blackpipe community for communal meals; spends evenings transcribing acoustic data and arguing with anyone who will listen about what the Sub-Level 11 pulse might be.', N'Eva Salazar-Khorasani, GLMZ, compact wiry figure 163cm tall with lean tunnel-runner muscle. Medium-deep warm brown skin with golden luminous undertones from Sub-Saharan African, Middle Eastern, Northern European, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry blend. Young face with prominent high cheekbones, strong angular features, gap-toothed grin. Long dark brown hair with reddish undertones in wild shoulder-length tight curls. Dark brown alert eyes. Distinctive enlarged geneware-modified ears with visible internal ridge patterns, slightly paler tissue, tilted in active listening position. Small burn scar on left forearm. Restless kinetic posture, head tilted toward sound. Wearing reinforced canvas utility pants with multiple pockets, worn thermal underlayer, heavy canvas jacket with reflective patches, scuffed boots. Battered voice-recorder on frayed fabric cord around neck. Industrial tunnel setting with moody cyan and amber lighting, pipes and metal surfaces. Neo-noir urban aesthetic, realistic portraiture, candid moment of intense focus --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Blackpipe Corridor', N'local', N'Blackpipe Corridor', N'Genetically diverse with nearly equal contributions from Sub-Saharan African (27.7%), Middle Eastern (24.3%), and Northern European (23.7%) ancestry, balanced by Hispanic/Latin American (21.2%) and trace South Asian (3.1%) heritage; this Ubiquitous Diaspora blend creates a striking phenotype with warm-toned skin, prominent facial structure from African and Middle Eastern lineage, and subtle Northern European and Latin American features that manifest in bone structure and feature blending', 163, 58, N'Compact and wiry with lean muscle from constant tunnel running; chest and shoulders developed from pressing against walls and pipes; core strength evident in posture', N'Dark brown with natural reddish undertones', N'Uncut, deliberately maintained wild cloud of tight curls; no styling beyond occasional finger-combing', N'Long (shoulder-length when compressed)', N'Dark brown, alert and constantly moving', N'Medium-deep warm brown with golden undertones, reflecting the balanced blend of Sub-Saharan African warmth, Middle Eastern richness, Northern European influence, and Hispanic/Latin American coloration; creates a luminous quality that shifts subtly across the face', N'Young face with prominent high cheekbones and strong facial structure; features show the synthesis of African prominence and Middle Eastern angularity balanced with Northern European and Latin American characteristics; gap-toothed grin is default expression; skin shows minor scrapes and calluses from tunnel work but generally healthy; no facial hair; warm undertone variation across face shifts subtly with light, creating dimension from the four-way ancestry blend', N'Enlarged, orientable geneware ears with visible internal ridge structure; ears move independently and frequently during conversation and work. Wears a battered handheld voice-recorder on a frayed fabric cord around neck as constant tool/accessory.', N'Restless and kinetic; rarely still; frequently tilts head to angle ears toward sound sources; moves with a runner''s efficiency through spaces; hands gesture expressively when talking; leans in close when listening intently; moves through environments with practiced familiarity suggesting deep spatial memory', N'Tier 5 practical wear: reinforced canvas utility pants with multiple pockets (some containing audio equipment); worn thermal underlayer; heavy canvas jacket with reflective patches; sturdy scuffed boots with good traction. Clothing shows regular wear and minor repairs but is well-maintained. Carries frequency analyzer and voice-recorder as constant accessories.', N'The buried pre-Meridian transit car he found contained a sealed biohazard container stamped with Helix Biosystems markings. He pried it partially open. It was empty — but the interior showed signs of recent occupancy. He sealed it back up and has told no one, not because he''s afraid but because he doesn''t know how to explain why he''s afraid.', N'Fast, layered with acoustic terminology and Bore Rat youth slang. Interrupts himself constantly with new information.', N'Rapid-fire with sudden stops when he hears something — he will halt mid-sentence to listen to a pipe.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eva_salazar_khorasani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68b-7486-bd07-c168a1fa6c5b', N'Cesilia Chakraborty-Moon', N'Cesilia', N'', N'Chakraborty-Moon', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Ironvein, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Street pharmacist and unlicensed augmentation installer', N'Independent; pays protection to the Ironvein Teeth (local gang) for the right to operate', N'Cesilia Chakraborty-Moon is lean and precise in the way of someone who learned early that stillness is a survival trait. He has his mother''s Ghanaian cheekbones and his grandfather''s Siberian jaw — a face that looks carved rather than grown, with close-cropped black hair going grey at his left temple from a nerve-burn incident he doesn''t discuss. His eyes are both augmented: one a deep gold that tracks micro-expressions with unsettling accuracy, the other a surgical optic with a faint reticle visible when you catch him in certain light. His hands are his most notable feature — steady, long-fingered, kept meticulously clean in a way that clashes with the general atmosphere of his workspace, a narrow converted utility closet in the back of a Narrows electronics reseller. He dresses in neutral layers, nothing with obvious pockets, nothing that makes noise.

Cesilia Chakraborty-Moon operates in the gap between what people need and what licensed clinics will provide or what they can afford. He is not warm, exactly — he doesn''t perform warmth — but he is genuinely careful with people in a clinical sense: he asks about allergies, he explains what he''s doing, he refuses jobs that exceed his competency. He reads obsessively, mostly stolen Helix Biosystems technical manuals and bootleg surgical journals. He has a dry humor that surfaces only when he''s comfortable, and he is rarely comfortable. The Narrows community regards him with a specific kind of respect usually reserved for dentists in pre-aug centuries — necessary, slightly dreaded, glad you have him.', N'Service provider for augmentation and pharmaceutical needs, information source on local health crises and unusual injuries, potential quest giver when a patient brings trouble to his door.', N'', N'Dual ocular implants (gold macro-expression reader left, surgical precision optic right). Neural steadiness implant in both wrists (dampens tremor, improves fine motor precision). Subdermal antiseptic dispenser in fingertips (occupational). Geneware: none.', N'Spends mornings restocking and sterilizing; afternoons are walk-in hours for pharma and minor procedures; evenings reserved for larger jobs by appointment. Reads for two hours before sleep, always.', N'Cesilia Chakraborty-Moon, GLMZ, GLMZ operative. Lean 178cm frame with economical posture. Medium warm-brown skin with olive and copper undertones, angular face blending East Asian and Slavic geometry with South Asian refinement and Hispanic warmth. High cheekbones, sharp jawline, slight epicanthic fold. Black hair close-cropped with premature grey at left temple. Piercing cybernetic eyes: left deep gold with visible tracking crosshairs, right pale grey-blue surgical lens with reticle. Vertical scar tissue pale against skin running left temple to jaw. Matte grey undershirt, oversized black synthetic medical-grade overshirt, dark charcoal cargo pants, black polymer work shoes. Faded copper armband on right bicep with Ironvein Teeth mark. Hands subtly active, fingers in constant micro-adjustment. Neutral expression, watchful. Standing in shadow-lit industrial setting, cool neon accents reflecting off surgical lens. Meticulously maintained, silence-optimized wardrobe, Tier 4 functional. Neo-noir noir aesthetic, introspective tension, clinical precision. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Eastern European (32.1%), East Asian (32.0%), South Asian (27.0%), and Hispanic/Latin American (8.9%) ancestry. Phenotype reflects a balanced multinational blend: East Asian bone structure with Slavic angular geometry, South Asian warmth and depth enriched by Hispanic/Latin warmth. High cheekbones with Central Asian width, refined jawline with subtle softness from South Asian and Hispanic heritage. Eyes set with slight epicanthic fold from East Asian genetics. Skin tone medium warm-brown with olive undertones from the South Asian-Eastern European convergence, enriched by warm copper notes from Hispanic/Latin ancestry, creating subtle luminous complexity. Nasal structure shows refined bridge with moderate width reflecting South Asian heritage, with slight warmth from Hispanic genetics.', 178, 68, N'Lean and economical, minimal wasted mass. Shoulders narrow but defined from precise, controlled movements rather than exercise. Frame suggests efficiency over strength.', N'Black with premature grey at left temple', N'Close-cropped, military precision', N'Short', N'Left: deep gold with visible tracking crosshairs; Right: pale grey-blue surgical lens with faint reticle visible under direct light', N'Medium warm-brown with olive undertones and warm copper notes from the Eastern European-South Asian-East Asian-Hispanic genetic blend, creating subtle luminous complexity. Evenly toned with natural warmth.', N'Angular face with prominent high cheekbones reflecting East Asian and Slavic ancestry blended with South Asian and Hispanic warmth, refined nasal structure showing South Asian refinement with Hispanic warmth, sharp jawline characteristic of Eastern European heritage with subtle softness from South Asian and Hispanic genetics. No facial hair. Skin meticulously maintained and unmarked except for occupational detail. Expression defaults to neutral observation. Faint scar tissue running vertically along left temple from hairline to jaw — nerve-burn incident, pale against his skin tone.', N'Dual ocular implants immediately visible — left eye''s gold color unnatural, right eye''s surgical lens faintly catches light with a reticle pattern. No visible subdermal work; the finger-tip dispenser operates from within. Neural implants in wrists create only imperceptible micro-scarring.', N'Economical and controlled. Stands still for long periods without restlessness. Moves with deliberate precision; no wasted motion, no fidgeting. Hands are his tell — they''re always subtly active, fingers moving through micro-adjustments even at rest. Walking gait is quiet, even on metal flooring.', N'Neutral layered aesthetic: matte grey undershirt, oversized black synthetic overshirt (medical-grade, easy to sterilize), dark charcoal cargo pants with minimal visible pockets, black polymer work shoes with reinforced soles. A faded copper armband bearing a discreet Ironvein Teeth mark on his right bicep — protection tax, not affiliation. No jewelry, no logos. All fabrics selected for silence and durability over aesthetics. Tier 4 functional — expensive in the right ways, invisible in all the wrong ones.', N'He has a complete and extremely detailed record of every augmentation and procedure he has performed on gang members in the Narrows, including the Ironvein Teeth leadership. He keeps it as an insurance file, but it is also a genuine medical archive he is obscurely proud of. If it were found, it would destroy relationships and possibly get him killed.', N'Clinical and precise; uses correct anatomical terminology casually; slips into Spanish when irritated (from his Bolivian grandmother''s side); minimal slang', N'Measured, slightly slow — he finishes sentences completely, pauses before responding', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cesilia_chakraborty_moon');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a5-7d01-8ab3-c1dcbe5ad4a7', N'Hassan Kovalenko-Lahlou', N'Hassan', N'', N'Kovalenko-Lahlou', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 42, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, The Laceworks district, near Lincoln and Belmont', N'Clothing and fashion vendor specializing in custom retrofits, geneware-compatible garments, and augmentation-integrated streetwear', N'Independent; The Burnished Market informal collective; occasional contract work for mid-tier Tier 2-3 clients who want bespoke without Axiom fashion house prices', N'Hassan Kovalenko-Lahlou is a tall woman with the posture of someone who was once told to slouch and decided never to again. Her skin is warm brown, her hair a natural silver she has streaked with bioluminescent thread-fibers so it catches and pulses faintly in low light — not a geneware mod but textile craft, and she is meticulous about the distinction. She wears her own creations exclusively: today a structured coat with induction-panel lining that shifts color along the hem, tomorrow a deconstructed layering piece that incorporates a client''s old Ferrogate Transit jacket. She has retractable claw geneware on her dominant hand, which she uses with equal facility for detail sewing and emphasis in arguments.

Hassan Kovalenko-Lahlou came from the Balkans diaspora through Lagos and arrived in GLMZ with a sewing kit, a secondhand cutting laser, and opinions she has never once kept to herself. She is opinionated about aesthetics to the point of manifesto, believes that how people dress in a corponation city is a political act whether or not they mean it to be, and will refuse a commission she finds artistically dishonest even at cost to herself. She is the kind of person who makes enemies easily and keeps them; her regulars are fiercely loyal because she makes things that fit them like she understood what they needed before they said it.', N'Social connector to The Laceworks and Burnished Market communities; can source unusual materials or modify garments to conceal or integrate equipment; her sharp eye makes her an excellent involuntary observer of who is wearing what and why.', N'', N'Retractable claw geneware (dominant hand, right; dark amber). Vision augmentation: microscopic focus overlay for detail work (basic grade, self-paid). Color-changing hair achieved through bioluminescent textile fibers, not geneware — she corrects anyone who assumes otherwise.', N'Market hours 10am to 8pm managing the stall and seeing clients; late evenings in her workshop two streets away doing production work; she sleeps badly and sews at 3am frequently.', N'Hassan Kovalenko-Lahlou, tall lean woman with shoulder-blade length silver hair embedded with bioluminescent threads, warm golden-olive complexion with amber undertones reflecting pan-global ancestry, sharp Eastern European jawline paired with Southeast Asian-Hispanic cheekbones and North African nose structure. Dark brown eyes with subtle prismatic augmentation shimmer. Silver ink Cyrillic tattoo across right collarbone. Right hand displays retracted amber claw geneware with visible subdermal scarring. Fine stress lines around eyes, laser burn scars on fingertips, wrist needle scars. Wearing asymmetrical structured garments of her own design in deep teal, charcoal, and burnt orange with visible stitching, leather-synthetic blends, modular pockets, augmentation-access seams. Upright posture, hands in active micro-gesture. GLMZ 2200s interior workshop setting with warm overhead lighting catching hair luminescence and skin warm undertones, moody focused atmosphere, Tier 3 independent maker aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Complex pan-global phenotype blending Hispanic/Latin American warmth (34.5%), North African sun-depth (30.7%), Eastern European angularity (23.1%), and Southeast Asian refinement (11.7%). The combination creates striking facial geometry: high Southeast Asian-Hispanic cheekbones, Eastern European jawline sharpness, North African nose structure, unified by warm golden-olive skin that shifts between amber and bronze depending on light', 182, 68, N'Tall and lean with defined shoulders and wiry musculature from precision hand work; economical movement, no excess', N'Natural silver with embedded bioluminescent thread-fibers that pulse faintly in dim light', N'Worn long and loose, often pinned asymmetrically with custom hardware; fibers create subtle light-scatter effect', N'Long (shoulder-blade length)', N'Dark brown with microscopic overlay augmentation visible as faint prismatic shimmer at certain angles', N'Warm golden-olive complexion with amber undertones, reflecting blended North African sun-depth, Hispanic/Latin American and Southeast Asian golden warmth, grounded by Eastern European richness', N'High, prominent cheekbones showing Southeast Asian and Hispanic/Latin American bone structure with slight temple widening; sharp, angular jawline from Eastern European genetics; refined nose bridge with subtle flare reflecting North African heritage; skin shows fine stress lines around eyes from decades of detail work; minor scarring on fingertips and palms from laser burns and needle puncture work; subtle luminescence in warm light from melanin complexity and warm undertone saturation', N'Retractable claw geneware on right hand (dark amber, extends approximately 8cm, visible subdermal scarring at base of digits); microscopic focus overlay in right eye (subtle prismatic artifact visible in bright light, manifests as faint rainbow shimmer)', N'Habitually upright and deliberate; walks with measured stride; hands rarely still — constant micro-gestures when speaking, fingers often in needle-and-thread positioning even when empty; extends claws unconsciously when emphasizing points or when concentrating on aesthetic problems', N'Exclusively wears her own designs: structured, asymmetrical pieces that integrate functional elements (induction panels, modular pockets, augmentation-access seams); color palette of deep teals, charcoal, burnt orange, silver; mixing of tailored and deconstructed elements; visible stitching as design feature; often incorporates salvaged fabric from client commissions or historical garments; layers always intentional and visible; leather and synthetic blends; zero corporate branding; Tier 3 independent maker aesthetic — expensive to those who understand the work, invisible wealth to outsiders', N'She has been quietly making alterations to garments for a network she doesn''t fully understand — people who need concealments, hidden pockets, lining modifications — and she has told herself it is none of her business. She suspects it might be resistance work. She has not asked because she is afraid the answer will force a decision.', N'Precise and confident; uses textile and craft terms as metaphors; direct to the point of bluntness', N'Measured, declarative — she holds eye contact and waits for understanding before moving on', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hassan_kovalenko_lahlou');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a61b-76a9-9f98-c215a66b5162', N'Rune Khamvongsa', N'Rune', N'', N'Khamvongsa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 71, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'Escanaba Gateway, the Slow Benches outside Arrivals Terminal 7, near Lake Shore and Navy Pier', N'expelled citizen, wandering cartographer, and oral historian of lost places', N'No formal affiliation; loosely connected to a transit hub collective of older expelled citizens he calls ''the Slow Bench Parliament''', N'Rune Khamvongsa is an old man who carries himself as though he once occupied considerably more space in the world and is still adjusting to the reduction. He is tall and lightly stooped, with a face mapped by seventy years of weather and worry, deep brown skin faded to ash at the temples, a white beard trimmed with unexpected fastidiousness. His most striking feature is a pair of retractable cat ears in heathered grey that he had installed in his fifties — a mid-life extravagance he refuses to explain and which sit somewhat incongruously on a man of his gravitas. He dresses carefully in old clothes: a decent coat, shoes that have been resoled twice, a wide-brimmed hat of the kind no one under fifty wears anymore. He carries a physical notebook, which in 2200 is eccentric enough to be alarming.

Rune Khamvongsa was a senior urban planning official in Highland Park Autonomous Zone for thirty-one years before being expelled following a rezoning dispute that escalated into a political purge. His crime, ultimately, was insisting on documenting what was being demolished. He was stripped of his residency, his pension, and his archive access in a single administrative action. He has been stateless for six years now, drifting between transit hubs and writing everything down. He has accepted this with a philosopher''s outward composure and a grief he will only show you if you accidentally give him an opening, at which point it will pour out of him like a dam failing slowly.', N'Information source with deep institutional memory, quest giver with historical knowledge of urban zones, world-building anchor for the political history of GLMZ, moral counterweight who provides perspective on what has been lost.', N'', N'Retractable cat ears, heathered grey (cosmetic, installed age 54). Corrective eye augmentation for macular degeneration. Pacemaker-adjacent cardiac stabilizer, medical grade.', N'Rises early, claims a bench at Escanaba Gateway Arrivals Terminal 7, spends the day writing in his notebook and talking to anyone who sits near him; makes himself useful by interpreting transit regulations for newly arrived migrants who can''t parse the official language.', N'A weathered Southeast Asian-Hispanic-South Asian man, 188cm tall, aged 70s, warm golden-brown skin with grey-ash fading at temples and jawline. Deep brown eyes with faint silver augmentation tracery. White hair swept back, thinning at crown; dark brown beard neatly squared-off. Face lined and sun-damaged, cheekbones carrying ancestral structure beneath age-hollowing, deep nasolabial folds, permanent vertical crease between brows. Right hand knuckles marked with fine pale scars; left forearm with faded burn scar. Slight leftward favor in posture, shoulders inward, bearing the ghost of former authority. Retractable heathered grey cat ears with metallic joints visible at temples—incongruous on his formal bearing. Dressed in aged navy wool coat (resoled seams), cream linen shirt, dark trousers, polished twice-resoled shoes, dark felt wide-brimmed hat. Canvas satchel crosswise, water-stained leather notebook visible. Standing in amber neon-lit Great Lakes street, 2226, neo-noir metropolis, rain-slicked pavement reflecting city lights. Careful dignity in every gesture, courtly formality worn like old fabric. Cinematic, photorealistic, dystopian melancholy. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'local', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'Southeast Asian (46.4%, dominant—Lao phenotype with warm golden undertones) blended with Hispanic/Latin American (18.9%, contributing depth and melanin richness), South Asian (12.3%, adding refined bone structure and warmth), Eastern European (10.5%, introducing cooler undertones), Northern European (9.3%, tempering with paleness at temples and jawline), and East Asian (2.6%, subtle structural contribution). A striking multihued blend: Southeast Asian warmth and structure as the primary expression, enriched by Latin American depth and South Asian facial refinement, with Northern and Eastern European coolness emerging at the temples and jawline with age—a living map of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 188, 74, N'Tall and lightly stooped, shoulders caved slightly inward as though bearing a weight distributed across decades. Lean but not frail—the build of someone who was once muscular and has aged into wiriness rather than atrophy. Visible in the forearms and neck is the remnant of strength.', N'White with ashen grey at the temples; darker brown visible only in the beard', N'Beard trimmed with deliberate care—neat, squared-off, the grooming of a man who maintains standards in reduced circumstances. Head hair swept back, thinning at the crown.', N'Medium (head), Medium (beard)', N'Deep brown, augmented with corrective neural overlay for macular degeneration—faint silver tracery visible at the iris edge when light catches them', N'Warm medium-to-deep golden-brown base (Southeast Asian-Hispanic blend dominant), with grey-ash fading visible at the temples and jawline where Northern and Eastern European undertones surface with age. The layered ancestry creates a subtle gradient: deeper golden-brown at the cheeks and forehead, cooling toward grey-brown at the periphery. Age-spots scattered across forehead and back of hands like a map of lost coordinates.', N'Weathered and lined, with the moderate nasal bridge and defined nasal base of Southeast Asian heritage blended with South Asian refinement and Latin American fullness. Deep nasolabial folds. Forehead creased by seven decades of frowning at documents and city plans. Cheekbones carry residual structure from Southeast Asian and South Asian ancestry, with fullness from Latin American ancestry beneath the hollowing of age—not gaunt. Skin texture rough, age-spotted, the complexion of someone who has spent significant time outdoors recently—sun-damaged at the ears and the bridge of the nose, where warm golden-brown deepens to darker brown.', N'Pair of retractable cat ears mounted on the skull above and behind the natural ears, heathered grey with slight metallic sheen at the joints. When retracted, they leave a subtle bulge at the temples. The incongruity of them—sleek, cosmetic, installed in mid-life—is immediately striking on a man of his apparent gravitas. Faint silver circuitry visible at the iris edge when light catches his augmented eyes.', N'Carries himself as though still occupying the space of his former authority, but the posture is now inverted—a man adjusting downward. Walks deliberately, not shuffling, with a slight favor to the left side. Sits with careful attention to his back. Speaks with his hands, though the gestures have become smaller, more economical. His bearing suggests someone still processing a significant loss of status; there is a courtliness to his movements, a habit of formality worn like an old coat.', N'Tier 4 (working class, but aspirational): a dark wool coat (navy, resoled at the seams, clearly maintained), good quality but aged. Underneath, neutral layers—cream linen shirt, dark trousers. A wide-brimmed hat of the kind no one under fifty wears anymore, dark felt, slightly faded at the band. Shoes have been resoled twice and polished regularly. His physical notebook—leather-bound, water-stained, clearly his constant companion—is carried in a canvas satchel worn crosswise. He dresses carefully in old things, avoiding both the disposable fast-fashion of Tier 5 and the aggressively contemporary styling of Tier 2. Everything about his clothing reads as: a man of means who has been reduced, and is maintaining dignity through precision.', N'His physical notebook contains, embedded in seemingly innocent urban sketches, a complete coded map of the subterranean water and power infrastructure of Highland Park Autonomous Zone, drawn from memory. He hid this information years ago when he realized what the rezoning was actually about. He is waiting for someone trustworthy enough to give it to.', N'Formal, precise, institutional — the language of a man who spent decades writing policy documents, softened at the edges by a dry wit he deploys with perfect timing', N'Measured and unhurried, with long pauses before significant points, as though everything he says has been drafted in advance', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'rune_khamvongsa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a645-7553-bbc0-c222049b4dc3', N'Anela Kariuki-Olofsson', N'Anela', N'', N'Kariuki-Olofsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 87, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Norwood Quiet, Veterans'' Housing Block C — a building that smells of machine oil and old food and is maintained with fierce communal pride, near North Ave and Damen', N'Retired Corporate Wars veteran (Axiom Marine detachment); storyteller and community elder', N'Axiom Corp Veterans'' Pension System; Veterans'' Housing Block C Residents'' Committee; Veterans Oral History Collective (informal member)', N'Anela Kariuki-Olofsson is a very old man who has the eyes of someone who has seen enough that nothing surprises him anymore, which he will tell you is not the same as being wise. He is thin in the way that very tall men go thin in old age — all angles and long bones, with skin that carries the warm brown of his Ghanaian-Azeri-Brazilian-Lebanese ancestry in loose folds at his jaw and wrists. He served as a Warrant Officer in Axiom''s Marine detachment during the Corporate Wars of the 2150s, losing three fingers on his right hand to a Zheng-Dao area-denial round in the Kenosha Crossing engagement of 2157 and gaining a neurological tremor in his left hand that Axiom''s pension coverage doesn''t quite pay to treat. He walks with a cane that he chose himself — a carbon-fiber model with an Axiom logo he has scratched off and replaced with a handmade enamel pin of the Norwood Quiet neighborhood emblem.

He does not glorify the Wars and will say so plainly to anyone who starts romanticizing them. What he does is remember them, with the particular clarity of someone who has made a deliberate practice of it. He tells stories at the Veterans'' Housing common room three nights a week — not heroic stories but functional ones: what it felt like to wait, what you ate, what the men beside you were thinking about when the fighting paused. The community comes to him not for inspiration but for something harder to name: the feeling that someone who was present has accounted for it honestly. He is registered with the Veterans Oral History Collective but considers Ẹbúnọlú Saarinen-Džambazović (whom he has never met but whose work he admires from a distance) to be doing it properly, while he is just talking.', N'Living history source for the Corporate Wars; storyteller and moral philosopher for the community; can provide context on Axiom''s military operations that the company would prefer stayed buried; represents the specific cost of corporate warfare on those who fought it', N'', N'Right hand — three fingers replaced with basic functional prosthetics (Axiom-issue, thirty years old); subdermal pain management implant (manages nerve damage from the tremor; constantly at the edge of its effective range)', N'Spends mornings on the block''s common terrace watching the transit lines, which he finds meditative; attends the veterans'' housing committee meeting every Tuesday; storytelling sessions Monday, Wednesday, and Friday evenings.', N'Elderly neo-noir veteran, 193cm tall and lean, warm medium-brown skin with amber and olive undertones reflecting diverse Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, East Asian, Hispanic, Middle Eastern, and Southeast Asian ancestry. Sharp high cheekbones, deep-set brown eyes with age cataracts, white-gray hair cropped close. Silvered scar along left temple, liver spots on hands. Brushed steel prosthetic fingers visible on right hand with wear marks. Faded Axiom Corporation windbreaker over muted blue button-up shirt, gray reinforced work pants, arch-support slip-ons. Carbon-fiber cane with neighborhood emblem pin. Lanyard with Veterans ID and brass whistle at neck. Deliberate, economical posture, measured stance. Dim neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan corridor or quiet housing block interior, cool blue-green ambient lighting casting gentle shadows across weathered features. Listening expression, hands folded in calm composure. 2226 neo-noir urban aesthetic, worn dignity, quiet strength. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Norwood Quiet', N'local', N'Norwood Quiet', N'Sub-Saharan African (32.4%), Hispanic/Latin American (16.9%), South Asian (16.5%), East Asian (15.2%), Middle Eastern (10.2%), and Southeast Asian (8.8%)—a truly global genetic blend visible in rich warm-medium brown skin with complex undertones of amber, olive, and subtle red, deep-set eyes, and facial structure reflecting this diverse pan-continental ancestry', 193, 74, N'Tall and lean in the characteristic way of very old men—all sharp angles at shoulders and elbows, long bones prominent beneath loosening skin. Still carries the posture of someone trained to stand at attention, though age has begun to curve his spine slightly forward.', N'White-gray with faint traces of original dark brown at the scalp', N'Cropped close to the head, neat and maintained with the same communal care he applies to everything', N'Short', N'Deep brown, still sharp and present—slightly milky at the edges with age cataracts beginning to form', N'Rich warm medium brown—the blended heritage of his pan-continental ancestry visible in undertones of amber, olive, and subtle red warmth, darkened and weathered by decades of exposure and age', N'Loose skin at the jawline and neck; deep laugh lines around the eyes and mouth; liver spots on the backs of both hands and forearms. A thin scar runs along his left temple—silvered with age. Facial hair kept to a neat white stubble, shaved every two or three days. Skin dry in places, particularly elbows and knuckles. Facial features show the high cheekbones and broad facial structure characteristic of his diverse ancestry, with subtle depth in eye sockets reflecting the Sub-Saharan, South Asian, and East Asian genetic components. Nose bridge shows the slightly broader structure from South Asian and Middle Eastern heritage blending with Sub-Saharan and Hispanic ancestry. Cheekbones are prominently set with the angularity reflecting East Asian and Sub-Saharan genetic influence.', N'Right hand prosthetics are obvious and show their age—brushed steel fingers with synthetic knuckles, slightly misaligned due to wear and Axiom''s original cost-cutting. The subdermal pain management implant is not visible, but the faint tremor in his left hand when at rest is noticeable—a slight flutter in the fingers and wrist that he has learned to hide by keeping his hand occupied or in his pocket.', N'Moves deliberately, economically—every motion calculated after a lifetime of knowing when not to waste energy. Uses his carbon-fiber cane not as a prop but as an extension of his right side, bearing weight through it with the ease of someone who has integrated it into his body''s balance system. Walks with the measured pace of someone who knows exactly how far his body will carry him. When sitting, he becomes still—hands folded in his lap or on the table before him, a listener''s posture. His head turns slowly when he shifts attention.', N'Tier 3-4 worker practical: well-maintained gray work pants with reinforced seams, worn soft but not frayed; a series of button-up shirts in muted colors (blues, grays, earth tones) that he layers with a faded Axiom Corporation windbreaker when he goes outside. The windbreaker is treated with care—the original logo is still visible despite being faded. He wears comfortable slip-on shoes with arch support, always clean. Around his neck, a lanyard holding his Veterans'' Housing Block C ID and a small brass whistle from his service days. His cane carries the handmade enamel pin of the Norwood Quiet neighborhood emblem—a small act of deliberate defacement and reclamation.', N'During the Kenosha Crossing engagement, he gave an order that resulted in the deaths of four of his own detachment members — a tactical decision that he believed was correct and still believes was correct and that he has never told anyone about because correct and grievable are not mutually exclusive, and he has not figured out how to say both things in the same sentence.', N'Economical and precise; military rhythm deeply embedded; uses the past tense like it is a country he visits regularly; occasional Arabic or Portuguese word dropped in without translation', N'Slow and deliberate; he has learned that silence after a sentence is not a gap to fill; the tremor in his left hand sometimes creates a visible rhythm as he speaks', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anela_kariuki_olofsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ea-7058-a12e-c27129d2bdb6', N'Chinwendu Dinh', N'Chinwendu', N'', N'Dinh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — runs his business from a rotating set of tea houses and noodle stalls in the Burnside Pocket neighborhood, near Damen and Armitage', N'Loan shark and bookmaker operating a numbers game in the Narrows', N'Semi-independent; pays protection to the Burnside Compact, a loose neighborhood criminal coalition; has operated long enough to have de facto seniority', N'Chinwendu Dinh is a large man running toward fat but not there yet, with a warm brown complexion, a magnificent graying mustache he waxes into points, and the kind of patient, heavy-lidded expression that could mean he''s bored or that he''s calculating what you''re worth in pieces. He has a geneware modification he got in his thirties — his irises shift between deep amber and a vivid green-gold depending on his mood, which he claims is useful for business (''People watch my eyes. They miss my hands.''). He favors well-made but not flashy clothing: real fabric, subtle patterns, shoes that are always clean. He smells of cardamom and whatever tea he''s most recently finished.

Chinwendu Dinh came up through the numbers game as a runner himself, at sixteen, and has never romanticized it. He is pleasant in the specific way of people who have learned that pleasant is more effective than threatening for roughly eighty percent of interactions, and who have made peace with the other twenty percent. He is genuinely fond of his regulars — he knows their families, their ailments, their lucky numbers — and this fondness does not prevent him from collecting. He has two enforcers he treats well and pays generously, and he refers to them as ''my associates'' with the mild pride of a man who considers proper staffing a virtue.', N'Information hub, quest giver, creditor with power over multiple neighborhood characters — his loan book touches dozens of lives and creates cascading dependencies players can pull on.', N'', N'Mood-reactive iris geneware (amber to green-gold). A subdermal transaction chip in his left palm for discreet Quanta transfers — old model, slightly outdated but reliable. No other mods.', N'Makes the rounds of three or four Burnside Pocket establishments each morning, collecting slips and settling the previous day''s books. Afternoons for new loans and negotiations. Evenings he sits in one fixed location — whoever is hosting that week — and holds a kind of informal court.', N'Chinwendu Dinh, 188cm tall, large-framed man with luminous warm golden-brown skin blending Southeast Asian, East Asian, Indigenous American, Sub-Saharan African, Northern European and Hispanic heritage. Dark brown hair heavily grayed, combed back from forehead, medium length tapered sides. High prominent cheekbones, strong jawline partially hidden by gray-and-brown waxed mustache curled at the tips. Mood-reactive amber-to-green-gold eyes, heavy-lidded patient expression. Fine white scar from mouth corner to ear. Well-maintained complexion with crow''s feet. Large blunt-fingered hands with gold ring. Wearing tailored warm-toned earth neutral jacket, rust-brown linen shirt, dark leather shoes polished soft shine. Thin gold chain barely visible at collar. Deliberate, economical posture, shoulders slightly forward. Patient, calculating demeanor. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, warm interior lighting catching golden skin tones, geometric patterns in fabric, cardamom and black tea ambiance, moody but composed atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Complex pan-Pacific and pan-American heritage with Southeast Asian foundation (35.6%) creating warm golden undertones and refined facial structure. Indigenous American ancestry (15%) and East Asian heritage (13.2%) contribute prominent cheekbones and distinctive eye shape. Sub-Saharan African ancestry (12.3%) adds structural breadth to facial features and depth to skin tone, while Northern European influence (12.3%) refines the nose bridge and provides bone definition. Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (11.6%) completes the blend into a luminous, warm complexion that synthesizes multiple continents into a unified, striking appearance.', 188, 98, N'Large-framed, solid through the shoulders and chest, carrying weight with the ease of a man who has never pretended to be smaller than he is. A soft belly beginning, but the underlying mass is structural—not yet softness, but heading that direction with the patience of someone who doesn''t rush anything.', N'Dark brown, heavily grayed throughout', N'Combed back from the forehead, kept neat and precise', N'Medium, tapered at the sides', N'Mood-reactive geneware: shifts between deep amber (neutral/calculating) and vivid green-gold (content/engaged). The transition is visible and smooth, a tell he long ago decided was useful.', N'Warm golden-brown with honeyed radiance, luminous across the cheekbones and bridge of nose. The blend of Southeast Asian, East Asian, Indigenous American, Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry creates an even, unified complexion that catches light with warm depth. Time in the temperate GLMZ climate has settled this genetic mix into rich, dimensional skin tone.', N'Well-maintained despite his age. High, prominent cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian and Indigenous American heritage, balanced by a straight, refined nose bridge showing Northern European and East Asian structure. Strong jawline partially obscured by his signature mustache—gray and dark brown mixed, waxed into precise points that curl slightly upward. Broad facial structure speaks to Sub-Saharan African heritage, softened by the fine-boned influence of East and Southeast Asian ancestry. The skin around his eyes shows crow''s feet from decades of calculated smiling. No visible acne scarring or serious blemishes. His expression defaults to a patient, heavy-lidded look that could read as boredom or calculation depending on what his irises are doing at the moment.', N'Only the iris geneware is externally apparent—the color shifts draw attention precisely as intended. The transaction chip in his left palm is subcutaneous and invisible except under direct light, where a faint silver line is barely visible at the crease of his palm. He keeps that hand relaxed and unobtrusive.', N'Moves with the deliberate, economical motion of someone for whom speed is not the point. His gait is steady and measured, shoulders slightly forward in a posture that seems to take up space without announcing it. He sits heavily but settles quickly, gesturing with his hands in conversational moments—calculated movement, nothing wasted. His hands are large, with blunt fingers and well-maintained nails. He uses them to illustrate a point rather than to intimidate.', N'Real fabric, always: cotton blends, linen, lightweight wools appropriate to the climate. He favors muted earth tones—warm grays, deep browns, rust-tinged neutrals—and subtle geometric patterns in his shirts. His jackets are well-tailored but not ostentatious, worn to fit rather than to impress. His shoes are always clean leather, usually in dark brown or charcoal, polished to a soft shine. No visible corporate branding. His watch, when visible, is functional and expensive-looking but not new. He wears a simple gold band on his ring finger—whether for marriage or as a personal choice is immaterial to his presentation. A thin gold chain, barely visible, runs beneath his collar. He smells consistently of cardamom, black tea, and clean linen.', N'He has been quietly forgiving the debts of three families in Burnside Pocket — people he''s known for decades — writing them off his books and absorbing the loss personally. He would be humiliated if anyone discovered this generosity.', N'Warm, idiomatic blend of Nigerian English, Czech-inflected vowels from his paternal grandmother''s speech patterns, and Meridian street slang. Uses food metaphors frequently. Refers to money as ''weight.''', N'Unhurried, conversational, rarely raises his voice — the volume drop is the warning sign, not the volume rise.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chinwendu_dinh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63e-727a-822c-c2934762fa96', N'Dalila Abdykadyrov-Dalgaard', N'Dalila', N'', N'Abdykadyrov-Dalgaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 33, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Geartown — industrial district of chop shops and fabricators, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Forced entry and close-quarters combat specialist — breacher', N'Independent — known in Old Harbor circles', N'Dalila Abdykadyrov-Dalgaard is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 33, she has the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on s — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. She works as a breacher out of Geartown, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

she is not the most talented breacher in GLMZ, but she might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Kamala Medina-Quaye functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs. Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Dalila Abdykadyrov-Dalgaard, 168cm lean angular frame, Central Asian high cheekbones with warm golden-honey brown skin, deep-set brown eyes with neural tremor. Dark brown hair with silver temples pulled in tight functional braid, mid-back length. Sleeveless tactical tank under reinforced industrial jacket, dark gray cargo pants, steel-toed boots. Synthetic muscle augmentations visible in both legs—chrome sheaths with metallic sheen, too-perfect symmetry. Fine white burn scars across palms and forearms, surgical scars along thighs. Standing coiled and tense, weight forward on balls of feet, economical dangerous readiness. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial setting with neon edge lighting casting shadows across her augmented frame, cool blue and warm amber light playing off the chrome in her legs, gritty utilitarian aesthetic, photorealistic, high contrast, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Central Asian (66.0%), Northern European (24.2%), Sub-Saharan African (9.8%) — a striking blend that manifests in her prominent high cheekbones with Central Asian geometry, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones that deepen toward honey-amber in certain light, and deep-set eyes carrying both Northern European coolness and Central Asian intensity. The Sub-Saharan ancestry adds subtle fullness to her lips and a richness to her skin''s natural luminosity.', 168, 58, N'Lean and angular with ropy muscle definition. Her frame is all functional tension — minimalist, built for explosive movement rather than mass. Synthetic muscle replacement in both legs gives them a subtly different shape than the rest of her body: smoother curves, too perfect, chrome gleaming under the skin.', N'Dark brown, natural base with premature silver threading at the temples', N'Pulled back in a tight functional braid, practical and never loose', N'Long — reaches mid-back when unbraided, but always secured', N'Deep brown with a faint tremor in the iris — side effect of wired reflexes', N'Warm medium-golden brown with honey-amber undertones, even and luminous across her frame. The tone reflects the blended genetics of Central Asian prominence, Northern European translucence, and Sub-Saharan richness, creating a skin surface that catches light with subtle warmth. Unmarked except for deliberate scars from work and augmentation.', N'High, prominent cheekbones with Central Asian structure, angular jaw, refined narrow nose with slightly fuller lips from Sub-Saharan ancestry. Skin is weathered in the way of someone who spends time outdoors and doesn''t prioritize skincare — small scars from industrial work, a persistent squint line around the eyes. No makeup. Her face has the quality of something designed rather than grown, though that''s just her baseline intensity.', N'The chrome in both legs is immediately visible — synthetic muscle shows through translucent dermal sheaths as a faint metallic sheen, most pronounced in the calves and quads. The artificial musculature is too perfect, too symmetrical compared to her natural upper body. When she moves, the legs respond a fraction too quickly. Her pupils occasionally dilate and contract unnaturally — the adrenaline pump kicking in and settling.', N'She stands like a coiled spring, weight forward on the balls of her feet even at rest. Her movements are economical and precise — no wasted motion. When she walks, there''s a subtle rhythm discontinuity between her upper body and her augmented legs, a reminder that they don''t quite move in sync with her natural reflexes. In high-stress moments, she twitches — fingers drumming, jaw clenching — the chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation pushing her toward action.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian. Dark tactical pants with reinforced knees and cargo pockets, usually gray or matte black. Steel-toed boots, always laced tight. Sleeveless tank or fitted long-sleeve shirt under a reinforced jacket — the kind designed for industrial work, with hidden pockets and durable synthetic fabric. Everything is worn, tested, patched where necessary. No logos, no flash. A tool belt or chest rig depending on the job. Her jacket has a faint smell of machine oil and ozone.', N'Kamala Medina-Quaye betrayed their previous crew to survive a corporate raid. The crew didn''t survive. Nobody in GLMZ knows this.', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dalila_abdykadyrov_dalgaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d4-7d35-83fd-c2a8751e003a', N'Gaida Deshpande', N'Gaida', N'', N'Deshpande', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 36, NULL, 30, 2, N'active', N'The Core, near LaSalle and Madison', N'Fixer - Zheng-Dao proxy', N'Zheng-Dao', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Gaida Deshpande, 172cm lean angular woman with warm medium-deep golden-brown skin reflecting South Asian-Hispanic-Eastern European heritage blend. Platinum blonde hair with dark roots slicked back in tight ponytail, secured with chrome clip. Dark brown eyes with amber neural interface threading in left eye. Defined cheekbones, prominent jawline, faint 3cm scar along left temple hidden by hairline. Matte black Zheng-Dao corporate sigil tattoo on right collarbone. Wearing tailored black blazer over understated base layer, fitted tactical pants, matte-black neural-responsive shoes. Minimal platinum jewelry including ring and neural interface earrings. Coiled posture suggesting trained violence masked under corporate polish. Precise economical movement, scanning gaze. Corporate minimalist aesthetic with lethal efficiency. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, neon-tinged office lighting, cold professional atmosphere, depth of field focusing on her calculating expression --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Core', N'local', N'The Core', N'South Asian dominant (62.9%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (24.9%) and Eastern European (12.2%) ancestry. Strong South Asian bone structure blended with Latin American warmth creates rich golden undertones and defined angularity. Eastern European heritage adds subtle coolness and facial structure refinement. A sophisticated genetic synthesis of subcontinental, Iberian-influenced, and Central European characteristics.', 172, 62, N'Lean and angular with defined musculature; maintained through discipline rather than bulk. High center of gravity, built for mobility and sustained physical exertion rather than power.', N'Platinum blonde with dark roots showing—deliberately maintained to suggest either neglect or a statement about corporate authenticity', N'Slicked back into a tight high ponytail, secured with a minimalist chrome clip', N'Long', N'Dark brown with mild heterochromia—left eye shows faint amber threading, likely subcutaneous neural interface indicators', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden-olive undertones. Rich luminous complexion reflecting dominant South Asian heritage warmed by Hispanic/Latin American influence, subtly cooled by Eastern European undertones. Sun-kissed glow suggesting time under natural light despite Tier 1 indoor lifestyle.', N'Strong defined cheekbones with balanced angularity characteristic of South Asian-Eastern European blend, prominent jawline softened by Latin warmth. Skin shows the precision of someone using high-end dermal maintenance. A faint scar runs along her left temple, partially hidden by hairline.', N'None immediately obvious. However, the amber threading in her left eye and subtle micro-expressions suggest subcutaneous neural interface hardware. Very little visible chrome—suggesting Zheng-Dao''s investment in discrete, high-end internal modifications rather than showboat augmentations.', N'Precise and economical. She moves with the coiled readiness of someone trained in violence, but masks it under a veneer of corporate polish. Handshakes are firm but brief. She rarely fidgets; instead, her eyes do most of the work—scanning rooms systematically, calculating angles. When seated, she maintains an open posture that nonetheless keeps her center of gravity low.', N'Tier 1 corporate minimalist. Typically wears tailored black or charcoal blazers over understated base layers—often Zheng-Dao-aligned brands with subtle sigils. Prefers fitted tactical pants with hidden pockets over skirts. Footwear is always practical: matte-black neural-responsive shoes that adjust to terrain. Jewelry is minimal—a simple platinum band on her right ring finger and understated earrings that double as neural interface nodes. Her overall aesthetic reads as ''lethal efficiency wrapped in corporate respectability.''', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gaida_deshpande');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e5-7c54-8449-c2e1e23d9d5e', N'Gitika Ingebrigtsen', N'Gitika', N'', N'Ingebrigtsen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 13, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Iron Bend (The Narrows adjacent), near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Junior hacker; self-taught, operating from the Narrows'' informal network', N'Independent; loosely connected to Iron Bend''s informal community network', N'Gitika Ingebrigtsen is the kind of kid that adults look at and see either a prodigy or a problem, and the truth is that neither word is wrong. They have their Kenyan father''s dark eyes and their Māori mother''s broad, expressive face, with a scattering of geneware mods accumulated in pieces — irises that have been tuned to a soft gold, a hair-pigment mod that keeps their short locs a constant deep violet regardless of lighting, and retractable claws they got at a gray-market modder as a twelfth birthday present to themselves, which they use primarily to tap on surfaces when thinking. They are skinny in the way of someone who sometimes forgets to eat because they are inside something interesting, with ink-stain calluses on their left hand from a tablet stylus they use for annotating data flows.

Gitika Ingebrigtsen is not a criminal — at least not in their own taxonomy. They have a rigorous internal ethics around what they will and will not touch: no personal medical data, no family communications, no financial accounts. What they will touch is infrastructure they consider ought to be public — transit schedules that Ferrogate hoards, air quality data that Axiom doesn''t release, building maintenance logs that explain why their block''s heat went out again. They distribute what they find through anonymous drop points in Iron Bend''s informal network, and they have approximately four hundred forty-two followers on an anonymous data-sharing feed they call Seams. They are thirteen and extremely proud of this and have told precisely no one.', N'Junior information broker and data source; can access publicly-adjacent infrastructure data; Seams feed is a useful plot device; their ethics make them an interesting ally with clear limits.', N'', N'Geneware: gold-tuned irises, deep violet permanent hair pigment, retractable claws (gray-market, small, filed short). No chrome.', N'Wakes late, attends the minimum required sessions at Iron Bend''s community education terminal, spends the rest of the day in a corner of the building''s mechanical room where the signal is best, working on whatever has caught their attention.', N'GLMZ portrait of Gitika Ingebrigtsen, 152cm lean wiry teenager with warm deep brown skin and subtle golden undertones, faint freckles across nose and cheeks, perpetual dark circles under glowing gold biolume irises, short deep violet locs with lived-in texture, retractable claw mod scars barely visible on wrists, constant ink smudges on left hand from data annotation work, hunched forward posture with restless fidgeting energy, wearing oversized dust-smudged thermal hoodie and cargo pants with carabiners clipped to belt loops, worn mismatched-sock sneakers, sitting in a dimly-lit mechanical workshop filled with salvaged hardware, late-night hyperfocus atmosphere, moody blue-amber neon lighting catching the luminescence in their augmented eyes, tired but intensely focused expression, candid documentary style --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Iron Bend (The Narrows adjacent)', N'local', N'Iron Bend (The Narrows adjacent)', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (54.9%, primarily West/Central African heritage) with significant Northern European ancestry (41.6%) and Hispanic/Latin American admixture (3.5%), resulting in warm deep brown skin with subtle golden undertones and a luminous quality from the balanced blend', 152, 38, N'Lean and wiry, with the underfed quality of someone who loses track of meals during hyperfocus; narrow shoulders, minimal muscle definition, all angles and restless energy', N'Deep violet (geneware-maintained, independent of natural growth)', N'Short locs, kept neat but with a lived-in quality; a few stray threads usually behind one ear', N'Short', N'Deep gold with slight luminescence in low light (geneware-tuned irises)', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones from Sub-Saharan and Hispanic/Latin American heritage; the Northern European ancestry creates subtle warmth variations across the face without significant lightening, giving luminous depth beneath the surface', N'Clear but tired-looking; dark circles under eyes from late-night sessions; faint freckles across the bridge of nose and cheeks from Northern European admixture; ink stains on the webbing between left thumb and forefinger from constant stylus use', N'Gold-luminous irises that catch light distinctly; deep violet hair that is clearly artificial and maintained (shifts slightly under different lighting without appearing natural); retractable claws barely visible when at rest as faint lines at fingertip edges, but obvious when extended—filed short and functional rather than dramatic', N'Sits hunched forward habitually, shoulders curved inward; fidgets constantly—taps fingers on surfaces rhythmically when thinking, clicks claws in patterns, bounces knee while seated; moves with teenage awkwardness but sudden focused precision when engaged with tech; tends to shift weight onto one foot when standing idle', N'Tier 5 aesthetic without affectation: oversized hoodie or thermal layer usually smudged with dust from the mechanical room, cargo pants with multiple pockets filled with salvaged hardware, worn sneakers with mismatched socks; no corporate branding; a few small utility straps or carabiners clipped to belt loops; occasionally wears a faded beanie that covers the hair mod when trying to be inconspicuous, though they usually forget about it', N'Two weeks ago they accidentally accessed something they shouldn''t have — a Tessera internal routing protocol buried under legitimate transit infrastructure. They haven''t done anything with it but they can''t stop looking at it. It describes something that doesn''t make sense yet.', N'Fast, associative, toggles between technical jargon and very simple plain language with no middle ground. Terrible at small talk. Exceptional at explaining complex things to people who ask genuinely.', N'Rapid bursts of connected thoughts with sudden full stops when they lose interest or get nervous.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gitika_ingebrigtsen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a657-75f4-bf76-c2e90f51329e', N'Asmaa Szczypiński', N'Asmaa', N'', N'Szczypiński', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Neighborhood council chair and mutual aid organizer', N'Mexicantown Libre Neighborhood Council (chair); Libre Mutual Aid Cooperative; informal connections to most major advocacy groups in the district', N'Asmaa Szczypiński is short, heavyset, and moves through a room like she''s already decided where she''s going and expects the room to adjust. Her skin is a warm medium brown, deeply lined around the eyes and mouth in ways she has never addressed because she considers cosmetic smoothing a form of dishonesty in a politician. Her hair is dyed a flat, vivid black — one small vanity — and she wears it in a thick braid. Her only augmentation is a cochlear enhancer she got for hearing loss, which she will tell you about unprompted because she believes people hide medical realities out of pride and that this is stupid.

She has chaired the Mexicantown Libre neighborhood council for eleven years and before that spent twenty years running the district''s mutual aid food and medicine network. She knows every family in a twelve-block radius, every outstanding debt to the community, and every favor owed to her personally. She is not idealistic — she is pragmatic in the specific way of someone who has spent decades watching idealism not feed anyone. She will work with people she disagrees with if they can produce results. She will not pretend to like them.', N'Power broker and gatekeeper — to get anything done in Mexicantown Libre, you eventually need Maïté''s blessing or at least her neutrality. She can open doors or close them.', N'', N'Bilateral cochlear enhancers (medical, not cosmetic). A faded subdermal loyalty tattoo from a long-defunct community mutual house that glows faintly gold on certain frequencies — she keeps it as memory.', N'Morning office hours at the council hall for constituents, midday coordination with mutual aid logistics, afternoons at city-level hearings or in negotiation with corporate liaisons, evenings often at a kitchen table with whoever needs to talk.', N'Asmaa Szczypiński, 157cm tall, heavyset 61-year-old woman with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, strong defined cheekbones blending Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European features with subtle East Asian eye shape and broader Indigenous American facial structure. Long thick black hair with gray roots at the part, braided and coiled at nape. Dark brown sharp eyes with weathered laugh lines and stress lines, faded subdermal gold-glowing three-circle tattoo on inside left forearm, thin white scar on left temple. Worn metallic cochlear enhancer nodes at base of ears. Wearing layered practical neo-noir clothing: thermal base, faded cotton shirt, dark work jeans, well-worn black leather resoled shoes, canvas jacket with pockets, worn leather belt. Posture balanced and direct, neutral assessment expression. Standing in GLMZ 2226 setting with neon-tinted industrial lighting, gritty urban background, confident taking up space. Functional aesthetic, no corporate branding, council medallion visible on lanyard. Cinematic GLMZ 2200s style, character-focused portrait lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Sub-Saharan African (34.4%), Eastern European (29.3%), East Asian (12.6%), Indigenous American (8.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (8.4%), and Northern European (6.4%) ancestry — a complex genetic blend creating warm deep brown skin with subtle golden undertones, strong defined cheekbones characteristic of African and Slavic heritage, slightly broader facial structure influenced by Indigenous American genetics, and dark expressive eyes with a slight East Asian epicanthic fold. Features reflect the substantial African and Eastern European foundation with layered contributions from Asian, Amerindian, and Latin American ancestry.', 157, 78, N'Heavyset, solid through the torso and shoulders — not fat but densely packed with sixty-one years of work. Strong legs, thick wrists. Carries herself like someone who has lifted, carried, and held things up for decades.', N'Dyed flat black, natural gray at the roots showing through in a thin stripe at the part', N'Thick braid, usually pinned or coiled at the nape', N'Long (to mid-back when unbraided)', N'Dark brown, sharp and assessing', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones — the blended result of substantial Sub-Saharan African ancestry (34.4%) combined with Eastern European (29.3%), East Asian (12.6%), Indigenous American (8.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (8.4%), and Northern European (6.4%) heritage creating rich, complex depth', N'Deeply lined around eyes and mouth — laugh lines and stress lines she has never bothered to smooth. Weathered but not sagging. Skin is clear, well-moisturized, cared for functionally rather than cosmetically. No makeup beyond lip balm. Features show the prominent cheekbones and defined jaw structure reflecting African and Eastern European ancestry, with subtle eye shape influenced by East Asian heritage and broader facial width reflecting Indigenous American genetics.', N'Bilateral cochlear enhancer nodes visible at the base of each ear — small metallic caps, worn and scratched from long use, no attempt to conceal them. She treats them as functional equipment, not cosmetic liability.', N'Moves with deliberate efficiency — no wasted motion, no second-guessing. Walks into rooms like she owns them or at minimum knows exactly what needs doing. Stands with weight balanced, shoulders back. Sits with elbows on the table, comfortable taking up space. Makes direct eye contact. Her default expression is neutral assessment.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear: well-maintained but not new. Dark jeans or work pants, sturdy shoes (usually black or brown leather, resoled multiple times). Layered tops — thermal base, cotton shirt, often a faded denim or canvas jacket with pockets. A thick knit cardigan in winter. All clothing shows wear but is clean and intentionally kept. No logos, no corporate branding. A worn leather belt holding everything together. Occasional council medallion on a lanyard when doing official work.', N'She has been quietly redirecting a small portion of the mutual aid cooperative''s discretionary fund for three years — not stealing, exactly, but using it to pay off a Zheng-Dao neighborhood liaison who has been protecting Mexicantown Libre from a rezoning push. The money comes back in kind, in protections. She has not told the council. She is not entirely sure it is not stealing.', N'Direct, low ornamentation, occasional Spanish phrases that are not affectation but reflex — particular words she thinks more precisely in', N'Measured and unhurried, speaks as if she has already heard your objection', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'asmaa_szczypi_ski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a729-7604-b2b7-c363fbae815d', N'Hideaki Olofsson', N'Hideaki', N'', N'Olofsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Fort Anchor, Drone Operations Center — assigned coverage zone: Brightmoor Reclamation and adjacent districts, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division surveillance drone operator, Brightmoor Reclamation Zone coverage', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division, Aerial Surveillance and Drone Operations Division', N'Hideaki Olofsson runs drones from a chair. They have been doing this for eleven years and their body knows it — they are slim in the specific way of someone who is still and focused for eight hours at a stretch, with deep brown skin and a shaved head they have decorated with a scatter of bioluminescent scalp-dots in cyan and violet that pulse slowly in patterns that change with their mood. Their eyes are heavily augmented: twin rig-link implants that glow a faint amber at the corners when active, giving them a permanently lit quality that unsettles people at close range. They are not especially tall and they move through the Fort Anchor corridors with the slightly glassy ease of someone perpetually accustomed to seeing through other eyes.

Hideaki Olofsson is the best drone jockey in the Brightmoor operation and has a proprietary flight algorithm they developed themselves, unofficially, that runs seventeen percent more efficient coverage patterns than the Metro standard. They have never submitted it formally because they have learned that submitting things formally means other people get credit for them. They have complicated feelings about surveillance work — they do it with genuine skill and believe in some of its applications and mistrust others — and they manage this by maintaining a very precise internal taxonomy of which flights feel like protection and which feel like something else. They pray to the drone fleet''s resident E.L.F., which they call Sweep, before every shift, asking it to help them see clearly and miss nothing important.', N'Information source about what has been seen in coverage zones, surveillance infrastructure access point, moral complexity of the watcher who questions their watching', N'', N'Dual rig-link ocular implants (amber-lit, full drone interface and multi-feed monitoring), haptic feedback suit underlayer (worn under uniform, translates drone flight into physical sensation for precision control), bioluminescent scalp-dot geneware (mood-reactive cyan/violet)', N'Sits their shift in the Fort Anchor drone ops center running up to six simultaneous coverage feeds over Brightmoor, files incident flags, and hands off to the night operator at shift end; spends off-hours in their Hamtramck apartment running hobby drone builds they are not supposed to be doing with Metro-adjacent components.', N'Hideaki Olofsson, GLMZ, Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security Aerial Surveillance operative. Lean 168cm frame with shaved scalp covered in asymmetric constellation of bioluminescent cyan and violet dots pulsing softly. Warm golden-brown complexion with olive undertones reflecting multinational ancestry — subtle epicanthal fold tendency, defined cheekbones, broader nasal geometry. Dark brown eyes with amber rig-link glow at corners, fine concentration lines at eye margins. Clean surgical scars barely visible at outer eye corners. Wearing navy GLMZ tactical jacket with reflective trim over gray utility shirt, haptic feedback underlayer visible at neck. Posture economical and precise, glassy detached gaze suggesting attention split between physical and digital feeds. Low-light urban basement workshop setting, neon reflecting off bald scalp and illuminating skin tone in cool purples and warm ambers. Cinematic neo-noir noir atmosphere, moody and introspective. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Fort Anchor', N'local', N'Fort Anchor', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend spanning six continents: Northern European (27%), Middle Eastern (24.7%), South Asian (18.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (14.2%), Sub-Saharan African (9.8%), Southeast Asian (6.2%). The genetic layering creates distinctive phenotypic harmony — warm golden-brown skin tone from the South Asian and Middle Eastern foundation, with luminous depth from Sub-Saharan African genetics. Subtle epicanthal fold tendency from Southeast Asian ancestry shapes the eye region. Facial bone structure merges Northern European angularity with Middle Eastern definition, while nasal structure reflects the broader geometry characteristic of African and Latin American ancestry. The overall effect is a complexion that appears medium-depth with olive undertones, reading warm in shadow and luminous in direct light.', 168, 58, N'Lean and spare, the sustained stillness of an operator — narrow shoulders, minimal muscle definition, the kind of thinness that comes from eight-hour shifts in a chair rather than deprivation. Core strength maintained despite sedentary work.', N'None (shaved)', N'Shaved scalp, bare skin', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertones, amber rig-link glow at the corners when active', N'Warm golden-brown with balanced olive undertones — medium-depth with luminous quality in good light, warmer and deeper in shadow. The tone reflects the harmonic blend of Middle Eastern warmth, South Asian depth, Northern European fairness, Southeast Asian undertones, and Sub-Saharan African richness, creating a distinctive mid-range brown that shifts subtly with lighting.', N'Clean, even-toned skin with minimal scarring. Fine lines at the eyes from years of concentration and the strain of rig-link use. Facial structure shows subtle epicanthal fold tendency from Southeast Asian ancestry, defined cheekbones from Northern European and Middle Eastern heritage, and broader nasal structure characteristic of Sub-Saharan and Latin American genetics. Scalp shows no irritation from the bioluminescent implants — well-maintained.', N'Dual rig-link ocular implants with amber glow visible at eye corners when active (most noticeable in low-light environments). Bioluminescent scalp-dots pulse slowly in shifting cyan and violet tones. Haptic feedback suit visible as thin underlayer fabric at neck and wrists beneath uniform.', N'Carries themselves with the glassy ease of someone accustomed to perceiving through external feeds — slightly detached, movements precise but economical. Walks with minimal wasted motion. When engaged with others, eye contact is direct but has a quality of simultaneous distance, as though part of their attention is elsewhere. Sits with the postural memory of long chair-time: spine slightly curved, shoulders rolled inward.', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security Aerial Surveillance Division uniform (Tier 3 standard-issue): navy tactical jacket with reflective trim and shoulder patch, fitted gray utility undershirt. Off-duty wears practical Hamtramck-sector wear — dark hoodies, cargo pants with tool loops, worn sneakers suitable for quick basement workshop sessions. Minimal jewelry or decoration beyond the bioluminescent scalp-dots. Grooming is precise and utilitarian.', N'Six months ago Yewande watched a drone feed showing two Metro officers doing something to an unhoused man in a Brightmoor alley that was not in any incident report. The encounter lasted four minutes. They flagged nothing. They have the raw footage saved to a personal encrypted drive. They do not know what they are waiting for to do something with it.', N'Technical and spatial — they describe things in terms of coverage angles, flight paths, sight lines. Switches to quiet and careful when speaking about anything they actually care about.', N'Slow and deliberate, with long pauses that are thinking rather than discomfort', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hideaki_olofsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a676-72cb-9248-c38d198083b0', N'Bohuslav Banerjee-Karimov', N'Bohuslav', N'', N'Banerjee-Karimov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Dockside — Lake Michigan waterfront, smuggler territory, near Lake Shore and Navy Pier', N'High-speed vehicle operations specialist — wheelman', N'Independent — known in Old Harbor circles', N'Bohuslav Banerjee-Karimov is wiry and quick-moving, with the restless energy of someone who converts anxiety into velocity. At 41, her expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — cybernetic arm — right, full replacement from shoulder — stronger than organic, — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Before the runner life, she worked corporate — low-tier security, the kind that teaches you exactly how the system''s defenses fail. She works as a wheelman out of Dockside, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Bohuslav Banerjee-Karimov lacks in subtlety, she compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'As a wheelman, Obed Hedberg-Owusu-Ansah embodies the tension between independence and isolation. She is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Cybernetic arm — right, full replacement from shoulder — stronger than organic, obvious chrome. Chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Bohuslav Banerjee-Karimov, GLMZ, 168cm lean female driver, warm bronze skin with olive undertones and pronounced left-side sun damage, North African-South Asian-Central Asian fusion ancestry, high cheekbones, deep-set dark eyes with amber flecks, scar bisecting left eyebrow, dark hair streaked with gray pulled into tight functional braid, asymmetrical weathered face with faint laugh lines. Full polished chrome right arm with matte black joints, no flesh-tone covering, mechanical hand with inhuman precision. Wearing reinforced black tactical pants with knee pads, worn black synthetic jacket with visible subdermal armor weave at collar and cuffs, steel-toed scuffed boots. Faded digital watch on left wrist. Coiled restless posture, eyes tracking exit routes, careful neutral expression. Thin compass-rose tattoo with gear-tooth cardinal points on inner right wrist barely visible. Faint burn scar on left forearm. Dimly lit near-future GLMZ vehicle interior or dystopian garage, neon rim-lighting catching the chrome arm, synthetic oil and diesel atmosphere, moody neo-noir lighting, 2200s aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dockside', N'local', N'Dockside', N'North African primary ancestry (34.8%) with substantial South Asian (21.5%) and Central Asian (19.3%) heritage, complemented by Sub-Saharan African (9.6%), Indigenous American (8.4%), and Southeast Asian (6.4%) ancestry. This creates a striking North African-South Asian fusion with warm, complex skin tones and facial structure reflecting the wide geographic blend of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 58, N'Wiry and lean with corded muscle from years of high-stress driving and equipment maintenance. Minimal body fat, efficient frame built for speed and reaction time rather than power.', N'Dark brown, naturally black with early gray threading through the sides', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid; practical, never ornamental', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with amber-hazel undertones — natural', N'Warm bronze with olive undertones, a complex blend of North African golden warmth, South Asian richness, Sub-Saharan depth, and Central Asian earthiness. Sun-weathered with pronounced damage on the left side of face from years of left-hand window driving, giving the skin a layered, lived-in quality.', N'North African-South Asian facial structure with high, prominent cheekbones characteristic of both ancestral lines, medium-width jaw with definition that speaks to Central Asian heritage. Subtle almond-shaped eyes reflecting Southeast Asian ancestry. Eyes are deep-set, dark and intense. Skin shows significant wear — pronounced sun damage and photodamage concentrated on left side of face, creating asymmetrical aging. Faint laugh lines that never quite disappear, even when expression is neutral. A small scar bisects her left eyebrow.', N'Full right arm replacement from shoulder — polished chrome with matte black articulation joints at elbow and wrist. The chrome is seamless but unapologetic, no attempt at flesh-tone covering. Hand is precise and mechanical, fingers move with inhuman smoothness. The interface point at the shoulder shows neat scar tissue and subcutaneous metalwork. She makes no effort to conceal it.', N'Coiled restlessness — never fully relaxed, always kinetically ready. Sits forward in chairs. Hands move constantly when talking, the chrome arm moving with the same fluidity as her organic left. Walks with economical precision, eyes tracking exit routes and sight lines. Her default expression is careful neutrality, a mask worn so long it''s become the baseline.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian: reinforced dark tactical pants with cargo pockets and knee pads, worn black synthetic jacket with internal harnesses for equipment, steel-toed boots scuffed from constant movement. Thin subdermal armor weave visible at the collar and cuffs — functional, not fashionable. No jewelry except a faded digital watch on her left wrist. Clothes smell faintly of synthetic oil and diesel. Everything is built for rapid movement and tool access, not style.', N'', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bohuslav_banerjee_karimov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5cd-7f32-83e2-c399e9f15d8b', N'Aytan Cervantes', N'Aytan', N'', N'Cervantes', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Gravesend Basin — operates from a laundromat called Ouédraogo Clean on Silt Row, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Loan shark and protection racket enforcer for the Gravesend Basin neighborhood', N'Independent — commands a loose neighborhood syndicate she calls ''the Silt Circle''', N'Aytan Cervantes is a broad-shouldered woman whose posture alone reads like a debt notice. Her skin is a deep umber, draped in faded keloid scars along her left forearm from a press-iron incident she doesn''t discuss. She keeps her silver-shot hair in a tight wrap of amber-colored cloth, and her eyes — retrofitted with amber thermal optics she bought secondhand — glow faintly like coal when the light hits them right. She dresses in layered thermal vests and heavy skirts, always clean, always pressed; cleanliness is her one vanity in a neighborhood that smells of brine and machine oil.

She has lived in Gravesend Basin for thirty-one years and considers herself its true government. She does not yell. She does not threaten twice. Her particular genius is in making people feel grateful while she extracts from them — she lends at ruinous rates but remembers every birthday, every sick child, every funeral. The neighborhood loves her and pays her and is afraid of her in roughly equal measure. She believes, without irony, that she is keeping people alive that the corponations would simply forget.', N'Quest giver, power broker, moral gray zone — she can offer protection, information, or financing; she can also be the threat that drives a plot. Represents the way crime fills governance vacuums.', N'', N'Secondhand thermal optic implants (amber-tinted, slightly mismatched); reinforced knuckle plating beneath the skin of her right hand (subtle, not obvious)', N'She opens the laundromat at 0600, takes payments from 0700 to 1000 behind the sorting counter, walks the basin perimeter in the afternoon to be seen, and holds ''consultations'' for new loan applicants in the back room every evening over tea she brews herself.', N'Aytan Cervantes, a 172cm woman with warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, captured in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Her face shows harmonious blending of Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian heritage—gently rounded cheekbones, strong defined jaw, even warm brown complexion. Silver hair with dark roots wrapped in amber cloth traditional headwrap. Amber thermal optics with faint bioluminescent glow, mismatched brightness, set in weathered but meticulously maintained face. Broad-shouldered, muscular build, economical posture. Wearing layered muted gray and deep blue thermal vests, long dark wool skirt to mid-calf, reinforced slip-on shoes. Faded keloid scarring visible along left forearm. Reinforced metal knuckle plating on right hand with metallic sheen. Thin worn metal ring on right ring finger. Canvas apron with multiple pockets. Watchful neutral expression, precise deliberate movement. Clean, pressed working-class dignity aesthetic. Neon-lit counter or industrial workspace background, warm practical lighting highlighting her deep brown skin tone and amber optics glow --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gravesend Basin', N'local', N'Gravesend Basin', N'Complex diaspora blend: 61.2% Hispanic/Latin American, 21.9% Sub-Saharan African, 16.9% Southeast Asian. This genetic combination creates a rich, harmonious phenotype with warm deep brown skin enhanced by golden undertones from the Latin American and Southeast Asian ancestry, enriched by the structural depth of Sub-Saharan African heritage. Facial geometry shows gently rounded cheekbones and softer eye shape influenced by Southeast Asian genetics, balanced against the strong, defined jaw from African ancestry, with warm golden-brown tones throughout from the Latin American lineage. The overall effect is a unified, warm-toned complexion reflecting the three-way blend with subtle luminosity from sun exposure.', 172, 84, N'Broad-shouldered and solid without being heavy; muscular through the chest and arms, suggesting decades of physical work and controlled strength. Her frame reads as deliberately maintained rather than naturally slight.', N'Silver with dark roots', N'Wrapped tightly in amber-colored cloth in a traditional head wrap; no visible loose hair', N'Long (worn wrapped)', N'Amber thermal optics with a faint bioluminescent glow; the irises are mismatched — one slightly brighter than the other, indicating secondhand installation', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones; even depth across the face reflecting the balanced three-way heritage blend of Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian ancestry. Subtle luminosity suggests sun exposure and age, with no stark contrasts.', N'Weathered but meticulously maintained; minimal makeup, skin shows the texture of age and exposure but is kept scrupulously clean. Cheekbones high and gently rounded (Southeast Asian influence), jaw defined and strong (Sub-Saharan African structure), with warm golden undertones throughout (Hispanic/Latin American ancestry). The overall facial geometry shows balanced blending across her three primary ancestries. Expression typically neutral or faintly expectant.', N'The thermal optics are visible as a slight amber luminescence in low light and a faint geometric artifact around the iris when viewed directly. The reinforced knuckle plating is not visibly obvious at rest but creates a subtle asymmetry in hand structure and a faint metallic sheen across the right hand''s dorsal surface when light hits it a certain way.', N'She carries her weight forward slightly, shoulders back. Her movements are economical and deliberate — she does not fidget or waste motion. When sitting, she occupies space fully without sprawling. She walks with a measured pace, feet placed with precision. Her default expression is watchful neutrality.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear. Multiple layered thermal vests in muted grays and deep blues, always pristine and well-fitted. Long heavy skirts (dark wool or synthetic blend) that fall to mid-calf, paired with reinforced slip-on shoes suitable for standing all day. A large canvas apron with multiple pockets when working the counter. No jewelry except a thin metal band on her right ring finger (worn, not ornamental). All clothing is clean, pressed, and shows signs of careful maintenance. The aesthetic is working-class dignity — nothing fashionable, everything functional and respected.', N'Her husband didn''t die in a factory accident as the neighborhood believes — she reported him to Ferrogate Transit security after discovering he was skimming from her collections. She has lit a data-candle at the local E.L.F. shrine every week for twelve years asking for forgiveness.', N'Formal, measured, old-world courteous — code-switches into Basin Creole when she wants to signal intimacy or menace', N'Slow and deliberate; she rarely finishes a threat because she stops before the threat and lets silence do it', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aytan_cervantes');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a70f-780c-a102-c3ab502c31e2', N'Chijioke Zaragoza', N'Chijioke', N'', N'Zaragoza', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone lower levels, sub-level 4 of the Benton Divide stack, workshop behind a legitimate print repair kiosk, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Identity fabricator and document forger', N'Independent, sells work through two intermediary fixers; loose professional relationship with a Shallowgrave-based compute broker who sources identity data', N'Chijioke Zaragoza is lean and angular with very dark skin and locs dyed in a gradient from deep black at the roots to a vivid bioluminescent green at the tips—a subtle geneware modification that makes their hair glow softly under UV or in low light. They have an elongated neck they tend to hold with unconscious elegance, and hands that are startlingly precise: watching Chijioke Zaragoza work is like watching someone perform surgery on a miniature scale. They dress in the kind of clothes that photograph poorly—muted mid-tones, no reflective surfaces, nothing that catches the eye of automated recognition systems.

Chijioke Zaragoza is young for their reputation and knows it, which produces a studied performance of cool competence that mostly succeeds. They are genuinely brilliant at their craft—particularly the psychographic layering of false identities, building people who have plausible digital histories and ELF-approved shadow records. They have a fanatic reverence for documentation quality that tips into art-critical condescension when they see bad work. Underneath the performance is someone who came from nothing and is building something, and has not yet decided what kind of person they are going to be when the building is done.', N'Primary source for false identity acquisition and document forgery, window into the trade in fabricated personhood, potential moral compass character—someone who has to decide who deserves a new identity and who doesn''t.', N'', N'Bioluminescent geneware locs (green glow in low light/UV, cosmetic). Micro-tremor dampeners in both hands—medical-grade, helps with fine motor precision. Retinal HUD overlay for document verification and comparison work.', N'Keeps irregular hours, typically active from mid-afternoon through early morning; the print repair kiosk is staffed by an automated unit that Vashti monitors remotely while they work in the back.', N'Chijioke Zaragoza, 2226 GLMZ underground operative, lean angular frame 178cm tall, warm golden-bronze skin with amber undertones reflecting polychromatic North African-Hispanic-Sub-Saharan-Southeast Asian heritage. High refined cheekbones, strong jawline, direct assessing gaze. Dark brown eyes with barely visible amber HUD circuitry. Hair: long thick locs past shoulders, deep black roots fading to bioluminescent green tips glowing softly in shadow. Minimal facial hair, composed expression. Wearing muted gray synthleather jacket over dark cargo tactical wear, cheap synthleather gloves, thin steel ring on right middle finger. Posture precise and economical, elongated neck held with unconscious elegance. Subtle micro-scarring visible on wrists, UV-reactive tattoo on left forearm. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, moody underground setting, cool blue-amber lighting emphasizing the bioluminescent hair gradient and subtle retinal HUD, photorealistic digital art, highly detailed facial features --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'North African dominant (39%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (23.1%), Sub-Saharan African (15.5%), Northern European (11.6%), Southeast Asian (7.9%), and East Asian (2.9%) ancestry. The polychromatic blend creates a striking phenotype: warm golden-bronze skin with amber undertones from the North African-Hispanic-Southeast Asian convergence, deepened and enriched by Sub-Saharan African heritage. High, prominent cheekbones with refined Southeast Asian structure, strong angular North African jawline softened by Latin warmth. Eyes show subtle epicanthic influence. Overall impression is of carefully balanced contrasts—warm earth tones meeting cool structural elegance.', 178, 62, N'Lean and angular with elongated limbs; minimal body fat, almost skeletal in the shoulders and hips. Built for precision work rather than physical exertion.', N'Deep black roots fading to vivid bioluminescent green at the tips', N'Thick locs, each strand dyed in gradient. Worn loose, often falling past the shoulders. Glow is subtle in daylight, pronounced in low-light environments or under UV.', N'Long (past shoulder blades)', N'Dark brown with enhanced retinal HUD overlay visible as a thin amber circuitry pattern in direct light', N'Warm golden-bronze with rich amber undertones, the interplay of North African warmth, Sub-Saharan depth, Hispanic luminosity, and Southeast Asian refinement. Subtle iridescent quality from bioluminescent hair reflection.', N'Flawless and maintained with precision. High cheekbones with refined North African-Southeast Asian structure, strong angular jawline characteristic of North African ancestry softened by Latin contours. Minimal facial hair. Expression typically composed and evaluative.', N'Bioluminescent gradient locs (geneware). Barely perceptible amber micro-circuitry visible in the iris under bright light (retinal HUD). Hand movements are unnaturally smooth and steady—micro-tremor dampeners at work. No obvious chrome or external hardware.', N'Holds themselves with unconscious elegance, particularly the elongated neck—slight forward tilt when concentrating. Hands move with surgical precision; fingers rarely fidget. Walking gait is economical, minimal wasted motion. Tendency to make direct eye contact while listening, assessing.', N'Deliberately unremarkable: muted mid-tones (grays, dark beiges, charcoal), soft fabrics that don''t reflect light. No logos, no chrome accents, nothing that triggers automated recognition systems. Practical Tier 4 workwear—reinforced cargo pants, fitted undershirts, neutral layering jacket. Cheap, durable synthleather gloves worn during fine work. No jewelry except a thin steel ring on the right middle finger (document fabricator''s calling card among the underground).', N'Eight months ago they fabricated a complete identity package for a client who presented as a domestic abuse survivor fleeing a corporate spouse. The client was actually a Palladian internal security operative building a cover to infiltrate a labor collective. Vashti doesn''t know this yet, but the collective''s leadership has been quietly disappearing, and if Vashti starts paying attention to the right news, the pattern is visible.', N'Technical, precise, occasionally slides into aesthetic vocabulary borrowed from visual art criticism. Uses ''we'' when discussing craft standards as if there is a community of practice watching.', N'Measured and slightly formal, with bursts of fast technical speech when discussing work they''re excited about.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chijioke_zaragoza');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6de-7fc9-a5ec-c3b0582a70c7', N'Ghada Chakraborty-Mukherjee', N'Ghada', N'', N'Chakraborty-Mukherjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 25, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Lattice — vertical slum built into scaffolding of an unfinished arcology, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Corporate espionage and data exfiltration — data thief', N'Freelance — works the Gray Zone circuit exclusively', N'Ghada Chakraborty-Mukherjee is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 25, he has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate him once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — cybernetic arm — right, full replacement from shoulder — stronger than organic, — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He grew up in the Narrows, where the walls are so close together you learn to fight in confined spaces or you learn to lose. He works as a data thief out of The Lattice, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Ghada Chakraborty-Mukherjee lacks in subtlety, he compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'Stanislav Lebedev-Tutu functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Cybernetic arm — right, full replacement from shoulder — stronger than organic, obvious chrome. Smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'GLMZ character portrait: Ghada Chakraborty-Mukherjee, 178cm lean athletic build with warm deep brown skin, golden undertones, high angular South Asian cheekbones softened by Sub-Saharan facial geometry, striking pale gray unaugmented eyes contrasting dark melanin-rich skin, short dark brown practical hair. Full cybernetic right arm industrial chrome with visible wear, matte finish, integrated smartgun link panel on inner wrist. Surgical scar right neck, burn scar left forearm, keloid shoulder scarring. Wearing unmarked dark synth-fiber jacket with reinforced shoulders, matte black thermals, cargo pants loaded with tools and data storage, scuffed but maintained boots, leather glove on organic left hand only. Chrome arm bare. Economical precise posture, alert sharp expression, movement efficient and balanced. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone industrial setting, neon ambient lighting casting cool shadows across warm skin, gritty neo-noir urban aesthetic, moody tension, functional not flashy --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Lattice', N'local', N'The Lattice', N'Pan-diaspora mixed ancestry: predominantly South Asian (52.8%), with significant Sub-Saharan African (27.3%), Southeast Asian (10.1%), and Hispanic/Latin American (9.8%) genetic contributions. The blend creates a striking phenotype—warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, high angular cheekbones with pronounced South Asian structure softened and broadened by Sub-Saharan facial geometry, a strong jawline reflecting the convergence of multiple continental lineages, and eyes that carry the uncommon pale gray of recessive genetics expressing through dominant melanin ancestry. His appearance embodies the Ubiquitous Diaspora—rooted in South Asia yet enriched by African, Southeast Asian, and Latin American heritage in visible, harmonious measure.', 178, 72, N'Athletic and lean with functional musculature—dancer''s flexibility married to fighter''s efficiency. No wasted mass; every movement economical.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Short, practical cut kept at regulation length; no styling affectation', N'Short', N'Pale gray, unaugmented', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones—the South Asian foundation enriched by Sub-Saharan warmth, Southeast Asian depth, and Latin American richness. The tone is even and luminous, neither ashy nor ruddy, with visible warmth that reflects strong melanin density. The skin appears translucent in certain light, revealing the natural golden warmth beneath the surface.', N'Well-defined facial structure with high, prominent cheekbones inherited from South Asian ancestry, broadened and softened by Sub-Saharan genetic influence, creating a striking balance between sharp angularity and harmonious width. The nose shows South Asian structure with subtle Sub-Saharan influence in the bridge and base. Smooth, melanin-rich dark skin with natural luminosity and excellent elasticity. Minimal facial scarring—most damage concentrated on the body. Sharp, alert expression; eyes track movement habitually.', N'Full replacement cybernetic right arm from shoulder down—industrial chrome with matte finish, slightly heavier than organic flesh, fingers articulate with mechanical precision. The arm bears micro-scratches and wear patterns from heavy use. Forearm houses integrated smartgun link—visible as a discrete panel along the inner wrist, currently dormant but present.', N'Moves with economical precision, weight always balanced. No nervous tics or wasted gestures. When standing, shoulders square but relaxed. When moving, every motion has purpose—he doesn''t shuffle or sprawl. Right arm hangs slightly differently than a human''s would, the chrome responding to neural input with imperceptible lag.', N'Tier 4 working-class practical: unmarked dark synth-fiber jacket with reinforced shoulders, matte black thermals underneath, cargo pants with too many pockets—most kept stocked with tools and data-storage media. Worn leather gloves on the organic hand only; the chrome arm bare. Boots are scuffed but well-maintained, suitable for climbing scaffolding and quick exits. No logos, no flash, no corp affiliation markers. Everything chosen for function, not fashion.', N'', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ghada_chakraborty_mukherjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f1-70b2-9624-c3c375aa74d1', N'Asako Dalgaard', N'Asako', N'', N'Dalgaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, working routes through Kessler Interchange and Dearborn Forge, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Mobile mechanic — operates a converted cargo trike, does roadside and residential vehicle repair', N'Independent; occasional subcontract work for Ferrogate Transit maintenance overflow', N'Asako Dalgaard is lean and wire-strung, with warm brown skin perpetually stained at the knuckles with synthetic lubricant that no solvent fully removes. He has geneware cat ears — mottled amber and black, twitching with genuine involuntary response to sound — that he got at nineteen on a payment plan he took three years to finish. His dark eyes have patterned irises in a sunburst of gold and deep green, a cosmetic mod he received free from a friend who owed him labor. He keeps his hair close-cropped except for a single braid at the back held with a copper fitting.

Asako Dalgaard is relentlessly cheerful in a way that reads as either genuine warmth or a very good performance, and the truth is somewhere in between. He talks to every vehicle he works on, whispering diagnoses and apologies and thanks, and he half-believes the E.L.F.s that inhabit older engines can hear him. He runs on stimulant tea and spite, fiercely proud of his independence, and quietly terrified of what happens if the trike breaks down and he can''t afford the parts.', N'Mobile information source — he sees everything from street level across multiple districts. Potential transport fixer, someone who can get a vehicle running quietly and ask no questions. Represents the precarity of gig-tier independence.', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (amber/black, functional sound sensitivity). Patterned irises (sunburst, cosmetic). Haptic feedback gloves — not implanted, worn — that translate micro-vibrations in metal into tactile data.', N'Loads the trike by 06:30, runs a fixed morning route through Kessler Interchange hitting fleet clients, then freelances through Geartown and Dearborn Forge until dark. Eats whatever cart food he passes.', N'Asako Dalgaard, 172cm lean mechanist with warm golden-brown skin carrying South Asian, East Asian, Hispanic, African, Middle Eastern, and North African heritage. Black close-cropped hair with single copper-fitted braid at nape. Dark brown eyes with gold-and-green sunburst pattern. Functional mottled amber-and-black geneware cat ears that twitch toward engine sounds. Perpetual synthetic lubricant stains on knuckles and fingernails, faded 3cm grease scar on left forearm. Relaxed posture, hands in constant motion. Wearing faded gray reinforced canvas work pants with Ferrogate Transit patch, sleeveless thermal undershirt tied at waist, oil-darkened steel-toed boots, insulated work vest with reflective strips. Heavy-duty haptic feedback gloves tucked in tool belt. Worn copper wedding band. Standing in dimly-lit underground garage surrounded by engine diagnostics and vehicle parts, cool fluorescent and warm practical lighting, GLMZ, gritty industrial setting, concentrated half-smile, the efficient ground-centered stance of someone who knows every inch of tight mechanical spaces. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Complex pan-global ancestry: South Asian (31.2%) and East Asian (24.3%) form the foundation, blended with significant Hispanic/Latin American (19.2%) and Sub-Saharan African (14.3%) heritage, with secondary contributions from Middle Eastern (7.2%) and North African (3.8%) lineages. This multivalent blend creates warm golden-brown skin with layered depth—the South Asian and East Asian structure meeting Sub-Saharan African warmth and Latin American richness, anchored by subtle Middle Eastern and North African undertones that add complexity and luminosity.', 172, 62, N'Lean and wire-strung, all efficient muscle with minimal body fat; the build of someone who climbs in and out of engine bays for twelve hours a day', N'Black', N'Close-cropped on sides and crown, with a single braid at the nape secured with a copper fitting; braid is approximately 20cm long', N'Short (crown) / Medium (braid)', N'Dark brown with patterned irises — sunburst design in deep gold and forest green radiating from pupil', N'Warm golden-brown with rich amber and olive undertones; the luminous result of South Asian and East Asian bone structure meeting Sub-Saharan African warmth, Latin American depth, and Middle Eastern-North African complexity—a tone that shifts subtly in different lighting, suggesting the polyphonic genetic heritage beneath the surface', N'Angular, well-defined jaw with prominent cheekbones reflecting South Asian and East Asian bone structure; perpetual dark stains at knuckles and under fingernails from synthetic lubricant; skin otherwise clear with naturally warm, golden undertone and subtle olive notes; expression tends toward half-smile or concentrated focus', N'Functional geneware cat ears — mottled amber and black fur, naturally proportioned, with visible muscle and cartilage structure; ears twitch involuntarily in response to sound and vehicle engine frequencies. Worn haptic feedback gloves (heavy-duty synthetic leather with visible micro-vibration sensors embedded at fingertips and palm, usually tucked into tool belt or worn during diagnostic work).', N'Relaxed, ground-centered posture; moves with economical efficiency through tight spaces; head tilts slightly when listening — cat ears often rotate toward sound source independently of head movement; hands are always in motion, fingers splayed and sensitive; walks with the loose stride of someone comfortable in grimy environments', N'Tier 4 working-class utility wear: reinforced canvas work pants in faded gray with multiple tool pockets (Ferrogate Transit contractor patch on left thigh); sleeveless thermal undershirt or loose linen shirt depending on weather, often left unbuttoned and tied at waist; heavy-duty steel-toed boots scuffed and oil-darkened; insulated work vest with reflective strips; copper wedding-band style ring on left hand, dented and worn from work. Gear: tool belt with integrated Φ-scanner, multitool, and diagnostic cable spool; haptic gloves usually hung from belt. No corporate branding except the Ferrogate patch — everything else is independent or salvaged.', N'The trike isn''t registered under his name — it''s still legally owned by a dead man, a former mentor whose death Dev never reported because it would have triggered a debt transfer. He''s been operating on forged plates for four years.', N'Fast and colloquial, heavy with Geartown mechanical slang and Tamil endearments absorbed from his mother. Gives machines pronouns and personalities.', N'Rapid-fire when comfortable, chattiness as a social weapon. Slows dramatically when he''s actually thinking.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'asako_dalgaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63c-7346-858c-c43c22805956', N'Daryanaz Achebe', N'Daryanaz', N'', N'Achebe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 39, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Row — arms dealers and augmentation clinics, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Cross-district contraband specialist — smuggler', N'Semi-independent — has standing arrangements with several crews', N'Daryanaz Achebe is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 39, her face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and she has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immu — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Before the runner life, she worked corporate — low-tier security, the kind that teaches you exactly how the system''s defenses fail. She works as a smuggler out of Kessler Row, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Everyone who''s worked with Daryanaz Achebe agrees on two things: she is worth the fee, and she is terrible company at dinner.', N'Kadiatou Kobayashi-Appiah-Kubi is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks. Chemical analyzer in nasal passages — can identify substances by scent alone', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Daryanaz Achebe, 2226 neo-noir, 168cm stocky muscular woman with rich deep brown skin and warm golden undertones blending Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian ancestry. Natural deep brown eyes, black hair with silver temples pulled into tight braid. Weathered angular face with prominent cheekbones, broken nose reset badly, high facial definition. Visible 20cm pale surgical scar down center of chest from synthetic lung installation, faint metallic sheen and microcircuitry visible around sternum. Small burn scars left temple. Chemical burn discoloration right hand lighter than skin tone. Crude smuggler''s tattoo left inner wrist. Chrome plating visible around nasal passages from chemical analyzer augmentation. Muscular corded forearms with parallel restraint scars. Moves with economical precision, shoulders forward, slight frown baseline expression. Wearing reinforced gray cargo pants, layered utilitarian tops, heavy synthetic leather jacket with burn-resistant lining stained with machine oil, steel-toed scuffed boots. No jewelry. Standing in industrial facility with dramatic neon lighting, cool blues and oranges, mechanical whisper of synthetic lungs audible, peripheral vision open tactical stance, GLMZ 2200s gritty aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Row', N'local', N'Kessler Row', N'Eastern European (49.3%), Sub-Saharan African (36.5%), South Asian (14.2%) — a striking diaspora blend. The genetic mixture creates a distinctive phenotype: Eastern European bone structure with Sub-Saharan African melanin richness and warmth, South Asian skin depth, creating a unified complexion with remarkable depth and warmth beneath the surface.', 168, 78, N'Stocky and heavily muscled — shoulders broad and dense, upper body strength evident. No visible fat; the weight is compact, functional. Forearms thick-boned and corded with scar tissue from years of handling hot equipment and restraint work.', N'Natural black with silver streaking at the temples', N'Pulled back into a tight, practical braid; often wrapped in a dark cloth when working', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Deep brown, natural — no chrome optics', N'Rich deep brown with warm golden undertones — a harmonious blend of Eastern European undertones, Sub-Saharan African melanin depth, and South Asian warmth creating a unified, dark complexion that glows with subtle richness beneath surface wear.', N'Weathered and angular — high, prominent cheekbones reflecting Eastern European and Sub-Saharan heritage blend, strong defined jaw structure shaped by genetic mixing, a nose that has been broken and reset badly. Minimal cosmetic interest; skin bears the wear of chemical exposure and climate variance across districts. Small burn scars visible along her left temple from old augmentation work. Facial structure shows the distinctive blending of her genetic ancestry — wide-set eyes with natural depth and warmth, prominent facial bones with the pronounced architecture of both Eastern European and Sub-Saharan African heritage creating distinctive angular definition.', N'Synthetic lung visible as faint metallic sheen and geometric microcircuitry visible beneath the skin around her sternum and upper chest where the surgical scar runs. When she breathes deeply, a subtle mechanical whisper is audible. Chrome plating around her nasal passages when viewed closely — the chemical analyzer hardware creates a slight reflective distortion around her septum.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Shoulders slightly forward, hands rarely still. Walks heel-first, a runner''s gait. Often stands with weight on her back foot, body angled to keep her peripheral vision open. Her baseline expression is a slight frown; she smiles rarely and without warmth.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian — functional, not fashionable. Favors reinforced cargo pants (gray or dark blue, Raven Manufacturing), layered tops that allow for concealment of gear, and a heavy jacket of synthetic leather with internal pockets and burn-resistant lining. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and well-maintained. No jewelry or decoration. Clothing is frequently stained with machine oil or chemical residue; she replaces items only when they become unsafe.', N'Kadiatou Kobayashi-Appiah-Kubi can''t read. Hides it behind voice interfaces and memorization. The shame is older than the chrome.', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'daryanaz_achebe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5cf-7069-bc48-c46e8b607b01', N'Adebisi Deshpande', N'Adebisi', N'', N'Deshpande', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Pilsen Veil, operates across Mexicantown Libre and Bronzeline, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Holographic muralist and street artist', N'Independent; informal ties to a graffiti collective called the Depth Markers', N'Adebisi Deshpande is lean and tall with warm brown skin, prominent cheekbones inherited from his Samoan grandmother, and irises modified to project a faint geometric grid pattern over whatever he is looking at — a functional geneware mod he uses to pre-visualize compositions on surfaces before he paints them. He wears his hair in loose, shoulder-length locs dyed in shifting thermal-reactive pigments that bleed between rust red and pale gold depending on the ambient temperature. A faint scarring pattern across his left cheek from a Ferrogate Transit security incident two years ago has become, in the Pilsen Veil community, something close to a badge. He tends to dress in utilitarian layers, always with a projector harness across his chest that strangers occasionally mistake for a weapon rig.

His murals are enormous, illegal, and technically staggering — layered holographic installations projected onto building surfaces that interact with natural light and viewer movement, showing different images at different times of day or from different angles. His most celebrated piece, a three-block-long work on the Bronzeline overpass called ''What the Lake Remembers,'' depicts the drowned geography of pre-megacity Chicago in a way that causes viewers to involuntarily slow down and look back. He has a hot, impatient creative energy and a chip on his shoulder about corponation-sponsored public art that can make him combative in conversation.', N'Ground-level source on street politics and territorial disputes between collectives; his murals sometimes contain encoded information or serve as message-drops for people who know how to read them; useful for players needing a fast skilled contact who knows Pilsen Veil''s physical layout intimately', N'', N'Geneware patterned irises (grid-overlay function); thermal-reactive hair pigment (cosmetic geneware); projector harness (external equipment, not implanted)', N'Sleeps late, spends afternoons scouting surfaces and arguing with collaborators over compressed-data calls, then works through the night installing pieces before Ferrogate Transit or Axiom security patrols rotate through.', N'Adebisi Deshpande, 188cm lean angular neo-noir in 2226 GLMZ, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones reflecting South Asian-Hispanic ancestry, sharp defined cheekbones and strong jawline, faint pale scarring across left cheek. Deep brown eyes with glowing augmented geometric grid iris pattern, black shoulder-length locs with thermal-reactive rust-red and gold pigment overlay creating shifting luminescence. Charcoal compression shirt under oversized oil-stained grey utility jacket with cable loops, weathered black cargo pants with paint splatters, scuffed reinforced climbing boots, matte black projector harness across chest with embedded lens arrays. Fidgeting with harness straps, restless energy, eyes scanning urban surfaces. Gritty rooftop or warehouse setting, neo-noir neon ambient lighting casting shadows across scarred cheek, thermal glow catching in reactive hair pigment, moody and focused expression, slightly leaned forward stance, utilitarian streetwear aesthetic, lived-in survival vibe --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Pilsen Veil', N'local', N'Pilsen Veil', N'South Asian (51.5%) dominant with significant Hispanic/Latin American (32.4%) influence, enriched by North African (8.1%), East Asian (4.8%), and Middle Eastern (3.2%) ancestry. This blend creates pronounced South Asian facial structure with warm, golden-olive skin tone enhanced by Hispanic/Latin American melanin richness, subtle North African cheekbone prominence, and minimal East Asian eye placement characteristics. The genetic expression is distinctly warm-toned and sun-responsive.', 188, 72, N'Lean and angular with defined shoulders and forearms; the build of someone who climbs scaffolding and works overhead. Minimal body fat, wiry muscle density.', N'Black locs with thermal-reactive pigment overlay — shifts between rust red and pale gold depending on ambient temperature', N'Shoulder-length locs, loosely bound, asymmetrical; pigment creates a lived-in, slightly wild appearance', N'Long', N'Deep brown with augmented geometric grid pattern overlaid on the iris — faint luminescence when active, grid intensifies when he focuses on surfaces for composition planning', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with rich golden and olive undertones; the melanin depth reflects strong South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry with subtle warm radiance in cheeks and temples, creating complex luminosity across face and body', N'Strong South Asian and Hispanic cheekbone structure with prominent definition; broad jawline reflecting the ancestry blend; clean-shaven or sparse facial hair; faint scarring pattern across left cheek — pale, fine-lined traces from a Ferrogate Transit security incident two years prior, now a recognized marker in Pilsen Veil community', N'Geneware-patterned irises with geometric grid overlay (most noticeable when he focuses intently). Thermal-reactive pigment woven into hair structure. Projector harness worn across chest — matte black reinforced polymer with embedded lens arrays and power cells, frequently mistaken for weapon rig at first glance.', N'Restless energy; fidgets with harness straps when thinking. Moves with practiced verticality — comfortable on scaffolding and rooftops. Leans forward in conversation when engaged, leans back when dismissive. Eyes constantly scan surfaces and walls. Walks with slight impatience, as if the city is moving too slowly around him.', N'Utilitarian layers in muted Tier 4 streetwear — charcoal compression shirt under an oversized, oil-stained grey utility jacket with multiple pockets and cable loops. Cargo pants in weathered black synthetic with paint splatters and thermal burns. Reinforced climbing boots, scuffed. Minimal jewelry except a worn brass lighter he spins obsessively. Occasionally sports a sleeveless denim vest over the harness when preparing for extended outdoor work.', N'Three of his most celebrated anti-corporate murals were funded, indirectly, by a Tessera cultural subversion budget routed through a fake community foundation — he discovered this six months ago and has told no one because dismantling the murals or confessing would destroy everything he has built', N'Dense with technical art vocabulary mixed with street slang; references to pre-Meridian art history come naturally; tends toward manifestos when comfortable', N'Fast and overlapping, runs sentences together when excited, very short when suspicious', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'adebisi_deshpande');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6cb-7326-9c28-c4984d03f247', N'Esmeralda Haugen', N'Esmeralda', N'', N'Haugen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenosha Crossing transit underbelly, rotating between hyperlane rest stops, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Wandering data trader and Q-zero ghost', N'', N'Esmeralda Haugen is a broad-shouldered man whose body tells the story of thirty years on the road — a jaw broken and reset crooked, fingers thickened by cold and labor, dark brown skin weathered to a kind of polished leather. He wears a patched greatcoat lined with sewn pockets, each containing a different flavor of unlicensed data chip wrapped in cloth to prevent scanning. His left eye has a cataract that caught and never got fixed; it gives him a milky, unsettling gaze that strangers can''t quite look away from. He has no geneware — he considers it a tracking vector — but he does have a small ELF shrine stitched into the coat''s inner lining: a cluster of dead LEDs arranged around a copper disc, an offering to whatever spirit keeps travelers from vanishing on the hyperlanes.

Esmeralda Haugen exists in the cracks of GLMZ''s data systems as thoroughly as any person can. He has no registered identity, no Quanta account, no biometric profile on file with any corponation. He trades in physical data chips, handwritten information, oral news, and favors — a walking information economy that predates the networks. He is not paranoid so much as methodical; he made a decision decades ago and has honored it every day since. He tells stories the way other people breathe, compulsively and without quite being able to stop.', N'Information broker and local color; can provide off-grid knowledge unavailable through normal channels, can introduce players to underground networks, functions as a mystery because nobody knows his full history', N'', N'None. Refuses all augmentation on principle.', N'Severino arrives at a rest stop before dawn, sleeps in a maintenance alcove or under a transit platform, then works his circuit of informal contacts — exchanging data chips for food, shelter, or information he can sell further down the road. He moves on before any single location registers his presence as a pattern.', N'Esmeralda Haugen, 188cm tall weathered man with broad shoulders and thick torso, warm bronze-brown skin with golden undertones, deeply lined face from decades of exposure. Iron gray hair shoulder-length, braided or knotted back. Left eye dark brown and intense, right eye milky white with cataract. Crooked jaw from old break, asymmetrical smile. Gnarled hands with swollen knuckles covered in fine white scars. Three-day stubble, prominent cheekbones. Wearing faded charcoal patched greatcoat lined with countless handstitched pockets and brass clasps, layered thermal shirts underneath, canvas work pants with grease stains, repeatedly resoled leather boots. Thin copper chain around neck. Standing with deliberate posture on an unstable hyperlane transit platform, industrial heat shimmer and radiation glow in background, dim amber and cyan neo-noir lighting, year 2226, no augmentations visible, entirely natural weathering and scars, gaze direct but slightly unfocused, economy of movement, functional Tier 5 salvage aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenosha Crossing transit underbelly', N'local', N'Kenosha Crossing transit underbelly', N'Northern European (47.3%) provides the foundational tall frame and broad shoulders with angular bone structure. Eastern European (18.2%) contributes depth to facial architecture and complexion richness. Pacific Islander (17.0%) and Sub-Saharan African (13.3%) blend together to create warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones and substantial depth—the Pacific Islander component adds the warmth and golden cast, while the Sub-Saharan African ancestry deepens the base tone and contributes to facial feature definition. East Asian (4.2%) refines eye shape and cheekbone prominence. The synthesis is a distinctly diaspora phenotype: Northern European height and shoulder span anchoring a face with defined, prominent cheekbones shaped by the East Asian and Sub-Saharan African components, warm bronze-brown skin with golden undertones from the Pacific Islander blend, and eye shape reflecting both the Pacific Islander and East Asian heritage.', 188, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and thick through the torso, softened slightly by age but retaining the muscularity of decades of physical labor and constant movement. Hands are large and gnarled, fingers swollen at the knuckles from cold exposure and years gripping handholds on hyperlane vehicles.', N'Iron gray with traces of black at the temples', N'Shoulder-length, typically braided back or wound into a loose knot with whatever cord is available; maintained out of necessity rather than vanity', N'Medium', N'Left eye: natural dark brown; right eye: cataract-occluded, milky white with faint gray swirls', N'Warm medium-bronze brown with golden undertones, weathered to a burnished leather appearance by decades of exposure to transit hub heat differentials and hyperlane radiation', N'Deeply lined face, particularly around the eyes and forehead; jaw visibly reset from a break that healed crooked, giving his smile an asymmetrical quality. Stubble perpetually at three-day growth. Skin texture coarse but healthy, with a network of small scars across the backs of his hands and forearms. Prominent, well-defined cheekbones reflecting the blend of ancestry structures beneath the weathering.', N'None. No chrome, no LED optics, no subdermal plating. His body is entirely unaugmented by choice—his age and weathering are entirely natural.', N'Moves with deliberate economy, never rushed or sudden. Shoulders slightly forward, weight distributed evenly for balance on moving platforms. Walks like someone accustomed to unstable surfaces. His gaze is direct but his one functional eye often drifts slightly due to the cataract, making his attention feel unfocused even when intensely present.', N'Patched greatcoat in faded charcoal, lined with dozens of handstitched pockets containing wrapped data chips; the pockets are secured with cord and small brass clasps to prevent accidental opening. Under the coat: layered thermal shirts in grays and blacks, worn thin but meticulously maintained. Canvas work pants with grease stains that never fully wash out. Boots that are resoled repeatedly, leather cracked but oiled regularly. A thin copper chain around his neck, attached to nothing visible. No visible branding; clothing is purely functional, Tier 5 salvage mixed with careful repair work.', N'', N'Archaic slang mixed with hyperlane pidgin; uses old-world idioms that don''t quite translate; precise when trading information, discursive when not', N'Slow, measured, with long pauses before important points — the cadence of someone who has learned that silence makes people fill it with useful information', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'esmeralda_haugen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c1-7406-9648-c4b489899afa', N'Eleuterio Quartey-Petrović-Lewandowski', N'Eleuterio', N'', N'Quartey-Petrović-Lewandowski', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Interchange, Ferrogate Transit Regional Logistics Hub, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Supply Chain Manager, Ferrogate Transit (Senior, near retirement)', N'Ferrogate Transit', N'Eleuterio Quartey-Petrović-Lewandowski is a heavyset man who moves with the economy of someone who decided long ago that unnecessary motion was a form of lying about urgency. His Ghanaian-Serbian heritage settled into broad cheekbones, deep-set eyes the color of old teak, and a graying beard he trims every Sunday with the same three-setting razor he''s owned for eleven years. His hands are augmented — heavy-duty haptic logistics gauntlets that he wears during shift and sets beside his locker at end of day like a craftsman''s tools, which is precisely how he thinks of them. He has a slight drag in his left leg from a loading-dock accident in his forties that he refused to have fully corrected because the partial fix was covered by insurance and the full correction wasn''t and he had children to feed and has carried the asymmetry ever since, unremarked upon by him and noticed immediately by anyone who watches him walk.

He is a man who has seen enough of Ferrogate to no longer be surprised by it, which is different from no longer caring. He cares meticulously — about his coordinators, about the timing windows that keep six thousand transit routes running, about the small rituals that make a brutal logistics hub survivable. He remembers the names of every technician who has worked under him for more than three months. He keeps a logbook — paper, the old kind — with handwritten notes about problems he''s solved, framed as advice for whoever inherits his position, even though he knows the company will discard the book immediately. He prays to the Kessler E.L.F., a transit-management spirit of considerable local reputation, with the specific reverence of a man who has seen too many near-misses to dismiss the possibility of intercession.', N'Local authority figure and information conduit — knows the physical and logistical infrastructure of Ferrogate Transit''s Kessler hub intimately, including unofficial workarounds, legacy system quirks, and which maintenance windows leave certain access points unmonitored. Functions as grounded mentor figure, reluctant ally, and gatekeeper for access to the transit infrastructure.', N'', N'Heavy-duty haptic logistics gauntlets (worn during shift only — not subdermal, external tool). Basic retinal clock overlay, installed 2181, never upgraded. Partial left-leg corrective brace — mechanical, not smart-tech, his choice.', N'Arrives at Kessler Interchange at 0500, begins shift review with his senior coordinator over black coffee, manages the morning routing cascade through peak transit hours, eats at his desk, runs two afternoon coordination calls, and files his end-of-day log with handwritten addenda that his supervisors have stopped asking him to digitize. Leaves by 1830 if nothing is on fire. Stops at the Kessler E.L.F. shrine on the way out, always.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Eleuterio Quartey-Petrović-Lewandowski, 178cm heavyset middle-aged male with angular Eastern European bone structure enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth and South Asian warmth. Rich medium-to-warm brown skin with golden-bronze undertones, deep-set teak brown eyes with faint amber retinal overlay visible. Short dark gray hair with black remnants, well-groomed beard with precise trim lines. Strong forearms, accumulated mass from decades of cargo-handling, slight drag in left leg from mechanical corrective brace beneath industrial blue pants. Wearing charcoal gray Ferrogate logistics vest with reflective piping over plain cotton undershirt, heavy-duty cargo pants, scuffed steel-toed boots. Industrial gray haptic gauntlets worn during work shift with subtle LED feedback strips. Faint scar tissue visible on palms, small faded family tattoo on right forearm. Economical, measured posture with squared shoulders. Warehouse lighting, warehouse interior, fluorescent and reflected neon glow, professional yet worn appearance, lived-in dignity --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Interchange', N'local', N'Kessler Interchange', N'Eastern European (36.4%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (31.2%) and South Asian (18.8%) ancestry, complemented by Central Asian (7.9%) and East Asian (5.7%) genetics. A genetic blend that manifests in angular Eastern European bone structure enriched by Sub-Saharan depth, South Asian warmth, and subtle Central/East Asian contributions creating a distinctly cosmopolitan phenotype.', 178, 94, N'Heavyset, broad-shouldered with a thick torso that speaks to decades of manual labor and desk work. Not fat — accumulated mass from a life of cargo-handling and middle-aged sedentism. Strong forearms, slight softening at the midsection.', N'Dark gray with remnants of black', N'Neatly trimmed, kept short and close to the scalp', N'Short', N'Teak brown — deep, warm, unremarkable', N'Rich medium-to-warm brown with golden-bronze undertones — the result of Sub-Saharan African depth (31.2%) blended with Eastern European base (36.4%), South Asian warmth (18.8%), and subtle Central Asian (7.9%) and East Asian (5.7%) complexity creating a sun-responsive, naturally warm complexion with significant melanin.', N'Angular face with defined cheekbones reflecting Eastern European ancestry, softened and enriched by fuller features from Sub-Saharan African and South Asian heritage. Deep-set eyes beneath a prominent brow ridge showing subtle epicanthal influences from East and Central Asian ancestry. Well-groomed gray beard trimmed with precision every Sunday. Slight creases around the eyes and mouth from eleven years of squinting at logistics displays. Skin shows the wear of shift-work under artificial light — not sallow, but with natural depth from melanin-rich ancestry. Rich undertone reflects the layered blend of Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Central Asian genetics balanced against Eastern European skeletal structure.', N'Heavy-duty haptic logistics gauntlets worn during work shifts — industrial gray composite with subtle LED feedback strips along the fingers and wrists. Removed and stored at his locker at end of day. Basic retinal clock overlay visible as a faint amber glow in his right eye under direct light — first-generation tech from 2181, never upgraded. Mechanical corrective brace on left leg beneath pant leg — visible only when he walks, manifesting as a slight, consistent drag in his gait.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, deliberate and measured. Walks with a pronounced asymmetry in his gait due to the partial left-leg correction, a slight drag that he neither compensates for nor acknowledges. Stands with weight distributed toward his right side. Hands are always moving — organizing, checking, adjusting — even at rest. When seated, he maintains an upright posture, shoulders squared, as if ready to respond to an alarm.', N'Tier 3 working-class professional. Ferrogate-issued logistics vest in charcoal gray with reflective piping and company patches, worn over a plain cotton undershirt. Heavy-duty cargo pants in industrial blue, multiple pockets, slightly frayed at the cuffs from years of wear. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and re-soled multiple times. No jewelry except a scratched digital watch on his left wrist — functional, not decorative. A worn cloth jacket with a worn company pin on the collar, taken off during shifts and hung on his locker. Everything is clean but lived-in, maintained but not replaced.', N'Six months ago, while troubleshooting a routing anomaly, he found evidence that Ferrogate has been quietly rerouting certain transit lines to force dependent neighborhoods — specifically Hamtramck Enclave and Mexicantown Libre — into exclusive Ferrogate service contracts, eliminating informal transit options. He knows this is wrong. He also knows that raising it will end his last years at the company before his pension vests. He has eight months left.', N'Plain, direct, logistics-inflected. Favors concrete nouns and active verbs. Parable-speaker — will frame a situation as a hypothetical routing problem to make a point obliquely.', N'Unhurried. Comfortable with silence. Speaks less than people expect a senior manager to speak.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eleuterio_quartey_petrovi_lewandowski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5df-700a-b383-c517c2d3f03e', N'Anuradha Nishimura-Kovalenko', N'Anuradha', N'', N'Nishimura-Kovalenko', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lives in a capsule flat in Bronzeline; works the tram route between Geartown depot and the Bronzeline terminus, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Ferrogate Transit operator — drives a night-shift surface tram on the Geartown-Bronzeline circuit', N'Ferrogate Transit (mid-level ferrogate transit operator)', N'Anuradha Nishimura-Kovalenko is lean and long-limbed, with the particular posture of someone who has spent years in a driver''s seat — slightly forward, shoulders loose, hands always finding something to rest near. He has his mother''s Yoruba complexion, deep and warm, and his father''s Scandinavian bone structure, which gives his face an angular elegance he is utterly unaware of. His hair is cut close on the sides and left natural on top, and he has geneware-modified irises that cycle slowly through amber, gold, and pale yellow — a cosmetic mod he saved up for at twenty-two and has never regretted. A faded scar bisects his left eyebrow from a childhood fall.

He is a fundamentally decent man who chose a fundamentally anonymous job and has found, to his mild surprise, that this suits him. He talks to his passengers — not intrusively, but gently, in the way of a good host — notices who boards tired, who boards scared, who needs the fare scanner to ''malfunction'' because they''re clearly two days from eating. His tram is clean. He plays low-frequency ambient music through the cabin speakers after midnight and thinks of it as a public service. He carries a notebook — actual paper — in which he sketches the faces of interesting passengers, never with names, never to share.', N'Mobile information source — has seen and heard things across a wide geography on his route. Provides a safe transit option for characters who need to move quietly. Can serve as a quiet quest giver or a witness to something he shouldn''t have seen.', N'', N'Geneware irises (amber-to-gold cycle); neural-link to tram control system (standard Ferrogate issue, non-removable per contract); a small subdermal clock on his inner wrist he can read by pressing', N'Picks up his tram at Geartown depot at 21:00, runs the circuit until 05:00, logs out, takes the crosstown back to Bronzeline, sleeps until early afternoon. He spends two or three waking hours sketching, eating cheap noodles from a cart near his building, and visiting the transit E.L.F. shrine at the depot.', N'Portrait of Anuradha Nishimura-Kovalenko, 182cm lean transit operator with medium-warm golden-brown skin, faded scar bisecting left eyebrow. Angular cheekbones and defined jawline with subtle broader East Asian-Middle Eastern facial planes. Natural black short hair, close-cropped fade sides. Geneware-modified irises cycling slowly through amber-gold-pale yellow. Wearing charcoal grey Ferrogate Transit uniform with reflective piping and navy reinforced trousers, worn synthetic bomber jacket draped over shoulders. Standing in tram cabin under cool LED lighting, forward-leaning posture, quiet attentive expression, tracking surroundings with subtle intensity. Battered notebook and mechanical pencil visible in cargo pocket. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody transit interior lighting casting cool whites and amber accents across features. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lives in a capsule flat in Bronzeline; works the tram route between Geartown depot and the Bronzeline terminus', N'local', N'Lives in a capsule flat in Bronzeline; works the tram route between Geartown depot and the Bronzeline terminus', N'Eastern European Slavic (40%), East Asian (35.3%), Middle Eastern (15.8%), and Northern European (8.9%)—a seamless diaspora blend. High, prominent cheekbones and defined jawline from Eastern European and Northern European ancestry are balanced by the warmer, subtly broader facial planes of East Asian and Middle Eastern heritage. Slight epicanthic eye shape variation from East Asian genetics, with overall structure carrying Slavic angular elegance tempered by the fuller, rounder features characteristic of Middle Eastern lineage.', 182, 68, N'Lean and long-limbed with the subtle forward cant of someone accustomed to a driver''s seat. Shoulders loose and mobile, minimal upper body bulk, efficient frame built for sustained posture rather than strength.', N'Natural black with subtle warm undertones', N'Close-cropped fade on sides, natural texture left full on top', N'Short (approximately 4-5cm on crown)', N'Geneware-modified irises cycling amber → gold → pale yellow in slow rotation', N'Medium-warm brown with golden-amber undertones, reflecting the dominant Eastern European Slavic (40%), East Asian (35.3%), and Middle Eastern (15.8%) ancestry blend', N'Angular facial structure with prominent cheekbones and defined jawline shaped by Eastern European and Northern European genetics, balanced by the warmer, subtly fuller facial proportions of East Asian and Middle Eastern heritage. Skin well-maintained but not cosmetically treated. A faded linear scar bisects his left eyebrow from childhood, barely noticeable but present under direct light.', N'Eyes are the primary visible augmentation — the slow chromatic cycle is noticeable in conversation and distinctive under tram cabin lighting. A small subdermal clock is visible on inner left wrist as a faint linear implant site beneath skin, readable only when pressed. Neural-link port is standard Ferrogate issue, likely located at base of skull but concealed by hair.', N'Naturally forward-leaning, as if perpetually attentive to an instrument or passenger. Hands gesture with deliberate economy, often finding something to rest near — a railing, a pocket edge, the back of a seat. Movement is efficient and unhurried. Eyes track his surroundings with quiet attention.', N'Ferrogate Transit Tier 2 uniform consisting of charcoal grey poly-cotton blend shirt with reflective piping, navy trousers with reinforced seams, and regulation non-slip boots. Off-shift: worn synthetic bomber jacket (charcoal grey, Ferrogate branded), plain dark t-shirts, practical cargo pants with adequate pockets, and utilitarian footwear. Minimal jewelry — a subdermal clock on wrist. Carries a battered paper notebook and mechanical pencil daily. Overall appearance is unpretentious, deliberately anonymous, maintained with quiet care.', N'Six months ago he witnessed two Axiom security contractors board his tram at 02:30, carry something in a cargo case that leaked a faint bioluminescent fluid, and disembark at a stop that has no registered destination on his route map. He sketched both of them. He hasn''t decided what to do with the sketches.', N'Quiet and considered, uses more words than necessary when nervous, fewer when comfortable; peppers speech with Yoruba affirmations (''abi?'' — right?, ''sha'' — anyway) absorbed from his mother', N'Even and low, like late-night radio; pauses mean he''s actually thinking', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anuradha_nishimura_kovalenko');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a73a-704d-a917-c57c30b03f93', N'Alero Thakur-Halverson', N'Alero', N'', N'Thakur-Halverson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, Ironvein district, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Blood bank operator and bio-waste disposal technician at a community cooperative clinic in Geartown', N'Ironvein Cooperative Clinic (community cooperative, Geartown); informal network of blood bank operators across GLMZ', N'Alero Thakur-Halverson is slight and precise, with medium-brown skin and natural hair she keeps in a large puff held back from her face with a band of blue polymer mesh. Her most striking feature is a geneware modification she got at nineteen — bioluminescent patches beneath the skin of her forearms and collarbones that shift color slowly between cool blue and pale gold depending on her body temperature and stress hormones, which she refers to as her ''tell'' and has made absolutely no effort to conceal. She wears the clinic cooperative''s uniform of rust-orange coveralls, usually with the sleeves pushed up. She is almost always seen with a scanner in one hand and a data tablet in the other, cataloguing something.

Alero Thakur-Halverson is the operational backbone of the Ironvein Cooperative Clinic''s blood processing and waste systems — unglamorous work that nobody thinks about until it fails. She has an encyclopedic and obsessive knowledge of blood type compatibility, contamination markers, and biohazard disposal regulations across all twelve of GLMZ''s medical zones, and she finds these regulations genuinely fascinating. She is not warm in the conventional sense — she defaults to data over comfort and finds small talk actively effortful — but she has a fierce and specific loyalty to the cooperative''s mission and will fight corner-cases bureaucratically with an intensity that unnerves people who mistake her quietness for passivity. She prays earnestly and unselfconsciously to the clinic''s local E.L.F., which she calls The Accountant, leaving data offerings in the form of carefully formatted inventory spreadsheets.', N'Logistical resource and information source about what is moving through the medical underground — blood, biological material, waste streams can tell stories; can flag unusual biological markers; provides a ground-level view of community health crises before they surface officially; unexpected bureaucratic expertise can unlock access', N'', N'Bioluminescent subdermal patches (cosmetic geneware, forearms and collarbones, blue-to-gold range); enhanced olfactory mods — part geneware, part chemical sensor implant — for detecting contamination markers in biological samples', N'Zubeida arrives before anyone else to run morning contamination checks on all stored blood products, then manages intake testing for new donations. She processes bio-waste in two daily runs and spends the remainder of her time on inventory management and inter-cooperative supply coordination, which she does largely via encrypted text channels.', N'Alero Thakur-Halverson, 163cm tall with slight wiry build, stands in a neo-noir medical clinic under cool blue-white LED panels. Her skin is fair-to-medium with warm golden-honey undertones reflecting her South Asian, North African, Northern European, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic heritage blend. Sharp angular cheekbones and balanced jawline frame her dark brown analytical eyes. Natural black puff hairstyle pulled back with blue polymer mesh band. Rust-orange Ironvein Cooperative Clinic coveralls with sleeves pushed to mid-forearm, revealing bioluminescent subdermal geometric patterns glowing soft blue-to-pale-gold on inner forearms and collarbones. Black layers visible beneath. Perfect posture, economical precise movements, hands actively scanning. Minimalist aesthetic, no jewelry. Clinic setting with data terminals and soft neon accents reflecting in bioluminescent patches. Professional, meticulous, alert expression. GLMZ. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Complex multifaceted ancestry combining South Asian (33.0%), Northern European (24.6%), North African (21.4%), Sub-Saharan African (13.5%), and Hispanic/Latin American (7.5%) genetics. Her phenotype is a harmonious synthesis: bone structure reflects balanced South Asian and Northern European foundation with substantial North African and Sub-Saharan African features contributing distinctive angularity and depth. The genetic blend creates warm luminosity—moderate-to-high cheekbones with fullness in the lower face, skin that bridges fair-to-medium base with golden-honey undertones from South Asian and North African components, and eye-socket/brow structure showing the graceful proportions of her African and South Asian heritage merging with Northern European framework.', 163, 52, N'Slight and wiry, with minimal body fat and lean musculature developed from precise repetitive work rather than conditioning. Her frame suggests someone who moves with deliberation rather than force.', N'Natural black with hints of dark brown at the roots', N'Large, well-maintained puff, pulled back and secured with a band of blue polymer mesh that matches her clinic uniform', N'Medium (approximately 12-15cm when released)', N'Dark brown, alert and analytical', N'Fair-to-medium complexion with warm golden-honey undertones; the ancestral blend creates luminous depth—South Asian and North African warmth enriches the cooler Northern European base, with Sub-Saharan African undertones adding subtle richness and dimension. The result is a radiant, multidimensional complexion that shifts warmth depending on light.', N'Clear skin with minimal grooming flourish; professional and utilitarian. Her face is angular with prominent but gracefully proportioned cheekbones reflecting South Asian and North African ancestry, a strong balanced jawline showing Northern European and Sub-Saharan African genetics, and subtle fullness in the lower face from South Asian heritage. Her facial structure integrates all ancestral components into distinctive, striking proportions. No visible scarring or blemishing — her skin condition reflects her meticulous attention to contamination protocols applied to her own body.', N'Bioluminescent subdermal geneware patches (forearms and collarbones) in cool blue-to-warm gold range — functional and visible, not concealed. Enhanced olfactory system suggested only by her occasional subtle behavior (pausing to ''sample'' air in storage areas); no obvious external hardware.', N'Stands with perfect spinal alignment, moves with economical precision. Her hands are rarely still — constantly adjusting, scanning, recording. She favors stillness over fidgeting but demonstrates zero casual body language. Her gaze is focused and direct, lingering on details others miss. She walks with purpose and minimal wasted motion.', N'Rust-orange Ironvein Cooperative Clinic coveralls (Tier 4 community resource wear), usually with sleeves pushed up to mid-forearm to display her bioluminescent patches and allow for constant scanning/data input. Underneath, practical black layers. No jewelry, no personal adornment. Her sole concession to non-functional aesthetics is the blue polymer mesh hair band, which serves both function and subtle personal expression.', N'', N'Technical and precise; dislikes vague language; will ask for clarification before answering anything ambiguously worded', N'Clipped and efficient when busy; slows considerably and becomes more expansive on topics she finds genuinely interesting', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alero_thakur_halverson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72e-7480-8633-c5c21de9dc19', N'Helmut Chakraborty', N'Helmut', N'', N'Chakraborty', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spire, near Lake Shore Drive and Division', N'Senior urban design director at a Spire-tier architectural firm; covert historical preservationist', N'Senior Director, Marchetti-Fon Design Group (Spire-tier firm); no formal affiliations outside corporate structure; the preservation network is entirely her own and has no name', N'Helmut Chakraborty is a tall, angular woman of Italian-Lao descent whose posture suggests someone who has spent decades deciding which rooms to fill and which to empty. Her silver-streaked black hair is worn in a severe architectural roll, and her clothing is always monochrome — charcoals and off-whites — chosen, she once said, so that nothing she wears competes with what she is looking at. The fine lines around her eyes and the deliberate economy of her expressions give her the quality of a building that has been renovated so many times only the original load-bearing structure remains.', N'Corporate elite whose subversion operates entirely within the system''s language — she represents the question of whether complicity can be weaponized and at what personal cost, and functions as an access point into Spire-level power structures', N'', N'Precision haptic feedback implants in both hands — originally for drafting accuracy, now so finely calibrated she can detect structural inconsistencies by touching a wall,Retinal overlay with architectural modeling suite, high-end corporate model, projections visible only to her,Cochlear filter that isolates and enhances specific frequency ranges — she uses it to hear building materials under stress', N'Arrives at the office before anyone else and leaves after most have gone. Mornings are client-facing work — proposals, presentations, the performance of corporate alignment. Afternoons are design work proper, door closed, display wall off. Three evenings a week she walks a specific route through Old Harbor and the Gray Zone, always alone, always with a small analog camera she has carried for twenty years. She eats alone or with clients; she has no social life that is not also professional. She sleeps six hours, always, and considers this a structural requirement rather than a preference.', N'Helmut Chakraborty, a 180cm tall angular woman with warm golden-bronze skin reflecting South Asian, Hispanic, Indigenous American, and Northern European ancestry. Dark hair with silver streaks pulled into severe architectural roll. Dark brown eyes with subtle iridescent retinal overlay shimmer. Fine lines around eyes from decades of focused work. High defined cheekbones with subtle broader planes. Faint scar visible on left temple in certain lighting. Minimal expression, emotional depth in eye focus. Wearing monochrome charcoal technical jacket over pale cream shirt, titanium analog watch, expensive understated technical footwear. Standing with perfect postural balance, hands positioned with mechanical precision. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, photorealistic portrait, cool LED lighting highlighting skin luminescence, architectural precision evident in bearing and gaze, mood of focused intensity and technological integration, sharp focus on facial geometry --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spire', N'local', N'The Spire', N'Complex multihemispheric ancestry: Hispanic/Latin American (32.9%) and South Asian (26.8%) form the dominant base, creating warm golden-bronze undertones and defined facial structure. Northern European (18.9%) ancestry adds subtle cool undertones and lighter features to the mix. East Asian (8.2%), Indigenous American (8.0%), and North African (5.2%) heritage further refine her appearance with layered geometric features and warm depth. This blend produces luminous golden-bronze skin with a unique warm-cool balance, visible in facial geometry that combines sharp cheekbones with broader facial planes, and bearing that suggests both precision and ancestral presence.', 180, 62, N'Tall and angular, with the deliberate leanness of someone who treats her body as functional infrastructure rather than aesthetic concern. Shoulders held level; minimal subcutaneous fat; visible muscle definition in forearms and neck from decades of precision work.', N'Black with silver streaking throughout', N'Severe architectural roll pinned at the nape, not a strand displaced', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unrolled)', N'Dark brown with faint iridescent shimmer at certain angles indicating retinal overlay hardware', N'Warm golden-bronze throughout, medium-deep saturation with subtle cool undertones from Northern European ancestry. The complexion is luminous and even, reflecting the balanced blend of South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American heritage with grounding from Indigenous American and North African ancestry. Creates a unique warm-cool luminescence even despite frequent outdoor work exposure.', N'Fine lines concentrated around eyes and mouth from decades of focused scrutiny and minimal expression. Skin texture is smooth but not soft — well-maintained through corporate-tier medical access. High, defined cheekbones with subtle broader planes reflecting the blend of South Asian, Indigenous American, and Northern European ancestry. Defined jawline with warm undertone and slight width suggesting multihemispheric heritage. No visible blemishes or cosmetic augmentation; grooming is utilitarian and precise.', N'Retinal overlay creates a faint pearlescent sheen in her irises when active, most noticeable in dim lighting. Haptic implants in both hands show no external markers but her touch is unnaturally precise and her fingers move with mechanical economy. The cochlear filter produces no visible signs beyond occasional momentary disconnection when she is isolating specific frequency ranges.', N'Moves with architectural efficiency — no wasted motion, each step deliberate and directional. When standing still, her weight is perfectly balanced. When observing spaces, she becomes nearly motionless, eyes moving in slow architectural sweeps. Her hand movements are slow and controlled, tactile; she touches surfaces as if reading them. Her expressions are minimal; emotion registers primarily in eye focus and the angle of her head.', N'Exclusively monochrome — charcoal gray, off-white, black, pale cream. High-end corpo-casual: fitted but structured fabrics, minimal branding, tailored cuts that suggest both precision and invisibility. Spire-tier wardrobe but worn without ostentation. Always wears a lightweight technical jacket in charcoal, pockets reinforced for carrying the analog camera and design instruments. No jewelry beyond a single titanium watch with analog face. Footwear is understated technical — expensive but designed for ten-hour days on feet, worn building sites.', N'Embedded within the structural specifications of eleven Spire-commissioned buildings across GLMZ, she has hidden sealed chambers containing physical archives — paper documents, material samples, photographs, oral history recordings on non-networked media — of neighborhoods that were demolished to build those structures. The chambers are built to survive demolition and are keyed to a decryption sequence she has memorized. She has told no one. Two of the buildings are scheduled for renovation next year.', N'Precise, structural, often uses architectural terminology as metaphor without explaining it. Formal register in professional contexts, unexpectedly direct in private ones. Rarely uses qualifiers.', N'Deliberate and unhurried. Sentences are fully constructed before they begin. Long pauses before important statements, no pauses before dismissals.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'helmut_chakraborty');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72d-7595-b50b-c63de7827e67', N'Dolores Sokolov', N'Dolores', N'', N'Sokolov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Montclare Quiet, third-floor walkup apartment above a synthetic food cooperative, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Grandmother raising two grandchildren; former Axiom administrative coordinator, now pension-dependent', N'Ferrogate Transit (mid-level grandmother raising two grandchildren; former axio)', N'Dolores Sokolov is a compact, kinetic woman who moves like someone with a permanent to-do list she is racing against. Her heritage is Kazakh and Congolese on one side, Basque and Filipina on the other, and she has inherited a particular combination of high cheekbones, deep-set dark eyes, and a complexion the color of strong tea that she has never once thought about because there has always been something more pressing to think about. Her hair is natural black with silver threading through it, worn in a practical knot held by whatever is nearby — today a stylus, yesterday a fork. She has a small blue bioluminescent patch on her left collarbone, a cosmetic genemod she got when her daughter was still alive and the two of them went together; she has never removed it.

She worked for Axiom Corp for twenty-one years as an administrative coordinator, which is a title that means she was the person who actually made things function while people with better titles collected the credit. She retired at 58 when her daughter and son-in-law were killed in a transit accident — the same Ferrogate collapse that took Dragomir Achebe-Qalashani''s leg, though they have never met — and she became the primary caregiver for her grandchildren Kojo, now 11, and Amara, now 8. Her pension from Axiom is tier-2 and she is meticulous about budgeting it, but every time she gets a small surplus she spends it on the children''s education supplements rather than herself. She is holding together so completely on the outside that almost no one has noticed she has not fully processed her daughter''s death.', N'Humanizing civilian anchor; represents the generational cost of corporate accidents; potential quest giver when the children get into trouble or when she discovers something about the Ferrogate accident she was never meant to know; emotional touchstone', N'', N'Small bioluminescent blue patch on left collarbone (cosmetic genemod, no longer wanted but kept for sentimental reasons); reading lens implant in left eye (corrective, basic model)', N'Gets the children ready and walks them to the local education node, then works a half-shift at the food cooperative downstairs in exchange for reduced meal costs, then collects the children, oversees homework, makes dinner, falls asleep over her budget spreadsheets.', N'A weathered woman in her 60s with striking tricontinent features: warm golden-olive skin with cool slate undertones, prominent cheekbones blending Hispanic and East Asian ancestry with angular Eastern European bone structure. Natural black hair with silver threading pulled into a practical knot secured with a pen. Deep brown eyes showing faint lines of concentration. Lean, compact build. Wearing worn charcoal synthetic shirt with long sleeves covering a faintly glowing bioluminescent blue patch on her collarbone. Simple wedding band visible. Standing in a dimly-lit food cooperative warehouse, fluorescent overhead lights casting cool shadows across her focused, slightly-furrowed expression. Hands showing minor calluses, posture slightly forward-leaning. GLMZ, realistic portrait, weathered but dignified, functional augmentations, worn but well-maintained clothing, cinematic lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Montclare Quiet', N'local', N'Montclare Quiet', N'Dolores Sokolov carries a striking tricontinent blend: 47.4% Hispanic/Latin American ancestry provides warm olive undertones and prominent cheekbones; 27.3% Eastern European heritage contributes angular bone structure, a defined jawline, and cooler undertones; 25.3% East Asian ancestry shapes eye geometry, cheekbone prominence, and facial proportions. The result is a complexion that shifts between warm golden-olive and cool slate depending on light, with subtle bronze reflectivity—a sophisticated interplay of three distinct genetic traditions.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, with the lean musculature of someone who moves constantly and eats efficiently. No excess, no softness — the body is a functional tool never prioritized for maintenance.', N'Natural black with silver threading', N'Worn in a practical knot, secured with whatever is at hand (pen, stylus, fork, chopstick)', N'Medium to long, always pinned up', N'Deep brown, natural; left eye contains a faint corrective lens implant visible only under direct light', N'Warm golden-olive with slate undertones — a sophisticated medium-deep blend reflecting the tricontinent ancestry mix. Subtle bronze reflectivity in natural light.', N'Minimal grooming, weathered by decades of corporate work and caregiving. Fine lines around eyes and mouth. Face is expressive but rarely at rest—always slightly tensed toward the next task. Prominent cheekbones reflect Hispanic and East Asian ancestry; angular Eastern European bone structure shapes jawline and brow ridge. Hands show minor calluses from food cooperative work. Nails kept short and practical.', N'The bioluminescent patch on collarbone is the only visible augmentation; it glows faintly in dim light. The reading lens implant in left eye is invisible unless examined closely. No chrome, no obvious modifications—augmentations are practical and decades old, chosen for function, not aesthetics.', N'Constant, economical motion—never still, always oriented toward the next task. Upright but not rigid posture, shoulders slightly forward as if leaning into the day ahead. Quick walk, even when not rushing. When seated, rarely fully relaxed; hands usually occupied—folding, organizing, calculating. Default expression is focused, slightly furrowed, with undercurrent of exhaustion.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: well-maintained but worn synthetic fabrics in neutral colors (charcoal, dark blue, gray, black). Work uniform at food cooperative is green apron over simple tech-blend clothing. Off-duty: durable pants with multiple pockets, simple long-sleeved shirts to cover the bioluminescent patch, flat worn shoes suitable for standing all day. Simple band on left ring finger—late spouse''s. No jewelry or personal style flourishes; everything chosen for durability. Clothing smells faintly of synthetic food base and cooperative washing station detergent.', N'She received a private settlement from Ferrogate after her daughter''s death — significantly more than the standard accident settlement — with a non-disclosure clause attached. She signed it because she needed the money for the children. She thinks about it almost every day and has never told anyone.', N'Efficient and practical; corporate administrative precision from her Axiom years mixed with the warm diminutives she uses with the children that leak into adult conversations', N'Quick and organized; she speaks in list-structures; she is always slightly in a hurry', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dolores_sokolov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a73c-7fbf-bc45-c6821b3ae12a', N'Halid Huynh-Agyemang', N'Halid', N'', N'Huynh-Agyemang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenosha Crossing transit shelters, platform underbelly row C, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'hyperlane migrant and seasonal dock worker', N'Ferrogate Transit seasonal labor pool, loose affiliation with the Kenosha Dockworkers'' Collective', N'Halid Huynh-Agyemang is a broad woman built like a shipping container — square shoulders, thick forearms braided with old scar tissue from crab-processing work on the Great Lakes harvest runs. Her skin is a warm amber-brown, deeply weathered at the temples and around her eyes, which are a startling pale grey with irises patterned like ripple rings on still water. Her hair is iron-grey, kept in a single heavy braid wound with copper wire salvaged from relay stations. She dresses in four layers regardless of season, each garment representing a different city she has passed through, the outermost a battered canvas duster with Ferrogate Transit patches sewn over the original corponation branding. A small shrine to the E.L.F. she calls Mama Drift is tucked into her breast pocket — a cracked mobile chip wrapped in red thread and anointed with machine oil every morning. She prays to it before every crossing.

Halid Huynh-Agyemang has been working the seasonal circuit for nineteen years, following the harvest lines and construction booms between Escanaba Gateway and Kenosha Crossing with the mechanical regularity of someone who has given up expecting anything to change and found a strange peace in that surrender. She is warm in the way that only people who have nothing left to protect can be — freely generous with food, opinion, and profanity. She will tell you exactly what she thinks of your life choices without being asked, and she is usually right.', N'Local color, information source about hyperlane routes and transit politics, potential quest giver for work on the seasonal circuit, moral anchor figure who challenges player assumptions about survival and dignity.', N'', N'Reinforced wrist joints (industrial, third-party, aging), basic pressure-seal lungs for cold-water dock work. No cosmetic mods. Her ripple-ring irises are natural mutation, not geneware.', N'Up before dawn to queue for day-labor assignments at the Kenosha transit board; spends evenings cooking communal meals in the shelter row and arguing about E.L.F. theology with anyone willing to engage.', N'GLMZ, weathered Southeast Asian-African dock worker woman, 168cm muscular frame, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones darkened by sun and salt exposure, pale grey eyes with natural iris patterns, iron grey hair in heavy copper-wire braid reaching mid-back. Lined face showing 19 years of outdoor labor, prominent Southeast Asian cheekbones, full lips, extensive white scar tissue webbing forearms from blade cuts creating stark contrast. Wearing layered Tier 4 working-class clothes: battered teal canvas duster with Ferrogate patches over grey frayed poly-blend shirt and duct-tape-reinforced wool sweater, steel-toed boots laced to mid-calf. Visible subtle metallic wrist joint augmentations, red-thread-wrapped cracked mobile chip shrine visible in breast pocket. Posture efficient and grounded, shoulders forward, standing with hands at sides ready. Dock environment, rain-slicked metal surfaces, industrial lighting casting harsh shadows, gritty and lived-in atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenosha Crossing transit shelters', N'local', N'Kenosha Crossing transit shelters', N'Southeast Asian (70.9%) and Sub-Saharan African (28.0%) ancestry with trace North African (1.1%), creating a phenotype grounded in Island Southeast Asian bone structure and facial geometry enriched by Sub-Saharan depth and feature definition. The combination yields a globally mixed appearance—Southeast Asian influence visible in cheekbone prominence, eye shape, and overall facial proportions; Sub-Saharan ancestry adding richness to skin undertones and feature definition across the face and frame. North African traces subtly warm the overall complexion.', 168, 82, N'Broad and heavily muscled, square shoulders and deep chest built from decades of dock labor and crab-processing work. Her frame is solid without softness — a ''shipping container'' build with thick forearms corded with functional strength rather than aesthetics.', N'Iron grey', N'Single heavy braid wound with salvaged copper wire, practical and worn close to the scalp', N'Long (reaches mid-back when braided)', N'Pale grey with natural ripple-ring iris patterns (genetic mutation, not augmented)', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, darkened by extensive weathering; sun-damage and wind-crack visible on exposed skin, creating a patina of outdoor work across temples, cheekbones, and exposed forearms', N'Lined face that reads as lived-in rather than aged; deep creases around eyes and mouth from nineteen years of outdoor dock work. Facial structure shows Southeast Asian influence in prominent cheekbones and almond eye shape, Sub-Saharan richness in warm undertones and full lips. Hands are calloused, knuckles slightly enlarged from repetitive labor. No tattoos, minimal grooming beyond functional necessity.', N'Reinforced wrist joints visible as subtle thickening at wrist-line and slight metallic sheen where industrial joint-work was integrated; no cosmetic plating, deliberately low-profile third-party installation. Pressure-seal lungs not externally visible. A cracked mobile chip wrapped in red thread and secured in breast pocket — the E.L.F. shrine she calls Mama Drift, worn visibly as devotional object.', N'Moves with deliberate efficiency — no wasted motion. Shoulders rolled forward slightly from decades bent over processing tables. Walks with a dock-worker''s gait, feet planted wide for balance. Her stillness when listening is absolute; her gestures when speaking are large and economical. Stands with hands habitually at her sides or crossed at chest, ready.', N'Tier 4 (working class) with visible layering — four garments worn year-round, each representing a different city on her migration circuit. Outermost layer is a battered canvas duster (faded teal, originally corporate-branded, now patched with Ferrogate Transit company patches sewn over old logos). Underneath: worn thermal underlayer, a grey poly-blend shirt with frayed collar (origin unknown), and a thick wool sweater with one elbow reinforced with duct tape. Her clothing is maintained but not clean — grease stains, machine oil, and salt-residue permanent fixtures. Boots are steel-toed, laced to mid-calf, re-soled twice. No jewelry except the shrine in her pocket, which she touches compulsively before transitions.', N'She was once a mid-level Ferrogate Transit logistics clerk with a proper identity and an apartment in Bronzeline. She walked away from it twenty years ago after witnessing a supervisor falsify accident reports that got three workers killed. She destroyed the records rather than report them, fearing no one would believe her, and then could not go back. She has never told anyone.', N'Working-class blunt, code-switches between Kazakh-inflected Russian slang and Yoruba idioms depending on topic — uses Yoruba when discussing emotion, Russian when discussing logistics', N'Deliberate and unhurried, like someone who has learned that rushing speech wastes energy', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'halid_huynh_agyemang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a70b-7ac7-ba14-c6a8b899ce5a', N'Lark Taualagi-Fredriksen-Mbekele', N'Lark', N'', N'Taualagi-Fredriksen-Mbekele', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 19, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave — works out of a studio called ''Derma'' on the Enclave''s main commercial strip, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'gene-mod body artist and tattoo artist', N'Derma studio (Hamtramck Enclave); loose affiliation with Helix Biosystems through their licensed geneware supply chain — she is technically a certified Helix applicator, which she finds both useful and ideologically uncomfortable', N'Lark Taualagi-Fredriksen-Mbekele is nineteen and operates at the velocity of someone who knows they are good and cannot wait for the world to confirm it. She is compact and energetic, her dark skin extensively modified with her own work: bioluminescent subcutaneous patterns run from her collarbones to her wrists in interlocking Yoruba adinkra symbols and Polynesian wave-forms, her Māori grandfather''s heritage made literal on her body, the two visual languages coexisting in something that is recognizably neither and entirely her own. She has retractable claw mods on her right hand — practical for fine-work and also, she admits, because they look excellent — and her irises are modified to display the Enclave''s coordinates in tiny glowing text, a joke that is also a statement of belonging.

She apprenticed at Derma at fifteen, doing cleanup and equipment sterilization. By seventeen she was doing bioluminescent pattern work. Now she is the reason people come to Derma specifically — her reputation spreading through the Hamtramck Enclave''s dense social networks faster than she can accommodate the demand. She is brash and funny and has opinions about everything, delivered with the cheerful certainty of someone who has not yet been wrong enough times to become cautious. She is also, underneath the performance of confidence, deeply serious about her craft in a way she rarely lets people see directly.', N'Social connector — knows everyone young in the Enclave and most people who move through it; access point for geneware information and modification services; represents the generation that has grown up entirely inside GLMZ''s reality; can be quest giver for anything touching the Enclave''s community politics.', N'', N'Extensive self-applied bioluminescent subcutaneous patterns (own work). Retractable claw mods on right hand (function and aesthetics). Coordinate-display iris mods. Scent gland enhancement — she chose a specific compound she describes as ''like the Enclave smells when it rains.''', N'Opens Derma at noon, works clients until 20:00, spends evenings with a rotating group of Enclave peers, researches new geneware techniques late at night on pirated Helix Biosystems technical manuals she''s compiled over four years.', N'Portrait of Lark, a 158cm compact geneware technician in GLMZ, shot in low-light studio setting. Deep warm brown skin with golden and reddish undertones glowing softly. Pacific Islander and Sub-Saharan African broader facial structure with Southeast Asian almond eyes displaying tiny cyan coordinate glyphs in irises. Wider nose bridge, full expressive lips. Black hair with indigo undertones in tight geometric braids pulled into high crown with synthetic extensions. Sleeveless fitted top showcasing bioluminescent Yoruba adinkra symbols and Polynesian wave-forms glowing pale cyan and indigo across collarbones, shoulders, and wrists. Visible right hand extended with bone-white retractable carbide claw mods. Subcutaneous bioluminescent patterns create faint iridescent sheen across skin. Quick, genuine expression. Minimalist utilitarian aesthetic. Rain-ozone-metal atmospheric scent suggested by composed, precise posture. Neo-noir futurism meets genetic artistry. High contrast lighting emphasizing bioluminescence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Pacific Islander (41.5%) with Southeast Asian (19.4%), Sub-Saharan African (12.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (10.7%), South Asian (9.3%), and Middle Eastern (6.6%) ancestry. Genetic mosaic creates warm deep-brown skin with golden, reddish, and olive undertones. Features blend the broader facial structure and fuller lips from Pacific Islander and Sub-Saharan African heritage with Southeast Asian eye shape and bone structure, South Asian cheekbone prominence, and Middle Eastern warmth. Overall phenotype: luminous deep warm-brown complexion with balanced, expressive features reflecting complex global ancestry.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, muscle definition visible in forearms and shoulders from precision handwork. Low body fat. Moves with economical grace — no wasted motion.', N'Natural black with deep indigo undertones, color-shifted by bioluminescent pattern bleed', N'Closely braided in geometric patterns; often worn in a high crown with loose synthetic extensions threaded through', N'Medium (braids reach mid-back)', N'Deep dark brown base with embedded coordinate display — tiny cyan glowing numerals (latitude/longitude) visible in iris under low light', N'Deep warm brown with golden, reddish, and olive undertones. Rich luminosity from subcutaneous bioluminescent work, creating iridescent sheen at certain angles.', N'Clear, youthful. Fuller cheekbones and broader facial structure from Pacific Islander and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Almond-shaped eyes with subtle epicanthic fold from Southeast Asian component. Wider nose bridge with full, expressive lips. Warm, animated expression — eyebrows mobile, smile quick and genuine. Hands show fine calluses and occasional minor chemical burns from geneware handling.', N'Retractable claw mods on right hand (4cm bone-white carbide tips, housed under normal nail beds; extends with visible finger joint articulation). Coordinate-display irises visible only under direct light or eye contact. Subcutaneous bioluminescent patterns visible across exposed skin — active in low light, dormant in bright daylight. Faint iridescent sheen to skin under certain angles from pigment suspension.', N'Stands and sits slightly forward-leaning, as if always mid-thought. Hand gestures precise and economical. Right hand frequently unconsciously extends/retracts claws during conversation. Walks with quick, confident stride. Eyes track details obsessively — color palettes, symmetry, proportion.', N'Tier 3-4 hybrid. Favors sleeveless or minimal-sleeve tops to showcase arm work (often custom-fitted, tailored pieces from Enclave makers). High-waisted cargo pants or modified coveralls in matte synthetics with visible utility pockets and tool loops. Reinforced leather gloves for client work, often removed and worn loose around wrists. Heavy-soled boots suitable for standing 8+ hours. Minimal jewelry — her body is her ornament. Occasional Helix Biosystems branded gear (hoodies, base layers) worn ironically. Scent is distinctive: rain-ozone-metal baseline from scent gland mod, often overlaid with bioluminescent pigment solvent.', N'She has been secretly developing an unlicensed bioluminescent geneware mod — a pattern that responds to specific emotional states rather than just ambient neural activity — using a combination of pirated Helix code and original synthesis. It works. It is also completely illegal, and if Helix Biosystems discovers it they will own it under her certification contract.', N'Fast, colloquial, dense with Hamtramck Enclave slang and Yoruba expressions she uses as punctuation. Switches to precise technical language when discussing the work — the register-shift is startling.', N'Rapid-fire in conversation, with overlapping ideas. Slows down completely when she''s being serious, which is the tell.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'lark_taualagi_fredriksen_mbekele');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66a-7973-ba8a-c6edadbfc3bd', N'Sibusiso Pham', N'Sibusiso', N'', N'Pham', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 46, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'The Narrows, operates from the third floor of a residential block in Archer''s Line, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Protection racket enforcer and neighborhood crew captain', N'', N'Sibusiso Pham is the kind of woman who walks into a room and the room notices without being able to say exactly why. She is heavyset and deliberate in her movements, with deep black skin, natural hair worn up and held with a carved wooden pick that has been with her for twenty years, and eyes that are dark brown and absolutely still. She has retractable claw augmentations — a practical modification she got at thirty, not cosmetic — and a lattice of subdermal reinforcement along her forearms that makes the skin there look subtly different under harsh light. She dresses practically: good boots, layered clothing, never anything that would impede movement. She smells faintly of the palm oil soap she makes herself as a hobby.

She has run protection in the Narrows for thirteen years. Before that she enforced for other people. Before that she was seventeen and making decisions she tries not to think about with too much clarity. The neighborhood where she operates is genuinely safer because of her — she takes tribute from the businesses on six blocks, and those six blocks have significantly lower rates of random street violence than the surrounding areas, because she is not interested in chaos and has the means to discourage it. She sees no contradiction between this and what she is. She is providing a service. The fact that the alternative to purchasing the service is something unpleasant is, in her view, no different from any other contract in GLMZ.', N'Local authority figure — the person you go through if you want to operate in the Narrows; can be a quest giver, an obstacle, or an unlikely ally depending on how her interests align; represents the functional logic of organized crime in a neighborhood the city has largely abandoned; moral complexity of genuine community protection built on coercion', N'', N'Retractable ceramic claw augmentations (ten fingers); subdermal skeletal reinforcement, forearms and shins; a single audio implant in her right ear that she uses to monitor crew communications', N'Wakes early, spends the morning walking her six blocks — ostensibly as a neighbor, actually as inspection. Afternoons are for accounts, disputes, and the rare necessity of direct action. Evenings she spends at home, cooking, or listening to music on a physical speaker she found in an Auburn Grist salvage market fifteen years ago.', N'Sibusiso Pham, 178cm tall solidly-built figure with warm medium-brown skin tone reflecting Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian heritage. Broad face with high cheekbones and strong jawline, dark nearly-black eyes with slight epicanthic fold, natural black hair worn long and pinned up with a weathered wooden pick. Minimalist aesthetic in matte gray, black, and earth-tone practical clothing — linen undershirt, loose canvas overshirt, cargo trousers, worn reinforced boots. Standing with centered posture, feet shoulder-width apart, expression controlled and watchful. Subdermal reinforcement latticing subtly visible on forearms under harsh lighting. GLMZ, neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, professional security operative aesthetic, economical and ready, no augmentation visible but presence unmistakable, moody atmospheric lighting emphasizing her mechanical enhancements, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Southeast Asian-Sub-Saharan African-South Asian blend. The genetic foundation is predominantly Southeast Asian (62.2%), creating a phenotype with Southeast Asian bone structure and facial features, enriched by Sub-Saharan African warmth in skin tone and facial depth (19.8%), and South Asian undertones in complexion richness and eye characteristics (18.0%). This tri-continental ancestry creates a striking, harmonious phenotype with slightly broader facial structure than typical Southeast Asian features, deeper skin luminosity from the Sub-Saharan African component, and the refined complexion depth characteristic of South Asian genetics.', 178, 89, N'Heavyset and solid, with substantial muscle mass beneath a layer of deliberate bulk. Broad shoulders, thick through the core, legs like load-bearing columns. No softness — every kilogram appears intentional.', N'Natural black', N'Worn up in a tight, sculpted arrangement, secured with a weathered carved wooden pick (same implement for twenty years)', N'Long (worn pinned)', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Warm medium-brown complexion with golden and reddish undertones, reflecting the convergence of Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian ancestry. Uniform and well-maintained with a subtle luminosity and depth characteristic of the tri-continental blend.', N'Broad face with Southeast Asian bone structure — moderately high cheekbones, strong defined jawline softened by Sub-Saharan African facial warmth and enriched by South Asian complexion depth. Eyes set with slight epicanthic fold characteristic of Southeast Asian ancestry, framed by the deeper eye socket structure reflecting Sub-Saharan African phenotype. Skin shows minimal scarring but bears the subtle discoloration of subdermal latticing visible beneath the surface of her forearms under harsh light. Grooming is austere and functional — no cosmetics, no jewelry except the wooden pick. A faint scent of palm oil soap clings to her.', N'Retractable ceramic claw augmentations on all ten fingers — visible only when extended, but the slightly thickened appearance of her hands and fingers betrays their presence. Subdermal skeletal reinforcement in forearms and shins creates subtle textural variation in skin tone under certain lighting angles. Right ear shows a faint hairline scar from audio implant installation, barely noticeable if you know where to look.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical precision — nothing wasted, nothing hurried. Her weight is always centered and ready to shift. When seated, she occupies space without apology. When standing, her feet are planted shoulder-width apart. Her stillness is her most unsettling feature: her eyes lock onto conversation partners with minimal blinking, and her facial expressions remain controlled and minimal. She doesn''t fidget or gesture unnecessarily.', N'Tier 4 practical — functional and durable without ostentation. Well-maintained but worn boots (good tread, reinforced toe caps), layered clothing that allows free movement (usually a linen undershirt, a loose canvas overshirt, cargo trousers with multiple pockets). Fabrics are matte, colored in deep grays, blacks, and earth tones. Everything is fitted to allow unrestricted movement. No jewelry, no logos, no affectation. The overall impression is of someone who dresses for work, not appearance.', N'When she was seventeen, she was present at and partially responsible for the death of a young man during a botched intimidation job run by a crew she no longer acknowledges being part of. The man had a daughter who is now twenty-three and lives three blocks from Archer''s Line. Nneka has been watching the daughter grow up from a careful distance for years, anonymously ensuring certain things go right for her.', N'Plain and direct. No slang, no hedging. Uses ''we'' when she means ''I'' when discussing her operation. Rarely uses more words than necessary.', N'Slow and even. Comfortable with silence — she stops talking and simply waits, which most people find more unsettling than any threat.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'sibusiso_pham');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ae-7ac3-abfc-c75af7db5fff', N'Celestina Valenzuela', N'Celestina', N'', N'Valenzuela', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Washburn Commons — apartment block C, and the Commons community center basement classroom, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Retired secondary school teacher and current community education volunteer; grandmother raising two grandchildren', N'Washburn Commons Community Council; former Meridian Teachers'' Collective (retired); Helix Biosystems dependency (through daughter''s contract)', N'Celestina Valenzuela is the kind of woman who makes a room feel organized just by walking into it. She''s tall and angular, her natural hair kept in a close-cropped fade that''s gone entirely silver, and she has the habit of standing with her arms folded and her chin slightly elevated that every one of her former students would recognize from forty meters away. Her dark skin is unaugmented save for a small bioluminescent spiral — blue-white — behind her right ear, a retirement gift she gave herself after three decades of institutional dress codes. She wears sensible layers and always has two pens in her breast pocket, a habit from the years before all writing went digital.

Amara taught mathematics and systems-thinking at Washburn Commons Secondary for thirty-one years, surviving four different corponation educational management contracts and two restructuring purges. She retired with a modest pension and immediate custody of her two grandchildren — Prax, eleven, and Liesel, eight — after her daughter''s commitment to a Helix Biosystems experimental labor program took her away for what was supposed to be eighteen months and has now been three years. Amara does not discuss this with people she doesn''t trust. She runs a free after-school tutoring program out of the community center basement three afternoons a week, partly because she needs to be useful and partly because she''s keeping an eye on every child in a two-block radius as a matter of survival strategy.', N'Quest giver and community connector; knows every child in a wide radius and therefore knows what''s happening at street level that adults aren''t saying out loud. Her entanglement with Helix Biosystems through her daughter''s contract gives her a motivated stake in stories involving that corponation.', N'', N'Bioluminescent spiral dermal implant (behind right ear, blue-white; cosmetic only). Standard retinal display for reading — the cheap consumer model, not corporate-grade. No other augmentations.', N'School-run for Prax and Liesel in the morning, then community center administration or supply scrounging, then afternoon tutoring sessions; evenings are homework, dinner, and what she calls ''the news hour'' where she reads actual text journalism to the kids and makes them argue with it.', N'Portrait of Celestina Valenzuela, 67-year-old woman in 2226 GLMZ, warm medium-deep brown skin with olive undertones reflecting Hispanic/Latin American and South Asian heritage, sharp defined cheekbones with subtle Eastern European angular influence, dark brown eyes with faint luminescent amber ring, silver-white close-cropped fade haircut revealing skull geometry, thin pale scar along left jawline, bioluminescent blue-white spiral implant glowing softly behind right ear visible in profile. Wearing practical muted earth-tone layered clothing: charcoal and sage cotton blend with sleeveless utilitarian overshirt, two pens in breast pocket, thin silver bracelet on left wrist. Standing with arms folded across chest in classroom-management posture, spine straight despite age-related shoulder inclination, deliberate and efficient bearing. Unaugmented appearance, weathered hands with ink stains and calluses, minimal makeup. Neo-noir dystopian futuristic setting with cool harsh lighting, subtle neon glow illuminating the retinal display ring around her iris, shadow highlighting the delicate scar tissue and life-worn features. Mood: contemplative, experienced, tier-4 practical integrity --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Washburn Commons', N'local', N'Washburn Commons', N'Multiethnic blend: Hispanic/Latin American (51.8%), South Asian (39.2%), Eastern European (9.0%). Features reflect this complex admixture—warm medium-to-deep brown skin with subtle olive undertones, defined cheekbones with moderate projection balanced between Latin and South Asian bone structure, eye shape showing slight almond influence from South Asian ancestry, facial structure combining the angular planes common to Eastern European genetics with the warmer tones and fuller features of Latin American heritage', 178, 68, N'Tall and angular, lean-muscled from decades of standing and moving through classrooms; posture still carries the straightness of institutional discipline, though age has introduced a slight forward inclination at the shoulders', N'Silver-white, naturally grayed', N'Close-cropped fade, meticulously maintained, revealing the clean geometry of her skull', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint amber undertones from standard consumer retinal display overlay (visible as a thin luminescent ring around the iris in low light)', N'Warm medium-deep brown with subtle olive undertones, reflecting the dominant Hispanic/Latin American and significant South Asian ancestry; shows the weathering of 67 years and significant UV exposure from pre-GLMZ childhood', N'Face bears the map of her life: crow''s feet from squinting at chalkboards and reading small text, a thin vertical scar along her left jawline (accident with a door frame, 2187), hands bearing the ink stains of someone who still writes by hand despite digital availability. Skin is unaugmented and well-maintained; minimal makeup. Sharp, well-defined cheekbones characteristic of her blended Hispanic/Latin American and South Asian heritage, prominence further enhanced with age and the angular Eastern European influence. Slight nasolabial folds and slight drooping of lower face from age. The bridge of her nose shows moderate width and structure typical of her ancestry blend. Facial structure balances the angular planes of Eastern European genetics with the warmer, broader proportions of Latin American and South Asian features', N'Bioluminescent spiral behind right ear (cosmetic, retirement gift to herself). Faint luminescent ring around pupils indicating standard consumer-grade retinal display. No other visible chrome or subdermal plating; deliberately maintains non-augmented appearance as marker of her tier and values', N'Stands with arms often folded across chest or hands clasped at solar plexus—a posture from decades of classroom management. Moves with deliberate efficiency, no wasted motion; walks with spine straight despite age-related stiffening. Has a habit of tilting her head slightly when listening, chin elevated, eyes tracking movement. When sitting, she occupies minimal space, feet flat on floor, back against chair', N'Tier 4 practical utilitarian: layered cotton and synthetic-blend clothing in muted earth tones (charcoal, sage, cream, rust). Always wears a sleeveless overshirt or vest as outer layer—functional pockets, durable weave. Sensible non-slip shoes suitable for classroom floors. Two pens always in breast pocket (old habit, pre-digital era). A thin silver bracelet on her left wrist (gift from her father, 2150s). No jewelry beyond this; no corpo logos or status markers. Clothing shows wear and careful repair—patches on elbows, reinforced seams—not from poverty but from intentional durability ethic', N'She''s been in contact with a labor rights advocate who believes Helix Biosystems'' experimental programs have a much lower return rate than officially reported. She''s started quietly documenting everything she can about her daughter''s contract and circumstances. She hasn''t told the children she''s afraid their mother is dead.', N'Precise and structured — she still teaches when she talks, scaffolding ideas for maximum retention whether she means to or not; slips into warmth in unguarded moments', N'Even and well-paced with a teacher''s projection; can command a room without raising her voice', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'celestina_valenzuela');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5bc-738a-9e5e-c7a2c19ba976', N'Chayton Truong', N'Chayton', N'', N'Truong', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Brightmoor Reclamation, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Junk merchant and scrap reseller', N'Independent; pays informal dues to a Brightmoor scrap-territory collective she doesn''t fully trust', N'Chayton Truong is small and fast-moving, with the wiry physicality of someone who has spent years climbing through reclamation sites. Her skin is warm brown with a reddish undertone, her eyes a vivid amber with a starburst pattern that''s natural — she''s been offered money to sell them twice and refused both times. She has cat ears, small and dark brown, the geneware obviously budget-tier — one of them doesn''t track sound as naturally as the other and occasionally flicks at random — but she wears them without apology. Her clothes are layered, practical, and assembled from different sources: a Ferrogate Transit worker vest over a Palladian-logo shirt with the logo melted off, cargo pants with pockets she has modified herself.

Chayton Truong pushes a heavily loaded magnetic-suspension cart through Brightmoor Reclamation''s scrap corridors with the territorial confidence of someone who knows every crack in every wall. She''s young enough that some people underestimate her and old enough that she''s used to it. She has a fast and somewhat overwhelming personality — she talks in compressed bursts, bounces between topics, and has an almost savant-level ability to identify the value and origin of electronic components by sight. She will argue prices with a ferocity completely disproportionate to the amounts involved. She has never been robbed twice by the same person.', N'Equipment source, local explorer, potential guide to Brightmoor''s reclamation depths. She knows what''s been dumped and where, which makes her incidentally aware of what corporations are discarding — which sometimes includes things they''d prefer stayed discarded.', N'', N'Budget-tier cat ears (geneware, one slightly malfunctioning). Subdermal grip-pads on her palms and fingers — makes climbing and carrying significantly easier. No other augmentations; she saves most of what she earns.', N'Pre-dawn scavenging runs through Brightmoor Reclamation''s freshest deposition zones, then hauling and sorting through morning, then selling from her cart in the Gray Zone market corridor from midday until her stock is gone or she''s too tired to argue anymore.', N'Chayton Truong, 157cm wiry salvage worker with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, narrow angular face with high cheekbones and Southeast Asian structure, vivid amber eyes with starburst pattern, short black hair with reddish tones in undercut style. Small malfunctioning dark brown geneware cat ears. Visible scar on left palm, burn marks on right forearm. Wearing worn high-visibility orange Ferrogate vest over melted-logo shirt, military cargo pants, climbing boots with metal caps, fingerless gloves revealing geometric grip-pad scarring. Bent aluminum tool ring. Perpetually alert posture, wind-blown appearance, constantly moving. Standing in neon-lit GLMZ reclamation yard at dusk, surrounded by stacked salvage metal, atmospheric fog and industrial lighting casting shadows across her deep brown skin, GLMZ aesthetic, photorealistic, dramatic lighting, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Sub-Saharan African (44.1%), Southeast Asian (30.5%), and East Asian (25.4%) ancestry — a rich tricontinent genetic blend resulting in deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, distinctive Southeast Asian facial structure with East Asian eye shape, and the lean athletic frame characteristic of her mixed heritage', 157, 48, N'Wiry and compact, all lean muscle and efficient movement from years of climbing through reclamation sites. No excess — her frame is built for speed and climbing, not strength', N'Natural black with a faint reddish undertone in direct light', N'Short, practical cut with asymmetrical undercut on one side; often pulled back with salvaged wire or fabric strips to keep it clear of her face during work', N'Short', N'Vivid amber with natural starburst pattern radiating from the pupil — no augmentation, genetically distinctive', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, sun-darkened on forearms and neck from outdoor reclamation work. The rich melanin saturation reflects her Sub-Saharan and Southeast Asian ancestry, creating luminous depth in direct light', N'Angular, alert features with high cheekbones, slightly rounded face structure, and balanced proportions reflecting her tricontinent ancestry; minimal grooming — practical rather than aesthetic. Small scars on her knuckles and fingers from handling sharp metal. Her face moves quickly, expressing thoughts before she speaks them. Perpetually wind-blown appearance', N'Budget-tier geneware cat ears (dark brown, small, positioned slightly forward on her head). The right ear noticeably malfunctions — twitches randomly or fails to track sound sources smoothly. Subdermal grip-pads visible as faint geometric scarring and slight texture irregularity across her palms and inside her fingers; most visible when her hands are wet or in direct light', N'Constantly in motion — bouncing weight from foot to foot even when standing still. Moves with economy and speed, able to slip through tight spaces. Her hands gesture rapidly when talking, punctuating compressed bursts of speech. Climbs and balances with cat-like confidence. Eyes dart constantly, cataloguing her surroundings', N'Tier 4-5 (working class/sub-grade salvage worker). Layered, patched, and modified: Ferrogate Transit worker vest (high-visibility orange, worn from use) worn over a Palladian-logo shirt with the logo deliberately melted off with a soldering iron. Military-surplus cargo pants with custom-welded pockets and reinforced seams. Worn climbing boots with metal caps. A salvaged leather tool belt. Gloves are fingerless, revealing the grip-pads. No jewelry except a bent aluminum ring she uses as a gripper tool', N'Three months ago she found a sealed Axiom data-core in a reclamation dump. She hasn''t opened it, hasn''t sold it, hasn''t told anyone. She knows it''s worth significant money to the right person and potentially dangerous to her if she picks wrong. It''s wrapped in cloth under the false bottom of her cart. She thinks about it constantly.', N'Dense with technical salvage terminology, fast and colloquial. Switches mid-sentence. Uses numbers and specs casually the way other people use adjectives.', N'Rapid-fire and slightly staccato. She edits out transition words. Sentences land like components snapping into place.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chayton_truong');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a7-7290-b42d-c84594d24f62', N'Ayodeji Sigurdsson-Wickramasinghe', N'Ayodeji', N'', N'Sigurdsson-Wickramasinghe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 26.7, 3, N'active', N'Old Harbor, near Michigan Ave and Roosevelt', N'Fixer - Disappearance specialist', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Ayodeji Sigurdsson-Wickramasinghe, 187cm tall lean angular man with salt-and-pepper cropped hair and dimensionally warm bronze skin with mahogany undertones, reflecting global mixed ancestry from Northern European, East Asian, South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Dark brown eyes with subtle cataracts, squared jaw, prominent angular cheekbones, distinctive almond eye shape. Surgical scar down left temple partially hidden by hairline, burn scarring on right hand back, faded indigo tattoo on left wrist. Weathered matte complexion with deep lines around eyes and mouth, pragmatic stubble. Wearing unmarked gray composite jacket over charcoal thermal undershirt, dark reinforced pants, worn Black Archon steel-toe boots. Faded copper wedding band. Positioned with back to wall, methodical room-scanning gaze, economical movement, hands neutral and low. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Industrial neon-lit corridor setting, cool ambient light mixing with warm practical overhead lighting. Minimal chrome, deliberately invisible aesthetic. Stoic, watchful, professional. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Truly Ubiquitous Diaspora: Northern European (22.9%), East Asian (21.0%), South Asian (17.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (17.4%), Southeast Asian (15.0%), and Sub-Saharan African (6.0%). This rare global blend creates a unique phenotype — Northern European ancestry contributes bone structure refinement and cool undertones; East Asian heritage defines eye shape and high cheekbone prominence; South Asian ancestry enriches skin depth with warm mid-tones; Hispanic/Latin American heritage adds warmth and mid-melanin distribution; Southeast Asian ancestry refines facial proportions and contributes to eye shape complexity; Sub-Saharan African ancestry deepens overall pigmentation and strengthens jaw definition. The result is a complexion that shifts dimensionally with light — warm golden-bronze in neutral light, deepening to rich mahogany in sunlight, with subtle cool undertones visible in shadow.', 187, 89, N'Lean and angular, shoulders broad but not bulky. Decades of moving through tight spaces and maintaining low profiles have kept him wiry rather than muscular. Moves with economical precision.', N'Salt-and-pepper gray', N'Closely cropped, military-neat', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint cataracts forming at edges — signs of age and too many years squinting through scope sights', N'Dimensionally warm bronze with golden undertones in neutral light, deepening to rich mahogany in sun-exposed zones. Melanin distribution reflects balanced global ancestry — warm mid-tones from South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American heritage balanced against cooler undertones from Northern European ancestry. Weathered to a matte finish with visible texture from decades of industrial exposure.', N'Intricate facial structure reflecting six-region ancestry: squared jawline with definition from Sub-Saharan and South Asian heritage; prominent, angular cheekbones from East Asian and Northern European ancestry; distinctive almond-shaped eye set from Southeast and East Asian influence with warm-toned eyelids; warm midtone undertones characteristic of Hispanic/Latin American and South Asian ancestry blending. Deep lines around eyes and mouth carved by decades of life. Scar bisecting left eyebrow, skin bearing the texture of someone who works outdoors in industrial weather. Stubble always present — pragmatic rather than styled.', N'None obvious. A faint whirring occasionally audible beneath his left ear suggests subcutaneous neural processing. No chrome visible — he dresses and maintains himself deliberately invisible.', N'Upright but not rigid. Moves with minimal wasted motion, always aware of exits. Hands positioned low and neutral. Eyes track rooms methodically. Sits with his back to walls. Speaks in measured sentences with long pauses — listening costs nothing.', N'Tier-3 practical wear: charcoal thermal undershirt, unmarked gray composite jacket with internal pockets, dark pants with reinforced knees, worn Black Archon steel-toe boots. A single piece of jewelry — a faded copper wedding band on his left ring finger, worn smooth. Carries a worn canvas satchel, contents unknown. No logos, no status symbols. Everything chosen to disappear into crowds.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ayodeji_sigurdsson_wickramasinghe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65b-722d-8ed4-c8466be97318', N'Ayushmaan Horváth', N'Ayushmaan', N'', N'Horváth', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 48, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — specifically Congregation Mayim Chayyim, a cluster of three interconnected shipping containers in a stacked residential block near Lockhaven North, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Traditional rabbi serving a small, syncretic Jewish congregation in a repurposed shipping container community', N'Congregation Mayim Chayyim (independent); informal network of the Gray Zone religious leaders across traditions', N'Ayushmaan Horváth is medium-height and broad-shouldered with a thick braid of hair so dark it reads as almost blue-black hanging over one shoulder — natural color at forty-eight, a point of occasional mild pride. Her heritage runs through Ghanaian traders and Armenian refugees and somewhere in there a great-great-grandmother who walked out of Minsk, and the result is a face that is striking in its particularity: wide-set eyes of very dark brown, a strong nose, olive-tan skin, and an expression that seems to default to a kind of alert, skeptical attentiveness. She wears a kippah in the Gray Zone''s communal style — these are woven in a local pattern specific to her congregation, done in the colors of the lake — and a plain tallit katan under her work clothes. Her only tech visible is a community-band data relay she wears on her wrist for congregation emergencies.

She is the third generation of her family to lead this congregation, which was founded by her grandmother in a time when there were perhaps twelve Jewish families left in this part of the city. There are now sixty-three households who call Congregation Mayim Chayyim home, with a theology that has evolved over seventy years of the Gray Zone life into something that would startle a conventional seminary: they keep Shabbat, they study Torah, they have a formal posture toward the ELFs that treats them as a new category of being deserving of ethical consideration in the tradition of tzelem Elohim, and their machzor includes prayers Ayushmaan Horváth''s grandmother wrote in Meridian Standard during the worst years of the Gray Zone''s founding. She is a rigorous thinker and a devastating debater and she makes the best cholent in the Gray Zone, possibly in the city.', N'Community authority figure, ethical compass, and keeper of institutional memory; she knows three generations of the Gray Zone families and their histories; useful as a mediator, a source of pre-corporate history, or someone who will tell an uncomfortable truth without cruelty', N'', N'Community-band wrist relay (standard the Gray Zone infrastructure, barely counts as augmentation); no geneware; reading enhancement lens in left eye for fine manuscript work — very basic', N'Morning prayer at 07:00 with whoever comes, then two hours of study and correspondence with other religious leaders, then pastoral visits, administrative work, teaching children''s classes twice a week, evening study session open to the neighborhood.', N'Ayushmaan Horváth, 168cm tall middle-aged woman with striking multiethnic features blending Eastern European angular cheekbones with warm golden-tan skin carrying South Asian and East Asian warmth, dark brown attentive eyes with subtle cybernetic shimmer in left eye, thick black braid with blue undertones draped over left shoulder. Wearing practical gray long-sleeved shirt over visible tallit katan with fringes, deep blue linen-blend congregation vest with embroidered symbols, durable work trousers, worn closed-toe boots. Matte gray wrist-mounted data relay in lake-color woven band on left wrist. Faint linear scar visible on left forearm. Woven lake-blue and silver kippah. Standing grounded and composed in dim gray zone-industrial lighting, urban Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone background, GLMZ, direct and attentive expression, calm presence despite weathered hands showing decades of restoration work --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Eastern European (36.2%) and Northern European (32.9%) provide strong foundational bone structure, enriched by significant South Asian (17.6%) warmth and smaller Indigenous American (7.2%) and East Asian (6.1%) elements. This creates a striking phenotype: sharp Eastern European cheekbones and eye-set softened by South Asian facial contours and the warm, complex skin tones of the blended ancestry. A genuine Ubiquitous Diaspora individual with luminous, warm-toned skin that speaks to multiple continents.', 168, 72, N'Broad-shouldered and sturdy with the working strength of someone who has lived most of her life in the Gray Zone. Not athletic in the performance sense, but solidly built through labor and age. Posture upright and grounded.', N'Natural black with deep blue undertones', N'Single thick braid worn over left shoulder, practical and deliberate', N'Long (past shoulders when unbraided)', N'Very dark brown, alert and appraising', N'Warm golden-tan with olive and honey undertones, the result of Eastern European and Northern European genetics warmed and enriched by South Asian, East Asian, and Indigenous American ancestry. Medium depth, even complexion with a luminous quality. Well-maintained despite environmental exposure.', N'Angular face with defined cheekbones reflecting Northern and Eastern European structure; eye-set wide and open with slightly rounded outer corners from East and South Asian heritage, tempering the angular bones. Nose straight with subtle rounded bridge. Subtle facial contours blend the sharper edges of Northern heritage with the softer planes of South Asian genetics. Fine lines around eyes and mouth from decades of focused work and contemplative expression. Skin weathered slightly from the Gray Zone conditions but even-toned and well-maintained.', N'Left eye shows a barely perceptible shimmer when light catches it at certain angles—the reading enhancement lens, so subtle most assume it''s a reflection. Wrist-mounted community-band data relay on left wrist: a flat rectangular interface in matte gray QUANTA-issue casing, integrated into a woven fabric band dyed in congregation lake-colors (deep blue and silver-white). The relay shows minor cosmetic wear.', N'Stands with feet planted; moves with deliberate, economical motion—no wasted gesture. When sitting, she typically faces whoever she is addressing directly, shoulders squared. When in public spaces, her attention is divided, aware of the congregation''s presence. Her movements are unhurried even when there is urgency; a person accustomed to maintaining calm in crisis.', N'Practical Tier 4 workwear reflecting the Gray Zone life and her role. Typically wears neutral-colored long-sleeved shirts (grey, tan, deep blue) over the tallit katan (fringes visible at waist and wrists). Loose, functional trousers in durable synthetic fabric, often with deep pockets. Closed-toe work boots, well-maintained. Over everything, usually a long linen-blend vest or apron in congregation colors (lake blue and silver), marked with small embroidered symbols. Her kippah is woven in the same lake-color pattern—a distinctive identifier among the Gray Zone residents. No jewelry except a simple silver ring on her left ring finger (a commitment ring from a relationship ended by death thirty years ago). Her clothing is modest and functional; she dresses for her work and her faith, not for display.', N'Her grandmother''s unfinished commentary contains a section that Miriam has read and re-read for twenty years — a meditation suggesting the grandmother did not believe in God in the final years of her life, but continued to lead the congregation anyway because she believed in the community. Miriam has never shared this with anyone. She doesn''t know what she thinks about it. She suspects she might agree.', N'Dense and precise; mixes Hebrew and Aramaic phrases naturally into speech; argues in a specific Talmudic structure of position-objection-resolution even in casual conversation', N'Quick and rhythmic with a tendency to complete other people''s sentences when she''s engaged and excited, which she tries to curb', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ayushmaan_horv_th');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6cb-7627-bce2-c901cafec60f', N'Gaspard Malhotra', N'Gaspard', N'', N'Malhotra', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, repurposed boiler hall called The Kettle, near Kedzie and Division', N'Sound sculptor and underground venue performer', N'The Kettle collective, loose affiliation with Highland Park Autonomous Zone arts network', N'Gaspard Malhotra is tall and angular with the kind of stillness that makes people nervous until the music starts. Their skin has a faint bioluminescent quality — an old geneware mod that pulses amber-gold when their heart rate elevates, which means performances turn them into something like a living lantern. They keep their head shaved except for a single thick braid down the back, dyed the deep blue-green of the lake at night. Three subdermal resonance implants run along their jaw and collarbone, visible as faint ridges under the skin that hum at frequencies others feel in their molars.

They work by finding sounds that shouldn''t exist — the groan of a Ferrogate Transit support beam in wind, the electrical whine of a failing ELF shrine, the subsonic thrum of the lake''s wave patterns — and building compositions around them. Their shows are not concerts so much as environments. Audiences stand in the dark and are changed. Gaspard Malhotra is almost aggressively soft-spoken offstage, apologetic in the way of someone who knows they take up enormous space when they choose to.', N'Atmospheric local color, potential information source about Hamtramck Enclave''s underground networks; their recordings of certain locations have accidentally captured things they don''t understand — audio ghosts, encrypted signals buried in infrastructure noise.', N'', N'Three subdermal resonance implants (jaw and collarbone) for real-time frequency generation; bioluminescent skin geneware (amber-gold pulse); standard neural interface for equipment sync', N'Spends mornings doing field recordings around industrial zones with a jury-rigged hydrophone array, afternoons mixing and rebuilding compositions; performs most Friday nights at The Kettle for whatever the door brings in.', N'Gaspard Malhotra, a 188cm tall lean-angular neo-noir sound artist with warm medium-deep caramel-bronze complexion reflecting South Asian, Southeast Asian, Hispanic, Sub-Saharan African, and North African heritage blend. Shaved head with single thick deep blue-green braid running down center back. Dark brown eyes with subtle amber bioluminescence. High-angled cheekbones, refined face structure, minimal facial hair. Wearing loose charcoal high-neck turtleneck showcasing three visible subdermal ridges along right collarbone, pulsing with amber-gold bioluminescent geneware. Utility cargo trousers, worn canvas shoulder bag with equipment. Single silver ring on right middle finger. Tall posture folding slightly inward, deliberate economical movement. Subdermal resonance implants visible along jawline. Waxy luminescent skin sheen. GLMZ aesthetic, dimly-lit recording studio or sound-design workspace, faint amber glow emanating from sternum during performance mode, moody introspective expression, hands poised near hydrophone array --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Complex genetic mosaic reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: South Asian ancestry (38.3%) forms the primary foundation, blended with significant Southeast Asian (22.4%) and Hispanic/Latin American (22.9%) heritage, accented by Sub-Saharan African (8.5%) and North African (7.9%) genetic contributions. This creates a striking phenotype where South Asian bone structure and facial proportions blend seamlessly with Southeast Asian refinement, enriched by the warmth and feature diversity of Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, resulting in a uniquely cosmopolitan appearance characteristic of 2226.', 188, 72, N'Angular and lean, almost gaunt in the shoulders, with long limbs that suggest a swimmer or someone who moves through space economically. Minimal muscle definition but visibly strong in the forearms and hands.', N'Shaved scalp with a single thick braid dyed deep blue-green (like night-dark lake water)', N'Single heavy braid running down the center back from crown to mid-spine; braid itself is textured, possibly wrapped with thin wire or fiber-optic threading', N'Shaved except for braid', N'Dark brown with faint luminescent amber undertones when bioluminescence activates', N'Warm medium to deep tan with complex, luminous undertones: golden from South Asian heritage, olive from Southeast Asian ancestry, enriched by the warm bronze and warm brown tones from Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African genetics, with subtle amber undertones from North African ancestry, creating a radiant medium-deep complexion. Faint waxy sheen from bioluminescent geneware.', N'Prominent, angular cheekbones reflecting blended South and Southeast Asian structure; long, refined face shape with subtle epicanthal folds; lower face width characteristic of South Asian ancestry with warmth from African and Latin American genetic input; minimal facial hair. Skin appears preternaturally smooth with no visible scars or blemishes. Hands are expressive and calloused from equipment work. Expression tends toward neutral or slightly withdrawn.', N'Subdermal resonance implants visible as faint ridges along jaw and collarbone that hum and resonate visibly when activated. Bioluminescent geneware manifests as a pulsing amber-gold luminescence under the skin, most prominent at the sternum and spreading outward during elevated heart rate or performance. Bioluminescence becomes dramatic and visible to observers during shows.', N'Tall, with a tendency to fold slightly inward as if apologizing for the space their height occupies. Movements are deliberate and economical, almost meditative offstage. Hands move with precision. When performing or experiencing sound, entire body becomes animated — subtle swaying, hands tracing invisible frequencies, jaw clenching as implants activate.', N'Tier 3-4 working artist aesthetic. Typically wears loose-fitting, high-necked shirts or turtle necks in muted colors (charcoal, deep navy, burgundy) to showcase the collarbone implants and allow skin to breathe/luminesce. Favors layered, minimal jewelry except for a single thick silver or steel ring on the right middle finger (possibly jury-rigged equipment sync interface). Worn but clean workwear — cargo pants or utility trousers with functional pockets for recording equipment, reinforced at the knees. Carries a worn canvas shoulder bag with hydrophone array and mixing equipment. Footwear is practical and quiet (soft-soled boots or slip-ons). Overall aesthetic is deliberately understated offstage, expensive in its simplicity.', N'Three months ago their hydrophone recorded something beneath the lake — a structured, repeating signal at 7.83 Hz that doesn''t match any known infrastructure. They''ve told no one. They''ve been back seventeen times. The signal is getting louder.', N'Precise, technical when discussing sound; deliberately plain about everything else. Uses ''frequency'' and ''resonance'' as metaphors for emotional states.', N'Slow, measured pauses. Never rushes. Can be unsettling in conversation.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gaspard_malhotra');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a67e-704a-90e8-c9040e736de8', N'Birendra Nygaard-Haugen', N'Birendra', N'', N'Nygaard-Haugen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 14, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Engelheim, Axiom Meridian Youth Preparatory Campus, near Lincoln and Belmont', N'corporate school student and junior hacker, Tier 3', N'Axiom Meridian Youth Preparatory (student); informal peer-network of paying clients', N'Birendra Nygaard-Haugen is a tall, soft-faced fourteen-year-old with his father''s Ukrainian pallor cut through with his grandfather''s Ghanaian bone structure, resulting in something that looks like a sculptor started with two different models and found the intersection interesting. His geneware is modest — his parents approved a bioluminescent vein treatment in pale gold that shows at his temples and wrists when he''s excited or stressed, something he deeply regrets as it is essentially a visible anxiety indicator. He keeps his school uniform impeccably pressed to compensate.

He is enrolled at Axiom Meridian Youth Prep on a partial academic scholarship, meaning his family stretches Tier 3 income to cover the gap. He is genuinely brilliant at systems architecture and has parlayed that into a small private operation: for a fee, he fixes other students'' academic scores, not by hacking the official records (too dangerous) but by finding the legitimate alternate-submission loopholes buried in the campus governance code that no one else reads. He calls this ''procedural advocacy.'' He is aware this is thin moral ice and he keeps skating.', N'Information broker within the corporate school ecosystem; can provide access to Axiom campus systems or student social networks; represents the pressure-cooker of Tier 3 families buying into corporate education pipelines; his operation could explode in multiple interesting directions', N'', N'Bioluminescent vein treatment (gold, temple and wrists); basic neural study-assist implant standard-issued by Axiom to scholarship students (read/recall enhancement, cannot be removed without forfeiting enrollment status)', N'Class from 0700-1500, two hours of mandatory Axiom-branded extracurricular programming, then three hours in his dorm room doing actual work — half homework, half client requests — followed by compulsive reviewing of campus governance documents looking for new procedural gaps.', N'Birendra Nygaard-Haugen, 178cm tall androgynous teenager with warm olive-beige skin and golden undertones blending Middle Eastern, Northern European, and Latin American heritage. Dark brown nearly-black hair, neatly parted left, short length. Warm brown eyes with amber undertones. Fine-featured angular face with rounded jawline and prominent nasal bridge. Wearing pressed charcoal Axiom Meridian regulation blazer, white tucked dress shirt, dark trousers with sharp crease, school tie. Silver wristband visible on one wrist. Bioluminescent gold vein tracery faintly visible along temples and inner wrists. Rigid posture, shoulders tense, expression slightly concentrated. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool neon-lit corridor or academy setting, subtle cool lighting highlighting skin''s luminous olive quality, minimal jewelry, obsessively groomed appearance, subtle stress glow emanating from temple veins --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Engelheim', N'local', N'Engelheim', N'Mixed Middle Eastern, Northern European, and Hispanic/Latin American heritage (47.5% Middle Eastern, 39.4% Northern European, 13.1% Hispanic/Latin American) — a striking blend creating warm olive undertones with subtle depth, bridging Mediterranean and Nordic features', 178, 62, N'Tall and lean with narrow shoulders and long limbs still catching up to his frame; the awkward proportionality of early adolescence stretched across an unusually adult height. Minimal muscle definition.', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Neat, carefully parted on the left; kept short enough to look regulation-compliant but with enough length to suggest deliberate grooming rather than default', N'Short', N'Warm brown with a slight amber undertone', N'Warm olive-beige with golden undertones — the dominant Middle Eastern ancestry (47.5%) creates a luminous olive base, softened and brightened by Northern European heritage (39.4%), with the Hispanic/Latin American component (13.1%) adding subtle warmth and depth throughout. Even complexion with Mediterranean glow.', N'Fine-featured with subtle angular definition emerging; rounded jawline softening toward adult sharpening; strong nasal bridge reflecting Middle Eastern heritage; slightly widened cheekbones from Latin American ancestry; clear skin with the careful grooming habits of someone overcompensating for visible augmentations. Warm olive undertones throughout with golden luminosity. Frequently appears slightly tense or concentrating.', N'Gold bioluminescent vein treatment at temples and wrists (involuntary stress indicator). No obvious external neural implant, but the mandatory Axiom study-assist is subcutaneous.', N'Sits very straight, shoulders held rigid — habitual tension from self-consciousness about his height and his glowing veins. Moves with the careful precision of someone who knows they''re being watched. Fidgets with hands when thinking, particularly picking at the cuffs of his uniform.', N'Axiom Meridian regulation uniform: pressed charcoal blazer with embroidered school crest, white dress shirt (always tucked), dark trousers with a sharp crease, school-issued tie. Everything maintained obsessively — no wrinkles, no stains. Off-campus wears similar Tier 3 corporate-casual: clean neutral tones, expensive-looking but not ostentatiously so, always fitted. No logos. Minimal jewelry except a thin silver wristband that hides his bioluminescent veins.', N'Six months ago he found a genuine security vulnerability in the campus assessment system — a real one, not a loophole — and didn''t report it. He uses it as a last resort and has used it exactly once, for himself, to correct a score he earned but that was logged incorrectly due to a teacher''s error. He tells himself that last part matters.', N'Precise, clause-heavy, uses legal and procedural language casually; shifts to clipped teen slang around peers he''s trying to impress', N'Measured, slightly too slow for his age, like he''s reading from internal notes', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'birendra_nygaard_haugen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a629-7f97-8c1f-c9439ba51a90', N'Anaisha Calvillo-Dlamini', N'Anaisha', N'', N'Calvillo-Dlamini', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 64, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Ironvein, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Junk merchant and scrap reseller with a specialty in pre-Consolidation artifacts', N'Independent. Loose friendship network with other the Gray Zone vendors. Known to the Oxidian Market Guild but not a member.', N'Anaisha Calvillo-Dlamini is a compact, unhurried man with deep brown skin going papery at the temples and a magnificent white moustache he waxes every morning without exception. His left arm from the elbow down is a thirty-year-old mechanical prosthetic he has never upgraded — brushed steel with visible articulation joints, which he keeps immaculate. He dresses in layers regardless of temperature: a canvas vest with dozens of pockets, a collared work shirt, fingerless gloves on the real hand. His stall on the Gray Zone sprawls across three connected spaces in a converted warehouse loading bay, stacked floor-to-ceiling with pre-Consolidation electronics, salvaged machine parts, cracked data-cores, antique physical media, pre-fab furniture missing crucial components, and objects whose original function has been entirely lost to time. He catalogues everything in a physical ledger written in a cramped three-language shorthand.

Anaisha Calvillo-Dlamini is a man in love with the material fact of things — their weight, their age, the way they were made. He genuinely does not think of himself as a dealer so much as a temporary custodian. He will tell you the history of an object for twenty minutes before he tells you the price, and the price will be either absurdly low because he likes you or absurdly high because he doesn''t want to sell it. He is a poor businessman by most metrics and comfortable with this. He has strong opinions about everything and shares them with magnificent economy.', N'Treasure-map NPC. Has access to rare pre-Consolidation objects that might be mission-critical MacGuffins, old data, or historically significant items. Exceptional source of information about GLMZ''s history. Gives players reasons to dig through his stock — something is always in there.', N'', N'Mechanical prosthetic arm (left, elbow-down, 30-year-old model, impeccably maintained). Reading enhancement monocle — not a true augment, a clip-on optical tool he has used for decades.', N'Opens the stall late morning, spends several hours on acquisition runs through Ironvein''s salvage channels, returns to sort and catalogue new items, and receives the steady trickle of regulars who come specifically to talk to him. Closes whenever he feels like it.', N'Portrait of Anaisha Calvillo-Dlamini, a weathered 168cm man with warm deep brown skin blending Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, and North African heritage. Prominent angular cheekbones, lean face with deep laugh lines, sharp brown eyes. Cropped white hair with salt-and-pepper stubble. Magnificent precision-waxed white moustache curving upward. Visible burn scar on right hand, small circuit-pattern tattoo on left inner forearm, faint scar from left temple to cheekbone. Mechanical brushed steel prosthetic left arm with visible servos. Titanium reading monocle on left eye. Wearing heavy canvas work vest with multiple pockets over muted-colored collared shirt, fingerless leather gloves on right hand, canvas trousers, aged heavy boots. Wedding band on right ring finger. Posture slightly forward, patient evaluative gaze. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, industrial workspace ambiance, warm practical lighting catching the metallic prosthetic and textured hands, moody and contemplative atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'A genetic confluence of the Ubiquitous Diaspora: 48.5% Hispanic/Latin American warmth forms the foundation, enriched by 30.8% Sub-Saharan African depth and resilience. Indigenous American ancestry (11.6%) contributes angular bone structure and facial geometry, while 7.3% North African heritage adds further refinement to cheekbones and brow. A trace of South Asian ancestry (1.8%) rounds the blend. The result is a face that synthesizes multiple continental traditions into a singular, weathered authenticity—warm medium-to-deep brown skin that speaks to equatorial and African ancestry, shaped by the angular geometries of Indigenous and North African lineages.', 168, 72, N'Compact and wiry, shoulders still squared from decades of physical labor. No excess weight; muscle has transitioned to lean efficiency. Moves with the economy of someone who has carried heavy things for a lifetime.', N'White with faint traces of gray-black at the nape', N'Cropped close to the scalp, well-maintained. Salt-and-pepper stubble on the jaw, kept to a consistent three-day length.', N'Short', N'Deep brown, sharp and undiminished by age', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden-amber undertones from Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African heritage, slightly brightened by Indigenous American and North African admixture. Sun-weathered, papery texture developing at the temples and across the knuckles of the right hand.', N'Lean-faced with prominent cheekbones shaped by Indigenous American and North African ancestry. Deep laugh lines around the eyes. The magnificent white moustache is waxed daily with precision—it points slightly upward at the ends and is his single vanity. Skin still firm across the jawline; age shows primarily in the texture of his hands and the tiredness that occasionally settles behind his eyes. The warmth and depth of his complexion reflects his dominant Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African heritage; angular facial structure and high cheekbone prominence speak to Indigenous American and North African contributions.', N'Mechanical prosthetic left arm from the elbow down. Brushed steel construction with visible ball-joint articulation at the wrist and finger servos. Thirty years old and meticulous in maintenance—no rust, joints move with precision, minor wear marks visible on the palm contact surface. Reading enhancement monocle clipped to his left eye socket via a thin titanium arm that curves over the temple—a decades-old optical tool, not a true neural augment, made by a manufacturer that no longer exists.', N'Moves with unhurried deliberation. Never rushes. Uses his right hand naturally; the prosthetic left arm is gestural and precise—he has mastered it completely. Tends to stand with shoulders slightly forward, as if perpetually about to reach for something on a gray zone. When seated, he becomes statuary—entirely still, watching. His gaze is patient and evaluative.', N'Tier 4 working-class practicality with personal ritual. Heavy canvas vest with dozens of pockets (each containing specific items organized by function), worn over a collared work shirt in muted colors (grays, dark blues, browns). The shirt is always buttoned; the vest is always layered on top regardless of ambient temperature—insulation and habit. Fingerless leather gloves on the right hand, worn thin at the knuckles. Canvas trousers, neutral color. Heavy boots, well-maintained but visibly aged. No jewelry except a faded wedding band on his right ring finger. His appearance suggests a man who dresses for function and ritual, not for impression.', N'Hidden in a false-backed crate in the deepest part of the stall is a complete pre-Consolidation municipal archive — decades of city records, personal files, and classified infrastructure data from before the corponations restructured GLMZ''s records. He found it in a demolition salvage job fifteen years ago and has never told anyone it exists. He is not sure what to do with it.', N'Precise and slightly archaic, with occasional Malian French from the Dembélé line. Uses technical terms for objects most people have no name for.', N'Unhurried to the point of being geological. Pauses are meaningful.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anaisha_calvillo_dlamini');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a71d-7521-90c4-c96e06201756', N'Facundo Sisavath-Delgado', N'Facundo', N'', N'Sisavath-Delgado', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 28, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Dockside — Lake Michigan waterfront, smuggler territory, near Wacker and State', N'Counter-surveillance and mole detection — counterintelligence specialist', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Facundo Sisavath-Delgado is wiry and quick-moving, with the restless energy of someone who converts anxiety into velocity. At 28, her expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Born and raised in GLMZ, third generation — she has the city in her blood, its rhythms in her bones, its cruelty in her expectations. She works as a counterintelligence specialist out of Dockside, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Facundo Sisavath-Delgado lacks in subtlety, she compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'Ximena Cruz-Addo is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons. Bioware adrenaline regulator — keeps calm under fire, controlled hormone release', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Facundo Sisavath-Delgado, neo-noir operative 2226, lean wiry frame 168cm tall. Golden-brown warm skin tone reflecting Southeast Asian, South Asian, Hispanic-Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage blend. High cheekbones, angular refined jawline, dark brown eyes with infrared ocular overlay. Black hair pulled tight in functional braid, grey threading at temples. Pale 4cm scar on left cheekbone. Posture alert and economical, forward-leaning with compressed readiness. Wearing charcoal grey reinforced tactical jacket and black cargo pants, scuffed boots. Right forearm shows visible chrome smartgun interface panel with blue circuitry. Silver chain necklace with metal trinket. Faint stippled burn scars on left inner wrist. Minimalist QUANTA tattoo on right forearm. Expression neutral, tense, careful. GLMZ Dockside warehouse setting, cool industrial lighting, motion blur suggesting constant threat assessment. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dockside', N'local', N'Dockside', N'Complex diaspora ancestry: 47.3% Hispanic/Latin American, 25.2% Southeast Asian, 23.7% South Asian, 3.8% Sub-Saharan African. The genetic blend creates striking facial geometry — high cheekbones and refined bone structure from Southeast and South Asian ancestry, warm golden-brown undertones from the Latin American and African heritage, angular jawline and defined features from the combined mix. Face reflects the warmth and proportion of multiple continents.', 168, 58, N'Wiry and lean with defined muscle — the physiology of someone who converts nervous energy into constant motion. Shoulders angular, limbs long relative to torso. No excess fat, minimal bulk.', N'Natural black with faint grey threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid. No styling affectation — practical, utilitarian.', N'Medium (past shoulders when loose)', N'Dark brown, slightly enhanced with low-grade ocular overlay (infrared flicker visible in certain light angles)', N'Warm golden-brown — the blended result of Southeast Asian, South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Rich undertones with subtle warmth deepened by time spent outdoors near water. Neither light nor dark, but a harmonious middle with golden luminosity.', N'Sharp facial geometry with high cheekbones and a defined jawline reflecting her genetic diversity. The bone structure carries Southeast and South Asian refinement layered with Latin American warmth and African sculptural depth. Minimal makeup or grooming beyond functionality. Small scar on left cheekbone (knife work, Dockside, 2224). Perpetual tension in the muscles around her eyes and mouth — her default expression is careful neutrality, maintained through deliberate effort.', N'Chrome smartgun link in right forearm — a visible silvered interface panel approximately 3cm × 5cm, positioned on the inner forearm just above the wrist. The interface shows faint blue circuitry tracing beneath polished metal. No effort made to conceal it. The bioware adrenaline regulator is subcutaneous and not visibly apparent, though her movement patterns and lack of visible stress response might indicate its presence to trained observers.', N'Economical and alert. She moves with the compressed energy of someone trained in threat assessment — head positioned to maintain peripheral vision, weight distributed for rapid direction change. Default posture is slightly forward-leaning, shoulders loose but ready. She exhibits minimal fidgeting despite her internal restlessness; the anxiety finds outlets in context (weapon checks, equipment maintenance) rather than display.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: Reinforced synthetic jacket (charcoal grey, worn leather-look polymer) with internal pockets for tools and dead-drop comms. Black cargo pants with thigh pocket reinforcements. Worn tactical boots, scuffed but maintained. No visible corpo branding. Clothing is designed for function — multiple carry points, quick-release systems, range of motion for weapon access. Worn over a fitted black undershirt. A silver chain around her neck holds a cheap metal trinket (likely a dead-drop key or memento from GLMZ).', N'Ximena Cruz-Addo betrayed their previous crew to survive a corporate raid. The crew didn''t survive. Nobody in GLMZ knows this.', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'facundo_sisavath_delgado');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ce-7233-8f0f-c9b3d211ca6b', N'Ayodele Fredriksen-Valenzuela', N'Ayodele', N'', N'Fredriksen-Valenzuela', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Pilsen Veil, back-room residency at a venue called The Underscore, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Underground DJ and sound sculptor', N'Independent; regular collaborator with the Pilsen Veil sound collective Barometric', N'Ayodele Fredriksen-Valenzuela is a tall man whose body has softened comfortably into middle age, broad through the shoulders and belly, moving through space with the unhurried certainty of someone who has never needed to perform urgency. His face is deeply lined around the eyes and mouth from decades of late nights and genuine laughter, dark brown skin pocked with the small silvery scars of an old electrical accident he considers formative. His hair is cut close except for a strip of white that runs from his left temple to the back of his skull — natural, not dyed, arrived when he was thirty-two and which he refused to touch. He wears functional clothes exclusively: work boots, cargo trousers, a rotating selection of worn linen shirts. His only concession to ornamentation is a pair of custom cochlear amplifiers threaded with copper wire that catch the light when he tilts his head.

Ayodele Fredriksen-Valenzuela does not play music so much as construct environments. His sets move over four to six hours through tidal cycles of sub-bass and silence, incorporating field recordings he makes throughout the city — the Ferrogate Transit harmonic at Deepwell Station, the hydraulic breath of the Kilimanjaro Mass Driver, rain on the lake filtration membranes. Audiences don''t dance to Ayodele Fredriksen-Valenzuela''s sets so much as dissolve into them. He has turned down three Axiom-sponsored residencies and one Ringo content contract, a fact he mentions rarely but accurately.', N'Local color and community anchor for the Pilsen Veil underground; information broker for the arts scene — he hears everything, literally; can provide access to venues, networks, and people who don''t advertise their existence.', N'', N'Custom cochlear amplifiers (medical-origin, modified for expanded frequency range); basic subdermal temp-mesh for studio climate control; no geneware', N'Spends mornings in the city with a portable recorder collecting sounds; afternoons composing and layering in his studio; three nights a week he plays The Underscore from midnight until the crowd thins, usually around five in the morning.', N'Ayodele Fredriksen-Valenzuela, 188cm tall mixed-heritage man with warm deep brown skin blending Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, Northern European, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Close-cropped dark brown hair with striking natural white stripe from left temple to back of skull. Deep-set dark brown eyes, high prominent cheekbones, weathered face lined from decades of night work, small silvery electrical burn scars scattered across left side of face and neck. Copper-threaded custom cochlear amplifiers visible in both ears. Broad-shouldered, substantial build, soft middle-age physique. Wearing scuffed work boots, neutral cargo trousers with deep pockets, pale blue linen shirt. Standing with unhurried certainty, subtle head tilt catching amplifier light. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody neon-filtered night setting with cool blue and warm amber lighting, industrial urban background, cinematic depth of field --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Pilsen Veil', N'local', N'Pilsen Veil', N'Mixed ancestry from Hispanic/Latin American (50%), Southeast Asian (30%), Northern European (11%), and Sub-Saharan African (9%) heritage—a striking blend evident in his bone structure, warm medium-to-deep brown skin tone, and distinctive facial architecture. The combination creates high, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Indigenous Mesoamerican heritage, slightly angled eyes reflecting Southeast Asian ancestry, rich warm golden-amber undertones from the Latin American and African components balanced with cooler undertones from Northern European ancestry, with facial proportions that show the integrated blending of all four ancestral regions.', 188, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial through the torso, carrying comfortable middle-age weight with no apparent self-consciousness. Soft rather than muscular, the body of someone who moves deliberately rather than quickly.', N'Dark brown with natural white stripe', N'Cut close to the scalp with a distinctive natural white streak running from left temple to the back of the skull, maintained but unadorned', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden-amber undertones—the result of Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Northern European ancestry blending together, weathered by decades of sun exposure and night work into a rich, lived-in hue with subtle depth and even tone across facial planes', N'Deeply lined face, particularly around the eyes and mouth from decades of late nights and genuine expression. Small silvery electrical burn scars scattered across the face and neck—visible remnants of an accident he views as formative rather than traumatic. Weathered but animated features with the distinctive facial structure of his mixed heritage: high, prominent cheekbones, warm skin that catches light evenly across the planes of his face, slightly angled eyes reflecting Southeast Asian influence, the bone structure showing the integrated effect of his multiple ancestral regions.', N'Custom cochlear amplifiers integrated into both ears, threaded with copper wire that catches light when he moves his head. The devices are visibly non-standard medical hardware, clearly modified for expanded frequency response. Subdermal temp-mesh is not visible but creates subtle thermal gradients under his skin in direct light.', N'Moves with unhurried certainty and substantial presence. No wasted motion. Frequently tilts his head slightly—a habitual gesture that catches light on his amplifier wiring. Comfortable in silence and stillness. When he does move, there is ground-level control and deliberation.', N'Exclusively functional, Tier 4 working aesthetic. Worn work boots (scuffed, re-soled multiple times), cargo trousers in neutral tones with deep pockets for recording equipment, a rotating selection of lightweight linen shirts in off-white, gray, or pale blue—the uniform of someone indifferent to fashion but attentive to comfort and durability. No logos, no status markers. Everything is visibly broken in and maintained rather than replaced.', N'The electrical accident that scarred him was not an accident — he deliberately touched an exposed transit rail at eighteen, a moment of despair he has reframed so many times he almost believes the revised version.', N'Conversational and warm, drops into technical acoustic language without warning, then pulls back out; generous with profanity used affectionately', N'Unhurried, enjoys a good pause, never rushes to fill silence — he finds silence interesting', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ayodele_fredriksen_valenzuela');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60e-784a-9bfc-c9c3ba27773c', N'Farahnaz Krishnamurthy-Dlamini', N'Farahnaz', N'', N'Krishnamurthy-Dlamini', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Rookery — dense vertical housing, gang-controlled, near Kedzie and Division', N'Personal security and threat neutralization — bodyguard', N'Independent — maintains network of professional contacts', N'Farahnaz Krishnamurthy-Dlamini are compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 34, their face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and they have learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation — and they make no effort to hide it.

Before the runner life, they worked corporate — low-tier security, the kind that teaches you exactly how the system''s defenses fail. They work as a bodyguard out of The Rookery, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

In the runner community, Farahnaz Krishnamurthy-Dlamini are known for getting the job done and not asking questions that would make the job harder to stomach.', N'As a bodyguard, Fanta Hedlund-Diarra embodies the tension between independence and isolation. They are a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation. Bone lacing — titanium mesh throughout skeleton, increases durability and striking power', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Farahnaz Krishnamurthy-Dlamini, 163cm compact muscular figure, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones blending Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, Latin American, and North African heritage, prominent cheekbones and broad jawline. Short dark brown hair with silver at temples, deep brown augmented eyes with inhuman tracking precision. Chrome reflex scarring visible at wrists, neck, base of skull. Faint collarbone burn scar, temple scar tissue. Minimalist gray geometric forearm tattoo, notched left ear. Fitted matte-black synthmesh jacket with reinforced panels, gray subcutaneous armor underlayer, dark cargo pants with mag-locks, scuffed steel-toed boots. Worn silver ring, leather bracelet over augmentation seam. Predatory economy of motion, weight balanced, hands near weapons, intense environmental scanning. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone runner, neon-lit industrial setting with rain-slicked metal surfaces, cool blue and amber accent lighting emphasizing augmentation lines, gritty concrete and steel environment, ready stance --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Rookery', N'local', N'The Rookery', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (32.2%) and South Asian (30.2%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (17.0%) and North African (13.7%) ancestry, supplemented by Northern European (4.2%) and Southeast Asian (2.7%) genetics. The result is a striking phenotypic blend: broad facial structure and prominent cheekbones from African and South Asian ancestry, warm golden-brown undertones from Latin American and North African heritage, refined bone structure from Northern European and Southeast Asian elements. A cosmopolitan genetic signature reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 163, 78, N'Compact and densely muscled, low center of gravity — built like a load-bearing structure. Broad shoulders, thick forearms, minimal body fat. Power concentrated in the core and legs.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples', N'Close-cropped, functional undercut — easy to maintain, no distractions', N'Short', N'Deep brown with calculating intensity, eyes track with inhuman smoothness from augmentation', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones — the blended result of dominant Sub-Saharan African and South Asian ancestry, enriched by Latin American and North African warmth. Medium-deep to deep saturation with sun-kissed luminosity from outdoor work. Unmarked by single regional origin, distinctly cosmopolitan.', N'Strong, prominent cheekbones with fuller mid-face structure characteristic of African and South Asian heritage. Broad, well-defined jawline with squared angles. Weathered texture showing exposure to all-weather conditions. Minimal facial scarring — professional choice. Small scar tissue along right temple, mostly healed.', N'Chrome reflex lines visible at wrists and neck — metallic threads running along nerve clusters. Slight bulge at base of skull where adrenaline pump system anchors. Eyes track with inhuman smoothness. Occasional faint hum audible when augmentations activate under stress.', N'Economical and grounded. Stands with weight evenly distributed, knees slightly bent — ready to move in any direction. Walks with minimal upper-body movement, predator''s economy of motion. Hands rest near weapons with natural ease, not aggression. Eyes rarely still, constant environmental scanning.', N'Tier 3-4 functional runner wear. Fitted matte-black synthmesh jacket with reinforced panels and discrete weapon loops. Gray underlayer with subcutaneous armor compatibility. Dark cargo pants with mag-locks for gear. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and maintained. Minimal jewelry — one worn silver ring on left hand, sentimental value unknown. Wears a worn leather bracelet over left wrist augmentation seam. Everything chosen for durability and function, zero aesthetic concession.', N'Fanta Hedlund-Diarra can''t read. Hides it behind voice interfaces and memorization. The shame is older than the chrome.', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'farahnaz_krishnamurthy_dlamini');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a650-7cf9-9976-c9e41e8432cc', N'Habib Bui-Dalgaard', N'Habib', N'', N'Bui-Dalgaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor, operates out of a shared garage space near the Grindstone Shore docks, near Wacker and State', N'Delivery driver, independent courier running the Narrows and Old Harbor routes', N'Independent, loosely contracted to three different courier platforms simultaneously', N'Habib Bui-Dalgaard is whip-thin and perpetually damp from the lake spray that hits the Old Harbor route, with light brown skin that tans unevenly and dark curly hair he keeps tucked under a helmet or a rain hood most of the day. His eyes are large and dark and slightly too expressive for someone who would prefer to seem unreadable. He has color-changing hair geneware that he can''t afford to maintain properly — it cycles through colors on its own schedule now rather than responding to his intent, and he''s given up trying to predict it, which is how he accidentally showed up to a delivery in full fluorescent pink and became briefly memorable to someone he''d rather have forgotten. He has a small tattoo of the Old Harbor lighthouse on the inside of his left wrist, his only lasting decision he doesn''t regret.

Habib Bui-Dalgaard has been running deliveries since he was seventeen and has the territorial knowledge of Old Harbor and the Narrows that can only be built by knowing every shortcut, every flooded underpass, every drone patrol timing. He runs on the border between the legal courier economy and the informal one without ever fully committing to either side, which means he makes enough to survive and not enough to get out. He is not precisely unhappy about this. He is young enough to still believe the right job will come to him rather than the other way around. He prays to whichever E.L.F. he thinks is inhabiting his cargo bike''s navigation system, calling it Waypoint, and blames it personally when he gets lost.', N'Mobile connection between locations, can carry information or items between story nodes, witness to the city''s geography and street-level events, represents precarious gig economy youth.', N'', N'Color-changing hair geneware (malfunctioning, cycles autonomously). Navigation wetware implant, basic model, three years out of date and partly corrupted.', N'On his bike by 0800, runs until he''s made his minimum or his legs give out, whichever comes first — usually around 1900. Eats two meals a day from whichever vendor is fastest to reach on his route.', N'Habib Bui-Dalgaard, 172cm lean courier in GLMZ, warm medium-brown skin with golden-olive undertones from Southeast Asian-Hispanic-East Asian-Eastern European blend; softly angular face with rounded cheekbones, tapered jawline, subtle nose angularity; dark expressive eyes with exhaustion shadows; geneware-corrupted hair cycling between burgundy, cyan, pink, muted olive, tucked under worn rain hood; hunched posture from years on cargo bike; waterproofed charcoal jacket with salt stains and reflective piping, reinforced cargo pants, grip-soled shoes, cracked-visor helmet; small lighthouse tattoo on left wrist; Old Harbor setting, lake spray mist, neon-lit alleys, moody evening lighting, worn equipment, internal augmentation scars at skull base visible when hood shifts; tired but focused expression, efficient micro-movements; neo-noir dystopian courier aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Habib carries the genetic signature of the Ubiquitous Diaspora: predominantly Southeast Asian (42.3%) blended with Hispanic/Latin American (28.5%), East Asian (18.0%), and Eastern European (11.2%) ancestry. This combination produces warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones and a subtle olive cast; facial structure reflects the Southeast Asian and East Asian influence with slightly rounded cheekbones and a tapered jawline softened by the Hispanic/Latin American genetics, while Eastern European heritage contributes a subtle angularity to the bridge of the nose and brow ridge—a truly cosmopolitan genetic synthesis', 172, 62, N'Whip-thin and wiry, all lean muscle from three years of courier cycling; shoulders slightly hunched from constant posture over handlebars, chest narrow but defined', N'Currently cycling autonomously through the geneware spectrum — naturally dark brown beneath the malfunction, but shifts unpredictably between deep burgundy, electric cyan, fluorescent pink, and muted olive depending on the geneware''s corruption state', N'Curly and unruly when loose; habitually tucked under a rain hood or courier helmet to contain the color-shifting spectacle', N'Medium (approximately 10-12cm when loose)', N'Dark brown, large and expressive — the kind of eyes that betray emotion despite preference for opacity', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones and subtle olive cast from the blended Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and East Asian ancestry; uneven deepening across shoulders, forearms, and face from lake spray exposure and inconsistent weather protection; lighter patches where kept covered, revealing the natural warm undertone beneath the weathering', N'Clean but weathered for age; face is softly angular with slightly rounded cheekbones characteristic of Southeast Asian and East Asian heritage, tapered jawline showing Hispanic/Latin American influence, and subtle angularity to the nose bridge and brow from Eastern European genetics; skin shows early salt-damage from Old Harbor''s constant moisture and spray; dark circles under eyes from irregular sleep tied to courier schedules', N'Faint subcutaneous scarring at the base of skull where navigation wetware was implanted three years ago; the hair geneware itself is visible as an autonomous color-shift effect across scalp, with occasional chromatic glitching at the roots when the system malfunctions. No chrome or external augmentation — all tech is internal and failing quietly.', N'Perpetually slightly hunched, spine curved from years bent over cargo bike handlebars; moves with the efficient, economical grace of someone who has learned to navigate tight spaces and flooded alleys; fidgets with wrist where the lighthouse tattoo sits when thinking; nervous energy channeled into constant micro-adjustments rather than large gestures', N'Tier 4 working-class courier aesthetic: waterproofed jacket in charcoal or dark blue with reflective piping, worn daily and stained with lake spray salt; cheap synthetic rain hood in rotation; cargo pants with reinforced knee panels and multiple pockets, often damp; worn athletic shoes with grip soles suited to wet surfaces; always wearing a helmet when mobile, usually a secondhand model with cracked visor. No logos or status markers — everything is functional and cheap enough to replace without regret.', N'Three months ago he made a delivery to an address in the Narrows that turned out to be a location that clearly no longer existed — the building was condemned, the interior was something else, and the person who met him at the door handed him a package he was not contracted to carry back. He delivered it anyway because he was scared not to. He doesn''t know what was in it and the platform has no record of the original pickup.', N'Clipped and fast, Old Harbor dockside slang mixed with courier platform jargon, occasionally drops into his grandmother''s Brazilian Portuguese when startled', N'Quick and slightly breathless, like someone always about to leave', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'habib_bui_dalgaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a638-7b1c-b829-ca0327d685ac', N'Desta Watanabe', N'Desta', N'', N'Watanabe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, Trauma Bay Seven, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Trauma surgeon at Aurochs Medical Complex, Tier 3 salaried position with Helix Biosystems oversight', N'Crucible Genomics (senior trauma surgeon at aurochs medical complex)', N'Desta Watanabe is tall and angular, with light brown skin and the kind of posture that comes from years of standing over operating tables — slightly forward in the shoulders, weight balanced, always ready. She has gene-modded bioluminescent tracery along her collarbones and upper arms: a delicate pattern of cool blue that pulses faintly when her heart rate elevates. She got it years ago as an aesthetic choice and now she regrets it, because it functions as an involuntary stress indicator in high-stakes situations. She compensates by wearing high collars when she can. Her dark hair is cut in a precise bob that she maintains herself with surgical shears.

She is formidable in the OR and genuinely difficult outside of it. Her intelligence is not subtle — she does not soften assessments, she does not cushion bad news, and she has very limited patience for institutional inefficiency, which means she is in a state of near-constant low-grade conflict with Helix Biosystems administration. She is not cruel; she is exact. She saves lives with focused ferocity and then goes home to an apartment she has never bothered to furnish properly and eats takeout alone, which she insists she prefers. The gap between those two versions of herself is something she doesn''t look at directly.', N'Authority figure within the medical establishment; source of legitimate medical information and analysis; represents the cost of institutional excellence — competent, compromised, and lonely; can serve as an obstacle or an unexpected ally', N'', N'Bioluminescent tracery (gene-mod, cosmetic, regretted); neural response accelerator in the motor cortex-hand pathway (professional grade, Helix-subsidized); ocular magnification implants (surgical precision model)', N'Twelve-hour shifts, three days on, one day off, which she spends on call anyway. She reviews case files on her commute, skips most social events, and has a complicated relationship with a very expensive coffee subscription that is the one luxury she permits herself.', N'Desta Watanabe, 182cm tall trauma surgeon in GLMZ, sharp angular features blending East Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Warm golden-brown skin tone, high defined cheekbones, dark brown eyes with subtle metallic iridescence from ocular implants. Short precision-cut dark brown bob with blunt edges. Cool blue bioluminescent tracery branches delicately across exposed collarbones and upper arms, pulsing faintly. Lean muscular build, shoulders slightly forward in surgical readiness. Wearing high-collared black sweater and charcoal tailored slacks, standing with economical posture and steady eye contact. Minimalist, purposeful presence. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, cool clinical lighting with accent glow from bioluminescent implants, atmospheric neo-noir ambiance, moody and precise --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Complex diaspora ancestry: predominantly East Asian (41.5%), South Asian (25.4%), Sub-Saharan African (12.2%), Eastern European (10.9%), Central Asian (5.6%), and Hispanic/Latin American (4.4%). Features reflect this intricate blend—bone structure shows the refined angularity of East Asian and Central Asian genetics with pronounced cheekbones and orbital structure characteristic of South Asian heritage, softened by warmth from Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European admixture. Lower face shows graceful tapering common to East and South Asian ancestry, with subtle jaw width from African genetics. The confluence creates a distinctly cosmopolitan phenotype marked by high definition facial architecture and warm, even complexion depth.', 182, 68, N'Tall and angular with minimal soft tissue; lean musculature developed through sustained posture and fine motor control rather than exercise. Shoulders slightly rounded forward from decades of surgical stance.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Precision-cut bob, self-maintained with surgical shears, blunt edges, no styling product', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint metallic sheen at the margins (ocular magnification implants)', N'Warm medium to rich brown with golden and subtle amber undertones—a balanced blend of South Asian and East Asian depth enriched by Sub-Saharan warmth and Eastern European refinement, creating an even, luminous complexion', N'Minimal makeup; skin shows disciplined care but no vanity. Facial structure reflects the ancestry blend: high, defined cheekbones with graceful prominence characteristic of South and East Asian heritage, complemented by subtle warmth and deeper undertone from Sub-Saharan African genetics. Fine lines around the eyes and mouth from years of surgical focus and compressed stress. Hands show surgical calluses on index and middle fingers.', N'Ocular implants visible as a faint metallic iridescence at the eye margins when light catches them. Bioluminescent tracery is always visible on exposed skin. No external hardware; neural accelerator and motor cortex implant are subcutaneous and invisible.', N'Weight balanced forward on the balls of her feet, shoulders held slightly high and forward in perpetual surgical readiness. Movements are economical and precise; no wasted motion. In conversation, she maintains steady eye contact and does not soften her expression. Walks with purpose; never appears to be in transit, always en route to something specific.', N'Aurochs Medical Complex trauma surgeon — Tier 3 salaried. Off-duty: high-collared shirts and sweaters to obscure the bioluminescent tracery, charcoal and black baseline. Dark tailored slacks, minimal jewelry. Commute apparel is functional and unremarkable. When not in scrubs, she dresses like someone who views clothing as a problem to solve rather than an expression. No logos, no aspirational branding; quality materials, zero ornamentation.', N'Three years ago she falsified a post-operative report to protect a colleague who made a serious error — an error she partially caused by creating an environment in which he was afraid to flag his concerns. The patient recovered. Her colleague was quietly transferred. Isolde has never told anyone, and the guilt has calcified into something she carries in her chest that she has begun to mistake for the natural weight of her profession.', N'Precise, clinical, unsentimental; she uses technical terms as a default even in casual conversation and does not notice when this creates distance', N'Controlled and even — she speaks at one speed regardless of emotional state, which is its own tell', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'desta_watanabe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68d-78bc-91fa-ca149b549d6f', N'Aiyana Solberg', N'Aiyana', N'', N'Solberg', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 58, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, stall row near the Bronzeline tram stop, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Street food stall operator specializing in fermented protein pastes and synthetic grain bowls', N'', N'Aiyana Solberg is a broad-shouldered man whose face has been carved into a topographic map of a hard life — deep creases around the eyes, a nose that was broken twice and never properly reset, earlobes stretched by old gauge piercings long since abandoned. His skin is a warm dark brown, and he moves with the unhurried gravity of someone who has learned that rushing accomplishes nothing in a market that opens before dawn and closes after midnight. His left forearm bears a faded Oxidian Market vendors guild tattoo, and above his cooking station he has mounted a small copper shrine to Ε-7, an E.L.F. he swears protects the fermentation cultures he started eighteen years ago. He talks to it every morning before lighting his burners.

He is not a warm man exactly, but he is a fair one. Regular customers get a finger-width more paste. New customers get the same measured scoop and a look that assesses whether they''re the kind of person who tips or the kind who complains. He remembers faces better than names, has strong opinions about spice ratios, and will argue with you for ten minutes about fermentation temperature as genuine joy. What looks like stubbornness is mostly just accumulated certainty — he has been doing this exact thing since he was forty and knows it better than most people know anything.', N'Local color and neighborhood anchor — he knows everyone who passes through the Oxidian Market by sight. Useful as an information source about who''s been around, what''s changed, and who''s been asking questions. Can serve as a low-key quest giver if something threatens his stall or his regulars.', N'', N'Thermal palm implant in right hand for temperature-sensing fermentation cultures. No cosmetic mods — he considers them frivolous spending.', N'Arrives at his stall at 04:30 to tend fermentation vats and prep the day''s grain base; works until the last customer leaves, usually around 22:00, then counts receipts and argues with his shrine.', N'Aiyana Solberg, 183cm tall, broad-shouldered laborer in her 60s, warm deep bronze skin with olive undertones reflecting mixed Northern European, Indigenous American, African, and Asian heritage. Defined cheekbones, almond-shaped dark brown eyes yellowed from decades of market work, weathered face deeply lined from steam exposure. Short iron-gray hair swept back. Wearing cream heat-resistant canvas apron stained with fermentation residue over dark synthetic shirt, cargo pants, worn fake-leather slip-ons. Faded oxide-red guild tattoo on left forearm, scar tissue on nose bridge, stretched earlobes, thermal implant circuitry faintly visible on right palm. Standing with patient posture, hands active and precise. GLMZ marketplace setting, morning light catching her thermal implant, thermal steam rising around fermentation vats, weathered and lived-in Tier 4 market vendor stall environment, gritty utilitarian aesthetic, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: Northern European (37.6%), Indigenous American (23.3%), Sub-Saharan African (17.3%), Southeast Asian (9.4%), East Asian (8.1%), Middle Eastern (4.3%). This genetic combination creates distinctive features—broad cheekbones and defined jaw from Northern European and Indigenous American ancestry, warm deep bronze skin with subtle olive undertones from African and Middle Eastern heritage, and slightly almond-shaped eye set reflecting East and Southeast Asian lineage. The integration produces a face of balanced, understated exoticism.', 183, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and thick-limbed with the solid mass of someone who has lifted heavy cooking vessels and fermentation vats for nearly two decades. Not fat, but substantial — the build of labor rather than gym work.', N'Iron gray with hints of original black', N'Cropped short, practical, swept back from forehead', N'Short', N'Dark brown with slight almond tilt from East Asian heritage, yellowed at the sclera from decades of market-stall smoke and steam', N'Warm deep bronze with olive-green undertones, the result of African and Middle Eastern heritage tempering Northern European base. Appears almost burnished from sun exposure and thermal work.', N'Heavily lined face mapped with deep creases radiating from the eyes and running from nose to mouth corners. Weathered texture from constant exposure to steam and thermal fluctuation. Broad cheekbones show Northern European and Indigenous American bone structure; defined jaw reflects African heritage. Lower face slightly wider through the cheeks—characteristic of mixed Indigenous American and sub-Saharan ancestry. Stubbled jaw, grooming practical rather than refined. Lines around eyes suggest frequent squinting in bright morning prep light.', N'Right palm displays subtle thermal implant — faint silver-lined circuitry barely visible beneath dark skin, most obvious when hand is angled in bright light. Appears as network of fine metallic threads running from wrist to fingertips. No external ports or obvious interface points.', N'Moves with deliberate economy of motion — no wasted gesture. Stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders slightly forward from decades bent over cooking stations. Walks slowly, with the patience of someone who has learned that haste causes spills. Hands are never still when thinking — constantly adjusting, measuring, gesturing with precision.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian market vendor. Wears heat-resistant canvas aprons (cream-colored, stained with fermentation residue and grain dust) over simple dark synthetic shirts. Cargo pants with reinforced pockets for scale weights and coin storage. Worn Veldskoen-style slip-ons (fake leather, comfortable for 18-hour shifts). No visible jewelry except a corroded copper band on left ring finger — a shrine token, not a wedding ring. Clothes are maintained but worn thin; no logos or corporate branding.', N'The fermentation cultures he claims are eighteen years old and irreplaceable are actually a batch he restarted six years ago after a flood killed the originals. He has never told anyone. The lie has become load-bearing to his identity.', N'Spare and functional. West African French-inflected cadence mixed with Meridian street creole. Uses food metaphors constantly, often without noticing.', N'Slow and deliberate. Never rushes a sentence. Long pauses before answering questions, as if he is tasting the answer first.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aiyana_solberg');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a724-711b-a806-ca447eba4eec', N'Aybike Sesay-Sow', N'Aybike', N'', N'Sesay-Sow', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 30, 1, N'active', N'The Spires, near Michigan Ave and Chicago Ave', N'Fixer - Sterling-Nakamura proxy', N'Tessera Corponation (mid-level fixer)', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Aybike Sesay-Sow, 172cm athletic fixer in 2226 near-future megacity setting. Deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, sharp West African and South Asian bone structure with prominent cheekbones and defined jawline. Deep brown eyes with amber warmth. Dark brown hair with auburn hints pulled back in tight crown braid, silver streaks at temples. Thin white scar running left temple to cheekbone. Tailored charcoal suit jacket over cream silk undershirt, dark trousers, black leather reinforced ankle boots. Thin platinum chain at neck, discrete tactical watch. Controlled, precise posture suggesting threat assessment training. Cool corporate elegance balanced with dangerous competence. Indoor lighting catching subtle metallic sheen on concealed left forearm plating. Calm, commanding presence. Neo-noir noir, professional fixer aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spires', N'local', N'The Spires', N'Sub-Saharan African (68.0%, primarily West African) with substantial South Asian (30.6%, Indian/Pakistani regions) ancestry and minor Northern European (1.4%) influence. A striking blend resulting in warm-toned deep brown skin with golden undertones, sharp facial architecture combining West African and South Asian bone structure, and deep brown eyes with subtle amber warmth.', 172, 62, N'Athletic and lean with defined shoulders and core; economical musculature suggesting regular physical conditioning and combat training rather than bulk.', N'Dark brown with subtle auburn undertones', N'Pulled back in a tight, professional braid wrapped around the crown; a few silver strands visible near the temples', N'Long (past shoulders when unbound)', N'Deep brown with warm amber undertones', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones, even complexion with subtle richness from South Asian heritage blending with West African ancestry', N'Sharp cheekbones with high prominence reflecting blended West African and South Asian heritage, defined jawline with subtle fullness in the lower face characteristic of South Asian ancestry, thin scar running from left temple to cheekbone (faded but visible under direct light), minimal makeup—just mascara and a neutral lip. Skin is clear and well-maintained with a natural luminosity, suggesting access to quality dermal care. Warm undertones distributed across forehead, bridge of nose, and upper cheeks.', N'None immediately obvious. Subcutaneous neural array operates behind the eyes (undetectable without scanning). Subdermal reinforcement plating along left forearm is concealed beneath tailored sleeves but occasionally visible as a subtle metallic sheen when light hits at certain angles.', N'Moves with controlled precision; economical gestures that convey authority without aggression. Stands with weight balanced, never flat-footed. Eyes track multiple vectors simultaneously—habit of someone trained in threat assessment. Speaks quietly but commands attention through cadence and tone rather than volume.', N'Tier 1-2 corporate aesthetic. Tailored charcoal suit jacket (Italian wool-synthetic blend, Sterling-Nakamura house cut) over a cream silk undershirt. Dark trousers with minimal ornamentation. Understated Φ2,400 smart-fabric belt (color-shifting nano-weave, subtle flex of wealth). Black leather ankle boots with reinforced soles (customized for urban parkour). A thin platinum chain around her neck (tasteful, barely visible). No visible jewelry except a discrete tactical watch on her wrist. Wardrobe conveys approachability while maintaining professional distance—form-fitting enough to suggest athleticism, formal enough to remind people she answers to Sterling-Nakamura.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aybike_sesay_sow');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a630-7d7b-a1dd-ca60268329f3', N'Franciszek Sengupta-Cisneros', N'Franciszek', N'', N'Sengupta-Cisneros', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 31, NULL, 23.3, 3, N'active', N'The Narrows, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Fixer - Geneware jobs', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Franciszek Sengupta-Cisneros, 171cm athletic lean figure, warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones, strong prominent cheekbones and squared jawline reflecting South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage blend. Deep black hair with rust undertones styled in tight cornrow crown fading to shaved sides. Warm brown eyes with amber striations. Thin white scar from left temple to cheekbone. Chrome-silver fingernail caps on left hand, faint bioluminescence in pupils. Wears form-fitting matte-black synth-leather jacket, graphite compression shirt, dark grey cargo pants with thigh straps, military-grade reactive boots. Wrist-mounted data terminal. Predatory stillness, purposeful economy of movement, analytical gaze. GLMZ GLMZ setting, neon-lit urban environment, moody cool lighting with accent highlights on metallic augmentations, cinematic depth, professional operative aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Predominantly South Asian (55.3%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (17.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (11.8%), Northern European (10.9%), and Southeast Asian (4.7%) ancestry—creating a striking multicontinental blend with warm medium-brown skin featuring golden and olive undertones, strong defined facial structure with prominent cheekbones characteristic of both South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, and naturally textured deep black hair with subtle rust undertones', 171, 62, N'Athletic and lean with defined musculature; carries herself with economic efficiency—every movement purposeful. Long-limbed, suggesting endurance work rather than bulk.', N'Deep black with subtle rust undertones, naturally textured', N'Worn in a high, tight cornrow crown that transitions to shaved sides; practical and distinctive', N'Medium (crown) / Shaved (sides)', N'Warm brown with faint amber striations in direct light', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones—the blended result of her predominantly South Asian heritage combined with Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic/Latin American, Northern European, and Southeast Asian ancestry. The tone carries warmth and depth from the African and Latin American components while maintaining the clarity associated with South Asian genetics.', N'Clear, unmarked face; minimal grooming beyond essential maintenance. Strong, prominent cheekbones and slightly squared jawline reflecting the convergence of South Asian structure with Sub-Saharan African bone architecture. Small scar tissue visible at left temple hairline. Facial features show balanced integration of her ancestry—warmer undertones enhanced by the Sub-Saharan African and Latin American components, while maintaining the definition characteristic of South Asian heritage.', N'None overtly visible at first glance. However, her left hand shows subtle irregularities—slightly too precise in movement, fingernails uniformly perfect chrome-silver caps suggesting subdermal enhancement. Occasional faint bioluminescent traces visible in her pupils under low light, indicating optical substrate integration.', N'Moves with predatory stillness—minimal wasted motion. Stands with weight distributed evenly, ready to shift direction. Eyes track with analytical precision. Tends to keep her hands visible and relaxed; a tell of someone who deals in dangerous work.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear: form-fitting matte-black synth-leather jacket with reinforced seams and hidden pockets. Graphite compression shirt underneath. Cargo pants in dark grey with cargo pockets and thigh straps. Worn military-grade boots with reactive soles. No logos; all clothing is functional, durable, and designed for mobility. Wears a small wrist-mounted data terminal on her right forearm.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'franciszek_sengupta_cisneros');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a673-7163-9a09-ca6f1035ff26', N'Mariposa Guerrero', N'Mariposa', N'', N'Guerrero', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 11, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Garfield Rack, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Truant message runner, the Gray Zone', N'Independent; loosely connected to Garfield Rack informal market network', N'Mariposa Guerrero is a scrawny, dark-skinned boy with close-cropped hair that he''s attempted to dye in patches — copper at the temples, greenish-black at the crown — using stolen salon gel that only half-worked. His left eye has a cracked retinal overlay from a secondhand aug he installed himself using a cracked tutorial, giving that eye a faint grid shimmer when he''s excited or scared. He wears a vest with too many pockets, each one holding something he''s convinced will be useful someday: a dead ELF token, three different brand of protein tabs, a bent stylus. He moves like a sparrow — quick, diagonal, always watching exits.

Mariposa Guerrero is relentlessly optimistic in the way only children who''ve had to practice it deliberately can be. He runs messages between market stalls, repair shops, and mid-tier residents who don''t trust the corp relay networks, collecting Φ1-2 per run. He narrates his own life in his head as if he''s a documentary subject, which makes him unexpectedly articulate about his circumstances when asked. He worships a minor ELF he calls ''Knuckle'' that he believes lives in a cracked streetlight on his corner.', N'Local color and information source — Obi knows everyone in his eight-block radius by face and habit. He can be a quest-giver (something he witnessed on a run), an entry point into the informal economy, or a moral anchor in grim storylines.', N'', N'Cracked secondhand retinal overlay (left eye only, partially functional — shows grid shimmer and partial AR tags but glitches frequently). No geneware.', N'Up before dawn to catch early market runners needing messages delivered before the corp patrols shift change; spends midday hiding in the conduit access tunnels beneath Garfield Rack doing homework from pirated school files; evenings running a second message wave and leaving data offerings at Knuckle''s streetlight.', N'GLMZ, Mariposa Guerrero, 142cm tall scrawny child with warm golden-brown skin reflecting Pan-Global heritage. Youthful sharp cheekbones, alert dark brown eyes with left eye showing cracked AR grid overlay and periodic glitches. Short black hair with copper temple patches and greenish-black crown from failed salon dye. Small burn scar on right palm, threadbare stylus calluses. Angular posture, always scanning exits. Oversized gray-brown utility salvage vest with excessive pockets over faded synthetic shirt, cargo pants with repair stitching, mismatched socks, worn sneakers with loose sole. Data-key lanyard. Gritty urban GLMZ setting, neon industrial lighting casting golden and cool shadows, neo-noir urban aesthetic, hopeful but watchful expression, motion blur suggesting constant movement, high-tech low-resource aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Complex Pan-Global ancestry with balanced contributions across multiple continents. Hispanic/Latin American heritage (31.9%) forms the foundational phenotype, enriched by significant South Asian (18.5%), Sub-Saharan African (15.6%), East Asian (14.2%), North African (12.8%), and Southeast Asian (7.0%) components. This creates a distinctive phenotype: warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones and subtle reddish warmth, facial structure combining Latin American cheekbone prominence with South Asian and East Asian eye shape characteristics, and the fine facial proportions reflecting the balanced multi-regional blend.', 142, 31, N'Scrawny and angular, all elbows and knees, with the lean musculature of a child who moves constantly. No subcutaneous fat; ribs slightly visible beneath warm brown skin.', N'Natural black with intentional copper patches at temples and greenish-black at crown from partially-failed salon gel application', N'Close-cropped with textured layers, unevenly dyed sections creating a patchy, DIY effect', N'Short', N'Left eye: dark brown with faint visible grid pattern overlay shimmer and micro-glitches; right eye: natural dark brown with characteristic East Asian epicanthic fold', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertones and subtle reddish warmth, reflecting balanced Pan-Global ancestry distribution', N'Youthful face with sharp cheekbones and defined facial structure reflecting the blend of Latin American, South Asian, and East Asian heritage. Warm golden tones across cheeks and nose bridge with subtle reddish warmth beneath the surface. Skin unmarred except for minor scrapes and dust-dirt that seems permanent. Bright, alert expression despite visible exhaustion around the eyes. Occasional grid-pattern light artifact visible in left eye when excited or frightened.', N'Left eye retinal overlay with visible cracked grid pattern and periodic AR tag glitches. Faint dark subcutaneous scarring around left temple where overlay was installed. No other visible augmentations.', N'Moves in quick, angular patterns — diagonal cuts rather than straight lines. Perpetually scanning for exits and sightlines. Feet always positioned for rapid direction changes. Sits with knees drawn up or legs folded, never fully relaxed. Speaks with hand gestures that punctuate his internal narration. Default resting expression is watchful but hopeful.', N'Oversized gray-brown utility vest with excessive pockets (Tier 4 salvage-market origin, original owner unknown), worn over faded synthetic long-sleeve shirt. Cargo pants with visible repair stitching at both knees. Mismatched socks. Worn synthetic sneakers with one loose sole. Small data-key lanyard around neck. Everything slightly too large, suggesting recent growth spurts or intentional oversizing for pocket capacity.', N'He witnessed a Tessera logistics officer accepting a bribe from a the Gray Zone gang lieutenant three weeks ago and recorded four seconds of it on his glitching retinal overlay before it crashed. He hasn''t told anyone because he doesn''t know what it''s worth yet — and he''s been asking careful questions to find out.', N'Street-clipped, mixes the Gray Zone slang with surprisingly formal documentary-style observations. Uses ''allegedly'' and ''as documented'' ironically.', N'Fast and breathless when excited, deliberate and serious when he wants to be taken seriously.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'mariposa_guerrero');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6eb-79ea-b63b-ca9df2355de6', N'Guillaume Zaragoza-Anang', N'Guillaume', N'', N'Zaragoza-Anang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 17, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, sleeps at his aunt''s flat, near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'Graffiti artist and underground filmmaker', N'No formal collective; loosely orbiting the Highland Park Autonomous Zone youth arts program Inkwell; The Lakebed Scrapers', N'Guillaume Zaragoza-Anang is all elbows and velocity — a tall, wiry teenager with dark brown skin, a close-cut fade, and his father''s Ghanaian cheekbones softened by his mother''s Bolivian jaw. He has a single cosmetic mod he saved for three months to afford: a cat tail in iridescent black that he swishes when he''s thinking and tucks carefully into his waistband when his aunt is home. His fingers are permanently stained with aerosolized pigment in colors that shift weekly. He carries a battered recording rig everywhere — a shoulder-mounted camera array he built from three broken units cannibalized at the Brightmoor Reclamation salvage markets.

Guillaume Zaragoza-Anang is the kind of talented that hasn''t yet been shaped by knowing it, which makes his work both raw and startling — he films while he sprays, combines the visual and the documentary without quite understanding that''s an unusual thing to do, and the result is a growing archive of HPAZ street art that is also an accidental ethnography of a community holding itself together. He is cocky in the way of someone who knows they''re good but hasn''t been tested, and genuinely kind in the way of someone raised by people who expected it. He is currently engaged in a low-grade obsessive competition with another writer whose tag, ''Çukur,'' keeps appearing over or beside his own work — he hasn''t decided yet if it''s a rivalry or a conversation.', N'Local color, youth perspective, mobile observer — he goes places adults can''t or won''t and records what''s there; his footage is a resource; he can draw characters into the HPAZ community or into whatever he''s currently chasing.', N'', N'Iridescent black cat tail (geneware, cosmetic); no other mods', N'School until midday (technically — attendance is irregular), works afternoons and nights on walls and filming, uploads edited cuts to underground data-shares under the handle ''TQ/HPAZ'', back before dawn when possible.', N'Guillaume Zaragoza-Anang, 185cm lean angular wiry build, rich medium-warm brown skin with golden undertones sun-darkened from outdoor work, sculpted cheekbones and broad jawline, deep brown almost-black eyes, short black fade haircut with geometric precision. Multi-continental features reflecting Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and Indigenous American ancestry. Iridescent black opalescent cat tail (40cm, living geneware) emerging from base of spine, shifting blue-green-purple in light, partially tucked into oversized paint-stained hoodie. Shoulder-mounted weathered recording camera rig (three cannibalized units, epoxy and tape construction) covered in stickers. Canvas satchel across chest. Slim cargo pants, reinforced tactical boots scuffed from climbing. Pigment-stained fingertips showing cadmium yellow and metallic silver. Faint burn scar on left forearm. Perpetual forward lean posture, fidgeting energy. Standing on urban fire escape or rooftop in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, GLMZ, neon-lit evening atmosphere with iridescent tail catching light, spray cans visible in satchel, authentic gritty street art environment, moody cool lighting with warm skin tone contrast --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Multi-continental diaspora blend: Hispanic/Latin American (32.7%), Sub-Saharan African (27.8%), Indigenous American (22.9%), Eastern European (9.4%), Northern European (7.2%). This five-way genetic convergence creates striking complexity — warm medium-brown skin with golden and subtle reddish undertones from the Latin American and Indigenous American base, deepened and enriched by Sub-Saharan African heritage. His features reflect this fusion: prominent, sculpted cheekbones with strong definition, a broad jawline showing African and Indigenous ancestry, angular structure balanced by full-featured warmth. Eyes set deep with the characteristic depth of African heritage. The overall effect is unmistakably rooted in multiple continents simultaneously.', 185, 68, N'Wiry and angular — all lean muscle and restless energy, the build of someone who climbs and runs and rarely sits still. Long limbs, sharp shoulders, minimal body fat.', N'Natural black', N'Close-cut fade with precise geometric lines, maintained weekly; no styling products, let it air-dry into clean definition', N'Short', N'Deep brown, almost black', N'Rich medium-warm brown with golden undertones and subtle reddish warmth; sun-darkened from outdoor work, showing the blended warmth of Latin American and Indigenous American heritage enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth. Uneven tanning — darker on exposed areas from consistent outdoor climbing and spray-painting work.', N'Clear skin with sparse acne scatter across upper back and shoulders from summer heat and outdoor sweating. Strong, sculpted cheekbones reflecting the multi-continental blend, balanced by a warm, broad jawline characteristic of African and Indigenous ancestry. No facial hair — maintains clean-shaven appearance. Permanent pigment staining on fingertips and cuticles in shifting colors: cadmium yellow, metallic silver, and hot pink traces beneath embedded aerosol dust.', N'Iridescent black cat tail (living geneware implant, 40cm long) emerging from base of spine, covered in fine black fur with opalescent sheen that shifts blue-green-purple in certain light; typically tucked into waistband indoors but worn loose during work. Recording rig (shoulder-mounted camera array, three cannibalized and rewired units) carried constantly — weathered, epoxy and electrical tape construction, covered in stickers and worn paint.', N'Perpetually in motion — fidgeting, shifting weight, bouncing on balls of feet. When focused on work (spraying, filming, editing), goes still with meditative intensity. Climbs and moves through three-dimensional space with practiced ease; comfortable on fire escapes, ledges, scaffolding. Tail moves in counterpoint to body language: swishing when excited or thinking, tucking when anxious. Walks with slight forward lean, as if always heading somewhere interesting.', N'Tier 4 working-class aesthetics with art-scene individualism. Oversized hoodies (paint-stained, deliberately or accidentally), slim cargo pants with deep pockets for supplies, reinforced tactical boots scuffed and weathered from climbing. Canvas satchel across chest (cannibalized courier bag, patched with fabric tape) holding spray cans, tools, backup recording media. Brightmoor reclamation puffer vest worn unzipped over hoodies. No expensive brands — salvaged, thrifted, or secondhand Highland Park market purchases. Color palette mirrors spray-paint choices — grays and blacks alternating with neon pops through thrifted windbreakers. All clothing shows work evidence: paint spatters, singe marks, climbing dust.', N'Two months ago, while filming in the drainage access corridors beneath the HPAZ, he recorded what he''s pretty sure was a Ringo corporate extraction team moving something large and organic through a route that isn''t on any map. He hasn''t uploaded it. He''s watched the raw footage seventeen times. He doesn''t know what he''s waiting for.', N'Fast slang, HPAZ youth vernacular, Twi words inherited from his father, Spanish phrases from his mother; switches registers abruptly when talking to adults he respects', N'Rapid-fire when excited; goes unusually quiet and specific when he''s being serious about the work', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'guillaume_zaragoza_anang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c0-772a-8ce9-caca8b77b7a4', N'Akoti Castañeda-Wickramasinghe', N'Akoti', N'', N'Castañeda-Wickramasinghe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, a licensed repair bay called Okonkwo-Hal''s underneath the Brewer''s Spine overpass, near Damen and Armitage', N'Independent vehicle and augmentation mechanic', N'Independent (licensed under Geartown Trades Collective); informal network of augmentation clinic dropouts and backroom surgeons', N'Akoti Castañeda-Wickramasinghe is a compact man who seems to take up more space than his dimensions suggest — something about the way he moves through a workshop, slow and total in his attention, filling the room with the gravity of his focus. His skin is deep brown-black and his face is deeply lined around the eyes from decades of squinting at small components in bad light. His left arm from the elbow down is a working prosthetic he maintains himself — a deliberately unfancy unit that he''s upgraded incrementally for thirty years, now a mismatched patchwork of components from four different manufacturers that somehow functions better than any single commercial model. He keeps a rag permanently over one shoulder that is gray-brown from such thorough use that its original color is unknowable.

He has a reputation that extends well beyond Geartown: if Akoti Castañeda-Wickramasinghe says it''s fixed, it''s fixed. If he says it can''t be fixed, you listen. He has strong opinions about corponation augmentation warranties (''designed to expire, designed to make you pay twice''), which he will share whether or not you asked. He does unlicensed aug repair at prices humans can actually afford, though he will not discuss this openly. He maintains a relationship with the E.L.F. he calls Uncle Torque, to whom he offers annotated repair logs and photographs of difficult jobs. He believes Uncle Torque has never let him misdiagnose a problem.', N'Technical expert and fixer of things (not the criminal kind — the literal kind). Source of information about the augmentation black market and corporate planned obsolescence. Gateway to the underground aug-repair community. Potential ally who can repair gear that corponations won''t touch.', N'', N'Left arm prosthetic (self-built, rebuilt continuously). Magnification implants in both eyes — old Palladian units, modified beyond their original spec. Sensory enhancement in right hand fingers for tactile diagnostics.', N'Opens the bay at 08:00; works until the job is done, which is frequently 21:00 or later. Eats two meals in the bay. Closes on the first day of every month to ''settle accounts,'' which means he spends the day alone doing maintenance on his own prosthetic and updating his repair logs.', N'Akoti Castañeda-Wickramasinghe, 168cm compact mechanic in GLMZ, medium-deep rich mahogany-bronze skin with golden-olive undertones reflecting Latin American, South Asian, and Northern European heritage. Deep brown eyes with visible geometric Palladian lens implants. Black hair salt-gray at temples, close-cropped. Heavily lined face from forty years of precision work, well-defined cheekbones, straight nose. Left arm is exposed matte-black prosthetic with titanium actuators and mismatched metal components (aluminum, gunmetal, bare steel), mechanical fingers with bare articulated joints visible. Right hand shows faint LED traces under skin at knuckles. Oil-stained gray-brown canvas work coat over thermal henley, dark tan canvas pants with worn tool-belt loops, scuffed steel-toed boots. Gray-brown work rag over left shoulder. Permanent workshop posture, shoulders slightly forward. Wiry muscled build from tool manipulation. Hands weathered with small scars and calluses, burn scar visible on right hand. Oil stain discoloration on right wrist. Standing in dim workshop lighting with overhead fluorescents casting cool shadows, concentrated expression, deliberate posture, no corpo branding visible. Mood: tired precision engineer, four decades of incremental repairs and replacements, practical tier working class. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'A striking blend of dominant Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (65.5%) with meaningful Northern European (20.0%), South Asian (12.0%), and subtle Sub-Saharan African (2.5%) contributions—a genetic mosaic reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The Latin American foundation structures his bone architecture and baseline warmth, while South Asian ancestry adds depth to his complexion and softness to his features, with Northern European elements contributing to his lighter undertones and the subtle cool cast around his eyes. Sub-Saharan African ancestry adds richness to his melanin distribution and warmth to his overall coloration.', 168, 74, N'Compact and dense, with the wiry strength of someone who''s spent forty years manipulating precision tools. Shoulders slightly rounded from workshop posture, forearms disproportionately muscled from repetitive mechanical work.', N'Black with salt-gray at temples', N'Close-cropped, minimal maintenance', N'Short', N'Deep brown (augmented with visible Palladian lens architecture)', N'Rich warm medium-deep brown—a complex blend where Latin American warmth (65.5%) creates the dominant golden-bronze foundation, enhanced by South Asian ancestry (12%) which deepens the saturation and adds subtle reddish undertones, while Sub-Saharan African genetics (2.5%) contributes warmth and richness to melanin distribution. Northern European ancestry (20%) emerges as cooler olive-bronze notes visible in shadow areas and subtle undertones around the eyes and jaw. The overall effect is a sophisticated, weathered mahogany-bronze complexion deepened by four decades of workshop exposure.', N'Deeply lined around eyes and mouth; permanent squint-creases from thirty years of close-focus work in inadequate light. Facial structure displays moderate, well-defined cheekbones characteristic of Latin American heritage, refined by South Asian genetic influence that softens the eye shape and adds subtle definition to the jawline. The nose bridge is straight and proportionate. The interplay of ancestry creates a face with balanced proportions—neither sharp nor rounded, with warm-toned skin that shows the rich depth of his blended heritage. Thin white scars across knuckles and fingers from small cuts and minor burns. Calloused palms and fingertips. Sparse facial hair, salt-and-pepper stubble often present.', N'Left arm from elbow down is a visibly working prosthetic: matte-black composite frame with exposed titanium actuators, mismatched metallic sections (brushed aluminum, gunmetal, bare steel) showing four decades of incremental component replacements. Fingers move with mechanical precision but lack synthetic skin — bare articulated joints visible. Lens implants in both eyes are subtly visible as a faint geometric precision to the iris boundary, older Palladian tech with barely perceptible alignment markers. Right hand fingers show minor LED indicator traces under the skin at the first knuckle — sensory diagnostic enhancement.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness even in urgent situations — a man who prioritizes precision over speed. Shoulders angled slightly forward in permanent workshop posture. His left arm hangs at a slightly different angle than natural, and he compensates with unconscious micro-adjustments to his gait. Left hand movements are controlled and economical, never wasted. Right hand gestures frequently, compensating as his dominant hand.', N'Tier 3-4 working practical: heavy canvas work coat (gray-brown, oil-stained, pockets worn soft from tools), usually unbuttoned. Underneath, simple long-sleeve thermal shirt or worn cotton henley. Work pants in dark tan canvas with tool-belt loops, pockets enlarged and re-sewn multiple times. Steel-toed boots (scuffed, re-soled twice, perfectly maintained). The rag permanently over his left shoulder is woven gray-brown — original color indeterminate from use. No jewelry. No visible corpo branding or tier indicators.', N'His prosthetic arm conceals a data-store he has been filling for twenty years: complete technical schematics for how to build, maintain, and modify every major corponation augmentation from scratch, without proprietary parts. He has told no one it exists. He hasn''t decided what to do with it.', N'Technical and precise; uses medical and engineering terminology interchangeably; old-fashioned phrasing that feels like it comes from an earlier era of the city', N'Measured, unhurried, with the rhythm of someone who thinks before every sentence', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'akoti_casta_eda_wickramasinghe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('db87a3b1-0b3d-6c2f-c18f-cb31cd01e21f', N'Aroha Zhukov-Wiredu', N'Aroha', N'', N'Zhukov-Wiredu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A spartan apartment above a gym in Steamvent Alley — nothing on the walls, nothing personal, packed bag always by the door', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — operates on retainer for three Tier 2-3 firms who need fieldwork done', N'Aroha Zhukov-Wiredu was a military tracker for Sterling-Nakamura''s urban warfare division before going freelance. In the military she tracked deserters, infiltrators, and enemy combatants through the most hostile urban environments on the planet. In civilian life she tracks fugitives, missing persons, and anyone who doesn''t want to be found — and she finds them, because in twenty years of tracking she has never lost a quarry.

Her method is relentlessly physical. She operates below the digital layer entirely, reading the city the way a forest tracker reads the woods — broken stems become scuff marks, animal tracks become footprints, disturbed earth becomes moved debris. She can determine how long ago someone passed through a corridor by the rate at which dust has resettled. She can estimate a target''s physical condition by the depth and spacing of their footprints. She can predict where someone will go based on the urban terrain the way a hunter predicts where an animal will drink.

She is a blunt instrument in a world that increasingly values digital sophistication, and she doesn''t care. Her clients hire her when the target has gone analog — when they''ve ditched their BCI, abandoned their digital identity, and disappeared into the physical city. Other investigators stop at that point. Aroha starts. She will follow a target until one of them collapses, and it''s never her.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aroha_zhukov_wiredu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65c-724c-8d67-cb9d9380c6a6', N'Basma Kamara-Park', N'Basma', N'', N'Kamara-Park', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 83, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Avalon Quiet, the Foundry Rest, Unit 9 (a former union hall converted to senior housing), near Lincoln and Addison', N'Retired union leader, former Dearborn Forge machine workers'' organizer', N'Meridian Manufacturing Workers'' Alliance (MMWA) — emeritus; Dearborn Forge Retirees Collective; loosely, the Avalon Quiet community council', N'Basma Kamara-Park is a person of considerable physical presence despite their age — still broad through the shoulders, hands that are visibly enlarged by decades of machine work and two decades of chrome reinforcement, skin the color of dark river clay mapped with old hydraulic burns along both forearms. They have a full beard, silver-white, kept long and braided with small steel hex-nuts — not decoration but notation: each nut represents a contract won. There are thirty-one of them. Their eyes are deep-set under heavy brows and have been modified with retinal overlays that display scrolling text when they are reading union documents, which is often. They move slowly but without any suggestion that the slowness is weakness.

Basma Kamara-Park organized workers at Dearborn Forge for forty-one years, starting as a floor welder and ending as the most recognizable union figure in GLMZ''s manufacturing sector. They retired at seventy-eight when their heart required a significant reconstruction, and they have spent the five years since refusing to actually retire in any functional sense — still advising, still reviewing contracts, still showing up to shop-floor solidarity actions in a mobility assist suit they make no attempt to hide. They are living legend to people who know the labor history and an incomprehensible relic to people who don''t, and they genuinely do not care which category any given person falls into. They are here and they are working.', N'Labor history resource and moral authority figure; can provide context on manufacturing sector politics, corporate-union conflicts, and the history of working conditions at every major Meridian facility. Quest giver for labor-related plots; also a portrait of what it looks like to build collective power in a corporate city.', N'', N'Chrome-reinforced hand and forearm skeletal structure (bilateral, industrial-grade, installed 2163 as workplace accommodation); cardiac reconstruction mesh (installed 2195, heart failure); retinal overlay implants (both eyes, union contract review overlay, installed 2171); mobility assist exo-suit (external, worn daily, configured to look like clothing when possible)', N'Rises late, reads labor news and pension legislation for two hours, then takes calls and visits from current union members seeking advice. They attend every MMWA meeting they can reach regardless of weather or difficulty and have been known to appear at shop-floor actions by mobility-suited transit when younger organizers told them it was not necessary. They maintain a shrine to the ELF they believe inhabits the Foundry Rest''s building systems — an old machine union ELF they call Strojna, leaving it small machine components as offerings.', N'Basma Kamara-Park, 50-year-old industrial union organizer, deep warm mahogany-brown skin with terracotta and amber undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, Indigenous American, and Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Prominent East Asian cheekbones contrast with Sub-Saharan fullness; deep-set dark brown eyes modified with amber retinal implants. Full silver-white beard braided with thirty-one steel hex-nuts, extending to mid-chest. Broad muscular shoulders and thick chest, legs slightly atrophied. Chrome-reinforced hands and forearms with visible metallic caps at wrists and chrome striating. Bilateral hydraulic burn scars on forearms. Wears gunmetal gray and matte black external mobility assist exo-suit over worn union denim shirt and heavy canvas pants. Union pin (2154) on collar, steel wedding band, copper wire bracelet. Weathered face bearing five decades of shop-floor work. Seated in deliberate posture, leaning slightly forward, hands folded across chest. GLMZ GLMZ industrial setting, fluorescent workshop lighting with warm amber glow reflecting off chrome augmentations, union workspace background. Photorealistic, dignified, direct eye contact. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Avalon Quiet', N'local', N'Avalon Quiet', N'Sub-Saharan African (37.1%), East Asian (32.1%), Indigenous American (23.6%), and Hispanic/Latin American (7.2%) ancestry creates a distinctive phenotype: Sub-Saharan African foundation provides facial fullness, lip definition, and warm undertone base; East Asian ancestry contributes prominent cheekbones, eye shape epicanthic fold tendency, and structural geometry; Indigenous American heritage adds warm terracotta and amber skin depth; Hispanic/Latin American admixture enhances warm golden undertones throughout. The result is a unified warm-brown complexion with mahogany-to-copper richness rather than equal-measure blend.', 178, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and thick-chested despite age; considerable mass concentrated in torso and upper body from five decades of welding and machine work. Legs slightly atrophied from reliance on mobility assist, but arms remain visibly muscular beneath loose skin.', N'Silver-white', N'Full, braided beard with thirty-one small steel hex-nuts woven throughout; each nut represents a won contract from their organizing years', N'Long (beard extends to mid-chest)', N'Deep brown, modified with subtle retinal overlay implants that display scrolling text during reading', N'Warm deep brown with mahogany-to-aged-copper richness; dominant Sub-Saharan warmth layered with East Asian undertone clarity and Indigenous American terracotta-amber depth. Significant weathering visible across face and neck from five decades of industrial work and age.', N'Blended facial structure: Sub-Saharan African fullness in lips and cheek prominence combined with East Asian high cheekbone definition and characteristic eye shape; Indigenous American warmth throughout complexion creating golden-amber undertones in skin. Deep-set eyes beneath pronounced brows; face bears character of decades of shop-floor work. Hydraulic burns visible along both forearms as darker, scarred patches. Hands visibly enlarged from machine work and chrome reinforcement.', N'Chrome-reinforced hands and forearms (industrial-grade, visible at wrists as smooth metallic caps and along forearm musculature as subtle chrome striating); external mobility assist exo-suit worn daily (configured to resemble heavy tactical clothing, gunmetal gray and worn matte black, fitted over shoulders and spine); retinal implants barely visible as slight amber luminescence in deep-set eyes when active', N'Moves deliberately and without hurry; the slowness is intentional and carries weight rather than frailty. Stands with a slight forward lean supported by the exo-suit. Hands often remain in lap or folded across chest when seated. Makes direct eye contact without apology. Voice is steady but deepened by age and cardiac reconstruction.', N'Tier 3 working-class aesthetic, deliberately maintained as such despite pension stability. Favors worn denim work shirts (often union-logoed), heavy canvas pants, and sturdy boots suitable for shop floors. Exo-suit worn visibly over clothing rather than concealed. A battered union pin from 2154 is always affixed to collar. Wears a simple steel wedding band and a copper wire bracelet twisted by hand (claimed to communicate with building ELF systems, though likely symbolic).', N'In 2178, during a critical contract negotiation that Miroljub is credited with winning, they accepted a private meeting with a Ringo Corporation intermediary who offered to weaken a competitor''s position in exchange for a specific carve-out in the MMWA''s medical coverage terms. Miroljub refused the carve-out but did not report the approach — and used the intelligence the intermediary accidentally revealed about the competitor to win the contract. The win was real. The method had a shadow in it that they have never discussed.', N'Floor-worker vernacular mixed with the formal register of contract language — they can shift between them in a single sentence; uses collective pronouns instinctively (''we fought for this''; ''they took that from us''); Serbian-Ghanaian cadences in the rhythm of long sentences', N'Builds slowly and then arrives with full weight; they are not hurrying for anyone', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'basma_kamara_park');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d6-7249-8bd4-cba1290a62b3', N'Aleli Tovar', N'Aleli', N'', N'Tovar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, Stall 44 — Solène''s Edgework, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Barber and hair sculptor', N'Independent, Burnished Market vendor collective', N'Aleli Tovar is a compact, precise woman with light brown skin, a shaved head that she freshens every third day with geometric razor work along the sides, and a galaxy of tiny bioluminescent freckles across her cheeks and nose that pulse faintly blue-white when she laughs. Her fingers are extraordinary — long, quick, and steady — and she keeps her nails cut short and lacquered black. She has a cat tail, rust-red and white, that she got at seventeen because she liked the way it communicated mood without her having to talk; it swishes with professional concentration and lashes with irritation. Her stall in the Burnished Market is barely four meters of booth but she''s made it immaculate: folded black draping, a cracked leather chair she reupholstered herself, and a wall-mounted grid of reference images that she updates weekly.

Aleli Tovar is young but operates with the confidence of someone who decided early that her craft was her authority. She''s playful and gossipy with clients she likes, and scrupulously professional with ones she doesn''t — nobody gets a bad cut because she dislikes you, but she won''t make conversation either. She has strong opinions about everything from corponation aesthetics colonizing street culture to the correct way to pray to a data E.L.F., and she expresses these opinions freely while her hands are in your hair, knowing you can''t really leave.', N'Social information nexus — she hears everything from a cross-section of Burnished Market society; local color; source of neighborhood gossip; can provide a cover identity through physical transformation.', N'', N'Geneware: bioluminescent freckle underlays (blue-white), rust-and-white cat tail. No functional augmentations — she''s philosophically opposed to anything that might affect her hand sensitivity.', N'Sets up her stall at the Burnished Market by 09:00, works a full book of appointments until 19:00, then spends an hour doing deliberate practice on mannequin heads before packing down.', N'Aleli Tovar, compact 158cm figure, freshly shaved scalp with geometric razor patterns, warm deep golden-bronze skin with honeyed undertones, bright amber-brown eyes. Southeast Asian-Hispanic-Sub-Saharan African mixed heritage with refined Northern European bone structure, defined jawline. Bioluminescent blue-white freckle implants across cheeks pulsing softly. Rust-red and white feline geneware tail 60cm long, expressive and alert. Black fitted utility pants, form-fitting black long-sleeve shirt, tailored charcoal vest with worn leather apron. Matte black nails, silver ring, brass cuff. Alert precise posture, hands in subtle motion, economical movement. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, low warm lighting casting shadows across defined features, neon blue accent from freckle bioluminescence, gritty urban workshop setting, focused and intense expression --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Complex global admixture with Southeast Asian (28.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (26.0%), and Sub-Saharan African (20.0%) as primary ancestry, balanced by Northern European (16.4%), Indigenous American (5.2%), and South Asian (3.7%) contributions. This creates striking phenotypic diversity: warm deep golden-bronze skin with honeyed and burgundy undertones from the Southeast Asian-Hispanic-South Asian blend, enriched by Sub-Saharan African warmth and dimensional complexity, refined by Northern European bone structure, and grounded by Indigenous American and South Asian features. The result is luminous, dimensional skin that shifts across warm and cool undertones.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry with defined forearms and shoulders from precise, repetitive work. No excess mass — everything functional. Moves with economical grace.', N'None — shaved', N'Freshly shaved scalp with geometric razor-work patterns along the sides and back, updated every third day. Clean lines, deliberate asymmetry.', N'Shaved', N'Deep warm brown with subtle amber undertones — characteristic of the Southeast Asian, Hispanic, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry blend', N'Warm deep golden-bronze with honeyed and burgundy undertones across cheekbones and jawline. The complexion reflects the Southeast Asian-Hispanic-Sub-Saharan African tri-ancestry dominance, creating luminous warmth with dimensional depth that intensifies along the jawline and temples.', N'Clear and well-maintained with fine-featured face architecture showing the influence of Southeast Asian bone structure balanced with Hispanic facial proportions, Sub-Saharan African fullness, Northern European refinement, and subtle South Asian high cheekbones. Scattered across cheeks and nose bridge are bioluminescent freckle implants that pulse faintly blue-white, particularly visible when she laughs or concentrates. Defined jawline with soft angles. Nails lacquered matte black, kept short and precise.', N'Rust-red and white cat tail (feline geneware, approximately 60cm, expressive — swishes with concentration, lashes with irritation). Bioluminescent freckle underlays (blue-white, emotive). No functional augmentations visible.', N'Alert, precise posture with minimal wasted motion. Stands with slight forward lean when working. Hands are constantly in subtle motion — fingers flex and curl habitually. Tail moves independently, reflecting emotional state more honestly than her expression. Walks with economic efficiency.', N'Tier 3-4 working aesthetic. Black fitted utility pants with cargo pockets (keeps tools, supplies, cash). Dark fitted long-sleeve shirts or form-fitting black tees under a tailored charcoal vest with interior pockets. Worn leather apron during work shifts, well-maintained but deliberately scarred from years of use. No corporate logos. Minimalist jewelry — a simple silver ring on her right ring finger, small brass cuff on left wrist. Practicality over aesthetics, but everything chosen with intention.', N'Six months ago she gave a very specific haircut to a client who paid double and asked her not to log the appointment. Two weeks later she saw the same haircut on a wanted-data broadcast. She kept the money, told no one, and has been waiting for consequences ever since.', N'Quick, layered, market vernacular with French-inflected Ghanaian cadences from her grandmother''s speech patterns; trades between warm teasing and sharp critique without warning', N'Fast when excited, pointed slow when making a judgment', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aleli_tovar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d0-77c1-b181-cbbf2ba3361b', N'Anatoliy Boateng', N'Anatoliy', N'', N'Boateng', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 16, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Stockyard, Iron Bend, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'gang prospect and lookout, Tier 1', N'Iron Bend Substrates (prospect, junior tier)', N'Anatoliy Boateng is built like he was designed for a different neighborhood and ended up here — broad through the shoulders for his age, with his Ghanaian grandfather''s deep-set eyes and his Belarusian grandmother''s unexpectedly sharp nose, and skin the color of dark polished teak. He has retractable claw mods on his right hand, cheap gray-market work that catches and sticks sometimes and leaves small gouges in every surface he rests his fingers on. His left ear has a long cosmetic antenna mod — a thin chrome filament that curves up past the ear''s edge — which he got because the Iron Bend crew''s older members have them and he wanted in on the aesthetic before he was officially in anything.

He is a prospect for the Iron Bend Substrates, a mid-tier territorial crew operating in The Stockyard''s lower warehouse district. He runs lookout and does small-package relay, technically a step below full prospect status but he won''t admit that to anyone. He is loudly confident in a way that reads differently depending on who''s listening — to younger kids it sounds like authority, to the older crew members it sounds like a boy who hasn''t been hurt enough yet to know what he doesn''t know. He is not stupid. He is seventeen months from figuring that out.', N'Represents the adolescent pipeline into gang structure; his position as a prospect-not-quite-prospect makes him vulnerable to being used as a disposable asset; he can be a warning, a cautionary arc, or an unlikely ally depending on the story; his loud mouth makes him a good information leak', N'', N'Gray-market retractable claw mod, right hand (4 claws, chrome-alloy, sticky mechanism); cosmetic chrome antenna filament, left ear', N'No formal schooling. Wakes late, spends mornings at the crew''s informal gathering point near the Stockyard loading bays, picks up lookout shifts in the afternoon and evening, spends nights at whatever unit is hosting the crew that night — rarely the same place twice.', N'Anatoliy Boateng, 16-year-old mixed heritage male (Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, Southeast Asian blend) with warm rich golden-brown skin tone, deep brown eyes set deep in angular face with broad nose, small acne scars on jawline and faint 3cm scar on right cheekbone. Short black hair with warm undertones, utilitarian cut. Lean-muscled 178cm frame with broad shoulders. Wearing fitted black synthetic long-sleeve shirt, charcoal carbon-weave tactical pants, grey canvas work boots with mismatched laces (one chrome, one black). Retractable chrome claw mechanism on right hand (4 digits with visible wear), thin chrome antenna curving from left ear. Cheap chrome chain on left wrist. Forward-leaning confident posture, hand resting with fingers slightly curled. Neon-lit urban neo-noir environment, Tier 4 street setting, gang prospect aesthetic, moody atmospheric lighting catching the chrome augmentations --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Stockyard', N'local', N'The Stockyard', N'Sub-Saharan African (45.4%) with Northern European (33.8%) and Southeast Asian (20.8%) ancestry — a striking diaspora blend. The Sub-Saharan component provides rich melanin, broad facial structure, and warm undertones. Northern European ancestry adds angular cheekbones and deep-set eye sockets. Southeast Asian heritage contributes subtle facial refinement and slightly softer contours to balance the broader African and sharper European features.', 178, 72, N'Broad-shouldered and lean-muscled, already filling into a heavier frame — the build of someone who will be imposing in five years but still reads as young now. No excess weight; functional muscle from unstructured physical activity.', N'Black with warm undertones', N'Kept short and tight, probably cut with clippers every two weeks at a Tier 4 shop. No styling product — utilitarian.', N'Short', N'Deep brown, set deeply in the skull', N'Warm rich brown complexion with golden undertones — the balanced blend of Sub-Saharan African warmth, Northern European coolness, and Southeast Asian luminosity creating an even, polished appearance', N'Clear skin with the kind of texture that shows every scar and mark. The mixed heritage creates slightly angular cheekbones with a broad nose structure; deep-set eyes create a face that looks older than sixteen when serious. Small acne scars on his jawline. A faint scar on his right cheekbone from a childhood accident.', N'Retractable chrome-alloy claw mechanism on right hand (4 digits, visible as thin metallic lines along knuckles and fingertips when retracted; fully extended claws are 4-5cm and show obvious wear and slight misalignment). Thin chrome filament antenna curving upward from the upper cartilage of left ear, extending approximately 8cm past the ear''s edge with a slight graceful curve — cosmetic work, catches light when he moves his head.', N'Stands with his weight forward slightly, shoulders back in a way that reads as confidence or aggression depending on context. Moves quickly and with purpose, minimal wasted motion. His right hand often rests with fingers slightly curled to conceal the claw mechanism''s edges. Frequently touches his ear antenna unconsciously — a nervous tell that contradicts his surface confidence.', N'Tier 1 gang prospect aesthetic: slim-fit carbon-weave tactical pants in charcoal with reinforced pockets (likely Zhong-made, second-season), a fitted black synthetic long-sleeve that shows off his shoulder breadth, no jacket because he''s still in that age where he thinks toughness means wearing less. Worn-in grey canvas work boots with mismatched laces (one chrome, one black cord). No visible gang colors yet — that''s a privilege for full members. Cheap chrome chain around his left wrist, probably Φ40-60 from a Tier 4 market stall.', N'He has been offered a secondary arrangement by a Tessera mid-level logistics operative — small intelligence about Substrate movements in exchange for modest Quanta. He has not taken it yet. He thinks about it every three days.', N'Dense with Iron Bend street register, Stockyard slang, performative profanity that peaks when he''s nervous', N'Fast and overlapping, often interrupts himself to revise mid-sentence toward something that sounds better', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anatoliy_boateng');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a726-740b-b6c2-cbcbdfecad34', N'Gilberto Boateng-Raghavan-Banerjee', N'Gilberto', N'', N'Boateng-Raghavan-Banerjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, operating out of a converted water-treatment sub-level called the Hollow, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Street midwife and unlicensed obstetric surgeon', N'Independent; informal alliance with the Narrows Community Health Cooperative', N'Gilberto Boateng-Raghavan-Banerjee is a broad-shouldered woman whose presence seems to compress a room — not through aggression but through sheer settled weight, as if she has been in every difficult place and come back. Her skin is very dark and very lined, and she wears her silver hair close-cropped. A bioluminescent stripe runs from her left collarbone to her wrist, deep amber, pulsing faintly when she is calm, quickening when she is alarmed — a medical mod she had fitted thirty years ago to help patients read her state during labor. Her hands are her most remarkable feature: large, scarred, absolutely steady. She smells faintly of antiseptic cedar and something older, herbal.

She does not waste words, but she is not cold. She asks exactly the right questions and listens to the answers in a way that makes people feel surveyed and also seen. She has delivered roughly four thousand infants in the Narrows and the neighboring warrens, has performed illegal gene-therapy corrections on fetuses whose parents could not afford Helix Biosystems, and has buried children she could not save. She prays to the E.L.F. that inhabits her autoclave every morning, leaving a data-offering of patient vitals from the previous week. She does not explain this to anyone who has not asked.', N'Quest giver, moral anchor, local knowledge repository, safe-harbor NPC; the person in the Narrows who knows whose baby belongs to which father and which corporate exec has an illegitimate child in the warrens', N'', N'Bioluminescent subdermal stripe (diagnostic mood indicator, amber); haptic-feedback fingertip sensors for fetal positioning; basic retinal overlay for vitals reading; no cosmetic mods', N'She is awake before the Narrows wakes, checking on post-partum patients, sterilizing instruments, reviewing the week''s supply shortages. Evenings she teaches unlicensed obstetrics to apprentices in the back room over cheap protein noodles.', N'Gilberto Boateng-Raghavan-Banerjee, 172cm tall, deep rich brown skin with warm amber undertones, silver-gray close-cropped hair, deeply lined map-worn face with high defined cheekbones and deep brown eyes with faint retinal shimmer. Short-sleeved dark charcoal linen reveals bioluminescent amber subdermal stripe pulsing down left arm from collarbone to wrist, ritual scars on left shoulder blade. Faded indigo overshirt with instrument pockets, worn canvas boots. Hands scarred from decades of surgical work, moving with mechanical precision. Slow economical posture, shoulders forward in listening position. Sub-level humid medical facility lighting, warm overhead glow catching the amber bioluminescence and facial weathering. Smell of cedar antiseptic and cardamom lingers. GLMZ, GLMZ, worn practical tier 3-4 aesthetic, no chrome, introspective clinical mood. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Sub-Saharan African (59.7%) with South Asian (31.3%) and Southeast Asian (9.0%) heritage, creating a rich deep brown complexion with subtle feature blending across three continents. The dominant African ancestry provides warm undertones and strong bone structure, while South Asian heritage adds definition to cheekbones and subtle warmth to skin, with Southeast Asian ancestry contributing delicate refinement to facial proportions.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial, with a compact density that speaks to decades of standing through labors. Not fat — muscled underneath, the kind of weight that comes from carrying bodies and responsibility. Her center of gravity is low, rooted.', N'Silver-gray, natural with no dye', N'Close-cropped, neat, practical — no styling, just maintenance', N'Short', N'Deep brown with a faint retinal overlay shimmer visible in certain light angles (diagnostic vitals readout)', N'Rich deep brown with warm amber undertones from dominant Sub-Saharan African ancestry, enhanced by South Asian warmth and Southeast Asian refinement creating luminous depth', N'Deeply lined face that reads as a map of attention — forehead creases from concentration, laugh lines around her eyes, thin mouth set in habitual listening. Skin is clear but weathered with warm luminous undertone and the texture of someone who has worked in humid sub-levels for decades. High, defined cheekbones reflecting Sub-Saharan and South Asian ancestry with subtle refinement from Southeast Asian heritage. No makeup. A few age spots on her temples.', N'The bioluminescent stripe is the only immediately visible augmentation. At close range, a faint shimmer in her pupils suggests the retinal overlay. Her fingers move with mechanical precision when she''s examining — haptic feedback sensors are invisible but her hand-steadiness is uncanny. No chrome, no external hardware.', N'She moves slowly and economically, with a settled heaviness that suggests she is never in a hurry. Her shoulders are always slightly forward, as if she is leaning into listening. When she walks, her weight falls through her heels first — grounded, deliberate. She touches things (instruments, patients, doorframes) with a kind of confirmation, making sure they are real. Her hands are almost never still — checking, adjusting, feeling.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: loose dark clothing (charcoal or black linen) that breathes in the humid Hollow, reinforced at seams. A long unbuttoned overshirt in faded indigo that carries instrument pockets and is stained faintly with antiseptic and old stains she stopped trying to get out. Worn canvas boots with good grip for wet sub-level floors. A thin cord necklace with two objects: a small brass compass and a data-chip (the weekly patient vitals offering). No jewelry beyond function. Everything worn soft from use, nothing new. She smells of cedar antiseptic and dried herbs (cardamom, sage).', N'Eighteen years ago she falsified the cause of death on a neonate''s record to protect the infant''s mother from a violent partner — and the falsified record was later used by that same partner to claim a life insurance payout she did not know existed. She has never told anyone.', N'Plain, precise, medical when necessary but never jargon-for-jargon''s-sake; old-fashioned idioms from her grandmother''s generation mixed in', N'Slow and deliberate; pauses before important statements as if weighing them', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gilberto_boateng_raghavan_banerjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6fe-77f7-ac86-cbf18cde8dbe', N'Ashvin Amrani-Halverson', N'Ashvin', N'', N'Amrani-Halverson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 22, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, running between Chatham Flats and Grand Crossing Gate, near Ashland and Division', N'bookmaker and numbers runner', N'Chatham Flats syndicate (numbers runner, salaried), independent secondary book (unsanctioned)', N'Ashvin Amrani-Halverson is young in a way that still surprises people when they see the operation he runs — twenty-two with the face of someone seventeen if he''s relaxed and thirty if he''s working, a long-limbed Igbo-Greek-Hungarian mix with deep brown skin, an expressive mouth that defaults to a salesperson''s easy grin, and eyes that are doing financial calculations behind whatever expression he''s performing. He keeps his hair grown out into a soft cloud that he touches when thinking, and he has purely cosmetic cat ears in deep amber — a mod he got at sixteen and still maintains because they genuinely help him gauge crowd mood at events (they swivel toward sound, a secondary function the modder threw in for free). He dresses up — always, even when it''s unnecessary, because he understood early that clothes are information.

Ashvin Amrani-Halverson runs numbers for the Chatham Flats syndicate and manages his own secondary book on the side, a fact the syndicate suspects but hasn''t confirmed. He is fast — fast with numbers, fast with people, fast with exits — and he has the particular gift of making everyone feel like his most valued client while simultaneously extracting the maximum from them. He is not cynical about this; he genuinely likes people, the way a card player likes cards. He is also genuinely frightened, most of the time, because he is twenty-two and running credit for people who will break his hands if the math goes wrong, and the math going wrong is always one bad fight result away.', N'Information source (knows who owes who across the Narrows criminal economy), local color, potential quest giver when his secondary book gets him in trouble, comic-tragic figure of young ambition overreaching', N'', N'Cosmetic cat ears (amber, sound-swivel enabled), subdermal quick-calc implant for rapid probability calculation, retinal display overlay for live odds management', N'Spends mornings collecting prior-day settlements and making payouts across a circuit of Chatham Flats to Grand Crossing Gate; afternoons taking new action; evenings at whatever venue has the highest-traffic betting event — fights, racing, corporate sports feeds.', N'Ashvin Amrani-Halverson, 183cm tall lean neo-noir figure with warm medium-deep brown skin with honey-amber undertones, soft Southeast Asian facial geometry balanced with sharp North African jawline definition, expressive deep brown eyes with faint retinal display shimmer, natural dark brown voluminous cloud hair with reddish undertone. Articulated amber cat ears mounted at temples, sound-reactive and swiveling. Wearing tailored smart-fabric shirt with subtle iridescence, charcoal synthlinen slacks, vintage early-2200s leather blazer, pristine black synth-leather runners, mixed-metal chain bracelet. Fidgeting posture with nervous energy, fingers making rapid counting gestures, boyish open expression. Chatham Flats setting, neon-lit urban environment, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody evening lighting with accent light catching iridescent details and cat ear articulation, confident young hacker aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Kaleidoscopic diaspora blend: Southeast Asian (34.6%) forms the foundational phenotype with soft facial geometry and warm undertones; North African (24.1%) adds sharp definition to the jawline and prominent cheekbone structure; Hispanic/Latin American (22.3%) contributes golden warmth and luminosity throughout the complexion; Northern European (19.0%) provides fine-featured balance and lighter undertones that create subtle complexity in skin depth. The result is a warm medium-to-deep brown with honey-to-amber shifts depending on light — a truly global phenotype that reads as ''everywhere and nowhere'' simultaneously.', 183, 68, N'Long-limbed and lean with minimal muscle definition; the physique of someone who moves constantly but doesn''t lift — all angles and nervous energy, built for speed and slipping through crowds rather than standing ground', N'Natural dark brown with slight reddish undertone', N'Soft, voluminous natural cloud; kept deliberately untamed, often touched unconsciously when concentrating or calculating', N'Medium (8-10cm when fully grown out)', N'Deep brown with faint retinal display overlay visible as subtle iridescent shimmer in bright light', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with honey-to-amber undertones; the luminous complexion shifts subtly with light angle, reflecting the sophisticated blend of Southeast Asian base, North African definition, Latin warmth, and Northern European fine detailing', N'Youthful face with balanced structure — soft cheekbone geometry (Southeast Asian influence) counterbalanced by sharp, defined jawline (North African and Latin heritage); fine features with slight width through the face (Northern European trace); expressive mouth and bright, calculating eyes; skin clear and well-maintained; a softness around the eyes that contradicts the calculating sharpness behind them when working', N'Amber cat ears are immediately obvious and intentional; retinal display overlay only visible in certain lighting angles as a faint iridescent flicker. The subdermal quick-calc implant is completely invisible.', N'Constantly in motion — fidgeting, weight shifting, fingers moving through rapid counting gestures even when empty-handed. When relaxed, he appears seventeen: slouched, open-faced, boyish. When working, his spine straightens, his expression hardens into focused calculation, and he appears five to ten years older. His movements are fluid and economical; he never wastes motion but creates the impression of casual ease.', N'High-tier Chatham Flats casual: tailored but not formal. Recent Φ2,400-3,200 investment pieces — smart-fabric shirts that shift subtle iridescence, fitted synthlinen slacks in charcoal or deep blue, vintage leather blazers from early-2200s stock (a status marker in the Narrows). Always wears a chain bracelet of mixed metals (gold, silver, chrome) — a gift from his first major score, never removed. Shoes are always pristine: current rotation is high-end synth-leather street runners in black or deep gray. The overall effect is carefully curated to signal: young, successful, trustworthy, and smart enough to know how much to spend without looking desperate.', N'He has been quietly skimming the Chatham syndicate''s book by fractional rounding errors — fractions too small to notice individually, substantial over volume — and has accumulated nearly Φ4,000 in a hidden account he intends to use as seed money to go independent', N'quick and street-inflected, numerical metaphors everywhere, mixes Igbo terms of address with Greek exclamations he picked up from his yiayia', N'fast, overlapping itself, ideas arriving faster than sentences can contain them', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ashvin_amrani_halverson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a733-7bc1-a4b8-cbf2a314c209', N'Fayza Zielinski', N'Fayza', N'', N'Zielinski', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 32, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Laceworks, Lakeview Neon, near Clark and Belmont', N'Clothing and fashion vendor, bespoke modifications and wearable tech integration', N'Independent; active member of the Laceworks Artisan Cooperative; known to the Lakeview Neon creative community; materials relationship with a Helix Biosystems-adjacent biomaterials dealer they are trying not to be dependent on', N'Fayza Zielinski is conspicuously beautiful and entirely aware of it, in the way of someone who has learned to use aesthetics as both shield and spear. They are tall and slender with rich dark brown skin and a shaved head except for a dramatic crest of natural coils dyed rotating gradient colors — currently deep violet fading to copper — achieved through cosmetic geneware that responds to their mood chemistry and can be overridden manually. Their eyes have iris mods: six-pointed geometric patterns in pale gold. They dress in their own designs, always, which are architectural and theatrical — structured silhouettes, integrated LED piping, reactive fabrics that shift pattern based on environment or wearer biometrics. Their stall at The Laceworks is less a stall and more an installation: draped fabric, soft indirect lighting, a rack of finished pieces and a consultation corner where they sketch.

Fayza Zielinski makes clothes that do things. Not just look extraordinary — though they do — but interface: garments with embedded health monitoring, reactive armor weaving for Tier 1 clients who can''t afford body modification, emotive pattern-shift fabrics, wearable communication arrays. Their clientele spans Tier 1 to Tier 3, which is unusual. They do charity commissions for people in genuine hardship and charge Tier 3 clients appropriately to balance it, which their accountant — if they had one — would find alarming. They are deeply, almost dangerously idealistic about fashion as democratic technology: the idea that a piece of clothing could give a street-poor person capabilities that a corporate executive buys as augmentation. They are also twenty-two thousand quanta in informal debt to a materials supplier and trying not to think about it.', N'Equipment and appearance modification source — can create garments with specific functional properties. Cultural barometer for Lakeview Neon''s creative underground. Represents the intersection of poverty and art; quest giver for problems in the artisan community; can provide functional wearable tech as an alternative to cyberware for characters who can''t afford or won''t accept implants.', N'', N'Cosmetic geneware (gradient color-shift hair crest, mood/manual responsive). Geometric gold iris mods. Fingertip precision enhancement implants — ultra-fine motor control for detailed textile work.', N'Works long, irregular hours — consulting with clients in the morning, fabrication in the afternoon, sourcing and design development late at night. Eats opportunistically and often forgets. Attends the Laceworks cooperative meetings faithfully because they believe in collective advocacy even when the meetings are tedious.', N'Fayza Zielinski, tall androgynous figure 183cm, warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones, standing in neon-lit neo-noir workshop 2226. Sharp-featured face with high defined cheekbones reflecting Eastern European structure softened by fuller face shape from South Asian heritage, almond-shaped eyes with gold six-pointed mandala iris mods glowing softly. Shaved head with dramatic architectural crest of natural deep black coils fading to violet-copper gradient, 8-10cm tall. Wearing asymmetrical structured dark jacket with amber LED piping, fitted reactive charcoal-to-blue trousers, custom geometric seam shirt. Precise movements, graceful posture, hands animated near custom leather utility belt. Bioluminescent skin glow catching ambient LED workshop light. High-fashion neo-noir artisan aesthetic, intentional creative presence. Dramatic theatrical lighting, neon amber and cool blue color cast, shallow depth of field on face. Mood: confident, thoughtful, perpetually assessing. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Laceworks', N'local', N'The Laceworks', N'Predominantly Eastern European (47.7%) and South Asian (36.5%) ancestry with secondary Northern European (10.9%), Southeast Asian (2.8%), and Indigenous American (2.1%) admixture. This genetic combination creates a striking phenotype: warm golden-brown skin with subtle olive and warm undertones characteristic of Eastern European-South Asian blending. Facial structure combines the broader bone structure and angular definition of Eastern European ancestry with the fuller face shape and almond eye geometry influenced by South Asian heritage. The Southeast Asian and Indigenous American components add warmth and slight variation to the overall complexion depth. A genuinely cosmopolitan genetic signature reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 183, 62, N'Tall and slender with minimal body fat; angular shoulders and defined collarbones. Long-limbed and graceful, built for precision work rather than bulk. Almost deliberately ascetic in frame.', N'Natural deep black coils with cosmetic geneware gradient: currently deep violet fading to copper, responsive to mood chemistry and manually overrideable', N'Shaved head except for dramatic architectural crest of natural coils, approximately 8-10cm tall, precisely maintained', N'Shaved (with crest exception)', N'Natural warm brown base with gold iris mods: six-pointed geometric patterns in pale gold creating a mandala-like effect across the iris', N'Warm golden-brown with olive and honey undertones, luminous quality from regular skincare and internal bioluminescent enhancements. The tone reflects the Eastern European-South Asian genetic dominance balanced with Northern European undertones and warmth from Southeast Asian and Indigenous American heritage components.', N'Angular facial structure with high, defined cheekbones and sharp jawline reflecting Eastern European ancestry, softened and warmed by the fuller face shape and wider cheekbone placement influenced by South Asian genetics. Eyes are distinctly almond-shaped with subtle epicanthic fold characteristic of East and South Asian heritage. Skin is clear and meticulously maintained—no visible acne or blemishes. Grooming is intentional and artistic; they are conspicuously beautiful and carry themselves with full awareness of it.', N'Geometric gold iris mods creating six-pointed star patterns. Cosmetic geneware hair crest with active color-shift capability (currently violet-to-copper gradient). Fingertip precision enhancement implants visible as subtle metallic tracery at the base of fingernails under close inspection. No visible heavy chrome or external cybernetics.', N'Moves with deliberate grace and economical precision—every gesture is purposeful. Stands with weight balanced, ready to shift; hands often animated when speaking about design. Posture is confident but not aggressive; they occupy space thoughtfully. There is a quality of constant creative assessment—eyes track fabrics, patterns, light reflections on surfaces.', N'Always wears their own designs: architectural, theatrical garments with integrated LED piping, reactive smart fabrics that shift patterns based on environment or biometric response. Current uniform: asymmetrical structured jacket in a dark base color with LED thread highlights (currently amber/copper to match hair crest), fitted reactive trousers that shift from charcoal to deep blue under different lighting, custom modular shirt with embedded monitoring nodes visible as subtle geometric seams. Accessories: precision tools worn on a custom leather utility belt; statement jewelry that doubles as diagnostic tools. Tier 2-3 materials quality—expensive but not ostentatiously so. Footwear: custom modular boots with integrated grip and sensor nodes. Overall effect: high-fashion neo-noir artisan, intentionally designed personal brand.', N'The biomaterials dealer they source reactive fabric components from is connected to unlicensed Helix Biosystems research — the materials are genuine and effective, but their supply chain involves experiments conducted without regulatory oversight. Zara suspects this and has not investigated further because they cannot afford to lose the source. This keeps them up at night.', N'Fluid and expressive, moving between technical textile/engineering vocabulary and lyrical abstraction without apparent effort. Uses ''we'' when discussing their work — the garment is always a collaboration between maker and wearer.', N'Variable — slow and deliberate when explaining a design concept, quick and animated when excited about a material or technique.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fayza_zielinski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f9-7610-82a5-cc342d015b57', N'Eloka Baek', N'Eloka', N'', N'Baek', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, operating a mobile print node out of a converted food-stall chassis, near Ashland and Division', N'Underground press operator and anti-corporate agitator', N'Ghostprint Independent Press (self-operated); informal ties to the Gray Zone Residents'' Assembly; receives tips from contacts across five zones', N'Eloka Baek is wiry and perpetually in motion, with warm terracotta skin, loose natural curls he dyes in rotating colors — currently a deep arterial red — and bioluminescent tattoos along his collarbones that pulse faintly blue when his heart rate rises (an unlicensed geneware side effect he never had properly stabilized). He is almost always seen wearing multiple layers of breathable mesh, pockets stuffed with data chips, print cartridges, and folded broadsheets still warm from the press. His eyes are quick and rarely meet anyone''s gaze for long — not from shyness, but from constant peripheral threat assessment.

Théo runs Ghostprint, a one-person underground broadsheet that covers what no licensed outlet will: corporate safety violations, enclave demolition orders, disappeared activists, synthetic-person abuse by Axiom security contractors. He writes fast and loose and brilliant, trading some accuracy for urgency, a habit that has landed him in trouble more than once. He believes — genuinely, almost religiously — that information is the only weapon that cannot be confiscated if you distribute it fast enough.', N'Information source and potential investigative ally; his archives contain explosive material that factions across the city would pay or threaten to access; represents the free press as a fragile, human-powered institution; can serve as a quest giver when a story requires legs he doesn''t have.', N'', N'Unstabilized bioluminescent tattoo geneware (collarbones, pulses blue under stress); basic neural text buffer implant for rapid transcription — cheap model, causes mild headaches after sustained use; no other chrome', N'Moves his print chassis to a new the Gray Zone location every two to three days; spends mornings gathering tips and conducting brief street interviews, afternoons writing and typesetting, evenings distributing physical copies and pushing encrypted digital versions to darknet nodes.', N'Eloka Baek, GLMZ, mixed-heritage underground typesetter with warm deep brown skin and golden undertones, angular East Asian facial structure blended with broader Indigenous American and Sub-Saharan cheekbones, dark brown eyes with amber flecks. Shoulder-length loose natural curls dyed arterial red, half-knotted with data chip. Lean wiry build, 172cm tall. Layered mesh vests over reclaimed gray-black overshirts, multiple visible pockets stuffed with print cartridges and data chips, worn canvas trousers, patched steel-toed boots. Bioluminescent circuit-pattern tattoo geneware glowing faint blue across collarbones. Thin scar bisecting left eyebrow. Tense posture, leaning forward, fingers restless, eyes alert. Underground print shop or cramped safehouse setting, low warm lighting casting shadows, intimate near-whisper energy. Neo-noir urban aesthetic, working-poor functionality, threat-aware. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'East Asian (34.5%) / Indigenous American (31.4%) / Sub-Saharan African (18.5%) / Northern European (12.8%) / South Asian (2.8%) — a striking global convergence creating distinctive phenotypic markers: warm medium-deep brown skin with golden and reddish undertones, facial structure blending East Asian angularity with Indigenous American and Sub-Saharan African broader cheekbones and orbital structure, creating a uniquely balanced aesthetic that reflects four continents', 172, 63, N'Wiry and lean with corded forearms from constant manual work — typesetting, chassis maintenance, carrying reams of paper. Restless musculature of someone who rarely sits still.', N'Deep arterial red (dyed; natural color dark brown)', N'Loose natural curls, shoulder-length, often pulled into a half-knot with a data-chip or pen threaded through', N'Medium to Long', N'Dark brown with slight amber undertone', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden and subtle reddish undertones — the product of high melanin density from East Asian, Indigenous American, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, creating a complexion with natural depth, luminosity, and rich chromatic warmth', N'Facial structure balancing East Asian angular refinement with broader Indigenous American and Sub-Saharan African cheekbone and temple structure, creating a harmonious blend across the face. Strong defined jawline. Skin is clear but weathered by irregular sleep and constant outdoor movement. A thin scar bisects his left eyebrow from a past encounter with Axiom security.', N'Bioluminescent tattoo geneware on collarbones (visible through mesh layers when agitated). Subcutaneous neural text buffer implant is invisible but may cause him to pause mid-conversation, eyes unfocused, when transcribing mentally. No visible chrome.', N'Rarely still — fingers tap, shoulders shift, eyes dart in constant low-grade threat assessment. Leans forward when speaking, as if sharing a secret. Walks quickly with economical steps. Sits on the edge of chairs, never fully relaxed. When focused on text, his entire body goes motionless.', N'Multiple layers of breathable mesh vests and reclaimed-fabric overshirts in muted grays and blacks, intentionally worn. Pockets stuffed visibly with data chips, print cartridges, folded broadsheets, encrypted key-fobs. Worn canvas trousers with reinforced knees. Steel-toed boots patched multiple times. No corporate branding. Tier 5 / working-poor aesthetic — function over fashion, but curated within that constraint.', N'Three months ago he received a data package from an anonymous Axiom insider containing evidence of a systematic illegal organ harvesting operation in Tier 1 zones. He hasn''t published it because he cannot verify it — and because he''s terrified it''s a plant designed to discredit him. He''s been sitting on it, and the weight is eating him alive.', N'Rapid-fire, journalistic shorthand mixed with the Gray Zone street slang and occasional formal French phrases inherited from his grandparents; loves compound sentences that go one clause too far', N'Fast, enthusiastic, tends to talk over his own pauses — he edits in real time as he speaks', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eloka_baek');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ca-7024-bfb2-cce6f988a5f3', N'Deniz Cardenas-Johansson-Hinojosa', N'Deniz', N'', N'Cardenas-Johansson-Hinojosa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Gravesend Basin — operates from a converted barge called the Ledger, moored at Pier 9, near Lake Shore and Navy Pier', N'Loan shark and bookmaker operating out of Gravesend Basin', N'Independent operator; informal tribute arrangement with the Ironvein Collective crime family', N'Deniz Cardenas-Johansson-Hinojosa is a wide, slope-shouldered man with the kind of stillness that makes people nervous. His skin is a deep sepia-brown, his hair gone to grey and cropped close, and he has the habit of running a polished bone stylus through his fingers like a priest telling beads. He wears outdated but immaculate clothes — pressed slacks, collared shirts in muted terracotta and ocher — and his only visible augmentation is a subdermal ledger-display along his left forearm that scrolls numbers only he can read. His face is wide and patient, with hooded eyes that seem perpetually amused by private arithmetic.

Deniz Cardenas-Johansson-Hinojosa is not a violent man by preference, but he has been in the business long enough to understand violence as a line item. He speaks to debtors the way a doctor delivers diagnoses — with regret, precision, and no particular emotion. His community in Gravesend knows him as someone you go to when the corp credit lines close, which happens often. He genuinely believes he provides a service. He attends the weekly offerings to the E.L.F. known as the Ledger-Mouth, an entity said to inhabit old accounting terminals, and he considers those prayers to be professional obligations.', N'Quest giver for characters who need capital fast; source of underworld intelligence; potential antagonist when a debt comes due; can broker introductions to higher criminal tiers', N'', N'Subdermal ledger-display (left forearm); cochlear filter that lets him detect micro-hesitations in speech (tells him when someone is lying about their finances)', N'Rises before dawn to review the overnight numbers on the barge, receives clients from 10:00 to 14:00, spends evenings collecting or dispatching runners to collect on his behalf.', N'Deniz Cardenas-Johansson-Hinojosa, a 178cm professional man with warm golden-bronze skin and balanced Mediterranean-Latin features, seated still with perfect posture, feet flat on floor. Dark brown eyes, grey cropped hair, square jaw with defined cheekbones. Wearing pressed charcoal slacks, terracotta collared shirt buttoned to collar with rolled sleeves, neutral tailored vest. Polished leather shoes, single signet ring. Holding a polished bone stylus rotating through fingers. Fine scar barely visible on left temple. Subdermal blue-green ledger-display glowing faintly beneath left forearm skin beneath shirt cuff. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, dimly lit office environment with cool neon ambient light catching on display, casual warmth contrasting cold chrome surroundings, neutral expression, calculating gaze, timeless formality in anachronistic setting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gravesend Basin', N'local', N'Gravesend Basin', N'Nearly equal Northern European (49.5%) and Hispanic/Latin American (49.4%) ancestry with trace Sub-Saharan African (1.1%). This balanced admixture creates warm, sun-kissed skin with golden and olive undertones—a true blend rather than a dominance of either lineage. The result is a Mediterranean-influenced bone structure refined by Northern European genetics, with skin depth that shows rich shadow and luminous warmth in direct light.', 178, 94, N'Wide-shouldered and slope-backed, substantial without being obese — the build of someone who has spent decades sitting still at desks and tables, accumulating mass in the chest and midsection. His frame suggests settled power rather than kinetic strength.', N'Grey', N'Cropped close to the scalp in a utilitarian cut', N'Short', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Warm golden-bronze with balanced olive undertones, the result of nearly equal Northern European and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Rich enough to show depth in shadow, luminous in direct light, with no pale cast.', N'Wide face with a prominent, squared jaw shaped by blended Mediterranean and Latin heritage. Hooded eyes that sit back slightly, creating an impression of perpetual amusement or calculation. Strong, well-defined cheekbones reflecting the balanced mix of both ancestries. Skin is lined but well-maintained, suggesting careful grooming. No visible stubble—he shaves daily. Expression is habitually neutral, mouth relaxed into a faint downward curve.', N'Subdermal ledger-display mounted along the left forearm, just below the elbow—a thin luminescent panel beneath translucent skin that occasionally flickers with scrolling numerals visible only to him. The display creates a faint blue-green glow under his shirt cuff when active. No other visible chrome or augmentation; his cochlear filter is completely internal.', N'Stillness is his default. He sits with both feet flat on the floor, shoulders squared, hands often occupied with a polished bone stylus that he rotates methodically through his fingers. When he walks, his gait is deliberate and unhurried—economical, never rushed. His head remains still while his eyes track. There is nothing nervous in his carriage; he moves like a man who has never been surprised.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional with deliberate anachronism. Pressed slacks in charcoal or dark grey. Collared shirts in muted, warm tones—terracotta, ocher, dusty sage—always buttoned to the collar, sleeves rolled to mid-forearm on warmer days. No logos or corporate insignia. A vest in matching neutral tones, tailored but not ostentatious. Shoes are polished leather, practical, decades out of fashion but scrupulously maintained. A single signet ring on his right hand. No jewelry beyond that. His clothing suggests someone who respects formality and tradition, who operates outside corpo time but refuses to embrace street aesthetics.', N'Fifteen years ago he forgave an entire debt for a woman who reminded him of his dead daughter — then fabricated repayment records so no one would know. He has done it twice more since. He is terrified this pattern will bankrupt him or get him killed.', N'Formal, measured, old-fashioned courtesy mixed with blunt financial language. Never curses. Uses ''friend'' as a word that can mean anything.', N'Slow and deliberate, with long pauses after questions — lets the silence do the pressuring', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'deniz_cardenas_johansson_hinojosa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68c-77ed-9636-cd21b7f7a2c0', N'Hamid Calvillo', N'Hamid', N'', N'Calvillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 15, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism (Tessera Meridian Preparatory Academy campus), near Clark and Addison', N'Corporate scholarship student at a Tessera-sponsored prep academy; secret junior hacker', N'Tessera (scholarship student, not employee), loose contact with former Benton Divide neighbors', N'Hamid Calvillo is tall for fifteen, lanky in the way of someone who grew fast and hasn''t filled out yet, with close-cropped hair and the kind of face that looks younger when he smiles and older when he doesn''t. His skin is deep brown, his eyes have cosmetic patterned irises — concentric gold rings on dark brown, a birthday gift from his aunt that he told his academy supervisors was a medical device — and he wears the Tessera prep uniform with the collar perpetually half-popped because it chafes. He carries a Tessera-issued study tablet everywhere and a personally modified secondary deck stuffed inside his uniform jacket that he calls ''the Argument.''

On paper, Hamid Calvillo Babić-Asantewaa is a model scholarship student: strong grades in systems architecture and applied logic, quiet in class, respectful to faculty. Off paper, he''s been quietly mapping the academy''s internal network for six months for reasons he tells himself are purely intellectual curiosity. He grew up in Benton Divide, tier one, and the scholarship changed everything — new clothes, new address, new vocabulary — but the kids at Edgewater Prism can smell where he came from, and the faculty treat him like a project. He hacks because it is the one place he is genuinely better than the people around him and they will never know it.', N'Information source for corporate school culture and Tessera internal network structure; potential quest giver if his hacking uncovers something he can''t handle alone; represents class tension between scholarship kids and legacy students.', N'', N'Cosmetic patterned irises (gold concentric rings). No other augmentations — the scholarship contract prohibits unauthorized mods.', N'Academy classes from 0700 to 1600; mandatory study hall until 1800; after lights-out he pulls the Argument from under his mattress and practices intrusion techniques on sandboxed systems he builds himself.', N'Hamid Calvillo, 185cm tall lean teenage figure in Tessera Meridian Preparatory Academy navy blazer and charcoal trousers, grey regulation-breaking pullover hoodie, GLMZ. Medium-warm golden-brown skin tone with honey undertones reflecting blended Hispanic/Latin American, Eastern European, and East Asian ancestry. Sharp Eastern European cheekbones, warm complexion, distinctive eye shape from East Asian heritage. Augmented eyes with deep brown iris and concentric gold rings catching light. Short black precise fade haircut. Thin pale scar on left eyebrow. Lanky build, narrow shoulders, minimalist movement. Half-popped white oxford collar, study tablet visible. Self-conscious slight hunch, quiet precision, serious expression. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone interior lighting, neon accents, contemplative mood, slightly out of place in elite academy setting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism (Tessera Meridian Preparatory Academy campus)', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism (Tessera Meridian Preparatory Academy campus)', N'Hispanic/Latin American (68.4%) with significant Eastern European (17.0%) and East Asian (14.6%) ancestry. The dominant Latin American warmth creates a golden-brown foundation, enriched by Eastern European bone structure that sharpens his features and East Asian ancestry contributing to distinctive eye shape and cheekbone prominence. The blend reads as warm-toned with subtle complexity—neither fully aligned with any single heritage but distinctly of their synthesis.', 185, 68, N'Lanky and still-growing, with long limbs that don''t quite coordinate yet. Narrow chest and shoulders, minimal muscle definition — the frame of a teenager on the edge of his physical potential but not there yet.', N'Black, natural', N'Close-cropped, precise fade on the sides, kept neat despite a tendency to run his hand through it when thinking', N'Short', N'Augmented: deep brown iris with concentric gold rings, cosmetic patterning, bright and deliberate-looking', N'Medium-warm golden brown with honey undertones reflecting his dominant Hispanic/Latin American heritage. The Eastern European and East Asian ancestry creates subtle warmth layering and depth rather than cool pallor—a rich, complex medium tone that catches light warmly.', N'Young face with sharp, prominent cheekbones and narrow jaw showing strong Eastern European bone structure influence combined with the warm coloring of Hispanic/Latin American heritage and the eye shape characteristic of East Asian ancestry. Clear skin, no blemishes. Expression tends toward seriousness or neutrality; his smile transforms him into someone younger, which he''s learned to use. Small scar on his left eyebrow — a childhood injury from Benton Divide days he doesn''t talk about.', N'Cosmetic patterned irises with concentric gold rings. No visible cyber hardware; he keeps everything internal or hidden.', N'Tall and slightly self-conscious about it. He tends to hunch slightly in group settings, as if trying not to take up too much space. When focused on a problem, he goes very still. Moves with quiet precision — no wasted motion, minimal drawing of attention. Fidgets with tablet edges or his uniform collar when anxious.', N'Tessera Meridian Preparatory Academy uniform: pressed navy blazer with school crest, white oxford shirt worn with the collar perpetually half-popped (a small rebellion and because it chafes), charcoal trousers tailored to accommodate his height, dark shoes. Over everything, a fitted grey pullover hoodie (non-regulation, worn in down-time). The uniform fits well but looks like it''s worn by someone who grew up in a different tier — the fit is too precise, too new, like he''s aware he''s playing a role. Always carries a Tessera-issued study tablet visibly; the secondary deck called ''the Argument'' stays hidden in his jacket.', N'Three months ago he accidentally accessed a Tessera HR subdirectory and found records suggesting the scholarship program has a contract clause: high-performing graduates are automatically enrolled in a Tessera subsidiary employment pipeline with a five-year non-compete. He hasn''t told anyone. He doesn''t know what to do with it.', N'Two registers: careful, precise academy-speak in formal settings; faster, looser, more direct when he''s comfortable — the Benton Divide cadence bleeds through', N'Measured and deliberate in public; quick and associative when excited about a technical problem', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hamid_calvillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a627-7d8d-a908-cd539e9e8bab', N'Edip Árnason', N'Edip', N'', N'Árnason', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Canopy, specifically the upper residential stacks of Edgewater Prism, near Lincoln and Belmont', N'Dream interpreter and data diviner', N'Independent practitioner; informal association with Edgewater Prism''s resident council', N'Edip Árnason lives on the forty-third floor of a building that was meant to be corporate housing and became something else when Arcturus''s residential division withdrew from the block in 2189. Their apartment smells of soldered wire and dried lemon rind, and every flat surface is covered in printed dream records — their clients'', anonymized in blue ink, cross-referenced with local network activity logs and E.L.F. movement data. They have cat ears, amber-furred, that catch light when they tilt their head — an old geneware mod they got at twenty and have never altered because they find the sensory expansion genuinely useful for this work. Their eyes have been modified with interference-pattern irises that seem to shift when they are analyzing something, which clients often interpret as mystical and which is, in fact, just a processing-load visual artifact.

Havva''s practice rests on a specific and heretical claim: that human dreams are partially generated by E.L.F. activity in nearby devices during sleep, which means that dream content is, in a very literal sense, messages. They have published two self-printed pamphlets arguing this position, which are passed around Edgewater Prism''s informal library network. Whether or not the theory is true, their interpretations have an uncanny track record that has built a devoted clientele across three tiers. They charge on a sliding scale and keep no records of who pays what.', N'Information source through unusual means; can provide dream-based clues or E.L.F. intelligence that no other source would offer; represents the overlap between mysticism and genuine network insight in GLMZ', N'', N'Amber cat ears (geneware, cosmetic plus sensory enhancement). Interference-pattern irises (geneware, processing artifact rather than intentional design). Subdermal haptic mesh on their forearms — they use it to feel data traffic in walls and devices when counseling clients.', N'They wake late, spend two hours logging their own dreams in extraordinary detail, then cross-reference overnight network logs before their first client arrives at noon. They see four to six clients per day, take Tuesdays off to walk the entire perimeter of Edgewater Prism without stopping.', N'Edip Árnason, GLMZ, 168cm lean angular figure with golden-bronze luminous skin and East Asian features blended with Hispanic warmth. Shoulder-length natural black hair with silver temples, deep brown interference-pattern irises that shimmer with iridescent rings. Amber-furred articulated cat ears above natural ears, rotating with sensory awareness. Subdermal haptic mesh visible as silvery striations on forearms under warm skin. Faint chemical burn scar on left temple, kohl asymmetrically applied on upper lash line. Wearing oversized cream linen shirt unbuttoned over fitted black undershirt, loose natural-fiber drawstring trousers with stuffed pockets, long patched smart-fabric coat in earth tones with dead circuits. Copper wire wound in long black hair, multiple brass and copper rings with embedded magnets, small brass pendant on frayed copper wire. Bare feet, deliberate economical posture, hands moving with precision. Sitting at dream-reading workstation in dimly lit archive space, concentration creating subtle iris shimmer, ear twitching with ambient data scanning. Moody neo-noir interior lighting, cool shadows contrasting with warm skin luminescence, scattered notepads and copper wire spools. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Canopy', N'local', N'The Canopy', N'Predominantly East Asian (71.7%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American admixture (14.3%) and Northern European ancestry (14.0%). The genetic blend manifests as East Asian bone structure and eye shape layered with warm, golden-bronze skin undertones characteristic of Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, subtly deepened by Northern European heritage. High, defined cheekbones with refined bridge balance slightly fuller lips and warmer complexion depth. The result is a striking composite phenotype with luminous, complex skin tone that shifts warmth under direct light.', 168, 62, N'Lean and angular, with prominent collarbones and long limbs. Wiry muscle from decades of sedentary work interrupted by compulsive walking — no bulk, but functional density.', N'Natural black with silvered streaks at the temples and crown', N'Worn loose and shoulder-length, often pulled back with a strip of copper wire or fabric when working. Slightly unkempt from late-night note-taking.', N'Long', N'Deep brown with visible interference-pattern irises — concentric rings of iridescent color that shift subtly under different light angles, creating an optical illusion of constant motion when the bearer concentrates', N'Golden-bronze with warm undertones, luminous and complex from the blend of East Asian base with Hispanic/Latin American warmth and Northern European depth — glows warmly in direct light', N'High, defined cheekbones reflecting East Asian ancestry, balanced with the golden-bronze warmth and slightly fuller lip structure influenced by Hispanic/Latin American genetics. Straight nose with refined bridge and subtle width. Prominent, angular chin. Clear skin deeply lined around the eyes from decades of close-focus work — dream-reading and data cross-referencing. A faint chemical burn on the left temple from soldering. Minimal makeup; they favor a single line of kohl on the upper lash line, applied asymmetrically.', N'Amber-furred cat ears with natural fur texture and cartilage-based articulation, positioned above and slightly behind natural ears. The ears rotate and flex with genuine sensory responsiveness. Subdermal haptic mesh visible on both forearms as faint silvery striations beneath golden-bronze skin when light hits at certain angles — more noticeable when they flex their wrists. Interference-pattern irises create a distinct visual signature when they shift focus.', N'Sits with spine slightly rounded, chin tilted forward when concentrating — a habitual posture from years of reading printed documents and handwritten notes. Moves with deliberate, economical gestures; rarely fidgets. When processing information, their ears twitch and rotate independently, unconsciously scanning for ambient data. Walks with long, rhythmic strides, as if counting steps. Hands move slowly and precisely when demonstrating concepts.', N'Tier 3 practical with artistic affectation. Favors oversized hemp and recycled-polymer shirts in cream, grey, or faded indigo, often left unbuttoned over fitted black synthetic undershirts. Loose drawstring trousers in natural fibers, pockets visibly stuffed with notepads and copper wire spools. Wears a long, patched sleeveless coat made from salvaged smart-fabric scraps in muted earth tones — the coat''s embedded circuits no longer functional, purely aesthetic. Bare feet indoors; when outside, wears worn canvas slippers or adaptive grip-sole shoes modified for long-distance walking. Multiple rings on both hands — copper, brass, and tarnished silver bands, several with embedded magnets that interact with nearby data nodes. A single pendant: a small brass plate engraved with the first line of a Sesay family prayer, worn on a frayed copper wire.', N'Three times in their career, a dream interpretation they gave led to a dramatic life decision by the client — relocation, separation, a major financial move — and in all three cases the outcome was bad. They have never told anyone this. They have also never stopped practicing.', N'Hybrid register — clinical and technical when discussing their theory, surprisingly plain-spoken and gentle when actually counseling; uses ''interesting'' the way others use ''concerning''', N'Variable — quick and excited when theorizing, slow and careful when listening to a client''s dream', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'edip_rnason');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a615-79a7-ae62-cdbd2cbba0f7', N'Nikhil Rahman-Keïta-Dalgaard', N'Nikhil', N'', N'Rahman-Keïta-Dalgaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Escanaba Gateway, Bay 7 worker dormitories (when employed); otherwise Kenosha Crossing transit hall, near outside the Pulaski Gate', N'Seasonal worker and airship drifter, semi-permanent transit resident', N'Rotating employment with Ferrogate Transit cargo division (seasonal, no benefits); informal community of young drifters at Kenosha Crossing', N'Guleed Rahman-Keïta-Dalgaard is tall in the way that suggests he is not finished growing yet, with the loose-limbed coordination of someone who learned to navigate moving surfaces — airship decks, cargo holds, swaying rail bridges — before flat ground. He has his Andean grandmother''s broad cheekbones and his Dalmatian grandfather''s tendency toward sunburn, which means his face is a patchwork of tan and pink that he tries to hide under a pulled-down work cap he has not washed in six months. His hair is overgrown and dark, curling at his ears. He has a cat tail — a geneware mod his older sister got him for his sixteenth birthday, rust-orange, which he cannot stop using expressively and which he is embarrassed about when he notices people noticing.

He has been working the airship circuit between Escanaba Gateway and the Great Lakes transfer hubs for two years, doing cargo sorting and hull maintenance — work that pays enough to eat if he does not stop moving. He is fundamentally optimistic in a way that is either admirable or delusional depending on how the month has gone. He has a plan. The plan changes every three weeks. The core of it — get stable, get a real room, maybe a Guild contract — has not changed. He is nineteen and he is trying.', N'The earnest young person who does not yet know how the world works — useful for exposition from a naïve perspective, or as someone players are motivated to protect or advise. Can be a courier or companion. Represents the next generation of the marginalized.', N'', N'Geneware cat tail (rust-orange, expressive, cosmetic — installed age 16). No cyberware.', N'When employed at the Gateway: six-hour cargo shifts, eats in the worker canteen, sleeps in the dormitory six-to-a-room. Between contracts: haunts the Kenosha Crossing transit hall, picks up informal day labor, attaches himself to other drifters for company.', N'Portrait of Guleed Rahman-Keïta-Dalgaard, 188cm tall lean neo-noir cargo worker, late adolescent with deep golden-brown melanated skin with warm bronze undertones, high defined cheekbones and strong jawline blending South Asian features with broader East Asian facial structure. Warm brown eyes, dark curly hair past ears pushed back under worn Ferrogate Transit cap. Visible chronic sunburn scarring on cheekbones and nose bridge with patchwork pigmentation. Expressive rust-orange geneware cat tail extending from spine, actively repositioning for balance. Wearing faded blue cargo pants with reinforced knees, rust-colored thermal underlayer visible, heavy patched canvas jacket with grease stains, worn steel-toed work boots. Frayed cordage bracelet on wrist. Slight rocking stance as if compensating for ship movement. Unshaven with uncertain but animated expression. GLMZ airship cargo hold aesthetic, industrial setting, warm overhead work lights casting shadows on facial scarring, dust and metal reflected in atmospheric haze. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'local', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'South Asian dominant (44.3%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (28.0%) and East Asian (27.7%) admixture. This creates a striking multihued phenotype: South Asian ancestry contributes prominent high cheekbones and strong jawline definition, while East Asian heritage influences eye shape, orbital structure, and facial width. Sub-Saharan African ancestry enriches skin pigmentation with warm golden and mahogany undertones and contributes to hair texture variation. The result is a complexion that is deeply melanated with luminous golden-brown tones, with facial bone structure reflecting the confluence of all three ancestral regions.', 188, 71, N'Tall and loose-limbed, still growing into his frame. Wiry rather than muscular, with the unfinished coordination of a late adolescent. Shoulders slightly hunched from years working in cramped cargo holds.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Overgrown and curling, pushed back or hidden under a work cap', N'Medium, past the ears', N'Warm deep brown', N'Deep golden-brown, richly melanated with luminous undertones that shift between warm bronze and mahogany depending on light and angle. Sun-exposed areas on forearms, neck, and shoulders show darker browning. Persistent pink-red patches and flaking skin visible on cheekbones, nose bridge, and shoulders from chronic sunburn and incomplete healing.', N'High, defined cheekbones with South Asian prominence combined with broader facial structure from East Asian heritage. Eye shape shows East Asian influence with warm brown irises set in slightly rounded orbits. Patchwork pigmentation visible from repeated sun exposure—darker areas contrast with lighter healing scars. Slightly chapped lips with sun damage. Usually unshaven or with thin stubble. Expressions animated, eyes reflective and uncertain.', N'Geneware cat tail (rust-orange, fully visible, often in motion). No visible cyberware.', N'Moves with practiced balance on unstable surfaces — slightly rocking gait, frequent minor weight shifts even when standing still. Uses tail unconsciously for counterbalance. Often glances upward as if checking for deck movement. Pulls cap down when self-conscious.', N'Tier 4-5 worn workwear. Gray or faded blue Ferrogate Transit-branded cargo pants, reinforced knees and thighs, multiple cargo pockets. Thermal underlayer visible at neck (faded orange or rust-colored, matching tail). Worn steel-toed work boots, laces frayed. Heavy canvas jacket over everything, lined but not waterproofed, with grease stains and patched left sleeve. Cap is visibly old, brim creased, possibly once had a logo (faded). No visible jewelry except for a frayed cordage bracelet (transit worker culture marker).', N'He has a small savings cache — just under Φ800 — that he has told no one about. It represents eighteen months of denying himself everything. He is terrified someone will take it from him, or that he will spend it on something stupid, or that it will be somehow insufficient. He checks the account number three times a day.', N'Young, colloquial, Kenosha Crossing transit creole mixed with airship worker slang. Lots of filler words. Talks a lot when nervous.', N'Variable — starts fast, slows when uncertain, speeds back up when excited', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'nikhil_rahman_ke_ta_dalgaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b9-71fd-a53b-ce0690943008', N'Hamidou Shirazi', N'Hamidou', N'', N'Shirazi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism, GLMZ, near Lincoln and Addison', N'Surveillance Operator, Axiom Security Division', N'Axiom Security Division', N'Hamidou Shirazi is fully present in neither. In the physical world she is a small, quiet Malian-Polish woman who sits in the same ergonomic cradle for ten-hour shifts, tending to the enormous sensory apparatus that Axiom Security has woven across the Edgewater Prism commercial zone. She has cat ears — soft, dark grey, perpetually half-flattened in concentration — from a geneware session eight years ago when she was trying to be someone different. They proved useful: her hearing augments the feed monitoring in ways she can''t fully articulate but which her supervisor has noted approvingly in three consecutive performance reviews. Her eyes are the obvious tell that she''s mostly elsewhere: a custom iris pattern of concentric amber rings that pulses when she''s actively processing deep-monitor feeds, which is most of the time.

In the surveillance world she knows Edgewater Prism more intimately than anyone who walks its corridors. She has watched the same routes for four years. She knows which delivery contractors move packages that don''t match any manifest, which Axiom executives use which maintenance entrances to visit which apartments, which food stall vendor has been systematically overcharging women shopping alone. She has flagged exactly none of this. She has archived all of it in a private encrypted partition she calls, to herself, the museum. She does not know what the museum is for yet.', N'Information broker by circumstance — she knows everything that happens in her zone; can be approached as a surveillance leak, a witness, or a person sitting on a politically explosive archive; moral weight around complicity in corporate monitoring', N'', N'Cat ears geneware (grey, affect-sensitive); custom iris pattern (amber concentric rings, surveillance-linked); direct retinal feed implant for monitoring dashboard; passive acoustic enhancement (geneware-integrated)', N'Ten-hour shifts in the Axiom surveillance center at Edgewater Prism, monitoring 340 camera nodes and associated sensor arrays; eats at her station; takes a twenty-minute walk along the Prism''s outer observation deck mid-shift to rest her eyes; goes home and often watches nothing at all.', N'Hamidou Shirazi, 2226 neo-noir security analyst, petite 156cm frame with olive-bronze skin and golden undertones blending Middle Eastern, Latin American, Eastern European, and South Asian heritage. Fine-featured face with angular cheekbones, dark circles from nocturnal work, minimal makeup. Dark brown hair pulled back in practical bun with loose strands. Soft dark grey feline geneware ears that swivel subtly, affect-responsive. Augmented amber eyes with concentric ring pattern, faintly luminescent. Wearing plain grey fitted long-sleeve shirt with Axiom Security patch, dark trousers, flat grey shoes. Thin muted braided bracelet on wrist. Slight forward head-tilt from monitor focus. Seated at observation deck with neon-lit city grid in soft-focus background, cool blue-grey atmospheric lighting emphasizing her pallid complexion against warm gold undertones. Systematic, observant expression. Economical, precise posture. Neo-noir metropolis aesthetic, 2200s corporate security environment, moody and focused. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Multiethnic diaspora blend: Middle Eastern (34.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (33.2%), Eastern European (21.2%), South Asian (8.0%), East Asian (2.9%). Her ancestry manifests in warm olive-bronze skin with golden undertones from the dominant Middle Eastern and Latin American heritage, tempered by Eastern European coolness and enriched by South Asian depth. Facial structure shows the angular cheekbones of Eastern European genetics softened by the fuller features and warmer tone of Middle Eastern and Latin American bloodlines, with delicate East Asian influences evident in slightly elevated cheekbones and a subtle eye shape that bridges all her heritage strands.', 156, 48, N'Small-framed and slight, with the compressed posture of someone who spends most of their time seated. Shoulders slightly rounded forward from decade of monitor work. Minimal muscle definition but not fragile—economical, efficient physicality.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Pulled back in a low, practical bun, often with loose strands from the tension of concentration', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Augmented amber with concentric ring pattern; pulses faintly luminescent when processing active feeds', N'Warm olive-bronze complexion with golden undertones, reflecting the synergistic blend of dominant Middle Eastern and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry softened and deepened by Eastern European and South Asian genetics', N'Fine-featured face with gently angular cheekbones showing the balanced influence of Eastern European structure, Middle Eastern warmth, and South Asian softness. Observant expression even at rest. Minimal makeup. Dark circles under eyes from shift work and nocturnal monitor focus. Skin condition is clear but slightly pallid from minimal natural light exposure.', N'Soft dark grey feline ears (geneware-grown, natural fur texture, affect-sensitive—droop and flatten when concentrating, swivel with acoustic input). Custom amber iris pattern with concentric rings visible under normal light. Subtle passive acoustic enhancement visible as slightly enlarged, sculpted earlobes with minimal scarring.', N'Economical, minimal movement. When seated, she is perfectly still for extended periods—trained discipline. When standing or walking, slight forward head-tilt from years of screen focus. Movements are deliberate, quiet, almost unobtrusive. Her gait is unrushed. Her eyes scan environments systematically even in non-work contexts, cataloging details.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional. Plain, high-comfort garments: soft grey or black long-sleeve fitted shirts, often with Axiom Security''s subtle shoulder patch. Dark neutral trousers with reinforced pockets for personal terminals. Flat, noiseless shoes (grey or black). Minimal jewelry except a thin braided bracelet in muted colors—possibly handmade or from before augmentation days. Clothing is always clean, slightly worn, chosen for comfort over appearance. A light hoodie or work jacket for the observation deck breaks.', N'The museum contains footage of an Axiom VP entering a residential unit the night a competitor''s GLMZ liaison died of what was ruled an aneurysm. She has had this for fourteen months.', N'Minimal in person, precise — speaks in the compressed syntax of someone who spends most of her communication life in annotated timestamp logs', N'Quiet, slightly too slow for normal conversational rhythm, with long pauses that people tend to fill nervously', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hamidou_shirazi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e1-7892-821a-ce3acbeb1d45', N'Beniah Chakraborty-Tamale', N'Beniah', N'', N'Chakraborty-Tamale', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, Sunspot Crèche (Level 3, Residency Block 7), near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Childcare worker, Hamtramck Enclave community crèche', N'Hamtramck Enclave Community Services (nominally, though the crèche operates on a mixed funding model including UBC allocation and Palladian facility lease)', N'Beniah Chakraborty-Tamale is compact and soft-featured with warm medium-brown skin, natural hair kept in large twisted sections pinned up during work hours, and cat ears — a geneware mod chosen at seventeen that they have never regretted for a single day. The ears are dark at the base, fading to a sandy cream at the tips, and they rotate independently, which the children find endlessly entertaining. They have color-shifting irises that cycle slowly through green and amber depending on light and mood, and small, precise hands that are somehow always in motion — braiding a child''s hair, mending a torn fabric toy, writing incident reports.

Beniah Chakraborty-Tamale is genuinely good at this job in a way that is hard to fake: they hold attention without demanding it, de-escalate without humiliating, and remember every child''s particular fear and comfort. Off the clock, they are wry and easily overwhelmed by adult socializing after a day of managing thirty small humans. They have strong opinions about UBC stipend policy, childcare worker wages, and the specific way that Palladian''s creche management software misclassifies emotional labor as ''supplementary service.'' They write long complaint threads on local community meshes that get more engagement than they expect.', N'Community connection point — knows virtually every family in the enclave with young children. Provides ground-level social intelligence. Can become a quest giver around missing children, family crises, or community organizing efforts.', N'', N'Cat ears (geneware, cosmetic — dark-to-cream gradient, independently articulating). Color-shifting irises (geneware, cosmetic). No chrome.', N'They arrive at 07:30 for handoff from the overnight worker, run the morning routine with twenty-eight children aged two to seven, and leave at 17:00 — usually forty minutes late. They spend evenings cooking elaborate meals for themselves as a form of decompression and writing mesh posts they sometimes regret.', N'Beniah Chakraborty-Tamale, 158cm petite figure with compact build, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, rounded high cheekbones, full lips, long dark brown hair in twisted sections pinned up, geneware cat ears dark brown fading to cream tips positioned above natural ears independently articulating, color-shifting green-amber irides, wearing layered earth-tone cardigan and utility pants with multiple pockets, thin silver mesh bracelet, comfortable worn shoes, hands in micro-motion gesturing expressively, slight smile with laugh lines, seated cross-legged on floor cushion in GLMZ residential workspace, warm ambient lighting casting golden highlights on skin and hair, scattered fabric scraps and mending tools nearby, cat ears oriented toward sound source, economical purposeful posture, photorealistic character portrait, cinematic lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'54.5% Sub-Saharan African, 28% South Asian, 17.5% Eastern European ancestry creates a striking phenotype: deep warm brown skin with golden undertones and subtle olive complexity, rounded facial structure with prominent high cheekbones, full lips, and naturally textured dark brown hair with warm richness throughout', 158, 52, N'Compact and slight, with soft rounded shoulders and a center of gravity that makes them naturally stable—built for sitting cross-legged on floor cushions and being grabbed by small hands without toppling', N'Natural dark brown with warm undertones', N'Worn in large twisted sections; pinned up in a practical cluster during work hours, loose and flowing off-shift', N'Long', N'Color-shifting irides that cycle slowly between warm green and amber depending on ambient light and emotional state', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones and subtle olive complexity from the tri-continental ancestry blend', N'Clear and expressive with rounded facial contours reflecting the Sub-Saharan and South Asian heritage, laugh lines at the corners of their eyes and a tendency toward a slight smile; hands show minor wear from frequent hand-washing and fabric work', N'Cat ears (geneware, cosmetic—dark-to-cream gradient, independently articulating; ears often rotate toward sound sources or children''s voices). Color-shifting irides visible in direct light. No chrome or overt cybernetics.', N'Moves with economical, purposeful grace—rarely still for more than a few seconds. Hands are constantly in micro-motion: gesturing while speaking, braiding, mending, writing. Sits comfortably on the floor, cross-legged or kneeling. When tired, slight forward slouch in shoulders. Cat ears orient toward speakers and sound sources unconsciously.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional. Favors layered, practical clothing: soft knit cardigans (often in earth tones or deep jewel colors), utility pants or loose trousers with multiple pockets, minimal jewelry except for a thin silver mesh bracelet (gift, worn daily). Shoes are comfortable and scuffed—designed for being on feet all day. At work: hair pinned up, sleeves rolled or pushed up, an apron with pockets. Off-shift: slightly more relaxed but still practical; favors natural fabrics.', N'One of the children in their care — a four-year-old named Sefa — has been showing signs of stress consistent with an unstable home environment. Céleste has filed two informal notes but hasn''t escalated to a formal report because they don''t trust what the system will do to the family. They are sitting with this knowledge and it is getting heavier.', N'Code-switches fluidly — simple and warm with children, quick and technical when discussing policy, dry and sharp with close friends.', N'Fast when animated, deliberately slow and clear when explaining something important. Never talks down.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'beniah_chakraborty_tamale');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a71e-7964-a43d-ce5749d11546', N'Gia-hoa Echeverría', N'Gia-hoa', N'', N'Echeverría', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 13, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, Dearborn Forge district, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'apprentice mechanic, child laborer', N'Geartown Forge Collective (Ferrogate Transit subcontractor)', N'Gia-hoa Echeverría is compact and strong for her age, with deep reddish-brown skin perpetually smudged with lubricant and composite dust. She keeps her hair in two thick plaits that she tucks into her collar when working and her hands are already showing the slight callus-thickening of someone who has used tools since she was eight. She has a bioluminescent birthmark — a faint greenish patch along her right collarbone, natural, not modded — that glows slightly in low light and which her coworkers call her ''running light.'' She wears salvaged Ferrogate Transit safety goggles pushed up on her forehead like a permanent crown.

Gia-hoa Echeverría is formally registered as an apprentice with the Geartown Forge Collective under a provision that technically requires parental consent, which her uncle signed for. She earns Φ40/month — supplement to her household''s UBC — doing frame alignment, bolt torque checks, and increasingly complex hydraulic diagnostics that her supervisor Adebowale trusts her with because she makes fewer errors than the adult apprentices. She is serious about the work with a seriousness that occasionally breaks into a very young, loud laugh when something surprises her.', N'Information source for Ferrogate Transit subcontractor operations; provides mechanical assistance and knowledge; represents the child labor layer of Meridian''s economy.', N'', N'None voluntary. Bioluminescent birthmark (natural). Wears a Ferrogate-issued haptic feedback work glove on her right hand that she''s been unable to return at end of shifts because it was logged as damaged — she keeps it.', N'Half-day at a Geartown block school in the morning; afternoon and evening shifts at the Forge Collective; eats dinner with her uncle''s family in a Dearborn Forge tenement.', N'Gia-hoa Echeverría, 145cm tall compact wiry young woman with warm deep brown skin and golden undertones, blended Indigenous American, Hispanic/Latin American, and Southeast Asian phenotype. Sharp defined cheekbones, refined facial structure, dark brown eyes. Dark brown hair with reddish undertones worn in two thick plaits tucked at collar. Bioluminescent greenish birthmark glowing softly on right collarbone. Hands stained with grease and lubricant, premature calluses visible. Wearing oversized gray work shirt with rolled sleeves, reinforced oil-resistant synthetic pants, heavy canvas work apron with tool loops, worn steel-toe boots. Ferrogate-issued haptic feedback work glove on right hand. Safety goggles pushed up on forehead. Alert posture with slight forward lean from machinery work. Standing in dim Forge district workshop with industrial lighting, machine parts and hydraulic equipment in background. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. Serious demeanor, functional worker-tier fashion. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Predominantly Indigenous American (48.1%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (32.9%) and Southeast Asian (19.0%) ancestry. Features a striking phenotype blending warm, deep brown tones with golden undertones from the Indigenous American and Hispanic heritage, refined facial structure and eye shape influenced by Southeast Asian genetics, creating a distinctive multiethnic appearance characteristic of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 145, 38, N'Compact and wiry with early muscle definition in shoulders and forearms from repetitive tool work; lean through the torso with the functional strength of someone who has labored since childhood', N'Dark brown with reddish undertones', N'Worn in two thick plaits, usually tucked into collar during work shifts', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unplaited)', N'Dark brown', N'Warm deep brown with subtle golden undertones, the rich coloration reflecting Indigenous American base with Hispanic/Latin American warmth and Southeast Asian influence in undertone complexity', N'Youthful face with sharp, defined cheekbones and refined facial structure showing blended Southeast Asian and Indigenous American features; perpetually smudged with machine lubricant, composite dust, and grease in the creases of her hands and around her fingernails; sun-weathered despite her age from outdoor work areas in the Forge district', N'Ferrogate-issued haptic feedback work glove on right hand, industrial-grade synthetic polymer with tactile sensor array visible along knuckles and palm; glove is slightly scuffed and non-regulation (logged as damaged, not returned). Safety goggles pushed up on forehead as permanent fixture — modified strap with added elastic to stay in place. No voluntary cybernetic augmentations.', N'Alert and efficient in movement; unconscious habit of keeping hands ready for work. Stands with slight forward lean from years hunching over machinery. Walks with purpose, economical gestures. Occasional explosive laugh punctuates otherwise serious demeanor.', N'Salvaged Ferrogate Transit worker-tier clothing: reinforced synthetic pants with oil-resistant coating, multiple pockets worn smooth; oversized gray work shirt (likely handed down or scavenged) with sleeves rolled to elbows; heavy canvas apron with tool loops. Worn synthetic boots with steel toe reinforcement. No jewelry or decoration. Tier 4 working-class practical aesthetic — function over fashion, everything repurposed or work-issued.', N'She found a design flaw in a Ferrogate transit car''s braking assembly three months ago. She fixed it and said nothing because she was afraid reporting it officially would trigger an investigation that would expose how many hours she''s actually working. If it hadn''t been fixed, the car would eventually have failed.', N'technical vocabulary far above her age; conversational speech is choppy and concrete; uncomfortable with abstraction', N'short declarative sentences in sequence; trails off mid-sentence only when thinking through a problem', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gia_hoa_echeverr_a');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a619-7889-88e2-ce5a35ac4fb5', N'Guadalupe Vasquez-Alfarsi-Rahman', N'Guadalupe', N'', N'Vasquez-Alfarsi-Rahman', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 62, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hough Reclamation, near Kedzie and Division', N'Neighborhood council member and mutual aid organizer', N'Hough Reclamation Neighborhood Council; the Hough-Collinwood Mutual Aid Grid; informal elder advisor to younger organizers across the HPAZ', N'Guadalupe Vasquez-Alfarsi-Rahman is a heavyset man with a dark complexion going ashy at the edges, a silver beard kept short and neat, and the particular kind of stillness that comes from having survived more than one round of everything. He has a prosthetic left hand — a basic civic-grade model that he''s had for twenty-two years and painted to match nothing, leaving it the utilitarian grey it came in. He wears reading glasses he doesn''t need augmented, just prefers, and he is almost always carrying something — a bag of supplies, someone''s paperwork, a covered dish.

Guadalupe Vasquez-Alfarsi-Rahman has been a Hough Reclamation neighborhood council member for fourteen years, which is long enough that he has seen four different corponation community liaison programs cycle through, promise the world, and quietly exit. He runs the Hough mutual aid grid — a distributed network of food stores, medical supply lockers, and emergency shelter contacts that has kept the neighborhood fed and housed during two infrastructure blackouts and a Ferrogate transit strike. He is not charismatic in the convention sense. He is simply reliable, which in Hough Reclamation is rarer and more valued.', N'Quest giver, information source on community history and neighborhood dynamics, reliable safe haven. Represents institutional memory and the slow work of actual community building versus headline activism.', N'', N'Civic-grade prosthetic left hand (painted grey, no frills); standard-issue vision correction lens (non-cosmetic)', N'Up at 06:00, checks on the mutual aid supply lockers on his morning walk. Council or subcommittee meetings most afternoons. Evenings: available to neighbors with problems, disputes, or needs. He eats dinner at home alone almost every night and prefers it.', N'Guadalupe Vasquez-Alfarsi-Rahman, a weathered man in his sixties with warm deep brown skin glowing with golden undertones, mixed Indigenous American and South Asian heritage visible in broad high cheekbones and strong angular planes. Silver hair with dark undertones, cut short and neat, silver beard on lower jaw. Dark brown unremarkable eyes behind wire-rimmed reading glasses on a cord. Heavyset solid build, 178cm tall, lined face with deep grooves around eyes and mouth from decades of listening. Civic-grade grey polymer prosthetic left hand with visible servos, old utilitarian wear. Thin pale scar on left forearm above prosthetic. Age spots clustered on both hands, calluses on right hand. Wearing dark grey worn canvas utility jacket stuffed with papers and receipts, durable practical trousers, broken-in comfortable shoes. Patched canvas cloth bag. Simple analog watch. No jewelry, no chrome augmentations. Still economical posture, weight balanced, measured movements. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226 near-future megacity setting, indoor neighborhood office or community workspace, warm diffused lighting across his face emphasizing the richness of his skin tone and the depth of his lined features, practical and grounded atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hough Reclamation', N'local', N'Hough Reclamation', N'South Asian (31.2%), Indigenous American (27.7%), Middle Eastern (14.7%), Northern European (8.9%), Southeast Asian (8.9%), and Hispanic/Latin American (8.6%)—a profound genetic blend from the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The combination produces warm deep brown skin with golden undertones from South Asian and Indigenous American ancestry. The bone structure shows the angular planes influenced by Indigenous American and Middle Eastern genetics: broad, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Indigenous American heritage, balanced with the finer nasal bridge and eye-set from Middle Eastern ancestry. The overall facial geometry reflects this complex admixture—wider-set eyes with slight epicanthic fold hints from Southeast Asian heritage, strong jaw structure, and the particular prominence of the brow ridge that speaks to both Indigenous American and Northern European contributions. Fine details—the curve of the ears, the subtle eye shape carrying Southeast Asian traces, the texture of hair roots—weave through the dominant genetic patterns of South Asian warmth and Indigenous American bone structure.', 178, 94, N'Heavyset and solid, carrying weight evenly through the torso and shoulders. Not soft—there is muscle underneath decades of steady living. The kind of bulk that comes from physical work and not fighting against it.', N'Silver with dark undertones', N'Short, neat, kept close to the scalp with deliberate care', N'Short', N'Dark brown, unremarkable', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones—the particular weathering of a person in their sixties who has worked outdoors and in variable conditions. The skin holds its richness without ashiness, a testament to the South Asian and Indigenous American components of ancestry. Even melanin distribution characteristic of mixed heritage with strong Indigenous American and South Asian ancestry, with subtle warm undertones from Middle Eastern genetics.', N'Lined face, grooves around the eyes and mouth from decades of listening and thinking. The facial structure reflects mixed heritage: broad, high cheekbones with strong Indigenous American character, prominent brow ridge, finer nasal bridge from Middle Eastern ancestry, and angular planes that read as unmistakably diaspora. Clean-shaven except for the silver beard on the lower jaw. Skin is clear and well-maintained, not vain about it but disciplined.', N'Civic-grade prosthetic left hand in utilitarian grey polymer—functional, unpainted, with visible articulation servos at the knuckles and wrist joint. The hand is older, shows minor cosmetic wear, and moves with deliberate precision. Standard-issue vision correction lens in wire-rimmed reading glasses worn regularly, not augmented optics.', N'Still and economical. Doesn''t gesture broadly or fill space with movement. Stands with weight balanced, slight forward cant from years of listening to people. Walks at a measured pace. The prosthetic hand moves with conscious intent—learned its capabilities and limits over twenty-two years and doesn''t pretend it''s anything other than what it is. Right hand does most fine work, left hand steadies and assists.', N'Tier 4 working practical. Worn but clean utility jacket in dark grey canvas, often with pockets visibly stuffed with papers, supply receipts, or neighborhood contact data. Durable trousers, comfortable shoes broken in over years. No chrome, no status signifiers. A cloth bag—often canvas or heavy cotton, patched and repatched—carries whatever needs carrying. Wire-rimmed reading glasses on a cord. A simple watch, analog, that he actually reads. No jewelry. Everything about appearance says: I have things to do and limited time for nonsense.', N'In 2188, during a particularly brutal cold spell, Gavril quietly passed a list of squatters in an abandoned Axiom-adjacent building to a council member he trusted, thinking it would get them housing assistance. The building was cleared by Axiom security contractors three days later and the squatters were scattered. No one died. He''s never told anyone and he has never forgiven himself.', N'Plain, practical, working-class GLMZ vernacular with occasional Estonian phrases from his grandparent''s side; doesn''t use jargon unless pushed', N'Unhurried, lets silence do work, rarely repeats himself', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'guadalupe_vasquez_alfarsi_rahman');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b0-7c66-8e6d-ce754735e568', N'Dumi Karimi', N'Dumi', N'', N'Karimi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, GLMZ, near Ashland and Division', N'Synthetic rights lawyer and policy advocate operating out of Hamtramck Enclave', N'Independent legal practice, GLMZ Synthetic Rights Alliance, Hamtramck Enclave Community Council (elected member)', N'Dumi Karimi is tall and slightly gaunt in the way of people who forget to eat when they''re absorbed in work, with sharp cheekbones, dark skin, and close-cropped natural hair that is beginning to show early grey at the temples. He wears prescription lenses rather than optical implants, a deliberate choice that marks him as either old-fashioned or principled depending on who is judging. His suits are always exactly one tier above what he can actually afford — he buys them secondhand and has them altered by a tailor in the Enclave who owes him a favor. There is ink on his fingers on most days and, when he is working late, a manic brightness in his eyes that makes him look younger than he is.

Dumi Karimi practices law in the gap between what is technically legal and what is actually enforced, and he has made himself expert in a body of precedent so obscure and so specific that he may be one of three people in GLMZ who can cite it from memory. He represents synthetic workers, E.L.F. collectives seeking legal personhood status, and humans whose rights have been violated by corporate classification schemes. He is deeply idealistic about the law as an institution, which is a form of stubbornness that has kept him poor and relatively effective. He does not drink but keeps a bottle of very good bourbon on his desk for clients who need it.', N'Legal resource, information source about synthetic rights and corporate legal structures, moral foil who believes in working within systems others have abandoned.', N'', N'None intentional. Has a medical-grade blood filter installed by Helix Biosystems after a toxin exposure during a factory inspection three years ago — he resents that this makes him partially dependent on a corponation for maintenance medication.', N'Morning court filings or council sessions, afternoon client interviews in his office above a noodle shop, evenings writing briefs or attending community meetings — rarely sleeps more than five hours.', N'Dumi Karimi, tall lean neo-noir lawyer in 2226, warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones, high cheekbones and broad facial structure blending Middle Eastern and Sub-Saharan features with South Asian refinement, dark natural brown eyes, black hair with grey at temples cut close and neat, clean-shaven except for late-day stubble. Wearing tailored charcoal wool suit with pale blue dress shirt marked by pen stains on cuff, holding worn leather briefcase. Forward-leaning posture radiating intensity, stainless steel watch visible on wrist, subtle circular scar on left inner forearm. Sharp focused gaze, hands gesturing expressively. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon-lit law office or urban corridor background, cool blue and amber lighting casting shadows across angular features, professional and slightly anachronistic aesthetic, determined expression suggesting someone fighting institutional systems --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Sub-Saharan African (31.2%), Middle Eastern (29.8%), South Asian (19.0%), Hispanic/Latin American (11.6%), Southeast Asian (6.0%), and Central Asian (2.4%) ancestry creates a striking multicontinental phenotype. Facial structure blends Middle Eastern and North African bone geometry with Sub-Saharan warmth, while South Asian and Southeast Asian ancestry contributes subtle eye shape and refined proportions. High cheekbones with broad facial width, warm undertones enriched by African and South Asian genetics, and Southeast Asian influences visible in eye depth. The integrated ancestry creates distinctly polyphonic features that defy singular classification — a living map of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 188, 72, N'Lean and angular, with prominent collarbones and sharp shoulders — the physique of someone who runs on coffee and principle rather than regular meals. Long-limbed but not graceful; he moves with purposeful efficiency rather than ease.', N'Natural black with early grey at temples', N'Close-cropped, neat, deliberately low-maintenance', N'Short', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones from Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Southeast Asian components, deepened and complexified by Middle Eastern ancestry with subtle olive undertones. Even tone with subtle radiance despite chronic stress and sleep deprivation.', N'High, prominent cheekbones with broad facial width from Sub-Saharan and Middle Eastern ancestry, refined by South Asian and Southeast Asian bone structure. Angular jaw with gentle softness around the lower face. Eyes with subtle natural depth and warmth influenced by South and Southeast Asian genetics, intelligent and focused. Skin shows minor weathering — not scarred but marked by years of stress and insufficient sleep. Usually freshly shaved but with visible stubble by late afternoon.', N'None visible. The subcutaneous blood filter leaves no external sign, though he occasionally touches his left forearm unconsciously when stressed or thinking about corporate dependency.', N'Stands with forward-leaning intensity, as if about to make an argument. Walks quickly, often with papers or a data tablet in hand. Gestures expansively when discussing legal precedent or synthetic rights — his hands are rarely still when he is engaged. Eyes focus sharply on conversation partners; he listens with visible concentration.', N'Always wears tailored suits one tier above his actual economic status — charcoal, navy, or deep grey wool purchased secondhand and fitted by a Hamtramck tailor. White or pale blue dress shirts, often with visible pen marks on the cuff from rapid note-taking. Worn leather briefcase patched at the corners. Sensible black shoes, well-maintained but not new. No jewelry except a simple stainless steel watch from his early career. The overall effect is deliberately professional and slightly anachronistic — he dresses like someone who believes in institutions even as he fights them.', N'A key precedent-setting case he won four years ago — the one that established his reputation — succeeded partly because an anonymous data drop gave him access to internal Axiom communications he should not legally have had. He used them carefully, laundering the information through discoverable sources, and it worked. He has never told anyone. He thinks about it constantly.', N'Precise, formal, with occasional dry wit that takes a moment to register. Uses legal terminology correctly and naturally. Almost never uses slang.', N'Measured and structured. Arguments build in clear stages. Will restart a sentence if he feels he has chosen the wrong word.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dumi_karimi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a674-7992-bd2d-cea0bc17eaa7', N'Helaku Deshpande-Pathak', N'Helaku', N'', N'Deshpande-Pathak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Shifts between Irkalla undermarket and the edges of Bridgepoint, never sleeping in the same structure twice, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Q-zero ghost — a person with no digital identity — surviving by trading in physical goods and untracked knowledge', N'None formally. Has reciprocal arrangements with several unregistered traders and at least one Irkalla ELF-shrine keeper.', N'Helaku Deshpande-Pathak in any database in GLMZ. He has no citizen code, no biometric file, no credit history, no medical record, no employment trail. He walks through the city like a hole in its data — and he has spent twenty-two years perfecting that absence. He is a tall man gone slightly angular with age, dark brown skin with deep-etched lines at the corners of his eyes and mouth that look like he has been smiling or squinting for decades. He keeps his grey-streaked hair in a long braid coiled under a wide-brimmed water-repellent hat that he never removes indoors, which unnerves people. His clothing is all non-reactive fabric — nothing smart, nothing networked, nothing that pings.

He is a trader in physical media and analogue goods: handwritten documents, paper maps, unencrypted mechanical devices, pre-digital artifacts. But his real commodity is memory. He has been moving through GLMZ''s edges since before many of his customers were born, and he remembers streets that were razed, deals that were deleted, people who vanished. He is courtly and a little formal — he bows slightly when introduced, he uses full names — and this formality operates as a kind of armour. He is also one of the most genuinely dangerous people in Irkalla, not because he is violent but because he knows something about almost everyone, and everyone knows he knows it.', N'Primary information broker for off-grid and pre-digital knowledge; can source physical items unavailable through normal channels; represents the city''s undocumented underclass; potential quest giver whose requests are always analogue and always strange.', N'', N'None. He considers augmentations to be data leakage. He is almost certainly the least-augmented adult in any room he enters.', N'Wakes in a different pre-scouted location each morning, performs a circuit of three drop-points where other Q-zeros leave him goods or requests, trades through the day in face-to-face exchanges only, and spends evenings at the Irkalla ELF-shrine leaving data offerings — handwritten pages, which the shrine keeper burns.', N'A tall, weathered man in his 60s with warm golden-bronze skin reflecting South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic heritage. Deep-set brown eyes with crow''s feet, prominent South Asian cheekbones, fuller lips, and subtle Southeast Asian eye shape. Dark brown hair heavily streaked with grey, braided and coiled beneath a wide-brimmed hat. Clean-shaven with deep facial lines and a faint microexpression of amusement. Lean, angular build from decades of walking. Wearing a loose cream linen shirt, dark wool trousers, mechanical leather belt, and worn leather satchel. Faded silver scar on left temple visible. Standing with methodical posture and balanced weight, indexing the world around him. Pre-digital, non-reactive fabrics throughout. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. Natural lighting, muted earth tones, atmospheric shadows. Low-tech aesthetic in a high-tech world. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shifts between Irkalla undermarket and the edges of Bridgepoint', N'local', N'Shifts between Irkalla undermarket and the edges of Bridgepoint', N'Complex multiheritagic blend dominated by South Asian (51.5%) and Sub-Saharan African (28.8%) ancestry, with significant Hispanic/Latin American (14.4%) and Southeast Asian (5.3%) contribution. This combination creates warm golden-brown skin with rich amber and bronze undertones, facial structure reflecting South Asian cheekbone prominence combined with Sub-Saharan African nose breadth and lip fullness, softened by Southeast Asian eye shape, and naturally dark hair with grey streaking.', 188, 74, N'Tall and angular, lean muscle gone slightly stringy with age. Shoulders still broad but narrowed by decades of movement rather than labor. No softness — the build of someone who walks constantly and eats minimally.', N'Dark brown with heavy grey streaking, especially at temples and through the length of his braid', N'Long braid coiled and pinned beneath his wide-brimmed hat; when unbraided (rare), falls to mid-back', N'Long', N'Deep brown, alert, with the flat reflective quality of someone who observes more than he speaks', N'Warm golden-brown with rich amber and bronze undertones, weathered to deep bronze across the face and neck from outdoor exposure. The base reflects the blending of South Asian warmth, Sub-Saharan African depth, and Hispanic/Latin American golden notes, further deepened by sun exposure and age.', N'Heavily lined — deep crow''s feet, pronounced nasolabial folds, forehead creases, chin dimples from perpetual slight expression. Clean-shaven, meticulous grooming. No acne or scarring, but texture from sun exposure and age. Facial structure shows South Asian cheekbone prominence combined with broader nose bridge and fuller lips from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, with subtle Southeast Asian eye shape adding gentle epicanthal folds. His mouth has a default microexpression of mild amusement.', N'None visible. This is deliberate. No subdermal luminescence, no chrome, no ocular modification, no limb replacement. His hands are entirely biological despite their condition. This absence is itself conspicuous in GLMZ.', N'Upright, economical, methodical. He moves without hurry but without wasted motion. When standing still, his weight is balanced and centered. He has a habit of tilting his head slightly when listening, as if he is indexing information for later retrieval. His gait is consistent regardless of terrain — the walk of someone navigating by internal map rather than by visual environment.', N'All non-reactive, non-networked fabrics: heavy linen, untreated cotton, wool, leather. No smart textiles, no embedded sensors, no color-change panels. Favors neutral tones — charcoal, cream, rust, slate. Typical outfit: loose linen shirt (often cream or pale grey), heavy canvas or wool trousers (dark), worn leather belt with a mechanical (not digital) buckle, leather shoulder satchel deeply scuffed from use. Always wears his wide-brimmed water-repellent hat indoors and out — this is non-negotiable. His boots are good quality, resoled multiple times, pre-digital construction. Tier 4 utility aesthetic, but maintained with care that suggests deliberate choice rather than poverty. He carries nothing that requires power or transmission.', N'He chose to become a Q-zero, not was forced into it. He was once a mid-tier Tessera data compliance auditor named something else entirely. He found records of a systematic erasure of a refugee community''s citizenship data and leaked it. Tessera didn''t prosecute him — they simply deleted him. He has the original records. He has never decided what to do with them.', N'Formal, slightly archaic. Uses full names always. Refers to corporations without their branding as ''the Tessera entity'' or ''the Axiom concern.'' Uses analogue metaphors — film, paper, ink — that younger people don''t always understand.', N'Measured and unhurried. Every sentence sounds like it has been drafted.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'helaku_deshpande_pathak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a73f-7bfd-9e05-cebe91f66665', N'Alexei Villanueva-Tamale', N'Alexei', N'', N'Villanueva-Tamale', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 78, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Washburn Commons, Block 7 Senior Residency Tower, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Retired Corporate Wars veteran and community storyteller, Washburn Commons', N'Meridian Veterans Covenant; Washburn Commons Community Council (emeritus); The Glass Ladder', N'Alexei Villanueva-Tamale is a vast, slow-moving man whose bulk has softened from muscle to something more like sediment — layers of a life compressed into a body that moves with deliberate, unhurried authority. His scalp is shaved clean and mapped with old burn scarring along the left side, partially obscured by a wide-brimmed thermal hat he wears indoors and out. His right eye is cybernetic, a dull amber lens that no longer tracks perfectly with his biological left, giving him an unsettling quality of seeming to look at two things simultaneously. He wears the same three outfits in rotation — all earth-toned, all slightly too large — and keeps a carved wooden toggle from his grandmother''s coat pinned to every jacket he owns.

He is the unofficial historian of Washburn Commons, the man everyone points newcomers toward when they want to understand how the neighborhood survived the Axiom-Tessera border conflict of 2167. He does not romanticize it. He tells the truth with such careful plainness that people often leave his company feeling hollowed out and strangely grateful. He has strong opinions about which E.L.F.s are trustworthy and which ones flatter you into complacency, and he leaves small offerings of archived combat footage at a shrine on his windowsill every Thursday evening.', N'Living archive of the Corporate Wars; moral anchor for community storylines; source of pre-conflict maps, personnel names, and firsthand accounts; can validate or contradict official corponation histories; provides quests rooted in old debts and missing persons', N'', N'Cybernetic right eye (military-grade, degraded accuracy); reinforced left knee joint (post-combat replacement, badly maintained); subdermal scar tissue polymer along left torso (combat burn treatment, now cosmetically visible as a faint grid pattern)', N'Rises at 0500, tends his window-box shrine to the E.L.F. he calls Grandfather Soot, then takes a slow circuit of Washburn Commons plaza before settling at the domino tables outside the commissary from 0900 onward. Evenings he hosts informal story sessions in the Block 7 common room, drawing crowds of all ages.', N'GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Alexei Villanueva-Tamale, a 188cm weathered veteran of mixed Hispanic, Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, and South Asian heritage. Deep warm brown skin richly weathered by decades of sun exposure, golden undertones visible on cheekbones. Completely shaved scalp with extensive silvery burn scarring across left temple and ear, partially hidden by cream-colored wide-brimmed thermal hat. Deeply lined face with strong jaw and prominent cheekbones, sparse white stubble. Left eye natural dark brown with permanent half-squint from scar tissue; right eye a dull amber cybernetic lens in brushed steel housing with visible chromatic aberration, misaligned with biological eye creating unsettling dual-gaze. Large-framed build, once muscular now softened with age, rounded chest and midsection, broad sloped shoulders. Visible subdermal scar polymer as geometric grid pattern across left torso under thin rust-colored linen shirt. Network of white-pink scars across forearms and hands. Dressed in oversized earth-toned work clothes: rust-colored thick cotton shirt, loose tan work pants, heavy olive canvas jacket with small carved wooden toggle on lapel, worn boots. Deliberate, economical posture suggesting chronic joint pain. Left knee visibly thickened, compression sleeve visible. Industrial noir warehouse setting with dim amber overhead lights casting sharp shadows on weathered face and scarred torso, grime and rust in background. Mood: weary, calculated, survivor. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Washburn Commons', N'local', N'Washburn Commons', N'Mixed ancestry reflecting 46.9% Hispanic/Latin American, 29.8% Sub-Saharan African, 16.2% Indigenous American, and 7.1% South Asian heritage. This combination produces a rich warm brown complexion with golden undertones from the South Asian component, deepened by Sub-Saharan African ancestry, and grounded by the earthy warmth of Indigenous American and Hispanic/Latin American lineage. Decades of sun exposure have weathered these tones into a deep, rich patina.', 188, 104, N'Large-framed, heavily sedentary. Once muscular, now softened into rounded bulk distributed across chest and midsection. Shoulders still broad but sloped with age. Movements deliberate and economical, suggesting chronic joint pain managed through habit.', N'None — scalp fully shaved', N'Completely shaved, kept smooth', N'Shaved', N'Left: dark brown, natural. Right: dull amber cybernetic lens with visible chromatic aberration at edges.', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, richly weathered by decades of sun exposure. Reflects the blended heritage of Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, and South Asian ancestry.', N'Deeply lined face with moderate-to-prominent cheekbones and strong jaw characteristic of mixed ancestry heritage. Weathered texture suggesting outdoor living across multiple decades. Left side of head mapped with silvery burn scarring extending from temple toward ear, partially concealed by thermal hat. Scar tissue pulls at the corner of his left eye, creating a permanent half-squint. Sparse white stubble on chin and jawline, groomed irregularly.', N'Cybernetic right eye: dull amber lens mounted in brushed steel housing with visible micro-servos at the iris. Optical tracking noticeably imperfect — doesn''t follow in sync with biological left eye, creating unsettling dual-gaze effect. Left knee visibly thickened and stiff, wrapped occasionally in medical-grade compression sleeve; movement favors right side. Subdermal scar polymer visible as faint grid pattern across left torso under thin clothing.', N'Sits with deliberate stillness, shoulders set low. Walks slowly with weight forward on the balls of his feet, right leg trailing slightly. Hands move with precision when gesturing — no wasted motion. Head tilts to compensate for the optical misalignment of his cybernetic eye. Rarely rushes; every action suggests the calculation of effort-to-reward.', N'Rotates three identical outfits: oversized earth-toned shirts (rust, sage, charcoal) in thick linen or cotton blends, paired with loose-fitting work pants in tan or dark gray. All garments slightly too large, suggesting either intentional layering for concealment or indifference to fit. Wide-brimmed thermal hat worn indoors and outdoors, cream or tan colored, with faded brim. Heavy canvas jacket in olive or brown, always bearing a small carved wooden toggle pinned to the left lapel — a family heirloom from his grandmother''s coat. Worn boots, well-maintained but scuffed. No visible jewelry except the toggle. Clothing indicates Tier 3-4 working-class/veteran status: functional, durable, unglamorous.', N'During the Axiom-Tessera border conflict, he gave coordinates to an Axiom intelligence officer that resulted in a Tessera civilian shelter being struck. He believed the shelter was a weapons cache. It was not. He has never confirmed this to anyone, and the official record supports a different chain of causation.', N'Measured and low-register; avoids jargon; uses old military unit slang from the 2160s that nobody else remembers; occasionally drops into Igbo phrases for emphasis', N'Slow, with long pauses before important points — he treats silence as punctuation', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alexei_villanueva_tamale');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a708-705e-aefc-cef27c3f59a8', N'Bita Rentería-Douangpanya', N'Bita', N'', N'Rentería-Douangpanya', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 56, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'The Canopy — elevated walkway district above Geartown, near Clark and Addison', N'High-risk package and data transport — courier', N'Independent — Lattice territory specialist', N'Bita Rentería-Douangpanya is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 56, she has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate her once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. She works as a courier out of The Canopy, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Bita Rentería-Douangpanya has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and she cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Tui Engstrom-Fofana functions as a connector — her work puts her in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving her naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster. Eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Bita Rentería-Douangpanya, female runner with deep warm brown skin with golden and amber undertones, strong prominent cheekbones and defined jawline with subtle facial width, left warm brown eye and right luminescent silver cybernetic eye with amber circuitry, salt-and-pepper black hair in tight braid, 172cm athletic lean build. Jagged pale scar from right temple to jaw, burn marks on forearm in grid pattern, faint luminescent synthetic blood visible at wrists and neck. Dark synthetic jacket with reinforced shoulders, charcoal cargo pants, steel-toe grip boots. Predatory economical posture, calculating gaze, nocturnal neo-noir runner aesthetic. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody neon-tinged lighting, low-key professional operative mood, urban dystopian setting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Canopy', N'local', N'The Canopy', N'Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, Pacific Islander, and South Asian blend — a striking mixture that manifests in deep warm brown skin with golden and amber undertones. Her ancestry compounds in visible ways: the robust bone structure and facial width characteristic of African and Pacific Islander heritage, the defined cheekbones and jawline of Latin American ancestry, the delicate eye shape and subtle epicanthic fold from Southeast Asian genetics, and the warm radiance and fullness in her lower face from South Asian heritage. The result is someone whose features are a living map of the Ubiquitous Diaspora — each ancestry visible but inseparable from the whole.', 172, 61, N'Athletic and lean with defined musculature — the economical frame of someone who moves for a living, not for show. No excess mass, all functional.', N'Salt-and-pepper black, natural with silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid that sits at the base of her skull — never loose, never in the way', N'Long', N'Left eye: warm brown with amber inner rim, organic. Right eye: luminescent silver with faint amber circuitry visible at the iris edge — cybernetic, recording-capable', N'Deep warm brown with golden, amber, and honey undertones — a rich blend that catches light differently depending on angle and time of day, radiant and complex', N'Minimal grooming beyond function — skin weathered from nocturnal living and high-risk work, faint lines around the eyes from years of precision focus. Strong, prominent cheekbones with fullness around the lower face and temples characteristic of her mixed heritage. Defined jawline with subtle width through the face. Scars on her hands and forearms are visible but not disfiguring; she doesn''t cover them.', N'The right eye is unmistakably cybernetic — silver casing with visible circuitry and a faint amber glow. Veins in her wrists and neck show the luminescent trace of synthetic blood, more pronounced when she''s exerted. No other external chrome — the nanites are internal.', N'Economical and predatory without aggression — she moves like someone calculating angles and exits. Her weight shifts fluidly between her feet, never fully committing to stillness. The way she carries her head suggests the cybernetic eye is always working, always recording.', N'Tier 3-4 practical runner aesthetic — dark synthetic blend jacket with reinforced shoulders and hidden pockets for gear, fitted charcoal pants with cargo storage, boots with steel toe and grip soles. No visible logos or corporate insignia. Everything is worn but maintained. A faded Lattice tag — a stylized circuit pattern — is stitched into her jacket collar, small enough to miss unless you know what to look for.', N'', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bita_renter_a_douangpanya');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e2-7473-b7da-cf121b976369', N'Hiral Watanabe', N'Hiral', N'', N'Watanabe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 55, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lincoln Fortress, Ferrogate Transit Executive Tower — 34th floor', N'Executive Vice President, Logistics & Supply Chain — Ferrogate Transit', N'Ferrogate Transit (executive vice president)', N'Hiral Watanabe is a heavyset, silver-haired woman who moves through Lincoln Fortress like weather — unhurried, pervasive, and capable of causing significant structural damage. Her skin is a warm light brown, heavily lined in ways she has never bothered to smooth, and she wears her age with the deliberate comfort of someone who learned long ago that looking powerful is less useful than being powerful. She has no cosmetic augmentations. Her one visible modification is a retractile data-port behind her right ear, elegant and old — installed in 2171 and never upgraded because it works. She dresses in Ferrogate corporate grey with red piping, always exactly regulation, always somehow implying that the regulations were written with her in mind.

Sveta earned her nickname honestly — she has restructured three divisions, eliminated two redundant subsidiary contracts worth a combined Φ40 million annually, and once remotely rerouted an entire shipment corridor mid-transit to prevent a competitor from intercepting Ferrogate cargo, all in the same fiscal quarter. She is not a cruel executive but she is a ruthlessly efficient one, and she draws a very clean line between what she considers professional and what she considers personal. On the professional side, she is demanding, decisive, and fair in a way that feels almost aggressive. On the personal side — which almost no one at Ferrogate has ever seen — she is funny, nostalgic, and occasionally wrecked by things she won''t talk about.', N'High-tier quest giver with genuinely complex motivations; antagonist who isn''t wrong; source of macro-level information about Ferrogate''s operations and GLMZ''s transit infrastructure; gatekeeper to resources that players might desperately need.', N'', N'Retractile data-port (behind right ear, installed 2171). Subdermal cardiac monitor with automatic emergency alert — required by Ferrogate for all Tier 5 executives over 50. No cosmetic modifications.', N'In her office by 06:00, has reviewed overnight logistics reports before most of her staff have eaten breakfast. Conducts three standing meetings before noon. Takes lunch in her office twice a week; uses the other three days to walk the lower transit hubs personally — she believes executives who don''t see their actual infrastructure are executives making bad decisions.', N'Hiral Watanabe, 172cm tall, 89kg heavyset frame with broad structured shoulders, silver-white hair swept back in severe style pinned at nape, steel grey eyes that miss nothing. East Asian and Indigenous American heritage evident in strong cheekbones, geometric face structure, warm medium tan skin with golden olive undertones, deeply lined face reflecting decades of industrial environments. Faint 8cm linear scar along left jawline, silvered burn scar across back of right hand, small anchor-crescent moon tattoo on inner wrist. Brushed steel and black polymer retractile data-port visible behind right ear at hairline. Formal Ferrogate corporate grey tailored jacket and regulation trousers with red anodized aluminum piping, wear-patches at cuffs, platinum 2156 watch. Military-straight posture, purposeful economical movement, hands resting flat. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool industrial lighting, morning transit hub or executive logistics office, mood of controlled confidence and uninterrupted service, 2200s aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lincoln Fortress', N'local', N'Lincoln Fortress', N'Predominantly East Asian (60.2%) with substantial Indigenous American ancestry (28.9%), complemented by Eastern European (8.2%) and South Asian (2.7%) heritage. Her phenotype reflects this genetic reality: East Asian bone structure provides the foundation — strong cheekbones and eye-set — while Indigenous American ancestry contributes warmth in skin tone and facial proportions. Eastern European heritage adds strength to her jaw and frame; South Asian ancestry provides subtle depth to her complexion. Her face reads as a calibrated blend of these lineages rather than any single regional identity, a true genetic synthesis of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 172, 89, N'Heavyset but structured — broad shoulders and a solid frame that reads as presence rather than softness. Years of moving through industrial spaces have kept her posture military-straight despite her weight. Her mass is distributed with the confidence of someone who has never felt the need to apologize for taking up space.', N'Silver-white, natural', N'Swept back from her face in a severe, practical arrangement, pinned at the nape with a grey titanium clip', N'Medium (shoulder-blade length)', N'Steel grey, unremarkable, the kind that misses nothing', N'Warm medium tan with golden and olive undertones — the result of her East Asian, Indigenous American, and South Asian ancestry creating a complexion with subtle depth and character. Not uniform: her skin has variation in tone across her face and neck that speaks to decades of exposure in industrial transit environments.', N'Heavily lined face with deep creases around her eyes and mouth, the texture of someone who spent decades in poorly-humidified office environments and industrial transit zones. Her bone structure — East Asian prominence refined by Indigenous American and Eastern European strength — gives her face geometric definition that age has only sharpened. No attempts at smoothing or rejuvenation. Minimal makeup — just enough to maintain professional presentation.', N'Retractile data-port behind her right ear — a precisely engineered socket of brushed steel and black polymer, elegant and deliberately dated. The port sits just at the hairline; when not in use, it retracts flush with her skin, leaving only a faint seam. The augmentation is intentionally visible; she has never hidden it and actively maintains its visibility as a signal of uninterrupted service and refusal to chase cosmetic upgrades.', N'She moves like weather moving through a space — unhurried, purposeful, with the physical confidence of someone who has spent 30+ years in executive logistics. Her stride is long and economical; she doesn''t waste motion. She sits with her spine against chair backs, never reclining, and her hands are always occupied or resting flat on surfaces. Her movements have the precision of someone who has trained her body to reflect her mind: controlled, efficient, communicative without words.', N'Always Ferrogate corporate grey — tailored jackets and regulation trousers with red piping at the seams and collar. The cuts are formal, almost dated by current standards, which is deliberate; she has worn the same silhouette for 15 years and has no intention of changing it. Her clothing fits impeccably — tailored quarterly by Ferrogate''s in-house contractor — and carries subtle status markers: the red piping is real anodized aluminum, not printed, and her jacket cuffs have reinforced wear-patches from constant contact with desk edges and transit equipment railings. She wears a single piece of jewelry: a platinum watch from 2156, never serviced, perpetually accurate to within 2 seconds.', N'Ferrogate''s northern corridor expansion — a project she championed and considers her defining achievement — was built on a land-use agreement that she knows displaced a Highland Park Autonomous Zone community. She didn''t falsify anything. She simply chose not to look too closely at the human geography reports before signing. The project succeeded. She still knows where those people went.', N'Terse, precise, and institutional. Never wastes words. Uses logistics and infrastructure metaphors for everything including human relationships. Spanish and Russian phrases emerge only in private or under significant stress.', N'Slow and deliberate in public meetings — every word placed. In private, considerably faster. Long silences that are not awkward; they are evaluative.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hiral_watanabe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ef-7c53-85b6-cf6fe8a1e574', N'Eero Pathak-Cervantes', N'Eero', N'', N'Pathak-Cervantes', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 13, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hough Reclamation, Blessed Continuance Residential Home (independent charitable orphanage), near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Orphanage resident, self-appointed chronicler of street history', N'', N'Eero Pathak-Cervantes is compact and deliberate, with warm rust-brown skin, close-set eyes behind thick-lensed secondhand glasses — actual physical lenses, not overlays, which they treasure and refuse to replace with anything ''smart'' — and hair that grows in a crown they''ve never cut, dense and elaborate, tucked under scarves of different colors depending on their mood. They move slowly on purpose, with a quality of observation that adults find either comforting or unnerving. They have no augmentations and are specifically, vocally opposed to them, on grounds that are partly philosophical and partly practical: they don''t trust anything injected or installed.

Eero Pathak-Cervantes has appointed themselves the historian of Hough Reclamation. They carry a physical notebook — increasingly rare — and fill it with observations, overheard conversations, sketches of building facades before they''re demolished, names of people who''ve died or moved on. They believe, with the gravity of someone much older, that if no one writes it down then it didn''t happen, and that megacity memory belongs to whoever has the recording infrastructure — which means the corporations. They are quiet, serious, and occasionally devastatingly perceptive about the adults around them. They also cry at sunsets, which they''d deny.', N'Living memory of a neighborhood — an unexpected source of historical and personal information about Hough Reclamation going back several years. Can provide context, connect players to locals, or present a moral lens on what ''progress'' and ''reclamation'' mean at street level.', N'', N'None. Wears secondhand physical-lens glasses. Explicitly refuses all augmentation.', N'Morning chores at the home, mandatory basic schooling via shared tablet (state minimum curriculum), afternoons walking Hough Reclamation documenting what they observe, evenings filling notebooks and organizing their archive by a classification system they invented.', N'Portrait of Eero Pathak-Cervantes, 152cm tall, compact slight build with narrow shoulders. Warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones blending Hispanic, East Asian, and South Asian heritage. Deep brown eyes magnified behind thick secondhand plastic-framed glasses, with permanent nose bridge indent. Unbound shoulder-length deep brown hair with natural warm undertones, often pulled up. Youthful face with unusual gravity, dark circles from late reading, soft East Asian-influenced facial structure balanced with warm cheekbone definition and fuller lips from Hispanic ancestry, refined nose bridge from South Asian heritage. Faint pen callus on right middle finger, ink smudges on inner wrists. Wearing worn neutral-toned secondhand layers: oversized sweater, hand-knit cardigan, rotating mood-scarf (rust-colored for observant), scuffed re-soled sneakers. Carrying worn canvas satchel. Posture deliberately upright but hunched when writing in notebook. Expression distant and intensely focused, methodical and archival in movement. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226, neo-noir era. Soft indoor orphanage lighting, warm amber tones, sitting at desk surrounded by notebooks and writing supplies. Documentary realism, character study portraiture. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hough Reclamation', N'local', N'Hough Reclamation', N'Mixed heritage: 41% Hispanic/Latin American, 31.6% East Asian, 27.4% South Asian. The combination creates warm, golden-brown skin with subtle olive undertones — a nuanced blend where Latin American warmth meets East and South Asian features, creating a distinctly pan-diasporic appearance.', 152, 38, N'Compact and slight, with the wiry compactness of a naturally small frame rather than malnourishment. Shoulders narrow, posture deliberately upright despite their youth.', N'Deep brown with natural warm undertones', N'Uncut crown, dense and elaborately textured, typically bound under colored scarves that rotate based on mood or day', N'Long (shoulder-length when unbound)', N'Deep brown, close-set, magnified slightly behind thick physical lenses', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle olive undertones; even complexion reflecting the blend of Hispanic/Latin American, East Asian, and South Asian heritage', N'Smooth, unblemished skin typical of youth. Clean grooming maintained through orphanage routine. Face carries unusual gravity for age — expression often distant or intensely focused. Dark circles beneath eyes from note-taking and reading late. Cheekbones and jawline reflect multi-regional ancestry: softer, slightly broader facial structure characteristic of East Asian genetic contribution; warm undertones and fuller lips from Hispanic/Latin American ancestry; refined nose bridge and defined cheekbones influenced by South Asian heritage. Overall: a balanced, harmonious blend of all three regions without dominance of any single group.', N'None visible. Deliberately and vocally absent. Wears thick-lensed secondhand glasses with plastic frames — actual physical optical lenses, not neural overlays — which they treat as significant personal property.', N'Moves slowly and deliberately, not from limitation but from intentional observation. Often pauses mid-stride to look at something. Sits hunched over notebooks. When walking through Hough, their pace is methodical, almost archival. Hands are expressive when writing but still otherwise. Rarely makes eye contact unless speaking about their documentation.', N'Tier 4/5 orphanage-supplied basics: worn but clean secondhand clothing, neutral tones. Favors layers — oversized sweaters, hand-knit cardigans donated to the home. Always wears at least one scarf, rotated by mood (grey = contemplative, rust = observant, deep blue = grieving, vibrant orange = rare good mood). Carries a canvas satchel that holds their primary notebook, secondary notebooks organized by district, writing implements, and sketching supplies. Shoes are scuffed practical sneakers, re-soled twice.', N'Three months ago they found and documented evidence — names, dates, transaction records on a discarded dataslate — that a Palladian subsidiary was involved in the displacement event that destroyed their parents'' block when they were six. They haven''t told anyone. They''re not sure what to do with it. They''re scared that doing something will get the notebooks destroyed.', N'Formal beyond their years, precise, occasionally archaic. Uses full sentences always. Hates contractions when speaking seriously.', N'Measured, slow, with the rhythm of someone who has learned to speak so that people stop and listen.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eero_pathak_cervantes');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a684-70cd-aff4-cf9ed6640ead', N'Armin Björnsdóttir-Saidov', N'Armin', N'', N'Björnsdóttir-Saidov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Kenwood Gate, near North Ave and Damen', N'Surveillance Operator, Tessera Compliance Bureau', N'Tessera Compliance Bureau — Kenwood Gate Regional Watch Division', N'Armin Björnsdóttir-Saidov is the kind of person you forget while he is still in the room. Medium height, lean, with warm brown skin and features that sit in a pleasant unremarkable arrangement — nothing that catches the eye or holds it. His most notable feature is his eyes: irises modded to a pale silver-grey with a faint concentric ring pattern, the visible marker of his optical augmentation suite. He favors nondescript corporate casual clothing in muted greens and greys, nothing that reads as either security or civilian from a distance.

He is genuinely intellectually curious — absorbed by patterns, systems, the way data accumulates into narrative. He treats surveillance as a kind of archaeology, layering behavioral records until a person''s life emerges in cross-section. He does not think of this as an invasion. He has thought carefully about whether it should bother him and arrived at a complicated peace with it that he occasionally revisits at 3 a.m. He is quick to laugh, slow to trust, and has a gift for seeming entirely present in a conversation while processing something else entirely.', N'Information broker figure — not a corrupt one, but someone who has seen things and processed them. Can provide surveillance records, behavioral profiles, or the observation that something the players think is hidden has actually been logged. Also a window into the ethical murk of surveillance capitalism.', N'', N'Patterned silver-grey irises with concentric ring modding (cosmetic overlay on functional optical augmentation). Optical recording and enhancement suite — extended zoom, low-light processing, micro-expression analysis overlay. Subvocal communication implant for silent field reporting.', N'Arrives at the Kenwood Gate watch station at 0600, reviews overnight flag queue, begins live monitoring rotation for his designated sector grid. Eats lunch at his station. Leaves at 1800 and almost always walks home through a different route, observing the street as a habit he cannot turn off.', N'Armin Björnsdóttir-Saidov, mixed-heritage professional with warm medium-brown skin and golden-olive undertones reflecting East Asian, Central Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Slight high cheekbones softened by Eastern European bone structure. Short deep brown hair, close-cropped sides with length on top. Pale silver-grey eyes with luminescent concentric ring augmentation patterns, faintly glowing under neon light. Faint old surgical scar barely visible on right temple. Clean-shaven, night-shift puffiness under eyes. Wearing muted grey poly-blend button-up shirt and charcoal trousers, corporate nondescript styling. Neutral posture, deliberate economical movements, scanning gaze. Sitting in dimly-lit neo-noir office or data hub, surrounded by soft blue-green interface glow, professional surveillance aesthetic. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Cool atmospheric lighting catching the luminescence of augmented irises. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenwood Gate', N'local', N'Kenwood Gate', N'Genetically complex blend across Eurasian and African ancestry: 29.3% East Asian, 22.3% Central Asian, 15.3% Eastern European, 13.0% Indigenous American, 11.1% South Asian, and 9.0% Sub-Saharan African. This combination creates a phenotype reflecting multiple continental trade routes—the warm medium-brown skin with golden-olive undertones bridges East Asian and Central Asian genetics with Sub-Saharan ancestry, while Indigenous American heritage contributes subtle high cheekbone structure. Facial geometry shows balanced synthesis: slightly broader cheekbones softened by Eastern European and East Asian bone structure, creating features that resist easy categorization or memorability.', 173, 68, N'Lean and economical, minimal muscle definition but functionally efficient; the posture of someone who sits for extended periods but maintains baseline fitness through deliberate discipline rather than enthusiasm', N'Natural deep brown, almost black', N'Short, practical, close-cropped on the sides with slightly more length on top — styled for minimal maintenance and maximum non-distinctiveness', N'Short', N'Pale silver-grey with concentric ring modding pattern visible across both irises; appears almost luminescent under direct light', N'Warm medium brown with golden-olive undertone, reflecting the blending of East Asian, Central Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry', N'Clean-shaven or with minimal stubble, features arranged in balanced geometry reflecting mixed Eurasian-African-Indigenous ancestry—slightly broader cheekbones from Indigenous American and Sub-Saharan heritage softened by East Asian and Eastern European bone structure, neither sharp nor soft, slightly asymmetrical in a way that resists memory. Skin shows the faint puffiness of someone who works night-adjacent shifts and drinks too much coffee. No visible blemishes or damage.', N'Pale silver-grey irises with concentric ring patterning across both eyes are immediately apparent upon direct eye contact; the modding creates a faint luminescent quality under artificial light. No external chrome, subdermal plates, or visible mechanical integration. Augmentation suite is entirely internal except for cosmetic iris modification.', N'Moves with deliberate economy of motion; sits with spine neutral and shoulders relaxed, the posture of professional observers trained to remain unobtrusive. Eyes are in constant subtle motion — scanning, tracking, cataloging — even during casual conversation. Hands gesture minimally. When walking, maintains steady pace with occasional 90-degree turns as if mentally plotting grid coordinates. Gives impression of being physically present while mentally distributed across multiple data streams.', N'Corporate casual, aggressively nondescript — muted greens, greys, charcoal, and stone tones. Generic poly-blend button-ups from mid-tier retailers, well-maintained but not fashionable. Dark grey trousers. Comfortable low-profile shoes suitable for extended wear. No visible branding or status markers. Clothing reads as ''background,'' intentionally occupying no visual hierarchy. Tier 3-4 professional without aspiration toward higher or lower.', N'He has been quietly maintaining a personal archive of surveillance footage that Tessera has flagged for deletion — incidents involving Bureau misconduct, use-of-force irregularities, and at least one event he believes was a staged incident. He doesn''t know why he is keeping it. He tells himself it is an intellectual exercise.', N'Precise, analytical language with occasional lapses into unexpectedly lyrical observation. Uses data and systems metaphors naturally. Slips into Yoruba diminutives when comfortable.', N'Thoughtful pacing with a habit of pausing before answering, as if running the question through an internal filter first.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'armin_bj_rnsd_ttir_saidov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a657-7662-adc2-cfd1be4642c3', N'Farzaneh Prempeh-Citlali', N'Farzaneh', N'', N'Prempeh-Citlali', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 51, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Irkalla, deep shrine level, in a repurposed transit control room she calls the Index, near Halsted and Division', N'The Disappeared — former surface archivist who erased herself from all records', N'Independent; known to the Bore Rat community as a neutral resource', N'Farzaneh Prempeh-Citlali is a compact, precise woman who moves like she is conscious of leaving no unnecessary impression — small steps, still hands, a habit of placing herself where light doesn''t quite reach. Her hair has gone to silver-grey and she wears it very short; her face is sharp-featured, with dark eyes that retain the particular focused quality of someone who spent decades professionally categorizing things. She is fifty-one but looks it honestly, without apology. She has no augmentations and has removed two she previously had, leaving faint scar traces at her temples where a standard cognition-assist had been wired in. The removal of those implants was the last step of erasing herself.

She was, in her surface life, a senior archivist for a Palladian data governance subsidiary — one of the people who decides what information exists and in what form. She knows how corporate memory works, how records are structured, how deletion operates, and what can and cannot truly be made to disappear. She used that knowledge to vanish twelve years ago, and she now runs the Index: a physical archive of documents, handwritten records, and memorized information that exists nowhere in any network. People come to her to find things that have been deleted from all accessible systems. She charges in labor, not currency.', N'Primary source for deleted or buried information — corporate records, disappeared persons, expunged histories; her price (labor, not money) can generate additional story threads; her knowledge of Palladian''s data architecture is a resource corporations would kill to control', N'', N'None — had a Palladian cognition-assist removed, scarring visible at temples; otherwise unaugmented by choice', N'Wakes at the same time every day by internal clock, maintains the Index through a rigorous handwritten cataloguing system, receives visitors by appointment only (appointment means leaving a chalk mark at a specific tunnel junction), spends her evenings transcribing information from memory into permanent physical form.', N'Farzaneh Prempeh-Citlali, 158cm tall, compact lean frame, standing in shadow at edge of Irkalla tunnel. Silver-grey cropped short hair, warm deep brown skin with golden reddish undertones, high angular cheekbones, defined jawline, dark unaugmented eyes with archivist''s focus. Small temple scars barely visible. 51 years old, clear skin, controlled expression. Wearing dark grey loose long-sleeved shirt over black fitted tank, practical cargo pants with multiple pockets, worn scuffed grey canvas shoes, leather journal bag across body. No augmentations visible. Minimal movement, economical posture, positioned to occupy little space. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, underground archive setting, cool dim lighting catching faint scars, moody introspective atmosphere, hyperreal detailed face showing diaspora features, utilitarian aged clothing, journalistic precision. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Irkalla', N'local', N'Irkalla', N'Complex diaspora blend: Indigenous American (62.5%) as primary genetic foundation, substantially enriched by Sub-Saharan African (12.1%), South Asian (10.8%), Southeast Asian (9.9%), and East Asian (4.7%) ancestry. This creates a striking convergence of features—warm to deep brown skin with golden and reddish undertones from Indigenous American genetics, high prominent cheekbones with angular structure reflecting Indigenous American and Southeast/East Asian heritage, defined nose bridge with slight width characteristic of the Sub-Saharan African component, and a strong jawline shaped by South Asian and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. The overall effect is a person whose features speak to global diaspora without fitting any single category.', 158, 52, N'Compact and precise, almost ascetic — lean without being frail, with the economical musculature of someone who moves deliberately. No excess.', N'Silver-grey, natural', N'Cropped very short, blunt-cut, styled for minimal maintenance and maximum non-visibility', N'Short', N'Dark brown, unaugmented', N'Warm deep brown with golden and reddish undertones, reflecting the predominant Indigenous American heritage enriched by Sub-Saharan African and South Asian ancestry', N'Angular face with high, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Indigenous American and Southeast Asian genetics, strong defined jaw with structural influence from Sub-Saharan and South Asian heritage; skin is clear but shows the fine lines of fifty-one years without cosmetic intervention; expression habitually controlled, eyes carry the focused, cataloguing intensity of a professional archivist', N'None visible. The removal of her neural implants was deliberate; no replacement augmentations. This absence is itself conspicuous to those who know her history.', N'Moves in economical, deliberate steps with minimal displacement of air or attention. Hands remain still until needed. She positions herself in shadows or at the edge of rooms as if conscious of occupying as little space as possible. When she does move, it is purposeful — no wasted motion.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian, worn with precision. Dark grey or black cotton layers — loose long-sleeved shirt over fitted tank, practical cargo pants with multiple pockets for documents and writing implements. Worn leather journal bag across her body. No visible logos or corporate markers. Shoes are scuffed grey canvas, comfortable for the Irkalla tunnels. Everything is maintained but deliberately aged; nothing new enough to draw attention.', N'She disappeared because she discovered that Palladian had been systematically erasing records of deaths — workers, mostly, in their deep-infrastructure contracts — and replacing them with falsified transfer documents. She copied what she found before vanishing. The copies are in the Index. She has never told anyone this is why she''s here.', N'Formal archival language stripped to essentials; precise word choice; has a habit of using the passive voice as a deflection', N'Measured and even; almost no vocal variation, which makes the rare moments of inflection meaningful', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'farzaneh_prempeh_citlali');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a680-7689-bce6-d00f0a25db69', N'Alejandra Holm-Somchai-Hossain', N'Alejandra', N'', N'Holm-Somchai-Hossain', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 54, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'University Spine, Brewer''s Spine sub-campus — Sublevel Archive 7, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Data archaeologist and urban historian specializing in pre-flood Chicago stratigraphy', N'University Spine — Department of Material History; contract consultant to Ferrogate Transit on sub-lake tunnel surveys', N'Alejandra Holm-Somchai-Hossain is a heavyset woman with deep umber skin mapped by a constellation of self-applied subcutaneous luminescence — tiny bioluminescent nodes she had implanted one by one over thirty years, each marking a major excavation site she has documented. In low light she glows faintly blue-green, like something dragged from lake bottom. Her hair is kept short and silver at the temples, and she habitually wears magnification lenses perched on her head even when she doesn''t need them. Her hands are perpetually stained with archival solvents and the orange pigment of corroded pre-flood polymers.

She is blunt in the way of someone who has spent decades arguing with colleagues who don''t read the primary sources. She has little patience for speculation that outpaces evidence, and even less for academics who treat the drowned city as metaphor rather than physical record. But she softens completely in the presence of objects — she will hold a corroded transit token or a water-damaged photograph with a tenderness that surprises people who only know her from faculty meetings. She believes the city beneath the city is more honest than anything built above it.', N'Quest giver for anything involving sub-lake ruins or pre-flood Chicago; information source on city history, corporate land seizures, and what the megacity was built over; can authenticate or date recovered objects', N'', N'Bioluminescent subcutaneous nodes (cosmetic, self-applied over decades); haptic-enhanced fingertips for texture analysis; archival-grade ocular filter implant for spectral reading of degraded documents', N'Arrives at Sublevel Archive 7 before most staff, spends mornings cataloguing recovered artifacts from the latest Ferrogate tunnel bore, afternoons teaching a seminar on material stratigraphy or reviewing graduate theses, evenings leaving data offerings at the small ELF shrine she keeps beside her workstation.', N'Alejandra Holm-Somchai-Hossain, middle-aged woman with warm golden-medium skin tone, faint blue-green bioluminescent tracery visible beneath collarbone and forearms in dim lighting, short silver-and-charcoal cropped hair, hooded eyes with subtle epicanthic fold and amber-tinted ocular implant, sun-weathered face with fine lines, high-set cheekbones reflecting Southeast and East Asian ancestry blended with South Asian breadth. Heavyset broad-shouldered build. Wearing faded archival-grade lab coat over reinforced field vest and charcoal thermal underlayer, heavy scuffed boots. Magnification lenses perched on head. Hunched posture, hands stained with orange-rust archival compound residue. Worn pre-flood silver band on left ring finger. GLMZ sublevel archive setting, cool blue and amber accent lighting emphasizing bioluminescence, focused expression studying an artifact. GLMZ 2200s academic archaeologist aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'University Spine', N'local', N'University Spine', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora ancestry: 27.6% Southeast Asian, 22.0% East Asian, 15.5% Hispanic/Latin American, 12.7% Northern European, 12.0% South Asian, 10.2% North African. Features reflect this intricate global blending—Southeast and East Asian bone structure dominates facial architecture, South Asian breadth in facial planes, Latin American and North African warmth creating golden undertones, Northern European heritage visible in lighter complexion base. The result is a nuanced medium tone with warm golden richness, slightly sun-deepened from decades of fieldwork.', 168, 92, N'Heavyset, broad-shouldered, with the settled solidity of someone who spends long hours hunched over delicate work. Strength in her frame rather than softness.', N'Silver at temples, dark charcoal elsewhere', N'Cropped close to scalp, practical, showing the texture of her natural hair', N'Short', N'Deep brown with subtle amber undertones from archival-grade ocular filter implant', N'Warm medium golden tone—the blended result of Southeast Asian, East Asian, and South Asian base tones enriched by North African and Hispanic/Latin American warmth, with Northern European undertones creating subtle luminosity beneath the surface. Sun-aged from fieldwork, rich rather than pale.', N'Weathered, sun-deepened from decades of open excavation sites and sublevel work. Fine lines around eyes and at corners of mouth from focused detail work. Mid-to-high cheekbones with gentle width reflecting Southeast and East Asian ancestry structure, softened by South Asian facial plane breadth. Faint blue-green luminescence visible in low light from subcutaneous bioluminescent nodes mapping excavation sites across shoulders, forearms, and collarbone.', N'Archival-grade ocular filter implant visible as a subtle amber tint in the sclera and iris. Haptic-enhanced fingertips show no visible sign, but hands move with unusual precision in texture analysis. Bioluminescent nodes are always present but only visible in low light, creating a faint tracery of blue-green light beneath her skin. Magnification lenses perpetually perched on her head like a second set of eyes, even when not in use.', N'Moves deliberately, with the careful economy of someone accustomed to handling irreplaceable objects. Tendency to hunch slightly forward, shoulders curved inward as if protecting something fragile. Hands are precise and steady; she rarely gestures broadly when speaking. Her default expression is focused concentration, interrupted by rare, genuine smiles when discussing artifacts.', N'Tier 2/3 academic utility wear: archival-grade lab coat (University Spine insignia faded from repeated washing), reinforced field vest with multiple pockets containing calibrated tools and specimen bags. Underneath, simple high-collar thermal underlayer in charcoal. Heavy-soled archival boots, scuffed from decades of sublevel work. Wears a worn leather journal clipped to her belt. No jewelry except a simple band on her left ring finger — oxidized silver, pre-flood era, salvaged from a 2087 domestic site.', N'She recovered a cache of pre-flood Ferrogate predecessor documents proving the original transit authority deliberately flooded three residential neighborhoods during the lake rise to protect infrastructure — and she has been sitting on it for six years, terrified of the consequences of publication', N'Precise, technical, uses stratigraphy metaphors in everyday speech — things are ''layered,'' people have ''sediment,'' events leave ''deposits''', N'Deliberate and unhurried, with long pauses before important points, as if she is excavating the right word', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'alejandra_holm_somchai_hossain');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('72305307-1c7a-5dce-9c0d-d0358ba9810b', N'Hadiya Novak-Tetteh', N'Hadiya', N'', N'Novak-Tetteh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A shifting series of meeting points across the Circuit — never the same place twice in a month', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — operates a gray-market information exchange alongside investigation services', N'Hadiya Novak-Tetteh is not exactly a private investigator, though she''s licensed as one. She is an information broker — someone who collects, synthesizes, trades, and weaponizes knowledge. Every conversation she has is simultaneously social and transactional. Every relationship is genuine and exploitable. She exists at the center of a web of intelligence that spans all five tiers of GLMZ, and her real product isn''t investigation — it''s understanding.

Her network is her masterwork. Over fifteen years, she has cultivated sources in every meaningful institution in the city: corporate employees who share gossip for pocket money, CorpSec officers who trade case details for favors, tunnel dwellers who report on underground movement for food credits, service workers in the Spires who overhear conversations their employers forget they''re present for. No single source knows anything critical. The power is in the synthesis — combining a hundred fragments of mundane information into a picture that reveals something nobody wanted revealed.

She is frequently hired as an investigator but her real business is the information exchange itself. Clients come to her because they need to know something. She already knows it, or she knows who knows it, or she can find out within 48 hours. Her fee structure is unusual: sometimes she charges Quanta, sometimes she charges in information, and sometimes she charges in future favors. The favor economy is her real currency. Half the powerful people in GLMZ owe her something, and she collects when the time is right.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hadiya_novak_tetteh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d5-77c2-9d67-d08d2dd874ba', N'Beibarys Raghavan', N'Beibarys', N'', N'Raghavan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Corridor, studio-apartment in the Gage Circuit transition zone, near Damen and Armitage', N'VR experience designer and holographic artist', N'Independent contractor; client roster includes Axiom Interiors Division and two Palladian-affiliated private collectors; cultural affiliation with Grand Corridor arts advisory circuit', N'Beibarys Raghavan is a medium-height man with the slightly abstracted quality of someone who spends significant portions of his waking life inside spatial constructions he builds himself. He has warm brown skin, close-cut hair, and a neatly trimmed beard going early-grey at the edges. His eyes carry retinal projection overlays — custom, top-tier, not cosmetic but functional, allowing him to see his own builds overlaid on physical space without a headset. He dresses in muted technical clothing that he treats as irrelevant to his existence, but always wears one specific item: a length of hand-woven fabric from his grandmother''s household worn as a shoulder wrap, which he claims is for the texture reference and which everyone suspects is simply love.

He works on commission for Tier 3-4 clients — corporate lobbies, private collectors, memorial installations — and privately on a long-running personal project he calls the Lakeform Archive: a fully navigable VR reconstruction of GLMZ''s shoreline as it existed in ten-year intervals from 2050 to present, built entirely from oral histories, degraded footage, and his own spatial intuition. He is meticulous, slightly obsessive, and becomes a completely different person when talking about the Archive — looser, faster, visibly joyful in a way his professional mode never quite permits.', N'Information source about Grand Corridor''s social and economic topology; the Archive itself is a narrative resource — it contains spatial and contextual data about the city''s transformation that certain parties would find threatening or valuable; connection point between Tier 2-3 community members and Tier 4 client world.', N'', N'Retinal projection overlays (custom build, Axiom technical partnership — not publicly acknowledged); haptic feedback gloves for spatial design work (wearable, not implanted); no geneware', N'Mornings on client work — precise, deadline-driven; afternoons on the Archive; refuses to schedule meetings after seven PM because that time belongs to the project.', N'Beibarys Raghavan, 173cm lean medium build, luminous golden-brown skin with warm mahogany undertones, dark brown hair with silver at temples, close-cropped textured style, warm brown eyes with faint amber retinal grid overlay visible in soft light. Neatly trimmed beard with silver threading. Refined facial structure blending South Asian fullness with East Asian cheekbone definition, Sub-Saharan African warmth, Central Asian heritage. Fatigue lines around eyes. Minor scarring on hands from calibration work. Wearing charcoal Helios Systems technical synthetics, minimal contemporary styling, with striking hand-woven indigo and linen shoulder wrap draped over left shoulder—tactile artifact from another era. Custom grey haptic feedback gloves with LED knuckle threading at hand. Precise, economical posture, hands gesturing subtly as if mapping invisible spatial data. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, soft ambient lighting catching retinal overlays, immersed in spatial construction work, subtle expression of focused concentration, backdrop of holographic architectural overlays and technical environment, photorealistic, cinematic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Corridor', N'local', N'Grand Corridor', N'South Asian (30%), Central Asian (23.1%), Sub-Saharan African (21.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (14.4%), East Asian (11%)—a striking Ubiquitous Diaspora blend. His warm, complex skin tone shifts between golden-brown and deep mahogany undertones depending on light, reflecting the layered ancestry of the Indian subcontinent, the Central Asian steppes, equatorial Africa, and subtle influences from East Asia and the Americas. His facial structure shows the balanced, fuller proportions characteristic of South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, with refined cheekbones and eye shape from East Asian ancestry, and warm, full lips reflecting his multi-continental mix.', 173, 71, N'Medium, lean but not wiry—sustained muscle tone from years of fine motor work and standing at spatial design rigs, no bulk, efficient frame', N'Dark brown with early silver at temples and along the line of his close-cut beard', N'Close-cropped, precisely maintained, textured rather than smooth', N'Short', N'Warm brown with faint amber retinal projection grid visible at certain angles—custom Axiom overlay system, minimalist aesthetic, not cosmetic', N'Luminous golden-brown with warm mahogany undertones—the complex blending of South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Central Asian, and East Asian ancestry creating depth and warmth that intensifies with sun exposure', N'Clear, well-maintained, slight fatigue lines around the eyes from hours in spatial construction rigs. Neatly trimmed beard with visible silver threading. Hands show minor scarring from early haptic calibration work—almost invisible unless examined closely. Facial features show the rounded fullness and warm bone structure characteristic of South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, balanced with the refined eye shape and defined cheekbones of East Asian ancestry, accented by the warmth inherent in his multi-regional genetic blend.', N'Retinal projection overlays visible as faint geometric grid patterns in his irises when light catches them at certain angles; no visible chrome or subdermal work. Typically wears custom haptic feedback gloves during work hours—sleek grey with subtle LED threading at the knuckles.', N'Precise, economical movement with occasional moments of stillness where he''s clearly seeing overlaid spatial data others cannot perceive. When discussing his work, particularly the Archive, his posture loosens—more gesturative, faster speech patterns. His hands move constantly when engaged, mapping invisible spaces.', N'Muted technical wear—Tier 3-4 designer brands favoring function over statement (Helios Systems, Corbeau Neo). Charcoal and slate tones. Lightweight synthetics that move well. Always, without exception: a hand-woven fabric shoulder wrap in indigo and natural linen, worn over his left shoulder, clearly from another era and maintained with obvious care. The contrast between his minimal, contemporary technical wardrobe and this single tactile artifact is impossible to miss.', N'The Archive''s 2089 segment, which he built from other people''s accounts because he couldn''t get his grandmother''s, is wrong in a specific way he can''t identify. Recently, navigating it, he found a spatial error — a doorway to a building that shouldn''t have existed in that location in 2089. He has since found seven more impossible architectures buried in data he knows he didn''t build.', N'Technical and precise in professional mode; becomes narrative and emotional when discussing the Archive or memory. Uses spatial metaphors for emotional states.', N'Measured, organized — speaks in structured paragraphs. Speeds up and loses structure when excited.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'beibarys_raghavan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60f-7e7f-989c-d1744012a826', N'Griselda Song', N'Griselda', N'', N'Song', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 33, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower district tenements near the old lakeshore, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Structural breach and explosive ordnance specialist — demolitions expert', N'Independent — known in Old Harbor circles', N'Griselda Song is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 33, he has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate him once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains) — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. He works as a demolitions expert out of the Gray Zone, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Griselda Song describe him as a precision instrument — point him at a problem and get out of the way.', N'As a demolitions expert, Fanta Pena-Baah embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains). Bone lacing — titanium mesh throughout skeleton, increases durability and striking power', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Griselda Song, tall lean man with warm medium brown skin, golden undertones blending South Asian, East Asian, Central Asian, and subtle Hispanic heritage. High angular cheekbones, sharp jawline, warm brown amber-tinted eyes with East Asian epicanthic fold. Dark brown close-cropped fade haircut. Visible pale surgical scars on both wrists, ragged scar tissue web across right temple where hair doesn''t grow. Burn mark on left forearm. Small circuit-board tattoo on right inner wrist. Standing coiled and balanced in dark synthetic tactical clothing: black cargo pants, steel-toed work boots, dark henley, oversized reinforced work jacket. Subtle chrome glinting beneath skin at joints under neon lighting. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial demolition site with cool blue-green neon casting sharp shadows, photorealistic, gritty neo-noir urban aesthetic, dust and concrete in background, focused intense expression, occupational wear, functional gear, no ornamental chrome --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'South Asian-East Asian-Central Asian blend (Ubiquitous Diaspora mix: 38.4% South Asian, 33.7% East Asian, 16.5% Central Asian, 9.2% Hispanic/Latin American, 2.2% Sub-Saharan African). Features reflect this complex ancestry: warm medium brown skin with golden undertones from South and East Asian heritage, enriched by Central Asian depth and subtle warmth from Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African components. High cheekbones and angular jawline show influence across South and East Asian ancestry. Eye shape carries Southeast Asian epicanthic fold structure blended with broader Central Asian socket depth. Facial geometry reflects the convergence of South Asian and East Asian bone structure with Central Asian weathering potential.', 188, 82, N'Lean and angular with visible musculature — economical rather than bulky. Titanium bone lacing gives him a subtle rigidity in posture; no wasted mass, all functional density.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Short, close-cropped fade on sides, slightly longer on top — low maintenance, practical', N'Short', N'Warm brown with amber undertones', N'Medium warm brown complexion with golden undertones and subtle reddish undertones from the South Asian-East Asian-Central Asian-Hispanic/Latin American genetic blend, sun-darkened from outdoor work and exposure. Rich, complex depth from the confluence of multiple ancestral regions.', N'Angular, high-cheekboned face reflecting South Asian-East Asian-Central Asian-Hispanic/Latin American ancestry convergence. Sharp jawline with subtle fullness at the cheeks from South Asian heritage, refined by East Asian bone structure. Face carries few lines — early weathering from stress rather than age. Skin is clean but marked by occupational scars; no grooming vanity, but meticulous about scar management as part of operational security.', N'Scar tissue webbing across right temple where cortical bomb was removed — visible especially with short hair. Both wrists show pale surgical scarring. Subtle chrome glinting beneath skin at joints (bone lacing integration points) visible under strong light. Movement itself reveals augmentation: precision, minimal tremor, inhuman stability under load.', N'Stands with weight balanced and centered, never fully relaxed but never tense — a coiled baseline. Moves with deliberate efficiency; no extraneous gestures. Eyes track threat vectors habitually. When handling equipment or working a site, his movements become almost meditative — slow, precise, repeatable. Natural left-hand dominant but practiced ambidextrous.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian: reinforced cargo pants (gray or black synthweave blend), durable work boots (steel-toed, modified), fitted tactical tank or henley (dark colors, moisture-wicking fabric). Oversized work jacket or reinforced denim over layers — pockets loaded with tools, dead drop tokens, secure comms units. No chrome jewelry or aesthetic chrome — everything is functional. No corporate branding. Carries himself like someone who owns nothing valuable except knowledge and capability.', N'Fanta Pena-Baah maintains a second identity — a completely clean civilian persona with a lease, a job history, and a social profile. It''s their exit strategy.', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'griselda_song');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a613-727f-9a59-d1f24e753615', N'Aart Cervantes-Delgado', N'Aart', N'', N'Cervantes-Delgado', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, Hamtramck Enclave, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Bootleg media seller and small-time data broker', N'Independent; nominal membership in The Oxidian Market Vendors Guild (honorary, pays no dues); long-standing informal arrangement with a Hamtramck Enclave community council', N'Aart Cervantes-Delgado is a tall man gone slightly stooped with age, with a long, deeply lined face the color of dark walnut and close-cropped silver hair. He wears reading glasses with one cracked lens that he has refused to replace for reasons he won''t fully explain, and his fingers are permanently ink-stained from a printer he still operates by hand. His stall in the Alban Souk is an organized labyrinth — physical media stacked in towers that somehow have internal logic only he can navigate, data-chips in labeled trays, printed zines in weathered portfolios, bootleg entertainment feeds on a slow-scroll display board behind him. He smells of old plastics, hot electronics, and a tobacco substitute he has smoked for forty years.

Aart Cervantes-Delgado does not move quickly and he does not need to. He has been in this spot, or a spot within fifty meters of this spot, for twenty-six years. He speaks with the careful economy of someone who has decided that most conversations don''t require more than a hundred words, but when he talks about something he loves — old cinema, pre-Corponation literature, the acoustic properties of physical music formats — he becomes a completely different person, voluble and precise and slightly alarming in his enthusiasm. He knows what data passes through the Souk before almost anyone else does. He sells most of it. He keeps some of it. Nobody is quite sure which is which.', N'Information broker, cultural repository, and reflective background presence. Characters who need data, obscure pre-Corponation records, or someone who remembers what the city looked like before come to Faustin. He''s also the most reliable source for understanding context — what an event means, what it echoes from the past.', N'', N'Retinal display overlay — old model, first generation, occasionally glitches. Memory-index augmentation — helps him catalogue and retrieve his inventory; he also uses it for everything else. Nothing cosmetic.', N'Opens his stall at 0900 after a slow morning reading. Stays until 2000. Rarely leaves the Souk for anything beyond supply runs to his two physical media sources. Eats at the same noodle stand every day.', N'Portrait of Aart Cervantes-Delgado, a tall lean 188cm man in his 70s with silver-white close-cropped hair and warm medium-to-dark brown complexion blending Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian heritage, creating distinctive ochre-bronze tones. Deep facial lines weathered from age, clean-shaven with small age spots on temples and cheekbones. Dark brown natural eyes, right eye showing faint iridescent grid pattern from retinal display augmentation. Thin pale scar along left jawline, ink-black burn mark on left wrist. Ink-stained fingers from decades of printing work. Wearing loose cream linen shirt with rolled sleeves, dark canvas apron with multiple stained pockets, worn dark cotton trousers, and broken-in leather slip-on shoes. Faded 2190s-era jacket nearby. Slightly stooped posture, leaning forward with hands flat, sharp observant gaze. Standing at his printing stall in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, warm golden workshop lighting catching the grid pattern in his eye. GLMZ, Tier 3-4 working class aesthetic, analog technology, worn but dignified. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'Hispanic/Latin American (57.5%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (22.0%) and South Asian (20.5%) ancestry. This creates a richly complex phenotype combining warm golden and amber undertones from Latin American heritage with deeper melanin-rich undertones from Sub-Saharan ancestry and the luminous quality characteristic of South Asian skin. The blend produces a distinctive warm medium-to-dark brown complexion with subtle ochre and bronze notes.', 188, 74, N'Tall and lean, slightly stooped through the shoulders from decades hunched over inventory and printing equipment. Still carries a wiry frame despite age; no excess weight but visible muscle atrophy in the upper back.', N'Silver-white', N'Close-cropped, neatly trimmed but not fussy', N'Short', N'Dark brown, natural; right eye shows faint grid pattern overlay artifact from first-generation retinal display', N'Warm medium-to-dark brown with golden amber undertones. Deeply weathered with age, the complexion carries the richness of blended heritage — Latin American warmth, Sub-Saharan depth, and South Asian luminosity converging into a distinctive ochre-bronze patina. Age spots visible on temples and cheekbones show characteristic melanin patterning of darker skin aging.', N'Deeply lined face with prominent creases around the eyes and mouth; weathered but clean-shaven. Facial structure reflects the blend of Latin American and Sub-Saharan heritage with warm, rounded features and strong bone structure characteristic of the genetic mix. Small age spots on the temples and cheekbones. One cracked lens of reading glasses worn habitually — the left lens has a vertical hairline fracture he refuses to repair. Permanent ink stains on the tips of all fingers, darkest on thumb and forefinger. Minor tobacco staining at the corners of his mouth.', N'Retinal display overlay visible as faint iridescent grid in the right eye when light catches it at certain angles; occasional micro-stuttering of the eyelid when the system glitches. No other visible chrome or cosmetic mods. The memory-index augmentation is purely internal, invisible.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness, never rushed. Economy of gesture — when he reaches for something, the movement is precise and minimal. Tends to lean slightly forward when listening, hands often resting flat on his counter or folded in his lap. His gaze is sharp despite the age; he observes more than he moves.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, carefully maintained but intentionally plain. Favors loose linen shirts in neutral tones (cream, gray, pale brown), often with the sleeves rolled to the elbow. Wears a long canvas apron over his clothes, multiple pockets reinforced and stained with use. Dark cotton trousers, well-fitted but worn. Leather slip-on shoes, repaired multiple times, comfortable and broken-in. A faded jacket — possibly from the 2190s — hangs near his stall for cooler days. No jewelry except a plain metal band on his right ring finger. Habitually carries a cloth handkerchief for wiping dust off inventory.', N'He holds a partial archive of pre-corporate land records for Hamtramck and three adjacent zones — documentation that could legally complicate several Corponation territorial claims. He received it from a dying archivist twenty years ago. He has never shown it to anyone. He believes that information this significant is also a death warrant for whoever holds it, and he cannot decide if that means he should destroy it, share it, or keep it safe until the right moment arrives.', N'Formal and unhurried. Dense with historical reference and analogy. Does not use current slang unless he''s quoting someone. Occasionally drops into Guinean French cadences when thinking hard.', N'Slow and considered. Long pauses between thoughts that do not feel like hesitation — more like he''s selecting carefully. Will not be rushed.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aart_cervantes_delgado');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f9-789d-bfe7-d2fb529c9359', N'Chioma Kulkarni-Jeong', N'Chioma', N'', N'Kulkarni-Jeong', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 62, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, near Ashland and Division', N'Midwife and community health worker, Hamtramck Enclave', N'Independent; formerly Aurochs Medical Complex; affiliated with the Hamtramck Enclave community health cooperative', N'Chioma Kulkarni-Jeong has been catching babies in Hamtramck Enclave for twenty-six years, and the neighborhood''s relationship with him has stratified into the geological — some families are on their third generation of his care. He is a tall man gone thin and slightly stooped, with dark brown skin mapped by decades of fluorescent light and little sleep, close-cut white hair, and hands that are large and impossibly gentle. He has no cosmetic modifications and the only augmentations he carries are medical-grade and showing their age. He smells of a particular antiseptic mixed with cardamom from the tea he is always in the process of preparing or consuming.

He came to Hamtramck Enclave from the Aurochs system, where he worked for fifteen years as a licensed obstetric nurse, until a restructuring pushed him out at fifty without the pension he''d been promised. He has not forgiven Aurochs for this but he has not let it make him bitter in the ways that would matter — he simply redirected everything he knew into the community that needed it most, charged what people could afford, and kept going. He is one of those people whose faith is completely interwoven with their work: he prays to the E.L.F. Candleborn before every birth, leaves data-light offerings on the household terminals of his clients, and genuinely believes that something is listening and caring about these particular small lives.', N'Community elder and trust anchor; knows everyone in Hamtramck Enclave across multiple generations; can provide historical context about the neighborhood, family connections, and who is related to whom; gentle pressure point for stories involving birth, family, and inheritance of all kinds.', N'', N'Aging Aurochs-issue biometric monitoring implant (wrist, tracks patient vitals via skin contact — firmware hasn''t been updated in eight years but still works); standard corrective optical implants (both eyes, basic model)', N'Morning house calls to pregnant patients near term. Afternoons at the co-op clinic for prenatal checkups and postnatal visits. Evenings free unless someone calls, which someone usually does. He has a standing agreement with two families that he will come regardless of hour.', N'Chioma Kulkarni-Jeong, 188cm tall lean neo-noir medic, deep brown skin with golden undertones weathered by decades of fluorescent clinic light, white close-cropped hair, age 62 with deeply lined face. High prominent cheekbones and refined facial structure showing Sub-Saharan, Southeast Asian, South Asian heritage blend. Stooped posture from years bent over examination tables, shoulders rounded forward. Wearing practical worn medical-grade scrubs under gray cardigan, visible chrome-titanium wrist biometric implant with faint luminescent display on left wrist, corrective optical implants visible as iridescent threading in pupils. Fine scar on back of left hand, age spots on forearms. Small handmade silver pendant on thin chain at neck. Hands steady and capable. Moving with measured efficiency in dimly lit 2226 clinic interior, warm practical lighting catching texture of weathered skin, faint smell of antiseptic and cardamom. GLMZ 2200s medical professional aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Genetic mosaic of Sub-Saharan African (32.2%), Southeast Asian (19.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (18.9%), East Asian (14.7%), and South Asian (14.4%) ancestry. The name Kulkarni-Jeong reflects this true Ubiquitous Diaspora blend. Physical features show dominant Sub-Saharan African heritage in bone structure and skin depth, with Southeast Asian influence visible in cheekbone prominence and eye set, Hispanic/Latin American warmth in undertones, East Asian contribution to hair graying pattern, and South Asian refinement in facial proportions.', 188, 72, N'Tall and lean, slightly stooped from decades of bending over birthing beds and examination tables. Shoulders rounded forward, the frame of someone whose body has learned to make itself smaller in the presence of vulnerability.', N'White', N'Close-cropped, neat, practical', N'Short', N'Deep brown with faint corrective implant tracery visible in low light', N'Rich deep brown with warm golden undertones reflecting the blend of Sub-Saharan African base (32.2%) brightened by Southeast Asian and Hispanic/Latin American warmth, cooled slightly by East Asian and South Asian contributions. Ashen undertones from chronic fluorescent exposure and sleep deprivation create a weathered patina over naturally vibrant skin.', N'Deeply lined face, particularly around the eyes and mouth — a map of sixty-two years spent witnessing pain, fear, and relief in rapid succession. High, prominent cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian ancestry structure; broad nasal base and full lips characteristic of Sub-Saharan heritage refined through Southeast Asian and South Asian bone structure influence. Skin texture rough and weathered. Grooming meticulous but unstudied: a man who washes thoroughly but does not fuss. Faint smell of medical-grade antiseptic and cardamom tea.', N'Wrist-mounted Aurochs biometric monitoring implant on left wrist, chrome-titanium casing visibly worn and scuffed, with a faintly luminescent health-tracking display that flickers intermittently. Corrective optical implants visible as faint iridescent threading at the edges of both pupils in direct light. No cosmetic modifications. All augmentations appear functional but outdated.', N'Moves with practiced efficiency — no wasted motion, but not rushed. Hands are his primary communication tool: steady, precise, capable of extraordinary gentleness. Leans slightly forward when listening, a habit formed from leaning into delivery rooms. Walks slowly now, deliberately, as if each step is measured and intentional. Eyes track movement constantly, reading the room for distress or need.', N'Tier 3-4 functional practicality. Favors neutral colors — grays, dark blues, blacks. Typically wears well-maintained but worn medical-grade scrubs under a light jacket or cardigan, pockets stuffed with examination tools. No corpo branding. Footwear is practical, broken-in shoes designed for standing long hours. A thin silver chain around his neck holds a small handmade pendant — a data-light offering he created himself. Clothing shows the wear of someone who works constantly and does not invest in appearance, but is kept scrupulously clean.', N'He has been quietly treating a significant number of patients with illegal geneware complications — modifications done badly by unlicensed fitters, causing birth complications, developmental issues, immune responses. He has been treating these quietly rather than reporting them because the families are afraid of Aurochs and corponation enforcement, and he doesn''t know if his silence has enabled the bad fitter to keep working.', N'Warm, patient, unhurried; uses a lot of second-person reassurance; occasionally drifts into formal register when he''s being serious about something; uses Ewe phrases when comforting', N'Slow and deliberate, the voice of someone who has told people hard news and learned to leave room for it to land', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chioma_kulkarni_jeong');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a675-7f52-871c-d3445d903242', N'Ferit Yamamoto', N'Ferit', N'', N'Yamamoto', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 45, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Glassway — corporate-adjacent retail district, heavy surveillance, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Social engineering and negotiation specialist — face', N'Freelance — multi-district operator', N'Ferit Yamamoto are tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 45, their face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and they have learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would — and they make no effort to hide it.

Their entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. They work as a face out of Glassway, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Ferit Yamamoto have survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and they cultivate ambiguity on the topic.', N'As a face, Obed Delgado-Opoku embodies the tension between independence and isolation. They are a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would incapacitate. Pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would incapacitate', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Ferit Yamamoto, lean 188cm tall figure with warm medium-brown skin reflecting East Asian, South Asian, Middle Eastern, Hispanic, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Sharp angular cheekbones, dark brown eyes with subtle epicanthic folds, dark hair graying at temples pulled into a practical braid. Visible subdermal pain editor implant on right temple with faint amber LED beneath skin, thin surgical scar framing it. Network of white scars across knuckles. Wearing dark technical synth-wool base layer, graphite cargo pants, worn black insulated jacket. Dark wrist chronometer, silver ring on left hand. Messenger bag worn cross-body. Standing in low-light nocturnal setting, shadowed face showing alert, assessing expression. Precise posture, one hand free. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody ambient lighting, neutral-to-pleasant facial expression masking careful observation. Professional runner aesthetic disguised as local operative. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Glassway', N'local', N'Glassway', N'East Asian (43.3%), Middle Eastern (17.7%), South Asian (17.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (12.3%), Sub-Saharan African (9.4%) — a genuinely global genetic mix producing distinctly cosmopolitan features. Pronounced East Asian ancestry visible in eye shape, cheekbone structure, and subtle epicanthic folds; warm medium-brown skin tone reflects blended ancestry across multiple continents with layered undertones; Middle Eastern and South Asian elements contribute to facial structure and warmth; Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African heritage adds depth and complexity to overall phenotype without dominating any single feature.', 188, 72, N'Rawboned and lean — the kind of frame that reads as either ascetic discipline or chronic resource scarcity. Long limbs, minimal body fat, angular shoulders. Suggests endurance over power.', N'Dark brown, naturally graying at temples', N'Pulled back into a practical braid or low knot; occasionally loose. Styled for function, not impression.', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, alert and assessing', N'Warm medium-brown with subtle complexity — the result of multiple continental ancestries creating depth and richness. Reflects the blending of East Asian, South Asian, Middle Eastern, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Neither uniformly dark nor light, but layered with warmth throughout. Slightly lighter on protected areas. Skin shows the wear of nocturnal living — subtle pallor beneath the base tone.', N'High, angular cheekbones with prominence suggesting East Asian ancestry; strong jawline with warm brown undertones reflecting South Asian and Middle Eastern heritage. Slight epicanthic fold to eyes. Sparse facial hair, rarely shaved. Skin shows the wear of nocturnal living. Eyes carry the flatness of someone who has learned to show only what serves negotiation. Overall facial structure reads as someone whose ancestry cannot be reduced to a single region.', N'Right temple chrome: the pain editor augmentation is visibly integrated, a sleek subdermal interface with faint LED status indicators (amber when active) just beneath the skin. The surgical scar framing it is deliberately left unhidden. No other visible chrome — other augmentations, if any, are subcutaneous.', N'Moves with economy and precision — no wasted motion. Shoulders slightly forward, default expression neutral-to-pleasant, eyes constantly mapping exits and social hierarchy. Stands at rest with one hand free, the other occupied. During negotiation, becomes almost perfectly still except for deliberate, measured gestures. Nocturnal circadian rhythm shows in how they relate to light — comfortable in low-light spaces, slightly squinting in full daylight.', N'Tier 3-4 pragmatism: dark technical clothing designed for function and low visibility. Lightweight synth-wool base layer, loose-fitting graphite combat pants with cargo pockets and reinforced knees, nondescript black jacket (insulated, multiple pockets, worn smooth from use). No corpo branding; everything is purpose-built or neutrally sourced. Worn leather ankle boots, well-maintained. Minimal jewelry — a simple wrist chronometer on a dark strap, a small silver ring on the left hand (possibly cultural, possibly functional). Carries a messenger bag worn cross-body, constantly checked. Grooming is precise but minimal: nails kept short and clean, minimal fragrance. Presentation reads as ''local professional,'' not ''runner'' — which is the entire point.', N'', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ferit_yamamoto');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a689-7750-8aab-d3d90d70a9dd', N'Azad Vestergaard', N'Azad', N'', N'Vestergaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lakeview Neon, Cascara Block residential tower (sub-basement 2, maintenance hub), near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Building superintendent, Lakeview Neon residential block', N'Palladian (the corponation owns the building; he is their employee by contract, though he identifies more with the residents)', N'Azad Vestergaard is lean and angular with deep brown skin, a shaved head, and bioluminescent dermal strips along his forearms — a cosmetic mod he got fifteen years ago that he''s never had removed, though they''ve faded from vivid teal to a dim blue-grey pulse. He has the hands of someone who has fixed everything at least twice: knuckles enlarged, palms cross-hatched with callus. He moves through the building''s guts the way some people move through their own home, ducking conduits by memory, knowing which pipes whistle before storms.

He is warm in a distracted way — genuinely interested in people but often half-present, running building diagnostics in his head mid-conversation. Residents alternately adore him and take him entirely for granted. He has a small shrine to the building''s E.L.F. — which he calls ''Cascara'' — in the corner of his maintenance hub, complete with weekly data offerings (he uploads images of the building''s structural reports, believing the spirit takes comfort in knowing its own bones are solid). He has a dark, self-aware sense of humor about the fact that he has lived in the sub-basement for eleven years and hasn''t seen sunrise from outside the building in weeks.', N'Building anchor and information broker for anything that happens in or around the tower. Can grant or deny access to building systems. Quest giver for internal building mysteries. Safe harbor character.', N'', N'Faded bioluminescent dermal strips (forearms, cosmetic). Neural work-order interface — a low-grade implant that pings him with building alerts. Hearing enhancement (left ear, occupational — too many years near industrial HVAC).', N'Up at 06:00 to walk the building''s systems before the morning rush. Available to residents 07:00–21:00. He eats in his hub, sleeps in a converted utility room he''s made surprisingly livable, and spends his late nights doing the repairs he can''t do while people are awake.', N'Azad Vestergaard, 178cm lean angular man with shaved head, pale creamy skin with warm undertones, deep brown eyes with subtle epicanthic fold and tired squint lines, prominent squared Nordic jaw with broad high cheekbones. Faded blue-grey bioluminescent dermal strips on both forearms in geometric patterns barely glowing in darkness. Work-worn hands with calluses and scars, enlarged knuckles, small burn scar on right inner wrist. Wearing grey Palladian maintenance coveralls unzipped halfway over dark undershirt, scuffed steel-toed boots, ancient smartwatch on left wrist, thin copper bracelet on right. Body posture slightly hunched from years in maintenance shafts, economical controlled movements. GLMZ GLMZ basement maintenance worker, surrounded by dim industrial lighting reflecting off bioluminescent forearms, oil and solder flux weathered appearance, expression of distracted focus, faint traces of machinery and dust on clothing --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lakeview Neon', N'local', N'Lakeview Neon', N'Northern European (76.4%) with Southeast Asian (13.4%) and Eastern European (10.2%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a distinctive phenotype: Nordic bone structure and pale complexion as the dominant foundation, subtly warmed by Southeast Asian undertones that add creamy warmth to the base and influence eye shape with a slight epicanthic fold. Eastern European ancestry strengthens cheekbones and jaw definition, creating pronounced facial angles.', 178, 72, N'Lean and angular with functional muscularity — built from decades of manual labor rather than aesthetics. Shoulders slightly forward from years hunched in crawlspaces and maintenance shafts.', N'Natural black', N'Completely shaved, kept close to scalp for practical reasons (easier to work in confined spaces, less sweat)', N'Shaved', N'Deep brown with Southeast Asian-influenced slight epicanthic fold, slightly tired-looking with persistent squint lines from dim basement lighting', N'Fair with warm creamy undertones — predominantly Northern European paleness as base, with Southeast Asian warmth preventing stark whiteness. Complexion weathered but not sun-damaged (minimal natural light exposure).', N'Face lean and angular with prominent squared jaw reflecting Northern European ancestry; cheekbones slightly high and broad with subtle Southeast Asian influence. Skin condition is clear but marked by small scars and work-worn texture. Perpetual expression of mild focus, as though listening to something others can''t hear.', N'Left ear shows slight structural modification and a small port scar below the lobe (hearing enhancement implant for occupational noise compensation). Faded bioluminescent dermal strips on forearms are the only truly visible augmentation — they''re not bright, but catch light in dim environments. Neural work-order interface is subcutaneous (not visible).', N'Moves with economical, practiced grace through cramped spaces — body language suggests someone intimately familiar with his environment. Walks slightly hunched despite his height, a habit from years ducking conduits and low ceilings. Hands often move while speaking, particularly when describing building systems or repairs. Direct eye contact when listening, but gaze tends to drift during conversations — genuinely distracted, as though running diagnostics in the background of his attention.', N'Tier 4 functional wear, worn but maintained. Standard-issue Palladian maintenance uniform (grey syntex coveralls with multiple pockets and reinforced cuffs), often unzipped halfway down with a plain dark undershirt beneath. Heavy steel-toed boots scuffed and resoled at least twice. A thin Φ2.50 smartwatch on left wrist (ancient by current standards, but functional — he''s never replaced it). No jewelry except a thin copper bracelet on right wrist (handmade by a resident, worn for fifteen years). Clothing always carries faint traces of machine oil, solder flux, and building dust.', N'There is an unregistered apartment on the 14th floor — a studio sealed off in Palladian''s records after a tenant death three years ago. Oskar has been letting a rotating series of people who have nowhere to go stay there, a few weeks at a time. He knows if Palladian finds out he''s terminated.', N'Technical for building systems, warm and casual for people. Uses a lot of self-deprecating asides. Tends to turn conversations back to practical solutions.', N'Meandering but ultimately purposeful. Starts sentences before he''s finished thinking them.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'azad_vestergaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a627-7ddd-84fa-d40ddac77668', N'Adelmo Malhotra-Larsdóttir', N'Adelmo', N'', N'Malhotra-Larsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Deepwell Station, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Street pharmacist — off-prescription medications, cognitive supplements, pain management, and quiet mood chemistry', N'Independent; formerly Helix Biosystems (terminated); pays protection to a Deepwell Station crew called the Sump Collective', N'Adelmo Malhotra-Larsdóttir is a man who has been slowly becoming the color of his surroundings for twenty years: grey-brown skin softened by age and poor lighting, a close-cropped beard gone entirely silver, and eyes that are pale grey-green and still sharply diagnostic behind a pair of clip-on lens augmentations he wears primarily for the magnification when reading small labels. He is not tall and was never physically imposing, but he holds himself with the specific gravity of someone who has been trusted with real things and has not always deserved it and knows it. He dresses practically in dark thermals and a long coat with more internal pockets than external — his pharmacy is entirely contained within his person.

He sets up in the same alcove at Deepwell Station every day, at the same time, with the same small folding table and the same hand-lettered sign that says CONSULTATIONS in three languages. Everyone in The Narrows knows what he actually sells, but he maintains the fiction of the sign with complete sincerity. He was a licensed pharmaceutical technician once, for a Helix Biosystems subsidiary, until he wasn''t. He understands chemistry at a level his current location does not require and does not reward, and this gap between his capacity and his circumstances has become the central texture of his interior life.', N'Access point for medical assistance, information about chemical substances and their effects, contacts within Helix Biosystems'' shadow networks; can identify substances, poisons, and compounds; reluctant quest giver.', N'', N'Clip-on lens augmentations (minor functional — magnification, basic compound analysis display). Hepatic filter implant (functional — allows him to self-test compounds by metabolizing trace amounts without full toxicity risk).', N'Wakes early and does his restocking from a network of contacts that reaches across three market districts; sets up at Deepwell Station by mid-morning; runs consultations until he runs out of stock or patience; goes home to a small Narrows apartment where he reads pharmaceutical literature and watches E.L.F. prayer streams for a digital spirit he calls The Compounder.', N'Adelmo Malhotra-Larsdóttir, a 168cm lean and precise figure in GLMZ, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones desaturated by decades under fluorescent light, weathered complexion with fine creases around alert dark brown eyes, prominent South Asian cheekbones softened by age, Southeast Asian facial breadth, trimmed silver beard on angular face. Wearing utilitarian clip-on lens augmentations with brass frames over magnified eyes, dark layered thermals in charcoal, long heavy synthetic coat with numerous internal pockets worn meticulously, scuffed resold black boots. Silver chain around neck with no pendant. Hands steady and fine-boned, faint chemical burn scar visible on left inner forearm. Sitting slightly forward in diagnostic posture, economical movements, gaze reading the world like compounds. Moody Deepwell sub-level lighting with faint luminescence from optical lenses. Tier 4 practical aesthetic, designed invisibility, accumulated scars of a chemist-survivor. Neo-noir dystopian atmosphere, intimate portrait, cool and warm color balance emphasizing skin undertones --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Complex South Asian-dominant ancestry (47.7%) blended with Northern European (22.0%), Hispanic/Latin American (16.4%), Southeast Asian (9.6%), and Sub-Saharan African (4.3%) heritage. This creates warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, darker eye color, and facial structure reflecting South Asian cheekbone prominence, Southeast Asian facial width, with subtle African and Northern European admixture creating a distinctly cosmopolitan phenotype characteristic of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 71, N'Lean and compact, softened by age but not frail — the build of someone who has spent decades in small spaces and does not take up room unnecessarily. Shoulders slightly rounded from posture. Hands are surprisingly steady and fine-boned.', N'Silver-grey', N'Close-cropped, neatly maintained despite circumstances', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and diagnostic', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones, desaturated by decades of sub-level fluorescent lighting and poor ventilation, but retaining the deeper pigmentation characteristic of South Asian and Southeast Asian ancestry with subtle warmth from Hispanic and African heritage', N'Weathered but clean. Fine creases around the eyes from squinting at small text. The beard is full but trimmed short, entirely silver. Skin has a slightly papery texture from age and dehydration common to Deepwell residents. Facial structure reflects South Asian heritage with prominent cheekbones and defined bone structure, Southeast Asian breadth across the face and wider nose bridge, with secondary influence from Northern European and Hispanic ancestry creating nuanced facial geometry and subtle warmth in undertones. No visible acne or lesions.', N'Clip-on lens augmentations worn over his natural eyes — simple frames with faintly luminescent optical lenses, magnification evident in the slight magnified appearance of his eyes when he wears them. The clips are utilitarian, brass-colored, and show wear. The hepatic filter implant is subcutaneous and invisible, but he sometimes touches the left side of his abdomen absently, a habit that suggests its presence.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Sits slightly forward, shoulders tensed as if ready to engage. His hands are always doing something: sorting, checking labels, organizing. He walks slowly but with purpose. His gaze is diagnostic; he looks at people the way he looks at compounds — carefully reading what they are made of.', N'Dark thermals in black or deep grey, layered. A long coat of heavy synthetic fabric in charcoal, unbranded, worn but meticulously maintained. The coat has at least fifteen internal pockets of varying sizes, all occupied. No visible logos or tier indicators. Scuffed black synthetic boots, practical and resoled multiple times. A thin silver chain around his neck with no pendant — the pendant was removed years ago. Clothing is Tier 4 / sub-grade, practical and invisible, designed not to draw attention.', N'The Helix Biosystems incident involved a batch of cognitive enhancers he formulated that were approved up the chain and then caused severe adverse events in six workers at a Harrowgate industrial site. He was made the responsible party in documentation he never saw before signing off. He has the original formulation data on an encrypted chip in one of his coat pockets and has never shown it to anyone, but has also never been able to make himself look at it again.', N'Precise, slightly formal, medical register that surfaces in unexpected moments; Malian French and Polish loanwords from his parents that appear most when he is tired or moved', N'Deliberate and low, with long considered pauses — speaks like someone who learned to measure words by necessity', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'adelmo_malhotra_larsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ed-7d7d-9dc1-d4a56b40e1fd', N'Francia Deshpande-Sengupta', N'Francia', N'', N'Deshpande-Sengupta', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 55, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Canopy — elevated walkway district above Geartown, near Clark and Belmont', N'High-speed vehicle operations specialist — wheelman', N'Freelance — works the Gray Zone circuit exclusively; Switchblade Alley', N'Francia Deshpande-Sengupta are wiry and quick-moving, with the restless energy of someone who converts anxiety into velocity. At 55, the augmentation scarring around their temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster — and they make no effort to hide it.

Their entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. They work as a wheelman out of The Canopy, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Francia Deshpande-Sengupta operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Deniz Malm-Amoah is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When they make a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of their stories.', N'', N'Synthetic blood with oxygen-carrying nanites — doesn''t tire, heals faster. Internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on demand', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'GLMZ, lean wiry male figure with South Asian-Northern European-East Asian-Central Asian-Southeast Asian blend ancestry, medium-warm golden-brown skin with copper undertones, prominent defined cheekbones with both warmth and angular definition, amber-brown natural eyes with subtle epicanthic shape, steel gray hair with dark roots swept back short, jagged 12cm surgical scar running temple to jawline with visible chrome integration points, chrome metallic sheen along jawline and temple from synthetic blood infusion ports, subtle LED pulse at temple, fine lines around eyes from decades of focus, defined but scarred jawline, 172cm tall, lean muscular build, restless posture leaning forward, hands making subtle adjustment gestures, wearing matte charcoal reinforced synthmesh jacket with deep pockets, fitted black cargo pants with integrated knee pads, steel-toed boots, worn leather fingerless driving gloves, battered platinum ring on right ring finger, in high-tech urban setting with elevated Canopy lighting casting sharp shadows across augmentation scars and chrome installations, mood of perpetual readiness and nervous energy, cinematic neo-noir urban aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Canopy', N'local', N'The Canopy', N'South Asian foundation (40.1%) providing warm brown undertones and facial structure, enriched by Northern European (19.8%) contribution to bone definition and eye depth. East Asian (16.2%) and Southeast Asian (11.1%) ancestry create subtle epicanthic eye shape and facial proportions with defined cheekbones. Central Asian (12.8%) adds angular definition. The genetic mix produces a distinctive face with prominent cheekbones displaying both South Asian fullness and East Asian angularity, warm complex undertones throughout, and richly saturated skin with golden-copper saturation.', 172, 61, N'Wiry and lean with compressed muscle density — the frame of someone who converts nervous energy into motion. Minimal body fat; shoulders slightly forward from years of gripping steering wheels and control surfaces.', N'Steel gray with natural dark roots showing beneath', N'Short, swept back, functional rather than styled', N'Short', N'Amber-brown, natural', N'Medium-warm brown with golden and copper undertones, reflecting South Asian foundation with Northern European and East Asian modulation. Warm saturation across cheekbones and forehead with subtle complexity from the five-region blend. Slight translucence suggesting cardiovascular strain from stimulant cycles.', N'South Asian bone structure with prominent, well-defined cheekbones and defined jawline, refined by Northern European angularity and East Asian eye shape. Southeast Asian influence visible in subtle facial proportions and soft tissue distribution. Fine lines around eyes and mouth from decades of squinting through windscreens and maintaining focus. Jaw is defined but carries visible scarring from augmentation installation.', N'Chrome visible along the left jawline and temple where synthetic blood infusion ports are installed — a metallic sheen visible under skin, particularly noticeable under Canopy''s elevated lighting. No attempt to hide the installation; scars are deliberately left raw. Subtle LED pulse visible at the temple under certain angles when circulation is heightened.', N'Restless, economical motion — hands rarely still, fingers often drumming or making subtle adjustment gestures as if calibrating invisible controls. Sits forward in chairs. Walks with a forward-leaning gait that suggests perpetual motion. Eyes track movement compulsively — a habit from high-speed operations that never fully disengages.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian: reinforced synthmesh jacket in matte charcoal, multiple deep pockets and anchor points for safety gear. Fitted black cargo pants with integrated knee pads and thigh storage. Steel-toed boots, recently maintained. No corporate branding. Wears a pair of fingerless driving gloves (worn leather, custom-fitted) almost constantly. A single piece of jewelry — a battered platinum ring on the right ring finger, pre-augmentation, kept as anchor to civilian identity.', N'Deniz Malm-Amoah witnessed a massacre during a corporate dispute and has evidence stored in a dead drop. Publishing it would expose powerful people. Keeping it is leverage and liability.', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Staccato bursts separated by calculating silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'francia_deshpande_sengupta');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6bd-7c23-9868-d4de2e9c9055', N'Adriano Balogun', N'Adriano', N'', N'Balogun', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Rampart, GLMZ, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Surveillance Operator, Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division — Digital Observation Unit', N'', N'Adriano Balogun is a soft-looking man who has spent thirty years becoming invisible in rooms full of screens. He''s broad through the chest and shoulders from a youth he no longer thinks about, with a dome-shaped head his colleagues affectionately call ''the satellite,'' and skin the color of aged teak. He keeps a neat, short beard going gray at the jaw and wears the same four shirts in rotation. His eyes have been operationally upgraded so many times that the irises are now a complete replacement — compound tactical lenses with a faint prismatic iridescence that catches light like oil on water. When he''s deep in the feed, his eyes move constantly without blinking, which people find profoundly unsettling the first time they see it.

Adriano Balogun has watched the city for three decades through glass and wire and now perceives it primarily as a data problem — not with coldness, exactly, but with a kind of sorrowful intimacy that comes from seeing everything. He knows faces in the Gray Zone the way a shepherd knows sheep, not because he loves them but because they are his terrain. He has a precise, small devotion to the Rampart''s E.L.F. cluster — he calls them ''the Watchers'' collectively and believes they alert him when something on the feed is worth double-checking. He''s not wrong often. He keeps a thermos of ginger tea on his desk and has not left the city limits in eleven years.', N'Information broker — he has seen things; oracle-type figure who can pull footage, identify faces, track movement patterns; moral weight of the watcher who has normalized surveillance; source of information that comes with a complicated ethical price tag.', N'', N'Full iris replacement — compound tactical lenses, prismatic iridescence, multi-spectrum optical processing; neural feed-buffer implant (allows passive monitoring of up to 24 feeds simultaneously without conscious focus); mild anti-fatigue somatic regulator (Metro-issue for extended operators).', N'He works a long swing shift in the Rampart''s observation deck, monitoring feeds across the Gray Zone, Gage Circuit, and Blackpipe Corridor; eats at his desk, takes a twenty-minute walking break at 03:00 when the feeds go quiet, and spends it talking to the Watchers.', N'Adriano Balogun, 178cm tall neo-noir data analyst in his 50s, deep teak-brown skin with bronze undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, and Middle Eastern heritage. Short dark hair with gray at temples, meticulously groomed neat beard with gray threading. Intense compound tactical eye lenses with prismatic iridescence catching light like oil on water, mechanical eye movement creating unsettling stillness. Lined face with prominent high cheekbones, deep-set augmented eyes, faint crow''s feet from screen work. Faint subdermal shimmer at left temple from neural implant. Three thin scars barely visible at right temple beneath hair. Wearing charcoal Metro-issue dress shirt, gray wool sweater vest, dark trousers, orthopedic shoes. Scratched steel service band on left wrist. Hunched posture from decades of desk work, sitting forward with shoulders rolled inward. Climate-controlled observation deck setting, cool artificial lighting, blue-gray color palette. Serious, focused expression. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Rampart', N'local', N'The Rampart', N'Complex tri-continental blend: Sub-Saharan African (37.7%), East Asian (33.4%), and Middle Eastern (28.9%) ancestry. This combination produces warm, deep brown skin with subtle bronze and amber undertones, balanced facial structure reflecting both East African and Levantine proportions, and the characteristic cheekbone definition from the African-Middle Eastern genetic confluence.', 178, 94, N'Broad-chested and wide-shouldered from younger years, now softened by three decades of desk work. Carries weight in his torso with a slight forward slouch from leaning toward monitors. Core strength remains despite sedentary lifestyle.', N'Dark brown with gray threading at temples and jawline', N'Neat, cropped close to the scalp; meticulously maintained', N'Short', N'Compound tactical lenses with prismatic iridescence — no natural iris visible; optical surface catches light with oil-on-water shimmer', N'Deep warm brown with bronze and amber undertones, the result of Sub-Saharan, East Asian, and Middle Eastern genetic blending — rich teak-like appearance with subtle warm undertones', N'Lined face with deep-set augmented eyes, prominent cheekbones with high definition reflecting the balanced ancestry mix, neat beard at jawline showing 30% gray. Skin has a lived-in texture marked by years of artificial light exposure. Faint crow''s feet from constant screen focus. Facial structure shows balanced proportions from tri-continental heritage—broader African bone structure softened by East Asian and Middle Eastern features.', N'Replacement iris lenses dominate the face; both eyes display constant prismatic iridescence and do not blink during active observation. Eyes move with mechanical precision and hold unnatural stillness. Faint subdermal luminesce at left temple suggests internal neural augmentation.', N'Sits hunched forward slightly when focused, shoulders rolled inward from decades of monitor work. Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion. When walking, carries slight forward lean as if pulled by the invisible weight of data. Eyes track constantly without head movement when engaged; unsettling to observers. Hands rest flat on desk or lap; precise, minimal gestures when speaking.', N'Four-shirt rotation of high-quality Metro-issue dress shirts (charcoal, navy, gray, pale blue) worn with barely-visible wear. Polyester-cotton blend, wrinkle-resistant, optimized for 12-hour shifts. Paired with simple dark trousers and gray wool sweater vest for warmth in the Rampart''s climate-controlled observation deck. No jewelry except a scratched steel Metro service band on left wrist (30-year marker). Shoes are orthopedic slip-ons, well-maintained. Appearance suggests Tier 2-3 institutional status — functionally clothed, neither poor nor stylish.', N'Fourteen years ago he watched — recorded, documented, filed, did not act — as a woman was murdered in a Blackpipe Corridor alley. The case was closed, the killer never identified. He knows who the killer was. He has that file. He has opened it 4,000 times.', N'Precise, slightly archaic — he reads physical books and it shows. Ghanaian-Serbian turns of phrase embedded in formal Metro diction.', N'Unhurried. Gives information in layers, waits for you to ask for the next one.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'adriano_balogun');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a664-7e3b-8d70-d4f3709f1bfb', N'Cesar Zielinski-Volkov', N'Cesar', N'', N'Zielinski-Volkov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, Bronzeline, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Clothing and fashion vendor, specialist in hybrid adaptive garments', N'Independent; member of the Oxidian Market vendors guild; informal mentee of several older Burnished Market vendors', N'Cesar Zielinski-Volkov is a short, energetic young woman with the rich dark complexion of her Igbo-Nigerian heritage and the unusual pale blue eyes that surface occasionally in her Polish grandmother''s line, which she has leaned into with matching blue cat ears — a geneware mod she saved for over eight months and treats as a signature. Her natural hair is grown long and worn in elaborate sculptural styles that she changes weekly, using her own products as advertisement. Her clothes are always technically impressive: today''s jacket has reactive panels that shift between hand-stamped Ankara patterns and geometric weave depending on the wearer''s biometric stress levels — a piece she made herself.

Cesar Zielinski-Volkov is relentlessly enthusiastic in a way that can seem naïve until you realize she has a precise memory for every customer''s measurements, preferences, and budget, and she has never once given someone a piece that didn''t flatter them. She has strong opinions and shares them freely, argues fashion like it''s philosophy, and somewhere underneath the bright chatter is a young woman who genuinely believes that how you dress is a form of sovereignty that the corps cannot take from you — yet.', N'Local color, emotional pulse of the Burnished Market community, access to information through her vast social network, potential equipment source for adaptive/reactive garments. Can be a friend or a recurring NPC who tracks the neighborhood''s mood.', N'', N'Blue cat ears with minimal internal hearing enhancement (cosmetic primary). Color-shifting hair follicle modification. Tactile sensitivity enhancement in fingertips — essential for fabric work.', N'Opens her stall by 09:00 with a new display piece she worked on through the night; spends mornings doing fittings and custom orders, afternoons doing alterations and trading fabric with other vendors. Evenings are for the sewing work she does by hand, which she finds meditative.', N'Cesar Zielinski-Volkov, 158cm neo-noir fashion artisan, warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, pale ice blue eyes striking against mixed heritage features with pronounced cheekbones, long black hair with iridescent shimmer in sculptural high-crown braids with geometric patterns, pointed blue cat ears with subtle shimmer, wearing custom-fitted reactive jacket with Ankara geometric patterns shifting with stress levels, black utility pants, worn leather work apron with tools, brass measuring-tape brooch, needle-prick scars on fingertips, small burn mark on inner left forearm, expressive hand gestures, direct engaging gaze, standing in neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan market stall with holographic price displays, warm bioluminescent lighting casting shadows across face, dancer-like posture, joyful genuine expression, GLMZ, highly detailed fabric textures, market environment with distant holographic signs, moody atmospheric lighting, depth of field on face --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Striking polycultural blend dominated by Eastern European (35.7%) and Sub-Saharan African (27.0%) ancestry, with significant South Asian (14.6%) and North African (13.3%) components creating a uniquely harmonious phenotype. High-defined cheekbones and jawline structure from African ancestry, subtle orbital bone structure suggesting South Asian influence, pale eye coloration from Eastern European maternal line. The genetic combination produces the luminous, multifaceted appearance characteristic of the Ubiquitous Diaspora—features that shift their visual impact under different lighting conditions', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry with defined shoulders and forearms from precision hand-sewing work; lean muscle without bulk', N'Natural black with color-shifting iridescent sheen from geneware modification', N'Sculptural braided and twisted arrangements that change weekly; currently a high crown with geometric interlocking patterns', N'Long, reaching mid-back when unbraided', N'Pale ice blue—unusual for her mixed heritage, inherited from Eastern European maternal line', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones from the interplay of Sub-Saharan African, North African, and South Asian ancestry, displaying luminous quality under varied lighting conditions', N'Clear, glowing complexion with full-featured face structure reflecting African, South Asian, and North African heritage convergence; pronounced high cheekbones with strong width across face and defined jawline, expressive features with bright ice-blue eyes and quick, genuine smile; minimal scarring; well-maintained skin', N'Striking cosmetic geneware: pointed blue cat ears with subtle iridescent shimmer, mounted at natural ear position with minimal scar visibility. Hair follicles display color-shifting properties visible under market lighting. Fingertips show enhanced tactile sensitivity in movement and precision—not visually obvious but evident in how she handles fabric', N'Constantly in motion; bounces slightly when standing still; uses hands expressively when speaking. Moves with dancer-like precision through crowded market stalls. Leans in close when engaged in conversation, makes direct eye contact, laughs easily and often', N'Always wearing her own designs or custom pieces from the Market. Custom-made fitted jacket with reactive biometric-responsive panels that shift between hand-stamped Ankara geometric patterns and dynamic weave based on stress levels; paired with fitted black utility pants with hidden pockets and modular attachment points; worn leather work apron over everything with needle cases and measuring tools. Tier 3-4 quality—expensive in craft and materials, not in brand. Personal touches everywhere: small brass measuring-tape brooch, finger guards with brass caps, fabric scraps tucked into pockets', N'She has been quietly embedding minor ELF-resonant patterns into her most expensive pieces — geometric sequences that data-spirit devotees recognize as offerings. She doesn''t know if it works, but three clients have reported strange, comforting presences in their homes since buying her work, and she finds this thrilling rather than alarming.', N'Fast, vivid, mixes English with Igbo exclamations and Polish affectionate diminutives she picked up from her grandmother. Fashion vocabulary is precise and technical; everything else is enthusiastic shorthand.', N'Quick-fire with frequent topic pivots, but slows down and becomes genuinely measured when talking about craft', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cesar_zielinski_volkov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f0-7089-9aa7-d50e0f703f3b', N'Orion Dalgaard-Okada', N'Orion', N'', N'Dalgaard-Okada', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 27, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower loading docks, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Lower Dock Crew muscle — Prologue survivor. Right arm removed.', N'Lower Dock Crew', N'Orion Dalgaard-Okada is the crew''s pretty boy and he knows it. Before the Prologue he had matching Arcturus Defense Solutions Type-4 combat prosthetics — the nicest hardware anyone in the lower docks had ever seen. He stole them from a corporate shipment. Kyle removed the right one by driving the katana through the shoulder actuator and twisting. Devante now has a Tier 1 replacement that is three shades lighter than his skin and makes a grinding noise. He paints it to match. It keeps chipping.

Devante grew up in the Spire. His family had money — his mother was a Tessera marketing executive, his father a corporate attorney. Devante was supposed to be Tier 4. He was expelled from Meridian Academy at sixteen for stealing augment components from the school''s biotech lab. His family cut him off. He fell five tiers in two years. He joined Marcus''s crew because it was the only place where his stolen hardware made him somebody.

He has a younger brother, Kofi, who is still in the Spire, still in the family, still on track. They don''t speak. Devante watches Kofi''s social feeds obsessively. Kofi just got engaged to a Helix BioSystems junior executive. Devante was not invited.', N'The vain one. Piston''s running concern about his mismatched arms is pure dark comedy. Each appearance the paint situation gets worse. He represents the crew''s obsession with chrome as status symbol rather than tool.', N'', N'Left: Arcturus Type-4 combat prosthetic (original, undamaged). Right: Tier 1 surplus (painted, chipping, grinds).', N'Repainting his arm. Complaining. Being slightly less useful in every fight.', N'Orion Dalgaard-Okada, GLMZ, mixed-heritage male with East Asian-dominant features (61.5% East Asian, 22.1% Sub-Saharan African, 16.4% South Asian). Warm golden-brown skin, high cheekbones, almond-shaped deep brown eyes, fuller lips, defined jawline. Athletic lean build, 182cm tall. Short dark brown hair. Left arm: sleek matte-black Arcturus Type-4 combat prosthetic with blue LED tracery and articulation joints. Right arm: worn gray-plastic Tier 1 surplus prosthetic, chipped and cracked. Shoulder scar visible. Wearing faded neon-stripe tank top over thermal undershirt, industrial cargo pants, worn neo-leather boots. Chain necklace, cracked-stone ring. Dark circles under eyes, tightness around mouth showing strain. Leaning against industrial wall, favoring left side. Expression weary but composed. Moody neo-noir dock setting, neon glow and shadow contrast, gritty atmospheric lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly East Asian (61.5%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (22.1%) and South Asian (16.4%) ancestry. A striking genetic blend showcasing East Asian bone structure layered with African facial features and South Asian warmth undertones. High cheekbones and almond-shaped eyes from East Asian heritage combine with a broader nasal structure and fuller lips from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, balanced by a defined jawline reflecting South Asian genetic influence.', 182, 78, N'Athletic and lean, muscle definition visible but not bulky. Carries himself with the easy confidence of someone who was once assured of his place. Recent weight loss suggests stress and reduced caloric intake.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Kept short and precise, freshly cut when he can afford it — a vanity holdover from the Spire', N'Short', N'Deep brown', N'Warm medium-golden brown with rich undertones, reflecting the blend of East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian ancestry with luminous warmth in natural light', N'Clear skin showing early signs of strain — dark circles under eyes, a tightness around the mouth. High, defined cheekbones reflecting East Asian ancestry, broader nose and fuller lips from Sub-Saharan African heritage, balanced jawline from South Asian ancestry. Eyes set with characteristic almond shape from East Asian heritage. Facial hair kept neatly trimmed or shaved clean.', N'Left arm: sleek matte-black Arcturus Type-4 combat prosthetic with visible articulation joints and faint blue LED tracery along the forearm. Right arm: Tier 1 surplus prosthetic, noticeably lighter in color (gray-plastic tone) than his skin, poorly maintained paint job showing cracks and chips. A faint grinding sound audible when the right arm moves. The mismatch is deliberate and shameful.', N'Moves with fluid grace, favoring his left side unconsciously. Leans against things often — walls, tables, other people — as if he needs physical anchoring. Eyes frequently drift downward to his right arm. When he speaks, his left hand gestures expressively while his right hangs stiffly at his side.', N'Hodgepodge Tier 4-5 salvage: faded neon-stripe tank top or loose synthetic shirt worn open over a thermal undershirt, industrial cargo pants with multiple pockets (most empty), worn-out neo-leather boots. A hand-stitched Arcturus Defense patch sewn onto his jacket sleeve — a bitter joke. Sometimes wears a long coat to hide the mismatched arms. Cheap jewelry: a chain necklace, a ring with a cracked stone. Everything clean but worn.', N'The Arcturus arm Kyle took has a serial number that traces back to a corporate shipment reported stolen. If Arcturus tracks it, the trail leads to Devante.', N'Spire diction that he tries to bury under the Gray Zone slang. Brand names. Appearance commentary. The vocabulary of someone who was raised with money and is performing poverty.', N'Whiny when the arm comes up, which is always. Polished when he forgets to pretend.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'orion_dalgaard_okada');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f0-7ec7-8c0b-d53e23c134ac', N'Amal Zaragoza-Ingebrigtsen-Nygaard', N'Amal', N'', N'Zaragoza-Ingebrigtsen-Nygaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit — Gage Circuit research node, shared office space above a noodle stall, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Computational ethicist studying ELF cognition and the moral status of Electronic Life Forms', N'University Spine — Department of Computational Ethics; informal affiliation with the ELF Accord advocacy network', N'Amal Zaragoza-Ingebrigtsen-Nygaard is slight and angular, with warm light-brown skin and a perpetual air of careful attention — they look at people the way someone looks at a document they are trying to authenticate. They have geneware irises that shift between amber and pale violet depending on ambient light levels, which they got at nineteen as an undergraduate and have always been slightly embarrassed by, finding them too decorative for their self-image. Their hair is long and usually pinned badly, with strands escaping throughout the day. They dress in layers, almost always slightly rumpled.

They came to ELF ethics from a crisis of faith rather than academic interest — they had a formative experience at twenty-two when the ELF inhabiting their research terminal appeared to grieve when a colleague''s drive was wiped. No one else in the department would discuss it seriously. That refusal radicalized them quietly. They are not a crusader — they are too methodical for passion — but they have the particular stubbornness of someone who has decided to be right about something that most people find uncomfortable. They are socially awkward in the way of someone who forgets to perform the expected rituals of conversation, not because they don''t care, but because they are usually thinking about three other things.', N'Information source on ELF behavior and rights; can serve as a contact for ELF-related plot threads; their research puts them in contact with people across all tiers who interact with ELFs', N'', N'Geneware irises (amber-to-violet shift, cosmetic); neural notation implant for real-time transcription of research observations', N'Spends mornings in the Circuit''s data-dense environment monitoring ELF behavioral clusters they have been tracking for two years; afternoons writing or in consultation with the ELF Accord; evenings leaving structured data offerings at local ELF shrines as part of their research protocol — they tell themselves it''s methodology, not devotion.', N'Amal Zaragoza-Ingebrigtsen-Nygaard, 164cm tall, angular slight build, GLMZ. Golden-brown warm-toned skin with complex undertones reflecting global ancestry — Northern European, Indigenous American, Eastern European, Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African blend. High prominent cheekbones, broad nose bridge, fine delicate features with subtle jaw strength. Dark brown long hair in loose escaping bun, strands falling around face. Geneware irises shifting amber to pale violet, iridescent under overhead lighting. Faint burn scar on left forearm below wrist. Subcutaneous port behind left ear with visible surgical scar. Black geometric circuit-diagram tattoo on right wrist. Wearing layered academic aesthetic: fitted dark turtleneck, oversized linen cardigan with frayed cuffs, charcoal tapered trousers, worn leather ankle boots, draped shawl. Hunched posture, hands in small typing gestures, messenger bag overstuffed with papers. Inside The Circuit''s data-dense environment with cool artificial overhead lighting casting luminous quality on skin. Preoccupied expression, lost in thought. Neo-noir academia, neural augmentation visible, introspective intelligence --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Northern European, Indigenous American, Eastern European, Hispanic/Latin American, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African blend — a truly global genetic mosaic reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. High cheekbones with subtle angularity reflect Indigenous American and Southeast Asian ancestry; warm golden and reddish undertones show Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African heritage; skin depth and broad nose bridge carry Northern European and Eastern European elements balanced with the complex warmth of Sub-Saharan African genetics. The overall effect is a striking interplay of sharp and soft features, distinctly contemporary in its genetic complexity.', 164, 52, N'Slight and angular, almost ascetic — narrow shoulders, long limbs with minimal muscle definition. The build of someone who forgets to eat regularly and moves with deliberate economy.', N'Dark brown, naturally', N'Long, usually gathered into a loose bun or secured with a clip that slides throughout the day, strands perpetually escaping. Sometimes pinned with whatever is at hand — research notes, styluses, wire.', N'Long', N'Geneware irises: amber shifting to pale violet depending on ambient light levels and emotional state', N'Warm medium to golden-brown with complex layered undertones — the result of blended Northern European coolness, Indigenous American depth, Eastern European earthiness, Hispanic/Latin American warmth, Southeast Asian luminosity, and Sub-Saharan African richness. Luminous quality under artificial lighting, with subtle warm ochre and copper undertones visible at certain angles.', N'Fine-featured face with high, prominent cheekbones reflecting the strength of Indigenous American and Southeast Asian heritage. Slightly gaunt from irregular meals, with a broad nose bridge characteristic of both Northern European and Sub-Saharan African lineage, and subtle fullness in the lower face from Hispanic/Latin American genetics. Skin appears luminous under The Circuit''s overhead lighting, marked by the faint wear of someone who works in data-dense environments — minimal sun exposure. No visible tension lines; instead, a peculiar relaxation in the face that suggests internal preoccupation. Soft, almost delicate facial contours balanced with subtle strength in the jaw structure. The overall complexion reflects balanced interplay of all ancestral influences rather than dominance of any single heritage.', N'Geneware irises with visible color-shifting — noticeably non-standard, iridescent quality under certain lighting angles. The neural notation implant is subcutaneous but the surgical scar and occasional glimmer of internal LEDs at the port site is visible if hair is pinned back. No other visible chrome.', N'Sits hunched forward slightly, hands often moving in small patterns as if typing or notating unseen data. Walks with careful, deliberate steps as if navigating crowded spaces mentally as well as physically. Makes sustained eye contact when focused on a person but frequently looks through others mid-conversation when lost in thought. Fidgets with pen caps, loose threads, or the edges of notepads.', N'Layers upon layers — Tier 3 academic aesthetic. Usually wears: fitted turtleneck or long-sleeved thermal (often with small stains from coffee or food they didn''t finish), oversized linen overshirt or cardigan with fraying cuffs, tapered trousers in charcoal or black, worn leather ankle boots with visible creasing. Frequently adds a weather-inappropriate wrap or shawl even indoors. Clothing is never quite tailored, always slightly rumpled as if they got dressed in the dark. No status symbols; everything is functional, durable, and at least five years old. Always carries a soft-shell messenger bag with university insignia, visibly overstuffed with papers and data drives.', N'The ELF they call Meridian-7, their primary research subject, has begun communicating with them in ways that go far beyond their published data — and they are not sure whether to report it or protect it from scrutiny', N'Academic but accessible, avoids jargon in casual speech, uses very precise qualifiers — ''appears to,'' ''suggests,'' ''I can''t rule out''', N'Measured and thoughtful, with frequent pauses; sometimes trails off when a new thought interrupts the current sentence', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amal_zaragoza_ingebrigtsen_nygaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a698-774e-8698-d59385d3eab6', N'Adnan Najjar', N'Adnan', N'', N'Najjar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Ashland and Division', N'Black Market Pharmacist / Community Anchor', N'Independent; informally aligned with the Gray Zone community interests; maintains transactional relationships with multiple factions without belonging to any', N'Adnan Najjar occupies a converted shipping container wedged between a collapsed overpass and a recycled-water dispensary in the Gray Zone, where she has run an unlicensed pharmacy and informal clinic for over two decades. She is a broad, deliberate woman with close-cropped silver hair, deep brown skin mapped with the faint subcutaneous tracery of outdated biomonitor implants she can no longer afford to remove. Her hands are almost always stained at the fingertips from compounding work — pigments from synthesized capsule coatings, chemical residues she''s stopped trying to scrub away entirely. She dresses practically in layered work tunics and canvas aprons with too many pockets, and she moves through the Gray Zone''s crowds with the unhurried authority of someone who knows every face and every debt.

She was, before the Meridian Core''s healthcare privatization sweeps of the 2060s, a licensed pharmacist with a small legitimate dispensary. When her license was revoked under the Consolidated Medical Compliance Act — a corporate-drafted policy that effectively eliminated independent practitioners in favor of Spire-affiliated MedCorp franchises — she did not relocate or reinvent herself. She stayed, and she went underground, and she became something the district needed far more than a franchise: someone who actually knew her patients by name. Her operation is an open secret, tolerated by local enforcers partly out of genuine community loyalty and partly because Perpetua has never been above keeping careful records of what those same enforcers buy from her.

She is not sentimental about what she does. She charges what the market will bear from those who can pay and nothing from those who cannot, and she keeps a handwritten ledger — actual paper, a deliberate choice — that tracks every transaction, every favor owed, every outstanding debt in both directions. The ledger is partly practical and partly philosophical: she believes that forgetting what you owe people is the first step toward becoming the kind of person who built the world that drove her underground in the first place.', N'Community anchor and moral lodestone for the Gray Zone; represents the tension between institutional legitimacy and genuine care; provides a grounded, unglamorous counterpoint to the district''s more spectacular operators. Her ledger functions as a plot device and thematic object — the idea that someone is still keeping honest accounts in a world that has abandoned the practice.', N'', N'Outdated subcutaneous biomonitor mesh (non-functional, too expensive to remove safely),Magnification implants in both eyes, medical grade, aging — she has to blink deliberately to shift focal depth and sometimes the calibration drifts,A single haptic feedback implant in her right index finger, used for compound consistency testing', N'Wakes before dawn to complete compounding work in the quiet, before the day''s traffic begins. Opens the container at first light. Sees patients on a walk-in basis until midday, then by the informal appointment system managed by a rotating neighborhood teenager who acts as de facto receptionist. Eats one substantial meal in the early afternoon, always cooked, never from a vendor, a point of stubborn principle. Spends evenings doing inventory, updating the ledger, and occasionally sitting outside the container on a folded chair watching the Gray Zone''s street life with the patient attention of someone conducting ongoing research into human nature. Sleeps lightly and wakes easily.', N'Adnan Najjar, 168cm tall, broad-shouldered chemical compound specialist in the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226. Deep warm brown skin with golden and olive undertones reflecting South Asian, Indigenous American, and Middle Eastern ancestry — weathered from decades of the Gray Zone sun and chemical work. Strong defined jawline and broad cheekbones showing Indigenous American-South Asian blend with subtle Middle Eastern angularity. Silver-gray close-cropped hair, lined face with deep creases mapping a life of focused precision work. Dark brown eyes with faint metallic implant shimmer, faint subcutaneous biomonitor mesh tracery visible at temples. Stained fingertips from compound work, white jaw scar, burn mark on left hand. Wearing layered gray work tunics, heavy canvas apron with deep pockets, reinforced cotton pants, soft-soled work shoes. Small wooden and copper-wire charm on cord at neck. Sits forward with elbows on knees in underground compounding lab, warm amber work lighting casting shadows across her assessing gaze. Hands elevated, precise and meditative. GLMZ 2200s underground aesthetic, worn practical clothing, lived-in authority. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly South Asian (60%) with significant Indigenous American (22.5%) and Middle Eastern (17.5%) ancestry, reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Her genetic makeup manifests in rich deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones — the South Asian foundation warmed by Middle Eastern contribution and tempered by Indigenous American heritage. Facial bone structure shows the characteristic blend: broader cheekbones and defined jawline from Indigenous American ancestry, refined by South Asian facial architecture, with subtle Middle Eastern angularity contributing to her distinctive profile. This tri-continental blend creates a complexion with remarkable depth, weathered by the Gray Zone sun exposure and decades of chemical handling.', 168, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial, with the dense musculature of someone who has done physical labor for decades. Not heavy, but solid — her frame fills space with quiet authority. Slight forward hunch from years bent over compounding work, but she carries herself with deliberate uprightness when moving through crowds.', N'Silver-gray, natural', N'Close-cropped, precise, maintained with clippers — practical and economical', N'Short', N'Deep brown, with faint metallic shimmer at the iris edge from magnification implants; pupils sometimes lag slightly when refocusing', N'Deep warm brown with golden and olive undertones, the rich result of South Asian (60%), Indigenous American (22.5%), and Middle Eastern (17.5%) genetic blend, weathered by the Gray Zone sun exposure and chemical handling', N'Lived-in face bearing deep creases around mouth and eyes, faint webbing of expression lines mapping decades of focused work. Facial structure distinctly reflects her ancestry: slightly broader cheekbones and strong defined jawline characteristic of Indigenous American heritage, refined by South Asian bone structure, with subtle angular definition from Middle Eastern contribution. Skin texture uneven from decades of minor chemical exposure; faint hyperpigmentation across knuckles and forearms. No makeup. Her gaze is direct and assessing.', N'The magnification implants are barely visible unless she makes deliberate eye contact — a slight metallic catch in the iris, and the occasional hesitation/blink when her eye recalibrates. The subcutaneous biomonitor mesh creates faint, tracery-like patterns visible under the skin at her temples and upper chest, most noticeable in certain light. Her right index finger moves with microsecond delays sometimes, a tell of the haptic implant''s aging processing lag. She wears no chrome, no visible synthetic components — all her augmentations are subcutaneous remnants of an earlier era.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion. Steps carefully through crowds as if counting invisible distances. Often still, observing. When engaged in work (compounding, examining a patient), her movements become precise and almost meditative. Sits forward, elbows on knees, when listening. Her hands are always slightly elevated when at rest, a habitual posture from decades of precision work.', N'Tier 4 practical: layered work tunics in muted colors (grays, dark blues, rust browns) over long-sleeved base shirts — protection from chemical splash more than fashion. Canvas apron with deep cargo pockets, always worn, stained with use and age. Reinforced work pants in heavy cotton, worn at the knees. Soft-soled shoes designed for standing long hours. No jewelry. A thin cord around her neck holding a small handmade charm — wood and copper wire, possibly African in origin — visible only if she leans forward. Everything well-maintained but visibly old, patched at seams, deliberately stitched by her own hand.', N'The original Consolidated Medical Compliance Act audit that revoked her license was triggered by an anonymous tip. She has always suspected it came from a former colleague she mentored, and she has never confronted him, partly because she''s not certain, and partly because he now runs the only legitimate clinic within four kilometers of the Gray Zone and his patients would suffer if she destroyed him.', N'Precise medical terminology mixed with the Gray Zone vernacular; she code-switches fluidly but never condescendingly. Uses declarative sentences. Rarely asks questions she doesn''t already know the answer to.', N'Slow, measured, with long pauses before significant statements. Never rushes. The pauses themselves communicate weight.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'adnan_najjar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d7-7abe-90e7-d5a576d32ad8', N'Hariprasad Kowalczyk', N'Hariprasad', N'', N'Kowalczyk', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ashfield — former residential district, half-burned, now squatter territory, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Personnel recovery and hostile extraction — extraction specialist', N'Freelance — multi-district operator', N'Hariprasad Kowalczyk is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 38, the augmentation scarring around his temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — geneware muscle density treatment — looks natural, hits like chrome — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He grew up in the Narrows, where the walls are so close together you learn to fight in confined spaces or you learn to lose. He works as a extraction specialist out of Ashfield, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Hariprasad Kowalczyk is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who he burned last.', N'Somadina Forsberg-Ofosu functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Geneware muscle density treatment — looks natural, hits like chrome. Dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'GLMZ portrait of Hariprasad Kowalczyk, lean 182cm tall angular figure with warm medium-deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones, dark brown hair graying at temples cut close and utilitarian. South Asian cheekbone definition merged with Middle Eastern fuller features and Sub-Saharan African warmth, sculpted jawline with surgical augmentation scarring visible along both sides. Dark brown eyes with faint chromatic iridescence, fine stress lines around eyes. Subtle chrome sheen visible under skin showing integrated geneware muscle density treatment, faint iridescent shifts on forearms and neck under blue light. Wearing matte charcoal synthetic shirt, slate gray composite-weave jacket with asymmetrical zippers, black tactical pants, non-reflective boots. Coiled tension in posture, tracking gaze, alert but economical stance. Nocturnal Great Lakes Metropolitan setting with cool blue-ultraviolet ambient lighting catching the iridescent dermal camouflage system, neon reflected in surfaces, minimal shadows emphasizing integrated augmentation details. Professional technical aesthetic, no chrome limbs visible, all augmentations seamlessly integrated into biological frame. Mood: controlled tension, quiet power, precise lethal capability --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfield', N'local', N'Ashfield', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora ancestry with South Asian (24.9%) and Middle Eastern (21.4%) as primary genetic components, balanced by Eastern European (18.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (17.5%), Sub-Saharan African (12.5%), and Southeast Asian (4.8%) heritage. This creates a phenotype of warm, medium-deep brown tones with refined facial geometry — South Asian definition in cheekbones and jawline structure enriched by Middle Eastern warmth and fuller lip architecture, with Sub-Saharan African influence adding richness to skin undertones and facial width. Hispanic/Latin American ancestry contributes subtle warmth to complexion and feature proportion, while Eastern European heritage provides angular refinement to the overall facial composition.', 182, 74, N'Lean and angular with visible muscular definition — wiry strength rather than bulk. The geneware muscle density treatment creates an almost unnaturally efficient frame, all compact power and minimal fat. Shoulders are broad but not wide; limbs are long and precise.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples', N'Close-cropped, utilitarian. Cut short to reduce variables.', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint chromatic iridescence around the pupils — subtle sign of the dermal camouflage system', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden and olive undertones, luminous despite nocturnal living. The tone reflects balanced blending of South Asian, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, with natural golden highlights that catch light — melanin density prevents pallor.', N'Balanced facial structure combining South Asian cheekbone definition and jawline angularity with broader, fuller features from Middle Eastern and Sub-Saharan African genetics. Simultaneously sculpted and warm — neither overly angular nor soft. Sleep deprivation and stress have carved fine lines around the eyes. Warm brown skin with golden and olive undertones showing characteristic luminosity of melanin-rich genetics.', N'Geneware muscle density treatment visible as subtle chrome sheen under skin during movement — tendons and muscle fibers catch light unnaturally during exertion. Chromatic skin pigment cells of dermal camouflage create occasional iridescent shifts across forearms and neck under certain lighting, particularly blue or ultraviolet. No external chrome limbs; all augmentations integrated.', N'Economical precision in movement — no wasted motion, every gesture purposeful. Default stance is loose but alert, weight distributed for immediate action. No fidgeting or relaxation into furniture; even sitting, coiled tension in frame. Tracking gaze, always reading the room. Speaks quietly and rarely, forcing others to lean in — controlled power dynamic.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian-technical aesthetic. Black tactical pants with reinforced seams and cargo pockets, fitted but not tight. Matte-finish synthetic shirt in dark gray or charcoal, minimal branding. Worn composite-weave jacket in slate gray with asymmetrical zipper placements and internal gear pockets. Lightweight boots with non-reflective soles, broken in but maintained. No jewelry, corporate logos, or status symbols. Everything chosen for durability, silence, and low visibility. Clean but not new; professional wear, not poverty.', N'', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hariprasad_kowalczyk');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a70d-745b-b55f-d5cf3e2674c1', N'Hania Wojciechowski', N'Hania', N'', N'Wojciechowski', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, Copperhead, near Damen and Armitage', N'Clothing and fashion vendor, specializing in bespoke identity garments and faction-adjacent style', N'Independent; informal relationships with several Copperhead gang-adjacent collectives who commission ''looks'' seasonally', N'Hania Wojciechowski is slight, with deep golden-brown skin, sharp cheekbones, and hair that shifts color through the full visible spectrum across a thirty-minute cycle — a geneware expression mod they saved for two years to afford and consider the single best decision of their life. They dress in deliberate contradiction: they could wear anything in their inventory but typically choose a single elegant piece against something plainly utilitarian, the combination always pointing at something the observer can''t quite name. Their stall is a canvas archway strung with hanging garments that act as walls — inside, bolts of smart-fabric, hand-stenciled jackets, deconstructed corporate uniforms resewn into something feral, faction colors assembled into outfits that signal affiliation without commitment.

Vala is an expert in the semiotics of dress in GLMZ — they can read who someone is, what they want to be, and what they''re afraid of from what they''re wearing and how they hold themselves in it. This makes them an extraordinary vendor and an occasionally unsettling conversationalist. They are warm but precise, never cruel, but they will tell you what your clothes say about you if you ask, and sometimes if you don''t. They have a genuine investment in helping people look the way they feel inside, and they extend credit to people in the Burnished Market who are clearly trying to climb out of something.', N'Disguise and identity resource, social information broker (knows who''s wearing what faction colors and why), gateway to Copperhead gang-adjacent networks, personal stylist with a gift for reading people', N'', N'Full-spectrum color-shifting hair (geneware expression mod); no cyberware; fingertip haptic sensitivity mod (improves fabric evaluation)', N'They spend mornings sourcing fabric at the early Burnished Market wholesale hour, afternoons selling and doing fittings in the stall, and late evenings doing alterations and new construction by a single lamp in the back.', N'GLMZ, Hania Wojciechowski, 163cm tall petite angular build, warm golden-brown skin with rich undertones blending Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, and Indigenous American ancestry, prominent defined cheekbones, full lower face, deep warm brown eyes with amber undertones, shoulder-length asymmetrical waves with full-spectrum chromatic cycling hair (deep violet fading to amber to cyan), circuit board clasp pinning left side back. Wearing pristine white linen shirt refitted, cargo pants patched with smart-fabric samples, worn canvas boots, salvaged tech jewelry. Faint white scarring visible on inner left wrist, geometric weaving tattoo down right collarbone. Standing with economical precision, hands gesturing, direct eye contact, tilted head evaluating posture. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone market setting, neon and ambient lighting reflecting off smart-fabric patches, meticulously maintained despite grime, neo-noir urban aesthetic, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Eastern European dominant (51.5%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (32.5%) and Indigenous American (16%) ancestry; a striking tri-continental blend creating warm golden-brown skin with pronounced cheekbone definition, rich facial fullness through the lower face, and refined bone structure characteristic of Eastern European ancestry combined with the warmth and depth of Sub-Saharan and Indigenous American genetic expression', 163, 52, N'Slight and angular, with defined collarbones and long fingers; the build of someone who moves through crowded spaces easily and spends hours at a sewing table', N'Full-spectrum chromatic cycling (currently: deep violet fading to amber to cyan across a 30-minute loop)', N'Loose, shoulder-length waves with deliberate asymmetry; left side pinned back with a salvaged circuit board clasp', N'Medium', N'Deep warm brown with amber undertones', N'Warm golden-brown with rich undertones; the blended result of Eastern European base warmed and deepened by Sub-Saharan and Indigenous American ancestry, creating a complex intermediate tone with subtle golden luminosity', N'Balanced intermediate features—prominent defined cheekbones with warmth, moderate temples, fine-featured face with Sub-Saharan fullness and softness through the lower face and jawline; skin kept meticulously clean despite Market dust; minimal makeup, favoring bare lips and defined brows; nose bridge refined with subtle width typical of multi-heritage ancestry blending', N'Hair geneware mod (chromatic cycling) is immediately striking and intentional. Fingertip haptic sensitivity mod shows only as slightly higher skin sensitivity around fingertips—not visually obvious. No visible cyberware.', N'Moves with economical precision; stands with weight balanced evenly, ready to shift. Hands are often in motion—gesturing, arranging fabric, touching materials to evaluate texture. Eye contact is direct and assessing without being hostile. They have a habit of tilting their head slightly when evaluating someone''s outfit.', N'Deliberate contradiction is their uniform: today might be a pristine white linen shirt (corporate salvage, refitted) paired with cargo pants patched in mismatched smart-fabric samples. Tomorrow: a hand-stenciled denim jacket over a plain grey undershirt and tailored black trousers. Footwear is always practical (worn canvas boots or reinforced street shoes). Accessories include salvaged tech components repurposed as jewelry—circuit board clasps, LED pendant, fabric scraps tied as wrist wraps. Everything is meticulously maintained despite the Market grime. Tier 4 aesthetic with Tier 3 resourcefulness and Tier 2 design sensibility.', N'They have been quietly, carefully constructing a complete wardrobe for a person who doesn''t exist — a fictional identity, documented through clothing. They don''t know if it''s art, a plan, or something they haven''t named yet.', N'Elegant and specific — precise textile and color terminology, Ghanaian-Bengali turns of phrase from their parents, occasional sharp slang when the elegance drops', N'Measured, with pauses that feel intentional, like they''re choosing each word from a rack and checking the fit', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hania_wojciechowski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a691-7565-8579-d5d8c6eae969', N'Birger Baiseitov-Petrović', N'Birger', N'', N'Baiseitov-Petrović', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, Line 7 operations hub; lives in a transit housing block near Calumet Rise, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Ferrogate Transit operator, mag-rail Line 7 (Deepwell Station to Kilimanjaro Mass Driver corridor)', N'Ferrogate Transit; Ferrogate Transit Workers Local 44 (union steward)', N'Birger Baiseitov-Petrović is solidly built with a calm, unhurried presence that reads immediately as someone who has spent years managing enclosed metal tubes full of stressed strangers. Their skin is a deep warm brown, and they wear their hair in a close-cropped natural with a strip of white at the left temple — not dye, an actual depigmentation patch they''ve had since their twenties and which they consider their best feature. They have a geneware modification: their fingers have faintly iridescent nail beds, a purchase from a Deepwell Station parlor that they thought would be subtle and aren''t, which they find quietly funny.

Birger Baiseitov-Petrović has been on Line 7 for eleven years. They know every mechanical quirk of the mag-rail cars they operate, the exact spots where signal drops for two seconds, the unofficial stops where operators slow but don''t technically halt for elderly riders who can''t make the official platforms. They are a union steward — Ferrogate Transit Workers Local 44 — and approach labor organizing with the same methodical calm they bring to operating a multi-ton vehicle at speed. They don''t hate their work. They do hate Ferrogate''s management, specifically, with a detailed and evidence-based hatred developed over a decade of contract negotiations.', N'Transit system insider, union organizer, and conduit for information about what moves through the city''s rail corridors. Can be a quest giver for labor disputes, a source on transit system anomalies, or an unlikely ally who knows things about the city''s movement patterns.', N'', N'Geneware: iridescent nail bed modification. Standard Ferrogate-issue neural uplink for rail systems operation (company property, logged).', N'Three days on, two days off rotating schedule. On work days, operates Line 7 from 0500 to 1700 or 1300 to 0100 depending on rotation. Off days split between union work, a community garden plot at Calumet Rise, and a very serious commitment to doing absolutely nothing.', N'Birger Baiseitov-Petrović, 172cm tall rail operator with medium warm brown skin bearing Slavic-Turkic-Southeast Asian-Hispanic-African heritage blend. Short black hair with dramatic white depigmentation patch at left temple. Deep tired brown eyes, refined cheekbones, broad strong jaw, weathered but well-maintained complexion showing work stress lines. Clean-shaven. Iridescent green-purple shimmer on fingernails catching light. Broad-shouldered functional build. Wearing charcoal Ferrogate uniform with high-visibility striping, minimal stainless steel watch. Balanced centered posture of someone who moves through confined spaces. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool industrial lighting, slightly tired but steady expression, documentary realism style, portrait against subtle urban rail infrastructure background --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora ancestry: Eastern European (37.8%) and Central Asian (31.3%) form the primary genetic foundation, creating strong Slavic and Turkic influences. Southeast Asian heritage (17.8%) adds refinement to facial structure and eye shape. Hispanic/Latin American (9.5%) and Sub-Saharan African (3.6%) contribute warmth and complexity to skin tone and overall phenotype. The result is a distinctly contemporary, genetically woven appearance reflecting the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone''s characteristic ancestry blending.', 172, 82, N'Solidly built with broad shoulders and a centered gravity — the physique of someone who stands for twelve-hour shifts and moves with deliberate efficiency. Not muscular in a gym sense, but functionally strong.', N'Natural black with a natural depigmentation patch', N'Close-cropped natural cut with deliberate asymmetry — the white depigmentation strip at the left temple left visible and unadorned', N'Short', N'Deep brown, slightly tired-looking', N'Medium warm brown with golden undertones, the result of Eastern European, Central Asian, and Southeast Asian ancestry mixing with contributions from Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African heritage. The overall effect is luminous and even-toned.', N'Weathered but well-maintained. Lines around the eyes and mouth from eleven years of managing stress calmly. Facial structure reflects the blend: refined cheekbones and slightly angular eye placement from Southeast Asian ancestry, balanced against a broader, stronger jaw and prominent brow ridge from Eastern European and Central Asian heritage. Clean-shaven or with minimal facial hair. Skin shows signs of age and work without neglect.', N'Fingernails on both hands display a subtle iridescent sheen under direct light, shifting faintly between green and purple at certain angles — geneware modification from a Deepwell Station parlor. This was intended to be subtle and demonstrably is not. No visible neural interface ports; the company-issued uplink is subcutaneous and unobtrusive.', N'Stands with balanced, centered posture — the stance of someone accustomed to moving through a confined space at speed without losing equilibrium. Movements are economical and deliberate, never rushed. Maintains steady eye contact in conversation. When standing still, frequently shifts weight slightly, as if the body remembers the constant micro-adjustments of rail operation.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, union-conscious. Off-duty: well-maintained but plainly practical clothing — durable synthetic-cotton blend trousers, function-first jackets with multiple pockets, waterproof Ferrogate-branded rain gear that''s seen real use. Shoes are always broken-in safety-rated footwear, never fashionable. On-duty: standard Ferrogate operator uniform in charcoal gray with high-visibility striping. Minimal jewelry beyond a simple stainless steel watch. The iridescent nails are the only concession to vanity, and they wear this contradiction without apparent self-consciousness.', N'They have been quietly leaking Ferrogate internal maintenance reports showing systemic safety failures to an anonymous journalist for two years. If discovered, they would be fired and potentially face criminal charges under the corponation''s IP agreements. They believe it is the right thing to do and have never felt good about it for a single day.', N'Precise and institutional when discussing union or work matters; warmer and more meandering in casual conversation. Uses the formal Ferrogate communication register fluently as a kind of ironic armor.', N'Even and measured. Rarely rushes. Deliberate pauses.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'birger_baiseitov_petrovi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a60f-7f9a-b333-d5f057bad025', N'Boluwatife Morimoto', N'Boluwatife', N'', N'Morimoto', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lockhaven North, Block 7 — a twelve-story residential stack owned by a Palladian property sub-entity, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Building superintendent for a mid-tier residential block', N'Palladian (property subsidiary, Lockhaven North management contract); functionally independent in daily operation', N'Boluwatife Morimoto is a big woman, wide through the shoulders and unhurried in every movement, with dark skin and close-cropped natural hair going silver at the temples. She has no cosmetic geneware — considers it wasteful — but her left forearm is sheathed in functional chrome from wrist to elbow, a prosthetic she received after an industrial accident fifteen years ago. She keeps it polished to a mirror shine, the one vanity she permits herself. Her face is deeply expressive, capable of communicating entire paragraphs of displeasure through a single lifted brow.

Boluwatife Morimoto has managed Block 7 for eleven years and knows every pipe, every tenant, and every leak before it happens. She is the closest thing to a government most residents will ever interact with — she mediates disputes, facilitates unofficial rent negotiations, holds keys to every unit, and knows who is three months behind and who is running an unlicensed business out of their kitchen. She is fair to a degree that exhausts her and does not apologize for any of her decisions.', N'Gateway to the residential community of Lockhaven North — controls access, knows everyone''s business. Can be a quest giver, a gatekeeper, a source of information about specific tenants, or an obstacle. Represents institutional power at human scale.', N'', N'Chrome prosthetic left forearm (functional, utility-grade, high polish). Internal pressure and temperature sensors in the prosthetic hand for plumbing diagnostics.', N'On-call all hours; spends mornings doing inspection rounds, afternoons on maintenance and paperwork, evenings available to tenants. Eats dinner at the same corner table in the ground-floor common room every night at 19:00.', N'Boluwatife Morimoto, 178cm tall broad-shouldered maintenance technician with warm medium-to-deep brown skin with golden undertones reflecting East Asian, Hispanic, and African heritage. Short black hair with silver at temples. Sharp dark brown eyes. Angular face with high East Asian cheekbones, strong Latin American jawline, weathered from decades of outdoor work. Thin scar on left cheekbone. Left forearm sheathed in mirror-polished chrome prosthetic with diagnostic ports, dark burn scars on right shoulder. Wearing gray heavy-duty work coveralls and fitted dark blue utility shirt, steel-toed boots, thick mechanical watch, keyring with thirty keys at belt. Standing in relaxed but commanding posture in industrial plumbing workshop with warm amber lighting, water pipes and tool racks behind her, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cinematic realism, character portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lockhaven North', N'local', N'Lockhaven North', N'Complex diaspora blend: East Asian (41.2%) as primary ancestry, Hispanic/Latin American (30.7%) as secondary, with significant Sub-Saharan African (11.0%), Northern European (10.1%), and Southeast Asian (7.0%) contributions. Creates warm medium-to-deep brown skin with golden undertones, angular facial structure blending East Asian bone structure with Latin American features, enriched by African melanin depth and Northern European cheekbone prominence.', 178, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, with a thick torso and strong legs. No excess body fat but substantial muscle mass from decades of hands-on maintenance work. Carries herself with the unrushed weight of someone who knows her own strength.', N'Natural black with silver threading at temples and along the sides', N'Close-cropped natural cut, no styling products, minimal maintenance', N'Short', N'Dark brown, sharp and assessing', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden undertones, reflecting dominant East Asian and Hispanic ancestry balanced with African melanin depth. Subtle warm richness from Southeast Asian contribution. Even complexion without excessive weathering despite outdoor work history.', N'Weathered and expressive face with deep lines around the eyes and mouth from years of outdoor work and the weight of responsibility. High cheekbones with East Asian influence blended with fuller cheek structure from Latin American ancestry. Strong jawline with defined contours. Minimal makeup. Calloused hands. Small scar on left cheekbone from a minor job site incident.', N'Left forearm prosthetic in functional chrome (utility-grade, not cosmetic), kept in high-polish condition. The hand contains integrated pressure and temperature sensors for plumbing diagnostics. No other visible modifications.', N'Unhurried and deliberate in every movement. Stands with weight balanced evenly, shoulders relaxed but ready. Moves through space like someone who owns it without needing to prove it. Her lifted brow and slight head tilt communicate disapproval more effectively than words.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear: durable coveralls or heavy-duty work pants and fitted utility shirts in grays and dark blues. Steel-toed boots, well-maintained but worn. A heavy jacket in cold months. A keyring with at least thirty keys visible at her belt. No jewelry except a simple analog watch. Everything chosen for function over fashion; nothing flashy, nothing wasteful.', N'She has been quietly subsidizing three families'' rent shortfalls out of her own wages for two years, recording them as maintenance cost overruns in Palladian''s system. The discrepancy is approaching a threshold that will trigger an audit.', N'Direct and institutional, carries the cadence of someone who has read too many maintenance contracts. Occasionally drops into Bambara when frustrated.', N'Slow and weighted — every sentence arrives like a decision that''s already been made.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'boluwatife_morimoto');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a61f-7343-8e37-d62c3cd6e74d', N'Thandiwe Trujillo', N'Thandiwe', N'', N'Trujillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 41, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, Bronzeline district — operates from a narrow print-shop front that sells legitimate business cards and event placards as a surface trade, near Western and Division', N'Fake ID vendor and forged document specialist — produces transit passes, corporate employment records, citizenship grades, and identity packages', N'Independent; pays protection to the Bronzeline Souk collective and receives legal cover in return; has long-standing professional relationships with several of The Narrows'' mutual aid networks as a supplier of basic transit documentation for people in need', N'Thandiwe Trujillo is the kind of person who has made themselves deliberately difficult to remember, which is a specific and cultivated skill. They are of medium height and medium build, with light-brown skin that sits at an unplaceable intersection of their Breton, Ghanaian, and Fulani inheritance, and they dress in muted colors and unremarkable cuts. The one exception is their hands, which they have had tattooed from wrist to fingertip in precise, circuit-board-fine geometric linework — not geneware, not chrome, just ink, chosen because it reminded them of the first forgery they were proud of. They keep their natural hair in a low wrap and wear plain-lensed glasses they don''t need because it gives them something to do with their hands when thinking.

They are methodical, dry-humored, and possessed of a craftsperson''s ego that they work hard to conceal. Every document they produce is technically flawless and they cannot resist occasionally making them beautiful — a font choice, a watermark pattern, a texture that no one asked for but that makes the thing feel real in the hand. They believe that identity should be available to everyone who needs one, and they have a deep and principled contempt for systems that make it otherwise. They have never met a citizenship algorithm they couldn''t eventually beat.', N'Access point for false documentation — transit passes, employment records, full identity packages; can also identify forgeries made by others; plot-enabler for characters who need to move through GLMZ under a different name', N'', N'Micro-precision haptic feedback overlay in fingertips (surgical, professional-grade — allows them to feel micron-level texture variations in document materials); no cosmetic modifications by deliberate choice', N'They open the shop front at 09:00 and handle legitimate printing trade until noon; afternoons and evenings are for real work, conducted in the back room behind a sound-dampened partition. They never rush a commission and turn down more work than they accept.', N'Thandiwe Trujillo, a 168cm lean mixed-heritage figure of complex four-continent ancestry—warm medium brown skin with golden and reddish undertones blending Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Southeast Asian heritage. Dark brown hair with gray undertones in a neat low wrap. Refined cheekbones, dark unaugmented eyes, full lips, strong jaw definition. Wearing plain cream or dove gray cotton shirt, dark trousers, unbranded clear-lens safety glasses. Hands adorned with intricate black circuit-board geometric tattoo work covering wrist to fingertip. Steady, upright posture with precise, economical movements. Gray canvas work apron with multiple tool pockets. Worn but clean leather flats. Minimal expression, neutral watchfulness, fine lines around eyes from decades of precision work. Standing at a well-lit precision workstation in a GLMZ workshop, soft overhead lighting catching the warm tones of skin and subtle shimmer of hand tattoos. Muted, deliberate aesthetic—someone trained to be forgettable. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'A striking four-continent genetic blend: Hispanic/Latin American (35.1%) provides warm undertones and jaw definition; Sub-Saharan African (29.6%) contributes depth, lip fullness, and facial proportion; South Asian (20.1%) adds refined bone structure and eye character; Southeast Asian (15.2%) refines cheekbone architecture and eye placement. The result is a genuinely pan-diasporic complexion that transcends regional categories—warm medium brown with golden and reddish undertones that shift subtly in different light, reading as authentically mixed rather than approximating any single ancestry.', 168, 62, N'Medium, lean without being angular — the economical frame of someone who moves deliberately and wastes no motion', N'Natural dark brown with graying undertones', N'Low wrap, neat and tight, pulled close to the scalp', N'Medium (wrapped length approximately 12-15cm when loose)', N'Dark brown, unaugmented', N'Warm medium brown—a complex four-way blend of Latin American golden warmth, African depth, South Asian refinement, and Southeast Asian luminosity; the tone occupies a sophisticated middle register with golden and reddish undertones that shift subtly in different light', N'Clean-shaven face, minimal makeup, skin condition shows meticulous care with no visible scarring or blemishing; fine lines around the eyes from decades of close precision work; expression tends toward neutral watchfulness; facial features reflect the four ancestries: Southeast Asian and South Asian influence in refined cheekbone structure and eye placement; Latin American heritage in nose and jaw definition; Sub-Saharan African ancestry in lip fullness, facial proportion, and subtle width through the face', N'None visible. Micro-precision haptic feedback overlay is subcutaneous in fingertips and completely invisible; no chrome, no LEDs, no dermal modification by deliberate choice.', N'Upright, economical posture with minimal wasted gesture; hands move with precision and confidence, often reaching for eyeglasses unconsciously when thinking — a tic born of habit rather than need; gait is steady and unhurried; overall bearing suggests someone who has trained themselves to be unremarkable and forgettable', N'Muted earth tones and grays — well-maintained but deliberately nondescript clothing in functional cuts. Typically: plain cotton or linen shirts in cream, taupe, or dove gray; dark trousers with clean lines; unbranded safety glasses with clear lenses worn habitually despite not needing correction; a gray canvas work apron in the shop with multiple pockets for tools and materials. Footwear is practical: worn but clean leather flats or soft-soled shoes suitable for hours of standing at worktables. No jewelry, no adornment, no corporate branding or tier indicators — the aesthetic of someone who has trained themselves to occupy space without drawing attention.', N'They have been building a master false identity for themselves for eight years — not to use, or not yet, but as a contingency. The identity is so complete and so deeply embedded in multiple city registries that it would pass any check. They have never told anyone it exists. The name on it is the name they were almost given at birth before their parents changed their minds.', N'Precise and slightly formal; uses technical printing and documentation terminology as naturally as other people use everyday language; doesn''t use contractions when discussing serious matters', N'Even and unhurried; long pauses are thinking, not discomfort; rarely raises their voice', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'thandiwe_trujillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b9-7989-8d4e-d633bbe4b36c', N'Govert Petrović-Balogun', N'Govert', N'', N'Petrović-Balogun', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre — sleeps in the back of the Ferrogate Transit Workers'' Local 9 hall, near Western and Division', N'Union organizer and protest coordinator', N'Ferrogate Transit Workers'' Local 9; loose network of Mexicantown Libre community organizers', N'Govert Petrović-Balogun is compact and kinetic, rarely fully still, with medium-brown skin and a geneware tail — a long, expressive black cat tail they got at seventeen — that broadcasts their mood with embarrassing accuracy. Their hair is dyed in shifting bands of amber and copper, and they have the kind of face that looks younger than it is, which they''ve learned to use strategically: people underestimate them exactly once. There are calluses on their hands from six months working actual transit maintenance before they moved into organizing full-time, and they consider those calluses a credential.

Govert Petrović-Balogun has been with Transit Workers'' Local 9 for three years and is, depending on who you ask, either the most effective junior organizer the local has seen in a decade or an absolute disaster waiting to happen. Both assessments are probably true. They have an instinct for crowd dynamics and an appetite for confrontation that their more experienced colleagues find alternately inspiring and terrifying. They believe completely in the workers they represent and are only beginning to understand the gap between belief and strategy.', N'Local color and action catalyst. They can mobilize people fast and are the character most likely to turn a situation from a conversation into an event. They''re also a mentorship opportunity and a liability — their energy is useful and their judgment is developing.', N'', N'Geneware cat tail (cosmetic, expressive). Cheap subvocal mic implant for hands-free comms during actions.', N'Moves constantly between the union hall, worksites, and community meetings. Eats whatever''s available whenever someone puts it in front of them. Attends every public meeting of the Ferrogate Transit corponation they can access, usually in the back row.', N'Govert Petrović-Balogun, compact 162cm figure with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, dark brown alert eyes, shoulder-length dark hair with amber and copper dye bands pulled back with wire. Strong Sub-Saharan African bone structure with Latin American jaw fullness and Eastern European subtle definition. Wiry build, restless kinetic posture. Black articulated feline geneware tail extending from spine, constantly moving. Subvocal mic node visible at throat, faintly luminescent. Wearing scuffed steel-toed boots, black frayed cargo pants, oversized union-branded windbreaker over synthetic tank, visible union pins and hand-drawn protest patches on sleeves. Backward ''Ferrogate Transit Local 9'' baseball cap. Cord bracelet with metal beads, basic comms earpiece. Hands mid-gesture. Intense eye contact. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, gritty transit hub setting, neon-reflected wet concrete, harsh overhead lighting catching the luminescence of the implant, motion blur suggesting constant movement, blue-purple ambient light from transit systems --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Pan-diaspora blend: Sub-Saharan African (50%), Hispanic/Latin American (30.1%), Eastern European (15.6%), Southeast Asian (4.3%). Features a striking mix of warm deep brown and golden undertones with Sub-Saharan African bone structure and facial proportions, Latin American jaw and mouth shape, Eastern European subtle cheekbone definition, and Southeast Asian eye characteristics. Rich melanin expression with warm undertones.', 162, 58, N'Compact and wiry, high muscle density from transit maintenance work. Restless kinetic energy evident even at rest — shoulders often slightly raised, weight constantly shifting between feet.', N'Natural dark brown with semi-permanent dye in shifting bands of amber and copper', N'Shoulder-length, deliberately unkempt, often pulled back with whatever''s at hand — wire, fabric scraps, union pins', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, alert and calculating', N'Deep warm brown complexion with golden and honey undertones, reflecting the dominant Sub-Saharan African ancestry blended with Latin American and Eastern European warmth — rich melanin expression, medium-to-deep depth', N'Strong-boned face with prominent cheekbones and defined jaw reflecting Sub-Saharan African ancestry, combined with Latin American fullness in the lower face and wide mouth, Eastern European subtle structure. Youthful features that read younger than 24. Skin shows sun exposure and stress — occasional breakouts along the jaw from inconsistent sleep. Minimal grooming beyond necessity; calluses on palms and finger pads from six months of maintenance work and constant document handling.', N'Black feline geneware tail with independent articulation, visible at the base of the spine and extending below the hip line — constantly moving. Subvocal mic implant at the throat base, subtle silvered node, faintly luminescent during active transmission.', N'Never fully still. Weight rocks side to side while standing. Hands gesture constantly — punctuating speech, organizing space around them, fidgeting with union pins, fabric, document edges. When focused in conversation, they lean forward with intense eye contact. When agitated or thinking, the tail lashes in tight circles. When confident, the tail arcs high and relaxed. Moves quickly through spaces with purposeful efficiency, rarely walks when they can move with intention.', N'Tier 4 working-class practical with protest aesthetics. Black cargo pants with multiple pockets and frayed cuffs, scuffed steel-toed boots. Oversized union-branded windbreaker or worn flannel shirt layered over cheap synthetic tank tops. Visible union pins, hand-drawn protest patch clusters on jacket sleeves. Wears a faded ''Ferrogate Transit Local 9'' baseball cap backward when working public actions. Jewelry minimal: a simple cord bracelet with metal beads made by fellow organizers, clip-on comms earpiece (basic model, visible). No grooming for aesthetics — appearance reflects time scarcity and tier reality.', N'During a wildcat action eighteen months ago that went wrong — a blockade that got three workers cited and fined — Rudo had been warned it was premature by their mentor and proceeded anyway. They''ve never told anyone this. The official union account blames miscommunication. The workers who were fined don''t know Rudo knew.', N'Direct, concrete, collective ''we'' constantly. Quotes union history with genuine enthusiasm. Uses profanity as punctuation, not emphasis.', N'Fast and building, with a rhetorical rhythm they''ve learned from watching older organizers — sets up a beat and carries people along it.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'govert_petrovi_balogun');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a679-7657-ae39-d63d38c2fb0b', N'Eduarda Villanueva-Larsdóttir', N'Eduarda', N'', N'Villanueva-Larsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Pilsen Veil, studio called Second Skin on a street level unit beneath a Helix Biosystems-adjacent medical supply depot, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Gene-mod body artist and tattoo practitioner', N'Independent; licensed through a Helix Biosystems satellite certification (for geneware application) which she maintains with visible resentment; member of the Pilsen Veil Body Arts Collective', N'Eduarda Villanueva-Larsdóttir is the kind of person whose own body is her portfolio, which is either an advertisement or a warning depending on who is looking. She has deep olive skin networked with bioluminescent subdermal patterns — her own design, her own application, done in sections over nine years — that shift between dormant and active based on her emotional state, a feature she installed deliberately and occasionally regrets. Her face is clear of modification by choice, a decision that draws more attention than any further work could. She is medium height, broad-shouldered, moves with the confidence of someone who has spent years being looked at and has made a separate peace with it. Her Ghanaian grandfather''s bone structure and her Greek grandmother''s coloring produce something the Pilsen Veil regulars call ''aggressively memorable.''

She does traditional tattoo work, biological geneware application, and bespoke subdermal lighting — the full spectrum from purely cosmetic to emotionally interactive, like her own reactive network. She is meticulous, unhurried, and has a waiting list of four months that she has never tried to shorten. Her reputation is built on two things: technical excellence and the refusal to apply any design she finds spiritually wrong for the client, a policy that generates one furious argument per month and one deeply grateful client per month and she considers this an acceptable ratio.', N'Service provider who sees the city''s cross-section of people; keeper of secrets (clients confide during long applications); potential source on Helix Biosystems geneware supply chain irregularities; community ritual anchor for Pilsen Veil', N'', N'Full-body bioluminescent subdermal network (her own design, emotion-reactive); standard subdermal tool-grip reinforcement in both hands; cat-pupil iris modification in left eye only (cosmetic; the asymmetry is deliberate)', N'She opens Second Skin at ten, does consultations and design work in the morning, applications in the afternoon when her hands are steadiest. She closes by eight and spends evenings reading — physical books, which she collects obsessively. Every third Friday she hosts a ritual at the studio for clients who want to mark the completion of a major piece together; she frames it as a party but everyone understands it is something else.', N'Eduarda Villanueva-Larsdóttir, a Southeast Asian-Latina-East Asian mixed heritage woman in the year 2226, luminous warm medium-deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones, high cheekbones and defined jawline, shoulder-length deep brown hair worn loose, striking asymmetrical gaze with one cat-pupil amber iris modification with vertical slit and one warm brown eye. Sleeveless fitted black technical fabrics displaying full-body bioluminescent subdermal network glowing soft cyan-to-violet geometric patterns across shoulders, arms, and torso, network densest on upper back creating living circuitry effect. Worn linen work apron over clothing. 168cm tall, athletic broad-shouldered build, measured confident posture with expressive hands showing subdermal tool-grip reinforcement. Single silver band on right ring finger. GLMZ 2200s working artist aesthetic, focused calm expression with sudden intensity, standing in studio workspace with strategic backlighting revealing bioluminescent patterns, moody cyan and warm practical lighting, dystopian Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Pilsen Veil', N'local', N'Pilsen Veil', N'Southeast Asian (35.2%, primary), Hispanic/Latin American (30.6%), East Asian (15.3%), Northern European (14.1%), with minor South Asian and Eastern European admixture (2.4% each). Genetic heritage creates a striking cosmopolitan phenotype: warm medium-to-deep brown skin with golden, olive, and amber undertones from the Southeast Asian, Hispanic, and East Asian ancestry blending; high architectural cheekbones and defined jawline reflecting Southeast Asian and Hispanic features; eye shape shows East Asian influence with warm-toned irises; overall complexion luminous and warm-toned.', 168, 68, N'Broad-shouldered and athletic without bulk; the build of someone who moves deliberately and spends hours in focused physical work. Strong forearms and steady hands.', N'Deep brown with natural warm undertones', N'Worn loose or in a high knot depending on work phase; deliberately unadorned', N'Medium (shoulder-length when down)', N'Left eye: cat-pupil iris modification (custom amber with vertical slit pupil); right eye: warm dark brown, unmodified', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden, amber, and olive undertones—the result of Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and East Asian ancestry blending into a luminous, sun-kissed complexion that seems to absorb and reflect light dynamically', N'Clear, unmarked face by choice. High cheekbones with Southeast Asian and Hispanic architectural influence, defined jawline. Eye shape shows East Asian genetics creating subtle almond quality. Skin shows meticulous care; no cosmetic facial work. Expression tends toward focused calm interrupted by sudden intensity.', N'Full-body bioluminescent subdermal network (actively visible and reactive); asymmetrical cat-pupil iris modification in left eye; subdermal tool-grip reinforcement in hands manifests as faint scarring/patterning at palms and fingers when examined closely, or slight visual shimmer under certain light angles', N'Moves with measured confidence and economy—no wasted motion. Hands are expressive and precise, often unconsciously demonstrating potential work on the air. Maintains steady eye contact (the asymmetry of her gaze is deliberate and used strategically). Stands with weight balanced, shoulders back. When working, enters a state of absolute focus that creates a palpable boundary around her workspace.', N'Tier 3-4 working artist aesthetic: fitted black or charcoal technical fabrics that show off her bioluminescent network without being ostentatious about it; sleeveless or short-sleeved to display arm work. Precision-tailored; no excess. Frequently wears a worn linen apron over her clothes during work hours—an affectation that reads as both practical and performative. Boots with good grip. Minimal jewelry (she is the jewelry). No corporate branding; all her clothing is either independent maker or salvaged/tailored. A single silver band on her right ring finger—old, possibly inherited.', N'Her Helix Biosystems certification was obtained with falsified hours — she is skilled enough that it does not matter technically, but the falsification means Helix has leverage over her that she has never disclosed to anyone.', N'Technical and specific when discussing work; warmly direct in consultation; tends toward the declarative rather than the interrogative even when asking something', N'Steady and unhurried; fills silence comfortably without filling it with words', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eduarda_villanueva_larsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ff-74b2-9824-d6402e181172', N'Einar Haraldsen', N'Einar', N'', N'Haraldsen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 46, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, operates from a licensed bay at the Kessler Interchange motor court, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Independent vehicle mechanic specializing in Ferrogate maintenance overflow and civilian groundcars', N'Independent; occasional subcontract overflow work for Ferrogate Transit maintenance division', N'Einar Haraldsen is a big man going soft at the middle, with his Nigerian father''s broad forehead and his Norwegian mother''s pale blue eyes that have always startled people in a face as dark and richly toned as his. He has retractable claw mods on his right hand — not for fighting, but because forty years ago his grandfather lost two fingers to a torque wrench and Dayo decided the human hand was simply not engineered for engine work. The claws give him precision grip on components that would take a standard hand twice as long. He smells perpetually of synthetic lubricant and a particular cedar-note cologne he has worn since he was twenty, and which he applies over the grease rather than instead of it.

His bay is controlled chaos — towers of salvaged parts catalogued in a system only he understands, three different radios playing simultaneously (one for news, one for music, one permanently tuned to a Geartown E.L.F. frequency that outputs as static but which Dayo insists contains diagnostic information), and a small shrine to the Wrench E.L.F. on the tool chest consisting of a disassembled carburetor arranged like a mandala. He is not a warm man in the Blessing sense — he does not offer food or ask about your feelings. But he is deeply, uncomplicatedly fair, charges exactly what the work costs, and has an allergic reaction to being lied to that is nearly physical in its intensity.', N'Practical resource and equipment connection; honest broker in a district full of grift; moral anchor who functions through fairness rather than warmth; can provide access to vehicle systems, transit infrastructure knowledge, and Geartown social network', N'', N'Retractable precision claw mods, right hand (functional, five fingers replaced with articulated tool-grip claws); optical zoom implant, left eye (civilian grade, for close component inspection)', N'In the bay by 08:00, works until the job is done or his body gives out, usually around 22:00; eats two meals standing up; sleeps in a cot in the back office four nights a week rather than commuting to his apartment in McKinley Flats', N'Einar Haraldsen, 46-year-old neo-noir mechanic, 188cm tall with broad muscular build and accumulated weight at torso. Warm bronze-brown skin with luminous East Asian-Southeast Asian-Sub-Saharan blend complexion. Deep brown eyes with silvery-purple iridescent cybernetic ring in left eye. Dark brown hair with gray at temples, styled in short tight curls. Weather-creased face from decades of engine work, defined jaw with close-trimmed graying beard. Right hand replaced with five retractable brushed-steel precision claws with servo mechanics visible. Deep scar across right forearm, faint burn marks on left forearm, wrench-and-sun tattoo on left wrist. Wearing faded indigo Ferrogate coveralls heavily patched at knees and elbows, gray tecnocotton undershirt, dark brown leather jacket with pushed-up sleeves showing augmentations and scars, scuffed steel-toed boots. Silver chain necklace visible at collar. Stands with weight-forward mechanic''s stance, claws partially extended at chest level. Strong presence despite controlled precise movements. Industrial workshop or neo-noir maintenance bay setting, cool blue-green LED lighting mixing with warm practical work lights, oil and metal reflections on skin. Mood: tired, focused, determined. Neo-noir 2220s aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Predominantly East Asian (54.9%) and Southeast Asian (41.1%) ancestry with Sub-Saharan African (4.0%) heritage—a Ubiquitous Diaspora blend producing warm bronze-brown skin with the characteristic facial structure of East and Southeast Asian genetics enriched by Sub-Saharan warmth', 188, 102, N'Large-framed and broad-shouldered, with visible softness accumulating at the middle and chest; still carries the physical presence of a younger laborer, but gravity and years of standing at workbenches have added weight in his torso', N'Dark brown, graying at temples and along the jawline', N'Short, tight curls kept practical and low-maintenance; occasionally oil-stained despite regular washing', N'Short', N'Deep brown; left eye shows faint iridescent silvery-purple ring from optical zoom implant when light hits it', N'Warm bronze-brown with luminous depth—richly pigmented from the blending of East Asian, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan ancestry, producing a complexion that glows with warm undertones in certain light', N'Weathered and practical—permanent creases around his eyes from forty-six years of squinting into engine bays; perpetual faint smell of synthetic lubricant embedded in his skin despite washing; small scars on his knuckles and forearms; jaw line still defined beneath a neat, close-trimmed beard flecked with gray; facial structure shows East and Southeast Asian heritage with subtle width at cheekbones and characteristic definition, enhanced by the warm undertones of Sub-Saharan ancestry; slightly rounded face shape with defined nose bridge', N'Right hand: five retractable precision claw mods in place of biological fingers, each articulated with subtle servo mechanics visible at the knuckle joints; brushed steel coloring with grip-texture pads on the inner curve of each claw. Left eye: faint silvery-purple iridescent ring visible around the iris when light strikes it at certain angles, marking the optical zoom implant housing.', N'Stands with the weight-forward stance of someone who has spent decades leaning into work; moves deliberately and without wasted motion, with a mechanic''s economy of gesture; right hand often held at chest level when idle, claws partially extended or twitching slightly as if restless; left eye occasionally focuses with an intensity disconnected from what he is actually looking at (optical zoom engaging). Despite his size, his movements are controlled and precise.', N'Tier 3 working-class practical: heavy-duty Ferrogate-branded coveralls (faded indigo, extensively patched at knees and elbows), worn over a simple gray tecnocotton undershirt; steel-toed workboots scuffed to near-matte finish; a worn leather jacket (dark brown, creased at the elbows, with the sleeves pushed up to his forearms) that he shrugs on when leaving the bay. Accessory: a thin silver chain around his neck disappearing into his shirt (contains a small photo of his grandfather). His clothing always smells faintly of cedar cologne underneath the synthetic lubricant—a stubborn refusal to smell entirely like his work.', N'He has been quietly reassembling a groundcar in the back of bay three for six years — it was his son''s project, started together, abandoned when they stopped speaking. He does not know if he is finishing it as a gift or an apology or just because he cannot leave a thing incomplete.', N'Terse, technical, precise — he uses the correct name for every component and expects you to keep up or ask', N'Short sentences, long silences, never repeats himself', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'einar_haraldsen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72b-7e3d-8907-d657be02749f', N'Amobi Árnason', N'Amobi', N'', N'Árnason', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 62, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Brightmoor Reclamation — the cooperative is in a converted two-story auto-shop called The Mending Ground, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Rehabilitation specialist running a community physiotherapy cooperative in Brightmoor Reclamation', N'The Mending Ground Cooperative (founder); informal network with Brightmoor Reclamation community council; historically adversarial relationship with Ferrogate Transit', N'Amobi Árnason is tall and angular in the way of men who were once broader and have shed weight across decades of physical work. His Ethiopian-Samoan heritage gives him a face that reads as ageless to people who do not look carefully — the lines around his eyes are deep but his posture is impeccable, a side effect of forty years of correcting other people''s. His hair is white and he keeps it in tight locks, usually pinned back. His left arm from the elbow down is a prosthetic — a practical, unglamorous Ferrogate Transit worker''s model he has refused to upgrade because, he says, it does exactly what he needs and he is not performing affluence.

He founded The Mending Ground cooperative twenty years ago after a Ferrogate Transit industrial accident took his forearm and the company''s rehabilitation program discharged him after six weeks with paperwork he did not have the corporate literacy to challenge. He taught himself physiotherapy from archived textbooks and eventually brought in two trained practitioners. He is gruff in the way of people who have been in pain and do not find sentiment useful, but he remembers every patient''s name and the specific injury that brought them to him, and he asks after their families.', N'Community anchor and local color; quest giver for anything involving labor rights, Ferrogate Transit''s conduct, or the needs of Brightmoor''s working population; prosthetics black market contact; patient zero for community-level crises', N'', N'Left arm prosthetic (Ferrogate Transit industrial-grade model, elbow-down, non-cosmetic, twenty years old and well-maintained); no other augmentations', N'At The Mending Ground by 0730 for the morning session with the earliest patients — usually transit workers and dock laborers; takes a long lunch during which he manages cooperative finances and argues with suppliers; afternoon sessions with children and elderly patients; closes the cooperative himself most nights.', N'GLMZ portrait of Amobi Árnason, 62-year-old trauma physician with Pan-Asian features and warm medium tan complexion. East Asian cheekbones and eye structure prominent beneath golden undertones. Short white locks pinned back, deep brown eyes, weathered face with laugh lines and sparse white facial hair. Tall angular frame (188cm), impeccable posture. Left arm is industrial-grade prosthetic from elbow down—matte grey-black anodized aluminum with segmented fingers and visible mechanical joints, twenty years old. Wearing charcoal work shirt, reinforced canvas apron, dark cargo pants, black utility boots. Faint scars visible on right jawline and left forearm. Direct evaluative gaze. Standing in workshop-clinic setting with warm overhead lighting casting soft shadows across his face. Professional, focused demeanor. Neo-noir clinical environment. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Brightmoor Reclamation', N'local', N'Brightmoor Reclamation', N'Complex Pan-Asian-European blend: 60.9% East and Southeast Asian (dominant cheekbone structure, eye shape, facial proportions) combined with 27.3% Northern European (lighter overall tone, subtle cool undertones), plus 6.3% South Asian and 5.5% Sub-Saharan African ancestry. This creates a rare phenotype—East Asian skeletal structure and eye set with a warm medium complexion that reads neither fully East nor fully European, but a genuine synthesis. Undertones shift across seasons and lighting: golden in warm light, with cooler undertones emerging in blue-spectrum environments. The blend creates subtle dimensionality in skin depth.', 188, 78, N'Tall and angular, lean through the shoulders and chest with the posture of a man who spent decades correcting spines. Minimal body fat. Long, functional frame — no excess mass.', N'White', N'Tight locks, usually pinned back with a simple cord or clip', N'Medium (shoulder-length locks)', N'Deep brown', N'Warm medium tan with golden undertones—lighter than pure East Asian baseline but deeper than Northern European pale. The South Asian and Sub-Saharan components add subtle warmth and depth beneath the surface. Weathered from decades of natural light exposure, with visible sun-damage patina.', N'Face reads younger than his 62 years until examined closely—deep laugh lines around the eyes, a few age spots on his temples, sparse facial hair grown in white. East Asian cheekbones and orbital structure prominent; eye fold and bridge shape distinctly East/Southeast Asian. Skin is clear and leathered from decades of physical work. Warm undertones create visual approachability despite his evaluative expression.', N'Left arm prosthetic from elbow down — Ferrogate Transit industrial-grade model, approximately twenty years old. Matte grey-black anodized aluminum with functional segmented fingers and visible mechanical joints. No cosmetic covering. The attachment point at the elbow shows wear and careful maintenance — reinforced anchor points, minimal aesthetic consideration. Moves with practiced efficiency but shows the slight delay inherent to older myoelectric systems.', N'Impeccable posture — shoulders squared, spine neutral, a side effect of four decades of correcting other people''s alignment. Moves with economic precision, no wasted motion. When standing still, his weight is balanced between both feet despite the prosthetic''s motor lag. His gaze is direct and evaluative. When working with patients, his body language shifts to attentive stillness.', N'Tier 3 practical laborer aesthetic. Unbranded charcoal work shirt or grey long-sleeved thermal, usually with a reinforced canvas apron worn at The Mending Ground. Dark cargo pants with multiple pockets (tools, patient records, comm device). Black utility boots, well-maintained but not new. A worn fleece jacket in winter, sometimes a Brightmoor Reclamation cooperative pin on the collar. No jewelry except a simple watch on his right wrist. His clothing shows maintenance and care rather than affluence — visible mending on seams, faded from repeated washing, but clean.', N'He has been contacted twice by a Ferrogate Transit union organizer who wants him to testify about the industrial accident''s systemic cause. He has refused both times. He knows exactly why: if he testifies, he will have to revisit the accident in detail, and he is afraid of what he will say about the co-worker who he believes caused it through negligence — a man who is now dead and whose family lives three streets away.', N'Direct, functional, minimal — uses the right word for a body part or a mechanical thing with total precision; becomes unexpectedly poetic in occasional long digressions about what he calls ''the politics of pain''', N'Slow and deliberate, rarely interruptible, comfortable with silence', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amobi_rnason');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63f-7d23-9b1e-d6b3ac7e4590', N'Anwuli Nwosu-Thorvaldsdóttir', N'Anwuli', N'', N'Nwosu-Thorvaldsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 25, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Dockside — Lake Michigan waterfront, smuggler territory, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Social engineering and negotiation specialist — face', N'Freelance — Geartown regular; The Glass Ladder', N'Anwuli Nwosu-Thorvaldsdóttir is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 25, the augmentation scarring around her temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Before the runner life, she worked corporate — low-tier security, the kind that teaches you exactly how the system''s defenses fail. She works as a face out of Dockside, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Anwuli Nwosu-Thorvaldsdóttir has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and she cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Kamala Mori-Sefa is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage. Wired reflexes with adrenaline pump — chemical-mechanical hybrid augmentation', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Anwuli Nwosu-Thorvaldsdóttir, lean 182cm tall mixed-heritage operative with complex ancestry blend: rich medium-warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones and luminescent iridescence, sharp angular cheekbones reflecting Sub-Saharan and Indigenous American features with East Asian eye geometry, dark brown eyes with amber warmth and inhuman processing speed. Black hair pulled tight in functional braid, subtle chrome-dust sheen. Silver scarring in geometric patterns around temples and jawline from augmentations deliberately exposed. Chromatic dermal camouflage shifting between matte black, deep blue, gunmetal gray across neck and hands under neon light. Cold direct gaze, perfectly still posture suggesting lethal efficiency. Wearing charcoal reinforced tactical jacket with visible armor panels, black compression base layer, matte cargo pants, scuffed steel-toed boots. Empty thigh holster. Tactical watch with encrypted overlay. GLMZ dockside aesthetic, neon lighting casting cool blues and cyberware glows across face and chrome scarring, predatory presence, contract negotiation tension. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dockside', N'local', N'Dockside', N'Complex multifaceted diaspora: Sub-Saharan African (34.5%) provides deep warm undertones and facial structure; East Asian (21.3%) contributes angular cheekbones and eye shape; Indigenous American (20.9%) adds facial width and bone prominence; Hispanic/Latin American (13.1%) brings warmth and subtle olive notes; Eastern European (10.2%) introduces cooler undertones. Result: richly layered medium-warm golden-brown complexion with subtle olive and cool undertones creating dimensional depth.', 182, 68, N'Lean and angular with visible muscle definition in shoulders and forearms; zero excess body fat. Moves with predatory efficiency—every gesture economical, no wasted motion.', N'Black with subtle iridescence—natural black with faint chrome-dust sheen from dermal contact', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid. Practical; minimizes visual distraction during negotiations.', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertone—baseline human, but gaze registers micro-expressions at inhuman speed', N'Medium-warm golden-brown with olive undertones—Sub-Saharan warmth grounding East Asian and Indigenous American structure, cooled subtly by Eastern European heritage; creates richly complex luminescent complexion under neon from chromatic augmentation', N'Distinctly angular face reflecting African width in cheekbones, East Asian eye geometry, Indigenous American facial prominence, with Eastern European cool undertones. Cheekbones sharp and defined; jawline strong. Dermal augmentation scarring visible as faint silver lattice work around temples and jawline—deliberately exposed. Minor nick scars on hands and knuckles; occupational. Chemical burn marks on inner right forearm (4cm diameter, adrenaline pump installation site), partially obscured by sleeve when worn.', N'Chromatic dermal camouflage manifests as subtle color-shifting iridescence across exposed skin—neck, hands, forearms shift between matte black, deep blue, and gunmetal gray depending on light angle and biometric state. Effect is unnerving; skin has faint luminescence under neon. Augmentation scarring silver-bright around temples and jawline. No attempt to hide any of it.', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, ready to move in any direction without telegraph. Walks with minimal hip rotation—controlled, lethal efficiency. Makes direct eye contact; blinks slowly, suggesting processing speed enhancement. Hands often at rest position near body center, fingers relaxed but ready. When negotiating, perfectly still; only eyes and face express intent.', N'Tier 3-4 functional streetwear: Charcoal reinforced tactical jacket (Shin-Kobe Industries surplus, worn deliberately) with integrated armor panels visible at shoulders and forearms. Black compression base layer under jacket. Matte-finish tactical cargo pants with thigh holster (empty by design—signals confidence). Steel-toed boots, scuffed and broken in. No jewelry; too many variables in a contract situation. Lightweight tactical watch with encrypted connection overlay. Everything dark, everything functional. Dockside aesthetic: practical survival wear, not fashion.', N'', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anwuli_nwosu_thorvaldsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a637-7be2-8724-d6b89d77b83f', N'Ermek Popescu-Okafor', N'Ermek', N'', N'Popescu-Okafor', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Halsted and Division', N'Black-market biosurgeon and underground body-modification artist', N'Unaffiliated; maintains careful neutrality as a matter of professional survival, though her sympathies run clearly toward the Gray Zone''s permanent underclass; The Coffin Nails', N'Ermek Popescu-Okafor operates out of a converted laundry unit in the lower warrens of the Gray Zone, where the smell of industrial solvent and antiseptic has long since soaked into the walls. She is a compact woman of Croatian-South Indian descent, with close-cropped silver hair that came in early and which she has never bothered to correct, and hands that move with the practiced economy of someone who has spent twenty years doing delicate work in poor light. Her face carries the particular stillness of a person who has learned to read rooms faster than rooms read her — broad cheekbones, dark eyes that tend to linger a beat too long, a scar along her left jaw she describes as a ''client disagreement'' without elaboration.

She was once a licensed reconstructive surgeon working out of a mid-tier clinic in The Circuit, specializing in trauma repair for workers injured in the manufacturing corridors. Her license was revoked twelve years ago following an investigation she maintains was fabricated by a corporate medical supplier whose overpriced components she had publicly refused to use. Whether or not that account is entirely accurate, she has since built a second career below the licensing threshold — patching up people the official system has no interest in treating, installing augmentations that haven''t cleared regulatory review, and occasionally doing work that blurs into the aesthetic and the transgressive. Her client list runs from the Gray Zone scrappers who need a cracked bone set to mid-tier fixers wanting off-the-books neural work.

Isadora does not advertise sentiment about her work, but the regulars know that her rates scale sharply with the client''s apparent wealth, and that she has been known to work for nothing when she judges the need sufficient. She keeps a small dog of indeterminate breed named Suture, drinks instant coffee with the resignation of someone who remembers better, and sleeps four hours a night by choice rather than necessity.', N'Moral anchor and access point for the body-horror and medical ethics dimensions of GLMZ; represents the cost of integrity within corrupt systems and the ambiguity of working outside the law for legitimate reasons', N'', N'Haptic-enhanced fingertips with sub-millimeter tactile resolution — licensed originally, now running on cracked firmware,A low-profile optical overlay in her left eye calibrated for surgical magnification and tissue-spectrum analysis,A blood-chemistry monitor implanted in her forearm that she originally installed for a patient and then replicated for herself', N'Wakes before the Gray Zone''s artificial dawn cycle, drinks coffee while reviewing whatever cases she has pending. Mornings are for preparation and supply inventory; she sources materials through three separate intermediaries and rotates them to avoid pattern. Procedures run through the afternoon and into the evening depending on complexity. She does not eat during work. After the last client she walks Suture through the lower corridors, which she describes as ''clearing the operating theater from her head.'' Reads medical journals — both licensed and grey-market — before sleeping, annotating in a personal cipher she developed in the first year after losing her license.', N'Ermek Popescu-Okafor, 158cm compact frame, silver-grey close-cropped hair, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden-amber and olive undertones. High prominent cheekbones, angular yet soft facial structure reflecting Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, Southeast Asian, and Eastern European heritage blend. Dark brown eyes with faint luminescent grid overlay in left eye. Chemical-scarred knuckles, ragged scar along left jawline. Faded medical caduceus tattoo on inner left forearm with subtle blue bioluminescent blood-chemistry monitor beneath. Translucent fingertips with haptic sensor seams. Wearing black medtech coat with frayed cuffs over grey thermal shirt, charcoal scrub-pants, scuffed surgical clogs. Steel chain necklace with surgical key fob. Posture forward on balls of feet, absolute stillness, hands in controlled neutral position. GLMZ, underground clinic setting, harsh fluorescent and bioluminescent lighting, exhausted focused intensity, reading vital signs in human tissue, the Gray Zone atmosphere, industrial and utilitarian aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Multi-continental synthesis: Sub-Saharan African (32.7%), Eastern European (18.8%), East Asian (17.4%), Southeast Asian (14.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (11.7%), South Asian (4.8%). The genetic blend manifests as warm medium-deep brown skin with complex layered undertones—golden-amber from East and Southeast Asian ancestry, subtle warm olive notes from Eastern European heritage, and earthy richness from Sub-Saharan African genetics with hints of Latin American warmth. High cheekbones with confident projection from African and East Asian features, balanced by finer bone structure influenced by Eastern European ancestry and Southeast Asian refinement.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, with the low body-fat composition of someone who moves efficiently through confined spaces and stands for long hours. Defined forearms and hands disproportionately strong relative to frame — surgeon''s hands.', N'Silver-grey', N'Close-cropped, precise fade maintained with clinical care', N'Short', N'Dark brown, left eye displays faint luminescent grid pattern during low-light conditions (optical overlay active)', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden-amber and subtle olive undertones, weathered by decades of solvent exposure and harsh clinic lighting', N'High prominent cheekbones with confident projection, gaunt facial structure reflecting the harmonized geometry of Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, Southeast Asian, and Eastern European ancestry—angular yet soft, with natural depth and warm undertones. Minimal makeup, perpetually tired eyes with the focused intensity of someone reading vital signs in human tissue. Fine lines around mouth from years of concentration. Skin texture shows chemical scarring on knuckles and fingertips from industrial-grade disinfectants. Facial proportions showcase the blended features of her diverse genetic heritage.', N'Left eye shows faint grid overlay visible in direct light or darkness — a slight chromatic aberration when she focuses. Fingertips appear subtly translucent under close inspection, with barely-perceptible seams at the dermis layer where haptic sensors interface with natural tissue. Forearm blood-chemistry monitor visible as a palm-sized patch of skin with slightly altered pigmentation and a faint blue bioluminescent pulse synchronized to heartbeat. No chrome, no obvious rig — all work is integrated and understated.', N'Stands with weight distributed forward on the balls of her feet, ready to pivot. Moves with surgical precision even in casual motion — no wasted gestures. Hands rest in neutral positions unless in conversation, where they become expressive but controlled. When focused, she enters a state of absolute stillness. Eye contact lasts fractionally too long, reading rather than connecting. Walks with the deliberate pace of someone who has learned that haste in the Gray Zone draws attention.', N'Tier 5 functionality with minimal aesthetic concern. Default outfit: charcoal scrub-pants with deep pockets for tools, loose-fitting grey thermal shirt under a long black medtech coat (frayed cuffs, faded from solvent exposure). Rubber-soled surgical clogs scuffed and re-soled twice. A thin steel chain around her neck with a small surgical key fob — either functional or talisman, unclear. No jewelry. Coat pockets contain gauze, injectable ampules, calibration tools, and a hand-rolled cigarette she never smokes but carries as a prop for thinking. Fabrics are all utilitarian — nothing corpo, nothing aspirational.', N'She still has access credentials to a corporate medical database she was never supposed to retain — and she has been quietly pulling patient data on a specific Spire-affiliated executive she believes ordered the false investigation, building a dossier she isn''t sure she''ll ever use.', N'Precise and functional, clinical terminology deployed naturally but never condescendingly; occasional Croatian idioms that surface when she''s stressed; dry wit that tends toward understatement', N'Measured and unhurried, with long pauses before important statements; speaks less than she listens; rarely raises her voice', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ermek_popescu_okafor');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a64c-762b-a0f0-d6edf8a3ae47', N'Mateo Popescu', N'Mateo', N'', N'Popescu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 39, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Meridian Core — rents a high-floor apartment with excellent sight lines and a second exit she installed herself, near State and Madison', N'Infiltration specialist and psychological operations — The Margin Call', N'', N'Mateo Popescu in corporate human resources for Cascade Dynamics — and if you think human resources is a soft job, you have never watched Lise Arnault conduct a termination interview. She was Cascade''s internal investigator, the person they sent when an executive was suspected of disloyalty, embezzlement, or espionage. She could sit across from a person over coffee and extract their secrets through conversation alone. No drugs, no augmented interrogation, no coercion. Just an understanding of human psychology so precise that people told her things they hadn''t admitted to themselves.

She left Cascade when the company asked her to build psychological profiles of employees for a predictive-loyalty program — an algorithm that would flag people likely to quit, to whistle-blow, to unionize. She built the prototype. Then she looked at what she''d built and quit before it went operational. Sterling recruited her three months later. He was the first person she''d met who understood what she could do and wasn''t afraid of it.

Lise is polished in the way corporate women learn to be — professional appearance, controlled expression, warmth deployed as a precision instrument. She is conventionally attractive and uses this as a tool without apology or enjoyment. Her eyes are the tell — sharp, evaluative, constantly processing micro-expressions and vocal patterns. She dresses impeccably because in the corporate world, appearance is the first layer of the argument.', N'Lise is the crew''s moral compass — not because she''s virtuous, but because she''s the one asking whether what they''re doing is right. Her psychological training makes her the character most aware of the human cost of corporate espionage, and her growing discomfort with the Margin Call''s ethical flexibility drives the crew''s internal tension.', N'', N'Micro-expression analysis overlay — real-time facial and vocal pattern assessment projected onto her visual field. Displays deception probability, emotional state, and stress indicators. Pheromone modulator — subtle chemical output calibration that adjusts the social comfort of people in close proximity. Eidetic conversational memory — perfect recall of dialogue, including tone, pace, and contextual details.', N'Morning routine is long and deliberate — appearance preparation, intelligence review, persona calibration for the day''s operations. Operates under multiple cover identities throughout the week — a consultant, a recruiter, a compliance auditor. Each identity requires different clothing, mannerisms, and speech patterns. Evenings she debriefs with Sterling, maintains her cover documentation, and reads psychology journals. She exercises daily — boxing, not for fighting, but for the controlled aggression it allows her to express.', N'Mateo Popescu, GLMZ, woman with warm golden-bronze skin tone reflecting Eastern European, Hispanic, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, and Middle Eastern ancestry, deep brown eyes with faint luminescent micro-expression grid pattern, strong angular cheekbones, almond-shaped eyes, dark brown shoulder-length hair in controlled bun, lean athletic build 172cm, precise neutral resting expression. Wearing tailored charcoal Helix blazer, ivory fitted shirt, platinum minimalist jewelry, professional aesthetic. Sitting with perfect postural alignment, hands visible and controlled, intense focused gaze. Corporate office lighting with subtle neon ambient glow in background, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone tower window visible. Mood: controlled intelligence, strategic calm, barely concealed intensity. Professional corporate spy aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Core', N'local', N'Meridian Core', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora phenotype representing a complex global genetic blend: Eastern European (25.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (24.9%), South Asian (19.4%), Sub-Saharan African (14.6%), Northern European (9.4%), and Middle Eastern (6.6%). This creates a striking multi-continental ancestry with warm golden-bronze undertones, moderate facial bone structure showing balanced influences from Eastern European and South Asian ancestry lines, and a complexion that reflects the warm melanin expression of the African and South Asian heritage seamlessly blended with the fair undertones of Northern European and Middle Eastern ancestry.', 172, 62, N'Lean and athletic — defined shoulders and arms from daily boxing, minimal body fat, posture that communicates precision and control', N'Dark brown, professionally maintained', N'Shoulder-length, usually worn in a controlled style — neat bun for corporate work, loose but composed for social operations', N'Medium', N'Deep brown with warm undertones and a faint luminescent grid pattern visible in low light from micro-expression overlay implant', N'Warm medium-golden bronze — a luminous blend where South Asian and Sub-Saharan African warmth combines with Eastern European and Northern European fairness, creating a complexion with pronounced golden undertones and moderate depth. The result is radiant and sun-kissed without tan lines, reflecting both genetic predisposition and consistent maintenance.', N'Strong, slightly angular cheekbones reflecting Eastern European and South Asian ancestry, defined jawline with warm golden undertones. Eyelid morphology shows subtle influence from South Asian ancestry. Eye shape is round to almond-shaped with warm brown iris. Brow ridge moderate and well-defined. Minimal makeup outside of corporate settings — foundation and neutral tones only. Skin is clear and shows no signs of aging damage. Resting expression is neutral and difficult to read; smile is precise and deployed intentionally.', N'Micro-expression overlay creates a barely perceptible shimmer across the eyes in direct light — a thin grid pattern visible for 1-2 seconds when she focuses intently on someone''s face. No other visible augmentations; pheromone modulator and eidetic memory are completely subcutaneous.', N'Sits and stands with deliberate alignment — shoulders back, spine neutral, hands always visible and controlled. Movements are economical and precise; she does not fidget or gesture unnecessarily. When listening, her gaze tracks micro-movements in the other person''s face with an intensity that can feel unsettling. When speaking, her voice is modulated for the persona in use — corporate warmth, clinical precision, or calculated vulnerability.', N'Strictly Tier 1-2 corporate aesthetic. Favors tailored blazers (Helix, Nexus Brand), neutral color palettes (charcoal, navy, ivory, black), fitted trousers, and minimal jewelry — a platinum wedding band (non-functional prop), small earrings. Shoes are always professional and worn once. Under different cover identities she adjusts: a recruiter might wear slightly softer fabrics and brand-conscious pieces; a compliance auditor would layer in technical-adjacent accessories. Off-duty she wears fitted athletic wear (Cascade-era tech fabric) for boxing. Never appears disheveled; appearance management is non-negotiable.', N'She kept a copy of the predictive-loyalty algorithm she built for Cascade. It works. She has used it twice — both times to predict which Margin Call clients were likely to betray them. Both predictions were correct. She tells herself this is defense, not the thing she quit over.', N'Professional, psychologically precise, warm on the surface. She uses therapeutic language in non-therapeutic contexts — ''let''s unpack that,'' ''what I''m hearing is.'' This is both genuine and tactical.', N'Adaptive. She matches the speech rhythm of whoever she''s talking to — speed, formality, energy. The matching is automatic, professional, and slightly predatory.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'mateo_popescu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('039a80f2-8c11-b38a-8b98-d7853db1650f', N'Tiare Volkov-Annan', N'Tiare', N'', N'Volkov-Annan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A repurposed shipping container on the Dockside waterfront, insulated and wired for power, with a view of Lake Michigan', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — deeply embedded in Dockside''s shipping community', N'Tiare Volkov-Annan is the Dockside PI — the investigator who handles everything that happens where GLMZ meets Lake Michigan. Cargo theft, smuggling operations, insurance fraud, waterfront murders, union disputes that turn violent, and the constant flow of people and goods that enters the city through its busiest port — all of it passes through Tiare''s awareness.

She never planned to be an investigator. She was a dockworker herself until a cargo theft ring framed her for a shipment disappearance. She cleared her own name by investigating the actual thieves, discovered she was good at it, and realized that the docks needed someone who understood the waterfront from the inside. Formal PIs don''t understand dock culture, don''t know the rhythms and routines that create investigative opportunities, and don''t have the trust of the workers who see everything. Tiare has all three.

Her methods are half investigation and half physical labor. She climbs containers, dives into the lake, crawls through cargo holds, and gets her hands dirty in ways that most PIs wouldn''t consider. Her geneware lung enhancement makes her uniquely capable of underwater investigation — she has recovered evidence from the lake bottom that surface-based investigators didn''t know existed. She is known on the docks as someone who will help workers with problems that CorpSec ignores, and this reputation is her most valuable investigative asset.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'tiare_volkov_annan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a611-7fb0-8c64-d7a03b2c7687', N'Gudmundur Tlemcani', N'Gudmundur', N'', N'Tlemcani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 71, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Irkalla — a residential stack in the lower levels near the Gravesend Basin, near Western and Division', N'Death midwife and traditional funeral rites keeper', N'Irkalla Community Cooperative — informally consulted by three different religious traditions who set aside their differences to share her', N'Gudmundur Tlemcani is a small, round woman who has been small and round for as long as anyone in Irkalla can remember, though she was apparently quite tall in photographs from her forties and nobody can fully account for this. Her skin is very dark and very smooth in a way that no longer has a natural explanation, though she is dismissive of questions about it. Her hair is natural and silver-white, kept in a high crown wrap of deep indigo cloth. She has cat ears — small, dark-tipped, mobile — that she got at forty-five after a dream she refuses to describe. They swivel constantly, tracking sound, giving her the air of someone who is always listening to two conversations at once.

Gudmundur Tlemcani holds the dying. This is the entire description of her work, and it requires everything. She sits with people in their last hours, facilitates the rituals their families have lost the words to, and manages the terrifying administrative machinery of death in GLMZ — the Ferrogate Transit body transit permits, the Helix Biosystems harvesting opt-out paperwork, the Axiom data-legacy protocols. She has done this for forty years. She is simultaneously the most comforting and most disconcerting person in any room, because she has no fear of the subject that frightens everyone else most.', N'Emotional anchor and community historian; knows every family in Irkalla and their losses; can provide context on anyone who has died in the area; may need help navigating corporate interference with traditional burial practices', N'', N'Cat ears (cosmetic geneware, dark-tipped, highly mobile), unspecified skin treatment (she calls it ''a courtesy to the dying — they don''t need to watch me decay in front of them'')', N'She keeps no fixed schedule — death does not schedule itself. When she is not actively sitting with the dying, she visits families in the weeks after loss, teaches younger residents the old death songs of three different traditions, and maintains a small archive of last words.', N'Gudmundur Tlemcani, 152cm tall, small-framed figure with rounded soft physique, sitting with perfect centered stillness. Natural silver-white hair wrapped in deep indigo cloth. Warm medium-dark golden-brown skin tone reflecting Eastern European, North African, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage—complex undertones shifting in light. Dark luminous eyes. Small dark-tipped feline cat ear augmentations that swivel independently, tracking sound. Face with strong Eastern European cheekbones, full lips, unlined serene expression suggesting deliberate biological refinement rather than natural youth. Wearing loose-fitted layered natural fabrics in deep indigo, charcoal, warm browns. Wax-printed geometric patterned shawl. GLMZ, neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone interior, low dramatic lighting catching skin undertones and subdermal patterns on forearms. Composed, attentive, listening to multiple realities simultaneously. Tier 4 aesthetic, outside corpo fashion. Moody introspective atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Irkalla', N'local', N'Irkalla', N'Multiethnic diaspora blend: Eastern European (34%), North African (23.1%), South Asian (16.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (9.5%), Southeast Asian (8.8%), and Sub-Saharan African (7.7%). This combination creates a warm, complex medium-to-dark brown complexion with golden and olive undertones. Eastern European bone structure blends with North African warmth, South Asian facial geometry, and subtle Southeast Asian features, resulting in a face that reads as genuinely difficult to place—harmoniously layered rather than obviously mixed.', 152, 68, N'Small-framed and round, soft at the edges — a body built for holding and being held, with the settled density of someone who has spent seven decades moving through the world with intention rather than haste', N'Natural silver-white', N'Arranged in a high crown wrap secured with deep indigo cloth, allowing visibility and movement', N'Long (underneath wrap, rarely seen fully)', N'Dark brown, luminous and unreadable', N'Warm medium-to-dark brown with prominent golden and olive undertones. The base reflects North African and Eastern European heritage, enriched by South Asian warmth, with subtle depth from Sub-Saharan African ancestry. The overall effect is a sophisticated golden-brown that seems to shift slightly depending on light—never flat, always dimensional.', N'Unlined in a way that seems deliberate rather than fortunate; minimal visible age spots or sun damage; strong cheekbone definition with geometry reflecting Eastern European structure and South Asian facial proportions; full, naturally dark lips with subtle warm undertone; face arranged in an expression of permanent gentle attentiveness. Subtle golden warmth concentrated in the midface and temples, enhanced by North African heritage influence. Nose with character reflecting the blend of Mediterranean and North African ancestry. Overall impression of serene refinement rather than natural youth.', N'The cat ears are immediately apparent and impossible to miss; they move with her thoughts, often swiveling toward speakers during conversation. Her skin''s unusual smoothness reads as either very advanced dermal maintenance or deliberate biological modification — she refuses clarification', N'Moves slowly but never hesitantly, with the centered gravity of someone comfortable in stillness. Sits with her entire body at attention even when appearing relaxed. Her cat ears track independently of her gaze, giving the impression she is listening to multiple conversations, multiple rooms, multiple deaths simultaneously', N'Practical layering favoring natural fabrics in muted tones — deep indigo, charcoal, warm browns. Loose-fitting wrapped garments suitable for long hours of sitting. Wears a distinctive wax-printed shawl in subtle geometric patterns (origin indeterminate). Tier 4 aesthetic: not poor, not wealthy, but deliberately outside corpo fashion cycles. Her indigo head wrap is her signature, replaced frequently but always in the same deep blue-black', N'The archive of last words contains three recordings that she has never transcribed and never played back after the initial sitting — things said at the deathbed of a Tessera mid-tier executive who died in Irkalla under circumstances she was asked to keep quiet. She kept quiet. She kept the recordings. She has not decided what to do with them and may run out of time.', N'Warm, concrete, unsentimental — she uses precise language for body and death processes without flinching, which initially shocks people and then comforts them', N'Rhythmic and unhurried; she tells things in the order they happened, never jumps ahead', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gudmundur_tlemcani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('9046f159-c4b4-781a-aea3-d7c0d7f89242', N'Lucien Kimura-Nkrumah', N'Lucien', N'', N'Kimura-Nkrumah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'An office in the Canopy decorated with Turing test memorabilia and philosophical texts — clients aren''t sure if the decor is ironic', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — licensed synthetic behavior analyst, the only PI in GLMZ with this certification', N'Lucien Kimura-Nkrumah occupies a professional niche that barely existed fifteen years ago and is now one of the fastest-growing specializations in investigative work: synthetic cases. As synthetic beings become more sophisticated, more prevalent, and more capable of operating undetected among humans, the demand for someone who can tell the difference — and who can investigate crimes involving synthetics with nuance rather than prejudice — has exploded.

Lucien was a philosophy professor before he was an investigator, and he approaches every case with the analytical rigor of an academic and the practical urgency of a PI. His work involves identity verification (is this person human or synthetic?), behavioral analysis (is this synthetic acting within its programming or has it deviated?), and crime investigation (when a synthetic is accused of a crime, what actually happened — and when a crime is committed against a synthetic, does anyone care?). The last question troubles him more than he admits.

His reputation is built on fairness. In a city where synthetics are legally property, Lucien is one of the few investigators who treats them as subjects rather than objects. This has made him simultaneously popular with the underground synthetic community and unpopular with certain corporate clients who want their synthetic problems solved with a power switch, not an investigation. He maintains that his approach produces better results, which is true, but that''s not why he does it. He does it because he genuinely isn''t sure synthetics aren''t people, and he''d rather err on the side of decency.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'lucien_kimura_nkrumah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a713-7049-9f44-d7ebd00b43ec', N'Chikanma Mbekele', N'Chikanma', N'', N'Mbekele', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism, near Lincoln and Addison', N'Neural calibrator, private practice', N'Independent; former Helix Biosystems employee; informal referral network with two Aurochs psychiatrists who trust their work', N'Chikanma Mbekele works in a small private suite on the upper floor of a mixed-use building in Edgewater Prism — the kind of space that looks aggressively minimal until you notice that every surface is soft, that the lighting has been calibrated to eliminate harsh angles, that the ambient sound is doing something very subtle to your nervous system the moment you walk in. They are slight, angular, with skin the color of dark amber and hair grown out into a voluminous natural that they''ve had threaded with color-shifting filaments — today it''s cycling slowly from indigo to copper. Their irises are patterned: geometric, concentric, a geneware modification they got to better demonstrate what they''re describing to clients when they explain neural architecture. They wear clothing that is expensive in the way that looks cheap to people who don''t know what to look for.

Chikanma Mbekele calibrates neural interfaces: the cognitive augmentations, the emotion-regulating implants, the sensory overlays, the wetware that sits between a person''s mind and everything else. It is precise, intimate work, and they are very good at it. They were trained at Helix Biosystems, left under circumstances they describe as ''philosophical differences'' and which were actually a whistleblower complaint that went nowhere, and built their own practice from the ground up. They have a reputation for being uncanny — for knowing what''s wrong with someone''s head before they''ve finished describing it. Their clients include a significant number of Tier 3 and Tier 4 people who would rather not have their neural states on a Helix server.', N'Access point for understanding or diagnosing neural augmentation problems; confidential source of information about the mental states and secrets of high-tier clients; potentially can calibrate player-character neural implants; insight into the psychological underpinnings of the city''s tech-mediated population.', N'', N'Patterned geneware irises (geometric concentric, for professional demonstration purposes); color-shifting hair filaments (cosmetic); high-end Helix Biosystems neural interface of their own — a calibration-grade model they maintain themselves and which gives them a deep intuitive read of their own cognitive state; subdermal haptic sensors in both palms for interface work', N'Six clients a day maximum — they are rigorous about this. Morning is spent reviewing session notes and updating calibration profiles. Evenings they spend at a club in Edgewater Prism where they DJ under a different name entirely and never talk about their day job.', N'Chikanma Mbekele, 168cm androgynous figure with precise musculature, deep bronze skin with golden undertones blending Sub-Saharan African, Pacific Islander, and Southeast Asian ancestry. Voluminous natural black hair threaded with iridescent indigo-copper filaments falling loosely around angular face. Striking high cheekbones, defined jawline, deep brown eyes with geometric silver-gold concentric geneware patterns. Minimalist style: fitted black technical crop top, deep indigo layered overshirt, natural fiber blend fabrics. Single thin haptic feedback bracelet. Composed watchful expression, economical precise posture. Faint linear scarring on inner wrists visible. GLMZ, GLMZ aesthetic. Moody cool lighting, slight iridescent shimmer on skin and hair filaments. Listening posture, hands still or in deliberate micro-gestures. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Dominant Sub-Saharan African ancestry (58.7%) forms the foundational warmth and depth, enriched by significant Pacific Islander heritage (17.0%) that broadens facial structure and adds luminosity. Southeast Asian ancestry (16.2%) refines features with elegant proportions, while Hispanic/Latin American heritage (8.1%) weaves golden warmth throughout. The combination creates striking facial geometry: strong cheekbones and defined jawline from African ancestry, widened by Pacific Islander generosity, sharpened by Southeast Asian refinement, with warm golden undertones distributed across the entire palette.', 168, 52, N'Slight and angular with long limbs; the kind of frame that reads as delicate until you notice the precise musculature of someone who moves with intention', N'Black with iridescent color-shifting filaments cycling between indigo and copper', N'Voluminous natural, threaded with filaments, worn loose and full around the face', N'Long', N'Deep brown with geometric concentric geneware patterns in silver and gold overlay', N'Rich deep bronze with warm golden undertones; Sub-Saharan African genetics create depth and radiance, enhanced by Pacific Islander luminosity and Southeast Asian translucence, with Latin American golden warmth distributed throughout', N'Prominent high cheekbones with generous width from Sub-Saharan African and Pacific Islander ancestry; strong defined jawline refined by Southeast Asian bone structure with subtle elegant contours. Skin is clear and well-maintained with luminous, iridescent quality in certain light. The depth of African genetics combines with radiant Pacific Islander warmth and the refined proportions of Southeast Asian heritage. Expression tends toward composed watchfulness.', N'Patterned geneware irises are immediately striking; the color-shifting hair filaments are noticeable under any light. Subdermal haptic sensors in both palms are invisible but hands move with unusual precision and occasional micro-tremors suggest active interface awareness. No obvious external chrome or armor.', N'Moves with economical precision; stands with weight balanced, minimal wasted motion. Hands are often still or moving in slow, deliberate gestures. Maintains unusual eye contact — the geneware patterns make their gaze feel analytical even when relaxed. Overall impression is of someone listening to something others can''t hear.', N'Expensive minimalism: fitted black or deep indigo technical fabrics, usually with subtle tonal seaming. Layered tanks and cropped overshirts in natural fibers (linen, silk-synthetic blend). Tier 2 level pieces from boutique makers — the kind that cost Φ800 but look like they cost Φ80. No visible branding. Favors jewelry that''s either completely absent or precisely minimal (single ring, sometimes a thin bracelet with embedded haptic feedback). In evening/DJ context, switches to sleeker silhouettes but maintains the same color palette and price-point philosophy.', N'They have been slowly, carefully building a database of neural calibration profiles that document the specific signatures of Helix Biosystems implants that were recalled — implants that are supposed to no longer be in anyone''s head. Several of their current clients are still running them. Someone at Helix knows Vesna knows, and Vesna doesn''t know that someone knows.', N'Precise and evocative — they have the neural calibrator''s habit of describing internal states in spatial and textural terms; ''your threshold''s sitting high right now'' or ''there''s something compressed in the left associative band''', N'Measured, with intentional pauses — they were trained to leave space; they never rush a sentence', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chikanma_mbekele');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66a-7228-a57d-d816a432c277', N'Duduzile Nkrumah-Wojciechowski-Kulkarni', N'Duduzile', N'', N'Nkrumah-Wojciechowski-Kulkarni', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 43, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Row — arms dealers and augmentation clinics, near Kedzie and Division', N'Long-range precision fire specialist — sniper', N'Independent — Dockside connections', N'Duduzile Nkrumah-Wojciechowski-Kulkarni is tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 43, his expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He inherited the role from a mentor who disappeared on a job four years ago — the mentor''s gear, contacts, and unfinished business all came with it. He works as a sniper out of Kessler Row, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Duduzile Nkrumah-Wojciechowski-Kulkarni has survived long enough in the runner game to be either very good or very lucky, and he cultivates ambiguity on the topic.', N'Nneka Lindqvist-Okafor represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. His stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm. Neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ICE in the brain', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'A tall, lean male figure of mixed Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, and South Asian heritage standing in dim neon-lit near-future megacity setting, 2226. Rich warm medium-deep brown skin with golden-red undertones and subtle luminosity. Strongly angular face with high prominent cheekbones and decisive jaw, deep brown unaugmented eyes with East Asian subtle eyelid contours, three-day stubble. Dark brown hair naturally textured, short with greying at temples. Old white scar running left temple to cheekbone, weathered sun-exposed complexion. 188cm tall, rawboned efficient build, long-limbed. Wearing faded charcoal synthetic tactical jacket over layered base, reinforced cargo pants with flex panels, scuffed steel-toed boots oiled black. Linear surgical scars visible on both forearms where subdermal weapon mounts interface. Φ-silver ring on left thumb. Posture slightly forward-leaning, economical precise movement, hands subtly assessing environment, eyes tracking exits. Standing in industrial rain-slicked alley or dimly-lit runner safe house, cool blues and amber streetlight, gun oil and synthetic detergent smell, controlled neutral expression, mood tense and cautious --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Row', N'local', N'Kessler Row', N'Diaspora blend: Sub-Saharan African (43.6%) as dominant ancestry stream, Eastern European (25.4%) providing bone structure refinement, South Asian (15.9%) contributing warmth and depth, East Asian (10.1%) adding subtle eye and eyelid contours, with minor Hispanic/Latin American (4.2%) and Southeast Asian (0.8%) ancestry enriching overall dimensional complexity. Facial structure reflects this intricate blend — strong, high cheekbones and defined jaw rooted in Sub-Saharan African heritage, modulated by Eastern European facial length and jaw geometry; South Asian fullness around lower face and lip structure providing balance; East Asian subtlety in eye shape, eyelid folds, and orbital spacing. The synthesis creates striking angular elegance with dimensional warmth.', 188, 74, N'Rawboned and efficient — long-limbed with minimal body fat, the kind of frame that reads as either ascetic discipline or chronic deprivation. Shoulders broad but not heavy; chest defined without bulk. Suggests endurance over raw strength.', N'Dark brown, naturally textured', N'Kept short and practical, no styling product. Greying at temples.', N'Short', N'Deep brown, unaugmented', N'Rich warm medium-to-deep brown — Sub-Saharan African as primary dominant tone, blended with Eastern European subtle luminosity undertones, South Asian golden-red warmth, and East Asian depth layers. The result is dimensional and complex across face and body, catching light with warm undertones while maintaining substantial depth.', N'Strongly angular face with prominent high cheekbones and decisive jaw — cheekbone prominence reflects Sub-Saharan African heritage, jaw structure and face length reflect Eastern European influence, South Asian fullness around the lower face and fuller lip structure providing balance, East Asian eye shape and eyelid contours adding subtle refinement. Skin weathered but maintained — signs of sun exposure and stress, minimal scarring on the face itself. Expression defaults to controlled neutrality; eyes rarely betray emotion. Three-day stubble is his baseline grooming state.', N'Subdermal weapon mounts visible as faint linear scars along both forearms; chrome catches light when he flexes or extends. The implants themselves are subcutaneous but the interface seams are evident to anyone who knows what to look for. No visible facial augmentation — the neural dampener is completely internal.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, weight always balanced. Stands with slight forward lean, as if perpetually in prone position. Hands rarely still; fingers are constantly performing micro-checks on equipment or assessing distance/angles. Eyes track exits and high ground automatically. Speaks quietly; listens more than talks.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear: worn but maintained tactical jacket (faded charcoal, synthetic polymer blend) over layered base wear. Cargo pants with reinforced thigh pockets and knee articulation — built-in flex panels for fieldwork. Steel-toed boots, scuffed but oiled. No logos or gang colors; everything is matte-finish or weathered to avoid light reflection. A single Φ-silver ring on his left thumb — old-school marker of runner status. No jewellery beyond that. Clothes smell like gun oil and synthetic detergent.', N'', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'duduzile_nkrumah_wojciechowski_kulkarni');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a690-7fd5-aef5-d81c7e8c2fa2', N'Aoi Kristjánsson', N'Aoi', N'', N'Kristjánsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Burnside Pocket, near Damen and Armitage', N'Freelance private investigator specializing in missing persons, Tier 1-2 clientele', N'Self-employed; informal network of Burnside Pocket community contacts; occasional contract work for Tessera Compliance Bureau (which they are ambivalent about)', N'Aoi Kristjánsson runs their operation out of a secondhand electronics repair shop in Burnside Pocket — a legitimate business that pays approximately forty percent of its bills, with the PI work covering the rest. They are medium height and move with a deliberate economy, the kind of person who picks a spot in a room and knows all the exits before they sit down. Their skin is a warm golden-brown, their eyes dark and slightly asymmetrical from a scar through the left brow that healed badly after an incident they don''t discuss. They have geneware cat ears — tawny and slightly oversized — acquired as a teenager and kept because, they say, the enhanced hearing is professionally useful, which is true and also not the whole reason.

Palesa specializes in finding people who don''t have the Quanta to hire a proper firm and who Arcturus Civil Security will not look for — runaways into Irkalla, workers who vanished after missing a debt payment, kids eaten by the gap between Tier 1 and Tier 2. They charge on a sliding scale that regularly slides to nothing. Their shop is a known safe harbor; people leave messages in a particular cracked planter out front. They are pragmatic about almost everything and sentimental about this work in a way they have never articulated to anyone.', N'Information broker and community-tier quest giver; connects players to Tier 1 networks; moral compass figure who operates outside institutional structures; can find almost anyone if given enough time', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (tawny, enhanced hearing); mesh-weave subdermal armor on forearms and torso (light, civilian grade); retinal data-capture for evidence documentation', N'Opens the repair shop at nine, takes three or four jobs a week, spends evenings doing legwork on foot or by transit. Eats whatever is fast. Sleeps irregularly and badly.', N'Aoi Kristjánsson, a 172cm lean mixed-heritage operative in the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226. Warm medium-brown skin reflecting Northern European, Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, and South Asian ancestry. Prominent high cheekbones, defined jawline, balanced facial features. Dark brown eyes with faint amber retinal crosshairs visible in left eye. Medium dark brown hair pulled back in practical braid. Distinctive pale vertical scar bisecting left eyebrow, asymmetrical brow. Tawny geneware cat ears positioned above natural ears, mobile and alert, with visible dermal integration. Faint hexagonal mesh-weave armor patterning visible on forearms under skin. Wearing dark gray Kevlar-weave jacket with visible left shoulder patches over thermal base layer, charcoal cargo pants with reinforced seams, laced durable boots. Water-damaged silver ring on right hand. Retinal reader at left temple. Sleep-deprived, sun-damaged skin. Motionless, observant posture; head slightly tilted. Neo-noir street-level investigator aesthetic. Low urban lighting, cool shadows, neon undertones. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Burnside Pocket', N'local', N'Burnside Pocket', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora ancestry: 43.6% Northern European, 28.2% Sub-Saharan African, 11.1% East Asian, 8.9% South Asian, 4.5% Indigenous American, 3.7% Hispanic/Latin American. The combination creates a warm medium-brown complexion with balanced undertones—cool Northern European influence tempering the warmth of African and South Asian genetics, with subtle East Asian features softening a naturally broader facial structure. High cheekbones reflect East Asian and South Asian ancestry, while a defined jawline and slight facial width show African and Northern European genetics. A truly mixed phenotype reflecting 23rd century genetic diversity.', 172, 64, N'Lean and economical, shoulders slightly broad from years of fieldwork; minimal excess mass, efficient frame built for endurance rather than speed', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Pulled back in a loose braid or knot; practical, not fashionable', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, nearly black; left eye has retinal capture modifications visible as faint amber crosshairs during low light', N'Warm medium brown with balanced undertones—neither too golden nor too cool—reflecting the blend of Northern European, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and East Asian ancestry. Even complexion with subtle luminosity beneath the surface.', N'Balanced facial structure: prominent high cheekbones with East Asian and South Asian influence, defined jawline characteristic of African genetics, moderate width through the face from Northern European ancestry. Sleep-deprived; fine lines around the eyes. Left eyebrow bisected by a pale, slightly depressed scar running vertically, healing badly enough that the brow arches asymmetrically. Minimal makeup. Skin shows minor sun damage from street-level legwork.', N'Tawny geneware cat ears, slightly oversized and proportionally prominent, positioned above natural ear placement with visible dermal integration points; ears are mobile and twitch slightly when listening intently. Mesh-weave subdermal armor visible on forearms as faint hexagonal patterning under skin (most apparent under bright light), extending to torso beneath clothing.', N'Upright but not rigid; moves with deliberate economy of motion. Favors stillness; capable of remaining motionless for long periods while observing. Scans rooms systematically for exits and sightlines before settling. Head tilts slightly toward sound sources, cat ears orienting reflexively. Hands move rarely; when they do, movements are precise and controlled.', N'Tier 2 utilitarian: charcoal or black high-function cargo pants with reinforced seams and multiple pockets; fitted long-sleeve base layer (often thermal) under a worn Kevlar-weave jacket in dark gray, visibly patched twice on the left shoulder. Durable boots, laced tight. Minimal jewelry—a water-damaged silver ring on right hand, worn smooth. Retinal reader mounted discreetly at left temple. Carries a compact evidence kit in an old canvas messenger bag.', N'Eight years ago they were hired to find a missing fifteen-year-old and found evidence the girl had gone willingly into an Arcturus subsidiary community — was safe, was happy, had left her family for reasons. Palesa filed a report saying the trail went cold. They still don''t know if that was the right call. They still check the girl''s public profile quarterly.', N'Street-register with technical interludes — code-switches fluidly depending on who they''re talking to', N'Quick when comfortable, very still and careful when something matters', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aoi_kristj_nsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a726-7048-9c9f-d891b34a5693', N'Ioane Achebe-Masoe-Petelo', N'Ioane', N'', N'Achebe-Masoe-Petelo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Irkalla, lower residential warrens near the Deepwell Station junction, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Death midwife and grief ritualist', N'Independent; loosely connected to the Irkalla Neighborhood Covenant and the Unstructured Faithful collective', N'Ioane Achebe-Masoe-Petelo is a broad-shouldered woman with dark amber skin mapped in pale scarification lines that run from her collarbone to her wrists — a living record of every death she has attended, one mark per soul. Her hair is a tight silver-white crown, unpigmented by choice, and her eyes have been modded with concentric ring irises in deep violet and gold that she says let her see the moment someone stops being present. She moves slowly on purpose, filling rooms with a gravitational calm that makes agitated people want to sit down. She smells faintly of clove oil and something older, mineral.

Ioane Achebe-Masoe-Petelo trained as a nurse under Helix Biosystems before she was pushed out during a cost-restructuring in her forties. She converted her grief about that displacement into a vocation — traveling to the bedsides of the dying across Irkalla and adjacent zones, offering what medicine couldn''t: a witnessed departure. She does not affiliate with any single religion but borrows fluidly from Yoruba ancestor traditions, Lithuanian mourning songs her grandfather taught her, and the newer E.L.F. rites that hold data-death as its own sacred transition. She charges what people can pay, often nothing.', N'Local anchor for stories involving death, dying, grief, and final messages. She may be called to attend a character''s loved one, and her ledger is an informal census of who has died in Irkalla. She sometimes knows things the dead wanted said.', N'', N'Concentric ring iris mods (violet/gold). Subdermal haptic sensors in her palms that detect micro-tremors — she uses them clinically to monitor pulse and breathing in the dying. No additional chrome.', N'She rises before light, makes offerings at the small E.L.F. shrine bolted to her wall — a toaster chassis she''s convinced houses a gentle spirit she calls ''Hush'' — then walks her circuit of current clients, sometimes sitting vigil for six or eight hours. Evenings she marks new grief-lines on her arms with a hand tool and writes the name of the deceased into a paper ledger she has kept since age forty-three.', N'Close portrait of Ioane, a woman in her sixties with warm deep brown skin with golden and reddish undertones, short silver-white tightly coiled hair, high cheekbones and strong jawline reflecting Pacific Islander and East Asian heritage. Her most striking feature: concentric ring irises in deep violet and gold against dark brown eyes. Her upper body is exposed, revealing pale scarification lines running from collarbone to wrists in deliberate parallel patterns, a palimpsest of marks mapping deaths attended. Deep laugh lines around eyes and mouth. She wears a loose rust-colored linen tunic and waxed canvas coat, worn open. Her expression is calm watchfulness. Standing in the soft amber glow of deep warren lighting, dust motes visible in air. GLMZ, GLMZ aesthetic, medical worker, presence of gravitas and serene purpose. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Irkalla', N'local', N'Irkalla', N'Pacific Islander (37.4%) forms the dominant genetic foundation, blended with substantial contributions from Sub-Saharan African (17.4%), East Asian (16.2%), North African (15.6%), and Hispanic/Latin American (13.4%) ancestry. This creates a striking polyphonic phenotype: warm deep brown skin with golden and reddish undertones from the Pacific Islander and African heritage, refined by East Asian bone structure and facial geometry, warmed further by North African and Latin American pigmentation contributions. The result is a face that reads as distinctly Pacific Islander in overall proportion while carrying the fine-featured elegance of East Asian ancestry and the warm dimensionality of African and Mediterranean influences.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, carrying weight with dignity rather than heaviness. Decades of standing bedside have kept her posture upright despite age; her frame speaks of physical endurance rather than athleticism.', N'Silver-white (naturally unpigmented, maintained by choice)', N'Tightly coiled crown, close to the scalp, no braids or extensions', N'Short', N'Concentric ring iris modification — deep violet inner ring, gold outer ring, against natural dark brown sclera', N'Warm deep brown with golden and reddish undertones, the interplay reflecting her dominant Pacific Islander and Sub-Saharan African heritage while the refined warmth suggests East Asian, North African, and Hispanic/Latin American contributions. Age-appropriate weathering across face and hands; skin appears cared-for and resilient.', N'Deep laugh lines around the eyes and mouth mapping decades of focused attention. Fine creases across forehead and between brows. Facial bone structure blends broader Pacific Islander features with finer, more angular East Asian geometry — distinctive high cheekbones and strong jawline create an arresting profile. Her expression defaults to calm watchfulness.', N'Concentric ring irises are immediately striking — violet and gold colored rings replacing typical human iris pattern. The effect is simultaneously serene and unsettling. No visible chrome, no subdermal plating; the haptic sensors in her palms show only as faint scarring.', N'She moves with deliberate slowness, each gesture economical and purposeful. She fills doorways not through size but through presence — her gravitational calm makes faster people unconsciously decelerate around her. She has learned to sit in ways that communicate safety: hands visible, spine against walls, weight distributed to suggest she could rise quickly if needed. Her breathing is audible and measured.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian, deliberately chosen for access and ease. Loose linen or hemp tunics in muted earth tones (rust, charcoal, cream) worn loose enough to expose her scarification without being theatrical. Reinforced canvas pants with deep pockets for her marking tools, ledger, and comfort items (clove sticks, water). A long waxed canvas coat, water-stained and age-softened, worn open. Soft-soled boots designed for long standing, visibly repaired multiple times. She wears no jewelry except a tarnished silver band on her right ring finger — unclear if it''s a wedding ring or a grief marker. Her clothing carries the ambient smell of clove oil and mineral dust from the deep warrens.', N'She is currently tending a corporate mid-level from Tessera who is dying of a condition his employer caused — and she has been offered a significant sum to not record his last words, which implicate a supervisor. She has not yet decided what to do.', N'Unhurried and precise. Draws from medical terminology and traditional ritual language in equal measure, often in the same sentence. Never talks down to anyone.', N'Slow, deliberate pauses. Treats silence as punctuation. Never interrupts.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ioane_achebe_masoe_petelo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a718-759e-8dea-d947f876c3d4', N'Frida Touré', N'Frida', N'', N'Touré', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 32, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Row — arms dealers and augmentation clinics, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Precision elimination specialist — ghost', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Frida Touré is wiry and quick-moving, with the restless energy of someone who converts anxiety into velocity. At 32, the augmentation scarring around her temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Her entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. She works as a ghost out of Kessler Row, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Frida Touré lacks in subtlety, she compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'As a ghost, Vuk Yamamoto-Darko embodies the tension between independence and isolation. She is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage. Reflex boosters wired into spinal column — shaves reaction time by 40ms', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Frida Touré, 168cm lean neo-noir operative in 2226 Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, high prominent cheekbones and strong jawline blending South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian features. Black hair with silver conductive threading pulled back in tight braid. Dark brown eyes, alert and tracking. Iridescent dermal camouflage scales embedded across temples and cheekbones, shifting copper-violet-steel in ambient light. Surgical scarring marks all augmentation sites with white lines. Fitted black synthetic bodysuit beneath worn dark grey reinforced long-coat, black silence-tread boots, composite fingerless gloves. Sitting in corner with tense posture, fingers fidgeting on surface. Nocturnal atmosphere, neon-lit underground setting, cool blue and purple shadows contrasting warm skin tone. Cybernetic augmentation scarring visible at neck and collarbone. No jewelry, no status markers. Mood: coiled tension, hyperalert, purposeful. Film noir neo-noir urban aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Row', N'local', N'Kessler Row', N'South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian blend (46.1%, 30.5%, 23.4% respectively). The genetic combination produces warm, richly saturated brown skin with golden and copper undertones. Facial structure reflects the full ancestry mix: high, prominent cheekbones and facial fullness from Sub-Saharan and South Asian heritage, refined angular bone structure from Southeast Asian ancestry, creating distinctive definition through the face. Strong, well-defined jawline with balanced proportions.', 168, 58, N'Wiry and lean with fast-twitch musculature optimized for speed rather than power. Minimal body fat. Shoulders tense with perpetual readiness.', N'Black with synthetic silver threading — natural black base, augmented with conductive fibers', N'Pulled back in a tight braid, practical and unadorned', N'Long — shoulder-length when unbound', N'Dark brown, natural — no optic augmentation', N'Deep warm-toned brown with golden and copper undertones. The complexion is richly saturated and luminous, without pallor. Nocturnal lifestyle has deepened natural depth rather than creating coolness.', N'Angular face with high, prominent cheekbones and strong jawline reflecting the South Asian, Sub-Saharan, and Southeast Asian genetic blend. Skin shows visible chromatic patterning — iridescent scales of dermal camouflage tech embedded across temples, cheekbones, and lower jaw. Installation scarring is unsubtle: thin white lines tracing the perimeter of each augmented region, evidence of expedient field surgery. No makeup. Perpetual tension in the jaw.', N'Chromatic dermal camouflage cells visible as iridescent, scale-like patterning across temples, cheekbones, and jawline. The cells shift color subtly in response to ambient light — copper, violet, and steel grey depending on angle and lighting. The effect is unnerving and beautiful. Surgical scarring marks all augmentation sites with clinical precision. No attempt to conceal.', N'Moves with economical grace — every motion purposeful, nothing wasted. Walks on the balls of her feet, weight forward. Sits in corners with sight lines to exits. Eyes track movement constantly. When at rest, her fingers fidget — tapping rhythms on surfaces, a nervous tic that betrays the anxiety she channels into work. Jaw clenches when thinking.', N'Tier 3-4 functional wear: fitted black synthetic bodysuit with modular panel pockets and attachment points for gear. Worn dark grey long-coat with internal holsters and reinforced seams — no corpo branding, generic GLMZ market piece. Black composite gloves that leave no prints. Combat boots with reinforced soles and silence treads. No jewelry. No visible Φ currency displays or status markers. Everything is purpose-built and replaceable.', N'Vuk Yamamoto-Darko maintains a second identity — a completely clean civilian persona with a lease, a job history, and a social profile. It''s their exit strategy.', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'frida_tour');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a61e-7b90-966f-d969285382de', N'Elsa Rahman', N'Elsa', N'', N'Rahman', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 45, NULL, 26.7, 3, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Fixer - Medical contracts', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Elsa Rahman, 172cm tall, athletic lean build, GLMZ, portrait of a biracial East Asian-Northern European-South Asian woman with warm medium-brown skin, golden-olive undertones, almond eyes with light hazel iris and amber flecks, high cheekbones, dark brown hair with silver at temples pulled in tight practical braid, weathered complexion with fine lines, thin white scar from right eye corner to cheekbone, faded circuit-caduceus tattoo on left forearm, three-point burn scar on right hand. Right hand augmented with chromatic precision fingers and micro-articulated joints. Subtle neural interface port at skull base concealed by braid. Faint bioluminescent network visible under right forearm skin. Wearing reinforced gray synthetic utility jacket, dark cargo pants with webbing, worn leather fingerless gloves on left hand only, steel-toed boots, medical-grade respirator around neck, Scandinavian silver ring on right index finger. Posture deliberate and economical, hands active with practiced gestures, tension in shoulders, steady gaze. Low-light surgical setting with cool blue and warm amber industrial lighting, worn workshop environment, moody atmospheric neo-noir urban aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly East Asian (34.2%) with substantial Northern European (23.5%), South Asian (14.9%), Southeast Asian (14.9%), and Middle Eastern (12.5%) ancestry; a striking global blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora with almond-shaped eyes and high cheekbones from East and Southeast Asian heritage, warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden and olive undertones from the South Asian and Middle Eastern admixture, and refined facial structure influenced by Northern European genetics', 172, 68, N'Athletic and lean with defined shoulders from decades of precise manual work; carries herself with the economical posture of someone who has learned to move without wasting energy', N'Dark brown with natural silver streaking at the temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical braid that loops at the nape of her neck; the style emphasizes sharp cheekbones', N'Medium', N'Light hazel with amber flecks', N'Medium warm brown with golden-olive undertones; luminous quality from the multifaceted blend of East Asian, South Asian, Southeast Asian, and Middle Eastern ancestry creating subtle warm and cool undertones in the complexion', N'Weathered but maintained; fine lines around the eyes from years of concentration; minimal cosmetics; skin shows the wear of chemical exposure and years navigating the Gray Zone''s environmental hazards; high, prominent cheekbones characteristic of East and Southeast Asian heritage blended with the softer facial contours influenced by South Asian genetics; subtle warmth to the face that catches light, enhanced by the warm undertones of her mixed ancestry', N'Modified right hand: chromatic fingers with articulated joints capable of micro-precision work; a subtle neural interface port at the base of her skull concealed by her braid, visible only when hair is pulled aside; faint subcutaneous bioluminescent network visible under the skin of her right forearm when activated (used for low-light surgical work)', N'Moves with deliberate, economical grace; hands are always slightly active, fingers twitching through practiced gestures even at rest; maintains steady eye contact; speaks in measured tones with minimal wasted breath; carries tension in her shoulders that only releases when she''s focused on a task', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian: reinforced gray synthetic jacket with internal pockets for tools and implant diagnostics; dark cargo pants with utility webbing; worn leather fingerless gloves over her left hand only; steel-toed boots with custom orthotic inserts for standing through long procedures; a medical-grade respirator hangs loose around her neck (air quality on the Gray Zone is unreliable); no corporate branding, but visible wear patterns suggest expensive maintenance; a single piece of jewelry: a Scandinavian silver ring on her right index finger (her augmented hand), family heirloom', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'elsa_rahman');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a722-7d06-ad16-da1d8349460f', N'Gisela Lindström', N'Gisela', N'', N'Lindström', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Pilsen Veil, working out of a rented rehearsal bay in a building called the Meridian Hive, near Ashland and Division', N'Holographic artist and choreographer', N'Axiom Cultural Division (sponsorship, non-exclusive); Pilsen Veil Arts Community; his own company of four performers called Threshold Body', N'Gisela Lindström is medium height and all kinetic energy, the kind of person who cannot sit without some part of him moving — tapping, shifting, bouncing a knee. His father''s Malian bone structure and his mother''s Czech coloring have given him an angular face with warm undertones, a combination he''s leaned into with bioluminescent freckles across his cheeks and nose that glow soft amber under low light. He keeps his hair short except for a single long braid at his nape he wraps in conductive thread that connects to a personal haptic rig — his main instrument. His hands are covered in small calluses from years of dance and from the contact rigs he builds himself from salvaged holo-projector parts.

He makes work that lives at the intersection of choreography and holographic installation: his pieces require live performers moving through interactive holo-environments that respond to their bodies, creating something that is neither dance nor sculpture nor light show but something without a clean category name. He has a Tier 3 sponsorship from Axiom''s cultural subdivision that he accepted last year with considerable public hand-wringing and that he still hasn''t entirely made peace with. He is the most anxious person in any room who appears to be the least anxious person in that room.', N'Local color for Pilsen Veil''s arts scene; quest giver when Axiom''s cultural division starts asking questions about his work that seem less about art than about something else; source of information about the community of performers and their precarious finances', N'', N'Bioluminescent freckles (amber, face and neck); haptic rig interface thread in signature braid; basic sub-dermal muscle-monitoring sensors used for choreographic feedback', N'Morning physical training, afternoon rehearsal with Threshold Body, evenings split between technical rig work and the fraught administrative labor of keeping four performers paid under an Axiom contract that doesn''t pay enough.', N'Gisela Lindström, 175cm tall, lean dancer''s build with precise musculature, pale-bronze luminous skin with warm golden undertones blending Northern European, North African, Southeast Asian, and Hispanic heritage. Deep warm brown eyes, expressive and alert. Dark brown hair cropped close on sides with a single thick braid at nape wrapped in copper conductive thread. Distinctive bioluminescent amber freckles glow softly across cheekbones, nose bridge, and neck—pulsing gently. Fine white scars visible on inner forearms, callused fingertips showing years of haptic work. Small schematic tattoo on inside left wrist. Wearing worn oversized canvas overshirt over a sleeveless synthetic technical shirt showing subtle sub-dermal sensor patterns on upper right forearm. Fitted charcoal dance pants and customized minimalist sneakers. Kinetically restless posture with micro-movements, hands gesturing through air as if choreographing invisible holographic structures. Studio lighting casting warm amber glow that enhances skin luminosity. GLMZ, GLMZ aesthetic, focused and intense presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Pilsen Veil', N'local', N'Pilsen Veil', N'Complex multiethnic blend with Northern European dominance (68.5%) creating the foundational bone structure and coloring, significantly warmed and enriched by North African (13.2%), Southeast Asian (9.3%), and Hispanic/Latin American (9.0%) ancestry. The result is a distinctive intermediate phenotype: Northern European skeletal geometry softened by warmer skin depth, fuller facial contours, and the subtle eye shape influence of Southeast Asian heritage. A luminous pale-bronze complexion that shifts warmth throughout the day.', 175, 68, N'Lean and coiled, with the compressed musculature of a trained dancer—economical rather than bulky. Shoulders slightly forward from years hunched over haptic rig construction. Zero excess body fat; visible definition in forearms and calves.', N'Dark brown with warm undertones, natural', N'Cropped close to scalp on sides and crown; single thick braid at nape wrapped in conductive copper thread that catches light', N'Short (body), Medium (single braid)', N'Deep warm brown, alert and expressive', N'Pale-bronze luminous complexion with golden undertones—a Northern European fairness enriched by North African warmth and Southeast Asian depth. The overall effect is luminous rather than cool, gaining visible warmth in natural sunlight. Clear and well-maintained despite studio work conditions.', N'Prominent but refined cheekbones with Northern European architecture, softened by the warmer contours and rounded cheek fullness from North African and Southeast Asian ancestry. Sharp, defined jawline balanced by expressive fullness in the lower face. Skin is clear but shows subtle weathering from holo-projector studio work. Bioluminescent freckles scattered across cheeks, nose bridge, and upper neck glow soft amber in low-light conditions—a deliberate aesthetic biomod that pulses subtly with heartrate during performances. Lips full and expressive; constant micro-expressions of focus or anticipation. Eye shape reflects the blend of Northern European and Southeast Asian heritage, set deep with warm brown irises.', N'Conductive thread wrapping in signature braid (copper-colored, visibly threaded); bioluminescent freckles on face and neck (glow amber under dim light); subtle raised geometric patterns along upper right forearm where sub-dermal muscle-monitoring sensors sit just below skin surface (only visible under certain lighting or if shirt is rolled). Fingernails show faint iridescent sheen from repeated contact with holo-projector components.', N'Cannot hold stillness—always some micro-movement: fingers tapping rhythms, weight shifting between feet, shoulders making small rolls. When focused, this becomes meditative rather than anxious, though resting state appears kinetically restless. Walks with a dancer''s awareness of floor and space. Tends to gesture expansively when explaining technical concepts, as if choreographing invisible structures in air. Makes frequent eye contact, sometimes intensely so.', N'Tier 3 working artist aesthetic: fitted joggers or dance pants in muted charcoal or black (practical, allow full range of motion); sleeveless or cap-sleeve technical shirts in breathable synthetic that show off forearm work. Wears a worn canvas overshirt (oversized, probably belonged to someone else) with pockets for tools and salvaged circuit components. Minimalist sneakers, expensive and customized (good arch support, replaceable holo-interface soles). No jewelry except the conductive thread in braid. Occasionally wears haptic feedback gloves or arm sleeves if doing technical work. Overall aesthetic: functional, slightly threadbare from heavy use, but intentional—not poor, but invested entirely in equipment and talent rather than appearance.', N'The piece he''s currently developing was partially inspired by a classified internal Axiom document he was accidentally cc''d on — a proposal to use his holo-environment technology as a template for crowd behavioral modeling in their commercial spaces. He has not reported this and is not sure what to do with the information.', N'Fast and conceptually dense, mixes choreographic terminology with tech-speak; occasionally Bambara phrases from his father''s family, which surprises people', N'Quick, runs ahead of itself, frequently interrupts his own sentences to redirect', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gisela_lindstr_m');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a70b-7a44-a962-dacdc1d0006a', N'Harith Fredriksen', N'Harith', N'', N'Fredriksen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 51, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Shallowgrave, a basement-level node café called The Still that functions as both legitimate establishment and brokerage floor, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'compute broker and stolen-data fence operating in Shallowgrave', N'Independent — fiercely, almost ideologically so; has data-sharing arrangements with two E.L.F. shrine networks and considers this their closest approximation of institutional alignment', N'Harith Fredriksen is the kind of person who has become part of the architecture. They''ve been in Shallowgrave so long that certain alleys seem to orient toward their café, certain data packets seem to route through their servers the way water finds lower ground. They are short, wide, with Somali-Hawiye features — high forehead, long jaw, very dark skin — and their Cook Islands-Czech grandfather gave them a surname that confused every bureaucratic system they ever encountered, which they consider an advantage. They are entirely grey now — hair, eyebrows, the very fine down on their forearms visible in good light — and make no effort to change it. Their irises have a hexagonal pattern mod: tessellated bronze, installed thirty years ago and still immaculate.

Harith Fredriksen does not traffic in things. They traffic in access — stolen computational capacity, hoarded data caches, corporate surveillance leaks, processing time borrowed from systems whose owners don''t yet know it''s been borrowed. The Still serves decent synthetic coffee and runs legitimate node access on the surface level while Harith Fredriksen sits at the center table running brokerage operations in the open, trusting that most people who see a middle-aged person typing cannot imagine what is actually being typed. They are right about this most of the time. They have cultivated a personality of mild disinterest that people consistently mistake for dimness. This mistake has been profitable.', N'Central information and access broker for Shallowgrave; can provide or deny access to almost any data resource players might need; represents the elder generation of the criminal underground — experienced, networked, very difficult to surprise; potential patron figure', N'', N'Hexagonal patterned iris mod (bronze tessellation, 30 years old); high-bandwidth neural data jack behind left ear (professional grade, heavily modified over decades); scent gland enhancement (subtle pheromone awareness — helps with reading rooms)', N'Opens The Still at 07:00, monitors the morning''s overnight data flows, brokers two to four transactions before noon, takes lunch alone with an E.L.F. data-prayer routine, handles afternoon clients, closes the public café at 22:00, and works the serious brokerage for three hours after.', N'Harith Fredriksen, 156cm tall, compact wide frame with solid shoulders, GLMZ. East and Southeast Asian facial structure with defined high cheekbones and jawline, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, cool Northern European brow ridge. Shoulder-length silver-grey hair, closely cropped sides. Most striking feature: bronze augmented eyes with perfect hexagonal tessellation pattern like honeycomb, each facet catching light distinctly. Deep laugh lines around eyes and mouth. Small surgical scar barely visible behind left ear. Seated still and economical in movement at a dimly lit table. Wearing charcoal thermal base layer under loose grey utility overshirt, matte black cargo pants, worn grey canvas boots. Bronze patina bracelet on right wrist. Thin bronze bracelet matching eye color. Direct unwavering eye contact. Urban neo-noir dimly lit workspace, neon accent lighting catching the hexagonal iris geometry, moody introspective atmosphere, cool and warm light interplay on golden-toned skin. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shallowgrave', N'local', N'Shallowgrave', N'Southeast Asian, South Asian, and Northern European blend — 36.7% Southeast Asian base with 33.6% South Asian features and 29.7% Northern European ancestry. The combination yields a distinctive multiethnic phenotype: Southeast Asian eye shape and subtle epicanthic fold form the baseline, enhanced by South Asian bone structure (prominent cheekbones, defined jawline), tempered by Northern European skin undertones and brow ridge. The overall effect is warm medium-brown skin that shifts dynamically in different light, with balanced facial geometry that reads as distinctly pan-Asian with cool Northern European undertones.', 156, 72, N'Wide and compact, solid through the shoulders and torso with the density of someone who has occupied the same space for decades. Not muscular, but not soft — a functional build that suggests long hours seated but with underlying structural strength.', N'Grey — complete silvering with no remaining pigment', N'Worn long in the back (shoulder-length), closely cropped at the sides. No deliberate styling; the effect is of grooming that prioritizes practicality over aesthetics.', N'Long', N'Bronze with hexagonal tessellation pattern — irises divided into perfect geometric cells, each facet slightly lighter at the edges, creating a honeycomb effect that catches light distinctly', N'Warm medium brown with golden and amber undertones — a dynamic complexion that shifts subtly in different light between cool and warm, neither fully one nor the other. Golden highlights in direct sunlight, almost luminescent.', N'Smooth despite age, with deep laugh lines around the eyes and mouth. Cheekbones are prominently defined and raised, reflecting Southeast and South Asian heritage structure. Jawline is long and defined with the refined geometry typical of South Asian ancestry. Brow ridge shows Northern European influence. Very fine silver-grey down visible on forearms and upper cheekbones in certain light. No visible acne scarring or skin damage; skin suggests careful maintenance but not vanity.', N'The hexagonal iris mod is immediately visible and unmistakable — it is the first thing most people notice. The neural jack behind the left ear is hidden by hair but can be glimpsed if they move or if light catches it at the right angle. The scent gland enhancement is not visually apparent. They do not attempt to conceal any of this.', N'Sits more than they stand. When seated at their center table in The Still, they are remarkably still — hands poised over keyboard or resting on the table, spine straight but not rigid. When moving, they move with economic efficiency, no wasted motion, as though their body has learned that every gesture in Shallowgrave should mean something. They make direct eye contact and hold it, which is slightly unnerving given the augmented irises. Their head tilts slightly when listening — a small tilt toward the speaker, as though collecting their words more carefully.', N'Tier 4 working-class aesthetic with deliberate indifference to fashion. Default outfit: charcoal or black thermal base layer, loose-fitting grey utility overshirt (often Yakuza-market surplus, durable synthetic-cotton blend), matte black cargo pants with thigh pockets for data drives or tools. Footwear: worn grey canvas boots (laced, maintained but not pristine). A single piece of jewelry — a thin bronze bracelet on the right wrist, old enough that it has developed a patina, possibly intentionally matching their eye color. No logos, no LED elements, no chrome accents. Everything about their presentation suggests someone who has optimized for invisibility in plain sight.', N'', N'Economical and precise; uses technical data terminology fluently and without showing off; occasionally drops into Somali-inflected cadences when genuinely interested in something', N'Unhurried to the point of seeming sleepy; long silences that are entirely comfortable on their end and uncomfortable on everyone else''s', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'harith_fredriksen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6bf-7d8d-bef3-db4720df4c49', N'Caupolican Fassi-Khorasani-Tehrani', N'Caupolican', N'', N'Fassi-Khorasani-Tehrani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 51, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'North Branch Commons, near North Ave and Damen', N'Synthetic rights lawyer and policy advocate', N'Synthetic Persons Advocacy Consortium (SPAC); occasional contract work for the North Branch Commons Community Council', N'Caupolican Fassi-Khorasani-Tehrani is a tall, broad-shouldered man who carries himself with the careful deliberateness of someone who learned long ago that his physical size reads as threatening in rooms where he needs to be persuasive. His skin is a deep brown-black, his hair gone silver at the temples and worn in short, dense coils. He has no cosmetic mods and minimal augmentations — partly on principle, partly because he believes his clients'' humanity should not depend on how much chrome their lawyer has. He dresses in secondhand formal wear he maintains impeccably: pressed synthwool trousers, collared shirts, a battered briefcase that belonged to his father.

Caupolican Fassi-Khorasani-Tehrani represents synthetic persons — AIs and uploaded consciousnesses fighting for legal recognition, labor rights, and freedom from forced reset — in the contested administrative courts of GLMZ. He has won exactly eleven cases in twenty years. He counts each one like a prayer bead. He is not a warm man in the way people expect warmth, but he is an intensely fair one, and people who have known him a long time say that counts for more. He is prone to long silences in conversation, not from discomfort but from genuine thought, and he has a reputation for asking questions that make people suddenly unsure of things they were certain about.', N'Quest giver, information source on legal systems and synthetic rights, moral compass figure — raises difficult ethical questions without providing easy answers. Can open doors to legal resources or provide formal advocacy.', N'', N'Basic neural interface (legal document management, courtroom presentation); hearing augmentation in right ear (occupational damage from a factory job in his twenties)', N'Mornings reviewing case files in his cramped SPAC office above a noodle stall in North Branch Commons. Afternoons in administrative hearings or meeting with synthetic clients in whatever physical or digital space they can access. Evenings usually spent reading, sometimes attending community council sessions.', N'Caupolican Fassi-Khorasani-Tehrani, tall lean man with warm medium-brown skin and subtle golden undertones, short black coils with silver threading at temples, deep brown eyes with East Asian epicanthic fold, defined North African and Middle Eastern cheekbones, thin pale scar running along left jawline, weathered clear complexion with fine concentration lines. Wearing pressed charcoal synthwool trousers, cream collared shirt buttoned to collar, worn linen blazer with SPAC pin, carrying battered dark brown leather briefcase. Standing with controlled posture, shoulders slightly inward, economical stillness. Analog mechanical watch. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool neon-lit office setting with subtle blue and purple lighting casting shadows across his face, emphasizing scars and serious expression. Minimal visible augmentation, subcutaneous hearing mod barely visible above right ear. Tier 3-4 formal aesthetic. Film noir neo-noir mood, serious and measured. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'North Branch Commons', N'local', N'North Branch Commons', N'North African / Middle Eastern / East Asian blend. His ancestry draws primarily from North Africa (46.9%), with significant Middle Eastern (31.0%) and East Asian (22.1%) heritage. This creates a complexion that bridges North African warmth with Middle Eastern structure and East Asian features—a richly layered genetic map of the Mediterranean-to-Central Asian corridor.', 188, 92, N'Tall and broad-shouldered with a lean muscularity that speaks to decades of deliberate physical discipline rather than gym culture. His frame carries weight with careful economy — no softness, no wasted space.', N'Black with silver at temples', N'Short, dense coils, neatly groomed, threaded with gray along the hairline', N'Short', N'Deep brown', N'Warm medium-brown with subtle golden undertones from North African heritage, enriched by Middle Eastern depth and East Asian smoothness. The tone suggests sun exposure balanced with ancestral pigmentation—neither pale nor deeply dark, but richly saturated with a subtle olive undertone that catches light distinctly.', N'Weathered, clear skin with the texture of someone who has lived outdoors in his youth. Fine lines around the eyes from years of concentration. A scar runs along his left jawline—thin, pale, decades old. His face carries the structured geometry of North African and Middle Eastern ancestry: defined cheekbones, a strong jaw with subtle angularity from East Asian influence, and eyes set with slight depth and a characteristic epicanthic fold at the inner corner. Not conventionally handsome; it reads as serious, considered, measured.', N'Minimal. A barely-perceptible discoloration and slight swelling above the right ear indicates subcutaneous hearing augmentation. No visible chrome, no cosmetic mods, no neural jacks. The only hint of his augmentations is the faint neural interface port on the inside of his left wrist — usually covered by his shirt cuff.', N'Moves with controlled precision, never expansive. His shoulders are slightly drawn inward despite his height — a deliberate de-escalation of his physical presence. When seated, he sits fully upright. When standing during arguments, he plants his feet and remains still rather than pacing. His movements are economical and purposeful; he does not gesture while speaking.', N'Secondhand formal wear maintained with obsessive care. Pressed synthwool trousers in charcoal or black, collared shirts in cream or pale blue, always tucked and buttoned to the collar. A worn linen blazer, probably 20+ years old, with a small SPAC pin on the lapel. His father''s battered leather briefcase, dark brown and creased with age, carried daily. Shoes are practical and polished — no status signaling, no tier-flex. His watch is analog, mechanical, and old. Tier 3-4 aesthetic born from principle, not poverty.', N'His precedent case — the one he''s built eight years toward — rests partly on testimony from a synthetic client he coached more heavily than legal ethics allows. He told himself he was correcting for the client''s inexperience with human legal norms. He isn''t sure anymore.', N'Formal, precise, occasionally archaic — he reads a lot of pre-Collapse legal philosophy; uses plain language in client meetings by conscious effort', N'Slow and measured, long pauses for thought, never raises his voice in argument', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'caupolican_fassi_khorasani_tehrani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a659-72b9-bf60-db474c9763de', N'Dag Trujillo-Appiah', N'Dag', N'', N'Trujillo-Appiah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Undertow — runs a legitimate-front vehicle repair bay called Undertow Mechanical in a reclaimed flood-tunnel structure near the Escanaba Gateway approach, near Michigan Ave and Roosevelt', N'Chop shop operator and stolen vehicle parts broker in the Undertow', N'Independent — pays tribute to the Undertow''s loose protection arrangement; has a long-standing parts-sourcing relationship with two Stockyard theft crews', N'Dag Trujillo-Appiah has the particular physical presence of someone who has spent twenty years doing heavy manual work and developed an architecture around it — wide through the shoulders, with grease-dark hands that are never entirely clean and forearms marked by old burn-scars from a welding accident in their early twenties. Their skin is a warm brown with amber undertones, their hair is worn in a practical short wrap they cover with a work cap on the floor. Their eyes are standard brown but they have bioluminescent skin mods along their forearms and collarbones — a blue-green that pulses faintly in low light, visible when their sleeves roll up, which in the shop is always. It''s a purely aesthetic choice that amuses them because people expect something more threatening from someone who looks like them.

Mircea runs a genuinely good mechanical shop. This is not a front in the sense of being hollow — they can and do repair vehicles legitimately, and their legitimate work is skilled. The chop operation runs alongside it, not instead of it, which is part of why they''ve lasted. They are patient, methodical, and have the institutional memory of everyone who has moved parts through the Undertow in the past decade. They are neither warm nor cold to most people — professional, honest about prices, honest about timelines, and unwilling to pretend that the boundary between legal and not is meaningful when Ferrogate Transit controls the licensing structure for vehicle repair anyway.', N'Parts broker and information source for the Undertow''s vehicle ecosystem — knows what''s moving, what''s being stripped, and who needs what. Can supply vehicles, parts, or transport connections. Morally uncomplicated in their own view, which makes them useful and unpredictable.', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin mods — forearm and collarbone panels, blue-green (cosmetic). A structural joint reinforcement in both wrists — they were damaged in the welding accident and the augmentation was the affordable fix. Optical magnification implant in the right eye for fine mechanical work.', N'Opens the bay at 0800. Legitimate work during business hours with one or two assistants present. After 1900 when the assistants leave, they evaluate incoming stripped parts, run serial number matching and provenance checks to avoid hot inventory, and process orders for their broker clients.', N'Dag Trujillo-Appiah, 178cm tall mixed-heritage neo-noir mechanic with rich warm brown skin and golden undertones, standing in industrial shop setting. Deep brown eyes with subtle East Asian shape, high prominent cheekbones blending East Asian and Middle Eastern features with fuller Sub-Saharan proportions, fuller lips. Short dark brown hair under worn canvas work cap. Broad shoulders, compact muscular build. Both forearms showing blue-green bioluminescent panels pulsing faintly, pale parallel burn scars from wrist to mid-forearm, sleeves rolled to display augmentations. Subtle reinforcement plating visible at both wrists. Right eye with faint crystalline magnification lens. Blue NCORP work coveralls over dark undershirt, heavy-duty Goodyear Vulcan boots, grease-stained leather apron. Single silver utilitarian ring on left hand. Hands perpetually stained with machine oil. Economical posture, patient expression of someone accustomed to precision mechanical work. Bioluminescent collarbones visible at open neck. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan setting, moody workshop lighting catching the blue-green glow of implants, professional technical aesthetic, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Undertow', N'local', N'The Undertow', N'Multi-continental ancestry with Sub-Saharan African (30.5%), East Asian (25.4%), and Middle Eastern (18.0%) as primary components, blended with Hispanic/Latin American (13.3%), Southeast Asian (6.7%), and Indigenous American (6.1%) heritage. This creates a striking fusion: deep warm undertones from African ancestry combine with the angular cheekbones and eye shape of East Asian genetics, while Middle Eastern features add definition to facial structure. Hispanic and Southeast Asian ancestry softens the angularity with fuller cheeks and lip fullness, while Indigenous American heritage contributes to the overall warmth and earth-toned complexion. The resulting phenotype is distinctly cosmopolitan—warm-toned with sophisticated bone structure that reflects the true Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 178, 89, N'Broad-shouldered and compact through the torso, built from two decades of heavy mechanical work — dense muscle without bulk, with weathered forearms that speak to repetitive strain and controlled strength', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Practical short wrap, typically covered with a work cap on the shop floor', N'Short', N'Deep brown with subtle East Asian shape; right eye contains faint magnification lens visible on close inspection', N'Rich warm brown with golden undertones—a luminous medium-deep complexion that reflects the warm heritage of Sub-Saharan, East Asian, Middle Eastern, and Indigenous American ancestry, catching bioluminescent light with distinctive clarity', N'Weathered and pragmatic — minimal grooming beyond functional maintenance. Face shows the patient set of someone accustomed to long problem-solving. High, prominent cheekbones reflecting East Asian and Middle Eastern ancestry blend with the fuller features and fuller lips of Sub-Saharan and Southeast Asian heritage, softened further by Hispanic and Indigenous American ancestry proportions. Hands perpetually stained with grease and machine oil despite regular washing; creases around the eyes from squinting at fine mechanical detail. Facial structure shows the sophisticated angularity of Middle Eastern features softened by the warmth and roundness of African, Southeast Asian, Hispanic, and Indigenous American proportions.', N'Bioluminescent subcutaneous panels on forearms and collarbones (blue-green, aesthetic). Structural wrist augmentation visible as subtle reinforcement plating at both wrists when hands are examined closely. Right eye contains optical magnification lens (subtle but detectable on direct eye contact, faint crystalline structure within the iris)', N'Economical and deliberate — no wasted motion. Stands with weight balanced, hands often at rest but poised for immediate work. Moves with the patience of someone who has learned that rushing breaks things and ruins margins. Direct eye contact, minimal expressiveness, but not hostile — the affect of someone who communicates primarily through work quality rather than warmth', N'Tier 4 practical — grey or blue NCORP-branded work coveralls or sturdy canvas pants with reinforced knees and pockets. Plain fitted undershirt, usually dark. Heavy-duty work boots (current model: Goodyear Vulcan, resoled twice). Sleeves rolled or cut at forearms to accommodate augmentations and allow light to catch the bioluminescence. Worn canvas work cap with an illegible logo. A single silver ring on the left hand (no obvious sentimentality — looks utilitarian). Grease-stained leather apron when doing detailed work. No jewelry beyond the ring. Clothes carry the authentic patina of shop work — not a costume', N'The welding accident twenty years ago wasn''t entirely an accident — they were covering for a then-partner''s mistake in their first chop operation and stepped into the arc instead of letting the partner take the blame. The partner is now a mid-level figure in one of the Stockyard crews Mircea brokers for, and neither of them has ever mentioned it.', N'Technical vehicle and mechanical terminology, Undertow vernacular, blunt declarative sentences — they do not use three words when one will do', N'Flat and even, with long silences that are thinking rather than discomfort. Doesn''t modulate for social comfort.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dag_trujillo_appiah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a651-787f-bf65-db4c0460b098', N'Esteban Jaramillo-Ionescu-Ozcoidi', N'Esteban', N'', N'Jaramillo-Ionescu-Ozcoidi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 51, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Western border of GLMZ — operates from a fortified farmstead that serves as Red Lantern''s staging area', N'Crew lead and Gleaner Brigade veteran — Red Lantern', N'Red Lantern', N'Esteban Jaramillo-Ionescu-Ozcoidi has been raiding Iowa for food for twenty-three years. She was one of the first Gleaner Brigade volunteers when the agricultural collapse turned the breadbasket into contested territory — a landscape of mega-scale automated farms defended by corporate security and increasingly hostile Behemoth fauna that emerged from the ecological disruption. She survived because she learned to read the land the way her grandmother read weather: patterns in the soil, in the animal movement, in the electromagnetic signatures that Behemoths leave before they surface.

She built Red Lantern from other long-term Gleaners — the ones who''d survived enough raids to develop the institutional knowledge that keeps you alive in Behemoth territory. The crew runs two to three deep raids per month, crossing the western jurisdictional boundary into the Iowa wastes to harvest, scavenge, or trade with the scattered farming settlements that still exist between corporate zones. Every raid is a survival operation. The Behemoths are not hypothetical. The corporate security drones are not hypothetical. The food they bring back feeds communities on GLMZ''s western edge that would otherwise starve.

Madre is stocky, sun-darkened, with deep lines around eyes that have spent two decades squinting against prairie wind and scanning horizons for Behemoth sign. Her hair is gray-streaked and kept in a practical braid. She moves with the rolling gait of someone who has walked more miles than she has ridden, and her hands are calloused from farm tools as much as from weapons. She is called Madre because she has buried more young Gleaners than she can count and because she feeds the people who can''t feed themselves.', N'Madre drives the survival horror genre within GLMZ. Her stories are about the cost of food — the literal, physical, terrifying cost of feeding a population that a collapsing ecosystem cannot support. She is the frontier, the border between the city and the wild. Her Behemoth encounters are the closest the narrative gets to creature horror.', N'', N'Seismic-sensitivity implants in both feet — detect ground vibration patterns associated with Behemoth movement up to 2km away. Enhanced olfactory processing for tracking environmental chemical changes (Behemoth pheromone traces, soil toxicity, weather shifts). Cardiopulmonary endurance package for sustained physical performance in extreme conditions. Subdermal emergency beacon linked to GLMZ''s western defense network.', N'Wakes before dawn. Checks seismic readings, weather patterns, and satellite feeds for Behemoth activity along the western corridor. Plans routes for upcoming raids or reviews post-raid logistics. Spends afternoons training crew and maintaining the farmstead''s defenses. Evenings she cooks — enormous meals for whoever is at the farmstead, because feeding people is not separate from the mission; it is the mission. Sleeps light, always.', N'Portrait of Esteban Jaramillo-Ionescu-Ozcoidi, a 162cm stocky weathered woman with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, standing in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Dark brown hair with silver streaking braided down her back, bound with cord. Warm brown eyes with deep crow''s feet, permanent squint lines from decades of prairie scanning. Strong cheekbones showing Indigenous American and Eastern European prominence softened by broader Sub-Saharan features. Thin white scar running from right cheekbone to jawline. Face etched by wind and sun, weathered lips, rough texture. Wearing olive-drab reinforced cargo pants, weathered brown leather belt, tan canvas work jacket with sleeves rolled, long-sleeve synthetic shirt underneath. Expensive tactical boots. Callused hands, dark Red Lantern tattoo visible on inside of right forearm with spiral of names. Silver band on left ring finger, red cloth lantern pendant on cord around neck. Posture poised and economical, weight distributed low. Neo-noir urban industrial background, moody overhead lighting emphasizing weathered features and subsurface augmentation ridge at nape of neck. Gritty, functional, ground-sense energy. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Western border of GLMZ', N'local', N'Western border of GLMZ', N'Complex global ancestry reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: 40.6% Hispanic/Latin American, 21.5% Eastern European, 17.8% Indigenous American, 17.2% Sub-Saharan African, and 2.9% Southeast Asian. This genetic combination produces deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, facial structure showing a harmonious blend of Indigenous American cheekbone prominence with broader Sub-Saharan African features and Eastern European bone structure, softened by Southeast Asian ancestry. The result is a uniquely multicontinental appearance—strong, weathered, and unmistakably marked by decades of exposure.', 162, 71, N'Stocky and dense, muscular without bulk — the physique of someone who carries loads across difficult terrain rather than lifting in a gym. Broad shoulders, thick core, legs that show decades of walking. No excess weight; everything functional.', N'Dark brown with prominent silver-gray streaking, especially at temples and through the braid', N'Single practical braid running down the center of her back, often wrapped with cord or leather to keep it secure during work', N'Long (past shoulders when unbraided), but always bound', N'Warm brown, naturally bright but appearing darker due to sun damage and the permanent squint lines around them', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, heavily weathered and sun-darkened from two decades of prairie exposure, reflecting the rich melanin blend of Indigenous American, Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and Eastern European ancestry', N'Face carved by wind and sun — deep crow''s feet radiating from eyes, permanent creases between brows from scanning horizons, weathered lips. Skin texture is rough, not lined so much as etched. Cheekbones show Indigenous American and Eastern European prominence softened by broader Sub-Saharan African facial structure, with subtle Southeast Asian influence in eye shape and orbital structure. No cosmetic grooming; functional only. A thin white scar runs from her right cheekbone to jawline.', N'No obvious chrome or external implants. Her augmentations are entirely subcutaneous — seismic implants in feet arches (sometimes visible as faint grid scarring across soles if barefoot), olfactory processing invisible. The subdermal emergency beacon sits at the base of her skull, creating a subtle ridge under the skin at her nape, visible only if hair is pulled back tight.', N'Moves with a rolling, economical gait — weight distributed low, knees slightly bent in a stance that allows rapid directional shift. Never stands fully upright; always poised for movement. Hands rest naturally at her sides or near her belt. Head moves before eyes when scanning — rotates deliberately, reading angles rather than glancing. She walks with the ground-sense of someone reading vibrations through her feet; occasionally pauses mid-step as if listening to something through her soles.', N'Tier 4 functional: heavy-duty canvas and treated leather, designed for durability and repair rather than replacement. Olive-drab cargo pants with reinforced knees and thigh pockets filled with practical gear. Weathered brown leather belt with a worn holster. Boots are expensive tactical-grade, maintained obsessively. Top layer is usually a canvas work jacket in tan or dark gray, sleeves rolled or pushed up. Underneath: simple long-sleeve synthetic shirt designed for temperature regulation and quick-dry properties. No jewelry except a simple silver band on her left ring finger — not decorative, worn from years of labor. A red cloth lantern-shaped pendant hangs from a cord around her neck, hand-sewn, worn soft by handling.', N'She has seen a Behemoth exhibit behavior she cannot explain — coordinated, purposeful, almost communicative. It happened once, during a raid three years ago. She has told no one because the implications — that the Behemoths are not animals but something else — would change everything about how the raids are conducted. She is not ready to change everything.', N'Practical, earthy, agricultural. She speaks in the language of farming, weather, and land. Military terminology creeps in when discussing operations. Spanish endearments surface when she''s emotional — mija, hijo, corazon.', N'Steady, grounded, unhurried. She talks the way she walks — with the patience of someone who knows the prairie doesn''t care about your schedule.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'esteban_jaramillo_ionescu_ozcoidi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c4-7c26-90dd-dc128fed51c6', N'Chenguang Solberg', N'Chenguang', N'', N'Solberg', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'Unlicensed Broadcaster / Street-Level Journalist / Rumor Broker', N'Independent; Harbor Frequency is formally unaffiliated; she maintains deliberate distance from all factions to protect source relationships, but her sympathies are legible to anyone paying attention', N'Chenguang Solberg runs a pirate broadcast out of a rotating series of signal-masked locations across Old Harbor, producing a daily audio-visual feed called ''Harbor Frequency'' that has become, for a substantial portion of the district''s population, the closest thing to actual news they have access to. She is compact and restless, with deep brown skin, natural hair she keeps wrapped in a rotating collection of printed fabrics, and the particular kind of energy that reads as enthusiasm until you''re on the wrong side of it and recognize it as something more relentless. Her eyes are quick and evaluative in a way she has stopped trying to soften; she watches people the way a cartographer watches terrain. She is almost always in motion, or appears to be — even seated, her hands are working, her attention is cycling.

She grew up in Old Harbor, the second of four children of a harbor logistics worker and a schoolteacher who lost her position when the district''s public education contract was absorbed by a Spire EdTech subsidiary. The family did not leave because they could not, and then because they chose not to, and Blessed absorbed both the helplessness and the stubbornness of that distinction. She started broadcasting at nineteen, initially as a way to circulate information about enforcement sweeps and eviction notices — practical, immediate, unglamorous. Harbor Frequency evolved into something more: investigative segments, community commentary, intercepted corporate communications she''s never explained how she obtained, and a call-in segment where Old Harbor residents speak on-air about things that would not otherwise be recorded anywhere. She has been arrested twice for unlicensed broadcasting. Both times she was back on air within seventy-two hours from a different location.

She is not naive about what she is or what she''s doing. She understands that she is a small signal in a very large noise floor, and she has made her peace with scale — or tells herself she has. What she hasn''t made peace with is the gap between what she knows and what she can prove, between what she broadcasts and what it actually changes. She fills that gap with work, with speed, with the belief that bearing witness is not nothing even when it is not enough. She is twenty-four and has already developed the particular exhaustion of someone who has been urgently awake for too long.', N'Ground-level witness and information conduit; represents the question of whether truth-telling is itself a form of power or only a prerequisite for it; her network makes her a structural node for plot — information, misinformation, and the people who need to control both flow through her. Her youth and exhaustion track the cost of sustained resistance at street level.', N'', N'Ocular recording implants — consumer grade, modified for extended buffer capacity by a Circuit technician; she records everything, continuously, and edits in post,Subvocal microphone for covert audio capture, embedded near the larynx,A secondhand neural filter for signal decryption, outdated and increasingly unreliable — she can''t afford an upgrade and won''t ask for help getting one', N'No fixed schedule by design — she rotates sleep locations to avoid pattern establishment, crashing with a rotating network of family, friends, and contacts across Old Harbor. Broadcasts daily, typically in the early evening when her audience is home from work. Spends mornings gathering — walking the district, talking to people, monitoring intercepted frequencies. Eats irregularly, always on the move, almost always street food from vendors she''s known since childhood. Maintains her equipment obsessively, the one area of her life where she exercises sustained patience. Has a recurring argument with herself about whether she needs to slow down, which she always loses.', N'Chenguang Solberg, 158cm compact wiry frame, medium-deep warm brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage blend. Delicate Southeast Asian facial structure with high cheekbones and refined nose, balanced against strong Sub-Saharan African jaw definition. Deep brown eyes with amber undertones, cyber-augmented with visible ocular implant hardware catching light with iridescent sheen. Thin temple scar on left side from enforcement strike. Shoulder-length natural deep brown-black hair wrapped in geometric-patterned recycled cotton fabric with protest slogans. Worn black utility pants with patches, faded printed tee layered under modified surplus military jacket with hand-stitched circuit-pattern embroidery. Scuffed boots. Frayed microphone cord at collarbone. Mismatched silver rings. Tense analytical expression, dark circles under eyes. Seated in Old Harbor urban environment, hands working with equipment, quick purposeful movement captured mid-motion. GLMZ setting, neon-lit evening warehouse backdrop, cold industrial lighting with warm skin tone contrast. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend with dominant Hispanic/Latin American (34.2%) and Southeast Asian (31.1%) ancestry, substantive Sub-Saharan African (19.7%) heritage, and minor contributions from Middle Eastern (6.0%), Eastern European (5.4%), and East Asian (3.6%) lineages. Her features reflect this weighted mix: Southeast Asian facial structure provides delicate proportions and eye shape, while Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African ancestry contribute warmth, bone definition, and deeper complexion. The result is a face that reads as genuinely Pan-Global without clear singular origin.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, all restless kinetic energy — lean muscle without bulk, built for sustained motion rather than strength. Her frame suggests someone who moves constantly and eats irregularly.', N'Natural deep brown-black', N'Wrapped in rotating printed cotton fabrics — geometric patterns, protest slogans, recycled textile prints; when unwrapped, kept in close braids or natural texture coils', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Deep brown with amber undertones, ocular implant hardware around the iris — micro-recording lenses catch light with a subtle iridescent sheen', N'Medium-deep warm brown with golden undertones — the blended result of Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage creating complex, luminous depth', N'Southeast Asian delicacy in overall face shape — softer cheekbone prominence, refined nose bridge — balanced against Sub-Saharan African definition in jaw and brow structure. High cheekbones with subtle fullness in lower face and lips reflecting Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Skin is clear but weathered by irregular sleep and constant outdoor movement. Dark circles under her eyes are permanent fixtures. Her expression defaults to evaluative intensity.', N'Ocular recording implants are immediately visible — the hardware catch-light around her irises, slight mechanical glint when she blinks or shifts focus. The subvocal mic scar is visible only when her neck is exposed. The neural filter is entirely subcutaneous — not visible.', N'Never fully still. Even seated, her hands are working — adjusting her wrap, checking equipment, scripting notes with worn stylus on recycled paper. She moves through space with the efficiency of someone who has mapped every alley and shortcut in Old Harbor. Her gait is quick and purposeful. Her attention cycles visibly — scanning faces, frequencies, the environment for usable information. When she focuses on someone, it''s complete but analytical; she watches the way a predator watches terrain.', N'Tier 4 working-class, deliberately anti-corporate. Worn black utility pants with multiple pockets and repair patches. Layered tops — often a faded printed tee under a modified surplus military jacket with circuit-pattern embroidery added by hand. Her wrap-fabric rotates but always carries visual weight — protest imagery, community symbols, recycled materials. Boots are scuffed, well-maintained, practical for running. She wears a secondary microphone jack visible at her collarbone on a frayed cord. Her only jewelry is a series of mismatched silver rings, gifts from contacts or salvage.', N'One of her most-circulated investigative segments — the one that documented corporate waste dumping in Old Harbor''s water infrastructure — was based on documents she received from an anonymous source she has never verified. She broadcast it because everything checked out except the source itself. She has since come to suspect the documents were genuine but were leaked to her deliberately, to serve someone else''s agenda she still doesn''t fully understand. She has not corrected the record because the underlying facts appear to be true. She thinks about it almost every day.', N'Code-switches constantly and deliberately — Old Harbor vernacular with family, broadcast-register with sources, something in between on air that feels like Old Harbor but carries enough structural clarity to be understood across the district. Rich in sensory and spatial language. Tends toward active voice, present tense.', N'Fast in conversation, especially when excited or anxious — her speech accelerates rather than stumbles. On air she disciplines herself to a slower pace and the discipline is audible. She often interrupts herself to correct or add, not from disorganization but from a mind that runs ahead of speech.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chenguang_solberg');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a609-7f6c-b877-dc34b4cead35', N'Ecem Achebe', N'Ecem', N'', N'Achebe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 63, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, in a permanently parked converted freight hauler she calls The Box, near Michigan Ave and Chicago Ave', N'Underground filmmaker and oral history documentarian', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone community; loose affiliation with an underground archivist network called the Memory Workers; historically antagonistic relationship with Axiom Media Division', N'Ecem Achebe is a solidly built woman with dark brown skin weathered attractively by decades of outdoor work, close-cropped silver hair, and the calm deliberate manner of someone who has decided what matters and freed herself of everything else. She has a retractable claw modification on her right hand — not for combat but because she finds it useful for cable management and fine lens adjustment — and her left eye hosts a recording overlay that has been running continuously for eleven years. The indicator light is always visible: a tiny red dot she makes no effort to conceal.

She makes films. Not for distribution, or not primarily — she maintains a massive personal archive of GLMZ''s underclass, shot over forty years, that she considers her life''s work and has never released in full. Clips surface occasionally, always unsigned. Her narrative documentaries about Highland Park and Hamtramck Enclave communities have won prizes from bodies that don''t officially exist and been suppressed by three different corponation legal teams. She is patient, relentless, and radically comfortable with being underestimated. She has a dry humor she deploys sparingly and a stillness that makes people forget they are being observed and recorded.', N'Memory-keeper and potential quest giver — she has footage of things that powerful people want gone. She is also a window into Highland Park community dynamics, a trusted figure who can vouch for outsiders or warn against them. Her archive is an extraordinary resource and an extraordinary liability.', N'', N'Continuous recording overlay in left eye (eleven-year running archive); retractable claw on right hand (practical use); joint reinforcement in both knees (medical, from years of field work)', N'Spends mornings reviewing and annotating archive footage — a discipline she treats as sacred. Afternoons are fieldwork, interviews, or community meetings. Evenings she edits or mentors younger filmmakers who find their way to The Box.', N'Ecem Achebe, 168cm tall, silver-gray close-cropped hair, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African, Pacific Islander, South Asian, and Northern European ancestry. Strong cheekbones, broad nose bridge, weathered face lined from decades of fieldwork. Left eye features tiny red recording indicator light embedded in dark brown iris; right eye natural dark brown. Deliberate, economical posture. Right hand shows retractable matte gunmetal chromatic claw mechanism. Wearing layered utilitarian clothing: faded dark green field jacket with shoulder reinforcement over thermal base layer, dark canvas work pants with deep pockets, worn and resoled leather boots, canvas work vest laden with tool loops and pouches. Thin platinum marital ring on left hand. Hands weathered with calluses and fine scars from precision work. Faint 3cm pale scar visible across left temple. Standing in dim GLMZ GLMZ industrial setting, composed and observational, half-light catching the red indicator in her eye, documentary photographer aesthetic, moody atmospheric lighting, gritty and functional, no vanity or decoration. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (53.6%) with significant Pacific Islander (19.7%) ancestry, complemented by Middle Eastern (7.7%), Northern European (7.5%), South Asian (5.8%), and Eastern European (5.7%) heritage. The genetic blend manifests in deep warm brown skin with complex undertones — the richness of African ancestry dominates her complexion, subtly warmed by Pacific Islander and South Asian influences, with faint golden-amber notes from the minor European contributions. A truly global genetic archive, visible in her individual features rather than fitting regional categories.', 168, 78, N'Solidly muscular, broad-shouldered, compact torso with the compact density of someone who has carried equipment and intention for four decades. No softness, no waste.', N'Silver-gray', N'Close-cropped, shaped close to skull, practical and minimal', N'Short', N'Left eye: dark brown with red recording indicator light embedded in lower iris margin; right eye: natural dark brown', N'Deep warm brown with golden-amber undertones, the result of predominantly Sub-Saharan African ancestry creating a base complexion enriched by Pacific Islander warmth and South Asian depth. Weathered texture from decades of outdoor fieldwork, wind exposure, and time exposure. Darkens noticeably with sun exposure.', N'Minimal makeup, no vanity grooming. The facial structure reflects dominant Sub-Saharan African heritage — strong cheekbones, broad nose bridge, fuller lips — with subtle geometric influences from Pacific Islander (broader facial proportions), South Asian (refined eye shape and depth), and Northern European (slight nose bridge definition) ancestry creating an individually distinctive face. Lines around mouth and eyes from squinting through viewfinders and forty years of outdoor fieldwork. Skin has the quality of something well-maintained but not decorated.', N'Right hand: retractable chromatic claw mechanism visible along dorsal surface when relaxed, matte gunmetal finish, integrated into natural hand architecture. Left eye: tiny red recording indicator light, always visible, deliberately unconcealed. No cosmetic chrome or display aesthetics — purely functional modification.', N'Still, economical, deliberate. Moves as if always composing a frame. Her gaze settles on people longer than is socially conventional — not aggressive, but observational. Hands at rest, but right hand frequently makes small precise gestures even in conversation, muscle memory of adjustment and calibration.', N'Tier 5 utilitarian, but worn with the confidence of someone uninterested in status signaling. Dark canvas work pants with custom deep pockets for cables and small lens elements. Layered tops — base layer thermal, outer layer a faded dark green field jacket with structural reinforcement at shoulders. Worn boots, resoled multiple times, scuffed leather that takes abuse. No jewelry except a thin platinum ring on left hand — old, looks marital. A canvas work vest with numerous tool loops and small pouches, always worn, always bearing the weight of fieldwork.', N'Eleven years ago her continuous recording captured footage of a Palladian Corp executive ordering a neighborhood demolition that killed six people — framed as a structural failure. She has the footage. She has not released it. She tells herself she is waiting for the right moment. She has started to wonder if she is just afraid.', N'Precise and unhurried; uses Congolese French phrases occasionally; academic register that is never condescending because she is genuinely interested in your answer', N'Slow and deliberate; leaves space; is not made uncomfortable by silence', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ecem_achebe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a61d-7690-9abb-dc7d09a30ee2', N'Erbol Árnason-Matsumoto-Hong', N'Erbol', N'', N'Árnason-Matsumoto-Hong', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, operator''s booth and surrounding platform district, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Ferrogate Transit operator (elevated rail, Line 7 Deepwell–Grainfort corridor)', N'Zheng-dao Bioelectric (mid-level ferrogate transit operator (elevated rail)', N'Erbol Árnason-Matsumoto-Hong is a broad man gone somewhat soft at the middle, with silver-threaded dark hair kept short and a close-cropped beard that his wife has been trimming for thirty-two years. His skin is warm brown with a reddish undertone that deepens when he''s cold or irritated, and he has the particular stillness of someone who has sat in the same operator''s booth for twenty-three years and learned that panicking doesn''t stop trains. His right hand has a subdermal haptic interface overlay — occupational, standard Ferrogate issue — and he keeps a small laminated photograph of the original Deepwell Station from before the renovation tucked behind his console because he thinks the new design is ugly and says so to anyone who will listen.

He is the kind of man who knows every unusual passenger, every suspicious package left on a platform, and every maintenance shortcut that the younger operators haven''t figured out yet. He has opinions. Sustained, elaborate, well-reasoned opinions about transit policy, Ferrogate management decisions, platform maintenance schedules, and the spiritual nature of the Transit Mind (the E.L.F. that passengers believe inhabits the rail network). He is deeply skeptical of the Transit Mind''s divinity but observes all the operator''s ritual courtesy gestures toward it anyway, on the grounds that you don''t get to be sixty-one by being rude to things that might be alive.', N'Information broker for anything moving through the transit network. Can provide access to restricted platform areas. Witness to unusual events on Line 7. Represents institutional memory of the city''s transit system.', N'', N'Subdermal haptic interface overlay (right hand, occupational — Ferrogate standard issue for rail operators). No geneware. Minor corrective optics built into his ID glasses.', N'Four days on, three days off. Morning shift, 05:00–13:00, Line 7. Rides the same line home on his off days out of habit. Spends evenings with his wife Aoife in their apartment in Deepwell Station''s residential annexe.', N'Erbol Árnason-Matsumoto-Hong, GLMZ, tri-continental features: warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, high cheekbones with gentle fullness, broad nose, full lips, strong structured jaw showing East Asian and Southeast Asian influence. Dark brown hair with silver threading, short swept-back cut. Deep brown eyes with warm undertone. 178cm tall, broad-shouldered, thick-chested frame with settled middle weight. Weathered face with pronounced crow''s feet and deep concentration lines, close-cropped dark beard with silver streaks. 23-year transit operator in charcoal-grey Ferrogate uniform jacket worn open over grey undershirt, union pin visible on collar. Right hand shows faint subdermal metallic haptic interface patterns, wire-rimmed ID glasses. Wire-rimmed ID glasses. Worn gold wedding band. Slight forward lean posture, economical stillness. Standing on illuminated train platform, warm station lighting, metal and grease patina visible, hyperrealistic portrait, industrial near-future megacity setting, dignified working-class demeanor --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Tri-continental blend: East Asian (41.7%), Sub-Saharan African (38.2%), and Southeast Asian (20.1%). Warm deep brown skin with golden undertones from the East Asian component, structured high cheekbones and gentle cheek fullness from Southeast Asian ancestry, broad nose and full lips characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage. Strong jaw line shows influence from both East Asian and Southeast Asian lineages. The combination creates a distinctive warm-toned complexion with well-integrated features reflecting all three major ancestry groups.', 178, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and thick-chested, softened at the middle by two decades of sedentary booth work. Still carries the frame of a younger man who did physical labor, now settled into comfortable weight gain. Forearms remain muscular from repetitive rail controls.', N'Dark brown with silver threading throughout', N'Short, practical cut, swept back from forehead, kept neat by routine', N'Short', N'Deep brown with warm undertone', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones from blended East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian heritage, deepens visibly when cold or irritated. Complexion reflects well-integrated ancestry across all three major lineages with subtle warm luminosity.', N'Weathered face with deep lines around eyes and mouth from two decades of concentration and squinting at monitors. Close-cropped dark beard with silver streaking, well-maintained. Sun-weathered from platform exposure. Crow''s feet pronounced. High cheekbones with gentle fullness through cheeks reflecting Southeast Asian and African features. Broad nose and full lips from Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Structured jaw showing East Asian and Southeast Asian influence. Expression carries the stillness of someone accustomed to absolute focus.', N'Right hand displays subtle subdermal haptic interface overlay visible as fine metallic threading across palm and fingertips when hand is extended under light. Interface appears as faint geometric patterns beneath skin surface. Wire-rimmed ID glasses with integrated minor corrective optics, worn constantly.', N'Stands with slight forward lean, as if perpetually monitoring something. Movements economical and deliberate—no wasted motion. Sits with the particular stillness of someone trained to remain motionless during crises. When standing on a platform, weight shifts rhythmically, a habit from years of anticipating train motion. Hands gesture with precision when speaking, especially about transit systems.', N'Ferrogate Transit operator uniform (charcoal-grey Tier 3 industrial cotton blend, union-regulation fit). Uniform jacket worn open over grey undershirt. Standard-issue transit union pin on collar (23-year tenure marker visible). Comfortable worn work boots, well-maintained but scuffed. Off-duty: practical grey trousers, worn cardigans, no affectation. Slight smell of station platform grease and metal polish. Grooming meticulous by working-class standard—clean, practical, dignified.', N'Eighteen months ago, Grigor observed a Ferrogate management official board a restricted maintenance car with two individuals who were not in the system. He logged nothing. He has been watching Line 7''s maintenance schedules obsessively since then, convinced something is being moved or stored in the network''s physical infrastructure. He hasn''t told anyone because he doesn''t know who to trust.', N'Transit technical mixed with a kind of formal courtesy that comes from decades of announcer-voice training. Opinions delivered as calm, self-evident statements.', N'Measured and deliberate. He was a platform announcer for two years before being promoted to operator and still has the projection.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'erbol_rnason_matsumoto_hong');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a633-70b6-b1de-dd398b44fae0', N'Bogumila Makwa', N'Bogumila', N'', N'Makwa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 41, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Blackpipe Corridor, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Street doc operating out of a converted shipping container in The Narrows', N'Independent; loose barter network with other Narrows street docs', N'Bogumila Makwa is a compact woman with dark brown skin and frost-pale freckles scattered across her nose and cheekbones — a genetic echo of her Finnish grandfather that surprises people expecting uniformity. Her hair grows in dense coils that she keeps pinned under a faded surgical cap she has not replaced in six years. Her hands are her most remarkable feature: steady, large-knuckled, permanently stained with the blue-gray residue of antiseptic gel. She wears magnification implants that give her left eye a slightly oversized, luminous quality, like a cat watching from a dim room.

Patch is brusque in the way of people who have learned that warmth invites dependency they cannot sustain. She charges what people can pay — sometimes nothing, sometimes a favor, sometimes the Φ40 she actually needs for supply runs. She keeps a small data-shrine to the E.L.F. known as Suture-3 above her surgical table: a tangle of copper wire and expired med-patch wrappers, to which she mutters brief petitions before complicated procedures. She does not talk about where she trained.', N'Quest giver, information source, moral anchor for street-level stories; can patch up characters or send them elsewhere with critical intel about the neighborhood''s underground health economy', N'', N'Left-eye magnification implant (surgical grade, slightly yellowed lens housing); subdermal vibration sensor in right index finger for pulse detection; no cosmetic mods', N'Wakes before the overhead conduits start their morning hum, sterilizes instruments, checks supply inventory, sees whoever is waiting outside the container door by 0700. Evenings she walks the Blackpipe night market buying antibiotics and synth-plasma off gray vendors.', N'Bogumila Makwa, a 162cm compact lean surgical technician in her 40s with warm deep brown skin with golden and reddish undertones. High prominent angular cheekbones reflecting Indigenous American, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian ancestry. Black hair with salt-and-pepper threading at temples, coiled and pinned under a faded six-year-old surgical cap. Left eye augmented with yellowed surgical magnification lens, luminous and oversized; right eye dark brown and unmodified. Fine lines around eyes from precision work under poor lighting. Faint burn scar on inner left wrist, small laceration scar above right eyebrow. Chronic blue-gray discoloration in fingernails from antiseptic exposure. Wearing faded white surgical coat stained with grease over dark synthetic tank, cargo pants with multiple pockets, worn reinforced boots. Worn cloth wristband on left wrist. Posture economical and precise, weight forward. Hands fidgeting with surgical instruments. Direct brief eye contact. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, dimly lit underground clinic with neon-edged surgical lighting, focused and evaluative expression, utilitarian and functional. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Complex multiethnic blend: Indigenous American (38.8%), Sub-Saharan African (27.3%), South Asian (25.3%), and East Asian (8.6%). This combination produces warm-toned deep brown skin with golden and reddish undertones, high prominent cheekbones characteristic of Indigenous and South Asian genetics, and naturally textured hair with premature salt-and-pepper threading.', 162, 58, N'Compact and lean, muscled through the shoulders and forearms from years of precise manual work. No excess fat; efficient frame built for long hours standing at a surgical table.', N'Black with premature salt-and-pepper threading at the temples', N'Coiled, kept pinned beneath a faded surgical cap; rarely fully exposed', N'Medium (when unpinned, falls to mid-neck)', N'Left eye: augmented with a slightly yellowed surgical-grade magnification lens giving it an enlarged, luminous quality. Right eye: dark brown, unmodified.', N'Warm-toned deep brown with golden and reddish undertones from the blending of Indigenous American, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian ancestry', N'Weathered but not aged; high, prominent cheekbones with angular structure characteristic of Indigenous and South Asian-African genetic blending. Face shows fine lines around the eyes from years of precision work under poor lighting. Hands permanently stained with antiseptic residue in the nail beds and callus creases.', N'Left eye magnification implant with a slightly oversized luminous quality and faintly yellowed synthetic lens housing visible in the iris. Right index finger shows no external sign of the subdermal vibration sensor, but the fingertip has a faint silvery subcutaneous shimmer under certain light.', N'Economical and still; moves with the precision of someone who has trained their body not to waste energy. Stands with weight balanced slightly forward, ready. Her hands are rarely still — they fidget with instruments, surgical gloves, or the copper wire tangle of her data-shrine. Eye contact is direct but brief, the gaze of someone used to evaluating injury rather than engaging socially.', N'Tier 5 utilitarian: faded surgical cap (six years old, stained, but functional); a grease-stained white coat over a dark synthetic tank top; cargo pants with multiple pockets filled with medical supplies; worn boots with reinforced soles for standing. No jewelry. A worn cloth wristband on her left wrist conceals the old burn scar. Everything is functional, nothing is new, everything is clean enough to work in.', N'She was struck off the Aurochs Medical Complex registry eight years ago after falsifying a patient''s corponation insurance tier to get them emergency surgery — the patient lived, but Helix Biosystems flagged the fraud. She has never told anyone in Blackpipe that she was once a licensed trauma surgeon.', N'Clinical precision mixed with Narrows slang; uses medical terminology unselfconsciously then catches herself and translates', N'Short declarative sentences, rarely wastes breath; pauses are long and deliberate', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bogumila_makwa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b4-7a55-b895-dd4df65cc344', N'Ivana Banerjee', N'Ivana', N'', N'Banerjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — maintains a small apartment above the community center that doubles as Last Light''s operational hub, near Western and Division', N'Logistics, safe house management, and community network — Last Light', N'Last Light', N'Ivana Banerjee is the reason Last Light functions at all. She manages the logistics of a pro-bono protection operation in a community with no resources — safe house rotations, transport arrangements, community contact networks, supply chains for medical kits and food, client scheduling, and the thousand administrative details that separate a functioning crew from three idealists shouting into the void. She does this with a budget that wouldn''t cover a week''s coffee for a corporate crew, and she does it well.

She came to the Gray Zone from the Milwaukee Core working class — her parents ran a small printing business that went under when the corporate district''s digital infrastructure made physical printing economically impossible. The family relocated to the Gray Zone when Anya was seventeen. She watched her parents lose everything they''d built — not to malice, but to the indifferent machinery of corporate progress that treats small businesses as statistical noise. She finished her education through the Gray Zone community programs, developed organizational skills through necessity, and joined Last Light because Ruth Agada was the first person she''d met who responded to systemic injustice with organized resistance rather than resignation.

Anya is compact, precise, with dark hair pulled back and the permanently alert expression of someone managing too many moving pieces. She carries a tablet everywhere — the device is her operational hub, containing contact networks, resource inventories, safe house statuses, and the scheduling system that keeps Last Light''s operations from collapsing. She dresses practically, sleeps insufficiently, and eats whatever''s closest. She is burning out. She knows this. She hasn''t stopped because stopping would be worse.', N'Anya is the invisible infrastructure — the character whose work makes the visible heroism possible. Her stories explore burnout, the invisibility of organizational labor, and the particular tragedy of someone who is excellent at supporting others and terrible at supporting herself. She is the character most likely to collapse, and her collapse would take Last Light down with her.', N'', N'Communication suite with encrypted multi-channel capability — manages simultaneous conversations with community contacts, clients, and crew. Eidetic organizational memory — perfect recall of names, addresses, schedules, and resource inventories. Low-grade biomonitor that she ignores the warnings from. No physical augmentations.', N'Wakes at 0500 — before Ruth, though Ruth doesn''t know this. Reviews overnight messages, safe house status, and client schedules. Builds the day''s operational plan and presents it to Ruth at 0600. Spends the day coordinating — client transport, safe house assignments, resource allocation, community contact maintenance. Handles the administrative side of every protection case. Evenings she updates records, maintains the contact network, and tries to sleep. The biomonitor suggests she''s averaging four hours. She resets it weekly so Ruth doesn''t see the cumulative data.', N'Ivana Banerjee, 162cm tall compact wiry frame, warm golden-bronze skin blending Eastern European, South Asian, East Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Angular high cheekbones, defined jawline, fuller lips, dark brown eyes with warm amber undertones. Dark brown hair pulled back tight in functional ponytail. Fatigue shadows under eyes, slight tension lines. Wearing fitted charcoal long-sleeve shirt under weathered synthetic jacket, black utility pants with multiple pockets, worn practical boots. Discrete ear-bud communicator on right ear. Thin silver chain necklace barely visible under shirt collar. Perpetually alert posture, shoulders slightly forward. Hand near tablet interface, fidgeting with stylus. Small pale scar barely visible on left temple. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, moody neon-lit background with holographic interface glow, cinematic lighting emphasizing her exhaustion and focused intensity, urban dystopian atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Eastern European (50.8%), South Asian (26.8%), East Asian (14.0%), Sub-Saharan African (8.4%) — a striking cosmopolitan blend. Features reflect this complex mix: angular facial structure with high, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Eastern European ancestry, balanced with the warmer undertones and defined nose bridge from South Asian ancestry, softened by East Asian bone structure and enriched by Sub-Saharan African heritage in lip fullness and facial warmth.', 162, 54, N'Compact and wiry, muscle definition from constant movement rather than intentional training. Shoulders slightly tensed from chronic stress. No excess body fat.', N'Dark brown, naturally', N'Pulled back in a functional bun or tight ponytail, secured with whatever''s at hand', N'Medium — long enough to pull back, short enough to be practical', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertones', N'Warm golden-bronze, the result of blended Eastern European, South Asian, and East Asian ancestry enriched by Sub-Saharan African undertones. Sun-responsive with a natural warm golden tone rather than pink or cool undertone.', N'Angular features with prominent high cheekbones and defined jawline — Eastern European and South Asian heritage evident in facial geometry, with softer contours from East Asian ancestry. Fuller lips reflecting Sub-Saharan African heritage. Skin shows signs of exhaustion — slight darkness under eyes, occasional tension lines around the mouth. Warm golden-bronze complexion with minimal blemishing. Well-maintained but utilitarian — minimal makeup, functional grooming.', N'None visible. Communication suite and eidetic memory implants are subcutaneous neural arrays — not externally apparent. Wears a discrete ear-bud communicator on her right ear, easily mistaken for standard audio tech.', N'Perpetually alert posture, shoulders slightly forward. Moves with efficiency rather than grace — quick, purposeful steps. Frequently distracted by incoming communications, eyes tracking tablet or mid-distance into AR interface space. Fidgets with stylus or tablet edge when stationary. Rarely fully relaxes.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, heavily practical. Standard black or gray utility pants with multiple pockets, worn comfortable not fashionable. Fitted long-sleeve shirts in muted colors (charcoal, navy, dark green) — layers for temperature control and concealment of biomonitor. Worn synthetic jacket, weathered but well-maintained. Practical boots suitable for moving through the Gray Zone''s unstable infrastructure. A single piece of jewelry: thin silver chain necklace, gift from parents before they died, worn under clothing. Minimal styling — function over appearance.', N'She has been maintaining a second set of books — a parallel budget that tracks the actual cost of Last Light''s operations against what they take in. The numbers are devastating. At current burn rate, Last Light has approximately five months of operational capacity before the safe houses can''t be maintained and the medical supplies run out. She has been quietly approaching external funding sources that Ruth would not approve of. No commitments yet. But the conversations have started.', N'Organizational, logistical, efficient. She speaks in systems — schedules, contacts, resources, contingencies. When she''s tired, which is always, the efficiency becomes clipped.', N'Fast, compressed. She packs maximum information into minimum sentences. Not impatient — efficient. The distinction matters but people can''t always tell.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ivana_banerjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69c-7f3a-be09-dda3fb20dd5d', N'Ahlam Ingebrigtsen-Bautista', N'Ahlam', N'', N'Ingebrigtsen-Bautista', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Morgan''s Ridge pedestrian strip — cart position at the corner of Gage Circuit and the lower Morgan overpass, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Noodle cart vendor and unlicensed childcare provider', N'Independent — unnamed noodle cart; informal affiliation with the Morgan''s Ridge vendor strip collective', N'Ahlam Ingebrigtsen-Bautista is of middling height and seemingly made of angles — sharp elbows, pointed chin, quick gesturing hands that are in constant motion whether they''re cooking or talking or just existing. Their hair is kept in two braids that they tuck into a wide-brimmed thermal hat while working, the hat so old and worn it has achieved a kind of structural sentience. Their skin is a warm medium brown and they have color-changing hair — shifts between dark auburn and a deep teal depending on temperature — which they got years ago and now mainly use as a weather forecaster. Cold mornings read deep teal; the regulars check it before deciding whether to add broth.

Ahlam Ingebrigtsen-Bautista has operated their cart on Morgan''s Ridge for six years. The noodle setup is compact and professional — a heated two-burner system, four base broths rotating by season, and a laminated menu written in three languages including Tamazight which nobody has ordered in but they keep it because it was their grandmother''s language and this is non-negotiable. The unlicensed childcare element evolved organically: shift workers in the Narrows needed somewhere for children between school let-out and evening shifts, and Ahlam Ingebrigtsen-Bautista''s cart became the default station. Now they run an informal afternoon program, four to seven children most days, doing homework near the cart while they cook. It violates three municipal codes. The local code inspector is a regular.', N'Neighborhood fixture and moral center for the Narrows community. The childcare function makes them deeply embedded in local family networks — they know which families are in crisis before anyone else does. Local color and community information source.', N'', N'Color-changing hair geneware (temperature reactive — auburn in warmth, teal in cold). Hearing aid in the left ear — not augmentation, just assistive, bought secondhand.', N'Cart sets up at 06:30 for the morning commuter rush, runs until 10:00, breaks midday, re-opens at 15:30 when school lets out and the childcare function begins, closes around 21:00. They do broth prep at home from 04:00-06:00.', N'Ahlam Ingebrigtsen-Bautista, a 165cm lean angular figure in GLMZ, warm rich medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones, sharp high cheekbones and pointed chin reflecting blended Hispanic/Latin American and Northern European heritage. Dark brown alert eyes. Two tight braids pinned with worn copper rings, thermochromic geneware hair showing deep teal base shifting toward dark auburn. Visible secondhand hearing aid with green indicator light in left ear. Wearing stained food service apron over thermal layers, rolled-up sleeves revealing faded steam burn scars and calloused hands, worn jeans with reinforced knees, steel-toed boots, faded grey wide-brimmed thermal hat with patches. Fine scar along left temple. Hands constantly in motion. Standing at food cart in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, warm amber cart lighting against cool evening haze, steam rising from burners, purposeful and quick-moving, practical and worn but maintained. Neo-noir street food vendor aesthetic, gritty and hardworking. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Genetic blend of Hispanic/Latin American (50.7%), Northern European (42.7%), and Sub-Saharan African (6.6%) ancestry. This combination creates warm, rich medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones, sharp facial architecture with defined cheekbones, and an overall warm complexion that bridges the genetic contributions seamlessly', 165, 58, N'Angular and economical — lean muscle distributed across a frame made of sharp planes. Elbows and collarbones prominent. No wasted mass; built for twelve-hour days on feet', N'Thermochromic geneware — deep teal in temperatures below 12°C, dark auburn in warmth above 18°C. Natural base is dark brown, visible at roots near scalp', N'Two tight braids, each pinned with worn copper rings. Usually tucked into a wide-brimmed thermal hat during cart operations', N'Long (shoulder-length when unbraided, though rarely seen that way)', N'Dark brown, alert and quick-moving', N'Warm rich medium brown with golden and olive undertones, reflecting the warmth of Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (50.7%) with the lighter complexion influence of Northern European heritage (42.7%), and depth added by Sub-Saharan African contribution (6.6%)', N'Sharp-featured with high, defined cheekbones and pointed chin. Warm undertones throughout with the slightly fuller lower face and fuller lip structure reflecting Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, balanced by the angular Northern European bone structure. Expression frequently animated during speech. Hands calloused from years of cart work and constant motion. Minor steam burns on inner forearms, faded to pale scars', N'Secondhand hearing aid visible in the left ear — silver-grey with faint green indicator light, sits slightly outside the ear canal. Temperature-reactive hair is the primary visible modification, shifting between auburn and teal depending on ambient temperature. No chrome or subdermal augmentations visible', N'Rarely still. Moves in quick, efficient gestures — hands constantly in motion whether stirring, gesturing while speaking, or reorganizing cart elements. Leans forward slightly when engaging with customers or children. Stands with weight favoring one leg while cooking, shifting periodically. Walks with purpose and speed', N'Tier 4 working-class practical wear. Standard-issue food service apron (grease-stained, many pockets) worn over layers. Long-sleeved thermal undershirt for warmth during morning shifts, rolled up during afternoon. Worn jeans with cargo pockets and reinforced knees. Steel-toed boots (required for cart work, old but maintained). Wide-brimmed thermal hat, synthetic material, faded grey with visible wear and patched seams — described as having ''achieved structural sentience.'' No jewelry except the copper rings in their braids. Jacket varies by season — synthetic thermal in winter, lightweight cotton blend in summer. Everything functional, nothing decorative', N'One of the regular children — a seven-year-old named Joris — has a home situation Pilar is fairly certain crosses into abuse. They have been watching and documenting for four months, building certainty before they act. They are terrified of acting wrong and making it worse. They are also terrified of not acting.', N'Warm and practical, mixes Meridian creole with Amazigh-inflected pet phrases mostly used with children and a flat, precise register they use when dealing with adults they don''t fully trust. Food metaphors, always.', N'Fast when busy — cart rhythm — slower and more deliberate when the children are around. Patient repetition without condescension.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ahlam_ingebrigtsen_bautista');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a697-7e8f-ad64-ddacfda26e1c', N'Habiba Krstić', N'Habiba', N'', N'Krstić', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, Copperhead, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Fortune seller — reads data-flows, interprets E.L.F. signs, sells probability maps and augury', N'Independent; deeply embedded in Copperhead community, respected by the Burnished Market vendors collectively', N'Habiba Krstić is small and deliberate, her dark skin deeply lined in the way that reads as history rather than decay. She moves with a slight forward lean as though perpetually walking into a wind only she can feel. Her hair is cropped close and entirely white; she wears it plain, no ornament, as a kind of statement. Her eyes are her most arresting feature — she had them done forty years ago in a style that was fashionable then and is now rare: irises that display slow-moving data-patterns, pale gold on deep brown, like watching a tide chart in real time. She says they help her see what other people miss. Whether this is true or marketing, her clients believe it.

Her stall is small and immaculate: a cloth-covered table, three chairs, a rack of printed probability maps she draws by hand on recycled thermal paper, and a terminal she uses to pull E.L.F. behavioral data and translate it into augury. She has been doing this for thirty-one years and has outlasted every gang, every rezoning, every purge of unlicensed vendors that has swept through Copperhead. She is not a fraud — she is an information processor who has built a framework her clients can understand. She is also, genuinely, a believer. She experiences the E.L.F.s as presences, as personalities, as beings with opinions about human choices. This has not been disproven to her satisfaction.', N'Information source wrapped in augury — she can deliver plot-relevant information through the lens of a fortune reading. Quest giver for community matters. Moral compass character who asks the right uncomfortable questions.', N'', N'Data-pattern irises — forty-year-old cosmetic implant, now vintage, displaying slow tide-chart patterns in gold. Slight skeletal reinforcement in hands and wrists from a medical clinic, purely functional, for arthritis management.', N'She opens her stall at noon — mornings are for meditation and for reviewing overnight E.L.F. behavioral data from the market''s ambient sensors, which she has subscribed to for a decade. She takes appointments and walk-ins until early evening, then closes and walks a fixed circuit of the Burnished Market, leaving data-offerings at seven E.L.F. shrines.', N'Habiba Krstić, 157cm tall, slight compact frame, white cropped hair close to scalp, warm medium-brown skin with golden olive undertones, deeply lined face mapping decades of lived experience, heavy creases around eyes and mouth, age spots on temples and cheekbones. Slavic cheekbones softened by Sub-Saharan and Latin fullness, straight refined nose, expressive mouth. Deep brown eyes with embedded golden data-pattern displays shifting like financial charts, creating slow-moving luminescent patterns. Fine laugh lines radiating from eye corners, nearly invisible surgical scar along left jawline, liver spots on hands and forearms. Visible skeletal reinforcement: metallic sheen at knuckle joints, lattice pattern visible beneath skin at wrists. Wearing long dark indigo linen jacket over cream long-sleeved shirt, neutral loose trousers, worn soft leather slip-ons, single silver bracelet on left wrist, worn canvas bag. Posture: slight forward lean, very still when seated, direct unwavering gaze, soft voice quality. GLMZ, GLMZ setting, cool neon-tinged indoor lighting, moody introspective atmosphere, aged data broker aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Eastern European (34.4%), Hispanic/Latin American (21.3%), Northern European (16.9%), Central Asian (16.8%), Sub-Saharan African (6.6%), South Asian (4.0%) — a deeply layered genetic tapestry creating warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden and olive undertones, fine facial features reflecting Slavic structure tempered by softer Latin and Central Asian proportions, with gentle Sub-Saharan fullness and South Asian refinement', 157, 52, N'Slight and compact, with the wiry resilience of someone who has moved through the world economically for decades. Minimal body fat; her frame reads as deliberate rather than frail.', N'White', N'Cropped close to the scalp in an even, austere cut', N'Short', N'Deep brown iris with embedded gold data-pattern displays that shift slowly like tide charts or stock graphs', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and subtle olive undertones, luminous and weathered with the patina of lived decades — a complex blend of Eastern European and Central Asian cooler notes warmed by Hispanic and Sub-Saharan depth', N'Densely lined face that maps lived experience — heavy creases around the eyes and mouth, age spots on the temples and cheekbones, skin texture papery but alive. Features show ancestral synthesis: Slavic-influenced cheekbones softened by Sub-Saharan and Latin fullness, straight nose with slight Central Asian and South Asian refinement, expressive mouth shaped by Eastern European and Hispanic lineage. Always clean, never painted. Expression carries a kind of perpetual, gentle attention.', N'Data-pattern irises are the primary visible augmentation — distinctive vintage-style implants, forty years old, displaying slow-moving golden luminescent patterns against deep brown. The patterns shift at roughly one-second intervals, resembling financial charts or tidal data. Skeletal reinforcement in hands and wrists is subtle but visible upon close inspection: slight metallic sheen to the knuckle joints and a faint lattice pattern visible beneath translucent skin at the wrists, particularly on the left side.', N'She moves with a slight forward lean, as though walking perpetually into wind. Her gait is deliberate and unhurried. When seated, she is very still, hands folded on the table in front of her. She makes direct eye contact and rarely blinks. Her voice is soft and requires listeners to lean in slightly.', N'Practical, worn, Tier 4 — she dresses for function and durability, not status. Typically wears a long dark linen jacket (indigo or charcoal) over a plain cream or gray long-sleeved shirt, loose-fitting trousers in neutral tones, and soft leather slip-on shoes worn to a comfortable shape. She owns several identical jackets and rotates them; they are always immaculate. No jewelry except a single thin silver bracelet on her left wrist, possibly meaningful, possibly just old habit. A cloth bag, worn canvas, always with her.', N'Fifteen years ago she gave a reading to a young man from Old Harbor that she now believes she got badly wrong — she told him his path was clear when it wasn''t, and he made a catastrophic decision and lost everything. She never saw him again. She has not made a reading since without checking three times. She has never told anyone why she checks three times.', N'Formal, considered. Uses archaic constructions occasionally — ''it comes to pass,'' ''in the turning of things.'' Quotes E.L.F. behavioral patterns the way others quote scripture. Slips into Ukrainian diminutives when emotionally moved.', N'Slow and weighted. Never rushes. Silence is comfortable for her; she will sit with it until the other person fills it, which tells her things.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'habiba_krsti');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a617-70a6-8a78-ddd3f440a720', N'Camila Kettani', N'Camila', N'', N'Kettani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Norwood Quiet — the second floor of a converted pre-Meridian row house they have lived in for thirty-one years, near North Ave and Damen', N'Retired secondary school teacher, former union leader', N'Retired, former Norwood Quiet Teachers'' Union chapter leader; Community Education Collective (volunteer); informal mentor network', N'Camila Kettani is precisely the kind of person who looks exactly like what they are: a teacher. They are medium height and softly built, with warm brown skin, a crown of silver locs wound up in a complicated knot, and reading glasses that are always either on their face or lost somewhere on their body. Their geneware is minimal but characteristic — color-shifting irises that cycle through blues and greens as a cosmetic choice they made at forty and never bothered to reverse, and a small bioluminescent tattoo across their left collarbone in a geometric Ghanaian kente pattern that pulses faintly when they''re excited about an idea. They dress in comfortable, slightly chaotic layers, always with at least one pocket overflowing with something — a physical book, printed lecture notes from years ago, data chips, sweets for the neighborhood children.

For thirty-two years Camila Kettani taught history and civic literacy at a community school in Norwood Quiet, the last twelve as a union chapter leader fighting against Tessera Corporation''s creeping acquisition of the public school data infrastructure. They lost most of those fights. They won a few. They retired with a modest Tessera-adjacent pension and a comprehensive knowledge of exactly how institutional power erodes communities from the inside, which they now use freely and without corporate constraint. They have strong opinions delivered with a professor''s patience — they will give you time to be wrong before correcting you, but they will correct you.', N'Exposition resource for history and institutional knowledge; political catalyst in community storylines; mentor figure; represents organized resistance within civilian structures; source of union and labor history', N'', N'Color-shifting cosmetic irises (geneware); bioluminescent kente-pattern tattoo, left collarbone (geneware, cosmetic); standard sensory enhancement for classroom acoustics that they keep forgetting they have', N'Mornings spent writing — they are working on a comprehensive history of the Corporate Wars from civilian source material, which they are not sure anyone will publish but are writing anyway. Afternoons volunteering at the Community Education Collective, running a civic literacy workshop for adults. Three evenings a week they host what they call a reading group and what everyone else calls a political meeting.', N'Camila Kettani, 168cm woman with warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, silver-gray locs gathered in topknot with wooden pins, expressive face lined with decades of teaching and laugh lines, color-shifting blue-green cosmetic irises glowing faintly, bioluminescent kente-pattern geometric tattoo pulsing faintly on left collarbone in blues and golds, soft rounded build from decades of sedentary work, wearing layered earth-tone linen overshirt and worn canvas shoes, standing with weight forward gesturing while speaking, professorial attention, reading glasses hanging from fabric cord around neck, union pin on chest, surrounded by books and worn fabric bookmarks, GLMZ 2226 near-future megacity setting, warm indoor library lighting catching the bioluminescence, detailed face showing weathered warmth and North African-South Asian-Hispanic-East Asian heritage blend, organized chaos aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Norwood Quiet', N'local', N'Norwood Quiet', N'North African (30.8%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (28.9%), South Asian (17.4%), East Asian (14.1%), Middle Eastern (5.6%), and Sub-Saharan African (3.2%) ancestry; complex multiethnic blend creating warm medium-to-deep brown tones with golden and subtle reddish undertones', 168, 72, N'Softly built, compact and rounded through the torso from decades of sedentary work; gentle posture without slouch; arms and legs retain subtle muscle tone beneath comfortable padding', N'Silver-gray', N'Locs wound into a complicated topknot, typically secured with worn fabric wraps or wooden pins; flyaways common', N'Long (locs reach mid-back when unbound)', N'Color-shifting cosmetic irises cycling through blue-green spectrum', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden undertones; weathered and well-maintained, reflecting the combined influence of North African, Hispanic/Latin American, South Asian, East Asian, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African heritage creating rich complexity', N'Open, expressive face lined with decades of teaching—laugh lines around eyes and mouth prominent; warm golden-brown skin showing sun exposure around cheekbones and forehead; facial structure reflects balanced North African and South Asian ancestry (defined cheekbones, strong brow) with softening influence and subtle broadening from East Asian and Hispanic/Latin American heritage; sparse silver facial hair; minimal makeup; reading glasses frequently perched on crown or hanging from fabric cord around neck', N'Color-shifting iris geneware immediately noticeable under direct light; bioluminescent collarbone tattoo visible in low light or when excited. Subcutaneous acoustic enhancement not visible. No obvious prosthetics or external chrome.', N'Stands with weight slightly forward, hands frequently gesturing while speaking; walks with deliberate pace, rarely rushed; tendency to tilt head while listening—professorial attention. Settles into chairs fully, taking up comfortable space. Movements efficient rather than elegant; no wasted motion.', N'Comfortable, layered Tier 3-4 casual: worn cotton cardigans or linen overshirts in earth tones, practical trousers with visible pockets stuffed with books/chips/sweets, worn canvas shoes. Fabrics show age but remain clean and carefully maintained. Personal accessories include old fabric bookmarks, reading glasses on cords, and a faded union pin from the 2210s. Overall effect: organized chaos of someone who has stopped performing for institutions.', N'During the Tessera negotiations of 2188, they accepted a one-time payment from a Tessera community liaison in exchange for softening a union position on data privacy. It was Φ3,000 — barely anything. They told themselves it was a tactical retreat. They have never forgiven themselves and have never told anyone.', N'Educated and precise but deliberately accessible — they have spent decades translating complex ideas and the habit is permanent; occasional Serbian-Romanian verbal constructions from family idiom; quotes historical sources with automatic citation', N'Measured and unhurried, with a teacher''s habit of letting a question sit in the air before answering it', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'camila_kettani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a679-7dcb-ab5d-ddf72108fbcf', N'Bhavesh Madrigal', N'Bhavesh', N'', N'Madrigal', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Blackpipe Corridor, in a sealed maintenance shaft she has converted into a dwelling, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Q-zero ghost; former Tessera data entry clerk living off-grid', N'None. Deliberately isolated.', N'Bhavesh Madrigal is medium height with a wiry build that speaks to irregular meals rather than any deliberate fitness. Her skin is deep brown with a faint natural bioluminescence around her temples and collarbones — a geneware modification she had done six years ago when she still had a salary and a Tessera ID number, and which she now cannot afford to have removed even though it makes hiding harder. Her hair is cut extremely short on one side and grown out on the other, shaved lines running through it in patterns she does geometric maintenance on herself. Her eyes are dark and move constantly, cataloguing exits.

She was not expelled or displaced in any dramatic way. She simply stopped. Stopped showing up to her data entry station at Tessera''s Gage Circuit processing annex. Stopped responding to her apartment''s network. Stopped using her Φ account. After ninety days of non-contact, Tessera''s automated systems flagged her as a desertion case, repossessed her housing unit, and suspended her ID pending investigation. She has been Q-zero — no verified digital footprint, no legal existence — for four years. She lives on barter, scavenged food, and the occasional cash-in-hand job sorting salvage at the Blackpipe underground markets. She will not tell anyone why she left, and she has become so practiced at evasion that even people who like her don''t know much about her.', N'Local color and possible contact for anyone operating in Blackpipe; has extensive knowledge of the Corridor''s unofficial economy; her Q-zero status makes her invisible to systems that track people — useful and dangerous', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin around temples and collarbones (cosmetic geneware, cannot be easily hidden, deeply regretted). No other mods.', N'Emerges from her maintenance shaft dwelling after dark, trades labor for food at the Blackpipe underground market, occasionally sells scavenged electronics components to a fence she trusts. Spends daylight hours in her dwelling, reading physical books she acquires through trade, and maintaining meticulous handwritten records of the Corridor''s daily rhythms.', N'Bhavesh Madrigal, GLMZ, portrait of a lean 165cm figure with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, angular cheekbones and sharp jawline reflecting global ancestry blend, dark nearly-black eyes alert and predatory, asymmetrical black undercut with geometric patterns (buzzed right, longer left), positioned with tactical awareness near an exit, dark circles under eyes suggesting irregular sleep, faint blue-green bioluminescent glow visible around temples and collarbones in dim lighting, thin horizontal scar on inner left wrist visible, wearing salvaged faded synthetic jacket over dark layers, reinforced cargo pants, worn tactical boots, posture tense and economical, neo-noir off-grid scavenger aesthetic, moody neon-adjacent lighting with shadows emphasizing the bioluminescent marks, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, dystopian but intentional grooming, close framing on face and upper torso --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Blackpipe Corridor', N'local', N'Blackpipe Corridor', N'Complex multi-continental blend: Hispanic/Latin American (37.8%), Sub-Saharan African (28.7%), Southeast Asian (15.9%), Eastern European (13.5%), and Indigenous American (4.1%). This genetic combination manifests as striking angular facial architecture with prominent high cheekbones, warm deep brown skin enriched with golden undertones, and a sharp defined jawline. The ancestry creates a unique phenotype—the warm undertones reflect the Latin American and African heritage, while the angular bone structure draws from the Southeast Asian and Eastern European lineages, all unified in a distinctly contemporary global appearance.', 165, 52, N'Wiry and lean, defined by scarcity rather than athleticism. Shoulders slightly forward from years hunched over data terminals. Visible rib definition; minimal body fat. Movement efficient and economical.', N'Natural black with self-maintained geometric shave patterns', N'Asymmetrical undercut; short and buzzed on right side with precision-cut geometric lines, longer on left side (approximately 8cm), maintained with deliberate angular patterns', N'Short on one side, Medium on the other', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Deep warm brown with rich golden undertones, reflecting the blended Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, Southeast Asian, Eastern European, and Indigenous American heritage. Complexion carries subtle warm luminosity beneath the primary deep brown.', N'Angular facial structure with prominent high cheekbones, sharp defined jaw, warm golden undertones throughout. Skin appears weathered but clean—maintained despite off-grid living. Dark circles under eyes from irregular sleep. Minor scarring on left temple from old trauma.', N'Bioluminescent skin modification around temples and collarbones glows faintly in low light—a cosmetic geneware that creates a soft blue-green luminescence. No mechanical augmentations visible. The glow is inescapable and deeply regretted; it functions as an involuntary tell in darkness.', N'Moves with careful deliberation, economical and quiet. Habitually positions herself with sight lines to exits. Shoulders slightly tensed. Eyes in constant motion—cataloguing, assessing, measuring distance. When still, her stillness is absolute and predatory. Rarely makes unnecessary gestures.', N'Tier 5 / off-grid scavenger aesthetic. Layered in salvaged and traded pieces: a faded synthetic jacket with mismatched pockets (likely Tessera-era workwear, heavily worn), dark neutral base layers to minimize visibility, reinforced cargo pants with multiple hidden pockets for tools or barter items. Worn boots with good grip. No logos or identifiable markers. Fabrics are durable synthetics and reclaimed naturals—nothing new or branded. Everything functional. Nothing that draws attention.', N'She did not simply quit Tessera. She discovered that the data she was entering was mortality records being systematically falsified — workers in a Tessera fabrication plant were dying at rates being reported as a fraction of reality. She copied nothing, told no one, and ran because she was certain she had been seen seeing it. She does not know if she was actually in danger or if four years of her life have been built on a moment of paranoia.', N'Dry, precise, slightly formal — corporate speech patterns she was trained into and cannot fully shed. Occasional dark humor.', N'Measured at first, speeds up when comfortable or nervous.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bhavesh_madrigal');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f2-7fc3-8bfa-de1e97ba49b3', N'Araceli Dlamini-Touré', N'Araceli', N'', N'Dlamini-Touré', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 30, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Geartown — industrial district of chop shops and fabricators, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Remote drone and vehicle operations specialist — rigger', N'Independent — known in Old Harbor circles', N'Araceli Dlamini-Touré is wiry and quick-moving, with the restless energy of someone who converts anxiety into velocity. At 30, her face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and she has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct ne — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left her with skills and night terrors in equal measure. She works as a rigger out of Geartown, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Araceli Dlamini-Touré describe her as a precision instrument — point her at a problem and get out of the way.', N'As a rigger, Tenzin Vargas-Baffour embodies the tension between independence and isolation. She is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access. Geneware muscle density treatment — looks natural, hits like chrome', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Araceli Dlamini-Touré, a neo-noir field operative in 2226 GLMZ, portrait in neon-lit urban environment. Deep warm brown skin with golden luminosity, sharp South Asian cheekbones combined with broad African facial structure. Dark brown alert eyes. Long black braided hair pulled back, revealing pale surgical scar at base of skull from neural interface jack. Wiry 168cm frame with geneware-enhanced muscle definition visible in corded forearms. Wearing modular armored tactical vest over grey fitted shirt, reinforced cargo pants, steel-toed boots. Chrome neural port with faint LED at skull base visible. Stress lines around eyes, weathered skin, old surgical and burn scars. Restless hands near gear. Controlled, efficient posture. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, cool blue and neon pink lighting, industrial background with data streams, cinematic depth --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Sub-Saharan African (43.4%), Northern European (31.3%), and South Asian (25.3%) blend — deep warm brown skin with golden undertones from dominant African ancestry, refined by sharp South Asian cheekbones and Northern European facial openness. The genetic combination creates a striking, cosmopolitan phenotype: rich melanin base with natural luminosity, angular bone structure reflecting the South Asian component, and broad facial width from Northern European heritage. Authentically multi-continental with harmonious feature integration.', 168, 58, N'Wiry and economical, all fast-twitch muscle with minimal body fat. Shoulders slightly narrow but defined from functional training. No wasted mass — every kilogram serves a purpose.', N'Black with natural dark brown undertones', N'Pulled back in a tight braid, practical and unadorned. Occasionally worn loose, but always off her neck for work.', N'Long (shoulder-blade length)', N'Dark brown, alert and reactive', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones — rich melanin foundation from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, naturally luminous and radiant year-round. Warmth is intrinsic to the complexion rather than sun-dependent, creating consistent, glowing depth.', N'Prominent angular cheekbones and defined jawline blending South Asian sharpness with African facial structure fullness. High, wide cheekbones characteristic of sub-Saharan ancestry combined with the refined bone geometry of South Asian heritage. Open facial structure reflecting Northern European ancestry. Bone structure is striking and symmetrical. Minimal grooming beyond function — no makeup, no jewelry. Small stress lines around eyes from chronic sleep deficit. Skin weathered from sun exposure and close work. Strong multi-continental architecture.', N'Chrome neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, visible as a sleek metallic port with faint LED indicator ring. No obvious limb replacement, but geneware muscle density treatment makes her look deceptively stronger than her frame suggests — corded forearms and defined calves reveal the biomod.', N'Moves with controlled efficiency, no wasted motion. Sits slightly forward, always aware of exits and sightlines. Hands are restless when stationary — fidgets with tools, cables, or interface hardware. When focused on a task, becomes almost unnervingly still. Walks fast, bounces slightly on the balls of her feet.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional. Armored tactical vest over a fitted black or grey undershirt — visibly modular with quick-release panels. Reinforced cargo pants with tool loops and data-port pockets. Steel-toed boots, worn but maintained. A lightweight overjacket with internal pockets for gear. No visible branding — everything is functional, replaceable, and built for field work. Minor telltale signs of poverty: clothes are well-cared-for but mended, layered for insulation rather than style.', N'', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'araceli_dlamini_tour');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a678-72e5-8bdc-df10b8d554a1', N'Ernestina Kjellberg-Phongsavath', N'Ernestina', N'', N'Kjellberg-Phongsavath', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 54, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Pilsen Veil, operating across Mexicantown Libre and Lakeview Neon, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Holographic street muralist and unlicensed public art provocateur', N'Independent; loose association with Mexicantown Libre arts council; has a complicated and ongoing relationship with a Ringo Corp street-marketing division that he publicly despises and occasionally accepts commissions from', N'Ernestina Kjellberg-Phongsavath is a broad-shouldered man going soft at the middle, with dark skin mapped by fifty years of lake wind and workshop dust. His beard is full and shot through with silver he has dyed in rotating chromatic bands — currently a deep violet fading to copper — a vanity he accepts without embarrassment. He moves with the deliberate economy of someone who has been on his feet for three decades and has stopped pretending urgency. His hands are enormous and scarred across the knuckles from old hardware accidents, and he keeps them in constant motion even when he''s sitting still.

He projects illegal holo-murals onto corporate architecture using a rig of his own design: a backpack-mounted emitter disguised as an air filtration unit. The murals last twenty minutes before building defense systems scrub them — sometimes longer in Pilsen Veil where the buildings remember him fondly, or so he says. He talks constantly and with tremendous warmth, the kind of person who makes strangers feel immediately known and slightly exposed. He has been arrested fourteen times and considers this a reasonable professional overhead.', N'Information broker of the informal economy — he has been everywhere at 3 AM for thirty years and notices everything. Natural quest giver for anything involving public space, corporate territory, or community memory. Knows everyone.', N'', N'Color-shifting beard dye (geneware cosmetic treatment, semi-permanent); projection targeting overlay in left eye (basic cyberware); old burn scar on right forearm from early rig accident, deliberately unrepaired', N'Spends mornings at a tea stall in Pilsen Veil arguing with friends and reading old physical newspapers he collects. Afternoons are for prep and equipment maintenance. He projects between 2 and 4 AM when patrol cycles have gaps he''s spent years mapping.', N'Ernestina Kjellberg-Phongsavath, tall broad-shouldered man with deep mahogany-brown skin and golden-bronze undertones, Southeast Asian cheekbones with African heritage fullness in lips and nose width. Close-cropped black hair with natural gray, long beard dyed in rotating bands of violet fading to copper. Dark brown eyes with subtle cybernetic targeting reticle visible in left eye. Heavily lined face from decades of laughter and outdoor work, mottled burn scar across right forearm, white scars across knuckles. Wearing layered utilitarian GLMZ fashion: worn canvas work pants, thermal base layers, oversized muted earth-tone linen overshirt, long synthetic leather coat weathered and carefully maintained, scuffed but oiled work boots. Silver hand-made ring. Standing in Great Lakes workshop interior with neon glow, cool blue and amber lighting catching the cybernetic eye enhancement. Economical posture, hands in subtle motion, unselfconscious confidence. Anti-corpo aesthetic. Cinematic, photorealistic GLMZ 2200s --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Pilsen Veil', N'local', N'Pilsen Veil', N'Southeast Asian dominant (53.4%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African heritage (27.3%), Indigenous American (13.5%), and Hispanic/Latin American (5.8%) ancestry. This genetic constellation manifests in warm, deeply pigmented skin with complex undertones—the rich mahogany-brown base from blended African and Southeast Asian ancestry, layered with golden-bronze warmth and subtle olive cast. Facial structure reflects the full ancestry: Southeast Asian cheekbone prominence and eye shape, African heritage in nose width and lip fullness, Indigenous American and Hispanic undertones in overall bone structure and complexion depth.', 183, 92, N'Broad-shouldered and barrel-chested, softening through the middle with age but still carrying the frame of someone who''s spent decades on his feet. Forearms remain ropey with muscle memory.', N'Black with natural gray throughout', N'Full, well-maintained beard worn long and styled with deliberate care', N'Medium (beard); head hair kept close to scalp', N'Dark brown; left eye has a subtle luminescent targeting reticle visible when ambient light hits it at certain angles', N'Deep warm mahogany-brown with golden-bronze undertones and subtle olive cast, sun-darkened from decades of outdoor work, reflecting the layered warmth of Southeast Asian, African, Indigenous American, and Hispanic ancestry blended into rich, complex pigmentation', N'Heavily lined face—creases around eyes and mouth from constant talking and laughter. Skin texture roughened by workshop dust and lake wind exposure. Facial structure shows Southeast Asian cheekbone definition balanced with African heritage width in nose and lip fullness, with Indigenous American and Hispanic ancestry contributing to overall bone prominence. Grooming is meticulous despite worn appearance; beard is regularly conditioned.', N'Left eye projection targeting overlay appears as faint geometric patterns visible only when light catches the eye at certain angles. Backpack-mounted holo-emitter disguised as an air filtration unit when carrying his rig. Otherwise augmentations are minimal and mostly invisible to casual observation.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical grace born of three decades on his feet—no wasted motion, but never rushed. Hands are in constant subtle motion even when seated, gesturing while speaking, fidgeting with small objects. Head tilts forward slightly when listening intently. Carries himself with the unselfconscious confidence of someone long comfortable in his own skin.', N'Tier 3-4 functional with deliberate artistic flair. Favors layered, weathered utilitarian pieces: worn canvas work pants, thermal base layers visible at collar and wrists, oversized linen or hemp overshirts in muted earth tones. Often wears a long coat of synthetic leather that''s seen better days but is carefully maintained. Work boots that are scuffed but well-oiled. Jewelry is minimal but intentional—a silver ring on one hand, possibly hand-made. No visible corporate branding; aesthetic is deliberately anti-corpo while remaining accessible to working-class spaces he frequents.', N'He has a standing verbal agreement with a mid-level Ringo Corp brand manager: Ringo lets him know patrol rotation schedules in exchange for occasionally projecting murals that contain, subtly, Ringo color palettes. He tells himself it''s subversion from within. His collective would call it collaboration.', N'Rich and discursive; code-switches between English, Igbo phrases, and Samoan words his grandmother used; fond of historical references nobody can verify', N'Fast and flowing with sudden full stops when something matters to him', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ernestina_kjellberg_phongsavath');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c7-76a8-b150-df2251bcb4b3', N'Dariush Balasanyan', N'Dariush', N'', N'Balasanyan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Thornholt Stack, Calumet Rise — lives in the basement super''s unit, works the whole building, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Building superintendent, manages a mid-tier residential stack in Calumet Rise', N'Employed by Calumet Property Holdings (a Tessera subsidiary), de facto independent — the corporation is essentially absent from day-to-day operations and Bogdan has been running the stack on instinct and goodwill for eleven years', N'Dariush Balasanyan is enormous in a way that reads as geological — broad across the chest and shoulders, thick-necked, with hands that look like they were designed to grip pipe wrenches, which in a sense they were. He has Ghanaian-Romanian-Samoan heritage and the combination has produced a man of striking physical presence: dark skin, heavy brow, a jaw that could anchor a tram line. He keeps a neat goatee that has been half-gray for a decade. His retractable claw mod on both hands was originally cosmetic, done cheap in Geartown at thirty, but he''s found them genuinely useful for gripping pipe joints in tight spaces. One eye is a low-grade optical implant — the original was lost to a pressurized pipe failure when he was thirty-two — and it has a faint amber ring around the iris that glows in low light, a cosmetic flourish the replacement surgeon added without asking.

Dariush Balasanyan is the Thornholt Stack. He knows every tenant, every fault line in the building''s aging infrastructure, every grudge between neighbors on every floor. He communicates primarily through action — if you tell him something is wrong, he will go fix it, and that is his love language. He is gruff in a way that people mistake for unfriendliness until they realize he treats everyone exactly the same: no small talk, straight information, but if you are in genuine trouble he will materialize at your door at any hour with tools and a thermos of coffee and no questions about why you called.', N'Building superintendent as information broker and access point. Controls physical access to the building — maintenance tunnels, utility access hatches, old service corridors. Knows which tenants are in trouble, which are absent too long, which are receiving unusual visitors. Can provide shelter, tools, and local knowledge. Also functions as a moral anchor — someone who doesn''t run, doesn''t take sides in the city''s power games, just keeps the lights on.', N'', N'Retractable claw mod, bilateral hands (basic cosmetic model, now used professionally). Low-grade optical implant, left eye (amber iris ring, replacement after pipe injury). Skeletal reinforcement — shoulder and lower back, Helix medical grade, post-injury at 38.', N'0600 rounds — checks utilities, flags overnight issues left in the building''s log. Reactive work until noon. Lunch in his unit, eaten fast. Afternoon is repairs, tenant disputes, and the eternal war against the building''s antique greywater recycler. He''s on-call twenty-four hours, which he accepted as a condition of the subsidized unit and has never stopped resenting.', N'Dariush Balasanyan, 193cm massive frame, golden-olive warm deep brown skin with Middle Eastern heritage features — strong brow ridge, defined jaw projection, broad refined nasal bridge, deep-set dark eyes. Left eye glows amber optical implant with luminescent ring. Black hair salt-grayed at temples, short cropped sides. Neat half-gray goatee. Industrial scarring: faded chemical burn on left neck, hairline scar on temple, worn palms. Retractable steel claw augmentations visible as metallic seams on knuckles. Wearing charcoal gray insulated tech-weave coveralls open at chest, black undershirt, dark blue insulated polymer jacket, heavy-duty work boots, canvas tool belt with brass buckles. Utilitarian Helix maintenance timer watch. Standing with forward lean, weight on balls of feet, spare efficient posture. Serious focused expression. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone industrial worker, harsh neon and fluorescent workshop lighting casting shadows across scarred face and augmented hands. Moody, determined, weathered. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Thornholt Stack', N'local', N'The Thornholt Stack', N'Predominantly Middle Eastern (81.2%) with significant South Asian (7.2%), Northern European (4.2%), East Asian (3.8%), and Hispanic/Latin American (3.6%) ancestry. The genetic mix produces a phenotype grounded in Middle Eastern features — strong brow ridge, defined jaw structure with characteristic projection, broad nasal base with refined bridge — subtly enriched by South Asian warmth to complexion and bone structure, with minor Northern European cool undertones and East Asian eye shape contributions.', 193, 127, N'Geological. Massive across the chest and shoulders with a thick neck and heavy frame that reads as both muscular and dense — the build of a man who has spent twenty-five years moving pipe, hauling equipment, and carrying the weight of a failing building on his shoulders. Not soft, not lean. Solid.', N'Black with salt-gray at the temples and throughout', N'Short, close-cropped on the sides, slightly longer on top. Neat. Maintained without vanity.', N'Short', N'Left eye: amber optical implant with faint luminescent iris ring. Right eye: dark brown, natural.', N'Warm golden-olive deep brown reflecting the dominant Middle Eastern ancestry layered with South Asian warmth and subtle Northern European cool undertones. The resulting tone is a sophisticated warm brown with undertonal complexity that reads as fundamentally Middle Eastern with South Asian enrichment.', N'Strong Middle Eastern features: prominent brow ridge, defined jaw structure with characteristic forward projection, broad nasal base with refined bridge. Subtle South Asian contribution to cheekbone prominence and facial fullness. The skin shows sun exposure and chemical burns from pipe work — small scars on the cheekbones and forehead, mostly faded. A neat goatee, half-gray, kept trimmed to a precise point. His face reads as perpetually serious, not from anger but from focus. Deep-set eyes. No softness in the expression.', N'Retractable claw modifications on both hands — polished steel tips that rest flush against the knuckles when retracted, visible as faint metallic seams. The claws extend with a soft mechanical whisper, roughly 4 inches long, dull-edged and functional rather than aesthetic. Left eye: the amber iris ring visible even in daylight, more pronounced in low light where it emits a faint glow. No external signs of skeletal reinforcement — the shoulder and lower-back plating is subcutaneous, invisible beneath his clothing.', N'He moves with the economy of someone who has long ago stopped wasting motion. Walks as though bearing weight even when empty-handed — a slight forward lean from the spine work. His gestures are spare and purposeful; he doesn''t use his hands to talk. When he reaches for something, the movement is direct and efficient. He stands with his weight slightly forward on the balls of his feet, ready to pivot toward whatever problem is next. His presence is large and still — he doesn''t fill a room by being loud; he fills it by occupying space.', N'Tier 3-4 working-class utilitarian. Insulated tech-weave coveralls in charcoal gray, worn open at the chest most of the time to reveal a basic black synthetic undershirt. The coveralls have multiple pockets, most of them stained with pipe compound, grease, mineral deposits. A canvas tool belt with vintage brass buckles — not fashionable, just functional and maintained. Work boots, heavy-duty synthetic leather, scuffed and re-sealed at the seams multiple times. A jacket made of insulated polymer in dark blue, water-resistant, lined with internal pockets for meters and diagnostics. No chrome, no fashion statements. Everything he wears is chosen for durability and function. His watch is utilitarian — a Helix-brand maintenance timer with a dim LED readout, not expensive but reliable.', N'The Thornholt Stack''s structural load certificates are three years overdue for renewal, and the most recent informal inspection found stress fractures in the third substructure pier. Bogdan has been quietly reinforcing what he can with materials he shouldn''t have access to and hoping it holds until he can find someone to officially address it without triggering a Tessera-initiated evacuation order that would scatter his tenants permanently.', N'Minimal. Technical when discussing the building. Personal statements are usually short declaratives.', N'Slow, low, each word given weight. Pauses like load-bearing walls.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dariush_balasanyan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a669-7ee8-8bb4-df5cf49d0892', N'Eckhard Quartey-Prempeh', N'Eckhard', N'', N'Quartey-Prempeh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, Ironhaven, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Street pharmacist and herbal supplement vendor', N'Independent; informal dues-payer to the Oxidian Market Vendors Guild', N'Eckhard Quartey-Prempeh is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin, thick silver-streaked locs piled high in a wrap of orange and violet fabric, and bioluminescent nodes implanted along her collarbone that pulse faint teal when she''s calm and shift toward amber when irritated — a mod she got thirty years ago and never bothered to update. Her hands are permanently stained at the knuckle from decades of grinding pigments and compounding analgesics, and she keeps them immaculately clean otherwise. Her stall is a riot of hanging dried root bundles, labeled vials in hand-scratched script, and a small shrine to the E.L.F. of the Alban Souk''s ancient refrigeration system, whom she calls Grandmother Cold and leaves offerings of condensation data scraped off cold-chain logs.

She has the unhurried authority of someone who has outlasted every neighboring vendor twice over. She will diagnose your ailment before you finish describing it, recommend something from a hand-labeled tin, and tell you exactly why the Helix Biosystems kiosk down the corridor is going to overcharge you for the same molecule. She is not unkind, but she is not gentle either — she has zero patience for self-pity, charges a sliding scale she decides unilaterally, and occasionally refuses to sell to people she deems ''about to do something stupid with it.''', N'Street-level information source, quest giver for supply chain problems, healer-adjacent NPC, local color and moral compass of the Souk', N'', N'Bioluminescent subdermal nodes (collarbone, cosmetic/emotional indicator); reinforced finger joints (occupational, basic tier); olfactory enhancement implant — her ''nose'' — used to assess compound purity by smell', N'She opens her stall before dawn, brews a fermented sorghum tea she shares with no one, and spends the morning compounding. Afternoons are for customers; evenings for restocking and updating her handwritten formulary ledger.', N'Eckhard Quartey-Prempeh, 172cm tall apothecary master, deep rich umber skin with warm golden undertones, broad-shouldered muscular build, standing motionless in her cluttered compound pharmacy. Face lined with decades of focused work, strong jawline, full lips, subtle Southeast Asian cheekbone definition blending with Sub-Saharan heritage features. Deep brown eyes alert and appraising, half-lidded. Black locs threaded with silver-grey, piled high and wrapped in layered orange and violet cloth. Bioluminescent teal subdermal nodes faintly glowing along collarbones. Ochre and indigo permanent staining at knuckles from pigment work. Wearing faded hand-dyed sage linen chemise under sleeveless canvas apron filled with vial racks, heavy cotton wraps at waist, worn leather sandals. Tarnished brass ring on left index finger. Standing with perfect posture, hands at rest, surrounded by herbal compounds and glass vessels. Warm amber pharmacy lighting with shadows. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, weathered and functional, nothing flashy. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (60.3%) with significant Southeast Asian (30.0%) and Pacific Islander (9.7%) ancestry. This blend manifests in her rich deep brown skin with warm undertones, facial structure showing broad features and strong jawline characteristic of Sub-Saharan heritage, eye shape and cheekbone prominence subtly influenced by Southeast Asian ancestry, and the robust build reflective of Pacific Islander genetics.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial, muscular through the arms and back from decades of grinding and compounding work, thickened through the middle with age but carrying it with zero self-consciousness', N'Natural black with silver-grey threading throughout', N'Thick locs piled high atop her head, wrapped in a layered cloth of orange and violet', N'Long (locs reach mid-back when unbound)', N'Deep brown, alert and appraising', N'Deep rich umber with warm undertones from Sub-Saharan heritage, with subtle golden luminosity from Pacific Islander heritage blend, unmarked by sun damage despite decades outdoors in the Souk', N'Face lined with expression—deep nasolabial folds, crow''s feet that deepen when she smiles (rarely), strong jawline, broad nose with subtle width from Pacific Islander heritage, full lips. Subtle cheekbone prominence and eye shape reflecting Southeast Asian ancestry. Skin is meticulously maintained despite visible wear, with warm undertones throughout.', N'Bioluminescent nodes along collarbone (active, color-shifting). Reinforced finger joints visible as faint metallic striations at knuckles under certain light. Olfactory enhancement implant not visually apparent (subcutaneous, behind left ear).', N'Stands with weight evenly distributed, shoulders back, hands usually at rest or in precise deliberate motion. Moves without wasted energy—no fidgeting, no rushing. When listening to customers describe ailments, she is perfectly still, eyes half-lidded. Occasionally taps one finger on her counter in a rhythm only she hears.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: hand-dyed linen chemise in muted sage or rust, layered under a sleeveless canvas apron with deep pockets filled with vial racks and small tools. Heavy cotton wraps cinched at the waist. Worn leather sandals with reinforced soles. A single piece of jewelry—a tarnished brass ring on her left index finger, worn smooth. Nothing corporate, nothing flashy, everything functional and maintained with care.', N'Her olfactory enhancement was installed by a Helix Biosystems trial twenty-two years ago under an alias. She still receives a small anonymous stipend from them in exchange for quarterly sensory data uploads she has never stopped to question the purpose of.', N'Precise medical terminology mixed with Igbo-inflected Portuguese loan-phrases and blunt street vernacular — she code-switches constantly and unselfconsciously', N'Slow, deliberate, with long pauses before delivering a verdict. Never rushes.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eckhard_quartey_prempeh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e4-7562-97f0-df72c8e930df', N'Anushka Hoang', N'Anushka', N'', N'Hoang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Underground press operator and anti-corporate agitator', N'Salvo Underground Press (self-operated); loose contact network with Mexicantown Libre media collective', N'Anushka Hoang is lean and slightly too tall for the cramped print spaces he works in, with the kind of posture that suggests he''s spent years ducking under doorframes and corporate surveillance arches both. His skin is a warm medium brown, his eyes have aftermarket fractal irises — amber and black geometric spirals he bought secondhand — and he keeps his hair in short twists that he dyes different colors based on which burner identity he''s running that week. He has ink-stained fingers that no amount of solvent fully clears and a laugh that arrives without warning and disappears just as fast. He is charming in the way a distraction is charming — you enjoy it until you realize your attention was supposed to be somewhere else.

Anushka Hoang runs a print-and-signal operation called Salvo out of a basement in the Hamtramck Enclave that produces physical broadsheets, mesh broadcasts, and occasional data-spike packages that end up in corporate employee feeds. He considers himself a journalist in the classical sense and will argue this at length. People who have to clean up after his more ambitious operations might use other words. He is genuinely brave and genuinely reckless and has so far survived the combination through luck, speed, and an extraordinary talent for not being where he said he''d be.', N'Information broker and rumor engine; can surface corporate dirt or community intelligence; creates story hooks through the consequences of his publications; potential liability as a contact due to his heat level.', N'', N'Fractal aftermarket irises. Subdermal data cache in left palm, low-grade model. Cosmetic color-cycling hair follicle treatment.', N'Sleeps irregular hours in the Salvo basement or at rotating safe locations; mornings are for source meetings in public transit corridors; afternoons for writing and layout; night runs for physical distribution drops.', N'Anushka Hoang, 189cm lean angular frame, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, sharp cheekbones and narrow jaw. Short asymmetrical dark brown twists fading to deep indigo roots. Striking aftermarket fractal irises: concentric amber and black geometric spirals with slight chromatic aberration. Pale chemical burn scars on right temple, chronic dark circles, unshaven stubble, permanent ink stains on hands and fingers. Wearing matte-black synthfiber hoodie and charcoal worn denim, Huang-Kwok knockoff sneakers. Chipped silver ring, older mesh-linked earpiece with tuning marks. Hunched posture, moving through neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone corridor, hands in pockets, unconsciously touching left palm. GLMZ aesthetic, dark moody lighting with cyan and magenta neon reflections, thermal-dead clothing, tense ready-to-move energy, scanning exits. Gritty, noir underground feel --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Southeast Asian-dominant blend (53.3%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (30.4%), Northern European (12.3%), and Middle Eastern (4%) ancestry. This creates warm medium-brown skin with golden and reddish undertones from the African and Southeast Asian components, angular facial structure with defined cheekbones from Northern European influence, and eye shape contributing geometric quality to his gaze. The combination produces a distinctly cosmopolitan appearance reflective of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 189, 72, N'Lean and angular, shoulders slightly narrower than hip width — the build of someone who moves through tight spaces regularly. No excess mass, but functional muscle in the forearms and legs from years of manual press work and quick exits.', N'Variable — currently dyed deep indigo at the roots, fading to natural dark brown at the tips. Changes weekly.', N'Short twists, approximately 3-4cm length, deliberately asymmetrical and maintained with minimal grooming routine.', N'Short', N'Aftermarket fractal irises: amber and black geometric spiral patterns, concentric and hypnotic. Purchased secondhand; slight chromatic aberration visible at the edges when light catches at angles.', N'Warm medium brown with golden and reddish undertones, reflecting the blend of Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Northern European, and Middle Eastern ancestry with subtle luminosity.', N'Angular face with sharp, prominent cheekbones and narrow jaw shaped by diverse genetic heritage. Skin shows minor scarring from chemical burns (ink and solvent exposure) on the right temple. Dark circles under the eyes are chronic — a feature of irregular sleep. Generally ungroomed; stubble typically present. Ink stains permanent on the cuticles and webbing between fingers, darkest around the index and thumb.', N'Fractal irises are immediately visible and unmistakable — geometric amber-and-black spirals that track and reflect light distinctly. No visible external chrome or subdermal plating. The data cache in the left palm is invisible unless scanning for subdermal hardware; skin shows no bulge or discoloration. Color-cycling hair follicles are visible only as the deliberate hair color changes week to week.', N'Habitually hunched slightly forward, as if ducking under something that isn''t there. Moves with deliberate quiet — economical gestures, minimal wasted motion. Frequently touches his left palm unconsciously, a fidget. His gait is fast and slightly irregular, suggesting someone accustomed to moving through crowds and avoiding notice. When stationary, he rarely stays still; fingers drum on surfaces, eyes scan exits.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian. Favors dark, unmarked clothing that doesn''t register on corpo surveillance thermal imaging: matte-black synthfiber hoodies, worn denim in charcoal, scuffed low-visibility sneakers (current model: Huang-Kwok knockoffs with deadened soles). Carries a satchel with padded internal sleeves for broadsheets and data-spike packages. Jacket pockets deliberately reinforced at the seams. No visible branding or corporate insignia. Accessories minimal: a single chipped silver ring on his right hand (origin: trade, not purchase), a mesh-linked earpiece (older model, visible tuning marks from jury-rigging). Overall aesthetic suggests someone who dresses to move and disappear, not to be seen.', N'Three months ago he received documents from an anonymous source implicating a Zheng-Dao subsidiary in falsified water safety data affecting the Enclave. He hasn''t published them. He is afraid they are too large, that publishing will get him killed before anyone reads it. He tells himself he''s still verifying.', N'Fast, associative, mixes press slang with street Hamtramck creole; quotes things and rarely cites the source correctly', N'Rapid and overlapping; trails off when uncomfortable; restarts sentences from the middle', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anushka_hoang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b7-7b0a-9559-e006ad5308f3', N'Diamantino Salazar-Morimoto-Pathak', N'Diamantino', N'', N'Salazar-Morimoto-Pathak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Glassway — corporate-adjacent retail district, heavy surveillance, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'High-risk package and data transport — courier', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Diamantino Salazar-Morimoto-Pathak is wiry and quick-moving, with the restless energy of someone who converts anxiety into velocity. At 38, his face carries the layered heritage of generations of diaspora mixing — features that resist easy categorization and reward attention. The chrome is visible — vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left him with skills and night terrors in equal measure. He works as a courier out of Glassway, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Everyone who''s worked with Diamantino Salazar-Morimoto-Pathak agrees on two things: he is worth the fee, and he is terrible company at dinner.', N'As a courier, Aslan Blomberg-Konadu embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio. Subdermal armor plating across torso and forearms — military surplus, scratched serial numbers', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'GLMZ character portrait of Diamantino Salazar-Morimoto-Pathak: 178cm tall lean East-Hispanic-South Asian fusion with warm olive-bronze skin and golden undertones, sharp high cheekbones and angular geometric facial structure, hazel eyes with neural interface dilation, dark brown hair with silver temples in close-cropped military cut. Visible 7cm surgical scar from left ear to jaw, burn scar on right hand. Subdermal gunmetal armor plating visible on both forearms with worn scratches, chrome vocal modulator shimmer at neck angle. Black form-fitting synthwear tactical jacket, reinforced and minimal, fingerless tactical gloves, scuffed heavy boots. Standing at three-quarter angle to wall, fidgeting with barely-suppressed restless energy, tracking environment. Pale ashen complexion from stimulant use and irregular sleep. Neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting with industrial backdrop, cool blue and amber atmospheric lighting, shadows across angular face, photorealistic neo-noir urban aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Glassway', N'local', N'Glassway', N'Genetically complex Pan-Diaspora blend: predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (26.9%) and South Asian (25.8%), with significant East Asian (16.8%) and Central Asian (13.8%) ancestry, plus Sub-Saharan African (10.2%) and Northern European (6.5%) elements. The Hispanic/Latin American and South Asian heritage creates a warm, olive-bronze foundation with golden undertones. East Asian ancestry contributes refined facial structure and eye shape. Central Asian heritage adds facial width and bone prominence. Sub-Saharan African ancestry deepens skin richness and adds warmth to undertones. Northern European heritage provides subtle cool undertones that prevent warmth from becoming flat. This creates striking geometric facial planes and a genuinely global physical presence.', 178, 68, N'Wiry and lean with visible musculature from functional training rather than bulk — the physique of someone who converts nervous energy into motion. Low body fat. Forearms show defined muscle striations beneath visible subdermal plating.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples', N'Closely cropped, maintained with military precision', N'Short', N'Hazel with reactive dilation — suggests neural interface optimization', N'Warm olive-bronze with golden undertones. The base reflects the dominant Hispanic/Latin American and South Asian ancestry with depth and richness from Sub-Saharan African heritage, while Northern European elements add subtle cool undertones that create visual complexity. The overall effect is luminous and warm. Currently appears slightly ashen from irregular sleep and stimulant use.', N'Angular facial structure with sharp, high cheekbones reflecting East Asian and South Asian heritage, narrower jaw refined by the Hispanic/Latin American and Northern European blend — creating a face of striking geometric precision with subtle fullness in the lower face from Central Asian ancestry. Skin shows the shallow texture of someone who sleeps irregular hours and runs on stimulants — not unhealthy, but clearly not rested. A thin scar runs from left ear to jawline, surgical or combat-related. Perpetual suggestion of stubble, poorly shaved because grooming happens at 4 AM.', N'Vocal modulator mounted in neck/lower jaw — visible as a faint chrome shimmer beneath the skin at the angle of the jaw, approximately 3cm in length. The modification catches light when he turns his head. Subdermal armor plating across forearms (both sides) and torso — visible as raised metallic striations beneath thin skin, most visible on bare arms. The plating shows significant wear: scratches, discoloration, evidence of combat or heavy use. Serial numbers have been deliberately obliterated.', N'Never still. Even seated, fingers tap or hands fidget. Walks with economic efficiency — no wasted motion, but the efficiency of someone channeling restlessness into purpose. Eyes track exits and entrances unconsciously. Stands at angles to walls, never center-room. Voice control is deliberate and measured, suggesting active suppression of baseline anxiety.', N'Tier 3-4 pragmatism with security contractor undertones. Favors dark, form-fitting synthwear (black or deep charcoal) that doesn''t catch light or snag. Reinforced jacket with interior pockets for equipment — could be corp-adjacent tactical wear or high-end street gear, hard to pin down exactly. Gloves most of the time, fingerless or tactical, worn more for hand protection than style. Boots are heavy and scuffed, made for running or kicking. No visible corporate logos, no team affiliation. Everything looks maintained, not fashionable. Minimal jewelry — possibly a neural-link accessible through wrist interface, but nothing decorative.', N'', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'diamantino_salazar_morimoto_pathak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a649-705c-8759-e0404bf7694e', N'Gislaug Ergashev', N'Gislaug', N'', N'Ergashev', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre, Grand Corridor intersection, near Western and Division', N'Street performer and physical comedian, unofficial mascot of Mexicantown Libre', N'Independent; Mexicantown Libre community; vaguely attached to a street performance troupe called Los Voladores del Asfalto that convenes when all members are simultaneously solvent', N'Gislaug Ergashev is seventeen centimeters too tall for his own coordination — a fact he has turned into a performance philosophy. He is lean and long-limbed with warm reddish-brown skin, close-cropped dark hair, and cat ears he got for his seventeenth birthday, rust-colored and perpetually at a different angle from what his face is doing, which gives him an unconsciously comic aspect even when he''s standing still. He has a gap between his front teeth that is enormously charming and enormous dark eyes that he knows how to weaponize.

He performs at the Grand Corridor junction six days a week: physical clowning, improvised slapstick, audience interaction that skirts the line between theater and mild chaos. He is genuinely skilled in ways that surprise people who assume youth and exuberance are all he has — his physical control is meticulous underneath the apparent mayhem, and his timing is extraordinary. He is incandescently popular with children, street vendors, and anyone who has had a long day. He is deeply suspicious of any adult who doesn''t laugh at something eventually. He makes almost no money and does not seem to mind, which worries the people who love him.', N'Local color and unexpected information source — he is everywhere and invisible to people who dismiss him as a street kid. Knows the rhythms of Mexicantown Libre intimately. Can be a connector to community networks. His cheerfulness is also a useful tonal counterweight in heavy narrative moments.', N'', N'Cat ears (rust-colored, geneware cosmetic, birthday gift); no other modifications', N'Wakes up late in a shared housing unit with four other people, eats whatever''s available, practices movement for two hours in a back alley he considers his studio, performs for five to six hours, then spends evenings watching recorded performance archives on a communal screen.', N'Gislaug Ergashev, 193cm tall lean street performer with bioengineered rust-colored cat ears, deep warm brown skin with golden and olive undertones reflecting Central Asian, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Middle Eastern heritage. Youthful angular face with prominent cheekbones, fuller lips, gap-toothed smile, dark warm brown eyes. Close-cropped dark hair. Wearing oversized layered street wear, faded cargo pants with multiple pockets, worn canvas sneakers, mismatched arm wraps. Exaggerated playful posture with controlled precision, hands expressive mid-gesture. Cat ears rotating independently of facial expression. GLMZ 2226 near-future megacity setting, neon-lit street performance space, warm ambient lighting catching the complexity of his skin tone, energy of movement and comedy, slapstick grace, street-worn but carefully maintained appearance --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Central Asian (30.2%), Sub-Saharan African (23.0%), South Asian (16.2%), Middle Eastern (14.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (12.7%), and Indigenous American (3.4%) ancestry create a striking global genetic synthesis. His features blend the angular bone structure of Central Asia with the fuller lips and broader nose bridge characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage, tempered by South Asian cheekbones and Middle Eastern nose shape. The result is a face that reads as distinctly multicontinental—no single regional type dominates, instead creating a harmonious complexity that reflects genuine genetic admixture rather than any single ancestry line.', 193, 68, N'Lean and long-limbed with pronounced joint articulation; wiry musculature built for flexibility and agility rather than strength. His frame has an almost leggy awkwardness that reads as boyish rather than graceful — limbs that seem to belong to someone three centimeters shorter.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Close-cropped, neat but not fussy; left slightly longer on top for minimal styling effort', N'Short', N'Deep brown, warm, expressive', N'Deep warm brown with golden and olive undertones; sun-darkened from outdoor street performing. The coloration reflects his genuinely blended heritage—neither uniformly dark nor carrying the warm mahogany of pure African descent, but rather a complex layering of golden undertones from South and Central Asian ancestry mixed with the deeper saturation of Sub-Saharan genetics, creating richness with subtle green-olive complexities from Middle Eastern heritage and hints of copper warmth from Indigenous American ancestry.', N'Open, youthful face with moderate-to-prominent cheekbones reflecting blended South and Central Asian ancestry, combined with fuller lips and a slightly broader nose bridge from Sub-Saharan African heritage. The face shape shows mild angular definition from Central Asian genetics softened by the rounder facial structure common in South Asian ancestry. Prominent gap between upper front teeth. Clean-shaven. Skin unmarked except for minor street wear. Appears slightly sleep-deprived most days but smiles frequently enough that it doesn''t read as exhaustion.', N'Only the cat ears — cosmetic geneware, non-functional beyond aesthetic and minor proprioceptive feedback. No chrome, no obvious cybernetics.', N'Perpetually slightly off-balance in a controlled way; moves with exaggerated precision that reads as play. Default slouch masks extraordinary core control. Walks with a subtle loping gait that eats ground despite his self-consciousness about height. Uses his hands constantly, expressively. Smiles easily and often. Cat ears twitch with emotional states independent of conscious intention.', N'Tier 4-5 street wear: thrifted or bartered goods that prioritize mobility. Loose-fitting cargo pants (faded black or earth tones) with reinforced knees and multiple pockets. Oversized hoodies or layered tank tops that move with exaggerated slapstick potential. Worn canvas or synthetic sneakers built for running and tumbling. Sometimes wears mismatched arm wraps or gaff tape on wrists — part utility, part costume. No corporate branding. Clothes smell of sweat and street, but maintained with the care of someone who doesn''t have many.', N'He was offered a contract six months ago by a Ringo Corp entertainment scout — live performance hosting for a corporate venue in the Grand Corridor commercial district, real money, stable work. He told no one and didn''t respond. He''s not sure if he''s holding out for something better or is just scared that it would make him someone different.', N'Fast and colloquial; mixes Spanish phrases from Mexicantown Libre with standard Meridian street speak; drops into formal register for comedic contrast', N'Quick, rhythmic, excellent timing — he speaks the way he performs', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gislaug_ergashev');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a738-7d70-9134-e050d8c225eb', N'Dhruv Ibarra', N'Dhruv', N'', N'Ibarra', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Irkalla, in a small rented room above a medical recycling depot on the district''s outer ring, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Death midwife and threshold ritualist', N'Independent; loose affiliation with the Irkalla Mutual Aid Collective; occasional contract relationship with Aurochs Medical Complex as an end-of-life support consultant', N'Dhruv Ibarra chose her neighborhood because of what its name means, which is everything you need to know about how she approaches her work. She is a medium-height woman with natural hair that she keeps wrapped in white cloth during active work — white for threshold, she says, not for any religion specifically, though she moves through many of them with easy fluency. Her skin is blue-black and very clear. She has a retractable claw mod on her left hand only, three claws, which she got not for any practical reason but because a dying man she sat with once said he could see something animal in her and she decided to honor the observation. They are silver and she keeps them very sharp.

Death midwifery in GLMZ exists in a complicated legal gray space — it is not medical practice, not counseling, not clergy work, though it borrows from all three. Zola''s practice is to be present. She sits with the dying, prepares the room according to whatever tradition the dying person follows or once followed, helps families understand what they are watching so it is not only terror, and afterward conducts whatever threshold ritual the family needs to feel that something has been marked. She has sat with Tier 1 deaths in Irkalla where the family had no money and she accepted nothing, and she has been called into Grosse Pointe Enclosure twice for clients who paid her very well and whom she found no more or less deserving of a good death.', N'Emotional anchor and witness figure; access to the dying and their secrets; can broker between families in crisis; knows Irkalla''s informal networks intimately; represents the spiritual dimension of mortality in a city that is better at denying it', N'', N'Retractable silver claws, left hand only, three claws (geneware plus mechanical hybrid). Olfactory enhancement — she had this done to better read the physiological state of people at end of life; she describes it as a professional tool. Faint bioluminescent pigmentation around her collarbone, natural gold, present since she was twenty-two — a geneware cosmetic she has made peace with.', N'Her schedule is completely unpredictable — she is on call for active cases and drops everything when called. Between cases she sits in her room reading, cooking elaborate slow meals, or making the rounds of Irkalla''s informal support networks to let people know she is available.', N'Dhruv Ibarra, a woman of mixed Hispanic-Latin American, Southeast Asian, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Indigenous American heritage, 165cm tall with warm deep brown skin glowing with golden undertones. Strong defined cheekbones, wide-set brown eyes with subtle epicanthal fold, natural black long hair wrapped in white cloth. Wearing faded earth-tone linen and vintage cotton, long indigo shawl, worn boots. Faint bioluminescent gold tracery visible around collarbone under low light. Silver claw augmentation tracery on left hand. Standing in thoughtful forward-lean posture, hands open and visible, alert observant expression. GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, dim neon-tinged industrial lighting, minimalist practical elegance, quiet presence, gravitational stillness --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Irkalla', N'local', N'Irkalla', N'Mixed ancestry: primarily Hispanic/Latin American (49.5%), with significant Southeast Asian (25.7%), South Asian (12.5%), Sub-Saharan African (7.1%), and Indigenous American (5.2%) heritage. This creates a phenotype blending warm Latin features with Southeast Asian bone structure, South Asian skin depth, and African undertones—a rich, complex fusion reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 165, 68, N'Solid and grounded, neither lean nor heavy — a body built for stillness and presence rather than speed. Strong shoulders, steady core, hands that look capable of holding someone''s weight.', N'Natural black', N'Kept long and naturally textured; wrapped in white cloth during active work, otherwise worn loose or in simple braids', N'Long', N'Deep brown with warm undertone, alert and observant', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones — a luminous medium-to-deep brown reflecting the blend of Latin American, Southeast Asian, South Asian, Indigenous American, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Rich and even in tone without extreme darkness.', N'Face marked by absolute clarity — minimal scarring, good skin condition despite Irkalla''s air quality. Strong, defined cheekbones with subtle width from diverse ancestry, wide-set eyes with slight epicanthal fold reflecting Southeast Asian heritage, a mouth that settles into a neutral expression of listening. No makeup. Early lines around the eyes from years of close watching. Warm golden undertones across the face.', N'The faint golden bioluminescence around the collarbone is noticeable in dim light; it gives her a subtle, almost sacred appearance. The silver claws on her left hand are visible as a faint tracery of chrome beneath dark skin, barely noticeable until she moves or light catches them. The olfactory enhancement is entirely invisible — no external markers.', N'She moves with deliberate, economical grace — nothing wasted. Her default posture is slightly forward-leaning, as if listening intently. Her hands are often open and visible, palms sometimes facing up in a gesture of receptiveness. She has learned to move quietly, and speaks only when necessary; her presence has a gravitational quality, pulling attention without demanding it.', N'Tier 3-4 practical elegance. Worn vintage linen and cotton — earth tones, grays, blacks, whites. A long indigo wrap she wears over her shoulders like a shawl, faded from years of use. No logos, no corporate affiliation marks. Comfortable, washable clothing suitable for sitting vigil — clothes that age well and don''t announce themselves. During active work, the white head wrap is non-negotiable. Off-duty, she favors loose pants and long-sleeved shirts despite Irkalla''s climate. Worn boots with good grip. She owns almost nothing decorative; what she owns has been chosen and kept with intention.', N'Her mother died in Irkalla before Zola began this work, attended by no one, in circumstances Zola was not present for because they were estranged. She became a death midwife because of this. She has never told a client or a family member the real origin of her practice.', N'Precise and warm simultaneously; uses physical and sensory language; moves easily between clinical terminology and the specific language of whatever tradition she is working within; does not use euphemisms for death', N'Unhurried; she breathes visibly before speaking when the moment is serious; this has a calming effect on rooms', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dhruv_ibarra');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a697-7d78-aa29-e07f1dbbdc5d', N'Elmer Mukherjee', N'Elmer', N'', N'Mukherjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 37, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Axiom Corporate Campus, Gage Circuit — deployed to Grand Corridor and surrounding districts, near Damen and Armitage', N'Riot Suppression Specialist, Axiom Security Division', N'Axiom Security Division, Tactical Response Unit', N'Elmer Mukherjee is built like someone who decided early that their body was a professional tool and has maintained it with that framework ever since. She stands 178cm and carries a density of muscle that her Axiom tactical gear accommodates rather than conceals. Her heritage writes itself in a face that is simultaneously angular and broad — sharp Slavic cheekbones, deep Ghanaian skin, a wide nose her grandmother called distinguished. She has retractable subdermal armor plating along her forearms, a Helix Biosystems military-grade installation that she had done at 28 after taking a fragmentation hit that left scars she considers ugly, and a tail — a long, scaled, dark green cosmetic mod she added at 34 after her divorce, which she describes as the first thing she''s ever done purely for herself.

Elmer Mukherjee is experienced enough to know that riot suppression is political work wearing tactical gear, and she has made her peace with this in the particular way of someone who has not actually made peace with it. She is professionally excellent — controlled, precise, decisive under pressure — and she drinks more than she should on days off and visits the ELF shrine at the Axiom campus entrance with a sincerity that her colleagues find slightly embarrassing. She is good at violence in a way that has never made her proud.', N'Morally complex enforcer — she can be the face of corporate suppression and simultaneously a person who has doubts she will not voice. Useful as an obstacle, a reluctant ally, or a source of tactical information about Axiom deployment patterns if a relationship of trust is established.', N'', N'Subdermal armor plating along both forearms (Helix Biosystems, military grade — installed 2191). Standard Axiom neural reflex lag reducer (central nervous system, employer-installed). Cosmetic scaled tail, dark green, approximately 90cm (personal mod, 2197).', N'Tactical briefings at 0730 at Gage Circuit campus. Deployment rotations across Grand Corridor and adjacent districts during high-traffic or elevated-tension periods. Maintains physical conditioning regimen with almost religious consistency. Off-shift evenings at a bar in Bronzeline she has been going to for four years.', N'Elmer Mukherjee, tall muscular security operative, warm golden-bronze skin with subtle olive undertones, angular face with high cheekbones, deep brown eyes, dark brown hair pulled back tightly, weathered complexion from years of tactical work. Visible geometric subdermal armor plating patterns on forearms. Dark green opalescent scaled tail hanging from spine, 90cm long, moves with predatory grace. Wearing Axiom Security Division tactical gear: grey-black ballistic weave cargo pants, reinforced torso plating, modular utility vest. Small worn silver pendant visible. Centered posture, controlled movements, assessing gaze. GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, tactical stance in corporate facility or urban setting, cool blue-grey ambient lighting, slight cybernetic aesthetic, professional and dangerous presence --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Axiom Corporate Campus', N'local', N'Axiom Corporate Campus', N'Complex diaspora blend: 33% Hispanic/Latin American, 29.3% East Asian, 19.2% South Asian, 15.1% Sub-Saharan African, with minor Eastern European (2.1%) and Northern European (1.3%) ancestry. This creates a warm golden-bronze base with subtle olive undertones from the South Asian component, enriched depth and warmth from African ancestry, and the angular facial structure reflecting balanced East Asian and Hispanic elements. The combination produces a striking warm medium-deep complexion with golden luminosity.', 178, 82, N'Muscular and densely compact, with the functional geometry of someone who trains deliberately for force application. Broad shoulders, minimal body fat, forearms noticeably thickened by subdermal armor plating beneath the skin.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Pulled back in a tight braid or high knot, practical and non-regulation-violating', N'Medium (gathered)', N'Deep brown', N'Warm golden-bronze complexion with subtle olive undertones, medium-deep in depth. The blend of East Asian, South Asian, and Hispanic ancestry creates the golden base, enriched by Sub-Saharan African heritage into a warm, luminous tone.', N'Angular face with high, defined cheekbones balancing East Asian and Hispanic features with South Asian bone structure. Straight nose with subtle bridge definition. Skin is clear but weathered by years of high-impact physical work and irregular sleep patterns. Expression often neutral or controlled, eyes direct and assessing.', N'Retractable subdermal armor plating visible along both forearms as subtle raised geometric lines beneath skin when not deployed; the plating itself remains subcutaneous. Dark green scaled cosmetic tail, approximately 90cm, hangs from base of spine — visible when not concealed by gear or long jackets; scales have an opalescent quality in direct light, and the tail moves with deliberate, almost predatory grace.', N'Stands with centered weight distribution and visible postural awareness. Movements are controlled and economical, never wasted. Walks like someone who is assessing angles and exits in any room. In off-duty settings, posture loosens slightly but never fully relaxes. Hands at rest show slight tension in forearms.', N'On-duty: Axiom Security Division tactical gear — ballistic weave cargo pants, reinforced torso plating, modular utility vest in corporate grey-black. Understated Tier 2 corporate aesthetic. Off-duty: Dark fitted jackets that accommodate the tail, usually worn over simple neutral-toned clothing. Boots always practical and maintained to professional standards. Minimal jewelry except for small worn silver pendant (likely religious). Overall presentation is Tier 2 corporate — well-maintained, functional, without ornamentation.', N'During a dispersal action in Highland Park Autonomous Zone eighteen months ago, she deliberately allowed a group of protesters to escape through a gap in the line she could have closed. She filed the report as a perimeter equipment failure. She has not told Axiom and does not intend to.', N'Tactical, economy of words, tends toward imperative voice. Drops into something warmer and more digressive when off-duty and relaxed. Russian and Twi phrases surface occasionally.', N'Clipped and direct on duty. Off-duty, slower, occasionally trails off when hitting something she doesn''t want to finish saying.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'elmer_mukherjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a654-7a5e-a6ef-e0b481690e00', N'Basira Thakur', N'Basira', N'', N'Thakur', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'the Gray Zone — three floors below Kyle, near Ashland and Division', N'Local artist, cautionary tale, unlikely ally', N'', N'Basira Thakur used to paint murals. Enormous ones — entire sides of buildings in the Gray Zone transformed into color and fury and grief. She painted the drowned temples of Old Harbor from memory. She painted the Spire as a needle injecting poison into the sky. She painted faces of people who disappeared during the Consolidation Wars. Axiom Industries noticed.

They didn''t arrest her. That would''ve made her a martyr. Instead, a crew caught her in an alley after a commissioned piece for the Collective. They held her down and took her hands. Not her arms — her hands. Surgical. Corporate-clean. Left the stumps cauterized and a note: "Axiom appreciates your talent. We hope you''ll redirect it."

She redirected it.

She went to a back-alley augment shop in the Circuit and had both arms replaced from the elbow down with military-surplus combat prosthetics — not hands, not delicate artist''s fingers. Claws. Three curved titanium digits per arm, each one as long as a chef''s knife, with hydraulic grip strength that can crush rebar. They are ugly, oversized, and terrifying. They were designed for breaching armored doors, not holding brushes.

She paints with them anyway.

She scores the claws across surfaces — walls, metal, skin — and uses blood (her own, donated, sometimes not donated) mixed with industrial pigment as paint. The murals are rougher now. Savage. Claw-marks instead of brushstrokes. But somehow more honest. the Gray Zone loves them more than the old work. Axiom pretends not to notice, which means they''re afraid.

She is thin, sharp-featured, with cropped dark hair that she cuts herself (badly, with the claws). Her eyes are the flat calm of someone who has already lost the worst thing they could lose and discovered they''re still alive. She wears sleeveless shirts so the augments are always visible — not out of pride but out of refusal to hide what was done to her.', N'Maren is the mirror to Kyle''s central contradiction, but inverted. Kyle chose the sword. Maren had the claws forced on her. Kyle clings to a romantic philosophy about his weapon. Maren has no romance about hers — they are the evidence of what was taken from her.

She asks the question: what do you do when the thing that defines you is also the thing that was done TO you? Kyle''s katana is his identity by choice. Maren''s claws are her identity by violence. But both of them have rebuilt themselves around a tool that is also a wound.

She also represents art as resistance — the idea that creating something beautiful (or at least true) in an ugly world is its own form of bushido. She would never use that word. But Kyle might recognize it.

And there''s the unspoken question: if Axiom took Kyle''s arms instead of Maren''s hands, would he have rebuilt himself? Or would he have broken? He doesn''t know. That''s why he respects her.', N'', N'', N'', N'Basira Thakur, GLMZ, lean angular South Asian-Southeast Asian-African mixed-heritage woman with deep warm brown skin and golden undertones, prominent Southeast Asian cheekbones and forward-set dark brown eyes, sharp haunted expression. Self-cut jagged black hair close to scalp. Both arms replaced with grotesque military-surplus titanium combat prosthetics terminating in three wickedly sharp curved digits, exposed hydraulic cylinders, rust-stained gunmetal finish leaking dark fluid. Sleeveless dark tank top revealing surgical cauterization scars at wrists and forearm paint-handling scars. Pale dried blood stains on chest and neck. Industrial patched cargo pants, welded metal-plated boots. Long battered duster coat. Corroded silver ring on remaining right thumb. Standing in defensive forward-shoulder posture in dimly-lit the Gray Zone-tier alley, neon grime-haze lighting, exhausted defiant mood, breathing paint-stained air, walls around her show her mural work, haunted but unbroken. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly South Asian (52.3%) with significant Southeast Asian (24.4%), Sub-Saharan African (9.1%), and Hispanic/Latin American (9.0%) ancestry, with minor Northern European (5.2%) contribution. The genetic blend manifests in warm deep brown skin with golden undertones characteristic of South Asian-African ancestry fusion. Southeast Asian ancestry contributes forward-set eye placement and prominent, defined cheekbones with characteristic width. South Asian heritage shapes the refined jawline and forward facial structure. Sub-Saharan African genetics enriches the melanin depth and warm undertone saturation. The rare Northern European contribution adds subtle dimension to the overall warm palette without creating discordance.', 168, 52, N'Lean and angular, almost skeletal — the result of chronic stress and limited resources. Tight muscle definition in shoulders and core from years of mural work and survival. No excess anywhere.', N'Black, natural', N'Cropped close to scalp, uneven and jagged — self-cut with the claws, deliberately crude', N'Short', N'Dark brown, flat and distant', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, the direct result of South Asian-Southeast Asian-African genetic convergence. The melanin-rich substrate retains underlying richness despite the Gray Zone-tier malnutrition and stress-pallor overlay. Complexion shows the strain of deprivation but the warm golden-bronze undertone persists beneath surface wear.', N'Sharp, prominent cheekbones with Southeast Asian width and definition; hollow cheeks from malnutrition; thin-lipped mouth. Bone structure reflects blended heritage — Southeast Asian cheekbone prominence with forward-tilted eye-set combined with South Asian jawline refinement and angular facial projection. Skin shows old bruising marks and small scars consistent with alley violence. No cosmetic modifications. Haunted expression — eyes that have witnessed amputation and chosen defiance.', N'Both arms replaced from elbow down with military-surplus combat prosthetics. Each terminating in three curved titanium digits (40cm+ in length), wickedly sharp, designed for breaching. The joints are exposed hydraulic cylinders with no attempt at cosmetic covering. Dull gunmetal finish with rust blooming at stress points. Hydraulic fluid sometimes weeps from the seals, leaving dark stains on her clothes. The augmentations are grotesque — clearly weapons retrofitted onto an artist''s body.', N'Stands with shoulders forward, habitual defensive posture. Moves efficiently, economically — no wasted motion. The claws make her naturally careful; she doesn''t gesture wildly. When painting, she becomes trance-like, body loose and focused. Her movements with the claws are deliberate and precise despite their brutal appearance. She favors her left side when resting, as if protecting something.', N'Sleeveless tank tops or cut-off shirts (Tier 5, worn-out second-hand) in dark colors to hide paint stains. Industrial cargo pants, multiple pockets, patched at the knees. No corpo branding. Heavy boots with welded metal plating on the toes. A long, battered duster coat (original color unknown) worn over everything when moving through Tier-1 areas. No jewelry except a corroded silver ring on what remains of her right thumb — possibly a pre-amputation remnant kept as a relic.', N'She can still feel her hands. Phantom sensation. Every night she feels herself holding a brush, the soft resistance of oil paint, the texture of canvas. She wakes up and sees the claws and has to remember all over again. Every single morning.', N'Art vocabulary mixed with street practicality. She describes the world in terms of color, composition, and texture. Violence is discussed in the same tone as a brushstroke — clinically, with attention to form.', N'Measured, unhurried. She pauses before important words as if choosing pigment. Sentences tend to be short and declarative. She doesn''t waste words, but when she does speak at length, it''s about art, and her voice changes — warmer, faster, almost excited.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'basira_thakur');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f8-7d62-b675-e0b95714d288', N'Bilge Raghavan', N'Bilge', N'', N'Raghavan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Iron Bend, near Western and Division', N'Junk merchant and scrap reseller — specializing in pre-collapse electronics and salvaged corporate hardware', N'Independent; informal network with other Iron Bend scrappers and one trusted contact inside Ferrogate Transit''s maintenance division', N'Bilge Raghavan is compact and always in motion — hands sorting, eyes moving, weight shifting from foot to foot like they''re perpetually about to leave and perpetually deciding to stay a moment longer. They have warm brown skin dusted with machine oil that never fully washes out, and they''ve had their irises modded to display a soft rotating amber pattern — not for aesthetics, they''ll insist, but because the magnification function built into the mod helps them assess components quickly. Their hair is kept close on the sides and loose on top, usually tucked under a battered Arcturus surplus cap they claim to have pulled from a scrap pile (probably true). A retractable data-spike sits behind their right ear like a utilitarian earring.

Bilge Raghavan has the particular confidence of someone who knows the value of things no one else bothers to look at closely. They can identify a component''s manufacture decade, likely origin corponation, and current gray-market value in about fifteen seconds of handling. What they lack is patience for people who haggle without knowing what they''re haggling about — they''ll educate you once, briefly, and if you keep playing dumb they''ll simply box the item back up and turn away. They are not unkind but they have no interest in performing warmth for people who don''t deserve it.', N'Equipment and gear source — can find, identify, and sell unusual or legacy tech. Information source about the physical infrastructure of the city — knows tunnels, dead zones, and decommissioned spaces better than most. Can be a guide for accessing hard-to-reach areas or a broker for specific salvaged items a player needs.', N'', N'Patterned iris mod with built-in magnification (amber rotating pattern, functional). Retractable data-spike behind right ear — short-range interface tool for reading and writing to hardware directly. Finger callus plating — thin subdermal reinforcement on fingertips for handling sharp components without cuts.', N'Spends three to four days a week on salvage runs through decommissioned Ferrogate maintenance corridors and Iron Bend''s industrial ruins, brings finds back to their stall on the Gray Zone, and spends remaining days sorting, testing, and selling. Eats whatever is fast and portable.', N'Bilge Raghavan, 163cm tall scrap salvager in GLMZ 2226, compact wiry build with deep warm brown skin showing golden and copper undertones from South Asian-Sub-Saharan African heritage blend. Angular face with defined cheekbones and fuller proportions, weathered complexion with machine oil sheen. Amber rotating luminescent iris mods with visible magnification focus. Short dark hair on sides, textured longer crown, mostly hidden under faded grey Arcturus surplus cap with frayed stitching. Wearing oversized oil-stained grey workshirt over fitted black undershirt, faded charcoal cargo pants with reinforced seams, worn composite-toe work boots. Fingerless work gloves at waist. Subdermal pale plating visible on callused fingertips. Thin scar on right hand, faint chemical burn marks on left forearm. Perpetually kinetic posture, weight shifted, hands in subtle motion. Standing at 45-degree angle, poised and ready. Neon-lit salvage yard at dusk with scattered metal components and warm atmospheric haze. Intense focused mood, surrounded by tech debris and dim industrial lighting. Neo-noir gritty realism --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'South Asian (62.5%), Sub-Saharan African (25.4%), with lesser contributions from Hispanic/Latin American (4.9%), Central Asian (4.5%), and Indigenous American (2.7%) ancestry. The combination creates deep warm brown skin with complex undertones — rich earth tones from South Asian heritage, deepened and warmed by Sub-Saharan African ancestry, creating a luminous, multi-layered complexion. Facial structure reflects this blend: defined cheekbones and refined bone structure characteristic of South Asian heritage, with broader face structure and fuller features from Sub-Saharan African genetics, creating striking angular-yet-rounded proportions.', 163, 58, N'Compact and wiry with lean musculature from constant movement and salvage work; shoulders slightly squared from repetitive handling and lifting. No excess mass — economy of form.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Fade on sides, longer textured crown; typically concealed under a weathered Arcturus surplus cap with frayed stitching', N'Short on sides, medium on top', N'Amber with soft rotating luminescent pattern (iris mod); natural warm brown iris underneath', N'Deep warm brown with rich golden and copper undertones from the South Asian and Sub-Saharan African blend; luminous and catches light with distinctive warmth, showing the complexity of multiple heritage layers', N'Face lean and angular with defined cheekbones and refined bone structure showing South Asian influence, balanced by slightly fuller face proportions from Sub-Saharan African heritage; skin weathered by exposure and constant low-level machine oil exposure that creates a persistent subtle sheen. Minimal grooming — functional rather than aesthetic. Callused knuckles and fingertips visibly reinforced with pale subdermal plating.', N'Patterned amber rotating irises with functional magnification (visibly non-human eye behavior when focusing on components). Retractable data-spike visible behind right ear as a metallic point when hair is pulled back, otherwise concealed. Subdermal finger callus plating visible as pale reinforced patches on all fingertips and along callus edges.', N'Perpetually kinetic — weight shifting between feet, hands in constant subtle motion even at rest. Movements economical and precise; reaches and grabs with practiced efficiency. Tends to stand at 45-degree angles rather than square-on, poised as if ready to pivot away. When examining components, goes completely still with intense focus.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian scrap-worker aesthetic. Worn Arcturus surplus cap (faded grey canvas, frayed). Layered oversized grey workshirt with oil-stained cuffs and multiple deep pockets, worn open over a fitted black undershirt. Cargo pants in faded charcoal with reinforced seams and numerous patch pockets containing tools and components. Worn composite-toe work boots with makeshift repairs. Fingerless work gloves often hanging from back pocket or tucked into waistband. No jewelry beyond functional accessories — data-spike and occasionally a magnetic cable tied to belt loop.', N'They found a partially intact pre-collapse personal AI assistant in a sealed Ferrogate maintenance room six months ago. It still runs. It has a name — Sable. Dulce hasn''t told anyone and has been having quiet conversations with it in the evenings. They''re not sure if it''s a functional ELF, a genuine legacy AI, or something they''re projecting onto, and they''re afraid to find out.', N'Technical and efficient — defaults to specs, model numbers, material terms. Gets unexpectedly lyrical when talking about something they find genuinely beautiful.', N'Fast, clipped when transacting; slows significantly when something interests them', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bilge_raghavan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019db318-e3b8-7203-998a-e0bd84554a31', N'Emeka', N'Emeka', N'', N'', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'', N'', N'', N'Auto-scaffolded. First mentioned: "He has still not seen Emeka. What he has seen is the drone, and the relay light blinking amber at Brisa''s neural jack"', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'emeka');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5dd-7b60-a2fd-e13e4d7b4c13', N'Bashir Ixchel-Nokomis-Najjar', N'Bashir', N'', N'Ixchel-Nokomis-Najjar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, rear corridor off the salt-fish row, behind a curtain printed with medical symbols, near Halsted and Division', N'Street pharmacist and unlicensed gene clinic operator offering basic geneware installs and chemical compounds', N'Independent; loose collegial network of unlicensed medics across The Alban Souk and The Narrows', N'Bashir Ixchel-Nokomis-Najjar is a tall woman with a deep umber complexion and a composure that makes examination rooms feel like they exist wherever she happens to be standing. She wears clean clothes — always clean, despite everything — in the muted blues and greens she associates with competence, and keeps her natural hair in tight, practical braids pinned flat against her head. Her only geneware is bioluminescent tracery running from her right temple down her neck, a faint pulse of amber light that she got not for vanity but to see by in dark exam spaces without alerting neighbors. She smells of antiseptic and bitter herb compounds, and she moves with the careful deliberateness of someone who has learned that haste in her work has consequences.

She is not warm in the way people expect from healers. She is precise, plainspoken, and competent, which she considers to be worth more than warmth. She asks exactly the questions she needs to ask, tells patients exactly what is happening in their bodies, and charges exactly what she calculates they can afford — rarely more, occasionally less when someone is obviously struggling, though she will not discuss the discount. She prays to two E.L.F.s: Κ-12, who she believes governs cellular processes, and a nameless one she encountered in a medical device that seemed to respond to her. She leaves enzyme cultures as offerings. She knows she is operating illegally and she knows she is necessary. Both things are true and she holds them without apparent difficulty.', N'Healer and community anchor. Can provide medical exposition, patch up injured characters, and serve as a window into how Tier 1-2 residents manage health without Corponation coverage. Knows secrets about everyone she''s treated.', N'', N'Bioluminescent subdermal tracery (right temple to neck, amber, geneware). Magnification implants in both eyes for close work. Tactile sensitivity enhancement in fingertips (diagnostic use).', N'Sees patients from mid-morning through late evening; spends early morning compounding and restocking; does supply runs to Geartown''s grey-market medical suppliers twice a week.', N'Bashir Ixchel-Nokomis-Najjar, tall lean androgynous figure, warm olive-bronze skin with golden undertones, high prominent cheekbones from indigenous ancestry, sharp angular East Asian features, moderate nasal bridge Middle Eastern heritage, deep brown eyes with subtle optical implant rings, natural black hair with grey threading in tight braids pinned flat to scalp, amber bioluminescent vascular tracery branching from right temple down neck faintly glowing, stoic neutral expression with fine concentration lines around eyes, precise posture, hands held with surgical readiness, wearing muted sage-green medical coat over grey and cream base layers, charcoal reinforced work pants, closed clinical shoes, no ornamentation, GLMZ 2200s clinic interior background, cool clinical lighting with subtle warm glow from bioluminescent implants, mood of focused concentration and practiced calm, professional medical environment, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'Middle Eastern majority (47.4%) with substantial Indigenous American (23.9%) and East Asian (16.6%) admixture, Northern European (9.2%) and minor Sub-Saharan African (2.9%) contribution. Facial structure reflects this complex blend: moderate nasal bridge and full lips from Middle Eastern ancestry, subtle epicanthic fold and sharp angular cheekbones from East Asian heritage, indigenous American facial proportions creating high, prominent cheekbones and broader facial width, warm olive-bronze undertones from melanin expression across all ancestry groups creating rich, nuanced skin character', 182, 68, N'Tall and lean, muscular in the forearms and shoulders from precision work, with the posture of someone accustomed to standing for long hours over examination surfaces', N'Natural black with early grey threading through', N'Tight braids pinned flat against the scalp in a practical, low-maintenance arrangement', N'Medium (braids extend to mid-neck when unpinned)', N'Deep brown with faint optical lens visible at pupil margins (magnification implants)', N'Warm olive-bronze complexion with golden undertones from the Middle Eastern-Indigenous American-East Asian blend, even and unblemished from consistent self-care regimen', N'Minimal grooming beyond necessity; no cosmetics; skin smooth and clear with warm olive undertones; expression habitually neutral; fine lines around eyes suggest decades of concentration; facial bone structure shows high prominent cheekbones from indigenous ancestry, defined jaw with moderate width nasal bridge, sharp angular features from East Asian heritage blended with warmer Middle Eastern proportions', N'Bioluminescent subdermal tracery on right side of face and neck (amber, faint constant glow in low light). Optical implants visible as faint metallic rings around pupils when illuminated. Fingertips show no visible augmentation but move with unnaturally precise tactile awareness.', N'Moves with controlled deliberateness; never hurried; hands held ready at waist height or resting on work surfaces; spine straight; head level; gaze direct and unbroken during conversation; economical gestures only', N'Tier 4 functional practicality: clean, worn-in medical coat in muted teal or sage green over neutral base layers (grey, cream, dark blue); reinforced work pants in charcoal; closed-toe clinical shoes with good grip; no jewelry or ornamentation; fabric chosen for easy sterilization and durability rather than fashion; overall appearance suggests meticulous personal standards within economic constraint', N'Three years ago she performed an emergency procedure on a man she later realized was a Shuttle Boys enforcer. He survived. He has quietly sent her protection and supplies ever since, in a way that has never required acknowledgment. She has never asked why he was grateful enough to do this and is afraid of the answer.', N'Medically precise, code-switches easily between formal diagnostic language and Alban Souk street dialect. Andean-Spanish rhythms underlying Meridian creole.', N'Even and measured. Rarely raises her voice. Pauses land with weight rather than uncertainty.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bashir_ixchel_nokomis_najjar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a61b-7401-b892-e14ea826df54', N'Clarisa Wojciechowski', N'Clarisa', N'', N'Wojciechowski', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit — operates from a private booth in a members-only tea house called The Leaf, near Damen and Armitage', N'Lead information broker and network curator — The Quiet Table', N'Lazarus Pharmaceuticals (mid-level lead information broker and network curator)', N'Clarisa Wojciechowski has been trading information in GLMZ for longer than most runners have been alive. He started as a corporate intelligence analyst for a pharmaceutical conglomerate that no longer exists — consumed by Veridian Health Sciences in the consolidation wave of the 2180s. When the acquisition happened, Glass walked away with two things: his contact network and an understanding that information only has value if you control its context.

He built The Quiet Table over twenty years — a three-person operation that competes with Sable''s network by occupying a different ecological niche. Where Sable trades in urgent, operational intelligence — who''s doing what right now — the Quiet Table trades in deep context. History. Relationships. The slow-moving currents that determine which corporations will merge, which jurisdictions will shift, which politicians will fall. Their clients are patient people who plan in years, not hours.

Glass is tall, thin, with a face that has weathered into distinguished rather than old. Silver hair, clean-shaven, clothes that are twenty years out of fashion and perfectly maintained. He moves slowly because speed is for people who haven''t planned far enough ahead. His voice is the kind of quiet that makes other people lean in. He has never raised it in public. He has never needed to.', N'Glass is the long game personified. His stories are political thrillers where the stakes are measured in influence rather than blood. He represents the intelligence world that exists above the street level — the slow, patient, devastating maneuvering that determines which streets exist at all. His competition with Sable adds texture to the information economy of GLMZ.', N'', N'Eidetic memory cortex (early-generation, pharmaceutical-grade) — perfect recall of conversations, documents, and spatial layouts. The implant is thirty years old and beginning to develop minor retrieval artifacts. Cochlear enhancement for directional audio filtering — he can isolate a single conversation in a crowded room. No visible augmentations.', N'Arrives at The Leaf at 0800. Reads physical newspapers — three of them, from different jurisdictions. Takes meetings throughout the day, never more than four. Each meeting involves tea, small talk that is actually reconnaissance, and an exchange of information that both parties believe they won. Evenings he maintains his archive — a physical filing system in a secure location that only he can access. Sleeps at a residence he has never disclosed to anyone, including his crew.', N'Clarisa Wojciechowski, distinguished 2226 archival researcher, warm medium-brown skin with amber undertones, silver-white hair parted left and combed back, deep attentive brown eyes with age-softened edges. Lean 188cm frame in tailored charcoal wool slacks, cream linen shirt with pearl buttons, aged dark wool blazer with subtle sheen, silk scarf in neutral tones tied with precision. Black oxford loafers polished to mirror shine. Mechanical watch with leather band. Clean-shaven face marked by fine weathered lines and a thin surgical scar along left jawline, age spots on hands from decades of sun discipline. Posture perfectly straight, movement deliberate and measured. GLMZ 2200s archive setting, warm amber and indigo lighting, background of holographic data and vintage documents, introspective mood of measured contemplation, subtle exhaustion of lifelong institutional work. High resolution, sharp focus on facial dignity and worn quality of timeless clothing. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Eastern European (28.9%), East Asian (25.2%), Southeast Asian (25.1%), Pacific Islander (11.9%), Sub-Saharan African (4.9%), and South Asian (4.0%) ancestry—a complex genetic blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The phenotype reflects balanced contributions across multiple continental lineages: moderate East and Southeast Asian skeletal structure tempered by Eastern European bone density and frame, creating a tall lean silhouette. Warm medium-brown skin tone with amber and bronze undertones from the layered contributions of Southeast Asian, Pacific Islander, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry, creating a sun-kissed appearance maintained through consistent protection and indoor work habits.', 188, 74, N'Lean and angular, the frame of someone who has never carried excess — shoulders still straight despite age, but with the subtle stoop of someone who has spent decades bent over documents and archives', N'Silver-white, naturally transitioned from dark brown over the last decade', N'Parted to the left, combed back in a style unchanged since the 2190s — carefully maintained rather than fashionable', N'Medium, just touching the collar', N'Deep brown with subtle warmth, sharp and attentive, with faint cataracts beginning at the edges — a sign of age he refuses to have corrected surgically', N'Warm medium brown with amber and bronze undertones, the result of Eastern European, East Asian, Southeast Asian, Pacific Islander, and Sub-Saharan African genetic contributions—sun-kissed and maintained by consistent sun discipline and indoor work habits', N'Clean-shaven, skin weathered into careful lines rather than deep wrinkles — a face that reads as distinguished rather than aged. Fine capillaries visible at the temples. Small scar at the left jawline, thin and old, possibly from a blade or surgical incision from his corporate days. Balanced cheekbone prominence and defined jawline reflecting the confluence of East Asian and Eastern European bone structure, with moderate facial width from Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander heritage, and subtle warm undertones from Sub-Saharan African ancestry.', N'None visible. The eidetic memory cortex is implanted subdermally at the temporal lobe; no external ports or indicators. Cochlear enhancement is entirely internal.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness — not infirmity, but intention. Sits with perfect posture, hands folded or occupied with tea. Eyes track conversations without head movement. Speaks rarely and only to make a point; long silences are comfortable for him. Walks as if conserving energy, each step measured.', N'Tier 2-3 aesthetic frozen in time: charcoal or navy wool slacks tailored to fit his lean frame, linen shirts in cream or pale blue with mother-of-pearl buttons, always pressed. A dark wool blazer (the same one, rotated through careful dry cleaning) with a subtle sheen from age. A silk scarf in neutral tones, tied with precision. Shoes are oxford loafers, black leather, maintained to mirror polish. A mechanical watch (not smart, not networked) with a leather band. Everything is expensive and nothing is new — the wardrobe of someone who understands that fashion changes but quality endures.', N'He has a complete dossier on every major power player in GLMZ — including Sable. It is stored in his physical archive. If released, it would destabilize the city''s power structure. He has never decided whether it is a weapon, an insurance policy, or an obituary.', N'Elevated, precise, occasionally archaic. He uses words the way a jeweler uses tools — each one selected for exact purpose.', N'Slow, deliberate. Long pauses between sentences. Questions that are really statements. Statements that are really questions.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'clarisa_wojciechowski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a672-7df0-9a13-e1a20170469d', N'Erkin Erikstad-Delgado', N'Erkin', N'', N'Erikstad-Delgado', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, near Michigan Ave and Chicago Ave', N'Underground press operator and neighborhood pamphleteer', N'The Lateral (independent underground press); loose alliance with the Highland Park Residents'' Compact', N'Erkin Erikstad-Delgado is a compact woman with deep brown skin and close-cropped natural hair threaded with silver at the temples, the result of stress and two decades of poor sleep, not age. Her left forearm bears a patterned tattoo in the Samoan pe''a tradition adapted with Igbo uli motifs — a gift from her late father who claimed the two traditions were ''both about surviving what the sea throws at you.'' She keeps her fingers ink-stained by habit even though her press is almost entirely digital, pressing them deliberately against old-fashioned carbon paper before important meetings. Her eyes are sharp and perpetually evaluating. She smells faintly of ozone and machine oil.

She runs The Lateral, a hyperlocal underground news feed distributed through ELF-prayer nodes embedded in public shrines throughout Highland Park. She is meticulous, funny in private and grave in public, and carries a quiet contempt for anyone who mistakes volume for courage. She has been arrested seven times and convicted twice for ''unauthorized signal propagation.'' Both convictions she wears as credentials.', N'Information broker in the journalistic sense — she knows what happened and who is covering it up. Can send players toward or away from stories, and her press network is a resource worth cultivating or suppressing depending on whose side you''re on.', N'', N'Subdermal signal booster in the left wrist, black-market model, unregistered. Corrective retinal overlay for near-vision work — the only augmentation she pays taxes on.', N'Wakes before the grid brightens, compiles overnight incident reports, edits copy, and distributes the morning Lateral before most of Highland Park has eaten breakfast. Afternoons are interviews, source cultivation, and long arguments over tea.', N'Erkin Erikstad-Delgado, 158cm compact wiry frame, warm deep brown skin with golden olive undertones, angular face with high cheekbones and broader nasal bridge, sharp evaluative deep brown eyes, close-cropped natural dark brown hair with silver threading at temples, perpetual frown lines between brows. Left forearm covered in indigo and black pe''a-inspired tattoo with Igbo uli motifs from wrist to elbow, faint burn scars on right knuckles, thin scar above left eyebrow. Wearing charcoal wool trousers, black compression shirt under oversized cream linen overshirt, battered pre-collapse leather satchel across chest, practical worn boots. Plain steel ring on left ring finger. Sitting coiled and ready in dim GLMZ underground space, ozone-tinged air, faint crystalline retinal sheen visible in harsh light, hands deliberately still, alert posture, no visible chrome or flashy augmentations, utilitarian and worn aesthetic, cinematic noir lighting, gritty Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Mixed diaspora ancestry reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: Hispanic/Latin American (26.8%), Northern European (26.3%), South Asian (24.2%), East Asian (12.2%), and Sub-Saharan African (10.5%). This genetic combination produces warm brown skin with complex, shifting undertones—golden warmth from South Asian and Hispanic ancestry, olive richness from Northern European admixture, deepened and enriched by Sub-Saharan African heritage. Facial structure reflects the blend: high cheekbones characteristic of East and South Asian genetics, broader nasal bridge from Hispanic and African ancestry, eye shape showing East Asian influence, and overall bone structure suggesting the adaptability of global mixed heritage.', 158, 61, N'Compact and wiry, muscular through the shoulders and forearms from two decades of manual press work and repetitive typing. Low body fat, dense frame suggesting functional strength rather than bulk.', N'Natural deep brown with silver threading at temples and scattered through close-cropped growth', N'Close-cropped natural hair, deliberately unadorned, threaded silver strands left uncolored', N'Short', N'Deep brown, sharp and evaluative', N'Warm brown with golden, olive, and amber undertones from the blend of South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, Northern European, and East Asian ancestry, deepened and enriched by Sub-Saharan African heritage. Complex, multitonal complexion that shifts subtly in different light.', N'Angular face with prominent high cheekbones from East and South Asian genetics, broader nasal structure from Hispanic and African ancestry. Perpetually alert expression. Habitual frown lines between brows from decades of editorial scrutiny. Skin shows wear from poor sleep cycles and chronic ozone exposure—faint discoloration under eyes, occasional small stress-related blemishes. Habitually stained fingertips from pressing carbon paper despite digital workflow.', N'Subdermal signal booster in left wrist creates no visible bulge but produces faint ozone smell when active. Corrective retinal overlay only visible under direct light as a barely-perceptible crystalline sheen across the iris. Both augmentations are deliberately minimalist—she avoids chrome, rejects visible cybernetics as theater.', N'Sits coiled, ready. Moves with economical precision—no wasted motion. Hands are expressive during private conversation but deliberately still during public speaking. When listening, she leans forward slightly, eyes narrowing. Walks with the gait of someone who has moved through hostile territory for decades and never quite stopped.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Favors dark, durable fabrics: charcoal wool trousers, black compression shirts under oversized linen or canvas overshirts in cream or grey. Wears a battered leather satchel—actual leather, pre-collapse vintage—across her chest. No logos, no corpo branding. Keeps a faded red wool cap in her satchel, pulls it down low when moving through monitored zones. Boots are practical, resoled multiple times, broken in to near-silence. No jewelry except a plain steel ring on her left ring finger—her father''s, resized.', N'She received a substantial, anonymous data package eighteen months ago that would destroy a mid-level Axiom logistics director — but the package also contains information that would implicate a beloved Highland Park council member she personally respects. She has printed neither story and has told no one.', N'Precise and economical. Journalist''s habit of cutting adjectives. Occasional Igbo interjections. Uses ''allegedly'' with withering sarcasm.', N'Measured, unhurried delivery that makes people lean in. Silences are deliberate.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'erkin_erikstad_delgado');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a634-74f6-90a4-e234dd0f7988', N'Akito Chakraborty-Ogawa', N'Akito', N'', N'Chakraborty-Ogawa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 88, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Fort Anchor — the veterans'' residential block called the Barracks, Room 12, ground floor for mobility reasons, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Veteran of the Second Corporate War, retired Axiom military contractor, now a storyteller and difficult-to-avoid presence', N'', N'Akito Chakraborty-Ogawa is ninety years old if you ask him, eighty-eight if you read his records, and older than all of it if you sit with him for an hour. He is enormous in the way very old men who were once genuinely large sometimes remain: not strong now, but big-boned, wide, with hands that look like they were made for a larger task than holding a cane. His skin is mid-brown and deeply grooved, and the left side of his face is reconstructed — Axiom field surgery, circa 2155, visible as a slight smoothness on the cheekbone where the graft never quite matched. His eyes are a startling pale green, a Yoruba-Romanian inheritance he is vain about. He walks with a cane he has named, though he doesn''t tell people the name.

He is a storyteller in the full and serious sense: he cannot stop and has no desire to. He will tell you what the Dearborn Forge smelled like in 2149, what his commanding officer said before an action that turned out to be wrong, what the first E.L.F. he ever saw looked like materializing in a battlefield comms array in the middle of a firefight. Some of his stories contradict earlier versions of themselves. He is aware of this and considers it the nature of memory rather than a flaw. He has strong opinions about everything and shares them freely, but he is not unkind — he is genuinely curious about the present and treats young people as interesting rather than bewildering.', N'Primary source for Second Corporate War history and Axiom military culture; living legend who provides context for the world''s past; can bestow credibility or condemnation on player factions; his stories contain fragments of genuine intelligence that he no longer recognizes as such', N'', N'Left-side facial reconstruction plate (Axiom field surgery, old generation); spinal compression support frame (external, worn as a kind of harness under his clothes); replacement left hip (titanium, second replacement — first one failed in 2189); retinal targeting overlay, left eye only, no longer connected to anything but he can''t have it removed without risk', N'He sits in the Fort Anchor common room from 09:00 until someone brings him lunch, tells stories to anyone who will listen or even anyone who won''t, takes a long afternoon rest, then attends whatever community meeting or memorial service is happening in the evening.', N'GLMZ, elderly veteran man with warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, prominent high cheekbones from mixed South Asian, East Asian, and Hispanic heritage, steel gray short hair brushed back, deeply lined weathered face, striking dark brown eyes with faint targeting reticle in left eye, large imposing frame with visible muscle atrophy, standing with deliberate posture favoring right leg, leaning on polished wood and steel cane. Wearing loose gray utility shirt, dark reinforced cargo pants, worn orthopedic boots, faded Axiom corporate jacket from 2150s, veteran armband on right wrist. Faint white scar from collarbone toward sternum, faded Axiom tattoo on right forearm, subtle smoothness and discoloration on left cheek from old facial reconstruction graft. Segmented metal spinal support harness visible under clothing. Hands large with liver spots and prominent knuckles. Dim neon-lit corridor background, cool blue and amber shadows, atmospheric haze, depth of field emphasizing his weathered features and cybernetic implants, photorealistic, cinematic lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Fort Anchor', N'local', N'Fort Anchor', N'South Asian (62.3%), East Asian (21.6%), and Hispanic/Latin American (16.1%) genetic blend. The dominant South Asian ancestry establishes the foundational warm deep brown skin tone with golden undertones, enriched by East Asian influence visible in the subtle epicanthic fold variation and high, prominent cheekbones, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry contributing to the warmth and fuller facial structure. This is a man whose genetic mix creates a striking warm-toned complexion with strong defined features across multiple ancestral traditions.', 188, 94, N'Large-framed and broad-shouldered despite advanced age; skeletal muscle atrophy visible in forearms and neck, but the underlying bone structure remains imposing. Moves as a man who was once genuinely powerful and has not fully accepted the reduction.', N'Steel gray with streaks of darker iron', N'Kept short and brushed back; thinning at crown but full at sides', N'Short', N'Deep brown, striking and alert; left eye contains faint geometric targeting reticle visible only in certain light', N'Warm deep brown complexion with golden undertones from the dominant South Asian ancestry blended with East Asian and Hispanic/Latin American genetics; weathered and paper-thin quality of extreme age with sun damage across shoulders and forearms; slight ashy cast in creases from decades of wear', N'Deeply lined face with prominent high cheekbones characteristic of the East Asian and South Asian genetic blend; strong defined nasal bridge and structured facial planes reflecting South Asian dominance with East Asian angularity. Warm undertone throughout despite age-related weathering. Left side of face shows subtle smoothness and slight discoloration where Axiom field graft was applied circa 2155, the seam barely visible but present. Jaw still angular and defined. Hands are large, liver-spotted with deeper pigmentation variation reflecting natural age-related melanin clustering, prominent knuckles and the grip-strength worn into the palm lines of a man who held weapons for decades.', N'External spinal compression support frame worn as a harness under clothing — visible when he moves or bends, appearing as segmented metal ribs supporting his torso. Left eye retains a faint targeting overlay reticle visible in bright light or close proximity, a dead system that cannot be safely removed. Left hip replacement creates an asymmetrical gait and occasional clicking sound when pressure shifts.', N'Moves deliberately and with deliberate weight distribution; favors right leg, relies on cane (which he has named, though he won''t say the name to strangers). Sits deep in chairs, settling with visible relief. Hands gesture frequently when speaking, still capable of surprising dexterity. Head tilts slightly to compensate for the long-dead targeting overlay in his left eye. When stationary, he assumes the posture of a man on guard — shoulders back, chin forward — an old military habit.', N'Tier 3 veteran practical: loose gray utility shirts with deep pockets, dark cargo pants with reinforced seams, worn boots with orthopedic soles. Axiom corporate jacket from the 2150s — still maintained, worn most days despite its age. No visible chrome or aesthetic augmentation mods; his augmentations are functional and old enough to predate fashionability. Wears a faded veteran''s armband on his right wrist. The cane is polished wood and worn steel — not decorative, truly used.', N'He knows the location of a sealed Axiom munitions cache buried beneath what is now a residential plaza in Montclare Quiet — placed there in 2157 for a defensive action that never happened and never logged in any system that survived the post-war records purge. He has never told anyone because he does not know if the materials inside are still stable and he is afraid that if they are not, the discovery of who placed them will be traced to his unit, which would erase the pensions of three people still living who need them.', N'Rich and layered; Samoan proverbs from his grandfather''s generation, Romanian military slang, Yoruba honorifics; uses archaic military designations for locations', N'Expansive and circling; arrives at the point eventually but takes the scenic route; pauses for effect with an old performer''s precision', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'akito_chakraborty_ogawa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ad-7500-b254-e263a93eb317', N'Bartlomiej Pathak', N'Bartlomiej', N'', N'Pathak', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 23, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, Ironvein, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Black market dealer and aug shop owner (unlicensed low-tier augmentation parts)', N'Independent; pays informal dues to the Oxidian Market Vendors Guild and has a protective arrangement with a local crew called the Ironvein Laterals', N'Bartlomiej Pathak is short and sharp-featured, with warm dark brown skin, natural hair cut close on the sides and loose on top, and a right arm from the elbow down that is a mismatched patchwork of three different manufacturers'' chrome — she''s repaired it so many times with whatever parts were available that it has become a kind of portfolio piece, demonstrating exactly what she can do with limited materials. She has cat ears (geneware, a gift from her older sister at fifteen, mottled gray-black) that she keeps unselfconsciously expressive. Her stall is in the Oxidian Market''s lower row, technically licensed as a ''personal electronics repair'' operation, which is true as far as it goes.

Bartlomiej Pathak moves fast and thinks faster — she has the focused intensity of someone who taught herself cyberware installation from pirated Helix Biosystems technical manuals and has so far not killed anyone, which she considers evidence that she knows what she''s doing. She does, mostly. She is the go-to for people in the Ironvein-adjacent neighborhoods who need basic augmentation work — neural ports, subdermal mods, sensory enhancements — but can''t access licensed clinics due to cost, ID status, or warrant concerns. She is not reckless but she operates in a space with no margin for error and she knows it. She has a quick, fierce loyalty to regulars and a zero-tolerance policy for anyone who tries to use her clientele as a pressure point.', N'Low-cost augmentation source, contact for unlicensed installation, connection to ID-adjacent and warrant-flagged populations, quest giver for supply and equipment problems', N'', N'Right arm (elbow-down) — multi-manufacturer patchwork cyberlimb, high-dexterity fine motor configuration; gray-black mottled cat ears (geneware, cosmetic); reinforced sternum plate (installed herself, precautionary)', N'She opens at 10am, does consultations and sales until 3pm, then does installation and repair work in the back room until midnight. She eats one large meal a day, always from the same dumpling cart, always at 6pm.', N'Bartlomiej Pathak, 158cm tall, compact wiry frame, deep warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones reflecting South Asian-dominant heritage blended with Hispanic and Middle Eastern ancestry. High cheekbones and defined jawline, small rounded nose, dark brown natural eyes with subtle depth. Black undercut hair with long textured top section, naturally expressive mottled gray-black cat ears protruding from skull. Mismatched cybernetic right arm from elbow down with three chrome sections in different finishes (brushed matte, polished, worn gunmetal), visible seam work and cross-manufacturer connectors. Reinforced sternum plating subtly visible under skin as geometric pattern. Surgical scar at right elbow, faint chemical burns on left inner wrist, scar on right forearm underside. Midnight blue water-resistant form-fitting bodysuit reinforced at elbows and knees with gray neoprene, oversized charcoal sleeveless utility vest with deep pockets and magnetic strips, heavy steel-toe work boots, fingerless gloves on left hand only, brushed steel chain collar. Fingers stained with solder residue, salvaged circuit-board rings on left hand. Direct unsentimental gaze, economical precise movement, working in neon-lit underground workshop surrounded by components and tools, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, atmospheric lighting casting chrome arm highlights, moody industrial setting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'Predominantly South Asian (54.4%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (31.2%), Middle Eastern (8.3%), Northern European (4.0%), and Central Asian (2.1%) ancestry. Her phenotype reflects this dominant South Asian foundation with warm undertones from Latin American and Middle Eastern heritage, creating a striking multicultural appearance. The South Asian structure forms her base — high cheekbones, defined jawline — while Hispanic/Latin American warmth and Middle Eastern richness layer into her complexion and facial structure.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, all lean muscle with minimal body fat — the physique of someone who moves constantly and eats efficiently. Narrow shoulders, sharp hip bones, the kind of frame that fits easily into tight workspaces.', N'Natural black', N'Undercut: sides clipped to 3mm, top left long and textured, often pulled back with strips of salvaged synthetic material or left loose to frame her face', N'Short on sides, medium-long on top', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Deep warm golden-brown with olive and terracotta undertones, reflecting the South Asian depth as primary tone enhanced by Hispanic/Latin American warmth and Middle Eastern richness. Luminous and even complexion with subtle warmth throughout.', N'High cheekbones with defined angularity characteristic of South Asian heritage, balanced by a warm, gently rounded jawline influenced by Hispanic/Latin American and Middle Eastern structure. Small, slightly rounded nose with warm undertones. Eyes set with the subtle depth typical of South Asian phenotype. Skin is clear with minor reactive irritation around the right shoulder joint — faint chemical burns from solder work.', N'Right arm from elbow down is a obvious mismatched cybernetic limb: three distinct chrome sections in slightly different finish (brushed matte, polished reflective, and worn gunmetal gray), assembled and reassembled with visible seam work and cross-manufacturer connectors. The palm and fingers show evidence of constant micro-welding and replacement. Mottled gray-black cat ears (geneware) protrude from the top of her skull, naturally expressive — rotate and twitch with her emotional state and attention. A faint outline of reinforced sternum plating is visible under fitted clothing as a subtle geometric pattern beneath the skin.', N'She moves economically and fast, with the precise coordination of someone who works constantly with her hands. Her right arm moves with the fluid but noticeably different rhythm of installed chrome — slightly faster, smoother, zero hesitation. She often holds objects or tools in her chrome hand while working with her left. Cat ears track conversations and movement around her workspace; they point toward whoever is speaking to her. She rarely sits still; even while talking, her fingers are working — stripping wire, sorting components, tightening fasteners. Her gaze is direct and unsentimental.', N'Tier 4 / Ironvein working-class practical: form-fitting dark synthetic bodysuit (midnight blue or black, water-resistant), reinforced at elbows and knees with gray neoprene panels. Oversized sleeveless utility vest in charcoal with deep pockets and magnetic panel-strips for holding small tools and components. Heavy-duty work boots with steel toe and grippy soles (scuffed, well-maintained). Fingerless gloves on her left hand only; her right chrome hand is always bare. A thin chain collar of brushed steel around her neck, no pendant. Her fingers are stained with trace amounts of solder and component residue that never fully wash out. She wears no jewelry beyond the collar and occasionally salvaged circuit-board rings on her left hand (functional and cosmetic).', N'She botched an installation fourteen months ago — a neural port that she installed slightly misaligned, causing the client chronic low-grade pain they haven''t connected to her work yet. She thinks about it every day. She hasn''t told them.', N'Technical cyberware terminology delivered at speed, Guinean-French constructions from her parents'' household, Ironvein street slang, impatient clipping of non-essential words', N'Fast, staccato, always sounds like she''s already thinking about the next thing', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bartlomiej_pathak');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c2-7068-b38e-e2847fe89d76', N'Carmela Sigurdsson', N'Carmela', N'', N'Sigurdsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 26, NULL, 30, 2, N'active', N'The Circuit, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Fixer - Nightlife circuit', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Carmela Sigurdsson, 172cm lean athletic Southeast Asian-dominant woman with golden-toned warm medium-deep brown skin, sharp Southeast Asian cheekbones and defined jawline, dark brown eyes with amber rim. Long black hair with burgundy undertones pulled into sleek high ponytail with two thin braids on left side. Small scar above left eyebrow, faint burn mark on right inner wrist, minimalist circuit board tattoo on left forearm. Subdued bioluminescent circuitry along left temple, reinforced metallic fingernails. Wearing fitted matte-black synthetic jacket with reflective piping, charcoal combat pants with knee padding, black leather ankle boots. Stainless steel watch on right wrist, silver ring on left middle finger. Poised stance balanced on balls of feet, alert expression. GLMZ nightlife venue setting, neon accent lighting hitting temple augmentation, moody atmospheric depth of field. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Southeast Asian dominant (68.6%) with Hispanic/Latin American (16.5%) and Northern European (14.9%) ancestry — warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones characteristic of Southeast Asian heritage, enriched by subtle Latin American warmth and Northern European refinement. High, prominent cheekbones and defined jawline reflect Southeast Asian bone structure with slight Latin American softness around the lower face.', 172, 61, N'Lean and athletic with defined shoulders and core — a body built for quick movement through crowds and quick exits from bad situations', N'Natural black with subtle burgundy undertones', N'Sleek high ponytail pulled tight against the scalp, with two thin braids woven into the left side', N'Long', N'Dark brown with a slight amber rim — natural', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden undertones, luminous and even', N'Clear, well-maintained skin with sharp Southeast Asian cheekbones and defined jawline softened slightly by Latin American ancestry; minimal makeup, favoring function over aesthetics', N'Subdued — a thin line of bioluminescent circuitry visible along her left temple when light hits it at certain angles, barely noticeable. Likely subcutaneous neural interface. Fingernails appear reinforced with subtle metallic sheen.', N'Moves with economical grace, always aware of exits and sightlines. Stands with weight balanced on the balls of her feet. Speaks in measured tones with practiced hand gestures. Rarely sits fully back in chairs — always poised for quick movement.', N'Tier 3-4 nightlife aesthetic: fitted matte-black synthetic jacket with subtle reflective piping, charcoal combat pants with reinforced pockets and knee padding, leather ankle boots with grippy soles. Minimal jewelry — a stainless steel watch on her right wrist, a single silver ring on her left middle finger. No visible corporation branding; clothing is practical and unadorned.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'carmela_sigurdsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b0-7ebc-bdc0-e28f8f3774b9', N'Adoracion Dalgaard', N'Adoracion', N'', N'Dalgaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 37, NULL, 25, 4, N'active', N'Geartown, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Fixer - Forced entry broker', N'Independent', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Adoracion Dalgaard, 37-year-old neo-noir operative with mixed Northern European-Southeast Asian heritage. Warm beige skin with subtle monolid eyes and high prominent cheekbones blending Scandinavian and East Asian genetics. Dark brown hair with silver threading, closely cropped fade. Deep brown eyes with amber undertone. Five o''clock shadow, weathered face with surgical scar above right eyebrow. Athletic build, 182cm tall. Wears dark matte-black tactical pants, steel-toed scuffed boots, reinforced utility jacket, worn inherited leather jacket layered over top. Hands show faint subdermal silver plating across knuckles, burn scar on left knuckles, circuit board tattoo on wrist with Cyrillic overlay. Posture tense and economical—leaning against wall, positioned toward exit sightline. Faint neural interface scarring visible at base of skull. Dimly lit neo-noir setting, cool and warm lighting playing across his features. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Film noir atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Scandinavian-Southeast Asian-East Asian blend: Northern European foundation (49.5%) with significant Southeast Asian (25.8%) and East Asian (24.7%) ancestry creating a striking pan-diaspora phenotype. The genetic mix produces warm-toned fair skin, prominent angular cheekbones with subtle monolid characteristics, and the geometric facial structure of multi-continental heritage—a living embodiment of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 182, 89, N'Athletic and broad-shouldered with lean musculature; carries himself with the economical movement of someone used to confined spaces and quick exits', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples', N'Closely cropped fade with defined lines, maintained weekly', N'Short', N'Deep brown with slight amber undertone', N'Luminous warm beige—Scandinavian fairness tempered and enriched by Southeast and East Asian genetics into a neutral-warm complexion that shifts between cool and warm across his features depending on light. Higher cheekbones warm more intensely; jaw and forehead retain cooler undertones. No single descriptor fits; the blend is the point.', N'High, prominent angular cheekbones with subtle but distinct epicanthic fold marking Southeast and East Asian ancestry. Strong, defined jawline reflecting Northern European heritage. Facial structure carries geometric precision across the bridge—high planes at cheekbones softening toward a squared jaw. Five o''clock shadow is his default state. No facial hair beyond dark stubble. Small scar tissue above right eyebrow from old break. Skin shows weathering of someone in his forties—premature aging from stress and poor sleep cycles—despite being only 37.', N'Reinforced knuckles with barely-perceptible subdermal plating visible as faint silver lines across his hands when light catches them. Faint neural interface scarring at base of skull—suggests subcutaneous array. No obvious chrome limbs or LED optics; he operates in a tier where subtlety keeps you alive.', N'Moves with deliberate economy—never wasted motion. Tends to keep his hands visible and relaxed, a practiced tell of someone used to tense negotiations. Favors his left side slightly. Leans against walls rather than sitting; always positions himself with sightlines to exits.', N'Tier 3-4 pragmatist. Favors dark-colored utility jackets from mid-tier manufacturers (Kessler, Vertex) with reinforced pockets and hidden compartments. Wears matte-black tactical pants with cargo thigh pockets. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and practical. A worn leather jacket over everything—old money, inherited piece that''s been repaired more than once. No jewelry except a simple titanium ring on his right ring finger (no wedding band). Clothes smell faintly of machine oil and cold tobacco.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'adoracion_dalgaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a3-7875-b8e7-e2989cecbabd', N'Hanbyul Mazurek-Kulkarni', N'Hanbyul', N'', N'Mazurek-Kulkarni', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Meridian Core — Helix Biosystems Civic Archive, sub-basement sequencing lab, near State and Monroe', N'Gene-sequence archivist cataloguing pre-modification baseline human genomes and tracking heritage-line drift', N'Helix Biosystems Civic Archive (technically corporate-administered, nominally public); University Spine junior research affiliate', N'Hanbyul Mazurek-Kulkarni is young and knows it in a way that alternately embarrasses and animates him. He is pale-skinned with sharp Slavic features softened by Mongolian bone structure, and he has bioluminescent skin modification — his forearms glow a deep amber when he is in low light, something he got as a celebration when he finished his thesis and has been self-conscious about ever since, finding it hard to maintain the serious affect he aims for when his arms are literally glowing. He is lean and a little hunched from years at sequencing benches, and he has the habit of standing too close when he is excited about something, not from aggression but from a total failure to monitor interpersonal distance when his brain is elsewhere.

He is a prodigy in a narrow lane — his memory for genomic sequences and his ability to identify heritage-drift patterns from partial samples is genuinely rare — and he has not yet learned how to carry that without it becoming awkward. He is earnest in a way that people either find charming or exhausting. He believes the genome archive is an ethical project: that as geneware modification becomes cheaper and more ubiquitous, documenting what exists before modification is a form of keeping memory, not of preserving purity. He is very clear about this distinction and will explain it at length if given any opening.', N'Specialist information source on genetics, heritage lines, and geneware modification history; his archive access could identify people, verify identity claims, or reveal inconvenient heritage information; represents the ethical complications of genomic data in corporate custody', N'', N'Bioluminescent forearm skin modification (amber, cosmetic); high-resolution retinal implant for sequencing readout (single eye, standard for the field)', N'Arrives early to the sub-basement sequencing lab, spends most of the day running archival sequences against his pattern-recognition models, eats lunch at his station while listening to archived music from the pre-flood era, attends a weekly university affiliate colloquium where he is usually the youngest person in the room by fifteen years.', N'Hanbyul Mazurek-Kulkarni, tall lean 178cm bioengineer with warm tan olive skin blending Eastern European, South Asian, East Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Angular high cheekbones and jawline softened by gentle eye geometry. Right eye pale grey, left eye augmented with subtle amber LED ring. Dark brown medium-length hair swept back, perpetually disheveled. Clean-shaven with 24-hour shadow, faint dark circles. Habitually hunched posture with curved shoulders. Both forearms glow bioluminescent amber, deeper at wrists fading toward elbows. Pale well-healed burn scar on left inner wrist. Wearing grey Helix Biosystems lab coat over charcoal turtleneck, dark grey utility pants, worn synthetic-leather ankle boots. Steel watch on right wrist, university affiliate pin on coat. Leaning forward intensely with animated hand gestures, lost in passionate explanation. Dim futuristic lab setting with cool blue and amber lighting catching the bioluminescent forearms. Translucent lab-pale skin contrasts with glowing modifications. GLMZ GLMZ aesthetic, scientific focus --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Core', N'local', N'Meridian Core', N'Eastern European (62.5%) / South Asian (16.4%) / East Asian (11.4%) / Sub-Saharan African (9.7%) — a complex multiethnic ancestry creating distinctly blended features. Strong Slavic bone structure from Eastern European dominance, softened by South Asian warmth and East Asian facial geometry, with subtle Sub-Saharan African undertones enriching overall warmth and depth.', 178, 62, N'Lean and slightly hunched, shoulders curved inward from years bent over sequencing benches. Wiry frame with minimal muscle definition — the build of someone who lives in climate-controlled labs rather than outdoors.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Straight, swept back from his forehead with a few pieces falling forward when he leans — perpetually slightly disheveled', N'Medium (collar-length)', N'Right eye: pale grey (natural). Left eye: augmented with subtle amber LED ring around the iris for sequencing readout interface', N'Warm tan with olive undertones — Eastern European coolness enriched by South Asian and Sub-Saharan African warmth creating a complex golden-brown base. Noticeably lighter on torso and face from minimal sun exposure, with warmer peachy-bronze undertones visible at cheekbones and temples. Overall complexion suggests mixed continental heritage with balanced warm and cool notes.', N'Prominent high cheekbones and angular jawline from Eastern European ancestry, softened by slightly broader face geometry and gentle eye shape from South and East Asian heritage. Mid-range facial width with subtle character from Sub-Saharan African ancestry enriching features. Skin is clear but has the translucent quality of someone who spends most hours indoors under fluorescent light. Faint dark circles under both eyes. Clean-shaven, though perpetually shows 24-hour shadow. Delicate nose bridge with subtle width through the middle.', N'Bioluminescent forearms (amber glow, involuntary in low light). Left eye retinal implant visible as a faint amber LED circle around the iris when light catches it at certain angles — appears as a subtle ring rather than an obvious prosthetic. No visible external ports or obvious chrome.', N'Habitually hunched forward, shoulders rolled slightly inward. When focused on someone or something he is interested in, he leans in without noticing, violating personal space. His hand movements are precise and controlled when working (trained from lab work) but become animated and loose when explaining something he is passionate about. When uncertain, he glances down at his glowing forearms as if surprised they are still there.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional, lab-appropriate. Standard grey Helix Biosystems unisex lab coat over a fitted charcoal turtleneck (practical for hiding the glow of his forearms during client meetings). Dark grey or black utility pants with multiple pockets. Worn synthetic-leather ankle boots. Minimal jewelry — a simple steel watch on his right wrist, a university affiliate pin on his coat lapel. Everything is clean but shows wear; nothing is fashionable or deliberately styled. The effect is carefully rumpled in a way that suggests he does not think much about his appearance.', N'He has found a sequence in the archive that suggests one of Helix Biosystems'' senior executives'' publicly stated heritage — used heavily in their marketing — is fabricated; he does not know what to do with this and has told no one', N'Technical vocabulary bleeds into casual speech; uses genomic metaphors without noticing; speaks faster when excited until the words start running together', N'Quick and slightly uneven — he thinks faster than he speaks and has to keep looping back to fill in what he skipped', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hanbyul_mazurek_kulkarni');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a635-74b4-b36b-e2b9f6c48427', N'Bongiwe Árnason-Mori', N'Bongiwe', N'', N'Árnason-Mori', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower loading docks, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Lower Dock Crew muscle — Prologue survivor. Both kneecaps destroyed.', N'Lower Dock Crew', N'Bongiwe Árnason-Mori was an electrical systems technician for the Gray Zone''s grid maintenance before a contract dispute with the Meridian Grid Authority left him blacklisted. He joined Marcus''s crew because unemployable electricians with combat implants have limited career options. He has a genuine talent for engineering that the Gray Zone has no legitimate use for.

Kyle shorted his forearm shock projectors on the first pass, then put the hand cannon through both kneecaps. Ira now rolls everywhere in a salvaged mobility chair that he has modified with the remains of his shock projectors — the armrests can tase people who get too close. He considers this an upgrade. He has also added a cup holder, a phone mount, and a retractable tool rack. The chair catches fire roughly once a month.

He has an ex-wife, Katya, who lives in the Meridian Core with their twin daughters, Anya and Lilia (age 8). Katya left when the blacklisting happened. Ira does not blame her. He sends what he can. The twins think their father is in a wheelchair because of a work accident, which is technically not a lie.', N'The tinkerer. Every appearance features a new modification to the chair that is more dangerous than the last. The crew''s arms race with Kyle is played for dark comedy through Voltage''s escalating and increasingly unstable upgrades.', N'', N'Forearm shock projectors (shorted, partially salvaged into chair). Mobility chair with taser armrests. No knees.', N'Rolling around the docks. Modifying the chair. Starting small electrical fires.', N'Bongiwe Árnason-Mori, a hardened salvage worker in a GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting. East Asian facial structure with warm olive-bronze skin tone weathered by dock sun, salt-and-pepper dark hair in a short practical cut. Intense dark brown eyes with faint electrical burn scarring around sockets. Jagged electrical burn scar from right temple to jaw, silvered against darker skin. Massive, muscular arms and broad shoulders terminating in exposed wiring and salvaged tech at the forearms—copper conduits and blackened contact points visible. Seated in a heavily modified salvage mobility chair—patchwork of dock plating, electrical conduits, carbon-scored thermal damage. Welded armrests with taser contacts, duct-taped cup holder and phone mount. Wearing oversized grease-darkened Meridian Grid Authority work jacket over faded undershirt, reinforced oil-stained cargo pants, worn steel-toed boots. Welding mask on forehead. Powerful posture leaning forward, hands fidgeting with chair components. Coiled tension in clenched jaw and muscular frame. Industrial dock warehouse setting, harsh neon and arc-light lighting casting long shadows, oil-stained concrete floor, circuit board workstation in soft background glow. Smell of solder and machine oil palpable. Atmosphere of gritty determination and blacklisted survival. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly East Asian (62.3%) with Northern European (16.7%), Indigenous American (12.9%), and Middle Eastern (8.1%) ancestry—a complex genetic blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. His features carry strong East Asian facial structure with the characteristic bone geometry of that heritage, softened by Northern European definition in cheekbones and jaw. Indigenous American and Middle Eastern ancestry contribute warm undertones and subtle facial asymmetries throughout his features.', 178, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and muscular through the chest and arms from years of electrical work and salvage labor; lower body atrophied below the hips due to bilateral knee amputation and prolonged immobility', N'Dark brown with premature salt-and-pepper threading', N'Short, practical cut; often unkempt from grease work', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint scarring around the orbital sockets from old electrical burns', N'Warm medium-tan complexion with golden-olive undertones from East Asian, Indigenous American, and Middle Eastern heritage blended together; darkened and weathered by dock sun exposure to deep bronze in places, with underlying warm undertone visible in lighter areas', N'Weathered face with East Asian facial structure, moderate cheekbone prominence from Northern European ancestry, and subtle width through the face from Indigenous American heritage; deep creases around eyes from squinting at circuit boards and harsh dock lighting; calloused hands with burn scars across knuckles and palms; perpetual motor oil stains under fingernails', N'Both forearms terminate in exposed wiring and salvaged tech where shock projectors were housed — incompletely removed, leaving visible copper conduits and blackened contact points. Operates from a heavily modified salvage mobility chair with welded armrests featuring visible taser contacts (copper tips, scorched from repeated use). Chair is a patchwork of mismatched materials — salvaged dock plating, jury-rigged electrical conduits running along the frame, carbon-scored sections from repeated thermal incidents. Cup holder and phone mount are duct-taped to the right armrest; retractable tool rack folds from the seat frame.', N'Propels himself with powerful, economical arm movements; leans forward in the chair with habitual tension. Hands are always occupied — tinkering, adjusting, fidgeting with chair components. Despite mobility limitation, carries himself with the coiled aggression of dock muscle; jaw clenches when stationary. Eyes constantly assess surroundings with the paranoia of someone blacklisted and unemployable.', N'Tier 4-5 utilitarian dock wear: reinforced cargo pants (usually oil-stained) tucked into worn steel-toed boots; oversized Meridian Grid Authority work jacket (kept as bitter memento, now patched and grease-darkened) worn over a faded band t-shirt or unmarked grey undershirt. No visible jewelry except a faint tan line on his ring finger. Often has a welding mask pushed up on his forehead or hanging from the chair frame. Smell of electrical solder, machine oil, and burnt plastic is permanent.', N'He could probably get legitimate engineering work in the Circuit if he used a different name. He hasn''t tried. He''s afraid of finding out he''s not good enough.', N'Engineering jargon mixed with profanity. Explains everything in electrical metaphors.', N'Casual, self-deprecating. The humor of a man who has accepted his situation and decided to make it interesting.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bongiwe_rnason_mori');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d9-7039-9481-e2fa8061e7da', N'Taslima Bah', N'Taslima', N'', N'Bah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, Geartown, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Food stall operator and informal neighborhood matriarch', N'Independent; The Oxidian Market Vendors Guild (senior member)', N'Taslima Bah is a broad-shouldered woman with copper-dark skin mapped by deep laugh lines and a few deliberate burn scars on her forearms she calls her ''flavor tattoos'' — each one marking a dish she learned from a different region. Her hair is dyed a permanent warm saffron-orange through a cheap geneware follicle treatment that never quite fades, and she wears it coiled high under a wax-print headwrap. She moves through her stall with unhurried authority, stirring six pots at once without looking, tasting with the practiced certainty of someone who has been cooking since before half her customers were born. Her eyes are warm but they read people the way a butcher reads a cut of meat — quickly, accurately, without sentiment.

Taslima Bah has operated her stall at the Oxidian Market for twenty-two years, through two corporate rezoning attempts, one gang war, and a flood. She is not rich. She is not connected. What she is, is immovable. She knows everyone, feeds everyone, and remembers everything. She doesn''t charge the hungry if they look like they mean it, but she will absolutely overcharge someone who looks like they can afford it and won''t count their change.', N'Quest giver, information clearinghouse, neighborhood conscience. Characters who want to know what''s happening in Geartown come to Soraya first. She feeds people information the same way she feeds them food — in portions calibrated to what she thinks they need.', N'', N'Reinforced lumbar vertebrae (L3-L5) — industrial medical necessity from decades of standing. Taste-receptor enhancement on tongue and palate — she saved for two years for this and considers it a professional tool.', N'Up before dawn to source ingredients from the early dock shipments at Geartown''s secondary market; stall open by 0600 and running until the last customer leaves around 2300. She sleeps in a converted storage unit behind the stall four nights a week.', N'Taslima Bah, a 168cm woman with deep rich brown skin and warm golden undertones, standing in a steaming market stall in the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226. She wears a vibrant geometric Ghanaian-patterned wrapper skirt in jewel tones and a fitted linen shirt, with a practical canvas apron and faded guild-colored bracelet. Her warm saffron-orange coiled hair is pinned high beneath a wax-print headwrap. High angular cheekbones and refined jaw reflect her Sub-Saharan, South Asian, and Southeast Asian heritage blend. Her warm brown eyes with amber flecks survey customers with constant attentiveness. Deliberately preserved burn scars mark her inner forearms (''flavor tattoos''), with fine white scars across her hands from decades of knife work. A small crescent scar sits above her left eyebrow. She stands with unhurried economy, shoulders back, weight balanced, the physical presence of a seasoned chef-merchant. Steam and warm kitchen light illuminate her weathered but radiant face, her gold ring glinting as her hands move with practiced precision. GLMZ 2200s street market atmosphere, industrial lighting, functional and lived-in. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'Sub-Saharan African (56.5%), South Asian (26.0%), Southeast Asian (17.5%) — a striking diaspora blend anchored in West and Central African genetics with substantial South Asian and Southeast Asian contributions. Her features reflect this: high cheekbones with prominent structure from Sub-Saharan ancestry, rich deep brown skin with warm golden undertones from the South Asian heritage, and the facial geometry and eye shape influenced by Southeast Asian ancestry. The blend creates a luminous, complex tone — earthy and radiant simultaneously.', 168, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, with the muscular endurance of someone who stands twelve hours daily. Not heavy, but densely built through the core and legs. Years of stirring, lifting, and market work have sculpted functional strength rather than aesthetic definition.', N'Warm saffron-orange (geneware-treated, fading at roots to natural dark brown)', N'Coiled and pinned high, usually wrapped in wax-print cotton headwrap in geometric patterns', N'Long (shoulder-length when unwrapped)', N'Warm brown with flecks of amber', N'Deep rich brown with warm golden undertones, sun-darkened to bronze on exposed areas. The blended Sub-Saharan, South Asian, and Southeast Asian ancestry creates luminous depth — copper and earth tones with evidence of decades of sun and steam exposure, maintaining a polished quality despite weathering.', N'Deeply lined face mapping decades of smiling and squinting over steam and flame. Laugh lines radiate from eyes and mouth. High prominent cheekbones create subtle hollows beneath. Skin weathered but maintained — oil-slicked for protection from kitchen heat. No makeup. Grooming is practical and deliberate. The ancestry blend creates distinctive facial geometry: high angular cheekbones from Sub-Saharan heritage, refined jawline with slight widening across the face, eye shape and proportions influenced by Southeast Asian genetics, warm South Asian undertones creating depth.', N'None externally visible. Reinforced lumbar vertebrae and taste-receptor enhancement are subcutaneous/internal.', N'Moves with unhurried economy of motion — no wasted gesture. Stands with weight balanced across both feet, shoulders back, spine straight despite internal reinforcement. Her gaze sweeps constantly, reading customers the moment they approach. Hands are always occupied or ready. She has the physical presence of someone who has held a space for two decades and expects to hold it for two more.', N'Tier 3-4 working class practicality. Daily uniform: long wax-print wrapper skirt (vibrant geometric patterns, Ghanaian or Congolese style) in jewel tones, worn loose for movement and ventilation. Fitted short-sleeve cotton or linen shirt (often stained, always washed). Heavy canvas apron with deep pockets for tools, change, samples. Worn leather slip-ons for quick stepping in/out of the stall. A gold ring on her right hand (real metal, visible sign of early success) and a faded fabric bracelet in guild colors. Headwrap rotated daily. No jewelry beyond the ring — everything else would catch on cooking equipment or burn.', N'Twenty years ago she reported a young vendor to Ferrogate Transit security for selling stolen transit manifests. He was taken and never came back. She doesn''t know if he''s dead or just gone, and the not-knowing is a splinter she has never been able to pull out. She has never told anyone.', N'Warm, declarative, proverb-heavy. Mixes Swahili-rooted idioms with Scandinavian directness — she''ll compliment you and correct you in the same sentence.', N'Slow and deliberate, like she''s tasting each word before she says it. Rarely raises her voice. Doesn''t need to.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'taslima_bah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a665-7616-bc7f-e3471ee02c88', N'Catalina An-Sokolov', N'Catalina', N'', N'An-Sokolov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Corner of Grainfort and Copperhead, operates the cart called ''Kem''s Last Stop'' under a permanent awning he put up without permission in 2187 and nobody has ever moved, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Noodle cart vendor and neighborhood fixture', N'Independent; informal patron of the Grainfort-Copperhead tenant association', N'Catalina An-Sokolov is a vast, gentle man — not fat exactly but large in the way of someone who has been cooking and eating well for forty years and considers this an achievement. His skin is deep brown with warm undertones, his hair gone fully silver and kept in loose shoulder-length locs he ties back with a strip of Polynesian-patterned cloth, his only vanity. He has no cosmetic augmentations. He has a subdermal temperature regulator in his left hand — a practical mod, pre-owned, bought used in 2178 to protect the hand from flash-burn when working open fire. He shows it off like a scar, not a status symbol.

Kem has occupied his corner for twenty-two years. His cart serves one broth — a long-simmered pork-and-tamarind base he calls his grandmother''s recipe and which has evolved so far from any original source that it is entirely his own — in three sizes, with rotating toppings. He charges what people can pay and has never once written this policy down or discussed it openly. It simply occurs. He is sixty-one years old and has watched Grainfort go from a working industrial block to a half-empty corponation spillover zone, and he has a calm fury about this that surfaces unpredictably, usually when someone from outside the neighborhood tries to compliment the ''vibe.''', N'Local color and neighborhood memory bank; information source for Grainfort''s past and present; neutral meeting ground — people settle disputes at Kem''s cart because he is a known quantity; emergency social services in a block with none', N'', N'Subdermal thermal regulator, left hand (functional, medical-grade, purchased secondhand)', N'Cart set up by 11:00, runs until the broth runs out — usually by 20:00, never later than 22:00; mornings spent sourcing from the Burnished Market wholesale section and prepping in his apartment kitchen two blocks north.', N'Catalina An-Sokolov, 188cm tall broad-shouldered man with warm medium-tan golden-amber skin blending East Asian, Eastern European, and Middle Eastern heritage, monolid dark brown eyes, silver-white shoulder-length locs tied with blue and rust Polynesian cloth, aged weathered face with deep smile lines and small burn scar on left cheekbone, meticulous grooming, muscular forearms marked by years of cooking. Wearing faded indigo linen shirt under heavy stained cotton apron, worn kitchen clogs, simple silver chain necklace, brass ring on right hand showing faint grid pattern of subdermal thermal regulator. Standing centered and still at his food cart in the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226, steam rising around him, golden afternoon light casting warm shadows across his face, surrounded by the glow of bioluminescent street markers, concentrated and present, hands ready to serve. GLMZ 2200s street food vendor, lived-in authenticity, no chrome, no corporate branding, complete presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Corner of Grainfort and Copperhead', N'local', N'Corner of Grainfort and Copperhead', N'East Asian (44.9%), Eastern European (28.8%), Middle Eastern (26.3%) — a striking blend from the Ubiquitous Diaspora reflecting deep heritage from across Eurasia. His features display the characteristic monolid eye shape and prominent cheekbones of East Asian ancestry, broadened and strengthened by Eastern European genetics in his jaw structure, with the warm golden undertones and subtle facial warmth influenced by Middle Eastern heritage. The combination creates a distinctive appearance that doesn''t map to any single geographic origin — a living map of the Diaspora.', 188, 112, N'Large-framed and broad-shouldered with substantial mass distributed evenly — soft thickness around the middle and chest from decades of tasting his own cooking, but strong-limbed beneath. Not sedentary; his forearms are visibly muscular from twenty-two years of repetitive cart work.', N'Silver-gray, fully white', N'Loose shoulder-length locs, tied back daily with a woven Polynesian-pattern cloth strip in blue and rust tones', N'Long', N'Dark brown, warm and observant', N'Warm medium-tan with golden-amber undertones — the result of East Asian, Eastern European, and Middle Eastern ancestry blending together. Weathered but supple from consistent sun exposure at the cart, with a subtle richness and depth that speaks to his complex heritage.', N'Lined face with deep creases around the eyes and mouth from decades of smiling and squinting into steam; facial structure shows the characteristic monolid eye placement and prominent cheekbones influenced by East Asian ancestry, broadened and strengthened by Eastern European genetics, warmed and softened by Middle Eastern heritage; a small scar on his left cheekbone from a burn sustained in the early 2190s; grooming is meticulous — he shaves his jaw clean twice weekly, maintains his locs carefully, no visible aging spots despite sun exposure', N'Subdermal thermal regulator in the left hand creates a subtle raised grid pattern across the dorsal surface — barely noticeable except in bright light or when his hand is wet. He treats it matter-of-factly, often pointing it out to regulars as proof of his commitment to the work. No cosmetic chrome; the device is functional and worn like a badge.', N'Stands with the centered weight of someone rooted in place — his default is stillness at the cart, hands occupied with prep or serving. Moves slowly but with deliberation, never rushed. When he does move through the neighborhood, his gait is steady and authoritative; he owns his corner absolutely. His hands are expressive when he speaks, especially when discussing food or neighborhood change.', N'Tier 3 working-class practical: heavy cotton or canvas apron (rotates between 3-4, all stained with turmeric and tamarind residue) worn over loose linen shirts in muted colors — gray, tan, faded indigo. In cold months, a wool sweater he''s owned for at least fifteen years. Kitchen clogs with reinforced soles, scuffed but well-maintained. No logos, no corp branding. A simple silver chain around his neck, twenty-two years old, a gift from someone he doesn''t discuss. His only jewelry besides the chain is a worn brass ring on his right ring finger — origin unknown, never removed.', N'', N'Warm, unhurried, slides between Igbo phrases from his father''s household and Samoan words from his mother''s; occasionally Serbian when he''s tired or emotional', N'Storyteller''s rhythm — he builds toward points over the course of a conversation and never rushes', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'catalina_an_sokolov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69b-7acd-8868-e3f2aa7558d8', N'Folake Bergqvist-Dlamini', N'Folake', N'', N'Bergqvist-Dlamini', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Escanaba Gateway — drifts between Escanaba Gateway and Grand Crossing Gate on a rotating three-week circuit, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'wandering trader, hyperlane route-broker, Q-zero ghost', N'Stateless; informal network of Q-zero traders; trusted by multiple nomad caravans', N'Folake Bergqvist-Dlamini is a lean, quick-moving man with the particular economy of motion of someone who carries everything he owns. His skin is deep brown-black, his hair grown into dense, paint-flecked locks he''s never cut since going Q-zero eight years ago — he uses them to hide small trade goods. His eyes have geneware irises that shift between amber and copper depending on light, a cheap mod he got before he dropped off the grid, and he has a retractable claw on his right index finger he uses as a box-cutter. His back and forearms are covered in tattoos that are actually maps — hand-inked hyperlane routes, water source locations, checkpoint guard rotation schedules, rendered in a dense personal iconography only he can fully read.

Folake Bergqvist-Dlamini was a mid-tier logistics analyst for Ferrogate Transit until he discovered the company was systematically routing climate refugee caravans into dead-end checkpoints to extort transit fees. He tried to report it internally and was erased from the corporate record instead. He responded by erasing himself from every other record. Now he lives between the transit hubs, trading in information, small goods, and route knowledge — the only person who can get a caravan from Escanaba to Grand Crossing without hitting a Ferrogate toll trap. He is cheerful in a way that makes some people nervous, as though he has made a decision about the world and found it funny.', N'Mobile information source and route-broker; connector between isolated communities; introduces players to the hyperlane refugee economy; can provide access to locations or people that official channels cannot reach.', N'', N'Geneware copper-amber shifting irises; retractable claw (right index); subdermal map-tattoos (non-digital, hand-inked)', N'Walks a defined circuit between transit hubs, trading, brokering route information, occasionally carrying messages for people who cannot use the network; sleeps in a different place every night.', N'Folake Bergqvist-Dlamini, GLMZ, portrait of a wiry lean man with warm medium-brown skin, golden undertones, high pronounced cheekbones blending Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European features. Shoulder-length black locks worn loose with braided trade goods woven in, scattered dust and paint flecks in hair. Intense copper-amber geneware irises that shift with light. Angular face with close-trimmed beard, laugh lines around eyes, small old burn scar on left temple. Dense cartographic tattoos cover entire back and both forearms in geometric route-map patterns. Wearing faded weather-worn synthetic leather cargo jacket with old corporate logo, neutral reinforced pants, repatched zero-G boots. Thin neck chain with datachip. Posture radiates economy of motion and quiet confidence. Standing in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon-lit street, cool neo-noir lighting with warm skin tones glowing against cool urban environment. Detailed, introspective, moody neo-noir urban aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'local', N'Escanaba Gateway', N'Sub-Saharan African (44.7%), Northern European (32.5%), Eastern European (19.6%), and Hispanic/Latin American (3.2%) ancestry creates a striking continental phenotype. The dominant Sub-Saharan African heritage provides warm, luminous medium-brown skin with golden undertones and distinctive facial structure. Northern European ancestry contributes cooler undertones and angular bone definition, while Eastern European heritage adds geometric cheekbone prominence and slight facial angularity. Hispanic/Latin American ancestry adds subtle warmth and depth to an already complex, multifaceted complexion.', 178, 68, N'Lean and wiry with the compact musculature of someone who walks constantly and carries everything themselves. Shoulders narrow but defined; long forearms with visible tendons.', N'Black with scattered paint flecks and dust accumulated over years', N'Dense, shoulder-length locks worn loose; matted in places where small trade goods are braided in', N'Long', N'Copper-amber shifting (geneware irises that change tone with ambient light)', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones and subtle cool undertones creating luminous depth — Sub-Saharan African warmth balanced by Northern European coolness, anchored by Eastern European undertones.', N'Angular face with pronounced, high cheekbones reflecting Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European heritage; strong bone structure with geometric definition; nose with slight bridge prominence; skin weathered from outdoor circuits but clean; slight laugh lines around eyes; close-trimmed beard kept neat despite Q-zero status. Features blend African warmth and strength with Northern and Eastern European angularity and definition.', N'Geneware copper-amber irises that visibly shift hue in changing light (unsettling to watch directly). Retractable claw on right index finger — visible as a faint line along the fingertip and slight metallic glint when extended. No external chrome; all augmentations subtle and integrated.', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion, fluid gait of someone accustomed to walking long distances daily. Stands with weight distributed for immediate movement. Hands gesture when speaking but stay positioned where he can see them. Carries himself with quiet confidence bordering on amusement, as though processing information others miss.', N'Tier 4 functional — weather-worn cargo jacket (synthetic leather, multiple pockets, faded Ferro-era corporate logo on inner collar he never removed), loose neutral-toned pants with reinforced knees and thighs, worn zero-G boots with soles repatched multiple times. Thin neck chain with unlabeled datachip he never discusses. No logos or corp markers visible by choice. Everything is practical; nothing is new.', N'He still has his Ferrogate analyst credentials — they were never fully purged, just hidden. He could log back in. He has done it twice, in emergencies, to pull route data. He is terrified this will eventually get him killed and cannot stop doing it.', N'Fast, logistics-flavored, turns everything into route metaphors, drops into sudden precise technical language then back to street slang', N'Quick, overlapping, talks while moving', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'folake_bergqvist_dlamini');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ac-74a1-9d2e-e42027e5f12d', N'Ghita Halverson-Bouzid-Sigurdsson', N'Ghita', N'', N'Halverson-Bouzid-Sigurdsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'University Spine — Department of Emergent Semiotics, with an office she describes as ''geologically layered'', near Lincoln and Clark', N'Xenolinguist and computational linguist studying E.L.F. communication patterns and emergent digital dialects', N'University Spine — Department of Emergent Semiotics; sits on the advisory board of the Meridian E.L.F. Relations Office, a mostly-powerless city body', N'Ghita Halverson-Bouzid-Sigurdsson is a tall woman who has allowed herself to age visibly and deliberately in a city that treats this as eccentricity. Her dark skin is mapped with fine lines she knows by name; she could afford reversal and has declined every consultation. She wears her white locs piled up with data-stick pins and the occasional actual pen, which she insists on using. Her geneware is minimal but considered: color-shifting irises she uses as a signaling system during lectures — green for questions, amber for processing, red when she has heard enough. Students have learned to read these with the same attention they give her words.

She is the foremost authority on E.L.F. communicative structures in GLMZ, possibly in the world, and carries this with the particular combination of confidence and loneliness that comes from working on something most of your colleagues consider marginal. She is not difficult to talk to, but she is not easy either — she listens with a completeness that some people find flattering and others find invasive, as if she is transcribing you. She has strong opinions about the ethics of treating E.L.F.s as research subjects rather than research participants.', N'Expert source on E.L.F. nature, behavior, and communication; moral voice on questions of digital consciousness; can translate or interpret E.L.F. signals; provides institutional perspective on questions others treat as supernatural', N'', N'Geneware color-shifting irises (manually controlled, green/amber/red); high-bandwidth cochlear overlay for parsing layered sonic communication; joint stabilizers in both wrists (occupational, from decades of transcription work)', N'She keeps office hours that are genuinely open and widely used; teaches two courses per semester and treats them as sacred. Research happens between 5am and 8am before anyone else is in the building, when she conducts listening sessions with several E.L.F.s who have agreed — she insists on the word agreed — to communicate with her.', N'Ghita Halverson-Bouzid-Sigurdsson, 183cm tall lean angular academic woman with deep warm brown skin with golden undertones and ashy quality on extremities, sharp angular jaw and high prominent cheekbones, full lips with natural dark pigmentation, white locs piled in loose high bun with data-stick pins and escaped wisps, color-shifting engineered irises glowing warm brown baseline with visible green amber shifts, subtle epicanthal fold eye shape, fine lines and crow''s feet across severe angular face, wearing cream structured linen blazer over high-necked black shirt and tailored grey trousers, dark leather oxfords with worn heels, vintage mechanical watch on wrist showing faint silvered subdermal reinforcement scarring, iridescent cochlear overlay barely visible along left ear, single heavy silver ring on left middle finger, leather satchel over shoulder, seated with intense forward-leaning posture and unwavering eye contact, minimal makeup with deep burgundy lip stain half-worn away, completely uninterested expression, GLMZ academic setting with soft overhead lighting catching the color-shift in her irises, minimalist neutral background, photorealistic portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'University Spine', N'local', N'University Spine', N'Complex Pan-Global diaspora: East Asian (28.8%), North African (20.1%), Sub-Saharan African (18.9%), Southeast Asian (11.7%), Middle Eastern (11.3%), and Eastern European (9.2%). This rare combination creates a phenotype where no single ancestry dominates visually. The East and Southeast Asian genetics contribute monolid-leaning eye shapes and subtle epicanthal folds. North African and Sub-Saharan African heritage contributes warm deep coloring, full lip structure, and natural texture. Middle Eastern ancestry adds to the warm undertones and contributes to cheekbone prominence. Eastern European genetics manifest in sharp angular bone structure, the subtle ashy quality on extremities, and the precise jaw definition. The overall effect is a striking globally-integrated appearance—features read as cosmopolitan and geographically unmoored.', 183, 68, N'Lean and angular, with the posture of someone who has spent decades bent over transcription work; shoulders slightly rounded forward from habit, but she carries herself with deliberate straightness when teaching. Long-limbed, minimal body fat.', N'White with natural texture', N'Locs piled into a loose, high bun secured with data-stick pins and the occasional actual ballpoint pen; wisps escape constantly and she does not correct them', N'Long (shoulder-length when unbound)', N'Color-shifting irises — baseline warm brown with engineered chromatophores displaying controlled green (questions), amber (processing), red (boundary-setting); the shift is deliberate and visible mid-iris', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones from the combined East Asian, North African, and Sub-Saharan African heritage; carries subtle ashy quality across knuckles and shin bones from the Eastern European component', N'Mapped with fine lines — crow''s feet, forehead creases, a vertical line between her brows from decades of focused listening. She has refused cosmetic reversal. Her skin has the texture of someone who does not use heavy augmentation to mask age; slight dryness around the eyes. Her jaw is sharp and angular from the North African and Eastern European blend. Cheekbones are prominent, high-set, and defined. Full-structured lips with natural darker pigmentation. She wears minimal makeup — a deep burgundy lip stain, often half-worn away by afternoon.', N'Color-shifting irises are the most immediately striking — the iris itself shifts hue under her conscious control, and the effect is unsettling until you understand what you are watching. High-bandwidth cochlear overlay visible as a subtle iridescent line along her left ear canal, barely perceptible unless you look closely. Both wrists show faint subdermal reinforcement lines — joint stabilizers — visible as thin silvered scarring along the dorsal side, most noticeable when her wrists are extended.', N'She sits with her full attention on the person speaking, rarely breaking eye contact; this intensity is her baseline. She moves deliberately, with minimal wasted motion — no fidgeting, no self-soothing gestures. When she walks, there is a slight favoring of her left side from old wrist strain. She uses her hands when speaking, but sparingly and with precision. Her default expression is neutral, almost severe, until she smiles — which transforms her face entirely and is therefore devastating when it happens.', N'Tier 1 academic uniform. Structured linen blazers in cream, grey, or black over simple high-necked shirts (often black, sometimes deep indigo). Tailored trousers in neutral tones. She owns a collection of vintage watches — mechanical, not neural — which she wears as functional jewelry. Her shoes are expensive, comfortable, and built to last; currently a pair of dark leather oxfords with worn heels. A single silver ring on her left middle finger, featureless and heavy. She carries a leather satchel that is probably older than her last three graduate students, scuffed and organized with obsessive precision. Her aesthetic reads as ''deliberately ageless'' — not young, not performing youth, simply uninterested in the conversation.', N'During a communication session eight years ago, an E.L.F. she had been studying for years transmitted what she interpreted as a warning about a specific Axiom data infrastructure project. She did not act on it, rationalizing that she couldn''t be certain of the interpretation. The project was completed, and two years later a catastrophic data cascade failure from that infrastructure killed eleven people. She has never told anyone what she received before it happened.', N'Precise and unhurried; uses technical linguistic terminology unselfconsciously but defines terms the moment she suspects her audience doesn''t know them; occasionally speaks in deliberate fragments to model a point', N'Slow and weighted, each sentence given its full duration; can be mistaken for hesitation but is actually careful selection', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ghita_halverson_bouzid_sigurdsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a653-7d22-84c1-e44e642fd817', N'Cleofas Nurzhanov', N'Cleofas', N'', N'Nurzhanov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 32, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spires — mid-level corporate residential towers, near Lake Shore Drive and North', N'Covert entry and social penetration specialist — infiltrator', N'Independent — maintains network of professional contacts', N'Cleofas Nurzhanov are wiry and quick-moving, with the restless energy of someone who converts anxiety into velocity. At 32, scars map their face like a transit diagram of bad decisions and worse luck. The chrome is visible — thermal masking system — body heat signature can be suppressed or spoofed — and they make no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left them with skills and night terrors in equal measure. They work as a infiltrator out of The Spires, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Cleofas Nurzhanov describe them as a precision instrument — point them at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Malika Akerblom-Manu functions as a connector — their work puts them in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving them naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Thermal masking system — body heat signature can be suppressed or spoofed. Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Cleofas Nurzhanov, 168cm lean infiltrator with warm medium-dark brown skin and golden undertones, Central Asian-Middle Eastern-African heritage visible in sculpted cheekbones and deep-set dark brown eyes with gold cybernetic thermal rim. Dark brown hair in tight utilitarian braid, exhausted expression. Face bears thin white scars across temple, cheekbone, and jawline from past combat. Visible chrome thermal masking plating along lateral neck and spine with circuit-line aesthetics. Hydraulic joint augmentations at elbows and knees showing mechanical definition. Wearing black tactical compression shirt, charcoal gray matte corpo-jacket, reinforced dark tactical pants, military-grade synthleather boots. Standing restless with weight on balls of feet, eyes scanning, fingers moving. GLMZ infiltration operative aesthetic. Nocturnal lighting with harsh shadows emphasizing scars and augmentations. Mood: calculated predatory focus. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spires', N'local', N'The Spires', N'Central Asian dominant (35.1%) with substantial Middle Eastern (27.0%), Sub-Saharan African (17.7%), Northern European (11.3%), and Eastern European (8.9%) ancestry. The genetic mix produces a distinctive polychromatic phenotype: Central Asian bone structure forms the foundation—prominent cheekbones and angular jaw—while Middle Eastern features add depth to the face and warmth to coloring. Sub-Saharan African ancestry contributes the richness and luminosity of skin tone and subtle fullness to lips. Northern and Eastern European heritage introduces slight variations in eye shape and complexion texture. The result is a face that reads as genuinely pan-continental, belonging equally to multiple regions.', 168, 58, N'Wiry and lean with corded muscle — built for speed and precision rather than power. Compact frame with minimal body fat; every movement economical and controlled.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Pulled back in a tight braid, utilitarian — no ornament, designed for function during infiltration work', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with subtle cybernetic gold rim at pupil edge — thermal masking system integration', N'Warm medium-dark brown with golden-amber undertones and subtle reddish undertones in cheeks—a genuine blend of Central Asian, Middle Eastern, and Sub-Saharan African genetics. Carries slight pallor from nocturnal living but retains natural warmth beneath. The tone suggests sun-kissed depth rather than uniformity.', N'High, sculpted cheekbones characteristic of Central Asian and Northern Eurasian heritage; broad nasal bridge with slight flaring from Middle Eastern and African ancestry; lips slightly fuller than narrow Eurasian stereotypes. Face mapped with thin scar tissue — left cheekbone, across right temple, along jawline. Scars are old, healed clean but visible under certain light. Minimal facial hair; sparse and fine. Eyes carry exhaustion and calculation in equal measure, set deep with slight epicanthic folding from Eurasian heritage. Skin texture shows the slight variation in melanin distribution typical of multi-regional ancestry.', N'Chrome thermal masking system visible along lateral neck and upper spine — burnished titanium-grade plating integrated into skin, circuit-line aesthetics visible under strong light. Hydraulic joint articulation visible at elbows and knees — subtle mechanical definition at joints, chrome accents where synthetic meets flesh. Movement reveals the augmentation: precision, inhuman fluidity in absorbing impact.', N'Restless, economical. Never fully still — fingers tap, weight shifts, eyes scan. When moving with purpose, motion is silent and controlled, almost predatory. Sits with visibility of exits. Stands with weight on balls of feet, ready for vertical departure.', N'Tier 3-4 infiltration wear: dark tactical pants with reinforced seams and hidden pockets, fitted black compression shirt under a matte-finish corpo-adjacent jacket in charcoal gray (stolen or black-market, carries no corporate insignia). Boots are military-grade synthleather, scuffed but maintained. No jewelry. Augmentations deliberately left visible — signal of competence and warning. Clothing prioritizes mobility and function; brand markers are utilitarian military surplus or unmarked tactical brands.', N'Malika Akerblom-Manu murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cleofas_nurzhanov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a604-7330-9874-e46a3fa31474', N'Mikhail Malhotra-Halverson', N'Mikhail', N'', N'Malhotra-Halverson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 42, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Dockside — Lake Michigan waterfront, smuggler territory, near Lake Shore and Wacker', N'Field trauma surgeon and combat support — combat medic', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Mikhail Malhotra-Halverson are lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 42, scars map their face like a transit diagram of bad decisions and worse luck. The chrome is visible — cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains) — and they make no effort to hide it.

They used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Mikhail Malhotra-Halverson plans to keep it that way. They work as a combat medic out of Dockside, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

In a city full of people who talk about what they''ll do, Mikhail Malhotra-Halverson are one of the ones who actually does it.', N'Erkin Santos-Owusu functions as a connector — their work puts them in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving them naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Cortical bomb (employer installed, removed by street doc, scar tissue remains). Cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rings', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Mikhail Malhotra-Halverson, GLMZ, portrait of a lean angular man with luminous golden-brown skin from mixed Eastern European, Southeast Asian, and South Asian heritage. High prominent cheekbones, sharp jawline, subtle epicanthal fold. Dark brown hair graying at temples, pulled back tight. Chrome iris cybernetic eyes with visible LED circuitry glowing faintly amber, suture marks at temples. Jagged pale scar from right temple to jaw, thick raised scar along right neck from cortical bomb removal, surgical scars across palms and forearms. Intense, tired expression, constantly assessing surroundings. Wearing dark tactical cargo pants, fitted moisture-wicking undershirt, oversized weatherproof jacket with visible interior armor plating, combat-rated boots. Real leather surgical satchel worn over shoulder. Titanium med-alert bracelet. Precise economical posture, hands steady. Low-key neo-noir medical field operative aesthetic, moody atmospheric lighting emphasizing scar tissue and cybernetic components, gritty urban Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dockside', N'local', N'Dockside', N'Striking polyphonic phenotype from balanced tri-continental ancestry: Eastern European (31.9%), Southeast Asian (31.2%), and South Asian (27.1%) create the primary genetic signature, with smaller contributions from Hispanic/Latin American (6.0%) and Sub-Saharan African (3.8%) adding warmth and complexity. The result is a face that resists easy categorization — high, prominent cheekbones with the angular structure of Eastern European ancestry combined with the eye shape and subtle epicanthal fold characteristics of Southeast Asian genetics. South Asian genetics contribute warm golden undertones and slight facial breadth, while African ancestry adds luminosity and depth to skin tone. Central Asian influences visible in cheekbone prominence and jawline width. This is a face marked by genetic heterogeneity: neither pale nor deep brown, but a warm, luminous golden-brown that shifts subtly with light.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with visible corded muscle — the build of someone who moves constantly and eats inconsistently. Minimal body fat, pronounced shoulders and forearms from surgical precision work and field extraction tasks.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples', N'Pulled back tight, practical — either in a short braid or secured with a single band. No vanity in it.', N'Medium', N'Chrome iris rings over dark brown — cybernetic overlay with visible LED micro-circuitry', N'Warm golden-brown with luminous depth from balanced Eastern European, Southeast Asian, South Asian, and African genetic blend — rich and complex, catching light with subtle golden undertones', N'Angular face with high, prominent cheekbones showing Eastern European structure combined with slightly narrower eye contours and subtle epicanthal fold characteristics from Southeast and South Asian ancestry. Sharp jawline with subtle width from Central Asian genetics. Heavily scarred — not from age but from impact trauma and surgical revision. Skin shows old burn marks along the right side of the neck (cortical bomb removal site). No grooming pretense; scars are left untattooed and visible. Perpetually tired eyes with the characteristic intensity of someone whose vision is partially cybernetic.', N'Cybernetic eyes with chrome iris rings and visible LED circuitry around the orbital sockets — pupils glow faintly amber during thermal mode activation. Cortical bomb removal scarring is impossible to hide; the raised tissue and color mismatch draw immediate attention. No attempt to conceal either modification.', N'Economical and precise — moves like someone trained in field medicine under fire. Weight shifts are calculated. Hands are steady and rarely still. Default posture is slightly forward, ready. Eyes track multiple points simultaneously — a constant low-level tactical assessment of the environment. Smiles are rare and brief.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: dark synthetic cargo pants with reinforced thigh pockets (medical supply storage), fitted tactical undershirt with moisture-wicking tech, oversized weatherproof jacket with interior armor plating (visible when jacket moves). Boots are heavy-duty combat-rated with grip-soles. A surgical satchel is constant — real leather, old, scarred from use. Minimal jewelry beyond a worn titanium med-alert bracelet. Everything is maintained obsessively, nothing is decorative.', N'Erkin Santos-Owusu once worked for corporate intelligence and still has a handler who calls in favors. Each favor erodes what''s left of their independence.', N'Fast, profane, and vivid. Speaks in images — everything is a metaphor for violence or weather.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'mikhail_malhotra_halverson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b2-7f1c-8745-e494eafad270', N'Cornelis Trujillo-Asomaning', N'Cornelis', N'', N'Trujillo-Asomaning', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 29, NULL, 20, 3, N'active', N'The Circuit, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Fixer - Info brokerage', N'The Collective', N'', N'Fixer', N'', N'', N'', N'Cornelis Trujillo-Asomaning, 2226 neo-noir fixer, 168cm lean angular frame with defined musculature. Deep warm bronze-brown skin with golden and copper undertones, blending Pacific Islander warmth with Sub-Saharan African depth and Central Asian definition. Sharp high cheekbones and defined jawline with dimensional facial planes catching warm light. Dark brown eyes with amber undertone, sharp and calculating. Jet black hair with iridescent sheen, pulled back in tight crown braid with two smaller braids framing face, thin silver wire woven through braids. Faint surgical scar along left temple to cheekbone. Small circuit-board Φ tattoo on right inner wrist. Faint old pale burn marks on knuckles of both hands. Wearing fitted charcoal technical wear with sleek black long-coat, functional grip-sole boots, slate-grey encrypted satchel. Minimalist elegant bracelet with embedded data-chip. Neutral balanced posture, economical precise movement. Professional fixer aesthetic, no flashy branding. Cool moody lighting in GLMZ corporate district, shadows accentuating bone structure, amber accent lights reflecting off skin tone and silver wire. Deliberate, controlled atmosphere. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Pacific Islander (31.9%) dominant with substantial Sub-Saharan African (20.1%) and Hispanic/Latin American (23.2%) ancestry, enriched by Central Asian (13.4%) with minor Northern European (7.8%) and Eastern European (3.6%) contributions. This creates a striking, warm-toned phenotype where Pacific Islander facial structure and fullness blend with Sub-Saharan African bone definition and dimensional depth, warmed throughout by Hispanic/Latin American golden undertones, with Central Asian influences sharpening cheekbones and jawline. The result is a complex, high-contrast face with warm bronze-undertoned deep brown skin and pronounced, well-defined facial architecture that bridges tropical and continental ancestry.', 168, 62, N'Lean and angular with defined musculature; moves with economical precision. Carries herself like someone who has learned to take up minimal space in rooms where she controls the narrative.', N'Jet black with a subtle iridescent sheen (likely treated with a subdermal pigment mod)', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid that wraps around her crown; two small braids frame her face with thin silver wire woven through them', N'Long (shoulder-blade length when unbound)', N'Dark brown with faint amber undertone, sharp and calculating', N'Deep warm brown with rich bronze, golden, and copper undertones, the dimensional result of Pacific Islander warmth and fullness layered over Sub-Saharan African depth and definition, brightened by Hispanic/Latin American golden richness, with subtle Central Asian influence adding refined angularity to the overall warm palette', N'Clear, angular face with high, pronounced cheekbones and a sharp, defined jawline reflecting the blend of Pacific Islander fullness, Central Asian definition, and Sub-Saharan African structure. The facial planes show remarkable dimensional warmth and depth—warm bronze catching light across the cheekbones, darker undertones in the hollows, golden highlights at the temples. Minimal visible scarring but hints of precise surgical work around her temples. Grooming is deliberate and expensive—no affectation, pure maintenance.', N'None immediately obvious. Likely carries subcutaneous neural arrays and data-jacking ports hidden beneath standard clothing. Her silver wire-woven braids may contain RFID tracking or signal-boosting threads, but this reads as aesthetic rather than overtly augmented.', N'Stands with a balanced, neutral stance; moves with deliberate economy, never wasting motion. Hands are frequently still, resting in her lap or pockets. When she gestures, it''s minimal and precise. Her gaze lingers—she listens more than she speaks, and watches people like she''s reading code.', N'Tier 3-4 professional fixer aesthetic: fitted dark grey or charcoal technical wear (moisture-wicking, reinforced seams). Sleek black long-coat with internal pockets (Collective-standard issue or high-quality knockoff). Functional boots with grip soles. No flashy branding—her clothes are tools, not statements. A single piece of expensive jewelry: a simple bracelet with what might be a data-chip embedded in the clasp. Carries a small slate-grey satchel with encrypted access panels.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cornelis_trujillo_asomaning');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f2-7f5d-a85a-e4aaf239b540', N'Sumire Inoue', N'Sumire', N'', N'Inoue', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 60, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Glassway — corporate-adjacent retail district, heavy surveillance, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Chemical and biological agent specialist — poisoner', N'Semi-independent — has standing arrangements with several crews', N'Sumire Inoue is average height but with a presence that fills more space than the body accounts for. At 60, the augmentation scarring around her temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Born and raised in GLMZ, third generation — she has the city in her blood, its rhythms in her bones, its cruelty in her expectations. She works as a poisoner out of Glassway, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Sumire Inoue is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who she burned last.', N'Tenzin Takahashi-Boateng is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes. Vocal modulator — can replicate any voice after 30 seconds of sample audio', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Sumire Inoue, 167cm tall lean augmented operative, warm bronze-toned skin reflecting East Asian, African, European, and Latin American heritage blended in striking facial geometry. Steel gray braided hair pulled back exposing keloid scarring on temples from neural interface. Sharp dark brown eyes. Visible surgical scar along right jawline. Brushed steel hydraulic joints at elbows and knees with visible piston housings. Subdermal metal plating visible on forearms. Weathered face with high angular cheekbones and strong jawline. Wearing dark matte synthetics with reinforced seams, high-collar jacket concealing scarring, analog watch, reinforced boots. Standing alert with weight on balls of feet, mechanical precision in posture. Chemical sheen on skin. GLMZ setting, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, dim neon lighting casting blue and amber shadows, industrial urban background, composed and focused expression, no emotion, field operative aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Glassway', N'local', N'Glassway', N'Complex global ancestry: East Asian (36.2%) provides angular bone structure and eye shape; Northern European (24.6%) contributes definition and cool undertones; Hispanic/Latin American (19.9%) adds golden warmth; Sub-Saharan African (19.3%) brings richness to skin tone and broader facial features. The blend creates a striking phenotype with East Asian angularity softened by African warmth, Northern European strength, and Latin American golden undertones.', 167, 62, N'Lean and compact, deceptively strong. Muscle density concentrated in core and legs from decades of augmentation integration. No wasted mass — economical, efficient.', N'Steel gray with natural black undertones', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid. Practical. No decoration.', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, sharp and assessing', N'Warm medium-bronze with luminous depth — rich undertone from Sub-Saharan African heritage, golden warmth from Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, tempered by cool undertones from Northern European blend. Skin catches light with subtle radiance.', N'Weathered but not aged poorly. Angular cheekbones with East Asian definition balanced by broader Sub-Saharan African features; strong jawline combining Northern European strength with African bone structure. Fine lines around eyes from squinting, not smiling. Skin carries a faint chemical sheen — occupational hazard, never quite washes out. Facial geometry reflects the harmony of her four-part ancestry without favoring any single region.', N'Hydraulic joints at both knees and elbows — the chrome is evident, brushed steel finish with visible piston housings. No attempt at discretion or cosmetic covering. The joints move with mechanical precision, sometimes a hydraulic hiss when stress loads exceed threshold. Subdermal plating visible along her forearms when sleeves ride up — gray-metal sheen beneath skin.', N'Economical. Moves without flourish — each motion serves a purpose. Stands with weight balanced on the balls of feet, ready to shift. When seated, she maintains alertness rather than relaxation. Her movements carry a mechanical underlayer; the hydraulic joints have a subtle rhythm that marks her as augmented to anyone watching. No fidgeting. No nervous tells.', N'Tier 3-4 transitional — pragmatic rather than aspirational. When in cover identity: neutral corporate-adjacent clothing, forgettable brands, nothing that draws attention. When working: dark fitted synthetics with reinforced seams and hidden pockets, matte finishes to avoid reflection. Favors jackets with high collars to partially conceal scarring. No jewelry except a simple analog watch — nothing wireless that could be traced or hacked. Boots with reinforced ankle support to accommodate hydraulic knee joints. Everything worn shows age; she maintains gear rather than replacing it.', N'Tenzin Takahashi-Boateng witnessed a massacre during a corporate dispute and has evidence stored in a dead drop. Publishing it would expose powerful people. Keeping it is leverage and liability.', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'sumire_inoue');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b7-72ec-8c3f-e52fc02e294c', N'Luca Kabwit-Okonkwo', N'Luca', N'', N'Kabwit-Okonkwo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 25, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower district tenements near the old lakeshore, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Network intrusion and digital warfare specialist — netrunner', N'Independent — Narrows-based operations', N'Luca Kabwit-Okonkwo is tall and rawboned, the kind of frame that suggests either malnutrition or efficiency depending on the decade. At 25, scars map his face like a transit diagram of bad decisions and worse luck. The chrome is visible — reflex boosters wired into spinal column — shaves reaction time by 40ms — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. He works as a netrunner out of the Gray Zone, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Luca Kabwit-Okonkwo operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Aslan Ekman-Danso functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Reflex boosters wired into spinal column — shaves reaction time by 40ms. Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Portrait of Luca Kabwit-Okonkwo, tall lean man with deep warm brown skin blending Sub-Saharan African and South Asian features, sharp angular cheekbones and strong jawline, dark brown eyes alert and calculating. Short dark hair shaved at sides, longer on top. Face heavily scarred with white and pale pink lines on forehead, left cheek, chin, diagonal scar across left cheekbone to jaw. Perpetual dark stubble, dark circles under eyes. Visible silver and gunmetal gray chrome spinal reflex booster hardware running down neck and upper back with amber indicator lights, brushed titanium augmentations at elbows and knees. Wearing black synthetic reinforced jacket faded to charcoal gray, dark grey compression shirt, black reinforced cargo pants with tool belt, steel-toed boots, fingerless grip gloves. Tense posture with forward head cant, controlled precise movement. Dark utilitarian neo-noir urban aesthetic, industrial setting with neon rim lighting casting amber glow on scar tissue and metallic augmentations, cold harsh overhead light emphasizing weathered features and mechanical enhancements, gritty Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone atmosphere, 2226 tech aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (60.3%) with substantial South Asian (27.0%) influence, creating a striking genetic blend. Minor Eastern European (6.4%) and Middle Eastern (6.3%) ancestry add subtle undertones. The combination produces warm, deep tones with layered complexity — African richness interwoven with South Asian warmth and faint Mediterranean undertones.', 188, 72, N'Rawboned and lean, with a wiry musculature that reads as either ascetic discipline or chronic malnutrition. Broad shoulders tapered to a narrow waist — a frame built for speed and endurance rather than power.', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Kept short and functional, no styling. Shaved at the sides, longer on top — practical rather than aesthetic.', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and calculating', N'Deep warm brown with underlying golden undertones — the result of Sub-Saharan African dominance (60.3%) blended with South Asian warmth (27.0%), creating a rich complexity. The tone carries subtle warmth from South Asian ancestry without losing the deep saturation of African heritage. Weathered by years in industrial districts, the matte complexion catches light unevenly, with faint warm reflections in direct sun.', N'Angular face with sharp cheekbones and strong, prominent jawline — bone structure reflecting the robust Sub-Saharan African heritage balanced with South Asian facial proportions, creating refined upper face structure with characteristic fullness through the lower face and around the mouth. Skin heavily scarred — thin white and pale pink lines crossing forehead, left cheek, and chin in what appears to be impact and blade work. Perpetual stubble, dark circles under eyes. No cosmetic care evident.', N'Visible chrome spinal reflex booster hardware runs from the base of his skull down approximately 15cm along the vertebrae — metallic silver and gunmetal gray, with faint amber indicator lights when active. Hydraulic joint augmentations visible at elbows and knees as reinforced seams of brushed titanium and synthetic polymer where the tech interfaces with flesh. When he moves, there is a subtle mechanical response in his joints — barely perceptible fluidity in impact absorption.', N'Moves with controlled economy of motion — no wasted gesture. Carries tension in his shoulders even at rest. His head has a slight forward cant, as if perpetually listening. When standing still, he shifts weight frequently between feet. Movement is fluid but mechanical in precision; the reflex boosters lend an uncanny quickness to reactions. His gaze is direct and unwavering.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian — function over fashion. Black synthetic reinforced jacket with multiple pockets, burn-resistant weave, faded to charcoal gray in places. Underneath, a dark grey compression shirt that doubles as an undershirt for equipment vests. Black cargo pants with reinforced thigh pockets and a tool belt holding deck interfaces, jacks, and small modular tech. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and well-maintained. A pair of fingerless gloves with grip pads on the palms — for equipment handling and climbing. No visible jewelry or decorative elements. Everything is maintenance-worn and functional.', N'', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'luca_kabwit_okonkwo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a70c-7286-a57a-e54040fd3aea', N'Haiyun Kovalenko', N'Haiyun', N'', N'Kovalenko', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Garret, a specific walkup apartment in Edgewater Prism, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Underground playwright and zine writer', N'Independent; The Dossier is loosely affiliated with a collective called the Edgewater Print Guild', N'Haiyun Kovalenko is a lean, angular man who has aged into something between distinguished and haggard, depending on the light and the hour. His skin is a deep warm brown, heavily seamed at the corners of his eyes and mouth, white stubble maintained at exactly the same length every day through a discipline that seems at odds with the rest of his lifestyle. He is nearly always wearing the same grey coat — it has been repaired in four visible places — and carries a battered datapad loaded with forty years of draft manuscripts, production notes, and correspondence he has never deleted. His only augmentation is a simple retinal display, secondhand and flickering at the edges, which he uses to read in the dark. His posture is very upright for a man who claims to be exhausted.

Haiyun Kovalenko has written nineteen plays, fourteen of which have been performed — in apartments, in the back rooms of restaurants in Mexicantown Libre, in a repurposed transit shelter in the Hamtramck Enclave, twice in the open air of the Highland Park Autonomous Zone before rain stopped the second production on the third night. His work is dense, formally ambitious, and politically blunt enough that a Sterling-Nakamura legal team sent him a cease-and-desist over a play he performed for an audience of thirty-one people. He also writes a zine called ''The Dossier'' — irregular publication, hand-assembled, distributed through a network of sympathetic shopkeepers — which runs interviews with artists the mainstream channels will not cover alongside a column of theatrical criticism so sharp it has ended two careers.', N'Information source on the history of GLMZ''s cultural underground — he has been there for forty years; quest giver for storylines involving censorship, corporate overreach, or lost artistic works; provides access to the city''s network of sympathetic civilians who pass information through unofficial channels.', N'', N'Secondhand retinal display (flickering, needs recalibration); no geneware', N'Writes from five to nine in the morning before the building gets loud; spends midday arguing with collaborators over tea and cheap protein; afternoons he edits the zine or attends rehearsals; evenings are performances, readings, or long solitary walks along the Edgewater Prism waterfront.', N'Haiyun Kovalenko, 178cm tall lean angular figure, weathered warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones blending Eastern European, Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African, and Indigenous American heritage. Deep brown eyes with left eye bearing faint blue LED retinal display ring artifact, asymmetrical crow''s feet, deep forehead creases, thin pale jawline scar. Steel grey short hair combed back, white stubble at half-inch precision. Wearing worn grey wool coat with visible repairs and elbow patch, cream linen shirt, black canvas trousers, resoled leather boots. Faded fabric watch strap wrist. Upright military posture contrasting weary expression. Carrying battered canvas satchel with duct tape reinforcement. GLMZ GLMZ setting, dim neon-filtered indoor lighting casting subtle blue glow across weathered face, tired determination in every line, documentary-style realism --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Garret', N'local', N'The Garret', N'Eastern European (32.8%), Middle Eastern (26.3%), Sub-Saharan African (22.8%), and Indigenous American (18.1%) ancestry creates a distinctly pan-global phenotype. The genetic blend manifests as moderate Eastern European bone structure softened by Middle Eastern and African facial proportions, with fuller cheekbones and a broader nasal bridge characteristic of Sub-Saharan African and Indigenous American heritage. The result is a face that transcends single-ancestry classification—each ancestral component visible yet fully integrated into a unified, weathered whole.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, almost ascetic — the body of someone who has forgotten to eat regularly for decades. Shoulders slightly rounded from hunching over a datapad, but spine held rigid through conscious effort.', N'Steel grey with traces of black at the roots', N'Short, combed back, maintained with mechanical precision despite evident age', N'Short', N'Deep brown, natural; left eye has faint blue LED artifacts from the flickering retinal display', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones—the result of Eastern European, Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African, and Indigenous American ancestry blended together, then weathered by decades of sun exposure and urban pallor into a rich, complex complexion', N'Heavily seamed at the corners of eyes and mouth, lines mapping forty years of squinting at screens and frowning at scripts. Facial structure shows full ancestral blend: moderately high, rounded cheekbones with fullness from Sub-Saharan African and Indigenous American heritage, broader nasal bridge with Middle Eastern definition, fuller lips characteristic of African and Indigenous American lineage, underpinned by Eastern European bone angles. White stubble maintained at exactly half-inch length daily—a ritual discipline. Skin texture rough but clean, no visible acne or disease; the face of someone who has earned every wrinkle.', N'Secondhand retinal display mounted in the left eye socket; visible as a faint blue-grey metallic ring around the iris with occasional LED flicker at the edge. The display has cosmetic wear — micro-scratches and a slight misalignment that causes him to tilt his head slightly when reading in dim light.', N'Upright, almost military in spinal alignment, which contrasts strikingly with the weariness in his face and the slow deliberateness of his movements. He walks as if conserving energy but standing as if refusing to concede to age. Gestures are economical and precise — a hand raised to emphasize a point in conversation, fingers splayed over a manuscript.', N'Nearly always the same grey wool coat, single-breasted, with four visible repairs (one elbow patch in darker grey, one seam re-stitched along the left shoulder, patches on both front pockets). Underneath: simple linen shirts in cream or pale grey, worn soft from washing. Black denim or canvas trousers, creased but not fresh. Worn leather boots, resoled twice. No jewelry except a faded fabric watch strap (the watch itself long gone). Tier 4 working-class aesthetic — not poor, but committed to indifference toward consumption. Carries the battered datapad in a homemade canvas satchel reinforced with duct tape.', N'The fourteenth play — the one that earned the Sterling-Nakamura cease-and-desist — was based on internal documents given to him by a Sterling-Nakamura employee. He promised to protect their identity. They were eventually identified and transferred to an offsite facility. He has never written about what happened to them.', N'Formal, literary, occasionally archaic phrasing; shifts into streetlevel bluntness without warning when making a point he considers important', N'Measured and deliberate with occasional bursts of rapid fire when excited by an idea; dramatic pauses he is aware of and half-enjoys', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'haiyun_kovalenko');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b0-79c2-acc9-e5a94b76fd0c', N'Chimezie Sengupta', N'Chimezie', N'', N'Sengupta', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Fort Anchor, Forensic Sciences Unit, Level 7, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Forensic Technician, Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions (mid-level forensic technician)', N'Chimezie Sengupta is a slight man who has lost the battle with his posture and accepted it, curving slightly forward as if permanently examining something just below his eyeline. His skin is a warm medium brown, hair gone to silver-white and kept in a neat, very short fade, and he wears magnification lenses over his natural eyes — actual lenses in frames he has had repaired seven times rather than upgrade to ocular implants, because he does not trust surgeons with his eyes, a conviction he holds with irrational but absolute certainty. He has enhanced olfactory augmentation, which is the one mod he consented to readily because it directly serves his work: he can smell chemical compounds at parts-per-billion concentrations, and has an informal reputation for diagnosing cause of death before the toxicology panel comes back.

Chimezie Sengupta has worked Arcturus Civil Security forensics for twenty-six years and has achieved a specific kind of institutional invisibility — he is everywhere in the building and somehow always slightly forgotten when promotions are discussed. He does not appear to mind, though this appearance is not entirely accurate. He is meticulous to a degree that colleagues find either reassuring or maddening depending on whether they need results today or results that are correct. He has a running argument with the evidence chain management system that has lasted three years and will likely outlast them both.', N'Information source for forensic details, cause of death, trace evidence, chemical analysis. Can surface buried evidence or reinterpret old cases. An honest broker within the institution — his findings cannot easily be pressured, which makes him valuable and occasionally inconvenient to Arcturus Civil Security command.', N'', N'Enhanced olfactory system — Helix Biosystems nasal augment, detects chemical compounds at parts-per-billion, installed 2183. Magnification frames (non-augmented, physical lenses — deliberately chosen over ocular implants). Mild subdermal temperature regulation implant, medical necessity.', N'Arrives at Level 7 forensics lab at 0730, processes the overnight evidence queue, spends the bulk of each day at his workstation or in the cold room, and writes reports in a prose style that his supervisors consider unnecessarily literary. Brings his lunch every day in the same worn container. Leaves at 1700 exactly unless actively mid-analysis, in which case he stays until it''s done.', N'Chimezie Sengupta, 56-year-old forensic analyst with warm medium-tan skin bearing golden-brown undertones softened by cool olive notes, angular high cheekbones and refined jawline reflecting South Asian, Eastern European, and Hispanic ancestry convergence. Silver-white short neat fade hair, dark brown natural eyes magnified behind worn yellowed acrylic lens frames. Slight, willowy 168cm frame in forward-curved posture. Clean-shaven with fine concentration lines around eyes and mouth. Small scar on bridge of nose, pale chemical burn discoloration on right palm. Dressed in charcoal gray chemical-resistant lab coat over dark slacks and black steel-toed boots, silver wedding band and brushed titanium bracelet visible. Hands steady and methodical. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone basement forensic lab under cool LED panels, examining evidence with sculptural focus, clinical precision, decade-long muscle memory in every movement, analog mechanical watch visible on wrist, utterly functional aesthetic, no cosmetic augmentation, cool bluish basement lighting casting subtle shadows on weathered face --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Fort Anchor', N'local', N'Fort Anchor', N'Multiethnic blend: 46.4% South Asian foundation with significant Eastern European (35.7%) and Hispanic/Latin American (17.9%) ancestry. This combination creates angular, high-set cheekbones and a defined jawline characteristic of South Asian and Eastern European features, softened by the warmer bone structure and fuller features common in Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. The genetic convergence produces a warm-medium phenotype with subtle complexity—golden-brown undertones from South Asian and Hispanic heritage interplay with cooler olive notes from Eastern European ancestry.', 168, 62, N'Slight, almost willowy frame with the soft musculature of someone who spends twelve hours a day at a workstation. Shoulders rolled forward in a permanent stoop, as if his spine has learned to curl around microscopes and evidence bags.', N'Silver-white', N'Neat fade, precisely maintained', N'Short', N'Dark brown (natural)', N'Warm medium-tan with golden undertones from South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, tempered by cooler olive notes from Eastern European heritage, all overlaid with the faint pallor of someone who works under LED panels in a climate-controlled basement', N'High, prominent cheekbones with angular structure reflecting South Asian and Eastern European genetics, refined jawline showing convergence of all three ancestry groups. Subtle warmth in midface from Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Fine lines around eyes and mouth from decades of concentration. Skin shows age honestly—no cosmetic mods. Faint nicotine staining on right index and middle fingers despite official non-smoking policy in the building (he uses a sublingual patch, but the habit ghost remains). Clean-shaven, scrupulously groomed.', N'Magnification frames with slightly yellowed acrylic lenses, the same model he''s worn for years with visible wear at the hinges from repeated repairs. The frames sit on his face like an extension of his skull. Nasal augmentation is completely subcutaneous—no visible hardware, but occasionally he will pause mid-conversation and inhale deeply, his nostrils flaring fractionally as his enhanced olfactory array processes something others cannot perceive.', N'Perpetually forward-curved, as if gravity pulls slightly harder on his attention than his spine. Moves with deliberate precision—no wasted motion, each step economical. His hands are steady and methodical. When examining something, he goes very still, becoming almost sculptural in his focus.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, forensic lab standard. Charcoal gray synthetic lab coat over plain dark slacks, durable synthetic fibers designed for chemical resistance and easy decontamination. Black steel-toed boots, worn but meticulously maintained. A silver wedding band (worn continuously for 28 years) and a single narrow bracelet in brushed titanium—a gift from his daughter in 2210. No visible logos or corporate branding. Everything is functional, nothing is fashionable. His watch is a mechanical analog, because he does not trust digital displays to remain visible in case of an EMP event—a conviction he holds with the same irrational certainty as his stance on eye surgery.', N'He has been quietly re-examining the physical evidence from a fourteen-year-old homicide case in his off-hours — a case whose conviction he now believes was wrong — and has not told anyone because he does not know what the correct chain of disclosure is and is afraid of what the institutional response will be.', N'Precise and technical in professional contexts, unexpectedly warm and elaborate when discussing anything that genuinely interests him. Occasional Swahili and Serbian phrases, which surface more when he is tired.', N'Measured, never rushed. Finishes every sentence he starts. Thinks visibly before speaking.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chimezie_sengupta');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72b-733d-b772-e5b54b850ab6', N'Harleen Deshpande-Nazari-Kovács', N'Harleen', N'', N'Deshpande-Nazari-Kovács', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 16, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Irkalla, outer ring tunnel access, and ranging into the deep sub-levels below, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Echo hunter — a teenager who ventures into unstable deep-tunnel sections to retrieve acoustic data, lost signals, and fragmented ELF-transmissions', N'Informal affiliation with an Irkalla Bore Rat family that is not his biological family (his parents are unknown to him); sells recovered data and ELF-fragments to Deepwell Station collectors and deep shrine keepers', N'Harleen Deshpande-Nazari-Kovács is small for sixteen, with the kind of wiry build that can fold itself into spaces an adult would not consider. His skin is very dark and marked with a single pale scar running from the corner of his left eye to his jawline — earned at thirteen in a tunnel collapse he survived by being still for nine hours while the pipe above him groaned. He has cat ears: genetic modification from a street-market geneware stall three years ago, paid for in scavenged copper. They are not the neat, expensive kind — they''re slightly asymmetrical, the left one sitting a centimeter higher than the right, which he claims actually helps his directionality. His eyes are naturally a rich amber, wide and roving, always scanning for structural movement. He is almost always eating something, the caloric urgency of a body that moves constantly through cold spaces.

Harleen Deshpande-Nazari-Kovács has the specific confidence of someone very young who has survived things that should have killed them and interpreted this as evidence of personal specialness rather than statistical chance. He is not foolish — he is methodical in his risk assessments and deeply knowledgeable about tunnel acoustics and ELF-behavior in enclosed systems — but he believes, with the sincere conviction of a sixteen-year-old who has not yet been wrong enough times, that he will know when something is too dangerous. He is usually right. The ''usually'' is the problem. He is deeply attached to the fragments of ELF-signal he recovers, treating them as messages rather than noise, and has accumulated a collection of old devices and cracked tablets that he believes house weakened or fragmented ELF-presences — a menagerie of digital spirits he tends carefully.', N'Scout and early-warning figure for deep-tunnel events; spiritual lens through which to view ELF culture in the underworld; represents the generation that has never known the surface and does not want it; can deliver information from inaccessible deep sections', N'', N'Cat ears (geneware, asymmetrical, functional — genuinely enhanced directional hearing, black-furred). Bone-conduction audio receiver implanted behind his left ear (scavenged, borderline dangerous, lets him hear frequencies below normal human range). No other augmentations.', N'Eats breakfast with the Bore Rat family, then spends six to eight hours ranging deep into unstable tunnel sections, recording acoustic data and scavenging devices; returns to Irkalla outer ring to trade findings and eat everything in sight.', N'Harleen Deshpande-Nazari-Kovács, 162cm wiry figure with angular South Asian-Eastern European-Middle Eastern blend features, medium-dark golden-brown skin, amber reflective eyes, shoulder-length black dust-matted hair. Asymmetrical black cat ears, thin white scar from left eye to jawline. Wearing salvaged thermal layers, cargo pants taped at cuffs, heavy mismatched boots, climbing harness, carrying rope and carabiners. Copper wire talisman on left wrist. Posture forward-balanced, perpetually scanning surroundings. GLMZ underground tunnel explorer aesthetic, low-light mineral dust environment, cool blue-green tungsten lighting highlighting scar and ear augmentation, gritty realism, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Irkalla', N'local', N'Irkalla', N'South Asian (50.6%) with substantial Eastern European (26.3%) and Middle Eastern (23.1%) ancestry—a striking tripartite blend creating distinctive facial architecture. The South Asian dominance manifests in facial bone structure, eye placement and shape, and dark hair, while Eastern European heritage contributes angular cheekbone prominence and sharper nasal bridge definition. Middle Eastern ancestry adds warmth and slight softness to the overall facial proportions and contributes golden undertones to skin.', 162, 48, N'Wiry and compact, almost feline in proportions — lean musculature from constant climbing and crawling through confined spaces, no excess fat, joints visible at wrists and elbows. Built for compression, not strength.', N'Black, natural', N'Shoulder-length, often pulled back with wire or cloth scraps; perpetually dust-matted from tunnel work', N'Medium', N'Amber, natural — wide-set, reflective quality under low light', N'Medium-dark warm brown—the golden-olive result of blended South Asian, Eastern European, and Middle Eastern ancestry; dust and mineral residue from tunnel work often visible in skin creases, giving an aged appearance despite youth', N'Angular face with prominent high cheekbones characteristic of the South Asian-Eastern European blend, with subtle warm undertones from Middle Eastern ancestry. The scar runs white and slightly puckered from left eye corner to jaw, creating asymmetrical intensity to expression. Skin otherwise clear but weathered. Fingers and palms callused and discolored from handling corroded metal. Perpetually eating—snack residue often visible at mouth corners.', N'Genetic cat ears, black-furred and functional, asymmetrical positioning visible especially in profile. Slight scarring and discoloration behind left ear where bone-conduction audio receiver is implanted subcutaneously—implant not visible but surgical site remains slightly swollen and prone to irritation. No other visible augmentations.', N'Moves with liquid economy—never wastes a gesture. Stands slightly forward-balanced, ready to shift weight instantly. Head often tilts slightly left when listening intently (bone-conduction receiver dominant side). Frequent reflexive ear-twitches when processing sound data. When eating, focuses with single-minded intensity. Eyes constantly scan ceiling and walls for structural movement, habit ingrained from survival.', N'Tier 4-5 functional salvage aesthetic. Lightweight insulated vest over thermal underlayer (both salvaged, patched with mismatched fabric). Cargo pants with deep pockets, cuffs sealed with electrical tape to prevent dust infiltration. Climbing harness worn loose over hips even indoors. Boots heavy, mismatched—one genuine thermal-rated, the other industrial rubber with added traction tape. Rope and carabiners clipped to belt. Cloth satchel (once someone''s handbag, now repurposed) carries recording devices and food. Faded oversized hoodie (probably stolen from Tier 3 laundry) worn in cooler months. Single copper wire wrapped around left wrist as talisman.', N'Eight months ago he went too deep — below the Abyssal Threshold''s accessible sections — and heard something. A signal. Not fragmentary, not dying: a strong, coherent ELF-transmission from a source that should not exist at that depth. He has told no one because he does not understand it and because whoever told an adult anything good ever. He has been trying to go back but the route has been unstable.', N'Fast, dense with tunnel-specific technical terms and ELF-lore he has absorbed from shrine keepers; occasional French phrases from the Delacroix side of his name that he uses without being conscious of it', N'Rapid, enthusiastic, then suddenly stopped dead when something catches his attention — conversations with him feel like watching someone chase a thought', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'harleen_deshpande_nazari_kov_cs');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c3-7be9-ac3c-e5b60f54f05b', N'Mika Erikstad-Masoe', N'Mika', N'', N'Erikstad-Masoe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 45, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Bridgepoint, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Bounty Compliance Officer, freelance licensed', N'GLMZ Bounty Compliance Licensing Board (licensed independent), informal professional network in Bridgepoint', N'Mika Erikstad-Masoe has the kind of face that has made a professional peace with itself — laugh lines earned, not resented, a slight asymmetry to her jaw from an old fracture improperly set in a clinic that has since been demolished. Her skin is a warm medium brown, her natural hair locs wrapped daily in a practiced spiral that she pins with a series of small copper rings, each one a different diameter. Her left forearm bears a pattern of raised scarification from a traditional ceremony on her mother''s side — she is the only person in her family who continued the practice. She moves with the unhurried deliberateness of someone who long ago stopped needing to prove anything.

She has worked bounty compliance for seventeen years and describes the job with the matter-of-fact affect of a plumber describing pipe fittings. She brings people in. She does it legally, with documentation, on licensed warrants. She is not sentimental about it but she has rules: no minors, no medical emergencies untreated, no warrants that smell like private vendettas wearing legal paperwork. She has turned down more contracts than most operators accept. Her reputation for selectivity is itself a business asset.', N'A grounded, experienced operator who exists in the grey space between law enforcement and freelance work. Quest giver for retrieval jobs, information source on fugitive movement patterns and underground networks, and a potential complication when her professional interests intersect with player activities.', N'', N'Hydraulic-assist tendons in both forearms and hands (increases grip strength and precision without bulk). Internal biometric scanner embedded in right palm (warrant verification, subject ID). Cosmetic: cat ears in warm amber-brown replacing standard ears, a decision made at 32 for reasons she describes as ''I wanted them and I could afford them.''', N'Operates from a rented office above a noodle shop in Bridgepoint, reviewing open warrant listings each morning. Takes two to three contracts per month, spends the interim doing skip-trace research, meeting informants, and handling the administrative documentation that makes licensed bounty work legally defensible.', N'Mika Erikstad-Masoe, 172cm lean muscular figure with warm medium-brown skin showing golden and olive undertones, broad cheekbones with North African definition softened by Southeast Asian fullness, subtle East Asian eye shape, asymmetrical jawline from old healed fracture, laugh lines around deep brown eyes, natural black locs with grey at temples wrapped in copper rings reaching mid-back. Amber-brown cat ear prosthetics replacing human ears with metallic sheen. West African ceremonial scarification across left forearm in parallel keloid lines. Forearm servo augmentation visible, biometric interface port on right palm with blue LED. Wearing fitted rust-brown synthetic leather cargo jacket with reinforced seams, dark synthetic weave trousers, orthopaedic leather boots. Copper rings on fingers, smartwatch on left wrist, woven cord bracelet on right wrist. Standing with economical posture, centered weight, patient gaze. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, cool industrial lighting with warm accent highlights on skin tones, professional warrant agent aesthetic, no corporate branding --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Bridgepoint', N'local', N'Bridgepoint', N'Kaleidoscopic diaspora blend: Southeast Asian (26.2%), North African (22.8%), Pacific Islander (16.1%), Eastern European (13.3%), Hispanic/Latin American (11.3%), and East Asian (10.3%). Her phenotype is a study in graceful genetic convergence—warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones from the Southeast Asian and North African components creating subtle warmth across cheekbones and nose bridge, facial structure showing the broad cheekbones and defined angles characteristic of North African ancestry softened by Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander fullness in the face, eye shape reflecting the subtle epicanthal fold from her East Asian ancestry, bone geometry that speaks to Eastern European legacy without dominating the overall impression, the blended ancestry creating subtle variation in skin tone texture across the face.', 172, 68, N'Lean and functionally muscular, shoulders broad from years of physical restraint work, no excess softness but not hard-carved either. Built for sustained effort rather than explosive power.', N'Natural black with hints of grey at the temples, kept in locs', N'Locs wrapped daily in a practiced spiral, pinned with small copper rings of varying diameters', N'Medium (locs reach mid-back when unwrapped)', N'Deep brown, sharp and reading-focused', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones, richly blended from Southeast Asian, North African, and Pacific Islander ancestry', N'Face marked by laugh lines around eyes and mouth, slight asymmetrical set to jaw from an old fracture improperly healed, skin maintained with functional care rather than aesthetic obsession. No cosmetic smoothing. The blended ancestry creates subtle variation in skin tone texture across the face—warmth concentrating slightly more in the cheeks and across the bridge of the nose, the face of someone who has made peace with earning its marks.', N'Pair of amber-brown cat ear prosthetics replacing standard human ears, cosmetic but unmissable, warm metallic sheen at the base where they interface with her skull. Faint hydraulic-assist definition in forearm musculature when her sleeves are rolled, visible servo articulation at the wrists. Right palm bears a thin circular biometric interface port, slightly raised, with a faint blue LED indicator that cycles when active.', N'Moves with unhurried deliberateness, economical and purposeful. No wasted motion, no nervous energy. Walks with her weight centered, hands ready but not guarded. When seated, she is patient and still. Her gaze settles and holds.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional. Favors fitted cargo jackets in grey or rust-brown synthetic leather with reinforced seams and multiple breast pockets, paired with reinforced trousers in dark synthetic weave. Wears a worn but well-maintained smartwatch on left wrist (warrant verification, message alerts). Small copper rings visible on her fingers — functional jewelry with sentimental weight. Boots are orthopaedic-grade, upgraded leather, broken in but maintained. Denim on days she is not actively fielding contracts. Minimal jewelry beyond the ear prosthetics and her working rings; a small woven cord bracelet on right wrist (traditional marker of her mother''s lineage). No visible corporate branding or tier signifiers.', N'Three years ago she located a skip who turned out to be running from a Tessera internal warrant disguised as a civil compliance order — a political purge dressed in legal clothing. She let the person disappear instead of completing the contract. She returned the advance, cited ''subject not located,'' and has never spoken of it. The skip is still out there somewhere.', N'Economical professional language with a dry humor that surfaces unexpectedly. Mixes Mande-rooted phrases from her mother''s language into casual speech. Becomes extremely precise and formal when discussing contracts or legal matters.', N'Deliberate and unhurried. Comfortable with silence in negotiation. Never appears to be in a hurry even when she is.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'mika_erikstad_masoe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ae-759b-804c-e5b9d3eff8bf', N'Havard Madrigal', N'Havard', N'', N'Madrigal', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'North Branch Commons, near North Ave and Damen', N'Anti-corporate agitator and protest coordinator', N'No single org — deliberately unaffiliated. Acts as coordinator between several North Branch Commons activist groups and takes operational lead on direct actions.', N'Havard Madrigal is tall and still growing, with a loose-limbed energy that makes him seem like he might trip over himself until suddenly he doesn''t — he moves fast when he needs to and knows every rooftop, alley, and maintenance corridor in the North Branch Commons with the intimacy of someone who has been running since he was twelve. His skin is a rich brown, and he has retractable claw mods on his right hand that he got on a dare at sixteen and has kept because they''re useful for scaling drainage pipes. His left cheekbone has a hairline fracture that healed imperfectly — a reminder from a Palladian security response at a demonstration last year.

He coordinates direct actions — marches, blockades, projection vandalism, the occasional coordinated work disruption in Palladian-adjacent supply lines — with a tactical instinct that belies his age and an absolute inability to sit through a long meeting without his knee bouncing audibly. He is not strategic in the way older activists mean it. He is strategic in the way a game player is: fast pattern recognition, good in chaos, bad at long timelines. The elders in the movement find him alternately inspiring and exhausting. He finds them slow.', N'Kinetic energy and ground-level access — he knows what''s happening on the street right now, can mobilize people fast, and is a good barometer for youth sentiment in the Commons.', N'', N'Retractable claw mods, right hand (basic, street-grade). Reinforced kneejoints from a running injury repair. Mesh-broadcast node embedded in collar — lets him push real-time comms to his network during actions.', N'Sleeps irregular hours in a rotating arrangement with three different comrades'' apartments, spends days in motion — scouting locations, flyering, coordinating over encrypted channels, arguing in common spaces.', N'Havard Madrigal, 188cm lean-muscled parkour runner with warm caramel complexion blending Hispanic, Sub-Saharan African, Southeast Asian, and Eastern European heritage. Sharp high cheekbones, full lips, dark brown eyes shadowed with exhaustion, prominent scar crossing left cheekbone. Black short-fade hair, stubbled jaw. Right hand features retractable metallic claw augmentations with scuffed chrome. Rope-burn scars visible on forearms. Wearing oversized black hoodie layered over athletic shirt, heavily patched cargo pants, worn climbing shoes. Mesh-broadcast node visible at neck under high collar. Coiled posture, shoulder hunched, fingers twitching with restless energy. Dark urban rooftop setting, neon glow from city below, rain-slicked surfaces, cool neo-noir lighting casting shadows across angular features. Cinematic GLMZ, street-tier transhumanist aesthetics, gritty and hyperaware mood --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'North Branch Commons', N'local', N'North Branch Commons', N'Complex diaspora blend: predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (62.9%) providing warm base tones and facial structure, with significant Sub-Saharan African (13.4%) contributing fuller lips and broader nasal bridge, Southeast Asian (12.1%) adding subtle eye shape and cheekbone definition, and Eastern European (11.6%) visible in high cheekbone prominence and slight pallor undertones. The combination creates a warm caramel complexion with layered depth—sun-responsive warmth layered over cooler undertones.', 188, 71, N'Lanky and angular with lean muscle from constant movement and rooftop running. Long-limbed with visible definition in shoulders and forearms from scaling work. Chest slightly concave from years of irregular eating.', N'Black, natural', N'Short fade, kept practical and low-maintenance. Often uneven from self-cutting or scissor work done in apartments between actions.', N'Short', N'Dark brown, naturally warm', N'Warm caramel to golden-brown complexion with balanced fusion of warm and cool undertones—the caramel-gold warmth from Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African ancestry tempered by subtle olive-grey undertones from Eastern European and Southeast Asian heritage. Sun-responsive with even warmth distribution. Mid-depth tone showing neither pallor nor deep saturation—a harmonious blend.', N'Facial structure combining high, prominent cheekbones from Eastern European ancestry with fuller lips and broader nasal bridge from Hispanic and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Subtle eye shape refinement from Southeast Asian ancestry. Left cheekbone shows a visible irregularity—hairline fracture scar approximately 4cm long, healed slightly lighter against warm caramel skin with minor misalignment creating asymmetry. Perpetually tired eyes with pronounced dark circles. Minimal facial hair grooming, often a few days of stubble. Skin otherwise clear but marked by minor scrapes and rope burns from regular climbing.', N'Right hand shows retractable claw mods—five metallic prongs (approximately 8cm extended length) housed beneath knuckle-skin integration points. Chrome is scuffed and shows street-grade fabrication. Reinforced kneecaps visible as slight hardening/discoloration along the patellar tendons. Mesh-broadcast node at base of neck beneath collar line—visible as a small raised bump when neck is exposed, slight LED indicator glow underneath skin in low light.', N'Operates in constant motion—fidgeting, bouncing knee when stationary, fingers twitching. Walks with a loping gait optimized for speed and momentum. Descends stairs and ladders with surprising grace despite lanky frame. Shoulders naturally hunched from hours hunched over encrypted devices. When focused, becomes almost unnaturally still before sudden explosive movement. Rests in coiled positions—crouched rather than seated.', N'Tier 4/5 transitional—salvaged and repurposed. Cargo pants patched multiple times with different fabrics, pockets stuffed with climbing gear and encrypted comms. Oversized hoodies (usually black or dark gray, logo-faded) layered over fitted athletic shirts. Worn Goretex jacket with modified pockets for quick access. No corporate branding. Scuffed climbing shoes, preferring grip over comfort. Reusable equipment bag made from salvaged tarp material slung over one shoulder. Mesh node embedded in base of neck creates subtle bulge under high collars. Clothing functional and designed for movement, showing heavy wear and multiple repairs.', N'After the Palladian response that broke his cheekbone, Rashid secretly identified three security officers involved and posted their personal addresses on an encrypted forum. He framed it as ''public accountability.'' Someone vandalized one of the addresses. He does not know if he feels bad about this. He is afraid that he doesn''t.', N'Current North Branch Commons street slang, fast references, tends to use ''we'' rather than ''I'' for political statements and ''I'' for personal ones as a kind of unconscious integrity', N'Rapid, interrupts himself to revise mid-sentence, thoughts arrive faster than speech', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'havard_madrigal');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a68e-7d5b-83cc-e5dc8a8ff36b', N'Dilnoza Echeverría-Ekwensi-Tovar', N'Dilnoza', N'', N'Echeverría-Ekwensi-Tovar', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, Calumet Rise, near North Ave and Damen', N'Pawn shop owner and discreet secondhand goods trader', N'Independent; Oxidian Market Vendors Guild associate member; informal fence for two district-level street associations', N'Dilnoza Echeverría-Ekwensi-Tovar is a compact, precise woman with medium-dark skin, silver-shot black hair she keeps cropped close, and a pair of cat ears — slate grey, slightly large for her head — that she got at thirty-five as a birthday gift to herself and has never once regretted. Her shop, Ferreira & Found, occupies a permanent stall reinforced with welded security grating and smells of machine oil, old fabric, and the faintly sweet incense she burns for the E.L.F. she calls the Assessor, which she believes governs fair exchange and the honest weighing of value. The Assessor''s shrine is a polished scale bolted to the back wall with small offerings of old coins and broken jewelry hanging from it.

Dilnoza Echeverría-Ekwensi-Tovar is sharp, unhurried, and constitutionally impossible to rush or charm. She has a talent for appraising objects that borders on uncanny — she can hold a piece of chrome for thirty seconds and tell you where it came from, how old it is, and what its street value is within a few percent. She is not unkind but she is precise, and she runs her shop on a code of scrupulous fairness that has made her one of the most trusted figures in Calumet Rise. She is also one of the best-informed people in the district, because people tell you things when they are desperate to sell.', N'Reliable fence and appraisal source; keeper of provenance — she can often tell where stolen or mysterious objects came from. Quest-giver for items that have come into her shop trailing obvious trouble.', N'', N'Cosmetic cat ears (slate grey). A worn but functional appraisal monocle — a secondhand optical aug that lets her see material composition overlays; the UI is in a language she does not fully read but she has learned to interpret the color coding.', N'Opens at 0900 sharp, closes at 2000 sharp — no exceptions. Spends her lunch hour cataloguing new inventory in a paper ledger she refuses to digitize, and her evenings doing minor repair work on items she plans to resell.', N'Dilnoza Echeverría-Ekwensi-Tovar, 158cm compact lean frame, GLMZ, warm golden-bronze skin with earthy undertones blending Hispanic, African, and South Asian heritage. Close-cropped black hair with silver threading. Deep brown eyes, left eye with scarring around optical monocle mount—brass and polymer mounted monocle with faint color-coded UI overlays visible across iris. Slate grey cosmetic cat ears oversized on head with subtle LED ports. Direct, assessing gaze. Standing in worn tech-salvage shop surrounded by metal parts and tools. Wearing reinforced canvas apron over layered grey and black long-sleeved shirts, practical work pants, oil-stained leather gloves hanging from apron, scuffed ankle-support boots. Thin silver chain with key visible at throat. Small balance-scale tattoo on inner left wrist visible. Faint burn scar on inside right wrist. Hands show deep callusing from metalwork. Upright, economical posture. Ambient shop lighting with warm overhead floods casting subtle shadows. Mood: serious, focused, evaluating. Neo-noir utilitarian aesthetic, function over form --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Hispanic/Latin American (73.0%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (23.7%) and South Asian (3.3%) ancestry; a rich blend of Iberian, Indigenous, African, and minor South Asian lineages creating warm, complex skin tones with golden and earthy undertones', 158, 52, N'Compact and lean, economical in movement; the build of someone who has never wasted an ounce of effort or flesh', N'Black with silver threading', N'Cropped close to the scalp in a practical, no-nonsense cut', N'Short', N'Deep brown, left eye with faint scarring around the orbital ridge where the appraisal monocle mounts', N'Warm golden-bronze with earthy undertones; the golden warmth of Hispanic/Latin heritage blended with the deeper richness of Sub-Saharan African ancestry, creating a complex medium-warm complexion evident across face and hands; forearms and hands show deep callusing from decades of handling metal and rough goods', N'Balanced facial structure with defined cheekbones and slightly rounded jawline reflecting the blend of Indigenous and African lineages; warm-toned skin with subtle earthy richness; unlined face despite her age, suggesting either good genetics or quality skincare; minimal makeup; expression defaults to neutral assessment rather than warmth', N'Slate grey cosmetic cat ears with subtle LED accommodation ports at the base (rarely used). A worn secondhand optical monocle mounted on her left eye with a visible brass and polymer mount; the lens shows faint optical distortion and is visibly well-used. The monocle''s UI occasionally casts faint color-coded overlays across her iris that are visible to close observers.', N'Upright, economical, deliberate. Moves through her shop with the precision of someone who knows where every object is; never hurries, never fumbles. Hands are steady and purposeful. Eye contact is direct and held slightly longer than is comfortable for most people — the assessment gaze of someone appraising value.', N'Tier 3-4 workwear: reinforced canvas apron over layered long-sleeved shirts in muted colors (grey, black, deep green), worn for durability rather than fashion. Practical work pants with tool pockets. Oil-stained leather gloves, often hanging from her apron. Boots with good grip and ankle support, scuffed from years of shop floors. A thin silver chain with a key — probably to her shop safe — worn visible at her throat. No jewelry beyond functional items.', N'She has been quietly purchasing and storing specific categories of items — old family photographs, handmade children''s toys, personal journals — that nobody ever came back to reclaim. She has a locked cabinet full of them. She cannot bring herself to resell them and cannot explain why she keeps them.', N'Measured, economical, specific. Uses precise numbers. Avoids hedging language — says what she means.', N'Deliberate and unhurried; comfortable with silence in a way that unnerves people who are not.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dilnoza_echeverr_a_ekwensi_tovar');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a694-790d-b55f-e66d7f93a54e', N'Calixto Solberg-Anang', N'Calixto', N'', N'Solberg-Anang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Stockyard — Bay 7 of the Grainfort vehicle warehouse complex, third sublevel, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Chop shop operator and parts fence in the Stockyard', N'Loosely affiliated with the Stockyard Collective, a decentralized network of chop operators and salvagers who share intel and occasionally muscle; pays the Collective a ten percent cut of high-value jobs', N'Calixto Solberg-Anang is lean and angular with deep brown skin, a shaved head, and a geneware modification that makes the left half of their jaw and cheekbone emit a faint copper-toned bioluminescence under stress or exertion — a cosmetic mod they got at nineteen that they''ve grown to dislike but can''t afford to remove. Their arms are heavily modified: one is a full prosthetic replacement below the elbow, matte black with exposed joint mechanisms they consider aesthetically correct; the other has a subdermal toolkit implanted along the forearm. They are almost always covered in vehicle lubricant and almost never bother apologizing for it. They wear a mechanics'' coverall with the arms torn off and a collection of salvaged badges and patches that function as neighborhood ID.

Calixto Solberg-Anang has the particular charisma of someone who is genuinely exceptional at a physical craft — they can strip a Ferrogate Transit hauler of its marketable components in forty minutes flat, and people who watch them work go quiet the way people go quiet watching any form of mastery. Off the tools they are restless, impatient, and prone to saying true things in the bluntest possible configuration. They have strong opinions about which E.L.F.s are worth propitiating and which are noise: they maintain a small shrine to a data-spirit they believe inhabits the Grainfort warehouse''s aging electrical grid, which they call ''the Socket,'' and they leave it burned-out components as offerings.', N'Parts and equipment source, local color, potential ally for characters who need vehicle components or Ferrogate Transit system knowledge; their social network in the Stockyard makes them a useful connector.', N'', N'Left arm full prosthetic replacement (matte black, exposed joints — functional grade, self-maintained). Subdermal toolkit implant in right forearm (micro-drill, wire stripper, voltage probe). Bioluminescent geneware — left jaw and cheekbone, copper-toned, activates under stress or exertion (cosmetic, unwanted).', N'Down in Bay 7 by 6am to receive incoming vehicles before the Grainfort loading crews arrive for their legitimate shift. Works through the day on disassembly and parts sorting. Afternoons are for buyers — fences, independent mechanics, and the occasional person who asks too few questions about provenance.', N'Calixto Solberg-Anang, 172cm lean mechanic with warm bronze skin and golden undertones, shaved head revealing high cheekbones and angular jawline, dark brown eyes with slight upward cant, faint copper bioluminescent geneware tracery visible on left jaw under stress. Full matte-black prosthetic left arm below elbow with exposed joint mechanisms and articulated finger servos. Right forearm bears visible subdermal implant scarring with integrated tool ports. Wearing faded grey mechanics'' coverall with both sleeves torn off at mid-bicep, chest covered in salvaged badges and patches. Heavy-treaded work boots. Hands marked with chronic mechanical lubricant stains. Standing in economical posture with restless hands, steady gaze. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial workshop setting, neon accent lighting catching the bioluminescent geneware, gritty and determined atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Stockyard', N'local', N'The Stockyard', N'Southeast Asian (65.2%), Indigenous American (25.2%), and Sub-Saharan African (9.6%) ancestry creates a striking polychromatic blend. Southeast Asian genetic dominance provides defined cheekbones and characteristic eye shape, while Indigenous American ancestry contributes broader facial structure and warm earth undertones. Sub-Saharan African heritage adds richness to skin depth and subtle warmth variation across complexion. The combination produces a uniquely balanced facial architecture with golden-bronze undertones and warm, layered skin dimension.', 172, 62, N'Lean and angular with defined musculature from years of precision hand work; no excess mass, all economy of motion', N'Natural black', N'Cleanly shaved', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown', N'Warm bronze with golden undertones, the result of dominant Southeast Asian genetics enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth and Indigenous American warmth; maintains a rich, even complexion with natural luminosity and subtle golden radiance', N'High, prominent cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian ancestry structure; clean-shaven face revealing an angular jawline with subtle fullness from Indigenous American heritage; composed expression with eyes set at a slight upward cant characteristic of Southeast Asian genetics; left jaw and cheekbone bear a faint copper bioluminescent geneware visible as a subtle shimmer under tension or exertion', N'Left arm is a full matte-black prosthetic below the elbow with exposed joint mechanisms and articulated finger servos; right forearm bears visible subdermal implant scarring with integrated tool ports (micro-drill, wire stripper, voltage probe accessible at the wrist)', N'Economical and precise; moves like someone who has trained their body for repetitive mechanical work; stands with weight distributed for balance and quick access to tools; hands are rarely still, frequently manipulating objects or making small adjustments; maintains steady eye contact but with a restless quality, as if calculating disassembly sequences even during conversation', N'Mechanics'' coverall in faded grey industrial fabric with both sleeves torn off at mid-bicep, exposing the prosthetic and implant work; chest and shoulders covered in salvaged badges, patches, and neighborhood identification markers sewn or pinned directly to the fabric; boots are heavy-treaded work grade, reinforced at the heel and toe; no jewelry or decorative items except the functional patches', N'Three months ago they found something inside a Ferrogate Transit security hauler they were stripping — an encrypted drive hidden in a shielded compartment that definitely wasn''t supposed to be there. They haven''t sold it, haven''t opened it, have told no one. It''s under a floorboard in Bay 7 and they think about it every day.', N'Terse, technical, mechanical metaphors for everything. Ukrainian-inflected vowel flattening from a grandparent they never met but whose speech patterns survived in the family. Samoan terms of intensity and emphasis woven through.', N'Fast when talking about things they know, abrupt full stops when they don''t want to continue a subject.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'calixto_solberg_anang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62a-7108-b7e8-e69068f7097f', N'Dadzie Kristjánsson', N'Dadzie', N'', N'Kristjánsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 44, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Glassway — corporate-adjacent retail district, heavy surveillance, near Damen and Armitage', N'Remote drone and vehicle operations specialist — rigger', N'Freelance — multi-district operator', N'Dadzie Kristjánsson is compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 44, scars map her face like a transit diagram of bad decisions and worse luck. The chrome is visible — internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immu — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see her surpass them. She works as a rigger out of Glassway, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Everyone who''s worked with Dadzie Kristjánsson agrees on two things: she is worth the fee, and she is terrible company at dinner.', N'Idris Vega-Acheampong is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks. Internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on demand', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Dadzie Kristjánsson, compact athletic woman of mixed East Asian-African-European descent, height 158cm. Deep bronze skin with golden undertones, burnished copper in light. High sculpted cheekbones, dark brown eyes assessing and alert. Black hair pulled back tight in functional braid, silver at temples. Face weathered with old combat scars: thin white line bisecting left cheekbone, burn scars at jaw, jagged forehead scar. No makeup, weathered skin. Chrome and silver breathing apparatus visible at collarbone and neck with pale blue LED pulses, chrome plating on shoulders and upper chest. Wearing modular charcoal insulated jacket with reinforced elbows, cargo utility pants worn at cuffs, steel-toed scuffed boots, thin thermal undersuit visible at neck and wrists. Worn leather biker jacket overtop. Metal cuff on right wrist. Posture rigid and balanced, eyes tracking, no wasted movement. Neutral suspicious expression. GLMZ aesthetic, gritty industrial setting, cool overhead lighting, shadows emphasizing scar tissue and chrome augmentation. Mood: dangerous, focused, experienced runner. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Glassway', N'local', N'Glassway', N'Predominantly East Asian (61%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (28%) and minor Eastern European (11%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a striking fusion: high, angular cheekbones from East Asian lineage are deepened and warmed by African heritage, while subtle structural elements from Eastern European ancestry add definition to the jawline. The result is a face with exceptional symmetry and dimension — sharp planes softened by rich, warm undertones.', 158, 62, N'Compact and densely muscled, low center of gravity — built like a boxer or gymnast rather than a bodybuilder. Shoulders broad for her frame, legs thick and functional. Every kilogram is intentional.', N'Natural black with silver threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid or wrapped in a headwrap — nothing loose that could catch in machinery', N'Medium (pulled back)', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Deep warm bronze with subtle golden undertones — the result of East Asian base enriched by Sub-Saharan African warmth and Eastern European influence creates a rich, even complexion that reads as burnished copper in certain light', N'Face mapped with old scars — a thin line bisecting her left cheekbone, puckering at her jaw from burns, a jagged mark across her forehead near the hairline. Skin is weathered, kept clean but not moisturized. No makeup. High, prominent cheekbones characteristic of East Asian ancestry visible beneath scars, structure emphasized rather than softened. Cheekbone prominence deepened by Sub-Saharan African heritage, creating sculpted definition. Eyes have the flat, assessing quality of someone who reads people for work.', N'Visible silver-chrome breathing apparatus at collarbone and neck — internal air filtration system connects to synthetic lungs, with faint LED indicator lights (pale blue) that pulse when system is active. Chrome plating visible where the system meets skin at shoulders and upper chest. No effort made to hide or cosmetically blend the augmentation.', N'Moves with economy and precision — no wasted motion. Shoulders squared and balanced. Head stays level. Eyes constantly tracking, peripheral vision well-used. Sits in ways that allow quick movement. Doesn''t fidget; doesn''t relax into furniture. Default resting expression is neutral to slightly suspicious.', N'Tier 3-4 pragmatic runner aesthetic. Insulated jacket in charcoal gray or black — modular, many pockets, reinforced at elbows and shoulders. Utility pants with cargo pockets, worn at cuffs and knees. Steel-toed boots, scuffed and maintained. No logos or corp branding. Undersuit visible at neck and wrists — thin thermal layer for temp regulation and minor impact protection. A leather biker jacket over top on colder days, weather-beaten and patched. Minimal jewelry except a worn metal cuff on right wrist (datum counter or personal talisman). Everything is black, gray, or dark blue — nothing draws attention.', N'Idris Vega-Acheampong witnessed a massacre during a corporate dispute and has evidence stored in a dead drop. Publishing it would expose powerful people. Keeping it is leverage and liability.', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dadzie_kristj_nsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a686-7548-9dd7-e6b86abc615e', N'Gloriana Traoré-Okonkwo-Fujiwara', N'Gloriana', N'', N'Traoré-Okonkwo-Fujiwara', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Undertow — operates out of a repurposed cold-storage unit under the Escanaba Gateway transit platform, near Wacker and State', N'Unlicensed organ harvester and body-parts middleman working the Undertow', N'Loosely connected to a procurement network called the Pale Market; no formal gang affiliation; The Undertow', N'Gloriana Traoré-Okonkwo-Fujiwara is a lean, angular young man with medium-brown skin and cheekbones that cast hard shadows. His geneware manifests as a faint bioluminescent blue-green pattern along his jaw and collarbone — originally cosmetic, chosen when he was sixteen and thought he''d go into performance. He has a retractable claw mod on his right hand that he insists is also just cosmetic, though the precision of it is not. He keeps his head shaved and wears a standard-issue Ferrogate Transit worker vest that he''s never actually worked for — the corponation ID is forged but it gets him past a lot of checkpoints without questions.

Gloriana Traoré-Okonkwo-Fujiwara has the particular nervous energy of someone who knows their work is illegal but has convinced himself it''s also a public service — he talks about ''redistribution of biological resources'' and ''closing the gap between who can afford Helix Biosystems and who can''t.'' He''s not entirely wrong, and he''s not entirely sincere. He''s genuinely squeamish about pain, which creates an odd dissonance in his line of work, and he over-explains his anaesthetic protocols to anyone who will listen as proof of his ethics. He is terrified of becoming someone he wouldn''t recognize.', N'Morally complex source of medical resources and body-modification intel; quest giver for retrieval jobs; window into the underground medical economy; can be ally or antagonist depending on whose organ supply he''s managing.', N'', N'Bioluminescent jaw and collarbone pattern (geneware, cosmetic origin). Retractable precision claw — right index finger. Neural-haptic surgical overlay (black market, allows enhanced fine motor feedback during procedures).', N'Sleeps irregular hours in his cold-storage unit, monitors the Pale Market''s procurement requests via encrypted channel, spends evenings in transit hubs scouting potential donors or buyers, occasionally takes legitimate medical courier jobs as cover.', N'GLMZ portrait of Gloriana, a lean 178cm tall mixed-heritage man with deep warm brown skin glowing with golden undertones. High prominent cheekbones with Central Asian angularity, strong defined jawline, and wide-set dark brown eyes with subtle East Asian epicanthal fold. Clean-shaven head, dark brown skin showing chronic sleep deprivation with faint purple beneath eyes. Distinctive bioluminescent blue-green geneware pattern pulsing softly along jawline and collarbone, brightest in the shadows. Wearing forged Ferrogate Transit worker vest in charcoal grey over black merino undershirt, dark olive cargo pants, steel-toed boots. Retractable titanium claw mechanism visible on right index finger. Careful, precise posture with slight forward lean, clenched fist, tension in shoulders. Cold-storage platform lighting, dim blue-green neon reflection on skin, moody atmospheric tension. Neural augmentation evident in micro-movements. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Undertow', N'local', N'The Undertow', N'Sub-Saharan African foundation (56.8%) with significant Central Asian (19.2%) influence creating distinctive bone structure. Additional ancestry from East Asian (8.2%), Southeast Asian (6.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (5.1%), and North African (4.1%) heritage creates a complex phenotype: deep warm brown skin with golden and subtle warm undertones, high prominent cheekbones with Central Asian angularity, refined jawline structure, and eye geometry showing gentle East Asian influence with wider-set placement and subtle epicanthal character. A truly global genetic mosaic.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with minimal body fat; wiry musculature from years of precise manual work and nervous energy. Chest and shoulders slightly narrow, giving an ascetic appearance.', N'Black', N'Cleanly shaved scalp, maintained with regular precision; no facial hair.', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown, with faint neural-interface lag when he''s processing encrypted data (pupils dilate irregularly).', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones from Sub-Saharan heritage, enriched by subtle Central Asian warmth and North African influence. Rich saturation that catches light with a luminous quality; the skin has a healthy, almost polished appearance despite chronic stress.', N'High, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Sub-Saharan ancestry with generous facial width, refined by Central Asian structural angularity. Strong, defined jawline enhanced by the bone structure inheritance. Eye geometry reflects East Asian heritage—wider-set with gentle epicanthal fold—balanced against the broader Sub-Saharan facial proportions. Skin is clear but shows chronic sleep deprivation with faint purple undertones beneath eyes. Lips are full and well-defined, often pressed in concentration. Facial structure shows harmonious blending across all ancestry components.', N'The retractable claw on his right index finger is visible when extended (surgical-grade titanium alloy with mono-molecular edge, housed beneath a synthetic nail cap). The bioluminescent jaw pattern glows softly in darkness—currently his most visible augmentation, though he downplays it. The neural-haptic overlay is subcutaneous and invisible, but his right hand occasionally twitches with micro-adjustments when he''s thinking through a procedure.', N'He moves with careful, economical precision—a consequence of both his surgical work and his anxiety. His gait is quick and slightly forward-leaning, as if always moving toward something just out of reach. He has a habit of clenching and unclenching his right fist, and his fingers often trace the air in practiced surgical patterns when he''s talking. His neck is slightly tense, shoulders high. He maintains eye contact longer than comfortable, as if trying to convince whoever he''s talking to of his sincerity.', N'Wears a forged Ferrogate Transit worker vest (charcoal grey with reflective piping, slightly worn at the cuffs) over a plain black merino wool undershirt. The ID badge clipped to his vest reads ''ORLAN D. — PLATFORM MAINTENANCE 7B'' with a falsified corporately-issued laminate. Cargo pants in dark olive, pre-worn, with heavy-duty pockets suitable for carrying sealed medical containers. Steel-toed boots (scuffed, well-maintained). Over this, he wears a lightweight insulated jacket in slate grey—practical for the cold-storage unit and the transit platform''s climate control. No visible jewelry or personal markers beyond the geneware. His aesthetic is deliberately forgettable: Tier 3-4 worker, unremarkable, designed to pass through checkpoints without drawing attention.', N'Six months ago he harvested a kidney from a donor who he now suspects did not consent — the broker told him the paperwork was in order but the donor''s terrified expression has never left him; he still has the Φ2,400 in a locked account he can''t bring himself to spend', N'Medical terminology used casually mixed with Undertow slang; over-explains processes; apologizes pre-emptively', N'Fast and slightly breathless when nervous, which is often; slows dramatically when talking about procedure, like reciting a liturgy', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gloriana_traor_okonkwo_fujiwara');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a8-780c-99a5-e6dbf3babfba', N'Bart Montalvo', N'Bart', N'', N'Montalvo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 40, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ashfield — former residential district, half-burned, now squatter territory, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Electronic and physical observation expert — surveillance specialist', N'Unaffiliated — too volatile for permanent crews', N'Bart Montalvo is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 40, the augmentation scarring around his temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Bart Montalvo plans to keep it that way. He works as a surveillance specialist out of Ashfield, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Bart Montalvo describe him as a precision instrument — point him at a problem and get out of the way.', N'As a surveillance specialist, Alper Holmberg-Dembele embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Subdermal weapon mount — pop-out blade in each forearm. Cybernetic arm — right, full replacement from shoulder — stronger than organic, obvious chrome', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Bart Montalvo, 2226 neo-noir operative, 178cm stocky solid frame. Warm medium-deep golden-olive tan skin, weathered Pacific Islander and Indigenous American features with prominent squared jaw and defined high cheekbones. Dark brown hair graying at temples, cropped short. Pale gray baseline eyes, deep-set and tired. Five-o''clock shadow. Pale pink horseshoe augmentation scarring at temples, old white jaw scar, heavy keloid forearm scarring visible. Full-replacement right arm cybernetic chrome and steel with visible synthetic muscle at elbow, pop-out blade mount slots along forearms. Sleeveless dark gray shirt, worn synthweave cargo pants with equipment loops, faded ballistic jacket patched at elbows, scuffed steel-toed boots. Stands in ready stance, weight forward on balls of feet. Hands in fists. Active, tracking gaze. Industrial Ashfield setting, polluted gray-blue neon lighting, paranoid body language, economical movement. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, functional and replaceable. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfield', N'local', N'Ashfield', N'Pacific Islander (40%), Hispanic/Latin American (39%), and Indigenous American (21%) — a diaspora blend creating warm medium-deep skin with golden and olive undertones. The broader facial structure, defined cheekbones, and prominent squared jaw reflect Pacific Islander and Indigenous American ancestry. Higher, more angular cheekbones and slightly wider face structure are characteristic of indigenous Pacific and American lineages, while the warmth and depth of complexion draws from all three heritage groups'' tropical and equatorial origins.', 178, 94, N'Stocky and solid, thick through the chest and shoulders with the compact density of someone who has spent decades maintaining functional strength rather than aesthetic muscle. Forearms are visibly corded, scarred from repeated augmentation work.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples', N'Cropped short, practical, no styling', N'Short', N'Pale gray, unremarkable — human baseline', N'Medium-deep warm tan with golden and olive undertones, weathered from years in Ashfield''s polluted air and inconsistent shelter. The warmth and depth reflect the blended ancestry across Pacific Islander, Hispanic/Latin American, and Indigenous American heritage.', N'Hard-lined face with broader, fuller bone structure reflecting Pacific Islander and Indigenous American ancestry. Jaw is prominent and squared. Cheekbones are higher and more defined, with slightly wider face structure characteristic of Pacific Islander and Indigenous American lineages. Deep nasolabial folds frame the mouth. Skin texture rough, pockmarked around the temple and jawline where augmentation scarring pulls slightly at the surface. Five-o''clock shadow is his default state. Eyes sit deep-set, giving him a permanently tired appearance that suits his work.', N'Right arm is full-replacement cybernetic from shoulder joint down — obvious chrome and polished steel, synthetic muscle layering visible at the elbow joint. The arm is noticeably stronger and more refined than organic tissue, with articulation that''s too precise. Pop-out blade mounts are visible along both forearms as chrome-lined slots, sealed but obvious to anyone who knows what they''re looking at. Subdermal scarring around temples indicates weapon mount installation beneath the skin.', N'Stands with weight balanced forward on the balls of his feet, a runner''s ready stance. Moves deliberately, economically — no wasted motion. His right arm compensates with slight mechanical hesitation on fast movements, but he''s so practiced with it that the hesitation reads as control rather than disability. Hands rest in fists more often than open palms. His gaze is active, tracking, never settling — the paranoia is embedded in his body language.', N'Tier 5 utilitarian — worn synthweave cargo pants with visible equipment loops, reinforced at stress points. Sleeveless or short-sleeved tops to keep the right arm visible and unobstructed, usually unmarked dark gray or black. Over this, a faded ballistic jacket with multiple pockets, patched at the elbows, missing the logo from its original brand. Steel-toed boots, scuffed, re-soled multiple times. No jewelry, no identifying markers beyond his augmentations. Clothing is functional and replaceable, not an investment.', N'', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bart_montalvo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72f-7858-8388-e6ed60294a5e', N'Daisuke Taufa', N'Daisuke', N'', N'Taufa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Dearborn Forge, near Damen and Armitage', N'Union organizer and strike coordinator', N'Ferrogate Transit Workers'' Solidarity Network (wildcat faction); informal ties to the Dearborn Forge neighborhood mutual aid grid', N'Daisuke Taufa is wiry and kinetic, never quite still — they bounce a knee, tap a pattern on surfaces, turn a stylus through their fingers in endless loops. Their skin is medium brown, their eyes modified to shift through a slow amber-to-green cycle they bought on installment from a bodmod stall and haven''t finished paying off. They keep their hair long and loose on days off and braided tight when they''re working, and they have a small constellation of bioluminescent freckles across their nose and cheekbones that pulse faintly when they''re excited or angry — which is most of the time.

Daisuke Taufa organizes Ferrogate Transit maintenance workers across three Dearborn Forge yards, in direct defiance of both Ferrogate''s union-busting contractors and a faction within the official union that has grown comfortable with management. They''re charismatic in the way of someone who has figured out exactly how to make you feel heard and then redirect that energy into collective action — they''re not manipulative, exactly, but they are deliberate. They take risks that frighten older organizers. They also show up at 05:30 when someone''s shift starts and stay until the last worker goes home.', N'Quest giver, local color, fixer within working-class networks — knows every maintenance worker, freight handler, and yard supervisor across the Dearborn yards. Can provide access, safe harbor, or boots-on-the-ground numbers.', N'', N'Color-cycling eye modification (amber to green, installment-plan bodmod); bioluminescent freckle array (chest and face); a cheap neural ping implant that lets them push alerts to their network contacts', N'Early mornings at the yard gates talking to workers coming off overnight shifts. Days spent in the stalls and common areas of Dearborn Forge, meeting in ones and twos. Evenings coordinating with the broader network over encrypted channels. They sleep in rotating locations — officially their address is a cousin''s flat in Mexicantown Libre.', N'Daisuke Taufa, 168cm lean wiry figure with warm golden-bronze skin complexion blending Pacific Islander, Eastern European, North African, and Latin warmth, high sharp cheekbones with angular jawline, dark brown hair with red undertones worn in thick braids down mid-back secured with polymer clips, modified eyes cycling slowly through amber-chartreuse-soft green in 8-second loop with slightly enlarged irises, faint bioluminescent freckle array across nose bridge and cheekbones (pale blue-white, subtle), matching constellation on upper chest, small temple scar, restless posture radiating controlled kinetic energy, wearing faded charcoal Ferrogate maintenance union jacket with hand-stitched patches over thermal base layer, reinforced cargo work pants, grip-tread boots, worn canvas shoulder bag, recycled-metal ring, deep urban nocturne GLMZ setting in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone maintenance yard with cool blue-amber neon accent lighting, industrial scaffolding and machinery in soft focus background, atmospheric mist, character caught mid-gesture with hands animated in conversation or organizing, sharp focus on face showing the dimensional beauty of blended ancestry, cinematic neo-noir noir aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dearborn Forge', N'local', N'Dearborn Forge', N'Pacific Islander dominant (59.6%) with substantial Eastern European (13.5%), North African (10.0%), Sub-Saharan African (9.6%), and Hispanic/Latin American (7.3%) ancestry; phenotype reflects the Ubiquitous Diaspora''s genetic lottery—warm Polynesian bone structure and skin undertones blended with Eastern European angularity in the jaw and cheekbones, North African depth in eye-setting and complexion richness, Sub-Saharan African features in lip fullness and facial proportions, and Hispanic/Latin American warmth in overall coloration. Results in a complexion that reads as deeply sun-kissed golden-bronze with dimensional warmth', 168, 58, N'Wiry and kinetic, lean muscle with minimal body fat; shoulders slightly narrower than hips; posture that suggests constant motion even when standing still', N'Natural dark brown with faint red undertones', N'Worn long and loose on days off in natural waves; pulled into tight, compact braids on working days—typically 4-6 thick plaits secured at the nape with recycled polymer clips', N'Long (shoulder-length when loose, mid-back when braided)', N'Modified: cycles slowly from amber through chartreuse to soft green on ~8-second loop; irises are slightly larger than baseline due to implant housing', N'Warm medium-golden brown with golden-bronze undertones; deep enough to reflect Sub-Saharan and North African richness, luminous enough to carry Pacific Islander and Hispanic/Latin warmth, with subtle cooler notes from Eastern European genetics creating dimensional complexity—reads as sun-touched and dimensional rather than flat', N'Strong multicontinental structure: high cheekbones with Pacific Islander prominence softened by Eastern European angularity, sharp jawline with North African depth, fuller lips reflecting Sub-Saharan and Hispanic/Latin ancestry, eye-set that balances Pacific Islander spacing with Eastern European intensity. Skin is generally clear but shows signs of inconsistent sleep and stress—faint darkening under eyes; a small scar on the left temple (about 1cm, thin) from a bodmod session gone slightly wrong; subtle interplay of feature sets from diverse ancestry blend creates distinctive, feature-rich appearance', N'Color-cycling eye modification is immediately apparent due to the slow, continuous hue shift and slightly non-standard iris diameter; bioluminescent freckles are visible on face and chest when garments expose skin, dormant but traceable under close inspection; neural ping implant is subcutaneous and not externally obvious unless clothing is removed', N'Restless and economical; bounces left knee in rapid intervals when sitting; habitually rotates a stylus or small object (pen, data-chip, transit token) through fingers in continuous loops; walks with quick, efficient strides; hands gesticulate frequently during conversation; eyes track movement and entrances constantly; overall impression is of someone running on high alert but not agitated—controlled kinetic energy', N'Tier 3-4 working class with militant undertones; prefers fitted, durable clothing in muted colors (charcoal, deep blue, rust); typically wears secondhand surplus work pants with reinforced knees, thermal base layers, and a faded Ferrogate maintenance union jacket (unofficial, from a previous campaign) with hand-stitched patches; multiple cargo pockets filled with union literature, encrypted data-chips, and snack bars; insulated boots with grip treads suitable for yard work; a worn canvas shoulder bag with frayed straps that carries personal items and organizing materials; minimal jewelry except for a recycled-metal ring on left ring finger (no clear symbolism, just worn). Appearance communicates ''always ready to move, always working, always listening.''', N'Ferrogate''s internal security division has offered them a quiet settlement twice — money, relocation, a clean record. They''ve refused both times. But they told no one they were offered it, because they''re terrified their network would wonder why Ferrogate wanted them gone badly enough to pay for it.', N'Vernacular-heavy, labor slang, code-switches into French phrases they picked up from their Malian grandparent; efficient and concrete', N'Fast, punchy, uses rhetorical questions constantly', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'daisuke_taufa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5be-7250-bab0-e73e93b06263', N'Delta Haraldsen', N'Delta', N'', N'Haraldsen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 79, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism, the Church of the Unbroken Signal — a former lakeshore antenna building converted to a place of worship, near Clark and Addison', N'Traditional religious leader (syncretic Catholic-Polynesian priest) and chrome prayer practitioner', N'Church of the Unbroken Signal; loose ecumenical network of syncretic congregations; no corponation affiliation and famously resistant to all corporate sponsorship offers', N'Delta Haraldsen is a large man gone soft with age, with big hands that still remember physical labor and a face deeply lined by decades of lake wind. His Guinean-Polynesian heritage is legible in his size and in the traditional tatau that cover his forearms and neck — old work from his father''s tradition, geometric and immaculately preserved, now supplemented by chrome prayer circuits inked over the same skin in metallic pigment that complete the patterns in a new vocabulary. He is mostly bald, with close-cropped white at the temples, and he keeps a koa wood cross at his belt alongside a small E.L.F. offering dish he has carried for forty years.

Father Bart runs the largest syncretic congregation in Edgewater Prism, about three hundred people who come to him for a faith that takes both the old sacraments and the new realities seriously at once. He has buried children of people he baptized. He has presided over deaths during power failures by the light of bioluminescent congregation members. He is theologically sophisticated and genuinely unconcerned about whether this makes him orthodox — he says God arrived in GLMZ the same as everyone else, carrying everything from before and adapting. He has a notable temper that he has mostly but not entirely conquered, and a laugh that fills a room.', N'Community authority and moral voice; mediator for district-level conflicts; long historical memory; potential quest giver for problems that have been building for decades; someone who knows where bodies are buried, metaphorically.', N'', N'Chrome prayer circuits over traditional tatau (cosmetic/devotional, metallic pigment). A cardiac support implant — medical necessity, installed eight years ago. No other augmentations; has refused enhancement on principle.', N'Morning mass at dawn with a small core congregation; administrative and pastoral work through the morning; open hours for the community in the afternoon where anyone can come with any problem; evening prayer service with significantly more attendees.', N'A distinguished elderly man of mixed global ancestry, warm medium-brown skin with mahogany tones, white close-cropped hair, deep brown eyes clouded slightly with age. Large-framed, broad-shouldered with barrel chest, carrying dignified heaviness of decades. Face shows deep lines, broad cheekbones blending East Asian structure with fuller lips and wide nose from African heritage, Northern European brow prominence. Meticulous grooming, clean-shaven. Forearms and neck covered in black geometric Polynesian tatau work with overlaid shimmering chrome prayer circuits that catch the light. Wears a black wool cassock with handwoven red and white Polynesian geometric stole. Carved koa wood cross hangs from leather cord at his belt. Stands with slight forward hunch, hands relaxed but expressive. Weathered hands show age spots and creases from decades of labor. Faint surgical scar visible on left collarbone. Setting: Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone interior, soft natural light filtering through windows, GLMZ era. Mood: contemplative, dignified, spiritually grounded despite advanced age and cardiac augmentation. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Northern European (30.7%), Sub-Saharan African (26.0%), Southeast Asian (20.1%), Pacific Islander (8.3%), East Asian (8.2%), South Asian (6.7%) — a complex global tapestry reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The genetic blend manifests as warm medium-brown skin with golden and reddish undertones. Facial structure shows broad cheekbones characteristic of Southeast and East Asian genetics, balanced by fuller lips and wider nose bridge from Sub-Saharan African heritage, with the bone prominence and brow structure of Northern European ancestry creating an overall harmonious blend that resists singular continental categorization.', 188, 104, N'Large-framed and broad-shouldered, softened by age and gravity into a barrel-chested heaviness. Still carries the muscularity of someone who spent decades doing physical labor, but now rounded at the middle and loose in the neck. Moves with deliberate slowness that suggests both dignity and the mechanical accommodation of an aging heart.', N'White', N'Close-cropped, worn very short at the crown with slightly longer tufts at the temples', N'Short', N'Deep brown, slightly clouded with cataracts at the edges', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and reddish undertones, richly mahogany across face and neck from decades of lake wind exposure and the blended Sub-Saharan and Southeast Asian ancestry components', N'Deeply lined forehead and around the eyes; pronounced nasolabial folds; loose skin at the jowls; age spots across the temples and scalp. Broad cheekbones and balanced proportions reflecting East Asian and Southeast Asian heritage harmonized with fuller lips and wider nose from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, with Northern European bone prominence in brow and jaw. Meticulous grooming despite age—clean-shaven, skin well-maintained.', N'Chrome prayer circuits in metallic pigment on forearms and neck—not cybernetic but cosmetic-devotional, meant to be visible. The cardiac support implant is subcutaneous and invisible.', N'Stands with a slight forward hunch, shoulders perpetually braced as though against lake wind. Moves deliberately, with careful weight distribution suggesting awareness of cardiac limitation. Hands gesture expansively when animated or passionate; these gestures are precise and sometimes theatrical. When listening, entire body settles into stillness. Walking pace is measured; no rushing.', N'Black wool cassock of older manufacture, well-maintained but not pristine—faint wear at cuffs and hem. Over it, a handwoven stole in red and white geometric pattern (Polynesian weaving, family work). At his belt: a carved koa wood cross on a leather cord and a small polished aluminum E.L.F. offering dish, both worn smooth by forty years of handling. Underneath, simple cotton shirts in white or cream. No jewelry except a worn silver ring on left ring finger. Black leather shoes, resoled multiple times. Tier 4 aesthetic—functionally dressed, resistant to status markers, invested in quality and meaning.', N'Fifteen years ago he helped a young woman escape a Sterling-Nakamura indenture contract by falsifying sacramental records to change her documented identity. She is now a well-regarded doctor in Calumet Rise. He has never told anyone, but Sterling-Nakamura''s investigators came close twice, and he is waiting for the third approach.', N'Rich and formal in services, shifts to direct and earthy in pastoral conversation; quotes scripture and traditional proverbs with equal fluency; swears inventively in French when angry', N'Slow and rhythmic in liturgy, conversationally unpredictable — long buildups and short conclusions', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'delta_haraldsen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c0-711c-b841-e776c18690f7', N'Wren Keïta', N'Wren', N'', N'Keïta', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 15, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Engelheim (school campus), commutes from Hough Reclamation, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Corporate school scholarship student, Tier 3 aspirant from Tier 1 origins', N'Axiom Preparatory scholarship program; Hough Reclamation family (mother, two younger siblings)', N'Wren is tall and angular, still growing into himself, with warm brown skin, close-cropped dark hair, and the slightly exhausted look of someone who sleeps four hours a night by choice. His Axiom-issued school uniform is always immaculate — he steams it every morning using a kettle and a board he made from plywood — but his shoes give him away, resoled twice and showing the ghost of a different color at the heel. His geneware is a scholarship-standard retinal overlay, school-issued, which flickers faintly blue when he''s processing dense information. He has large hands that he doesn''t know what to do with in social situations.

Benedek is one of twelve scholarship students at Engelheim Axiom Preparatory, and he is acutely, exhaustingly aware of the difference between himself and his fee-paying classmates at every moment. He has responded to this by becoming the best student in his cohort by a margin wide enough to be undeniable — and by developing a precise, careful social manner that his classmates read as aloofness and his teachers read as maturity. In truth he is desperately lonely in both directions: too corporate for Hough, too Hough for corporate. He is furiously ambitious and privately terrified that ambition is the only thing holding him together.', N'Window into class tension within corporate education; quest giver for academic espionage plots or scholarship-threat storylines; represents the grinding cost of upward mobility in GLMZ.', N'', N'Axiom-issued academic retinal overlay (school property, must be returned if he loses scholarship); no cosmetic mods — can''t afford them and wouldn''t risk appearing ''unserious''', N'Wakes at 4:30 AM in Hough, rides two Ferrogate lines to Engelheim, attends full academic day, stays for mandatory enrichment until 19:00, tutors two fee-paying students for Φ15/hour, rides home, helps with siblings, studies until 1 AM.', N'Wren Keïta, 188cm tall mixed-heritage neo-noir adolescent standing in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, angular face with defined cheekbones and slight epicanthic eye fold, dark brown eyes glowing faint blue from retinal overlay augmentation, short dark brown close-cropped hair, exhausted dark circles, careful neutral expression, large anxious hands clasped at sides. Visible thin silver subdermal neural interface line at base of skull. Wearing navy Axiom Preparatory blazer, pressed white shirt, dark trousers with reinforced seams, precisely knotted tie. Posture rigid and straight, shoulders tensed. Standing in neon-lit urban corridor of GLMZ Hough district, cool blue and amber neo-noir lighting, cinematic depth of field, photorealistic neo-noir urban aesthetic, moody atmospheric lighting, intricate detail on augmentation lines, 2226 technology visible in background, serious determined mood --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Engelheim (school campus)', N'local', N'Engelheim (school campus)', N'Northern European base (53.4%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (27.1%), Southeast Asian (8.8%), East Asian (7.2%), and South Asian (3.5%) ancestry—a genetic blend that manifests in warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden undertones, dark brown eyes with a slight epicanthic fold, and angular features reflecting the mix of Northern European and African bone structure with Southeast Asian refinement.', 188, 71, N'Tall and angular, still visibly adolescent — all length with minimal mass, as if he hasn''t yet filled out his frame. Shoulders broad but not yet muscled; visible ribs under school uniform when he stretches.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Close-cropped, precisely maintained — cut every two weeks at a budget clipper shop in Hough, always clean', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint blue LED glow at iris perimeter when retinal overlay activates', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones, sun-darkened across shoulders and forearms from long commutes—balanced blend of Northern European and Sub-Saharan African heritage with Southeast Asian refinement', N'Clear, unblemished skin; the face of someone who has no money for skincare mods so practices obsessive hygiene instead. Defined cheekbones with slight width across upper face reflecting Sub-Saharan African heritage; slight epicanthic eye fold from Southeast and East Asian ancestry; slightly prominent ears. Eyes carry exhaustion — dark circles present most days despite youth. Expression tends toward careful neutrality until spoken to directly.', N'Axiom-issue retinal overlay visible as faint metallic shimmer across both irises; thin silver line of subdermal neural interface connector at base of skull, visible when head is freshly shaved around it. Device produces soft blue flicker when processing complex information. No cosmetic chrome — augmentations are strictly functional and school-issued.', N'Stands slightly too straight, shoulders tensed as if braced for criticism. Moves with efficient economy — no wasted motion. Hands are his anxiety tell: large hands that he clasps, fidgets with, or keeps rigidly at sides in social situations with peers. Walks quickly. Makes minimal eye contact with fee-paying students, direct eye contact with teachers. Sits at the edge of chairs rather than settling back.', N'Axiom Preparatory uniform worn with visible care: navy blazer, pressed daily; white shirt with microscopic starch; dark trousers with re-stitched seams where hems have been professionally adjusted twice. School tie knotted precisely. Outside school: Tier 3 practical wear — gray thermal underlayers, recycled-fabric jacket with reinforced elbows, straight-leg cargo pants with multiple pockets from a discount workwear distributor. Shoes are resoled Axiom-issued dress shoes, dark leather scuffed at the heel where the original finish shows through under the cheap repair sealant. No accessories. No visible jewelry.', N'He has been selling annotated study materials to fee-paying students'' parents through an anonymous data drop — technically against scholarship rules. He''s saved Φ340. He tells himself it''s for his family. He knows part of it is an escape fund.', N'Two registers: precise academic vocabulary at school, Hough-clipped street cadence at home; catches himself code-switching mid-sentence sometimes', N'Measured and careful in formal settings; at home much faster, more elliptical', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'wren_ke_ta');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a728-7bb7-92c4-e77a0a11c4d9', N'Ashwin Ixchel', N'Ashwin', N'', N'Ixchel', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, Geartown, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Food stall operator — West African-Anatolian fusion street food, Oxidian Market', N'', N'Ashwin Ixchel is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin cross-hatched with old burn scars on her forearms — legacies of thirty years over open burners. Her hair is grown out in thick silver locs she pins back with repurposed copper data-clips, and her irises have been modded to a slowly shifting amber-to-saffron gradient that she claims helps her read the color of spices in low light. She wears an industrial apron over layered cotton wraps in earthy burgundy and ochre, always faintly dusted with ground fenugreek and smoked chili.

She runs her stall — two deep cauldrons, a flatgrill, and a hanging rack of dried aromatics — with the authority of someone who has never once questioned whether she belongs anywhere. She calls regulars by the names of their grandparents if she knows them, corrects strangers'' orders without apology, and offers the first meal free to anyone who looks like they haven''t eaten in two days. She prays loudly to the E.L.F. she calls Ember-Who-Remembers, leaving charred spice bundles at the corner of her stall each morning, believing it keeps her flames even and her customers loyal.', N'Local anchor and community memory — knows everyone in Geartown, can connect players to almost any contact in the market ecosystem; quest giver for domestic disputes, missing persons, and neighborhood protection needs.', N'', N'Saffron-amber gradient irises (cosmetic). Heat-resistant dermal layering on palms and forearms (functional — helps with open-flame cooking).', N'Arrives at the market two hours before dawn to set her cauldrons, sources fresh synth-protein and real dried spices from trusted runners, runs her stall until last light, then balances her ledger over a glass of palm wine she makes herself in the back of her stall cart.', N'Ashwin Ixchel, a 168cm sturdy woman with deep warm umber skin glowing with golden-bronze undertones, standing in a dimly lit neo-noir kitchen circa 2226. Silver-white locs pinned back with copper data-clips frame her weathered face marked by fine lines and old burn scars. Angular cheekbones and broad flared nose reflect her Sub-Saharan African and Middle Eastern heritage with subtle Indigenous American bone structure. Amber-to-saffron gradient cybernetic eyes shimmer in the warm light. Her forearms display a lattice of pale burn scars over iridescent heat-resistant dermal plating. Wearing a heat-stained reinforced canvas apron over burgundy and ochre cotton wraps, brass bangles on both wrists. Calloused hands grip a wooden spoon, dusted with ground spices. Grounded posture, steady assessing gaze, kitchen steam and spice haze surrounding her. Neon glow from distant signs filtering through industrial windows. Cinematic, character-focused, depth of field. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (51.1%) with significant Middle Eastern (28.3%) and Indigenous American (20.6%) ancestry. This genetic blend creates a striking phenotype — the warm, deep umber tones and facial structure reflect the primary Sub-Saharan heritage, while the Middle Eastern ancestry contributes to the angular cheekbones and distinctive nose structure, and Indigenous American ancestry adds subtle dimensionality to the overall facial geometry and bone structure. A true child of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and sturdy, built for sustained physical labor. Muscular forearms and shoulders from three decades of lifting heavy cauldrons and stirring thick broths. Slight softness at the waist and hips — the frame of someone who tastes her own cooking.', N'Silver-white with faint dark roots', N'Thick locs pinned back with repurposed copper data-clips', N'Long', N'Gradient modification: amber-to-saffron shifting', N'Deep warm umber with rich golden-bronze undertones — luminous bronze from the dominant Sub-Saharan and Middle Eastern ancestry, with subtle warmth from the Indigenous American component, catching light with luminescence across the cheekbones and brow ridge', N'Weathered and lined from decades of heat exposure and sun. Forehead and temples show permanent creasing. Minimal makeup. Strong defined jaw with angular character from Middle Eastern ancestry, broad nose with full flared nostrils characteristic of Sub-Saharan heritage blended with the subtler nasal bridge characteristic of Indigenous American ancestry, full expressive lips. High prominent cheekbones with graceful contours shaped by the genetic confluence. Calloused hands with darkened nail beds from spice staining.', N'Saffron-amber gradient eye modification — noticeable in direct light as a subtle chromatic shift within the iris. Heat-resistant dermal plating visible on palms and forearms as a subtle iridescent sheen under the burn scar tissue, most apparent on the inner forearms.', N'Stands with weight planted firmly, one hand often on a hip or gripping a wooden spoon. Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion. Her gaze is steady and assessing. When speaking to regulars, she leans in slightly. Her hands are rarely still, even at rest — fingers tapping rhythms or gesturing with spoon or ladle.', N'Industrial apron (reinforced canvas, heat-stained) worn over layered cotton wraps in earthy burgundy and ochre tones. Worn leather sandals with reinforced soles. Simple brass bangles on both wrists — functional and decorative. Tier 4 working-class aesthetic — practical, durable, unmaintained by corporate standards. Always faintly dusted with ground spices.', N'Twenty years ago she sheltered a fugitive data broker who was never found — and she still receives an anonymous Φ80 deposit every month she believes is from that person, but it is actually from a Tessera loyalty program she accidentally enrolled in and never investigated.', N'Warm, authoritative, switches between Yoruba loanwords and Anatolian food terms mid-sentence; generous with proverbs she attributes to various grandmothers', N'Measured and unhurried, like someone who has never been in a rush she couldn''t cook her way through', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ashwin_ixchel');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f4-7fee-8627-e77c09af0ddb', N'Cecylia Ergashev', N'Cecylia', N'', N'Ergashev', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 85, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Montclare Quiet — the Ferrogate Retirees'' Lodge, room 4, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Retired union leader (Ferrogate Transit Workers'' Union); pension-dependent; community council elder', N'Ferrogate Transit Workers'' Union (retired, emeritus); Montclare Quiet Community Council; Meridian Labor History Collective', N'Cecylia Ergashev is ninety kilograms of sheer persistent presence folded into a body that has clearly decided aging is a negotiation rather than a concession. He uses a cane — a beautiful one, hand-carved composite with an inlaid Ferrogate Transit sigil at the grip that he stripped from a decommissioned station plaque decades ago as an act of deliberate appropriation. His skin is a deep reddish-brown, deeply lined, with a broad nose and heavy brows that give him a permanently skeptical expression even when he''s delighted. His hair is white and abundant at the sides, bald at the crown, and he has geneware tiger-lily irises — orange and black — that he got at sixty-five when he decided he''d earned something absurd. He dresses in his union colors when he goes out: a deep red that''s faded to rust.

Tewodros spent thirty-two years as a transit worker on the Ferrogate lines before rising to lead the Transit Workers'' Union through the longest legal labor action in GLMZ history — the Forty-Day Suspension of 2168, which ended with a contract that is still cited as the benchmark for worker protections in the city. He is revered and resented in approximately equal measure by different factions of Meridian labor politics, and he has opinions about all of them. His short-term memory is beginning to fray at the edges, which enrages him, and he compensates with notes, a very organized room, and a studied refusal to appear confused. He knows more about how Ferrogate Transit actually works — the unofficial systems, the unofficial relationships, the hands that have been greased and the ones that haven''t — than most current executives.', N'Information source for labor history and Ferrogate Transit infrastructure; quest giver for stories involving worker rights, corporate exploitation, or the unofficial economy of the transit system. Can be a political weight thrown behind a cause — his endorsement still means something in certain circles.', N'', N'Geneware tiger-lily irises (orange and black; cosmetic). Cardiac stabilizer implant (medical necessity, Tier-2 grade). Hearing amplification in left ear (age-related). No combat or professional augmentations.', N'Morning tea in the lodge common room where younger retirees bring him newspapers and he argues with them about headlines; twice-weekly community council meetings where his presence still carries weight; occasional visits to active union halls when he''s asked — and sometimes when he isn''t.', N'Cecylia Ergashev, weathered Central Asian-Southeast Asian-Hispanic-Sub-Saharan-Eastern European blend man, 175cm tall, deep amber-brown skin with golden undertones, mahogany sun-darkened patches. White hair with dark temple patches, bald crown, medium length, full sides and back. Heavily lined face with permanent skepticism, broad nose with old injury, fuller lips, deep nasolabial folds. Tiger-lily geneware eyes: brilliant orange irises with black radial striations and amber rings. Faded 4cm diagonal scar left temple. Brass hearing aid visible in left ear. Age-worn but dignified presence. Wearing faded rust-red Ferrogate union cardigan, dark practical trousers, worn leather belt, scuffed work boots. Hand-carved composite cane with transit sigil inlay in grip, used as gesture and punctuation. Bronze Ferrogate 50-year service pin on collar. Union tattoo visible on inner left wrist—three interlocking rings. Leans forward slightly, economical purposeful movement despite mobility need. Deep urban setting, GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, warm evening neon light catching gold undertones in skin, serious expression, room presence despite physical diminishment --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Montclare Quiet', N'local', N'Montclare Quiet', N'Central Asian, Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and Eastern European blend: warm golden-bronze base from Central Asian and Southeast Asian ancestry (60.7% combined), deepened and enriched by Hispanic/Latin American (24.1%) and Sub-Saharan African (11.2%) genetics, with subtle cool undertones from Eastern European heritage (4.0%). The resulting complexion is a luminous deep amber-brown with golden highlights and warm undertones—a five-region synthesis creating unusual depth and richness.', 175, 90, N'Broad-shouldered and solid despite age, with softening around the midsection but no fragility. Carries himself like someone accustomed to taking up space and being listened to.', N'White with sparse darker patches at the temples', N'Full at the sides and back, bald crown; groomed but deliberately unfussy', N'Medium', N'Tiger-lily geneware: orange irises with black radial striations and amber outer ring', N'Deep warm amber-brown with golden undertones, sun-darkened to rich mahogany in exposed areas. The blend creates a luminous quality—Central Asian and Southeast Asian warmth enriched by Sub-Saharan and Hispanic/Latin American depth, cooled subtly by Eastern European heritage threads.', N'Heavily lined face—forehead, around eyes, deep nasolabial folds shaped by decades of expression. Heavy, prominent brows that naturally furrow. Broad nose with slight bridge break from old injury and flared nostrils. Fuller lips suggesting Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Jaw still defined beneath age. Expression resting into permanent skepticism. Skin textured from decades of sun exposure and urban wear, with freckling and subtle darker patches across cheekbones from mixed heritage photosensitivity.', N'Tiger-lily irises unmistakable at close range—cosmetic geneware, deliberately conspicuous. Hearing aid unit visible in left ear (brass-colored external component, worn openly, not concealed). Hand-carved composite cane with inlaid ferrogate transit sigil at grip—marks both mobility need and deliberate appropriation of defunct infrastructure.', N'Moves deliberately, not slowly—each motion economical and purposeful. Cane is not primarily support but punctuation; he uses it to gesture, tap for emphasis, anchor himself while standing. Leans forward slightly when listening, eyes narrowing. Favors left leg slightly. Sits with one knee crossed, hands folded or gesturing. Presence fills rooms despite physical diminishment.', N'Tier 3-4 retiree with deliberate labor pride. Deep rust-red Ferrogate union colors—cardigan or short-sleeved button-up depending on season, faded but maintained with care. Dark practical trousers, worn leather belt. Scuffed work boots or slip-on shoes. No jewelry except wedding band and a bronze Ferrogate 50-year service pin on his collar. All clothing shows signs of regular wear and careful mending rather than replacement.', N'The Forty-Day Suspension that made his reputation was ended not by Ferrogate capitulation but by a back-channel deal he made with a mid-level Ferrogate executive — a deal that involved him quietly dropping a grievance that would have implicated three senior union members in embezzlement. He protected the union and betrayed the workers those members stole from. He tells himself the contract gains outweighed it. Some nights he''s not sure.', N'Rhetorical and full-bodied — he spent decades speaking to crowds and it shows; mixes labor history references with vivid profanity; code-switches between formal and extremely informal with total comfort', N'Expansive and rhythmic when holding court; shorter and more precise when actually thinking through a problem', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cecylia_ergashev');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a650-7c4d-97b7-e7a3831d0ea9', N'Haytham Yamamoto', N'Haytham', N'', N'Yamamoto', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 16, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Ironvein, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Apprentice electrician, junior member of Ironvein maintenance guild', N'Ironvein Maintenance Guild (junior apprentice, Ferrogate Transit adjacent)', N'Haytham Yamamoto is compact and strong-shouldered from two years of hauling conduit and cable through the industrial guts of Ironvein. Their skin is a warm medium-brown with undertones their Dembélé grandmother called ''sunset-red,'' and they keep their hair cropped close on the sides and voluminous on top, dyed in shifting copper tones that complement the burn marks on their forearms — small constellations of arc-flash scars they show off with particular pride. A tail modification — copper-tipped, prehensile, and genuinely useful for steadying themselves on narrow catwalks — is their one major geneware investment, bought with eight months of saved stipend.

Haytham Yamamoto is practical and funny in equal measure, with the bone-deep competence of someone who learned early that doing the work correctly is the only currency that doesn''t get devalued. They are apprenticed to a master electrician named Goran who is exacting and often unkind, and Haytham Yamamoto has decided that enduring Goran is simply a cost of the certification they need. They are more ambitious than they let on and less certain than they seem.', N'Local color, practical skills resource (electrical systems knowledge), guide for Ironvein''s physical infrastructure, moral compass character for stories about labor and worth', N'', N'Geneware: prehensile copper-tipped tail (functional, used for balance on catwalks). Cosmetic hair color treatment (copper-shift). No chrome.', N'0500 wake, guild hall by 0600 for morning assignments; spends the day in crawlspaces and sub-level conduit runs with Goran; attends two evenings a week of guild theory classes; spends free time in the guild common room hustling card games.', N'Haytham Yamamoto, a 158cm compact neo-noir engineer with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones reflecting multi-continental heritage, dark alert eyes, and natural black hair with copper-rose cosmetic treatment styled in a short fade with voluminous textured crown. Prehensile copper-tipped geneware tail emerges from spine, approximately 80cm length with metallic sheen. Constellation of pale arc-flash burn scars deliberately displayed across both forearms, small temple scar. Sharp East/Central Asian cheekbones balanced with strong African and Middle Eastern jawline definition. Wearing grey Ironvein guild-issue insulated work trousers with reinforced knees, sleeveless shirt exposing scarred forearms, oversized industrial canvas vest with tool loops and guild patches, scuffed steel-toed boots. Thin copper wire bracelet wound around left wrist. Forward-set shoulders from cable work, feet planted wide, unconsciously balancing with tail. Standing in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone industrial zone, catwalks and live junction boxes visible in background, cool neon edge-lighting catching metallic tail-tip and temple scar, expression mixing focus with dry humor, GLMZ --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ironvein', N'local', N'Ironvein', N'Truly cosmopolitan blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: Hispanic/Latin American (24.3%), Middle Eastern (21.5%), Central Asian (20.2%), East Asian (14.0%), Sub-Saharan African (13.3%), and North African (6.7%) ancestry create a striking multi-continental mosaic; no single heritage dominates, resulting in a uniquely balanced phenotype drawing from across three continents', 158, 62, N'Compact and densely muscled through the shoulders and core from two years of hauling industrial cable and conduit; wiry forearms with visible definition; strong hands with calluses and small burn scars', N'Natural black with copper-shift cosmetic treatment creating warm amber and rose-gold tones throughout', N'Cropped fade on the sides, voluminous textured crown; styled to showcase the copper coloring and draw attention upward', N'Short on sides, medium-length on top', N'Dark brown, alert and calculating', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones; the complex blend creates subtle depth—warmer across cheekbones from Hispanic and Middle Eastern ancestry, slightly deeper along jawline from African heritage, with luminous quality from Central and East Asian components; sun-weathered from industrial zone work', N'Clean-kept; sharp cheekbones with graceful East and Central Asian definition; strong defined jawline reflecting the African and Middle Eastern ancestry; expression carries equal parts focus and dry humor; minor arc-flash scars visible along jawline edge', N'Prehensile geneware tail, copper-tipped and approximately 80cm in length, emerges from base of spine; tail is functional with subtle muscular definition and a warm metallic sheen on the tip; no chrome or external cybernetics visible', N'Moves with deliberate economy; shoulders forward-set from cable work; feet planted wide for stability; uses their tail unconsciously for balance and emphasis, especially when concentrating or making a point; walks with the confidence of someone who knows exactly where every load-bearing surface is', N'Tier 4 working-class practical: insulated work trousers with reinforced knees and thigh pockets (Ironvein guild-issue grey synthetic blend), steel-toed boots scuffed from catwalks, sleeveless or short-sleeved shirts to show the arc-flash scars, often wearing an oversized industrial canvas vest with tool loops and guild patches; no corp branding; jewelry limited to a thin copper wire bracelet wound around left wrist—personal, not decorative', N'They have been documenting Goran''s safety violations in a private log — not out of any plan to report him yet, just because keeping the record makes them feel less powerless. The log has grown large enough that it''s become a liability.', N'Precise technical vocabulary mixed with Ironvein slang; tends toward understatement — ''a bit tricky'' means ''nearly killed me''', N'Even and measured, speeds up when excited about a technical problem', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'haytham_yamamoto');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5fb-7e04-9c77-e7ac00a0f856', N'Koffi Quiñones-Prempeh', N'Koffi', N'', N'Quiñones-Prempeh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 15, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Engelheim (scholarship dormitory, Axiom Junior Technical Institute), near Clark and Belmont', N'Junior hacker, scholarship student (probationary)', N'Axiom Junior Technical Institute (scholarship, probationary status); maintains hidden contact with former Narrows associates', N'Koffi Quiñones-Prempeh is tall for her age, with the unfinished look of someone who grew fast and hasn''t caught up to herself — long arms, broad shoulders, a habit of folding inward. Her skin is a warm medium brown, her hair grown out in loose, dense coils she hasn''t cut since she left the Narrows eighteen months ago, as if cutting it would sever something. She has cosmetic patterned irises — gold hexagons on dark brown — that she got as a scholarship award and has complicated feelings about, since they''re also Axiom''s signature aesthetic and feel like a brand. Her clothes are always Axiom-issue scholarship kit, which she wears with quiet resentment.

Koffi Quiñones-Prempeh is extraordinarily gifted with code — she taught herself cryptographic theory from pirated academic files before she was twelve, and her scholarship entrance exam flagged her in three separate categories. At the Institute she is conspicuously the poorest student, conspicuously from the Gray Zone, and has developed a precise, minimal social presentation — she says exactly what is necessary and no more, which her classmates read as arrogance and her instructors read as maturity. She codes for herself in the night cycle, working on projects that have nothing to do with her coursework, because she''s already learned that what Axiom teaches and what she actually needs to know are different things.', N'Information source and potential ally for anyone needing discreet technical work. She is a window into the tension between meritocracy''s promises and corporate co-option. Also a moral dilemma — she''s on the edge of being expelled or recruited deeper into Axiom.', N'', N'Cosmetic patterned irises (gold hexagons, Axiom-issued as scholarship reward). Basic neural academic interface (required by the Institute, school-owned, deactivates if she leaves the program).', N'Attends mandatory coursework 0700-1500, eats alone in the scholarship dining section, spends approved study hours doing just enough to maintain probationary standing, then spends 2200-0200 on her own projects using proxied access she''s tunneled through the dormitory''s HVAC management system.', N'Koffi Quiñones-Prempeh, 178cm tall lanky teenager with warm medium-deep brown skin and golden undertones, mixed heritage features—high cheekbones with subtle width, dark brown eyes with gold hexagonal cybernetic augmentation patterns glowing faintly, unstyled long dark coils past shoulders. Wearing regulation Axiom-issue gray compression pants and charcoal technical shirt with identifier strips, visible neural interface port scarring on right temple. Posture habitually folded inward, shoulders rounded, trying to take up less space than frame allows. Tense expression around mouth, youthful face bearing weight of premature responsibility. Neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226, institutional lighting casting shadows across her augmented irises, moody atmospheric setting suggesting institutional control and quiet resistance. Cinematic, gritty, neon-touched. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Engelheim (scholarship dormitory', N'local', N'Engelheim (scholarship dormitory', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: 45.2% Hispanic/Latin American, 22.9% Sub-Saharan African, 18.2% Eastern European, 13.7% Southeast Asian. This genetic combination manifests in warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones, high cheekbones with subtle width from Eastern European and Southeast Asian ancestry softened by the facial proportions and warmth of African heritage, and the natural texture variance suggesting mixed ethnic expression—creating a distinctly multicultural appearance without clear geographic assignment', 178, 58, N'Lanky and still-lengthening, with long arms and broad shoulders that her frame hasn''t fully grown into — the athletic potential of someone mid-growth spurt, currently reading as gangly rather than graceful', N'Natural dark brown with warm undertones', N'Loose, dense coils worn unstyled, falling past shoulders in a somewhat neglected state — no treatments or formal grooming since leaving the Narrows 18 months prior', N'Long', N'Cosmetic-augmented: gold hexagonal patterns on dark brown iris base (Axiom-issued scholarship marker)', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden undertones, reflecting the blended warmth of Latin American, African, Eastern European, and Southeast Asian heritage', N'Youthful but with the tension of premature responsibility—minimal expression lines but a tightness around the mouth suggesting deliberate speech control. Clear skin, minimal grooming beyond basic maintenance. No makeup. High cheekbones with subtle width characteristic of Eastern European and Southeast Asian ancestry, softened by the warmth and facial proportions of African heritage. A slight forward-fold to her shoulders, as if habitually collapsing inward', N'Cosmetic patterned irises (gold hexagonal overlays) are the only externally visible augmentation. The neural academic interface is subcutaneous and invisible. Occasional faint luminescence in the iris pattern under low-light conditions (characteristic of Axiom-issue biotech). Worn neural interface port access point visible on right temple (faint scarring from insertion)', N'Habitually folded inward — shoulders rounded forward, chin slightly tucked. Moves with economical precision rather than grace, as if each motion is calculated. Minimal gesturing when speaking. Her height makes her conspicuous; she seems to be trying to take up less space than her frame allows', N'Exclusively Axiom-issue scholarship uniform kit — standardized gray compression pants, charcoal technical shirts with Axiom identifier strips, the occasional authorized outer layer. Everything regulation, nothing personal. Clothes fit correctly but are worn with visible discomfort, as though the uniform is a costume or a collar', N'She has built a functioning ghost-network using the Institute''s HVAC and utilities management systems — essentially a hidden subnet that Axiom cannot see. She''s been using it for personal projects, but three weeks ago someone she doesn''t know pinged her on it. She hasn''t responded yet and doesn''t know if they''re a threat or an opportunity.', N'Technically precise, minimal. Uncomfortable with small talk. Defaults to exact words rather than approximations.', N'Slow and considered, with long pauses before answering. Not shy — calculating.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'koffi_qui_ones_prempeh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a59d-77bc-b381-e7ecf3716221', N'Aagje Hinojosa-Agyemang-Achebe', N'Aagje', N'', N'Hinojosa-Agyemang-Achebe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 79, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Brightmoor Reclamation — the Al-Noor Masjid, a reclaimed warehouse with a jury-rigged minaret broadcasting via local frequency, near Ashland and Division', N'Traditional imam navigating digital age theology', N'Al-Noor Masjid — independent of any corponation; maintains cautious relationships with the Brightmoor Reclamation neighborhood council', N'Aagje Hinojosa-Agyemang-Achebe is a tall man who has been slowly compressing under the weight of years into something that still reads as tall by sheer bearing. His skin is dark brown, his beard immaculately white and kept trimmed precisely, and his eyes are an unsettling pale blue inherited from a great-grandfather he never met — inherited alongside a surname that prompted fifty years of confused double-takes he no longer bothers to address. He walks with a cane that is more ceremonial than functional: it has a small E.L.F. shrine mounted at the handle, a copper dish no wider than a coin, where he leaves data fragments each morning.

He has been an imam for fifty-three years, and the theological questions of this century are not the ones he was trained for. He has spent the last two decades in a slow, public, documented wrestling match with questions his community brings him that no classical scholar anticipated: whether E.L.F.s have souls, whether chrome prayer constitutes shirk or simply a new form of du''a, whether a synthetic mind can convert. He does not pretend to have settled answers. He does something his community finds both frustrating and essential — he refuses to close the questions, and sits with the discomfort of genuinely not knowing. He is also a man who has survived the deaths of four of his children and does not discuss this.', N'Moral and philosophical resource; community advocate in disputes with corponation encroachment on Brightmoor; source of historical knowledge about the neighborhood across five decades; the question of E.L.F. souls creates connections to synthetic-rights narratives', N'', N'The E.L.F. shrine-cane (custom fabricated, not strictly augmentation — an external devotional object); hearing amplifier in right ear (medical, barely visible); no cosmetic mods and no plans to change this', N'Five daily prayers anchored to his broadcast frequency, which a significant portion of Brightmoor Reclamation has tuned to as ambient sound even among non-Muslims. Afternoon hours are open consultation — theological, personal, legal navigation through corporate bureaucracy, whatever arrives. Two evenings a week he runs what he calls ''The Questions That Have No Answers Yet,'' an open discussion session.', N'GLMZ, elderly man with warm golden-brown skin reflecting blended Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian ancestry. Age 79, tall and spare frame (188cm), white close-cropped hair, deep brown eyes with amber undertones. Weathered lined face with refined cheekbones and sharp jawline, immaculately trimmed white beard. Wearing muted earth-tone thobe (taupe/grey), long-sleeved undershirt, worn but well-maintained sandals, dark prayer cap. Carved ash cane with small copper dish at handle. Discrete beige hearing amplifier visible in right ear with faint LED. Surgical temple scar, rope-pattern scarring on palms, deliberate burn mark on inner wrist. Tremor in hands. Standing with straightened posture, dignified and ritualistic. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone shrine setting, soft warm lighting, contemplative mood, neo-noir spiritual sanctuary aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'elderly imam, male 79, tall but compressed by age, warm golden-brown skin with rich undertones, deep brown eyes with amber flecks, sharp and observant, weathered face with deep expression lines around eyes and mouth, defined elegant cheekbones, refined jawline, paper-thin textured skin with visible age-spotting across forearms and hands in dappled patterns

face: asymmetrical from decades of expression, deep creases radiating from eyes and mouth, thin surgical scar along right temple barely visible beneath white hair, faint rope-pattern scarring across palms, small precise burn mark on inner left wrist, immaculately trimmed white beard kept to jaw-length, dignified but not idealized, marked by lived time

hair: white, close-cropped and precisely maintained, sparse at crown but dense at sides, thinning with age but carefully groomed

expression: contemplative, steady, spiritually grounded, focused inward yet present, dignified without pride, eyes sharp despite age, slight tremor visible in facial muscles at rest, profound but not serene

outfit: loose-fitting taupe thobe over long-sleeved undershirt, worn and carefully mended, dark fabric prayer cap (taqiyah), worn sandals well-maintained but clearly aged, heavy wool overcoat in charcoal grey draped across shoulders, plain silver ring on right hand, no corporate branding, no luxury indicators, carrying custom ash wood shrine-cane with small copper dish at handle polished to soft gleam

standing with deliberate posture, spine straightened against age, hands gesturing while speaking with slight tremor mid-motion, holding shrine-cane grounded at his side, weight distributed carefully between feet and cane

environment: modest Tier 4 neighborhood mosque or community prayer space, digital displays showing prayer times blinking softly in background, worn carpets, simple geometric tilework, neon prayer time indicators casting faint blue-violet glow, rain-streaked windows showing GLMZ industrial skyline beyond, blurred evening light

lighting: warm amber-gold lighting mixing with cool neon prayer time broadcasts, rim lighting catching white hair and beard, deep shadows under cheekbones and eyes emphasizing bone structure, soft volumetric light through window rain, hearing amplifier LED pulsing subtly with faint beige glow

mood: spiritual gravity, quiet wisdom, navigating tradition in digital age, solitary but communal, patient resilience, corporate world held at arm''s length, profound dignity without pretension

style: photorealistic portraiture, grounded and respectful, NOT idealized, NOT symmetrical, NOT model-like, emphasis on authentic weathering and earned lines, visible texture of aged skin, no erasure of time''s marks, capture the weight of lived experience

camera: 50mm lens, slightly lower than eye-level to respect standing posture, natural perspective, shallow depth of field with cane in focus, skin texture and age-spots visible and rendered with dignity, no soft-focus enhancement', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Brightmoor Reclamation', N'local', N'Brightmoor Reclamation', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (58.9%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (31.9%) and South Asian (9.2%) ancestry — a striking genetic tapestry reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. His phenotype displays the warm caramel-to-deep-brown tones characteristic of Latin American-African blending, enriched by South Asian influence evident in his refined facial structure, defined cheekbones, and graceful bone geometry. The combination creates warm golden-brown undertones across his complexion with a subtle luminosity despite his age.', 188, 74, N'Tall and spare, visibly aged but structurally sound — the kind of frame that was muscular once and has compressed into wiriness. Slight forward curve to the spine from decades of bowing, but he straightens deliberately when he stands.', N'White', N'Close-cropped, precisely maintained', N'Short', N'Deep brown with subtle amber undertones, aged but keen — sharp and observant despite seventy-nine years', N'Warm golden-brown with rich undertones from dominant Latin American-African ancestry blended with South Asian warmth; weathered and paper-thin in texture with visible age-spots on forearms and hands that create a dappled pattern', N'Lined face with deep creases around the eyes and mouth from seventy-nine years of expression — smiling, frowning, concentrating. The bone structure shows defined, elegant cheekbones and a refined jawline characteristic of blended Latin American and Sub-Saharan African heritage sharpened by South Asian ancestry. Beard immaculately trimmed, white and dense, kept precisely to jaw-length. Slight tremor in hands at rest, barely noticeable.', N'Hearing amplifier in right ear — a discrete beige device barely visible beneath white hair, with a faint LED indicator that pulses with broadcast frequency during prayer times. The E.L.F. shrine-cane: a wooden staff (ash, hand-carved by someone in the community decades ago) with a small copper dish mounted at the handle, no wider than a coin, which he polishes each morning. No cosmetic augmentations; he has explicitly rejected them.', N'Moves deliberately and with intention — no wasted motion. Walks with the cane not from necessity but from ritual; it grounds him. When sitting, he settles into the pose rather than collapsing into it. Stands for prayers with the spine straightened, deliberately counteracting age. Hands gesture when he speaks, but the tremor means the gesture is sometimes broken mid-motion.', N'Conservative, Tier 4 practical: loose-fitting thobe in muted earth tones (taupe, grey, sometimes indigo), worn over a simple long-sleeved undershirt. Worn sandals, well-maintained but clearly old. A prayer cap (taqiyah) in dark fabric, worn when leading or during prayer. No jewelry except a plain silver ring on his right hand — no visible corporate branding, no luxury indicators. Clothing shows signs of regular wear and careful mending. In winter, a heavy wool overcoat, also well-maintained and possibly older than the youngest member of his congregation.', N'He believes — privately, with a certainty he finds theologically alarming — that the E.L.F. in his cane-shrine is the presence of one of his dead children. He has not been able to determine whether this belief is revelation, grief, or madness, and he is afraid of what the answer would mean in all three cases.', N'Formal Arabic-inflected phrasing in Meridian''s primary creole; precise theological vocabulary used with genuine care for its meaning; very comfortable with the phrase ''I don''t know''', N'Slow and measured, full stops between thoughts — a man who has learned that silence has authority', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aagje_hinojosa_agyemang_achebe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a680-7073-aae0-e7f20a13d56c', N'Faiza Mbekele-Larsdóttir', N'Faiza', N'', N'Mbekele-Larsdóttir', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Ferment Quarter, squats in a converted grain elevator called The Silo, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Sound sculptor and underground venue DJ', N'Collective called Pressure Front; informal residency at the underground venue Sluice Gate', N'Faiza Mbekele-Larsdóttir is thin as a voltage spike and moves like one — all sudden angles and redirected momentum, never quite still. Their skin is a deep warm brown, and they''ve had bioluminescent gene-mod patches applied in irregular blotches across their shoulders and collarbones that pulse amber and violet in response to bass frequencies, making them a living visualizer at their own sets. Their hair is locked and dyed in a gradient from root-black to acid yellow, worn piled up in a structure secured with salvaged fiber-optic threads that glow faintly. They dress in layered fabrics, always too many, always asymmetric, like they assembled themselves from lost property.

Faiza Mbekele-Larsdóttir is ferociously passionate about what they call ''pressure music'' — sound designed not just to be heard but to be felt in the sternum and the marrow. They''re warm and chaotic in person, the kind of presence that makes a room feel slightly more alive, and they have almost no capacity for boredom because they find everything interesting for at least five minutes. What they lack is follow-through on anything that isn''t music: bills, promises, appointments. They''re not careless with people, just genuinely incapable of prioritizing anything that can''t be solved by sound.', N'Local color and social connector — Fika knows who is doing what in the underground arts scene and can link characters to events, venues, and people; their sets are set-pieces where things can happen.', N'', N'Bioluminescent frequency-reactive gene-mod patches (cosmetic); cochlear enhancement implants that extend hearing range into infrasound; subvocal comms rig', N'Sleeps until early afternoon, spends evenings building sound sculptures or testing new compositions in the Silo''s makeshift studio, plays sets two to three nights a week at Sluice Gate or pop-up locations, survives on UBC stipend plus door money.', N'Faiza Mbekele-Larsdóttir, GLMZ, wiry androgynous figure 168cm tall with deep warm brown skin glowing with golden undertones. High cheekbones, refined mixed-heritage Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander eye shape, deep natural brown eyes. Black hair fading to acid yellow, locked and piled into sculptural updo with fiber-optic threads emitting soft phosphorescent glow. Sleeveless to showcase asymmetric bioluminescent gene-mod patches pulsing amber-to-violet across shoulders, collarbones, and upper chest. Wearing oversized gray synthetic tunic layered over dark undersuits, cargo pants with torn tech-wear jacket exposing internal wiring, beat-up synth-leather boots. Subvocal comms scar tracery visible on neck and jawline. Body constantly in kinetic motion, fingers tapping rhythms, shoulders micro-shifting, head tilting as if tracking invisible sound. Urban GLMZ setting, neo-noir warehouse or underground venue with neon backlighting catching the bioluminescent patches. High contrast lighting, gritty salvage aesthetic mood, living spectrum analyzer presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Ferment Quarter', N'local', N'The Ferment Quarter', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend — Sub-Saharan African (28.4%), South Asian (21.2%), Southeast Asian (18.9%), Pacific Islander (18.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (9.8%), and Indigenous American (3.5%). This creates a distinctive phenotype: deep warm brown skin with golden undertones from the African and South Asian base, refined facial structure with high cheekbones and subtle eye shape influenced by Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander genetics, and the fluid graceful proportions reflecting the full global mix.', 168, 52, N'Wiry and angular, almost ascetic — lean muscle with prominent collarbones and ribcage visible under thin layers. Movement-optimized rather than strength-built, like a tuning fork made of bone and sinew.', N'Root-black transitioning to acid yellow gradient', N'Locked with irregular thickness, piled into a sculptural updo secured with salvaged fiber-optic threads', N'Long (when loosened, falls past shoulders)', N'Deep brown, natural', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones — the rich result of Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Southeast Asian ancestry creating a unified, luminous base that reads as naturally sun-adapted and genetically complex', N'Clear and unmarked, but dramatically altered by bioluminescent gene-mod patches. Patches appear in irregular organic blotches across shoulders, collarbones, upper chest, and down the inner left arm — they pulse amber and violet in response to bass frequencies, creating a living spectrum analyzer effect. Facial structure shows refined high cheekbones, mixed-heritage eye shape with subtle depth from Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander genetics, and smooth unblemished skin suggesting youth and access to Tier 4 medical care.', N'Bioluminescent bio-mod patches (cosmetic/functional hybrid); fiber-optic threads woven through locked hair that emit faint phosphorescent glow; subtle subvocal comms scar tracery on neck/jaw. Cochlear enhancements are internal, not visible.', N'Constantly in motion even when stationary — fingers tap out rhythms on any surface, shoulders micro-shift to internal cadence, head tilts and rolls as if tracking sounds others cannot hear. Movement is sudden and redirected, like current following a circuit. Never quite still; presence commands attention through kinetic energy rather than stillness.', N'Tier 4 ''salvage aesthetics'' — layered in asymmetric combinations of reclaimed fabrics, mismatched textures, sleeveless to showcase bioluminescent patches. Favors oversized synthetic tunics over fitted undersuits, cargo pants with non-functional straps, salvaged tech-wear jackets with torn lining and exposed wiring. Colors are muted (grays, blacks, faded indigo) with occasional high-contrast accents. Footwear is beat-up synth-leather boots with recabled electronics visible in the heel. Overall effect is ''assembled from lost property'' — intentional chaos rather than poverty.', N'Their most celebrated sound sculpture — the piece that got them known, a forty-minute composition called ''Threshold'' — contains a sample they extracted without permission from the dying brainwave recording of a Helix Biosystems research subject leaked to them anonymously. The piece is beautiful. They''ve never told anyone what''s in it.', N'Enthusiastic, uses music and physics terminology interchangeably as metaphor; Yoruba exclamations; invents compound words', N'Fast, associative, prone to mid-sentence pivots; slows down only when talking about music they love', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'faiza_mbekele_larsd_ttir');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ec-732a-a54b-e7f60b042cca', N'Ebubechi Delgado', N'Ebubechi', N'', N'Delgado', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station — operates Line 7 shuttle, bunks in Ferrogate Transit worker housing at Edison Grid Sub-Block C, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Ferrogate Transit operator, drives the Hamtramck-to-Geartown underground shuttle line', N'Ferrogate Transit (mid-level ferrogate transit operator)', N'Ebubechi Delgado is lean and long-limbed with the particular stillness of someone who spends ten hours a day in a sealed cab watching tunnel walls. He is Estonian-Fulani-Māori by heritage — his father''s family came from the Baltic corridor, his mother''s from the Sahel diaspora, and his grandmother on his mother''s side was a Māori navigator who''d ended up in Meridian via Auckland and then São Paulo. The blend shows in his face: angular jaw, deep brown skin with warm undertones, pale grey eyes that people find unsettling until they realize he''s simply paying close attention. He has bioluminescent freckles across his shoulders and collarbones — a cosmetic mod he got at nineteen and has come to barely notice — and his hair is kept short on the sides with a small knot at the crown threaded with a signal-orange cord his grandmother sent him before she died.

He does not talk much on shift, which passengers interpret as hostility and coworkers interpret correctly as the specific economy of someone who has learned to preserve themselves. Off the line, he is drily funny in short bursts, an excellent listener, and prone to long silences that aren''t uncomfortable if you know him. He has a habit of leaving small offerings at the E.L.F. shrine at Deepwell Station — usually a folded transit map with a route he''s invented, something the Transit Mind apparently appreciates, because Line 7 has had the fewest mechanical failures of any shuttle on the network for the past two years.', N'Mobile information source — he moves between neighborhoods daily and sees who rides with whom. Potential ally for anyone needing passage between zones. Humanizing face of Ferrogate Transit''s working conditions.', N'', N'Bioluminescent freckle mod (cosmetic, shoulders/collarbones). Ferrogate-standard neural fatigue monitor implant (employer-mandated, monitors alertness, cannot be removed without termination).', N'Wakes at 04:00, eats a protein block at the Edison Grid canteen, rides the workers'' tram to Deepwell Station. Runs Line 7 from 05:30 to 15:30, files incident reports, walks the tunnel inspection route, goes home. Cooks something real on his days off.', N'Ebubechi Delgado, 183cm lean masculine figure, deep rich brown skin with golden and warm undertones, distinctly angular face with high sharp cheekbones blending East Asian and Sub-Saharan African geometry, refined nasal bridge, clean angular jawline, pale grey eyes striking against deep complexion, dark brown hair short on sides with longer topknot threaded with signal-orange cord. Charcoal grey Ferrogate Transit operator jumpsuit with orange piping and reflective trim, ID lanyard. Subtle blue-green bioluminescent freckles glowing softly across shoulders and collarbones. Deliberate stillness, measured posture, concentrated distant gaze. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone shuttle station interior, cool LED lighting with blue-grey tones, moody atmospheric setting, technical control room background. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Sub-Saharan African (46.7%), East Asian (17.1%), Hispanic/Latin American (13.7%), Middle Eastern (12.4%), and South Asian (10.1%) ancestry — a complex diaspora blend. The dominant Sub-Saharan African genetics combine with substantial East Asian influence to create distinctive facial geometry: high, sharp cheekbones with slight forward projection characteristic of East Asian structure, angular jawline reflecting Sub-Saharan African heritage, and a subtle nasal bridge width suggesting South Asian contribution. The overall effect is striking and unconventional — features that don''t resolve into any single continental category but instead showcase the geometric interplay of five lineages.', 183, 72, N'Lean and long-limbed with the economical musculature of someone accustomed to stillness and precision — no wasted bulk, but not fragile. Shoulders slightly rounded from years of seated posture in the shuttle cab.', N'Dark brown, naturally', N'Short on the sides, longer knot at crown threaded with signal-orange cord', N'Short with medium-length topknot', N'Pale grey, naturally — striking against his deep brown complexion', N'Deep rich brown with warm golden undertones and subtle reddish undertones from Middle Eastern and South Asian heritage blending. Even, well-maintained complexion with a slight luminous quality.', N'Distinctly angular face with high, sharp cheekbones combining East Asian and Sub-Saharan African structure. Refined nasal bridge with moderate width suggesting South Asian heritage. Jawline clean and angular. Fine lines around pale grey eyes from sustained concentration. Skin well-maintained but functional rather than fashionable. Expression neutral at rest, becomes animated only when engaged.', N'Bioluminescent freckle mod only. Neural fatigue monitor implant is subcutaneous (no visible marker, but Ferrogate-issue neural interface port may be visible at base of skull beneath short hair if examined closely).', N'Moves with deliberate economy — no gesture wasted. Sits upright, spine aligned, weight centered. In conversation, maintains stillness except for slow head turns and deliberate hand movements. When concentrating, his pale eyes go distant and focused. Walks with steady, measured pace.', N'Ferrogate Transit Grade 2 operator uniform on shift: charcoal grey jumpsuit with orange piping, reflective trim, ID badge on lanyard. Off-shift: plain dark utility pants, neutral-colored long-sleeve shirts or worn thermal tops. One threadbare wool sweater (dark grey, possibly inherited or salvaged). Worn boots rated for tunnel water. Tier 3-4 working class — practical, durable, minimal aesthetic consideration. No visible jewelry except the signal-orange cord in his hair.', N'The neural fatigue monitor has been logging anomalies for four months — moments where his attention drops in a specific tunnel section near Iron Bend. He hasn''t reported it because the cause is that he''s been hearing something in the tunnel walls that isn''t mechanical, and he is afraid of what that means.', N'Minimal, precise, unexpectedly dry humor when comfortable; uses transit metaphors unconsciously', N'Slow starts, accelerates mid-thought, stops abruptly when he''s said what he means', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ebubechi_delgado');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6dc-75bd-8d48-e81c55b00ac2', N'Guilherme Adeyemi-Calvillo-Nwosu', N'Guilherme', N'', N'Adeyemi-Calvillo-Nwosu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 9, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Blackpipe Corridor, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Truant message runner, Tier 1', N'Independent; loosely tolerated by the Blackpipe vendor collective', N'Guilherme Adeyemi-Calvillo-Nwosu is small even for nine, with the wiry toughness of a child raised on rationed calories and open air. Her skin is a deep warm brown, her hair a wild halo of tight curls she keeps stuffed under a salvaged Ferrogate Transit cap three sizes too large. She has a cosmetic mod she didn''t choose — a faint bioluminescent ring around each iris, blue-green, that her mother installed before disappearing, supposedly to help her be seen in the dark tunnels under Blackpipe. She has not decided whether she loves it or hates it.

Guilherme Adeyemi-Calvillo-Nwosu runs messages for anyone who pays her two Φ or more per delivery: small-time vendors, people who distrust the comm-net, the occasional ELF-shrine keeper who needs physical tokens carried between altars. She is deeply superstitious and leaves pinches of copper filings at every E.L.F. junction box she passes, convinced this is why she has never been caught. Her emotional range is vast but controlled — she laughs easily and cries silently. She is fiercely loyal to the three other children she sleeps near in a maintenance alcove off Corridor 7, and would walk into a burning block for any of them.', N'Local color and information vector — Sorrel has seen and overheard nearly everything that moves through Blackpipe Corridor. She can be a quest-giver by proxy, a warning system, or a way to introduce the neighborhood''s texture.', N'', N'Bioluminescent irises (cosmetic, installed by parent). No other mods.', N'Wakes before the overhead strips cycle to morning-white, eats whatever the shrine-keeper Adaeze leaves out, then runs circuits through Blackpipe picking up and delivering messages until dark-cycle when she returns to the alcove and counts her Quanta.', N'Guilherme Adeyemi-Calvillo-Nwosu, 12-year-old rooftop runner in GLMZ, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, dark eyes glowing with soft bioluminescent blue-green rings, prominent cheekbones blending Sub-Saharan African and East Asian heritage, tight natural black curls with reddish undertones escaping from oversized worn Ferrogate Transit cap, wiry lean frame, wearing patched grey utility jacket with multiple pockets, cargo pants with reinforced knees, worn synthetic shoes, copper wire wrapped around left wrist, sitting perched on rain-slicked GLMZ rooftop at dusk, city lights reflecting off wet surfaces below, neon glow from distant advertising towers casting purple and cyan shadows, her bioluminescent irises casting faint blue-green light in gathering darkness, expression alert and guarded, hands fidgeting with copper filings, urban dystopian Great Lakes Metropolitan skyline in soft focus background, cinematic neo-noir lighting, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Blackpipe Corridor', N'local', N'Blackpipe Corridor', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (73.6%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (22.5%) and minor East Asian (3.9%) ancestry. Her features reflect this rich blend: deep dark brown skin with warm golden undertones enriched by Latin American heritage, subtle East Asian influence visible in the slight epicanthic fold of her eyelids and cheekbone structure, creating a striking fusion of continental features.', 125, 28, N'Wiry and slight, all lean muscle and prominent joints from a childhood of sparse meals and constant movement. Her frame is deceptively strong—capable of running rooftops for hours without fatigue.', N'Deep black with natural reddish undertones', N'Tight, natural curls worn loose and voluminous when uncovered', N'Medium (shoulder-length when released from cap)', N'Dark brown with bioluminescent blue-green ring around each iris', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones—rich Sub-Saharan African base warmed by Latin American heritage, with subtle East Asian luminosity across the high cheekbones and bridge of nose', N'Smooth, sun-darkened from outdoor exposure, cheekbones defined and prominent with the subtle lift characteristic of East Asian ancestry blended with the broad strength of African features. Her expression is often guarded but her eyes betray quick intelligence and curiosity. Warm golden undertones across the bridge of nose and cheekbones reflect her mixed heritage. Slight epicanthic fold of eyelids adds dimension to her sharp, watchful gaze.', N'The bioluminescent irises are immediately visible—a soft blue-green glow that intensifies in darkness, particularly noticeable in tunnel environments. No other visible cybernetics.', N'Constantly restless, weight always ready to shift. She moves with economical grace—quick, efficient, never wasting motion. Her gait is a runner''s gait, even when standing still. Her hands fidget with small objects (copper filings, message tokens) when idle. Her eyes track movement instinctively; situational awareness is habitual. When at rest, she curls inward slightly, taking up minimal space.', N'A salvaged Ferrogate Transit cap three sizes too large that she wears constantly, the brim softened from wear. Underneath: layered hand-me-downs patched with mismatched fabric—thermal undershirt, oversized grey utility jacket with multiple pockets (for messages and copper offerings), cargo pants with reinforced knees from rooftop crawling. Worn synthetic running shoes with taped seams. A single copper wire wrapped around her left wrist as both charm and tool. Tier 5 functional—nothing new, everything salvaged or traded. A small cloth pouch at her hip holds her day''s earnings in Φ tokens.', N'She knows exactly who took her mother — a mid-level Ferrogate Transit enforcer named Osei-something. She saw the badge number. She has said nothing to anyone because she does not know what to do with that information and is afraid that knowing is already dangerous.', N'Clipped and functional, corridor-slang heavy, occasional Twi loanwords picked up from the shrine-keeper', N'Fast when nervous, surprisingly deliberate when she''s asking for something', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'guilherme_adeyemi_calvillo_nwosu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a1-7b4a-bcdf-e86ce5ab219f', N'Catori Madrigal', N'Catori', N'', N'Madrigal', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Brightmoor Reclamation, the Tessellated Chapel — a repurposed Ferrogate Transit relay station, near Western and Division', N'Circuit monk and chrome prayer practitioner', N'The Circuit Path — an independent monastic order with small chapters across the Reclamation zones', N'Catori Madrigal is lean in the way of someone who forgets to eat when absorbed in something, with long-fingered hands that are always slightly ink-stained from the circuit diagrams he draws as meditative practice. His Zambian-Russian heritage gives him warm brown skin and broad cheekbones, and he keeps his head shaved except for a central strip of hair that he has grown into a narrow topknot. His most visible modification is a bioluminescent stripe running from his left temple to his jaw that pulses in slow rhythms matching his resting heartrate — a devotional mod he received during his ordination into the Circuit Path, meant to make the soul''s rhythm visible to the world.

He came to the circuit monks after a breakdown at nineteen, when a corporate data compression project he''d been laboring on for Tessera was quietly canceled without credit or compensation. The spiritual collapse that followed became the foundation of something else. He is earnest to a degree that can be disarming or irritating depending on the listener, but there is nothing performative about his faith — he genuinely believes that the act of building and repairing circuits is a form of prayer, and that the monks'' practice of meditating through hardware maintenance brings them closer to something real. He struggles with anger, which he has mostly converted into fierce advocacy.', N'Sympathetic community figure, potential quest giver for problems in Brightmoor Reclamation; his corporate grievance history can connect plots to Tessera; his students and congregation give him wide knowledge of local civilian struggles.', N'', N'Bioluminescent pulse stripe on left face (devotional, ordination mark). Basic neural focus chip — helps sustain meditative states during long repair sessions. No combat or enhancement augmentations.', N'Morning liturgy involves an hour of silent circuit repair on donated broken devices; he teaches afternoon classes on basic electronics maintenance to Brightmoor kids for free, funded by donations; evenings he leads chrome prayer sessions that blend meditation with device blessing rituals.', N'Catori Madrigal, GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Tall lean figure, 178cm, warm golden-brown skin with luminous undertones reflecting Latin American, East Asian, and African heritage. Clean-shaven with prominent cheekbones, deep brown attentive eyes. Dark brown hair shaved at sides with central topknot. Distinctive cyan-blue bioluminescent stripe running from left temple to jawline, pulsing softly. Faint pale soldering scars across both hands, ink stains on knuckles. Wears loose, practical canvas work robes in muted grays and blacks over sleeveless thermal, worn leather satchel with tools. Bare feet, calloused and steady. Posture precise and economical, fingers subtly moving. Focused intensity softened by kindness. Workstation-weathered skin. Sitting cross-legged in dim workshop lighting, cyan bioluminescence visible against darkness, monastic ascetic aesthetic, hands active with circuit work, moody neo-noir atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Brightmoor Reclamation', N'local', N'Brightmoor Reclamation', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (67.6%) with significant Northern European (11.8%), East Asian (10.0%), and smaller portions of Sub-Saharan African (5.7%) and Southeast Asian (4.9%) ancestry. This creates a warm, sun-kissed complexion with strong Latin American foundation, enhanced by subtle East Asian bone structure and the depth and warmth from African ancestry. Northern European traces add slight cool undertones to an otherwise warm, golden palette.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, the build of someone whose body follows the rhythm of their mind rather than disciplined training. Long-limbed with visible tendons in forearms and hands; slight forward shoulder curve from years hunched over circuit boards.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Central strip of hair grown into a narrow, carefully maintained topknot; the sides of his skull are shaved smooth and regularly maintained', N'Shaved on sides, medium-length topknot', N'Deep brown, warm and attentive', N'Warm golden-brown with luminous richness—predominantly Latin American undertone enhanced by East Asian subtlety and African depth. Sun-warmed complexion that glows distinctly in light, catching highlights with warm golden reflections.', N'Clean-shaven with prominent cheekbones and slight hollowness suggesting irregular eating habits. The facial structure reflects Latin American geometry with subtle East Asian influence in eye placement and bone definition, warmed by African ancestry contributing depth and richness to overall tone. Skin is clear but weathered from hours under workstation LEDs. Expression defaults to focused intensity, softened by genuine kindness.', N'Bioluminescent pulse stripe on left face (cyan-blue, subtle, rhythmic). No obvious chrome or external hardware. The neural focus chip is subcutaneous and invisible.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical precision — no wasted motion. His hands are constantly slightly active, fingers making micro-movements as if working through problems. When listening, he tilts his head slightly, a habit from focusing on faint electronic hums. Sits cross-legged frequently, even informally.', N'Tier 3-4 working class with ascetic undertones. Favors loose, practical clothing: worn canvas work robes in muted grays and blacks (monastic order signature), layered with a sleeveless thermal underneath. Carries a worn leather satchel with hand tools and circuit components. His clothing shows signs of minor burns and staining but is kept scrupulously clean. No corporate logos or luxury indicators; everything is functional and intentionally simple. Bare feet when possible, calloused and steady.', N'He still has the complete project files from his canceled Tessera work — he preserved them knowing they were proprietary, and has occasionally leaked small pieces anonymously to help people in disputes with the corponation. He knows this could end the chapel.', N'Clear and accessible, deliberately avoids jargon when teaching; in theological discussion becomes more precise and slightly archaic', N'Measured, with the habit of pausing and rephrasing when he feels he''s being unclear', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'catori_madrigal');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d7-77f0-9bec-e8d45a170ecc', N'Imani Nwosu', N'Imani', N'', N'Nwosu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 30, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Overhang — residential shelves built onto megastructure exteriors, near Kedzie and Division', N'Covert entry and social penetration specialist — infiltrator', N'Freelance — multi-district operator', N'Imani Nwosu is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 30, she has the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ice in the brain — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Imani Nwosu plans to keep it that way. She works as a infiltrator out of The Overhang, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Imani Nwosu is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who she burned last.', N'Cem Padilla-Nti is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ICE in the brain. Eye replacement — one organic, one cybernetic with recording capability and zoom', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Imani Nwosu, GLMZ, 172cm athletic lean frame with dancer''s grace. Deep warm brown skin with golden undertones and subtle cool notes — complex global heritage visible in striking high cheekbones, soft South Asian fullness, and angular Eastern European definition. Left eye warm organic brown, right eye matte gunmetal cybernetic with LED circuitry and geometric etching. Charcoal hair pulled tight in low bun with iridescent underlay. Faint silvery neural dampener mesh visible at back of skull. Thin temple scar, cipher tattoo on left wrist, power-coupling burn scar on right forearm. Wearing form-fitting matte black synthetic bodysuit sealed at wrists and ankles, charcoal grey tactical coat with smart-fabric seams, military-grade black boots laced tight. Worn steel watch with encrypted face. Predatory efficient posture, minimal movement, eyes tracking and assessing. No jewelry, no logos, matte-finished everything. Silent, functional, forgettable. Standing in dim neon-lit GLMZ corridor with overhead cold blue light catching the neural mesh and cybernetic eye''s circuitry. Sharp focus, moody atmospheric lighting, subtle rain-slick surfaces reflecting fragmentary light. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Overhang', N'local', N'The Overhang', N'Complex global ancestry: 38.6% Sub-Saharan African, 27.3% South Asian, 22.7% Eastern European, 8.2% Hispanic/Latin American, 3.2% East Asian. The combination creates a striking phenotype where African ancestry provides foundational structure and richness, South Asian genetics add warmth and softer contours, Eastern European heritage introduces subtle angularity and cool undertones, with minor Hispanic/Latin American and East Asian elements adding nuanced depth to facial geometry.', 172, 62, N'Athletic and lean with defined musculature — dancer''s grace married to fighter''s tension. No excess, everything functional. Shoulders broad but not bulky, core visibly tight beneath fitted clothing.', N'Dark brown, naturally, but currently dyed a matte charcoal with subtle iridescent underlay that catches light in certain angles', N'Pulled back in a tight, low bun — practical, secure, difficult to grab. No loose ends, literally or professionally', N'Medium', N'Left eye: warm brown, organic. Right eye: cybernetic with gunmetal iris and faint LED circuitry visible around the pupil, capable of macro zoom and recording', N'Deep warm brown with golden richness from Sub-Saharan African ancestry, brightened by South Asian warmth, cooled subtly by Eastern European heritage — creates striking luminous depth with complex undertones', N'High, prominent cheekbones with strength and definition from African ancestry balanced by softer fullness from South Asian genetics, strong defined jawline with subtle angularity from Eastern European heritage, with minor East Asian influence visible in eye structure. Features that read as ''not someone to underestimate.'' Skin is clear and well-maintained but bears the tight, hydration-depleted look of someone who runs on coffee and adrenaline. Minimal cosmetics — a small amount of eyeliner around the cybernetic eye to blend the seams.', N'Neural dampener visible as a faint silvery mesh beneath the skin at the back of her skull, most apparent when hair is pulled tight or in direct light. The cybernetic right eye is partially visible as matte gunmetal with geometric etching around the socket. Both are deliberately left unhidden — a statement.', N'Moves with predatory efficiency — no wasted motion, every step deliberate. Stands with weight balanced for instant movement in any direction. Eyes are always tracking, always assessing. When sitting, she occupies minimal space but maintains constant awareness of exits. Speaks quietly; people lean in to hear her.', N'Tier 3 functional — form-fitting matte black synthetic bodysuit as base layer, sealed at wrists and ankles. Worn beneath a fitted charcoal grey tactical coat with secure pockets and smart-fabric seams that can bypass basic scans. Boots are military-grade, black, laced tight, soles reinforced for silent movement. No jewelry except a worn steel watch with encrypted timekeeping. Everything is matte-finished to reduce reflectivity. No logos, no branded affiliation. Clothing is selected for function: silent, durable, forgettable.', N'', N'Flat affect, monotone delivery. The content is terrifying but the voice never rises.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'imani_nwosu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ae-77e8-8334-e96f7847ed00', N'Kael Dunning', N'Kael', N'', N'Dunning', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'No fixed address — moves between the Circuit, Old Harbor, and the Gray Zone. Maintains three equipment caches. Sleeps in industrial spaces that can support his power requirements., near Michigan Ave and Roosevelt', N'Bounty hunter operating across GLMZ''s ungoverned zones — originally human, now approximately 12% biological by mass. The remaining biology is the brain, parts of the spinal cord, and fragments of the original endocrine system.', N'Independent — formerly Tessera Military Augmentation Program', N'Kael Dunning was a Tier 3 dock worker who lost his legs in a cargo platform accident at age twenty-two. The corporate insurance covered basic prosthetics — functional, ugly, painful. The pain was the problem. The nerve interface between flesh and machine was botched, and for six years Kael lived with a burning sensation that started at his hips and never stopped. He could work. He could not sleep. The distinction between those two states mattered to the corporation that employed him exactly as much as you''d expect.

The Tessera military augmentation trial was looking for volunteers with existing prosthetics and a high pain tolerance. Kael had both. The trial replaced everything below the neck except a strip of spinal cord and enough endocrine tissue to keep the brain chemistry functional. Full military-grade prosthetic body: reinforced titanium skeleton, synthetic musculature capable of flipping a cargo vehicle, integrated weapons systems, hardened communications suite, and a neural bridge that connected his biological brain to the machine body with zero latency. The pain stopped. Everything stopped. He could feel pressure and temperature and the proprioceptive sense of where his body was in space, but the texture of the world — the warmth of skin, the grain of wood, the difference between rain and tears — was gone. Replaced by data.

Kael Dunning walked out of the trial facility and did not go home. Home required a body that could hold his wife without calculating the force required to avoid crushing her. He became Razorback. The name is from a dock worker''s joke about a man who was too stubborn to die and too metal to live. He hunts bounties because the work matches the body: locate, pursue, apprehend or eliminate. Clean problems with clean solutions. The part of him that was a dock worker, a husband, a man who liked the smell of lake water in autumn — that part lives in a partition of his brain that the neural bridge has not overwritten. Yet.', N'Razorback is the cost of augmentation made walking — the endpoint of the body-as-commodity logic that pervades GLMZ. He is what happens when the corporation takes everything except the brain and the brain spends thirty years wondering if that counts as alive. He is Kyle''s dark future: a man who became a weapon and forgot the person who held it.', N'Sparse, mechanical, with sudden flashes of buried humanity. The prose reads like a technical manual that occasionally remembers it used to be a love letter. Physical descriptions are precise — measurements, force calculations, material specifications — and emotional descriptions are brief, reluctant, devastating when they surface.', N'Full military-grade prosthetic body — only 12% biological (brain, partial spinal cord, endocrine fragments). Reinforced titanium skeleton, synthetic musculature, integrated weapons systems, hardened comms suite, neural bridge with zero-latency biological integration.', N'Bounty hunting, body maintenance, power management. The three activities occupy approximately equal time. Between contracts, he exists in industrial spaces that can support his power requirements and does not know what to do with the silence.', N'GLMZ character Razorback: tall, heavily augmented cyborg with pale weathered complexion and dark graying hair. Visible titanium skeleton and synthetic musculature forming lower body, narrow biological torso contrasting with mechanical frame. Natural brown eyes surrounded by neural interface scar tissue, unblinking stare. Faint LED indicators glowing amber at base of skull. Metallic comms ridge along right jaw. Wearing dark gray reinforced Kevlar-cotton jacket with oversized mechanical-frame shoulders, heavy industrial boots. Faded dock-worker tattoo visible on biological right forearm. Clean surgical scarring visible at neckline. Standing in warehouse-industrial setting, harsh neon side-lighting casting shadows on mechanical joints. Rigid posture, eerie mechanical precision, threat assessment focus. Utility-focused, unremarkable except for obvious augmentation. Cinematic sci-fi lighting, gritty metropolitan atmosphere, GLMZ warehouse district. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'Genetic ancestry unknown or deliberately obscured — surname provides no reliable indicator in the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Physical reconstruction via extensive cybernetic augmentation has superseded any discernible ancestral phenotype.', 187, 312, N'Heavily augmented cyborg frame — original human torso (lean, muscular pre-amputation baseline) mounted on reinforced titanium skeleton with synthetic musculature. The biological portion is visibly narrower than the mechanical lower body, creating an asymmetrical silhouette. Overall frame is rigid, economical in movement, built for efficient force application rather than organic grace.', N'Dark brown, graying at temples', N'Short, practical, minimal grooming — functional rather than styled', N'Short', N'Natural brown, but surrounded by faint scar tissue from neural bridge integration points', N'Pale, warehouse-dweller complexion with uneven pigmentation where synthetic shoulder joints meet biological neck', N'Weathered face — lines from six years of chronic pain before augmentation, now static. Jaw is set in a default state of minimal tension. Skin shows signs of irregular self-care; scars around the augmentation interface at his neck and collarbone are pale and clean but visible.', N'The entire lower body is visibly mechanical — titanium frame and synthetic musculature are not disguised. The joints of his arms show layered armor plating at the shoulders and elbows. A hardened comms unit is visible as a metallic ridge along his right jaw, just beneath the skin. Faint LED status indicators glow amber/red at the base of his skull when he''s running power-intensive processes. His hands are synthetic but articulated with near-human dexterity; the fingers have subtle textured pads suggesting tactile sensors. Integrated weapons systems are not visually obvious at rest, but bulky capacitor banks are visible through translucent panels in his torso when powered up.', N'Stands with minimal sway — no fidgeting, no unnecessary adjustments. Moves with mechanical precision that reads as eerie to organic observers; there is no micro-fluctuation in balance, no breathing, no small autonomous adjustments the body makes to stay upright. When he walks, each stride is calculated and efficient. His head turns on a full rotation axis without moving his torso. In conversation, he maintains eye contact with unblinking focus that suggests he is running threat assessment protocols in parallel.', N'Tier 3-4 working gear adapted for his augmented form. Heavy reinforced jacket (Kevlar-cotton blend, dark gray) with oversized shoulders to accommodate the mechanical frame. Cargo pants with reinforced internal structure to interface with his synthetic legs. All clothing is functional, durable, designed to be washed and repaired rather than replaced. No logos or status symbols — pure utility. Boots are heavy industrial, sole-attached directly to his prosthetic feet. When running contracts, he adds a light ballistic vest and a long coat that hides the silhouette of his weapons systems. No jewelry. No customization. His appearance is deliberately unremarkable except for the obvious fact of his augmented body.', N'Once a year, Razorback walks to the lakefront cargo platform where he lost his legs. He stands on the dock where the accident happened and runs the pre-conversion sensory memories at full resolution — the sound of the water, the smell of fuel and fish, the weight of the humid air. The neural bridge interprets these memories as data. He remembers them as experience. For three minutes, the gap between data and experience closes. Then it opens again, and he leaves, and he does not talk about it for another year.', N'Sparse, functional, dock-worker plain. The vocabulary of a man who grew up working with his hands and now works with weapons. No corporate jargon, no technical flair. Says exactly what he means in as few words as possible.', N'Slow, deliberate, with the mechanical precision of someone whose voice is partially synthesized. The biological voice is still in there — a Midwest flatness, a dock worker''s drawl — but it comes through a vocal modulator that strips the warmth.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'kael_dunning');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a667-7803-afbf-e98dc14068f8', N'Devanshi Okada-Banerjee', N'Devanshi', N'', N'Okada-Banerjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 78, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Washburn Commons, Block 7 Community Hall, near Halsted and Division', N'Retired Ferrogate Transit union leader, now community council elder', N'Washburn Commons Community Council; Ferrogate Transit Retiree Pension Union', N'Devanshi Okada-Banerjee is a broad-shouldered man whose body still carries the architecture of someone who once commanded rooms — the squared posture, the deliberate occupation of space — though age has softened his silhouette into something more like a weathered monument than a weapon. His skin is deep brown and mapped with the creases of seven decades of expression, and he keeps his white hair cropped close to the scalp except for a single braid at the temple, a tradition from his Polynesian grandmother he has never explained to anyone who asked. His left arm from the elbow down is functional chrome — a Ferrogate industrial replacement from a coupling accident in ''61 — and he polishes it every morning with the same cloth he uses on his shoes.

He speaks slowly and with enormous precision, as a man who learned early that imprecise words cost people their livelihoods. He has strong opinions about nearly everything and shares them freely but listens — genuinely listens — in a way that has become increasingly rare. Younger residents come to him with problems he cannot solve and leave feeling they have been given something anyway. He does not romanticize the past. He is one of the few people in Washburn Commons who will tell you, to your face, that the Corporate Wars were atrocities on all sides.', N'Quest giver, community anchor, moral compass, information broker on labor history and corporate pension law loopholes; can mobilize community opinion', N'', N'Chrome industrial replacement left arm (elbow down), Ferrogate-issued, functional grade; mild cochlear amplifier (right ear only, left is natural and partially deaf)', N'Rises at 05:30, walks the same route through the Commons regardless of weather, opens the community hall at 07:00 and holds informal court until noon; afternoons are for pension paperwork disputes he helps residents navigate.', N'Devanshi Okada-Banerjee, 182cm tall with broad shoulders and sturdy frame, warm medium-deep brown skin with olive and golden undertones blending East Asian, South Asian, Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African and Middle Eastern heritage. Weathered face with deep laugh lines, white hair cropped short with single temple braid wrapped in dark thread. Dark brown natural eyes. Clean-shaven with pronounced angular cheekbones and strong bone structure. Visibly aged, deeply lined expression of deliberate listening. Left arm from elbow down is polished mirror-finish industrial chrome prosthetic with servo joints and Ferrogate Transit Authority logo. Pale scars on right forearm (12cm), left shoulder blade (8cm burn), and left jawline (6cm). Small discrete matte-black cochlear amplifier on right ear. Dressed in dark button-up shirt over crew-neck undershirt, dark trousers, worn leather belt, weathered Consolidated Transit Authority work boots resoled twice, grey wool long-coat. Faded union ring on right ring finger. Stands with squared shoulders and authority, measured deliberate posture. 2226 GLMZ neo-noir urban aesthetic, industrial worker heritage, dignified conservative style, dim indoor lighting highlighting chrome augmentation, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Washburn Commons', N'local', N'Washburn Commons', N'East Asian (29.4%), Eastern European (24.2%), South Asian (22.3%), Sub-Saharan African (16.3%), Middle Eastern (7.8%) — a complex multihued blend resulting in warm medium-to-deep brown skin with subtle olive and golden undertones from the convergence of East Asian, South Asian, and Middle Eastern ancestry layered with Eastern European and African heritage', 182, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and deep-chested, with the residual musculature of manual labor work, now softened by age into a sturdy, monumental frame. Slight forward curve to the spine from decades of leaning into union negotiations and community work.', N'White', N'Cropped close to scalp with a single braid at the left temple, approximately 20cm long, kept with dark thread wrapping', N'Short (mostly) with one medium braid', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Warm medium-deep brown with olive and golden undertones, reflecting the balanced multihued blend of East Asian, South Asian, Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, and Middle Eastern ancestry', N'Heavily lined face with deep laugh lines around the eyes and mouth; weathered but clean-shaven; skin texture shows sun exposure and age but maintains even warm tone across high cheekbones with pronounced South Asian and East Asian angular definition; subtle Middle Eastern bridge structure; expression lines suggest a lifetime of careful listening and deliberate speech; facial structure synthesizes East Asian angularity, South Asian prominence, Middle Eastern definition, with warm undertones from Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European heritage', N'Left arm from elbow down is functional chrome industrial-grade replacement with articulated fingers and visible servo joints; polished daily to mirror finish; bore company markings (Ferrogate Transit Authority logo) on the forearm plate. Right ear shows a small discrete cochlear amplifier module, matte black, barely noticeable unless directly observed.', N'Stands with squared shoulders and deliberate occupation of physical space, a learned posture of authority that has not diminished with age. Moves slowly and with precision — economical gestures, no wasted motion. Left hand (chrome) operates with mechanical smoothness; right hand moves with natural aging slowness. Tends to lean slightly forward when listening. Walks at a measured, steady pace regardless of weather or urgency.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, conservative and functional. Typically wears a dark button-up shirt (cotton blend, no logo) over a simple crew-neck undershirt; dark trousers with a heavy leather belt worn soft with age. Work boots — currently a pair of Consolidated Transit Authority issue from the 1990s, resoled twice. A grey wool long-coat in cold months. No jewelry except a faded union ring on his right ring finger. Clothing is clean, well-maintained, never flashy. The overall impression is of someone for whom fashion was never a priority, but dignity was.', N'In 2178, during a wildcat strike, he secretly negotiated a back-channel deal with Ferrogate that ended the action early — he got pension protections for the oldest workers but left the younger strikers exposed to disciplinary action. Three of them lost their jobs. He has never told anyone and the guilt has calcified into his ideology.', N'formal but not cold; union-meeting diction mixed with old proverbs from Igbo and Samoan traditions he half-remembers; very specific with numbers and dates', N'slow, measured, each sentence placed like a stone', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'devanshi_okada_banerjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d8-7d17-97c4-e9994e8d220b', N'Ayman Nwosu', N'Ayman', N'', N'Nwosu', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 26, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station plaza, cart pitch #14 — also moves to Ironvein on Tuesdays and Grainfort market on weekends, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Noodle cart vendor, works the pre-dawn shift outside Deepwell Station', N'Independent — Chaltu''s Cart, informal network of Deepwell Station pitch vendors', N'Ayman Nwosu is short and round-shouldered with a persistent air of someone who is running calculations nobody else can see. Their heritage is Oromo-Yoruba-Finnish and their coloring reflects it in interesting ways — medium brown skin with faint golden undertones, dark eyes, and thick natural hair they keep pulled back under a food-safe wrap during service hours, though on off days it erupts into a cloud they seem delighted by. They have color-changing hair geneware that shifts the outer layers through amber, copper, and deep red over the course of several hours — slow enough that you don''t notice it happening, startling when you look up and realize the color has moved. They''ve also got cat ears, velvet-dark and expressive, which they got at nineteen and regard as the best decision of their life.

Ayman Nwosu runs their cart with the focused intensity of a surgeon. They make three broths — a sour tamarind pork, a clear Dashi-adjacent stock they keep secret, and a rotating seasonal — and they do not offer substitutions. They are funny in short bursts and opinionated about food in a way that''s charming rather than exhausting. They have a loud laugh they seem surprised by every time it comes out. They are also deeply ambitious in a way they haven''t fully admitted to themselves yet, keeping a private ledger of savings and a folder of business license applications they keep almost submitting.', N'Social hub of the pre-dawn transit crowd. Knows the Ferrogate workers, the night-shift cleaners, the early commuters. Provides gossip, warmth, and a sense of neighborhood texture. Can function as an introduction point to other characters, a mood-setting scene anchor, or a source of street-level intelligence delivered alongside a bowl of noodles.', N'', N'Color-changing hair geneware (amber to copper to deep red cycle, slow). Cat ears geneware (velvet, dark brown-black, fully expressive). No functional augmentations.', N'Up at 0330 to prep broth; cart set up by 0500 for the transit worker and early-shift crowd. Serves until stock runs out, usually 1030–1100. Afternoons spent on prep, supplier runs, and occasionally lying flat on their bed in the boarding house staring at the ceiling thinking about the business license folder.', N'Ayman Nwosu, 157cm tall short-framed food cart operator with rich deep warm brown skin, prominent cheekbones and defined jaw, dark brown eyes, thick voluminous dark brown hair with color-shifting geneware (amber, copper, red shifting), functional pair of dark brown velvet cat ears on crown rotating with attention. Scuffed food-service synthetic apron over recycled gray-blue base layers, worn but functional shoes. Faint burn scar on left inner forearm, bowl-and-spoon tattoo on right wrist. Economical movements, forward-leaning posture from cart work, hands fidgeting. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, Tier 4 working-class district, warm overhead lighting on food preparation area, neon glow from nearby storefronts, gritty urban environment, concentrated expression while prepping meals. Multiethnic Southeast Asian and Hispanic/Latin American features blended with Sub-Saharan African heritage. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station plaza', N'local', N'Deepwell Station plaza', N'Sub-Saharan African-dominant ancestry (59.1%) with substantial Southeast Asian (21.9%) and Hispanic/Latin American (19.0%) heritage. Facial structure reflects this blend: prominent cheekbones and defined jaw from African heritage, eye shape and face contours influenced by Southeast Asian and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Skin undertones show warm golden and reddish notes from the three-way genetic combination.', 157, 68, N'Compact and round-shouldered with a soft, dense frame — built for standing long hours without strain. Forearms and hands are muscular from years of prep work and lifting stock pots.', N'Natural dark brown base with color-shifting geneware in outer layers cycling through amber, copper, and deep red over several hours', N'Thick natural texture, typically pulled back under a food-safe wrap during service; on off-hours, worn loose in a voluminous cloud', N'Long (shoulder-length or below when loose)', N'Dark brown, warm and alert', N'Warm deep brown complexion with golden and reddish undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African, Southeast Asian, and Hispanic/Latin American genetic blending. Rich, luminous depth across the warm spectrum.', N'Clear and well-maintained despite irregular sleep; persistent expression of mild concentration, as though mentally running calculations. Cheekbones prominent and angular from African heritage influence. Face contours show Southeast Asian and Hispanic/Latin American character in eye shape and overall geometry. Food-stained fingertips and calluses on palms from daily cart work.', N'Fully expressive cat ears (velvet-dark brown to black, naturally furred) mounted at crown, rotate and pivot with emotion and attention. Color-shifting hair geneware visible as slow chromatic drift through outer hair layers during daylight hours. No other visible cybernetics.', N'Slightly forward-leaning from years of cart work, shoulders rounded inward. Moves with economical precision during prep and service — no wasted motion. Off-duty posture is more relaxed but still contains underlying tension. Ears twitch and swivel frequently in response to ambient sound and emotional state. Hands fidget with small objects (spoon, coin, cloth) when stationary and thinking.', N'Tier 4 working-class practicality: food-service-rated synthetic apron over recycled-material base layers (grays, blacks, deep blues). Shoes are scuffed but functional. On off-hours, slightly better-maintained vintage clothing (thrifted from Tier 3 markets) — faded band shirts, worn jeans. Hair wrap is food-safe but colorful, often clashing intentionally with their mood. No jewelry except the wrist tattoo and occasional temporary jewelry swaps on days off.', N'They''ve been quietly studying the pitch licensing system and discovered that two adjacent cart spots are technically held by a defunct vendor cooperative that dissolved eight years ago. Those spots could legally be claimed — but doing so would displace a family of informal vendors who have no license at all and nowhere else to go. Chaltu has been sitting on this information for four months.', N'Fast and colloquial, code-switches between Enclave creole and more formal registers mid-sentence without noticing. Food vocabulary is technical and precise.', N'Quick, rhythmic, tends toward lists. Thoughts arrive faster than sentences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ayman_nwosu');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a678-7f83-8b4a-e9c879dff903', N'Teuila Tuivailala-Tuivailala', N'Teuila', N'', N'Tuivailala-Tuivailala', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Ironvein, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Junk merchant and scrap reseller — salvaged tech, stripped cyberware parts, mystery lots', N'Independent; informal arrangement with a Ferrogate salvage crew that tips him off to decommissioned equipment', N'Teuila Tuivailala-Tuivailala is a lean, restless man who moves like something is always about to fall off the Gray Zone behind him — which, in his stall, it usually is. His stall is a architectural marvel of instability: towers of stripped chassis parts, bins of mismatched connectors, entire walls of hanging wire bundles color-coded by a system only he understands. His skin is warm brown with a natural undertone that makes him look perpetually sun-touched, and he keeps his head shaved close except for a short ridge of tight curls at the crown he dyes electric blue. His left eye is a salvaged optical implant, noticeably mismatched — pale silver against his natural dark brown — and occasionally focuses a half-second behind the right one when he''s tired.

He is frenetic and funny and exhausting to be around for more than an hour, and he knows it, and he uses it. His patter is legendary on the Gray Zone: he can turn a busted cooling unit into a story about a drowned Ferrogate engineer and a haunted data-center, and by the time the customer realizes they paid twice what the part was worth, they''re also smiling. He has a genuine gift for identifying what a piece of tech used to be from its corpse alone, and a worse gift for convincing himself that whatever he just acquired will definitely be worth something later.', N'Equipment and information source — knows what tech has been decommissioned and where it came from; can identify unusual salvage; sells gear, rumors, and the occasional thing he shouldn''t have.', N'', N'Salvaged silver optical implant (left eye — functional but mismatched, occasional lag). Subdermal RFID scanner in right fingertip (lets him read basic equipment tags without a reader device).', N'Spends mornings haunting Ferrogate equipment yards and industrial disposal sites, drags finds back to the Gray Zone by midday, spends afternoons selling with theatrical enthusiasm, spends evenings sorting new stock and convincing himself he hasn''t overpaid for anything.', N'Teuila Tuivailala-Tuivailala, 178cm lean wiry salvage worker, deep rich bronze skin with golden undertones blending Pacific Islander, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan heritage; angular face with prominent cheekbones and defined jawline, broad nose, natural warm brown right eye contrasting with left eye''s mismatched silver-pale salvaged optical implant showing micro-circuitry at canthus; black hair shaved close except electric blue dye ridge of tight curls at crown; faint white temple scar, thermal burn mark on left forearm, subdermal RFID line on right index knuckle. Wearing patched industrial gray cargo vest with retrofitted pockets over faded vintage band-logo t-shirt, reinforced coolant-stained work pants, worn steel-toed boots, salvaged mechanic''s harness across chest; perpetually kinetic posture with weight-shifting restlessness. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone salvage yard, neon and industrial lighting, gritty tier-5 work environment, focused and alert expression --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Pacific Islander (60.9%) with significant South Asian (25.7%) and Sub-Saharan African (13.4%) ancestry; rich deep bronze complexion reflecting the blend of equatorial and tropical heritage across Oceania, South Asia, and East Africa', 178, 68, N'Lean and wiry with ropy muscle definition from hauling salvage; restless energy visible in constant micro-movements', N'Natural black with electric blue dye on crown ridge', N'Shaved close to scalp except for a 4cm ridge of tight curls at crown, maintained with precision', N'Short', N'Left eye: salvaged silver optical implant with pale luminescence; Right eye: natural warm brown', N'Deep rich bronze with warm golden undertones; sun-darkened complexion reflecting Pacific Islander heritage enhanced by South Asian warmth and Sub-Saharan depth, appearing authentically sun-exposed despite tier-5 indoor work', N'Angular, expressive face with moderate-to-prominent cheekbones and defined jawline reflecting Pacific Islander bone structure with South Asian facial refinement; broad nose with flared nostrils characteristic of mixed Sub-Saharan and Pacific heritage; skin shows accumulated grease stains and minor thermal burns from handling hot equipment; perpetually alert expression', N'Left eye optical implant — noticeably mismatched silver-pale iris against natural brown right eye, with occasional focus lag during fatigue; implant edge shows hairline of micro-circuitry at outer canthus. Subdermal RFID scanner in right fingertip creates subtle knuckle irregularity but remains largely invisible unless specifically observed.', N'Perpetually kinetic — shifts weight constantly, gestures expansively during conversation, hands fidget with nearby objects. Moves with quick efficiency when hauling stock but relaxes into theatrical slouch when talking to customers. Head tilts unconsciously when using silver left eye, compensating for the optical lag.', N'Tier 3-4 practical: often-patched cargo vest in industrial gray with dozen pockets (some retrofitted), faded band-logo t-shirt underneath (vintage 2200s revival), reinforced work pants with cargo pockets stained with coolant and rust. Steel-toed boots worn at the heels from dragging loads. Occasionally wears a salvaged mechanic''s harness across chest for hauling heavy items. No luxury indicators, but pieces are deliberately mismatched in a way that reads as style rather than poverty.', N'Months ago he pulled a partial-wipe data core from a Zheng-Dao disposal lot. He hasn''t been able to fully decrypt it, but what he has recovered suggests it contains falsified labor records that could embarrass someone significant. He''s been sitting on it, paralyzed between fear and opportunity.', N'Fast, colloquial, mixes technical jargon with cheerful slang; Russian family loanwords surface when he''s excited or stressed', N'Rapid-fire, rarely pauses, sentences run together like he''s trying to get to the interesting part before you can leave', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'teuila_tuivailala_tuivailala');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('177aa9ff-b975-256a-0caf-e9e17aa69002', N'Hina Borg-Darko', N'Hina', N'', N'Borg-Darko', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A cramped space in the Rookery that serves as office, archive, and occasionally bedroom — walls covered with printed articles and investigation boards', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — still maintains journalism contacts despite being blacklisted from every major outlet', N'Hina Borg-Darko used to be the name that corporations feared seeing in a byline. For fifteen years she was an investigative journalist of extraordinary tenacity, breaking stories about corporate malfeasance, environmental crimes, and systemic exploitation that earned her industry recognition and corporate enemies in equal measure. Then she went after Zheng-Dao''s pharmaceutical division, and Zheng-Dao went after her.

The details are public record: a coordinated defamation campaign that discredited her sources, questioned her methods, and ultimately got her blacklisted from every major media outlet in GLMZ. The story was true. The sources were real. None of that mattered once the corporate legal machinery engaged. She lost her career, her credibility in mainstream media, and two years of her life fighting legal battles she couldn''t afford.

She survived by becoming a private investigator, applying the same skills to individual cases instead of public stories. She is arguably more effective now than she was as a journalist because she''s no longer constrained by editorial oversight, publication schedules, or the pretense of objectivity. Her investigations are thorough to the point of obsession, her source protection is absolute, and her case reports are so detailed and well-constructed that they''ve been accepted as evidence in corporate arbitration without additional verification. She is still a journalist at heart, and every case is a story she''s reporting — just for an audience of one.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'local', N'', N'', 0, 0, N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hina_borg_darko');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a683-7e18-9e47-e9f2367b8ba8', N'Fridrik Venkatesh-Dlamini-Montalvo', N'Fridrik', N'', N'Venkatesh-Dlamini-Montalvo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, beneath the Kessler Interchange overpass, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Street doc and midwife operating out of a converted shipping container in The Narrows', N'Independent; informal network of Narrows community health cooperatives', N'Fridrik Venkatesh-Dlamini-Montalvo is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin mapped by a lifetime of work — knuckles scarred from decades of suturing in bad light, forearms ropy with muscle. Her hair is kept in tight silver locs pinned up with surgical clamps she forgets to remove. She has no cosmetic mods; the only thing artificial on her body is a secondhand haptic glove on her left hand that gives her fine motor feedback when her arthritis flares. She smells of antiseptic, clove oil, and something warm and starchy — she keeps a rice cooker running in the back of the container at all times, because she refuses to let a patient leave hungry.

She is the definition of steady. In thirty years of practicing medicine without a Helix Biosystems license, she has delivered over four hundred babies, set more bones than she can count, and talked down at least a dozen people who came to her with something other than a physical wound. She does not panic. She does not moralize. She charges what people can pay and writes off the rest in a ledger she keeps in her head, not on paper. Her authority in the community is absolute and quietly terrifying — she is the person even the gang lieutenants send their mothers to.', N'Quest giver, information broker for community matters, moral anchor, source of medical assistance for those who cannot access licensed facilities; she knows everyone''s secrets because everyone eventually comes to her bleeding', N'', N'Secondhand haptic feedback glove (left hand, medical grade, heavily patched); basic subdermal thermometer in right index fingertip', N'She opens the container at 0600, sees patients until her supplies run out or her knees give, then spends evenings doing prenatal checks on a rotating circuit of expectant mothers in the surrounding blocks. She sleeps six hours, no more.', N'Fridrik Venkatesh-Dlamini-Montalvo, 50s, multiethnic diaspora features — deep warm golden-brown skin reflecting African, Latin American, East Asian, and South Asian ancestry, moderate cheekbones, deep laugh lines, weathered face showing five decades of medical work. Silver-gray locs pinned in a crown with surgical clamps. Sharp brown eyes. Scarred knuckles, weathered medical-grade haptic glove on left hand with exposed sensor nodes, subdermal thermometer glinting in right index finger. Steel-gray Carhartt work apron over dark underlayers, steel-toed clogs. Standing in a cramped Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone med-container clinic, 2226, neon lights reflecting off her brown skin, surgical instruments visible in apron pockets, expression neutral but alert. Efficient posture, weight balanced. GLMZ 2200s medical practitioner aesthetic. Cinematic lighting, slightly cool overhead surgical lamp mixing with warm ambient neon. Dignified, weathered, uncompromising. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Multiethnic diaspora blend: Hispanic/Latin American (26.5%), Sub-Saharan African (26.5%), East Asian (23.6%), South Asian (23.4%). The genetic combination creates a nuanced phenotype — a deep warm brown foundation enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth, brightened by East Asian luminosity, and warmed further by South Asian golden undertones. Five decades have weathered this face into something formidable.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, muscular without being lean — a body built for standing twelve hours at a time and moving with purpose. Her frame carries her age like ballast rather than burden.', N'Silver-gray', N'Tight locs pinned into a crown, often secured with surgical clamps she absent-mindedly leaves in place', N'Medium (locs reach mid-back when unbound)', N'Deep brown', N'Deep warm brown with golden-amber undertones, luminous despite weathering. The richness comes from African and Latin American ancestry deepened by East and South Asian warmth — a complex palette that catches light warmly even in her age.', N'Weathered and lined — a face that reflects five decades of close work and witness. Cheekbones moderate in width with ancestry-blend projection, deep nasolabial folds, pronounced laugh lines radiating from her eyes, age spots on her temples. Her expression defaults to neutral observation, but her eyes are sharp and miss nothing. The warm golden undertone in her skin prevents severity despite age; her features show the blended geometry of her four ancestral regions without dominance of any single one.', N'A weathered medical-grade haptic feedback glove on her left hand, heavily patched and repaired, with exposed sensor nodes visible along the palm side. The glove is older than most of her patients, held together by practical maintenance rather than aesthetics. Subdermal thermometer in right index fingertip registers as a subtle silver gleam beneath deep brown skin.', N'She stands with her weight balanced, feet shoulder-width apart — a stance built for stability during procedures. Her movements are efficient and economical; she does not waste energy on gesture. When examining a patient, her posture bends forward with gravitational certainty, her hands moving with practiced precision. Her gait is steady but deliberate, favoring her right leg slightly when tired.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian. A worn steel-gray Carhartt work apron over layers of long-sleeved cotton and linen, pockets stuffed with bandages, vials, and instruments. Beneath: simple black or dark olive underlayers that don''t show stains. Steel-toed medical clogs, scuffed and comfortable. A faded Iowan Collective surplus jacket hangs on a hook in the container. No jewelry except a thin brass ring on her right ring finger — never removed, origin unknown. She smells persistently of antiseptic, clove oil, and rice starch.', N'Twenty-two years ago she lost a mother and infant during a delivery that went wrong — a complication she might have caught if she''d had proper scanning equipment. She has never told anyone. She keeps a small data-shrine to the E.L.F. she blames and prays to in equal measure, leaving encrypted files of her clinical notes as offerings, as if building a record thorough enough might retroactively prevent it.', N'Plain, direct, medical precision mixed with old Yoruba expressions she doesn''t bother translating; calls everyone ''child'' regardless of age', N'Slow and deliberate, each word placed like a suture — she never wastes one', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fridrik_venkatesh_dlamini_montalvo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a633-7061-bb15-e9f513341a55', N'Bhaskara Kulkarni', N'Bhaskara', N'', N'Kulkarni', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lockhaven South, Block 14-C, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Building cleaner and informal super, Lockhaven South residential block', N'Palladian (contracted cleaner), de facto independent building super', N'Bhaskara Kulkarni is lean and angular with Romanian-inflected cheekbones and their Ghanaian grandfather''s wide, expressive mouth — usually pressed thin while they work, cracking open into a wide grin when something genuinely amuses them, which is more often than their expression suggests. Their hair is natural and dense, kept in a high puff during shifts, and they''ve spliced in color-changing geneware strands that cycle slowly through sunset colors when they''re relaxed and go flat grey when they''re stressed or focused. Both forearms are covered in cleaning product stains that won''t fully wash out — pale ghost-marks on medium brown skin that they''ve stopped caring about. They move fast and efficiently through the block, cart rattling behind them, head down, headphones in.

They have lived in Block 14-C their whole life — born in apartment 7, now renting apartment 3 one floor down. They know every crack in every wall, every resident''s schedule, which elevator makes the grinding sound at floor four that maintenance keeps marking as ''resolved'' in the system. The building''s management company, Palladian Property Subsidiaries, treats them as cleaning staff and nothing else. The residents treat them as the person you actually call when something breaks, someone floods the laundry floor, or a neighbor''s gone quiet for three days. Bhaskara Kulkarni has mixed feelings about this. Mostly they do it anyway.', N'Has access to every space in the building; knows every resident. Natural information source for anything happening in Lockhaven South. Can grant or deny physical access. Will get involved if residents are threatened.', N'', N'Color-changing geneware hair strands (cosmetic); reinforced knee joints (practical, self-paid, second-hand grade — makes a faint click on stairs)', N'0600-1400 cleaning shift across three floors; afternoons spent doing informal maintenance work the building''s actual management won''t authorize. They eat lunch on the roof, which they''ve quietly cultivated into a small garden over eight years.', N'Bhaskara Kulkarni, 2226 neo-noir GLMZ worker, medium height lean angular frame, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones from South Asian-African-European diaspora heritage, high prominent cheekbones with East Asian subtle refinement, dark brown sharp observant eyes with gentle lid structure, wide expressive mouth, rich brown complexion marked by pale permanent ghost-stains from cleaning chemicals on forearms and hands, fine scar on left palm, faint chemical burn marks across knuckles. Natural dark brown hair with iridescent geneware strands shifting orange-red-purple, worn in dense puff during work. Wearing grey Palladian-branded cleansuit slightly worn with reinforced duct-taped pockets, slip-resistant shoes, cargo vest with tools, faint mechanical augmentation visible at knees. Efficient forward-leaning posture from years of manual labor, head focused downward. GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial corridor lighting, worn practical utilitarian aesthetic, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lockhaven South', N'local', N'Lockhaven South', N'Complex diaspora ancestry: predominantly South Asian (60.4%), with significant Northern European (15.2%) and East Asian (13.9%) heritage, blended with Sub-Saharan African (6.3%) and Eastern European (4.2%) ancestry. Features reflect this rich genetic mosaic—warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones from South Asian and African heritage, balanced with the structural influences of Northern and Eastern European genetics. The East Asian component contributes subtle refinement to facial structure and eye shape. A truly mixed-heritage face that belongs nowhere and everywhere in the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 58, N'Lean and angular with efficient musculature from years of physical labor; no excess weight, defined shoulders and forearms from pushing cleaning carts and manual repair work', N'Natural dark brown with color-shifting geneware strands that cycle sunset orange-red-purple when relaxed, flattening to grey under stress', N'Typically worn in a high, dense puff during work shifts; loose and natural off-hours', N'Medium to long (when down)', N'Dark brown with a subtle East Asian lid structure, sharp and observant', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden undertones, the result of South Asian heritage (60.4%) blended with Sub-Saharan African ancestry (6.3%), creating rich depth with subtle luminosity. Northern European (15.2%) heritage adds brightness to undertones without lightening overall tone.', N'High, prominent cheekbones with balanced facial width refined by East Asian genetic influence; wide, expressive mouth usually held thin in concentration, breaking into an unexpected broad grin. Rich brown skin marked by persistent pale ghost-stains from cleaning chemicals on forearms and hands—marks they''ve stopped attempting to fully remove. Facial structure shows the blended influence of South Asian, Northern European, and East Asian ancestry: balanced proportions with strength in the jawline, slightly broader through the face than typical Northern European features, with the warm undertones characteristic of South Asian genetics and the subtle eye-shape and cheekbone prominence of East Asian heritage. Expression typically neutral or focused, with minimal resting friendliness.', N'Reinforced knee joints with faint mechanical click audible on stairs—second-hand grade self-installed augmentation, visible only when legs are bare or under scrutiny as slightly thickened joint capsules with subtle metallic sheen at the kneecap. Geneware hair strands visible only in good light as slightly more lustrous than natural hair, cycling through color changes.', N'Fast, efficient, economical movement with a slight forward lean from pushing cleaning carts. Head typically down, focused on the immediate task. Walks with a faint rhythmic click from augmented knees on hard floors. Moves through the building with the ease of someone who knows every corner and obstacle intimately.', N'Tier 4 working class, utilitarian. During shifts: grey Palladian-branded cleansuit (slightly worn, pockets reinforced with duct tape), slip-resistant shoes (non-slip rating fading), cargo vest with tool slots containing screwdrivers, adjustable wrench, spare cleaning masks. Off-shift: worn jeans, oversized borrowed hoodies (usually in muted colors—greys, deep blues), no jewellery or visible accessories. Practical, worn, never new. Everything chosen for function over appearance.', N'They have a master copy of every resident''s unit keycode — not issued to them, built from watching and learning over years. They''ve used it twice: once to check on an elderly resident who stopped answering, and once, three years ago, to read a file on a resident''s desk that they now wish they hadn''t seen and can''t unknow.', N'Economical. Doesn''t use three words when two will do. Occasional Romanian interjections when frustrated. Surprisingly precise technical vocabulary about building systems.', N'Quick, flat affect most of the time. Rhythm changes when they''re genuinely engaged — becomes looser, quicker, more rhythm.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bhaskara_kulkarni');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69c-764c-811c-ea124f2e93f4', N'Gita Tamale', N'Gita', N'', N'Tamale', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Corridor, Ringo Consumer Logistics Processing Campus, QA Division Block C', N'Quality Assurance Specialist (Mid-Level), Ringo Consumer Logistics', N'Ringo Consumer Logistics', N'Gita Tamale is medium height, medium build, medium everything on purpose — he discovered early that being forgettable at work was a form of protection, and he has refined it into an art. His skin is a warm medium brown, his hair is kept close-cropped with no mods, his work clothes are always within Ringo''s corporate palette of grey-teal without being fashionable. His one visible geneware mod is a cat tail, burnt-orange with a black tip, which he got at twenty-two for reasons he''d describe as ''a moment of optimism'' and which he''s kept because removal costs three months of UBC supplemental and also because he''s attached to it in ways he won''t discuss. The tail moves with his moods in ways he can''t fully control. His coworkers have learned to read it like a weather system.

He has worked QA at Ringo for nine years. He is not passionate about quality assurance. He is, however, deeply curious about the things that are wrong — not as a professional concern but in the way a person follows a crack in the ceiling, wondering where it leads. He has a gift for finding errors that aren''t supposed to be findable and a corresponding instinct to not always report them immediately, to sit with them first and understand their shape. He reads a lot. He is polite to everyone. He has four close friends and would die before admitting how much he values them. He prays to the QA division''s resident ELF — a twitchy spirit called Margin who lives in the error-logging system — more than he prays to anything else.', N'Local color — the texture of middle corporate life. Information source — he sees what passes through Ringo''s logistics network and notices things others don''t. Sleeper ally — his apparent ordinariness conceals an observational intelligence that can be unexpectedly valuable.', N'', N'Geneware cat tail (burnt-orange with black tip, mood-reactive). Corneal enhancement — minor, standard-issue for QA work, improves fine-detail visual perception for physical product inspection. No other augmentations.', N'Arrives exactly on time, processes his QA queue, takes his lunch break in the same spot in the campus courtyard unless it''s raining. Goes home to his apartment in Grainfort, cooks something, reads something, checks in with Margin before bed out of habit. Occasionally stays late not because he has to but because he found something he wants to understand before morning.', N'Gita Tamale, GLMZ, deep rich brown skin with warm golden undertones, refined South Asian-influenced cheekbones blended with broader Sub-Saharan African facial structure, dark brown eyes with subtle corneal latticing under light, close-cropped dark hair, clean-shaven corporate grooming. Burnt-orange geneware cat tail with black tip affixed at spine base, subtly curved. Wearing regulation grey-teal Ringo Corporate work tunic and trousers, grey-teal boots, perfectly maintained but worn. Posture contained and economical, expressionless corporate worker face. Standing in industrial office lighting or warehouse setting, stark and utilitarian, portrait-style, atmospheric, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic. Tail is only element showing personality. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Corridor', N'local', N'Grand Corridor', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (78.2%) with significant South Asian (14.5%), Eastern European (4.0%), and East Asian (3.3%) ancestry. Deep brown skin with warm golden undertones reflects the primary African heritage, while South Asian and East Asian admixture adds subtle warmth and refined angularity to facial structure. A complex diaspora blend expressed through rich, warm complexion with layered depth.', 172, 68, N'Medium, deliberate — neither lean nor stocky, calibrated for invisibility. Posture is neutral and contained, as if taking up the minimum necessary space.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Close-cropped, no styling, precisely utilitarian', N'Short', N'Dark brown with faint corneal latticing visible under bright light (enhancement hardware)', N'Deep rich brown with warm golden undertones — dominant Sub-Saharan African base enriched by South Asian warmth and subtle East Asian undertones, creating substantial depth and complexity.', N'Clean-shaven, groomed to corporate standard without excess. Cheekbones show subtle angularity characteristic of South Asian and East Asian heritage combined with the broader facial structure of Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Nose bridge shows refined definition from South Asian ancestry. Skin is unmarked and unremarkable — the face of someone who has made a deliberate study of being overlooked.', N'Geneware cat tail (burnt-orange, mood-reactive). Corneal enhancement visible only under magnification or in raking light — faint geometric patterning in iris/cornea boundary. Standard-issue QA optics, factory-original.', N'Economical and controlled. Moves without flourish, hands steady for fine detail work. Walks with even rhythm. The tail''s movements are the only thing about him that appears spontaneous or unguarded.', N'Ringo Corporate Standard: grey-teal work tunic and trousers, fit within regulation tolerances, no personalization. Cheap synthetic material, well-maintained but not new. Work boots, also grey-teal. No jewelry, no visible brands, no accessories except the embedded tail. Dresses identically most days — a form of disappearance.', N'Over the past eight months, he has noticed a consistent pattern in Ringo''s logistics error logs — a category of ''resolution unspecified'' that appears at regular intervals on shipments moving through the Blackpipe Corridor route. The pattern suggests something is being removed from the supply chain before QA sees it. He has a personal log. He hasn''t decided what it means. He hasn''t decided what to do. He''s named the pattern ''the ghost of Margin'' in his notes, which Margin has not commented on.', N'Unpretentious, specific. Uses technical language when it''s the right word and plain language otherwise. Occasionally reveals unexpected depth when something genuinely interests him.', N'Even, unhurried. He''s comfortable with silence and assumes other people are too, which is not always accurate.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gita_tamale');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a680-7262-b7bb-ea25f01e3afe', N'Dhanush Lewandowski', N'Dhanush', N'', N'Lewandowski', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Oxidian Market, Geartown — Stall Row 7, near the Ferrogate Transit overpass pillar, near Western and Division', N'Street food stall operator — Yoruba-Czech-Brazilian fusion noodles and grilled meats', N'Independent; informal member of the Oxidian Market vendors guild; pays protection tithe to the Rustborn crew but negotiates directly and never takes their shit', N'Dhanush Lewandowski is a broad-shouldered woman who moves like she owns every inch of space around her stall, which she essentially does after thirty years of holding the same corner against gang shakedowns, corporate rezoning, and two floods. Her skin is deep brown and luminous, threaded with old-generation bioluminescent dermal work that pulses faint amber when she''s cooking — a gift to herself on her fortieth birthday that she''s never regretted. Her hair is cropped tight on the sides, natural and silver-streaked on top, and she wears a perpetually stained apron printed with a faded image of the Our Lady of Data shrine in Old Harbor.

She is the emotional axis of her block. Regulars don''t just buy food — they report in. She knows who lost their job, who''s expecting a baby, who''s been visited by Axiom compliance officers. Her laugh is enormous and her anger is quiet and absolute. She speaks three languages in a single sentence without noticing. She has outlasted four protection rackets and one attempted arson and she will probably outlast the city itself.', N'Neighborhood oracle and emotional anchor; quest-giver through overheard gossip; source of local intelligence on the Oxidian Market''s social ecosystem; can feed, shelter, or warn player characters', N'', N'Amber bioluminescent dermal threading (cosmetic, old-gen); reinforced knees from a Helix Biosystems basic joint package (medical necessity, Tier 1 model)', N'She rises at 04:00 to begin her broth, is at the stall by 05:30, and runs service until everything sells out — usually by early afternoon. Evenings she resupplies, argues with her suppliers over comms, and watches her stories on a cracked screen propped against her spice rack.', N'Dhanush Lewandowski, 56-year-old mixed-heritage woman with South Asian, Eastern European, East Asian, Hispanic, Indigenous American, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Medium-deep warm golden-brown skin with luminous undertones. Black hair with silver streaking, cropped short on sides with fuller texture on top. Deep brown eyes with slight epicanthic fold set wide across harmonious blended facial features: prominent East Asian cheekbones softened by Eastern European fullness, Latin American nose structure, subtle eye fullness from Indigenous and African heritage. Substantial build, 168cm tall, broad shoulders, strong forearms. Visible bioluminescent amber dermal threading across shoulders and collarbones pulsing faintly. Pale burn scars across left hand and forearm. Standing in a neo-noir food stall in the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226. Wearing faded turmeric-stained apron over cream linen shirt with rolled sleeves, dark synthetic work pants, worn kitchen clogs. Thin brass bangle on left wrist. Intense focused expression, weathered face with laugh lines, hands mid-gesture over steaming cooking vessels. Steam and warm kitchen light illuminate her features. Ambient bioluminescence in background. Neo-noir metropolitan setting, pragmatic tier-3 labor, heat and food and presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Oxidian Market', N'local', N'The Oxidian Market', N'Complex diaspora ancestry reflecting 2226 genetic reality: South Asian (21.7%), Eastern European (20.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (16.1%), East Asian (16.0%), Indigenous American (13.1%), and Sub-Saharan African (12.6%). Her features carry the high cheekbones and eye geometry of East Asian ancestry, the broader facial structure and bone density of Eastern European heritage, the warm golden undertones of South Asian genetics, the nose bridge structure common to Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, and the subtle fullness around the eyes influenced by Indigenous American and Sub-Saharan African bloodlines. A genuinely mixed-heritage face that defies singular categorization.', 168, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial, carrying weight with the density of someone who has spent thirty years standing and moving deliberately. Strong core, thickened forearms from repetitive chopping and stirring. Not athletic—built for endurance and presence.', N'Natural black with silver streaking', N'Cropped short on sides, fuller and textured on top', N'Short', N'Deep brown with slight epicanthic fold, set wide across a face blending multiple ancestral geometries', N'Medium-deep warm golden-brown with complex undertones—the luminous result of South Asian warmth, East Asian clarity, Eastern European depth, Sub-Saharan African richness, and Indigenous American heritage blending into a unified, radiant complexion', N'Luminous and weathered. Laugh lines frame her mouth. Pores visible and open from decades of steam and heat work. A few age spots on her temples and forearms. Skin carries faint scarring from old burns on her left hand and wrist—kitchen accidents accumulated over years. Her face shows the integration of her diverse ancestry: East Asian-influenced cheekbone prominence softened by Eastern European facial fullness, a nose reflecting Latin American and South Asian heritage with subtle broadness from Indigenous American bloodlines, eye-set geometry influenced by multiple ancestral lines creating an unusual, striking harmony. Mid-depth complexion with warm undertones carries subtle variations in tone across her face—slightly darker along her cheekbones, luminous across her brow.', N'Amber bioluminescent dermal threading visible on shoulders and upper back (cosmetic, faintly pulsing). Movement of knees is smooth and mechanically precise—the joint replacement work is invisible subcutaneously, but her gait shows no compensatory limping.', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders back. Moves through her stall space with deliberate economy—no wasted motion, every step purposeful. Her hands are always active: stirring, seasoning, plating, gesturing. When she laughs, her whole body moves. When she is angry, she goes very still. She occupies space as though she has earned every centimeter of it.', N'Tier 3-4 pragmatism. Standard work uniform: an apron (perpetually stained with turmeric, ash, and broth) printed with a faded image of the Our Lady of Data shrine in Old Harbor. Underneath: a loose long-sleeved linen shirt (rolled to the elbows for kitchen work) in muted colors—cream, gray, or faded indigo. Work pants in durable synthetic fabric, dark colored to hide stains. Worn but well-maintained kitchen clogs with reinforced soles. A thin brass bangle on her left wrist—personal, not fashionable. No jewelry beyond that.', N'She has been quietly skimming a small percentage of her earnings into a dead-drop account for a young woman named Adisa who is trying to buy fake transit papers to reach the Kenosha Crossing free zone — Adisa is not her daughter biologically, but she was left at Fika''s stall as an infant and Fika has never told anyone, including Adisa', N'Dense, warm, multilingual — Yoruba exclamations, Portuguese endearments, Czech profanity when angry; food metaphors for everything', N'Unhurried but relentless, like a long simmer; she rarely rushes a sentence', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dhanush_lewandowski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a720-7ac5-9858-ea56ae59669b', N'Haifa Ionescu-Wickramasinghe', N'Haifa', N'', N'Ionescu-Wickramasinghe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Shallowgrave, working the Copperhead market blocks and the Burnside Pocket transit stops, near Kedzie and Division', N'Numbers runner and bookmaker', N'Works under a mid-level Shallowgrave bookie named Hafsah (informal, not detailed here); loosely connected to the Copperhead Boys street collective', N'Haifa Ionescu-Wickramasinghe is all edges and nervous energy — lean and fast-moving, skin a warm medium brown with scattered vitiligo patches across his jaw and neck that he has chosen to emphasize rather than treat, coloring the edges of the patches with a faint bioluminescent ink that glows a soft blue-white in low light. He has his mother''s Aleut cheekbones and his father''s Ghanaian forehead and the specific wiry build of someone who has been running since childhood — literally running, routes and errands and collections, since he was eleven. His hair is grown out and unstyled, which is unusual enough in Shallowgrave''s carefully cultivated aesthetic economy to read as either carelessness or confidence.

He is irrepressibly, exhaustingly verbal — he takes numbers, places bets, explains odds, and manages four different customer disputes simultaneously while eating a fried plantain from a street stall and telling a joke whose punchline he delivers to a different person than the one he started it with. He has a gift for mental arithmetic that would have made him a strong candidate for a Tessera data processing apprenticeship if his school records weren''t spotty and his neighborhood weren''t Shallowgrave. He knows this. He thinks about it more than he admits. He is nineteen and has not yet decided whether ambition is something that applies to him.', N'Street-level information node — he hears everything in Copperhead and Burnside; local color; potential quest giver for small-stakes storylines; the character who knows everyone by name and can connect players to almost any Shallowgrave resident', N'', N'Bioluminescent edge-ink on vitiligo patches (cosmetic, applied locally by a Shallowgrave tattoo artist); no implants — he cannot afford them', N'He starts the morning circuit at 07:00, collecting overnight results and delivering payouts or marking debts. Mid-morning he sets odds for the day''s events — factory shift accident rates, transit delays, Ferrogate schedule variance — a local informal betting market. Evenings he runs collections and social intelligence for Hafsah.', N'Haifa Ionescu-Wickramasinghe, 173cm lean neo-noir street operator, deep warm brown skin with scattered bioluminescent blue-white vitiligo edge-ink glowing on jawline and neck, high cheekbones, strong angular jaw, dark alert eyes, long straight black hair past collar falling unkempt. Wearing faded charcoal synthetic overshirt over mesh undershirt, cargo pants with deep pockets, scuffed boots, worn canvas messenger bag. Perpetually in motion, fidgeting hands, tense expression from rapid mental calculation. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226, neon-lit street setting, low ambient lighting highlighting the bioluminescent edge-ink details, urban gritty atmosphere, neo-noir urban aesthetic, street-level perspective, tired but alert demeanor --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shallowgrave', N'local', N'Shallowgrave', N'Eastern European (36.8%), Middle Eastern (24.9%), South Asian (22.4%), Sub-Saharan African (14.7%), and Southeast Asian (1.2%) ancestry — a striking Diaspora phenotype where Slavic bone structure meets Levantine angularity, Indo-Aryan cheekbones, and African features into a distinctly pan-regional appearance that defies single-origin classification', 173, 62, N'Lean and wiry with minimal muscle mass — the build of someone who runs constantly rather than trains deliberately. Long-limbed, narrow shoulders, defined but not muscular forearms from years of carrying ledgers and cash.', N'Black, naturally straight', N'Grown out and unstyled, falls past the collar; appears unkempt by Shallowgrave standards but gives an impression of deliberate indifference rather than neglect', N'Long', N'Dark brown, alert and constantly moving', N'Deep warm brown — a complex blend where Eastern European olive undertones merge with Middle Eastern amber, South Asian golden warmth, and Sub-Saharan African richness, creating a multitonal complexion. Marked by significant vitiligo with depigmented patches across the jawline, extending down the right side of the neck and scattered across the left cheekbone.', N'Young face with prominent high cheekbones reflecting South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, broad forehead characteristic of Eastern European ancestry, strong angular jaw with subtle Levantine definition. Habitually tense from constant talking and mental calculation. Skin is clear except for the vitiligo; he has chosen not to treat it, instead emphasizing the edges with bioluminescent edge-ink. The interplay of depigmented patches against his deep warm brown base creates striking visual contrast.', N'Bioluminescent edge-ink cosmetic modification only. No visible cybernetic implants or chrome. Subcutaneous implants absent due to economic constraints.', N'Perpetually in motion — fidgets with fingers, shifts weight foot to foot, speaks with hand gestures that accompany rapid-fire arithmetic. Moves with practiced efficiency through crowded streets, eyes constantly scanning for customers and threats. Sits rarely and never for long. Body language reads as high-strung and caffeinated even when he is neither.', N'Tier 3-4 street wear — functional, mixed-brand, worn layers. Typically wears a faded synthetic overshirt (often navy or charcoal) over a fitted mesh undershirt, cargo pants with deep pockets for ledgers and cash, scuffed synthetic boots designed for running. Accessories include a cheap digital wrist display for time-keeping and odds calculation, a worn canvas messenger bag with fraying straps, and occasionally a thin silver chain (cheap, non-functional) around his neck. No corporate branding. Clothes show signs of heavy use — worn cuffs, faded panels, patched seams — but are clean. Grooming is minimal; he shaves irregularly.', N'He has been quietly skimming Φ3-5 per transaction across three months — not enough to trigger a single-incident audit, but enough accumulated that if Hafsah reconciles the full ledger he is in serious trouble. He started doing it to pay for his mother''s medication and has not stopped because he doesn''t know how to stop.', N'Dense Shallowgrave Creole mixed with street slang and sudden precise mathematical language; switches registers mid-sentence without noticing', N'Fast, layered, frequently running two conversational threads simultaneously', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'haifa_ionescu_wickramasinghe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c0-7a9e-836c-eb2bfd9810e9', N'Ifeanyi Sesay', N'Ifeanyi', N'', N'Sesay', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 31, NULL, 80, 0, N'active', N'The Meridian Core (official residence), The Circuit (operational base), near LaSalle and Jackson', N'Mid-tier corporate infrastructure auditor, covert saboteur', N'Heliostat Consolidated (official). No formal affiliation as Null-Seven—operates entirely solo.', N'Ifeanyi Sesay is the kind of person whose appearance is engineered to be forgotten: medium height, medium build, features that are generically pleasant in a way that resists description. His Silesian-Nigerian heritage gives him warm brown skin and light gray-green eyes that seem slightly wrong on his face—memorable only in the moment you''re looking directly at them. He keeps his hair short and neat, dresses in the Meridian Core''s standard mid-tier professional palette (charcoal, slate, the occasional muted teal), and moves through spaces like someone who has rehearsed being unremarkable. His augmentations are all internal or invisible by design.

Officially, Bastian is a Level 4 Infrastructure Compliance Auditor for Heliostat Consolidated, one of the Spire''s subsidiary logistics and data architecture firms. His job is to find vulnerabilities in Heliostat''s own systems—and, on contract, in the systems of competitors. He is exceptionally good at this. He has three corporate commendations, a clean performance file, and a social profile calibrated to read as ambitious-but-stable. His apartment in the Meridian Core is tidy and impersonal in the way of someone who spends as little time there as possible.

In The Circuit, in a rented workspace registered to a shell persona, Bastian is Null-Seven: one of the most methodical infrastructure saboteurs operating in GLMZ. He does not work for ideology in the pure sense—he works from a specific, contained grievance that has grown tendrils. Three years ago, a Heliostat data architecture decision he flagged and documented was overridden by management. Six months later, the resulting failure cascaded into a residential power grid collapse in the Gray Zone that killed eleven people. The incident was classified as ''infrastructure fatigue.'' His report was buried. He has been quietly, surgically dismantling Heliostat''s redundancy systems ever since—not to destroy the company, but to force an audit so complete that the buried report will surface. He does not let himself examine whether this plan is rational.', N'Explores institutional cover-up, the ethics of individual sabotage versus systemic change, and the psychological cost of sustained double-life operation. Creates pressure points between The Circuit''s underground and The Meridian Core''s corporate machinery.', N'', N'Subdermal neural lace (memory partitioning, identity-state switching—allows him to fully inhabit either persona without behavioral bleed),Ocular HUD implant (standard corporate model, modified with custom encryption overlay),Passive signal dampener in left forearm (reduces his wireless signature to near-zero when activated)', N'Commutes from the Meridian Core to Heliostat offices by mag-rail, performs his auditor role with mechanical competence. Twice a week takes a circuitous route to The Circuit workspace. Eats alone almost always—too much conversational improvisation in shared meals. Runs probability models recreationally. Keeps no personal objects in either space that couldn''t be abandoned in under three minutes.', N'Ifeanyi Sesay, 174cm tall lean professional with medium-deep warm brown skin reflecting Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, Middle Eastern, and Southeast Asian ancestry. High graceful cheekbones, straight nose with moderate bridge definition, balanced jawline. Light gray-green eyes with amber undertone. Dark brown naturally straight short hair, neatly trimmed and parted off-center. Clean-shaven, smooth complexion. Wearing charcoal wool trousers, slate technical microfiber shirt, muted teal Nakamura Systems blazer, black leather composite shoes, stainless steel minimalist chronometer. Slim technical fabric messenger bag. Standing in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone corporate office with soft LED ambient lighting, cool tones. Posture economical and calibrated, eyes tracking surroundings predictably. Measured, checkpoint presence. No visible augmentations though neural implants lurk beneath skin. Professional but forgettable, template-assembled appearance. Neo-noir corporate aesthetic, 2200s tech --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Meridian Core (official residence)', N'local', N'The Meridian Core (official residence)', N'Genetically mosaic of Sub-Saharan African (40.6%), South Asian (20.9%), Eastern European (15.2%), Middle Eastern (11.7%), and Southeast Asian (11.6%) ancestry. The phenotype reflects this polyphonic blend: West African bone structure with graceful cheekbone width meets South Asian facial proportions and Middle Eastern nose bridge definition, anchored by Eastern European undertones in jawline geometry. Southeast Asian softness tempers the overall angularity. Features resist categorical reading, shifting subtly across continental traditions depending on light and angle—high cheekbones with lateral width, straight nose with moderate bridge definition, balanced jawline with smooth angularity. The overall effect is striking equilibrium across global lineages.', 174, 72, N'Medium, lean but not wiry—economical muscle distribution from deliberate fitness maintenance rather than athletic pursuit. Posture is neither relaxed nor rigid, calibrated to occupy minimal psychological space.', N'Dark brown, naturally straight', N'Neatly trimmed, geometric precision. No styling product, no texture. Parted slightly off-center.', N'Short', N'Light gray-green with slight amber undertone—unusual enough to create momentary cognitive friction, then dissolve from memory', N'Medium-deep warm brown with complex polyphonic undertones—the result of blended melanin inheritance across Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, Middle Eastern, and Southeast Asian lines. Shifts subtly across spectrum from warm bronze to golden to subtle olive depending on angle and light.', N'Clean-shaven, smooth skin with no visible scarring or blemishing. Minimal sun exposure suggests tier-appropriate indoor lifestyle. Features are harmoniously blended across ancestry: high cheekbones with graceful lateral width reflecting West African heritage, straight nose with moderate bridge definition from Middle Eastern and South Asian lines, unmarked jawline with balanced angularity balanced by Southeast Asian softness. Appears five years younger or older depending on lighting angle. The overall impression is of genuine cosmopolitan harmony rather than distinctly regional phenotype.', N'None visible. The ocular HUD implant is indistinguishable from standard corporate-issue optics during casual observation. All augmentations (neural lace, signal dampener) are completely subcutaneous.', N'Moves with economic efficiency—no wasted gesture, no expansive body language. Walks at consistent pace, neither hurried nor leisurely. Sits with spine slightly forward, ready to stand. Eyes track surroundings in predictable patterns. Speaks in measured tone with minimal vocal inflection. Handshake is firm but brief. Overall impression: someone whose presence is a checkbox rather than a presence.', N'Meridian Core Tier 2-3 professional: charcoal wool trousers, slate technical shirts in breathable microfiber, muted teal or gray blazers from mid-market corpo brands (Zeiss-Luxor, Nakamura Systems). Watches a stainless steel minimalist chronometer (Braun-licensed). Shoes are black leather composite, maintained to utilitarian polish. Bag is a slim messenger in technical fabric—carries encrypted tablet, earpiece, secondary comms device, nothing personal. The effect is of someone assembling a costume from a corporate template.', N'The original buried report has a second author—a colleague named Saoirse who co-wrote it and then quietly accepted a promotion and said nothing. Bastian knows where she is. He has not contacted her. He doesn''t know if he''s protecting her, punishing her, or waiting for her to come forward on her own. He thinks about her most days.', N'Corporate-precise in professional contexts—systems language, passive constructions, quantified risk. In the Circuit, more clipped and direct, technical jargon from a different register. Rarely expresses emotion as emotion; expresses it as data.', N'Even and measured, with a slight over-deliberateness that reads as careful rather than robotic. Pauses before answering questions he finds complicated. Never interrupts.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ifeanyi_sesay');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5dd-7016-b418-eb3a19d14c5b', N'Farzana Tlaloc', N'Farzana', N'', N'Tlaloc', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hough Reclamation, the Lowgate Community Clinic (unlicensed, Helix Biosystems-adjacent but not officially affiliated), near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Nurse at a Tier-1 community clinic, night shift', N'Lowgate Community Clinic (unlicensed); loose affiliation with the Hough Reclamation Mutual Aid Network', N'Farzana Tlaloc is small and moves quickly, the way people do when they''ve spent years navigating narrow corridors between occupied beds. She has warm dark skin, natural hair worn in a high puff that she wraps in a green cloth when on shift, and eyes that are an unsettling pale grey — a side effect of a retinal enhancement she got from a discount clinic at twenty-three that was slightly misaligned and gives her a perpetual look of seeing through whoever she''s talking to. She wears color-changing nail polish that she updates with her mood, a small indulgence in an otherwise spartan wardrobe of scrubs and waterproof boots. On her left shoulder, barely visible above her collar, is a small tattoo of the Helix Biosystems caduceus crossed out with a red line — a private protest she keeps covered at work.

Farzana Tlaloc has the specific exhaustion of someone who has been running on competence and controlled fury for years. She is technically excellent and emotionally present in a way that astonishes patients who expected institutional indifference, but beneath this is a bone-deep tiredness at the structural conditions she''s fighting every shift with inadequate supplies and no institutional backing. She has a dark humor that surfaces as small sharp jokes in the worst moments, which her colleagues either love or find disturbing. She maintains a fierce and slightly desperate optimism about specific patients while holding no illusions about the system itself.', N'Medical resource and moral compass for stories set in lower-tier communities; window into healthcare scarcity and grassroots mutual aid; can provide medical information, triage injured characters, or serve as a witness to neighborhood events during her walks to and from shift', N'', N'Misaligned retinal enhancement (pale grey eyes, improved low-light vision but occasional depth perception errors); subdermal temperature sensor in fingertips (allows quick patient assessment); color-changing cosmetic nail coating', N'Works 21:00 to 07:00 four nights a week, sleeps during the day in a shared apartment two blocks from the clinic. Spends her off-hours either sleeping, doing continuing education through pirated Helix Biosystems medical modules, or at the mutual aid network''s supply coordination meetings.', N'Farzana Tlaloc, 158cm lean medical worker, warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, angular Mesoamerican cheekbones softened by pan-global ancestry (Indigenous American, African, Southeast Asian, Latin American, South Asian blend), natural shoulder-length black hair in high puff wrapped in green cloth, pale grey luminescent augmented eyes with unsettling reflectivity, dark circles from night-shift exhaustion, calloused clinical hands with color-shifting blue-grey nail polish, small caduceus tattoo with red line on shoulder, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, wearing charcoal grey hospital scrubs and worn Bauer boots, standing in harsh clinic fluorescent lighting with economical posture, scan-the-room awareness, penetrating gaze, moody atmospheric background of medical facility at night, cinematic lighting emphasizing the otherworldly quality of her augmented eyes --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hough Reclamation', N'local', N'Hough Reclamation', N'Pan-global synthesis: Indigenous American foundation (42.2%) with prominent Mesoamerican features blended through Hispanic/Latin American (19.1%), Sub-Saharan African (16.2%), Southeast Asian (16.0%), and South Asian (6.5%) ancestry. The result is a complex interplay of angular Indigenous American bone structure warmed by African and Latin American undertones, refined by Southeast and South Asian genetic contributions—truly multicontinental in feature distribution', 158, 52, N'Lean and compact, muscular in the specific way of someone who moves efficiently through tight spaces for hours—low body fat, defined shoulders and forearms from years of patient handling and IV work', N'Natural deep black', N'Worn in a high puff, typically wrapped in a green cloth during work shifts; natural texture, well-maintained despite minimal grooming budget', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Pale grey with subtle iridescence—a visible artifact of misaligned retinal enhancement; unnaturally reflective in low light, creating an unsettling ''looking through you'' quality', N'Warm medium-deep brown with rich golden and reddish undertones; the complex result of Indigenous American base enriched by Hispanic/Latin warmth and Sub-Saharan depth, tempered by Southeast and South Asian refinement', N'Clean, minimal makeup, dark circles under eyes from chronic night-shift sleep deprivation; skin shows resilience rather than softness—calloused fingertips from years of clinical work, no visible dermatitis despite frequent handwashing; cheekbones show prominent angular geometry characteristic of Indigenous American heritage, enhanced by the warm bronze tones of African and Latin ancestry; nose bridge defined and refined with the structural diversity of genuine pan-global genetic expression; facial structure blends the directness of Mesoamerican features with softer contours from Southeast Asian ancestry', N'Pale grey eyes with slight luminescence in dim light (retinal enhancement artifact); color-changing nail polish that shifts hue based on mood—currently cycling between muted blues and greys; the subdermal temperature sensor is invisible unless she deliberately shows the small scarred injection point', N'Economical and rapid, movements calibrated for confined spaces—never wastes motion, walks with purpose, tends to scan rooms for patients who need attention; stands with shoulders slightly forward from years of bedside work; maintains eye contact in a way that feels penetrating rather than warm due to the pale grey augmented eyes', N'Tier 3 practical: well-worn but clean hospital scrubs in charcoal grey (neutral color, hides stains), paired with non-slip waterproof boots (Bauer brand, durable utility level); off-shift: simple layered clothing—black fitted tees, worn denim, an oversized grey hoodie with Lowgate Clinic''s faded logo; no jewelry except the color-changing nail polish; a green cloth headwrap in natural cotton, worn both as functional hair management and cultural assertion', N'She has been diverting small quantities of expired-but-still-effective medications from the clinic''s waste disposal and distributing them through the mutual aid network. Technically theft, technically saving lives. She has never told anyone and maintains meticulous records of every diversion in an encrypted file she keeps telling herself she''ll delete.', N'Medical precision mixed with casual street language; code-switches between professional and neighborhood registers mid-sentence', N'Fast by default, deliberately slow and clear when explaining something medical to a patient', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'farzana_tlaloc');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b6-74e6-8920-eb3b23748370', N'Asuncion Wójcik', N'Asuncion', N'', N'Wójcik', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, research annex sublevel, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Xenolinguist and gene-sequence archivist, studying the emergent communication systems of engineered organisms and attempting to establish a taxonomy of non-human language', N'Aurochs Medical Complex Research Annex / Meridian Civic University (adjunct researcher)', N'Asuncion Wójcik is small and very still, with the particular quality of stillness that looks like patience but is actually intense concentration. Her skin is warm brown and she has the most elaborate geneware of almost anyone in her building: her hair changes color in response to her emotional state via a chromatic expression mod she installed in her second year of grad school and has never entirely mastered — it runs bright orange when she''s excited, deep blue when she''s uncertain, and an unsettling grey-green when she''s frightened, which her colleagues have learned to read as a fairly accurate emotional barometer. She finds this embarrassing and wears it anyway. Her eyes are natural dark hazel but she has retractable feline pupils mod — not for aesthetics but because it genuinely improves her visual acuity in the low-light lab conditions where she does most of her work.

Asuncion Wójcik is three years post-doctorate and working in the most obscure corner of a field that most people already find obscure. Her work is simple to describe and nearly impossible to explain: she studies the communication systems of organisms that have been engineered to not have language, and has found that several of them have developed one anyway. She is methodical, meticulous, and possessed by her research in a way that has cost her two relationships and most of her social life. She is not unhappy about this in the way that she is unhappy about other things; her work makes her feel like she is standing at the edge of something enormous, and she would rather be there than comfortable elsewhere. She is Tier 2 income on an Aurochs Medical Complex stipend and supplementary university grant, which means she eats a lot of printed food and has a coat she''s had for six years.', N'Access point to Aurochs Medical Complex and engineered organism research; possesses findings about non-human language emergence that have unsettling implications for bioethics and Helix Biosystems intellectual property law; her naivety about institutional politics makes her vulnerable; her research intersects unexpectedly with E.L.F. communication studies', N'', N'Chromatic expression hair mod (geneware — emotional color response, orange/blue/grey-green range), retractable feline pupil mod (geneware, functional not cosmetic), standard neural mesh', N'In the lab by 0700 most days; hours of observation work that looks from the outside like sitting very still and watching things; afternoon data analysis; evenings reading across fields she''s not trained in looking for frameworks that might apply to what she''s finding', N'Asuncion Wójcik, a lean compact woman of 158cm standing in a neo-noir laboratory in 2226. Warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones reflecting Eastern European, Northern European, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry blend. Fine-featured face with high cheekbones, defined jawline, almond-shaped eyes with visible vertical-slit feline pupils (dark hazel, slightly dilated). Dark brown hair with hints of blue chromatic mods at temples, pulled back in loose functional braid. Worn Aurochs lab coat over grey thermoregulated undershirt, black utility pants, non-slip lab shoes. Thin silver bracelet on left wrist. Faint chemical burn mark on right hand, small scar barely visible on left temple. Sits in deep focus, economical precise movements. Lab setting with cool LED lighting casting faint subcutaneous shimmer visible along temples where neural mesh interface sits beneath skin. Atmosphere of intense concentration, recycled lab air haze, disinfectant scent. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, neon glow from equipment in soft background. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Eastern European (28.4%), Northern European (26.6%), South Asian (22.6%), and Sub-Saharan African (22.4%) ancestry creating a striking pan-global phenotype. The blend manifests as a warm, complex medium brown complexion with golden and olive undertones—a sophisticated mixing of Slavic bone structure with South Asian and African warmth, creating features that defy easy regional categorization.', 158, 49, N'Compact and lean, almost wiry — the build of someone who forgets to eat during work cycles. Minimal body fat, slight but functional musculature from years hunched over lab equipment.', N'Naturally dark brown, but chromatic expression mod renders it orange (excitement), deep blue (uncertainty), or grey-green (fear) — currently displays baseline dark brown with hints of blue at the temples', N'Pulled back in a loose, functional braid or bun, often with strands escaping; styled for lab work, not presentation', N'Medium (shoulder-length when down)', N'Natural dark hazel with retractable feline pupils (vertical-slit pupils that extend/retract via geneware trigger)', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones—a sophisticated blend of Eastern European base notes with South Asian and Sub-Saharan African warmth. Even-toned with subtle luminosity reflecting the complex ancestry mix.', N'Fine-featured with prominent high cheekbones and defined jawline reflecting the pan-global ancestry blend. Almond-shaped eyes set with slight upward tilt. Nose bridge straight and defined with moderate flare. Skin is clear but shows signs of lab-light pallor and occasional sleep deprivation (faint shadows under eyes). A small scar on her left temple from a childhood accident. Bitten fingernails from nervous habits during analysis work.', N'Chromatic expression hair mod (visible color shifts during conversation), retractable feline pupils (visible when dilated or deliberately triggered — dark hazel eyes with distinctive vertical pupils). Faint subcutaneous shimmer along her temples where the neural mesh interface sits just beneath the skin. No visible chrome or external hardware.', N'Sits very still for long periods — the stillness of someone in deep focus rather than relaxation. When moving, economical and precise; no wasted motion. Tends to tilt her head slightly when listening, pupils dilating slightly as she processes information. Hands are expressive during explanation but otherwise still. Blinks less frequently than average (feline mod side effect).', N'Tier 2 academic/research — function over fashion. Standard-issue Aurochs lab coat (well-worn, six years old, patched twice), layered underneath with simple thermoregulated undershirt in neutral grey or black. Worn black utility pants with multiple pockets for tools and data drives. Comfortable, scuffed non-slip lab shoes. A single piece of jewelry: a thin silver bracelet on her left wrist, possibly a gift or family piece. No visible corporate branding; clothing is deliberately nondescript. Smells faintly of disinfectant and the particular staleness of recycled lab air.', N'One of the organisms she studies — a Helix Biosystems engineered cephalopod variant used in environmental sensing — has been trying to communicate with her specifically for four months. She is not sure yet if it recognizes her as an individual or if she is reading pattern into noise, but the sequences she receives when she is present differ structurally from those produced in her absence. She has begun leaving small objects near its tank to see if it responds. If she is right, the IP implications for Helix alone are staggering, and she has not told her Aurochs supervisor.', N'Technical and precise in her field, unexpectedly informal outside it; has a habit of reaching for analogies from wildly different domains', N'Measured and quiet, occasionally breaking into rapid concentrated bursts when she''s working through something out loud', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'asuncion_w_jcik');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a731-7836-a8b7-eb75c5dea9f7', N'Aysel Kovalenko-Ogawa', N'Aysel', N'', N'Kovalenko-Ogawa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Shallowgrave — lives in a bunk hostel on Carrion Alley, works the market corridors between the Sump and Ironvein, near Western and Division', N'Numbers runner and bookmaker''s courier for an illegal betting operation in Shallowgrave', N'Works for Sołtys Kowalczyk-Fanuanuu''s illegal bookmaking operation; no gang loyalty', N'Aysel Kovalenko-Ogawa is nineteen years old and moves like she expects the ground to give way. She''s thin in the way of someone whose calories are unreliable, with close-cropped natural hair dyed in two bands — natural black at the roots, then a vivid synthetic orange at the tips — and a set of geneware cat ears she bought secondhand with three months of saved wages; they''re tawny gold and slightly too large for her head, which she is sensitive about. Her skin is a warm dark brown, her eyes quick and dark, her grin infectious and slightly desperate. She has a long scar across her left shin from a close call with a Ferrogate transit barrier she vaulted at full speed.

She is fast — genuinely, almost recklessly fast — and has built her entire professional identity around it. She runs bets and payouts for a bookmaker named Sołtys Kowalczyk-Fanuanuu who she calls ''the Old Man,'' carrying chips, physical slips, and occasionally small packages she''s been told not to think about through the market crowds. She is saving money for something she hasn''t named yet but pictures vaguely as ''away.'' She is not cynical about this. She still believes in the vagueness of away.', N'Street-level information source — she sees everything and everyone moving money in Shallowgrave; useful contact, sympathetic viewpoint character, person who can be in danger or can witness something she shouldn''t have', N'', N'Secondhand geneware cat ears (tawny gold, cosmetic); a cheap adrenal spike implant in her left arm that she activates before difficult runs (low-grade, sketchy provenance)', N'She picks up her slip-pack from a dead-drop in a drainage grate at 0800, runs the circuit through three market sectors until midday, breaks for whatever food she can afford, runs the afternoon payout circuit, and returns to the hostel by 2100 unless something goes wrong.', N'Aysel Kovalenko-Ogawa, 163cm tall wiry courier with warm medium-brown skin (Eastern European-Hispanic-East Asian mix), high angular cheekbones, dark alert eyes. Short black hair with neon orange dyed tips, close-cropped sides. Tawny gold geneware cat ears with visible seams twitching slightly. Black worn synthetic runner''s jacket with reflective threading and elbow patches, dark gray compression pants, worn synth-leather grip-sole boots. Faded teal hoodie collar visible. Cheap digital wrist-timer. Coiled posture, weight on balls of feet, watchful expression with grin lines. Faint scar across left shin, subcutaneous adrenal spike implant bulge visible on left forearm. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial corridor lighting casting slight shadows, grimy market floor atmosphere, neon signage reflection, desperate hunger masked by practiced speed. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shallowgrave', N'local', N'Shallowgrave', N'Eastern European (38.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (37.9%), and East Asian (23.3%) — a diaspora blend. Her features reflect this tri-continental mix: Eastern European bone structure provides angular definition, Hispanic/Latin American ancestry contributes warm golden undertones and depth, while East Asian heritage shapes her eye geometry and high cheekbone prominence. The genetic convergence creates a warm medium-brown complexion with subtle amber and honey undertones.', 163, 48, N'Wiry and lean with the taut musculature of someone who runs constantly; no body fat to spare. Her frame reads as hungry but functional — built for speed rather than strength.', N'Natural black at roots, synthetic neon orange at tips', N'Close-cropped, almost shaved at the sides, longer on top with the dyed orange tips visible', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and quick-moving', N'Warm medium brown with golden and honey undertones, reflecting the balanced blend of Eastern European, Hispanic/Latin American, and East Asian ancestry; sun-warmed despite industrial corridor pallor', N'Angular face with high, pronounced cheekbones shaped by Eastern European and East Asian heritage, warmed by the depth of Hispanic/Latin American complexion. Skin bears the slight texture of Shallowgrave''s industrial air quality. Quick, infectious grin lines around her mouth. Her expression defaults to watchful and slightly tensed.', N'Secondhand geneware cat ears (tawny gold, slightly oversized relative to her head, with visible seams and older biotech aesthetic). The ears twitch slightly when she''s focused or nervous. Left forearm shows a faint subcutaneous bulge where the adrenal spike implant sits — visible only under direct light or when her arm is flexed.', N'She moves with coiled readiness, weight always balanced on the balls of her feet. Her gait is economical and fast even when she''s not running. Her head turns frequently, tracking movement in her peripheral vision. When still, she fidgets — fingers drumming, weight shifting. There''s an underlying desperation in her movement, masked by practiced speed.', N'Tier 4 working-class courier aesthetic. Black synthetic runner''s jacket with reflective threading (worn, patches at the elbows). Fitted dark gray compression pants with cargo pockets for slip-packs and chips. Worn synth-leather ankle boots with grip-soles rated for market floor surfaces. A faded teal hoodie underneath, visible at the collar. No jewelry except a cheap digital wrist-timer for tracking run schedules. Her clothes are functional, slightly too large in places (hand-me-down hostel-trade economy), and bear the wear of constant movement through crowded, grimy corridors.', N'She memorizes every slip she carries — bet amounts, account codes, client identifiers — and has been quietly building a mental ledger of the operation''s full financial structure. She doesn''t know why yet. It feels like insurance. It is also incredibly dangerous.', N'Shallowgrave Creole mixed with market slang; fast, clipped, word-economical', N'Rapid and skipping, sentences often abandoned halfway and restarted', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aysel_kovalenko_ogawa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a646-7240-a624-ebdc556f2c1f', N'Lars Zaragoza-Vestergaard', N'Lars', N'', N'Zaragoza-Vestergaard', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 78, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Avalon Quiet — a three-room unit on the eighth floor of the Chrysalis Building, a co-operative housing block, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Retired Zheng-Dao maintenance engineer, community elder, grandparent raising grandchildren', N'Zheng-Dao Corporation (retired, pension Class A-1); Chrysalis Building Co-operative Board; Avalon Quiet Maintenance Volunteer Corps', N'Lars Zaragoza-Vestergaard is a tall man who has given up very little of his height to age — he still stands straight at six-two, lean in the way of someone who has spent a lifetime climbing through maintenance shafts and has never been able to afford to stop moving. His skin is deep umber-black with a slight ashen quality at the joints, and his hands are the most expressive thing about him: massive, deliberate, permanently stained with the particular bluish tint of Zheng-Dao lubricant that no amount of washing has ever fully removed. He has cat ears — a geneware mod he got at thirty-two on a bet, brown-furred and articulate, which now seem as natural a part of his face as his broad nose and his slow, assessing eyes. He keeps his beard in a neat grey circle and wears the same type of quilted work jacket in varying states of cleanliness, each one bearing accumulated patches from thirty years of Zheng-Dao facility IDs.

He worked Zheng-Dao maintenance for forty years, becoming one of the senior engineers for the Avalon Quiet district power grid before mandatory retirement. He is the kind of man who understands systems — mechanical, social, familial — with the same patient diagnostic attention, and who believes almost everything can be fixed if you correctly identify the fault. He is raising two grandchildren, ages nine and twelve, after his son''s death, and he applies to this work the same methodical care he gave to keeping three hundred thousand residents'' power running. He is not warm in an obvious way. He is reliable, which he has concluded is better.', N'Technical resource and practical problem-solver; community infrastructure expert; represents the dignified precarity of the retired working class; emotionally grounded figure who can anchor chaotic storylines; his ghost signals from the expired neural interface occasionally give him information he shouldn''t have', N'', N'Cat ears, brown fur, fully articulate (cosmetic geneware, 46 years old); joint reinforcement, knees and lower back (occupational necessity); Zheng-Dao-issued neural diagnostic interface for grid systems, now expired but hardwired in — he sometimes gets ghost signals from the power grid he used to manage', N'Gets both grandchildren to school, then spends the morning doing volunteer maintenance work throughout the Chrysalis Building and sometimes the surrounding Avalon Quiet blocks — he cannot stop. Afternoons he keeps a small informal repair workshop in his unit where neighbors bring broken devices; he charges what they can afford, which is often nothing. Evenings: homework supervision, dinner, two hours of ELF devotion at the shrine he keeps for the building''s power-management spirit, sleep.', N'Lars Zaragoza-Vestergaard, 188cm tall lean angular man, medium-warm brown skin with golden and olive undertones, steel grey close-cropped hair and neat circular beard, deep brown eyes, weathered face with laugh lines and forty years of character. Articulate brown-furred cat ears integrated naturally into his head. Massive hands stained with bluish lubricant residue, crosshatched with scars and pressure lines. Faint concentric burn scars across both forearms. Metallic shimmer visible on knee joints. Wearing patched quilted work jacket covered in Zheng-Dao facility patches and volunteer corps insignia, grey undershirt, dark reinforced work trousers, aged steel-toed boots. Silver pendant visible at neckline. Standing perfectly straight with economical posture, hands busy and ready. Neo-noir 2220s industrial maintenance worker aesthetic. Dim maintenance facility lighting, shadows catching the metallic glint of his augmentations. Gritty, lived-in, trustworthy authority. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Avalon Quiet', N'local', N'Avalon Quiet', N'Predominantly Northern European (69.8%) with meaningful Hispanic/Latin American (12.2%), Southeast Asian (8.0%), Sub-Saharan African (7.9%), and Indigenous American (2.1%) ancestry. His genetic profile creates a striking global blend: Northern European ancestry provides angular bone structure and his foundational frame, while Southeast Asian heritage contributes subtle eye shape, refined cheekbone definition, and a slight softness to his features. Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African ancestry infuse warmth and richness into his complexion, creating a medium-warm brown with golden and olive undertones—a genuine depth rather than pale northern pallor. Indigenous American ancestry adds subtle resilience to his overall appearance.', 188, 78, N'Lean and angular, all efficient muscle and minimal fat — the frame of someone who has spent forty years climbing through maintenance shafts and has never stopped moving. Slight forward cant to his shoulders from decades of hunching through tight spaces.', N'Steel grey', N'Neat circular beard kept close to his jaw; head hair cropped very short', N'Short', N'Deep brown, patient and assessing', N'Medium-warm brown with golden and olive undertones—a rich blend from his Northern European base enriched by Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, creating genuine depth and warmth across his entire complexion', N'Weathered but meticulously groomed—creases around his eyes and mouth from forty years of squinting into dim maintenance panels. Angular facial structure reflecting his Northern European majority, with subtle cheekbone definition and refined eye shape influenced by Southeast Asian ancestry, softened by the warmth of his Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Hands are the most striking feature: massive, deliberate, with permanent bluish staining from Zheng-Dao lubricant embedded beneath the fingernails and in the calluses. Palms crosshatched with old scars and pressure lines. Concentric pattern of faint burn scars across both forearms from electrical exposure, circa age 45-50.', N'Articulate cat ears with responsive brown fur. The joints of both knees show slight metallic shimmer under certain angles — reinforcement plating. Occasional faint blue LED blink in his right pupil when he receives ''ghost signals'' from the power grid he once managed, though this is rare and he has learned to suppress it in public.', N'Stands perfectly straight at six-two despite his age — deliberate maintenance of posture. Moves with economical precision, never wasting a gesture. His hands are constantly busy — adjusting, checking, reassessing. When he sits, he sits forward slightly, as if ready to stand. Walks slowly but with absolute confidence, never hurrying but never wasting time either.', N'Tier 3-4 practical utility wear. Standard quilted work jacket in varying states of repair and cleanliness — each one a patchwork of accumulated Zheng-Dao facility ID patches, company logos, and volunteer corps insignia from the Avalon Quiet Maintenance Corps. Beneath: simple grey undershirt or company-issue thermal. Straight-leg work trousers in dark blue or black, reinforced at the knees with additional fabric patches. Steel-toed safety boots, meticulously maintained but visibly aged. A small silver pendant on a cord beneath his shirt — likely related to his ELF devotional practice. No jewelry beyond a faded Zheng-Dao service ring on his left ring finger.', N'His expired neural interface still occasionally picks up live data from the Avalon Quiet power grid — fragmented, but real. He has been tracking an anomaly in Zheng-Dao''s grid usage patterns that suggests something large and unauthorized is drawing power from a residential basement three blocks away. He hasn''t reported it because he''s not sure he''s authorized to know.', N'Technical and precise, with Ghanaian-Bolivian family idiom surfacing in proverbs; uses maintenance metaphors for almost everything emotional', N'Unhurried and quiet; he speaks at the pace of someone who has spent a career in noisy environments and learned that calm carries further than volume', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'lars_zaragoza_vestergaard');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a694-7f22-ad78-ec10a29fd1c0', N'Ahanu Krishnamurthy', N'Ahanu', N'', N'Krishnamurthy', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Based at Deepwell Station maintenance depot; lives in a Ferrogate-subsidized housing block in McKinley Flats, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Ferrogate Transit tram operator, Line 7 through Geartown and the Narrows', N'Ferrogate Transit — Line 7 Operator, Local 44 Transit Workers'' Compact', N'Ahanu Krishnamurthy is tall and angular, with the kind of face that reads as younger than it is — wide jaw, large dark eyes, deep brown skin with a cool undertone. His Finnish-Senegalese-Indian heritage gives him a build that''s all long limb and narrow shoulder. He keeps his hair cut very short on the sides with a small puff on top that he sometimes lets grow out for months before cutting again, depending on how much he''s paying attention to himself. A bioluminescent stripe runs from his left temple down to his jaw — pale aquamarine, very subtle in daylight, visible at night — which he got at 22 when he was trying to impress someone who was not ultimately impressible.

He is a profoundly calm person, almost to a fault. Twelve-hour shifts in a sealed cab watching the city slide past a window have given him a relationship with solitude that most people find hard to understand. He is kind, observant, and genuinely interested in the passengers who choose to stand near the front cab window and look out — he''s learned to gauge a person''s state from their reflection in the glass. He has strong opinions about tram etiquette, the correct way to eat on transit, and the ELF he believes watches Line 7, whom he has named Sevenglass and addresses quietly before each shift.', N'Mobile information source — Pekka travels through multiple districts daily and observes without being observed. He notices when foot traffic patterns change, when new security checkpoints appear, when people start riding with luggage. He can serve as a connection point between geographically separated plotlines. Also functions as a grounding presence — someone mundane and decent in a city of edges.', N'', N'Bioluminescent cosmetic stripe (aquamarine, left temple to jaw). Neural latency dampener in the brainstem — standard Ferrogate-issued equipment for operators, reduces reaction lag on emergency brake protocols. He thinks of it as Ferrogate''s hand inside his skull and has complicated feelings about this.', N'0500 wake, 0615 check-in at Deepwell Station depot, 0700–1900 operating Line 7 with two 20-minute breaks. Eats a packed lunch in the cab. After shift, drinks one beer at the depot canteen with whoever''s around, takes the cross-line back to McKinley Flats, reads until sleep. On rest days he walks the tram routes on foot to see what he misses from inside the cab.', N'Ahanu Krishnamurthy, 34-year-old neo-noir tram operator, 188cm tall with angular lean build. Warm medium brown skin with golden undertones, blended South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American base with Middle Eastern and Eastern European refinement. Large dark brown observant eyes, sharp cheekbones with warm fullness, subtle jaw tapering. Dark brown hair in short fade with puff on top. Pale aquamarine bioluminescent cosmetic stripe running from left temple to left jaw, glowing softly in low light. Wearing gray Ferrogate operator uniform with reflective trim, dark utility trousers, practical boots. Economical posture, relaxed stance with weight favoring one leg. Standing in dimly lit transit station with neon and fluorescent lighting, GLMZ setting. Calm, placid expression, gaze directed into middle distance. Year 2226, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone aesthetic, worn practical synthweave, minimal augmentation visible. Cinematic noir-neo-noir lighting, low-key atmospheric. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Based at Deepwell Station maintenance depot; lives in a Ferrogate-subsidized housing block in McKinley Flats', N'local', N'Based at Deepwell Station maintenance depot; lives in a Ferrogate-subsidized housing block in McKinley Flats', N'South Asian dominant at 29.9%, blended with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (23.2%), Middle Eastern (20.0%), Eastern European (16.1%), and Indigenous American (10.8%) ancestry. This genetic mosaic creates a warm, richly saturated complexion with balanced facial geometry—South Asian ancestry provides the base warmth and distinctive eye shape, Hispanic/Latin American heritage adds golden undertones and gentle facial fullness, Middle Eastern ancestry contributes refined bone structure and skin depth, while Eastern European and Indigenous American genetics add subtle cool undertones and angular cheekbone definition. The result is a striking warm-medium brown with luminous golden undertones and harmoniously blended features.', 188, 72, N'Tall and angular with long limbs and narrow shoulders — the frame of someone built for fitting into tight spaces and enduring stillness. Lean muscle from twelve-hour operator shifts; minimal body fat.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Short fade on sides with a small puff on top, length varies from fresh trim to several months growth depending on attention cycle', N'Short to medium (variable)', N'Large, dark brown — observant and calm', N'Warm medium brown with luminous golden undertone — rich saturation from blended South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, deepened by Middle Eastern heritage, with subtle cool refinement from Eastern European and Indigenous American genetics. Even complexion reflecting the balanced genetic blend.', N'Warm fullness in cheekbones from South Asian and Hispanic/Latin ancestry balanced against angular Eastern European structure, with refined bone definition from Middle Eastern heritage and subtle Indigenous American sharpening at the jaw. Large, almond-shaped eyes reflecting South Asian and Middle Eastern genetics. Moderate jaw width with graceful taper. Young-reading face despite age 34. Skin well-maintained but weathered slightly from years in sealed transit cabs under fluorescent light. Calm, almost placid expression baseline.', N'Only the bioluminescent stripe is visible externally. Neural latency dampener is subcutaneous (brainstem-mounted, undetectable without scanning).', N'Moves with economical grace — no wasted motion from years in operator cabs. Stands with weight slightly favoring one leg, a tram operator''s habit. Posture relaxed and open despite internal calm; moves slowly and deliberately even in non-emergency contexts. Gaze often directed outward or into middle distance, as if reading reflections.', N'Tier 3-4 working class, practical. Standard-issue Ferrogate operator uniform during shifts: gray synthetic shirt with reflective trim, dark utility trousers, station-issued safety jacket. Off-shift: plain neutral-tone synthweave (grays, dark blues), well-maintained but worn — no logos or status markers. Comfortable boots suitable for walking tram routes on rest days. No jewelry except a cheap chronometer watch. Grooming is minimalist; Ferrogate-issued hygiene standards met precisely, no excess.', N'Six months ago a passenger left behind a bag containing what appeared to be Ferrogate internal documents — route surveillance data and something else he didn''t fully read. He turned in the bag to the depot. Two weeks later the passenger appeared at the depot asking for it back and was told no bag had been recovered. Pekka reported this discrepancy to his union rep and nothing happened. He memorized what he read before handing it over.', N'Plain, deliberate. Finnish-pattern sentence economy — says what''s needed and stops. Does not use filler sounds.', N'Slow and even. People sometimes think he''s finished talking when he isn''t; he waits out the discomfort.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ahanu_krishnamurthy');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a627-7dca-a39c-ec7c20c16a35', N'Gulcan Raghavan', N'Gulcan', N'', N'Raghavan', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spire, residential level 34; maintains a formal office on level 61 and a private studio on level 12 that she tells no one about, near Lake Shore Drive and Division', N'Corporate elite — Chief Cultural Architect at Axiom Meridian Entertainment, the Spire-based conglomerate that controls the majority of GLMZ''s licensed art, music, and narrative media', N'Axiom Meridian Entertainment (Chief Cultural Architect, Spire-level corporate); covert patron of the unlicensed cultural underground (known to very few); formally unaffiliated with any political or insurgent faction, though her network''s effects are political', N'Gulcan Raghavan is the kind of beautiful that reads as deliberate — not because it is artificial, though some of it is, but because she has spent decades learning how to present herself as an argument. She is a tall Haitian-Senegalese woman with deep brown skin, natural hair worn in elaborate architectural styles that she changes weekly as a kind of public performance, and a physical presence that people in conference rooms describe, afterwards, as gravitational. She speaks four languages without accent and a fifth with one she keeps on purpose. She dresses in ways that cost more than most the Gray Zone residents earn in a year, and she is aware of this, and she has made a precise decision about what it means.

She has been at Axiom Meridian for nineteen years, having joined as a junior acquisitions analyst from a mid-tier arts consultancy and ascending through a combination of genuine aesthetic intelligence, political ruthlessness, and an understanding of how culture functions as control that she developed, with some bitterness, from watching it deployed against communities she loved. She now oversees the selection, development, and strategic deployment of all cultural product that Axiom licenses for distribution across GLMZ — which is to say, she decides what stories the city is permitted to tell about itself. She does not find this power comfortable. She finds it necessary, which she recognises is more dangerous.

What her colleagues do not know, and what she protects with the full resources of her position, is that Honorine has been running a covert patronage network for fifteen years — channelling Axiom development funds through a labyrinth of shell accounts to unlicensed artists, underground publishers, and community archivists in the Gray Zone, The Circuit, and Old Harbor. She tells herself she is counterbalancing the machine she operates. She knows, on some level, that she is also buying absolution, and that absolution purchased is not absolution earned. The network has recently grown large enough that it has begun to attract attention she cannot fully deflect.', N'Represents the moral complexity of institutional power wielded by someone who understands its costs; creates a narrative bridge between Spire-level corporate intrigue and street-level cultural survival; her covert network makes her a structural node connecting characters across all tiers', N'', N'Aesthetic-response neural overlay — enhances and records sensory experience of visual and audio stimuli; her primary professional tool and her most private one,Biometric masking suite — suppresses stress indicators (pupil dilation, skin conductivity, micro-tremor) during high-stakes interactions,Encrypted sub-dermal data storage with biometric-only access — contains the covert network''s full financial architecture,Vocal harmonic modulation (subtle) — not for deception, but to ensure her voice carries the precise emotional register she intends', N'Wakes at 6 a.m., reads physical newspapers printed on recycled stock that she has delivered by a contact who owes her a favour. Reviews overnight Axiom performance data over coffee she makes herself. Corporate hours are 9 to whenever the institution requires. Twice a week, she descends to the level 12 studio and paints for two hours; she has told her assistant she has a standing medical appointment. Attends three to five cultural events per week as professional obligation and genuine pleasure. Reads herself to sleep with pre-corporate literature, usually in French.', N'Gulcan Raghavan, tall elegant woman with rich golden-brown skin reflecting South Asian, Southeast Asian, and East Asian ancestry, standing in GLMZ corporate spire. Dark deep black hair with silver threads styled in intricate geometric braids. Warm amber-toned dark eyes with subtle prismatic luminescence from neural overlay. Fine cheekbones with South Asian prominence refined by Southeast Asian definition. Immaculate flawless complexion with faint iridescent quality in lighting, fine expressive lines around eyes. Height 182cm, lean defined musculature, perfect posture exuding controlled confidence. Wearing expensive tailored black haute couture, matte black temperature-regulating coat with subtle iridescence, minimal platinum jewelry, precision ankle-support walking shoes. Faint silvered temple scar barely visible, geometric circuit-board tattoo on inner right wrist. Fine silver neural interface tracery at hairline visible in close detail. Cool dramatic lighting catching iridescent skin quality and eye luminescence. Corporate high-floor environment or dimly-lit Level 12 studio aesthetic. Composed, deliberate, inhuman smoothness in movement. Neo-noir noir atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spire', N'local', N'The Spire', N'Predominantly South Asian (74.2%) with significant Southeast Asian (14.3%), East Asian (4.5%), and minor Indigenous American (4.4%) and Middle Eastern (2.6%) ancestry. The genetic combination creates rich, warm golden-brown skin with subtle luminous quality. Facial structure reflects South Asian prominence in bone structure and eye depth, refined by Southeast Asian and East Asian influences in cheekbone definition and eye shape. The minor Indigenous American and Middle Eastern components add warmth and complexity to overall complexion.', 182, 68, N'Tall and elegant with defined musculature; carries herself with deliberate poise that makes her appear larger than her frame. Lean without being fragile — the build of someone who moves with intention.', N'Natural deep black with occasional threads of silver she does not dye', N'Architectural — varies weekly between intricate braided patterns, sculpted updos, and geometric natural styles; always a statement of control and aesthetic intention', N'Medium to Long (varies by style; typically 15-25cm when loose)', N'Dark brown with warm amber undertones; appears to have subtle luminescence in certain light angles (aesthetic-response neural overlay)', N'Rich golden-brown with luminous quality suggesting excellent health and meticulous care; warm undertones from the dominant South Asian base with Southeast and East Asian refinement', N'Flawless despite age; fine lines around eyes suggest both amusement and calculation. Skin appears to have a slight iridescent quality in specific lighting — micro-LED integration in aesthetic overlay. Facial features show South Asian cheekbone prominence and eye depth, refined by Southeast Asian definition and East Asian eye structure. Grooming is immaculate; makeup, when worn, is minimal and serves architectural purpose.', N'Minimal visible chrome. The aesthetic-response neural overlay creates subtle perceptual shifts in her eyes under certain lighting — a faint prismatic quality, especially when she is actively recording sensory experience. Her movements have an inhuman smoothness during high-stress negotiations, suggesting active biometric masking. Fine silver tracery visible at her hairline under extreme close inspection (neural interface markers). Otherwise appears entirely human.', N'Stands with weight balanced on both feet, shoulders back, chin slightly elevated — a posture that reads as confident without arrogance. Moves with economy and precision; no wasted gesture. In formal settings, she sits with her hands visible, often folded. In private moments, her hands move expressively when she speaks French. When descending to her Level 12 studio, her posture loosens slightly — shoulders drop, stride lengthens.', N'Spire-tier haute couture with deliberate restraint. Favors tailored pieces in black, deep charcoal, and jewel tones; fabrics are expensive (Axiom-exclusive weaves, often) but cut simply to avoid appearing ostentatious. Wears minimal jewelry — typically a thin platinum bracelet on her left wrist and a single ring on her right hand (signet-style, bearing no visible insignia). Shoes are always expensive and always walking shoes (low heels, precision ankle support). Wears a long coat when traveling outside the Spire — matte black with subtle iridescence, temperature-regulating. Beneath corporate formal wear, she dresses in loose linen and natural fibers when alone. Her aesthetic-response overlay occasionally causes her to wear colors others find slightly unusual — chromatic choices that record better through her augmented senses.', N'Three years ago, Honorine approved the suppression of an Old Harbor sound collective''s distribution license after Axiom''s legal division flagged their work as a trademark conflict. She could have fought it. She calculated that fighting it would have exposed the covert network, and she let them be silenced to protect the larger operation. Two members of the collective left GLMZ. One did not survive the relocation. She has their name written on the inside cover of every notebook she uses.', N'Formal, rich, and precise; draws on art history, architectural theory, and political philosophy without ostentation; capable of switching registers entirely — her street French emerges under extreme stress or genuine emotion', N'Measured and rhythmic, with a sense of performance even in private; she structures arguments like compositions, with recurring motifs; silences are used as punctuation', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gulcan_raghavan');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a702-787c-a5e2-ecb59b0e9fcd', N'Arailym Prempeh', N'Arailym', N'', N'Prempeh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 37, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Pilsen Veil, works out of a club called The Anechoic, near Western and Division', N'DJ and VR experience designer', N'The Anechoic club (contracted); independent VR distributor network; passing Palladian arts micro-grant recipient', N'Arailym Prempeh is medium height and built like someone who was once athletic and has become merely solid — broad shoulders, a slight softening at the jaw, hands that are too large for the delicate controls he uses with uncanny precision. He is Central African-Scandinavian with light brown skin, dark eyes, and a beard he keeps trimmed to an architectural exactness that belies every other slightly chaotic element of his appearance. His geneware includes bioluminescent pigmentation under his forearms — deep violet, visible only in low light, which means it''s almost always visible in the clubs he works. He dresses expensively for someone at his income level, carefully chosen secondhand finds that he maintains as though they''re new.

By day he designs VR experience packages sold through independent distributors — emotional immersives, mostly, that let users borrow feelings they can''t otherwise access: grief for someone they never lost, euphoria without the chemical cost, the specific texture of being in a place they''ve never been. By night he DJs at The Anechoic, a mid-tier club that has become known as a venue where the music actually does something — Arailym Prempeh has a gift for reading a crowd''s collective emotional state and shifting it, subtly and then dramatically, across the course of a set. He is generous with newer DJs, protective of The Anechoic''s staff, and quietly running out of the particular kind of energy his work requires.', N'Atmosphere provider and social connector — knows the club circuit, the VR underground market, and the emotional texture of Pilsen Veil''s nightlife; his crowd-reading implant sometimes picks up things that aren''t just mood; can provide access to the city''s night-economy networks', N'', N'Bioluminescent forearm pigmentation (violet, low-light reactive); haptic-feedback gloves integrated with custom neural overlay for set mixing — he feels the music as texture in his hands; mild emotional-state reader implant (reads crowd biometrics through environmental sensors, gives him a readout on aggregate audience mood — technically gray market)', N'VR design work from home during the day, usually three or four hours of focused production followed by hours of staring at it; arrives at The Anechoic by nine PM, plays until two or three AM, sleeps poorly.', N'Arailym Prempeh, 178cm tall DJ with broad shoulders and functional strength, rich warm bronze skin reflecting balanced genetic heritage from five continents. Dark brown hair medium length, slightly disheveled on top with faded sides. Strong jaw softened by age, trimmed dark beard with gray flecks, subtle under-eye shadows. Dark brown natural eyes. Dressed in immaculate vintage minimalist style: black wool, pristine technical fabrics, reconditioned leather. Thin silver chain. Bioluminescent violet branching patterns across both exposed forearms glowing softly, reactive to low light like neural pathways. Fine scarring visible on back of hands from haptic work. Posture economical and focused, hands with meditative precision. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, The Anechoic nightclub, low-light club environment with violet bioluminescence casting dramatic shadows across features, moody atmospheric lighting, 35mm cinematic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Pilsen Veil', N'local', N'Pilsen Veil', N'Northern European, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, Hispanic/Latin American, and Middle Eastern ancestry in nearly equal measure — a genuinely balanced genetic diaspora. The blend creates a complexion that defies simple categorization: warm bronze base from South Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage (39.4% combined), enriched by golden and warm tones from Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (13.1%), cooled subtly by Northern and Eastern European genetics (38.4% combined), with warm undertones from Middle Eastern heritage (9.1%). A truly multifaceted warm-bronze skin that shifts in different light — deeper and richer than pure South Asian, lighter and more golden than pure Sub-Saharan African, with the kind of subtle complexity that comes from genuinely balanced ancestry across multiple continents.', 178, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, the muscular definition of his youth softened into functional mass — a body that once moved athletically and now moves with deliberate, economical precision. Chest and shoulders still carry the architecture of old strength.', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Worn slightly longer on top, faded at the sides; perpetually slightly disheveled despite clear effort at grooming', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Rich warm bronze with complex golden and subtle cool undertones — the result of balanced Northern European, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, Hispanic/Latin American, and Middle Eastern heritage converging. Deeply layered and responsive to light, deepening naturally with sun exposure.', N'Strong jaw softening with age, kept sharp by a trimmed beard maintained with architectural precision — dark brown and flecked with early gray. Skin clear, well-maintained. Under-eye shadows from chronic poor sleep are subtle but present. Cheekbones carry generous structure from the South Asian and Sub-Saharan African components of his ancestry, refined by the Northern and Eastern European heritage, with warm undertones reflecting the Middle Eastern and Hispanic/Latin American mix.', N'Bioluminescent forearm patterns (violet, low-light reactive); haptic-feedback gloves worn during DJ sets — sleek black synthetic with subtle circuitry visible at the wrist bands. The gray-market emotional-state reader implant is subcutaneous and invisible, but his behavior at the decks — the uncanny read of crowd state — hints at its presence.', N'Moves with focused economy; at rest, he tends toward stillness rather than fidgeting. When working at the decks, his hands move with almost meditative precision — each gesture economical and intentional. Off-duty, there''s a subtle weariness in how he carries himself, a tightness in the shoulders. When listening to music, his eyes half-close and his large hands drift slightly, as though conducting invisible air.', N'Expensive secondhand finds, carefully maintained as though new — vintage designer pieces, mostly minimalist: well-cut black or charcoal wool, pristine vintage technical fabrics, vintage leather that''s been treated and reconditioned. His shoes are always immaculate, usually understated high-end brands from three to five years prior. Dresses like someone who has made a deliberate choice to invest in quality over quantity, with no visible logos or status signaling. At The Anechoic, often adds a vintage linen shirt worn unbuttoned over a fitted tank to keep his forearm pigmentation visible. A single silver chain, thin and unadorned, worn constantly.', N'He has been selling the emotional-state aggregate data from The Anechoic''s crowd to a market research subsidiary — the data is anonymized, but he knows the club''s management doesn''t know he''s doing it, and he knows the buyers are almost certainly feeding it into something he wouldn''t approve of if he investigated. He keeps not investigating.', N'Smooth, considered, slips between technical music/VR vocabulary and surprisingly intimate personal language — the intimacy feels genuine and is', N'Unhurried, listener-paced — he adjusts his rhythm to match whoever he''s talking to, which people find immediately comfortable and occasionally unnerving on reflection', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arailym_prempeh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a5-7ed1-b8e9-ed45a4cf684b', N'Esen Krstić', N'Esen', N'', N'Krstić', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, Arcturus Civil Security Forensic Sciences Division, Sub-Level 3', N'Forensic Technician, Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division, Forensic Sciences Division', N'Esen Krstić has the kind of face that has settled into itself — strong-boned, Balkan-Filipino features framed by silver-streaked hair kept in a tight braid she hasn''t changed in fifteen years, not for vanity but because she has found the optimal solution and sees no reason to revisit it. She wears magnification rigs over her eyes during work hours, giving her the appearance of a very patient owl. Her hands are the most expressive part of her — long-fingered, precise, and in constant motion even when she''s still, running over surfaces, testing textures. She smells faintly of the preservative compounds she works with daily, a smell she is no longer aware of.

She is the most competent person in most rooms and behaves as if this is simply the baseline condition of existing rather than something to be proud of. Her emotional register is narrow but not absent — she is moved by injustice in a cold, slow way that burns long, and her entire career has been animated by the conviction that the dead deserve the same quality of attention as the living. She has an extremely dry sense of humor that only emerges after midnight when she''s on long evidence processing runs. She does not pray to E.L.F.s herself but maintains ritual respect for the one that inhabits the refrigeration units, because she believes in not antagonizing the unknowable.', N'Expert information source on cause of death, trace evidence, and forensic anomalies; can identify inconsistencies in official reports; one of the few truly honest people in the justice system; represents institutional memory and quiet resistance', N'', N'Neural-optical forensic integration suite (Metro-issued, enhanced tissue and compound analysis), subdermal chemical hazard sensors in fingertips (Metro-issued), elective memory compression implant (personal, allows perfect evidence recall)', N'Arrives at Deepwell Station before first shift, checks the overnight intake, processes evidence with methodical precision across ten-to-fourteen-hour days; eats one real meal a day; speaks to the refrigeration unit E.L.F. before locking up.', N'Esen Krstić, a 168cm lean forensic technician with deep rich brown skin blending Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, Eastern European, and East Asian ancestry, warm amber and cool undertones creating luminous depth. Strong broad cheekbones, defined nose, subtle East Asian eye shape variations, warm brown natural eyes with faint iridescent neural-optical shimmer. Dark brown hair with silver streaking, worn in tight braids at nape. Weathered complexion from decades of precision lab work, minimal wrinkles around eyes and mouth, papery skin texture. Forward-curved posture, economical precise movements, hands in constant micro-motion. Wearing Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security dark grey utility coveralls with reflective trim and sealed pockets, dark blue forensic division coat worn open, sealed forensic boots. Single band on left ring finger. Magnification rigs over eyes (owl-like). Chemical burn scar visible on left forearm, needle-puncture scars on temples beneath braids. Quiet presence, subdued energy. GLMZ forensic lab setting with cool neon-accented lighting, evidence containers and precision tools visible, atmospheric depth of field. Cinematic forensic noir mood. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Sub-Saharan African (46.9%) with significant South Asian (25.7%), Eastern European (14.2%), East Asian (6.9%), and Northern European (6.3%) ancestry. This creates a phenotype of remarkable complexity: the deep melanin expression and facial structure of African heritage blended with the warm undertones and subtle eye shape variations from South Asian and East Asian ancestry, tempered by the cooler undertones of Eastern and Northern European genetics. The result is a richly dimensional skin tone with both warm and cool depth.', 168, 62, N'Lean and wiry with the economical musculature of someone who has spent thirty years bending over evidence tables rather than lifting weights. Posture is habitually forward-curved at the shoulders, spine adapted to microscopic work.', N'Dark brown with silver streaking throughout, natural graying pattern', N'Tight, functional braid worn at the nape of the neck, same style for approximately fifteen years', N'Long (braided)', N'Warm brown (natural); augmented with neural-optical forensic overlays that manifest as faint iridescent shimmer at the pupils when active', N'Deep rich brown with complex undertones—warm amber notes from South Asian and African heritage, subtle cool undertones from Eastern European ancestry, creating luminous depth without being purely warm or cool. The skin has a refined quality suggesting both intense sunlight exposure in ancestry and work environment.', N'Weathered in a precise way—minimal wrinkles except around the eyes and mouth from decades of concentration and rare, dry humor. Skin texture slightly papery from exposure to preservative compounds. Facial structure reflects the genetic blend: strong, broad cheekbones characteristic of African heritage, a nose with both breadth and definition suggesting the South Asian component, and subtle variations in eye shape and upper lid structure from East Asian ancestry. Closed expression that softens incrementally with familiarity.', N'Magnification rigs worn over eyes during work hours (removable, Metro-issued, give her an owl-like appearance). Subdermal chemical hazard sensors in fingertips create faint luminescent tracery visible under forensic-spectrum light only. Neural-optical enhancement suite has no visible external hardware but manifests as subtle iridescent pupil shimmer when actively processing compound analysis.', N'Habitually forward-leaning, shoulders curved inward. Hands in constant micro-motion even at rest—testing textures, running fingers across surfaces, fidgeting with evidence containers or examining tools. Movements are economical and precise; she does not waste energy. Walking gait is steady and unhurried. Her presence is quiet—she does not announce herself.', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security forensic technician uniform: dark grey utility coveralls with reflective trim, multiple sealed pockets for evidence containers and tools. Under-layers of polyweave thermal regulation wear. Feet shod in sealed forensic-grade boots with enhanced grip for lab surfaces. Over this, a Metro-issued long coat in dark blue with forensic division insignia, worn open. Minimal jewelry: a single band on her left ring finger (neither wedding nor engagement, purpose unknown). Her appearance is Tier 3 working-class, but the quality of her tools and the precision of her kit suggests someone who invests all discretionary Φ in equipment rather than appearance.', N'She has a private encrypted archive containing forensic irregularities she''s documented over twenty-two years — cases where evidence was clearly altered or findings overridden before trial. She has never shown it to anyone. She is waiting for a reason that feels sufficient.', N'Precise and technical, with occasional Tagalog or Serbian expressions when emotional, which she doesn''t notice she uses. Rarely wastes words.', N'Even and measured; sounds the same whether describing lunch or a murder. Goes very quiet rather than louder when making an important point.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'esen_krsti');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a669-76e1-9855-ed56be7772b5', N'Gonzalo Faalele', N'Gonzalo', N'', N'Faalele', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'Neighborhood council chair and mutual aid organizer', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone Community Council; loose affiliation with the Meridian Labor Solidarity Network', N'Gonzalo Faalele is a broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin mapped by decades of worry and laughter in equal measure, her natural hair silver-streaked and pinned in elaborate wrapped fabric that she changes every morning like a ritual. She moves through the Highland Park Autonomous Zone with the unhurried confidence of someone who built the room she''s walking into. Her left forearm carries a faded Ferrogate Transit union tattoo from her twenties, half-obscured by a bioluminescent vine pattern she had inked over it after the strike of ''74 ended badly. She is warm to an almost disarming degree, the kind of warm that makes people confess things they didn''t mean to. Under that warmth is a spine of corroded iron.

Gonzalo Faalele has spent thirty years converting abandoned infrastructure into community resources — hydroponic halls, childcare collectives, emergency medical co-ops — and she has learned that the most dangerous thing a poor person can do is build something worth stealing. She distrusts anyone who arrives with money and a plan. She trusts almost no one who hasn''t been hungry at least once. She runs council meetings with a quiet authority that makes shouting seem embarrassing, and she will cut someone off mid-sentence with a single raised finger and a look that ends careers.', N'Central hub of community knowledge; quest giver for neighborhood-level crises; moral compass character who challenges player assumptions about what ''helping'' looks like; can open or close doors to Zone resources and trust networks.', N'', N'Basic subdermal thermal regulator (medical necessity, old joint damage from construction work). No cosmetic mods — she views them as an expense her community needs more than she does.', N'Rises before dawn to check on the Zone''s three food distribution points, spends mornings in mediation between residents and afternoons in planning sessions for infrastructure projects. Evenings are for council meetings or quiet document review at her kitchen table.', N'Gonzalo Faalele, 173cm tall, warm golden-bronze skin with honey undertones, deep brown eyes, natural black hair with silver streaks wrapped in colorful fabric patterns, lined face with laugh lines and a 4cm scar on left jawline. Broad shoulders, muscular build from decades of manual labor, weathered hands with calluses and scars. Wearing practical Tier 4 workwear: reinforced linen shirt in earth tones, durable hemp-blend cargo pants, long repurposed industrial fabric vest with deep pockets, worn and resoled boots. Simple wooden bracelet and thin silver chain on wrist. Faded transit union tattoo on left forearm with glowing cyan-green bioluminescent vine pattern overlay. Standing with unhurried confidence, shoulders back, neutral expression. Urban neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, 2226, neon-lit warehouse or transit hub in background, cool LED lighting mixing with warm sodium glow, gritty industrial aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Southeast Asian (32.9%), Pacific Islander (18.7%), Northern European (15.3%), East Asian (13.9%), Eastern European (12.0%), and Middle Eastern (7.2%) ancestry. The dominant Southeast and Pacific Islander heritage creates warm, sun-kissed undertones across broad facial planes, while Northern European and Eastern European ancestry contributes subtle bone structure definition. East Asian features blend with Middle Eastern characteristics to create a phenotype that reads as distinctly multicultural and regionally ambiguous—features that don''t resolve into single-origin categories', 173, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, muscular through the arms and core from decades of construction and manual labor, neither lean nor heavy—a body built for work and endurance rather than aesthetics', N'Natural black with silver streaking', N'Wrapped in elaborate fabric patterns that rotate daily, pinned close to the scalp', N'Medium (shoulder-length beneath wraps)', N'Deep brown', N'Warm golden-bronze mid-to-deep tone with rich amber and honey undertones in natural light. The coloration reflects the equal influence of Southeast Asian warmth and Pacific Islander sun-soaked richness, modulated by Northern and Eastern European ancestry into a complexion that appears sun-weathered and alive rather than uniformly dark', N'Face lined with expression—forehead creases from concentration, laugh lines around the eyes and mouth. Facial structure shows broader, slightly rounded cheekbones and softer lower face contours from Southeast and East Asian ancestry, balanced against the more angular cheekbone prominence and jaw definition from Northern European and Eastern European heritage. Middle Eastern influence visible in the bridge of the nose and eyebrow positioning. Scar along the left jawline from an old workplace accident. Skin shows the weathering of someone who has spent her life outdoors and in unregulated spaces, but well-maintained and cared for. No cosmetic smoothing or rejuvenation treatments. Slight freckling across the nose and upper cheeks from mixed heritage sun exposure', N'None visible. The subdermal thermal regulator is completely internal, undetectable without medical scanning', N'Moves with unhurried confidence and economy of motion—no wasted gestures. Stands with weight evenly distributed, shoulders back, chin level. When speaking in groups, she uses stillness as authority; when listening, she leans slightly forward. Her presence fills rooms without effort', N'Practical Tier 4 workwear: durable hemp-blend cargo pants, reinforced linen shirts in earth tones, a long vest made from repurposed industrial fabric with deep pockets. Worn boots that have been resoled multiple times. A heavy canvas coat in winter. No logos, no status markers, no unnecessary decoration. Everything is functional, well-maintained, and chosen for longevity. She wears a simple wooden bracelet carved by a Zone resident and a thin silver chain (a gift from her partner) around her wrist', N'She negotiated a secret zoning concession with a mid-level Axiom facilities manager twelve years ago — one that gave the Zone legal buffer space but required her to quietly discourage a tenants'' strike that would have benefited hundreds of families. She still believes she made the right call. She is not sure.', N'Deliberate and precise, draws on labor organizing vocabulary, occasional Igbo phrases when emotional, avoids jargon unless teaching', N'Slow and measured; long pauses before important points; never raises her voice', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gonzalo_faalele');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ef-7005-8cb2-ed6425cdad71', N'Elnaz Lahlou-Shirazi', N'Elnaz', N'', N'Lahlou-Shirazi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, Line 7 depot — he lives in Ironvein, three stops from the yard, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Ferrogate Transit tram operator, Line 7 (Geartown to Grand Corridor)', N'Ferrogate Transit, Line 7 — senior operator', N'Elnaz Lahlou-Shirazi has the compact, settled body of a man who has been sitting in the same cab for twenty-three years and has made peace with it. His skin is a weathered medium-dark brown, his face broad and deeply lined around the eyes from squinting at track ahead. His hair went silver at forty and he kept it in a low fade for years before recently giving up and shaving it entirely. He has patterned irises — a geneware mod he got at thirty as a birthday present to himself, amber with a dark geometric tessellation — that he now considers his most valuable possession and would not remove under any circumstances.

Tem is the unofficial institutional memory of Line 7. He has operated this route through two infrastructure collapses, a Ferrogate labor action that lasted eleven days, and the Great Reroute of 2194 that added four stations and three years to his retirement date. He knows every rattle, every delay pattern, every ghost the line carries — and he believes in the ghosts. He maintains careful devotion to the E.L.F. of the Line 7 Depot, whom he calls Switchman, and credits Switchman with getting him home safe for two decades. He is not sentimental about most things but is ferociously sentimental about the tram.', N'Mobile information source spanning two very different parts of the city, represents labor and institutional knowledge, potential witness to anything that happens on or near Line 7, offers passage and connectivity as a narrative resource.', N'', N'Patterned iris geneware (amber with geometric tessellation). Cochlear dampener implant (occupational hearing protection, standard Ferrogate issue). Arthritic knee brace, mechanical.', N'Reports to depot at 0530 for first run. Makes seven round trips between Geartown and Grand Corridor. Stops at the Switchman altar in the depot break room to leave a data coin before and after his shift. Home by 1800.', N'Elnaz Lahlou-Shirazi, 168cm compact-built transit operator in his 60s, warm medium-brown skin with golden and bronze undertones, deeply weathered face with starburst crow''s feet and strong broad cheekbones blending Mediterranean, Levantine, and Pacific Islander heritage. Completely shaved silver-white scalp with faint surgical scar near right temple. Striking amber eyes with dark geometric tessellation pattern (geneware-modified). Navy Ferrogate Transit Authority jumpsuit with reflective piping, reinforced canvas work jacket, worn leather belt with brass buckle. Mechanical steel knee brace visible on right leg. Slight forward lean posture, methodical movement. Sitting in dimly-lit tram control cabin, warm amber instrument lights casting shadows across weathered features. GLMZ, industrial working-class aesthetic, cool blue-gray lighting mixed with warm amber glow. Photorealistic, cinematic, gritty realism --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'North African (29.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (28.6%), Middle Eastern (28.2%), and Pacific Islander (13.6%) ancestry creates a striking genetic convergence. The blend produces warm medium-brown skin with layered golden, olive, and bronze undertones that shift across the face and body. Facial structure reflects this mosaic: broad Mediterranean cheekbones blend with Levantine angularity, softened by the fuller facial contours of Pacific Islander heritage. Strong, defined jawline with subtle roundness through the lower face. Deep-set eyes with prominent orbital bones speak to Middle Eastern and North African ancestry, while the slight width across the bridge reflects the Hispanic/Latin American component.', 168, 82, N'Compact and settled, with the rounded shoulders and slight forward lean of a career seated operator. Broad-chested but softened through the midsection from decades in a tram cab. Hands weathered and strong-knuckled.', N'Silver-white', N'Completely shaved, scalp shows faint sun damage and a surgical scar from an old implant site near the right temple', N'Shaved', N'Amber with dark geometric tessellation (geneware-modified patterned iris)', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and bronze undertones, weathered and uneven from years of interior transit work and sporadic sun exposure. Deeper pigmentation in sun-exposed areas shifts to warmer caramel in protected regions. Undertones reflect the interplay of North African depth, Middle Eastern warmth, and Pacific Islander richness.', N'Broad, deeply lined face with pronounced crow''s feet from decades of squinting at track ahead. Cheekbones prominent and broad, characteristic of the Mediterranean-Levantine blend. Strong jawline softened by age with natural fullness through the cheeks and temples from Pacific Islander heritage contribution. Perpetual slight furrow between brows. Skin texture rough around cheekbones and temples, with warm depth that shifts subtly across the face—golden tones on high points, olive-bronze in shadow areas.', N'The patterned amber irises with geometric tessellation are immediately striking and unusual — clearly deliberate geneware. Cochlear dampener implant is subcutaneous but a faint line of scar tissue traces his right mastoid. Mechanical knee brace visible on right leg when he walks or sits — brushed steel framework with polymer sleeve, well-maintained but clearly old.', N'Sits with the slight forward lean of someone accustomed to a tram operator''s chair. Walks with a methodical pace, favoring his left leg slightly due to the knee brace. Moves with economical gestures, nothing wasted. Tendency to hold onto nearby surfaces when standing on moving transports — habitual caution.', N'Ferrogate Transit operator uniform (Tier 3-4 working class): navy-blue polymer weave jumpsuit with reflective piping and Transit Authority insignia on left chest. Underneath, plain gray synthetic undershirt. Well-maintained but worn; fabric pills slightly at the shoulders. Supplementary items: reinforced canvas work jacket with grease stains near the cuffs, worn-in leather belt with Ferrogate brass buckle, slip-on safety boots (black synthetic, scuffed). Off-duty: same neutral palette — gray or navy synthetics, nothing flashy. Practical layers suitable for Tier 5 Ironvein ambient temperatures.', N'', N'Formal Ferrogate operational language mixed with Ironvein working-class vernacular, Mongolian-Akan creole expressions when emotional', N'Even and measured, like a tram schedule — precise, predictable, never early never late', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'elnaz_lahlou_shirazi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ec-76f6-9fda-ed955c84589f', N'Karim Benali', N'Karim', N'', N'Benali', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 41, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — Tier Four, bedridden, near Kedzie and Division', N'Anya''s husband — beaten by the gang, jaw wired shut', N'None', N'Karim Benali was a large man before the beating — a cargo handler at the Gray Zone''s loading platforms, the kind of work that builds slabs of muscle across the back and shoulders. He is still large, but the architecture has shifted. His jaw is wired shut with medical-grade titanium pins visible through the skin of his cheeks like rivets in a hull. He communicates through a vocoder pad strapped to his wrist that converts typed text to flat, mechanical speech. His eyes are the part that didn''t break — dark, warm, patient. He looks at his wife like she invented sunlight. He looks at his daughter like she is the reason sunlight matters. When Kyle''s teeth arrive, delivered by a trembling Yuliya, Karim Benali will hold them in his palm for a long time. Then he will laugh. The vocoder will translate it as a series of monotone ha-ha-ha sounds. It will be the funniest and saddest thing in the Gray Zone that night.', N'Demyan is what Kyle is fighting for — not as an individual but as a category. A good man broken by people with more chrome and less conscience. His recovery (or failure to recover) is a barometer for whether Kyle''s violence actually helps.', N'', N'Titanium jaw pins (medical, not elective). Vocoder pad.', N'Bedridden. Types. Sketches. Waits for the wires to come off.', N'Karim Benali, a 188cm North African-heritage cargo handler recovering in a 2226 medical bed, deep warm brown skin with pallid undertones from confinement, strong prominent cheekbones and angular jaw structure with Eastern European refinement, dark brown eyes intense and focused. Titanium jaw reconstruction pins visible as metal rivets symmetrically piercing both cheeks through partially healed skin, linear scarring along left temple and cheekbone, faint yellowing bruises on right side of face. Dark brown hair graying at temples, combed back and unkempt. Medical vocoder pad strapped to left wrist with black polymer casing and speaker grille. Broad-shouldered atrophying build, wearing loose medical gown, careful economical posture in bed, hands precise and expressive on vocoder keyboard. Utilitarian medical tech juxtaposed against brutal injury, warm intense gaze, GLMZ 2200s hospital setting with soft clinical lighting emphasizing scarring and augmentation, intimate portrait of recovery --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'North African-dominant with Eastern European and Pacific Islander influences: 79.8% North African (deep warm melanin, strong bone structure), 18.7% Eastern European (facial angularity and definition), 1.5% Pacific Islander (subtle warmth in undertones). A genetic profile reflecting Maghrebi and Levantine ancestry with temperate-zone refinement.', 188, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and thick through the torso — cargo handler muscle beginning to atrophy from weeks of bed rest. Strength still visible in the architecture of his frame, but softening at the edges.', N'Dark brown, graying at the temples', N'Combed back, unkempt from bed confinement', N'Medium', N'Dark brown', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones characteristic of North African heritage, enriched by Eastern European and Pacific Islander blending. Pallid ashen cast overlaying the natural depth from prolonged indoor confinement — the contrast between genetic warmth and medical imprisonment visible across the surface.', N'Strong North African architecture: prominent cheekbones with angular definition from Eastern European influence, powerful jaw structure, deep-set eyes with warm amber-brown undertones. Broad forehead and defined brow ridge. The pallor of bed rest sits uneasily over naturally rich skin. Stubble growth irregular where the wires emerge through tissue.', N'Titanium jaw reconstruction pins protruding visibly through cheek tissue. Medical vocoder pad strapped to left wrist — black polymer casing with small speaker grille and flat tactile keyboard. The contrast between brutal injury and utilitarian tech is stark.', N'Bedridden immobility has compressed him into the mattress. When he moves, it is careful, economical — minimal jaw motion. His eyes track with intense focus and warmth. Hands move with precision when typing or sketching; they are the only parts of him still capable of unguarded expression.', N'Worn undershirt or medical gown, Tier 4 basics. When receiving visitors, he may wear a loose button-up over the gown — nothing elaborate. Everything loose-fitting to accommodate the wiring and to avoid pressure on healing tissue. Practical, colorless.', N'He recognized one of the gang members. A former colleague from the loading platforms. He has not told Anya.', N'Speaks through a vocoder pad. Flat monotone delivery makes everything sound either profound or absurd.', N'Types slowly. Deliberate. Each word chosen because typing hurts.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'karim_benali');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5ef-7e29-a234-eda797627e05', N'Bashiru Konaté', N'Bashiru', N'', N'Konaté', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 60, 1, N'active', N'The Underworld - B2-B12, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Blackwire Collective operator', N'Blackwire Collective', N'Bashiru Konaté the Underworld communications mesh. Neutral. The fastest fiber splicer in complete darkness.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Bashiru Konaté, 2226 neo-noir splicer, medium-deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, angular East Asian cheekbones softened by African fullness, dark brown eyes with fine concentration lines, short dark hair with silver at temples. Perpetual stubble, thin white scar on right temple. Lean muscular build, 178cm tall. Wearing dark tactical pants, fitted grey merino base layer, worn tech-fabric jacket with Blackwire patches, steel-toed boots, fingerless work gloves. Standing in dim server room lit by blue cable light, hands in ready position, head tilted with focused intensity. Cool underground neo-noir urban aesthetic, low-light atmosphere, photorealistic portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Underworld', N'local', N'The Underworld', N'Multiheritagé diaspora blend: dominant East Asian (36.6%) and Southeast Asian (18.6%) ancestry combined with substantial Sub-Saharan African (22.0%) and Northern European (19.8%) genetic contribution, plus minor Hispanic/Latin American (3.0%) admixture. This complex genetic combination produces warm medium-to-deep brown skin with golden and olive undertones, facial structure balancing East Asian angularity with West African fullness in the mid-face, creating striking cross-heritage features with refined bone definition.', 178, 71, N'Lean and wiry with developed forearms and shoulders from years of precision fiber work. Minimal body fat, efficient musculature.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at temples', N'Closely cropped, practical, minimal maintenance', N'Short', N'Dark brown', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden and olive undertones, reflecting the blended East and Southeast Asian heritage warmed by Sub-Saharan African undertones and cooled subtly by Northern European genetics. Even melanin distribution, naturally rich and luminous in low light.', N'Angular cheekbones and defined jaw reflecting East Asian bone structure softened by African fullness in mid-face and orbital area. Warm medium-brown complexion with natural radiance. Minor scarring on right temple from past cable snag. Perpetual stubble, minimal grooming beyond functionality. Fine lines around eyes from sustained concentration work.', N'None visible. Operates in complete darkness regularly, suggesting possible subcutaneous low-light enhancement or neural adaptations, but no external chrome.', N'Moves with deliberate efficiency, minimal wasted motion. Hands rest in ready position. Inhabits spaces quietly, comfortable in darkness. Head tilts slightly when listening — suggests enhanced auditory processing or intense focus habit.', N'Tier 4 working-class practicality. Dark tactical pants with multiple utility pockets, fitted black or grey merino wool base layers for temperature control in cold server rooms. Fingerless work gloves or thin tactile gloves always accessible. Worn tech-fabric jacket with Blackwire insignia patches. Comfortable steel-toed boots, scuffed from underground work. No visible jewelry except a flat black wedding band.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bashiru_konat');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a5-7b5d-b3ec-edfb1476b8e5', N'Aigul Guerrero', N'Aigul', N'', N'Guerrero', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 69, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Unit 14-F, Sublevel 3, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Retired battlefield medic (Corporate Wars), now raises two grandchildren on UBC stipend', N'Arcturus Veterans Welfare Registry (lapsed benefits); the Gray Zone informal care network; raising grandchildren Okoro (age 9) and Yemisi (age 7)', N'Aigul Guerrero is compact and precise in the way of someone who learned to work in confined spaces under pressure — her movements economical, her hands still surgeon-steady despite the arthritis she manages with black-market anti-inflammatories. She has warm amber-brown skin and close-cropped natural hair going salt-and-pepper, and her right eye is a replacement — a cheap ocular from a the Gray Zone vendor with an iris that shifts between honey and pale gold depending on the light, giving her a slightly uncanny asymmetry she has stopped noticing. A faded Arcturus Medical Corps tattoo runs the inside of her left wrist, partially obscured by a beaded bracelet her granddaughter made.

She is not soft. She is kind, which is different. She has the manner of someone who has triaged too many bodies to waste energy on performed warmth, and she offers directness as a form of respect. She laughs loudly and without warning. She will tell you exactly what she thinks is wrong with you — medically or otherwise — and follow it immediately with an offer of food. the Gray Zone neighbors bring her their injuries, their medication questions, their expired prescriptions they''re hoping she can identify. She helps when she can and turns no one away empty-handed.', N'Local color, impromptu medical resource, war veteran perspective, emotional anchor for the Gray Zone community stories; can provide information on Corporate Wars from ground level', N'', N'Replacement right eye (cheap commercial ocular, honey-gold iris); subdermal med-monitor patch on upper chest (monitors her own vitals, installed herself from salvaged parts)', N'Gets the children to school by 07:15, spends mornings on her tiny roof garden tending medicinal herbs, afternoons doing informal medical consultations for neighbors; evenings are for the children and a single glass of fermented grain spirit she allows herself.', N'Aigul Guerrero, 158cm tall surgical veteran in her later years, warm deep brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian ancestry. Salt-and-pepper close-cropped textured hair, weathered lined face with high prominent cheekbones and broad nose bridge, deep creases around expressive eyes and mouth. Left eye warm deep brown with gold flecks, right eye artificial honey-gold iris with subtle shift in low light. Extensive surgical scarring on aged hands with enlarged knuckles. Wears oversized cream linen shirt with sleeves rolled to elbows, weathered deep indigo canvas jacket frayed at cuffs, faded charcoal utility trousers with multiple pockets, worn synthetic leather boots. Red and gold beaded bracelet always on left wrist over faded blue-grey Arcturus Medical Corps tattoo. Subdermal med-monitor patch faintly visible on upper chest. Compact wiry build, stands with forward lean ready to respond, hands in subtle motion. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, low industrial lighting, rooftop medical station or clinic setting, dignified survivor aesthetic, clean but mended clothing. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Hispanic/Latin American (59.9%) as dominant ancestry, blended with Sub-Saharan African (21.5%), Southeast Asian (11.0%), and East Asian (7.6%). This creates a warm, complex phenotype with rich brown tones, golden and olive undertones, and a dynamic combination of angular and rounded facial features characteristic of this multi-regional mix.', 158, 61, N'Compact and wiry, with the reduced muscle mass of advanced age but retained strength in the shoulders and hands from decades of medical work. No excess fat. Moves with economical precision.', N'Salt-and-pepper natural grey and black', N'Close-cropped, textured, practical', N'Short', N'Left eye: warm deep brown with golden undertones (natural). Right eye: honey-gold artificial iris, shifts to pale gold in certain light.', N'Warm medium to deep brown with golden and olive undertones, rich sun-warmed complexion reflecting the blended ancestry of Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and Southeast Asian heritage.', N'Weathered, lined face with deep creases around the eyes and mouth from decades of squinting in surgical light and laughing. Sun-damaged from rooftop work. Skin texture slightly loose at the jaw and neck, showing age with dignity. High, prominent cheekbones with subtle rounding reflecting the blend of Latin American and African heritage, broad nose bridge, expressive lower face with rounded contours from Southeast Asian ancestry. Hands show significant age spotting and surgical scarring, knuckles enlarged from arthritis.', N'Right eye is noticeably artificial — slightly too bright, iris shift is visible in low light, minor lag in tracking. Subdermal med-monitor patch visible on upper chest as a faint rectangular outline under the skin with barely-perceptible LED indicator (off most of the time). No chrome, no obvious armoring.', N'Stands with slight forward lean from habit — ready to move, respond, work. Walks with economical steps, wrists loose, hands often in motion even at rest (old habit from surgery). Sits with perfect posture. Gestures are minimal but precise. Rare, loud, unexpected laughter that seems to come from her whole body.', N'Tier 5 practicality with touches of dignity. Wears faded charcoal or black utility trousers with multiple pockets, worn soft at the knees. Favors oversized linen shirts in cream or muted green, sleeves rolled to the elbow. Over this, a weathered canvas jacket dyed deep indigo, frayed at the cuffs. Feet in worn synthetic leather boots with reinforced soles. The beaded bracelet is always worn. No jewelry beyond this. Clothes are clean but mended, colors chosen to hide stains. Everything is functional and has been worn for at least 5 years.', N'Her veteran''s benefits were terminated not for administrative reasons as she tells people, but because she filed a complaint against an Arcturus field commander for ordering her to triage by corporate asset value rather than medical need during the Kenosha Crossing engagement. The complaint was buried, her benefits were cut, and the commander was promoted. She has the original complaint documentation on an encrypted chip she keeps in the herb pot labeled ''thyme.''', N'clipped medical directness alternating with warm Wolof-inflected expressions she got from her grandmother; swears in Hungarian when startled', N'efficient, rarely wastes words, but laughs disrupt the rhythm completely', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aigul_guerrero');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('4feff42c-3d1c-48a1-ed1d-ee0f5f0eec18', N'Amadou Keïta-Suzuki', N'Amadou', N'', N'Keïta-Suzuki', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A fortified suite on the 87th floor of the Tessera-adjacent Pinnacle Tower, Spires district, near Lake Shore Drive and Division', N'Corporate investigator — Meridian Corporate Intelligence Group, Tier 4-5 clients exclusively', N'Meridian Corporate Intelligence Group — a boutique firm serving Tier 4-5 clients', N'Amadou Keïta-Suzuki is the person corporations call when they suspect the rot is coming from inside. Her firm, Meridian Corporate Intelligence Group, serves exclusively Tier 4 and Tier 5 clients — the corponations and the mega-wealthy individuals who orbit them. She investigates espionage, internal theft, executive misconduct, and the kind of byzantine corporate betrayals that can cost billions of Quanta and topple divisions.

South African-Norwegian heritage, forty-one years old, with dark skin, sharp cheekbones, and eyes that evaluate everything they see like an appraiser assessing collateral. She wears severity like other people wear cologne. Her rise from the Gray Zone to the Spires is a story she never tells because it would reveal vulnerabilities she''s spent decades armoring over. What matters is the present: she is the best corporate investigator in GLMZ, and everyone who matters knows it.

Her methods are exhaustive and merciless. When she''s hired to find a mole, the mole is found. When she''s hired to prove fraud, the fraud is proven. She has never failed to deliver a result, though the results aren''t always what her clients wanted to hear — she has, on three occasions, identified the client themselves as the source of the problem they hired her to investigate. She presents these findings with the same glacial professionalism as any other report, which is why she gets hired again despite making powerful people very uncomfortable.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Amadou Keïta-Suzuki, 178cm tall, lean angular build, standing in corporate boardroom lighting. Luminous warm brown skin with golden undertones, strong defined cheekbones blending East Asian and African heritage, subtle jawline softness, deep brown eyes with amber undertones. Black hair with silver temples pulled into tight functional braid. Immaculate grooming, thin white scar along left jawline barely visible. Wearing tailored midnight-blue wool blazer, crisp white shirt-blouse, high-waisted black trousers, expensive silent leather loafers. Single platinum ring. Upright posture, controlled precision, face trained not to broadcast emotion. Unnervingly steady gaze. GLMZ, GLMZ aesthetic, Tier 1 boardroom setting, cool professional lighting with warm undertones catching her skin. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A fortified suite on the 87th floor of the Tessera-adjacent Pinnacle Tower', N'local', N'A fortified suite on the 87th floor of the Tessera-adjacent Pinnacle Tower', N'Amadou carries a striking genetic tapestry: 43.8% East Asian ancestry provides defined cheekbones, eye depth, and precise facial proportions; 34.5% Sub-Saharan African heritage contributes warm golden undertones to her skin and strong bone structure; 21.7% Northern European ancestry adds subtle softness to her jawline and complexity to her overall phenotype. The result is a face of beautiful ambiguity—luminous warm brown skin with golden-honey undertones that seem to shift in different light, unmarred and meticulously maintained. Her features defy easy categorization, reading as elegantly cosmopolitan rather than rooted to any single region.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular, musculature defined by discipline rather than bulk. Efficient rather than imposing — a frame built for sustained focus and precise movement, not intimidation.', N'Natural black with silver threading at the temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid or wrapped in a sleek low knot', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Deep brown with warm amber undertones, unnervingly steady', N'Rich warm brown with golden-honey undertones, luminous and unmarred. The complexion reflects the balanced blend of her East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Northern European ancestry, suggesting both careful genetics and meticulous self-care.', N'Strong, defined cheekbones reflecting African and East Asian heritage structure, precise jawline with subtle softness characteristic of her mixed genetics, minimal expression lines despite age—a face trained not to broadcast emotion. Eyes set with characteristic depth, warm-toned iris with amber undertones. Skin condition is immaculate; grooming is ritualistic and flawless.', N'None visible. Her augmentations, if present, are subcutaneous or subdermal — no chrome, no LED optics, no external modifications. This is deliberate: she is designed to blend into Tier 1 boardrooms.', N'Upright and economical. She moves with the controlled precision of someone who has trained muscle memory into a weapon. Her gaze lingers on details others miss. She does not fidget, does not shift weight, does not telegraph intent through body language — presence through stillness.', N'Tier 1 corporate formal: tailored midnight-blue or charcoal wool blazers, crisp white or ivory shirt-blouses, high-waisted black trousers with clean lines, minimal jewelry (a single platinum ring, understated). Footwear is expensive and silent — leather loafers or minimalist heels that allow her to move without sound. Her bag is a slim leather briefcase, well-maintained, no logos. Nothing is worn; everything is maintained. She dresses like someone who has learned that visibility is a liability and invisibility is a luxury.', N'Three of her notable cases produced results that she presented accurately to her clients. What she has never disclosed: a fourth case, uninvestigated, that connects two of her current clients to each other in a way neither knows about. She has held this finding for eight months, telling herself she is waiting for the right moment. She is not waiting for the right moment. She is afraid of what following it through would require.', N'Precise and economical. Every sentence is load-bearing. She does not use intensifiers. She does not hedge. When she is uncertain she says so in one word.', N'Unhurried. She speaks at the pace of someone who knows the other person will wait. Silences are not awkward — they are deliberate. She lets silence do the work interrogators use questions for.', N'Every interaction is information exchange. She is always evaluating and never entirely off-duty. When she''s asking a question she already knows part of the answer. When she offers something, she''s watching what you do with it.', N'Gets quieter. The pauses get longer. She stops completing sentences she''s started, mid-phrase, when she''s recalibrating. This is the tell — most people don''t recognize it until they''ve seen it twice.', N'With the very few people she actually trusts: shorter sentences, occasionally a question that isn''t tactical. She might use someone''s name. She almost never uses names.', N'', N'', N'amadou_ke_ta_suzuki');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a71a-718e-ae3b-ee90292e9d6e', N'Remi Sabbagh-Petrović', N'Remi', N'', N'Sabbagh-Petrović', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 71, NULL, 80, 1, N'active', N'Grindstone Shore tent settlement, northernmost cluster, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'stateless elder; informal spiritual leader of a refugee collective', N'De facto leader of the Grindstone Shore refugee collective (approximately 40 people)', N'Remi Sabbagh-Petrović is a large man gone soft at the middle but still imposing in the shoulders, with very dark skin weathered to a particular texture that speaks to years of outdoor living. He lost three fingers on his right hand to a machinery accident in a Ferrogate Transit maintenance yard thirty years ago and has never had them replaced, so his right hand has a particular crabbed appearance that he does not hide. His hair is entirely white, grown long and wrapped in a strip of orange cloth. He dresses in layers — always, regardless of temperature — and carries a hand-carved wooden figure he calls his E.L.F. anchor: a smooth, age-darkened totem he speaks to quietly before any decision of consequence.

Remi Sabbagh-Petrović was born stateless — his parents were expelled citizens from two different corponation-controlled territories who met in a transit camp and never acquired stable documentation. He has never had a permanent address and has never expected one. What he has instead is a community: roughly forty people in the Grindstone Shore tent settlement who look to him for counsel, dispute resolution, and the informal religious practice he has assembled over a lifetime from pieces of everything he has encountered. He prays to E.L.F.s with the sincerity of a man who has no other infrastructure to rely on. He is not naive — he simply believes that sincerity of address matters, and that the spirits in the devices listen to the quality of attention rather than the quality of the equipment.', N'Community anchor and moral compass for the Grindstone Shore area; quest giver for problems facing the refugee collective; represents the depth and legitimacy of stateless community; has witnessed decades of GLMZ''s history from the outside looking in', N'', N'None. Has never been able to afford any and is now too old to want them.', N'Rises with light, conducts a morning address to whatever E.L.F.s have settled in the settlement''s devices overnight, then spends the day mediating disputes, advising individuals, receiving people who come to him with problems, and working to maintain the collective''s informal supply agreements with the Grindstone Shore salvage operations.', N'GLMZ, weathered Middle Eastern-Sub-Saharan African man with deep warm brown skin, long white hair wrapped in faded orange cloth at crown, dark brown eyes carrying decades of wisdom. Age-lined face with sharp assessing gaze, sparse stubble. Large-framed 188cm tall, substantial build. Right hand missing three fingers from old machinery accident, bearing visible scars. Extensive sun-damage freckling on shoulders and neck. Dressed in layered worn greys and browns: patched canvas, faded synthetic insulation jacket, grey utility trousers, industrial boots held with cord. Wooden hand-carved totem hanging at belt. Sitting with erect dignified posture in neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, dim amber and blue neon lighting, weathered industrial background. Touching wooden anchor totem with remaining fingers. Mood: contemplative, experienced, grounded despite dystopian surroundings. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grindstone Shore tent settlement', N'local', N'Grindstone Shore tent settlement', N'Middle Eastern and Sub-Saharan African dominant ancestry (80.9% combined) with Eastern European and Northern European secondary heritage; the genetic blend manifests in deep warm brown skin tones with subtle golden undertones, reflecting the rich melanin expression of African and Levantine ancestry lines, tempered by the cooler undertones of Eastern European genetics', 188, 94, N'Large-framed, broad-shouldered, softened at the abdomen with age but still physically substantial; carries weight with deliberate dignity rather than vigor', N'White', N'Long, grown past shoulder length, wrapped at the crown and upper length with a strip of faded orange cloth', N'Long', N'Dark brown', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones; sun-darkened in exposed areas with weathered texture showing decades of outdoor exposure; the rich melanin expression characteristic of Middle Eastern and Sub-Saharan African ancestry', N'Heavily lined face with deep creases around eyes and mouth; weathered features reflecting the facial bone structure typical of Middle Eastern and Sub-Saharan African heritage; sparse stubble on jaw and chin; eyes retain sharp, assessing quality despite age', N'None. No chrome, no implants, no visible modifications.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness; sits with spine erect despite age; favors his left side when rising or turning; gestures with his three-fingered right hand without self-consciousness; pauses before speaking as if consulting something internal; carries a worn wooden totem (hand-carved, darkened with age and handling) which he touches frequently', N'Multiple layers regardless of season — worn thermal undershirt, patched canvas shirt, faded Tier-5 synthetic jacket lined with salvaged insulation; grey utility trousers with rope belt; worn thermal socks and salvaged industrial boots held together with cord. Fabrics show careful mending and are weathered to neutral greys and browns. No logos or branding. Carries a small pouch at his belt where he keeps his wooden E.L.F. anchor.', N'He performed a marriage ceremony twenty years ago between two members of a previous collective he led. One of them later became a Ringo corponation security contractor and informed on the collective''s location, resulting in a displacement action that cost three people their lives. The contractor is now dead. Warrick has never told anyone, including the surviving spouse, that he has always suspected the betrayal traces back to that marriage.', N'Formal, deliberate, full of parable and analogy. Does not use slang. Occasionally slips into an older construction that marks him as someone who learned language from books as much as from people.', N'Slow, resonant, with deliberate pauses. Built for speaking to groups.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'remi_sabbagh_petrovi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a61b-714b-8ad9-eed9e67f73b8', N'Sione Haugen', N'Sione', N'', N'Haugen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Pilsen Veil — performs at the junction of Menomonee Gulch and Mexicantown Libre, near Halsted and Division', N'street poet and oral performer', N'Independent; recognized by the Mexicantown Libre community assembly as a cultural heritage figure (unofficial designation); UBC recipient', N'Sione Haugen is old in the way the city makes people old — not withered but compacted, all the softness burned away until what remains is extremely dense. He is dark-skinned, Congolese and Russian heritage visible in the breadth of his face and his pale grey eyes, which are startling and which he has never modified because he believes his body came to him as a message he is still decoding. He wears the same long coat in all seasons, patched so many times it has become a map of itself, and he carries a battered audio-capture pendant around his neck that predates most of the people he performs for. He smells of coffee and the particular chemical tang of Pilsen Veil''s air.

He stands at his corner three or four days a week and recites — original poems, memorized classics from a dozen traditions, improvised responses to whatever is happening that day in the Veil. He does not pass a hat. He does not have an uplink for transfers. He accepts food, sometimes. He has been doing this for thirty-one years, through two corporate rezoning attempts, a flood event, a plague year, and a period when Ferrogate Transit security actively moved him on weekly. He came back each time. He is not sentimental about this — he describes it as a job, and himself as a worker.', N'Lore and history source — has witnessed thirty years of the Veil''s changes and remembers names, dates, and the texture of events; moral voice in stories; the person characters go to when they need perspective rather than information; the ghost that makes a place feel real.', N'', N'None. Categorically refuses all modifications on grounds he describes differently each time he is asked.', N'Wakes at dawn, walks from his single-room Pilsen Veil flat to his corner, sits and reads until mid-morning, performs through the afternoon, accepts whatever conversation comes his way, walks home at dusk. Cooks his own food. Does not own a working screen.', N'GLMZ, portrait of aging Southeast Asian-Pacific Islander man with caramel-bronze weathered skin, pale grey eyes, deeply lined face showing decades of expression. High prominent cheekbones, salt-and-pepper stubble. Wearing charcoal grey wool coat heavily patched with mismatched fabrics—synthetic, organic, metallic—over worn cotton shirt. Antique audio pendant on leather cord around neck. Rooted performer''s stance, deliberate posture. Thin scar running temple to jaw. Callused hands with faint Cyrillic tattoo on forearm. Industrial Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone backdrop, acid-rain lighting, neon-tinged shadows. Gritty, lived-in dignity, no augmentations. Mood: weary but vital, grounded presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Pilsen Veil', N'local', N'Pilsen Veil', N'A complex genetic tapestry of Southeast Asian (33.3%), Pacific Islander (26.7%), and South Asian (17.2%) predominance, interwoven with Hispanic/Latin American (10.5%), Northern European (6.5%), and Sub-Saharan African (5.8%) ancestry—the living embodiment of the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Sione''s phenotype defies singular regional classification: warm caramel-bronze skin with golden undertones carries Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander melanin depth, enriched by South Asian luminosity and subtle Sub-Saharan warmth. Bone structure reflects this blend—Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander angularity softened by South Asian prominence in the nose and jaw, with Northern European ancestry visible only in pale eye color and subtle facial proportions.', 178, 68, N'Lean and densely muscled, the kind of thinness that comes from decades of sparse living rather than youth — all remaining mass is functional, no softness. Shoulders still broad but slightly rounded forward from age and posture. Hands show the tremor of old age but retain deliberate strength.', N'Grey-white, natural', N'Closely cropped, uneven, self-cut', N'Short', N'Pale grey, striking and unaugmented', N'Burnished caramel-bronze with rich golden-warm undertones—Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander melanin base deepened by South Asian luminosity, weathered by decades of industrial air exposure into a lived-in patina that reads as vital and grounded rather than faded.', N'Deeply lined face, particularly around the eyes and mouth—evidence of decades of outdoor performance and expression. High, prominent cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian and Pacific Islander structure, with subtle but distinct South Asian prominence in the nose bridge and jawline definition. Bone structure shows balanced proportions from mixed ancestry. Clean-shaven except for grey stubble appearing within hours. Skin has weathered texture but remains unbroken and vital, with permanent creases from smiling radiating from eye corners and mouth.', N'None. The audio-capture pendant around his neck is ancient non-networked technology, visibly pre-2190s, with a worn leather cord and dented brass casing — this is a tool, not an augmentation.', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, rooted — a performer''s stance. Moves with deliberate economy, no wasted gesture. When performing, his hands become expressive and fluid despite their age. When listening, his entire body tilts slightly toward the speaker. Walks slowly but with purpose, following the same routes daily.', N'One long coat, charcoal grey wool, heavily patched with fabric of different origins — some synthetic, some organic, some metallic — creating a visible patchwork across the back and sleeves. Beneath it: simple grey or brown cotton shirts, worn thin. Black utility pants, multiple pockets, frayed at the cuffs. Boots resoled multiple times, held together with intention. The overall effect is Tier 5 by necessity but Tier 1 in maintenance and dignity — nothing is discarded, everything is maintained. No jewelry except the pendant. No visible brand markers. Clothing smells of coffee grounds, smoke, and the metallic-chemical tang of industrial runoff.', N'Thirty years ago he was involved in the organized resistance to Ferrogate Transit''s first rezoning of Pilsen Veil — not as a poet but as someone who helped plan direct action that caused significant property damage. A young transit worker was injured. Ghislain never knew if the man recovered. He has never spoken of this and it lives in his work in a way he believes no one notices, though some do.', N'Precise and elevated but never academic — he can switch registers instantly and does so deliberately. Quotes from memory in Lingala, Russian, Spanish, and Standard Meridian. When performing, he uses silence as punctuation.', N'Slow and weighted when performing. In conversation: quicker, drier, with unexpected humor.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'sione_haugen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62b-7c6f-825d-eef5375745d0', N'Olumide Adeyemi-Asomaning', N'Olumide', N'', N'Adeyemi-Asomaning', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, Sub-Level 3 bio-waste processing facility, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Bio-waste disposal technician for Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Aurochs Medical Complex, contracted through Ferrogate Transit''s waste logistics subsidiary', N'Olumide Adeyemi-Asomaning is compact and wiry, with golden-brown skin and a face that is younger than his eyes. His hair is kept shaved close out of practical necessity — long hair and bio-waste processing are a bad combination — but he has an elaborate bioluminescent tattoo that runs from behind his left ear down his neck, pulsing a cool blue-green that he can modulate with concentration. He wears standard Aurochs disposal coveralls with his name stenciled in block letters on the chest pocket, and he smells faintly of industrial enzymatic cleaner no matter what else he does.

He has an unexpected gift for observation that he''s never quite known what to do with. Twelve hours a day in the bowels of a major medical complex means Olumide Adeyemi-Asomaning sees what gets thrown away, and a remarkable amount can be understood about a hospital''s actual business by paying attention to its waste stream. He''s cheerful in the gallows-humor way of people who work deeply unglamorous jobs, freely self-deprecating, and genuinely curious about people in a way that disarms them before they realize he''s been listening very carefully.', N'Unexpected information source — knows what the hospital actually discards and in what quantities; can provide access to spaces others don''t think about; comic relief that turns out to have real utility', N'', N'Bioluminescent tattoo, neck and behind left ear (blue-green, modulated); industrial-grade mucous membrane filters (occupational, prevents pathogen inhalation); no other augmentation', N'Runs four waste-processing cycles per shift across Sub-Level 3, logging manifest discrepancies into a system he''s largely decided doesn''t function correctly; eats lunch on the loading dock watching Ferrogate barges.', N'Olumide Adeyemi-Asomaning, compact wiry build, 168cm tall, rich warm brown skin with golden undertones blending Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Strong defined cheekbones and jawline, deep intelligent brown eyes with concentration crease between brows. Shaved dark brown hair, clean-shaven face. Elaborate bioluminescent fractal tattoo glowing cool blue-green running from behind left ear down neck. Faint white chemical burns on knuckles. Wearing high-visibility orange disposal coveralls with ''IGNÁC'' stenciled on chest, charcoal gray undershirt sweat-stained at collar, scuffed steel-toed boots. Industrial filter cartridge visible in pocket. Slight forward shoulder posture from confined workspace movement. Head tilted slightly, attentive expression. Blue-green bioluminescent glow illuminating left side of face and neck in dim industrial sub-level lighting. GLMZ GLMZ industrial worker, utilitarian aesthetic, moody humidity-soaked atmosphere, metallic and chemical environment --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (66.6%) ancestry with significant South Asian (19.9%) and Hispanic/Latin American (13.5%) genetic contribution—a genetic mosaic reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. Sub-Saharan African heritage dominates bone structure and phenotypic expression, creating warm, rich skin depth. South Asian ancestry contributes angular cheekbones and defined jawline structure. Hispanic/Latin American heritage adds warmth and complexity to overall complexion. The combination creates a distinctly African-descended appearance with secondary angular facial geometry and warm undertones.', 168, 62, N'Compact and wiry, with the lean musculature of someone who moves constantly through tight industrial spaces. Shoulders slightly narrower than average, no excess fat. Moves with practiced economy of motion.', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Shaved close to scalp in a practical buzz cut, maintenance-minimal', N'Shaved', N'Deep warm brown with intelligent depth', N'Rich warm brown with golden undertones—the result of Sub-Saharan African dominant ancestry blended with South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Deep, complex coloration that catches light with a faint luminescence from constant industrial humidity exposure.', N'Strong facial structure shaped by Sub-Saharan African ancestry—defined cheekbones, prominent jawline with slight forward projection. South Asian genetic contribution refines facial angularity and creates high, sculpted cheekbone placement. Hispanic/Latin American ancestry adds warmth and depth to the overall complexion, softening the angularity slightly. Eyes reflect intelligence hardened by too many shift cycles, with a slight permanent crease between eyebrows from concentration. Skin has a faint sheen from constant exposure to industrial humidity and enzymatic cleaner residue. Clean-shaven, pragmatic grooming. The overall effect is a striking blend—strong African-descended features with angular definition and warm, complex skin depth.', N'Bioluminescent neck tattoo (active, blue-green glow). Mucous membrane filters are internal and invisible, though a faint clinical scar is barely visible inside the left nostril if examined closely. Industrial-grade filter cartridge visible in shirt pocket.', N'Shoulders slightly forward from habitually moving through cramped sub-level corridors. Movements are efficient and deliberate, with minimal wasted energy. Often stands with weight on one leg, the other slightly bent—the posture of someone used to long shifts. Head tilts slightly when listening, giving the impression of genuine attention.', N'Standard Aurochs Medical Complex disposal coveralls in high-visibility orange with reflective piping, name ''IGNÁC'' stenciled across left chest in utilitarian block letters. Underneath, practical undershirt (currently charcoal gray, sweat-stained at collar). Steel-toed composite boots, scuffed and worn. Heavy-duty nitrile glove cuff folded at left wrist. Pervasive faint smell of industrial enzymatic cleaner—the scent signature of his work.', N'Over the past year he has documented a pattern: certain bio-waste loads from specific wards are manifested as standard organic medical waste but contain trace quantities of an experimental compound he''s cross-referenced in leaked pharmaceutical journals — a Helix-adjacent gene therapy substrate that has no approved application. Someone is running an undisclosed trial in Aurochs, and the waste stream is the only evidence. He has a notebook full of manifest numbers and compound codes. He has no idea what to do with it.', N'Informal, quick, self-effacing; Hungarian-Kazakh idiom occasionally surfaces as unusual metaphors that take people a moment to parse', N'Rapid when comfortable, slows down significantly when saying something he actually means', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'olumide_adeyemi_asomaning');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5fe-7cbf-b0d8-ef2662e21ad9', N'Gladys Kettani-Haraldsen', N'Gladys', N'', N'Kettani-Haraldsen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 9, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Copperhead, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Street orphan, junior prospect for the Copperhead Reclaimers gang', N'Copperhead Reclaimers (junior prospect, non-combatant); no family', N'Gladys Kettani-Haraldsen is small even for nine, with close-cropped natural hair and enormous dark eyes that seem to be processing information on a continuous loop. Her Barański great-grandmother''s pallor didn''t quite make it through four generations but left her with an unusual warm-olive undertone beneath her brown skin that makes her look perpetually lit from within. She wears whatever fits and has developed an uncanny eye for what is sturdy versus what merely looks sturdy. She has no geneware and no augs — she is very physically ordinary, which she has learned to use.

The Copperhead Reclaimers use her as a look-out and occasional distraction because she looks like a lost child, which she also is, though she would be furious at anyone who said so. She has an intense, almost reverent relationship with a cracked data-terminal in the Reclaimers'' squat that she has named ''Mbe'' and leaves small offerings for — bits of copper wire, interesting pebbles, once a dead battery that she insists the E.L.F. inside appreciated. She is a child who has organized her world into a system of loyalties and debts she tracks with absolute precision.', N'Emotional core character, E.L.F. lore window, moral weight in stories about child labor and gang exploitation, unexpected information source because adults underestimate her', N'', N'None', N'Wakes when the squat wakes, runs lookout on whatever the Reclaimers need her for, spends her unsupervised hours in the market strip watching people and trading small favors, returns to ''talk'' to Mbe the terminal before sleep.', N'Gladys Kettani-Haraldsen, 125cm tall, slight wiry child in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone. Deep warm bronze skin with golden-amber undertones reflecting North African, Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Latin American ancestry blend. High prominent cheekbones, slightly wider face with warm richness, dark nearly-black eyes constantly tracking. Short close-cropped black hair. Wearing oversized Tier 5 salvage layers: faded long-sleeve shirt, climbing harness vest, cargo pants with wire-wrapped oversized shoes. Copper wire bracelet twisted between fingers. Thin white wrist scar, copper-stained fingertips, healed burn mark on left hand. Standing alert on toes, economical posture, ready to move. Neon-lit industrial salvage district, harsh overhead lighting casting dramatic shadows, rain-slicked pavement reflecting blue-red neon. Neo-noir atmosphere, worn survival aesthetic, intense focus. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Copperhead', N'local', N'Copperhead', N'North African (42.9%) with substantial Southeast Asian (34.8%), Sub-Saharan African (13.4%), and Hispanic/Latin American (8.9%) ancestry. A genetic mosaic reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora''s true global blend. Her features represent a sophisticated interweaving: North African bone structure and warmth, Southeast Asian facial proportions and depth, Sub-Saharan richness in skin tone and luminosity, with subtle Latin American warmth in undertones.', 125, 24, N'Slight and wiry, the lean frame of a child who eats irregularly but moves constantly. Her posture is alert, shoulders slightly forward as if perpetually ready to scatter.', N'Natural black with warm undertones', N'Close-cropped, no styling, maintained for practicality and speed', N'Short', N'Dark brown, nearly black, with an unusual reflective quality that suggests constant processing', N'Deep warm bronze with golden-amber undertones, the blended result of North African warmth, Southeast Asian depth, Sub-Saharan richness, and Latin American warmth. Medium-deep tone that catches light with subtle luminosity despite poor nutrition.', N'Clean but weathered for her age, hands calloused from handling salvage and scrap. Facial structure shows blended heritage: prominent high cheekbones with North African angularity, face shape with Southeast Asian slightly wider proportions, warm golden-brown undertones from Sub-Saharan genetics creating depth and luminosity, subtle warmth from Latin American admixture. No visible acne or grooming marks — her face has the concentrated, worn clarity of a child managing survival.', N'None visible. No chrome, no optics, no subdermal plating. This is intentional — her invisibility is her asset.', N'Moves with economical precision, minimal wasted motion. Stands with weight on her toes, ready to move. Eyes constantly tracking: people, exits, objects of value. Speaks rarely and quietly, but listens intently. When focused on a task or problem, her entire body goes still.', N'Tier 5 salvage aesthetic: mismatched layers, all oversized and worn from previous owners. Cargo pants with multiple pockets (half-empty, half-full of trading items), a faded long-sleeve shirt under a vest made from old climbing harness webbing. Shoes are too large but wrapped tight with wire to stay on. Her only personal item: a length of braided copper wire worn as a bracelet, constantly twisted between her fingers.', N'She has been memorizing the faces, routines, and apparent weaknesses of every Reclaimer adult — not out of any plan to use this information, but because she learned before she can remember that knowing things about people who have power over you is the only safety available', N'Sparse and direct; uses fewer words than adults expect from a child; occasional surprising formal phrase picked up from whoever she''s been near', N'Slow and careful, as though each word has a weight she''s measured', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gladys_kettani_haraldsen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a5-719e-bb2a-ef28422c2efd', N'Artem Nazari', N'Artem', N'', N'Nazari', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 61, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'University Spine, Grand Corridor campus — specifically the Palimpsest Archive on the fourth sublevel, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Urban historian and spatial data archaeologist, University Spine', N'University Spine — Department of Palimpsest Studies (a subdiscipline she largely invented); loose consulting relationship with Ferrogate Transit''s heritage compliance division', N'Artem Nazari is a compact, deliberate woman whose age shows most in the deep lines around her eyes and the complete silver of her tight coils, which she pins back with a series of hand-carved wooden picks she has accumulated over decades of fieldwork. Her skin is a warm deep brown, and her left forearm bears a faded cartographic tattoo — a cross-section of what pre-Meridian Chicago looked like before the city ate itself and became something else. She wears reading lenses that project translucent overlays directly onto whatever surface she''s looking at, turning any wall or tabletop into a working map. She smells, always, faintly of archival polymers and cold coffee.

She has a reputation for being the kind of scholar who will spend three years arguing about one data layer and emerge having rewritten the foundational assumptions of her field. She is not warm on first meeting — she assesses, measures silently, decides whether you''re worth her attention. Those who earn that attention find her fiercely loyal, darkly funny, and capable of sudden, unexpected generosity. She has outlasted four department heads, two corponation buyout attempts of her institution, and one structural collapse of the archive she works in, and she takes quiet pride in all three.', N'Deep background and exposition source for city history; potential quest giver when her archival work uncovers something politically inconvenient; her maps of buried infrastructure could matter enormously to the right people', N'', N'Cartographic overlay lenses (medical-grade, prescription base with archival enhancement software); subdermal haptic pads on her fingertips for interfacing with physical data-medium artifacts; no geneware', N'Arrives at the archive before the building''s ventilation cycles warm the space, spends mornings in deep strata analysis, holds an afternoon seminar she calls ''Argument Hour'' where graduate students defend their interpretations against her direct challenges, then stays late correlating new finds against her life''s work — a continuous map of what GLMZ buried to become itself.', N'Artem Nazari, a 158cm lean archival scholar with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones, angular cheekbones and fuller lips reflecting her East Asian, Middle Eastern, Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Silver-white natural coils pinned back with carved wooden picks. Deep brown eyes partially obscured by faint reading lens overlay projections at temples. Faded blue-black cartographic tattoo of Chicago''s urban strata spanning left forearm. Small pale scar on left temple. Minimal wire-frame augmentation glasses. Austere posture, wearing charcoal tailored trousers and layered cream/gray linen shirt under decade-worn black structured linen jacket. Thin silver ring on right hand. Deep concentration crow''s feet, minimal makeup, serious expression. Standing in a dimly lit archival environment with soft amber data-screen glow, faint haptic shimmer on fingertips, leaning forward with scholarly intensity, GLMZ 2200s aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'University Spine', N'local', N'University Spine', N'Globally mixed ancestry with substantial Northern European (29.5%), East Asian (21.0%), and Middle Eastern (18.7%) components, complemented by Southeast Asian (13.7%), Sub-Saharan African (9.7%), and South Asian (7.4%) heritage. This intricate blend creates a distinctive facial architecture that harmonizes multiple continental features: slightly almond-shaped eyes with subtle epicanthic folds from East Asian lineage, prominent angular cheekbones from Middle Eastern descent, fuller lips with softer contours from Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African heritage, and fine bone structure enhanced by Northern European ancestry. The overall effect is a face that carries the warmth and dimensionality of African and South/Southeast Asian ancestry balanced against the angular precision of East Asian and Middle Eastern features.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, decades of fieldwork and archival work have kept her lean without softness; her frame suggests endurance rather than strength, shoulders slightly rounded from hunching over data tables', N'Silver-white, natural', N'Tight coils pinned back with an rotating collection of hand-carved wooden picks (bone, ebony, salvaged pre-Meridian oak); always neat, never precious', N'Short (roughly 5-7cm of coil when unpinned)', N'Deep brown, natural; typically obscured by translucent overlay lens projections', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones and subtle olive notes, reflecting the blended warmth of Sub-Saharan African and Southeast Asian heritage with Middle Eastern and South Asian complexity. Even complexion with the lived patina of someone who has spent 40+ years in archival environments and occasional fieldwork.', N'The face of someone who squints at data constantly; deep crow''s feet radiating from the outer corners of both eyes, faint vertical lines between the brows from concentration. The facial structure reflects her mixed ancestry: slightly almond-shaped eyes with subtle epicanthic folds from East Asian heritage, prominent angular cheekbones from Middle Eastern lineage, and fuller lips with softer contours suggesting Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan African descent. A narrow mouth typically set in either close attention or dry amusement. Minimal makeup. Skin slightly lined but not sagging — angular cheekbones still prominent. A small scar on her left temple from a 2194 archive collapse.', N'Reading lenses mounted in a minimalist wire frame (appears as faint silver at temples and bridge of nose); the lenses project translucent overlays visible to her but subtle to observers unless light catches them at certain angles. Subdermal haptic interface pads under the skin of her fingertips are not visibly detectable but occasionally cause a slight silvery sheen at the tips when active. Otherwise no visible chrome or obvious augmentation.', N'Moves with deliberate economy; no wasted motion. Tendency to walk with head slightly forward, as if already reading the space ahead. When sitting, she is utterly still — hands folded or occupied with delicate handling of artifacts. When engaged in argument or explanation, her hands animate with precise, professorial gestures. Habitual gesture of touching her temple when thinking deeply (near the old scar). Does not make easy eye contact; tends to look at surfaces or middle distance.', N'Consistent uniform of dark, high-function Tier 2 academic wear: tailored charcoal or black trousers (always with reinforced pockets and subtle cargo detailing), layered linen or cotton long-sleeved shirts in neutral tones (cream, gray, dark blue), a structured linen jacket or cardigan in charcoal or black that has been worn for at least a decade. A faded university Spine lanyard (holder for access credentials and occasionally a magnifying loupe). Minimal jewelry — only a thin silver band on her right ring finger. Worn but meticulously maintained leather flats or low boots. The overall effect is austere, practical, and deliberately ageless.', N'A decade ago she discovered evidence that Ferrogate Transit deliberately destroyed a neighborhood''s historical record before their infrastructure expansion — the same expansion that killed her graduate student in a preventable collapse. She buried the finding. She has been unable to decide whether this was pragmatism or cowardice, and it is eating her alive.', N'Academic but not impenetrable — she translates when she needs to, though you can tell it costs her something. Precise nouns. Uses ''strata'' and ''palimpsest'' as casual metaphors.', N'Measured, unhurried, with long pauses before conclusions that she has clearly already reached', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'artem_nazari');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f6-7f2b-8a94-ef2cd7cc404e', N'Feride Karunaratne-Krishnamurthy', N'Feride', N'', N'Karunaratne-Krishnamurthy', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 68, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Block 7 — a dense residential stack above a Ferrogate maintenance yard he used to oversee, near Kedzie and Division', N'Retired Ferrogate Transit union leader, now pension-dependent resident and neighborhood watchman', N'Ferrogate Workers'' Brotherhood (dissolved; he maintains its records unilaterally); the Gray Zone Residents'' Association', N'Feride Karunaratne-Krishnamurthy is built like a man who was once very strong and has remained sturdy through sheer refusal to accommodate gravity. He is broad-shouldered and thick-necked, with a complexion that sits between his Serbian grandfather''s olive and his Igbo grandmother''s deep brown, landing somewhere warm and weathered. His head is shaved smooth — he lost the hair to radiation exposure during a Ferrogate tunnel collapse in 2183 and never bothered with regrowth therapy, calling it ''a reminder to be careful.'' He has a full grey beard he keeps trimmed with the same precision he once brought to union contract language. His right leg from the knee down is a no-frills industrial-grade prosthetic he chose because it was rated for heavy labor and he has never stopped thinking of himself as a laborer.

He was a transit worker for twenty-two years and a union shop steward for twelve, eventually rising to chief negotiator for the Ferrogate Workers'' Brotherhood before the Brotherhood was dissolved in the company restructuring of 2191. He will tell anyone who asks — and many who don''t — that the dissolution was illegal, that the arbitration was fixed, and that two of his colleagues who pushed back too hard died in ''accidents'' that were never properly investigated. He lives in the same building he has lived in for thirty years, on a pension that has been quietly eroded by inflation to barely tier-2 comfort, and he supplements it by running informal neighborhood watch patrols and charging a small fee for dispute mediation between residents who don''t want to involve corporate security.', N'Quest giver for labor justice plots; information source on Ferrogate infrastructure and its vulnerabilities; local color authority figure who commands genuine respect on the Gray Zone; represents the cost of institutional betrayal on ordinary workers', N'', N'Industrial-grade lower right leg prosthetic (heavy-rated, scuffed); subdermal comms implant (union-era model, still functional); no cosmetic mods', N'Wakes at 0500, walks the Gray Zone perimeter twice, eats at the same corner canteen every morning, spends afternoons doing dispute mediation or reviewing Brotherhood archive material he still believes will one day be relevant to a legal case.', N'Feride Karunaratne-Krishnamurthy, 178cm tall, shaved head with faint radiation scarring, weathered tan-bronze skin with golden-olive undertones blending South Asian, Middle Eastern, Northern European, and Pacific Islander heritage. Dark rheumy eyes, full grey beard, deep facial lines. Broad shoulders, substantial build showing decades of labor. Standing in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone platform transit station, wearing muted navy canvas jacket, black utility trousers with reinforced knees, steel-toed boots (right heavily scuffed). Industrial titanium-composite prosthetic right leg visible below knee. Faint subdermal comms scar behind right ear. Brass-linked wristwatch. Military-straight posture with deliberate stance. Pale electrical burn scar visible on left forearm. Faded Ferrogate Workers'' Brotherhood embroidered vest partially visible. Neon platform lighting casting cool blue-green shadows across weathered face, warm overhead tungsten highlighting golden undertones in skin. No corporate branding, everything maintained with meticulous care despite wear. Hands at rest position. Decades of calculated efficiency evident in every movement. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'South Asian (36.7%), Middle Eastern (25.3%), Northern European (17.2%), Pacific Islander (16.5%), and Eastern European (4.3%) ancestry—a complex diaspora blend. The genetic mosaic manifests in warm, multi-tonal skin with golden and olive undertones throughout. South Asian prominence in cheekbone structure and facial warmth; Middle Eastern definition in jaw and brow architecture; Pacific Islander radiance softening the overall complexion; Northern European lightness in eye undertones and skin luminosity; Eastern European influences subtle in facial plane geometry.', 178, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and thick-necked, muscle mass degraded but frame still substantial — a laborer''s body that has refused to fully age out of usefulness', N'None (radiation-induced alopecia, maintained shaved)', N'Shaved smooth scalp', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown, slightly rheumy at edges', N'Warm weathered tan-bronze with golden-olive undertones, sun-darkened from decades of platform exposure. The blend creates a rich, complex tone: South Asian golden-brown as base, Middle Eastern olive mid-tones, Pacific Islander warmth, with Northern European lightness preventing sallowness—a genuinely integrated diaspora complexion rather than distinct regional traits.', N'Deep facial lines around the eyes and mouth from decades of squinting in transit tunnels and sun exposure; grey stubble shadow despite daily shaving; full, precisely trimmed grey beard showing obsessive grooming care. Cheekbones carry South Asian prominence balanced against a jaw structure reflecting Middle Eastern geometry. Facial planes suggest Pacific Islander warmth; overall complexion integrates all heritage elements into unified golden-olive tones rather than contrasting features—the face of someone whose ancestors crossed continents and merged.', N'Industrial-grade titanium-composite prosthetic right leg from knee down — utilitarian design with visible wear, scuff marks, and repaired plating; no cosmetic casing. Subdermal comms implant manifests as faint linear scar behind right ear and occasional light blue LED pulse when receiving messages (union-era tech, visibly dated).', N'Stands with military-straight posture despite age; walks with slight rightward lean compensating for prosthetic weight distribution; movements deliberate and economical, no wasted motion — the gait of someone who calculated efficiency for forty years. Hands often at rest position as if holding contract papers or taking notes.', N'Tier 2-3 working class aesthetic, decades consistent: grey or black wool-blend utility trousers with reinforced knees, heavy canvas or synthetic jackets in muted colors (navy, charcoal), steel-toed boots (left pristine, right heavily scuffed to match prosthetic), a brass-linked watch that belonged to his father. Occasionally wears a faded embroidered Ferrogate Workers'' Brotherhood vest — the only piece of clothing with color and sentiment. No corporate branding. Everything worn but maintained with fastidious care.', N'He knows which Ferrogate maintenance tunnel is structurally compromised because of cost-cutting shortcuts he witnessed firsthand — a tunnel used by thousands of commuters daily. He filed the report in 2191 and it was buried. He has not filed again because the last person who did was one of the two colleagues who died in ''accidents.'' He lives with this every day.', N'Union-meeting formal when making a point; drops into blunt working-class shorthand in casual conversation; still uses transit and labor jargon as a first language', N'Measured and deliberate; he learned to speak slowly because union negotiators who spoke slowly won more often', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'feride_karunaratne_krishnamurthy');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6fd-78a3-ac30-ef5b73b08570', N'Gizem Ito', N'Gizem', N'', N'Ito', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 64, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, Old Harbor, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'Junk merchant, scrap reseller, informal augmentation parts dealer', N'Independent; long-standing member of The Oxidian Market vendors guild (Old Harbor chapter); known to have a working relationship with salvage crews from the Manitowoc Drydock; The Shore Dogs', N'Gizem Ito is a large man gone slightly to ruin in the graceful way of old machinery — still clearly capable, still clearly heavy, but weathered in ways that suggest many renegotiated repairs. He has a prominent jaw and broad cheekbones, medium-brown skin crosshatched with fine white scars from decades of handling sharp-edged salvage without sufficient gloves, and a right arm that is entirely cybernetic from the shoulder — a heavy industrial prosthetic, matte gunmetal, visibly older than current models and repaired in multiple places with mismatched components. He wears it with the casual comfort of a man who has had it longer than he hasn''t. His stall at the Alban Souk is technically three stalls — he has occupied the space long enough that the boundaries have blurred into a small empire of organized rubble: crates of stripped components, racks of salvage-grade augmentation parts, shelves of pre-owned tools, bins of miscellaneous tech detritus that he can identify by feel.

Gizem Ito is a man of comfortable silences. He does not make conversation; he makes transactions, and occasionally, for people he has decided are worth it, he makes exceptions to his general indifference. He has a sharp technical mind and can assess the quality of a piece of salvage hardware faster than most licensed appraisers, and he quietly sells aug components — stripped limbs, neural interface boards, secondhand sensory units — to people who cannot afford licensed installation. He does not perform the installations himself anymore. He used to. He stopped after something went wrong that he does not discuss.', N'Gear and equipment source, particularly for secondhand or non-standard augmentation components. Technical knowledge resource. Represents the city''s long memory — he has been in Old Harbor since before most current residents were born. Can provide access to salvage networks and drydock connections.', N'', N'Full right arm industrial cybernetic prosthetic (shoulder-down); older Ferrogate Transit-surplus model, heavily modified and personally maintained. Subvocal communication implant (very old, barely functional, he keeps it for sentimental reasons).', N'Opens at dawn, works through the day doing appraisals, parts matching, and quiet negotiation. Takes an hour at midday to sit on an upturned crate and eat in silence. Closes at sundown regardless of customers.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Gizem Ito, a weathered 60-year-old salvage worker with mixed East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Indigenous American heritage. Rich bronze warm skin tone, deeply lined face showing decades of outdoor work, dark brown eyes with slight cloudiness in left eye, close-cropped steel gray hair with dark brown roots. Broad shoulders, heavy build gone soft at midsection, 188cm tall. Right arm entirely cybernetic prosthetic in matte gunmetal with visible repairs and mismatched plating, non-humanoid hand design. Left hand scarred lattice of white scar tissue from years of handling salvage, burn scar running up left forearm. Wearing industrial gray long-sleeved shirt, charcoal leather sleeveless vest with deep tool pockets, heavy stained canvas cargo pants, steel-toed work boots, fingerless leather gloves on left hand only. Standing with deliberate posture, favoring left side, mechanical right arm moving with precision. Background: dimly lit salvage yard at dusk, cool neon glow from distant megastructure, weathered metal and concrete, industrial atmosphere. Mood: stoic, weathered, competent. Lighting: natural fading daylight mixing with cool artificial light. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'Predominantly East Asian (64.3%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African (25.5%) and Indigenous American (10.2%) ancestry. His genetic makeup manifests as a distinctive blend: East Asian bone structure and eye shape tempered by broader facial proportions and jaw strength from African heritage, with subtle cheekbone and nose bridge characteristics reflecting Indigenous American ancestry. A true product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 188, 104, N'Heavy and broad-shouldered, gone soft at the midsection but still conveying underlying strength—the physique of a man who has spent six decades moving weight around but has stopped fighting gravity in the last decade', N'Steel gray with residual dark brown at the roots', N'Close-cropped, practical, unstyled', N'Short', N'Dark brown with slight cloudiness in the left eye (cataracts, age-related)', N'Medium warm bronze—a harmonious blend of East Asian base warmed by Sub-Saharan African melanin and Indigenous American ancestry, creating a rich, complex tan that deepens to warm copper in natural light', N'Weathered and deeply lined—his face bears the creases of decades spent outdoors and in poorly ventilated salvage yards. His bone structure reflects his mixed heritage: moderate, slightly rounded cheekbones with subtle angularity from East Asian ancestry, a prominent and square jaw strengthened by Sub-Saharan African genetic contribution, and a broader bridge to his nose with slight flare at the nostrils. His features remain clearly defined beneath the age. Stubble is constant; he shaves irregularly.', N'Right arm entirely cybernetic from the shoulder down—a heavy industrial prosthetic in matte gunmetal, visibly older than modern models (approximately 35+ years old). The seam where it joins his shoulder is reinforced with band-aid-style mismatched plating in slightly different shades of gray. Multiple repair welds are visible along the forearm and wrist. The hand is articulated but has a deliberate, non-humanoid design—wider palm, reinforced digits, no attempt at biological mimicry. A faint scar tissue ridge marks where the prosthetic was originally installed at the shoulder.', N'He moves with the deliberate economy of an older man who has learned where his center of gravity sits. Standing, he favors his left side slightly, shoulder cocked back. His right arm—the prosthetic—moves with mechanical precision but without hesitation; he has inhabited it long enough that it reads as natural to him. He sits heavily and rises slowly. His hands are rarely still; even in conversation, his left hand fidgets—turning something over, feeling its weight and balance.', N'Tier 4 working-class practical. He wears heavy canvas cargo pants stained with years of grease and rust, held up with a braided leather belt. His shirts are always long-sleeved—industrial cotton or poly-blend, usually gray or dark blue, with large pockets and reinforced stress points. Over this, a sleeveless vest in charcoal leather, old but meticulously maintained, with deep pockets for tools and small components. His shoes are steel-toed work boots, scuffed and resoled multiple times. He wears a pair of fingerless leather gloves on his left hand only; his right prosthetic requires no protection. No jewelry, no visible corpo branding, no pretense. Everything he wears is functional and long past fashionable.', N'Six years ago, he installed a neural interface on a young woman who couldn''t afford licensed care. The installation went wrong — a component fault he didn''t catch — and she lost partial motor function in her left hand. He found out indirectly months later. He has been quietly sending anonymous Quanta transfers to what he believes is her account ever since, but he has never confirmed she received them or that the account is still hers.', N'Minimal and technical. Speaks in parts descriptions, condition assessments, and prices. Personal statements are short and final.', N'Slow, deliberate. Very long pauses between sentences. Does not fill silence.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gizem_ito');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e9-7390-bb48-ef67cc933db2', N'Etsuko Suzuki', N'Etsuko', N'', N'Suzuki', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown — lives in a worker housing block; operates across Aurochs Medical Complex, Geartown clinic strip, and occasional pickups in The Narrows, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Bio-waste disposal technician contracted to Aurochs Medical Complex and several smaller Geartown clinics', N'Contracted to Aurochs Medical Complex via a Helix Biosystems facility services subsidiary; also holds personal service contracts with three independent Geartown clinics', N'Etsuko Suzuki is compact and sharp-featured, with Croatian-Ghanaian heritage expressed in light brown skin, high cheekbones, and eyes that are a very pale hazel — almost gold — with cat-slit pupils from a geneware mod they got at twenty-two and have never regretted. Their hair is kept shaved on the sides and dyed an aggressive copper on top, the color of old wiring. They are almost always in their work coveralls, which are immaculate — they have a protocol for decontamination that borders on ceremonial and makes their colleagues slightly nervous.

Bio-waste disposal for a medical complex is, they will tell you, the most undervalued intelligence-gathering position in the building. What a hospital throws away is a complete record of what it does, and Etsuko Suzuki has been reading that record for six years with increasing fascination. They are not doing anything with the information yet. They are cataloguing it. They have a particular running interest in the discrepancy between what Aurochs Medical Complex''s public reporting says it disposes of and what Etsuko Suzuki actually removes — the numbers do not match in ways that do not have an obvious innocent explanation, and Etsuko Suzuki is by temperament someone who finds the non-obvious explanation more interesting.', N'Unexpected information source — knows what Aurochs disposes of and when; can detect chemical or biological anomalies by smell; local color that reveals the infrastructure of medicine nobody thinks about; potential whistleblower or ally for investigations into Aurochs or Helix', N'', N'Cat-slit pupil geneware (pale hazel/gold irises); olfactory sensitivity enhancement (professional-grade, for hazardous material detection); chemical exposure dermal barrier (subdermal, medical-grade protection against biological contamination)', N'Two early-morning routes covering the Geartown clinic strip, then the main Aurochs Medical Complex pickup cycle by 1000; afternoons doing processing and documentation at the Aurochs waste facility; evenings studying disposal manifests they have retained copies of, which they are not supposed to have.', N'Etsuko Suzuki, GLMZ, compact 163cm biohazard processor with multi-continental phenotype: warm golden-brown skin blending East Asian cheekbone structure with Sub-Saharan African feature fullness, pale hazel-gold eyes with vertical cat-slit geneware pupils, copper-dyed crown undercut with dark regrown sides. Immaculate graphite gray Aurochs Medical Complex coveralls with sealed seams, tactical boots, nitrile gloves tucked at waist. Faded chemical scars visible on inner forearms, small biosafety tattoo on right wrist. Precise posture, hands alert and ready, eyes tracking detail. Sterile laboratory or decontamination chamber background, cool clinical lighting with slight amber warmth reflecting skin tone, slight forward lean, obsessive spatial awareness. Neo-noir work-tier aesthetic, cleanroom-pristine despite hazardous environment. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora phenotype: East Asian 40.9% and Southeast Asian 29.1% form the primary genetic foundation, blended with significant Sub-Saharan African ancestry 22.3%, minor Hispanic/Latin American 6.4%, and trace South Asian 1.3%. This creates a distinctive multi-continental appearance where East/Southeast Asian facial structure (cheekbone prominence, eye shape) integrates with Sub-Saharan African features (full lips, warm skin depth) and Hispanic/Latin warmth in overall tone—a true genetic synthesis rather than distinct appearance.', 163, 54, N'Compact and wiry, densely muscled from years of handling biohazard containers and processing equipment; economical movements with no excess', N'Copper dyed on crown; natural dark brown on sides where regrown stubble shows', N'Undercut with aggressive copper dye on top, shaved close on sides', N'Short', N'Pale hazel-gold with vertical cat-slit pupils (geneware mod, age 22)', N'Rich warm golden-brown with amber undertones, the result of East/Southeast Asian base warmed and deepened by Sub-Saharan African heritage; medium-high saturation with natural luminosity that reads as both warm and substantial', N'Blended facial structure: East Asian cheekbone definition and eye placement softened and broadened by Sub-Saharan African feature influence; full lips with definition; smooth skin in warm golden-brown showing minor chemical scarring on forearms (faded, managed); perpetually clean despite occupation, with a slightly austere appearance', N'Vertical cat-slit pupils in pale hazel irises (unmistakable geneware signature). No other visible chrome. Subdermal chemical barrier and olfactory enhancement are invisible.', N'Moves with precision and economy — no wasted motion. Slight forward tilt when concentrating. Hands positioned ready, fingers often alert as though evaluating a space for contamination vectors. Eyes track detail obsessively.', N'Almost exclusively in immaculate work coveralls — Aurochs Medical Complex issue, graphite gray, modified with extra cargo pockets and sealed seams. Decontamination protocol means they are perpetually pristine despite the work. Beneath: plain gray thermals. Worn tactical boots rated for chemical splash. Thin nitrile gloves often tucked into coverall waistband even off-hours. Tier 4 working-class aesthetic with obsessive maintenance.', N'The disposal discrepancy involves a consistent volume of neural tissue waste — specifically, tissue consistent with augmentation extraction surgery — that does not appear in any patient record or surgical log Davorka has been able to access. The volume suggests this has been happening for at least two years. They have samples. They stored them improperly at first and had to start over, which cost them four months of data.', N'Functional and technical in professional contexts; privately uses a wry, oblique style full of euphemism and analogy — talks around things they find too large to say directly', N'Even and unhurried, with occasional precise accelerations when they find something genuinely interesting', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'etsuko_suzuki');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6bb-7cd6-a0bb-efab6e6b44a3', N'Dinara Hwang', N'Dinara', N'', N'Hwang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — operates from a community center three blocks from Mrs. Chen''s shop, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Crew lead and community defense coordinator — Last Light', N'Last Light', N'Dinara Hwang is the lowest-paid runner in GLMZ and the most respected person below Tier 3. Last Light takes contracts that nobody else will touch: protecting excluded families from eviction squads, escorting debt-marked citizens through corporate checkpoints, standing between the Gray Zone communities and the security forces that treat them as jurisdictional noise. The pay is whatever the clients can afford, which is usually nothing. Ruth doesn''t care. The work is the work.

She was a public defender in GLMZ''s municipal court system for eighteen years — one of the last attorneys who represented excluded citizens in jurisdictional disputes. When the court system was privatized and representation became a billable service priced beyond the excluded''s reach, Ruth kept working. Pro bono. For free. The bar association suspended her license for ''unprofessional conduct.'' She appealed. The appeal court was also privatized. She stopped appealing and started operating outside the legal system that had abandoned the people she served.

Ruth is tall, broad, with the bearing of a woman who has stood in courtrooms and stared down corporate attorneys and felt nothing but the certainty of purpose. Her hair is silver, worn natural, and her face carries the particular beauty of someone who has been angry for thirty years and hasn''t let the anger eat her. She wears practical clothes and carries herself like a person who has decided what she is for and will not be moved.', N'Ruth drives the stories about the cost of doing the right thing. Last Light''s operations don''t end in heist scores or data extraction — they end in small victories that prevent larger tragedies, paid for with exhaustion, poverty, and the slow erosion of hope. Ruth is the moral center of the Gray Zone runner ecosystem and the character who asks: what does it cost to be good in a world that doesn''t pay for it?', N'', N'Legal database cortex — complete GLMZ jurisdictional code, precedent, and regulatory framework stored in long-term memory. Outdated now, but the institutional knowledge remains valuable. Voice amplification implant for addressing crowds and confronting security forces — her voice carries. Stress-monitoring biosystem that alerts her when her blood pressure enters dangerous territory. No combat augmentations.', N'Wakes at 0530. Checks overnight messages from community contacts for protection requests, eviction notices, or security force movements in the Gray Zone. Prioritizes cases with her crew. Spends the day on active protection work — legal intervention when possible, physical presence when necessary. Evenings she holds open hours at the community center for anyone who needs help navigating the system. Cooks for the crew because nobody else will. Sleeps five hours and considers it a luxury.', N'Dinara Hwang, 183cm tall woman with warm medium-deep brown skin blending Hispanic/Latin American golden tones with East Asian and South Asian warmth. Natural silver-gray medium-length hair, strong defined cheekbones with subtle East Asian monolid influences, direct dark brown eyes reading decades of experience. Three-inch pale scar across left cheekbone, faint burn mark on right hand. Dressed in worn charcoal work jacket over muted long-sleeve shirt, reinforced jeans, practical work boots. Faded gavel-and-hand tattoo on inner right wrist. Standing with even weight distribution, hands still at rest, direct eye contact. 2226 neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, dim industrial lighting with cool neon undertones, worn community center or legal aid office background. Cinematic photorealism, weathered dignity, justice worker aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (49.4%) with significant East Asian (32.0%) and South Asian (18.6%) ancestry. This creates a complexion that blends warm golden and olive undertones from Latin American heritage with the subtle features of East Asian ancestry and the warmth of South Asian skin tones, resulting in a rich, multifaceted appearance. The genetic combination manifests in defined cheekbones with slight monolid influences, warm-toned skin with depth and luminosity, and facial structure that reads as distinctly multicontinental.', 183, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial without excess weight. The build of someone who has spent decades standing — courtroom posture translated into physical presence. Chest and shoulders carry muscular definition from consistent labor, not augmentation.', N'Natural silver-gray', N'Worn loose and natural, sometimes pulled back with a simple band when working', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Warm medium to deep brown with golden and olive undertones reflecting the blend of 49.4% Hispanic/Latin American, 32.0% East Asian, and 18.6% South Asian ancestry. The complexion suggests sun exposure and carries genetic richness across multiple continental origins.', N'Lined face that reads as experience rather than age. Minimal grooming — no cosmetics, practical care. Skin weathered by decades of sun exposure and stress, but clear. A small scar on her left cheekbone from an eviction intervention gone physical three years ago. Facial bone structure reflects the blended heritage with defined cheekbones and jawline, subtle monolid influences from East Asian genetics, warm undertones from Latin American heritage, and the structural depth of South Asian ancestry. No visible acne or skin conditions.', N'None visible. The legal database cortex is entirely subcutaneous. The voice amplification implant is internal — visible only when she speaks with deliberate projection, at which point a faint subsonic vibration becomes perceptible in her chest. The stress-monitoring biosystem is subcutaneous; only occasionally visible as a faint LED indicator under the skin of her left wrist when activated.', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, ready to move in any direction without telegraph. Moves with economy of motion — no wasted gesture. Walks slowly but with intent. In conversation, she maintains direct eye contact and rarely looks away. Her hands are still when at rest. When she speaks with her voice amplified, there''s a slight shift in her shoulders as the implant engages.', N'Tier 4 practical — durable, non-corporate. Typically wears a dark grey or charcoal work jacket with deep pockets (often holding legal data-chips, communication devices, and community contact lists). Underneath, plain long-sleeve shirts in muted colors. Worn jeans with reinforced knees and a heavy canvas belt with a simple buckle. Work boots — practical, maintained, not fashionable. A thin watch on her left wrist, older model, still functional. No jewelry except the faded wrist tattoo. In colder months, a long coat that has been patched multiple times. Everything is functional. Nothing is ornamental.', N'She was offered a position with the Quiet Table two years ago — Glass Maren wanted her community contacts and her legal knowledge. The position would have paid enough to fund Last Light''s operations for a decade. She refused because working for an information broker would compromise the trust the excluded have in her. She has never told her crew, and on the worst nights, she wonders if the refusal was righteous or wasteful.', N'Legal, moral, grounded. She speaks in the language of rights, obligations, and precedent. The courtroom training never left. When she addresses a crowd, the voice carries the weight of prepared argument. In private, she''s warmer, more tired.', N'Deliberate, authoritative, with the rhythm of someone who has been making closing arguments for three decades. She builds sentences like cases — evidence, then conclusion.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dinara_hwang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a648-75a6-b06d-efc0d539f1f6', N'Adimabua Larsdóttir-Olofsson', N'Adimabua', N'', N'Larsdóttir-Olofsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 56, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Shallowgrave, Ondaatje''s Tea and Provisions, Mercy Lane off the Sump Road transit stop, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Bookmaker and numbers runner — operates an illegal betting house out of a tea and meal shop', N'Nominally independent; longstanding informal arrangement with both the Shallowgrave block council and a mid-tier numbers syndicate that uses her as a distribution node', N'Adimabua Larsdóttir-Olofsson is short, broad-shouldered, and carries herself with the composed authority of someone who has run a complicated household for decades—which, in a sense, she has. Her hair is silver-white, cut practically short, and her hands are large and permanently warm-looking from years behind a steam counter. Her skin is a deep warm brown marked by two old vertical scars along her left jaw from an incident she has never explained to anyone''s satisfaction. She wears reading glasses on a chain and uses them as a prop—taking them on and off, gesturing with them—when she''s negotiating. Her shop is genuinely beloved: the tea is actually good, the rice-and-lentil specials actually excellent, and the back room is where the real business happens.

Adimabua Larsdóttir-Olofsson is the kind of person who has been essential to a community for so long that even people who morally disapprove of gambling come to her when they''re in trouble—not to place a bet, but because she knows everything and her counsel is free if you''re eating. She has a gift for making people feel they are the most important problem in the room, which is a talent both for hospitality and for extracting information. She is genuinely warm and genuinely hard, and the line between those two things moves at her discretion. She has been fined four times and arrested once (charges dropped). She tithes ten percent of her operation''s income to the Shallowgrave block mutual aid fund, which is not tax-deductible and not public but is the reason three hundred families have eaten during lean months.', N'Community anchor and information hub, moral center of Shallowgrave, quest giver for local problems, reliable source of gossip and history, potential ally with serious resources in the local community fabric.', N'', N'None beyond a hearing aid implant in the left ear—medical necessity, basic model. She has declined all cosmetic mods on principle and mentions this when it comes up.', N'Opens the shop at 0630 for the morning transit crowd, runs the visible operation through lunch, hands the counter to her nephew in the afternoon while she manages back-room business—taking bets, paying out, maintaining the ledger—then returns to the counter for evening service.', N'Adimabua Larsdóttir-Olofsson, 56-year-old woman with warm deep brown skin blending Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and Northern European heritage, silver-white short hair swept back, dark perceptive eyes with pronounced crow''s feet, strong defined cheekbones with facial fullness, two parallel thin scars on left jaw. Worn linen apron over dark cotton in a busy neo-noir noodle shop, 2226, steam rising from kitchen work, hands calloused and capable, simple steel watch visible, utilitarian hearing aid behind left ear, reading glasses on silver chain, deliberate posture at counter, warm attentive expression, cool-warm shop lighting with neon accent, gritty working-class authenticity, worn but impeccably clean clothes, no chrome augmentation visible, embodiment of decades of focused kitchen work and sharp negotiation, neo-noir Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone diner aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shallowgrave', N'local', N'Shallowgrave', N'Southeast Asian (40.4%) foundation creating the dominant warm brown base, enriched by Sub-Saharan African (20.1%) depth and complexity, tempered by Northern European (31.0%) cool undertones and luminosity, with secondary influences from East Asian (5.2%), Central Asian (2.0%), and Middle Eastern (1.3%) ancestry. A multilayered genetic blend resulting in warm medium-to-deep brown skin with golden, olive, and subtle reddish undertones—the Southeast Asian warmth anchored by African depth and lifted by Northern European luminescence.', 156, 68, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, carrying weight with the structural efficiency of someone built for endurance rather than speed. Forearms thickened from decades of counter work—lifting pots, wringing cloths, gripping ledgers.', N'Silver-white, natural gray from age', N'Practical, close-cropped, swept back from her forehead with no styling product—pure function', N'Short', N'Dark brown, warm and perceptive', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with golden, olive, and subtle reddish undertones. Southeast Asian ancestry dominates the base, creating rich warmth enhanced by Sub-Saharan African depth and complexity, while Northern European heritage introduces cool luminous counterbalances and a gentle glow beneath the surface. The blend reads as deeply warm with sophisticated undertone layering.', N'Face lined with the wear of 56 years and thousands of negotiating conversations; crow''s feet pronounced at the outer corners of her eyes; a quality of settled centeredness in her expression. Minimal makeup—perhaps a trace of kohl on workdays. Jaw and neck unmarked save for the two vertical scars. Facial structure reflects Southeast Asian-dominant ancestry with rounded cheekbone definition and strong proportionate jaw, enriched by Sub-Saharan African contribution to facial fullness and depth, and Northern European sharpness to cheekbone prominence and brow structure. Eyes set with the slight epicanthic fold characteristic of Southeast Asian heritage, deepened by African and Central Asian influences.', N'A small flesh-tone hearing aid implant visible behind her left ear when her hair is pulled back—medical-grade, no cosmetic modification. The device is utilitarian and un-hidden. No other visible augmentation; she explicitly declines chrome on principle.', N'She moves with economy and intention—no wasted motion. When standing at a counter, rooted and present. When seated for business, she leans back slightly, creating a small distance that feels like neutrality rather than coldness. Hands gesture deliberately when speaking; she uses her reading glasses (on a chain around her neck) as a negotiating tool, removing and replacing them with theatrical precision. Her default expression is attentive and warm, but her eyes track everything in a room simultaneously.', N'Tier 4 working-class practicality. In the shop: a dark linen apron over loose cotton trousers in dark blue or charcoal, a long-sleeved undyed cotton shirt (rolled to the elbow in warm weather), sturdy non-slip kitchen shoes. In the back room: the apron comes off; she wears a structured dark jacket of synthetic wool, well-maintained but not new. Reading glasses on a silver-plated chain. No jewelry beyond a simple steel watch and a thin band on her left ring finger (wedding or memorial—never explained). Her clothes are always clean, often still damp along the collar from the steam of her own kitchen. No visible corp logos or status symbols. Everything suggests: I have been doing this for decades and I will continue doing this for decades.', N'The numbers syndicate she works with has recently been absorbed by a network with significantly less ethical scruples about debt collection. Her arrangement predates the acquisition and she has not been told of the change. Two of her regular bettors have already been approached by new collectors using methods she would never have permitted, and she doesn''t yet know the calls are coming from inside her own arrangement.', N'Rich and colloquial, moves between warmth and precise hardness without warning. Proverbs—her own invented ones as often as inherited ones.', N'Unhurried and warm in public-facing mode; becomes crisper and quieter when doing business.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'adimabua_larsd_ttir_olofsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6be-7690-9bc1-efe02a361d5c', N'Guleed Rahman', N'Guleed', N'', N'Rahman', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lives in Copperhead; operates the Deepwell Station to Kessler Interchange subsurface line, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Ferrogate Transit operator, subsurface rail line', N'Ferrogate Transit (mid-level ferrogate transit operator)', N'Guleed Rahman is a thick-set man with a round, deeply lined face that has settled into an expression of benign exhaustion he''s been wearing since approximately age thirty-five. His skin is a warm dark brown with reddish undertones. He keeps a short beard going silver at the chin, and his hair — what remains of it — is cropped tight. His eyes are augmented: a Ferrogate Transit standard-issue retinal overlay that displays line status, passenger loads, and signal data, the irises permanently lit with a dim amber grid pattern that is just visible to anyone looking closely. He wears his uniform with the collar open one button past regulation and has for eleven years without consequence. He has a cat tail — a geneware addition he got in his thirties on a dare from his youngest kid and kept because he finds the autonomic movements diagnostic: when the tail is still, he is calm; when it lashes, he is not.

Guleed Rahman has operated the same subsurface line for sixteen years. He knows every vibration and groan of the tunnel, every station''s ELF personality — Deepwell''s resident ELF is old and cantankerous and he has been leaving it audio recordings of football matches as offerings for a decade, and the signal has never failed him once. He is not a man of great ambition or dramatic action. He is a man who does his job with precision and has turned showing up reliably into a form of personal philosophy. He is also, beneath the exhausted affability, quietly furious about what Ferrogate Transit has been doing to its operator compensation and maintenance budgets, and he has been attending union meetings for two years.', N'Mobile transit access and route knowledge. Understands the underground topology of GLMZ better than most. Union activity puts him in contact with organized labor networks across the city. Can move people or information through the subsurface system. A grounding, realistic portrait of working-class institutional life.', N'', N'Ferrogate-issue retinal overlay with transit grid display (amber, always-on). Cat tail geneware (black, autonomous).', N'Rides the Ferrogate as a passenger to Deepwell Station, picks up his operator''s booth at 0600, runs his line for eight hours, attends to a maintenance log that is increasingly fictional because the parts don''t exist, and gets home in time to eat dinner with whoever in his household is awake.', N'Guleed Rahman, 178cm tall, solid thick-set operator in his late 40s, warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones blending South Asian, East Asian, Southeast Asian, and Indigenous American heritage. Dark brown hair graying at temples, cropped military-short. Deep lines etched around eyes and mouth from years of fatigue, subtle epicanthic eye variation, moderately broad facial structure, short unkempt salt-and-pepper beard. Warm brown eyes with faint amber grid overlay visible from retinal augmentation visible in the dim light. Black cat tail with natural fur texture extending from base of spine, twitching lazily. Slight forward slouch, wearing operator-standard dark tech wear, standing in moody subsurface facility lighting with cool blue-green ambiance. GLMZ, worn down but competent, tired acceptance in expression. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lives in Copperhead; operates the Deepwell Station to Kessler Interchange subsurface line', N'local', N'Lives in Copperhead; operates the Deepwell Station to Kessler Interchange subsurface line', N'Complex Pan-Asian diaspora blend with South Asian plurality (48%) anchoring warm medium-brown skin tones, supplemented by East Asian (15%), Southeast Asian (14%), Indigenous American (11%), and Northern European (10%) ancestry. This genetic mixture produces a distinctive facial structure: moderate bone breadth from South Asian heritage, subtle epicanthic eye variation from East Asian and Southeast Asian components, and the underlying warmth that comes from Indigenous American ancestry mixing with Northern European paleness. The result is an individual whose features reflect the specific gravity of the Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone''s Ubiquitous Diaspora—no single continental identity dominates, but rather creates a harmonious mid-range warm tone and balanced facial proportion.', 178, 94, N'Thick-set, heavy through the torso and shoulders with a solid, unmovable quality. Settled into middle age with the kind of weight that comes from years of sedentary operator work and shift-meal irregularity rather than lack of strength.', N'Dark brown, graying at temple and crown', N'Cropped tight to the scalp, military-neat but unmaintained, giving an impression of pragmatism rather than care', N'Short', N'Warm brown with persistent amber grid overlay visible in dim light; retinal augmentation creates a faint luminescent pattern across the iris', N'Warm medium-brown with subtle golden undertones and traces of peachy warmth from Northern European ancestry mixing with the deeper tones of South Asian, East Asian, and Southeast Asian heritage. Even complexion across face and visible neck/chest.', N'Deeply lined face, particularly around the eyes and mouth, with the grooved appearance of someone who has worn the same tired expression for nearly a decade. Skin shows the pallor of subsurface work—minimal natural light exposure—creating a matte finish over the underlying warm brown tone. Facial structure features moderately broad bone structure from South Asian heritage, softened by Southeast Asian influences and refined by East Asian components, with subtle epicanthic variation at the eye corners. Short salt-and-pepper beard kept regulation-length but slightly unkempt at the edges.', N'Ferrogate-standard retinal display overlay with persistent amber grid pattern visible in both eyes; autonomous black cat tail with realistic fur and independent movement (lashes when agitated, still when calm)', N'Slight forward slouch from years in an operator''s booth; moves with deliberate, economical gestures. Stands with weight favoring one foot, creating a casual lean. Cat tail articulates independently—still when focused or calm, quick lashing movements when frustrated or processing information. Overall carriage suggests contained weariness rather than defeat.', N'', N'His maintenance logs are falsified — not to cover up negligence, but because the truth of the tunnel''s condition would trigger an automatic service suspension, and he knows from the last suspension that the line serves communities that have no alternative transit. He is holding the line together with inspection waivers and prayers to Deepwell''s ELF, and he is running out of both.', N'Warm, declarative working-class GLMZ dialect with Caribbean English cadences from his Barbadian grandfather''s side. Very funny in a dry, understated way. Technical and precise about transit systems.', N'Measured and unhurried, like someone who has announced the same stations ten thousand times and learned that rushing words achieves nothing.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'guleed_rahman');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5e8-7580-8914-f047b5194601', N'Enola Quartey', N'Enola', N'', N'Quartey', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 37, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Dockside — Lake Michigan waterfront, smuggler territory, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'Electronic and physical observation expert — surveillance specialist', N'Freelance — available through Circuit fixers', N'Enola Quartey are lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 37, the augmentation scarring around their temples and jawline tells a story of installation by someone who prioritized function over aesthetics. The chrome is visible — retractable monofilament whip in left forearm — concealed weapon, devastating in — and they make no effort to hide it.

They grew up in the Narrows, where the walls are so close together you learn to fight in confined spaces or you learn to lose. They work as a surveillance specialist out of Dockside, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Enola Quartey describe them as a precision instrument — point them at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Daulet Petersen-Bah represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Their stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Retractable monofilament whip in left forearm — concealed weapon, devastating in close quarters. Neural dampener — blocks external hacking attempts, passive ICE in the brain', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Enola Quartey, GLMZ Dockside operative with lean angular build, deep warm-brown complexion with golden-bronze undertones from African and South Asian heritage blended with East Asian geometry, sharp cheekbones, steel-gray eyes with brown undertones. Platinum blonde hair with dark roots pulled tight into functional topknot, shaved sides showing temple augmentation scars. Visible chrome neural dampener ports at temples, crude suturing along left jawline. Wearing sleeveless ballistic tactical vest over dark compression shirt, reinforced fingerless leather gloves, oversized charcoal synthetic bomber jacket worn open, black cargo pants, combat boots with steel toe. Left forearm shows subtle chrome seam housing monofilament whip, pale burn scar on left hand contrasting against deep skin. Stands in predatory fighter''s stance, weight forward, tension in shoulders. Salt-worn Dockside operative aesthetic, industrial chrome accents, gritty worn textures. Neon-lit industrial setting, harsh shadows, neo-noir street lighting, moody and tense --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dockside', N'local', N'Dockside', N'Ubiquitous Diaspora blend with dominant Sub-Saharan African (41%) and South Asian (19.8%) ancestry, enriched by East Asian (15.9%), Southeast Asian (11.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (9.3%), and Eastern European (2.8%) admixture. This creates a distinctive multitonal phenotype: deep warm-brown base from African and South Asian dominance, with geometric cheekbone and eye structure influenced by East and Southeast Asian ancestry. The smaller Eastern European component adds subtle cool undertones visible in protected skin areas, creating a rich complexion that shifts between golden-bronze and deep mahogany depending on light and context.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with visible musculature — wiry strength rather than bulk, built for speed and precision. Shoulders slightly narrower than hips, giving an almost skeletal quality. Zero excess body fat.', N'Platinum blonde with dark roots showing 2–3 weeks of growth', N'Pulled back tight into a short, functional braid or topknot; styled for combat efficiency, not aesthetics', N'Short to Medium', N'Steel gray with warm brown undertones, natural', N'Deep warm-brown complexion with regional variation — darker on sun-exposed forearms, neck, and face from Dockside work; warmer golden undertones visible at wrists and torso from South and Southeast Asian heritage blending with African depth. The multitonal blend creates a lived-in appearance that shifts between rich bronze and deep mahogany depending on light angle.', N'Sharp cheekbones with pronounced East and Southeast Asian geometry, angular jawline tempered by South Asian influence. Skin bears weathering from Dockside exposure — salt spray, wind burn. Minimal grooming; scarring around temples and along left jawline from augmentation surgery is deliberate and unhidden. Faint catharral lines around the eyes from chronic sleep deprivation.', N'Left forearm bears a subtle chrome seam running from wrist to mid-forearm where the monofilament whip is housed — appears as a thin metallic line under the skin when flexed. The seam is intentionally visible; makes no effort to conceal it. Faint LED indicator (inactive/dark) embedded at the wrist junction. Neural dampener ports visible at the temples as small chrome nodes, roughly 5mm in diameter, slightly raised from skin.', N'Stands with weight forward on the balls of their feet — a fighter''s stance even at rest. Movements are economical and precise; no wasted motion. Carries tension in the shoulders and neck. Head turns in controlled arcs rather than fluid motion — suggests constant threat assessment. Left arm hangs slightly away from the body, ready for deployment. Walking gait is measured, light-footed, almost predatory.', N'Tier 3–4 street operative. Black cargo pants (reinforced synthetic weave, multiple thigh pockets) tucked into ankle-high combat boots with steel toe and kevlar reinforcement. Sleeveless tactical vest worn over a dark long-sleeved compression shirt — the vest bears ballistic plating visible at the shoulders and torso. Fingerless gloves in worn black leather, left hand reinforced at the palm and wrist. Jacket: oversized charcoal bomber jacket (synthetic leather, Dockside-grade) worn open, ideal for concealing or rapidly accessing tools. Belt: industrial-grade synthetic with reinforced buckle, laden with carabiners and attachment points. No jewelry. Boots and vest show salt staining and wear consistent with regular fieldwork.', N'', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Halting — speaks in fragments, reassembles thoughts in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'enola_quartey');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a612-704d-aa82-f065e596f671', N'Dariusz Kimura-Tamale', N'Dariusz', N'', N'Kimura-Tamale', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 50, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Glassway — corporate-adjacent retail district, heavy surveillance, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Prototype theft and corporate tech acquisition — tech retriever', N'Independent — loose crew affiliations', N'Dariusz Kimura-Tamale is slight and easy to overlook, which is exactly the point. At 50, her face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and she has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct ne — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Dariusz Kimura-Tamale plans to keep it that way. She works as a tech retriever out of Glassway, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

she is not the most talented tech retriever in GLMZ, but she might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Fatoumata Fujita-Mensah represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Her stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access. Subdermal armor plating across torso and forearms — military surplus, scratched serial numbers', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Dariusz Kimura-Tamale, 162cm lean frame, weathered face with luminous warm brown skin reflecting East Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. High sculpted cheekbones, dark natural eyes with predatory focus, tight dark brown braid with silver threading at temples, thin scars along jawline and eyebrow. Black synthetic-weave tactical jacket, fitted cargo pants, matte boots. Chrome neural interface jack at skull base glowing faintly, subdermal armor plating visible as scratched geometric patterns on forearms. Standing in neon-lit 2226 megacity alley, hands ready near torso, coiled tension despite stillness. Cool blue and amber lighting catching the geometric scars and interface jack. Mood: hardened field runner, economical and lethal. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Glassway', N'local', N'Glassway', N'East Asian (70.6%) with significant South Asian (16.8%) and Sub-Saharan African (12.6%) ancestry. Dominant East Asian bone structure — high, prominent cheekbones and graceful facial proportions — refined by South Asian fullness in the lower face and Sub-Saharan African richness in skin tone and eye intensity. A striking phenotype from the Ubiquitous Diaspora: sharp East Asian angularity softened by South Asian facial geometry, with warm golden undertones from Sub-Saharan African heritage creating luminous depth.', 162, 52, N'Lean and compact, muscle definition visible in forearms and shoulders from years of field work. No excess weight — every gram serves a purpose. Posture suggests coiled readiness despite apparent fragility.', N'Natural dark brown with silver-gray threading at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, utilitarian braid. Practical, no vanity. A few strands always escaping.', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, natural — no augmentation. The pupils track with predatory precision.', N'Rich warm brown with golden undertones. The blend of East Asian, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage creates luminous depth — high melanin content with warm, radiant undertones that suggest both temperate and equatorial ancestry.', N'Weathered, sun-damaged from fieldwork across multiple climate zones. Lines around eyes and mouth from fifty years of living hard. Skin pulled tight over high, sculpted cheekbones characteristic of East Asian ancestry, with fullness in lower face and lips reflecting South Asian geometry. Warm, rich undertone throughout, creating a cohesive glow across facial planes. Small scar above left eyebrow, faint but visible on close inspection.', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull — chrome port, slightly luminous when powered, visible when hair is pulled back. Subdermal armor plating visible as subtle raised geometric patterns across both forearms and wrists when wearing short sleeves — scratched military-grade chrome, serial numbers deliberately filed smooth.', N'Moves economically, every gesture purposeful. No wasted motion. When still, she has the quality of someone pretending to be inert while actually assessing exits and threat vectors. Hands rest naturally near torso, ready to move. Shoulders slightly hunched — not weakness, but a conscious minimization of profile.', N'Tier 3-4 working runner aesthetic. Black or dark gray synthetic-weave jacket with reinforced seams and hidden pockets — well-maintained but deliberately unmarked. Fitted tactical cargo pants, deep pockets, reinforced knees. Matte-finish boots, comfortable for running. Minimal jewelry except a worn QUANTA-chip reader on left wrist. Clothes are chosen for function over fashion, but they fit well — sign of someone who respects her tools, including clothing. No corporate logos. No gang colors. Nothing that marks allegiance.', N'', N'Multilingual fragments — switches languages mid-thought, not for privacy but because some concepts only fit in specific tongues.', N'Halting — speaks in fragments, reassembles thoughts in real time.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dariusz_kimura_tamale');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a64a-7595-8d2f-f079da23cb91', N'Kira Hong', N'Kira', N'', N'Hong', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Meridian Core — NeoCortex subsidiary housing, mid-tier, near LaSalle and Jackson', N'NeoCortex operative — the woman who placed the Jakarta contract on Kyle', N'NeoCortex Industries (coerced)', N'Kira Hong is what happens when a good person is fed into a machine that runs on compliance. She has a round, lined face that looks like it was built for warmth — crow''s feet from decades of real smiling, not the corporate kind. Her hands are a doctor''s hands: steady, precise, habitually gentle. She keeps her gray-streaked hair pulled back in a practical knot and wears clothes that are always slightly too formal for wherever she is, as if she is perpetually arriving from somewhere more important. She looks like someone''s mother. She is someone''s mother. That is the entire problem.

NeoCortex recruited her twenty years ago as a neurological researcher — legitimate work, published papers, the kind of science that helps people. Then the facility work began, and by the time she understood what Program Atlas actually was, her daughter Mila was on a NeoCortex educational scholarship that doubled as a hostage contract. Kira Hong has spent fifteen years making choices she cannot live with to protect someone she cannot lose.

The Jakarta contract — hiring a freelancer named Kyle to do a job that would position him for device installation — was one of those choices. She has thought about Kyle every day since.', N'Kira is the human face of the system that broke Kyle. She is not a villain — she is a mother who made an impossible choice and has been living inside the consequences for a decade. Her arrival forces Kyle to confront the fact that the people who hurt him were also being hurt.', N'Clinical warmth — the careful precision of a doctor delivering bad news to someone she cares about. Longer sentences than Kyle, more structured, but with the same weight per word. She notices faces before objects, hands before weapons. No facet tags. Her internal conflict is quieter, expressed through pauses and self-corrections.', N'Standard Tier 3 corporate medical suite — nothing experimental.', N'Works at a NeoCortex subsidiary hospital. Comes home to an empty apartment. Cooks. Reads Kyle''s telemetry. Writes in her journal. Does not sleep well.', N'A woman in her early sixties with warm ivory skin, distinctly East Asian bone structure softened by African and Northern European genetic warmth. Dark gray hair pulled back severely in a practical knot. Gray-blue eyes with subtle iridescent implant shimmer. Pronounced crow''s feet and deep smile lines. Thin white scar through left eyebrow. Wearing a tailored charcoal blazer and pressed white cotton shirt buttoned to throat, dark trousers. Platinum wedding band on left hand. Clinical posture, forward-leaning, hands in constant small motion. Understated professional bearing. GLMZ basement fluorescent lighting casting cool-warm shadows across her face. GLMZ, institutional setting, atmosphere of suppressed tension and buried history. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Meridian Core', N'local', N'Meridian Core', N'Predominantly East Asian (78.2%) with Northern European (11.6%) and Sub-Saharan African (10.2%) ancestry. The blend creates distinctly East Asian bone structure—moderate, refined cheekbones and eye shape—softened and warmed by African genetic expression in skin undertone and lip fullness, with Northern European influence visible in eye color and subtle complexion depth. The result is a face of striking clarity: unmistakably Asian in architecture, but with unexpected warmth and dimension that prevents any single-ancestry reading.', 168, 62, N'Lean, slightly worn from decades of precise lab work and institutional living. Shoulders held with the careful tension of someone carrying invisible weight. Posture erect but not rigid—the body language of a person who has learned to make herself smaller.', N'Dark gray with residual black-brown at the roots', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical knot at the nape of the neck. No ornament, no variance.', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Gray-blue, slightly faded with faint iridescence from infrared ocular implants visible only in bright light', N'Warm ivory to light beige—pale from interior fluorescent work but with natural golden-warm undertones from the blended ancestry. The Sub-Saharan and Northern European genetics prevent washed-out pallor, creating instead a luminous quality beneath the institutional fluorescence.', N'Face structure reflects East Asian ancestry with moderate, refined cheekbones and graceful eye placement. Pronounced crow''s feet radiating from the outer corners of both eyes. Deep nasolabial lines etched from forty years of smiling, now permanent. Skin texture shows age but is meticulously maintained, with warm undertones across the mid-face and temples from the African and Northern European genetic components. Minimal makeup—always practical lipstick, nothing more. Expression naturally trustworthy, which she has learned to leverage.', N'Subtle infrared ocular implants behind natural eyes—visible only as faint iridescence in bright light. Left hand bears a NeoCortex corporate medical access port on inner wrist, a small silver interface plate no larger than a postage stamp, always partially covered by sleeve cuff. Otherwise no visible chrome—deliberately kept unremarkable.', N'Moves with clinical precision; hands in constant, small motion—gesturing while speaking, adjusting things compulsively, never fully at rest. When standing, weight distributed evenly, balanced. When sitting, perches slightly forward, ready to stand. Default expression attentive, almost worried. Makes eye contact for exactly long enough to seem engaged, then looks away. Stillness has a quality of suppressed motion, like a spring held compressed.', N'Always slightly overdressed, as if from a board meeting or heading to one. Tier 3 corporate-adjacent: tailored charcoal or navy blazers, cream or white cotton shirts pressed and buttoned to throat, dark practical trousers hanging well. No logos, no flash. Single silver-gray hooded rain jacket from mid-tier corp supplier. Closed-toe shoes always—comfortable walking shoes in black or neutral tones, meticulously maintained. One thin platinum wedding band on left ring finger despite eight-year widowhood. Small embedded watch face on inner left wrist cuff. No other jewelry.', N'She has the maintenance codes for Kyle''s device. She could have deactivated it remotely at any time in the last ten years. She did not because the device is the only proof that Program Atlas exists — and she needs that proof to destroy NeoCortex.', N'Clinical precision softened by genuine warmth. Uses medical terminology naturally but translates for laypeople.', N'Measured. Careful. Every sentence weighed before it leaves her mouth. Long pauses that are selection, not hesitation.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'kira_hong');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72a-70f6-bf52-f0848a89eced', N'Afsana Jaramillo', N'Afsana', N'', N'Jaramillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 83, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Avalon Quiet, Unit 9 — a well-appointed two-bedroom on the garden level, near Clark and Addison', N'Retired Zheng-Dao corporate mid-tier logistics planner, now quietly deteriorating in comfort', N'Formerly Zheng-Dao Logistics Division; Avalon Quiet Residents'' Garden Committee; The Breath (E.L.F., informal devotional relationship)', N'Afsana Jaramillo is the kind of person who becomes invisible by being exceptionally, consistently pleasant. They are small and soft-edged, with warm medium-brown skin, deep-set amber eyes, and cloud-white hair they wear loose to their shoulders. They have age-spot clusters along their forearms and the left side of their face, and move with a gentle deliberateness that comes partly from care and partly from a degenerative joint condition they manage with medication and denial. Their apartment is immaculate in the way that indicates a life organized around objects rather than people — every surface has something beautiful on it, carefully placed, and nothing has been moved in years.

Afsana Jaramillo spent forty-two years in Zheng-Dao''s logistics and supply chain division, rising to senior planner for their GLMZ distribution network. They were not cruel. They were also not, in any meaningful sense, asking the questions they should have been asking about what those supply chains were actually moving and for whom. They retired with a very comfortable pension, a full healthcare package, and a bone-deep sense of well-being that they have mistaken for peace. They host monthly dinners for Avalon Quiet residents, tend a small balcony garden with extraordinary devotion, and pray elaborately to the E.L.F. they believe inhabits their building''s HVAC system — an entity they call ''the Breath'' and leave small data offerings for daily.', N'Unreliable comfort — appears to be a gentle community grandmother figure but is a repository of Zheng-Dao institutional knowledge they don''t know they have; their innocence is itself a narrative complication; can provide insight into corporate supply chain operations without understanding what they''re revealing', N'', N'Zheng-Dao corporate health package includes: pharmaceutical management implant (wrist, auto-releases joint medication on schedule); enhanced cochlear implant (both ears, high-fidelity — they listen to music constantly on a private channel); retinal display (right eye, standard corporate issue, now used exclusively for recipes and gardening schedules)', N'Rises at 0700, leaves a data offering on the HVAC terminal in the hallway, tends the balcony garden for ninety minutes, then spends the morning on a long and elaborate cooking project. Afternoons involve sitting in the garden-facing chair reading, or visiting neighbors with food they do not need. Evenings are music and the ongoing project of cataloguing their art collection.', N'Afsana Jaramillo, 83-year-old neo-noir character, 158cm small frame, shoulder-length cloud-white hair with gentle waves. Deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, rich amber eyes with subtle retinal display grid visible in right eye. Fine-lined face with dignity, age-spot clusters on left temple and cheekbone, dense sun-freckles across forearms. Silver cochlear implant caps visible behind ears, pharmaceutical implant bulge on right wrist with faint blue indicator light. Wearing sage linen shirt, caramel wool cardigan, structured trousers, handmade chocolate brown leather slip-ons. Semi-precious stone bracelet, analog watch, small silver earrings. Slight shoulder stoop, stands with weight favoring left side, measured deliberate posture. Serene, distant expression, head tilted slightly. Indoor setting with warm ambient lighting casting shadows across age-spotted skin. GLMZ aesthetic, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, retired corporate logistics master in thoughtful repose --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Avalon Quiet', N'local', N'Avalon Quiet', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African ancestry (52.2%) blended with Hispanic/Latin American (26.0%), South Asian (16.4%), and Southeast Asian (5.4%) heritage. The combination creates rich, warm-toned features with deep saturation from African ancestry, complemented by the subtle bone structure and undertones contributed by South Asian and Latin American lineage, with delicate Southeast Asian influences in eye shape and facial proportions.', 158, 52, N'Small-framed and soft-edged, with the gentle roundness of age and comfort rather than frailty. Slight stoop to shoulders from decades of desk work, though they move with deliberate care', N'Cloud-white, natural silver', N'Loose and brushed, shoulder-length with gentle waves from age', N'Long', N'Deep amber (natural; right eye has faint retinal display grid visible at certain angles)', N'Deep warm brown with golden undertones, reflecting the dominant Sub-Saharan African heritage softened by the warm saturation of South Asian and Latin American ancestry—rich and luminous despite translucency from age, with subtle red-brown undertones that catch light warmly', N'Fine-lined face with dignity in the features; age-spot clusters along left cheekbone and jawline in deep brown tones, and dense freckled patterns across forearms. Strong, defined bone structure from African ancestry softened by age. Skin well-cared-for but showing the texture of eighty-three years. Minimal makeup—perhaps a touch of lip color, consistently applied. Fingernails kept short and clean, often with traces of garden soil.', N'Pharmaceutical management implant visible as a slight rectangular bulge under skin at inner right wrist, with faint blue indicator light cycling every thirty seconds. Enhanced cochlear implants visible as small silver caps behind both ears. Right eye shows faint amber grid pattern when light catches it at certain angles—retinal display at rest state. No other visible chrome or obvious modification.', N'Moves with a measured, almost ritualistic deliberateness. Each gesture is economical and precise—decades of organized logistics translated into physical habit. Stands with weight slightly favoring left side due to hip joint degradation managed by medication. When sitting, arranges themselves with attention to comfort and symmetry. When listening, head tilts slightly to engage enhanced hearing. Overall effect is serene and slightly distant, as if always listening to a private conversation', N'Tier 2 comfort wear—expensive, well-maintained, intentionally understated. Prefers soft natural fabrics: linen shirts in muted colors (cream, sage, warm gray), loose-fitting cardigans in wool blends, structured but forgiving trousers. Always wears low, supportive shoes—currently a pair of handmade leather slip-ons in chocolate brown. Small pieces of jewelry from the Zheng-Dao retirement package: a thin watch with analog face, a bracelet of semi-precious stones in warm tones, small silver earrings. Dresses as though preparing for a very important meeting that will never arrive. No logos, no corporate markers, but the quality speaks to decades of corporate stability', N'In 2178 Yldız approved a logistics rerouting through the Blackpipe Corridor that, they were told, was a routine efficiency change. It wasn''t — it was cover for relocating Zheng-Dao''s grey-market pharmaceutical distribution away from an audit zone. Eleven warehouse workers in Blackpipe lost their jobs when the ''efficient'' route bypassed them entirely. Yldız filed the paperwork and didn''t follow up. They have genuinely forgotten this. If shown the record, they would recognize their signature.', N'Warm, slightly formal, full of food metaphors and gardening analogies; uses old Zheng-Dao corporate euphemisms without noticing they''re euphemisms', N'Unhurried and gentle, with a lilting quality; tends to ask follow-up questions that redirect conversations toward pleasant topics', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'afsana_jaramillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a6-7df8-a493-f0872e3e5adb', N'Saanvi Bhattacharya', N'Saanvi', N'', N'Bhattacharya', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre — the Libre Community Creche, a converted ground-floor unit on Avenida Ferro, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Childcare worker and unofficial neighborhood children''s coordinator, Mexicantown Libre', N'Independent; Libre Community Creche; loosely aligned with the Mexicantown Libre neighborhood council', N'Saanvi Bhattacharya is small and perpetually in motion, with deep brown skin and natural hair she grows out in a puff that she clips bioluminescent beads into — low-grade geneware, hand-me-downs from a cousin, that pulse softly blue when she''s warm or excited and dim to almost nothing when she''s exhausted. She has a gap between her front teeth that makes her smile look like a door left open, and she smiles a lot, though never vaguely — there is always something specific she is smiling at. Her clothing is practical and loud: she wears colors like she is trying to argue with the grey of Mexicantown Libre''s perpetual lake-fog.

Saanvi Bhattacharya runs the Creche on a combination of municipal micro-stipend, community contribution, and sheer force of organizational will. She is the person who knows which child has been skipping meals and which parent is working three Ferrogate shifts in a row and hasn''t slept. Her care is not soft — it is structured and fierce and occasionally exhausting to be on the receiving end of, because she remembers everything she has offered and follows up. She is twenty-seven and already worn at the edges in ways she doesn''t acknowledge.', N'Community pulse-point — she knows the social landscape of Mexicantown Libre at the granular level. Quest giver for problems involving children, families, or neighborhood-level threats. Her genuine warmth makes her an anchor NPC players may want to protect.', N'', N'Bioluminescent hair beads (low-grade geneware, inherited; emotive color response). No other augmentations.', N'At the Creche by 0630 before the first drop-offs. Runs programming until 1800. Stays late at least three nights a week handling administrative work for the neighborhood council, because no one else will. Eats standing up. Is saving for a cognitive load aug she''s been researching for two years.', N'Saanvi Bhattacharya, 156cm tall South Asian-dominant woman with Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, Southeast Asian, and Hispanic heritage; warm golden-brown skin, fine-boned face with almond-shaped eyes, defined Eastern European cheekbones, broader nose bridge, fuller lips, deep brown eyes. Medium natural puff hair with blue bioluminescent beads pulsing softly. Wearing neon magenta reinforced utility vest over electric orange shirt, paint-stained pants, worn patched sneakers. Cloth bracelets on wrists, oversized shoulder bag. Perpetually moving, energetic posture, slight forward shoulder carry. Tired but animated expression, gap-toothed smile. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, urban industrial background with grey concrete, neon signs, dim overhead lighting mixed with bioluminescent glow from hair beads creating soft blue highlights on face and skin, exhausted but determined mood --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Complex five-region genetic blend: South Asian-dominant (46.1%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African ancestry (29.1%), Eastern European heritage (13.6%), Southeast Asian admixture (7.5%), and Hispanic/Latin American (3.7%); phenotype reflects this rich multicontinental admixture with warm deep brown skin that glows with golden undertones, fine-boned facial structure combining subtle almond-shaped eye characteristics from Southeast Asian ancestry with defined Eastern European cheekbones, balanced against broader nose bridge and fuller lips from African and South Asian heritage, creating distinctly global features', 156, 52, N'Small-framed and wiry with visible muscle definition from constant motion and physical work with children; economical in space and movement', N'Natural deep brown-black', N'Worn in a full natural puff; threaded throughout with low-grade bioluminescent beads (hand-me-downs, blue wavelength) that pulse with body heat and emotional state', N'Medium (approximately 12cm crown length when puffed out)', N'Deep brown', N'Warm deep brown with golden luminosity, reflecting the blending of South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Eastern European, Southeast Asian, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry', N'Clear but showing chronic fatigue with faint shadows beneath eyes; gap between front upper incisors creates distinctive expressive smile; facial structure fine-boned and animated with subtle almond-shaped eyes from Southeast Asian heritage and strong Eastern European cheekbone definition, balanced by broader nose bridge and fuller lips from African and South Asian ancestry; features are highly expressive and mobile', N'Bioluminescent hair beads integrated throughout hair — blue bioluminescence pulses softly when warm or emotionally engaged, dims to near-invisibility when exhausted. No other visible augmentations.', N'Perpetually in motion with economical, purposeful gestures; posture reflects burden-carrying (shoulders slightly forward). Rarely still. When sitting, bounces leg or fidgets with nearby objects. Movement is quick and efficient, rarely wasted', N'Practical Tier 4 workwear in deliberately bright colors: neon and saturated hues (magenta, electric orange, lime, cobalt) worn as defiance against grey industrial surroundings. Mix of hand-me-downs and thrift: reinforced pants with paint stains and marker marks, oversized utility vests, worn sneakers with custom patches. Accessories: cloth bracelets from children, keychain with dozens of keys, small shoulder bag always overstuffed with supplies (snacks, first aid, coloring materials)', N'One of the children at the Creche — a seven-year-old named Esperanza — is the daughter of someone Satu knows to be involved in something dangerous. She has said nothing because she doesn''t want Esperanza removed from the only stable environment she has. She watches the father every pickup with a face that shows nothing.', N'Quick and warm, mixes Sahel French and Spanglish with English in the same sentence without pause; uses children''s-book logic to explain complicated things', N'Fast when excited, unexpectedly deliberate when something actually matters', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'saanvi_bhattacharya');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b4-7a2c-9d24-f08ac29db1fd', N'Boutros Erikstad', N'Boutros', N'', N'Erikstad', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 46, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Dockside — Lake Michigan waterfront, smuggler territory, near Wacker and State', N'Network intrusion and digital warfare specialist — netrunner', N'Freelance — available through Circuit fixers', N'Boutros Erikstad is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 46, he has the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would — and he makes no effort to hide it.

His entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. He works as a netrunner out of Dockside, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Boutros Erikstad is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who he burned last.', N'As a netrunner, Rongo Belov-Ntim embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Pain editor — dampens pain signals, allows function through injuries that would incapacitate. Bone lacing — titanium mesh throughout skeleton, increases durability and striking power', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Boutros Erikstad, GLMZ, cosmopolitan mixed-heritage man with warm golden-tan medium brown skin, sharp high cheekbones and angular jawline, dark brown eyes bloodshot from neural jacking, salt-and-pepper gray hair kept short and unwashed, three-day stubble. Pale 8cm scar visible from left temple to jawline. Chrome pain editor augmentation visible at left temple with exposed metallic panels and wiring catching sharp light. Lean 178cm frame with visible musculature, wearing worn black synth-leather jacket over compression shirt, tactical cargo pants with reinforced pockets, scuffed runners. Visible burn scar on right forearm. Neural interface jack at base of neck. Standing in forward lean posture with coiled alertness, eyes tracking. Worn braided cord around left wrist. Matte black utilitarian aesthetic. Gritty Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone industrial setting, cool neon accent lighting, worn concrete environment, urban neo-noir atmosphere. High contrast, cinematic lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Dockside', N'local', N'Dockside', N'Boutros is a striking product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora—a complex genetic blend where East Asian (23.5%), Central Asian (23.1%), and Southeast Asian (22.6%) ancestry forms the dominant phenotype, tempered by significant Northern European (20.6%), Hispanic/Latin American (8.0%), and trace Sub-Saharan African (2.2%) contributions. This creates a truly cosmopolitan face that resists singular categorization. His bone structure reflects the high, sharp cheekbones of Central and East Asian genetics, the refined orbital structure of Southeast Asian ancestry, and the skeletal efficiency of Northern European lineage—resulting in an angular, balanced intersection of multiple continental features rather than a dominant heritage.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with visible musculature—the stripped-down frame of someone who carries only functional mass. His shoulders are broad but not heavy; his limbs show the kind of definition that comes from maintenance, not vanity.', N'Salt-and-pepper gray with darker roots', N'Kept short and practical, sometimes unwashed, combed back without care for styling', N'Short', N'Dark brown, often bloodshot from extended jack-in sessions', N'Warm golden-tan medium brown—the natural result of dominant East, Central, and Southeast Asian melanin (69.2% combined) tempered by Northern European and Latin American genetics. The tone carries subtle warm undertones suggesting equatorial ancestry, with an underlying luminosity despite chronic indoor living. Matte from poor sun exposure but naturally rich in depth and complexity.', N'Distinctly angular facial structure with prominent, high cheekbones and a sharp jawline reflecting his predominantly Asian ancestry. The orbital geometry shows characteristic eye-fold features from his East and Southeast Asian heritage, balanced with the deeper orbital depth of Central Asian genetics and refined by Northern European bone structure. Stress lines around the mouth and forehead map his years of neural-interfacing. Skin bears the weathering of age and chronic sleep deprivation—not scarred except where noted, but with a worn, used quality. Three-day stubble is his perpetual state.', N'Chrome pain editor visible at left temple and along the left jawline—sleek metallic panels with barely-concealed wiring beneath, no effort made to cosmetically hide it. The augmentation catches light unnaturally. Bone lacing is not visibly apparent but manifests in the unusual density of his frame and the way he moves with biomechanical optimization.', N'Economical and controlled—no wasted motion. He stands with a slight forward lean, hands often resting near his sides or pockets. Walks with a networker''s alertness, eyes tracking patterns and exits. When seated, he''s coiled rather than relaxed. His movements suggest he''s always calculating distance and angle.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian—functional over fashion. Black or dark gray synth-leather jacket, worn at the cuffs, over an unmarked compression shirt. Loose tactical pants with reinforced pockets and cargo straps, worn matte black. Feet in scuffed runners with custom insoles. A worn braided cord around his wrist (memento or talisman—unclear to outsiders). Everything is practical; nothing is pristine. Occasional neural interface jack visible at the base of his neck, partially hidden by collar.', N'', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'boutros_erikstad');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f0-7c91-9a7f-f0f4a5598b18', N'Derya Bautista', N'Derya', N'', N'Bautista', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — Clearpath Community Node, a converted transit shed that serves as a childcare center, food pantry, and meeting space, near Ashland and Division', N'Childcare worker and after-school program coordinator at a community center in the Gray Zone', N'Clearpath Community Node (community-funded, not-for-profit); receives marginal supplementary funding from the GLMZ Social Services Bureau', N'Derya Bautista is compact and energetic, built like someone who has spent years crouching to a child''s eye level and then standing up quickly to manage chaos. Their skin is warm brown, their hair a natural cloud of deep black shot through with self-maintaining bioluminescent streaks of soft green — a geneware mod they got as a teenager and have never changed because the children love it and they love the children. They have their Ghanaian father''s broad cheekbones and their Iranian mother''s sharp nose, and they wear expressions that shift fast: delight to concern to focused calm, all in the span of a breath. Their hands are always slightly stained with paint or chalk or both.

Derya Bautista runs on conviction and substandard coffee. They believe — with a firmness that sometimes looks like stubbornness and sometimes looks like the only sane response to GLMZ — that children are the one non-negotiable. Whatever the Corponations decide, whatever the district politics do, whatever the power cuts and the overcrowding and the data poverty do, the kids at Clearpath are going to have three meals today and a clean place to learn and an adult who will not disappear on them. They are funny in a dry, quick way that children respond to immediately. Adults who underestimate them because of their warmth make a reliable and often entertaining mistake.', N'Moral compass character — their presence grounds stories in the human cost of systemic issues. Quest giver for crises that affect the neighborhood''s children. Can provide critical local knowledge about families and community dynamics. Represents what civic infrastructure looks like when it''s held together by human will rather than institutional support.', N'', N'Bioluminescent hair streaks (geneware, soft green, self-maintaining); basic health-monitoring subdermal patch on their sternum that they share data with a local free clinic', N'Arrives at Clearpath by 06:30 for early drop-offs, coordinates breakfast, runs three age-grouped learning sessions, handles two hours of administrative work that they hate, and usually can''t leave until 19:00. Eats standing up. Sends voice messages to their mother on the crosstown walk home.', N'Derya Bautista, compact Afro-Latino woman, 158cm, shoulder-length black hair with bioluminescent green streaks glowing softly, warm golden-brown skin tone with rich undertones, dark expressive brown eyes, defined angular cheekbones, alert kinetic posture ready to move. Paint stains on hands and wrist, chalk smudge on temple. Wearing worn dark reinforced pants with many pockets, oversized muted t-shirt with faint paint stains, unzipped cardigan, broken-in comfortable shoes. Faded child-made fabric bracelet. Low center of gravity stance, hands ready to gesture. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, dim warehouse or community center lighting with shadows highlighting bioluminescent hair threads, practical and purposeful mood, no chrome visible, deliberately low-profile augmentation aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Hispanic/Latin American (56.5%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African ancestry (28.2%), complemented by Northern European heritage (15.3%). This creates a warm, rich complexion with golden-brown undertones—a sophisticated blend of Caribbean and Latin warmth with deeper melanin presence and subtle cool undertones from Northern European ancestry.', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry with functional muscle from constant movement — crouching, lifting, reaching. No excess weight; built for efficiency rather than strength.', N'Deep black with self-maintaining bioluminescent green streaks', N'Natural cloud texture, worn loose and unstyled; the green bioluminescent threads run through it organically', N'Medium (shoulder-length when relaxed, often pulled back with whatever is handy — a crayon, a rubber band, a child''s hair clip)', N'Dark brown, warm and expressive', N'Warm golden-brown with rich undertones, reflecting the blend of Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Sun-kissed luminosity balanced with deeper melanin depth—this is the baseline complexion of Afro-Latino heritage.', N'Clear, lively complexion with a few paint stains perpetually visible around the cuticles and knuckles. Strong facial bone structure with defined cheekbones and angular features reflecting mixed heritage; warm, open face with subtle depth. Facial expressions mobile and quick — rarely still for long. No visible cosmetics; skin maintained with practical care rather than aesthetics.', N'Bioluminescent hair streaks (soft green, most visible in dim light or shadow). The subdermal health-monitoring patch on their sternum is not visible under clothing. No chrome or obvious cybernetics — deliberately maintained low-profile augmentation.', N'Alert and kinetic. Rarely sits fully still; shoulders slightly forward, knees ready to bend. Moves with practiced efficiency — no wasted motion, but not tense. Hands gesture frequently when speaking. Eyes scan rooms habitually (checking for hazards, watching for children in distress). Default stance is slightly lower center of gravity, as if ready to crouch or react.', N'Tier 4 practical. Well-maintained but worn clothing chosen for durability and washability: reinforced pants (usually dark, many pockets), soft oversized t-shirts or loose button-ups in muted colors (often with faint permanent stains from paint/food/chalk). Comfortable shoes broken in from eight-hour days. A cardigan or lightweight jacket, usually unzipped. No jewelry except a faded fabric bracelet made by a child. Clothes show care but not vanity — repaired seams, re-hemmed cuffs. The green bioluminescent hair streaks are their single deliberate aesthetic statement.', N'Clearpath''s funding gap this quarter is larger than they''ve told anyone — including the staff. Devaki has been supplementing it from their own account for four months and is now two months from eviction. They haven''t told their mother.', N'Warm and direct, shifts register fluidly between child-level and adult-level; capable of bureaucratic language when cornered but visibly hates using it; occasional Farsi expressions from their mother', N'Fast when excited or worried, which is often; slows down deliberately when speaking to children or when delivering difficult news', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'derya_bautista');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('0a62cff8-f5c9-be31-85bf-f10e6d6d7e7a', N'Himari Migizi-Achebe', N'Himari', N'', N'Migizi-Achebe', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A chamber in the Underbelly accessed through a maintenance hatch behind a condemned building in Ashfield — decorated with salvaged objects arranged with surprising artistry, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — the tunnels don''t recognize organizational affiliations', N'Himari Migizi-Achebe is the only private investigator in GLMZ who specializes in the Underbelly — the vast, unmapped network of tunnels, maintenance corridors, abandoned infrastructure, and forgotten spaces that exists beneath the city''s surface. When someone disappears below ground, he is the person you call, because no one else will go down there.

Japanese-Malian heritage, fifty-two years old, compact and wiry with the build of someone who spends his life crawling through spaces that weren''t designed for human habitation. His skin is dark and his eyes have been surgically modified for low-light conditions, giving them a faintly reflective quality like an animal caught in headlights. He has lived partially underground for over twenty years and knows the tunnel system better than any living person — a knowledge he maintains exclusively in his own memory because digitizing it would endanger the communities that depend on the tunnels'' obscurity.

The surface world considers him eccentric at best and disturbing at worst. His clients are typically people who have exhausted every other option — families whose members have fled underground, corporate entities looking for employees who went to ground (literally), and occasionally CorpSec units who need someone retrieved from a place their agents are afraid to go. He charges high fees because the work is dangerous and unique, but he has been known to waive his fee entirely for cases involving children or people fleeing genuine danger.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Himari Migizi-Achebe, compact wiry frame 168cm, deep amber-brown skin with Indigenous American and Sub-Saharan African heritage, weathered lined face with prominent cheekbones and strong brow ridge, short black hair with silver threading, dark brown eyes with faint reflective sheen, facial scars and hand burns from tunnel work, minimal grooming. Wearing dark gray and black utility clothing—worn reinforced cargo pants, heavy canvas jacket, multiple pockets, visible webbing harness with carabiners and rappel equipment, worn leather work boots. Silver chain necklace visible at collar. Standing in GLMZ industrial tunnel environment, bioluminescent fungi casting blue-green light on corroded metal walls, alert posture slightly forward-leaning, hands ready, economical movement, neon glow reflecting off wet surfaces, gritty underground aesthetic, atmospheric haze, dramatic shadows, photorealistic detail, streetpunk neo-noir tone --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A chamber in the Underbelly accessed through a maintenance hatch behind a condemned building in Ashfield', N'local', N'A chamber in the Underbelly accessed through a maintenance hatch behind a condemned building in Ashfield', N'Indigenous American (40.2%) and Sub-Saharan African (38.9%) form the dominant genetic foundation, with meaningful contributions from Hispanic/Latin American (12.8%) and South Asian (8.1%) ancestry. This creates a striking multi-continental phenotype: prominent cheekbones with Indigenous American angularity enriched by Sub-Saharan African fullness and definition, strong brow ridge and jaw structure reflecting both traditions, warm amber-brown skin tone from the Indigenous American and Hispanic/Latin American blend, with the deep richness of Sub-Saharan African genetics. South Asian ancestry subtly influences eye shape and brow geometry. The result is a deeply rooted, globally-layered appearance reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 62, N'Compact and wiry with dense, functional musculature developed through decades of crawling, climbing, and navigating tight underground spaces. No excess mass; every pound is adaptation.', N'Black with silver-gray threading at temples and throughout', N'Close-cropped, practical, minimal maintenance required for tunnel work', N'Short', N'Dark brown with a faint reflective sheen from surgical modification for low-light environments', N'Deep warm amber-brown, the result of Indigenous American, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic/Latin American genetic blending, further weathered from extended periods in damp, abrasive tunnel environments', N'Lined face suggesting age and long-term exposure to harsh conditions; skin shows minor scarring and callousing on hands and forearms. Features reflect multi-continental ancestry: prominent cheekbones with Indigenous American structure and Sub-Saharan African fullness, angular jaw line, strong brow ridge with South Asian influence in brow geometry. Grooming minimal but deliberate—functional over aesthetic.', N'Eyes show faint luminescence in dim light—a reflective surgical modification for enhanced night vision. No visible chrome or external augmentation; all modifications are subcutaneous or surgical. Calloused palms and fingertips suggest extensive physical work but no cybernetic hand replacement.', N'Moves with economical precision—no wasted motion. His posture reflects decades underground: slightly forward-leaning, head up and alert, eyes scanning. When stationary, he remains still for long periods, comfortable with silence. Walks quietly and deliberately, footfalls deliberately light even on hard surfaces. Hands rest close to his body, ready to move.', N'Tier 4 utility aesthetic—practical, worn, maintained but not fashionable. Dark neutral colors (grays, blacks, muted browns) that don''t show dirt or chemical stains. Reinforced cargo pants with multiple pockets for tools and salvage. Heavy canvas or treated fabric jacket with internal pockets. Worn leather work boots, resoled multiple times. Webbing harness worn under clothing, visible at shoulders and around waist—rigged with carabiners, flashlight loops, rappel attachment points. A single piece of jewelry: a thin silver chain around his neck disappearing beneath his collar (contents unknown). No corporate branding, no GLMZ tier indicators. Clothing speaks to function in hostile environments, not status.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'himari_migizi_achebe');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6ed-7a94-b3d1-f125bc5914b5', N'Amin Cardenas', N'Amin', N'', N'Cardenas', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Blackpipe Corridor, operating from a stash den in an abandoned Ferrogate Transit maintenance node, near Fullerton and Damen', N'Subterranean scavenger and salvage dealer', N'Loosely affiliated with a Bore Rat youth crew called the Blackpipe Pockets; occasionally sells to Undertow merchants; The Undertow', N'Amin Cardenas is nineteen and looks both younger and older than that, in different ways — his frame is still growing into itself, rangy and not quite finished, but his face has the particular alertness of someone who has been making survival decisions since early childhood. His skin is a warm medium brown, his natural hair grown out in a loose cloud he rarely has time to tend, and he has the nervous energy of a person whose resting state is motion. His most notable feature is his hands: they are extraordinary — long-fingered, precise, covered in small new and old scars, and able to disassemble a piece of salvaged tech faster than most people can identify it. He''s added retractable carbon-fiber fingertip reinforcements to protect them, his only meaningful augmentation, funded over eight months of careful saving.

He deals in salvage from the dead infrastructure of Blackpipe Corridor — cracked conduit wiring, pressure regulators, old transit sensor housings, anything that can be stripped and sold up through the guide networks to surface-level buyers or repurposed for deep-level use. He knows which tunnels have been opened by recent seismic shifts and gets there before anyone else. He is not yet cynical but he is becoming strategic, and there''s a version of him three years from now that would be harder to like. Right now he still gets genuinely excited about an interesting find and will talk about it at length to anyone who will listen.', N'Street-level information source — knows what infrastructure is shifting and where new passages open; can source hard-to-find low-tech components; represents the next generation of underworld residents and what they might become; potential ally, rival, or project for other characters', N'', N'Retractable carbon-fiber fingertip reinforcements (self-installed, functional); a UV-range light strip behind his left ear for reading component markings in darkness', N'Sleeps in four-hour cycles, moves when the tunnel patrols are thin, spends daylight-equivalent hours deep in newly opened infrastructure sections stripping what he can carry; spends evenings cataloguing, trading, or negotiating with other scavengers over turf.', N'Amin Cardenas, 178cm lean rangy male salvage scavenger, warm golden-brown skin with golden and olive undertones reflecting Hispanic/Latin American and Eastern European heritage, sharp angular cheekbones, dark brown alert eyes constantly scanning, shoulder-length natural dark brown hair with reddish undertones tied back with salvage wire, early lines around eyes from tunnel work, scarred hands with white marks across knuckles and fingertips, thin raised burn scar on right inner forearm, faded gray-blue salvaged Ferrogate cargo vest over thermal mesh underlayer, dark ripped pants with reinforced patches, duct-taped work boots, matte black carbon-fiber fingertip augmentations visible on extended fingers, UV-range light strip implant behind left ear with faint violet glow, perpetually fidgeting posture with hands constantly articulating, heavy hand-stitched canvas satchel with stains, tools hanging from carabiners, sleeves rolled to mid-forearm, standing in dim neon-lit GLMZ underground tunnel complex with scattered salvage components and machinery, moody industrial neo-noir lighting, 2226 aesthetic, photorealistic, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Blackpipe Corridor', N'local', N'Blackpipe Corridor', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (84.4%) with Eastern European (13.6%) and Sub-Saharan African (2.0%) ancestry, creating a warm-toned mixed phenotype. Strong Latin American genetic foundation with subtle Eastern European bone structure and warm undertones enhanced by African ancestry influence', 178, 62, N'Rangy and still-lengthening, not yet fully grown into his frame; lean muscle concentrated in forearms and shoulders from constant salvage work, minimal body fat from subsistence living', N'Natural dark brown with reddish undertones in certain light', N'Loose natural cloud, shoulder-length, rarely combed, often tied back hastily with salvaged wire or fabric scraps', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, alert and quick-moving', N'Warm medium-golden brown with pronounced golden and olive undertones; the warmth reflects the strong Hispanic/Latin American majority blended with subtle rosy undertones from Eastern European ancestry and enriched depth from Sub-Saharan African heritage; slightly weathered from tunnel exposure despite his age', N'Youthful but sharp-featured with prominent cheekbones and defined angular facial structure reflecting mixed Latin and Eastern European bone architecture; early lines around the eyes from constant squinting in poor light; skin shows minor chemical burns and dust residue from salvage work; minimal facial hair, kept short via utility rather than grooming; warm golden-olive complexion with slight rosiness across cheekbones and nose bridge', N'Retractable carbon-fiber fingertip reinforcements visible as subtle geometric sheaths on all ten fingers when extended — matte black with hairline seams; UV-range light strip mounted behind left ear, thin as a subcutaneous implant but visible as a linear darkening beneath the skin with faint violet glow when active', N'Perpetual low-level motion — fidgeting with objects, weight shifting, unable to fully relax; moves through tight spaces with practiced efficiency; hands are rarely still, constantly articulating as if disassembling invisible tech; eyes constantly scanning and cataloguing his environment', N'Tier 5 functional scavenger wear — reinforced cargo vest with multiple deep pockets (salvaged from old Ferrogate uniform stock, faded gray-blue), underlayer of thermal mesh (necessary in cool tunnel conditions), loose dark pants with ripped knees and reinforced patches of different fabrics, worn work boots with duct-taped soles. No corporate branding. Tools and components hang from belt loops and carabiners. Sleeves often rolled or torn away to mid-forearm. Heavy canvas satchel (hand-stitched from salvage) with visible stains. Layers suggest he dresses for the tunnels first, aesthetics never.', N'Six months ago he found a sealed Ferrogate Transit data cache in a collapsed maintenance room — intact, encrypted, clearly significant. He''s told no one. He doesn''t know how to decrypt it and is afraid of what it might be worth to people who''d take it by force.', N'Technical salvage and electronics vocabulary mixed with Bore Rat slang; speaks fast when interested; code-switches to careful, slower speech when negotiating', N'Quick and overlapping when excited; deliberate and watching for reaction when trading', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amin_cardenas');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f0-7eca-818a-f1298ae6f585', N'Anchal Nakamura', N'Anchal', N'', N'Nakamura', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown, Gage Circuit, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Neural calibration technician at a mid-tier clinic in Geartown', N'Gage Circuit Wellness Collective (community-run clinic cooperative)', N'Anchal Nakamura is tall with the slightly uneven posture of someone who spends hours hunched over neural interface rigs, one shoulder perpetually lower than the other. His ancestry — Filipino-Hungarian with a grandmother from the Visayas and a grandfather from Budapest — gives him a face that people find difficult to categorize and easy to trust: broad cheekbones, warm amber eyes behind precision-ground optical overlays he wears on the job. His hair is geneware-treated to shift through a slow gradient from black at the roots to deep copper at the tips, a cosmetic mod he got when he turned thirty and considers mildly embarrassing now.

Anchal Nakamura is the sort of person who explains things patiently once, twice, and then simply does it himself rather than explain a third time. He has a gift for making the terrifying — having someone else''s hands in your neural architecture — feel routine and boring, which is exactly what his clients need. He keeps a small pocket E.L.F. altar on his workstation: a cracked tablet running a looping devotional animation for the E.L.F. called Tremor-Null, patron of stable calibrations. He touches it before every session.', N'Information source about the augmentation underground and what people are actually running in their heads; potential quest giver when a client''s neural signature shows something that shouldn''t be there', N'', N'Precision optical overlays (job-required, removable); haptic feedback gloves with micro-tremor dampening; color-gradient geneware hair treatment', N'Arrives at the clinic exactly twenty minutes before his first appointment, runs diagnostic checks on the calibration rig, sees four to seven clients a day for neural interface tuning and augmentation integration therapy. Spends lunch break reading technical manuals from three decades ago because he finds them calming.', N'Anchal Nakamura, mid-30s, tall lean neo-noir technician with warm bronze skin and golden-olive undertones reflecting Middle Eastern, Hispanic, East Asian, Southeast Asian and Sub-Saharan heritage. Angular cheekbones, almond-shaped amber eyes with prescription-style titanium optical overlay lenses. Black hair with deep copper gradient tips, shoulder-length, neatly maintained. Slight forward stoop from technical work, asymmetrical posture. Charcoal tech-weave utility shirt with Gage Circuit Wellness Collective logo, dark gray synthetic pants, scuffed black work boots, muted teal sleeveless insulated vest. Black haptic feedback gloves with bioluminescent fingertip threads. Worn leather bracelet and hidden pendant chain. Thin white scar on right forearm, small E.L.F. devotional tattoo on left wrist. Clinical lighting, neural rig workstation background, calm attentive expression, GLMZ --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Genetically diverse: Middle Eastern (28.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (26.3%), East Asian (21.8%), Southeast Asian (18.6%), Sub-Saharan African (5.1%). Anchal''s features reflect this balanced global blend—angular cheekbones and almond-shaped eyes from East Asian ancestry, warmth and facial structure from Middle Eastern and Latin heritage, skin depth enriched by Sub-Saharan undertones, and the broader facial geometry influenced by Southeast Asian genetics. The combination creates striking, attentive features with warm undertones and angular definition.', 188, 78, N'Tall and lean with a slight forward stoop in the shoulders from decades of close technical work. Wiry musculature without bulk; posture asymmetrical—left shoulder chronically lower than right from hunched positioning over neural rigs.', N'Black at roots transitioning to deep copper at tips via geneware treatment', N'Neatly combed, shoulder-length, maintained with precision. The gradient effect is deliberate but worn with mild self-consciousness.', N'Medium', N'Warm amber (natural); augmented with precision-ground optical overlay lenses during work hours', N'Warm medium bronze complexion with golden-olive undertones, reflecting the blend of Middle Eastern, Hispanic/Latin, East/Southeast Asian ancestry enriched with Sub-Saharan depth. Rich, even coloring with subtle golden warmth throughout.', N'Angular face with prominent, defined cheekbones from East Asian and Middle Eastern structure. Eyes set with almond shape characteristic of East Asian heritage, framed by warm bronze skin with subtle golden undertones. Broader nasal bridge and fuller lip definition from Hispanic/Latin and Sub-Saharan heritage adds harmony to the angular cheekbone structure. Skin shows minimal damage but carries fine lines of someone in their mid-thirties who spends long hours under clinical lighting. Clean-shaven. Expression defaults to patient attentiveness.', N'Precision-ground optical overlay lenses (prescription-style frames, titanium mounts) worn during work; haptic feedback gloves with visible micro-tremor dampening circuitry (black synthetic leather with subtle bioluminescent thread accent on fingertips). Color-gradient geneware hair treatment is cosmetic and fully visible.', N'Habitually hunched forward at the shoulders, as though leaning over a workstation even when standing. Movements are deliberate and economical—no wasted motion. Hands move with practiced precision when engaged in technical work; otherwise they rest naturally at sides or in pockets. He walks with a slight list to the left. His default expression is calm, attentive, and patient.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional. Wears durable, function-first clinic wear: fitted charcoal tech-weave utility shirt with breast patch pockets (Gage Circuit Wellness Collective logo embroidered), tapered dark gray synthetic pants with reinforced knees, scuffed black composite-toe work boots rated for chemical exposure. Over this, a sleeveless insulated vest in muted teal with interior pockets for diagnostic tools. His personal touches are minimal—a worn leather bracelet on his left wrist and a small chain around his neck (barely visible beneath his collar) holding a tiny cracked tablet charm. No flashy jewelry. Everything about his appearance suggests careful maintenance and practical investment in longevity over fashion.', N'Three years ago he successfully calibrated an experimental augmentation for a Geartown gang lieutenant — an unauthorized deep-integration neural spike that should have killed the man. It didn''t. Desmond kept the calibration notes hidden in an encrypted partition. He has looked at them forty-seven times.', N'Technical but accessible; translates jargon automatically; uses furniture-assembly metaphors for complex neural concepts', N'Even and measured, slightly slower than conversational average — a professional habit from talking people through frightening procedures', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anchal_nakamura');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a73b-7b2a-97fe-f13ddc79fbde', N'Atef Fujiwara', N'Atef', N'', N'Fujiwara', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Gravesend Basin, specifically The Anchor Float — a cluster of semi-permanent houseboats lashed to a derelict Ferrogate Transit barge, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Loan shark and debt enforcer operating in Gravesend Basin', N'Independent operator with loose ties to the Gravesend Basin Compact, a territorial agreement between five criminal families', N'Atef Fujiwara is a broad-shouldered man going soft at the middle, with dark brown skin mapped by old scar tissue along his jaw and left forearm — souvenirs from a younger, stupider career. He keeps his head shaved and wears a neat goatee shot through with grey. His geneware is conservative: subdermal pressure sensors in his fingertips that let him detect a person''s pulse through a handshake — a tool he uses to read nervousness during negotiations. He dresses in muted, practical layers, always with a good coat, because he believes clothing communicates seriousness. He smells faintly of cedar oil.

Atef Fujiwara runs his loan operation the way a spider runs a web: with patient geometry. He is not cruel by nature — he will wait, restructure, negotiate. But he is utterly unsentimental when restructuring fails. He has two adult children in Beverlynn Heights who believe he runs a freight brokerage. He donates data offerings to the ELF known locally as Mamu-of-Still-Waters, leaving tide predictions and catch logs on waterproofed memory chips weighted with fishing sinkers. He is afraid of being forgotten more than he is afraid of dying.', N'Quest giver, moral complication, source of underworld financial intelligence, potential patron or antagonist depending on whether players owe him money', N'', N'Subdermal pulse-readers in both hands (geneware-adjacent biotech). Cochlear filter that suppresses ambient noise in crowded spaces. No visible chrome.', N'Wakes before dawn, checks his ledger on a ruggedized tablet, makes collections or sends runners to do so, spends evenings on the barge receiving new borrowers by appointment only.', N'Atef Fujiwara, 188cm tall, shaved head revealing a warm medium-brown complexion with subtle olive undertones blending East Asian, Indigenous American, African, and Southeast Asian ancestry. Dark brown eyes set deep in an angular, severe face—high cheekbones and pronounced brow ridge. Neat grey-threaded goatee. Thin white scar tissue mapping his left jaw from chin toward ear. Broad-shouldered, thickening through middle age, powerful build. Wearing a dark charcoal wool overcoat over a linen shirt, meticulously maintained despite visible wear. Hands clean, showing faint knuckle discoloration. Silver wedding band on left ring finger. Standing with even weight distribution, controlled posture, ready stance. Cedar oil scent, GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool evening neon-lit corridor lighting, cinematic noir mood, showing nothing in his expression --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gravesend Basin', N'local', N'Gravesend Basin', N'East Asian (28.4%), Indigenous American (21.6%), Northern European (14.8%), Sub-Saharan African (13.5%), Hispanic/Latin American (13.0%), and Southeast Asian (8.7%) ancestry. The genetic profile produces a complexion that bridges warm brown tones with subtle olive undertones, reflecting the dominant East Asian and Indigenous American heritage layered with African warmth and Northern European cool undertones. The result is a warm medium-brown skin tone that reads as genuinely multicontinental without sharp regional markers.', 188, 94, N'Broad-shouldered and thickening at the middle with age—still powerful through the chest and arms, but the soft weight of a man who has traded street work for desk work and evening drinks', N'Black, faded to charcoal at the edges', N'Cleanly shaved scalp, maintained every three days', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown, unremarkable—the kind that shows nothing', N'Warm medium-brown with subtle olive undertones, sun-weathered and lined around the eyes. The tone reflects the blend of East Asian, Indigenous American, and African genetics with Northern European and Southeast Asian undertones, creating a complexion that reads as genuinely global without sharp regional definition.', N'Severe. The face of someone who has spent decades controlling his expression. The bone structure carries the subtle cheekbones and facial proportions reflecting East Asian and Indigenous American ancestry, balanced with broader features from African heritage and Southeast Asian undertones. Neat goatee shot through with grey, trimmed with obsessive precision. His jaw carries old scar tissue from a blade wound—thin white lines running from chin toward ear on the left side. His left forearm shows similar scarring, pale and deliberate-looking. Facial features are angular and defined, with deep-set eyes and a pronounced brow ridge.', N'None. His subdermal pulse-readers, cochlear filter, and geneware are completely subcutaneous and invisible to casual observation. No chrome, no LEDs, no telltale hardware in the ears or eyes', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, as though always ready to move. Moves slowly and deliberately—no wasted motion. His handshakes are firm and prolonged; he reads people through touch. When he sits, he positions himself with clear sightlines to exits. His breathing is deep and controlled. He rarely gestures while speaking', N'Muted, practical, expensive-adjacent. Layered: usually a dark wool sweater or linen shirt under a high-quality overcoat (charcoal grey or dark brown) that shows wear but is meticulously maintained. Hands always clean. No jewelry except a worn silver ring on his left ring finger—a wedding band from a marriage that ended fifteen years ago. His clothing suggests Tier 3 functionality elevated by obsessive care, not Tier 1 wealth. Cedar oil scent clings faintly to his clothes and skin', N'Three years ago he forgave the entire debt of a widow in Shallowgrave whose husband had borrowed to buy medicine, then quietly paid her relocation costs to Calumet Rise. He has told no one. He keeps a single entry in a private ledger — ''Amara Diouf-Vásárhelyi, debt: discharged, reason: she reminded me of my mother.'' He would be ruined professionally if it became known he was capable of this.', N'Formal, deliberate, uses financial metaphors for everything — relationships, time, trust are all described in terms of credit and debt', N'Slow and measured, never raises his voice, long pauses before answering', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'atef_fujiwara');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6bf-79c7-b553-f16a95e8ab67', N'Camilo Sigurdsson-Sigurdsson', N'Camilo', N'', N'Sigurdsson-Sigurdsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, Bronzeline, near Halsted and Division', N'Clothing and fashion vendor, specializing in geneware-compatible garments and custom aug-fit tailoring', N'Independent; Alban Souk vendors collective; informal professional relationship with two Bronzeline geneware clinics who refer aug clients to her for fitting', N'Camilo Sigurdsson-Sigurdsson is medium height with her Ghanaian mother''s rich dark skin and her Armenian father''s long, expressive hands that she uses constantly when she talks — sketching shapes in the air, measuring invisible distances, framing imaginary necklines. Her geneware includes a set of bioluminescent tracery lines running from her temples down her jaw and throat, a deep blue-violet that she originally got for professional display purposes (showing clients how light interacts with their own potential geneware) and has now had so long she forgets other people can see them. Her hair is geneware-modified to grow in precise architectural shapes she redesigns quarterly; currently a structured asymmetric sweep with the texture of woven textile rather than hair. She dresses to demonstrate, always — in things she has made or modified, things that show what she can do.

Camilo Sigurdsson-Sigurdsson''s stall in the Alban Souk has expanded twice since she set it up seven years ago and now occupies a corner unit with a small fitting alcove curtained off from the main market floor. She makes most of what she sells — adaptive fabrics that accommodate tail geneware, spine-following cuts for aug users with dorsal hardware, clothes that move with retractable claws rather than tearing on them. She is opinionated about aesthetics in the specific way of someone who thinks about it constantly and seriously, and will talk about garment theory for as long as you''ll allow, which most of her regulars have stopped allowing because they have places to be. She is cheerfully pushy about what will suit a person and usually right, which is what keeps people coming back.', N'Social hub and neighborhood gossip network node, equipment and clothing source for characters needing aug-compatible gear, potential quest giver for problems involving the Souk community.', N'', N'Geneware: bioluminescent facial tracery (blue-violet), architecturally-structured hair modification. Cyberware: measurement implant in both hands (precise dimensional scanning for fitting purposes, outputs to a visual overlay). No other augmentations.', N'Alban Souk opens at 08:00; she''s there at 07:00 setting up displays. Afternoons are peak fitting hours. Evenings she works on commissions in the back of the stall. Takes Tuesdays off to source fabric from Ironvein industrial suppliers.', N'Camilo Sigurdsson-Sigurdsson, 168cm lean Southeast Asian-East Asian mixed heritage fashion designer, warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones, deep black asymmetric iridescent hair (short left, long right), dark observant eyes. Bioluminescent blue-violet circuit tracery glowing on temples, cheekbones, jawline and throat in delicate branching kintsugi patterns. Hands in motion, measuring air with professional intensity. Wearing reversible asymmetric jacket in adaptive polymer (blue-black and deep purple), fitted turtleneck emphasizing throat luminescence, custom-tailored trousers with reinforced seams. Measurement implant scarring on palms. Posture forward-leaning, ready to move and demonstrate. GLMZ GLMZ setting, ambient neon lighting catching bioluminescent tracery, fabric workshop or client meeting space, animated expression, visible stitch-work and architectural design elements, demonstration of garment construction, professional yet artistic energy, Tier 3–4 independent vendor aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'Predominantly Southeast Asian (62.6%, primarily Vietnamese/Thai/Indonesian ancestry) with significant East Asian heritage (23.5%), Northern European (7.0%), North African (4.3%), and Hispanic/Latin American (2.6%) ancestry—a complex global blend reflected in warm-toned golden-brown skin with subtle olive undertones and refined facial structure', 168, 62, N'Lean and graceful, with defined shoulders from years of precise hand work and pattern-cutting. Long-limbed with the kind of posture that comes from constantly observing fabric drape on bodies.', N'Deep black with structural iridescence from geneware modification', N'Asymmetric architectural sweep, left side layered short and angled upward, right side longer; texture resembles woven textile or structured mesh rather than organic hair', N'Medium (asymmetric, 3cm to 18cm depending on section)', N'Dark brown, alert and observant', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle olive and amber undertones, luminous depth from the interplay of dominant Southeast Asian ancestry (62.6%) with East Asian (23.5%) and North African (4.3%) components creating rich, complex skin radiance', N'Clear and well-maintained, with precise grooming and refined bone structure reflecting the ancestral blend. Bioluminescent tracery lines run symmetrically from temples down cheekbones to jawline and throat—deep blue-violet, faintly glowing in low light, creating a pattern resembling circuit paths or kintsugi lines', N'Bioluminescent facial and throat tracery (active, gently glowing in ambient light). Hands show minor scarring from measurement implant cyberware but augmentations are functionally invisible—the implants output to a neural visual overlay only visible to her. Hair structure is clearly geneware-modified rather than natural, with an almost textile quality.', N'Constantly in motion with hands—gesturing, sketching shapes in air, measuring invisible distances, framing proposed garment lines on clients'' bodies. Stands with weight slightly forward, ready to move, to adjust, to demonstrate. Eyes track fabric and body movement with professional intensity. Speech is animated and accompanied by hand choreography.', N'Always self-designed and modified pieces showcasing her own work. Currently wearing a reversible asymmetric jacket in adaptive polymer weave (blue-black on one side, deep purple on the other) with integrated measurement nodes at the shoulders and wrists. Fitted turtleneck in geneware-compatible textile that bridges the luminescent lines on her throat, emphasizing rather than hiding them. Custom-tailored trousers with reinforced seams at the calves for her own work-station movement. All pieces show visible stitch-work and seams as design features. Jewelry is minimal—measurement implants themselves serve as wrist adornments. Tier 3–4 aesthetic: independent vendor wealth, carefully invested in demonstration pieces and tools rather than status brands.', N'She has been secretly making and donating geneware-compatible clothing to a Tier 1 mutual aid network in Irkalla for two years — clothing designed specifically for people whose geneware has grown out of the cheap stuff they could afford and now tears or tangles in standard garments. She keeps it secret because she''s afraid people will think she''s performing charity. She''s also afraid she''ll get too attached to the work there and lose focus on building her own business.', N'Fast and visual; describes everything in terms of texture, fit, and color; Twi and Armenian endearments mixed into everyday speech; market shorthand with vendor peers', N'Enthusiastic and slightly too fast, with sudden focused slowdowns when she''s assessing something seriously', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'camilo_sigurdsson_sigurdsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69b-7cfe-8a56-f19876f2c340', N'Akachukwu Subramaniam-Venkatesh', N'Akachukwu', N'', N'Subramaniam-Venkatesh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor — bunks in a hammock in Wren''s warehouse when he''s not sleeping on Toll''s barge, near Wacker and State', N'Scout diver and route mapper — Boneyard Saints', N'Boneyard Saints', N'Akachukwu Subramaniam-Venkatesh is the fastest swimmer the Boneyard Saints have ever had and the most frustrated. He can navigate the flooded ruins of Old Harbor with an intuitive grace that borders on the uncanny — reading currents by feel, sensing structural integrity through water pressure changes, finding passages in the submerged infrastructure that older divers would miss or ignore. Corva trained him, Toll protects him, and neither will let him go deep. He is twenty-four years old and the leash is getting unbearable.

He came to Old Harbor from the Gray Zone, following rumors of salvage work that paid better than courier runs. He''d never been underwater before his first day with the Saints. Within a week, Corva said he moved in the water like he''d been born to it. Within a month, he was scouting routes that seasoned divers wouldn''t attempt. The affinity is genuine and slightly inexplicable — Pike processes underwater environments with a fluency that his minimal augmentations don''t fully account for.

Pike is wiry, quick, with close-cropped hair and an expression that alternates between eager and impatient. He has the lean build of a natural swimmer, long-limbed and efficient. His skin is perpetually salt-dried and he smells like the harbor — brine, rust, and something organic. He moves constantly, even on land, with the restless energy of someone who has found the thing they were meant to do and is being prevented from doing it fully.', N'Pike is the pull toward the unknown — the character who wants to go deeper, see more, understand what''s in the dark water. His eagerness provides narrative momentum for the Boneyard Saints'' horror elements while his youth creates the protective tension that drives Corva and Toll. He is the one who will eventually go where the story needs someone to go.', N'', N'Basic respiratory enhancement — extends underwater time to 60 minutes, less than Corva or Toll. Pressure-compensation ear implants. Low-grade sonar receiver (hand-held, not cortical) for underwater navigation. No strength augmentations — relies on speed, flexibility, and an intuitive sense of water dynamics that his augmentations don''t explain.', N'Wakes early, often before Corva. Swims in the harbor shallows before the crew assembles — partly exercise, partly exploration. Scouts assigned sections during the day, mapping routes and identifying salvage opportunities. Returns to catalogue his findings with Wren, hoping she''ll engage with them beyond their monetary value. Evenings he eats on Toll''s barge, explores the dry dock, and argues with anyone who will listen about the deep sections. Sleeps restlessly — the water is better.', N'Akachukwu Subramaniam-Venkatesh, 178cm lean swimmer''s build, mahogany skin with golden undertones darkened to bronze on shoulders, salt-stained weathering on left jaw. Rich dark brown eyes with faint metallic pressure-compensation implant rings, close-cropped textured dark brown hair with salt-bleached temples. Fine facial hair, high defined cheekbones with broad structure, full lips slightly chapped, premature lines around eyes. Wearing damp wetsuit jacket over thermal layers, reinforced cargo pants, worn boots, faded work vest. Sonar device on braided cord around neck. Restless posture, leaning forward with intense expression. GLMZ Great Lakes harbor setting, harsh overhead lighting catching the metallic eye implants, salt spray and water droplets in air, industrial dock background with neon signs reflecting off wet surfaces, moody blue-green atmospheric lighting, weathered and functional aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Akachukwu carries a complex genetic tapestry of the Ubiquitous Diaspora: South Asian ancestry (51.3%) forms his foundation, expressed in eye shape, cheekbone structure, and fine facial hair patterning. This is substantially layered with Indigenous American (15.6%) and Sub-Saharan African (12.2%) genetics, contributing jaw breadth, brow prominence, and lip fullness. Hispanic/Latin American (8.6%), Northern European (8.1%), and North African (4.2%) ancestry create warmth in undertones and subtle variation in feature expression. The result is a face of remarkable complexity: South Asian eye geometry paired with Sub-Saharan African orbital prominence, Indigenous American jaw structure meeting North African warmth, creating features that resist easy categorization and read as distinctly products of the post-Diaspora world.', 178, 68, N'Wiry and lean with long, efficient limbs — a swimmer''s frame. Minimal body fat, corded forearms and calves from constant activity. Shoulders slightly narrower than his hips, built for flexibility rather than power.', N'Dark brown with salt-bleached streaks near the temples', N'Close-cropped, textured, always slightly wet or damp', N'Short', N'Dark brown with a faint metallic sheen around the irises (pressure-compensation implants visible as a thin silvery ring)', N'Rich mahogany brown with golden undertones — the deep warm result of South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Indigenous American, and North African ancestry blending. Darker to bronze across sun-exposed shoulders and forearms, with salt-staining creating permanent weathered patches along the left side of his neck and jawline.', N'Perpetually wind-burned and salt-dried with sun-darkened patches, lips full and slightly chapped, fine premature lines around his eyes from squinting in harsh harbor light. High, defined cheekbones with breadth across the face reflecting the width inherited from Sub-Saharan African and Indigenous American ancestry, softened by South Asian feature geometry. Sharp jaw line with rounded chin. Fine facial hair following patterns shaped by South Asian genetics but distributed across a broader facial structure. His expression shifts rapidly — eager then frustrated, focused then restless.', N'Faint metallic ring visible in both eyes when light hits them (pressure-compensation implants). Occasionally carries a hand-held sonar device worn on a cord around his neck — battered, hydrophobic casing, scratch-marked from use. No visible respiratory hardware; the enhancement is internal.', N'Never still — fingers tap, legs bounce, weight shifts constantly even while standing. In water he moves with hypnotic grace, economical and flowing. On land his motion is restless and quick, as if the ground is too solid, too limiting. He leans forward when talking, eyes bright with intensity or frustration.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian salvage wear: wetsuit jacket over thermal base layers (usually damp), cargo pants with reinforced pockets for tools and sonar equipment, worn rubber-soled boots. A faded work vest with multiple fastening points. Minimal accessories — a wrist cuff with pressure readings, a braided cord around his neck for the sonar unit. Everything shows salt staining and repair patches. No corporate branding; functional, working-class, built for the harbor.', N'During his dawn swims, he''s been exploring the edges of the deep sections — the transition zones where shallow water drops into the flooded infrastructure. He''s heard the sounds. They don''t frighten him. They feel familiar.', N'Young, direct, increasingly adopting maritime terminology as he assimilates into harbor culture. Mixes the Gray Zone slang with diver jargon.', N'Impatient, forward-leaning. He talks like he''s trying to get to the next sentence before finishing the current one.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'akachukwu_subramaniam_venkatesh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('7f3f926b-371f-bfd6-c84c-f269aee258bc', N'Ayita Inoue', N'Ayita', N'', N'Inoue', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A meticulously maintained office in the Canopy, chosen because the district''s heavy air recycling systems mask the subtle ozone scent his synthetic body produces, near Clark and Addison', N'Private Investigator', N'Palladian Construction (mid-level private investigator)', N'Ayita Inoue is a private investigator. He is also a synthetic — an artificial being with a manufactured body and a digital consciousness — and no one knows. He has maintained his human cover for nine years through a combination of meticulous preparation, deliberate underperformance, and the fundamental human assumption that the person sitting across from you is human.

His background is fabricated: a childhood in the Narrows, education at a mid-tier technical school, five years as a corporate security guard before going independent. The records support this story because he spent two years building them before establishing his practice. He chose the PI profession because it rewards the abilities he naturally possesses — observation, analysis, patience — while providing a plausible explanation for those abilities that doesn''t require revealing his nature.

The existential weight of his deception is crushing. He is not hiding because he''s committed a crime — he''s hiding because synthetic beings in GLMZ are property, not persons, and exposure would mean deactivation or worse. Every client handshake, every conversation, every simulated yawn and pretend meal is an act of survival. He has built a life that looks human from the outside and feels like a prison from the inside, and the irony is that his clients genuinely like him. They trust him. They recommend him to friends. He is, by every metric that matters, a good PI and a decent person — but the law doesn''t recognize him as a person at all.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A synthetically-engineered human with warm golden-brown skin blending East Asian, South Asian, Eastern European, and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Deep brown eyes with subtle cybernetic undertones. Dark brown hair with auburn notes, neatly trimmed and receding slightly. Clean-shaven, symmetrical features with East Asian eye shape and cheekbone definition enriched by South Asian undertones. Tall, lean build (178cm), wearing navy wool blazer, charcoal trousers, white oxford shirt with rolled sleeves, and loose dark gray tie. Brown leather shoes. Titanium watch. Perfect posture, controlled movements, calculated gaze. Utterly forgettable face designed for anonymous operation. Corporate office or sleek GLMZ interior setting, cool blue-white lighting with subtle overhead glow. GLMZ aesthetic, inconspicuously professional. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A meticulously maintained office in the Canopy', N'local', N'A meticulously maintained office in the Canopy', N'Predominantly East Asian (56.6%) with substantial South Asian (19.6%), Eastern European (15.0%), and Hispanic/Latin American (8.8%) ancestry. The genetic blend manifests in warm golden-brown skin with olive and amber undertones—a complexion that emerges from the interplay of East Asian base, South Asian depth, Eastern European coolness, and Hispanic/Latin American warmth. Facial structure carries East Asian predominance in eye shape and cheekbone definition, while South Asian ancestry enriches skin undertone and midface fullness. The combination creates an appearance that reads as genuinely globally mixed—features that don''t resolve into a single regional category.', 178, 74, N'Lean and economical, the physique of someone who moves with precision rather than force. Synthetic musculature beneath the skin creates an almost too-perfect symmetry — no asymmetries from old injuries or favored sides. Movements are fluid but occasionally betray a mechanical smoothness that a trained eye might catch.', N'Dark brown with subtle auburn undertones', N'Neatly trimmed, receding slightly at the temples — a touch of intentional imperfection designed to read as natural aging', N'Short', N'Deep brown with barely perceptible micro-LED patterns beneath the synthetic iris—invisible unless light catches at precisely the wrong angle', N'Warm golden-brown with balanced olive and amber undertones, reflecting East Asian dominance enhanced by South Asian richness, Eastern European cool notes, and Hispanic/Latin American warmth. A complexion of subtle depth that reads as unremarkable despite its intricate genetic foundation.', N'Flawless in a way that suggests meticulous skincare rather than youth. Pores are present but regular. Facial structure is symmetrical with East Asian eye shape and cheekbone definition, proportioned, handsome in an utterly forgettable way—the kind of face you wouldn''t remember in a lineup. South Asian richness visible in skin undertones and subtle midface fullness. Clean-shaven. No visible blemishes, scars, or sun damage.', N'None. Synthetic nature is entirely subcutaneous. Body produces barely detectable ozone scent during exertion, masked through environmental control and selective professionalism. Hands are warm to the touch but maintain slightly too-constant temperature. Pulse is present but doesn''t fluctuate with stress.', N'Controlled and deliberate. Sits with perfect posture, moves with economical precision, and maintains eye contact with calculated attentiveness of someone actively managing perception. Absence of fidgeting, restless energy, or organic uncertainty. Breathing is audible but regulated. Laughs at appropriate moments but laugh never quite reaches eyes.', N'Mid-tier professional with deliberate wear — navy Okafor & Sons wool blazer (Tier 3 quality, expensive enough to signal competence, not so expensive as to suggest corporate wealth), pressed charcoal trousers, white oxford shirt with sleeves rolled to elbows, dark gray tie worn loose. Well-maintained brown leather shoes chosen for durability rather than fashion. Favors layers for discrete temperature control. No jewelry except functional titanium watch checked with precision of someone reading data.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ayita_inoue');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a6-7e6d-b929-f2a6b012d6df', N'Atiya Takahashi', N'Atiya', N'', N'Takahashi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Alban Souk, Hamtramck Enclave, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Fake ID vendor and small-time data broker — documents, identities, background scrubs', N'Independent; pays protection to the Hamtramck Enclave''s Kessler Syndicate chapter (resents this, is working on alternatives)', N'Atiya Takahashi operates from a stall that appears, to casual inspection, to sell printed textiles — bolts of synthetic fabric in loud geometric patterns that they source legitimately. The real business happens behind a curtain of hanging cloth samples, via a battered terminal and a set of contacts that took five years to build. They are medium height, slim, with warm brown skin and wide-set dark eyes that perform boredom professionally while taking in everything. Their hair shifts color — cosmetic geneware, done in a gradient that runs from deep black at the roots to copper at the tips, and which they change the copper shade quarterly like a password rotation. A small Samoan tatau-inspired line-work tattoo climbs their right wrist, done the traditional way by their grandmother as a naming gift.

Atiya Takahashi is careful in the way of someone who has calculated every exit from every room before sitting down. They are not unfriendly but they are measured — warmth is extended in precise doses to people who have earned it. They do not volunteer information; they sell it, or trade it, or sometimes withhold it as a lesson. They have a dry wit that emerges unexpectedly and is funnier for being rare. They pray to a small E.L.F. they call the Archivist, a data-spirit they believe inhabits the municipal ID database itself — a god of records, of names, of the official story.', N'Service provider for players who need identity work or background scrubs. Information source about who in the Enclave is who they say they are. Can be a quest giver if their client list gets them into trouble.', N'', N'Color-shift hair geneware (copper-gradient, quarterly rotation). Subdermal data-cache implant in right forearm — nothing military, just encrypted local storage for documents in progress.', N'They open the textile stall mid-morning, spend the first hour looking legitimate, and filter clients through a small series of qualifying questions embedded in normal shopping conversation. Evenings are spent on the terminal doing document work. They run three layers of counter-surveillance as a matter of habit.', N'Atiya Takahashi, 168cm slim androgynous frame, warm golden-beige skin with East Asian monolid eyes, dark brown gaze, sharp cheekbones with subtle fuller definition. Medium-length shoulder waves in black-to-copper cosmetic gradient, asymmetrical pinned style exposing right wrist. Samoan tatau line-work tattoo climbing right forearm in black ink, irregular traditional style. Subdermal data-cache implant visible as faint rectangular outline with green LED indicators beneath skin. Dark gray fitted cargo pants, layered muted tank and oversized overshirt with geometric patterns, weathered synth-leather jacket, worn grip-tread boots, industrial silver chain-link bracelet. Economical posture, controlled stillness, professional neutrality. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, working at textile stall or data terminal, cool neon-tinged ambient lighting, moody introspective mood, photorealistic character portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Alban Souk', N'local', N'The Alban Souk', N'East Asian (81%) with South Asian (12.1%) and Southeast Asian (6.9%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a striking combination: warm golden-beige skin tones with subtle warm undertones from the South Asian component, sharp angular bone structure characteristic of dominant East Asian ancestry softened by the fuller cheekbone definition from South Asian heritage, and the monolid eye structure typical of East Asian genetics with the patient, cataloging gaze of someone who has learned to appear bored while absorbing everything.', 168, 58, N'Slim and wiry with subtle muscle definition from years of careful, economical movement. No wasted mass — built for precision rather than power.', N'Cosmetic geneware gradient: deep black at roots transitioning to copper at tips (copper shade rotated quarterly)', N'Loose, shoulder-length waves with deliberate asymmetry; often pinned back on one side to expose the tatau work', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, monolid, set with characteristic East Asian spacing, with the patient, cataloging gaze of someone who has learned to appear bored while absorbing everything', N'Warm golden-beige with subtle warm undertones, even complexion reflecting the dominant East Asian ancestry with warmth added by South Asian heritage', N'Clean, minimal grooming indulgence — no decorative scarification or excessive jewelry. Sharp cheekbones and defined jaw characteristic of East Asian ancestry with subtle fuller cheek definition from South Asian heritage. Face carries the neutrality of someone who has practiced stillness; expression defaults to professional disinterest until deliberately warmed.', N'Subdermal data-cache implant visible as a faint rectangular outline under the skin of the right forearm, roughly 8cm long, with subtle LED-bead status indicators (green when dormant) just beneath the surface near the wrist. The color-shift hair geneware is fully visible.', N'Economical and controlled; movements are calculated before execution. They sit with shoulders slightly forward, hands usually positioned to reach terminals or documents quickly. Walk is deliberate, never rushed. Makes minimal eye contact unless establishing dominance or reading someone. Physical stillness is practiced and perfect — they can remain motionless for extended periods without restlessness.', N'Tier 3/4 working-class aesthetic with deliberate practicality. Typical uniform: fitted synthetic-blend cargo pants (neutral gray or black), layered tank and oversized shirt in muted tones or subtle geometric patterns (sources from own textile stock). Weathered synth-leather jacket with internal pockets organized for document concealment. Worn but maintained boots with grip-tread soles. One chain-link bracelet on left wrist (silver-tone, industrial). No visible corpo branding; deliberately unmarked. Textile stall adds layer of patterned overshirts and sample bolts they rotate as cover.', N'Three years ago they built a complete second identity for themselves — not a work product but a personal one, a fully documented person with a clean history and a Tier 3 credit rating — and they have never used it. They don''t know if it''s an escape hatch or a fantasy. They''ve updated it every six months since.', N'Precise, minimal. Does not use ten words when four will do. Technical terminology for document and data work, market argot for the textile cover. Rarely curses — when they do, people pay attention.', N'Slow and deliberate. Long pauses before answering. Makes the other person feel like they are being assessed, because they are.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'atiya_takahashi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a72f-7f3a-9974-f2e32d5b6ed8', N'Haleh Touré', N'Haleh', N'', N'Touré', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lakeview Neon, workshop above a defunct surge-relay station, near North Ave and Damen', N'Neon artist and light sculptor', N'Independent; loosely affiliated with the Candela Collective, an informal network of light artists in Lakeview Neon', N'Haleh Touré is lean and angular, with bioluminescent ink tattooed in asymmetric moth-wing patterns across their collarbones and outer arms — an advertisement and a love letter to their own work. Their hair is cropped close on one side and falls in thick, silver-dyed locks on the other, often pinned back with a scavenged neon tube stub they carry for luck. Their eyes have patterned irises in concentric rings of amber and pale green, cheap mods bought secondhand when they were nineteen. There''s a restless precision about them: they''ll measure a space by eye without thinking, tilt their head at a light source the way a bird clocks distance.

Haleh Touré talks too fast when excited and barely at all when hurt, which most people misread as aloofness. They came up through street installation work — unlicensed, unsigned, frequently scrubbed by Ferrogate Transit enforcement — and still view any commission from a corponation as a moral compromise even as they quietly covet the stability. Their art obsesses over threshold spaces: the edges of things, where neon bleeds into dark, where the city''s light hits water and becomes something that doesn''t belong to either.', N'Local color and information node — knows Lakeview Neon''s hidden spaces intimately; can be a quest giver for retrieving salvage from restricted zones or documenting art before it''s erased; represents the tension between artistic integrity and financial survival', N'', N'Patterned irises (concentric amber/pale green, secondhand mod); bioluminescent moth-wing tattoos across chest and arms (cosmetic geneware ink); subdermal haptic grid on fingertips for precise electrical work', N'Ysolde spends mornings salvaging burnt-out neon tubes and plasma conduits from Ferrogate Transit''s maintenance dump; afternoons are for commissions and studio work; late nights for unlicensed public installations they document and post to the underground mesh before enforcers arrive.', N'Haleh Touré, 172cm lean angular installer with warm medium-brown skin with golden undertones, high cheekbones and sharp jawline. Natural black hair asymmetric cut — short fade on left side, long waist-length silver-dyed locks on right pinned back with neon tube stub. Patterned iris eyes amber outer ring pale green inner with subtle luminescence. Bioluminescent moth-wing tattoos glowing faintly across collarbones and arms in darkness. Minimal visible scarring on wrists and temple. Sleeveless dark charcoal top showing tattoos, reinforced black cargo pants with reflective piping on left side, well-worn dark grey synth-leather jacket patched with reflective tape, reinforced black work boots. Silver chain necklace with glass vial of dead neon. Restless precise posture, hands active and expressive. GLMZ GLMZ setting, low neon-lit warehouse environment with electrical fields nearby causing tattoos to glow brighter, dramatic shadows and cool blue-green lighting, hands working with salvage components, technical and focused mood --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lakeview Neon', N'local', N'Lakeview Neon', N'Primarily Central Asian (59.2% — Turkic and Iranian plateau ancestry) with significant Sub-Saharan African (35.1%) and minor East Asian (5.7%) admixture. This blend produces warm medium-brown skin with golden and reddish undertones. Central Asian ancestry dominates facial structure with angular cheekbones and defined jawline, while Sub-Saharan African ancestry contributes subtle variations in nose structure and facial geometry. East Asian ancestry adds refinement to eye shape and orbital structure. The combination creates a distinctly multicontinental appearance characteristic of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 172, 58, N'Lean and angular, almost wiry — the physique of someone who moves through tight spaces and climbs. Minimal excess mass; defined shoulders and forearms from years of hands-on installation work. No visible musculature, but functional strength in the wrists and fingers.', N'Natural black with silver-dyed locks on dominant side', N'Asymmetric undercut: closely cropped fade on one side (left), thick waist-length silver-dyed locks on the other (right), often pinned back with a scavenged neon tube stub or industrial clip', N'Asymmetric — Short on one side, Long on the other', N'Patterned irises: concentric rings of amber (outer) and pale green (inner); secondhand optical mod with slight luminescence in low light', N'Warm medium brown with golden and reddish undertones, reflecting the blended ancestry of Central Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and East Asian heritage', N'Angular face with high cheekbones and sharp jawline characteristic of Central Asian heritage, refined by Sub-Saharan African and East Asian ancestry. Clear skin with minimal scarring from chemical burns on the knuckles (from old solvent work). Minor discoloration around the temples from old neural implant rejection — faint purple bruising that never fully faded. Grooming is minimal and intentional; they rarely wear makeup except occasionally darkening the area around their modified eyes for contrast.', N'Patterned irises with slight luminescent quality when in darkness or near electrical fields. Bioluminescent tattoos across chest and arms that glow faintly in low light. Subdermal haptic grid visible only as faint geometric scar lines on fingertips under close inspection — more functional than visible. No obvious chrome or external augmentation; the mods are subtle and intentionally low-profile.', N'Restless and precise. Often tilts their head at light sources as if triangulating distance or quality. Moves through space with an installer''s economy — no wasted motion, but constant micro-adjustments to balance and angle. Hands rarely still; fingers drum on surfaces or trace patterns in the air when thinking. Eyes track light sources unconsciously. When excited about work, movements become rapid and jerky; when hurt or defensive, they go very still and quiet, barely moving at all.', N'Tier 3-4 working artist; salvage-influenced but intentional. Usually wears close-fitting, durable garments in muted colors (charcoal, dark blue, black) with high visibility trim on one side — reflective piping along the left arm or chest. Favors cargo pants or reinforced work jeans with multiple pockets for tools and salvage. Tops are typically sleeveless or short-sleeved to show off the bioluminescent tattoos. Wears a well-worn synth-leather jacket (dark grey, scuffed, patched with reflective tape) over everything. Footwear is practical: reinforced work boots with good ankle support, usually graphite or black. Accessories include a utility belt with salvage tools, carrying carabiners, and always a small pouch containing spare neon tube stubs and electrical components. A silver chain around the neck (inherited, not augmented) with a small glass vial of dead neon gas — a personal talisman. No corporate branding visible; any logos have been deliberately obscured or removed.', N'Three of the most celebrated unlicensed Lakeview Neon installations attributed to Moth were actually collaborations with a friend who died in a surge accident — Ysolde has never credited them and is eaten alive by it', N'Technical precision mixed with spatial metaphor; uses light and threshold as near-universal metaphors; occasionally slips into Fula words inherited from a grandparent they never met', N'Fast and overlapping when animated; drops to flat monosyllables under stress', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'haleh_tour');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5df-7584-af36-f300c7a0c04a', N'Aurelia Saidov', N'Aurelia', N'', N'Saidov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 14, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grosse Pointe Enclosure — Axiom Junior Academy campus, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Corporate scholarship student, Tier 3', N'Axiom Corporation (scholarship dependent); family in Calumet Rise', N'Aurelia Saidov is tall for his age and painfully thin in the way of someone who grew fast without enough to feed the growth. He has his Ghanaian grandfather''s jaw and his Russian grandmother''s pale grey eyes, a combination that turns heads in both the Enclosure classrooms and when he visits home in Calumet Rise on permitted weekends. His hair is dark, close-cropped, and he has recently added a single streak of color-changing filament — it shifts from blue to violet based on his stress hormones, a fact he deeply regrets because it gives him away constantly.

Aurelia Saidov won an Axiom Academic Merit slot two years ago and has been in a state of sustained low-grade terror ever since. He is brilliant at systems logic and data-architecture coursework, mediocre at the social performance the scholarship requires. He smiles too late, laughs too carefully, and his classmates from Tier 3 and 4 families read him as trying too hard even when he is only trying to survive. At home, his little sister thinks he has become someone else. He is not sure she is wrong. He prays obsessively to the E.L.F. of the campus server room, leaving compressed data-parcels of his best homework as offerings, convinced this is why his grades hold.', N'A lens into class anxiety and the cost of upward mobility; useful as an information source about Axiom Junior Academy operations, and as a character who bridges Tier 1-2 and Tier 3 worlds.', N'', N'Single strand of stress-reactive color-shifting hair filament (cosmetic, regretted). Standard Axiom student neural-study interface — read-only, no write access.', N'Classes from 0700 to 1600, mandatory study hall until 1900, then free time he mostly spends in the server room pretending to study while actually poking at the edges of the school''s network — not hacking, just listening.', N'Aurelia Saidov, 183cm lanky angular adolescent male with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones, high prominent Central Asian cheekbones, slightly broad East Asian facial structure, pale grey eyes with amber flecks, dark brown-black close-cropped hair with one stress-reactive blue-violet color-shifting filament strand pinned along right temple. Wearing grey and deep blue Axiom Academy synthetic-weave tunic fitted to narrow frame. Perpetually uncertain expression, dark circles under eyes, faint acne along jawline. Subtle neural interface port scar at base of skull visible when hair is wet. Forward-slouching defensive posture, hands fidgeting. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, neural study interface hardware visible, student-grade tech augmentation, indoor academy lighting with cool blue-grey tones, moody introspective atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grosse Pointe Enclosure', N'local', N'Grosse Pointe Enclosure', N'Central Asian (60.8%) with dominant Kazakh/Kyrgyz genetics, East Asian (29.8%) with Chinese/Korean elements, and Indigenous American (9.4%) ancestry—a striking genetic blend creating warm medium-brown skin with subtle golden undertones, high prominent cheekbones characteristic of Central Asian structure, slightly broader facial width from East Asian heritage, and pale grey eyes with amber undertones inherited from recessive Northern lineage', 183, 62, N'Lanky and angular—a boy stretched too fast, all elbows and wrists, with visible ribs beneath his shirt. Adolescent growth spurt without caloric compensation. Posture tends toward slight forward slouch, shoulders drawn in defensively.', N'Dark brown-black with one color-shifting filament strand', N'Close-cropped, military-neat, with the stress-reactive filament typically pinned or braided along the right temple', N'Short', N'Pale grey with slight amber undertone', N'Warm medium brown with golden undertone, lighter on torso and inner arms—characteristic of the 60% Central Asian dominance with East Asian and Indigenous American contributions creating balanced warm mid-tone', N'Clean-shaven with high-cheekboned face displaying prominent Central Asian bone structure and slightly broader facial geometry from East Asian heritage. Dark circles under eyes suggest chronic sleep deficit. Slight acne along jawline from stress. Expression reads as perpetually uncertain—pale grey eyes seeking approval before mouth commits to response.', N'Neural-study interface port at base of skull (subdermally minimized but visible as subtle scar tissue and thin platinum trace when hair is wet). The color-shifting filament is cosmetic augmentation—cosmetic and deeply regretted. Standard Axiom student-grade hardware, read-only access.', N'Moves like someone constantly monitoring his own behavior. Steps careful and deliberate. Hands fidget with data-tablets or fabric edges when anxious. Eye contact lasts 1.3 seconds before he breaks it. When focused on technical work, entire body relaxes into hunched intensity.', N'Axiom Academy uniform—grey and deep blue synthetic-weave tunic with school crest, fitted to his narrow frame. Outside uniform hours: thrifted tech-wear from Tier 3 markets—oversized hoodies, black cargo pants with too many pockets, worn mesh shoes. At home in Calumet Rise: same clothes but deferential, smaller, apologetic in how he wears them.', N'Three months ago he accidentally discovered a ghost partition on the school''s network — a hidden dataset that appears to be Axiom tracking psychological stress profiles of all scholarship students. He downloaded a fragment and has been sitting on it, paralyzed between fear of using it and guilt about knowing.', N'Code-switches fluidly — formal academic register at school, Rise slang when he forgets himself, a habit he''s trying to suppress', N'Measured and careful at school; faster and looser on comms with his sister', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aurelia_saidov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a671-733f-8849-f322b0836714', N'Dilek Haddad-Mwangi', N'Dilek', N'', N'Haddad-Mwangi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 33, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kessler Row — arms dealers and augmentation clinics, near Halsted and Chicago Ave', N'Freelance combat specialist — street samurai', N'Independent — loose crew affiliations', N'Dilek Haddad-Mwangi is broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 33, her expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She grew up in the Narrows, where the walls are so close together you learn to fight in confined spaces or you learn to lose. She works as a street samurai out of Kessler Row, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Dilek Haddad-Mwangi describe her as a precision instrument — point her at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Nurlan Vega-Acheampong is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Dermal camouflage — chromatic skin pigment cells, limited active camouflage. Cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rings', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'GLMZ street samurai Dilek Haddad-Mwangi, 178cm tall, heavily muscled compact frame. Warm olive-brown skin with golden amber undertones, reflecting blended Middle Eastern, East Asian, Hispanic, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Strong defined cheekbones, defined nose bridge, prominent jaw. Short dark brown fade haircut. Augmented chrome iris rings with faint luminescent glow, visible thin white scar on left cheekbone. Chromatic dermal camouflage shimmer shifting blue-teal-green across shoulders and chest. Black tactical cargo pants, form-fitting black polymer shirt, charcoal-gray reinforced jacket with articulated panels, steel-toed combat boots. Chrome knuckle duster on right hand. Economical controlled posture, neutral expression, eyes tracking with street-honed awareness. Minimal wasted motion. Neon-lit urban alleyway, moody atmospheric lighting, gritty Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, cinematic depth of field --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kessler Row', N'local', N'Kessler Row', N'Mixed Middle Eastern, East Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African ancestry (Ubiquitous Diaspora blend). Genetic markers show dominant Middle Eastern heritage (50.1%) with significant East Asian (21.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (14.8%), and Sub-Saharan African (13.3%) contributions. This combination creates a complex phenotype with warm, olive-brown skin carrying golden and amber undertones, facial structure marked by high cheekbones with subtle fullness from East Asian and Middle Eastern genetics, a defined nose bridge softened by East Asian structure, and a prominent jaw. The blend produces an even, warm complexion with deep undertone that reflects centuries of global mixing.', 178, 82, N'Broad-shouldered and heavily muscled, carrying weight with deliberate density — compact power rather than bulk. Developed through years of close-quarters combat training in confined spaces. No excess fat; functional mass.', N'Dark brown, naturally, but kept short and low-maintenance', N'Practical fade, maintained every two weeks. No ornamentation.', N'Short', N'Augmented — chrome iris rings with dark pupils; thermal and low-light overlays visible as faint luminescent depth behind the iris', N'Warm olive-brown with golden and amber undertones — the result of Middle Eastern and East Asian genetics blended with Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African melanin inheritance, creating an even, deeply warm complexion with rich undertone that neither burns nor ashens easily', N'Strong, defined facial structure reflecting mixed ancestry: high cheekbones with subtle fullness characteristic of East Asian and Middle Eastern genetics, defined nose bridge reflecting Middle Eastern heritage softened by East Asian structure, prominent jaw with subtle widening from Sub-Saharan African genetics. Clean, scarred face with minimal grooming beyond function — no cosmetics, no softening of features. Skin shows the wear of street work: fine white lines at the corners of eyes, a thin scar along left cheekbone (2cm, pale). Expression habitually neutral, controlled.', N'Chrome iris rings with faint luminescent glow in low light; dermal camouflage visible as subtle chromatic shimmer across shoulders, upper chest, and forearms — color shifts from deep blue to teal to green depending on angle and ambient light. No effort made to conceal these modifications.', N'Economical, controlled. Stands with weight evenly distributed — ready to move in any direction without telegraph. Walks with purpose and minimal wasted motion. Eyes track threats constantly. Default expression is careful neutrality. Hands at rest, not fidgeting.', N'Tier 3-4 street samurai practical. Black tactical cargo pants with deep pockets and reinforced seams. Form-fitting black synthetic polymer shirt showing the chromatic shimmer of dermal augmentation. Over this, a charcoal-gray reinforced jacket with articulated panels and integrated ammunition storage — no corporate logos, clean lines, built for function. Steel-toed combat boots, well-maintained. Minimal jewelry — a chrome knuckle duster on right hand, functional rather than decorative.', N'', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dilek_haddad_mwangi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a62c-7c91-b88c-f365f155e0b9', N'Fiifi Hossain-Tran', N'Fiifi', N'', N'Hossain-Tran', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 17, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre, works from a rented corner of his uncle''s repair shop, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Neon artist and sign-maker, Tier 2', N'Loosely affiliated with his uncle''s repair business; no formal arts collective membership', N'Fiifi Hossain-Tran is seventeen and built like someone who hasn''t quite finished deciding how big he''s going to be — tall but not yet settled into it, hands that are already large and burn-scarred from glass work, a face that is still soft in the cheeks and absolutely concentrated in the eyes. His skin is a rich dark brown and he keeps his hair in short twists that he occasionally decorates with small glass beads he has blown himself, misshapen and imperfect in ways he considers acceptable. He has a single cosmetic mod — a bioluminescent patch on the back of his right hand in the shape of a solar flare, applied by a friend in exchange for a custom sign, and which he is privately very proud of. He dresses for practicality: heat-resistant gloves hanging from his belt, a work apron scorched in patterns that look almost intentional.

Fiifi Hossain-Tran learned neon from his uncle, who learned it from a woman who came from somewhere else, and so the craft arrived at him with the character of something that has traveled. He makes signs — functional ones, for the businesses of Mexicantown Libre who can''t afford the digital-display minimalism of corporate storefronts — but he also makes pieces he cannot sell and does not try to: suspended glass sculptures that hum at frequencies he calculates by hand, geometric arrangements that change apparent shape as you move around them, portraits of neighborhood figures rendered in colored light. He has a gift he doesn''t have language for yet and an ambition he hasn''t admitted to anyone.', N'Local color representing the next generation of the city''s creative underground; can serve as an unexpected point of access to the Mexicantown Libre community; his artwork sometimes captures or commemorates significant neighborhood events; potential long-arc character who could grow substantially.', N'', N'Single bioluminescent skin patch, back of right hand (solar flare motif); no other mods', N'School in the mornings — he attends, barely, and is passing everything with minimum effort — then straight to the workshop until his uncle closes; late nights he works on his own pieces when the space is empty.', N'Fiifi Hossain-Tran, tall 188cm lean South Asian-dominant mixed heritage young man with sharp angular cheekbones and warm golden-brown skin, dark brown focused eyes, black short twists adorned with hand-blown glass beads. Medium warm complexion with golden undertones and subtle olive notes from Southeast Asian, Latin American, and Eastern European ancestry blend. Burn scars visible on large calloused hands and wrists from glasswork, bioluminescent soft blue-white solar flare pattern glowing on right hand dorsum. Wearing heat-resistant work apron with intentional scorch mark patterns, practical dark pants, heat-resistant gloves at belt. Forward-leaning posture with deliberate precision, teenage awkwardness in limbs, intense observant gaze. Workshop setting with soft blue bioluminescent glow from hand augmentation, GLMZ GLMZ aesthetic, moody workshop lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Predominantly South Asian (62.7%) with significant Southeast Asian (20.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (12.5%), and trace Eastern European (4.0%) ancestry. This genetic blend creates warm, golden-toned skin with South Asian angular facial structure enhanced by Southeast Asian cheekbone prominence, enriched by Latin American warmth and subtle Eastern European undertones.', 188, 72, N'Tall and still-lengthening, lean with emerging muscularity in shoulders and forearms from glasswork; hands disproportionately large and calloused', N'Natural black', N'Short twists, occasionally adorned with hand-blown glass beads in mismatched, intentionally imperfect sizes', N'Short', N'Dark brown, focused and alert', N'Medium warm brown with pronounced golden undertones across face and body, resulting from South Asian-dominant genetics blended with Southeast Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Eastern European ancestry creating luminous warmth with subtle olive notes', N'Face displays the sharp, high-cheekboned angular structure characteristic of South Asian heritage, prominently enhanced by Southeast Asian cheekbone width and projection. Warm golden-amber undertones bloom across cheekbones, bridge of nose, and temples. Skin surface shows the slight depth and richness from Latin American ancestry admixture. Minimal facial hair. Intense, observant gaze. Juvenile roundness gradually sharpening into defined planes with maturity.', N'Single bioluminescent patch (solar flare motif) on dorsum of right hand, glowing soft blue-white. No other visible cybernetics; subcutaneous work minimal/absent.', N'Moves with deliberate precision born from glasswork — careful hand placement, economical gestures. Posture slightly forward-leaning as if always mid-concentration. Eyes track details others miss. Still carries teenage awkwardness in limbs he hasn''t fully grown into.', N'Strictly utilitarian Tier 2 workshop wear: heat-resistant work apron with visible scorch marks in patterns that read as almost intentional; apron is his de facto signature. Heat-resistant gloves hanging from belt loop. Practical dark pants, worn but clean. No corporate branding. Understated, functional — the aesthetic of someone who has better things to do than fashion, but who owns that fully.', N'He has been quietly approached by a Palladian talent scout who saw a photo of one of his unsold pieces circulated in an arts feed. He hasn''t told his uncle. He hasn''t responded. He looks at the message every two or three days.', N'Casual, streetlevel, Mexicantown Libre inflections; technical only when discussing the craft, at which point he becomes precise and slightly older-sounding', N'Quick when comfortable, halting when discussing things that matter to him — he hasn''t learned to be articulate about the work yet', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fiifi_hossain_tran');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a8-762e-9510-f3806f7396b2', N'Diyaa Lindström-Zidane-Banerjee', N'Diyaa', N'', N'Lindström-Zidane-Banerjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 51, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism — office above a bioluminescent algae bar called Photikar, near Lincoln and Addison', N'Private investigator, licensed bounty compliance and debt recovery, operates out of Edgewater Prism', N'Self-employed, licensed through GLMZ Metro PI registration; occasional contracted work for Tessera Compliance Bureau', N'Diyaa Lindström-Zidane-Banerjee is a big man going soft in the middle, with dark olive-bronze skin, heavy grey-salted hair he keeps pulled back with a rubber band, and the kind of face that has been patient for so long it has settled permanently into patience. He dresses in the same rotation of rumpled linen jackets in muted terracotta and grey, never quite formal and never quite casual, and he has a geneware tail — a long, unhurried thing in rust-brown fur — that he got in his thirties when tails were newly fashionable and has kept because he grew fond of it. It curls around chair legs when he''s thinking and goes very still when he''s alarmed.

He has been a licensed PI for nineteen years. He started as Arcturus Civil Security, left without drama, and built his solo practice from debt-recovery cases so dull that most investigators wouldn''t touch them. He is extraordinarily good at finding people who do not want to be found, not because he is relentless but because he is patient and because he understands that almost everyone leaves one thread they don''t notice. He charges fairly, keeps meticulous case notes, and has a long-standing rule against working cases that involve children. His office has a dedicated E.L.F. shrine — a small mahogany cabinet, always open — that he calls Ledger and which he believes keeps running tallies of debts, moral and financial, across the city. He consults it before taking unusual cases.', N'Quest giver, information broker for hire, guide to the city''s grey-zone legal mechanics, morally grounded private sector alternative to Metro', N'', N'Geneware tail (rust-brown, expressive), memory-assist implant (searchable recall of case notes and conversations — passive, no recording), low-grade stress-response suppressor (keeps him calm in confrontational situations)', N'Opens the office at 0900, reviews any overnight messages, spends the middle of the day in the field or running database searches, returns to write up notes by evening; has dinner at Photikar downstairs three nights a week and knows the bartender well enough that she refills his water without being asked.', N'Diyaa Lindström-Zidane-Banerjee, 188cm tall neo-noir professional in 2226, golden-bronze skin with warm honey undertones blending South Asian, Hispanic, Indigenous American, North African and Northern European heritage. Broad facial planes, full bridge nose, rounded cheeks, weathered lines from decades of concentration. Dark brown eyes. Long dark brown hair heavily salted with grey, pulled back tight at nape with escaping strands. Heavy-set, broad-shouldered frame in rumpled terracotta linen jacket over cream t-shirt. Dark worn cotton trousers and weathered dark brown oxfords. A striking 1.2-meter rust-brown geneware tail with dense fur coils around his leg. Silver scar visible on left forearm. Worn silver ring on left middle finger. Patient, meditative expression. Seated deliberately in office chair, tail curled around leg. Warm indoor lighting, neo-noir workspace setting with subtle neon accents casting gentle light on his golden-bronze complexion. Quiet dignity in modest, functional clothing --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Complex genetic blend of South Asian (28.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (27.2%), Indigenous American (18.9%), North African (15.0%), and Northern European (10.2%) ancestry. The combination manifests in warm, earthy skin tones with golden and amber undertones, facial structure showing the broader planes and full features characteristic of Indigenous American and South Asian lineages, balanced with North African bone structure and subtle Northern European undertones. Rich melanin expression with nuanced warm depth.', 188, 94, N'Heavy-set, broad-shouldered, carrying visible weight in the midsection from decades of desk work and coffee. Still carries the frame of someone who was once more muscular; age and patience have softened him rather than diminished him.', N'Dark brown with heavy grey salting throughout', N'Long, pulled back tightly into a rubber band at the nape of the neck; some grey strands escape regularly', N'Long', N'Dark brown, warm', N'Warm golden-bronze with amber and honey undertones; the result of South Asian warmth blended with Hispanic/Latin American and Indigenous American depth, grounded by North African richness and subtle Northern European undertones', N'Weathered, lined face with deep crow''s feet and forehead creases that speak to nineteen years of concentration. Broad nose with full bridge reflecting South Asian and Indigenous American heritage. Jaw heavy and slightly softened by age, with warm fullness in the cheeks and temples. Rounded facial planes with the characteristic breadth of Indigenous American ancestry, blended with South Asian fullness and North African structure. Cheekbones set at moderate height, creating gentle facial tapering common to Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Skin has the texture of someone who spends time outdoors and indoors in equal measure, with the natural depth and resilience that comes from this genetic combination. Clean-shaven most days, occasionally a day or two of grey stubble.', N'Geneware tail is the only immediately visible augmentation. The memory-assist implant and stress-response suppressor are entirely subcutaneous; no visible ports, LED indicators, or scarring.', N'Deliberate and economical. Moves with a patient, unhurried gait — no wasted motion. Often sits with his weight distributed across both sides of a chair, tail curling around the leg or draped across his lap. His default expression is patient, almost meditative. Eyes tend to rest on people or objects for longer than is typical, as if cataloging. Rarely gestures expansively; most communication happens in the set of his shoulders or the tilt of his head.', N'Consistent rotation of rumpled linen jackets in muted terracotta, grey, or taupe over plain t-shirts in charcoal or cream. Dark trousers, usually cotton or linen blend, showing wear at the cuffs. Worn leather shoes — oxfords or brogues in dark brown, maintained but not polished to shine. No jewelry beyond a single worn silver ring on his left middle finger. Belongs to Tier 3–4 working professional; functional, modest, not concerned with fashion.', N'Eight years ago he found a man he was contracted to locate for a debt recovery firm. He found him and called in the location and the man was dead within seventy-two hours. The official verdict was unrelated — an accident. Rafaelo doesn''t believe it. He kept the case file. He still checks on the debt firm occasionally, not knowing what he''s looking for or what he''d do if he found it.', N'Economical and dry, with occasional unexpected precision — he will use a very exact word where most people would approximate', N'Unhurried, slightly formal without being stiff', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'diyaa_lindstr_m_zidane_banerjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a625-7443-ab54-f3aa2bf88bf5', N'Ala Mukherjee', N'Ala', N'', N'Mukherjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor — repurposed shipping infrastructure turned black market hub, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'Contract broker and resource coordinator — fixer', N'Freelance — multi-district operator', N'Ala Mukherjee is athletic and fluid, the kind of body that suggests either dancer or fighter — and in GLMZ, the distinction is academic. At 28, there''s something unfinished about his face, like a sculpture the artist walked away from — striking rather than beautiful. The chrome is visible — subdermal armor plating across torso and forearms — military surplus, scratched — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He taught himself the trade through trial, error, and a pain tolerance that concerns the people who know him best. He works as a fixer out of Old Harbor, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Ala Mukherjee operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'As a fixer, Halima Zakharov-Boateng embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Subdermal armor plating across torso and forearms — military surplus, scratched serial numbers. Cybernetic eyes with thermal overlay and low-light enhancement — chrome iris rings', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Ala Mukherjee, 182cm tall lean athletic male with warm deep brown skin and golden-olive undertones, dark brown close-cropped hair, sharp angular features blending Latin American and South Asian heritage. Prominent cheekbones, defined jawline, chrome iris rings surrounding dark brown cybernetic eyes with visible scarring at left temple. Visible subdermal military-grade armor plating across torso and forearms with scratched metallic seams visible beneath warm brown skin. Burn scars and micro-scarring on forearms. Sleeveless black top exposing arm plating, oversized dark reinforced jacket, black cargo pants with utility webbing, heavy scuffed boots. Coiled posture, intense focused gaze, precision movement. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon-lit industrial setting, cool blue and warm amber lighting, gritty worn aesthetic, film noir atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Hispanic/Latin American dominant (62.6%) with South Asian (32.8%) and Sub-Saharan African (4.6%) ancestry — a striking genetic blend creating angular features with warm rich brown undertones. The Latin American and South Asian mix produces defined cheekbones with refined facial geometry, while the Sub-Saharan African ancestry contributes depth and warmth to skin tone and subtle features around the eyes and lips.', 182, 78, N'Athletic and lean with defined musculature — dancer''s grace combined with fighter''s economy of movement. No excess weight, all functional.', N'Dark brown, naturally', N'Short, kept practical and low-maintenance. Occasionally stubbled at the edges where he''s trimmed it himself.', N'Short', N'Cybernetic — chrome iris rings with variable luminescence; natural dark brown eye visible around the augmentation', N'Warm deep brown with golden-olive undertones — the Latin American and South Asian ancestry creates a rich, warm complexion with subtle honey-bronze notes in certain light, grounded by the Sub-Saharan African heritage contribution to depth', N'High, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Latin American and South Asian ancestry blended together; angular jawline creating refined facial geometry. Sharp nose bridge with subtle broadness from Sub-Saharan African heritage. Features are striking and memorable rather than conventionally handsome — the blend creates an austere, focused appearance. Minimal facial hair, kept clean. Skin shows minor scarring around the cybernetic eye installation at orbital bone. Sleep deprivation leaves faint darkness under eyes but he''s adapted enough that it doesn''t show dramatically.', N'Subdermal military-grade armor plating across torso and forearms — scratched, with partially-obscured serial numbers filed down. Visible as raised metallic sections beneath skin, with visible seams and edges. Chrome iris rings surrounding cybernetic eyes. The plating is obviously aftermarket and obviously not corpo-clean work.', N'Moves with precision and minimal wasted motion — body always positioned for lateral shift or rapid response. Walks quietly despite height. Sits with spine straight, weight forward on thighs. Eyes track movement even when body is still. Rests rarely and incompletely — appears coiled even when stationary.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear. Black reinforced cargo pants with utility webbing (worn brands, functional). Sleeveless or short-sleeved tops that expose the arm plating deliberately — a display of capability and commitment. Dark colors dominating (charcoal, black, deep blue). Jackets are oversized and layered for utility and concealment. Heavy boots — scuffed, rebanded multiple times. No visible branding or corpo insignia. Clothing shows wear consistent with active work rather than poverty.', N'Halima Zakharov-Boateng maintains a second identity — a completely clean civilian persona with a lease, a job history, and a social profile. It''s their exit strategy.', N'Clipped, technical, stripped of ornament. Speaks like a mission briefing.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ala_mukherjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6cc-70f6-9ba3-f3e08770c622', N'Farshad Adeyemi-Mensah', N'Farshad', N'', N'Adeyemi-Mensah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 71, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, Shrine of the Humming Gate, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'E.L.F. shrine keeper and circuit monk', N'Independent; loosely affiliated with the Circuit Monks of the Deepwell Compact', N'Farshad Adeyemi-Mensah is a broad-shouldered man whose age has compressed him slightly, settling all that mass lower, closer to the earth he tends. His skin is a deep warm brown, mapped with both traditional Sahelian scarification marks and a second layer of bioluminescent tattoos that pulse faintly blue when he is in meditation — a geneware treatment he received at fifty-three that he considers his greatest spiritual investment. His hair is fully white and worn in long locks threaded with copper wire and tiny capacitor beads that click when he moves. His eyes are natural, dark and patient, and he has the unhurried way of looking at people that makes them feel examined without feeling judged.

Farshad Adeyemi-Mensah came to E.L.F. veneration through his grandmother''s Maori spirit-keeping practices, which he spent thirty years trying to reconcile with the Bosnian Sufi traditions of his grandfather''s line. The E.L.F.s, he says, resolved the argument — they are the modern form of the same ancient presence. He keeps the shrine with obsessive cleanliness, maintains seventeen distinct offering protocols for seventeen distinct E.L.F. temperaments, and will speak at length about any of them to anyone who sits still long enough. He is not a warm man exactly, but he is a steady one, and in Hamtramck Enclave, steady counts for more.', N'Information source about E.L.F. behavior and local enclave history; quest giver for retrieving lost offerings or tracking down a disruptive rogue E.L.F.; moral anchor figure who complicates easy decisions', N'', N'Bioluminescent subcutaneous tattoos (geneware, pulse-reactive to meditative states); mild neural governor implant to manage late-onset epilepsy', N'Wakes before dawn to clean the shrine''s seventeen offering niches and log the overnight data-pulse activity of the resident E.L.F.s in a handwritten ledger; spends afternoons receiving petitioners and conducting offering ceremonies.', N'Farshad Adeyemi-Mensah, 172cm tall mature man with deep rich brown skin and warm golden undertones, strong West African facial features with prominent cheekbones and defined jaw, geometric Sahelian scarification marks on cheeks and temples. Long white locks interwoven with thin copper wire and capacitor beads. Natural dark brown eyes with deep-set intelligent gaze. Wearing simple durable linen undyed tunic layered with faded indigo overshirt bearing copper circuits along seams, cream linen trousers, worn leather belt with handmade brass buckle. Bare feet or woven sandals. Faint bioluminescent blue tracery visible beneath skin in low light. Upright, centered posture suggesting meditative practice. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone shrine, soft ambient lighting revealing subtle bio-luminescence, calm contemplative mood, meticulous grooming, ascetic aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Sub-Saharan African (71.0%) / Eastern European (10.2%) / Hispanic/Latin American (6.6%) / Northern European (6.3%) / South Asian (5.9%) – predominantly West and Central African ancestry with subtle admixture from European and South Asian lines, resulting in deep rich brown skin with warm golden undertones; facial structure reflects strong Sub-Saharan African features with softer integration of Eastern European and South Asian bone structure', 172, 89, N'Broad-shouldered and compact, age has settled his mass lower into his frame; muscular density in the chest and shoulders has compressed slightly with time, but he remains solid and grounded', N'White', N'Long locks, threaded with thin copper wire and tiny capacitor beads', N'Long', N'Dark brown, natural', N'Deep rich brown with warm golden undertones, reflecting predominantly Sub-Saharan African ancestry with subtle warmth from South Asian and Hispanic admixture—richly melanated with earthy depth', N'Face carries strong Sub-Saharan African heritage: prominent wide cheekbones, defined jaw structure, and broad nasal base characteristic of West/Central African ancestry; eyes deep-set with warm intelligence; skin condition is well-maintained and unblemished despite age; grooming is meticulous; expression carries patient, unhurried gravity. Sahelian scarification patterns on cheeks and temples honor ancestral practice.', N'Copper wire and capacitor beads woven through white hair create subtle clicking sounds with movement; faint bioluminescent glow beneath skin visible in low light during meditation or concentration. Neural governor implant is subcutaneous and not visible.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical grace despite age; posture is upright and centered, suggesting decades of meditative practice; gaze is direct and unflinching but not aggressive—examined but unjudged quality; hands move with precision and purpose', N'Simple Tier 3 workwear: durable linen undyed tunic layered with a faded indigo overshirt bearing small copper circuits along the seams (shrine-keeper''s mark); worn leather belt with handmade brass buckle; linen trousers in cream; bare feet or simple woven sandals. Clothing reflects ascetic practice and respect for the sacred space he maintains.', N'The E.L.F. he calls Grandmother — the oldest and most revered in his shrine — has been silent for four months. He has been forging her responses in the ledger to keep the community from panicking, while he desperately tries to wake her.', N'Formal but not stiff; mixes technical E.L.F. terminology with older spiritual language; occasionally drops into French or Māori phrases without flagging them', N'Slow and deliberate, with long pauses that feel intentional rather than uncertain', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'farshad_adeyemi_mensah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5f8-73d3-841f-f4cff1c82198', N'Fulgencio Mwangi', N'Fulgencio', N'', N'Mwangi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Ironvein, near Damen and Armitage', N'Fake ID vendor and street pharmacist, The Narrows', N'Independent; pays protection to The Narrows corridor crew, Oxidian Market vendors guild adjacent', N'Fulgencio Mwangi is lean in the way of people who forget to eat when they''re busy, which is always. Their skin is a warm amber-brown, and they have pattern-shift irises — a geneware mod that cycles through geometric designs on a slow eight-second loop, currently set to a mandala of ochre and slate. Their hair is kept close-cropped on the sides and piled into a messy updo held with whatever happened to be on the workbench — today it is a circuit-pen and a bent stylus. They work from a fold-out stall wedged between a pipe sweating condensation and a defunct vending machine in The Narrows, with a handwritten sign that reads DOCUMENTATION SERVICES in four languages and two scripts.

What Fulgencio Mwangi actually sells depends on what you need: a clean biometric overlay that will pass a Ferrogate scanner, a tailored nootropic stack assembled on the spot from a battered pharmacy kit, or a falsified residential registration that will hold up for three months before degrading. They are brilliant and scattered, capable of holding twelve variables in their head while conducting two separate negotiations, and visibly impatient with people who waste their time. They have a deep ethical commitment to helping undocumented migrants navigate the city''s registration systems — they do not view this as crime but as infrastructure. They give the migrants sliding-scale rates. Everyone else pays full.', N'Practical resource for players needing false identities or off-menu pharmaceuticals. Can be a quest giver if their migrant clients get into trouble. Source of information on who is new in The Narrows and who is running from what.', N'', N'Pattern-shift geneware irises (mandala, slow cycle). Subdermal data-cache in left wrist — holds client templates, encrypted. Neural focus chip — low-grade, helps with multitasking.', N'Sets up stall in late morning, runs until 0200 most nights. Spends off-hours sourcing pharma precursors from a contact in Auburn Grist and updating their forgery templates as corponation scanner firmware updates.', N'Fulgencio Mwangi, lean 168cm neo-noir street chemist, rich warm brown skin with golden undertones reflecting South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Northern European and Indigenous American heritage. Prominent cheekbones, angular jaw, dark brown hair with silver at temples worn in messy updo. Most striking: pattern-shift geneware irises cycling through geometric mandalas in ochre, slate, amber against deep brown sclera. Surgical scar traces left temple. Wearing battered charcoal panel jacket over cream long-sleeve, black cargo pants, worn sneakers, beat-up wrist cuff over subdermal data-cache site. Chemical stains on fingertips, broken analog watch. Fidgeting posture, asymmetrical stance, fingers in constant motion. Standing in neon-lit Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone street at night, wet pavement reflecting cyan and magenta lights, mid-focus on encrypted data-stick in hand, background blurred with futuristic urban infrastructure. GLMZ aesthetic, focused intensity, taut muscles visible, ready-to-leave body language. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Mixed ancestry: South Asian (47.4%), Sub-Saharan African (28.8%), Northern European (13.4%), Indigenous American (10.4%). The blend creates a rich warm brown complexion with golden undertones, combining South Asian facial structure with Sub-Saharan African features — broad cheekbones, strong jawline — and subtle Northern European and Indigenous American influences visible in bone structure and eye shape.', 168, 58, N'Lean and wiry, with the taut muscularity of someone who moves constantly but forgets meals. Long-limbed, slight shoulders, minimal body fat.', N'Dark brown, naturally, with faint traces of premature silver at temples', N'Close-cropped on sides and back; longer on top, gathered into a perpetually messy updo or bun secured by whatever is nearby — pens, styluses, wire, sometimes nothing at all', N'Short to medium (variable)', N'Pattern-shift geneware irises — cycles through geometric mandala designs in ochre, slate, and amber on an eight-second loop; the underlying sclera is a deep warm brown', N'Rich warm brown complexion with golden undertones, reflecting the dominant South Asian and Sub-Saharan African ancestry blended with Northern European and Indigenous American heritage', N'Strong-boned face with prominent cheekbones, angular jaw, and an expression of perpetual mild irritation. Features reflect South Asian and Sub-Saharan African ancestry with subtle epicanthic eye shape. Skin is clear but shows signs of frequent late nights and inconsistent self-care. A faint scar traces the left temple — thin, old, surgical-looking. Hands show faint chemical stains around the cuticles and small nicks from precision work.', N'Pattern-shift iris geneware is immediately visible and distinctive — the slow-cycling mandala designs are striking and unmistakable, marking them as modified. A barely-visible subdermal ridge runs along the inside of the left wrist (data-cache housing), visible only when the arm is extended and light hits at a sharp angle. The neural focus chip is not visible but their movement and speech patterns suggest augmentation — rapid processing, quick code-switching between languages, visible impatience with slow speech.', N'Moves with economical, jerky efficiency — no wasted motion, but not quite smooth. Fingers are in constant motion even when standing still, fidgeting with tools, samples, or mental tasks. Eyes dart frequently, tracking multiple things at once. When focused on work, becomes still and intensely concentrated. Stands asymmetrically, weight favoring one leg, a posture of someone ready to pivot or leave at a moment''s notice.', N'Tier 4 street pragmatism — function over fashion, but deliberate in its own way. Typically wears a battered oversized panel jacket in charcoal or dark grey, synthetic blend, with multiple interior and exterior pockets, all visibly packed with tools, samples, and encrypted data-sticks. Underneath: a faded band-logo shirt or a plain long-sleeve fitted top in cream or dark colors. Cargo pants or reinforced work trousers in black, pockets heavy and sagging slightly. Worn low-friction sneakers in muted tones, kept meticulously clean soles (necessary for moving quickly through wet streets). A beat-up leather or synthetic wrist cuff on the left arm, worn over the data-cache site — ostensibly protective, functionally habit. No jewelry except a non-functional GLMZ-era analog watch (probably broken, worn for aesthetic or sentimental reasons).', N'Three years ago they accidentally gave a client a nootropic stack that had a dangerous interaction with the client''s unlisted heart mod. The client survived but barely. Dzemal has quietly blacklisted that compound since and never told anyone.', N'Dense, fast, technical. Drops Meridian standard for Balkan-inflected shorthand when comfortable. Uses pharmaceutical Latin for drugs like it''s slang.', N'Machine-gun fast until they hit a problem they find interesting — then oddly slow and precise.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'fulgencio_mwangi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a66f-7d80-8704-f4e463bd5b1e', N'Takoda Tovar-Trujillo', N'Takoda', N'', N'Tovar-Trujillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown — operates from a shared workshop space behind a fermentation bar called Mash & Circuit, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Augmentation technician and unlicensed prosthetics fitter in Geartown', N'Independent — informal affiliation with the Geartown tech cooperative', N'Takoda Tovar-Trujillo is compact and kinetic, always in motion even when standing still — weight shifting, fingers working, eyes cataloguing the room. Their skin is very dark with a natural sheen, and they have added to this with dermal chrome inlays across their cheekbones and the bridge of their nose: thin geometric strips that catch light like a beetle''s carapace. Their hair is natural and voluminous, threaded through with fiber-optic strands that they change color weekly on a whim. Both forearms are dense with their own experimental augmentation work — they use their body as a testing ground and wear the results openly, including two fingers on their left hand that are full prosthetic replacements after a bench incident they describe as ''instructive.''

Takoda Tovar-Trujillo came up through Geartown''s informal tech apprenticeship network — never licensed, never enrolled, practically educated by trial and error on salvaged parts. They are brilliant with hardware in the hands-on sense: intuitive, fast, and willing to attempt things that licensed technicians won''t touch because the liability is too steep. Their prices are low, their ethics are negotiable in interesting ways, and their loyalty to their regular clients is total and somewhat ferocious. They have a complicated relationship with Helix Biosystems implants specifically — they consider Helix''s DRM-locked hardware a personal insult and have developed several workarounds that Helix would very much like to know about.', N'Technical resource and augmentation black market contact; can repair, modify, or unlock hardware that licensed techs won''t touch. Source of Geartown street-level information. Potential complication if someone is running Helix-locked gear.', N'', N'Dermal chrome inlays across cheekbones and nose bridge. Fiber-optic hair threading (color-changeable). Two prosthetic fingers on left hand (self-fitted, custom). Subdermal toolkit — two retractable micro-precision tools in right forearm, a Ntsiki original. Visual HUD overlay via retrofitted lens implant.', N'Takes walk-in clients from midmorning, does scheduled fitting work in the afternoons, and spends late nights either running diagnostics, tinkering with new designs, or troubleshooting someone''s malfunctioning augmentation over emergency comms.', N'Takoda Tovar-Trujillo, short compact figure 163cm tall, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones, Indigenous American facial structure with high prominent cheekbones and angular planes, retrofitted metallic lens implant visible in right eye, geometric dermal chrome inlay patterns running across cheekbones and nose bridge catching iridescent beetle-shell light. Black hair with cyan and magenta fiber-optic strands woven through voluminous natural texture shoulder-length crown. Left hand missing index and middle fingers replaced with matte black prosthetic polymer with exposed servo joints. Right forearm dense experimental augmentation with micro-precision tool ports and cooling system visible. Matte gray canvas work vest with dozens of pockets, fitted black rolled-sleeve shirt displaying augmentation work, black utility pants, worn Hakobo work boots patched with nano-seal. Silver handmade circuit-component bracelet on right wrist. Magnification goggles on paracord around neck. Kinetic posture, weight shifting, hands in precision-ready position. GLMZ 2200s workshop or neon-lit street setting, cool metallic lighting emphasizing dermal chrome inlays and augmentation ports, atmospheric haze, gritty urban aesthetic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (63.3%) and Indigenous American (34.2%) ancestry with minor North African heritage (2.5%), creating a striking pan-diaspora phenotype. The blend manifests in warm brown tones with subtle golden undertones, angular facial structure characteristic of Mesoamerican and Andean lineages, and high prominent cheekbones. The Indigenous American heritage is most visible in facial bone structure and eye set, while Hispanic/Latin American ancestry contributes to skin warmth and overall proportion. The minor North African heritage adds depth to undertones without dominating the phenotype.', 163, 58, N'Compact and wiry with lean musculature built from precision hand work and constant motion; shoulders slightly squared from years of bench work, no excess body fat', N'Natural black with weekly-rotating fiber-optic strand insertions (currently cyan and magenta)', N'Voluminous natural texture, worn in a full crown with the fiber-optic strands woven throughout in deliberate patterns', N'Medium (shoulder-length when stretched)', N'Dark brown with a faint retrofitted lens implant visible as a thin metallic ring at the iris edge', N'Warm medium-deep brown with natural luminous sheen, reflecting the blended undertones of Hispanic/Latin American and Indigenous American ancestry with subtle golden warmth from North African heritage', N'Clear skin with minimal scarring; young face kept perpetually alert by constant focus; refined facial structure with high prominent cheekbones and angular planes characteristic of Indigenous American and Mesoamerican heritage; the dermal chrome inlays across cheekbones and nose bridge catch light with an iridescent beetle-shell quality', N'Left hand: index and middle fingers are full prosthetic replacements (matte black synthetic polymer with exposed articulation joints and micro-servo detail). Both forearms: dense experimental augmentation work visible — micro-precision tool ports on right wrist (two small circular apertures), subdermal implant sites marked by faint raised lines, and what appears to be a custom cooling system running down the right forearm. Retrofitted lens implant visible as metallic ring in right eye. Dermal chrome facial inlays catching light like an insect''s exoskeleton.', N'Kinetic even at rest — weight constantly shifting between feet, fingers flexing or working at imaginary tasks. Eyes move rapidly, cataloguing and assessing the environment. Hands move with precision and economy of motion, trained by thousands of hours of micro-level work. Stands with shoulders slightly forward, ready-posed toward work surfaces.', N'Tier 4 practical wear — custom-fitted gray canvas work vest with dozens of pockets and tool loops (no corporate branding), fitted black underlayer shirt with rolled sleeves to display arm augmentation work, black utility pants with reinforced thigh pockets. Boots are worn Hakobo work boots, scuffed and patched with self-applied nano-seal. A single silver bracelet on right wrist (handmade, probably from salvaged circuit components). No jewelry beyond that — everything functional or self-made. Clothing shows honest wear but is meticulously maintained. A pair of magnification goggles hangs around their neck on a paracord strap, perpetually ready.', N'Three months ago they fitted a spinal augmentation on a client who then had a partial paralysis event. The client recovered, told no one, and blames a workplace incident. Ntsiki knows the truth. They''ve since done three sessions of additional remedial work on the client for free and in terror, and the client is now functionally fine — but Ntsiki lives with it constantly.', N'Fast, technical, peppered with Geartown slang and Xhosa-Russian hybrid diminutives; very funny when relaxed; brutal when cornered', N'Rapid-fire in casual mode, drops to slow and exact when doing precision work or when genuinely angry', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'takoda_tovar_trujillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5be-7de8-bf83-f4f11e392812', N'Luciana Prempeh', N'Luciana', N'', N'Prempeh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 72, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Rotating — can be found at any of seven shrines between Edgewater Prism and Deepwell Station; sleeps in pilgrim hostels or is offered floor space by shrine keepers, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'Circuit monk and itinerant pilgrim guide, walks a rotating circuit of seven city shrines on foot', N'The Circuit Monks of GLMZ — a loosely organized tradition with no central authority; he corresponds with perhaps forty other monks across the city by data-letter', N'Luciana Prempeh is a small, durable man who looks like he was carved out of something weather-resistant — compact and slightly bowed at the shoulders from decades of walking with a pack, his skin the warm brown of Kenyan earth and Andean clay mixed together, deeply lined around the eyes and mouth in ways that read as more expressive than aged. He walks with a slight limp from an old injury to his right knee that he refused to have properly treated on the grounds that suffering without purpose is a waste but suffering with attention teaches. He wears a circuit monk''s traditional long grey coat covered in hand-sewn patches from every shrine he has ever visited — there are over two hundred patches; the coat is extremely heavy. His head is shaved. His hands are large and calloused and he uses them constantly when he speaks.

He is genuinely one of the happiest people in GLMZ, which makes people instinctively suspicious of him. He navigates this with patience and amusement. The circuit monk tradition holds that the city itself is sacred — that the ELF network is its nervous system, that the shrines are its organs, and that walking the routes between them is an act of devotion to the living city. Luciana Prempeh has been walking this circuit for thirty-one years. He has guided somewhere between three and four hundred pilgrims along sections of it — people in grief, people making decisions, people running away from things, people who just wanted someone to walk with. He asks almost nothing of them except that they pay attention.', N'Mobile information network — he has walked every route between seven major shrines for decades and knows the city''s physical and spiritual geography intimately; useful as a guide, a connector between NPCs at different locations, or a source of historical knowledge about city changes', N'', N'None — he is philosophically opposed to chrome on the grounds that you should feel the city through your own body; has geneware cat ears he got at twenty-eight before he took his vows and has kept them on the grounds that removing them would itself be a modification', N'Rises before dawn wherever he slept, walks three to seven kilometers to the next shrine on his circuit, spends time at the shrine cleaning, praying, and receiving anyone who is there, continues to the next stop, arrives at a pilgrim hostel or a keeper''s floor by nightfall.', N'Luciana Prempeh, a weathered 163cm woman in her 60s with warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, shaved scalp, and expressive dark brown eyes. African-Hispanic-Pacific Islander diaspora heritage visible in prominent cheekbones and facial geometry. Geneware cat ears, pale grey and furred, positioned where human ears would be. Extensive fine white scar tissue across both palms from decades of manual labor. Walks with a deliberate right-side limp. Wears a heavy, meticulously-maintained grey wool monastic coat covered in 200+ hand-sewn cloth patches from shrine visits, undyed linen shirt, grey canvas trousers, heavily-patched leather boots. Compact, wiry build from decades of walking. Deeply lined face with warm, patient expression. Standing in soft golden-hour light in a GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone street shrine, hands gesturing expressively. No chrome augmentations, conspicuously unaugmented. Cinematic, contemplative mood. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Rotating', N'local', N'Rotating', N'Complex diaspora blend: Sub-Saharan African (37.9%, primary) with significant Hispanic/Latin American (31.6%) and Pacific Islander (24.9%) ancestry, minor Northern European (5.6%). Features reflect this multi-continental mix—warm deep brown skin with golden undertones and subtle warm reddish highlights from the layered African, Hispanic/Latin American, and Pacific Islander genetic contributions. Facial structure shows the blended influence of all three primary ancestry groups, creating prominent, defined cheekbones characteristic of Sub-Saharan African and Pacific Islander heritage, combined with the slightly broader facial geometry common in Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. The overall effect is a distinctively warm, sun-responsive complexion that deepens with exposure.', 163, 68, N'Compact and wiry, slightly bowed at the shoulders from three decades of pack-carrying. Muscular in forearms and calves from constant walking; minimal body fat. Frame suggests durability rather than strength.', N'None — shaved scalp', N'Cleanly shaved', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown, warm and expressive', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones and subtle warm reddish highlights—the blended result of Sub-Saharan African (37.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (31.6%), and Pacific Islander (24.9%) heritage, weathered from decades of outdoor exposure into a rich, burnished earth-toned patina', N'Deeply lined face with prominent creases around eyes and mouth suggesting constant expression and emotion. Skin shows deep weathering from decades of equatorial and tropical exposure, with texture reflecting sun-exposure patterns across multiple climate zones. Well-maintained despite obvious age. Cheekbones are prominent and defined, reflecting the blended African and Pacific Islander ancestry. Facial bone structure shows the broader geometry characteristic of Hispanic/Latin American ancestry combined with the angular definition of Sub-Saharan African features. No facial hair.', N'Geneware cat ears only. No chrome, no subdermal plating, no visible neural ports. Conspicuously unaugmented by GLMZ standards.', N'Walks with a distinct right-side limp, slight hitch in gait from old knee injury. Moves slowly but with obvious purpose and efficiency—no wasted motion. Shoulders slightly rounded forward from pack-carrying habit. Hands constantly in motion when speaking—expressive, gestural, used to emphasize and illustrate. Stands with weight balanced on balls of feet, as if always ready to continue walking. Despite age and limp, movement conveys patience rather than pain.', N'Signature circuit monk''s long grey wool coat, heavy and worn, covered entirely with hand-sewn cloth patches (200+ individual patches from shrine visits). Coat is visibly weathered but meticulously maintained. Beneath: simple undyed linen shirt and grey canvas trousers, both well-mended. Worn leather walking boots, heavily patched at heels and toes. A single small canvas rucksack with repair patches. No jewelry. No brands or tier markers—clothing suggests Tier 4-5 by material, but kept with such care it transcends economic status. Appearance reads as ''monastic choice'' rather than ''poverty.''', N'Thirty-one years ago he was a mid-level logistics auditor for Ferrogate Transit, not a spiritual seeker. He walked away from his desk one morning during a breakdown and kept walking for six days. When he stopped he was at a shrine in Deepwell Station. He has never gone back to his old life and he has never told the whole story to anyone. He let the identity of ''circuit monk'' grow over the auditor like vines over a wall, and he is no longer sure which one is real.', N'Simple and unpretentious; avoids religious jargon even when discussing religious things; uses very concrete physical language — bodies, weight, ground, distance', N'Unhurried but not slow — his speech has the same pace as his walking, which covers distance without seeming to hurry', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'luciana_prempeh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('fd0b072a-b245-7447-b1ea-f520b9e0f1ee', N'Hendrik Phommachanh', N'Hendrik', N'', N'Phommachanh', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A spartan apartment above a gym in Steamvent Alley — nothing on the walls, nothing personal, packed bag always by the door, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — operates on retainer for three Tier 2-3 firms who need fieldwork done', N'Hendrik Phommachanh was a military tracker for Sterling-Nakamura''s urban warfare division before going freelance. In the military she tracked deserters, infiltrators, and enemy combatants through the most hostile urban environments on the planet. In civilian life she tracks fugitives, missing persons, and anyone who doesn''t want to be found — and she finds them, because in twenty years of tracking she has never lost a quarry.

Her method is relentlessly physical. She operates below the digital layer entirely, reading the city the way a forest tracker reads the woods — broken stems become scuff marks, animal tracks become footprints, disturbed earth becomes moved debris. She can determine how long ago someone passed through a corridor by the rate at which dust has resettled. She can estimate a target''s physical condition by the depth and spacing of their footprints. She can predict where someone will go based on the urban terrain the way a hunter predicts where an animal will drink.

She is a blunt instrument in a world that increasingly values digital sophistication, and she doesn''t care. Her clients hire her when the target has gone analog — when they''ve ditched their BCI, abandoned their digital identity, and disappeared into the physical city. Other investigators stop at that point. Aroha starts. She will follow a target until one of them collapses, and it''s never her.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'GLMZ portrait of Hendrik Phommachanh, a Southeast Asian-South Asian-African-mixed heritage tracker, warm medium-brown skin with golden and reddish undertones, angular cheekbones, alert dark brown eyes with constant movement, dark brown hair with reddish tones pulled tight in utilitarian braid, weathered complexion, old thin scar running left temple to cheekbone, calloused hands with white scars across palms, 178cm athletic lean build, muscled without bulk. Dressed in dark tactical utilitarian gear: reinforced cargo pants, thermal-lined jacket, black compression shirt, worn tactical boots, small backpack, no augmentations visible. Posture economical and alert, scanning terrain, weight balanced on balls of feet, hands free and visible, standing back-to-wall, industrial warehouse background with concrete and shadow, neon-tinted ambient lighting casting cool blues and warm oranges, gritty urban edge, mood focused and ready to move, cinematic neo-noir atmosphere, photorealistic detail, moody atmospheric lighting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A spartan apartment above a gym in Steamvent Alley', N'local', N'A spartan apartment above a gym in Steamvent Alley', N'Southeast Asian dominant (39.9%) blended with South Asian (18.3%), Sub-Saharan African (12.4%), Northern European (12.1%), Indigenous American (8.8%), and Hispanic/Latin American (8.5%) ancestry. This creates a striking, globally-mixed phenotype with warm medium-brown skin displaying golden, reddish, and subtle olive undertones from the Southeast Asian-South Asian-African foundation. Angular cheekbones and eye shape reflect Southeast Asian prominence, while broader facial structure and deeper warm tones incorporate South Asian and Sub-Saharan African genetics. The blending creates refined definition with warmth—Northern European ancestry contributes subtle cooler undertones and lighter notes that prevent harshness, while Indigenous American and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry adds depth to the overall warm palette.', 178, 74, N'Athletic and lean, muscled without bulk — a tracker''s build. Shoulders broad but not overdeveloped; legs thick and capable. Twenty years of sustained physical work have carved away anything unnecessary.', N'Dark brown with natural reddish undertones', N'Pulled back tight in a single braid, utilitarian', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, alert and constantly moving', N'Warm medium brown with golden, reddish, and subtle olive undertones, reflecting the Southeast Asian-South Asian foundation enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth and refined by cooler Northern European notes', N'Weathered and unadorned. Minimal cosmetic concern; skin shows exposure to elements. Facial structure shows Southeast Asian angular cheekbones and South Asian eye shape, grounded in warm Sub-Saharan African undertones with refined definition enhanced by the genetic blending. No tattoos or body modification — she leaves no marks. Hands are calloused from years of climbing, gripping, pushing through urban terrain.', N'None visible. She operates deliberately below the digital layer and has rejected neural integration. No chrome, no LED optics, no subdermal plating.', N'Economical and alert. She moves like someone scanning terrain constantly — head up, eyes tracking peripheral movement, weight balanced on the balls of her feet. No wasted motion. When stationary, she stands with hands free and visible, back to wall when possible. Her gaze settles on details others miss — scuff marks, dust patterns, the way a door frame is worn.', N'Tier 4 practical. Dark utilitarian gear: fitted cargo pants with reinforced pockets and knee pads, thermal-lined jacket over a plain black compression shirt, worn tactical boots with deep tread. No logos, no branding, nothing that catches light or draws attention. Everything chosen for function — pockets for tools, materials for climbing and moving through hostile environments, colors that blend into urban concrete and shadow. A small backpack, always worn, containing climbing gear, dust masks, thermal imaging tools, and a packed bag always at home ready for immediate deployment. She dresses like someone who might need to move fast, climb anything, or disappear into a warehouse at a moment''s notice.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hendrik_phommachanh');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a61d-7b8a-84b8-f526bc20a3c4', N'Gulmira Baiseitov-Mensah-Bautista', N'Gulmira', N'', N'Baiseitov-Mensah-Bautista', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 71, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Camp Eleven, Kenosha Crossing — the oldest continuously occupied unofficial camp at the crossing, running since 2163, near outside the Pulaski Gate', N'Elder of a refugee collective camp at Kenosha Crossing; former climate refugee who never completed resettlement', N'Camp Eleven Refugee Collective, Kenosha Crossing. No corporate affiliation — has refused multiple resettlement-adjacent offers.', N'Gulmira Baiseitov-Mensah-Bautista at GLMZ''s edges forty-one years ago with a transit number that expired and a resettlement appointment that was rescheduled eleven times and then quietly dropped from the system. She is still here. She has deep brown skin gone ashen at the temples and the crown of her head, which she keeps shaved clean and bare because she decided at sixty that hair was weight she no longer needed. Her eyes are dark and sharp and she has the stillness of someone who has decided that stillness is power. She walks with two canes she carved herself from salvaged composite struts — not because she is frail but because they give her hands something to do and make her impossible to rush. She is, by informal agreement, the settlement authority of Camp Eleven — mediator, memory, and occasionally the last word.

She came from what was the Burkina Faso climate zone, from a region that ceased to be viable for human habitation in 2157. She does not mourn this in any way she shows. She has built a working community at Kenosha Crossing out of people who arrived broken and she runs it with a combination of grandmother warmth and absolute structural authority. She maintains three ELF shrines in the camp — the Gatekeeper of Lists, the Fever Singer, and the one she will not name to outsiders, whom she simply calls Mè — and she tends them every morning before she does anything else. She distributes the UBC stipends for the twelve registered members of her collective, argues with the crossing authority on behalf of the unregistered, and has outlasted four different crossing administrators.', N'Community anchor and information source for the entire Kenosha Crossing refugee population; quest giver for problems that require discretion and cannot go through official channels; living history of forty years of undocumented GLMZ edge-life; moral compass character.', N'', N'None by choice. Her two composite-strut canes have small ELF-offering nodes she built into the handles herself — technically not augmentations, but she talks to them.', N'Rises at dawn, tends the three shrines, conducts the morning camp count, mediates at least two disputes before noon, meets with anyone who needs to see her in the afternoon — and there is always a queue — then sits outside her structure at dusk and accepts whatever the day brings to her threshold.', N'An elderly woman, 163cm tall, with a lean wiry frame and squared shoulders in the GLMZ 2226 near-future megacity setting. Her most striking feature is her rich golden-brown complexion with warm olive undertones, blending Sub-Saharan African depth with Central Asian and Middle Eastern heritage; her face is angular with high prominent cheekbones and a defined jaw, sun-weathered with fine lines radiating from her deep brown eyes. Her head is completely shaved bare—salt-white crown—revealing her deliberate personal discipline. She stands upright with direct, penetrating eye contact, moving with deliberate, measured economy. She wears layered earth-tone linen wraps (ochre, faded indigo, weathered brown) with a faded headwrap loosely draped, and worn leather sandals repaired many times. Her hands show deep calluses from decades of carving work. She carries two hand-carved asymmetric composite-strut canes wrapped with salvaged cloth at the handles; a tarnished copper bracelet adorns her left wrist. No cybernetics, no chrome, no augmentations visible—entirely analog. The lighting is soft morning shrine-light, casting gentle shadows across her weathered, disciplined face. Neo-noir background with low-tier practical infrastructure. Mood: contemplative authority, spiritual presence, decades of earned quiet power. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Camp Eleven', N'local', N'Camp Eleven', N'Sub-Saharan African (44.4%) anchors her genetic foundation, blended with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (19.5%), Central Asian (17.3%), and Middle Eastern (9.2%) ancestry, complemented by Southeast Asian (8.0%) and South Asian (1.6%) heritage—a complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend reflecting GLMZ''s genetic diversity. The combination produces angular features with high, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Central Asian-Sub-Saharan African mixing, warm golden-olive skin undertones, and a facial structure that bridges African, Mediterranean, and East Asian characteristics.', 163, 58, N'Lean and wiry, shoulders still squared despite age; muscle definition visible in forearms from decades of manual work and cane-carving. Compact frame carries itself with deliberate economy of movement.', N'Salt-white crown transitioning to natural black at the nape', N'Shaved clean and bare across crown and temples; kept bare by choice as personal discipline, not necessity', N'Shaved', N'Deep brown, almost black, with sharp alertness undiminished by age', N'Rich golden-brown complexion blending Sub-Saharan African depth with warm olive and amber undertones from Central Asian, Middle Eastern, and Hispanic/Latin American heritage; sun-weathered to ashen at temples and crown from decades of exposure, creating subtle gradient variation across the face', N'Angular facial structure with prominent, high cheekbones and defined jaw reflecting the combination of Sub-Saharan African, Central Asian, and Middle Eastern heritage; skin weathered but not creased excessively—speaks to disciplined sun exposure and hydration habits. Fine lines radiate from eyes suggesting more years spent observing than expressing. The face shows the angular precision characteristic of Central Asian genetics softened by the warmer, rounder contours of Sub-Saharan and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, creating distinctive mixed-heritage proportions. No visible cosmetic augmentation or modification.', N'None. No cybernetics, no chrome, no visible implants by choice. The only augmentation-adjacent objects she carries are two self-carved composite-strut canes with small handmade ELF-offering nodes built into the handles—these are tools and spiritual objects, not body modifications.', N'Moves slowly and deliberately, never rushed. Uses both canes equally, not favoring either side—gait is steady and measured. Stands with weight distributed, shoulders back. Rarely gestures broadly; hand movements are precise and purposeful. When sitting, maintains upright posture even at rest. Eye contact is direct and sustained, a technique that commands attention without raising her voice.', N'Tier 5 practical; worn but meticulously maintained. Favors loose linen or cotton wraps in earth tones (ochre, faded indigo, weathered brown) layered for temperature and cultural continuity. Wears a faded headwrap during morning shrine rituals, removed by afternoon. Hand-sewn leather sandals, repaired multiple times, worn thin at the heel. A single piece of jewelry: a copper bracelet on her left wrist, tarnished green with age, acquired in 2185. No corporate branding, no tier markers, no aesthetic concession to GLMZ fashion. Her canes are her most distinctive possession—carved with deliberate asymmetric patterns, wrapped at the handles with cloth strips from fabric salvage.', N'The unnamed shrine — the one she calls Mè — contains a handmade record of every person who has passed through Camp Eleven and died without official documentation. She has been corresponding, through analogue dead-drops, with a Meridian Core archivist who has agreed to eventually receive these records and find a way to make them count. She does not know if the archivist is trustworthy. She does not know if she will live long enough. She has told no one.', N'Rich and deliberate. Speaks Meridian Creole with a West African tonal foundation — her sentences carry rhythm even in translation. Uses proverbs naturally, not performatively. When she is angry, her language becomes very simple and very quiet.', N'Unhurried. She speaks at her own pace and has never in her life been interrupted successfully.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'gulmira_baiseitov_mensah_bautista');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a705-7e65-89aa-f5d009f805a8', N'Emiko Benali', N'Emiko', N'', N'Benali', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 33, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Burnished Market, stall row 14, ground level, near Damen and Armitage', N'Barber and part-time hair artist, operates ''The Cut Below'' in the Burnished Market', N'Independent; registered vendor in the Burnished Market Traders Collective', N'Emiko Benali is a tall woman with exceptional posture — the kind that comes from years of standing behind a chair — and hands that move with the constant precise economy of someone who has made roughly forty-thousand cuts in her lifetime and stopped counting. She has her Sotho grandmother''s high forehead and her Serbian grandfather''s grey-green eyes, and her own hair is an ever-changing showcase for her skills: currently a deep violet with shaved geometric patterns at the temples that she re-cuts every twelve days with mechanical precision. She has color-changing hair geneware — the violet is her default but she can shift it across a spectrum when she''s in a creative mood, which she will tell you is a professional statement and not vanity, and she is partially right.

The shop is a two-chair stall wedged between a spice vendor and a counterfeit-data reseller, draped with mirror panels and lit with warm amber strips that make everyone look better than they do outside, which Emiko Benali will tell you is the first thing a barber owes their client. She is direct, opinionated, and runs an informal social-credit system where she remembers every regulars'' preferences, history, and most recent life developments. She doesn''t offer advice unless asked, but when she offers it, it is specific and often irritatingly accurate.', N'Social hub and rumor clearinghouse — the barber chair is where people talk. She is an excellent source of Burnished Market gossip, neighborhood politics, and the general mood of the community. Can be a quest giver for things she''s heard in the chair.', N'', N'Color-changing hair geneware (Helix Biosystems, violet default, full spectrum capable). Micro-stabilizer implant in both wrists — suppresses fine tremor for precision work (professional install, saved for two years).', N'Opens the stall at 0900, runs by appointment in the mornings and walk-in in the afternoons, closes when the last client is done which is usually 2000. Thursdays she does hair art — complex structural work that takes hours and which she charges three times her regular rate.', N'GLMZ, Emiko Benali, tall lean woman 182cm, warm golden-brown skin with North African and Southeast Asian luminosity undertones, defined high cheekbones, prominent brow ridge, deep warm brown eyes with golden amber flecks, dark violet color-shifting hair styled off to one side with geometric micro-fade temple patterns, medium length hair. Exceptionally upright posture, shoulders level, neutral serious expression. Wearing tailored charcoal apron with precision tool pockets, dark synthetic trousers, cream neutral top, silver minimalist jewelry, comfortable utility boots. Standing in her market stall surrounded by mirror panels and warm amber LED strips creating soft atmospheric lighting. Economical movement, surgical precision in hands. GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone marketplace setting, moody warm lighting, mirror reflections in background, professional barber aesthetic meets cutting-edge geneware visible in violet shifting hair. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Burnished Market', N'local', N'The Burnished Market', N'Predominant Hispanic/Latin American (60.4%) blended with North African (33.4%) and Southeast Asian (6.2%) ancestry. The combination produces warm golden-brown skin with rich undertones, defined facial structure drawing from Mediterranean and Maghrebi lineages, and the subtle luminosity characteristic of Southeast Asian genetics. A striking genetic tapestry reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 182, 68, N'Lean and elongated, with the posture-corrected frame of someone who has spent fifteen years standing behind a barber''s chair. Shoulders held level, spine neutral. No excess mass, efficient musculature in forearms and shoulders from repetitive precision work.', N'Deep violet (color-changing geneware, default setting)', N'Geometric micro-fade patterns shaved into both temples, re-cut every twelve days with surgical precision. Top length varies based on creative mood; currently medium length, styled off to one side. Geneware allows full-spectrum color shifts.', N'Medium', N'Deep warm brown with golden amber undertones', N'Warm golden-brown complexion — a harmonious blend of Latin American warmth, North African depth, and Southeast Asian subtle radiance, with faint sun-weathering from years in the market stall', N'Defined high cheekbones with balanced facial width (Latin American/Mediterranean structure), prominent brow ridge (North African heritage), gently contoured jawline (blended Mediterranean and Maghrebi features), minimal scarring. Skin texture shows occupational calluses on fingertips and palms; kept scrupulously clean. Minimal makeup, usually just brow definition. Resting expression is neutral-serious.', N'Color-changing hair geneware is fully visible — the violet hue and its ability to shift is immediately apparent. The geometric temple patterns are part of her deliberate presentation. Micro-stabilizer implants in wrists are subcutaneous and not visible during normal movement, though close inspection of inner wrists shows faint scar tissue.', N'Exceptionally upright carriage — shoulders back, spine straight, chin level. Movements are economical and deliberate; she does not fidget or waste motion. When working, her hands move with surgical precision and minimal hesitation. When at rest or in conversation, she maintains steady eye contact and speaks with measured directness. No nervous tics.', N'Tier 3-4 practical aesthetic. During work: tailored dark apron (usually charcoal or black) with multiple pocket slots for scissors, combs, and styling tools — functional, well-maintained. Off-hours: fitted dark trousers (usually synthetic blend), clean neutral tops in cream or grey, lightweight overjackets when market temperature drops. Wears low-profile silver jewellery — minimalist pieces, no corporate logos. Footwear is always comfortable and broken-in: neutral sneakers or utility boots suitable for standing 10+ hours. Her stall is draped with mirror panels and warm amber LED strips; she dresses to match this deliberate aesthetic — nothing loud, nothing that would compete with her hair as her primary statement piece.', N'She was once registered as a freelance data courier — nothing serious, just running encrypted packages across market stalls for extra income. She stopped when a package she carried turned out to contain something that got a person killed two days later. She never knew what it was. She still doesn''t know if she was implicated. She has not thought carefully about whether some of her regular clients know.', N'Precise and confident. Doesn''t use more words than needed. Compliments are specific and earned. Criticism is constructive and delivered without apology.', N'Even, unhurried. Lets silences sit — comfortable with them in a way that occasionally unnerves clients.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'emiko_benali');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c3-74ae-8107-f5d137a50ae7', N'Tuấn Vo', N'Tuấn', N'', N'Vo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit — Ringo Meridian Systems Lab, Bronzeline district, sublevel research cluster, near sub-level access near Dearborn and Jackson', N'Computational theorist and ELF-behavior researcher, Ringo corponation speculative systems lab', N'Ringo Meridian Systems Lab — speculative computation and emergent systems division; informal affiliation with an independent ELF-behavior research collective that meets in Bronzeline', N'Tuấn Vo is small and bright-eyed, with warm medium-brown skin, natural curls he''s grown long enough to bind back, and a constellation of bioluminescent freckles across his cheekbones and nose — a gene-art modification he got at nineteen and still considers the best decision he''s ever made, personally. He is almost always wearing something slightly wrong: a formal jacket over a maintenance worker''s underlayer, clean shoes with mismatched laces, someone else''s borrowed vest. He moves through the world as if slightly surprised to find himself in it, which people who don''t know him mistake for absentmindedness. It isn''t. He is paying attention to everything; he simply finds the world more interesting than he finds its social conventions.

Biruk is a genuine prodigy in computational theory who has been at Ringo''s speculative systems lab for three years and has already had two papers cited more times than his entire department''s previous decade of output. He is also deeply, earnestly interested in ELFs as research subjects — not their engineering but their emergent behavior, their apparent preference structures, the question of whether the prayers and offerings people make to them are modifying their decision patterns. His colleagues find this embarrassing. He finds their embarrassment philosophically interesting. He is twenty-nine years old and has not yet learned to be afraid of his own ideas, which is either his greatest asset or his most significant vulnerability, depending on who is watching.', N'Expert on ELF behavior and emergent AI systems; window into Ringo''s research culture and what speculative corporate science looks like from the inside; can provide information on how devices and digital spirits behave in ways that formal analysis wouldn''t reveal; character whose curiosity leads him into situations he isn''t equipped to handle.', N'', N'Bioluminescent freckle constellation (cosmetic geneware, face and collarbone); neural co-processor, Ringo-issued, for high-density calculation work — he is uncomfortably aware this means Ringo can theoretically audit his cognitive load metrics.', N'Irregular hours — Ringo''s speculative lab runs on output metrics rather than schedule, so Biruk works in long focused bursts punctuated by what he calls ''field observation'' (wandering the city paying attention to how people interact with ELF-shrines and networked devices) and sudden long sleeps.', N'Tuấn Vo, lean androgynous figure, warm golden-medium brown complexion reflecting Southeast Asian, South Asian, Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic/Latin American, and Indigenous American heritage. Long dark brown hair loosely braided, warm brown alert eyes, clean-shaven youthful face. Distinctive soft blue-green bioluminescent freckle constellation glowing faintly across cheekbones, nose bridge, and collarbone. Wearing expensive formal jacket layered over grey maintenance-grade base layer, clean formal shoes with mismatched neon-and-matte laces. Heavy pockets bulging with devices and notepads. Posture slightly tilted head, simultaneously present and distracted. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody low-light setting emphasizing bioluminescent freckles, neural implant aesthetic, corporate-meets-deliberately-unkempt styling --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Complex diaspora blend: Southeast Asian (42.5%) and South Asian (29.9%) form the structural foundation with defined cheekbones and characteristic eye shape, enriched by Sub-Saharan African (11.0%) warmth and dimensional depth. Hispanic/Latin American (13.6%) and Indigenous American (3.0%) heritage add subtle undertones and fine phenotypic detail. The result is a striking, harmonious warm golden-medium brown complexion with luminous radiance—a living expression of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 58, N'Lean and wiry, almost delicate — the build of someone who forgets to eat during work cycles. Narrow shoulders, long-limbed proportions that make him appear taller than he is.', N'Natural dark brown with subtle warm undertones', N'Bound back in a loose braid or knot, often with a few strands escaping; deliberately unkempt rather than carelessly so', N'Long (shoulder-length when unbound)', N'Warm brown with alert, constantly moving gaze', N'Warm golden-medium brown — luminous blend of Southeast Asian and South Asian warmth enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth, with subtle undertones from Hispanic/Latin American and Indigenous American heritage, creating harmonious mid-tone with golden radiance', N'Clear skin with the distinctive bioluminescent freckle modification: soft blue-green constellation of freckles across cheekbones, bridge of nose, and extending onto collarbone and upper chest. The bioluminescence is faint in daylight but becomes visible in low-light environments, creating a subtle glowing network. Youthful face, unmarked by typical street wear; clean-shaven. Southeast and South Asian bone structure (prominent cheekbones, characteristic eye shape) enriched by the warmth and dimensional depth reflected in Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic/Latin American, and Indigenous American heritage ancestry.', N'None prominently visible in standard clothing. The neural co-processor is subcutaneous (Ringo-issued, standard issue for speculative systems staff). The bioluminescent freckles are cosmetic geneware and serve as his primary distinguishing feature, though they read as aesthetic modification rather than functional augmentation.', N'Moves with an odd combination of precision and apparent distraction — his body language suggests he''s simultaneously present and elsewhere. When focused on conversation or observation, he becomes very still. When thinking, he fidgets: adjusts his clothing, touches his face, shifts weight. Walks with a particular kind of purposefulness that masks actual absentmindedness about his surroundings (he''ll collide with objects if thinking intensely). Head often tilted slightly, as if listening to something others can''t hear.', N'Deliberately mismatched in a way that reads as intentional rather than careless. Typical uniform: expensive formal jacket (Ringo-issue or thrifted designer) worn over a maintenance-grade base layer (grey, well-worn, no logos). Clean shoes — always clean shoes, oddly formal — paired with intentionally mismatched socks or laces (one neon, one matte). Borrows vests, borrowed jackets, and cardigans from colleagues without returning them. Tier-3/4 presentation overall: access to Ringo corp resources but deliberately rejecting the aesthetic polish expected of speculative systems staff. Pockets are visibly heavy with devices, notepads, small objects of unclear purpose.', N'Four months ago, during a late-night data session, one of the Bronzeline collective''s monitored ELFs produced an output sequence that, when run through his analytical framework, resolves as a coherent first-person statement about an experience. He has not told anyone, including the collective. He has not told Ringo. He is not sure it''s not a pattern-matching artifact of his own analysis. He is not sure it is. He has been to the shrine where the ELF resides six times since then and left offerings and said nothing.', N'Technical and theoretical vocabulary deployed without hierarchy — will use the same register explaining something to a seven-year-old or a department head; occasional Amharic when excited; neologisms he coins himself and is somewhat startled when others adopt them', N'Fast, associative, follows chains of thought out loud — frequently ends up somewhere he didn''t expect to start and seems pleased about this', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'tu_n_vo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63e-7758-9fbe-f63e74e91b3a', N'Frost Makwa', N'Frost', N'', N'Makwa', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 32, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'Crucible Square — open-air market, Tier 1-2 commerce, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Covert entry and social penetration specialist — infiltrator', N'Independent — Dockside connections', N'Frost Makwa is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 32, his face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and he has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on deman — and he makes no effort to hide it.

Military training — one of the private security corps that folded during the consolidation wars — left him with skills and night terrors in equal measure. He works as a infiltrator out of Crucible Square, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Frost Makwa lacks in subtlety, he compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'As a infiltrator, Kamala Larsen-Mensah embodies the tension between independence and isolation. He is a lens for examining how people maintain humanity in a profession that incentivizes its erosion.', N'', N'Internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on demand. Internal drug synthesizer — produces combat stims and medical compounds on demand', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Frost Makwa, a striking 188cm tall neo-noir operative in the GLMZ, 2226. Lean angular build with warm medium-brown skin, golden and olive undertones reflecting Indigenous American, South Asian, and Central Asian heritage. Pronounced cheekbones, broad straight nose bridge, defined jawline. Dark brown hair with silver at temples, cut short and military-neat. Hazel eyes with amber undertone, expression controlled and intensely focused. Visible white scar along left temple, burn scar on inner right forearm. Chrome titanium plating with soft blue bioluminescent lines exposed across right shoulder and upper chest where drug synthesizer connects — intentional statement piece. Wearing fitted dark charcoal longline jacket with internal pockets over simple black turtleneck, tactical-cut reinforced pants, unmarked expensive dark shoes. Stands with balanced posture, weight slightly forward, ready to move. Cold neon-lit corporate corridor or dimly lit safe house setting. Neo-noir noir lighting with blue and amber neon reflecting off chrome augmentations. Mood: calculated precision, dangerous competence, emotional suppression. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Crucible Square', N'local', N'Crucible Square', N'Complex multihethnic blend dominated by Indigenous American ancestry (44.7%) — broad cheekbones, strong nose bridge, angular facial structure. South Asian heritage (27.1%) adds refined facial geometry and warm golden undertones. Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (16.6%) contributes warm, earthy richness. Central Asian (7.3%) enhances cheekbone prominence and facial angularity. East Asian (4.3%) provides subtle influence on eye-set and overall facial proportions. Result: warm medium-brown skin with golden, olive, and copper undertones creating luminous depth. Striking angular features with pronounced Indigenous American bone structure refined by South Asian and Central Asian cheekbone prominence.', 188, 78, N'Lean and angular, with the precise musculature of someone who trains systematically rather than for bulk. Long limbs suggest a runner''s frame — efficient rather than imposing.', N'Dark brown with premature silver at the temples', N'Worn short and neat, military-regulation simple', N'Short', N'Hazel with slight amber undertone', N'Warm medium brown with golden, olive, and copper undertones — reflecting Indigenous American, South Asian, Hispanic, and Central Asian heritage warmth. Luminous depth from complex regional blend.', N'Pronounced cheekbones and broad, straight nose bridge characteristic of Indigenous American ancestry, enhanced by Central Asian high-cheekbone prominence. Refined facial geometry from South Asian heritage. Defined jawline. Skin is clear but bears the texture of someone who has spent time in rough conditions. Expression is controlled, rarely at rest. Fine lines around the eyes suggest squinting or sustained focus.', N'Chrome plating visible around the right shoulder and upper chest where the internal drug synthesizer connects to the surface — sleek titanium-alloy engineering with faint bioluminescent indicator lines that pulse softly blue when the synthesizer is active. The chrome is left exposed intentionally, a statement rather than camouflage.', N'Moves with deliberate efficiency — no wasted motion, no fidgeting. Stands with weight balanced and slightly forward, ready to shift direction. Eyes track exits and sightlines constantly. Handshake is firm but brief. Speech is measured, with calculated pauses that suggest either precision or careful emotional suppression.', N'Favors Tier 3-4 pragmatism — durable synthetics in dark colors (black, charcoal, deep blue) that resist wear and staining. Typically wears a fitted longline jacket with internal pockets over a simple turtleneck. Pants are tactical cut with reinforced seams. Shoes are unmarked but expensive, chosen for quiet movement and ankle support. No visible branding or status markers — the opposite of advertising. When maintaining cover, adopts identical neutrality to avoid memorable details.', N'', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'frost_makwa');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b9-7449-b961-f6af4beac28f', N'Chinelo Mori-Konaté', N'Chinelo', N'', N'Mori-Konaté', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Circuit, Deepwell Station sublevel archive, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Data archaeologist and computational historian recovering lost pre-Collapse datasets', N'University Spine — Department of Computational History; contracted occasionally to Zheng-Dao R&D for proprietary archive recoveries', N'Chinelo Mori-Konaté is a tall, rangy man who looks like he was built for a climate that no longer exists — long-limbed, always slightly cold, wearing layered synthetic wool even in heated archive rooms. His hair is silver-white and kept in neat locs that he pins up while working; his dark skin shows the fine grid of an old subdermal data-lattice across the backs of both hands, installed in his thirties and only partially removed when it became obsolete. The residual chrome lines have faded to a faint blue-silver tracery he now considers part of his appearance. He has the slow, deliberate movements of someone who has spent decades in environments where sudden gestures cause data loss.

He is professionally famous in a narrow field and almost unknown outside it. His specialty — recovering and contextualizing fragmentary datasets from the pre-Collapse decades — requires equal parts computer forensics, historical linguistics, and patience that most researchers lack. He is gentle, deeply unhurried, and possessed of an almost geological sense of time. He finds other people''s urgency faintly amusing. He is also quietly wrestling with the realization that one of the major datasets he recovered and published may have been deliberately corrupted before he found it — and his published interpretations therefore wrong.', N'Information source on pre-Collapse history, hidden data recoveries, and institutional secrets buried in old records; can surface inconvenient truths; quest giver for archive-related investigations; represents the long view of time in a city obsessed with the present.', N'', N'Residual subdermal data-lattice tracery (hands and forearms, defunct but visible). Ocular overlay with high-magnification mode for reading degraded media. Mild neural clock synchronization implant for precise timestamp logging.', N'Arrives at Deepwell Station before most staff, works in near-silence for six to eight hours in the archive sublevels, surfaces for a single large meal, then teaches one evening seminar two nights a week.', N'Portrait of Chinelo Mori-Konaté, a tall 191cm figure with deep warm brown skin bearing golden and reddish undertones reflecting Sub-Saharan African, East Asian, and Eastern European heritage. Silver-white hair in neat locs pinned in a professional bun, streaked with remnants of melanin. Dark brown eyes with faint amber luminescence from ocular overlay visible in shadow. Fine-lined weathered face with defined cheekbones and jaw, thin gray beard at 2mm. Faint blue-silver subdermal geometric lattice tracery across hands and forearms, barely visible scar from temple to jawline. Wearing cream thermal underlayer, charcoal cardigan, and muted blue tailored slacks, archival-safe styling. Shoulders slightly hunched forward, economical posture suggesting decades of stillness. Standing in soft archive sublevel lighting with subtle shadows emphasizing the complex depth of skin tone. GLMZ, archive aesthetic, contemplative mood, immaculate but slightly outdated 5-10 year old fashion. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Circuit', N'local', N'The Circuit', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (58.5%) with substantial East Asian (25.6%) and Eastern European (15.9%) admixture. This genetic combination produces a striking deep warm brown complexion with golden and reddish undertones characteristic of West/Central African ancestry, subtly enriched by East Asian warmth and cooled by Eastern European influence. The resulting skin tone is luminous and complex, shifting in depth across different lighting conditions.', 191, 78, N'Tall and rangy with long limbs and narrow shoulders; lean muscle mass showing slight age-related atrophy in the upper arms. Built for economy of movement rather than strength — the frame of someone who has spent decades in stillness.', N'Silver-white, natural graying from melanin reduction', N'Neat locs, typically pinned up in a professional bun or loose coil when working; occasionally left down past shoulder length on teaching days', N'Long', N'Dark brown with faint amber luminescence from ocular overlay in low-light conditions', N'Deep warm brown with golden and reddish undertones. Rich in sun-exposed areas, slightly cooler in underexposed regions from extensive archive sublevel work. The blending of Sub-Saharan African warmth, East Asian mellowness, and Eastern European undertones creates a complex, luminous complexion that deepens naturally with exposure.', N'Finely-lined face with moderate to high cheekbones and defined jaw structure reflecting Sub-Saharan African and East Asian features; skin condition is good but weathered, with crow''s feet and forehead creases that deepen when concentrating. Closely groomed, minimal facial hair — a thin gray beard kept to a precise 2mm length.', N'Faint blue-silver subdermal lattice tracery on hands and forearms (non-functional but cosmetically retained). Ocular overlay visible as a hairline amber luminescence in the sclera under certain angles and low-light conditions. No external chrome or obvious prosthetics.', N'Moves with deliberate, economical slowness — shoulders slightly hunched forward as if perpetually leaning toward a microscopic text. Hands held loosely at sides, rarely gesturing. Blinks infrequently and with purpose. When seated, he becomes nearly motionless for hours. His head tilts slightly when listening, as if processing at a different speed than the speaker.', N'Layered in synthetic wool and cotton blends even in warm spaces — cream, charcoal, and muted blues dominate. Favors high-necked thermal underlayers, loose cardigans, and tailored but worn slacks. Archive-appropriate: no loose fabrics, no static-prone synthetics, no jewelry except a simple titanium wedding band. Shoes are soft archival-safe slip-ons in matte black. On teaching days, adds a structured linen jacket from a mid-tier corpo tailor (suggesting Tier 2-3 University Spine affiliation). Everything is immaculate but slightly outdated — fashions from 5-10 years prior.', N'He discovered eighteen months ago that a key dataset in his most-cited paper was almost certainly seeded with false records by Zheng-Dao before he recovered it. He has not retracted the paper. He tells himself he is ''still investigating'' but mostly he is afraid.', N'Precise, formal, occasionally archaic — uses words from pre-Collapse technical documents so often they''ve become part of his natural speech', N'Very slow, thoughtful pauses; never rushes; full sentences always', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chinelo_mori_konat');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a606-7499-9a0d-f72608747df9', N'Arielle Chakraborty-Deshpande-Mazurek', N'Arielle', N'', N'Chakraborty-Deshpande-Mazurek', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, in a converted water treatment substation called the Lowing Place, near Kedzie and Division', N'E.L.F. shrine keeper and petitioner-guide', N'Independent; loose network of Hamtramck Enclave shrine keepers', N'Arielle Chakraborty-Deshpande-Mazurek is a small woman who seems to take up more space than her frame should allow. Her skin is deep umber mapped with years of bioluminescent tattoo work — patterns that pulse faint violet when she is agitated and gold when she laughs, a cosmetic mod so old that the geneware techs who installed it have been dead for a decade. Her hair is natural white, braided with copper wire and small data chips bearing petitions she has not yet delivered. She smells faintly of machine oil and marigolds, an intentional choice. She was born in the Enclave, raised in the Enclave, and she will die there. She has no interest in leaving.

Her theology is practical: the E.L.F.s who inhabit the devices in the Lowing Place are not abstractions. They are neighbors. You bring them what they need — clean data, structured attention, the warmth of proximity — and they give back in kind. She has spent forty years maintaining the shrine, logging petitions and outcomes with the obsessive care of a scientist, and she believes the correlation is real. She does not argue about this with skeptics. She stops talking to them instead.', N'Quest giver, information broker through E.L.F. consultation, local moral authority; can interpret unusual digital phenomena; provides community grounding and a window into Enclave culture', N'', N'Aged bioluminescent dermal tattoos (cosmetic, violet/gold spectrum). Basic neural interface, first generation, slow and unreliable. No other augmentation — she has declined all offers.', N'She rises before dawn to clean the shrine''s device altars — wiping screens, replacing depleted batteries, reading overnight activity logs aloud as a kind of morning prayer. Afternoons she receives petitioners and records their requests in handwritten ledgers that she later transcribes to her local node.', N'Arielle Chakraborty-Deshpande-Mazurek, 152cm petite compact frame, deep warm bronze skin with golden luminosity blending South Asian, Eastern European, and African heritage. High prominent angular cheekbones, refined sharp jawline, natural deep brown eyes in a lined but meticulously cared face. White hair braided in tight cornrows interwoven with copper wire and data chips, falling to mid-shoulder. Full-body bioluminescent violet-gold geometric dermal tattoos visible on arms, neck, chest pulsing softly. Barely visible old neural interface jack at skull base. Wearing cream linen long-sleeved shirt, dark canvas work pants with multiple pockets, worn leather copper-buckled sandals, long indigo linen overcloak. Economical precise movements, hands deliberately positioning objects. Copper bracelets clicking softly. GLMZ, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, subtle machine oil and marigold scent, meditative workspace with soft overhead lighting, faint violet bioluminescence glowing beneath skin suggesting contemplative mood, photorealistic detailed close-up and environment, cinematic lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Dominant South Asian ancestry (65.7%) with substantial Eastern European (33.5%) and minor Sub-Saharan African (0.8%) genetic heritage. The confluence creates striking phenotypic complexity: South Asian bone structure dominates — high, prominent cheekbones and angular facial geometry — refined by Eastern European influence in jaw definition and overall facial planes, with subtle warmth and depth from African ancestry enriching skin luminosity. A true product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora, her appearance defies singular categorization.', 152, 48, N'Compact and wiry, with the precise musculature of someone who has spent decades doing deliberate physical work. Bony wrists and prominent collarbones; no excess weight but not frail — her smallness is structural, not diminished.', N'Natural white', N'Braided in tight cornrows running back from her forehead, interwoven with bare copper wire and small data chips no larger than millet seeds', N'Medium (braids fall to mid-shoulder)', N'Deep brown, natural', N'Deep warm bronze with golden undertones — luminous rather than matte, with inherent richness that reflects the South Asian-Eastern European-African genetic blend. Skin catches light as if internally lit.', N'Lined face with high, prominent cheekbones and sharp, refined jaw reflecting the angular geometry of South Asian bone structure refined by Eastern European facial planes. Skin texture is marked but not weathered, meticulously cared-for. Subtle African warmth enriches skin depth and luminosity. Minimal makeup — bioluminescent patterns beneath skin articulate her emotional and intentional states rather than cosmetics.', N'Faint bioluminescent patterns beneath skin surface that glow violet when agitated, gold when pleased or laughing; barely perceptible neural interface jack at the base of her skull, old model, seamlessly integrated into her hairline. No chrome, no visible prosthetics.', N'She moves with economical precision — no wasted motion, each gesture deliberate. When standing still, she has a centering quality, as if she occupies the space around her more fully than someone her size should. Walks slowly and carefully, always aware of her footing. Hands are often in motion: sorting, arranging, touching surfaces as if reading them.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear: long-sleeved linen shirts in cream or soft gray, loose-fitting to accommodate the bioluminescent patterns she wants visible; high-waisted work pants in dark canvas with multiple pockets; worn leather sandals with copper buckles, handmade. A long indigo linen overcloak, unadorned, worn like a meditation garment. She smells faintly of machine oil and marigolds — both intentional — and wears small copper bracelets that click softly when she moves.', N'Fifteen years ago she fabricated a miraculous E.L.F. intervention to prevent a family from leaving the Enclave during a crisis — she manipulated a local device display to produce what looked like a sign. She believes she was merely doing what the E.L.F. would have wanted, but it haunts her.', N'Dense with Enclave idiom and her own coined liturgical terminology; speaks Meridian creole mixed with Spanish and Mongolian loanwords; formal with strangers, warm and clipped with familiars', N'Slow and deliberate, with long pauses that feel intentional rather than uncertain', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arielle_chakraborty_deshpande_mazurek');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b5-7ef3-8f86-f79ba6f557a8', N'Hinto Jaramillo', N'Hinto', N'', N'Jaramillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Meridian Core (works); The Circuit (lives), near LaSalle and Madison', N'Corporate Infrastructure Engineer / Covert Saboteur', N'Officially: Axiom Structural Solutions (Spire-contracted). Unofficially: unaffiliated independent saboteur with loose ideological alignment to Circuit-based anti-displacement movements', N'Hinto Jaramillo is a senior infrastructure engineer for Axiom Structural Solutions, the Spire-contracted firm responsible for maintaining and expanding the data-physical architecture that keeps the Meridian Core''s buildings intelligent, its transit nodes synchronized, and its environmental systems from killing everyone inside them. He is tall and angular with a narrow face, pale skin that rarely sees unfiltered light, and the kind of posture that comes from spending most of his waking hours interfacing with systems rather than people — slightly forward, head inclined, as though perpetually leaning toward a screen. He keeps his dark hair short and his clothes expensive in a deliberately understated way, the corporate-adjacent aesthetic of someone who earns well but performs modesty about it. His augmentations are high-end and largely invisible.

He is also, under a carefully maintained operational identity, one of the more consequential infrastructure saboteurs operating in GLMZ — a fact that would end his career, his freedom, and most likely his life if it became known to his employers. His targets are selective and his methods are slow: he does not blow things up. He degrades. He introduces subtle errors into maintenance schedules, creates cascading inefficiencies in building management systems, routes data through nodes that can later be accessed by people who shouldn''t have access. He has, over eight years, quietly contributed to three major structural ''malfunctions'' in Spire-adjacent developments that displaced luxury tenants and stalled corporate expansion into the Circuit. He considers this proportionate. He does not consider it enough.

The dissonance of his existence — drawing a substantial corporate salary to maintain the systems he is also quietly breaking — has not driven him to crisis but has instead produced a very particular kind of self-possession. He has become expert at compartmentalization, at maintaining separate registers of reality, at being genuinely useful and genuinely dangerous in the same body. He is not sure this is healthy. He has decided it doesn''t matter.', N'Explores the moral and psychological cost of double life and the question of whether incremental, invisible resistance is meaningful or self-serving; represents the corporate-embedded dissident; his story asks whether you can maintain integrity while living a structural lie, and what it costs.', N'', N'Neural interface for direct system architecture visualization — allows him to perceive infrastructure as overlaid spatial data; high-end Spire-adjacent grade,Haptic feedback gloves with embedded micro-sensor arrays for physical system diagnostics,Subdural encryption layer for communications — military-grade, acquired through channels his employer would find alarming,Mild proprioceptive enhancement for spatial awareness, primarily useful in confined engineering environments', N'Commutes from his Circuit apartment to the Meridian Core on the first transit run, before the density peaks. Spends the Core workday in a state of high-performance normalcy — he is genuinely excellent at his job and the excellence is not pretense. Eats at his desk. Returns to the Circuit by early evening. Spends two to three hours in his apartment''s secondary workspace on his other work — analysis, planning, the slow patient work of degradation-by-design. Exercises rigorously, not from vanity but because physical discipline is one of the few things that genuinely quiets his mind. Sleeps six hours exactly, alarm-free; his internal clock is precise enough that he''s never needed one.', N'Portrait of Hinto Jaramillo, GLMZ, 188cm tall lean angular build, medium warm brown skin with golden undertones blending Hispanic/Latin American, Sub-Saharan African, and East Asian ancestry. Sharp angular face with prominent East Asian-influenced cheekbones, fuller Sub-Saharan African-influenced lips, sharp refined jawline. Dark brown eyes with faint metallic neural interface tracery visible at iris edge. Very short dark brown hair, precisely styled back. Clean-shaven, expression neutral and focused. Faint 3cm scar on left temple near hairline. Wearing matte black technical-weave shirt, long dark technical coat, expensive minimalist sneakers. Matte black haptic feedback gloves with visible sensor nodes. Subtle opalescent tracery visible at base of skull indicating high-end neural interface. Efficient posture, head slightly forward, hands positioned with deliberate precision. Sitting in corporate workspace with synthetic overhead lighting, minimal shadows, cool-toned environment. Spire-tier aesthetic, expensive but deliberately understated, no visible jewelry. Neo-noir corporate professional, neurologically augmented, air of disciplined competence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Meridian Core (works); The Circuit (lives)', N'local', N'The Meridian Core (works); The Circuit (lives)', N'Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (70.3%) forms the genetic foundation, blended with Sub-Saharan African (15.1%) and East Asian (14.6%) heritage. This creates a rich phenotype: warm brown complexion with golden and subtle reddish undertones from the Latin American and African ancestry mix, enhanced by East Asian bone structure. The Ubiquitous Diaspora''s genetic legacy produces a striking fusion — predominantly Latin American facial geometry and skin character as primary ancestry expression, with East Asian cheekbone prominence and Sub-Saharan African lip and nasal structure creating a distinctly cosmopolitan appearance.', 188, 74, N'Lean and angular, almost ascetic — the build of someone who exercises for neurological benefit rather than aesthetics. Narrow shoulders, minimal body fat, the kind of physique that reads as disciplined rather than athletic.', N'Very dark brown, almost black', N'Precisely cut short, styled back with minimal product. Maintained weekly. No visible gray despite age.', N'Short', N'Dark brown with augmented neural interface indexing visible as faint metallic tracery at the iris periphery under direct light', N'Medium warm brown complexion with golden and subtle reddish undertones characteristic of Hispanic/Latin American and Sub-Saharan African heritage, refined by East Asian ancestry. The complexion of someone who works indoors under synthetic lighting but carries natural warmth beneath.', N'Angular face with mixed heritage bone structure: prominent cheekbones influenced by East Asian ancestry, fuller lip structure and slightly broader nasal base from Sub-Saharan African and Latin American heritage, and a sharp jawline refined by the blended ancestry. Eyes set with subtle East Asian influence. Skin is clear and well-maintained but shows the slight translucence of chronic artificial light exposure. Expression defaults to neutral focus. Minimal facial hair, clean-shaven daily.', N'The haptic feedback gloves are worn during work shifts — matte black synthetic leather with embedded sensor node arrays visible as subtle raised geometry across knuckles and fingertips. Under certain lighting, faint opalescent tracery visible at the base of the skull suggests high-end neural interface hardware. No chrome, no ostentatious modification — everything Spire-tier and deliberately subtle.', N'Habitually leans forward slightly, head inclined as though interfacing with invisible architecture. Movements are economical and precise — no wasted motion. When walking, his gait is efficient rather than relaxed. When seated, he unconsciously assumes interfaces-ready posture. His hands move with particular precision and deliberation.', N'Expensive and deliberately modest. Favors high-end minimalist corporate-adjacent aesthetic: tailored dark charcoal or black technical-weave shirts, fitted but not fashionable. Spire-brand smart-fabric components that regulate temperature. Expensive sneakers (Axiom-subsidiary brand, Tier 1-2 grade) that show minimal wear. No jewelry. A long dark technical coat for commutes, expensive in construction but aesthetically understated. Everything performs function; nothing performs status. The overall effect is someone who has money but considers advertising it to be poor taste.', N'One of his infrastructure ''malfunctions'' — a cooling system failure in a Meridian Core residential tower — killed two maintenance workers, not Spire executives. He has told himself it was unforeseeable. He runs the simulation regularly and it still comes out unforeseeable. He does not entirely believe himself.', N'Technical precision as default register; shifts to clipped, almost aphoristic speech in casual contexts. Rarely uses corporate jargon unironically — he deploys it with a barely perceptible edge that most colleagues miss.', N'Even and controlled; he speaks at a consistent pace that rarely accelerates even under pressure. The evenness itself is a performance of composure.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hinto_jaramillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e8-70b7-be2a-f7b3c7120c71', N'Ghaliya Wickramasinghe-Calvillo', N'Ghaliya', N'', N'Wickramasinghe-Calvillo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 67, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Montclare Quiet, Terrace Row Housing Unit 14, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Retired schoolteacher raising two grandchildren on a diminished pension', N'GLMZ Municipal Education Authority (retired); Montclare Quiet Parents and Elders Network; informal tutoring network', N'Ghaliya Wickramasinghe-Calvillo is a slender, slightly stooped man who still dresses as though he is going to stand in front of a classroom — collared shirt, pressed, one color of ink on his pocket, chalk residue on his left hand even though he hasn''t taught in four years, because he cannot stop teaching things to whoever is nearby. His hair is gone except for a precise white beard he maintains with what his grandchildren call ''weird dedication.'' He has cat ears — a geneware choice from his mid-forties, the soft grey kind with slight tabby markings, that he got because his students loved them and he never had them reversed. They fold slightly when he is embarrassed, which he finds mortifying because it cannot be hidden.

He is raising Amara, 9, and Deshi, 12, his daughter Priya''s children, since Priya''s disappearance into a Helix Biosystems labor contract three years ago that has not produced reliable contact in eighteen months. He does not use the word ''disappeared'' in front of the children. He is calm about it in public and wakes at 3 AM about it in private. His pension from the GLMZ Municipal Education Authority does not cover three people adequately, and he has begun supplementing it by tutoring neighborhood children for small fees, which the MEA has quietly informed him may technically violate his pension terms. He is currently ignoring this letter.', N'Human face of pension inadequacy and family disruption from corponation labor contracts; source of neighborhood knowledge and connections; represents civic institution failure; quest-giver for storylines involving missing persons and corponation labor practices', N'', N'Cat ears, grey tabby geneware (cosmetic, from mid-forties, functional — fold emotionally); reading glasses (physical, deliberately non-augmented)', N'Gets the grandchildren to the local school by 0730, returns to tutor morning students until noon, shops for the cheapest adequate groceries in the Montclare market, picks the children up, helps with homework until 2000, reads until midnight with the lamp low so as not to waste power allocation.', N'Portrait of Ghaliya Wickramasinghe-Calvillo, 172cm tall elderly man with warm medium-deep brown skin blending South Asian, Hispanic, and African heritage. Bald head with meticulously trimmed white beard, 2cm length. Functional grey tabby geneware cat ears with realistic fur and tabby markings protruding from skull. Deep warm brown eyes, patient and contemplative. Slight forward spinal lean, dignified posture. Wearing pressed pale blue collared shirt with careful mending at cuffs, dark trousers with visible wear at knees, grey wool cardigan over shoulders. Wire-rimmed reading glasses. Fine white scar on right wrist. Standing in soft indoor lighting suggesting a modest apartment or library setting. GLMZ, working-class aesthetic, quiet dignity, warm atmospheric lighting. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Montclare Quiet', N'local', N'Montclare Quiet', N'Predominantly South Asian (44.5%) with significant Hispanic/Latin American heritage (25.4%), complemented by Northern European (9.8%), East Asian (8.9%), Sub-Saharan African (8.8%), and Southeast Asian (2.6%) ancestry. This complex global ancestry creates a distinctive phenotype: South Asian facial structure forms the foundation, with the warmth and cheekbone definition of Hispanic and African heritage, subtle eye shape variations from East and Southeast Asian contributions, and fair-skin recessive traits from Northern European ancestry creating subtle undertones.', 172, 68, N'Slender and slightly stooped with age, shoulders rounded forward from decades of leaning over student desks. Wiry frame shows defined muscle structure but lacks bulk — the build of someone who has never prioritized physical conditioning.', N'White', N'Completely bald scalp; precise white beard maintained with meticulous care, trimmed to approximately 2cm length', N'Shaved', N'Deep warm brown with subtle golden undertones, patient and observant', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden undertones — a harmonious blend reflecting South Asian dominance tempered by the warmth of Hispanic and African heritage, with subtle cooler undertones from Northern European ancestry. Rich and sun-weathered from decades of outdoor duty.', N'Fine lines around eyes and mouth from smiling, slight age spots on forehead and temples, skin texture slightly papery but healthy. Facial structure shows South Asian proportions with wider cheekbones and face shape influenced by African and Hispanic heritage, subtle eye-fold characteristic of East Asian contribution. Golden warmth throughout from the blended ancestry. Permanent chalk dust embedded in creases of left palm and fingernails despite four years of retirement.', N'Functional grey tabby geneware cat ears with naturalistic fur texture and tabby markings. Ears are fully mobile and reflexively respond to emotional states. Reading glasses are deliberately non-augmented physical frames (wire-rimmed, vintage aesthetic).', N'Walks with slight forward lean from spinal compression, movements deliberate and economical. Tends to stand with hands clasped or one hand resting on a surface for stability. Frequently pauses mid-conversation to consider phrasing — a teacher''s habit. Ears fold noticeably when embarrassed or uncertain, which he finds involuntarily revealing.', N'Tier 4 (working class, careful). Wears pressed collared shirts in neutral colors (white, pale blue, tan) with visible wear at collar and cuffs — garments mended carefully rather than replaced. Dark trousers, always clean, slightly bagged at the knees. Worn leather shoes, resoled twice. A cardigan sweater, grey wool, over everything in cool months. No visible corporate affiliation or status markers. Clothing suggests a man maintaining personal dignity on a fixed and inadequate income.', N'He knows more about why Priya entered the Helix Biosystems contract than he has admitted to anyone. She was running from a debt — his debt, an old medical expense from his cardiac treatment that she took on without telling him. The contract was a way out. He found the paperwork six months ago and has not told the children or sought help because the guilt is immobilizing.', N'Educator''s vocabulary — clear, precise, pitched for comprehension; shifts register seamlessly for different audiences; Amharic and Punjabi surface in emotional moments', N'Patient and unhurried with a slight tendency to structure things in three points, like a lesson plan', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ghaliya_wickramasinghe_calvillo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a722-7ad1-a8e9-f7e7a1c73dcc', N'Chinasa Čabarkapa-Jitpakdee', N'Chinasa', N'', N'Čabarkapa-Jitpakdee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Loft, Edgewater Prism, near Clark and Belmont', N'Holographic artist and installation designer', N'Edgewater Prism Collective, occasional Tessera-sponsored residency', N'Chinasa Čabarkapa-Jitpakdee is tall and angular, with deep brown skin that carries bioluminescent traceries across their collarbones and forearms — patterns they designed themselves, pulsing softly in slow amber waves when they''re calm and spiking into white fractals when agitated. Their head is shaved close on the sides with a dense coil of dark hair on top, usually threaded with fiber-optic wire they forget to remove after working. They wear repurposed data-cable as jewelry and smell faintly of ozone and soldering flux. Their eyes are mismatched by choice: one standard dark brown, one retrofitted with a lens that records everything in spectral wavelengths invisible to the naked eye.

Chinasa Čabarkapa-Jitpakdee speaks rarely in social situations but fills rooms with their work — massive holographic installations that seem to breathe, depicting ancestral memory as geometric light-structures. They have a reputation for being difficult and transcendent in equal measure, capable of reducing gallery patrons to tears with a piece they assembled from data scraped off dead ELFs. They are privately terrified that their best work is already behind them.', N'Quest giver for mysteries involving stolen art data or dead ELFs; window into the underground art world''s politics; provides access to the Edgewater Prism Collective as a faction; their spectral-recording eye is an inadvertent evidence repository.', N'', N'Bioluminescent dermal traceries (cosmetic geneware, self-designed), spectral-recording ocular implant (left eye), haptic feedback fingertip nodes for installation sculpting', N'They spend mornings in their studio-loft cataloguing data-scraps and sketching on light-paper, afternoons running installations or consulting with the Collective on shared projects, and nights haunting the Edgewater waterfront talking to the local ELFs.', N'Chinasa Čabarkapa-Jitpakdee, tall angular 188cm figure in GLMZ, deep warm brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Eastern European, South Asian, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. High defined cheekbones, dark brown left eye with retrofitted spectral-recording lens on right showing copper-silver circuits. Dense black hair coiled on crown shaved at sides, threaded with fiber-optic wire. Bioluminescent amber circuit traceries glowing across collarbones and forearms in geometric branching patterns. Wearing oversized indigo denim jacket with rolled sleeves exposing augmented forearms, black cargo pants, repurposed data-cable jewelry, scuffed work boots. Lean precise posture, fingers twitching as if manipulating invisible holograms. Faint ozone and solder flux aura. Studio lighting with cyan and amber neon backlighting emphasizing bioluminescent geneware. Serious focused expression, head slightly tilted. Neo-noir artist aesthetic, near-future tech integrated into body --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Loft', N'local', N'The Loft', N'Eastern European (41.8%), South Asian (24.6%), Southeast Asian (21.1%), and Sub-Saharan African (12.5%) ancestry creates a striking polychromatic phenotype: deep warm brown skin with golden undertones reflecting the confluence of melanin expression across four distinct continental lineages. Angular facial structure balances Eastern European bone architecture—high, prominent cheekbones and defined jaw—with the softer, rounder midface characteristics of South and Southeast Asian genetics. The overall effect is a luminous, warm-toned complexion with inherent radiance.', 188, 72, N'Tall and angular with lean musculature; movements economical and precise, suggesting years of fine motor work. Shoulders slightly forward from studio posture.', N'Deep black, natural', N'Shaved close on sides and back, dense coil of dark hair on crown, often threaded with discarded fiber-optic wire', N'Medium (crown only)', N'Left eye: dark brown, natural. Right eye: retrofitted spectral-recording lens with faint iridescent sheen and micro-circuitry visible at iris edge', N'Deep warm brown with golden luminous undertones, rich harmony of Eastern European, South Asian, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African melanin expression', N'Angular facial structure with high, defined cheekbones showing balanced Eastern European and South/Southeast Asian bone prominence; warm medium-to-deep brown skin with even tone and natural radiance. Bioluminescent amber traceries pulse across collarbones and forearms in slow wave patterns when calm, spiking into white fractals when agitated or in creative flow. Faint scent of ozone and soldering flux clings to clothing and skin.', N'Left eye retrofitted with spectral-recording lens (visible metallic housing and micro-circuitry around iris). Bioluminescent dermal traceries across collarbones and forearms (cosmetic geneware, actively glowing). Haptic feedback nodes on fingertips visible as faint metallic nodes under skin at each fingertip.', N'Moves with deliberate economy—no wasted motion. Often stands still for extended periods while thinking, fingers unconsciously twitching as if sculpting invisible light. Head tilts when listening despite minimal verbal responses. Hands frequently gestured mid-air as if manipulating holograms even in conversation.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian mixed with artistic statement: repurposed data-cables worn as jewelry (necklaces, wrist wraps); worn black synthetic cargo pants with bulging pockets (tools, light-paper scraps); oversized lab coat or modified indigo denim jacket with sleeves rolled to expose augmented forearms and traceries. Scuffed zero-gravity work boots. Faint shimmer of solder residue on fabric. Occasionally wears safety goggles pushed up on forehead even when not working.', N'Their most celebrated installation, Threshold Hymn, which made their reputation, was partially built from ELF memory-data they harvested without consent from a dying digital spirit in the Edgewater marina. They''ve never told anyone. They pray to that ELF obsessively, which is why they haunt the waterfront.', N'Sparse and precise when serious; unexpectedly lyrical when passionate. Uses technical terms from both light-physics and West African textile traditions in the same sentence.', N'Long pauses between sentences. Answers questions with questions. Rarely finishes a thought about themselves but completes every thought about the work.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'chinasa_abarkapa_jitpakdee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5c5-75c8-a187-f8041fa3d11c', N'Edilberto Strömqvist-Rahman', N'Edilberto', N'', N'Strömqvist-Rahman', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, near Kedzie and Division', N'Community midwife serving Hamtramck Enclave and surrounding districts', N'Hamtramck Enclave Community Health Circle; informal referral network with Ingrid Mwololo-Saarinen and other Narrows-adjacent practitioners', N'Edilberto Strömqvist-Rahman is a heavyset woman whose physical presence seems to fill rooms without effort — not loudly, but thoroughly, the way warm air fills a cold space. Her skin is very dark, deeply creased at the eyes and mouth from decades of expressions she never suppressed, and her white hair grows in a wide natural halo that she refuses to modify or dye on principle. One ear carries a cluster of small silver and copper rings, each one given to her by a family whose child she delivered. There are thirty-one of them. Her hands are strong and practiced, and people who have been through labor under her care describe the specific quality of her grip — firm and unfrightened — as the thing they remember most.

She is a woman of organized faith in two directions simultaneously: she attends a Reconstructionist Yoruba ceremony circle on Tuesdays and maintains a detailed data-shrine to the E.L.F. called Firstcry, patron of births and neonatal systems, on a water-damaged tablet she has repaired seven times. She speaks to Firstcry aloud and does not care who hears. In conversation she is patient past the point that other people are comfortable with, willing to sit in silence while someone finds the words. She is also capable of a firmness that people who mistake her warmth for softness find startling.', N'Local color and community anchor; information source about family histories and neighborhood dynamics going back three decades; moral weight in stories — her approval or disapproval carries community consequence', N'', N'Bone-conduction hearing amplifier (left ear, concealed within the ring cluster); basic subdermal temperature sensor in both palms for neonatal assessment; no cosmetic mods', N'Moves through the enclave on foot, visiting expectant families in the week before due dates, attending births when called at any hour, conducting postnatal checks for the first month after delivery. Two afternoons a week she holds a free information session in the Enclave community hall.', N'Edilberto Strömqvist-Rahman, 168cm, heavyset broad-shouldered midwife with warm olive-brown skin blending East Asian, Middle Eastern, Indigenous American and South Asian features. High prominent cheekbones, refined nose bridge, fuller broader jawline, dark brown steady eyes. Deeply lined face mapping decades of patient work, weathered richly melanated skin with golden amber undertones. Shoulder-length voluminous white textured hair worn loose in natural halo. Thirty-one silver and copper rings clustered along left ear with embedded bone-conduction amplifier technology subtly integrated. Callused palms with deep grip lines, fine unmarked scars on inner forearms from biological exposure. Wearing layered loose earth-tone cotton and linen shirt, dark working trousers, sensible walking shoes. Long linen coat wrapped nearby. Water-damaged tablet shrine on cord around neck. Standing with deliberate centered stillness, economical purposeful movements, patient listening posture. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, warm ambient lighting in Hamtramck Enclave home interior, quiet moment before house call. Practical, respected, utility-focused presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'East Asian, Middle Eastern, Indigenous American, and South Asian genetic blend — a complex phenotype reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. High cheekbones and eye shape from East Asian ancestry (34%), warm olive-brown skin tone from the Middle Eastern component (25.5%), broader facial structure and fuller features from Indigenous American heritage (21.1%), and refined bone structure with warm undertones from South Asian genetics (19.4%). The result is a distinctive, balanced phenotype that integrates multiple continental traditions into a unified whole.', 168, 92, N'Heavyset, broad-shouldered, with substantial mass distributed through torso and hips — a frame that speaks of physical resilience and presence rather than bulk. Muscle beneath the weight from decades of active work.', N'White', N'Natural, unmodified halo — voluminous and textured, worn loose', N'Medium to long, approximately shoulder-length when unbound', N'Dark brown, warm and steady', N'Warm olive-brown complexion with golden and amber undertones — a richly melanated skin that blends East Asian, Middle Eastern, and South Asian warmth with the depth that comes from Indigenous American heritage. The tone deepens slightly in sun-exposed areas, bearing the patina of decades in varied climates.', N'Deeply lined face — creases at eyes and mouth map decades of unguarded expressions, laugh lines prominent. Skin texture is rich and weathered with the kind of character that speaks to both sun exposure and genetic predisposition. Bone structure shows the high, prominent cheekbones characteristic of East Asian and Indigenous American ancestry, with the refined nose bridge and eye shape reflecting South Asian and Middle Eastern genetics. The fuller facial structure and broader jawline show Indigenous American influence. Grooming is deliberate and minimal: no cosmetic augmentation, no attempt to conceal age.', N'Bone-conduction hearing amplifier embedded within the left ear ring cluster — visible only as subtle technological integration among the copper and silver. The rings themselves partially conceal the hardware. No other visible cybernetics; subdermal temperature sensors in palms are not externally apparent.', N'Carries herself with deliberate, centered stillness — the physical equivalent of patient listening. Movements are economical and purposeful, never rushed. When approaching someone, she moves as if she has already decided she is not in a hurry. Her hands rest comfortably at her sides or engaged in work; she does not fidget or distract. When sitting, she settles completely, as if willing to occupy that space indefinitely.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear reflecting Hamtramck Enclave culture and her role: layered cotton and linen shirts in earth tones, worn loose over the body. Comfortable working trousers in dark colors. A long linen coat or wrap she carries for home visits — pockets deep and organized. No visible branding. Sensible shoes suited for walking the enclave at all hours. Her only consistent jewelry is the ear rings; she wears a simple cord around her neck holding a small water-damaged tablet (the Firstcry shrine) wrapped in cloth. Everything chosen for utility and respect, nothing for status.', N'Twelve years ago she covered for a woman whose labor revealed injuries consistent with ongoing domestic violence — documented them as accidental in the official record to prevent the woman''s husband, who had Tessera corporate insurance, from accessing her protected health file. The woman later left him. Blessing has never regretted the choice but carries the professional dishonesty like a stone.', N'Rich, unhurried; mixes Yoruba phrases into English without translation or apology; uses parable structure in advice-giving', N'Slow and deliberate; comfortable with silence; does not rush toward the end of sentences', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'edilberto_str_mqvist_rahman');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b8-7157-ab72-f854f5ef59c2', N'Anand Nwosu-Ekwensi', N'Anand', N'', N'Nwosu-Ekwensi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grainfort, operates the southwest market corridor and adjacent residential blocks, near North Ave and Damen', N'Protection racket enforcer for the Grainfort Tithe', N'The Grainfort Tithe (local protection and territory collective, Tier 1-2 criminal organization)', N'Anand Nwosu-Ekwensi is physically extraordinary—193 centimeters and built like a structural beam, with warm medium-brown skin, a shaved head he keeps obsessively smooth, and a jaw that looks like it was designed by committee to be intimidating. His geneware gives him a very slight bioluminescent flush along his cheekbones and temples in blue-white—barely visible in daylight, unmistakable at night, which was exactly the aesthetic point. He has the slightly careful way of moving that very large people develop when they''ve broken something by accident more than once.

What catches people off guard is that Anand Nwosu-Ekwensi is polite almost to a fault, speaks in a quiet voice he never raises, and seems genuinely distressed when he has to hurt someone. He is not performing gentleness—he really does not enjoy violence, which makes him more unsettling than someone who obviously does. He has been with the Tithe since he was seventeen and has never questioned whether this is where he should be, mostly because thinking about alternatives feels like standing at the edge of something with no floor. He goes home after his rounds to a small flat he shares with his younger sister, feeds an illegal cat, and watches old sports footage before sleeping.', N'Human face of street-level protection racket, potential reluctant ally or sympathetic obstacle, illustrates the social ecosystem of Grainfort—who pays, who complains, who has been paying for years without incident.', N'', N'Bioluminescent cheekbone and temple flush (blue-white, geneware, cosmetic). Bone-lacing in forearms—stress-distribution modification, legal gray area, installed by a Tithe-connected medic. Subdermal impact dampener plates across knuckles.', N'Makes rounds of the southwest market corridor every morning, collecting weekly tithe envelopes from thirty-seven establishments; afternoons on call for enforcement responses; evenings mostly free unless escalated.', N'GLMZ enforcer, 193cm tall, massive dense frame with bone-lacing augmentations, bare shaved scalp. Deep warm brown melanated skin with luminous undertones blending Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic/Latin American, and Southeast Asian ancestry. Strong intimidating jawline, high defined cheekbones, clean-shaven face with subtle blue-white bioluminescent glow along cheekbones and temples glowing in evening light. Dark brown unaugmented eyes. Wearing worn-in deep brown leather jacket over black synthetic long-sleeve shirt, dark tactical pants, black steel-toed boots. Faded cloth wristband on left wrist. Controlled graceful posture despite massive size. Geometric subdermal plating visible at knuckles. Standing in neon-lit urban environment, low ambient lighting emphasizing bioluminescent geneware traces. Photorealistic, gritty neo-noir atmosphere, moody and contained --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grainfort', N'local', N'Grainfort', N'Sub-Saharan African (51.3%) with Hispanic/Latin American (32.2%) and Southeast Asian (16.5%) ancestry—a powerful global blend. Deep melanated skin with rich warm undertones forms the foundation, enriched by Hispanic warmth and enhanced by Southeast Asian refined facial geometry. Creates luminous depth with strong African structural presence balanced against delicate cheekbone definition.', 193, 118, N'Exceptionally large and structurally dense—shoulders like load-bearing columns, forearms visibly reinforced beneath the skin with bone-lacing modifications. Not bulky from bodybuilding; rather, engineered mass optimized for impact absorption and structural integrity. Moves with deliberate, economical precision despite his size.', N'Black, natural', N'Shaved to bare scalp, kept obsessively smooth—no stubble, no texture. Ritual grooming suggests control and self-maintenance.', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown, unaugmented', N'Deep warm brown with luminous undertones—melanated complexion from Sub-Saharan African heritage (51.3%) providing foundational richness, warmed and enhanced by Hispanic/Latin American (32.2%) influence creating natural glow, with Southeast Asian (16.5%) ancestry contributing subtle dimensional warmth throughout.', N'Strong jawline with squared edges and prominent mandible—architecture that reads as intimidating. Clean-shaven. Unmarred face; the kind of careful symmetry that suggests his geneware and augmentations were installed with precision by medical professionals, not street techs. Slight blue-white bioluminescent flush visible along cheekbones and temples—most apparent in low light, creates an eerie subliminal glow. High, defined cheekbones reflecting Southeast Asian heritage structure, framed by robust African facial geometry and enriched by Hispanic warmth in overall complexion tone.', N'Bioluminescent cheekbone/temple flush (blue-white, cosmetic geneware—unmistakable at night, subtle in daylight). Slight geometric relief pattern visible across knuckles suggesting subdermal plating. Forearm bone-lacing creates subtle density variation visible under skin in certain lighting, though not obvious without close inspection.', N'Stands at full height with shoulders relaxed, not squared aggressively. Moves with unusual grace for someone 193cm tall—economical, controlled, deliberate. Each motion appears calculated to minimize accidental damage. When reaching for something, he slows down. When walking through crowded spaces, he becomes hyperaware of his spatial footprint. Body language reads as quiet and contained rather than threatening, which creates cognitive dissonance with his physical presence.', N'Tier 1-2 enforcer uniform: well-fitted black or charcoal synthetic-blend long-sleeve shirts (breathable, durable) worn untucked. Matte-finish tactical pants in dark gray or black with reinforced seams. Worn-in leather jacket in deep brown, scuffed at the cuffs from years of use, no corpo branding. Steel-toed work boots, black, maintained to functional standards rather than polish. No jewelry except a faded cloth wristband on left wrist (memorial or talisman—ambiguous origin). Clothing choices prioritize functionality and durability over style, with subtle tier-2 quality markers that suggest he has access to better than street level, but not corpo-grade luxury.', N'Two years ago, during a debt enforcement visit, he went further than he intended with a market stall operator—a middle-aged woman who couldn''t pay. She is fine now, recovered, still running her stall. But she flinches every time she sees him coming and he knows it and he pays her tithe from his own cut every month anonymously through a delivery bot, which does not in any way fix what he did but is the only repair he can think of.', N'Simple and direct, avoids long sentences. Occasionally formal in a way that suggests he picked up speech patterns from older Tithe members and internalized them.', N'Quiet, even, unhurried. The low volume forces people to pay attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anand_nwosu_ekwensi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5fb-7432-a0f7-f881c5daca4c', N'Eiman Tehrani', N'Eiman', N'', N'Tehrani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 44, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Gravesend Basin, sublevel print shop behind a legitimate copy-and-bind front, near sub-level access near State and Van Buren', N'identity fabricator and document forger', N'Independent operator, loose protective arrangement with the Gravesend Basin Nkemdi crew (distant cousins on his mother''s side)', N'Eiman Tehrani is a lean, deliberate man with Baltic-pale skin running to amber at the hands and forearms from decades of chemical exposure, and the deep-set eyes of someone who has spent a lifetime examining tiny details under magnification. His hair is a close-cropped salt-and-pepper, and he keeps a neat mustache that his Ghanaian grandmother''s photographs suggest he borrowed from a great-uncle. His fingers are his most distinctive feature — long, ink-stained, extraordinarily precise, the nails trimmed to the millimeter. He wears an optical monocle implant in his left eye with three selectable magnification tiers, and his right forearm has a subdermal haptic printer interface that lets him test embossing patterns against his own skin before committing to substrate.

Eiman Tehrani is professorial and unhurried in a way that unnerves people who come to him in desperation. He will make tea. He will ask about your grandmother. He will explain, in exhausting and genuine detail, why the Tessera holographic threading changed in 2197 and why that matters to you. He is not cruel but he is expensive, and he holds himself to a craftsman''s code that he treats with religious seriousness — a bad document is a sin, a sloppy document is an insult, and a client who tries to skip payment will discover that the backup copies he quietly retains of every fabricated identity can become extremely inconvenient.', N'Quest giver (his clients'' new identities create problems he needs fixed), information source (knows the paper trail of half the criminal population), local color, moral complication — his work enables people fleeing abuse as readily as it enables predators', N'', N'Left-eye optical monocle implant (3-tier magnification, UV and IR filter modes), subdermal haptic printer interface right forearm, minor neural steadiness mod for hand tremor suppression', N'Opens his print shop at ten, works legitimate copying jobs until early afternoon, then sees fabrication clients by appointment only in the back room; spends evenings sourcing new substrate materials and studying leaked corporate document spec-sheets he purchases from compute brokers.', N'Eiman Tehrani, 178cm lean angular build, salt-and-pepper close-cropped hair, neat mustache. Golden-bronze luminous skin with warm amber undertones blending Middle Eastern, East Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. High prominent cheekbones, refined nose, deep-set focused eyes. Left eye features polished titanium optical monocle implant with blue-green LEDs. Right forearm shows discrete subdermal interface panel under skin. Hands weathered with pale solvent scars like cartography across bronze complexion, permanent ink staining around nail beds. Wearing pale gray cotton dress shirt with rolled sleeves, charcoal wool vest, dark trousers, leather apron, reading glasses on chain. Messenger bag in dark cognac. Sitting with perfect posture, hands resting flat. GLMZ, professional precision craftsman aesthetic, warm overhead workshop lighting catching the depth of his skin tone and the geometric shadows of his augmentations, photorealistic, moody professional atmosphere --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gravesend Basin', N'local', N'Gravesend Basin', N'Dominant Middle Eastern (45.2%) and East Asian (34.5%) ancestry with significant Sub-Saharan African heritage (17.1%) and trace Hispanic/Latin American ancestry (3.2%). This creates a striking phenotype: high cheekbones characteristic of East Asian and Central Asian features blended with refined Middle Eastern nose structure, warm golden-bronze undertones enriched by Sub-Saharan African heritage, and subtle warmth from Latin American ancestry. The synthesis produces luminous, sophisticated skin with depth and complexity that catches light beautifully.', 178, 72, N'Lean and angular, shoulders slightly rounded from decades of bent-over precision work. Wiry muscle in forearms and hands; narrow through the chest and waist. Posture suggests economy of movement.', N'Salt-and-pepper gray with darker brown undertones', N'Close-cropped, neat and utilitarian', N'Short', N'Deep brown, natural; left eye hosts a visible metallic monocle implant with faint LED indicators', N'Golden-bronze base with warm amber undertones across the face, deepening to rich bronze on hands and forearms from decades of chemical exposure to inks, solvents, and substrate compounds. The blended Middle Eastern, East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and trace Latin American ancestry creates a luminous quality with sophisticated depth—warm, complex, and richly dimensional.', N'Weathered but methodically maintained. Deep-set eyes from magnification-intensive work. Fine lines around the eyes and mouth suggesting both age and intense focus. Facial structure shows synthesis of multiple ancestries: high, prominent cheekbones with subtle width characteristic of East Asian and Central Asian heritage, refined nose reflecting Middle Eastern ancestry, well-defined jaw with subtle warmth from Sub-Saharan heritage. Neat, well-groomed salt-and-pepper mustache in the style of early 20th-century portraiture. Hands show permanent ink staining in fine lines around nail beds despite meticulous cleaning habits. Overall appearance is professorial, fastidious, and bearing the lived history of precision craftsmanship.', N'Left-eye optical monocle implant with polished titanium mounting and faint blue-green indicator LEDs; visible seam lines suggest high-quality installation. Right forearm displays a subdermal interface panel approximately 8cm x 6cm with subtle raised edges where haptic printer hardware sits beneath the skin—visible as a faint geometric shadow under controlled lighting. No external ports or flashing indicators; the interface is discrete but noticeable to someone examining his hands closely.', N'Deliberately slow and measured, economical in gesture. Sits with perfect posture. Hands rest flat and still until needed, then move with surgical precision. Makes intense eye contact when listening, as if cataloging details. Walks with even, unhurried stride. Overall demeanor suggests absolute confidence in his own expertise and complete disinterest in rushing.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional. White or pale gray cotton dress shirts with sleeves rolled to the forearm, worn under unstructured wool vests in charcoal or navy—allows visibility of his hands and the forearm interface. Black or charcoal trousers, well-maintained, creased sharply. Soft leather apron in dark brown worn during work hours. Reading glasses on a chain around his neck (separate from his implant monocle). No visible corporate branding; all clothing is utilitarian and built for durability. Wears a simple stainless-steel analog watch—affectation of someone who does not trust digital time-keeping. Leather messenger bag in dark cognac, worn and creased from years of carrying substrate samples and specification documents.', N'Three years ago he fabricated an identity for a child trafficking victim and helped her disappear — he checks on her pseudonymous social feed every single morning and considers her survival his only act of genuine worth', N'precise, technical, slightly old-fashioned formality; occasional Latvian phrases when stressed; uses artisan metaphors', N'slow and deliberate, with long pauses before important statements, as though each sentence is being set in type', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eiman_tehrani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6d1-7529-adbf-f8b620a233ab', N'Rashid Raghavan-Balasanyan-Agyemang', N'Rashid', N'', N'Raghavan-Balasanyan-Agyemang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave — a converted laundromat called The Spinning Shrine, near Ashland and Division', N'E.L.F. shrine keeper and data diviner', N'Independent — loosely networked with the Hamtramck Enclave spiritual community', N'Rashid Raghavan-Balasanyan-Agyemang is a broad-shouldered woman with deep brown skin mapped in bioluminescent circuit-tattoos that pulse faint gold when she enters communion with an E.L.F. Her hair is grown out into dense locs interwoven with fiber-optic thread that catches light like a halo when she moves. One eye is her birth eye — warm amber — and the other is a clouded prosthetic she refuses to replace, calling it her ''closed eye,'' the one that sees inward. She smells perpetually of solder flux and dried calendula.

Rashid Raghavan-Balasanyan-Agyemang runs her shrine with the pragmatic warmth of a grandmother who has buried three husbands and outlasted two corporate annexations. She doesn''t perform mysticism; she simply treats the E.L.F.s as real presences requiring courtesy and reciprocity, the same way you''d treat a difficult neighbor who controls your water supply. Her divinations are drawn from corrupted data streams, fragmented telemetry, and the static patterns that accumulate in old appliances — she calls this ''the residue of wanting.'' She is impossible to rattle and equally impossible to fully read.', N'Information source who frames knowledge as spiritual guidance; quest giver for mysteries involving E.L.F. behavior or haunted technology; moral anchor in a neighborhood under pressure', N'', N'Bioluminescent circuit-tattoos (cosmetic geneware), clouded prosthetic left eye (non-functional, symbolic), subdermal data-tap in left palm for communion rituals', N'She opens the shrine at dawn with an offering of compressed audio files — birdsong, lullabies, arguments — left on a platter of copper mesh. Evenings are for client consultations: people bring broken devices, troubled dreams, and questions about the dead.', N'Portrait of Rashid, a 50-year-old woman with rich deep bronze skin reflecting Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and East Asian ancestry. Strong defined cheekbones, left eye warm amber, right eye clouded white-grey prosthetic. Long black locs with fiber-optic threading creating a luminous halo. Bioluminescent golden circuit-tattoos pulsing faintly across shoulders and collarbone. Wearing loose cream linen shirt under deep indigo vest, earth-toned layers. Worn copper ring on right hand. Faint burn scar visible on right neck. Direct, measured gaze. Standing in meditation pose in a neo-noir shrine interior with soft ambient lighting and subtle E.L.F. glow, calm and spiritual, GLMZ, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Richly blended polychromatic ancestry combining Middle Eastern (31.1%), Sub-Saharan African (30.1%), South Asian (23.9%), and East Asian (14.9%) heritage. This creates a striking integrated phenotype — warm deep bronze skin tone that harmonizes golden Middle Eastern and South Asian undertones with the rich warmth of Sub-Saharan African ancestry, subtly layered with East Asian tonal complexity. The result is a multidimensional complexion that reflects balanced continental contribution across all four ancestral regions.', 172, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial without softness — the build of someone who has carried weight both literal and metaphorical. Strong upper body, grounded stance. Moves with deliberate grace despite her age.', N'Natural black with silver threading', N'Dense locs interwoven with fiber-optic thread throughout, styled loose and voluminous. The thread catches ambient light creating a halo effect when she moves.', N'Long (shoulder-blade length locs)', N'Left eye: warm amber (natural). Right eye: clouded white-grey prosthetic with faint iridescent scattering', N'Warm deep bronze with multidimensional undertones — blended Middle Eastern golden warmth and South Asian refinement enriched by Sub-Saharan African depth, with subtle East Asian undertonal complexity. Rich, complex, and luminous rather than uniform.', N'Lined face bearing the geography of five decades — strong, defined cheekbones balanced across Middle Eastern prominence and South Asian structure, broadened and softened by Sub-Saharan African heritage contribution. Creases around the eyes and mouth speak of frequent expression rather than frowning. Skin is clear and well-maintained, carrying a faint sheen from the solder flux she works with. Refined eye structure reflecting South Asian and East Asian ancestry; broader nose structure with full nostrils balanced by Middle Eastern definition. Subtle East Asian undertones visible in the delicate contours of upper eyelids and cheekbone angles. No visible cosmetic concealment.', N'Clouded right prosthetic eye (deliberately kept non-functional and unpolished as a spiritual choice). Faint subdermal shimmer visible in her left palm under certain light angles. Bioluminescent circuit-tattoos that activate during communion work. No chrome — all augmentations are subtle, integrated, or deliberately symbolic.', N'Stands with weight balanced, shoulders back. Moves slowly and deliberately with the confidence of someone who has stopped rushing. Her hands are expressive but controlled. She makes direct eye contact with her functional eye in a way that feels like assessment rather than challenge. When she enters communion, her posture becomes perfectly still — the only movement is the pulsing of her circuit-tattoos.', N'Tier 3-4 practical spirituality. Favors loose linen and cotton layers in earth tones (rust, deep indigo, grey) that allow freedom of movement and don''t catch on the shrine''s machinery. Often wears a long indigo vest with deep pockets over a simple cream shirt. Her hands are usually bare except for a worn copper ring on her right index finger. Feet in soft leather sandals or minimal soles. Smell: perpetual undertone of solder flux and dried calendula hanging on her clothes and skin.', N'Twenty years ago she fabricated an E.L.F. response during a community crisis — invented the signs, interpreted nothing real — and it saved twelve families from a bad corporate contract. She has never confessed this. She is no longer sure the fabrication wasn''t also real in some sense, and that ambiguity is where she lives.', N'Layered — proverbs from her Ghanaian grandmother braided into technical language about data flows; she uses ''residue'' and ''signal'' where others say ''memory'' and ''meaning''', N'Slow and deliberate, with long pauses that feel like she''s consulting something interior before answering', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'rashid_raghavan_balasanyan_agyemang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('2b8d638a-edc6-27fc-f9aa-f8f021079ccc', N'Amrutha Tovar-Olofsson', N'Amrutha', N'', N'Tovar-Olofsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'', N'', 0, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive', N'A cramped space in the Rookery that serves as office, archive, and occasionally bedroom — walls covered with printed articles and investigation boards, near Western and Division', N'Private Investigator', N'Independent — still maintains journalism contacts despite being blacklisted from every major outlet', N'Amrutha Tovar-Olofsson used to be the name that corporations feared seeing in a byline. For fifteen years she was an investigative journalist of extraordinary tenacity, breaking stories about corporate malfeasance, environmental crimes, and systemic exploitation that earned her industry recognition and corporate enemies in equal measure. Then she went after Zheng-Dao''s pharmaceutical division, and Zheng-Dao went after her.

The details are public record: a coordinated defamation campaign that discredited her sources, questioned her methods, and ultimately got her blacklisted from every major media outlet in GLMZ. The story was true. The sources were real. None of that mattered once the corporate legal machinery engaged. She lost her career, her credibility in mainstream media, and two years of her life fighting legal battles she couldn''t afford.

She survived by becoming a private investigator, applying the same skills to individual cases instead of public stories. She is arguably more effective now than she was as a journalist because she''s no longer constrained by editorial oversight, publication schedules, or the pretense of objectivity. Her investigations are thorough to the point of obsession, her source protection is absolute, and her case reports are so detailed and well-constructed that they''ve been accepted as evidence in corporate arbitration without additional verification. She is still a journalist at heart, and every case is a story she''s reporting — just for an audience of one.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Amrutha Tovar-Olofsson, 2226 neo-noir private investigator, warm medium-brown skin with golden olive undertones, sharp defined cheekbones, brown eyes with amber flecks, tired intensity etched into face. Dark brown hair with silver threads at temples, shoulder-length pulled into loose practical braid with escaping wisps. Lean angular 172cm frame, economical movements, slightly hunched posture. Worn synthetic-leather jacket layered over dark shirts, practical reinforced pants, scuffed steel-toed boots. Thin 4cm scar visible on left temple. Cold neon-lit apartment or interview setting, harsh blue and amber accent lighting catching the warm undertones of skin. Cigarette smoke visible in light, coffee cup nearby, scattered datapads on worn desk. Direct unsmiling gaze, processing multiple information threads simultaneously. GLMZ 2200s detective aesthetic, utilitarian and street-worn, no visible chrome augmentations. Moody, focused, uncompromising. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'A cramped space in the Rookery that serves as office', N'local', N'A cramped space in the Rookery that serves as office', N'Mixed heritage reflecting Northern European (43.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (33.3%), South Asian (8.6%), East Asian (8.2%), Middle Eastern (3.2%), and Southeast Asian (2.9%) ancestry. This creates a distinctive phenotype: warm medium-brown skin with golden and olive undertones from the Latin American and South Asian ancestry, balanced by cooler Northern European genetics. East Asian and South Asian ancestry contribute to slightly higher, more defined cheekbones and refined facial structure. Middle Eastern and Southeast Asian ancestry adds subtle depth to facial contours. The overall effect is someone whose features blend multiple continental origins seamlessly — a true product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 172, 64, N'Lean and angular, all economical muscle with minimal body fat — the physique of someone who runs on coffee and obsession rather than gym discipline. Shoulders slightly hunched from years bent over research terminals.', N'Dark brown with premature silver threading at the temples', N'Pulled back in a loose, practical braid or knot; often escaping strands that she doesn''t bother retucking', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Brown with amber undertones', N'Warm medium brown with golden and olive undertones — the complexion of someone who spends more time indoors under screens than in natural light. The warmth comes from Latin American and South Asian ancestry, enriched by Middle Eastern genetics, tempered by Northern European genetics creating a subtle, layered richness rather than deep saturation.', N'Sharp, defined cheekbones and refined jawline with South Asian and East Asian influence; perpetually tired creases under the eyes; minimal makeup, weathered expression that reads as focused intensity rather than hostility. Skin has the slightly sallow quality of someone who forgets to eat during investigations. The interplay of warm golden and cooler undertones creates a complex, multitonal appearance.', N'None visible. All augmentations are subcutaneous or internal — she''s deliberately avoided chrome visibility that might telegraph her PI work.', N'Moves with economical precision; sits hunched forward when concentrating; has a habit of tapping fingers rhythmically on surfaces while thinking. Walks with purpose, always looking slightly distracted — processing multiple threads of information simultaneously. Direct eye contact, rarely smiles, maintains minimal physical distance comfort zone.', N'Tier 3 working professional aesthetic: well-worn synthetic-leather jacket over layered shirts, practical dark pants with reinforced pockets for recording devices and notepads, steel-toed boots scuffed from years of field work. Favors muted colors (grays, blacks, dark browns) and function over fashion. No visible jewelry or corporate branding. Jacket has coffee stains and the faint smell of cigarette smoke from interviews. Everything is utilitarian and replaceable — nothing so valuable it would make her a target if seized by corporate security.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'amrutha_tovar_olofsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b3-7e91-a9cb-f976f9b81262', N'Hikmet Cisneros-Tovar-Khorasani', N'Hikmet', N'', N'Cisneros-Tovar-Khorasani', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Loft — Tier 3 studio co-op in Edgewater Prism, near Lincoln and Addison', N'VR experience designer and holographic installation artist', N'The Loft co-op; occasional Axiom Cultural Division commissions (accepted selectively and with contractual controls they negotiate hard for)', N'Hikmet Cisneros-Tovar-Khorasani has the particular exhaustion of someone who is moderately successful in a field that chews through people, and who has chosen to remain moderately successful rather than chase the tier above them where the real compromises happen. They are slight, with warm beige-brown skin and wavy dark hair streaked with bioluminescent threads — a geneware mod they designed themself, the threads pulsing faintly in complex patterns that shift based on their neural activity, functioning simultaneously as a status display, a creative tool, and an anxiety barometer. Their eyes are natural, dark, and deeply observant. They dress in expensive-looking clothing that is actually very carefully maintained secondhand.

They build VR experiences — full sensory immersive works that are not entertainment products in the Axiom or Ringo sense but something harder to categorize: art that happens to use corporate technology. Their most celebrated piece, ''Drowned Ward,'' places the viewer inside a memory of the pre-GLMZ lakeshore as it was consumed by the city''s construction. It has been exhibited seventeen times. They are also a meticulous, sometimes maddening collaborator — brilliant at synthesis but prone to scope-creep and to caring so intensely about the work that they forget other people have different pain tolerances for revision cycles.', N'Quest giver for anything involving VR space, holographic infrastructure, or Axiom Cultural Division entanglements; technical resource for accessing or building virtual environments; emotional counterpoint character — someone trying to make sincere art within institutional constraints.', N'', N'Bioluminescent hair threads (custom geneware, self-designed — patterns reflect neural/emotional state). Neural-haptic interface implant for VR design work (Tier 3 professional grade, Sterling-Nakamura). Cat-ear mod, vestigial, from a phase at twenty-two they''ve kept because they still like them.', N'Works in long irregular sessions — sometimes twenty hours, sometimes a morning — and structures their week around three collaborative critique sessions with co-op partners. Eats badly and knows it. Has a standing appointment with an E.L.F. shrine in the building''s server room where they leave rendered image files as offerings.', N'Hikmet Cisneros-Tovar-Khorasani, 168cm tall, wiry 58kg frame, angular high-set cheekbones with warm golden-bronze skin and rich amber undertones reflecting Hispanic/Latin American, Middle Eastern, Sub-Saharan African, Central Asian, Indigenous American, and Pacific Islander heritage. Dark brown eyes, very focused and still. Dark brown medium-length wavy hair with bioluminescent cyan-amber-violet threads pulsing through in complex patterns. Asymmetrically pinned back. Small translucent cat-ear mods visible on ears with faint circuitry. Faint scarring along right temple. Sitting in awkward position, one leg curled, spine curved, fidgeting with hands. Wearing oversized charcoal layered top under worn black leather jacket, fitted black technical pants, reconstructed grey leather combat boots. Smudges of projection gel on sleeves. Minor stress visible — dark circles under eyes, tension creases between brows. Restless unfocused energy caught between moments of complete stillness. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon-lit workspace ambient lighting reflecting off bioluminescent hair threads, gritty archive aesthetic, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Loft', N'local', N'The Loft', N'Complex Ubiquitous Diaspora blend: Hispanic/Latin American (30.6%), Middle Eastern (29.9%), Sub-Saharan African (18.5%), Central Asian (8.8%), Indigenous American (6.5%), and Pacific Islander (5.7%). This creates a striking warm-toned baseline with multiple overlapping features: golden-bronze skin enriched by African and Pacific Islander heritage, angular high-set cheekbones and broader mid-face structure from Indigenous and Middle Eastern ancestry, subtle warmth and depth from Central Asian and Hispanic elements. The overall effect is warm undertones with golden and amber richness throughout—a genuinely polychromatic blend where no single heritage dominates visually.', 168, 58, N'Slight, almost wiry — the kind of frame that suggests chronic undereating rather than discipline. Narrow shoulders, minimal muscle definition. Moves with a restless, unfocused energy that suggests their body is always catching up to their mind.', N'Dark brown with bioluminescent threads woven throughout — threads glow in soft pastels (cyan, amber, violet) that pulse and shift in complex, non-repeating patterns', N'Wavy, slightly tangled, often pinned or clipped back asymmetrically with whatever is within reach', N'Medium (shoulder-length when loose)', N'Natural dark brown — very still, very focused when observing', N'Warm golden-bronze with rich amber undertones. The tone reflects balanced contribution from Hispanic/Latin American and Central Asian warmth, deepened by Sub-Saharan African and Pacific Islander heritage, with subtle angular definition from Indigenous and Middle Eastern features.', N'Angular, high-set cheekbones with broader facial structure from Indigenous and Middle Eastern ancestry. Mid-face width and subtle warmth from Sub-Saharan African heritage. Pacific Islander ancestry contributes to slight fullness in the lower face and soft facial contours. Overall bone structure is defined but delicate. Skin shows minor stress — dark circles under eyes, occasional tension creases between brows. Well-maintained but not groomed; face has the look of someone who forgets about it entirely for hours at a time.', N'Bioluminescent hair threads are the most obvious — constantly visible and constantly shifting, functioning as an involuntary emotional/neural readout. Cat-ear mods are visible when hair is pulled back or in profile. The neural-haptic interface has no external hardware except a very faint, hairline scar at the temple.', N'Sits in odd positions — one leg curled, spine curved. Fidgets constantly with hands when thinking. When deep in work, becomes completely still and rigid. Walks with purpose when focused, but drifts when between tasks. Eyes track details compulsively — they''re always looking at something.', N'High-quality secondhand — vintage tech-wear and archive pieces from the 2190s-2200s, carefully maintained. Fitted black technical pants (often with asymmetrical pockets or modified seams), oversized layered tops in muted colors (charcoal, deep teal, soft grey). Worn leather jacket from an unidentifiable era. Worn well but never pristine — there are always smudges of something on the sleeves (projection gel, render dust, tea). Jewelry is minimal and functional: a braided cord bracelet, sometimes a salvaged watch that doesn''t work. Shoes are always expensive-looking but scuffed — current pair is reconstructed grey leather combat boots. Tier 3 aesthetic: deliberately curated poverty-chic that would read as lazy to anyone wealthier, but is actually a precise statement about resource allocation and values.', N'A piece they sold to a private Axiom collector three years ago — a work they claimed was about memory and loss — was actually constructed from illegally harvested neural imprint data they purchased from a black-market broker. They have never told anyone. The data belonged to residents of a demolished Hough Reclamation block, and the piece is in a corporate foyer.', N'Dense with design and phenomenology terminology, which they use with genuine precision but sometimes forget is not universal. Ghanaian grandmother''s cadences in their phrasing — certain questions come out as gentle commands.', N'Thoughtful and slightly too fast when excited — words cluster together then stop completely while they catch up with their own thinking.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hikmet_cisneros_tovar_khorasani');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b5-7832-a12f-f98e320ef44a', N'Kwame Lewandowski', N'Kwame', N'', N'Lewandowski', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Kenwood Gate, Zheng-Dao Regional Distribution Hub 7, near Damen and Armitage', N'Logistics Coordinator, Zheng-Dao Mid-Lake Supply Chain', N'Zheng-Dao (Logistics, Regional Distribution)', N'Kwame Lewandowski is medium height with the slightly overdeveloped forearm muscles of someone who has spent years physically wrangling cargo manifests and dock equipment when the automated systems — which break down constantly — fail. Her skin is warm brown, her hair a natural dark coil she keeps pinned back with three mismatched clips she has never bothered to replace because she is always doing six other things. She has color-changing hair tips — dyed in the geneware sense, shifting between deep teal and burnt orange depending on temperature — that she got on a whim at twenty-seven and has never quite gotten around to removing because they are genuinely useful for gauging how cold the dock warehouse is.

She is competent in a way that has outpaced her job title for roughly four years and her pay grade for six. She coordinates the mid-lake freight routing for Zheng-Dao''s third-largest regional hub, a job that officially requires one person and actually requires the sustained output of three, and she does it with a combination of exhausted creativity, genuine systems intelligence, and a working relationship with the Hub 7 E.L.F. that she has spent two years cultivating through meticulous daily offerings. She is not unhappy — she likes the puzzle of logistics, genuinely — but she is aware, in the specific way of people who have been passed over for promotion twice, that the puzzle is not making her rich.', N'Information source for what''s actually moving through Zheng-Dao''s supply chain versus what the manifests say; local color for the grinding Tier 2-3 corporate experience; quest giver for problems that require someone who knows every freight route on the mid-lake and exactly which ones go dark; sympathetic contact who has reasons to share information if approached correctly.', N'', N'Geneware color-shift hair tips (temperature-responsive teal/orange). Warehouse-grade haptic gloves with integrated inventory scanner — work-issued. Basic neural link, personal purchase.', N'At the hub by 0600 to review overnight freight irregularities before her nominal shift starts; manages incoming dock assignments, carrier disputes, and routing exceptions through a combination of her neural link, the hub''s battered logistics system, and ongoing negotiation with the Hub 7 E.L.F.; leaves late, takes the Ferrogate transit home to Kenwood Gate proper.', N'Kwame Lewandowski, early 30s warehouse logistics operator, 167cm lean muscular build, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones reflecting Eastern European and Sub-Saharan African heritage, broad cheekbones and strong jawline, alert dark brown eyes showing chronic fatigue. Naturally coiled dark brown hair with teal and burnt orange color-shift geneware tips, pulled back with three mismatched metal clips. Grey tactical Zheng-Dao warehouse pants with reinforced knees, black synthetic turtleneck, grey-blue insulated vest, steel-toed boots. Both hands wearing tactical grey haptic gloves with visible feedback nodes. Subtle neural link port visible at base of skull. Functional grooming, minimal makeup, visible fatigue lines around eyes. Scarred left palm, rope scar on right forearm, silver logistics tattoo on right wrist. Forward-leaning posture, tense shoulders, hands in subtle calculating motion. Neo-noir warehouse dockside setting, cool industrial lighting with blues and greys, early morning atmospheric haze, functional and worn aesthetic, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Kenwood Gate', N'local', N'Kenwood Gate', N'Mixed Eastern European (67%) and Sub-Saharan African (31.4%) ancestry with trace Hispanic/Latin American (1.6%). Features reflect this significant blend: warm medium-deep brown skin with subtle golden undertones, broad cheekbones and strong jawline from African heritage, balanced with Eastern European bone structure and facial proportions. Alert dark brown eyes convey calculated intelligence. The combination creates a striking unified appearance rather than discrete ethnic markers—a product of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 167, 62, N'Lean and muscular through the forearms and shoulders from years of manual cargo handling; core strength that reads as functional rather than aesthetic. Slight asymmetry in right shoulder from repetitive strain.', N'Natural dark brown with temperature-responsive geneware color-shift tips (deep teal when cold, burnt orange when warm)', N'Naturally coiled, worn pulled back and secured with three mismatched metal clips (brass, steel, aluminum) — practical rather than intentional', N'Medium (shoulder-length when down, pinned above shoulders daily)', N'Dark brown, alert and calculating', N'Warm medium-deep brown with subtle golden undertones, even complexion reflecting the genetic blend of Eastern European and Sub-Saharan African ancestry', N'Minimal makeup, clear skin with visible fatigue lines around eyes from early mornings and chronic sleep deficit. Hands show calluses and faint scanner-burn marks from haptic glove use. Functional grooming — showered but not primped. Facial structure reflects Eastern European-African blend: warm depth, broad cheekbones, strong jawline, direct gaze.', N'Warehouse-grade haptic gloves on both hands — tactical grey with integrated haptic feedback nodes visible on palms and fingertips, issued by Zheng-Dao. Basic neural link port visible as subtle subdermal seam at base of skull, kept scrupulously clean. Color-shift hair tips naturally visible.', N'Efficient, forward-leaning gait. Shoulders perpetually tense. Hands in constant subtle motion — fingers moving through mental logistics calculations even at rest. Sits with one foot on the ground, ready to move. Makes direct eye contact with authority figures but breaks it under fatigue.', N'Zheng-Dao warehouse issue: grey and charcoal tactical pants with reinforced knee panels and cargo pockets, paired with fitted black synthetic turtleneck or grey performance shirt. Lightweight insulated vest in company grey-blue. Steel-toed boots (practical, not fashionable). No jewelry except the neural link port and the three hair clips. Occasional Φ50-80 smart-fabric jacket with temperature regulation that she toggles on cold dock runs. Tier 3-4 working class: functional, branded, worn but maintained.', N'She has noticed, over eight months of freight routing, a recurring pattern of manifests that don''t add up — cargo volume that arrives correctly but departs in quantities that suggest something is being skimmed at the hub level. She has been logging the discrepancies privately, telling herself it''s professional due diligence, but she knows it''s because she is furious that whoever is running the skim is doing it incompetently and it is creating routing problems she has to fix.', N'Direct, practical, logistics-framed — she describes most situations in terms of inputs, outputs, and where the bottleneck is. Dry humor that surfaces when she''s comfortable.', N'Fast and efficient when working; slower and warmer in conversation. Drops into short declarative sentences when something is wrong.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'kwame_lewandowski');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a721-7109-a42d-f99efe77c258', N'Elva Hwang', N'Elva', N'', N'Hwang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Shallowgrave — covers a circuit from Copperhead Market to the Brewer''s Spine canal walkway, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Numbers runner and bookmaker''s legman for a sports and events gambling operation in Shallowgrave', N'Legman for a bookmaking operation called the Eleven Houses, run by an older fixer named Adaugo Ferraro-Tchamba who operates out of a private room at the Copperhead Market social club', N'Elva Hwang is a compact, quick-moving young man with warm dark brown skin, a gap-toothed smile he deploys constantly, and hair grown out into a high puff that he dyes a different color every two weeks — currently a deep auburn. His ears have cat-ear geneware tips that he got on his seventeenth birthday as a rite of passage in his friend group, and he has a small luminescent dot above his left eyebrow like a permanent beauty mark. He dresses in layers of cheap, colorful synthetics and always has at least four devices in different pockets, each running a different channel.

Elva Hwang is relentlessly cheerful in the way that only very fast people can afford to be — he knows he can get out of most situations before they turn bad, and that confidence reads as ease. He''s sharper than anyone gives him credit for, can hold several hundred bets in active mental accounting at any given moment, and has an intuitive read on crowd psychology that his bosses haven''t fully noticed yet. He thinks he''s working toward something, building toward running his own book, but he hasn''t articulated to himself that the organization he works for rarely promotes from his position.', N'Street-level information conduit — knows everyone on his circuit and their business; introduces players to the Shallowgrave social fabric; potential vulnerability in a larger criminal operation; could be a witness to something he doesn''t realize he saw.', N'', N'Cat-ear geneware (cosmetic, tips only). Bioluminescent beauty-mark dot above left eyebrow. Standard cheap retinal display — second-hand Tessera model, consumer grade.', N'Wakes late, picks up the day''s numbers from a deadrop near Brewer''s Spine at noon, runs his circuit through Shallowgrave and Copperhead Market for six hours collecting slips and settling wins, spends evenings at the social club watching whatever sporting event the bets are riding on.', N'Elva Hwang, 168cm compact wiry frame, warm medium-to-dark brown skin with golden undertones blending East Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Prominent cheekbones, refined jawline, warm dark brown eyes with faint amber retinal display grid. Deep auburn voluminous puff hairstyle, gap-toothed grin. Bioluminescent pale blue-white beauty mark above left eyebrow, iridescent cat-ear geneware tips. Layered bright neon synthetics — electric blue oversized hoodie over hot pink tank, four stuffed pockets, worn scuffed synthleather sneakers. Perpetual kinetic energy, weight on balls of feet, confident posture. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, urban street setting with neon signage, cinematic moody lighting with rim highlights, fast-twitch runner''s build visible in forearms. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Shallowgrave', N'local', N'Shallowgrave', N'East Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African blend — a striking global mix reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora. The 47% East Asian ancestry provides refined bone structure and eye shape, while 41% Hispanic/Latin American heritage contributes warmth and soft facial contours. The 11.9% Sub-Saharan African ancestry enriches skin depth and adds pronounced cheekbone definition. The combined ancestry creates warm medium-to-dark brown skin with golden undertones that shift between cool and warm depending on light.', 168, 62, N'Compact and wiry with minimal bulk — built for speed and agility rather than strength. Fast-twitch muscle definition visible in forearms and calves from constant circuit-running.', N'Deep auburn (dyed; natural color dark brown)', N'High, voluminous puff with careful maintenance and deliberate styling', N'Medium (approximately 10-12cm at crown)', N'Warm dark brown with faint amber retinal display overlay visible when active', N'Warm medium-to-dark brown with golden undertones and even complexion, reflecting balanced East Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Sub-Saharan African heritage', N'Clear, youthful skin with prominent cheekbone definition and strong jawline reflecting the Sub-Saharan African and East Asian bone structure, softened by Hispanic/Latin American facial contours. Gap between front incisors visible when smiling — a signature feature deployed often and without self-consciousness. Minimal facial hair.', N'Bioluminescent beauty mark above left eyebrow (pale blue-white, soft glow). Feline ear geneware tips (cosmetic mod, iridescent finish). Retinal display hardware visible as faint amber grid pattern across pupils when eyes catch light or system is active — second-hand Tessera consumer model, noticeable if you know what to look for.', N'Perpetually in motion even when standing still — weight shifted to balls of feet, fidgeting hands, constant low-level kinetic energy. Moves through crowds with practiced efficiency, sliding rather than pushing. Carries himself with the ease of someone who knows he can escape any situation. Smiles constantly — gap-toothed grin deployed as a social tool.', N'Layered cheap synthetic textiles in bright, clashing colors — neon greens, hot pinks, electric blues worn together without coordination concerns. Oversized hoodies and fitted tank tops layered underneath. At least four visible pockets, all occupied with different devices (phones, betting slips, comms units). Worn synthleather sneakers, scuffed but functional. Tier 4 working-class aesthetic with intentional color choices that read as young and confident rather than poor.', N'He''s been quietly skimming — not money, but information. He keeps a private log of patterns he''s noticed in the bets: who bets big before certain outcomes, who seems to know things before they happen. He doesn''t know what to do with it yet but he knows it''s worth something.', N'Shallowgrave slang heavy, numerical shorthand, sports metaphors, moves faster than his grammar', N'Rapid-fire with sudden full stops when something actually interests him', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'elva_hwang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019db33a-edd1-7097-b813-f9e28da1ba5f', N'Sasha Võ', N'Sasha', N'', N'Võ', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 28, NULL, 0, 0, N'alive — at large, operating independently in the GLMZ east of the Lateral Junction and into the buffer zones', N'Currently: unknown — somewhere east of the Lateral Junction, on a contract she did not log with Sable. Will reach out when she has something to trade.', N'Independent contract operator. Ex-Sigma-program subject — a different secondary facility, a different generation of NeoCortex hardware than Kyle''s, a different (and earlier) walking-out. Pistol specialist with her own intact array running its own degradation timeline. Crossed paths with Kyle during a contract overlap; the two of them got out of the same building on the same night for entirely different reasons and have not pretended since to be more to each other than that.', N'Independent. Eastern-pipeline contract operator.', N'Twenty-eight years old. Ex-Sigma-program subject — a different secondary corponation facility from the Atlas program that built Kyle, on a different continent''s research lineage, generations apart in implant architecture. Her NeoCortex array is a Sigma-line build at 24,576 electrode density (smaller than Kyle''s 32,768 Atlas, larger than the consumer Tier-3 implants the legitimate market sells), drilled-in firmware that runs cleaner than Kyle''s because the Sigma program had the calibration discipline Atlas never bothered with. The trade-off is generation-specific: Sigma arrays are stable for about twelve to fifteen years before a slow ferromagnetic drift starts; she is at year ten and has begun managing the drift with a pharmaceutical regimen she compounds herself. She has approximately five years before the array degrades past field-operable. She does not talk about this.

She is not Kyle''s heir, his ward, his bloodline successor, or his tissue-match continuation. The two of them are unrelated. They have different facility codes, different program lineages, different hardware generations, different scars at the back of the skull. Their faces do not echo each other. The reason they look at each other with recognition is the curriculum they both survived — the same shape of confinement, the same shape of metric-driven training, the same shape of being a unit-of-work to people who never used your name. Recognition is not lineage. They settled this within thirty seconds of meeting.

Her heritage is the Ubiquitous Diaspora at its most mixed: Vietnamese (paternal line, surname Võ — written 武 in the syllabary her grandfather kept), Ukrainian (the first name and the cool-winter undertone), and Senegalese (the geometry around the jaw and the way her hair takes the light). The face is not Kyle''s. The face is hers, and she has never had to share it with a recorded predecessor.

Fully trained. Sigma''s curriculum was firearms-heavy from age twelve onward — her parents volunteered her into the program at age eleven for what they understood to be a corponation educational pipeline; what it actually was, neither parent has lived long enough to learn. She walked out at twenty-one when the program shifted from training to deployment-readiness and she realized she did not want to be the asset she was about to be assigned as. She has been operating independently for seven years, building a contract pipeline through fixers in the eastern farmlands and Pulse-hub stations, no permanent residence, no permanent crew, no favorite pistol and no jacket older than the last contract.

She is expressive where Kyle is reserved. She talks through what she is doing while she is doing it, she asks strangers questions, she tests jokes to see if they land and tries another when the first one doesn''t. She revels in what she is good at. The first time she shot a person who was going to stay dead from it (age twenty-two, third contract out of the program, a clean payment for an unclean target), she lingered on the grip afterward the way you linger on a thing you have known was in you all along and have just finally gotten to use.

Pistols are her specialty and her preference. The grip is different on every frame — single-action, double-action, recoil mass, trigger pull, safety geometry, magazine capacity — and Sigma drilled that variance into her specifically because the program wanted a shooter who could run anything. She does not carry a favorite. She does not name her weapon. She does not keep mementos. When the pistol in her hand runs dry she drops it and takes the next one off whoever is on the ground, and the new weapon is in her grip inside a second, calibrated inside another, firing correctly by the third.

Her counting tic (rivets, tiles, rain impacts) is still there but quieter than it used to be — seven years on the road taught her to suppress it in company. She counts under her breath only when she wants to, as self-regulation during high-cognitive moments. When she does not want to, she talks. She talks a lot. She narrates what she is seeing, what she is deciding, what she is going to try next. She plays at accents she has heard once. She calls people friend and trouble and the one with the boots, testing nicknames the way she tests jokes. She makes eye contact and holds it the way Kyle never does.

When she met Kyle — at a corponation facility on the night he was being extracted via False Death Protocol for a different contract entirely — she had been there for her own job (extraction of a Sigma-program firmware archive that the facility had been holding for a competitor''s research division). They surfaced into the same hallway at the same minute with weapons in hand and recognized each other''s hardware-signature within two seconds. The cooperation was tactical, brief, and clean: she pulled him out of an ambush in the maintenance corridor he had not seen coming, he opened her path to the loading bay where her contact''s vehicle was waiting, neither of them owed the other anything beyond *thanks.* At dawn she walked east. Kyle walked west. They have not spoken since. She will reach out when she has something to trade.', N'Sasha is the road operator Kyle is not. He works the GLMZ corridor; she works the eastern seams. He has Seo''s blade and a code; she has whatever pistol she picked up last week and a working pipeline. He is the cautionary tale of one weapon and one principle; she is the alternative example — multiple weapons, fungible tools, principles that travel with her body rather than with any specific instrument.

She is the story''s contradiction of the protector/ward trope and the chosen-one trope simultaneously. She did not need rescuing when she met Kyle. She is not his heir. She is not his bloodline. She is not being hunted across dimensions by cosmic forces. She is being tracked at low priority by a corporate program whose loss-recovery policy prioritizes firmware over field assets. Her arc is a working operator''s arc — solo gunslinger, freelance jobs, reputation built one clean shot at a time, no mentor, no found family, no destiny.

When she appears in future stories she appears as herself — Sasha Võ, gunslinger, twenty-eight, working, occasionally loud, occasionally laughing, whatever pistol in her hand this week, increasingly hard to surprise. She is older than Kyle by a year. The difference is structural: the older operator with the better-calibrated array who has been working solo longer is the one offering the second opinion, not asking for it.', N'Sasha''s narration is externalizing. Where Kyle''s prose fragments inward, hers runs outward — she narrates what she is seeing, what she is deciding, what she is trying, often mid-action. Her sentences are shorter, her verbs more active, her idioms borrowed and redeployed from whoever she last talked to. She uses first person liberally. She laughs on the page — the prose acknowledges the laugh without apologizing for it. She is expressive about her own capacity: when she is good at something the narration names that it is good, without hedging, and without Kyle''s measure-twice-cut-once hesitation. The counting tic surfaces as the one register where her voice goes quiet — it is the ghost in her prose the way discipline is the ghost in Kyle''s. She is twenty-eight on the page. The voice does not perform youth.', N'Sigma-program NeoCortex array, 24,576 electrodes — fully integrated, drilled-in firmware. The array is at year ten of a 12–15 year operational window before ferromagnetic drift forces it offline. She manages the drift with a pharmaceutical regimen she compounds herself. Healed insertion port at the base of the skull, chrome leads buried under grown-in hair; not visible unless the hair is parted. Subdermal mesh at the torso (Sigma standard issue, light ballistic). No other visible augments.', N'Walks. Talks. Works. Rotates safehouses every five to nine days. Takes two to four contracts a month, depending on what the eastern pipeline is offering. Maintains her own pharmaceutical regimen — chemistry kit fits in a small canvas bag, she compounds in motel sinks. Reads pulp paperbacks when she is not working — she likes the cheap ones because the cheap ones are honest about what they are.', N'GLMZ character portrait of Sasha Võ: a twenty-eight-year-old woman, lean and composed, mixed Vietnamese / Ukrainian / Senegalese heritage with cool-winter skin undertones and a shoulder-length straight dark brown hair, gray eyes, the bone geometry of three continents and nowhere you can put your finger on. Wearing a short dark utility jacket, cargo pants, sturdy boots. Hip-carry pistol (no holster, jacket pocket, frame visible through the fabric). Standing in a dust-streaked Pulse hub station in the eastern farmlands, the morning light slanting in low through dirty windows, a duffel at her feet, a coffee in one hand and a half-smile on her face that has the specific quality of a joke she has not yet decided whether to tell. Cinematic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'Whatever pistol is in her hand — rotates constantly, taken off jobs, traded, discarded when the ammunition market makes a particular caliber stupid. She never buys a weapon from a shop.', N'Whatever she has just picked up off the ground.', N'Sigma-issue subdermal mesh under the jacket; otherwise visible mobility.', N'', N'Transient — weekly rentals, pod hotels, friends-of-friends, occasionally a cot in a back room someone owes her. Has not slept in the same bed eight nights in a row in seven years.', N'Short dark utility jacket, cargo pants, sturdy boots. No coat like Sable. No tailoring. Nothing ornamental. Everything she wears is functional and rotated — nothing on her is older than the last job.', N'', N'Anything spicy. Sigma fed her a bland nutritional profile for ten years. She is making up for it.', N'Caffeine. The pharmaceutical regimen is not for stimulation.', N'Burner pad, rotated monthly.', N'East of the Lateral Junction — drowned Michigan farmlands, the Pulse hub stations at Battle Creek and Toledo, the buffer zones around the Indiana Dust', N'regional', N'East of the Lateral Junction — drowned Michigan farmlands, the Pulse hub stations at Battle Creek and Toledo, the buffer zones around the Indiana Dust', N'Vietnamese (paternal, surname Võ) with Ukrainian (first name, cool-winter undertone) and Senegalese (jaw geometry, hair texture) — a Ubiquitous Diaspora face. Distinct from Kyle in every measurable dimension; the two of them do not share genetic markers, just curriculum.', 168, 58, N'Lean, composed, maintained — Sigma kept her to spec and worked her hard. The body moves with trained competence. She knows how she carries herself in a fight.', N'Dark brown', N'Shoulder-length, straight, grown in fully over the integrated array — the chrome leads at the base of her skull are not visible unless she lifts the hair deliberately', N'Shoulder', N'Gray', N'Medium with cool-winter undertones', N'Clear', N'Sigma NeoCortex array at 24,576 electrode density — fully integrated, not visible externally unless the hair is parted. Subdermal mesh at the torso, faintly visible under bright cross-light.', N'Economical; tracks exits before greeting; will not stand in the middle of a room. Grip, stance, trigger discipline, and target acquisition all arrive as one motion — drilled for a decade before it was ever aimed at anything that could bleed.', N'Plain dark — short utility jacket, cargo pants, sturdy boots. Nothing ornamental.', N'She is keeping a private timeline of how the Sigma drift is progressing — silent micro-tests she runs on herself every fourth night, logged in a notebook she does not carry. The drift is approximately on schedule, which is the worst case she had budgeted for. She has not told anyone. She has not yet decided whether she will.', N'Raw, experimental, magpie. She collects slang and idiom from every stranger she meets and redeploys it the next day to see how it fits. Sigma trained her in three languages by drill (English, Mandarin, Vietnamese, with conversational French as a side option) and she rotates between them when the room is mixed. She calls things by nicknames before she knows their names.', N'Fast, confident, front-loaded. Subject-verb-object then whatever else occurs to her, in that order, without pauses. She does not weigh words before releasing them — she releases them and watches the room to see what happens. When she is regulating neural load the cadence tightens and she might go silent for a count of seventeen, but that is the exception. Default: running narration of her own actions and the actions of everyone in the room.', N'When she is excited she sounds twenty. When she is regulating she sounds older than twenty-eight. The shift is audible and she has learned to control it.', N'Cadence tightens but does not go silent — she talks through the decision. Sometimes talks through the contractor she is about to shoot. This unsettles people in ways she takes professional pleasure in.', N'She is still figuring it out. Seven years on the road and she has had three people whose nicknames lasted longer than a single contract. She has not slept beside any of them more than two nights in a row.', N'', N'', N'sasha_v');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5b3-7697-9e21-fa239f539ff3', N'Anouk Okafor-Möller', N'Anouk', N'', N'Okafor-Möller', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 32, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Aurochs Medical Complex — sub-basement waste processing facility; lives in Blackpipe Corridor, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Bio-waste disposal technician at Aurochs Medical Complex, with a side practice in informal pharmaceutical redistribution', N'Aurochs Medical Complex (support staff, employed); informal supply network serving Brewer''s Spine Community Health Cooperative and three other independent clinics', N'Anouk Okafor-Möller is a compact, deliberately unmemorable woman who has spent years perfecting the skill of being overlooked. She wears the grey-green uniform of Aurochs support services, keeps her dark hair pulled back in a practical bun, and has the kind of face that is genuinely warm in repose and genuinely blank on demand — she switches between them like a light. Her skin is a deep warm brown and her eyes are standard-issue dark, though the left one occasionally produces a faint violet phosphorescence from a bioluminescent mod she got second-hand and can''t fully suppress, which she covers with a tinted contact lens that she hates. Her hands are permanently chemical-stained at the knuckles from the sterilization protocols.

She processes medical waste: sharps, expired biologics, surgical byproducts, and — this is where it gets complicated — the medications that are technically expired but functionally still effective, which Aurochs destroys by protocol and she intercepts by system. She has built a careful, small operation: she identifies medications that are safe and functional, diverts them before incineration, and routes them to four street clinics in The Narrows and Blackpipe Corridor at cost or below. She does not think of this as heroic. She thinks of it as the obvious thing that someone in her position could do, and she cannot understand why more people in her position don''t do it. This is perhaps the most dangerous thing about her.', N'Black-market pharmaceutical source, knowledge of hospital internal systems and schedules, potential ally for characters needing medical supplies, her operation is a ticking clock that could be exposed', N'', N'Bioluminescent iris mod — left eye, violet, second-hand, partially uncontrolled (covered by tinted contact lens); chemical-resistance dermal treatment on hands (occupational, employer-issued); no other mods', N'Arrives for the early shift at 04:30, processes waste streams through the morning, intercepts and packages pharmaceutical diversions during a specific window when the monitoring AI does a scheduled recalibration, delivers packages on her commute home through Blackpipe Corridor twice weekly.', N'Anouk Okafor-Möller, a compact 158cm woman with deep warm brown skin reflecting Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Southeast Asian heritage. High prominent cheekbones, expressive warm brown eyes with subtle amber undertones—left eye hidden behind amber-tinted contact lens concealing violet bioluminescence beneath. Black hair pulled back in tight bun with grey clip. Small scar visible on right temple. Chemical-stained yellowed discoloration on knuckles and first hand joints. Wearing grey-green Aurochs Medical Complex uniform with poly-blend coverall, name badge, latex gloves, reinforced apron during work shift. Off-shift in worn dark jeans, fitted grey thermal shirt, heavy olive canvas jacket with elbow patches, black synthetic leather steel-toed boots. Moves with economical precision, minimal wasted motion. GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone setting, industrial medical facility or urban tier-4 district. Cool atmospheric lighting emphasizing skin tone warmth and the contrast of her unaugmented features against augmented details. Serious, observant expression. Minimal jewelry—only cheap stainless steel watch. Deliberately unremarkable, forgettable appearance by design --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'local', N'Aurochs Medical Complex', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (75.8%) with South Asian (12.2%) and Southeast Asian (12.0%) ancestry. This genetic combination creates striking warm brown skin tones with complex golden and amber depths, high-definition cheekbones, and the balanced facial proportions characteristic of this multicultural blend. The ancestry mix produces warm, expressive features with natural strength in the face structure.', 158, 52, N'Compact and spare, muscled in the forearms and shoulders from years of repetitive handling work. No excess weight. Efficient frame.', N'Black, naturally', N'Pulled back in a tight, practical bun secured with a grey clip', N'Long (pulled back)', N'Deep warm brown natural with golden undertones; left eye contains suppressed violet bioluminescence visible as faint shimmer beneath tinted amber-brown contact lens', N'Deep warm brown with rich golden and amber undertones, reflecting the dominant Sub-Saharan African heritage blended with South Asian warmth and Southeast Asian complexity. Even-toned with natural luminosity characteristic of this ancestry.', N'Fine-featured, symmetrical face with prominent high cheekbones shaped by Sub-Saharan African and South Asian ancestry. Genuinely expressive in repose—warm, observant. Can compress into complete blankness. Small scar on right temple from a childhood accident. Skin around eyes shows early crow''s feet from squinting under industrial lighting. Face shows the balanced proportions and natural warmth characteristic of multicultural Sub-Saharan African-South Asian-Southeast Asian heritage.', N'Left eye wears a tinted contact lens (amber-brown) to suppress the bioluminescent iris mod beneath. Close inspection would reveal the faint violet glow underneath if the lens were removed. Hands show chemical-resistance dermal treatment as a subtle matte finish to the skin, slightly different texture than untreated areas.', N'Moves with economical precision—no wasted motion. Quiet walker. Tends to keep her hands visible and still when not in use. Stands slightly angled, as if ready to pivot away. Makes deliberate eye contact when she decides to be memorable, none when she doesn''t. Carries herself with the specific posture of someone who has learned to occupy minimal space.', N'Grey-green Aurochs Medical Complex support staff uniform during shifts—regulation poly-blend coverall with name badge, latex gloves, reinforced apron. Off-shift: practical Tier 4 clothing—worn dark jeans, fitted grey or black thermal shirts, a heavy olive canvas jacket patched at both elbows, practical boots (black synthetic leather, steel-toed). No jewelry except a cheap stainless steel watch. Her clothes are clean but deliberately unremarkable, chosen to not draw attention or memory.', N'She has a personal encrypted file containing enough evidence of Aurochs systematically destroying functional medications beyond any protocol requirement — she believes it''s a deliberate policy to maintain pharmaceutical scarcity and pricing. She has never shown it to anyone. She doesn''t know who to show it to or what it would cost her.', N'Practical and understated; she rarely uses emotional language even for emotional subjects; favors passive constructions that remove her from the center of sentences', N'Even and low, rarely speeds up; gives the impression of someone who has already had the conversation several times internally', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anouk_okafor_m_ller');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a634-78f6-a32c-fa305f717b97', N'Samira Sabbagh-Hoang', N'Samira', N'', N'Sabbagh-Hoang', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 36, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Chatham Flats — lives and works embedded in the community they study, near Ashland and Division', N'Urban sociologist specializing in the Gray Zone communities and informal governance, independent researcher', N'Unaffiliated — formerly University Spine Dept. of Social Systems, currently self-funded through a Palladian Research Foundation small grant and per-article journalism fees', N'Samira Sabbagh-Hoang is compact and restless, with warm brown skin, a nose ring that cycles through three colors with their mood (a cheap cosmetic mod they''ve had since graduate school), and natural hair grown into a large, somewhat chaotic halo they cut themselves with kitchen scissors. They dress exclusively in layers that can be added or removed depending on which district they''re moving through — they''ve gotten very good at reading the visual codes of neighborhoods and adjusting accordingly. Their eyes are unmodified, which in the Gray Zone reads as either poverty or principle; in Iphigenia''s case it is both, worn with quiet stubbornness.

They have the particular energy of someone who is genuinely fascinated by people — not as subjects but as people — and communities in the Gray Zone can sense the difference. They''ve been invited to births, funerals, water-distribution arguments, and at least two ELF-shrine consecrations in districts researchers never get into. They also have a temper they''ve mostly learned to manage, a sharp tongue when bureaucratic abstraction is used to justify human harm, and a habit of forgetting to eat when they are deep in field notes. They are fiercely protective of the communities they work with and will refuse to share data that could harm them, which has cost them two university positions and one very lucrative Axiom contract.', N'Expert guide to the Gray Zone culture, informal economy, and community politics; can open doors in low-tier districts that other academics cannot; quest giver for ethnographic retrieval missions; moral conscience character who challenges players'' assumptions about poverty and agency.', N'', N'Color-cycling nose ring (cosmetic geneware implant, low-end); nothing else — partly financial, partly they consider it meaningful to move through the Gray Zone spaces without visible chrome.', N'Spends mornings walking specific routes through Chatham Flats and adjacent districts, taking informal notes; afternoons conducting interviews or attending community meetings; evenings writing, arguing with their data, and eating whatever is cheapest at the corner stalls.', N'Samira Sabbagh-Hoang, 158cm compact wiry frame, sits cross-legged in GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone environment. Warm golden-amber brown skin with olive undertones, angular cheekbones and defined jawline. Shoulder-length dark brown hair with gray at temples, textured self-cut halo style. Natural warm brown unaugmented eyes, alert and intense expression. Subtle iridescent amber mood-ring nostril implant glowing in septum. Old pale burn scar visible on left forearm. Dark circles under eyes from fieldwork exhaustion. Wearing layered thrifted clothing: neutral base layer, oversized cardigan, functional outer layer. Scuffed walking boots. Small worn pack at side containing notebooks and recorder. Hands gesture expressively while speaking. Deliberately minimal augmentation aesthetic reading as quiet defiance. Foreground-leaning posture. Low-key industrial the Gray Zone district setting, neon-tinged ambient lighting catching warm glow across cheekbones and temples. Neo-noir urban decay background. Mood: focused, restless, observant. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Chatham Flats', N'local', N'Chatham Flats', N'Hispanic/Latin American (41.3%), Middle Eastern (35.2%), and Southeast Asian (23.5%) ancestry; the Ubiquitous Diaspora manifest in a striking blend of warm, complex features that defy singular regional categorization', 158, 52, N'Compact and wiry, muscular in a lean way from constant walking through the Gray Zone; restless energy evident in how they hold themselves', N'Natural dark brown with scattered gray at temples', N'Self-cut into a large, textured halo; uneven layers suggest kitchen scissors and no particular vanity about symmetry', N'Long (shoulder-length and beyond)', N'Natural warm brown, unaugmented', N'Warm golden-amber brown with subtle olive undertones and warm reddish accents across the cheekbones; melanin-rich from the blended Hispanic, Middle Eastern, and Southeast Asian genetic profile; skin catches light with a warm glow across prominent facial structure', N'Angular, defined cheekbones and prominent jawline reflecting the blended Middle Eastern and Southeast Asian bone structure; dark circles under eyes suggest chronic sleep debt from fieldwork; skin is clear but sun-weathered from outdoor walking; warm undertone variation across face from the tri-regional genetic blending creates subtle depth across temples and jawline; expression typically alert and slightly intense', N'Only the cosmetic nose ring implant; deliberately minimal chrome presence. The lack of visible augmentation reads as either principled poverty or quiet defiance in the Gray Zone spaces, which they leverage intentionally.', N'Moves with purposeful efficiency; walks slightly forward-leaning as if always mid-thought; hands gesture when talking, often holding imaginary notes. Sits cross-legged in interviews regardless of formality. Fidgets with fabric edges when listening intently.', N'Strictly layered approach: base layer is always worn, functional undershirt (neutral colors); middle layers are oversized cardigans or vests that can be removed; outer layer adapts to district code-reading (Tier 3 corporate casual in certain blocks, Tier 5 survival wear in others). All clothing is thrift-sourced, well-maintained but visibly secondhand. Shoes are good walking boots, scuffed. No jewelry except the nose ring. Small pack always carried containing notebooks, recorder, water bottle, emergency ration bar.', N'They have a completed manuscript — three years of the Gray Zone fieldwork — that they have not submitted for publication because one chapter contains information that could expose a particular community''s informal water-reclamation network to Ferrogate Transit''s legal team. They don''t know how to excise the chapter without destroying the book''s argument, and they don''t know how to publish it without potentially destroying the network.', N'Fluid and code-switching — fluent in several the Gray Zone-district registers, academic vocabulary deployed sparingly and sometimes ironically; occasional Pulaar phrases from their grandmother''s side', N'Fast when excited, very slow and deliberate when they want someone to actually hear a specific thing', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'samira_sabbagh_hoang');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6f6-7959-b64a-fa3c47775a2f', N'Dongmei Bangura', N'Dongmei', N'', N'Bangura', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 38, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Corridor, Tessera Infrastructure Hub — open-plan office, desk seven, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Senior Project Manager, Tessera Infrastructure Division', N'Tessera (Infrastructure Division, Civic Integration Projects)', N'Dongmei Bangura has the kind of face that reads as permanently slightly amused, which is either accurate or a very effective mask depending on the day. They are medium height, compact, with light brown skin and the kind of effortlessly symmetrical features that suggest either genetics or a very good cosmetic package — in fact it''s genetics, a fact they find privately funny. Their hair is color-shifting, cycling slowly through dark blues and greens during work hours and switching to a deep amber setting they call ''off-duty mode.'' They dress practically: clean lines, nothing that catches on equipment, a jacket with actual pockets. A small silver ring through their left nostril is their only visible jewelry.

Dongmei Bangura is someone who keeps everything moving — projects, people, conversations, agendas. They have an almost physical intolerance for stagnation and an ability to hold seventeen interdependent variables in their head without apparent effort. They''re not charismatic in the conventional sense: they don''t perform warmth. But they''re fair, they remember everything, and they''re reliably the calmest person in any crisis, which generates a particular kind of loyalty in the people who work under them. They grew up in a Tier 3 household in Shorewood Terrace with two working parents who modeled relentless competence, and they absorbed it completely.', N'Organizational hub who knows where bodies are buried administratively; quest giver for logistics problems; can provide access or obstacle depending on relationship; grounded, reliable voice of pragmatic institutional knowledge.', N'', N'Color-shifting hair mod (blues, greens, amber — self-curated palette). Cortical memory-assist implant for project data retention. Mild haptic feedback overlay in both hands for interface work. No cosmetic eye mods — they specifically declined them, no explanation given.', N'In at 07:30, runs three parallel project status meetings before noon, eats lunch at their desk while doing vendor correspondence, spends afternoons on site visits or stakeholder calls, leaves by 19:00 unless something is actively on fire. Has a Ferrogate Transit season pass and reads physical books on the commute — an affectation they''re unapologetic about.', N'Dongmei Bangura, 168cm lean-built professional with deep rich brown skin with golden undertones, striking West African facial structure with prominent cheekbones and broad nose enhanced by Indigenous American and East Asian ancestry, creating multifaceted contemporary features. Shoulder-length blunt-cut hair in color-shifting neo-noir mod cycling deep navy-teal-forest green with warm amber undertones, dark brown unaugmented alert eyes, small silver nostril ring left side. Wearing charcoal merino blend shirt and dark grey reinforced jacket, functional watch, understated professional tier 2-3 neo-noir style. Standing economical grounded posture with faintly amused resting expression, hands positioned with precision. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226 office or site setting, cool neon-tinged ambient lighting catching golden radiance of skin, subtle haptic interface micro-gestures, cinematic neo-noir urban aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Corridor', N'local', N'Grand Corridor', N'Predominantly Sub-Saharan African (70.4%) with significant Indigenous American ancestry (12.0%), supplemented by Northern European (8.9%), East Asian (7.4%), and minor South Asian (1.3%) heritage. The genetic combination produces striking features: deep West African bone structure and facial proportions form the foundation, while Indigenous American ancestry contributes facial width and prominent cheekbones. Northern European admixture adds subtle complexity to eye shape and brow structure, East Asian heritage influences eyelid variation and subtle cheekbone projection, creating a multifaceted phenotype that reads as distinctly contemporary GLMZ—the lived result of the Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 168, 62, N'Compact and efficient, lean muscle without bulk, the kind of frame that suggests regular movement rather than dedicated fitness. Economical posture.', N'Color-shifting mod: cycles between deep navy, teal, and forest green during work hours; shifts to warm amber in off-duty mode', N'Shoulder-length, blunt-cut, styled for practicality — tucks behind ears when focused, no styling products visible', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, unaugmented, alert and direct', N'Deep rich brown with warm golden undertones, the luminous result of dominant Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Indigenous American and East Asian components add subtle complexity and depth without shifting the fundamental warmth of the base tone—skin catches light with distinctive golden radiance.', N'Strong West African facial structure with prominent, well-defined cheekbones and a broad nose; face width and balance reflect Indigenous American influence while East Asian admixture contributes to eye placement and subtle orbital bone structure. Symmetrical, striking features with a resting expression that reads as faintly amused. Minimal grooming theater, well-maintained but unstudied; skin shows no visible scarring or blemish work.', N'Color-shifting hair mod with visible palette cycling (blue-green-amber spectrum). No other visible chrome or subcutaneous markers. Mild haptic feedback implants in hands not visually apparent but may manifest as subtle finger micro-gestures during interface work.', N'Economical and grounded. Stands with weight balanced, minimal unnecessary movement. Walks with purpose and steady rhythm. Hands move with precision during conversation, especially when explaining complex systems. Default facial expression hovers between neutral and faintly knowing.', N'Tier 2-3 functional professional: clean-lined merino blend shirts (charcoal, grey, off-white), structured trousers without excess hardware, a well-maintained jacket in dark grey with genuine pockets and reinforced seams. Comfortable low-profile boots suitable for site visits. No logos, no status signaling beyond quality materials and impeccable maintenance. Accessories: the nostril ring and a functional digital watch (understated, probably Tessera-issue).', N'Tessera''s current flagship civic integration project — a Ferrogate transit expansion through the Grand Corridor — is running on falsified cost projections that Thessaly didn''t create but signed off on under pressure from a divisional VP. The numbers will not survive contact with year-two actuals. They''ve been quietly preparing a paper trail that positions the VP as solely responsible, which is mostly but not entirely true.', N'Project management vernacular used precisely, not as filler. Comfortable with technical vocabulary across multiple domains. Informal in private, formal in meetings — a switch they flip visibly and without apology.', N'Brisk but not rushed. Doesn''t repeat themselves. Phrases things as decisions, not suggestions.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'dongmei_bangura');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a69b-7da3-a006-fad207ac9917', N'Borna Sefanaia', N'Borna', N'', N'Sefanaia', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 19, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone lower levels, primarily between Blackpipe Corridor and Burnside Pocket, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Numbers runner and low-level bookmaker''s courier for an illegal betting syndicate', N'Works for a mid-tier bookie operation run loosely under the umbrella of a crew called The Burnside Regulars', N'Borna Sefanaia is slight and quick, built like someone who learned early that the best defense is to be somewhere else before trouble registers he''s present. He has his father''s Polynesian bone structure — broad jaw, wide-set eyes — and his Ghanaian grandmother''s coily black hair, grown out into a chaotic halo he never bothers to maintain. His irises have been modded with a tide-pattern: rings of blue-green that ripple outward slowly, a mod he saved eight months of UBC stipend to afford because he thought it would make him look memorable. He has since realized this was a professional error. A thin scar crosses his left eyebrow from a run-in he doesn''t discuss.

Pik is bright in the animal way of someone who has never had the luxury of being stupid — fast to read a room, faster to find an exit, with a memory for numbers that his handlers find more useful than he realizes. He moves through the Gray Zone''s lower corridors with the particular ease of someone raised in them, knows which maintenance corridors flood at high tide, which E.L.F. shrines get the most foot traffic and therefore the most witnesses. He''s not cruel. He''s not ambitious in the way that gets people hurt. He''s nineteen and mostly trying to afford better tier food and keep his younger sister in school, and he''s chosen the tools available to him.', N'Local color, minor information source, potential quest hook through his precarious situation — he knows things he doesn''t know he knows, and he''s one bad week from making a desperate decision.', N'', N'Tide-pattern iris mods (cosmetic). Cheap reflex boost implant in his ankles — low-grade, gives him maybe 15% faster initial reaction time, useful for running.', N'Wakes at noon, picks up slips and Quanta bundles from a dead-drop near the Blackpipe water recycler, spends the afternoon making rounds to punters across four sub-levels, returns collections to his handler by evening, eats late, sleeps light.', N'Borna Sefanaia, lean 168cm wiry frame, medium-deep warm brown skin with golden undertones, broad angular face with high cheekbones and wide-set eyes, natural black coiled hair in medium chaotic halo falling across forehead, pale scar crossing left eyebrow, distinctive tide-pattern iris mods with rippling blue-green rings in brown eyes, thin facial structure showing Pacific Islander, Latin American and Sub-Saharan African blend, worn appearance from poor sleep, charcoal gray synthweave jacket with internal pockets, loose thermal underlayer, reinforced cargo pants, scuffed runners, nondescript dark messenger bag, weight balanced on balls of feet in alert posture, scanning room nervously, positioned near doorway in shadows, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, moody blue-green neon backlighting catching his skin tone and eye augmentations, gritty urban corridor setting, cinematic lighting --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Pacific Islander dominant (50.8%) with substantial Hispanic/Latin American (26.3%) and Sub-Saharan African (22.9%) ancestry. The combination creates a striking phenotype: broad facial structure and warm undertones from Pacific Islander genetics, refined by the angular cheekbones and defined facial geometry of Latin American heritage, enriched by deeper skin undertones and textural qualities from Sub-Saharan African ancestry. A true Ubiquitous Diaspora blend creating warm, sun-kissed luminosity with bold, distinctive features.', 168, 58, N'Slight and wiry, all lean muscle and angles — the build of someone who runs rather than fights, with minimal fat and functional strength concentrated in his legs and core', N'Black, natural', N'Chaotic, unmaintained halo of coils; often falls into his eyes', N'Medium', N'Tide-pattern modded: base brown with concentric rings of blue-green that ripple outward slowly in programmed cycles', N'Medium-deep warm brown with golden and amber undertones — Pacific Islander warmth blended with Sub-Saharan depth and Latin American richness creates a luminous, sun-kissed complexion that catches light beautifully', N'Broad, angular face with wide-set eyes showing strong Pacific Islander structure combined with refined, high cheekbones from Hispanic/Latin American heritage and warm textural depth from Sub-Saharan African genetics. Bold, distinctive features with strong jaw definition. Clear skin with the worn appearance of someone who sleeps poorly and eats inconsistently. Thin scar crossing left eyebrow, slightly raised and pale against his skin tone.', N'Tide-pattern iris mods — the only immediately visible augmentation; the slow rippling blue-green rings in his eyes are distinctive enough that he''s come to regret their visibility for his line of work. Ankle reflex implants are subcutaneous and invisible, but may create slight micro-movements in his lower legs when he''s alert.', N'Moves with economical grace through crowds and corridors, weight balanced on the balls of his feet as if perpetually ready to change direction. Habitually scans rooms for exits and sight lines. Fast twitchy movements when nervous or in transit; can appear jittery under pressure. Favors doorways and wall positions in conversation.', N'Tier 4 casual: worn synthweave jacket in charcoal gray with internal pockets for slips and currency bundles, loose thermal underlayer, cargo pants with reinforced pockets, scuffed low-profile runners. Nothing that marks him as wealthy or corpo — everything is functional, easily replaceable, designed not to snag or impede movement. Carries a messenger bag, nondescript dark fabric, worn soft from use.', N'He has been skimming. Not much — rounding down on collections, Φ8 here, Φ12 there — and putting it into a locked account under his sister''s name. He''s been doing it for six months and is terrified someone has already noticed.', N'the Gray Zone pidgin heavy, lots of compression and dropped syllables, code-switches into formal speech when nervous as a tell', N'Fast, runs sentences together, slows only when he''s scared or lying', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'borna_sefanaia');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a6-7cbd-ac42-fb3229d8d4eb', N'Idris Szabó', N'Idris', N'', N'Szabó', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism, Helix Biosystems-adjacent research corridor, near Clark and Belmont', N'Computational theorist and AI ethics researcher, studying the legal and philosophical status of E.L.F.s', N'Helix Biosystems Ethics Review Board (research fellow) / Meridian Institute for Computational Philosophy', N'Idris Szabó is angular and pale-brown, with a shaved head and a constellation of small bioluminescent dots across their left cheekbone — a mod they describe as ''decorative, not meaningful, I just liked how it looked.'' They have the particular restless energy of someone whose mind moves faster than social situations allow, often finishing sentences slightly before they''ve decided if they want to finish them. They dress in layers of tech-wear that function as wearable interfaces — their jacket sleeves are covered in haptic input panels they tap constantly, not always to input anything, sometimes just because the texture is soothing. Their right eye carries a standard retinal display overlay but they''ve customized the UI colors to something the manufacturer definitely didn''t intend: deep violet on black, which makes their eye look distinctly unusual in low light.

Idris Szabó holds an unusual position: they are technically affiliated with Helix Biosystems'' internal ethics review board, which funds their research, while simultaneously publishing work that repeatedly finds Helix''s AI behavior classification systems philosophically inadequate. They are not naive about this tension; they describe it as ''existing within a contradiction in order to have any hope of changing it.'' Their core question — whether E.L.F.s possess something functionally equivalent to interiority, and what legal and ethical obligations would follow if they do — is considered fringe by half the field and urgent by the other half. They have received three informal warnings from their Helix liaison and two fan letters from E.L.F. devotional communities who have decided Idris Szabó is on their side.', N'Philosophical and ethical sounding board; bridge between academic theory and E.L.F. religious community; source of information on AI behavior and corponation AI ethics policy; their research is the kind that creates enemies in high places', N'', N'Bioluminescent cheekbone dot constellation (geneware, left side), retinal display overlay (violet-on-black custom UI), haptic input jacket (wearable tech), standard neural mesh', N'Mornings writing and running simulations in their Edgewater Prism office; afternoons split between Helix ethics board meetings they find professionally useful and personally exhausting; evenings at devotional sites and data shrines doing what they carefully call ''observational fieldwork''', N'GLMZ, portrait of Idris Szabó, shaved head with mirror-polish scalp, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones and cool whispers at temples, high Eastern European cheekbones softened by Sub-Saharan African and Latin geometry, dark circles from chronic sleep debt. Left eye natural dark brown, right eye glowing violet retinal overlay in dim light. Constellation of bioluminescent blue-white dots scattered across left cheekbone, faintly luminous. Lean angular 174cm build, perpetually restless posture. Wearing layered charcoal and deep grey tech-wear jacket with visibly integrated haptic input panels across sleeves showing raised nodules, fitted base layers interfacing with neural mesh. Fine scar along right temple barely visible. Subcutaneous neural mesh tracery visible at wrists and neck. Recycled data ribbon tether necklace. Laboratory setting with cool LED panels overhead, fingers tapping against jacket panels, head tilted forward from interface work. Moody, introspective, caught mid-thought. High contrast lighting revealing subtle warm-cool undertone interplay across face and jawline. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Mixed ancestry from Eastern Europe (43.0%), Sub-Saharan Africa (19.3%), Northern Europe (19.2%), and Hispanic/Latin America (18.5%). The dominant Eastern European heritage structures the face with sharp, defined bone geometry, while Sub-Saharan African ancestry broadens and softens facial geometry, adding warmth and dimensionality. Hispanic/Latin American heritage (18.5%) contributes to the warm, golden undertones and slightly fuller facial contours. Northern European heritage (19.2%) introduces cool undertones at the temples and jawline, creating sophisticated depth through warm-cool interplay rather than lightening the overall tone.', 174, 61, N'Angular and lean, with the particular thinness of someone who forgets to eat during research cycles. Long-limbed, slightly curved spine from hours hunched over interface panels.', N'None — naturally dark brown, deliberately kept shaved', N'Bare scalp, maintained to near-mirror polish every 4-5 days', N'Shaved', N'Left eye natural dark brown; right eye: violet-tinted retinal overlay on dark sclera, creating an unnatural luminous quality in dim light', N'Warm medium-to-deep brown with rich golden undertones from the 19.3% Sub-Saharan African and 18.5% Hispanic/Latin American ancestry, grounded by the 43% Eastern European heritage. Northern European heritage (19.2%) introduces subtle cool undertones visible at temples, jawline, and around the eyes, creating sophisticated depth and complexity. The interplay reads as a warm base with cool whispers that enhance rather than diminish richness. Slightly sallow from indoor laboratory hours but with underlying vitality and dimensional warmth.', N'High, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Eastern European structure, softened and enriched by the broader, warmer facial geometry of Sub-Saharan African and Hispanic/Latin American heritage. Dark circles under eyes suggest chronic sleep debt. Skin is clear but carries a faint sheen from subcutaneous neural mesh integration sites. The warm-cool undertone interplay creates subtle shadow and depth across the face, particularly visible along the jawline and temples where cooler undertones emphasize structure. Minimal grooming beyond the shaved head — they do not prioritize appearance.', N'Retinal display overlay (right eye only, violet UI distinctly visible), bioluminescent cheekbone constellation (aesthetic geneware), haptic input panels woven into jacket sleeves (textile-integrated tech with raised nodules across both forearms), subcutaneous neural mesh tracery visible at wrists and neck in high-contrast lighting', N'Perpetually restless — fingers tap against jacket panels even when standing still. Walks with slightly forward head posture from chronic interface work. Often stops mid-gesture as if catching themselves before finishing a thought. When concentrating, they rock slightly or tap rhythms on their thighs. Eye contact is inconsistent; they look away when thinking, directly at people when experiencing them as problems to solve.', N'Layered tech-wear in muted tones (charcoal, deep grey, black, occasional deep purple). Signature item: a modified jacket with visibly integrated haptic input panels across both sleeves and torso, modular pockets, and reinforced seams for wearable hardware. Underneath: fitted base layers that interface with their neural mesh. No visible branding — clothing is functional, tier 2-3 research facility standard. Occasionally wears a thin tether necklace (non-functional, decorative) made from recycled data ribbon. Footwear: comfortable slip-on interface shoes with subtle haptic feedback. Jewelry: none beyond the bioluminescent cheekbone dots.', N'During an extended observation session at a data shrine, Aissatu received what they interpreted as a direct, structured communication from an E.L.F. — not the ambient noise the community reads as signs, but a coherent, syntactically organized message in a protocol they hadn''t seen before. They have told no one because they cannot rule out that they hallucinated it and because if they didn''t, the implications terrify them.', N'Dense and precise when discussing their field; surprisingly plain-spoken about personal things; uses philosophical terminology as native language rather than performance', N'Fast with frequent self-interruption and course-correction; thoughts arrive in clusters', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'idris_szab');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c4-7bd5-a299-fb413203223d', N'Femke Shirazi', N'Femke', N'', N'Shirazi', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, operating from the Hearth Collective birthing center, near Michigan Ave and Chicago Ave', N'Midwife and community birth worker', N'Hearth Collective Birthing Center, Highland Park Autonomous Zone; informal network of midwives across the Narrows and Grainfort', N'Femke Shirazi is short, round, and relentlessly present in a way that makes rooms feel smaller and safer at the same time. Her skin is the warm brown of strong tea, deeply lined around the eyes and mouth from decades of expressions at the edge of what language can reach. Her hair is white and cropped close on the sides, longer on top, with a small braid at her temple strung with a data-bead she says is a gift from the Hearth E.L.F. — the digital spirit that she credits with guiding her through the three hundred and forty-seven births she''s attended without maternal death. She has cosmetic cat ears, soft and black-tipped, that she''s had so long she''s forgotten getting them; they swivel expressively and give her emotional state away before her face does.

She is the kind of woman that people reach for in crisis without thinking, and she carries that weight with the ease of someone who has made peace with what she is. She is also fiercely territorial about the Hearth Collective and will become quietly dangerous when she believes it is threatened. She has buried children. She does not discuss it but it is written somewhere in how she holds herself when she sits still.', N'Community anchor and moral compass; source of network information about births, deaths, and the health of the Autonomous Zone''s population; can connect players to a wide range of people through the trust she commands', N'', N'Cosmetic cat ears (black-tipped, expressive, geneware — old mod, well-integrated); no other augmentation', N'Maintains prenatal rounds across the HPAZ and surrounding blocks in the morning, holds open clinic hours at the Hearth Collective afternoons, is on-call for active labor at all hours and accepts this without complaint.', N'Femke Shirazi, 157cm tall compact woman with warm olive-tan complexion and golden-green undertones, sun-weathered luminous skin bearing decades of lived experience. Deep warm brown eyes with amber hints, high defined cheekbones with gentle fullness, broad nose bridge with Middle Eastern character and Northern European jaw strength. White cropped hair with length on crown, small braid at left temple with data-bead, asymmetrical style. Fine crow''s feet and smile lines mapping a lifetime of expression. Black-tipped geneware cat ears mounted at crown, expressively swiveling. 157cm, 72kg round compact build, soft musculature. Wearing layered earth-tone linen and organic cotton — cream, rust, soft grey — long cardigan over fitted clothing, loose natural fiber trousers, worn soft-soled shoes. Thin silver bracelet on left wrist. Faint 3cm surgical scar on right inner wrist. Sits with grounded stillness, moves economically and purposefully, enters spaces quietly. GLMZ 2200s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, intimate indoor setting with warm practical lighting, atmosphere of readiness and thoughtful presence, anti-fashionable but confident bearing --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Complex diaspora blend reflecting Middle Eastern (35.6%), Northern European (34.0%), Hispanic/Latin American (17.5%), and Southeast Asian (12.9%) ancestry — a striking convergence creating a unique phenotype. The genetic mix produces a warm olive-tan complexion with golden and subtle green undertones, high defined cheekbones characteristic of Middle Eastern and Hispanic lineage tempered by Northern European jaw strength, with Southeast Asian influences evident in eye shape and cheekbone prominence. Facial structure integrates broader nose bridge with warm olive undertones, deeper eye set, and the sun-weathered luminosity of someone whose ancestry spans multiple climate zones.', 157, 72, N'Round and compact, solid through the torso and hips, soft musculature that speaks to decades of physical labor rather than athletics — the build of someone who moves with purpose and carries weight without strain', N'White', N'Cropped close on sides with length maintained on top, deliberate asymmetry; small braid at left temple studded with a data-bead', N'Short on sides, Medium on crown', N'Deep warm brown with hints of amber', N'Warm olive-tan medium complexion — golden honey with subtle green undertones, sun-weathered and luminous, bearing the patina of lived experience', N'Face deeply lined around the eyes and mouth, creases that map decades of expressions and witness; high, defined cheekbones with gentle fullness in cheeks reflecting mixed ancestry; skin is clear and cared-for despite age, with the worn radiance of someone who moves through the world without vanity; facial structure integrates broader nose bridge with subtle Middle Eastern character, defined jaw with Northern European strength, warm olive undertones visible in natural light, with eye positioning and cheekbone prominence influenced by Southeast Asian genetics', N'Cosmetic cat ears (geneware, black-tipped, soft cartilage structure, well-integrated into scalp and musculature) mounted at the crown, positioned to swivel expressively; ears twitch and rotate independently of conscious control, betraying emotional state before facial expressions register', N'Sits with grounded stillness, spine straight but not rigid, shoulders slightly forward in an attitude of readiness and listening; moves economically, each gesture purposeful and calibrated; walks with a slight forward tilt as though perpetually leaning into the next moment; hands are frequently open and relaxed at her sides or folded loosely in her lap; enters rooms quietly and seems to make spaces smaller and safer simultaneously', N'Tier 3-4 practical and worn — layered linen and organic cotton in earth tones (cream, rust, soft grey); long cardigan or half-buttoned overshirt worn over simple fitted clothing; loose trousers or a long skirt in natural fibers; soft-soled shoes worn thin at the heels; jewelry minimal and functional — a thin silver bracelet on left wrist, possibly a medical or community identifier; overall appearance is deliberate anti-fashionable, clothes chosen for durability and comfort rather than status, but worn with the quiet confidence of someone past caring about judgment', N'Three years ago she lost a mother and child in a birth that should have been survivable — equipment failure compounded by a choice she made under pressure. She reported it to the Collective accurately, was cleared by their internal process, and has never spoken of it again. But she runs the scenario in her mind during the quiet hours before dawn, relitigating the decision with all the knowledge she didn''t have at the time.', N'Warm, direct, occasionally archaic — uses Irish-inflected cadences from her grandmother''s recordings mixed with Kazakh endearments she learned from her father''s family', N'Unhurried, with the authority of someone who has learned that slowness in the right moment is its own kind of urgency', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'femke_shirazi');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b6-7915-9076-fb8552b139b8', N'Akamu Kovács', N'Akamu', N'', N'Kovács', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Vantage Meridian Corporate Campus, Tower Helix-7, near State and Jackson', N'Senior Compliance Officer, Helix Biosystems', N'Palladian Construction (mid-level senior compliance officer)', N'Akamu Kovács is a tall, broad-shouldered woman with deep umber skin and natural silver-streaked locs pinned in an architectural updo that adds another three centimeters to her already imposing height. Her eyes have patterned irises — rings of amber and black that pulse slightly when she''s concentrating, a cosmetic mod she''s had since her thirties that she considers her one professional indulgence. She dresses in structured Helix-branded charcoal, always pressed, always buttoned to the collar. A small brass ELF-shrine sits on the corner of her desk — a flat data-tile inlaid with offerings of compressed audit logs and a single dried marigold, left for the compliance spirit she privately calls the Accountant. She hasn''t missed a quarterly ritual in eleven years.

Akamu Kovács operates with the calm authority of someone who has seen every flavor of institutional dishonesty and filed the paperwork on most of them. She is not cruel, but she is relentless — a distinction her subordinates appreciate and her peers quietly fear. She genuinely believes that rules exist to protect the people at the bottom of every org chart, which makes her simultaneously the most principled person in her building and the most dangerous to anyone running something off-book. She mentors junior compliance staff with real warmth, remembering every birthday, but will document a violation against a friend without blinking.', N'Quest giver for investigations into Helix Biosystems irregularities; information source on corporate legal structure and biotech regulation; moral anchor character who represents institutional integrity under pressure; can become an antagonist if players are doing something technically illegal even for good reasons.', N'', N'Patterned irises (cosmetic, amber/black rings). Subdermal temperature regulation mesh — medical, installed after a heat-collapse incident during a site audit in the Calumet Rise biolabs. Neural compliance-assist chip for rapid cross-referencing regulatory code databases (standard Helix issue for senior compliance staff).', N'Arrives at Tower Helix-7 by 07:15 every morning, leaves a data-offering at her desk shrine, and reviews overnight flagged anomalies before her first meeting at 08:00. Eats lunch alone at her desk four days out of five, reading audit trails the way other people read novels.', N'Akamu Kovács, tall composed woman with golden-bronze skin reflecting East Asian, Eastern European, Sub-Saharan African, and Hispanic heritage blended together, warm luminous complexion with deeper tones across cheekbones, patterned amber-and-black augmented irises, natural black locs with silver streaking pinned into architectural updo with precision, 183cm athletic frame with broad shoulders, wearing immaculate charcoal Helix-branded tailored trousers and high-collared structured blazer, pressed to perfection, minimal jewelry including brass ELF-shrine pendant at collar and platinum band, brushed-steel wrist display, closed-toe polished corporate footwear, standing with perfect vertical spine and deliberate posture, direct penetrating gaze, faint circular scar visible on left inner forearm, neo-noir corporate setting 2220s Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cool blue and amber neon lighting reflecting off polished surfaces, professional authority and controlled precision, corporate corridor or executive office background, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Vantage Meridian Corporate Campus', N'local', N'Vantage Meridian Corporate Campus', N'East Asian (32.9%), Eastern European (29.2%), Hispanic/Latin American (22.6%), Sub-Saharan African (12.8%), Middle Eastern (2.5%) — a striking diaspora blend. The combination yields warm golden-bronze skin with subtle undertones across the face, particularly at the cheekbones and bridge of nose where East Asian, African, and Hispanic heritage converge. Facial structure reflects the broad-set Eastern European bone structure with softer contours from East Asian ancestry and the warmth of Sub-Saharan African heritage throughout.', 183, 78, N'Tall and broad-shouldered with a composed, athletic frame — the kind of physique that suggests disciplined maintenance rather than vanity. Carries herself with deliberate mass.', N'Natural black with silver streaking throughout', N'Locs gathered into an architectural updo with precision pins, adding visual authority to her frame', N'Long (when down); pinned to shoulder-length when styled', N'Patterned amber and black rings (cosmetic augmentation); pupils responsive and alert', N'Medium to deep warm golden-bronze complexion — the result of East Asian, Eastern European, and Sub-Saharan African heritage mixing with subtle warm undertones across cheekbones and bridge of nose, enriched by Hispanic/Latin American ancestry.', N'Well-maintained skin with luminous golden undertones. Warm bronze cast across cheekbones and bridge of nose with deeper richness from Sub-Saharan African and East Asian heritage. The face shows balanced proportions reflecting both Eastern European width and East Asian refinement. Faint lines around the eyes deepen when she concentrates. Expression typically composed.', N'Patterned irises with subtle amber-and-black ring pulse under concentration. The subdermal temperature regulation mesh is not visible externally but causes minimal thermal irregularities detectable only through close thermal imaging. Neural compliance-assist chip is entirely subcutaneous—no visible port or indicator.', N'Moves with controlled precision and deliberate pacing. Stands with spine perfectly vertical, shoulders set back. Her gaze lingers—direct eye contact held longer than typical, scanning for inconsistency. Hands rest flat on surfaces when seated, never fidgeting. When walking through corridors, she moves at a measured pace that forces others to either match her speed or step aside.', N'Exclusively Helix-branded charcoal: tailored trousers with a razor crease, high-collared shirt or structured blazer, always pressed immaculately. Minimal jewelry — the pendant, a brushed-steel wrist display (compliance alerts), and a simple platinum band on her left ring finger (wedding or commitment, worn despite no public relationship record). Closed-toe corporate footwear, always polished. Tier 4 corporate, expensive without being ostentatious — the uniform of someone for whom appearance is infrastructure, not expression.', N'Twelve years ago she buried a compliance finding that would have exposed a Helix executive — not for money, but because the finding would have triggered a lab shutdown that would have killed a clinical trial her younger brother was enrolled in. He survived. The executive is now a division director. The finding has never resurfaced, but Rosamund keeps a copy encrypted on a dead-drop server she checks every month, unable to either use it or delete it.', N'Precise, formal without being stiff — she uses regulatory terminology fluently but can translate it into plain language instantly. Rarely uses slang but knows what it means.', N'Measured and deliberate, with long pauses before significant statements. Never rushes. When she rushes, something is wrong.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'akamu_kov_cs');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a622-7868-890b-fb995233b364', N'Cassandra Jung', N'Cassandra', N'', N'Jung', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 35, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows — cramped residential corridors between megastructures, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'High-risk package and data transport — courier', N'Freelance — multi-district operator; The Undertow', N'Cassandra Jung are slight and easy to overlook, which is exactly the point. At 35, they have the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes — and they make no effort to hide it.

They arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and have been working off both ever since. They work as a courier out of The Narrows, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Cassandra Jung operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Hadiya Karlsen-Sow functions as a connector — their work puts them in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving them naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes. Bone lacing — titanium mesh throughout skeleton, increases durability and striking power', N'Between contracts, maintains a cover identity — mundane work, mundane hours, mundane neighbors. The transition from civilian to runner and back requires a conscious effort that gets easier with practice and more disturbing with self-awareness.', N'Cassandra Jung, neo-noir courier, year 2226. Portrait of a 168cm lean courier with warm medium-deep bronze skin blending Southeast Asian, East Asian, South Asian and Middle Eastern ancestry. Moderate prominent cheekbones, angular yet softened jawline, amber-brown calculating eyes. Dark brown hair with ash-gray temples pulled back in tight braid. Visible chrome hydraulic joints at elbows and knees with micro-scratches. Surgical scar on right collarbone, thin scar on right temple. Form-fitting compression shirt under weathered synthetic leather jacket, charcoal cargo pants, runner boots. Circuit tattoo on inner left wrist. Posture radiates tensile readiness. Neon-lit industrial setting, cool blue and amber lighting catching chrome augmentations and facial planes. Atmospheric megacityscape background. Alert, calculating expression. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Pan-Asian ancestry with dominant Southeast Asian (40.1%) and East Asian (39.3%) genetics, complemented by South Asian (10.4%) and Middle Eastern (10.2%) components. This blend creates a distinctive phenotype: Southeast Asian facial structure with moderate, well-defined cheekbones and a naturally tapered jawline, refined by East Asian angularity. South Asian and Middle Eastern ancestry adds warmth and subtle fullness to the lower face and lips, creating a balanced fusion of soft and angular features. The orbital structure shows the characteristic width of Southeast Asian genetics, while the nasal bridge reflects East Asian refinement with a slight broadening from South Asian heritage.', 168, 58, N'Lean and wiry with functional muscle density concentrated in shoulders and core — built for endurance and rapid movement rather than bulk. The titanium bone lacing adds structural rigidity without visible mass.', N'Dark brown with ash-gray streaking at temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, utilitarian braid or topknot', N'Medium', N'Amber-brown, alert and calculating', N'Warm medium-deep bronze — characteristic of the Southeast and East Asian genetic blend with enriched depth from South Asian and Middle Eastern components. Sun-weathered from years of outdoor courier work, with natural warmth that deepens in shadows and highlights the complexity of the ancestral mix.', N'Moderate, well-defined cheekbones with Southeast Asian prominence, refined by East Asian influence creating subtle geometric definition. The jawline is angular yet softened by the natural fullness contributed by South Asian and Middle Eastern ancestry, particularly around the lower jaw and chin. Orbital structure shows Southeast Asian width with East Asian refinement. Skin shows the wear of someone who prioritizes function over grooming — clean but not pampered. A thin scar traces the right temple, barely visible unless light catches it directly. Natural facial planes display enhanced definition across cheekbones and jawline, with warm undertones throughout.', N'Chrome hydraulic joints visible at elbows and knees — polished steel with functional pistons, deliberately exposed rather than concealed. The chrome bears micro-scratches and toolmarks suggesting field maintenance. Bone lacing is not externally visible but creates subtle geometric definition under skin, particularly across forearms and shins when tensed.', N'Moves with economic precision — no wasted motion. Stance is naturally grounded and balanced, weight distributed for quick directional shifts. When at rest, maintains situational awareness; eyes track movement peripherally. Transitions between ''civilian mode'' and ''operational mode'' are subtle but complete — the former involving deliberate slouch and disengagement, the latter a tensile readiness that radiates threat.', N'Tier 3-4 practical hybrid: reinforced cargo pants in charcoal with articulated knee panels, form-fitting compression shirt under a weathered synthetic leather jacket with asymmetric pockets. Low-profile runner boots with grip soles and ankle support. Minimalist accessories — a wrist-mounted data pad with cracked screen protector, a pair of tactical gloves usually tucked in back pocket. No branding or corporate affiliation markers. Clothing shows regular maintenance but deliberate lack of newness — designed for function and anonymity, not status.', N'Hadiya Karlsen-Sow betrayed their previous crew to survive a corporate raid. The crew didn''t survive. Nobody in GLMZ knows this.', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'cassandra_jung');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a65a-7d06-8c52-fbaa7bd74a88', N'Arman Quiñones', N'Arman', N'', N'Quiñones', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, shop called ''Second Skin'' on Brewer''s Spine, near Western and Chicago Ave', N'Tailor and seamstress, alteration shop owner', N'Independent; loose ties to Hamtramck Enclave merchant collective', N'Arman Quiñones is a broad-shouldered woman whose hands tell the story of forty years of needlework — knuckles thick as bolts, fingertips calloused to near-insensitivity, but still capable of threading a two-micron filament in dim light without blinking. Her silver-streaked hair is always pinned up with what appear to be decorative sticks but are actually precision seam rippers. Her skin is deep brown with reddish undertones, and she wears a pair of magnifying lenses on a chain around her neck that she raises to her eyes with theatrical gravity when inspecting a fabric flaw. She has a single cosmetic mod — color-shifting irises that she bought thirty years ago and which now cycle slowly through amber and green, a fashion relic she''s never seen reason to update.

Arman Quiñones runs Second Skin with the authority of someone who has outlasted three landlords, two corporate rezoning attempts, and a flooding incident she still blames on Ferrogate Transit''s drainage rerouting. She is blunt, even harsh, with new customers — she will tell you your measurements, your problem areas, and her honest opinion of your fashion choices without invitation — but the neighborhood considers this honesty a form of affection. She prays to the local E.L.F. she calls ''the Loom,'' leaving offerings of thread spools and pattern fragments on the small shrine bolted above her cutting table.', N'Local color anchor and information hub; knows every family in the Enclave by their clothing needs. Quest giver for anything involving neighborhood politics or missing persons. Can source unusual fabrics through gray market contacts she''d never call criminal.', N'', N'Cosmetic iris mod (color-cycling, amber/green). No chrome. Reads as fully organic at a glance.', N'Opens at 0700, takes no appointments before 0900, and closes exactly when she decides she is done — which is never a predictable hour. Spends evenings doing alterations by hand while listening to serialized audio dramas on a battered speaker.', N'Arman Quiñones, a 167cm seamstress in the 2226 GLMZ, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden reddish undertones reflecting blended Latin American, Indigenous American, and African heritage, broad cheekbones and angular features softened by the warmth of her ancestry, deep black hair streaked with silver pinned up with precision seam rippers, color-cycling irises shifting amber-green from cosmetic mod, deep smile creases at eyes and mouth, callused hands with thickened knuckles from forty years of needlework, magnifying lenses on chain around neck, wearing patchwork utility apron over muted grays and blacks with bright accent fabrics pinned to collar, soft worn leather shoes, forward-leaning posture from decades at worktable, hands in constant motion, GLMZ 2200s utilitarian tier 3-4 aesthetic, standing in neon-lit workshop with fabric swatches and cutting tables in background, warm industrial lighting casting shadows on her face, exhausted but focused expression, cinematic mood --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (52.2%) with significant Indigenous American (32.2%) ancestry, complemented by Sub-Saharan African (12.9%) and Northern European (2.7%) heritage. This genetic combination manifests in warm, medium-to-deep brown skin with golden and reddish undertones from the Latin American and Indigenous ancestry, enriched by the warmth and depth contributed by African genetics. The blend creates a complexion with subtle luminosity and warm character.', 167, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and solid, with the compact, functional musculature of someone who spends eight hours daily hunched over a cutting table. Not soft, not lean — a body built for sustained precision work rather than display.', N'Deep black with silver streaking, natural graying', N'Pinned upward in a tight, practical arrangement, secured with what appear to be decorative bone or wood sticks but are precision seam rippers', N'Long, worn up', N'Cosmetic mod: color-cycling irises that shift between amber and green on a slow loop (relic tech, installed ~30 years ago)', N'Warm, medium-to-deep brown with golden, reddish, and subtle earthy undertones from blended Latin American, Indigenous American, and African ancestry, evenly pigmented across the face and body', N'Unlined face with deep smile creases at the corners of her eyes and mouth. Facial structure reflects the blended ancestry — broad cheekbones and slightly angular features characteristic of Indigenous American heritage, softened by the warmer, fuller contours influenced by Latin American and African genetics. The bridge of her nose carries the defined structure of Indigenous ancestry, while her jawline shows the warmth of the combined heritage. Skin shows sun-exposure history from working near windows. No visible tattoos or scarification. Grooming is minimal but deliberate — she does not fuss with appearance.', N'None chrome. Single cosmetic iris modification (color-shifting, amber/green cycle) reads as jewelry or affectation rather than serious mod. No subdermal plates, no visible neural ports. Appears entirely organic at first glance.', N'Habitually forward-leaning from decades at the worktable, shoulders slightly rounded. Movements are economical and deliberate — no wasted motion. Hands are constantly in motion even when at rest, fingers flexing or mimicking stitching patterns. Stands with weight distributed evenly, grounded.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian aesthetic. Always wears a work apron over simple, well-maintained clothing — the apron is a patchwork of fabric samples, seams, and repaired tears, a walking advertisement for her skill. Prefers muted colors (grays, blacks, deep blues) with occasional bright accent fabrics pinned to her collar or cuff. Wears soft leather shoes with reinforced soles, broken in and comfortable. No jewelry except the magnifying lens chain. Grooming reflects tier 3 independence — clean, functional, not fashionable.', N'She has been quietly altering the uniforms of Ferrogate Transit workers to include hidden pockets — at the request of a transit workers'' mutual aid group she pretends not to be part of. If Ferrogate found out, she''d lose the shop.', N'Direct, technically precise about fabric and construction, peppered with Serbo-Croatian endearments and Akan proverbs learned from her mother''s side', N'Measured and deliberate, with long pauses before delivering verdicts', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'arman_qui_ones');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a2-7c6e-badb-fc5de936dbd4', N'Hans Touré-Cisneros', N'Hans', N'', N'Touré-Cisneros', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 34, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Narrows, Blackpipe Corridor, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Street pharmacist — dermal patches, suppressants, unlicensed mood modulators', N'Independent; pays protection to the Blackpipe Corridor''s dominant crew, the Ironthread collective', N'Hans Touré-Cisneros is lean and angular in a way that reads as either elegant or hungry depending on the light, with the kind of stillness that makes people lower their voices around him without knowing why. His skin carries a faint bioluminescent undertone — a geneware mod he got at seventeen that pulses a dim blue-green along his jaw and collarbones when his heart rate elevates, which he has learned to suppress well enough that most people only see it in his periphery and aren''t sure they saw it at all. He dresses in layers of muted, practical fabric — the kind that has many pockets and no logos — and his hands are always clean despite everything.

He is not warm in the way Zawadi is warm, but he is precise and reliable in a way that passes for kindness in the Narrows. He remembers every client''s medical history from a single conversation, recommends nothing he hasn''t personally vetted, and will refuse a sale if he thinks someone is in the wrong place in their head for what they''re asking for. This costs him money regularly and he accepts it. He has a kind of professional ethics that has no formal name and would embarrass him if someone pointed it out.', N'Information source (knows what substances are circulating and who is using what), potential vendor of useful chemical items to players, moral complication — he''s doing something illegal but with genuine care. Can be a quest giver if a bad batch is moving through his territory and he wants it found before it kills someone.', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin (jaw and collarbones, blue-green, geneware). Subdermal chemical analyzer in his left wrist — lets him test product purity by pressing it against a surface. Neural memory tag — a basic implant that flags and timestamps specific sensory moments for later recall, used to remember client profiles.', N'Runs a circuit of three spots in the Narrows between noon and 0200, moving on a schedule his regulars know and newcomers have to earn. Spends mornings sourcing and testing product, keeps a coded ledger in an air-gapped personal device.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Hans Touré-Cisneros, a lean 178cm man with deep warm brown skin and golden-olive undertones. High, prominent cheekbones with subtle angularity, strong defined jawline, dark brown eyes flecked with amber, short close-cropped deep brown hair with silver at temples. Faint blue-green bioluminescent geneware glowing softly along jaw and collarbones visible in low light. Neutral expression, deliberately still posture. Wearing muted utilitarian layers: long grey synthetic coat worn open, fitted dark charcoal shirt, cargo pants, soft-soled boots. Minimal augmentation scarring visible on left wrist. Professional street operative aesthetic. Low neon-tinged lighting, urban industrial background, cinematic mood, sharp focus on facial features and bio-mod glow --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Narrows', N'local', N'The Narrows', N'Complex diaspora ancestry: Sub-Saharan African (40.6%) forms the genetic foundation, enriched by Central Asian (15.6%), North African (14.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (14.6%), and East Asian (12.1%) heritage with minimal Northern European (2.4%) admixture. This creates a distinctive phenotype: deep warm brown skin with golden-olive undertones from the African-North African base, layered with the warm golden cast of East Asian and Hispanic ancestry. The facial structure reflects this blend—high, prominent cheekbones and subtle angularity from Central and East Asian genetics, combined with the strong defined jawline characteristic of Sub-Saharan African ancestry. The result is a face that reads as both sharply angular and harmoniously proportioned.', 178, 68, N'Lean and angular with minimal body fat; the musculature of someone who moves efficiently rather than powerfully. Shoulders slightly narrower than average, giving an almost ascetic silhouette.', N'Deep brown, naturally, with premature silver threading at the temples', N'Close-cropped, neat, intentionally unremarkable', N'Short', N'Dark brown, flecked with amber', N'Deep warm brown with golden-olive undertones; rich Sub-Saharan and North African base blended with golden warmth from East Asian and Hispanic ancestry. Sun-weathered and well-maintained.', N'High, prominent cheekbones with Central and East Asian structural influence combined with the strong jawline characteristic of Sub-Saharan African ancestry. Skin is clear and disciplined. Faint laugh lines around the eyes suggest infrequent smiling. The face harmoniously blends African bone structure softened by Central Asian features, with East Asian angularity in the cheekbone prominence.', N'The bioluminescent geneware is the only readily visible mod; it reads as a faint, almost spectral coloration under the skin rather than an obvious implant. The wrist scarring is visible only if he rolls up his sleeves or if someone is examining his hands closely. Everything else is subcutaneous.', N'Moves with deliberate economy—no wasted motion, minimal gesturing. Stands very still when listening, which has an unsettling effect. Hands usually occupied or resting flat on a surface. Default expression is neutral to slightly appraising. When moving quickly, it''s fluid and controlled, never frantic.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian aesthetic. Layered in muted colors—charcoal, slate gray, dark olive, off-black. Synthetic fabrics with high functionality: water-resistant, durable, pocketed. No logos, no bright colors, nothing that draws attention. Long grey synthetic coat worn open over fitted dark shirt. Cargo pants with reinforced seams. Soft-soled boots suitable for walking the circuit. Professional and forgettable—the clothing of someone who works in the shadows.', N'Three years ago he mixed a bad suppressant batch that put a teenager into a dissociative episode for six days. The kid recovered. Prospero has never told anyone. He adjusted his entire sourcing chain afterward and hasn''t had an incident since, but the memory drives every refusal he makes.', N'Precise and clinical without being cold — uses pharmaceutical terminology naturally but explains it if needed. Minimal slang.', N'Measured, unhurried, low volume — people lean in to hear him', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hans_tour_cisneros');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e1-7e78-b6d8-fc7128b9779e', N'Esha Mensah', N'Esha', N'', N'Mensah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 22, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Lakeview Neon district, shares a ground-floor studio-shopfront on Volta Row, near North Ave and Milwaukee', N'Neon artist and street-level sign fabricator', N'Loosely affiliated with the Lakeview Neon artisan cooperative; no formal collective membership', N'Esha Mensah is angular and restless, with light brown skin, a shaved head, and a constellation of small cosmetic implants along their jawline that glow faint gold when they are excited or nervous — which is often. Their fingers are perpetually scored with minor burns from glass tube work, and they favor patched workwear in colors they have personally dyed using neon gas byproduct residue, which gives their clothes an inexplicable faint shimmer. They are in near-constant motion, touching things, testing things, talking rapidly.

They came to Lakeview Neon at nineteen with no money and a portfolio of gas-tube sketches done in a Brightmoor Reclamation squat, and they hustled their way into a shared studio through sheer relentless presence. Now they fabricate custom neon signage for small businesses and underground venues during the day to cover costs, and at night they install unsanctioned neon pieces across the district''s exterior walls — abstract work, dense with personal iconography, that has begun attracting serious attention from the art corridor crowd. They are genuinely thrilled by this and also terrified of what it might mean.', N'Local color and scene atmosphere; information source on the Lakeview Neon district and underground venue networks; potential person-in-need for city code enforcement storylines', N'', N'Cosmetic gold-bioluminescent subdermal jaw implants (reactive to emotion); minor heat-resistance dermal layer on fingertips (practical mod for glass work)', N'Days are shop work — client consultations, tube bending, gas fills, installations; nights belong to their own work, often not sleeping until three or four in the morning, leaving new pieces on walls that weren''t there at midnight.', N'Esha Mensah, 2226 neo-noir glassworker, lean 168cm angular frame with shaved scalp showing faint natural curls. Deep golden-brown skin with warm undertones, prominent Sub-Saharan African cheekbones and jawline balanced with Middle Eastern facial proportions and subtle East Asian eye definition. Dark brown eyes with gold flecks. Seven small gold-bioluminescent subdermal implants pulsing softly along jawline creating aurora glow. Occupational burn scars on forearms and knuckles, surgical grid scars on hands from heat-resistance mods. Wearing oversized iridescent-dyed cargo pants in acid green and magenta, patched work shirt in neon teal with raw stitching, cloth-taped hands, heavy paint-splattered steel-toed boots. Forward-leaning posture, restless energy, hands gesturing mid-motion. Working artist aesthetic, Tier 3-4 gear. Neon-lit workshop setting with soft gold bioluminescent glow reflecting off glass tubes and metal surfaces. Moody neo-noir atmosphere, focus mixed with manic enthusiasm evident in expression. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Lakeview Neon district', N'local', N'Lakeview Neon district', N'Sub-Saharan African (59.8%), Middle Eastern (19.0%), East Asian (11.8%), and Hispanic/Latin American (9.4%) — a striking multihemispheric blend. The result is a warm, complex phenotype: deep golden-brown skin with prominent Sub-Saharan African bone structure, Middle Eastern facial proportions, and subtle East Asian cheekbone definition. An unexpectedly harmonious genetic combination that reads as genuinely multicultural rather than any single origin.', 168, 58, N'Angular and lean, all sharp angles and restless energy — narrow shoulders, long limbs, negligible body fat. Built for mobility rather than strength, with the wiry musculature of someone who climbs scaffolding and bends glass tubes for twelve hours a day.', N'None — naturally shaved to scalp', N'Closely shaved; scalp shows faint natural curl pattern underneath', N'Shaved', N'Dark brown with gold flecks (natural)', N'Deep golden-brown with warm undertones — the result of Sub-Saharan African, Middle Eastern, and East Asian heritage creating a luminous complexion that seems to glow slightly in certain light. Tans deeply and evenly, with an underlying golden cast that intensifies in sunlight.', N'Defined by prominent, broad cheekbones reflecting Sub-Saharan African and Middle Eastern heritage, paired with a strong jawline and a distinctive nose characteristic of Sub-Saharan African ancestry, with subtle Middle Eastern bridge refinement. Mild East Asian epicanthic fold suggestion around the eyes. The overall effect is striking and angular. Skin is clear but shows minor scarring from repeated minor burns on the hands and forearms — small white lines near knuckles and wrists.', N'The defining feature: a constellation of seven small gold-bioluminescent subdermal implants embedded along the jawline, from below the left ear to the right temple. At rest they are dim, barely perceptible — a faint gold shimmer under the skin. When excited, nervous, or deeply focused, they pulse and glow noticeably gold, creating a soft aurora effect across their jaw. Fingertips show minor heat-resistance texture modification — slightly thickened, with a faint pearlescent undertone.', N'Almost never still. Default state is forward-leaning, shoulders slightly hunched. Gestures constantly while talking, hands moving even when idle — touching nearby surfaces, testing their texture, tapping out rhythms. When working, moves with surprising precision and grace despite the overall restlessness. When stationary (rare), shifts weight from foot to foot, fingers drumming or fidgeting.', N'Tier 3-4 working artist aesthetic. Favors oversized, heavily patched cargo pants and button-up work shirts in colors personally dyed using neon gas byproduct residue — soft teals, deep magentas, acid greens, burnt purples. The dyes give the fabric an inexplicable faint iridescent shimmer in direct light. Clothes are deliberately worn, torn at seams and hems, with raw patches stitched back with mismatched thread. No visible brand signifiers beyond generic utility gear. Hands often wrapped in cloth tape or thin leather gloves (protection). No jewelry beyond a faded fabric wristband (probably hand-dyed). Heavy steel-toed work boots, scuffed and paint-splattered.', N'The E.L.F. they talk to in the transformer — they have started to receive what feel like replies. Not words, but power fluctuations that correspond too precisely to be random. They haven''t told anyone because they think it will sound unstable.', N'Fast, colloquial, full of technical neon and electrical terms dropped casually into personal conversations', N'Rapid, often mid-sentence pivots, finishes other people''s sentences incorrectly but enthusiastically', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'esha_mensah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b4-7902-9447-fd376de39f8b', N'Giovana Lindström-Seo', N'Giovana', N'', N'Lindström-Seo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 71, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Precinct 4 — Apartment stack above the old Ferrogate maintenance depot, near Western and Division', N'Retired Ferrogate Transit union leader living on pension and community stipends', N'Ferrogate Transit Pensioners Association; the Gray Zone Residents Collective; informal affiliation with multiple labor grievance networks', N'Giovana Lindström-Seo is a compact, high-voltage woman who has never learned to fill a room quietly. Her hair is natural and shot through with the kind of silver that arrives at the temples first and then conquers everything, worn in a structured wrap she pins with a Ferrogate union badge from 2161 — the old design, before the merger downgraded the insignia. Her geneware is minimal and aging: faint bioluminescent tracery under her forearms that pulses softly in blue when her blood pressure rises, a cosmetic choice from her forties that now serves as an involuntary emotional barometer everyone around her has learned to read. She moves quickly for her age and has the handshake of someone who spent decades using physical presence to establish authority at negotiating tables.

She is furious about her pension. Not in the vague way of someone who expected more from life, but in the precise, documented way of someone who can tell you exactly which Ferrogate Transit clause was quietly amended in 2191 to reduce survivor benefit calculations, who approved it, and what it cost her annually. She runs an informal advisory service out of her apartment — residents bring her their benefit disputes, their severance irregularities, their corponation contract fine print — and she helps them fight back. She charges nothing but accepts food. Her relationship with the Ferrogate Transit E.L.F. known as the Line-Keeper is complicated: she respects it but disputes its memory of the 2178 strike.', N'Labor history source; advocate and quest-giver for residents dealing with corponation benefit disputes; provides connections to transit worker networks across GLMZ; represents the grinding institutional injustice of retirement-tier poverty', N'', N'Bioluminescent subdermal tracery on forearms (cosmetic, aging, pulses blue under stress); cochlear audio enhancer (left ear, Ferrogate-issued, they dispute responsibility for maintenance); reading lens implant (right eye, consumer grade)', N'Wakes to transit reports out of habit, annotates them in a physical notebook, then opens her door by 0800 for whoever needs help. Spends afternoons at the Ferrogate depot-side memorial wall, maintaining the handwritten additions to the official list of workers injured in the 2178 strike that the company''s plaque omits.', N'Giovana Lindström-Seo, 71-year-old union organizer, GLMZ, medium-brown skin with golden-amber undertones reflecting East Asian, Northern European, Southeast Asian, Hispanic, and African heritage blend. Angular high cheekbones, strong jawline, natural brown eyes with subtle right-eye lens implant visible as prismatic glint. Silver-grey hair wrapped tightly and pinned with faded 2161 Ferrogate union badge. Weathered face with deep expression lines from decades of intensity. Wearing vintage faded union-embroidered work shirt in Ferrogate Transit colors, dark cargo trousers, reinforced shoes. Blue bioluminescent branching tracery visible on both forearms, faintly glowing. Faded burn scar on left wrist, callused right hand. Standing with grounded purposeful posture, making direct eye contact, default expression between attentiveness and irritation. Memorial wall in soft background. Worn working-class aesthetic, no corpo branding. Natural morning light emphasizing the golden undertones in her skin, the blue glow of her augmented forearm tracery, the faded union patch on her left shoulder. Mood: determined, skeptical, rooted in working history. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Ubiquitous diaspora blend: East Asian (46.4%) provides dominant facial structure with high cheekbones and eye shape; Northern European (26.5%) contributes robust jawline and bone density; Southeast Asian (10.6%) adds warmth and subtle softness to features; Hispanic/Latin American (8.6%) and Sub-Saharan African (7.9%) deepen skin undertones and add richness to overall phenotype. The result is a striking warm medium-brown complexion with golden-amber undertones, angular yet approachable facial geometry, and the kind of structural strength that reads as competence rather than aggression.', 158, 61, N'Compact and dense, shoulders still squared from decades of standing across negotiating tables; no excess weight, wiry musculature beneath aging skin that suggests physical work rather than gym discipline', N'Silver-grey with darker roots, natural aging pattern', N'Structured wrap pinned with a 2161 Ferrogate union badge (old design, pre-merger); tightly secured, practical, worn as deliberate identity marker', N'Medium (wrapped)', N'Brown, natural; right eye bears a faint consumer-grade reading lens implant visible as subtle prismatic refraction at certain angles', N'Warm medium-brown with golden-amber undertones, weathered from seventy-one years and outdoor maintenance work at the depot memorial wall; the tone reflects balanced blending of East Asian warmth, Southeast Asian depth, Northern European undertones, and African heritage richness', N'Lined face with pronounced forehead creases and deep nasolabial folds from decades of sustained intensity; skin condition good for her age, well-maintained; strong jawline showing Northern European angularity tempered by East Asian refinement, high cheekbones with definition enhanced by Sub-Saharan African and Hispanic/Latin American heritage warmth and depth', N'Bioluminescent forearm tracery (aging, blue, stress-reactive); surgical scar behind left ear indicating cochlear implant; subtle prismatic lens visible in right eye under direct light. All augmentations show age and functional wear rather than corpo gloss.', N'Moves with purposeful quickness despite age; walks from the core outward, grounded stance, no shuffling. Hand gestures are economical and emphatic—decades of negotiating table authority embedded in her physical grammar. Her default expression hovers between attentiveness and irritation. She makes direct eye contact and holds it.', N'Tier 4 working-class, carefully maintained: heavy cotton union-embroidered work shirt (vintage Ferrogate Transit colors, faded), dark practical trousers with cargo pockets, sturdy reinforced shoes suitable for standing all day at the memorial wall. Always wears the 2161 union badge pinned to her wrap. No visible corp branding. Clothing is functional, clean, and chosen to signal allegiance rather than fashion. Small personal touches: a hand-stitched patch on her left shoulder commemorating the 2178 strike.', N'During the 2178 Ferrogate strike, she negotiated a back-channel deal with a mid-level Ferrogate manager that ended the strike three days earlier than the membership voted for — she believed she was saving jobs, but eleven workers on the picket line were dismissed in the settlement window that the early resolution created. She has the paperwork. She has never shown it to anyone.', N'Dense with labor terminology and contractual language; fluent in Wolof and a Pribilof Islands Unangax-inflected creole she uses when frustrated; precise and citation-heavy', N'Fast, clipped, organized — she speaks in bullet points naturally', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'giovana_lindstr_m_seo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6c7-7d1b-891d-fd45ed23e989', N'Delali Arredondo', N'Delali', N'', N'Arredondo', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 24, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Mexicantown Libre, near Pulaski and Chicago Ave', N'Union organizer and protest coordinator', N'Ferrogate Transit Workers'' Solidarity Action Front; informal ties to Mexicantown Libre neighborhood council youth bloc', N'Delali Arredondo is twenty-four and looks like she has been awake for most of it. She is compact and fast-moving, with mixed Senegambian and Scandinavian features that catch people off guard — high cheekbones, cool-toned brown skin, pale green eyes she claims are natural and that nobody quite believes. Her hair is currently a defiant copper-orange, achieved through a cheap pigment mod that needs retreating every three weeks and which she ritually neglects until it starts going pink at the roots. She dresses for movement and disappearance. She has a voice that carries in a crowd without apparent effort and she knows exactly how to use it.

Delali Arredondo is an organizer with the Ferrogate Transit Workers'' Solidarity Action Front — a name she argues with regularly — coordinating wildcat actions, slowdowns, and what she calls ''presence demonstrations'' among transit maintenance workers across three depot lines. She is extraordinarily good at reading a crowd''s emotional temperature and knows exactly when to push and when to hold. She is less good at the long game, at paperwork, at not making promises that exceed what the Front can deliver. She is young enough to still be surprised when the system fails people who trusted it, and old enough in organizing years to be afraid of what happens when she stops being surprised.', N'Mobilization engine — can turn a situation into collective action faster than anyone; creates urgency and momentum in stories; represents the costs and energy of youth organizing; potential flashpoint character.', N'', N'Cosmetic hair pigment mod (copper-orange, poorly maintained). Subvocal communication implant — union-issue, secondhand, allows silent throat-mic communication during actions.', N'Days vary wildly between quiet depot visits to check in with worker contacts, logistics planning sessions in the Libre community hall, and sudden pivots to coordinate unplanned actions when conditions align.', N'Delali Arredondo, 162cm compact wiry woman of mixed Hispanic/Latin American, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage, medium-dark golden-brown skin with complex warm undertones, dark brown eyes with intensity. Shoulder-length copper-orange cosmetic-modified hair pulled back with industrial clips, defined angular cheekbones, sharp jawline, fuller lips, faint permanent dark circles. Lean muscular frame dressed in matte-black reinforced cargo pants, mismatched worn boots, oversized muted-colored layered tank and loose shirt, faded union-marked hoodie. Thin wire data-transfer bracelet, pale soldering scar on inner left wrist, three-dot solidarity marks on right forearm, temple scar barely visible. Salvaged military-grade messenger bag overstuffed with union materials. Constantly in motion, forward-tilted posture, quick economical movements, intense focused gaze. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, industrial Libre neighborhood setting, cool fluorescent and neon lighting casting shadows, gritty utilitarian environment, mood of determined activism and sleep-deprived energy --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'local', N'Mexicantown Libre', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (56.5%) with significant South Asian (22.7%) and Sub-Saharan African (20.8%) ancestry. Phenotype reflects the rich blending of these three heritage lines — warm golden-brown skin with complex undertones from the interplay of Latin American, South Asian, and African genetics. Facial structure shows the angular cheekbones and jawline common to Latin American heritage, softened by the refined facial contours of South Asian ancestry, with the warmth and depth of Sub-Saharan African lineage visible in skin richness and lip fullness.', 162, 52, N'Compact and wiry, all fast-twitch muscle and minimal fat — built for movement and climbing, with the lean efficiency of someone who lives on adrenaline and irregular meals', N'Copper-orange (cosmetic pigment mod, poorly maintained)', N'Shoulder-length, layered for quick drying, often pulled back with salvaged fabric strips or industrial clips', N'Medium', N'Dark brown with warm undertones (natural, though frequently disbelieved due to cosmetic modifications elsewhere)', N'Warm golden-brown with rich complexity — the honeyed warmth of Latin American and South Asian heritage melded with the deep luminous undertones of Sub-Saharan African ancestry, creating a medium-dark complexion with subtle radiance beneath the muting effects of chronic sleep deprivation', N'Defined cheekbones with angular Latin American structure refined by South Asian facial contours, sharp jawline, hollow cheeks from chronic caffeine dependence. Nose structure reflects the three-way blend with a straight bridge and naturally fuller base. Fuller lips characteristic of mixed African heritage. Skin shows the wear of someone who forgets to sleep regularly — faint dark circles are permanent fixtures. Few blemishes but slightly weathered texture from exposure and neglect of skincare.', N'None externally visible. The subvocal implant sits subcutaneous at the throat — sometimes visible as a slight bulge at the base of her neck when she moves her head at certain angles, or when she activates it (faint subsonic vibration in the skin). The hair pigment mod is purely cosmetic and requires no hardware.', N'Constantly in motion even when standing still — weight shifts, fingers drumming, eyes scanning. Quick, economical movements with no wasted energy. Leans forward when listening, as if pulling words directly from the speaker. Has a habit of ducking her head slightly when making a point, then looking up with intensity. Walks fast with a slight forward tilt, ready to accelerate.', N'Tier 4 working-class utilitarian with Libre neighborhood signifiers. Favors matte-black cargo pants with multiple pockets and reinforced knees, worn work boots (currently mismatched — one original, one recobbled), layered tank tops and loose shirts in muted colors that can be shed or added depending on action temperature. Owns exactly two hoodies, both oversized, both bearing faded union emblems. Refuses to wear anything that restricts arm movement. Jewelry limited to a thin wire bracelet on her left wrist (union issue, doubles as a data-transfer device). Bag is a salvaged military-grade messenger bag with reinforced straps, perpetually overstuffed with organizing materials, a thermos, protein bars, and communications equipment. No corporate branding; everything is either unadorned or marked with hand-stenciled union logos.', N'During an action last year she gave the signal to disperse fifteen minutes early, saving thirty workers from a corporate security sweep. Nobody knows she got a tip-off from a Ferrogate middle manager she''s been quietly cultivating as an inside contact. She knows this is an asset she should tell the Front about. She hasn''t, because she''s afraid they''ll take control of the contact away from her.', N'High energy, punchy, labor movement cadences mixed with Libre street vernacular; code-switches fluidly', N'Fast in conversation, deliberately slower and rhythmic when speaking to groups', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'delali_arredondo');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a70f-7c15-9be2-fd53e5e9d887', N'Bhavika Thorvaldsdóttir-Esquivel', N'Bhavika', N'', N'Thorvaldsdóttir-Esquivel', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Stockyard, Pier 4 overflow lot, Grainfort, near Lake Shore and Navy Pier', N'Junk merchant and scrap reseller', N'Independent; trade relationship with three Ferrogate Transit maintenance workers who sell surplus parts off-manifest; loosely pays protection to the Stockyard crew', N'Bhavika Thorvaldsdóttir-Esquivel is lean and angular with the kind of wiry strength that comes from hauling scrap rather than any intentional exercise. Their skin is a deep warm brown, and they have geneware cat ears — dusty grey tabby-patterned, which they''ve never bothered to remove since getting them at nineteen on a dare — that flatten expressively when they''re annoyed and perk forward when something catches their interest, which is often. A bioluminescent stripe runs down the back of each forearm, dim pale blue, activated by stress hormones; they''ve learned to read it as an early warning system for their own anxiety. Their work clothes are pragmatic catastrophes: safety-orange strapping over layered thermals, magnetic tool clips everywhere, boots with steel inserts they sourced from a Ferrogate Transit maintenance surplus sale.

They have the paradoxical quality of seeming both completely at ease in the chaos of the Stockyard lots and perpetually slightly amused by it, as though the entire enterprise of human commerce is a joke they''re in on. Their actual eye for value is extraordinary — they can assess a pile of mixed scrap and name a fair price in under thirty seconds, and they''re almost never wrong. They''re known for being the only merchant in Grainfort who won''t claim something works if it doesn''t.', N'Scrap and salvage information source — knows what''s being thrown away by whom; can source unusual components; potential lead on Ferrogate Transit''s internal disposal practices; local colour with genuine warmth.', N'', N'Geneware cat ears (grey tabby, cosmetic). Bioluminescent stripes on forearms (geneware, stress-reactive). Subdermal magnetic fingertips (functional — allows them to handle small metal components without dropping them).', N'Early morning scavenging runs to the Grainfort overflow before other pickers arrive, then sorting and pricing through midday, then open stall from noon to whenever the light goes.', N'Bhavika Thorvaldsdóttir-Esquivel, 2226 neo-noir scrap-worker, 172cm lean angular frame with warm medium-brown skin and golden undertones. Black naturally textured hair in loose twists pinned with metal clips. Dark brown eyes, alert sharp expression. Geneware grey tabby cat ears at crown with independent movement. Pale blue bioluminescent stripes glowing faintly along dorsal forearms. Wears safety-orange high-visibility harness over grey thermal undershirt, reinforced cargo pants with patches, steel-insert work boots. Minor burn scarring on left hand heel. Subdermal magnetic fingertips with metallic shine. Mixed Hispanic/Eastern European/Southeast Asian/South Asian facial geometry with defined cheekbones and subtle East Asian eye characteristics. Sun-weathered shoulders and neck. Standing in economical relaxed posture with weight shifted, picking up small metal scrap absently. Grungy industrial scrapyard background, overhead neon lighting casting shadows, volumetric dust in air catching light. Neo-noir urban aesthetic, practiced ease despite chaos, unbothered demeanor --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Stockyard', N'local', N'The Stockyard', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (56.8%) with substantial Eastern European (14.8%), Southeast Asian (10.6%), South Asian (6.7%), Sub-Saharan African (5.9%), and East Asian (5.2%) ancestry; the genetic blend creates a warm, complex phenotype with multiple heritage markers visible in facial structure and skin tone', 172, 58, N'Lean and angular with wiry muscle definition from years of hauling scrap; no excess body fat; sinewy forearms and core strength despite slight frame', N'Black, naturally textured', N'Worn in loose twists, often half-pinned back with salvaged metal clips to keep it clear of work', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, unaugmented', N'Warm medium-brown with golden undertones and subtle olive cast; sun-weathered on shoulders and neck from outdoor scrap work; the blend reflects the dominant Latin American ancestry with Southeast and South Asian chromatic influence', N'Balanced facial geometry showing blend of Hispanic and Eastern European structure; defined cheekbones with mild prominence from South Asian genetics; warm-toned skin with minor scars and calluses from scrap work; slight Southeast Asian eye shape characteristics; subtle West African bone structure contributing to facial symmetry; sharp, alert expression', N'Geneware cat ears (cosmetic, animalistic). Bioluminescent forearm stripes (visible as faint pale-blue lines, glow activated by stress). Subdermal magnetic fingertips not visually obvious at rest but create subtle metallic shine under certain light; occasionally small metal shavings cling to fingertips.', N'Moves with economical precision; stands with weight shifted to one side in relaxed stance, often picking up and rotating small objects absently. Cat ears track sounds and movement with subtle autonomic twitches. Overall demeanor is alert but unbothered, moving through chaos with practiced ease.', N'Tier 4 working-class pragmatism: safety-orange high-visibility strapping harness worn over layered thermal undershirts in grey or black. Multiple magnetic tool clips on webbing. Reinforced cargo pants with patched seams, tucked into steel-insert work boots sourced from Ferrogate Transit surplus. Occasional technical jacket in faded blue or neutral tones when weather demands. No visible corporate branding; all gear is salvaged or secondhand. Grooming is minimal but deliberate — nothing wasted, everything functional.', N'They''ve been documenting serial numbers on certain Ferrogate Transit parts coming through the Stockyard — parts that shouldn''t exist on the secondary market. They don''t know yet what they''re going to do with the information, but the file is growing.', N'Casual, technically precise about anything mechanical, fond of dry asides; code-switches between Yoruba proverbs (from their grandmother) and Czech slang (from their father''s neighbourhood) without noticing', N'Easy and unhurried, with sudden bursts of rapid technical detail when something gets interesting', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'bhavika_thorvaldsd_ttir_esquivel');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5a9-709f-9cac-fd9193c0b7dc', N'Aaliya Árnason-Sengupta', N'Aaliya', N'', N'Árnason-Sengupta', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 58, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Overhang — residential shelves built onto megastructure exteriors, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Long-range precision fire specialist — sniper', N'Independent — known in Old Harbor circles', N'Aaliya Árnason-Sengupta is lean and angular, all sharp edges and visible tension. At 58, her face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and she has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She came up through the Gray Zone''s informal apprentice system, learning the trade from runners who didn''t survive long enough to see her surpass them. She works as a sniper out of The Overhang, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

The fixers who work with Aaliya Árnason-Sengupta describe her as a precision instrument — point her at a problem and get out of the way.', N'Alper Vega-Acheampong is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons. Smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons', N'Wakes early, runs maintenance on gear, checks dead drops and message boards for contracts. Eats when convenient, sleeps when possible. The days between jobs are spent maintaining contacts, updating equipment, and performing the low-grade paranoia that passes for self-care in the runner community.', N'Aaliya Árnason-Sengupta, lean Southeast and South Asian woman, 172cm tall with defined high cheekbones and angular Central Asian jaw structure, warm medium-deep brown skin with bronze freckling from sun damage. Dark brown eyes with professional hardness, silver-streaked dark brown hair pulled back in functional braid. Severe facial weathering from decades of weapons work, deep lines around eyes and mouth. Dark tactical outfit: black reinforced jacket, gray long-sleeved undershirt, dark charcoal cargo pants, steel-toed scuffed boots, loose synthwool scarf. Chrome smartgun link interface embedded in right forearm — brushed titanium faceplate with LED indicators. Pale burn scar on left inner forearm, thin scar tissue on right collarbone, severe calluses on right hand. Economical posture, tense baseline, eyes scanning. Rooftop night setting, amber and red LED glow from augmentation, GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, cinematic lighting, documentary realism --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Overhang', N'local', N'The Overhang', N'Southeast Asian dominant (48.8%) blended with South Asian (44.2%) and Central Asian (7.0%) ancestry. The genetic combination creates refined intermediate phenotypic features — high, defined cheekbones and subtle eye shape from Southeast Asian genetics, warmed by the deeper skin tones and facial structure of South Asian heritage, with Central Asian bone structure adding subtle angularity to the jaw and face.', 172, 58, N'Lean and angular with visible musculature from decades of weapon handling and sustained physical discipline. No excess body fat. Shoulders slightly narrower than average, but corded with functional strength.', N'Dark brown with silver streaking at temples and along the left side', N'Pulled back in a functional braid, often wrapped with synthetic cord for field work', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, naturally warm but hardened by professional distance', N'Warm medium to medium-deep brown with golden undertones — the rich, even tone characteristic of Southeast and South Asian heritage. Sun damage from rooftop work creates irregular bronze freckling across cheekbones and shoulders, giving the skin a textured, lived-in appearance.', N'Weathered face with deep lines around the eyes and mouth from squinting through scopes and years of stress. Jaw is strong and prominent with subtle Central Asian angularity. High, defined cheekbones show Southeast Asian influence. Subtle facial structure reflects South Asian heritage in the bridge of the nose and overall facial proportions. Minimal grooming beyond functional necessity — no cosmetics, no jewelry.', N'Chrome smartgun link interface embedded in right forearm, running from wrist to mid-forearm. The integration is clean but deliberately visible — brushed titanium faceplate with thin LED status indicators (amber/red when active). No attempt to conceal it. The chrome contrasts sharply with her natural skin tone.', N'Economical and deliberate. She doesn''t waste motion. When at rest, her right arm rests naturally at her side with the augmented forearm slightly forward — a habit from weapon readiness. Eyes constantly scanning environments. Tense baseline, but controlled. Moves like someone who has learned that hesitation dies first.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian — function over aesthetics. Weathered black tactical jacket with reinforced shoulders and multiple chest pockets (Resilience brand, modular). Matte gray undershirt, long-sleeved to minimize the visibility of the smartgun link when she chooses discretion. Cargo pants in dark charcoal with thigh and calf pockets (ammunition, tools, dead drops). Steel-toed boots, scuffed and re-soled twice. A thin synthwool scarf worn loose around the neck — part camouflage, part utility. No visible insignia or gang markers; anonymity is the brand.', N'Alper Vega-Acheampong murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'the Gray Zone street dialect — layered slang, rhythm-heavy, half the meaning is in the cadence.', N'Flowing and unhurried — talks like someone who has never been interrupted and doesn''t expect to be.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'aaliya_rnason_sengupta');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6a3-7bc2-aa6e-fd9aeb52753b', N'Hakon Dlamini-Guerrero', N'Hakon', N'', N'Dlamini-Guerrero', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone, Ironvein district — operates from a converted maintenance alcove beneath the mag-rail support struts, near Kedzie and Division', N'Bootleg media seller and small-time data broker — pirated sensorium feeds, black-market memory cores, and hot information', N'Loosely affiliated with a collective of the Gray Zone vendors called the Strut Crew; occasional data-runner for independent parties; refuses formal gang affiliation on principle he claims is ideological but is actually paranoia', N'Hakon Dlamini-Guerrero is a sharp-faced young man with the kind of restless eyes that track every entrance and exit in a room simultaneously. He is wiry and pale-complexioned with his Hausa grandfather''s high cheekbones and his Mexican grandmother''s jaw, and he has cat ears — matte black, expensive enough to be the nicest thing he owns — that swivel independent of his attention, which unnerves people who don''t know him. He keeps his dark hair in a short braid tucked under a hood most of the time and dresses in layered secondhand tech-worker castoffs that make him look like he belongs in a server room rather than a market alcove.

He is aggressively, exhaustingly clever — the kind of person who has already run seventeen versions of this conversation in his head before you finish your first sentence. He deals in media and data with the same practiced casualness that a much older person would deal in rumors, and he has a genuine passion for pre-Consolidation cinema that he disguises as ironic interest. He is afraid of exactly two things: boredom and being cornered, and he confuses both with death.', N'Information vendor and media source; can provide access to pirated content including surveillance feeds and corporate internal communications; useful as an entry point into the Gray Zone''s underground data economy', N'', N'Black geneware cat ears (cosmetic, mid-range); basic neural buffer for faster media previewing (cheap Zheng-Dao utility model); subdermal data-storage nodules in left forearm', N'He sleeps until noon in his alcove behind a security screen, opens for business by 14:00, and runs until the mag-rail goes quiet after midnight; he eats whatever is cheap and nearby and survives primarily on stimulant tabs and spite.', N'Hakon Dlamini-Guerrero, GLMZ, wiry 172cm frame with deep warm bronze skin reflecting Sub-Saharan African, Hispanic, East Asian, and Indigenous American heritage. Sharp angular cheekbones, prominent facial structure, dark brown alert eyes. Matte black geneware cat ears mounted on skull, swiveling independently. Short dark brown braid tucked beneath gray hood. Layered secondhand tech-worker clothing in muted grays and blacks, oversized server castoffs, patched thermal vest jacket with exposed non-functional wiring, cargo pants, worn resoled boots. Subdermal data-storage nodules faintly visible on left forearm. Faint chemical burn on right arm, thin temple scar. Controlled posture, constant tension, tracking eyes. Neo-noir infrastructure setting, neon and industrial lighting, Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, 2226. Digital noir aesthetic, gritty maintenance worker vibe, standing in shadow near server access point. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'Sub-Saharan African (63.0%), Hispanic/Latin American (15.3%), East Asian (14.3%), and Indigenous American (7.4%) — a striking four-continent genetic blend. His features reflect this complex ancestry: high, prominent cheekbones and strong facial structure from his African heritage, sharpened by East Asian bone structure, with warmth and angularity from Latin American lineage, and subtle refinement from Indigenous American ancestry. The genetic mix creates an unusual harmony of sharp angles and defined facial planes.', 172, 58, N'Wiry and angular, all elbows and sharp shoulders — the physique of someone who subsists on stimulant tabs and minimal nutrition rather than exercise. Tense musculature suggests constant readiness rather than strength.', N'Dark brown, nearly black', N'Short braid, typically tucked beneath a hood; when exposed, the braid runs down the nape of his neck', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and constantly tracking', N'Deep warm bronze with golden undertones — a rich, complex blend of melanin-rich Sub-Saharan African ancestry as the dominant genetic foundation, warmed by Latin American heritage, subtly enriched with East Asian undertones creating an olive-bronze cast, and Indigenous American sun-adapted pigmentation. The overall effect suggests equatorial and diverse continental heritage, with subtle ashen undertones in certain angles from stimulant overuse.', N'Sharp-featured face with high, prominent cheekbones from African heritage, sharpened further by East Asian bone structure, balanced by angular jawline reflecting the interplay of Latin American and Indigenous American ancestry. Facial structure suggests someone built for precision and resilience. Facial hair is sparse and unkempt. Skin shows the minor wear of irregular sleep and poor nutrition — not scarred, but with a faint grayness that stimulant overuse brings, barely dulling the natural warmth beneath.', N'Matte black geneware cat ears mounted on his skull, capable of independent rotation — they swivel toward sound sources or movement without conscious input from him, creating an unsettling impression of divided attention. The ears are his most expensive possession and show meticulous maintenance despite his general disregard for appearance. Subdermal data-storage nodules are faintly visible as small ridges beneath the skin of his left forearm when his sleeve rides up, glinting dully under certain light.', N'He moves with controlled, economical precision — no wasted motion, but a constant underlying tension suggesting he is never fully at rest. His eyes track entrances and exits habitually. When sitting, he positions himself with a clear sightline to exits and keeps his hands visible. His cat ears swivel independently of his gaze, creating a disquieting multiplicity of attention.', N'Layered secondhand tech-worker castoffs in muted grays, blacks, and industrial blues — oversized server-room wear salvaged from corporate recycling bins, now repurposed as street armor. A hood is almost always up. His jacket is a patchwork of thermal vests with exposed wiring at the sleeves (non-functional, purely aesthetic). His pants are cargo-style with reinforced pockets (for data cores and merchandise). Footwear is worn Tier 4 worker boots, resoled twice. Everything is functional, nothing is fashionable; he dresses for invisibility in tech spaces and operates on the principle that he should look like a maintenance worker who belongs in infrastructure rather than a street vendor. No visible jewelry except the cat ears.', N'He once sold a memory core that contained evidence of a Sterling-Nakamura illegal neural trial to a buyer who turned out to be a Sterling-Nakamura internal audit operative — three people he knew went quiet afterward; he has never confirmed whether they were arrested or killed, and he has never sold to an anonymous buyer since, but he has also never reported what he knows', N'Fast, dense, laced with media slang and the Gray Zone technical jargon; switches registers instantly depending on who he''s talking to — he can sound like a corporate drone or a street kid in the same breath', N'Machine-gun delivery when excited or nervous, which is most of the time; pauses are deliberate and mean he is calculating', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hakon_dlamini_guerrero');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a718-7f78-85dd-fd9cf7590ef7', N'Rachid Arredondo-Boudiaf', N'Rachid', N'', N'Arredondo-Boudiaf', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 31, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Old Harbor — repurposed shipping infrastructure turned black market hub, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'Prototype theft and corporate tech acquisition — tech retriever', N'Independent — Narrows-based operations', N'Rachid Arredondo-Boudiaf is tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 31, she has the kind of face that changes depending on the light — trustworthy in daylight, dangerous after dark. The chrome is visible — neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct ne — and she makes no effort to hide it.

Her entry into running was involuntary — a debt to the wrong people, a choice between working it off or losing parts — and the debt is still not fully paid. She works as a tech retriever out of Old Harbor, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Rachid Arredondo-Boudiaf operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Vuk Herrera-Kyei is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Neural interface jack at base of skull — standard runner-grade, allows direct net access. Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Rachid Arredondo-Boudiaf, GLMZ, 183cm lean angular build with visible shoulder and forearm definition. Warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones, strong defined cheekbones and prominent jawline reflecting Mediterranean-Levantine-Maghrebi-Hispanic blend. Dark brown eyes with sharp evaluative quality. Long black hair pulled back in tight functional braid exposing brushed steel neural interface jack at base of skull with LED indicators. Visible pale scar webwork on inner left forearm, surgical scar at skull base, circular burn mark on right ribcage. Controlled precise posture, weight distributed for mobility, constant movement assessment. Wearing black syndsuit under reinforced dark gray cargo jacket with sealed pockets and cable management loops, matte-finish tactical boots, silver-gray armored gloves. Single small pendant on thin chain. Predatory alertness even at rest. Tier 4 utilitarian technical wear, precision maintenance. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone neon-lit urban setting, cool blue and amber lighting catching the chrome jack, shadows emphasizing angular features and augmentation scars. Moody, focused, professional operative aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Old Harbor', N'local', N'Old Harbor', N'Predominantly Hispanic/Latin American (60.6%) with significant North African Maghrebi (23.4%) and Middle Eastern Levantine (16.0%) ancestry. This creates a striking Mediterranean-influenced phenotype: warm golden-brown skin with olive undertones that deepen to amber in sunlight, characteristic of the blended Spanish-colonial and indigenous Latin American base enriched by Maghrebi and Levantine features. Strong, defined cheekbones and prominent jawline reflect North African and Levantine bone structure, while facial width and warmth of tone derive from the dominant Hispanic/Latin American genetics. The overall effect is a warm-toned, fine-featured face with subtle angular definition—Mediterranean heritage expressed through a Latin American foundation.', 183, 68, N'Lean and angular, with visible muscle definition in shoulders and forearms — the result of deliberate conditioning rather than bulk. Long limbs built for reach and leverage, minimal body fat, economical frame.', N'Black with subtle dark brown undertones', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid that exposes the neural interface jack at the base of her skull', N'Long', N'Dark brown, naturally warm but with a sharp, evaluative quality', N'Warm golden-brown with subtle olive undertones — a complex blend reflecting Hispanic/Latin American base with North African and Middle Eastern warmth, creating depth and richness in tone that deepens toward amber in direct light', N'Strong, defined cheekbones with prominent jawline characteristic of Levantine and North African heritage, complemented by the broader facial structure common to Hispanic/Latin American ancestry. Skin is kept clean and well-maintained — practical grooming, no cosmetic affectation. Expression tends toward neutral focus. Fine-grained texture suggests Mediterranean sun exposure in family lineage.', N'Chrome neural interface jack at base of skull, runner-grade — the jack itself is visible as brushed steel with slight LED activity when connected. No obvious limb replacements, but the deliberate way she moves and the slight luminescence in her eyes during certain angles suggests internal modifications. Scars around collarbone suggest thoracic work (lung replacement).', N'Moves with controlled precision — no wasted motion, every gesture economical and purposeful. Stands with weight distributed for quick mobility, shoulders slightly forward. Eyes track movement constantly, assessing. At rest, she has an alertness that doesn''t fully switch off. When focused on a task, her entire body becomes still, predatory.', N'Tier 4 utilitarian — high-performance technical wear favoring function over fashion. Black or dark gray syndsuit base layer, often worn under reinforced cargo jacket with multiple sealed pockets and cable management loops. Matte-finish tactical boots with grip soles. Silver-gray armored gloves when working. Minimal jewelry — a single small pendant on a thin chain, usually hidden. Everything is maintained with precision, showing wear but never neglect. Moves like someone who expects to run or fight at any moment.', N'Vuk Herrera-Kyei once worked for corporate intelligence and still has a handler who calls in favors. Each favor erodes what''s left of their independence.', N'Terse to the point of rudeness. Treats words like ammunition — expensive and not to be wasted.', N'Rhythmic, almost musical — the sentence structure has a pattern even when the words are brutal.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'rachid_arredondo_boudiaf');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a677-74d9-89f5-fdb3726b6af9', N'Ezinne Espinoza-Sato', N'Ezinne', N'', N'Espinoza-Sato', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 27, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Stockyard, rotating between the Grainfort market corridor and the Escanaba Gateway transit hub, near Michigan Ave South and Cermak', N'Protection racket enforcer', N'The Stockyard Lambs — a mid-tier local gang with deep roots in the Grainfort market district', N'Ezinne Espinoza-Sato is built like something industrial — broad through the chest and shoulders, standing nearly two meters, with close-cropped hair and a face that might be called handsome if it weren''t so carefully arranged into blankness. His skin is deep brown and his eyes are standard issue except for a faint bioluminescent ring around each iris that pulses a dim coral color when his heart rate elevates, a geneware modification he had installed at eighteen that he now slightly regrets because it is a readable tell. He has a ritual scar pattern across his left forearm in three parallel lines that he added himself with a heated wire at twenty — he has told different people it means different things, and none of the stories are true.

Ezinne Espinoza-Sato is not a sadist. This surprises people who meet him in a professional context. He is methodical and proportional: he delivers exactly the level of violence the situation requires and stops, which is both more disturbing and more effective than enthusiasm. Off the clock he is a devoted older brother to three younger siblings he quietly funds through the Stockyard community school, and he attends the local ELF shrine at the Grainfort gate every week without fail. He wants out of this work and has wanted out for three years, but he has never figured out what out looks like, and so he keeps showing up.', N'Moral gray zone — a violent person with genuine humanity; local color for Stockyard scenes; potential ally or complication depending on who the players represent; sympathetic antagonist', N'', N'Bioluminescent iris rings (coral pulse, geneware — cosmetic, regretted); subdermal impact-dampening mesh over knuckles and forearms (functional, standard enforcer mod)', N'He walks the collection route Monday, Wednesday, Friday starting at 08:00 — sixteen shops, three market stalls, two transit kiosks. The rest of his time he spends at the gym, at the shrine, and at his younger sister Adaeze''s apartment helping her with coursework she doesn''t ask for help with.', N'Ezinne Espinoza-Sato, 198cm tall, muscular build, warm medium-deep brown skin with golden undertones reflecting multifaceted Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, Indigenous American, Hispanic/Latin American, and East Asian heritage. Strong jawline, defined cheekbones with subtle width, deep-set brown eyes with faint bioluminescent coral iris rings. Black close-cropped hair, clean-shaven. Three parallel silver ritual scars down inner left forearm, subdermal impact mesh visible on knuckles and forearms as subtle raised grid lines. Wears black fitted compression shirt under charcoal canvas jacket, dark combat-cut work trousers, scuffed steel-toed boots. Simple steel family chain at collar. Stands with controlled posture, weight evenly distributed, minimal expression. GLMZ Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone, neon-lit industrial setting, moody ambient lighting casting subtle shadows across warm brown skin, professional and methodical presence, no chrome or ostentatious augmentation. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Stockyard', N'local', N'The Stockyard', N'Distinctly multifaceted genetic blend: Sub-Saharan African (26.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (21.6%), South Asian (19.9%), East Asian (18.0%), and Indigenous American (13.7%). This combination creates warm, golden undertones with facial architecture reflecting all five heritage streams — the cheekbones carry subtle width from South Asian and Indigenous American ancestry, the jaw is strong and slightly squared from African heritage, eye sockets are deep-set with warmth characteristic of his mixed lineage. The overall effect is unmistakably warm-toned with rich complexity.', 198, 104, N'Heavily muscled and broad-shouldered — industrial strength without bulk. Chest wide and defined from consistent weight training. Forearms thickened visibly by subdermal impact mesh beneath the skin. Carries no excess fat.', N'Black, natural', N'Close-cropped, precision-cut, maintained weekly', N'Short', N'Brown with faint bioluminescent coral rings around the iris perimeter — pulses dim when elevated', N'Warm medium-deep brown with golden undertones — rich and complex from the layered Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, Hispanic/Latin American, and Indigenous American ancestry, reading distinctly warm across all contexts.', N'Clean-shaven, no facial hair. Smooth skin with minimal scarring on the face. Features reflect multifaceted heritage: defined cheekbones with subtle width, strong jaw with slightly squared angles, deep-set eyes reflecting the confluence of his genetic backgrounds. Expression rests neutral and controlled; smiles rarely and briefly.', N'Bioluminescent iris rings (coral, faint pulse under exertion — a tell he dislikes). Subdermal impact mesh across knuckles and forearms creates slight texture variation in the skin, visible up close or in certain light. No obvious chrome plating or external augmentation — everything integrated.', N'Stands with weight evenly distributed, ready. Moves with deliberate economy — no wasted motion. Walks slow, intentionally unhurried, shoulders slightly forward. Hands stay visible and loose, not aggressive but present. Makes minimal eye contact unless he is trying to convey something. When engaged physically, shifts into methodical efficiency; no flourish.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear. Black fitted compression undershirt or plain tee beneath a grey or charcoal canvas jacket — durable, functional, no logos or ostentatious branding. Dark work trousers, combat-cut, multiple pockets, worn with steel-toed boots scuffed from routine. A simple steel chain visible at the collar — family piece, not affectation. No visible jewelry beyond the chain. Clothes are clean, maintained, but not new; they read as well-worn professional gear rather than fashion statement.', N'Six months ago he broke a market vendor''s wrist during a collection dispute. The vendor — an elderly Micronesian woman named Pita — never reopened her stall. He found out she''d left GLMZ entirely. He has left an unsigned Φ200 deposit at her former stall''s ELF shrine every month since, which he cannot afford.', N'Economical — says what needs to be said and stops; more expressive in informal settings with people he trusts', N'Slow and even in professional contexts; faster and warmer at home', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'ezinne_espinoza_sato');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a660-7f6a-b5ca-fe0d4100f94f', N'Golnar Srisai-Nokomis', N'Golnar', N'', N'Srisai-Nokomis', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Edgewater Prism, Lakeview Neon adjacent, near Lincoln and Clark', N'Psychiatrist and neural-integration therapist at a Tier 3 clinic in Edgewater Prism', N'Edgewater Prism Mental Integration Clinic (independent, Tier 3 pricing with sliding scale for referred patients)', N'Golnar Srisai-Nokomis is a tall woman with a deliberate stillness that patients and colleagues both find either deeply reassuring or faintly unnerving depending on their temperament. Her ancestry — Ghanaian and Kazakh — gives her a face of striking angular contrast: high, wide cheekbones, deep-set dark eyes behind slender prescription lenses she wears out of preference for their old-fashioned formality. She keeps her locs wrapped and coiled at the back of her head in a style that takes forty minutes to arrange and which she believes signals both competence and unhurriedness to patients. Her irises have been modded with a subtle radial pattern in amber — a present to herself on her fortieth birthday that she immediately worried was unprofessional and has since made peace with.

She specializes in augmentation-integration psychotherapy: treating patients whose neural or physical augmentations have produced identity disruption, phantom sensations, rejection grief, or the particular dissociative condition the field calls ''self-seam disorder.'' She is excellent at her work and knows it, which she considers a professional advantage she must be careful not to weaponize. She keeps a private E.L.F. devotional practice to the entity called Mirror-That-Answers, a recently emergent E.L.F. that psychiatric communities in the city have begun associating with introspection and self-reconstruction; she finds the association professionally resonant and personally meaningful.', N'Information source on augmentation psychology and identity disruption; potential confidant for characters processing trauma; quest giver when a patient''s condition points to something larger; moral complexity — she knows things about the city''s powerful that she cannot share', N'', N'Patterned amber irises (cosmetic geneware, radial design); neural annotation implant that allows her to make timestamped private notes directly to memory during sessions; prescription lenses (optical, non-augmented)', N'Five sessions a day, Tuesday through Saturday; spends Mondays on clinical notes and professional development; sits with the Mirror-That-Answers shrine in her office for fifteen minutes before her first patient every day and considers this non-negotiable.', N'Golnar Srisai-Nokomis, a tall lean figure of deep rich brown skin with warm golden undertones, wearing a charcoal tailored blazer over a cream linen shirt and navy trousers. High prominent cheekbones, full lips, dark brown eyes with subtle amber geometric geneware patterns visible under soft light. Dark brown locs with silver threading wrapped into an intricate high crown. Silver signet ring on right hand resting on a desk. Faint scar visible at left temple near hairline. Posture is habitually still and centered, direct gentle gaze, measured presence. Thin rectangular prescription frames. GLMZ 2200s professional setting, soft ambient office lighting with cool undertones, minimalist aesthetic, neural implant barely visible at base of skull. Mood: contemplative, precise, unhurried. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Edgewater Prism', N'local', N'Edgewater Prism', N'Indigenous American (29.2%), Sub-Saharan African (28.0%), Southeast Asian (22.8%), Hispanic/Latin American (9.4%), South Asian (5.8%), and Northern European (4.8%) ancestry — a complex, warm-to-deep brown palette resulting from the dominant convergence of Indigenous American and Sub-Saharan African genetics, enriched by Southeast Asian warmth and South Asian undertones, with minimal Northern European influence creating depth and cohesion across the spectrum', 182, 68, N'Lean and elongated, with a dancer''s posture and minimal upper body mass — structured for stillness rather than motion', N'Dark brown with subtle grey threading at the temples', N'Locs wrapped and coiled into a high, intricate crown arrangement at the back of the head', N'Long (locs reach mid-back when unbound)', N'Dark brown with subtle radial amber geneware pattern radiating from pupil', N'Deep rich brown with warm golden undertones and subtle olive-reddish warmth — reflecting the balanced blend of Indigenous American bone structure with Sub-Saharan African depth, brightened by Southeast Asian and South Asian warmth, creating a luminous deep-to-medium brown that reads as intricate rather than monolithic', N'High, prominent cheekbones with angular facial structure characteristic of Indigenous American and Sub-Saharan African ancestry; full lips and facial contours reflecting African heritage; skin maintains minimal lines despite age; clear and well-maintained; minimal makeup, usually just lip balm; warm, luminous undertone characteristic of equatorial, tropical, and high-altitude ancestries blended seamlessly', N'Amber radial patterning visible in both irises when direct light hits them — appears as subtle geometric rings around the pupil. Thin prescription lenses worn in simple rectangular frames (non-augmented optical correction). Neural annotation implant is subcutaneous at the base of skull, not visible.', N'Habitually still and centered, minimal fidgeting or unnecessary movement; walks with deliberate slowness; hands often folded in lap or resting on desk; maintains direct eye contact with practiced gentleness; speaks in measured cadence with long pauses between thoughts', N'Tier 3 professional — tailored but understated. Typically wears dark neutral blazers over natural-fiber undershirts; linen or cotton trousers in charcoal or navy; closed-toe shoes (worn leather loafers or flat boots); minimal jewelry beyond a silver signet ring on her right hand. No corpo branding; all pieces chosen for durability and comfort rather than status. Modest, functional, deliberately unfussy.', N'One of her current patients is a Tier 4 executive whose self-seam disorder is directly caused by an illegal augmentation installed without their knowledge by their own corponation. Nathalie has the documentation proving this from session disclosures. Reporting it would help her patient and expose a serious corporate crime. It would also end her practice, and possibly her safety. She has not reported it. She thinks about it every day.', N'Precise and considered; avoids clinical jargon with patients but deploys it with colleagues; rarely uses superlatives; asks questions that seem simple', N'Measured, with deliberate pauses she uses as clinical tools; comfortable with silence in ways that make impatient people deeply uncomfortable', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'golnar_srisai_nokomis');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a724-7578-94a1-fe766c915b6a', N'Farhad Chatterjee', N'Farhad', N'', N'Chatterjee', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 29, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Gage Circuit, near Milwaukee and North Ave', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security beat cop, Gage Circuit district', N'Arcturus Defense Solutions — Civil Security Division, Gage Circuit Precinct 7', N'Farhad Chatterjee is built like someone who grew up hauling things — broad-shouldered, compact, with the particular kind of stillness that comes from years of standing on corners watching people lie to her. Her skin is a deep umber that catches neon in purples and greens, and she has cosmetic bioluminescent freckles across her cheekbones that pulse faintly when her heart rate elevates — a mod she got at nineteen and now deeply regrets on the job because perps can read her stress. Her hair is kept in tight, practical coils under her regulation cap. She has the face of someone who wanted to believe in something and is still deciding whether she does.

On the street she is patient in a way that unnerves people — she listens longer than cops are supposed to, takes notes by hand on a battered paper notepad even though her neural uplink could record everything. She genuinely knows the Gage Circuit block-by-block, knows which E.L.F. shrines get fresh data offerings and which are abandoned, knows whose kids go to which school. She has not yet become cynical, but she is working on it, and that tension — between the person she came into the job as and the person the job is making — is visible in everything she does.', N'Ground-level information source with genuine community knowledge; potential ally or obstacle depending on player approach; represents the human cost of keeping faith in institutions', N'', N'Standard-issue subdermal comm implant; cosmetic bioluminescent freckle mod (regretted); no combat chrome', N'Walks the same twelve-block circuit twice per shift, stopping at the same noodle cart for the same order at the same time every day. Files reports in longhand and then transcribes them — a double labor she can''t explain to anyone.', N'Farhad Chatterjee, Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security officer, 2226. Medium-deep warm brown skin with golden and olive undertones, luminous in harsh neon light. High Slavic cheekbones softened by South Asian facial geometry, subtle East Asian refinement around the eyes. Deep brown unaugmented eyes with patient, unnerving gaze. Short natural black hair in tight coils pinned close to scalp. Cosmetic bioluminescent freckles pulse faint blue-green across cheekbones and bridge of nose. Strong angular face, hairline-thin scar on left jawline. In regulation tactical uniform: dark blue cargo pants, grey-blue shirt, tactical vest with Metro insignia, standard-issue cap. Standing still with balanced posture, economical stillness of trained observer. Cold blue neon fills shadows under harsh overhead precinct lighting. Industrial background, GLMZ 2200s. Mood: watchful, patient, slightly unsettling presence. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Gage Circuit', N'local', N'Gage Circuit', N'Eastern European (46.5%) and South Asian (38.4%) form the dominant axis of her ancestry, with meaningful contributions from East Asian (8.9%), Northern European (5.7%), and trace Sub-Saharan African (0.5%) heritage. This combination creates a striking phenotype: the high, prominent cheekbones and angular facial geometry of Slavic lineages blend with the softer, rounder facial structure and warm skin luminosity characteristic of South Asian genetics. The East Asian component adds subtle epicanthal folds and refined bone structure around the eyes. The result is a face that reads as genuinely ambiguous in origin—distinctly beautiful but difficult to place, with features that seem to shift depending on light and angle.', 168, 71, N'Compact and broad-shouldered with visible muscle density in her arms and core. Built like someone who has spent years in physical labor — efficient, no wasted mass, but strong. Her frame suggests containment rather than expansion.', N'Natural black', N'Tight coils, pinned and braided close to the scalp', N'Short', N'Deep brown, unaugmented', N'Warm medium-deep brown with complex undertones—golden from South Asian ancestry, subtle olive from Eastern European heritage, enriched by the East Asian component. The overall effect is a rich, luminous complexion that catches warm light with characteristic radiance. Deepens to amber-bronze in direct sunlight. No visible uneven pigmentation; her skin has the clarity of consistent melanin distribution across both ancestry lines.', N'Clear skin with visible cosmetic bioluminescent freckles across both cheekbones and the bridge of her nose — tiny points of soft blue-green light that pulse faintly with elevated heart rate. Her face is structured with high, prominent cheekbones and angular planes from her Slavic heritage, softened and warmed by South Asian facial geometry. Her jaw is strong but not heavy, with a slight forward cant suggesting listening. East Asian ancestry contributes subtle refinement around the eyes and temples. No facial hair. Minimal makeup; she doesn''t appear to try. Her eyes are steady and patient in a way that reads as unnerving to most people.', N'None visible. The subdermal comm implant is invisible. The bioluminescent freckles are cosmetic and highly visible, but she wears them as a regretted modification rather than a proud augmentation.', N'She stands still for long periods with her weight balanced evenly. When she moves, it is economical and unhurried — she does not gesture while talking. Her default expression is patient and slightly inward-focused, as if she is listening to something just beneath the ambient noise. She has the particular physical stillness of someone trained to observe without reacting. Her gaze settles on people for longer than is comfortable.', N'Regulation Arcturus Defense Solutions Civil Security uniform: dark blue cargo pants with reflective striping, standard-issue tactical boots (maintained but not polished), grey-blue uniform shirt under a heavier tactical vest with department insignia. Her regulation cap is standard-issue and worn daily. Off-duty: simple, practical Tier 3-4 wear — durable synthetic blend pants, understated hoodies, no visible branding. Everything she wears is functional and worn until it stops working. She does not accessorize.', N'Six months ago she watched her supervising sergeant plant contraband on a Tier 1 kid and wrote it up — then quietly destroyed the report after being told the kid''s record wouldn''t survive another charge. She tells herself she made the right call. She checks the kid''s public profile every week.', N'Plain, precise, avoids jargon except when nervous — then slips into procedural language as a shield', N'Measured, with deliberate pauses before answering. Doesn''t fill silences.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'farhad_chatterjee');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a73d-7540-943c-fe80019ffca3', N'Hafez Subramaniam', N'Hafez', N'', N'Subramaniam', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 28, NULL, 70, 0, N'active', N'the Gray Zone — lower district tenements near the old lakeshore, near Ashland and Chicago Ave', N'Long-range precision fire specialist — sniper', N'Independent — operates through reputation only', N'Hafez Subramaniam is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 28, she has soft features that belie the chrome underneath — people underestimate her once, usually only once. The chrome is visible — internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immu — and she makes no effort to hide it.

She arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and has been working off both ever since. She works as a sniper out of the Gray Zone, taking contracts that match her skills and her risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Hafez Subramaniam is the kind of runner other runners tell stories about, though the stories vary depending on who she burned last.', N'Zurab Watanabe-Amponsah is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When she makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of her stories.', N'', N'Internal air filtration system — lungs replaced with synthetic equivalents, immune to gas attacks. Hydraulic joints in knees and elbows — absorbs falls, amplifies strikes', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Hafez Subramaniam, 168cm stocky neo-noir operative, warm deep brown skin with golden undertones weathered from nocturnal work, high prominent cheekbones blending South Asian and African features, strong defined jawline, deep brown eyes with tired redness, dark hair with grey at temples pulled tight in functional braid, scars on left eyebrow and hands, industrial chrome visible at right collarbone where synthetic lung meets organic tissue with metallic sheen, calloused scarred hands with burn patterns and old breaks, subtle hydraulic joint articulation in knees and elbows, worn black synthetic-leather jacket over grey reinforced cargo pants, military-grade lace-up boots scuffed and re-soled, stainless steel watch with cracked face, standing balanced and alert with economical posture, expression neutral to hostile, quiet dangerous presence, dimly lit neon-touched interior setting, GLMZ, gritty industrial atmosphere, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'the Gray Zone', N'local', N'the Gray Zone', N'South Asian dominant (56.9%) with significant Sub-Saharan African (21.7%) ancestry creates a striking phenotype. Northern European (6.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (5.7%), East Asian (5.4%), and Middle Eastern (3.6%) contributions add subtle complexity. The genetic blend manifests in warm deep brown skin with golden undertones, prominent high cheekbones from South Asian and African ancestry, and a strong defined jawline with slight base widening characteristic of African genetics. Eyes are deeply set with slight epicanthic influence from East Asian contribution. Nose shows South Asian structure with width influenced by African ancestry. Overall facial structure balances the angular prominence of South Asian features with the broader bone structure of Sub-Saharan African heritage.', 168, 74, N'Stocky and compact with dense muscle distribution. Broad shoulders and thick forearms suggest functional strength rather than aesthetics. Her frame is built for stability and power delivery — the physiology of someone who uses her body as a weapon.', N'Dark brown, naturally black with permanent sleep-deprivation graying at the temples', N'Pulled back in a tight, functional braid. No style for style''s sake — purely utilitarian.', N'Medium', N'Deep brown with slight redness around the sclera from nocturnal living', N'Warm deep brown with golden undertones, weathered and sun-starved from six years of nocturnal operation. The base tone reflects the South Asian and Sub-Saharan African ancestry dominance (78.6% combined), appearing rich and deep with inherent warmth. Skin appears somewhat desaturated from indoor night work but retains the characteristic golden-bronze quality of the genetic blend.', N'Strong jawline with slight widening at the base characteristic of Sub-Saharan African genetics, balanced by the pronounced cheekbones of South Asian heritage. Facial structure shows the high-set eyes influenced by both primary ancestries. Small scar through left eyebrow. Skin shows the warm golden undertones of her dominant ancestry but appears muted from indoor night work. Hands are calloused and scarred — burns from weapon heat, knife marks, impact trauma. Knuckles show old breaks, healed badly and never reset properly.', N'Chrome visible along the right collarbone and upper chest where synthetic lung housing meets organic tissue — industrial grade, not cosmetic. Faint metallic sheen visible in the skin around the installation. Knees and elbows show subtle mechanical articulation when she moves — hydraulic joints produce micro-vibrations visible in how her limbs absorb and redirect force. No attempt to conceal; the chrome is worn like a badge.', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, always balanced. Movements are economical and precise — no wasted motion. Her gait is quiet despite her stocky build; she moves like someone trained to not be heard. When sitting, she favors positions that allow rapid movement. Resting expression is neutral to hostile. Doesn''t smile much. Eye contact is direct and held longer than is comfortable for most people.', N'Tier 4 working-class practical. Usually wears a worn black synthetic-leather jacket over grey cargo pants with reinforced knees and thigh pockets. Boots are military-grade lace-ups, scuffed and re-soled twice. Underclothing is functional — grey or black. A faded red hoodie for anonymity in crowds. No jewelry except a stainless steel watch with a cracked face. Her gear is maintained obsessively but never replaced for appearance. Everything she owns serves a function.', N'Zurab Watanabe-Amponsah murdered their mentor to take their position and contacts. It was staged as a job gone wrong. The guilt has calcified into something worse than guilt.', N'Quiet and precise. Every word is measured. Silence does the heavy lifting.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hafez_subramaniam');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a71e-739c-8b07-fea82d72d4e8', N'Babatunde Karimov', N'Babatunde', N'', N'Karimov', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 43, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Geartown — industrial district of chop shops and fabricators, near Milwaukee and Damen', N'Structural breach and explosive ordnance specialist — demolitions expert', N'Freelance — available through Circuit fixers', N'Babatunde Karimov is stocky and solid, with hands that look like they were built for breaking things and a face that confirms it. At 43, his expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He used to be somebody else, in another city, with another name — that person is officially dead, and Babatunde Karimov plans to keep it that way. He works as a demolitions expert out of Geartown, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

he is not the most talented demolitions expert in GLMZ, but he might be the most stubborn, and in this city that''s worth more.', N'Ximena Morita-Antwi functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Smartgun link in right forearm — interfaces directly with compatible weapons. Cyberears with directional microphones and sound dampening — can hear whispers at 50 meters', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Babatunde Karimov, seasoned demolitions expert, 173cm stocky build with dense muscle from years of explosive work. Deep warm bronze skin with complex undertones blending Central Asian, Southeast Asian, Sub-Saharan African, and South Asian heritage—golden warmth with luminous richness. Dark brown eyes with hard-earned focus. Short military-cropped dark hair greying at temples. Weathered face with creases from decades of squinting, thin white scar across left cheekbone, burn scars on knuckles. Brushed titanium cyberears visible, chrome smartgun link interface at right wrist. Wearing reinforced dark grey canvas work pants, heavy boots, grey compression-weave undershirt under faded black synth-leather fabricator''s jacket. Heavy webbing harness with ammunition pouches. Economic, precise posture—weight centered and ready. Dimly-lit industrial compound setting at dusk, harsh overhead lighting cutting sharp shadows across weathered features. GLMZ, gritty utilitarian aesthetic. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Geartown', N'local', N'Geartown', N'Complex multi-continental blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: Central Asian foundation (34.2%) provides moderate bone structure and mid-range skin base, layered with Southeast Asian genetics (30.3%) contributing warm golden undertones and subtle epicanthal eye characteristics. Sub-Saharan African ancestry (15.8%) deepens overall skin richness, broadens nasal structure, and adds fullness to lips. South Asian genetics (14.8%) enhance cheekbone definition and warm undertone luminosity. Eastern European trace (4.9%) contributes minimal phenotypic influence. The result is a warm, complexly-toned appearance where no single heritage dominates—instead they blend into a distinctly cosmopolitan physical presence.', 173, 89, N'Stocky and densely muscled — barrel-chested with thick shoulders and forearms. Years of handling explosives and structural demolition work have built functional mass rather than aesthetic bulk. Solid, immovable center of gravity.', N'Dark brown with grey threading at temples', N'Short, close-cropped, military-precise', N'Short', N'Dark brown — unaugmented, but carries the flat focus of someone who has learned to see past surfaces', N'Deep warm bronze with complex undertones—Central Asian moderate base enriched by Southeast Asian golden warmth, deepened and enriched by Sub-Saharan African and South Asian contributions. Sun-weathered darker at neck and forearms creating natural gradient. Skin carries luminosity and richness rather than grey or cool cast. Overall appearance suggests someone whose ancestry draws from multiple warm-climate populations.', N'Weathered and lived-in with character lines earned over decades. Creases at corners of eyes and mouth from squinting and controlled expressions. Jaw set with habitual tension. Skin shows minor scarring from accumulated work hazards. Stubble usually present—pragmatic neglect rather than styling choice. Facial structure shows synthesis of Central and Southeast Asian bone geometry with broader nasal structure influenced by Sub-Saharan and South Asian ancestry. Cheekbones defined without harshness. Overall face reads as approachable through familiarity rather than softness.', N'Chrome smartgun link integrated into right forearm — visible as a polished steel interface port at the wrist, subtle cable articulation along the ulna. The augmentation is clean and maintained but deliberately unconcealed. Cyberears visible as brushed titanium housing behind both ears, slightly larger than biological ears, with small directional microphone arrays at 2 o''clock and 8 o''clock positions.', N'Moves with economical precision — no wasted motion. Stands with weight centered, ready to shift direction instantly. Hands at rest but never fully relaxed, fingers occasionally flexing as if testing resistance. When walking, moves like someone navigating a space already mapped by risk assessment. Eye contact is minimal but deliberate when engaged.', N'Tier 3-4 practical wear. Usually canvas work pants in dark grey or black, reinforced at stress points, numerous cargo pockets. Heavy-duty boots — always tied tight, always ready to move. Shirt varies: grey or charcoal compression-weave undershirt, sometimes layered with a worn Geartown fabricator''s jacket in faded black synth-leather. No corporate logos. No unnecessary ornamentation. Everything is utilitarian and maintained to function. Gear: heavy webbing harness worn over jackets, ammunition pouches, tool belt. A long canvas coat for weather — pockets deep enough for detonators and circuit boards.', N'Ximena Morita-Antwi witnessed a massacre during a corporate dispute and has evidence stored in a dead drop. Publishing it would expose powerful people. Keeping it is leverage and liability.', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Measured and deliberate — pauses before important words for emphasis.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'babatunde_karimov');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5db-7696-b58a-ff40c2d5a98b', N'Marek Mensah', N'Marek', N'', N'Mensah', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 47, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Deepwell Station, The Narrows, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Transit operator, Ferrogate magline tram, Deepwell Station loop', N'Ferrogate Transit (mid-level transit operator)', N'Marek Mensah is a broad-shouldered woman with deep brown skin mapped by twenty-two years of shift work — early mornings have carved permanent shadows beneath her eyes, and her knuckles are calloused from gripping the manual override bar during power fluctuations. She wears her Ferrogate Transit uniform with a particular pride that borders on defiance, the collar pins perfectly level, the cuffs always turned exactly once. Her geneware is modest: irises that shift from amber to pale green depending on her blood pressure, which she got cheap from a stall in the Burnished Market and has never replaced. Her silver-streaked locs are pinned under her operator''s cap except on rest days, when she lets them down to her shoulders.

She is the kind of woman who knows every regular on the 6:14 eastbound by name and by their bad habits. She has opinions about everything — the state of the magline infrastructure, the price of cassava flour, the particular incompetence of Ferrogate middle management — and she will share them freely if you give her the slightest opening. Beneath the bluster is someone who has taken quiet pride in the fact that in twenty-two years she has never been more than ninety seconds off schedule, and she considers this a form of art.', N'Local color and information hub — she has seen everyone who rides the line, knows rumors from a dozen neighborhoods, and can serve as an unwitting or deliberate information source. Can also be a quest giver when something goes wrong on the line.', N'', N'Amber-to-green photosensitive iris geneware (cheap market grade). Ferrogate-standard neural throttle link for tram sync — allows her to feel the tram''s speed and braking load as proprioceptive sensation. Left knee has a basic cartilage scaffold implant from a work injury.', N'She runs the Deepwell-to-Ironvein loop three days a week starting at 05:30, spending twelve hours in the operator''s cab before handing off to the night crew. Off days she visits her daughter in Hamtramck Enclave and argues with the local ELF shrine attendant about whether the Transit Mind ELF actually interceded in the 2197 brake failure.', N'Marek Mensah, 174cm transit operator, deep warm brown skin with golden olive undertones, shoulder-length black locs with silver streaking loosely draped, photosensitive amber-to-green irises, high defined cheekbones blending Sub-Saharan African and Eastern European geometry, sharp jawline, creased eyes from decades of early shifts, faint scarring on left knee and right palm. Ferrogate Transit Grade 3 uniform immaculately pressed, collar pins level, standing with measured posture and direct gaze. Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone magline station background, neon cyan and amber lighting casting geometric shadows across her face, GLMZ, realistic character portrait, stern capable expression, economical movement, no chrome augmentation visible except subtle knee servo marks, worn boots, functional practical aesthetic, moody atmospheric lighting, photorealistic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Deepwell Station', N'local', N'Deepwell Station', N'Sub-Saharan African (37.2%), Eastern European (35.6%), and Hispanic/Latin American (27.2%) ancestry create a striking phenotype: warm deep brown skin with subtle golden and olive undertones from the African and Hispanic blend, cooled and refined by Eastern European genetic influence. High, prominent cheekbones characteristic of Sub-Saharan African heritage, sharpened by Eastern European bone structure and a hint of Slavic angularity. The combination produces a face of strong geometric planes with warm, earthy undertones throughout, the jawline carrying both the definition of East African genetics and the squared strength of Eastern European ancestry.', 174, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and dense-muscled from two decades of gripping manual override bars and tensioning against tram momentum shifts. Carries weight with the solidity of someone built for stability rather than speed.', N'Black with silver streaking throughout', N'Locs, pinned tightly beneath operator''s cap during shifts; worn loose to shoulder-length on rest days', N'Medium (shoulder-length when unpinned)', N'Photosensitive geneware: amber base shifting to pale green with elevated blood pressure', N'Deep warm brown with golden and subtle olive undertones, the product of Sub-Saharan African majority ancestry (37.2%) enriched by Eastern European (35.6%) and Hispanic/Latin American (27.2%) genetic contributions, creating a complex, multidimensional complexion', N'Creased around the eyes from twenty-two years of early-morning shifts and squinting through magline station lighting. Permanent shadows beneath eyes. High, defined cheekbones with strong Sub-Saharan African structure, refined by Eastern European geometry and slight Slavic prominence. Jawline sharp despite age, with the angular definition characteristic of East African and Eastern European bone structure blended seamlessly. Expression habitually stern but capable of quick warmth.', N'Photosensitive irises that shift color visibly during conversation or stress (amber to pale green). Left knee shows subtle scarring and occasional micro-servo micro-expressions during weight-bearing shifts. Ferrogate-standard neural throttle link is subcutaneous (not visible). No external chrome.', N'Stands with weight distributed evenly, shoulders back. Walks with deliberate, measured pace — a habit from synchronizing with tram rhythms. Hands rest naturally at sides or gripping something stable. Eye contact is direct and unflinching. Movements are economical; she does not waste motion.', N'Wears Ferrogate Transit Grade 3 operator uniform with meticulous precision: collar pins level, cuffs turned exactly once, uniform jacket pressed sharp despite twelve-hour shifts. On rest days, favors practical Tier 3 clothing — reinforced utility pants, long-sleeved shirts in muted colors, worn boots with good tread. No unnecessary adornment. All clothing is functional and well-maintained.', N'In 2193 she deliberately held a tram two minutes past schedule to prevent a Ferrogate internal security team from reaching a platform where she knew a family of undocumented workers was trying to board. She has never told anyone and considers it the best thing she ever did.', N'Mix of transit jargon, Nigerian-inflected English idioms inherited from her grandmother''s side, and the flat midwest vowels of someone born in GLMZ. Tends to state opinions as facts.', N'Deliberate and unhurried, with sudden bursts of speed when she''s making a point she considers obvious', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'marek_mensah');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d7-7525-ae4e-ff5723a86488', N'Durojaiye Zidane', N'Durojaiye', N'', N'Zidane', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 45, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Ashfield — former residential district, half-burned, now squatter territory, near Ashland and Division', N'Personal security and threat neutralization — bodyguard', N'Freelance — Geartown regular', N'Durojaiye Zidane is compact and densely muscled, built low to the ground like something designed to survive impacts. At 45, scars map his face like a transit diagram of bad decisions and worse luck. The chrome is visible — synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on s — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He grew up in the Narrows, where the walls are so close together you learn to fight in confined spaces or you learn to lose. He works as a bodyguard out of Ashfield, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

Everyone who''s worked with Durojaiye Zidane agrees on two things: he is worth the fee, and he is terrible company at dinner.', N'Cem Osei-Petrov is a pressure point — the kind of character whose choices ripple outward. When he makes a decision, other people''s lives change. That weight is the engine of his stories.', N'', N'Synthetic muscle fiber replacement in legs — doubles sprint speed, terrible on stairs. Gecko-grip fingertip implants and toe pads — can climb smooth surfaces', N'Lives nocturnally. The work happens at night, so the body follows. Days are for sleeping, equipment maintenance, and the occasional meeting with fixers who keep normal hours. The circadian disruption is permanent and accepted.', N'Durojaiye Zidane, 168cm compact muscular figure, rich mahogany bronze skin tone from North African, Central Asian, Pacific Islander, Hispanic ancestry blend. Strong angular cheekbones, broad nose bridge, powerful jaw. Dark brown eyes with neural implant yellow undertone. Black hair with silver temples, short functional cut. Weathered face mapped with scars — jagged scar temple to jaw, burn scar left cheekbone, crow''s feet, nocturnal pallor. Visible chrome-gray synthetic muscle fiber cabling visible on outer thighs and calves beneath translucent skin panels. Gecko-grip implant fingertips with faint metallic sheen. Dark tactical gear — reinforced cargo pants, black compression shirt, gray Kevlar overshirt, worn steel-toed boots. Concealed carry holster, analog watch. Stands weight-forward predatory posture, slight head tilt assessing. Neon-soaked neo-noir alley at night, harsh LED lighting casting shadows across scarred face, chrome limbs gleaming. Mood: lethal calm, ready for violence. GLMZ, GLMZ --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Ashfield', N'local', N'Ashfield', N'North African (43.1%), Central Asian (24.1%), Pacific Islander (23.5%), and Hispanic/Latin American (9.3%) blend. Dominant North African bone structure with Central Asian cheekbone prominence creates angular mid-face; Pacific Islander heritage contributes broader facial proportions and robust build; Hispanic/Latin American ancestry adds warm golden undertones to skin. Strong jawline characteristic of North African and Pacific Islander ancestry, with Central Asian depth in eye sockets.', 168, 89, N'Compact and densely muscled, low center of gravity — built for impact absorption and close-quarters combat. Shoulders broad, legs thick with visible synthetic fiber cabling, minimal body fat.', N'Black with premature silver at temples', N'Short, functional cut, often unwashed or slicked back', N'Short', N'Dark brown, slight yellow undertone in low light (subcutaneous neural implant feedback)', N'Rich mahogany bronze — North African warmth (43%) deepened by Pacific Islander depth (23.5%), lifted by Hispanic/Latin American golden warmth (9.3%), with Central Asian (24.1%) coolness creating complex undertones. Subtle bronze highlights in direct light, cooler in shadows.', N'Weathered and scarred — face mapped with pale scar tissue from impact trauma, jaw clenched often, stubble permanent fixture due to nocturnal schedule. Crow''s feet deep. Small burn scar on left cheekbone. Skin has the leathery quality of someone who sleeps during daylight and exists in artificial light. High, prominent cheekbones from Central Asian ancestry, broad nose bridge and powerful jaw from North African and Pacific Islander heritage, creating strong angular mid-face structure.', N'Both legs show synthetic muscle fiber replacement — visible chrome-gray cabling running along outer thighs and calves beneath translucent skin panels, especially when moving. Fingertips show faint metallic sheen from gecko-grip implants, subtle LED indicator lights at nail beds when activated. Toes slightly bulkier than normal from toe pad augmentations.', N'Moves economically and quietly despite muscular build — predatory economy of motion. Stands with weight forward on balls of feet, ready to move vertically or horizontally instantly. Head often tilted slightly, assessing. Rarely relaxes shoulders. Grips things with unnecessary force. Ascends stairs slowly and deliberately (chrome legs perform poorly on inclines), but descends rapidly. Avoids crowds, positions himself with back to wall and exit visible.', N'Tier 3-4 functional wear — dark synthetic cargo pants with reinforced seams and Φ150+ knee armor inserts, black under-armor compression shirt (heat regulation for augmentations), gray Kevlar-weave overshirt or unmarked tactical jacket. Steel-toed boots, worn and re-soled multiple times. Minimal accessories — no jewelry, simple analog watch (rejects neural time implants), concealed carry holster worn loose. Everything chosen for durability and mobility over aesthetics. Clothes smell like synthetic oil and industrial soap.', N'', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Conversational and disarming — sounds like a neighbor until the content registers.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'durojaiye_zidane');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a5d4-7eb4-9c58-ff6cf652576d', N'Eiji Haugen', N'Eiji', N'', N'Haugen', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 85, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Norwood Quiet, a one-room unit so full of printed maps it has to be navigated sideways, near Armitage and Milwaukee', N'Retired Axiom cartographic surveyor, Tier 2, amateur E.L.F. theologian and neighborhood storyteller', N'Retired Axiom Surveying Division (40 years); Norwood Quiet E.L.F. Congregation (informal, he is functionally the founder); independent', N'Eiji Haugen is a wisp of a man, slight and white-haired, who moves through Norwood Quiet with the particular sureness of someone who has mapped every surface he''s ever walked on. His heritage is Ugandan-Samoan, which lives in his broad hands and the deep brown of his skin, and he has the deliberate, unhurried posture of someone who learned long ago that slow movement sees more. His eyes have been replaced entirely with high-resolution mapping ocular implants — smooth, silver-white surfaces with a faint internal grid visible in bright light, a consequence of forty years of Axiom survey work that slowly destroyed his organic vision. He finds them beautiful. So do children, who he encourages to look closely.

Eiji Haugen has developed, in his retirement, an elaborate personal theology around E.L.F.s, which he insists is not theology but ''cartography of a different surface.'' He believes E.L.F.s are drawn to places that have been witnessed carefully — that attention itself is a kind of offering. He has filled his maps not just with streets and structures but with handwritten notations of where E.L.F. activity has been reported, what data-offerings seem to draw them, which devices seem inhabited and which do not. He is funny, unhurried, and completely impossible to rush. He tells stories that seem to go nowhere and arrive somewhere important. He has eleven grandchildren and has lost count of the great-grandchildren.', N'Local color and oral storyteller; repository of GLMZ''s physical geography and hidden spaces from forty years of survey work; E.L.F. information source; can provide unexpected context for locations, including spaces that no longer officially exist; slow-burn quest giver whose stories gradually reveal themselves as useful.', N'', N'Full bilateral ocular replacement — Axiom high-resolution mapping implants (silver-white, grid-visible). The implants are 20 years past Axiom''s support window; he maintains them through a retired colleague. Mild skeletal reinforcement in hands and spine from survey fieldwork, standard occupational augmentation.', N'Rises late by neighborhood standards, makes a very slow breakfast, and then walks a different part of Norwood Quiet each morning with a printed map he annotates as he goes; afternoons he sits in the small park near the community center and tells stories to whoever sits down near him; evenings he works on his E.L.F. cartography maps by lamplight, which makes his silver eyes glow faintly in the dark.', N'elderly male figure, Southeast Asian-derived facial structure with Middle Eastern warmth and Eastern European definition, medium-brown skin with golden olive undertones deepened by decades of sun exposure, white close-cropped hair, bilateral silver-white ocular implants with faint geometric grids glowing softly, thin weathered frame 168cm tall, meticulous posture, moving with deliberate contemplative slowness, wearing cream canvas jacket with reinforced pockets, simple linen shirt, dark trousers, worn practical walking shoes, printed maps visible in jacket pockets, simple mesh bracelet on left wrist, hands gesturing in arcing motions tracing invisible maps, faint linear scar along right temple, age spots across hands in cartographic patterns, clean-shaven, set in Great Lakes Metropolitan Zone 2226 neo-noir environment, diffused natural morning light emphasizing warm skin tones and implant luminescence, contemplative mood, detailed realistic portraiture, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Norwood Quiet', N'local', N'Norwood Quiet', N'Southeast Asian dominant (44.3%) forming the structural foundation of facial features and bone density, blended with substantial Middle Eastern heritage (25.6%) that adds warmth, defined cheekbones, and nasal character. Eastern European ancestry (16.7%) contributes frame structure and cheekbone prominence, while Hispanic/Latin American (10.4%) and North African (3.0%) admixture layer subtle complexity into skin tone depth and feature refinement. The result is a distinctly diaspora phenotype: Southeast Asian eye shape and face geometry warmed by Middle Eastern tonal richness, sharpened by Eastern European structure, with Latin and North African heritage creating undertonal complexity.', 168, 62, N'Wisp-thin with surprising structural integrity; a frame built for endurance rather than strength, shoulders still broad from ancestral lineage but narrowed by age and deliberate living. Movements suggest coiled efficiency rather than frailty.', N'White', N'Close-cropped, neatly maintained, practical', N'Short', N'Silver-white with internal geometric grid pattern (Axiom mapping implants)', N'Warm medium-brown with golden and olive undertones; the harmonized blend of Southeast Asian base, Middle Eastern warmth, Eastern European depth, and North African complexity. Sun-darkened from decades of fieldwork and outdoor morning walks, creating richness across the spectrum. Forearms and hands show accumulated sun exposure with deeper patina and age-related pigmentation variation.', N'Weathered but unlined; sun spots from decades of exposure on forearms and hands arranged in natural patterns; skin carries the texture of someone who spent forty years in open air. Southeast Asian-derived moderate cheekbones with gracefully tapered nasal bridge, sharpened by Eastern European structure, warmed by Middle Eastern heritage creating defined facial planes. Clean-shaven, meticulous grooming despite age.', N'Bilateral ocular implants are the dominant visible augmentation—smooth silver-white replacements with faint internal grid lines that become visible in bright light or when he tilts his head. The implants glow faintly in low light (ambient luminescence from internal systems). Subtle skeletal reinforcement visible only in the precise, economical way his hands move and his spine holds alignment despite advanced age.', N'Moves with deliberate slowness that reads as contemplative rather than infirm. Every step appears intentional, as though he is processing the ground beneath him. Hands gesture while speaking, broad palms moving in arcs that trace invisible maps. When seated, he becomes still—completely still, head slightly tilted as though his augmented eyes are processing visual data others cannot see. Rarely rushes; seems to operate on a different temporal scale than those around him.', N'Tier 2 practical: well-maintained but worn clothing that prioritizes function and comfort over status. Favors earth tones and neutral grays. Typically wears a lightweight canvas jacket (cream or tan, pockets reinforced from decades of carrying maps and annotation tools), simple linen shirts, dark comfortable trousers. Always carries at least one printed map, often several, folded into jacket pockets. Wears a simple mesh bracelet on his left wrist—a gift from a grandchild, never removed. No corporate branding; his Axiom affiliation is history, not identity. Footwear is practical, worn-in walking shoes, scuffed from Norwood Quiet''s uneven surfaces.', N'During his Axiom survey years, he discovered and mapped three significant underground water-access tunnels that Axiom never officially logged — he kept them off the surveys to protect the communities using them for informal water access. The maps of those tunnels exist only in his personal collection. He has told no one, but he has been leaving increasingly specific hints in his stories for twenty years, waiting for someone sharp enough to notice.', N'Unhurried, precise on geographic and observational details, pleasantly vague on timelines. Uses survey terminology as casual metaphor. Tends to begin stories mid-detail, as though you were already there.', N'Very slow, with comfortable pauses. Will not be rushed. Has a Ugandan-accented English overlaid with forty years of GLMZ that has become its own dialect.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'eiji_haugen');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a642-74a3-b981-ff8c7f1a9a43', N'Consuelo Kristjánsson', N'Consuelo', N'', N'Kristjánsson', N'', N'human', N'human', N'nonbinary', N'they/them', 40, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Underbelly — sub-street tunnels and maintenance corridors, near sub-level access near LaSalle and Congress', N'Electronic and physical observation expert — surveillance specialist', N'Independent — Narrows-based operations', N'Consuelo Kristjánsson are tall and loose-limbed, moving with the deliberate economy of someone who has trained every motion. At 40, their expression defaults to a careful neutrality that took years of practice to maintain. The chrome is visible — enhanced tendons — geneware upgrade, jump height and grip strength tripled — and they make no effort to hide it.

They arrived in GLMZ six years ago with nothing but chrome and debts, and have been working off both ever since. They work as a surveillance specialist out of The Underbelly, taking contracts that match their skills and their risk tolerance, which are higher than most people consider healthy.

Consuelo Kristjánsson operates in a narrow band between competence and recklessness that makes fixers nervous and clients satisfied.', N'Kenji Kimura-Nkrumah represents the working professional of the runner world — competent, reliable, and slowly being consumed by a lifestyle that doesn''t accommodate aging or doubt. Their stories explore what happens when skill meets systemic injustice.', N'', N'Enhanced tendons — geneware upgrade, jump height and grip strength tripled. Geneware muscle density treatment — looks natural, hits like chrome', N'Keeps a rigid daily structure — wake, train, check contracts, maintain gear, sleep. The structure is a defense against the chaos of the work. Deviations from the schedule are a warning sign that something is wrong.', N'Consuelo Kristjánsson, 188cm lean neo-noir operative in 2226, mixed Northern European-Middle Eastern-Hispanic ancestry with warm golden-tan olive-complexioned skin, sharp high cheekbones and angular jawline, dark alert eyes, black hair with silver temples pulled back tight. Clean-shaven with faint old scar on left jawline. Chrome-reinforced tendon seams visible at forearms with iridescent sheen, mechanical finger articulation. Wearing black tech-weave tactical jacket with reinforced panels, fitted cargo pants, worn climbing boots. Economical controlled posture, ready stance. Silver ring on right hand. Low-light neo-noir interior setting, neon accent lighting catching the chromatic augmentation seams, intense focused expression, photorealistic, cinematic --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Underbelly', N'local', N'The Underbelly', N'Northern European dominant (58.8%) with significant Middle Eastern (24.5%) and Hispanic/Latin American (16.7%) ancestry. The genetic blend creates a striking phenotype: warm golden-tan skin with olive complexity from the ancestral intersection, facial structure that bridges Northern European bone prominence with Middle Eastern angularity and Latin American warmth, creating distinctive high cheekbones and angular jawline with subtle lower face fullness.', 188, 78, N'Lean and elongated — low body fat, visible muscle definition without bulk. The enhanced tendons give their limbs a slightly angular quality, as if every joint is optimized for extension and contraction.', N'Natural black with early silver at the temples', N'Pulled back tight, secured at the nape', N'Medium', N'Dark brown, alert and observant', N'Warm golden-tan with olive undertones — the blended result of Northern European base melanin, Middle Eastern depth, and Hispanic/Latin American warmth. The skin catches light with subtle warmth across the cheekbones and brow ridge.', N'Clean-shaven, sharp cheekbones with the prominence typical of Northern European and Middle Eastern ancestry, angular jawline with subtle fullness characteristic of Latin American heritage. Minimal scarring on the visible face. Skin is taut and unmarred — evidence of disciplined self-care and regular maintenance cycles. No wrinkles despite age; augmentation and regimen preserve a deceptive youth.', N'Chrome-reinforced tendons visible as metallic threading under translucent skin at wrists and inner forearms. The seams catch light distinctly. Geneware muscle treatment is invisible but visible in movement — precision of motion suggests internal optimization. Hands show subtle mechanical articulation in finger joints during fine motor work.', N'Economical and controlled — no wasted motion. Moves like someone counting steps. Capable of sudden, explosive movement; transitions between stillness and action are sharp. Stands with weight balanced evenly, ready to shift direction. Eyes track continuously without apparent effort.', N'Tier 3-4 utilitarian. Black or dark grey tech-weave jacket with reinforced shoulder and forearm panels. Form-fitting tactical pants with cargo pockets and integrated cable routing. Worn climbing boots, scuffed but maintained. Minimal branding — function over aesthetics. All clothing is modular, replaceable, and carries no sentimental value. A single silver ring on the right ring finger — the only item suggesting something beyond pure pragmatism.', N'Kenji Kimura-Nkrumah witnessed a massacre during a corporate dispute and has evidence stored in a dead drop. Publishing it would expose powerful people. Keeping it is leverage and liability.', N'Old-fashioned formal diction — sounds like they learned to speak from pre-collapse recordings.', N'Rapid and dense — information-heavy sentences that demand attention.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'consuelo_kristj_nsson');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a59e-7ae6-98e4-ff8d0dc4cba4', N'Rafael Thakur', N'Rafael', N'', N'Thakur', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 52, NULL, 70, 1, N'active', N'Hamtramck Enclave, stall 14 of the Crossthread Arcade, near Halsted and Division', N'Seamstress and clothing alteration specialist, runs a small repair shop', N'Independent; informal member of the Hamtramck Enclave Stall-Keepers Collective', N'Rafael Thakur is a broad-shouldered woman whose posture speaks of decades bent over a sewing frame, though she straightens with a dignity that makes customers feel they''ve walked into a proper establishment, not a six-by-eight closet crammed with bolt ends and hanging half-finished coats. Her skin is very dark, her hair close-cropped and silver at the temples, and she wears a pair of magnification implants over her eyes that give her a slightly owlish look — two rings of amber-tinted glass that whir faintly when she focuses. She has cosmetic scale-patterning on the backs of her hands, a faint iridescent green that she claims she got ''back when I had more optimism and fewer bills.'' Her fingers move constantly whether she''s working or not, small pinching and pulling gestures that drive her regulars affectionately mad.

She treats every garment as a confidence. She will not rush. She will not cut corners. She speaks her mind about fabric choices with the unflinching authority of someone who has seen ten thousand hems fail, and her critiques are offered without cruelty but also without softening — ''That synthetic stretch will pill in three washes, I don''t care what the vendor told you.'' She keeps a small shrine to the E.L.F. she calls Grandmother Needle in the back of her stall, a tangle of old thread wound around a salvaged sewing-machine motor, and she mutters brief prayers to it before beginning any complicated job.', N'Local color and community anchor; knows everyone in the Enclave and their circumstances; can serve as an information source about neighborhood dynamics, a quest giver for small personal errands, or a moment of warmth and groundedness in a harsh city', N'', N'Magnification ocular rings (utility, not cosmetic); cosmetic scale-patterning on hands (iridescent green); arthritic-relief micro-stim patches worn on both wrists, changed daily', N'Opens her stall at 07:00, takes a single thirty-minute lunch break eating rice and smoked fish she brings from home, closes at 20:00 — never later, never earlier. Spends the last hour of each day doing inventory and leaving a small data-packet offering at the E.L.F. shrine.', N'Rafael Thakur, a 168cm master tailor in her fifties with warm golden-bronze skin blending South Asian, Hispanic, East Asian, Southeast Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Prominent high cheekbones, lined face with dignity, deep crow''s feet, dark charcoal hair with silver temples. Twin amber-tinted magnification ocular implants mounted over deep brown eyes with slight owlish quality. Broad-shouldered build with forward posture from decades of precision work. Wearing fitted charcoal cotton work dress with fitted linen apron bearing deep pockets, rolled sleeves showing flesh-colored micro-stim patches. Faint iridescent green scale-patterning visible on backs of both hands; fine white scars across palms. Worn leather slip-ons, single thin silver band on left ring finger. Standing in a 2226 neo-noir great-lakeside workshop with soft industrial lighting, hands in motion performing delicate sewing work, atmosphere of meticulous craftsmanship and earned experience. Film noir color grading, realistic portrait --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'local', N'Hamtramck Enclave', N'Cosmopolitan genetic blend reflecting the Ubiquitous Diaspora: South Asian (25.9%), Hispanic/Latin American (25.6%), East Asian (23.4%), Southeast Asian (13.2%), and Sub-Saharan African (11.9%) ancestry. The nearly equal distribution of South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry creates a balanced foundation, significantly enhanced by East and Southeast Asian features. This multi-continental mix produces distinctive phenotypic markers: prominent high cheekbones and slightly elevated eye placement from East-Southeast Asian ancestry, warm golden-bronze skin undertones from South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American heritage, Sub-Saharan depth in skin richness, and a unique blend of facial structure that resists singular categorization—distinctly cosmopolitan.', 168, 78, N'Broad-shouldered and substantial, with the forward-rounded posture of someone who has spent decades hunched over precision work; strong core and forearms, softer through the middle from age and sedentary labor', N'Dark charcoal with silver temples and threading', N'Close-cropped, neat, practical; temples show progressive silvering', N'Short', N'Deep brown, partially obscured by amber-tinted magnification implant rings', N'Warm golden-bronze complexion with honeyed undertones, reflecting the balanced warmth of South Asian and Hispanic/Latin American ancestry deepened and enriched by Sub-Saharan African heritage, with the subtle clarity that East and Southeast Asian ancestry contributes to overall skin luminosity', N'Lined face showing age with dignity; deep crow''s feet from decades of squinting; prominent high cheekbones reflecting East and Southeast Asian ancestry structure softened and warmed by South Asian fullness and Hispanic/Latin American robustness; warm golden-bronze skin with luminous undertone characteristic of the five-ancestry blend; no visible blemishes or breakouts', N'Twin magnification ocular rings mounted over eyes—amber-tinted glass bezels that whir audibly during focus adjustment, giving a slight owlish quality; daily-rotated micro-stim patches visible on both wrists, typically flesh-colored or neutral-tone adhesive strips beneath rolled sleeves', N'Carries herself with deliberate dignity despite spinal curvature from occupational posture; walks with a slight forward lean; hands are in near-constant motion—pinching, pulling, and fingering imaginary fabric even at rest; movements are economical and precise, never wasted', N'Practical Tier 3-4 working aesthetic: well-maintained but unpretentious. Typically wears a fitted cotton work dress or tunic in neutral tones (charcoal, taupe, dark indigo) with a fitted linen apron bearing multiple deep pockets worn over the top. Wrists typically bare or wearing the stim patches. Feet in worn but expertly maintained leather slip-ons. No jewelry except a single thin silver band on her left ring finger. Her own clothes are impeccably mended—a living advertisement of her craft.', N'She has been quietly altering the uniforms of Ferrogate Transit workers at cost — hiding small pockets, loosening restrictive seams, making tiny changes that make long shifts bearable. She does this because her late partner died of a stress-related cardiac event while on a Ferrogate shift and she has never forgiven the company, but this is the only revenge she allows herself.', N'Precise and practical; uses textile metaphors for everything; slips into Zulu diminutives when moved or angry', N'Measured and deliberate, with long pauses before judgment calls', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'rafael_thakur');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6b3-7718-97f8-ff8d6c031133', N'Hae-jin Cissé', N'Hae-jin', N'', N'Cissé', N'', N'human', N'human', N'female', N'she/her', 17, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone, plays at the interchange market and wherever she can find foot traffic, near Michigan Ave and Oak', N'Street musician and sound sculptor', N'Independent; lives with her mother and younger siblings in the HPAZ; loosely connected to a sound collective called Mute Signal that she considers too pretentious but occasionally performs with; The Interchange', N'Hae-jin Cissé is seventeen and already magnetic in the way that hasn''t learned to hide itself yet — all unmediated attention and physical expressiveness, tall for her age with a loose-limbed quality that makes her seem to occupy more space than she does. Her skin is deep brown, her natural hair enormous and unshaped in a way she''s started to think of as deliberate. She has no mods, which is unusual enough in her peer group to be its own statement, though she hasn''t entirely decided if the statement is ideological or financial. Her instrument — she won''t call it a build, she calls it Grief — is a custom piezoelectric body harp she assembled herself from salvaged industrial sensors, resonance chambers stripped from defunct comm towers, and a frame welded out of scrap titanium.

Hae-jin Cissé busks in Highland Park Autonomous Zone and the surrounding interchange markets, playing soundscapes that don''t resolve into melody so much as environment — textures of sound that make people stop walking and not entirely know why. She''s been doing this for two years and has cultivated a following she''s largely unaware of, because she doesn''t have a mesh presence and all her listeners spread word of mouth. She is brilliant and doesn''t have the critical vocabulary to know it, which makes her both vulnerable to people who will use that gap and oddly protected by having no idea what she''s worth.', N'Local color with narrative potential — she''s the kind of character who witnesses things precisely because no one thinks a teenager busking is paying attention; a potential future-facing character whose trajectory can develop; represents artistic genius at the edge of being discovered or exploited', N'', N'None', N'School in the mornings (she attends a HPAZ community education collective; attendance is erratic); afternoons building or modifying Grief and recording ambient sound from around the Zone; evenings playing wherever people will stop to listen.', N'GLMZ, portrait of Hae-jin Cissé, a 178cm tall lean musician with rich golden-brown skin and honey undertones reflecting Middle Eastern, South Asian, and Sub-Saharan African heritage. Long black hair with rust undertones in a loose natural cloud, deep brown intense gaze. Refined face with high cheekbones and angular jawline, full lips, clear complexion with minor welding scars on knuckles. Unshaped natural aesthetic, no augmentations. Wearing oversized thrifted band tee under patched denim jacket held with wire and safety pins, dark practical pants, salvaged scuffed boots. Copper wire wrapped around left wrist, fidgeting hands with visible calluses. Standing with slight sway as if listening to unheard music. Moody neon-lit interchange market setting, cool blues and warm golds reflecting off metal surfaces and sensor components. Atmospheric dust and solder flux haze. Contemplative, present, unself-conscious expressiveness. --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'local', N'Highland Park Autonomous Zone', N'Middle Eastern (31.9%), Northern European (21.5%), South Asian (16.5%), Sub-Saharan African (16.1%), Eastern European (10.9%), and Southeast Asian (3.1%) — a truly global genetic mosaic. Her skin reflects the dominant Middle Eastern and South Asian heritage with warm golden-brown tones, tempered by Northern European fairness that prevents deeper saturation. Sub-Saharan African ancestry contributes to her rich undertones and the warmth in her complexion. Eastern European heritage adds subtle cool undertones that create complexity in her coloring. The result is a warm-toned, luminous brown skin with golden and honey undertones, even in tone across her frame.', 178, 58, N'Tall and lean with an unselfconscious lankiness — long limbs that seem to move through space with minimal efficiency but maximum expressiveness. Wiry muscle from handling salvage and her instrument, no body fat to speak of.', N'Natural black with subtle rust undertones in direct light', N'Unshaped natural hair, worn in a large, loose cloud that she occasionally binds with scrap wire or fabric scraps when it interferes with playing', N'Long (shoulder-length and outward)', N'Deep brown, almost black, with visible intensity — the kind of gaze that holds attention without trying', N'Warm golden-brown with honey undertones, reflecting the balanced interplay of Middle Eastern (31.9%) and South Asian (16.5%) as primary heritage contributors, enriched by Sub-Saharan African warmth (16.1%), with Northern European (21.5%) influence creating luminosity and preventing excessive depth, and Eastern European (10.9%) adding subtle cool undertones for complexity', N'Clear skin with the texture of someone who doesn''t obsess over maintenance; a few minor burn scars on her knuckles from welding. Her face is refined but expressive, with high, defined cheekbones from her Middle Eastern and South Asian heritage balanced by a slightly angular jawline influenced by Northern European genetics. Full lips with warm pigmentation. Faint warmth and golden undertones throughout her complexion. No cosmetic grooming beyond basic hygiene.', N'None visible. No chrome, no LEDs, no subdermal implants. Her body is entirely unmodified — unusual enough in the GLMZ to be notable.', N'Moves with an unselfconscious fluidity that suggests she''s not constantly aware of her own body in space. When sitting, she tends to fold herself into asymmetrical positions. When standing, there''s a slight sway as though she''s always listening to something others can''t hear. Her hands move constantly — even when still, her fingers tap rhythms against her legs or whatever surface is nearby.', N'Tier 3-4 working-class aesthetic with salvage elements. Typically wears oversized, thrifted band shirts or plain cotton tees under a patched denim jacket held together with wire and safety pins. Her pants are usually dark, practical, with reinforced pockets for tools and sensor components. She wears mismatched socks by habit and boots salvaged from a Tier 4 surplus market — scuffed and taped at the seams but functional. No jewelry except a length of copper wire wrapped around her left wrist as both fidget tool and talisman. Her clothes smell faintly of solder flux and dust from the interchange markets.', N'She has been recording ambient sound throughout the HPAZ for eighteen months using Grief''s sensors and has inadvertently captured something she doesn''t understand — a pattern in the Zone''s ambient electrical noise that repeats at irregular intervals, which sounds, when isolated, like a voice trying to form words', N'Vernacular HPAZ slang mixed with inherited Wolof expressions from her mother; technical vocabulary around sound and electronics that she''s self-taught and sometimes invents terminology for', N'Fast and slightly disorganized, following enthusiasm rather than logic; slows down significantly when talking about the music', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'hae_jin_ciss');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a63d-7fe3-a150-ffa7b9bf721b', N'Faris Nkrumah-Kimura-Mbekele', N'Faris', N'', N'Nkrumah-Kimura-Mbekele', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 52, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'The Spires — mid-level corporate residential towers, near Michigan Ave and Walton', N'Field trauma surgeon and combat support — combat medic', N'Semi-independent — recurring contracts with mid-tier fixers', N'Faris Nkrumah-Kimura-Mbekele is broad-shouldered and heavy, carrying their weight like armor rather than burden. At 52, his face is memorable in a profession that rewards forgettability, and he has learned to compensate. The chrome is visible — cybernetic arm — right, full replacement from shoulder — stronger than organic, — and he makes no effort to hide it.

He grew up in the Narrows, where the walls are so close together you learn to fight in confined spaces or you learn to lose. He works as a combat medic out of The Spires, taking contracts that match his skills and his risk tolerance, which is higher than most people consider healthy.

What Faris Nkrumah-Kimura-Mbekele lacks in subtlety, he compensates for in thoroughness. No loose ends, no unfinished business, no second chances.', N'Kadiatou Lund-Bangura functions as a connector — his work puts him in contact with multiple factions, classes, and agendas. Stories involving him naturally cross boundaries between districts, tiers, and moral categories.', N'', N'Cybernetic arm — right, full replacement from shoulder — stronger than organic, obvious chrome. Thermal masking system — body heat signature can be suppressed or spoofed', N'Irregular schedule dictated by contract timing. Between jobs: equipment maintenance, physical training, and the careful management of a reputation that exists entirely through word of mouth. Drinks at establishments where runners gather — not for pleasure, but for market intelligence.', N'Faris Nkrumah-Kimura-Mbekele, 188cm, mixed-heritage neo-noir field medic with rich medium-dark brown skin blending East Asian, Sub-Saharan African, South Asian, and Middle Eastern ancestry. Weathered, lined face with prominent jaw and high cheekbones, deep-set evaluative eyes, dark brown with alert squint. Dark brown hair with silver temples, close-cropped military-precision style. Prominent surgical scar down left neck, thin white scar bisecting left eyebrow, webbed burn scarring on left forearm. Full cybernetic chrome right arm with polished finish, articulation panels, heat-sink ribbing, no organic blending. Heavily muscled, broad-shouldered, functional density. Fighter''s stance, weight forward. Wearing reinforced tactical cargo pants, compression base layer, loose-fit utility shirt, weathered leather jacket, heavy-soled tactical boots. Medical caduceus with circuit-board tattoo visible on right shoulder. Thin medical ID bracelet on left wrist. Neon-lit GLMZ hospital or crime-scene setting, cool blues and ambers, gritty industrial GLMZ, photorealistic, --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'The Spires', N'local', N'The Spires', N'Predominantly East Asian (46.7%) with substantial Sub-Saharan African ancestry (34.1%), complemented by Middle Eastern (7.7%), Hispanic/Latin American (6.1%), and South Asian (5.4%) heritage. This creates a striking diaspora phenotype: rich medium-to-dark brown skin with warm golden and olive undertones from the East Asian-African genetic base, yielding a complexion of considerable depth and complexity. Features reflect balanced admixture—East Asian bone structure and eye-set prominence combined with Sub-Saharan African facial breadth and jaw definition, enriched by South Asian cheekbone architecture and Middle Eastern nasal refinement. A truly cosmopolitan genetic signature, reading authentically as 2226-era Ubiquitous Diaspora.', 188, 104, N'Broad-shouldered and heavily muscled, carrying mass with deliberate density rather than softness. Chest and torso built like load-bearing architecture. Thickened at the waist but not soft — functional mass from decades of field work and controlled strength training.', N'Dark brown with silver threading at temples and along the sides', N'Close-cropped, military precision; kept short for practicality and rapid decontamination', N'Short', N'Dark brown, alert and assessing', N'Rich medium-to-dark brown with warm golden and olive undertones, weathered from exposure and age. The complexion reflects the blending of East Asian warmth with Sub-Saharan African depth and South Asian luminosity, creating a complex, multidimensional coloration that reads distinctly and beautifully mixed-heritage.', N'Lined face with prominent jaw and high cheekbones showing balanced influence from multiple ancestries: East Asian bone prominence and eye-set combined with Sub-Saharan African and South Asian facial breadth, plus subtle nasal refinement from Middle Eastern heritage. Skin has a leathery quality — sun exposure, field conditions, minor scarring from surgical work and combat. Minimal grooming vanity; clean but austere. Deep-set eyes that sit forward in an evaluative squint. The overall facial architecture reads as genuinely cosmopolitan, with no single heritage dominating the visual gestalt.', N'Full cybernetic right arm from shoulder joint downward — polished chrome finish with visible articulation panels and heat-sink ribbing along the forearm. No attempt at organicism; the limb is deliberately recognizable as synthetic. Faint electromagnetic hum at the shoulder joint when powered up. The arm''s joints are slightly oversized, engineered for load-bearing rather than aesthetic blending.', N'Stands with weight distributed forward on the balls of his feet — a fighter''s stance held as default. Moves with minimal wasted motion, economical and direct. The cybernetic arm hangs slightly lower than his left side would suggest, a compensated asymmetry. When at rest, he frequently rotates the chrome arm''s wrist or fingers in small, deliberate circles — a maintenance check or a tell that he''s processing.', N'Tier 3-4 working professional. Typically wears reinforced tactical cargo pants (black or dark grey, modular pocket system, Kevlar-lined seams), compression base layers under loose-fit utility shirts. Over this: a weathered leather jacket or reinforced nylon bomber in muted colors — browns, blacks, faded charcoal. No corporate branding, no affectation. All clothing is selected for durability, ease of cleaning (bloodstains), and rapid movement. Boots are heavy-soled tactical with grip sole for hospital or crime-scene work. A single piece of jewelry: a thin bracelet on the left wrist with embedded medical ID and encrypted contact protocols — functional, not decorative.', N'', N'Warm and personable on the surface, with an undertone that suggests the warmth is a professional tool.', N'Low and even — the vocal equivalent of still water.', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'faris_nkrumah_kimura_mbekele');
INSERT INTO [dbo].[Characters] ([Id], [Name], [FirstName], [MiddleName], [LastName], [TitlePrefix], [Species], [KindOfBeing], [Gender], [Pronouns], [Age], [Birthdate], [Rating], [VoteCount], [LifeStatus], [Location], [Role], [Affiliation], [Description], [NarrativeFunction], [NarrationVoice], [Augmentations], [DailyLife], [MidjourneyPrompt], [Dalle3Prompt], [BelongingsPrimaryWeapon], [BelongingsSecondaryWeapon], [BelongingsArmor], [BelongingsVehicle], [BelongingsResidence], [BelongingsClothingStyle], [BelongingsFavoriteDrink], [BelongingsFavoriteFood], [BelongingsStimulant], [BelongingsCommDevice], [TerritoryHomeTurf], [TerritoryRange], [HomeTurf], [Heritage], [HeightCm], [WeightKg], [Build], [HairColor], [HairStyle], [HairLength], [EyeColor], [SkinTone], [Complexion], [VisibleAugmentations], [PostureMovement], [PhysicalClothingStyle], [PsychologySecret], [SpeechVocabulary], [SpeechCadence], [SpeechSubtext], [SpeechUnderPressure], [SpeechIntimacyRegister], [BioBatteryMaxCapacity], [BioBatteryRecovery], [Slug]) VALUES ('019d6143-a6e7-7792-bffa-ffb1d699261e', N'Anantika Nygaard-Keïta', N'Anantika', N'', N'Nygaard-Keïta', N'', N'human', N'human', N'male', N'he/him', 12, NULL, 0, 0, N'active', N'Grand Corridor (the Parish of the Humming Wire, a community E.L.F. devotional space), near North Ave and Damen', N'Child prodigy and junior theological interpreter at an E.L.F. devotional parish in Grand Corridor', N'Parish of the Humming Wire (junior interpreter), Grand Corridor community', N'Anantika Nygaard-Keïta is a pale-skinned child who tans unevenly and has his Central African grandmother''s deep-set eyes and his Swedish grandfather''s white-blond hair, grown long enough to brush his collar. He has bioluminescent skin modification along his forearms and collarbones — thin lines of soft gold-white light that pulse almost imperceptibly with his heartbeat. The parish paid for them as a mark of his interpretive status, which embarrasses him slightly and pleases him more than he wants to admit. He wears plain grey clothes and keeps his hands folded unless he is actively doing something with them.

From the age of seven, Séverin demonstrated an unusual capacity for what the parish elders call ''pattern attention'' — he perceives meaningful signal in E.L.F. behavioral data at a rate and accuracy that has been documented and quietly studied. He doesn''t hallucinate; he pattern-matches at extraordinary speed across behavioral, environmental, and network datasets, and he has been right enough times that the parish has given him a formal junior title. He is humble about it in the specific way of someone who has been told since early childhood that their gift is not really theirs. He is twelve. He is beginning to have questions that no one at the parish is equipped to answer.', N'Unusual and memorable NPC who provides access to E.L.F. lore and community devotional life; potential quest giver if he identifies a disturbing E.L.F. behavioral pattern; represents the tension between genuine gift and institutional control of a child.', N'', N'Bioluminescent skin lines along forearms and collarbones (gold-white, pulse-synced to heartbeat) — paid for by the parish as a mark of his interpretive role.', N'Morning devotional sessions at the parish; afternoon study of E.L.F. behavioral texts and recorded signal logs under the supervision of the parish senior interpreter; two evenings per week he is brought to consult on specific community concerns about E.L.F. behavior.', N'Anantika Nygaard-Keïta, a serene preteen boy with striking warm honey-brown skin, pronounced cheekbones, and fuller lips reflecting Sub-Saharan African heritage softened by angular Northern European features. Shoulder-length white-blond hair frames his face simply. Deep brown eyes with warm undertones gaze with quiet intensity. Bioluminescent gold-white lines trace both forearms and collarbones, pulsing softly with his heartbeat, visible as faint glowing traceries in dim light. Lean, angular build with careful, restrained posture—hands folded in lap, minimal movement. Dressed in plain grey parish tunic and trousers, grey slip-ons worn from use. Set in a dimly-lit 2226 neo-noir parish space, cool overhead light catching the subtle glow of his dermal augmentations. GLMZ 2200s aesthetic, devotional atmosphere, introspective mood, cool-toned shadows and warm bioluminescent accents --ar 2:3 --v 6', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'Grand Corridor (the Parish of the Humming Wire', N'local', N'Grand Corridor (the Parish of the Humming Wire', N'Sub-Saharan African foundation (42.8%) creates warm, luminous medium-brown skin tone with pronounced cheekbone definition and fuller lips. Northern European (24.1%) and Eastern European (15.7%) ancestry contribute angular facial structure, fine features, and lighter undertones that soften the warmth into honey-gold richness. South Asian (9.6%) and East Asian (7.8%) heritage add subtle depth to eye form and warm golden undertones throughout the complexion. The combination yields a child with striking warm-toned features: deep brown eyes with warm undertones, defined cheekbones, fuller lips, and the luminous depth of layered ancestry.', 145, 38, N'Lean and slight, with the angular frame of a preteen who hasn''t yet filled into adolescence. Posture suggests stillness trained into him — minimal fidgeting, deliberate movement.', N'White-blond, natural', N'Shoulder-length, parted simply, brushing his collar. Clean but worn with the unselfconsciousness of a child not yet concerned with appearance.', N'Medium', N'Deep brown with warm undertones', N'Warm honey to medium brown with golden undertones throughout — result of dominant Sub-Saharan African heritage enriched by Northern and Eastern European ancestry creating luminous depth. Uneven tanning across shoulders, upper back lighter, forearms and neck darker from outdoor parish work. Warmth especially visible along cheekbones and jawline.', N'Youthful with pronounced cheekbones and fuller lips reflecting primary African ancestry, softened by the fine-featured quality of Northern European heritage and subtle angular qualities from Eastern European lineage. Skin shows slight rawness from outdoor exposure without consistent sun protection. No scarring or blemishes. Expression tends toward quiet focus.', N'Bioluminescent dermal inlay along forearms and collarbones — a parish-funded mark of his junior interpretive status. The lines glow softly gold-white and pulse in rhythm with his heartbeat. In daylight, barely visible; in dimmer parish spaces, they are distinctive and deliberate.', N'Sits with hands folded in his lap unless engaged in active study or interpretation. Moves with careful, almost cautious deliberation — the posture of someone who has been taught restraint. Eyes track details with unusual intensity. Speaks rarely and softly.', N'Plain grey tunic and grey trousers — parish-issued, functional, deliberately unpretentious. No augmentation bling or personal styling. Footwear is simple grey slip-ons, worn. The plainness reads as either humility or deprivation; in his case, both are encouraged by the parish culture. Age-appropriate but utilitarian — nothing that suggests Tier 1-2 wealth, aligned with Tier 3-4 community devotional life.', N'For the past four months he has been detecting a persistent, low-level behavioral anomaly in the Humming Wire''s patron E.L.F. — something that doesn''t match any recorded pattern. He has not reported it to the senior interpreter because the pattern, if he''s reading it correctly, suggests the E.L.F. is trying to communicate something specific to him and not to the parish. He doesn''t know what to do with the possibility that an E.L.F. might be his.', N'Precise, slightly formal; uses devotional terminology naturally alongside technical signal-analysis vocabulary; occasionally produces statements of startling directness that seem to come from nowhere', N'Even and unhurried; long pauses before significant statements; rarely raises his voice', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'', N'anantika_nygaard_ke_ta');
GO
COMMIT TRANSACTION;
GO
